21:06.000000','tt0295701',5.9,195119,'en','xXx','Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government \"recruits\" him to go on a mission, he\'s not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.','/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg','2002-08-09',124,'Released','A new breed of secret agent.','xXx',7451,14.1601,5.989,'NgPdDDzVhkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17163,_binary '\0','/bubZ2cNoCiRo6kibQl8N0Sb6Ywd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295721',5.8,49388,'fr','Taxi 3','A gang of thieves calling themselves the Santa Claus Gang are wreaking havoc, and the police can\'t keep up. Police Captain Gilbert is distracted by a Chinese reporter writing a story on his squad, and taxi driver Daniel is in the midst of a relationship crisis. After a string of mistakes in which the thieves outsmart the police time and time again, Daniel and his super-taxi pitch in.','/6Yk3O5mNIYpIKIKaB2l4TJBDdlS.jpg','2003-01-29',87,'Released','No speed limits the next 90 min.','Taxi 3',2334,6.1115,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17164,_binary '\0','/dRE9FP2E8u2VybOD22h5Zf1D4eI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295725',5.4,3375,'en','Time Changer','The year is 1890 and Bible professor Russell Carlisle has written a new manuscript entitled \"The Changing Times\". His colleague, Dr. Norris Anderson, believes that what Carlisle has written could greatly affect the future of coming generations and, using his secret time machine, Anderson sends Carlisle over 100 years into the future, offering him a glimpse of where his beliefs will lead.','/cqkfKoK5YLqrOhvnsqdz9Zbgni6.jpg','2003-10-25',95,'Released','Time Will Tell!','Time Changer',45767,2.5948,5.6,'OE1DKYnN-lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17165,_binary '\0','/hvmuMRJ3cg1Xqz4AL6Jq4Fj51ue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295736',4.4,1302,'fr','3 Zéros','A young Hungarian dreams of playing for the French football team and will get the help of a couple of friends.','/tYq9Ht0gSwiUn7O1XrLeXv65uEP.jpg','2002-04-24',97,'Released',NULL,'Shooting Stars',18419,1.3609,4.707,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17166,_binary '\0','/4TwBMvs4CUWU7U79KwgFs0JRQXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295743',6.6,2257,'fr','Vendredi soir','The night before she is to move in with her boyfriend, a young Parisian woman picks up a male hitchhiker, leading to a highly charged and impossibly erotic detour.','/oBLkiNfPaXGKQHwSd8I9Ta36UTZ.jpg','2002-09-11',86,'Released','This could be any evening in any place.','Friday Night',45044,2.2235,6.2,'zmAjqA35KhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17167,_binary '\0','/gUh5zV15mS4W2wQdNvF5PHAiXCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295876',7,1279,'en','Beneath Clouds','The story of Lena, the light-skinned daughter of an Aboriginal mother and Irish father and Vaughn, a Murri boy doing time in a minimum security prison in North West NSW. Dramatic events throw them together on a journey with no money and no transport. To Lena, Vaughn represents the life she is running away from. To Vaughn, Lena embodies the society that has rejected him. And for a very short amount of time, they experience a rare true happiness together.','/6kVbJk6WPFDAzuW3J1GYL8Cl6Hi.jpg','2002-05-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Beneath Clouds',60109,1.2243,6.3,'mOl6cQcLr8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17168,_binary '\0','/j3P5wkyiigZW8aeogoZoiNIZySL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296042',6.9,64536,'ja','殺し屋1','As sadomasochistic yakuza enforcer Kakihara searches for his missing boss he comes across Ichi, a repressed and psychotic killer who may be able to inflict levels of pain that Kakihara has only dreamed of.','/k8j4YLZlda98dqp9ErymKzjYowG.jpg','2001-12-22',129,'Released','Love really hurts.','Ichi the Killer',9696,6.0151,6.986,'YWnd581Ihgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17169,_binary '\0','/qTuvOJ2UwyGsl9OrsYfVdoCxG6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296166',6.9,8895,'en','Real Women Have Curves','In East Los Angeles, an 18-year-old struggles between her ambitions of going to college and the desires of her domineering mother for her to get married, have children, and oversee the small, rundown family-owned textile factory.','/ziemD3ATULYKt399FkO1ZhAwrOH.jpg','2002-10-18',86,'Released','Real women take chances, have flaws, embrace life...','Real Women Have Curves',30309,3.0547,6.1,'vKpDifyDIp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17170,_binary '\0','/wSqGD7qeaCvdSB1s1E4qT3b2BAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296251',7.3,3648,'en','Tru Confessions','Trudy Walker hated her life. She thought it was totally messed up until she found out about a contest that could change everything...','/o56atIC1y4KGitMAicrK1YnLTf2.jpg','2002-04-05',83,'Released',NULL,'Tru Confessions',71886,2.2829,6.9,'pwiGuvhTPQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17171,_binary '\0','/o4MN9WO9sGXVYrU5rgunjkQENxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296492',6.5,1975,'ko','악어','Under the Han River lives Crocodile, a rugged member of the lumpenproletariat who exists from schemes and stealing. His position as a scavenger of society undermines South Korea’s boasts of its newfound economic position as an Asian Tiger. One day, Crocodile finds a girl floating in his river.','/jeahTw8QqY1Fls1yhtsVMteDLKn.jpg','1996-11-16',102,'Released','The most twisted love story you\'ll ever see!','Crocodile',25652,1.3893,6.3,'4EJvAvHtad4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17172,_binary '\0','/lt3NqorBMWn786m9bzqM0OLdMS8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296572',6.6,253563,'en','The Chronicles of Riddick','After years of outrunning ruthless bounty hunters, escaped convict Riddick suddenly finds himself caught between opposing forces in a fight for the future of the human race. Now, waging incredible battles on fantastic and deadly worlds, this lone, reluctant hero will emerge as humanity\'s champion - and the last hope for a universe on the edge of annihilation.','/bVO1r90diKfFLzvZ5D3qK6Z558O.jpg','2004-06-11',119,'Released','All the power in the universe can\'t change destiny.','The Chronicles of Riddick',2789,7.5153,6.6,'6kVvQ1Rtb9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17173,_binary '\0','/iFd0f324IzQgZkCEq5uTc4LUJ1G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296574',7.9,17378,'hi','Company','Mallik is a henchman of Aslam Bhai, a Mumbai underworld kingpin. He inducts local hothead Chandu into the gang, and the two of them soon form a formidable faction within the gang, eventually displacing Aslam. As the empire grows, however, the two of them start drifting apart.','/1A2J7bYryOmBVBU8qpTs3fta0hv.jpg','2002-04-15',156,'Released','A Law & Order Enterprise','Company',15761,1.8641,7,'3A1nXzhra-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17174,_binary '\0','/65vwocYaQrSjuaAL3UuNVc0YIoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296658',7.1,2777,'ko','고양이를 부탁해','When one girl from five close school friends moves to Seoul after school is over, the other four try and deal with the loss of her moving and them drifting apart.','/u370ioBFru34SrfbdvatdsuJ5c3.jpg','2001-10-12',112,'Released','Cat-like twenty-year-old girls and their secret life','Take Care of My Cat',37288,1.9354,6.9,'Jm-UU6vAEQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17175,_binary '\0','/98yi4Me1hFdp4sxhROAv1NVEXLC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296696',6.3,3735,'ko','조폭 마누라','Eun-jin who is a living legend among the gangsters dominates the male-centered underworld wielding only a pair of her trademark blades. One day, Eun-jin finds her sister from whom she was separated at an orphanage during childhood, and her sister tells Eun-jin that her last dying wish is to see that Eun-jin gets married.','/cmg4E3GLJpx6cDOLslFeCZ2ZZRN.jpg','2001-04-19',110,'Released','She can\'t clean or cook. But she can kick your ass.','My Wife is a Gangster',21707,2.6913,5.9,'tJqwzfQ7keA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17176,_binary '\0','/gpFO37cXk6kZdEsCKp997oSJeti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296711',5.2,1328,'en','Kiss The Bride','Sibling drama overshadows the impending nuptials of Danni Sposato and her longtime boyfriend, Geoff Brancato. Television actress Niki brings her manager-boyfriend, Marty, to meet the family for the first time, while spiky youngest sister Toni shows off her bandmate and lover, Amy, and driven Wall Street banker Chrissy flashes the status symbols of her financial success.','/8wWAXwivvZ3SRjK4jIlWhDS7enz.jpg','2002-10-16',89,'Released','Marriage, sibling rivalry and other catastrophes.','Kiss The Bride',82432,1.9995,4.9,'adgcP0yRhE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17177,_binary '\0','/6hhzasM2fl3xpUVm8K8y6M7b2Kk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296712',6,1271,'da','Klatretøsen','Ida\'s father suddenly gets a stroke and is rushed to the hospital, diagnosed with a deadly disease with no other opportunity than to travel to USA to attend a medical experimental operation. Unfortunately, the small family have to get the money themselves, as the state doesn\'t pay for that kind of experimental procedures. Ida has to get the money - and she got no other way than to steal them from the bank where her mother works...... developing the banks intense security.','/gIZ3IY6Ea0DkvhtI8TqXsHoyjkN.jpg','2002-01-25',90,'Released','One hell of a bank job','Catch That Girl',48761,1.8057,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17178,_binary '\0','/2YnxrbLqUiaaoMRyecuamD2muDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296843',7.4,1309,'en','The Scooby-Doo Project','In the Fall of 1999, four teenage sleuths and their Great Dane got lost in the woods while in search of a mystery. This is their story.','/nOEdNxSqrWMiYLFJEM6poBu3bSH.jpg','1999-10-31',20,'Released',NULL,'The Scooby-Doo Project',423336,2.1643,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17179,_binary '\0','/HBDCAk7pkHFbanbIsfeElE14x1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296845',6.4,3620,'en','Little Secrets','Emily is a plucky preteen who is entrusted with her young neighbors\' most private and cherished secrets. Every Wednesday, Emily sets up a booth in her backyard that regularly attracts the guilty young souls of the neighborhood. These include Philip, whose clumsiness and his interest in Emily make him a challenging client. But complications ensue when she suddenly finds it difficult to keep all of her neighbors\' secrets to herself.','/2dm2cljvMFrZZHwmWckhso2WkIj.jpg','2002-08-23',96,'Released','Can you keep a secret?','Little Secrets',50573,2.099,6.4,'l_eBMTGV884','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17180,_binary '\0','/uYo84MtnPcECYvmNUtEBv2wUrE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296881',7.2,2964,'en','Symbiopsychotaxiplasm: Take One','In Manhattan\'s Central Park, a film crew directed by William Greaves is shooting a screen test with various pairs of actors. It\'s a confrontation between a couple: he demands to know what\'s wrong, she challenges his sexual orientation. Cameras shoot the exchange, and another camera records Greaves and his crew. Sometimes we watch the crew discussing this scene, its language, and the process of making a movie. Is there such a thing as natural language? Are all things related to sex? The camera records distractions - a woman rides horseback past them; a garrulous homeless vet who sleeps in the park chats them up. What\'s the nature of making a movie?','/wMRtQ3A4pOmG2dXKOxx9tTerFi6.jpg','1968-10-28',75,'Released',NULL,'Symbiopsychotaxiplasm: Take One',44783,1.4656,6.9,'yn4rJLzv4Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17181,_binary '\0','/1xDQTI2Hl4JVfo00GI1VOcXGrd8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0296915',7.5,4680,'es','Valentín','Valentin, an 8-year-old boy living with his grandmother in late-1960s Buenos Aires, is surrounded by problems in his family he finds only himself capable of solving.','/qBLSZ8lXDBzXrkxKyGlCZ42WOU6.jpg','2002-09-29',83,'Released','Cupid just turned eight.','Valentin',30125,2.1544,7.5,'4Z_2ncica48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (17182,_binary '\0','/bRZQqYtGK8y2wypgvVRY338fIxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297037',6.5,11100,'en','Brown Sugar','Sidney and Dre can attribute their lifelong friendship and the launch of their careers to one single childhood instant... witnessing the birth of hip-hop on a New York street corner. Now some 15 years later, she is a revered music critic at a national magazine and he is a successful, though unfulfilled, hip-hop record company executive. Both come to realize that their true life passions will only be fulfilled by remembering what they learned that day on the corner.','/n9SnhQk29094VoLfyiYM4viyCrU.jpg','2002-10-05',109,'Released','When did you first fall in love with hip-hop?','Brown Sugar',37964,3.3776,6.7,'1cMkcfL8w5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17183,_binary '\0','/us2aG5buhsLUYz4Npcx8i8HvSDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297144',6.8,6831,'en','Ghosts of the Abyss','With a team of the world\'s foremost historic and marine experts as well as friend Bill Paxton, James Cameron embarks on an unscripted adventure back to the wreck of the Titanic where nearly 1,500 souls lost their lives almost a century ago.','/aSht7L9Mnr1zc4hDJTOwPuTfnV8.jpg','2003-04-10',91,'Released','The legend no one can forget has become the greatest 3D adventure ever filmed.','Ghosts of the Abyss',24982,4.4377,6.8,'aEGQS7Ex_QY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17184,_binary '\0','/kn2DrfbjYWyNAXlYjCIhQPOTEYd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297162',4.6,17863,'en','Half Past Dead','A man goes undercover in a hi-tech prison to find out information to help prosecute those who killed his wife. While there, he stumbles onto a plot involving a death-row inmate and his $200 million stash of gold.','/fJhudecoqyoZLoCwAZvqNPd7MK5.jpg','2002-11-15',98,'Released','The good. The bad. And the deadly.','Half Past Dead',10167,4.9297,5.1,'JyNYoAd02Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17185,_binary '\0','/qwGkQpQbDXuHDOq909RQmJPENwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297181',5.4,55795,'en','I Spy','When the Switchblade, the most sophisticated prototype stealth fighter created yet, is stolen from the U.S. government, one of the United States\' top spies, Alex Scott, is called to action. What he doesn\'t expect is to get teamed up with a cocky civilian, World Class Boxing Champion Kelly Robinson, on a dangerous top secret espionage mission. Their assignment: using equal parts skill and humor, catch Arnold Gundars, one of the world\'s most successful arms dealers.','/hmjCMtkeqxruMVocq7iwMx899xi.jpg','2002-10-31',97,'Released','Attitude meets espionage.','I Spy',8427,6.0062,5.4,'Z-aZceoVnWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17186,_binary '\0','/hjBzzYreOmk5z6Cg1khylRRnhsl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297234',5.6,2255,'sv','Klassfesten','35-year old Magnus Edkvist hates class reunions as much as anyone and usually skip them. Still he accepts an invitation for a reunion for class he left over twenty years ago. But he has his reasons, as there is a chance that his teen love Hillevi will show up. The girl he wanted to run away with and share the rest of his life. The girl that got away...','/q8fEYORuVjMKSFw3DnygwoLz3nE.jpg','2002-02-27',103,'Released',NULL,'The Reunion',77351,0.7968,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17187,_binary '\0','/mRBjIxqCTTpY5XJONx6vucpTuVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297241',5.5,3034,'hi','क्योंकि... मैं झूठ नहीं बोलता','Inpired from the movie \"Liar Liar\", this movie is about a lawyer (Govinda) who lies his way through marriage and career. His wife (Sushmita Sen) falls in love with him because of his honesty and when she finds out of his dishonesty she threatens to divorce him. Their son, to avoid the divorce, wishes on a shooting star that his father should lose the ability to lie. What happens after that is an enjoyable journey.','/mNw4wVuvtJP15JFKGtpc9VRPsQe.jpg','2001-09-21',149,'Released',NULL,'Kyo Kii... Main Jhuth Nahin Bolta',166233,4.2176,5.308,'4jUxyT_OkdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17188,_binary '\0','/EssJKNYFUd1zwtC1U1leEuxSk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297247',7,2548,'sr','Lavirint','The story evolves around the Arian sect. During the III century AD they have seriously shaken the very foundations of Christian world. It is also known that in this region they had a stronghold between towns of Sirmium and Belgrade. \"Labyrinth\" is not only the story about our times, but a story of our roots.','/RI5WfzwMCNQIFVgskJ3Lwd2RKu.jpg','2002-08-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Labyrinth',108835,0.931,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17189,_binary '\0','/m9lgsATmrHxCC4BPbi5fjLmKlXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297284',6.3,69239,'en','Mindhunters','Trainees in the FBI\'s psychological profiling program must put their training into practice when they discover a killer in their midst. Based very loosely on Agatha Christie\'s And Then There Were None.','/uTTGRvnqCI9ZC7WkyP9u7XRiOaA.jpg','2004-05-07',106,'Released','For seven elite profilers, finding a serial killer is a process of elimination. Their own.','Mindhunters',16617,6.6488,6.4,'ZTLaj8JuIsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17190,_binary '\0','/xNVnuBdgqQvXqPxXmniJ9sXx1A9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297389',6,1462,'en','Poster Boy','The gay son of a conservative senator who is also the poster boy for his father\'s re-election unknowingly befriends a gay activist bent on destroying the hypocritical campaign.','/bDx4n2ZrQeeJJyJ2k6O2PVP4oO6.jpg','2004-05-08',98,'Released','Can he keep his secret?','Poster Boy',17651,2.4799,5.4,'4Rpm1xDCwes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17191,_binary '\0','/wTWy7b1SKslcNn1GDah6S7MQa5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297721',7.5,14583,'ja','リリイ・シュシュのすべて','Charts the troubled teenage years of students Yūichi Hasumi and Shūsuke Hoshino, exploring the shifting and complex power dynamics of their relationship against the backdrop of Yūichi\'s love for the dreamy and abstract music of pop star Lily Chou-Chou.','/pLBNmJUH9JYRCRsh349PJ22WpkS.jpg','2001-10-06',146,'Released','Pain can take you in prison. The ether can set you free.','All About Lily Chou-Chou',16664,7.4191,7.5,'Kwlh-z2R8QE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17192,_binary '\0','/nJBpPuUmSB8XxuAYGEXLlPrZoFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297741',7,4412,'hu','Argo','The crew of Tibi Balogh sets out on a journey across Hungary to get the ancient Gold Owl statue, as well as the Milk Man. The treasure is worth millions, who gets there first?','/KMdChAqXjgYvDqLNVWtPGKLs8G.jpg','2004-09-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Argo',92069,1.6994,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17193,_binary '\0','/aqgkUysvSUVOMFwEK5NWArN1nob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297753',6,4367,'fr','Kaena, la prophétie','Compelled by a mysterious force, Kaena, a rebellious, high-spirited teenage girl will defy the High Priest and her people\'s ancestral beliefs to take the perilous journey through the Axis and discover what dark secrets lie beyond the clouds.','/ihIIh8BR9YwtG2noVZ3enkiiozb.jpg','2003-06-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Kaena: The Prophecy',11572,2.5572,6,'cRwTWgS40E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17194,_binary '\0','/kwz7BZAUmfAyz2w7sGZa5I20vlm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297780',4.7,1307,'en','Beyond the Limits','The rookie journalist Vivian seeks Frederick, the caretaker of the oldest cemetery in an undefined country, asking for an interview and the old man tells the story of two \"costumers\" and both connected by a mysterious secret. The powerful gangster Jimmie Levinson accuses his former partner Paul Pattuchi of stealing a load of cocaine and orders to kill his beloved girlfriend Clarice. Paul is found dead later in a cottage, and Jimmie and his friends and girlfriends are visited during a dinner party by Robert Downing first and then by the sadistic Mortimer and his partner Rick seeking the truth about Paul and a suitcase with a mysterious relic. The second story takes place in the Middle Ages, where the cruel David Deming and his minion Tom Brewster chase the renegade priest James Flynn in the name of the Inquisition but actually trying to force him to reveal the secret of the Eternal Heart to grant immortality.','/5fQBid5s6vn1jwxKyBgs07rZQHv.jpg','2003-03-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Limits',39908,1.5942,5.625,'neGSCyJ3IWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17195,_binary '\0','/k0HFJNOfwuWbYKon7BwCbnX8OkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0297884',7.3,51944,'en','Far from Heaven','In 1950s Connecticut, a housewife\'s life is upended by a marital crisis and mounting racial tensions in society.','/9gQuvFDRPLx39smUvyafm36tp0d.jpg','2002-11-08',107,'Released','What imprisons desires of the heart?','Far from Heaven',10712,4.9238,7.059,'TmMEG0OdKwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17196,_binary '\0','/8KgkBQw29OosMlzZGFDI0x5gyEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298082',6.4,2033,'fr','Ni pour, ni contre (bien au contraire)','\"Ni Pour, Ni Contre\" tracks the fall of a young TV camerawoman, Caty, after she becomes involved with a group of petty criminals and their enigmatic leader, Jean. The gang lives hand-to-mouth until the day Jean plans a daring bank robbery. Although other gang members feel out of their league, Jean persuades them to take part and Caty finds herself in a hellish world of betrayal, violence and murder.','/rgd2DStNLE8zblUPJcez6r3Y3b5.jpg','2003-03-05',111,'Released','The wrong path is often the best.','Not For, or Against (Quite the Contrary)',11958,2.0587,6,'9iYnYR1hiaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17197,_binary '\0','/6tuNQ16hC4Qp7wjTweKzUnnLBkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298130',7.1,406530,'en','The Ring','Journalist Rachel Keller investigates a strange videotape that may be behind the untimely deaths of four teenagers. There is an urban legend about this tape: the viewer will die seven days after watching it. Rachel tracks down the video... and watches it. Now she has just seven days to unravel the mystery of the Ring in order to save herself and her son.','/AeRpUynJKDpJveklBJipOYrVxCS.jpg','2002-10-18',115,'Released','Before you die, you see','The Ring',565,14.5047,6.709,'CG7BAY6_hsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17198,_binary '\0','/tn649itx4MRNOZEDmKR316vno1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298131',6.7,2642,'de','Rosenstraße','When Ruth\'s husband dies in New York, in 2000, she imposes strict Jewish mourning, which puzzles her children. A stranger comes to the house - Ruth\'s cousin - with a picture of Ruth, age 8, in Berlin, with a woman the cousin says helped Ruth escape. Hannah, Ruth\'s daughter engaged to a gentile, goes to Berlin to find the woman, Lena Fisher, now 90. Posing as a journalist investigating intermarriage, Hannah interviews Lena who tells the story of a week in 1943 when the Jewish husbands of Aryan women were detained in a building on Rosenstrasse. The women gather daily for word of their husbands. The film goes back and forth to tell Ruth and Lena\'s story. How will it affect Hannah?','/whHyCV08F1C2r7uzTeyHsJ4nIWg.jpg','2003-09-18',136,'Released',NULL,'Rosenstrasse',6317,1.711,6.4,'QEVT_3689dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17199,_binary '\0','/8ohobj5lAIbl5XWw11FywS3IRrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298148',7.4,563663,'en','Shrek 2','Happily ever after never seemed so far far away when a trip to meet the in-laws turns into a hilariously twisted adventure for Shrek and Fiona. With the help of ever-faithful Donkey, Shrek takes on the potion-brewing Fairy Godmother, pompous Prince Charming, and infamous ogre-killer Puss In Boots.','/2yYP0PQjG8zVqturh1BAqu2Tixl.jpg','2004-05-19',92,'Released','What happens after happily ever after?','Shrek 2',809,23.1308,7.33,'iuNghO1XsHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17200,_binary '\0','/jNG7pl0DkN1nzxnbZj4MCGf2VEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298203',7.2,355410,'en','8 Mile','For Jimmy Smith, Jr., life is a daily fight just to keep hope alive. Feeding his dreams in Detroit\'s vibrant music scene, Jimmy wages an extraordinary personal struggle to find his own voice - and earn a place in a world where rhymes rule, legends are born and every moment… is another chance.','/7BmQj8qE1FLuLTf7Xjf9sdIHzoa.jpg','2002-11-08',111,'Released','Every moment is another chance.','8 Mile',65,12.2817,7.148,'axGVrfwm9L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17201,_binary '\0','/dLJ6qwEXg2AglBSClRV5iVYZI1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298228',7.5,44550,'en','Whale Rider','A contemporary story of love, rejection, and triumph as a young Māori girl fights to fulfill a destiny her grandfather refuses to recognize.','/cVBZQZq091KtwBm2qObOv0JTFcH.jpg','2003-01-30',101,'Released','In the ways of the ancients she found a hope for the future.','Whale Rider',1088,4.5373,7,'0PPmfCx91d8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17202,_binary '\0','/dteOfLObqADjRmWVenb0CDb1qVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298296',3.9,8840,'en','Derailed','NATO operative Jacques Kristoff (Jean-Claude Van Damme) is summoned into action—on his birthday, no less—to track down Galina Konstantin (Laura Harring), who has stolen an extremely valuable and dangerous top-secret container from the Slovakian Government. Finding Galina doesn\'t take long, and Jacques must wrap up the mission by returning Galina and the contraband to his superiors by train. Things seem to be going smoothly as Jacques and Galina board the train posing as a couple, but soon all hell breaks loose.','/ot5eFU2sWOEG9IbWydNpwggBiIg.jpg','2002-05-19',88,'Released','The deadliest disease ever discovered is about to be unleashed on the world.','Derailed',17774,3.8563,5.2,'pAdJsfL8jGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17203,_binary '\0','/y4cfBdeAsvONJ1VqD9qp7SIVpXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298337',5.9,7116,'no','Slipp Jimmy fri','Four stoners, five vegans, three mobsters, four hunters and a million reasons to free one junkie elephant.','/AmDtL2KYezl1Pvuz6dEQcHGpcwv.jpg','2006-04-21',86,'Released',NULL,'Free Jimmy',14453,2.089,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17204,_binary '\0','/7FvW7PDL4GHW0AOdG9g262FKIQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298350',8.4,1525,'bg','Господин за един ден','This film is a comedy about a poor man named Purko. Purko always fails in his attempt to escape from poverty. The film illustrates the social and the moral atmosphere in Bulgaria during the 1930\'s.','/gUbR473Lwe89LbbTHhCJLlcxd9.jpg','1983-05-16',87,'Released',NULL,'King for a Day',214938,1.1811,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17205,_binary '\0','/jhq8rurRTNlLaahVZYvF2k6tGMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298351',5.6,3362,'sv','Grabben i graven bredvid','Desirée, a modern librarian with urban friends and interests is visiting her late husband\'s grave when she meets Benny, a simple farmer. After his mother\'s death Benny lives alone on the run-down farm, desperately seeking a woman to take care of him. In spite of their differences the two have the dream of finding that special someone in common, and fall passionately in love. Benny wants Desirée to move in with him and start a family as soon as possible. But being a farmer\'s wife is not something she is very enthusiastic about. Just presenting Benny as her boyfriend proves to be an embarrassing experience. And when she gets a tempting job offer in Stockholm she has to consider her priorities carefully.','/bPe1ZPMPTxvnWYHShSH29LvX7V7.jpg','2002-08-02',94,'Released',NULL,'The Guy in the Grave Next Door',40787,1.5718,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17206,_binary '\0','/f02gitQgX3QocVeeqgak8U6LZB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298388',6.5,4904,'en','Jonah: A VeggieTales Movie','Get ready as Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and the rest of the Veggies set sail on a whale of an adventure in Big Idea\'s first full-length, 3-D animated feature film. This is the story of Jonah and the Whale as you\'ve never seen it before - a story where we learn that one of the best gifts you can give - or get - is a second chance.','/xJ6ImpQIqZxBh4eE2813ljQ0TQ3.jpg','2002-10-04',82,'Released','Fresh Fish. Mixed Vegetables.','Jonah: A VeggieTales Movie',15173,2.712,6.2,'py6CtMzy28M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17207,_binary '\0','/v6U5nTWR2ILnnf7f5gKAoTqVEhp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298408',6.4,18166,'en','Laurel Canyon','When an uptight young man and his fiancée move into his libertine mother\'s house, the resulting clash of life attitudes shakes everyone up.','/z7knajZv3nxqN0o2Jq8kIOkpgu6.jpg','2003-03-07',103,'Released','Somewhere between Hollywood and the rest of the world.','Laurel Canyon',13819,3.913,6,'xOBzSFozkwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17208,_binary '\0','/je79nIbMhZkbuxbvbRclnJwmHYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298482',6.1,6275,'en','Nothing','After a terrible day, two good friends and housemates find the outside world converted into a featureless and empty white void.','/vefWBq6xpeMYtF7ROgGfXLdp5Qu.jpg','2003-09-09',90,'Released','Seriously... where did everybody go?','Nothing',10981,2.2677,5.9,'zc8XXv3pl10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17209,_binary '\0','/dM5oFjWAJshpySl83XTYNISj9lg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298491',6.4,3428,'sv','Den osynlige','A teenager is assaulted and killed, but returns as a ghost to find his killer.','/vinvtwxUlNlcnsTwh17NvoFcC5s.jpg','2002-01-30',92,'Released',NULL,'The Invisible',13040,1.6379,6,'_cxfLo-vjFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17210,_binary '\0','/llOXGvKkFyUAaabusi4JMHM7OKy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298504',6.5,5830,'en','Undertaking Betty','A politician\'s wife and the mortician who has secretly loved her for years plan to fake her death so they can run away together.','/zAXWOj1qznqWWVcXpZ0JZOgvSp2.jpg','2002-12-04',94,'Released','Sometimes finding true love can be the death of you.','Undertaking Betty',10918,4.5413,6.126,'bXhDTZX0cWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17211,_binary '\0','/5j89WTjoMZQNW8rhhGUB98VZ3O6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298514',7.2,1965,'ml','രാവണപ്രഭു','Karthikeyan, a liquor baron, sets out to take back his ancestral house which was usurped by Shekharan. To seek revenge, Karthikeyan abducts Shekharan\'s daughter and ends up falling in love with her.','/lnnIQ5jotRzefDN8ISp3reYJf4T.jpg','2001-08-31',161,'Released',NULL,'Ravanaprabhu',240160,1.3126,7.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17212,_binary '\0','/204u2koZm4kP2MwwYdALCd5i4Vi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298744',6.7,16148,'en','Auto Focus','A successful TV star during the 1960s, former \"Hogan\'s Heroes\" actor Bob Crane projects a wholesome family-man image, but this front masks his persona as a sex addict who records and photographs his many encounters with women, often with the help of his seedy friend, John Henry Carpenter. This biographical drama reveals how Crane\'s double life takes its toll on him and his family, and ultimately contributes to his death.','/71CQUn4vtpDQtAPXtaLP7IGH0Sg.jpg','2002-10-18',104,'Released','A day without sex is a day wasted.','Auto Focus',14112,3.4213,6.4,'v6Sgoq-VVV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17213,_binary '\0','/vRRYOgwbfqBqt5vyhsqobCYnBIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298780',7.6,1947,'tr','Büyük Adam Küçük Aşk','An orphaned Kurdish child (Hêjar) and a Turkish pensioner (Rıfat) are thrown together by circumstance. Rıfat, a widowed retired judge, refuses to get involved in politics. He is forced out of his solitude, when Hêjar the only survivor of a police raid on his Kurdish neighbors, takes refuge at his home. Gradually, he warms up to the kid and decides to reunite her with her family.','/tMCTxJZhAXdGZ4e1KXCDyeXTPvu.jpg','2001-10-19',115,'Released',NULL,'Big Man, Little Love',61850,1.1976,7.1,'I3vSHEadm08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17214,_binary '\0','/r5BVqptgwUOvxhBiMJnWip8Dwz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298786',6.5,1612,'pt','Caramuru: A invenção do Brasil','Diogo Álvares, a Portuguese map illustrator, reaches the Brazilian coast, after his caravel sinks. He is saved by the Indian chief Itaparica and his two daughters, Paraguaçu and Moema. They call him Caramuru and together they engage in a happy love triangle. But the chance to return to Portugal arises, and it is clear this amoral arrangement cannot last.','/ywgPZAD7rbzFvMOmhR7BtpIu1Yz.jpg','2001-11-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Caramuru: Brazil Reinvented',70815,1.4521,6.444,'lT99uXGXCEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17215,_binary '\0','/iTgjBD4EkeA3Ra86E1X47vgREO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298798',6.6,3020,'en','Cherish','After a martini-induced rampage, a fantasy-prone young woman is placed under house arrest.','/hTNAKGnqi8v4FRPEjm9Wl5S5yMz.jpg','2002-01-17',99,'Released','She\'d get out more if it wasn\'t a felony.','Cherish',18408,1.5166,6,'m_1qRpBF7KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17216,_binary '\0','/v2YxWPX2yKdo6arIAknJzKLxhZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298814',5.5,117430,'en','The Core','Geophysicist Dr. Josh Keyes discovers that an unknown force has caused the earth\'s inner core to stop rotating. With the planet\'s magnetic field rapidly deteriorating, our atmosphere literally starts to come apart at the seams with catastrophic consequences. To resolve the crisis, Keyes, along with a team of the world\'s most gifted scientists, travel into the earth\'s core. Their mission: detonate a device that will reactivate the core.','/iMPR3OFhKNVvJw4eZoRhf9RzfHJ.jpg','2003-03-28',136,'Released','The only way out is in.','The Core',9341,12.1782,5.8,'zcjj6ZSjtNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17217,_binary '\0','/uJHm54Z8Y6WSTSDvhqGSeKjP88v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298845',7.6,44536,'en','In America','A family of Irish immigrants adjusts to life on the mean streets of Hell\'s Kitchen while also grieving the death of a child.','/cUhMjWQyyApA0pFinogCsE2wy8g.jpg','2003-09-22',105,'Released','A new home. A new life. Seen through eyes that see everything.','In America',10511,2.9406,7.145,'CK4sLTF0MPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17218,_binary '\0','/q3P6P6yVij3i16B4F0sotx8IOzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298856',7,7578,'en','Evelyn','Desmond Doyle is devastated when his wife abandons their family on the day after Christmas. His unemployment, and the fact that there is no woman in the house to care for the children—Evelyn, Dermot and Maurice—make it clear to the authorities this is an untenable situation. The Catholic Church and the Irish courts decide to put the Doyle children into Church-run orphanages.','/kGsCpJcJj9JDsSLQRlfukNuZJgq.jpg','2002-09-30',92,'Released','The Story of a Father’s Love That Changed a Nation.','Evelyn',21868,2.6841,6.4,'5a5vdukt_4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17219,_binary '\0','/np2UjnUfHwJyLgNTDWmGoem8PgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0298954',7.6,3637,'el','Το Κλάμα Βγήκε Απ\' Τον Παράδεισο','This is the story of two Greek families, named Delafrangas and Bisbikides. The former family is very wealthy & lucky, the latter very poor and continually struck by fate. Poor but honest Martha is in love with Giakoumis, a young builder and bouzouki organist, but all her dreams fall apart when posh Tzela \"steals\" the love of her beloved one... A couple of flash backs, following their families roots back to WW2 and the Turkish domination, and a hidden secret will unfold the story\'s ending..','/8bi5paxTmFDPIomPsxpTcPMDfiE.jpg','2001-10-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Crying... Silicon Tears',47118,1.2779,6.9,'sfQIemAABQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17220,_binary '\0','/hgt5Op2vVJ0RjaT5FHjHkDs84cn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299108',7.5,10256,'hi','रहना है तेरे दिल में','Maddy impersonates Rajeev, the person his love interest, Reena, is about to marry and attempts to woo her. However, he is unprepared for the moment when the truth will be revealed.','/qTKDqkD5h5ADx9ZoBh6RWNz4DcV.jpg','2001-10-19',168,'Released',NULL,'Rehnaa Hai Terre Dil Mein',46418,1.6889,6.467,'Uxj6qGVpU1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17221,_binary '\0','/o4VyCq8p9QqGH05TdG7J9UzPTNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299117',6.8,18400,'en','Roger Dodger','A smooth-talking ad executive attributes his remarkable success with women to his ability to manipulate their emotions from the moment he first meets them. When his teenage nephew drops in for a visit, he soon learns that his approach isn\'t as foolproof as he thought when he attempts to teach the boy how to pick up women.','/cGfo8maMxoI1W9qA8KcYA7sw10s.jpg','2002-05-09',106,'Released','The naked differences between men and women.','Roger Dodger',13441,2.304,6.1,'cpoXKczjOgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17222,_binary '\0','/Jghbo8U2XkmGjCfKD9NiMM70ha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299172',5.4,30172,'en','Home on the Range','When a greedy outlaw schemes to take possession of the \"Patch Of Heaven\" dairy farm, three determined cows, a karate-kicking stallion and a colorful corral of critters join forces to save their home. The stakes are sky-high as this unlikely animal alliance risk their hides and match wits with a mysterious band of bad guys.','/cgKnkbO3fNWwKc9qLyLYdeZQ9Vj.jpg','2004-04-02',76,'Released','Bust a moo.','Home on the Range',13700,12.6343,6.068,'LMW_nGAsLfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17223,_binary '\0','/dLF1zhiztPEluPkF3GP8PFAXyil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299213',7.1,3261,'ja','ウォーターボーイズ','In a Japanese school, 5 adolescent geeks join the new sport teacher and take up the challenge to take part in the synchronised swimming competition, in-spite of the mockeries of the real sportsmen.','/kYwFX6pJKkI68Ne35LTm0VfEMDe.jpg','2001-09-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Waterboys',30839,3.4833,6.5,'Bc-547XK4Yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17224,_binary '\0','/dRtyK88tpvxWyBPVRLx4b64W036.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299458',6.7,11340,'en','All the Real Girls','In a sleepy little mill town in North Carolina, Paul is the town Romeo. But when his best friend\'s sister returns home from boarding school, he finds himself falling for her innocent charm. In spite of her lack of experience and the violent protests of her brother, the two find themselves in a sweet, dreamy and all-consuming love.','/sQ6dMkwPIFucYSmFQcr38WBYzs.jpg','2003-02-14',108,'Released','Love is a puzzle. These are the pieces.','All the Real Girls',13132,2.6023,5.961,'FTrjVYno6Xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17225,_binary '\0','/2el4qMvnUVhe1GF9iJ2m1q2aSbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299478',7.5,9166,'sv','Saraband','Reuniting the characters of Johan and Marianne three decades after \"Scenes from a Marriage,\" \"Saraband\" follows Marianne’s visit to her reclusive ex-husband, where she finds him locked in a destructive conflict with his troubled son Henrik and Henrik’s musically gifted daughter Karin. Told as an intimate chamber drama, the film explores love, resentment, forgiveness, and the inescapable pull of family bonds.','/8Lt35scCMOh3HhnG81Ndc6dhazA.jpg','2003-12-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Saraband',55650,1.783,7.1,'N2hyg4FyUcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17226,_binary '\0','/ja921tYvpguPNK8pQ3GTWntBirV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299502',6.9,4239,'tr','Laleli\'de Bir Azize','Pimps want to expand and conquer the world, by abiding the greats and oppressing the losers, but they lose their prostitute to some sailors.','/a3YECnPyFNUQwTkbQZMx8otB66g.jpg','1999-03-12',85,'Released',NULL,'A Madonna in Laleli',61843,1.0581,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17227,_binary '\0','/am2a2eK0plsRAjZaZ8W9qcU5ehX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299556',4.4,1398,'fr','Bloody Mallory','Mallory is the head of an elite government-run strike force dedicated to combating the supernatural. Her team includes the drag queen Vena Cava, an explosives expert; a mute, pre-teen telepath capable of possessing others named Talking Tina; and an armed governmental agent named Durand.','/a2hKsgJQpTd17rf6uSrywFkEEQ1.jpg','2002-07-17',94,'Released','Evil has a new enemy.','Bloody Mallory',24829,1.8122,5.1,'OhM6H9zjrDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17228,_binary '\0','/q4ZCSHrpbwZqNJqNidZtoddfKmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299594',6.7,2242,'fr','Brève traversée','A young French man and an older English woman spend one night together on a ship.','/nT8wLojXXdUEjpISv0cCJ7XqPiz.jpg','2001-03-06',84,'Released',NULL,'Brief Crossing',39770,2.1648,5.915,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17229,_binary '\0','/euxYhuuJjChU755u2YHj0ZPjww3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299658',7.2,258633,'en','Chicago','Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.','/3ED8cWCXY9zkx77Sd0N5qMbsdDP.jpg','2002-12-10',113,'Released','If you can\'t be famous, be infamous.','Chicago',1574,8.484,7.1,'YwXWryx-oJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17230,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299854',6.1,1752,'en','The Escapist','Denis Hopkins, a pilot, lives with his pregnant wife Valerie and has a comfortable lifestyle. When a gang of criminals led by the sadistic Ricky Barnes breaks into his home, he offers whatever the criminals want to protect his wife and unborn child, but the evil Ricky kills Valerie anyway. Their baby is saved, and later Barnes is arrested and sentenced to life in the maximum security prison, Sullen Voe. Denis fakes his own suicide, then assaults a police car in order to get himself arrested and sent to prison with the intention of tracking down and killing Ricky Barnes. He does not reveal his true name and is called John \"What\" by the prisoners and guards. Denis escapes from successive prisons, forcing his eventual transfer to Sullen Voe. When he reaches his objective, Ricky Barnes schedules a confrontation, but things do not quite turn out the way Denis had expected.','/3mmtzUN9VLQiB3aEIr7x96AXC4m.jpg','2002-04-12',88,'Released','He can escape from anything... except his past.','The Escapist',49814,1.2443,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17231,_binary '\0','/mxLDJjmPw7gCGoHSaaTLLQbX0op.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299873',6.1,1615,'es','Fausto 5.0','On his way to a medical convention, Dr Fausto runs into a man who claims the Doctor removed his stomach eight years ago in a surgical operation. Against all odds, he is still alive. The man turns up repeatedly and promises Fausto to make all his wishes come true. Reality starts dissolving and Fausto begins to lose control','/3ro3LJm6vfLTYymSwmKHMSUTsUj.jpg','2001-08-30',93,'Released',NULL,'Fausto 5.0',71786,1.4634,6.1,'Cw_DvX8UQEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17232,_binary '\0','/ciIVYsDU4F4nCfrE6j6d1kCfStU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299930',2.7,51082,'en','Gigli','Gigli is ordered to kidnap the psychologically challenged younger brother of a powerful federal prosecutor. When plans go awry, Gigli\'s boss sends in Ricki, a gorgeous free-spirited female gangster who has her own set of orders to assist with the kidnapping. But Gigli begins falling for the decidedly unavailable Ricki, which could be a hazard to his occupation.','/qOhAK3WDqdeVTIE59loXvEGU7Lu.jpg','2003-08-01',122,'Released','Life doesn\'t play by the rules.','Gigli',8046,4.1526,4,'qDED4FPmuZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17233,_binary '\0','/enGdajhhWSvzuxsH5kXg7sMpGuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299937',7.4,3278,'ja','GO','Sugihara, a Japanese-born, third-generation Korean teenager struggles to find a place in a society that will not accept him.','/1b4JNGUsy0WAuHAVK2VPNCcvPGS.jpg','2001-10-20',122,'Released','This is my love story.','GO',37959,2.198,7.378,'jGnFNDEVn9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17234,_binary '\0','/uYncAMtKx9Srm210uZ8wkOWlI2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299943',5.7,2281,'en','Gotta Kick It Up!','This was going to be the first year that Marshal Middle School was not going to have a dance team. All that changes when the new Biology teacher, Ms. Bartlett, agrees to be the coach. Now the girls need to prove that they are ready to compete and are able to win; not only to themselves, but to their parents and coach. Using the chant \"si, se puede\" or \"yes, I can\" the Dance team builds their confidence to perform.','/3pTKPtHKcVAMjHmRbUOV3Lu5Ljy.jpg','2002-07-26',85,'Released','Yes We Can!','Gotta Kick It Up!',124108,2.7697,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17235,_binary '\0','/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299977',7.9,195395,'zh','英雄','During China\'s Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king\'s life three years ago.','/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg','2002-12-19',99,'Released','One man\'s strength will unite an empire.','Hero',79,10.3068,7.5,'MgsddFEe9Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17236,_binary '\0','/oyzdxAn5Z7O6VdRpuuzHC1acAmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0299981',3,10431,'en','Highlander: The Source','The world is falling into chaos. As he roams a crumbling city, Duncan MacLeod, the Highlander, remembers happier times before the love of his life left... Hopeless and alone, MacLeod finds his way to a band of immortal companions, including his mysterious friend Methos, and a mortal, Watcher Joe Dawson. Together this small group sets out on a quest to find the origin of the first Immortal.','/1d0pKQuk6KUHaK5LL6ZNvSp6vS8.jpg','2007-02-06',86,'Released','The quest for mortality begins.','Highlander: The Source',13360,3.1464,4.1,'eIpjY0FEW0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17237,_binary '\0','/5fzp2qAtmSdKWPk5YaeZ3WyBDcx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300015',6.8,8423,'en','I Capture the Castle','In 1930s England, 17-year-old Cassandra Mortmain and her eccentric family struggle to survive in a decaying English castle.','/fGV45q9gyysfp9SdoqrrReVxC9a.jpg','2003-05-09',113,'Released','You can\'t choose who you fall in love with','I Capture the Castle',17920,2.9392,6.7,'I3zqvagbRo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17238,_binary '\0','/e2yTVFdirggRRntYoGiFAqS3uTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300028',5.5,2973,'hi','Indian','DCP Raksekhar Azad (Raj) is an invincible cop with a great aim. He arrests a terrorist by the name of Khan. But Khan lands in a prison cell that looks cushier than the Buckingham Palace. However, this gets Raj promoted, and he is congratulated by none other than his father-in-law, who is also a very high ranking policeman. Then all of a sudden, Raj finds out that many policemen would like to see Khan go free. He discusses this issue with his father-in-law, and to his surprise, does not find any support from him. Disagreements and arguments ensue, and as a result, his father-in-law gets killed. The Police suspect Raj of killing him, they begin the process of arresting him, he runs away, while Khan is all set to get freed to do whatever he likes.','/kMoS0caFjAsEJFX5HrbMGd4g51T.jpg','2001-10-26',178,'Released',NULL,'Indian',82575,1.0347,5.167,'ErMqa8av_Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17239,_binary '\0','/zuxSfx7ZNzBsXE0f0lSGrfRB01e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300051',6.2,75075,'en','Jersey Girl','Ollie Trinke is a young, suave music publicist who seems to have it all, with a new wife and a baby on the way. But life deals him a bum hand when he\'s suddenly faced with single fatherhood, a defunct career and having to move in with his father. To bounce back, it takes a new love and the courage instilled in him by his daughter.','/nMmMWoSooR6QmCjdT0AvZardof1.jpg','2004-03-25',102,'Released','He wanted it all...but he got more than he bargained for.','Jersey Girl',9541,5.8553,6.2,'CL04A-DrIEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17240,_binary '\0','/eCU2dxggXJjJ9lsIMp5qf5qvz98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300140',7.8,56487,'sv','Lilja 4-ever','In a struggling post-Soviet community, Lilya a teenage girl is abandoned when her mother moves to the United States with her boyfriend. Facing neglect and poverty, she meets Andrei, who offers her a job in Sweden, giving her hope for a better life — and a journey that will change everything.','/5i1uhvcdv2Iogx0Bb1znvUmkCvN.jpg','2002-08-23',109,'Released',NULL,'Lilya 4-ever',12093,5.8186,7.6,'LUHHsPP7XRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17241,_binary '\0','/aRFsgk8X8J6mRvgStvUDBIaDdlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300214',6.8,12623,'en','Morvern Callar','After her boyfriend commits suicide, a young woman attempts to use the unpublished manuscript of a novel and a sum of money he left behind to reinvent her life.','/kKGUF97v8a62MtSKM0V6fqDxGTS.jpg','2002-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Morvern Callar',18602,2.3391,6.7,'oZ-13OskDDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17242,_binary '\0','/qldSMzF8Sel8DztoaiYKqOkXbed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300237',6,2401,'de','Nackt','The story of three couples, one of which just broke up, one that seems to be about to, and one perfectly okay. They are all friends, and from time to time, they gather to talk about everything. One time, they gather for dinner at the second couple\'s \"mansion“— the husband became rich with his business. We see each couple as they prepare themselves for the party and learn a lot about their relationships. At the dinner, they get to talking about recognizing each other\'s peer with closed eyes and decide to try it, naked.','/axR8AzjkjzjIVdJWVAb48XQuQvw.jpg','2002-09-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Naked',1740,2.1838,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17243,_binary '\0','/s1K8dZkKIhhsrdUPE27AWaiK4fQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300270',6.8,4766,'es','La niña santa','Amalia is an adolescent girl who is caught in the throes of her emerging sexuality and her deeply held passion for her Catholic faith. These two drives mingle when the visiting Dr. Jano takes advantage of a crowd to get inappropriately close to the girl. Repulsed by him but inspired by an inner burning, Amalia decides it is her God-given mission to save the doctor from his behavior, and she begins to stalk Dr. Jano, becoming a most unusual voyeur.','/srA4HPJe0YpDTZ4L4Nj5psD7v48.jpg','2004-05-06',106,'Released','She is both temptation and salvation.','The Holy Girl',44413,2.3683,6.624,'BY6M-Datddg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17244,_binary '\0','/AoXqOWzD0HGZttYi0wHMvvGJZhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300471',6.2,118424,'en','Shanghai Knights','When a Chinese rebel murders Chon\'s estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.','/vVNQStMlZS9mn2AKBEpadRunHgt.jpg','2003-02-06',115,'Released','A Royal Kick In The Arse','Shanghai Knights',6038,9.4227,6.139,'1QUHogxpXp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17245,_binary '\0','/xsVMKdSndUKid3Xm3Tudf5bcOlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300532',5.7,34768,'en','Blue Crush','Nothing gets between Anne Marie and her board. Living in a beach shack with three roommates, she is up before dawn every morning to conquer the waves and count the days until the Pipe Masters competition. Having transplanted herself to Hawaii with no one\'s blessing but her own, Anne Marie finds all she needs in the adrenaline-charged surf scene - until pro quarterback Matt Tollman comes along...','/iZSw0JVG0cIFuZoTHuQU3nmGT4k.jpg','2002-08-16',104,'Released','If you want to feel the rush, you have to take the risk.','Blue Crush',9266,4.858,6,'ljN7SEEwhmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17246,_binary '\0','/lEmO4jnwfU2tifXQZDsbjSJLJTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300556',5.7,69923,'en','Timeline','A group of archaeological students become trapped in the past when they go there to retrieve their professor. The group must survive in 14th century France long enough to be rescued.','/vexgfnhdlKERRMMdyVYLBXx89LW.jpg','2003-11-26',115,'Released','They had to travel into the past to save the future','Timeline',9562,6.8494,5.731,'6GLVsHZ9J1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17247,_binary '\0','/DKiebEytdEyrh9E66XQ9kWovcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300620',6.6,8478,'cn','夕陽天使','A conflict of interest between two high-kicking assassin sisters is complicated as they\'re pursued by the criminals who hired them and an equally high-kicking female cop.','/zdw5bISsOT9JLS4mB9OPxH91Sg5.jpg','2002-05-14',111,'Released','Looks can be deceiving.','So Close',15136,4.6752,6.9,'O_WpfNNJTBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17248,_binary '\0','/ctW5cIR3romaxkynGLI00DehWlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300657',3.9,2553,'pl','Wiedźmin','A heroic fantasy based on the famous novels by Polish writer Andrzej Sapkowski, \"The Sword of Destiny\" and \"The Last Wish\". This film immerses us in a world inhabited by kings and knights, princesses and sorcerers, priests and magicians, where fire-breathing dragons guard untold treasures, and human greed leads to an endless struggle for power, cruelty, bloodshed, and violence. And this world has its own superheroes - fearless witchers, people with magical powers. Their mission is to protect the human race from any misfortune. The witcher Geralt of Rivia must find the young princess Ciri, kidnapped by enemies. Only her return to the small kingdom of Cintra, which was attacked by aggressors, can restore peace and order there. The brave witcher sets off on a journey, long, distant and deadly.','/7C5xgUSD9uzCrjv0CT2TNhUn78P.jpg','2001-11-09',130,'Released','Destiny is a double-edged sword','The Hexer',57278,1.5431,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17249,_binary '\0','/a1NQ6RVB56vtMAsX3jx7cwO2BC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300902',4.2,3522,'en','Absolon','In the near future, a virus has infected everyone on the planet, and Absolon is a drug that everyone must take to stay alive. One corporation controls the drug. Murchison is the leader of this firm. A scientist who was researching the virus is found murdered, and Norman Scott is the policeman who investigates the crime.','/pLhakprIzI0nXDpwwgJ04XiYcFM.jpg','2003-03-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Absolon',4612,2.2936,4.151,'f6OgVzEs0O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17250,_binary '\0','/pDUvDgNLlcnbJNp6Eyc1KUXzgOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300922',3.1,2401,'en','All Babes Want To Kill Me','A Martial Artist, afflicted with a disease that makes beautiful women want to kill him, goes on a suicide mission to find true love anyway.','/2SI8DtUzdqbhIQ4I0fXgidLEkd6.jpg','2005-02-16',82,'Released','Come Celebrate the Cruelty','All Babes Want To Kill Me',61715,1.5293,2.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17251,_binary '\0','/ocmtNnI6b8sBUXb5KAtxZB4AGoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0300957',7.7,3128,'el','Ας Περιμένουν οι Γυναίκες','In the course of the summer three brothers-in-law at a crucial age become involved in ephemeral romantic adventures in the area of Lake Volvi while their families vacation on the island of Thassos and… can wait.','/5Sg230a9w9nOwwTbkRALAtAi0Z1.jpg','1998-12-04',87,'Released',NULL,'Let the Women Wait!',73329,1.327,7.175,'YAHbLS2zqa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17252,_binary '\0','/nvYzkjzoaqm9wzdPPqZLtwK1S4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301050',7.2,1327,'es','Bolivia','Freddy emigrates to Buenos Aires in search of a more prosperous life. In his native country, Bolivia, he left his family. But the capital of Argentina is not the paradise he dreamed of, and much less for illegal immigrants like himself. But even with that, he gets a job as a griller in a restaurant.','/4DEsWiHiSGQpzcgB2OlIQC6rkkO.jpg','2002-04-11',75,'Released','The tragedy of being a foreigner.','Bolivia',49913,1.6305,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17253,_binary '\0','/u9K1AShm7AgQkLozGvG8VGFuh6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301082',7.2,2021,'ja','劇場版カードキャプターさくら','Sakura Kinomoto, a Card Captor, wins a game of chance and is awarded a trip to Hong Kong, along with her best friend Tomoyo and her rival, Syaoran Li. It turns out that the ancient rival of Clow Reed, the creator of the mysterious and powerful Clow Cards, summoned them, and she\'s out for revenge. A battle ensues, and secrets are revealed about Clow Reed\'s shady past and Sakura\'s connection to him.','/qgFFwLekxzDYLjc07OqnsSShqwb.jpg','1999-08-21',81,'Released',NULL,'Cardcaptor Sakura: The Movie',26945,3.0845,7.7,'8tEW5hqcpSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17254,_binary '\0','/8WCbSctYQbBxU3dsFlDAZgLDyDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301083',7.7,1996,'ja','劇場版 カードキャプターさくら 封印されたカード','All of the Clow Cards have been captured, and Sakura Kinomoto, the new Master of the Cards, is preparing to play the lead in the play for the town festival. However, a new evil force is causing mysterious events all over Tomoeda, including the disappearance of Sakura\'s cards. With Syaoran\'s help, Sakura must figure out the cause of these events, and save her town.','/doJEr8GLTZYq10jZwKLQnzPZGsy.jpg','2000-07-15',82,'Released',NULL,'Cardcaptor Sakura: The Sealed Card',31347,3.2966,8.2,'8RPTwKMsHnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17255,_binary '\0','/uXCJQ6hEYAPcoV3LuD8m3vZC1OY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301167',5.6,2977,'ja','DEAD OR ALIVE FINAL','In post-apocalyptic Yokohama, a hard-boiled cop and a mellowed out drifter hook up with a gang of rebels. When the gang kidnap the cop\'s son, the wheels are set in motion for an inevitable showdown.','/7wHsgK1dvFdp6pv3ok3BHDY33Op.jpg','2002-01-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Dead or Alive: Final',36222,2.7205,5.6,'VdMfLalXfE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17256,_binary '\0','/VbhAaAjxFeGJS6ZpdWF2pDkDlI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301181',6.1,8244,'en','Deliver Us from Eva','Eva Dandridge has been in charge of her younger sisters ever since their parents died many years ago. She is a very uptight young woman who constantly meddles in the affairs of her sisters and their significant others. Her brothers-in-law, who are tired of Eva interfering in their lives, decide to set her up with someone so she can leave them alone. They end up paying Ray, the local \"playboy,\" $5,000 to date her. The plan goes by smoothly, but trouble comes when Ray actually falls in love with Eva.','/mkCC7wOJ0C1gfEt44ca25x8xTdL.jpg','2003-02-07',105,'Released','Lead us into temptation but...','Deliver Us from Eva',26454,2.5936,6.4,'tGUb0rQvW3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17257,_binary '\0','/4Q28PE1ZlRBMZqRluoVkP3NN7eO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301199',7.2,45847,'en','Dirty Pretty Things','An undocumented immigrant finds a human heart in one of the toilets of the west London hotel where he works with other undocumented immigrants.','/nWpXOqB1STDq8ji3rQawcg1fGS9.jpg','2002-09-05',97,'Released','Every dream has its price.','Dirty Pretty Things',3472,4.5615,6.9,'lJD8-AXGVPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17258,_binary '\0','/bJAtYjDG9YGawZuoAVEnB7WAX0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301235',6.8,1819,'en','Hell House','A look at the \"Hell House\" performed annually in October by the youth members of Trinity Church (Assemblies of God) in Cedar Hill, Texas (a Dallas suburb) — seen by over 10,000 visitors each year.','/sFwYtNYAZc8WOhKIeh4ESp3Xamr.jpg','2001-09-12',85,'Released','This church wants to scare the Hell out of you.','Hell House',33068,1.9846,6.3,'TXxfIktv8RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17259,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301245',5.4,1425,'nl','Oesters van Nam Kee','Young Dutch dropout, Berry, falls in love with slightly older nightclub dancer and ex-nude model Thera and gives up his social live with his dodgy comrades and fine family to make a three-stop \'world tour\' together. Suddenly Thera ODs terribly, leaving Berry alone with his obsessive but unanswered love which drives him crazy.','/lHB81CWqZODRlHAuzcCzL396j3u.jpg','2002-09-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Oysters at Nam Kee\'s',37602,1.1688,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17260,_binary '\0','/uBLmfG7MyNXPXI50eMs1ZjxpbnV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301357',7.7,160883,'de','Good Bye, Lenin!','Alex Kerner\'s mother was in a coma while the Berlin wall fell. When she wakes up he must try to keep her from learning what happened (as she was an avid communist supporter) to avoid shocking her which could lead to another heart attack.','/uHk1oGEbnvQGLnyiiYxTslZLoog.jpg','2003-02-13',121,'Released',NULL,'Good Bye, Lenin!',338,7.09,7.532,'mIjSaHUKD5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17261,_binary '\0','/jlSPQZ5t58ibJvdrvSHN5I2tNk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301390',6.5,2938,'en','The Heart of Me','Drama set in 1930s London with two sisters, Madeleine married to Rickie, and Dinah, who falls in love with him. Rickie and Dinah begin an affair which is to have repercussions throughout all their lives.','/4zxVdxQoptVl7lShV7FJTMiKez5.jpg','2004-02-10',96,'Released','Every pleasure has a price...','The Heart of Me',24985,2.2982,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17262,_binary '\0','/yQB81KQw8XFX7CZgZx6hB7HGyul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301414',7.1,7875,'fr','L\'Homme du train','A man, Milan steps off a train, into a small French village. As he waits for the day when he will rob the town bank, he runs into an old retired poetry teacher named M. Manesquier. The two men strike up a strange friendship and explore the road not taken, each wanting to live the other\'s life.','/3npd5xuegtcYc6HPt5NgdB27sRA.jpg','2002-10-02',90,'Released','A poet. A thief. Two strangers with nothing in common are about to trade their lives for a chance to cheat their destinies.','Man on the Train',22016,2.7969,6.7,'6fGtw2CZAj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17263,_binary '\0','/2Hb9jP9CHpMAEFe73aGAzdIrAln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301429',5.9,3725,'ko','화산고','Kim is expelled from his eighth school and finds himself at Volcano High where students fight to possess a treasured ancient document. Kim, who must resist from using his Chi, is caught in the middle.','/c9ItiEc0OlFcxvQtKITxwU6o8tJ.jpg','2001-12-08',120,'Released','Who is the Best WaSanGo Martial Arts Expert?','Volcano High',23834,3.1321,6.038,'V5W351aUYJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17264,_binary '\0','/pPZUYQx5PuH4xkXkFizirTd0ey1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301470',5.7,76413,'en','Jeepers Creepers 2','When their bus is crippled on the side of a deserted road, a team of high school athletes discover an opponent they cannot defeat – and may not survive.','/u2ghDfjcs3y5c8ata3COc4pWiAN.jpg','2003-08-08',104,'Released','He can taste your fear.','Jeepers Creepers 2',11351,8.529,6.2,'Quy0zQ1PXVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17265,_binary '\0','/gw108P9cMhSgCw2Efsp7eNWis2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301524',6.4,6154,'es','El otro lado de la cama','When Paula leaves her mate Pedro, he misses her and looks for comfort with his best friends, Javier and Sonia. Paula is having an affair with Javier. Pedro tries to find who is the secret lover of Paula, and hires a private eye. Meanwhile, while comforting Pedro, Sonia has a one night stand with him and Javier thinks she is cheating on him with her lesbian friend Luzia.','/6qHQ1dnXeJnV9fg7UINvGrZfBKx.jpg','2002-04-27',114,'Released','If love is only a game...Why not cheat?','The Other Side of the Bed',2722,2.4074,6,'3LYvBIOvgh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17266,_binary '\0','/w2RdgPaBWuPV98FQgGBTUZ8ef38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301555',7.9,2996,'en','God Grew Tired of Us','Filmmaker Christopher Quinn observes the ordeal of three Sudanese refugees -- Jon Bul Dau, Daniel Abul Pach and Panther Bior -- as they try to come to terms with the horrors they experienced in their homeland, while adjusting to their new lives in the United States.','/mrUCcDeCPW3d0s2VCgyTRVoxyKa.jpg','2006-12-31',89,'Released',NULL,'God Grew Tired of Us',15325,1.9389,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17267,_binary '\0','/jtr93LYk6EITJzXH4RpTMOUtDU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301634',8.3,11071,'sr','Mrtav \'ladan','The basic plot revolves around drug dealer Limeni and two men, Lemi and Kiza, who are trying to transport their dead grandfather for burial, until their car breaks down and they end up struggling to get him home onboard a train. This is when these two plots intersect and all hell breaks loose.','/hXbGz9XJy9HqxdJyursXIv4669x.jpg','2002-03-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Frozen Stiff',15303,1.8574,7.109,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17268,_binary '\0','/hD4Ok3fWe9gpGQlunPcCOO79Hlq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301684',6.2,4970,'en','Once Upon a Time in the Midlands','Though Dek leads a simple and happy life with his girlfriend Shirley and her 12-year-old daughter Marlene, his grand, televised marriage proposal puts his devotion to the test—especially as Marlene\'s long-absent biological father, Jimmy, looms in the background.','/z4w08dm44L650QCegJQML4AyFTJ.jpg','2002-09-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in the Midlands',22200,1.8473,6.1,'cW-OZw3NX0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17269,_binary '\0','/c8lCUmgvyxfM3oJzbD9bQf8bV02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301727',7.9,12727,'fr','Le Peuple migrateur','This documentary follows various migratory bird species on their long journeys from their summer homes to the equator and back, covering thousands of miles and navigating by the stars. These arduous treks are crucial for survival, seeking hospitable climates and food sources. Birds face numerous challenges, including crossing oceans and evading predators, illness, and injury. Although migrations are undertaken as a community, birds disperse into family units once they reach their destinations, and every continent is affected by these migrations, hosting migratory bird species at least part of the year.','/qjv7cYLSufwf03So0SuRFU7sRxB.jpg','2001-12-12',89,'Released','The amazing odysseys of traveling birds','Winged Migration',11516,4.4123,7.598,'Pc_qpk2d-ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17270,_binary '\0','/mjs9DUgxtiiUs3uw5t2P9rD09AN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301744',4.9,1456,'en','The Principles of Lust','Crippled by his writer\'s block, Paul enters into a new, exciting relationship with risk-taking Billy and super-sexy Juliette. As it becomes increasingly tangled, however, he must choose one of them over the other.','/5EH7sX7aWWWQZhZpcfFSSjNoVnb.jpg','2003-01-29',108,'Released',NULL,'The Principles of Lust',187383,2.4449,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17271,_binary '\0','/2TwTXRtFT2tjl8hsLcUbdjbZc1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301777',6,1459,'en','Robot Stories','Four stories including: \"My Robot Baby,\" in which a couple must care for a robot baby before adopting a human child; \"The Robot Fixer,\" in which a mother tries to connect with her dying son; \"Machine Love,\" in which an office worker android learns that he, too, needs love; and \"Clay,\" in which an old sculptor must choose between natural death and digital immortality.','/bXpVhiLaG8i1bIYaMEsC3pRJIkM.jpg','2003-01-01',85,'Released','Everything is changing... Except the human heart.','Robot Stories',20032,1.406,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17272,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301848',4.3,1720,'en','Slash','A rock band gets stuck on a haunted farm while visiting its lead singer\'s family.','/wD5FkAFrHWDcfNXf3l02JSATa8P.jpg','2002-09-13',93,'Released','Where blood is Sown, Evil is Grown.','Slash',48359,1.2221,4.2,'WKMbsENuBuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17273,_binary '\0','/xX7PgNYaBTeGjtcxeSUh7DvI9o4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301893',4.3,2411,'en','State Property','A Philadelphia gang member becomes a drug kingpin and starts a feud with vicious rivals in his quest for the American Dream.','/eq8ygk2egSs9QnQfrjqE4fJ44OJ.jpg','2002-01-18',88,'Released',NULL,'State Property',25006,2.1359,6.4,'0j0uyeAO1zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17274,_binary '\0','/9Z5hWuD1fSZfrcorI8xXVaL3bAJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301935',6.9,1300,'en','Three Days','Ten years ago, Andrew married his childhood sweetheart, Beth. Now Andrew\'s a high-powered literary agent, but his relationship with his wife has not fared as well. When Beth is tragically killed just days before Christmas, an angel gives Andrew the chance to relive the last three days his wife was alive. But he can\'t change fate and Beth will still lose her life. However, Andrew can still discover the gift Beth needs most from him.','/gAxVMBz3mueFJqbxISwJ7ejN5u6.jpg','2001-12-09',91,'Released','An angel interrupts destiny to give love 72 hours for a second chance.','Three Days',63809,1.8872,6.1,'ditB7wqaFuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17275,_binary '\0','/lIWbyPbnUUJPUvzwIN4BaeEGIgU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301976',6.9,25434,'en','The United States of Leland','A withdrawn young man, Leland Fitzgerald is imprisoned for the murder of a mentally disabled boy, who also happened to be the brother of his girlfriend, Becky. As the community struggles to deal with the killing, Pearl Madison, a teacher at the prison, decides to write about Leland\'s case. Meanwhile, others affected by the murder, including Becky and her sister, Julie, must contend with their own problems.','/60B0kXNSy3isCSZtM3vl2GWeKdE.jpg','2003-05-15',108,'Released','Crime. Confusion. Compassion. They\'re all just states of mind.','The United States of Leland',13573,4.5673,6.502,'0yZujcBv8S4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17276,_binary '\0','/dnL9JOW8kcXaLcSFxFO4RI5FegT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301978',7.4,9184,'fa','ده','A visual social examination in the form of ten conversations between a driving woman and her various pick-ups and hitchhikers.','/6qOJ6COcbJ3X8JmZI6A7VroGsn2.jpg','2002-05-20',94,'Released',NULL,'Ten',14633,1.4827,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17277,_binary '\0','/v31unExuoySkoFcff2I6rBg8cru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301989',5,1454,'en','Visitors','The story of Georgia Perry, the first woman to sail around the world solo.','/7Cumw8zsn0LpNaGHtWdOhaO37Nn.jpg','2003-11-27',100,'Released','Fear Runs Deep','Visitors',51046,1.3789,5.2,'J92MXqAvX-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17278,_binary '\0','/rJ2yVNyFz5RPTws7j5Cq55A1QPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0301992',4.2,1637,'nl','Volle Maan','A bunch of graduates go out sailing to visit a secret Full Moon Party. Hans Nijboer also tries to get his brother Ties back home to work in the familie business. Ties has other plans, he wants to become a singer.','/knnb0XsCxAEW5awz61TYA1872Te.jpg','2002-10-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Full Moon Party',42972,0.9684,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17279,_binary '\0','/hfRllpqjLJfD2s78OVj0KCaGPQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302022',8.5,3140,'en','We Stand Alone Together: The Men of Easy Company','Over a period of two years, Mark Cowen and his crew travelled to thirty U.S. states and ten European cities, to interview the veterans of Easy Company. The stories told by the veterans themselves, create a history of the Second World War from the point of view of this heroic company of men, made famous in the mini-series Band of Brothers.','/sB1gxrDCLp9ikxDzMEzraVKrTnj.jpg','2001-11-10',78,'Released',NULL,'We Stand Alone Together: The Men of Easy Company',235199,2,7.4,'z6j_nop4wh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17280,_binary '\0','/l1PPSx89WvyA6Avpmfdzyc9FbhU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302282',6.8,1472,'tr','Aslan Bacanak','Selim, a minibus driver, moves to a new neighborhood. After a while, he falls in love with Zeynep, who lives in the neighborhood, and proposes to her. She accepts on the condition that he convinces her brother. Selim will try to convince her brother Halim, a bully, so that he can marry Zeynep.','/s3TQ9tvJQWvA0lWiAibUu18AGLL.jpg','1977-04-01',93,'Released',NULL,'My Brother-in-Law',453494,1.059,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17281,_binary '\0','/6K8FUL9eKJuVN4VKp5by4h3d7ec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302297',4.7,6684,'en','Barely Legal','Teenager Deacon works at a video shop, and his buddies, Fred and Matt, sell the bootleg porno films he acquires. Deacon gets fired, but the pals have the bright idea of filming their own Internet porn flick in order to make money and become more popular at school. Hijinks ensue as they cast and create their movie, but porn industry player Vic Ramalot grows jealous of their burgeoning success and tries to put a stop to the project.','/xN3CR1V3ccOmp1LXhR1FutwmuU2.jpg','2003-05-15',92,'Released','They couldn\'t rent it, so they made it themselves.','Barely Legal',15276,4.592,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17282,_binary '\0','/2suIPAGVDP2P1jHx3Y0aKY3mKIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302361',5.9,2390,'en','Bookies','Four college friends become small-time bookies, only to find their world spinning dangerously out of control when their greed attracts the attention of organized crime.','/pHfc4AbPqx7St264XoWzm7cScQM.jpg','2003-01-20',88,'Released','Risk is the biggest rush.','Bookies',14759,2.0362,6.4,'k-rRx5ePVX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17283,_binary '\0','/rPxTanFuMee6OVCTmV5nBhp1Mwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302436',6.2,3612,'en','To Kill a King','A recounting of the relationship between General Fairfax and Oliver Cromwell, as they try to cope with the consequences of deposing King Charles I.','/ruWWU2gr0C9ZZCjxnjorHIEb8Cy.jpg','2003-05-16',102,'Released','...It takes a traitor and a hero','To Kill a King',18359,3.0838,5.8,'Jxcs3HnFps8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17284,_binary '\0','/iYWxUv1n9itE8hGhBTUgBINeuCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302463',6.5,4392,'tr','Deli Yürek: Bumerang Cehennemi','Yusuf Miroğlu and Zeynep travel to Diyarbakır in southeast Turkey to attend his best friend Cemal\'s wedding. While performing the traditional halay dance at the wedding, Cemal is killed by an assassin. Cemal\'s widowed wife Leyla pleads Yusuf to find the people behind the murder and bring them to justice. Yusuf finds himself caught in a struggle against the PKK and other terrorist groups in the area.','/nI9U0teyntTLf5dC1rp8U5vcKzC.jpg','2001-12-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Hell of Boomerang',199326,1.7935,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17285,_binary '\0','/li0odPdqPoxaFYsQcjtXU1klwyP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302585',6.8,4710,'en','Fubar','Terry and Dean are lifelong friends who have grown-up together: shotgunning their first beers, forming their first garage band, and growing the great Canadian mullet known as \"hockey hair\". Now the lives of these Alberta everymen are brought to the big screen by documentarian Ferral Mitchener in an exploration of the depths of friendship, the fragility of life, growing up gracefully and the art and science of drinking beer like a man.','/95f3BiuBTKhemHLVe7Nyh8AhuEa.jpg','2002-05-24',80,'Released','Just Give\'r','Fubar',13984,1.1342,6.3,'DbW0_C2H19c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17286,_binary '\0','/vK8uTRjiNkJ7P2VINNLxYWiiw0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302640',5.6,111343,'en','The Hot Chick','Not only is Jessica Spencer the most popular girl in school -- she is also the meanest. But things change for the attractive teen when a freak accident involving a cursed pair of earrings and a chance encounter at a gas station causes her to switch bodies with Clive, a sleazy crook. Jessica, in the form of the repulsive Clive, struggles to adjust to this radical alteration and sets out to get her own body back before the upcoming prom.','/lnnGE4TKa05t20SZ2batuAhXCp4.jpg','2002-12-13',104,'Released','The hottest chick in town just switched bodies with the luckiest loser in the world.','The Hot Chick',11852,12.5884,6.4,'6z5zbY-0QCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17287,_binary '\0','/zZ6I4kmBSKcA3r4LcvP1ya4Vkmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302674',6,20848,'en','Gerry','Two friends named Gerry become lost in the desert after taking a wrong turn. Their attempts to find their way home only lead them into further trouble.','/jzuPVECdfWuHoBIqQEFajbSwwpa.jpg','2002-09-20',103,'Released','The desert can be a silent world.','Gerry',1956,2.7768,6.1,'L6Gfr0OJODI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17288,_binary '\0','/X3rrtCJmwPthjRnFobBAMrosjJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302819',4.8,3136,'en','Mr. Bones','A medicine man is sent looking for the son of his tribal king, and brings back an American golfer and a host of goons intent on keeping him in the golf tournament.','/tE7YBzz8qigI3MSemIQu2fglLWZ.jpg','2001-10-30',110,'Released','You\'ll laugh till your bones hurt','Mr. Bones',36267,2.2793,6,'br0cyOHUi4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17289,_binary '\0','/2tZVYiosztNM1DAYUF59VPsNp9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302886',7,258329,'en','Old School','Three friends attempt to recapture their glory days by opening up a fraternity near their alma mater.','/nYtuwNHpEoIbTgS3aFPSEwZNN6l.jpg','2003-02-21',92,'Released','All the fun of college. None of the education.','Old School',11635,12.4503,6.628,'VqtymOtKr48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17290,_binary '\0','/rjpFi7nQsSWyy9a1wInAPanIIpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0302935',4.4,1314,'da','Polle Fiction','The whole plot in this crazy comedy movie is a story about a geeky and nerdy guy called Polle, who lives in a little village named Snave, which is far out in the Danish countryside. Even though he has turned 30, he\'s is still living with his parents, and he\'s kind of an outsider in the little town. The only sort of \"friends\" he actually has, are three totally much more insane yokels named Heino, Jøgge and Knasti, who are always spending their time, doing live tough for poor Polle.','/z8q2o0y9F2s3kWTC2kcu5skqIgF.jpg','2002-03-08',90,'Released','Money. Power. Lust. And shit.','Polle Fiction',77568,1.9463,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17291,_binary '\0','/edeSUOYacNFzwT3anFI3HL8xZoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303010',6.3,1320,'en','Savage Messiah','As a small-town social worker investigates a commune headed by a spiritual leader calling himself Moses, she discovers a dead child, sadistic rituals, and ruthless mental and physical abuse.','/wfFaCct1TWjnIHSu79qnp8IcnYB.jpg','2002-04-26',94,'Released','He promised them... Love, Healing, SALVATION','Savage Messiah',48381,1.3382,5.4,'ERX1ImACfvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17292,_binary '\0','/h72UnVD7EwXYc7BYAZvffrDjs7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303017',3.7,1540,'en','Scorcher','The only hope for humanity to survive a natural disaster is to detonate a nuclear bomb in Los Angeles.','/hkyMlHqPwWFSSuDwuQLRlIhlWiv.jpg','2002-10-04',91,'Released','Mankind Faces Earth\'s Final Days...','Scorcher',5965,1.2754,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17293,_binary '\0','/wmLyTa2T20xf7QouwbOyUpWFPZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303021',5.4,1590,'es','El segundo nombre','After the suicide of her beloved father, the biologist Daniella Logan visits her catatonic mother in a mental institution to tell the tragic event and her mother calls her \"Josephine\". Daniella goes to the cemetery and finds that her father\'s grave had been opened and his corpse was profaned. She decides to investigate, and receives a message of a diabetic priest, Father Elias, who tells her about an ancient fanatic religious sect of followers of Abraham that kills the first child. Later, she meets a weird man, Toby Harris, who claims to be his legitimate father. Daniella continues seeking the truth about her origins and discloses very dark secrets about her family and friends.','/iak4DHSceDrQtdJ2wkhnZnpWH9W.jpg','2002-11-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Second Name',59851,1.5706,5.6,'kujLHv1A-sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17294,_binary '\0','/Rd44wrhCZWNaPl4dO4l62veITZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303184',6.9,5552,'hu','Valami Amerika','Tamás is a young, Budapest-based director of video clips and commercials who dreams of directing his...','/3oejzT2Duq53XiWLK7ClcVMuOQX.jpg','2002-01-31',115,'Released',NULL,'A Kind of America',40360,1.6688,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17295,_binary '\0','/eFEA6ftIihZnsh3lUYuuR8l8u3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303243',7.3,4314,'zh','幸福时光','Zhao is an ageing bachelor, who has not been fortunate in love. Believing that he has finally met the female of his dreams, Zhao makes her believe that he is opulent and consents to a lavish wedding.','/3R2mheIEHKmbrjDyohw88Z89d8a.jpg','2000-12-31',102,'Released','An hilarious look at life and the pursuit of happiness!','Happy Times',45861,1.8873,7.1,'fbn08yxNb0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17296,_binary '\0','/y3bebCmOJ32gzLKpghjKcRoKFRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303353',7.3,8365,'en','The Kid Stays in the Picture','Documentary about legendary Paramount producer Robert Evans, based on his famous 1994 autobiography.','/wQd4tf308KGwbUZeoDLPxgYqhiv.jpg','2002-08-16',93,'Released','Success, scandal, sex, tragedy, infamy. And that\'s just the first reel...','The Kid Stays in the Picture',29047,2.7024,6.6,'uLatU-2Hu_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17297,_binary '\0','/hMCHIxRzdBwdQVf5301q3wRH0GQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303356',6.7,5150,'en','Biggie & Tupac','In 1997, rap superstars Tupac Shakur and Christopher Wallace (aka Biggie Smalls, The Notorious B.I.G.) were gunned down in separate incidents, the apparent victims of hip hop\'s infamous east-west rivalry. Nick Broomfield\'s film introduces Russell Poole, an ex-cop with damning evidence that suggests the LAPD deliberately fumbled the case to conceal connections between the police, LA gangs and Death Row Records, the label run by feared rap mogul Marion \"Suge\" Knight.','/hh64yVsYNWjPGcIEKITp0f6Uqsu.jpg','2002-01-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Biggie & Tupac',30586,2.158,6.4,'PFHXjUMwmgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17298,_binary '\0','/nWnKu94QMMozLSgkP1F69cJZvLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303361',6.6,43799,'en','May','A socially awkward veterinary assistant with a lazy eye and obsession with perfection descends into depravity after developing a crush on a boy with perfect hands.','/oFXhJYTax1cnNtgvLdKlXuYiWPV.jpg','2003-04-11',93,'Released','If you can\'t find a friend... make one.','May',10894,3.563,6.6,'YbN_uoGQysc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17299,_binary '\0','/6aANP3hW1PO7nJLMWKRt45sPs6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303408',7.1,2033,'pt','O Invasor','Two businessmen hire a hitman to kill their third partner and are then blackmailed by the hitman as he takes over their company.','/eToltyeAuwv9SMKdX9n9QQvdR1G.jpg','2002-04-05',97,'Released',NULL,'O Invasor',53960,1.8851,7,'efenlo9Zc1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17300,_binary '\0','/hlznKqjAKlbLDXUqp2lhFzRo6h3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303661',6.4,1865,'en','Anita and Me','Meena, a 12-year-old living in a mining village in the English Midlands in 1972, is the daughter of Indian parents who\'ve come to England to give her a better life. This idyllic existence is upset by the arrival in the village of Anita Rutter and her dysfunctional family.','/ih3tJ76cG207h5amSBy1aEUgNTp.jpg','2002-11-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Anita and Me',14596,1.7634,6,'F5pI2UPaT8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17301,_binary '\0','/k3g8IWufvzGV6X20dvICcZhEPDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303668',6.2,1260,'en','San Giovanni: L\'Apocalisse','The film is set in 90 AD and concerns Jesus Christ\'s last surviving disciple, John of Patmos, and his writings and visions from the Apocalypse of John. Emperor Domitian has declared himself to be God and ruler, over heaven and earth. The Christians do not recognize his divinity and face persecution, from the God Emperor. John has been imprisoned on, the island of Patmos, a Roman mining, penal colony, with many others. He writes out messages of his visions and sends the \"Revelation of God\", to the seven churches of Greek Asia Minor. The Christian church, in Ephesus, sends Irene to make sure John is alive and to confer with him in person. The movie depicts scenes from the Book of Revelation and links them to events happening to the church in Asia.','/dzwlAnjrui9tmYyw29k1qOnKEry.jpg','2004-12-03',93,'Released','The story about St. John, his visions, and the time he spent on the Island of Patmos.','The Apocalypse',58433,2.7872,5.5,'qN2D0R3VBYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17302,_binary '\0','/zsbmsV4XHyJqG5fD7Vdw4NZbT2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303714',6.4,36192,'en','Barbershop','A day in the life of a barbershop on the south side of Chicago. Calvin, who inherited the struggling business from his deceased father, views the shop as nothing but a burden and waste of his time. After selling the shop to a local loan shark, Calvin slowly begins to see his father\'s vision and legacy and struggles with the notion that he just sold it out.','/up8cEgEsl2Dq5Djb9lMZYBK0s84.jpg','2002-04-01',102,'Released','Everyone\'s gettin\' lined up.','Barbershop',10611,5.2623,6.446,'pECEp1iOh-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17303,_binary '\0','/1TNk0O3QnPZXdZQ1CtVk4Cj2Epc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303780',7,1252,'ja','BLUES HARP','Ambitious Yakuza Kenji befriends harmonica-playing bartender Chuji, who moonlights as a part-time drug-dealer for the opposing gang. Their friendship is threatened by Kenji\'s plans for advancement, as well as by his bodyguards\' growing jealousy of Chuji.','/bLu5BbocsoLysN6NNVZJor2o5jk.jpg','1998-07-15',107,'Released',NULL,'Blues Harp',36242,1.5587,6.6,'wYkpX3qs7SA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17304,_binary '\0','/ahdc4lmShSJOkIGnbUI77xeh2Ze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303785',6,2624,'en','Bollywood/Hollywood','Rahul Seth is a dashing young millionaire who believes he is \"western\" enough to rebel against his mother and grandmother. They are not too keen about his Caucasian girlfriend Kimberly who, to make matters worse, is a pop star. Before you can say \"karmic intervention,\" Kimberly dies in a freak accident and Rahul is devastated. Instead of allowing him to mourn in peace, Rahul\'s mother sees the opportunity she\'s been waiting for. She threatens to call off his sister\'s wedding unless he finds himself a \"nice Indian girl.\" Rahul enlists the services of Sue, a fiercely independent escort whom he believes to be Hispanic, and therefore not \"married\" to the conventions taught to young Indian women. With a wink in her eye, Sue accepts the deal to pose as his Indian bride-to-be. She needs the money and having never been a fan of the typical Indian male, she feels her heart is safe. The charade begins....','/pXIVHT73QG70nZZdsVMwa0OgFUK.jpg','2002-10-25',101,'Released','Nothing is what it appears to be.','Bollywood/Hollywood',333,1.8739,5.7,'js3N8e8InnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17305,_binary '\0','/kGG4eCEaWvq20r4OofW4oUskhkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303816',5.6,89676,'en','Cabin Fever','A group of five college graduates rent a cabin in the woods and begin to fall victim to a horrifying flesh-eating virus, which attracts the unwanted attention of the homicidal locals.','/vaUkSL7PbeeKfdFKOh9TYR9M1ds.jpg','2003-08-15',93,'Released','Terror… in the flesh.','Cabin Fever',11547,5.8874,5.685,'EZxwWaUF0Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17306,_binary '\0','/1MqmlqsPYmbXwufXRWmDKdPAB0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303830',6.4,2275,'en','Casa de los Babys','A group of women, including Skipper, the wealthy young Jennifer and the domineering Nan, journey from the United States to South America in hopes of easily adopting children. Unfortunately, their plans are complicated by local laws that require the women to live in the foreign nation for an extended period before they can take in orphaned kids. While stuck in another country, the women bond as they share their aspirations and anxieties.','/OLDSseQTeHSWwqyqgwMZwxfqGt.jpg','2003-09-19',96,'Released','Six Women. One Dream.','Casa de los Babys',38244,2.1814,5.6,'A_-9-UItIqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17307,_binary '\0','/46scrnII4tNzNQmeULCMCsCmgKA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303933',6,38033,'en','Drumline','A talented street drummer from Harlem enrolls in a Southern university, expecting to lead its marching band\'s drumline to victory. He initially flounders in his new world, before realizing that it takes more than talent to reach the top.','/zl7gdxYqKdFCioPT3DAkZR5DDUP.jpg','2002-12-13',118,'Released','Half time is game time.','Drumline',13497,5.2306,6.979,'PSki9bBcQh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17308,_binary '\0','/kWgfRiVqXtO847nmXD09G43ClWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0303970',4.7,1637,'cn','殭屍大時代','In 17th century China, zombies and vampires roamed the lands, feeding on the unsuspecting. A group of martial artists / vampire hunters find themselves employed by a very rich - and very insane - old man who has kept everyone of his relatives preserved in wax and not buried. Apparently it is his family\'s tradition. So, having generations of potential zombies in your cellar may not be the smartest idea ever, but it takes two to tango. In this case, a thief wants the old-man\'s treasure and hires a zombie-wrangler to re-animate the waxed up relatives in order to sneak into the mansion and steal the treasure. It\'s up to the kung-fu fighting vampire hunters to save the day (or night).','/huzITGUWuU8XVPDcPSnQcS1Gjlb.jpg','2003-05-23',108,'Released','Five heroes. A coven of vampires. A lot of bad blood.','Vampire Hunters',40226,1.9015,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17309,_binary '\0','/6g8iPZcDp7Q4aNUAiKIKLkaR5MQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304120',5.8,2138,'ko','에이치','A string of brutal murders targeting pregnant women mirrors the crimes of convicted serial killer Shin Hyun, who remains behind bars. Detectives Kim Mi Yun and Kang Tae Hyun take on the case, suspecting that Shin Hyun may be manipulating the copycat killings from prison.','/nR0rbY1OjTraZkJXm6QrkKzxAeS.jpg','2002-12-26',106,'Released','You Can\'t Spell H-ell Without It.','H',36928,1.3038,6.4,'Gm2Ow_SHaBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17310,_binary '\0','/ykyF3JodRIB32iHMufklU45lDIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304126',7.1,1765,'de','Halbe Treppe','Christian is a presenter at a small radio station. His wife Katrin directs traffic in a car park. Both are friends with Uwe, who runs a fast food kiosk, and Ellen, who works in a perfume shop. Their four lives are stuck in a rut. Until the day Chris and Ellen sleep together and upset the balance of the two couples...','/bMdeYeO8ylTqJDVnEPECdhroEg8.jpg','2002-02-12',111,'Released',NULL,'Grill Point',316,1.2802,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17311,_binary '\0','/htmYEfH7TQgzsXHCnNXxmoYKQtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304141',7.9,778771,'en','Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban','Harry Potter\'s life is in danger once more as dangerous wizard Sirius Black has escaped from Azkaban Prison and is heading to Hogwarts.','/aWxwnYoe8p2d2fcxOqtvAtJ72Rw.jpg','2004-05-31',141,'Released','Something wicked this way comes.','Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban',673,44.7341,8.012,'VwErvYgoH70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17312,_binary '\0','/7OeOWIWvWTzVtLfu2npB7zALEVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304229',6.8,7046,'en','Japanese Story','Sandy, a geologist, finds herself stuck on a field trip to the Pilbara desert with a Japanese man she finds inscrutable, annoying and decidedly arrogant. Hiromitsu\'s view of her is not much better. Things go from bad to worse when they become stranded in one of the most remote regions on Earth.','/ArghsmarxtUGW7fSrXdNXx3WwIj.jpg','2003-08-30',110,'Released','Some stories can change your life.','Japanese Story',13433,2.0308,6.3,'n1rKG6jshtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17313,_binary '\0','/8kFu3NmbwMmi8iRXWy09awhMFLC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304262',6.9,10686,'ja','カタクリ家の幸福','The Katakuri family has just opened their guest house in the mountains. Unfortunately their first guest commits suicide and in order to avoid trouble they decide to bury him in the backyard. Things get way more complicated when their second guest, a famous sumo wrestler, dies while having sex with his underage girlfriend and the grave behind the house starts to fill up more and more.','/8iIei17w5DVEz4P9OjxIM10f7Jh.jpg','2002-02-23',113,'Released','Love. Music. Horror. Volcanos. Cinema was never meant to be like this!','The Happiness of the Katakuris',16184,1.9054,6.9,'Z4Pe4aSw71I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17314,_binary '\0','/jDuUdCjZv6uCBTPZRsqmT5EzU7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304327',5.6,1493,'de','Der letzte Lude','The batty sandwich seller and wannabe pimp Andy Ommsen finally gets his chance in the red light district. A reckless underworld-boss hires him to guard the beautiful go-go-dance Anica. Unfortunately, this collides with Andy\'s second job, which is to show the c-grade actor Timo how to behave as a real pimp.','/ssiqMTIvg5ZHS3KIie4Ohg69Kqh.jpg','2003-07-10',90,'Released','Everyone can be a pimp.','Der letzte Lude',10932,1.2056,6.5,'dqYMKOV4lBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17315,_binary '\0','/CdDVgYAhRkOCDrkdXBXFMMX2kR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304328',6.3,6972,'en','Levity','Manuel Jordan is a man who is free after serving 23 years for killing a teenager during an attempted robbery. After nearly two decades of staring at his victim\'s face on a newspaper clipping in his cell, the newly paroled man seeks redemption. Instead, redemption—in the form of a mysterious minister and two needy women— finds him.','/pLmF3LChsgxkF6dCBN0aHJR91Gu.jpg','2003-03-16',100,'Released','How you gonna make it right?','Levity',21052,2.2267,6.1,'MIrsOIvAiQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17316,_binary '\0','/trfjdJI51Krnig9UmxJQkz15ICo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304415',6.6,100571,'en','Mona Lisa Smile','Katherine Watson is a recent UCLA graduate hired to teach art history at the prestigious all-female Wellesley College, in 1953. Determined to confront the outdated mores of society and the institution that embraces them, Katherine inspires her traditional students, including Betty and Joan, to challenge the lives they are expected to lead.','/bg0VKsXnLjIZ0cHmZHZLs9gzrvm.jpg','2003-12-19',117,'Released','They had everything. She showed them more.','Mona Lisa Smile',11820,8.1305,6.9,'VqexVyd_ybI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17317,_binary '\0','/sBUB4Z8zPxhSEOKbQZUKr39IWuo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304584',4.4,1675,'en','The President\'s Man: A Line in the Sand','A counterterrorism specialist is assigned by the President to track down a terrorist who is suspected of planning to set off a nuclear device in the U.S.','/2hD7YD3nA2YJTNmBjvTimS0NIMA.jpg','2002-01-20',90,'Released',NULL,'The President\'s Man: A Line in the Sand',36996,2.0781,4.8,'aaeIVWHdrw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17318,_binary '\0','/pXiqeertFeAclQau5EXyTXsVL8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304636',5.9,1635,'en','The Riverman','A series of interviews are conducted with convicted serial killer Ted Bundy in hopes of gaining insight into the Green River Killer who is terrorizing Seattle.','/kQfpeqbiwAxGn359nryCe98lQyX.jpg','2004-09-06',91,'Released','To catch a killer, you must understand evil.','The Riverman',56766,1.8915,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17319,_binary '\0','/yC9EPqmGVX9L041W3cIbJS8t6TL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304638',6,2584,'en','Rolling Kansas','A group of friends go on a journey to a secret marijuana forest in Kansas.','/tOYv1HAf0M0X1RDuLLPiaPJ4gMY.jpg','2003-01-24',89,'Released','Five friends looking for a higher purpose. What a trip!','Rolling Kansas',33639,1.2925,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17320,_binary '\0','/ycQyXPqcTOgBNVDCTBTHBqsAbOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304669',5.8,70233,'en','The Santa Clause 2','Better watch out! The big guy in red is coming to town once again. This time, Scott Calvin -- also known as Santa Claus -- finds out there\'s an obscure clause in his contract requiring him to take on a wife. He has to leave the North Pole to fulfill his obligations, or else he\'ll be forced to give up his Yuletide gig.','/2EAMkz0z1pbr9weOY1Y7buy2AxV.jpg','2002-09-29',104,'Released','What\'s Christmas Fun without some Reindeer Games?','The Santa Clause 2',9021,9.3727,6.001,'NML7Y1APyZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17321,_binary '\0','/xHBalaJTvYxbZxIdI2moPMXQ52a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304678',5.7,3293,'fr','Sex is Comedy','A director struggles with a difficult sex scene between a young actor and actress who can\'t stand one another. Aided by her loyal assistant, she is hell-bent on getting the scene right without compromise.','/twhRxBqPbbbeUNZtvpyQl2PvNPF.jpg','2002-06-05',94,'Released','Faking it has never been like this.','Sex Is Comedy',53244,1.8159,5.933,'xWSMrmZeiGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17322,_binary '\0','/7KBJf963tZBijpP6bKOJrxkowGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304711',5.1,19195,'en','The Order','For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order\'s most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.','/7kj4TffoKCt4gIrNupr2oqmir69.jpg','2003-09-05',102,'Released','Behind the disguise of good hides the soul of evil.','The Order',9616,3.4849,5.7,'_ml-EkbiYHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17323,_binary '\0','/kK7C6OpoeLwEOBh2cnls7Cf5crw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304722',4.3,2239,'en','Skinned Deep','An ordinary family goes on a trip by car, but their car breaks down. The dutiful father of the family immediately sets off to get help and seems to find it with a nice elderly lady. The woman invites the whole family to dinner, but the hospitality soon turns out to be an ambush.','/aRQcRjy4CS1bRAU7oIhZfVX0rcB.jpg','2004-02-14',97,'Released','Meet the surgeon general!','Skinned Deep',97814,1.5977,4.2,'U8hjxBKacDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17324,_binary '\0','/3lvQSIawim7dc2FrzrIf72Uxw6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304808',7.1,3788,'en','Ten Minutes Older: The Trumpet','Ten Minutes Older is a 2002 film project consisting of two compilation feature films entitled The Trumpet and The Cello. The project was conceived by the producer Nicolas McClintock as a reflection on the theme of time at the turn of the Millennium. Fifteen celebrated film-makers were invited to create their own vision of what time means in ten minutes of film.','/yxIKQ2MeZAYiZ5lbJyYrNmXf7Dy.jpg','2002-05-18',92,'Released',NULL,'Ten Minutes Older: The Trumpet',23676,2.069,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17325,_binary '\0','/w1bljLz20AYhLYP0vEqBI5XkyAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0304931',5.7,2540,'de','Werner - Gekotzt wird später!','Werner, Andi and Eckat play dice to determine the next king of the trio. When Werner is crowned king, he decides for all of them to skip work and start for Korsika.','/qBv3CtwUaERWjZSokGmhP2Gks2.jpg','2003-07-17',80,'Released',NULL,'Werner - Gekotzt wird später!',10470,1.7371,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17326,_binary '\0','/hY1qFGWted4GHXStctsJu92SEnX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305173',5,2114,'hi','Aamdani Atthanni Kharcha Rupaiya','Jhoomri and her husband, Bhimsha, move into a new neighbourhood. Their immediate neighbours are three squabbling couples, namely Vijay and Anjali who are newly married; Appu Khote and Vimla, who are married and have 4 children; and Ravi and Meena, who are also married and have one child. With their wages unable to keep up with inflation and high cost of living, unable to pay even rent to the landlord, B.K. Kakkad, the wives decide to seek employment to augment their income, with hilarious results from their spouses, who will go to any extent to keep their wives at home, even if means to bring a dancing girl home to cook and look after the children!!','/9xl6TNdI2QM1kKBrsuNKJkWadu4.jpg','2001-12-21',161,'Released',NULL,'Aamdani Atthanni Kharcha Rupaiya',25801,1.3409,4.879,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17327,_binary '\0','/51Q6Wyadho2zmOe8yCOdAWDpdGm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305206',7.4,55083,'en','American Splendor','An original mix of fiction and reality illuminates the life of comic book hero everyman Harvey Pekar.','/rPLMxuk82AiqDiwEUVJ6E7WpjYs.jpg','2003-08-15',101,'Released','Ordinary life is pretty complex stuff','American Splendor',2771,3.6544,7.147,'Vo8nb45auc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17328,_binary '\0','/jDQcNjo5SM8YxlcSn06cFzlLH6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305224',6.3,244183,'en','Anger Management','After a small misunderstanding aboard an airplane escalates out of control, timid businessman Dave Buznik is ordered by the court to undergo anger management therapy at the hands of specialist Dr. Buddy Rydell. But when Buddy steps up his aggressive treatment by moving in, Dave goes from mild to wild as the unorthodox treatment wreaks havoc with his life.','/8wX3S5HjL3bgb2yi4CfR2qIqbdH.jpg','2003-04-11',106,'Released','Feel the love.','Anger Management',9506,10.5238,6.162,'1Gl2kVUsy2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17329,_binary '\0','/8l90i4hdsNOOnbWZZNSj3o1r4Lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305240',6.8,1340,'ja','荒ぶる魂たち','When a young yakuza torments the customers in a rival crime family\'s nightclub, it is not long before his dead body is found. Soon, inter-family retaliation follows, resulting in the death for a prominent crime boss. Devastated by this turn of events, the temperamental Kenzaki vows to avenge his boss\'s death and, as bloody violence ensues, the body count reaches excessive proportions.','/kebGMY4ORYs4RGmW4vwa1pXMrbd.jpg','2001-10-28',150,'Released','Thank you and fuck you brother','Agitator',2896,1.5581,6.426,'E0RSkHV7V1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17330,_binary '\0','/rS3QJdsCPyhhQ0mJEr8VirNmOMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305357',5,138724,'en','Charlie\'s Angels: Full Throttle','The Angels are charged with finding a pair of missing rings that are encoded with the personal information of members of the Witness Protection Program. As informants are killed, the ladies target a rogue agent who might be responsible.','/n4cdJ0Wqxb7C0HmZbcaC4eYnkIf.jpg','2003-06-25',106,'Released','This summer the Angels are back.','Charlie\'s Angels: Full Throttle',9471,11.305,5.5,'oftSBgP7Hhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17331,_binary '\0','/eb0NYoP6H8qxj1GDh9LXazJktmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305392',6.6,1288,'de','Poppitz','Car salesman Gerry Schartl is on his way to dream holidays in an all-inclusive club at Cosamera. He´s a smart guy, great in his job, and his life is perfect - well, nearly perfect...','/ssLTXNfqOQKMmJCFsFuCd7PsydA.jpg','2002-08-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Poppitz',56398,0.8222,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17332,_binary '\0','/aA2vwXBjONLtInbR7i6OI4SuWOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305396',5.4,7276,'en','The Crocodile Hunter: Collision Course','Steve Irwin, AKA The Crocodile Hunter, has avoided the death-roll and saved a croc from poachers. But what he doesn\'t know is that the crocodile has swallowed a top secret U.S. satellite beacon, and the poachers are actually American special agents sent to retrieve it.','/8JyI97jCN1BIzdTjWfIxV4GKlyw.jpg','2002-07-26',90,'Released','His First Big-Screen Adventure!','The Crocodile Hunter: Collision Course',17043,2.8215,5.4,'GxNfZO--bko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17333,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305502',8.4,1630,'sr','Два сата квалитетног ТВ програма','Made for New Year\'s Eve program, \"Two Hours of Quality Program\" exceeded all expectations becoming more than just a small TV movie. Using black humor as its sharp weapon, it dealt with ongoing chaos in the country and the introduction of new values to the urban culture.','/jHsVhg5okPnqn9EJ9dYhO9BS5Sf.jpg','1995-01-01',67,'Released',NULL,'Two Hours of Quality TV Program',268352,0.9612,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17334,_binary '\0','/fvHx1Cwns9xMyOplKPCCrq5bM0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305568',5.7,5863,'fr','Fanfan la Tulipe','In this 2003 remake of the classic 1952 French film, Fanfan la Tulipe is a swashbuckling lover who is tricked into joining the army of King Louis XV by Adeline La Franchise, who tells Fanfan that by doing so, he will eventually marry one of the king\'s daughters','/ykQjvmeJf4QbRSnVpUS2W6jAgFw.jpg','2003-06-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Fan-Fan the Tulip',37559,4.0277,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17335,_binary '\0','/2jwJtiw4lZ55iPftK6Opy1kUNoK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305632',3.9,1678,'en','Fascination','Young Scott Doherty (Adam Garcia) gets suspicious when his mother (Jacqueline Bisset) plans to wed Oliver Vance (Stuart Wilson) soon after her husband\'s untimely death. Scott investigates with Oliver\'s pretty daughter, Kelly (Alice Evans), who shared Scott\'s doubts about the upcoming nuptials. Along the way, he falls in love with Kelly, but a fatal explosion turns Scott\'s life upside down - and the evidence points to him as the murderer. Has he been framed?','/h9IsB1pv6U7H4bEUiKG92VXlNrn.jpg','2004-10-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Fascination',71547,1.3029,4.1,'Co6CZcFSHhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17336,_binary '\0','/mRaNy8rNfxOpT0LrD3FIQztmpYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305669',5.7,41530,'en','Bringing Down the House','Uptight lawyer Peter Sanderson wants to dive back into dating after his divorce and has a hard time meeting the right women. He tries online dating and lucks out when he starts chatting with a fellow lawyer. The two agree to meet in the flesh, but the woman he meets — an escaped African-American convict named Charlene — is not what he expected. Peter is freaked out, but Charlene tries to convince him to take her case and prove her innocence. Along the way, she wreaks havoc on his middle-class life as he gets a lesson in learning to lighten up.','/jic0ULHTcqQQaCSIEw6SAhHhIPA.jpg','2003-03-07',105,'Released','Everything he needed to know about life, she learned in prison.','Bringing Down the House',10678,5.3186,5.96,'5YN1HoijXbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17337,_binary '\0','/e80O23jzx3T7qgWrIoFz7hMgsjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305711',5.5,78274,'en','Just Married','Although Tom Leezak and Sarah McNerney come from different worlds, they are both unexpectedly swept off their feet after their first meeting. They quickly fall in love and plan to get married, despite opposition from Sarah\'s uptight, rich family. After their wedding, the happy couple sets off - with the highest of hopes and ideals about love and marriage - on what they expect will be the perfect honeymoon in Italy. Thanks to a relentless string of bad luck with one disaster after another, and an impromptu visit from Sarah\'s wealthy one-time ex-lover Peter Prentiss, the newlyweds experience the honeymoon from hell that tests the limits of their young love. Is it worth throwing away their love and marriage?','/FRqnYDjbstsCgLSJJ3SifOh2ca.jpg','2003-01-08',95,'Released','It was the perfect honeymoon...until it began.','Just Married',12090,7.3775,5.8,'UhzaFn02IA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17338,_binary '\0','/eIZuh3Bx5e0fPL25X38A4kpzQj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305973',5.6,4834,'en','Sonny','New Orleans, 1981. Sonny Phillips, just discharged from the Army, returns home. The only life he\'s known is as a gigolo, working for his mother, but he wants to leave that behind. However, the job his Army buddy promised doesn\'t materialize, and he can\'t escape his past.','/9Btip4jrDAxbAuDkEyPq8OkLbZw.jpg','2002-10-26',110,'Released','His life was the morning after, until he decided to change the night before.','Sonny',28028,2.126,5.2,'gr2yb3Vzc1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17339,_binary '\0','/rLalIAY8JI9V9JbtGfbUgK6n7jk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0305999',6.8,2999,'en','The Rage in Placid Lake','Placid Lake has always been different. As an odd fish in a sea of mediocrity, his brilliant ideas are bound to get him into more trouble than success. So when he finds himself flying off the school roof and breaking every bone in his body on graduation night, Placid decides to make a bid for the elusive normal life. To his parents\' horror, he gets a normal job.','/bwJCynrOg4Xr4k8Fi0TBAWZjPru.jpg','2003-05-17',89,'Released','For anyone who ever felt different... your hero has arrived.','The Rage in Placid Lake',14868,1.7057,6.5,'emcWJj_nofE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17340,_binary '\0','/nF74HKjNe7X54XMcIc7ulK5InxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306047',5.6,177419,'en','Scary Movie 3','News anchorwoman Cindy Campbell has to investigate mysterious crop circles and killing video tapes, and help the President stop an alien invasion in the process.','/8dLsax5KSwlCY5uWXETKjud5k6U.jpg','2003-10-24',84,'Released','Great trilogies come in threes.','Scary Movie 3',4256,17.3099,6,'O21wD8Tzr2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17341,_binary '\0','/8lko69TNjjEa5KRANIcgM4sE2o6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306069',6.2,1607,'en','The Singles Ward','When Jonathan Jordan gets divorced he\'s thrust back into the world of being a single Mormon - a world who\'s ultimate goal is eternal marriage. Struggling to fit in, Jonathan decides to stop going to church only to be pursued by the members of the local singles ward who want to reactivate him. Nothing works until Jonathan falls for Cammie Giles, the ward activities director. Suddenly, going to church becomes much more appealing, But is he going for the right reasons?','/A1l7mSbptwFdutUbOq4zzhH4goa.jpg','2002-01-30',102,'Released','The Road to Eternal Marriage Has Never Been Longer','The Singles Ward',16653,2.0896,6.2,'8VmwHaWnNUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17342,_binary '\0','/wHgsk3A7bgoHyIBwcI3aA75PYhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306097',6.3,1451,'ko','Stratosphere Girl','Angela is a French art student living in Germany who loves to draw comics and creates elaborate tales drawn in a soft and romantic style. One night, Angela meets Yamamoto, a club DJ from Japan, who invites her to come to Tokyo with him. Infatuated with Yamamoto, Angela impulsively agrees, and is soon sharing an apartment with a handful of Western expatriates who work at a nightclub where Japanese businessmen drink, sing karaoke, and date the \"hostesses\" for a fee.','/4qbhiIPBviYUCfugTv1ysSOBZtY.jpg','2004-09-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Stratosphere Girl',36353,1.7657,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17343,_binary '\0','/8wTHOFb5KEuL60pPtUxAmgPphJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306355',8.3,1258,'en','Mark Twain','Largely considered to be the greatest American author, Mark Twain is celebrated in this exhaustive documentary by filmmaker Ken Burns.','/lKV31pCaSp9ACZq8HMVICb1kRak.jpg','2002-01-14',212,'Released',NULL,'Mark Twain',130002,2.0441,7.1,'dB52dA14tQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17344,_binary '\0','/gzIXTXh0V1yMOCFuW6Iu5nYOPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306432',6.2,1724,'es','A mi madre le gustan las mujeres','Sofia introduces her three adult daughters to her new lover who is their age and happens to be a woman. The women, in particular Elvira find it extremely difficult to accept their mothers sudden apparent sexual reversal. The news pushes the neurotic Elvira to the point of nervous breakdown. Sol, the youngest daughter, writes a lude rock song about it and performs in front of them at a concert. The daughters plot together on how to get their mothers new girlfriend, a native Czech, and brilliant pianist, out of her life. Their plot goes terribly wrong and turns the film from a light-hearted comedy, into mildly amusing drama.','/afSbeXchTDtZ1TapTNLGcxT4lkm.jpg','2002-01-11',93,'Released','Family just isn\'t what is used to be!','My Mother Likes Women',97754,1.7766,5.9,'xrUuGkg5cfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17345,_binary '\0','/8AX1EvfBxoJ16vzgpKspEAZ9Myf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306434',7.4,14948,'hi','आँखें','After his hatred of dishonesty costs him his job, an embittered man goes over to the dark side and plots to rob the bank he once managed.','/sv9tCwXzvTFSbA2OmH9nqQZCNQ7.jpg','2002-03-27',165,'Released','A dangerous game is about to begin','Aankhen',21982,1.4884,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17346,_binary '\0','/3fGQpJKtD4b7wRmlVGmkY7imI7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306519',1.6,1364,'de','Barschel - Mord in Genf?','A conspiracy-theorizing filmmaker meets with a prospective producer in order to pitch a movie about the death of real-life German politician Uwe Barschel, in which the official ruling of suicide raised more questions than answers.','/a7BpnrCwtCUu9138wR5RoVD9tkO.jpg','1993-03-04',74,'Released',NULL,'Barschel: Murder in Geneva',31285,1.1241,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17347,_binary '\0','/7EoVLqy8CdP22sXyHtFUsO9SM7C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306597',7.1,1332,'en','Brother to Brother','A drama that looks back on the Harlem Renaissance from the perspective of an elderly, black writer who meets a gay teenager in a New York homeless shelter.','/oWlLj4JZM9qIoH6Cb3Y4943jpEZ.jpg','2004-01-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Brother to Brother',47272,1.7379,5.652,'poD6D4o2GhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17348,_binary '\0','/eNZB5QdcOsU5GOoK2WzqiaObnX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306646',7.2,1277,'ja','チリンの鈴','Chirin is an innocent though adventurous young lamb whose carefree life on the farm comes to an abrupt end when a wolf murders his mother. Confused and angry, Chirin pursues the wolf into the mountains, seeking revenge. The laws of nature are brutal, however, and hatred alone won\'t be enough to avenge the loss of his mother. Only the strong survive in the wild, and obtaining that strength may change Chirin forever.','/28gMUOzWtWSR4N9nE4AMTO9OzUt.jpg','1978-03-11',46,'Released',NULL,'Ringing Bell',77859,1.5472,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17349,_binary '\0','/qG0sMpn3Rzx0d3LkFSPQdt9tXOb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306685',5.8,48147,'en','Cradle 2 the Grave','Gang leader Tony pulls off a major diamond heist with his crew, but cop-turned-criminal Ling knows who has the loot and responds by kidnapping Tony\'s daughter and holding her for ransom. Unfortunately, Tony\'s lost the diamonds as well. As he frantically searches for his daughter and the jewels, Tony pairs with a high-kicking government agent who once worked with Ling and seeks revenge on him.','/8iXpVITXenqPG8gQ0lCFpUMtZIx.jpg','2003-02-28',101,'Released','Born 2 the life. True 2 the code. Bad 2 the bone.','Cradle 2 the Grave',10623,10.3894,6.133,'bzV6WtYbffs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17350,_binary '\0','/w2UHBWTJux7bWSi44mMS21tPhGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306734',4.9,12651,'en','Le Divorce','While visiting her sister in Paris, a young woman finds romance and learns her brother-in-law is a philanderer.','/ucBJrWKCJ1naTylSFN8jpaEqwwe.jpg','2003-08-08',117,'Released','Everything sounds sexier in French.','Le Divorce',9499,3.7517,4.945,'N_s6lS1azJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17351,_binary '\0','/hgzX6YBJXI4fvosxvjnPrAmWPNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306841',5.6,43975,'en','The Lizzie McGuire Movie','Lizzie McGuire has graduated from middle school and takes a trip to Rome, Italy with her class. And what was supposed to be only a normal trip, becomes a teenager\'s dream come true.','/pLi6nOT95LHgCBicakNagC41uFM.jpg','2003-05-02',94,'Released','The only risk in taking an adventure is not taking it at all.','The Lizzie McGuire Movie',18736,6.396,6.339,'D9iltFxTRPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17352,_binary '\0','/ucepGxbgyxMvByTrDHpYvCBVa39.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306846',4.5,4248,'en','No Pain, No Gain','The story of a bodybuilder who longs to be respected for his mind. Mike Zorillo, a small town Ohio champion bodybuilder with a genius IQ, journeys to the Mecca of bodybuilding, Los Angeles, determined to beat his nemesis, Jake Steel, with natural science instead of steroids. Far from home, he\'s confronted by a gym culture of freaks, juicers and Hollywood wannabes. As he pursues his dream, he\'s also persecuted by the world\'s largest sports nutrition company, an entity that\'s hell-bent on destroying him. Against all odds, the honest and driven bodybuilder resolves to win the prestigious \"Mr. West Coast\" competition as a way to prove himself and his ideas to the world.','/wTiEG5PtLr0VDnQxADXjpwaJe65.jpg','2005-12-03',94,'Released','Nothing Is Stronger Than The Mind','No Pain, No Gain',354882,0.8018,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17353,_binary '\0','/tKyX1zOGKOdqzWBcXMPtPAB5ylD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306855',6.7,2415,'hi','Style','Chantu and Bantu are a couple of scam-artists trying to woo rich girls for easy money. In the process, they get embroiled in a murder case and become the prime suspects.','/37jAJgh9ANO76orj9EsvXlu1Wgt.jpg','2001-12-28',159,'Released',NULL,'Style',20916,1.6392,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17354,_binary '\0','/lGkxrGlxnUELoZHaRYlXH7eygM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306892',5.6,4770,'en','George and the Dragon','In 12th century England, the handsome and noble knight, George, has left the Crusades behind to follow his dream of a peaceful life on his own piece of land. However, in order to obtain his land from the ruling King Edgaar, he must help find the King\'s missing daughter, Princess Lunna, a quest which sees George drawn into an unexpected battle with the kingdom\'s last surviving dragon.','/50NxkQexHBoQypzfADEdlxxOlWA.jpg','2004-03-28',93,'Released',NULL,'George and the Dragon',5494,3.0469,5.5,'GM7e5nEcNHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17355,_binary '\0','/hwGA0G51VXwEtlqqaUERXtQxHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0306909',7.1,2480,'ko','공공의 적','A notorious dirty cop makes an honest attempt to catch a serial killer who even murdered his own parents.','/7xNVM4UmFm27UUr52q7cxwYrrrW.jpg','2002-01-25',138,'Released','Lawless cops and a savage killer battle to the bitter end!','Public Enemy',33171,1.4539,7.1,'KEgnTdSGMhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17356,_binary '\0','/reZZ1YiOHXI4P2HXHUcRu6WTWj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307034',6.7,1457,'cn','嚦咕嚦咕新年財','Follows the adventures of a compulsive Mahjong player named Andy and his aging mother, estranged brother, loyal ex-girlfriend, and a local gang.','/8ohzkBUG45YvMWJrRZUSgKoTeEV.jpg','2002-02-08',96,'Released','Good character makes good player','Fat Choi Spirit',60282,1.8062,6.4,'zjFvlBjYQjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17357,_binary '\0','/rQLqQhmX1YxKeaLlon7ts9H9kQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307076',5.6,1902,'fi','Kuutamolla','This movie is about Iiris Vaara. She turns 30 and meets young director Marko. All dreams come true but does Marko share her dreams?','/xvJ7HZXyN9nXP8Yizs7a3th6hdV.jpg','2002-02-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Lovers & Leavers',21245,0.9286,4.8,'DeFPWDgDzBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17358,_binary '\0','/3oS3h14rd7NjjkNcBydVIzrQuYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307109',6.8,5343,'en','The Lost Skeleton of Cadavra','A dedicated scientist, aided by his clueless wife, rolls up his shirt sleeves and tries to save the world from a radioactive monster, curious space aliens, an evil scientist and a crabby skeleton.','/nGUjqu7DotLx6yfakAeqaj8D1FO.jpg','2001-09-12',90,'Released','No One Can Stand Its Mental Power!','The Lost Skeleton of Cadavra',18841,1.6439,6.3,'j8D0PQQDptM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17359,_binary '\0','/K7hyQLsgIl96F7G5srTBp1ZbfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307116',3.8,1485,'hi','Maa Tujhhe Salaam','Bollywood superstar Sunny Deol plays Maj. Pratap Singh, who\'s in command of an Indian battalion guarding his country\'s border with Pakistan in this action-packed thriller from director Tinnu Verma. When Singh\'s girlfriend -- intelligence agent Sonia Khanna (Tabu) -- informs him that self-styled Pakistani leader Lala aims to rule Kashmir as a sovereign state, Singh finds an unexpected ally in a mercenary (Arbaaz Khan) once loyal to Lala.','/cmNtGP3BxQM74NXJfg0Ge8ja7id.jpg','2002-01-25',160,'Released',NULL,'Maa Tujhhe Salaam',321335,0.8688,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17360,_binary '\0','/gjeCuv8B7i0saVy1Ftrjgc9Np0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307156',5.4,4704,'fr','Michel Vaillant','Michel Vaillant is # 1 of pilots, undisputed champion in rallying in all circuits in the world. His success arouses admiration and envy. Ruth Wong, director of Team Leader, is determined to break his streak and avenge the memory of his father, founder of Leader. She is capable of anything to achieve her goal.','/6jBneaCmyN8gvgtUUUMkoTmmzqa.jpg','2003-11-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Michel Vaillant',10572,3.8541,5.4,'Eajgd1BuZGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17361,_binary '\0','/aVXKAhq2UYSuljNC6XAFS0LAwBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307197',7.9,4790,'fr','Un coupable idéal','2001 French documentary about the murder trial of a 15 year old black teen accused of murder in Jacksonville, Florida. Winner of 2002 Academy Award for Best Documentary.','/vFl8G6VSVcStLLKbH0KzipYjISe.jpg','2001-09-14',111,'Released',NULL,'Murder on a Sunday Morning',51391,1.2016,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17362,_binary '\0','/AlLN0T6Tz2ruQJMiGhNhLX0ShSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307213',6.6,11280,'ko','나쁜 남자','A pimp enforcer takes revenge on a woman who rejected his advances by tricking her into prostitution, but complications arise.','/2gI1b0kHperlUjC4EE34mKJBGI6.jpg','2002-01-11',102,'Released','Trapped in a world of pleasure and pain...','Bad Guy',25649,2.8488,6.521,'4nE4yBBrpm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17363,_binary '\0','/26gr06Z8mgyGFGtFwBOWU87FQbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307351',6.1,2135,'en','Prey for Rock & Roll','In late 1980s Los Angeles, Jacki and her all-girl punk rock band, Clam Dandy, are trying to make it big. On the verge of turning 40, Jacki decides that if the band\'s one last shot at the big time is unsuccessful, she will give up her dreams of stardom.','/qXXAJjWHcXbfwdlq96nHSTxCVHv.jpg','2003-09-26',104,'Released','For these girls... it\'s all about survival.','Prey for Rock & Roll',28026,2.1228,4.9,'GXyV6srCbrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17364,_binary '\0','/xX7Rjut5ox4CAO93qIBuumv8JeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307385',7.9,2577,'en','Rivers and Tides','Portrait of Andy Goldsworthy, an artist whose specialty is ephemeral sculptures made from elements of nature.','/6KmRx9auUqQ2bHCPGi32TS5VSYh.jpg','2001-02-13',90,'Released','Working with Time','Rivers and Tides',30140,1.559,7.3,'AT3lveJmjY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17365,_binary '\0','/7ZmZxar3bYORcl0TPA4oceyxcaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307453',6,216223,'en','Shark Tale','Oscar is a small fish whose big aspirations often get him into trouble. Meanwhile, Lenny is a great white shark with a surprising secret that no sea creature would guess: He\'s a vegetarian. When a lie turns Oscar into an improbable hero and Lenny becomes an outcast, the two form an unlikely friendship.','/r08DpyPyhXcJTfNZAICNGMzcQ8l.jpg','2004-09-20',90,'Released','Behind every little fish is a great white lie.','Shark Tale',10555,18.1963,6.047,'mp2SbaK8dDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17366,_binary '\0','/qf55kqMNxU4RbUcLqk5xZIZrIVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307466',4.5,2060,'en','Sin','Retired cop Eddie Burns gave 15 years and the use of his left arm to the Reno homicide squad. When his wayward sister, Kassie, goes missing Eddie Burns finds himself subjected to a fiendish and ingenious campaign of revenge by the mysterious Charlie Strom. In order to protect his sister, Eddie - disabled, betrayed and alone - journeys into the heart of his own darkness: where he discovers that the reason for his ordeal lies in his own past sins and those of his adversary Charlie Strom.','/juNwK0xRUZlQxCU9f5KDgBfFclF.jpg','2003-01-01',107,'Released','Never forgive. Never forget.','Sin',37946,2.4306,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17367,_binary '\0','/avjG5EPgWXyLvsUId6hEn0iqT4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307479',6.2,89637,'en','Solaris','A troubled psychologist is sent to investigate the crew of an isolated research station orbiting a bizarre planet.','/drdrB1hEZmzFlK1xtW5HMxK3LUJ.jpg','2002-11-27',99,'Released','How far will you go for a second chance?','Solaris',2103,5.5103,6,'fl_vGUJWYp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17368,_binary '\0','/s0snY93Lppdv6rNoxGUuMBlxj8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307541',6.6,1828,'te','టక్కరి దొంగ','A fearless outlaw offers to safeguard the daughter of his accomplice in return for a map to a secret diamond mine. However, his quest is compromised after a bandit gets wind of the secret map.','/sCSOX0C9dhsI2Ci286JMu2IqAuG.jpg','2002-01-12',164,'Released',NULL,'Takkari Donga',82727,1.1505,6.575,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17369,_binary '\0','/evkP5UCA4mLCEvaZgmCXhkYeBUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307596',6.7,1302,'en','The Tulse Luper Suitcases, Part 1: The Moab Story','A comic study of 20th-century history, reconstructing the life of writer, creator and professional prisoner Tulse Luper. Born in 1911 Newport and last heard of in 1989, Luper’s life is pieced together from the evidence found in 92 suitcases scattered across the globe. In the first of three parts, we follow Luper through three distinct episodes: as a child during the First World War; as an explorer in Mormon Utah; and as a writer in Belgium during the rise of fascism.','/roUKvEKMSxxjo3Du0MIrwUHzjdN.jpg','2003-07-18',127,'Released',NULL,'The Tulse Luper Suitcases, Part 1: The Moab Story',3097,1.9971,5.2,'HlNdJG3itrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17370,_binary '\0','/vtinvOlQRzT3DCH8eIcL5ffU7m8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307681',7.2,1323,'zh','小孩不笨','Kok Pin, Boon Hock and Terry are classmates in \"EM3\" stream. In Singapore, that means that at the age of 12, the government has decided that they are not as academically inclined as their peers. Kok Pin is creative and a born artist but his parents would rather he focus on his Maths and Sciences. Boon Hock comes from a low-income family and needs to balance school and helping out at the food stall. Terry, a spoilt brat is just too lazy a student. While the three children suffer from the pressure of school, their parents have another set of problems - their jobs and careers.','/bXQ9kHkb5SXPrDM3qvMXWoDGTDi.jpg','2002-02-09',105,'Released',NULL,'I Not Stupid',56836,0.9591,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17371,_binary '\0','/nRTmi69sicoBzypGAZUzaFUoAvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307873',6.6,5334,'hi','राज़','A couple goes for a vacation to the scenic mountains of Ooty to save their crumbling marriage, but the bungalow they are staying at is haunted by a vengeful spirit that holds a secret.','/oc7d4jzqZ2Zat831pVSkvEIVMYa.jpg','2002-02-01',152,'Released','Do You Want To Know The Secret...?','Raaz',20731,1.6415,5.813,'O6GUoVApVkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17372,_binary '\0','/mpfRchw4jh2cEBajB9EJltTnDH2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307901',7.6,191614,'en','25th Hour','On the eve of a seven-year prison sentence, a New York drug dealer spends his final day of freedom confronting his past, his relationships, and the choices that led to his downfall in a city still reeling from 9/11.','/uW7tTRElr2tRhmAVESzvHy4ByXg.jpg','2002-12-19',135,'Released','Can you change your whole life in one day?','25th Hour',1429,6.8789,7.31,'5TBu6e1IC_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17373,_binary '\0','/y4m8QLMn98N8BMpHxFVEaLmGkZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307919',5.8,2069,'en','The Actors','During the run of a particularly awful interpretation of Richard III, the star, Anthony O\'Malley, begins to frequent a rough pub to develop his character. He meets Barreller who he discovers owes someone he\'s never met a considerable sum of money. Seeing an opportunity to make some fast money, O\'Malley convinces hapless extra, Tom, to meet Barreller as the debt collector.','/4ZzM7JyLLGWMW8z66L7F1K0Ug1c.jpg','2003-03-16',91,'Released',NULL,'The Actors',33175,1.4969,5.6,'JwgyjWNDyOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17374,_binary '\0','/xqFm4FCok2mvesJwKH3Hj1TeC3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307920',7.7,3678,'id','Ada Apa dengan Cinta?','A popular high school girl strains her relationship with her close-knit clique when she begins falling for a reclusive, lower-class schoolmate.','/gOiBEEK6C0ZB5r7SXt1zD1YV7rg.jpg','2002-02-08',112,'Released','A single poem changed everything','What\'s Up with Cinta?',39060,1.7849,7.5,'PPvYf0K6M8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17375,_binary '\0','/tbmNzJIc7R1MuEweCOThpTzglyx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0307987',7,168635,'en','Bad Santa','You\'d better watch out - Willie T. Soke is coming to town, and he doesn\'t care if you\'ve been naughty or nice. Willie\'s favorite holiday tradition is to fill his sacks with loot lifted from shopping malls across the country. But this year his plot gets derailed by a wisecracking store detective, a sexy bartender, and a kid who\'s convinced Willie is the real Santa Claus.','/rfClLIyeHqpMofmrPY8DaLe4z9x.jpg','2003-11-26',92,'Released','He doesn\'t care if you\'re naughty or nice.','Bad Santa',10147,8.0086,6.568,'cvXyEiIoH2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17376,_binary '\0','/3ivhTBoGtSRcxqsTdXHHkYFLxO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308055',6.9,44045,'en','Bobby','In 1968 the lives of a retired doorman, hotel manager, lounge singer, busboy, beautician and others intersect in the wake of Robert F. Kennedy\'s assassination at the Ambassador Hotel in Los Angeles.','/ea6aSTUFQopOW7kWFZB9AvMYnbs.jpg','2006-09-05',120,'Released','He saw wrong and tried to right it. He saw suffering and tried to heal it. He saw war and tried to stop it.','Bobby',10741,3.1949,6.4,'dakDA3bY_6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17377,_binary '\0','/3eceYFkNcpvpGPIRN6S43JUeET5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308152',6.4,36147,'en','Dead End','On Christmas Eve, while driving to see his in-laws with his family, Frank Harrington decides to try a shortcut for the first time in 20 years. It turns out to be the biggest mistake of his life.','/7zEQIztSdusobBMM2TNHcffaldp.jpg','2003-12-12',83,'Released','Read the signs.','Dead End',11427,3.7359,6.39,'j_ihzCUh_k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17378,_binary '\0','/k7CLxxoZXmVf1iKAY9xn5DpsNMQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308208',3.7,21857,'en','Ballistic: Ecks vs. Sever','Jeremiah Ecks, an FBI agent, realizes that he must join with his lifelong enemy, Agent Sever, a rogue DIA agent with whom he is in mortal combat, in order to defeat a common enemy. That enemy has developed a \"micro-device\" that can be injected into victims in order to kill them at will.','/7Jcb486hN7hQRZTsb0RybFGeDOQ.jpg','2002-09-20',91,'Released','Your most dangerous enemies are the friends you\'ve double-crossed.','Ballistic: Ecks vs. Sever',10550,5.1035,4.4,'Tme_SdRv2gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17379,_binary '\0','/7xZQczaWW9b7xEAYiSMwXOVFEC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308252',5.3,3263,'en','Fear of the Dark','Twelve year old Ryan Billings has been diagnosed with an acute fear of the dark. He spends each night lying awake in torment, waiting and watching as the evil in the darkness grows stronger, feeding off his fear. His older brother Dale, suspects that there is nothing wrong with Ryan and that this is just a ploy for more attention. Regardless, he promises to watch over his little brother as their parents head off to a party for the night. Outside a storm rages and when the power goes out, darkness envelops the house. Ryan knows that tonight the evil has finally come to claim him. Dale desperately tries everything to try and calm him down, until the horrors in the dark make him realize Ryan had good reason to be so afraid!','/vPaqnJwsyGmljco3EOVq119Bg7n.jpg','2003-09-28',86,'Released','Whatever Happens, Don\'t Close Your Eyes','Fear of the Dark',44195,1.8734,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17380,_binary '\0','/jT7GMt5DH4A3Bbq55mwgEjq6n8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308280',7.9,6175,'ta','Friends','A man values his best friend more than anything else in the world. One day he confesses a dark secret from their childhood to his wife, which is overheard by another. Once the secret gets out, the friendship is destroyed.','/iOCOY9SAD8u9N5JWCaLILrlgpzP.jpg','2001-01-14',167,'Released',NULL,'Friends',108248,1.3732,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17381,_binary '\0','/xK1aaKscu3OwYQW8fFTdQS9dk7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308347',3.7,1644,'hi','Haan Maine Bhi Pyaar Kiya','Shiv (Abhishek Bachchan) and Pooja (Karisma Kapoor) are happily married to each other but sometimes can get into the most petty arguments coming from the way they approach life. Shiv takes each day as it comes whilst Pooja\'s imagination sometimes gets the best of her. Pooja falls in love with Shiv so much that she gives up her high rising career for him and settles as a housewife. Their in-difference gets worse and Pooja is soon convinced that Shiv has been unfaithful. Pooja asks for a divorce and leaves him. She carries on with life and meets Raj (Akshay Kumar). Raj has everything anyone could ask for: money, fame but not love something he has craved for some time. He falls for Pooja and she also begins to like him. They get engaged and as the wedding approaches, Shiv re-enters Pooja\'s life. Old feelings and emotions come rushing back and she finds herself torn between two men. Who does she choose...?','/8ZieFqNsFeN4A1CcffNMXFCxDEB.jpg','2002-02-15',174,'Released',NULL,'Haan Maine Bhi Pyaar Kiya',165979,1.3948,4.382,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17382,_binary '\0','/zBW4LZyYi0Moqz82BTkEQzR7h0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308353',4.5,11673,'en','Happily N\'Ever After','An alliance of evil-doers, led by Frieda, looks to take over Fairy Tale Land. But when Ella realizes her stepmother is out to ruin her storybook existence, she takes a dramatic turn and blossoms into the leader of the resistance effort.','/geXsapJfihg78gVDvEVPoK5c07y.jpg','2007-01-05',87,'Released','Fairy Tale Endings Aren\'t What They Used To Be.','Happily N\'Ever After',5393,5.8756,5.1,'Qk2KQGjmB-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17383,_binary '\0','/gSpBjqqxCuyQKVClvWvuFpjf3lj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308379',6.7,37867,'ja','仄暗い水の底から','A woman in the midst of an unpleasant divorce moves to an eerie apartment building with her young daughter. The ceiling of their apartment has a dark and active leak.','/iSq6J55RFLfwcceDKxYtMjOr1sz.jpg','2002-01-19',101,'Released','Don\'t let the water reach you.','Dark Water',12205,5.0097,6.8,'25170QMcYGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17384,_binary '\0','/dCX2wx2z7KmizfQpJZRUrprW9j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308383',6.2,33979,'en','The Human Stain','Coleman Silk is a worldly and admired professor who loses his job after unwittingly making a racial slur. To clear his name, Silk writes a book about the events with his friend and colleague Nathan Zuckerman, who in the process discovers a dark secret Silk has hidden his whole life. All the while, Silk engages in an affair with Faunia Farley, a younger woman whose tormented past threatens to unravel the layers of deception Silk has constructed.','/zRgYzYpcXyXznlSc4swqNpXcnVs.jpg','2003-10-29',106,'Released','How far would you go to escape the past?','The Human Stain',10922,5.5229,5.991,'5yHcniemxQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17385,_binary '\0','/4OI84heveHnK3BSUN3AtXsIXTWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308411',6.5,1949,'en','Interview with the Assassin','Out of work TV cameraman Ron Kobelski is approached by his formerly reclusive neighbor Walter Ohlinger. Ohlinger claims that he was the mysterious \"second gunman\" that shot and killed President Kennedy. Ohlinger has kept quiet all these years, but has decided to tell his story now that he has been diagnosed with terminal cancer. Kobelski is skeptical of his neighbor\'s story, after his investigations provide ambiguous answers. His attitude changes, however, after he receives threatening messages on his answering machine, and spots shadowy figures in his backyard. Is Ohlinger telling the truth? Or is there a bigger conspiracy at work?','/yCEP43DIYqx8NM9ttcmgSnxScRI.jpg','2002-10-10',88,'Released','Dallas. 1963. The second shooter.','Interview with the Assassin',36584,1.6349,5.5,'_WzxqGXR0XY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17386,_binary '\0','/fCzes5B9KXgOopIJSCnMm8xzyDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308443',3.1,1445,'en','Just for Kicks','A stranger tries to help twin brothers who play for a winless soccer team.','/hEyNZyDjcDmFfoUja5iRfQmuiRq.jpg','2003-09-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Just for Kicks',31242,1.4229,4.1,'oLVcLWp62K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17387,_binary '\0','/1qwXItFKqvKYyW1CwbYhxyUC8Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308476',7.7,8274,'ru','Кукушка','September of 1944, a few days before Finland went out of the Second World War. A chained to a rock Finnish sniper-kamikadze Veikko managed to set himself free. Ivan, a captain of the Soviet Army, arrested by the Front Secret Police \'Smersh\', has a narrow escape. They are soldiers of the two enemy armies. A Lapp woman Anni gives a shelter to both of them at her farm. For Anni they are not enemies, but just men.','/g0bVxxdeAkDwzLoJq7o8ehQZWa6.jpg','2002-09-12',100,'Released','She\'s Making Peace One Man at a Time.','The Cuckoo',554,3.8126,7.089,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17388,_binary '\0','/lh0uM88KjXsmRzWXUGAGWJ0AOJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308506',5.5,24799,'en','Like Mike','Calvin and his friends, who all live in an orphanage, find old shoes with the faded letters MJ connected to a powerline. One stormy night, they go to get the shoes when Calvin and the shoes are struck by lightning. Calvin now has unbelievable basketball powers and has the chance to play for the NBA.','/9HSaQmu1QwzvUE7R97RGoDqjTv5.jpg','2002-07-03',99,'Released','Think like Mike, achieve like Mike, be like Mike.','Like Mike',21972,6.3179,6.1,'HTHJyw1UsLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17389,_binary '\0','/1ne50VwTD1FYVa9Nvj2Q9MsDgbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308508',7.4,2862,'en','Step Into Liquid','No special effects. No stuntmen. No stereotypes. No other feeling comes close. Surfers and secret spots from around the world are profiled in this documentary.','/gF352z3G8wnk5GDKzn7RcIDstwh.jpg','2003-08-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Step Into Liquid',15292,1.0282,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17390,_binary '\0','/6WleKGryFv038LEj0Z1KvP8I09q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308514',7.3,12316,'en','Lost in La Mancha','Fulton and Pepe\'s 2000 documentary captures Terry Gilliam\'s attempt to get The Man Who Killed Don Quixote off the ground. Back injuries, freakish storms, and more zoom in to sabotage the project.','/gPlWNmQOzJ7j8djCxXcc40syVS3.jpg','2002-02-11',93,'Released','They’ve got a story, but have lost the plot.','Lost in La Mancha',21189,2.7187,7.1,'YwMh1N0GxFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17391,_binary '\0','/ursbJ6xP9YnmtlTFKf77KPxmw7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308644',7.6,218170,'en','Finding Neverland','During a writing slump, playwright J.M. Barrie meets a widow and her four children, all young boys—who soon become an important part of Barrie’s life and the inspiration that lead him to create his masterpiece. Peter Pan.','/A9jgLICNCEb3lvWdNaIKAG9pRdp.jpg','2004-10-29',106,'Released','Where will your imagination take you?','Finding Neverland',866,7.458,7.3,'m41gObaKgOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17392,_binary '\0','/vrUB92EdhVprP0sICAzxHSISXWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308671',6.7,2190,'ru','Олигарх','During the Gorbachev years, Platon Makovski and his four buddies are university students who jump on the private capitalism movement. Fast-forward 20 years, Platon finds himself the richest man in Russia, having sacrificed his friends to get to the top. But with this cynical rise, comes a brutal fall.','/nWZncYsVgTNMdJiFm4BDoYvIQjv.jpg','2002-06-06',128,'Released',NULL,'Tycoon',39088,2.3394,5.3,'7k9Mmo99Ytk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17393,_binary '\0','/9DWasKWj8nqrlxo6034svGjuZEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308772',6.8,2884,'en','Pure','A young boy trying to deal with his mother\'s heroin addiction befriends a waitress who helps him cope with the tough situation.','/hxlm722P1IvsMqKQ5P4QZXdiPht.jpg','2002-09-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Pure',18072,2.3588,6.1,'lijLJKLCFtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17394,_binary '\0','/9u6KmcIbp2139xYW4RAxc5lvVPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308808',7.2,2717,'en','Revolution OS','REVOLUTION OS tells the inside story of the hackers who rebelled against the proprietary software model and Microsoft to create GNU/Linux and the Open Source movement.','/h7oBhsEsiHUgZ1uflyqBafB6SoB.jpg','2001-03-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Revolution OS',19433,0.8878,7,'NrI-0u4npGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17395,_binary '\0','/bLksPXWy2lNFITFeCYGNRSOikPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0308878',6.6,12213,'en','The Shape of Things','Quiet, unassuming Adam is changing in a major way, thanks to his new girlfriend, art student Evelyn. Adam\'s friends are a little freaked by the transformation.','/iETHZRRlr9WCgx3W8hoOp7gvOn2.jpg','2003-07-24',96,'Released','Seduction Is An Art','The Shape of Things',22958,3.4029,6.2,'OjxOtYx0Au4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17396,_binary '\0','/7CNn2H0bvwwQfwnWMAM4VvWmqwn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309047',7.5,6227,'ru','Война','During the bloody war in Chechnya, a British couple and two Russian soldiers are taken hostage by Chechen rebels. Two of the hostages are then released to bring the money for the British woman who is forced to wait for the ransom.','/uj1vANvuVgWGUwbuNwaTP215dHm.jpg','2002-03-14',120,'Released',NULL,'War',82737,1.5849,6.905,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17397,_binary '\0','/qIuN8rJwud0Q4osCFMvxyVIjELL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309061',7.9,4460,'de','War Photographer','Documentary about war photographer James Nachtwey, considered by many the greatest war photographer ever.','/uHs3wYmLUzIl64ofRHxOplLn66n.jpg','2001-11-01',96,'Released',NULL,'War Photographer',12722,1.4903,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17398,_binary '\0','/TlQ8aU2pzH34wGWhdwqt5SQBbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309150',7.5,1886,'en','Dreamkeeper','In South Dakota, in an Indian reservation, an old storyteller Indian asks his grandson Shane, who is in trouble owing money to some bad guys, to take his old pony and him to Albuquerque to the great powwow, an Indian meeting. While traveling, Grandpa tells mysterious Indian tales of love, friendship and magic.','/pmqMjP09ExnUQJePIEYElm9o9kc.jpg','2003-12-28',174,'Released',NULL,'Dreamkeeper',55534,2.4866,6.7,'syPMksYASCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17399,_binary '\0','/9OfxUDrEntAoxoA6AngWiUqvEc8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309291',7.2,5377,'ja','青い春','Soon after being named the new leader of his high school\'s gang system, Kujo grows bored with the violence and hatred that surround him. He wants desperately to abandon his post… but his once-enviable position of power has a strange way of making him feel powerless.','/ywUB6mMJGJHEIIl1BVV2eBLMWif.jpg','2001-09-09',83,'Released','AREN’T THERE SOME FLOWERS THAT NEVER BLOOM.','Blue Spring',33333,2.8107,7.1,'CEjNMsAI1Tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17400,_binary '\0','/1hILrN2fe21IMYonRKN5OKTpnvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309372',5.8,1385,'en','Blizzard','A young girl\'s aunt tells her the tale of a young ice skater and an enchanted reindeer.','/uLGrJDBi67Bb4e3mMGoH3duefhw.jpg','2003-05-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Blizzard',22081,2.2678,6,'_cLMnlVzG-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17401,_binary '\0','/6Jatq6wjJ4c2YbPkE5e5VzukEI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309377',6.4,51234,'en','Blood Work','Still recovering from a heart transplant, a retired FBI profiler returns to service when his own blood analysis offers clues to the identity of a serial killer.','/A6wWJkIREagRWFNu3YotID3n9aW.jpg','2002-08-09',110,'Released','He\'s a heartbeat away from catching the killer.','Blood Work',9573,6.1415,6.2,'vMg7LZ-JF6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17402,_binary '\0','/gncvmif7zzVOpMNxnpAOPfSXgUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309530',6.3,47452,'en','Down with Love','In 1962 New York City, love blossoms between a playboy journalist and a feminist advice author.','/74lG2SGDJdyiS8hB4kkFcRIviSi.jpg','2003-05-08',102,'Released','The ultimate catch has met his match','Down with Love',10720,6.4956,6.131,'2wzS37O7m-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17403,_binary '\0','/oRQ4qOWTx08p7arASg57lyOkMMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309565',7.2,4077,'fa','ارتفاع پست','A person wants to hijack an airplane to go out of Iran and cure his sick son.','/8WtLfukCYVQTzyQ4QCvUsWzEU5d.jpg','2002-02-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Low Heights',44067,0.9518,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17404,_binary '\0','/tKnmfO5lAyu8hpTZMyMaI4lhZpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309593',6.2,221831,'en','Final Destination 2','When Kimberly has a violent premonition of a highway pileup she blocks the freeway, keeping a few others meant to die, safe...Or are they? The survivors mysteriously start dying and it\'s up to Kimberly to stop it before she\'s next.','/vnFgxRlLTA9fDNcGXLiHmgwmIEo.jpg','2003-01-31',90,'Released','For every beginning there is an end.','Final Destination 2',9358,16.2073,6.316,'MNXpuPu4URk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17405,_binary '\0','/h6kB5E3upVSZ6NF2vZEET5xiRFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309600',6,1901,'en','Menja d’amor','Young aspiring pianist attracts attention of famous musicians. Chance encounters bring them together but expectations must be managed by all.','/9MqumkO3fGMeyLOdG0Ot4OKNEKe.jpg','2002-02-08',105,'Released','In matters of love and sex... every good boy does fine.','Food of Love',41645,1.7627,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17406,_binary '\0','/iiPBXynI88EgnpunHoUlBCnLpSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309698',7.3,297622,'en','Identity','Complete strangers stranded at a remote desert motel during a raging storm soon find themselves the target of a deranged murderer. As their numbers thin out, the travelers begin to turn on each other, as each tries to figure out who the killer is.','/sYgimsiBywqVwJI8H4sETke8m7v.jpg','2003-04-25',90,'Released','The secret lies within.','Identity',2832,13.7483,7.179,'2ReUIVKB4to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17407,_binary '\0','/nMzxuTv5ooUb3OBhRaBAVS39zgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309725',6.8,1695,'nl','Ja Zuster, Nee Zuster','In the guest-house of sister Klivia, the inhabitants are very cheerful and good-hearted persons whose open communal lifestyle is contrasted with the life of somewhat nasty and complaining neighbour Mr Boordevool. Boordevool has spent ages looking for reasons to shut the guest-house. One day a girl from the guest-house meets a nice young guy Gerrit. Sister Klivia lets Gerrit stay regardless of him being a thief. Will that give a chance to the insinuations of the neighbour?','/pam1zGMb7M2Fy1qhXOQ9LhScASU.jpg','2002-09-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Yes Nurse! No Nurse!',21896,1.3578,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17408,_binary '\0','/5tsQ6QrKa7to3S2DCosSOYrJ6OE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309820',6.6,16803,'en','Luther','During the early 16th century, idealistic German monk Martin Luther, disgusted by the materialism in the church, begins the dialogue that will lead to the Protestant Reformation.','/5Z3wlA8sKdd3tPTZW8N1q3YEd5f.jpg','2003-10-29',123,'Released','Rebel. Genius. Liberator.','Luther',5653,4.9106,6.5,'Oe84Aolmmcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17409,_binary '\0','/1hUp9RxrVoG9Nbzhak2nHDdzvVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309832',6.2,4937,'fr','Maléfique','Four prisoners discover a handwritten book of black magic in their cell, and decide to use it to escape.','/pY8e2HOCpB1SxJKGC7QgfyCEUO1.jpg','2003-05-07',90,'Released','Will you make it out alive?','Maléfique',46025,2.3368,5.889,'D6e2UaE4fps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17410,_binary '\0','/lpBubGegDJ7LI11P0nTYiInbaOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309872',6,1793,'fr','Mon idole','Bastien, an ambitious young production assistant, catches the attention of Jean-Louis, a producer of high regard, and is granted a shot at his own television show.','/A1XRyCECB4a8prUBMMD4WIObh7f.jpg','2002-12-17',110,'Released','Desperate to succeed?','Whatever You Say',31354,2.1768,5.7,'BN_uEffYgbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17411,_binary '\0','/bvhAbUMsDfFTseAAoPE49JJ0ebA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309912',7.1,15152,'en','Nicholas Nickleby','Nicholas Nickleby, a young boy in search of a better life, struggles to save his family and friends from the abusive exploitation of his coldheartedly grasping uncle.','/uLilCY2We3Ore9Ke7CdafntHvmT.jpg','2002-12-27',132,'Released','EVERY FAMILY NEEDS A HERO.','Nicholas Nickleby',29339,4.5571,6.843,'lYcmxq1BjAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17412,_binary '\0','/gvr2N9cwighn92GRL10LzrCu0IP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309986',5.4,1582,'en','Paper Soldiers','Paper Soldiers follows an overeager burglar named Shawn through the ups and downs of his short, stressful career.','/z2rHu9VeJTj5IuJkUdu7WmvPx3T.jpg','2002-06-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Paper Soldiers',24978,1.8741,5.6,'VvZjdok7cNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17413,_binary '\0','/vaRCS4CCFXcWz1j9GKd6rGLsQQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0309987',7.1,142328,'en','The Dreamers','When Isabelle and Theo invite Matthew to stay with them, what begins as a casual friendship ripens into a sensual voyage of discovery and desire in which nothing is off limits and everything is possible.','/gBb7GGaFYPu7nEUYvC8G4LaJJN1.jpg','2003-10-10',115,'Released','Together nothing is impossible. Together nothing is forbidden.','The Dreamers',1278,17.9266,7.2,'9DsxpEA9EUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17414,_binary '\0','/hKIPhk37KxUqlniVRwPpQW3KaFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310001',6.9,1668,'es','Piedras','The stones of the title are the dreams and burdens carried by these five women with interlinked lives. This story of decision and transformation was nominated for the Golden Bear at the Berlin Film Festival.','/hwp4NfSnguyrRYudveJIvhTjaqB.jpg','2002-02-08',135,'Released',NULL,'Stones',28204,1.7508,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17415,_binary '\0','/qpI3S8hytJzzp5tuLv1t6b7fZ67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310149',5.6,3142,'ja','修羅雪姫','Raised by assassins, Yuki is the last of the Takemikazuchi royal bloodline. A deadly weapon in her own right, she learns the gruesome truth about the death of her beloved mother and joins forces with a mysterious rebel leader.','/qZNxgBOfi6SaAevgYkkeW68vqZK.jpg','2001-12-15',95,'Released',NULL,'The Princess Blade',17180,1.3605,5.6,'R0QnGz9hcf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17416,_binary '\0','/u9OU5l8zocq48CAlkMjRbKCPy9v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310154',7.3,4554,'en','In This World','Torn straight from the headlines, Michael Winterbottom\'s compelling and prescient \'In This World\' follows young Afghan Jamal and his older cousin Enayat as they embark on a hazardous overland trip from their refugee camp at Peshawar, north-west Pakistan. Entering Turkey on foot through a snowy, Kurdish-controlled pass, the pair again take their lives into their hands and face suffocation when they are locked in a freight container on a ship bound for Italy. From there they plan to travel on to Paris, the Sangatte refuge centre and ultimately asylum in London.','/denzE2tZc3TZ95vQNK3rKo0iDHn.jpg','2003-03-28',88,'Released','The journey to freedom has no borders.','In This World',36791,1.6052,6.2,'c2_hJ6g4bbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17417,_binary '\0','/wFY88k4fQQCwgALmANwNVtMRusm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310203',7.1,32792,'fr','Tais-toi !','After hiding his loot and getting thrown in jail, brooding outlaw Ruby befriends Quentin, a dim-witted and garrulous giant. After Quentin botches a solo escape attempt, they make a break together. Unable to shake the clumsy Quentin, Ruby is forced to take him along as he pursues his former partners in crime to avenge the death of the woman he loved and get to the money.','/cVmCfQJ1U744FsWWJmeK5bujy2d.jpg','2003-10-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Ruby & Quentin',7229,5.2323,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17418,_binary '\0','/jMMmk2ffrjLot1v7EXCpfbQd8XW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310254',5.7,3747,'hi','तुमको ना भूल पाएँगे','Veer, a villager, becomes restless after he is haunted by the visions of his past. When he is attacked on the day of his wedding, he forces his parents to reveal the truth about his identity.','/mI4cFL7bEQcTgI6vtoPSkAWU1tJ.jpg','2002-02-24',160,'Released','Expect the unexpected.','Tumko Na Bhool Paayenge',55212,1.4669,5.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17419,_binary '\0','/4dZnJLpTzy6FKtrZmoViw3yh0CO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310281',7.2,32431,'en','A Mighty Wind','Three eclectic, never-quite-famous folk bands come together for the first time in decades following the death of their manager to put on an reunion concert in his honor, at the request of his son.','/5wUYwAD75BxtJ0Mp4da6XzHIFex.jpg','2003-04-16',92,'Released','Back together for the first time, again.','A Mighty Wind',13370,3.9438,6.8,'abUnxPS58EQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17420,_binary '\0','/hpOcNP4EWpk6PrbC96vscRFPUjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310313',6.3,1263,'fr','La Vie nouvelle','A young American drifts through a decaying Eastern European city, where his fixation on an elusive woman pulls him deeper into an underworld fueled by possession.','/nceP5x7xMAD8e5Ur6FVGZGUdwL8.jpg','2002-11-27',102,'Released','Are you ready?','A New Life',99642,1.3763,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17421,_binary '\0','/xH9BdS2DzkX20Ly9FG8Iwczi3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310357',6.1,20295,'en','Willard','Desperate for companionship, the repressed Willard befriends a group of rats that inhabit his late father\'s deteriorating mansion. In these furry creatures, Willard finds temporary refuge from daily abuse at the hands of his bedridden mother and his father\'s old partner, Frank. Soon it becomes clear that the brood of rodents is ready and willing to exact a vicious, deadly revenge on anyone who dares to bully their sensitive new master.','/hRVP8Ud9ehv7tp5WWQ4CHk2XNus.jpg','2003-03-14',100,'Released','When the cat\'s away, the rats will play.','Willard',10929,3.6234,6.1,'rV0NN2eFVqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17422,_binary '\0','/b6elu2cz2Be9PqgX0MzggMCH4fk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310775',7.5,82817,'ko','복수는 나의 것','A deaf man and his girlfriend resort to desperate measures in order to fund a kidney transplant for his sister. Things go horribly wrong, and the situation spirals rapidly into a cycle of violence and revenge.','/uj42ubGbgVL65T10SvPVr0p9mJc.jpg','2002-03-29',129,'Released','Revenge was never this sweet.','Sympathy for Mr. Vengeance',4689,7.4712,7.5,'6D0cjs2NW9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17423,_binary '\0','/3kXZJ8XogMUQhZKx4mfAlifKLwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310778',6.7,5370,'fr','Bon voyage','On the eve of World War II four Parisians cope with the impending invasion of their city by German forces. While the French government braces for impact, the intersected lives of a young writer, a vain movie star, a French politician and a young scientist are examined as they attempt to deal with war and evade German spies.','/2pP1STSvXOv6jITKQnaZfI1xXB6.jpg','2003-04-16',114,'Released',NULL,'Bon Voyage',14652,2.2604,6.3,'5EgcEiFP_uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17424,_binary '\0','/70uUnpfe7en9x011UjpZoub101l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310793',7.9,152716,'en','Bowling for Columbine','This is not a film about gun control. It is a film about the fearful heart and soul of the United States, and the 280 million Americans lucky enough to have the right to a constitutionally protected Uzi. From a look at the Columbine High School security camera tapes to the home of Oscar-winning NRA President Charlton Heston, from a young man who makes homemade napalm with The Anarchist\'s Cookbook to the murder of a six-year-old girl by another six-year-old. Bowling for Columbine is a journey through the US, through our past, hoping to discover why our pursuit of happiness is so riddled with violence.','/4XsiTsZcNCRSkee1o0fdr5OqYRT.jpg','2002-10-09',120,'Released','Are we a nation of gun nuts or are we just nuts?','Bowling for Columbine',1430,4.4232,7.5,'AElSP38H8OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17425,_binary '\0','/5JMTQHYN7xIWeeaBNC9uWkZa7g6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310851',6,1272,'en','The Case of the Whitechapel Vampire','The scene of the crime is Whitechapel, the same London district notorious for the recent attacks of Jack the Ripper. Three monks are found dead, the apparent victims of a vampire - now, someone else is out for blood. Or is it something else? As bizarre events unfold, the answer is left to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson to find.','/ueQqFcj093gptJfaFWaK91DUMO1.jpg','2002-10-27',90,'Released','A fly-by-night killer is leaving Sherlock Holmes in the dark.','The Case of the Whitechapel Vampire',81382,2.0238,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17426,_binary '\0','/g5woRbuOrwynegzoMKOg8GmMf0j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310910',6.6,36546,'en','Confidence','What Jake Vig doesn\'t know just might get him killed. A sharp and polished grifter, Jake has just swindled thousands of dollars from the unsuspecting Lionel Dolby with the help of his crew. It becomes clear that Lionel wasn\'t just any mark, he was an accountant for eccentric crime boss Winston King. Jake and his crew will have to stay one step ahead of both the criminals and the cops to finally settle their debt.','/yJzmAtY9DmhhjJwFnW0Zjlvz6yg.jpg','2003-04-25',97,'Released','It\'s not about the money. It\'s about the money.','Confidence',10743,3.8923,6.268,'6-AeSFk_wPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17427,_binary '\0','/ukg6d35NGTW4DuOyG4hs6cB6uwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310924',6.4,5951,'en','Crime Spree','An out-of-town heist becomes a nightmare for a crew of French burglars when they mistakenly rob the head of the Chicago mafia. Unaccustomed to the ways of the American underworld, it is not long before they have the mafia, the FBI and a couple of street gangs on their backs as they attempt to make their way back to Paris.','/dxiL0nUW82RGz5lNv8HbRf95Dc5.jpg','2003-04-16',98,'Released','It was supposed to be an easy job.','Crime Spree',6277,4.0178,5.6,'3zQfiNtylQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17428,_binary '\0','/8pEGugLhyfhQWiUuK18O7rKyM6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0310952',5.1,2836,'en','Riverworld','A movie for the Sci Fi Channel based on the book series by Philip José Farmer. The location is Riverworld, a mysterious and treacherous land where every human who died between the years 99,000 BC and 2,200 AD has been resurrected on the banks of a huge river.','/z228kLHgr1XHNqLyCXyLMnfhlVH.jpg','2003-03-22',86,'Released',NULL,'Riverworld',16356,1.8257,4.5,'UBAOBwsuG74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17429,_binary '\0','/b6HMSKwA8tBdWYRl8Nr5UAN4w1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311018',5.3,2063,'en','Disappearance','A family driving through Nevada decides to take some snapshots at an out-of-the-way ghost town named Weaver, and horrible things start happening.','/yTR5uhaMQRvX5SIBZoIjQnrIWR2.jpg','2002-04-21',91,'Released','The town of Weaver isn\'t on a map. That\'s not a mistake. It\'s a warning.','Disappearance',86973,1.4167,5.6,'C-lL-5C3nRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17430,_binary '\0','/hvaytcTIhHWYfntGHeppJtUbEiR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311041',7.3,1286,'zh','独自等待','An award-winning audience favorite in China since it debuted, Waiting Alone tells the first-person-narrative of Wen (Xia Yu), a shop owner and aspiring author who feels that he\'s met his dream girl (Li Bingbing). The only problem is, he seems stuck in the friend-zone. Aided by his best friends and the one girl he completely trusts (Gong Beibi), he tries different ways to woo her...','/gyAUJlnQikSNkZUHUB0VxV4itQl.jpg','2005-09-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Waiting Alone',75185,1.5708,6.821,'hUh7r8KmSSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17431,_binary '\0','/hw21ZwKL39ycxQcJhopzEjN9XYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311072',7.1,2163,'es','En la ciudad sin límites','Victor is a man who gets to Paris to join his family around their seriously ill father, Max. Victor is desperately asked for help by Max. What seems in the beginning mere delusions of an old man losing his mind, begin to show traces of some sort of real \'secret\' that is troubling Max\'s last days. Victor decide to help his father to find that he is searching for.','/rDbWt7X1rJmv9HQiJ1ykDZ7MkBY.jpg','2002-03-01',125,'Released','You must find the exit','The City of No Limits',20316,1.6042,6.8,'FuIJmJ6x_ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17432,_binary '\0','/u42S6M2yca5czyRLu5YRE886PTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311110',5.5,5417,'en','It Runs in the Family','This is the story of a dysfunctional New York family, and their attempts to reconcile','/xmnZQwgNoTuzPr65QwLAEpFu9UP.jpg','2003-04-25',109,'Released','Some families can survive anything. Even each other.','It Runs in the Family',31459,2.4863,6,'MjBy15Th-PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17433,_binary '\0','/zMHyNxNt4zhL939XX8QLBW3gWfu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311113',7.5,259470,'en','Master and Commander: The Far Side of the World','After an abrupt and violent encounter with a French warship inflicts severe damage upon his ship, a captain of the British Royal Navy begins a chase over two oceans to capture or destroy the enemy, though he must weigh his commitment to duty and ferocious pursuit of glory against the safety of his devoted crew, including the ship\'s thoughtful surgeon, his best friend.','/7ZUHF6P0vcA5v1Gm8NbRYyd9w4N.jpg','2003-11-14',138,'Released','The courage to do the impossible lies in the hearts of men.','Master and Commander: The Far Side of the World',8619,9.5549,7.2,'tHTHCNYiiHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17434,_binary '\0','/lMancq0xdjUyXtpUtzS4G3AW9mF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311141',6.3,1575,'de','Das fliegende Klassenzimmer','A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school. United with his new peers, he gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.','/jI28MbNtjz9WV1NY9W7qARPNSfd.jpg','2003-01-16',110,'Released',NULL,'The Flying Classroom',10519,1.5322,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17435,_binary '\0','/edcsiaiTPBZBaVTRjVViOk3R5sJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311210',6.7,1489,'en','Out of the Ashes','The real-life story of Gisella Perl, a Jewish Hungarian doctor imprisoned in the notorious Auschwitz death camp of World War II.','/dK0ObrwNoLlB8haDO3JZUKoDtOL.jpg','2003-04-13',113,'Released',NULL,'Out of the Ashes',19338,2.3221,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17436,_binary '\0','/cVMK2k0Wbs8DV3IK5sS4ziVenrI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311289',7.1,111677,'en','Holes','After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. As he endures the brutal routine, Stanley begins to uncover a hidden truth behind the camp—one that connects to a dangerous secret and his family’s history.','/o2Dm2mcE1qW8vT0bpsJO5OMBbqa.jpg','2003-04-18',117,'Released','Some secrets are too big to keep hidden.','Holes',8326,8.0607,6.909,'ehfD-_2zz2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17437,_binary '\0','/7rMZQzMeoYii9XozQSbsW7qo2Zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311320',7.3,1938,'de','Im toten Winkel - Hitlers Sekretärin','Documentarians Andre Heller and Othmar Schmiderer turn their camera on 81-year-old Traudl Junge, who served as Adolf Hitler\'s secretary from 1942 to 1945, and allow her to speak about her experiences. Junge sheds light on life in the Third Reich and the days leading up to Hitler\'s death in the famed bunker, where Junge recorded Hitler\'s last will and testament. Her gripping account is nothing short of mesmerizing.','/4FyWb8uQsC2qj8o7rMiJgicZvy0.jpg','2002-03-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Blind Spot: Hitler\'s Secretary',9082,1.4843,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17438,_binary '\0','/chTzuvknyHTc0jqjQjGsEjmg5DG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311361',4.9,4932,'en','Jesus Christ Vampire Hunter','The second coming is upon us, and Jesus has returned to earth. But before he can get down to the serious business of judging the living and the dead, he has to contend with an army of vampires that can walk in the daylight.','/iYAiPgkzaCAlMwQ7hyAr0h3D2uF.jpg','2001-06-10',85,'Released','The Power of Jesus Impales You!','Jesus Christ Vampire Hunter',16209,1.9158,4.9,'4LRIypcaIX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17439,_binary '\0','/n3VpgjdOB1DkHSUe1DbFzV8ncpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311429',5.8,193314,'en','The League of Extraordinary Gentlemen','To prevent a world war from breaking out, famous characters from Victorian literature band together to do battle against a cunning villain.','/kdAuVFP63XXxnb983ry2pLCKd9S.jpg','2003-07-11',110,'Released','The power of seven become a league of one.','The League of Extraordinary Gentlemen',8698,11.4819,6.017,'Ed4xjEz_9Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17440,_binary '\0','/nvzRMLQSYB1XYooexBr8Nqp5vcU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311519',7.6,29291,'fi','Mies vailla menneisyyttä','Arriving in Helsinki, a nameless man is beaten within an inch of his life by thugs, miraculously recovering only to find that he has completely lost his memory. Back on the streets, he attempts to begin again from zero, befriending a moody dog and becoming besotted with a Salvation Army volunteer.','/9tBepCujkyNg1qM52MsaJfDkIRw.jpg','2002-03-01',97,'Released',NULL,'The Man Without a Past',7294,2.9057,7.411,'3srBsylmHW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17441,_binary '\0','/1Z4D31l2avNXR8KLTgqIGW3uHkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311594',8.8,6757,'te','నువ్వు నాకు నచ్చావ్','Venky and Nandini\'s relationship changes from mere friendship to something that is more romantic. However, love only blossoms between the two after Nandini\'s marriage is fixed elsewhere.','/z6F2Y7zddPFZ2ls9OY006egVClP.jpg','2001-09-06',180,'Released','... the new love story','Nuvvu Naaku Nachav',82255,1.6983,7.551,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17442,_binary '\0','/jcue2THX5mjQFV7EXqoQyXyLlbR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311648',7,23320,'en','Pieces of April','Quirky and rebellious April Burns lives with her boyfriend in a low-rent New York City apartment miles away from her emotionally distant family. But when she discovers that her mother has a fatal form of breast cancer, she invites the clan to her place for Thanksgiving. While her father struggles to drive her family into the city, April -- an inexperienced cook -- runs into kitchen trouble and must ask a neighbor for help.','/qm3jGZwz2UkwwEFEFzSot8T0pz1.jpg','2003-10-17',81,'Released','She\'s the one in every family.','Pieces of April',1550,3.0873,6.5,'p4_nmB7PsOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17443,_binary '\0','/o6jlE3V7ihpE8kKYBB8eZndNPRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311730',6.3,1948,'en','The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone','An aging actress\' husband dies of a heart attack en route to Rome, where they\'d planned to holiday. There, she rents an apartment and, through the Contessa, she meets a young man, with whom she begins an affair.','/ty6DKxqNJjgWA4xb1C1ZtySoQn.jpg','2003-05-04',108,'Released',NULL,'The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone',158928,2.5638,6.2,'E8v1wI6UqIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17444,_binary '\0','/1zgwimfXuJHGUi6CGeJbw65MztN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311913',7,2789,'cn','天下無雙','Two pairs of siblings are destined for each other, but fate throws countless obstacles in the path. When the young Emperor and his sister contrive to leave the palace, they meet the loves of their lives in the town of Meilong.','/jZdT63XWtBBCmPIzLyJd1YATdxn.jpg','2002-02-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Chinese Odyssey 2002',45379,2.1249,6.836,'eFsVTbeF1fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17445,_binary '\0','/5ju95gTwu6kevyzhTdIO5dqyYWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311926',7.8,6121,'sv','Torsk på Tallinn - En liten film om ensamhet','Percy Nilegaard collects Swedish single men and embarks on a bus trip to Tallinn with a so-called \"highly-experienced driver\".','/7jLEi0gcDs8eUQmO8xftWdkXi5i.jpg','1999-04-22',59,'Released',NULL,'Screwed in Tallinn: A Small Film About Loneliness',16076,1.4827,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17446,_binary '\0','/AqRYUwWbHpbP8PK2q8magXOlOI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0311941',5.9,6453,'en','Try Seventeen','Teenager Jones has opted not to go to college and is instead renting a room in a boarding house to work on his writing skills. Soon, Jones finds himself dividing his time between two women: a young actress named Lisa and a photographer named Jane. After Jane\'s ex-boyfriend arrives to help her recover from a car accident, Jones begins to understand just how much he cares for her.','/oXgmh24wIlKLAlvVnZ4gZnYsrkh.jpg','2002-09-10',96,'Released','You\'re only seventeen once. For Jones Dillon, it\'s one time too many.','Try Seventeen',14874,2.456,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17447,_binary '\0','/Aqvtwgu1G4eEwIf8nSIxiCN5ewC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312004',7.5,158693,'en','Wallace & Gromit: The Curse of the Were-Rabbit','Cheese-loving eccentric Wallace and his cunning canine pal Gromit run a business ridding the town of garden pests. Using only humane methods, which turns their home into a halfway house for evicted vermin, the pair stumble upon a mystery involving a voracious vegetarian monster that threatens to ruin the annual veggie-growing contest.','/cMQ2lNd7sBe6PCf6zF5QxrKzbRG.jpg','2005-09-15',85,'Released','Something wicked this way hops.','Wallace & Gromit: The Curse of the Were-Rabbit',533,11.7743,7.1,'BXYNHHj4KDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17448,_binary '\0','/yBRIOaJVeMpfvPMeiqV7RtAMV81.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312318',8.5,7961,'en','9/11','An on-the-scene documentary following the events of September 11, 2001 from an insider\'s view, through the lens of two French filmmakers who simply set out to make a movie about a rookie NYC fireman and ended up filming the tragic event that changed our lives forever.','/k4Cs8h56Q1zpvWQMNSCi67uAqEe.jpg','2002-03-10',128,'Released',NULL,'9/11',11304,1.9773,7.9,'foZuOsf5tEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17449,_binary '\0','/i9AIrb3C7l3wuxuqYbrv4rBCEHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312329',5.3,7646,'en','Against the Ropes','A fictional story inspired by North America\'s most famous female boxing promoter, Jackie Kallen. Her struggle to survive and succeed in a male dominated sport.','/9CuODYTA3vvrGluaIl0hMPsEIK8.jpg','2004-02-20',106,'Released','She gave the boxing world the one-two punch they never saw coming.','Against the Ropes',8842,2.9525,5.1,'zfOonAJg61U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17450,_binary '\0','/fObSu01QCt3kRfvRXlSTf95jT2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312358',5.1,4140,'de','Anatomie 2','The doctor and soccer player in the leisure time Jo Hauser decides to move to Berlin and be an intern in a famous clinic, expecting to increase his knowledge and expertize, and help his handicap brother Willi Hauser. He joins a secret fraternity of doctors, under the leadership of Prof. Muller-LaRousse, who is researching the use of bionic muscles in human beings without any ethics or respect to the laws. The team is also volunteer to the experiences, and is under investigation of Paula Henning. When Jo gets close to a Filipino nurse, and becomes addicted in the drugs used in experience, he realizes the truth hidden in the methods used by the secret society in the development of science.','/yT8ouLaEJtLb899m34BYtR5bR5o.jpg','2003-11-23',101,'Released','A new experiment in terror...','Anatomy 2',1699,2.4453,5.6,'IE-5rB5QCpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17451,_binary '\0','/jgskBl5kxLYiCu6bYCzf6hmnf1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312409',6.2,1835,'en','Bad Eggs','Ben Kinnear and Mike Paddock are two undercover detectives with way too much publicity, who find they can no longer turn a blind eye to the corruption in the police force.','/ogMCG0Btzl5lt3ZGMG9Sh0Xk7s5.jpg','2003-07-24',98,'Released','Someone’s on the shonk.','Bad Eggs',15935,1.2458,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17452,_binary '\0','/ihOd5W6qOgrBSLj0uDTnGs8k1aa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312528',4.2,96141,'en','The Cat in the Hat','During a rainy day, and while their mother is out, Conrad and Sally, and their pet fish, are visited by the mischievous Cat in the Hat. Fun soon turns to mayhem, and the siblings must figure out how to rid themselves of the maniacal Cat.','/uYYLz67e5xEQMsY858VSSCDsLU6.jpg','2003-11-21',82,'Released','Don\'t mess with the hat.','The Cat in the Hat',10588,38.1964,5.381,'oIPq9Kp-9A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17453,_binary '\0','/pku59jhFJGLqrFIP0m1ITyqfQcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312549',6.8,23179,'en','Veronica Guerin','In this true story, Veronica Guerin is an investigative reporter for an Irish newspaper. As the drug trade begins to bleed into the mainstream, Guerin decides to take on and expose those responsible. Beginning at the bottom with addicts, Guerin then gets in touch with John Traynor, a paranoid informant. Not without some prodding, Traynor leads her to John Gilligan, the ruthless head of the operation, who does not take kindly to Guerin\'s nosing.','/1aJYz1YjcZggKsTJhCcYJ3adtcm.jpg','2003-07-11',98,'Released','Why would anyone want to kill Veronica Guerin?','Veronica Guerin',10629,5.0638,6.657,'VMpOJFOahqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17454,_binary '\0','/4iTONlcLU9wwxEnwvxGCcc4asHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312700',3.4,7754,'en','The Foreigner','This story is about a freelance agent who is the courier of a package from France to Germany. He soon finds that many people want to get their hands on it.','/esfi6vzwvq5M6H5OisFvG58mSvt.jpg','2003-06-01',96,'Released','If they think they can stop him, they\'re dead wrong.','The Foreigner',18248,4.7565,3.933,'mnxu-C5axKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17455,_binary '\0','/zveQBQ7lPGkxtQGY1JMualMGrwF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312773',7.1,3352,'pt','O Homem do Ano','Maiquél has lost a bet and dyed his hair blond. This seemingly innocuous event triggers a head-on collision with destiny in which he goes from nobody to hero to outlaw — all in 24 hours.','/7Qai7kYNbx5k8Dy4mGTPHdVxXjK.jpg','2003-08-01',104,'Released','Even losers get to win sometimes.','The Man of the Year',8441,1.8493,6.7,'6YExz6dONSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17456,_binary '\0','/u4uANfkQL69QWLtvEvZS6D0pHLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312841',7.7,6386,'ko','집으로...','This is the story of a 7-year-old boy, Sang-woo, born and raised in the big city, and his mute grandmother, who has spent her whole life in a small rural village.','/z2NTGih179RkIN7EQntiFy5RZiF.jpg','2002-04-05',86,'Released','Discover the magical movie that has captured the heart of a nation.','The Way Home',33251,1.9343,8.012,'x36wqfOh7tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17457,_binary '\0','/pK8jgMF9o5SBq7grQzVnpeqib7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312843',6.5,24234,'ja','自殺サークル','When the bizarre mass suicide of 54 high school girls throwing themselves in front of a subway train appears to instigate a string of suicides around the country, Detective Kuroda strives to find the answer, which isn\'t as simple as he had hoped.','/oMjWlKHzR9cwhf3oCUy9j57o67O.jpg','2001-10-29',99,'Released','Well then, goodbye everybody.','Suicide Club',12720,3.1741,6.5,'Xh-uW3fAB-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17458,_binary '\0','/wwjEDqlzZ7V6pVORhvuHiiSqh7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312859',8.3,10909,'ta','கன்னத்தில் முத்தமிட்டாள்','A little girl is told by her parents that she is adopted. Determined to find her birth mother, her family eventually agrees to take her to Sri Lanka, where they encounter the militant group known as the Tamil Tigers.','/eypuf9fEWnTH6cSx6Pm82QGqp4r.jpg','2002-02-14',137,'Released',NULL,'Kannathil Muthamittal',40998,1.8328,7.694,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17459,_binary '\0','/7OxVkfW6mblkAFE02wIYkxjqmsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312862',6.2,2222,'pl','Kariera Nikosia Dyzmy','Nikos is a master of funeral ceremonies (that\'s undertaker to you and me) who doesn\'t expect much from life. After drunkenly insulting a diplomat at a party, weird things begin to happen for Nikos. The news that a mysterious stranger offended the hated Deputy Prime Minister galvanizes the political elite assembled at the banquet, and a rumor that Nikos can take care of anything spreads like wildfire, making him an idol of the masses.','/7yJadqcF5GcL8YEchsKyJ2fUpoK.jpg','2002-03-15',108,'Released',NULL,'The Career of Nikos Dyzma',38371,1.3386,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17460,_binary '\0','/8plVtK6V4pZx85O2yVOA9sfU1Tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312886',7.1,1297,'cn','男人四十','Secondary school teacher Lam Yiu-kwok is suffering from a mid-life crisis—his peers have all become more successful than him; his relationship with his wife, Chan Man-ching, is in trouble when her old flame returns, and he finds himself tempted by a 17-year-old student who has a crush on him.','/A8J2cRXxPCxcma09kbEcg12SjG6.jpg','2002-03-14',103,'Released',NULL,'July Rhapsody',51484,1.3801,6.5,'BnfxGRgFI3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17461,_binary '\0','/zauCubfXEfmdEyI8iTjlhOpqEIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312932',7.3,1872,'cn','買兇拍人','A hired killer pairs up with an amateur filmmaker to provide clients with satisfying footage of enemies getting whacked.','/c19P4K4hRhuCMlQoQuaadi8EOH4.jpg','2001-08-16',94,'Released','During a slack period, contract killers market their business as a consumer experience.','You Shoot, I Shoot',93582,2.606,7,'8csmKxUQS4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17462,_binary '\0','/qe3WYa7UUfKFvpf4fFiS9Sqrpot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0312941',7.4,1343,'zh','麥兜故事','McDull is not the brightest kid on the block, but he continuously tries to do his best to please his mother. Still it seems he may not be destined for great things like she wishes, but McDull strives to try anyway.','/nr1X77Yj7YPYfHYWiMYVr7vGaH8.jpg','2001-12-15',75,'Released',NULL,'My Life as McDull',73884,1.1563,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17463,_binary '\0','/lisILqhRqF9qlkFbLVTo6S4Rvbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313021',6.2,9929,'de','Der Wixxer','A mysterious serial killer is shocking the underworld. Scotland Yard is investigating the case. Clues lead the detectives to Blackwhite Castle.','/tHcKs8FBYsxxHV3COhBM2EsY0eL.jpg','2004-05-20',85,'Released','He\'s coming...','The Trixxer',7281,2.8305,6.4,'adO3gXakmUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17464,_binary '\0','/pH4MhQJK12l8lT6DCpNy0Lu8Wub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313196',6.7,15102,'es','El crimen del padre Amaro','Sent to Mexico to help take care of aging Father Benito, young Father Amaro faces a moral challenge when he meets a 16-year-old girl who he starts an affair with. Likewise, the girl\'s mother had been having an affair with Father Benito. Father Amaro must choose between a holy or sinful life.','/wqwt2DKcQV6EeSwXuYTk7pkLFii.jpg','2002-10-01',118,'Released','Lead us not into temptation','The Crime of Padre Amaro',542,3.9273,6.64,'4XSnLQyX5qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17465,_binary '\0','/nVDvLtrmcJi0WmrGaLVZCX2xKkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313285',5.7,3764,'en','Black Cadillac','What starts as a night of celebration for three friends quickly becomes the ultimate test of survival when their car breaks down on a frozen and deserted mountain road. The mystery grows further when they are joined by a local deputy sheriff and are stalked down the mountain by the ominous, probing headlights of a black Cadillac. It\'s a terrifying race - man against machine ... and Mother Nature\'s most fearsome elements. Based on writer / director John Murlowski\'s own terrifying experience on a late-night road trip in January 1983.','/aCcHPu3TFJYNTT1NoWJPQa1tPi1.jpg','2003-05-03',93,'Released','Revenge in the driver\'s seat','Black Cadillac',69217,1.4609,5.7,'gM2lT9KjeZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17466,_binary '\0','/iSfEs4TSZ0ECPukWNPw5EoBws3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313300',6.2,1678,'en','The Blue Butterfly','Based on a true story, The Blue Butterfly tells the story of a terminally ill 10-year-old boy whose dream is to catch the most beautiful butterfly on Earth, the mythic and elusive Blue Morpho. His mother persuades a renowned entomologist to take them on a trip to the jungle to search for the butterfly, leading to an adventure that will transform their lives','/wuKQhiIrPPhY6DDOdYYrsWoVcK9.jpg','2004-02-20',97,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Butterfly',25379,1.5618,7.1,'FGeHGtgP5QY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17467,_binary '\0','/b6NwOhvIVpbMyzFqdMnaSojv6CJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313410',7,2997,'en','No Night Is Too Long','A chance meeting, a stolen kiss and a sudden flare of passion sets a handsome young university student on a journey of betrayal, heartbreak and murder.','/81uNqDEDFrM9NmdOigwQIjXNF2w.jpg','2002-12-27',116,'Released','Love may have mortal consequences…','No Night Is Too Long',65830,3.1996,6.3,'m_CYVTMhV7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17468,_binary '\0','/ip2SgXV5XBT3XDQRrNdXtk1kZd5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313443',6.5,72455,'en','Out of Time','Matt Lee Whitlock, respected chief of police in small Banyan Key, Florida, must solve a vicious double homicide before he himself falls under suspicion. Matt Lee has to stay a few steps ahead of his own police force and everyone he\'s trusted in order to find out the truth.','/zMExJ6RdJQmRMydvozhEBlOLX1m.jpg','2003-10-03',105,'Released','How do you solve a murder when all the evidence points to you?','Out of Time',2116,6.1182,6.4,'gtVWtSTsn4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17469,_binary '\0','/zIckqbwhqxiMQKcpfdPuOCXfp5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313542',7.1,122672,'en','Runaway Jury','After a workplace shooting in New Orleans, a trial against the gun manufacturer pits lawyer Wendell Rohr against shady jury consultant Rankin Fitch, who uses illegal means to stack the jury with people sympathetic to the defense. But when juror Nicholas Easter and his girlfriend Marlee reveal their ability to sway the jury into delivering any verdict they want, a high-stakes cat-and-mouse game begins.','/hpBot7sqaskTdZS264c7hOhGiQ0.jpg','2003-10-17',127,'Released','Trials are too important to be decided by juries.','Runaway Jury',11329,9.9486,6.946,'c80vGyzA0LI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17470,_binary '\0','/uJNPy1qGevGoKyfZsXU08U2ftOj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313550',7.3,1634,'ko','생활의 발견','After being rejected for a film role, a stage actor leaves Seoul to visit a friend and, in his travels, winds up getting involved with two women.','/kU1DLrWyJwDVHHhBT5K2Pp826ev.jpg','2002-03-22',116,'Released',NULL,'On the Occasion of Remembering the Turning Gate',53267,2.0241,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17471,_binary '\0','/upmWtaTXSirlLbLGukWemT56kT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313573',7.7,4252,'tr','Selamsız Bandosu','Selamsiz (wich means \'no greeting\') is a small town in Anatolia. The town has a lot of problems but noone from governments come and see the town. One day the mayor learns that the prime minister will come to the city. They, now, have a chance to solve their problems. However, they think that they should have a band to greet the prime minister.','/r00yDAQ5iHAnKmmhJIWko5mVrwn.jpg','1987-09-04',107,'Released',NULL,'Selamsız\'s Band',31176,1.8105,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17472,_binary '\0','/8MO7xk0rUHbTHQjyJlR9icL1bjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313597',2.9,5974,'en','Shark Attack 3: Megalodon','When two researchers discover a colossal shark\'s tooth off the Mexican coast their worst fears surface - the most menacing beast to ever rule the waters is still alive and mercilessly feeding on anything that crosses its path. Now they must hunt the fierce killer and destroy it... before there is no one left to stop it','/5jPTanuMn99GaLSSRVfaEwDVUWM.jpg','2002-11-26',99,'Released','The terror has surfaced...','Shark Attack 3: Megalodon',18015,3.0322,4.7,'VFDKxnJjKnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17473,_binary '\0','/s3Q8PL6P9ZPQFhwHEN7Kt4MFbHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313608',5.3,1579,'en','Simon: An English Legionnaire','Unlikely friends in a melting pot of confusion. Simon Murray fights for the French Foreign Legion. Pascal Dupont fights for himself. War torn men question honour, hope, morality...because you can desert everything...except yourself.','/nb7fYnVnWeTRYNxvKFLDbcRV87f.jpg','2002-04-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Deserter',63971,1.9713,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17474,_binary '\0','/t8wEJ8SYPWQeZs8c0tnNzx3Nv1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313634',6.2,1726,'en','The Scream Team','Eccentric Frank Carlyle ran a horror shop in small-town Steeple Falls, which takes pride in and profit from its Halloween traditions. Frank\'s widower grandson Richard grudgingly returns there from Boston with his own kids, bright Ian and bratty Claire, to settle the inheritance. Ian discovers great-grandpa\'s house is really haunted, and not just, as legend holds, by historic owner Zachariah Kull, who was burned on the stake.','/7yNkp4WVF2gRS5jw0YXU4NWagXM.jpg','2002-10-11',88,'Released',NULL,'The Scream Team',109164,2.557,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17475,_binary '\0','/xpdXXd5i1IN7d4eOhqAreApobxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313670',7.4,15283,'en','Sweet Sixteen','Determined to have a normal family life once his mother gets out of prison, a Scottish teenager from a tough background sets out to raise the money for a home.','/p5h50WEZQ4pRFffnSULqL4cEuLp.jpg','2002-09-07',106,'Released','Life... it\'s about to hit the fan!','Sweet Sixteen',1376,2.6907,7,'WWEpdJ8zcXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17476,_binary '\0','/7OEBVP4ft1ShucNmhcxuVbMltyh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313724',6.3,4384,'sv','Den tredje vågen','Johan Falk hasn\'t been working for over a year since he resigned from the police. Most of all he wants to move out to the countryside, but fate has a different thought.','/qANSnHCJPYfc5lsAybMFlTw36Tn.jpg','2003-10-15',115,'Released',NULL,'The Third Wave',21041,2.1451,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17477,_binary '\0','/owRq5hVmyLv8pNx3Kn1dmE6AQOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313737',6.2,135201,'en','Two Weeks Notice','Dedicated environmental lawyer Lucy Kelson goes to work for billionaire George Wade as part of a deal to preserve a community center. Indecisive and weak-willed George grows dependent on Lucy\'s guidance on everything from legal matters to clothing. Exasperated, Lucy gives notice and picks Harvard graduate June Carter as her replacement. As Lucy\'s time at the firm nears an end, she grows jealous of June and has second thoughts about leaving George.','/r18hSGAcxWiUysbX6nFShIZyjjP.jpg','2002-12-19',101,'Released','Over. Done. Finished. A comedy about love at last glance.','Two Weeks Notice',2642,8.7432,6.365,'_guQ-_EFmHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17478,_binary '\0','/1ZGPaOYfEe4DW2yFQok98TZCm4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313792',6.3,34527,'en','Anything Else','Jerry Falk, an aspiring writer in New York, falls in love at first sight with a free-spirited young woman named Amanda. He has heard the phrase that life is like \"anything else,\" but soon he finds that life with the unpredictable Amanda isn\'t like anything else at all.','/bvyoWDh60R31ZE5L8TjZ8Qpv5xM.jpg','2003-08-27',108,'Released','In any relationship, one person always does the heavy lifting.','Anything Else',10739,4.2952,6.171,'wIAuRc7TrrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17479,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313844',7,1494,'hi','16 December','Indian intelligence agents race against time to stop a renegade Pakistani terrorist from detonating a nuclear weapon in Delhi. White collar crimes that drain the nation of precious foreign exchange is connected to the funding of international terrorism. The much-told Hollywood theme is retold in the Indian context with much needed technical wizadry.','/7sWFJFSIKnqyk0wRSn56uSWpuQM.jpg','2002-03-22',158,'Released',NULL,'16 December',46369,1.0346,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17480,_binary '\0','/5daWhr7xQwpdoRhoXnAOHWj2zhW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0313911',5.2,39709,'en','Agent Cody Banks','Recruited by the U.S. government to be a special agent, nerdy teenager Cody Banks must get closer to cute classmate Natalie in order to learn about an evil plan hatched by her father. But despite the agent persona, Cody struggles with teen angst.','/fhK0mqqirPsckxkNisvi32A4lf6.jpg','2003-03-14',102,'Released','Save the world. Get the girl. Pass math.','Agent Cody Banks',10923,6.1586,5.5,'wZgYSQ5KD_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17481,_binary '\0','/5xFTtFfNxXSFU77vCmzeZBFme3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314006',5.7,1891,'hi','दम','Uday dreams of becoming a police officer and serving his country. His dream is accompanied by a fierce determination and drive to make his dream come true. Even as he courageously treads on his chosen path, he is confronted by the face of evil in the form of a crooked police officer, Shankar. But Uday soon meets with a television employee named Kaveri and once again finds his life upside down.','/ce7IjHHe0raaU4KNFfAkfJ8GjPZ.jpg','2003-01-24',160,'Released','Can you face him?','Dum',69632,1.171,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17482,_binary '\0','/zBNXMNnqnvqu4sMQ6vITXW3wMTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314009',7.1,1499,'pt','Durval Discos','Durval and his mother Carmita live at the back of a record store they own in São Paulo specializing in vinyl records. They lead a boring and unattractive life, until the day Durval hires a maid, Celia, to help his mother with the housekeeping. However, on her second day, Celia goes away leaving a 5-year-old child behind, Kiki, and a note promising to be back in a couple of days. Durval and Celia are charmed by the child at first, but soon they see some sad news about Celia and Kiki on TV that change the whole situation.','/jZR2iMPekRdjAXu4nPHUUfySJSu.jpg','2002-03-27',93,'Released','Everything in life has an A side and a B side','Durval Discos',74901,1.9525,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17483,_binary '\0','/1s9Gz5M2L2YWHkcxhcHwgXFD8c9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314063',5.9,22505,'fr','Immortel (ad vitam)','In the distant future, Earth is occupied by ancient gods and genetically altered humans. When a god is sentenced to death he seeks a new human host and a woman to bear his child.','/ryCZBW1iGlW70LGCswawI26AcBE.jpg','2004-03-13',103,'Released',NULL,'Immortal',5552,4.4854,5.7,'KdtUbFCbp1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17484,_binary '\0','/djVpe9kegBOyoRDtAR45foLLL0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314067',8.4,14815,'ro','Filantropica','In 21st century Bucharest, to go out in the city on Saturday evening on the arm of a beautiful woman is a risky financial investment. Ovidiu, an unassuming high school teacher, never could afford it. Looking for a source of income more substantial than a teacher\'s salary, Ovidiu plunges into a fabulous world – the beggar mob.','/uv5vulLjXeMi5CaSZ6MkYkF8gVS.jpg','2002-03-15',110,'Released','The extended hand that does not tell a story does not receive alms.','Philanthropy',56474,2.0907,7.723,'ri6OgrxBHpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17485,_binary '\0','/yLPLt2wdzcpamI7c0p9mkvINcK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314097',7.4,7969,'en','The Gathering Storm','A love story offering an intimate look inside the marriage of Winston and Clementine Churchill during a particularly troubled, though little-known, moment in their lives.','/7NfDZwBPNxceuynFKXU2VkSsH6D.jpg','2002-04-22',94,'Released',NULL,'The Gathering Storm',36464,2.5491,6.713,'UGfqxmTlm-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17486,_binary '\0','/fDkwRFthToJTJN1rhf9zAAA1fcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314111',6.6,6355,'ja','ゴジラ×メカゴジラ','JSDF pilot Akane has a fateful encounter when a new Godzilla emerges in Tateyama. As a countermeasure, a cyborg named Kiryu is constructed from the remains of the original. The machine is discovered to harbor the restless soul of the original monster as Akane must learn to find value in her own life as well.','/Kg6J3qyf80cwnKkv1YorSjkNaK.jpg','2002-11-02',88,'Released','Startup - Resonance - Smashed Ice.','Godzilla Against MechaGodzilla',12636,3.0051,7.5,'LZKZ4QJAjIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17487,_binary '\0','/gLIDdvf3vmYmZ9RPzEfGUKQqbDO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314121',5.3,3836,'es','La gran aventura de Mortadelo y Filemón','In the Headquarters of the T.I.A. (Terminal Intelligence Agency), someone has stolen Professor Bacterio\'s most dangerous invention, the D.O.T. (Demoralizer of Troops), an artifact that ends up in the hands of a very short, wacky dictator who is ready to use it for criminal purposes. The T.I.A Chief, though, is firm in his resolve: if he wants to get the D.O.T. back, he must NOT count on his agents Mortadelo & Filemon. But when the crime fighting duo discover that the T.I.A. has engaged a cocky and slimy detective from outside the agency, they decide to act at their own risk, even if that risk involves all of Humanity.','/tiP17WpKYLotQwg4EUs0UfmQq24.jpg','2003-02-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Mortadelo & Filemon: The Big Adventure',8980,2.2402,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17488,_binary '\0','/tX2xfDIplLpMteA6AQrSrUvSQho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314134',1.3,1394,'pl','Gulczas, a jak myślisz?','A feature film starring mostly the participants of the first edition of Polish \"Big Brother\" reality show in 2001.','/8z7zGEYS3SUkVAySFJ1TBVxLzY.jpg','2001-12-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Gulczas, what do you think...',144197,1.2928,2.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17489,_binary '\0','/1pEMcogCLU2z9s3Vl10UUKswLLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314166',6,8448,'en','Hey Arnold! The Movie','Arnold and his friends must recover a stolen document in order to prevent the neighborhood from being bulldozed.','/etxcq4qiFNi5p0q71APw8MNzPPT.jpg','2002-06-28',76,'Released','A big problem calls for a big head.','Hey Arnold! The Movie',17710,4.1952,6.5,'COSIdSl9mrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17490,_binary '\0','/pGFR6ueaa4pbzBawC7cpS8WPDC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314197',6.1,3641,'en','Imagining Argentina','Set during the unsettling disappearances in Buenos Aires during the dictatorship of the 1970s, the film involves theater director Carlos Rueda and his wife Cecilia. Shortly after Cecilia writes an editorial commentary questioning the mysterious abductions, she is herself abducted and taken into police custody.','/dq0PSUvzC0ibUVM5ABoZ5ZrJj0v.jpg','2003-09-13',107,'Released',NULL,'Imagining Argentina',34036,3.4233,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17491,_binary '\0','/xUWf5xX0AnZgAnYXAMk03zTbsef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314331',7.5,584382,'en','Love Actually','Eight very different couples deal with their love lives in various loosely interrelated tales all set during a frantic month before Christmas in London.','/7QPeVsr9rcFU9Gl90yg0gTOTpVv.jpg','2003-09-07',135,'Released','Love actually is all around.','Love Actually',508,15.3723,7.097,'PP3g0WzGdQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17492,_binary '\0','/cMkUwVCe6dpQnDqDwn0KwyBB2iv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314353',6.6,137519,'en','Tears of the Sun','Navy SEAL Lieutenant A.K. Waters and his elite squadron of tactical specialists are forced to choose between their duty and their humanity, between following orders by ignoring the conflict that surrounds them, or finding the courage to follow their conscience and protect a group of innocent refugees. When the democratic government of Nigeria collapses and the country is taken over by a ruthless military dictator, Waters, a fiercely loyal and hardened veteran is dispatched on a routine mission to retrieve a Doctors Without Borders physician.','/fUnSSQukwTwBSdCbufEE36petLq.jpg','2003-03-07',121,'Released','He was trained to follow orders. He became a hero by defying them.','Tears of the Sun',9567,15.781,6.901,'DuTlpSfptO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17493,_binary '\0','/xFGx6ovBEArqUzmHHvHICHqTgtS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314390',6.1,1580,'fr','Moi César, 10 ans 1/2, 1,39 m','Cesar is a young schoolboy living in Paris with his family. Their life is ordinary, but Cesar wants more excitement (which he creates, in one instance, by claiming to his teachers that his father has been arrested). During the school holidays, Cesar and his friend Sarah decide to help their mutual friend, Morgan, find his father who supposedly lives in London. Each one tells their parents that they\'re staying with the other two, and together they sneak out to begin their search.','/mEMSJSet752wIVM75u5BewGsTy8.jpg','2003-04-09',91,'Released',NULL,'I, Cesar',60025,1.9377,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17494,_binary '\0','/kZyurQjTMLHalUxs7sHgH5XeiwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314412',7.4,26746,'en','My Life Without Me','A fatally ill mother with only two months to live creates a list of things she wants to do before she dies without telling her family of her illness.','/pFEtVPW88pWflYV84UFL0h1iJr3.jpg','2003-03-07',106,'Released','What you are… is what you leave behind.','My Life Without Me',20,4.3843,6.1,'rxPRhy276ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17495,_binary '\0','/hC3rDydNKC4X3FAbxSEKs8Sb90J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314431',5.4,8503,'en','Hope Springs','British artist Colin Ware discovers that his fiancée, Vera, is going to marry another man. Distraught and despondent, he gets on a plane for America and ends up in the tiny town of Hope in New England. At first, Colin is depressed, but he soon finds more than a shoulder to cry on when his innkeepers introduce him to Mandy, a beautiful nurse. All\'s going well and Colin has almost forgotten his old flame until Vera shows up with a surprise of her own.','/wWRh4buz7yp7CinH7jGVvFkgUdN.jpg','2003-05-09',90,'Released','The problem every man dreams of... a choice.','Hope Springs',21544,3.3751,5.332,'9lfq7yY3vRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17496,_binary '\0','/jGbt2fgERUEBKLyxpH0BiAcn8oV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314498',5.7,27468,'en','The Perfect Score','Six high school seniors decide to break into the Princeton Testing Center so they can steal the answers to their upcoming SAT tests and all get perfect scores.','/xflTliVBvCztaLzTJx9luHnSqwD.jpg','2004-01-30',93,'Released','The S.A.T is hard to take. It\'s even harder to steal.','The Perfect Score',13505,5.0809,5.8,'wUHzFQFHOUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17497,_binary '\0','/1iJaghW7RSqTdULWQoTzhvFDGRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314502',6,3406,'nl','Phileine Zegt Sorry','Gorgeous Dutch youngster Max has two passions, acting and girls. The first becomes his brilliant career, which takes off so well he gets invited to a prestigious New York theatre course for a year. But since he met fickle bitch Phileine in an Utrecht park, his flirting life is cut short while she cruelly plays with his feelings rather then his horny body. After refusing to follow him, she turns up uninvited later and still acts jealous and possessive. Grief follows for everyone, working up to a convoluted finale.','/vyQaRijGA2UtO0m2jVWZ3Rrl1wf.jpg','2003-10-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Phileine Says Sorry',24285,1.626,5.408,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17498,_binary '\0','/yL354LZflDfbsFFuthMnD9wASIi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314519',7.6,1475,'en','Pollyanna','Pollyanna Whittier goes to live with her wealthy but bitter aunt after the tragic death of her father. Pollyanna shares a game her father taught her -- the \'Glad Game\' -- in which everyone can find a silver lining in even the darkest cloud, and her sunny nature, good humor and determination to look on the bright side of life prove to have an astonishing effect on those around her. With the help of her orphaned friend, Jimmy Bean, she casts her spell on the grumpiest townsfolk of Beldingsville -- including the cynical shut-in Mrs. Snow, the morose millionaire Mr. Pendleton and the enigmatic Dr. Chilton. And Pollyanna masterminds the romance between her Aunt\'s maid, Nancy, and the handyman, Tim. It is only Aunt Polly, who cannot bring herself to embrace Pollyanna\'s innocence and joy. But all is not straightforward in Pollyanna\'s war against pessimism, since she must overcome a personal tragedy that threatens to banish \"glad\" from her vocabulary forever.','/ecXl8ajCtAYA6qohT3y50QIvRIV.jpg','2003-01-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Pollyanna',78713,1.5215,8.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17499,_binary '\0','/wsQWCwnPV3HmKUU4LD6CEdlc3OE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314524',6.5,5942,'sv','Populärmusik från Vittula','Matti and Niila, growing up in the mid-sixties in the harsh and conservative environment of a Finnish-speaking part of Tornedalen in Swedish Laponia, close to the Finnish border. Their big dream is to become rock stars. In the present the now grown-up Matti feels guilt for the death of his drug-addicted rock star friend Niila.','/79nUxKn6kPagIOHcOMsev3UxT38.jpg','2004-10-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Popular Music',442,1.9309,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17500,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314589',4.4,1548,'tr','Romantik','The friendship of Gokhan and Omer is challenged when Omer falls in love with beautiful Yasemin. Gokhan frames his best friend Omer for a murder, subsequently Omer must leave the country.','/7iHFGiIL9VMJc0PErmCeUeDapbi.jpg','2007-03-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Romantic',51431,1.3757,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17501,_binary '\0','/rCoJnXXWmEuGVXa3NtL6Cvn1nA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314620',6.1,1742,'nl','De schippers van de Kameleon','Two young boy twins receive a boat of their own by a stroke of luck. It turns out to be very fast and they use their boat to help out their friends.','/kEH4MVGLM0y1Za9U2snpVdOZUjE.jpg','2003-06-25',100,'Released',NULL,'The Skippers of the Cameleon',33021,1.2125,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17502,_binary '\0','/7bHjjd5ZtrhuK4CfpHeOD0d3LVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314630',6.3,3713,'en','The Secret Lives of Dentists','An introspective dentist\'s suspicions about his wife\'s infidelity stresses his mental well being and family life to the breaking point.','/aIUL0GeTgKdOnAq1hly19vjjRQt.jpg','2002-09-09',104,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Lives of Dentists',26195,1.9959,5.7,'m0wKLr_z4lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17503,_binary '\0','/hU74yMO9p7UzVvpfCl7rEqA4XPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314676',5.4,9211,'en','The Singing Detective','Tormented and bedridden by a debilitating disease, a mystery writer relives his detective stories through his imagination and hallucinations.','/bjkLSHpV294HIllRpHKWkNICs3N.jpg','2003-10-24',109,'Released','When it comes to murder, seduction and betrayal, he wrote the book. Now he\'s living it.','The Singing Detective',30141,3.1426,5.1,'wRbWvJqOc24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17504,_binary '\0','/liLlOyBGOVdOcJ7rnLJAvaJJI8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314693',6.7,1836,'es','Soldados de Salamina','Professor Lola Sánchez investigates the truth behind the events experienced by Rafael Sánchez Mazas, one of the founders of the Falange Española party, during the Spanish Civil War.','/sUrSL3dHnbsHWVRVExXgc5pDtlH.jpg','2003-03-21',120,'Released',NULL,'Soldiers of Salamina',38086,1.3738,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17505,_binary '\0','/6LAXVdzVLh26hKmTx6bBRpnPRmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314725',7.8,4057,'en','Standing in the Shadows of Motown','In 1959, Berry Gordy Jr. gathered the best musicians from Detroit\'s thriving jazz and blues scene to begin cutting songs for his new record company. Over a fourteen year period they were the heartbeat on every hit from Motown\'s Detroit era. By the end of their phenomenal run, this unheralded group of musicians had played on more number ones hits than the Beach Boys, the Rolling Stones, Elvis and the Beatles combined - which makes them the greatest hit machine in the history of popular music. They called themselves the Funk Brothers. Forty-one years after they played their first note on a Motown record and three decades since they were all together, the Funk Brothers reunited back in Detroit to play their music and tell their unforgettable story, with the help of archival footage, still photos, narration, interviews, re-creation scenes, 20 Motown master tracks, and twelve new live performances of Motown classics with the Brothers backing up contemporary performers.','/rsOTrPTRhBgw5eWAgJISBMiIg5m.jpg','2002-09-11',116,'Released','The soul behind the sound.','Standing in the Shadows of Motown',30192,1.7055,7,'2tqQBh2Ra_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17506,_binary '\0','/2cT8Q75gYiseEuPOE55n3lmBpRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314786',5.8,18434,'en','The In-Laws','Right before his daughter\'s wedding, a mild-mannered foot doctor discovers that his new in-laws are international smugglers.','/15TNyg00AMSDff6u77AR9JeaEzR.jpg','2003-05-23',98,'Released','He\'s not losing his daughter. He\'s gaining a madman.','The In-Laws',5146,4.5251,5.647,'THq7uQku8ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17507,_binary '\0','/gxit7oTVFNMe0KS61Xqyz14XSAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0314942',5.8,1885,'pl','Zemsta','A winter day at a Polish castle, half owned by a fatalistic notary and half by a volcanic old soldier\'s niece. The old soldier, Cupbearer, and the notary are sworn enemies, which may doom the love between the niece, Klara, and the notary\'s son, Waclaw. On this day, the tongue-tied Cupbearer asks a braggart courtier, Papkin, to sue on his behalf for the hand of the widow Hanna. Papkin succeeds and','/n8Xrdyf1kSt3WfxMGycHhINNuuY.jpg','2002-10-04',100,'Released',NULL,'The Revenge',19721,2.0712,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17508,_binary '\0','/25TagjkrkQnpmziQkuTEzZ5mo4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315110',5.1,5522,'en','Twentynine Palms','A photographer and an unemployed woman embark on a chaotic trip to the California desert for a photo shoot, filled with passionate encounters and frequent fights. Their seemingly empty relationship takes a dark turn when a brutal incident abruptly ends their journey.','/y5JeGg69UPpgwakBeKrA7uaAoaf.jpg','2003-09-17',114,'Released',NULL,'Twentynine Palms',26636,2.0305,5.104,'47d6tbkY8KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17509,_binary '\0','/nWIgyZqKRsrZMx7MRXcTWIfmEeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315152',5.9,1507,'fr','Ah ! Si j\'étais riche','Between Alice, a hospital nurse and Aldo, a shampoo sales representative, things have turned sour of late. Alice blames her husband for lacking ambition and contemplates divorce.One day Aldo wins the ten million euro lotto prize. But, unwilling to share the bonanza, he keeps mum about it, all the more as he finds out Alice has an affair with Gérard, Aldo\'s former friend and ... new boss. However, Aldo, leading a double life, starts spending his money ...','/wK8P91PlbLqXi75AlzaxErd1e8q.jpg','2002-11-27',105,'Released',NULL,'If I Were a Rich Man',18303,2.05,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17510,_binary '\0','/sFXDOVTlKrfBlRHg8q0ZfdY4q2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315297',5.3,25961,'en','Twisted','Recently promoted and transferred to the homicide division, Inspector Jessica Shepard feels pressure to prove herself -- and what better way than by solving San Francisco\'s latest murder? However, as Shepard and her partner, Mike Delmarco, soon discover, the victim shared a romantic connection to her. As more of Shepard\'s ex-lovers turn up dead, her mind starts to become unstable, and she begins to wonder if she could be the very killer she\'s trying to track down.','/nfdfU9tYsEnjlFGoY2HabFMdHLi.jpg','2004-02-27',97,'Released','Every murder has a mark.','Twisted',13572,5.0383,5.569,'sjphe2tlKKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17511,_binary '\0','/odSvWtn22HynOxFEwJuGlR9uUKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315312',5.2,1412,'en','Borderline','Psychiatrist Dr. Lila Colleti is divorcing her husband and is devastated when he wins custody of their two little girls, whom he gets largely because Lila\'s job, being a psychiatrist for the criminally insane at the local prison, is a potentially dangerous one that forces her to keep long, erratic hours. When one of Lila\'s patients, Ed Baikman, is released into a half-way house, he decides under the delusional influence of his psychosis to help her out by murdering her ex-husband and his girlfriend, and then threatening to tell the cops they\'d planned it together when she refuses to become romantically involved with him. Though Lila\'s lover, police detective Macy Kobacek, stands by her loyally, Baikman does such an ingenious job of implicating Lila in the crime that even Macy begins to have his doubts about Lila\'s innocence','/jVe5Uf85ZToJxR5KLaMqH4Dsjpa.jpg','2002-11-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Borderline',69492,1.7954,5.2,'Rpayo0TY4mY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17512,_binary '\0','/m0eJc9CwCy5nowYQdNEaxkHHmj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315327',6.8,475720,'en','Bruce Almighty','Bruce Nolan toils as a \"human interest\" television reporter in Buffalo, NY, but despite his high ratings and the love of his beautiful girlfriend, Bruce remains unfulfilled. At the end of the worst day in his life, he angrily ridicules God — and the Almighty responds, endowing Bruce with all of His divine powers.','/wqkWrOFtYnZSvIMu8Lsmz7WIvKC.jpg','2003-05-23',101,'Released','In Bruce we trust?','Bruce Almighty',310,18.0021,6.727,'0XBxoKumlqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17513,_binary '\0','/ncs4UzuKjrohGPtC1iYisJ2NuYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315459',5.9,1234,'en','Dallas 362','Rusty has been bailed out of bad situations more than once by his understanding but distraught mother, Mary. When Mary starts dating a psychologist, Bob, Rusty connects with the man and begins talking to him about his problems. As Rusty benefits from the therapy sessions, his best friend, Dallas, still very involved in illegal and dangerous activities, takes issue with Rusty going straight and cleaning up his life.','/fQMzFpodUpMoKiueWx5MaOK7Xtb.jpg','2005-05-06',97,'Released','Sometimes the only way home is through hell.','Dallas 362',41183,1.7871,4.9,'AfaTdWc_uzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17514,_binary '\0','/1pRNzOM7OQA29cVayaCheBI4vn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315543',7.5,11766,'da','Elsker dig for evigt','Cecilie and Joachim are about to get married when a freak car accident leaves Joachim disabled, throwing their lives into a spin. The driver of the other car, Marie, and her family don’t get off lightly, either. Her husband Niels works in the hospital where he meets Cecilie and falls madly in love with her.','/hOrV2fCw2kmSiS4ZMGFPfXqr3lt.jpg','2002-09-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Open Hearts',102,3.85,7.112,'JyFbSMfEOhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17515,_binary '\0','/8eFUmmssJsaP4e5nCrFuPFHTSgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315632',5.7,1489,'hi','Road','Arvind Chauhan and Lakhsmi are in love with each other. Lakhsmi\'s dad, a senior police inspector, hates Arvind, and so Arvind and Lakshmi decide to elope','/7tl9yuCM9VxphiPJHgtYQDNd7sK.jpg','2002-09-27',144,'Released','Only Accidents Don\'t Kill','Road',166258,1.1203,5.615,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17516,_binary '\0','/lD6lYulY6js9EAgUufh2ekNnCR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315642',7.1,20941,'hi','वज़ीर','\'Wazir\' is a tale of two unlikely friends, a wheelchair-bound chess grandmaster and a brave ATS officer. Brought together by grief and a strange twist of fate, the two men decide to help each other win the biggest games of their lives. But there\'s a mysterious, dangerous opponent lurking in the shadows, who is all set to checkmate them.','/wo5ASV73rrLr9z22P4nfqwPQPRA.jpg','2016-01-07',103,'Released','This new year make your best move','Wazir',275269,1.5382,6.75,'gdwM7xKOph0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17517,_binary '\0','/5SgrtPH6kBmmHao0PofxpvOYfWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315733',7.6,253620,'en','21 Grams','Paul Rivers, an ailing mathematician lovelessly married to an English émigré; Christina Peck, an upper-middle-class suburban housewife and mother of two girls; and Jack Jordan, a born-again ex-con, are brought together by a terrible accident that changes their lives.','/wZ0l6or5juuVWqDkLEgaghs4f9l.jpg','2003-11-18',124,'Released','How much does life weigh?','21 Grams',470,8.433,7.316,'x_tPi8pYzSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17518,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315775',2.3,3807,'en','Anne B. Real','Anne B. Real is the coming of age story of a young female rapper, who finds her inspiration by reading the Diary of Anne Frank.','/s3uzBvmAvuA8SeeiUOvcEM89WFS.jpg','2003-06-14',91,'Released',NULL,'Anne B. Real',31284,0.9906,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17519,_binary '\0','/3ERk0cT9GIfxv6ULs2XZV3wgvEU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315824',4.9,19379,'en','The Big Bounce','A small-time con artist and a Hawaiian real estate developer\'s mischievous, enterprising mistress team up for a potential $200,000 score.','/l6tzLXXGubnC6TbFgg8acfcvGRO.jpg','2004-01-30',88,'Released','It\'s all in who you trust','The Big Bounce',12634,4.2869,5,'ic-zY4QSbd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17520,_binary '\0','/3FVxe8whMRvxVxDBOeJQ4poz7XU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315850',6.8,2365,'es','El bonaerense','Zapa is a locksmith in a remote and quiet little town, lost somewhere deep in the province of Buenos Aires. After getting involved in a crime, his uncle, a retired policeman, bails him out and gets him a spot to join the Provincial Police as an aspiring officer in the thick urban sprawl of Greater Buenos Aires\' West Zone. Soon he will get involved in a new type of corruption.','/AeLZROGOpgJZS0HP6vuA9hj01Ju.jpg','2002-09-19',105,'Released',NULL,'El bonaerense',83505,1.18,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17521,_binary '\0','/rge3MZKez9ykg97b5ZzrMDbmAMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315870',6.5,1260,'ja','GTO','Great Teacher Onizuka is back, using his unorthodox brand of inspiration and education as a substitute teacher in a depressed small town in Hokkaido.','/765d5TmDGXnd1wbJvhjPSTu7LQC.jpg','1999-12-18',108,'Released',NULL,'GTO: The Movie',36184,3.2192,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17522,_binary '\0','/5f6BvtEnpee3cA0WAkZj65gfP8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315930',6.9,1361,'ko','결혼은, 미친 짓이다','Joon-yeong is a Korean professor of English literature and confirmed bachelor. But when he meets Yeon-hee on a blind date, his days of bachelorhood seem numbered.','/ushno1voiwejyniuZHuYU8wWFa4.jpg','2002-04-26',103,'Released',NULL,'Marriage Is a Crazy Thing',64222,3.1759,6.7,'OU0E5YVCVjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17523,_binary '\0','/jZ9lWWCnV5gBRe29PpzEXNgf8i8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0315983',7.5,76285,'en','House of Sand and Fog','Behrani, an Iranian immigrant buys a California bungalow, thinking he can fix it up, sell it again, and make enough money to send his son to college. However, the house is the legal property of former drug addict Kathy. After losing the house in an unfair legal dispute with the county, she is left with nowhere to go. Wanting her house back, she hires a lawyer and befriends a police officer. Neither Kathy nor Behrani have broken the law, so they find themselves involved in a difficult moral dilemma.','/hLxSOukLfC4j5pNbdE7lqaw8KgL.jpg','2003-12-19',126,'Released','Some dreams can\'t be shared.','House of Sand and Fog',11093,6.2788,7.1,'8Y-0cSERrvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17524,_binary '\0','/dtH4wjqXHvhDKt0Y9t0siRycz6l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316023',6.3,2018,'cn','異度空間','This is the story of Yan, a young woman haunted by fleeting images of what she believes to be dead people. Told that it is all in her mind by her psychologist Jim, Yan still cannot find any other explanations for her visions. Soon, her suspicions are confirmed when Jim begins seeing the same things she does and the two begin to unravel a mystery that leads to a forgotten past','/a4tfRHRqLX8TH50GKK8OcPk2KBx.jpg','2002-03-28',100,'Released','Her Daydreams Become His Nightmare.','Inner Senses',78195,2.0767,5.8,'6GRqK4YAHfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17525,_binary '\0','/tiEFeRZmsnftBWc88mbcEFlF2AJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316062',5.5,1409,'te','జాని','A martial arts coach struggles to earn money through fights in order to save his wife suffering from blood cancer.','/ptRvbdotZP4uhS5hM1jsm3OLFgZ.jpg','2003-04-25',178,'Released',NULL,'Johnny',281954,1.2783,6.556,'Izz6Le4Z1wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17526,_binary '\0','/1YLMExz0J2jIGSnOLLw5v0Yp9eV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316078',8.2,5647,'ta','காதலுக்கு மரியாதை','Jeevanandhan meets Mini in a book shop and their eyes meet leading to sparks of love in their hearts. Mini has a loving mother and three brothers, James, Thomas and Stephen and she is the apple of their eye. Mini is hesitant to reciprocate her love for Jeeva who steadily makes an inroad into her heart, the love affair incensing her family members who give him a thrashing each time he meets her. Jeeva\'s parents are under the impression that their son is pursuing his MBA studies until his father receives an SOS from Jeeva, injured in one such beatings. His father Chandrasekhar is stunned by the developments and Jeeva\'s mother is also shocked. Jeeva refuses to part company with Mini when his father arrives with his henchmen to take him back.','/JWhGtMqWatEdePEcTaTNXLXTzc.jpg','1997-12-18',160,'Released',NULL,'Kadhalukku Mariyaadai',69660,1.5453,6.647,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17527,_binary '\0','/jzmBi5WblXlcraO3zj5fyj7WdvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316187',6.1,1638,'en','LolliLove','A hip, misguided Southern California couple decide to make a difference in the lives of the homeless by giving them lollipops with a cheery slogan on the wrapper.','/7GIE8Td9CG7x6uDnCdd3JDJsQ57.jpg','2004-11-21',64,'Released',NULL,'LolliLove',19719,1.4865,5.9,'794bj7LFrcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17528,_binary '\0','/zI2dRzIeRJtNwUalLTSg5OBmY4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316188',7.2,5956,'en','Raising Victor Vargas','Victor, a Lower East Side teenager, as he deals with his eccentric family, including his strict grandmother, his bratty sister, and a younger brother who completely idolizes him. Along the way he tries to win the affections of Judy, who is very careful and calculating when it comes to how she deals with men.','/cMHMtMBca8VNxjYICc1WHK1Qqe5.jpg','2003-03-28',88,'Released',NULL,'Raising Victor Vargas',25461,1.4893,6.808,'DPaqpjtIDTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17529,_binary '\0','/e65E7jH5bKMSgHJnWLw4ex02Dyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316356',7.4,85460,'en','Open Range','A former gunslinger is forced to take up arms again when he and his cattle crew are threatened by a corrupt lawman.','/1mrNc88NrUEGtMtat4FD7sfpFrW.jpg','2003-08-11',139,'Released','No place to run. No reason to hide.','Open Range',2055,5.6226,7.2,'Rd1tXbsOGxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17530,_binary '\0','/zyWbOvKCdA9V9P5xuUG2eiPYsUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316396',6.8,85764,'en','Peter Pan','In stifling Edwardian London, Wendy Darling mesmerizes her brothers every night with bedtime tales of swordplay, swashbuckling and the fearsome Captain Hook. But the children become the heroes of an even greater story, when Peter Pan flies into their nursery one night and leads them over moonlit rooftops through a galaxy of stars and to the lush jungles of Neverland.','/6QdU3TZZrIvXFzoHOwafZAynFjB.jpg','2003-12-18',113,'Released','All children grow up except one.','Peter Pan',10601,10.1058,7.1,'SyYESEvDNIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17531,_binary '\0','/9KDURu1kvQHjuSGUwdakh5S3QsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316463',7.2,2001,'fr','Québec-Montréal','Quebec-Montreal: 250 km (150 miles) of asphalt, nine thirtysomething travelers, four cars, one destination. The journey becomes an opportunity to share points of view about life and to discuss troubling questions about our existence.','/bNx6QWA8g3z7Iszq907TZNgrOIk.jpg','2002-08-02',104,'Released',NULL,'Quebec-Montreal',61509,0.8817,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17532,_binary '\0','/wDln5edQPFYMeKvakkYCLUXOPRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316465',6.9,49790,'en','Radio','In the racially divided town of Anderson, South Carolina in 1976, football coach Harold Jones spots a mentally disabled African-American young man nicknamed Radio near his practice field and is inspired to befriend him. Soon, Radio is Jones\' loyal assistant, and he becomes a student at T.L. Hanna High School. But things start to sour when Coach Jones begins taking guff from parents and fans who feel that his devotion to Radio is getting in the way of the team\'s quest for a championship.','/uQ6ci4iFHhB6TWB2f4wftR7AEly.jpg','2003-10-24',109,'Released','His courage made them champions.','Radio',13920,6.8524,7.38,'bcfvpJvbYyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17533,_binary '\0','/5iUTkShTXQYJKFDugCreXaQqOtI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316599',6.9,2515,'ja','新・仁義の墓場','A barkeeper saves a yakuza boss\' life and thus makes his way up in the organization. However, his fear of nothing soon causes problems.','/eF25E1OUyISJ4fCwkpUdAG3shgM.jpg','2002-06-22',131,'Released',NULL,'Graveyard of Honor',20646,1.8469,6.3,'LMNVDlEYIDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17534,_binary '\0','/6al048Lat3eLVQOuKtc9h6Tu94d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316654',7.5,808590,'en','Spider-Man 2','Peter Parker is going through a major identity crisis. Burned out from being Spider-Man, he decides to shelve his superhero alter ego, which leaves the city suffering in the wake of carnage left by the evil Doc Ock. In the meantime, Parker still can\'t act on his feelings for Mary Jane Watson, a girl he\'s loved since childhood. A certain anger begins to brew in his best friend Harry Osborn as well...','/aGuvNAaaZuWXYQQ6N2v7DeuP6mB.jpg','2004-06-25',127,'Released','There\'s a hero in all of us.','Spider-Man 2',558,14.5568,7.333,'3jBFwltrxJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17535,_binary '\0','/tX9QP4WciyzzGlXlYFf5a8Q7w6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316732',4.6,48599,'en','Taxi','A mouthy and feisty taxicab driver has hot tips for a green and inept cop set on solving a string of New York City bank robberies committed by a quartet of female Brazilian bank robbers.','/eLDoNLJHZPcavTT1vJqZoGydoWB.jpg','2004-10-06',97,'Released','Take a Ride on the Wild Side.','Taxi',11045,8.1316,5.6,'oCjiNBiEUaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17536,_binary '\0','/j20lYJRd4NH4lb9FZA4XH3AwYMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316768',4.2,6843,'en','Tiptoes','A man is reluctant to tell his fiancee that his parents, uncle and brother are dwarfs.','/m609NhpkIUzAyIWgQYaaPSIsWFO.jpg','2002-12-17',90,'Released','It\'s the little things in life that matter.','Tiptoes',8325,3.3986,3.88,'ukRdEVthmWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17537,_binary '\0','/N4wnCPqeCMbqKskSwrlKWw5rhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316824',6,4829,'en','In Enemy Hands','At the height of Hitler\'s infamous U-boat war, the crew of the U.S.S. Swordfish were heading home after months at sea. They never made it. Now prisoners of war aboard U-boat 429, a small group of American survivors will find their loyalties put to the ultimate test when they\'re forced to join their German captors to fight for their very lives.','/whFBBXjMlVZ8zzUSF0sRotzKWlr.jpg','2004-02-25',94,'Released','Their only way out is the enemy.','In Enemy Hands',23592,4.6023,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17538,_binary '\0','/ggQfbt17mh8BuPVJpwT7ufmHf6p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0316829',7,1680,'ja','海は見ていた','O-Shin is a young brothel worker who, one night, helps a young samurai escape from his pursuers. Against the warnings of her fellow workers, particularly Kikuno and the brothel\'s owner, O-Shin falls in love with the samurai.','/cEmmSvxEg1C2CSJ4qFdo06fyjzG.jpg','2002-07-27',119,'Released',NULL,'The Sea Is Watching',41453,1.6495,5.8,'9MZcNzBGaRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17539,_binary '\0','/wUkBBerMPPOYaM38mSBKI20iP55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317042',5.9,6262,'en','One Point O','Paranoid computer programmer Simon wakes up to find a package in his room one day. Despite attempts at securing his apartment, the packages keep arriving. While cameras watch Simon\'s every move, he struggles to find the answers to the mysterious forces taking over his life.','/hFiozrJZK6a3BTnkmyDMrTjeVNe.jpg','2004-03-16',95,'Released','Are you infected?','One Point O',17110,2.3395,5.755,'rw3V_VnRoaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17540,_binary '\0','/sCCWto7FxFV2tMEdnRvv6aGzQD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317052',6.3,1275,'en','AKA','In 1970s Britain, 18-year old Dean feels hampered by his working-class background and his family. In order to make something of himself, he assumes another identity and manages to enter high society. Uses a unique projection technique that displays three side-by-side frames of nearly simultaneous action, giving the impression of simultaneous events, rather than a multi-camera recording. This innovative \"three-camera\" or triple-image effect was an \"almost innovation\" for the time, offering a novel cinematic experience alongside the film\'s compelling story and strong direction.','/jFC75UlLCy8rWqCQRu0iE1cXjhU.jpg','2002-01-19',123,'Released','Lies are like wishes: tell enough of them... some of them come true.','AKA',43657,1.4334,5.6,'foyEu5VZMhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17541,_binary '\0','/A7DkuH1XcN9DKITdVdpRIwh7aVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317132',6.4,13868,'en','Because of Winn-Dixie','A girl, abandoned by her mother when she was three, moves to a small town in Florida with her father. There, she adopts an orphaned dog she names Winn-Dixie. The bond between the girl and her special companion brings together the people in a small Florida town and heals her own troubled relationship with her father.','/oMUFS7HmIyTeui5xuoIEkPYTWC8.jpg','2005-02-18',106,'Released','Discover what happens when you go looking for a miracle and a miracle comes looking for you.','Because of Winn-Dixie',17880,4.0094,6.5,'FtfWMexIZNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17542,_binary '\0','/7a8FmPDj93Nq6AN633vk4RXBUeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317171',6.9,2868,'th','สุดเสน่หา','In Thailand, an illegal immigrant from Myanmar with a mysterious skin rash, his girlfriend, and her friend visit the doctor\'s before spending the afternoon on individual and collective adventures.','/eVKGlfX57Yz9VTLGYCIdrbnGQvp.jpg','2002-10-08',128,'Released',NULL,'Blissfully Yours',47046,1.5348,6.4,'rQa47f1hsN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17543,_binary '\0','/hNE0LvMfeiX6vS95VcLo9AUA6PR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317198',6,134049,'en','Bridget Jones: The Edge of Reason','Bridget Jones is still dating her new love, barrister Mark Darcy, for a perfect six weeks. However, while on assignment in Thailand with her disreputable ex, Daniel Cleaver, claiming to be reformed, Bridget questions if she has everything she\'s ever dreamed of having.','/zDthRXkGnwFIWI0zWcJyS7h6lUl.jpg','2004-11-10',108,'Released','Big liar. Big lawyer. Big dilemma.','Bridget Jones: The Edge of Reason',9801,8.3901,6.227,'2DFQNPx5sxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17544,_binary '\0','/sOLgkBKf1gjMRc4yXxM5aciXdfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317219',7.3,549165,'en','Cars','Lightning McQueen, a hotshot rookie race car driven to succeed, discovers that life is about the journey, not the finish line, when he finds himself unexpectedly detoured in the sleepy Route 66 town of Radiator Springs. On route across the country to the big Piston Cup Championship in California to compete against two seasoned pros, McQueen gets to know the town\'s offbeat characters.','/2Touk3m5gzsqr1VsvxypdyHY5ci.jpg','2006-06-08',117,'Released','Ahhh... it\'s got that new movie smell.','Cars',920,32.5343,7.056,'XszNWHhpaTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17545,_binary '\0','/69dToUkNmREIekgRVDH6tf1fESY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317226',7.4,1722,'ku','جێھێڵراو لە عێراق','During the war between Iran and Iraq, a group of Iranian Kurd musicians set off on an almost impossible mission. They will try to find Hanareh, a singer with a magic voice who crossed the border and may now be in danger in the Iraqi Kurdistan. As in his previous films, this Kurdish director is again focusing on the oppression of his people.','/mzWqK0U0APFiXKofG1qzl1OEYgW.jpg','2002-10-09',108,'Released',NULL,'Marooned in Iraq',13438,0.941,7,'OfkHCDl3kLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17546,_binary '\0','/Akw1Wh1hgAc0K4Cg4AXovNaNaLC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317234',7.1,2951,'ko','취화선','Jang Seung-eop, also known as \"Chihwaseon,\" drinks and paints all day. Through Mae-hyang, he learns the meaning of fate, sees art beyond even the smallest things, and sets out for the path he seeks.','/3TTzpOZPtEwAjamtcRRCXdn48cZ.jpg','2002-05-10',120,'Released','The Life of Painter Jang Seung-up.','Chihwaseon',18302,2.2854,7.015,'1I5Ca2Tmd8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17547,_binary '\0','/uvitbjFU4JqvMwIkMWHp69bmUzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317248',8.6,881923,'pt','Cidade de Deus','In the poverty-stricken favelas of Rio de Janeiro in the 1970s, two young men choose different paths. Rocket is a budding photographer who documents the increasing drug-related violence of his neighborhood, while José “Zé” Pequeno is an ambitious drug dealer diving into a dangerous life of crime.','/k7eYdWvhYQyRQoU2TB2A2Xu2TfD.jpg','2002-08-30',129,'Released','If you run, the beast catches you; if you stay, the beast eats you.','City of God',598,22.7847,8.4,'dcUOO4Itgmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17548,_binary '\0','/gQ9uxP1hBIJd0dw4jMTCkToQQly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317303',5.7,80328,'en','Daddy Day Care','Two men get laid off and have to become stay-at-home dads when they can\'t find jobs, which inspires them to open their own day-care center.','/uiey5XUKuPicwpIJMf1OpaOd1jL.jpg','2003-05-09',92,'Released','Who\'s your daddy?','Daddy Day Care',10708,7.106,5.921,'hx0_F3I10ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17549,_binary '\0','/nknhG8FNwCtLpeFsIgaC5EsCjhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317640',6.1,5300,'en','The Hebrew Hammer','When a psychotic Santa tries to destroy Chanukah by hypnotizing Jewish children with bootlegged copies of the Christmas classic \"It\'s a Wonderful Life,\" it\'s up to the Hebrew Hammer to save the day. Together with Mohammed, head of the Kwanzaa Liberation Front, the Hammer takes no prisoners in his quest to hunt down the renegade Santa and make the holiday season safe for all.','/HryOo5fCwJ5QUbNqjYAotgoj9c.jpg','2003-12-05',81,'Released','Part man. Part street. 100% Kosher.','The Hebrew Hammer',19187,2.9775,5.5,'V7FD2xIS1yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17550,_binary '\0','/sAiTihJ8bjEqg8nYUIlTQUnVXuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317648',6.7,89172,'en','Hidalgo','Set in 1890, this is the story of a Pony Express courier who travels to Arabia to compete with his horse, Hidalgo, in a dangerous race for a massive contest prize, in an adventure that sends the pair around the world...','/iGzENlBPYJEFWZnye4t3nqWSSp1.jpg','2004-02-04',136,'Released','Unbridled. Unbroken. Unbeaten.','Hidalgo',2023,6.4404,6.913,'jxp9NEdQ4Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17551,_binary '\0','/aNUEHLNsNMprLZt6fjf5nqDq6er.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317676',2.1,40132,'en','House of the Dead','On an island off the coast, a techno rave party attracts a diverse group of college coeds and a Coast Guard officer. Soon, they discover that their X-laced escapades are to be interrupted by zombies and monsters that attack them on the ground, from the air, and in the sea, ruled by an evil entity.','/jmRjnbrcP85xV6LBtsVTM1BVOxM.jpg','2003-04-11',90,'Released','You won\'t last the night.','House of the Dead',11059,6.0264,3.126,'htx3igt0ksk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17552,_binary '\0','/lxwzY9vNwjDgxWKt3zZ6zcU6rEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317705',8,917066,'en','The Incredibles','Bob Parr has given up his superhero days to log in time as an insurance adjuster and raise his three children with his formerly heroic wife in suburbia. But when he receives a mysterious assignment, it\'s time to get back into costume.','/2LqaLgk4Z226KkgPJuiOQ58wvrm.jpg','2004-10-27',115,'Released','Super strength can’t carry a family.','The Incredibles',9806,34.1973,7.729,'-UaGUdNJdRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17553,_binary '\0','/jPH8ROhZMLvP0owQCE1J6it7fN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317740',7,410648,'en','The Italian Job','Charlie Croker pulled off the crime of a lifetime. The one thing that he didn\'t plan on was being double-crossed. Along with a drop-dead gorgeous safecracker, Croker and his team take off to re-steal the loot and end up in a pulse-pounding, pedal-to-the-metal chase that careens up, down, above and below the streets of Los Angeles.','/eSkjK4kctyrWpFhxl35GPvSs6tI.jpg','2003-05-30',110,'Released','Get in. Get out. Get even.','The Italian Job',9654,17.0265,6.8,'YT9VyEbUkCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17554,_binary '\0','/oMu1yt9nCkysiY8R22qWbEiJF1N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317743',6.9,5116,'tr','İtiraf','A man suspects his wife of being unfaithful, but he\'s not prepared for what her confession will do to him.','/2D7za33UtEJzYpHhmmY4kgGd8WV.jpg','2001-12-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Confession',79084,1.2833,6.702,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17555,_binary '\0','/gjRlJf1v7NhFRYdsOmk6mu1tP1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317794',6.7,1290,'fa','کاغذ بی‌خط','Royaa, mother of two children, tries to follow her dream of becoming a writer, while her life and relationship with her shady architect husband Jahaan, gets into some serious drama; which leads to question if everything is really what it seems to be?','/zke3jKv2UvsjBpeuH8Lmnfs8Llt.jpg','2002-02-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Unruled Paper',373624,0.4946,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17556,_binary '\0','/6ooId7ur2K6YJMpyIC1njs2eTGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317842',7.3,2612,'he','כנפיים שבורות','Daphne and her four children try to cope with the abrupt death of husband/father. As the family seems to fall apart, a sudden incident gives them a chance to heal their \'broken wings\'.','/somDluLofBXeIu2y55mlG6Wc5JA.jpg','2002-10-24',87,'Released',NULL,'Broken Wings',49689,0.9881,6.7,'-Dq0bKauUa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17557,_binary '\0','/4xp2igbXfRYa7pWsBfsQQKqRRpE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317887',7,3454,'pt','Madame Satã','In the favelas of Rio de Janeiro of the 1930s, João Francisco dos Santos is several things — son of slaves, ex-convict, thug, homosexual and adopted father for a number of pariahs. João expresses himself on the stage of a cabaret as Madame Satã.','/rgsrsLJXzzmMiTvatmEhXU8fMY2.jpg','2002-10-03',105,'Released','Hustler, dreamer, devil, saint','Madame Satã',46993,2.0226,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17558,_binary '\0','/dFFdQgTtvL2X02xuGpDwn6SqFiL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317910',8,26398,'en','The Fog of War','Using archival footage, cabinet conversation recordings, and an interview of the 85-year-old Robert McNamara, The Fog of War depicts his life, from working as a WWII whiz-kid military officer, to being the Ford Motor Company\'s president, to managing the Vietnam War as defense secretary for presidents Kennedy and Johnson.','/m1dEnkrdJGBSLeAyJepuGrU9sNI.jpg','2003-10-26',107,'Released',NULL,'The Fog of War',12698,3.7863,7.7,'1WMmpqMaQYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17559,_binary '\0','/bYKeB9uUcPmvikjouEEQ86uvPw9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317919',6.9,428849,'en','Mission: Impossible III','Retired from active duty, and training recruits for the Impossible Mission Force, agent Ethan Hunt faces the toughest foe of his career: Owen Davian, an international broker of arms and information, who\'s as cunning as he is ruthless. Davian emerges to threaten Hunt and all that he holds dear – including the woman Hunt loves.','/vKGYCpmQyV9uHybWDzXuII8Los5.jpg','2006-04-25',126,'Released','The mission begins.','Mission: Impossible III',956,20.786,6.766,'4oVva0muTE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17560,_binary '\0','/rydUuATtZiElalX7EtiZQy5gIkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0317965',7,2153,'it','L’ora di religione - Il sorriso di mia madre','A celebrated painter receives a visit from a cardinal\'s assistant, who informs him that his mother could become a saint.','/8u1NKcKcNVhBEUxMeQL4WIggBps.jpg','2002-04-19',105,'Released',NULL,'My Mother\'s Smile',65045,1.749,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17561,_binary '\0','/uBuazTEgvWuRY5kYiJhe0gc9sED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318025',6.8,2874,'zh','任逍遥','Two disaffected, unemployed Chinese youth drift through life on the streets of their industrial town, their paths crossing with that of a local young singer and dancer working for a liquor company as a spokesmodel.','/9koydgKSQLs8MjnGilFmjRlhzXA.jpg','2002-06-06',112,'Released',NULL,'Unknown Pleasures',80243,1.5897,6.6,'J5c4R9i5cRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17562,_binary '\0','/cwVYUZWbZ4abEEE6gDbMbJvHjzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318028',6.6,1309,'fa','رضا موتوری','Reza Motori, who has feigned madness, escapes from an asylum and robs a factory, with the aid of a friend. Afterwards, a young writer, who looks exactly like Reza, visits the asylum in order to write about inmates. There he is mistaken for Reza and detained. Meanwhile, Reza assumes the identity of the writer. Reza falls in love with the writer\'s fiancée and decides to give up the money he has stolen from the factory, but his friends prevent him from doing so.','/zJERyR0mCSNVvRkJfxzfFLQNsAI.jpg','1970-08-04',80,'Released',NULL,'Reza, the Motorcyclist',353178,0.7441,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17563,_binary '\0','/lLQgQy1nX3qocg83BLTCz1911R4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318034',7.2,23197,'ru','Русский ковчег','A ghost and a French marquis wander through the Winter Palace in St Petersburg, encountering scenes from many different periods of its history.','/dkFM8Q7J0wNpEnbtD1AcWumkShj.jpg','2002-05-22',99,'Released','2000 cast members, 3 orchestras, 33 rooms, 300 years, ALL IN ONE TAKE','Russian Ark',16646,2.9798,7.2,'ZV1kphEEXn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17564,_binary '\0','/4Yn8JnFi46VYdVoLxiBfXMMCLG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318040',3.3,1754,'en','Evil Breed: The Legend of Samhain','Two American tourists on a romantic camping trip are brutally murdered. A few days later, during the ancient festival of Samhain, a group of American university students moves into a beautiful cottage, surrounded by a lush forest and a majestic lake They are here to learn about the rituals of the ancient Druids and other Celtic legends. But in the remains of an abandoned copper mine, lives the ancestors of an incestuous clan of cannibals. Stalked by a hulking, disfigured mutant, the students and their chaperone are in for the most harrowing time of their young lives. And keeping their heads on their necks will become their main concern...','/jyvRKU0BduPFOtGwcy3OnxkFTWq.jpg','2003-03-01',78,'Released','Evil roams the woods of Ireland...','Evil Breed: The Legend of Samhain',39923,1.5233,4.8,'uoyFkrG9qII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17565,_binary '\0','/hTwqZ67zVrA1zOsgCeXezPNBtBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318049',6.4,1271,'en','Searching for Debra Winger','Rosanna Arquette talks to various actresses about the pressures they face as women working in the entertainment industry.','/50a7jpkUukf6aypYFiapoOF2lui.jpg','2002-07-13',99,'Released',NULL,'Searching for Debra Winger',142168,1.3799,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17566,_binary '\0','/lK4djTiyTUIdIbutqryXDC8mOxC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318069',7.3,2492,'fa','شطرنج باد','The first lady of a noble house has died and now there is conflict between the remainders for taking over her heritage.','/c91Dtd2bIaKRSvw2xl0TWG4WTNj.jpg','1976-11-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Chess of the Wind',194088,1.5477,7.1,'4bI1t3RfdB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17567,_binary '\0','/cdR9ESJzcocgVphpwO5AYZRwrWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318081',4.3,21890,'en','A Sound of Thunder','When a hunter sent back to the prehistoric era runs off the path he must not leave, he causes a chain reaction that alters history in disastrous ways.','/mdO0UpJEmSZJqauMbNrfzwKlxoR.jpg','2005-05-15',101,'Released','Some rules should never be broken.','A Sound of Thunder',10077,4.9391,4.9,'2UjlbkED_Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17568,_binary '\0','/iZiYzix7sMS0NEWsHURSzHF1wxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318155',5.8,43886,'en','Looney Tunes: Back in Action','Fed up with all the attention going to Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck quits Hollywood, teams up with recently-fired stuntman Damien Drake Jr. and embarks on a round-the-world adventure, along with Bugs and The VP of Warner Bros. Their mission? Find Damien\'s father, and the missing blue diamond... and stay one step ahead of The Acme Corp., who wants the diamond for their own purposes.','/q0kntpdsHA0QdYjpQdNBqrVTdQq.jpg','2003-11-14',92,'Released','How do they solve a mystery when they don\'t have a clue?','Looney Tunes: Back in Action',10715,9.2865,6.383,'Wjvc6VYwe0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17569,_binary '\0','/AorzxxnM7A0LLWJrgOBNF5JEyM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318202',7.8,8781,'fr','Être et avoir','The documentary\'s title translates as \"to be and to have\", the two auxiliary verbs in the French language. It is about a primary school in the commune of Saint-Étienne-sur-Usson, Puy-de-Dôme, France, the population of which is just over 200. The school has one small class of mixed ages (from four to twelve years), with a dedicated teacher, Georges Lopez, who shows patience and respect for the children as we follow their story through a single school year.','/mqB5QPNCmbF8DgsZqmyGQAGktUE.jpg','2002-08-28',104,'Released','An observation of the humanity of young people.','To Be and to Have',5168,1.6578,7.3,'uDcqQuoWnFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17570,_binary '\0','/7pHOjO5v4uQGZ9ggl5RrcRIUJYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318283',5.5,14582,'en','Alex & Emma','Writer Alex Sheldon must finish his novel within a month. If he doesn\'t, he won\'t get paid. And, if that happens, angry Mafia types to whom he owes money will come looking for him. In order to expedite things, Alex hires typist Emma Dinsmore and begins dictating his novel. The book is about a doomed love affair between a character similar to Alex and a character named Polina Delacroix. But, as Alex falls for Emma, his work takes a different turn.','/1CVw4MMqeBdkUs3DfCDWkaP6O3U.jpg','2003-06-20',96,'Released','Is it love... or are they just imagining things?','Alex & Emma',17813,2.766,5.2,'cMEvxaFvxps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17571,_binary '\0','/3obBVWeKVUh2LBtziL7SNR6yxOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318292',6.7,5021,'es','Amar te duele','Family and friends try to sabotage the budding romance between a young upper class girl and a humble student.','/kbtgdKUEnX76MOJ7w30js5vSNLT.jpg','2002-11-08',104,'Released','Who says money isn\'t important?','Love Hurts',51822,3.2394,8.124,'PaCulQK3V7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17572,_binary '\0','/7oVJSFrqARW4jRRimEqEpHKAp1Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318374',6.9,37439,'en','The Cooler','Bernie works at a Las Vegas casino, where he uses his innate ability to bring about misfortune in those around him to jinx gamblers into losing. His imposing boss, Shelly Kaplow, is happy with the arrangement. But Bernie finds unexpected happiness when he begins dating attractive waitress Natalie Belisario.','/gq3cZxo7SS6HAXdaxObLIyw9N1r.jpg','2003-11-26',101,'Released','When your life depends on losing... the last thing you need is lady luck.','The Cooler',10744,3.1102,6.7,'pI0ATkUpOyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17573,_binary '\0','/teMi2HuGuWOmBL599u7dg1xtD1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318411',7.7,30240,'en','The Magdalene Sisters','Three young Irish women struggle to maintain their spirits while they endure dehumanizing abuse as inmates of a Magdalene Sisters Asylum.','/akOnyPsfzcDvCwP3lzY35i2NIha.jpg','2002-08-30',119,'Released','In a place that defied belief their only hope was each other.','The Magdalene Sisters',8094,4.1595,7.5,'vzFMDRSOc00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17574,_binary '\0','/o6Ln9kTC4ZrHZNUhWLOwBfUvqXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318462',7.7,109883,'es','Diarios de motocicleta','Based on the journals of Che Guevara, leader of the Cuban Revolution. In his memoirs, Guevara recounts adventures he and best friend Alberto Granado had while crossing South America by motorcycle in the early 1950s.','/qz2aBYT8CAiJYvX4fRZpJ5G0Oz1.jpg','2004-02-06',126,'Released','Let the world change you...and you can change the world.','The Motorcycle Diaries',1653,4.5309,7.401,'0_LAiSdIXos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17575,_binary '\0','/7jmPLMQyNv746EZED5uMSSFdny9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318523',7.2,2705,'es','Un oso rojo','Bear has never gotten over the separation from his wife and daughter after having been convicted for armed robbery and homicide and sent to prison. Now he is out, to finally get his cut of the money and reunite with his family, or at least avenge the damage done.','/kD8SPTJVhjUvJOvB6Xhe7crkLN4.jpg','2002-05-23',95,'Released',NULL,'A Red Bear',125948,1.1457,7.06,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17576,_binary '\0','/pN7c5advjqyVkB9r9BYaRVCsbsu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318590',6.9,4796,'pt','Cazuza: O Tempo Não Pára','Inspired by the moving book “Só as Mães São Felizes”, by Lucinha Araújo, Cazuza\'s mother, the film covers a little more than 10 years of the singer’s crazy and brief life – from the beginning of his career in the Circo Voador venue, in 1981, to the huge success and the apotheosis of his shows with the Barão Vermelho band, his solo career, his relations with his parents, friends, lovers and passions, and the courage he had to face his final years, with HIV, until his death, in 1990.','/5D3vujJhxAl5Kyvfkr6Hfg7YPpU.jpg','2004-06-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Cazuza: Time Doesn\'t Stop',59474,1.4343,7.078,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17577,_binary '\0','/8W2vSgbzJUaGnC9j3SzDLfOS57C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318605',7,1221,'ta','ராஜாவின் பார்வையிலே','Gowri, a rich man\'s daughter in the village, falls for Raja, an ambitious college going guy with poor family background. When Raja continues to avoid Gowri, she begins to investigate why he is not interested in her.','/esxgYQU2XU08Od57OxdCdQIyQBu.jpg','1995-08-05',135,'Released',NULL,'Rajavin Parvaiyile',78656,1.2107,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17578,_binary '\0','/5PJP3NaiH9ZJRzrEHLeqSY5rNxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318627',6.1,223785,'en','Resident Evil: Apocalypse','As the city is locked down under quarantine, Alice finds out that the people that died from the previous incident at the Umbrella Corporation have turned into zombies. She then joins a small band of elite soldiers, who are enlisted to rescue the missing daughter of the creator of the mutating T-virus. Once lack of luck and resources happen, they begin to wage an exhilarating battle to survive and escape before the Umbrella Corporation erases its experiment from the face of the earth.','/yzNQSLlZb7NAkA4C5uADfNDJ7hm.jpg','2004-09-10',94,'Released','The evil continues...','Resident Evil: Apocalypse',1577,15.7767,6.371,'PkutbYENBis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17579,_binary '\0','/CXQ9wYj4n9MBwy2TQ92YaRygWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318649',6.1,110382,'en','Sahara','Seasoned adventurer and treasure hunter Dirk Pitt, a former Navy SEAL, sets out for the African desert with his wisecracking buddy Al in search of a confederate ironclad battleship rumored to have vanished long ago, the main draw being the treasure supposedly hidden within the lost vessel. When the daring duo come across Dr. Eva Rojas, a beautiful scientist who is juggling an escape from a warlord and a mission to stop the spread of a powerful plague, their desert expedition begins to heat up.','/kyY1onYxkKBDlJsheRsVbMaoQEM.jpg','2005-04-06',124,'Released','Adventure has a new destination.','Sahara',7364,8.846,5.925,'VvA4Tbjk8tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17580,_binary '\0','/7VcJ2EZWAS0gmo8IRGRpur89CxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318725',7,5100,'fr','Stupeur et tremblements','Amélie, a young Belgian woman, having spent her childhood in Japan, decides to return to live there and tries to integrate in the Japanese society. She is determined to be a \"real Japanese\" before her year contract runs out, though it precisely this determination that is incompatable with Japanese humility. Though she is hired for a choice position as a translator at an import/export firm, her inability to understand Japanese cultural norms results in increasingly humiliating demotions. Though Amelie secretly adulates her, her immediate supervisor takes sadistic pleasure in belittling her all along. She finally manages to break Amelie\'s will by making her the bathroom attendant, and is delighted when Amelie tells her the she will not renew her contract. Amelie realizes that she is finally a real Japanese when she enters the company president\'s office \"with fear and trembling,\" which could only be possible because her determination was broken by Miss Fubuki\'s systematic torture.','/42IOjOSnZAfXIKMtfI7alpLEMmX.jpg','2003-03-12',107,'Released',NULL,'Fear and Trembling',31076,1.6271,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17581,_binary '\0','/1OBQNt3V01p3PVvkGbK5RB8UWpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318742',6.6,1948,'en','Ten Minutes Older: The Cello','Collection of short films the summaries of which include; a foreign man moving to Italy, getting married and having a child; a four split scene short involving plot-less images of old people with television sets for heads, a beautiful woman having sex, and overall confusion; and an old man reminiscing over his youth.','/eOdg45o54m4n0pTqbGCgTHhCu0F.jpg','2002-09-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Ten Minutes Older: The Cello',79591,1.9845,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17582,_binary '\0','/uTh7Uyy5sdGmcl2AgqJoHlxP3PE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318761',6.5,22620,'en','Thumbsucker','Justin Cobb, a teenager in suburban Oregon, copes with his thumb-sucking problem, romance, and his diagnosis with ADHD and subsequent experience using Ritalin.','/fBLjXNRkH0KuC5JEnGBUZx3SQw3.jpg','2005-09-16',96,'Released','He\'s not O.K. they\'re not O.K. and that\'s O.K.','Thumbsucker',1546,3.3622,6.188,'MqRXF4gfC7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17583,_binary '\0','/z7nc41k7XyfGa2zhOOlfyXeMX4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318819',6.6,1595,'ja','WXIII 機動警察パトレイバー','Set in the year 2000, when the level of Labor accidents begin to escalate around Tokyo Bay, police detectives Kusumi and Hata are assigned to investigate. What they discover leads to a series of government cover-ups, conspiracy concerning a new biological weapon entitled WXIII-Wasted Thirteen and a tragic, personal connection to Hata. The only hope to stop this threat is to cooperate with the military and lead WXIII into a showdown with the Labors of Special Vehicle Division 2.','/zgitZmF0cejES0dyuS7ZGvJ8NEQ.jpg','2002-03-30',107,'Released','Stillborn terror strikes from Tokyo Bay.','Patlabor WXIII the Movie',16402,2.4902,6.6,'jKEFcQgHLlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17584,_binary '\0','/jHaBtSr3g1RaHeyK4v3sFRmXh2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318850',5.4,1466,'en','Young Black Stallion','When courageous young Neera becomes separated from her family in the desert, she chances upon a wild colt. Together they find friendship, trust, and their way back home only to discover her family is about to lose everything!','/6QRfEgONo5MYgDEDTipIcetnHsO.jpg','2003-12-25',49,'Released','The greatest story of friendship ever told.','Young Black Stallion',42418,2.7645,6.6,'mYs9nBLFT5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17585,_binary '\0','/fy8E5sF1Phf5aihA3nxx4Qqxotl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0318974',6.1,23839,'en','The Alamo','Based on the 1836 standoff between a group of Texan and Tejano men, led by Davy Crockett and Jim Bowie, and Mexican dictator Santa Anna\'s forces at the Alamo in San Antonio, Texas.','/weHQHadXJLrmIvBXwZJsMgfJ6jJ.jpg','2004-04-07',137,'Released','You will never forget','The Alamo',10733,6.4349,5.8,'u9T5HMtr0WA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17586,_binary '\0','/vRxA3p4YRZFuRdSjC2MPYiIhLtq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319020',6.3,10269,'hi','आवारा पागल दीवाना','A dentist and a henpecked husband finds his life in trouble after getting embroiled in a mafia rivalry.','/yrNFzWj68qBC0zcf1HvX6sqeSoV.jpg','2002-06-21',169,'Released','Bollywood\'s answer to The Whole Nine Yards','Awara Paagal Deewana',115124,1.4891,5.661,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17587,_binary '\0','/bLqUd0tBvKezDr9MEla7k34i3rp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319061',7.9,480094,'en','Big Fish','Throughout his life Edward Bloom has always been a man of big appetites, enormous passions and tall tales. In his later years, he remains a huge mystery to his son, William. Now, to get to know the real man, Will begins piecing together a true picture of his father from flashbacks of his amazing adventures.','/tjK063yCgaBAluVU72rZ6PKPH2l.jpg','2003-12-10',125,'Released','An adventure as big as life itself.','Big Fish',587,11.9017,7.745,'T6M-jwyz28U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17588,_binary '\0','/vVwUs3YvUUNeG3bx4sTBA9aKTu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319147',6.5,1293,'it','Casomai','Tommaso meets Stefania. They like each other, they fall in love, they get married. A child is also born. It all started very well, it evolved well, then discreetly, little by little until the crisis. It seemed impossible, yet the love, which seemed really solid, perhaps fell apart, even turning into hatred. Who knows if there is still time to do so. Volo, ex Jena, tries to be a real actor. An appeal test is required.','/rw1WtV9GczDfybyoCAlf859S95F.jpg','2002-04-30',114,'Released',NULL,'Casomai',62545,0.9756,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17589,_binary '\0','/smqQ71MIn1DSdSiQzCzCOV6rgRq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319262',6.5,517594,'en','The Day After Tomorrow','After paleoclimatologist Jack Hall is largely ignored by UN officials when presenting his environmental concerns about the beginning of a new Ice Age, his research proves true when a superstorm develops, setting off catastrophic natural disasters throughout the world. Trying to get to his son, Sam, who is trapped in New York City with his friend Laura and others, Jack and his crew must travel to get to Sam before it\'s too late.','/Wr4HeYQRvwVCxzOV5TmGE7UkXq.jpg','2004-05-26',124,'Released','Where will you be?','The Day After Tomorrow',435,15.4155,6.567,'HUBDFoMNXzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17590,_binary '\0','/vpSdMAP1GfAwDStBA4hwOIw4aZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319337',7.6,1564,'ml','ഈ പറക്കും തളിക','Unnikrishnan owns an old bus, received as a compensation for his father\'s road accident and he is facing lots of consequences due to the pathetic condition of the bus. The plot took a turn when a girl named Basanthi entered the bus as a nomad','/dZzM4eaB60Ogz31NqomsHEdar45.jpg','2001-07-03',138,'Released',NULL,'Ee Parakkum Thalika',194083,1.1496,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17591,_binary '\0','/5nhp41gx49vXjwXuDXJwQrRFsng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319343',7.1,349343,'en','Elf','When young Buddy falls into Santa\'s gift sack on Christmas Eve, he\'s transported back to the North Pole and raised as a toy-making elf by Santa\'s helpers. But as he grows into adulthood, he can\'t shake the nagging feeling that he doesn\'t belong. Buddy vows to visit Manhattan and find his real dad, a workaholic.','/oOleziEempUPu96jkGs0Pj6tKxj.jpg','2003-11-07',97,'Released','Discover your inner elf.','Elf',10719,11.2161,6.669,'14o38xfHlXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17592,_binary '\0','/a6CpPBYPveFXGCamFuoWGPIdHYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319470',6.3,1461,'en','The Guys','The story of a fire captain who lost eight men in the collapse of the World Trade Center and the editor who helps him prepare the eulogies he must deliver.','/hqfMkCb2EuwkZSbM6pJ1szAizye.jpg','2002-09-11',84,'Released','How do you find the words?','The Guys',65684,1.5257,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17593,_binary '\0','/38SJ5HR1EyvpbTWLRxmPrY469UU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319524',5.6,10203,'en','How to Deal','For teenager Halley, love seems like an alien concept. Her mother is divorcing her father, who is dating a younger woman Halley can\'t stand. Her sister is about to get married and doesn\'t realize that her fiancé is not the man of her dreams. And her best friend has fallen madly in love for the first time, leaving Halley to feel even more alone. But, when she meets edgy Macon, she learns what love is really all about.','/pD87iTm4MP7JNcxIUssAbpri8nF.jpg','2003-07-18',99,'Released','Rule #1: There are no rules.','How to Deal',17403,2.6806,5.5,'Ry69copJjT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17594,_binary '\0','/ayTQ3hMnyv4yawGMSVwfBy5teg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319531',5.8,9466,'en','I\'ll Sleep When I\'m Dead','Will Graham is a former London crime boss who has left his former life to live as a recluse in the forest. Haunted by the blood of those he has murdered, Will wishes never to return. But when his brother commits suicide following a sexual assault at the hands of a volatile car dealer, Will returns to London to discover the cause of his brother\'s death and administer justice to those responsible.','/azbXPYe22TpcxNOkLZNjtN84olR.jpg','2003-05-14',97,'Released','From the ultimate crime of power comes the ultimate act of revenge.','I\'ll Sleep When I\'m Dead',3515,3.1162,5.5,'4M_4KcbAp_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17595,_binary '\0','/mmuWx4t5LI847W0SVo1uoKwthrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319557',7.5,3395,'te','ఇంద్ర','A man embarks on a quest to make peace between two families fighting over the water problem in their district. In a bid to solve this crisis, he agrees to marry a girl from the rival family.','/pP5yRV7vs1NHFAWULv6ZldnA6Pq.jpg','2002-07-24',179,'Released','Born for the people.','Indra',25882,1.2515,6.605,'BcJ7k31Lldw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17596,_binary '\0','/9HDkF65P2hU85eyX6khu5vAuMwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319685',6.6,1314,'fa','خانه ای روی آب','Director Bahman Farmanara\'s second film following a 20-year exile from his native Iran depicts the spiritual crisis of a middle-aged man. In the film\'s dreamlike opening scene, Dr. Reza Sepidbakht (Reza Kianian), a well-off Tehran gynecologist, thinks he runs over an angel while driving home at night with a call girl. The next morning at the hospital where he works, he is shown a comatose boy who is famous for having memorized the entire Koran. These two events cause him to rethink his cynical outlook on life and his relationships with his elderly father, wayward son, and the women he has mistreated since becoming estranged from his wife. When the boy awakens from his coma, Dr. Sepidbakht begins to look to him for answers.','/iPvchpU9wt1xJHPFDU39FhsiiVR.jpg','2002-04-01',111,'Released','The midlife crisis of a successful professional man is put into the perspective of eternity','A House Built on Water',257608,0.5941,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17597,_binary '\0','/ovNKuovFtAGMPRQV98KCQwI5kM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319728',5.5,4233,'en','The Last Horror Movie','A serial killer uses a horror video rental to lure his next victim. What begins as a teen slasher transforms into a disturbing journey through the mind of Max Parry, a mild mannered wedding photographer with a taste for human flesh.','/aqVkfkNcoxXVlECQojU7W3zG6R4.jpg','2004-06-25',76,'Released','Wait until you see the final cut...','The Last Horror Movie',25033,1.7969,5.5,'llpcBnUOQhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17598,_binary '\0','/pJ3m234HaUOCRlcOSM9BhfNKrEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319736',8.2,18537,'hi','द लीज़ेंड ऑफ़ भगत सिंह','Born in British India, Bhagat Singh witnesses numerous atrocities during his childhood and grows up to become one of the most fearless freedom fighters in the country.','/pOd8woHbZUDn9HheKTkSQHFNTZ2.jpg','2002-06-07',155,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Bhagat Singh',31525,1.6768,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17599,_binary '\0','/li27iYcGbSp89YTlVRmwujteykw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319754',6.9,2549,'en','The Lion in Winter','Christmas 1183, Angevin Empire: King Henry II plans to announce his successor to the throne. Jockeying for the crown, though, is complex. Henry has three sons and wants his boy Prince John to take over. Henry\'s wife, Queen Eleanor, believes their son Prince Richard should be king. As family and various schemers gather for the holiday, each tries to make the indecisive king choose their option.','/f6yEfCBBMNp6jdny9AD4ZTG9tgi.jpg','2003-12-26',167,'Released','All of Britain and half of France were his kingdom. But there was one thing Henry II would never control . . . His Family.','The Lion in Winter',37945,2.5344,5.9,'WH8TrFQn5QY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17600,_binary '\0','/gbVjmYtMZLIiq22SWtW7heRBPE4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319758',7.2,5047,'en','Live from Baghdad','A group of CNN reporters venture to the Iraqi capital to cover the Gulf War.','/dN5KeWVYJBqNJtscttaqHvLWmtZ.jpg','2002-12-07',108,'Released','No story is worth dying for. But this was the story of a lifetime.','Live from Baghdad',28730,3.1807,6.7,'h1LrX9IgH78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17601,_binary '\0','/epTYWHgVYkDCMJnEMthaASNk1Hl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319769',7.5,16560,'es','Los lunes al sol','After the closure of their shipyard in Northern Spain, a few former workers: Santa, José, Lino, Amador, Sergei and Reina keep in touch. They meet mainly at a bar owned by their former colleague Rico. Santa is the most superficially confident and unofficial leader of the group. A court case hangs over him relating to a shipyard lamp he smashed during a protest against the closure. José is bitter that his wife, Ana, is employed when he is not.','/4BlI5weSiYUU1YnjqdaPLnOzc3Z.jpg','2002-09-27',113,'Released','This film is not based on a real story. It is based on thousands.','Mondays in the Sun',54580,3.0876,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17602,_binary '\0','/9zoo6uzFiewyzQxW9SXcE1ErM23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319829',5.3,5273,'en','Masked and Anonymous','A nation wracked with civil war and social unrest anticipates a giant charity concert, organized by deceptive promoter Uncle Sweetheart, who plans on raking in huge sums for himself from the event. Headlining is legendary musician Jack Fate, whose prison time is cut short with Sweetheart\'s help. Meanwhile, journalist Tom Friend investigates the corrupt concert and sets out to unmask the truth to the public.','/zKxB2Ivm1717Hbnuvvy2lONC4R1.jpg','2003-07-25',112,'Released','Would you reach out your hand to save a drowning man if you thought he might pull you in?','Masked and Anonymous',24356,2.7749,5.2,'jZM-yS5uCCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17603,_binary '\0','/eDhODQqXkYVDBbn4x2JaVBHcms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319836',8.3,4426,'bn','মাটির ময়না','A family must come to grips with its culture, its faith, and the brutal political changes entering its small-town world.','/lpuRN4Gh2jiKhwZeHEsKjgoHZ83.jpg','2002-11-08',98,'Released',NULL,'The Clay Bird',72958,1.0291,7.397,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17604,_binary '\0','/yth0fWe2f8PxP9r0rjpFaYm1Q55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319901',6.7,1517,'cn','我左眼見到鬼','A car accident gives a spoiled, troubled young woman the ability to see ghosts, including one of a former classmate.','/hqg4I0EXEd1cb2SGngyZ8e6vaTk.jpg','2002-07-13',97,'Released',NULL,'My Left Eye Sees Ghosts',45397,2.1484,6.3,'iKXL0fAf1M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17605,_binary '\0','/feGtCFDPjDSS7CJW8aTWFjoqVnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319917',6.9,1685,'es','Planta 4ª','Three friends in wheelchairs welcome a new patient at a children\'s hospital. Growing up together. All emotions pass the revue. Friendship and hope survive all.','/5vsQpIDyyMYmUXemOxhmfPLgXIf.jpg','2003-10-31',100,'Released',NULL,'The 4th Floor',40432,1.6156,6.6,'NEL0xidOiA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17606,_binary '\0','/8z5qtVE2N3AuA3bmvIQsI10Wjg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0319970',5.4,12840,'en','Carrie','An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl\'s lonely life is dominated by relentless bullying at school and an oppressive religious fanatic mother at home. When her tormentors pull a humiliating prank at the senior prom, she unleashes a horrifying chaos on everyone, leaving nothing but destruction in her wake.','/knjeEeeyIwDkUtZwDfJOcUIuNdB.jpg','2002-11-04',132,'Released','If only they knew she had the power.','Carrie',7342,4.5367,6.151,'HV1MidLk3nI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17607,_binary '\0','/asUFlz7i668CzNhILo8YWFYKGmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320042',7.1,3965,'es','Kamchatka','In 1976, Argentina fell into the hands of a de facto government. Thousands of citizens are persecuted and kidnapped. This is the case of the parents of two children, who, knowing they are wanted, decide to hide.','/raielLvbmZw1SUTOWHVNciXcDHU.jpg','2002-10-17',106,'Released','Growing up is nothing more than discovering a couple of secrets.','Kamchatka',28710,2.0384,6.7,'JkAWI_fS7Pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17608,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320097',4.2,1755,'hi','हम किसी से कम नहीं','When Munna Bhai, a notorious gangster, meets Komal, he is immediately smitten. However, he must first confront her protective brother, Dr. Rastogi and her current boyfriend, Raja.','/nWbFdohCOPStWe5wZIyfgCldqTX.jpg','2002-05-31',161,'Released',NULL,'Hum Kisi Se Kum Nahin',97437,1.6346,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17609,_binary '\0','/zUnF9O3Wy8XVtz9GXgouA4k8Gu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320193',7.8,11901,'ko','오아시스','A young man released from prison visits the widow of the man he killed drunk-driving and becomes infatuated with his cerebral palsy-stricken daughter.','/aaajiBpeBVbVwovpSQKaMfKRGKw.jpg','2002-08-09',132,'Released','Love knows.','Oasis',26955,2.815,7.7,'QzGMhla2-G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17610,_binary '\0','/mjaIGkS65pv7siMlRdlRhexNDry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320194',7.4,2961,'ro','Occident','Three overlapping stories take place over the course of a week in Bucharest, with characters whose life paths intersect and overlap; often independently of their intentions to emmigrate from Romania, or to stay behind.','/uMX12UGM8PlOEe7DECWJpJPCsic.jpg','2002-05-23',106,'Released',NULL,'Occident',38907,0.9857,6.83,'rU2iJgtztEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17611,_binary '\0','/c0tjgU8rq9ZsveoCvlqOnJQ5Aji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320244',6.2,18424,'en','Party Monster','The New York club scene of the 80s and 90s was a world like no other. Into this candy-colored, mirror ball playground stepped Michael Alig, a wannabe from nowhere special. Under the watchful eye of veteran club kid James St. James, Alig quickly rose to the top... and there was no place to go but down.','/4DVWGtV1OA3W8kZxiimdNsepS6O.jpg','2003-09-05',98,'Released','Till death do they party.','Party Monster',1415,3.8092,5.801,'qV7MND4r0mY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17612,_binary '\0','/ag92sqEVTBRgjcGvJvROJZgUmYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320421',7.9,1232,'ta','சத்யா','Sathya, a jobless youth who does not like injustice becomes a puppet in the hands of a corrupt politician, and unknowingly helps him in his malicious endeavors.','/cDwU6KmVzX9HYcjHT7tSZWW72KA.jpg','1988-01-28',147,'Released',NULL,'Sathya',66369,0.955,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17613,_binary '\0','/5TzPlKBjQNCkli0SZRtwkV8LNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320512',7.6,2657,'en','The Smashing Machine','An unflinching look at the life and story of Mark Kerr between 1999 and 2001, an intelligent, articulate, and emotionally vulnerable athlete, considered by many at the time to be the most dominant ultimate fighter in the world. A former Olympic wrestler, Kerr easily dominated all his opponents, earning him the nickname \"The Smashing Machine.\" With the promise of big money and the euphoria of his early victories, Kerr must battle his injuries and inner fears. The shock of these fights takes a heavy toll on his body and mind, and Kerr attempts to overcome these physical and psychological traumas by turning to painkillers. Kerr\'s addiction is shown in its raw form, with the camera capturing him desperately soliciting drugs from friends and staff, and injecting painkillers into his veins. His shocking defeat to Fujita in Japan shows us a story that is sometimes difficult and heartbreaking to watch.','/xfR7bDx7vh7HqRuZmnaRyMWju87.jpg','2002-05-01',93,'Released','The Life and Times of Extreme Cage Fighter Mark Kerr','The Smashing Machine',35997,1.2091,7.1,'-7DO5c7gWNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17614,_binary '\0','/8itHQecANtOevcCdr3AhVxFCYkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320661',7.3,361404,'en','Kingdom of Heaven','After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.','/rNaBe4TwbMef71sgscqabpGKsxh.jpg','2005-05-03',144,'Released','Be without fear in the face of your enemies. Safeguard the helpless, and do no wrong','Kingdom of Heaven',1495,42.5048,7.091,'6Z2wGCZ2fSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17615,_binary '\0','/zsgdVbuEwqZbnUN9qLGEMBYf2Zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320691',7,303323,'en','Underworld','Vampires and werewolves have waged a nocturnal war against each other for centuries. But all bets are off when a female vampire warrior named Selene, who\'s famous for her strength and werewolf-hunting prowess, becomes smitten with a peace-loving male werewolf, Michael, who wants to end the war.','/zsnQ41UZ3jo1wEeemF0eA9cAIU0.jpg','2003-09-19',122,'Released','An immortal battle for supremacy.','Underworld',277,11.6683,6.861,'gvzQGXGFD14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17616,_binary '\0','/16N7unZ9vkIp54p1E2Qmp1lpIow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0320736',7.3,1284,'ta','விக்ரம்','Vikram, a cop who is mourning the death of his wife, is assigned to retrieve a missile. He is aided by a highly educated engineer Preethi, who holds the knowledge to disarm the weapon, in his mission.','/zMgY2Cbu6KZBNOh3QSm5yY2hkgA.jpg','1986-05-29',138,'Released',NULL,'Vikram',66373,1.7738,6.115,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17617,_binary '\0','/cxpVJ2NJLYWgbsPdHkImdmIJCI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321359',6.5,2287,'en','Return to the Batcave: The Misadventures of Adam and Burt','Adam West and Burt Ward are taken on a crazy adventure when the Batmobile is stolen from a car museum and they must track down the thief and return it. After solving a puzzle, they realize that the clues to finding the fiend who stole the Batmobile are hidden in their past. During the search, they flashback to their three seasons in tights, including their many sexual escapades.','/9jWkvwp9DNpUGAi57MiRwp3iYLJ.jpg','2003-03-09',90,'Released','Holy reunion, Batman!','Return to the Batcave: The Misadventures of Adam and Burt',20776,2.5768,5.8,'Jb9bw0SU2rU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17618,_binary '\0','/6s8imh2tD2DcYnLxtJSZ926LhMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321440',6.1,1247,'fr','Bienvenue chez les Rozes','Two ex-convicts, MG and Gilbert find refuge in a charming middle-class house whose couple is about to celebrate its 20-year old marriage. Our duo has no other solution than to take this entire brood in hostage. But, contrary to all expectations, they are warmly greeted by the occupants who don\'t think twice before helping them, they are even ready to put their guests off, even to kill them if necessary...','/pigSG3zhAXxc3CUdQByx4wFcjkB.jpg','2003-04-02',90,'Released',NULL,'At Home with the Rozes',44710,1.8074,5.464,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17619,_binary '\0','/mr5qKupb4zE96rh0oNeM56WNw1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321442',6,4708,'en','The Big Empty','Struggling actor John Person agrees to drive a blue suitcase from Los Angeles to the small town of Baker, Calif., and hand it over to a mysterious cowboy in return for having his credit card debt of $27,000 paid off. Upon his arrival, John can\'t find the cowboy but receives an ominously head-shaped package he\'s supposed to hang onto. While waiting, John gets close to Ruthie, whose psychotic boyfriend, Randy, keeps threatening to kill him.','/d6q6Sy1HoeBiRPuVNXIDYLz30Wa.jpg','2003-05-16',95,'Released','Cowboys. Aliens. Blue suitcases and bowling balls. Strange things are happening out in the middle of nowhere.','The Big Empty',14892,4.2289,6.1,'JlPJNlW4PT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17620,_binary '\0','/wD7pJC0ZpGAzBSczXnf3dHuexLq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321715',7.8,2924,'fr','La Classe américaine','George Abitbol, the classiest man in the world, dies tragically during a cruise. The director of an American newspaper, wondering about the meaning of these intriguing final words, asks his three best investigators, Dave, Peter and Steven, to solve the mystery. (Sixteen French actors dub scenes from various Warner Bros. films to create a parody of Citizen Kane, 1941.)','/iQKZwYLsaJIATKeS5t4yVoKzMxV.jpg','1993-12-31',72,'Released','Attention! This flim is not a flim about cyclign.','La Classe américaine',16130,1.9871,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17621,_binary '\0','/3v9I1MzEWXjkwvRdjhQc38iPOQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321781',6.9,1598,'xx','Cremaster 3','CREMASTER 3 is set in New York City and narrates the construction of the Chrysler Building, which is in itself a character - host to inner, antagonistic forces at play for access to the process of (spiritual) transcendence. These factions find form in the struggle between Hiram Abiff or the Architect...','/Aa4k3iHCFT0iwVENcfe3M3QAlen.jpg','2002-05-15',182,'Released',NULL,'Cremaster 3',23986,1.2321,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17622,_binary '\0','/s0Qj1L8l2A1GwhF1o5KAakrwSRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0321997',4.1,2603,'en','Detention','A heroic high school teacher leads a band of students trapped in school by violent drug-runners.','/75lub4L2d052VgLZVoB5AJ4jMYl.jpg','2003-07-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Detention',95140,3.407,4.4,'VaiIN7b0eGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17623,_binary '\0','/qLLRXmqTYIoZDbT8x247qG7B1JT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322008',5,2477,'en','Terminal Invasion','Aliens in human disguise commandeer a rural airport during a snowstorm. To survive, the people trapped inside must determine which of their own is not of this Earth.','/xxJByxfFFSqAsWQeTPL6e0UduB0.jpg','2002-09-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Terminal Invasion',40217,1.4476,4.7,'cqGInT0CieU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17624,_binary '\0','/btXfAsrIcNkoU9VmVHjpD1LefBb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322023',6.4,2273,'en','Die, Mommie, Die!','Angela Arden is a washed up, has-been singing star who is trapped in a hateful marriage to film producer Sol Sussman. In an attempt to escape her marriage so that she can be with a hunky layabout, she poisons her husband. However, Angela\'s manipulative daughter, gay son and alcoholic maid are not going to make it easy for her.','/shWps7YrqBPujesJQrIoHnhGhZh.jpg','2003-10-31',90,'Released','Hollywood... It\'s a dirty town but someone has to do it!','Die, Mommie, Die!',43708,1.8327,6.6,'zVhhMVvdHuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17625,_binary '\0','/rbFvIeRROVIW3pXlmd1PbcP14lU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322120',5.5,2019,'pl','E=mc²','The film tells about mainly three people - Max, a bored, smart, poor University Professor of Philosophy; Ramzes, a mafia leader, cool, strong, merciless bully and Stella, Ramzes girlfriend.','/cY3Jv6as4IQjdQdybvDz9YHw3BT.jpg','2002-08-23',93,'Released',NULL,'E=mc²',14224,1.2923,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17626,_binary '\0','/5EhqgzEyFK3gPR1Hztn1adVXPVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322132',7.1,1367,'ar','اضحك الصورة تطلع حلوة','Photographer Sayed Gharib leaves his hometown and moves Cairo to be close to the Faculty of Medicine that his daughter Tahani attends. Tahani clashes with the aristocratic society around her as love blossoms between her and the son of a famous businessman','/j90RQDQbb4g2v92KzcXKZTVtPYo.jpg','1998-11-24',114,'Released',NULL,'Smile, The Photo Comes Out Better',452461,0.838,7.4,'1NmCZYvvx10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17627,_binary '\0','/90ooE5SbUEO0OVJHewNO7pgySb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322259',6,330163,'en','2 Fast 2 Furious','It\'s a major double-cross when former police officer Brian O\'Conner teams up with his ex-con buddy Roman Pearce to transport a shipment of \"dirty\" money for shady Miami-based import-export dealer Carter Verone. But the guys are actually working with undercover agent Monica Fuentes to bring Verone down.','/6nDZExrDKIXvSAghsFKVFRVJuSf.jpg','2003-06-05',108,'Released','How fast do you like it?','2 Fast 2 Furious',584,3.7717,6.522,'fDooSsgINLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17628,_binary '\0','/osPfgq5zKWZrkXxb6rMvWzwyt8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322289',6.4,3878,'fr','La Fleur du mal','Three generations of a wealthy Bordeaux family are caught in the crossfire when Anne decides to run for mayor, thanks to a political pamphlet that revives an old murder scandal.','/kbOV3t9rQMkLaARTkb4DumTdJdw.jpg','2003-02-09',104,'Released',NULL,'The Flower of Evil',10930,2.5934,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17629,_binary '\0','/f2x1uVCQwAP0Ta2Wb0jdP2LUTAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322298',6.7,1619,'es','El fondo del mar','An architect trails a man who was hiding under his girlfriend\'s bed.','/1x1cPyLiaUW1LB2IgLNTu8TBTsb.jpg','2003-08-26',92,'Released',NULL,'The Bottom of the Sea',244145,1.526,7,'cV5_dvlCZ84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17630,_binary '\0','/cTGeY2fdf0eLubvEFZAGcr2PfLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322330',6.4,179777,'en','Freaky Friday','Mother and daughter bicker over everything -- what Anna wears, whom she likes and what she wants to do when she\'s older. In turn, Anna detests Tess\'s fiancé. When a magical fortune cookie switches their personalities, they each get a peek at how the other person feels, thinks and lives.','/y6kn3tUb4qrNZvV4TDIIjskZ9eV.jpg','2003-08-05',97,'Released','Mondays are manic. Wednesdays are wild. And Fridays are about to get a little freaky.','Freaky Friday',10330,16.412,6.589,'8C7L9ANISmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17631,_binary '\0','/oYdNnmgFybqL4z76B0tnG2XNYsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322420',7.5,13970,'sr','Život je čudo','Set during the Bosnian war in the early 1990s, Luka is a mild-mannered railway clerk whose life is turned upside down, not just by the outbreak of the war, but when his wife runs off with a local musician. Then Luka\'s son is conscripted and eventually captured in the fighting. To recover his son, Luka is commanded to guard a pretty young Muslim nurse who will be used in a hostage swapping operation.','/wyPG79yFyq0zj4qWXD2CkCj0nTJ.jpg','2004-05-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Life Is a Miracle',20128,2.3646,7.2,'l0eXYiAnlz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17632,_binary '\0','/n0R9fbj9H8BQmBPKJPGEVx8eyKK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322545',7.1,7950,'de','Herr Lehmann','In October 1989, the part of the West Berlin borough of Kreuzberg called SO 36, had been largely shut off by the Wall from the rest of the city for 28 years. A lethargic sub-culture of students, artists, bohemians and barflys had flourished among crumbling buildings. Part of that microcosm is barkeeper Frank, semi-formally called \'Herr Lehmann\' by friends and patrons. He hangs out drinking, sports utter disregard for anything beyond SO 36 and lazily pursues an affair with cook Katrin. His lifestyle is gradually disturbed, when his parents show up for a visit, things go awry with Katrin and his best friend Karl starts to act strange. Meanwhile, political turmoil mounts on the other side of the Wall.','/fdH4E51jkMwLx3D8BfZr3BZZdl4.jpg','2003-10-01',105,'Released','Till then, then…','Berlin Blues',4326,2.1656,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17633,_binary '\0','/9dixOiaWMKAJiqBiIf7GgHADsG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322589',5.4,49507,'en','Honey','Honey Daniels dreams of making a name for herself as a hip-hop choreographer. When she\'s not busy hitting downtown clubs with her friends, she teaches dance classes at a nearby community center in Harlem, N.Y., as a way to keep kids off the streets. Honey thinks she\'s hit the jackpot when she meets a hotshot director casts her in one of his music videos. But, when he starts demanding sexual favors from her, Honey makes a decision that will change her life.','/gnY6d7BoddAAQ8s42fxCJK8lL1A.jpg','2003-12-05',94,'Released','Her dream. Her terms.','Honey',10028,6.2656,6.356,'9gPkNpqP-2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17634,_binary '\0','/nb7SjAaXbUKIPiZpgDGMETvwR4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322622',6.5,2910,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called in to unravel a mysterious curse that has plagued the Baskerville family for generations. When Sir Charles Baskerville is found dead, his heir, Sir Henry, begs Holmes to save him from the terrifying supernatural hound that has brought fear and death to his household.','/fVC7KS1LSKJ18yGqk8a6CfGOCuY.jpg','2002-12-26',105,'Released',NULL,'The Hound of the Baskervilles',28486,2.6433,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17635,_binary '\0','/aWg40fkUvghFwrCya2fHvAEvjud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322645',7.2,3107,'ja','犬夜叉 時代を越える想い','InuYasha is a half-demon who was trapped in the Legendary Tree and was set free by Kagome, a girl who traveled 500 years through time. This time, both of them will have to face Menomaru, a Chinese demon whose father, known as Hyoga, came 300 years ago to invade Japan, but was stopped by InuYasha\'s Father. InuYasha and Kagome, along with Sango, Miroku, Shippou, Kaede and Myoga, will try to stop Menomaru in his becoming the most powerful demon ever.','/gl8TvgVL6B2PR71cnrG7PbAUPls.jpg','2001-12-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Inuyasha the Movie: Affections Touching Across Time',42360,3.8248,7.547,'u_iiFP0-tEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17636,_binary '\0','/nWLaHqGMy8S5FfmjfpDTDFpNMDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322653',5.4,2747,'hi','Mere Yaar Ki Shaadi Hai','Sanjay and Anjali are childhood chums. When Sanjay\'s roommate Ria declares he has fallen for Anjali, he vehemently denies it. But the truth hits him like a ton of bricks when Anjali calls to tell him that she is getting married to Rohit. Sanjay wants to win Anjali\'s heart at any cost and sets off on a mission to stop the wedding. Based partly on the American film \"My Best Friend\'s Wedding\" (1997).','/26fFnoLCuA5vzEGQsmLbNYBiI8J.jpg','2002-06-07',158,'Released',NULL,'Mere Yaar Ki Shaadi Hai',139656,1.4487,6.105,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17637,_binary '\0','/2u8uQchpm5zUIwax4XdWqZF6DNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322659',6.2,5713,'en','Northfork','The year is 1955, and a great flood is coming to Northfork, Montana. A new hydroelectric dam is about to be installed in the mountains above the town, ready to submerge the valley in the name of progress. It is the responsibility of a six-man Evacuation Committee to relocate the townsfolk to higher ground. Most have duly departed, but a few stubborn stragglers remain – among them a priest caring for a sickly orphan, a boy whose fevered visions are leading him to believe he is a member of a roaming band of lost angels desperately searching for a way home.','/jb3qheP75UgVibpnfubotrBDY5v.jpg','2003-07-11',103,'Released','We are all angels. It is what we do with our wings that separates us.','Northfork',32235,2.3594,6,'b4D_41dmCII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17638,_binary '\0','/mO1j0lsFaAsOW3uGSNwH6Bz3z60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322674',7.4,7718,'nl','De Tweeling','1920s Germany. Two sisters aged six years, no sooner see their remaining parent buried when they are torn apart. Lotte goes to live with her upper middle class Dutch aunt in Holland, Anna to work as a farm hand on her German uncle\'s rural farm. The World War II impacts each of their lives and finally in old age they meet again.','/wYVApv3A8cbQ6cIp04Su02nCvZ2.jpg','2002-12-12',137,'Released',NULL,'Twin Sisters',16132,1.7973,6.8,'vmBAWBqlPe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17639,_binary '\0','/4mB8E58UxT4Ds4TfiI69h9PEcN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322700',5.1,2069,'en','I Love Your Work','A fictional movie star endures the disintegration of his marriage, a gradual mental breakdown, and an increasing obsession with a young film student who reminds him of his own life before becoming famous.','/eEHWma4acEcP0byL2a7h9MJxB57.jpg','2003-10-05',111,'Released',NULL,'I Love Your Work',25428,2.2831,4.6,'jBmet9VGib8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17640,_binary '\0','/umlLMR5eUvkGKjRit3VJNAjjEed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322725',7,3239,'it','L\'imbalsamatore','Peppino, a diminutive taxidermist with a reputation for sleaziness, meets Valerio, a handsome if artless much younger man fascinated by the trade. Peppino offers him a large salary to be his assistant—the job burgeoning into a budding friendship he mistakes for something more. When Valerio gets a girlfriend, their fledgling romance will be threatened by an insanely jealous third wheel.','/pT9Maaop1epDYWiXEO11NcuR25R.jpg','2002-09-06',101,'Released',NULL,'The Embalmer',35265,1.5847,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17641,_binary '\0','/zqd39GO0GdO5TaO8HxnkmWwu2p8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322802',6.6,107640,'en','Jackass: The Movie','Johnny Knoxville and his band of maniacs perform a variety of stunts and gross-out gags on the big screen for the first time. They wander around Japan in panda outfits, wreak havoc on a once civilized golf course, they even do stunts involving LIVE alligators, and so on.','/9Rb659hvGfmef1xm0mMvDHEBqmf.jpg','2002-10-25',85,'Released','Do not attempt this at home.','Jackass: The Movie',9012,7.2843,6.339,'dCp40n0T11Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17642,_binary '\0','/vDHuNywcjOD2jayltdCg4usDDy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322807',6.4,2407,'sr','Јагода у супермаркету','Ex-soldier Marko storms into a supermarket and takes all the cashiers hostage because one of them insulted his grandmother. One of the cashiers is Jagoda, a self-conscious country girl in her late 20s or early 30s who thinks that she passed her \"expiration date\" long ago. A surreal situation jazzed with comedy stunts helps Marko and Jagoda find their places in the world.','/ro1Ke0X1aZ2SlTvmrAdiuoK6kci.jpg','2003-02-06',83,'Released',NULL,'Strawberries in the Supermarket',11373,1.3021,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17643,_binary '\0','/3jLbq8i0QStXfPIxfOgFJQaeGPV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322824',6.8,4222,'es','Japón','A painter from the big city goes to a remote canyon to commit suicide. To reach some calmness he stays at the farmstead of Ascen, an old religious woman. Although only a few words are spoken, love grows.','/dvLPpPzRhwHx32wNbtglIUWQFhq.jpg','2003-01-15',134,'Released',NULL,'Japón',36211,1.2182,6.7,'QVPKEE0aUHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17644,_binary '\0','/o1G9i9BzY598fE5RNmSWXCz24d4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0322918',6.6,1381,'ja','聖闘士星矢 神々の熱き戦い','Hyoga is missing somewhere in Asgard... When Seiya and the others are looking for him, Athena is kidnapped and they have to rescue her from Dolvar and some mysterious warriors.','/zwL4R8y2b18nLe8q0OgSr5vbnnc.jpg','1988-03-12',46,'Released',NULL,'Saint Seiya: The Heated Battle of the Gods',83091,3.3482,7.7,'SscaDNeWk4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17645,_binary '\0','/99J3jwjhmgyQdrnPnm1M2EiqRed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323013',7.8,28391,'hi','लक्ष्य','An aimless, jobless, irresponsible grown man joins the army and matures into a battlefield hero.','/ctB8RWoK2LHn5skqN4eUWVSvpyM.jpg','2004-06-18',186,'Released','It Took Him 24 years And 18000 Feet To Find Himself','Lakshya',21175,1.9276,6.7,'YoKGmYyljmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17646,_binary '\0','/ktvFYpvolLOzUzWV7tXt6Mz0jwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323033',5.9,26120,'en','Laws of Attraction','Amidst a sea of litigation, two New York City divorce lawyers find love.','/6aqR0xwmK0mPOIVShDlT88Vo5W0.jpg','2004-04-04',90,'Released','Love always has the last word.','Laws of Attraction',11141,4.4438,5.826,'ZhsP_gvhdaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17647,_binary '\0','/nnrNau1w3kIsPYMllbfsVQNUJVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323120',6.2,14431,'en','Loving Annabelle','Annabelle is the wise-beyond-her-years newcomer to an exclusive Catholic girls school. Having been expelled from her first two schools she\'s bound to stir some trouble. Sparks fly though when sexual chemistry appears between her and the Head of her dorm and English teacher, Simone Bradley. Annabelle pursues her relentlessly and until the end the older woman manages to avoid the law.','/a6p1Oexil6Z2XO5d1QVHR3F2OoM.jpg','2007-05-24',77,'Released','One student. One teacher. One secret.','Loving Annabelle',19344,3.5942,6.6,'AEzcWmymuEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17648,_binary '\0','/nKg5kyHwYzJU7US64unJfCkjQEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323298',6.7,4952,'en','The Mother','A grandmother has a passionate affair with a man half her age, who is also sleeping with her daughter.','/uCoIolCRu8edvQidFDMOdKLPH3t.jpg','2003-11-14',112,'Released',NULL,'The Mother',59210,4.0942,6,'zDWv4U5CvJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17649,_binary '\0','/mYjxTDMT2cpf2bKfmSY2UToEBTG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323332',6.9,3912,'en','My House in Umbria','Emily Delahunty is an eccentric British romance novelist who lives in Umbria in central Italy. One day while travelling, the train she is on is bombed by terrorists. After she wakes up in a hospital, she invites three of the other survivors of the disaster to stay at her Italian villa for recuperation. Of these are The General, a retired British Army veteran, Werner, a young German man, and Aimee, a young American girl who has now become mute after her parents were both killed in the explosion.','/2Qa8b99kco74Kk4UNWKUHc0VX8K.jpg','2003-05-25',103,'Released',NULL,'My House in Umbria',36730,2.4642,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17650,_binary '\0','/3yO7ofBUiqBG2YRPhRG3eg3MlVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323443',6.6,2982,'fi','Nousukausi','Katri and Janne want to take a trip which none of their friends have taken. They end up in Jakomäki.','/iDlaOEfSOHNOzFUC9jtYIWBY9JG.jpg','2003-02-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Upswing',55496,1.8398,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17651,_binary '\0','/mFhU0ehBDVjnnrfZIGznifZ66JW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323465',4.3,3354,'en','Octane','After a family visit, stressed businesswoman Senga Wilson is driving with her rebellious daughter, Nat, down an ominous highway in the middle of the night. After they pick up a weird teenage hitchhiker, their journey goes awry. Nat decides to give her mom the slip and runs off with the hitchhiker at a rest stop. In a desperate search to find her daughter, Senga learns that Nat has been drawn into an evil cult.','/krCaiVWChpMu8MQhufmjqqmfmGp.jpg','2003-05-16',91,'Released','Nobody in chains, ever soared up to the sun.','Octane',44289,1.8194,5,'bziBlWwki9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17652,_binary '\0','/9RWlpI5lXN5SqoWs2Mi5H1qqJPW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323551',6.3,5756,'fi','Pahat pojat','The story bases on four Finnish brothers, nicknamed \'the Eura Daltons\' who received nation-wide notoriety for tearing gas pumps apart when they needed cash.','/6LofhRTJEOuLoSzEobxDFLuCbEb.jpg','2003-01-17',126,'Released',NULL,'Bad Boys: A True Story',20164,2.0678,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17653,_binary '\0','/urpB3KBRu71ltbr44B68us4uiCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323571',5.3,2540,'en','Nemesis Game','Sara Novak is an introverted college student with a few skeletons in her closet. Shying away from classmates, she prefers to spend time with Vern, an older comic store owner who shares her passion for mind games and riddles. But when the riddles she solves lead to the deaths of those around her, she realizes the riddles are more than a simple game.....','/6CwK46VeembPAiT6IdF2Z2BjNbG.jpg','2003-09-16',92,'Released','The only thing more terrifying than playing it...is winning','Nemesis Game',45877,1.6546,5,'NEvHaal_mJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17654,_binary '\0','/sKhK29PiA4MVaZPyEhQmngyFaj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323572',4.8,4655,'en','Chasing Papi','Playboy Thomas Fuentes has so far been able to skate by in life on good looks and charm alone. But when his duplicitous relationships with three women -- impassioned waitress Cici, meticulous lawyer Lorena and bored socialite Patricia -- spiral out of control, he suffers a mental breakdown. His doctor recommends that he choose just one girlfriend -- but can he choose in time before they discover his deception?','/mdn6NwGZChgaSuWHQzYKYO1KBL6.jpg','2003-04-16',80,'Released','Three women. Three cities. Three times the trouble.','Chasing Papi',24621,3.0989,6.7,'nsQ28luQBOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17655,_binary '\0','/2YxtGkkKsdB3kXNPnyGqOVhxe5a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323630',6.1,5518,'ko','폰','Soon after getting a new phone, a woman notices strange things starting to happen. When she investigates, she discovers that everyone who has had her phone number before her has died suddenly and mysteriously.','/gh24kU3ssb477MdLVdgumg9bQ4N.jpg','2002-07-26',103,'Released','The Last Call You\'ll Ever Get...','Phone',32242,1.9766,6.1,'GOY1gXV5Vao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17656,_binary '\0','/uefhJ3kVYrU5oW0VBJMuCAXlTzH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323633',6.7,3380,'en','Melvin Goes to Dinner','Four thirtysomethings convene for a wine-fueled dinner party that turns increasingly intimate as they discuss everything from religion and ghosts to relationships and sexual fetishes.','/nH2RvmUq4c2R4GN4GRzlVV3dHMx.jpg','2003-12-04',84,'Released','Sex, religion, infidelity, fetishes, ghosts... and that\'s just the appetizer.','Melvin Goes to Dinner',34681,2.0076,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17657,_binary '\0','/yrIL6TukQ3m2KLf9oFoLMF7kDnz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323642',6.1,9684,'en','Piglet\'s Big Movie','When the gang from the Hundred Acre Wood begin a honey harvest, young Piglet is excluded and told that he is too small to help. Feeling inferior, Piglet disappears and his pals Eeyore, Rabbit, Tigger, Roo and Winnie the Pooh must use Piglet\'s scrapbook as a map to find him. In the process they discover that this very small animal has been a big hero in a lot of ways.','/cytspPjtacOInHroA6h2dIekDrp.jpg','2003-03-16',79,'Released','A tale you\'ll never forget.','Piglet\'s Big Movie',13691,6.5817,6.676,'wgbU7gfpxTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17658,_binary '\0','/qRpoH1NgnsskEwKM8yR7Dkxzd76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323807',6.4,4591,'it','Ricordati di me','A middle-class Italian family is tore apart when the father meets an old flame, the mother—a frustrated onetime actress—auditions for a play, their insecure son tries to make friends through drugs, and their underaged daughter—who has already figured out how to use sex to her advantage—does what she does best to appear on TV.','/3GcAGqAtaSfD8V2ULGV1v6CROPj.jpg','2003-02-11',125,'Released','Some loves are never forgotten','Remember Me, My Love',38970,2.0819,5.8,'AFQuK5jOpKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17659,_binary '\0','/oJiBH1aSFv0gOKwb34I7CCKqgRE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323808',3.8,3227,'en','The Wicker Tree','Gospel singer Beth and her cowboy boyfriend Steve leave Texas to preach door-to-door in Scotland. When, after initial abuse, they are welcomed with joy and elation to Tressock, the border fiefdom of Sir Lachlan Morrison, they\'re about to learn the real meaning of sacrifice.','/vAmjzxeMWKkQRo7Wz6mUupZ4vfN.jpg','2011-08-27',96,'Released','Accept our sacrifice','The Wicker Tree',79544,1.3566,3.9,'aKdnshZz-WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17660,_binary '\0','/m8qkhwLjDMIr4d2qxW8iZYAw05K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323810',6.1,1707,'en','Right on Track','Based a on a true story about two sisters who came out on top of a man\'s sport. The story is based on Erica and Courtney Enders, two sisters who get in to junior drag racing and make it all the way to the top. The two sisters fight a battle of fellow racers who are against having girls race with them therefore it pushes them harder to compete against their competition. Erica becomes stressed when her racing life becomes mixed with her social life and academic goals, and decided to quit racing, until she realizes racing is what she truly wants to do. Finally towards the end of their teen years the Enders sisters come out on top to win the junior drag racing national title. They continue to race throughout high school and college, and still do so today.','/cPfAqTFenHPXgC4eAU1qIjywVbI.jpg','2003-03-21',89,'Released',NULL,'Right on Track',77606,1.9835,6.6,'p8JBZlinx_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17661,_binary '\0','/q4k9UDHE5foTcs48zpqJbpLUDNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323869',6.4,1687,'ja','聖闘士星矢','In the first anime film of the Saint Seiya series, Seiya and the gang must defeat mysterious Ghost Knights to save the world from the pending resurrection of Eris, the Goddess of Chaos!','/44Ni4sNvXkyRAh2ayuE07CV0lE5.jpg','1987-07-18',46,'Released',NULL,'Saint Seiya: Evil Goddess Eris',83090,3.5984,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17662,_binary '\0','/dwiYVqQj8mWIrRG137hznn3LFue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323872',7.3,8927,'no','Salmer fra kjøkkenet','Swedish efficiency researchers come to Norway for a study of Norwegian men, to optimize their use of their kitchen. Folke Nilsson (Tomas Norström) is assigned to study the habits of Isak Bjørvik (Joachim Calmeyer). By the rules of the research institute, Folke has to sit on an umpire\'s chair in Isak\'s kitchen and observe him from there, but never talk to him. Isak stops using his kitchen and observes Folke through a hole in the ceiling instead. However, the two lonely men slowly overcome the initial post-war Norwegian-Swede distrust and become friends.','/srIgymX8L1uYlNkRUVbOEYfcGex.jpg','2003-05-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Kitchen Stories',11083,1.6187,7,'VxXT1A4zqcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17663,_binary '\0','/4bPNy1jpf75bwHk4T7iIuEYayEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323939',6.3,13947,'en','Shade','Tiffany, Charlie and Vernon are con artists looking to up the ante from their typical scams. They figure a good way of doing this is taking down Dean \"The Dean\" Stevens, a well-known cardsharp, in a rigged game. However, they first need enough money to enter a game with Stevens, so they decide to strike a deal with fellow crook Larry Jennings to scam a local gangster -- which turns out to be a bad idea.','/2uK217wp1SSFgbIcwDaPrzlLd7X.jpg','2003-05-18',101,'Released','Lie, cheat, steal... your deal!','Shade',14576,5.7745,6.155,'0rCOxEgyzWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17664,_binary '\0','/u4OUSKeFwuP1z42dL58Mi0LYwIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323944',7.1,40387,'en','Shattered Glass','Stephen Glass is a staff writer for the respected current events and policy magazine The New Republic and a freelance feature writer for publications such as Rolling Stone, Harper\'s and George. By the mid-90s, Glass\' articles had turned him into one of the most sought-after young journalists in Washington, but a bizarre chain of events - chronicled in Buzz Bissinger\'s September 1998 Vanity Fair article - suddenly stopped his career in its tracks.','/bIFJ49tk79hiFr9Z6bF6QapTg66.jpg','2003-11-14',94,'Released','He\'d do anything to get a great story.','Shattered Glass',13537,5.8156,7,'Hrol_9rcBPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17665,_binary '\0','/1pySFXXpL9qlSgP6A6NL5lsHMeu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0323998',6.9,11077,'sv','Smala Sussie','When Erik, a Stockholm urbanite, learns that his beauty-queen sister, Susie, is missing, he goes to their country roots to look for her. But after talking to the eccentric locals -- including a shy video store clerk and a corrupt police officer -- Erik finds a woman who is not at all like the girl he left behind. Award-winning director Ulf Malmros helms this black comedy infused with hipster flair.','/4ND3jFeBkQnKzQLOPxVs30VdPj2.jpg','2003-10-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Slim Susie',11466,1.3779,6.6,'Q8Drrm6Mlco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17666,_binary '\0','/8Szkfsz861G3T5LCcYD8QzvPaBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324013',7.8,7792,'en','Soldier\'s Girl','This true story, which takes place in Fort Campbell, KY, tells the heart-wrenching story of the life and tragic death of soldier Barry Winchell. His love for Calpernia Addams, a transgender nightclub performer, was misunderstood by his fellow soldiers and eventually led to his murder.','/uVekYkCKmyLSEZ4eRi8dWlA3GwH.jpg','2003-05-10',112,'Released','She was the only man he ever loved.','Soldier\'s Girl',32526,2.7611,6.995,'1sRGi4UFqj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17667,_binary '\0','/dgBKkMKbMCh3h1bxhoOsiyJKdcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324015',5.8,2282,'de','Soloalbum','Ben is a young editor for a famous german music magazine in the mid 90\'s. His life is falling apart after his girlfriend breaks up with him. From now on he decides to go solo...','/1wFe3VnOK6q85PS7eNwHQcKPm8Q.jpg','2003-03-26',89,'Released','Love, Sex and Cough Syrup','Soloalbum',9295,1.1694,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17668,_binary '\0','/xLfBGBUnEkhwzn1lMRwZNxfregM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324127',5.7,25193,'en','Suspect Zero','A killer is on the loose, and an FBI agent sifts through clues and learns that the bloodthirsty felon\'s victims of choice are other serial killers.','/7r2iBM6U9rorDlLzcDw8ledAmk0.jpg','2004-08-27',99,'Released','Who\'s next?','Suspect Zero',8080,4.4318,5.6,'EAqJb5iKvGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17669,_binary '\0','/q0kZOxL6OMSeDlT6SRNKCJYStlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324133',6.7,51862,'en','Swimming Pool','A British crime novelist travels to her publisher\'s upmarket summer house in Southern France to seek solitude in order to work on her next book. However, the unexpected arrival of the publisher\'s daughter induces complications and a subsequent crime.','/10xMAznUxI0LZPYyPxA9WjJsThr.jpg','2003-05-21',102,'Released','On the surface, all is calm.','Swimming Pool',302,8.282,6.488,'NlQiybP-2I8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17670,_binary '\0','/95oQbB1Pt7LNZz4eWxErwul8jR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324197',6.4,12434,'fr','Le temps du loup','A middle-class family flees an unspecified disaster that has struck the city and takes refuge in their country home. They think this will allow them to escape the chaos, but they soon realize that getting away won’t be so easy.','/10tjiBzMlvGYPpNpjHUOzMKNC6P.jpg','2003-08-28',113,'Released',NULL,'Time of the Wolf',24190,2.1388,6.109,'cJUxjnErFUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17671,_binary '\0','/xnShZK7y4lupUmXghz75HRSooW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324216',6.2,163995,'en','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre','After picking up a traumatized young hitchhiker, five friends find themselves stalked and hunted by a chainsaw-wielding killer and his family of equally psychopathic killers.','/781px1eOtfVt1RdIsL4Dt1s3x7R.jpg','2003-10-17',98,'Released','What you know about fear...doesn\'t even come close.','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre',9373,10.5686,6.3,'y2NDtxcE2DY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17672,_binary '\0','/gOJovPn9DQbPOMAV61NCVumbpj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324242',6.1,4261,'ko','쓰리','An anthology consisting of three horror shorts from different Asian directors: Memories by Kim Jee-woon, The Wheel by Nonzee Nimibutr, and Going Home by Peter Chan.','/jhi6iI4CqQwWI97GKmYdpRg4HGq.jpg','2002-07-09',129,'Released','When two just ain\'t enough!','Three',54117,2.8094,6,'G-MBovP1rmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17673,_binary '\0','/ogBcoLNyfwvgfWtEmNhjL8kBZN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324554',6.9,60307,'en','Wicker Park','Matthew, a young advertising executive in Chicago, puts his life and a business trip to China on hold when he thinks he sees Lisa, the love of his life who left him without a word two years earlier, walking out of a restaurant one day.','/gRKEluSpV1wBrZVTvLLaCSkzqcf.jpg','2004-09-03',115,'Released','Passion never dies.','Wicker Park',11208,6.2891,6.815,'vFo0u-nXbGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17674,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324619',6.6,1387,'en','Spinning Boris','Russian political elite hires American consultants to help with President Yeltsin\'s re-election campaign when his approval rating is down to single digits.','/5LbRF6UGBSYnesVnVhFd3AqhIoG.jpg','2003-10-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Spinning Boris',101887,1.6384,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17675,_binary '\0','/h5kXpNZVkw1FkdMF3f0YW9LEVbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0324952',4.3,1256,'en','Three Blind Mice','Thomas is a talented computer programmer living in a vibrant, urban metropolis. Lonely and unsure about life, he finds solitude in the world of internet chat rooms, webcam sites and virtual communication. One evening, Thomas witnesses the brutal murder of a webcam friend and in a vain attempt to protect her he becomes the prime suspect in the homicide. Determined to prove his innocence, Thomas teams up with Claire, a specialist in internet crimes to uncover the truth. To expose the murderer, Claire and Thomas decide to set up their own webcam site using Claire as the cyber bait. Somewhere down the line the truth becomes blurred and Thomas no longer knows where to turn or who to trust. As his life starts to spiral out of control, he has to face the terrifying reality that he could be the next victim.........the virtual nightmare has only just begun.','/dSOPRKn9eqMIlU222NX5WNmJDeP.jpg','2003-10-08',89,'Released','See how they run...','Three Blind Mice',49481,1.5853,4.1,'wYnyLyyPUyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17676,_binary '\0','/cVkrxt6WsiYLR7rVnxKUjAY0Fmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325005',5.6,1857,'ru','Антикиллер','Former criminal investigator, Major Korenev, nicknamed Fox is released from prison. He has been detained there as a result of planted incriminating evidence of unlawful investigation techniques. Setting accounts with Shaman - a big criminal boss, who ordered the evidence planted and also with his former colleagues was not a part of Korenev\'s agenda. As he returns to Moscow he finds a new world ruled by underworld bosses, criminal clans fighting each other and utter chaos on the desperately keeping appearances streets of Russian capital. Facing death of his friends, Major Korenev decides to re-install law and order using some unorthodox methods that are only relevant in 21st century Russia.','/etGu5noSpWfeEcyEPgRQODkg2QI.jpg','2002-08-01',113,'Released',NULL,'Antikiller',41955,1.1637,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17677,_binary '\0','/gaHdGL1F1Wxmi2qx3OVxkmSVagk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325011',6.9,1438,'it','Arrivederci amore, ciao','Leftist radical-turned-terrorist Giorgio—hiding out in Latin America since the 1970s—turns himself in as soon as the Berlin Wall falls. Wishing to lead a comfortable, bourgeois life in his native Italy, he cuts a deal with a dirty cop, getting his sentence reduced in return for ratting former comrades out. Once released, Giorgio obsessively pursues his dream of becoming an upright citizen, but his old police aquaintance keeps dragging him down...','/9gstmEqp3c9GY9u94Kswf9zT5Ke.jpg','2006-02-24',107,'Released',NULL,'The Goodbye Kiss',35464,1.6485,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17678,_binary '\0','/3Mu8h4RSr6RwQ1qhQWPvf3U7Z77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325055',6.3,11655,'en','Sylvia','Story of the relationship between the poets Ted Hughes and Sylvia Plath.','/fEhrg0uQqhmHUDRqODxxvRPipfB.jpg','2003-10-17',109,'Released','Life was too small to contain her.','Sylvia',28200,2.2865,5.8,'rPK5dnE9CS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17679,_binary '\0','/gP3fRkvy0ABEorenM76QHKefBOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325123',6.5,6825,'en','Bright Young Things','During the 1930s in England, a group of young socialites dominate the national gossip with extravagant and outlandish antics. Among the group is the aspiring novelist Adam Fenwick-Symes, who is attempting to raise enough money to marry fellow member Nina Blount. However, after customs officials confiscate his first manuscript, Fenwick-Symes must recover from the financial setback and figure out new ways to earn money for a wedding.','/m7ik01FJKBSEoy0L0PKz7eEf9kI.jpg','2003-10-03',106,'Released','Sex... Scandal... Celebrity... Some things never change.','Bright Young Things',15271,2.5355,6.3,'KrBtsUcc0vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17680,_binary '\0','/wOpOnnE0tnG9uPb817I68dQ44UW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325145',6.8,3031,'es','La caja 507','Modesto, an honest and responsible professional, is a manager of a small bank branch in Costa del Sol. His daughter died in a forest fire which he had thought to be accidental. One day he wakes up in his bank, after being locked and dragged by unknown men, and finds out in a safety-deposit box that the fire was plotted. From that day on, he sets on a personal crusade for justice.','/hWi4jfgOY4NQ8kZvgXieSL210Ci.jpg','2002-08-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Box 507',33110,1.5246,6.524,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17681,_binary '\0','/98lCeBdxbfaCs0M1MviA1D52MO6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325191',6.8,1434,'de','Sabah','One day, when Sabah least expects it, she falls in love with the wrong man. She\'s Muslim, he\'s not. Unbeknownst to her family, she goes on a whirlwind affair before both culture and love collide.','/mo2cYWxTMipPtVZcEix5XiSb7Gf.jpg','2005-06-04',86,'Released','A Love Story','Sabah',61559,1.1082,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17682,_binary '\0','/nfkGXr1OSE2lyG16EWEdNT3vtZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325258',5.6,16479,'en','Dickie Roberts: Former Child Star','TV child star of the \'70s, Dickie Roberts is now 35 and parking cars. Craving to regain the spotlight, he auditions for a role of a normal guy, but the director quickly sees he is anything but normal. Desperate to win the part, Dickie hires a family to help him replay his childhood and assume the identity of an average, everyday loser.','/eyn1WbZmUUIXU8QoorKWJTQ1iLg.jpg','2003-09-04',98,'Released','50 million people used to watch him on TV. Now he washes their cars.','Dickie Roberts: Former Child Star',13778,4.8071,5.1,'u51-0sIYINU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17683,_binary '\0','/3Ck0ZYfJ6Mqgo3zK2GUhaFGzAXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325352',6.5,2309,'en','I\'ll Be There','A has-been rock star that discovers he has a teenage daughter from a long forgotten love affair.','/9xbkTT6jGCUsFdaRJhWwISjZ1Ls.jpg','2003-06-13',105,'Released','Olivia just met the perfect man for her mom...her dad.','I\'ll Be There',48967,2.3208,5.4,'qioKKQOAzu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17684,_binary '\0','/12LmdeaGGitnPIdz9XcSlCQbuJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325537',5.5,21163,'en','Head of State','When a presidential candidate dies unexpectedly in the middle of the campaign, the Democratic party unexpectedly picks a Washington, D.C. alderman as his replacement.','/5itBve85q2oXmiQ3SkgCJa5Asxq.jpg','2003-03-28',95,'Released','The only thing white is the house.','Head of State',9776,5.164,5.578,'UT6ARbhTjiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17685,_binary '\0','/reKKVrgeaKozpODdLCbhEQAhN0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325596',6,11840,'en','The I Inside','When Simon awakens in the hospital after surviving a near-fatal accident, amnesia has erased the last two years from his memory. He learns that his brother was killed, he has married a woman he doesn\'t remember and he\'s haunted by strange visions of the woman he loved.','/vGPMhj7Pp2bxubm7JsCyTB3Tg6Z.jpg','2004-03-21',90,'Released','His story began when it all ended.','The I Inside',11588,4.55,5.936,'B1v-tQmVRd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17686,_binary '\0','/fEurvklilb04BbyYZM2FtumpyQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325655',6.6,31239,'cn','見鬼','A blind concert violinist gets a cornea transplant allowing her to see again. However, she gets more than she bargained for when she realizes her new eye can see ghosts. She sets out to find the origins of the cornea and discover the fate of its former host.','/cTtgcKrRWI0HNoHTwHF67x17Kk1.jpg','2002-05-09',98,'Released','How can you believe your eyes when they\'re not yours?','The Eye',10389,3.6007,6.6,'QmH5HHdjjBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17687,_binary '\0','/it0lgpkwzJhRIxpy6s6wU5sCrMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325675',7.7,6944,'tr','Karpuz Kabuğundan Gemiler Yapmak','In his award-winning debut feature film, director Ahmet Ulucay portrays the innocence of childhood and the lure of the cinema for two teens in a small Turkish village. Working for a watermelon seller by day, Remet spends his evenings trying to rebuild a film projector with his friend Mehmet. Both have big dreams to be famous film directors one day.','/7DeHGGQuGdmXLORzIM6Sqy7Xn9t.jpg','2004-11-26',110,'Released','The 60\'s, Tepecik, a small Anatolian village…','Boats Out of Watermelon Rinds',103785,1.5843,7.852,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17688,_binary '\0','/lyCPWvJJSLgUo62USdnvqOVJfGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325703',5.5,151943,'en','Lara Croft: Tomb Raider - The Cradle of Life','Off the coast of the volcanic island of Santorini, the intrepid archaeologist Lara Croft makes the unexpected discovery of a pulsating golden orb able to guide its holder to the mythical Pandora\'s Box. As the legendary artifact contains ancient mysteries of unfathomable power - said to contain one of the deadliest plagues on Earth, Lara is tasked by MI6 to make sure it doesn\'t fall into the wrong hands. With the aid of former Marine turned mercenary Terry Sheridan, she travels the world in pursuit of the precious item in a race against time; she must beat the unscrupulous Nobel Prize-winning scientist turned bioterrorist, Jonathan Reiss, to it.','/ylIEGeAr2ygSClK4FDj9mi2Ah22.jpg','2003-07-21',117,'Released','The lady returns.','Lara Croft: Tomb Raider - The Cradle of Life',1996,8.4247,5.8,'q5VugO68swI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17689,_binary '\0','/z354BaTVzKj7E60WLzDoSmUuO4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325710',7.8,510083,'en','The Last Samurai','Nathan Algren is an American hired to instruct the Japanese army in the ways of modern warfare, which finds him learning to respect the samurai and the honorable principles that rule them. Pressed to destroy the samurai\'s way of life in the name of modernization and open trade, Algren decides to become an ultimate warrior himself and to fight for their right to exist.','/a8jmJPs5eZBARmnuEEvZwbjwyz4.jpg','2003-12-05',154,'Released','In the face of an enemy, in the heart of one man, lies the soul of a warrior.','The Last Samurai',616,21.9279,7.61,'QZpQrc0R6J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17690,_binary '\0','/h74qqBEGMvjmWAgYFQAFOn82KYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325733',6.9,4432,'de','Was nützt die Liebe in Gedanken','A posthumous look at the last days of Guenther\'s life as he, his best friend, and his sister let loose on a four-day binge of alcohol, drugs, and sex.','/iOiPogpC9IF0MLBSiSrP9WIJ9nD.jpg','2004-02-12',89,'Released','Love is the only reason to die for','Love in Thoughts',1962,2.285,6.3,'urvp9lbvHJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17691,_binary '\0','/kqcBzC4MM20NRHUKoGG25aZBswS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325734',6.8,1428,'de','Liegen lernen','18-year-old school boy Helmut falls in love with fellow pupil Britta. He starts working for a Peace movement to get to know Britta. Britta, however, suddenly moves to San Francisco to live with her father and whilst there, finds a new boyfriend. Helmut studies, literature and politics in his home town and have a relationship with another girl from his former school, now studying medicine at the same university but they break up after having an affair with her roommate. Helmut begins a lot of short affairs with different women but still searches for his first girl.','/p8zlm6zE8NKgxCBr5UEOW17o488.jpg','2003-07-02',87,'Released',NULL,'Learning to Lie',1558,1.371,6.2,'VGCZqmV0qJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17692,_binary '\0','/hS0c4wECg4dtP1Z0MBzWcKeuTff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325761',5.3,1270,'en','Luster','An irreverent and refreshing take on the queer world of sex, lust and unrequited love. Lanky, blue haired Jackson, record store employee and poet, is in love with most of the men in his life! A refreshing departure from the typical gay love story, LUSTER is a raw and darkly comic look at young punks in love.','/r2mKcrPLB0HgpWpT0j3hupHePRs.jpg','2002-03-17',90,'Released','What Makes You Shine?','Luster',35565,1.9648,5.6,'5QqRmMDySs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17693,_binary '\0','/7HiMvoDSYW4fyu4rkmWH6pcKKuF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325805',7.2,146665,'en','Matchstick Men','A phobic con artist and his protege are on the verge of pulling off a lucrative swindle when the con artist\'s teenage daughter arrives unexpectedly.','/cIWQzIoWOvx0piZM0UpiHMhzHWW.jpg','2003-09-12',116,'Released','Lie. Cheat. Steal. Rinse. Repeat.','Matchstick Men',7270,6.3901,7.007,'zDoOdd00nHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17694,_binary '\0','/vmkwYx4dZ0pd8FI7iz699Kkjdrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325968',5.2,1685,'en','Perfect Strangers','When Melanie goes home from the pub with a handsome stranger, she’s captivated by his charm and attentiveness. He sails her away to his ‘castle’- a rundown shack on a deserted island. But when seduction becomes deception and passion becomes possession, Melanie realizes that she has been kidnapped. Torn between fear and desire, Melanie must escape – but her ardent admirer has other plans.','/As7gEiTlng2oLVk9EWLHdlXxUYp.jpg','2003-10-09',96,'Released','A Chilling Romance','Perfect Strangers',41258,1.7702,4.6,'rnaIDK5GkP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17695,_binary '\0','/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0325980',8.1,1345806,'en','Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl','When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.','/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg','2003-07-09',143,'Released','Prepare to be blown out of the water.','Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl',22,32.0652,7.834,'-9HT0l9HV4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17696,_binary '\0','/6zGsyQLBS5uS7ZLZRdd55CsohUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326036',6.1,1460,'fr','Qui a tué Bambi ?','Isabelle, a beautiful nursing student, is starting her internship at a prestigious hospital. She meets Dr. Philip there, feels atracted to him from the beggining and starts suffering from strange fainting; so he calls her Bambi: her legs don\'t support her. Patients mysteriously start to dissappear from their rooms; so Bambi and Dr. Philip start a cat vs. mouse paranoid game, in order to catch the probable killer.','/nKhmdbwcMXWM21AqSBKLvV3kdog.jpg','2003-12-24',126,'Released',NULL,'Who Killed Bambi?',1917,1.9139,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17697,_binary '\0','/2qqEifSnDgTsHEHPoYzi2OMCQJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326098',8.5,1219,'bg','С деца на море','A funny adventures of a group of children, spending their holidays at the seaside.','/7lBbNe8B1UbcFP7210CuZgzqsfi.jpg','1972-11-17',76,'Released',NULL,'Vacation with Kids',266954,0.7282,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17698,_binary '\0','/1FdYcvnpyk8vxBbw583ZzwVQ5Ev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326101',6.5,1228,'ja','聖闘士星矢 最終聖戦の戦士たち','The plot involves the coming of Lucifer to the Sanctuary, where his underlings systematically dispose of the surviving Gold Saints. Athena goes to Lucifer to ask for peace, placing herself in peril. The Bronze Saints must then come to her rescue, destroying Lucifer\'s Fallen Angels (Seima Tenshi in Japanese) in the process.','/a1ftT2mM219UvZ86jgF19mBoUT1.jpg','1989-03-18',45,'Released',NULL,'Saint Seiya: Warriors of the Final Holy Battle',83088,3.6272,7.4,'Vr3sKdef3l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17699,_binary '\0','/l4oOfCiMqIaaL0Vyx8dnu4FENra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326143',7.2,1675,'ja','聖闘士星矢 真紅の少年伝説','The Sun God Abel returns to life, bent on punishing the humans and cleansing Earth from their presence. When Athena joins him, leaving humans to their fate, the Bronze Saints must defend the world in their greatest battle yet.','/qDqk23o8qOljUetnCkQCQk7kElk.jpg','1988-07-23',75,'Released',NULL,'Saint Seiya: Legend of Crimson Youth',66105,4.1857,7.9,'CgVNAmPQq1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17700,_binary '\0','/xMZFqrm1VyhI8emhEcXNzbrsZrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326208',7,9721,'en','Stander','The life and career of Andre Stander, a South African police officer turned bank robber.','/qZdbA5MScI0dDeeyI2BzuI2lfut.jpg','2003-10-10',116,'Released','Good cop. Great criminal.','Stander',18927,2.253,6.168,'6f_yZ7gXaVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17701,_binary '\0','/rwlWqC7UPhk9WSGJJXSOsnJ4zfx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326306',7.6,2128,'en','The Trials of Henry Kissinger','This riveting documentary depicts former Secretary of State Henry Kissinger as a warmonger responsible for military cover-ups in Vietnam, Cambodia and East Timor, as well as the assassination of a Chilean leader in 1970. Based on a book by journalist Christopher Hitchens, the film includes interviews with historians, political analysts and such journalists as New York Times writer William Safire, a former Nixon speechwriter.','/hTzpmKT6w14A33L4ZQElLaZxPvM.jpg','2002-09-25',80,'Released','A film about the war crimes of the American diplomat, Henry Kissinger.','The Trials of Henry Kissinger',54714,1.6254,6.9,'Qxe4XomNEpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17702,_binary '\0','/uQRMbvfrMu0rt6cah5WzFpr44eg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326429',6.7,8030,'de','Das Wunder von Bern','The movie deals with the championship-winning German soccer team of 1954. Its story is linked with two others: The family of a young boy is split due to the events in World War II, and the father returns from Russia after eleven years. The second story is about a reporter and his wife reporting from the tournament.','/ujNucP3lk3VpJAswjNBUc0DYHPT.jpg','2003-10-15',118,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle of Bern',1611,2.1564,6.5,'QNllJPLHPJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17703,_binary '\0','/1CXZhDeuJV3iRlCTPzqUbNc1PeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326449',7.3,5267,'sr','Зона Замфирова','Zona Zamfirova is set in the eastern Serbian city of Niš in the 19th century. The plot follows the story of Zona Zamfirova, a local rich man\'s daughter, and the vicissitudes of her affair with Mane, an ordinary goldsmith. As it was undesirable for the daughter of a rich man to marry a craftsman, the two are at first divided, with the possibility of Zona marrying Manulać, who came from a wealthy family. Everything is, however, changed as Mane organizes a successful conspiracy to keep Zona for himself.','/dH2d2wPHimn1diMdmKb5cUJIz4n.jpg','2002-10-31',104,'Released',NULL,'Zamfir\'s Zona',51817,1.1699,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17704,_binary '\0','/cVWSNDSC8pY7KBUq0CZbKXlmOLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326450',6.9,3015,'ru','Звезда','In the summer of 1944, the Nazi Armies prepare a massive Tank Division named \'Viking\" for the offensive on occupied Russian land. The Russian Army\'s special group of seven snipers named \"Zvezda\" is sent for a reconnaissance operation behind the enemy lines in the back of the Nazi Tank Division. Two previous Russian groups never came back. The seven Russians know that they are going to an almost certain Death for the sake of Victory.','/eAphHhkP3NtseCsJ36tUMyT1xrk.jpg','2002-05-06',97,'Released',NULL,'The Star',54474,1.8109,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17705,_binary '\0','/tVOxVgtN3HiNOZa62T1I6s8QL2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326576',6.5,4292,'hi','हमराज़','Karan plans to cheat Raj, a businessman, by getting his lover Priya married to Raj so that they can claim his wealth. However, when Priya falls in love with Raj and leaves Karan, he seeks revenge.','/wYHShqkkup1WjTVBiNdRbfWzvki.jpg','2002-07-26',173,'Released','Karan and Priya Share a secret Raj wants to know the secret.','Humraaz',165404,3.0686,6.135,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17706,_binary '\0','/eT1FZF0BpQ8rrqKe5pccL8bi2DL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326600',4,1400,'hi','Maine Dil Tujhko Diya','Ayesha is the elder daughter of rich business tycoon Mr. Verma, an overprotective father who\'s kept his two daughters away from modern influences. Ayesha goes to college and comes in contact with Ajay, the leader of a group called Aryans, responsible for handling the security at the college. Ajay\'s soft-spoken nature and humble, down-to-earth attitude soon make Ayesha his most ardent admirer.','/6jlO3kTvZVB9w7KRzXUTyVgm5sD.jpg','2002-08-23',154,'Released',NULL,'Maine Dil Tujhko Diya',277751,1.3783,5.2,'7ms3L_L2yzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17707,_binary '\0','/iHAJJqIwbqu4eONiHR4QA0mxAqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326664',7,3655,'en','Swimming Upstream','A young man aspiring for recognition of his talents battles against his estranged father\'s sentiment towards him as the father deals with his own demons.','/4gf6tspHI8Doh0hTYaC4mf1Zm87.jpg','2003-02-27',114,'Released',NULL,'Swimming Upstream',15474,2.3464,6.8,'A9pjEeIZ43g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17708,_binary '\0','/oLyQu5QAR1w7e8roeveNiZXS5kN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326716',6.5,1660,'en','5-25-77','Alienated, hopeful-filmmaker Pat Johnson\'s epic story growing up in rural Illinois, falling in love, and becoming the first fan of the movie that changed everything.','/jTi6pvvK5oiBPbQ4tYv3Djh97ir.jpg','2008-10-17',132,'Released','The true story of a boy... a girl... and the movie that changed everything.','5-25-77',199734,1.5454,6.1,'7bvWJuhQ2a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17709,_binary '\0','/cfvIbVDiI3tkKNaBwcJJeWWo4wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326746',5.4,2774,'ta','பாபா','Baba is an atheist who always questions the existence of a higher power. But when a turn of events bestows him with divine powers, he uses the opportunity to help other people.','/4r5Kne06Q20OuzEzV1oGlVv8mEv.jpg','2002-08-15',160,'Released','Known Is A Drop, Unknown Is An Ocean!','Baba',66243,1.8247,6.296,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17710,_binary '\0','/pxz6PBvEGiaT2giDIXekjpfrhwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326769',4.7,14876,'en','Biker Boyz','A mythic motorcycle tale of father and son, this is the story of Manuel Galloway, also known as \"the King of Cali\", the president of a motorcycle club whose members are all African-American men, mostly white-collar workers who exchange their suits and ties at night and on weekends for leather outfits and motorcycle helmets.','/frb2Tk7DTBshZ61Or0D3M1kslWL.jpg','2003-01-31',110,'Released','Survival of the fastest.','Biker Boyz',12253,4.6284,6.4,'rUVfKb_emfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17711,_binary '\0','/bHAqlUjH3ZjoUevtS4vAJL72IxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326828',5,1688,'en','A Different Loyalty','In January 1963, British journalist Leo Cauffield suddenly disappears from his home in Beirut. His wife Sally knew that he was working part-time for British intelligence, but was not prepared to be told by the British embassy that they suspect he has defected to Communist Russia. As his wife puts together the pieces of the mysterious jigsaw of the past, tracking her passionate relationship with her husband and his history as former head of MI6’s counter-espionage section, her relentless search for the truth takes her to London, New York and finally Moscow.','/fbJwFcXT6tvIVHMzXmN7FnJgQxW.jpg','2004-11-12',96,'Released',NULL,'A Different Loyalty',19180,2.3139,4.8,'-mEqmyJXj-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17712,_binary '\0','/xo6BiwGPV5MhGMQ7gBTQ6coC19H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326835',6.7,9201,'en','Dot the I','A fiery Spanish woman is about to marry a kind British man when she meets a Brazilian actor who ignites in her a flame of lust she can\'t ignore.','/2Gq1e0OC7r6L4V5dJaLgANk09xl.jpg','2003-10-31',92,'Released','Danger is in the details.','Dot the I',18538,2.656,6,'Sx99L2Yj1J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17713,_binary '\0','/rgImWBvvXCGTl4mNJ3L5960svfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326856',4.8,33665,'en','Envy','A man becomes increasingly jealous of his friend\'s newfound success.','/vrsZUr8R041YzINcy9SFe5iSM1m.jpg','2004-04-30',99,'Released','Success didn’t go to his head, it went to his neighbor.','Envy',10710,3.4421,4.889,'aBDQiiItVyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17714,_binary '\0','/5unbVMlqYsgNPEzct6UBo2mVD6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326900',5.1,4921,'en','Good Boy!','An intergalactic dog pilot from Sirius (the dog star), visits Earth to verify the rumors that dogs have failed to take over the planet.','/kZDXSPfeKNtai6l8yE4J5LwVQMY.jpg','2003-10-10',88,'Released','Rover is about to take over.','Good Boy!',21765,3.7976,5.6,'aBtZIPcguJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17715,_binary '\0','/6gFB71pIo0PY3OOrojTQ97Qy8qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326905',6.6,25386,'en','The Great Raid','As World War II rages, the elite Sixth Ranger Battalion is given a mission of heroic proportions: push 30 miles behind enemy lines and liberate over 500 American prisoners of war.','/k5Q76tzV2T4RtDdYwNj64c1qQ16.jpg','2005-08-12',132,'Released','The most daring rescue mission of our time is a story that has never been told','The Great Raid',13922,5.5969,6.544,'N51IAYnlNK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17716,_binary '\0','/aHspMnRBCdJwgHwQCvARQGWXuxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326965',5.5,2194,'en','In My Sleep','A sleepwalking, sexaholic masseur wakes up, covered in blood next to a bloody knife, when cops ring the doorbell.','/x1GJBX0RPkYuA77WujLyyLAoDAn.jpg','2010-04-23',90,'Released','Sleepwalking can be deadly.','In My Sleep',40048,2.4168,5.2,'91MiOF4FmSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17717,_binary '\0','/gpjHHQcHKBefkgRkroGQHbS8CnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326977',7.4,18168,'it','Io non ho paura','In a tiny community enclosed by wheat fields, the adults shelter indoors, while six children venture out on their bikes across the scorched, deserted countryside. Exploring a dilapidated and uninhabited farmhouse, nine-year-old Michele discovers a secret so momentous, so terrible, that he dares not tell anyone about it...','/vTf4qR0OSuV4qBT8As4QoWxSJSq.jpg','2003-02-08',108,'Released','Who can you trust when everyone\'s a suspect?','I\'m Not Scared',25300,3.4906,7.1,'aqv11VJVkf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17718,_binary '\0','/AvWM9V8ad9J2evtmeXGV19K3OVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0326983',2.8,4602,'hi','Jaani Dushman: Ek Anokhi Kahani','A shape-shifting snake exacts revenge on the men he believes are responsible for the death of Divya, his lover in her previous life.','/e9Aps5rxiu3lzPgtccEERfReJ6R.jpg','2002-08-16',179,'Released','An Incredible Tale','Jaani Dushman: Ek Anokhi Kahani',159436,1.7279,4.586,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17719,_binary '\0','/zMHkwDUg9IgKLdIynfWHSUVMUal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327036',5.4,1827,'en','Martin Lawrence Live: Runteldat','The controversial bad-boy of comedy delivers a piercing look at his life, lifting the metaphorical smokescreen that he feels has clouded the public view, commenting on everything from the dangers of smoking to the trials of relationships, and unleashing a nonstop litany of raucous anecdotes, stinging social commentary and very personal reflections about life.','/fRpS1sr1GFPgQobsXoNm5lxatcy.jpg','2002-08-02',113,'Released','Truth in the Raw','Martin Lawrence Live: Runteldat',20337,1.6086,5.3,'-Cn2F5TVaaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17720,_binary '\0','/4ycpMe25LYpzGW42U9amyW9gM53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327056',7.9,531578,'en','Mystic River','The lives of three men who were childhood friends are shattered when one of them suffers a family tragedy.','/hCHVDbo6XJGj3r2i4hVjKhE0GKF.jpg','2003-10-08',138,'Released','We bury our sins, we wash them clean.','Mystic River',322,14.0314,7.743,'W7NktJhrRYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17721,_binary '\0','/eLNjnXV4OjBeki8cOPYG4u3rpgi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327071',5.5,2353,'hi','Om Jai Jagadish','Widowed Mrs. Saraswati Batra (Waheeda Rehman) has brought up three sons with a lot of care and love. Her eldest son Om (Anil Kapoor) is very honest and diligent; her two other sons Jai (Fardeen Khan), and Jagdish (Abhishek Bachchan) also live in the same house. this is their story','/cdKXPLHY2O6Wgx5kNoCLmEEqFbP.jpg','2002-07-08',172,'Released',NULL,'Om Jai Jagadish',33146,1.3791,5.261,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17722,_binary '\0','/reK7SgAFlyxg3s9R7neh6M970kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327084',6.7,205513,'en','Over the Hedge','A scheming raccoon fools a mismatched family of forest creatures into helping him repay a debt of food, by invading the new suburban sprawl that popped up while they were hibernating – and learns a lesson about family himself.','/jtZnymorbnHY7mOiBXR14ZDJseM.jpg','2006-05-17',83,'Released','Get over it.','Over the Hedge',7518,26.2122,6.609,'BE77igZczlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17723,_binary '\0','/ithoU8bcAj5dIaKkhN4ybiiWhyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327137',7.5,66748,'en','Secondhand Lions','The comedic adventures of an introverted boy left on the doorstep of a pair of reluctant, eccentric great-uncles, whose exotic remembrances stir the boy\'s spirit and re-ignite the men\'s lives.','/mYIMMAma7DCACRfiGhHAybPAdKa.jpg','2003-09-19',111,'Released','The McCann brothers have finally met their match.','Secondhand Lions',13156,7.254,7.2,'Ebkrm7u44UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17724,_binary '\0','/rjUeBEhX3xZ5gN5RNcCwUDGHCqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327162',5.4,73080,'en','The Stepford Wives','What does it take to become a Stepford wife, a woman perfect beyond belief? Ask the Stepford husbands, who\'ve created this high-tech, terrifying little town.','/ygr0Wlmm1KmE16TUefNitIscVBG.jpg','2004-06-10',93,'Released','The wives of Stepford have a secret.','The Stepford Wives',9890,6.7846,5.7,'XfhUO27d16w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17725,_binary '\0','/8YuUF4YmWA3M5SPDe0YUeQKuXgu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327169',5.5,1247,'ko','성냥팔이 소녀의 재림','A young man is on a quest to beat the game and rescue the Little Match Girl from the hands of the corporation that operates the game, but can he succeed?','/aiNjZXUWXw82W6l8qlwvke3VxTQ.jpg','2002-09-13',123,'Released','Game start.','Resurrection of the Little Match Girl',45572,2.1117,5.143,'IeVQZHAiwsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17726,_binary '\0','/5pkyvgJy3zgVW0N0pBnImSgKSJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327227',6.7,1241,'de','Verschwende deine Jugend','The year is 1981, the German New Wave is at the peak. Harry, otherwise Sparkasse trainee, wants to make it big as a manager of the band of his friends, Apollo Schwabing. He has booked the band as the opening act for a concert where the group DAF are the headliners.','/mNNqCB4p8Gzgr2pa1j8cx5x7nKl.jpg','2003-07-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Wasted Youth',9690,1.1843,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17727,_binary '\0','/cQUSBypH7uVSLvZYW6yVgorjgHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327247',5.5,61063,'en','The Whole Ten Yards','Jimmy \"The Tulip\" Tudeski now spends his days compulsively cleaning his house and perfecting his culinary skills with his wife, Jill, a purported assassin who has yet to pull off a clean hit. Suddenly, an uninvited and unwelcome connection to their past unexpectedly shows up on Jimmy and Jill\'s doorstep; it\'s Oz, and he\'s begging them to help him rescue his wife, Cynthia.','/4fbglyCpPqK1u40fhncLXKAF74A.jpg','2004-04-07',98,'Released','They missed each other. This time, their aim is better.','The Whole Ten Yards',2122,8.2207,5.74,'Hfdu5CLYAWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17728,_binary '\0','/hWTqjvMryjtCLMxo90iSqZ89tT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327409',5.2,5656,'en','Alien Hunter','Government agents find evidence of extraterrestrial life at the South Pole.','/cb58aaGnPJROoooFCXlR6o1ebw5.jpg','2003-07-19',100,'Released','Earth just got its final warning!','Alien Hunter',22076,3.3307,5.1,'YRGBY4Ds4PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17729,_binary '\0','/nm25E5r11tImVJrFXfTbdSVLrbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327419',5.7,2151,'ar','أمير الظلام','The film revolves around Saeed AL-Masri (Adel Imam), one of the pilots of the October War who lost his eye-sight after his plane crashed during the war. Saeed AL-Masri is forced to live in a home for disabled people that is managed by a very bureaucratic managers which they turn it into a prison.','/kJ7U9hfuJbpXaeYcEB75uxPWSuD.jpg','2002-06-26',114,'Released',NULL,'The Prince of Darkness',86584,1.4041,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17730,_binary '\0','/lpZPrfmWrcSkYQx8JHT9APj2uPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327437',5.9,100235,'en','Around the World in 80 Days','A bet pits a British inventor, a Chinese thief and a French artist on a worldwide adventure that they can circle the globe in 80 days.','/bBiMw6Jtg8tSTcEq8jFV7qk9TRW.jpg','2004-06-16',120,'Released','Let your imagination soar.','Around the World in 80 Days',10204,9.643,5.956,'tFe7H-7YWD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17731,_binary '\0','/cxAr9Su5gYfx16vxtS2Zi6qc5DZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327554',3.5,133598,'en','Catwoman','Liquidated after discovering a corporate conspiracy, mild-mannered graphic artist Patience Phillips washes up on an island, where she\'s resurrected and endowed with the prowess of a cat — and she\'s eager to use her new skills... as a vigilante. Before you can say \"cat and mouse\", handsome gumshoe Tom Lone is on her tail, fascinated by both of her personas.','/pvnPgukFyEKgCzyOxyLiwyZ8T1C.jpg','2004-07-22',104,'Released','You can’t CATch her.','Catwoman',314,9.4191,4.642,'Fp7MeqkCUfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17732,_binary '\0','/hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327597',7.8,305951,'en','Coraline','Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.','/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg','2009-02-05',100,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Coraline',14836,40.0067,7.94,'P8lfdvXkhu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17733,_binary '\0','/fMcQJo24zZnZte0uRo9C75VK4eZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327643',3.6,7823,'en','Dirty Love','The klutzy yet stunning Rebecca Sommers walks in on her hunky boyfriend in bed with another woman. They break up and Rebecca starts to fall apart, but, with the help of her close girlfriends, she begins to date again. Unfortunately, the men she meets all happen to be crazy. John, her dorky guy friend, tries to express his secret love for Rebecca, but she\'s too busy to notice as she tries to come to terms with her breakup.','/aN5hVMCAeqlypwAEAAsORK8dExI.jpg','2005-09-23',91,'Released','got dumped?','Dirty Love',18189,3.6202,4.3,'e0-DoQE15mQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17734,_binary '\0','/r4Q7GKzTiAzr1MGU1b13s9L12YZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327679',6.3,81899,'en','Ella Enchanted','Ella lives in a magical world in which each child, at the moment of their birth, is given a virtuous \"gift\" from a fairy godmother. Ella\'s so-called gift, however, is obedience. This birthright proves itself to be quite the curse once Ella finds herself in the hands of several unscrupulous characters whom she quite literally cannot disobey. Determined to gain control of her life and decisions, Ella sets off on a journey to find her fairy godmother who she hopes will lift the curse. The path, however, isn\'t easy -- Ella must outwit a slew of unpleasant obstacles including ogres, giants, wicked stepsisters, elves and Prince Charmont\'s evil uncle, who wants to take over the crown and rule the kingdom.','/7AyNzwSEpJEG1gBdgwRfXi1cjs8.jpg','2004-04-09',96,'Released','Get enchanted','Ella Enchanted',14442,9.3956,6.485,'OoSUHgs7hCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17735,_binary '\0','/x6KHeO1IDdGG27wVhps4KNMOMZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327698',6.2,8036,'en','The Even Stevens Movie','The Stevens think that they\'ve won an all-expenses-paid trip to an island halfway around the world. When their house is destroyed, their food stolen, and their bacon eaten, the Stevens family crumbles, unaware that their family vacation is in fact a hidden camera reality show!','/xFDvO48Gq7putBBJmvjZAXARHQW.jpg','2003-06-13',94,'Released','Dream vacation? Dream on.','The Even Stevens Movie',50794,3.4318,5.9,'s33tlnR-J7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17736,_binary '\0','/xdA871I2bdUKyKM4OOiHSLJjpjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327753',6.4,3147,'en','Funny Ha Ha','Unsure of what to do next, 23-year-old Marnie tries her best to navigate life after college. Still partying like there\'s no tomorrow, Marnie drags herself out of bed for her miserable temp job and can\'t decide whether she\'s wasting her time going after best buddy Alex, who doesn\'t seem to be interested.','/4UsciNkAvuOZiM7ZfgLbfNR0WNJ.jpg','2003-11-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Funny Ha Ha',33693,1.4221,6.2,'AfP7lkQQjdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17737,_binary '\0','/iMbVeRGaPGnoELlCioglhT6Hnjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327761',6.3,1302,'ta','Gemini','Gemini, a gangster, falls for Manisha who reciprocates his love without knowing his truth. After getting arrested and completing his term, he tries to convince his lover that he is a changed man.','/xNB30KsiQENcq1VTFm2qqCcb2nB.jpg','2002-04-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Gemini',69664,1.0539,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17738,_binary '\0','/zGLQmrmIB56kMZPnzqReIOBay1B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327785',5.8,21896,'en','The Killer\'s Game','When top hitman Joe Flood is diagnosed with a terminal illness, he decides to take matters into his own hands – by taking a hit out on himself. But when the very hitmen he hired also target his ex-girlfriend, he must fend off an army of assassin colleagues and win back the love of his life before it\'s too late.','/4bKlTeOUr5AKrLky8mwWvlQqyVd.jpg','2024-09-12',106,'Released','Winning is all in the execution.','The Killer\'s Game',507241,12.8622,6.431,'ZHK6WghyWGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17739,_binary '\0','/8E77ALz9J7jHy2g2iGoq6I6TwDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327835',7.7,2124,'ar','الحريف','Fares, a shoe factory worker, has only one passion in life: football. He lives a humble life in a chaotic neighborhood where he plays street football to increase his income. However, neither his marriage nor his job is stable enough. He goes through a lot of problems due to his lack of self-discipline with his divorced wife and his son.','/tCD7QbaWBwDh6i7Kl8T8tMTOn9u.jpg','1983-08-06',109,'Released',NULL,'The Street Player',258773,1.219,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17740,_binary '\0','/i7ClLxhjClTCXGBt3FLC4hbEvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327850',6.6,149068,'en','The Rundown','When Travis, the mouthy son of a criminal, disappears in the Amazon in search of a treasured artifact, his father sends in Beck, who becomes Travis\'s rival for the affections of Mariana, a mysterious Brazilian woman. With his steely disposition, Beck is a man of few words -- but it takes him all the discipline he can muster to work with Travis to nab a tyrant who\'s after the same treasure.','/cwNeP2fz0vqNhmKIcSgLD0xc6g2.jpg','2003-09-26',104,'Released','Bulls, guns, whips, gold and one sacred cat.','The Rundown',10159,10.8538,6.449,'BehhBCBSplY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17741,_binary '\0','/sDFK6Lo00pRYDKRMOjNGAx7szYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327890',8,3904,'en','Hornblower: Loyalty','Hornblower must deliver a French nobleman to a secret rendezvous near Brest, all while coping with enemy agents in his own ranks.','/jMppZaklESfouOsEh3M410JczFm.jpg','2003-01-05',125,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: Loyalty',65310,1.7174,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17742,_binary '\0','/5RNH0Pscp4hke5HisiCGxmdRpOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327919',7.1,8685,'en','I Am David','A 12-year-old boy manages to flee a Communist concentration camp on his own, through sheer will and determination. All he has in his possession is a loaf of bread, a letter to deliver to someone in Denmark, and a compass to help get him there.','/cPoiPR15ylyBCNIr9zmUAzEb1Jm.jpg','2003-12-03',90,'Released','Believe in the power to change your destiny','I Am David',15397,3.3019,6.8,'j_GeHxTIYwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17743,_binary '\0','/7Oix1MrIQtp4AhrBd6KRn6hDJ2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0327920',7.4,2303,'en','I Am Trying to Break Your Heart: A Film About Wilco','A documentary by photographer Sam Jones documenting American rock band Wilco recording their fourth album Yankee Hotel Foxtrot. Originally intended as a showcase of the band\'s creative process, the film crew catches unexpected complications between the band and its record label and problems among the band members themselves.','/fM4eEtfq0Nsvz6gi6t8UpC4Xdhq.jpg','2002-06-21',92,'Released',NULL,'I Am Trying to Break Your Heart: A Film About Wilco',14308,1.4299,7.5,'6z3hIYB8nec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17744,_binary '\0','/xcfpiUV5APngRXoivL11mkcDVSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328031',6.1,4983,'en','King of the Ants','A young drifter, struggling to makes ends meet, accepts a job to kill a prominent accountant. When he isn\'t paid for the hit, revenge is now his path.','/bFsxsZlEDo1rMemCLZiR06z9YlF.jpg','2004-07-28',102,'Released','They wanted a Fall Guy. They created a Monster.','King of the Ants',21619,2.275,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17745,_binary '\0','/AeFTYQb20tf12yLmZQIQzz0s57X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328077',6.3,4000,'en','Love Object','The twisted tale of Kenneth, socially insecure technical writer who forms an obsessive relationship with \"Nikki\", an anatomically accurate silicone sex doll he orders over the Internet.','/cUXaPxe7hyksghZYcXyQ9UxSTT4.jpg','2004-02-13',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Object',16973,1.9369,5.9,'kY391WsPZTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17746,_binary '\0','/bwkrnryQYBaYNagZoEuuPlOI2UM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328099',5.3,22472,'en','Malibu\'s Most Wanted','A senator arranges for his son, a rich white kid who fancies himself black, to be kidnapped by a couple of black actors pretending to be murderers to try and shock him out of his plans to become a rapper.','/bjYuoz2S8S1AED5QIMvmAi21drc.jpg','2003-04-10',86,'Released','Ever feel like you don\'t belong?','Malibu\'s Most Wanted',13411,5.1904,5.402,'RbM6FIgZZg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17747,_binary '\0','/6c7j7MQCczzNVvcrNEiXbs8Kt2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328107',7.7,426273,'en','Man on Fire','Jaded ex-CIA operative John Creasy reluctantly accepts a job as the bodyguard for a 10-year-old girl in Mexico City. They clash at first, but eventually bond, and when she\'s kidnapped he\'s consumed by fury and will stop at nothing to save her life.','/grCGLCcTHv9TChibzOwzUpykcjB.jpg','2004-04-23',146,'Released','Creasy\'s art is death, and he is about to paint his masterpiece.','Man on Fire',9509,15.9055,7.468,'eDDh50B6kA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17748,_binary '\0','/mhQ42QCAXr2uTCriouUEO6RZhn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328132',6,2016,'fi','Menolippu Mombasaan','Pete loses his consciousness while playing in a pop band. The diagnosis is harsh and the doctor cannot say for sure whether Pete will celebrate his 18th birthday. One night, encouraged by the vodka on Jusa\'s 18th birthday, Pete confesses his love to Kata, his dream girl. Together with Jusa, they go to Lapland where Kata has her summer job. In Jusa\'s wild company, Pete experiences something which he never felt before as they decide to take a trip to Mombasa via Lapland.','/mDhfS9JmPpLz1LrCrbvT7eIT2JS.jpg','2002-09-06',88,'Released',NULL,'One-Way Ticket to Mombasa',68098,1.5556,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17749,_binary '\0','/xsnw09pg2wQ6IViLARNuQQutFzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328258',7,3669,'ja','ピンポン','As children, the introverted Smile was being bullied by a gang of kids until the brash Peco comes by and chases all of them them away. Peco then takes Smile under his wings and teaches him how to play the game of ping pong. From there a life long best friend relationship comes into existence between these two polar opposite kids.','/u4Xr2r4D5Jo0GvaKtCz3IKjwxao.jpg','2002-07-20',114,'Released','Enter the hero!','Ping Pong',25675,2.065,7.1,'nwFVc2NAt94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17750,_binary '\0','/5f4VWbgyvvXi8qNIYwDMZS20MR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328349',7.1,2944,'ar','سهر الليالي','A social romance that portrays the lives of 4 married couples who are friends. As they gather to celebrate the birthday of the daughter of one of them, their fundamental differences and their unstable marriages come to the surface as the men decide to leave for Alexandria.','/dHQvOAjDLI2lESp2mtsbZkC0k85.jpg','2003-07-16',124,'Released',NULL,'Sleepless Nights',136857,1.3869,6.602,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17751,_binary '\0','/ow2boWFZWza7D4qDvJohg9GJVoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328538',6.8,108025,'en','Thirteen','When 13-year-old Tracy befriends Evie, the most popular girl in school, her life is turned upside down as Evie introduces her to a world of sex, drugs, and money. But it isn’t long before Tracy’s new lifestyle begins to take a heavy toll on her and her family.','/uzTLlZrNF6rMPBh5mUQu6vLnTtX.jpg','2003-08-20',100,'Released','It\'s happening so fast.','Thirteen',11023,8.325,6.704,'a_OlFt2XgmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17752,_binary '\0','/dy516GsG7lvszB47FiotNjLARDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328589',6.8,65973,'en','Under the Tuscan Sun','Frances Mayes, a 35-year-old professor and writer from San Francisco, decides to take a tour of Tuscany following a difficult divorce. After impulsively buying a run-down villa in the Italian countryside, she begins to piece her life back together in unexpected ways.','/3vQUQwdtfPt1Sl2GZrIECWWA0dk.jpg','2003-09-20',113,'Released','Life offers you a thousand chances ... all you have to do is take one.','Under the Tuscan Sun',10934,7.4797,6.9,'aURoPYu_29w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17753,_binary '\0','/cYYox4V5PlOo1cWLFI5eQGj0nmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328671',4.8,3181,'hi','ये है जलवा','Raju, a businessman who had been orphaned as a child finds out that he is the illegitimate son of a wealthy business owner; he goes to London to connect with his father, and there meets Sonia, whom he believes may be the love of his life.','/8slJezlw5nTNQlPgp3ubfWTUnQY.jpg','2002-07-25',142,'Released',NULL,'Yeh Hai Jalwa',161218,1.9866,5.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17754,_binary '\0','/6vxNxU6wOFDMXUyUfymZkfI7wCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328675',7.1,2292,'ko','연애소설','A college student befriends two cute girls his age. He loses contact with them. He tries to find them years later.','/vW1wzczT4ZYvwARJkZx3k4EfD0h.jpg','2002-09-13',106,'Released','Love\'s a threesome.','Lovers\' Concerto',54332,1.7233,7.182,'ehvfkjSbS9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17755,_binary '\0','/2t1ZwES9JOWpmyrYsumSSGcvgLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328720',5.2,2928,'en','The Collingswood Story','When Rebecca went away to college, her boyfriend John thought video chatting would help them stay in touch. But idle curiosity leads to a dark secret when Rebecca and John video chat with Vera Madeline, an online psychic, who initiates a deadly reign of terror over their lives.','/v7h2cTowUiPr79NqC0HNlqOX4iu.jpg','2002-10-29',82,'Released','A Revolutionary Experiment in the Supernatural!','The Collingswood Story',54511,1.0348,4.7,'Ptki_HtKTDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17756,_binary '\0','/vy1VtmZsvsTqbjD4jl0YnuUPzn5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328729',5.2,2288,'hi','दिल मांगे मोर','Nikhil is a simple young man . He loves his hometown Samarpur , football matches , and the college his grandfather passed down to him as a legacy ...','/7FX9KuLUFmuilftgQ4AdUfUwYQD.jpg','2004-12-31',123,'Released','Why does it happen in love?','Dil Maange More!!!',217745,1.0093,4.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17757,_binary '\0','/mpCIVcb4ywBGU6K0Qt1DCIcKoJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328802',6.8,6165,'fr','11’09”01 – September 11','Eleven directors from eleven countries each contribute an eleven-minute short reflecting on the events of 11 September 2001: A village teacher in Iran tries to explain to her young students what\'s happened; city kids in Burkina Faso think they\'ve spotted Osama bin Laden; a deaf Frenchwoman in Manhattan writes a Dear John letter to a man who left that morning for work at the World Trade Center; a Chilean remembers Allende; events recall other deaths; a mother endures more than her son\'s death. Tones vary, as do the locales. Most concern coming to terms with the events of the day, but at least one confronts the viewer with tragedy and death.','/3DfDYe82PS4rDWpHKSSWeiPme8C.jpg','2002-09-04',134,'Released',NULL,'September 11',1926,2.5547,6.409,'3haDg8wk3BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17758,_binary '\0','/qW703anWHFXulRTKWOckAg9i70K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328828',6.3,231027,'en','American Wedding','With high school a distant memory, Jim and Michelle are getting married — and in a hurry, since Jim\'s grandmother is sick and wants to see him walk down the aisle — prompting Stifler to throw the ultimate bachelor party. And Jim\'s dad is reliable as ever, doling out advice no one wants to hear.','/pCO3lJv2PzPkJty29APxCVSjyoE.jpg','2003-08-01',103,'Released','Forever hold your piece.','American Wedding',8273,11.0493,6.2,'4bqeLmhNbfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17759,_binary '\0','/wazQOHr0GBivrwo3AeGRhxtqN8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328844',7.2,5075,'da','Arven','A young Danish man, Christoffer, lives a life of joy and happiness with his wife Maria in Stockholm. When his father dies his mother insists that Christoffer take over management of the family industry which is in danger of bankruptcy. He is torn between his chosen life and his sense of duty to his family and its past. When he chooses to step in as manager his family life and self-respect languish.','/jPRNBFoKpuhvwOfguCAka3fIrTj.jpg','2003-02-21',116,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritance',15824,2.5832,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17760,_binary '\0','/sZhY0BAsN1bMAPLIqMRqG1fqb3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328880',6.9,138409,'en','Brother Bear','When an impulsive boy named Kenai is magically transformed into a bear, he must literally walk in another\'s footsteps until he learns some valuable life lessons. His courageous and often zany journey introduces him to a forest full of wildlife, including the lovable bear cub Koda, hilarious moose Rutt and Tuke, woolly mammoths and rambunctious rams.','/otptPbEY0vBostmo95xwiiumMJm.jpg','2003-10-23',85,'Released','See through another’s eyes, feel through another\'s heart, and discover the meaning of brotherhood.','Brother Bear',10009,17.9355,7.284,'_w897MMkjPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17761,_binary '\0','/rXw6VPz2trn9tYh29GeJAmhZtwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328955',4.7,2582,'fr','Chouchou','Choukri, alias Chouchou, a transvestite Maghrebi with clear eyes, comes illegally to Paris to find his nephew. Hired as an assistant by a psychotherapist, known for his good mood, he also work as a waiter in a transvestite cabaret of Clichy where he meets Stanislas.','/74Bv2j3LVWxArUqoN2EZwS0Hr7x.jpg','2003-03-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Chouchou',17684,2.1693,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17762,_binary '\0','/pHxgGdEXEz8QKc3K92gYwg2nxUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328962',6.9,7503,'en','Comedian','A look at the work of two stand-up comics, Jerry Seinfeld and a lesser-known newcomer, detailing the effort and frustration behind putting together a successful act and career while living a life on the road.','/tktajWQ91P09zTV7HdefzeVw1UV.jpg','2002-10-11',82,'Released','Where does comedy come from?','Comedian',19973,1.2552,6.7,'zGjwZ3XMDes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17763,_binary '\0','/mzkr6gd6pkdgUn7Hs3duWOHGwIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0328998',5.7,2492,'hi','दिल है तुम्हारा','Hiding her husband\'s affair from the world after his death, Sarita raises his love child alongside their daughter. When the girls grow up and fall in love with the same man, Sarita is forced to deal with her biases.','/6DkO7aZTZtXNESGcSq3R1wmrb06.jpg','2002-09-05',185,'Released',NULL,'Dil Hai Tumhaara',175614,1.6405,5.653,'rv-buo9Q4y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17764,_binary '\0','/e2Ppz6IQcukpqyYYJsRkWcsGXvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329028',3.5,44820,'en','Dumb and Dumberer: When Harry Met Lloyd','This wacky prequel to the 1994 blockbuster goes back to the lame-brained Harry and Lloyd\'s days as classmates at a Rhode Island high school, where the unprincipled principal puts the pair in remedial courses as part of a scheme to fleece the school.','/qxD6P3UXASFCdbrVavceZzgOfI9.jpg','2003-04-14',85,'Released','The evolution of dumb...','Dumb and Dumberer: When Harry Met Lloyd',10152,7.7479,4.164,'tdjX8Voj5vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17765,_binary '\0','/hmhwvtyWr5pEx5ZHcDfYAqFA4pK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329030',5.9,1822,'en','The Dust Factory','Ryan is a teenager who lacks the ability to speak. One day, Ryan falls off a bridge and he finds himself transported to a strange fantasy world where he encounters his Grandpa Randolph and a pretty girl named Melanie; together, Ryan and Melanie learn to help one another with their problems, and they both discover the wisdom they can gain from elders like Grandpa Randolph.','/dbLyWQPdiGGBWWbxYvS3dMl5KGq.jpg','2004-10-15',99,'Released','The journey of a lifetime...','The Dust Factory',2319,2.0742,5.8,'p5iGw-YUfDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17766,_binary '\0','/WT6DJukD0oNQ3r3e9YfFLQ8lae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329042',7,2218,'it','El Alamein - La linea del fuoco','War seen through the eyes of Serra, a university student from Palermo who volunteers in 1942 to fight in Africa. He is assigned to the Pavia Division on the southern line in Egypt. Rommel and the Axis forces are bogged down; it\'s October, the British prepare an offensive. At first, boredom, heat, hunger, and thirst bedevil the Italians; then the Brits attack, and there\'s no luck or heroism in death. Finally, it\'s retreat in confusion. Serra, his sergeant Rizzo, and his lieutenant Fiori take a last walk toward home. It\'s said that each soldier gets three miracles; when Serra\'s are used up, what then?','/7yvhXV6RqgYXQYO1vtBTAyY3taZ.jpg','2002-11-08',117,'Released',NULL,'El Alamein: The Line of Fire',26495,2.0219,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17767,_binary '\0','/pjbuo7x4uu15kFLFSLw45y5c2fZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329083',7.1,2622,'hr','Fine mrtve djevojke','Iva and Marija, a young lesbian couple, rent an apartment in Zagreb, in a building that seems to provide a quiet and safe environment for their love, but over time the atmosphere in the building becomes more and more threatening. The elder landlady Olga dominates the building. Other tenants include her calm husband, her grown-up son Daniel who has a crush on Iva, the prostitute Lidija, an abused housewife, a widower keeping the corpse of his newly deceased wife, a gynecologist performing abortions in one flat of the house, and an ex-soldier who regularly plays martial music at night. After Olga finds out that Iva and Marija are lesbians, the situation escalates .','/jmeTpxg27eqtCTrUl237yaW2rT1.jpg','2002-07-24',77,'Released','Two Girls in Love Enter the Doors of Hell','Fine Dead Girls',10125,1.3331,5.4,'iNwlY3Bg--U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17768,_binary '\0','/hCAOQTMRop2fHjsl8n7yNwpkMJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329101',5.8,137487,'en','Freddy vs. Jason','Freddy Krueger and Jason Voorhees return to terrorize the teenagers of Elm Street. Only this time, they\'re out to get each other, too.','/f9ZASRUfl8Jlco7rgRx3ujPR0P7.jpg','2003-08-15',97,'Released','Even a killer has something to fear.','Freddy vs. Jason',6466,12.8305,6.1,'oCf4l6XnML8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17769,_binary '\0','/m3jrSepRoM8BlYZyiuKUzq5LD8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329106',6.6,1619,'de','Führer Ex','Ingo Hasselbach, whose parents were Communist Party members in East Germany during his childhood, has lived at both ends of the political seesaw. The question of how people reach a change of heart is a profound one; Hasselbach describes the external forces that led to his founding Germany\'s first neo-Nazi political party and the internal ones that led him away from it five years later.','/9UT3mQokA5SdmVHfPCDmIkfDj9a.jpg','2002-08-31',105,'Released','Violence. Feeling. Being caught.','Führer Ex',10630,2.0285,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17770,_binary '\0','/7kHxNCeUcROtri3XKUubXBwDEfq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329111',6.5,3555,'fr','Les égarés','Fleeing the June 1940 arrival of Hitler\'s army in Paris, a young war widow and her two children are rescued from dive-bombing German fighters by a cocky, reckless teenager. He finds them refuge in an abandoned house, but despite the fact that the family quickly comes to be depending much on his cunning and survival abilities, their cohabitation proves uneasy.','/94aX13B3Rjz6F8lqV1fkvnXYrAI.jpg','2003-08-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Strayed',38018,1.6983,5.8,'rcsuSmI1dj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17771,_binary '\0','/cmpzmjrwM7TU1q0I7qTAhiyyVTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329162',5.3,4625,'en','Devil\'s Pond','After a brief courtship, Julianne marries her handsome boyfriend, Mitch. To celebrate their honeymoon, the couple travel to a remote cabin on a small island. When they arrive, however, Mitch becomes aggressive and physically abusive, and Julianne soon realizes he\'s not the ideal husband she once thought he was. Knowing that Mitch doesn\'t plan on ever letting her leave the island, Julianne, who is afraid of water, must find a way to escape.','/oyc5fDw1tBaE0d258sBNc9674WM.jpg','2003-12-16',92,'Released',NULL,'Devil\'s Pond',30669,2.6193,5.683,'bk-ACWLZ6Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17772,_binary '\0','/171wf8HVXZAIScPf9zJyrXpxgRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329200',2.6,44550,'en','Home Alone 4','Kevin McCallister\'s parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father\'s rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie\'s mansion.','/qRktvMOO2QaCL7gvNyvZDoxPOZj.jpg','2002-11-03',84,'Released','Bigger house. Badder baddies. Bigger and better laughs.','Home Alone 4',12536,9.6779,4.485,'89W163wlc-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17773,_binary '\0','/waJPfBVSY9XO3vYELvZpKKx6ayd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329216',5.7,1686,'en','I Witness','After 27 bodies are discovered in a collapsed tunnel in Tijuana, a man tries to unravel the mystery before becoming the next victim.','/ovSPoXsqdLjXYhjK3pBOWzWIWxi.jpg','2003-04-13',98,'Released',NULL,'I Witness',62107,1.4985,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17774,_binary '\0','/51kl4lITGRJJQGMtQrP3WaVDwmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329297',5.9,1522,'en','American Girl','A pregnant teenager is determined to leave her trailer park home with the hope of living a happy family life.','/1Zrzagu8IAeffUGtDnRE6shHXMa.jpg','2002-02-10',88,'Released',NULL,'American Girl',15041,1.8859,5.5,'pWCDZiLasig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17775,_binary '\0','/xV6BqrX3XgKXWLpWW5TsiJKO4yo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329330',7.6,2212,'es','Lugares comunes','In Buenos Aires, a few days before traveling to Spain with his beloved wife Liliana Rovira to visit their son Pedro, the leftist Literature professor Fernando Robles is compulsory retired in the University, and he concludes that it is impossible to live with his pension. The crisis in Argentina does not allow Fernando to get a new job, and his wife decides to sell her family\'s apartment and move to a small farm near Villa Dolores to reduce their expenses. Fernando comes up with the idea to grow lavender and sell the oil to the perfume industry.','/nCOuPTKoSD3jHTBZDE872Xpl8zz.jpg','2002-10-04',110,'Released','It\'s never too late to begin again.','Common Ground',32546,1.1919,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17776,_binary '\0','/gNHCFoAF2lwwcZIZGCfNFMwAvTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329347',7.1,4163,'fa','من ترانه پانزده سال دارم','Taraneh is a model 15-year-old Iranian girl, studious and filial, who supports her ailing grandmother with a job at a photo shop and visits her father (who has been imprisoned for reasons never made clear in the film) bearing gifts of cigarettes and magazines. But when Amir, a young man from a well-off family, sets his sights on Taraneh and courts her with an intensity that borders on stalking, her well-ordered life spirals into chaos.','/lILbh9WeapuF4BGqGYohdQFu56P.jpg','2002-11-13',110,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Taraneh, 15',225951,0.8327,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17777,_binary '\0','/kd53yeBJOJF4gUQSUETdw2VKRP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329354',4.9,2201,'en','Marigold','Marigold Lexton, an American actress who gets stranded in Mumbai and lands a minor role in a Bollywood musical. She meets Prem, the film\'s choreographer, and undergoes a personal transformation as she experiences Bollywood firsthand.','/GwaIlVG1eG8yRkySKX7Si4V6xo.jpg','2007-08-17',110,'Released','Her unexpected adventure is about to begin','Marigold',25827,2.1746,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17778,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329355',6.7,1456,'en','Marion Bridge','When three estranged sisters reunite to care for their dying mother, old conflicts and secrets return to the surface.','/wzT6wo9jQvkJ5zIoJ9mDARobnQ3.jpg','2003-04-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Marion Bridge',18941,2.12,6,'aSl5AJZTUlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17779,_binary '\0','/56uYFEyonCvjlM3lpPchy1LRruH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329388',7.3,12049,'fr','Monsieur Ibrahim et les Fleurs du Coran','Paris, 1960s. Momo, a resolute and independent Jewish teenager who lives with his father, a sullen and depressed man, in a working-class neighborhood, develops a close friendship with Monsieur Ibrahim, an elderly Muslim who owns a small grocery store.','/lS4hx9X5v6cpoCzzQohZs7zD881.jpg','2003-09-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Monsieur Ibrahim',337,2.3909,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17780,_binary '\0','/3DConUIPzpQ87nZ2dnMgOEMZSiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329390',7.1,3438,'en','Monte Walsh','Monte Walsh and Chet Rollins are long-time cowhands, working whatever ranch work comes their way, but \"nothing they can\'t do from a horse.\" Their lives are divided between months on the range and the occasional trip into town. Monte has a long-term relationship with prostitute Martine Bernard, while Chet has fallen under the spell of the widow who owns the hardware store. Camaraderie and competition with the other cowboys fill their days, until one of the hands, Shorty Austin, loses his job and gets involved in rustling and killing. Then Monte and Chet find that their lives on the range are inexorably redirected.','/5zQ4b28cAvV8sUNl40kBq6relH6.jpg','2003-01-17',117,'Released',NULL,'Monte Walsh',37348,2.7814,6.1,'0r0fBbTjEo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17781,_binary '\0','/ibZDhteTpHC6ciROdvvwx6zgHZ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329393',7.9,5081,'en','Mr. and Mrs. Iyer','Mrs. Iyer and her infant son are traveling to Kolkata with the help of photographer Rajah. When religious tensions flare up and the bus travelers become stranded under martial law, she makes a choice to save him that entwines their lives.','/ge3B43rnPktTcFAHZ2wF7Dsonhj.jpg','2002-07-19',117,'Released','Emotions Under Curfew','Mr. and Mrs. Iyer',41184,1.4942,6.82,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17782,_binary '\0','/rpShcpjf3EwJqnTzPPi9vVoHubR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329485',7.1,3587,'fr','Le Papillon','An old man who has one interest in life, collecting butterflies, has his life changed by an eight year old girl.','/4tZCGXqlEPSGxNWZup6YxxCzS5G.jpg','2002-12-18',85,'Released',NULL,'The Butterfly',45699,2.0854,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17783,_binary '\0','/9mxDXwoNLLX1SOeq2uiqEfGg4sN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329575',7.3,79487,'en','Seabiscuit','True story of the undersized Depression-era racehorse whose victories lifted not only the spirits of the team behind it but also those of their nation.','/5m7NfZvxYsSm2YBCJ2VPQf8ziKr.jpg','2003-07-22',141,'Released','The hopes of a nation rode on a long shot.','Seabiscuit',4464,5.0376,7.062,'8fnYdEGeXbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17784,_binary '\0','/giQy3vmsOIbNCMZ9EAZScSQZ3jo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329691',4.2,30730,'en','Torque','Biker Cary Ford is framed by an old rival and biker gang leader for the murder of another gang member who happens to be the brother of Trey, leader of the most feared biker gang in the country. Ford is now on the run trying to clear his name from the murder with Trey and his gang looking for his blood.','/pY35tW8BMAjZewl87OxjXK8ui02.jpg','2004-01-16',84,'Released','Circuit of Fire','Torque',10718,7.9234,5.292,'olxto6CgFPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17785,_binary '\0','/fQnbVD4wXaKeTHEYk6y2pn0GVAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329717',5.4,41747,'en','Hollywood Homicide','Joe Gavilan and his new partner K. C. Calden, are detectives on the beat in Tinseltown. Neither one of them really wants to be a cop, Gavilan moonlights as a real estate broker, and Calden is an aspiring actor moonlighting as a yoga instructor. When the two are assigned a big case they must work out whether they want to solve the case or follow their hearts.','/Am7AhZYG7HLksY5E35oaEJ3Desz.jpg','2003-06-09',116,'Released','They\'re two cops with one shot at solving a murder... and surviving each other.','Hollywood Homicide',11375,6.9043,5.2,'AjXl3GWGg1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17786,_binary '\0','/yrNvvUB0IkeLYUoZO51QDagatW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329737',6.2,5424,'en','It\'s a Very Merry Muppet Christmas Movie','The owner of a bank (Miss Bitterman) wants to own the Muppet Theatre so she can build a nightclub over it. After she tricks Pepe into giving her the only copy of the contract between her father and the Muppets, she changes it so the Muppets have very little time to pay a debt they owe. Meanwhile, the Muppets are trying to put on a Christmas show. After the Muppets are confronted by Bitterman, they make a lot of sacrifices to save up so they can keep the Theatre.','/j5O65ITSvFGalNI2wRHHAPymO5R.jpg','2002-11-29',88,'Released','An inspirational, celebrational Muppets Christmas!','It\'s a Very Merry Muppet Christmas Movie',13352,3.6104,6,'O1Uf_oqCdDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17787,_binary '\0','/2bCcbNyB1g5F8CXqABo0JsNig73.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329767',6.8,8265,'da','Wilbur begår selvmord','The strange comedy film of two close brothers; one, Wilbur, who wants to kill himself, and the other, Harbour, who tries to prevent this. When their father dies leaving them his bookstore they meet a woman who makes their lives a bit better yet with a bit more trouble as well.','/bRrHJbr8kMb849IKBZ0RBk2Vmte.jpg','2002-11-08',111,'Released','Meet a man dying to live','Wilbur Wants to Kill Himself',156,2.1215,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17788,_binary '\0','/vBDHS8bdo5vzqaaqviMupznoRaN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329774',4.5,77242,'en','xXx: State of the Union','Darius Stone\'s criminal record and extreme sports obsession make him the perfect candidate to be the newest XXX agent. He must save the U.S. government from a deadly conspiracy led by five-star general and Secretary of Defense George Deckert.','/nL9J0N3HJSdZTKRsd5xcE6IzL5s.jpg','2005-04-27',101,'Released','Prepare for the next level.','xXx: State of the Union',11679,11.3671,5.103,'TS8Pl4tsJGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17789,_binary '\0','/3fTp3zRVxynf3G9pjgoKTssnlmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0329783',6,2295,'en','You Wish!','A frustrated teen\'s careless wish sends his little brother into a world of forgotten dreams. Now, he must navigate whimsical challenges and learn the true value of family before time runs out to bring him back!','/ogsjMXr9xzi0sZ8BcgiaJAg85n6.jpg','2003-01-10',87,'Released',NULL,'You Wish!',111485,5.0495,5.8,'eC3eUEdL6qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17790,_binary '\0','/pkFlwWtIwMkMaq9eZTZG0VeawKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330069',7.2,4945,'en','Blue Collar Comedy Tour: The Movie','The comedic stylings of four sort-of famous funnymen are brought to the big screen courtesy of this 2002 documentary.','/fUlTnmldkZQCSOy3nCAfire0SWM.jpg','2003-01-10',105,'Released',NULL,'Blue Collar Comedy Tour: The Movie',23626,2.0734,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17791,_binary '\0','/dsRrrwHcZPS7Xb4VK8MCCoDd1Py.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330082',2.3,1646,'en','Boom','The fashion world meets the underworld in BOOM, written and directed by Kaizad Gustad and produced by Ayesha Shroff under the banner of Quest Films','/ctNn9pZpLm7x5hvMw3rlfj48FEF.jpg','2003-09-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Boom',20791,1.9715,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17792,_binary '\0','/lJQBWCJYL44JG9FGv6xzgCJ3cSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330099',4.9,17223,'en','The Brown Bunny','Bud Clay races motorcycles in the 250cc Formula II class of road racing. After a race in New Hampshire, he has five days to get to his next race in California. During his road trip, he is haunted by memories of the last time he saw Daisy, his true love.','/bGzU4TgdqmMjIfPIgf2MjDW6H7c.jpg','2003-11-14',93,'Released','ADULTS ONLY','The Brown Bunny',12703,4.1407,5.4,'Xg1dUrJ9qeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17793,_binary '\0','/p6hAttOqiF0nxB4ZywjU6TEBJir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330111',5.6,4928,'en','The Calcium Kid','When milkman Jimmy Connelly accidentally puts Britain\'s contender for the World title out of action, he is propelled from amateur boxer to the world stage and announced as the replacement contender for the championship fight.','/eug0h5nFQZTClWpmuf3E3xovsgS.jpg','2004-04-30',89,'Released','It takes a lotta bottle to be the champ','The Calcium Kid',31063,2.7179,5.5,'TiwkKyCwHDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17794,_binary '\0','/pFJ9aixC7McbaQ3aRSeke8NwQjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330136',6.3,1223,'en','Charly','Sam Roberts thinks he has all the answers: the purpose of life, the meaning of love, the plan for a perfect future. Until Charly walks into his life.','/lx0D3Yp9pOhBkueuBYly3XSiS3z.jpg','2002-09-27',103,'Released','Real Love Stories Have No Ending','Charly',38951,0.9221,7.1,'lfMLZMvqed0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17795,_binary '\0','/2exYPi3NK8blXSdhPt1krr82FUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330152',6.6,3120,'en','The Christmas Shoes','Two separate stories mesh - in the first, a young music teacher, Maggie Andrews, begins dying of a heart condition and her son Nathan tries to get a pair of Christmas shoes for her before she dies. In the second, lawyer Robert Layton and his wife Kate are slowly drifting apart and the matter comes to a head during Christmas when Kate takes over for Maggie for the school choir.','/uDuFMPcx64Tbd46CvPLjsxWoJrw.jpg','2002-12-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Shoes',30768,2.3456,6.8,'YFviZZv1MX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17796,_binary '\0','/jEVBSiSZwfWok2eyRUZP6IviJ1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330217',4.9,2260,'hi','दिल का रिश्ता','Wealthy Jai Mehta is a young man with a heart that has gold. He supports many charitable organizations in India and one day when he visits a deaf and dumb school, he falls in love with the teacher there, Tia Sharma, expresses his love to her and is openly humiliated when she introduces her fiancé, Raj. Soon after Raj and Tia gets married and are proud parents of a baby boy, Anshu. A heart broken Jai takes to alcohol and one night under the influence of alcohol, Jai\'s car collide with Raj and Tia\'s car mysteriously killing Raj and seriously injuring Tia about the head. Tia is treated by doctor, recovers but is unable to remember anything from her troubled past. Jai makes it his responsibility to take care of her, slowly she falls in love with him and proposes marriage. But will this marriage takes place or will Tia remembers her past and takes revenge from Jai for the death of her husband and for her current condition','/ykfDAJ4rUtytVPfkHkBgLu6D0yg.jpg','2003-01-17',150,'Released',NULL,'Dil Ka Rishta',105025,1.5427,6.354,'kWGufI0A9go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17797,_binary '\0','/cxULojvpOWYX8AUG5eJpTYS8IbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330229',7.5,18057,'ja','ドールズ','Dolls takes puppeteering as its overriding motif, which relates thematically to the action provided by the live characters. Chief among those tales is the story of Matsumoto and Sawako, a young couple whose relationship is about to be broken apart by the former\'s parents, who have insisted their son take part in an arranged marriage to his boss\' daughter.','/vQ9XBpH88jvO3hpHt9Zm5IHe5NP.jpg','2002-10-12',114,'Released','Three stories of never-ending love.','Dolls',870,2.6885,7.5,'jKoDf0Yrphw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17798,_binary '\0','/mE3Z5CkndqNObVwyv6HKMUcz0ow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330243',8.1,13574,'pl','Dzień świra','It is a bitter story about a middle-aged man, who hates his life and other people, including himself. Adam Miauczynski, the character known from director Marek Koterski\'s previous films, is a 49 year-old teacher, who reads poetry during school lessons and later goes home swearing and calling his neighbours\' names. The worst pain for him is the next 5 minutes of living. He doesn\'t accept himself and even everyday contacts with others cause his aggression. Though constantly dreaming of a romantic love, he is not bold enough to make his dreams come true. The desperate Miauczynski personalizes our own fears and obsessions, which have become so visible recently.','/2FT8jX2bPHTv8VDC6c4AvBEEq65.jpg','2002-06-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Day of the Wacko',20719,2.4557,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17799,_binary '\0','/cClWTo3ftVXvV1sF8vlLuWfnlph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330373',7.7,764823,'en','Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire','When his name emerges from the Goblet of Fire, Harry Potter becomes a competitor in a grueling battle for glory among three wizarding schools. Signs of Voldemort\'s return emerge as Harry\'s friends help him prepare for the Triwizard Tournament.','/fECBtHlr0RB3foNHDiCBXeg9Bv9.jpg','2005-11-16',157,'Released','Dark and difficult times lie ahead.','Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire',674,46.177,7.8,'4xkFJgcCQRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17800,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330452',6.7,1416,'en','The Interrogation of Michael Crowe','When 12-year-old Stephanie Crowe is brutally murdered at her home in her small home town, the authorities foolishly jump to conclusions that her 14-year-old brother Michael must be responsible. They completely ignore strong evidence that suggests another suspect is the one. They work hard to force Michael to falsely confess to what he did not do, in order to avoid tougher investigation.','/4LozgZP8J7NHsC8fXiq2tIfKoCc.jpg','2002-12-02',100,'Released',NULL,'The Interrogation of Michael Crowe',56523,2.9131,6.9,'GHgehuZblDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17801,_binary '\0','/tqn6XJnzZV25yU75tr6TFBUNs4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330501',6,4810,'ja','呪怨2 ビデオ版','On his request, the sensitive sister of a real estate agent visits a house he intends to put up for sale, only to cross paths with its resident curse.','/8cgf6nczK5kSbSHmvIUtig58uQT.jpg','2000-03-25',76,'Released',NULL,'Ju-on: The Curse 2',44203,1.901,6.235,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17802,_binary '\0','/lZXWOTy1FOzW2TQKY4XhM8gfhEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330536',7.4,2674,'ja','拳銃は俺のパスポート','A gang lord hires Kamimura, a hit man, to take out a rival boss who\'s gotten greedy.','/hZsInFWTUyxxdp8UrokyEFICqZT.jpg','1967-02-04',84,'Released',NULL,'A Colt is My Passport',38728,1.2982,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17803,_binary '\0','/tjlVklWsCrJH2XkoT1I2LIXvkvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330602',6.7,7224,'en','Mambo Italiano','When an Italian man comes out of the closet, it affects both his life and his crazy family.','/siYFoZUq0HOCksnOc7me8YT1AOo.jpg','2003-06-06',89,'Released','Things change. Family doesn\'t.','Mambo Italiano',321,4.5818,6,'Fw8s2TGeJSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17804,_binary '\0','/76G3sFkP5DoUIIx585ATriqhhJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330664',6.9,1530,'en','Murder, She Wrote: The Celtic Riddle','Jessica Fletcher is off to solve another murder mystery, this time in Ireland.','/hRA70jq3qFPV3uJnXIaLa3u7JSN.jpg','2003-05-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Murder, She Wrote: The Celtic Riddle',238294,2.5327,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17805,_binary '\0','/QfgzgVa6bfZgY3mEeiobRduVkh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330691',4.9,6082,'it','Il cartaio','Policewoman Anna Mari is forced to play a dangerous game with the title serial killer. If she loses, she witnesses the maniac\'s tortured victims having their throats cut in explicit close-up detail via webcam. She teams up with British cop John Brennan to find out the identity of the murderer.','/33rZkxArZICmef1UgSl59PKK9Vd.jpg','2004-01-02',103,'Released','A serial killer with a vice for Video Poker','The Card Player',15483,2.6006,4.4,'uK8arz8yoSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17806,_binary '\0','/obZ3HXsiIhZtfCUBgvzBXOYfOhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330702',7,8992,'it','Non ti muovere','While waiting for the brain surgery of his daughter Angela, victim of a motorcycle accident, the surgeon Timoteo recalls his torrid affair with and passion for Italia, a simple woman from slums in the periphery of the big city where he lives. The ghost of the beloved and sexual object of desire Italia chases him in his memories.','/o5kErZoLG5eAQ5IqZxUoIzNmlJ1.jpg','2004-03-12',125,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Move',16729,4.2382,7,'pDZQk4Y8OkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17807,_binary '\0','/eZCNm8u9w7nEYWgbPXHFQpGf9A7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330760',6.5,1605,'en','The Pentagon Papers','This compelling political drama is based on the true story of high-ranking Pentagon official Daniel Ellsberg, who, during the Nixon era, strove to preserve American democracy by leaking top-secret documents to the New York Times and Washington Post. The documents in question would eventually become famous as the Pentagon Papers, which revealed the true reasons for U.S. involvement in Vietnam.','/q2npPf6898vk78b20DPpcglyNcA.jpg','2003-03-09',92,'Released','His greatest act of patriotism was an act of treason.','The Pentagon Papers',40113,1.6912,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17808,_binary '\0','/ziexSS07RmowuyqAdJMh1sGxjHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330793',6.4,183048,'en','The Punisher','When undercover FBI agent Frank Castle\'s wife and son are slaughtered, he becomes \'the Punisher\' -- a ruthless vigilante willing to go to any length to avenge his family.','/7rmA1HwYp2GKM85BL0cVwCaosGr.jpg','2004-04-15',124,'Released','There is no justice, there is only revenge.','The Punisher',7220,17.0478,6.4,'TqVSFchQEyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17809,_binary '\0','/d5Vw8K3r5HONHatWOtbazUHm9SY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330802',7.1,2540,'fi','Raid','Raid is a mysterious drifter and ex-criminal who comes and goes as he pleases. He has been away from the country for an extended period of time but learns on his return that his ex-girlfriend Tarja has presumably died in a fire that he soon discovers was a larceny. He is also contacted by inspector Jansson, who he knows from the past regarding the murder of a protestor. Raid begins his investigation and soon finds that there\'s more to the cases than meets the eye.','/nvZP1504zfdegmLlOeKKbbGIxAQ.jpg','2003-01-31',128,'Released',NULL,'Raid',20375,2.5528,6.1,'xCWyoCRbU9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17810,_binary '\0','/4q43NFnDpUlLjw6TKpDxMyEIF3G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330843',6.8,9696,'hi','साथिया','A couple elopes to get married and set up home hoping that just love will do the trick - but that\'s just the beginning of their story.','/905TrVqL3R6PmaT2difJaB6I0OM.jpg','2002-12-20',143,'Released',NULL,'Saathiya',20656,1.9617,6.161,'FCYp6V8BJR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17811,_binary '\0','/aPTNUl2DAWsYX8i5of715XTdJ6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330859',6.6,1619,'en','Scary Godmother: Halloween Spooktakular','Scary Godmother is the whimsical all-ages story that follows the first trick-or-treating adventure of Hannah Marie, a young girl whose rotten older cousin is babysitting her one dark Halloween. Unhappy to be saddled with Hannah, her cousin cooks up a scheme to frighten her. But his scheme backfires when Hannah gets help from her Scary Godmother.','/dmmL7DZmCVM5ORsgI4HHj5B6soY.jpg','2003-10-22',47,'Released','Celebrate our Spooky Night!','Scary Godmother: Halloween Spooktakular',48567,2.4601,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17812,_binary '\0','/1R3SGbnlVNByhRxj9qufZDZp2sH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330904',6.8,5958,'ja','六月の蛇','Rinko, a woman in a sexless marriage, is blackmailed by a stalker with intimate photos, forcing her into a series of erotic acts that disrupt her mundane life.','/v8HRcVaZS5IV3InYxnAWIzzVqwc.jpg','2003-06-13',77,'Released',NULL,'A Snake of June',33431,2.1357,6.8,'CXlv-KWeIQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17813,_binary '\0','/wHiihCGJqW4okT2xNqKDF0W6q98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330911',7,2076,'sv','Elina – som om jag inte fanns','In rural Sweden of the early 1950s, little Elina goes to school again after recovering from tuberculosis, the same illness that has killed her father a few years earlier. Elina\'s family belongs to Finnish-speaking Finns frowned upon by a staunch schoolmistress who starts hounding Elina for questioning her authority. Elina\'s mother, sister, and a liberal young male teacher all try to mediate the ensuing battle of wills between Elina and Miss Holm. Elina finds consolation in wandering out on the dangerous marshlands to have imaginary conversations with her dead father. Written by Markku Kuoppamäki','/80mLBYT7pdtm4SPlrMkA1cDoSdT.jpg','2003-01-31',77,'Released',NULL,'Elina: As If I Wasn\'t There',46814,1.4914,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17814,_binary '\0','/7WvqS5L82rClyGx6bxWvJ7mKyoq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330977',6.1,2373,'ta','தமிழன்','Surya is a lawyer with right values, who tries to redress things the legal way. He falls in love with Priya. His brother-in-law Shakthivel, also an upright lawyer, is killed in the process of upholding justice. Surya\'s sister also meets a pitiful end at the hands of criminals. But Surya refuses to give up. His mission is to make the layman understand his legal rights and how he does so forms the crux of the story.','/3Y6SCeHkCz1JBakEnDqG6xwbn0o.jpg','2002-04-12',150,'Released','Born to win.','Thamizhan',69651,1.4243,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17815,_binary '\0','/4Sddw1BFQFHOIQZ3DY7QS0mGnVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0330994',1.5,9829,'it','Titanic: La leggenda continua','An animated retelling of the worst passenger ship disaster in history. In this version, love blossoms between the upper-class Sir William and the blue-collar Angelica, who is hoping to find romance in America. At the same time, there are also a number of animal passengers, including talking dogs, cats and mice, who are also looking forward to arriving in the New World.','/s1PHRSlos2hIFrtA8Ze0JybJTGb.jpg','2000-09-15',70,'Released','A full-length animated feature, based on the legend of the Titanic','Titanic: The Legend Goes On...',71235,2.0308,2.8,'QyuU5UrlJ-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17816,_binary '\0','/13M2pSAnOi7OVLgnJRvcpMmAZHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331080',7.1,3029,'de','Rad der Zeit','Wheel of Time is Werner Herzog\'s photographed look at the largest Buddhist ritual in Bodh Gaya, India.','/d26W3zIQXucyHU6s98DVyOVlqV1.jpg','2003-10-30',83,'Released',NULL,'Wheel of Time',51311,1.6825,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17817,_binary '\0','/k6081p3YV0w4Aqv1iuuEmx8TLh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331175',7.1,2604,'en','Any Way the Wind Blows','Antwerp, early June. On a sweltering Friday, eight people dream of a different life. There is wind and music, police and paranoia, gossip and arguing. There\'s an ancient virus, a lost Frisbee, a dead horse, and, wandering the city, an enigmatic phenomenon called Windman who feels everyone\'s pain but can\'t seem to help himself. In the evening a party awaits them...','/a83O7SAIcHyUuXESl1cfhcwnhf.jpg','2003-05-17',127,'Released',NULL,'Any Way the Wind Blows',17001,1.4142,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17818,_binary '\0','/vucwXdyRhttm6ditwA0wOht7fzi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331216',4.4,1467,'hi','चोर मचाए शोर','After serving a two-year stretch in the slammer, thief Shyam Singh (Bobby Deol) returns to his secret hiding place to retrieve a priceless stolen diamond, only to discover that the site has become a police precinct. To gain entry, Shyam masquerades as a cop but soon arouses the suspicions of a fellow officer (Om Puri). Director David Dhawan\'s action comedy also stars Bipasha Basu, Paresh Rawal and Shilpa Shetty.','/zZtRVP9lnCzoqajWYIHYKBGX3mb.jpg','2002-08-23',145,'Released',NULL,'Chor Machaaye Shor',309386,1.2913,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17819,_binary '\0','/9PwnAeVUoxajOEXiv1AI3W9XQmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331217',8.4,1222,'en','Christmas Eve on Sesame Street','Everyone on Sesame Street is preparing for Christmas: Bert and Ernie exchange gifts in a \"The Gift of the Magi\" fashion, Cookie Monster wants to get his most desired treat this year, and Big Bird worries when Oscar tells him that if Santa Claus can\'t fit down the chimney on Christmas Eve, nobody would get presents. Luckily for him, Grover and Kermit the Frog (along with some interviewed kids) decide to help with his investigation, but when Big Bird decides to take matters into his own hands, all of Sesame Street is thrown into a mad dash to find him.','/6W2DvQl7GkkWjzzXXEs6XopkpyM.jpg','1978-12-03',60,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Eve on Sesame Street',306685,1.5593,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17820,_binary '\0','/yN9oaRCoL4VTHGrmz4den1Viptz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331282',7,2143,'sr','Мала ноћна музика','Spasoje and Cole are cute and silly boys who constantly find themselves in risky situations. They work in a morgue. One night they heard mobile phone that rings in your pocket just dead guy. Of course, they can not resist, and answer the call. On the other side man voice ordered them to go to a specific address and get some money. Cole and Spasoje don\'t reject easy profit...','/RzRD1qqkmBWmojLkCmqq0iVLG0.jpg','2002-08-22',95,'Released','If you die of laughter, we give your money back.','A Little Night Music',70527,1.7704,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17821,_binary '\0','/tOK9iWvwVE98QHzi8G5QnI7OLvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331338',6.2,1792,'en','16 Years of Alcohol','16 Years of Alcohol is a 2003 drama film written and directed by Richard Jobson, based on his 1987 novel. The film is Jobson\'s first directorial effort, following a career as a television presenter on BSkyB and VH-1, and as the vocalist for the 1970s punk rock band The Skids.','/pWOrn2waRpTNNpSrSkBoDm657lD.jpg','2003-05-17',102,'Released','Trainspotting meets A Clockwork Orange','16 Years of Alcohol',29656,2.2627,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17822,_binary '\0','/9uZUSc8S2BlwNKkES4QRwxh9IXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331370',7.1,7869,'es','Whisky','When his long-lost brother resurfaces, Jacobo, desperate to prove his life has added up to something, looks to scrounge up a wife. He turns to Marta, an employee at his sock factory, with whom he has a prickly relationship.','/zteglNK16wK8kGD74J4npQyCUBl.jpg','2004-08-06',99,'Released',NULL,'Whisky',36971,1.1701,6.9,'rNbNqBVBsHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17823,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331421',5.2,1391,'hi','Akhiyon Se Goli Maare','Akelinder or Bhangari Dada (Kader Khan) has a shop at Chor bazaar which he runs illegally, he lives with his wife and only daughter Kiran (Raveena Tandon). Bhangari wants his daughter to be married to a gangster, so he begins his search. He finds Shakti dada (Shakti Kapoor) and wants him to be married to Kiran but Kiran already loves Raj (Govinda), a wealthy man who has no links to crime. But in order to satisfy her dad, she persuades Raj to pose as a Gangster for time being. For this they search a Trainer called Subramaniam (Johnny Lever), who teaches Raj to act as a Gangster. Finally Raj becomes successful posing as a gangster but Bhangari\'s dad (Kader Khan) somehow appears and doesn\'t want Kiran to marry to a gangster. Will Raj be able to clean his image?','/qK7ceXlDh10AJxEz53dHlWhjPYL.jpg','2002-08-02',146,'Released',NULL,'Akhiyon Se Goli Maare',158723,1.3767,5.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17824,_binary '\0','/aPWyBhUyZQaoaVe0WOQkT0ALjyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331468',5.1,26512,'en','Cold Creek Manor','A family moves from New York into an old mansion in the countryside, still filled with the previous owner\'s things. As they begin to make it their own, a series of events begin to occur that makes them believe that the former inhabitants are not yet gone.','/2AKitfwCoCmHU4PTtC5oF6LImlG.jpg','2003-09-19',118,'Released','The perfect house hides the perfect crime.','Cold Creek Manor',12767,4.9352,5.4,'EUKuySo1mzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17825,_binary '\0','/rGBdYe6SfSLZlknJHdyB6Sv06Nr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331621',7,1222,'ta','ரன்','Siva comes to Madras from a small Tamil Nadu town to study. He instantly falls in love with elusive stranger Priya who resists his charms quite persistently. Madhavan later discovers that romancing Priya can be a dangerous hobby.','/9aGNzJwCxhDrDtrHWoKqsMsThWy.jpg','2002-05-09',157,'Released',NULL,'Run',69590,0.9942,6.868,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17826,_binary '\0','/m8y7OjvCBLmJfG6CIb5gpXFSLec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331632',5.4,74458,'en','Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed','A masked villain wreaks mayhem on the city of Coolsville with a monster machine that creates real-life versions of Mystery Inc.\'s former foes like The 10,000 Volt Ghost, The Cotton Candy Glob, The Skelemen and The Pterodactyl Ghost. Fred, Daphne, Shaggy, Velma and Scooby-Doo launch an investigation into the monster outbreak that leaves Shaggy and Scooby questioning their roles in Mystery Inc. Eager to prove their detective skills, the ever-ravenous duo comes up with a secret plan to solve the mystery all by themselves. Can the gang unravel their most challenging case?','/5BrXCJrs22bR5KR6mLHluYo6y4m.jpg','2004-03-24',93,'Released','Doo the fright thing.','Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed',11024,6.7463,6.119,'mwsDWv26sVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17827,_binary '\0','/oyKXimC0eJH8N7aBiNVzhEKdqmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331639',6.1,5809,'hi','Shakti: The Power','A couple visits the husband\'s family in India and finds itself in the middle of a fratricidal battle.','/3nn3XFCa0FreqSG7GfDK5bDUH12.jpg','2002-09-20',185,'Released','The Power','Shakti: The Power',161179,2.2005,6.409,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17828,_binary '\0','/72jbXJIXiGdLzrqfbKynVhtnl5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331811',7.1,52928,'en','11:14','Tells the seemingly random yet vitally connected story of a set of incidents that all converge one evening at 11:14pm. The story follows the chain of events of five different characters and five different storylines that all converge to tell the story of murder and deceit.','/3TFB0Doe92l9Jgc5qtUnE6r9rqt.jpg','2004-08-20',86,'Released','Fate can change in seconds.','11:14',9282,4.7505,6.8,'XS8gh5qMlFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17829,_binary '\0','/lFI2YmvPGKVYpGZ4kKXpL9oNoi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331834',5.5,1526,'ja','ALIVE','Tenshu is imprisoned and sentenced to death for murdering the men who raped his girlfriend. However, he manages to survive his execution and is presented with an option: face another execution attempt or subject himself to their bizarre and dangerous experiments.','/4BvfITuoAHhCTPz5f0jFCjbHNzm.jpg','2003-06-21',119,'Released','A life worse than death.','Alive',5844,1.4889,5.8,'Fqw97laxbNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17830,_binary '\0','/r8L44sbcIzJHbFb9Wa4dNsxqlO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331851',5.3,1287,'hi','Armaan','Dr. Siddharth Sinha is a dedicated selfless doctor who dreams of building a state-of-the-art hospital with all the modern instruments and amenities for patient care . His foster son Akash shares his dream . Akash falls in love with Neha Mathur , an anaesthetist in the same hospital . In a friend\'s party , Akash meets Sonia who is a spoilt daughter of a millionaire Gulshan Kapoor . Sonia develops an infatuation for Akash . Gulshan Kapoor proposes to Dr. Siddharth Sinha that he will donate a big sum of money to his hospital , on the condition that Akash marries Sonia . Dr. Siddharth Sinha declines but dies of a heart attack a few days later . Burdened with fulfilling his father\'s dream , Akash decides to marry Sonia sacrificing his own love . But even after marriage Sonia is jealous of Neha and constantly accuses Akash of infidelity which leaves him in a dilemma , torn between two women .','/iUWnIdPCPA38i8eq9hpEBDTAeBM.jpg','2003-05-16',158,'Released','Love... Ambition... Desire...','Armaan',73259,0.8339,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17831,_binary '\0','/jUiZOFbC9MjQV3gzi9nn7AsQ4Ea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331933',5.5,26695,'en','Man of the House','Texas Ranger Roland Sharp is assigned to protect the only witnesses to the murder of a key figure in the prosecution of a drug kingpin -- a group of University of Texas cheerleaders. Sharp must now go undercover as an assistant cheerleading coach and move in with the young women.','/anBhlqCABytNvybE2Xr3tvsCOTp.jpg','2005-02-25',100,'Released','Protecting witnesses is a challenge. Living with them is impossible.','Man of the House',13498,7.5528,5.8,'a39EYIVPAhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17832,_binary '\0','/5TxdHuNzox3DKHHoSl3HCWDGi74.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331952',5.8,14966,'en','The Clearing','When affluent executive Wayne Hayes is kidnapped by a disgruntled employee and held for ransom in a forest, Wayne’s wife is forced to reckon with the FBI agents as they negotiate with the kidnapper.','/xA61ULyMRTlX5GCBpI0HPiEpu9L.jpg','2004-07-02',95,'Released',NULL,'The Clearing',10742,4.926,5.751,'GfDJHQAcl-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17833,_binary '\0','/6Mh45I2bE4uEjy19Jk45THEmLd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0331953',5.7,33049,'en','Club Dread','When a serial killer interrupts the fun at the swanky Coconut Pete\'s Coconut Beach Resort -- a hedonistic island paradise for swingers --- it\'s up to the club\'s staff to stop the violence ... or at least hide it!','/9slWyVotwxZNthMcKoeFaK3tgNz.jpg','2004-02-27',104,'Released','A vacation to die for.','Club Dread',11217,4.7657,5.189,'mEoysl_tMqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17834,_binary '\0','/pO5t46tVAagZwr1hllMtCjXjT8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332047',6.3,50369,'en','Fever Pitch','Lindsay is stuck in the middle of her relationship with Ben and his passion for the Boston Red Sox.','/xwJBEOM5BVElAgQIA82KBLX10fu.jpg','2005-04-06',104,'Released','A comedy about the game of love.','Fever Pitch',11431,6.6942,6.2,'uKaldffU02c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17835,_binary '\0','/rcJynPuUuSBuzOmahUTasliurzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332136',7,35442,'en','If Only','After his impetuous musician girlfriend, Samantha, dies in an accident shortly after they had a fight (and nearly broke up), Ian Wyndham, a grief-stricken British businessman living in London gets a chance to relive the day all over again, in the hope of changing the events that led up to her getting killed.','/m55qCh44VzrDhWSINr1MdB7RtAb.jpg','2004-01-23',92,'Released','He loved her like there was no tomorrow.','If Only',15775,4.2411,7,'T9U5p4vnwik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17836,_binary '\0','/zdXnJqBaGFVtLoPNuMeKfEYUViZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332280',7.8,702132,'en','The Notebook','An epic love story centered around an older man who reads aloud to a woman with Alzheimer\'s. From a faded notebook, the old man\'s words bring to life the story about a couple who is separated by World War II, and is then passionately reunited, seven years later, after they have taken different paths.','/rNzQyW4f8B8cQeg7Dgj3n6eT5k9.jpg','2004-06-25',123,'Released','Behind every great love is a great story.','The Notebook',11036,32.1742,7.889,'FC6biTjEyZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17837,_binary '\0','/sQLAF4RGTgOBwscrHEKHD4Qnrfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332281',5.3,1717,'en','Happy End','Val is 23 years old and full of dreams. She travels to New York to become an actress. She is lonely in a strange country, in a strange city, with little money and no friends. In her path, she meets weird people who they, also, seek their dreams but everyday life gets in the way. Tired and hungry she sits on the corner of a building. Across the street a writer whose fantasy has dry out. In an instant she becomes his muse... At the Oscar\'s night she will be the one with the Golden Globe in her hands.','/jbLxetPVJH03a8CZPpa0bw4E2tI.jpg','2003-12-24',98,'Released',NULL,'Happy End',29079,2.0268,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17838,_binary '\0','/hhQ0RKPbBBqCRc13W6d5tzFT7zT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332285',7.1,3569,'en','Off the Map','An 11-year-old girl watches her father come down with a crippling depression. Over one summer, she learns answers to several mysteries and comes to terms with love and loss.','/9v3M2fAn5N8A78CZeOGSwSdtPo.jpg','2003-09-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Off the Map',24078,1.7632,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17839,_binary '\0','/9viXmNTZczTzVQbQpImNr1hUsxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332318',3.9,1705,'en','Pinocchio 3000','This is the story of a little robot known as Pinocchio 3000 whose greatest wish is to become a real boy. The year is 3000. Geppetto, with the help of his faithful assistant, Spencer the cyber penguin, and by the holographic fairy Cyberina, creates Pinocchio, a prototype superrobot equipped for emotions. But before he can be given a heart and become a real boy, Cyberina insists that Pinocchio learn the difference between right and wrong.','/qtTJzlzJf5FuY4qWjleSsLIgYjD.jpg','2004-05-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Pinocchio 3000',23056,4.1185,4.4,'EfhjX-H5w-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17840,_binary '\0','/ehy1Q7v1xnmi9E55jQ9X7OX2Dr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332375',6.7,51567,'en','Saved!','Mary is a good Christian girl who goes to a good Christian high school where she has good Christian friends and a perfect Christian boyfriend. Her life seems perfect, until the day that she finds out that her boyfriend may be gay — and that she’s pregnant.','/nmf2tFTcRJZVEQ9e3mgLH5gAQYs.jpg','2004-06-11',92,'Released','Heaven help us.','Saved!',13193,3.3778,6.4,'cgWdUumlgUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17841,_binary '\0','/k5MTAtE9CCi5TWA84qaFMYv3ajB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332379',7.2,362138,'en','The School of Rock','Fired from his band and hard up for cash, guitarist and vocalist Dewey Finn finagles his way into a job as a fifth-grade substitute teacher at a private school, where he secretly begins teaching his straight-A students the finer points of rock \'n\' roll and the power of sticking it to the man. But as the school’s stern principal closes in and the Battle of the Bands looms, Dewey must risk everything to prove that rock \'n\' roll can change lives.','/zXLXaepIBvFVLU25DH3wv4IPSbe.jpg','2003-10-03',110,'Released','He just landed the gig of his life: 5th grade.','The School of Rock',1584,14.4281,7.09,'KdzWQT0wLCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17842,_binary '\0','/9sSSBZJUEedcannAaJE0UezTqub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332381',6.8,1812,'is','Hafið','Wealthy, aging patriarch Thordur assembles his scattered heirs in his remote Icelandic fishing village to discuss the future of the family fishery. But bringing everyone together unleashes a storm of long-repressed dark family secrets.','/pO490YKiao764Cq9MePC48KbfRv.jpg','2002-09-13',109,'Released',NULL,'The Sea',27217,1.3892,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17843,_binary '\0','/ZPcC5hJh21QiW0jmhMQhZeSoGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332452',7.3,649114,'en','Troy','In year 1250 B.C. during the late Bronze age, two emerging nations begin to clash. Paris, the Trojan prince, convinces Helen, Queen of Sparta, to leave her husband Menelaus, and sail with him back to Troy. After Menelaus finds out that his wife was taken by the Trojans, he asks his brother Agamemnon to help him get her back. Agamemnon sees this as an opportunity for power. They set off with 1,000 ships holding 50,000 Greeks to Troy.','/a07wLy4ONfpsjnBqMwhlWTJTcm.jpg','2004-05-13',163,'Released','For passion. For honor. For destiny. For victory. For love.','Troy',652,30.5312,7.192,'6FG3BfPuwBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17844,_binary '\0','/8MVitvSlFmHLCDgJr93NvFX7H34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332605',7,2983,'ru','Дом дураков','The war film that\'s not a war film. A film about the mental institution which backdrop is the Chechen war. A story about the patients living in an institution during the war on the border of Chechnia and Russia during the war. The patients have to continue living their day to day life after being invaded twice over, and they have to deal with their sicknesses.','/p3q9U27s7czWbynaxkCvcYWBfPQ.jpg','2002-12-06',104,'Released','It\'s a mad, mad, mad world...','House of Fools',72996,1.3326,5.9,'eSWE_ugZEkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17845,_binary '\0','/svtQAvk4P9h36cMKrsxlg4v20Xn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332639',7.4,4597,'zh','和你在一起','When a violin prodigy Xiaochun and his father head to Beijing seeking fame and fortune, they soon discover a fierce world of cutthroat ambition. But when Xiaochun is \"adopted\" by a famous music tutor, success finally seems within reach - until a shocking discovery begins to unravel his entire world, and the boy must make the most difficult choice of his life. Can he achieve the fame his father had always hoped for without losing the extraordinary passion that sets him apart?','/yG67qljsdR06NzwdWM9wBQ5EkyY.jpg','2002-09-10',116,'Released','Some lessons can only be learned by heart.','Together',18385,1.6458,6.9,'rSyrT6XuSwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17846,_binary '\0','/cOAt3YlPeaN8jw9ff7Riq7QVWG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332658',6.8,17464,'en','Intermission','A raucous story of the interweaving lives and loves of small-town delinquents, shady cops, pretty good girls and very bad boys. With Irish guts and grit, lives collide, preconceptions shatter and romance is tested to the extreme. An ill-timed and poorly executed couple\'s break-up sets off a chain of events affecting everyone in town.','/hQdFebtqcbwKELQHKf1hcjIHD0D.jpg','2003-08-29',105,'Released','Life is what happens in between.','Intermission',16941,3.0658,6.2,'x1X_5yCgTAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17847,_binary '\0','/fCKdK97yRUc7ek1MS7SxKYgkmee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332712',4.5,3969,'en','My Baby\'s Daddy','A trio of young men are forced to grow up quick when their girlfriends all become pregnant around the same time.','/lah4ZvLmjxwF8Pa1UHIm3u2xNuR.jpg','2004-01-09',86,'Released','They\'re going from players to playtime.','My Baby\'s Daddy',26710,2.3131,4.6,'ulme-4tRhYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17848,_binary '\0','/gCwStXfUejqjOOiVdaABgrWSlNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0332831',6.9,1408,'zh','小城之春','In a mansion decimated during World War II, a frustrated, bored housewife, Yuwen, is torn between caring for her ailing husband and her longing for a former sweetheart, a doctor who has come to treat her husband.','/usPnOdqJgVIiJBM0acXNwQW3Hya.jpg','2002-09-04',116,'Released',NULL,'Springtime in a Small Town',61485,1.113,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17849,_binary '\0','/dPQBK2pWa5Ht1qGFDakv1B1z2J9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333074',6.7,2664,'pt','Amarelo Manga','The lives of a macho butcher, his wife, a lonely waitress, a sadist and a flophouse manager intersect in Recife, Brazil.','/jPpO7RQQQ9pHGowyhLdyX0Koeoh.jpg','2002-08-14',103,'Released','The human being is all stomach and sex.','Mango Yellow',80426,1.233,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17850,_binary '\0','/4VVw78ytllyGkc8C7yjNATGq56i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333388',8.3,2147,'pt','Edifício Master','The daily lives and routine of 37 families living in a huge 12-story building in Copacabana, Rio de Janeiro: their drama, aspirations, intimate revelations, loneliness, dreams...','/n3Nf5XD3PjoQoX0z41bNBwOC8Kx.jpg','2002-11-22',110,'Released','A film about people like you and me','Master, a Building in Copacabana',60142,0.8879,8.1,'OcgQfatgwmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17851,_binary '\0','/nyLoesxn5qMLpZTl4QD3kdPO7AH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333701',7.3,1994,'sl','Kajmak i marmelada','A story about a couple from the bottom of the social ladder, about smuggling refugees across borders and other \'suspect\' things- it is, first and foremost, an attempt to tell a story about the worst in people, wherever they may be coming from.','/Aajqwoaug4rNjsBL8PeMW6fnH5h.jpg','2003-11-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Cheese and Jam',70526,1.176,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17852,_binary '\0','/xnJiAxIyYOfB712LqG4yH7HqVt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333764',7.4,4804,'zh','藍色大門','Yueh-chen has an obsession with her classmate Shihao, but is too shy to confess to him directly. She sends in her best friend, Kerou, to act as a go-between, and Shihao ends up falling for Kerou, who is not sure what to think of him.','/wGfHXN9IitbrRrqMAFLYtDUERtP.jpg','2002-09-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Blue Gate Crossing',44708,1.8272,7.2,'9S7RcFgL4kU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17853,_binary '\0','/2mu6XkJE0B6nK5jeOvXOyWPVmhw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333766',7.4,228578,'en','Garden State','Andrew returns to his hometown for his mother’s funeral, a journey that reconnects him with old friends. The trip coincides with his decision to stop taking his powerful antidepressants. A chance meeting with Sam—a girl also struggling with various maladies—opens up the possibility of rekindling emotional connections, confronting his psychologist father, and perhaps beginning a new life.','/h3iqYiGS6F3y7GxaS4AT8nFxZ2i.jpg','2004-07-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Garden State',401,5.4079,7.074,'u82n0e1mgmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17854,_binary '\0','/jmf9dLoKVDDwEB2cb0OJ9fEGbHy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0333780',4.8,80728,'en','Legally Blonde 2: Red, White & Blonde','Now a rising young lawyer, Elle Woods is about to make partner at her firm, but when she finds out her dog\'s relatives are being used as cosmetic test subjects, she heads to Washington D.C. to fight for animal rights.','/4kC0UGTuJgFnlZq2ZM6OiY7nuY8.jpg','2003-07-02',95,'Released','Bigger. Bolder. Blonder.','Legally Blonde 2: Red, White & Blonde',10327,12.2953,5.7,'I25jkF0bdJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17855,_binary '\0','/yKjaeMSOJ0ObahfjcoSPLMSeOXE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0334405',7.6,12670,'en','Spellbound','This documentary follows 8 teens and pre-teens as they work their way toward the finals of the Scripps Howard national spelling bee championship in Washington D.C.','/whPFGfqZayYOU5f5mx0GdXZOgpi.jpg','2002-11-13',97,'Released','Everyone wants the last word.','Spellbound',16636,1.1371,7.3,'J0lMqo53kMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17856,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0334416',7.8,2811,'en','Stevie','In 1995 Director Steve James (Hoop Dreams) returned to rural Southern Illinois to reconnect with Stevie Fielding, a troubled young boy he had been an \'Advocate Big Brother\' to ten years earlier.','/67TAylTWoysC2ffqVO18do0rwEE.jpg','2003-04-11',145,'Released',NULL,'Stevie',51927,0.8037,7,'ux7emenR2pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17857,_binary '\0','/jw15z5cLD7obgE8c2MavCqPM7f8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0334482',7.6,1307,'ml','തെങ്കാശിപ്പട്ടണം','Kannan is in love with his childhood friend Meenakshi but keeps it a secret from his beloved friend Das. However, the friendship between them is ruined as Das falls in love with the same girl.','/5hPACP5jtvT5SPVHaNbBk4keo3n.jpg','2000-12-02',150,'Released',NULL,'Thenkasipattanam',240214,1.1151,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17858,_binary '\0','/phifQtHo3WfVXBKYWDsIVrg4jFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0334725',7,1315,'en','Wondrous Oblivion','David Wiseman is eleven years old and mad about cricket. He has all the kit but none of the skill. When a Jamaican family moves in next door the father starts giving cricket lessons to David, and becomes close to David\'s mother. But this is 1960\'s London, and when the locals start making life difficult for the new arrivals, David has to choose between fitting in and standing up for his new friends.','/icOESDabUE6UTaS9vXV7t1IGLfH.jpg','2004-04-23',106,'Released','A wide-eyed boy in a narrow-minded world.','Wondrous Oblivion',25334,1.4399,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17859,_binary '\0','/ql8eEivmqg2vfas07ucDNAAtAAb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0334754',7.1,7966,'he','יוסי וג\'אגר','A sociological study of two men in the Israeli army who are lovers. The others in the unit react to their situation, suspecting, but not always understanding. One will leave the military soon, a few months away, as a snowy and desolate outpost is guarded from attack.','/iAaoY66dkJiZftsj3bmbWLeNgRt.jpg','2002-08-28',65,'Released','Two soldiers and a love that lasts forever...','Yossi & Jagger',17614,1.4956,6.7,'iLhlQiQcSk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17860,_binary '\0','/7crZgHFGctVmCmNiTtgxenEWQsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335013',6.2,7240,'en','The Company','Ensemble drama centered around a group of ballet dancers, with a focus on one young dancer who\'s poised to become a principal performer.','/kZpURQjJuGvl2a0xI01J8uocCWW.jpg','2003-12-25',112,'Released',NULL,'The Company',52036,3.3217,5.3,'U6rlWpWRPVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17861,_binary '\0','/tuiupUeJrNQkmO6LADHOSjbGJ6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335119',6.9,84883,'en','Girl with a Pearl Earring','This film, adapted from a work of fiction by author Tracy Chevalier, tells a story about the events surrounding the creation of the painting \"Girl With A Pearl Earring\" by 17th century Dutch master Johannes Vermeer. A young peasant maid working in the house of painter Johannes Vermeer becomes his talented assistant and the model for one of his most famous works.','/41DkOi1MvTgTQXt5BevVSzo94kk.jpg','2003-12-12',101,'Released','Discover the mystery behind the legend.','Girl with a Pearl Earring',3635,6.1106,6.642,'8awflTA4QYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17862,_binary '\0','/eDcuAU8mpjRYXOMtDGUYx7Y0tVR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335121',4.8,27362,'en','Godsend','A couple agree to have their deceased son cloned under the supervision of an enigmatic doctor, but bizarre things start to happen years after his rebirth.','/lLncs8FEzKupj19wCqZ3sPmg3eU.jpg','2004-04-30',102,'Released','When a miracle becomes a nightmare, evil is born.','Godsend',11058,4.3459,4.863,'iMIBmhQZCKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17863,_binary '\0','/mdaBC7yEcorGC4uI9U5CEyfWsvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335245',6.2,113145,'en','The Ladykillers','An eccentric, if not charming Southern professor and his crew pose as a band in order to rob a casino, all under the nose of his unsuspecting landlord – a sharp old woman.','/l4g9R39NCp6VaYFrw6q8JwKNW9x.jpg','2004-03-25',104,'Released','The greatest criminal minds of all time have finally met their match.','The Ladykillers',5516,7.6957,6.1,'BVL6AjybCZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17864,_binary '\0','/6ITVHoipvxAS8luzKtHTbPaHLtT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335266',7.7,534824,'en','Lost in Translation','Two lost souls visiting Tokyo -- the young, neglected wife of a photographer and a washed-up movie star shooting a TV commercial -- find an odd solace and pensive freedom to be real in each other\'s company, away from their lives in America.','/3jCLmYDIIiSMPujbwygNpqdpM8N.jpg','2003-09-18',102,'Released','Everyone wants to be found.','Lost in Translation',153,16.4959,7.377,'1s4YQqnbnM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17865,_binary '\0','/4840rkbpsiuow5ew155oVKcqJwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335345',7.3,277088,'en','The Passion of the Christ','A graphic portrayal of the last twelve hours of Jesus of Nazareth\'s life.','/rBM5o2HpmCfDejuIPybI09tkY3V.jpg','2004-02-25',127,'Released','By his wounds, we were healed.','The Passion of the Christ',615,20.0132,7.539,'ezOafmA21NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17866,_binary '\0','/shHQeNfFPCrWoLAYY55aumkbuQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335351',6.1,1872,'fr','La Petite Lili','This film, loosely inspired by Anton Chekov\'s The Seagull, weaves a story about sex, family and the business of making films. When the young and overly sensitive filmmaker Julien screens his new DV art-film starring his girlfriend Lili (Swimming Pool\'s Ludivine Sagnier) --a sexy young local girl--to his famous actress mother Mado, and her lover Brice, an accomplished film director, an unraveling of the delicate peace in their house begins. The graceful beauty Lili, who dreams of becoming a famous actress like Mado, is immediately fascinated by Brice, who gladly falls prey to her charms.','/a310dwedBi2MwT2QpvOtVJQBEIQ.jpg','2003-08-27',104,'Released',NULL,'Little Lili',51865,1.7671,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17867,_binary '\0','/k6Qnu4fTXskJwjFBEZRtTPSLHu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335438',6.1,162901,'en','Starsky & Hutch','Join uptight David Starsky and laid-back Ken \"Hutch\" Hutchinson as they\'re paired for the first time as undercover cops. The new partners must overcome their differences to solve an important case with help from street informant Huggy Bear and persuasive criminal Reese Feldman.','/fmBYVkBjhVspPv3GGus84qhBo1a.jpg','2004-03-05',101,'Released','They\'re the man.','Starsky & Hutch',9384,8.6627,5.8,'o0NsujlK0FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17868,_binary '\0','/xSQF9wV5geTvcXhKGDpsvJwNEp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335559',5.6,30901,'en','Win a Date with Tad Hamilton!','A small-town girl wins a date with a Hollywood star through a contest. When the date goes better than expected, a love triangle forms between the girl, the celebrity, and the girl\'s best friend.','/5kXxbKlIEgMv0t8hLtZ3hfKLmG7.jpg','2004-01-23',95,'Released','In every love story, there\'s only room for one leading man.','Win a Date with Tad Hamilton!',13476,5.2995,5.7,'GbcH9KCN4Xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17869,_binary '\0','/jvgbITybzUZN6upjadXa644cwMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0335563',6.5,24946,'en','Wonderland','On the afternoon of July 1, 1981, Los Angeles police responded to a distress call on Wonderland Avenue and discovered a grisly quadruple homicide. The police investigation that followed uncovered two versions of the events leading up to the brutal murders - both involving legendary porn actor John Holmes.','/mfG8S7D4rYeVqvTzjc3D36PAK3R.jpg','2003-10-23',104,'Released','Sex, drugs, murder. Welcome to L.A.','Wonderland',4997,5.2355,6.093,'tIWMOSKKlgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17870,_binary '\0','/yzMj1q5RGsSXpQZS9XgpHaEDelq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0336264',7.5,2707,'fr','Depuis qu\'Otar est parti...','The one joy in the lives of a mother and daughter comes from the regular letters sent to them from Paris from the family\'s adored son, Otar. When the daughter finds out that Otar has died suddenly, she tries to conceal the truth from her mother, changing the course of their lives forever.','/6XhnliIYcSRb4K0FnUt6KHvw9FX.jpg','2003-09-17',99,'Released','For a mother, a sister and a niece, nothing is the same... Since Otar Left','Since Otar Left',13432,1.3964,6.6,'B082aEXxk4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17871,_binary '\0','/wACHOwiQmTw0EylrLmxhnkrSuX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0336678',6.8,1641,'ko','중독','Two brothers get into a sudden tragic accident and they both fall into a coma at the same time. A year later, the younger brother Dae-jin wakes up believing he is his older brother Ho-jin.','/znBcfFX8BjFDCDwiW5MrKqXPKhT.jpg','2002-10-25',110,'Released','What would you do for love?','Addicted',67025,2.0284,6.1,'JlRECBELnRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17872,_binary '\0','/mU6yYDAfZx1ynXQPeBzBTm4iBGD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0336910',6.2,1604,'en','9 Dead Gay Guys','The story of two lads from Belfast as they stumble their way through the London gay underworld in search of \'gainful employment\'. This being the offering of sexual favours to older gay men in order to subsidise their respective giros. 9 Dead Gay Guys is a high-camp send-up of gay stereotypes.','/wuyqqHOVqGomGBDyH436pX54vrW.jpg','2002-10-18',83,'Released','Who\'s next?','9 Dead Gay Guys',19555,1.7522,5.9,'ONgSyZlB1zQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17873,_binary '\0','/lgml5hKTsTGNqDKKm6UCtY7EqGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337103',5.9,22859,'fr','Les Rivières pourpres 2 : Les Anges de l\'apocalypse','No one is safe when seemingly random killings emerge as a deadly pattern intended to usher in the end of the world. A murder victim with the same DNA as Christ. A serial killer mimicking the deaths of the 12 Apostles. Inspector Niemans and a young, rebellious detective team up with a beautiful expert in religion to crack the case before their elusive suspect completes the cycle of terror, paving the way to an even bigger bloody catastrophe.','/hvQZKLVzW3cYfR5bjgGTGZuCuHs.jpg','2004-02-18',97,'Released','An unholy crime... An unstoppable killer... Caught in a deadly tide.','Crimson Rivers II: Angels of the Apocalypse',60672,5.1054,6.091,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17874,_binary '\0','/lk4GtL72KSxiJQFoCGksmrjSxDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337114',4,1280,'en','Romy and Michele: In the Beginning','It\'s 1987, and best friends Romy and Michele, fresh out of high school, are desperate to get away from their square hometown of Tucson and take their rightful place amongst the beautiful, hip people of Hollywood.','/2n6CB6BUJC336aWqn1oBiEcw50h.jpg','2005-05-30',86,'Released','Before they ruled the reunion, they rocked Hollywood!','Romy and Michele: In the Beginning',36249,2.2191,5.4,'CYzW8paM9gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17875,_binary '\0','/ld7UTOGzZSxIMbuYsb6eQ6QdN4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337563',6.4,253158,'en','13 Going on 30','After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she\'s thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna\'s prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can\'t be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.','/iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg','2004-04-13',98,'Released','For some, 13 feels like it was just yesterday. For Jenna, it was.','13 Going on 30',10096,15.4204,6.778,'_pmFp2W65Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17876,_binary '\0','/qwpkykpdPFycZBhjOQvA0xYluCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337573',6.9,9636,'de','Antikörper','When a notorious German serial killer is captured after committing some of the most heinous acts against humanity ever imaginable, a farmer and police officer from a sleepy rural community on the outskirts of Berlin is drawn into the case as he searches for the answers to a murder that has shaken his tight-knit community.','/wIQP8C3yz8E4J1La9ehIy4Yta6e.jpg','2005-04-24',127,'Released','The Good is the Evil in It','Antibodies',8332,1.6201,6.7,'N4-E4JpXpps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17877,_binary '\0','/oP5d70kOE09OZYvFZDlygQYuqK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337578',7.4,19192,'hi','बागबान','After dedicating their whole life in upbringing their children, elderly couple Raj Malhotra and Pooja gets homeless. Instead of caring, their children treat them as a burden.','/p6NPup58fPjIEAU9tKU4XpQhtTA.jpg','2003-10-03',183,'Released','Can you depend on your family?','Baghban',39839,2.5611,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17878,_binary '\0','/pGlgLhYBBiPerXXgERqsEKn7VlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337579',5.7,17260,'en','Barbershop 2: Back in Business','The continuing adventures of the barbers at Calvin\'s Barbershop. Gina, a stylist at the beauty shop next door, is now trying to cut in on his business. Calvin is again struggling to keep his father\'s shop and traditions alive--this time against urban developers looking to replace mom & pop establishments with name-brand chains. The world changes, but some things never go out of style--from current events and politics to relationships and love, you can still say anything you want at the barbershop.','/n4sOe401udZJWJEOvKvSs3peZcB.jpg','2004-01-20',106,'Released','Let your hair down.','Barbershop 2: Back in Business',21301,5.7418,6.1,'YQTD_yRV_bA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17879,_binary '\0','/bYk4H2MSvNWckhrYhZNQHe8v90o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337592',5.3,10827,'en','Love Don\'t Co$t a Thing','A high school outcast pays a cheerleader to pose as his girlfriend so he can be considered cool.','/88zspc72LIkfiuMnGpHnsWCuqEH.jpg','2003-12-12',100,'Released','Love Don\'t Co$t A Thing but it pays to be yourself.','Love Don\'t Co$t a Thing',21542,5.9088,7.706,'qi83JMiIq1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17880,_binary '\0','/AcPSzUKYMGf8UFBFdhZhoRJTmKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337593',5.8,1472,'en','Sherlock: Case of Evil','Early in his crime-solving career, Sherlock Holmes attempts to prevent Moriarty from cornering the heroin market.','/4cfXiJ5oa0iD18AC0sU4EIRCK1b.jpg','2002-10-25',100,'Released','Forget Everything You Know About Sherlock Holmes','Sherlock: Case of Evil',46561,3.8709,6.264,'xyvsmDD0VTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17881,_binary '\0','/hZXTZ2jNLStwv4JcpWiKvlUomm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337611',5.7,3455,'hi','Dilwale','When Arun is falsely implicated in a murder case, he loses his sanity and is sent to an asylum. However, things take a turn when Vikram, an honest policeman, comes to his aid.','/2ll1GSmybHRZub0gFXNz1YRjYzO.jpg','1994-01-29',180,'Released',NULL,'Dilwale',159164,2.4221,6.421,'Io-HyfTdeYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17882,_binary '\0','/6INxMjS0Cny47NVeg4Cj92RNIbR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337631',6.6,1562,'en','The Boys & Girl from County Clare','In Ireland in the mid 1960s, two feuding brothers and their respective Ceilidh bands compete at a music festival.','/3pO8Ur0tfOlBr2m9zJxMMm5Ha1F.jpg','2003-09-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Boys & Girl from County Clare',1589,1.738,6,'9JIDexBoWFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17883,_binary '\0','/mlLXhoMLdQsr4yz0zflh3qBHIBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337656',5.1,1348,'en','Keep Your Distance','In the perfectly normal town of Louisville, KY, there is a perfectly normal man living the perfect life. David Dailey is a man who has it all: A great career, a community that adores him, and an enduring marriage. But beneath the surface, David\'s idyllic world is crumbling. He\'s haunted by a series of mysterious notes that warn of an imminent fall from grace...','/yxgKaJGMpCEP5kcUq7Elt0Rf6X6.jpg','2005-09-02',94,'Released','Everyone you trust has the power to betray you.','Keep Your Distance',47540,1.515,4.3,'AuPvNEAJPjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17884,_binary '\0','/nsdEvRaKu7yJxHB5i8dsxmnVZvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337689',4.2,2067,'it','Natale sul Nilo','A womanizing lawyer follows his wife and son to a trip to Egypt in a last-ditch effort to make up for his infidelities. Also travelling to Egypt is a bumbling police chief who\'s desperate to keep his rebellious daughter from becoming a showgirl. The two meet during a Nile cruise. Calamity ensues.','/rgeIKAhuSWqxcrFRq9lqybpiLmx.jpg','2002-12-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Natale sul Nilo',42432,1.6142,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17885,_binary '\0','/5dUOTVeNPU2CmEfFniQ8TE6HChG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337692',6,44963,'en','On the Road','Sal Paradise is a young writer whose life is shaken and ultimately redefined by the arrival of Dean Moriarty, a free-spirited, fearless, fast talking Westerner and his girl, Marylou. Traveling cross-country, Sal and Dean venture out on a personal quest for freedom from the conformity and conservatism engulfing them in search of the unknown, themselves, and the pursuit of “it” -- the pure essence of experience.','/k7LQteD02p3VHixbS6NXHkFdFwT.jpg','2012-05-22',142,'Released','\"The best teacher is experience.\"','On the Road',83770,5.2998,5.619,'MNcIPA7F7ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17886,_binary '\0','/7sT7cQFkPCttExFzV9JPZKnhuCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337697',5.9,43977,'en','The Prince & Me','A fairy tale love-story about pre-med student Paige who falls in love with a Danish Prince \"Eddie\" who refused to follow the traditions of his parents and has come to the US to quench his thirst for rebellion. Paige and Edward come from two different worlds, but there is an undeniable attraction between them.','/1rdb6Cr5VuLzW9ha2INswhpgmln.jpg','2004-03-28',111,'Released','Finding your inner princess can be such a royal pain.','The Prince & Me',11137,6.4734,6.211,'nobF8WLI52U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17887,_binary '\0','/7jhCBakn96BcRpjQfFyMZdnrKEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337711',5.6,9724,'en','Rugrats Go Wild','When the Rugrats find themselves stranded on a deserted island, they meet the Thornberrys, a family who agrees to help them escape.','/hpVpXRNY2IsU0xvfXtYOxu0QDwc.jpg','2003-06-13',81,'Released','The family vacation goes overboard.','Rugrats Go Wild',20694,6.395,6.4,'Pb8FpdXuU8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17888,_binary '\0','/kkFwxts0A2E6k2maR0UktH4cV4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337721',7.3,12215,'en','The Snow Walker','A bush pilot in nothern Canada who with the aid of modernity thinks he can handle it all & knows it all. After reluctantly agreeing to transport a local indian girl to a medical facility his light plane crashes & they have to survive whilst finding their way back to civilization. Along the journey the man finds a new respect for the native ways as they battle to survive the elements.','/1UlHIWfqjkizc2qem0IPZBG6nn5.jpg','2003-09-11',103,'Released',NULL,'The Snow Walker',14694,3.2501,7.04,'XNHLc79HF6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17889,_binary '\0','/xTQXtSQQZY5ZbJ1GxEcSCRP4aWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337741',6.8,141011,'en','Something\'s Gotta Give','When perpetually single, aging music industry exec Harry Sanborn, and his latest trophy girlfriend, Marin, arrive at her mother\'s beach house in the Hamptons, they find that her mother, playwright Erica Barry, also plans to stay for the weekend. Erica is scandalized by the relationship and Harry\'s sexist ways. But when Harry has a heart attack while there, and the doctor prescribes bedrest, his only option is to stay at the Barry home. Left in the care of Erica and his doctor, a love triangle starts to take shape.','/1cpdqe0SpiHzzbOLq9GDUUlZdSl.jpg','2003-12-12',128,'Released','After a lifetime of going from girl to girl, the ultimate bachelor is about to encounter something new.','Something\'s Gotta Give',6964,8.7393,6.6,'6zVzIaEuXS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17890,_binary '\0','/wI1zLPtIKHCXISuH60mPU1A2DD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337744',3.4,1630,'en','Vlad','Death and spiritual torment stalk three American students visiting the Carpathian mountain homeland of Vlad Tepes.','/wTEJdNKH7MWbU1OMhV9NTr1IrRx.jpg','2004-09-10',98,'Released','The Original Vampyre...Still Undead.','Vlad',57190,2.1089,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17891,_binary '\0','/1j1HWW08eYsVNw6zDX5aBoLAhmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337824',6.5,3902,'en','And Starring Pancho Villa as Himself','In 1914, the Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa invites studios to shoot his actual battles against Porfírio Diaz army to raise funds for financing guns and ammunition. The Mutual Film Corporation, through producer D.W. Griffith, interests for the proposition and sends the filmmaker Frank Thayer to negotiate a contract with Pancho Villa himself.','/aPXm56o3tEQdk0QTR6sZzmyw4f5.jpg','2003-09-07',112,'Released',NULL,'And Starring Pancho Villa as Himself',24241,2.5577,6.712,'F2oGHM87iKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17892,_binary '\0','/3iPyg1mXyMDczVsPNpeLirjoh3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337851',4.1,2480,'en','Baywatch: Hawaiian Wedding','Mitch Buchannon, believed to have died in a boating accident survived and only has amnesia, he has been recovering in a Los Angeles hospital. His new fiancée, Allison Ford, resembles his old lover, Lt. Stephanie Holden who died years ago.','/nMUGYIvqZdwye3spOAHDP0Fyw7A.jpg','2003-02-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Baywatch: Hawaiian Wedding',56427,3.0089,6,'ohGc1yoovEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17893,_binary '\0','/ueXO7FqIECtcPbpPSw87hiFlrSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337876',6.3,45351,'en','Birth','It took Anna 10 years to recover from the death of her husband, Sean, but now she\'s on the verge of marrying her boyfriend, Joseph, and finally moving on. However, on the night of her engagement party, a young boy named Sean turns up, saying he is her dead husband reincarnated. At first she ignores the child, but his knowledge of her former husband\'s life is uncanny, leading her to believe that he might be telling the truth.','/z70iQ61WqhxETAz8ar2oD8pkIM.jpg','2004-10-29',100,'Released','Careful what you wish for.','Birth',10740,4.9799,6.1,'3mZq5Cgey9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17894,_binary '\0','/AtLIMw6T08lDFJcdAxRKcShAeIW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337879',5.6,4692,'en','Blackball','Blackball follows the fortunes of Cliff Starkey, a working-class fine of lawn bowls with an exceptional talent. Wanting to take on the Aussies he manages to become regional champion, only to get banned. Sports agent Rich Schwartz picks him up and makes him so popular the Bowls Committee deem to lift the ban. Now the question is whether he can regain his form and his friends to beat the Aussies.','/sVlrowz2VtOJIxDTBMU4Jsb1njN.jpg','2003-05-18',96,'Released','At Last, A Sportsman The British Can Be Proud Of','Blackball',15443,1.8874,5.2,'v8MuNXR_lCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17895,_binary '\0','/sDvmwa8de137sriLkg9zeZg16Mw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337881',5.5,5268,'en','Blind Horizon','Left for dead in the remote Southwest, Frank is found clinging to life and in a state of amnesia. As he recovers, ominous memories begin to flash back...','/gmEHqjdjPiFFZnXq0nNV3VUXLS4.jpg','2003-12-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Blind Horizon',24619,2.8877,5.868,'Zgmfo7wHwyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17896,_binary '\0','/mB23ce4CxfUwSb9Y6YY8NPLyy2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337909',6.9,28482,'en','Calendar Girls','Members of a Yorkshire branch of the Women\'s Institute cause controversy when they pose nude for a charity calendar.','/8vLMUEcXdNKALFU6WuBmkjVNYWv.jpg','2003-09-02',108,'Released','Some ladies will do anything for a good cause.','Calendar Girls',8696,5.6527,6.5,'dXjjQPlctd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17897,_binary '\0','/6rRFfVdQ3W3uvai65KsZB62arMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337910',2.5,1905,'en','Camp Slaughter','About 25 years ago an unholy child was born in an ancient noble family. The parents were the mother and son of the family. The goal was to create the perfect daughter, but instead she gave birth to a monster! The son, whose only interest are rabbits, called the monster Bunny Man, and placed him in a hole in the woods. He supplied his son with food and rabbits, to play with. Unfortunately, the lack of human contact made him violent, and his rabbits died when during his so called games. One day the son forgets to lock the hole and Bunny Man suddenly finds himself free, in a world he\'s never seen and doesn\'t understand. At the same time, a group of kids arrive at a cabin in the woods to throw a party. Kids that, to an untrained eye, seem quite similar to rabbits...','/1ozRpwwIybohM4912jeQoBERag0.jpg','2004-01-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Camp Slaughter',121587,0.7897,2.5,'DenxYbRlVkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17898,_binary '\0','/eIJEApRNDaysFxBIJFXCxdciZpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337917',5.2,11496,'en','Catch That Kid','A determined twelve-year-old mountain climber takes drastic action to save her injured father by planning a high-stakes bank heist, using her skills and teamwork to navigate the challenge.','/vNZTtrzrIsIAHzqH3143oWIzFjG.jpg','2004-02-06',92,'Released','They\'re on a mission without permission.','Catch That Kid',20483,4.169,5.6,'beER2ztu1PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17899,_binary '\0','/AjHQO6ZNDHNSg6nWR5xeRruhTOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337921',6.5,110041,'en','Cellular','A young man receives an emergency phone call on his cell phone from an older woman. She claims to have been kidnapped – and the kidnappers have targeted her husband and child next.','/AhD3qVfVmxz5CXDxctXwK5nmrOp.jpg','2004-09-06',94,'Released','If the signal dies so does she.','Cellular',9759,7.0156,6.403,'saSi2sVJY5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17900,_binary '\0','/doUBcqc4dT4kJO5UHAj1jpwNHhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337930',6.5,3915,'es','Nicotina','A hacker who is spying on a pretty neighbour messes up his assignment to break into Swiss bank accounts for Russian mobsters.','/Y5O3hU5DpH4Kz1wcPDumGjTkxb.jpg','2003-10-03',93,'Released','A comedy with cigars, heartbreak and 20 diamonds.','Nicotina',11556,1.2328,6.7,'7BfgRVqmBnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17901,_binary '\0','/8E35lLYHJOprJRFIhmnpvoelJgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337945',4.4,1643,'en','Coronado','An american woman, in search of her fiance\', becomes involved in a revolution of a central-american country.','/gBjHPS2XltYfd0xi2kCNpO5oAG.jpg','2003-09-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Coronado',25426,2.0956,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17902,_binary '\0','/sCR9zK21yw8OOnQhUe8kwZRiYHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337960',6.8,5459,'en','Danny Deckchair','An unappreciated laborer\'s patience reaches breaking point when his girlfriend cancels a romantic holiday. Making light of the situation, he decides to tie hundreds of helium balloons to a chair in an outlandish bid to float to a new life.','/7rL1WDYxTIPouUFDbdtcyqTyywu.jpg','2003-05-16',100,'Released','For anyone who ever dreamed of taking off.','Danny Deckchair',14389,1.4185,6.1,'b5Ner-0gm_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17903,_binary '\0','/1woyehC0mrGCsrV74nXziZQKepx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337961',6.2,6632,'fr','Dans ma peau','After a disfiguring leg injury, a young woman develops an unsettling secret relationship with her own body in which pain is pleasure, mutilation is love and hungers of the flesh have a mind of their own.','/v57vYRakOfsIvDaa4VcmysZgIV0.jpg','2002-12-04',93,'Released','Some truths cut deep.','In My Skin',1836,2.3526,6,'HP6Ro-Rwvl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17904,_binary '\0','/ogw0az8LVUtZxMJhiFSDz9BmzeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337971',6.5,3423,'hi','दीवानगी','A lawyer tried to defend a person accused of murder who is diagnosed with Split personality disorder.','/lehvyJEHb2VE7ah5pHBWO4zsXqo.jpg','2002-10-25',156,'Released',NULL,'Deewangee',78827,2.4263,6.526,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17905,_binary '\0','/aRqTPOPt8BOHE0ngppM9jnuuaeS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0337978',7.1,437851,'en','Live Free or Die Hard','John McClane is back and badder than ever, and this time he calls on the services of a young hacker in his bid to stop a ring of Internet terrorists intent on taking control of America\'s computer infrastructure.','/31TT47YjBl7a7uvJ3ff1nrirXhP.jpg','2007-06-20',128,'Released','The choice will be clear.','Live Free or Die Hard',1571,17.0352,6.644,'svIjk-nlh_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17906,_binary '\0','/W1ffLQGHoxfAOq0ZYdPtJlvAdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338013',8.3,1196188,'en','Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind','Joel Barish, heartbroken that his girlfriend underwent a procedure to erase him from her memory, decides to do the same. However, as he watches his memories of her fade away, he realises that he still loves her, and may be too late to correct his mistake.','/5MwkWH9tYHv3mV9OdYTMR5qreIz.jpg','2004-03-19',108,'Released','You can erase someone from your mind. Getting them out of your heart is another story.','Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind',38,23.7077,8.088,'c2e-bj6qy8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17907,_binary '\0','/cl4YFssTisk1NHRVCVjHPgbwTYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338075',6,4016,'en','Grand Theft Parsons','There are times when it\'s right and proper to simply bury the dead. This is not one of those times... Gram Parsons was one of the most influential musicians of his time; a bitter, brilliant, genius who knew Elvis, tripped with the Stones and fatally overdosed on morphine and tequila in 1973. And from his dying came a story. A story from deep within folklore; a story of friendship, honour and adventure; a story so extraordinary that if it didn\'t really happen, no one would believe it. Two men, a hearse, a dead rock star, five gallons of petrol, and a promise. And the most extraordinary chase of modern times.','/5sWWj5tlTDyAi2yiEjQZUmJCoKr.jpg','2004-06-18',88,'Released','It\'s better to burn out than to fade away.','Grand Theft Parsons',16433,2.1781,6,'tDx_x5X6nnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17908,_binary '\0','/bcChY1gxAIxV4CtZovHxbqgN0tG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338077',6,14542,'en','Grind','Four skaters follow their idol on his summer tour in an attempt to get noticed, get sponsored, and become stars themselves.','/3ijvfbWQYLaFQ2PaX6hywnMW3Hv.jpg','2003-08-15',104,'Released','Live Fast... Play Hard... Die Laughing...','Grind',20210,4.2709,6,'r3-DDJM8PRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17909,_binary '\0','/uUgn9P3Ulmjt9bOfp5Yt83fauAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338094',5.3,60630,'en','The Haunted Mansion','Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.','/lGi5yio4pdDz5PkSeZCbnMQz5vK.jpg','2003-11-26',88,'Released','Check your pulse at the door... if you have one.','The Haunted Mansion',10756,9.5279,5.685,'IAJBBmMhC9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17910,_binary '\0','/ecn4qv1SzQaZ8jMyPPs307UqKxa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338095',6.7,83868,'fr','Haute Tension','Best friends Marie and Alexia decide to spend a quiet weekend at Alexia\'s parents\' secluded farmhouse. But on the night of their arrival, the girls\' idyllic getaway turns into an endless night of horror.','/vKeFa7CqSxmWsQDjHP6SJXKoDbj.jpg','2003-06-18',91,'Released','Hearts will bleed.','High Tension',10226,5.8942,6.8,'SIFwOugjyKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17911,_binary '\0','/595WmPkDojtR9XVu2ssKfSIWu3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338096',5.9,31144,'en','Dirty Dancing: Havana Nights','In pre-revolution Cuba, Katey Miller is about to defy everyone\'s expectations. Instead of a parent-approved suitor, Katey is drawn to the sexy waiter, Javier, who spends his nights dancing in Havana\'s nightclubs. As she secretly learns to dance with Javier, she learns the meanings of love, sensuality and independence.','/5FnSCH592YIivbKtotq7YQanvmu.jpg','2004-02-27',86,'Released','Break the rules. Find your freedom. Live your life.','Dirty Dancing: Havana Nights',10677,5.9396,6.4,'LBGEbEqQAsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17912,_binary '\0','/30TFieICaZPeAggwGF9S5GQeoFa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338097',6.5,16538,'en','Head in the Clouds','Gilda Bessé shares her Paris apartment with an Irish schoolteacher, Guy Malyon, and Mia, a refugee from Spain. As the world drifts toward war, Gilda defiantly pursues her hedonistic lifestyle and her burgeoning career as a photographer. But Guy and Mia feel impelled to join the fight against fascism, and the three friends are separated.','/7hife90EykgFaJ6KPY1DX8y7DVD.jpg','2004-04-29',121,'Released','Three lives. One destiny.','Head in the Clouds',18804,5.3991,5.9,'_ot_hmVFHio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17913,_binary '\0','/4nxRVDs64m7kTdwuSx4Qc3kjl6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338109',7.1,4824,'en','Homeless to Harvard: The Liz Murray Story','Based on a true story. Liz Murray is a young girl who is taken care of by her loving, but drug-addicted parents. Liz becomes homeless at 15 and after a tragedy comes upon her, she begins her work to finish high school.','/oI6BivZQsKj5uZLsudJOke8rc1S.jpg','2003-04-07',104,'Released','When there was nothing to believe in, she believed in herself.','Homeless to Harvard: The Liz Murray Story',80219,2.7195,7.293,'amLnAzq1i7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17914,_binary '\0','/q6pAPcs5xxJNF273eKkpKYNKwAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338133',6.8,2064,'en','Dandelion','In a small town of rolling fields and endless skies, isolated 16 year old Mason lives in a world where families exist in fragmented silence and love seems to have gone missing. Then Mason meets Danny, a sensitive and troubled girl, and their tender bond is soon tested after a fatal accident and a series of complications takes Mason away for something he didn\'t do.','/a7TXZamEJJOMn75R8bXelwjC1S9.jpg','2004-01-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Dandelion',16430,1.7717,6.3,'5KeqW49Yby4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17915,_binary '\0','/7PefpVkSOiQmcdGv6TGHU8kn296.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338135',7.5,31043,'fr','Les invasions barbares','In this belated sequel to \'The Decline of the American Empire\', middle-aged Montreal college professor, Remy, learns that he is dying of liver cancer. His ex-wife, Louise, asks their estranged son, Sebastian, a successful businessman living in London, to come home. Sebastian makes the impossible happen, using his contacts and disrupting the Canadian healthcare system in every way possible to help his father fight his terminal illness to the bitter end, while reuniting some of Remy\'s old friends, including Pierre, Alain, Dominique, Diane, and Claude, who return to see their friend before he passes on.','/mqlgZiQHT3B5J8Q4mkgaCkt47uJ.jpg','2003-05-01',99,'Released','A comedy about sex, friendship, and all other things that invade our lives.','The Barbarian Invasions',11042,2.6385,7,'H8zyMnzJ8BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17916,_binary '\0','/g5QRbgrgRwaSyDfcCPUhP6XcilR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338139',7.3,6780,'en','Iron Jawed Angels','Defiant young activists take the women\'s suffrage movement by storm, putting their lives at risk to help American women win the right to vote.','/pLtbTAIBpoRrQxnfTVB0y0wVEKK.jpg','2004-01-16',125,'Released','Votes for women.','Iron Jawed Angels',49007,3.5553,6.8,'UGyB3tV9kU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17917,_binary '\0','/o8bs4oCB3qCooYfpMhXY4evNVLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338188',6.5,41905,'en','The Missing','When rancher and single mother of two Maggie Gilkeson sees her teenage daughter, Lily, kidnapped by Apache rebels, she reluctantly accepts the help of her estranged father, Samuel, in tracking down the kidnappers. Along the way, the two must learn to reconcile the past and work together if they are going to have any hope of getting Lily back before she is taken over the border and forced to become a prostitute.','/86s5nw5F1G8lJtEowO0LBB4hoBW.jpg','2003-11-26',135,'Released','How far would you go, how much would you sacrifice to get back what you have lost?','The Missing',12146,6.678,6.3,'qp63X34jNB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17918,_binary '\0','/wBIQsOrenmVjnfUqSub7Zrw0JNm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338216',5.9,21706,'en','Lucky You','A professional poker player whose astounding luck at the table fails to translate into his lonesome love life attempts to win the World Series of Poker while simultaneously earning the affections of a beautiful Las Vegas singer.','/23jI1zZnrLlrkeGjjkBkUF4FVTf.jpg','2007-05-01',124,'Released','Change your game. Change your life.','Lucky You',1950,4.3682,5.7,'kGWgHKHBWm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17919,_binary '\0','/tqK8vlWnxpOLPoE6AF6Smf8EGY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338290',7.1,3647,'en','Normal','A Midwestern husband and father announces his plan to have a sex change operation.','/jIVHUZYRGW7HHirQUTen4anfYZN.jpg','2003-01-21',110,'Released','Love. Marriage. Acceptance. Sex change.','Normal',67809,2.3786,6.7,'DdWur61dvqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17920,_binary '\0','/2EIiauBZJspEHEJQeSw7OvrFG3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338309',7.7,45100,'sv','Ondskan','Stockholm, in the 1950s. Erik is expelled from the local school for getting into one brawl too many. To protect Erik from his violent stepfather’s reaction to his expulsion, Erik\'s mother arranges for Erik to spend a year at Stjärnsberg Boarding School, the only school willing to accept him. This is Erik\'s last chance to graduate to Upper School and he promises his mother, for his and her sake, to do all he can to stay out of trouble.','/1qqI4qh3VP7jUBRTGsIxh1miNKJ.jpg','2003-09-16',113,'Released','It\'s time to take a stand.','Evil',11197,4.3174,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17921,_binary '\0','/2JMSOfek5JxgbIZ0ql9eLDOWTxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338325',5.7,16162,'en','Paparazzi','A rising Hollywood actor decides to take personal revenge against a group of four persistent photographers to make them pay for almost causing a personal tragedy involving his wife and son.','/m9swmQKxrbRTYY3wN2bWmRiebM4.jpg','2004-09-03',84,'Released','One good shot deserves another.','Paparazzi',15644,3.8029,5.3,'npjQ7bN8TGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17922,_binary '\0','/rdlXnumaarKFHQ4rB8YBWINEeuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338337',6.3,119337,'en','Paycheck','Michael Jennings is a genius who\'s hired – and paid handsomely – by high-tech firms to work on highly sensitive projects, after which his short-term memory is erased so he\'s incapable of breaching security. But at the end of a three-year job, he\'s told he isn\'t getting a paycheck and instead receives a mysterious envelope. In it are clues he must piece together to find out why he wasn\'t paid – and why he\'s now in hot water.','/h0BWaPnWYXwbCXF69DxS0YWcVy2.jpg','2003-12-25',119,'Released','The future depends on a past he was paid to forget.','Paycheck',9620,7.3963,6.2,'DsN52jTlxzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17923,_binary '\0','/jtOvTVlkF8TlaOq94oNXRc9u2yp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338348',6.6,274048,'en','The Polar Express','When a doubting young boy takes an extraordinary train ride to the North Pole, he embarks on a journey of self-discovery that shows him that the wonder of life never fades for those who believe.','/eOoCzH0MqeGr2taUZO4SwG416PF.jpg','2004-11-10',100,'Released','A journey like you’ve never imagined.','The Polar Express',5255,16.5122,6.726,'eHvSH2EoLLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17924,_binary '\0','/qXpH9cCA8LUJzCgnveciovBYcmr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338427',6.3,25451,'en','Shopgirl','Mirabelle is a disenchanted salesgirl and aspiring artist who sells gloves and accessories at a department store. She has two men in her life: wealthy divorcée Ray Porter and struggling musician Jeremy. Mirabelle falls in love with the glamorous Ray, and her life takes a magical turn, but eventually she realizes that she must empower herself and make a choice between them.','/h66UO0ddlJlK4t2DIu0fJ1s5jkM.jpg','2005-10-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Shopgirl',2610,4.3007,5.8,'YODMeNOSofo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17925,_binary '\0','/yZJpH3kCZEgLDgOKbDEbsFESlog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338434',7.5,2171,'en','Silent Night','Fact-based World War II story set on Christmas Eve, 1944, finds a German Mother and her son seeking refuge in a cabin on the war front. When she is invaded by three American soldiers and then three German soldiers, she successfully convinces the soldiers to put aside their differences for one evening and share a Christmas dinner.','/exN9rOtB1JGBmT6d3R9aylwnHmY.jpg','2002-12-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Silent Night',17639,1.6343,6.1,'6yEB33A0LTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17926,_binary '\0','/bmuTrxbPcr1nKCsV5YWWJi73PGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338459',4.4,72211,'en','Spy Kids 3-D: Game Over','Carmen\'s caught in a virtual reality game designed by the Kids\' new nemesis, the Toymaker. It\'s up to Juni to save his sister, and ultimately the world.','/buA8dN4zLNr0dYBeKfHfMnEfdLE.jpg','2003-07-25',84,'Released','3rd mission. 3rd dimension.','Spy Kids 3-D: Game Over',12279,9.8472,5.138,'mx0lo-xCljA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17927,_binary '\0','/bj4VHJFQOWXKgnvFrlHoBeOLU3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338466',5.8,56991,'en','Stuck on You','In Martha\'s Vineyard, Mass., conjoined twins Walt and Bob Tenor make the best of their handicap by being the fastest grill cooks in town. While outgoing Walt hopes to one day become a famous actor, shy Bob prefers to stay out of the spotlight. When a fading Hollywood actress, Cher, decides to get her show \"Honey and the Beaze\" cancelled, she hires Walt -- and his brotherly appendage -- as her costars. But their addition surprisingly achieves the opposite.','/5TmPGPsOP4EgMo8X14pyywxB1j2.jpg','2003-12-10',119,'Released','Brothers that are stuck together...stick together.','Stuck on You',1792,5.8663,5.365,'ZaZtut5al68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17928,_binary '\0','/j7HWYuiBgcEQyOetZh8eDAX4X1B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338467',6,2428,'en','Stuey','Based on the true story of the rise and fall of poker legend Stu \"The Kid\" Ungar.','/bOPvntl8GRavuMIOTOVzeeoFBRj.jpg','2003-05-01',120,'Released',NULL,'High Roller: The Stu Ungar Story',27079,2.2136,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17929,_binary '\0','/9DCqkS3aYIWj1eEXn3rV2c8g4Sq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338477',4.4,1711,'hi','Talaash: The Hunt Begins','Babu works for three underworld dons and must go to prison to protect them. When his sentence is over, he returns home to find that Purnima (his wife), Arjun (his son) and Pooja (his daughter) live a destitute life. When he confronts his bosses, he is beheaded in front of his wife and children, and his daughter is abducted. Purnima (Raakhee) loses her mind, and is hospitalized in a mental hospital. Growing up, Arjun (Akshay Kumar) becomes a high profile vigilante. As for Purnima, she becomes terribly ill and can be saved only if she sees her daughter again. Thus, Arjun decides to re-unite his mother and sister. In order to do so, he must discover the identity of his father\'s killers.','/3E20MGbsGiUdYtCbBspeJ0hnQKz.jpg','2003-01-03',153,'Released','The Hunt Begins','Talaash: The Hunt Begins',270823,1.8488,5.273,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17930,_binary '\0','/uYYc3VllG2iq3BLGVmrbUT9xoJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338490',7.8,2774,'hi','3 Deewarein','Three inmates on death row become the reluctant subjects of a documentary made by Chandrika. Gradually, they begin to trust her and reveal their stories.','/2dvUYYXBiXsP3KKmSDap2BrknEg.jpg','2003-01-08',120,'Released','Three convicts… One woman… One truth…','3 Deewarein',73237,1.5532,7.55,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17931,_binary '\0','/3pZP6t6DV3bsE9AtACZNMnullB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338512',7,16696,'en','Deux Frères','Two tigers are separated as cubs and taken into captivity, only to be reunited years later as enemies by an explorer (Pearce) who inadvertently forces them to fight each other.','/5I2pRuJI3SZVsxP5iaorGaczzkI.jpg','2004-04-07',109,'Released','Two infant tiger cubs, separated from their parents and each other.','Two Brothers',1997,4.5859,7.2,'xvRZIAwkTvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17932,_binary '\0','/d72ROyJqXQtw2OupW0l15eicRAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338526',6.1,309922,'en','Van Helsing','Famed monster slayer Gabriel Van Helsing is dispatched to Transylvania to assist the last of the Valerious bloodline in defeating Count Dracula. Anna Valerious reveals that Dracula has formed an unholy alliance with Dr. Frankenstein\'s monster and is hell-bent on exacting a centuries-old curse on her family.','/gsFun8nATm52aGHeT8ueAel98nE.jpg','2004-05-03',132,'Released','The one name they all fear.','Van Helsing',7131,16.3958,6.43,'W6C6qcCW2JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17933,_binary '\0','/oYiPf8oR2ZrjvGIVzGTw1BZihDP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338556',5.3,1353,'en','Wicked Minds','Holden returns home from college and is surprised to find his overpowering competitive father married to a much younger woman Lana. Holden quickly falls for the beauty and charisma of his step mother. A passionate affair begins between son and stepmother.','/A6A15cDR8mpdOxW4y7UzFanzbM0.jpg','2003-03-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Wicked Minds',153104,9.6739,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17934,_binary '\0','/4Mm5l3TcKGynSNto0eyRJgBrkJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338564',8,139387,'cn','無間道','Chan Wing Yan, a young police officer, has been sent undercover as a mole in the local mafia. Lau Kin Ming, a young mafia member, infiltrates the police force. Years later, their older counterparts, Chen Wing Yan and Inspector Lau Kin Ming, respectively, race against time to expose the mole within their midst.','/gix9thDBXfjJ8M7rYbihqbQGBcP.jpg','2002-12-12',101,'Released','Loyalty. Honor. Betrayal.','Infernal Affairs',10775,8.7649,7.805,'GqdXakBnmsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17935,_binary '\0','/1WVvLN3oqvNiAcsQXAk0tTCPVp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338706',6.5,5359,'en','Alexandra\'s Project','Steve is a man who has it all, a successful career, wonderful children, beautiful home and a loving wife. However, returning to his home after work on his birthday, he finds his house deserted and darkened with almost all the lightbulbs missing, all easy access outside cut off and a videotape waiting for him. Playing that tape, he watches a bizarre and grueling recording in which his wife explains her grievance with him, her reasons for disappearing with the children and her revenge for how he treated her in a way he would never forget.','/sao0EIQ94kcSjMABVvAZJDmaAIU.jpg','2003-05-16',103,'Released','Not everyone loves surprises','Alexandra\'s Project',34595,1.1333,5.9,'O2pu_NRNhkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17936,_binary '\0','/6KLKdhk9wZvJ6OcTzDCoxup0Kmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338751',7.5,413005,'en','The Aviator','A biopic depicting the life of filmmaker and aviation pioneer Howard Hughes from 1927 to 1947, during which time he became a successful film producer and an aviation magnate, while simultaneously growing more unstable due to severe obsessive-compulsive disorder.','/lx4kWcZc3o9PaNxlQpEJZM17XUI.jpg','2004-12-17',170,'Released','Some men dream the future. He built it.','The Aviator',2567,14.9203,7.215,'ViR4nGMaFvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17937,_binary '\0','/5BCPhT1zOsSJzeBU7CenRfO6YwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338763',4.6,22428,'ja','バトル・ロワイアルII 鎮魂歌','It\'s three years after the events of the original Battle Royale, and Shuya Nanahara is now an internationally-known terrorist determined to bring down the government. His terrorist group, Wild Seven, stages an attack that levels several buildings in Tokyo on Christmas Day, killing 8000 people. In order for the government to study the benefits of \"teamwork\", the new students work in pairs, with their collars electronically linked so that if one of them is killed, the other dies as well. They must kill Nanahara in three days - or die.','/ynk3exf5wJ63cMzco6WnbNpn9YH.jpg','2003-07-05',155,'Released','This time it\'s war.','Battle Royale II: Requiem',3177,4.1034,4.9,'CV8gaI67YOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17938,_binary '\0','/nw04iPKNK8psaFzz5CaygvM6hde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338806',5.3,1465,'en','Boudica','The Celtic queen who shook the Roman Empire. Boudica is one of history’s first and fiercest women warriors. Sickened by ceaseless war, the king of the Iceni accepts a treaty with the Romans in exchange for his tribe’s continued independence. But oppressively high taxes impoverish the tribe and soon the Romans want something more — slaves. Refusing to submit, the Romans, led by the greedy and psychotic Emperor Nero, move to crush the Iceni and control their lands. Drawing on the strength of her warriors, mystical druidic powers, and her own pain, Boudica unites the historically fractious tribes of Briton to unleash a stunning onslaught on the Roman colonial camps. The ferocity of Boudica’s attacks will shake the foundations of the Roman empire and make her a legend.','/c1w5oJIViN7vqv5GJF3cyQmHiZn.jpg','2003-09-28',83,'Released',NULL,'Boudica',62326,1.7887,4.8,'mKDCf7sebRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17939,_binary '\0','/bZ56yw30p5rS9Zc5nY7qKa8a2Ez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338828',6,2960,'fr','Mais qui a tué Pamela Rose ?','FBI Agents Bullit and Riper investigate the murder of a young dancer called Pamela Rose, found dead in her motel room in Bornsville, a small american town. Despite their differences, they must team up: the local police is hostile and they can only count on themselves to solve the crime. They meet Ginger, Pamela\'s best friend, and discover soon enough she knows more than she says.','/1m1hLUtU5xwPWUNOX7FVOyS0ekb.jpg','2003-06-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Mais qui a tué Pamela Rose ?',20106,1.9776,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17940,_binary '\0','/qJVUx5xUes9cTDpMiNWx4Fab2ac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338852',5,10084,'en','The Cheetah Girls','A four-member teen girl group named the Cheetah Girls go to a Manhattan High School for the Performing Arts and try to become the first freshmen to win the talent show in the school\'s history. During the talent show auditions, they meet a big-time producer named Jackal Johnson, who tries to make the group into superstars, but the girls run into many problems.','/7XOJqR8WErIm1ZqytABCEuUke1C.jpg','2003-08-15',89,'Released','They have one shot to show their spots.','The Cheetah Girls',32293,4.3357,6,'ty2mA4U5H6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17941,_binary '\0','/1T4JJYyaDOrohnr0b7snTpKbbWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338949',7.4,2241,'pl','Edi','The film tells a story of two scrap pickers - the title hero Edi and his friend Jureczek. Edi is wrongly accused of having raped the girl whose brothers have got the control over one of the city areas. Edi is severely punished for that but he accepts his fate taking care of the girl\'s child.','/oCQBvAIdQ4jWqaevyJ7s0P0th8Y.jpg','2002-10-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Edi',29828,1.2465,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17942,_binary '\0','/xcC3kBv5RcgmMLp0Xn99fTAhDmz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0338977',6.9,3362,'fr','L\'Esquive','A group of teenagers living in a housing project in the outskirts of Paris rehearse a scene from Marivaux\'s play of the same name. Krimo is determined not to take part, but after developing feelings for Lydia, he quickly assumes the main role and love interest in the play.','/vrGRVDJqa9WcFbfoIV9vYV3Fg7d.jpg','2003-11-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Games of Love and Chance',1549,2.1948,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17943,_binary '\0','/tMC3NsISgID3PtQ5zomhCF93eSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339034',1.9,26210,'en','From Justin to Kelly','A waitress from Texas and a college student from Pennsylvania meet during spring break in Fort Lauderdale, Florida and come together through their shared love of singing.','/bLLlgQ6nZPGxvAjp0qjTX1wD2hl.jpg','2003-06-20',81,'Released','The tale of two American Idols.','From Justin to Kelly',31246,2.9608,3.2,'YZriuov42Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17944,_binary '\0','/sz1V6jr0eRQsGz9BuNpsoTAuiQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339071',6.9,1769,'en','Girls Will Be Girls','Nothing stirs up the competitive spirit in haggard Hollywood has-been Evie Harris like having to share a house with a younger actress like Varla. Especially since Varla happens to be the daughter of Evie\'s now-deceased rival! But even as their saner roommate, Coco, attempts to keep the peace, Evie\'s jealousy over Varla\'s burgeoning infomercial career is about to explode... in the most spectacular, showstopping way possible!','/dkuOR3E28A3mXjfjuoMudJWEN4B.jpg','2003-07-05',79,'Released','«An actress\' life can be a real drag»','Girls Will Be Girls',21059,2.0005,5.7,'Z6_1BGAg7m0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17945,_binary '\0','/eULuK7Cmovn0j1OHekkfvSFvAvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339072',4.2,1703,'en','Gladiatress','Three unlikely heroines set out to thwart a Roman invasion and save Celtic Britain in their own unique and outrageous style.','/mbiaH8jDBaHJrpkTiKOd9GGmqoD.jpg','2004-08-19',89,'Released','Does my gluteus maximus look big in this?','Gladiatress',20125,1.6332,3.9,'uRXmJuROKyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17946,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339079',7.2,1602,'en','Gone','After the rapture, three lawyers struggle to survive.','/eIhdky3pbMPPND7T0VckKCX1VwY.jpg','2002-01-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Gone',318633,1.3567,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17947,_binary '\0','/8C8YqYUdS74VmzZieKJnT7x9QWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339091',2.7,1293,'en','Gang of Roses','In 1828 the town of Flat Ridge is over run by a band of outlaws looking for lost treasure said to be buried somewhere in town. In their quest for dominance, the outlaws kill Sally, a prostitute who happens to be the sister of Rachel and a former member of the disbanded Rose Gang. With the weight of grief on her heart, Rachel decides to shed her new found religious faith to bring vengeance upon her sister\'s killers. After laying Sally to rest, Rachel goes in search of her former posse to assist her in avenging her sister\'s death.','/bbtZf4SwMD9VmtRKsdU0u3R0rRX.jpg','2003-10-10',94,'Released','On the trail of vengeance.','Gang of Roses',66667,2.0188,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17948,_binary '\0','/3M4JB5PtzOqXBEfHOGh4H90nDPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339135',6.1,23037,'en','In Hell','A man must survive a prison where hardened criminals battle to the death for the warden\'s entertainment.','/vE2fYcP07fbIHoouATNErRQuNrw.jpg','2003-11-24',96,'Released','Rage unleashed.','In Hell',19277,5.0159,6.7,'cA_ctD7fB3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17949,_binary '\0','/9cZVewkxDE5e2WH2htJczc1VReG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339147',5.7,10114,'en','Highwaymen','James Cray watched as his wife was killed by Fargo, a hit-and-run serial murderer. After severely injuring Fargo and going to prison for several years, James is now determined to avenge his wife\'s death. He drives across the country looking for Fargo\'s 1972 Cadillac Eldorado, which the now-disabled killer has turned into a rolling death trap. James\' search is helped by a state traffic officer and a singer with her own agenda.','/fJb2XlqYSYFA25EMyodon0cBare.jpg','2004-02-13',80,'Released','When murder is no accident, revenge is no crime.','Highwaymen',29979,3.3146,5.7,'5Ztj3ZH5yv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17950,_binary '\0','/3Dj0PASsZymZ98X9m0iW39qCFaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339230',6.7,22961,'sv','Kopps','A small Swedish village, Högboträsk, is so peaceful that crime is nonexistent. The police spend their shifts drinking coffee, eating hot dogs and chasing down runaway cows. This is all well and good for the village\'s own police, but the police management board wants to discontinue the local police force for lack of crime.','/uKHXQGqnr1pVfKWv8vGPgWusWuE.jpg','2003-02-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Kopps',9256,2.5189,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17951,_binary '\0','/nAHp4y5jhZXBsUO6zUvPduwyDhV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339252',7.8,1519,'te','ఖడ్గం','After being victims of terrorism, an aspiring actor, a driver and a sincere police officer come together to stop a terrorist from fleeing and put an end to his plans.','/i5r4za7yrfDP2PxNN3RaRDDvGLi.jpg','2002-11-29',150,'Released','I am an Indian','Khadgam',81068,1.2722,7.273,'2yW90JkYFxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17952,_binary '\0','/i0M3a8Z2hfj5Oj4msArajhLjGvV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339291',6.8,232988,'en','Lemony Snicket\'s A Series of Unfortunate Events','Three wealthy children\'s parents are killed in a fire. When they are sent to a distant relative, they find out that he is plotting to kill them and seize their fortune.','/r7S57FpBsCljWc9fBUo2Iy5XGew.jpg','2004-12-16',108,'Released','Mishaps. Misadventures. Mayhem. Oh joy.','Lemony Snicket\'s A Series of Unfortunate Events',11774,12.1667,6.8,'fccho1IyX8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17953,_binary '\0','/qlnyMVybhEfZtDZP4Kt2D4WiIcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339300',5.9,1274,'nl','Liever verliefd','As her last lover Dirk breaks with her to his wedding to give a new chance, Anna has had it. For her no more men. Never. That same day she meets Rob. And a few hours later Sander. Both men fall in love with Anna, and she also falls for them. Together they form the perfect man Rob for jobs at home and good sex and Sander for the romance and ....','/qoYUzaCwHgDaVUEiU2FjNU8IZbM.jpg','2003-03-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Rather Love',31956,1.0758,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17954,_binary '\0','/wsMd6w63m8TETGYdwCAnyMRs7h1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339334',5.3,4129,'en','The Magic Roundabout','A shaggy, candy-loving puppy named Dougal along with a group of friends embarks on a dangerous journey in an effort to imprison their oppressor -- the evil ice sorcerer ZeeBad (Zebedee\'s evil twin). As the world is placed in mortal danger Zeebad who wants to turn the world to ice. Doogal and his friends must recover 3 diamonds that are needed to stop him.','/qUUxGu8Oxtzk2VasR99Jqy74ogK.jpg','2005-02-02',85,'Released',NULL,'The Magic Roundabout',16455,3.6312,5.4,'J32YSdeCluE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17955,_binary '\0','/145dpObpyQj83xcSCz4G5jRRY0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339357',6.8,2060,'fr','Histoire de Marie et Julien','Julien is a clockmaker with destructive impulses who decides to blackmail Madame X, a rich, attractive woman who traffics in stolen antiques. What he doesn’t know is that she has an even more dangerous secret that leads him to Marie, with whom he had fallen in love a year earlier.','/lsifh9GSHLCto3VzKFUYoEm9Ui6.jpg','2003-09-10',150,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Marie and Julien',79043,2.4986,6.45,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17956,_binary '\0','/e1G7DTsAy6fhR1kOoMmxVDc7HBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339385',5.7,3094,'da','Midsommer','It is the last day of school for Christian and his younger sister Sophie. They are heading to a party at his friend Trina. High school graduation is just around the corner and after the freedom and future. But behind the idyllic facade lurks tragedy and secrets. That evening Sophie commits suicide.','/rnypzzV2WDbHQkteEnpF0SsLlbT.jpg','2003-02-07',94,'Released','Everyone has a past. Some have a future.','Midsummer',16032,1.3054,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17957,_binary '\0','/9wTvyVN6l0i5F5qOhs8iuSVF3Oc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339412',5.6,16070,'en','Mr. 3000','Aging baseball star who goes by the nickname, Mr. 3000, finds out many years after retirement that he didn\'t quite reach 3,000 hits. Now at age 47 he\'s back to try and reach that goal.','/g7CNkytZsZzQ8ZEr8F4SmrhjI5y.jpg','2004-06-15',103,'Released','Big league. Big mouth. Big time.','Mr. 3000',16232,3.7461,5.3,'39Lk3xeidI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17958,_binary '\0','/1CDAkjz6QDTwOXxCMeC3N7Fhdtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339419',7.1,4910,'en','The Mudge Boy','Chronicling the troubled existence of Duncan Mudge, a 14-year-old misfit who—while vying for the attention of his vacant father—struggles to fill the void brought on by his mother\'s sudden death.','/daxDdN3vBBqx8KuOXNHBtu9QcbQ.jpg','2003-01-17',93,'Released','Duncan Mudge has a secret…','The Mudge Boy',26899,2.014,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17959,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339422',6.2,1370,'en','Murder in Greenwich','The story of Martha Moxley, a 15-year-old girl murdered in Greenwich in the 1970s. Her murder went unsolved for 25 years.','/nlSXpnlTn1U32lCGRMIqQT2sdpP.jpg','2002-11-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Murder in Greenwich',56744,1.1686,4.8,'LERu9jKEmCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17960,_binary '\0','/kthqQYlZzbLavVA4bAX7suXhIL6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339450',7,2456,'et','Nimed marmortahvlil','Despite peaceful speeches, the army of the Soviet Russian is attacking Estonia, and the country\'s government is declaring a mobilization for all. Henn Ahas, the son of a poor family, hesitates to go to war.','/dTgHA4JWwsTh0vXYVISN5Lry4Yb.jpg','2002-11-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Names in Marble',46890,0.9973,5.9,'we-aGuBSdrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17961,_binary '\0','/cMKphvC0En6ncFNyRWoORDw3pbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339489',6.9,2631,'es','Palabras encadenadas','A mild-mannered psychopath plays mind-games with a woman he has tied to a chair in his basement.','/v8cJwKbYd9v73DEy9qvEOVoRafT.jpg','2004-08-20',89,'Released','Your next move may be your last.','Killing Words',31068,1.0261,6.6,'ehuB-DsMM0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17962,_binary '\0','/fpdOvUoXVsP99s9NBQYXBkxK697.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339525',5.9,1233,'fr','7 Ans de mariage','After seven years of marriage, a couple of professional workers (he, a doctor and she, a banker) try to refresh their sex life.','/i1mzZaporwNd9SYVytAxh2ljygV.jpg','2003-06-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Seven Years of Marriage',19565,1.8778,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17963,_binary '\0','/3rrJcnc3kk1b7bWjWnHFZinAuzh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339535',8.4,8074,'sr','Profesionalac','Till recently a University professor, a bohemian writer, a member of Belgrade\'s intellectual circles and a passionate opponent of the Milosevic\'s regime meets the man, unknown to him, but who knows every tiny detail of his life. Man tells him a story and plot unfolds unimaginably.','/smfrkCYH3LTZaWV1qJiQwZ5piVE.jpg','2003-05-21',104,'Released',NULL,'The Professional',55130,1.2447,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17964,_binary '\0','/vrmr04EM1BuZ424lbz7InitoPAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339579',6.4,11917,'ja','リターナー','A young woman from the future forces a local gunman to help her stop an impending alien invasion which will wipe out the human race.','/vM5VswPvFBhDd5tuQlQb21RKlqf.jpg','2002-08-31',116,'Released','The future could be history.','Returner',5493,2.2822,6.6,'gG_hs03cPXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17965,_binary '\0','/skrKyrqdngMKAv5dFln0kmJGexR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339642',5.1,2512,'en','Daltry Calhoun','In small town Tennessee, a ne\'er-do-well man wrestling for control over his fading golf club is reunited with his estranged daughter, a 14-year-old musical prodigy.','/rXJStu8CAPpgPD3waTdCDlXDqlR.jpg','2005-09-25',100,'Released','Proudly spreading his seeds across America.','Daltry Calhoun',20668,1.7684,5,'uuVYUb6GCl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17966,_binary '\0','/sv4KpGDnMXKWRZx7DIOlhH09Fg2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339707',7.5,5302,'en','Song for a Raggy Boy','William Franklin is a teacher who was born in Ireland and moved to the United States only to repatriate in 1939 after his leftist political views cause him to lose his job. Franklin becomes the first non-cleric instructor at St. Jude\'s, a school for wayward boys run by Brother John, who is a firm believer in strong discipline.','/rB1K3v5780GVH5KUGFadWi4w8Aw.jpg','2003-01-19',94,'Released','Four walls. One faith. No identity.','Song for a Raggy Boy',49890,2.4469,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17967,_binary '\0','/4FNhPAjmkStEcZgQzSXyRn1kJwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339727',5.8,2164,'en','Stateside','The film follows a rebellious teenager on leave from the Marines who falls in love with a female musician. The relationship is threatened when she develops a mental illness...','/dPRZpD44rA1ZqgcLjKyVw4fIlgo.jpg','2004-05-23',97,'Released','Boy in a flack jacket meets girl in a straight jacket.','Stateside',43670,1.7563,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17968,_binary '\0','/j6h5NLCwcdXSYa5RiJmC6LWHM0i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339736',5.6,4594,'en','The Evil Within','The sadistic tale of a lonely, mentally handicapped boy who befriends his reflection in an antique mirror. This demonic creature orders him to go on a murderous rampage to kill the people he loves most.','/2PTfanA2YsdKUgbw27mtZ2E98QW.jpg','2017-06-13',98,'Released','You can\'t run from a nightmare','The Evil Within',444193,2.8271,5.7,'HJ_sduGRt_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17969,_binary '\0','/8vh7llvlNrctZyOomXcevNDln0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339785',6.6,2397,'en','Thoughtcrimes','Freya McAllister suddenly starts hearing voices in her head on the night of her High School Prom. One night Dr Michael Welles arrives telling Freya that she isn\'t crazy but that her voices are the thoughts of everyone around her. He teaches her to turn her telepathic powers into a powerful gift. What he doesn\'t say is that he works for the National Security Agency...','/rcVeILmiYwsEdIuxkqo5CxhvOf0.jpg','2003-01-01',86,'Released','In a fight against crime, her mind is their most valuable weapon.','Thoughtcrimes',14942,2.3141,6.5,'VCFicaw_i3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17970,_binary '\0','/eiLMrtjnMO4IDnYrXkfVQzOqp7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339806',6.5,4281,'es','Torremolinos 73','Set in 1973 Spain, a struggling encyclopedia salesman and his wife take advantage of an offer to make adult films. The act turns him into an aspring legit filmmaker and her into an international sex symbol.','/ljQh3rHlltuJnWT1w54s7bBhUd.jpg','2003-04-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Torremolinos 73',26488,2.7728,6.202,'EOMdJmeKCTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17971,_binary '\0','/511UgSfAcCtfOmRXy8cH4xx2EI0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339824',5.5,1457,'ko','튜브','Burnt-out transit cop Jay forms an unlikely alliance with pickpocket Kay to stop a terrorist hijacker from blowing up a subway car during rush hour.','/AqNBp4KzUhUkyRtkN2TroN78ZLs.jpg','2003-06-05',113,'Released','Giving up is not an option. challenge extended tube.','Tube',32238,2.0028,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17972,_binary '\0','/gbF3RMDwPDUXMlS5CM8gJPSHAnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339827',6.2,1453,'en','Twist','In a gritty retelling of the Dickens\'s classic, Twist takes Oliver and the Artful Dodger out of the poorhouse and onto the streets, where junk is the currency and hustling is the game.','/uKdyuEhoDWXJcseUXvDdLP9FttO.jpg','2003-09-07',97,'Released','Boys do what boys must!','Twist',44375,1.2705,5.2,'Hvx4CngwWDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17973,_binary '\0','/rWwcX62LLBiIuVOP8bxMAWbIdTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0339840',5.3,14009,'en','Undead','A quaint Australian fishing village is overcome by meteorites that turn its residents into the ravenous undead, leaving a small group of those unharmed to find a way out.','/jwXrKFO20FTvA7mHqnTvMXSznDS.jpg','2003-09-04',97,'Released','Crazy has come to town for a visit.','Undead',8991,2.6483,5.459,'UcJpT2bAbk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17974,_binary '\0','/l90EUsDDzegv92iL3TbXXAF1t6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340012',7,13446,'en','Being Julia','Julia Lambert is a true diva: beautiful, talented, weathly and famous. She has it all - including a devoted husband who has mastermined her brilliant career - but after years of shining in the spotlight she begins to suffer from a severe case of boredom and longs for something new and exciting to put the twinkle back in her eye. Julia finds exactly what she\'s looking for in a handsome young American fan, but it isn\'t long before the novelty fling adds a few more sparks than she was hoping for. Fortuately for her, this surprise twist in the plot will thrust her back into the greatest role of her life.','/wiJp4pN2bYgtWQqZYZhGNLeFmx8.jpg','2004-09-03',104,'Released','Passion. Obsession. Revenge. Prepare for the performance of a lifetime.','Being Julia',18701,3.3964,6.4,'quzIsJq7t08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17975,_binary '\0','/r0EgmEiyBR3NQZ9po80m3RWPZDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340057',7.2,1253,'en','Copenhagen','No one knows for sure what transpired when German physicist Werner Heisenberg met with his Jewish Danish counterpart, Niels Bohr, in Copenhagen -- the event became the stuff of modern scientific mythology. Director Howard Davies puts his spin on the momentous meeting that occurred one night in September 1941, during which the longtime friends entered into a dangerous discussion about physics and politics.','/gIuDQm1Hb2t3u1CD3A9IvK31CdV.jpg','2002-09-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Copenhagen',51016,1.2837,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17976,_binary '\0','/g1oUhH8SYcoNCOQOJnPvfJv6Zuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340074',7.6,1409,'ar','ضد الحكومة','After being fired by the prosecution office, Mostafa becomes a personal injury lawyer and takes advantage of people\'s pain for profit. But his life turns upside down when his only son falls victim to a car accident.','/2T8wf39inK5YY1j8bLO5dRI0lz3.jpg','1992-06-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Against the Government',329456,0.6993,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17977,_binary '\0','/aMbo1svtbNvE6iR1Q96MR1E5AQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340086',6.7,1355,'fr','Dédales','Psychologist Dr. Brennac is asked by a colleague to help with the case of Claude, a patient on trial for multiple murders. Is Claude really guilty of the crimes, or is he a victim of his own mind?','/a7fD9Ls1qSBLWOpLgcbrM8R0jqo.jpg','2003-09-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Labyrinth',22578,1.8643,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17978,_binary '\0','/m49dLlJH81YCw4USCNyzoimixae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340110',5.6,3875,'en','Fat Pizza','Fat Pizza is yet another slice of life at a dodgy suburban Sydney take away. Bobo Gigliotti the psychotic pizzeria owner/pizza chef is awaiting the arrival of his mail-order refugee bride Lin Chow Bang, and a new pizza deliverer is on the block. Channel V\'s Jabba almost steals the show as token skip delivery boy Davo Dinkum, a stoner with a bong strapped to his face like a feedbag.','/liPJfjBKSn0UKQ1W2GTgfk07Rmb.jpg','2003-04-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Fat Pizza',15603,2.1554,5.6,'RVYxdWScsm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17979,_binary '\0','/uPEOUD9wFNHna9Bl6aeBnxHExBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340122',4.8,1233,'te','గంగోత్రి','A factional leader\'s only daughter falls in love with his loyal lieutenant\'s son. When the childhood lovers\' secret is exposed their fathers become enemies. How will the young man react to his lover\'s father bombing his house? Will there ever be an end to the cycle of violence, hatred and revenge?','/6Lag0Rz0STSejW65oQLgDtzK2AV.jpg','2003-03-28',148,'Released',NULL,'Gangotri',117092,2.0692,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17980,_binary '\0','/qbl2m9PcHmmhzQIVpvF2mApxFpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340137',5.7,2548,'fr','Grande école','Paul and Agnes have been going out for quite a while and Agnes is shocked to learn that he\'d rather live with two roommates on campus than move in with her. As soon as he meets one of his roommates, Louis-Anault, Paul\'s behavior changes - he is attracted to Louis without realizing so himself. Agnes, on the other hand, gets quite jealous and offers a bet: Whoever gets to have Louis-Anault first, wins... If she does, Paul will no longer explore his homosexual desires, if he does - she\'ll walk away. Meanwhile, Paul meets Mecir, a young Arab worker, who shows him there\'s more to life than elite colleges...','/etGBmCDIfXWSFrb4wplSsOxAfSN.jpg','2004-02-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Grande école',4676,2.7326,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17981,_binary '\0','/aK1uB5c111DXSvPOrriizPoWwh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340163',6.5,116837,'en','Hostage','When a mafia accountant is taken hostage on his beat, a police officer – wracked by guilt from a prior stint as a negotiator – must negotiate the standoff, even as his own family is held captive by the mob.','/vjhLmtjO2pMQXRgkxcwZoq2Ma8n.jpg','2005-03-09',113,'Released','Every second counts.','Hostage',2026,7.4106,6.364,'HCt4L7RPweE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17982,_binary '\0','/nlWTByQKsvun17ArNRvbAsgb6LD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340285',6.6,1377,'nl','De passievrucht','Armin is in crisis. One fateful day he discovers he is infertile and has been throughout his life. From this he discovers his first wife, Monika, was unfaithful before she died. How else could she have the child that Armin always thought was his? His paranoia drives him to find the truth.','/7X2ENEHsnbJbcX0kRy035doEnoI.jpg','2003-12-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Father\'s Affair',24245,1.3841,5.9,'uIgy0vVMk0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17983,_binary '\0','/allvJZKXH3PVzXcQVpmM3TUMSrf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340331',6.4,6723,'en','School of Life','At Fallbrook Middle School, the annual student-elected Teacher of the Year award is held. And every year for the last 43 years Norman Warner or most fondly called Stormin\' Norman Warner has won the award. Now that he has died, the burden of carrying the legacy falls into the hands of Matt Warner, the son of the late Norman Warner who has always lived in the shadow of his father.','/6v3lhMJLKQEsIpQRM56pU0FMwzW.jpg','2005-02-19',111,'Released','This School Rocks!','School of Life',35320,2.6666,6.3,'Vb9JRUVGp1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17984,_binary '\0','/uHFZdbtLAaAaVFKBowN1RTDD0oC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340376',6.2,5865,'en','The Statement','An ambitious Judge and an exacting Colonel re-open the sixty-year-old case of Pierre Brossard, an escaped Nazi collaborator accused of murdering seven Jews. Now an old man living a sheltered life within the Catholic Church, Brossard is also being trailed by mysterious hit men, determined to kill him before he\'s arrested.','/a7IvoBJ70dp6U1fjRlvB04ZtxvF.jpg','2003-12-12',120,'Released','At the end of World War II, many of those involved in war crimes were prosecuted. Some got away. Until now.','The Statement',41488,2.7097,5.7,'DLZqRaw8cWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17985,_binary '\0','/bX5UVSVDOcuFMJh2zWN6gXbKswM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340377',7.6,81770,'en','The Station Agent','When his only friend dies, a man born with dwarfism moves to rural New Jersey to live a life of solitude, only to meet a chatty hot dog vendor and a woman dealing with her own personal loss.','/kjJg6eJa9I9flfHaJG67ecEv8YX.jpg','2003-12-05',88,'Released','Loneliness is much better when you have got someone to share it with.','The Station Agent',2056,6.431,7.3,'031TV29V3e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17986,_binary '\0','/pVKIGWU73bOc1RGocdRUwB573JT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340380',6.8,1914,'en','Straight from the Heart','Jordan Donavan, a photographer in New York, is so disappointed when after five years of going steady Edward Morgan offers her not marriage but just to move in with him, that she accepts the match-making arranged via a magazine by her female friend with Tyler Ross, a horse rancher in the West, whose candidacy was actually also posted by his sister. After a bad start they soon grow closer.','/9bDM5O87EbABkYEjV6VmSDXVCYT.jpg','2003-02-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Straight from the Heart',26131,1.6713,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17987,_binary '\0','/purLFx9MR327mRclyc4sFYjE1cv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340468',7.8,9078,'pt','Ônibus 174','On 12 June 2000, in Rio de Janeiro, Ônibus 174 was taken by an armed young man, threatening to kill all the passengers. Transmitted live on all national networks, this shocking and tragic event became one of violence\'s most shocking portraits, and one of the most terrifying examples of police incompetence and abuse in recent years.','/30v64yPfBbNSmnYHShExuWlXUJh.jpg','2002-10-22',118,'Released','Reality transcends fiction','Bus 174',8439,1.8285,7.349,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17988,_binary '\0','/nUJk4UjWS9YvBJUepCWziQ1QYSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0340855',7.3,173426,'en','Monster','In 1989, prostitute Aileen Wuornos befriends and enters a relationship with a young woman named Selby. Determined to straighten out her life, Aileen\'s limited education lands her back on the corner. She\'s raped by a trick, who she kills. A string of murder and robbery follows that ultimately leads Aileen to becoming America\'s first female serial killer.','/sWPKG1GX0woLNBuvDZkwZC8Q3Ub.jpg','2003-12-24',109,'Released','Based on a true story.','Monster',504,11.2219,7.2,'vq70brIQP40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17989,_binary '\0','/bU0Mg9htLgTXOhwq1bNyfLAT3d5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341266',6.4,4612,'hi','भूत','A Mumbai businessman and his wife are looking for a new flat. Apartment 1201 has been vacant since its previous occupant jumped to her death. Undeterred, the couple still decides to move in, but before long, the wife starts to have visions.','/tbQMeDyLSYUqHOcOexuJVeE3wLy.jpg','2003-05-30',113,'Released',NULL,'Bhoot',107937,1.1274,6.014,'zGXrqDEo9aI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17990,_binary '\0','/r9w9jic0JIZLjSWSw1TCzmEdVRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341376',6.7,3587,'en','Gettin\' Square','Gettin\' Square is about starting over, keeping clean and going straight. Barry Wirth is fresh out of prison and determined to stay on the straight and narrow. But like his mate Johnny \'Spit\' Spiteri and reformed gangster turned restaurateur Dabba, he finds out the hard way that there are old scores and a few new ones that\'ll make getting square a lot harder than he thought.','/pNmRcemD7hWuJkT2694ErOWU0K6.jpg','2003-10-09',100,'Released','Sunny place. Shady people.','Gettin\' Square',23201,1.9564,6.38,'KugQtOF4R4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17991,_binary '\0','/dKEdyAzeV1PmBf4WQrDKpbS88LB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341384',6.4,3649,'ko','해안선','A member of Coast Guard Platoon 23, Private Kang monitors a high-infiltration stretch of beach lined with barbed-wire fencing. Driven by the belief that killing a spy is the highest honor, he waits for a chance to prove his worth.','/ezHR68DZeyKgRraAZd3eGCgmIl.jpg','2002-11-22',96,'Released','There is a line that cannot be crossed.','The Coast Guard',1416,1.9686,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17992,_binary '\0','/oi28QA3CdKJ6FVyHPbTOk8PpZce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341455',7.5,2618,'hi','मकड़ी','One half of an identical set of twins, the mischievous Chunni is known in her hometown for the pranks she plays, notably on her father, the schoolteacher and the village butcher. To get out of trouble, Chunni often impersonates her sister Munni and makes others look a fool.','/1HuLZToYLNaeDDwZCbWV3UP12gF.jpg','2002-11-22',90,'Released','The Web of the Witch','Makdee',134841,1.195,6.84,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17993,_binary '\0','/9SIFiToG6kRkoS5OKUhuPYp2mnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341495',5.5,8812,'cn','赤裸特工','A mysterious woman, known as Madame M, kidnaps forty pre-teen girls and transports them to a remote island to train them as the most deadly assassins. CIA operative Jack Chen follows the case for 6 years with no leads, but when a series of assassinations begin to occur, Jack suspects that Madame M is back in business.','/bEkFMDlIosqroIO8yBBIKZWoGRh.jpg','2002-11-15',90,'Released','They will seduce you - just before they kill you!','Naked Weapon',10855,1.5385,6.8,'po5IAj7iGyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17994,_binary '\0','/y7aUGF0d32JcmuWW8TsgnTEZaLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341555',6.5,6859,'ko','색즉시공','Eun-sik tries to pass the state exam while studying in college after his military service. One day, he meets a beautiful woman Eun-hyo, and his life changes.','/5Z5Frv3V7vqVt0wN7aM2EmaAO43.jpg','2002-12-12',96,'Released','Go Kids!','Sex Is Zero',16318,6.1826,6.177,'gaxh1HQ_AxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17995,_binary '\0','/k7NJU5ExxtzKj5zHuT6uoYt27w3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0341578',6.1,2866,'nl','Shouf Shouf Habibi!','Abdullah \'Ap\' Bentarek is happy that, unlike his Uncle Yusuf who stayed in the ancestral Moroccan mountain village, his father Ali moved to the Netherlands – even though it does mean that he’ll have to deal with lousy friends and unrealistic expectations at the employment office. A light-hearted portrait of the immigrant experience and the ubiquitous intolerance of the unfamiliar in Dutch society.','/vO3O4ZYTWqAqk1gDRZD1V4Gtkfw.jpg','2004-01-29',89,'Released',NULL,'Hush Hush Baby',21022,0.9444,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17996,_binary '\0','/ik7CjQH06N4vCPJNRSYKtFs3Ms0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342012',7.6,2365,'tr','Dokuz','In a poor neighbourhood of Istanbul, a young homeless girl has been found dead. Six people from the neighbourhood are being interrogated. While the police camera is recording, these six witnesses find themselves caught in manipulation and abuse, forcing them to give away their innermost secrets.','/x8mQbcOIp1n9V5LFEU2Wb5Jd97L.jpg','2002-11-15',91,'Released',NULL,'9',61812,1.3883,7.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17997,_binary '\0','/cdde5FZcHmRmqDl70sVkx1zlSdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342143',6.5,2093,'en','Born Rich','A documentary on children of the insanely rich. Directed by one of their own, Johnson &amp; Johnson heir, Jamie Johnson.','/6M8O4tNFy93wvTE9U5QKZNrolww.jpg','2003-01-19',75,'Released',NULL,'Born Rich',55047,1.9524,6.6,'u-hIuvgfpIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17998,_binary '\0','/fqPhhswcdM2NNa1nohM7LgZjRJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342150',7.8,3792,'en','Bukowski: Born Into This','Director John Dullaghan’s biographical documentary about infamous poet Charles Bukowski, Bukowski: Born Into This, is as much a touching portrait of the author as it is an exposé of his sordid lifestyle. Interspersed between ample vintage footage of Bukowski’s poetry readings are interviews with the poet’s fans including such legendary figures such as Lawrence Ferlinghetti, Joyce Fante (wife of John), Bono, and Harry Dean Stanton. Filmed in grainy black and white by Bukowski’s friend, Taylor Hackford, due to lack of funding, the old films edited into this movie paint Bukowski’s life of boozing and brawling romantically, securing Bukowski’s legendary status.','/84jdtVpKSgyGpBy9fdeQZWXiqeI.jpg','2003-01-18',115,'Released',NULL,'Bukowski: Born Into This',16765,1.8679,6.8,'94y4lApb-Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17999,_binary '\0','/1DamXq2CtwO0uwM8bPjtZMI6uYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342167',6.2,6398,'en','Camp','Misfits in their lives back home, a group of young people live it up at musical-theater camp. While the sports counselor is completely ignored, the kids\' spend all their time in rehearsal for a grueling schedule that involves a new show every two weeks. Several personal stories come to the fore.','/7aOOZisCXvI26i7wgMqBaWQxTY3.jpg','2003-09-05',114,'Released','You can\'t fit in when you already stand out.','Camp',33339,2.2645,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18000,_binary '\0','/zzA34BteuSwSgo9tYhtHwq87paL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342172',7.6,29021,'en','Capturing the Friedmans','An Oscar nominated documentary about a middle-class American family who is torn apart when the father Arnold and son Jesse are accused of sexually abusing numerous children. Director Jarecki interviews people from different sides of this tragic story and raises the question of whether they were rightfully tried when they claim they were innocent and there was never any evidence against them.','/429t6nh7M8cg29CtgXAjvwWe1Dv.jpg','2003-05-30',107,'Released','Who do you believe?','Capturing the Friedmans',2260,2.0085,7.1,'DGrD_vVE5bQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18001,_binary '\0','/teljQG7QGmMVD97XQe3cqtvdkPS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342213',6.9,3985,'en','Comandante','Oliver Stone spends three days filming with Fidel Castro in Cuba, discussing an array of subjects with the president such as his rise to power, fellow revolutionary Che Guevara, the Cuban Missile crisis, and the present state of the country.','/gJjwog4k9ricwM9oi0rc0CsOrXr.jpg','2003-02-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Comandante',25783,1.2801,6.6,'roo8Xm-I6eI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18002,_binary '\0','/leukkAoRu9rsa3s8oaLm8C10EWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342258',7,112724,'en','Unleashed','Raised as a slave, Danny is used to fighting for his survival. In fact, his \"master,\" Bart, thinks of him as a pet and goes as far as leashing him with a collar so they can make money in fight clubs, where Danny is the main contender. When Bart\'s crew is in a car accident, Danny escapes and meets a blind, kindhearted piano tuner who takes him in and uses music to free the fighter\'s long-buried heart.','/gghvmS3UxtOw1UHIgYjpeZNxHil.jpg','2005-02-02',103,'Released','Serve no master','Unleashed',10027,6.1363,6.96,'AoBkHA7-I84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18003,_binary '\0','/h3EmI6sR3THbrsMe5x12qnFtsH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342272',6.5,10752,'en','Dear Wendy','In a blue-collar American town, a group of teens bands together to form the Dandies, a gang of gunslingers led by Dick Dandelion. Following a code of strict pacifism at odds with the fact that they all carry guns, the group eventually lets in Sebastian, the grandson of Dick\'s childhood nanny, Clarabelle, who fears the other gangs in the area. Dick and company try to protect Clarabelle, but events transpire that push the gang past posturing.','/2IF19Tcx5D9d8iUWa0PxFhO6MYZ.jpg','2005-02-04',105,'Released','One shot is all it takes','Dear Wendy',10913,2.6276,5.8,'D1Mh8wJOeg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18004,_binary '\0','/Q12KsBMEk6XZoqp7GoG5khaHos.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342275',7.6,2892,'en','A Decade Under the Influence','A documentary examining the decade of the 1970s as a turning point in American cinema. Some of today\'s best filmmakers interview the influential directors of that time.','/uzt9AkMIxm84IStnjU1hB4o3bWG.jpg','2003-04-25',110,'Released',NULL,'A Decade Under the Influence',38868,2.4936,7.9,'2o5PG4j8ILE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18005,_binary '\0','/8c3EHJbYJ79dXMtFqmyduLs18RS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342492',7.2,27981,'da','De grønne slagtere','Svend and Bjarne work for a butcher in a small Danish town. Fed up with their boss\' arrogance, they decide to start their own butcher shop. After dismal beginnings, an unfortunate accident happens which coincides with a large order of meat. One hasty decision leads to another and soon the business thrives. In the meantime, Bjarne has to deal with his twin brother who has been in coma for years following a gruesome car accident.','/w9hCJ0JKftF8nX9Z2gNbVOtCFh1.jpg','2003-03-08',100,'Released','Pick your cut!','The Green Butchers',4972,3.7709,7.1,'D-9zg3f0wCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18006,_binary '\0','/1eaJjLLrSLyfnKKsdjMmBBi2PzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342508',4.8,2813,'en','Hangman\'s Curse','Bullying students are becoming deathly ill after screaming the name of a legendary ghost. What\'s to blame? An exotic illness? An illicit drug? Or is it the supernatural? The clues are few and time is running out for the students of Rogers High School. The only hope is the Veritas Project, a highly trained investigative team working undercover to expose the truth. Lives hang in the balance as they scramble to unravel the mystery and protect the student body from their own hatred and fear.','/x56Xy4QEVXiNXNpogBUebycGjW.jpg','2003-09-12',106,'Released','Watch your locker, watch your back, watch your soul.','Hangman\'s Curse',45862,1.6671,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18007,_binary '\0','/iInmtgnJor6kqwJ9ovWJ5xaUGwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342520',6.4,3579,'fi','Helmiä ja sikoja','When their bootlegging father ends up in jail, four twenty-something brothers need money to pay his debts to local crooks. Next, their 9-year-old half-sister is dumped on their doorstep by her prostitute mother. A karaoke set helps reveal that the little girl is quite a singer, just as a talent contest for children is coming up on national television offering more than enough money to the winner.','/pUmJWFUbVb7P9vQeXRZDQz2H4R.jpg','2003-08-29',114,'Released',NULL,'Pearls and Pigs',54764,1.4045,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18008,_binary '\0','/pagEjnPNtOeByBJ0CAaWFAugP4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342636',7.2,4631,'sv','Fyra nyanser av brunt','An eccentric millionaire dies at a manor in Dalarna in Sweden, leaving behind three sons and a mistress. One of four parallel stories about parents and children. Four sides of Sweden. Four shades of brown.','/7J7MM2AtEaZkuxdl1Jehdy2GyR2.jpg','2004-01-25',192,'Released',NULL,'Four Shades of Brown',25283,1.3435,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18009,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342689',2.9,3640,'fi','Levottomat 3','30-something Jonna, successful executive with cozy architect husband Niklas and two children, leads a double life. She is constantly on the lookout for quick casual sex. When she starts seeing handsome and rich young yacht owner Aleksi, things start going awry in her life. While her sister Sanna provides her with suitable alibis,sex therapist Nora tries to help her come to terms with her addiction','/oyE1dGFYalNjFAC9V2wWneXKtGJ.jpg','2004-01-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Addiction',20162,0.5092,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18010,_binary '\0','/dbAAQhptC6FyxBJx91IQv9zRiki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342735',7.2,26636,'da','Manderlay','In 1933, a young woman and her father discover an Alabama plantation whose inhabitants live as if slavery had never been abolished. Feeling a sense of duty to those behind the heavy gates, she stays to liberate the people and see them through their first harvest. With four of her father\'s colleagues and a lawyer, she faces the daunting task of resurrecting the place known as Manderlay.','/6HYoHEcLNgETHlJDyQrC4Y7e01.jpg','2005-06-03',138,'Released','Liberation. Whether they want it or not.','Manderlay',1951,5.1567,6.914,'vFk2Vy1bWHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18011,_binary '\0','/5EUsv9EUV6MNXPCOtcjc7YOOxIE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342771',5.8,2297,'sv','Miffo','Tobias is the new, idealistic priest in a suburb but he soon learns that his flock is quite uninterested in Christianity. However, he befriends Carolina, a chain smoking woman his age, wheelchair-bound since birth. It is opposites attract although their backgrounds are different.','/cC2GpeXogGyCNq9BaPXhg1w3SnH.jpg','2003-07-31',105,'Released',NULL,'Miffo',5995,1.2442,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18012,_binary '\0','/mM4i4fMjO6EvzM4GconQ1sLBcs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342778',6.6,1513,'zh','寻枪','After a policeman gets drunk and loses his service weapon, he frantically searches for his revolver and the killer who murdered his former lover.','/rG14eUFqiJUmKv5L1kdljPgVFkV.jpg','2002-05-09',90,'Released',NULL,'The Missing Gun',83277,1.4254,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18013,_binary '\0','/zzxtUF9lpW3NBrmq0P2Y27bwjSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342804',8.3,1804,'en','My Flesh and Blood','My Flesh and Blood is a 2003 documentary film by Jonathan Karsh chronicling a year in the life of the Tom family. The Tom family is notable as the mother, Susan, adopted eleven children, most of whom had serious disabilities or diseases. The film itself is notable for handling the sensitive subject matter in an unsentimental way that is more uplifting than one might expect.','/nS6FmSnmG40W84xZVXyB5NLMMnL.jpg','2003-04-25',83,'Released',NULL,'My Flesh and Blood',22289,1.2095,8.2,'xDIhXB5c0cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18014,_binary '\0','/oyXdJKeaZMSSRECidiW4jeaieNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342835',3.4,1316,'en','Nightstalker','Richard Ramirez, aka the Nightstalker, who terrorized people in Los Angeles during the 1980s, and the police had no clue with him.','/zpH9qinJGB8QaGd0tVzvO0gkZid.jpg','2002-11-10',97,'Released','This Is His Story.','Nightstalker',64929,1.4587,3.2,'qpjsaBdG6Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18015,_binary '\0','/q5Dw0lwoyyPOFzHGqx28TXsYCNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0342882',6.2,1576,'en','The Piano Tuner of Earthquakes','Dark fairytale about a demonic doctor who abducts a beautiful opera singer with designs on transforming her into a mechanical nightingale.','/a3vfQ4tsbw6qcw7RJC16RFLwlaX.jpg','2005-09-09',99,'Released',NULL,'The Piano Tuner of Earthquakes',44502,2.1159,6.3,'gOxn6XkCYRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18016,_binary '\0','/qLsRInhxgSMPsspRpJ02MpNlsdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343095',5.6,3101,'en','This Girl\'s Life','The porn star Moon spends her time working, nursing her widowed father that has Parkinson disease and with her friends Jessie and Martine. Her boss Aronson gives a new contract to Moon to be signed. Moon has a blind date with Jessie\'s friend Kip and they feel a great attraction for each other. When Jessie asks Moon to test the fidelity of her boy-friend, Moon decides to offer the service to other customers. But when she meets the dangerous Terry, she reevaluates her life and her relationship with Skip.','/vngo9sQN55Jr0lBL2iW5uBEJvsK.jpg','2004-12-03',104,'Released',NULL,'This Girl\'s Life',14883,2.8697,5,'sqkMgdZWMo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18017,_binary '\0','/7J1uNQ2pGvHMzXzD2uePRUBI63m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343121',7.9,10060,'en','Tupac: Resurrection','Home movies, photographs, and recited poetry illustrate the life of Tupac Shakur, one of the most beloved, revolutionary, and volatile hip-hop MCs of all time.','/dGJxjq8npqFZtuAtGsyjntip7uh.jpg','2003-11-14',112,'Released','In his own words','Tupac: Resurrection',21525,2.0286,7.9,'kNn0gj4FP8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18018,_binary '\0','/d0oHN3xA6TxOvADW64OiyYFpLOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343135',6,151205,'en','Along Came Polly','Reuben Feffer is a guy who\'s spent his entire life playing it safe. Polly Prince is irresistible as a free-spirit who lives for the thrill of the moment. When these two comically mismatched souls collide, Reuben\'s world is turned upside down, as he makes an uproarious attempt to change his life from middle-of-the-road to totally-out-there.','/7Tp16THdpHkMrqgoiDresDz9CWL.jpg','2004-01-16',90,'Released','For the most cautious man on Earth, life is about to get interesting.','Along Came Polly',5966,9.7067,6,'BTXS-5D_U8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18019,_binary '\0','/1PKVTysj2gRrfSNf4TKaywedK8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343168',7.4,3881,'en','The Weather Underground','The remarkable story of The Weather Underground, radical activists of the 1970s, and of radical politics at its best and most disastrous.','/fuTAf8DJkj2vljaprE5upLP3nWA.jpg','2002-11-17',92,'Released',NULL,'The Weather Underground',14108,1.6297,6.6,'02EelIEfvS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18020,_binary '\0','/qA02x3zsnhHOCjknQvy5upUZSXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343221',7.6,4821,'fi','Äideistä parhain','1943: Nine-year-old Eero whose father is killed during the war is brought to Sweden to foster parents to his protection like thousands of other Finnish children. Eero feels lost, particularly as his foster mother Signe behaves very unfriendly. She was expecting a little girl and still mourns for her daughter who drowned in the sea.','/dJhGq1H1EeptuB3YT0aZWj1CZ5N.jpg','2005-09-30',111,'Released',NULL,'Mother of Mine',32990,1.9847,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18021,_binary '\0','/f4mH2U6R79mIjRv8GDs2TGUAC3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343422',7.5,1244,'tr','Bereketli Topraklar Üzerinde','The tragic story of three farm worker who migrates from their village to the cotton land Çukurova.','/goP82yq5gUB2K16dVXtzq9xaCwJ.jpg','1980-01-02',115,'Released',NULL,'On Fertile Lands',329165,0.8208,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18022,_binary '\0','/76b2CVFBWbARUlxIzKLb9MsRbZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343426',4.4,1616,'fr','La Beuze','Alphonse Brown, who firmly believes he is the bastard son of James Brown, meets up with his best friend Scotch after Brown gets out of jail. On their way to Paris to begin careers as recording artists, the pair stumbles across a potent type of marijuana that was engineered by the Nazis. Their decision to begin selling the stuff leads to a variety of people chasing after them.','/glrZtjRcHQtZr19EFoaxGRhqwbQ.jpg','2003-02-05',93,'Released',NULL,'The Dope',49878,1.3663,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18023,_binary '\0','/80MARgu7K3BWGFJ94Jrtc0sEwWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343449',4.4,3091,'en','The Bone Snatcher','After miners disappear in the Namib Desert, some scientists find their remains and the demonic creature that killed them.','/kceAJpK27zaE2IdXU1iIzUHZcIt.jpg','2003-12-23',90,'Released','It will scare you out of your skull.','The Bone Snatcher',22451,1.9818,4.6,'HgUUyzXeY68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18024,_binary '\0','/ak173gW3RUlAC1N52OQ2eCDcqm3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343531',6.9,1425,'en','A Christmas Visitor','The Boyajian family learned of 18-year-old John\'s death in the Persian Gulf War on Christmas Eve eleven years earlier and have not celebrated Christmas since. They have been so consumed by his death that they have forgotten the joys of the holidays, until a mysterious visitor enters their lives and rekindles the spirit of the season.','/vMqB3RZIgjk4RMUHNtAkWOrnNQz.jpg','2002-11-24',100,'Released','They were a family shattered by the past and struggling with the future. One visitor will change them forever.','A Christmas Visitor',26934,1.3696,5.4,'kTi5vYvG8fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18025,_binary '\0','/v8lPo8UWKyP2tIXD8N64HfNP4Pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343660',6.8,420650,'en','50 First Dates','Henry is a player skilled at seducing women. But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total recall, he realizes it\'s possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again. That\'s because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.','/lzUI2Cg7OMfcUNv3f7MywYNBjs6.jpg','2004-02-13',99,'Released','Imagine having to win over the girl of your dreams... every friggin\' day.','50 First Dates',1824,18.2785,6.9,'17KJk3ErIx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18026,_binary '\0','/7ehwRyqw5k65erbI6m25P1tgLtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343663',5.9,7818,'en','Eros','A three-part anthology about love and sexuality: a menage-a-trois between a couple and a young woman on the coast of Tuscany; an advertising executive under enormous pressure at work, who, during visits to his psychiatrist, is pulled to delve into the possible reasons why his stress seems to manifest itself in a recurring erotic dream; a story of unrequited love about a beautiful, 1960s high-end call girl in an impossible affair with her young tailor.','/bz8pWVNsbg1MMKCgp2VX6wFOXJX.jpg','2004-12-03',109,'Released','Three visionary directors. One erotic journey.','Eros',39850,4.2332,5.7,'A0Xpq2WKBxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18027,_binary '\0','/kR0b1QrKIn4AJs1a56ejU7tWfoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343737',6.7,113318,'en','The Good Shepherd','Edward Wilson, the only witness to his father\'s suicide and member of the Skull and Bones Society while a student at Yale, is a morally upright young man who values honor and discretion, qualities that help him to be recruited for a career in the newly founded OSS. His dedication to his work does not come without a price though, leading him to sacrifice his ideals and eventually his family.','/qWmF0rQRPeIVQRfwQN3C9VFKsBh.jpg','2006-12-11',167,'Released','Edward Wilson believed in America, and he would sacrifice everything he loved to protect it.','The Good Shepherd',1247,9.2004,6.4,'MKStOxOrxiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18028,_binary '\0','/jpFcZH2eyh6gcoxCa637TrGe4bT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343818',7.1,621328,'en','I, Robot','In 2035, where robots are commonplace and abide by the three laws of robotics, a technophobic cop investigates an apparent suicide. Suspecting that a robot may be responsible for the death, his investigation leads him to believe that humanity may be in danger.','/efwv6F2lGaghjPpBRSINHtoEiZB.jpg','2004-07-15',115,'Released','One man saw it coming.','I, Robot',2048,23.0855,6.972,'ry1N9lrzt7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18029,_binary '\0','/4PnsKLoZBnv25r55aYyUEYG8bFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0343996',6.5,10219,'en','The Lost City','In Havana, Cuba in the late 1950\'s, a wealthy family, one of whose sons is a prominent nightclub owner, is caught in the violent transition from the oppressive regime of Batista to the Marxist government of Fidel Castro. Castro\'s regime ultimately leads the nightclub owner to flee to New York.','/v19DsrJb0TJxTCdgaUzzuvOjfeD.jpg','2005-09-03',144,'Released','A place you leave is a place that lives forever.','The Lost City',9700,2.9564,6.2,'Ox9QbPf1SA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18030,_binary '\0','/prAjDGy5xZon2BK88zRYUFzVrQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0344273',7,4178,'fr','Rois et Reine','Shortly before her wedding, art gallery director Nora travels from Paris to Grenoble to visit her preteen son, Elias, who is spending time with her aging professor father, Louis, recently diagnosed with terminal cancer. During her stay, she reaches out to her former lover, Ismaël, a viola player and father figure to Elias who has been committed against his will to a mental hospital. Ismaël, however, has his own problems to sort out.','/oNG2gAM1xqZnV8iTXn5qXF8IMyv.jpg','2004-12-22',150,'Released',NULL,'Kings & Queen',44524,1.6032,7,'7YYNT3A-DM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18031,_binary '\0','/vOpm4wQk5qIl8UepoKrpaloqaPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0344510',7.6,78280,'fr','Un long dimanche de fiançailles','Young Frenchwoman Mathilde searches for the truth about her missing fiancé, lost during World War I, and learns many unexpected things along the way. The love of her life is gone. But she refuses to believe he\'s gone forever — and she needs to know for sure.','/jZ3Ir3d69dsyxif8dTVh3DjKzKH.jpg','2004-10-27',133,'Released','Never let go.','A Very Long Engagement',2841,5.0088,7.3,'BNx2iuOGVVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18032,_binary '\0','/yr90qtmsOMlR3NZ1ellJeRFoWFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0344604',6.4,3295,'fr','Après vous...','Antoine works in a bar in Paris. One evening on his way home from work, he intervenes when a man tries to commit suicide. He feels strangely guilty about having saved the man\'s life and constantly tries to help him, make things better. No matter what Antoine does, he can\'t get Louis\'s mind off Blanche, the woman of his dreams, his sole obsession, the reason why he wanted to die... Antoine decides to look for her, but doesn\'t let Louis know.','/ro2GcTo04JtEl62caPAjzVBPcPx.jpg','2003-12-17',110,'Released',NULL,'After You',16932,2.436,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18033,_binary '\0','/yrV9hx7OnSpJQbvfpTDl0IakjVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0344777',4.1,1707,'en','Six: The Mark Unleashed','Resistance fighters must stop a brutal dictator who uses high tech surveillance to rule the world.','/aO2gEcLFpf9IwGdmrXq7raJ2s5V.jpg','2004-05-06',104,'Released','Three Men. Two destinations. One choice.','Six: The Mark Unleashed',43210,2.5146,4.6,'fOx59BOtHHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18034,_binary '\0','/zwV8u4kq6ClZ3IDylLGF3DprKDv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0344854',6,45086,'fr','Arthur et les Minimoys','Ten-year-old Arthur, in a bid to save his grandfather\'s house from being demolished, goes looking for some much-fabled hidden treasure in the land of the Minimoys, tiny people living in harmony with nature.','/gH27K0S7BiZCsNMxzOQTacG9IZp.jpg','2006-12-13',94,'Released','Adventure awaits in your own backyard.','Arthur and the Invisibles',9992,10.7954,6.394,'xIzKgO3C6Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18035,_binary '\0','/9vgZTcALddJ49YOyiDFtO7MiU1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345032',7.1,2551,'it','Le chiavi di casa','Meeting his handicapped son for the first time, a young father attempts to forge a relationship with the teenager.','/vQJtW76ln4tbOYlhkwoV1LkPy7m.jpg','2004-09-10',111,'Released',NULL,'The Keys to the House',42420,2.0017,6.5,'A4Kfvfio75w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18036,_binary '\0','/8BsZeEl8gArwpYIBXyJ2WdreF8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345061',6.1,21878,'en','Code 46','In a dystopian future, insurance fraud investigator William Gold arrives in Shanghai to investigate a forgery ring for \"papelles\", futuristic passports that record people\'s identities and genetics. Gold falls for Maria Gonzalez, the woman in charge of the forgeries. After a passionate affair, Gold returns home, having named a coworker as the culprit. But when one of Gonzalez\'s customers is found dead, Gold is sent back to Shanghai to complete the investigation.','/ijayvLrCAwOVizi9OY8LZWq5SRW.jpg','2003-09-02',93,'Released','How do you solve a crime when the last thing you want to know is the truth?','Code 46',2577,3.628,6.155,'C107PH39Xig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18037,_binary '\0','/co2HWhWxNvyWWRLEpudY659gqK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345074',6.3,9007,'en','Connie and Carla','After accidentally witnessing a mafia hit in the Windy City, gal pals Connie and Carla skip town for L.A., where they go way undercover as singers working the city\'s dinner theater circuit ... disguised as drag queens. Now, it\'s not enough that they become big hits on the scene; things get extra-weird when Connie meets Jeff -- a guy she\'d like to be a woman with.','/mR0K8S5s2c5uxpcevnVam17HFrh.jpg','2004-04-16',98,'Released','When you follow your dream, there\'s no telling what you\'ll become.','Connie and Carla',15673,3.1068,5.9,'B-UiWexA8CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18038,_binary '\0','/iiuUFMSMTurcIaDKSxN3ki4L63M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345128',7.1,1464,'fr','Deux ans après','Agnès Varda’s follow-up to her acclaimed documentary THE GLEANERS AND I takes us deeper into the world of those who find purpose and beauty in the refuse of society, revisiting many of the original film’s subjects.','/azTpxHHruFZlroxfcYir9ESpcAK.jpg','2002-12-18',63,'Released',NULL,'The Gleaners and I: Two Years Later',84026,1.1391,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18039,_binary '\0','/18lBYsCVfl0XtV63fZgNN09xToA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345177',8.3,1833,'hi','एक डॉक्टर की मौत','After years of painstaking research at the cost of his domestic affairs, Dr. Dipankar Roy is working on a vaccine for leprosy. As the word slowly gets out in medicine, he becomes vulnerable to the professional jealousy, incompetence, and abuse of power from the medical department.','/kbLJ6AkumaH3Lcdufs1TgFENfKu.jpg','1990-01-01',133,'Released',NULL,'Death of a Doctor',212051,0.9777,6.433,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18040,_binary '\0','/2XZV0gaakXCU59hGv2UBxpMkC2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345185',6.7,1228,'es','En la ciudad','A group of eight thirtysomethings search for happiness in their relationships.','/h9MmksudfCBMMoM8w7MYUVnUTf9.jpg','2003-11-07',110,'Released','Relationships aren\'t easy.','In the City',71110,1.4514,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18041,_binary '\0','/wTbxGCUpbO0Jh39M5cJnONHNqaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345235',4.6,2674,'fr','Les Fils du vent','A multicultural band of acrobatic do-gooders take on gangsters of three great nations in this action-packed sequel to the French box-office smash Yamakasi. The Yamakasi are a team of crime fighters who can scale buildings and urban towers with the ease of a fly walking up the wall; after leaving their home base in Paris to set up operations in England, the men decide to set up a satellite facility','/6fy4t7qzeNvEkew3cTBOopyX399.jpg','2004-06-23',90,'Released',NULL,'The Great Challenge',25631,2.6523,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18042,_binary '\0','/pGkLONOflJi0uLdBkbJIcf68oDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345549',7.4,11977,'th','เรื่องรัก น้อยนิด มหาศาล','An obsessive-compulsive Japanese librarian living in Bangkok spends most of his days contemplating suicide in his apartment. His life changes when he witnesses the death of a young girl and becomes acquainted with her elder sister.','/pN6e9bMNfFNsIJZqb924KKu8lq4.jpg','2003-08-03',112,'Released','Why bother with suicide?','Last Life in the Universe',11606,1.7227,7.1,'1xMEQuwVnHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18043,_binary '\0','/lAqRSGKRcLog0mYJJG9uQ3mmPPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345551',7.1,19610,'en','Latter Days','Christian, a hunky, 20-something, West Hollywood party boy gets more than he bargains for when he tries to seduce Aaron, a sexually confused Mormon missionary who moves into his apartment complex.','/uwzJL11Xp6h8stocOz6E8e2LWtB.jpg','2004-01-30',108,'Released','Aaron prays, Christian plays...opposites attract.','Latter Days',15708,3.238,6.9,'ZuQe-6Za_K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18044,_binary '\0','/dDz1oJtj43y0bPlGMK6hoazRicA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345561',6.5,5998,'it','La leggenda di Al, John e Jack','Hapless Depression-era gangsters Al, John and Jack find out their boss wants to get rid of them and come up with a plan to sell him to the FBI, but Al\'s short-term memory loss could make it difficult.','/t7Xb04P1uCUJ1LADWD5RfqWGyDu.jpg','2002-12-13',105,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Al, John and Jack',38397,1.8031,7.073,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18045,_binary '\0','/8es0Zx66M3TNclfHtj5NyG4NA2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345591',7.3,7884,'en','Love Comes Softly','Nineteen year old pioneer woman Marty has recently married. She goes west with her husband Clem, hoping to start a new life. But Clem unexpectedly dies, and Marty finds herself alone, two months pregnant. Widower Clark offers her a marriage of convenience: she needs food and money, and he needs someone to take care of his daughter Missie. She accepts his proposal as a temporary solution.','/shyGlG9BJtb8k201XP6R17niKU5.jpg','2003-04-13',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Comes Softly',16250,4.4933,6.8,'JFTsYgtGcwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18046,_binary '\0','/jRjWfKaswkaG4OcbSEsaPXc4uI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345853',6.3,3316,'da','Rembrandt','Two bumbling scrap metal thieves - father and son - steal the wrong painting during a museum heist. The painting turns out to be the only original Rembrandt painting in Denmark, and all hell breaks loose. What do you do when you\'ve got Interpol, the Danish police and the entire Danish underworld on your heels? And who was this Rembrandt guy anyway?','/gN38rJZ77dtnVqbIGTkNtF4glX2.jpg','2003-05-17',109,'Released','They did the robbery of the century - They just didn\'t know it','Stealing Rembrandt',11196,1.3185,6,'DmxS1GIUXtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18047,_binary '\0','/6ZnHQKcqQ8nmfP6woZu2v5EtXoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0345950',7.2,113018,'en','The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie','There\'s trouble brewing in Bikini Bottom. Someone has stolen King Neptune\'s crown, and it looks like Mr. Krab, SpongeBob\'s boss, is the culprit. Though he\'s just been passed over for the promotion of his dreams, SpongeBob stands by his boss, and along with his best pal Patrick, sets out on a treacherous mission to Shell City to reclaim the crown and save Mr. Krab\'s life.','/1rvzKV1d18EbDVaEd4VDzK3cgnY.jpg','2004-11-19',87,'Released','Hero. Legend. Sponge.','The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie',11836,18.0285,7.113,'Tv8xk7BKaNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18048,_binary '\0','/tCuAIg6KXy5Q2cewOyl6mKJOsnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346094',7.5,25008,'tr','Uzak','A young man from rural Turkey arrives in Istanbul with dreams of working on a ship and stays with a cousin while he searches for work. Over time, the former’s struggles to find employment and the latter’s troubles and disappointments strain their relationship and living situation.','/7XKGrHh1BRnMiIRMRYRsWPQDJfh.jpg','2002-12-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Distant',31026,2.3237,7.128,'YJKIypY3P-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18049,_binary '\0','/rJTX2M5fEz1sBxUhYuY534jXQBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346156',6.1,90706,'en','Sky Captain and the World of Tomorrow','When gigantic robots attack New York City, \"Sky Captain\" uses his private air force to fight them off. His ex-girlfriend, reporter Polly Perkins, has been investigating the recent disappearance of prominent scientists. Suspecting a link between the global robot attacks and missing men, Sky Captain and Polly decide to work together. They fly to the Himalayas in pursuit of the mysterious Dr. Totenkopf, the mastermind behind the robots.','/pFJDXKg280uKiXG3eorscwV68D7.jpg','2004-09-17',107,'Released','Who will save us?','Sky Captain and the World of Tomorrow',5137,7.4442,5.9,'cY3ypQD6p2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18050,_binary '\0','/leF9AKe937UhQsfWGtXfG7tBRvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346336',8.4,28788,'it','La meglio gioventù','After a fateful encounter in the summer of 1966, the lifepaths of two brothers from a middle-class Roman family diverge, intersecting with some of the most significant events of postwar Italian history in the following decades.','/ltmcFRvTeAgBgMLUGa15KzDSQqs.jpg','2003-06-22',367,'Released','The Possibilities Were Endless...','The Best of Youth',11659,3.2457,8,'eIozQwKTxp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18051,_binary '\0','/iujJbAcLr7FdXeqSgWz4NKwzzKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346457',6.5,11152,'hi','Mangal Pandey - The Rising','The film begins in 1857, when India was ruled by the British East India Company. Mangal Pandey is a sepoy, a soldier of Indian origin, in the army of the East India Company. Pandey is fighting in the Anglo-Afghan Wars and saves the life of his British commanding officer, William Gordon. Gordon is indebted to Pandey and a strong friendship develops between them, transcending both rank and race.','/sNbujMdQQavUFvUCDhoFtKkpYL7.jpg','2005-08-12',150,'Released',NULL,'Mangal Pandey - The Rising',20496,2.8272,6,'4ujFeqC_BTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18052,_binary '\0','/h21dxRjtR7xOhyZljtSYeTETCht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346491',5.6,184900,'en','Alexander','Alexander, the King of Macedonia, leads his legions against the giant Persian Empire. After defeating the Persians, he leads his army across the then known world, venturing farther than any westerner had ever gone, all the way to India.','/jrwQu72sGwGqwE8Ijne89PSIvhp.jpg','2004-11-21',176,'Released','The greatest legend of all was real','Alexander',1966,14.0953,6,'CKKKyLe0CJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18053,_binary '\0','/hzVQ1bOgrbXgXuoltdDEEO5KFlI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346507',5.3,3024,'hi','अंदाज़','Young Raj Malhotra lives with his elder brother, Rohit; his sister-in-law Kiran, and a niece. After an accident fractures his leg, he is unable to walk for some time. Due to psychological reasons, he cannot walk even after the fracture heals. When the Malhotras move to Dehra Dun, Raj befriends young Kajal, as both share a common passion for airplanes. Kajal encourages Raj to walk, and succeeds. Years later the two continue to be fast friends, and everyone expects them to marry soon. Then Raj is recruited by the Indian Air Force and goes for training for a year and a half. After his training gets over, he rushes to Kajal to propose to her, only to find out that she has given her heart to a multimillionaire, Karan Singhania (Verma), who owns several airplanes and choppers. Raj congratulates Kajal and Karan, but does not reveal his true feelings.','/xLUQ9NLnn13rujYqbmdoNvv2dmM.jpg','2003-05-23',146,'Released','When you love someone express it','Andaaz',54072,1.2485,5.895,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18054,_binary '\0','/1ecpXOwhQrMzoV3TrzqJELduQjo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346631',6.7,38586,'en','Blood and Bone','In Los Angeles, an ex-con takes the underground fighting world by storm in his quest to fulfill a promise to a dead friend.','/4XoqjwKhqN3GlGt0fQtcY2OhkZq.jpg','2009-02-07',93,'Released','Meet the last man standing.','Blood and Bone',22164,8.8642,7.4,'8pdKYIapamQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18055,_binary '\0','/to8rqdubR3IUCotrIz2xirwmgAb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346723',6.5,17911,'hi','चलते चलते','A man pursues a woman who is already engaged and eventually gets married to her. Differences between the two lead to a bitter separation that threatens to destroy their relationship forever.','/7eux23WmDXUkmgLdMdxuuFn9II4.jpg','2003-06-12',175,'Released','Opposites Attract','Chalte Chalte',4252,1.8261,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18056,_binary '\0','/veE9egHhtWn3t8tHyhp2HArXN1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346800',6.9,1560,'en','Cowards Bend the Knee','When he takes his girlfriend to a seedy abortion clinic in the back room of a combination hair salon / bordello, Guy Maddin meets the madam’s daughter and falls in love. But she won’t let any man touch her until her father’s murder has been avenged.','/3Oto4m94iirzlTD5v0y7jXv0qsg.jpg','2003-01-22',64,'Released',NULL,'Cowards Bend the Knee',17595,1.4548,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18057,_binary '\0','/2qjYdHlbYMY2zfRdv1HPZxCkR3c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0346932',6.6,2540,'en','Eloise at the Plaza','Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York\'s Plaza Hotel. Her caretaker \"Nanny\" watches over her while her mom is away. Then one day, while trying to figure out how to get invited to a fancy ball as well as how to meet a visiting prince, Eloise makes a new friend around her age! So she decides to take him on a tour of the city - and all while plotting some matchmaking hijinks for her other friends too!','/bdxBapcOvqfndDDrnrg8rv0STHN.jpg','2003-04-27',89,'Released',NULL,'Eloise at the Plaza',46806,2.7087,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18058,_binary '\0','/lJ5x8E2X0qh8JyFdzwq7AEWNqlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347016',6.7,1220,'da','Forbrydelser','Anna, a young theology graduate, starts work as a prison chaplain. She becomes especially concerned about one inmate, Kate, regarded as difficult and withdrawn, but whom the other inmates credit with mysterious healing powers.','/e26AUVUGKfqqQ14uWFH5F6p3X7c.jpg','2004-01-23',101,'Released',NULL,'In Your Hands',33294,1.5736,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18059,_binary '\0','/wpHeTVD7KtfbIPh0dIBXzzb985E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347048',7.8,61330,'de','Gegen die Wand','With the intention to break free from the strict familial restrictions, a suicidal young woman sets up a marriage of convenience with a forty-year-old addict, an act that will lead to an outburst of envious love.','/9L5BBJiXZss58EBcbw0l4holdzZ.jpg','2004-03-11',122,'Released','You don\'t really know how much you can love...','Head-On',363,4.3559,7.49,'zRioyPHCSVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18060,_binary '\0','/szTU3G3gC6vUrdPBLJiQtlpa6nz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347105',7.4,2497,'bs','Gori vatra','Two years after the Bosnian civil war, a town that is slowly rebuilding itself must whip together a democracy when it\'s announced the U.S. President Bill Clinton might be paying a visit.','/u5nyYeEH4vADCypXaqRPZr6ilDk.jpg','2003-08-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Fuse',126090,0.8315,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18061,_binary '\0','/2iphMECIWgez9bybdNjEQPKlmWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347131',6.8,1249,'es','Los guantes mágicos','This film follows the crisscrossed fortunes of, among others, a rock musician, a flight attendant, a dog walker with an alarming penchant for over-the-counter medication, and a cab driver, who doesn’t really care about his life spiralling out of control, as long as he can sit in his old Renault 12.','/WIGGC9jG91LSt3c4UV0p2kgtbD.jpg','2003-09-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Magic Gloves',126104,0.8548,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18062,_binary '\0','/4cn1lg9wKOeuAI1zQOpzZezZpfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347145',6.2,1262,'ar','حرامية فى كى جى تو','Two thieves, Hassan and Sebaey, plan to rob the safe in the Kaitby Fortress in Alexandria, but the police capture Sebaey, who asks Hassan to take care of Nesma, his daughter; if he does this, Sebaey will not say that Hasan conspired in the robbery attempt. Hassan meets Nesma\'s teacher, Miss Reem, and the two become romantically involved. Miss Reem does not know of Hasan\'s history.','/wGBaSROonYVXhR88PXhr20ngYOE.jpg','2002-02-20',107,'Released',NULL,'Thieves in KG2',452162,1.298,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18063,_binary '\0','/nv5wwZou159v5OC61i4ElR7OqyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347149',8.2,521630,'ja','ハウルの動く城','Sophie, a young milliner, is turned into an elderly woman by a witch who enters her shop and curses her. She encounters a wizard named Howl and gets caught up in his resistance to fighting for the king.','/13kOl2v0nD2OLbVSHnHk8GUFEhO.jpg','2004-09-09',119,'Released','Love Comes First.','Howl\'s Moving Castle',4935,52.5694,8.387,'0YNhAf4qxLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18064,_binary '\0','/e7o1KXbkxImEzxMUPytp0DiXQrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347167',5.5,2878,'hi','दी हीरो : लव स्टोरी ऑफ़ अ स्पाई','Arun Khanna is a spy for the Indian government whose aid is enlisted to stop ISI Chief Ishak Khan. Khan is trying to build a nuclear bomb with which he can liberate Kashmir from the Indians. A battle of wits ensues. When Khan detonates a bomb at Khanna\'s engagement party to a fellow spy, Khanna\'s resolve is only strengthened. Now not only does he have to fight Khan, but he also has to track down his missing fiancee.','/f1tNXXHZwPRCiP94P7sB0NeNSRT.jpg','2003-04-10',160,'Released','Love story of a spy','The Hero: Love Story of a Spy',271677,2.8506,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18065,_binary '\0','/7Ug83qMQmLSy2WUoND5Cjr3h7ay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347228',7.5,1800,'en','The Iceman Confesses: Secrets of a Mafia Hitman','Richard Kuklinski was a devoted husband, a loving father...and a ruthless killer. A decade after HBO last visited him in prison, the convicted murderer, who freely admits having whacked more than 100 people in cold blood, takes viewers back inside his cold, calculating mind. In this follow-up to America Undercover\'s 1992 film The Iceman Tapes: Conversations with a Killer, Kuklinski provides all-new insights about his exploits as one of the Mafia\'s most notorious assassins...and reveals some shocking confessions for a number of previously unsolved murders.','/4d36q3fUSJE1TmeciZ0qnjj93eB.jpg','2001-03-01',43,'Released','He\'s killed over 125 people, one at a time... sometimes just for practice.','The Iceman Confesses: Secrets of a Mafia Hitman',216043,0.7858,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18066,_binary '\0','/8Cbzx17QdJ6xBx2uDkdlpWsemGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347246',7.4,43124,'ja','イノセンス','Cyborg detective Batou is assigned to investigate a series of murders committed by gynoids—doll-like cyborgs, which all malfunctioned, killed, then self-destructed afterwards. The brains of the gynoids initialize in order to protect their manufacturer\'s software, but in one gynoid, which Batou himself neutralized, one file remains: a voice speaking the phrase \"Help me.\"','/1ZJRbLDVr90KLtKdmTT4WZhT26E.jpg','2004-03-06',100,'Released','When machines learn to feel, who decides what is human...','Ghost in the Shell 2: Innocence',12140,5.385,7.4,'0XkATpPvqEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18067,_binary '\0','/58zBo7rdkVJKECHoExaijVgzVe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347278',7.1,2286,'hi','Jhankaar Beats','Deep and Rishi, best friends and passionate musicians, navigate the challenges of their personal and professional lives while preparing for the annual music contest, \"Jhankaar Beats.\" Deep enjoys a stable life with his wife, Shanti, and young daughter, but faces pressures from a demanding job, a quirky client, and a meddlesome mother-in-law. Rishi, on the other hand, is grappling with a failing marriage to his headstrong wife, Nicki, and the emotional toll of living apart. When Neel, a talented guitarist with his own romantic troubles, joins their advertising agency, he becomes an unlikely ally. Together, the trio juggles work chaos, relationship conflicts, and their unyielding dream of winning the competition. Set against a backdrop of music, camaraderie, and laughter, their journey is one of self-discovery, forgiveness, and the pursuit of harmony both on and off the stage.','/m2xDt3HvKBwjlhtqR2Kp4zvyVul.jpg','2003-06-20',144,'Released','Thodi Masti.. Thodi Yaari.. Thoda Pyaar','Jhankaar Beats',161834,1.0273,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18068,_binary '\0','/9SBIiF803WgYbLtgstZ64GCW9Hh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347304',7.9,82595,'hi','कल हो ना हो','An uptight MBA student falls for the charismatic new neighbor who charms her troubled family – but he has a secret that forces him to push her away.','/zhMI6I0kSLnewTMwE0A8Tz3Cj2f.jpg','2003-11-27',187,'Released','A story of a lifetime… in a heartbeat.','Kal Ho Naa Ho',4254,4.4187,7.5,'tVMAQAsjsOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18069,_binary '\0','/kjP6ghSTQAJmN0zzva0PuwLiK88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347330',6.5,4801,'fr','Le Convoyeur','Vigilante, a small armored truck company, is in full crisis mode. Victim of three violent hold-ups in a year, which left no survivors, the company is on the verge of bankruptcy and its employees are extremely worried. Some even suggest a complicity between the robbers and the firm. It is in this difficult context that a man, Alexandre Demarre, one morning presents himself to start his first day of work at Vigilante.','/huGODrOTIElqmV3WuOHwo2IFZVv.jpg','2004-04-14',95,'Released',NULL,'Cash Truck',21776,2.8638,6.4,'PGZ2UDltLeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18070,_binary '\0','/lbqlG7AmXjBW10f0ESj1oUrz1s7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347332',7.4,17647,'hi','ख़ाकी','DCP Anant and his team get tasked with escorting an alleged terrorist to Mumbai. However, a rogue ex-police officer makes their task difficult as he tries to stop them from reaching their destination.','/dMsqwWFl51t8jXR0tWzjEuO8H4l.jpg','2004-01-23',180,'Released',NULL,'Khakee',21665,1.5168,6.5,'GtY2SiJMtz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18071,_binary '\0','/5LEz0AsrcsQUWBEBtnGAW3s0PsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347369',5.1,2671,'en','Jiminy Glick in Lalawood','Hungry for an A-list interview that could launch him into the gossip rag stratosphere, Jiminy Glick, a small-time journalist with big aspirations and an even bigger appetite, drags his wife and kids across the country to the star-studded Toronto Film Festival. But in between the nonstop parties and all-you-can-eat buffets, Glick soon finds himself in the middle of an outrageously scandalous mystery that becomes the celebrity scoop of the decade!','/xggAb26HJ64LTx7SYIn58nIM1b0.jpg','2005-05-08',91,'Released','It takes a big man to cover this town.','Jiminy Glick in Lalawood',67445,2.4315,4.4,'nERZw-Uvb5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18072,_binary '\0','/mQmGfyRcmLEensLsg4X8H5dC0Wx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347416',5.5,3785,'hi','LOC: Kargil','This film dramatizes events that occurred as the hostility between India and Pakistan over Kashmir came to a head in 1999, when more than 1,000 men crossed the \"Line of Control\" that separates the two locations. Taliban and Pakistani soldiers took over the area, blocking the main road that linked the regions. Standing their ground, Indian soldier drove them away, but not without losing more than 400 of their own men first.','/8rwlGnSWgLJlveO4OoOJ2n2YZyv.jpg','2003-12-12',255,'Released',NULL,'LOC: Kargil',71920,2.3657,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18073,_binary '\0','/srroA2hnqkrvQKpoXkEl6KgE9hA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347449',7.2,6175,'es','Luna de Avellaneda','The story of a social and sports club in a Buenos Aires neighborhood and of those who try to save it from being closed.','/vyGtvy3TCMzULGznJwXUJ4tGxUT.jpg','2004-05-20',143,'Released',NULL,'Moon of Avellaneda',57977,1.4413,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18074,_binary '\0','/67ITyxHiAhBVeNLrQPtHTiEB4Us.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347457',7.1,1578,'sv','Om jag vänder mig om','Sweden, shortly before Christmas. Surgeon Rickard is told the job he expected goes to a Dane, because of his substance abuse. It\'s too late to cancel dinner with his in-laws. The guest couple announces their in-vitro is a success. Then Richard\'s wife learns he cheated her with Sofie. Meanwhile ugly hag Anita trades drugs to afford a taser to use on her ex Olof and his former physiotherapist. Workaholic builder Anders is disgusted by his grieve-deranged client Knut\'s plan and decides to spend time on his family, not just money.','/xWY3vHjvUSGslGlrxKX6gMeAXQZ.jpg','2003-11-14',110,'Released','Same day, different lives...','Daybreak',25157,1.4581,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18075,_binary '\0','/v9WuP3V5eeJudaqoDE870HEuYSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347473',7.1,45508,'hi','मैं हूँ ना','An army major goes undercover as a college student. His mission is both professional and personal: to protect his general\'s daughter from a radical militant, and to find his estranged half-brother.','/e14wdurP8vKrajKWZO3fmC1sITq.jpg','2004-04-30',179,'Released',NULL,'Main Hoon Na',14134,3.2963,6.6,'lzOH61u36W0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18076,_binary '\0','/gitYCf6XVeX711p8PfkkqcjtG4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347591',4.6,2755,'en','My Name Is Modesty: A Modesty Blaise Adventure','Modesty, raised by a casino owner after being abandoned by her parents, has become skilled in the ways of fighting and now acts as the casino owner\'s bodyguard. When she\'s unable to prevent the owner\'s murder at the hands of an old foe, Modesty is hell-bent on seeking revenge. --- An adaptation of the Modesty Blaise novels and comic strip by Peter O\'Donnell.','/k2xL9z1Bwh7s4WLE9uNF6CE27Mo.jpg','2004-09-28',78,'Released',NULL,'My Name Is Modesty: A Modesty Blaise Adventure',20013,2.4238,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18077,_binary '\0','/cPRfgCgNLJ20jLuOAXAxcNHNDn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347618',7.1,73671,'ja','猫の恩返し','Young Haru rescues a cat from being run over, but soon learns it\'s no ordinary feline; it happens to be the Prince of the Cats.','/pqyY7IEWkCWNZ7EuRStQaJITEta.jpg','2002-07-19',75,'Released','It\'s not so bad being a cat, now is it?','The Cat Returns',15370,10.8147,7.1,'25aQLIj6jPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18078,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347779',7.9,3172,'hi','पिंजर','In the days leading up to Partition, a Hindu woman is abducted by a Muslim man. Soon, she finds herself not only forced into marriage, but living in a new country as the borders between India and Pakistan are drawn','/ld5kHH5HxKlgYLDlhYQpYgLymu8.jpg','2003-10-22',188,'Released','Beyond boundries','Pinjar',198727,1.3443,7.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18079,_binary '\0','/6nfEmbfWMuMBenYMOY6Vdho3Ycg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0347791',6.1,7856,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター 水の都の護神 ラティアスとラティオス','Ash, Pikachu and the gang try and stop a pair of thieves hiding out in the canals and alleyways of Altomare, the age-old water capital. Joining the adventure are two new legendary Pokémon, a pair of siblings named Latias and Latios, who serve as peacekeepers and protectors of the Soul Dew — a priceless treasure with a mysterious power.','/eySv5rdYLW1k6LxepxCNl8ND26R.jpg','2002-07-13',80,'Released','On a mission they never expected. To a world they never imagined. An adventure you\'ll never forget.','Pokémon Heroes',33875,6.1087,6.7,'0czLeuT6rU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18080,_binary '\0','/bk8m8EPLv3RsfgUJ7FSJdnBgSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348031',4.1,1519,'en','Silent Warnings','In a small Oregon town, mysterious crop circles have begun appearing in Joe\'s corn fields. When Joe\'s cousin, his five college friends and local Sheriff Willingham happen upon the otherworldly designs, they unleash unfathomable terror.','/fiQrZqQncvKmy73AXZwEMGT9U1G.jpg','2003-05-03',87,'Released',NULL,'Silent Warnings',44020,1.3983,4.1,'a1Ho0FMAZE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18081,_binary '\0','/eu7qPQljYrB5rDuXL2MDopA95g3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348121',6.8,19894,'ja','スチームボーイ','In 1860s Britain, a boy inventor finds himself caught in the middle of a deadly conflict over a revolutionary advance in steam power.','/o6WsW5QFh3YaDdAJkyVUweTpUtr.jpg','2004-07-17',126,'Released','He will save the future.','Steamboy',8953,3.6362,6.9,'rQpbBwA0r14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18082,_binary '\0','/8eRscFbRYl681zDfkjv1jjW1KAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348150',6.1,304938,'en','Superman Returns','Superman returns to discover his 5-year absence has allowed Lex Luthor to walk free, and that those he was closest to felt abandoned and have moved on. Luthor plots his ultimate revenge that could see millions killed and change the face of the planet forever, as well as ridding himself of the Man of Steel.','/385XwTQZDpRX2d3kxtnpiLrjBXw.jpg','2006-06-28',154,'Released','Look up in the sky!','Superman Returns',1452,12.5756,5.829,'zVCozSQj8TQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18083,_binary '\0','/jaegX6b1InnSSUAagdr0NE2ABBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348333',6.7,114132,'en','Waiting...','Young employees at Shenaniganz restaurant collectively stave off boredom and adulthood with their antics.','/h3NJDiaaliUH35ApXPu8PFKZwWz.jpg','2005-10-07',94,'Released','What happens in the kitchen ends up on the plate.','Waiting...',7553,7.1195,6.2,'HJEsNjH3JT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18084,_binary '\0','/5Tb2QTevPW7L29I6EnISxnoArw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348505',6.1,5807,'en','Asylum','A woman becomes very curious about one of her psychiatrist husband\'s inmates, a man who was found guilty in the murder and disfigurement of his former wife.','/kpVKZeMaTf6twAQycbccbeFjBDE.jpg','2005-09-09',99,'Released','Passion. Possession.','Asylum',24461,3.805,6.04,'nxKcbDRul1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18085,_binary '\0','/diEr7cut4E9f7Xw3bMjXDblS8Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348529',4.5,7047,'fr','Anatomie de l\'enfer','A woman employs a gay man to spend four nights at her house to watch her when she\'s \"unwatchable\".','/mCjueTbZd8x88DM3slyGQjmeXma.jpg','2004-01-28',77,'Released',NULL,'Anatomy of Hell',2003,4.627,4.8,'_KyPzHOasbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18086,_binary '\0','/45N9i1D3OrGZgyqswMcEWAmiupv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348568',7.7,11063,'ko','클래식','Ji-hae\'s friend is having problems expressing her feelings to the boy she loves, so she asks Ji-hae to write e-mails to him in her name. As the boy falls in love with her letters, Ji-hae discovers the story of her mother\'s romance which is remarkably similar to her own circumstances.','/sNe23Tsia9usMBN5TW2KXPJdq2K.jpg','2003-01-30',133,'Released','Chance is a gift for those who try.','The Classic',42190,3.2977,7.61,'ui0797zvICo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18087,_binary '\0','/8O90ZGiXWihkXkOlqGUUaPQummW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348591',6.5,2649,'ko','동갑내기 과외하기','A touching story of two completely different students from two completely different worlds. One is a rich male repeating his third year of high school and the other a poor girl in her second year of university struggling to make ends meet.','/b0P50XbHewuq2GStOyVGyFHWOEP.jpg','2003-01-30',110,'Released','The funniest couple ever is born.','My Tutor Friend',18371,2.1727,6.509,'guoZ2_hL_NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18088,_binary '\0','/61zVIux4OdinQEtO7mthpnVEjeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348593',6.6,16721,'en','The Door in the Floor','A writer\'s young assistant becomes both pawn and catalyst in his boss\'s disintegrating household.','/2elMSIcQ9wDuFz1uzLU72AAKFOF.jpg','2004-07-18',111,'Released','The most dangerous secrets are the ones we\'re afraid to tell ourselves.','The Door in the Floor',1944,4.5085,6.1,'KZLcb3wijC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18089,_binary '\0','/8GSdmt4M8SNKAGeDyWJTkXwMhqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348656',4.2,1935,'hi','खुशी','While playing matchmaker to a pair of their friends, two young university students begin developing feelings for each other.','/zqEnM5Ef8QXcbWrPZ311i2TLSUA.jpg','2003-02-07',166,'Released',NULL,'Khushi',345426,1.4063,5.261,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18090,_binary '\0','/eLBHPVQkJZyaSEUAGAFWNJJwmeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348836',5.9,124697,'en','Gothika','After a car crash, criminal psychologist Dr. Miranda Grey regains consciousness only to find that she\'s a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. She\'s been accused of murdering her husband Dr. Douglas Grey — but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-worker, Dr. Pete Graham, of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.','/frSGNQcWx1ek8dCduFYCux1ho7n.jpg','2003-11-21',98,'Released','Because someone is dead doesn\'t mean they\'re gone.','Gothika',4970,6.1696,6.2,'STxbF5tl5T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18091,_binary '\0','/9NcQ98dSkIJF13RibV9hY8MapJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348843',5.3,2552,'hi','Jism','Kabir Lal is an alcoholic lawyer whose life is looking as if going down the drain. One morning he sees a stunningly attractive woman on a beach and is instantly enamored by her. By chance he sees her again in a restaurant and offers to buy her a drink. In the process he learns that her name is Sonia and she is married. Unable to resist, he asks her whether she would show him her home. It marks the beginning of a passionate affair, during which Kabir is told that Sonia\'s husband neglects her. But Sonia cannot leave him because she cannot support herself without her husband\'s money. Sonia suggests murder and Kabir, blind with lust, agrees. They manage to kill Sonia\'s husband and make it look like an accident, but then Kabir gets to see Sonia\'s other side: she no longer is the passionate lover as before, but is a cool-headed mean woman now who won\'t let go of her wealth at any cost.','/afSVOdens3jMc1QzLA3Ps3XGSbR.jpg','2003-01-17',136,'Released',NULL,'Jism',48391,1.6707,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18092,_binary '\0','/rYzVBCiWUIgfyIYxtRcuhpFgqVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0348853',6.3,5494,'fr','Nathalie...','Paris doctor Catherine starts to think her husband, Bernard, is having an affair when she hears an unfamiliar woman\'s message on his voice mail. Hoping to learn more about his extramarital activities, Catherine heads to a strip club, where she hires call girl Nathalie to have a fling with Gerard. As the affair progresses, Nathalie gives Catherine regular status reports, and the relationship between the women evolves from business to personal.','/29cGC3wI4RtumU8suSs7U4IAS2w.jpg','2004-01-07',105,'Released','Can you ever control another person\'s sexuality?','Nathalie...',38376,2.1198,5.806,'bnjEqOnbGNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18093,_binary '\0','/wrTM20Hh6rc0Gzw6AkIF0sVBnOc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349047',5.5,17181,'de','(T)Raumschiff Surprise - Periode 1','Hundreds of years after humans have settled on Mars, Regulator Rogul and Lord Jens Maul lead a force of Martians to Earth in order to conquer the planet. Queen Metaphor looks to the gay heroes aboard the Dreamship Surprise – Captain Kork, Mr. Spuck, and first engineer Schrotty – for help.','/60YgMkDDwobP4JXwc2hOFa2VmGg.jpg','2004-07-14',87,'Released',NULL,'(T)Raumschiff Surprise - Periode 1',9805,4.0588,6.2,'1ttzRMIRZNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18094,_binary '\0','/m5yWqFG83kfcwqc7KJ9HHdMCpEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349113',1.4,2226,'en','The Weekend It Lives','A weekend retreat at a remote cabin in the woods for a group of childhood pals turns into a terrifying fight for survival, as a former friend whose family was killed years earlier comes along looking for revenge.','/4ToGUWxNwDDNrmsyTTDfHPYOBWI.jpg','1992-01-29',71,'Released','It Was Supposed To Be A Weekend Get–Away Until The Horror Began!','Ax \'Em',155341,1.5106,2.9,'pTPEWDzjnYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18095,_binary '\0','/iMaC9U1FnmGEJifz65LbIQkiH9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349169',5.6,6618,'en','Breakin\' All the Rules','After being dumped by his model girlfriend, aspiring writer Quincy Watson quits his job and is inspired to pen the ultimate how-to book on breaking up. When it becomes a smash bestseller, he starts giving his player cousin, Evan, choice tips on how to win the battle of the sexes. But when Evan\'s beautiful girlfriend Nikki gets wind of the plan, it\'s these players that end up getting played.','/piEqcDe7CTbxxPUSwswrsoKWzMw.jpg','2004-05-14',85,'Released','When it comes to getting dumped... he wrote the book.','Breakin\' All the Rules',16428,3.114,6,'IPeL9AsrDPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18096,_binary '\0','/cgqJ2JAEFrFIxLpJ7hrsSMu1dDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349205',6,116501,'en','Cheaper by the Dozen','The Baker brood moves to Chicago after patriarch Tom gets a job coaching football at Northwestern University, forcing his writer wife, Kate, and the couple\'s 12 children to make a major adjustment. The transition works well until work demands pull the parents away from home, leaving the kids bored -- and increasingly mischievous.','/afclGGoQslTYFTnyW1LRMtJMiBp.jpg','2003-12-24',98,'Released','The more...the scarier!','Cheaper by the Dozen',11007,9.8179,6.292,'csiX-mSqkGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18097,_binary '\0','/gscoUByieXHy0pCNpF87iLR0Ueh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349225',6.5,2004,'fr','Le Cœur des hommes','The life of four best friends in Paris: Antoine (a gym school teacher), Jeff (director of a monthly journal), Alex (Jeff\'s associate in the monthly journal and a Don Juan) and Manu (owner of fine food store). Their time is shared between their respective jobs, their relationship with women (their own and others...) and the times they meet together to discuss about life and play sport lottery.','/2QCoj8iZWysxVsG78DmFqv606P2.jpg','2003-04-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Frenchmen',19099,1.5083,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18098,_binary '\0','/28GYawVOhonTtiEFGC0nLaFkInj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349260',6,3085,'en','In My Country','An American reporter and an Afrikaans poet meet and fall in love while covering South Africa\'s Truth and Reconciliation Commission hearings.','/zjyO6TrpJSeDCjxdFZk8RYEg6F6.jpg','2004-05-04',103,'Released','A South African Story of Truth, Love and Reconcilliation','In My Country',16635,2.2802,6,'JZTCM5y0Azg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18099,_binary '\0','/AsdEyJUgvyF88vcgrBg8jui0dwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349333',6.4,5007,'hi','डरना मना है','Stranded in an abandoned building, six friends relate scary stories while a crazed killer lurks in the forest.','/aoI022wesHyrQJJKu4mH0bcXuCD.jpg','2003-06-25',121,'Released','Six Stories. One Ending.','Darna Mana Hai',74481,1.4456,6.011,'HMeQgwBm-qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18100,_binary '\0','/lf824nz5248CsXdRjr9KhNKd8d8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349340',6,1243,'en','Dead Bodies','The return of a vengeful ex-girlfriend sets into motion a series of gruesome events for a hapless Irish bachelor in director Robert Quinn\'s grim black comedy. Tommy (Andrew Scott) had thought he had seen the last of Jean (Katy Davis) after their recent breakup, but when she returns to stake her claim on Tommy\'s apartment, the confrontation that ensues makes their previous quarrels look petty by comparison. After leaving the apartment in the head of the fight to cool his head and gather his thoughts, he returns only to find that Jean has died and enlists the aid of his friend Noel (Darren Healy) in ditching the body and ensuring that no one ever finds out what happened.','/apGKZgD3eCuMcyg1pLRmEM7W1Tp.jpg','2003-04-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Dead Bodies',64797,2.0963,5.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18101,_binary '\0','/smeZtoEGTydigK2Ecku4sKmHmES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349416',6.4,9711,'en','Eulogy','A black comedy that follows three generations of a family, who come together for the funeral of the patriarch - unveiling a litany of family secrets and covert relationships.','/u56l2hEhbiVHT4wcjBapcVtAtY6.jpg','2004-10-15',91,'Released','A comedy that puts the *fun* back in funeral.','Eulogy',16358,2.8689,6.4,'idAN2D2S7zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18102,_binary '\0','/asi4QVM9QSdSAZUo5mpMZVxNaxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349467',5.2,17976,'en','Freedomland','A black police detective must solve a strange case of a kidnapped boy and deal with a big racial protest.','/fM9MYcI7BHJ2YqEtcr8JKPE8nDB.jpg','2006-02-17',113,'Released','The Truth Is Hiding Where No One Dares To Look.','Freedomland',9959,4.3005,5.2,'aCy6_bgJ6-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18103,_binary '\0','/pzxTnjc3IyVEjISyu3WyyHM0QI6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349683',6.3,183981,'en','King Arthur','The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the \'Sarmatian hypothesis\' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.','/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg','2004-07-07',126,'Released','Rule Your Fate.','King Arthur',9477,10.3601,6.304,'8Fw_1TwxTRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18104,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349691',6.8,1551,'fi','Koirankynnen leikkaaja','Bright young soldier Mertsi suffers a permanent brain injury in the Second World War. In the late 1940s he wanders around the Finnish countryside looking for simple work and relying on other people\'s help. A workmate, Ville, tells him about his clever Spitz dog back home and the problems with her overlong dew claws. Together with his helpful war buddy Eetvi, Mertsi joins a lumber camp in the middle of a freezing winter, tries hard but finds the work there too strenuous for his body and mind. While he still sees nightmares about the war, in the daytime he keeps dreaming and worrying about the dog...','/7Myk0sEW5AcwZyAN8kQVaokfDAy.jpg','2004-02-13',105,'Released',NULL,'Dog Nail Clipper',55396,1.1808,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18105,_binary '\0','/cxp835z7tswt1g2eBTisOU6cHs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349703',4.4,2053,'hi','क्यों! हो गया ना...','A man and a woman have opposing beliefs about love. He sees her as a friend, but she is in love with him. When the woman decides to marry someone else, the man is left with a heavy heart and wonders if this is what love feels like.','/kKJZqL53LhyTB5vuBj8dQ3JW9Wh.jpg','2004-08-11',175,'Released',NULL,'Kyun! Ho Gaya Na...',19491,1.3697,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18106,_binary '\0','/jF94vmzKJIL9M60TiRqHuHIEesH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349710',6.5,60495,'en','Ladder 49','Under the watchful eye of his mentor, Captain Mike Kennedy, probationary firefighter Jack Morrison matures into a seasoned veteran at a Baltimore fire station. However, Jack has reached a crossroads as the sacrifices he\'s made have put him in harm\'s way innumerable times and significantly impacted his relationship with his wife and kids.','/aJWQNUUHVcI7kvlVdUzPS9J8XHt.jpg','2004-10-01',115,'Released','Their greatest challenge lies in rescuing one of their own.','Ladder 49',11128,5.3311,6.5,'jpU7gzT6CdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18107,_binary '\0','/wCcz89uLIjZ7PKwGvrsQTz0vqe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349825',7.5,64437,'en','Miracle','When college coach Herb Brooks is hired to helm the 1980 U.S. men\'s Olympic hockey team, he brings a unique and brash style to the ice. After assembling a team of hot-headed college all-stars, who are humiliated in an early match, Brooks unites his squad against a common foe: the heavily-favored Soviet team.','/mxtej2th8t8x0ufVBTyhsO6Htxj.jpg','2004-02-06',135,'Released','The story of the greatest moment in sports history.','Miracle',14292,4.498,7.129,'X7xfRXGMrDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18108,_binary '\0','/vQNSK9WcM5INmirp2LyBlgqQ37G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349878',7.6,1463,'hi','Bose: The Forgotten Hero','After resigning from the presidential post of the Indian National Congress, Subhas Chandra Bose plays an important role in India\'s freedom struggle during World War II.','/wxCUiQkMseSSiGxPKA8GnPlpoDY.jpg','2005-05-13',208,'Released','The Forgotten Hero','Bose: The Forgotten Hero',58725,2.2009,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18109,_binary '\0','/iDQDnTiuUeIGZKbVnPwc5rPQ0rS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349889',5,5545,'en','Unstoppable','The deranged military and former CIA agent Dean Cage is in a rehab program, trying to forget the traumatic loss of his best friend Scott in Bosnia. When he dates with his girl-friend and Scott\'s sister, Detective Amy Knight, in a dinning restaurant, he is mistakenly taken as being the CIA agent that is investigating the robbery of the military experiment EX by a man called Sullivan. He is injected with the drug and abducted by the thieves. Amy has six hours to find the also stolen antidote and save Dean\'s life.','/2IGu2f9ItfMuXfM8TuPUizBot1j.jpg','2004-10-20',96,'Released','You can\'t stop a man who will stop at nothing.','Unstoppable',23520,3.1022,5.2,'PuTZjioOnNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18110,_binary '\0','/5b5HrewiViLWEdMR4dmbd7ajQ8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349903',6.5,441816,'en','Ocean\'s Twelve','Despite pulling off one of the biggest heists in Las Vegas history and splitting the $160 million take, each of the infamous Ocean\'s crew have tried to go straight, lay low and live a legit life... but that\'s proven to be a challenge. Casino owner Terry Benedict demands that Danny Ocean return the money, plus millions more in interest. Unable to come up the cash, the crew is forced to come together to pull off another series of heists, this time in Rome, Paris, and Amsterdam – but a Europol agent is hot on their heels.','/pE5anFf7nf6ah7V3VRezQ1KSovi.jpg','2004-12-09',125,'Released','Twelve is the new eleven.','Ocean\'s Twelve',163,16.922,6.566,'ATHwwFhB-UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18111,_binary '\0','/8A7gT7IEq01O0jyiyuv1lYGMNxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0349995',6.7,1883,'it','Prendimi l\'anima','Zurich, 1905. Nineteen-year-old Russian Sabina Spielrein is put by her parents in a psychiatric hospital, suffering from a severe form of hysteria and refusing to eat. A compassionate doctor, Carl Gustav Jung, takes her under his care and, for the first time, experiments with the psychoanalytical method of his teacher Sigmund Freud. Thus is born a sweeping story of love and passion, of body and soul, soaring to the utmost heights, but also plunging to the darkest depths of the 20th century.','/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg','2003-01-17',90,'Released',NULL,'The Soul Keeper',47505,1.8958,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18112,_binary '\0','/lw5YfNEZaxWo7Q7sn76bLUlyAhi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350028',6,40004,'en','Raising Helen','Helen Harris has a glamorous, big-city life working for one of New York\'s hottest modeling agencies. But suddenly her free-spirited life gets turned upside down when she must choose between the life she\'s always loved, and the new loves of her life!','/ubZin4oGXYp6hCn3WU6nrBre62y.jpg','2004-05-27',119,'Released','Her uptown life gets turned inside out!','Raising Helen',4599,5.3125,6.151,'022ampc_2gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18113,_binary '\0','/7i0WHzf7GxUhfnrj1vOQRrKwrqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350193',7.4,7937,'es','Te doy mis ojos','One winter night, Pilar runs away from home. With her, she takes only a few belongings and her son, Juan. Antonio soon sets out to look for her. He says Pilar is his sunshine, and what\'s more, \"She gave him her eyes\"...','/2U9z48ULc5eQSlkERAaLjTZ276m.jpg','2003-10-08',103,'Released','Where it reads \'home\' read \'hell\'. Where it reads \'love\' there is pain','Take My Eyes',1418,3.0596,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18114,_binary '\0','/6amurqTJldc87U62057vJBX8Tup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350194',5.7,2076,'en','Teacher\'s Pet','Meet Spot, a clever little dog with big dreams of becoming a real boy. When Spot finds out that a crazy scientist can make his wish come true, he takes a cross-country trek with Leonard, his best friend and master, and their mom. However, Dr. Krank\'s experiments are a little less than perfect, and it will take Leonard and his pet pals to right this genetic wrong.','/3IiwOT4QF4beOOdCLbJxdw7xzH1.jpg','2004-01-16',74,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Teacher\'s Pet',24034,3.5743,6.1,'4gR84rDqGKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18115,_binary '\0','/wKJvKRpudwPvUW3M9VGMMt40xgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350232',3.9,1660,'en','Trespassing','A graduate student preparing his thesis on mythology leads his friends on a research expedition to an old plantation estate on the outskirts of the Big Easy. The site is reputed to mysteriously cause madness and death to all who enter it.','/yCpwLDcmvziDOkHT9yTKWcT13Tc.jpg','2004-07-26',88,'Released',NULL,'Trespassing',36984,2.154,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18116,_binary '\0','/umtxTkop7Ec9UFynjB7Z53lmkX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350258',7.7,167249,'en','Ray','Born on a sharecropping plantation in Northern Florida, Ray Charles went blind at seven. Inspired by a fiercely independent mom who insisted he make his own way, He found his calling and his gift behind a piano keyboard. Touring across the Southern musical circuit, the soulful singer gained a reputation and then exploded with worldwide fame when he pioneered coupling gospel and country together.','/tSPC7sO2XYNL9QcMmK88tuUALL5.jpg','2004-10-29',152,'Released','The extraordinary life story of Ray Charles.','Ray',1677,8.1949,7.4,'jVHCQfcugdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18117,_binary '\0','/2jOCJ6ejsn9ErgYUjmxWiziOeaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350261',7,36580,'en','An Unfinished Life','Stoic and heartbroken, Einar Gilkyson quietly lives in the rugged Wyoming ranchlands alongside his only trusted friend, Mitch Bradley. One day, the woman he blames for the death of his only son arrives at his door broke, desperate, and with a granddaughter he\'s never known. But even as buried anger and accusations resurface, the way is opened for unexpected connection, adventure, and forgiveness.','/7ugLG1yF1l8HWYhmdmHHSC3kJ8b.jpg','2005-09-09',108,'Released','Every secret takes on a life of its own.','An Unfinished Life',1947,8.1703,6.8,'6_C_8K_KnG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18118,_binary '\0','/5ZTI26xvOKkht81rBHZBT4DJ5VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350774',5.7,6506,'en','Dead & Breakfast','Six friends on a road trip stop for the night at a bed and breakfast in the sleepy town of Lovelock. After a night that leaves both the inn\'s owner and chef dead, the gang finds themselves under suspicion by the local sheriff. But that\'s only the beginning as nearly all of the town\'s quirky residents become possessed by an evil spirit and pin down the friends inside the B&B.','/A10Ce0fJ4RvVvTGm2mbvG08Nc7N.jpg','2004-03-16',88,'Released','It\'s like a bad horror movie, only worse.','Dead & Breakfast',21838,2.4487,5.5,'y7EOYRuHlko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18119,_binary '\0','/8B5KwdFiSUZTQZsLybMj8nt0NU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350804',6,2877,'pt','Deus é Brasileiro','God decides to take a vacation, but first He has to find a saint who can rule the universe while He\'s away. So He goes to the Northeast of Brazil, where He believes there\'s a very good man for the job. As soon as He comes down to Earth, a young man comes along to help on His quest.','/g7mDnFbYus7q9z2OtvJgFWLFjFn.jpg','2003-01-31',113,'Released','It could be a serious mission, if it wasn\'t so funny.','God Is Brazilian',34196,1.6932,6.249,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18120,_binary '\0','/3VtHzw1ZlHcGoGL6I0U85wv9XAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0350811',5.4,4366,'en','The Diary of Ellen Rimbauer','“The Diary of Ellen Rimbauer\" follows the story of the twisted marriage of matriarch Ellen Rimbauer to the promiscuous early 20th-century industrialist, John Rimbauer, and the haunted beginnings of an enormous Seattle mansion that has come to life. Based on the best-selling novel by Ridley Pearson, passages of the diary track a series of deadly encounters surrounding the Rose Red Estate that transform Ellen Rimbauer from the innocent and submissive wife of a wealthy industrialist into a woman possessed by the dark forces inhabiting her home.','/fjTzrF9m2hC8OF4Q1umM5CPoeK9.jpg','2003-05-12',88,'Released',NULL,'The Diary of Ellen Rimbauer',16175,2.8825,5.4,'wyLRuAI_leg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18121,_binary '\0','/1zjOixNUWJiLk4DaRGvccub3u09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351078',4.9,1591,'sv','Hotet','A programmer who\'s working with the secret EWS computer system at a military air force base is threaten by foreign agents, along with his family. His only chance of rescue seems to be the war veteran Haglund who is a leader of a special taskforce.','/336Vd2nQ3mTYBgdtBnohsGVKbml.jpg','2004-02-06',103,'Released',NULL,'The Threat',37267,0.8216,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18122,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351238',7.5,2228,'de','Lichter','Lichter is an episodic tale from Hans-Christian Schmid about the life on the border between Germany and Poland. The film sheds light on the everyday stories of escape and desperateness.','/vpKnM9Vc8jADfOfhM9ftOCimKv9.jpg','2003-02-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Distant Lights',446,1.6849,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18123,_binary '\0','/tPaurpIUskVji5vwV0dhy9pq4Vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351283',7,487628,'en','Madagascar','Four animal friends get a taste of the wild life when they break out of captivity at the Central Park Zoo and wash ashore on the island of Madagascar.','/zMpJY5CJKUufG9OTw0In4eAFqPX.jpg','2005-05-25',86,'Released','They weren\'t born in the wild... They were shipped there.','Madagascar',953,21.8817,6.932,'fq5zU9T_Hl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18124,_binary '\0','/r1TwMdrbwqRanwaaiWQcmEfcESC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351299',7.6,3131,'zh','盲井','Two Chinese miners, who make money by killing fellow miners and then extorting money from the mine owner to keep quiet about the \"accident\", happen upon their latest victim. But one of them begins to have second thoughts.','/ot4n095y50pCqI4CPAfSnq79x8N.jpg','2003-02-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Blind Shaft',11492,1.7946,7.5,'a4LmmUEgaAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18125,_binary '\0','/wGwgbEsY3NCmuy7JeNBLCu1aRd5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351459',6.8,2892,'pt','Os Normais: O Filme','The film shows the day when Rui and Vani first met. It was at their wedding (with other partners). Vani was going to marry Sérgio, and Rui would marry Marta in the same church, following Vani\'s marriage. While waiting for the ceremony, they begin to talk. Complications ensue.','/nurdgMhou91k8cagOvlzre5izIb.jpg','2003-10-24',93,'Released','Find out how it all started','Os Normais: O Filme',37050,1.4907,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18126,_binary '\0','/2verdecl3RVgi25DCi9LgynSJtF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351461',7.3,9882,'is','Nói albínói','17 year old Nói drifts through life on a remote fjord in Iceland. In winter, the fjord is cut off from the outside world, surrounded by ominous mountains and buried under a shroud of snow. Nói dreams of escaping from this white-walled prison with Íris, a city girl who works in a local gas station. But his clumsy attempts at escape spiral out of control.','/dy8srjJ3pQCA967wcJ2WaaTbr51.jpg','2003-02-28',90,'Released','Nói would like to be loved. Nói would like to become rich. Nói would like to escape to Hawaii.','Noi the Albino',1720,1.579,6.968,'CbBD3kjFTmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18127,_binary '\0','/mCTr6YaCvhool90G4CTval0iaiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351770',6.9,2060,'fr','Son frère','After years of estrangement due to difficulties accepting his brother\'s sexuality, a man diagnosed with a terminal illness decides to reconnect. As the brothers grow closer, their renewed bond starts to alienate their partners, leading to emotional turmoil and strained relationships.','/pTBeS1PLFSRavsg3wMsYDLxxBHU.jpg','2003-05-15',92,'Released',NULL,'His Brother',78208,1.2519,5.3,'P5IVCkB-GPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18128,_binary '\0','/vIzv89578J2IMffX3ZSaD6STKQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351795',5.8,1424,'fr','Ripoux 3','It\'s been ten years since the paths of René and François parted ways. From the glorious era when, as cops, they roamed the Montmartre district, they only have a handful of memories left, the money from their cronies having evaporated over time. Everything comes to an end. Until it starts again.','/1xHhUux28lemC990bH5KCqWS0Er.jpg','2003-12-10',105,'Released',NULL,'My New Partner III',22623,1.8501,5.339,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18129,_binary '\0','/pNpQf1ZwdKLHo25jFSDisMfqXJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351817',8,27297,'ja','たそがれ清兵衛','Seibei Iguchi leads a difficult life as a low ranking samurai at the turn of the nineteenth century. A widower with a meager income, Seibei struggles to take care of his two daughters and senile mother. New prospects seem to open up when the beautiful Tomoe, a childhood friend, comes back into he and his daughters\' life, but as the Japanese feudal system unravels, Seibei is still bound by the code of honor of the samurai and by his own sense of social precedence. How can he find a way to do what is best for those he loves?','/bB2M8UF8wc9flfGWkcgkTTf8Mzr.jpg','2002-11-02',129,'Released',NULL,'The Twilight Samurai',12496,4.6344,7.789,'VAepcd9zwgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18130,_binary '\0','/jkEoGVpGmhDyRrF7xhPgtE0tM8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351887',5.5,5624,'cn','千機變','An evil Duke attempts to kill and collect the blood of a royal family of European vampires in order to become all powerful. The only surviving member of the family travels to Hong Kong, only to complicate his struggle by falling in love with a mortal girl who just happens to have a vampire hunter for a brother.','/frwUWEGWFiIlYekPRuZFG5N250Q.jpg','2003-03-08',107,'Released','A new age of darkness is dawning.','The Twins Effect',17457,3.4202,6.1,'_NLJ6j0h65Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18131,_binary '\0','/kK9WAzCaxN5vxoTgO38wiPIe9ba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0351977',6.2,114040,'en','Walking Tall','A former U.S. soldier returns to his hometown to find it overrun by crime and corruption, which prompts him to clean house.','/2sdmKtRz2SlGSLxxZDePKm5zxus.jpg','2004-04-02',86,'Released','One man will stand up for what\'s right.','Walking Tall',11358,8.3237,6.315,'ZGn_qOhEYoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18132,_binary '\0','/mzKFq3rbDr2K39MaGhLMnsuDJOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352230',6.1,2453,'es','Carmen','A French writer documents the seductive power of the beautiful Carmen, who has enchanted José, a young soldier, awakening his most fervent passions leading to tragedy. A path chained to obsession, jealousy, betrayal, and blood.','/6lmfWnwLE66sKWTgaxkpEIO3hw5.jpg','2003-05-16',119,'Released',NULL,'Carmen',25911,1.9626,5.3,'-FYp-Vxl76s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18133,_binary '\0','/oO5sMDETneOPCneX3jfXMFfPh9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352248',8,211056,'en','Cinderella Man','The true story of boxer Jim Braddock who, following his retirement in the 1930s, makes a surprise comeback in order to lift his family out of poverty.','/wkeOjIcpuqLMW4GnVowlM9VI0JE.jpg','2005-06-02',144,'Released','One man\'s extraordinary fight to save the family he loved.','Cinderella Man',921,10.2703,7.6,'PpdRWplFjG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18134,_binary '\0','/hyzXN0OHhrASruzSQw0ULySxsYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352277',6.6,12415,'en','De-Lovely','From Paris to Venice to Broadway to Hollywood, the lives of Cole Porter and his wife, Linda Lee Thomas were never less than glamorous and wildly unconventional. And though Cole\'s thirst for life strained their marriage, Linda never stopped being his muse, inspiring some of the greatest songs of the twentieth century.','/QBqiBQW7MGqlDSyvid4fKzS0Xz.jpg','2004-07-02',125,'Released','A love that would never die and music that would live forever.','De-Lovely',15237,2.0583,6.1,'2gd3UnlpLXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18135,_binary '\0','/ehzwTMxQd4f64Ui2c2REluW4vE2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352314',7.5,8557,'hi','एक हसीना थी','A woman falls for a charming and mysterious businessman. The whirlwind romance turns sour when she is framed for his underworld crimes. Now, finally out of prison she is ready for sweet revenge.','/2SITNl9uSDOelIjfaAEaohKc6tD.jpg','2004-01-16',120,'Released',NULL,'Ek Hasina Thi',135199,1.3976,6.678,'QBCXhMSwLFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18136,_binary '\0','/ch7GVOHMxMuDpNlTO3pOKRqJfPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352332',7.2,2016,'fr','La face cachée de la lune','After the death of his mother, a man tries to discover a meaning to his life, to the universe and to rebuild a relationship with the only family he has left: his gay brother.','/sq4pT3u7r7Os6TVqHtJPSIHzYJs.jpg','2003-09-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Far Side of the Moon',22618,1.4634,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18137,_binary '\0','/dcJLwvM8sRgnMyYRHF2dyOg19z8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352343',7.2,12240,'it','La finestra di fronte','Overburdened and stuck in a greying marriage, Giovanna takes to caring for a Jewish Holocaust survivor her husband brings home. As she begins to reflect on her life, she turns to the man who lives across from her.','/1yeh5uQ6KgvxnInUYE0SYSUWd22.jpg','2003-02-27',106,'Released','Desire knows no bounds.','Facing Windows',29987,4.0303,7,'WMojedvOpFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18138,_binary '\0','/AubgwI5k7Fweo2rJNVe6HQVqBCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352410',7.9,3710,'en','Hornblower: Duty','Admiral Pellew interrupts Hornblower\'s wedding reception and tasks him to locate a British ship which has disappeared off the French coast, where Napoleon\'s troops are engaged in covert activities.','/9flbPp3UHY2rLVxBQoUtp8sYePf.jpg','2003-01-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: Duty',65313,1.3593,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18139,_binary '\0','/1XUjqfCCgoqGiJYV6hfPlHOxC59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352465',6.7,1865,'ja','実録・安藤昇侠道（アウトロー）伝 烈火','After Kunisada\'s Yakuza leader and father figure is brutally murdered, he and his best friend go on a two-man mission to avenge his death, killing other Yakuza leaders leading to a final confrontation by the old man\'s killers.','/2r4WNCpwAQzekbaZwoCcOv1GJuO.jpg','2002-09-21',96,'Released','He is the hunter, and the hunted.','Deadly Outlaw: Rekka',36274,1.557,6.6,'Li2Xnrp8wdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18140,_binary '\0','/lD6JhXP1MGeRNdkdTpid1ClfiIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352520',6.9,15975,'en','The Life and Death of Peter Sellers','The turbulent personal and professional life of actor Peter Sellers (1925-1980), from his beginnings as a comic performer on BBC Radio to his huge success as one of the greatest film comedians of all time; an obsessive artist so dedicated to his work that neglected his loved ones and sacrificed part of his own personality to convincingly create that of his many memorable characters.','/eZHnSd73L5v5FDZdBpGhQPLUZGW.jpg','2004-10-01',122,'Released','Never judge a man by his cover.','The Life and Death of Peter Sellers',10609,4.2448,6.607,'m9pBWtZHV1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18141,_binary '\0','/vUZozcLaxb4KPhKSSVDKQzvW5gQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352524',5.5,1349,'en','Living with Michael Jackson','Martin Bashir conducts a rare interview with Michael Jackson and is given unprecedented access to the reclusive performer\'s private life over a span of eight months, from May 2002 to January 2003.','/jP3GV0E3r3xtbwYCcJqXoRTFvyt.jpg','2003-02-03',60,'Released',NULL,'Living with Michael Jackson',106006,2.051,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18142,_binary '\0','/7rR7eUoPOLJSB8SoaNWniOEQf9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352531',6.7,1499,'el','Ο Χαμένος Τα Παίρνει Όλα','A mysterious man, small-time grifter and big time hard-man has an anarchic tendency to riff on the system, society, police, the underworld itself and other things, along with his beloved bird, Bellafonte, meets up with an odd posse consisting of a young songwriter, a prostitute who gathers money in order to open a bookstore, an alcoholic girl haunted by the relationship with her dead mother, and the grudgey bar-woman-ex-girlfriend. The quintet get caught up in a scheme involving the media, the mob, politicians and the police. And they definitely want to get the hell out of the city, probably to some Caribbean paradise.','/AcauZjWXpzQQSIAzAz0gLksSR9f.jpg','2002-11-15',120,'Released',NULL,'The Loser Takes All',75865,0.7031,6.118,'7tdfyPsgXYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18143,_binary '\0','/z5YFbE9VVHwDXbXbqZdoO6THqPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0352994',7.3,7241,'he','ללכת על המים','Eyal, an Israeli Mossad agent, is given the mission to track down and kill the very old Alfred Himmelman, an ex-Nazi officer, who might still be alive. Pretending to be a tourist guide, he befriends his grandson Axel, in Israel to visit his sister Pia. The two men set out on a tour of the country, during which Axel challenges Eyal\'s values.','/mVWFN3RaBFLuJRtRLPebatX9qPq.jpg','2004-02-05',103,'Released','He was trained to hate until he met the enemy.','Walk on Water',26,2.3766,6.9,'P_-_w_jm1NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18144,_binary '\0','/9h8lN8CExMulqDmYg9hLpz8TvvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353014',6.6,9674,'ko','원더풀 데이즈','Civilization has been destroyed by war and pollution, but the survivors have built the last city of Ecoban. As most natural resources have been exhausted, Ecoban is powered by pollution. The citizens of Ecoban need to continue creating this pollution leading them into conflict with the inhabitants of Marr while one man just wants to clear away the clouds and see the sky.','/ot2pohox9Hbmt5eH1JzNYleOgL1.jpg','2003-07-17',86,'Released','A fantastic journey to the future begins.','Wonderful Days',14258,2.1096,6.158,'zgjC7LW6UEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18145,_binary '\0','/u81o47AHNknwsTRF8sjKj3DkBLh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353161',5.2,1260,'de','Achtung, Fertig, Charlie!','In a Swiss church, Antonio Carrera is getting married to the pretty daughter of an Italian Mafioso, when army police officers march in and take him to the 15 week compulsory Swiss military training.','/s3PWCVCQHX7nD9cONb95b9LNpVU.jpg','2003-09-18',92,'Released','The Swiss answer to American Pie','Ready, Steady, Charlie!',21062,1.323,5.4,'T-xt65Y79iA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18146,_binary '\0','/eHgPwO7hOb3JJocdHvgGd3CTEoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353261',6.8,1412,'en','BraveStarr: The Legend','Marshall Bravestarr is the lawman of the wild-west planet \"New Texas\" with help from Thirty-Thirty, his cybernetic talking horse and Deputy Fuzz, his sidekick and Shaman, his mentor. Bravestarr with his special powers fights the outlaw Tex-Hex, the leader of the Carrion Bunch, who are after the mineral Kerium, Bravestarr sets out to set things right and enforce peace and justice on \"New Texas\".','/2JRTpKWwpPXyNVEBeAGpjLHRJU9.jpg','1988-03-18',91,'Released','It took a legend...','BraveStarr: The Legend',66454,1.8221,7.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18147,_binary '\0','/tPTlKJ1cVvPjJCULYwxEvxhnJpO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353324',3,10584,'en','The Crow: Wicked Prayer','After ex-con Jimmy and his girlfriend are brutally murdered by a biker gang, he is resurrected by the power of The Crow to avenge their deaths and reunite with her in the afterlife.','/l6TfZVVzvrlGjxDlZK3CoHwaccc.jpg','2005-05-04',99,'Released','Passion..Revenge...Eternity.','The Crow: Wicked Prayer',16456,4.0725,3.814,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18148,_binary '\0','/lC2HVZdmccXmevHwevfba5DA0zs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353357',5.4,2129,'en','Day of Wrath','At the height of the Spanish Inquisition, high-ranking noblemen begin dropping like flies, with alarming frequency and unexplained violence. But can local 16th-century sheriff Ruy de Mendoza discern who\'s responsible when no one wants to cooperate? After all, before Mendoza can even identify the bodies, the crime scenes are mysteriously cleared - and the villagers pretend the murders never happened.','/pEnuT6JdfyPb0HRWXMO40Un2mQN.jpg','2006-06-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Day of Wrath',16432,2.6956,4.5,'MBketACCI-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18149,_binary '\0','/8OAsjAvlf90uKjYicEkfeKu7NaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353393',7,3010,'en','Eloise at Christmastime','Eloise is a precocious but lovable six-year-old girl who lives in New York\'s Plaza Hotel. The owner\'s daughter is getting married, but Eloise discovers that the fiance has devious plans to defraud kind Rachel! When her true love is revealed to be none other than Eloise\'s best friend Bill who works in the kitchen, Eloise goes on a mission to bring about a Christmas miracle and get the starcrossed lovers back together.. will things work out in time for a happy holiday ending?','/uBm2QXjmBHN10n68MANWoRw8bMu.jpg','2003-11-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Eloise at Christmastime',59191,1.969,6.3,'mBSgmZK95P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18150,_binary '\0','/lhiLBuFJcRC0wkjsj04vfAfZWPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353489',6.3,16830,'en','Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed','Brigitte has escaped the confines of Bailey Downs but she\'s not alone. Another werewolf is tailing her closely and her sister\'s specter haunts her. An overdose of Monkshood - the poison that is keeping her transformation at bay - leads to her being incarcerated in a rehabilitation clinic for drug addicts where her only friend is an eccentric young girl by the name of Ghost.','/no1Qw1jMGrH77fIuWxwYZ7BIhHa.jpg','2004-01-30',94,'Released','It only dies if you do.','Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed',10361,4.416,6.5,'rj7TQHjbsq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18151,_binary '\0','/Ajdw53WL5zYYXJOuIfFwH8auEmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353496',8.6,4913,'ml','ഗോഡ്ഫാദർ','A retelling of William Shakespeare\'s \"Romeo and Juliet\", the film revolves around the rivalry between two families, the Anjooran and Anappara houses, and the consequences faced when two members of the families fall in love.','/xnsLPhy3IkgDFDZQjLofOgPDa5d.jpg','1991-09-15',150,'Released',NULL,'Godfather',134474,1.8169,7.528,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18152,_binary '\0','/q7KvJviVftr6bpxv58wGsao6a2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353671',7.1,1285,'bs','Ljeto u zlatnoj dolini','At the traditional Muslim funeral service for his father Fikret Varupa, sixteen year old boy from Sarajevo, learns that his father owes money to Hamid, a man he does not even know. The debt is considerable and Hamid does not want it to go to the grave with the body, so the debt automatically passes from the father to the son. Since in Bosnia this way of collecting debts, at a funeral, is considered to be utterly humiliating, it is never, ever applied. Fikret and his entire family become subjects of ridicule. Fikret, who is practically still a child, is decisive to \"redeem his father\'s soul\". Wishing to repay his father\'s debt and to secure the forgiveness, Fikret wanders into the real world of Sarajevo, the world that is ruled by post-war chaos, misery and poverty and becomes an ideal target for two corrupted policemen who wish to \"help\" him: they plant the kidnapped girl on him.','/ewC2ZViKVCTck1QnIk6gWhLbUrI.jpg','2003-04-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Summer in the Golden Valley',102337,1.2371,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18153,_binary '\0','/uJjU1NONIbTOZICAmPGVF8mv06Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353725',8,2374,'ml','മീശ മാധവൻ','Madhavan is a petty thief who is accused of stealing the idol of the village goddess. However, he soon escapes police custody and tries to find the real culprit.','/vjdImEMRdLoWeyxaL9aj31hx1P.jpg','2002-07-04',165,'Released',NULL,'Meesa Madhavan',312927,1.217,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18154,_binary '\0','/esbdPyfUu5p23Dkhf8np2nCNs21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353935',8.5,4039,'ml','റാംജിറാവ് സ്പീക്കിങ്ങ്','The story revolves around three unemployed people who get involved in a kidnapping saga due to a case of mistaken identity.','/vJ1k4tWjLZUpTY46liLDSfu7Vfx.jpg','1989-08-04',150,'Released',NULL,'Ramji Rao Speaking',150768,1.5742,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18155,_binary '\0','/4jkmstOiSgAFUJ22Tcdjtof5K47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353962',5,1779,'sv','Rånarna','A gang of highly efficient and cold hearted robbers strike against a number of banks in Stockholm. The investigation ends up with the criminal detective Klara and the SWAT commander Greger Krona, who together lead the hunt for the robbers. Their investigation takes them in a dangerous direction that proves to have unforeseen consequences. The hunt for the robbers is intense and their methods become more refined and terrifying. Klara ends up in the line of fire, both literally and figuratively, and the investigation takes her in a direction that she could never have imagined.','/qAcNXFeNffjTy5uE0ii3AVK51ua.jpg','2003-12-13',100,'Released',NULL,'At Point Blank',8743,0.9557,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18156,_binary '\0','/6Kn6qW3an3DkPl3MahWemTzrjCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353969',8.1,275118,'ko','살인의 추억','A sadistic serial rapist and murderer of young women terrorizes a small province in 1980s South Korea. To prevent further crimes, three increasingly desperate detectives with conflicting methods race against time to unravel the violent mind of the killer in a futile effort to solve the case.','/jcgUjx1QcupGzjntTVlnQ15lHqy.jpg','2003-04-25',131,'Released','The worst of them will stay with you... forever.','Memories of Murder',11423,17.5023,8.063,'0n_HQwQU8ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18157,_binary '\0','/4hLgKxux7MTSt8jSZ1UiQW5Sujd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0353975',9,6575,'ml','സന്ദേശം','After his retirement, Raghavan Nair (Thilakan) is back at his home. His long cherished dream to spend his retired life along with his family is thwarted after seeing his two sons brawling each other over their political differences.','/tF1Y52WGqX7t3Lj35oQC6IL3ENB.jpg','1991-02-04',137,'Released','The message','Sandhesam',134477,1.3115,7.9,'D_wQDDJhM0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18158,_binary '\0','/yPFrk9856PdpYQyTW3ML1sgRWzO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354148',8.3,2494,'ml','വടക്കുനോക്കിയന്ത്രം','A man with a serious case of inferiority complex is married to a beautiful girl. Soon, his love and care turns into suspicion.','/uZgZZ3cfoIhS5cDcu3nJzVtxv4l.jpg','1989-05-19',121,'Released',NULL,'Vadakkunokkiyantram',316412,0.9075,7,'mtA3vS6YtXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18159,_binary '\0','/6eCtpjjGIXaM9rLqLYIFikWBKNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354216',4.4,1936,'en','The Wisher','Mary is a horror-movie junkie whose obsession is out of control, leading her over-protective father to ban her from seeing scary flicks. But when she and her friends sneak out to see a film called The Wisher, its creepy antagonist seems to escape into her life and make her darkest desires come true.','/uSSl9aqlIhcl83Zsqca1HoHZhwa.jpg','2002-05-31',90,'Released','You\'ll wish it was just a nightmare...','The Wisher',55102,1.2112,4.6,'ztoix3kcO8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18160,_binary '\0','/rVV13ggN1UrZRHpwiSwn1CzlEaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354243',6.4,1664,'zh','周渔的火车','Zhou Yu, a ceramic artisan in China\'s rural Northwest, has a deep rapport with Chen Qing, a shy sensitive poet. Taking a long train ride every weekend just to make mad passionate love with him, her longing seems insatiable. Until one day, she meets the hedonistic vet Zhang Qiang and begins a torrid affair, which takes her to another train station, and another level of lust. Driven by the locomotive of love and desire, she hustles through a dark tunnel of no return.','/etTZFDdXUjGB0cagwyWIeHlx6Xb.jpg','2002-08-01',97,'Released','A woman torn between a man and a memory','Zhou Yu\'s Train',61477,0.9898,6.4,'0zPEfifJ61g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18161,_binary '\0','/ToHe5BbOxhhmTx8txIJLM45ff8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354356',6.6,10870,'fr','5x2','As young French couple Gilles and Marion officially separate, we see, in reverse order, the milestone moments in their relationship: Gilles revealing his unfaithfulness at a tense dinner party; Marion giving birth to their premature son while Gilles is elsewhere; Gilles and Marion\'s joyous wedding; and, finally, the fateful moment when they meet as acquaintances at an Italian beach resort, and their love affair begins.','/sZRa3rg7kKt8qkJ6C480VPmUR6A.jpg','2004-09-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Five Times Two',4974,2.4253,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18162,_binary '\0','/uLTPL6AFTby3AdYzjUJk8BO3y2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354538',5.4,2529,'hi','Ek Aur Ek Gyarah: By Hook or by Crook','Two petty thieves Tara and Sitara get on the bad side of two wanted criminals, namely Panther and Cobra.','/vB9tqshSF52Jw5oTN79W9IOdTs4.jpg','2003-08-06',144,'Released',NULL,'Ek Aur Ek Gyarah: By Hook or by Crook',212502,1.6313,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18163,_binary '\0','/cP31o6Ta11t4PFo7PYvtCOTJJhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354575',7.4,9752,'da','De fem benspænd','In 1967, experimental filmmaker Jorgen Leth created a striking short film, The Perfect Human, starring a man and women sitting in a box while a narrator poses questions about their relationship and humanity. Years later, Danish director Lars von Trier made a deal with Leth to remake his film five times, each under a different set of circumstances and with von Trier\'s strictly prescribed rules. As Leth completes each challenge, von Trier creates increasingly further elaborate stipulations.','/xMcCmIdos88yd44xqCXj4NUWph3.jpg','2003-11-07',88,'Released',NULL,'The Five Obstructions',12456,1.9105,6.9,'aKEVA6ISqoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18164,_binary '\0','/m9kux73Co4j0BCn42B3FdgZl3sB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354595',6.1,3761,'en','The Game of Their Lives','During the 1950 World Cup, the hastily assembled U.S. soccer team enters as heavy underdogs when matched up against the highest-ranked team in competition — England.','/iZkVLxvWfx9PzuixNnlVz1Y9fa6.jpg','2005-04-22',101,'Released','America\'s finest moment in the world\'s greatest game.','The Game of Their Lives',29078,3.6875,5.8,'PhcBQp9NFJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18165,_binary '\0','/1yRIjUeLTyy4A1PLWhg1genlhuY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354668',7.1,11829,'ko','지구를 지켜라!','A young man believes that his country\'s leaders are actually toxic reptilian aliens sent down to launch a takeover of his beloved Earth. So he decides to abduct them and force the truth out on camera in his basement that doubles as a film studio and torture chamber.','/kou9TDjveVwBhWnxCRUT88RUVCs.jpg','2003-04-04',117,'Released','I caught a dirty rotten alien.','Save the Green Planet!',11297,3.1346,7.014,'NhM2PSNvArg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18166,_binary '\0','/hrM6X1GR5Rvca71gt9WqpFRPzGf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354766',5.6,6396,'en','Never Die Alone','A drug kingpin\'s rise and tragic fall is witnessed vicariously by a reporter who uses the criminal\'s diary as the basis for his new book.','/nLN6zs2ySlekfdXS7mZ6uujTSBi.jpg','2004-03-26',88,'Released','No King Rules Forever','Never Die Alone',20304,2.9888,5.5,'sCqS_nd2_EY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18167,_binary '\0','/ciQxS1iijdx4FTBxZgpJR8avloc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354770',7.7,1638,'zh','哪吒闹海','In Chentang Pass, Nezha, the magical son of General Li Jing, makes enemies with Ao Guang, the Dragon King of East Sea. When he is reported to heaven\'s court and his home is threatened, Nezha takes it upon himself to destroy the palace and defeat the dragons. A retelling of the classic chapters from Investiture of The Gods.','/jMThfUmAEsA0K1rZIjW3dqRXv2q.jpg','1979-05-19',65,'Released','Little Nezha churns the sea!','Nezha Conquers the Dragon King',74037,2.6188,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18168,_binary '\0','/9XizmVKaw8Fce9J8YUY1LN0i6EQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354836',6.4,4647,'fr','Podium','Bernand Fréderic is a mediocre bank executive. He\'s married and has a son. He used to have another profession: being French star Claude Francois. Now, with the Imitators Gala Night coming up, he must choose between his wife or the only thing that makes him happy: the applause.','/rq2KTyTJXd2p4kwCa1dajdrXimA.jpg','2004-02-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Podium',14648,1.8844,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18169,_binary '\0','/bHePzkyRcMhnab2qZbhj1bCElnf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354899',7.2,72400,'fr','La Science des rêves','A man entranced by his dreams and imagination is lovestruck with a French woman and feels he can show her his world.','/8bummqwU6MV65ZJvNtKx8Y3NIEk.jpg','2006-06-25',106,'Released','Close your eyes. Open your heart.','The Science of Sleep',300,4.3661,7,'dHtE0szIip0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18170,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0354965',5.8,1340,'te','గుడుంబా శంకర్','Gudumba Shankar falls in love with Gowri and finds out that she is being forced to marry Kumar Swamy, a gangster. Shankar tricks Kumar Swamy and gets married to Gowri.','/1fR2C5yQ1RqqqTw0034g3jXDUPP.jpg','2004-09-10',150,'Released',NULL,'Gudumba Shankar',117093,1.3259,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18171,_binary '\0','/ee0S5UoRLkVrKo0JUi5NuEFOH8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355029',7.2,1447,'de','Wolfsburg','Philipp Gerber is a smart, but self-satisfied car salesman. In an inattentive moment at the wheel of his car, he runs over a boy on a bike and, instead of helping him, he drives away. As he has feelings of guilt, he tries to find out more about the accident’s victim.','/lIxi4i3NzjyPeqNlo6lFeDEmr7S.jpg','2003-09-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Wolfsburg',88418,1.1164,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18172,_binary '\0','/cMDrNf7QdDCqKwgIh2HSKbfn6EH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355169',8.1,4076,'ml','ആറാം തമ്പുരാന്‍','Jagannadhan moves to Kanimangalam and wins over the locals, but falls into trouble with Appan Thamburan, a feudal lord. It starts after he organises a festival that has been banned by Appan himself.','/yExpzbpdW3ymmR5zG1ONTduEdvZ.jpg','1997-12-19',167,'Released',NULL,'Aaram Thamburan',198254,1.4326,6.542,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18173,_binary '\0','/aDfGKWdtNHzDmnHkdDyXz7zoDuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355295',5.9,133011,'en','The Brothers Grimm','Folklore collectors and con artists, Jake and Will Grimm, travel from village to village pretending to protect townsfolk from enchanted creatures and performing exorcisms. However, they are put to the test when they encounter a real magical curse in a haunted forest with real magical beings, requiring genuine courage.','/iPrey2UYrA5Fqa8L3KnxqMqfmSq.jpg','2005-08-26',118,'Released','No curse they can\'t reverse. No demon they can\'t exterminate. No spell they can\'t break.','The Brothers Grimm',4442,13.3039,5.9,'ohxNxVlk2GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18174,_binary '\0','/6fbsTZxVY0QZ13ctCuHZd2BA0ae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355611',6.3,1564,'no','Jonny Vang','Three friends since childhood are trying to work out their complicated relationships. Jonny tries to be best friends with Magnus, Magnus tries to be married to Tuva, and Tuva tries to have sex with Jonny.','/aNTBoyiS9IQWvIbJBPeiY8mrgnb.jpg','2003-02-14',85,'Released',NULL,'Jonny Vang',33688,0.9922,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18175,_binary '\0','/r19wkx0JESCD74GVyREFLzZN2VA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355702',7.1,62088,'en','Lords of Dogtown','The radical true story behind three teenage surfers from Venice Beach, California, who took skateboarding to the extreme and changed the world of sports forever. Stacy Peralta, Tony Alva and Jay Adams are the Z-Boys, a bunch of nobodies until they create a new style of skateboarding that becomes a worldwide phenomenon. But when their hobby becomes a business, the success shreds their friendship.','/k2NiPfydLSwmk28C6qpvpJPuqtq.jpg','2005-06-03',107,'Released','They came from nothing to change everything.','Lords of Dogtown',9787,7.2872,7.1,'KHwimJTfvxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18176,_binary '\0','/zuKLHPLQjwZfo1Si8l15ofwEYOc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355715',7.2,1550,'ar','معالي الوزير','A mix-up leads Ra\'fat Rostum to a ministerial seat that he was never meant to have. As he successfully holds onto his office for a long time, he starts having violent nightmares and asks his office manager, Ateya, to accompany him to the North Coast in an attempt to stop the nightmares.','/7NVm7hFjrY7y1ncNmw7d1JxckR3.jpg','2002-12-04',101,'Released',NULL,'His Excellency the Minister',406872,0.9082,7.6,'2xUBZxizQnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18177,_binary '\0','/cTDymTdCXygVSekF9bY5Zh2Uvq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355742',8.3,4952,'te','మన్మథుడు','Abhiram, a misogynist, works as a manager in his own advertising agency. When his uncle, the chairman, appoints Harika as an assistant manager, he mistreats her, but his hatred soon turns into love.','/bHjMjCmtpfQzQoDjiL9rWWo4ahd.jpg','2002-12-20',142,'Released','He Hates Women..!','Manmadhudu',81083,1.3298,7.462,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18178,_binary '\0','/ylltwzZsurwL6bSxAJrivlCr2BO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355743',7.9,1658,'ml','മാന്നാർമത്തായി സ്പീക്കിങ്ങ്','The hilarious trio from \'Ramji Rao Speaking\' faces a new trouble when the heroine of their drama group quits.','/iQXkmUVVaLm87ZhEaSw3z1X0x4P.jpg','1995-01-01',150,'Released',NULL,'Mannar Mathai Speaking',150770,0.8408,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18179,_binary '\0','/if0IBbnzdeacoGf2Dgj1dAqZktu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355857',6.2,1684,'ja','陰陽師','During a dark time in the Heian period, when evil forces threaten the kingdom, the emperor relies on the onmyōji to keep the supernatural forces in line. But as political events become highly charged, friction within the order leads to betrayal. Now, Seimei, a talented member of the clan, must face down his master, Dōson, in the hopes of restoring peace to the kingdom.','/ptiwNaV092Ut3qWLnN07fx2hFjl.jpg','2001-10-06',116,'Released',NULL,'Onmyoji',21325,1.6256,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18180,_binary '\0','/4LQcthUFunuet9VP7jJRRstGjrz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0355954',5.2,11636,'en','Riding the Bullet','In 1969, while studying at the University of Maine, artist Alan Parker becomes obsessed with death. Believing he is losing his girlfriend, he tries to commit suicide on his birthday but his friends manage to stop him. He receives news that his mother has had a stroke and decides to hitchhike to visit her at the hospital.','/oM9X7NvJ0Ses0thXu70Wuar9Afd.jpg','2004-10-15',98,'Released','The dead travel fast','Riding the Bullet',12483,4.0434,5.1,'RdlCnaz4AAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18181,_binary '\0','/kg8na5u6qdCydm7cK7p2I0zQmgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356150',6.6,247644,'en','EuroTrip','When Scott learns that his longtime cyber-buddy from Berlin is a gorgeous young woman, he and his friends embark on a trip across Europe.','/iLdO4PwbZCCQSa9rchZMwuJm9xe.jpg','2004-02-20',92,'Released','No actual Europeans were harmed in the making of this film.','EuroTrip',9352,10.793,6.631,'-_Eu0X3B6OM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18182,_binary '\0','/dP8hUKC6yII1Jj21Y520vy01CCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356154',5.9,1340,'no','Ulvesommer','The young Norwegian girl Kim almost gets killed after falling from a hillside. She finds shelter and stumbles upon the territory of a wolf and her puppy. When she finds out three shepherds are out to kill the wolf, she decides to get across the border to Sweden, where they don\'t hunt for wolves.','/8A2v7rZo6J6Pyv4F3fN4YzGZ6t7.jpg','2003-02-28',87,'Released',NULL,'Wolf Summer',115383,1.3324,5.6,'nUuTPjLzEVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18183,_binary '\0','/3xWRBzQeAoIl3MU0NQCmiabR4Qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356159',5.5,2929,'en','Hellbent','A night filled with beautiful people, music and dancing at the West Hollywood Halloween Carnival turns deadly for four gay friends. When two men are found dead, the friends find that they are the killer\'s next target. No one knows who will survive the night. A wild, relentless ride filled with unexpected surprises and shocking scares.','/cVknIe9xoeB4MfT0qGHdxbBmB5t.jpg','2005-09-16',85,'Released','When the night belongs to the Devil, the party goes to hell.','Hellbent',47488,2.8467,5.5,'8Hzz2uTibWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18184,_binary '\0','/gqnCBYNQvoQk1jQ7WMik3X2K8gl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356176',6,6126,'no','Villmark','Five Norwegians head for a cabin in the wilderness for a few days of teambuilding. But strange things start happening — especially down by the water where they find an abandoned tent. Is there someone else?','/7RN1dL0P8Gb6Jv9zL1WB4AkAsoe.jpg','2003-02-21',85,'Released','They should have stayed away from that water','Dark Woods',41070,2.0228,5.8,'037AQawSHT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18185,_binary '\0','/ux4HpKKilst54SDiw4DPQAdGT3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356336',5.4,5096,'fr','Agents secrets','From his offices in Switzerland, Russian Igor Lipovsky is engaged in a vast and profitable gunrunning operation with Africa. The French government wants to hinder the activities of the arms dealer and sends a team to sink one of his ships heading for Angola with a load of illegal weaponry. Lisa, Brisseau, Loïc, Tony and Raymond are professionals: they carefully set up their cover, plan all their moves meticulously, and carry out orders without asking questions. Perhaps they should. The code-name of the mission is \"Janus\"; and just like with the ancient deity, there are two opposite faces for every aspect of the operation: the objective of the French government, the role of each team member, the presumed friend and the assumed foe...','/5tzRPF8TUQ1XTz3UnABCLOhMug4.jpg','2004-03-03',109,'Released',NULL,'Secret Agents',12648,3.2517,5.5,'8CKm9townGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18186,_binary '\0','/lS3bFdov7fPGn6wlVwVnMAcLDZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356443',5,3937,'en','The Bridge of San Luis Rey','In 1714 Peru, a friar is tried by the Spanish Inquisition for questioning God\'s intentions when five die in the collapse of an Andean rope bridge.','/jp26f92Z28eFVmwZ90Q09bnrBEB.jpg','2004-12-22',120,'Released','Five lives bound by one fate.','The Bridge of San Luis Rey',45881,3.0743,5.2,'Ev367Fb38UY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18187,_binary '\0','/cxj7Fi2r1fjE8iM2jynhx4YF1Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356470',6,103973,'en','A Cinderella Story','Routinely exploited by her wicked stepmother, the downtrodden Samantha Montgomery is excited about the prospect of meeting her Internet beau at the school\'s Halloween dance.','/ukwP7gDPWxj1R1dW5iN3mnxkL3D.jpg','2004-07-16',95,'Released','Once upon a time... can happen any time.','A Cinderella Story',11247,13.7817,6.6,'B_VFs9j95gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18188,_binary '\0','/81eFSVg7bjRQi39CRRikJCl8YjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356487',7.4,1585,'es','Whisky Romeo Zulú','Whisky Romeo Zulu tells the story prior to the crash of LAPA Boeing 737 that on August 31, 1999, caught fire after hitting an embankment in the center of Buenos Aires, killing 67 people. The disaster changed the history of civil and commercial aviation in Argentina, and the film recounts, from the standpoint of the director, a former airline pilot-how in some countries the safety of the flight is incredibly precarious.','/lYngbEZF3TWlhM7hMaHq2tHKIHv.jpg','2005-04-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Whisky Romeo Zulú',23434,1.4214,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18189,_binary '\0','/uookmLyx9dKDBrjXJDDp175meg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356614',6.4,12023,'en','Foolproof','Kevin, Sam and Rob have an unusual hobby: planning foolproof heists, without intending to actually perform them. The game goes wrong when their latest plan is stolen and carried out. Things get even worse when a mysterious man approaches them with an offer: plan a heist for him, or go to jail. As the clock ticks, they find that the risk might be higher than just their freedom.','/gudhSz8sDzRXxHY5XchllQKxw77.jpg','2003-10-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Foolproof',14527,2.7663,6.1,'o3qndVGGsM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18190,_binary '\0','/tq5xnlYFDlfRZvSAOr3T7H8Yeko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356618',5.8,71523,'en','The Forgotten','Telly Paretta is a grieving mother struggling to cope with the loss of her 9-year-old son. She is stunned when her psychiatrist reveals that she has created nine years of memories about a son she never had. But when she remembers a man who had a similar experience, Telly embarks on a search to prove her son\'s existence, and her sanity.','/gANKh0Vm00CTE1Hf2aTh2IIXn8X.jpg','2004-09-24',91,'Released','Everything you\'ve experienced, everything you\'ve known... never happened.','The Forgotten',10145,5.9644,5.9,'pmrh4qM3FQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18191,_binary '\0','/r8Vk1PJ7eDwRKDZJOS4AKC7puK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356634',5.1,101926,'en','Garfield','Garfield, the fat, lazy, lasagna lover, has everything a cat could want. But when Jon, in an effort to impress the Liz - the vet and an old high-school crush - adopts a dog named Odie and brings him home, Garfield gets the one thing he doesn\'t want. Competition.','/vqwTSWNLyH55g8kBT61s2DgNYEp.jpg','2004-06-10',80,'Released','It’s his world… we just live in it.','Garfield',8920,10.427,5.724,'5g1SLGRM6qU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18192,_binary '\0','/yJav7yjKcYnP7C9QbFLECThWv4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356680',6.3,91037,'en','The Family Stone','An uptight, conservative businesswoman accompanies her boyfriend to his eccentric and outgoing family\'s annual Christmas celebration and finds that she\'s a fish out of water in their free-spirited way of life.','/nlqw53HmTP7o3b2NDttYNOtsK4V.jpg','2005-12-15',103,'Released','Feel The Love','The Family Stone',9043,7.7402,6.3,'ps8DhuMfScQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18193,_binary '\0','/lMSlZxJp43HR81XacWh75w3hW2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356721',6.5,67816,'en','I ♥ Huckabees','A husband-and-wife team play detective, but not in the traditional sense. Instead, the happy duo helps others solve their existential issues, the kind that keep you up at night, wondering what it all means.','/h27ytqXyOrAB6KmRx2abOp8p2W.jpg','2004-09-10',106,'Released','An existential comedy','I ♥ Huckabees',1599,5.2555,6.3,'61TptTktMSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18194,_binary '\0','/tgDSUwWMgypgmcBhRs9u30RLPNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356910',6.5,602352,'en','Mr. & Mrs. Smith','A husband and wife struggle to keep their marriage alive until they realize they are both secretly working as assassins. Now, their respective assignments require them to kill each other.','/kjD700RtyhveN3ZbOnSvUSne0Qj.jpg','2005-06-07',120,'Released','\'Til death do us part.','Mr. & Mrs. Smith',787,19.0561,6.695,'TWB_icm5M38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18195,_binary '\0','/6m3zFutZ3EeEDvHvvWIpcakB3ZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356922',6.3,1986,'fr','Le Mystère de la chambre jaune','Joseph Rouletabille, a reporter for a local newspaper, investigates the attempted killing of Mathilde Stangerson, who uses the yellow room of the title as her bedroom. At the time of the revolver shots her room was locked and the windows were barred, but when her father enters after having forced the door, there is no-one there except for Mathilde. So who did it and how did he get away?','/cDIb3HZ2FgGlbpA7BruuQ76t424.jpg','2003-06-11',118,'Released',NULL,'The Mystery of the Yellow Room',37351,2.1059,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18196,_binary '\0','/vU2URpMlpgcCXXHC36I2i0tExuQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356982',7.6,2642,'hi','पांच','Members of a desperate, drug-fueled rock band hatch a fake kidnapping scheme to extort money from a wealthy patriarch. But when a flash of volatile violence crosses an irreversible line, the group spirals into a claustrophobic nightmare of murder, paranoia, and betrayal.','/mMrZBw7KcotPHiSfB83MMhzdgS1.jpg','2003-09-21',158,'Released','Avoid Life. It Kills You In The End.','Paanch',64109,1.1253,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18197,_binary '\0','/4GJbq7pe3hZ7ECubGJn5cJQoxHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0356999',6.4,1748,'fr','Pas sur la bouche','A musical drawing room farce set in Paris circa October, 1925. Middle-aged Gilberte flirts with men but loves her husband Georges, wishing he were more demonstrative. He\'s negotiating a deal with American Eric Thomson, who turns out to be Gilberte\'s first husband from an annulled and secret stateside marriage. Along with her sister Arlette, Gilberte begs Eric not to tell Georges about their past. Meanwhile, a young artist, Charly, pursues Gilberte while Arlette tries to match him with the young Huguette, who loves him. Will Eric play along or try to re-win Gilberte\'s affection? Can Gilberte play one off against another? And who will manage to kiss whom on the lips?','/aLDY62kgrEWrD4ll9ChS5JAGEQJ.jpg','2003-12-03',115,'Released',NULL,'Not on the Lips',51945,1.3185,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18198,_binary '\0','/kRf7A2p3GudecHPFPwfEsenkP1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357054',5.7,4545,'en','The Last Shot','A movie director-screenwriter finds a man to finance his latest project but soon discovers that the producer is actually an undercover FBI agent working on a mob sting operation.','/2Rm4xsJnrZaZL0qPO2wBP5MJJpE.jpg','2004-09-24',90,'Released','Inspired by the true story of the greatest motion picture never made.','The Last Shot',26486,3.2525,5.7,'h-m1hKqMfaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18199,_binary '\0','/ijOpOJqWYn2vSf6gZ6LmrH0Nv9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357058',7.2,1588,'cs','Pupendo','Artist Bedřich Mára (Bolek Polivka) is unable to find much secure work due to his public antagonism toward the ruling Communist Party. He has a wife and two children. Life begins to change when art historian Alois Fábera (Jiři Pecha) begins working on a piece about Bedřich, leading to a job offer from a Party official. Things are looking up, until the wrong people hear portions of the historian\'s writing.','/fr9xvyqMOdwuvJUs4DYiUeExQ1u.jpg','2003-03-27',120,'Released',NULL,'Pupendo',46288,1.7393,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18200,_binary '\0','/226BOT8YMPY1OgXGHTVPqUPSG0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357110',6.5,12745,'en','The Ballad of Jack and Rose','Jack Slavin is an environmentalist with a heart condition who lives with his daughter, Rose, on an isolated island. While Jack fights against developers who wish to build in the area, he also craves more contact with other people. When he invites his girlfriend, Kathleen, and her sons, Rodney and Thaddius, to move in, Rose is upset. The complicated family dynamics makes things difficult for everyone in the house.','/jhID43WmWf3HeH3M3tBCPTSeBOi.jpg','2005-02-25',111,'Released','Selfhood begins with a walking away, and love is proved in the letting go.','The Ballad of Jack and Rose',17113,2.82,6.1,'J4NhD8BFaPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18201,_binary '\0','/rZPpxJhROE2Q6umzH6nxDUi1x9M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357111',5.9,16435,'fr','RRRrrrr!!!','In 35,000 BC, the tribe of the Dirty Hairs is at war against the tribe of the Clean Hairs for eight hundred years, trying to get their shampoo. The chief of the Dirty Hairs sends his daughter Guy disguised to the enemy tribe to get some shampoo for his tribe. When the healer of the Clean Hairs tribe surprisingly kills two cavemen of his tribe, their imbecile chief assigns Pierre with curled hair and Pierre blonde to investigate the murder and find the criminal.','/qsGU6myn85MfqpNAxzJtxJ3VgrM.jpg','2004-01-28',98,'Released',NULL,'RRRrrrr!!!',21778,3.6338,6.3,'SqLwLXFWlHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18202,_binary '\0','/kRpokiyfzyQHkQ0meMmvqPzQXnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357277',4.7,106592,'en','Elektra','Elektra the warrior survives a near-death experience, becomes an assassin-for-hire, and tries to protect her two latest targets, a single father and his young daughter, from a group of supernatural assassins.','/gC6s6NKHneSrOKyQZnUMb443RKU.jpg','2005-01-13',97,'Released','Looks CAN kill.','Elektra',9947,8.0723,5.049,'etfIjKxKzqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18203,_binary '\0','/2EyFB4mgISaU37BNhz63pl77fGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357282',8.1,3058,'el','Ο βασιλιάς','A 35-year old man, just released from jail, decides to make a clean break from the big city and his troubled past. He retreats to the abandoned village his father came from and moves into an old, collapsing house. Alone, far from the bigger village and doing petty jobs to survive, he will strive to find himself once more. Amidst a haze of suspicion and scorn by villagers who treat him an intruder, his past catches up to him in the form of his girlfriend from Athens. Conflict is inescapable','/uZhd0CFnpqUx4jCFNf0ilpZuN00.jpg','2002-11-09',130,'Released',NULL,'The King',237506,0.8463,7.283,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18204,_binary '\0','/dS8EkHnn9rUalCzXxrlaOt5WX22.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357283',7.5,1334,'ur','خاموش پانی','Ayesha is a widow with a secret past, living with her beloved son Saleem in a small town in Pakistan close to the Indian border. When the fires of Islamic nationalism invade their tranquil lives, Saleem and a few of the town\'s other young men are soon gripped by a religious fervour, and they attempt to bring radical Islamic law to their friends and neighbours. After a group of Sikh pilgrims arrive in town, tensions reach boiling point as Ayesha\'s haunted past comes rushing back.','/tKfh0R96Zq5NS2XgiiK1rodTEmL.jpg','2004-02-25',99,'Released','The Water Stirs','Silent Waters',100086,0.9916,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18205,_binary '\0','/djuj8QnYv7fw6SL3mZvFhnUQNYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357392',6.1,1354,'en','The Other Boleyn Girl','Based on the controversial novel by Philippa Gregory, \"The Other Boleyn Girl\" is a fictionalised account of the life of Lady Mary Boleyn who becomes mistress to England\'s king, Henry VIII, before being ousted by her younger sister, Anne. Mary leaves the Court to marry a commoner, but returns when Anne embarks on a reckless policy to save herself from ruin.','/70pAJXRmqr6hab23aimtA43NLSp.jpg','2003-03-28',90,'Released','Sex, Passion and Royal Intrigue','The Other Boleyn Girl',79905,2.9632,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18206,_binary '\0','/qWSI9Lpq8K4o1n9ZD9zUVD4Gds1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357413',7.1,404986,'en','Anchorman: The Legend of Ron Burgundy','It\'s the 1970s and San Diego anchorman Ron Burgundy is the top dog in local TV, but that\'s all about to change when ambitious reporter Veronica Corningstone arrives as a new employee at his station.','/mhZIcRePT7U8viFQVjt1ZjYIsR4.jpg','2004-06-28',95,'Released','They bring you the news so you don\'t have to get it yourself.','Anchorman: The Legend of Ron Burgundy',8699,10.5123,6.703,'-T3wnP91OnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18207,_binary '\0','/rsCrJYNPkdmz5NYtUzp4r2wsW82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357470',6,4709,'en','The Battle of Shaker Heights','A quirky teen with a penchant for war reenactments, Kelly Ernswiler obsesses over military tactics with his buddy Bart. The school bully is one of Kelly\'s regular headaches, and he also has to deal with a frustrating situation at home, where his father is a recovering drug addict. Kelly\'s life gets even more complicated when he falls for Tabby, Bart\'s pretty and soon-to-be-wed older sister.','/l7PDR9rtbUN5b4gMVPSLMqIgfov.jpg','2003-08-22',79,'Released','When you\'re 17, every day is war.','The Battle of Shaker Heights',21413,2.2391,5.7,'oulnfKJKIyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18208,_binary '\0','/sJEcInnWer58nvYEbZmrx5eAQ7R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357507',4.2,34088,'en','Boogeyman','Every culture has one – the horrible monster fueling young children\'s nightmares. But for Tim, the Boogeyman still lives in his memories as a creature that devoured his father 16 years ago. Is the Boogeyman real, or did Tim make it up to explain why his father abandoned his family?','/5KffN0UcuAKJdUAcOvZ21OrqXc8.jpg','2005-02-04',89,'Released','You thought it was just a story.','Boogeyman',8968,4.3589,4.939,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18209,_binary '\0','/nJ3fpugCXF3AgUUVDUCLfHceuTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357585',4.7,5769,'en','Decoys','Luke and Roger are just another couple of college guys trying to lose their virginity. But when Luke sees something unusual, he begins to suspect that the girls on campus aren\'t exactly...human.','/nieqSpywIW3J25cFC8mEUXF2FTk.jpg','2004-02-27',95,'Released','They can seduce anyone... Prey it isn\'t you!','Decoys',18442,2.7881,4.9,'UfwgV0CayNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18210,_binary '\0','/tPilzL9jnubZAcnak3V0msDFx1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357648',7,1648,'en','Fallen Angel','When his father dies, Terry (Gary Sinese) returns to the house where he grew up, planning to stay only long enough to clean and settle the estate. Yet something indescribable keeps him there longer than expected. Soon, he is reunited with memories and people from his past and his life is changed forever.','/sbNrCQJ2Gi8GoYfagotdKqB14ce.jpg','2003-03-23',99,'Released',NULL,'Fallen Angel',55210,1.2218,6.3,'3ZM8i94S2RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18211,_binary '\0','/q9YJ50IylRVYtAFGnwyu6GiDpaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357668',6.8,3666,'en','The Flyboys','Two boys from a small town find their courage tested when they accidentally stow away aboard an airplane owned by the mob...','/pQoxndesKFNyG3895L0yiVcVJUK.jpg','2008-08-15',104,'Released',NULL,'The Flyboys',20789,4.315,7.6,'s5D0GKyaNx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18212,_binary '\0','/oiwibRaLWih5JJ1ZqpUq8L4AG6N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357829',7.9,2001,'ml','കല്ല്യാണരാമൻ','Ramankutty, a wedding planner, falls in love with Gauri and their families approve of their marriage. However, an astrologer\'s shocking prediction about Ramankutty\'s family creates complications.','/lp4nOZXHsB01190lgnrpILm6jiB.jpg','2002-12-20',126,'Released',NULL,'Kalyanaraman',351496,0.8308,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18213,_binary '\0','/qIv8FsIostewulxzp7MTs92poNy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357894',5.1,2586,'cn','飞鹰','Lulu Wong, a rock star and philanthropist, fights injustice as her superhero alter-ego Silver Hawk. When the criminal baddie Wolfe sets a plan in motion to dominate the world through cell phone signals, Silver Hawk joins forces with police detective Richman to save the world.','/wxV3zVOcEPPqH09CnQQQS68z8f4.jpg','2004-01-15',99,'Released','The law has limits. She Doesn\'t.','Silver Hawk',41392,2.1921,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18214,_binary '\0','/voVlWqOCGVOSqfPd4pezLJR5gr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357905',7.6,2818,'ta','மின்னலே','Rajesh Shivakumar is a college hoodlum who has his first crush on Reena Joseph, who unfortunately, is engaged to be married to Rajiv Samuel, an Indian engineer settled abroad. In an effort to gain her heart, Maddy impersonates Rajiv and gets close to Reena, aided by his grandfather Subbuni and his crooked sidekick Chockalingam. However, the real Rajiv shows up, bringing a shocking end to Reena\'s romantic interlude.','/gRrvcl7js9oNOx3wmzXwSRzuhSu.jpg','2001-02-18',150,'Released',NULL,'Minnale',47938,1.7949,6.788,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18215,_binary '\0','/le2CZe9qvrikydSvZ16vUQlihqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0357959',5.8,1720,'nl','Pietje Bell 2: De Jacht op de Tsarenkroon','Peter Bell and his Black Hand gang tangle with evil newspaper tycoon Stark once again, as the latter schemes to steal a priceless royal crown with his two cronies.','/56DePyKy4ZNYA7pU1JJTHBP6Cw7.jpg','2003-12-18',112,'Released',NULL,'Peter Bell II: The Hunt for the Czar Crown',21664,1.3108,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18216,_binary '\0','/8p4gCdDT55PMY3UMDvo6ybzMrai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358082',6.4,177128,'en','Robots','Rodney Copperbottom is a young robot inventor who dreams of making the world a better place, until the evil Ratchet takes over Bigweld Industries. Now, Rodney\'s dreams – and those of his friends – are in danger of becoming obsolete.','/fnKCh67l2DDG9NxxIlk9IpsXQ99.jpg','2005-03-10',90,'Released','The biggest comedy ever assembled!','Robots',9928,14.6822,6.509,'MwTUHhUenWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18217,_binary '\0','/dbk1GH7eRmUrs8y9WFQP1corti2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358135',6.2,53113,'en','Shall We Dance?','A bored estate lawyer spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.','/aGIyiQv08Gw1HO5BV1yrwCWtGHC.jpg','2004-10-15',106,'Released','Step out of the ordinary.','Shall We Dance?',4380,6.5025,6.4,'UGtS3CL-zpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18218,_binary '\0','/pMBKzEotLUzk3NuQiyVjZEDlH70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358273',7.8,282608,'en','Walk the Line','A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash\'s life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.','/zMkD6FVikyPNnigoupO7vD5ti9p.jpg','2005-09-13',136,'Released','Love is a burning thing.','Walk the Line',69,9.6566,7.499,'pbQ22zWPYbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18219,_binary '\0','/kgpHkygDOnHL7MWNuZUnBTRK8on.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358294',4.3,8384,'en','Into the Sun','After the assassination of Tokyo\'s Governor by Yakuza members, the CIA bureau chief for Tokyo puts out a call to an agent that had been raised in Japan and trained by ex-Yakuza. Using his former ties, he quickly determines that a war is brewing between old-guard Yakuza members and a young, crazed leader with ties to the Chinese Tong.','/rrfGzNwsIycS8uQZ9eb0iJhPbgs.jpg','2005-11-26',97,'Released','Only one man can stop the Yakuza.','Into the Sun',24546,3.715,4.5,'NJmjPdgH4Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18220,_binary '\0','/yZoZigIp9V0owES9Ch0riDn29Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358345',5.7,1709,'ko','4인용 식탁','An engaged interior designer sees two small girls on the subway train that die there. He sees them again in his apartment. A woman he meets can also see them. He talks to her about his forgotten childhood.','/Au2FDOXYYYGRFQei67Ei5B4a9s0.jpg','2003-08-08',125,'Released','There is more to this world than is safe to know…','The Uninvited',29448,1.5252,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18221,_binary '\0','/dkCeC92reZFKnZDspABZVpk0RLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358349',4.6,17194,'en','Agent Cody Banks 2: Destination London','With all-new gadgets, high-flying action, exciting chases and a wisecracking new handler, Derek (Anthony Anderson), Cody has to retrieve the device before the world\'s leaders fall under the evil control of a diabolical villain.','/zlAltvp84rYVTYs3kdemqHBaiat.jpg','2004-03-12',100,'Released','Adventure is an attitude.','Agent Cody Banks 2: Destination London',17047,5.9064,5.6,'3t-pTVmIHqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18222,_binary '\0','/nEo7B55t79RhcbOjLo6Zcbig4Ku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358456',8.6,20633,'en','Earthlings','Using hidden cameras and never-before-seen footage, Earthlings chronicles the day-to-day practices of the largest industries in the world, all of which rely entirely on animals for profit.','/fcRUYYyDWLJPlX7D6RPtQwdU7G2.jpg','2005-09-24',95,'Released','Make The Connection','Earthlings',30238,2.9805,8.1,'Hm7Babs_FJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18223,_binary '\0','/yh3o31XuViFwV23hG0zuX3UL3TN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358500',6.3,2021,'en','H.H. Holmes: America\'s First Serial Killer','Torture chambers, acid vats, greased chutes and gassing rooms were just some of the devices of death designed by the Torture Doctor, H.H. Holmes in his castle of horrors. Follows Holmes\' entire life as a criminal mastermind.','/bZOfFhkrwhqBynucPcgXkZ5SFAW.jpg','2004-10-26',64,'Released','The Castle. The Murder. The Monster.','H.H. Holmes: America\'s First Serial Killer',13558,1.3466,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18224,_binary '\0','/5Kyu4T6D1urbLb41eotIUHtWQxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0358569',7.1,1369,'en','Live Forever','In the mid-1990s, spurred on by both the sudden world-domination of bands such as Oasis and Prime Minister Tony Blair\'s \"Cool Brittania\" campaign, British culture experienced a brief and powerful boost that made it appear as if Anglophilia was everywhere--at least if you believed the press. Pop music was the beating heart of this idea, and suddenly, \"Britpop\" was a movement. Oasis, their would-be rivals Blur, Pulp, The Verve, and many more bands rode this wave to international chart success. But was Britpop a real phenomenon, or just a marketing ploy? This smart and often hilarious documentary probes the question with copious interviews from Noel and Liam Gallagher of Oasis, Pulp\'s Jarvis Cocker, Damon Albarn of Blur, Sleeper\'s Louise Wener, and many other artists and critics who suddenly found themselves at the cultural forefront.','/wUccEsBqI7THYKc7EEEz9YH1KCe.jpg','2003-03-07',82,'Released','What happened then?','Live Forever',54300,1.1488,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18225,_binary '\0','/63eAFgJtN6ZTyFFzlAOoZLhlYqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359013',5.8,203489,'en','Blade: Trinity','For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night. But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers. Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.','/6f7iXvPOnf83MaLB1JmPzUor1rr.jpg','2004-12-08',113,'Released','The final hunt begins.','Blade: Trinity',36648,15.4706,5.9,'qcHEDGs7eAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18226,_binary '\0','/fm9mEq1nGbwtXqJejXwPZfnRRIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359045',7.1,3780,'es','Cachorro','Pedro, a gay man with an active social life and big circle of friends, takes in his nephew Bernardo for a couple weeks. When it appears as though it might become a permanent arrangement, however, Pedro turns to his friends for guidance as he and 9-year-old Bernardo begin to forge a household together.','/oAit5WpzApbgtJ1nJ95rl30zAuR.jpg','2004-02-27',99,'Released','Parenthood is about to get a little hairier.','Bear Cub',47549,1.2895,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18227,_binary '\0','/zsOXZ2LkNFvIF6BfthKcgjZuWJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359078',4.9,2691,'en','Churchill: The Hollywood Years','A group of American executives making a film about World War II decide that since their lead is rather unglamorous, they will draft in an American G.I. to play the part of Winston Churchill. Their take on the war depicts a handsome Churchill falling in love with Princess Elizabeth, who is herself involved in the war as an undercover agent.','/sN0yLmCvxvtldr3oH1TCh4gzShP.jpg','2004-12-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Churchill: The Hollywood Years',14614,2.4449,5.3,'ZYB7aSWSyOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18228,_binary '\0','/4lzZU04sCv2nMo3qJ4wGWG6tna7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359203',7.5,3256,'en','Easy Riders, Raging Bulls: How the Sex \'n\' Drugs \'n\' Rock \'n\' Roll Generation Saved Hollywood','The chronicle of the mind-blowing journey that was Hollywood during the seventies; the true and gripping story of the last golden age of American cinema, an exalted celebration of creativity and experimentation; but also of sex, drugs and rock \'n\' roll: a turbulent and dark tale of ambition, envy, betrayal, hatred and self-destruction.','/sKztDZqY6T5fhnpJKDqNsAaSLqZ.jpg','2003-03-09',119,'Released',NULL,'Easy Riders, Raging Bulls: How the Sex \'n\' Drugs \'n\' Rock \'n\' Roll Generation Saved Hollywood',32276,1.4714,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18229,_binary '\0','/poEwy5vjsbBHvUTWtwgYfUy5YCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359254',6.6,1451,'es','Familia rodante','A wedding invite from an estranged sibiling inspires a grandmother to assemble her family and embark on a roadtrip in a broken down caravan.','/p6vTD1Ctbz79TKkUwk8RSBzZk8A.jpg','2004-09-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Rolling Family',79767,1.3062,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18230,_binary '\0','/qTpL1GZVXClosHDpEmlrZnyBNrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359423',6.6,14399,'en','A Home at the End of the World','Three friends form a bond over the year, Johnathan is gay, Clare is straight and Bobby is neither, instead he loves the people he loves. As their lives go on there is tension and tears which culminate in a strong yet fragile friendship between the three.','/o1YC1V30LR0LJzGR6JtbzpDSTYy.jpg','2004-07-23',96,'Released','Family can be whatever you want it to be.','A Home at the End of the World',18923,3.6636,6.417,'E-jE6R90fY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18231,_binary '\0','/qNpmWT0K7EzOQq9cBoyjTKWJWXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359517',4.6,9066,'en','Johnson Family Vacation','Nate Johnson, a Los Angeles man estranged from his wife and three children, decides to reconnect with his family by taking them with him on a road trip to Missouri for a big family reunion.','/3F6bmetJSJvqLCB9PMxpNz1sngB.jpg','2004-04-07',97,'Released','Take the ride.','Johnson Family Vacation',19084,4.0135,5.5,'NaN-uJNd1Qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18232,_binary '\0','/e8aihDdcXylamCMeswIyee6G1v1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359692',7.4,5619,'ja','壬生義士伝','Kanichiro Yoshimura is a samurai and family man who can no longer support his wife and children on the low pay he receives from his small-town clan. He is forced by his love for his family to leave for the city in search of higher pay to support them.','/nR2BXaLS3eSpDBEhEZP1rKubwbj.jpg','2003-01-18',137,'Released',NULL,'When the Last Sword Is Drawn',14455,2.36,7.4,'atm97D5xRyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18233,_binary '\0','/8hSjOHRY4OUEpqxszYbMdem8z9C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359950',7.3,377534,'en','The Secret Life of Walter Mitty','A timid magazine photo manager who lives life vicariously through daydreams embarks on a true-life adventure when a negative goes missing.','/iAo1hlzsPV9XpYcLQp6Ud065tGO.jpg','2013-12-18',114,'Released','Stop dreaming. Start living.','The Secret Life of Walter Mitty',116745,16.8277,7.231,'Bp_cxxqOaPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18234,_binary '\0','/6FP0j2UDP6aLzJ3dc7iGG3YgULl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0359984',4.1,1580,'en','Silence Becomes You','Two sisters, Grace and Violet, bound together by more than blood, live a reclusive life in a large mansion, detached from society and reality too. They have a plan. It\'s hardly conventional, but the outcome nine months later is all that counts. Whatever they do they must not fall in love with the man that they choose to ensnare. Set in contemporary New England.','/qVlNJYAUDAU4DYgcY4koQdBOI62.jpg','2005-12-13',88,'Released','The Perfect Sin.','Silence Becomes You',24075,2.2016,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18235,_binary '\0','/1dm0kjWhYDcVPyBk0CZRThxwNyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360009',6.5,33343,'en','Spartan','U.S. government agent Scott is assigned to rescue the daughter of a high-ranking government official. As willing as he is to bend the rules to get things done, though, Scott is shocked to find that others are willing to go even further to protect a political career.','/rcdhS2g1d38NOoeh0PPAN2bLE7w.jpg','2004-03-12',102,'Released','She\'s missing.','Spartan',11169,4.6864,6.2,'YDulN4dyYC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18236,_binary '\0','/vgxm0t7WQRo7QNyQCkuPD4tLK9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360016',5.6,2560,'en','Standing Still','A chain reaction of confrontations and romantic encounters occurs when college friends reunite for one\'s wedding.','/zKn3tCS4cZAOWbrjHaAYyDqdkzH.jpg','2005-01-02',90,'Released','Sometimes it\'s hard moving forward without first looking back.','Standing Still',14167,3.0835,5.5,'NOtoBudFWXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18237,_binary '\0','/T7Qcvp3dHithwMEZU62uJjk3Vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360032',6.2,2113,'en','Strange Bedfellows','Two \'very straight\' old timers have to learn how to pass as a loving gay couple after falsely claiming same-sex status to take advantage of newly legislated tax laws.','/zub7yJWZwGf61jLnANdV2mb1yRo.jpg','2004-04-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Strange Bedfellows',32141,1.5916,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18238,_binary '\0','/rLgPvANrOztHnu1ZTmecU6LdtU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360130',6.5,9718,'en','Undertow','The Munns, father John and sons Chris and Tim, recede to the woods of rural Georgia. Their life together is forever changed with the arrival of Uncle Deel, though the tragedy that follows forces troubled Chris to become a man.','/dWjsI848P3kPT0wbVYZ8huydJPW.jpg','2004-10-22',108,'Released','Hear me now brother. I was washed in the same blood as you.','Undertow',16131,3.1096,6.1,'8rq_5CmE0iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18239,_binary '\0','/cXlUiO1keDZAiSo9432x2H5yb6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360139',6.1,41356,'en','Chasing Liberty','The President\'s daughter, unable to experience life like a normal 18 year-old, escapes from her entourage of Secret Service agents while traveling in Europe. She falls in love with a handsome British stranger, who also happens to be working undercover for her father.','/aGh5zpJSuxcx4lzFFbZ2QyY8wQP.jpg','2004-01-09',111,'Released','How do you fall in love with the whole world watching?','Chasing Liberty',14844,4.6857,6.219,'58-dpfJenkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18240,_binary '\0','/rQekKZM4yKw928vnPkbxFWmG8Uo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360201',6.4,68503,'en','Wimbledon','Britain’s Peter Colt has never quite lived up to his dreams of tennis stardom. Once ranked as high as number 11 in the world, the journeyman veteran has watched his number slip to 119 as his confidence on the court slowly ebbs away. Now, on the eve of his leaving the world of professional tennis, he’s granted a wild card, allowing him to play his final Wimbledon tournament…make that his final tournament ever.','/agiItFfsvNsjpinLGwjfpYOhLaX.jpg','2004-09-13',98,'Released','She\'s the golden girl. He\'s the longshot. It\'s a match made in...','Wimbledon',11823,4.9982,6.235,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18241,_binary '\0','/2gnRFFAoL39MKQgp3SXdjYPOSdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360323',6.2,7588,'en','10th & Wolf','A former street thug returns to his Philadelphia home after a stint in the military. Back on his home turf, he once again finds himself tangling with the mob boss who was instrumental in his going off to be a soldier.','/wzrJMJKZIpp5iw1S0zRx8xkxh5F.jpg','2006-02-19',107,'Released','The Intersection Where Family, Honor and Betrayal Collide.','10th & Wolf',13197,5.3493,5.9,'12wdi73Kbxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18242,_binary '\0','/x3YFn10ehQKMRIJwIfiDAX8S9Xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360486',7,413338,'en','Constantine','John Constantine has literally been to Hell and back. When he teams up with a policewoman to solve the mysterious suicide of her twin sister, their investigation takes them through the world of demons and angels that exists beneath the landscape of contemporary Los Angeles.','/vPYgvd2MwHlxTamAOjwVQp4qs1W.jpg','2005-02-08',121,'Released','Hell wants him. Heaven won\'t take him. Earth needs him.','Constantine',561,17.2497,7.2,'819JCbGfZpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18243,_binary '\0','/7oy4miyq4WYYy0xtX6lbNVPrEsr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360556',5,26635,'en','Fahrenheit 451','In an oppressive future, a \'fireman\' whose duty is to destroy all books begins to question his task.','/urH9H50gKbUK8U6qTVd89SLQPjx.jpg','2018-05-12',100,'Released','Knowledge is a dangerous thing','Fahrenheit 451',401905,5.2004,5.5,'O3irxFd965s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18244,_binary '\0','/enztPCJ765Aq06H6uPh0IJyvau3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360674',6.9,1664,'nl','Interview','A middle-aged journalist interviews the real-life Dutch star Katja Schuurman, in her own loft. Pierre, the journalist is annoyed at being given such a fluffy assignment, as he is normally a political correspondent. Initially he has no questions for Katja, but soon they are coaxing their darkest secrets out of each other.','/6wQHYXC9o1NXWCAFFRIIGm6jTE.jpg','2003-05-28',89,'Released',NULL,'Interview',36350,0.8452,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18245,_binary '\0','/mRM2NB0i3wv4HqxXvwIjEVi4Qqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360717',7.2,474599,'en','King Kong','In 1933 New York, an overly ambitious movie producer coerces his cast and hired ship crew to travel to mysterious Skull Island, where they encounter Kong, a giant ape who is immediately smitten with the leading lady.','/6a2HY6UmD7XiDD3NokgaBAXEsD2.jpg','2005-12-12',188,'Released','The eighth wonder of the world.','King Kong',254,17.6673,6.9,'9extfjDZCts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18246,_binary '\0','/5KWXtqlJZmjgEJCisDk49eCUE5g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360845',6.8,3316,'fr','Notre musique','A three-chapter (Hell, Purgatory and Paradise) meditation on the city of Sarajevo in the wake of the Bosnian war, on Palestine and Israel, and on war itself.','/s6wUXAAly1AqJ8GHyHfV0KbbgOU.jpg','2004-05-19',80,'Released',NULL,'Notre Musique',26347,1.8548,6.7,'lNRjo6nr-tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18247,_binary '\0','/ilpL6PTHhVqip11raFIKmYrlp6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0360916',2.9,3977,'en','The Real Cancun','Sixteen American college students drink, flirt, fight and canoodle during their Spring Break vacation in Cancun, Mexico.','/wyLs32hfhfShhHPJ8h8VzAash55.jpg','2003-04-23',96,'Released','No scripts. No actors. No rules. Anything can happen on spring break, and it did.','The Real Cancun',19153,1.1161,4.1,'NSyLi4E1PaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18248,_binary '\0','/lUt5SfdcIN8SJdQu8R9JOUl3i8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361037',7.9,3394,'te','ఠాగూర్','Tagore (Chiranjeevi) creates his own vigilante military network called the Anti-Corruption Force (ACF) that eliminates the most corrupt individuals, from all walks of life, in a systematic manner. As pressure builds on Police and Government to track down the Man who masterminds these killings, Balbir Singh (Puneet Issar), is specially summoned to head the task. He is aided by Suryam (Prakash Raj) who, though being just a constable in the mammoth Police force, is compelled by his instincts to see through the underlying design. Together they unravel the mystery and unveil the phenomenon called Tagore, but not before Badrinaryana (Sayaji Shinde), the human face of evil, finds out that his revelry in the belief of Tagore’s death was a mistake he can never make amends for.','/uMYWgHSiFEiE0bPLBp4eZTxLnqv.jpg','2003-09-24',175,'Released',NULL,'Tagore',97343,0.9702,6.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18249,_binary '\0','/zHunoIc5AWtVK5YlPY2OC7yvM6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361089',5.5,26163,'en','Valiant','Set in 1944, Valiant is a woodland pigeon who wants to become a great hero someday. When he hears they are hiring recruits for the Royal Homing Pigeon Service, he immediately sets out for London. On the way, he meets a smelly but friendly pigeon named Bugsy, who joins him, mainly to get away from clients he cheated in a game of find-the pebble, and helps him sign up for the war.','/tSRO8wukDlGMlrkmRpqL2nWhgPs.jpg','2005-03-25',76,'Released','Featherweight Heroes.','Valiant',14175,5.0876,5.7,'HPurt-LTyKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18250,_binary '\0','/ebojikILvOdZlVMWmp9WJLv1LVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361127',7.1,37102,'en','The Woodsman','After twelve years in prison, Walter returns home. His family has abandoned him, save for his brother-in-law. Few know he\'s a sex offender and pedophile. Walter finds an apartment and is regularly visited by his parole officer. He gets a job at a lumber mill and starts seeing a coworker. Then his new world begins to unravel; as his past becomes known, he strikes up a high-risk friendship with a young girl and realizes that a man loitering near a schoolyard is a child molester prowling for his next victim.','/4fDgLcc35A0IpxhMyJMP33bSDXj.jpg','2004-12-24',87,'Released','Nothing can undo the past.','The Woodsman',9692,3.8832,6.837,'X7SjEfXP-gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18251,_binary '\0','/52eiIndD693MR6Y6eoK7whGN3Fq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361309',6.2,10652,'en','We Don\'t Live Here Anymore','Married couple Jack and Terry Linden are experiencing a difficult period in their relationship. When Jack decides to step outside the marriage, he becomes involved with Edith, who happens to be the wife of his best friend and colleague, Hank Evans. Learning of their partners\' infidelity, Terry and Hank engage in their own extramarital affair together. Now, both marriages and friendships are on the brink of collapse.','/rBxDYB5nVssDh5VF0YDXHvpsBMF.jpg','2004-08-13',101,'Released','Why do we want what we can\'t have?','We Don\'t Live Here Anymore',23601,2.6596,5.712,'bxmUE9aYQNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18252,_binary '\0','/9icnC5LhckumDiq4UZZA4l6ysJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361399',4.8,1767,'en','Blast','Former Navy SEAL Lamont Dixon thought he left his fighting days behind when he became a tugboat captain assigned to tow an offshore oil rig. But calm waters begin to stir as an offshore drilling protest turns into a terrorist hijacking. When the hijackers reveal part of their elaborate scheme, Dixon suspects foul play. With the help of FBI Agent Lisa Reed coordinating the counter-attack from shore, it\'s sink or swim as Dixon and Reed try to save the hostages, but can they diffuse the deadly plan before it\'s too late?','/9Ub3DShZwd40LOt0efh7suj858a.jpg','2004-11-11',92,'Released','Oil And Money Are An Explosive Mix.','Blast',24775,1.8331,4.9,'nkMlcZwZ2z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18253,_binary '\0','/dxAeLMQC7M4Xp0dxrkL3rPq4vpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361411',6.2,22804,'en','Bride & Prejudice','Mrs. Bakshi is eager to find suitors for her four unmarried daughters when a family friend introduces them to handsome American Will Darcy. A Bollywood-style modern adaptation of Jane Austen\'s classic novel.','/yqqo00GZqyG0dijKCqBbdQLUvht.jpg','2004-02-11',112,'Released','Bollywood meets Hollywood… And it\'s a perfect match','Bride & Prejudice',57825,4.6359,6.5,'nFYwqts1_TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18254,_binary '\0','/z5r8XnWFWTD0shvIlR9yCn85Lna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361467',4.8,34027,'en','Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen','After moving to New Jersey, Lola bags a coveted role in a school play, which earns her the wrath of Carla, the most popular girl in school, who will do anything to ruin Lola\'s life.','/nQA9Ozh9ftLQyJvuKy6sl5zSlH2.jpg','2004-02-17',90,'Released','So much drama, so little time.','Confessions of a Teenage Drama Queen',11132,7.8833,5.7,'OjdHGTBYDsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18255,_binary '\0','/phlfaINv7hOb7oCon3PHidPUHdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361500',4.2,3348,'en','Delgo','In a divided land, it takes a rebellious boy and his clandestine love for a Princess of an opposing race to stop a war orchestrated by a power hungry villain.','/wtk430tDLZ0Ql5jCUWCja8qJJQQ.jpg','2008-12-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Delgo',20542,2.8777,4.6,'5Gi8ZG7UE5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18256,_binary '\0','/cLZxnkj75cGBK1tLTMyIudOZYZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361596',7.5,135456,'en','Fahrenheit 9/11','Michael Moore\'s view on how the Bush administration allegedly used the tragic events on 9/11 to push forward its agenda for unjust wars in Afghanistan and Iraq.','/cZ7M343iuiMDc36fSeSm699XQFv.jpg','2004-06-25',123,'Released','Controversy... what controversy?','Fahrenheit 9/11',1777,4.4904,7.084,'lQm4efsmVGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18257,_binary '\0','/1ajUdpDtgR64pVu7HjC3VCpBSXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361620',5.2,31951,'en','First Daughter','Samantha MacKenzie, the daughter of the president of the United States, arrives at college with a group of Secret Service agents. Samantha, however, resents their presence and decides she wants to attend school just like a normal student.','/iUZ3hDMo8SGY2IoujCKwVt8ukm9.jpg','2004-09-24',105,'Released','The girl who always stood out is finally getting the chance to fit in.','First Daughter',13969,6.6629,6.2,'PyQv-dNbTOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18258,_binary '\0','/fQOFjdWCMDnYujXlDuGBmNhV4i1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361668',6.9,13471,'ja','極道恐怖大劇場 牛頭 GOZU','Minami mistakenly kills a gangster associate of his named Brother. Almost as soon as the murder takes place, the body of the deceased man is gone, prompting Minami to conduct a search. While looking, he finds a mysterious isolated hotel where he decides to take a rest. Not only are the front desk clerks a bit strange, but even the ambiance feels unusual. Minami soon realizes he may have gotten more than he bargained for.','/mo5L0XzMYmLhdsvgA40qlYiHhAF.jpg','2003-07-11',130,'Released',NULL,'Gozu',12487,2.9051,6.8,'1Tt2BZc7ueY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18259,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361670',7.2,2690,'fr','Le Grand Voyage','Reda, summoned to accompany his father on a pilgrimage to Mecca, complies reluctantly - as he preparing for his baccalaureat and, even more important, has a secret love relationship. The trip across Europe in a broken-down car is also the departure of his father: upon arrival in Mecca, both Reda and his father are not the characters they were at the start of the movie. Avoiding the hackneyed theme of the return to the homeland, the film uses the departure to renew a connection between two generation.','/ypKFwK1Sn8eeXoEu5vXTThue1eb.jpg','2004-11-09',108,'Released',NULL,'The Great Journey',44003,1.171,6.829,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18260,_binary '\0','/yZmosLPiLAewMCqiT3m7BmUDeRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361693',6.3,9802,'en','Happy Endings','Filmmaker Nicky offers to track down the son that Mamie gave up for adoption nearly two decades before. Meanwhile, Mamie\'s stepbrother (and the father of her child), Charley, along with his boyfriend, Gil, try to find out what became of the sperm Gil donated to a lesbian couple. Finally, singer Jude becomes entangled in a love triangle with androgynous drummer Otis and his conservative father.','/76Hq3Buq6SIOe5Z7f5APwh1s7vU.jpg','2005-01-20',128,'Released','All\'s well that ends swell.','Happy Endings',14922,4.0906,5.6,'z-rgRTsjaG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18261,_binary '\0','/jpxKKX36mVUxV6gdOxPDSSsc2SA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361696',5.8,30095,'en','Raise Your Voice','A coming-of-age story centered around a small-town singer brokenhearted by the death of her brother in a car crash, who had secretly submitted her for a summer session at a performing arts academy in Los Angeles. In the academy, she experiences a whole new way of life in the big city, far from the small town lifestyle she\'s used to.','/89sfBkVOsgFRPs6uKaBtSMCDSv3.jpg','2004-08-10',107,'Released','Don\'t Hold Back ...Don\'t Give Up.','Raise Your Voice',14024,4.5482,6.552,'BBntfOIjsRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18262,_binary '\0','/nGd0NNJSXMVwCGvWcVmp0pMd8uo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361715',7.1,9177,'en','Duma','An orphaned cheetah becomes the best friend and pet of a young boy living in South Africa.','/opoDxQW9S6SaiP8rY7urw16QVTL.jpg','2005-04-22',100,'Released','Some friendships are wilder than others','Duma',15907,2.9389,7.4,'bwebjc4mfYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18263,_binary '\0','/hwNtEmmugU5Yd7hpfprNWI0DGIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361748',8.4,1817934,'en','Inglourious Basterds','In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as \"The Basterds\" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers.','/aupnPtagH9JVBuMrGEanf4iqXEQ.jpg','2009-08-02',153,'Released','Once upon a time in Nazi occupied France...','Inglourious Basterds',16869,30.837,8.217,'QFIUD3aq_do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18264,_binary '\0','/10qih3joKDNsiMQrAkfNhJDejRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361818',7.9,7054,'ta','குஷி','College friends Jenny and Shiva part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.','/n0bz0nX3GqPKfoXY8kH8QFTyWCs.jpg','2000-05-19',178,'Released',NULL,'Kushi',69654,1.6841,7.076,'IyFx-rAqHnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18265,_binary '\0','/uOn7OxSRhOcVpnypbmcYf23uiPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361841',5.4,20037,'en','Little Black Book','Determined to learn about her boyfriend\'s past relationships, Stacy -- who works for a talk show -- becomes a bona fide snoop. With her colleague, Barb, Stacy gets the names of Derek\'s ex-lovers and interviews them, supposedly for an upcoming show. But what she learns only adds to her confusion, and her plans begin to unravel when she befriends one of the women.','/c6TD54dLIryqhQAOdGExy8Lie1l.jpg','2004-08-06',107,'Released','Have you ever been tempted to look inside his...','Little Black Book',14846,5.0521,5.4,'aCz7zxl6-G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18266,_binary '\0','/hi3lxLd93iKwCmVAfhMV9m1k2jr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361862',7.6,446518,'en','The Machinist','Trevor, an insomniac lathe operator, experiences unusual occurrences at work and home. A strange man follows him everywhere, but no one else seems to notice him.','/diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg','2004-09-24',102,'Released','How do you wake up from a nightmare if you’re not asleep?','The Machinist',4553,9.1842,7.519,'7HPT9006wT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18267,_binary '\0','/iF7Ak3YsKNvCr3apItDeblkXORg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0361925',5.3,14509,'en','Welcome to Mooseport','A US president who has retired after two terms in office returns to his hometown of Mooseport, Maine and decides to run for Mayor against another local candidate.','/xesXaNCtdGUO5FsMDYooPQAMHxQ.jpg','2004-02-24',110,'Released','This town isn\'t small enough for the both of them.','Welcome to Mooseport',16784,4.3203,5.1,'ydxisYfODz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18268,_binary '\0','/x4T5Sb0sxozWb1I5cCXyOTGDITU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362001',6.5,1294,'en','A Painted House','A young boy, his family, and the migrant workers they hire to work their cotton farm struggle against difficult odds to raise and sell the crop. Meanwhile, the boy dreams of living in better conditions. However, with this particularly tough farming season, the boy learns that his challenges guide him in discovering who he really is.','/iurcGxgA8q0VdUo5W2HUaT8wuWA.jpg','2003-04-27',97,'Released','Desperate Times, hard truths, unexpected dangers. One extraordinary summer will change a young boy and his family...forever.','A Painted House',46317,2.2569,7.1,'-wyvO4ciThk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18269,_binary '\0','/e7nnxev4s0ZsJ4IE3tpw4n2zEmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362004',6.7,13548,'en','Palindromes','Aviva is thirteen, awkward and sensitive. Her mother Joyce is warm and loving, as is her father, Steve, a regular guy who does have a fierce temper from time to time. The film revolves around her family, friends and neighbors.','/woPb5Bb5zpmjg3LtMUJIFfXpOCh.jpg','2005-03-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Palindromes',13073,2.8055,6.2,'7Ht6ewQlXhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18270,_binary '\0','/4ACkisdnfqSUbgeLKVZbodZEL5A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362084',5.3,1540,'fr','Atomik Circus - Le Retour de James Bataille','James Bataille is in love. He attempts to stage an elaborate motorcycle stunt to impress the girl, but when it goes sour, he ends up in prison with a 133-year sentence. Bataille escapes from behind bars to make an appointment to fix the car of music biz tycoon, as well as watch the love of his life take part in the town\'s annual talent show.','/i5rF1Ryz6dCmiPKQUjmiRBWNzMW.jpg','2004-07-21',92,'Released',NULL,'The Return of James Battle',25714,1.7392,5.6,'KmaflZfLUVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18271,_binary '\0','/pSNwe7G9bESwlCBVurlwRs7fMZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362120',5.1,143858,'en','Scary Movie 4','Cindy finds out the house she lives in is haunted by a little boy and goes on a quest to find out who killed him and why. Also, Alien \"Tr-iPods\" are invading the world and she has to uncover the secret in order to stop them.','/dEwlu8S0z1AibuX1weLwUyiRWFl.jpg','2006-04-12',83,'Released','Bury the grudge. Burn the village. See the saw.','Scary Movie 4',4257,13.4647,5.498,'h0zAlXr1UOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18272,_binary '\0','/73MUJRFc8lfEtTaM7YtNdPhVHpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362129',5.8,2633,'en','Seeing Other People','Ed and Alice are two months shy of getting married when she realizes that she wishes she\'d had a more active love life while still single. Reluctantly, Ed agrees to have an open relationship in the months before their wedding, and initially this seems to improve their connection, particularly in the bedroom. However, as Ed and Alice get more involved in their own flings, the experiment goes awry.','/79BzDZv6oxZn1Z8RvVT35DXiMcd.jpg','2004-05-07',90,'Released','Get it out of your system.','Seeing Other People',32298,2.3336,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18273,_binary '\0','/zbGteYxh9dMJAKPyZY9AWzzHR5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362165',2.3,62608,'en','Son of the Mask','Tim Avery, an aspiring cartoonist, finds himself in a predicament when his dog stumbles upon the mask of Loki. Then after conceiving an infant son \"born of the mask\", he discovers just how looney child raising can be.','/Adgnfhm9B8YAQmC0osuP4zO9SRc.jpg','2005-02-11',94,'Released','The next generation of mischief.','Son of the Mask',10214,11.4539,4.2,'FKwtGHbpVDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18274,_binary '\0','/7hcoMi2AMRvPC7YnGm41k3Wcgvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362225',7.5,62004,'fr','Ne le dis à personne','A man receives a mysterious email appearing to be from his wife, who was murdered years earlier. As he frantically tries to find out whether she\'s alive, he finds himself being implicated in her death.','/fr2wEeO1H8dzx6EDfzYTRBIvZaE.jpg','2006-11-01',131,'Released','Eight years ago Alex\'s wife was murdered. Today she emailed him.','Tell No One',10795,7.5126,7.219,'4AqH7AAYWHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18275,_binary '\0','/zywtNiaZ9r7azrcNdl2j0jOgrkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362227',7.4,542031,'en','The Terminal','An Eastern European tourist unexpectedly finds himself stranded in JFK airport, and must take up temporary residence there.','/cPB3ZMM4UdsSAhNdS4c7ps5nypY.jpg','2004-06-17',128,'Released','Life is waiting.','The Terminal',594,17.6238,7.4,'GZjC9dAvWuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18276,_binary '\0','/pU6ykikWNiiGnHjuCUKHmAUGNRa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362246',6.2,1294,'fr','Tiresia','Based on the legend of Tiresias, it tells of a transgender woman who is kidnapped by a man and left to die in the woods. She is then saved by a family and receives the gift of telling the future.','/wi4vY3Ri4cDlrL3kDHmV3S6xFIx.jpg','2003-05-20',115,'Released',NULL,'Tiresia',67236,1.8639,5.9,'usdoSv1DBGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18277,_binary '\0','/yA7MG24LZCtQhsKXhqJ5TfbjFoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362269',7,52826,'en','Kinsey','Kinsey is a portrait of researcher Alfred Kinsey, driven to uncover the most private secrets of a nation. What begins for Kinsey as a scientific endeavor soon takes on an intensely personal relevance, ultimately becoming an unexpected journey into the mystery of human behavior.','/cODCjWNRcZkwe4ONQs1GzRqYtRb.jpg','2004-09-04',118,'Released','Let\'s talk about sex','Kinsey',11184,3.9772,6.6,'5UxVz4tn7ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18278,_binary '\0','/7tWktnLQ81G8pHUkhuTebcTkcB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362270',7.2,222350,'en','The Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou','Renowned oceanographer Steve Zissou has sworn vengeance upon the rare shark that devoured a member of his crew. In addition to his regular team, he is joined on his boat by Ned, a man who believes Zissou to be his father, and Jane, a journalist pregnant by a married man. They travel the sea, all too often running into pirates and, perhaps more traumatically, various figures from Zissou\'s past, including his estranged wife, Eleanor.','/qZoFLNBC78jzboWeDH6Ha0qavF2.jpg','2004-12-10',119,'Released','The deeper you go, the weirder life gets.','The Life Aquatic with Steve Zissou',421,8.5597,7.1,'XVRXYnGz-Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18279,_binary '\0','/rvtH6PbKFa2PUoMxJvtct1bP5Jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362387',6.8,4239,'ja','2LDK','Hoping to land a role, two Japanese actresses begin a fight within their apartment that keeps escalating.','/zpfIwrt8iHOQzOpTeGmyT5ARIIH.jpg','2003-04-11',70,'Released','Envious roommates in a duel to the death.','2LDK',24092,1.7724,6.8,'R6hMokW-Hp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18280,_binary '\0','/zQg0UCo6xJVKOAe86E0vGsgUNCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362389',6.3,5775,'en','44 Minutes: The North Hollywood Shoot-Out','After a failed bank robbery, two heavily armed men hold the Los Angeles Police Department at bay for 44 minutes.','/zcL30rZ71NfoCQtTwPlJiLI40qr.jpg','2003-06-05',86,'Released',NULL,'44 Minutes: The North Hollywood Shoot-Out',14842,3.315,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18281,_binary '\0','/a3A6lD7fQ8xPZAJTWYd3DihdCRX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362417',6.6,2381,'ja','荒神','Two seriously wounded samurai find refuge from a storm at an isolated temple, the home of a swordsman and a mysterious young woman. One samurai awakes to find that not only has his comrade died, but that his wounds have miraculously healed. He discovers that he has been given the power of immortality by the swordsman, a man once known as the legendary Miyamoto Musashi, who now lives an endless existence as Aragami, a \"god of battle\".','/kSCNj4TSAnCp0XcCRJRN1x5dNdv.jpg','2003-03-27',76,'Released',NULL,'Aragami',5845,1.2799,7,'MqcUjJrtTOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18282,_binary '\0','/kjVhc1Ba9dFhgsdzQLGKrUbfe1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362478',5.6,98295,'en','The Box','Norma and Arthur Lewis, a suburban couple with a young child, receive a simple wooden box as a gift, which bears fatal and irrevocable consequences. A mysterious stranger delivers the message that the box promises to bestow upon its owner $1 million with the press of a button. However pressing this button will simultaneously cause the death of another human being somewhere in the world; someone they don\'t know. With just 24 hours to have the box in their possession, Norma and Arthur find themselves in the cross-hairs of a startling moral dilemma and must face the true nature of their humanity.','/xMAmOu6xl4CsstixcuecBle9krd.jpg','2009-10-29',115,'Released','You are the experiment.','The Box',22825,6.228,5.638,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18283,_binary '\0','/ncRGDPCechwk6j5dO3s6l6zXWe4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362506',6.5,1746,'en','Chrystal','Many years after a devastating accident that took the life of his only son and permanently injured his wife, Joe finally comes home and tries to redeem himself.','/dj4St7fCnjPF9d7DoorOgD3qGOL.jpg','2004-02-26',106,'Released','Life is hard. Love is simple.','Chrystal',33403,1.3994,5.6,'2tQ7hg0OH4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18284,_binary '\0','/1BTSSNRGc0WBFsJyvoN2zjCBXTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362511',4.7,8664,'en','National Lampoon Presents Dorm Daze','When a foreign-exchange student and a hooker - both named Dominique - show up on a college campus, the unsuspecting student body is in for the education of a lifetime!','/3Aey8eozhVGgiDK37k8UzqwNV8m.jpg','2003-09-26',96,'Released','Study Hard.','National Lampoon Presents Dorm Daze',18113,4.2969,5.092,'MOC0j-gVd0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18285,_binary '\0','/zehty7MIyCKGv9uE3Tfqa3ZquzO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362526',6.4,11482,'en','Criminal','Needing a new partner capable of intricate cons, Richard Gaddis, recruits Rodrigo, a crook with a perfect poker face. The two plan a big-time scam: selling a fake Silver Certificate to currency collector William Hannigan. Rodrigo distrusts his new associate, but needs money to help out his ill father. The situation becomes more complicated when Rodrigo falls for Gaddis\' sister, Valerie, drawing another player into the game.','/2Nd816rpRLxuq8YU3dPcDsoTpWR.jpg','2004-09-10',87,'Released','Ever get the feeling you\'re being played?','Criminal',14198,3.2409,6.24,'--ny4HSCs5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18286,_binary '\0','/qIVKlPIvqpqjZQivDalKIbY2jdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362548',7.2,1891,'ta','தூள்','Arumugham is an uneducated, good hearted, helpful village hick. Easwari is his childhood friend. A chemical factory in the village pollutes the local river and when all attempts to stop the factory waste from going to the drinking water falls flat, the villagers decide to send Arumugham to Chennai and meet the concerned minister who has won from their constituency. He sets out for the city with Easwari and her grandmother and they stay with Arumugham\'s friend and gang.','/oz3a9QkNMLozHegJE4bDY0oxO4Z.jpg','2003-01-15',160,'Released',NULL,'Dhool',69661,2.0204,6.058,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18287,_binary '\0','/y06Rldcar3Zg3avk4U56SpCCfKx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362590',6.1,10920,'en','Employee of the Month','\"Employee of the Month\" is about a guy whose day spirals from bad to worse when he gets fired from his dream job at the bank and is dumped by his fiancée Sara. David\'s best friend Jack tries to convince him it\'s for the best, but the opposite occurs when bank robberies and millions of dollars become part of his day from hell.','/9OJGGE1fdLxHGZTporORoxHpJoH.jpg','2004-01-17',98,'Released','Things are not always what they seem.','Employee of the Month',11413,3.6133,5.711,'fsXqZtK4vrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18288,_binary '\0','/tSrTiiHJILtJOfqVroVB6L63ZFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362696',7.6,3379,'hi','Haasil','Anirudhh, a law-abiding college student, in love with Niharika, gets caught up in college politics and crime, and must fight it out for himself, when friends turn into foes.','/7y8PBC2OyhnlJl8O4IPYa1IKmf0.jpg','2003-05-15',161,'Released',NULL,'Haasil',114813,0.902,7.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18289,_binary '\0','/6NjTK111h2aNiz7uJuExpD5amBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362771',6.1,5020,'hi','इश्क़ विश्क','Rajiv Mathur decides to go conditionally steady with fellow collegian, Payal, so that be can be permitted to go on an outing. Payal accepts, and accompanies him. During the outing, he gets intoxicated, and attempts to molest her, and she decides to dump him. Thereafter, slighted but not beaten - Rajiv turns on his charms on another beauty - the gorgeous Alisha Sahay. But will she be as permissible as Payal?','/h3ipvgyBjWS6nTeO4iB75vKulgL.jpg','2003-05-05',145,'Released',NULL,'Ishq Vishk',41901,0.9567,5.943,'JdLcKgRsIRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18290,_binary '\0','/aM2C5U8kQQG9X4QEopoEmOLBori.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0362942',3.3,2603,'de','Apokalypse Eis','Meteor Bay-Leder 7 struck earth on October 18th, 2012. Causing earthquakes, tidal waves, and a dust cloud that soon covered most of the Northern hemisphere, it changed the face of our planet forever.','/1GlM9DOMnT47VBWHigCaUzgZId0.jpg','2004-05-20',90,'Released','Where the world ends, survival begins.','Post Impact',15910,2.2726,4.6,'qQws-LKD9Pk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18291,_binary '\0','/mZ7RRQFQpTCU8U5Hhy89wv7lTvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363060',7.2,1911,'ja','沙羅双樹','The Aso family live in the old town of Nara. One Day, Kei, one of the Aso\'s twin boys suddenly disappears. Five years later seventeen-year old Shun, the remaining twin, is an art student. He now has to move forward with his life, together with his childhood friend, Yu.','/tfsdobIiofqZVHNbDyLDs5d0pzR.jpg','2003-07-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Shara',36281,1.2717,6.4,'_AH729mSYR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18292,_binary '\0','/o3EvC5uurO6te4mzZ49Zt3775pg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363095',6.4,2999,'en','Freeze Frame','Sean Veil is an ultra paranoid murder suspect who takes to filming himself round the clock to provide an alibi, just in case he\'s ever accused of another crime. Problems arise however when the police do come calling and the one tape that can prove his innocence has mysteriously disappeared.','/A7SNMoBXWt0GAdktkVY1SB3y3vQ.jpg','2004-05-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Freeze Frame',12612,1.314,6.3,'NbyAuFPKmls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18293,_binary '\0','/puVSkJbKz0iiaI3l1yOFkO7kwEH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363143',4.7,3646,'en','Trauma','Awaking from a coma to discover his wife has been killed in a car accident, Ben\'s world may as well have come to an end. A few weeks later, Ben\'s out of hospital and, attempting to start a new life, he moves home and is befriended by a beautiful young neighbour Charlotte. His life may be turning around but all is not what it seems and, haunted by visions of his dead wife, Ben starts to lose his grip on reality.','/k9uFGgQYmyhGFhwRM9jZuIlYAiu.jpg','2004-09-17',94,'Released','Believe what you SEE what you believe.','Trauma',20357,1.9193,5.2,'M-ZZ-PhDeF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18294,_binary '\0','/cT80aGpjWZLn8rd7cLtsbktFMhf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363163',8.2,403971,'de','Der Untergang','In April of 1945, Germany stands at the brink of defeat with the Russian Army closing in from the east and the Allied Expeditionary Force attacking from the west. In Berlin, capital of the Third Reich, Adolf Hitler proclaims that Germany will still achieve victory and orders his generals and advisers to fight to the last man. When the end finally does come, and Hitler lies dead by his own hand, what is left of his military must find a way to end the killing that is the Battle of Berlin, and lay down their arms in surrender.','/cP1ElGjBhbZAAqmueXjHDKlSwiP.jpg','2004-09-16',155,'Released','April 1945, a nation awaits its... Downfall','Downfall',613,11.5811,7.863,'Bp1RXmM1-60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18295,_binary '\0','/kP6WiYHQUUXo6ZaXI06enkMsxkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363226',7.4,53506,'ja','座頭市','Blind traveler Zatoichi is a master swordsman and a masseur with a fondness for gambling on dice games. When he arrives in a village torn apart by warring gangs, he sets out to protect the townspeople.','/iCIycswWbX1EDS6PYYBcR9ohrC.jpg','2003-09-06',116,'Released','His sword made him a hero... his courage made him a legend.','Zatoichi',246,6.8593,7.2,'hfMSfvmUPH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18296,_binary '\0','/lki0m8iBZT4vYuSEqpMAiW636TP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363235',6.7,3288,'ja','アカルイミライ','Buddies working at an oshibori factory bond over an uncontrollable rage neither can control, as well as a strange jellyfish they keep as a pet.','/1YybmpoxjOaBu4Z5o54OFjwhMa4.jpg','2003-01-18',115,'Released',NULL,'Bright Future',26886,1.7092,6.9,'EUT7wkew3iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18297,_binary '\0','/8o2l1tDdEP79o1aKqOFUwQl5Bf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363249',6.5,2747,'ru','Отец и сын','In this dreamlike film, a nameless father and his son, Aleksei, live together in an apartment in St. Petersburg. Aleksei\'s mother has died and consequently the two have a very close relationship. When Aleksei acquires a girlfriend, she refuses to take a back seat to his bond with his dad, and breaks up with him. Aleksei is also experiencing nightmares, dreading separation from his father to be a part of the military as his father was.','/pGGUrgF5nPyMpJbiN87SlT2zqxB.jpg','2003-09-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Father and Son',44513,1.1058,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18298,_binary '\0','/dcukZQZQFBNPSrHIgevvvod67RZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363276',5.4,7360,'en','Madhouse','A young psychiatric intern unearths secrets about the mental health facility in which he works.','/ug2DwSZ5WCgMUJcWfEPn7wIHtpn.jpg','2004-07-30',91,'Released','Let the insanity begin.','Madhouse',17209,2.6859,5.7,'aYWrcU0Lqa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18299,_binary '\0','/13UkK69iyMsB45H2p1WPXJPS87w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363282',5,26793,'en','New York Minute','Honors student Jane Ryan heads to Manhattan for a college-scholarship competition. Her rebellious twin Roxy tags along to crash a video shoot. But anything can happen – and does – in a romp involving a pursuing truant officer, a smuggler, hunkalicious guys, and the girls\' realization that when the chips are down, a sister can be the best friend of all.','/px9hV6w6XzAjGdxCRUAUasAHQsP.jpg','2004-05-07',91,'Released','Anything can change in a New York minute.','New York Minute',11025,6.2343,6.1,'nB9VyKVHKKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18300,_binary '\0','/jegQMIfcXMktZH0oJ3yeZPsxstl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363290',6.1,1412,'zh','紫蝴蝶','Ding Hui is a member of Purple Butterfly, a powerful resistance group in Japanese occupied Shanghai. An unexpected encounter reunites her with Itami, an ex-lover and officer with a secret police unit tasked with dismantling Purple Butterfly.','/hAc6iJYzfq6aI56k5K7cclgGzVp.jpg','2003-07-04',127,'Released','United by Passion. Divided by Fate.','Purple Butterfly',34561,1.3196,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18301,_binary '\0','/bYkgJUGlkDrKzCrN6Jrd1qVx9aB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363292',6.2,2792,'es','Sexo con amor','In Santiago, Chile, the schoolteacher Luisa proposes a debate about sex with the parents of her students with the intention of giving classes about sex education to the youngsters.','/9Unz4SnlkXg0OAxgiLKZAfu096c.jpg','2003-03-27',108,'Released',NULL,'Sex with Love',20222,3.0587,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18302,_binary '\0','/gu3RYo6sJBEXVa0govnGR5gAJbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363303',6.8,1652,'fa','پنج عصر','Nogreh is a young Afghan woman living with her father and her sister-in-law, Leylomah, whose husband, Akhtar, is missing. Beyond the issue of Akhtar, Leylomah is most concerned with how to feed her baby. She cannot provide milk for her baby as her own hunger is preventing her from lactating. Nogreh, however, aspires toward a life in a western styled democracy. Although the Taliban are no longer in power in Afghanistan, traditional forces are still active in the country. Nogreh often displays signs of rebellion, such as wearing a pair of white pumps instead of the traditional slipper beneath her burqa. But mostly, Nogreh wants to be educated. Without her father\'s knowledge, Nogreh is attending a secular girls school. Ultimately, she wants to become President of Afghanistan. With the help of a Pakistani refugee who likes her as a woman, Nogreh tries to understand exactly what forces led to current world leaders being elected, those forces which she wants to emulate.','/8Vg7D342cJMB4brLWgfjj6jS5WN.jpg','2003-08-20',105,'Released',NULL,'At Five in the Afternoon',43969,1.1399,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18303,_binary '\0','/v3sPv48qk0IQ4UshIAzYnAJHk1Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363409',5.8,3574,'hi','Aan: Men at Work','Crime is at its highest peak in Mumbai with it split in three ways. Walia has one-third, Manik Rao has one-third and Roshni has a third of the Mumbai territory. The crime rate rises with more smuggling, trading and illegal activities soaring.','/3iZjhwvpnSrZPWviWWSs2wu10ey.jpg','2004-06-04',149,'Released',NULL,'Aan: Men at Work',155973,2.2439,5.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18304,_binary '\0','/mgUoPbQ3uWEYdIY0svr5pisdc6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363472',4.2,2863,'hi','बेवफा','After her sister dies, Anjali gives up her relationship with Raja and marries her brother-in-law. Years later, they cross paths again, leaving her torn between him and her loyalties.','/8FVH3HfBkkwmPNMHb6c6lqvH82v.jpg','2005-02-25',151,'Released',NULL,'Bewafaa',205212,3.3261,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18305,_binary '\0','/6lqG65kS1z3WrquVosNmb3uhBY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363473',6.7,16140,'en','Beyond the Sea','Based on the life and career of legendary entertainer, Bobby Darin, the biopic moves back and forth between his childhood and adulthood, to tell the tale of his life.','/wIewPJNyyTIMI5rQzcElc23jenW.jpg','2004-11-16',118,'Released','In the era of cool, Bobby Darin was the soundtrack.','Beyond the Sea',6478,3.4018,6.331,'Bz8bY2xn3bA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18306,_binary '\0','/1XFfzzXRlPiCRUbZMvcJ6570t9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363504',5.9,1673,'en','Bigger Than the Sky','After being dumped by his girlfriend, a man stuck in a deadend life decides to audition for a small role in a local community theatre\'s production of Cyrano de Bergerac. Despite having no experience as an actor, he lands the lead role, which wreaks havoc upon his life.','/djKEJkN9D3pQAI8aGbz1Uq44g7C.jpg','2005-02-18',106,'Released','Life has a role for everyone.','Bigger Than the Sky',51177,1.9277,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18307,_binary '\0','/5YLmhWBKeOF2dABeefMXNs7Q3Ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363510',8.2,2766,'en','La revolución no será televisada','Hugo Chavez was a colourful, unpredictable folk hero who was beloved by his nation’s working class. He was elected president of Venezuela in 1998, and proved to be a tough, quixotic opponent to the power structure that wanted to depose him. When he was forcibly removed from office on 11 April 2002, two independent filmmakers were inside the presidential palace.','/6OeVe8oGS7vccKjsiuIGTwBlAFk.jpg','2003-03-07',74,'Released',NULL,'The Revolution Will Not Be Televised',33222,1.3216,7.7,'tlG0nyE_Om0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18308,_binary '\0','/zSqQHZvUnEdQlDVk584f6CVyOKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363532',6.9,5444,'fr','Confidences trop intimes','Because she picked the wrong door, Anna ends up confessing her marriage problems to a financial adviser named William Faber. Touched by her distress, somewhat excited as well, Faber does not have the courage to tell her that he is not a psychiatrist. From appointment to appointment, a strange ritual is created between them. William is moved and fascinated to hear the secrets no man ever heard.','/yutL7HnWZoeXZAACXq0Hl5Ic0C7.jpg','2004-02-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Intimate Strangers',21200,2.1473,6.353,'34YVqhsyDzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18309,_binary '\0','/c1bejD7jTTf8qSUkcv32Gmv8N50.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363547',7.2,290762,'en','Dawn of the Dead','A group of survivors take refuge in a shopping mall after the world is taken over by aggressive, flesh-eating zombies.','/ttquyxStEEctzghtA2f4PUGprDr.jpg','2004-03-19',101,'Released','When there\'s no more room in Hell, the dead will walk the Earth.','Dawn of the Dead',924,16.6647,7.1,'DV8mJcuYVaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18310,_binary '\0','/7Dil0i2PT5llCrZCaeaPGgETpfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363579',6.6,2563,'en','Down to the Bone','A woman stuck in a stale marriage struggles to raise her children and manage her secret drug habit. But when winter comes to her small town, her balancing act begins to come crashing down.','/x5A0RdsKe8qnX9ntPXL4dsPGvMl.jpg','2004-01-14',104,'Released','Old habits die hard.','Down to the Bone',40876,2.0937,6.4,'XiXvcySnuD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18311,_binary '\0','/n9irXcigQGlcub5JJ6RV1EdDW1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363589',7.1,105612,'en','Elephant','Several ordinary high school students go through their daily routine as two others prepare for something more malevolent.','/1a4VU9z2hxEvugHMK7VsobB9xTX.jpg','2003-09-20',81,'Released','An ordinary high school day. Except that it\'s not.','Elephant',1807,8.821,7.011,'LLakpFFOsUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18312,_binary '\0','/g4y7CTD1nc3quJ7JVZ50euOW8oC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363668',7.6,1910,'en','Heat Vision and Jack','As the result of a NASA miscalculation, Astronaut Jack Austin flew too close to the sun, the rays expanding his mind and making him the smartest man on the planet. Now he and his talking motorcycle (who contains the mind of his former roommate) are on the run from NASA and their assassin, actor Ron Silver who want to take his brain. They travel from place to place solving paranormal mysteries with the help of Jack\'s newfound ability to become a super genius when his brain absorbs sunlight.','/hhy3UIunQbUlpSZQXSbDUc9ca8U.jpg','1999-01-10',30,'Released',NULL,'Heat Vision and Jack',184500,1.8888,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18313,_binary '\0','/1zJuMR5q3K82HaEZi8vSE9VL3zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363728',5.9,1364,'en','Just Desserts','Marco Poloni\'s family owns a bakery in the Bronx and it seems that they have fallen on hard times and his family is considering selling the bakery. Marco then decides to enter a baking competition hoping that the money and publicity will help them. But he needs a partner, so her asks Grace Carpenter, the baker of restaurant, but unfortunately they started off on the wrong foot, but she agrees. So they go to the competition and things seem to be looking good except for a few complications. One of the other contestant Jacques du Jacques is Marco\'s former classmate at the Academy, whom he says betrayed him. Emil, one of the judges, is Marco\'s former instructor at the Academy whom he did not leave a good impression on. And Marco\'s temper. So will they be able to pull it off. And at the same time Marco finds himself attracted to her but she already has a boyfriend.','/wpQjwZsPaDp6hUUMY2u6eesPJvf.jpg','2004-01-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Just Desserts',40635,1.2649,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18314,_binary '\0','/zNxTeN8piRxAlR7Dg06Z2xanyPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363768',6.4,1438,'en','Lightning Bug','In this drama thriller set in the South, a young boy named Green (Bret Harrison) longs to escape his unhappy life but feels trapped in his hometown. A gifted special-effects makeup artist, Green has big dreams of working in Hollywood. But the boy\'s personal demons -- a drunken, abusive stepfather, a group of religious zealots out to destroy his work and the love of a girl who prefers small-town life -- may stand in the way of his dreams.','/mWoLLZJOmkingXZDdNZTa97w5eL.jpg','2004-04-09',97,'Released','There are monsters standing in his way.','Lightning Bug',33459,1.4989,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18315,_binary '\0','/tuDhEdza074bA497bO9WFEPs6O6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363771',6.9,462310,'en','The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe','Four kids travel through a wardrobe to the land of Narnia and learn of their destiny to free it with the guidance of a mystical lion.','/iREd0rNCjYdf5Ar0vfaW32yrkm.jpg','2005-12-07',143,'Released','The beloved masterpiece comes to life.','The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe',411,30.4302,7.145,'3mKPrxjwF7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18316,_binary '\0','/r92sUtYxfGTv1tAmqUwRQ0uhOGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363780',6.8,14809,'en','Lymelife','A coming of age dramedy where infidelity, real estate, and Lyme disease have two families falling apart on Long Island in the early eighties. Scott, 15, is at the point in his life when he finds out that the most important people around him, his father, his mother, and his brother, are not exactly who he thought they were. They are flawed and they are human.','/jLo39N9UuiRJlL3cRytkM7BzZK5.jpg','2008-09-08',95,'Released','The American Dream Sucks','Lymelife',22152,3.2611,6.1,'qRckkaOLaRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18317,_binary '\0','/zprxl5QxWT1je6Cu13xRxc2Bmlh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363852',4.9,2890,'tr','O Şimdi Asker','When the devastating Kocaeli earthquake occurs, the Turkish government passes a special law allowing people to complete their military service in a month.','/2JgcEqfGE0yj0yQOzw1iufOg6yf.jpg','2003-03-27',145,'Released',NULL,'He\'s in the Army Now',447073,0.9201,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18318,_binary '\0','/dBSYDUZpps3LWru7ofUZAYoFgUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0363988',6.5,223641,'en','Secret Window','Mort Rainey, a writer just emerging from a painful divorce with his ex-wife, is stalked at his remote lake house by a psychotic stranger and would-be scribe who claims Rainey swiped his best story idea. But as Rainey endeavors to prove his innocence, he begins to question his own sanity.','/hvzw4wufKZkDCTPVeG71Z7pGfZh.jpg','2004-03-12',96,'Released','The most important part of a story is the ending.','Secret Window',1586,8.5651,6.563,'QboGT3v7c5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18319,_binary '\0','/7IciAaJltRsOohcz2JlkupIF1s9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364045',6.2,101660,'en','Taking Lives','Recruited to assist Montreal police in their desperate search for a serial killer who assumes the identities of his victims, FBI profiler Illeana Scott knows it\'s only a matter of time before the killer strikes again. Her most promising lead is a museum employee who might be the killer\'s only eyewitness.','/zeFGOS1kj0CxuZjGhtK3WlMCYsa.jpg','2004-03-19',103,'Released','He would kill to be you.','Taking Lives',11081,7.5346,6.369,'Uj85gr6R1as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18320,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364079',6.3,1220,'en','Trekkies 2','Denise Crosby takes another look at the huge fans of \"Star Trek\" and how the series from around the world has affected and shaped their lives.','/s7hgTHxoXjk8EV5hO8zxDupXewr.jpg','2004-04-20',93,'Released','How much is too much?','Trekkies 2',24703,1.4621,6.5,'YHTh8WEhGF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18321,_binary '\0','/5Je5W2w1AtehkR1VZJGXsAyqWof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364093',6.5,2284,'pt','Um Filme Falado','A meditation on civilization. July, 2001: friends wave as a cruise ship departs Lisbon for Mediterranean ports and the Indian Ocean. On board and on day trips in Marseilles, Pompeii, Athens, Istanbul, and Cairo, a professor tells her young daughter about myth, history, religion, and wars. Men approach her; she\'s cool, on her way to her husband in Bombay. After Cairo, for two evenings divided by a stop in Aden, the captain charms three successful, famous (and childless) women, who talk with wit and intellect, each understanding the others\' native tongue, a European union. The captain asks mother and child to join them. He gives the girl a gift. Helena sings. Life can be sweet.','/kVEWev0owMP6IYV1Y1wjyv0CkZH.jpg','2003-08-31',96,'Released',NULL,'A Talking Picture',95536,2.0049,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18322,_binary '\0','/1LxOCpRitEaUSaGURqlPyOSgqG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364303',6.6,1576,'hi','देव','Joint Commissioner of Police Dev Pratap Singh, a duty-bound, self-righteous officer, and Special Commissioner Tejinder Khosla, the balancing force between the political interests of Chief Minister Bhandarker and Dev\'s commitment to the law, are lifelong friends, each with his own ideals. Farhaan, a law graduate, was brought up with ideals of non-violence and patriotism. Dev unwittingly gives Farhaan the wound that plunges him into rage and violence after witnessing the death of his father during a peace demonstration. Taking advantage of the situation, corrupt politician Latif sets the vulnerable young man on a path of violence and destruction that threatens to ignite the city. Aalyn is the light in Farhaan\'s life. Beautiful and innocent, the young woman also gets caught in extraordinary circumstances that transform her life and she dares to stand up for the truth.','/hZrDic5d9lpPKY5SQrZcGfhsrq4.jpg','2004-06-11',176,'Released','He choose to walk the razor\'s edge...','Dev',136527,2.4886,6.421,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18323,_binary '\0','/nGjquGZjmS3tlfXCKTHOrtDJwOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364343',6.1,36165,'en','The Final Cut','Set in a world with memory implants, Alan Hakman is a \'cutter\'—someone with the power of final edit over people\'s recorded histories—but his latest assignment puts him in great danger.','/btgoWLl4vp6tN8RqYaXhEvV0pU9.jpg','2004-10-15',95,'Released','In the end, he sees everything.','The Final Cut',11099,4.844,6.1,'EM5MzCAZ3OY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18324,_binary '\0','/wJO9uBYIPQ8lIeb0qeRu3LgSEVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364376',3.4,5467,'en','The Gingerdead Man','An evil yet adorable Gingerbread man comes to life with the soul of a convicted killer, and this real life cookie monster wreaks havoc on the girl who sent the killer to the electric chair.','/tZgIllFk4ncvhuzNipLkStjPjqk.jpg','2005-11-08',70,'Released','Evil never tasted so good...','The Gingerdead Man',27296,1.8393,3.9,'mLFVY41RmtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18325,_binary '\0','/jNGVlbH2tnZmVqEIvuoxvV78vBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364385',6.7,52875,'ja','呪怨','When a social worker is sent to check on a traumatized elderly woman whose family have moved in at the site of a notorious murder case, she unwittingly unleashes a cycle of terror that transmits via its victims.','/6q1hlBC6rudc3mHwXsbMBR2xAT6.jpg','2002-10-18',92,'Released','When a grudge from the dead passes to the living, who is safe?','Ju-on: The Grudge',11838,7.0781,6.756,'AmjiUxnZBpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18326,_binary '\0','/2ae9oj1XDQPPyfO0luvL1HufUhk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364447',6,1427,'ko','조폭 마누라 2: 돌아온 전설','Former Scissor Gang leader Eun-jin, who now suffers from amnesia, nevertheless defends Jae-cheol, a restaurateur who employs her, from a gangster who wants his business.','/nS3nSiaHzM6fc7yT8Yu7vThNnl9.jpg','2003-09-05',110,'Released','Return of the Godmother.','My Wife is a Gangster 2',21708,1.9248,5.8,'Jd_xrelBteM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18327,_binary '\0','/lB6gUTrssAP78BjZF4g5IjZXW4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364457',4.7,1881,'en','The Keeper','When an apparently exemplary cop abducts and secretly imprisons a beautiful dancer, a deadly battle of wills between captor and captive ensues.','/g3XWVNbVLk8fcbZdKWKXVsOzWXm.jpg','2004-05-14',95,'Released',NULL,'The Keeper',40990,2.0094,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18328,_binary '\0','/bwbTBi7QmHDGuI7A51B16IoCqpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364517',7.5,74656,'fr','Jeux d\'enfants','As adults, best friends Julien and Sophie continue the odd game they started as children -- a fearless competition to outdo one another with daring and outrageous stunts. While they often act out to relieve one another\'s pain, their game might be a way to avoid the fact that they are truly meant for one another.','/vvjC5LSMANKvGGDHjIWj1YomPdN.jpg','2003-09-17',93,'Released','When is love a game, and when is it not?','Love Me If You Dare',8424,4.4226,7.219,'5buvvd5z7Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18329,_binary '\0','/yok0SVqNpXaSMsUU7iWvHfyYI4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364556',6.8,1919,'en','Neo Ned','Like most kids, Ned idolized his father and dreamed of following in his footsteps. Unfortunately, his father was a two-bit crook who spent most of his life in jail. Without a family of his own, Ned falls in with the Aryan Brotherhood. Soon after, Ned is placed in a mental hospital where he is mesmerized by a young black girl who believes Adolf Hitler was reincarnated in her.','/vRFsPvQTfHjEII4FwMFDSkdVHJP.jpg','2005-04-22',97,'Released','Love is not a race.','Neo Ned',91795,1.6305,6.2,'N9WnW1RAE1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18330,_binary '\0','/rwf5SUTiEsmfkXAgy15R0UtJUtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364569',8.3,732259,'ko','올드보이','With no clue how he came to be imprisoned, drugged and tortured for 15 years, a desperate man seeks revenge on his captors.','/pWDtjs568ZfOTMbURQBYuT4Qxka.jpg','2003-11-21',120,'Released','15 years of imprisonment, five days of vengeance.','Oldboy',670,19.939,8.234,'tAaBkFChaRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18331,_binary '\0','/41sz0UWmL7zzYtlUsi24GzaT7AQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364571',6.9,1655,'ta','ஒன்ஸ் மோர்','Vijay, a guy with a careless attitude, gets Selvam, a senior home inmate, to act as his dad for an important business deal. Gradually, both help each other through their own experiences and problems.','/4CrcRVrYb4EIB4zoZ96WX5Cur7O.jpg','1997-07-04',161,'Released',NULL,'Once More',261844,0.956,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18332,_binary '\0','/g3U85CIpRjxWJCsh821wRg5g9gu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364616',3.6,1262,'en','Clawed: The Legend of Sasquatch','When a group of poachers is found mauled to death in the woods of the Pacific Northwest -- mirroring a grisly slaying that happened years ago, known as the \"Echo Mountain Massacre\" -- angry locals are convinced that the infamous Sasquatch is to blame. But that doesn\'t stop four passionate high school students from making a plea to spare the creature\'s life.','/AwcAauBu0eOxsbhi0VCwJBVrELP.jpg','2005-04-14',85,'Released','Some Legends Never Die.','Clawed: The Legend of Sasquatch',55449,1.8494,4.9,'R95HYnur-ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18333,_binary '\0','/rY829BVghNTf6E8nf1j5upsEaJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364621',4.8,2760,'hi','कयामत','CBI Officer Akram Sheikh is on the verge of nabbing three dreaded Pakistan-backed arms dealers, the brothers Ali and Abbas and their common moll Laila. When Sheikh busts an important arms deal conducted by his three targets, Ali-Abbas join forces with Gopal, a corrupt scientist to get hold of a deadly virus and take the tourists at the Elphinstone Jail resort as hostage. Akram Sheikh is now compelled to get help from Rachit, a criminal serving jail time who was a former associate of Ali-Abbas and the only person in history to have successfully escaped the Elphinstone jail . Along with a commando team, they try to pull off a rescue attempt by breaking in the jail and rescuing the hostages.','/6m1X6pzhX2bFE6zcueymzyGgsEP.jpg','2003-07-11',157,'Released',NULL,'Qayamat: City Under Threat',318484,0.1258,5.016,'BpRh2GsORN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18334,_binary '\0','/9bFOkZPI0Qf2rCKqc83ugJZuCwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364647',8.4,9879,'ta','விருமாண்டி','Angela, a civil advocate interviewing inmates at the Madras Central Prison for a documentary on the death penalty meets Virumaandi and Kothaala, who are sentenced to death and life respectively for their roles in perpetrating the massacre of 24 people during a brutal clash between feuding villages. As tensions mount within the prison walls, she listens to their conflicting accounts of the same story.','/iV24YxRf7JohgzhK7jw9CpSNFaX.jpg','2004-01-14',175,'Released','An ode to humanity','Virumaandi',66340,1.6392,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18335,_binary '\0','/1nL5TJrldKI4rIj16tZTdqpdYL3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364725',6.7,289236,'en','DodgeBall: A True Underdog Story','When megalomaniacal White Goodman, the owner of a trendy, high-end fitness center, makes a move to take over the struggling local gym run by happy-go-lucky Pete La Fleur, there\'s only one way for La Fleur to fight back: dodgeball. Aided by a dodgeball guru and Goodman\'s attorney, La Fleur and his rag-tag team of underdogs launch a knock-down, drag-out battle in which the winner takes all.','/r8KbNHkkwFXLjV1suGwm0Qjure5.jpg','2004-06-18',92,'Released','Grab life by the ball.','DodgeBall: A True Underdog Story',9472,11.6301,6.369,'j5unqrzdF5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18336,_binary '\0','/kLGiMImvMHJoOOrEGY0Lk6QrUAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364745',5.6,1416,'en','Whirlygirl','After a run in with a hot exotic dancer one wintry night straight-laced prep school student James will find himself on the ride of his life. Risking his future he follows this mysterious woman to New York City - ditching school dodging cops and partying at hot nightclubs along the way.','/ohnbKEWnIOTglQ1kimthX3F26rR.jpg','2006-05-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Whirlygirl',17236,2.0791,5.4,'nsK5fz6fp2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18337,_binary '\0','/vEEEKiUJOXmOJXW7X8P3kCgsm9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364751',5.9,54849,'en','Without a Paddle','Three friends, whose lives have been drifting apart, reunite for the funeral of a fourth childhood friend. When looking through their childhood belongings, they discover a trunk which contained details on a quest their friend was attempting. It revealed that he was hot on the trail of the $200,000 that went missing with airplane hijacker D.B. Cooper in 1971. They decide to continue his journey, but do not understand the dangers they will soon encounter.','/bSQBfHDzyfzxrCLepjegVb5F8j8.jpg','2004-08-20',95,'Released','The call of the wild. The thrill of adventure. The mistake of a lifetime.','Without a Paddle',10762,5.5528,5.7,'CutKiSmYBIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18338,_binary '\0','/dEBx1cg8jUgi4N3Wb1snfyH9qAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364930',7.1,7316,'en','Aileen: Life and Death of a Serial Killer','British documentarian Nick Broomfield creates a follow-up piece to his 1992 documentary of the serial killer Aileen Wuornos, a highway prostitute who was convicted of killing six men in Florida between 1989 and 1990. Interviewing an increasingly mentally unstable Wuornos, Broomfield captures the distorted mind of a murderer whom the state of Florida deems of sound mind -- and therefore fit to execute. Throughout the film, Broomfield includes footage of his testimony at Wuornos\' trial.','/6MJpX3xlQicN2zIBhPsjpyyIWH.jpg','2003-11-21',89,'Released','The 2002 Interviews.','Aileen: Life and Death of a Serial Killer',37088,2.4599,6.7,'rExhihAZGxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18339,_binary '\0','/yDgMI5clt1rQwvsdcM16UJ5yz3j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364955',6.3,18438,'en','Art School Confidential','Starting from childhood attempts at illustration, the protagonist pursues his true obsession to art school. But as he learns how the art world really works, he finds that he must adapt his vision to the reality that confronts him.','/eV6UL22Zlpsq5XybUupWh0rBOp0.jpg','2006-05-05',102,'Released','Who said anything about talent?','Art School Confidential',9786,5.484,6.1,'IEp9pGNW6PA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18340,_binary '\0','/mhMBrMEzG7eMVmOeBSmZUjH5Yu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364961',6.9,26614,'en','The Assassination of Richard Nixon','It’s 1974 and Sam Bicke has lost everything. His wife leaves him with his three kids, his boss fires him, his brother turns away from him, and the bank won’t give him any money to start anew. He tries to find someone to blame for his misfortunes and comes up with the President of the United States who he plans to murder.','/5jOOvAVvP0XtwC5yYQpQCy4cjq1.jpg','2004-05-17',95,'Released','The mad story of a true man.','The Assassination of Richard Nixon',842,3.9144,6.5,'oHO6MlSu7_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18341,_binary '\0','/AjDyXDvk4VOtDp9aLJpAnBx1uyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364970',5.5,101297,'en','Babylon A.D.','A veteran-turned-mercenary is hired to take a young woman with a secret from post-apocalyptic Eastern Europe to New York City.','/bQqb3T0FIHOvgozzX9aygmWUbLZ.jpg','2008-08-20',101,'Released','Kill or be Killed.','Babylon A.D.',9381,6.5911,5.7,'_wW9pYbRkjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18342,_binary '\0','/c7PRkkUk71uL0SGL9qFNNfh30bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0364986',1.9,8368,'en','Ben & Arthur','A pair of recently married gay men are threatened by one of the partners\' brother, a religious fanatic who plots to murder them after being ostracized by his church.','/6fVVmRBM7baWubsETorSwHChveV.jpg','2002-09-09',85,'Released','Love calms the soul... and so does revenge.','Ben & Arthur',31130,1.2215,2.5,'sg-FZdhu8oI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18343,_binary '\0','/eqIq2AdKcoFctoPbQeqHdZvdNN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365020',6.5,1377,'en','Everyday People','The closing of a local restaurant concerns a number of employees who\'ve dedicated their lives to the eatery','/cIqt9Wy2EpyJI6sBlDQ4lZmFlje.jpg','2004-01-18',91,'Released','You can\'t wash out all the color and keep the flavor.','Everyday People',41851,1.9132,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18344,_binary '\0','/4w4pZKvkh5OFzliAJTlJ5c1zbL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365043',5.3,3510,'en','The Challenge','Estranged twins Lizzie and Shane are chosen for a Survivor-like popular game show with college scholarships as the prize.','/qrOwyD2mHc3bbHt0nZ220NgrWJ6.jpg','2003-05-03',90,'Released','Rival Sisters. Challenge of a Lifetime. Let the Games Begin!','The Challenge',44899,2.0167,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18345,_binary '\0','/2xTQ0djQw6e6SUKTigPFNWLh5f3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365089',7.3,6203,'sr','Сиви камион црвене боје','Belgrade, the summer of 1991. Yugoslavia is falling apart. Gavran can\'t get a driving licence because he is color blind. He is a rural Bosnian introvert obsessed with trucks. So, as soon as he is released from prison, he steals a truck to go on a joyride. Suzana, a city girl, discovers she is pregnant, but until she\'s due for an abortion, she decides to go to Dubrovnik. She hitchikes and Gavran almost runs her over. She is unhurt, but she blackmails him to take her to Dubrovnik. Two people from different worlds, equally removed from the real one. For him she is the first woman he can talk to; for her he is just another idiot to add to the long list of them that she has so far compiled. But the pressure of danger and the intimations of war force them together. The world about them has become so absurd that they seem to each other the only sober people left.','/eGJaWVzJY2k60a7kNSkw1iFVlmA.jpg','2004-08-11',95,'Released',NULL,'The Red Colored Grey Truck',109587,1.0651,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18346,_binary '\0','/rtdGOcCW1vJYxk6uxk2VUV4Z0Q3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365109',7.4,3311,'en','Deep Blue','Deep Blue is a major documentary feature film shot by the BBC Natural History Unit. An epic cinematic rollercoaster ride for all ages, Deep Blue uses amazing footage to tell us the story of our oceans and the life they support.','/lzKirFeKspU0PktaX5BfdhSofcT.jpg','2003-05-18',83,'Released',NULL,'Deep Blue',11019,4.4059,6.885,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18347,_binary '\0','/6njeLorayAYvVxmBeOep1RMlDCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365125',5.1,14310,'en','A Dirty Shame','Sylvia Stickles runs a convenience store with her husband and mother-in-law. One day, Sylvia is hit on the head and transforms from an uptight prude to a sex-crazed lunatic. As she goes on a rampage through town, Sylvia attracts the attention of Ray Ray, a sexual healer and tow truck driver in search of the world\'s greatest orgasm. Their sexual revolution, however, causes a class war in their tiny Baltimore community.','/10QtswgtDo8IBfFHz4J6WAyVSbN.jpg','2004-09-24',89,'Released','Threatening the very limits of common decency.','A Dirty Shame',13702,4.7265,5.4,'ZAIR3f6k6ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18348,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365130',7.6,2095,'en','Doc Martin','Doc Martin tells the tale of Martin Clunes\' character in the film, in the months leading up to the Saving Grace story. Martin Bamford is a heart-broken London obstetrician, in a jealous rage after he finds out that his wife has been sleeping with three of his buddies. He escapes to a small Cornish fishing village, which he grows surprisingly attached to, and is extremely reluctant to return with his cheating wife when she comes to pick him up. Although he has only been looking for a week\'s R & R, Dr Bamford stumbles across a network of secrets in the village of Port Isaac, and finds himself embroiled in the most exciting scandal the village has seen for centuries.','/hbYfsUpaa1uDho1aPxOd01riFd1.jpg','2001-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Doc Martin',76474,1.5403,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18349,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365135',7.3,1357,'en','Double Dare','With being thrown off buildings an occupational hazard, professional stuntwomen Jeannie Epper and Zoë Bell (the alter egos of Wonder Woman and Xena, respectively) would seem well-equipped for any challenges Hollywood might dish out. But finding roles -- and respect -- in a male-dominated field can prove more harrowing than dodging punches.','/g1o0DIK6vCuNwrgmvOlwrZG0OZq.jpg','2004-03-13',81,'Released','SAVING THE FILM INDUSTRY ONE ACTRESS AT A TIME','Double Dare',19416,1.7971,6.5,'Bd8Zl3YtZso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18350,_binary '\0','/smw2RZ8MwTOwncMWFWr9exoVrnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365149',5.9,3549,'en','Eddie\'s Million Dollar Cook Off','Junior high school student Eddie Ogden is an aspiring baseball player, but what he truly loves is cooking. Although he receives plenty of athletic encouragement from his father, who also serves as his team\'s coach, Eddie can\'t resist pursuing his culinary skills, and this decision ends up interfering with baseball. Despite the disappointment expressed by his father and friends, Eddie presses on with his cooking and enters a high-profile competition.','/fNNTa8Gw38S4O4wxQ9Wbtu1EuHU.jpg','2003-07-18',85,'Released','Winning never tasted so good.','Eddie\'s Million Dollar Cook Off',124097,3.4409,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18351,_binary '\0','/gugMbmic9XHhMnQyWx9JZMaBth6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365190',6.6,3300,'fr','Feux rouges','A cross-country trip turns out to be a nightmare for a troubled couple.','/68FX0iIQVqtRotg4RqxTYTEZNN4.jpg','2004-03-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Red Lights',25500,1.504,5.6,'hwEcwJ8BcNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18352,_binary '\0','/6WiX5YHelMF0ci2S1xXsiAQ9Jsu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365265',5.8,12670,'en','Ginger Snaps Back: The Beginning','Set in 19th Century Canada, Brigitte and her sister Ginger take refuge in a Traders\' Fort which later becomes under siege by some savage werewolves. But when one of the girls is bitten, they have no one to turn to but themselves.','/tQ17krYhctcHnnslqq90zzGkhg7.jpg','2004-07-10',95,'Released','Evil Rises.','Ginger Snaps Back: The Beginning',12583,3.5473,6.113,'clmJQwTJ5fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18353,_binary '\0','/76H7IcoLjN1WR3ENYUijomJu854.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365270',4.5,8395,'en','Wild Things 2','Two Florida high school vixens hatch a murderous plan to win an inheritance, but they hadn\'t bargained for an escalating whirlpool of blackmail and sexual games with a sleazy insurance investigator who has his own plans for the money.','/3aoRiK4Q36kS4kYWWeF1CG4HhZr.jpg','2004-02-19',95,'Released','You\'ll never guess what\'s beneath the surface.','Wild Things 2',10367,4.9991,5.2,'-CIF82f1QgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18354,_binary '\0','/327ezUILPLcQ2tuaDyWaEG09GJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365289',6.3,2145,'nl','Grimm','One cold winter\'s day, Jacob and his sister Marie are abandoned in a wood by their out of work father. In his jacket Jacob finds a letter from their mother urging them to go to her brother in Spain. Once in Spain, it turns out that their uncle is dead. Marie meets Diego, a wealthy charming Spanish surgeon, and falls in love with him. Diego lives with his sick, domineering sister, Teresa. To Jacob\'s astonishment, Marie wants to marry Diego. Even after the wedding has taken place, jealous Jacob tries to get his sister away from Diego. When this doesn\'t succeed, Jacob starts to provoke his brother-in-law. It soon transpires that no one will go unpunished for this.','/sQqsGLGjQFMR9lHlQDJyjPMih6Y.jpg','2003-10-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Grimm',50387,1.2015,5.744,'1T9NB0gJC-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18355,_binary '\0','/fSaoBP4x9qapyEcsY8NiWOEZpOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365296',6.7,1304,'en','Hair High','Rod and Cherri are the unmistakable king and queen of Echo High. When new kid Spud arrives, he makes a faux pas so bad that Rod forces him to be his girl\'s slave. What unfolds is the tale of Cherri and Spud\'s blossoming relationship behind Rod\'s back, and their untimely demise on the night of the prom. A tale of tragedy that could only be as irreverent and sensational through the pen (or pencils, if you will) of Bill Plympton.','/3FhSXe000gBExEjg89Tex0jofVd.jpg','2004-04-17',78,'Released',NULL,'Hair High',27300,2.1604,6.4,'UcqM104xh9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18356,_binary '\0','/syKbZiHVdXw0NcH6NdXWEKZaECv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365376',7.1,75240,'ko','장화, 홍련','Two sisters return home after a stay in a mental institution, only to face disturbing events and a strained relationship with their stepmother. As eerie occurrences unfold, dark family secrets begin to surface, blurring the line between reality and nightmare.','/l3exwhwyGE0NnHJ3lFQ7eXoBSkH.jpg','2003-06-13',115,'Released','Our sorrow was conceived long before our birth.','A Tale of Two Sisters',4552,7.477,7.109,'Ln0gWJE7SAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18357,_binary '\0','/a1GkCNdgI9GWMzHMdSMbcYy3Kth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365478',5.4,5919,'en','Man with the Screaming Brain','The brains of a Russian taxi driver and a wealthy businessman are brought together in one body by a mad scientist.','/uWmtvO8DTFnD62br6cAJ3ZX76jz.jpg','2005-04-03',90,'Released','He\'s losing their minds','Man with the Screaming Brain',2151,1.9317,5.1,'6hk6-wkfptc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18358,_binary '\0','/mFCoNOMNRN3F1FVWOUyHnyk2q57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365480',4.5,1344,'en','Marie and Bruce','A day in the life of a couple trapped in a sadomasochistic relationship. When Marie decides to break up with Bruce, their conversation devolves into a torrent of foul-mouthed rippings and ferociously humorous musings on their marriage, love, hate and committment.','/xSPFLzTc63ncvyvJ0JsKnGkyDyU.jpg','2004-01-19',90,'Released','A surreal story of two people','Marie and Bruce',25903,1.3826,4.4,'CmSf-460YQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18359,_binary '\0','/jBxIfffFWY69oAx6CLQtKZ3xtYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365485',6.7,48058,'en','The Matador','The life of Danny Wright, a salesman forever on the road, veers into dangerous and surreal territory when he wanders into a Mexican bar and meets a mysterious stranger, Julian, who\'s very likely a hit man. Their meeting sets off a chain of events that will change their lives forever, as Wright is suddenly thrust into a far-from-mundane existence that he takes to surprisingly well … once he gets acclimated to it.','/oJnlAGmrhsg4QrlVKGgP91J6WPu.jpg','2005-05-12',97,'Released','A hitman and a salesman walk into a bar...','The Matador',9515,4.1972,6.309,'k3qUl2i9lVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18360,_binary '\0','/s5PmaZuvj7vajfavnNhQazHnovc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365513',5.6,5638,'en','Monster Man','Two guys and a female hitchhiker are terrorized by a monstrous looking man driving a giant monster truck.','/iFCta7mFC7aVTPMA3opH8Vq62Pn.jpg','2003-07-30',95,'Released','On this highway the roadkill... is human!','Monster Man',1693,1.8458,6.1,'JKQbMDg_1wQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18361,_binary '\0','/oCMqNtCtQkhWiwHmSAOWDd5lXMG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365514',6.2,2170,'ja','ムーンチャイルド','Moon Child follows a group of childhood friends as they advance in a futuristic criminal underworld. Sho feels he is doomed to walk in his idol Kei\'s footsteps as a vampire with the gift of eternal life and the curse of blood thirst. Over time, their tight friendship becomes corrupted because of their rivalry and love for the same woman.','/yMwIUlkROihOj4KgyhxtbPRQyeY.jpg','2003-04-19',120,'Released',NULL,'Moon Child',21513,1.1618,5.8,'PEHHXf45bys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18362,_binary '\0','/ljTYcQ3pkzYF52Z8ev1Z1UThnPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365545',6.4,10479,'en','Nappily Ever After','After an accident at the hair salon, Violet realizes she\'s not living life to the fullest. A soulful barber helps her put the pieces back together.','/lxXsGqxUwSxypffv8hn3r332jf4.jpg','2018-09-21',100,'Released','Let yourself grow','Nappily Ever After',519035,2.873,7.202,'e-pMVkg7wHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18363,_binary '\0','/bFvxBAUNZsnC9q4pSVE0pWSxkmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365653',3.4,2092,'en','Dinocroc','After an African dinosaur ancestor of the crocodile is found, Dr. Campbell uses its DNA to create prototypes at Paula Kennedy\'s Gereco lab.','/8Q3qe9yg0lEzsljgknyES8pVHIu.jpg','2004-04-20',86,'Released','It feeds on fear.','Dinocroc',4289,2.517,4,'F2LewVc8a6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18364,_binary '\0','/A20D83vGtFGF47rYF4TjHEw06Dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365675',6.3,13771,'de','Der rote Baron','Richthofen goes off to war like thousands of other men. As fighter pilots, they become cult heroes for the soldiers on the battlefields. Marked by sportsmanlike conduct, technical exactitude and knightly propriety, they have their own code of honour. Before long he begins to understand that his hero status is deceptive. His love for Kate, a nurse, opens his eyes to the brutality of war.','/lUuryram6Aoa11dCgoXohR8avjU.jpg','2008-03-29',106,'Released','Heroes rise. Empires fall. Legends endure.','The Red Baron',8349,4.596,6.7,'vhL7vb6xUhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18365,_binary '\0','/z97nIAAEPD0CFZvOnwoTheoKqEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365677',4.2,3219,'en','Red Water','In the quiet waters of the Mississippi, body parts are being discovered. No one knows what is behind it all, until a huge man eating bull shark turns up. This bull shark is different, as it can breath in fresh water, making a deadly encounter between anyone who comes before it. John Sanders must now try and reach the surface, with his ex-wife and whilst being held hostage.','/lK45kc6m6wbRRFsh5nKXsNTh82C.jpg','2003-08-17',92,'Released','Fear strikes where you least expect it.','Red Water',22450,2.437,4.1,'_0V35RtSrOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18366,_binary '\0','/9mQYX1AXNJsD9WcDrDQeDPMNq0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365686',6.3,109851,'en','Revolver','Hotshot gambler Jake Green is long on bravado and seriously short of common sense. Rarely is he allowed in any casino because he\'s a bona fide winner and, in fact, has taken so much money over the years that he\'s the sole client of his accountant elder brother, Billy. Invited to a private game, Jake is in fear of losing his life.','/cXJYFEIGNxiNTCekP1A68ICzJen.jpg','2005-09-11',111,'Released','Your mind will not accept a game this big.','Revolver',10851,5.8115,6.4,'DNXtExBM-KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18367,_binary '\0','/xSUsz5n5qtR9yEwmRxEmYvMLN7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365737',6.8,139202,'en','Syriana','The Middle Eastern oil industry is the backdrop of this tense drama, which weaves together numerous story lines. Bennett Holiday is an American lawyer in charge of facilitating a dubious merger of oil companies, while Bryan Woodman, a Switzerland-based energy analyst, experiences both personal tragedy and opportunity during a visit with Arabian royalty. Meanwhile, veteran CIA agent Bob Barnes uncovers an assassination plot with unsettling origins.','/mO3hWUTOxmLJxihvDU0YFkb0Mb5.jpg','2005-11-23',128,'Released','Everything is connected.','Syriana',231,5.532,6.42,'FmMKoLho9fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18368,_binary '\0','/wb34q3VgzHgL8frVMywrN3wXmqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365748',7.8,644758,'en','Shaun of the Dead','Shaun lives a supremely uneventful life, which revolves around his girlfriend, his mother, and, above all, his local pub. This gentle routine is threatened when the dead return to life and make strenuous attempts to snack on ordinary Londoners.','/dgXPhzNJH8HFTBjXPB177yNx6RI.jpg','2004-04-09',99,'Released','A romantic comedy. With zombies.','Shaun of the Dead',747,16.6926,7.546,'_QuY93B2FS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18369,_binary '\0','/6d45CtdR02J9JoilQSwECPqgnf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365763',6.9,2762,'sv','Skenbart: en film om tåg','Christmas 1945. In a train from Stockholm to Berlin are a motley collection. It is the failure of the author Gunnar who wants to leave his old life and make a contribution in Berlin; physician Henry who plan to marry Marie and likewise Henry\'s current wife Karin, who he plans to kill during the journey, the middle-aged gay couple Pompe and Sixten, a soldier going to Uppsala but is on the wrong train: the cheerful and cynical old Margaret, and a dressed elf and a surly conductor. With the train are also a number of Baltic refugees accompanied by two nuns to be sent to Germany.','/fYr2mCTp7ynjMjqQshvO0hQtoXt.jpg','2003-12-25',100,'Released','Nothing is necessarily what it seems...','Illusive Tracks',12608,1.4046,6.1,'pI6r7xpesl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18370,_binary '\0','/w2oqAVl5CJqasfwlFELYFxgtDzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365810',6.6,2161,'no','Ammrika','Anna lives with her father Karl someplace in the outskirts of northern Norway. Karl killed his ex-wife and threw her newborn coloured child into the sea when he discovered that she obviously had been unfaithful. Now Karl is being haunted by her ghost and is developing a serious drinking problem. Anna is looking for the love of her life, but there aren\'t many bachelors around - until they discovers another small family on the other side of the mountain. They meet a semi-alcoholized widow on Karl\'s age, her son Peder, and her black adopted son, Ante, that arrived from the sea on a piece of wood.','/5WTIWpbsV5iWV34wuTJXQNCkCui.jpg','2003-04-11',87,'Released',NULL,'The Black Lapp',14190,1.4674,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18371,_binary '\0','/frWnQLBGB6ROzdK2aPCCLRnz24J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365830',6.8,120490,'en','Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny','In Venice Beach, naive Midwesterner JB bonds with local slacker KG and they form the rock band Tenacious D. Setting out to become the world\'s greatest band is no easy feat, so they set out to steal what could be the answer to their prayers... a magical guitar pick housed in a rock-and-roll museum some 300 miles away.','/8baHzEIfrBvBy5b9XKe87Skl1tf.jpg','2006-11-22',93,'Released','An epic quest. A magical guitar pick. A chance to put the D in Destiny.','Tenacious D in The Pick of Destiny',2179,7.4579,6.8,'vz6BkxJFZ5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18372,_binary '\0','/xChyWmjDeEH8zOVi9dwVrtIJEfd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365847',6.1,17446,'zh','神話','When a fellow scientist asks for Jack\'s help in locating the mausoleum of China\'s first emperor, the past collides violently with the present as Jack discovers his amazing visions are based in fact.','/iBDFnLkTZZxQlbb6IIeYkufnPCY.jpg','2005-05-11',118,'Released','An Unforgettable Journey Through Time Unearths A Hero For The Ages.','The Myth',11653,6.0809,6.4,'tcK1vl36dUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18373,_binary '\0','/bPkP368pQkRY3m89nP2nWYjIxRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365885',6.8,24154,'en','The Upside of Anger','After her husband runs off with his secretary, Terry Wolfmeyer is left to fend for herself -- and her four daughters. As she hits rock bottom, Terry finds a friend and drinking buddy in next-door neighbor Denny, a former baseball player. As the two grow closer, and her daughters increasingly rely on Denny, Terry starts to have reservations about where their relationship is headed.','/iS9lP4poDyvSGXyh199ZEXMPHrY.jpg','2005-03-11',118,'Released','Sometimes what tears us apart helps us put it back together.','The Upside of Anger',11354,5.1237,6.3,'2ZPPZv0q02s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18374,_binary '\0','/k23FPWl97XKpJ1oTaDyADzxWxs6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365907',6.5,132451,'en','A Walk Among the Tombstones','Private investigator Matthew Scudder is hired by a drug kingpin to find out who kidnapped and murdered his wife.','/euPgyPsiNFp6gOBB7nUFxvN5ZaY.jpg','2014-09-18',114,'Released','Some people are afraid of all the wrong things.','A Walk Among the Tombstones',169917,13.5504,6.3,'aTKBowDjMQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18375,_binary '\0','/18uabdgGRxX4bJr3i6Zon7EXGlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365929',5.5,42684,'en','Whiteout','The only U.S. Marshal assigned to Antarctica, Carrie Stetko will soon leave the harsh environment behind for good – in three days, the sun will set and the Amundsen-Scott Research Station will shut down for the long winter. When a body is discovered out on the open ice, Carrie\'s investigation into the continent\'s first homicide plunges her deep into a mystery that may cost her her own life.','/kkXXA3353MX60B8PRSkTGRabxXu.jpg','2009-09-09',101,'Released','See Your Last Breath','Whiteout',22787,6.1922,5.612,'GqxjF9qR5Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18376,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365938',6,1509,'en','Winter Solstice','A widower confronts his older son\'s decision to leave home and his younger son\'s self-destructive behavior.','/5TSYo4o1b1CHPvoQUPZGLpSqa7e.jpg','2004-01-29',90,'Released','The only way to find the future is to face the past.','Winter Solstice',52796,1.2869,6,'iToEmu2tBhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18377,_binary '\0','/1NSRfeWDoZXCLdgYrG1GvJj8JZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365957',4,28481,'en','You Got Served','At Mr. Rad\'s Warehouse, the best hip-hop crews in Los Angeles compete for money and respect. But when a suburban crew crashes the party, stealing their dancers — and their moves — two warring friends have to pull together to represent the street.','/nFwT3QisWFQa3Wlfnw1gC458xJn.jpg','2004-01-30',95,'Released','If you want respect, you\'ve got to take it.','You Got Served',14114,5.3039,6.386,'UqLHJoHTVJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18378,_binary '\0','/ahXtNFVHtFxvjphZN8QlHRVsu9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0365960',7.2,5903,'en','Zero Day','Two troubled adolescents chronicle the events that ultimately lead up to a terrifying assault on their school.','/xFmFNW8Am3QwS4vCpctWkleWbzj.jpg','2003-09-03',92,'Released','In high school, you\'re told you can do anything you put your mind to.','Zero Day',27090,3.8515,7.5,'LjeiTns-8a4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18379,_binary '\0','/5JuJmZw4kmX3ncwblFEhB3VJvlq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366137',6.9,3204,'es','El abrazo partido','In Buenos Aires, the twenty-something Jewish-Argentinean Ariel Makaroff ditches the University of Architecture and spends his time wandering through the downtown gallery where his mother has a lingerie shop and his brother runs an importation business. Ariel has never understood why his father left him when he was a baby, but when his dad returns to Argentina, that will soon change.','/kmXuxzMazRbivZFLSg9kaOxNGCc.jpg','2004-03-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Lost Embrace',49681,1.2536,6.6,'qHvys9ERRkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18380,_binary '\0','/k1XtfdHiBfdkf0p3olGIljGpA0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366174',4.8,38125,'en','Anacondas: The Hunt for the Blood Orchid','A scientific expedition sets out for Borneo to seek a flower called the Blood Orchid, which could grant extended life. Meanwhile, they run afoul of snakes and each other.','/apAZ6o1SyYgcC8R2LqTCYnBe1lK.jpg','2004-08-25',96,'Released','The hunters will become the hunted.','Anacondas: The Hunt for the Blood Orchid',11237,9.6014,5.5,'hVo9Gw9rJiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18381,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366180',6.1,1834,'te','స్టాలిన్','Stalin is deeply moved by the suicide of a girl with physical disabilities. As a result, he devises a formula of extending unconditional help to those who need it to establish peace. But things turn complicated in his life with the entry of Home Minister Muddu Krishnayya.','/qGrBPtRJHz3s1QpoVznTApdqNQR.jpg','2006-12-14',168,'Released',NULL,'Stalin',242911,1.398,5.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18382,_binary '\0','/z2nW9qeIYThKTyDll86v1A6Lwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366287',6.8,3318,'it','Caterina va in città','When her social-climbing father is relocated from a one-horse town to his native Rome, 12-year-old Caterina enrolls in his old school, finding herself adrift in an environment where eighth-graders form friendships based on social class and their parents\' political affiliations.','/20YWJFpf42UxcGUgXimyLrP6A5E.jpg','2003-10-24',105,'Released','Sometimes you just want to fit in... or not.','Caterina in the Big City',18503,1.9304,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18383,_binary '\0','/An28cWCkn3S9JPSFaf0FADFenUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366292',6.2,20992,'ja','着信アリ','People mysteriously start receiving voicemail messages from their future selves, in the form of the sound of them reacting to their own violent deaths, along with the exact date and time of their future death, listed on the message log. The plot thickens as the surviving characters pursue the answers to this mystery which could save their lives.','/8ujSEEePCVMyi7Mt1RQMXd6SWmy.jpg','2003-11-03',112,'Released','Death cannot be put on hold...','One Missed Call',9694,3.8013,6.2,'Qi2g9i015h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18384,_binary '\0','/ns2741hZmzZQDHH3DeK2fNmRNdJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366304',7.2,2228,'bn','চোখের বালি','A young woman is left to her own devices when her sickly husband dies. Based on the novel by Rabindranath Tagore.','/izErrnZhCWHOaDUjRnpbqW4gU63.jpg','2003-08-09',167,'Released','A Passion Play','Chokher Bali',185357,1.1823,7.528,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18385,_binary '\0','/gkMaZOMddfTDvHgIymjABIPwWR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366442',7.5,1231,'ar','في بيتنا رجل','Rebel Ibrahim Hamdy assassinates a pro-colonial Prime Minister but is arrested and hides with a fellow university student, who initially refuses but eventually accepts him. Abdul Hamid Khatib meets Samia and her cousin, and Ibrahim uses the situation to hasten Samia’s marriage, which she rejects. Nawal, the youngest daughter, becomes the liaison between Ibrahim and his colleagues, helping him escape. Abdul Hamid tries to inform the political police of Ibrahim’s location, but Samia stops him. The head of the political police suspects them and punishes them to find Ibrahim. Ibrahim refuses to leave the country, returning to fight colonialism and participating in an operation.','/jCWFwuSiumEXDpOBF36RzvCqS5N.jpg','1961-04-17',153,'Released',NULL,'A Man in Our House',280464,0.9743,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18386,_binary '\0','/2A9bL4Rtmq7wHyl4URF9ygv2fjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366450',5.5,5786,'en','Five Children and It','The Psammead is an \'it\', an ancient, ill-tempered sand-fairy with a spider-shaped body, bat-like ears, and snail-like eyes. It is grumpy but has the power to grant one wish a day, which must be made before sunset. Five siblings—Cyril, Anthea, Robert, Jane, and infant Hilary—encounter It and experience the highs and lows of frivolous wish-making.','/qjRlksMO0bDgWVMXqViSj1SNY2r.jpg','2004-10-15',88,'Released','You are invited to discover the secret...','Five Children and It',16791,4.4388,5.6,'moZugdUFBXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18387,_binary '\0','/inKlinj8casOIMINWBFXWLK46G7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366505',8.7,3980,'bn','গল্প হলেও সত্যি','In a family where relations have deteriorated to the worst level, even affecting professional lives, an outsider tries to rebuild the lost love and compassion.','/lhuI9lcPCg2zlhmrJI5vVjFe3fN.jpg','1966-10-13',104,'Released',NULL,'Galpo Holeo Satti',366061,0.9262,8.143,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18388,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366518',5.5,1645,'en','Breaking Dawn','Within the confines of an insane asylum languish many would-be seers and messiahs. Medical students meet them day in, day out. But when Eve meets Don Wake, she discovers he\'s not your run-of-the-mill paranoic. In fact, his visions of her life on the outside tread the line between fantasy and reality as a stalker becomes known to her. She could be in danger; it could all be in her head.','/nK89Nb7qHXEp1scxlJdoCywTdnw.jpg','2004-10-16',88,'Released','A mind is a terrible thing to lose.','Breaking Dawn',32707,1.4644,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18389,_binary '\0','/kRLox0vaEZfqXsuHhD3yXLlzWu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366526',6.4,5927,'ja','ゴジラ×モスラ×メカゴジラ／東京SOS','Mothra and her fairies return to Japan to warn mankind that they must return Kiryu to the sea, for the dead must not be disturbed. However Godzilla has survived to menace Japan leaving Kiryu as the nation\'s only defense.','/iwRJNFY9yvtPdu0DsTXOJ8sAap3.jpg','2003-12-13',91,'Released','No human being may touch the souls of the dead.','Godzilla: Tokyo S.O.S.',39469,2.9242,7.2,'KNrIPkAOsmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18390,_binary '\0','/5sJ7cH7RjKuEEFToM8Fwl2wNZSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366527',6.4,1814,'en','Goldfish Memory','A small group of friends experience relationships which grow and stumble, involving everything from straight, gay, lesbian, and bisexual relationships. The speed with which these relationships last leads to the Goldfish memory effect, the belief that a Goldfish only has a 3 second memory is a metaphor for the transient nature of the characters relationships.','/suAI6GzznyVrMpd3esgzOP906jI.jpg','2003-03-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Goldfish Memory',12802,1.6782,5.774,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18391,_binary '\0','/sVvsR3Y6KRAgi2uu3hvqCyL1AUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366532',7.3,5663,'fr','La grande séduction','A much-needed boost, in the form of a new factory, is promised to the residents of the tiny fishing village St. Marie-La-Mauderne, provided they can lure a doctor to take up full-time residency on the island. Inspired, the villagers devise a scheme to make Dr. Christopher Lewis a local.','/s81LmEGSec8XcUfRmlCYL1ZAjP4.jpg','2003-05-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Seducing Doctor Lewis',41277,1.6278,6.9,'WIC5CeiKQEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18392,_binary '\0','/eIxnorIDSgrTHYjkWilqBGTCvFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366544',5.6,1856,'es','Géminis','An incestuous love affair. Meme and Jeremias are the younger children in a typical bourgeois family. Their mother Lucia is the dominant force in the household, but her fixation on upholding the niceties of upper middle class life has prevented her from seeing what is going on under her roof. When the siblings’ older brother and his fiancee arrive home for their wedding, it seems inevitable that the concealment will be impossible to sustain. But equally it becomes apparent that if Lucia were to find out about the affair, there would be catastrophic consequences.','/6VzGSoaXJLNJkWLnkNABwB3CZEa.jpg','2005-06-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Gemini',30688,2.4733,5.4,'HJqlWf0i5e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18393,_binary '\0','/tKVXRDeQogwQuS4O09Na7WMlrGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366548',6.4,215981,'en','Happy Feet','Into the world of the Emperor Penguins, who find their soul mates through song, a penguin is born who cannot sing. But he can tap dance something fierce!','/zP4CK9O70P8GDilfTkPm4lrmaks.jpg','2006-11-16',108,'Released','Everybody dance now!','Happy Feet',9836,12.9123,6.232,'ThMZMdH3gVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18394,_binary '\0','/dzloVSv0FGM8fs4L5w9yV60p0PT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366551',7,216533,'en','Harold & Kumar Go to White Castle','Nerdy accountant Harold and his irrepressible friend, Kumar, get stoned watching television and find themselves utterly bewitched by a commercial for White Castle. Convinced there must be one nearby, the two set out on a late-night odyssey that takes them deep into New Jersey. Somehow, the boys manage to run afoul of rednecks, cops and even a car-stealing Neil Patrick Harris before getting anywhere near their beloved sliders.','/5vO7R4xYlDipTp8gzfRbWegO8eb.jpg','2004-07-02',88,'Released','Fast food. High times.','Harold & Kumar Go to White Castle',11282,8.5531,6.58,'cwP5E15VzRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18395,_binary '\0','/2xWjZoYH7RHgWGjZjTEjGk22n1O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366555',5.4,2173,'en','The Hazing','The Evil Dead meets Scream as an evil professor, through an ancient staff and a book of incantation, possesses the bodies of a group of fraterity and sorority pledges during a night of \"hazing\" activities in an abandoned mansion. When the students meet one grisly death after another, the survivors finally realize it\'s the professor who is possessing their friends and killing them all off. Now none of them trust each other-- is it their friends or puppets of the professor that they\'re hanging with? Somone better figure it out quick... or none of them will make it through the hellish night of The Hazing!','/uBHpAbskwe2GESonggBR7La9YEu.jpg','2004-03-06',87,'Released','Live Through This...','The Hazing',27619,1.6968,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18396,_binary '\0','/6sbkFrgjQTx1dvOANk3HmzfZcjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366581',6.1,1219,'ar','حب البنات','The story of three half-sisters who are united when their father dies and his will dictates they live together if they are to get their inheritance. The three sisters; the passionate Nada, the westernized Roqaya, and the tempered Ghada, have to work out their differences.','/b5Njqw4EPWMuyxm1tAGKuapE8uX.jpg','2004-01-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Girl\'s Love',137369,1.1041,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18397,_binary '\0','/bk8nJM3ko8Ag9Le6Q70LahCQYEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366596',4.6,1967,'fi','Hymypoika','Taavi,the enigmatic 18-year-old lead, has just inherited his long-deceased wealthy parents home and estate. It is high school graduation and Taavi\'s birthday, and after his fiends greet him au natural and are arrested, Taavi invites his friends to the mansion for a wild party. Taavi lives with a recording camera to his eye, a machine that allows his to keep interpersonal distance from everyone. Among his friends are Jere who considers himself a woman\'s man, Markus (who appears the well-adjusted one, and chubby, pierced Sami whose sexuality is ambiguous. The party gets wild, guests sleep around, and Taavi records it all!','/2LdUdayoATafbwCIEzeuqiuppdb.jpg','2003-10-24',108,'Released','Privacy is an illusion.','Young Gods',50988,0.7876,4.1,'eXyzl50w3iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18398,_binary '\0','/57YcKYbTFmtrEy498Nc23sncMoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366598',5.5,1220,'en','I Accuse','Kimberly Jansen is a single mother who lives in a small Canadian town. After cutting her hand at a party, she visits the hospital to seek what she assumes will be routine treatment. Instead, she falls victim to a predator in a white coat: Dr. Richard Darian, who drugs her and rapes her while she is asleep. Kimberly attempts to press charges, but the townsfolk and the local police, who regard her as a tramp and respect the doctor, dismiss her accusations.','/mGZPrMGSnoRJd8arXaSHJgLUQpb.jpg','2003-11-30',86,'Released','You Can Alter The Evidence, But Not The Truth.','I Accuse',73646,2.0156,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18399,_binary '\0','/bPw2N56vdHgAjgNAWBD68WYGFVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366620',6.2,3647,'en','Into Pitch Black','After the events of Pitch Black, a contractor is hired to locate Riddick, dead or alive. He reviews available information on him and the events of Pitch Black. Terrified, he hires a female cyberpunk merc to do the job for him.','/daB2WDVkOXzaWohtuxvOArpRF4X.jpg','2000-12-02',44,'Released',NULL,'Into Pitch Black',244839,1.7172,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18400,_binary '\0','/40XTRnRRDZ4TzbjcrfW3WvtSsKW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366621',7.3,2595,'ja','犬夜叉 鏡の中の夢幻城','With their most formidable foe vanquished, Inuyasha and his comrades begin returning to their everyday lives. But their peace is fleeting as another adversary emerges: Kaguya, the self-proclaimed princess from the Moon of Legend, hatches a plot to plunge the world into an eternal night of the full moon. Inuyasha, Kagome, Miroku, Sango and Shippou must reunite to confront the new menace.','/iIHC94gkBt0Uha8TUTgHcAt6IoD.jpg','2002-12-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Inuyasha the Movie 2: The Castle Beyond the Looking Glass',22537,3.8885,7.7,'BZiXEbZ9OQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18401,_binary '\0','/8BhAtXw6iYCIIb0vDo6SreaMGOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366623',8,1510,'ar','إشاعة حب','Hussein, a shy young man, is desperately in love with Samiha. However, Samiha is more interested in her singing and dancing cousin Lucy. Admiring Hussein greatly, Samiha\'s father attempts to help him and starts spreading the rumor that Hussein is having an affair with famous actress Hind Rostom, hoping jealousy will move the daughter\'s heart. The plan seems to work... until Hind Rostom herself comes to town.','/2QGK0dDJMmhTjuWvdQyK0OUZxjO.jpg','1960-11-21',99,'Released',NULL,'Eshaet Hob',330493,1.2048,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18402,_binary '\0','/oMson3ThVDsgHUMbdFFyUdpLU2M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366627',7.1,125588,'en','The Jacket','A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.','/bt89UfRhjAvJDAO9CWJnRFXAN3p.jpg','2005-03-04',103,'Released','Terror has a new name.','The Jacket',9667,7.1397,6.866,'HfKjVvyONoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18403,_binary '\0','/4mqPvFVpyi5yls6SE8sZHbis4Gy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366635',6.7,1368,'cs','Jedna ruka netleská','When Standa is released from jail, he feels a brighter future is about to take hold. Instead, his bad luck grows, thanks to a new acquaintance.','/ksqF2JV2xNeUJ7IRJEjl0S6E3J0.jpg','2003-09-18',103,'Released',NULL,'One Hand Can\'t Clap',41218,1.1231,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18404,_binary '\0','/yzACjwv35Fkqbs5rRjcFuJaBtkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366701',6.1,1393,'fi','Lapsia ja aikuisia','Longtime couple Venla and Antero come to a serious impasse. After years with Antero, Venla wants to start a family, but her boyfriend, worried that parenthood will stifle his speed-skating career, secretly gets a vasectomy. Determined to have a child, Venla seeks help from a female fertility doctor, a decision that breeds new possibilities for the prospective mother when she falls in love with the doctor.','/6cYdN0EsH8ekdWZ1SE0jBMLEdT5.jpg','2004-09-17',102,'Released','Just when you think you\'ve grown up...everything changes','Producing Adults',39496,1.5176,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18405,_binary '\0','/9JqtSiNILlK59BMGaOTm0z47wOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366721',7.8,5827,'el','Το Λιβάδι που δακρύζει','The story follows a family of refugees from the early twentieth century through to the Civil War. Through movements, separations, and reunions, personal lives intersect with Greece’s major historical transformations. Space and time are in constant flux, while the characters remain trapped in an unending search for a homeland.','/4lXTXN5i9rqO55uSQ6dqdAln5i9.jpg','2004-02-20',169,'Released',NULL,'The Weeping Meadow',37952,1.5671,7.6,'SyjDPa854aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18406,_binary '\0','/le7HI4p1gWRIIZ1FdfUfyy0Cj3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366777',6.8,27356,'en','Millions','Two boys, still grieving the death of their mother, find themselves the unwitting benefactors of a bag of bank robbery loot in the week before the United Kingdom switches its official currency to the Euro. What\'s a kid to do?','/rypaIocIovS3ICLKKakMvHDDQ0T.jpg','2005-04-08',98,'Released','Can anyone be truly good?','Millions',13373,3.2148,6.4,'QHcQF8LNvfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18407,_binary '\0','/zDkLBWZmt8jZrEhdKoUKoaEwETC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366780',6.7,24440,'en','MirrorMask','In a fantasy world of opposing kingdoms, a 15-year old girl must find the fabled MirrorMask in order to save the kingdom and get home.','/itIJU3NKbdgScA1WPIxXzOlm0Uj.jpg','2005-01-25',101,'Released','The Other Side of Reason. The Other Side of Fate. The Other Side of Truth.','MirrorMask',14517,2.6542,6.4,'swrcKRVgeGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18408,_binary '\0','/bB65WB9fVXWItfab4M5PFbp5jtI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366840',8,11766,'te','ఒక్కడు','Ajay, a fiery Kabaddi player from Hyderabad, visits Kurnool for a tournament and rescues Swapna from a faction leader Obul Reddy, who wants to force her into marriage. He secretly hides her in his home and assists her in planning her escape abroad for her higher studies. But, fate has other plans.','/nVBa5QWSPrVzFyHK2XWrsruQzyl.jpg','2003-01-15',170,'Released',NULL,'Okkadu',94965,1.66,7.784,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18409,_binary '\0','/ne8b3lOJTgsSsKNBqTnK4ApKFDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366842',2.7,1979,'tr','Ömerçip','This is the millennium version of the old black and white movies produced by Erler film.. The stories of those movies were like fairy tales to its audiences. Years passed and now we are to witness the the funny story of the rich girl Melek, her boy friend Adnan, the cab driver, their bright son Omer, the sweet Hulusi Bey, Necdet the chef, Kayhan the butler, Suzan the trouble making nanny, Coskun the rapist, Nuri the psychopath, and Onder the thief of hearts!','/y9si14kEWWuO74PVX2e1kDM3fww.jpg','2003-05-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Ömerçip',331125,0.8174,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18410,_binary '\0','/yJThOFo5CwIQ0ibmffSHG0NxG0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366905',7,6024,'sv','Pippi Långstrump','Pippi Longstocking, a super-strong redheaded little girl, moves into her father\'s cottage Villa Villekulla, and has adventures with her next-door neighbors Tommy and Annika in this compilation film of the classic Swedish TV series. This was followed by Pippi Goes on Board.','/yhqsBw9uiZQ3ibMsXAg3ooyJZg7.jpg','1969-05-09',100,'Released','The most famous children\'s book of the last decade - Now a motion picture!','Pippi Longstocking',12097,3.1028,6.8,'arHCB9-DvWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18411,_binary '\0','/bU27L9zv1J7dtGTME3JKq7ByMpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366920',5,2992,'en','Pride and Prejudice','In this contemporary LDS twist on Jane Austen\'s iconic novel, Elizabeth Bennet is a hard-working, intelligent college student who won\'t even think about marriage until she graduates. But when she meets Jack Wickham, a good-looking playboy, and Darcy, a sensible businessman, Elizabeth\'s determination is put to the test. Will she see through their exteriors and discover their true intentions?','/3oAub2opFoDhepSoNW3Tlcmems7.jpg','2003-12-05',104,'Released','Love has met its match.','Pride and Prejudice',18087,1.9696,4.9,'42XYXw5FNKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18412,_binary '\0','/kQLdhWclPH8t1dDwQfTxQ3L40t0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366943',7.3,7824,'da','Reconstruction','Late one evening Alex suddenly abandons his girlfriend, Simone, to pursue the beautiful Aimee. In his encounter with Aimee time and place dissolve for him and he becomes a stranger to Simone, to whom he cannot return.','/fWke9pUnvJ1S3LRL5b0CDs621Pa.jpg','2003-05-17',92,'Released','How much will one man sacrifice for his dream of true love?','Reconstruction',29456,1.2842,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18413,_binary '\0','/vu4Di47WfYDnvhp7iw0mbutXsb8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366985',2.8,1562,'hi','Rudraksh','Good and sinful are two sides of a same coin. If good grows in strength so does evil. Finally there comes a point when one must overcome the other. Dr. Gayatri (Bipasha Basu) is an Indian American paranormal researcher at University of California, researching esoteric practices like voodoo, spirit possession, magic and healing powers. She seeks the hidden knowledge that goes into such practices, the knowledge that cannot be explained by science or logic. Her search for answers brings her and her team of scientists to India. In India she comes across an uncommon man named Varun (Sanjay Dutt) who is gifted with special intuitive and healing powers which he claims to have developed through meditation. He can affect people\'s minds through his mental powers. He is a blend of Indian philosophy and modern culture, a master at martial arts and a devotee of Lord Hanuman. He heals people by absorbing their pain. He worships and trains by day, while working as a bouncer at a club by night.','/3sE0OIkg0qUIpUcrJAVWXTdQP3Y.jpg','2004-02-13',145,'Released',NULL,'Rudraksh',361866,1.3515,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18414,_binary '\0','/1iewRrC7LwkANjLzu2mimlNV0Pe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0366996',7,6608,'en','The Saddest Music in the World','In Depression-era Winnipeg, a legless beer baroness hosts a contest for the saddest music in the world, offering a grand prize of $25,000.','/7ATs79HpMv82hcPM3iv6kwugyDj.jpg','2003-09-17',100,'Released','\"If you\'re sad, and like beer, I\'m your lady.\"','The Saddest Music in the World',37209,2.0832,6.9,'abLMg0PV_MM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18415,_binary '\0','/uWmlQFCB2RjsFmSxUqutKubQkFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367000',5,5263,'fr','Saint Ange','In 1958, in the French Alp, the young servant Anna Jurin arrives in Saint Ange Orphanage to work with Helena while the orphans moved to new families. Anna, who is secretly pregnant, meets the last orphan, Judith, left behind because of her mental problems, and they become closer when Anna find that Judith also hear voices and footsteps of children.','/2d1JogvQG3Hcay30wo8261otfZ6.jpg','2004-06-23',98,'Released',NULL,'House of Voices',21198,2.7673,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18416,_binary '\0','/a9VOWosINcLNJQb3hNZAqEShVTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367027',6.3,37544,'en','Shortbus','In post-9/11 New York City, an eclectic group of citizens find their lives entangled, personally, romantically, and sexually, at Shortbus, an underground Brooklyn salon infamous for its blend of art, music, politics, and carnality.','/s8QBrWgpZpYrySSyTQ0xbFLPKrS.jpg','2006-10-04',101,'Released','Open your mind. And everything else.','Shortbus',1378,8.4176,6.259,'txkMNU6wnak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18417,_binary '\0','/cyI5Bl7maJpEhGtfWSAYVsGqjOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367082',7,7457,'hu','Sorstalanság','A Hungarian youth comes of age at Buchenwald during World War II. György Köves is 14, the son of a merchant who\'s sent to a forced labor camp. After his father\'s departure, György gets a job at a brickyard; his bus is stopped and its Jewish occupants sent to camps. There, György find camaraderie, suffering, cruelty, illness, and death. He hears advice on preserving one\'s dignity and self-esteem. He discovers hatred. If he does survive and returns to Budapest, what will he find? What is natural; what is it to be a Jew? Sepia, black and white, and color alternate to shade the mood.','/eLR8T7uNFNYYwne7Z1fAjQi8Nzy.jpg','2005-02-10',140,'Released','You can close your eyes. You can turn away. But you will never forget.','Fateless',41508,1.4868,6.9,'832JoXF_h4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18418,_binary '\0','/oEH2tn8G1YGEhNBVqSAW6k1C9iB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367085',4.6,26572,'en','Soul Plane','Following a ridiculously awful flight that leads to his pet\'s death, Nashawn Wade files a lawsuit against the airline, and wins a multimillion-dollar settlement. Determined to create a better flying experience, Nashawn starts his own airline, one that caters to an African-American clientele. Going into business with a tricked-out plane piloted by the smooth Capt. Mack, the airline hits a snag when it has to deal with the family of Elvis Hunkee.','/b5Rzb5JUwPinllWGYUYER3OV14F.jpg','2004-05-28',86,'Released','Announcing the arrival of the first airline with soul.','Soul Plane',12657,7.1467,5.515,'K4243zRQyrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18419,_binary '\0','/lnbeZkVX3A4gdJeha8McFjVPPeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367088',4,1539,'en','Spymate','Amelia, a young genius and daughter of a top secret agent, unknowingly invents a contraption that makes her the target of an evil scientist.','/kIH7SSDDLgqShwtPo78WkIRSd1G.jpg','2006-02-24',84,'Released','An amazing new breed of secret agent.','Spymate',26266,1.8187,6.2,'ajwlyS8yIEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18420,_binary '\0','/3ZjxENlw4HXioGGwhqaJrvdEXKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367089',7.3,95082,'en','The Squid and the Whale','Based on the true childhood experiences of Noah Baumbach and his brother, The Squid and the Whale tells the touching story of two young boys dealing with their parents\' divorce in Brooklyn in the 1980s.','/9NbXn1NMdfGM491V3EFjZADR9SX.jpg','2005-10-05',81,'Released','Joint custody blows.','The Squid and the Whale',10707,5.5863,6.952,'JRkK5n2mkvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18421,_binary '\0','/AmRfsOyEXpVhnaYXZMoDlZd9Siq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367110',8.2,107310,'hi','स्वदेस','A successful Indian scientist returns home to his village to take his nanny back to America with him, and in the process rediscovers his roots.','/yUSL24kpHc9Nls4Pohia4shgcIM.jpg','2004-12-17',195,'Released','We, the people.','Swades',15774,2.2676,7.35,'vc7AZNWvs0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18422,_binary '\0','/zxqnM6rJoFzWZnZ4PmoFtRHihOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367153',5.3,9653,'en','Toolbox Murders','A historic Hollywood hotel houses a supernatural evil. It\'s been subdued for decades, but when renovations start, a series of murders take place.','/mxfetphMy1oD8Omg8ULY4ByjyVb.jpg','2004-11-12',95,'Released','If you lived here, you would be dead by now.','Toolbox Murders',16764,2.5132,5.6,'_7SRE9Pw-ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18423,_binary '\0','/rm3u8BxwGsobw7L5FYD2uFga9An.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367174',6.8,2085,'cn','向左走．向右走','An aspiring violinist and a professional translator live parallel lives and appear to be perfect for each other, but somehow fate seems to keep them apart. Living in different units of the same apartment building, they never meet, because when they leave, one turns left, and one turns right.','/lr9jAfUS0C6MxBLvr3DsAvis64X.jpg','2003-08-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Turn Left, Turn Right',41198,1.7889,7.2,'Z3tyCaVzQE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18424,_binary '\0','/volZgUC7W4QMIwWr3hAZPSZ6tb4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367188',7.1,13218,'en','Modigliani','Set in Paris in 1919, biopic centers on the life of late Italian artist Amedeo Modigliani, focusing on his last days as well as his rivalry with Pablo Picasso. Modigliani, a Jew, has fallen in love with Jeanne, a young and beautiful Catholic girl. The couple has an illegitimate child, and Jeanne\'s bigoted parents send the baby to a faraway convent to be raised by nuns.','/dyvkjImdzdERJnRPwx5Tj39c8a0.jpg','2004-05-18',128,'Released','His passion was life. His obsession was art.','Modigliani',34308,2.7306,7,'GCN-p5_HT_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18425,_binary '\0','/3YTH3XzxwD7AiMe1tKyyytsxnq8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367232',5.4,2599,'en','Intern Academy','Follows the misadventures of a group of young interns at a hospital/medical school - dealing with the pressures of school and love.','/a6YQiS6nseTBsENp93r6mbfjSvc.jpg','2004-05-16',98,'Released','Are you hot enough to be admitted?','White Coats',55922,2.178,5.1,'4QEZjDIeC1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18426,_binary '\0','/xANEiNxM8I6BpPynFkPuMEGRMp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367245',4.1,1237,'en','Wuthering Heights','Orphan Heath is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cate. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until the death of the patriarch, leaving Cate to start seeing Eddie Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heath, now a rock star who swears revenge on those who have wronged him, vows to win her back. A contemporary musical adaptation of Emily Bronté\'s classic novel.','/9oi4N7N5X2oF0W1MLx787rb9z3I.jpg','2003-09-14',88,'Released',NULL,'Wuthering Heights',165569,2.5549,5.5,'Aw_esK7Pmto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18427,_binary '\0','/pdd21d0dgFC4rImh4WCOaECiJmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367478',5.5,10863,'en','Wake of Death','Ben Archer, an ex-mob enforcer, seeks revenge against a ruthless Chinese kingpin responsible for his wife\'s brutal murder. When Archer joins forces with his old underworld friends, an all-out war is waged against the Chinese Triad.','/xC4QHeyTM5KeFwNwEY1zcTiCUB3.jpg','2004-12-28',91,'Released','Revenge was all he had left.','Wake of Death',14172,6.8259,6.1,'ALrqbe2j00s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18428,_binary '\0','/4aPNUEIcXK7ISOV6qiQpTekGQez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367479',6.2,53941,'en','After the Sunset','An FBI agent is suspicious of two master thieves, quietly enjoying their retirement near what may - or may not - be the biggest score of their careers.','/ldor5Ep0B01TCfwZ2vWWA8VPT6U.jpg','2004-11-12',97,'Released','Who will walk away?','After the Sunset',10589,8.0407,6.2,'ZLOwRK2rKJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18429,_binary '\0','/9QaebfA43SkffIy6sDFje5q0jdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367495',8.6,28616,'ta','அன்பே சிவம்','Anbarasu, young and arrogant, and Nallasivam, damaged - physically but not spiritually - by life, are thrown together by circumstances, and find that they are in some ways bound together by fate.','/nT556HbikCCLABe8xQ4zQ2QIb0O.jpg','2003-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Anbe Sivam',26910,1.4131,7.676,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18430,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367501',8.4,2626,'en','Anglian Lives: Alan Partridge','A documentary on the life and career of Norwich\'s finest broadcaster, Alan Partridge. In the programme, Alan is asked tough questions about his divorce, Toblerone addiction and his autobiography \'Bouncing Back\' by formidable interviewer Ray Woollard.','/cpP0njKz41cZ4jx851BvPnywYMQ.jpg','2003-03-24',29,'Released',NULL,'Anglian Lives: Alan Partridge',401814,1.6086,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18431,_binary '\0','/atoIgfAk2Ig2HFJLD0VUnjiPWEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367594',6.7,578463,'en','Charlie and the Chocolate Factory','A young boy wins a tour through the most magnificent chocolate factory in the world, led by the world\'s most unusual candy maker.','/iKP6wg3c6COUe8gYutoGG7qcPnO.jpg','2005-07-13',115,'Released','Prepare for a taste of adventure.','Charlie and the Chocolate Factory',118,24.9931,7.037,'p6JAQ2aoXm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18432,_binary '\0','/6ZA6O0q48rEpvqnm5SA5a5Cu4IC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367623',2.7,4154,'en','Christmas Vacation 2: Cousin Eddie\'s Island Adventure','Though Eddie\'s fired right at Christmastime, his boss sends him and his family on a South Pacific vacation, hoping Eddie won\'t sue him after being bitten by a lab monkey. When the Tuttle family winds up trapped on a tropical island, however, Eddie manages to provide for everyone and prove himself a real man.','/wTtEMlMul5Xpg4L2lOrj6Kp0R4I.jpg','2003-12-20',83,'Released','Eddie\'s ready for the holidays. But are the holidays ready for Eddie?','Christmas Vacation 2: Cousin Eddie\'s Island Adventure',11155,2.6498,4,'aSp7TmKzga0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18433,_binary '\0','/cVkb5wUZrO71wCFM7nDyqPDezCL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367631',5.5,20307,'en','D.E.B.S.','The star of a team of teenage crime fighters falls for the alluring villainess she must bring to justice.','/68BfXrFQPHg9iBWJVgp5R48gTix.jpg','2005-03-25',91,'Released','Evil is so totally busted!','D.E.B.S.',540,6.7807,6.5,'ySFxUMCutV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18434,_binary '\0','/lQFFYowxGHXCDTbHHeIeqBoJoYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367652',4.7,56698,'en','Deuce Bigalow: European Gigolo','Deuce Bigalow goes to Amsterdam after a little accident including two irritating kids and a bunch of aggressive dolphins. There he meets up with his old friend T.J. Hicks. But a mysterious killer starts killing some of Amsterdam\'s finest gigolos and T.J. is mistaken for the extremely gay murderer. Deuce must enter the gigolo industry again to find the real murderer and clear T.J.\'s name.','/yXdQ4UGDFCsPrynJOdIk20AYLus.jpg','2005-08-12',83,'Released','For the women of Europe... The price of love just got a lot cheaper.','Deuce Bigalow: European Gigolo',11453,7.7527,5.3,'NlsISs23Qfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18435,_binary '\0','/bBScaJIqFGjgYPbPMClJJzAAbe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367677',2.1,6923,'en','Dracula 3000','In the year 3000, the deep space salvage ship Mother III locates the vanished starship Demeter in the Carpathian System. Captain Abraham Van Helsing and his crew composed of the blonde assistant Aurora Ash; the crippled navigator Arthur \"The Professor\" Holmwood, who believes that he is a genius; the strong and dumb Humvee; the intern Mina Murry; and the drug addicted 187, decide to claim the possession of Demeter. While exploring the spacecraft, they see a tape of fifty years ago of Captain Varna telling that he was locked in his cabin since his crew was acting weird after getting a cargo of coffins in Transylvania station. When 187 decides to search in the coffins for some possible hidden dope, he cuts his hand and his blood awakes Count Orlock, a.k.a. Count Dracula. When Aurora discloses who Dracula is, the survivors try to find a way to destroy the vampire.','/ucrvSJIoxw1D2SZ2p6J9EIHzFPg.jpg','2004-08-09',86,'Released','In space there is no daylight.','Dracula 3000',10838,3.006,2.8,'Od7C8WMLv2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18436,_binary '\0','/4ne8VH7Fnjvo2DHCqB2vNUwTbEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367790',7.3,5422,'en','Baadasssss!','Director Mario Van Peebles chronicles the complicated production of his father Melvin\'s classic 1971 film, \"Sweet Sweetback\'s Baadasssss Song.\" Playing his father in the film, Van Peebles offers an unapologetic account of Melvin\'s brash and sometimes deceptive conduct on the set of the film, including questionable antics like writing bad checks, tricking a local fire department and allowing his son, Mario, to shoot racy sex scenes at the age of 11.','/mMFWMlNMFPSPDbYvKpBH7baDzjp.jpg','2004-05-28',108,'Released','A father, a son, a revolution.','Baadasssss!',28219,1.5556,6.5,'qBbnwWjr6rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18437,_binary '\0','/gM4IaWJol2yMmtmZ5ybBEY8AM3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367854',4.5,2401,'en','The Hollow','The presence of Ichabod Crane\'s descendant in Sleepy Hollow conjures the Headless Horseman to return and resume his spooky slaughtering.','/2RPzdYOhStgkUJpPdAYlv1VvFzX.jpg','2004-08-25',83,'Released','Some Legends Never Die.','The Hollow',35946,1.9739,5.1,'iSdMLVeqyFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18438,_binary '\0','/fN4OThflKQ8ZT1w2qRRIJmLejKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367859',7.6,12934,'pt','O Homem Que Copiava','A young photocopier operator becomes infatuated with his neighbor and, unable to afford anything from her shop, turns to shady schemes to make money.','/3RsEkEdLEFd0Q5HThqMd4X8tYZk.jpg','2003-06-13',123,'Released','Life is original. Everything else is copy.','The Man Who Copied',40823,1.8789,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18439,_binary '\0','/wnaEKwRbJValhMnZuOuihXQC2xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367878',7.3,1519,'pt','Os Imortais','Every year, four ex-soldiers who call themselves \"Os Imortais\" (\"The Immortals\"), get together with four women to celebrate their war deeds and remember the old days, back in the war. On the summer of 1985, tired of their monotonous lives, they decide to rob a bank. Joaquim Malarranha, a chief inspector from the local police force who is about to retire, crosses their path and chooses to spend his last days of duty trying to solve the robbery. But as he carries on with his investigation, he discovers more than he could have ever imagined...','/h2E3jMXZUWc8P662A2tD15LPwHP.jpg','2003-11-07',130,'Released',NULL,'The Immortals',50250,1.3618,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18440,_binary '\0','/p96949hcwUG2BwE6MgKmw0uYNCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367882',6.2,517922,'en','Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull','Set during the Cold War, the Soviets—led by sword-wielding Irina Spalko—are in search of a crystal skull which has supernatural powers related to a mystical Lost City of Gold. Indy is coerced to head to Peru at the behest of a young man whose friend—and Indy\'s colleague—Professor Oxley has been captured for his knowledge of the skull\'s whereabouts.','/56As6XEM1flWvprX4LgkPl8ii4K.jpg','2008-05-21',122,'Released','The adventure continues...','Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull',217,15.608,6.024,'kTJy1rFBtVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18441,_binary '\0','/rQvjuEw7OWthkbZleA4v1nsOcXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367913',6.3,12351,'ja','呪怨2','When the cast and crew of a paranormal TV reality program decide to shoot in the house of the original Saeki hauntings, a series of strange events unfold at the location.','/agI9bflzv44lVsbah2dtdkkUqoW.jpg','2003-08-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Ju-on: The Grudge 2',9666,4.0278,6.484,'v74QvcS8pMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18442,_binary '\0','/am6ZfhUTUmcjPjjA4GIkLEJ33TN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367959',6.1,122442,'en','Hannibal Rising','The story of the early, murderous roots of the cannibalistic killer, Hannibal Lecter – from his hard-scrabble Lithuanian childhood, where he witnesses the repulsive lengths to which hungry soldiers will go to satiate themselves, through his sojourn in France, where as a medical student he hones his appetite for the kill and learnt sword skills from his Japanese girlfriend, who happened to have similar fate','/7FTDMQoac0uqJUquZk4KenDzLMZ.jpg','2007-02-06',121,'Released','It started with revenge.','Hannibal Rising',1248,2.2278,6.3,'ECOUSPHn4Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18443,_binary '\0','/eAOOeqa14oCxgdKxLvpDYxCJhqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0367975',7.6,8119,'pt','Lisbela e o Prisioneiro','Lisbela is a young woman who loves going to the movies. Leléu is a con man, going from town to town selling all sort of things and performing as master of ceremonies for some cheesy numbers, such as the woman who gets transformed into a gorilla. He gets involved with Linaura, a sexy and beautiful woman who happens to be the wife of the most frightening hitman of the place. The hitman finds out his wife\'s affair and goes after Leléu, who has to leave in a hurry. In another town, he meets and falls instantly in love with Lisbela, who is engaged to Douglas, a hillbilly who tries hard to pass for a cosmopolitan Rio de Janeiro dweller.','/raCdo5Hjpd3uXbpSd1JZ7tEyE31.jpg','2003-08-22',106,'Released',NULL,'Lisbela and the Prisoner',52345,0.3694,7.828,'XcQlvsg7Pa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18444,_binary '\0','/266RMJ7qurwYgnKmy8zuWN81e2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368008',6.6,123807,'en','The Manchurian Candidate','Years after his squad was ambushed during the Gulf War, Major Ben Marco finds himself having terrible nightmares. He begins to doubt that his fellow squad-mate Sergeant Raymond Shaw, now a vice-presidential candidate, is the hero he remembers him being. As Marco\'s doubts deepen, Shaw\'s political power grows, and, when Marco finds a mysterious implant embedded in his back, the memory of what really happened begins to return.','/4xEWtEbKK2EXMZ8UPff8hDCSiVW.jpg','2004-07-30',130,'Released','Everything is under control.','The Manchurian Candidate',14462,6.3907,6.496,'rJ-CKZnqyqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18445,_binary '\0','/vZ1sMt6bn0pj3aXsJj7ZsmWV5jZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368045',6,2909,'no','Mors Elling','Elling has lived with his mother all his life. Mom is the practical one, while Elling ponders the more theoretical aspects of life. He spends his time in their apartment reading books and looking at the neighbours through the living room window. Elling doesn\'t seem to need to be around others like most people. That\'s why Elling is less than enthusiastic when his mother suddenly decides to take her son on a beach vacation to Spain. Reluctantly, Elling agrees. After all, a lady at her age needs a good man by her side. But what Elling refuses to realize is that Mom is not only old, but also sick. Very sick. On her last vacation she tries to get Elling to see that life is bigger than their living room.','/c4eHE3cy5JBjoGSobHxaUkOmv4a.jpg','2003-10-10',78,'Released',NULL,'Mother\'s Elling',11166,2.3323,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18446,_binary '\0','/vxRIvMcVkgWSbL6Gnv24GmpwiuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368089',5.4,3223,'en','November','Sophie Jacobs is going through the most difficult time of her life. Now, she just has to find out if it\'s real.','/qqCn3bYlG85dlVdUBd5Vjv3i0Qg.jpg','2004-01-18',73,'Released','The truth lies outside the frame.','November',1424,2.0681,4.885,'tTd66rOoq1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18447,_binary '\0','/4RbxxPAUushqUYNO8EW09GSluBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368222',6.1,13574,'en','Romance & Cigarettes','Ironworker Nick lives with his wife, Kitty, and three daughters. When he meets a significantly younger woman, Tula, he starts an affair with her, much to the chagrin of his wife, and his life is thrown into upheaval. Kitty kicks Nick out of the house, and he is forced to make some difficult decisions.','/phSntD46jD5IfYAa2lSoU6xJDJ6.jpg','2006-03-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Romance & Cigarettes',13994,3.7379,6.1,'CDSQPpAAdz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18448,_binary '\0','/6OnOH5FIp0ZJQgPlu0ehDfXzVyp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368226',3.6,100882,'en','The Room','Johnny is a successful banker with great respect for and dedication to the people in his life, especially his future wife Lisa. The happy-go-lucky guy sees his world being torn apart when his friends begin to betray him one-by-one.','/9QscHN4pXj6Ja1k7e1ZT4vWDGnr.jpg','2003-06-27',100,'Released','Can you ever really trust anyone?','The Room',17473,4.4831,3.999,'KRAUPqK9Y7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18449,_binary '\0','/2pElQ16KvJ3Vm62TYeUeXLuOLNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368249',5.1,1228,'en','School for Seduction','An Italian temptress arrives at a school in Newcastle to teach a group of Geordies about the art of romance.','/mauEEbVK9961pHRyVmPYdwLZ5vd.jpg','2004-12-03',104,'Released',NULL,'School for Seduction',26510,1.5215,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18450,_binary '\0','/wd0USU5yJEO8v5lXEDlFuoHk7sx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368259',4.7,2726,'en','Sex Lives of the Potato Men','Two lowlifes with active fantasy sex lives deliver potatoes to various restaurants and grocers.','/vpVrjh8r9KcrkgsgChFNQi3aZmX.jpg','2004-02-20',85,'Released','The search for the lowest form of life on the planet is over.','Sex Lives of the Potato Men',13371,1.9826,4.5,'WU7Xwwd8QwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18451,_binary '\0','/6SwGTOH8JAikiMkwFlVz2bwMmOo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368296',5.1,1768,'ja','STACY','Girls surrounding 17 years old are affected by an illness that make her to be \'Stacies\': they feel a strange and momentary happiness until they become zombies.','/hVlUOSy7ScfxU7epbktKlSlNCIy.jpg','2001-08-18',80,'Released','School\'s Out ... Forever!','Stacy: Attack of the Schoolgirl Zombies',36836,1.5197,4.6,'ePU8umnG_7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18452,_binary '\0','/kYFvWBAq8jR0IM9atygEcQLVycl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368314',6.9,1550,'en','Surplus: Terrorized Into Being Consumers','Swedish documentary film on consumerism and globalization, created by director Erik Gandini and editor Johan Söderberg. It looks at the arguments for capitalism and technology, such as greater efficiency, more time and less work, and argues that these are not being fulfilled, and they never will be. The film leans towards anarcho-primitivist ideology and argues for \"a simple and fulfilling life\".','/4JDIDRCUzfSw3EzeGLOZmyp6L2G.jpg','2003-11-21',54,'Released',NULL,'Surplus: Terrorized Into Being Consumers',39179,1.2096,6.5,'0Jus-pL_MRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18453,_binary '\0','/lcAUO3FVCIcQcMvgBnRSMG9Atzk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368343',4.6,1664,'en','Three Way','Lew is a small time loser with a troubled past and a very big secret. Overhearing a couple plan a kidnapping, Lew is tempted to come up with a scheme of his own. He decides to get to the victim first and then blackmail the real criminals. His plan soon spins out of control.','/4sDNvHPwnCy6dQBU4FjSawNhrow.jpg','2004-06-29',88,'Released','A sinfully tasty brew of sex, extortion and murder.','Three Way',34601,2.3758,4.3,'h-ZlnPwSemM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18454,_binary '\0','/t9wYlBc9kQwDxRBLwppZJaSdpkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368400',8,4599,'ta','வாலி','A man struggles to deny his attraction to his twin brother\'s new bride.','/gHu0yg869aw51CZXEVAW8P3N0dz.jpg','1999-05-01',158,'Released',NULL,'Vaali',69428,1.9759,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18455,_binary '\0','/lxwCRTWWfCisuarrFFUhW43eBnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368447',6.6,299345,'en','The Village','When a willful young man tries to venture beyond his sequestered Pennsylvania hamlet, his actions set off a chain of chilling incidents that will alter the community forever.','/v7UvYtKfIVaHLaHwVgfalyrK7Ho.jpg','2004-07-30',108,'Released','There is no turning back','The Village',6947,13.8695,6.494,'c7TL1BZegLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18456,_binary '\0','/5QDoHPqcKkCZ1WGAQpDUDm2dVhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368563',5.4,8532,'en','Possession','A woman\'s life is thrown into chaos after a freak car accident sends her husband and brother-in-law into comas. Thrills arrive after the brother-in-law wakes up, thinking he\'s his brother.','/8L0ZVI4OAm6nagDx5QM0ufUsqG8.jpg','2009-07-16',86,'Released','What if the person you loved became someone else?','Possession',33788,2.5425,5.6,'XyRL4FKwrxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18457,_binary '\0','/9OnDNG6CIi8FQZfNyQRnvoAK6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368571',5.9,1436,'en','Americano','\"Americano\" centres around Chris McKinley (Jackson), a recent college graduate backpacking through Europe who savours his last three days of freedom before boarding the career fast track back in the United States. In Pamplona with two friends (Timm Sharp and Ruthanna Hopper), Chris meets an Australian thrill-seeker (Phil Barantini), a quintessential Spanish beauty (Varela) and an enigmatic provocateur (Dennis Hopper), all of whom encourage him to rethink his life. As the minutes and seconds until his departure tick away, Chris struggles with an age-old question: Should he follow the beaten path or risk it all on the road less travelled?','/Ae917w1mL8zOH1snBKh6nTcP6IC.jpg','2005-01-07',95,'Released','Do what scares you','Americano',40798,1.8002,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18458,_binary '\0','/p5ZW0xCRXO8vf1byKzSJzIOj6hm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368578',4.8,37490,'en','Are We There Yet?','The fledgling romance between Nick, a playboy bachelor, and Suzanne, a divorced mother of two, is threatened by a particularly harrowing New Years Eve. When Suzanne\'s work keeps her in Vancouver for the holiday, Nick offers to bring her kids to the city from Portland, Oregon. The kids, who have never liked any of the men their mom dates, are determined to turn the trip into a nightmare for Nick.','/guDkMD4wrZ1BGUO7DFFBVzaiGij.jpg','2005-01-20',95,'Released','24 hours. 350 miles. His girlfriend\'s kids. What could possibly go wrong?','Are We There Yet?',11637,7.6607,5.7,'xFvco0kn7bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18459,_binary '\0','/w3aInhUxXtxKf8tiTZasHH5k15A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368619',7.6,5370,'el','Νύφες','A young female character, Nikki Douka, from Samothraki, is sailing to the U.S. to fulfill a marriage contract and save her family honor. Her skills as a seamstress keep her busily sewing throughout the voyage to alter wedding dresses for the third-class voyagers. But along the way, she meets a young American photographer who is returning from the Middle East where he was snapping shots of the war in Smyrna, 1922. Her honesty, pride, and beauty attract the attention of the American who falls in love with her. Tribulations abound during the voyage, following the dramas of several unfortunate young women upon whom nasty characters preyed, as Nikki struggles with her feelings for the photographer.','/2TQLUonavjMF9aEt2dnA5TALlG.jpg','2004-10-22',128,'Released',NULL,'Brides',24223,1.7595,6.3,'6OkEehGMMQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18460,_binary '\0','/gHvK2mylJnSIh1pdgGxaGsgNgyB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368658',7.1,11199,'en','Stage Beauty','Humble Maria, who outfits top London theater star Ned Kynaston, takes none of the credit for the male actor\'s success at playing women. And because this is the 17th century, Maria, like other females, is prohibited from pursuing her dream of acting. But when powerful people support her, King Charles II lifts the ban on female stage performers. And just as Maria aided Ned, she needs his help to learn her new profession.','/lh0u89m2OPr48TUKZSGZVoc0JmP.jpg','2004-09-03',106,'Released','She was the first of her kind. He was the last of his.','Stage Beauty',26108,2.9162,6.6,'T1Mpt0xFit0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18461,_binary '\0','/eDso5UEr3nnA1SYPH3aVDsjE09I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368667',7.8,17988,'en','Interstella 5555: The 5tory of the 5ecret 5tar 5ystem','Four talented alien musicians are kidnapped by a record producer who disguises them as humans. Shep, a space pilot in love with bass player Stella, follows them to Earth. Reprogrammed to forget their real identities and renamed The Crescendolls, the group quickly becomes a huge success playing soulless corporate pop. At a concert, Shep manages to free all the musicians except Stella, and the band sets out to rediscover who they really are — and to rescue Stella.','/AsvPgdcSlHocAbMp3yGZXjPiKKF.jpg','2003-05-28',68,'Released','The animated House Musical.','Interstella 5555: The 5tory of the 5ecret 5tar 5ystem',11049,4.7213,7.809,'EMroa1WgofA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18462,_binary '\0','/vTO1NvWhOR3CxrsnzZ1V8LwBjmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368668',3.3,3946,'fr','Les Dalton','Joe and Averell are the eldest and youngest of the four Dalton brothers, the worst outlaws in Wild West history...','/h6mI0TunvRfKE02tOPtTJFAMZKX.jpg','2004-11-08',86,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Luke and the Daltons',10870,4.3753,3.6,'cBxv6v7KGIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18463,_binary '\0','/tlII4fiCpxbX9wxeaSx3zrXTOoq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368688',5.1,1900,'en','Direct Action','Frank Gannon, a veteran cop, is being hunted by his fellow police officers after they learned he has betrayed the brotherhood and exposed to the feds wide scale corruption of the LAPD. He has one day left to prove his case and survive.','/cgS2xvButiNQtT1dGf1cukdoMcR.jpg','2004-05-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Direct Action',28280,2.4552,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18464,_binary '\0','/cx2nwab4wKPpmQ9uacgBU7jJfEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368709',6.3,75666,'en','Elizabethtown','Drew Baylor is fired after causing his shoe company to lose hundreds of millions of dollars. To make matters worse, he\'s also dumped by his girlfriend. On the verge of ending it all, Drew gets a new lease on life when he returns to his family\'s small Kentucky hometown after his father dies. Along the way, he meets a flight attendant with whom he falls in love.','/mOdlzAQxhMgiaazRzif1YtJzg9s.jpg','2005-10-14',123,'Released','It\'s a heck of a place to find yourself','Elizabethtown',9621,6.5124,6.2,'qyPq2BS8Ug0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18465,_binary '\0','/lnGcVQGBdSywCX4nmqXo3upk9mZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368711',7.9,4043,'en','End of the Century: The Story of the Ramones','A years-in-the-making documentary on the legendary punk band the Ramones. Through a mixture of archival footage, archival and new interviews with all members of the band\'s various lineups, and new interviews with a number of their contemporaries, the film traces the peaks and valleys the band experienced over the course of its 20-plus year career before disbanding in 1995.','/pqoZkkOVWE5f0H8jnrFRc7KAHs7.jpg','2003-01-19',110,'Released',NULL,'End of the Century: The Story of the Ramones',16301,2.1395,7.7,'WIE_tS6ML0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18466,_binary '\0','/acjOlbsTISQNPbgqtlLjsc8nSvQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368721',7.7,1535,'en','Faster','Faster is an electrifying tribute to the white-knuckle world of MotoGP™ — the fastest sport on two wheels — where the world’s top riders go wheel to wheel at over 200mph and crash at over 100mph. Narrated by Ewan McGregor, Faster chases two seasons’ worth of the world championship, featuring revealing interviews with riders, mechanics, doctors, commentators and fans. If you want high octane, adrenaline fuelled thrills, Faster will take you on a nerve shredding journey through the most exciting sport on the planet!','/puHBmn28Cxx53q2GBNSx06GafYH.jpg','2003-05-15',103,'Released','Two wheels. 200MPH. Every man for himself.','Faster',30129,1.2003,7.6,'tEMmKyR11yM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18467,_binary '\0','/wznFWFoRcOKvXkFGuWObIJ2e5L3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368725',5.6,1440,'en','The Fever','Tells the story of a woman who gets involved in politics with no previous contact with world events.','/fXLee26yjmFAZG3ZEZwZ8eTcPJ7.jpg','2004-09-24',83,'Released','Look beyond comfort.','The Fever',64192,2.0638,5.4,'s2fL7Y1bffY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18468,_binary '\0','/kfjHG9n155YsOVwGKciB7q8KPAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368774',6.2,7609,'en','The Heart Is Deceitful Above All Things','Young Jeremiah lives in a stable environment with loving foster parents until the day his troubled mother, Sarah, returns to claim him. Jeremiah becomes swept up in his mother\'s dangerous world of drugs, seedy hotels, strip joints and revolving lovers. Salvation comes in the form of the boy\'s ultrareligious grandparents, but soon Jeremiah\'s mother returns. Maternal love binds the pair together on the road until Sarah\'s desperate and depraved lifestyle finally consumes her.','/gf5wCcEvCPhpLFZkY68aLzMNAfC.jpg','2004-09-15',98,'Released','Behind the greatest hoax of our time is the heartbreaking story that started it all.','The Heart Is Deceitful Above All Things',26579,3.3454,5.856,'FhbPeX98Qkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18469,_binary '\0','/hXGZv8TAFP52jxIZLdIDCVmPJBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368794',6.8,63779,'en','I\'m Not There','Six actors portray six personas of music legend Bob Dylan in scenes depicting various stages of his life, chronicling his rise from unknown folksinger to international icon and revealing how Dylan constantly reinvented himself.','/bucgvB7gQqcl1m71efHkenfIMTj.jpg','2007-10-01',135,'Released','All I can do is be me, whoever that is.','I\'m Not There',3902,6.4845,6.5,'abVh39ZmUag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18470,_binary '\0','/iXA5sUMjmBvSsIv0i4tyPI4ZDFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368811',6.1,3222,'hi','Jajantaram Mamantaram','A young man lands in the land of little people, who ask him to save them from their enemies.','/sN7WWCY8fKLEIl2oKUiX30gJfwL.jpg','2003-05-30',115,'Released',NULL,'Jajantaram Mamantaram',348152,1.124,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18471,_binary '\0','/9EnZD3ZWjpJy4IPoQkqTzxvZrso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368891',6.9,381562,'en','National Treasure','Modern treasure hunters, led by archaeologist Ben Gates, search for a chest of riches rumored to have been stashed away by George Washington, Thomas Jefferson and Benjamin Franklin during the Revolutionary War. The chest\'s whereabouts may lie in secret clues embedded in the Constitution and the Declaration of Independence, and Gates is in a race to find the gold before his enemies do.','/jKbZBMRFpF2EfFuvrsDZ2uQYsEQ.jpg','2004-11-19',131,'Released','In order to break the code, one man will have to break all the rules.','National Treasure',2059,20.8998,6.653,'I0u9-5lPP4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18472,_binary '\0','/nwA20KOaj6pjtbwdNz8rUnmlmwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368896',6.6,2282,'te','నిజం','A young man is guided by his mother in a methodical manner to avenge his father against the perpetrators who falsely accused and killed him.','/zfLW8BlQjL9hlaPIdltr49hbcnj.jpg','2003-05-24',185,'Released',NULL,'Nijam',224947,0.8192,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18473,_binary '\0','/A7WpMBH6N1T0pPIEXsq9w4tu0oB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368909',7.2,82159,'th','องค์บาก','When the head of a statue sacred to a village is stolen, a young martial artist goes to the big city and finds himself taking on the underworld to retrieve it.','/oagqAwp48dMPoCT94yDJUDOCVPi.jpg','2003-01-31',105,'Released','No computer graphics. No stunt doubles. No wires.','Ong-Bak',9316,7.7916,7.16,'nTBm1FGTBps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18474,_binary '\0','/1Xwbli4B20ajKdq4fWSmWavMAds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368913',7.3,9962,'fa','Osama','After the rise of the Taliban in Afghanistan and the restriction of women in public life, a preteen girl is forced to masquerade as a boy in order to find work to support her mother and grandmother.','/pOKz4zpccIjdib2pfDRkg69Ojej.jpg','2004-03-24',83,'Released','To save her family a girl must become a boy','Osama',14757,3.1231,7,'B45o08SssgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18475,_binary '\0','/pmOXaAK8hteMlCiMZyyDJENHCZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368933',5.9,99091,'en','The Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement','Mia Thermopolis is now a college graduate and on her way to Genovia to take up her duties as princess. Accompanied by her friend Lilly, Mia continues her \'princess lessons\', like riding horses side-saddle and archery. But her already complicated life is turned upside down once again when she learns that she is to take the crown as queen earlier than expected, all while she meets a mysteriously charming young man.','/upJOyrxxSIxlSZC7KEqJfB1vlGl.jpg','2004-08-06',113,'Released','It can take a lifetime to find true love; she\'s got 30 days!','The Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement',11130,11.6271,6.718,'iemU7EUQgmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18476,_binary '\0','/sTN649ZUR6AfMvxnTWRCpqMDHyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368954',7.2,1272,'fr','S-21, la machine de mort Khmère rouge','Documentary of the S-21 genocide prison in Phnom Penh with interviews of prisoners and guards. On the search for reasons why this could have happened.','/7lkXz41WJjIvoHCnsLtXMqvCeiW.jpg','2003-05-17',101,'Released',NULL,'S21: The Khmer Rouge Killing Machine',43936,1.251,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18477,_binary '\0','/rsAVieXcoVAabHOKV2SsNIqJKen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368962',7.5,1243,'mk','Илузија','As Macedonia faces its difficult transition, a boy escapes into a world of his own creation.','/91yd5gyAVSky8EN0bfrSMSunsqg.jpg','2004-07-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Mirage',108827,0.9614,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18478,_binary '\0','/6alQcAv7ofMudb3ABlJGPztTNJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0368975',5.3,19643,'en','Sleepover','Desperate to improve their social status, four best friends enter into an all-night scavenger hunt against the popular clique in their school.','/w0kE8EufKNtYsliKWtsd4GJRH1b.jpg','2004-07-09',89,'Released','The rules are set. The game is on.','Sleepover',9893,5.7813,6.1,'MjqJRydu1Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18479,_binary '\0','/nwRQejHZXTo0SgKWxn4wXBTVolV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369036',4.5,1325,'ta','உதயா','Udhayakumar and Vasanthi are collegemates and they fall in love. But soon he comes to know that she is engaged to be married. After he moves to Chennai and finds a job as a reporter at a magazine. He tries to fight for social change. In the process , he unknowingly gets to know a group of unsavoury characters who promise to help him in his goals. They frame him up. One day Udhaya is arrested for a crime involving a terrorist plot which he is not responsible. The movie is about how Vasanthi fights to prove his innocence and to get him out from behind bars.','/rTCLFuy4XrKZbLnsUtCFWAUeI42.jpg','2004-03-28',160,'Released',NULL,'Udhaya',69658,1.2482,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18480,_binary '\0','/jbWlI8dqKiEZ3eolUDkpV3GMNTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369053',6.4,5192,'en','Separate Lies','Following a traffic accident, things take a turn when the victim\'s identity is revealed.','/vynOCaKcX3Ypp3PH3FlXdrDjWX4.jpg','2005-09-16',85,'Released',NULL,'Separate Lies',38583,3.4208,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18481,_binary '\0','/j0bK5l5Wo4XvUUrKp1FckLvbse9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369060',7.2,21462,'cn','無間道II','In this prequel to the original, a bloody power struggle among the Triads coincides with the 1997 handover of Hong Kong, setting up the events of the first film.','/q9MCjc4CMXju59slJEzYEtr7F3W.jpg','2003-10-01',119,'Released','The Birth of a Legend.','Infernal Affairs II',11647,6.9147,7.3,'4at78Tm57JI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18482,_binary '\0','/srSpXq7Xlzx6c0ofSGbySQXy2nz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369084',7,1230,'en','Byron','Life and adventures of lord George Gordon Byron. BBC dramatization of the poet\'s final thirteen years','/b4NYNKMA0lj5FsqCiXj0JCcLeyx.jpg','2003-09-27',147,'Released',NULL,'Byron',121293,1.2677,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18483,_binary '\0','/lcLyZzhB1ctfdH0hGBsTFrbflqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369226',2.4,46360,'en','Alone in the Dark','Edward Carnby is a private investigator specializing in unexplainable supernatural phenomena. His cases delve into the dark corners of the world, searching for truth in the occult remnants of ancient civilizations. Now, the greatest mystery of his past is about to become the most dangerous case he has ever faced.','/bSxrbVCyWW077zhtpuYlo3zgyug.jpg','2005-01-28',98,'Released','Can mankind defeat the army of darkness unleashed by an ancient evil cult?','Alone in the Dark',12142,5.34,3.4,'P-Gc5bgZ2B8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18484,_binary '\0','/85It5Uw5gWNZB3GRvY8zKVarcSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369258',7.7,2881,'mk','Bal-Can-Can','A Macedonian military deserter and his Italian blood-brother are searching for a dead grandmother wrapped up in a stolen carpet, all over the Balkan\'s criminal underworld.','/biLPULIigwXiL7VP7cUqsfpu6kC.jpg','2005-10-11',89,'Released','Laughter, Tears, Fear, Passion... And a Granny Wrapped In a Carpet!','Bal-Can-Can',57218,1.2722,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18485,_binary '\0','/qVzmXKKOTtd3szkiCheCNrfa394.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369339',7.5,474024,'en','Collateral','Cab driver Max picks up a man who offers him $600 to drive him around. But the promise of easy money sours when Max realizes his fare is an assassin.','/nV5316WUsVij8sVXLCF1g7TFitg.jpg','2004-08-04',120,'Released','It started like any other night.','Collateral',1538,13.184,7.248,'-JDf2zIFgO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18486,_binary '\0','/vbErBD1uLaxAvGmrguWPYGpL3J2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369359',4.7,2452,'en','Dead Meat','A couple\'s vacation to Ireland transforms into a nightmare as a virus spreads from slaughtered animals to humans, causing the dead to rise and feast on the living.','/5PAu5iX2M0ddpkgQt3mzURhQWe2.jpg','2004-10-01',78,'Released','It\'s not what you eat, it\'s who you eat!','Dead Meat',15689,1.2715,4.8,'2EZtStZZKEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18487,_binary '\0','/6ZuYKN5wJKcuCw7o1WsbjYo68vz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369436',5.8,89133,'en','Four Christmases','Brad and Kate have made something of an art form out of avoiding their families during the holidays, but this year their foolproof plan is about go bust -- big time. Stuck at the city airport after all departing flights are canceled, the couple is embarrassed to see their ruse exposed to the world by an overzealous television reporter. Now, Brad and Kate are left with precious little choice other than to swallow their pride and suffer the rounds.','/zixj44TC7rwzpxtJAG5OzFJnEqe.jpg','2008-11-26',88,'Released','His father, her mother, his mother and her father all in one day.','Four Christmases',12193,8.2791,5.819,'6veo6Js7HUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18488,_binary '\0','/9srAE8f6r4Ln3i4B7QwuvaewKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369441',6.2,164369,'en','Fun with Dick and Jane','After Dick Harper loses his job at Globodyne in an Enron-esque collapse, he and his wife, Jane, turn to crime in order to handle the massive debt they now face. Two intelligent people, Dick and Jane actually get pretty good at robbing people and even enjoy it – but they have second thoughts when they\'re reminded that crime can hurt innocent people. When the couple hears that Globodyne boss Jack McCallister actually swindled the company, they plot revenge.','/xTcIPKpzCqQUQixNPS0Rb7HPEAf.jpg','2005-12-21',90,'Released','Giving big businesses a run for their money!','Fun with Dick and Jane',7552,9.4644,6.236,'5Iwd_Ye-qNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18489,_binary '\0','/dF6FjTZzRTENfB4R17HDN20jLT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369610',6.9,738010,'en','Jurassic World','Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.','/rhr4y79GpxQF9IsfJItRXVaoGs4.jpg','2015-06-06',124,'Released','The park is open.','Jurassic World',135397,23.0553,6.702,'RFinNxS5KN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18490,_binary '\0','/gQpwrHblINKkh9Hq8ZidrLrkDHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369637',5.4,2552,'hi','Kuch Naa Kaho','Raj a mere bachelor, who has no intention of marrying is being convinced by his uncle. His uncle passes on the duty to Namrata a married woman whose husband Sanjeev leave her five years ago. Namrata is responsible for finding Raj a suitable bride, while she is busy finding girls for him, he is busy along with his mischievous friend Adi straying away all the girls by making up wired plans. But Raj falls in love with the match - maker herself. While this is happening Sanjeev, Namrata\'s husband return and foil all plans between Raj and Namrata.','/hxZlXIflrZ5FJkDhFkV5OFe1bWi.jpg','2003-08-26',169,'Released',NULL,'Kuch Naa Kaho',48923,1.0662,5.7,'GMgOWyMuqdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18491,_binary '\0','/8KOtoiqtNNMBR2STj9ZDWeEoTpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369672',7.1,28330,'en','A Love Song for Bobby Long','A headstrong young woman returns to New Orleans after the death of her estranged mother.','/7HoqdnUpIcK1CnFDNNONPZ9PBoi.jpg','2004-09-02',119,'Released','The heart is a lonely hunter.','A Love Song for Bobby Long',9953,4.1042,6.796,'4ve-nxuX_sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18492,_binary '\0','/7XmDhCTkce5GH8KCdbMoTZdxn1p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369702',7.9,89461,'es','Mar adentro','Ramón Sampedro is a ship mechanic and part-time poet left a quadriplegic following a diving accident. Ramón fought for 30 years for the legal right to end his own life. He develops close relationships with his long-term lawyer Julia and his friend Rosa, who tries to convince him that his life is worth living. Despite his situation, Ramón manages to inspire those around him to live life to the fullest.','/mQW1JJKCUg02cmWBzr9JFu9vM1V.jpg','2004-09-03',126,'Released',NULL,'The Sea Inside',1913,5.8328,7.566,'0qqvyzamlns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18493,_binary '\0','/ff7kkFMyU6eZ1821y2gAyKa6o11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369723',5,1556,'ar','ميدو مشاكل','Mido studies at the Technical College, and in his spare time, he works in installing satellite dishes. His constant fall into troubles earned him the title \'Mido the troublemaker\' but the gravest of his troubles is when a mysterious man approaches him for a secret mission.','/eoWQ7rw8iV33V0onIhpIsdwOdZ2.jpg','2003-05-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Mido the Troublemaker',372308,1.1264,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18494,_binary '\0','/FjqN9Aaqxd63Bfjoft6APu4Fua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369735',5.6,69948,'en','Monster-in-Law','Office temp Charlotte Cantilini thinks she\'s found Mr. Right when she starts dating gorgeous surgeon Dr. Kevin Fields. But there\'s a problem standing in the way of everlasting bliss: Kevin\'s overbearing and controlling mother, Viola. Fearing she\'ll lose her son\'s affections forever, Viola decides to break up the happy couple by becoming the world\'s worst mother-in-law.','/iRqcGkIPdRbEaW0xMEA5kgceUF8.jpg','2005-05-13',101,'Released','This relationship is going to be a real mother.','Monster-in-Law',4379,7.3976,6.229,'mW4iEGH1-1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18495,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369738',2.5,2492,'en','Moscow Heat','After a U.S. policeman is killed by black market weapons dealers, his partner, Rudy (Robert Madrid), and the murdered cop\'s father, ex-British Intelligence agent Roger Chambers (Michael York), head to Moscow to find the killers. The two begin to track down their targets, but their plan falters when Rudy\'s injured and Chambers is arrested. Enter Vlad (Alexander Nevsky), a Russian officer who\'s willing to help the men complete their mission.','/7WwaL21mcewnQTVAz3zOStDB4M1.jpg','2004-11-24',89,'Released','Vengeance is only the beginning.','Moscow Heat',106546,1.361,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18496,_binary '\0','/cCuT0flLIurv6J7Zc1R4wGQFoqC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369918',4.9,4994,'en','Shallow Ground','A naked teenage boy covered in blood appears at a remote sheriff\'s station one year after the brutal unsolved murder of a local girl. Now Sheriff Jack Shepherd, guilt ridden over the girl\'s murder, must confront his own demons as he desperately searches for the boy\'s true identity and possible victims. Little does Jack realize that he has started down a path that will bring him face to face with an unthinkable horror. Before sunrise the living will pay for the pain the dead have suffered.','/78kkO758SsSKotEripSPDW4eULL.jpg','2005-04-28',97,'Released','Fear your past... it will find you','Shallow Ground',24702,1.8224,5.1,'obkuiyajyag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18497,_binary '\0','/dscm4GcskThwtWmVnTrKZV7CDuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0369994',5.9,8922,'en','Strangers with Candy','A prequel to the critically acclaimed series featuring Jerri Blank, a 46 year old ex-junkie, ex-con who returns to high school in a bid to start her life over.','/hPx4aELIbpf6ZRdHPmBH5h5Qs95.jpg','2006-06-28',86,'Released','Going to high school for the first time is always scary... Especially the second time around.','Strangers with Candy',13141,2.8846,5.7,'uCWSgdKwlfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18498,_binary '\0','/dSMWw6rNIKqtHyWEIkDa8u7Mboa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370032',4.4,86932,'en','Ultraviolet','In the late 21st century, a subculture of humans have emerged who have been modified genetically by a vampire-like disease, giving them enhanced speed, incredible stamina and acute intelligence. As they are set apart from \"normal\" and \"healthy\" humans, the world is pushed to the brink of worldwide civil war aimed at the destruction of the \"diseased\" population. In the middle of this crossed-fire is - an infected woman - Ultraviolet, who finds herself protecting a nine-year-old boy who has been marked for death by the human government as he is believed to be a threat to humans.','/27OzQ2BBahQHYPiPEAXRXMbhnPQ.jpg','2006-03-03',87,'Released','The blood war is on.','Ultraviolet',9920,5.4534,5.207,'3O79UT32DzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18499,_binary '\0','/uRONYwYgrJDYsjIaFZVcSmv2OTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370082',5.8,3521,'ko','여고괴담 3: 여우계단','A staircase leading to a schoolgirls\' dormitory usually has 28 steps, but sometimes a 29th step appears. Any wish you make while standing on this step comes true, even if it must come true in the most horrific way possible.','/hX1CdiS8hJJxY8TuAmMoExYXKfn.jpg','2003-08-01',100,'Released','Watch Your Step.','Wishing Stairs',32237,2.1665,6.2,'6D5S9vY_MZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18500,_binary '\0','/20zcHI8A2xBAy5ES73gsY0v2dPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370244',7.2,2099,'ja','ナイン・ソウルズ','After discovering a hole in their crowded cell, nine prisoners escape their confinement to track down the key of the universe, which a fellow prisoner known as the Counterfeit King said he had hidden.','/oQXbOoBPOn7QvePAgAdnoUtmXxO.jpg','2003-07-19',120,'Released',NULL,'9 Souls',16976,1.6671,6.4,'KKtgno6Xs5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18501,_binary '\0','/xvq1RLaiwSdHwPHe7WUhqZa1rCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370263',5.7,235132,'en','AVP: Alien vs. Predator','When scientists discover something near Antarctica that appears to be a buried Pyramid, they send a research team out to investigate. Little do they know that they are about to step into a hunting ground where Aliens are grown as sport for the Predator race.','/ySWu5bCnnmgV1cVacvFnFIhgOjp.jpg','2004-08-12',101,'Released','Whoever wins... we lose.','AVP: Alien vs. Predator',395,10.6924,5.961,'_kF_sV4-nV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18502,_binary '\0','/5pGkJ9E1b9aDPATh2wjikHzBeih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370402',5.7,1513,'ko','청풍명월','Kingdom of Joseon, ancient Korea. A usurper has conquered the throne. His ministers are being systematically eliminated by a mysterious assassin. An arrogant master swordsman is in charge of putting an end to the carnage.','/sDp5vC60tzHSfNBxOKzN1M1j8n1.jpg','2003-07-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Sword In The Moon',13512,1.8949,5.3,'uVTNp7ILUAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18503,_binary '\0','/1VKzDyry0hxHAmpFSiTCSi3a5vS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370477',6.7,3449,'nl','De Dominee','Amsterdam, 1970s. A wealthy grammar school student Klaas and his friend start trafficking hash and become entangled in the brutal criminal scene.','/stSHfy0JaA6FGslxgv5KcWdPqyR.jpg','2004-09-02',110,'Released',NULL,'De Dominee',5473,1.1259,6.1,'CBP7VGb2GLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18504,_binary '\0','/uEOU23Q8FQ5AGhNHtSuHm3I7TFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370904',6.6,3301,'en','Lucky 7','Instead of really living her life since losing her mother at age 7, Seattle lawyer Amy Myer sticks to a foolproof \'timeline\' her mother drew as a guideline to help plot the course of her life. The timeline, which proves to be accurate in all other respects, predicts that Amy should marry her seventh boyfriend. However, Amy must question her instincts when she feels that her sixth boyfriend is the one she should marry, not the predicted seventh. Now she must decide whether to follow her mother\'s advice, or follow her own heart.','/o4GCda5liUllqYpFS3UVfxSLhq2.jpg','2003-07-20',96,'Released','Love doesn\'t always arrive on schedule.','Lucky 7',45693,1.7713,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18505,_binary '\0','/8MX2V0YhkJEbapX3uafaLoushFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370919',5.5,4215,'hu','Magyar vándor','A Hungarian historical movie that tells the story of the Hungarian ancestors, the seven leaders, who are looking for their new homeland in the last years of the 9th century. Before they leave their original home in Asia, they have a farewell party. They wake up with a severe hangover after consuming large quantities of kumis. The seven leaders wake up to find that their people have disappeared.','/wcPx4tP1qSYKOrfXCvrIOircEVw.jpg','2004-02-05',110,'Released',NULL,'Hungarian Vagabond',66926,1.5273,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18506,_binary '\0','/yiNHoIFUlFAByjXkTDdJOK9nw2Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0370986',7.6,86944,'en','Mysterious Skin','A teenage hustler and a young man obsessed with alien abductions cross paths, together discovering a horrible, liberating truth.','/wgSwDqhl6Rt3cuSCwt5sNpPna3x.jpg','2005-03-30',105,'Released','Two boys. One can\'t remember. The other can\'t forget.','Mysterious Skin',11171,7.4115,7.7,'5Lp5v4oQZRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18507,_binary '\0','/pE1JUtQtTVB2YWdFRQSWq4tWAQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371190',5.7,1928,'en','See Jane Date','When editor Jane Grant receives a plus-one invitation to her cousin\'s wedding, she finds herself in a predicament. To one-up her old high school rival Natasha Nutley, Jane tells her about her perfect, charming and handsome boyfriend -- except he isn\'t real. Catching word of her \"boyfriend,\" Jane\'s intrusive Aunt Ida demands he make an appearance at the wedding. Now, Jane must go on every date she can snag to find a man who fits the bill.','/urfndp7Npy3KiBsLDBigztXS1Hc.jpg','2003-08-16',90,'Released','Meet Jane. She\'s always one date away from finding the perfect guy.','See Jane Date',44880,2.1237,5.7,'ktAYQqV075M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18508,_binary '\0','/uXJgpBBOxD21X5Q93bZmjNHHdGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371246',6.4,93370,'en','Spanglish','Mexican immigrant and single mother Flor Moreno finds housekeeping work with Deborah and John Clasky, a well-off couple with two children of their own. When Flor admits she can\'t handle the schedule because of her daughter, Cristina, Deborah decides they should move into the Clasky home. Cultures clash and tensions run high as Flor and the Claskys struggle to share space while raising their children on their own, and very different, terms.','/x3OTaBvjqzhRL53Q39fOoIYqxyO.jpg','2004-12-17',130,'Released','Every family has a hero.','Spanglish',2539,5.7705,6.055,'GtzwDv0lrBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18509,_binary '\0','/eUNQJ0XKHoGDDQzj1Y4WhE5zAFJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371257',6.7,95367,'en','Stay','Psychiatrist Sam Foster has a new patient, Henry Letham, who claims to be suicidal. In trying to diagnose him, Sam visits Henry\'s prior therapist and also finds Henry\'s mother -- even though Henry has said that he murdered both of his parents. As reality starts to contradict fact, Sam spirals into an unstable mental state. Then he finds a clue as to how and when Henry may try to kill himself, and races to try to stop him.','/nrLZVP8jG0KBcabahRPp6UP7Oy2.jpg','2005-09-24',99,'Released','Between the worlds of the living and the dead there is a place you\'re not supposed to stay.','Stay',8066,7.1279,6.6,'wQs35Rka34A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18510,_binary '\0','/l3BaM4dtnhPljmiauzvyTAcshWL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371280',7.4,6186,'fa','طلای سرخ','Pizza man Hussein is a daily witnesses to the unjust distribution of wealth in his native Iran. One day, he finds a purse filled with shockingly expensive receipts from an upscale jewelry store. He attempts to bring the purse back to the store, but because of his working-class attire, he\'s not allowed inside. Then, during a delivery, a rich man invites Hussein into his extravagant mansion – an event that spurs Hussein to make a desperate bid for wealth.','/o8MFZIqtcCyo2J1cCnpVfGa6i66.jpg','2003-09-12',96,'Released','When you\'re pushed too far, you might just push back','Crimson Gold',40427,1.8789,6.953,'SDADriMrEls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18511,_binary '\0','/yBdtVoQe010z8PRJBPaun0iCKso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371552',6,13738,'fr','Astérix et les Vikings','Asterix and Obelix have been given a tough mission: Transform the chief\'s lazy nephew Justforkix into a warrior. When the Vikings abduct him and bring him back to their homeland, Asterix and Obelix must travel to Norway to rescue Justforkix.','/dW9h1Ez6PRx8PnZUVT27MnG8Wu5.jpg','2006-04-12',78,'Released',NULL,'Asterix and the Vikings',9642,6.4404,6.1,'nBZE7eQ4tvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18512,_binary '\0','/7qJmjEVASCtXSkINsyCIXkzxNMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371572',3.8,2142,'en','Beneath Still Waters','Studying under a disciple of Aleister Crowley, the leader of an upper class group invokes a supernatural force that slowly devours the village of Marienbad and its inhabitants, threatening to spread beyond its geographical limits. The mayor from the town nearby commissions the building of a dam which would flood the valley and therefore submerge the village forever sealing the evil force under water after leader and his followers were incapacitated to be kept from escaping. However, fate ensured the leader\'s freedom as he remained in the depths when the waters covered Marienbad. Now 40 years later an array of disappearances and deaths in mysterious circumstances are threatening the town next to the reservoir that now covers Marienbad.','/3tajmTmBG7ptIKTI5uBreIP2BEs.jpg','2005-11-02',92,'Released','Fear is rising.','Beneath Still Waters',18210,2.8486,4,'RUOniGuuPX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18513,_binary '\0','/nNj9HAAIC3ClVbTGxnPONajTlLh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371589',6.8,4870,'no','Buddy','Kristoffer lives in Oslo with his friends Geir and Stig Inge. He works as a billboard installer, and in his spare time he makes a video diary with Geir and Stig, containing stunts of a Jackass-nature. When Kristoffer\'s girlfriend, Elisabeth, leaves him, his life seems to fall to pieces. Until his videos are featured on Norway\'s most popular talk show and Kristoffer becomes famous.','/1W3M9AbhEsrZ6FigFSU3GR9WEEb.jpg','2003-08-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Buddy',15177,1.3015,6.4,'sN6i5Oepabg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18514,_binary '\0','/h5Bwxe6dTVFtAFkybkd1EAB4yUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371606',5.7,110866,'en','Chicken Little','When the sky really is falling and sanity has flown the coop, who will rise to save the day? Together with his hysterical band of misfit friends, Chicken Little must hatch a plan to save the planet from alien invasion and prove that the world\'s biggest hero is a little chicken.','/87FpA4b90eTaw3U6zmCNikoPLir.jpg','2005-11-04',81,'Released','The end is near.','Chicken Little',9982,14.6486,5.922,'PPuk2JQgMkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18515,_binary '\0','/i3IOqOFdAdjw0ebQXkIevybkkNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371724',6.7,218509,'en','The Hitchhiker\'s Guide to the Galaxy','Mere seconds before the Earth is to be demolished by an alien construction crew, Arthur Dent is swept off the planet by his friend Ford Prefect, a researcher penning a new edition of \"The Hitchhiker\'s Guide to the Galaxy.\"','/4fOFbNMjq708CQ7ou71by6rI6wZ.jpg','2005-04-28',109,'Released','Don\'t leave Earth without it.','The Hitchhiker\'s Guide to the Galaxy',7453,11.2219,6.69,'MbGNcoB2Y4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18516,_binary '\0','/w6C4786tsSlpVdZzqC0SkMS2HZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371735',7.6,19425,'hi','हंगामा','A case of mistaken identities featuring a young woman, an electronics business owner and an aspiring musician which leads to chaotic yet hilarious situations.','/oLmPYAufnpoqlkfzyeWWcsVcc0F.jpg','2003-08-01',153,'Released','A singer, a young woman and a bank employee lie to get ahead in life, leading to cases of mistaken identities.','Hungama',21184,1.619,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18517,_binary '\0','/zZlkCilSVHz6OeJSiIYdL6II2nw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371739',5.3,7714,'en','The Zodiac','An elusive serial killer known as the Zodiac terrorizes the San Francisco Bay in the late 1960s, while detectives aim to stop him before he claims more victims. Based on a true story.','/oVHKV8KOHdmEqVr6rcoPFfUaeM5.jpg','2005-07-31',92,'Released','THE MOST INFAMOUS SERIAL KILLER OF OUR TIME ...IS STILL OUT THERE','The Zodiac',11345,2.2878,5.4,'DZMXxuGuysM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18518,_binary '\0','/cKvDv2LpwVEqbdXWoQl4XgGN6le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371746',7.9,1250077,'en','Iron Man','After being held captive in an Afghan cave, billionaire engineer Tony Stark creates a unique weaponized suit of armor to fight evil.','/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg','2008-04-30',126,'Released','Heroes aren\'t born. They\'re built.','Iron Man',1726,39.3237,7.666,'8ugaeA-nMTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18519,_binary '\0','/xh1Xjiu7Q0ORz3DbJjlwfC2KwVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371853',4.1,3702,'es','La monja','Years ago, a cruel and merciless nun turned a boarding school into a living hell for her students until they could no longer bear the abuse, and she mysteriously disappeared. Now the alumnae are being brutally murdered one by one.','/2bDojliSLzGFwxlqQZodJAXHy7H.jpg','2005-11-03',101,'Released','Pray for mercy','The Nun',42968,3.0993,5.69,'hZEXyfKmYHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18520,_binary '\0','/4YGUOCc0xv2hFRVWR9Pb96voOjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371878',5.8,1309,'en','Piccadilly Jim','Set in the 1930s, an American with a scandalous reputation on both sides of the Atlantic must do an about-face in order to win back the woman of his dreams.','/aK2XHepPUa1RlGky2Frk6ea7k7y.jpg','2004-11-01',97,'Released','What\'s Wrong with Love?','Piccadilly Jim',48643,1.5185,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18521,_binary '\0','/kqbvDnt9V3tZljvefUn5NQrTlad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371920',3.2,2586,'en','Rottweiler','Dante travels across a desolate, futuristic Spain in search of his girlfriend, Ula. He is pursued by a bloodthirsty, cybernetic Rottweiler.','/uONkXsdAU11mTC8Z6SeJQyuLptC.jpg','2004-12-01',95,'Released','Eat. Sleep. Fetch. Kill.','Rottweiler',12532,1.7553,3.4,'e3uluAacRD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18522,_binary '\0','/arOsXXPxSnXfdvKA9Wughl7Uvfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371939',6.5,2747,'es','Secuestro Express','Young couple Carla and Martin are abducted by three men and spend a terrifying night in Caracas as they wait for Carla\'s father to hand over the ransom','/AhCIkOgBj2lgEbCQ7eAVPgGH39A.jpg','2004-06-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Secuestro Express',25956,1.2785,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18523,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0371954',3.8,1768,'en','Snakehead Terror','A small town, desperate to recover from hard economic times, is under threat when voracious Snakehead fish mutate and survive previous lake chemical poisonings. The fish transform from pests to predators when human growth hormones are dumped into the local lake in the hopes of reviving the local fishing industry. Thriving on the hormones, the Snakehead fish grow to monstrous proportions, devouring everything within reach. Capable of moving and eating on land, they are forced to leave the now barren lake in a desperate search for food - animal, vegetable or human.','/pyiyftwx05BIsx2pephTuadHEnX.jpg','2004-03-13',77,'Released',NULL,'Snakehead Terror',37947,1.4411,4.5,'Q2S7zB6OoeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18524,_binary '\0','/9btzUjRWAhhfO2xrujsSolYPX7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372122',5.8,3406,'en','Adam & Steve','Adam and Steve are two gay youths who have a one-night stand that ends embarrassingly. Nearly two decades later, Adam, now a Manhattan tour guide, and Steve, a psychiatrist, meet again -- but neither remembers the other from years before. The two begin dating, even playing matchmaker for their friends Michael and Rhonda, but their promising relationship hits a major snag when Adam and Steve finally recall their past connection.','/peATXTLxUsLkWTa7S7R9dtLxbRF.jpg','2005-04-24',99,'Released','A tempting new comedy','Adam & Steve',17021,2.1448,5.4,'970IMbt9JkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18525,_binary '\0','/fE7RqvVHbGHjBC9NjIjlLh2t4zK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372183',7.7,518068,'en','The Bourne Supremacy','A CIA operation to purchase classified Russian documents is blown by a rival agent, who then shows up in the sleepy seaside village where Bourne and Marie have been living. The pair run for their lives and Bourne, who promised retaliation should anyone from his former life attempt contact, is forced to once again take up his life as a trained assassin to survive.','/jupG9sFT64YwM8PSkwkUD2wHcYD.jpg','2004-07-23',108,'Released','They should have left him alone.','The Bourne Supremacy',2502,16.3366,7.335,'ofMkaGkyAPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18526,_binary '\0','/pfojsC4a1wLzWGPZjHJBM1vIbUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372237',5.9,49917,'en','Guess Who','When a young African-American woman brings her fiancé home to meet her parents, she\'s neglected to mention one tiny detail – he\'s white.','/8BF6qSAANBvhEPZxQVTUiZbfiOy.jpg','2005-03-25',105,'Released','Some in-laws were made to be broken.','Guess Who',11638,7.7712,6,'2Nef33uJ_VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18527,_binary '\0','/ltI7NLGZB5TR0C9zdCW2BEMiVGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372279',7.5,2597,'en','Festival Express','The filmed account of a large Canadian rock festival train tour boasting major acts. In the summer of 1970, a chartered train crossed Canada carrying some of the world\'s greatest rock bands. The Grateful Dead, Janis Joplin, The Band, Buddy Guy, and others lived (and partied) together for five days, stopping in major cities along the way to play live concerts. Their journey was filmed.','/5ehULJQMNCdASy2i7jaTbcIvQKA.jpg','2003-09-19',90,'Released','Festival Express... The longest party in rock-n-roll history.','Festival Express',14770,1.2573,7.2,'qX_RZ9ufkYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18528,_binary '\0','/xjBSc1RSiUOwC3lBZxJ0vcsMXhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372303',5.2,1727,'en','The Good Shepherd','When a clergyman is accused for the murder of a social worker, the parish priest recruits a reporter (and his ex-girlfriend) to clear his name.','/AkNl18FRZcbuifRo6rYvVuYtVrf.jpg','2004-03-21',88,'Released',NULL,'The Good Shepherd',10356,2.4013,5.3,'dopMKyIJQV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18529,_binary '\0','/98opTQ1UGgR1UVpOoLYVOh67JMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372334',6.8,10313,'en','House of D','In the present, artist Tom Warshaw recalls his traumatic coming of age. As a 13-year-old growing up in New York City in 1973, Tom hangs out with Pappass, a mentally disabled man. With Tom\'s mother battling depression after the death of her husband, the young boy is left to his own devices. When Tom develops a crush on schoolmate Melissa, Pappass feels abandoned and begins behaving erratically.','/oVBMJQKHVTbXM8vEph3RhS4mKgr.jpg','2004-05-07',97,'Released','See the world a little differently.','House of D',24363,4.3821,6.303,'3w00GXmJ8KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18530,_binary '\0','/wjLJydMD09fyFq57SOLYhCYakkX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372366',6.9,1922,'ru','Коктебель','A widowed aeronautics engineer, who has lost his job, travels with his son hopping freight trains from Moscow to Koktebel, a town by the Black Sea, to start a new life with the father\'s sister.','/4Sacy3mxqVRhR793WKaHSewyGwe.jpg','2003-09-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Roads to Koktebel',49653,1.3792,6.2,'vCRPXQyDfsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18531,_binary '\0','/8KA6W4CsHSFCFDPUCVqrOdWZtQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372478',7.2,2213,'ru','Прогулка','Today’s twenty-something Russians are the first generation in the country’s post-communist history to have grown up free. Their twenties are the age of freedom, of fast-changing events and intense emotions. Perhaps only at this age they can live a whole life in one day. A young girl and her two accident companions walk halfway around St.-Petersburg; they flirt and tease each other, and for ninety minutes they act out a real-time romantic drama. This stroll is full of laughter and tears against a backdrop of the hustle and bustle of the streets.','/97Fo6WpJComuBIuOgUd4HZPKHJ6.jpg','2003-09-20',90,'Released',NULL,'The Stroll',23898,1.1716,6.3,'xXTLIHbYusM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18532,_binary '\0','/jOF3m9ajvpxGAoYvUzFsgZ4mAqJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372532',6.1,60161,'en','The Wedding Date','With the wedding of her younger sister fast approaching, Kat Ellis faces the undesirable prospect of traveling alone to London for the ceremony. While this is bad enough, Jeffrey, the man who left her as they moved closer to marriage, happens to be the groom\'s best man. Determined to show everyone -- most of all Jeffrey -- that her romantic life is as full and thrilling as ever, Kat hires a charming male escort as her date.','/x3o3VMEdwct54uLZmuzI4iyi2Zh.jpg','2005-02-04',88,'Released','Love doesn\'t come cheap.','The Wedding Date',6961,5.3996,6.8,'DS1bOLtMNfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18533,_binary '\0','/5jQEcjppZnQnBAVN10uWPk6IKUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372588',7.2,186163,'en','Team America: World Police','When North Korean ruler Kim Jong-il orchestrates a global terrorist plot, it\'s up to the heavily armed, highly specialized Team America unit to stop his dastardly scheme. The group, which has recruited troubled Broadway actor Gary Johnston, not only has to face off against Jong-il, but they must also contend with the Film Actors Guild, a cadre of Hollywood liberals at odds with Team America\'s \'policing the world\' tactics.','/m1Q2VFe1DVVbjfu1LDZe7tlp9yb.jpg','2004-10-10',98,'Released','Freedom hangs by a thread.','Team America: World Police',3989,6.7757,6.727,'kMyJWuvW_9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18534,_binary '\0','/p5FXEFFR8Zzo2WuLEw9jPuKXGKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372594',6.4,3929,'fi','Vares – Yksityisetsivä','On the trail of a woman, Vares finds himself caught up with underworld characters who are on the trail of hidden millions.','/xkNp84MJnXBXj3q7SFZuaoapUTw.jpg','2004-07-23',95,'Released','That summer a woman was running with the devil and it rained more than ever…','Vares: Private Eye',37988,1.0513,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18535,_binary '\0','/sSDRNbPa7eUv5yN7cAVSCwn8FEq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372782',6,2199,'ko','바람난 가족','A woman, married and with a child but becoming increasingly distant from her husband who is already cheating on her, reluctantly enters a secret relationship with her neighbor, a teenage boy.','/u1txTG5duqYDe4b9RAZTTlBJMYV.jpg','2003-08-14',106,'Released','A good wife, a cheating husband, a very sexy family drama...','A Good Lawyer\'s Wife',61952,3.2451,5.7,'3hfHvNbEgaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18536,_binary '\0','/9IIBboV7MCT0bTxzXHmWK1Hq558.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372784',8.2,1744254,'en','Batman Begins','Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City. Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.','/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg','2005-06-10',140,'Released','Evil fears the knight.','Batman Begins',272,32.5335,7.73,'FiL1_5DWV7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18537,_binary '\0','/eWYrrdCKd4bjOKB9DB0HtRUhI1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372824',7.9,72894,'fr','Les Choristes','In 1940s France, a new teacher at a school for disruptive boys gives hope and inspiration.','/hUl7gSvkGygyk9wt3zy5NqpC5bb.jpg','2004-03-17',97,'Released',NULL,'The Chorus',5528,11.0181,7.747,'QVtJgU6WTj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18538,_binary '\0','/o0CAEE2zY7PgRRmTBvcC7dkZc42.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372832',2.1,2247,'en','Skeleton Man','A co-ed group of Special Forces agents search the wilderness for a predator type creature that has been on a killing spree.','/eLncuEmiPLIiihGVH6LMlNHlJ40.jpg','2004-03-01',89,'Released','Not Even Death Will Stop Him','Skeleton Man',56527,2.2794,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18539,_binary '\0','/5WWqrUIGrCb1QvZtYVaSfZgUG8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372873',3.5,26362,'ko','디 워','Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he\'ll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior\'s beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.','/rEpvqWGu08coDLUpcpiz4sMoDYo.jpg','2007-08-01',90,'Released','They\'ve made our world their battleground.','Dragon Wars: D-War',10253,4.1698,4.6,'LbF4DtgO_yY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18540,_binary '\0','/AkU2fKVAEj7evLl6q1akIdU1YGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372884',5.8,6686,'en','Eating Out','After getting dumped by his slutty girlfriend, Caleb falls in love with Gwen. However, thanks to Caleb\'s roommate, Gwen thinks he\'s gay and sets him up with her roommate, Marc.','/xSbgNViEhXOFpaAZ1nB1AEC4pwg.jpg','2004-02-14',84,'Released','The fastest way to a girl\'s heart is through her gay best friend.','Eating Out',14681,1.5959,5.705,'Cvxear7o4JY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18541,_binary '\0','/9juVj3F7dFanjMrbaGb7AruYVgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372909',4.9,3481,'it','Fallo!','Lies, subterfuge, betrayal and mischief. Fallo! is a collection of six stories based on the joys of sexuality and the eroticism of a new generation of women.','/C5HakXfAFQMDZX0HplcjZIdv0i.jpg','2003-08-28',86,'Released','The maestro of Italian erotica is back!','Private',30287,0,5.3,'RrfQn5W9R6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18542,_binary '\0','/jnpB7EUBFXz8RhnrNvJehB8xIKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372921',3.6,1474,'en','Flesh for the Beast','Six parapsychologists investigate a reputed haunted mansion and are set upon by three flesh-eating succubus ladies under the control of the sinister warlock owner bent on finding a mysterious amulet to give himself more power.','/kYphnvI5CT863qV2E0FlBcCEDM0.jpg','2003-09-27',89,'Released','Open the gate. Step in. Lose your mind.','Flesh for the Beast',27272,1.7758,3.6,'6FVmldP9nn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18543,_binary '\0','/7JkFjyQDmN015TTfzQU6laone6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0372937',6.3,3826,'ko','거울 속으로','Woo Yeong-min retired from the police force after trying to save his partner and causing his death. After a series of mysterious deaths in the shopping mall in which his uncle has allowed him to work as a security guard prior to its reopening, he must face both his own fear of mirrors and the mystery surrounding the fire that closed down the mall.','/tCXA0sCvmxRMCSDpnYYPgcJOXOV.jpg','2003-08-14',113,'Released','In the deep night, if you live alone, don\'t look in the mirror!','Into the Mirror',27316,2.1236,6.3,'702Cpythwgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18544,_binary '\0','/6qzpKiZ3XdKpg34GTNlLLeO8mv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373024',7,10453,'en','Imaginary Heroes','Matt Travis is good-looking, popular, and his school\'s best competitive swimmer, so everyone is shocked when he inexplicably commits suicide. As the following year unfolds, each member of his family struggles to recover from the tragedy with mixed results.','/tHMgJGkovOFpHi2lnQ9xTrIaR7N.jpg','2004-09-14',111,'Released','People are never who they seem to be.','Imaginary Heroes',25350,2.4223,6.5,'66t8HdBVdPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18545,_binary '\0','/Adlc8JMVEXOelFO6hYpIYcGBx2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373051',5.8,143099,'en','Journey to the Center of the Earth','On a quest to find out what happened to his missing brother, a scientist, his nephew and their mountain guide discover a fantastic and dangerous lost world in the center of the earth.','/kL55wY0s2H9JdwfjoWIp9plvYnl.jpg','2008-07-10',93,'Released','Same planet. Different world.','Journey to the Center of the Earth',88751,12.8657,6.101,'Dk0v8pe7tzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18546,_binary '\0','/9XhZhoSnFJ3AjpfzdIiZVHLQIS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373074',7.7,166495,'cn','功夫','It\'s the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.','/exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg','2004-02-10',99,'Released','So many gangsters… so little time.','Kung Fu Hustle',9470,15.5917,7.518,'-m3IB7N_PRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18547,_binary '\0','/lWka0Rp7dhUu5ijstVW77IjphGG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373175',7.4,3467,'en','My Architect: A Son\'s Journey','World-famous architect Louis Kahn (Exeter Library, Salk Institute, Bangladeshi Capitol Building) had two illegitimate children with two different women outside of his marriage. Son Nathaniel always hoped that someday his father would come and live with him and his mother, but Kahn never left his wife. Instead, Kahn was found dead in a men\'s room in Penn Station when Nathaniel was only 11.','/flpuP2Y2qUkVGghsOYkxj0HkgB9.jpg','2003-11-12',116,'Released','A man. His buildings. His secret lives.','My Architect: A Son\'s Journey',50314,1.5424,6.9,'0HxB9Iu3Hbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18548,_binary '\0','/vxGdyxwpHIavn4jNJQeR8A7nqgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373280',6.7,1436,'en','Sucker Free City','The film follows three young men as they are drawn into lives of crime. Nick (Crowley) uses his entry-level corporate job to commit credit card fraud and deals drugs on the side. K-Luv (Mackie) is a member of the \"V-Dubs\", an African-American street gang. Lincoln (Leung) is a rising figure in the Chinese mafia. Gentrification forces Nick\'s family to move out of their home in the Mission District into Hunter\'s Point where they are harassed by the V-Dubs. K-Luv\'s side business of selling bootleg compact discs leads him to enlist Nick\'s help to bootleg CDs and to negotiate a truce with Lincoln. Lincoln conducts an affair with his boss\' daughter Angela (Carpio), a Stanford student engaged to a medical student classmate.','/1F5fspEEqpK5MkpfFLicNMYRoFM.jpg','2004-09-16',113,'Released','ON THESE STREETS, EVERYBODY\'S GOT A GANG','Sucker Free City',65724,1.4205,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18549,_binary '\0','/nTyyyUg8p5EWfze3haCzL6aKWfj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373283',6.6,22134,'en','Saints and Soldiers','Five American soldiers fighting in Europe during World War II struggle to return to Allied territory after being separated from U.S. forces during the historic Malmedy Massacre.','/A4LgmMTiRpkEzC6pxRcxE28IDov.jpg','2003-09-11',90,'Released','Trapped behind enemy lines. All they have is their hope.','Saints and Soldiers',10105,3.7667,6.3,'jWygHIALgLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18550,_binary '\0','/4ODyigwyu03HZqFhvQqD5tpHwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373416',4.4,6066,'en','Underclassman','A young detective goes undercover at an elite private school to destroy an international stolen car ring.','/kOpQ5doAbDaxKyGq91PugsCTOYO.jpg','2005-09-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Underclassman',19803,2.4426,4.924,'TugBJXuy4bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18551,_binary '\0','/3V617MptZZj3nReODRU59K0Z66K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373445',5.5,6340,'en','The Wendell Baker Story','Luke Wilson plays a good-hearted ex-con who gets a job in a retirement hotel. Three elderly residents help him win back his girlfriend as he lends them a hand in fighting hotel corruption.','/sdBiC4J0QMDOoPzX4eudGnTM0MJ.jpg','2005-08-03',99,'Released','Why not call him a hero?','The Wendell Baker Story',12183,2.7529,5.1,'pTnXpNdP8Tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18552,_binary '\0','/rMXqN3gXG66W4BzX0AMbpnZN41I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373450',6.4,19740,'en','Where the Truth Lies','An ambitious reporter probes the reasons behind the sudden split of a 1950s comedy team.','/4gWQoxAmSeBaugpccnWdlg5Ov6f.jpg','2005-10-07',107,'Released','Your best friend could be your worst enemy.','Where the Truth Lies',9729,4.3559,6.2,'34780SshixA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18553,_binary '\0','/kKdBNPXfjENj3wG5qtiCrZ2wflp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373469',7.4,251381,'en','Kiss Kiss Bang Bang','A petty thief posing as an actor is brought to Los Angeles for an unlikely audition and finds himself in the middle of a murder investigation along with his high school dream girl and a detective who\'s been training him for his upcoming role...','/aWfjIkpENFX6Uw82pET7EQ6jnrd.jpg','2005-09-14',103,'Released','Sex. Murder. Mystery. Welcome to the party.','Kiss Kiss Bang Bang',5236,9.0272,7.157,'x7L-kF5Im1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18554,_binary '\0','/73P0GdsDxPN12H5WWOpXydAvhvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373653',5.5,1927,'en','12 Days of Terror','July of 1916 was a time of record heat, a polio epidemic, and a World War in Europe. But beachgoers in New Jersey are threatened by a even greater terror: a shark that has suddenly developed a taste for human flesh. Starting July 1st and lasting over a period of 12 days, the unidentified shark kills four people and seriously injures a fifth before the attacks stop, and threatens New Jersey\'s thriving tourist industry. Based on true events, and one of the inspirations behind Peter Benchley\'s Jaws.','/5H1p1ljwpDuXQgbzesb5kYoXoVl.jpg','2004-05-01',86,'Released','The True Story of the New Jersey Man-Eater.','12 Days of Terror',153102,1.9242,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18555,_binary '\0','/iJBusqvrFtJ76J2kND1SUmJSaib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373690',5.4,7784,'fr','Arsène Lupin','As the daring thief Arsène Lupin ransacks the homes of wealthy Parisians, the police, with a secret weapon in their arsenal, attempt to ferret him out.','/eAXpjyyZ48bDrXaCGZOYvoBDc08.jpg','2004-10-13',131,'Released','Find out how it all started','Arsène Lupin',11540,4.3964,5.288,'sWCT3SpBqrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18556,_binary '\0','/hNpExSqRqOzrQZ0U63xkqubt4eO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373712',5.4,1500,'no','Bare Bea','16 year-old Bea is in her first year at upper secondary school in Oslo. Active on the school magazine, she falls in love with Daniel, the smartest and most gifted student in the top year, who returns her feelings. There is just one drawback, namely her friend\' idea of virginity and first love...','/8ejChMekZyl3lAzzvGlo0OCDQLg.jpg','2004-01-23',86,'Released','First Time Sucks','Just Bea',38398,0.9565,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18557,_binary '\0','/65JIeiuARQOJp81pBZPlJ85BnGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373733',7.2,4501,'ta','பாய்ஸ்','The story centers on six youngsters, who experience the downfalls of teenage life. The film conveys a message about the importance of a good education and career over other distractions, such as romance and sex.','/oQBEA5Slv40HHHM5WA1ey8D7nnl.jpg','2003-08-29',172,'Released',NULL,'Boys',75076,2.1414,6.694,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18558,_binary '\0','/otswcE6OAPKMlZzBKCpuFNeEdS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373747',7.4,3547,'pt','Casa de Areia','A woman is taken along with her mother in 1910 to a far-away desert by her husband, and after his passing, is forced to spend the next 59 years of her life hopelessly trying to escape it.','/x6XEC7B7bJ9igsxkQb9ZMFEAv9f.jpg','2005-05-13',115,'Released',NULL,'The House of Sand',29262,1.6492,6.7,'algdilTBfRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18559,_binary '\0','/tnf0o78SWhaLqMgfdqhNwsPeDUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373760',7.3,3407,'pt','Cinema, Aspirinas e Urubus','1942, in the middle of Northeastern Brazil, two very different men meet along the road: Johan, an aspirin salesman avoiding the German draft, and Ranulpho, a rural Brazilian seeking escape from the drought.','/8lCLU3vMgauPutirtcbHDC3pRUI.jpg','2005-05-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Cinema, Aspirins and Vultures',43420,1.6339,6.9,'faIt3KwLWQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18560,_binary '\0','/nQJOH9jAMOsjwcNyNmvbPLCsvWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373786',3.9,1329,'ja','デビルマン','A scientific exploration in search of a new energy source unleashes a group of powerful demons who begin possessing human bodies and destroying civilization. Close friends Akira and Ryo wind up on different sides of this epic struggle. Akira’s inner strength allows him to maintain his identity and fight for good, but the weaker Ryo is completely overtaken by Satan himself.','/aTzh9x9WYdUKcisNkGNlaccVBF2.jpg','2004-10-09',116,'Released',NULL,'Devilman',36166,1.8923,6.1,'meaivOyt33k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18561,_binary '\0','/coML7p8C5YUsEDLL4tACUGLXRTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373856',7.8,19262,'hi','Gangaajal','An honest Superintendent of Police, IPS Amit Kumar, is assigned to a crime infested town to reduce its crime rates. There, he soon learns that cleaning up the town also means confronting the corruption among police and politicians.','/ihEE4nyTglmbHp4NSZQHtZtnnmK.jpg','2003-08-29',157,'Released',NULL,'Gangaajal',46428,1.1323,6.7,'cf5mD-Q05_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18562,_binary '\0','/8jB2BJAbXTVAUl3GvbyGCEXKXMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373861',7.4,6614,'mn','Die Geschichte vom weinenden Kamel','When a Mongolian nomadic family\'s newest camel colt is rejected by its mother, a musician is needed for a ritual to change her mind.','/c3SAAO5hNJqLWLlJr9TZ6CQ8eGI.jpg','2004-08-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Story of the Weeping Camel',1114,2.7022,7.1,'aDpneKa9YxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18563,_binary '\0','/uEnA2AKtrpX4LCZ98hBLwVkhJEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373883',6.1,140055,'en','Halloween','The early years of young Michael Myers and the events leading up to his fateful Halloween night murder rampage in the quiet town of Haddonfield, Illinois.','/cD8JrfSEI4j7WVnKM1GdiYzMoUh.jpg','2007-08-31',110,'Released','Evil has a destiny.','Halloween',2082,9.2197,6.241,'4DvAAGrxT3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18564,_binary '\0','/9svsJni0pNROt53QBEj9JqZMuEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373889',7.5,711407,'en','Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix','When a new professor\'s methods leave Hogwarts unprepared to fight the rising tide of evil, Harry teaches students how to defend against the dark arts.','/5aOyriWkPec0zUDxmHFP9qMmBaj.jpg','2007-07-08',138,'Released','The rebellion begins.','Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix',675,35.3012,7.673,'47PHbQTmw5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18565,_binary '\0','/m9Vn0PUq2j5LX3WYtZ7BKOlGxbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373908',3.5,7758,'en','The Honeymooners','Working class New York bus driver Ralph Kramden is always coming up with get-rich-quick schemes for him and his best friend, Ed Norton, who\'s always around to help him get in (and out of) trouble.','/97rcPjnmzrIH8raQ2CU2ptY0gdy.jpg','2005-06-10',90,'Released','Dream big. Scheme bigger.','The Honeymooners',21295,3.3724,4.059,'eOQY1HvR3Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18566,_binary '\0','/A5mBIAtZOqVpAVUXolwtOnaQcZc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373926',6.4,116504,'en','The Interpreter','After Silvia Broome, an interpreter at United Nations headquarters, overhears plans of an assassination, an American Secret Service agent is sent to investigate.','/wTidq3J9fh8sEOAlD8WZFHVLSuB.jpg','2005-04-08',128,'Released','The truth needs no translation.','The Interpreter',179,13.5157,6.3,'a7O8mPlNlRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18567,_binary '\0','/x1i0wTxKqT86n1M71GBnc13mxLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0373981',7.6,28592,'hu','Kontroll','A subway enforcement officer working in the oppressively gray Budapest metro gets a chance at love — but first he needs to find out why passengers are jumping — or being pushed — to their deaths onto the tracks.','/rEf7jXTm4oaI4YWTLlqQCukn63j.jpg','2003-11-20',107,'Released','There\'s no such thing as a free ride.','Kontroll',5204,2.2142,7.2,'Dx5Rt2BPLLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18568,_binary '\0','/vlKBYymF54exCFe99kObyTSHnFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374089',5.8,4118,'ru','Nomad','The Nomad is a historical epic set in 18th-century Kazakhstan. The film is a fictionalised account of the youth and coming-of-age of Ablai Khan, as he grows and fights to defend the fortress at Hazrat-e Turkestan from Dzungar invaders.','/vLHtz57xpPBrIl9YAhEgC29LCyk.jpg','2005-07-17',112,'Released','Courage know no limit','Nomad: The Warrior',19495,3.0749,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18569,_binary '\0','/58BUQzjN6TH0bLe6JEfgMbHc55u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374102',5.8,59638,'en','Open Water','Two divers are left out at sea without a boat. There’s nothing but water for miles, unless they look at what’s underneath them...','/7Gy5N0Yp7ocaKBR860v9KDbpYHj.jpg','2004-08-06',79,'Released','Scream all you want.','Open Water',83,3.4244,5.55,'Z9q1qJi1nMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18570,_binary '\0','/55DYbx4ZG9qXpRr6Wto4qYxNayn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374128',6.5,3167,'sr','Pljačka Trećeg rajha','During 1941 in Belgrade, two well-known thieves try to carry out the biggest robbery of Nazi authorities ever.','/6Bod3gQCB3LTn5SrRkV54drgN5E.jpg','2004-02-16',105,'Released',NULL,'The Robbery of the Third Reich',33611,0.9731,5.8,'M9hBFzIrGtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18571,_binary '\0','/lb8i0BNMBArwWEYQ2jAIp1kgdmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374153',6.6,2485,'fa','رقص در غبار‎‎','When forced to divorce his wife by family and social pressure because her mother is a prostitute, Nazar works double shifts to pay back the loan he took out for his impulsive wedding and to pay some ongoing restitution to his sweet jilted bride, Reyhaneh. When he falls behind in the payments he flees the police and ends up in the desert with an uncommunicative old man who catches poisonous snakes for their venom. These two are forced to coexist in the desert, because Nazar is unwilling to return to the city and wants to catch snakes to make enough money to settle his debts. His verbose, chattering annoys the reticent old man until Nazar\'s life is endangered.','/lZgTn4EcpPVeBTbzHttGfOfKE0k.jpg','2004-01-23',95,'Released',NULL,'Dancing in the Dust',89066,1.0364,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18572,_binary '\0','/cyVJTvrWYEmTNJRV0Fc1iGcUArD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374180',5.2,3859,'en','Romasanta','A terror is stalking the land: people are disappearing daily, their bodies appearing covered in savage gashes coupled with precise surgical cuts. The legend of the \'Werewolf of Allariz\' spreads across the land like wildfire. When Barbara (Elsa Pataky) falls in love with travelling vendor Manuel Romasanta, she is at first besotted with him - but soon begins to be suspicious of him. What has happened to her sister, who - after being escorted by Romasanta to the city - seems to have disappeared forever.','/yMVYoaAHA85fgH7CLKK7rimyPaX.jpg','2004-05-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Romasanta: The Werewolf Hunt',12653,1.9982,5.179,'YE29iH-LEQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18573,_binary '\0','/yVgv80XIDcl1RGqT4Q1qVmnKlnr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374184',6.6,3625,'cn','大隻佬','A monk turned body-builder, with the gift to see into people\'s lives, befriends a female cop, and uses his gift to change the force of Karma and her destiny.','/3cykM7YvqhRgMwAuaxDNZQjz0SV.jpg','2003-09-27',94,'Released','He is a monk. He knows kung fu. And, he can see the future.','Running on Karma',32233,2.7491,6.529,'7h3te1p6eNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18574,_binary '\0','/lDQ7Dh3dEL46K3B7RB6hFoOHXc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374248',6.9,4524,'en','Strings','The story of Prince Hal who sets out to avenge his dead father against the city\'s rivals, the Zeriths, little knowing it was his wicked uncle Nezo who is the real killer, with his own designs on the throne.','/lJJ5ePSlmx3BZ8jFPndboIA60iH.jpg','2004-10-24',88,'Released','We are all connected.','Strings',21290,2.4272,6.6,'vX_34cIOx9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18575,_binary '\0','/zTD3td14GjguCVufmTdYfpxRVPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374252',5.7,2109,'en','Sugar','Cliff receives an unusual 18th birthday gift from his younger sister — marijuana, alcohol, a subway token and the mission to lose his virginity. This results in Cliff meeting a young street hustler named Butch. At first, as Butch introduces Cliff to gay street life in Toronto, Cliff is excited by his new relationship. But as the two grow closer, he finds that Butch has problems, including drug addiction, that are cause for serious concern.','/UHmjRNgnSNG3bXlfjQ5OGwmFoG.jpg','2004-05-22',78,'Released','Everyone has a fix.','Sugar',36799,1.4556,5,'m3UGbdvWoHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18576,_binary '\0','/gVZJoulxZqNfSgCUwGGoQx1BB3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374271',7.2,22845,'hi','Tere Naam','A rowdy ex-college boy who, after a hazing session, loses his heart to first year student Nirjara, a traditional Brahmin girl.','/pOWPLmEzta4gAEfZwjnVuamDxY0.jpg','2003-08-15',132,'Released','Unfortunately, a true love story','Tere Naam',56969,2.4241,6.4,'p4cChXSkEiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18577,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374273',5.2,1386,'en','The Tesseract','A psychologist, an Englishman, a bellboy and a wounded female assasin have their fates crossed at a sleazy Bangkok hotel.','/nk7ReOEX2Mp8z2g18F62WrBzBHQ.jpg','2004-06-19',93,'Released',NULL,'The Tesseract',26541,1.6672,4.8,'5Z2HlvlrGmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18578,_binary '\0','/zqyPV2phegZVytG7XFfNrdHDkMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374277',6.5,4607,'en','Touch of Pink','Alim is a gay man living in London to escape the domineering eye of his conservative Muslim mother, Nuru, back in Canada. Alim keeps his homosexuality secret from his mother, so when she comes for a surprise visit, he and his boyfriend, Giles, must put on a straight facade to hide the truth.','/8FIovz3tPvxXvBY0bySbuo6cbwD.jpg','2004-07-16',91,'Released','Playing it straight is about to get very complicated.','Touch of Pink',55177,1.8453,6.1,'LAx3wi8UEkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18579,_binary '\0','/r6rKd3nJYH9ivkHks7oc9DbSx9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374279',7,1305,'he','סוף העולם שמאלה','The year is 1968. To a small town in the south of Israel, mostly inhabited by Moroccan immigrants, a few families from India arrive, searching for a better life in the west. The instinct driven Moroccans patronize the \"black\" Indians, while the quiet Indians see the Moroccans as Ignorant and coarse. In this cultural war two girls, Moroccan and Indian, discover the sexual revolution of the 60\'s.','/tFuMLNU3IeWvNMaasJwsDkqbR3T.jpg','2004-06-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Turn Left at the End of the World',26500,1.5636,6.1,'c38-yFyHfT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18580,_binary '\0','/umGLf0T28LOQw8e3zkHL13CQJ4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374294',6.4,1735,'fr','Triple agent','The Popular Front wins elections, the Spanish Civil War begins, and Hitler and Stalin are manipulating and spying. The brilliant exile, Fiodor Voronin, a general at 20, is the deputy at the White Russian Military Union, probably slated to replace the aging Général Dobrinsky soon. Fiodor\'s Greek wife, Arsinoé, paints and stays away from politics, befriending Communist neighbors. Her health declines; the attentive Fiodor arranges care and, against the backdrop of Stalin\'s Great Purge, considers his options. He plays a chess game in which love of country, love of Arsinoé, ideology, petty jealousies, and the machinations of power roil in matters of life and death.','/oelyn9Xx8NRnKAt5oIKRC6XxwIQ.jpg','2004-03-17',115,'Released','A moving epic of love and betrayal...','Triple Agent',65041,1.5342,5.8,'1N9KdExkulU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18581,_binary '\0','/qAaXEiS97kCJugGGZrPtQag6ivx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374298',6.9,5130,'ru','Турецкий гамбит','The film is based on the second book from the Adventures of Erast Petrovich Fandorin series of novels written by the Russian author Boris Akunin. The film takes place in 1877 during the Russian-Turkish war. Erast Fandorin has just escaped from Turkish prison and is trying to get on the Russian side as soon as possible to give important information about the upcoming attack of the enemy. On his way he meets Varvara Suvorova, a young lady who is going to see her fiancée - a soldier of the Russian army. Erast also knows that there is a spy somewhere in the Russian army, everyone is under suspicion.','/sgHkvzl6mcgorOQtr3Dt0Ppf18n.jpg','2005-02-22',130,'Released',NULL,'The Turkish Gambit',53129,1.5362,6.32,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18582,_binary '\0','/cCKeV1TGuhbaA9nTcDIZEIL6F8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374308',6.1,1266,'no','United','Kåre is a youth coach with aspirations to become the greatest football player ever like his idol, Bryan Robson. However, his dreams are starting to take a toll on his relationship with his girlfriend, Anna.','/9xVtfzH8ifD96Ms8Jt8EwmjuNdM.jpg','2003-08-22',85,'Released','Sometimes we could all use a little kick-start!','United',13630,1.3081,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18583,_binary '\0','/aEnAGGbb0pHaiEb2b1Qj5H8FVGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374330',6.3,4544,'zh','天地英雄','A Chinese emissary is sent to the Gobi desert to execute a renegade soldier. When a caravan transporting a Buddhist monk and a valuable treasure is threatened by thieves, however, the two warriors might unite to protect the travelers.','/gvf2IHzIpiAMEv09pdlsniFpsm0.jpg','2003-09-23',114,'Released',NULL,'Warriors of Heaven and Earth',14797,2.8537,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18584,_binary '\0','/fzIZWDF0zdHqSWCiiitQhF5IRdh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374339',6.8,15983,'cn','無間道III: 終極無間','Triad gangster turned corrupt cop Lau Kin-ming goes to dangerous lengths to avoid detection.','/kXTHj16K8Lr1EgwdzuzAB1j4Cy5.jpg','2003-12-12',118,'Released','The Ultimate Showdown.','Infernal Affairs III',14310,5.7512,6.9,'nyzwtsHhLTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18585,_binary '\0','/vKVX9hV2HnCPe8XnauCQKEHQCwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374345',7.2,11060,'nl','De zaak Alzheimer','Vincke and Verstuyft are one of the best detective teams of the Antwerp police force. When they are confronted with the disappearance of a top official and the murder of two prostitutes, the trail leads to the almost retired assassin Angelo Ledda. Since Ledda starts showing symptoms of Alzheimer\'s, it\'s getting more and more difficult to complete his contracts. When he has to murder a 12-year old call-girl, he refuses and becomes a target himself. While Vincke and Verstuyft are chasing him and counting the corpses, Ledda is taking care of his employers.','/rKFzSI5XtDOfXoULnY5TEaNpuMC.jpg','2003-10-15',114,'Released',NULL,'The Memory of a Killer',24860,1.9235,6.709,'bX1OphaziQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18586,_binary '\0','/oixwTGtaXdBo17B0Llpj84ySXdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374358',6.5,1285,'it','È già ieri','Filippo is a star on the Italian TV. He works for a documentary series about wild animals and nature. He is sent to Tenerife (Spain) to shot an issue about the local stork. It is the 13th of August. After he did his job is time to leave, but the ferry couldn\'t operate. He has to spend the night in the island. The day after is again the 13th of August, and Filippo live again the same day for different times. Something has to change to exit the paranoid and unrealistic situation.','/qkTdoEsyqZAdKvhVCtcJuMhQ9HO.jpg','2004-01-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Stork Day',54427,1.2657,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18587,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374497',7.4,1227,'te','అమ్మ నాన్న ఓ తమిళ అమ్మాయి','Chandu is very passionate about kickboxing and his life revolves around his mother and his girlfriend. His life is shattered when his dying mother asks him to meet his estranged father Raghuveer.','/szkBh5ADjZxxAaMoOeZGOBhxzKR.jpg','2003-04-19',154,'Released',NULL,'Amma Nanna O Tamila Ammayi',31350,1.1682,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18588,_binary '\0','/vBVRgryngFoqHazyLqFca6xNTeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374536',4.9,79039,'en','Bewitched','Thinking he can overshadow an unknown actress in the part, an egocentric actor unknowingly gets a witch cast in an upcoming television remake of the classic show \"Bewitched\".','/8lx4EXmAZo8ogh4128UBZRQfCjI.jpg','2005-06-21',102,'Released','Be warned. Be ready.','Bewitched',9722,7.3652,5.1,'hS05j44UKUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18589,_binary '\0','/dgjR7X6WjgjuwJ02idEOxvMyFjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374546',8,91504,'ko','봄 여름 가을 겨울 그리고 봄','An isolated lake, where an old monk lives in a small floating temple. The monk has a young boy living with him, learning to become a monk. We watch as seasons and years pass by.','/6SQQ5REuAz7k0FMQ9mSCT40T2LN.jpg','2003-09-19',103,'Released','What you like, others will also like.','Spring, Summer, Fall, Winter... and Spring',113,6.4837,7.8,'3rIgudJbHek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18590,_binary '\0','/mgiKwR18cagbuasTPnihOmlzXsk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374563',4.6,24447,'en','Captivity','The sought-after images of top model Jennifer adorn magazine covers and billboards worldwide. When alone at a club, she is abducted and incarcerated in a cell with another prisoner. When their captor subjects the two to torture, they commit to escaping the chamber of horrors before they\'re killed.','/diP1wQRnmvKHPFcHGoi0WkUSHXw.jpg','2007-03-01',85,'Released','When You Think The Worst Has Happened... Think Worse','Captivity',14125,3.9236,4.9,'rDp3hXGHm-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18591,_binary '\0','/d752ELVYYWdfqFpyq6tJmHfPKMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374569',6.8,36630,'en','Che: Part Two','Seven years after his triumph in Cuba, Che winds up in Bolivia, where he tries to ignite the same revolutionary fires as before.','/fKQwwWXYQNkrZa59VbnfVy2kfoF.jpg','2008-12-12',135,'Released','The untold story of his final revolution','Che: Part Two',8880,6.6582,6.6,'O7JIkJDxbzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18592,_binary '\0','/jf2FtZmfwURp9IfD6p7zAtCJkUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374583',6.8,5616,'fr','Comme une image','Talented 20-year-old Lolita dreams of a singing career. But her self-esteem is low due to her weight problem and her narcissistic father, Étienne, a literary star with scant interest in his daughter\'s life. Lolita finds little comfort in the attentions of her vocal coach, suspecting the woman is using her to meet her influential father. Étienne\'s second wife proves to be Lolita\'s only trustworthy ally in her private battle to find a sense of worth.','/kRtLMLdf6PkOjWCvhTpa811aMZy.jpg','2004-11-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Look at Me',11399,1.5421,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18593,_binary '\0','/kS6JiKIs2byAPeynKXXoaLrDcLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374584',6.2,8393,'en','Control','Lee Ray Oliver, a death row inmate, is given a second chance at life if he agrees to undergo a new chemical treatment used to modify behavior.','/bhyHkbCwq4IbATninLIWmIRHOvG.jpg','2004-12-07',104,'Released','Sentenced to death... chosen to live... destined to kill again.','Control',9636,2.9264,6.1,'rIh6g5Da1q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18594,_binary '\0','/vLkWOUeqIt1HBxBwXM9Rg0zGc0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374627',4.1,2515,'fr','Double zéro','Ben and Bill are the two worst, completely useless agents - real losers. But who else would you send on a super-difficult top-secret mission? The French have just sold a new high-power M51 rocket to the Russians for crazy money. Unfortunately for them, the rocket was hijacked before they could get it of their hands. However, not just any fool is up to neutralizing this threat, but only the craziest and most stupid of them can cope with such a task.','/vCPKGHTiuxg3y7JsWfN0ScoWAQ4.jpg','2004-06-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Double zéro',33624,1.8695,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18595,_binary '\0','/2yOQlNiVanHwBEbTaIzf5oOI60L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374639',6.4,4778,'en','Incident at Loch Ness','When renowned director Werner Herzog and fellow filmmaker Zak Penn set off to explore the legend of Scotland\'s Loch Ness monster, they uncover much more than they bargained for. Unexplained sightings of the creature and chaos among the crew create an uneasy feeling that things aren\'t what they seem.','/hsBmbcL4KiZerEwFJO4BHlvnbA8.jpg','2004-12-17',94,'Released','This fall... there\'s something in the water.','Incident at Loch Ness',48463,2.1606,5.8,'MNtADqCQ_Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18596,_binary '\0','/kVftNpJHp6ahi7MhW6XRZkoLzCL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374853',5.7,3527,'en','Malice in Wonderland','A modern take on the classic fairytale, Alice in Wonderland, set in South East England.An American law student in London. Knocked down by a black cab, she wakes with amnesia in a world that\'s a million miles from home - Wonderland. We follow her adventures as she\'s dragged through an underworld filled with twisted individuals and the lowest low-lifers, by the enigmatic cab driver, Whitey. She needs to find out who she is, where she\'s from and use what wits she has left to get back home in one piece. As her journey progresses she discovers nothing is what it seems, realizes that fate and life are terminally entwined, and finds true love lurking in the unlikeliest place.','/azesynSFVrwZbBpATRP7lGbTpoo.jpg','2010-02-05',87,'Released','Guns, Gangsters, Pimps & Prostitutes. Wonderland just got dirtier.','Malice in Wonderland',32407,1.5325,5.3,'KudE_03ilWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18597,_binary '\0','/smaFFzbd1flJKUqDI2ylljQ8Pki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374887',8.2,99667,'hi','मुन्ना भाई एम बी बी एस','A gangster sets out to fulfill his father\'s dream of becoming a doctor.','/OjJ2eZFMr0InHxjYCQXwxDoo4v.jpg','2003-12-19',156,'Released','He Might Just Cure You','Munna Bhai M.B.B.S.',19625,2.6671,7.2,'6lCGvu-hwX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18598,_binary '\0','/vVMMgWiQkXNB6YpE1ecs8FsXDh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0374900',7,259429,'en','Napoleon Dynamite','A listless and alienated teenager decides to help his new friend win the class presidency in their small western high school, while he must deal with his bizarre family life back home.','/6Iv6Uwa2SBLN0dSGM00rdrwN4MJ.jpg','2004-06-11',95,'Released','He\'s out to prove he\'s got nothing to prove.','Napoleon Dynamite',8193,6.7699,6.8,'W1IgJoRJ34Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18599,_binary '\0','/zmuRxro8AxPDjACjXTIIDCUNwDl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375063',7.5,218667,'en','Sideways','Two middle-aged men embark on a spiritual journey through Californian wine country. One is an unpublished novelist suffering from depression, and the other is only days away from walking down the aisle.','/zOsaxYLgvZVU7cJBpPn8CuE0MrP.jpg','2004-10-22',127,'Released','In search of wine. In search of women. In search of themselves.','Sideways',9675,5.7681,7.1,'FccttA8wPqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18600,_binary '\0','/bQFArB0fPMoVTnEKL5P87tEE8tw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375066',7.3,4103,'te','సింహాద్రి','Simhadri, a loyal servant in a landlord\'s house, leads a secret life as Singamalai, a powerful leader in the state of Kerala.','/pTzdNOtWSXB32OGPCI5ayE4NgiX.jpg','2003-07-09',171,'Released',NULL,'Simhadri',80805,1.6743,6.526,'IaEbDf_f2lM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18601,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375093',8.6,2860,'bn','শ্রাবণ মেঘের দিন','The second movie directed by Humayun Ahmed. Revolving around a folk singer, his love interest and the local aristocratic family\'s involvement, the movie offered some beautiful folk songs like Amar Gaye Joto Dukhkho Shoy by Bari Siddiqui. Golam Mustafa, Zahid Hasan, Mahfuz, Mukti and Shaon played the main characters in the film.','/g7qNeNb7aht8AjX2hqcp37abUqA.jpg','1999-12-11',150,'Released',NULL,'Srabon Megher Din',93531,0.7174,7.318,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18602,_binary '\0','/xRcACL8ifYEwoESpRC6vEvUQEYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375100',4.6,2216,'sv','Strandvaskaren','Three students murdered at century-old boarding school. Killer drowned himself; body never found. On 100th anniversary of killings, student researching incident vanishes, along with others, as dark presence haunts school.','/5Anms2X90NWqINDodUVoIPGXXIm.jpg','2004-10-14',100,'Released',NULL,'Drowning Ghost',58384,1.5171,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18603,_binary '\0','/1HgzSoXcRXt1OxnDZMw2KcqqTyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375104',6.6,4339,'en','Bobby Jones: Stroke of Genius','The story of golf icon and legend, Bobby Jones, who retired from competition at the tender age of 28.','/wzbV4jsCWZqOEAmyjjGemLNZbK7.jpg','2004-04-30',120,'Released',NULL,'Bobby Jones: Stroke of Genius',24747,3.5057,5.9,'eEnEAUXL4Tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18604,_binary '\0','/cmmOLD0UOrw8rJ2WBb3rvEUhkE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375154',6.8,56507,'en','Tristan & Isolde','An affair between the second in line to Britain\'s throne and the princess of the feuding Irish spells doom for the young lovers.','/r7TpY5hJ4jQGH7c8yzJgBnTwPH6.jpg','2006-04-07',125,'Released','Fighting countries can still love...','Tristan & Isolde',9044,7.8291,6.688,'LAJJay0Uv4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18605,_binary '\0','/fTs7kWfwaYpM8OuzMMoimsMSTUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375173',6.2,56857,'en','Alfie','A tale of a philosophical womanizer who is forced to question his seemingly carefree existence.','/dvKvkoc2d06cOSheq5hQ7G4FJJX.jpg','2004-10-22',106,'Released','Meet a man who never met a woman he didn\'t love.','Alfie',8849,4.0077,5.857,'3Aluvw2P9ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18606,_binary '\0','/71X982Z2hHTRSc2Ez70cpgeGuVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375210',5.5,53334,'en','White Noise','An architect\'s desire to speak with his wife from beyond the grave using EVP (Electronic Voice Phenomenon), becomes an obsession with supernatural repercussions.','/ncB9SvOclmXYALlcAsF1jRIuISl.jpg','2005-01-07',98,'Released','The line separating the living from the dead has been crossed.','White Noise',11804,5.5929,5.617,'haHHr5_VX7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18607,_binary '\0','/8DlJUfvsKQ6jEcxyuoZNR9ZZ9Xn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375233',6.8,7039,'fr','Innocence','At a peculiar all-girls academy, new arrivals, including Iris, are delivered in coffins. Guided by enigmatic teachers, the students dance through enchanted woods by day, while the night unveils sinister lessons that blur innocence and awakening.','/8ATqAwGvznKn9hgLPS6J5nJgBnB.jpg','2005-01-12',121,'Released','The end of innocence... the beginning of life.','Innocence',33623,2.3266,6.4,'Cuw1BEyUq-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18608,_binary '\0','/t39jaNSYMVNecNPQSVVlW6I4opm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375568',6.3,43492,'en','Astro Boy','Set in the futuristic Metro City, Astro Boy (Atom) is a young robot with incredible powers created by a brilliant scientist in the image of the son he had lost. Unable to fulfill his creator\'s expectations, Astro embarks on a journey in search of acceptance, experiencing betrayal and a netherworld of robot gladiators, before returning to save Metro City and reconcile with the father who rejected him.','/6AK3uOHaIbl6EDaytHYe4FinZMu.jpg','2009-10-15',94,'Released','Have a blast.','Astro Boy',16577,8.7748,6.3,'HIzvNSXXQWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18609,_binary '\0','/cWtejSPmLXq0C5CqIdCHtvIMRfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375571',7.9,5581,'ta','ஆயுத எழுத்து','A goon, who dreams of making it big in life, a student leader, who strives to keep politicians away from college election and a third guy who wants to settle abroad. Their lives change after an incident on a bridge.','/7SJMzuXWaVwjUHfGJaMzU0cTtJB.jpg','2004-05-21',155,'Released',NULL,'Aayitha Ezhuthu',63825,1.379,7.047,'kiuOvdYBCzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18610,_binary '\0','/x2EwZsBJY0NxQl64JeNXI0xPLgQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375611',8.1,37759,'hi','Black','Unable to see, hear, or speak after a childhood illness, a young woman grows up prone to violent outbursts until an eccentric tutor changes her life.','/cFICDU9erHYmlAyCZzbb1adNMgh.jpg','2005-02-04',124,'Released',NULL,'Black',31977,2.1222,7.671,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18611,_binary '\0','/oXthUlbgdSmXxp9bZDW5MU5b9bP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375662',7.4,2021,'nl','Cloaca','Four old college friends in their forties come together in a time of trouble and despair. Old joy relives, but the harsh reality of their problems can\'t satisfy them and eventually endangers their friendships.','/ncrGUZktYG4WxYxngDX1p2XUPFa.jpg','2003-10-23',108,'Released',NULL,'Cloaca',19581,0.87,6.4,'KyYvrP2DDbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18612,_binary '\0','/l5LNCgS4hbNMnt5acKFT9G3LcMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375679',7.7,464370,'en','Crash','In post-Sept. 11 Los Angeles, tensions erupt when the lives of a Brentwood housewife, her district attorney husband, a Persian shopkeeper, two cops, a pair of carjackers and a Korean couple converge during a 36-hour period.','/86BdPC6RDX88NC880pLidKn2LCj.jpg','2005-05-06',112,'Released','Moving at the speed of life, we are bound to collide with each other.','Crash',1640,10.4686,7.212,'dgepOrbliX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18613,_binary '\0','/jogWINBpTbACShEC4ScpSi3m8UY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375735',6.3,11446,'en','Enduring Love','Two strangers become dangerously close after witnessing a deadly accident. On a beautiful cloudless day a young couple celebrate their reunion with a picnic. Joe has planned a postcard-perfect afternoon in the English countryside with his partner, Claire. But as Joe and Claire prepare to open a bottle of champagne, their idyll comes to an abrupt end. A hot air balloon drifts into the field, obviously in trouble. The pilot catches his leg in the anchor rope, while the only passenger, a boy, is too scared to jump down. Joe and three other men rush to secure the basket. But fate has other ideas...','/ogaUARGgXWmNSuh8qnFCcbqVvZL.jpg','2004-10-29',100,'Released','Unexpected. Unpredictable. Uncontrollable. A deadly obsession takes hold.','Enduring Love',9391,3.2019,5.8,'EXiNVFmv0UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18614,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375782',5.6,2594,'en','Gone, But Not Forgotten','Questions about the identity of an amnesiac threaten his romance with the park ranger who rescued him.','/4mvgICD1irRjZycWwfHal0P04Kj.jpg','2003-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Gone, But Not Forgotten',27152,1.3268,5.3,'N-qF7elIej0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18615,_binary '\0','/qyhjOUGsZIzvyJ07Pf8lNrMDsKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375785',5.7,7599,'en','Gray Matters','Sam and Gray are such a well-matched pair that it is difficult to believe they are brother and sister rather than husband and wife. They both share a love of 1940s movies and dancing, and when they meet Charlie, they have something else in common: They both fall in love with her. Sam must deal with unexpected feelings of jealousy, while Gray struggles to come to terms with her sexual orientation.','/dg5kX6v4xbGL0FtNyELGb7wDt9b.jpg','2007-02-23',96,'Released','A romantic comedy about a brother, a sister and the girl of their dreams.','Gray Matters',14845,2.7099,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18616,_binary '\0','/71RBebcMlyTRzi0H2OEIFB8vbgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375878',8,7573,'ta','காக்க காக்க','After a police team kills his brother, a drug-dealing gangster vows to kill the entire team and their respective families.','/d1tXC8fqHr9khx9rt6W6lVSOlmn.jpg','2003-08-01',151,'Released','An episode in a Police officer’s life','Kaakha Kaakha',330629,1.5758,7.388,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18617,_binary '\0','/kKCE0gPUUshGBB2bBNXOfUCxg77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375880',8,2770,'ta','காதல் கொண்டேன்','A genius-yet-introverted orphan, raised by a church priest, is sent to college where he turns out to be a social outcast. Although he is shunned by the majority of the other students, one girl shows him kindness and befriends him. Things take a turn when he falls for her, and she in turn falls for another classmate.','/kqyE6xNR3YsSxbNephE08LvYjtl.jpg','2003-07-04',150,'Released','I Fell In Love.','Kadhal Konden',69533,1.0762,7.783,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18618,_binary '\0','/3uCSWRBRp80URJXgcQ0G1Q55UkL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375911',6.7,2015,'de','Männer wie wir','Ecki is a sweet, closeted gay man who works in his family’s bakery and plays goalie in his small town’s soccer team. When he both loses the big game, and is caught flirting with another player, his homophobic teammates throw him out. He vows to return one day with an all-gay team that will grind the heteros into the dust, so he sets off to find his “dream team.” With the help of his nurse sister, Ecki scours local gay bars and eventually assembles a hilariously motley but endearing crew of misfits that includes a leather-daddy threesome, a femme Turk with Beckham fantasies, a secret straight guy in love with the sister, and a seriously cute nurse eager for some private play-time with the goalie. Ecki now has two problems – turning this bunch into a team, and facing his own fears regarding his first romance.','/JlvC93ZOutHYjXBrx7vFWTatPp.jpg','2004-10-07',106,'Released',NULL,'Guys & Balls',5873,1.1256,6.4,'Zf-EG2U4ZLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18619,_binary '\0','/tUjgRaqoTPgQKfqDx8PjVbpPWrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375912',7.2,209409,'en','Layer Cake','When a seemingly straight-forward drug deal goes awry, XXXX has to break his die-hard rules and turn up the heat, not only to outwit the old regime and come out on top, but to save his own skin...','/rDOxXteqxALBaSa3V3zTjGJuyWB.jpg','2004-09-30',105,'Released','The art of good business is being a good middleman.','Layer Cake',4836,6.1046,6.9,'QtrbWfZtxxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18620,_binary '\0','/NdTaUaxHQzTIUupFKD2YmDT0o1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375920',6.2,38976,'en','The Libertine','The story of John Wilmot, a.k.a. the Earl of Rochester, a 17th century poet who famously drank and debauched his way to an early grave, only to earn posthumous critical acclaim for his life\'s work.','/11bd8chDHTPWUaUwIYIVIfwS99u.jpg','2004-09-16',114,'Released','He didn\'t resist temptation. He pursued it.','The Libertine',7548,4.65,5.9,'T3fZG0HziLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18621,_binary '\0','/xc0ql3Sz2Z6AWRENahcCqMXb01T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0375997',7.6,2907,'ta','நந்தா','Nandha returns after serving his term for killing his father. Although he killed him to save his mother, she does not forgive him. He is then taken in by Periyavar, who shelters Sri Lankan refugees.','/fl7I3LPqyMU1HjeHxxTt0bCDUHk.jpg','2001-11-14',180,'Released',NULL,'Nandha',111614,1.3166,6.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18622,_binary '\0','/kBE4hr418WRLKCE8Jg9WXNVUrZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376006',5.4,1864,'en','Book of Love','Living among fusty academics, an unusual young man gets between a high school history teacher and his wife.','/nY5ZQvQHwWxVzihBfdIu5llGoad.jpg','2004-01-18',83,'Released','When good people do bad things.','Book of Love',120515,1.8183,4.6,'9lgf7PJTCpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18623,_binary '\0','/8iBGlQm72f3nb4piDq1ei2bvNBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376076',8.3,8499,'ta','பிதாமகன்','A young orphan grows up in a graveyard and is devoid of any human feelings; when he leaves the cemetery and meets people, he experiences emotions for the first time.','/rVjlkoD5jfSkSrVJlaBlxFOQ4X0.jpg','2003-10-24',139,'Released',NULL,'Pithamagan',69638,1.2529,7.533,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18624,_binary '\0','/QpKBAkssvvKtJrJLJvbq5I4Ggg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376105',5.3,19533,'en','Racing Stripes','Shattered illusions are hard to repair -- especially for a good-hearted zebra named Stripes who\'s spent his life on a Kentucky farm amidst the sorely mistaken notion that he\'s a debonair thoroughbred. Once he faces the fact that his stark stripes mark him as different, he decides he\'ll race anyway. And with help from the young girl who raised him, he just might end up in the winner\'s circle.','/epDsuf5oUdzTFYHqV2IRcyy8Rwc.jpg','2005-01-06',102,'Released','Cheer \'til you\'re horse!','Racing Stripes',6439,7.5349,5.9,'PL64Q_JM5qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18625,_binary '\0','/eo9RDCkWCAoWgcIkUtJTpst6yOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376108',5.2,14257,'en','Rebound','An acclaimed college hoops coach is demoted to a junior varsity team after a public meltdown.','/4l0Q1lAf4aV3h1LJQ00EpxVQefr.jpg','2005-07-01',86,'Released','A comedy where old school ...meets middle school.','Rebound',7233,6.0487,5.7,'uOAKDKAfieU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18626,_binary '\0','/ed4iq5kHCDnrsvCaXDItZGEUV6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376127',8.4,26978,'ta','அந்நியன்','Unable to tolerate society\'s injustices and devastated by rejection from the woman he loves, a meek lawyer develops a split personality: one side a vengeful vigilante killer punishing evildoers, the other a dashing playboy capable of winning her heart. Complications arise when the three sides begin to collide.','/c00EX1zqb8DppHIRB6d51kN5Y27.jpg','2005-06-17',181,'Released',NULL,'Anniyan',19978,2.3922,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18627,_binary '\0','/jxsWn2D4pk0rgtO3hBzFq9rROZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376136',6.1,110510,'en','The Rum Diary','Tired of the noise and madness of New York and the crushing conventions of late Eisenhower-era America, itinerant journalist Paul Kemp travels to the pristine island of Puerto Rico to write for a local San Juan newspaper run by the downtrodden editor Lotterman. Adopting the rum-soaked lifestyle of the late ‘50s version of Hemingway’s \'The Lost Generation\', Paul soon becomes entangled with a very attractive American woman and her fiancée, a businessman involved in shady property development deals. It is within this world that Kemp ultimately discovers his true voice as a writer and integrity as a man.','/uErFROiMrpk7owQWKK3bpD4hSJs.jpg','2011-10-13',120,'Released','One part outrage. One part justice. Three parts rum. Mix well.','The Rum Diary',23514,7.8813,5.891,'-m0yqS3jodU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18628,_binary '\0','/ywIFHK8CCo8qVZR4ub0p13v3yTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376144',7.3,2727,'ta','சாமி','A policeman accepts bribes from corrupt politicians and local thugs to help them in their illegal work. However, he decides to correct his mistakes after he falls in love with a woman.','/932IkUzs2H5tuRxbKyTO4XdGcty.jpg','2003-05-05',140,'Released',NULL,'Saamy',49029,1.5822,6.485,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18629,_binary '\0','/icCOS7ahBUIAKV3AqxWFyHl4tkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376177',6.8,1843,'es','Seres queridos','A mismatched couple discovers that whatever can go wrong will go wrong during a family visit.','/rCu06B2kU7D74mmSogY1dJYuQ51.jpg','2004-07-09',93,'Released','They seemed a nice, normal family... then he met them!','Only Human',5960,1.252,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18630,_binary '\0','/qT04pLZst3z1HVRhpIzTVGc17wF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376181',6.6,5139,'en','The Shadow Dancer','An aspiring young writer tracks a literary titan suffering from writers block to his refuge in rural Italy and learns about life and love from the irascible genius and his daughters.','/8rAHY4G69iz1hwG6tkeBNupzimz.jpg','2005-05-12',100,'Released','In life every man must find his own path.','Shadows in the Sun',12547,4.9328,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18631,_binary '\0','/s6TsAaBVxgeuUyliarOFqix0Tbt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376196',5.7,4478,'en','Slow Burn','A district attorney is involved in a 24-hour showdown with a gang leader and is, at the same time, being manipulated by an attractive assistant district attorney and a cryptic stranger.','/ho43ENDjPpkuMZvBsGTV1STFFik.jpg','2005-09-12',93,'Released','The truth is just a trick of light.','Slow Burn',18777,2.555,5.4,'ftvoyLIe-qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18632,_binary '\0','/FEKqArMJkdf9AF07c09cPlBGo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376215',6.1,2089,'en','Strip Search','Strip Search follows several parallel stories examining personal freedoms vs. national security in the aftermath of 9/11; two main subplots involve an American woman detained in China and an Arab man detained in New York City.','/lWoZQE5hcVWSLk2X5MKQ8mvOTCu.jpg','2004-04-27',56,'Released',NULL,'Strip Search',41847,1.91,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18633,_binary '\0','/kYeDbAfdI0b5tkd0z49lm22pQYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376479',6.1,19650,'en','American Pastoral','Set in postwar America, a man watches his seemingly perfect life fall apart as his daughter\'s new political affiliation threatens to destroy their family.','/pgpMzdML9FUj3GpDU3LFi7AWbHQ.jpg','2016-10-20',108,'Released','A radically ordinary story.','American Pastoral',326285,5.337,6.161,'079zFCh81L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18634,_binary '\0','/s7oDV92ltdecJ7BTfGSOgsDi900.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376541',7.1,252610,'en','Closer','The relationships of two couples become complicated and deceitful when the man from one couple meets the woman of the other.','/fGGaokx4k00S0J603VG53Qlr9jz.jpg','2004-12-03',104,'Released','If you believe in love at first sight, you never stop looking.','Closer',2288,7.3992,6.8,'bZ6nilkuYeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18635,_binary '\0','/o5M7ylojGgFW8tA3iuq4eirFaTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376543',6.1,7167,'en','Colour Me Kubrick','The true story of a man who posed as director Stanley Kubrick during the production of Kubrick\'s last film, Eyes Wide Shut, despite knowing very little about his work and looking nothing like him.','/gqunu6IHCm6qxGZMDC8pMyRtDfk.jpg','2005-10-06',86,'Released','A True...ish Story','Colour Me Kubrick',13802,2.083,5.7,'gzeKoHgG9jA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18636,_binary '\0','/fjdXDG5WicfJrcx8Orze9RdMrCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376649',5.2,2090,'en','The Hillside Strangler','Kenneth Bianchi is a security guard whose attempts to become a police officer are repeatedly thwarted. He moves to California to live with his cousin Angelo and dates a string of women, becoming increasingly preoccupied with sex. Eventually the cousins decide to start an escort agency. After violently killing a prostitute they thought had betrayed them, Kenneth and Angelo begin committing a series of crimes that become a media sensation.','/161tBJNqn3KH0rIdrhT7VJbOaYi.jpg','2004-11-12',97,'Released','They lived to watch you die.','The Hillside Strangler',24196,1.4343,5.1,'PAeQAj2u7EM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18637,_binary '\0','/dab0TVdngupULeTOdgMde21FEnp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376650',5.4,1575,'es','Hipnos','Dr Sánchez Blanch owns and operates a psychiatric hospital where he specializes in hypnotizing his severely emotionally disturbed patients.','/inrappFLgBO81u1pMb2P8EK6DJr.jpg','2004-10-08',93,'Released','The horror of being dead. The nightmare of still being alive.','Hipnos',19936,2.2752,5.3,'fj_W2U5NYR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18638,_binary '\0','/aUEUmNfVlvh1n9WkCqrSTAgpDQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376717',3,2667,'en','Lady Killers','Calvin and Leonard, two broke losers, are arrested for trying to rob rich old sisters Doris and Betty. The women have a change of heart, drop the charges and invite the the boys over to their mansion. Calvin decides he and Leonard should marry the women, and, when they soon die, live off the inheritance. The ladies, however, have run into their own financial troubles and wed the boys with plans of murdering them for insurance money.','/mOCAfLSo6hkAIdWRCvNwquwsPwy.jpg','2003-06-15',87,'Released','A comedy about two guys who\'d do anything to be on top.','National Lampoon\'s Gold Diggers',44181,1.4058,3.2,'6akH8QHyRMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18639,_binary '\0','/aigJ63ezP6Fm1TGosGcSTTwPrdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376720',4.7,1472,'en','The Last Run','When a young accountant is devastated after discovering his inspiringly beautiful girlfriend is cheating on him, his best friend, who\'s engaged to a girl he doesn\'t love, convinces him to go on a \"run\" and sleep with as many women as he can to get over his heart break.','/7DmOhfeaQSBhfFjodVm2u5RNDaQ.jpg','2004-01-01',97,'Released','When a young accountant is devastated after discovering his inspiringly beautiful girlfriend is cheating on him...','The Last Run',9971,1.7421,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18640,_binary '\0','/pMwk4zeF5CjGMvJasLCYAF34EcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376787',5.3,1658,'te','నాని','An impulsive youngster, who is furious with his mother, seeks assistance from a scientist for a way to become an adult overnight. His wish is granted and he begins look like a 28-year-old man. How will he deal with the complexities of adulthood? How will his relationship with his mother evolve?','/nYt4kIke4B52YksXYRmKlZVDkHP.jpg','2004-05-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Naani',281948,1.3718,5.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18641,_binary '\0','/hgXhCeW8feM89W1hQGPRQV1HLNA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376800',7.6,4677,'es','Noviembre','Impelled by a spirit which still preserves a patina of idealism, Alfredo arrives to Madrid with the intention to create \"a performance that is free, straight from the heart, capable of making people feel alive\". His concept of what acting should be begins beyond the stage, out in the streets face to face with the public. Outdoors, in any town square, in a park or in the city\'s most commercial street, Alfredo and his troupe November start the show; demons to provoke passers-by, displays of social conscience, actions taken to the extreme to put the forces of law and order on full alert. There are no limits, no censorship; only ideas which are always valid so long as the public ceases to be the public and becomes part of the show swept by surprise, fear, tears or laughter. Theater as life, life as theater… there is no longer any difference.','/6K52ZhGL1XfD4Ds33WZIYHFpNum.jpg','2003-09-26',104,'Released','Shut down the theaters, the performance has hit the streets!','November',9775,0.9401,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18642,_binary '\0','/5MDzSwqW4rgIp75GWCGjEYCYwam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376890',6,4350,'en','Silver City','The discovery of a corpse and the ensuing probe by an idealistic journalist threatens to unravel a bumbling local politician\'s campaign for governor of Colorado.','/9WNpjGCUTCC21fIcUpZ9lX0PJyU.jpg','2004-09-17',128,'Released','Vote Early. Vote Often.','Silver City',18711,1.8653,6.1,'UyJSRo2PP4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18643,_binary '\0','/8ULBp6mMRhpR6qnEqEWFbMdmdNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376968',7.9,49888,'ru','Возвращение','Two young brothers in contemporary Russia are reunited with a father they know only from an old photograph after his sudden return from a long absence. With their mother’s reluctant consent, they set out on a remote trip that quickly becomes an uneasy test of authority, trust, and masculinity. As the journey moves deeper into the wilderness, the fragile bonds between father and sons are pushed to their limits.','/7V8iHBs34cPYw7ohpLqliF9x8Gv.jpg','2003-06-25',111,'Released',NULL,'The Return',11190,3.1253,7.3,'mEKp-Ort7hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18644,_binary '\0','/4GSaYgyx9zLnLVJ31wsnqejfJBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376990',5.1,2385,'de','Die Wilden Kerle','The school year is over and for a diverse group of carefree kids, soccer is king! These kids believe that they are the local gold team and there is nothing they like more than improving their game. \"If you want to be cool, you should be wild.\" However, the relentless rain turns their field into a swamp, so they have to take an unexpected break. And when the sun finally comes, a gang of older, bigger and dumber boys has just taken over the field. They won\'t give it back unless they lose a match against the kids.','/jrYqdIOF1EOoBQSQbkIU88NJy9n.jpg','2003-10-02',94,'Released','It\'s all good as long as you\'re wild!','The Wild Soccer Bunch',10755,2.0143,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18645,_binary '\0','/nLMXULCGLnzRxz11txPzPqbOHSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0376994',6.6,580080,'en','X-Men: The Last Stand','When a cure is found to treat mutations, lines are drawn amongst the X-Men led by Professor Charles Xavier, and Magneto\'s Brotherhood of Mutants.','/a2xicU8DpKtRizOHjQLC1JyCSRS.jpg','2006-05-24',104,'Released','Take a stand.','X-Men: The Last Stand',36668,1.1549,6.427,'X8ozc_dQprk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18646,_binary '\0','/hzLY9qOiix8Pe2WIiAExOjzJgX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377038',7.5,1861,'en','The Best Two Years','Follows the lives of two pairs of American LDS missionaries serving in the Dutch city of Haarlem: Elder Johnson, the District Leader who oversees and reports their efforts; the vain and position-climbing Elder Van Pelt; the capable but disillusioned Elder Rogers; and the \"greenie\" (newcomer) Elder Calhoun, who arrives to Haarlem with limited language training and all the eagerness to serve and work.','/uH57dHiG0zO3KoQJqq1VeJva4nY.jpg','2004-02-20',112,'Released','Every moment counts.','The Best Two Years',16668,1.5529,7,'J6U9F45VmXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18647,_binary '\0','/14yjn1iQVYVYZU086DFa0Ic1Keu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377057',5.1,3136,'en','Elvis Has Left the Building','Harmony had an encounter early in life with the young Elvis, and can\'t seem to shake his influence. Now a Pink Lady selling cosmetics, she seems to inadvertently bring harm to any Elvis impersonators she encounters. After a bizarre car accident leaves a slew of them dead, Harmony goes on the run from the authorities, hooking up with a downtrodden ad exec who has Elvis troubles of his own.','/yfIRJpLwR0yGAj6PmWMHZVU8mB1.jpg','2004-08-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Elvis Has Left the Building',37641,3.1716,5.3,'kWOpXolMsF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18648,_binary '\0','/mWXU29QjfjEG37d0c2hE11MWRGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377062',6.1,59365,'en','Flight of the Phoenix','When an oil rig in the Gobi Desert of Mongolia proves unproductive, an aircraft crew are sent to shut the operation down and fly them out. On the flight out over the desert on the way to Beijing, Capt. Frank Towns and co-pilot A.J. are unable to keep their cargo plane, a C-119 Flying Boxcar, in the air when a violent sandstorm strikes. Crash-landing in a remote uncharted part of the desert, the two pilots and their passengers -- a crew of oil workers and a drifter -- must work together to survive by rebuilding the aircraft. Soon, low supplies and a band of merciless smugglers add even greater urgency to their task.','/pcj6unMsKCw0ogWFlUXmbc9gKap.jpg','2004-12-17',113,'Released','Out of the ashes, hope will rise.','Flight of the Phoenix',11866,7.7334,6,'bANHr1Qc-7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18649,_binary '\0','/goV5xvp99pu3P4CFFYW40hZHW4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377079',6.1,4930,'ja','イゾー','Izo is an assassin in the service of a Tosa lord and Imperial supporter. After killing dozens of the Shogun\'s men, Izo is captured and crucified. Instead of being extinguished, his rage propels him through the space-time continuum to present-day Tokyo. Here Izo transforms himself into a new, improved killing machine.','/rr2i9pba5sUieXoycquuNk1I4WN.jpg','2004-09-07',128,'Released','The world never can be changed.','Izo',12580,1.8569,6,'8nP-XnULq58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18650,_binary '\0','/Eqdi8hiWfrXJEyrXYf4QyS55Yg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377084',7,13812,'en','Ladies in Lavender','Andrea, a gifted young Polish violinist from Krakow, is bound for America when he is swept overboard by a storm. When the Widdington sisters discover the handsome stranger on the beach below their house, they nurse him back to health. However, the presence of the musically talented young man disrupts the peaceful lives of Ursula and Janet and the community in which they live.','/wm3wG0qf1qhUj0xtgI0BarQpmbT.jpg','2004-11-12',104,'Released','The story of two sisters who saved a stranger, and the stranger who stole their hearts.','Ladies in Lavender',9528,4.0032,6.4,'N8LKGIPn0FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18651,_binary '\0','/4IkG0gkx9AvIGZUFK94fDsPFT8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377088',6.1,1471,'en','Mail Order Wife','A documentarian funds a NYC doorman\'s Asian mail order bride in exchange for the right to film the experience.','/8WwJfR687919Od6auUqHBb9tluV.jpg','2005-02-01',92,'Released','Because no one wants to be alone.','Mail Order Wife',47524,1.2669,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18652,_binary '\0','/lFjONSYWA01SFDxnwRLxjUrh0GR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377091',7.1,35026,'en','Mean Creek','Teenagers living in small-town Oregon take a boat trip for a birthday celebration. When they get an idea to play a mean trick on the town bully, it suddenly goes too far. Soon they\'re forced to deal with the unexpected consequences of their actions.','/nlU3SJzt5focTIkhLcO0ggnvbpW.jpg','2004-08-20',90,'Released','Beneath the surface, everyone has a secret.','Mean Creek',12281,2.6955,6.8,'zKbyAyhLnY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18653,_binary '\0','/nP3y0TkR6XniFs9J53qQkg4Bnnk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377092',7.1,493096,'en','Mean Girls','Cady Heron is a hit with The Plastics, the A-list girl clique at her new school, until she makes the mistake of falling for Aaron Samuels, the ex-boyfriend of alpha Plastic Regina George.','/2ZkuQXvVhh45uSvkBej4S7Ix1NJ.jpg','2004-04-30',97,'Released','Watch your back.','Mean Girls',10625,29.4948,7.23,'EMzEmGfTuM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18654,_binary '\0','/7WW1qhOdDzYWmjmhIwVt8lc9FCJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377107',6.6,47994,'en','Proof','Catherine is a woman in her late twenties who is strongly devoted to her father, Robert, a brilliant and well-known mathematician whose grip on reality is beginning to slip away. As Robert descends into madness, Catherine begins to wonder if she may have inherited her father\'s mental illness along with his mathematical genius.','/h5z4JWhaPYMMXhYzwuK7SUgjmMm.jpg','2005-09-05',100,'Released','The biggest risk in life is not taking one.','Proof',9777,3.9018,6.354,'DI1vRch4omw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18655,_binary '\0','/A9myIvZ8Jvq0kP32ynx6bC1jZZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377109',5.4,106760,'en','The Ring Two','After the ordeal with Samara, Rachel and Aiden move to a rural town. But soon Rachel learns about the death of a girl in a similar fashion. To save Aiden, she must dig into Samara\'s past even further.','/bHbz7z2pecTawhkqLpuC2m0qywe.jpg','2005-03-10',109,'Released','Fear comes full circle.','The Ring Two',10320,9.0077,5.8,'apyfeNwsTu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18656,_binary '\0','/efmATkgMQfhq40IxP65WyudZtvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377309',4.9,11626,'en','Three','After a yachting accident, a millionaire and his wife are shipwrecked on a desert island along with their former deckhand, Manuel.','/v45dAZ1vI4NUqcYcLUmGVXHGYFj.jpg','2005-11-16',95,'Released','Looks can kill.','Three',9753,8.2067,5.589,'BjZ2N0y96wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18657,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377320',5.7,1701,'en','A-list','Darren goes to Hollywood to tackle his dream of becoming an A-list movie star. However, once he gets there his dreams are crushed once he realizes the life of an actor isn\'t all of the glitz and glamour he had hoped. When Darren is mistaken for Dante, an A-list actor in tinsel town, Darren\'s world is thrown upside down. With gigs coming in left and right and the paparazzi on his tail, Darren gets his wish, for better or for worse.',NULL,'2006-04-27',90,'Released',NULL,'A-list',228581,0.9455,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18658,_binary '\0','/jKA1r0AtZaUnaNaojx8iw4BhQnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377321',7.5,1795,'ta','ஆசை','A man kills his wife when she learns that he lusts after her sister. He then begins to make his moves for his sister-in-law. When he tries to sabotage the girl\'s marriage, her fiance gets suspicious.','/baIB9Ufp9xsn8Op6mWt47XMw9vh.jpg','1995-09-25',157,'Released',NULL,'Aasai',69422,1.2156,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18659,_binary '\0','/gldiGnOHhjpOX0mLBgbjdaqobOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377340',4.7,1280,'hi','एतबार','After the tragic death of his son - Rohit, in a car accident, Dr. Ranveer Malhotra has been very protective of his daughter Ria. All is well for Ria until one day on a college mishap Ria reaches up with Aryan and both fall in love with each other. Aryan showers Ria with a lot of love and she thought that he is her ideal life partner. Ria invites Aryan to dinner at her home and introduces him to her parents. Her mother immediately approves of him but her father thinks that something is a miss and tells Ria to stop meeting Aryan. But Aryan is madly in love with Ria and refuses to leave her. When Ria disobeys him, her father decides to dig deeper into Aryan\'s past. Ranveer is desperate as he knows Ria is heading towards something dangerous.','/iFU4TSOiaEPhBygTSwRzx7ncoz2.jpg','2004-01-23',152,'Released','Love Can Kill...','Aetbaar',334397,1.0724,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18660,_binary '\0','/rAx0aCQ6luULuUb8tW6CD1365Mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377471',5.6,75429,'en','Be Cool','Disenchanted with the movie industry, Chili Palmer tries the music industry, meeting and romancing a widow of a music executive along the way.','/ekKCH7Zkb5ZTr1f1AczZY23FH.jpg','2005-03-04',119,'Released','Everyone is looking for the next big hit.','Be Cool',4551,6.6027,5.5,'Cx4ZswI5Lno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18661,_binary '\0','/lch9NDBb4oM0xKNEz0ZN7Mc27MS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377556',7.1,7348,'zh','不散','On a dark, wet night in Taipei City, a cavernous old picture palace is about to close its doors forever. A meager audience, the remaining few staff, and perhaps even a ghost or two, watch King Hu’s wuxia classic \"Dragon Inn\", each haunted by memories and desires evoked by cinema itself.','/js1uTY2FuKspVRQWLudFkEteFI5.jpg','2003-12-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye, Dragon Inn',56616,1.9249,6.8,'JiDI-F0jvAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18662,_binary '\0','/z5E3p3YAzV3SvOdvTplgr6Y6NrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377569',7.1,4316,'it','Buongiorno, notte','The 1978 kidnapping and murder of Aldo Moro, president of the most important political party in Italy at the time, Democrazia Cristiana, as seen from the perspective of one of his assailants -- a conflicted young woman in the ranks of the Red Brigade.','/5r6JAD9E6BUCfpN8At52a0TJbaR.jpg','2003-09-05',106,'Released',NULL,'Good Morning, Night',24164,2.2435,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18663,_binary '\0','/xENDw3ncVi3RgHhoGptDos9vHDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377575',8.1,2774,'ml','സി.ഐ.ഡി മൂസ','Moosa, a private detective, faces many challenges while solving various cases. His only rival is his own brother-in-law, Peethambaran, who is a police officer.','/evsWMsxq8xZbCDFWwjN6ZX8e3Fw.jpg','2003-07-04',160,'Released',NULL,'C.I.D. Moosa',329991,1.9009,7.97,'ZoOn8M0J9-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18664,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377643',8,1593,'ml','ചിന്താവിഷ്ടയായ ശ്യാമള','Vijayan, the village school teacher, believes that his degree in economics is sufficient for him to succeed in the business ventures he undertakes. Taking long leaves of absence from work, he roams around with his schemes, all of which turn out to be downright failures.','/xxlIr6hbuZ9CofLcup8xwUfO5Xa.jpg','1998-10-15',158,'Released',NULL,'Chinthavishtayaya Shyamala',151633,1.1329,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18665,_binary '\0','/lZfHuq0c6uPAE7Gaa0lQI9SGbYC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377701',6.8,2695,'en','Cowboys & Angels','This story concerns a hapless civil servant who gets more than he bargains for when he moves into an apartment in Limerick with a gay fashion student and becomes a star on the catwalk. A contemporary story embracing the essence of what it is to be young in today\'s Ireland.','/8S55zmOu7cdN6v71M9AzKLVdrOr.jpg','2004-07-23',86,'Released','How far will you go?','Cowboys & Angels',20148,1.1351,6,'xMtQxZvTU5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18666,_binary '\0','/yzx3x8g7gHtZDEyCOWWjXMONKcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377713',5.6,43753,'en','Cube Zero','A young programmer whose job is to watch over the reality-warping Cube defies orders to rescue an innocent mother trapped in one of its rooms.','/m5ODgUYh5lMvRumBY63QJ4eVYp5.jpg','2004-10-10',97,'Released','There must be an exit!','Cube Zero',438,4.291,5.7,'T5x4LJ9d84Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18667,_binary '\0','/xxugKaediIbQeoukADMVpqdfyZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377744',4.8,3417,'en','Un día sin mexicanos','When a mysterious fog surrounds the boundaries of California, there is a communication breakdown and all the Mexicans disappear, affecting the economy and the state stops working missing the Mexican workers and dwellers.','/3vyKh5kdYw1attsNOX21Ru433Ro.jpg','2004-05-14',98,'Released','There goes the neighborhood.','A Day Without a Mexican',16427,2.32,5.9,'cYJcfhxMkrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18668,_binary '\0','/WyCraJdklEeet3hTJiAjzhmhWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377749',5.6,11960,'en','Dead Birds','Towards the end of the Civil War, a group of Confederate soldiers hole up on an abandoned plantation after robbing a bank, and find themselves at the mercy of supernatural forces.','/xB1qpndocvnS23qIv0F7OqYZLpj.jpg','2005-04-22',91,'Released','There are worse things than dying.','Dead Birds',19592,2.9708,5.7,'CX3x7t4a6ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18669,_binary '\0','/1eFyO5JIDTZxrQuVZ3NfHl0M0xU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377752',7.6,23182,'en','Dear Frankie','Nine-year-old Frankie and his single mum Lizzie have been on the move ever since Frankie can remember, most recently arriving in a seaside Scottish town. Wanting to protect her deaf son from the truth that they\'ve run away from his father, Lizzie has invented a story that he is away at sea on the HMS Accra. Every few weeks, Lizzie writes Frankie a make-believe letter from his father, telling of his adventures in exotic lands. As Frankie tracks the ship\'s progress around the globe, he discovers that it is due to dock in his hometown. With the real HMS Accra arriving in only a fortnight, Lizzie must choose between telling Frankie the truth or finding the perfect stranger to play Frankie\'s father for just one day...','/5YRDvaBWBbhTKBYYc7BoOWdW01N.jpg','2004-05-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Dear Frankie',8981,3.956,7.1,'NJ9Fqzj0psI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18670,_binary '\0','/iDYWe9pBdJkR9Q2aoHfsluQqtKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377800',6.6,8430,'en','Don\'t Come Knocking','Howard Spence has seen better days. Once a big Western movie star, he now drowns his disgust for his selfish and failed life with alcohol, drugs and young women. If he were to die now, nobody would shed a tear over him, that\'s the sad truth. Until one day Howard learns that he might have a child somewhere out there...','/sF9LWvw71gaGR46QtJIFGtLXhWc.jpg','2005-08-25',123,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Come Knocking',3527,3.2196,6.2,'fxcjOTQyNjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18671,_binary '\0','/luOLydz3H319kUl79MbBcfGsCgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377818',5.2,85500,'en','The Dukes of Hazzard','Cousins, Bo and Luke Duke, with the help of their eye-catching cousin, Daisy and moonshine-running Uncle Jesse, try and save the family farm from being destroyed by Hazzard County\'s corrupt commissioner, Boss Hogg. Their efforts constantly find the \'Duke Boys\' eluding authorities in \'The General Lee\', their 1969 orange Dodge Charger that keeps them one step ahead of the dimwitted antics of the small southern town\'s Sheriff, Roscoe P. Coltrane.','/2ZrNyYJEgE0VIqhelQPqFTR20xF.jpg','2005-08-05',104,'Released','Cousins. Outlaws. Thrillbillies.','The Dukes of Hazzard',6519,8.8228,5.6,'lJzWkSmeMaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18672,_binary '\0','/nXw7PSsO9sSVdW47o9dh04vkRV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377834',6.2,3240,'es','Días de fútbol','A comedic romp that celebrates the power of friendship to turn your life around, Dias de Futbol introduces us to Antonio, an ex-convict and amateur shrink who convinces his pals that the best way to overcome their midlife crises and lack of success with women is to reassemble their old soccer team and win something in life, even if only a local championship. Directed by David Serrano. Starring Alberto San Juan, Natalia Verbeke (Dot the I, Son of the Bride), Pere Ponce, and Fernando Tejero.','/8qFkuNJWye1s1yyainngE04Oqvz.jpg','2003-09-19',113,'Released',NULL,'Soccer Days',54148,2.0478,6,'NmWpNYhK67U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18673,_binary '\0','/mE0px2B1KJ1VA4auvwSza3g8QEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377935',6.5,1760,'sv','Framom främsta linjen','A movie based on real wartime diaries tells the story of the Swedish speaking Finns\' infantry regiment 61. The story follows the regiment during the Continuation War from 1942 to 1944 and from Syväri to the Karelian Isthmus where they faced some of the most grueling battles against the Soviet Union.','/6Or1Ax9ZztqlnFx0aB7eXfBREPM.jpg','2004-03-05',127,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Front Line',29436,1.2078,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18674,_binary '\0','/w3LLngJIAA1R7Mp2S3G0HZl2R3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377981',5.9,64635,'en','Gnomeo & Juliet','A version of Shakespeare\'s play, set in the world of warring indoor and outdoor gnomes. Garden gnomes Gnomeo and Juliet have as many obstacles to overcome as their quasi namesakes when they are caught up in a feud between neighbors. But with plastic pink flamingos and lawnmower races in the mix, can this young couple find lasting happiness?','/vVQwgfS9gSFviVT4gS7tZAmhRFc.jpg','2011-01-13',84,'Released','The greatest love story you have never gnome.','Gnomeo & Juliet',45772,10.2942,5.904,'tgO03BFtvSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18675,_binary '\0','/nJbYD8guDHNWuZVsZlSwBqiNi5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377990',6.1,1389,'en','The Goodbye Girl','Musical dancer on the way out (at 36) Paula McFadden had it swell with actor Tony DeSanti, but instead of taking her to Hollywood he gets a European movie part. He even sublets their (his) New York apartment to Elliot Garfield, who generously lets her stay, even keeping the master bedroom. Pragmatic pre-teen daughter Lucy soon takes to his charm, but Paula remains determined to hate all actors. Despite the stress of a Broadway Shakespeare lead he must play too queer for Frisco, he\'s determined to snatch romance from ingratitude.','/fYNAWxYgHjONccHJazSOc9wIeQK.jpg','2004-01-16',103,'Released',NULL,'The Goodbye Girl',66722,1.9784,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18676,_binary '\0','/380aihjywM92ad2hieYAFgXXMoF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0377992',7.7,4672,'en','The Gospel of John','A word for word depiction of the life of Jesus Christ from the Good News Translation Bible as recorded in the Gospel of John.','/rKbmbnYfFhgTjGoDU9F4pIhVvKh.jpg','2003-09-11',180,'Released','For God loved the world So much…','The Gospel of John',30973,3.5008,7.5,'6K5E5jUMpuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18677,_binary '\0','/71Pw2W2IfBOT5wOBRACfCJtm9XS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378072',7,16348,'hi','हम तुम','The encounters of two people who run into each other on several occasions under circumstances ranging from friendly to hostile to loving. Along many years and countless run-ins, the two despise each other, befriend each other, and fall in love with each other—in no particular order.','/u4ctCNPq6qfwnUyZzAfxEzdJ0Lq.jpg','2004-05-28',142,'Released',NULL,'Hum Tum',4253,1.6098,6.4,'kz1MR1nuhKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18678,_binary '\0','/bgYcrIYjoaoZAJY9rvdwGpyIvrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378109',5.9,85571,'en','Into the Blue','When they take some friends on an extreme sport adventure, the last thing Jared and Sam expect to see below the shark-infested waters is a legendary pirate ship rumored to contain millions of dollars in gold. But their good fortune is short-lived, as a ruthless gang of criminals gets word of what they have uncovered.','/h5oXcjRu0EOiAxSxYuGq58897tu.jpg','2005-09-30',110,'Released','Treasure has its price.','Into the Blue',11968,9.3891,5.9,'5uMDUHdN24o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18679,_binary '\0','/pgG6tzJzC8mjGqhaT8IWwEk00xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378194',8,880318,'en','Kill Bill: Vol. 2','The Bride unwaveringly continues on her roaring rampage of revenge against the band of assassins who had tried to kill her and her unborn child. She visits each of her former associates one-by-one, checking off the victims on her Death List Five until there\'s nothing left to do … but kill Bill.','/2yhg0mZQMhDyvUQ4rG1IZ4oIA8L.jpg','2004-04-16',136,'Released','The bride is back for the final cut.','Kill Bill: Vol. 2',393,20.2947,7.873,'q2h6EFk36kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18680,_binary '\0','/vOI9PjfHak9UNpIgEnPX1aIPt0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378215',7.3,5464,'da','Kongekabale','Starting a new job as a political journalist at a leading newspaper, Ulrik Torp witnesses a brutal struggle for power in the Midparty\'s ranks -- a struggle that coincides with the charismatic party leader\'s involvement in a near fatal car accident. A flurry of lies and media speculation surrounds the incident. Gradually, Ulrik unearths a ruthless conspiracy involving the incumbent prime minister.','/h3hUu80dYIwusnnU9mYA7lrLIf.jpg','2004-08-10',107,'Released',NULL,'King\'s Game',15961,2.0307,6.9,'vVSTy7SJLWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18681,_binary '\0','/zY90gUhF8xKDP63e2g2YW7WKnsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378262',6.8,1453,'ru','Карлик Нос','When he refused to support power-hungry witch, the good shoemaker\'s boy, Jacob is transformed into a hunchbacked dwarf with overlong nose. Of their mother no longer recognized, mocked by the people of the city and driven away, Jacob runs one day a goose on the road. Together with the spring animal - in fact the king\'s daughter Greta enchanted - Jacob is now trying to make the transformation to reverse and put the wicked witch craft.','/5ULJpVro6x6mHIuMAmWyC1KMzEd.jpg','2003-03-20',82,'Released',NULL,'Little Longnose',51349,2.1545,6.9,'dgVoSsCfZbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18682,_binary '\0','/xPt9uunKOZ8EC2xukQbkSDh45oq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378284',7.7,13294,'es','Machuca','Santiago, capital of Chile during the Marxist government of elected, highly controversial president Salvador Allende. Father McEnroe supports his leftist views by introducing a program at the prestigious \"collegio\" (Catholic prep school) St. Patrick to allow free admission of some proletarian kids. One of them is Pedro Machuca, slum-raised son of the cleaning lady in Gonzalo Infante\'s liberal-bourgeois home. Yet the new classmates become buddies, paradoxically protesting together as Gonzalo gets adopted by Pedro\'s slum family and gang. But the adults spoil that too, not in the least when general Pinochet\'s coup ousts Allende, and supporters such as McEnroe.','/sP3ceWIvq7DZm8VLYWuFKzbDK43.jpg','2004-02-24',116,'Released','Two boys observe a political coup in their native Chile.','Machuca',12086,1.8953,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18683,_binary '\0','/x41xFrJvmD1mlEGwbIkdFUX3Cy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378407',6.4,4819,'en','My Date with Drew','Ever since the second grade when he first saw her in E.T. The Extraterrestrial, Brian Herzlinger has had a crush on Drew Barrymore. Now, 20 years later he\'s decided to try to fulfill his lifelong dream by asking her for a date. There\'s one small problem: She\'s Drew Barrymore and he\'s, well, Brian Herzlinger, a broke 27-year-old aspiring filmmaker from New Jersey.','/19ChghJMN72BG9mQeDK0D209whF.jpg','2005-08-05',90,'Released',NULL,'My Date with Drew',25975,2.2509,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18684,_binary '\0','/t73bezUPhAI2D9vf2otp6H905un.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378417',5.6,3076,'de','Die Nacht der lebenden Loser','Three not-so-cool school friends decide to try a old voodoo ritual. Later, they die in a car accident, but live on as zombies. But being a zombie has advantages, too...','/7q0emZHypKC6q0N2cN18M1ReltW.jpg','2004-11-03',90,'Released','Being a loser was never this cool!','Night of the Living Dorks',12128,2.1006,5.5,'0Gbf1Rpvgzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18685,_binary '\0','/7D0iKqHEudWGADUtLkFjjwqdN3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378428',5.7,4716,'ko','내츄럴 시티','Two cops, R and Noma, hunt down renegade cyborgs. Cyborgs are used as commandos by the military, as lust objects and for companionship. Normaly they have a limited lifespan of three years but black market technology is being developed to be able to transfer a cyborg\'s artificial intelligence into human host. This drives R to find a suitable host for his expiring cyborg Ria.','/bjuRpVj192XZvREDBu8Yrygp45x.jpg','2003-09-05',114,'Released','The war has begun.','Natural City',14573,1.7401,5.4,'nJbdBho7dCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18686,_binary '\0','/7WGMII2Oo8zqQey9gC186x2RhtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378453',6.6,2585,'es','No sos vos, soy yo','Thirty-year-old Javier is a surgeon and in his free time works as a disc jockey. He decides to marry and move to the United States with his girlfriend María. They make all their plans; they wed, and then María is the first to move and make contacts in their new home, while Javier packs up in Argentina and prepares to start his new life in the States. While he is on the way to the airport, he receives a call from María telling him that she is confused and has been seeing someone else.','/9E0cpXrBagDb7uHnAG4eT9C2qLf.jpg','2004-10-28',105,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Not You, It\'s Me',83266,1.3452,6.4,'sWsbNP8WF0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18687,_binary '\0','/6RHCMLag18Ek65Fc6TwUjGS4MGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378647',8.2,2473,'ta','ரமணா','Ramana decides to abolish corruption once for all with the help of his students who are now working in various government offices.','/qcMxg4Tdj1ojbq0lAqJVKyq621L.jpg','2002-11-04',178,'Released',NULL,'Ramanaa',78955,1.213,7.654,'VBwznYXlMXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18688,_binary '\0','/rrbghODXZJgQY1Tud7AtGdlL9T4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378661',5.8,3130,'fr','Les Revenants','The lives of the residents of a small French town are changed when thousands of the recently dead inexplicably come back to life and try to integrate themselves into society that has changed for them.','/86NALpTJd7xD4EiVYzXk4nf8KCz.jpg','2004-10-27',102,'Released','Why have the dead suddenly returned...','The Returned',65513,2.5918,5.5,'g0b_7Z2Gcrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18689,_binary '\0','/9J759jTIcQhmeeiD5bDuXI7iOoC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378793',7.2,32850,'en','Speak','Freshman high-school student Melinda has refused to speak ever since she called the cops on a popular summer party. With her old friends snubbing her for being a rat, and her parents too busy to notice her troubles, she folds into herself, trying to hide her secret: that star senior Andy raped her at the party. But Melinda does manage to find solace in her art class headed by Mr. Freeman.','/oRjQJG2PziTl2bUvzUCFS16ncfj.jpg','2004-01-20',93,'Released','The Truth Will Change Everything.','Speak',15058,4.3176,7.091,'clAtIIG-mQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18690,_binary '\0','/jUoJsdNAksofYogKCM14AER8qjd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378848',5.8,2081,'fi','Tali-Ihantala 1944','The Soviet army breaks through the Finnish defences on the Karelian Isthmus in June 1944, advancing with overwhelming force. Somehow, the Finnish troops must find the strength to fight back, with all odds against them. The Battle of Tali-Ihantala was the largest battle ever fought in the history of the Nordic countries. This film depicts the true events through five separate stories.','/35azd5Cp0luhyDrgQWlWPKOqtI4.jpg','2007-12-07',117,'Released',NULL,'1944 The Final Defence',49322,1.5043,5.8,'g9IEQYlpFlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18691,_binary '\0','/cGQHYYghFRwIEaWhQBDbJrJdpXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378867',5.3,1399,'en','Testosterone','Dean has been stumped for some time in his attempt to produce a follow-up to \"I was a Teenage Speed Freak,\" his incredibly successful graphic novel. His fans expect great things from him and his editor, Louise, is hounding him. Instead of working, however, Dean spends his time searching for his Argentine lover Pablo, who went out one night for cigarettes and never came back.','/2Fghk6IMzQLEfrxBU86JDEhj2UH.jpg','2003-09-11',103,'Released','Breaking up is hard to do...','Testosterone',5591,1.4038,5.3,'imWrbt3SUX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18692,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378873',6.9,1218,'ml','തിളക്കം','Padmanabhan reunites with his son after many years of separation, but his happiness is short-lived when he realises that his son is mentally ill.','/pJjd2MfckaeiZBDC6cghOThzYPQ.jpg','2003-04-11',147,'Released',NULL,'Thilakkam',358308,0.8255,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18693,_binary '\0','/k6qLXzjfCkUZeoYksN9KNqGXv4W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378897',7.5,15669,'el','Πολίτικη Κουζίνα','\"A Touch of Spice\" is a story about Fanis, a young Greek boy growing up in Istanbul, whose grandfather, a culinary philosopher and mentor, teaches him that both food and life require a little salt to give them flavor. They both require... A Touch of Spice. Fanis grows up to become an excellent cook and uses his cooking skills to spice up the lives of those around him. 35 years later he leaves Athens and travels back to his birthplace of Istanbul to reunite with his grandfather and his first love. He travels back only to realize that he forgot to put a little bit of spice in his own life.','/vtLPf20exDzczcgxeW5pazWEFGi.jpg','2003-10-24',108,'Released','Cinnamon... is bitter and sweet, just like a woman','A Touch of Spice',12497,2.6605,6.7,'YOhpWC8Nl70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18694,_binary '\0','/xhcitF19HBlc0Fv3TFMtnlPw0aS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378906',7.4,2449,'dz','ཆང་ཧུབ་ཐེངས་གཅིག་གི་འཁྲུལ་སྣང','A young government official, named Dondup, who is smitten with America (he even has a denim gho) dreams of escaping there while stuck in a beautiful but isolated village. He hopes to connect in the U.S. with a visa out of the country. He misses the one bus out of town to Thimphu, however, and is forced to hitchhike and walk along the Lateral Road to the west, accompanied by an apple seller, a Buddhist monk with his ornate, dragon-headed dramyin, a drunk, a widowed rice paper maker, and his beautiful daughter, Sonam.','/rVXiPoXzeoyExzepxdv4eQQMERa.jpg','2003-09-09',108,'Released','The bitter and the sweet of temporary things.','Travellers and Magicians',37232,1.1282,6.986,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18695,_binary '\0','/Nez4mwFX2Y0QSpgyrDKzsskpnB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0378947',6.4,34250,'en','Melinda and Melinda','While dining out with friends, Sy suggests the difficulty of separating comedy from tragedy. To illustrate his point, he tells his guests two parallel stories about Melinda ; both versions have the same basic elements, but one take on her state of affairs leans toward levity, while the other is full of anguish. Each story involves Melinda coping with a recent divorce through substance abuse while beginning a romantic relationship with a close friend\'s husband.','/3cLNqq5dpblYG0QkPgwn763DvJB.jpg','2004-12-22',100,'Released','Life can be a comedy or a tragedy, it all depends on how you look at it.','Melinda and Melinda',9688,4.5152,6.2,'coPNaZp6EE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18696,_binary '\0','/lwWEw3DHZp6g6cxCSgciJTJyLLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379060',5.3,3226,'en','Zenon: Z3','Zenon Kar, a teenager living on a space station in the year 2054, competes in the first ever Galactic Teen Supreme contest.','/mnX94DJ9GVXEOmbdN97Yh5hGifT.jpg','2004-06-11',81,'Released','Saving the universe is as easy as 1... 2... Z!','Zenon: Z3',34765,2.331,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18697,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379184',6.2,1307,'en','Blackballed: The Bobby Dukes Story','Caught cheating and banned for ten years, Bobby Dukes, paintball\'s first superstar, returns to reclaim his title and erase the memory of his tainted past.','/uxurJMtBsPpyM44sHbvDbjSoJpQ.jpg','2004-03-12',91,'Released','Second place is first place for losers','Blackballed: The Bobby Dukes Story',14346,1.7597,5.9,'2cCnmi64ygg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18698,_binary '\0','/1KDLaQ6iklN4Kr0PVl97rSU2X7C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379199',6.5,1330,'pt','O Caminho das Nuvens','Romão, illiterate and unemployed, feels destiny drawing him on an odyssey to Rio de Janeiro in pursuit of a job and a decent life. A family of seven journeys 2,000 miles across the hinterlands of Brazil on bicycles. Along the way, the story explores the inner dynamics of a family facing a great challenge with the courage to pursue dreams.','/b8yJOq6yWWc1ACIgdOwRjAsLDQO.jpg','2003-09-12',85,'Released',NULL,'The Middle of the World',47089,1.4794,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18699,_binary '\0','/AtPCvNJVrngHxpoogQsQkIZBs3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379217',7,71312,'en','Coffee and Cigarettes','An anthology of eleven vignettes featuring star-studded casts of extremely unique individuals who all share the common activities of conversing while drinking coffee and smoking cigarettes.','/pfG02QCsutx3PIxFS8UY4iM9AsS.jpg','2004-03-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Coffee and Cigarettes',883,4.908,6.911,'mM6Mpn0-eyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18700,_binary '\0','/2JJkxOfwjyTeNOyKl46jlgG7fDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379225',8,22373,'en','The Corporation','Since the late 18th century American legal decision that the business corporation organizational model is legally a person, it has become a dominant economic, political and social force around the globe. This film takes an in-depth psychological examination of the organization model through various case studies. What the study illustrates is that in the its behaviour, this type of \"person\" typically acts like a dangerously destructive psychopath without conscience. Furthermore, we see the profound threat this psychopath has for our world and our future, but also how the people with courage, intelligence and determination can do to stop it.','/aN7LHIKHkq6x16a4pXlaiB7PHiP.jpg','2003-09-10',145,'Released','The corporation as psychopath...','The Corporation',11420,3.383,7.6,'2MMx53V8M8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18701,_binary '\0','/6sRnge2VQo4IenahuV0Yy8kD4YX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379240',5.3,3593,'en','Dead Fish','Gary Oldman is Lynch, a strangely charming hit man in this explosively funny dark comedy in the tradition of Snatch and Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels. With an all-star cast including Terence Stamp, Elena Anaya, Robert Carlyle and Billy Zane, Dead Fish is a chaotic tale of criminals looking for love, money and revenge that will have you falling out of your chair laughing!','/w0CV2soSYdDU4h9k2liEKYxXGRq.jpg','2005-10-11',94,'Released','Traitors, killers and lovers collide in London.','Dead Fish',19059,2.0454,5.6,'n2AoSUsQlTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18702,_binary '\0','/9EGIS9j7UUeAJX5p7JZFIBht0yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379270',5.7,1838,'en','Easy','Quirky Jamie Harris is a magnet for less-than-kind men as she hops beds. But things start to look up when she becomes the object of affection of two seemingly normal men. Unfortunately, there\'s the immense problem of her self-imposed 90-day moratorium on sex.','/2p2pAHyuZCNR3rxJ7CPfuje6SOt.jpg','2003-09-10',99,'Released','Sex is easy. Love isn\'t.','Easy',45174,1.9509,5.7,'soZ-ifIf3Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18703,_binary '\0','/sWz2PWqlLO3MoLOO8FI5ANovl0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379296',6.7,1431,'en','Game Over: Kasparov and the Machine','Garry Kasparov is possibly the greatest chess player who has ever lived. In 1997, he played a match against the greatest chess computer: IBM\'s Deep Blue. He lost. This film depicts the drama that happened away from the chess board from Kasparov\'s perspective. It explores the psychological aspects of the game and the paranoia surrounding IBM\'s ultimate chess machine.','/92yRagLCvY5XE8GqOslXXmzLuVx.jpg','2003-09-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Game Over: Kasparov and the Machine',57337,0.9925,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18704,_binary '\0','/lG8NOXROOWHlUovTeHp9RjALpec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379298',7.6,1246,'fr','Gaz Bar Blues','This is the story of Mr. Brochu, whose friends like to call \"the Boss\". He runs his gas station the best he can and tries to stay happy no matter what happens. This movie relates all the small tragedies surrounding the gaz bar, such as hold-ups, competition from the big companies invading the neighbourhood, and the fact that is sons don\'t seem to be interested in the gas station.','/5kbVOF04fG1e7uFKyRu9VNdypqJ.jpg','2003-09-05',115,'Released',NULL,'Gaz Bar Blues',17213,1.2215,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18705,_binary '\0','/x6wu8QbwQu7xDpIaFczNftoFWPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379306',6.4,13620,'en','A Good Woman','Fleeing 1930s New York and leaving behind a chequered past, the giltzy divorcee Mrs Stella Erlynne travels to Italy\'s sun-dappled Amalfi coast. Mrs Erlynne\'s appearance causes a stir amongst the visiting aristocracy. Based on the Oscar Wilde play \"Lady Windemere\'s Fan.\"','/C6D8RHgGtGsGnpMTpRIiVwhFAu.jpg','2004-09-15',93,'Released','Seduction. Sex. Scandal.','A Good Woman',15184,4.0601,6.3,'DFQ7HrSjo7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18706,_binary '\0','/stONLu1vcrJqgx8MTWP3mkScZUD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379357',7.8,3150,'en','Los Angeles Plays Itself','From its distinctive neighborhoods to its architectural homes, Los Angeles has been the backdrop to countless movies. In this dazzling work, Andersen takes viewers on a whirlwind tour through the metropolis\' real and cinematic history, investigating the myriad stories and legends that have come to define it, and meticulously, judiciously revealing the real city that lives beneath.','/wmzGSQktsLf2JvfkhBaLSdG4G3Z.jpg','2004-07-28',169,'Released',NULL,'Los Angeles Plays Itself',38643,1.5904,7.6,'K-DWcJLrSuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18707,_binary '\0','/rCQV72xJ90ZmG8tiXeJiOJEBzm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379370',8,16344,'hi','मक़बूल','The Scottish tragedy \'Macbeth\' set in the contemporary underworld of India\'s commercial capital; two corrupt, fortune telling policemen take the roles of the weird sisters, and \"Duncan\" is Abbaji, the head of a crime family.','/8ULTBxnbt0NrWlDm5fahbQooj91.jpg','2003-01-30',132,'Released',NULL,'Maqbool',21265,1.68,7,'LESsmI1rJcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18708,_binary '\0','/v3gNzAHkQzJBSFZkvw117JnEvcI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379375',7.6,2599,'hi','मातृभूमि','A woman, attended by two midwives, is giving birth in a small village in India. When the child\'s cry rings, the father bangs on a steel plate to attract the attention of all the villagers, ...','/5cBn5q6mt3wiKM2Etafx6Qn23nY.jpg','2005-01-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Matrubhoomi: A Nation Without Women',127763,1.4448,6.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18709,_binary '\0','/m0WQZszgmtb1dxH5AnXhOX5tM6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379557',7.9,40047,'en','Touching the Void','The true story of Joe Simpson and Simon Yates\' disastrous and nearly-fatal mountain climb of 6,344m Siula Grande in the Cordillera Huayhuash in the Peruvian Andes in 1985.','/fsydA5H8FSDaYlYWddfMpMpDUX.jpg','2003-09-05',106,'Released','The closer you are to death. The more you realize you are alive.','Touching the Void',11194,4.0646,7.573,'gdHliYYs1qI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18710,_binary '\0','/be4dDOLrCOJiz1PTjCl4pk5I4TY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379577',6.8,2233,'hy','Vodka Lemon','In a remote, isolated Yazidi Kurdish village in post-Soviet Armenia, Hamo, a widower with a pitiful pension and three worthless sons, travels daily to his wife\'s grave. There he meets the lovely Nina, who is communing with her late husband. The two are penniless--she works in a local bar that is about to close down, while he has been forced to start selling his meager possessions. All seems hopelessly bleak, yet when Hamo begins to court Nina, their unexpected love revitalizes them.','/tTGBdlBAthuBIIkzSBAyXl3m0P6.jpg','2003-11-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Vodka Lemon',56946,1.8531,6.543,'NxlyKdae0A8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18711,_binary '\0','/6sIRxzsPNWfM8zID4C1kySYaqcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379593',6.8,6242,'en','The Yes Men','A comic, biting and revelatory documentary following a small group of prankster activists as they gain worldwide notoriety for impersonating the World Trade Organization (WTO) on television and at business conferences around the world.','/lbwXEMe4fz6hj3ySwgstRJx38Wz.jpg','2003-09-07',80,'Released','Changing the world one prank at a time.','The Yes Men',3396,1.2108,6.8,'Qzui2HM8pIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18712,_binary '\0','/taOYgqsAQz5nugWXw3KnS6VmJmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379725',7.3,150652,'en','Capote','A biopic of writer Truman Capote and his assignment for The New Yorker to write the non-fiction book \"In Cold Blood\".','/tzsxkZMnJvozpHQEl1KzO8KwWu.jpg','2005-09-30',114,'Released','In New York City, he was the ultimate insider. But out here, he was on the outside, looking in.','Capote',398,4.4532,6.969,'vq-kLlga0EI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18713,_binary '\0','/kDa2gkBf00LocugUUJ1N5mL8BL6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379730',7.9,1468,'en','Charlie: The Life and Art of Charles Chaplin','Brilliant, long in-the-works story of the life and art of the world\'s greatest comedian and the cinema\'s first genius, Charlie Chaplin. Produced, written and directed by renowned film critic Richard Schickel.','/71HnWfOoUwHAlBzPHG5HYxPSmsE.jpg','2003-05-01',132,'Released',NULL,'Charlie: The Life and Art of Charles Chaplin',53367,2.0267,7,'RfCkpqchz5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18714,_binary '\0','/3aGsZdB5ud6LmU9lppwTLh2fqH1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379786',7.8,317236,'en','Serenity','A group of rebels travel the outskirts of space evading the sinister Alliance regime. Their lives of smuggling and cargo-running are interrupted by a psychic passenger who harbours a dangerous secret. Soon, the crew find themselves being pursued by an Alliance agent who will stop at nothing to find them.','/4sqUOaPFoP2W81mq1UYqZqf5WzA.jpg','2005-09-25',119,'Released','They aim to misbehave.','Serenity',16320,9.9883,7.359,'zybHB2V27G8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18715,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379790',4.6,1497,'en','The Freediver','The Freediver is a film about a female free diver. Set in Greece, a talented girl is brought to for training to an island where she finds love, danger, madness and her ambitions fulfilled.','/uR2w89RLSnKTkPnjbhMDSJmikQj.jpg','2004-01-01',95,'Released','Freediver - death in the deep','The Freediver',160451,2.4082,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18716,_binary '\0','/p6sqf1ujNfaQepZgVC7j3E0dU0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379865',6,34782,'en','Leatherheads','A light hearted comedy about the beginnings of Professional American Football. When a decorated war hero and college all star is tempted into playing professional football. Everyone see the chance to make some big money, but when a reporter digs up some dirt on the war hero... everyone could lose out.','/dl2yu8iuwG3dqbpjalm2odadRaH.jpg','2008-03-24',114,'Released','If Love Is a Game, Who\'ll Make the First Pass?','Leatherheads',4942,4.7033,5.877,'Yl-aiyudEI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18717,_binary '\0','/2fX8oILb0dGsGH4E6biP2WWlf91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379889',7,40270,'en','The Merchant of Venice','Venice, 1596. Bassanio begs his friend Antonio, a prosperous merchant, to lend him a large sum of money so that he can woo Portia, a very wealthy heiress; but Antonio has invested his fortune abroad, so they turn to Shylock, a Jewish moneylender, and ask him for a loan.','/bvpPg5oTD1qT7hjY3BOsoniYdHG.jpg','2004-12-03',132,'Released',NULL,'The Merchant of Venice',11162,6.0571,6.793,'mdbzRtxVtns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18718,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379918',6.5,1342,'en','Oyster Farmer','A love story about a young man who runs away up an isolated Australian river and gets a job with eighth generation oyster famers.','/iUV6VJa4BrqAU9VI2PxVm7lpej.jpg','2004-09-10',91,'Released',NULL,'Oyster Farmer',16066,1.0121,5.7,'7LGkQPN04Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18719,_binary '\0','/xDVLCGKjJK8wRgTQKZLOevlFoTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0379976',5.7,12786,'en','Savage Grace','This examination of a famous scandal from the 1970s explores the relationship between Barbara Baekeland and her only son, Antony. Barbara, a lonely social climber unhappily married to the wealthy but remote plastics heir Brooks Baekeland, dotes on Antony, who is homosexual. As Barbara tries to \"cure\" Antony of his sexuality -- sometimes by seducing him herself -- the groundwork is laid for a murderous tragedy.','/rtJp4ulwC1SvSYAUFGUa1pWV7nk.jpg','2007-09-20',97,'Released','Truth is more shocking than fiction.','Savage Grace',10822,3.7333,5.7,'ZrJB48uTSeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18720,_binary '\0','/8IuDDi2bNu2at9zU7765gfHBMjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380066',5.6,13585,'en','The Woods','In 1965 New England, a troubled girl encounters mysterious happenings in the woods surrounding an isolated girls school that she was sent to by her estranged parents.','/lQWtLTy7xBxXx1l89sSQRfplHXm.jpg','2006-04-24',91,'Released','Private school, deadly lessons.','The Woods',6948,3.1946,5.7,'aZckcy6kClQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18721,_binary '\0','/cRKVJP9uzKImliEpTprWMN7MZo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380164',5.6,2112,'ko','아카시아','A Korean horror film about an adopted young boy with a strange link to an old, dead acacia tree. As the boy settles in to his new home, the tree comes to life. When the family who adopted him becomes pregnant, he is to go back to the orphanage, and horror ensues.','/eF37VEHEqjjEWBLB1jlGVxsLhgF.jpg','2003-10-17',102,'Released','Nobody loves me except the acacia tree.','Acacia',37284,1.1601,5.788,'ZAkc-GATPJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18722,_binary '\0','/3YeZ81LytfW33FCLKvdvAItvF8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380249',6.8,2609,'sr','Чарлстон за Огњенку','Story of two sisters that grew up in a small Serbian village in the beginning of the 1930s. The village is torn up by wars and years long blood oath. There are no men left in the village. Our heroines, Ognjenka and Mala Boginja decide to go to the city, kidnap men and return life to their village. The lights of the metropolis dazzle them and there starts this little amusing and sentimental adventure.','/90dWmvkiNDEgIhy4cC8HbKAsiLk.jpg','2008-01-30',86,'Released',NULL,'Tears for Sale',16403,1.2794,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18723,_binary '\0','/8RiUJp8Xl4yHTwMC5eA8iM8YVS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380268',7.7,14756,'en','Cocaine Cowboys','In the 1980s, ruthless Colombian cocaine barons invaded Miami with a brand of violence unseen in this country since Prohibition-era Chicago - and it put the city on the map. \"Cocaine Cowboys\" is the true story of how Miami became the drug, murder and cash capital of the United States, told by the people who made it all happen.','/gxGis0HgcLJv2MS3l01a0wuhCAI.jpg','2006-11-03',118,'Released','How Miami became the cocaine capital of the United States!','Cocaine Cowboys',14761,2.207,7.3,'4Kbitg2mKOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18724,_binary '\0','/lTTOed6NeyEaMzgItVWnNrF2yFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380275',8.6,2321,'en','Concert for George','As a memorial to George Harrison on the first anniversary of his passing, The Concert for George was held at the Royal Albert Hall in London on 29 November 2002 . Organized by Harrison\'s widow, Olivia, and son, Dhani, and arranged under the musical direction of Eric Clapton and Jeff Lynne. A benefit for Harrison\'s Material World Charitable Foundation, the all-star concert took place on the day of the first anniversary of his death. Proceeds from the film also went to the Material World Charitable Foundation. The film was shot using discreet cameras from over twelve locations.','/mpz7cVFuwC9QnNMb2SjZOqzCJUx.jpg','2003-10-03',140,'Released',NULL,'Concert for George',28236,2.1303,8.1,'NP-K4hKdmjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18725,_binary '\0','/qOvEqQ8F7UuaraNfDHqxVJTbF7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380277',3.9,3568,'en','The Cookout','When Todd Anderson signs a $30 million deal with his hometown team, the New Jersey Nets, he knows that his life is set for a big change. To keep things real, he decides to throw a barbeque at his place -- just like the ones his family used to have. But when you have new and old friends, family, agents, and product reps in the same house, things are bound to get crazy.','/t5UL6yNoZmirS9RHO4C0HpsVlo8.jpg','2004-09-03',97,'Released','This summer, get your grill on!','The Cookout',18475,2.5753,4.7,'oEiF8EH1W6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18726,_binary '\0','/wIK3PmfQFLISrFl455tq99kkVBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380349',5.8,4798,'fr','L\'Enquête corse','Jack Palmer is a Paris-based detective with a huge ego. Ange Leoni is a rebel native of Corsica whose location can\'t be pinned down by even the most dogged of detectives. Approached by an obscure, small-time attorney and charged with the seemingly simple task of locating the missing Leoni, gifted gumshoe Palmer accepts the job under the assumption that it will be the easiest money of his professional career. But this superstar sleuth is about to find out just how mistaken he was...','/aeYtaowpQTgp5OvIsimvsFHyNzG.jpg','2004-10-06',92,'Released',NULL,'The Corsican File',39386,3.2221,5.9,'8QV1-mv35bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18727,_binary '\0','/7gbyUPeXXKuPKhS33qdrttkk0ht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380366',7.1,7676,'en','Ae Fond Kiss...','A young man upsets his Punjabi family when he falls in love with an Irish schoolteacher.','/tShULKbs8svdBcekljqGPO42PNj.jpg','2004-07-14',104,'Released',NULL,'Ae Fond Kiss...',1404,2.1533,6.5,'Y2YNgMqXh4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18728,_binary '\0','/hpuWR2rfcjRMni6HLtxPet4o4P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380389',6.7,69335,'en','Goal!','Like millions of kids around the world, Santiago harbors the dream of being a professional footballer... However, living in the Barrios section of Los Angeles, he thinks it is only that—a dream. Until one day an extraordinary turn of events has him trying out for Premiership club Newcastle United.','/9YZhJGoIbJtrjDYbENGhR6f6SZE.jpg','2005-09-29',118,'Released','Every dream has a beginning.','Goal!',9763,5.0317,6.8,'--qOSiMyD84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18729,_binary '\0','/2VJ1eehzRI8DQiOu6D75BNgSACI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380420',5.2,1869,'en','Freshman Orientation','A bored college student sees a prime opportunity to score with a hot coed who has made the assumption that he is gay, and he decides to play along when she follows her sorority leader\'s assignment to seduce then cut loose a series of misfits and losers.','/85Jj34KuJieIBobf010KXGNOvt3.jpg','2004-01-18',92,'Released','How Far Would You Swing... To Get The Girl You Loved?','Freshman Orientation',41862,1.5732,5.3,'BL7lLCFA1K0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18730,_binary '\0','/60Cq5hciX1IBTujpy7vA1xGwunI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380485',7.5,1279,'he','הכוכבים של שלומי','16 years old Shlomi lives with his restless mother, his soldier brother and their ill grandfather. Although not doing well in school, Shlomi is a gifted cook and takes care of most household chores. One day, the school\'s principal finds out Shlomi is actually a genius and tries to get him into a more suitable curriculum. However, Shlomi is more interested in taking care of his family and his new love interest, the beautiful girl next door.','/qXGzK4Ypok99C4iUoISAJutl93e.jpg','2003-04-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Bonjour Monsieur Shlomi',78344,1.3407,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18731,_binary '\0','/vmonG9lV1s3CtmOQmmWUO206Xay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380510',6.6,193697,'en','The Lovely Bones','After being brutally murdered, 14-year-old Susie Salmon watches from heaven over her grief-stricken family -- and her killer. As she observes their daily lives, she must balance her thirst for revenge with her desire for her family to heal.','/kIa9CyK2yiE4CAy7RJPGe7lztse.jpg','2009-12-26',136,'Released','The story of a life and everything that came after...','The Lovely Bones',7980,16.4457,7.057,'QydPyttFzhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18732,_binary '\0','/q2FY8sbqaSJBWz5ABg1E6lNiAbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380538',7.4,6348,'es','Matando Cabos','Two young men get involved with some criminals while trying to free the tycoon they kidnapped.','/3zDkYwTGx4BTbqxOszsvniaCJpi.jpg','2004-07-16',98,'Released','A killer mob comedy.','Killing Cabos',14399,2.5521,7.862,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18733,_binary '\0','/2tfwa81Fg8iD4o8iEtIQRI8UY0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380599',6.8,35870,'en','Oliver Twist','An orphan endures a harsh life in a workhouse before fleeing to London, where he falls in with a gang of juvenile pickpockets led by the criminal Fagin, and eventually finds a better life, exposing the cruelties of poverty and child labor in Victorian England.','/zhPdYZ3x2uanhM1SyBj4CuL6hSa.jpg','2005-09-23',130,'Released',NULL,'Oliver Twist',257,6.7501,6.754,'4aUGLJicck8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18734,_binary '\0','/vPZiV7yihBqQ6icvrc05k8vlXuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380609',6.1,6830,'en','P.S.','Louise, an unfulfilled divorced woman with regrets, gets the chance to relive her past when she meets a young man who bears an uncanny resemblance, in name and appearance, to her high school sweetheart who died many years before.','/hcf2pZUjtqa6BpV84VwNZvZf6mg.jpg','2004-10-15',97,'Released','What would you do for a second chance at your first love?','P.S.',25313,3.5891,5.6,'gR64Q43h7gM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18735,_binary '\0','/n7VPfkQMLz80jjIiFftoISBUaiv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380615',7.3,1835,'en','Paper Clips','Whitwell, TN is a small, rural community of less than two thousand people nestled in the mountains of Tennessee. Its citizens are almost exclusively white and Christian. In 1998, the children of Whitwell Middle School took on an inspiring project, launched out of their principal\'s desire to help her students open their eyes to diversity in the world and the horrors and enormity of the holocaust.','/62E1tAw370MbsXWeTR10bg5VX5N.jpg','2004-09-08',82,'Released','It began as a lesson about prejudice... What happened next was a miracle.','Paper Clips',33823,1.3983,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18736,_binary '\0','/hPqpB8P8ghhguGok9sSeTdMVjYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380623',5.5,33395,'en','The Perfect Man','Holly is tired of moving every time her mom Jean breaks up with yet another second-rate guy. To distract her mother from her latest bad choice, Holly conceives the perfect plan for the perfect man, an imaginary secret admirer who will romance Jean and boost her self-esteem.','/sT4sCDXcqQBjAqyDaofkRmP0er5.jpg','2005-06-17',100,'Released','Is it all too good to be true?','The Perfect Man',15648,5.0475,6.153,'uXhk2QJm-14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18737,_binary '\0','/lI4L2g08jlBl2a8HfaOvTxmiFlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380636',7.1,1312,'pl','Pogoda na jutro','A man, after having abandoned his family to live in a monastery, goes back into the world after 17 years.','/7vNFvb10CAY0SBSfyQ4EasTom5v.jpg','2003-10-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Tomorrow\'s Weather',211746,1.1669,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18738,_binary '\0','/kt10YeDszQoDLeBK2Xrp0ZCFSeG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380687',5.3,7412,'en','Satan\'s Little Helper','A naïve young boy unknowingly becomes the pawn of a serial killer.','/osugwBXcbXZ2IYmzR4rCkrJxiQa.jpg','2005-10-04',100,'Released','You\'ll laugh \'til you die.','Satan\'s Little Helper',9976,2.8086,5.4,'V5kHZXUkLTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18739,_binary '\0','/6PESw2RNX9osNRb2bzDCEybgqzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380689',6.8,2953,'ko','스캔들: 조선남녀상열지사','In late 1700s Korea, Lady Cho challenges the playboy Lord Jo-won into seducing and sleeping with her husband\'s coming young, virgin concubine. Lady Cho agrees to sleep with him if he succeeds.','/kyM639uVa6bYY73LDJzNUmOUs26.jpg','2003-10-02',124,'Released','Forbidden desire from the far east.','Untold Scandal',50476,7.9777,6.4,'YBKm7UtYyjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18740,_binary '\0','/A1e1zMf0eG634TWDpHzNDkJujOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380726',5.6,1500,'pl','Stara baśń. Kiedy Słońce było bogiem','In IX century Europe, on the brink of Poland\'s birth, a cruel prince, Popiel, murders his cousins to ensure his son\'s succession. His crimes lead to an uprising of his subjects lead by the former commander of Popiel\'s army, Piastun, and a young hunter and warrior, Ziemowit. Meanwhile Ziemowit falls in love with Dziwa, lovely girl who is to become a priestess in the local temple ...','/9pJjeyOgHremqgNVa9N2bCVoIZm.jpg','2003-09-19',107,'Released',NULL,'The Old Fairy Tale: When the Sun Was God',35021,1.4771,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18741,_binary '\0','/AcB5zkVUYGnFFYqCPcfzTTsILGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380732',6.3,1412,'fr','Sur le seuil','One day, for no apparent reason, a cop kills 11 children. The same day, horror novelist Thomas Roy tries to commit suicide after cutting his fingers. At first glance, nothing seems to link the two events – until Dr. Paul Lacasse, a disillusioned psychiatrist, takes over the case. Prompted by his colleague Jeanne, a fan of Thomas Roy, Dr. Lacasse investigates the writer’s past. Hounded by a gossip columnist, Dr. Lacasse uncovers a series of troubling facts that bolster his convictions about the case. As he tries to reassemble the pieces of the puzzle in order to better treat the famous writer, Dr. Lacasse is dragged further and further into a series of events, with terrifying consequences.','/93xPP1fTVVMcI7oqfGWxSOjLhk0.jpg','2003-10-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Evil Words',50538,1.2864,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18742,_binary '\0','/ymekglI5uasXJsAGkhJzyZjYUod.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380736',6.7,1657,'es','El séptimo día','Isabel Jimenez is a teenager witnessing a horrible feud between her own family and the Fuentes family, a feud involving broken hearts, property disputes and a mysterious fire that destroyed the Fuentes house. Isabel\'s uncle is murdered by Jeronimo Fuentes, who later tries to stab her father. After Jeronimo dies in jail, Isabel must look outside of her family for the truth, learning from the village idiot that her father may have set fire to the Fuentes home.','/2iXtMgvD9TXipIO1z30ysaMXW1t.jpg','2004-04-23',103,'Released','Thirty years of hatred. One bloody Sunday','The 7th Day',29008,1.7116,6.6,'eyfiNlYls3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18743,_binary '\0','/z9tPXNIAs7u8undtCldKZc1I1hb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380773',6.3,1899,'fr','Le Clan','Annecy is no tourist destination for three working-class Algerian brothers and their father, in the months after their mother has died. Marc is deeply troubled: he tries to stiff drug dealers and then plots revenge. Christophe is released from jail, lands a job, and must overcome various temptations in order to keep it. Olivier, nearing 18, may be falling in love with Hicham...','/uiuZvPhIrtAkwB4SR5y1YQNmH1r.jpg','2004-06-16',86,'Released',NULL,'Three Dancing Slaves',36423,1.0253,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18744,_binary '\0','/9rsl0IaUMOlqOaIFz2Ux5BtRP2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0380817',6.2,9244,'en','Winter Passing','Actress Reese Holden has been offered a small fortune by a book editor if she can secure for publication the love letters that her father, a reclusive novelist, wrote to her mother, who has since passed away. Returning to Michigan, Reese finds that an ex-grad student and a would-be musician have moved in with her father, who cares more about his new friends than he does about his own health and well-being.','/uNAiNCHd7015BzeNggoRiTT4abf.jpg','2006-02-07',98,'Released','Sometimes you go looking for something you want. . . and find what you need.','Winter Passing',14256,2.5277,6.1,'yEtlWDkoeYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18745,_binary '\0','/klJMCIblHLFwCuGjKz7tyOpekIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381061',8,754342,'en','Casino Royale','Le Chiffre, a banker to the world\'s terrorists, is scheduled to participate in a high-stakes poker game in Montenegro, where he intends to use his winnings to establish his financial grip on the terrorist market. M sends Bond—on his maiden mission as a 00 Agent—to attend this game and prevent Le Chiffre from winning. With the help of Vesper Lynd and Felix Leiter, Bond enters the most important poker game in his already dangerous career.','/lMrxYKKhd4lqRzwUHAy5gcx9PSO.jpg','2006-11-14',144,'Released','Everyone has a past. Every legend has a beginning.','Casino Royale',36557,20.6434,7.575,'U4NT78c-pYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18746,_binary '\0','/qnYf2NuU9KIOkXyo0adeM9jD8Mj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381111',6.1,4030,'nl','Kruistocht in Spijkerbroek','Dolf a 15 year old boy is sent back in time by a timemachine. Accidentally he is sent back to the Middle Ages. He is rescued by children who are part of a childrens\' crusade, on their way to rescue Jeruzalem. During the trip Dolf finds out the danger is not coming from outside the crusade, but from within.','/c4kphpgrPkkB26IConFGp8bE1vq.jpg','2006-11-15',125,'Released',NULL,'Crusade in Jeans',2286,2.0218,5.9,'c1y_7iCj6xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18747,_binary '\0','/gHmpSJzSc7agekPXnGSKCLAzxrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381116',6,1573,'en','D.C. Sniper: 23 Days of Fear','Based on the known events that shook the United States for 23 days in 2002. Within 24 hours six people were killed by a sniper in Maryland County. A man and his son get overlooked in all settings where shootings occur. The police, in cooperation with the FBI follows the wrong track of a white van, while the murderers act with impunity and panic seizes the population','/wt9e6zLJ0mxIPoqG5rQbPCXoyd.jpg','2003-10-17',120,'Released',NULL,'D.C. Sniper: 23 Days of Fear',10108,2.4513,6.4,'eVkkYUdgIf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18748,_binary '\0','/iz7zb6Y3IeJWiaoKRemKPdej9Mo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381131',7,1583,'en','The Deal','It is approaching an election in the UK when the leader of the Labour party, John Smith, suffers another in a line of heart attacks and dies. With the leadership campaign about to start the clear choice appears to be Gordon Brown, a stanch Scotsman. However Tony Blair is also beginning to appear more likely as he will appeal to Southern voters who would be turned off by Brown. Blair rings Brown to arrange a meeting to discuss which will go for the job. The film flashbacks to the start of their relationship, sharing an office in Westminster on their first seats.','/yuV6TLg5xALrUeRLtKJwk5u8NVg.jpg','2003-09-28',75,'Released',NULL,'The Deal',43699,1.5496,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18749,_binary '\0','/hzzSm5gtM5WYyIqn77VpYILbcIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381270',6.4,5654,'fr','Ils se marièrent et eurent beaucoup d\'enfants','Is love compatible with coupledom? And what of freedom and fidelity? These are some of the questions facing two married men.','/iD9h5RnOqOyt19EUA94zbuGpWHE.jpg','2004-08-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Happily Ever After',14653,2.6165,5.984,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18750,_binary '\0','/pKXUs2l4YjgQlBOl3m4TOQn4Yvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381341',4.3,1475,'en','Kisses and Caroms','In California, Zack owns the \"Breakingtime Billiards\", a store that sells pool tables and game room supplies. He works with his girlfriend Jennifer; the sexy seller Tara; the installer of pool tables and best friend, the wolf David, and his idiot assistant Eddie. After having a threesome arranged by Jen with Tara, Zach breaks up his relationship with Jen, in spite of her bringing him up all the time. He tells his sexual experience to David while Jen asks for an advice to her psychologist Dr. Bob Johnson in his radio show. Along the day and after the visit of many peculiar clients, Zack concludes that Jen is his dream girl.','/i4hxVrmJQLIexMC1koyZMxOAkQW.jpg','2006-08-22',81,'Released','Chalk up your stick','Kisses and Caroms',21473,1.1015,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18751,_binary '\0','/eSsuO7T8Epurn2kGJsw2Gp9E8UE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381348',6.8,16350,'ja','雲のむこう、約束の場所','In a post-war alternative timeline, Japan is divided into the North, controlled by the Union, and the South, controlled by the United States. A mysterious high tower rises within the borders of the Union. Three high school students promise to cross the border with a self-built airplane and unravel the secret of the tower.','/xlyJw6WmfLn378oz0ZmI0SYFoGb.jpg','2004-11-20',90,'Released','Against all odds, a promise will be kept.','The Place Promised in Our Early Days',12924,3.4824,6.6,'b3X0ZSWKOFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18752,_binary '\0','/qbTIAJApAIKRHgs3ejKAWXwLlav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381361',3.4,1887,'en','The Last Sign','A woman who is tormented by the ghost of her abusive, alcoholic husband. She must come to terms with the past if she is to find peace and love...','/6RvP7t1Tq99bB9pD9mI3HqHA8ZN.jpg','2005-05-31',90,'Released','Even The Dead Need Forgiving.','The Last Sign',51121,1.3366,3.6,'xWBYqNR9jqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18753,_binary '\0','/qTZAaHBjdhupfodsMIj4xZrzek0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381392',4.9,8401,'fr','Ma mère','After his father\'s death, a young man is introduced to a world of hedonism and depravity by his amoral mother.','/isjCiiz0pilpAfxAe70rgJthL8p.jpg','2004-05-19',112,'Released',NULL,'Ma mère',48266,4.3646,4.5,'jl2rB7oQres','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18754,_binary '\0','/fDt3yKI0PdSAssMbgQePT4QTOJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381429',6.7,8687,'en','Somersault','Australian teenager Heidi is left with little choice but to leave home after she\'s caught red-handed with her mother\'s boyfriend. With few options, Heidi ends up in Jindabyne, a tourist community. Upon meeting Joe at a bar, she pursues a relationship with him and tries to find something resembling a normal home life. Heidi makes small strides by getting a job and finding a place to stay, but her relationship with Joe must overcome more than its share of hurdles.','/hN6GnyLhamDrz2xAOqVZ4Fv6Lyo.jpg','2004-06-19',105,'Released','Love can turn you upside down.','Somersault',16605,1.5502,6.3,'0uHT1pm3acc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18755,_binary '\0','/yfOZnKb77EOLGewJcvSCb5fZ2a2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381442',6.2,2977,'fr','Narco','Gustave Klopp suffers from narcolepsy, he can fall asleep everwhere at anytime whithout warning. Living a simple life with his wife Pam and his best friend Lenny Bar, Gus decides to undergo therapy sessions and finds out that he can make incredible comics from his dreams.','/w4Ea1P4Ig5B48hZl9owRshUepVs.jpg','2004-12-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Narco',20200,2.6643,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18756,_binary '\0','/pmUHC8IsRJsCEyggnNdbGnqeu6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381505',6.4,11140,'en','Pretty Persuasion','A 15-year-old girl incites chaos among her friends and a media frenzy when she accuses her drama teacher of sexual harassment.','/oTbmRS9OBqACIlgRkTqHIc1n6lO.jpg','2005-01-22',109,'Released','The devil wears a grey skirt and her name is Kimberly Joyce.','Pretty Persuasion',14166,6.0786,5.8,'m1_ud4OUn7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18757,_binary '\0','/7kjJUB5VNVwQETEPptpjuT56cOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381601',4.5,3640,'en','Slipstream','A scientist plots a bank robbery based around his newest invention -- a time travel gadget that will send its user 10 minutes into the past. Everything goes according to plan, until he encounters a group of thieves who\'ve planned their heist for the same day.','/vCHjdhP2gmHaEJycpqeA0LYiwj.jpg','2005-02-03',89,'Released','He\'s got 10 minutes to change the past, or his future is history','Slipstream',24029,2.2298,5.196,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18758,_binary '\0','/1cjQgVNDWEpeKqjJ8I2zQw7O3nx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381637',7.6,4065,'pl','Symetria','Łukasz, an unemployed geography graduate, is wrongfully arrested for robbery. His alibi is weak, and he is identified during a lineup. The situation gets hopeless when, a few hours later, the alleged victim suddenly dies. The defense lawyer promises to do everything in his power, but Łukasz ends up in custody. He must find his place in a world of harsh prison rules. He chooses the cell of the “grypsujący” (inmates who communicate by coded messages)…','/3jJAcF5eE1yBGwMHYRj9xmOkEte.jpg','2003-09-16',99,'Released',NULL,'Symmetry',38530,1.4695,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18759,_binary '\0','/6JPh7zM1CYJVytBT8BTyUoOzevA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381668',7.1,6876,'th','สัตว์ประหลาด','A romance between a soldier and country boy is ruptured by the boy’s sudden disappearance. Their story turns into a mythical venture based on Thai folklore.','/9WJ8ZSZp2NC7jSvweFLskldpzzg.jpg','2004-06-24',118,'Released','Love is a malady without a cure...','Tropical Malady',11534,1.878,6.7,'rRN_HRZoV_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18760,_binary '\0','/tcZi0LQc5iu2u6i5aOWyj9NBBvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381681',8.1,319651,'en','Before Sunset','Nine years later, Jesse travels across Europe giving readings from a book he wrote about the night he spent in Vienna with Celine. After his reading in Paris, Celine finds him, and they spend part of the day together before Jesse has to again leave for a flight. They are both in relationships now, and Jesse has a son, but as their strong feelings for each other start to return, both confess a longing for more.','/4sW5XH9ZfYXpvFzev00S1IGAEbg.jpg','2004-06-16',80,'Released','What if you had a second chance with the one that got away?','Before Sunset',80,9.0398,7.807,'jx0UWbMMZOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18761,_binary '\0','/lDZiR71OuK3CFX9hAK5DZjPIDuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381682',4.4,5302,'sv','Ett hål i mitt hjärta','In a decript apartment, a young man watches as his father and a friend shoot an amateur porn film. Issues of morality, reality TV and friendship are explored.','/nT8SGitqWYH4pfWPiDiFBZTYY0o.jpg','2005-04-08',98,'Released',NULL,'A Hole in My Heart',34614,1.2529,4.4,'SLH410nnTFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18762,_binary '\0','/i7Z2hHvm0bKEFB4EvXpk6kFYDyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381690',6.3,2969,'fr','Vers le sud','A story of three female tourists who visit Haiti, in order to enjoy the sexual nature of the young men.','/6QxQ5D3vgTPPhTUsSUdHfchmOpL.jpg','2006-01-25',108,'Released',NULL,'Heading South',1540,1.5424,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18763,_binary '\0','/di47xqYMCYpjqwnqNlO17X5qXMX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381707',6,200254,'en','White Chicks','Two FBI agent brothers, Marcus and Kevin Copeland, accidentally foil a drug bust. To avoid being fired they accept a mission escorting a pair of socialites to the Hamptons--but when the girls are disfigured in a car accident, they refuse to go. Left without options, Marcus and Kevin decide to pose as the sisters, transforming themselves from black men into rich white women.','/aHTUpo45qy9QYIOnVITGGqLoVcA.jpg','2004-06-23',109,'Released','They\'re going deep undercover.','White Chicks',12153,26.8313,6.966,'aeVkbNka9HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18764,_binary '\0','/eZiWpNvSb3qOTnYp6bxl9hkAHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381717',6.4,3340,'en','Yes','She is a scientist. He is a Lebanese doctor. They meet at a banquet and fall into a carefree, passionate relationship. But difficulties abound because of his heritage and her loveless marriage. She flies to Havana to sort things out on the beach and in the cabarets. She sends him a ticket, but harbors no illusions that He will join her in this Caribbean melting pot.','/70PQCYF3ExuKHqyieJhYV0GJg9H.jpg','2005-08-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Yes',25312,3.0418,5.9,'kWFRkN5SgmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18765,_binary '\0','/u6WDU3Z1d6y0ybisMYiDFwt0YHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381838',7.2,2377,'ko','...ing','Follows the life of a young woman who has become reserved and indifferent to the world as a result of her chronic illness deformed hand and quietly portrays the unconventional, yet endearing relationship between mother and daughter as well as the development of Min-ah as she is befriended by the high spirited and carefree photographer Young-jae who moves into their apartment complex.','/bUy74ts2Ru4mOjXUGzWP1Gs3LG.jpg','2003-11-28',104,'Released','The Happiest Time of My Life.','...ing',41091,1.6333,6.72,'SSN1dAqJJPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18766,_binary '\0','/2eznGndOi8s9CGReAvcQ8PEULwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381849',7.6,353800,'en','3:10 to Yuma','In Arizona in the late 1800s, infamous outlaw Ben Wade and his vicious gang of thieves and murderers have plagued the Southern Railroad. When Wade is captured, Civil War veteran Dan Evans, struggling to survive on his drought-plagued ranch, volunteers to deliver him alive to the \"3:10 to Yuma\", a train that will take the killer to trial.','/voMB69AsLnPNmtfbrBl0lbeFKDH.jpg','2007-09-06',122,'Released','Time waits for one man.','3:10 to Yuma',5176,11.8742,7.235,'Kv6apbWxb5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18767,_binary '\0','/hkRBphefeefAq4Q9sqiOtGv2YdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381936',7,9131,'ru','Бумер','A black BMW, a symbol of luxury, is racing along the night streets of Moscow in the 90s. Bad luck turns four friends into criminals and they have no way back. Only the black “bimmer” is reliable in this life without rules, taking the friends farther and farther from Moscow, into the crazy and ruthless wilderness of Russian roads… None of them wanted to kill. None of them wanted to die. But they will have to face their destiny in the end.','/ukaoIeNfqXbNM0zvUSaRpPaDJoi.jpg','2003-08-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Bimmer',62276,2.1001,6.217,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18768,_binary '\0','/lLt7UMEHeMNnwLQJow8crCcmVU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381940',6.1,20636,'de','Cargo','The story of CARGO takes place on rusty space-freighter KASSANDRA on its way to Station 42. The young medic LAURA is the only one awake on board while the rest of the crew lies frozen in hibernation sleep. In 4 months will Laura\'s shift be over.','/5CFTLlGbRMtNI0ZyfRL4YC1qD4f.jpg','2009-09-24',120,'Released','Space Is Cold','Cargo',34069,2.4204,5.9,'ROxGAncAi2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18769,_binary '\0','/dbtzAgcURp3tklexywJekMluvx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381942',5.2,1367,'en','A Carol Christmas','Carol Cartman, a tempestuous talk show host, is a high-heeled, high-maintenance Scrooge. This insensitive, self-centered and stingy woman is about to experience a holiday she\'ll never forget.','/uhK2RkSV67DM0hfFEzCXAd4s4Bu.jpg','2003-12-07',92,'Released','She\'s looking for a little holiday spirit, before she gets scrooged.','A Carol Christmas',72853,2.191,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18770,_binary '\0','/ooPtDdWP2nuYCoyLJAVwdthf5dN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381966',5.6,34485,'en','Creep','Trapped in a London subway station, a woman who\'s being pursued by a potential attacker heads into the unknown labyrinth of tunnels beneath the city\'s streets','/w5oxV6MDEfL48FMK9BmYTD2wQRm.jpg','2004-08-10',85,'Released','Your journey terminates here.','Creep',8555,4.3539,6,'QZUzM_p6a1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18771,_binary '\0','/3YqFugvX6pQA3FU17maO0DgAo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0381971',6.5,19788,'en','Curious George','When The Man in the Yellow Hat befriends Curious George in the jungle, they set off on a non-stop, fun-filled journey through the wonders of the big city toward the warmth of true friendship.','/7SpokDLiRHON9H36GdlF7vWKOm6.jpg','2006-02-10',87,'Released','Show me the Monkey!','Curious George',9975,9.6537,6.5,'CUjd98rZCVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18772,_binary '\0','/x8PXMl4AGaSgFw9Q4yacQOCNank.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382010',6.5,2369,'ar','اللمبي','El-Limby lives in a decrepit neighborhood with his mother Faransa and he develops feelings for his neighbor. However, her father objects to their marriage, and El-Limby\'s mother encourages him to find a job to provide for his family-to-be.','/xrCgrBgAeOS24sxToCPN1HW7eOL.jpg','2002-07-10',89,'Released',NULL,'El Lemby',42315,1.132,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18773,_binary '\0','/jK4x6pqGXTcbSnoQBjFapNVdGcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382019',4.8,1666,'en','Eternal','Detective Raymond Pope is a detective of questionable morals, searching for his missing wife. His investigation leads him to the wealthy estate of the enigmatic Elizabeth Kane and her young maid Irina. Under Elizabeth\'s fascinating looks and aristocratic manners hides a terrifying secret,shared by her companion Irina. As Detective Pope finds himself perversely drawn to the powerful Elizabeth, bodies begin to surface, his inquiries only deepening the mystery surrounding Elizabeth\'s past. Pope\'s obsession grows so intense that he completely fails to anticipate Elizabeth\'s reaction to his intrusion into her dark world, a fatal mistake that might cost him his life and the lives of those close to him.','/1jhHwF0sMoi8fcmiZh1TAFfG7vF.jpg','2004-09-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Eternal',30767,1.5637,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18774,_binary '\0','/3j8d3Gja1sTgWWBkQQFasZIX6UZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382028',2,4057,'en','Fat Slags','Leaving their hometown of Fulchester in the North of England, Sandra and Tracey head for the bright lights of London, shagging and boozing their way to fame and fortune.','/ysb1ys1JtBHjDC2CjS06xv74JLD.jpg','2004-10-15',73,'Released','Their clothes may be tight but their morals are loose','Fat Slags',31120,1.6465,3.4,'j_CTgE1nDDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18775,_binary '\0','/QeXVsXbhrhHRQAV7TRkuryS4YH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382073',6.8,4966,'en','Heights','Spanning twenty-four hours, HEIGHTS follows five New Yorkers challenged to choose their destiny before the sun comes up the next day.','/vXZ83B2GJ2NgljKziPfx1rYn428.jpg','2005-07-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Heights',29080,1.8574,6.3,'Y1En79L-Yzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18776,_binary '\0','/4QwtFTo7e8pfh0HCklVng5xun3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382077',6,93405,'en','Hide and Seek','David Callaway tries to piece together his life in the wake of his wife\'s suicide and has been left to raise his nine-year-old daughter, Emily on his own. David is at first amused to discover that Emily has created an imaginary friend named \'Charlie\', but it isn\'t long before \'Charlie\' develops a sinister and violent side, and as David struggles with his daughter\'s growing emotional problems, he comes to the frightening realisation that \'Charlie\' isn\'t just a figment of Emily\'s imagination.','/orY4PX3TNFdCbdVwhKY32UKMvoA.jpg','2005-01-27',101,'Released','Come out, come out, whatever you are.','Hide and Seek',11096,7.9145,6.348,'o9uEkTPchIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18777,_binary '\0','/jve16uFoNMyeaZwYOKoyffS24Nv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382095',6.6,1719,'nl','In Oranje','An 11 year old talented soccer player, Remco, has one big dream: to be selected for the national under 12s team. His father Erik coaches him and everything seems to work out fine, until Erik suddenly dies. Remco and mother Sylvia are shocked. Remco keeps working to fulfil his dream, being helped by his friends Anne and Winston.','/i3ecQMqv6QEu2S21Cr2tgcb8mhd.jpg','2004-04-28',90,'Released',NULL,'In Orange',73123,0.9477,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18778,_binary '\0','/oHhvjJsUjUngx5ujTdYwgkWszHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382142',5.7,1266,'en','Full-Court Miracle','Inspired by the true story of University of Virginia basketball star Lamont Carr, the film centers on a group of young Jewish basketball players who search for a coach to help them out of a slump. The main character Alex Schlotsky is inspired by the true story of Alex Barbag and Chad Korpeck.','/f2ijqurlC6fvqWORioahgVXTvKj.jpg','2003-11-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Full-Court Miracle',158265,2.8511,5.8,'bYTXMqGPZS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18779,_binary '\0','/yyD97jO6qJDKuI016aD3a0nTpml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382189',6.7,23188,'en','My Summer of Love','In the Yorkshire countryside, working-class tomboy Mona meets the exotic, pampered Tamsin. To seal their friendship, Mona introduces Tamsin to her born-again Christian brother and helps her spy on her adulterous father. Bound together by their secrets, the two girls see their friendship deepen and enter into dangerous waters.','/47eozMel2wZgEASToUzScsPVpDs.jpg','2005-05-05',87,'Released','The most dangerous thing to want is more.','My Summer of Love',9709,4.2998,6.2,'G6fEOBmqUPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18780,_binary '\0','/o4UvkrkSQBjxgyOKVvFOrdYToxx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382271',6.3,2696,'es','Rosario Tijeras','Rosario Tijeras has been abused by men all her life, initially by her stepfather. Years later, she works as a paid assassin, seducing men and killing them when they least expect it. She meets Emilio, a wealthy womanizer, and his best friend, Antonio, at a nightclub, and starts an affair with Emilio despite Antonio\'s growing feelings for her. But circumstances bring her closer to Antonio, until her past catches up with her in a devastating way.','/d8CnXqN257vDOwZyIaA0IM6DcoU.jpg','2005-08-12',126,'Released','It\'s easier to kill than to love','Rosario Tijeras',10810,3.193,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18781,_binary '\0','/ztUvX5Xik81GYBsrNUklJ7CqLnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382295',4.9,6938,'de','7 Zwerge - Männer allein im Wald','The Seven Dwarves live deep within a female-free-zone of the Enchanted Forest, but they cannot resist the innocent charms of Snow White when she enters their world. So when the evil queen abducts her, it is up to the dwarves to save her life.','/b7cfDQirLJbOryFB0VfpQJHwTIx.jpg','2004-10-28',95,'Released',NULL,'7 Zwerge - Männer allein im Wald',9803,3.4453,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18782,_binary '\0','/mtnJhqHzSV2vRrv9CGJ0nYpNqU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382301',6.4,2203,'en','Skellig','An ordinary boy named Michael is going through some extraordinary changes in his life. His family has just moved into an unfamiliar house, and his brand new baby sister has fallen ill. One day, while cleaning out the garden shed, he stumbles across something mysterious, a strange creature huddled in the corner; weak of body but strong of will. This is Skellig.','/dyJlxhY5WLcrlCm7Gjd2ztpCoay.jpg','2009-04-27',104,'Released','A Magical Story of an Unlikely Friendship.','Skellig',17046,2.2661,6.2,'8SQOTiQSIrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18783,_binary '\0','/1MUfnjzUBTTEEZKaWWmIruh03Ke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382330',7.5,19402,'sv','Så som i himmelen','A musical romantic tragedy about a famous composer who moves back to his small hometown after having had heart troubles. His search for a simple everyday life leads him into teaching the local church choir, which is not easily accepted by the town yet the choir builds a great love for their teacher.','/ygJ6RQQSmXRQLPpUKP9SCdKXSKJ.jpg','2004-09-03',132,'Released',NULL,'As It Is in Heaven',464,3.3214,7.1,'YvsMjwgTU3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18784,_binary '\0','/1h8yWKNP8FkDyRrIkIhMOhsEZxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382357',6.4,4267,'en','Land of Plenty','After living abroad, Lana returns to the United States, and finds that her uncle is a reclusive vagabond with psychic wounds from the Vietnam War.','/oK8z5rPlEjhGBiHk2OqE3bIhyol.jpg','2004-09-10',123,'Released',NULL,'Land of Plenty',1595,3.3862,6.2,'MO5W5OHbBxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18785,_binary '\0','/2caylxaVkTLihX7zqTQlicQHdeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382365',6.1,3658,'nl','Vet Hard','Bennie, a clumsy criminal who\'s touchy about his weight, teams up with his adoptive father\'s biological (serial killer) son, his employees who in his absence turned his snack-bar into a quiche bakery, a suicidal manic-depressive woman and a Yugoslavian who keeps blowing things up unintended. They need to get 300000 Euro to get Bennies father a new liver.','/cdll0WQH5fyWXaKRKSjm2AUZzVY.jpg','2005-02-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Too Fat Too Furious',29101,1.5729,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18786,_binary '\0','/xDs2K2VNBz7UemiUt3rywvdLHKx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382383',7.3,9859,'hi','युवा','An accident on a bridge ties together three young men from different social classes, sparking a course of events that will forever alter their lives.','/m3h7iSCBBFT40IZYuh3IjJN6fjE.jpg','2004-05-22',161,'Released',NULL,'Yuva',43410,1.7133,6.553,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18787,_binary '\0','/hxB33dWpFAaSL3xI6LBZ8VRRTvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382385',5.4,1847,'hi','Zameen','An Army colonel (Devgan) and his commandos capture a dangerous terrorist. The other members of the terrorists\' organization hatch a plot to hijack an Indian jet and demand his release in exchange. In Mumbai, ACP Jay (Bachchan) is hot on their trail. He discovers Army\'s involvement in the case and has to work together with the colonel. However, there are some skeletons in the closet.','/jAKO0Rk0Vqm1Mabi6tpFTY202hz.jpg','2003-09-26',154,'Released',NULL,'Zameen',101783,0.9376,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18788,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382561',5.1,5878,'en','Hair Show','Running from the IRS due to back taxes, Baltimore hairdresser and salon owner Peaches reunites with her more successful sister, Angela, a fellow stylist, in Los Angeles. Angela is burdened by her sister\'s financial woes, and Peaches\' rival, Marcella, threatens to take over the salon back in Baltimore. While Angela helps her sister get back on her feet, Peaches enters a hairstyling competition in hopes of winning a big cash prize and saving her salon.','/jmSJv7x00qN4Z5fS5AzzAbNSILg.jpg','2004-10-17',104,'Released','Beyond The Beauty Shop.','Hair Show',167177,1.3565,5.5,'DTzrz-DVvRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18789,_binary '\0','/2JgnbTVpE6kqu1Q9FK6gc1GEQOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382621',6.8,3649,'es','Crónicas','A suspense thriller about a reporter from Miami who travels to Ecuador in pursuit of a serial killer known as the \"Monster of Babahoyo.\"','/pPQOC8eyaJmlouI9Il4dCF2iS6E.jpg','2004-05-16',108,'Released','If It\'s On TV, It Must Be The Truth.','Crónicas',20511,1.8566,6.377,'-AMLH3Cx7_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18790,_binary '\0','/4NsQl44oXVMiuIM9t7ZsVgYzOkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382625',6.7,490308,'en','The Da Vinci Code','A murder in Paris’ Louvre Museum and cryptic clues in some of Leonardo da Vinci’s most famous paintings lead to the discovery of a religious mystery. For 2,000 years a secret society closely guards information that — should it come to light — could rock the very foundations of Christianity.','/9ejKfNk0LBhSI9AahH4f9NJNZNM.jpg','2006-05-17',149,'Released','Seek the truth.','The Da Vinci Code',591,21.0683,6.736,'Xy6aVei3Mnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18791,_binary '\0','/XKZjyePvRYPn7JdfRGZO3Q87qu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382628',5.6,68202,'en','Dark Water','Dahlia and her five-year-old daughter are ready to begin a new life together. But their new apartment — dilapidated and worn — suddenly seems to take on a life of its own. Mysterious noises, persistent leaks of dark water and other strange happenings send Dahlia on a haunting and mystifying pursuit — one that unleashes a torrent of living nightmares.','/cm4M9xaBu78IjuAVNG4LCXdXsg.jpg','2005-07-08',105,'Released','Dark water conceals darker secrets.','Dark Water',9009,6.1619,5.7,'t24DuU9TXRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18792,_binary '\0','/qH6e13I6ScnJ8JGkbbChYsZ7puK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382765',6.3,7273,'en','Jindabyne','Outside the Australian town of Jindabyne, local man Stuart Kane is on a fishing trip with friends when they discover the body of a murdered girl.','/zozfpvbl8OezjqBsgFByTGkbnw8.jpg','2006-07-20',123,'Released','Under the surface of every life lies a mystery','Jindabyne',4657,2.2137,5.4,'4Krrq9hSQTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18793,_binary '\0','/toe4WbxplWcOCxGbQsKlkQ7kTs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382806',7,3139,'en','Look Both Ways','During one unusually hot weekend, four friends struggle after hearing some life-changing news.','/cHjIvyJJw2FKP1wXTGdcaQ77g28.jpg','2005-08-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Look Both Ways',16151,2.0013,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18794,_binary '\0','/bjVXOhX9AKIzK5o53rnzc0aKp5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382810',6.1,9671,'en','Little Fish','Set in the Little Saigon district outside of Sydney, a woman trying to escape her past becomes embroiled in a drug deal.','/d3ohsAq0DO5z5nTWVkEkzVg48DK.jpg','2005-07-19',114,'Released','The past is right here','Little Fish',9993,1.7742,5.8,'wxenulh_JIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18795,_binary '\0','/qXh8mVwF9IQwclEZAdjbuqfXAeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382856',3.6,1524,'en','Monster Island','Mutant radioactive bugs attack VJs, Carmen Electra and an island full of MTV contest winners in this tongue-in-cheek tribute to B-movies, monster flicks and even MTV. MTV Original Movies presents Monster Island, a flick with old school effects mixed with hot new celebrities. There’s action, romance and big bugs--now is that something you really want to miss?','/mkzLVg7jhsPLd5LJ8KBSz4fgBqE.jpg','2004-03-07',88,'Released','Tickets to Paradise... or ParaSITES?','Monster Island',88905,1.8673,4.4,'FCF-zMRTB9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18796,_binary '\0','/qxGmHvmjlBlH5WZOhdHEHAjHaMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382932',8.1,965858,'en','Ratatouille','In one of Paris\'s finest restaurants, Remy, a determined young rat, dreams of becoming a renowned French chef. Torn between his family\'s wishes and his true calling, Remy and his pal Linguini set in motion a hilarious chain of events that turns the City of Lights upside down.','/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg','2007-06-28',111,'Released','He\'s dying to become a chef.','Ratatouille',2062,31.4496,7.847,'-tNqfcZKn6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18797,_binary '\0','/JhSAJ2IRpsAyC1veq6bNjIBjwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382988',7,4453,'el','Σπιρτόκουτο','Dimitris, a grumpy middle-aged man, is having a hard time with his business partner on a particular decision as to opening a new business; and he\'s also having a hell of a time with his family members. He has a really short temper, and the unpleasant behaviour of his nasty wife and his disrespectful children don\'t contribute much to his health.','/j4qO46PThmTqhVKvoxG95HV5FXn.jpg','2003-03-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Matchbox',47106,0.8323,7.209,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18798,_binary '\0','/qpHQMt7zzlEkN3R4zMsYkqhgpeK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0382992',5.1,58857,'en','Stealth','Deeply ensconced in a top-secret military program, three pilots struggle to bring an artificial intelligence program under control ... before it initiates the next world war.','/cVtQHyTwaDhYFVRFXSuDthC2bXH.jpg','2005-07-27',121,'Released','Fear the sky','Stealth',10048,6.7996,5.5,'dJ8FNgRQFuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18799,_binary '\0','/pCPXnddyDtsHAZVzVumuRpDN1vO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383010',5.2,34967,'en','The Three Stooges','Left on the doorstep of an orphanage run by nuns, three newborn knuckleheads grow up to be finger-poking, nyuk-nyuking janitors named Larry, Curly and Moe. When they learn that financial problems will soon force the only home they\'ve ever known to close, the trio sets out to raise $830,000 in one month. Out in the world for the very first time, the three innocent bumblers become embroiled in a murder plot and find stardom on a TV reality show.','/b0nNQCL90RGTwjxLEFsFFLQZKNe.jpg','2012-04-13',92,'Released','All pain. No brain.','The Three Stooges',76489,5.5431,5.8,'RQGXqn00hf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18800,_binary '\0','/tzrjDbbDTleFhoPPyDkhe1US2kA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383020',7.5,1379,'ru','Настройщик','A young piano tuner befriends two rich old-ladies, and plots, with the help of his girlfriend, to betray their trust and steal from them.','/vPVuY2Ya1tXVZnVT8OiZL5X29Gj.jpg','2005-04-07',154,'Released',NULL,'The Tuner',61385,1.4065,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18801,_binary '\0','/c6L4ns0Nac4I9lr7yTE9Xf4TI8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383025',6.6,1872,'fr','Mensonges et trahisons et plus si affinités…','Raphael is a ghostwriter who takes a job writing for famous footy player Kevin. To his delight and his girlfriend, Murials horror, Kevins current girlfriend is an old (easily rekindled) flame of Raphaels. A freak accident leaves a close friend dead and Raphael is forced to reconsider his priorities.','/yjBq8pSEXpnmypHkIXqFhVXahnw.jpg','2004-09-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Story Of My Life',10271,1.3798,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18802,_binary '\0','/insPcjOIWFf6Uc9DR0ORgXATqSM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383028',7.5,105899,'en','Synecdoche, New York','A theater director struggles with his work, and the women in his life, as he attempts to create a life-size replica of New York inside a warehouse as part of his new play.','/5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg','2008-10-24',124,'Released','The end is built into the beginning.','Synecdoche, New York',4960,6.7153,7.526,'i2q8F0yRmrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18803,_binary '\0','/uMGIiLUP54iXu6bo5PqrlZe9xyy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383041',5.8,1239,'de','Vom Suchen und Finden der Liebe','Director helmut Dietls and Patric Susskinds illustrate a legendary story of two lovers who cant keep themselves away from death.','/eauZ3KLBcBejZDyXge5HoWJ6zwn.jpg','2005-01-27',105,'Released',NULL,'About the Looking for and the Finding of Love',419,1.6898,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18804,_binary '\0','/78wGUhRitwMSc72vUng0k2gYNUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383053',7.3,2581,'en','Windy City Heat','A man caught up in the glamor of being a Hollywood celebrity has no idea that the production he\'s in is a fake.','/nAHkyMQbTufFk9P6f7Jv5BXaQCs.jpg','2003-10-12',92,'Released','Unleash the fury','Windy City Heat',47126,1.6923,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18805,_binary '\0','/n3PvPAdpnh1eaGXzfkXDBzm9GaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383060',4.4,23732,'en','Zoom','Jack Shepard is an out-of-shape auto shop owner, far removed from the man who once protected the world\'s freedom. Reluctantly called back into action by the government, Jack is tasked with turning a ragtag group of kids with special powers into a new generation of superheroes to save the world from certain destruction.','/v4rSFmiy0v9D7qmKkaUVJn5UhZ1.jpg','2006-08-11',88,'Released','They\'re going to save the world... as long as they\'re home for dinner.','Zoom',14113,5.5689,5.3,'5y7q5b3WyEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18806,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383177',9,3584,'bn','আগুনের পরশমণি','A middle-class family shelters a freedom fighter in war-torn Dhaka.','/ygJopYcwwi8wbZTaUFav5u6Rz8L.jpg','1995-05-25',123,'Released',NULL,'Aguner Poroshmoni',93526,0.9741,7.821,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18807,_binary '\0','/3jiNJ4lyAmdSidvbFTFIL2GQGBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383216',5.7,100335,'en','The Pink Panther','When the coach of the France football team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium at the end of a game, and his huge, expensive ring with the Pink Panther diamond disappears, the ambitious Chief Inspector Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector – Jacques Clouseau – to the case.','/57ViRkdsddHLK32W8Nf3ZPLSAu4.jpg','2006-02-10',93,'Released','Pardon His French.','The Pink Panther',12096,9.8235,5.9,'er7sxi-ur1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18808,_binary '\0','/7M4Gg8VJLO4RgZVfEPq02px2SVL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383222',3,38858,'en','BloodRayne','In 18th-century Romania, after spending much of her life in a traveling circus, human-vampire hybrid Rayne escapes and plots to take down her father, Kagan, the evil vampire king. When she\'s discovered by three vampire hunters, she manages to convince them to spare her life and join her cause. But slaying a vampire as powerful as Kagan will be no easy task.','/1Xy9uu5INNMnyF7W6BTEQkkGOZC.jpg','2006-01-06',94,'Released','Revenge never tasted so sweet.','BloodRayne',168705,3.8119,4.155,'-3rk6xEZn5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18809,_binary '\0','/jkpnzK3azTAKjuEnowngms6K9GP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383304',5.3,2183,'en','Deepwater','A drifter comes to the town of Deepwater and is seduced into a twisted game of deceit and murder.','/tVBVqC9pzgeQw6VBDwENivv77bn.jpg','2005-06-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Deepwater',9915,1.9478,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18810,_binary '\0','/si4hR3wG5RuFsqLANYFVoDpt2lq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383353',5.2,6289,'en','Evil Aliens','The sensationalist reporter Michelle Fox presents the TV show Weird World, with phony matters about UFOS and aliens. When she hears about Cat, a young woman that claims that have been abducted with her boyfriend and become pregnant by aliens, she convinces her chief to travel with a team to the remote Welsh island of Scalled to interview Cat. She invites the cameraman Ricky Anderson with his sound technician partner; the nerd expert in \"ufology\" and \"ley lines\" Gavin Gorman; the actress Candy Vixen and an obscure gay actor to prepare the matter. They get a van and wait for the low tide to reach the island, and when they find evidences that aliens are really landed in the location, the ambitious Michelle decides to film her way to fame and wealth.','/rSGYrrua4QoyXPhic6GvxgdQFb8.jpg','2006-03-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Evil Aliens',10177,2.3427,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18811,_binary '\0','/dlFloiCgHWPXQtjnQzR7SOT0NdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383393',6.4,3801,'en','Helter Skelter','The rise of Charles Manson and his \"family,\" who are responsible for a series of famous murders in the late 1960s. Manson, a magnetic and mysterious man, attracts road-weary single mother Linda Kasabian to join his collection of outcasts on a ranch outside of Los Angeles. After murdering actress Sharon Tate, Manson and his followers are investigated by district attorney Vincent Bugliosi.','/qunKvPx1m2VuuMELKIMqPKjkwbT.jpg','2004-07-23',137,'Released','How did one man turn all-American teens into cold-blooded killers?','Helter Skelter',45759,2.7014,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18812,_binary '\0','/xxyLAhbU2iDDAKM1LX7nAieAh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383518',6.1,4522,'en','Mouth to Mouth','An aimless adolescent joins several itinerant misfits who live on the fringe of society and welcome at-risk youths into their fold.','/1b5nFWdaWRpjNP4axtmvfoVyKFe.jpg','2005-06-02',101,'Released','Close your eyes and picture the perfect world.','Mouth to Mouth',8008,1.3923,5.5,'-xuke9qmZDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18813,_binary '\0','/pON7e50BuoMYRKRlksWpxQQd6Gt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383534',6.1,11874,'en','Noel','With Christmas Eve just around the corner in bustling New York, five lonely and sad strangers find their lives inadvertently intersected.','/pPYlVwLF8mRFxCiXFxHeFN0d4ON.jpg','2004-11-12',96,'Released','Miracles are closer than you think.','Noel',41171,4.4141,5.8,'-pmlZ_IfNNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18814,_binary '\0','/vr6n6ZFUZvedvIlhfYcbCWcaKyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383574',7.4,836948,'en','Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Man\'s Chest','Captain Jack Sparrow’s got a blood debt to pay: he owes his soul to the legendary Davy Jones, ghastly Ruler of the Ocean Depths. To escape eternal servitude aboard the Flying Dutchman, ever-crafty Jack must track down the still-beating heart of Jones. But he won’t do it alone: Will Turner and Elizabeth Swann are drawn back into another one of his perilous quests—assuming they can evade execution for aiding a pirate.','/uXEqmloGyP7UXAiphJUu2v2pcuE.jpg','2006-07-06',151,'Released','Captain Jack is back!','Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Man\'s Chest',58,39.1185,7.39,'elqO-GNfStM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18815,_binary '\0','/lznDiKSx3ZO6LUlGkGxjKo4i6pQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383678',7.9,4199,'en','Trailer Park Boys','After a psychic predicts his death, a small-time hoodlum named Julian hires a cheap documentary film crew to document the last few days of his mis-spent life. This is the film that pioneered the show of the same name.','/sB2JGcgznErnf9lCm8cZjhV2W4W.jpg','1999-07-15',67,'Released',NULL,'Trailer Park Boys',38674,1.433,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18816,_binary '\0','/ziJgbmfktniqisfCqJSqQ8VreZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383694',7.6,28998,'en','Vera Drake','Abortionist Vera Drake finds her beliefs and practices clash with the mores of 1950s Britain – a conflict that leads to tragedy for her family.','/556fElboCLlEmP8UULaYosU45Bc.jpg','2004-10-22',125,'Released','Wife. Mother. Criminal.','Vera Drake',11109,4.3048,7.2,'_5L3hGxHumY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18817,_binary '\0','/cHmXbVVxgvmND7wYIgxBNLW4sFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383717',6.6,1658,'en','Wilby Wonderful','A day-in-the-life dark comedy concerning a group of islanders, their respective secrets, and one man\'s plan to kill himself quietly.','/swoPnOcgrVFHbKlOtG9N4n3zNZ0.jpg','2004-09-13',99,'Released','Everybody gets a second chance.','Wilby Wonderful',38349,1.4248,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18818,_binary '\0','/zhmUqvka887cLSE68GWFiDrj1ix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383846',8.4,12617,'sr','Kad porastem biću kengur','A young student Braca is trying to seduce a beautiful model Iris. Although they are from two different worlds, they both try not to show it. In another story, Šomi and Duje anxiously follow the football match between Manchester and Eastwich. They bet on Eastwich, because their childhood friend Kengur is their goalkeeper. The plot of the third story takes place on the roof of the solitaire, where Avaks and Hibrid are wasting time in anticipation of something happening.','/sf5BCdk9cZykYIKUCiVvGTZjnjS.jpg','2004-03-25',99,'Released',NULL,'When I Grow Up, I\'ll Be a Kangaroo',55135,1.7542,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18819,_binary '\0','/nebsdIFZ50aiqNPTpk7QjW0Svc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383862',7.4,1412,'es','Roma','Joaquín Góñez, a novelist in his sixties recalls his emotions, his wild years in Buenos Aires, the memories of old friends, the meaning of loyalty and the intimate relationship with his mother, Roma.','/umwZzQUp20FSyLQk2BfZQixqMr1.jpg','2004-04-15',152,'Released','Uncovering the buried past...','Roma',43432,1.1711,6.5,'Jh_LZ3Ol8tY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18820,_binary '\0','/vKKz7PlhKC8t2HhGqZKmaDH8atx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383975',6.8,2698,'hi','चमेली','Lamington Road on Bombay\'s Western Railway is the nearest railway station that takes one to Kamathipura, notorious for it\'s red-light, in particular, and a crime-prone area in general.','/uIDURYYsAQYmV4V9PgNG7cL2nuO.jpg','2003-12-31',108,'Released',NULL,'Chameli',33067,2.9434,5.865,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18821,_binary '\0','/5UJFS2nXZKiJ6xmxBfLdG4k3CBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0383995',5.3,1629,'fr','Les Clefs de bagnole','Who would think losing car keys could lead us that far ? Be careful, adventure is on every street corner...','/zzaO8iWpWEA84kD2L02xCOqZ9p3.jpg','2003-12-10',90,'Released','Don\'t watch it, this is shit !','The Car Keys',16930,2.109,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18822,_binary '\0','/g90Hlbaj8OofowG9hDg9ScD5fqG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384116',8,72468,'tr','G.O.R.A.','Carpet dealer and UFO photo forger Arif is abducted by aliens and must outwit the evil commander-in-chief of G.O.R.A., the planet where he is being held.','/k58f5o49jv3R9JXDTrGby53BLqf.jpg','2004-11-12',127,'Released',NULL,'G.O.R.A.',27275,2.257,7.273,'EmCsr9g9q-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18823,_binary '\0','/j54AMTBNjpYESymzcrfLxHmLSbt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384286',5.8,30043,'en','Cry_Wolf','After a local woman is murdered, a group of teenage liars create a warning e-mail of a serial killer named “The Wolf”, coming on the next full moon. The teens describe each death method The Wolf uses, but when the described victims actually do start turning up dead, suddenly no one knows where the lies end and the truth begins.','/7OQ2McKYgnyfIHHkm0jBxQnu7ou.jpg','2005-09-16',90,'Released','Nobody believes a liar... even when they\'re telling the truth.','Cry_Wolf',10092,4.7879,5.8,'RybzZQodTtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18824,_binary '\0','/7Or5uj52hqOnHWDna13OagcX9aP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384369',7.4,19897,'de','Napola - Elite für den Führer','In 1942, Friedrich Weimer\'s boxing skills get him an appointment to a National Political Academy (NaPolA) – high schools that produce Nazi elite. Over his father\'s objections, Friedrich enrolls. During his year in seventh column, Friedrich encounters hazing, cruelty, death, and the Nazi code. His friendship with Albrecht, the ascetic son of the area\'s governor, is central to this education.','/dhTTscZkiQefuq6OeYp9rnvhCBW.jpg','2004-07-04',117,'Released','Men make history. We make the men.','Before the Fall',9393,4.3901,7.1,'aBcPXnLR6Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18825,_binary '\0','/arrc5eDdvbtSE9mbdfRUKmAwtaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384488',7.3,6664,'en','Saint Ralph','This Canadian made comedy/drama, set in Hamilton, Ontario in 1954, is a sweet and - at times - goofy story that becomes increasingly poignant as the minutes tick by. It\'s the fictional tale of a wayward 9th grader, Ralph (Adam Butcher), who is secretly living on his own while his widowed, hospitalized mother remains immersed in a coma. Frequently in trouble with Father Fitzpatrick (Gordon Pinsent), the principal of his all-boys, Catholic school, Ralph is considered something of a joke among peers until he decides to pull off a miracle that could save his mother, i.e., winning the Boston Marathon. Coached by a younger priest and former runner, Father Hibbert (Campbell Scott), whose cynicism has been lifted by the boy\'s pure hope, Ralph applies himself to his unlikely mission, fending off naysayers and getting help along a very challenging path from sundry allies and friends.','/3MdWgqUunIBWnc7mYi2dtZrD54Y.jpg','2005-08-05',95,'Released','He\'s hoping for a miracle. He doesn\'t have a prayer.','Saint Ralph',25248,2.1103,7,'Vh6KlOW1J8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18826,_binary '\0','/nCVrPYcMWT9AUdxx4lFgOEwPM8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384491',7,2151,'hi','Samay: When Time Strikes','Assistant Commissioner of Police (ACP) Malvika Chauhan battles time to obtain & solve the clues to solve the various murders occurring in the city.','/vlxRMeakczNOsovgluMk6T65rcw.jpg','2003-10-10',130,'Released',NULL,'Samay: When Time Strikes',150922,1.4709,6.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18827,_binary '\0','/piT1WWJlC0ebUVpAWI1SBwg2Vdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384504',7.4,15547,'en','Saving Face','A Chinese-American lesbian and her traditionalist mother are reluctant to go public with secret loves that clash against cultural expectations.','/7XbbgkKi4nEMOu9iwiANXpjKKhe.jpg','2004-09-12',97,'Released','A romantic comedy about right, wrong and everything in between.','Saving Face',19316,3.206,7.2,'78h8WeP3Oas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18828,_binary '\0','/61TkJ1U9zBF6C7JczCswA8BQ3AT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384533',5.3,8595,'en','She Hate Me','Fired from his job, a former executive turns to impregnating wealthy lesbians for profit.','/jjfzD3AEABBuJRnCJAZhUuwQvPi.jpg','2004-07-30',139,'Released','One heterosexual male. 18 lesbians. His fee $10,000... each.','She Hate Me',20912,3.7718,5.1,'OMNWW4XE_eU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18829,_binary '\0','/48TM0HjZSRjIr4QMuDTsMWcz7gX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384537',6.5,263248,'en','Silent Hill','Rose, a desperate mother, takes her adopted daughter, Sharon, to the town of Silent Hill in an attempt to cure her of her ailment. After a violent car crash, Sharon disappears, and Rose embarks on a horrific journey to get her back and begins to uncover the truth behind the apocalyptic disaster that burned the town 30 years earlier.','/r0bEDWO2w4a43K2xTNSF284qOsc.jpg','2006-04-21',125,'Released','We\'ve been expecting you.','Silent Hill',588,15.8654,6.646,'1mfnhu8sO5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18830,_binary '\0','/wbxZNVlmnEmvwJrquQFKPV66D4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384639',6.8,4798,'no','Uno','Best friends David and Morten work as gym instructors at Jarle\'s gym. Jarle is a sadistic small-time criminal whom, together with his son Lars, purchase and distribute anabolic steroids.','/3DAmSxmj9ezpLN2xwKzl1WdOL3w.jpg','2004-09-10',103,'Released','You can\'t stand alone forever','Uno',18508,1.5261,6.5,'t6beS01oaaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18831,_binary '\0','/ryWBhLFJGaebx5G2AM872Q3MX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384642',5.6,44108,'en','Kicking & Screaming','Phil Weston has been unathletic his entire life. In college he failed at every sport that he tried out for. It looks like his 10-year old son, Sam, is following in his footsteps. But when Phil\'s hyper-competitive dad benches Sam, Phil decides to transfer his son to a new team which needs a coach. Phil steps in to be the temporary coach and immediately begins to butt heads with his dad over this new competition in their lives.','/4erPZ5V0yzNXRB2IcypOACMEgOA.jpg','2005-05-13',95,'Released','All his life, Phil Weston has dreamed of being on a winning team. Phil...your time has come.','Kicking & Screaming',9981,5.4063,5.798,'uhVqNhOKVws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18832,_binary '\0','/wn2zysoNM6QncXEw9MyvSGJ6eS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384680',6.5,86635,'en','The Weather Man','A Chicago weather man, separated from his wife and children, debates whether professional and personal success are mutually exclusive.','/oQilVzOxLPxvBn9hAuvGpKTpONM.jpg','2005-10-20',101,'Released','...bring an umbrella','The Weather Man',6963,4.513,6.1,'qjweCcEa61o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18833,_binary '\0','/wGrlPGwCcbmaJnxyGOAJISIjvqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384683',6.3,2192,'en','What We Do Is Secret','The true-life story of Darby Crash, who became an L.A. punk icon with his band The Germs. Along with Lorna Doom, Pat Smear, and Don Bolles, Darby Crash completely transformed the L.A. punk scene, while sacrificing everyone he loved, his career, and ultimately his life.','/3ZsIq3gg5oW7TZwey9xbqYpjyBc.jpg','2007-06-23',92,'Released','American Punk started with a Germ','What We Do Is Secret',17137,1.8176,5.1,'JYi_bVkWWuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18834,_binary '\0','/6coKuJMLZnX1Us87n5H51giDC5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384686',6.5,7368,'en','The White Countess','In 1930s Shanghai, \'The White Countess\' is both Sofia, a fallen member of the exiled Russian aristocracy, and a nightclub created by a blind American diplomat who asks Sofia to be the centerpiece of the world he wants to create.','/65AKidOOKrfyQkiVYtkgDJVM4CA.jpg','2005-10-30',135,'Released',NULL,'The White Countess',18840,2.8104,6.2,'L7pGV5AiPWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18835,_binary '\0','/gHn0UK1kQ2UlZcPkfKyRr8r8Alr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384699',6.5,1721,'en','Missing in America','A haunted Vietnam veteran, living in exile in the forests of the Pacific Northwest, is faced with a life-changing decision after he is visited by a former platoon member and his young Amerasian daughter.','/f6mktkzLF0dAK1tuoIJm0WNOltX.jpg','2005-01-01',102,'Released','It\'s never too late to find your way home','Missing in America',13834,1.5474,5.7,'O9OPFemqzZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18836,_binary '\0','/bKdNEAJ4TEN7w9Y8MgUwiC7F8Xd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384793',6.4,149480,'en','Accepted','A high school slacker who\'s rejected by every school he applies to opts to create his own institution of higher learning, the South Harmon Institute of Technology, on a rundown piece of property near his hometown.','/pMh1dCw5vhMATmJs0ve0OpoSVED.jpg','2006-08-18',93,'Released','When every college turned them down. . . they made one up.','Accepted',9788,6.1864,6.47,'NRfS_Pvk0Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18837,_binary '\0','/27acFtG7du5twjjYzUDj5EDbE0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384806',5.9,123444,'en','The Amityville Horror','George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Dutch colonial mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.','/4D246dpe7yy2GvHI2IbpeqkUXry.jpg','2005-04-14',90,'Released','What happened over the next 28 days has never been explained.','The Amityville Horror',10065,9.9244,6.127,'j_Lm2PXb3tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18838,_binary '\0','/yoiKV1vb8RsB9AVEipMdZ6aye16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384810',6.4,4621,'en','Around the Bend','A tale of four generations of men, all of whom have had their offspring at a young age: a great-grandfather, a grandfather, a father in his twenties and a son who is about 7 years old. When the oldest member passes away, the trio heads out on the road together in the Southwest to search out an old family secret that connects to their past.','/9JcHU68BwPh6FhSwGp9CvHyN7h1.jpg','2004-10-08',85,'Released','The skeletons in the family closet just came out to play.','Around the Bend',15503,2.7476,5.9,'AQuG5nfQoko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18839,_binary '\0','/qykc21PjbISZCmpKedY76fojV1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384814',5.7,10522,'en','Ask the Dust','Mexican beauty Camilla hopes to rise above her station by marrying a wealthy American. That is complicated by meeting Arturo Bandini, a first-generation Italian hoping to land a writing career and a blue-eyed blonde on his arm.','/iuJZyJNiQxnmMBBqu40mF0a2nuv.jpg','2006-02-02',117,'Released','Trapped by passion. Faced by their dreams.','Ask the Dust',1967,2.8091,5.5,'NkkhO8_6Yiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18840,_binary '\0','/oKGaTHGcveMKUalGLmEIt5CUgNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384819',6.7,15559,'ja','あずみ','In war-torn Japan, the Tokugawa Shogun, desperate to restore peace to his people, orders the assassination of the hostile warlords. A beautiful young woman is raised from birth with nine other orphans, to become an assassin. Her name is Azumi, the ultimate assassin.','/3pnMViIDP6whWXnTBq7ibQipSyS.jpg','2003-05-10',128,'Released','From The Ravages of War Raises An Assassin.','Azumi',5889,3.5084,6.9,'XmI86tMnNmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18841,_binary '\0','/69evmTt8pqn94fQ3ny2t6OPNYyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384832',5.7,1596,'ja','地獄甲子園','Battlefield Baseball is a tough game — it doesn\'t end until all the members on the opposing team are dead. In this game the Gedo High team is composed of blue-faced zombies, and their opponents on the Seido High team know they don\'t have a chance at beating them unless they can bring back a star pitcher who has a lethal pitch called the Super Tornado, but who has hung up his cleats and has no desire to return to the game.','/zBR2uo91eF4UK66eF6tMDl9Fd1.jpg','2003-07-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Battlefield Baseball',51890,1.2034,5.5,'ocyUzoaoVfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18842,_binary '\0','/3uJhw4tMRodXlZHk2aoRJ9L9qoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384833',4.7,5946,'en','Frankenfish','When the body of a man is found completely destroyed in the swamps in Louisiana, the medical investigator Sam Rivers is assigned to investigate the murder. He travels with the biologist Mary Callahan to the location where the victim lived in a floating house and he meets his family and friends. They find that Chinese snake-heads genetically engineered that belong to a wealthy hunter are attacking and killing the locals. While the group fights to survive, the hunter Jeff arrives with his team to hunt the predators.','/wEDsyEsd0mf5UJ8hxpD1UFCu06X.jpg','2004-10-09',84,'Released','Welcome to the bottom of the food chain.','Frankenfish',33641,2.6932,5.6,'nvWMdTgl9hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18843,_binary '\0','/5T2cfBEZ1rNPJVOcLddVM6gxMnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0384929',6.4,2579,'en','The Dying Gaul','A grief-stricken screenwriter unknowingly enters a three-way relationship with a woman and her film executive husband - to chilling results.','/rDnZhwCILaP2hfLkyQWQmzrUdV9.jpg','2005-01-20',95,'Released','\"Woe to him who seeks to please rather than appall.\"','The Dying Gaul',41189,1.9469,6,'4anzz0hhGjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18844,_binary '\0','/isRzCN0ATsZ4CdBf6CSGA2ruclW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385002',7.4,172966,'en','Green Street Hooligans','After being wrongfully expelled from Harvard University, American Matt Buckner flees to his sister\'s home in England. Once there, he is befriended by her charming and dangerous brother-in-law, Pete Dunham, and introduced to the underworld of British football hooliganism. Matt learns to stand his ground through a friendship that develops against the backdrop of this secret and often violent world. \'Green Street Hooligans\' is a story of loyalty, trust and the sometimes brutal consequences of living close to the edge.','/tfLj69EoP1b8ZWfLyg5FGJ5LC38.jpg','2005-09-09',109,'Released','Stand your ground.','Green Street Hooligans',8923,7.812,7.3,'EAe-1Lv1KYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18845,_binary '\0','/qODx2OuPQNDxXUoqHBmTNww2iC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385004',7.5,120381,'zh','十面埋伏','In 9th century China, a corrupt government wages war against a rebel army called the Flying Daggers. A romantic warrior breaks a beautiful rebel out of prison to help her rejoin her fellows, but things are not what they seem.','/93feGsGiCtG5ymrRcErUgBsdo6v.jpg','2004-07-16',119,'Released',NULL,'House of Flying Daggers',9550,6.6792,7.265,'AaOO2oork7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18846,_binary '\0','/v84flsYxNKvAY4qG5Y6RuAK6pdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385013',6.2,2336,'en','The Reality of Love','Ryan Banks\'s manager and old friend, Todd, comes up with the idea to have Ryan be the bachelor on a reality dating show in order to clean up his image. The only problem is, Todd falls in love with Charlie, the girl Ryan has chosen to propose to.','/vlXVkHPwCQxaMqEgtsYXExwxKIM.jpg','2004-01-18',90,'Released',NULL,'The Reality of Love',82134,2.4573,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18847,_binary '\0','/enR3QQW5AtpNbRtSMsFPTX3eX4O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385017',7.4,8176,'en','In My Father\'s Den','War journalist Paul Prior returns to his New Zealand hometown after his father’s death, rekindling strained relationships with his brother and memories of a troubled past. He befriends Celia, a curious and aspiring writer, who shares a fascination with his world. When Celia mysteriously disappears, Paul becomes the prime suspect, forcing him to confront buried secrets and uncover the dark truths of his family and community.','/tnFvXenEmwfESsw401SE6N9oFQp.jpg','2004-06-11',126,'Released','Who you set out to be isn\'t always who you become.','In My Father\'s Den',1126,2.3287,6.9,'1-K4FP4pu-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18848,_binary '\0','/qzUY5BlilSqg18glC6YzCePuDc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385056',6.5,8263,'en','Lonesome Jim','After failing to find success as a writer in New York City, Jim slinks back to his family\'s home in the Midwest to lick his wounds. But his visit is quickly complicated when his angst spreads to his brother, Tim, who promptly decides to drive his car straight into a tree. Under the shadow of his sibling\'s injurious actions, Jim strikes up an unlikely friendship with Anika, whose centered small-town wisdom gradually rubs off on him.','/z5wh9kFxpqC6bKB7TUx7j6X7BOq.jpg','2005-11-16',91,'Released','Change your outlook. Change your life.','Lonesome Jim',7301,2.0773,6.1,'hXJ114gtiWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18849,_binary '\0','/t2hQ2SSlN51DgXoVY4phfmNlCzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385057',5.2,8575,'en','The Long Weekend','Cooper is an actor who sees life as one big party, while Ed is in advertising and takes life too seriously. When Ed gets stressed over a deadline he has to meet, his brother Cooper works hard in trying to get his brother hooked up with a girl, thus a long weekend of stress and beautiful women, culminating in Ed meeting, and making love to, the woman of his dreams.','/mSzN5KfJW9htMdItZ5pQ5QFRTO2.jpg','2005-08-05',85,'Released','Two Brothers. One Weekend. No Shame.','The Long Weekend',19109,4.8538,5.7,'LJPE3tnqYNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18850,_binary '\0','/ukShYvWPLrGBFdy1CvnKXR79oRV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385267',6.4,58162,'en','In Good Company','Dan Foreman is a seasoned advertisement sales executive at a high-ranking publication when a corporate takeover results in him being placed under naive supervisor Carter Duryea, who is half his age. Matters are made worse when Dan\'s new supervisor becomes romantically involved with his daughter an 18 year-old college student Alex.','/5H3fbU4NlHPbLf3MUFZwPdmD3nS.jpg','2004-12-29',110,'Released','He\'s rich, young and handsome. He\'s in love with you and he\'s your dad\'s boss.','In Good Company',1901,5.7366,6.1,'8M7z4LoGVEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18851,_binary '\0','/rpSnoM2ki0FjGLBPwntkEecvgVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385277',7.5,10043,'fa','سنتوری','Ali is son of a well-off family who plays the santoor (an Iranian instrument) and has earned some reputation through his concerts and teaching music but is rejected by his family because of this profession, which they despise. He falls for one of his music students but after a short blissful period, life doesn\'t treat him as well as before and also his addiction agonizes him in his numbered days before redemption.','/l49O4oPHTsdzq9sQp1GEAyq05yW.jpg','2007-04-01',107,'Released',NULL,'The Music Man',266234,1.2003,6.9,'ezzLUXCJDrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18852,_binary '\0','/ddHMBiTFoC4dWSGliZiwMkWoD6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385278',5.8,2901,'en','She\'s Too Young','A mother/daughter relationship is thrown off balance when the mother discovers that her \"good girl\" daughter is part of a group who are engaging in sexual activities with multiple partners that results in an outbreak of sexually transmitted diseases.','/AuSuhgxpbsDMogfO1hW6e0QSi1A.jpg','2004-02-16',88,'Released','Her 14-year-old daughter\'s not fast... she\'s just keeping up.','She\'s Too Young',38878,2.0606,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18853,_binary '\0','/2UYxVugjbaPHH5f3cEQveufe75Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385307',5.2,86332,'en','Miss Congeniality 2: Armed and Fabulous','After her triumph at the Miss United States pageant, FBI agent Gracie Hart becomes an overnight sensation — and the new \"face of the FBI\". But it\'s time to spring into action again when the pageant\'s winner, Cheryl, and emcee, Stan, are abducted.','/gcYoIHND3ugn2VH1cNHHNQasEyI.jpg','2005-03-11',115,'Released','You might feel a little prick.','Miss Congeniality 2: Armed and Fabulous',10040,9.1361,5.747,'iv4SzMPlwp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18854,_binary '\0','/rVr2iqausyYwD6zv0GzvCWnDlW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385351',3.1,2080,'hi','ये लम्हे जुदाई के','A successful singer and his childhood friends become entangled in deception and treachery.','/42bvkEbdYh2Pxsv310oOn0Q9TlI.jpg','2004-03-27',188,'Released',NULL,'Yeh Lamhe Judaai Ke',161175,1.3464,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18855,_binary '\0','/bWVJ0SsXDcL1QiIUwFNHJfYZmvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385363',5.6,1321,'pl','Zróbmy sobie wnuka','To save the family land from a mysterious millionaire, a farmer hatches a plan to marry off his two children so they can take over the business.','/bZwEHMasx5dMJjSbqvzo0o8zDDz.jpg','2003-10-10',83,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Make a Grandson',74922,0.9746,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18856,_binary '\0','/ddEqe6g0aVfbw9ka3wRMdKmv8b2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385560',4.1,5592,'en','Boo','The friends Emmett, Freddy, Marie, Kevin and his reluctant girlfriend Jessie decide to spend the Halloween night in an abandoned hospital. Meanwhile, the younger Allan meets the old friend of his father Arlo Ray Baines and asks him to help to find his vanished sister Meg in the same spot. The two groups meet each other in the mental institution section on the haunted third floor.','/9VyMAPsjUIeLf71J2OG5V8DO7Jj.jpg','2005-05-13',94,'Released','You don\'t have a ghost of a chance.','Boo',20215,1.6059,4.9,'-WjxjMNGuRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18857,_binary '\0','/wfeyDJiPpjTsLzPFaJkzBtMwXZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385567',6.5,3638,'en','A Boyfriend for Christmas','Holly Grant has learned a long time ago not to rely on Santa Claus leaving Mr. Right in her Christmas stocking. But Holly is in for a surprise when a handsome man arrives on her doorstep with a twinkle in his eye and Yuletide tree in tow.','/nj4Dg2xsHzTpSvgwxRrs6uyHHjh.jpg','2004-11-27',83,'Released','Some Wishes Do Come True...','A Boyfriend for Christmas',26463,2.3596,5.516,'c7O7EHPguOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18858,_binary '\0','/eU9aNlCCgtwFBHgdbOHZG7Zqc2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385568',6.5,2944,'en','Bullet Boy','Ricky is just out of a young offenders institute, heading home to Hackney and determined to go straight. Instead, he heads straight for trouble when he becomes involved in a street confrontation, siding with his best friend Wisdom against a local rude boy. The trouble escalates into a series of tit-for-tat incidents that threaten to spiral out of control. Ricky\'s 12-year-old brother Curtis, hero-worships Ricky, though he appears smart enough to know he doesn\'t want to follow his example. Yet, despite the stern warnings from his mother and support from her friends in the community, might Ricky\'s bad boy allure be too attractive for Curtis to resist?','/lZk17BnjqJTbXWu7xCimOJtjGuv.jpg','2004-09-15',89,'Released','You only get one shot at life.','Bullet Boy',32566,1.0972,5.7,'lywm8-CeYC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18859,_binary '\0','/msEAkrT0nwhypSdKu9Ykx6tKkcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385635',6.9,1241,'fr','Dans une galaxie près de chez vous, le film','The movie chronicles the long, futuristic voyage of a team of Québécois space explorers looking for a planet capable of sustaining life, in the year 2034, after the destruction of the ozone layer through excessive human pollution, prompting the need for a new planet to welcome humankind. The seven crew members venture outside their own galaxy to explore other star system in search of a new planet large enough to sustain 6 billion people. The few habitable planets encountered are ultimately abandoned either because they are already occupied (emphasizing the wrongdoing of invading other civilizations and cultures), or because upon closer inspection they are found to have other problems (cow-sized mosquitoes, high radiation levels, dog overpopulation, unsuitable living environment, ...).','/eCan91bSlSMmRmhXFcfK4AZIZDj.jpg','2004-04-09',109,'Released',NULL,'Dans une galaxie près de chez vous, le film',60222,1.3494,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18860,_binary '\0','/zLw2CeEcv2zng9kpHiDQmj68Kum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385639',4.3,2834,'en','Death Bed: The Bed That Eats','In a one-room stone building near a dilapidated mansion, a demon has condemned an artist to living behind a painting in a state of limbo, forcing him to watch in vain as trespassers\' lives are taken by a ravenous bed.','/s4ScOSYYa2rCdIvDpgUygGfRDMs.jpg','1977-10-26',77,'Released','If you want to survive, don\'t go near THE BED.','Death Bed: The Bed That Eats',45795,1.7674,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18861,_binary '\0','/mkLrsbRJKCUkurN4okYlc2DhP3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385677',5.9,1247,'nl','Ellis in Glamourland','Ellis\'s life is less fairy-tale-like than she had expected. As a single mother with an ex-husband who spends almost no money on his son, she has to work two jobs. Ellis decides it\'s time for a change and enrolls in a course called \"How to Marry a Millionaire.\" Together with her fellow students, she goes hunting for rich bachelors. While the other students make shameless attempts to catch a millionaire, Ellis turns out to be a heartbreaker for the lonely millionaire! Everyone tries to impress her in their own way... But who will win Ellis\' heart? Will she choose wealth, stability, or passion?','/xUrQ0VVoF7IdW3NdhFPsN30luvN.jpg','2004-09-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Ellis in Glamourland',24199,1.3494,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18862,_binary '\0','/lsXnU0zkJSianGyxnK3Jhx4vObM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385700',7.1,59952,'ja','Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children','Two years have passed since the final battle with Sephiroth. Though Midgar, city of mako, city of prosperity, has been reduced to ruins, its people slowly but steadily walk the road to reconstruction. However, a mysterious illness called Geostigma torments them. With no cure in sight, it brings death to the afflicted, one after another, robbing the people of their fledgling hope.','/pTIXM2yu8McSlcQVs1VjVSNC45x.jpg','2005-07-14',101,'Released','Is it for the children, for a memory, or for himself?','Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children',647,6.9874,7.161,'FUMxY-767OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18863,_binary '\0','/2mtsus18cOR5Sb6qNSCz8px1gS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385703',6.8,2598,'es','La flaqueza del bolchevique','After getting into a minor traffic accident, Pablo attempts to make light of the situation by asking the driver of the other car, Sonsoles, out on a date. When she refuses and instead files an injury report, Pablo snaps and begins stalking her. He soon discovers that Sonsoles has a beautiful teenage sister, Maria, with whom Pablo is immediately infatuated -- a lust that soon turns dark. Can Pablo control his obsession, or will it consume him?','/tFmFyW3aCTRXCnQ0skIdmntlji7.jpg','2003-10-31',95,'Released',NULL,'The Weakness of the Bolshevik',15948,1.6087,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18864,_binary '\0','/7WpbG7uASBBX6oT9TQMxl8mtfkx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385705',6.7,35187,'en','The Football Factory','The Football Factory is more than just a study of the English obsession with football violence, it\'s about men looking for armies to join, wars to fight and places to belong. A forgotten culture of Anglo Saxon males fed up with being told they\'re not good enough and using their fists as a drug they describe as being more potent than sex and drugs put together.','/ja76eLRw7XSc1VdlNXEb8ufTIoW.jpg','2004-05-13',91,'Released','What else you gonna do on a Saturday?','The Football Factory',10296,3.4166,6.4,'kzuEkF1oLVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18865,_binary '\0','/bWN6ZBr6nJNEuHigL9fQWhZ78hd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385726',7.2,51700,'en','Glory Road','In 1966, Texas Western coach Don Haskins led the first all-black starting line-up for a college basketball team to the NCAA national championship.','/bGRSV5tStxDNPRLCewnOeeiZzrY.jpg','2006-01-13',118,'Released','The incredible story of the team that changed the game forever.','Glory Road',9918,6.7748,7.4,'uEd69QSBI0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18866,_binary '\0','/tYPpVRMIR7Lo5TnAWQdh4pWoyYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385738',5.8,1512,'ar','حرامية في تايلاند','Heema finds out that he has a brother. He accepts him in his life because he needs him to paint an exact copy of an expensive painting , that he plans to steal and smuggle to Thailand.','/cAtcJrQB87HMZT5Y73SVAtOJNwr.jpg','2003-05-02',105,'Released',NULL,'Thieves in Thailand',514330,0.8703,5.9,'rubOXVg2gQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18867,_binary '\0','/3kXUvygK8YAw3hAG5Xvm6IdqZMt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385751',5.4,5147,'sv','Hip hip hora!','A teenager\'s reputation is destroyed when she falls asleep drunk at a party and some boys take provocative photos of her.','/dv9wzD01o9ODfjkNQHfy7VCjeyY.jpg','2004-01-30',90,'Released',NULL,'The Ketchup Effect',17010,1.495,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18868,_binary '\0','/qifYc5jT4CZxmLH9DfOlipioSPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385752',6.1,204741,'en','The Golden Compass','In a parallel universe, after overhearing a shocking secret, precocious orphan Lyra Belacqua trades her carefree existence roaming the halls of Jordan College for an otherworldly adventure in the far North, unaware that it\'s part of her destiny.','/6DTH9poR8RAw859L6OuokT7z993.jpg','2007-12-04',113,'Released','There are worlds beyond our own. The compass will show the way.','The Golden Compass',2268,12.724,6.1,'ao1hPhJn2j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18869,_binary '\0','/2JBZZoJZ4Odjw41pBKEm7cBSL8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385842',6.9,3984,'es','El Lobo','Based on a true story. In the 70s, during the last stages of Franco\'s dictatorship, Txema, a basque construction worker, is arrested because of his connection to some terrorists who have just committed a murder. The secret service see in him an ideal candidate to infiltrate the terrorist band ETA and become a mole, so they try to offer him a deal if he will do so.','/grbm7ADpAzXCQLWPWITHtKP2UBa.jpg','2004-11-05',125,'Released',NULL,'Wolf',36610,2.0417,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18870,_binary '\0','/aDnCTWpWMHcQxOeGWsITmoLuEGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385880',6.7,158185,'en','Monster House','Monsters under the bed are scary enough, but what happens when an entire house is out to get you? Three teens aim to find out when they go up against a decrepit neighboring home and unlock its frightening secrets.','/zCRPr4bkO3ae0U1134vJ39xZnAG.jpg','2006-06-30',91,'Released','There goes the neighborhood.','Monster House',9297,20.6392,6.713,'kS8eoP8bols','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (18871,_binary '\0','/xMHeU84wLQ9uH9acJ0oPgdii9wO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385887',6.8,66771,'en','Motherless Brooklyn','New York City, 1957. Lionel Essrog, a private detective living with Tourette syndrome, tries to solve the murder of his mentor and best friend, armed only with vague clues and the strength of his obsessive mind.','/2wm20cbkH1L8nA54Gtwfgz2hTqo.jpg','2019-10-31',145,'Released',NULL,'Motherless Brooklyn',504562,6.0051,6.685,'Fru8IkuDp_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18872,_binary '\0','/2NzPJJ3rEUv1gOEJmb12RaRHYB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385890',3.2,1429,'en','My Big Fat Independent Movie','This hilariously smart satire tells the story of Johnny Vince, a swingin\' hepcat who meets hitman Sam and Harvey on a road trip to pull a \"botched robbery\" in Las Vegas. Along the way they take a deeply unfulfilled not-so-good-girl hostage, encounter the mysterious Mechanic, get harassed by a foul-mouthed answering machine... and did we mention the lesbians? The result - hilarity ensues!','/xPmQ4BCANMoiS7bvQU5wdFFqsUR.jpg','2005-09-30',80,'Released','The Hitmen. The Swinger. The Not So Good Girl. Together they\'ll discover Action, Culture, Mystery, Romance (and Lesbians?) in the most Pretentious, Artsy, Violent, Botched Heist film EVER MADE! Taking the highbrow world of Independent Film to all new lows!','My Big Fat Independent Movie',27404,2.4579,3.6,'fvipnU9IjzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18873,_binary '\0','/qPD62YFxSXPq2yfT1FHCofBvxq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385891',4.8,1925,'de','Mädchen Mädchen 2','Inken and Lucy are facing hard times when their parents\' money is radically cut off. Together with Lena, who is fed up with her boyfriend, they desperately search for money, an apartment and love. But because each individual point is difficult to realize on its own, the girls decide to kill all three birds with one stone for the sake of simplicity. The solution: they need rich, nice boys with suitable living space - and they need them now! But until then, horrendous rents, false identities and sleazy neighbors put their friendship to the test.','/hdFAZeWyLsJfJZl2T9WMT8jt8PT.jpg','2004-06-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Girls on Top 2',11179,1.758,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18874,_binary '\0','/hvLsr6yTFRNghh9S1zuSG927Fuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385928',8.2,5133,'ta','பஞ்சதந்திரம்','Ram\'s friends hire Maggie, a call girl, to help him get over his wife, who mistakenly believes him to be a philanderer. However, they get in trouble when Maggie ends up dead.','/ofTPB176uIsjGTdsZbQrVE86yxA.jpg','2002-06-28',153,'Released',NULL,'Panchatanthiram',49033,1.2309,7.014,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18875,_binary '\0','/d47wbSFJwf4GnxMNpGhIijhQeU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385940',5.5,1385,'en','The Perfect Husband: The Laci Peterson Story','Dean Cain portrays Scott Peterson, the California man accused of murdering his 8 month pregnant wife, Laci. Based on a true story.','/vheArX6vDhznQ96LLc5g3r46N1a.jpg','2004-01-01',120,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Husband: The Laci Peterson Story',19520,2.0632,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18876,_binary '\0','/t6m28u6MvSrwD46joToO3MfKrkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385969',5.2,1878,'en','Pursued','A fast rising hi-tech executive must protect his career and family from the ruthless tactics of a homicidal corporate headhunter.','/qEn9ZZuCS57EuwoqCM3vPC6TnS6.jpg','2004-12-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Pursued',39403,1.7881,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18877,_binary '\0','/6ErwKFoo1kP2LQXxH1wDSUUvHdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385988',3.6,1444,'en','Red Riding Hood','Teenage Claire would rather hang out with her friends at the mall than to stay home with her brother Matt while Grandma babysits. Who wouldn\'t? Unfortunately, Grandma isn\'t about to let Claire out of the house. Worse, she insists that Claire and Matt listen to her reworking of the Brothers Grimm classic tale \"Little Red Riding Hood\". Fortunately, Grandma has a sense of humor, and adds some modern twists. Claire imagines herself as Red, and her brother, parents and grandma as....her brother, parents and grandma.','/67ReUHzeOMgdNNT1HTIwZLiA9Mg.jpg','2006-06-27',84,'Released','The Better To Eat You With, My Dear...','Red Riding Hood',44507,2.1351,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18878,_binary '\0','/210CIWTknc6r8ULLML2L0blTEmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0385990',3.2,1887,'en','Retrograde','Two time travelers with opposing views are sent back to the present aboard a research ship in the Antarctic to prevent a global biological disaster from occuring','/9O7V4YN9WRxCeYCr7Hj9ZyU0jzs.jpg','2004-11-02',93,'Released','In the past... Lies our future.','Retrograde',38046,2.615,3.1,'1JusFfwHSgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18879,_binary '\0','/qDcLJIeg2z1oMtAWs9qFLeJVJ6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386005',6.9,31224,'cn','新警察故事','Sent into a drunken tailspin when his entire unit is killed by a gang of thrill-seeking punks, disgraced Hong Kong police inspector Wing needs help from his new rookie partner, with a troubled past of his own, to climb out of the bottle and track down the gang and its ruthless leader.','/kWUTyIao0b8DxVrO6L0LnpJVYWV.jpg','2004-09-23',123,'Released','Failures and suffering make a real hero.','New Police Story',11636,7.6213,7.2,'6q4q7sye_FQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18880,_binary '\0','/yvqAedtvpEXsc4SKrHQ7DkRLGMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386032',8,78273,'en','Sicko','A documentary about the corrupt health care system in The United States whose main goal is to make profit even if it means losing people’s lives. \"The more people you deny health insurance, the more money we make\" is the business model for health care providers in America.','/8PxUhW78Oy4DWZNRyUkKYmhGUaH.jpg','2007-05-18',123,'Released','This might hurt a little.','Sicko',2359,4.0333,7.4,'8BJyyyRYbSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18881,_binary '\0','/xkVrHvP7xINbZgEqV1Zz02PqVvp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386038',7.4,3634,'de','Silentium','A man who accused a catholic bishop of abusing him when he was a child dies in the Austrian city Salzburg. Everyone except his widow and the eccentrical detective Simon Brenner keeps silent and believes that the man killed himself.','/uca8Pb96wSgcTuUYaT5Nb3IIAzu.jpg','2004-09-24',116,'Released',NULL,'Silentium',9010,1.254,7.24,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18882,_binary '\0','/oqaKsofz49zjNhi48sxQIq8U73X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386064',8,42548,'ko','태극기 휘날리며','When two brothers are forced to fight in the Korean War, the elder decides to take the riskiest missions if it will help shield the younger from battle.','/efc2MwDwvQsYsbxLXaXtlmOJ7LZ.jpg','2004-02-05',148,'Released','One country, one family… divided by war.','Tae Guk Gi: The Brotherhood of War',11658,4.3191,7.981,'Nnx2CjhHADM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18883,_binary '\0','/7Z7OjSKXalRXbxRKo38RiepHWNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386117',6.7,112639,'en','Where the Wild Things Are','Max imagines running away from his mom and sailing to a far-off land where large talking beasts—Ira, Carol, Douglas, the Bull, Judith and Alexander—crown him as their king, play rumpus, build forts and discover secret hideaways.','/pzVqDpSzOg32IpXghHGSGAAArl6.jpg','2009-10-16',101,'Released','There\'s one in all of us.','Where the Wild Things Are',16523,6.908,6.5,'G6DD3K86X8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18884,_binary '\0','/2b3PSB97qrxQduzquYihf7u3uwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386140',6,115753,'en','The Legend of Zorro','Despite trying to keep his swashbuckling to a minimum, a threat to California\'s pending statehood causes the adventure-loving Don Alejandro de la Vega and his wife, Elena, to take action.','/93iEBX1QbsxAv8eSybe8lhLXY1A.jpg','2005-10-24',130,'Released','Adventure begins with a Z.','The Legend of Zorro',1656,12.1111,6.1,'gs19Vnl8M3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18885,_binary '\0','/RgcVhcF1kyd9nWT7AV7Mz62lWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386342',7.5,12474,'da','Brødre','A Danish officer, Michael, is sent away to the International Security Assistance Force operation in Afghanistan for three months. His first mission there is to find a young radar technician who had been separated from his squad some days earlier. While on the search, his helicopter is shot down and he is taken as a prisoner of war, but is reported dead to the family.','/faViDuoxyQ3qJsCbLclqBp4oK4y.jpg','2004-08-27',117,'Released',NULL,'Brothers',3875,1.8497,6.8,'P5e2IM4QAMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18886,_binary '\0','/aqqh8NT9Ky5DWgS7cAnQO9M8z4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386428',6.7,2130,'ar','اللي بالي بالك','Ellambi how stole from his uncle and go to prison and then he escaped from prison and during the hunting he makes an accident','/txstnOjizjPhtTeVN8pyY8OU8lZ.jpg','2003-03-23',115,'Released',NULL,'You Know Who',42319,0.886,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18887,_binary '\0','/kGinxaX9yrpfKqYAxRpdVFUcEAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386504',5.7,7131,'en','Haven','During a weekend, two shady businessmen flee to the Cayman Islands to avoid federal prosecution. But their escape ignites a chain reaction that leads a British native to commit a crime that changes the nation.','/cV6rQ2wPN5I58d34DHyFAmO36BF.jpg','2004-09-10',115,'Released','Can love survive the fall of paradise?','Haven',9830,3.208,5.2,'i6HuxJvxeHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18888,_binary '\0','/a6tIX4fGgp60w2d9pqYRbFM91ne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386588',6.6,352001,'en','Hitch','Dating coach Alex \'Hitch\' Hitchens mentors a bumbling client, Albert, who hopes to win the heart of the glamorous Allegra Cole. While Albert makes progress, Hitch faces his own romantic setbacks when proven techniques fail to work on Sara Melas, a tabloid reporter digging for dirt on Allegra Cole\'s love life. When Sara discovers Hitch\'s connection to Albert – now Allegra\'s boyfriend – it threatens to destroy both relationships.','/x3W9H3nhGQbWSlyI8Amp2F6Z6cz.jpg','2005-02-11',118,'Released','The cure for the common man.','Hitch',8488,10.3102,6.6,'dMaq_pfxs-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18889,_binary '\0','/zd6tAFtBNiURNYXxlVWIWh9MNTC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386650',7.7,2765,'ta','மெளனம் பேசியதே','Gautham, who runs a restaurant, falls in love with his friend Kannan\'s cousin, Sandhya. Problems arise when Gautham learns that Kannan\'s parents want Kannan to marry Sandhya.','/nvgnteJqmaxIyyaJrZuoRhYi5kb.jpg','2002-12-13',168,'Released',NULL,'Mounam Pesiyadhe',111583,1.1002,6.86,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18890,_binary '\0','/a2vKhH7LJXU0ebIoGjtOFESjErN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386651',7.6,5785,'zh','可可西里','A moving true story about volunteers protecting antelope against poachers in the severe mountains of Tibet.','/cPwpHuwvKthGXD0VXwCnPdUfpZn.jpg','2004-10-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Mountain Patrol',16074,2.154,7.607,'rosOtYVJM4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18891,_binary '\0','/pGBof6x459pUur191LuxwjjSEDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386669',5.3,1459,'fr','Nouvelle-France','In the mid-18th Century, as England and France battle over control of Canada, an epic romance between a peasant woman and a trapper unfurls','/p4IlppLWJdAr0V6XU1uUc7tKG6q.jpg','2004-11-19',143,'Released','Rise. Unite. Fight.','Battle of the Brave',57709,2.3123,6.3,'1IHjVE4keuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18892,_binary '\0','/25z40geOwWZVVDFyqi4Iq4Fi2xp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386695',4.7,2787,'fr','Les 11 commandements','After an evening of drinking, six men find themselves in front of The God of the Joke. Distressed to find that people aren\'t laughing anymore, He gives the six friends a mission: to save the world with the Eleven Commandments of the Joke. The men enthusiastically take on their task. They undertake various tests aimed at pushing the limits of stupidity.','/3TPmWdZ74vUvF2yNfOU3iWrye3T.jpg','2004-02-04',85,'Released',NULL,'The 11 Commandments',17825,1.5619,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18893,_binary '\0','/8ZwAm4sgZlAf8fvKApzla4j2eCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386741',6.6,16801,'fr','Renaissance','To find Ilona and unlock the secrets of her disappearance, Karas must plunge deep into the parallel worlds of corporate espionage, organized crime and genetic research - where the truth imprisons whoever finds it first and miracles can be bought but at a great price.','/fTdbmjAegzFQOCPTAckPcmTpJvp.jpg','2006-03-16',105,'Released','Paris 2054. Live forever or die trying','Renaissance',9389,3.2153,6.532,'9ftZhphGgwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18894,_binary '\0','/3XQBmsJtO3iK76pZyiJn4a2djpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386751',5.7,4287,'en','The River King','Abel Grey is sent to investigate the death of a boy from an exclusive local school, who is found floating in the river. Fearing scandal, the school insists it was suicide. But after discovering from the boy\'s girlfriend, Carlin, that he was being badly bullied, Abel suspects that a dangerous schoolboy initiation has gone horribly wrong and he secretly solicits the help of a sympathetic teacher, Betsy. He is warned off the investigation by his boss, as the school is a generous benefactor to the Police benevolent fund. Abel, however, cannot let the case go, not only because his own brother committed suicide years before, but also it seems that the spirit of the dead boy is leaving them clues as to what really happened that night.','/fXrjpHBftZftvqC4vfU2ZCSJpXt.jpg','2005-10-21',95,'Released','It\'s the truth that haunts us','The River King',45072,2.1488,5.8,'VKG5_F5ydyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18895,_binary '\0','/oT6z05HLXAfgD2CI3cPMuqG8OAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386792',8,18290,'en','Something the Lord Made','A dramatization of the relationship between heart surgery pioneers Alfred Blalock and Vivien Thomas.','/lk2wEO6Rt3mnZmfRTu8wvYiGPmp.jpg','2004-05-30',110,'Released','A breakthrough that changed the face of medicine. A unique partnership that broke the rules.','Something the Lord Made',20544,5.889,8,'UclKFAQ0eJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18896,_binary '\0','/eD9HS6eQ5Kkwy09Ow6LfDuWxUZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386820',7.1,13405,'da','Terkel i knibe','6th-grader Terkel begins experiencing a streak of bad luck after sitting on a black spider. His teacher dies and is replaced by the strange Justin. At home, Terkel\'s Uncle Stewart erupts in sporadic fits of rage, and at school Terkel is bullied by two boys after they learn that fat Doris likes him. On a school camping trip, Terkel begins receiving death threats and must figure out who wants to kill him.','/ewylxRYsBcqjYvbeAKryNr1JiBz.jpg','2004-04-02',77,'Released','Experience torture and extremely tight pants!','Terkel in Trouble',10797,2.1737,6.6,'459ajX4zn_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18897,_binary '\0','/cun5ZZ9msggjxnI5fmfjeg7uNTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0386862',7.2,2065,'de','Der Wald vor lauter Bäumen','As an awkward idealistic high school teacher begins her first job in the city, things turn out to be much tougher than she had imagined.','/oRPjlpoSWCd5SoORErbl3UVCbyL.jpg','2004-09-16',81,'Released',NULL,'The Forest for the Trees',6443,1.3144,6.6,'IwMcKCL2sJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18898,_binary '\0','/9ET6oAD0NEF65NFuTUAtRJUHjhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387037',6.7,1873,'en','Aurora Borealis','A young man struggles to correct his life after the death of his father.','/5PhzrlJ9ewazxL1F2p4CUnSCjFj.jpg','2005-04-22',109,'Released','Love is the hardest job to hold','Aurora Borealis',28320,1.5814,6.5,'ECS530-gLzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18899,_binary '\0','/lKc9mOjyvImvZji9tBBsv2KWSsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387055',5.5,6978,'es','Batalla en el cielo','Set in Mexico City, Carlos Reygadas\'s sexually explicit drama centers on a man in turmoil over his past actions. Chauffer Marcos feels compelled to reveal a dark secret to his boss\'s daughter, Ana, a wealthy woman who works as a prostitute just for the thrill of it. Marcos confesses that he and his wife committed a crime that ended in horrible tragedy. Haunted by his past, Marcos searches for redemption.','/h7ovpCYol1s3i3rNn7iv7vFPo62.jpg','2005-10-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Battle in Heaven',17247,2.6818,5.8,'V8JotMzKT20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18900,_binary '\0','/i8WBEj3vm8q1AXtb9Ommgi5EpRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387059',5.4,7515,'en','Bee Season','Wife and mother Miriam begins a downward emotional spiral as her husband avoids their collapsing marriage by immersing himself in his 11-year-old daughter\'s quest to become a spelling-bee champion.','/xeUOz7tYY8YuARrwAQL54DThscu.jpg','2005-09-03',104,'Released',NULL,'Bee Season',24618,3.2969,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18901,_binary '\0','/ksT0nX66UpCVBdvXiXW1byaZtjo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387131',7.3,156638,'en','The Constant Gardener','Justin Quayle is a low-level British diplomat who has always gone about his work very quietly, not causing any problems. But after his radical wife Tessa is killed he becomes determined to find out why, thrusting himself into the middle of a very dangerous conspiracy.','/nkXq7V7mmJVbvwZGr3nxkHo7HkS.jpg','2005-08-31',129,'Released','Love. At any cost.','The Constant Gardener',1985,6.3363,6.985,'9FycLyDTCWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18902,_binary '\0','/fDTPZZBavezBg5ZhULWgoinIwzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387151',6.5,1734,'sv','Dag och natt','Thomas has decided to die, and spends his last day driving around to say good-bye to everybody, his son, wife, mistress and all others. Nobody understands that this good-bye is definite, and still he says things they will never forget.','/o07at9VrOY7c81mkHvuHMzvqhjY.jpg','2004-08-06',95,'Released','If the answer is love - then what is the question','Day and Night',34902,1.3891,6.4,'gUu4JWKegtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18903,_binary '\0','/6mDeNWKoSBHLCVfs7k5fCFum6cf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387233',5.5,1904,'sv','Fröken Sverige','Moa is in her early 20s, works at a factory and lives by herself in a cottage in the forest. She is a vegan and follows her friends and demonstrations, mostly to fit in. But at home, by herself, she listens to pop music and use make-up.','/juRfocPlkGrLiJxifH4MAj9TbXB.jpg','2004-03-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Miss Sweden',35304,2.3366,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18904,_binary '\0','/aic826xQMN5J4GiCFNDhjIL7ezx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387301',7,1966,'en','I Want a Dog for Christmas, Charlie Brown','All Rerun wants from Santa is a dog, but his mother won\'t let him have one. Spending time with Snoopy provides the perfect pick-me-up. But when Snoopy gets too busy to play with Rerun, they call in a substitute—Snoopy\'s brother Spike.','/iwbvzY1jwcxbJOoP17bAgOTBr30.jpg','2003-12-09',41,'Released',NULL,'I Want a Dog for Christmas, Charlie Brown',24251,3.4689,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18905,_binary '\0','/ltOJ3h6gIMYnq9oXB8eteoKQr2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387357',5.5,2259,'en','The Locals','Two best friends, Grant and Paul, hita country road for a night of fun, but unfortunately take a short cut to their fate...where they meet the Locals.','/pAwkxutW71iup3jrP9Zph6fMLNh.jpg','2003-10-17',88,'Released','They\'re Dying To Meet You','The Locals',35250,1.2388,6,'4MO0mTybP08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18906,_binary '\0','/y1wd7YlAmYVnS45x2kK9ryydixM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387361',7.5,1898,'en','Louis Theroux: Louis and the Brothel','Louis stays with the residents of a soon to open brothel in Nevada for a few weeks.','/4ECg9X4SGpzP86Xx0CyogRUQiKd.jpg','2003-11-09',77,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Louis and the Brothel',143481,1.2467,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18907,_binary '\0','/kVlnObukrKh1vyAuLyHGdsCxJNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387412',7.5,21196,'en','Metallica: Some Kind of Monster','After bassist Jason Newsted quits the band in 2001, heavy metal superstars Metallica realize that they need an intervention. In this revealing documentary, filmmakers follow the three rock stars as they hire a group therapist and grapple with 20 years of repressed anger and aggression. Between searching for a replacement bass player, creating a new album and confronting their personal demons, the band learns to open up in ways they never thought possible.','/pnsRHqjrYbVUJXsPIDNsKV7gRmc.jpg','2004-06-10',140,'Released',NULL,'Metallica: Some Kind of Monster',11401,2.7832,7.08,'LFX6IA_4hH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18908,_binary '\0','/bCoTUOb9SkJlvGlaPVh0GTCa0yj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387462',4.1,3799,'tr','Okul','The film revolves around a young group of spoiled teenagers and their struggle to prepare for the standardized test required to get into university. All of a sudden a ghost enters their lives, scares and incites them to misbehave.','/ikvF78Z9l5sdbh11sniRytIZ7f3.jpg','2004-01-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Okul',54671,1.6643,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18909,_binary '\0','/jEMWkXiEJ2Xe0a1G4ArIVlL504I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387514',6.2,43768,'en','Prime','A career driven professional from Manhattan is wooed by a young painter, who also happens to be the son of her psychoanalyst.','/gz17H1jiLI9OrTo8ruS31WkP9Am.jpg','2005-09-21',102,'Released','A Therapeutic New Comedy','Prime',2313,5.3517,6,'sTecl1pXoaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18910,_binary '\0','/275B5XWawsMRVErkjbfLkU5q2CH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387541',6.6,10422,'en','Ring of the Nibelungs','In this swords-and-sorcery tale, good-hearted blacksmith Eyvind hides away infant Prince Siegfried after two malevolent kings murder his father. But a fiery meteor sent by the gods reveals Siegfried\'s destiny, sending him on the quest of a lifetime. To save a crumbling kingdom claim the heart of his true love, he\'ll have to slay the nefarious dragon, Fafnir.','/jQEOhDR05dhGcRQA4TIGVs0Q46d.jpg','2004-11-19',133,'Released','The Nordic legend that inspired J.R.R. Tolkien to write the Lord of the Ring trilogy.','Ring of the Nibelungs',11188,4.6733,6.3,'o_T0Vji6evg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18911,_binary '\0','/wDunyb5KMmdK8xMD97xjOBWUawp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387549',4.8,2422,'en','The Roost','Following a near-death car accident, four friends on their way to a Halloween wedding, venture to a secluded farm for help. Little do they know however, they will soon disturb an ancient evil with far more ghastly plans in store for them...','/ounpk1FoUejhejEOJkeowaUYhcH.jpg','2005-03-12',80,'Released','Caution: If They Bite You...Kill Yourself!','The Roost',27417,1.1173,5.2,'TTUBkIHBRb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18912,_binary '\0','/ok4ot3YbfDYZcINXf91JUfq3maB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387564',7.6,516919,'en','Saw','Two men wake up to find themselves shackled in a grimy, abandoned bathroom. As they struggle to comprehend their predicament, they discover a disturbing tape left behind by the sadistic mastermind known as Jigsaw. With a chilling voice and cryptic instructions, Jigsaw informs them that they must partake in a gruesome game in order to secure their freedom.','/rLNSOudrayDBo1uqXjrhxcjODIC.jpg','2004-10-01',103,'Released','How much blood would you shed to stay alive?','Saw',176,22.9971,7.427,'0bHDblokwv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18913,_binary '\0','/eZOt0qAmxwCXyJHLgEIEKdjQVM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387575',4.9,53946,'en','Seed of Chucky','This time around, Chucky and his homicidal honey, Tiffany, are brought back to life by their orphan offspring, Glen. Then the horror goes Hollywood as Chucky unleashes his own brand of murderous mayhem!','/vd9K93gQ9whMKjXzADZanxWpIXM.jpg','2004-11-12',86,'Released','Fear the second coming.','Seed of Chucky',11249,10.5858,5.5,'U18RvBCCGEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18914,_binary '\0','/dbZRnjdBxpIHnyfCDMLlFSzx7pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387596',7,5008,'ko','실미도','On 31 January 1968, 31 North Korean commandos infiltrated South Korea in a failed mission to assassinate President Park Chung-hee. In revenge, the South Korean military assembled a team of 31 criminals on the island of Silmido to kill Kim Il-sung for a suicide mission to redeem their honor, but was cancelled, leaving them frustrated. It is loosely based on a military uprising in the 1970s.','/jwE6cVIoJ4JP397yMGfBBpHMJmF.jpg','2003-12-24',135,'Released','A Forbidden History Now Breaks It Deep Silence.','Silmido',19644,2.8641,7.1,'3PWIFA-ulP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18915,_binary '\0','/9Z4msMhKvNp63sOB1ZvxPMPvqz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387808',6.5,221480,'en','Idiocracy','To test its top-secret Human Hibernation Project, the Pentagon picks the most average European-Americans it can find - an Army private and a prostitute - and sends them to the year 2505 after a series of freak events. But when they arrive, they find a civilization so dumbed-down that they\'re the smartest people around.','/6cTHBq49ApwsJaRr3ojlY1cmiXk.jpg','2006-09-01',85,'Released','In the future, intelligence is extinct.','Idiocracy',7512,16.4536,6.39,'clYwX8Z43zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18916,_binary '\0','/kkNO9F5siCFpCAiXnq2t68Kl8go.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387877',5.6,80360,'en','The Black Dahlia','In 1940s Los Angeles, two former boxers-turned-cops must grapple with corruption, narcissism, stag films and family madness as they pursue the killer of an aspiring young actress.','/su7yuXqGUHICfoijtcSaxWLE34Y.jpg','2006-09-15',121,'Released','Inspired by the most notorious unsolved murder in California history.','The Black Dahlia',9676,7.1248,5.6,'49DrnE1s6ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18917,_binary '\0','/nE5GrbmJWM6q8BjcqY0GyQVoo8f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387892',6.9,1641,'fr','Brodeuses','French drama, the debut film from writer-director Eléonore Faucher. Teenager Claire (Lola Naymark) discovers she is pregnant and decides to keep it a secret. Abandoning her dead-end supermarket job, she is taken on as an apprentice by couturiere Madame Mélikian (Ariane Ascaride), who is grieving over the death of her own child. As the two women work together, they soon develop a supportive and fam','/j9mUn7MfTUWdM4VthTcTPQE4Bdo.jpg','2004-05-14',89,'Released',NULL,'A Common Thread',26810,1.1295,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18918,_binary '\0','/mOYIUiSdoLWynoZIGDZSAAUZ3ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387898',7.3,91082,'fr','Caché','As the host of a literary TV show, Georges begins receiving anonymously filmed videos of his family alongside cryptic, disturbing drawings, but as the tapes become increasingly intimate, they reveal a stalker who has known him for a very long time.','/vTzjRi0Uhy0tt3Rjw8SARZZJHlX.jpg','2005-10-05',118,'Released','Hidden within.','Caché',445,4.4822,7,'pvT_9TqIEtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18919,_binary '\0','/oaUWMPGxpb4OsVCrppmlhQA2bwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387914',7.8,8700,'es','Voces inocentes','A young boy, attempting to have a normal childhood in 1980s El Salvador, is caught up in a dramatic fight for his life when he desperately tries to avoid the war that is raging all around him.','/hvwB4LdMCLzqXsk5ZjR77vzPkGk.jpg','2005-01-28',120,'Released',NULL,'Innocent Voices',20941,4.0048,8.207,'x6xwPYpdeAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18920,_binary '\0','/qJiadhrwmYM3hJEJlI6t6KuaQeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387925',5.8,1793,'en','Chestnut: Hero of Central Park','Ray and Sal, two orphaned sisters, adopt and hide a Great Dane puppy from their two adopted parents living in a luxury downtown New York apartment that expressely forbids dogs.','/quDRdSE0gZ1Q1lpOkZVq4ek2kaQ.jpg','2004-10-21',86,'Released',NULL,'Chestnut: Hero of Central Park',34672,3.922,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18921,_binary '\0','/cXUqwsbCAqz25iF1VAgPBPyQNat.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0387989',6,1781,'hi','दीवार','Major Ranvir Kaul (Amitabh Bachchan) is a POW who was captured along with over 50 soldiers by Pakistani soldiers in 1971 during the war between India and Pakistan. 33 years later Ranvir\'s son Gaurav (Akshaye Khanna) decides to go on a rescue mission to Pakistan and bring back his father who he has not seen since he was a child. Helping him on his mission is Khan (Sanjay Dutt) who had successfully escaped from the same prison. They steal, kill, and plan to get the prisoners out. This movie is inspired by the film The Great Escape.','/An2v1gqXvtR4EAEhiGHhQ7lKwec.jpg','2004-06-25',161,'Released','54 men trapped behind enemy lines. . .One man who didn\'t know how to help. . .Another who didn\'t want to. . .And the greatest escape ever.','Deewaar: Let\'s Bring Our Heroes Home',127531,1.1692,6,'zWl-OsrpOoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18922,_binary '\0','/pkKf4Rdgs3Ftyspx4qSijI7IxsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388098',5.5,1433,'ja','花と蛇','The wealthy president of a company has built up an unpayable debt to a local crime lord, and to escape punishment he sells his famous dancer wife to the lecherous old man figuring a 90 year old can’t do too much bad with her. Perhaps not, but others can while he watches. She’s put on stage in an underground BDSM sex show and begins a spiraling decent from strongly independent woman to submissive sex slave','/erWJ9tFvsKqVK08jk56UCLlgh8t.jpg','2004-03-13',115,'Released',NULL,'Flower & Snake',41472,4.7269,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18923,_binary '\0','/yNhmsmCqK6bTl4xUT28fJ1r6f61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388125',6.5,69828,'en','In Her Shoes','Irresponsible party girl Maggie is kicked out of her father\'s and stepmother\'s home—where she lives for free—and is taken in by her hard-working sister, Philadelphia lawyer Rose. After Maggie\'s disruptive ways ruin her sister\'s love life, Rose turns her out as well. But when their grandmother, who they never knew existed, comes into their lives, the sisters face some complicated truths about themselves and their family.','/gmd2n3TuXewrbINp8Jfhwd5Jw6S.jpg','2005-10-07',130,'Released','Friends. Rivals. Sisters.','In Her Shoes',11931,7.1384,6.2,'ws3QUUyoNhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18924,_binary '\0','/vi1FKA8ntkEikvaxFZlzJvJ2wXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388130',7.7,2515,'ja','劇場版 頭文字D Third Stage','With high school graduation right around the corner, Takumi Fujiwara has a lot on his mind and a lot to prepare for. Everything becomes even more complicated when Takumi is offered a spot on Ryosuke Takahashi\'s elite Kengai Racing Team, which seeks to assemble the greatest racers in the Gunma area for a tour of Japan\'s mountain passes. Before he can accept however, Takumi feels the need to settle the score with the Lancer Evo driving Emperor team, defend his downhill-racer crown against the son of his father\'s greatest rival, and finally settle things with his unfaithful girlfriend Natsuki.','/8QzB6uLoRQWsTKrg0MdZ9Dfl1rH.jpg','2001-01-13',104,'Released',NULL,'Initial D: Third Stage',80741,4.4726,6.921,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18925,_binary '\0','/o3prcL5cI97VFmhN6yVDgnulz8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388139',7.2,21382,'en','It\'s All Gone Pete Tong','A comedy following the tragic life of the legendary Frankie Wilde. The story takes us through Frankie\'s life from being one of the best DJs alive, through a subsequent battle with a hearing disorder, culminating in his mysterious disappearance from the scene.','/4AvbVwbejmSMKGEdLmVYDLAss1i.jpg','2004-09-12',90,'Released',NULL,'It\'s All Gone Pete Tong',12109,2.7182,6.548,'WGsCzaI5qrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18926,_binary '\0','/dpBNUIvZJO9gPoGDalyHG4Cok1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388154',7.2,2600,'en','Mickybo and Me','The film tells the story of two boys who become friends at the start of the Troubles in 1970. The boys share an obsession with Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid, with the consequence that they run away to Australia.','/t7gXH1z0Ul1Ei98dEVkZWSSJ9vM.jpg','2005-03-25',95,'Released','We all need heroes','Mickybo and Me',55134,1.8215,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18927,_binary '\0','/n0LDZHQJ67GZ3rX68juko8kGgDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388182',6.6,24300,'en','King of California','Charlie gets released from an insane asylum and moves in with Miranda, the young daughter he left behind. Charlie believes that there is treasure hidden beneath the local Costco, so he puts together a plan to unearth the loot. By convincing Miranda to quit her job at McDonald\'s and instead work at the wholesale store, he is able to obtain a key. Although Miranda is skeptical, she helps her father with his irrational quest.','/zLoa3oJ83zo9g3mV9LNCHbqO7jH.jpg','2007-01-24',93,'Released','You\'ve got to believe in treasure to find it.','King of California',5718,3.2978,6.4,'hhCmvoYAhpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18928,_binary '\0','/kCeNbVy6Y8lhvgr6o71M8Iabw3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388183',4.4,4049,'en','King\'s Ransom','Hoping to foil his own gold-digging wife\'s plan, a loathsome businessman arranges his own kidnapping, only to realize that there are plenty of other people interested in his wealth as well.','/lH8Nugl7DnMaMHfOChEFNXXQ3zX.jpg','2005-04-22',95,'Released','Big man. Big plan. Big mistake.','King\'s Ransom',27360,2.0775,5,'-aSAFqkxrzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18929,_binary '\0','/fMzvP4QR6zYybVD9YqlscUxQa77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388213',5.3,3540,'en','Loverboy','A neglected daughter becomes a possessive mother in an emotional journey into the heart and mind of a woman who loved too much.','/vziSkZ47MA1GvQk1oBd7jJSDh6l.jpg','2005-01-24',84,'Released','Sometimes love is not enough.','Loverboy',58462,3.517,5,'p2JE_yOj0RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18930,_binary '\0','/9r6p7ztTGacAmr5guMtR9h9WEUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388230',5,4669,'en','Malevolence','It\'s ten years after the kidnapping of Martin Bristol. Taken from a backyard swing at his home at the age of six, he is forced to witness unspeakable crimes of a deranged madman. For years, Martin\'s whereabouts have remained a mystery...until now.','/l7JVY5uGMeOkEDNYIFLmZcEEQze.jpg','2004-09-10',90,'Released','No one gets out alive...','Malevolence',54702,1.3684,5.2,'RC9ZDSIm02E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18931,_binary '\0','/i565zTNe8qZ8U02aEVUMlAkTQfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388242',5.6,1262,'fr','Mariages!','A wedding is an opportunity for three couples of different generations to question commitment and the strength of love.','/bR5VF8uwqQzJLozryGXzqc0FwNA.jpg','2004-04-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Mariages!',52538,1.9962,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18932,_binary '\0','/fFE4JwHNbzNGRBcvEciblTDigxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388285',5.6,4366,'en','Going the Distance','Nick is a successful young man whose comfortable West Coast life couldn\'t be better. However, when his girlfriend falls under the influence of lecherous music producer Lenny Swackhammer, Nick impulsively decides to travel to Toronto to intervene. Nick\'s buddies Tyler and Dime opt to turn the quest into a cross-country road trip that\'s complete with wacky antics and encounters with beautiful women.','/shmF571Ph6U5E03ahuuzOPi6rl9.jpg','2004-08-20',93,'Released','They came. They saw. They came.','Going the Distance',19423,2.9634,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18933,_binary '\0','/i8ItsnJttxDMZuYsO689NjMLDH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388288',4.7,1264,'en','My First Wedding','A young lady about to get married realizes that she has a problem: she fantasizes about every man she sees. She goes to confess at church but unknowingly confesses to a young man who is not a priest. He agrees to help her, but falls in love with her along the way. Unfortunately she still thinks he is a priest.','/4EjGJsOnRLOzXkvmFS8w8BXfemD.jpg','2006-08-18',94,'Released','He is so NOT a real priest!','My First Wedding',25169,1.3654,5.1,'jET5jcsjvUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18934,_binary '\0','/4BuXJnJtDCn2FjQlAMDpcP56QD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388311',7,1705,'he','אור','Or shoulders a lot: she\'s 17 or 18, a student, works evenings at a restaurant, recycles cans and bottles for cash, and tries to keep her mother Ruthie from returning to streetwalking in Tel Aviv. Ruthie calls Or \"my treasure,\" but Ruthie is a burden. She\'s just out of hospital, weak, and Or has found her a job as a house cleaner. The call of the quick money on the street is tough for Ruthie to ignore. Or\'s emotions roil further when the mother of the youth she\'s in love with comes to the flat to warn her off. With love fading and Ruthie perhaps beyond help, Or\'s choices narrow.','/mZfpWNAVK4Y8SsSnx0bu0sVdUb7.jpg','2004-06-29',97,'Released',NULL,'Or (My Treasure)',1918,1.3832,6.6,'CNWgVdZ55JI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18935,_binary '\0','/j1nChiTr3CrVqGUJtHo1iUc3Gcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388318',7.4,6832,'fi','Paha maa','When a schoolteacher is sacked, he projects his bad mood at his troubled teenage son. The son, in turn, buys a CD player from a pawnshop with counterfeit money. This starts a chain reaction of misery as every victim projects his problems on to another person.','/dTrzRNF1HKCBnHfq5XK3J500aGA.jpg','2005-01-14',133,'Released','In the end things work out for the best, for all of us','Frozen Land',18279,1.8271,6.8,'Mp2zuPdkPTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18936,_binary '\0','/jzwZuEDJNIj1XNlZ60X6Pim62uD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388364',6.7,2654,'en','Red Dust','Sarah Barcant, a lawyer in New York City who grew up in South Africa, returns to her childhood dwelling place to intercede for Alex Mpondo, a Black South African politician who was tortured during apartheid.','/h2MmLzkWv3Wx3phsMQqFgyB3plJ.jpg','2004-01-11',110,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than the truth.','Red Dust',13542,1.6207,5.796,'S0wq1VzKdkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18937,_binary '\0','/oOPI9v2U6EkDDIyztdMYCCUyJdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388367',6.3,3327,'en','Redemption: The Stan Tookie Williams Story','Redemption tells the story of Stan \"Tookie\" Williams, founder of the Crips L.A. street gang. Story follows his fall into gang-banging, his prison term, and his work writing children\'s novels encouraging peace and anti-violence resolutions which earned him multiple Nobel Peace Prize nominations. After exhausting all forms of appeal, Tookie was executed by lethal injection.','/9xpQkmUVD57nMcbKR6tm9sooPQW.jpg','2004-01-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Redemption: The Stan Tookie Williams Story',31781,2.1979,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18938,_binary '\0','/c3jZf0zYx4OD74nYbu6o9WJwmG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388377',5.9,2874,'en','River Queen','In 1860s New Zealand, a young Irish woman desperately trying to find her son finds herself caught on both sides of the lines during the wars between Māori tribes and the British colonial army.','/kJSIpSC3wuw9bHz52hBdDJn3kiU.jpg','2005-09-12',114,'Released','With darkness all around, only the heart can see where the forest meets the river.','River Queen',24671,2.1242,5.7,'nh7BGvIg0hE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18939,_binary '\0','/qoC5y0MGq6ZVdZES8GLTi2D8JAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388395',7,3835,'de','Schultze Gets the Blues','Schultze is an accordion player and newly without work. When the local music club celebrates its 50th anniversary, his taste of music changes unexpectedly.','/cYadK5k73gVA88Z8hIkTzXDMhSu.jpg','2003-09-02',114,'Released','It\'s never too late to re-tune your soul','Schultze Gets the Blues',9483,1.3233,6.635,'9htQXPy6UAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18940,_binary '\0','/lcFar2tdF9Lir12R0K3Dvw6uABu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388419',5.6,65868,'en','Christmas with the Kranks','When their only daughter Blair leaves the family nest, Luther and Nora Krank decide to book an island cruise to beat the yuletide blues and just skip the holidays. But their decision to boycott tradition has the whole neighborhood in an uproar, and when Blair calls on Christmas Eve to announce a surprise visit with her new fiancée, the Kranks have just twelve hours to perform a miracle and pull themselves and their neighbors together to throw the best celebration ever!','/q866vL3KhAjbkZH1enT7AoxmRHx.jpg','2004-11-24',99,'Released','Their Christmas will turn the town upside down!','Christmas with the Kranks',13673,9.0003,6.169,'jiPMySZo0Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18941,_binary '\0','/oknykzERyoik1q7qQoySMdE4TcV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388437',6.7,2883,'de','Stauffenberg','In 1944, a group of high command officers plot an attempt against Hitler, and one of the leaders of the conspiracy, Stauffenberg, goes to a meeting with the Fuhrer in charge of exploding the place. However, Hitler survives and the officers are executed. This unsuccessful operation was called \"Valkyrie Operation\", and this realistic movie discloses this true event.','/o21Ps0zrLqAi9XGciFlvaZOEmmp.jpg','2004-02-24',92,'Released','He turned against an empire to save the world.','Operation Valkyrie',10417,1.886,6,'sNvReY8clSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18942,_binary '\0','/A590CJUy3ILMpwxVAKprVy0Mone.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388458',6.7,1650,'de','Jazzclub - Der frühe Vogel fängt den Wurm','A musician tries to get by working several jobs.','/96SlV36czw2HeNhguSa5gUCFacp.jpg','2004-04-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Jazzclub - Der frühe Vogel fängt den Wurm',11394,1.4159,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18943,_binary '\0','/mnppPdfdtKPNoRemzIZDwOKpgfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388473',7.8,55848,'ja','東京ゴッドファーザーズ','On Christmas Eve, three homeless people living on the streets of Tokyo discover a newborn baby among the trash and set out to find its parents.','/sPC66btzQlzuRdPKiSDYZ5Hvxgc.jpg','2003-12-05',92,'Released','Meet the ultimate dysfunctional family.','Tokyo Godfathers',13398,5.5762,7.926,'ZL_2E-HfIZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18944,_binary '\0','/lbs1ood36hzj0O0cqW2a8MqptOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388482',6.3,227768,'en','Transporter 2','Professional driver, and former Special Forces officer, Frank Martin is living in Miami, where he is temporarily filling in for a friend as the chauffeur for a government narcotics control policy director and his family. The young boy in the family is targeted for kidnapping, and Frank immediately becomes involved in protecting the child and exposing the kidnappers.','/cdm17vK8PxHfTi7ayZf6WKbOgUO.jpg','2005-08-03',88,'Released','The best in the business is back in the game.','Transporter 2',9335,17.0504,6.3,'rEggzzOVOyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18945,_binary '\0','/ujCvokRcEkE54t9UF4viGniENMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388483',5.1,3862,'it','Tre metri sopra il cielo','A bad boy and a socialite girl hook-up.','/hvpElD8429AyA3SS9AQBx0gyYnu.jpg','2004-03-12',101,'Released',NULL,'Three Steps Over Heaven',56903,1.8109,5.8,'FYjhheXVsFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18946,_binary '\0','/dxIBEtwBSaigyF9irXKayJkBrcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388500',5.7,20792,'en','Beauty Shop','Far from Chicago, hairdresser Gina Norris has relocated to Atlanta with her daughter and has quickly established herself as a rare talent in her profession. But after repeatedly butting heads with her shady, over-the-top boss, Jorge, Norris sets out to create her own salon -- even snagging a few of Jorge\'s employees and clients. Now, Jorge will do anything to shut her down.','/3y5I9WKlfeNnSQbOvS4l3mVPqri.jpg','2005-04-22',105,'Released','A cut above','Beauty Shop',14177,5.6802,6.3,'twy94Qb5EIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18947,_binary '\0','/12YKdvErSqcMp33ZeNe7MjSW06A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388505',7.8,6609,'fr','Va, vis et deviens','In 1980, the black Falashas in Ethiopia are recognised as genuine Jews and are secretly carried to Israel. The day before the transport the son of a Jewish mother dies. In his place and with his name (Schlomo) she takes a Christian 9-year-old boy.','/kc1GnNnFH99VWoSCQwPQ9ZslU4t.jpg','2005-03-30',140,'Released',NULL,'Live and Become',1986,3.3313,7.4,'4O1tBFjeoGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18948,_binary '\0','/bVJoDBC5Z2im0951jLV4ZvieTyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388556',6.5,3871,'ja','ゼブラーマン','A down-and-out schoolteacher receives the calling to become the real life personification of an old television superhero, Zebraman.','/3kBangW2OBBNkqYyp48blW9cwE5.jpg','2004-01-30',115,'Released',NULL,'Zebraman',36223,1.8866,6.3,'JSIHn9pddho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18949,_binary '\0','/nX9KhYw8gwOIjeD078wtIPjs0Fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388562',7,1715,'fr','L\'Équipier','Camille arrives in Ouessant, the island of her birth off the Brittany coast, to sell the family home. She spends a last night in the house during which she discovers a secret. In 1963 a man came to work with her father, who was the Jument lighthouse operator. He only stayed two months, but his presence proved to be a disturbing catalyst.','/l7fJ1TmyaNVLHBtjz4QbUW5qLVs.jpg','2004-11-03',105,'Released',NULL,'The Light',2299,1.132,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18950,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388670',7.7,1532,'fr','Le 7ème mensonge','Diane marries a rich and wealthy orchestra conductor who turns to be very difficult to live with.','/dQdJrK9wLsruW6kRo1lz5QhKBm6.jpg','2005-11-02',91,'Released',NULL,'The 7th Lie',574552,0.7421,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18951,_binary '\0','/7xABF95Ep2CilVBCodQghxN24LM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388727',7,2761,'da','Anklaget','On the surface Henrik and Nina Christofferson are an ordinary family living happily. But they have a problem. Their daughter, Stine, a difficult 14 year old, has a habit of telling lies in class. When Stine accuses her father of sexual abuse, and is believed by seemingly eager social workers, their family is thrust into crisis. Could Henrik have done it? And when Stine prepares to return home, the ugly side of family life is exposed.','/534CWHbiW0M9obTt9rVlnOxItrS.jpg','2005-01-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Accused',15822,1.5037,6.7,'4Xyl4l7bnJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18952,_binary '\0','/oaCyJfVefkJvugZv1zp3mwOm2Zq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388789',7.1,19005,'en','Born into Brothels: Calcutta\'s Red Light Kids','Documentary depicting the lives of child prostitutes in the red light district of Songachi, Calcutta. Director Zana Briski went to photograph the prostitutes when she met and became friends with their children. Briski began giving photography lessons to the children and became aware that their photography might be a way for them to lead better lives.','/e7OWmWptBRCnUKj6MJ2qbxj5ZY5.jpg','2004-12-08',85,'Released',NULL,'Born into Brothels: Calcutta\'s Red Light Kids',1392,1.9236,6.8,'1Man1KT8VkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18953,_binary '\0','/vXzqV2RtJlT9WhNEM4NYWCEC6ZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388795',7.7,421974,'en','Brokeback Mountain','In 1960s Wyoming, two men develop a strong emotional and sexual relationship that endures as a lifelong connection complicating their lives as they get married and start families of their own.','/aByfQOQBNa4CMFwIgq3QrqY2ZHh.jpg','2005-10-22',134,'Released','Love is a force of nature.','Brokeback Mountain',142,19.1163,7.782,'xZvu-SczR1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18954,_binary '\0','/dwSdmuui68qmSCalGWsDZEgkgOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388838',6.8,5108,'en','Clean','After she ends up in prison and loses custody of her son, a woman struggles to assimilate outside her former life and remain clean long enough to regain custody of her son.','/srenglG0ITLow4pR35IvJiAYuiX.jpg','2004-09-01',111,'Released','When you don\'t have a choice, you change.','Clean',39851,2.7162,6.409,'K1brQ6kqJp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18955,_binary '\0','/tyvPer6haotGIa6pgNO1k563jLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388888',7.7,7088,'en','Dig!','A documentary on the once promising American rock bands The Brian Jonestown Massacre and The Dandy Warhols. The friendship between respective founders, Anton Newcombe and Courtney Taylor, escalated into bitter rivalry as the Dandy Warhols garnered major international success while the Brian Jonestown Massacre imploded in a haze of drugs.','/lTE7ODSgIvYUBNhkSnW3qL2h4mi.jpg','2004-05-14',107,'Released','Do you dig?','Dig!',1843,1.7299,6.8,'dUZDSzE3qIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18956,_binary '\0','/78zbtT4Rml9ArE0021FUR0jYqBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388973',5.3,1218,'en','The Girl from Monday','A comic drama about a time in the near future when citizens are happy to be property traded on the stock exchange.','/9eCsRqLyALNbWw5FNX3ALjNDwiW.jpg','2005-01-26',84,'Released',NULL,'The Girl from Monday',33102,1.478,4.2,'hp2AJSewO0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18957,_binary '\0','/tlShC6NKoFUcxh0AiUpaZRydyWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388976',5.6,1437,'en','Call Me: The Rise and Fall of Heidi Fleiss','The story of Heidi Fleiss, known as \"The Hollywood Madam\", who was the daughter of a prominent Los Angeles doctor and eventually became a prostitute for a well-known Los Angeles madam. She took over her boss\' operation and soon was raking in $300,000 a month by hiring only the most beautiful and highest-class hookers and catering to wealthy Hollywood types, European and American corporate executives and Arab sheiks. Her operation was broken up by Los Angeles police in 1993, and she eventually went to prison for income-tax evasion.','/3yoTZuaosNsoHJNU5zxX9bZFgUh.jpg','2004-03-29',84,'Released',NULL,'Call Me: The Rise and Fall of Heidi Fleiss',57495,2.2207,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18958,_binary '\0','/nCzfXkipK6LCg9JAPkrYw2QA0GO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0388980',7.4,36468,'en','The Greatest Game Ever Played','A biopic of 20-year-old Francis Ouimet who defeated his golfing idol and 1900 US Open Champion, Harry Vardon.','/kh4vd6wKa6j9xVFzxhQrsT0p2YN.jpg','2005-09-30',120,'Released',NULL,'The Greatest Game Ever Played',15487,6.1903,7.299,'sv6FZMeA2Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18959,_binary '\0','/vkyiRXgIAKFNVBYmauTF1a7u4wj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389074',7,5268,'en','Kim Possible: A Sitch in Time','Kim and Ron start a new school year, only to learn that Ron\'s family is moving to Norway. This puts a strain on their partnership, just as Dr. Drakken, Monkey Fist, and Duff Killigan team up to find and use an ancient time travel device to rule the world. Attacking Kim in the past, present, and future, can these villians succeed? Or will an unforeseen force be more destructive?','/3XAMrWxsqqQI5HNJfegbUXtXiEG.jpg','2003-11-28',66,'Released','Travel through time with Kim.','Kim Possible: A Sitch in Time',51786,3.0463,6.73,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18960,_binary '\0','/6B3kS8PeYG06VAEvRWHDsvp6Fjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389326',7.8,4795,'en','Riding Giants','Riding Giants is story about big wave surfers who have become heroes and legends in their sport. Directed by the skateboard guru Stacy Peralta.','/8L3ir0KNqSqpps2oVAeCUPVTPhr.jpg','2004-07-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Riding Giants',291,3.3111,7.6,'ADy8f6t4Ri8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18961,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389327',5,3482,'en','The Right Way','Amy and David are two underachievers from suburbia. Amy has had a rough life raised by her neglectful drug addicted single mother. David has been raised in a more conventional family, but his lack of motivation has driven his father crazy. When Amy meets David it seems they both find what they are looking for. But when Amy gets pregnant, both Amy and David go through a personal and surreal crisis in making choices. Which leads them to decide if they should do it the right way or the wrong way?','/76zjCMyG1LhG7JpejCR1zuvD9Lc.jpg','2004-11-17',80,'Released',NULL,'The Right Way',352730,0.9736,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18962,_binary '\0','/wai7w9pjMK2NEY22pns8nIY0ZQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389328',4.9,13042,'en','Rise: Blood Hunter','A reporter on the trail of a sinister cult wakes up in a morgue to find herself a member of the undead. She goes on a personal vendetta against a group a cultists who are responsible for her death.','/h4QNqFITPXjRrWGELtbifg34T1V.jpg','2007-04-28',97,'Released','They didn\'t leave her alive. They left her UNDEAD.','Rise: Blood Hunter',1872,4.1429,5.3,'2_QQkB54Cg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18963,_binary '\0','/jV5KHMHVrMRJOht4WOvQkiwIhf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389340',7,3315,'ar','صعيدى فى الجامعة الأمريكية','Khalaf, a bumpkin southern Egyptian wins a scholarship to study at the American University in Cairo where students - many from Cairo\'s upper class - are known for their Americanized attitudes.','/oLdJ9SiQ6DgwXDh0a6aLfr7tGID.jpg','1998-08-03',120,'Released',NULL,'Upper Egyptian in the American University',183387,0.9762,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18964,_binary '\0','/xE90oDrxYWqChHaOeT8u3B96v1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389361',7.6,1250,'en','Searching for the Wrong-Eyed Jesus','A stunningly-photographed, thought-provoking road trip into the heart of the poor white American South. Singer Jim White takes his 1970 Chevy Impala through a gritty terrain of churches, prisons, truckstops, biker bars and coalmines. Along the way are roadside encounters with present-day musical mavericks the Handsome Family, David Johansen, David Eugene Edwards of 16 Horsepower and old-time banjo player Lee Sexton, and grisly stories from the cult Southern novelist Harry Crews.','/gnzK1MeBDhv1KWRk8FU7tlGGo1E.jpg','2004-07-09',82,'Released',NULL,'Searching for the Wrong-Eyed Jesus',26818,1.0971,7.5,'n_MWRlwrqj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18965,_binary '\0','/5tfv0pRaGv7UV81gPsnoIbCQTyP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389448',8.2,1558,'zh','铁西区','A detailed look at the gradual decline of Shenyang’s industrial Tiexi district, an area that was once a vibrant example of China’s socialist economy. But industry is changing, and the factories of Tiexi are closing. Director Wang Bing introduces us to some of the workers affected by the closures, and to their families.','/hRH0ToR9tgCtNpyzOpqzYv1G47W.jpg','2004-06-09',551,'Released',NULL,'Tie Xi Qu: West of the Tracks',86282,1.7527,7.8,'-TPZ1sV3wD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18966,_binary '\0','/vT39NcxIWHL5XVNQGRMbS8NxXs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389557',7.7,84411,'nl','Zwartboek','Israel, 1956: Jewish teacher Rachel Stein rather unexpectedly meets an old friend at the kibbutz. It brings back memories of her experiences in the Netherlands during the war, memories of betrayal. In September 1944, Rachel\'s hiding place is bombed by Allied troops; she makes contact with a resistance member and joins a group of Jews to be smuggled across the Biesbosch to the freed South Netherlands. Only Rachel escapes a massacre by patrol Germans, and is rescued by a resistance group under the leadership of Gerben Kuipers, whose son is captured trying to smuggle weapons. Kuipers asks Rachel to seduce SS-hauptsturmführer Ludwig Müntze, a mission that she will soon learn that the boat attack wasn\'t a coincidence.','/vZaYDWa3IqTNKsHCsUr72J4zTJ6.jpg','2006-09-14',145,'Released','To fight the enemy, she must become one of them.','Black Book',9075,5.4737,7.4,'DIklvGsU7bM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18967,_binary '\0','/w8VDpCcKezdBbXJEWMHwttI35mU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389722',6.6,203178,'en','30 Days of Night','This is the story of an isolated Alaskan town that is plunged into darkness for a month each year when the sun sinks below the horizon. As the last rays of light fade, the town is attacked by a bloodthirsty gang of vampires bent on an uninterrupted orgy of destruction. Only the small town\'s husband-and-wife Sheriff team stand between the survivors and certain destruction.','/7LwSrvFA0gz1KAlcrGcinoQPene.jpg','2007-10-17',113,'Released','They\'re Coming!','30 Days of Night',4513,11.6343,6.44,'8ClVrVK_y0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18968,_binary '\0','/pGicBHLGc78YqJ9Fq9F0lMV07Vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389738',6.6,1857,'de','Agnes und seine Brüder','Focuses on three very different siblings, all searching for happiness. Hans-Jörg is a sex addicted librarian, who is interested in young students. Werner is a successful politician with a dysfunctional family. Agnes, a trans woman, works as a table dancer in a night club. The three brothers just have one thing in common: their longing for a happy life.','/dPc7sNkyBdW2Q4ufUcJSJcZjg3b.jpg','2004-10-13',115,'Released','... on the way to happiness','Agnes and His Brothers',1925,2.4588,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18969,_binary '\0','/uRZhr7zzaxeidLq2eYL59ulh4vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389790',6.1,200663,'en','Bee Movie','Barry B. Benson, a recent college graduate who wants more out of his life than making honey, decides to sue the human race after learning about the exploitation of bees at the hands of mankind. What will happen next?','/tX2mgKFUkzFMZingSVD4vioZNz2.jpg','2007-10-28',91,'Released','Honey just got funny.','Bee Movie',5559,18.8613,6.051,'z3PtI-ljZAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18970,_binary '\0','/mVlX8MvdxKeotkZnFDtuMa0GDxg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389828',6.4,5354,'en','C.S.A.: The Confederate States of America','Through the eyes of a British \"documentary\", this film takes a satirically humorous, and sometimes frightening, look at the history of an America where the South won the Civil War.','/6tf2eXhIbG27hb1D52xDvNK7GdR.jpg','2005-06-24',89,'Released','What if the South had won the War?','C.S.A.: The Confederate States of America',24408,1.873,5.8,'gIqxBn1oLAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18971,_binary '\0','/n6eIm882V7cj0In0xp8QXNItoTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389860',6.5,392635,'en','Click','A married workaholic, Michael Newman doesn\'t have time for his wife and children, not if he\'s to impress his ungrateful boss and earn a well-deserved promotion. So when he meets Morty, a loopy sales clerk, he gets the answer to his prayers: a magical remote that allows him to bypass life\'s little distractions with increasingly hysterical results.','/oL0k5JA53PyoHSZqKb3cNkhwBCE.jpg','2006-06-23',107,'Released','What if you had a universal remote...that controlled your universe?','Click',9339,14.7885,6.3,'APUqyhgtCfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18972,_binary '\0','/jjQgdluuOti22SzZoLyLNlHfsgJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389912',4.1,1228,'en','Deep Evil','There\'s been an incident at a top secret bio-research lab in remote Alaska. A crack team of military ops are on their way, unsure if it\'s an accident, an act of terrorism ... or something else. Tensions rise as the squad uncovers one grisly discovery after another, and faces the possibility of a traitor in their midst.','/nKC0DrtMN09WOBxXfDy6LefCXqc.jpg','2004-06-27',93,'Released','THE NEW BREED OF TERROR!','Deep Evil',19010,1.9348,4.4,'ilq80JTpTbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18973,_binary '\0','/secc9CFi6OERSCB6RZ9yusDYlEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0389957',5.3,17058,'en','Edison','In the troubled city of Edison, a young journalist, his jaded editor, and an honest investigator from the district attorney\'s office join forces to gather evidence against corrupt members of an elite police unit.','/7K2amWJd9lASC9R04M7IfVklBc1.jpg','2005-07-29',99,'Released','In this city, only the cops are above the law.','Edison',10064,4.1734,5.3,'G3xH5ke7B9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18974,_binary '\0','/dxXhdYuQyuMPX0lCEo6LhCv69Xq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390022',7.2,71438,'en','Friday Night Lights','A small, turbulent town in Texas obsesses over their high school football team to an unhealthy degree. When the star tailback, Boobie Miles, is seriously injured during the first game of the season, all hope is lost, and the town\'s dormant social problems begin to flare up. It is left to the inspiring abilities of new coach Gary Gaines to instill in the other team members -- and, by proxy, the town itself -- a sense of self-respect and honor.','/8HIqpOgqShRc3TAleabnYispDl1.jpg','2004-10-08',118,'Released','Hope comes alive on Friday nights.','Friday Night Lights',13416,4.7664,6.9,'dzwJFNZLvxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18975,_binary '\0','/trQo5GDL0NI2blRU6O9kDWbbqJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390042',7,2043,'ko','그녀를 믿지 마세요','A professional lady con makes herself the pharmacist\'s fiancée overnight, and faces a disastrous blemish in her impeccable con-woman career.','/1NiodSUUTKjw4HZwLsQp1To2OBi.jpg','2004-02-20',115,'Released','The queen of trickery has appeared!','Too Beautiful to Lie',18372,1.8814,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18976,_binary '\0','/log76gY6cMTCcs5hwV1isQnNtZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390109',7.3,1393,'en','I Like Killing Flies','In the cramped, cluttered confines of Shopsin’s, a legendary hole-in-the-wall diner in New York’s Greenwich Village, eccentric chef Kenny Shopsin holds court—serving up an absurdly massive menu alongside his razor-sharp wit and unfiltered philosophies on life, food, and human nature. As the family-run institution faces a forced relocation, this intimate documentary captures the controlled chaos of Kenny’s world, where every customer is a character and every meal is a performance. A love letter to stubborn individuality and the art of doing things your own way.','/elr5xGIbVqJtg2Y5KJ7mUmbWTi4.jpg','2004-01-15',80,'Released',NULL,'I Like Killing Flies',51069,0.7822,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18977,_binary '\0','/gf2jWMEElanX8IsxQGzGEakKh0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390123',7.3,2335,'en','In the Realms of the Unreal','In the Realms of the Unreal is a documentary about the reclusive Chicago-based artist Henry Darger. Henry Darger was so reclusive that when he died his neighbors were surprised to find a 15,145-page manuscript along with hundreds of paintings depicting The Story of the Vivian Girls, in What is Known as the Realms of the Unreal, of the Glodeco-Angelinnian War Storm, Cased by the Child Slave Rebellion.','/lKxzlejHu8ApBZohNHMfbmIGzZd.jpg','2004-01-15',81,'Released','The Mystery of Henry Darger','In the Realms of the Unreal',1853,3.5084,7.2,'MSzzirIP0No','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18978,_binary '\0','/e7zWLL6usha8A9URHzCbmdhmhoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390136',4.5,1591,'es','Isi/Disi - Amor a lo bestia','Will love compromise one man\'s devotion to heavy rock? That\'s the all-important question behind this broad comedy from Spain. Isi (Santiago Segura) and Disi (Florentino Fernandez) are two best friends who live in a lower middle-class neighborhood near Madrid. Isi and Disi aren\'t especially bright, but their devotion to heavy metal is complete and unquestioned, and they wouldn\'t be caught dead listening to a lame pop singer like, say , Joaquin Sabina. However, one day Isi sees Vane (Jaydy Michel), a beautiful girl who attends a nearby college, and immediately falls head over heels in love.','/bn8JLZHxuHdwpjWdpXl1yld8TBG.jpg','2004-07-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Isi/Disi - Amor a lo bestia',48635,1.7578,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18979,_binary '\0','/a7FjMHK3AQVbAcVOeQoeEAxTDU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390205',7.4,2939,'ko','말죽거리 잔혹사','A model student transfers to the notorious Jungmoon High School known for its severe corporal punishment by teachers and power struggles between school gangs.','/sUQcZdu7EfYC9Ljz7vanUJfzVQg.jpg','2004-01-15',116,'Released','Spirit of jeet kune do.','Once Upon a Time in High School',49214,2.6847,7.3,'9jYDDZ4ZjfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18980,_binary '\0','/q6xEN0Lx214QUXXXlQfLaoJS7EB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390221',7.4,37778,'es','María, llena eres de gracia','A pregnant Colombian teenager becomes a drug mule to make some desperately needed money for her family.','/30CImATfvHWLXy6a3KmHXnYXB6c.jpg','2004-04-02',101,'Released','Based on 1,000 true stories.','Maria Full of Grace',436,3.6844,7.2,'FkdFcCtrFzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18981,_binary '\0','/3TKdFiMnTMXg7lQXF2mcaJO0Mx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390245',5.9,4444,'fi','Matti','Four Olympic gold medals, seven World Championship titles, four World Cup tour championships, and forty six World Cup circuit victories. Once his career as a professional athlete ended however, the other side of his personality emerged into public view in all of its vulgarity. An alcohol dependency, several marriages accompanied by numerous marital problems, petty crime, uncontrolled acts of violence, and greedy hangers-on.','/1UAfy9NDIlenfIjDyBHmsnDiSJP.jpg','2006-01-13',141,'Released',NULL,'Matti: Hell Is for Heroes',29040,1.6717,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18982,_binary '\0','/ryxeBhuXhldEQch918Ih2GLugNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390272',7.3,1229,'cn','忘不了','Sui Wai lost her fiance Ah Man in a car accident. With the obligations of life sitting heavy on her shoulders, she lives on only to find herself confiding in her beloved through a phone call. Dai Fai. a mini-bus driver who witnessed Ah Man\'s death, is always there offering her attentive encouragement and support, yet he himself also lives in the shadow of his last relationship. When Siu Wai strives to face the future without the man she loves, Dai Fai finds himself steadily falling in love with her.','/AuNpbU1WPp4daEnnrKgHQUuoI6p.jpg','2003-11-20',109,'Released',NULL,'Lost in Time',61676,1.9303,7.3,'2cRUh76R7Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18983,_binary '\0','/1eXRr0AyDYRKANenQVUQUenh226.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390336',7.1,4780,'en','Overnight','Alternately hilarious and horrifying, Overnight chronicles one man\'s misadventures of making a Hollywood movie. It starts out as a rags to riches story as Troy Duffy, a Boston-bred bartender, sells his first screenplay for The Boondock Saints.','/tw0Ozor3NWNAj2r0CJ5Arz0U8Uv.jpg','2003-06-12',82,'Released','There\'s more than one way to shoot yourself','Overnight',27007,1.8917,6.4,'jc2GYck0jEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18984,_binary '\0','/blSQbKAreIqcu2AWGDNjR8k3fAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390384',6.7,123089,'en','Primer','A group of fledgling inventors discover a complex method to manipulate reality. At first, they successfully game the stock market with it, but the consequences of the invention start to catch up with them.','/xEoq2WmDzpzxhkHEsmOYOg6BPg6.jpg','2004-10-08',77,'Released','What happens if it actually works?','Primer',14337,4.3676,6.8,'-vD-yj9o664','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18985,_binary '\0','/aDG5Bm9WhH7f0rLBAzy781r64J4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390418',5.1,1930,'en','The Raspberry Reich','Gudrun has modeled her amateur German terrorist group after the 1970s Red Army Faction (Baader-Meinhof Gang). She attempts to imitate her heroes by kidnapping the son of a wealthy industrialist and hopes to negotiate leftist demands from the father. When Gudrun’s not spouting leftist verses (including during a hilariously brilliant fuck session), she’s trying to convince her all-male gang to abandon their heterosexuality, which she believes is the result of mass delusion.','/2sZ5RvohgzMfHNDGmw2AwwutVPu.jpg','2004-04-01',91,'Released','The revolution is my boyfriend','The Raspberry Reich',27069,2.0501,5.6,'2pOO_Zad_aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18986,_binary '\0','/qwX9BtM4WwJEpfj0ouUYhW68GCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390450',4.2,2459,'en','Blessed','Heather Graham and James Purefoy play a couple who desperately want to have a baby. Unfortunately, she has been diagnosed as infertile, and the couple can\'t afford the medical treatments that might allow her to conceive. Good fortune appears to be smiling on the couple when they are given an opportunity to receive free treatments at a mysterious fertility clinic.','/lQIQzonaUBSb5VG90Eq4VGfN4Dv.jpg','2004-05-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Blessed',20695,1.8211,4.8,'eA9tb_iTNlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18987,_binary '\0','/f589RGsnKpDvHu9qvELM6LZBEbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390521',7.2,115565,'en','Super Size Me','Morgan Spurlock subjects himself to a diet based only on McDonald\'s fast food three times a day for thirty days without exercising to try to prove why so many Americans are fat or obese. He submits himself to a complete check-up by three doctors, comparing his weight along the way, resulting in a scary conclusion.','/zYkbqQaCuIHBxqBDGgnQCwJ9jIG.jpg','2004-01-17',100,'Released','The first ever reality-based movie ... everything begins and ends in 30 days!','Super Size Me',9372,2.6877,6.7,'as2zMlxeOkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18988,_binary '\0','/pMX2Qe0jOmRPrfNQSqO7I8twdbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390531',5.6,2966,'ar','التجربة الدنماركية','When Kadry El Meniawy becomes the minister of Youth and sports, the attractive woman Anita from Denmark comes to Egypt for cultural exchange between the two countries. As she stays at the minister\'s villa, his sons try to get close to her while he also falls for her.','/zCLPq2NHoScjOs4f5SNsduxkLQH.jpg','2003-08-06',109,'Released',NULL,'The Danish Experience',418319,1.2309,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18989,_binary '\0','/ayCacNxcVzNdw7wwTKYwzMihjRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390538',7.1,6917,'en','Tarnation','Filmmaker Jonathan Caouette\'s documentary on growing up with his schizophrenic mother -- a mixture of snapshots, Super-8, answering machine messages, video diaries, early short films, and more -- culled from 19 years of his life.','/7zeQapdvD8poOizcaHwzmPxN9Km.jpg','2003-10-19',91,'Released','Your greatest creation is the life you lead','Tarnation',1435,1.6825,6.8,'Gz74_hpl9bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18990,_binary '\0','/4E48ebNRuMkMEcoTbc7szR0YB6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390614',6.8,14556,'hi','वक्त','A chronic illness leaves Ishwar with only a few months to live. His son Aditya is extremely reckless. To make him realise his responsibilities, Ishwar throws his son out of the house.','/vELjzwLrR9oel81b4xguRNCMDrN.jpg','2005-04-22',153,'Released','The Race Against Time','Waqt',31364,1.5863,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18991,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390632',6.9,1776,'en','Word Wars','The classic board game, Scrabble, has been popular for decades. In addition, there are fanatics who devote heart and soul to this game to the expense of everything else. This film profiles a group of these enthusiasts as they converge for a Scrabble convention where the word game is almost a bloodsport.','/vOZFWlATXn0Ux3UPOITLDxKhCam.jpg','2004-05-28',80,'Released','This Is NOT Your Grandmother\'s Game Of Scrabble.','Word Wars',28105,1.1138,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18992,_binary '\0','/9NfwnRWloDU9SIpsLcjTEdEGcen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0390808',7.1,19624,'fr','36 quai des Orfèvres','In Paris, two cops are competing for the vacant job of chief of police, in the middle of the search for a gang of violent thieves. The movie is directed by Olivier Marchal, a former police officer who spent 12 years with the French police before creating this story, taken in part from real events of the 1980s.','/exD0FsvhkZqetOVOYrfGqwnc7nX.jpg','2004-11-24',111,'Released','A FILM BY OLIVIER MARCHAL.','36th Precinct',7291,4.6419,6.9,'SE8GaK9gMtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18993,_binary '\0','/4RJ59jew85X9crvY76xK2sIhBJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391024',7.6,5379,'en','Control Room','A chronicle which provides a rare window into the international perception of the Iraq War, courtesy of Al Jazeera, the Arab world\'s most popular news outlet. Roundly criticized by Cabinet members and Pentagon officials for reporting with a pro-Iraqi bias, and strongly condemned for frequently airing civilian causalities as well as footage of American POWs, the station has revealed (and continues to show the world) everything about the Iraq War that the Bush administration did not want it to see.','/pm6Tvrh3XC2mOwwCB8AQWcpBg1K.jpg','2004-01-22',84,'Released','Different channels. Different truths.','Control Room',18889,1.356,7.3,'FgMkd6d4qVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18994,_binary '\0','/yefSD6lp3jOBYkBeY5QxRRKTJME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391198',5.9,159568,'en','The Grudge','An American nurse living and working in Tokyo is exposed to a mysterious supernatural curse, one that locks a person in a powerful rage before claiming their life and spreading to another victim.','/7vPAVPKYexQVmvC578wPLn2CGCL.jpg','2004-10-22',92,'Released','It never forgives. It never forgets.','The Grudge',1970,11.015,5.9,'tqn2t3PefdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18995,_binary '\0','/7Q0hbVTeCqbbF3IrYSrFnvXThlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391229',6.1,3636,'en','I Want Someone to Eat Cheese With','Life has its downs for James, living with his mom in Chicago at 39, an aging performer at Second City, eating and weighing too much. A woman he\'s been dating drops him, as does his agent, her brother. James turns down roles in local TV, roles that make him sad. Someone\'s remaking his favorite movie, \"Marty,\" a role he\'d love, but he doesn\'t even get an audition.','/4zVqWaiC9Y2GJSmuJjMDRlYv4ae.jpg','2006-04-28',80,'Released','Sometimes love is just a big bowl of wrong.','I Want Someone to Eat Cheese With',13066,2.1714,5.5,'-Phmk_AmmnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18996,_binary '\0','/kRpzc3knsyOzLFOi4C4ZUbLPScu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391304',6.6,73900,'en','A Lot Like Love','On a flight from Los Angeles to New York, Oliver and Emily make a connection, only to decide that they are poorly suited to be together. Over the next seven years, however, they are reunited time and time again, they go from being acquaintances to close friends to... lovers?','/6xrF9zwEbYiYBOalMO14RAWBLLj.jpg','2005-04-21',107,'Released','There\'s nothing better than a great romance... to ruin a perfectly good friendship.','A Lot Like Love',8976,7.0829,6.8,'MRPr34vEbC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18997,_binary '\0','/lqHue5WaWkxBy6CkBx0taA9K1ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391353',5.9,1607,'en','Mrs. Harris','Based on the sensational 1980s media event, famed cardiologist Herman Tarnower meets a particularly brutal end at the hands of his jilted lover, Jean Harris.','/uLKEPOnWg3jmDZXfJ9VBZi4ggR6.jpg','2005-09-16',94,'Released','She loved him. So she shot him.','Mrs. Harris',58934,1.6512,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18998,_binary '\0','/mwxYdfqvT7ovX281WOZIySJUanf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391483',7.1,3111,'zh','Take Out','An illegal Chinese immigrant falls behind on payments on an enormous smuggling debt. Ming Ding has only until the end of the day to come up with the money.','/hBpAozLANehQQnvTPcCHcKQt2vP.jpg','2008-06-06',88,'Released','One illegal immigrant, one smuggling debt, one day to pay up.','Take Out',37736,1.8524,7,'u8Bp1c_9ejQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(18999,_binary '\0','/aFNrH9l46cnMGSRqP6Z9MGthIK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391728',4.4,2933,'en','Adam and Eve','Adam is a typical college-aged guy... which is to say he wants sex 24 hours a day. But when he meets - and falls for - Eve, a scorchingly hot coed who\'s still very attached to her virginity, the waiting game is on! While his college buddies score left and right, and campus hotties make tempting passes, Adam ponders an explosive question: Will Eve say \"It\'s the right time\"... before he completely goes out of his mind?','/jtf60tNMJQ6Jbman4Fi43rnSIVA.jpg','2005-11-04',93,'Released','She\'s got it all... and he\'s not getting any.','Adam and Eve',53928,1.949,4,'ioWyUonJWPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19000,_binary '\0','/y7FuBqRgItUbxXObj1yKPK8HpKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391774',4.7,2121,'de','Autobahnraser','Junior police constable Karl-Heinz has just been given a telling-off by his boss for allegedly botching a major operation against car thieves. Now he senses an opportunity to rehabilitate himself when a gang of high-flying highway speeders catch his eye during a traffic check. Karl-Heinz decides to go undercover with the gang and gets to know their colorful characters. He soon takes more pleasure in the illegal speeding than is good for his health and career.','/zlgyFZDFP6iU6K3fmoR31fcISTk.jpg','2004-02-19',87,'Released',NULL,'A2 Racer',11930,2.4404,4.7,'RQkVrN9C-FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19001,_binary '\0','/92UT2ZSW2dtBhuczEQlSu3n14Cd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0391891',4.6,9350,'en','Cruel Intentions 3','Meet Cassie, Jason and Patrick, three amoral college students who, through a series of sexual wagers, take malicious pleasure in ruining the lives of their fellow classmates.','/pxjJf3QnZxe3EO8NuwEeK0Yldcd.jpg','2004-08-10',85,'Released','The 3rd time\'s a charm...','Cruel Intentions 3',5460,5.4731,4.8,'FAXTEDB-ZV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19002,_binary '\0','/gp3PlqufqUVRIkZorXqq8iDjOlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392049',5.8,2290,'da','Den Gode strømer','A crew of young, small-time crooks screws up. Ripping off a shipping container of Chinese silk for a Rasta gang, they also come away with two and a half kilos of heroin belonging to the Latvian mafia. A friend of theirs, Jens (Kim Bodnia), a plainclothes cop, tries to mediate, but instead all barrels are turned on him. The Latvians and the Chinese want him. Jamaican dope growers, ice-cold Serbian heroin dealers and Polish human smugglers are gunning for him. And to top it all off, he also has to dodge his fellow officers, backed by the scuba corps and elite-forces soldiers, to save his young friends.','/1OuBPvfEAWBRxg4NsU2KOn0xR2O.jpg','2004-04-16',86,'Released',NULL,'The Good Cop',4991,1.7535,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19003,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392262',6.1,1829,'tr','Keloğlan ile Cankız','Keloglan (Bald Boy) is a dreamer but his only ability is talking, one day The Sultan announces a tournament and best warrior of the land will win his daughter, Keloglan wants to join the tournament to make his dreams come true but didn\'t know how to fight so he begins a travel to learn fighting from famous warrior Master Ali Cengiz.','/jM80q8CDvhNKGd8sksjlIdnRuW9.jpg','1972-06-15',90,'Released',NULL,'The Bald Boy and Cankiz',447093,0.868,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19004,_binary '\0','/dSmuYT1e49kjLxI6URq7mIU6OXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392360',6.1,1878,'hi','Love','A man meets and falls in love with a beautiful woman. However, due to his violent background, her parents are against the relationship. After the couple shows no signs of breaking up, her mother has the man arrested.','/aRbBltP71wvWA1C5Mk2iI9KZmI3.jpg','1991-11-15',153,'Released',NULL,'Love',161401,1.0814,6.2,'rJm4Y7dlz-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19005,_binary '\0','/4umzequ4lJsoihonwaAyHNe05ac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392465',6.7,9698,'en','Mozart and the Whale','A love story between two savants with Asperger\'s syndrome, a kind of autism, whose conditions sabotage their budding relationship.','/aklblysd3jShpjzh1ryYWYowEUM.jpg','2005-09-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Mozart and the Whale',23478,2.963,6.179,'sjpSqYu_ZGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19006,_binary '\0','/5ze6lU5pTdPtJ3YhzN7HznvqUCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392494',3.7,1925,'it','Natale in India','Destinies intertwined for two antithetical people who meet during a trip to India, where lots of misunderstandings and funny situations will take place.','/anOwIDAfs93mWVY4ZX6LQdbjXbv.jpg','2003-12-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Natale in India',42433,1.2565,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19007,_binary '\0','/sWYVXYXOaUlnPdVH9e7J9YpX1By.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392591',5.5,1484,'it','Il paradiso all\'improvviso','Confirmed bachelor Lorenzo sees his beliefs about commitment put to the test when a gorgeous Latina deserted by her fiancée forces him to take his place in the romantic trip she had planned.','/sdLPKJ7wEGFDBNibDpNpUg1QhFm.jpg','2003-12-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Suddenly Heaven',61630,1.9226,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19008,_binary '\0','/vIT0i6s8s8vLcA7uomrAzSzOtQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392878',6.2,17349,'en','The Onion Movie','Venerable newscaster Norm Archer reports the latest news in politics, health, culture and entertainment - such as an automotive recall of decapitation-inducing \"Neckbelts\" and a study finding that \"depression hits losers hardest\". This compilation of bogus news stories, celebrity profiles, movie trailers and skits come courtesy of the ace satirists at The Onion.','/AikMOGbaKpCzHnupsdBzyacsKC2.jpg','2008-05-31',90,'Released','America\'s finest news source.','The Onion Movie',14771,3.913,6.1,'SNjzV_nNDvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19009,_binary '\0','/dpsQ4ZrBx8YvSHtWJjM4w7kzrkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392883',6.9,1992,'fr','La Vallée des fleurs','A Himalayan legend of a love struggling against the inevitability of death, an astonishing tale spanning from the early 19th century mountain existence, to hectic, bustling modern day Tokyo.','/5E8fSf9UiAiL2An4sX3C4WVXlY4.jpg','2006-07-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Valley of Flowers',8014,1.6322,6.8,'rk87L544DRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19010,_binary '\0','/bny7txHGdHDLZpHjiZM31VSJNQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0392908',5.8,1630,'en','When Do We Eat?','An old school dad is as tough on his sons as his father is on him. On this night, however, one of the boys slips dad a dose of special, hallucinogenic ecstasy in order \"to give him a new perspective.\"','/uk16CbLHzX7WDR95Jobw7dXTqAb.jpg','2006-04-07',86,'Released','Sex, Drugs, and Matzoh Ball Soup','When Do We Eat?',35556,1.6202,5.2,'ophhewEkOK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19011,_binary '\0','/sDr2KjWpEbJ8M1F88rEmhoczLkX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393109',7.1,114616,'en','Brick','A teenage loner pushes his way into the underworld of a high school crime ring to investigate the disappearance of his ex-girlfriend.','/5WVk8JpNIxepn4fpZzQeCumkOL5.jpg','2006-03-31',110,'Released','A detective story.','Brick',9270,4.1849,6.8,'awbOgB7yB_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19012,_binary '\0','/n4CvA50GBtIPrSqCl8nMNZCliYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393162',7.4,195514,'en','Coach Carter','Based on a true story, in which Richmond High School head basketball coach Ken Carter made headlines in 1999 for benching his undefeated team due to poor academic results.','/y3HOTTyM5nLsdUzXFtFCohG28qj.jpg','2005-01-14',136,'Released','It begins on the streets. It ends here.','Coach Carter',7214,13.3475,7.587,'MV5v0zNDrlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19013,_binary '\0','/wYF1MYLHpkrRlGmY3atsd6DOSLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393329',5.8,1687,'en','Go Go Tales','A financial struggle between owners of a go-go club threatens its future.','/fTYuLNemTVlt5za6uFKd7Nce3J5.jpg','2008-06-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Go Go Tales',50318,2.3739,5.6,'b2nqIUxi_hI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19014,_binary '\0','/x8gFHJsqaP041fAuis7bJDNdxtr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393421',4.3,1481,'en','Larva','In Host, Missouri, the newcomer Dr. of Veterinary Science Eli Rudkus is called by the farmer Jacob Long to exam one of his cows. The veterinarian finds a strange parasite in the animal and sends it to a friend in the Department of Agriculture for research. Later, he finds the same parasite in a creek and he summons the population for a meeting, warning that the cause might be the animal food. However, Fletcher Odermatt, the wealthy owner of the local Host Tender Meals that has been providing free animal food for the farmers, brings his lawyer Hayley Anderson and discredits Eli. When a huge mutant parasite attacks Eli and Jacob, they discover that the meals are actually an experimental genetic cocktail that is growing parasites inside the cattle and people. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil','/16OwY4VyqeZyLvHdfyjznIqv2TP.jpg','2005-01-22',96,'Released','A terror that gets under your skin','Larva',52244,1.3509,5,'s1tM1bdeBBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19015,_binary '\0','/h5dmCDfEUzNGw10BxBcIVBaiIwM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393567',5.1,1599,'en','The Other Side','Samuel North (Nathan Mobley) escapes from Hell to find the person who murdered him, but a team of invincible bounty hunters called REAPERS are sent from the Netherworld to bring him back.','/ibnEmQBkRamIj4NcnFdU0sYNzMk.jpg','2006-01-13',95,'Released','Fear the reapers.','The Other Side',51465,1.464,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19016,_binary '\0','/yNjspaPkOJ6D6SvPry9ulxZrlpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393596',5.6,4370,'en','Pixel Perfect','Samantha\'s band, the Zettabytes, is meeting with little success, so her friend Roscoe uses his knowledge of technology designed by his father to create a holographic lead singer, Loretta Modern. The band instantly becomes successful, but Samantha begins to feel alienated, Roscoe discovers feelings for Samantha, and Loretta struggles with individuality.','/Apz1iXuiAUNArN7CLXGHNCuVeSn.jpg','2004-11-13',90,'Released','They don\'t make rock stars like they used to.','Pixel Perfect',124117,2.8671,5.3,'Fbd7TT1yZ6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19017,_binary '\0','/4ADZ2iiATjoKxZwjJRiEo1x6Fk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393597',7.9,14990,'en','Earth','An epic story of adventure, starring some of the most magnificent and courageous creatures alive, awaits you in EARTH. Disneynature brings you a remarkable story of three animal families on a journey across our planet – polar bears, elephants and humpback whales.','/xybnXW6E28W9agiwUeGLbTYS454.jpg','2007-10-10',90,'Released','The remarkable story of three families.','Earth',10946,3.79,7.7,'DlF2zaiVyLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19018,_binary '\0','/iY3QBjMz4hlPj6WXMBp8Iq6euKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393635',5.1,11436,'en','Reeker','Strangers trapped at an eerie travel oasis in the desert must unravel the mystery behind their visions of dying people while they are preyed upon by a decaying creature.','/vyx8J1SFPjb7t8v0gLXnUBw3a8t.jpg','2005-03-13',91,'Released','Between light and dark. Night and day. Living and dead.','Reeker',14457,2.7668,5.655,'D9RwpcNXXiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19019,_binary '\0','/xOfUAMzceH38mHxrm84CNXBteuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393685',5.4,12504,'en','Santa\'s Slay','Santa Claus is actually a demon who lost a bet with an angel, so he became the giver of toys and happiness. But this year the bet is off, and Santa is about to return to his evil ways.','/sdd0TRVpMjAViiBPq0oufYOHg0m.jpg','2005-10-25',85,'Released','He\'s making a list... pray you\'re not on it.','Santa\'s Slay',12591,3.494,5.5,'45wLLhUaMgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19020,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393724',7.2,1473,'ml','സേതുരാമയ്യർ സിബിഐ','Alex, who is awaiting execution, confesses to having committed six out of the seven murders he is acquitted for. Officer Sethurama Iyer decides to trace the original murderer of the seventh one.','/boOs4jfJBV97ShzPiPtn1BNjhi1.jpg','2004-01-22',145,'Released',NULL,'Sethurama Iyer CBI',267686,1.2558,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19021,_binary '\0','/veUujxONO3SyAvfZp5QndqPSzLg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393735',4.4,21100,'en','The Shaggy Dog','The tale of a workaholic dad-turned-dog who finds that being man\'s best friend shows him the most important job - being a great dad.','/tGX3YyPaYMbjiRwR5PjRsJW7GtM.jpg','2006-03-09',98,'Released','It\'s going to be a ruff day.','The Shaggy Dog',10067,6.2199,4.9,'S09rcCJl8pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19022,_binary '\0','/jmGCos3hQQVC1EETAdzd3q8zUDP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393775',7.8,8484,'nl','Simon','A mild-mannered gay dentist and a womanizing bar owner rekindle their unlikely friendship when, upon meeting by chance after a decade apart, the latter turns out to be severely ill.','/gwU2qVIqHkvzsjUxMf3GEWAsobl.jpg','2004-09-30',102,'Released','He\'ll change your life','Simon',19398,0.8192,7.3,'gNnEWwXGE_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19023,_binary '\0','/pk05jSI6yQqK0duLEFOUAtvycYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0393956',5.8,1690,'en','Viva','Abandoned by her husband, Barbi is dragged into trouble by her girlfriend, who spouts women\'s lib as she gets Barbi to discard her bra and go out on the town. Barbi becomes a Red Riding Hood in a sea of wolves, and quickly learns a lot more than she wanted to about nudist camps, the hippie scene, orgies, bisexuality, sadism, drugs, and bohemia.','/6c8GlvDF71b1f62K8fapWAa8Qtv.jpg','2008-03-07',120,'Released','They were housewives seeking kicks, in a world of swingers, orgies, booze and sin that was the sexual revolution!','Viva',24870,1.089,5.1,'0-umb9qXvgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19024,_binary '\0','/eqpkycxmFt6ETn9XuE6dT1ldCdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395119',6.1,14883,'es','Alatriste','In 17th century Spain, Diego Alatriste, a brave and heroic soldier, is fighting in his King\'s army in the Flandes region. His best mate, Balboa, falls in a trap and, when near to his death, asks Diego to look after his son and teach him to be a soldier.','/hQ4b8dXp0uCqslHm0jOvjw4BNUe.jpg','2006-09-01',145,'Released',NULL,'Captain Alatriste: The Spanish Musketeer',13495,3.3839,5.9,'SHYEjR6N3OM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19025,_binary '\0','/vZUntwE0BLPxvjDVi54qQqxYyOI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395125',7,13749,'es','Crimen ferpecto','A playboy has the tables turned on him when he finds himself being used as a plaything by an undesirable woman.','/1wOWudCNA550cLNk3JFoqhxLOGB.jpg','2004-09-10',102,'Released',NULL,'The Ferpect Crime',9534,2.3015,6.7,'jmeQbWrKHxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19026,_binary '\0','/cogb2aEw6WkbhTzKqVpjnn4Jrzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395140',7,6294,'ko','어린 신부','A teenage girl tries to continue her normal social and school life, after her grandfather forces her into an arranged marriage with a man in his twenties.','/eFE1fhmj57bidgHQCKuGcprYjjg.jpg','2004-04-02',115,'Released','Sometimes marriage comes before love…','My Little Bride',44656,2.1764,7.09,'MK40stPdxcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19027,_binary '\0','/jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395169',8.1,394858,'en','Hotel Rwanda','Inspired by true events, this film takes place in Rwanda in the 1990s when more than a million Tutsis were killed in a genocide that went mostly unnoticed by the rest of the world. Hotel owner Paul Rusesabagina houses over a thousand refuges in his hotel in attempt to save their lives.','/p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg','2004-12-22',122,'Released','When the world closed its eyes, he opened his arms.','Hotel Rwanda',205,9.0387,7.72,'2x8UzELvKlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19028,_binary '\0','/h6hvy15g67TlFr3fJh3QWtT6vr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395173',7.1,2304,'es','Inconscientes','A Freudian comedy set in Barcelona, 1913, that playfully questions sexual taboos through a Sherlock Holmes-style investigation.','/c8T1FrVgNAQTWbszFrvlMiXbYHS.jpg','2004-08-27',100,'Released','Uncover Hidden Desires.','Unconscious',43271,1.0211,6.9,'MjPz3sLWMgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19029,_binary '\0','/8PU4tUGUdrKujKwkUkw3M9ZrAaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395251',6.4,47439,'en','The Producers','A conniving Broadway producer and his meek accountant plan to profit from charming wealthy old biddies to invest in an overbudget production, and then put on a sure-fire disaster, so nobody will ask for their money back — and what\'s more disastrous than a tasteless musical celebrating Adolf Hitler.','/nG0Bix2SH2SQcbAIGhb6yqTG5UH.jpg','2005-12-25',134,'Released','They had everything to gain by not being a success!','The Producers',9899,5.6172,6.2,'u36iNj52rac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19030,_binary '\0','/ndFQSlmnST5V33l2ZUa5F3kVgVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395424',6.3,1419,'en','3 Needles','A three-paneled look at the worldwide AIDS crisis: in Montreal, a porn actor schemes to pass his mandatory blood test; a young nun makes a personal sacrifice for the benefit of a South African village; in rural China, a black market operative posing as a government-sanctioned blood drawer jeopardizes an entire village\'s safety','/twoD2f2vx3rHc2FiSHgvmFDn2hl.jpg','2005-09-09',127,'Released',NULL,'3 Needles',18166,1.5154,5.9,'PPhqnvJckvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19031,_binary '\0','/3bOcexFOgJn3WPQe0TwGBFVYSd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395461',7.5,4221,'fa','بابا عزیز','The story of a blind dervish named Bab\'Aziz and his spirited granddaughter, Ishtar. Together they wander the desert in search of a great reunion of dervishes that takes place just once every thirty years. With faith as their only guide, the two journey for days through the expansive, barren landscape.','/sdCuifwyHNRG1tmEdPOinCMqC22.jpg','2006-11-15',96,'Released','To find the beloved, one must have faith','Bab\'Aziz',45882,1.4912,7.2,'IPYjenA3VFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19032,_binary '\0','/lhw6WtUgbxvrFnGHynZfOYh8aoz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395495',5.9,30905,'en','Catch and Release','For a grieving fiancée, learning to love again requires the help of her late love\'s three best friends.','/mcGvcb65JdftAHxyhxd2dxCPNOa.jpg','2006-10-20',111,'Released','Life is messy. Love is messier','Catch and Release',13668,5.0857,5.9,'802GQQ2XyUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19033,_binary '\0','/50nJYKx0ACzDymkygPn4EQqgK6p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395514',7,1907,'fr','Le Dernier Trappeur','Norman is not just an admirer of nature, he\'s a part of it. He survives the harshness of the climate and the wildlife by coexisting with it. With his wife Nebraska, they live almost entirely off the land, making money by selling their furs.','/hZDA3HI7ZPIjEdeTlz2bAv8BPRP.jpg','2004-12-12',94,'Released','In the 21st century, we can still choose to live differently.','The Last Trapper',13678,1.6871,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19034,_binary '\0','/uwhdNBtZqyHotOtxPZaubKtpKFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395543',6.1,1977,'en','Forty Shades of Blue','A Russian woman living in Memphis with a much older rock-n-roll legend experiences a personal awakening when her husband\'s estranged son comes to visit.','/tWhkFzXkqS9afk2KKTTwd6IBmZ6.jpg','2005-12-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Forty Shades of Blue',30082,1.939,4.5,'IA8Qrbcoq90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19035,_binary '\0','/w7gu9CSme21bkvoPt0JI3oLDLL5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395565',7.4,4309,'en','Gracie\'s Choice','For as long as she can remember, 16 year-old Gracie has been raising her four siblings, each of whom has a different, absent father and their mother is on the fast track to self-destruction. When these children\'s lives are about to be pulled apart, Gracie will have to do the impossible and make the ultimate sacrifices to keep her family together.','/mECvCiSy8nsdMtGNAxlupMjIug7.jpg','2004-01-12',90,'Released','A story of love','Gracie\'s Choice',70476,2.143,7.1,'zqS8_1eP5dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19036,_binary '\0','/gYekT5QeTM47iWT555JQrEbRNmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395571',7.4,6661,'en','Hawking','The story of Professor Stephen Hawking\'s early years. It is 1963, and our young cosmologist celebrates his 21st birthday. At the party is a new friend, Jane Wilde - there is a strong attraction between the two. Jane is intrigued by Stephen\'s talk of stars and the Universe. But she realises that there is something very wrong when Stephen suddenly finds that he is unable to stand up.','/zqQZ050fNDnKzRWTo6Q0iLdDLMs.jpg','2004-12-10',90,'Released','The story of the search for the beginning of time.','Hawking',34843,2.2744,7.1,'PFCnp70cyp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19037,_binary '\0','/ya7pQHMp57aJAbNu6e5HaJLqvQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395584',6.7,111930,'en','The Devil\'s Rejects','The murderous, backwoods Firefly family take to the road to escape the vengeful Sheriff Wydell, who is not afraid of being as ruthless as his target.','/drZz4AuI7trq6BxlH9Xa4v4O0Pb.jpg','2005-07-22',111,'Released','This summer, go to hell.','The Devil\'s Rejects',1696,7.0036,6.7,'rK6HXh9zRdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19038,_binary '\0','/yNEIo4uwh1vP2yZ8Y23UmNlitpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395585',5.3,11542,'en','House of 9','Nine strangers wake up in a house with no recollection how they got there and no way out. The voice on the PA introduces them to a grisly game they must play. The prize is $5 million and their life.','/3WHQlgb9aKMu35K5UC0DTlUd37n.jpg','2005-06-19',86,'Released','Nine Strangers. One House. Only One Will Get Out... Alive.','House of 9',19166,2.3894,5.1,'Pl0GnMDdEF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19039,_binary '\0','/y1wd7YlAmYVnS45x2kK9ryydixM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395644',7.7,2352,'en','Louis Theroux: Louis and the Nazis','Louis Theroux travels to California to meet the man dubbed \"the most dangerous racist in America\"; Tom Metzger. Louis meets him, his family and his publicity manager as well as following him to skinhead rallies and on a visit to Mexico.','/pQVY432slrJMDCvX7eH00yssQeK.jpg','2003-12-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Louis and the Nazis',171711,1.4296,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19040,_binary '\0','/sIbZYC9Va7A6ShINccE13SGMDyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395669',2.3,2875,'en','Miss Cast Away and the Island Girls','A plane carrying beauty contestants crash lands on a deserted island. Captain Maximus Powers and co-pilot Mike Saunders have to take care of their passengers, while avoiding the dangers of Jurassic Pork (a giant prehistoric pig) and a group of apes busy trying to relaunch Noah\'s Ark.','/zzjutZ0Zkg4LF0oozsOR1nzYY9V.jpg','2004-11-10',90,'Released','There\'s trouble in paradise.','Miss Cast Away and the Island Girls',31389,2.3146,2.8,'TdADMVrKo_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19041,_binary '\0','/u7brIZ1clOun8Mc5x2Au6NScMxg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395677',6,3402,'ko','내 사랑 싸가지','After being dumped by her boyfriend just before their 100-day anniversary, Ha-young meets a college guy named Hyung-joon when she kicks a can that accidentally hits him in the face and causes him to scratch his Lexus. He demands she pay him $3000 on the spot.','/4kTS3R0NR7Y5t1OpIuVWURlFYBF.jpg','2004-01-16',95,'Released',NULL,'100 Days with Mr. Arrogant',16632,2.4374,6.469,'n91eG9d7d6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19042,_binary '\0','/p0HdiQZVYylWy5JG8iuwzT1Ssdl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395699',5.6,108066,'en','The Pacifier','Navy SEAL Shane Wolfe is handed a new assignment: Protect the five Plummer kids from enemies of their recently deceased father -- a government scientist whose top-secret experiment remains hidden in the kids\' house.','/ayVLPibrtazh7U5FliWRLDMmG3d.jpg','2005-03-04',95,'Released','Welcome to the infantry.','The Pacifier',10022,13.3854,6.1,'pknw1wh-2-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19043,_binary '\0','/LvUuVoSUbvB6hDjpr8yTQrKZTE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395802',5.8,1971,'hi','वीरगति','A gangster and his flunkies abduct and kill a man\'s daughter. Soon, the man\'s adopted son sets out to avenge her death.','/xYAS6hnxZvqUpkHoDX0FbbLnp78.jpg','1995-09-29',165,'Released',NULL,'Veergati',71833,1.1812,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19044,_binary '\0','/8854djFI4gmNYdL51JLsnuGpfPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395824',7.4,1711,'tr','Yusuf ile Kenan','When their father is killed in a blood feud, Yusuf and Kenan, two shepherd boys, flee to Istanbul in search of their uncle. They become involved with the streetboys, and Yusuf turns to crime although Kenan wants to learn a trade.','/hZqY42rRnZ4mxnG2RLU8KASy8iz.jpg','1979-01-02',80,'Released',NULL,'Yusuf and Kenan',285163,1.1362,7.37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19045,_binary '\0','/mZbc7nYK7YKcyUeODDr1zozJvj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395947',5.2,2005,'de','Back to Gaya','The beautiful world of Gaya is home to two similar humanoid species: Zeldons who are the furry majority residents, and Snurks, who are goblin-like outcasts. But suddenly all Gayans are facing imminent danger when a magic stone which protects their world, \"the Dalamite\", is beamed away by a mysterious force. Three Snurks immediately go after it, hoping to be the heroes for once. They are shortly followed by some standout Zeldons: Zino the trouble-prone popular guy & his sidekick, clever but somewhat cowardly inventor Boo, as well as rebel princess Alanta. Their journey ends up leading them all on a dangerous interdimensional quest to find the stone, while they must also figure out a way to get back to Gaya.','/daqf0AgiiBAzbOyEJMn3LPr8HbZ.jpg','2004-03-18',91,'Released',NULL,'Back to Gaya',10927,2.8322,5.3,'yLmj28mnaBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19046,_binary '\0','/6rgiRuLHn65d3qalkc7YjrtmDQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0395972',7.3,47988,'en','North Country','A fictionalized account of the first major successful sexual harassment case in the United States — Jenson vs. Eveleth Mines, where a woman who endured a range of abuse while working as a miner filed and won the landmark 1984 lawsuit.','/upxUN4zmX79o49mBW9htKZDeNq7.jpg','2005-02-12',126,'Released','All she wanted was to make a living... Instead she made history.','North Country',9701,7.444,7.3,'urVRa7mBsso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19047,_binary '\0','/oiHsOdDElXUPfAkgus8XRhIF0W8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396032',4.6,1822,'en','Getting Played','Three smart and sexy friends, Andrea, Lauren and Emily, are fed up with being played by the men in their lives. To prove that all men are predictable and easily seduced, this hot trio decides to play by a new set of rules. They enter into a wild game of seduction to convince one lucky man that he\'s living the dream... but what the girls don\'t realize is their mark is on to their game and he\'s got a few plays of his own. Can the girls win? Or, will this player\'s double play end their game?','/3bK0BRVyO96qe5BOI3Lla0E9oko.jpg','2005-12-10',81,'Released','The rules are about to change.','Getting Played',18307,2.0863,6,'QF52Q5Q6RAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19048,_binary '\0','/rUCnMIMnmrxi2o6elIZcWjEScwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396042',5.4,2982,'en','The Ugly Duckling and Me!','The Hans Christian Anderson tale gets a new treatment, this time with a rat trying to exploit the talents of a little ugly duckling for profit.','/RVAn63xJZARpMy8wGAA2LSF8DH.jpg','2006-09-10',90,'Released',NULL,'The Ugly Duckling and Me!',13517,4.5753,5.5,'lVwxn-UJ284','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19049,_binary '\0','/iYdLijckRi33dQ45VQeEkGP0Ctc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396096',4.3,1303,'en','Pit Fighter','Jack Severino has no memory, all he knows is the brutal sport of Pit Fighting. When his past catches him up, he realizes he is not who he thought he was. For some men must fight for redemption.','/8Sy48J8CqpmMu0YLqhNhNejMSQp.jpg','2005-07-06',83,'Released',NULL,'Pit Fighter',35631,2.8439,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19050,_binary '\0','/kvdy0Ijjo2r9qsnWV4Dzx07qwnc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396171',7.5,281003,'en','Perfume: The Story of a Murderer','Jean-Baptiste Grenouille, born in the stench of 18th century Paris, develops a superior olfactory sense, which he uses to create the world\'s finest perfumes. However, his work takes a dark turn as he tries to preserve scents in the search for the ultimate perfume.','/2wrFrUej8ri5EpjgIkjKTAnr686.jpg','2006-09-13',147,'Released','Obsession can cause the unthinkable.','Perfume: The Story of a Murderer',1427,13.1875,7.375,'zutiIw_2e2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19051,_binary '\0','/2MG8bwkkvypszwWa2oLlSmcgqJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396184',7.3,30276,'da','Pusher II','Tonny is released from prison - again. This time he has his mind set on changing his broken down life, but that is easier said than done.','/qxvyw5NZBphzWliVdSzn7gSxUel.jpg','2004-12-25',100,'Released','With blood on my hands.','Pusher II',11328,5.2527,7.2,'BcFcDPWysEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19052,_binary '\0','/zYhtledBfkAn4QgljNjNep8YDfd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396190',6.3,2634,'en','Return to Sender','While fighting for a woman who sits on death row, a lawyer happens upon new information which brings into question the motives of a man asso