sed','They\'re young, sexy and fully loaded.','Hardcore',42318,1.2399,5.6,'ICD9s6dy3aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19060,_binary '\0','/k7dNmXtZeJVpvdoljSFRwpcCYPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396652',6.1,31965,'en','Ice Princess','With the help of her coach, her mom, and the boy who drives the Zamboni, nothing can stop Casey Carlyle from realizing her dream to be a champion figure skater.','/ptOO4Or8KyB4k3BRyyUvAPJCfYe.jpg','2005-03-17',98,'Released','Big things happen to those who dream big.','Ice Princess',13374,13.9955,6.442,'jYfssnIBaAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19061,_binary '\0','/xPdUja2zYYDr148tpmxs56dpvWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396659',7.6,2641,'ja','映画犬夜叉 天下覇道の剣','Inuyasha and his brother, Sesshomaru, each inherited a sword from their father after his death. However, their father had a third sword, named Sounga, that he sealed away. Seven hundreds years after his death, Sounga awakens and threatens mankind\'s very existence. How will the children of the Great Dog Demon stop this unimaginable power?','/cUqC1pHXFhow0kSJbg4e77EcuxQ.jpg','2003-12-20',99,'Released','The Three Swords of the Fang collide in an epic battle!','Inuyasha the Movie 3: Swords of an Honorable Ruler',34295,3.4826,7.71,'tyqA2Dhcl-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19062,_binary '\0','/z32qfa3XfKzDvIe73epuaqUtijk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396688',6.6,7650,'en','The King','When Elvis Valderez is honourably discharged from the Navy, he heads to the small Texas town of Corpus Christi, where he introduces himself to Pastor David Sandow, his long-lost father, soon becoming a stalwart member of the church.','/936i1LOZJARcpCh3sdBch7wBXBx.jpg','2006-05-05',105,'Released','The devil made me do it.','The King',20021,1.7551,6,'-tmf73KmWro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19063,_binary '\0','/lX34o8XcV8sT7Gd3ddhb29AWflB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396690',4.6,1544,'hi','किस्ना','The film is set in the India of the tumultuous 1930\'s when nationalists fighting for the country\'s independence rose up as one, urging the British to quit. At this time, a young Indian, Kisna befriends and then shields a British girl Katherine, from an enraged mob of nationalists including Kisna\'s own uncle and brother. Katherine is the young daughter of a ruthless British collector. Kisna takes it upon himself to escort Katherine to the safety of the British High Commission in New Delhi, who will arrange for her to board a ship home. A tender attraction develops between Kisna and Katherine during the journey, a love story that is torn between \'Karma\' (the noble deed) and \'Dharma\' (the duty). Laxmi, the Indian girl Kisna is engaged to, forms the third point in an emotional triangle involving the Indo-British romantic pair','/b4homgKuE49RXW5d3aUW1C5bRtJ.jpg','2005-01-21',170,'Released','The Warrior Poet','Kisna',78701,2.9442,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19064,_binary '\0','/wdpebYdOMtUJpfYZsUei07wOfuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396707',6.1,12264,'en','The Secret of Moonacre','When 13 year old Maria Merryweather\'s father dies, leaving her orphaned and homeless, she is forced to leave her luxurious London life to go and live with Sir Benjamin, an eccentric uncle she didn\'t know she had, at the mysterious Moonacre Manor.','/1ZdwKhauiCgIxulUme63JjejpTS.jpg','2009-02-06',103,'Released','A magical journey begins.','The Secret of Moonacre',18032,5.4572,6.6,'3k06AHWgOqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19065,_binary '\0','/sUB0tLwARo6rII1dJ8HoQ7uHPjj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396746',7.2,2785,'de','Muxmäuschenstill','A pseudo documentary study of an archetypal German who tries to model his world according to his ideas of law and (sexual) order.','/hSY9J3wAio50hjpmM2xsLQnOhkR.jpg','2004-01-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Quiet as a Mouse',4896,1.4687,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19066,_binary '\0','/ijmKdhQQ86L18ZUywjHjM7h7YgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396752',6.6,92805,'en','Nanny McPhee','Widower Cedric Brown hires Nanny McPhee to care for his seven rambunctious children, who have chased away all previous nannies. Taunted by Simon and his siblings, Nanny McPhee uses mystical powers to instill discipline. And when the children\'s great-aunt and benefactor, Lady Adelaide Stitch, threatens to separate the kids, the family pulls together under the guidance of Nanny McPhee.','/8tommndfI0W62teXwSmXdmVZ7gz.jpg','2005-10-21',97,'Released','You\'ll learn to love her. Warts and all.','Nanny McPhee',11283,11.2779,6.7,'rA9R6oustLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19067,_binary '\0','/dbxm1Po8G6FQb1a7ww3LrJgSwBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396818',6.6,2095,'it','Primo amore','Vittorio is looking for a woman who matches his ideal. Through a classified ad he meets Sonia, a sweet, pleasant, intelligent girl. However, she weighs 125 pounds -- which according to Vittorio is way too much. A goldsmith by trade, Vittorio is obsessed with the desire to shape Sonia\'s body and mind as does a fire with gold. Almost imperceptibly Sonia becomes a passive participant and the relationship grows into a reciprocal masochistic game. When the two lovers isolate themselves in a country house in the Veneto hills, they dangerously lose touch with reality and the rest of the world.','/9c45ndIEI1zIkiiRCiflYSuSJX4.jpg','2004-02-13',100,'Released',NULL,'First Love',62495,2.4628,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19068,_binary '\0','/mvHwxn2AZNej9CLLnbTFcHrN5kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396857',5.5,7120,'en','Shadowboxer','Mikey and Rose are professional assassins. They are also lovers, and once upon a time Rose also knew Mikey\'s father. During an elaborate hit job for a malicious gangster, Rose fails to kill the main target, the gangster\'s pregnant girlfriend. Instead, she delivers her baby and convinces Mikey to help her protect them both. As Rose weakens from cancer, Mikey becomes breadwinner for this unusual family. But tranquility will not last.','/eqXOZ5a3q8AAM8jvNaVQC8PAILk.jpg','2005-09-09',93,'Released','Feeling Protected Is Very Seductive','Shadowboxer',9921,2.0431,5.1,'GrsbEEt2BIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19069,_binary '\0','/AaxHKIvqk9hSmioQGZ3EuPGpHTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0396962',8.2,1719,'mr','श्वास','This story follows an old man who, while facing the insurmountable challenge of cancer, strives to show his grandson the profound beauty and value of life. It highlights the power of maintaining a positive outlook, even in the darkest times.','/6FgJ3PDXE955djB25zKz23fyko9.jpg','2004-12-10',107,'Released',NULL,'Shwaas',116753,0.7027,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19070,_binary '\0','/wHzR9AzN9ePToQbCsz0ZZPpzWZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397044',5.3,18901,'en','Blood and Chocolate','A young teenage werewolf is torn between honoring her family\'s secret and her love for a man.','/mzNe2RAZi19Uk1eqj8fE9oPkP1d.jpg','2007-01-26',98,'Released','The hunt never tasted so sweet.','Blood and Chocolate',10075,3.5874,5.616,'jDvS856hLms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19071,_binary '\0','/2J7re6BvXXxLFXCYZpTUmRKkTHn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397065',5.5,147728,'en','House of Wax','A group of unwitting teens are stranded near a strange wax museum and soon must fight to survive and keep from becoming the next exhibit.','/aCLSgw1DaqkRvosYc3YUttBTtpT.jpg','2005-05-05',113,'Released','Prey. Slay. Display.','House of Wax',10066,11.086,6.043,'ezUtqfB24Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19072,_binary '\0','/tBLg1E9bQa7drOFZqQQLoNFfHqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397078',5.5,66784,'en','Just My Luck','Manhattanite Ashley is known to many as the luckiest woman around. After a chance encounter with a down-and-out young man, however, she realizes that she\'s swapped her fortune for his.','/wWpqG3zrrPZhvNLflYJdbW1NgY3.jpg','2006-05-12',103,'Released','Everything changed in the wink of an eye.','Just My Luck',10025,8.7224,6.2,'ZnR2KrXcovM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19073,_binary '\0','/23ZwzaqO5dAWHa3HpDaG9ThYmdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397101',6.5,133298,'en','The Skeleton Key','A hospice nurse working at a spooky New Orleans plantation home finds herself entangled in a mystery involving the house\'s dark past.','/wHmubdzrVw8oq7htzrf364wsJNp.jpg','2005-07-29',104,'Released','Fearing is believing.','The Skeleton Key',9913,10.4021,6.625,'654uzrc6Lsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19074,_binary '\0','/gR2yVX6tDLBlDYByapgiOUWUMxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397113',5.8,1876,'en','Tiger Cruise','On its last leg homeward, from Pearl Harbor, Hawaii to San Diego, the USS Constellation hosts a jolly \"tiger cruise\" for US Navy, Marines and USNAF relatives, mainly minors (\"Navy brats\"). Attitudes and emotions vary from simple joy to open frustration, the worst brat being XO commander Gary Dolan\'s daughter Maddie, who wants him to refuse a promotion to command for a shore job. Then the news of the WCC terror crisis changes everything, as the crew is recalled to war footing.','/oltUNC3hNkxoHtSuHkSkhCfm5rJ.jpg','2004-08-06',88,'Released','Maddie wanted a father. She found a hero.','Tiger Cruise',51909,2.751,6.049,'Fn_eQE8JyHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19075,_binary '\0','/v97TKVQS7Bgzrqy596Qg5xHVRr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397229',6.6,1410,'cn','20 30 40','A woman in her 20s, another in her 30s and a third in her 40s must each find a way to navigate the challenges they face in life and love.','/rTxFPjjB4WGJ1b2y8I3QnAHBxUy.jpg','2004-03-05',113,'Released','They were looking for love... but they found each other.','20 30 40',76275,1.6971,5.6,'TflJhBlqcmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19076,_binary '\0','/1GAEBLa8EmA9d8l0s8gHB2zxWLq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397313',7.3,72206,'en','Eight Below','In the Antarctic, after an expedition with Dr. Davis McClaren, the sled dog trainer Jerry Shepherd has to leave the polar base with his colleagues due to the proximity of a heavy snow storm. He ties his dogs to be rescued after, but the mission is called-off and the dogs are left alone at their own fortune. For six months, Jerry tries to find a sponsor for a rescue mission.','/39hR806Me4wI42LCFcK2LBiCRGW.jpg','2006-02-17',120,'Released','The Most Amazing Story Of Survival, Friendship, And Adventure Ever Told.','Eight Below',9036,10.8824,7.037,'HRQ1JeRieCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19077,_binary '\0','/kE1wEeZxNlHiOiknZyrYyTFS4ZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397401',4.8,2985,'en','Drop Dead Sexy','When their money scam runs aground, a group of would-be thieves turn to kidnapping in an attempt to blackmail their target.','/pIsp5FUgPGJdQT6jVKtjQ94puz.jpg','2005-03-12',83,'Released','Small time crooks... Big time idiots!','Drop Dead Sexy',21791,2.8969,4.9,'rfN4ZSoWh1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19078,_binary '\0','/jCGSQaP5Ny6EgCbt0devxd9q7DF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397430',4.5,2260,'en','Frankenstein','An investigation into a serial killer leads two detectives to discover that Dr. Frankenstein and his creature are still alive after two centuries of genetic experiments.','/gmeccZOjv2l12NM7dTjHXTYHaC4.jpg','2004-10-09',88,'Released','Someone new is playing God.','Frankenstein',3056,1.6299,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19079,_binary '\0','/jm4eiprHo37I5Dy63c4RJM2Rm7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397530',6.5,2202,'en','Man to Man','An epic about anthropologists who hunt and capture pygmies for study back in Europe, in an attempt to illustrate the link between man and ape.','/3eV6ZfUZOa3MyQX0bDEeUjSmy3O.jpg','2005-04-13',122,'Released',NULL,'Man to Man',10087,2.5296,6.3,'gm87tGzbAc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19080,_binary '\0','/zJDnqXtGNHUmexiaWNa52Vslve5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397535',7.3,174163,'en','Memoirs of a Geisha','In the years before World War II, a penniless Japanese child is torn from her family to work as a maid in a geisha house.','/pBwYsQaSTgnPphIy02DJjCF2cqs.jpg','2005-12-06',146,'Released','A story like mine has never been told.','Memoirs of a Geisha',1904,10.6025,7.637,'NwJw70Yufug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19081,_binary '\0','/lvWOPNKEKEFDUfYyWOz62N2T2D9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397619',7,14541,'ko','사마리아','Jae-Young is an amateur prostitute who sleeps with men while her best friend Yeo-Jin \"manages\" her, fixing dates, taking care of the money, and making sure the coast is clear. When Jae-Young falls in love with one of those men, she suppresses her feelings towards him in respect of her friend who\'s jealous.','/w0cn9vwzkheuCT2a2MStdnadOyh.jpg','2004-03-05',96,'Released','Let him that is without sin first cast the stone at her','Samaritan Girl',1279,3.1265,6.921,'HfVOGAc9H4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19082,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397882',4.6,2011,'hi','अब तुम्हारे हवाले वतन साथियो','All Maj. Amarjeet Singh wants is for his grandson Kunal to be as noble and brave as Amarjeet and the boy\'s father, Vikramjeet. But Kunal has other plans and does not wish to follow in his father\'s and grandfather\'s military legacies. Reluctantly, Kunal gives in and joins the army and ends up falling for Shweta, the widow of a fallen soldier. When the man later turns up alive, will Shweta return to him or stay with her new love?','/2l0a5q0BHUK7mheDbcjPCfhlGJS.jpg','2004-12-24',192,'Released','An unusual journey of love','Ab Tumhare Hawale Watan Saathiyo',177360,1.2206,5.136,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19083,_binary '\0','/zWqxBc6pdSIjklqWfZ70l5ce28P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0397892',6.8,251275,'en','Bolt','Bolt is the star of the biggest show in Hollywood. The only problem is, he thinks it\'s real. After he\'s accidentally shipped to New York City and separated from Penny, his beloved co-star and owner, Bolt must harness all his \"super powers\" to find a way home.','/v5aC4nrzXFGJDWY4JO1eengXzqk.jpg','2008-11-21',98,'Released','Fully Awesome.','Bolt',13053,13.5438,6.554,'SElF6TVhzhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19084,_binary '\0','/yhx8DtHySbvIm19wurVttyXCTTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398017',6.6,79415,'en','Derailed','When two married business executives having an affair are blackmailed by a violent criminal, they are forced to turn the tables on him to save their families.','/bcCoOkwEBHUS5Y7Rm1u1oTLUHdb.jpg','2005-11-11',108,'Released','They never saw it coming.','Derailed',8999,7.4718,6.4,'84mGKTTv5Gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19085,_binary '\0','/AzFcxCHZlftO0aZTSnjGI6rGhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398027',6.3,19599,'en','Down in the Valley','On a trip to the beach, a teenage girl named Tobe meets a charismatic stranger named Harlan, who dresses like a cowboy and claims to be a former ranch hand. The pair feel an instant attraction and begin a relationship, but her father, a lawman, is suspicious of her lover.','/qgyp48naq0W7j4NbOttFi91DlYW.jpg','2005-05-13',112,'Released','Sometimes it\'s hard to find your way.','Down in the Valley',7870,3.9276,5.9,'Uuz6SrxywFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19086,_binary '\0','/79RY04WZpGCrfw4M3Rdjio9iTTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398029',4.5,2710,'en','The Last Drop','Different factions in WWII-era Holland race to find a stash of Nazi gold.','/uMzMmrzi0ATCICWlszQOm1OMJjG.jpg','2006-04-13',103,'Released','The fog of war... what better time for a robbery?','The Last Drop',2911,2.3333,4.2,'yrOJd0s5m2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19087,_binary '\0','/63V4wbVah1gnjckPJnSU0ZmOGAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398165',6.4,214052,'en','The Longest Yard','Disgraced pro football quarterback Paul Crewe lands in a Texas federal penitentiary, where manipulative Warden Hazen recruits him to advise the institution\'s football team of prison guards. Crewe suggests a tune-up game which lands him quarterbacking a crew of inmates in a game against the guards. Aided by incarcerated ex-NFL coach and player Nate Scarborough, Crewe and his team must overcome not only the bloodthirstiness of the opposition, but also the corrupt warden trying to fix the game against them.','/nbKcVBcxF96ARW2oKHqDYAcLdu.jpg','2005-05-27',113,'Released','If you can\'t get out, get even.','The Longest Yard',9291,12.9492,6.7,'Cl--Ye9pmAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19088,_binary '\0','/byrOFofc8Bs3PxmXBkeTYzr0QE9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398237',6.1,2067,'hu','Nyócker!','In an effort to end family feuding, a young gypsy travels back in time to kill mammoths to ensure Hungary becomes rich by killing mammoths in order to create a massive oil reservoir. Things don\'t go entirely according to plan...','/jUJ86PzGZFMkJWcw8u9o33eAtc8.jpg','2004-12-09',87,'Released',NULL,'The District',29004,2.236,5.1,'7ZOL7FzPCwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19089,_binary '\0','/cWczNud8Y8i8ab0Z4bxos4myWYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398286',7.7,554050,'en','Tangled','Feisty teenager Rapunzel, who has long and magical hair, wants to go and see sky lanterns on her eighteenth birthday, but she\'s bound to a tower by her overprotective mother. She strikes a deal with Flynn Rider, a charming wanted thief, and the duo set off on an action-packed escapade.','/ym7Kst6a4uodryxqbGOxmewF235.jpg','2010-11-24',100,'Released','They\'re taking adventure to new lengths.','Tangled',38757,30.0843,7.617,'2f516ZLyC6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19090,_binary '\0','/aDgysYfiPZBgGSaOjxYooYSvNxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398373',4.8,2870,'cn','千機變II花都大戰','Set in Flower Capital, a land ruled by an Evil Queen. All men in the kingdom are slaves to women. However, a prophecy foretells that one day, the Star of Rex will find and wield a mythical sword, rise to power, overthrow the queen, and restore the balance of the two sexes.','/4UNGA2zrHgHmQQ8LY7S8uEKL3Dv.jpg','2004-08-12',106,'Released','Their strength will defy an empire.','The Twins Effect II',10257,4.2987,5.3,'McqJFP6y0DU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19091,_binary '\0','/vL1HcSiY83UCnqXo7zeeVA2WYIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398375',5.5,66235,'en','Rumor Has It...','Sarah Huttinger learns that her family was the inspiration for the book and film \"The Graduate\" -- and that she just might be the offspring of the well-documented event.','/ypirKAqugrpevnEqMJxkBoIlgco.jpg','2005-12-22',97,'Released','Based on a true rumor.','Rumor Has It...',2800,9.533,5.7,'QWYqikq6YuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19092,_binary '\0','/pzvclGZcAUS4YMHZaBxiMLL7rFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398563',6,1548,'ja','スカイハイ 劇場版','A serial-murderer is on the loose who just so happens to also be removing the hearts of his victims and taking them with him. His victims however, are not merely random humans as thought by the police. They are in fact, the past and present guardians of the gateway of the afterlife.On the day he is to be married, Detective Kanzaki, who happens to be on the case, discovers that his fiancé Mina has been murdered with her heart also missing. He also learns that the killers are Kudo, a geneticist, and his evil secretary Rei. The two are trying to obtain six hearts from the guardians so that they may call forth a horde of demons from the Gate of Rage and have their every desire granted. Only problem is, once they open the gate the entire world will be covered in darkness.','/7zpyHnfykViMlE0x5gREq0X2yqc.jpg','2003-12-05',122,'Released',NULL,'Sky High',5846,1.4312,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19093,_binary '\0','/2c0Ls3EwFoWJWVqWuaMyCUAgmzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398712',6.3,84969,'en','Assault on Precinct 13','On New Year\'s Eve, inside a police station that\'s about to be closed for good, officer Jake Roenick must cobble together a force made up cops and criminals to save themselves from a mob looking to kill mobster Marion Bishop.','/oBpsRvMN1ONl8oFHuWt1rasDYFJ.jpg','2005-01-19',109,'Released','Unite and fight.','Assault on Precinct 13',8978,9.8224,6.2,'Tcoi_b1hMc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19094,_binary '\0','/o4mQHoP8LExn2Q9dn16OGqHvaiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398808',7.2,194620,'en','Bridge to Terabithia','Jesse Aarons trained all summer to become the fastest runner in school. So he\'s very upset when newcomer Leslie Burke outruns him and everyone else. Despite this and other differences including that she\'s rich, he\'s poor, she\'s a city girl, and he\'s a country boy the two become fast friends. Together they create Terabithia, a land of monsters, trolls, ogres, and giants where they rule as king and queen.','/ieIoNyJvtwQ6joyG6npTKxnCtGH.jpg','2007-02-15',95,'Released','Discover a place that will never leave you, and a friendship that will change you forever.','Bridge to Terabithia',1265,39.6834,7.353,'T2TDSEG57hI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19095,_binary '\0','/ywtfwXB7ypXq7BziGvpA1keu8PY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398839',3.7,1415,'en','Cattle Call','A guy starts a fake casting agency in hopes that he will meet his soul mate.','/e6aZjWuMaQwQ7R5mazmaPO5zgAP.jpg','2006-06-01',83,'Released','The casting couch just got caught.','Cattle Call',18404,2.121,4.1,'r1iuTFvNkpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19096,_binary '\0','/fvY93fnx6QR9moPqGC9lDlw2GAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398842',4.9,4230,'en','The Celestine Prophecy','A spiritual adventure film chronicling the discovery of ancient scrolls in the rainforests of Peru. The prophecy and its nine key insights predict a worldwide awakening, arising within all religious traditions, that moves humanity toward a deeper experience of spirituality.','/hI6gIW203lNGSF9qzoqQEuYjpEP.jpg','2006-06-01',99,'Released','The book that changed our lives is now a movie','The Celestine Prophecy',18524,3.0427,5.177,'efk7ImHv0-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19097,_binary '\0','/6SRoBPlzXUasFegwnY0s4hbpqJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398883',7.4,20928,'it','Le conseguenze dell\'amore','Lugano, Switzerland. Titta Di Girolamo is a discreet and sullen man who has been living for almost a decade in a modest hotel room, a prisoner of an atrocious routine, apparently without purpose. His past is a mystery, nobody knows what he does for a living, he answers indiscreet questions evasively. What secrets does this enigmatic man hide?','/2ubdrvMHcRTFzkUdmSIuvupLqRS.jpg','2004-09-24',100,'Released','Everyone has a dark secret','The Consequences of Love',24653,2.9455,7.5,'RihHjY1-_gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19098,_binary '\0','/wa5eEBwjI01yhNMKPwIaqeBiw2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398913',4.8,48187,'en','DOA: Dead or Alive','Four beautiful rivals at an invitation-only martial-arts tournament join forces against a sinister threat. Princess Kasumi is an aristocratic warrior trained by martial-arts masters. Tina Armstrong is a wrestling superstar. Helena Douglas is an athlete with a tragic past. Christie Allen earns her keep as a thief and an assassin-for-hire.','/hRcYqTWgbPF3TtpSDfwqRDAJjlv.jpg','2006-09-07',87,'Released','They\'re the ultimate fighters. They\'ve got the looks. They\'ve got the moves, and the men fall at their feet.','DOA: Dead or Alive',9053,9.7231,5.3,'eZCoTTV40qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19099,_binary '\0','/tFkQEVrkPDEESliKFWUdWgMHmaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398963',6.7,2514,'en','Dorian Blues','Dorian realizes he is gay in his final year of high school. He meets another gay youth locally, but remains confused. He starts therapy, then resorts to confession in the Church, and finally comes out to his brother. Dorian then decides to come out to his father; he gets kicked out of the house.','/nZfhoKWz6BpVQ1Puzpot7aG03v7.jpg','2005-09-23',88,'Released','School\'s out and so is Dorian.','Dorian Blues',32444,2.0641,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19100,_binary '\0','/nlo59j1q4lZCCIox8J7Ea1ivihM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0398982',6.5,2432,'en','Duane Hopwood','A down-on-his-luck divorced father struggles to get his life and family back together before it\'s too late.','/AmWM5EcFuLUOrklT0f0wKnNIHwa.jpg','2005-11-11',84,'Released','When the odds are against you, your best bet is a second chance...','Duane Hopwood',26907,1.4184,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19101,_binary '\0','/gCooYpd8UaJlSkzo4eDpMDovHPj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399040',7.9,2616,'th','แฟนฉัน','Jeab, a young man working in Bangkok, receives word that his childhood sweetheart, Noi-Naa is to be married. While driving back to his hometown, the memories from his childhood come flooding back.','/A2bnH1j5kOw0GvABqhMcE1AXsrf.jpg','2003-10-03',114,'Released','I was 10. She was also 10, We grew up together and she was my first love.','My Girl',18486,1.4469,7.9,'yU6ioogL1Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19102,_binary '\0','/5t7zGnOTe9qIAuwuSE4nbs39M3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399095',7.3,18999,'en','Trade','A Texas cop, whose own daughter might have been forced into sexual slavery, joins forces with a Mexican youth to find the boy\'s sister, who was abducted and forced into prostitution. Meanwhile, a Polish woman who was promised a better life in America also becomes a victim.','/x2ckiEGoYz2AomOeviEPqnhrw7Q.jpg','2007-01-23',120,'Released','Each year, more than 1,000,000 people are trafficked across international borders... against their will.','Trade',4170,2.9967,7,'hO80W0tpYx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19103,_binary '\0','/irLLP6uZRB10P4bCGZMzlGB5p6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399102',6.3,10965,'ja','ゴジラ ファイナルウォーズ','Humanity finally rids themselves of Godzilla, imprisoning him in an icy tomb in the South Pole. All is peaceful until various monsters emerge to lay waste to Earth\'s cities. Overwhelmed, humanity is seemingly saved by a race of benevolent aliens known as Xiliens. But not all is what it seems with these bizarre visitors. If humanity wishes to survive, they must reluctantly resurrect their most hated enemy, Godzilla.','/21lWA4YyYppVnwAPOiBkGrt2FGr.jpg','2004-12-04',125,'Released','Farewell, Godzilla.','Godzilla: Final Wars',15767,5.5003,7.1,'rXNM802ip-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19104,_binary '\0','/bMb1mgcVucuez6xUN8FE6PIVEFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399104',6.6,1751,'en','Going to the Mat','Jace Newfield has a problem. Besides being blind and being the new kid at school, his problem is that the kids at his new school thinks he\'s a jerk. Jace has to find a way to be accepted into his new school. Joining the wrestling team just might work.','/lCETZz4SBfIBdidCTcRozR37DF4.jpg','2004-03-24',96,'Released','There\'s more to winning than meets the eye.','Going to the Mat',122987,2.8579,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19105,_binary '\0','/iZHJsUYxhjI6kbooHoQRWXv6F8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399146',7.4,277214,'en','A History of Violence','An average family is thrust into the spotlight after the father commits a seemingly self-defense murder at his diner.','/ptJKY9WGDUUL064ge3jW78zBX0t.jpg','2005-09-23',96,'Released','Tom Stall had the perfect life...until he became a hero.','A History of Violence',59,9.2147,7.164,'jsEcDGKh56U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19106,_binary '\0','/zZZ1FDl5FPClZ9OnMrlaPA4Iuxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399201',6.8,345081,'en','The Island','In 2019, Lincoln Six-Echo is a resident of a seemingly \"Utopian\" but contained facility. Like all of the inhabitants of this carefully-controlled environment, Lincoln hopes to be chosen to go to The Island — reportedly the last uncontaminated location on the planet. But Lincoln soon discovers that everything about his existence is a lie.','/9MaZYEyFmQwNeDTxZGQEN8E0e4p.jpg','2005-07-21',136,'Released','Your time will come...','The Island',1635,13.3011,6.694,'pZsDzeJh4nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19107,_binary '\0','/w70hJkM78ooUkQ6br4DQPdLEY5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399222',6,1333,'fr','Je préfère qu\'on reste amis…','The two friends Claude and Serge are fundamentally different in their temperament. Similarities arise only when they try to have a relationship with a woman, because both fail equally. While Claude is simply too shy to even start a relationship, let alone meet a woman, Serge is too jumpy to have a relationship. Together they go in search of the great love in all sorts of curious situations, from the self-help group on speed dating to wedding celebrations of strangers - in the hunt for the right woman, they are no way too far.','/gieCXEDWVb7DBfI3pXSmTzndisN.jpg','2005-02-23',100,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Be Friends',40192,1.7958,5.5,'jFCpUUffe_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19108,_binary '\0','/5HLNp2zEsXezVoXtOfLJE29xaUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399295',7.6,362803,'en','Lord of War','Yuri Orlov is a globetrotting arms dealer and, through some of the deadliest war zones, he struggles to stay one step ahead of a relentless Interpol agent, his business rivals and even some of his customers who include many of the world\'s most notorious dictators. Finally, he must also face his own conscience.','/3MGQD4yXokufNlW1AyRXdiy7ytP.jpg','2005-09-16',122,'Released','Where there\'s a will, there\'s a weapon.','Lord of War',1830,13.4394,7.348,'AL8jpJkKUnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19109,_binary '\0','/a4RWaNIeoRsrAwRFZpCsQoAa6ZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399327',5.6,27849,'en','The Man','A case of mistaken identity forces a Federal agent and a dental supply salesman to team up as they speed through the streets of Detroit to pull off a sting operation and solve the murder of the agent\'s former partner.','/bnofwLKvg2g7Ky9sSpyTHaan37n.jpg','2005-09-08',83,'Released','One guy walks the walk. The other talks and talks. Only one of them can be…','The Man',9074,3.941,5.847,'uKryYt2bWlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19110,_binary '\0','/i3pBf1iIdu2Yg7TCiCbe8lBUE7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399465',5.7,1297,'el','Οξυγόνο','In the small, closed community of a provincial town, Magda tries to maintain a balance within a family facing many serious problems. The families apparently normal, bourgeois, every-day life will crack open, bringing to the surface hatred and passions of the kind that lie well-hidden in the mists of the nearby lake. An intense plot and a totally unexpected ending make up this film, which features characters who are vulnerable, innocent and ordinary, but who become ruthless and callous, worrying only about protecting their financial resources. The offences are disproportionately serious compared to the financial benefits they try to secure','/i73bFZ84eIRQoClOash9nxOykyK.jpg','2003-11-14',100,'Released','Blackmail leads to murder in a small town.','Blackmail Boy',47960,1.0604,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19111,_binary '\0','/4gyvWxhq4gCZMCLgxolwV63vH0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399650',7,1663,'zh','手机','Follows the story of a television host who\'s hidden so much personal and secret information on his phone, that when it gets out, catastrophe strikes.','/vLdxjtu88sATLyT7qmqws22ditq.jpg','2003-12-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Cell Phone',79064,1.4571,6.089,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19112,_binary '\0','/46S7eqYhoQa35fpSxzvSRvG0YbI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399692',6.5,2529,'nl','Steve + Sky','A story about two struggling people who are trying to find their own place in the world. He is a small-time crook recently released from prison and she is a prostitute craving some love and affection. They find each other in an obscure part of Gent. Jean-Claude is responsible for their meeting ; he is also an ex-inmate who has just traded the low-life crime scene for life as a pimp. Will their love survive?','/o02dmQsFyDahHggOoLhNob5LUsh.jpg','2004-02-18',97,'Released','Beats of love... beats everything','Steve + Sky',85757,1.709,6.45,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19113,_binary '\0','/oEOwWlYlNmqJfYGJ9P30iYkgvuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399738',6.1,1879,'fr','Les temps qui changent','In Tangiers where he traveled for his work, a man finds the woman he loved, and attempts to revive their romance though it ended some 30 years earlier.','/cUF2Dbtsayn0q2KebksAzvbLlwN.jpg','2004-12-08',90,'Released','Can your first love also be your last?','Changing Times',38021,2.1202,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19114,_binary '\0','/3dFUmTCaPZJkbTT4BaHiEGgBrSp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399854',6.5,17585,'tr','Vizontele Tuuba','Guner Sernikli is a government official who, with his wife and their wheelchair bound daughter, has been assigned as the head librarian to this isolated province, virtually an exile since there is no library in the village. The family is warmly welcome, but these are the years of political anarchy and leftist/rightist clashes in big cities and the youth of the village inevitably follow the tides. They arrive in Vizontele, just as the situation is becoming really absurd. Guner brings wisdom; his daughter Tuba brings beauty, innocence and love. Some like the Mayor, Nazmi Dogan and crazy Emin appreciate these things but they are in the minority and confusion continues to reign. The story is based on the memories of writer-director Yılmaz Erdoğan of the last summer of his childhood in Hakkâri, Turkey in 1980.','/nUWLp3pTs7uDLcZl46eU4Sck1Zi.jpg','2004-01-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Vizontele Tuuba',92834,2.0782,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19115,_binary '\0','/ghbiFYjiPGH3s4mEv7O9qRGGcvk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399862',6.8,5676,'en','End of the Spear','\"End of the Spear\" is the story of Mincayani, a Waodani tribesman from the jungles of Ecuador. When five young missionaries, among them Jim Elliot and Nate Saint, are speared to death by the Waodani in 1956, a series of events unfold to change the lives of not only the slain missionaries\' families, but also Mincayani and his people.','/2jMM1cuF1FcxdPPdEJy8gquDmES.jpg','2005-10-24',108,'Released','Dare to Make Contact','End of the Spear',14120,3.2354,6.3,'JeEF_3J0ZY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19116,_binary '\0','/8UbudSoPEbbCUGDnj56TbDK0jYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399877',5.2,14151,'en','What the #$*! Do We (K)now!?','Amanda is a divorced woman who makes a living as a photographer. During the Fall of the year Amanda begins to see the world in new and different ways when she begins to question her role in life, her relationships with her career and men and what it all means. As the layers to her everyday experiences fall away insertions in the story with scientists, and philosophers and religious leaders impart information directly to an off-screen interviewer about academic issues, and Amanda begins to understand the basis to the quantum world beneath. During her epiphany as she considers the Great Questions raised by the host of inserted thinkers, she slowly comprehends the various inspirations and begins to see the world in a new way.','/ghoM9gorKvgAcqkSJ6TDQcsObWN.jpg','2004-04-23',109,'Released','It\'s time to get wise!','What the #$*! Do We (K)now!?',8357,3.773,5.3,'3QlZ5O8_bGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19117,_binary '\0','/tp3NtU9ul4YIZikQbnhuZ8teMTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0399934',4.6,2567,'en','Zombie Honeymoon','Zombie Honeymoon is a gore-soaked exploration of how far the boundaries of true love can be pushed without reaching a breaking point.','/uy1SqoVGXuH8G9QfMaeU9ZgqNv3.jpg','2004-10-23',83,'Released',NULL,'Zombie Honeymoon',25060,1.4994,4.9,'vAW9eypZjxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19118,_binary '\0','/hYj5nrBz6BO5lhNBfAME0nbpUT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400063',7.7,6591,'en','Sometimes in April','Two brothers are divided by marriage and fate during the 100 horrifying days of the 1994 Rwandan genocide.','/jDr1iXVPKSdzPMb1QeGwacEL9Vq.jpg','2005-02-17',140,'Released',NULL,'Sometimes in April',16374,2.9334,7.1,'XBAB1d8Gfg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19119,_binary '\0','/dnmj15zRtMzSl3YuMXb5WQvkpsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400156',5.4,1805,'da','Ambulancen','Two brothers commit a robbery to pay their dying mother\'s medical bills and are forced to steal an ambulance during their getaway. But, unbeknownst to them, the ambulance has a dying heart patient and a hospital intern in the back.','/mGyVx66TCiZGf7UKBvuCOePdjZQ.jpg','2005-07-15',75,'Released',NULL,'The Ambulance',15821,1.6577,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19120,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400172',2.3,3708,'en','Anus Magillicutty','When Anus Magillicutty\'s woman stops a would-be assassin, Anus is forced to interrupt his life of guzzling beer and women to dispose of the corpse. What starts as a simple chore quickly escalates into a darker plot of deceit and revenge where it seems even Satan himself is after Anus.','/yJ2M3a9fcvHFj9ToBJd8NxA4ol.jpg','2003-04-15',70,'Released','Tastes Great, Less Feeling!','Anus Magillicutty',32626,0.7537,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19121,_binary '\0','/2BCAKAno5MjKXAhLyo0Bc1XSF6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400234',8.4,26564,'hi','Black Friday','Bombs tear through Bombay in 1993, wreaking havoc and polarising the citizens. With perpetrators at large, the state launches a massive man-hunt to unmask the perpetrators behind these events.','/jzqsxRSmaYBwbXVMvqQ54fOljTD.jpg','2004-08-13',162,'Released','The shocking truth behind the \'93 Bombay blasts','Black Friday',28740,1.6488,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19122,_binary '\0','/AiCdYkIx3ITb0aO2yFxKd85mat0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400420',6.7,3293,'fr','Exils','One day Zano suggest a crazy idea to his companion Naïma: travel across France and Spain down to Algeria, where they might ultimately come to know the land their parents once had to flee.','/enhjywSKKDgdZZKhRp0iEWfJFZ5.jpg','2004-08-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Exiles',18497,1.8916,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19123,_binary '\0','/zt5slO9dVCtXSA2dWT14qtx2kT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400426',3.2,15824,'en','Far Cry','Jack Carver, a former member of the Special Forces takes the journalist Valerie Cardinal to an Island to visit her uncle Max who is working in a Military complex on the Island. As they arrive Valerie gets captured by the minions of Doctor Krüger. After the destruction of his boat Jack finds out about the true purpose of the Facilities on the Island, which is the creation of genetic soldiers.','/fOMM5tHlY6eBNnRYVttq9dU9Sqi.jpg','2008-10-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Far Cry',7916,3.188,3.708,'03ommmlfCNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19124,_binary '\0','/llZz64BIZcIyGnazveysBCFsPsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400435',7.2,6407,'en','The Five People You Meet In Heaven','On his 83rd birthday, Eddie, a war vet and a maintenance worker at the Ruby Pier amusement park, dies while trying to save a girl who is sitting under a falling ride. When he awakens in the afterlife, he encounters five people with ties to his corporeal existence who help him understand the meaning of his life.','/1fvMz3gy4YuqPDC5LotTWofFFcx.jpg','2004-12-05',132,'Released',NULL,'The Five People You Meet In Heaven',30698,2.8041,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19125,_binary '\0','/u6qrMY2PIzXwmydmKNHmVDFbjaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400497',5,54954,'en','Herbie Fully Loaded','Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin\' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.','/7lTfTZ8CDfXw09eAv3OOvsbCVgs.jpg','2005-06-19',101,'Released','Start your engines...','Herbie Fully Loaded',11451,10.6891,5.847,'K0aTcuB9IPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19126,_binary '\0','/qDEU8UwN07cz689uErkWtMlok0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400525',6.2,26050,'en','The Ice Harvest','A shady lawyer attempts a Christmas Eve crime, hoping to swindle the local mob out of some money. But his partner, a strip club owner, might have different plans for the cash.','/8N2X2u6nPoPEwRLIZbKacJw1xrC.jpg','2005-11-23',88,'Released','Thick Thieves. Thin Ice.','The Ice Harvest',9005,3.6347,5.942,'LJ3RRfGWHVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19127,_binary '\0','/4jjisaXPMBs4Lcmjr0r3S8biGjj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400538',5.4,1785,'da','Inkasso','A romantic comedy set in the world of gambling, debt collecting and professional boxing. Laura is an unlucky gambler with a huge debt, she crosses paths with Claus, a former boxer who now makes a living as a debt collector. Laura is cheating, scamming, and lying and eventually life catches up with her. Claus is trying to regain his self respect and start anew. Together, they make an awkward but very charming couple on the verge of love. It is a story about trust, friendship, new beginnings, getting a second chance and doing the right thing.','/BIE2Ky10POWt3lZCHmInrclpDe.jpg','2004-10-22',86,'Released',NULL,'The Collector',15931,0.9709,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19128,_binary '\0','/goqJMLqOM91n4OCsdDxKSmKHP4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400585',7.4,1683,'ml','വെട്ടം','Petty thief Gopi steals a chain, and in order to escape a police inspector, drops it in Veena\'s bag. Later, he tries to take it from her, but the chain is no longer there. He becomes a part of her plan to stop her boyfriend from marrying a rich tycoon’s daughter','/bSaRLe4YGiGLEx5Tkr9sHNmh2Aj.jpg','2004-08-20',161,'Released',NULL,'Vettam',285945,1.5769,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19129,_binary '\0','/oFC881a9O8JECb83oql8mjop4w1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400688',5.7,1879,'pl','Nigdy w życiu!','Judyta is a middle-aged housewife whose peaceful life suddenly falls apart due to divorce. But soon she finds the strength to carry on fighting for her happiness, a place in the sun and love of her life.','/42qTPvEu5JG766D1XfxdO8dWHep.jpg','2004-02-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Never in My Life!',143240,0.8629,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19130,_binary '\0','/wttDKH1WRXGpebDVzrqnVSdh15u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400717',6.1,115780,'en','Open Season','Boog, a domesticated 900lb. Grizzly bear finds himself stranded in the woods 3 days before Open Season. Forced to rely on Elliot, a fast-talking mule deer, the two form an unlikely friendship and must quickly rally other forest animals if they are to form a rag-tag army against the hunters.','/w5Lctmkc1yah215Luxmci4djaiW.jpg','2006-09-27',86,'Released','One fur all. All fur one.','Open Season',7484,13.8078,6.195,'YHQAL6s3Mk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19131,_binary '\0','/bEwxNeMdTd5hGMFNWOuV6sl1AtZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0400761',7.1,1859,'ja','クイール','A Labrador retriever named Quill begins specialized training as a guide dog from an early age, then the canine is paired with a blind man who is initially reluctant to rely on his new partner.','/97KHrHEnvVFGrhC5kupwqwcIHjv.jpg','2004-03-13',100,'Released','A dog\'s life is never as easy as it looks.','Quill: The Life of a Guide Dog',49258,1.8173,7,'x5aL5UtKrHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19132,_binary '\0','/h34IJUeyuQqjHTMbHDKpycw2Eaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401085',7.8,35293,'fr','C.R.A.Z.Y.','A young French Canadian, one of five boys in a conservative family in the 1960s and 1970s, struggles to reconcile his emerging identity with his father\'s values.','/AoFk3zmjnfSQC7LkE0aqkzZlOPZ.jpg','2005-05-27',126,'Released','Growing up in this family, you\'d have to be... C.R.A.Z.Y.','C.R.A.Z.Y.',11421,4.6402,7.5,'w1gSfxLtKSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19133,_binary '\0','/dXd7ulNaVyT42RcxSIXhP6RU67k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401088',6.8,1827,'en','3: The Dale Earnhardt Story','A biopic of NASCAR legend Dale Earnhardt, Sr., documenting the driver\'s career from his earliest days onward and also looking at the family he built along the way. Earnhardt\'s death in 2001 rocked the sport, but his seven championships and 76 wins made an impact on NASCAR forever.','/htyvtvpWgGjJarRKqrXkUpSIKKw.jpg','2004-12-11',92,'Released',NULL,'3: The Dale Earnhardt Story',30762,3.0185,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19134,_binary '\0','/aDnOZYUmfFM3vPzRe4f3Jlyepga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401089',6.5,1926,'ru','72 метра','The film begins in the 1980s Soviet Union. Two best friends, Orlov and Muravyev, are serving at the Black Sea Navy Base in Sevastopol, Crimea. Both fall in love with one beautiful girl Nelly, and their friendship suffers a first blow. Because she picks Muravyev, his friend Orlov struggles with an inferiority complex and becomes a secretive alcoholic. After the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991, both friends are transferred to the Northern Fleet on the Polar Ocean. One day their sub is performing a routine training. A disturbed WWII mine slowly moves on a collision course with the sub. A mighty blast knocks down everyone inside the wrecked sub, 72 meters below the sea level. Then ensues a nerve-racking struggle for survival.','/bT2SXcsgIBcN3hSOeZyxa4knUON.jpg','2004-02-12',117,'Released',NULL,'72 Meters',42952,1.1118,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19135,_binary '\0','/z85BQhs5WIQDnRVZC62b6zLsGIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401233',6.9,19063,'ja','アップルシード','In a utopian society created at the end of World War III, a female warrior who has been plucked from the badlands begins to see cracks in this new facade. And what does this community have planned for the rest of humankind?','/mtSmeCDTexb0uWhVedouJ4SeD6c.jpg','2004-04-17',105,'Released','Humanity\'s last chance for survival.','Appleseed',11633,3.8161,6.8,'ps4iKlkc41E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19136,_binary '\0','/ceCncO5fnkpM8jGeb2uzN3TtxAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401244',6.4,5120,'en','The Baxter','Mild mannered tax accountant Elliot Sherman is what he calls a \"Baxter\": the kind of calm, unexciting fellow who \"wears sock garters\" and \"enjoys raking leaves.\" Loved by bosses and parents, Elliot is a perfectly nice guy. And that\'s his problem.','/9V1ASfnxMZxrkqIvVQYySE5qSwd.jpg','2005-08-26',91,'Released','A romantic comedy for anyone who\'s ever been dumped.','The Baxter',13169,2.5011,6,'T4mzrmBql-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19137,_binary '\0','/Afsp5bre27ffHgxkLIn4iqL7yb1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401248',7.2,3392,'th','บิวตี้ฟูล บ๊อกเซอร์','Based on the real life story of Parinya Charoenphol, a Muaythai boxer who underwent a sex change operation to become a woman.','/2qMi3DvtOBF38aiZy6nlUyBcxnp.jpg','2003-11-26',118,'Released','Born in a boy\'s body, believeing he has a girl\'s heart.','Beautiful Boxer',6414,1.2855,6.6,'sl9piEAylpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19138,_binary '\0','/8v9UL4hL4WDC58IrKb9bkBz0kIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401383',8,113254,'fr','Le Scaphandre et le Papillon','Jean-Dominique Bauby, editor-in-chief of French fashion bible Elle magazine, has a devastating stroke at age 43. The damage to his brain stem results in locked-in syndrome, with which he is almost completely paralyzed and only able to communicate by blinking an eye. Bauby painstakingly dictates his memoir via the only means of expression left to him.','/6NkJ4gnLrvLj0PZDW6sNM85JMbj.jpg','2007-05-23',112,'Released','Let your imagination set you free.','The Diving Bell and the Butterfly',2013,6.4713,7.573,'TGPhtOMOCcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19139,_binary '\0','/kgFoOXK3JmameBkjb61TYcxJgif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401394',6.4,1455,'fa','دوئل','The story of Zeinal, a man who after 20 years of being a POW, tries to clear up his past.','/9k6Zr7XjSXrRaiTLfkZxCPTULv7.jpg','2004-07-06',133,'Released',NULL,'Duel',736566,0.6739,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19140,_binary '\0','/wmIr8XOFH3zoUyNBzIyS9siyjFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401420',6.4,7609,'en','Fierce People','A massage therapist looking to overcome her addictions and reconnect with her son, whose father is an anthropologist in South America studying the Yanomani people, moves in with a wealthy ex-client in New Jersey.','/mv4WXcAudHDCxm8xFvVDvqAl36f.jpg','2006-04-28',112,'Released','Every family tree has its nuts.','Fierce People',19583,2.974,6.107,'CuUFkNVmE_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19141,_binary '\0','/dV5AKLfihrUTfAqh7dj9MG3OUWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401445',6.9,108091,'en','A Good Year','Failed London banker Max Skinner inherits his uncle\'s vineyard in Provence, where he spent many childhood holidays. Upon his arrival, he meets a woman from California who tells Max she is his long-lost cousin and that the property is hers.','/10ErazhJxfL68rWg2KLfwiRuIou.jpg','2006-09-09',117,'Released','Everything matures... eventually.','A Good Year',9726,7.7234,6.7,'bKKrLj5ZHiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19142,_binary '\0','/jq1vKqxRP9ZmhG552GpZsJUF58f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401488',6.9,2040,'cs','Horem pádem','Milan and Goran are two criminals who smuggle illegal immigrants. One night after they complete a smuggle, they discover that one of the immigrants has left a baby behind. Milan and Goran decide to sell the baby to Lubos and Eman, who are responsible for running an illegal baby adoption center. Lubos and Eman make attempts to sell the baby to Miluska and Frantisek, a barren couple.','/pNe8hVohFlPmN561fKcHAfeSFOq.jpg','2004-09-16',108,'Released','A comedy that makes you cry. A drama that makes you laugh.','Up and Down',65967,1.3827,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19143,_binary '\0','/yfErEoTHKe8r8jrdQqS6rLEKNh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401504',7.1,4208,'en','Ike: Countdown to D-Day','The story of the senior-level preparations for the D-Day invasion on June 6, 1944 from the time of Dwight D. Eisenhower\'s appointment as the Supreme Allied Commander in Europe, to the establishment of the beachhead in Normandy.','/a094KlACWR9GMYTdSfCt1HUQHoX.jpg','2004-05-31',89,'Released',NULL,'Ike: Countdown to D-Day',31065,2.669,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19144,_binary '\0','/3viNdUBEauryYk9Xu4EpXgScwuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401696',4.3,1410,'en','Non aprite quella porta 3','Melanie Beck is the only surviving victim of a killer-rapist who wears a Freddy Krueger-esque mask and claw. Despite having seen the killer\'s face, Beck has blocked it from her memory. Becoming suicidal, she tries to kill herself on the beach but is saved by Axel, another rapist sleazeball who keeps her locked in his hotel room. All this builds to a mind blowing conclusion.','/2da5wkbFCYdo9cf5Ex0mdcbqPTM.jpg','1990-08-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Night Killer',126463,1.8757,5,'ntRXhupgyEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19145,_binary '\0','/z5SQmAzMAkK54qMQJC9WsZ6PddL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401711',7.2,76677,'fr','Paris, je t\'aime','Olivier Assayas, Gus Van Sant, Wes Craven and Alfonso Cuaron are among the 20 distinguished directors who contribute to this collection of 18 stories, each exploring a different aspect of Parisian life. The colourful characters in this drama include a pair of mimes, a husband trying to choose between his wife and his lover, and a married man who turns to a prostitute for advice.','/mcke8Uvw8QDToAZQ94UGo7VU0g6.jpg','2006-06-21',120,'Released','Fall in love with Paris 18 times.','Paris Je T\'aime',2266,6.5435,6.768,'kD7ecYD4-0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19146,_binary '\0','/689yJyzzy6yGj359HrsT9KWyeWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401729',6.6,301272,'en','John Carter','John Carter is a war-weary, former military captain who\'s inexplicably transported to the mysterious and exotic planet of Barsoom (Mars) and reluctantly becomes embroiled in an epic conflict. It\'s a world on the brink of collapse, and Carter rediscovers his humanity when he realizes the survival of Barsoom and its people rests in his hands.','/lCxz1Yus07QCQQCb6I0Dr3Lmqpx.jpg','2012-03-07',132,'Released','Lost in our world, found in another.','John Carter',49529,15.6518,6.386,'6Rf55GTEZ_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19147,_binary '\0','/t9kQnqiaxQ8TLB25rTzDKLd0fdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401792',8,824130,'en','Sin City','Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it dark… Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home — Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.','/i66G50wATMmPrvpP95f0XP6ZdVS.jpg','2005-04-01',124,'Released','There is no justice without sin.','Sin City',187,14.9509,7.464,'0p0h_YCinMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19148,_binary '\0','/bAulG4AVPVYOj7y0PYK8wZPoDTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401815',5.1,11930,'en','Tamara','Tamara, an unattractive girl who is picked on by her peers, returns after her death as a sexy seductress to enact revenge.','/9zQaMgFEBKtSB2ZZu73nBis71t9.jpg','2005-05-12',98,'Released','Revenge has a killer body.','Tamara',10263,3.0023,5.3,'6ks698Ux04Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19149,_binary '\0','/lao4tAa7y5QX5benDMyIeeRiTCb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401855',6.7,219321,'en','Underworld: Evolution','As the war between the vampires and the Lycans rages on, Selene, a former member of the Death Dealers (an elite vampire special forces unit that hunts werewolves), and Michael, the werewolf hybrid, work together in an effort to unlock the secrets of their respective bloodlines.','/oJaQG353uOzOqffQ5K2hg03k4Vp.jpg','2006-01-12',106,'Released','A new race. A new battle. A new hero...','Underworld: Evolution',834,10.7813,6.607,'W38N0LGau9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19150,_binary '\0','/8WneCViPYXAcnJcJ2VZuAPPHQ5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0401997',7,64173,'en','Breach','Eric O\'Neill, a low-level surveillance expert with the FBI, believes he is accomplishing his dream of becoming a full-fledged agent, with his unexpected promotion and assignment to clerk for Robert Hanssen, a renowned senior agent with 25 years in the FBI. However, he soon learns the reason for his promotion is to gain Hanssen\'s trust and find proof that he is a traitor to the country. Determined to draw the suspected double-agent out of deep cover, O\'Neill finds himself in a lethal game of spy vs. spy, where nothing is as it seems.','/m2iVkJPxDrrink7NiE412nFBMQj.jpg','2007-02-12',110,'Released','How one man betrayed the security of a nation.','Breach',4169,6.8183,6.64,'XJuLFKeRoJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19151,_binary '\0','/xPsYOVN9SNtODk8JnUkTaAy7N7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402014',7.8,10128,'hi','अब तक छप्पन','Following the fortunes of tough cop Sadhu Agashe both in his fight against crime and in his personal life. Garnering newspaper headlines for his crime-fighting activities, he also makes some enemies in the police department, most notably in the form of his superior, who believes his officer has gone too far.','/4oiBsdFOy2Wuivznvq9r145x5PJ.jpg','2004-02-27',129,'Released','Doctors Cure, Engineers Build, I Kill','Ab Tak Chhappan',16566,1.2157,7.456,'Wh4-W-kGHbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19152,_binary '\0','/uTqxyztRGHSq96JYhByyNFuqqld.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402022',5.4,137931,'en','Æon Flux','400 years into the future, disease has wiped out the majority of the world\'s population, except one walled city, Bregna, ruled by a congress of scientists. When Æon Flux, the top operative in the underground \'Monican\' rebellion, is sent on a mission to kill a government leader, she uncovers a world of secrets.','/5958Nt4QX6aRSUdQnvNw8wqjTJQ.jpg','2005-11-30',93,'Released','The perfect world meets the perfect assassin.','Æon Flux',8202,8.5062,5.638,'f0XQB6j5gpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19153,_binary '\0','/jSaZ02GsGuFIGo0B2kh3FA7hQ0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402057',5.8,19368,'en','Beowulf & Grendel','The blood-soaked tale of a Norse warrior\'s battle against the great and murderous troll, Grendel. Heads will roll. Out of allegiance to the King Hrothgar, the much respected Lord of the Danes, Beowulf leads a troop of warriors across the sea to rid a village of the marauding monster.','/49s4KMmF2YBJhHYTqwdvikpTztt.jpg','2005-09-14',103,'Released','The Hero. The Monster. The Myth.','Beowulf & Grendel',5471,4.5426,5.582,'V7jjEpi2vRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19154,_binary '\0','/9BvSimiMRFtQH7MPO7QnctUI5Tp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402115',6.3,3428,'hu','Csak szex és más semmi','The attractive, 32-year old and single Dora edits scripts for plays and is working on \"Dangerous Liaisons.\" One day when her lover shoves her, half-naked, out on a balcony at the sudden appearance of the wife that Dora didn\'t know he had, Dora is rescued by a handsome man named Tamas.','/naeRjzBWZkd0YuXyteUuYc0C7nf.jpg','2005-12-08',97,'Released','Sex, Love, Theater.','Just Sex and Nothing Else',25902,0.0616,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19155,_binary '\0','/sGYr5Rj2VSJmrgBvwtfYMTaVGdl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402127',4.8,1958,'en','The Defender','The global war on terror rages on. When a government official goes missing, Lance, a man with an impressive record of service to his country, finds himself protecting the man who embodies everything he has dedicated his life to fight against.','/8DL4r94XsOTpO9UyVWXQ7LFWc8.jpg','2004-12-20',92,'Released',NULL,'The Defender',26125,1.9846,4.822,'dW4YejCtoeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19156,_binary '\0','/aNgJdTFrtbCp19G9emZNJN4Klb4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402141',6.8,1627,'it','Dopo mezzanotte','A beautiful fugitive draws a shy film buff out of his shell while she hides in the museum — the cavernous interiors of the Mole Antonelliana in Turin, Italy — where he works as night watchman.','/9i2kGn1n2tQJurXDfEbB1DRU6Yw.jpg','2004-04-23',92,'Released',NULL,'After Midnight',38004,1.846,6.4,'hFTOzyzAdlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19157,_binary '\0','/1i8oz24NssaUplHdB8N7Od4Iqki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402158',5.8,12655,'fr','L\'Empire des loups','When the young detective Paul Nerteaux finds the third slashed female corpse of illegal Turkish immigrants, he decides to ask for support to the experienced dark retired detective Jean-Louis Schiffer to chase the serial killer. Together, they infiltrate in the Turkish mafia trying to find the answer to the crimes. Meanwhile, the worker Anna Heymes is being submitted to a brain treatment and has severe headaches and glimpses of memories and visions. When these two parallel events collide, disclose that the Turkish organization \"The Wolves\" is behind them.','/AkX5I7NF3OcFvxwWm2VzsRgZ1yb.jpg','2005-04-20',128,'Released','If You Can\'t Remember Your Past...You Can\'t Save Your Future.','Empire of the Wolves',10799,4.8595,5.8,'fEXHUtXA53g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19158,_binary '\0','/63nvvdGXEJT0d50VYQ5fHghMRgG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402230',5.5,1631,'en','The Great New Wonderful','The Great New Wonderful weaves five stories against the backdrop of an anxious and uncertain post-9-11 New York City.','/nIGd6MeWNBkLkxW38yzNPs5KDp4.jpg','2005-04-22',88,'Released',NULL,'The Great New Wonderful',23726,2.0851,4.8,'ej9TrGCoM8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19159,_binary '\0','/qvXzjEYd04Ws7vqAfLE68wiYahY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402249',6,5821,'en','The Dark Hours','Dr. Samantha Goodman is a beautiful, young psychiatrist. Burnt out, she drives to the family’s winter cottage to spend time with her husband and sister. A relaxing weekend is jarringly interrupted when a terrifying and unexpected guest arrives. What follows is an extraordinary night of terror and evil mind games where escape is not an option.','/yOYCpZ7jsMedfkHQpXQJw83F3GL.jpg','2005-03-11',80,'Released',NULL,'The Dark Hours',18045,2.1157,5.743,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19160,_binary '\0','/nEswysSpTVR1FnrorCXKKYLjkuk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402294',3.8,2007,'fr','Iznogoud','In Baghdad the Magnificent reigns Haroun al Plassid, who is the Caliph. There also dwells Iznogoud, who wants to be the Caliph. The irascible Grand Vizier hatches plot after plot to remove his ruler and take his place—melting Djinn, invisibility spell, cursed diamond, voodoo doll… But no amount of cunning or obstinacy can make up for sheer, hilariously bad luck.','/rkI5qp75RSxgEZws2Rn9wZkMNOp.jpg','2005-01-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Iznogoud',48916,1.6536,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19161,_binary '\0','/nPzlHOc3uNXoG7UYRBspWLGHhbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402336',5.1,1803,'en','The Last Ride','After thirty years in prison, ex-con Ronnie recruits his grandson to exact revenge on Darryl, the cop who put him behind bars. Standing in their way is Ronnie\'s son, whom Darryl raised.','/4Qu4ZA2bzvzNSCbpOFrLmFbi53A.jpg','2004-06-02',84,'Released',NULL,'The Last Ride',42584,1.8616,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19162,_binary '\0','/a7KCwUZKG0k6h2nYKxKxwcnsTxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402348',7,3944,'en','Love\'s Enduring Promise','In the 1800s frontier, Missie Davis is a bright and beautiful schoolteacher whose love for the prairie is matched only by her passion for books. When Missie encounters Grant, a handsome New England railroad executive, she feels as though she\'s met a hero from one of her novels.','/Aakkjr1wjTO8T2a3bPsYKGkKtLX.jpg','2004-11-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Love\'s Enduring Promise',20641,3.7495,6.821,'M5VY4sgh9Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19163,_binary '\0','/basalqnxZZdLnc2qd60Zy5WYR2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402399',6.7,94251,'en','The New World','A drama about explorer John Smith and the clash between Native Americans and English settlers in the 17th century.','/dPyWMlQd54r3pK17GKG3iqjvNZ7.jpg','2005-12-25',151,'Released','Once discovered, it was changed forever.','The New World',11400,7.7894,6.5,'i2LdlqW26zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19164,_binary '\0','/ecv70eYfPb3CgGtIasiABtpv2Q5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402493',7.3,4870,'sr','Ивкова слава','The story takes place in Nis, towards the end of the nineteenth century, during the calm down of the stormy historic events which led to final liberation of southern Serbian parts from Turkish occupation. The comedy is about celebrating traditional saint\'s day feast, organized by Ivko and how his guests test the Serbian hospitality.','/iIyMjxmO3iRlvigqFllrKlr6BeF.jpg','2005-11-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Ivko\'s Feast',55125,0.9511,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19165,_binary '\0','/jNdTqwWalVntD7c5amcNgc5gl5G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402743',5.1,5420,'en','Abominable','A man, crippled in an accident, returns to the woods after rehabilitation, certain that he\'ll not see Bigfoot again.','/hVz9kkRU0RmkjHrb1JQBLlQCncS.jpg','2006-04-10',94,'Released','Think Big.','Abominable',10011,1.96,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19166,_binary '\0','/g82Zcp8nqDsO5xRQbtQXgLDJj0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402755',6.5,1284,'it','Agata e la tempesta','The story of a middle-aged bookshop owner, who becomes embroiled in a surreal swirl of romance and family secrets of infidelity, her energy levels registering in bursts of electrical interference - causing lightbulbs, traffic lights, toasters and computers to spontaneously spark and malfunction.','/jx7kuBMHAmfSPW84APW9MYRFlEQ.jpg','2004-02-27',125,'Released',NULL,'Agatha and the Storm',14086,1.9901,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19167,_binary '\0','/78qRsQWYbZZSK4CiOb2S990jPVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402764',6.2,1349,'it','L\'amore è eterno finché dura','Gilberto, 50enne, si fa coinvolgere in una cosiddetta speed-date, una gara in cui i protagonisti devono trovare un partner in 3 minuti. Arrestato, deve confessare tutto in presenza della moglie che lo sbatte fuori di casa. Rifugiatosi da amici scopre che il suo migliore amico è amante della moglie e comincia a tentare di avviare nuove relazioni che falliscono tutte.','/ijW1rmBDMlhaSYR5iO25pPnbx6s.jpg','2004-02-20',108,'Released',NULL,'L\'amore è eterno finché dura',22728,1.8447,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19168,_binary '\0','/swiMDuuplzAxOw9SGCyGKNCqQxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402850',6.3,16100,'en','The Big White','To remedy his financial problems, a travel agent has his eye on a frozen corpse, which just happens to be sought after by two hitmen.','/cdBbDH4eqN9CvRmkjkUQxszPArF.jpg','2005-10-27',100,'Released','When you need somebody, anybody will do.','The Big White',9968,3.5804,6.2,'jzU0CHI37Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19169,_binary '\0','/kopv9YXvv06mhxkSs0C2tuTisyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402874',6,4286,'ru','Бумер. Фильм второй','The film takes place a few years after the events shown in Bummer. Kostyan \"Kot\", who lost all his friends, the woman he loved and was nearly killed in the first installment of the film tries to begin a new, peaceful life. But is it possible to do? Has Russia changed and do \"bratki\" on black \"bummers\" no longer control business? Can he escape his past?','/n7t6XzBKoAmgPeoBVE1GDeymNv1.jpg','2006-03-07',115,'Released',NULL,'Bummer 2',61139,1.6324,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19170,_binary '\0','/1WQGyi1Z7823obW2dFMddriDgMQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402894',6.5,58527,'en','Casanova','With a reputation for seducing members of the opposite sex, regardless of their marital status, a notorious womanizer discovers a beauty who seems impervious to his charms. However, as he continues to pursue the indifferent lady, he finds himself falling in love.','/pp237jqOnlLojQfvCgJHv5yZofL.jpg','2005-12-25',112,'Released','He won every woman\'s heart. She won his.','Casanova',9681,4.5094,6.5,'FLbl01QrMzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19171,_binary '\0','/hHhZBHknSjrtSnIEVqQtAjMBNu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402901',5.2,44578,'en','The Cave','After a group of biologists discovers a huge network of unexplored caves in Romania and, believing it to be an undisturbed eco-system that has produced a new species, they hire the best American team of underwater cave explorers in the world. While exploring deeper into the underwater caves, a rockslide blocks their exit, and they soon discover a larger carnivorous creature has added them to its food chain.','/gMfJo22XulGLA8h8yAjiLhdQusv.jpg','2005-08-26',97,'Released','There are places man was never meant to go.','The Cave',9042,6.9224,5.5,'Q5AHUMpBtCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19172,_binary '\0','/rPeI2PGTpkl2KycnblfRwokNwaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402904',3.5,1256,'en','Cemetery Gates','When two ecologists break-in the laboratory of Dr. Belmont, they find a box with a subject and they decide to set the experiment free in the woods. During the transportation, the box opens and releases the mutant Tasmanian Devil that devours the two activists and escapes to the woods. Meanwhile, Dr. Belmont\'s son Hunter travels in a van with four friends to film a horror movie in the cemetery in the woods, while Belmont and his associate Dr. Christine Kollar seek their deadly experiment called Precious.','/f6aHjoxXeUKjC2pmu98X5SOAVyl.jpg','2006-05-30',92,'Released','Meet the new gate keeper.','Cemetery Gates',39912,1.7053,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19173,_binary '\0','/dzXMnUsS1PJpagWmOgauvGisVqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402906',7.3,2444,'cs','Český sen','Two students from the Czech Film Academy commission a leading advertising agency to organize a huge campaign for the opening of a new supermarket named Czech Dream. The supermarket however does not exist and is not meant to. The advertising campaign includes radio and television ads, posters, flyers with photos of fake Czech Dream products, a promotional song, an internet site, and ads in newspapers and magazines. Will people believe in it and show up for the grand opening?','/dnmdNDHtCYwoBDOi3NPwnXPc8Xl.jpg','2004-06-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Czech Dream',33916,1.0169,7.2,'cKFUuMr63EM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19174,_binary '\0','/rR8c2J0i8j9tEjacHE8xgEDPDUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402910',6.4,60969,'en','Chaos','In Seattle, detective Quentin Conners is unfairly suspended and his partner Jason York leaves the police force after a tragic shooting on Pearl Street Bridge, when the hostage and the criminal die. During a bank heist with a hostage situation, Conners is assigned in charge of the operation with the rookie Shane Dekker as his partner. The thieves, lead by Lorenz, apparently do not steal a penny from the bank. While chasing the gangsters, the police team disclose that they planted a virus in the system, stealing one billion dollars from the different accounts, using the principle of the Chaos Theory. Further, they find that Lorenz is killing his accomplices.','/9cZNRnR9dwrBApBbpp781qJS84E.jpg','2005-01-17',106,'Released','When the system breaks down... someone is about to get rich.','Chaos',5289,5.5718,6.3,'IzWbjvuIgAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19175,_binary '\0','/2QJP1w89KBQNKpuP7HBNpjabp4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0402912',5.8,1390,'it','Che ne sarà di noi','A coming-of-age tale about three 18-year-olds just out of high school who go to a Greek island following one of the boys\' older girlfriend.','/zneNjDx7zyOhpM0RYR9foUSg6OO.jpg','2004-03-05',100,'Released',NULL,'What Will Become Of Us',38328,1.324,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19176,_binary '\0','/oC3ya5pKxKy8BXjj3eXDit7iz3e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403016',4.4,5059,'en','Supercross','Faced with the suspicious death of their father, two brothers must motivate one another to get back on their bikes and take the Las Vegas Motocross Championships by storm.','/82dbqeFOA2iPhwWuciZItw1ELew.jpg','2005-08-16',80,'Released','Fear nothing. Risk everything.','Supercross',17186,2.7129,6.3,'2HIV9gnE2gM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19177,_binary '\0','/pH6tXFobpuxD7J9kVe0YeKWAnMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403217',5.7,25001,'en','Last Days','The life and struggles of a notorious rock musician seeping into a pit of loneliness whose everyday life involves friends and family seeking financial aid and favors, inspired by rock music legend Kurt Cobain and his final hours.','/btbp47CHXgLhw30kyDoVfNFLB3g.jpg','2005-06-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Last Days',1665,2.7738,5.588,'EG1dt0I1wps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19178,_binary '\0','/flrkGVqgR6ILTh8ZL8u1ojvdIxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403237',5.8,1844,'en','Everything You Want','A visionary and artistic young woman finds her love torn between her imaginary boyfriend and a real boy from one of her classes.','/19Ii8uFaODwEDHwR4b6Ppin3bjX.jpg','2005-04-17',93,'Released','Love is Just An Illusion. Until the Real Thing Comes along','Everything You Want',21753,2.0827,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19179,_binary '\0','/2f6La6ZJDIQTNPcn2WSR6qdXy8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403358',6.4,57353,'ru','Ночной дозор','Among normal humans live the \"Others\" possessing various supernatural powers. They are divided up into the forces of light and the forces of the dark, who signed a truce several centuries ago to end a devastating battle. Ever since, the forces of light govern the day while the night belongs to their dark opponents. In modern day Moscow the dark Others actually roam the night as vampires while a \"Night Watch\" of light forces, among them Anton, the movie\'s protagonist, try to control them and limit their outrage','/mWdfItjr9tZtsSgjkqB8YhORF8T.jpg','2004-07-08',114,'Released','All that stands between light and darkness is the night watch.','Night Watch',3040,3.5805,6.2,'SU-7ZwbH7Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19180,_binary '\0','/41qh5qAiZMvvoFdRyravwmpRSDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403360',6.8,2938,'da','Nordkraft','The unflinching tale of Maria, Allan and Steso, who are struggling for survival. Maria is a pusher frau, wandering restlessly among addicts, abusers and bikers in a relentless search for love. Allan has just returned from an ill-fated trip across the Pacific and must reclaim his life and stay clean, but ghosts from his past return to haunt him. Steso, the intellectual, god-forsaken and prophetic cynic, does his utmost to unite the two polar opposites that give meaning to his life: his girl and drugs. All three try desperately to make some sense of the madness, but how do you find meaning in the chaos that is life? And how do you find love if you can\'t recognize it?','/mARHol09nUcvhH9zAh3N4Scr5JO.jpg','2005-03-04',125,'Released',NULL,'Angels in Fast Motion',14897,1.1512,5.8,'nJIRAutRYDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19181,_binary '\0','/2E4BhpkadFj2tp8cRiROf1s5FAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403407',5.3,5966,'en','Perfect Creature','The vampire myth is given a stylish 1960s treatment, where a human cop partners with a vampire cop to stop a vamp bent on creating a war between the two \"separate but equal\" races.','/dimESyMjhfzmukbisslB3djbXhQ.jpg','2007-08-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Creature',18726,2.0477,5.3,'C0mKCAWoMZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19182,_binary '\0','/bheeOBdK27vWCYJ7nrhSDRMuw1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403455',6.3,8369,'en','Roll Bounce','In the summer of 1978, a teenager and his group of friends face new challenges when their neighborhood roller-skating rink closes, forcing them to visit a different rink.','/lStFr3EHTNbnyOdOk2QDCqYGnlR.jpg','2005-09-23',112,'Released','BOUNCE, ROCK, SKATE, ROLL','Roll Bounce',14544,4.3922,6.9,'KRbtDCxcN-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19183,_binary '\0','/2WackFzjJHGa1Fd2dZJu4VIQMdU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403508',6.5,67703,'en','The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants','Four best friends (Tibby, Lena, Carmen &amp; Bridget) who buy a mysterious pair of pants that fits each of them, despite their differing sizes, and makes whoever wears them feel fabulous. When faced with the prospect of spending their first summer apart, the pals decide they\'ll swap the pants so that each girl in turn can enjoy the magic.','/oetVWVTXKZUDKmmdOKWO3iAKIkL.jpg','2005-06-01',119,'Released','Laugh. Cry. Share the pants.','The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants',9779,5.5585,6.515,'eV1IkLvTe1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19184,_binary '\0','/vo4dXvjko6hQFkkVKmqT6iEqcOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403522',6.1,2584,'da','Solkongen','While changing the pipes in the tanningbeds at Golden Sun, Tommy meets the owner. A middleaged former Miss Fyn called Susse. Slowly an unusual love affair begins. Tommy\'s two friends Ole &amp; Flemming give him tips on how to give Golden Sun some masculine appeal. Susse just happens to have a sleazy lawyer that does not appreciate the new look.','/xj2luouSvKtdpXNOStISSbYRjFR.jpg','2005-02-11',86,'Released',NULL,'The Sun King',33446,2.063,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19185,_binary '\0','/erCu5q8RvB388Iz4w9Drd2lzAAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403537',4.5,1628,'en','State Property: Blood on the Streets','Three gangsters vie for control of the streets of Philadelphia.','/plp9AHFlFghfmMESJyPmsJnhQao.jpg','2005-04-13',94,'Released',NULL,'State Property: Blood on the Streets',13409,1.7886,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19186,_binary '\0','/m8zlPvbDp7fS3a8LUFuKo0SP6YT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403579',7.4,1442,'ru','Свои','It is August 1941. With the battle line far away in the east, three soldiers who have managed to escape from captivity find it difficult to hide: the territory is occupied by the enemy. The local woods are not safe: you can easily get embogged. Are the villagers loyal? Nobody can say. There is an old man who offers to help them. Is he reliable enough? He may kill them or report them to the local German authorities. Anything may happen, but one of them, the sniper, is his son who is his youngest, his dearest.','/oQb2cPYcziZ9lmgOuP277wxrUjQ.jpg','2004-08-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Our Own',63715,0.8293,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19187,_binary '\0','/bQ1vPhjXt2DQetGOJVF1gxzilDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403645',4.3,4738,'ru','Утомлённые солнцем 2: Предстояние','Epic film about WWII, a sequel to Utomlyonnye solntsem (1994). Evil Stalin is terrorizing people of Russia while the Nazis are advancing. Russian officer Kotov, who miraculously survived the death sentence in Stalin\'s Purge, is now fighting in the front-lines. His daughter, Nadia, who survived a rape attempt by Nazi soldiers, is now a nurse risking her own life to save others. In the war-torn nation even former enemies are fighting together to defend their land. People stand up united for the sake of victory. Written by Steve Shelokhonov','/tvDDahBQMM1ueTSb3zx6PJxyO3a.jpg','2010-04-22',180,'Released',NULL,'Burnt by the Sun 2: Exodus',38318,1.9749,4.669,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19188,_binary '\0','/5HUWQDUJMIL4Di2C5TC2eU6f7tU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403692',6.4,2129,'ko','여자는 남자의 미래다','As the first snow falls in Seoul, two old friends reunite; one is a successful college professor, and the other, a struggling filmmaker recently returned from the United States. After their reminiscences, they finally decide to go in search of the young woman each had romanced years earlier.','/nxPZsN8qpPKJjmIEy9uGdPnNGdd.jpg','2004-05-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Woman Is the Future of Man',16447,2.5317,6.1,'8YFYt3vZ0xE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19189,_binary '\0','/gcRl1gl8EOEoniQWgz6LPwwlmrD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403702',6.4,78357,'en','Youth in Revolt','As a fan of Albert Camus and Jean-Luc Godard, teenage Nick Twisp is definitely out of his element when his mother and her boyfriend move the family to a trailer park. When a pretty neighbor named Sheeni plays records by French crooners, it\'s love at first sight for frustrated and inexperienced Nick. Learning that she is dating someone, Nick launches a hilarious quest to find his way into Sheeni\'s heart -- and bed.','/3J48x7Utjx0sdYIvjsMWnlEbxpV.jpg','2009-09-11',89,'Released','Every \"Revolution\" Needs A Leader.','Youth in Revolt',22327,5.0025,6.141,'_6vVncYxUTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19190,_binary '\0','/eZhgY71I2kOkKgYckYHuLncsVlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403703',5.1,9742,'en','Yu-Gi-Oh! The Movie','After the conclusion of the Battle City Tournament, deep below the sands of Egypt, an ancient evil has awakened. Anubis, who was defeated centuries ago by Yugi’s mysterious alter ego – the ancient Pharaoh – has returned for revenge. Wielding the power of the Eighth Millennium Item, Anubis is determined to destroy Yugi and take over the world.','/3VD5QDTu0rQgRvERBMXtAvg0oIC.jpg','2004-08-13',89,'Released','Everything else was just practice!','Yu-Gi-Oh! The Movie',11052,4.4884,6.1,'BDb5Q3zskv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19191,_binary '\0','/10Ta5Y2K1DIozP86yILj62ZAvO5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403885',3.1,1573,'en','Death Valley: The Revenge of Bloody Bill','When a group of college kids stumble upon a small abandoned town of Sunset Valley, they must fight a band of Zombies led by a Confederate soldier seeking retribution for his grisly execution.','/21vclriIvQ2MOsyb3qSnIIu5WvD.jpg','2004-10-26',82,'Released','In the middle of nowhere, there is nowhere to run.','Death Valley: The Revenge of Bloody Bill',20669,1.8189,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19192,_binary '\0','/s21q00bxTBKCPO5QNqmPV0if9ib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403933',5.3,1517,'en','Chasing Ghosts','A serial killer targeting the city\'s mobsters taunts police with clues and photos left behind at the crime scenes. A veteran cop takes on a rookie partner hoping to crack one last case before retiring. As the web of deception and lies unravels, the truth slowly begins to reveal itself.','/9GB0DATfGe3ZGjyR0te9ybNPvgF.jpg','2005-05-11',119,'Released','Digging up the past will get you buried.','Chasing Ghosts',41726,1.744,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19193,_binary '\0','/ngUU8Xm4pfyLjRo2zZE6bfdorAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403935',3.5,4908,'hi','एक्शन जैकसन','A man meets his lookalike, who\'s not just a killer of evil, but also a kind hearted man. Together, they team up to fight against a dreaded gangster.','/3cVmG3G4YezZNLlJ4RuyE3MgKkE.jpg','2014-12-05',144,'Released','Naa Commitment, Naa Appointment, Only Punishment!','Action Jackson',308165,2.0981,4.2,'YubQzbzGHps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19194,_binary '\0','/8FIBQymoFRc9IHT4OgyAUyDmwun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403946',4.2,1316,'en','Cloud 9','Has-been sports promoter Billy Cole gets a second shot at fame and fortune when he puts together a women\'s volleyball team, comprised of exotic dancers...','/wAOpdKNVnCtO0rtHEI8HvEYX8rI.jpg','2006-01-01',93,'Released','Beach volleyball just got hotter.','Cloud 9',18424,1.8108,5.2,'l0plhoieSgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19195,_binary '\0','/5r8ZuVDpPwvJKX0HTR0R3LqOsl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0403990',6.3,1619,'ja','ドッペルゲンガー','Shortly after hearing from a colleague about a woman whose brother committed suicide after seeing his doppelgänger, a Japanese engineer on the verge of a breakthrough in medical technology is confronted by his own.','/wiQ5x3wUTVVevo8tWToRVKpRN8R.jpg','2003-09-27',107,'Released','What if your worst nightmare… turned out to be you?','Doppelgänger',32234,3.8719,7,'Rbz7heUKveI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19196,_binary '\0','/v6DoiKp2ThK0VUgWt73JrEN4qa4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404030',7.4,61608,'en','Everything Is Illuminated','A young Jewish American man endeavors—with the help of eccentric, distant relatives—to find the woman who saved his grandfather during World War II—in a Ukrainian village which was ultimately razed by the Nazis.','/gk469Y3fJTlbcAkSNMZc4OtETOK.jpg','2005-09-05',105,'Released','Leave Normal Behind.','Everything Is Illuminated',340,3.4958,7.3,'tSUOYY4oukc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19197,_binary '\0','/eHT36hVNslbJXCY3SXgtzxPE3cl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404032',6.7,150673,'en','The Exorcism of Emily Rose','When a young girl called Emily Rose dies, everyone puts blame on the exorcism which was performed on her by Father Moore prior to her death. The priest is arrested on suspicion of murder. The trial begins with lawyer Erin Bruner representing Moore, but it is not going to be easy, as no one wants to believe what Father Moore says is true.','/qMN0HIP34f736kkQcfvTfmL9TP3.jpg','2005-09-09',122,'Released','One person\'s story of faith and possession.','The Exorcism of Emily Rose',8643,10.2081,6.6,'Bi-PLwxwvy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19198,_binary '\0','/ujtwNQTcnuwNJROfnmHFh3EC2Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404090',3.4,7785,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Merhaba','The year is 2003, and the Private Çamlıca High School, once home to the legendary “Hababam Class”, is still in operation. The school’s founder has passed away, and his son, nicknamed “Mad Bedri,” now runs the place. The time-honored Hababam traditions continue in full force, and every teacher is so exasperated by the endless pranks of that class that they’re constantly looking for a way out. Seeing his chance, Mad Bedri plans to sell the school to a developer in exchange for floor space rights, so that it can be torn down and replaced with a high-rise office complex. When the principal, Fatoş, learns of his scheme, she enlists the help of the original “Hababam” alumni to save the school by taking on its current troublemakers. Tensions rise once Bedri announces the sale, and a huge surprise awaits everyone.','/sUPcjS9z84rFwlpLCG5j9gb7Z9E.jpg','2004-01-16',118,'Released',NULL,'Wacky Class Welcome',32333,1.3109,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19199,_binary '\0','/5IokXOZYTeUhoNyZ2YIg01qrO6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404163',5.8,5035,'en','Even Money','Gambling addiction bring the stories of three otherwise unconnected people together as it destroys each of their lives.','/63SdrM8TZbAi4R1Ju7yiIqBmpY3.jpg','2007-03-13',113,'Released','The Fix. The Gamble. The Betrayal. The Threat.','Even Money',19126,3.7323,5.6,'_uoEhTD-ZZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19200,_binary '\0','/uDDgaNppSCJm6kWDLl7vMeu8xcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404203',7.5,122646,'en','Little Children','The lives of two lovelorn spouses from separate marriages, a registered sex offender, and a disgraced ex-police officer intersect as they struggle to resist their vulnerabilities and temptations.','/l2wTSP0Ifo9vY03nJEfkFBbT2S9.jpg','2006-10-06',137,'Released',NULL,'Little Children',1440,7.0866,7.1,'xiuWqJK0IFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19201,_binary '\0','/y5GmfcmFLbSmxzOeEYvmd8LNIw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404215',6.3,2104,'ar','مافيا','After his expulsion from the Military Academy, Hussain gets involved in mafia crimes abroad. Upon being deported to an Egyptian prison, and in order to give him a second chance to live a well meaning life, the Egyptian Intelligence Agency assign him with a secret mission. Hussain reluctantly accepts extensive bio-psychological training with a unique patriotic team who revive his love for his country.','/fzfCVpRAXcAQPsgiz2JSo9SIc12.jpg','2002-07-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Mafia',452160,1.3546,6.909,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19202,_binary '\0','/evZEvYmaC7dZknqsXPyIjonLvBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404254',6.2,21048,'en','My Sassy Girl','A guy has his life planned out until he is wooed, groomed and then dumped by an elusive woman.','/2cJWaUNdyNpd86CzdU6jUnbfxMq.jpg','2008-05-26',96,'Released','She\'s beautiful, smart, funny and totally crazy.','My Sassy Girl',14197,3.8954,6.8,'GqckBN0CCQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19203,_binary '\0','/Ag660gnSIe3UpL2s7gAqj8OeYs7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404364',7.1,7317,'en','Reefer Madness: The Movie Musical','From an ominous Lecturer, a small 1930s middle American community learns of the Harper Affair, in which young Jimmy Harper finds his life of promise turn into a life of debauchery and murder thanks to the new drug menace marijuana. Along the way, he receives help from his girlfriend Mary and Jesus Himself, but always finds himself in the arms of the Reefer Man and the rest of the denizens of the Reefer Den.','/38xnsPZiuIYMTsOXhtTIg1dUnRu.jpg','2006-01-27',108,'Released','The Feel Good Event of the Year!','Reefer Madness: The Movie Musical',20521,2.9418,6.6,'84jKkUGbylU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19204,_binary '\0','/p5z5X3GRnaFEqgtEa7fiGhgtUkA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404390',7.3,107410,'en','Running Scared','A low-ranking thug is entrusted by his boss to dispose of a gun that killed corrupt cops, but things spiral out of control when the gun ends up in wrong hands.','/f2LU6M8wFmt6G1fzv9JFWbIkRd9.jpg','2006-01-06',122,'Released','Every bullet leaves a trail.','Running Scared',7304,6.8583,6.998,'bBboyvN3s-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19205,_binary '\0','/s4lyjmizpoPoiEyaYEoiMCP1QT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404552',4.2,1845,'es','Yo puta','An anthropology student exploring the nature of prostitution is drawn deeper into that profession than she ever expected.','/gjItTS8d5XNSfvHEdZ0XSZbPDuv.jpg','2004-04-16',87,'Released','What\'s your pleasure?','The Life',20502,3.6526,4.8,'F001nWmYvd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19206,_binary '\0','/A7uFycM7H4Cs9q50IpnQt28NNRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404756',4.4,4648,'en','Alien Apocalypse','An astronaut doctor Ivan Hood and his fellow astronaut Kelly return from their mission in space to find the world has been taken over by aliens. Now Dr. Ivan Hood and Kelly must lead a revolution to free the human slaves from their alien masters.','/kMCLTS7tjfzYpd6JAiLYs07ZLd1.jpg','2005-03-26',88,'Released','Yesterday, they were only astronauts. Today, they\'re humanity\'s only hope.','Alien Apocalypse',14907,1.6471,4,'ZvIa4o38dJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19207,_binary '\0','/hiNz1scA7CqDscjgbaxhwotXLrQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404777',6.5,4162,'ko','아라한 장풍 대작전','Sang-hwan became a cop in order to help the downtrodden, but he doesn\'t get much respect. All that changes when he meets the Seven Masters.','/98c0nyZOLW9xdGJwvkzWQMiAgBT.jpg','2004-04-30',114,'Released','Unmeasured ultimate power, He is the Last Hope!','Arahan',13970,2.8134,6.6,'DORsZsHy1zA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19208,_binary '\0','/lpILXg6a1sGlBSzYgZN559CpGZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404789',5.5,1599,'ar','عسكر في المعسكر','The Upper Egyptian Khader Hassanein joins the Central Security Forces, he accidentally meets Metwally Al-Zanati on the train, who tells him that he must take the revenge of his father who was killed 20 years ago. Khader realizes that he is the person who Metwally is meant to kill.','/emABtj0t2LQw68d1xaKxDnsux5q.jpg','2003-07-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Soldier In the Camp',407717,0.9053,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19209,_binary '\0','/g16gB5MVOSGWW5k3yMbYpAvS9Qf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404802',6.5,12257,'en','The Notorious Bettie Page','Bettie Page grew up in a conservative religious family in Tennessee and became a photo model sensation in 1950s New York. Bettie\'s legendary pin-up photos made her the target of a Senate investigation into pornography, and transformed her into an erotic icon who continues to enthrall fans to this day.','/jRzcb9O8WdGmJdz8EESEaBEuZZJ.jpg','2006-04-14',91,'Released','The Pin-Up Sensation That Shocked The Nation.','The Notorious Bettie Page',15402,4.3346,6.279,'Cd252I7A6NE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19210,_binary '\0','/jBxQjghhOR3yyhf95cZtwqJ3Van.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0404978',5.7,27013,'en','Gambit','An art curator decides to seek revenge on his abusive boss by conning him into buying a fake Monet, but his plan requires the help of an eccentric and unpredictable Texas rodeo queen.','/9oj9hpmMLaMhsRpSRCBaoQOpPxM.jpg','2012-04-25',89,'Released','A fake masterpiece. The perfect plan.','Gambit',97434,4.3026,5.5,'glqvVQCB6ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19211,_binary '\0','/9vS9v3j3Rz5hZFvHkEXIHf8V3rG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405022',6.5,1570,'en','House of Boys','It is 1984. Frank is a determined English teenager who runs away from high school to find an alternative gay lifestyle in Amsterdam. He finds a home and a job at the \"House of Boys\", a bar-cum-brothel run by a strict Madame who has an eye for what his punters crave. Frank works his way up from barman to on-stage dancer and falls in love with some of his housemates, Jake. The first intimations of what is described as \'the gay cancer\', casts a long shadow over Frank\'s tight-knit group of friends. Yet despite the troubles that cloud the hopes and dreams of young Frank, his perseverance, along with support from a willing doctor, will carry him through.','/ggbRpkmQ52gdsfqrjzTSdqhmAYo.jpg','2009-11-20',120,'Released','Make Love Your Goal','House of Boys',51935,2.3346,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19212,_binary '\0','/9WjFFChAnb934d0o1hmVNct24F0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405052',5.2,1431,'en','Irish Jam','Upon discovering that their town is up for sale, crafty Irish villagers scheme to raise the money to prevent the buy-out. They hold a poetry contest with a tempting grand prize -- the deed to their local pub. But what could happen when a duplicitous American rapper emerges as the best poet around?','/vgoLNwhI5amH58v8sQulF2eeDDz.jpg','2006-01-01',94,'Released','The luck of the Irish just ran out.','Irish Jam',34789,1.3847,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19213,_binary '\0','/blOO2Sj5aYt67K9a1ELP9DlBVUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405061',5.7,5306,'cn','見鬼2','Pregnant Joey teeters on the brink of madness after several fruitless suicide attempts. She\'s the unwilling recipient of an influx of shadowy images that haunt her pervasively. In an attempt to quell this disturbing phenomenon, she looks up with her secretive ex-lover Sam, who may be able to shed some light upon the mysterious twilight world descending upon Joey.','/oLzGWnLYBTdCVqaXooertbagQgn.jpg','2004-03-18',95,'Released','You will discover that ghosts exist!','The Eye 2',24674,2.0574,6,'CC8CDBRjLus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19214,_binary '\0','/g11nKgir3nIhlG2gIDWIvJeR4fz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405094',8.4,447145,'de','Das Leben der Anderen','In 1984 East Berlin, dedicated Stasi officer Gerd Wiesler begins spying on a famous playwright and his actress-lover Christa-Maria. Wiesler becomes unexpectedly sympathetic to the couple, and faces conflicting loyalties when his superior takes a liking to Christa-Maria.','/cVUDMnskSc01rdbyH0tLATTJUdP.jpg','2006-03-23',137,'Released','Before the Fall of the Berlin Wall, East Germany\'s Secret Police Listened to Your Secrets.','The Lives of Others',582,11.7267,8.037,'n3_iLOp6IhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19215,_binary '\0','/zgSVBjBBjSwLCIzed2MMx8DWSr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405149',7.2,5186,'fa','مهمان مامان','A mother of a poor family, has guests coming over, yet doesn\'t know how to get the dinner party altogether with limited resources.','/vw6QYehfluAwrJYlx6EKPL1EIIX.jpg','2004-02-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Mum\'s Guest',379835,1.1237,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19216,_binary '\0','/oGMomeS7bE43eN8SGJUaKvQnmud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405159',8.1,773625,'en','Million Dollar Baby','Despondent over a painful estrangement from his daughter, trainer Frankie Dunn isn\'t prepared for boxer Maggie Fitzgerald to enter his life. But Maggie\'s determined to go pro and to convince Dunn and his cohort to help her.','/jcfEqKdWF1zeyvECPqp3mkWLct2.jpg','2004-12-05',132,'Released','Beyond his silence, there is a past. Beyond her dreams, there is a feeling. Beyond hope, there is a memory. Beyond their journey, there is a love.','Million Dollar Baby',70,13.6712,8,'5_RsHRmIRBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19217,_binary '\0','/A7wROeDATxR28m6oyCYMh4IUKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405163',6.2,6810,'en','The Amateurs','Sex sells in America and these guys know it. The Amateurs follows a small town band of loveable losers who hit upon an idea that can make their dreams and fantasies come true. Thinking they\'ve found the road to riches and fame they decide to make the world\'s most innocent adult film. Everyman\'s fantasy turns into a hilarious misadventure when they find they\'re in way over their heads.','/kj4ZZpyP95ltT4ZF2c6aiyEH5N9.jpg','2006-04-28',96,'Released',NULL,'The Amateurs',17035,2.4687,5.6,'Cj8_p99LeeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19218,_binary '\0','/wATxrmSllujUHc67YJV5Daql1Aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405266',7.7,6054,'hi','Raincoat','Tells the story of two lovers, separated by destiny, who meet again one day. This encounter allows each to realize the truth about the lives they are living.','/doz7H7x8MA7NBJdlqg8P0xCeK6R.jpg','2004-12-24',120,'Released','One afternoon can prove to be greater than a lifetime','Raincoat',41252,2.0054,7.406,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19219,_binary '\0','/do8idarfaUTxxwaarefTNA724Qj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405296',7,122568,'en','A Scanner Darkly','An undercover cop in a not-too-distant future becomes involved with a dangerous new drug and begins to lose his own identity as a result.','/lUKudOpHICDj6A6SO7DdaZM4W48.jpg','2006-07-07',100,'Released','Everything is not going to be OK.','A Scanner Darkly',3509,6.2877,6.81,'l1-xKcf9Q4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19220,_binary '\0','/4gsnFDp3bsfFuDFot38F7sCVvBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405325',6.3,102167,'en','Sky High','Set in a world where superheroes are commonly known and accepted, young Will Stronghold, the son of the Commander and Jetstream, tries to find a balance between being a normal teenager and an extraordinary being.','/nBB0XNMwvYvWpo67EcxQqKMoMKf.jpg','2005-07-29',100,'Released','Saving the world.. one homework assignment at a time.','Sky High',11459,10.761,6.3,'G7aMWVN1ThM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19221,_binary '\0','/oaT5yMG61XetddVmymGrDVeoCg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405336',5.3,42523,'en','Southland Tales','Set in the futuristic landscape of Los Angeles on July 4, 2008, as it stands on the brink of social, economic and environmental disaster. Boxer Santaros is an action star who\'s stricken with amnesia. His life intertwines with Krysta Now, an adult film star developing her own reality television project, and Ronald Taverner, a Hermosa Beach police officer who holds the key to a vast conspiracy.','/7dbIDQ80z4bxiDlAvxRwc5TI44C.jpg','2007-11-14',145,'Released','This is the way the world ends.','Southland Tales',4723,4.9463,5.3,'Sbovtczv99U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19222,_binary '\0','/bmjo4w9MoLag2BjayBIHCAl0w0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405393',6.8,9766,'es','Rudo y Cursi','Tato and Beto are poor stepbrothers living on a banana plantation in Mexico. Both are talented soccer players, but their dreams lay elsewhere: tone-deaf Tato wants to be a singer, while Beto is content to remain on the plantation. One day, a sports agent sees the two young men playing soccer and offers to take one of them to Mexico City for a chance at sports stardom.','/rZRKMeyVkgxriKAjItTIf1gAcTD.jpg','2008-12-19',102,'Released','Even when your luck runs out, some things never change.','Rudo & Cursi',4786,2.6949,7.2,'zAMlwcJchoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19223,_binary '\0','/bCzQcdHYmiWsV24IqMnFVi9Q20b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405410',7.4,2415,'tr','Turist Ömer','Tourist Ömer is a poor man who lives a carefree life without worries. He has never held down a steady job and always got fired. His closest friend is Ruknettin. Tourist Ömer eventually takes a job distributing advertising funds for a bank. When he goes to the bank to collect the advertising funds, he accidentally takes a suitcase full of real money stolen from a robbed bank.','/lCHSFfdiinjlYvAvVvsMMFIUuX4.jpg','1964-01-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Omer The Tourist',319367,0.8173,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19224,_binary '\0','/3Wej7JW8Ikrzbm6h0lmSdeOYMmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405422',7.1,508022,'en','The 40 Year-Old Virgin','Andy Stitzer has a pleasant life with a nice apartment and a job stamping invoices at an electronics store. But at age 40, there\'s one thing Andy hasn\'t done, and it\'s really bothering his sex-obsessed male co-workers: Andy is still a virgin. Determined to help Andy get laid, the guys make it their mission to de-virginize him. But it all seems hopeless until Andy meets small business owner Trish, a single mom.','/mVeoqL37gzhMXQVpONi9DGOQ3tZ.jpg','2005-08-11',116,'Released','Better late than never.','The 40 Year-Old Virgin',6957,16.7933,6.431,'QVucTi58nA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19225,_binary '\0','/mT3nr5RtXV50vxh6b8L8VgNAcp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405469',5.2,29963,'en','The Wild','An adolescent lion is accidentally shipped from the New York Zoo to Africa. Now running free, his zoo pals must put aside their differences to help bring him back.','/sxqzaOto1qyUseSg6YpIP9Su5lp.jpg','2006-04-06',82,'Released','Start spreading the newspaper.','The Wild',9904,9.0366,5.549,'2Ud851VoYzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19226,_binary '\0','/sPv96xgkp8Mme0jpIC2RkQotk9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405496',7.6,1928,'en','Z Channel: A Magnificent Obsession','A documentary on the Z Channel, one of the first pay cable stations in the US, and its programming chief, Jerry Harvey. Debuting in 1974, the LA-based channel\'s eclectic slate of movies became a prime example of the untapped power of cable television.','/mhEUVtXc08I8hZSbexWnilXga1p.jpg','2004-05-16',121,'Released',NULL,'Z Channel: A Magnificent Obsession',56224,1.8315,7.1,'nNZeFFKceeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19227,_binary '\0','/evcMcI8aNfU6Q5S3j5tHOP12Oek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405507',5.6,8926,'hi','Murder','To escape a secure but stifling life with her workaholic husband Sudhir, bored housewife Simran begins an affair with Sunny, an ex-boyfriend from her college days. However, when Sudhir grows suspicious and hires a private detective, the infidelity soon comes to light.','/j14NjDFy7QQWHDSzfO9EkZvc9ZF.jpg','2004-04-02',130,'Released','She is married, she is lonely, she is having an affair......','Murder',20534,1.8438,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19228,_binary '\0','/fgRhyGbMAolDsQ65VRBRBtVQZNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405508',8.1,127422,'hi','रंग दे बसंती','After a group of friends graduate from Delhi University, they listlessly haunt their old campus, until a British filmmaker casts them in a film she\'s making about freedom fighters under British rule. Although the group is largely apolitical, the tragic death of a friend owing to local government corruption awakens their patriotism. Inspired by the freedom fighters they represent in the film, the friends collectively decide to avenge the killing.','/f1bF8CHzEu621bPSIg6XiUNAabh.jpg','2006-01-26',157,'Released','A Generation Awakens.','Rang De Basanti',7913,2.8042,7.1,'l-BTOTtcGmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19229,_binary '\0','/ocDhysBK4Qh7Qn2zL3gZjRxTJKv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405629',6.9,3050,'fr','Aaltra','In this pitch black comedy the rivalry between two neighbors escalates into an all out war. Through a maintenance error on a tractor they both end up, paralyzed, in a wheelchair. It seems they are doomed to stay together. They no longer focus their rage on each other but on the manufacturer of the tractor, in Helsinki. So get ready for a hilarious wheelchair road movie.','/oacJEKUH4czthUvFdfWY2f5FdMy.jpg','2004-06-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Aaltra',12249,1.9159,6.19,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19230,_binary '\0','/xp5cZAZC9jcdaIr10Md47CgPHbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405676',6.1,26772,'en','All the King\'s Men','The story of an idealist\'s rise to power in the world of Louisiana politics and the corruption that leads to his ultimate downfall. Based on the 1946 Pulitzer Prize-winning novel written by Robert Penn Warren, loosely based on the story of real-life politician Huey Long.','/r3Yu6JdufxUSqy6PJgT887UpSMt.jpg','2006-09-10',128,'Released','Time brings all things to light.','All the King\'s Men',1717,7.7657,5.754,'ug7bvj2Wz-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19231,_binary '\0','/eI70OmCCWYk99ZYxmR2PEFq6Yd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405743',7.1,11681,'de','Barfuß','A hedonistic bachelor - he is his rich family\'s black sheep - falls for a suicidal mental patient.','/gAoSSuWskaixnrFUXJwHwTuEfzt.jpg','2005-03-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Barefoot',6183,1.5583,6.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19232,_binary '\0','/nOovQqWWrGRkEkefR19syGO5a9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405821',6,14147,'ja','CASSHERN','Fifty years of war between the Great Eastern Federation and Europa - now merged as Eurasia - have taken their toll on planet Earth. As a result of the use of biological, chemical and nuclear weapons, much of Earth has become uninhabitable and people have become prey to new diseases. Professor Azuma\'s \"neo-cell\" project, which is supposed to be the answer to mankind\'s hardships, becomes a nightmare come true when mutants spawned from the experiment escape and declare war on the human race. Azuma\'s son Tetsuya, who was killed during the previous war, is reborn into the cyborg Casshern as mankind\'s last hope against the new mutant threat. This live-action sci-fi movie based on a 1973 Japanese animé of the same name.','/naIjHWfQFge69GqeehgsekwDkbl.jpg','2004-04-24',141,'Released','When a hero falls a legend will rise','Casshern',11662,3.8447,5.9,'1xeis94QNB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19233,_binary '\0','/qydQ9jQt7CI6mXmLxrk8InA1ibx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405861',5,2077,'en','The Deal','A political thriller steeped in illegal oil trading, the Russian Mafia, and governmental cover-ups.','/4WHzLfb9uGo9PgNu8IIiTSz1c6P.jpg','2005-06-17',107,'Released',NULL,'The Deal',10274,2.1997,5.7,'gcU29GQ-hBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19234,_binary '\0','/fKMxZ00Qf4pRWpMYH4ubnXw7kPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405866',6.7,2958,'fr','La Demoiselle d\'honneur','A hard-working young man meets and falls in love with his sister\'s bridesmaid. He soon finds out how disturbed she really is.','/1DGGdYDDYeVknSsaBsBrwRWbjkP.jpg','2004-11-17',111,'Released','The New Film from the Master of the French Thriller.','The Bridesmaid',72272,1.6427,6.3,'H5mr1WBx9eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19235,_binary '\0','/nrr8DJ2SgWwErLSYq3bi3ugGiPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0405977',3.2,2397,'en','Chaos','Two girls heading to a rave take a detour to score some drugs, only to find themselves brutalized and violated by a psychotic gang.','/jJar2mJShQFO0zeKm0tPpFjUk57.jpg','2005-08-10',74,'Released','The most brutal movie ever made','Chaos',39914,1.4845,4.233,'0fLNZj6WWNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19236,_binary '\0','/guGulPHu3AZGs59UbTxUpk0Jp1O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406038',7.2,1824,'en','Loggerheads','A troubled woman seeks out the child she gave up for adoption; a gay motel owner takes in a handsome drifter; and the wife of a preacher frets that a gay couple has moved in across the street. All of their lives will intersect as Loggerheads subtly draws out their secret losses and desires.','/t56bWDhZFhkbcSuf8n6FjqiMUFo.jpg','2005-10-14',95,'Released','One son. Two mothers. Three endangered lives.','Loggerheads',19965,2.0261,5.9,'sZlh97_2uuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19237,_binary '\0','/vzeyPbl4rWMVgdkAj7thmDuQZmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406046',7.4,8599,'en','The Magic of Ordinary Days','Pregnant out of wedlock, an educated young woman is pressured by her father into an arranged marriage with a lonely farmer in this drama set during WWII.','/4UAR1KJNyvBdhTXmmlxqROUCxi2.jpg','2005-01-30',120,'Released','In a world at war, he gave her a place of peace.','The Magic of Ordinary Days',47525,4.5905,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19238,_binary '\0','/x1yHo15KSJv2utoHuwLsQO3yMrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406098',7.1,1599,'cs','Štěstí','Over the course of a year, in a small town scarred and beaten down by industrialization, Tonda and Monika, friends since childhood, come to experience what life might be like if they could be with one another – which they seemingly can\'t. Or can they?','/jthWhnwubYovcx7Sw1yAcM4Lkp1.jpg','2005-09-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Something Like Happiness',33682,1.0514,6.4,'1krGLFs_-3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19239,_binary '\0','/nR9BSMvZMQAh2kL2SC62yLiv2B4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406158',7.2,8875,'en','The Prize Winner of Defiance, Ohio','A Midwestern housewife supports her large family by entering contests for ad slogans sponsored by consumer product companies, while dealing with abuse from her alcoholic husband. Based on a true story.','/wBAxyz9LTvyRlQ6wcMA2La2rYgX.jpg','2005-09-28',99,'Released','She raised ten kids on twenty five words or less.','The Prize Winner of Defiance, Ohio',27176,3.038,6.6,'BA7bs2Cbik8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19240,_binary '\0','/ur6OGvtHthICkOTVt37Ldn9NgAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406227',5.9,1217,'cs','Snowboarďáci','Rendy and Jáchym have enough of spending New Year\'s Eve with their parents plus they want to learn how to ride a snowboard. They have not yet stood on a real board, just a video game one. They win a season pass at the Arcade and they arrange an accommodation at Jáchym\'s cousin Milan\'s mountain lodge. Jáchym has to take his annoying sister Marta with him. They are allowed to stay in exchange for doing housework. The lodge is also housing three hot girls who the boys fall in love with. Jáchym and Rendy have to walk the dog, clean the dishes, clean the lodge, get along with Marta and other things all while they learn how to snowboard and impress the girls.','/hZttLR2mOqViZRmITPeukZ5ObCM.jpg','2004-11-04',99,'Released','The only good snowman is a dead snowman','Snowboarders',65897,1.61,6,'Jf8fl9MHpY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19241,_binary '\0','/tl4LL0MOwiLbCDdfraWHI1LrZT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406265',6.4,3195,'en','Their Eyes Were Watching God','A drama set in the 1920s, where free-spirited Janie Crawford\'s search for happiness leads her through several different marriages, challenging the morals of her small town. Based on the novel by Zora Neale Hurston.','/vVn2KohzehZMN40YmNM69HqXxWm.jpg','2005-03-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Their Eyes Were Watching God',17364,2.5696,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19242,_binary '\0','/s9Bn7Mx4U9cWOR1WdFZjU1DTAkh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406375',6.3,128181,'en','Zathura: A Space Adventure','After their father is called into work, two young boys, Walter and Danny, are left in the care of their teenage sister, Lisa, and told they must stay inside. Walter and Danny, who anticipate a boring day, are shocked when they begin playing Zathura, a space-themed board game, which they realize has mystical powers when their house is shot into space. With the help of an astronaut, the boys attempt to return home.','/gDb5BW2NLqZ9cvg9nyzkZVvmgze.jpg','2005-11-06',101,'Released','Adventure is waiting.','Zathura: A Space Adventure',6795,11.1843,6.454,'hxrF-X1yn6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19243,_binary '\0','/ltrTheaVE9VD0qF9EbsRHIpeaCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406649',6.3,2523,'en','A Christmas Carol','Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.','/2KMxnbPZilgwF5N1rs6zmpwyVyG.jpg','2004-11-28',87,'Released','The holiday heart-warmer as you\'ve never seen - or heard - before!','A Christmas Carol',28769,2.6807,6.4,'8Mc1doWd5rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19244,_binary '\0','/t5dM0pTUTZ8X3ubmUp3hOuOpdcO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406650',6.8,19665,'en','The Chumscrubber','The Chumscrubber is a dark comedy about the lives of people who live in upper-class suburbia. It all begins when Dean Stiffle finds the body of his friend, Troy. He doesn\'t bother telling any of the adults because he knows they won\'t care. Everyone in town is too self consumed to worry about anything else than themselves. And everybody is on some form of drug just to get through their days.','/uMb26IjDgdq8p4H3XNO1CAsjT4m.jpg','2005-06-08',108,'Released','Meet Generation Rx.','The Chumscrubber',13919,3.7037,6.515,'Fjj2WZh8pco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19245,_binary '\0','/mKDDk26wRvNFAI0xworwZnAPQOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406661',3,1471,'ko','클레멘타인','Kim, a Taekwondo champion decides to give up his fighting career for good in order to take care of his daughter Sa Rang. But when an evil gambling kingpin kidnaps Sa Rang, Kim must agree to fight in a rigged boxing match in exchange for Sa Rang\'s freedom.','/jbZtQcnO7oNZd6GRXwkMpEHfS6I.jpg','2004-05-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Clementine',47336,2.4073,3.2,'jebwQIvTmo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19246,_binary '\0','/eBJDAJmhFVLINV78sB0VkvCsVkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406728',4.6,6582,'en','Dungeons & Dragons: Wrath of the Dragon God','Due to a curse from his former master Profion, Damodar survived his death by Ridley Freeborn as an undead entity in pursuit of an evil artifact for some hundred years, so that he might be capable of unleashing unstoppable destruction on Izmir and the descendants of those who caused his demise.','/n5PV0sV4Nd0eCZMcRfipeNhTpmz.jpg','2005-09-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Dungeons & Dragons: Wrath of the Dragon God',9288,4.2273,4.7,'NdShvRiPEUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19247,_binary '\0','/RuvpWz3WTia72UmqFBshmE1lWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406754',6.1,4025,'en','Evilenko','For years, Andrei Evilenko eluded the obsessive Detective Lesiev and the psychiatric profiler Aron Richter. Spurred on by his rabid fury at the gradual crumbling of his precious Soviet Union, Evilenko is a man who will live, die and kill as a communist.','/rbSjcMoWAijPqdhqhbBJd6WcYgQ.jpg','2004-04-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Evilenko',46342,2.9602,5.8,'_LpkI8FaSac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19248,_binary '\0','/x5HfRp97ZoYbYTTBGA5JRrqbCZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406759',5.4,59382,'en','The Eye','Violinist Sydney Wells was accidentally blinded by her sister Helen when she was five years old. She submits to a cornea transplantation, and while recovering from the operation, she realizes that she is seeing dead people.','/eW39LaILpKGLthbnC4KgUJErslK.jpg','2008-02-01',98,'Released','How can you believe your eyes when they\'re not yours?','The Eye',9030,6.9377,5.9,'lYlkmWZGhaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19249,_binary '\0','/ytclDXEffquvzjwNXbiYEU1b6F2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406816',6.9,104116,'en','The Guardian','A high school swim champion with a troubled past enrolls in the U.S. Coast Guard\'s \'A\' School, where legendary rescue swimmer Ben Randall teaches him some hard lessons about loss, love, and self-sacrifice.','/iFOw9bXeLM6a2WbI7T1ytF8o0Wn.jpg','2006-09-28',139,'Released','How do you decide who lives or who dies?','The Guardian',4643,10.0324,7.1,'fvVrlOS8vC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19250,_binary '\0','/xyELWMr8TAL8NE4yvU8osVCwG1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406910',7.8,1218,'bs','Kod amidže Idriza','Fuke visits his uncle Idriz and aunt Sabira to fix a broken boiler. He soon finds out there\'s a lot more that needs to be repaired. Idriz and Sabira aren\'t ready to accept the loss of their only son in the Balkan war, seven years earlier. When Fuke\'s car refuses to start, Fuke has to stay over in their house. He meets a lot of old friends and neighbors there.','/A6lBbswQy6c1RkmwLg2IXgsE4uu.jpg','2004-08-20',93,'Released','The story of a man who came to fix a bolier, but ended up fixing people\'s hearts','Days and Hours',177155,1.0658,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19251,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406942',5.7,1916,'en','Lost','Trapped in a maze of endless desert highways, bound by a vital deadline, and pursued by an unseen menace.... Jeremy Stanton is about to take the longest ride of his life. He will learn that when you reach the crossroads of life... you must be careful which way you turn.','/omC5gd03AHx9lRt12vJzAseemyA.jpg','2004-10-05',90,'Released','Be careful which way you turn.','Lost',54439,1.4877,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19252,_binary '\0','/c0ahfvAgNZE6reDkwUgZ28sddVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0406977',6.2,7812,'hi','मस्ती','Three henpecked friends try to escape their unhappy marriages by seeking out some extramarital fun, only to end up being blackmailed.','/2cUfjsn5uCiDiTdkjiEQM2HXYLg.jpg','2004-04-09',166,'Released',NULL,'Masti',76684,1.3431,5.654,'-3gH7v8LZLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19253,_binary '\0','/bVvZaEGe0iQCSSLBkB1lX12ZS7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407021',6.7,1281,'es','Los Muertos','Vargas, a 54 year old man, gets out of jail in the province of Corrientes, Argentina. Once released, he wants to find his now adult daughter, who lives in a swampy and remote area. A deep mystery surrounds him.','/153bDV9xmiQADtFFGKgUubNeUro.jpg','2004-04-16',78,'Released',NULL,'Los Muertos',36241,1.6357,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19254,_binary '\0','/1VzPVUQsgRj6QGNvkpWfWfXQi8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407038',4.1,1247,'en','Pucked','Frank Hopper is a former lawyer, long-term loser and constant dreamer - and frankly, probably just not all that bright. When he receives a credit card in the mail, he believes he\'s hit the jackpot. It\'s not long before he\'s working his way toward financing his dream - an all-woman hockey team. He\'s also put himself in debt to the tune of more than $300,000. Naturally, he winds up in court when his plan backfires','/wsT5QZgArjd5cPmaDd1SlXxQ199.jpg','2006-02-10',83,'Released','Sometimes even the losers score big.','Pucked',36964,1.6304,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19255,_binary '\0','/wUFgVDjkSlUwX6ehWhOsy6JSnCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407121',6.4,9513,'en','Pooh\'s Heffalump Movie','Who or what exactly is a Heffalump? The lovable residents of the Hundred Acre Wood -- Winnie the Pooh, Rabbit, Tigger, Eeyore, Kanga and the rest of the pack -- embark on a journey of discovery in search of the elusive Heffalump. But as is always the case, this unusual road trip opens their eyes to so much more than just the creature they\'re seeking.','/5kd5JqccroxOnC9sVMP5NtLrbkr.jpg','2005-02-11',68,'Released','Heffa nice day.','Pooh\'s Heffalump Movie',13682,7.9959,6.9,'08KKL6G9LNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19256,_binary '\0','/4SFf9Fo5Y2mwjSh8j3ouZY00L9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407236',7.1,4167,'cs','Šílení','A man takes up residence with a mysterious marquis and is soon persuaded to enter into an asylum for preventative therapy. Things are not what they seem, and the marquis may be even more sinister than what the young man might have predicted.','/n03zXfOnaMvv3m9F2Y2Hp9jRZCE.jpg','2005-11-17',117,'Released',NULL,'Lunacy',21156,1.6652,6.727,'TZyfIkXrblM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19257,_binary '\0','/m0LR5LAQUtVsR6ZUm0phaajGX7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407246',7.2,5167,'es','Temporada de patos','Flama and Moko are fourteen years old; they have been best friends since they were kids. They have everything they need to survive yet another boring Sunday: an apartment without parents, videogames, porn magazines, soft drinks and pizza delivery.','/aDh6wDWliUViXt6noYFrQQxrH2k.jpg','2004-10-22',90,'Released','Adulthood is a moving target.','Duck Season',34207,1.4097,7.1,'4-X6iN-d_B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19258,_binary '\0','/40z3PhEHOWopC9KFqEIZaqJ5NAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407265',7.3,43470,'en','Transamerica','A transgender woman takes an unexpected journey when she learns that she had a son, now a teenage runaway hustling on the streets of New York.','/3MmLpqRlrYSP0uFIDr9BHA4o2LP.jpg','2005-02-14',103,'Released','Life is a journey. Bring an open mind.','Transamerica',546,3.7568,7,'PPbGIErXKpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19259,_binary '\0','/wvnYuWAQTtTpoJOgOwBmg7PURMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407269',5.3,4639,'en','The Truth About Love','As part of a drunken bet with her sister Felicity, happily married Alice sends an anonymous Valentine\'s card to her husband Sam to see if he hides it. When he does, what was a prank leads to a series of events and revelations that may put her marriage at risk, and leaves her looking for answers.','/h4vfB0pL7YDY9DUIvnYWGlSjKdf.jpg','2005-04-21',94,'Released','How far would you go to test your man? How far would you go to keep him?','The Truth About Love',14933,2.7362,4.625,'-tLjyGaFJYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19260,_binary '\0','/bInicBgSHfQiWLbnRT5jxw9Grvm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407304',6.6,513832,'en','War of the Worlds','Ray Ferrier is a divorced dockworker and less-than-perfect father. Soon after his ex-wife and her new husband drop off his teenage son and young daughter for a rare weekend visit, a strange and powerful lightning storm touches down.','/6Biy7R9LfumYshur3YKhpj56MpB.jpg','2005-06-28',117,'Released','They\'re already here.','War of the Worlds',74,22.9033,6.574,'TLnQXsKn5-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19261,_binary '\0','/wCQ6zH0fKWwsW8Gdi7DluD5wga2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407536',6.4,1367,'en','The Aryan Couple','A German Jewish industrialist is forced to hand over his business to the Nazis in order to ensure his family\'s safe passage out of Germany.','/jIkUYRzEMOBdKMo5x9bT6WPtKfi.jpg','2004-12-10',120,'Released',NULL,'The Aryan Couple',20344,1.6467,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19262,_binary '\0','/d70Quq9clByCZKBzVwwvo19AWn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407612',7,1836,'en','The Brooke Ellison Story','Rendered a quadriplegic since a child from a near-fatal neck injury, a young girl fights against all odds to succeed in life from grade school to her acceptance into college under the assistance of her loyal and dedicated mother.','/vDfyPpsH18bRA8gpTlFyeMDpRFF.jpg','2004-10-25',91,'Released',NULL,'The Brooke Ellison Story',38517,2.3184,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19263,_binary '\0','/8i4GUCNk8MDCjFMQ5e6SgHb3sLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407617',6.3,1401,'de','c[r]ook','A killer for the Russian Mafia in Vienna wants to retire and write a book about his passion - cooking. The mafia godfather suspects treason.','/ebH7UcxveEudlhzlmfRBu2Tneq.jpg','2004-11-11',108,'Released',NULL,'C(r)ook',8995,1.2456,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19264,_binary '\0','/6PKtrsAGNKOFKbdRkdKlKQLQInT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407621',6.1,15577,'fr','Calvaire','A few days before Christmas, traveling entertainer Marc Stevens is stuck at nightfall in a remote wood in the swampy Hautes Fagnes region of Liège when his van breaks down. An odd chap who\'s looking for a lost dog then leads Marc to a shuttered inn.','/vFQOoXIBZP1cokmy8ow7yKKrXVZ.jpg','2005-03-09',88,'Released','Some people would kill for company.','Calvaire',12517,2.8992,5.9,'GGJ5U3iQSKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19265,_binary '\0','/fAM3zlePdmzWGGKOBoPJcdR6Xgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407708',5.6,1246,'cn','大佬愛美麗','Georgie Hung is handsome, stylish and charming but he hides a secret that his old-fashion father, Hung who is a Triad leader, can never forgive. He has been sent to Thailand since he was a child and never returned. After Hung\'s death, his right-hand Cheung intends to bring back Georgie to take over. However, Cheung finds Sam, Georgie\'s flat-mate, whom he mistakes for Geogie...','/wwGS2UMI635naMjZUnCbvc0xRdY.jpg','2004-04-08',104,'Released',NULL,'Enter the Phoenix',21522,1.9267,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19266,_binary '\0','/ru9MR7fZt7kRb2atgU7N9iQYi7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407732',5.7,9042,'en','Dirty Deeds','According to a high school\'s lore, the \"Dirty Deeds\" are a daunting list of dares almost no student has ever completed. To win the student body\'s respect and get noticed by his crush, senior Zach is determined to finish the list in the allotted 24-hour time period. As the school\'s bullying jocks try to thwart him at every turn, Zach embarks on a wild journey, highlighted by beer swilling, grand theft auto and the snagging of an ex-homecoming queen\'s bra.','/fw9FRxhBftqehUVBCvsXwNQnPsw.jpg','2005-08-26',87,'Released','10 Dares. 12 Hours. One Wild Night.','Dirty Deeds',15022,2.593,5.481,'O17vfHbCvKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19267,_binary '\0','/3n64ecD4Sissex4f4GGSikKQ9hV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407821',6.5,2347,'ko','거미숲','TV Producer Kang Min enters Spider Forest for a documentary. He enters a cabin and discovers two brutally murdered bodies. One is his girlfriend Hwang Soo-Young and the other is his colleague Choi Jong-Pil. Kang Min also senses someone watching him and runs after that person into to the forest. He\'s soon knocked unconscious. When he awakens again he continues his chase into a tunnel. Kang Min is then struck by a speeding car.','/jBEkJPSxwptnt2fjkrHQnqtc4WY.jpg','2004-09-03',112,'Released','In that forest… memories get lost.','Spider Forest',21781,1.504,6.6,'GfhqCydgmQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19268,_binary '\0','/mSPCNxQ6qqF4uawIqBxfhqwslxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407851',7.2,5452,'ja','花とアリス','Two teenage best pals attracted to the same boy end up scrambling his life after he walks into a door and is knocked unconscious.','/bkEn15Jm8Edl40ra0qRJny2MYTq.jpg','2004-03-13',135,'Released','Best friends and boyfriends, which one will you choose?','Hana & Alice',27799,2.7821,7,'42FDVfk8BC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19269,_binary '\0','/6WRrGYalXXveItfpnipYdayFkQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407887',8.5,1578174,'en','The Departed','To take down South Boston\'s Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there\'s a mole among them.','/nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg','2006-10-04',151,'Released','Cops or criminals. When you’re facing a loaded gun, what’s the difference?','The Departed',1422,31.538,8.158,'ggs6Ip97vRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19270,_binary '\0','/1PJi26CSVmRDdbHRkkjwgX5FdTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407936',7.8,2707,'en','Lackawanna Blues','In a story fueled by rhythm and blues, a young boy\'s life is shaped by love and the stories of a cast of characters in the boarding house where he lives in 1960s Lackawanna, New York.','/r96EgKcTtNUzwH5mZp7I6yYlppW.jpg','2005-01-26',95,'Released','In the songs of life, every note matters.','Lackawanna Blues',133382,2.3342,5.9,'sofw5pY9Va8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19271,_binary '\0','/mG6tv2oV4UpSRVMSYhE2i2urmf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0407998',5.5,5901,'en','The Mistress of Spices','Tilo is an Indian shopkeeper in America with an ability to see the future and a magical connection to powerful spices, which she uses to help her customers satisfy their various needs and desires. One day she falls in love with an American man. But the spices forbid it.','/4B1bLyeRdrVVS9TirZdPUyP9we1.jpg','2005-09-11',92,'Released','One spice for passion. And one woman who knows its name.','The Mistress of Spices',9724,3.4596,6.2,'YPRvUkkG6QA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19272,_binary '\0','/dE8OFHRWtS61uv18UiUzgmcZKzw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408017',7.5,10235,'tr','Mustafa Hakkında Her Şey','A man is forced to confront his past after he loses everything in an accident. Mustafa is a successful business man living a seemingly great life with his family when an accident takes it all away from him and leaves him with many questions and a cab driver, Fikret, who can answer it all. Mustafa is due to get a lot more than what he bargained for, however, as his interrogations take him to long-forgotten childhood memories and force him to see his formerly perfect life from a very different perspective.','/3MmtTqGLZtiirKdQQdDpXAWbd40.jpg','2004-03-19',119,'Released','In fact, nothing is as it seems.','Everything About Mustafa',56655,1.7926,6.7,'KHPDaTy6grI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19273,_binary '\0','/sFw4wDF4Y4NRyndAmhwKNupqbY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408056',7.2,1813,'en','Omagh','The movie starts at the 1998 bomb attack by the Real IRA at Omagh, Northern Ireland. The attack killed 31 people. Michael Gallagher one of the relatives of the victims starts an examination to bring the people responsible to court.','/gIvDkfyQldeLXtkuXIcafk1bXma.jpg','2005-03-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Omagh',5413,1.4867,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19274,_binary '\0','/rJ9voBSWRGseQ1gm4jKOLM79DUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408120',7.2,1822,'cs','Příběhy obyčejného šílenství','A man who deals with parcels at an airport cargo company finds that he likes planes more than people.','/8IQrf7cXX6gdNxdykz7i2FQ7DUh.jpg','2005-02-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Wrong Side Up',26826,1.5336,7.296,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19275,_binary '\0','/mQtMZBlOxFtStlwoy4oGEMwyTW2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408126',4.9,1772,'ta','புதிய கீதை','Sarathy is a brilliant and carefree young man who is unaware that an astrologer has predicted his death at the age of 27. Eventually, he comes to loggerheads with Reddiar over a land deal gone bad.','/sLb9hJ0TzModbi7EZMXmTqEpaQM.jpg','2003-05-08',160,'Released',NULL,'Puthiya Geethai',63646,0.8666,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19276,_binary '\0','/ce8jHoftiGpF0u6k7SMTCM9pBHj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408181',7.6,2321,'te','శంకర్ దాదా ఎం.బి.బి.ఎస్.','Shankar Dada is a local goon who sets out to fulfill his parents\' dream of him being a doctor. With help from his sidekick ATM, he enrolls himself in medical college and drives the principal and his daughter Dr. Sunitha up the wall.','/rBkVDxKUGsElewghzsf7e1JKJ3f.jpg','2004-10-15',166,'Released',NULL,'Shankar Dada M.B.B.S.',148884,1.1658,6.9,'Ivv5K-xkS84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19277,_binary '\0','/obYVvi6eD4rjFeC7g4uoZQPIh7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408236',7.3,409357,'en','Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street','The infamous story of Benjamin Barker, a.k.a Sweeney Todd, who sets up a barber shop down in London which is the basis for a sinister partnership with his fellow tenant, Mrs. Lovett. Based on the hit Broadway musical.','/gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg','2007-12-21',116,'Released','Never forget. Never forgive.','Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street',13885,12.6745,7.177,'AAU7dRxGvco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19278,_binary '\0','/titl6uMe5u974sLAA2Zy1kFi4sC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408306',7.5,255731,'en','Munich','During the 1972 Olympic Games in Munich, eleven Israeli athletes are taken hostage and murdered by a Palestinian terrorist group known as Black September. In retaliation, the Israeli government recruits a group of Mossad agents to track down and execute those responsible for the attack.','/iUekaw96QLInZpsNwRTlRKrZgwm.jpg','2005-12-23',164,'Released','The world was watching in 1972 as 11 Israeli athletes were murdered at the Munich Olympics. This is the story of what happened next.','Munich',612,11.0724,7.1,'OuT_uh0CAf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19279,_binary '\0','/in6lSIoIBQW0H30dpyO30v5wgHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408318',7.1,3568,'da','Voksne mennesker','A young man spurs romance and helps his friend and himself go through the struggles of their ordinary life in Denmark.','/jtXMNyPFypqB6Wrlqk6cnbBvVDb.jpg','2005-05-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Dark Horse',5177,1.9007,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19280,_binary '\0','/w7N0Xkwhcz3oGHfSG3X5kPCSQjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408345',5.8,61589,'en','Firewall','State-of-the-art security system creator Jack Stanfield has cemented his reputation as a man who\'s thought of everything. But when a criminal finds a way into his personal life, everything Jack holds dear is suddenly at stake.','/v4HHAWJthAGxnvefLGSyeSInZZx.jpg','2006-02-08',105,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than a man with everything to lose.','Firewall',9754,4.664,5.8,'xCmAjnjwH1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19281,_binary '\0','/tpL6vrHgT3QVWdqUyWzoQCdZKAZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408524',5.8,24764,'en','Bad News Bears','Morris Buttermaker is a burned-out minor league baseball player who loves to drink and can\'t keep his hands to himself. His long-suffering lawyer arranges for him to manage a local Little League team, and Buttermaker soon finds himself the head of a rag-tag group of misfit players. Through unconventional team-building exercises and his offbeat coaching style, Buttermaker helps his hapless Bears prepare to meet their rivals, the Yankees.','/ja1yrgfYAGmwnridioMY3MV0GDm.jpg','2005-07-22',113,'Released','Baseball has rules. Meet the exceptions.','Bad News Bears',13341,4.6755,5.8,'1RPfmcc5L7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19282,_binary '\0','/gCD0eMZW1pUitLzH93WYWJYQgGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408664',8,36044,'ja','誰も知らない','In a small Tokyo apartment, twelve-year-old Akira must care for his younger siblings after their mother leaves them and shows no sign of returning.','/kDUUdWrbBBVqzSmm27pHFJcTvCU.jpg','2004-08-07',141,'Released','Did mom really abandon us?','Nobody Knows',2517,6.1846,8,'ThksKmIMGAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19283,_binary '\0','/whgmJ6vRE7o8zszh60kicT1vVSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408777',7.4,33174,'de','Die fetten Jahre sind vorbei','Three activists cobble together a kidnapping plot after they encounter a businessman in his home.','/jpiXFtvBYemLbAktLPNx5xDGvJn.jpg','2004-10-25',127,'Released','Every heart is a revolutionary cell.','The Edukators',276,2.9552,7.2,'UyT8bEa4XYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19284,_binary '\0','/59vrJSluVcM4bs9nnGMYnXX569o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408790',6.3,186687,'en','Flightplan','Flying at 40,000 feet in a state-of-the art aircraft that she helped design, Kyle Pratt\'s 6-year-old daughter Julia vanishes without a trace. Or did she? No one on the plane believes Julia was ever onboard. And now Kyle, desperate and alone, can only count on her own wits to unravel the mystery and save her daughter.','/oNjZFzbe7PfF3TxztNHDkinOPyB.jpg','2005-09-22',98,'Released','If someone took everything you live for... how far would you go to get it back?','Flightplan',9315,7.8109,6.445,'o_TUxNsMh30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19285,_binary '\0','/7c6RBG6UmwBMPPbVIocwenYw2eK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408828',5,2152,'en','Guy X','A black comedy set in 1979, about a soldier mistakenly posted to an Arctic military base.','/kAruqIkf1GxYyWS03pq7NKdp6dC.jpg','2005-06-06',101,'Released','He was a somebody...until the army made him a nobody','Guy X',14407,1.7151,4.7,'6-tlAWY-Jz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19286,_binary '\0','/oC4LniL98rnmvW52FizMqzD5QzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408839',5.9,102519,'en','The Heartbreak Kid','Eddie, the 40-year-old confirmed bachelor finally says \"I do\" to the beautiful and sexy Lila. But during their honeymoon in Mexico, the woman of his dreams turns out to be a total nightmare, and the guy who could never pull the trigger realizes he’s jumped the gun.','/bVWM0L3DqFpNE3Yt49WjAgTQUc0.jpg','2007-10-05',116,'Released','He waited all his life to get married. Too bad he didn\'t wait another week.','The Heartbreak Kid',9038,10.7418,5.753,'ON1-SohDqDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19287,_binary '\0','/feJR8Q4QxDn6t3mUldhUUnXAYeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408961',5.6,2884,'en','Kids in America','Inspired by real events, this ribald comedy pits an unlikely gang of students against their principal after she bars safe-sex activities on campus. Protesting Principal Weller\'s muzzling of free speech, the teens stage a bold and hilarious rebellion.','/qf5WHidnEkKOQ8hl8l4RuKh0Fxx.jpg','2005-10-21',91,'Released','Get Schooled Not Fooled.','Kids in America',21246,2.0845,5.5,'1tXvRvFkXSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19288,_binary '\0','/j18YTlWkTwJ8s0L4lLEZ83eEI2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408970',5.9,1911,'cn','救命','A horrid crime was committed at a wedding reception and bridesmaid Chi Ching was the lone eyewitness. At the police station, she recognised the suspect, Suen Ling, in a line up. She also discovered the affair between this stranger and her lover. All of a sudden the emotional turmoil surrounding her chronic illness resurfaced and quickly grew beyond control.','/g4rbbJseIrDJgoecqEyngwOi5v2.jpg','2004-04-27',88,'Released','Help!','Koma',40976,1.4327,5.4,'a1hahaxuNvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19289,_binary '\0','/mmxlycCXTvZDFBkyQhEKXVAERfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408976',5.3,1829,'hi','कृष्णा कॉटेज','After their car breaks down, a group of collegians are forced to take shelter in the mysterious Krishna Cottage for the night. Little do they know that the cottage is haunted by a spirit awaiting its lover.','/9yfKxgffAXDQR8vJpsArWnSM9NT.jpg','2004-07-30',124,'Released',NULL,'Krishna Cottage',211105,1.3422,5.2,'7Mw6kitNa8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19290,_binary '\0','/7D1v3y0RPoyJBZAx4eGdjcqJUuD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0408985',6.6,43331,'en','Last Holiday','The discovery that she has a terminal illness prompts introverted department store saleswoman Georgia Byrd to reflect on what she realizes has been an overly cautious life. With weeks to live, she withdraws her life savings, sells all her possessions and jets off to Europe where she lives it up at a posh hotel. Upbeat and passionate, Georgia charms everybody she meets, including renowned Chef Didier. The only one missing from her new life is her longtime crush Sean Williams.','/2SkM1AHIgCQgdOboER6euPKTxGF.jpg','2006-01-13',112,'Released','She always thought she was somebody special... and she was.','Last Holiday',17379,8.6811,7.3,'YJMQBqsiN3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19291,_binary '\0','/rBys943zqj2ZjZ2oWhFA3FW4uev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409011',4.9,16495,'en','Love Wrecked','18-year-old Jenny Taylor is ecstatic when she finds out that her favorite rock star, Jason Masters, is a guest at the tropical resort where she is working for the summer. When they are both thrown overboard during a Caribbean cruise, she saves his life and they find themselves stranded on a remote beach. Deliriously in love with the idea of time alone with him, she manages to hide the fact that they\'re a stone\'s throw away from their resort.','/inCHWvO1EVXa2SYYaBLavL9KkjR.jpg','2005-11-01',87,'Released','He thinks they\'re marooned. She plans on keeping it that way.','Love Wrecked',27902,4.8959,5.163,'4pcyz_2JMpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19292,_binary '\0','/s9OqrwA6gD05eFUuVCRbi9AjMqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409034',6.5,3880,'en','Marilyn Hotchkiss\' Ballroom Dancing & Charm School','Frank Keane, a baker by trade, has been consumed by grief over his wife\'s untimely death. But everything changes when he pulls his bread truck over on a rural highway to help a dying stranger entangled in a car wreck, who was on his way to a fateful reunion.','/xEwS94mnWGL3tGpZFc5dU79Fbx5.jpg','2006-01-12',103,'Released','One man\'s dream, another man\'s destiny.','Marilyn Hotchkiss\' Ballroom Dancing & Charm School',53905,2.6505,5.9,'m3x2B7nTeAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19293,_binary '\0','/giLwfNo0LXBbOHvcmIsvG5lPbip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409043',5.2,6023,'en','Grilled','Maurice and Dave sell high-end cuts of beef, but after hitting a patch of no sales, they\'re facing being fired. Maurice needs money to enroll in his final semester of acupuncture school, and the recently-separated Dave needs money for his daughter\'s birthday gift. Their final client card—a beautiful woman—is attracted to Maurice, but a desperate call from a suicidal friend interrupts her signing the contract. Still hoping to close the sale, they offer to drive her to the friend\'s house—where their troubles multiply.','/3xS38WcGrzTvs5lO3uhKo5EiJxj.jpg','2006-07-11',83,'Released',NULL,'Grilled',11701,1.9569,4.9,'iEiKP4ZGOJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19294,_binary '\0','/fE3DxK3zjWZwhdNpyPY0guCTTgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409072',7.1,8082,'ko','내 여자친구를 소개합니다','Kyung-jin, a police officer who finds herself chasing down a suspected bag-snatcher on her day off. However, the man she catches turns out to be Myungwoo, a passer-by who was himself trying to apprehend the real criminal.','/8OyugG9zsjK4HT42yIcqXMXc2CR.jpg','2004-06-03',123,'Released','If only I can feel you... even as the wind.','Windstruck',10103,2.5165,7.131,'-EtUf_8FEoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19295,_binary '\0','/cmif4raVnSublaj6wEswHHPPL65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409182',5.7,117772,'en','Poseidon','A packed cruise ship traveling the Atlantic is hit and overturned by a massive wave, compelling the passengers to begin a dramatic fight for their lives.','/fDPdjGc8SUEDWfTwMaZlCE6NSi3.jpg','2006-05-03',98,'Released','Mayday','Poseidon',503,8.4412,5.908,'K-Hcdd_t9gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19296,_binary '\0','/2GrIzazWXa7sDigrETwj9e0xIG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409184',6.9,22026,'fr','Les Poupées russes','Five years after their summer together in Barcelona, Xavier, William, Wendy, Martine and Isabelle reunite.','/3jB22Ii6FuE6YEMn1BHzsXaFUPm.jpg','2005-06-15',129,'Released',NULL,'Russian Dolls',1826,3.9221,6.641,'Nu8F2EL1l-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19297,_binary '\0','/iExOE5nfduuD1rL1flHBhkCffxp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409345',6.3,19125,'en','Surveillance','An FBI agent tracks a serial killer with the help of three of his would-be victims - all of whom have wildly different stories to tell.','/8CYX53rLeRonQjJOKyHkwAwBIWD.jpg','2008-02-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Surveillance',10900,2.8271,6,'OuAwj6QQcTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19298,_binary '\0','/AdRO1ZGa8Or4inBr8Bb557NV0Ba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409379',6.1,11109,'en','In Secret','In 1860s Paris, a young woman, Therese, is trapped in a loveless marriage to the sickly Camille by her domineering aunt, Madame Raquin. She spends her days behind the counter of a small shop and her evenings watching Madame play dominos with an eclectic group. After she meets her husband’s alluring friend, Laurent, she embarks on an illicit affair that leads to tragic consequences. Based on Emile Zola’s novel, Thérèse Raquin.','/iJSTzDyF2BKB9mcor7slIOOXSBD.jpg','2014-02-21',101,'Released',NULL,'In Secret',172226,7.8885,6.095,'lgCP7v_Fj3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19299,_binary '\0','/dH7ia3vtkYCa3CBvDnvVjqm9uiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409459',7.6,616428,'en','Watchmen','In a gritty and alternate 1985, the glory days of costumed vigilantes have been brought to a close by a government crackdown. But after one of the masked veterans is brutally murdered, an investigation into the killer is initiated. The reunited heroes set out to prevent their own destruction, but in doing so they uncover a sinister plot that puts all of humanity in grave danger.','/aVURelN3pM56lFM7Dgfs5TixcIf.jpg','2009-03-04',163,'Released','Justice is coming to all of us. No matter what we do.','Watchmen',13183,13.3571,7.356,'89xoXmHgG00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19300,_binary '\0','/yLCv4aEHKXNRuFZMV2Rhuurl57N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409527',5,1636,'hi','Shabd','Shaukat, a writer suffering from writer\'s block, prompts his wife to have an affair with a stranger as he seeks inspiration to write a new story. Will his wife help him write his dream novel?','/aNzaVnUGJsnFVLx4clDoLsnjkKX.jpg','2005-02-04',140,'Released',NULL,'Shabd',21905,1.2906,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19301,_binary '\0','/ums8XVCi9kWoQhTg51J0bASKltd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409681',6.3,6630,'en','The Alibi','Con man Ray Elliot decides to leave crime behind to start a company that sells fake alibis to clients who have been unfaithful to their significant others. It seems that the streetwise Ray has found his calling, until he unexpectedly becomes a murder suspect in a case involving one of his most influential customers. Now, as the police and an assassin called \"The Mormon\" track Ray, he and his attractive assistant, Lola, must clear their own names.','/7PaZLT7vfCIU6p3nG0QkIvdrTpF.jpg','2006-01-12',90,'Released','We keep your private life private.','The Alibi',14938,3.4256,5.7,'qfusfbULObM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19302,_binary '\0','/kzWJO3Y9qtdvRjusIlwcBWRj1Xn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409793',5,1314,'en','Cargo','A young backpacker gets into some trouble in Africa and stows away on a cargo ship heading to Europe.','/mhTKO6b3UgnwVwAnwtjj8buwVpt.jpg','2006-02-14',90,'Released','The secret will never leave the ship','Cargo',15073,1.2897,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19303,_binary '\0','/sGXCYMzr1sCnGNVuRpB2TOWPWDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409847',6,243788,'en','Cowboys & Aliens','A stranger stumbles into the desert town of Absolution with no memory of his past and a futuristic shackle around his wrist. With the help of mysterious beauty Ella and the iron-fisted Colonel Dolarhyde, he finds himself leading an unlikely posse of cowboys, outlaws, and Apache warriors against a common enemy from beyond this world in an epic showdown for survival.','/9uZsGCP4rvOHVGCpMpYq5gNCuNI.jpg','2011-07-29',119,'Released','First Contact. Last Stand.','Cowboys & Aliens',49849,12.9236,5.71,'0JlTboo4cPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19304,_binary '\0','/8XhQcvwrdclXAXAk0j2eumkggzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409860',6.3,2245,'ja','キューティーハニー','When Honey\'s uncle gets kidnapped by the evil criminal gang known as \"Panther Claw,\" she must use her magical powers of transformation to save him. Meanwhile the same crime group has been responsible for a number of other crime sprees across Tokyo. In the process, Honey teams up with the seemingly cold police woman Natsuko Aki and hot shot journalist Seiji Hayami as well as battle the four \"claws\" of the Panther Claw gang to save her uncle and the rest of the city.','/ZIip0Op4FtjXbgLBju1dp6B8ge.jpg','2004-05-29',93,'Released','Super cute and super fun.','Cutie Honey',20921,2.0394,6.4,'KnYteHOmTTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19305,_binary '\0','/qV34mKEiF63iyfc0X3mdayAp6ap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409904',6.4,36562,'ru','Дневной Дозор','A man who serves in the war between the forces of Light and Dark comes into possession of a device that can restore life to Moscow, which was nearly destroyed by an apocalyptic event.','/c99EkthlyDtdVh0xTaKsk9PRDg1.jpg','2006-01-01',146,'Released','The second chapter in the epic fantasy trilogy','Day Watch',2269,4.2017,6.1,'FLY79X1VJj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19306,_binary '\0','/zez4eIEDWUoY7fu8HgcS1WfOWRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0409947',5.6,1261,'ko','페이스','A serial killer is burning away the flesh of his victims with acid, leaving only the bones behind. The police turn to Hyun-min, a former forensic sculptor adept in reconstructing faces by examining and interpreting skulls. With the victim\'s bones in his house, Hyun-min\'s daughter begins to experience disturbing visions. As he races against time to find the answers and save his daughter, the deadly truth behind these victims reveals a sinister conspiracy that threatens everyone involved.','/gBLkbzzcJ0dAPIlcd7E5fYWBuQI.jpg','2004-06-11',92,'Released','Looks Can Kill...','Face',23688,1.4504,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19307,_binary '\0','/d4ZrRcwEPmLQvOCyrSdWw5NglGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410097',7.3,45925,'en','Hustle & Flow','With help from his friends, a Memphis pimp in a mid-life crisis attempts to become a successful hip-hop emcee.','/yO5QTMZ2Oex6mwsgJuwRuINGuOQ.jpg','2005-07-22',116,'Released','Everybody gotta have a dream.','Hustle & Flow',10476,4.7954,7.2,'8ObH9HNW9AI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19308,_binary '\0','/cvenzPOcYthevmYvy0WX4pZ2RNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410297',6.8,166809,'en','The Lake House','When architect Alex Wyler moves into an unusual glass house on stilts over a lake, he discovers a note from the previous tenant in the mailbox--but no one\'s lived in the house for years. He replies and soon discovers that he\'s corresponding with a doctor named Kate Forster. Their correspondence, only through the \'magical\' mailbox, turns romantic and their paths cross in unexpected ways, but when they try to truly connect, danger looms. They must try to unravel the mystery behind their extraordinary romance before it\'s too late.','/tHpc1118dYWLnHZleGhwZxRbpae.jpg','2006-06-16',99,'Released','How do you hold on to someone you\'ve never met?','The Lake House',2044,10.7543,7.038,'V02lqEpbk2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19309,_binary '\0','/3eWN6NwynEKODoQvJjeOOfG8vvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410332',3,4430,'en','August Underground\'s Mordum','The sequel to the cult classic August Underground is a character study in the sick, an amoral putrid fantasy. The found footage contained in August Underground’s MORDUM documents extreme deviant sexuality, torture and murder, while unfolding a classic tale of a man and woman in love. However, the woman cannot give up her other lover, who also happens to be her younger brother. August Underground’s MORDUM will vomit all over you and leave you for dead!','/aiPdmqkCr4el6YSKTUyKUdhTrbL.jpg','2003-01-01',77,'Released','Feed into the sickness!','August Underground\'s Mordum',24837,2.785,3.8,'qtrM1q84R1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19310,_binary '\0','/dnAXIoWR1qwBmVHPNTea3pm7VSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410369',7.4,13669,'tr','Neredesin Firuze','Hayri and Orhan are two music producers head over heels in debt. In an attempt to find the next big thing to turn the business around, they contact Ferhat, a gastarbeiter in Germany, and desperately bring him to Istanbul to sign him. As they are struggling to find the necessary funds to promote Ferhat\'s debut album, a mysterious rich woman named Firuze shows up and starts supporting them. The future now seems bright, but things are not always what they seem...','/biPSj61WZE1zE1zaIvCHfoFUjbJ.jpg','2004-02-20',132,'Released',NULL,'Where\'s Firuze?',89111,1.2044,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19311,_binary '\0','/yXqNFTsp2P3fSkSQvs0vxkQF586.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410377',6,38436,'en','Nim\'s Island','A young girl inhabits an isolated island with her scientist father and communicates with a reclusive author of the novel she\'s reading.','/vhNoXDpc7T5OdmAuu8DMHLB39uo.jpg','2008-04-03',96,'Released','Be the hero of your own story.','Nim\'s Island',10488,7.616,5.9,'NfXn2pE_ExE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19312,_binary '\0','/fJeWzL72YMMXZJ7DA0DTu73DOTZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410400',6.9,3525,'en','On a Clear Day','After decades of laboring as a Glasgow shipbuilder, Frank Redmond, a no-nonsense 55-year-old working-class man, suddenly finds himself laid off. For the first time in his life, he is without a job or a sense of direction, and he\'s too proud to ask for guidance. His best mates - rascally Danny, timid Norman and cynical Eddie - are there for him, but Frank still feels desperately alone. An offhand remark from Danny inspires Frank to challenge himself. Already contemplating the state of his relationships with loving wife Joan and all-but-estranged son Rob, Frank is determined to shore up his own self-confidence. He will attempt the near impossible - swimming the English Channel.','/gE2TRj270Z4KJ5tjSnhpROBwxIH.jpg','2005-08-18',98,'Released','Anything is possible','On a Clear Day',38344,1.8344,6.4,'kQbccINEr4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19313,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410454',6.6,1284,'en','The Work and the Glory','When Benjamin Steed and Mary Ann Steed relocate their family to upstate New York in the early 1800\'s, they unwittingly settle in a town divided along religious lines. After their new hired help turns out to be at the center of the uproar, each member of the Steed family must come to terms with their own beliefs in the face of heavy persecution. Together they struggle to weather the raging controversy surrounding a young man named Joseph Smith.','/b5Y3hNp7jY2rVea9EP0iCToNMlO.jpg','2004-11-24',110,'Released','One Man....A Remarkable Vision; One Family....A Desperate Struggle','The Work and the Glory',36046,2.5168,6.6,'ObXqDLG_D1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19314,_binary '\0','/wJnCNd46Gp0k42j4aE41TVaYNCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410537',5.9,2166,'ko','령','Min Ji-won is suffering from amnesia. Her memory slowly comes back, after she discovers that all her friends mysteriously drowned recently. She begins piecing together her past, revealing the event that caused her memory loss.','/xQVyDiVfrfT7ZDFMh4FA2AoH425.jpg','2004-06-18',98,'Released','Don\'t remember... Take it to your grave.','The Ghost',21792,1.2765,6,'EVVsdFQS3eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19315,_binary '\0','/sgDWw9FP95fN01NvS39wgM8T3Cf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410639',6.4,1967,'fr','Les Sœurs fâchées','Louise, who has just written a novel, comes to Paris to meet with a potential publisher. While in the city, she stays with her older sister, Martine, who in many ways is the exact opposite of Louise: she lives in a fashionable neighborhood, is cold to others, and has snobby friends, while Louise lives in a small town and is thoroughly unpretentious. Louise\'s apparent happiness -- and similarities to their mother -- gradually gets on Martine\'s nerves.','/2obYnhA22UMOtwhMHLZVCNTRL4f.jpg','2004-11-21',92,'Released','Finally reunited!','Me and My Sister',1935,2.3032,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19316,_binary '\0','/n6b4WxGWaFn7V5MaAIV6EJLwlvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410650',4.2,12277,'en','Species III','After she delivers her child in an ambulance, alien Eve is killed by a half-breed. Fortunately, Dr. Abbot scoops up the baby alien and escapes. In time, the baby grows into a gorgeous blonde named Sara and begins her quest to find a worthy mate. But Sara is also savage and leaves a trail of deaths in her wake. This carnage makes chemistry student Dean question whether to help her race or not.','/8BelHo8qmaurZjPS9hipSQ79Rr6.jpg','2004-11-27',111,'Released','Beauty is only skin deep','Species III',9711,5.3315,5.221,'zfEd03oAWUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19317,_binary '\0','/af7JrretfC3XQCXHuLDOoZXw2z0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410696',5.6,4909,'en','Stuck in the Suburbs','Brittany Aarons is one of the many girls who has a crush on popular singer and boy-toy Jordan Cahill. However, she is bored of living a suburban existence and seeks a little something more.','/3iTQNq076Q7eNzUJpScDdxgQtcH.jpg','2004-07-16',78,'Released',NULL,'Stuck in the Suburbs',115626,2.9196,6,'FQB0JVcoQf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19318,_binary '\0','/iagFTj7kfQ20gAK4vaItMyMaoU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410730',6.8,19782,'hu','Taxidermia','Three stories. Three ages. Three men. Grandfather, father, son. One is an orderly, one is a leading sportsman, and one is a master taxidermist. One desires love, the other success, and the third immortality.','/uRqxKim0Vr1JZPLYcR1rjFtu74p.jpg','2006-08-23',94,'Released','Three stories. Three generations. Three men. One bizarre and shocking universe.','Taxidermia',15742,2.7181,6.6,'xeQqwG3D0l4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19319,_binary '\0','/w4bRVvptwS5i2GJpvQkiPhlZqF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0410764',6.3,36125,'en','Tideland','Because of the actions of her irresponsible parents, a young girl is left alone on a decrepit country estate and survives inside her fantastic imagination.','/mjCRfmxg7awp5kVIM1lHR0d7S4A.jpg','2005-10-13',120,'Released','The squirrels made it seem less lonely','Tideland',11559,2.8118,6.509,'RXw2q4qzud4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19320,_binary '\0','/lEimZXv1tMve0VG9Oox8dfongto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411061',5.9,80730,'en','88 Minutes','Famed forensic psychiatrist Dr. Jack Gramm enjoys a reputation as one of the most sought-after profilers around. His expert testimony has resulted in the conviction of many criminals, including serial killer Jon Forster. On the eve of Forster\'s execution, one of Gramm\'s students is murdered in a vicious copycat crime, and Gramm himself receives an ominous message informing him that he has less than 90 minutes to live.','/bSrmBJ2Png69Qnb5L1KHYZMsDP7.jpg','2007-02-14',108,'Released','He has 88 minutes to solve a murder. His own.','88 Minutes',3489,6.131,5.8,'veerS9sCGnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19321,_binary '\0','/3Gcv3tUO2pHaLH9wGrPJtzk9OlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411098',7.4,4452,'fr','Les enfants invisibles','Seven short films - each one focused on the plight of a different child protagonist.','/rMr7aC8UmaC3oLeuyQqzwiZeDFB.jpg','2006-03-03',124,'Released',NULL,'All the Invisible Children',24553,2.0434,7,'iPcn-BqG7b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19322,_binary '\0','/5Y8rf3dRcito2J7hIepkDECwDF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411117',6.1,1342,'fr','L\'Annulaire','When she is slightly hurt in the factory where she works, Iris quits her job and finds a new one as an assistant in a laboratory of a very peculiar kind. Without fully grasping what is at play around her, she gradually engages in a disturbing love affair with her enigmatic employer.','/3ToULCjxL4E9owW271jQXNBfkr4.jpg','2005-06-08',100,'Released',NULL,'The Ring Finger',46280,2.0187,5.4,'WRVRp7hKrLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19323,_binary '\0','/sD17m2rWAQpRXOB2TiN2IgJBRVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411118',6.5,8922,'fr','Anthony Zimmer','François, an ordinary Joe, falls hard for the sublimely beautiful woman who has just picked him up on the train and invited him to spend the weekend with her on the Riviera. But when the lady disappears the next morning and the police drag him in for questioning, François discovers he\'s been set up to pass for her notorious outlaw husband on the run, Anthony Zimmer. Even though he\'s been lied to and manipulated, François\' life is changed forever and he\'s ready to give anything - maybe even his life - to hold this mysterious beauty in his arms again.','/mMBJnGPOr5lr7Dnyr3O4sMgpKPM.jpg','2005-04-01',90,'Released','Pick a man. Seduce him. Trap him.','Anthony Zimmer',11604,3.0968,6.3,'9ICL6bzJkps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19324,_binary '\0','/AaKItBnW5ob4hP7ZSkgIj5TX2Vm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411131',7.8,1356,'ta','ஆட்டோகிராஃப்','Senthil, an advertising executive, decides to invite his old friends to his wedding. His past is unraveled as he sets out on a journey to meet his old friends and lovers.','/icy3xHF6LcHSys9RxNAuI4xyAW1.jpg','2004-02-20',167,'Released',NULL,'Autograph',140299,0.9144,7.462,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19325,_binary '\0','/lbkDfC6Xw4ZPaAKvXYnUMABOjmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411195',7.2,26735,'en','Breakfast on Pluto','In the 1970s, a young transgender woman called “Kitten” leaves her small Irish town for London in search of love, acceptance, and her long-lost mother.','/14tmdb1PiLNDZf3VD29S2nUKVV0.jpg','2005-11-16',128,'Released','Same world. Different planet.','Breakfast on Pluto',1420,5.9537,7.2,'5blVrqSKiRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19326,_binary '\0','/dhr0q4eiRr8ltqPig32TwhPRdaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411267',5.3,11963,'en','The Dark','In an attempt to pull her family together, Adèlle travels with her young daughter Sarah to Wales to visit her father. The morning after they arrive, Sarah mysteriously vanishes in the ocean. Not long after, a little girl bearing a striking resemblance to their missing daughter reveals that she has retuned from the dead — and that Sarah has been taken to the Welsh underworld.','/h6gCVAzjFLhzkffv2VZO1RgVCBt.jpg','2005-09-28',87,'Released','One of the living for one of the dead.','The Dark',17,2.8764,5.7,'AbilWAFEAYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19327,_binary '\0','/xqjIVyovqfl3g6u0kJEvteclrbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411270',7.2,21753,'fr','De battre mon cœur s\'est arrêté','A ruthless real estate agent discovers a passion for piano and auditions with help from a young virtuoso, but the pressures of his corrupt career threaten to derail his musical aspirations.','/w4Y1WJMUP6w2hZo5FnQdZL3OWjN.jpg','2005-03-16',107,'Released','Can music tame the raging soul?','The Beat That My Heart Skipped',1553,3.4866,6.9,'odDwZgpMJoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19328,_binary '\0','/czLjLCZTie8Oaf9Bz9ANhsD705i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411272',7.4,32636,'fr','L\'ennemi public n°1','After nearly two decades of legendary criminal feats, making him France\'s most notorious criminal while simultaneously feeding his desire for media attention and public adoration, Mesrine becomes increasingly paranoid and isolated, leading to a dramatic confrontation with the law that ultimately seals his fate as the nation\'s most infamous public enemy.','/k9lhZ0PhY78nzwG034rNpsLXlpW.jpg','2008-11-19',133,'Released',NULL,'Mesrine: Public Enemy #1',15362,4.2967,7.3,'XgYzDUhoah0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19329,_binary '\0','/1hbQE03hjJG63PI4Fb3F9PntlB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411291',7.1,1632,'en','Dirty Filthy Love','A man\'s life falls apart as a result of his affliction with Obsessive Compulsive Disorder and Tourette\'s Syndrome in this touching and funny tale.','/3MduGn66iGDdlgHtBqIa9bKDZbr.jpg','2005-05-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Dirty Filthy Love',65579,1.9113,6.6,'wOmhe55oF28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19330,_binary '\0','/h5F7wRZQOkS9Y6WCk5ineZcRkZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411323',5.7,3192,'en','Downloading Nancy','When Albert Stockwell comes home from work one day he finds a note from his wife of 15 years, Nancy, saying she has gone to see friends. After waiting several days, Albert realizes that his wife is missing. Nancy has met her salvation on the Internet in the form of Louis Farley. Nancy and Louis, both wounded souls, take comfort in one another through e-mail, pictures, and promises of perverse sexual encounters.','/11unuBv9a4wbH6BA3zQNk3ywb9m.jpg','2008-01-21',101,'Released','She\'s looking for someone to complete her.','Downloading Nancy',18273,1.6545,5.4,'e7tjsC6YZhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19331,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411427',6.5,1218,'en','One Day in Europe','One day in Europe shows stories set in four European countries. All of them involve thievery in some way or the other. The protagonists are strangers in the respective country. For none of them their stay turns out as planned.','/pKNUDZy2L2IbPifjdbaswYWRJ34.jpg','2005-04-01',95,'Released',NULL,'One Day in Europe',9047,1.5471,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19332,_binary '\0','/clClcoMCHkbey3jVhM8dMa1ZIOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411469',7.9,5650,'hi','हज़ारों ख़्वाहिशें ऐसी','Set against the backdrop of the Indian Emergency, the movie tells the story of three youngsters in the 70s, when India was undergoing massive social and political changes.','/q9YIo33RIwA0vUZ7Cz9gIQv68lS.jpg','2005-05-15',117,'Released',NULL,'Hazaaron Khwaishein Aisi',21557,1.109,7.324,'jL7U30ESYWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19333,_binary '\0','/30Gmk6N7KkKRkRiqrl028K1Yf4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411475',5,16934,'en','Hell Ride','Two rival bikers gangs, the Victors and the Six-Six-Six\'s, refuel their decades-old rivalry.','/rZcKg8Zai9J4vFq1fAbbtGOOqix.jpg','2008-08-08',84,'Released','The rebellion against all there is','Hell Ride',13300,2.9979,5.2,'6Cz8JZPHKYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19334,_binary '\0','/gqQKxYVIaYv53Qoy72nQqQxdXYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411477',7,300424,'en','Hellboy II: The Golden Army','Hellboy, his pyrokinetic girlfriend, Liz, and aquatic empath, Abe Sapien, face their biggest battle when an underworld elven prince plans to reclaim Earth for his magical kindred. Tired of living in the shadow of humans, Prince Nuada tries to awaken an ancient force of killing machines, the all-powerful Golden Army, to clear the way for fantasy creatures to roam free. Only Hellboy can stop the dark prince and prevent humanity\'s annihilation.','/zO0Wdrxnhx3KoJEvychSmnY3urC.jpg','2008-07-11',120,'Released','Believe it or not... He\'s the good guy.','Hellboy II: The Golden Army',11253,10.8455,6.77,'Yjivaeh5YOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19335,_binary '\0','/5wLy105E6V08XScgKu0waCich7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411646',4.9,4008,'en','Michael Moore Hates America','Michael Wilson, like the subject of his film, is trying to get an interview with a multi-millionaire; however, in this case, that millionaire is Michael Moore himself.','/p6ruftIefW1QtZdtfqnKV5WHtTl.jpg','2004-09-12',93,'Released','The story of a rebel who took on Mike.','Michael Moore Hates America',20328,1.2874,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19336,_binary '\0','/sATDqrB9kjcAkwAbsMKAsK1UlXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411674',7,1556,'en','Mondovino','Mondovino (in Italian: World of Wine) is a documentary film on the impact of globalization on the world\'s different wine regions written and directed by American film maker Jonathan Nossiter. It was nominated for the Palme d\'Or at the 2004 Cannes Film Festival and a César Award. The film explores the impact of globalization on the various wine-producing regions, and the influence of critics like Robert Parker and consultants like Michel Rolland in defining an international style. It pits the ambitions of large, multinational wine producers, in particular Robert Mondavi, against the small, single estate wineries who have traditionally boasted wines with individual character driven by their terroir.','/ciXRSY7ScGESKXx40llMb4IMUsE.jpg','2004-11-03',135,'Released',NULL,'Mondovino',48121,1.7837,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19337,_binary '\0','/h96aWNg5t3Dl7jqCHPeAqGXvaFD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411702',7,2023,'de','Der neunte Tag','During WWII, head priest Henri Kremer is mysteriously freed from Dachau. He learns that he can return home to Luxembourg, for only nine days, during which he\'ll have to face a persuasive Gestapo chief who will put his faith to the test.','/iKcMiUVOdSrGzkNTSCJN3Fl3yl3.jpg','2004-11-11',98,'Released',NULL,'The Ninth Day',11195,1.8226,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19338,_binary '\0','/qU7tNIMpRqkizIObXfkJY3haTqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411705',4.7,25731,'en','9 Songs','Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London\'s Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night\'s end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.','/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg','2004-07-16',70,'Released','2 lovers, one summer, and the 9 songs that defined them.','9 Songs',27,15.0687,5.5,'N1HWcofsxJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19339,_binary '\0','/s9eUPXwow8SRWLvQHgVPnufvveo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411805',3.3,5947,'en','Return of the Living Dead: Necropolis','In an attempt to rescue their friend from an evil corporation, a group of teenagers end up releasing a horde of bloodthirsty zombies.','/yJZZthnvnJ7l4kMWud9BpTvopdn.jpg','2005-10-15',88,'Released','You cannot kill what is already dead.','Return of the Living Dead: Necropolis',24935,3.7383,5.2,'tQD5ZLP5c-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19340,_binary '\0','/rVvmHuoP02sjBMumip9BalBarop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411806',3.3,5118,'en','Return of the Living Dead: Rave to the Grave','A student creates and sells a drug called \'Z\' which has the unexpected side effect of resurrecting the dead as flesh-eating zombies, who proceed to wreak havoc at a Halloween rave.','/dDmrNvttYmbRT3sZbiCXDmXvyyf.jpg','2005-10-15',95,'Released','Dance til\' you drop...dead.','Return of the Living Dead: Rave to the Grave',24939,3.0769,5.1,'sK8LrKQSPJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19341,_binary '\0','/uw1fozRUKixPeD6wH945xVwD9Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411815',5,1641,'hi','Run','This action movie is filled with romance and adventure. As Abhisek fights for his life against the forces of crime and injustice, he meets Bhoomika, who captures his heart.','/8J8V2fg2KvilI6LC5H1hpCjCjIk.jpg','2004-01-29',134,'Released',NULL,'Run',158780,1.2207,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19342,_binary '\0','/sHm4T1o2lMYJHfch7aNxaiJPjsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0411951',4.8,29946,'en','Tekken','In the year of 2039, after World Wars destroy much of the civilization as we know it, territories are no longer run by governments, but by corporations; the mightiest of which is the Mishima Zaibatsu. In order to placate the seething masses of this dystopia, Mishima sponsors Tekken, a tournament in which fighters battle until only one is left standing.','/1xO2LirDZstkqZic1FwfK6GJIHH.jpg','2010-03-20',92,'Released','Survival is no game','Tekken',42194,4.9828,5.3,'TIJ-oV5ivTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19343,_binary '\0','/xTO4x2OyF7TdZ32mVnjzhjslDOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412019',7.1,110744,'en','Broken Flowers','An introverted man receives an anonymous letter from an ex-lover informing him that he has a son who may be looking for him. A freelance sleuth neighbor motivates the man to embark on a cross-country search for his past flames, seeking answers.','/gd8JNjwgiM6ZgGm6NFAkovQWoYn.jpg','2005-07-31',106,'Released','Sometimes life brings some strange surprises','Broken Flowers',308,6.6972,6.931,'aRWaJ_CqqVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19344,_binary '\0','/qKxAghWoR2M8ZIheMpbHp8jeXFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412080',7.7,64591,'en','The World\'s Fastest Indian','The life story of New Zealander Burt Munro, who spent years building a 1920 Indian motorcycle—a bike which helped him set the land-speed world record at Utah\'s Bonneville Salt Flats in 1967.','/vUIwPFAAXeCUuS040uGC0xSatcG.jpg','2005-10-12',127,'Released','Based on one hell of a true story.','The World\'s Fastest Indian',9912,6.9315,7.7,'02Yy1vihIKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19345,_binary '\0','/9tSx66TNkhDKdNBlCTX8HIUVDRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412308',7.1,3191,'en','Being Cyrus','The Sethnas are a Parsi family that reside in the hills of Panchgani. When the bizarre Cyrus comes into their lives, it is soon revealed that things aren\'t quite right with the Sethna family.','/7aFwJjyumVeFkClcLdDSfsIe6L9.jpg','2005-12-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Being Cyrus',28868,1.2176,6.104,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19346,_binary '\0','/oIQjxDpFs8YFfIFGZQcoYfxvfdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412366',7.1,2477,'en','Samantha: An American Girl Holiday','Kindhearted Samantha Parkington\'s world starts to change the day Nellie O\'Malley walks into her life. Nellie, her father, and her two little sisters have moved in next door to be servants for the Ryland family. Though they come from completely different backgrounds, Samantha and Nellie become fast friends. The girls turn to each other in happiness and sorrow, adventure and danger.','/hJwb18mOK68CJfREiNaBD0Xfrpn.jpg','2004-11-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Samantha: An American Girl Holiday',25786,2.2595,6.4,'Bnsg0pxPO68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19347,_binary '\0','/ssfctwEwIrXReQrY7NJAJZGCVWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412535',5.2,8558,'fr','Brice de Nice','A wannabe surfer parties on the French Riviera while awaiting the perfect wave.','/1bxno5lAD6PzulewOT9joMfGPsU.jpg','2005-03-30',98,'Released',NULL,'The Brice Man',17350,1.7733,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19348,_binary '\0','/yXF89vOhQeGl4ayy1jez67zTPHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412536',6.6,14374,'en','Brideshead Revisited','Befriended by aristocrat Sebastian Flyte, Oxford student Charles Ryder finds that the power and privilege experienced by the family is seductive. On a visit to the ancestral home, Brideshead, he falls in love with his friend\'s sister, Julia. However, as his ties to the Flytes deepen, Ryder finds himself at odds with their strong Roman Catholicism.','/yCkPDr0Yv8HdrHzKxqToUsZqFLt.jpg','2008-07-25',133,'Released','Privilege. Ambition. Desire. At Brideshead everything comes at a price.','Brideshead Revisited',12568,4.2462,6.3,'cwUA82BGUdk','YouTube','Trai