a best-selling crime novelist, is devastated and filled with guilt over the accidental death of her son. Hoping that a change of scenery will help alleviate her suffering, she leaves her home in the city and moves into a vacant country house owned by a friend and begins a relationship with charming local Angus. But, just as her life is taking a turn for the better, Rachel realizes she\'s being romanced by a ghost, leading her to doubt her own sanity.','/c29RoGcznRr14a7fsBYbhJZAK2U.jpg','2006-01-17',110,'Released','When the darkness falls the dead will rise.','Half Light',9756,3.2259,6.1,'7lNA19x7dR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19353,_binary '\0','/ct5mjsceDm0Fxc3rh5W6Yw1aQoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412808',5.8,1312,'en','The Hawk Is Dying','A Gainesville Florida auto upholsterer attempts to subvert his mundane life by training a wild, red-tailed hawk.','/rY3mgBFmmDC4aVSyR1lx9UZzkFR.jpg','2007-03-30',112,'Released',NULL,'The Hawk Is Dying',44813,2.2375,4.9,'o4YrgtCxyHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19354,_binary '\0','/9S18SqofoNHSEEReGQkFZy3y9Mj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412888',7.1,2061,'de','Kammerflimmern','Traumatised paramedic looks for the woman of his dreams.','/nGkJpzuTBJH1AHnyDc0qYIxEK2z.jpg','2004-09-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Off Beat',3539,1.2824,6.225,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19355,_binary '\0','/crsADrmQFBtTFfiZaCXjpBOyzMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412915',6.2,24374,'en','The Librarian: Quest for the Spear','When a magical artifact is lifted from his library, a meek librarian sets out to ensure its safe return.','/wRwbSr0imj632D0qxaHQig4WYf3.jpg','2004-07-12',106,'Released',NULL,'The Librarian: Quest for the Spear',14207,7.1458,6.3,'eYUHJ978EU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19356,_binary '\0','/f5XOH9b9oV7yzIqhKDEXtDx0uz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412922',7.4,26133,'en','Little Manhattan','Ten-year-old Gabe Burton is just an average kid growing up in Manhattan until Rosemary Telesco walks into his karate class. But before Gabe can tell Rosemary how he feels, she reveals that she won\'t be going to public school any more. Gabe has a lot more to learn about life, love, and girls.','/z0RNI1NMtsvLsuTo1rWZfNHVs1z.jpg','2005-09-26',90,'Released','Nothing\'s as big as your first love.','Little Manhattan',16553,5.0002,7.2,'Lrz0qQ_KRfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19357,_binary '\0','/kLlIDD0PchVUWeV7VVjMexHG19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0412956',7.7,10269,'en','The Making of \'Kill Bill Vol. 1\'','The documentary of Kill Bill Vol. 1, and how it was made. This is a documentary found on the DVD of Kill Bill Vol. 1. It consists of interviews, behind-the-scenes footage, and clips of the movie.','/dvS2LCLp0QqCoCHase38VupywiT.jpg','2003-10-17',22,'Released',NULL,'The Making of \'Kill Bill Vol. 1\'',1145586,1.8193,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19358,_binary '\0','/uJ5jqdqNuMzN23BISccF5VNIe3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413015',7,17173,'en','Mrs. Henderson Presents','Recently widowed well-to-do Laura Henderson purchases the Windmill Theatre in London as a post-widowhood hobby. After starting an innovative continuous variety review, which is copied by other theaters, they begin to lose money. Mrs Henderson suggests they add risqué burlesque acts similar to the Moulin Rouge in Paris.','/rFmx0ajncGacM8Ono9vpXiHt7Vy.jpg','2005-09-08',103,'Released','The show must go on, but the clothes must come off.','Mrs. Henderson Presents',10773,3.1047,6.7,'X858gLx6kuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19359,_binary '\0','/yVwCXQzSZvg9H0YBXvzPfSs6Vqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413099',5.5,164400,'en','Evan Almighty','God contacts Junior Congressman Evan Baxter and tells him to build an ark in preparation for a great flood.','/blI1ioXbgJWOJ3PbcBuSV65Ebwu.jpg','2007-06-09',96,'Released','A comedy of biblical proportions.','Evan Almighty',2698,16.4998,5.6,'R1QArbkQsVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19360,_binary '\0','/wvXxKpFGXvQJRB0nvvfURhRD3C0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413267',6.1,365309,'en','Shrek the Third','After the King of Far Far Away dies, Shrek and Fiona are to succede. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, he and Donkey set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.','/n4SexGGQzI26E269tfpa80MZaGV.jpg','2007-05-17',93,'Released','He\'s in for the royal treatment.','Shrek the Third',810,29.8826,6.315,'InR865IDDjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19361,_binary '\0','/FfAU0PUs8AJkMU2VbkVNFtRXR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413300',6.3,719661,'en','Spider-Man 3','The seemingly invincible Spider-Man goes up against an all-new crop of villains—including the shape-shifting Sandman. While Spider-Man’s superpowers are altered by an alien organism, his alter ego, Peter Parker, deals with nemesis Eddie Brock and also gets caught up in a love triangle.','/qFmwhVUoUSXjkKRmca5yGDEXBIj.jpg','2007-05-01',139,'Released','The greatest battle lies within.','Spider-Man 3',559,33.4933,6.484,'e5wUilOeOmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19362,_binary '\0','/gcgAOPm2Gp0sHbYiixxnhyRt4oc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413466',5.9,5164,'en','Wassup Rockers','Instead of adhering to the norms of their South Central neighborhood, a group of skater boys opt to bus into Hollywood and Beverly Hills, where they attract local rich girls - and plenty of trouble with the police, jealous boyfriends, and nervous parents.','/mABP5REdreZ4ZMhP0jUgyQlQBqB.jpg','2005-09-12',111,'Released','From South Central to Beverly Hills','Wassup Rockers',18484,2.1293,5.6,'q3D4jYSQW2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19363,_binary '\0','/cYmdPNG99L77mLjKNJRQrnfU714.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413615',8.3,1848,'en','Unforgivable Blackness: The Rise and Fall of Jack Johnson','The story of Jack Johnson, the first African American Heavyweight boxing champion.','/9A3hG4XsV49t1Cc3QAnBk6bTW5a.jpg','2004-09-04',214,'Released',NULL,'Unforgivable Blackness: The Rise and Fall of Jack Johnson',32063,1.9613,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19364,_binary '\0','/6TtOZzchMybpJw4tKuO6sgP3FDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413879',4.9,4223,'en','Cake','A travel writer improves her love life when she becomes an editor for her father\'s wedding magazine.','/oFsEI7Ou2GGdYaPrl1VbJnhfGdU.jpg','2005-05-12',95,'Released','Have your life and eat it too.','Cake',24123,2.2836,4.8,'BYLMLu2pvJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19365,_binary '\0','/kmPpgz9TNhQO8IQcZMtmznRtgKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413893',7.6,8097,'ja','茶の味','A spell of time in the life of the five-piece Haruno family in rural Tochigi Prefecture. Yoshiko is not an ordinary housewife, instead working on an animated film project. Uncle Ayano, a successful music producer, is looking to get his head together after living in Tokyo. Meanwhile, Sachiko is concerned with why she seems to be followed by a giant version of herself. As the lazy days pass by, each member of the family is followed in a series of episodic vignettes.','/yapwfNElQYFY9TaVS03jv6Gk2Rs.jpg','2004-07-17',143,'Released','We were all watching the sunset, at the edge of the universe.','The Taste of Tea',15318,3.9142,7.5,'Da6FJH7IkNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19366,_binary '\0','/x7B2zT2OL8fKM53Wgzqz6nc7r02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413895',6.3,50541,'en','Charlotte\'s Web','Wilbur the pig is scared of the end of the season, because he knows that come that time, he will end up on the dinner table. He hatches a plan with Charlotte, a spider that lives in his pen, to ensure that this will never happen.','/fU0IR5HF8KxQbZijuWKPTrY81Qv.jpg','2006-12-07',97,'Released','Help is coming from above.','Charlotte\'s Web',9986,8.9577,6.2,'ORMcpzpmLTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19367,_binary '\0','/x9q1C3kPdYCROabEVcbLo9tp6Yg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0413900',5.9,1695,'en','Single Santa Seeks Mrs. Claus','Nick\'s plan to let fate bring his wife to him must be altered because he must replace his father as Santa Claus on December 26. Ernst, the right-hand man to several generations of Santas, generates a list of potential mates. Nick dutifully sets off to meet them, but fate may have a candidate after all.','/vDluhxh8bGriK368p2G0rx32Yc6.jpg','2004-01-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Single Santa Seeks Mrs. Claus',55739,1.6035,5.9,'mqmgHnOUGbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19368,_binary '\0','/sRx1eyBP8ydHQixz5ejV09YVZrn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414055',6.8,78504,'en','Elizabeth: The Golden Age','When Queen Elizabeth\'s reign is threatened by ruthless familial betrayal and Spain\'s invading army, she and her shrewd adviser must act to safeguard the lives of her people.','/oBQ64TyPEINgVpwKWriv3QsIDJb.jpg','2007-09-09',114,'Released','Woman. Warrior. Queen.','Elizabeth: The Golden Age',4517,7.9671,6.7,'0wNboYbgYjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19369,_binary '\0','/8yIBm3FmL0uADVnttvzRBSXaxJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414078',6,9746,'en','Halloweentown High','Marnie puts her magic on the line to get several Halloweentown teenagers transferred to her high school in the mortal world. But soon, Marnie and her new friends are in trouble and out of luck when the evil Knight Of The Iron Dagger appears. He\'s determined to destroy all things magical, and it\'s up to Marnie to save her high school, the human world and her magic.','/dJsmptwkTWbxk1NwLAKeoYtcTuJ.jpg','2004-10-08',82,'Released','Too ghoul for school.','Halloweentown High',34560,5.5991,6.5,'eJD_l_K1Asc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19370,_binary '\0','/bhk57ogiqAa3sQcoJFfTDCjZfXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414161',2.8,1656,'en','Intermedio','Under the border leading into Mexico, within a labyrinth of caves, a deadly presence haunts all who enter. For four friends on an expedition, the caverns become an underground graveyard as the tortured ghosts prey upon them, one by one.','/Aqav7keW6hT7E1uLBwkvZcOiZ2V.jpg','2005-03-29',82,'Released','In the caves of Mexico... The dead bury the living.','Intermedio',30402,1.2359,4.6,'OnTi57pNHkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19371,_binary '\0','/ngjk3mR45eil3AVQY7dHVtB5KKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414177',6.7,1978,'en','Jimmy Timmy Power Hour','Mayhem reigns supreme in the animated kingdom as whiz kid Jimmy Neutron and Timmy from \"The Fairly Oddparents\" swap places in each other\'s worlds.','/oJTKUJqa9vh2ZnYpq3dlYaZn73E.jpg','2004-05-07',50,'Released','When two worlds collide... it\'s one wild ride!','Jimmy Timmy Power Hour',40706,3.2603,7,'DB7DjgV0MJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19372,_binary '\0','/oP8U3fmc6r7VsWBpcTOCGf98dAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414195',7,2164,'da','Kinamand','Keld is in a rut. His wife of 25 years has left him. For sustenance, he eats his way through the menu at the local Chinese takeaway. The owner talks him into a marriage of convenience with his sister from China and the unplanned-for happens. A delicate romance blossoms between these two damaged, fragile individuals, but a secret gives their relationship a fateful twist. A subtle and touching story of life\'s diversity.','/pKPjpEx4y61KhuF3ZE88fcxPDNs.jpg','2005-04-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Chinaman',23019,2.3328,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19373,_binary '\0','/fG4djIKlkt0vxIuF9tEGGOJ1OlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414200',6.6,1292,'nl','Off Screen','March 11th, 2002. John R. takes the head of security and 17 others hostage in Amsterdam biggest skyscraper. John R. demands to speak with the Philips head of Sound&Vision. His goal is to warn people about a large-scale fraud, aimed at brainwashing consumers by means of widescreen TV sets. In the film, we find out about John\'s preliminary frustrations, his bizarre encounter with Philips head of Sound&Vision Gerard Wesselinck, their impossible friendship, rivalry and John\'s armed attempt to force the executive to do penance in public.','/14EdFtz9gNRreYechypJRroeK4O.jpg','2005-02-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Off Screen',147241,1.7468,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19374,_binary '\0','/AeWDzyqzKpf8rJYqNgP9DuojzdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414344',6.8,1286,'en','The War Within','A Pakistani involved in a planned attack in New York City experiences a crisis of conscience.','/yCypYZ3j9fXRK5tXPUH3kSHEqL7.jpg','2005-09-30',93,'Released',NULL,'The War Within',26567,1.363,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19375,_binary '\0','/1Onam6oWyFAUCcoxtdWkACtEiNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414387',7.8,383032,'en','Pride & Prejudice','A story of love and life among the landed English gentry during the Georgian era. Mr. Bennet is a gentleman living in Hertfordshire with his overbearing wife and five daughters, but if he dies their house will be inherited by a distant cousin whom they have never met, so the family\'s future happiness and security is dependent on the daughters making good marriages.','/o8UhmEbWPHmTUxP0lMuCoqNkbB3.jpg','2005-09-16',128,'Released','Sometimes the last person on earth you want to be with is the one person you can\'t be without.','Pride & Prejudice',4348,25.5126,8.1,'Ur_DIHs92NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19376,_binary '\0','/t5Le32NekXRyWBlkYHNVkeeELhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0414426',6.1,2683,'en','Quid Pro Quo','A semi-paralyzed radio reporter is sent out to investigate a story that leads him into an odd subculture and on a journey of disturbing self-realization.','/iHVnQhe46JfQE5Kh3psDaYP7Rj2.jpg','2008-06-13',82,'Released',NULL,'Quid Pro Quo',1566