through a Ouija Board. On her second day at school, one of the spellbound bursts into flames and dies just as she sits down where Yu-jin used the board. Next day, another victim burns to death, and now the school is enclosed by horror.','/24DnruFa2Jr5j9ay6J7XiI8GOvv.jpg','2004-08-05',92,'Released',NULL,'Bunshinsaba: Ouija Board',32173,1.4281,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19403,_binary '\0','/rd53Pr2YTjhhiWEvhvLIUyHRAXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415768',5.5,3819,'hi','Dus','Jamwaal, a terrorist, plans to wreak havoc in Canada when the Indian Prime Minister visits the nation. However, a team of special agents from India are sent to catch the terrorist.','/xHT7fJEkeeNnV45pNy2jYI12qbj.jpg','2005-07-08',146,'Released','Every hour, every minute, every second... counts.','Dus',58302,2.4169,5.226,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19404,_binary '\0','/u84h5KH3J1XisLLF6UN2gtis9vX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415778',5.1,5971,'en','End Game','Secret Service agent Alex Thomas is detailed with protecting the president of the United States but, at a public appearance, everything went wrong and the president is assassinated. Wracked with guilt, he blames himself for his team\'s failure. Meanwhile, seasoned journalist Kate Crawford comes to believe there\'s a massive conspiracy afoot and convinces Alex of it. Together they unravel a treacherous web of lies as they try to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy amid the deadly threat of shadowy assassins and ex-special ops enforcers.','/1fqDXE7nxsqWCng3rwlWZwzBBBn.jpg','2006-07-27',93,'Released','The assassination was only the beginning.','End Game',9727,2.7002,5.4,'qsDQMnLR5Dc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19405,_binary '\0','/kLTCfnDwhFKCC7nZvvVsa7Tno7L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415819',6.1,1434,'ko','그 놈은 멋있었다','When high school girl Han Ye-won finds an offensive note on the internet school board left by arrogant Ji Eun-seong from vocational school, she replies even more offensively. She doesn\'t know he\'s hot-tempered and well-known as a bully. So when Ji Eun-seong starts looking for her to teach her a lesson, Han Ye-won realizes how big her mistake was.','/eTlkvJm1VPvwaFzuwKQDs61vHfy.jpg','2004-07-22',115,'Released','Unexpected date starts with one little mistake!','He Was Cool',45404,1.5145,6.6,'8pARTUv2lxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19406,_binary '\0','/5sZ87qDmWsMo7wlARI9MrpN7mh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415833',6.2,1752,'en','Hate Crime','Robbie Levinson and Trey McCoy suddenly encounter intolerance and hostility at the hands of their new neighbor, Chris Boyd, the son of a fundamentalist preacher.','/mmwd6e7mULFzDkpbqcmst1BbTgY.jpg','2005-01-14',104,'Released','Do unto others.','Hate Crime',32671,1.8665,5.7,'mSdYMIjBgyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19407,_binary '\0','/eSVh7LZP1TZBj9wOliS1qIAmuaM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415850',4.4,3372,'tr','Hırsız Var!','With the death of a billionaire engaged in illegal practices, his billion-dollar fortune is up for the grabs. As his art collection is being prepared to be sold at an auction, two Turkish thieves from Germany are hired to steal valuable paintings from the art collection. Meanwhile, Seckin the fashioner designer - also the brother of Binnur, wife of the late billionaire - prepares for a fashion show in the same hotel that the robbery is going to take place. With the intervention of police, the beautiful model and her ex-lover, a hip papparazi, the two \"Laz\" mafia bosses seeking revenge, and the getaway driver straight out of Selcuk Erdem caricatures, the robbery is bound to go wrong. Prepare for a twist at the end as the plot unfolds towards a climactic ending...','/k33lqXh6wFjYpTSRtDPE7y0Axn6.jpg','2005-02-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Robbery Alla Turca',49891,0.9714,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19408,_binary '\0','/EwziCsDeSDopdAXtqW93yA68gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415855',5.6,2309,'de','Hotel','When Irene takes a position at a hotel deep in the woods of the Austrian Alps, she soon discovers the girl she replaced vanished without a trace.','/opPhzc0wc6cW6om3lN6A01n4UBS.jpg','2004-12-03',76,'Released',NULL,'Hotel',52251,1.9197,5.658,'XxuNDa97V6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19409,_binary '\0','/dyqOb3yIF0JGoVxVoredYevxQHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415856',6.2,6818,'en','Hounddog','A drama set in the American South, where a precocious, troubled girl finds a safe haven in the music and movement of Elvis Presley.','/gHu64aEbNpkKM8Hh2NFDu45y3B6.jpg','2008-09-19',102,'Released','Every heart has an awakening. Every soul needs a song.','Hounddog',14882,3.1831,6.51,'NcXbhuOOsuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19410,_binary '\0','/qkRjxtLsoxbzqz11xgSPQ7TxSmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415908',4.8,6650,'hi','काल','After a series of deaths in Orbit Wildlife Park are attributed to a man-eating tiger, wildlife reporter Krish Thapar decides to investigate the incidents for a magazine article. But something deadlier than tigers hunts in the forest.','/dzFAY2jqODs7GXGhi590222WAyw.jpg','2005-04-29',127,'Released','Time to die','Kaal',20132,2.0413,4.735,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19411,_binary '\0','/9wExS5BkPpCNnva3oXRkw1uV4xJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415932',6.7,5552,'fr','Lemming','After the death of his boss\'s wife, a young engineer faces the sudden psychological metamorphosis of his own wife, seemingly possessed by the soul of the deceased...','/zzGmXQnc9xsFoVM1Zqqm7r4hfBp.jpg','2005-05-11',130,'Released',NULL,'Lemming',1622,2.3407,6.5,'cB4lf0huKfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19412,_binary '\0','/4pTKjspho5UBQ23zegs5MG6epbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415949',5.4,3320,'en','Keeping Up with the Steins','All hilarity breaks loose in this heartwarming coming-of-age comedy when three generations of Fiedlers collide in a crazy family reunion. As they prepare for the biggest Bar Mitzvah on the block, they begin to see that they\'re much more alike than they\'d originally thought.','/bYp81rOQZEoFfDMX6xqRU1x3R7M.jpg','2006-05-12',90,'Released','Something\'s not quite kosher','Keeping Up with the Steins',21014,2.6901,5.3,'8TKLR1_JVLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19413,_binary '\0','/hAvQYr8vpK9OlJHwn4ft0ETKzRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415965',6.7,21530,'en','Martian Child','A recently-widowed science fiction writer considers whether to adopt a hyper-imaginative 6-year-old abandoned and socially-rejected boy who says he\'s really from Mars.','/amRUHHflkZsbcvRnfJN9ZKxv8R3.jpg','2007-11-02',106,'Released','Doesn\'t matter where you come from, as long as you find where you belong!','Martian Child',5126,3.584,6.7,'Fo--9mYFpVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19414,_binary '\0','/j3moxxL3MBkJhp0imy4v1QxALwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0415978',7.2,38804,'en','Me and You and Everyone We Know','Single dad Richard meets Christine, a starving artist who moonlights as a cabbie. They awkwardly attempt to start a romance, but Richard’s divorce has left him emotionally damaged. Meanwhile, Richard’s sons—one a teenager, the other 6-years-old—take part in clumsy experiments with the opposite sex.','/hrj9VsInHnqSDBhEc2FvY0qd79F.jpg','2005-05-12',91,'Released','))<>((','Me and You and Everyone We Know',1382,3.7381,7,'t87QILBZd_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19415,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416032',6.9,1296,'bg','Мила от Марс','Fleeing an abusive relationship, Mila, a teen prostitute, finds herself in a border town, pregnant, alone, and, to her surprise, welcome. The remote village is on a marijuana plantation run by a group of elderly men and women. Not having known much kindness, she goes into emotional hiding, but by the time the baby is born she has a new life and love. Her past, however, is not far behind','/dqurmcVVX2GdTrXlbG6HXhExf8s.jpg','2004-03-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Mila from Mars',113054,1.073,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19416,_binary '\0','/m50btvvexrrDUpJjSey1C4IU1OD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416044',7.2,51780,'ru','Монгол','The story recounts the early life of Genghis Khan, a slave who went on to conquer half the world in the 11th century.','/8hlyJVMKFJNJb8QRtdfjage2tGF.jpg','2007-09-20',125,'Released','Greatness comes to those who take it.','Mongol: The Rise of Genghis Khan',12246,4.3856,6.8,'Hr_PNoCZXg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19417,_binary '\0','/tD2rd9MH4Bx9H8TdFjgJCgSY2T0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416051',5.3,2010,'en','Mr. Fix It','Lance Valenteen makes a living as \"Mr. Fix It,\" a man who gets hired by men that have just recently been dumped by their girlfriend. Lance dates the guys\' ex-girlfriend and becomes the worst date possible, sending the girl back into her ex-boyfriends arms. But when Lance gets hired by Bill Smith to get Sophia Fiori back, Lance, for the first time, starts falling for one of his marks.','/dBgEdBeMg4KDJaWGRUmPKppQg2I.jpg','2006-12-26',93,'Released','A man who tricks women into returning to their ex-boyfriends soon finds himself falling for one of his marks.','Mr. Fix It',18517,1.8796,4.9,'irf6OpHZnQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19418,_binary '\0','/6NLpgjJYXVOCfQgNhE1cgWT7z7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416185',6.7,21862,'en','Resurrecting the Champ','Up-and-coming sports reporter rescues a homeless man (\"Champ\") only to discover that he is, in fact, a boxing legend believed to have passed away. What begins as an opportunity to resurrect Champ\'s story and escape the shadow of his father\'s success becomes a personal journey as the ambitious reporter reexamines his own life and his relationship with his family.','/rJKTZf2QIhUwvqsfkher1JlLCdZ.jpg','2007-06-14',112,'Released','Based on a true story, that was based on a lie.','Resurrecting the Champ',13074,3.7657,6.3,'22yPmAd-JlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19419,_binary '\0','/40K8NpPgBqIDukExvG4yWPkYEvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416212',7.2,30018,'en','The Secret Life of Bees','Set in South Carolina in 1964, this is the tale of Lily Owens a 14 year-old girl who is haunted by the memory of her late mother. To escape her lonely life and troubled relationship with her father, Lily flees with Rosaleen, her caregiver and only friend, to a South Carolina town that holds the secret to her mother\'s past.','/m1LGEeoYfc6crbfG8WmTKg9SVqL.jpg','2008-09-17',114,'Released','Bring Your Girlfriends, Sisters, Mothers and Daughters.','The Secret Life of Bees',12837,5.2349,7.5,'WY9RvcbzTCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19420,_binary '\0','/4QCs7akSCJPOs2IYnLOTDvHFdVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416220',7.2,9384,'ja','下妻物語','Momoko, a strange and seemingly emotionless girl obsessed with 18th century France, befriends a Yanki biker and the two experience the ups and downs of their unusual lives in a rural Japanese town.','/fpmFgBElC7bDSHJwtmfJnYFyMqw.jpg','2004-05-29',102,'Released','The extraordinary adventures of a Lolita-look aficionado and a tough biker gang chick.','Kamikaze Girls',26275,4.8044,7.143,'CTR4gBMmqC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19421,_binary '\0','/cVfaHnjOOS5qX8z10qnBsslq2Oi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416236',6.5,110110,'en','The Spiderwick Chronicles','Upon moving into the run-down Spiderwick Estate with their mother, twin brothers Jared and Simon Grace, along with their sister Mallory, find themselves pulled into an alternate world full of faeries and other creatures.','/uN7MUMaCXfa8DbMMp61A8iXEcEG.jpg','2008-02-14',95,'Released','Their world is closer than you think.','The Spiderwick Chronicles',8204,9.8039,6.7,'_yTZ8E3vbsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19422,_binary '\0','/yj71c8lTZERmaiO3YBprlEukguS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416292',7.1,2100,'ru','Водитель для Веры','The film is set during 1962 in Sevastopol, Crimea, then a secret Navy Base in the Soviet Union. General Serov hires Viktor, a cadet from the Kremlin Guard to work as his private chauffeur. In a jet-black \"ZIM\" limo, Viktor is chauffeuring the General\'s disabled daughter Vera. Viktor is oblivious to the hidden agenda of the KGB agent Saveliev, who manipulates everyone behind the scenes in the old rivalry between the Army and KGB.','/8mDjCHnnZrFSbDXc1ogdzmMZ0h2.jpg','2004-07-27',105,'Released',NULL,'A Driver for Vera',64483,1.422,6.1,'ujIOIK2ye34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19423,_binary '\0','/315xehapBIRk5XCHbcTxjgUmvdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416315',6.2,85387,'en','Wolf Creek','Three backpackers stranded in the Australian outback are plunged inside a hellish nightmare of insufferable torture by a sadistic psychopathic local.','/545PYpfCeDwVgdgydHCQqXFr168.jpg','2005-09-16',99,'Released','The thrill is in the hunt.','Wolf Creek',9885,6.3729,6.233,'eMaEkGjm4dM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19424,_binary '\0','/oTOUJCvds5zFcMcgTpqlOmbq30r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416316',5.6,4405,'ru','Волкодав из рода Серых Псов','He was doomed to die, but managed to survive, and now his mission is to revenge for the annihilation of his tribe. He is the great warrior who calls himself Volkodav, and is the last man from the tribe of Serie Psi (Grey Hounds). After escaping certain death, Volkodaw — accompanied by Neletuchaya Mysh — is on a mission to kill Ludoed who is responsible to what happened to Serie Psi.','/7uWSweoe5ykaxpEmXvzaEOHQFl7.jpg','2006-12-28',136,'Released',NULL,'Wolfhound of the Grey Dog Clan',13334,2.1798,5.4,'Hrcv7kaSUwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19425,_binary '\0','/yUJf20GQ5vifhk9QDxUGotAEaLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416320',7.6,240539,'en','Match Point','Chris, a former tennis pro, takes a job as an instructor and befriends his wealthy young student, Tom. After being introduced to his family, Chris is soon engaged to Tom\'s sister, Chloe. Despite the professional and financial advantages that this relationship affords him, Chris becomes obsessed with Tom\'s fiancee, American actress Nola.','/vHjEVTD8ucuwKSFOZJeyAnTZYli.jpg','2005-10-26',124,'Released','There are no little secrets.','Match Point',116,10.3563,7.356,'yIC7Ygsy0Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19426,_binary '\0','/drK0PlCLkKUz5MmYHNHkVLPwFh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416331',6.7,2929,'de','Alles auf Zucker!','Germany director Dani Levy filmed this comedy about Jewish life in today’s Germany along side the familiar east-west conflict. With it great success this film is a joyful comedy of humor and knowledge.','/sDAVHwXZI3yMSBOqjZGtiEyfhQt.jpg','2004-12-31',91,'Released',NULL,'Go for Zucker',460,1.5945,6.2,'9hZ8a4McwQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19427,_binary '\0','/lgBZlJ1LHQel5nneNQMoesmvc7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416449',7.6,921737,'en','300','A story very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians.','/h7Lcio0c9ohxPhSZg42eTlKIVVY.jpg','2007-03-07',117,'Released','Prepare for glory!','300',1271,15.6006,7.2,'UrIbxk7idYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19428,_binary '\0','/cuuwXiiLlNd24H8eYFXTzUjybkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416471',6.1,3289,'en','American Gun','Seemingly disparate portraits of people -- among them a single mother, a high school principal, and an ace student -- Distinctly American -- all affected by the proliferation of guns in American society.','/1GikvdDanJwSQOb0oCWY5FqFTxZ.jpg','2005-09-15',95,'Released',NULL,'American Gun',15366,2.0756,5.7,'ads_cVKTC5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19429,_binary '\0','/vmDpLofmDgDx3KXTNzRc6dYROim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416496',5.7,39334,'en','Bandidas','When a ruthless robber baron takes away everything they cherish, a rough-and-tumble, idealistic peasant and a sophisticated heiress embark on a quest for justice, vengeance…and a few good heists.','/31wgXG6OxDaXbp5IzyNoUJdVS5e.jpg','2006-01-18',93,'Released','Being bad never looked so good!','Bandidas',1969,4.6057,6.1,'gEoz9mpxBVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19430,_binary '\0','/h9lQKuyioiPh6RfNsR2IyAt1b5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416499',6.9,4400,'ko','바람의 파이터','An account of karate competitor Choi Yeung-Eui who went to Japan after World War II to become a fighter pilot but found a very different path instead. He changed his name to Masutatsu Oyama and went across the country, defeating martial artists one after another. This film concentrates on the period when he is still young, and developing his famous karate style, Kyokushin.','/tp4YiskOE7aciwfPomXuruGfxnY.jpg','2004-08-12',121,'Released',NULL,'Fighter in the Wind',21115,2.8405,7.1,'7EdYQZX6YMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19431,_binary '\0','/r95IP56O3j8fz9a09x55lymr9uJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416508',7,68728,'en','Becoming Jane','Though young Jane Austen\'s financially strapped parents expect her to marry the nephew of wealthy Lady Gresham, Jane herself knows that such a union will destroy her creativity and sense of self-worth. Instead, she becomes involved with Tom Lefroy, a charming but penniless apprentice lawyer who gives her the knowledge of the heart she needs for her future career as a novelist.','/yHA6JEn57MBGp2yGFgYyopJvk2O.jpg','2007-03-02',120,'Released','Her own life is her greatest inspiration.','Becoming Jane',2977,7.666,7.3,'4w54MfAxj14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19432,_binary '\0','/3KF8IxlmBSfpLuhtz4NK3Oco5wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416675',6,3782,'en','Dark Matter','Liu Xing a brilliant Chinese student, arrives at University and makes the transition into American life with the help of Joanna Silver. Xing joins a cosmology group working to create a model of the origins of the universe. He is obsessed with the study of dark matter and a theory that conflicts with the group\'s model. When he begins to make breakthroughs of his own, he encounters obstructions.','/zu5G3J4ITaGzwGu4z6FHa32XbkK.jpg','2008-04-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Dark Matter',18031,2.466,5.549,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19433,_binary '\0','/6WgajZ9s2zX2pnpXUqn6VFfNUAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416853',5.7,2222,'ko','인형사','Five people are invited to a remote doll museum and one by one they are mysteriously killed. The survivors find out the truth: dolls have spirits, and they have come to settle scores.','/hayajVOmjk8LhqvYDHdQ7K5Ler2.jpg','2004-08-06',90,'Released','They walk. they talk. they kill.','The Doll Master',56790,1.8326,6,'naF8-ji4y8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19434,_binary '\0','/cTRmQXnJf89AeG1D0sfkZSj1uJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416854',7.2,4364,'tr','İnşaat','Two construction workers from Istanbul yearn to escape to sunny Italy and find better jobs. In an attempt to save enough money to move, they unwittingly become involved in their boss\'s shady criminal dealings. With a little twist of unexpected events their lives turns out to be far from anything they have dreamed of.','/pWobaL2rCplwQz0QAbs97lhYlgx.jpg','2003-11-21',113,'Released',NULL,'Under Construction',63237,0.8714,7.144,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19435,_binary '\0','/uuTKt6mcqtMEDeP4i7vCNcMI3jK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416871',5.8,4161,'fi','Jadesoturi','Thousands of years ago in ancient China, a man fights against his destiny. He wants another chance to be reunited with his loved one and he gets that chance, in a far away place and a far away time, in modern Finland.','/uYdcCSnJ9Mb9rruJWp4os2zF1sc.jpg','2006-10-13',105,'Released','Forge me the Sampo and you will get your loved one back.','Jade Warrior',59500,1.5856,5.095,'x6dsOJe9EfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19436,_binary '\0','/fdtGbLY9F5RWixb2mRibuMSzQXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416881',7.3,2541,'ja','ジョゼと虎と魚たち','A part-time employee in a mahjong parlour runs across a young woman, who is unable to walk, in baby carriage. He becomes friends with the woman and begins to feel enamoured with her.','/1fdnR6AHQQAVNKWFSInrSxZqBxF.jpg','2003-12-13',116,'Released',NULL,'Josee, the Tiger and the Fish',72443,2.0208,6.9,'gd9Vp1Nedes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19437,_binary '\0','/5atneVsCkiSLEtkFZPkqjEEGAVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416891',5.1,1602,'en','The Kid & I','Aaron Roman is a teenager with cerebral palsy who dreams of starring in a big-time action movie. When his father grants Aaron his wish for his eighteenth birthday, he experiences the reality a bit hard to manage.','/nr5k1hesGiVEyjlAldEGbXyL0Ba.jpg','2005-12-02',93,'Released','Get a little action.','The Kid & I',64972,2.5328,5.2,'avm4rESwujw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19438,_binary '\0','/z5RveBkq2ewRjesCRR69SkmWpFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416960',8.4,24731,'fa','مارمولک','The satirical commentary on clergymen in post-revolutionary Iran. While in prison, petty criminal Reza (Parviz Parastui) comes across a clergyman, sparking a plan for escape. Reza dons his new acquaintance\'s clerical robes and makes a bid for freedom. He soon learns that being a clergyman brings little respect from the public. Reza travels to the outlying villages, from where he plots to escape the country. However, his plans must be put on hold when the villagers accept him into their community and expect him to perform religious duties. Will Reza\'s prison break transform him into an unlikely pillar of the community?','/iDnxWhlRLab2h7nFGvuUsq0HQho.jpg','2004-02-04',111,'Released',NULL,'The Lizard',75404,1.4873,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19439,_binary '\0','/fw7CPAMk8Cums6i4Kz7EbjT3IFt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416979',6.6,3209,'pt','Meu Tio Matou um Cara','Éder is arrested after confessing the murder of a man. Duca, his nephew, is sure that his uncle confessed the crime to protect his girlfriend, Soraya, ex-wife of the deceased, so he enlists two of his friends to help prove his theory.','/kJS0v5sjb7LaVMBCSzjll5lB7d7.jpg','2004-12-12',87,'Released','We don\'t choose our relatives. Neither can we choose a great love.','My Uncle Killed a Guy',77710,1.8014,6.159,'rCm9orLayFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19440,_binary '\0','/3v7Y2bx5gSSlQGBUz9O0QX9RyRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0416991',7.6,4412,'bm','Moolaadé','When a woman shelters a group of girls from suffering female genital mutilation, she starts a conflict that tears her village apart.','/9S7lWdLExHw6LP3Vq7smiyGY5MR.jpg','2004-08-04',124,'Released',NULL,'Moolaadé',39504,1.129,7.2,'HCgCZVPQk7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19441,_binary '\0','/mZ5YlqaT0gZqXRoDkuMJfqB5OAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417001',6,34453,'en','Must Love Dogs','Sarah Nolan is a newly divorced woman cautiously rediscovering romance with the enthusiastic but often misguided help of her well-meaning family. As she braves a series of hilarious disastrous mismatches and first dates, Sarah begins to trust her own instincts again and learns that, no matter what, it\'s never a good idea to give up on love.','/252PdRj3y2S05DC4oSf2qk2vva3.jpg','2005-07-21',98,'Released','The hardest trick is making them stay.','Must Love Dogs',11648,5.1256,5.9,'6Yzk_TTBcmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19442,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417011',7.4,2862,'ta','நேருக்கு நேர்','Raghu and Shanti are divorced couple which sparks problems between both respective younger brothers.','/ziOIIjYY6826RebWErF5bDDtlrC.jpg','1997-09-01',151,'Released',NULL,'Nerrukku Ner',66197,1.2722,6.321,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19443,_binary '\0','/aGm9f3JapOcwKqxQ1I1YBOsQgh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417046',5.7,1757,'no','Gymnaslærer Pedersen','A drama focused on Norwegian society in the 1970s, an era politically influenced by Marxism and Leninism.','/VMwvljc0EAteYL0fEf6STYmGmu.jpg','2006-02-24',123,'Released',NULL,'Comrade Pedersen',33114,2.9793,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19444,_binary '\0','/kL4eu1AIu8V5XQnffeiqlA2aTBD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417056',1.7,18250,'en','Pledge This!','At popular South Beach University, filthy rich super-snob Victoria English is the absolute queen of leading Greek student club, Sigma Sigma. In order to achieve her crowning ambition, winning FHM Magazine\'s annual best sorority, she must recruit atypical \'Sigmies\' to fulfill the diversity criteria. Ambitious sycophant pledge Kristen Haas helps her attract \'losers\' (too poor, ugly, unfashionable), who are cruelly put through excruciating hazing, without intent to actually enroll them. Gloria, the brightest and most assertive pledge, wins the heart of Derek \'baby Dick\', Victoria\'s ideal, yet constantly abused boyfriend, whose bitch-addiction is cured by this alternative lover. Together they lead the revolt of the not-even-nerds.','/e3wkX38lNtjlz3R8XuKmJQIad8I.jpg','2007-02-08',91,'Released','Pledging Has Never Been This Hilarious.','Pledge This!',19213,2.9491,2.902,'J5non3F9E6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19445,_binary '\0','/tV4ASlhHNvfvhTuICH8pUOsl0Pr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417072',6.2,6611,'ko','알포인트','On 07 January 1972, the South Korean base in Nha-Trang, Vietnam, receives a radio transmission from a missing platoon presumed dead.','/93Zn3ews5S0KiChq9mW5TkrhWi9.jpg','2004-08-13',107,'Released','He who sheds others\' blood will not return... NOT EVEN HIS SOUL...','R-Point',16138,3.4098,6.621,'9b8WhQATBv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19446,_binary '\0','/wxGhAD63EM7N2YIQw9bktgQR8QM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417148',5.5,150578,'en','Snakes on a Plane','FBI agent Neville Flynn boards a flight from Honolulu, Hawaii to Los Angeles, escorting a key witness to testify against a mob boss at an upcoming trial. An on-board assassin releases a crate full of hundreds of deadly venomous snakes in an attempt to eliminate the witness. Flynn and a host of frightened passengers and crew must band together to survive the slithery threat.','/i0ynvZ89tV1t8MAL9FmeQELfXH0.jpg','2006-08-17',105,'Released','Sit back. Relax. Enjoy the fright.','Snakes on a Plane',326,9.3832,5.5,'5noedIVk8Cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19447,_binary '\0','/jBquQ2TE3OWZyDy0DGWl93m2755.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417189',7.1,9611,'fr','Le Temps qui reste','Romain, 31, a fashion photographer with terminal cancer, elects to die alone, preparing others to live past him rather than prolong the inevitable with chemotherapy or be smothered in sympathy by those who know him.','/6feRtkzLkYiVsF1BYfHQSsZ8Y5O.jpg','2005-11-24',78,'Released',NULL,'Time to Leave',2566,2.6154,6.5,'qu3pNe221xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19448,_binary '\0','/qI5d0CKsziyd08F54u8zAXDMqlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417202',7.3,4190,'ar','تيتو','Tito is the second installment in the new-wave Egyptian action movies. After Mafia by Sherif Arafa, which was a breakthrough in Egyptian cinema making, Tarek El-Aryan brings us Tito, the next logical step. Very simply, this movie is about an ex-con who tries to escape his sinful life by starting a new one, but his past comes back to haunt him. The reason, why Tito is better than Mafia is because the script and story line in Tito is more complex, and some of the characters had real depth in them and where fully developed throughout the movie.','/shzOfwyV2aN6BhQpaD9TEpc6UZf.jpg','2004-06-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Tito',140718,1.0416,7.4,'JZ2rJkUMf2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19449,_binary '\0','/bXYUq1h2GyEQhPkHSkaecCyJTBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417217',6.2,55400,'en','Two for the Money','A former college athlete joins forces with a sports consultant to handicap football games for high-rolling gamblers.','/5SedPYdGLrp6LX9C2cWXLx38w1D.jpg','2005-10-07',122,'Released','How much will you risk?','Two for the Money',9910,6.2778,6.071,'vcsdAwqZ-WI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19450,_binary '\0','/l3S9jKTD6zCegaPrVkCfSZS2xJV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417225',6.2,6060,'en','Idlewild','A reticent piano player Percival, along with Rooster, his flamboyant lead performer and manager, struggle to keep their speakeasy, in the Prohibition-era South, out of the hands of gangsters who want to take it over.','/d1KW3hrGAJCsvs2GC2MCkYebD2u.jpg','2006-08-25',121,'Released',NULL,'Idlewild',13816,2.6041,5.7,'vLn7aNjVNMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19451,_binary '\0','/ngRPqZ32pjZFt4y6lFjnsNiUSZs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417229',7.5,1280,'te','వెంకీ','Venky is headed to Hyderabad to join the police force. However, he ends up embroiled in a double murder on the train. When he joins the academy, he realises that their boss is the murderer.','/xCtw4lF84m57WIh1nIOnZvKMvKw.jpg','2004-03-26',162,'Released',NULL,'Venky',73112,1.272,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19452,_binary '\0','/rCyXAsRG3zsImzUMe6h2G0759ve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417241',7.1,3010,'ta','வில்லன்','Shiva, a bus conductor, robs the corrupt in order to fund an organisation that aids those with disabilities. To avoid detection and trial, he pretends to be his twin, who has disabilities.','/y3eoYGx9HtfYoq7AHOGAM1pQIUC.jpg','2002-11-04',157,'Released',NULL,'Villain',69417,1.0684,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19453,_binary '\0','/9CKkju9wiNYT34QL0DS2CUGLXvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417243',6.7,3688,'ja','ヴィタール','A young man awakens in the hospital after an accident wipes his memory. Fascinated by a textbook full of drawings of dissections, Hiroshi is drawn to medical school. There he catches the eye of a fellow student, but it\'s another who becomes his obsession: the dead woman on the cadaver table.','/hPRz4NBXIX7OJttBN4D6TR29MpT.jpg','2004-12-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Vital',36215,1.6586,6.7,'ve9DE1IIx-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19454,_binary '\0','/ezeQW1PTI1agRCV4Ce2CQbGmnZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417385',7.4,7867,'en','12 and Holding','Three close knit 12-year-olds - introverted Jacob, precocious Malee and vulnerable Leonard - start down the path of self-discovery and begin to distinguish their own voices from those of their parents.','/jOs1N3B7w5ASq80hvTu1m9DiPmE.jpg','2006-03-31',90,'Released','Do You Know Who Your Kids Are?','12 and Holding',18164,2.3857,6.8,'LRqF3HOPjpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19455,_binary '\0','/e6LS0VXLHc4JJLXnzPXX5Aslvrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417397',7,22677,'ru','9 рота','Russian army recruits complete training and take their posting in late 1980s Afghanistan, where the insurgents are slowly gaining the upper hand.','/yKPr5DbUZRPsdT1gOhUnTVsnplg.jpg','2005-09-19',139,'Released','They stood together while their country fell apart...','9th Company',14097,4.3773,6.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19456,_binary '\0','/EKgE2XEu6Gr6IdFX2oJ1Bm7Zqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417415',6.3,3702,'en','Aliens of the Deep','James Cameron teams up with NASA scientists to explore the Mid-Ocean Ridge, a submerged chain of mountains that band the Earth and are home to some of the planet\'s most unique life forms.','/fr93LZw0vilOK42vbWCgtekyMpQ.jpg','2005-01-28',95,'Released','The search for life beyond begins below.','Aliens of the Deep',22559,3.4205,6.057,'ax2vq4SwLGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19457,_binary '\0','/ni8i04GxVd8Yw9YuLEahx60GObL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417433',5.8,22752,'en','Annapolis','Jake Huard, from a shipbuilders family, promised his dying mother he\'d make it to Annapolis Naval Academy. Thanks to tenaciously bugging a Congressman, he\'s selected despite dubious grades. Once inside, Jake soon proves sub-standard academically. Constantly challenged to his limits, repeatedly made the \'over-cocky\' reason for the entire class to suffer, Jake nearly quits, but after facing his utterly un-supportive father\'s gloating returns just in time. Stubborn Jake finds support withs mates as well as Senor Ali, his lover-to-be, and a discipline he may excel in: the \'brigade\' boxing tournament, open to all ranks.','/hH6YeqFcihbZsz7iWl6MzQVzL8O.jpg','2006-01-27',108,'Released','50,000 Apply. 1,200 Are Accepted. Only The Best Survive','Annapolis',13275,3.9351,6.9,'jMQT5wQN-pk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19458,_binary '\0','/nhmtFsZKYFmSPexoE3JvOSIpW7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417614',6.3,2566,'en','Dreamland','A young woman who lives in a desert trailer park must choose between caring for her hapless father and sick friend or fulfilling her own destiny.','/4wp2t4oE6oqPbGC40dq7OMKTFRQ.jpg','2006-01-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Dreamland',8199,1.4254,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19459,_binary '\0','/k41nJTWy18zAWv0mGqXOfLCb7Ct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417658',6.6,15733,'en','Factotum','This drama centers on Hank Chinaski, the fictional alter-ego of \"Factotum\" author Charles Bukowski, who wanders around Los Angeles, CA trying to live off jobs which don\'t interfere with his primary interest, which is writing. Along the way, he fends off the distractions offered by women, drinking and gambling.','/qfuqZHaAFiC4N8natPXojrpXR2y.jpg','2005-04-25',94,'Released','What matters most is how well you walk through the fire','Factotum',10475,2.7566,6.147,'7QXMybzPJRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19460,_binary '\0','/rT7fJVxiVlDEgOtooVpj51OfD9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417686',2.9,1269,'en','Forest of the Damned','A group of friends go on a roadtrip and come to a stop in a forest where legend has it a group of naked bisexual female monsters lurk. Will they awaken them? And if so will they survive?','/3F7D07fOpAjclKBi3w9bZUIC0kK.jpg','2005-05-13',83,'Released','Thrown out of Heaven... They\'ll take you to Hell...','Forest of the Damned',28416,2.5573,3.3,'b9g9DLbO0OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19461,_binary '\0','/mITJS77BV4TSqdFB5FPGBc7JKXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417741',7.6,670615,'en','Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince','Dumbledore tries to prepare Harry for the final battle with Voldemort while Death Eaters wreak havoc in both Muggle and Wizard worlds.','/z7uo9zmQdQwU5ZJHFpv2Upl30i1.jpg','2009-07-15',153,'Released','Dark secrets revealed.','Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince',767,36.3329,7.7,'5ywxgP9OudI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19462,_binary '\0','/98YMyHBH0Kax7KkG7Lt08z1Ai7b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417745',4.6,2136,'en','Headspace','25-year-old Alex Borden\'s chance encounter with a mysterious stranger has found his intellect rapidly expanding, but as the power of his mind grows so too does the mystery of a brutal series of murders. Now, as the killer seems to set his sights on Alex, the frightened genius must use his newfound brain power to put an end to the mayhem once and for all.','/778KuzKdty9VQFBMgsIJRqvhin3.jpg','2005-09-18',89,'Released','Evil has many faces.','Headspace',9987,2.4068,5.1,'PniRei3ICQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19463,_binary '\0','/fhLuXmwt2cUKv8bOSLiqEZ211mT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417751',5.1,1883,'en','Her Minor Thing','Jeana does IT for the Sacramento Fire Department. She and Tom, a self-confident local TV news reporter, are about to go on a cruise to Rio when he lets slip on TV that she is a virgin. It\'s a slow news week, so this becomes a story: the media pursue Jeana, she breaks up with Tom and wants the tickets or her cruise money back, and Tom can\'t believe she\'s serious. Her path crosses that of Paul, a photographer recently arrived from Texas who\'s also Tom\'s cameraman; he\'s had six serious relationships that have ended with his heart broken. A triangle of sorts develops. Will Jeana end up with either man? Will she end up on the cruise? And what about that minor thing?','/tB11rbsJ3Ka4huSygtYV0IQ7tUM.jpg','2005-06-10',91,'Released',NULL,'Her Minor Thing',39344,2.0796,4.6,'OKZ7cobWjdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19464,_binary '\0','/g94TQSYSMLOHzOpcgItyWk8sHky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417791',7.7,16795,'en','Inside I\'m Dancing','Michael is a 24-year-old who has cerebral palsy and long-term resident of the Carrigmore Residential Home for the Disabled, run by the formidable Eileen. His life is transformed when the maverick Rory O\'Shea moves in.','/2umd8KCnjamgEk9RpSUDQ9TltbW.jpg','2004-10-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Inside I\'m Dancing',31165,3.371,7.414,'m2X4M3WT0W4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19465,_binary '\0','/yUBTO1m9TlReQ2AeiRANMDECogV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417871',5.1,3474,'de','Klimt','A portrait of Austrian artist Gustav Klimt whose lavish, sexual paintings came to symbolize the art nouveau style of the late 19th and early 20th century.','/k23zlYZptToVRMJrG7KdKSGTL6o.jpg','2006-03-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Klimt',29291,2.3207,5.2,'WbbaU5P0lL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19466,_binary '\0','/iNA6tstHf47FfVRFxedM7OBEjPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417944',6.3,5696,'it','Manuale d\'amore','Four intertwined stories on the joys and sorrows of love.','/A01c5gorpOBwrSPJU2JrBMAVTZj.jpg','2005-03-18',116,'Released',NULL,'The Manual of Love',20068,2.5295,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19467,_binary '\0','/AwlJ2bQGjfEuXLsL5XJAaxOmMuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0417976',5.6,9725,'zh','无极','An orphaned girl, driven by poverty at such a young age, makes a promise with an enchantress. In return for beauty and the admiration of every man, she will never be with the man she loves. This spell cannot be broken unless the impossible happens: snow falling in spring and the dead coming back to life. Now a grown and beautiful princess, she regrets her promise, for all of the men she\'s loved has always been met with tragedy.','/tdm4mlc27S1d72ub4Y4xcU2OlDD.jpg','2005-12-15',121,'Released',NULL,'The Promise',2008,3.0487,5.6,'9lZGyW_oqIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19468,_binary '\0','/qOx8xsS2ph3Styv93GpAVC7jOr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418004',6.5,7174,'en','Neverwas','Zach Riley is a psychiatrist, who leaves a job at a prestigious university, to take up a job at the privately run mental institution, Millwood. What he doesn\'t reveal at the time of his appointment is that this was the very place where his novelist father, T.L. Pierson, spent many years of his life.','/c5iWZcsBb3bNO2AijsXyQWXl2e8.jpg','2005-09-09',103,'Released','Every fairy tale needs its hero.','Neverwas',22473,2.3683,6.4,'XFEE0Nesuts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19469,_binary '\0','/fUod0zgyaAnNrfyKzD41WGuw0rT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418038',7.5,6331,'en','Outfoxed: Rupert Murdoch\'s War on Journalism','This film examines how media empires, led by Rupert Murdoch\'s Fox News, have been running a \"race to the bottom\" in television news, and provides an in-depth look at Fox News and the dangerous impact on society when a broad swath of media is controlled by one person. Media experts, including Jeff Cohen (FAIR) Bob McChesney (Free Press), Chellie Pingree (Common Cause), Jeff Chester (Center for Digital Democracy) and David Brock (Media Matters) provide context and guidance for the story of Fox News and its effect on society. This documentary also reveals the secrets of Former Fox news producers, reporters, bookers and writers who expose what it\'s like to work for Fox News. These former Fox employees talk about how they were forced to push a \"right-wing\" point of view or risk their jobs. Some have even chosen to remain anonymous in order to protect their current livelihoods. As one employee said \"There\'s no sense of integrity as far as having a line that can\'t be crossed.\"','/5SodI4NHGIHghH6HGfqryiNlMSA.jpg','2004-07-14',74,'Released',NULL,'Outfoxed: Rupert Murdoch\'s War on Journalism',13372,1.8623,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19470,_binary '\0','/psOtyMIfeSJebpeKiDUR1M6wto2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418110',7.2,10299,'it','Romanzo criminale','After serving prison time for a juvenile offense, Freddo gathers his old buddies Libano and Dandi and embarks on a crime spree that makes the trio the most powerful gangsters in Rome. Libano loves their new status, and seeks to spread their influence throughout the underworld, while the other two pursue more fleshly desires. For decades, their gang perpetrates extravagant crimes, until paranoia threatens to split the friends apart.','/jd06ZOSBpjfKEthqli5O2urO0nm.jpg','2005-09-30',152,'Released',NULL,'Crime Novel',14375,2.7287,7.147,'i7970XJ_HKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19471,_binary '\0','/ptPR6glb7BrwigoXuhIwqpjfhkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418239',6.9,2957,'it','Tickets','A train travels across Italy toward Rome. Onboard is a professor who daydreams a conversation with a love that never was; a family of Albanian refugees who switch trains and steal a ticket; three brash Scottish soccer fans en route to a match; and a complaining widow travelling to a memorial service for her late husband who\'s accompanied by a community-service volunteer who\'s assisting her. Interactions among these Europeans turn on class and nationalism, courtesy and decorum, and opportunities for kindness.','/kJENjmJmISO5AV2Ogu9wGy62Ldq.jpg','2005-03-25',109,'Released',NULL,'Tickets',57251,1.8614,6.426,'zViD9yRse1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19472,_binary '\0','/hp7yyC8l1yBvJrMeMFVCME2ccpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418259',6.4,4557,'it','Tu la conosci Claudia?','Claudia is married with Giovanni, a rather dull type. Meek Giacomo is happily divorced, until he meets her. Aldo is a colorful cabbie with whom she had an affair. Who\'ll win her heart?','/4MbovTjSHv2AvcK39qUaEYeNuyl.jpg','2004-12-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Have You Met Claudia?',57112,1.7867,6.733,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19473,_binary '\0','/iCDMBi6WLjUBnt24dNwHqqF81UL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418279',7.1,726802,'en','Transformers','Young teenager Sam Witwicky becomes involved in the ancient struggle between two extraterrestrial factions of transforming robots – the heroic Autobots and the evil Decepticons. Sam holds the clue to unimaginable power and the Decepticons will stop at nothing to retrieve it.','/lkZ9gqCEjzX85lKR6Jjd1uGAXNp.jpg','2007-06-27',144,'Released','Their war. Our world.','Transformers',1858,7.1856,6.846,'CbX_SIz_9fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19474,_binary '\0','/p7LCoCpGMlIjInDMGVy8kKXAR3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418325',4.4,1803,'de','Die Wilden Kerle 2','An unsupervised junior soccer team loses its ace player to the leader of a rival gang. Since only an entire team can win, they must have her back to be able to win the game against the national team. The existence of The Wild Soccer Bunch is at stake ...','/eXeD3tEC643rxlKizBT2MOQioUa.jpg','2005-02-17',85,'Released','It\'s all good as long as you\'re wild!','The Wild Soccer Bunch 2',8344,1.9936,5.7,'syq_9RB3qQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19475,_binary '\0','/h0ihknzGbE42QEk9ujUTMebFnDT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418362',6.8,19225,'hi','मुझसे शादी करोगी','Sameer, fast at losing his temper is re-located to Goa where he falls in love with Rani. But Sameer\'s new roommate Sunny, has some plans of his own.','/9PqBPlaO5wLI7LPMaJNLoIiSSSA.jpg','2004-07-30',163,'Released','How to win a girl\'s heart.','Mujhse Shaadi Karogi',20495,2.1434,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19476,_binary '\0','/iVnsOj0MtVE1lzfillNAPqCdhpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418455',7.7,59934,'da','Adams æbler','A neo-nazi sentenced to community service at a church clashes with the blindly devotional priest.','/kBP0xOOaAT9rmJZGVxrolRk87AR.jpg','2005-04-15',95,'Released','When it rains, it pours','Adam\'s Apples',1023,5.5031,7.5,'RaJdhU7qWVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19477,_binary '\0','/5qtWJ3qvxh2NZJ7Hph5Eg3E4DDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418460',6.6,11835,'hi','ऐतराज़','Raj, a married man, is falsely accused of rape by his ex-girlfriend who is also his employer\'s wife. He decides to sue her for sexual harassment despite societal pressures.','/9tVt6N7vgIFnf8g6NzaqfjkQObr.jpg','2004-11-12',159,'Released',NULL,'Aitraaz',22315,1.9167,6.07,'dkQORU9eN9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19478,_binary '\0','/ifnC2XjKGubjYzrzSOdRqQS7vzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418471',6.1,2625,'ar','عريس من جهة أمنية','A businessman who loves his daughter very much, refuses every man who proposes for her in order not to leave him. But can he refuse a man from a security entity?','/9JOrlF4qcxzdnzW7x3OuzKt3urn.jpg','2004-07-28',90,'Released',NULL,'A Groom from a Security Agency',87059,1.3871,5.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19479,_binary '\0','/A3aPjVk6PmElus8z7F4H8vM5ON5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418586',6.2,7654,'en','The Cake Eaters','The death of the Kimbrough family matriarch affects the three male survivors of the clan. Widower Easy tries to reconnect with his old flame, Marg. Eldest son and struggling musician Guy moves back to town, feeling guilty that he missed the funeral. His brother, Beagle, who was his mother\'s caretaker, falls for Marg\'s granddaughter, Georgia, a chronically ill girl who fears her time is growing short.','/tIomPiujrKChXFGNHofw8hkDGoQ.jpg','2007-04-29',86,'Released','Love is the Frosting...','The Cake Eaters',16071,2.6753,5.5,'FhRAZDFLo3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19480,_binary '\0','/pYNI8VN8OysgC8YChGUmmSZLgH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418627',2.6,5503,'en','Death Tunnel','For an initiation stunt, five college women are locked in a Kentucky hospital built in 1910 where 63,000 people died from a disease known as the \"white plague\". Deep under the hospital is the \"Death Tunnel\" which once were used to secretly remove the dead from the grounds.','/xElzRRGuSSLyUxole8UY3i80PFw.jpg','2005-10-17',97,'Released','Your initiation into terror.','Death Tunnel',9814,2.6819,3.7,'7q9YRxVEX5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19481,_binary '\0','/5ldZJsJ4xMj4PqiYH817tW5Ccpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418647',6.9,14894,'en','Dreamer: Inspired By a True Story','Ben Crane believes that a severely injured racehorse deserves another chance. He and his daughter Cale adopt the mare and save it from being sacrificed by the owner.','/7Z5FuLTrP5myJ2Dl9VzDRa6q0CG.jpg','2005-09-10',106,'Released',NULL,'Dreamer: Inspired By a True Story',12920,4.5226,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19482,_binary '\0','/wKIXa9e6EUepGz34MtrJ8EDaUFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418657',6.3,1240,'de','Goldene Zeiten','Ingo organizes a charity event for the local golf club. Special guest will be the Hollywood star Douglas Burnett. But who remembers what the aging star looks like today?','/u6lXPa9JOO7H8SYThw3xB2x7ufc.jpg','2006-06-26',129,'Released',NULL,'Out of Bounds',11406,1.2292,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19483,_binary '\0','/vscsDExaKK0oKqrYBze9Tm2oitf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418689',7.1,135152,'en','Flags of Our Fathers','There were five Marines and one Navy Corpsman photographed raising the U.S. flag on Mt. Suribachi by Joe Rosenthal on February 23, 1945. This is the story of three of the six surviving servicemen - John \'Doc\' Bradley, Pvt. Rene Gagnon and Pvt. Ira Hayes - who fought in the battle to take Iwo Jima from the Japanese.','/2nkPrhf4YIyMFelfe4zdOnGRYz5.jpg','2006-10-19',135,'Released','A single shot can end the war.','Flags of Our Fathers',3683,9.5971,6.85,'2GdDPaT2nEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19484,_binary '\0','/1lXuVrX8ZcQWHc1k192yFSNh1R7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418753',6.7,7275,'en','Inside Deep Throat','In 1972, a seemingly typical shoestring budget pornographic film was made in a Florida hotel: \"Deep Throat,\" starring Linda Lovelace. This film would surpass the wildest expectation of everyone involved to become one of the most successful independent films of all time. It caught the public imagination which met the spirit of the times, even as the self-appointed guardians of public morality struggled to suppress it, and created, for a brief moment, a possible future where sexuality in film had a bold artistic potential. This film covers the story of the making of this controversial film, its stunning success, its hysterical opposition along with its dark side of mob influence and allegations of the on set mistreatment of the film\'s star.','/iy96Ud1jpnjOEYiHh2XMooD1PfG.jpg','2005-02-11',90,'Released','It was filmed in 6 days for 25 thousand dollars. The government didn\'t want you to see it. It was banned in 23 states. It has grossed over 600 million dollars. And it is the most profitable film in motion picture history.','Inside Deep Throat',12228,3.8258,6.4,'dgXfPA1FOTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19485,_binary '\0','/ldrPNqXFaK1Qful4L3Im4UbKP7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418758',6.4,1993,'fr','Jacquou le Croquant','In 1815, young Jacquou lives an idyllic peasant life with his parents in the Périgord region of France. But one day, his childhood happiness is cruelly ended when his father is arrested, after a dispute with the arrogant Count de Nansac. With both his parents dead, Jacquou is adopted by Bonal, a kind priest, under whose influence he grows into an assured, morally upright young man. Now an adult, Jacquou has one desire. To repay the Count de Nansac for the evil he once inflicted on his parents...','/jVLkOarUiKvFSLGSTQYGkdpwN2j.jpg','2007-01-17',140,'Released',NULL,'Jacquou the Rebel',17227,1.6402,6.4,'JYJ9Tpt8Yeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19486,_binary '\0','/bQ8fRUaitJvi54O2lUT6Ta7FVHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418763',7,227257,'en','Jarhead','Jarhead is a film about a US Marine Anthony Swofford’s experience in the Gulf War. After putting up with an arduous boot camp, Swofford and his unit are sent to the Persian Gulf where they are eager to fight, but are forced to stay back from the action. Swofford struggles with the possibility of his girlfriend cheating on him, and as his mental state deteriorates, his desire to kill increases.','/6vdj47RAWOUZBkeQmqToeZ7eaio.jpg','2005-11-04',123,'Released','Welcome to the suck.','Jarhead',25,8.8376,6.7,'-aBP-c28_1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19487,_binary '\0','/bgglizDnM6MFm0F216VI7l0SoyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418773',6.9,24064,'en','Junebug','On the way to meet with an independent artist in the South, newlywed art dealer Madeleine is convinced by her husband, George, that they should stop to meet his family in North Carolina. Madeleine\'s affluent lifestyle clashes with the family, but she befriends George\'s wide-eyed and pregnant sister-in-law, Ashley, who is nearing her due date. Through the family, Madeleine gains greater insight into George\'s character.','/asC6UOPrR6OlNMiyXbeXWu08SOG.jpg','2005-08-03',106,'Released',NULL,'Junebug',1444,3.871,6.531,'mUj7k7Ypb60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19488,_binary '\0','/sGfNTBd0mIoxUFUGLP7LoJz14gX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418778',6,6071,'ja','感染','Infection takes place in a dark, isolated hospital, where one doctors mistake has led to dire consequences for a patient. In a hospital death is just a breath away.','/zCMSiJQ0iigWKaizcHN6Qv0tGqz.jpg','2004-10-02',98,'Released','Evil Is Contagious','Infection',32171,2.2877,6.379,'eGWuqC-t9xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19489,_binary '\0','/oOZtWMhJft0QvPcnJXFgGlt0Jn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418819',6.2,105637,'en','Land of the Dead','The living dead have taken over the world, and the remaining humans live in a walled city to protect themselves as they cope with the situation.','/xxp0qcZ3n2YA53SIzWilDSfIaA4.jpg','2005-06-18',93,'Released','The dead shall inherit the Earth.','Land of the Dead',11683,11.2871,6.269,'atXJB9luiko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19490,_binary '\0','/A3ycWsKLNtEDKQ6Au3K81JAQ2zm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418832',5.2,18654,'en','Lie with Me','Happily unattached, the sexually voracious Leila satisfies her desires with a host of rapidly changing bed partners, unconcerned about the emotional consequences. But that all changes when she meets an artist looking for a deeper commitment.','/qG2KYlTxTZbKcXJHMe1OG7aI4un.jpg','2005-11-11',93,'Released','Sex brought them together, now it could tear them apart.','Lie with Me',14174,7.5925,5.221,'YEkkL6-MWTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19491,_binary '\0','/AryGHYFexykTB45dLfa2B99ILmG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418879',5.2,2062,'en','Memory','Dr. Taylor Biggs is haunted by a past that\'s not his own. A hallucinatory drug gives him the power to see visions of vicious crimes, visions made all that more disturbing when he discovers that the murderous memories may belong to the father he never knew . Biggs\'s mother, whose own failing memory makes her powerless to help him unravel his family history.','/iWl7jAxhZrLojDakkaLcwmifQ63.jpg','2006-11-01',98,'Released','Sometimes memories can kill','Memory',36960,1.6528,5.3,'QLIirgLnMBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19492,_binary '\0','/krLTJD6gAsmJfgeKXiUNMi6e1Qm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418887',6.2,5581,'sr','Ми нисмо анђели 2','In this sequel of \"We Are Not Angels\", a highly successful Yugoslavian comedy, a former playboy must cope with his daughter\'s adolescence, as well as numerous boys that keep knocking at her doors. A worried father thinks she may get in type of troubles he used to cause when he was just the age of her wooers.','/vVrubShARhIdW3bzKM4HpfUjyWF.jpg','2005-01-25',89,'Released',NULL,'We Are Not Angels 2',33606,1.0126,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19493,_binary '\0','/y4fDFBsnZcb281E9VIafR3ZcEoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0418986',5.4,1284,'ar','عوكل','(Okal) is devastated when his ex fiancee is married to a rich man. After getting drunk,he finds himself in a coffin heading to Turkey. The mayor of Egyptians take him in and he falls in love with his daughter.','/77YlWDcBSh21HJikQD81GtC2gzi.jpg','2004-07-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Okal',42320,1.3603,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19494,_binary '\0','/urK6J2WurQ9NIcsAEVdCCkfoRWo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419058',7.4,32850,'hi','Phir Hera Pheri','Raju, Shyam and Baburao are living happily after having risen from rags to riches. However, they lose it all after falling victim to a chit fund scam due to their greed for more money. Soon, they find themselves in new mess and encounter eccentric and dangerous characters in their quest for a shortcut to riches again.','/c1Mvyd983ZyrU5Vf2aKEe6WncSq.jpg','2006-06-09',155,'Released',NULL,'Phir Hera Pheri',20359,2.1927,6.925,'Im_lCAsA27Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19495,_binary '\0','/ecXixOcWzgvGpCpRyYtZKcdVBWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419073',6.7,2899,'da','Princess','The story of August who loses his beloved sister Christina, a former porn star known as The Princess. He adopts Christina\'s five-year-old daughter Mia. Weighed down by grief and guilt, August breaks down and with Mia in tow, he embarks on a mission of vengeance to erase Christina\'s pornographic legacy.','/p0VozdkEdVLyhH4PZTaZCjfOcvf.jpg','2006-06-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Princess',14173,1.7367,6,'1KyB482t_pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19496,_binary '\0','/2VeMAkWhogX8A0EWN8gFwF9HTNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419146',6.4,2071,'da','En soap','32-year-old Charlotte could have it all, but she doesn\'t want any of it. When she moves away from her boyfriend, she happens to become the upstairs neighbour of a trans woman Veronica. Veronica prefers to keep to herself with her little dog and a romantic soap show on TV, while Charlotte gets through the nights with one-night stands. An assault, a new bed and some white curtains bring the two of them together.','/voJjFkkn240R0ppNljTqxeuxRgO.jpg','2006-04-07',105,'Released',NULL,'A Soap',15845,1.6841,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19497,_binary '\0','/oOb25w2xFnU6gwh538N0p7nDPoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419160',4.4,1704,'en','Spirit Trap','When five young students move into an old unoccupied mansion an inexplicable chain of events is set into motion as a mysterious spirit clock begins to tick again. As the story unfolds, revealing each student\'s dark secrets, the boundary between the real world and the afterlife is no longer clear. Will they find a way to escape or will they be trapped with the spirits forever?','/xYlBOIJOwUdgeSHDwk40RGSxSK5.jpg','2005-08-12',91,'Released','There\'s a thin line between life and death.','Spirit Trap',22060,1.462,4.4,'cw_o1PXGSCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19498,_binary '\0','/eoYqlqSKE381giHHxVafHa5eUDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419198',7,14897,'it','La tigre e la neve','Love and injury in time of war. Attilio de Giovanni teaches poetry in Italy. He has a romantic soul, and women love him. But he is in love with Vittoria, and the love is unrequited. Every night he dreams of marrying her, in his boxer shorts and t-shirt, as Tom Waits sings. Vittoria travels to Iraq with her friend, Fuad, a poet; they are there with the second Gulf War breaks out. Vittoria is injured. Attilio must get to her side, and then, as war rages around him, he must find her the medical care she needs. In war, does love conquer all?','/18ZaN20XRwG2dOJYuo8tvWdDMCR.jpg','2005-10-14',114,'Released','A love-struck Italian poet is stuck in Iraq at the onset of an American invasion.','The Tiger and the Snow',10846,3.9336,6.7,'Z50NSjFyFiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19499,_binary '\0','/2cIG1sUUHF6ec2fpaGrFRct2EAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419256',6.7,3454,'en','Wah-Wah','Set at the end of the 1960s, as Swaziland is about to receive independence from United Kingdom, the film follows the young Ralph Compton, at 12, through his parents\' traumatic separation, till he\'s 14.','/awDKSn5dEJYJZXCQuXkoaQETzE2.jpg','2005-08-17',120,'Released','Every family has its own language.','Wah-Wah',15013,2.0734,5.8,'tz4uM0rjpdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19500,_binary '\0','/cFl2vnMIneeNvKUS7waiNMV5UzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419279',7.5,2605,'zu','Yesterday','After falling ill, Yesterday learns that she is HIV positive. With her husband in denial and young daughter to tend to, Yesterday\'s one goal is to live long enough to see her child go to school.','/bAwey8xDPRZHqLVcLvqgrU0pomN.jpg','2004-09-03',96,'Released','Powerless to change the past . . . She lived to change the future.','Yesterday',6934,1.0995,7.4,'VWd9a83EBKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19501,_binary '\0','/wwjBU3s8oJtAs0qHKEcw2mDyRqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419280',6.2,4874,'ja','予言','While stopped at a roadside phone booth for transmitting his work through the Internet to the university, Professor Hideki Satomi finds a scrap of newspaper with the picture of his five-year-old daughter Nana in the obituary section.','/Aarfof4kkVvxw9aKETcOGX8vFaZ.jpg','2004-10-02',95,'Released','If you see it... you will die!','Premonition',40069,2.1487,6.3,'6O1QpCH4Jso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19502,_binary '\0','/3n4Bfg390okuusER56enINib0kL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419294',7.3,43478,'en','The Three Burials of Melquiades Estrada','When brash Texas border officer Mike Norton wrongfully kills and buries the friend and ranch hand of Pete Perkins, the latter is reminded of a promise he made to bury his friend, Melquiades Estrada, in his Mexican home town. He kidnaps Norton and exhumes Estrada\'s corpse, and the odd caravan sets out on horseback for Mexico.','/uHOEb6mo45qMSJaZqbkVa7oW1Y7.jpg','2005-11-17',121,'Released','Nobody is beyond redemption.','The Three Burials of Melquiades Estrada',8053,4.6577,7,'H3P7wiVIhWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19503,_binary '\0','/2mE3up8HbAQqXUHpGjQOiWa370E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419358',4.4,4034,'en','The Poseidon Adventure','A cruise ship succumbs to a terrorist act and capsizes on New Year\'s eve. A rag-tag group of survivors, spearheaded by a priest and a homeland security agent, must journey through the upside down vessel and attempt an escape.','/a8eznt2qshQS8qnZ70vdsM6UBeF.jpg','2005-11-20',173,'Released',NULL,'The Poseidon Adventure',28512,3.8715,5.2,'k5fjUS8WERw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19504,_binary '\0','/gxaaYsRmBSuTaiTlw2BJfqPILVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419372',6.6,2628,'en','Supervolcano','Yellowstone is a park, but it\'s also the deadliest volcano on Earth. Beneath it, a sleeping \'dragon\' is stirring. When an earthquake opens a crack for magma to seep through, other warning signs of an eruption start popping up, but they are ignored or dismissed as \'minor\'. But when they learn an eruption will happen, panic breaks out through people of the USA and the world.','/mVmVm2gZduw857yU4LR6C1nb2lO.jpg','2005-03-13',120,'Released','A true story of global disaster... it just hasn\'t happened yet','Supervolcano',18230,1.666,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19505,_binary '\0','/9n46ONadB3wz2gi2R7vR5NgRAQ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419373',3.8,1980,'en','Supernova','A international science conference is held in Australia when Dr. Austin Shepard mysteriously disappears. Dr. Shepard\'s colleague, Christopher Richardson and other people are soon faced with the reality of an impending crisis and an attempt to keep the information from the public. While a full-blown supernova does not occur, explosions on the sun cause massive damage in Australia, and is shown often in Sydney and in various other cities and countries of the world.','/jdHJKwwGE9bLLItExwN7Uzfb9aP.jpg','2005-09-05',172,'Released','The day the world catches fire','Supernova',42904,1.3365,4.3,'D_AQNiVQYog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19506,_binary '\0','/oFtbDiwugAZETEHroIugi5uwm5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419416',6.6,3008,'ar','ابو علي','When a young man on the run crosses paths with a woman escaping her own troubles, the two become unlikely fugitives. Hunted by the law and framed by the media, they must fight to prove their innocence and survive the chase.','/libwOyI3CFSUItipEDUwrDy4DYG.jpg','2005-01-19',120,'Released',NULL,'Abu Ali',300406,0.9948,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19507,_binary '\0','/newa3OKEdK8YKz4loySfHcZNjpP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419420',7.1,3443,'en','Adam & Paul','Adam and Paul are two young junkies living in Dublin and perpetually on the lookout for their next fix. During their search, they encounter various unsavoury characters and make some futile attempts at petty theft. As their day progresses, Adam and Paul get into a good share of trouble as they do whatever they can to score heroin, eventually running afoul of an imposing thug—who only drags them into more shady activities.','/o0AclBTFK6UIe536Q6WUethFsC4.jpg','2004-08-27',86,'Released','...and you thought you were having a bad day...','Adam & Paul',21810,2.0209,6.9,'F0Ja6k12Zzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19508,_binary '\0','/5SI4grWGu7Qt7zYL7I4kSXt4ktT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419422',6.8,1745,'ar','أحلى الأوقات','Ahla el-Awqat (The Best of Times) tells the story of a successful middle-aged woman (Salma, played by Hanan Tork) who is left to live with her step father after a not-so-tragic accident that claims the life of her mother. Salma goes on a quest to find out the identity of the sender of mystery letters and packages. One letter includes a picture of her and her two best friends from school (played by the Hend Sabry and Menna Shalaby), whom she has not seen for 14 years. Reunited, the girls embark on the quest of finding the identity of the sender.','/vrywPczpVUUhhc9FiCbXHQZB7LT.jpg','2004-04-04',113,'Released',NULL,'Best Times',136870,1.1105,7.396,'D3182F_mxRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19509,_binary '\0','/suJ3beeMSJgGKwPtIFcHaFw79OI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419434',7.3,3745,'en','American Hardcore','Inspired by Steven Blush\'s book \"American Hardcore: A tribal history\" Paul Rachman\'s feature documentary debut is a chronicle of the underground hardcore punk years from 1979 to 1986. Interviews and rare live footage from artists such as Black Flag, Bad Brains, Minor Threat, SS Decontrol and the Dead Kennedys.','/v0nxzzUYHrudMn32WVIYdKnxe2M.jpg','2006-09-22',100,'Released','The History of American Punk Rock 1980-1986','American Hardcore',16018,1.994,6.9,'l1ZnFT2qAJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19510,_binary '\0','/nThW8P9qB1P83p83OWG71X3mCW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419449',6,4077,'de','Antares','A deadly car crash sets off three parallel stories of women at crisis points, faltering behind the doors of the same, plain Vienna apartment block.','/jbtaESI8Jgr6Pwuaaa413YatP2V.jpg','2004-12-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Antares',47120,2.5828,6,'cACqNWpEsXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19511,_binary '\0','/laU6VZKhzIcREM7HVHcQ1YUqjl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419468',5.4,3898,'hi','बाबुल','When his only son dies in an accident, Balraaj urges his depressed daughter-in-law to marry a man who has long loved her in silence.','/301y5k764riqCJIgzs1OIh7d0MA.jpg','2006-12-08',169,'Released',NULL,'Baabul',48184,2.2833,6.041,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19512,_binary '\0','/8mQxk01VrnGpjHhbTJOUTyIZs6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419473',6.7,1650,'ar','بحب السيما','A child who loves the cinema struggles with a fanatic dad who finds everything (including cinema) a sin, and a mother who is sexually repressed.','/rWg1pg8uNWvUQ9eykKZB2zuits1.jpg','2004-06-09',124,'Released',NULL,'I Love Cinema',193422,0.9466,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19513,_binary '\0','/5eHrR3zNBpcoSOFsLmOQn9iWaym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419482',6.5,3116,'ar','الباشا تلميذ','The film revolves in the context of romantic comedy and action through the character of a police officer under covered as student in a university and befriends key students to uncover a drug distribution network within the university.','/1gVpkTX7KKz9YVXyN1ls4heWHxr.jpg','2004-01-27',110,'Released',NULL,'The Student Cop',48644,1.5794,6.4,'lhgY_oFR0-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19514,_binary '\0','/cpAgb6knQT3BZ7VtP9uyIg5kNRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419515',7,2249,'ja','血と骨','In 1923, teenager Kim Shun-Pei moves from Cheju Island, in South Korea, to Osaka, in Japan. Along the years, he becomes a cruel, greedy and violent man and builds a factory of kamaboko, processed seafood products, in his poor Korean-Japanese community exploiting his employees.','/zngpZqvE9sLbHEGGXcotQVJ7BJV.jpg','2004-11-06',144,'Released',NULL,'Blood and Bones',21966,4.5012,6.6,'r3bgJuRwwmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19515,_binary '\0','/lfbECTYqeXfsRDnxbryFTGn6O2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419641',6.1,2260,'en','Chromophobia','Encouraged by his editor to seek \'sexy stories that sell\', a reporter preys upon the private life of an erstwhile friend, with disastrous results.','/w80QHQSpygtgBXT45uP29RE8Bcf.jpg','2006-05-10',136,'Released','Don\'t live your life in black and white.','Chromophobia',17086,2.6721,5.2,'zpKODugmt2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19516,_binary '\0','/hgczcRWoHfLwnqOQ7781Z0uUIo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419663',3.8,1618,'en','Cruel World','Following his dismissal from a television reality show, a deranged young man lures a group of beautiful coeds to his abode by telling them they will be the stars of a new show he is creating. What the women do not know is that when they lose their slot on the show, they lose their lives as well.','/nwJnkCghNpjnJ6GkSDg5YYooGV4.jpg','2006-10-27',88,'Released','When You Get Voted Off This Reality Show... It\'s For Good!','Cruel World',44250,1.7782,4.5,'-qDpXm8qYwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19517,_binary '\0','/gaCrwIiqB2S0w6xDOSa76NUIawU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419677',7.5,63963,'en','Dead Man\'s Shoes','A soldier returns to his small town and exacts a deadly revenge on the thugs who tormented his disabled brother while he was away.','/sCbXlGHmonE3QEOeM7I2PRkG8y6.jpg','2004-09-29',90,'Released','He\'s in all of us.','Dead Man\'s Shoes',12877,4.0154,7.1,'4k9mkQjEzuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19518,_binary '\0','/AmEvUvU4ktoL4rb3KA94t9LyEaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419704',4.5,2387,'es','Donkey Xote','The donkey, Rucio, tells the true story of Don Quixote and defends the idea that he wasn\'t insane, but a very intelligent, passionate and enthusiastic fellow.','/ysicR8T5LLgVgzE5zG7paKJ2UHd.jpg','2007-12-05',84,'Released','From the producers who saw \"Shrek\"','Donkey X',14704,4.0867,5.4,'YcASkdv105Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19519,_binary '\0','/9EpgaLS44zlXoTSAOhGiJmkIA4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419706',5.2,125034,'en','Doom','A team of space marines known as the Rapid Response Tactical Squad, led by Sarge, is sent to a science facility on Mars after somebody reports a security breach. There, they learn that the alert came after a test subject, a mass murderer purposefully injected with alien DNA, broke free and began killing people. Dr. Grimm, who is related to team member Reaper, informs them all that the chromosome can mutate humans into monsters -- and is highly infectious.','/y50lH061yWOvEstoZRn7lYs0huk.jpg','2005-10-20',105,'Released','No one gets out alive.','Doom',8814,7.2934,5.213,'LljkKoPs1Gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19520,_binary '\0','/4aAmGZrR15CnVU0VjVuzMHNQ2eZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419749',7,38259,'en','Find Me Guilty','Based on the true story of Jack DiNorscio, a mobster who defended himself in court for what would be the longest mafia trial in U.S. history.','/8M0dkX7jOor7exKor1txoUl9Ynu.jpg','2006-03-16',125,'Released','Sometimes the best defense... is a wiseguy.','Find Me Guilty',9950,5.669,6.545,'tjlkibbkK6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19521,_binary '\0','/kADj6EdJdhZzkqh91iy6w0rSFIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419765',6.3,2375,'ar','جاءنا البيان التالي','Nader saif eldeen and Afet elsherbiny are two competing Egyptians newspaper reporters who expose the truth but the Channel Manager rejects that for fear of government.','/f6rA8VqfTlo8USJr0vnWwI83g6D.jpg','2001-06-12',126,'Released',NULL,'The Following Statement Came To Us',407215,0.7932,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19522,_binary '\0','/upkbWBq5V5FY3Xr5vnsIJv2eetf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419766',6.1,1343,'fr','Garçon stupide','This coming-of-age drama deals with a young man, realizing who he really is and which things he will never do...','/hcWAaBdY87d98s1ulqS9AR4245m.jpg','2004-03-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Stupid Boy',12453,3.0088,5.7,'5DfJAh_13ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19523,_binary '\0','/xeC3cJqCGIforWA6iIVwGWh4TZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419773',6.8,1765,'de','Gespenster','Nina, a mentally ill teenage orphan, starts a new job as a garden cleaner when she meets Toni. They fall in love but soon Toni starts betraying Nina. Meanwhile, Francoise is picked up at a Berlin psychiatric hospital by her husband, Pierre. After spotting Nina, Francoise believes that she has found her kidnapped daughter Marie, but no one believes her.','/uyr7FB8cUR6hOHjEMRGRGesb3OQ.jpg','2005-09-15',85,'Released',NULL,'Ghosts',1115,2.0794,6.1,'0SclolUcPvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19524,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419781',8.3,6833,'en','Graves End','When society turns their back on reformed felons, the town of Graves End welcomes them but when the ex-cons disappear, FBI agent Paul Rickman comes looking for them and discovers more than he expected.','/7fsIifyJpvre1nFWYtXOD7DkHd2.jpg','2005-04-22',90,'Released','Some Dark Secrets Won\'t Stay Buried Forever','Graves End',81844,1.0471,5.9,'OOQSxGjDxUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19525,_binary '\0','/hSzsvpy2l5PuuXTHZj1BawTXdN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419787',6.6,2604,'ar','همام في أمستردام','Hammaam lives with his big family in a crowded Egyptian alley. As he is jobless, he loses his girl to a rich suitor. He then decides to leave for Amsterdam where his uncle has immigrated long ago. As soon as he arrives he loses his money and passport and gets assaulted in an inn. Adriano the young Egyptian emigrant saves his neck and helps him find his uncle who dumps him. Hence, Hammaam stays with a group of young Arabs. After his tiring journey between failure and success he falls in love with a young lady who helps him fulfill his dream of buying a certain famous restaurant. As his business flourishes, he returns home to visit his family proud of his success.','/2dguERfqKOPe8zAyxYDNuma5ECZ.jpg','1999-08-17',134,'Released',NULL,'Hammaam in Amsterdam',193440,1.4933,7.029,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19526,_binary '\0','/dUEFKK9iUIjadCVLVBaP0azpLce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419843',6.4,33663,'en','In the Land of Women','After a bad breakup with his girlfriend leaves him heartbroken, Carter Webb moves to Michigan to take care of his ailing grandmother. Once there, he gets mixed up in the lives of the mother and daughters who live across the street.','/qbfVeY8sE3luiRXYZTPT9rjV6p1.jpg','2007-04-20',97,'Released','Get ready to fall','In the Land of Women',13067,3.9119,5.9,'qs43QuyMu4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19527,_binary '\0','/dpjFQgGakB4DGcJAtdnt196XJNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419881',6.5,2995,'sv','Kim Novak badade aldrig i Genesarets sjö','14-year old Erik gets sent to live with his older brother, Henry, during the summer as his mother is dying in cancer. Henry starts dating Ewa, who is married to Berra. A few days after Ewa shows up battered and bruised from an altercation with Berra, he is found dead on a nearby parking lot.','/tpVDiw0p6T67VL3v2GWzB973FW6.jpg','2005-09-23',95,'Released',NULL,'Kim Novak Never Swam in Genesaret\'s Lake',25544,1.9874,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19528,_binary '\0','/CAC2F6C6R8hZ3AoByDX6Jj2VOw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419887',7.5,85581,'en','The Kite Runner','After spending years in California, Amir returns to his homeland in Afghanistan to help his old friend Hassan, whose son is in trouble.','/dom2esWWW8C9jS2v7dOhW48LwHh.jpg','2007-12-14',128,'Released','There is a way to be good again.','The Kite Runner',7979,6.3967,7.3,'sLtavGjAOJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19529,_binary '\0','/zaQV7A4jFGKm4UjoNIgKtMxI1Qp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419909',7,1616,'en','The Last Casino','A University teacher finds three bright students and decides to teach them how to count cards to make lots of money. As they learn how to play the casinos, things get tricky when the debt owing teacher informs them that their front man wants restitution for loses in about a weeks time. The three students decide to hit all the major casinos in Ontario and Quebec until discovered.','/hgcpfMJ59TbWKFgrPLzqTZqclN4.jpg','2004-06-26',92,'Released',NULL,'The Last Casino',22085,1.3613,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19530,_binary '\0','/mGT2XVE9MjSkGeTAw3VQFwECBYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419946',4.8,37647,'en','The Marine','A group of diamond thieves on the run kidnap the wife of a recently discharged marine who goes on a chase through the South Carolinian wilderness to retrieve her.','/pONyvBJwHNg5CWu7mtsv4qaq75C.jpg','2006-10-13',92,'Released','They took his wife. Now he\'s coming.','The Marine',8975,5.4734,6,'NaYiwodqOv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19531,_binary '\0','/y7uCaIOE4u61aPWZww9iUhwb0yT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419952',6.6,1448,'nl','06/05','A fictional version of the events that led to the assassination of the Dutch politician Pim Fortuyn on May 6, 2002. The movie is based upon the book \"The sixth of May\" by Tomas Ross.','/ciBeBTiqA43cS2miZEDXmedD5FD.jpg','2004-12-15',117,'Released',NULL,'06/05',30860,0.9494,5.354,'HJQLMV3gPv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19532,_binary '\0','/hQeziDlIu7WbAiV69FIuvvu3AbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419967',7.3,1832,'en','Miracle Run','Corinne is a single mother of twin 5-year-old boys, Steven and Phillip, who are diagnosed with autism. Public school officials threaten to remove them from school due to their behavior, but through therapy, the boys are able to make major strides in their capabilities. A decade later, teens Steven and Phillip seek to prove they can handle high school while still struggling with their disorder.','/6aGx9NJAXynsDiLXch9NTXj5D3R.jpg','2004-08-09',87,'Released','She fought to give her sons an ordinary life. What they gave in return was extraordinary.','Miracle Run',58591,2.0695,7.6,'tz58HKABjwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19533,_binary '\0','/su2uztpuD0dYRJYmfLjMM8WKqBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419984',5.2,38132,'en','Mr. Woodcock','Taken aback by his mother\'s wedding announcement, a young man returns home in an effort to stop her from marrying his old high school gym teacher, a man who made high school hell for generations of students.','/tNOovj6N2C5scr0KgND0aKT2kkd.jpg','2007-09-14',87,'Released','Letting go of your past is hard... Especially when it\'s dating your mom.','Mr. Woodcock',13257,4.5913,5.071,'B7TTA63VFA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19534,_binary '\0','/iSaHKxjfcgalpXGR1sGhNfVW1pF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0419992',7.3,1413,'hi','My Brother... Nikhil','Nikhil, a bright young swimmer, finds his life falling apart after getting diagnosed with HIV. In his troubled times, he finds the support of his sister, Anamika, and his boyfriend, Nigel.','/wk3bdtdcBnMDGA0jU03R9WdtK7s.jpg','2005-03-25',120,'Released',NULL,'My Brother... Nikhil',137303,1.2593,6.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19535,_binary '\0','/ud5BO7gSbNo3E9oKPZeZ1McMdF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420015',6.7,7388,'en','Nine Lives','Captives of the very relationships that define and sustain them, nine women resiliently meet the travails and disappointments of life.','/fq2Va94FZOImNwNvz0MII3K86Py.jpg','2005-09-02',115,'Released','Every life has a story. And every story has a life of its own.','Nine Lives',16022,3.5535,6.1,'V5tYjoIagn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19536,_binary '\0','/bGU8DD03FfsEPtUpu8zgu4TTHNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420076',5.8,5369,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター アドバンスジェネレーション 七夜の願い星 ジラーチ','Ash, May, Brock, and Max come upon the festival of the Wishing Star of Seven Nights. During their enjoyment, the legendary Pokemon--Jirachi, descends from the heavens and befriends Max. Jirachi, with the power to grant any wish, is sought after by many people wanting to claim its power. One man seeks to use its legendary power to revive an ancient Pokemon known as Groudon, unaware of the dangers hidden within Jirachi\'s powers','/jbH0tIEymhyd6uk4xV4vrS6qybV.jpg','2003-07-19',81,'Released','In a world of magic and mystery, a dangerous force lies just beneath the surface','Pokémon: Jirachi Wish Maker',36218,4.3612,6.6,'eCgjWW_5SIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19537,_binary '\0','/a207j6hwf3iHiLO8ArhLIljiC1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420087',6.7,24671,'en','A Prairie Home Companion','A look at what goes on backstage during the last broadcast of America\'s most celebrated radio show, where singing cowboys Dusty and Lefty, a country music siren, and a host of others hold court.','/jVdqvd8SgPTWLdG3qc9pSlXGxQi.jpg','2006-06-01',105,'Released','Radio like you\'ve never seen it before.','A Prairie Home Companion',9526,4.505,6.3,'DE3TZSdjVFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19538,_binary '\0','/bSc0H5FhzioOCPIn67x90Q6OUjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420128',3.6,1514,'en','Riding the Bus with My Sister','A woman spends time with her developmental disabled sister after the death of their father.','/qxI7ucCdLYs6KomNf0R2siIk5ed.jpg','2005-05-01',90,'Released','For Rachel and her sister Beth, life is about to take the most unexpected turns.','Riding the Bus with My Sister',63191,1.9144,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19539,_binary '\0','/mjCTpAo0GIfK8tzt1YPJuy1dA9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420206',7.2,15087,'de','Sommersturm','Tobi and Achim, the pride of the local crew club, have been the best of friends for years and are convinced that nothing will ever stand in the way of their friendship. They look forward to the upcoming summer camp and the crew competition. Then the gay team from Berlin arrives and Tobi is totally confused. The evening before the races begin, the storm that breaks out is more than meteorological.','/7fqQmDzKGIiIk0mORANha9SsLVy.jpg','2004-09-02',98,'Released','Life happens without warning.','Summer Storm',342,2.8762,6.8,'A4YghiZxHfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19540,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420211',6.3,1488,'pt','Sorte Nula','Alberto is planning the ultimate romantic escape, but before he can catch the airplane he will endure the creepiest day of his life.','/gxg4CtnnjrY8Z5MgCORFKjl6ENU.jpg','2004-12-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Sorte Nula',50238,0.7773,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19541,_binary '\0','/d9eONXYtCmQnPWw61w9pNMGlSzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420223',7.5,246865,'en','Stranger Than Fiction','Harold Crick is a lonely IRS agent whose mundane existence is transformed when he hears a mysterious voice narrating his life.','/nCzcepubwShvZ4vbCsygQNgF2Z1.jpg','2006-11-10',113,'Released','Harold Crick isn\'t ready to go. Period.','Stranger Than Fiction',1262,6.1798,7.3,'PZpg8VII7es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19542,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420233',7.4,1801,'hr','Ta divna splitska noć','An anthology of several intertwining stories that takes place during a New Year\'s Eve celebration in the coastal city of Split, that blends together the criminal underworld, love, music and sexuality into a story about a desperate search for inner peace and one\'s place in the world, both of which may not always be far from home.','/q4ILcnRfS0bToqzvKTk2bNYV5S8.jpg','2004-07-20',100,'Released','Three parallel plots involving drugs and sex.','A Wonderful Night in Split',54925,1.7659,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19543,_binary '\0','/zsroSDR1aERgORUtbHBczq7F0Ke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420238',6.1,41676,'en','The Tale of Despereaux','Once upon a time... in the far away kingdom of Dor... lived a brave and virtuous mouse with comically oversized ears who dreamt of becoming a knight. Banished from his home for having such lofty ambitions, Despereaux sets off on an amazing adventure with his good-hearted rat friend Roscuro, who leads him, at long last, on a very noble quest to rescue an endangered princess and save an entire kingdom from darkness.','/6bBzgQ1uJabDHeGR9QvKrHvHYzG.jpg','2008-12-18',93,'Released','Small Mouse. Big Dreams.','The Tale of Despereaux',10199,7.8336,6.151,'I7b-Vfz0ga4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19544,_binary '\0','/lJ5lUT0yccP3ejklErN0HqlGMwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420251',6.9,22103,'ko','쓰리, 몬스터','Features an anthology centred on the experiences of a witch doctor, a film-maker and a disgruntled extra determined to take revenge on him, and a novelist as well as her twin sister.','/r0UzUF15suxLatzvNK3TQKxp10h.jpg','2004-08-20',125,'Released','From the Nightmares of 3 Horror Masters.','Three... Extremes',33908,3.7462,6.8,'FRcKyKTNc40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19545,_binary '\0','/b1sHfJEgP2ac8Df9UVqyJEXPex6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420260',7.2,5320,'ja','トニー滝谷','A reclusive illustrator falls in love with a young woman who addictively shops for clothing.','/hYpqldOPAeBQbfFntiHeoFdOgt7.jpg','2004-08-11',77,'Released','Loneliness is a prison.','Tony Takitani',29269,2.085,6.8,'gxdQbc9L8KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19546,_binary '\0','/lw7HSbpr9i2eRFU0dDzYrqsXJjs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420291',6.8,6098,'en','Keane','William Keane is barely able to cope. It has been six months since his six-year-old daughter was abducted from New York City’s Port Authority Bus Terminal while traveling with him. Repeatedly drawn to the site of the abduction, Keane wanders the bus station, compulsively replaying the events of that fateful day, as if hoping to change the outcome.','/9i0mdCNik76ULpWMQQ4YM6Ecpg1.jpg','2004-09-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Keane',13468,2.2509,6,'NG-jckJZxJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19547,_binary '\0','/5cxaJCzHwQisLeVewv7jiuqsVLp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420293',6.8,48402,'en','The Stanford Prison Experiment','In 1971, Stanford\'s Professor Philip Zimbardo conducts a controversial psychology experiment in which college students pretend to be either prisoners or guards, but the proceedings soon get out of hand. Based on a true story.','/orMkBkPqu7szuBRdMLUB4TWKiVV.jpg','2015-07-17',122,'Released','They were given 2 weeks. It lasted 6 days.','The Stanford Prison Experiment',308032,5.9942,6.801,'7LviGTHud5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19548,_binary '\0','/bkuCWDEVAp97j7XHftziO9ROYDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420294',5.8,82749,'en','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre: The Beginning','Chrissie and her friends set out on a road trip for a final fling before one is shipped off to Vietnam. Along the way, bikers harass the foursome and cause an accident that throws Chrissie from the vehicle. The lawman who arrives on the scene kills one of the bikers and brings Chrissie\'s friends to the Hewitt homestead, where young Leatherface is learning the tools of terror.','/hTBueN0Ru3R7brwtONenDyEMNYe.jpg','2006-10-05',91,'Released','What you know about fear... doesn\'t even come close.','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre: The Beginning',10781,8.4534,6.17,'2OKXd2j6Fmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19549,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420304',7,2320,'hi','Viruddh... Family Comes First','An ordinary 60 plus couple - Vidhyadhar Patwardhan and his wife are forced to search for their faith in human values and society after the death of their only son Amar. In the process they undergo the most testing struggle of their lives.','/yOu5GADc1xzK7pUerul59Fb2361.jpg','2005-07-22',132,'Released',NULL,'Viruddh... Family Comes First',117409,1.499,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19550,_binary '\0','/9QunkmhwvnKTw9e9Oh4TOJ9ebcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420318',7.7,5321,'pl','Wesele','Wojnar is a wealthy man who is marrying off his beautiful daughter Kasia, in a small town in present day Poland. Wojnar had to bribe the groom with a fancy car, since Kasia was pregnant by another man. At the end of the ceremony, the car is delivered by a gangster, who immediately demands the promised money and the deed to land from Kasia\'s grandfather. Unfortunately grandpa is unwilling to let go of the land. Meanwhile each of the workers at the reception demand to be paid, so Wojnar, who is very reluctant to part with his money, tries to haggle and bribe his way out of all the situations.','/nifnApRgBBbDeX4dPNPcA2Udl8j.jpg','2004-10-13',109,'Released','This is a story about love and money… but actually about love for money','The Wedding',10819,1.1923,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19551,_binary '\0','/tID8mHaMGDwh9sNydvSo3U1fdxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420332',7.8,67333,'hi','वीर-ज़ारा','Squadron Leader Veer Pratap Singh, a pilot in the Indian Air Force, rescues the stranded Zaara, a woman from Pakistan, following a bus accident, and their lives are forever bound.','/j267YqLvKAHeyykTflxzpgVgviQ.jpg','2004-11-12',192,'Released','A Love Legend','Veer-Zaara',4251,3.5712,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19552,_binary '\0','/fvl1geY63c1xoa6r6iRPARGJdJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420509',7.1,15924,'es','El aura','A quiet, epileptic taxidermist plans the perfect crime. All he needs is the right opportunity. An accident, perhaps…','/waaFS27AOSt2JvKMZyFi9m7uGKY.jpg','2005-09-15',134,'Released',NULL,'The Aura',13653,2.9754,7,'Rw3