researching his book In Cold Blood, writer Truman Capote develops a close relationship with convicted murderers Dick Hickock and Perry Smith.','/cIQUn20lUQpi70W0Z7ixezQJ7gj.jpg','2006-10-13',110,'Released','There\'s more to the story than you know','Infamous',9672,3.525,6.5,'jZw8ORyIbLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19557,_binary '\0','/tr7HF6JVIUOpu2PwtqfcnmQH8ZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420683',5.6,2642,'en','I Do (but I Don\'t)','Lauren is a divorced wedding-planner who falls for the groom-to-be.','/rlubi4HSdkVRlrBUsPiHVDE8DkY.jpg','2004-09-13',88,'Released','The perfect wedding planner is about to step into a perfect mess.','I Do (but I Don\'t)',57174,3.0303,5.7,'y7DG8YZ1Ycg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19558,_binary '\0','/qUhuu2Q6muEjlRSkv5gcfVLMqhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420740',5.9,5312,'en','A Little Trip to Heaven','Insurance investigator Abraham Holt travels to a tiny town in rural Minnesota to look into a particularly unusual insurance claim stemming from a horrific car accident. As Holt examines the scene of the wreck, it all seems a bit too perfect. And when he interviews Isold Mcbride and her shifty husband, Fred -- the impoverished beneficiaries of the massive, recently initiated life-insurance policy -- he begins to suspect that something is amiss.','/nRfJgzVdPp77Zn3gvXFEFxkdtNT.jpg','2005-12-26',98,'Released','There is no such thing as a no fault death.','A Little Trip to Heaven',15124,2.7579,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19559,_binary '\0','/xcr16SwsB2765ztzX0deFJHXSxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420757',5.5,8744,'en','Man About Town','A top Hollywood talent agent finds his cushy existence threatened when he discovers that his wife is cheating on him and that his journal has been swiped by a reporter out to bring him down.','/eorqaoGq2rU923VGJE5ZmRdWfLR.jpg','2006-06-08',96,'Released','Welcome to the deep end of a very shallow town.','Man About Town',9784,3.7256,5.2,'xWaOeqFXM-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19560,_binary '\0','/6PkzgNLKoK1Oy0j7L79JuBgl22r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420901',7.6,12481,'en','Shooting Dogs','Two westerners, a priest and a teacher find themselves in the middle of the Rwandan genocide and face a moral dilemna. Do they place themselves in danger and protect the refugees, or escape the country with their lives? Based on a true story.','/9xC2yUgqPVvoHykYuigrxLyunya.jpg','2006-03-08',115,'Released','What would you risk to make a difference?','Shooting Dogs',8588,2.3337,7.482,'k9w5RCI8PEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19561,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420966',6.5,1893,'en','Wounded Love','Wounded Love is a gripping emotional film about how a girl trapped in an troubled relationship is saved one dark night by a stranger. An artist who is lost himself. Their love gives her the strength and courage to face the darkness and save herself. But her past life isn\'t about to set her free.','/4rgPVpPrVG9APb8VzkRLGlYUG91.jpg','2004-07-28',143,'Released',NULL,'Wounded Love',1779705,1.438,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19562,_binary '\0','/ycITBchR1ZVXL0g2QIY5C9zxZmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0420982',7.2,10932,'ru','Жмурки','Sergei and Simon have to deliver a suitcase full of heroin to Mikhalych or else they will be killed. There is one minor detail: the only problem-solving technique they are familiar with is a shot in the head.','/vsPkj2gvKjggBQD25CQGAdku04s.jpg','2005-05-26',111,'Released','Who says crime doesn\'t pay?','Dead Man\'s Bluff',20994,3.1349,6.71,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19563,_binary '\0','/c8s1AXtxoiHr3dvMywMb4oCtIHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421045',5.5,3615,'en','Bickford Shmeckler\'s Cool Ideas','When his journal of bright ideas is stolen, college freshman Bickford Schmeckler has to blanket the campus in order to locate it.','/bDMVu4QS9peGUgvingjfnlBCApQ.jpg','2006-06-02',79,'Released','Solving the mysteries of the universe, one girl at a time.','Bickford Shmeckler\'s Cool Ideas',33563,2.3532,5.5,'_nRCQi0KHxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19564,_binary '\0','/pcqfU01PhwVXSFTrHlVoVfyPuOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421051',1.2,15201,'de','Daniel, der Zauberer','Evil teenager assassins Rike & Tom want to kill and film the execution of the rock star Daniel Küblböck [or Lana Kaiser to be correct], who is spiritually supported by his dead grandfather Johnny, with the support of the mysterious Baltazar! Will our well-intentioned wizard succeed to survive this Christmas related mess and learn to forgive the others while beign kidnapped and almost executed, even if that means stickin\' his finger in cakes, rollin\' in tha snow like a cat or having psychedelic music dreams? (and singin\' some bangers in the meanwhile!)','/uoB4dD1iYvBH0lCf8aYy7R1jWtS.jpg','2004-08-12',81,'Released','Loved by millions, hated by many','Daniel, the Wizard',9596,1.5131,1.6,'W2vKfxXE7_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19565,_binary '\0','/n6KcrQTZSdh8giDiYxe2EymRy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421054',5.9,71831,'en','Domino','The story of the life of Domino Harvey, who abandoned her career as a Ford model to become a bounty hunter.','/pZdIfYkM5kV5BaUDYzwzgmpUxno.jpg','2005-10-14',127,'Released','Heads You Live... Tails You Die.','Domino',9923,5.9278,5.9,'fzP2Pz3ZEfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19566,_binary '\0','/tNUM567Hrv925Z3vWXdJUjQE6Ho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421073',6.8,130510,'en','Street Kings','Tom Ludlow is a disillusioned L.A. Police Officer, rarely playing by the rules and haunted by the death of his wife. When evidence implicates him in the execution of a fellow officer, he is forced to go up against the cop culture he\'s been a part of his entire career, ultimately leading him to question the loyalties of everyone around him.','/iTO7sBfVTr7LUqiFtGeFW7g2Ncf.jpg','2008-04-10',109,'Released','Their city. Their rules. No prisoners.','Street Kings',1266,10.5612,6.667,'jdHjrd4P9Rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19567,_binary '\0','/dwxdn3ppDAn7QtaLlhGDEErWfg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421082',7.6,72213,'en','Control','The story of Joy Division’s lead singer Ian Curtis, from his schoolboy days in 1973 to his suicide on the eve of the band\'s first American tour in 1980.','/jOJiaOhwrDdwqTRZvZOhbndqHGp.jpg','2007-09-12',122,'Released','He had the spirit, but lost the feeling.','Control',5708,4.9705,7.506,'XCbOrTbBr6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19568,_binary '\0','/pLU6TeWHB1pDxRBMJagqURkIdWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421090',6.1,2557,'en','Zerophilia','Luke, a young man insecure about his masculinity, discovers he\'s a Zerophiliac, with the ability to change sex at will. Join Luke as he journeys into the extraordinary world of Zerophilia where so many crazy questions arise, only one question matters: \"Whom do you love?\"','/b8hjffkgD8MkvuY1aDPxzOPoigz.jpg','2005-10-13',90,'Released','What have you got in your genes?','Zerophilia',30548,2.4147,5.9,'mZmItt_hdFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19569,_binary '\0','/eK5yvR3qESXxwsjK8gqFv4Ezai0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421121',3.6,1408,'en','Cerberus','The breastplate of Attila the Hun is stolen as it has clues to the location of the Sword of Mars. It is said the Sword of Mars made Attila invincible and is guarded by Cerberus.','/grFI9NJo79IeIPOGgogWEKaXsQ.jpg','2005-10-29',92,'Released','Three times the terror','Cerberus',31012,1.898,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19570,_binary '\0','/qPeMXSecEnk4PFW6caRJJrJAe3b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421206',6.9,83435,'en','Gridiron Gang','Under the leadership of their counselor, teenagers at a juvenile detention center gain self-esteem by playing football together. Based on a true story.','/tTjDApg546wt8OWazvPbEhygu83.jpg','2006-09-15',125,'Released','One goal. A second chance.','Gridiron Gang',9766,8.0182,7.1,'BF25qyiEUpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19571,_binary '\0','/cPvRdthkIUhxhRQbKBk0w8UI3j7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421229',7.6,4795,'en','Mrs Palfrey at The Claremont','All but abandoned by her family in a London retirement hotel, an elderly woman strikes up a curious friendship with a young writer.','/2ltHp4xmmeWT7oRKklsD9FwF4aR.jpg','2005-11-25',108,'Released','One Chance Meeting, Two Changed Lives','Mrs Palfrey at The Claremont',47880,2.1776,6.755,'B8jM0Ef5NvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19572,_binary '\0','/5ndWXHSKcdN6uYSPOLlxnSMuAEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421238',7.3,58368,'en','The Proposition','In 1880s Australia, a lawman offers renegade Charlie Burns a difficult choice. In order to save his younger brother from the gallows, Charlie must hunt down and kill his older brother, who is wanted for rape and murder. Venturing into one of the Outback\'s most inhospitable regions, Charlie faces a terrible moral dilemma that can end only in violence.','/bbSHSJuO5XjrIKMh6QXXLTg3Yzr.jpg','2005-10-06',104,'Released','This land will be civilized.','The Proposition',16608,5.2924,7,'BL9l9W49SRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19573,_binary '\0','/1uRkvEDPvZUIGtGnJz895ajvb7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421239',6.4,167603,'en','Red Eye','An overnight flight to Miami quickly becomes a battle for survival when Lisa realizes her seatmate plans to use her as part of a chilling assassination plot against the Deputy Secretary of Homeland Security. If she refuses to cooperate, her own father will be killed. As the miles tick by, she\'s in a race against time to find a way to warn the potential victims before it\'s too late.','/ba0v2Uluo5MZe3Yto3MH9NQq792.jpg','2005-08-10',85,'Released','Fear takes flight.','Red Eye',11460,9.5944,6.4,'Z9M9mkcyO48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19574,_binary '\0','/pEhgVz9a4cMEVf7T0cFZK6veBHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421528',6.6,2026,'es','20 Centímetros','Colloquially-told story of a few days in the life of Marieta, who\'s saving money for the last operation in her change from man to woman. She works as a prostitute in Madrid and longs for a legitimate job. Whenever she builds up her savings, her housemate and best friend Tomás finds ways to spend, lose, or cost her those funds. She meets Raúl, whom she likes and who likes her; the trouble is he also likes that part of her she wants removed. If that\'s not enough, she also has narcolepsy, and when she conks out, she dreams of musical-theater numbers in which she\'s the singing and dancing star. Are these dreams always going to be 20 centimeters out of reach?','/6d9Xc34sUhLbeItvJ7nBDQcKlaJ.jpg','2005-06-10',112,'Released','How big is your dream?','20 Centimeters',40938,1.5748,5.4,'ZYL-LFwvEus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19575,_binary '\0','/fhYvbtMaQIZCOmcoAZ4ArcxfBNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421625',7.3,7274,'tr','Anlat İstanbul','Five interconnected stories set in modern-day Istanbul based on the fairytales Snow White, Cinderella, Pied Piper, Sleeping Beauty and Little Red Riding Hood.','/xRzPdw9c6g1w4GGG4MVOOS4PCtW.jpg','2005-04-11',99,'Released',NULL,'İstanbul Tales',30633,4.5743,6.821,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19576,_binary '\0','/2fswjyrY3GEzeoVn6mF8pNeNcgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421715',7.8,754385,'en','The Curious Case of Benjamin Button','Born under unusual circumstances, Benjamin Button springs into being as an elderly man in a New Orleans nursing home and ages in reverse. Twelve years after his birth, he meets Daisy, a child who flits in and out of his life as she grows up to be a dancer. Though he has all sorts of unusual adventures over the course of his life, it is his relationship with Daisy, and the hope that they will come together at the right time, that drives Benjamin forward.','/26wEWZYt6yJkwRVkjcbwJEFh9IS.jpg','2008-12-25',166,'Released','Life isn\'t measured in minutes, but in moments.','The Curious Case of Benjamin Button',4922,18.8698,7.602,'lqijVXvw7_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19577,_binary '\0','/wIQ7wsT4C1ZTzSJkA3dcCz8vkOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421729',4.9,49889,'en','Big Momma\'s House 2','FBI agent Malcolm Turner goes back undercover as Big Momma, a slick-talking, slam-dunking Southern granny with attitude to spare! Now this granny must play nanny to three dysfunctional upper-class kids in order to spy on their computer hacker father.','/wlbov6pkgySqYZilZcO54f29Dg1.jpg','2006-01-26',99,'Released','The momma of all comedies is back.','Big Momma\'s House 2',11565,11.4024,5.764,'345vOvSvGPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19578,_binary '\0','/9XGU37CXAa68sPH3bqYkH16Rp4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421974',5.7,4979,'fr','Les Chevaliers du ciel','Two air force pilots prevent a terrorist attack on the Bastille Day celebrations in Paris.','/2IMSZ2F4tfmkBIBguPWdlfpL1PV.jpg','2005-10-15',102,'Released',NULL,'Sky Fighters',10798,4.3261,6.1,'HEe3xfWfkG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19579,_binary '\0','/6Zrz2cEupZ2CRHU1coEgb2xa1hq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0421994',6.8,40117,'en','Imagine Me & You','During her wedding ceremony, Rachel notices Luce in the audience and feels instantly drawn to her. The two women become close friends, and when Rachel learns that Luce is a lesbian, she realizes that despite her happy marriage to Heck, she is falling for Luce. As she questions her sexual orientation, Rachel must decide between her stable relationship with Heck and her exhilarating new romance with Luce.','/a7CbxY3TMwFKX6awlBxhb7Es6tS.jpg','2006-01-27',93,'Released','There goes the bride.','Imagine Me & You',1544,6.2153,7.583,'oir0eyldvsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19580,_binary '\0','/8aMGsqLtJ9wfGkFRvGJSm4kUDGU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422015',7.3,9265,'fr','Le Couperet','Bruno loved his job as a middle manager at a paper company, but optimistically views being laid off as an opportunity. After two years of searching for a comparable position, optimism turns to desperation. His wife works two jobs, and their marriage slowly deteriorates as their hold on the middle class slips away. Bruno concocts a grimly audacious plan to identify and kill his fellow job applicants so that he is the only qualified person left.','/v6upsNV9GWkSn0ODM8hFpvbQNJn.jpg','2005-03-02',118,'Released','Some people would die to get (him) this job.','The Ax',34186,2.9008,6.903,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19581,_binary '\0','/7XkAU2MTHV1ifbINbcSS3P1mwG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422091',6.7,25053,'hi','धूम','A gang of bikers headed by the cool-headed and arrogant Kabir is on a robbing spree in Mumbai. ACP Jai Dixit is put in charge of the case and he recruits a bumbling bike mechanic and racer to help Jai nab them.','/A3GBoQROHP0WjU9RXzlDU0iG3be.jpg','2004-08-27',129,'Released','One brave cop... one smart thief... one cool biker... together they create... Dhoom','Dhoom',17478,2.091,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19582,_binary '\0','/ds88sDzCE13ZmGBtCfPsltd9qC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422093',5.8,17198,'en','Diary of a Mad Black Woman','Charles, an attorney, and Helen, his devoted wife, seem to have everything – money, a beautiful mansion – the American Dream. However, as Helen prepares to celebrate their 18th wedding anniversary, her life takes an unexpected twist when she comes home to find her clothes packed up in a U-Haul van parked in the driveway. Charles is divorcing her and kicks her out. Helen moves in with her grandmother Madea, an old woman who doesn\'t take any lip from anyone. Madea helps Helen through these tough times by showing her what is really important in life. Helen is forced to rediscover love, life, and religion in her pursuit for happiness.','/4w36ckDhsWFPD9XaHOOJb1ru7JZ.jpg','2005-02-25',117,'Released','Time heals the heart. Faith heals the rest.','Diary of a Mad Black Woman',16186,5.1292,6.5,'1zjWNnchvN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19583,_binary '\0','/1umTBYNmRpB4BZlPmL4W8JoYmRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422133',6,2555,'fr','Douches froides','Mickael\'s family is struggling (they don\'t have enough money to pay for hot water) however his life is full with Judo and his girlfriend Venessa. Then Mickael makes a decision to open up his relationship to include Clement his rich-kid Judo partner, starting a chain of events.','/qn8azEgsSyYuSqdP7LyQsx1Py1v.jpg','2005-06-22',102,'Released',NULL,'Cold Showers',27095,1.8341,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19584,_binary '\0','/c8NwZtZGSC8Ll7jRrBSqxx7Pzba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422236',5.5,3229,'hi','फ़िदा','It is about a man who falls for a woman involved in a major heist leading to betrayal, revenge, and a tragic ending.','/4MBbNqBbTHCtfjEEqrskZWIVfBZ.jpg','2004-08-20',122,'Released','Not all love stories have the perfect ending','Fida',166027,1.3574,5.391,'Z0xJu_yEBpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19585,_binary '\0','/nx7SzAKZWidlzggOKYTEH1U9Bon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422265',6.5,3237,'ar','فول الصين العظيم','Mohy Al-Sharqawi is a young man whose grandfather and his uncles form a smuggling gang. As Mohy is a coward who cannot go along with them, he goes to live with his mother and step-father but they send him to China to represent Egypt in a cooking competition which gets him into a lot of troubles','/xk3cOm7iRFi3kFom3zdh1c7qpKv.jpg','2004-08-08',105,'Released',NULL,'The Great Fava Beans of China',455657,1.6506,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19586,_binary '\0','/laHt3sEdpLt8Y1vrY8B13woemYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422272',6,18525,'en','Fragile','Haunted by memories of a patient\'s death, a nurse takes a job at an antiquated hospital for children. Soon she learns that the kids fear a ghost that prowls the floors and will not allow anyone to leave. Amy tries to protect them and convince the other staffers of the evil that lurks there.','/s7gCOegufXiQR48IhuTsPNy0Fav.jpg','2005-10-14',101,'Released','A ghost story.','Fragile',11348,2.9358,6.543,'Ux2TQ3hMEO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19587,_binary '\0','/xkyqLhklybD8BnWHOJo22jliJD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422295',6.3,16804,'en','Fur: An Imaginary Portrait of Diane Arbus','In 1958 New York Diane Arbus is a housewife and mother who works as an assistant to her husband, a photographer employed by her wealthy parents. Respectable though her life is, she cannot help but feel uncomfortable in her privileged world. One night, a new neighbor catches Diane\'s eye, and the enigmatic man inspires her to set forth on the path to discovering her own artistry.','/62Owq5NVXvhgEqTklu1oMwTWQUL.jpg','2006-08-30',122,'Released','A love story.','Fur: An Imaginary Portrait of Diane Arbus',18615,4.3345,6.1,'SODvv2xxvgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19588,_binary '\0','/yICYSIMIXSqUeWpghbgMo4AzYZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422319',6.4,2114,'ar','غبي منه فيه','To make ends meet ahead of marrying his sweetheart, a man goes into the burglary business with her uncle — but his incompetence gets them into trouble.','/nlMavs7h4gsan6GtnEZy9yisuKW.jpg','2004-06-28',90,'Released',NULL,'A Natural Born Fool',301121,1.0427,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19589,_binary '\0','/wSFbFtoEmb9vziQVatktYi585gf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422320',8.2,19336,'ta','கில்லி','Muthu Pandi, a village strongman, decides to marry Dhanalakshmi, and begins his quest by eliminating everyone who opposes their union - starting with both her brothers. In desperation, Dhanalakshmi decides to escape from the village, and in the process is unwittingly assisted by a university Kabaddi player Velu.','/aUvUohnBgX5sbuMKNyKDAPAoVNc.jpg','2004-04-17',168,'Released',NULL,'Ghilli',63647,1.4271,7.1,'-I4H71WYW-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19590,_binary '\0','/icCdJnjPt2RaazHBG7JbcSGwfId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422370',5.9,1258,'ja','グシャノビンヅメ','Luchino\'s routine morning elevator ride up from her subterranean home on level 138 to her school many stories above turns horrific when the elevator operator is ordered to pick up two passengers from floor 99, the maximum security level. What starts as psychological manipulation soon turns wholly physical as both the cruel convicts and Luchino\'s own dysfunctional past are unleashed. And then every passenger must fight for his or her survival.','/1dr7hmURza1r2Dxhit2wraeFkJX.jpg','2004-02-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Hellevator: The Bottled Fools',49037,1.3112,5.491,'V1qCXRT-aek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19591,_binary '\0','/ni1CHXAZjmi8P588hEmEvr96uKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422401',5.7,36690,'en','Hatchet','When a group of tourists on a New Orleans haunted swamp tour find themselves stranded in the wilderness, their evening of fun and spooks turns into a horrific nightmare.','/lkh3Fwruds78feXfP1Zb9kBLydL.jpg','2006-04-27',84,'Released','Stay out of the swamp.','Hatchet',11908,4.3758,5.8,'3C33S_cqiJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19592,_binary '\0','/abj02BoR8pA6rZH85PMkeZLX8AI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422460',5.4,1815,'tr','İki Genç Kız','Escaping from their dysfunctional families, Behiye and Handan become best friends. Their euphoria will soon be replaced by regrets and eventual betrayal as class differences resurface.','/8Ac3hbgRNEjwYSiEpT3nBk34Azg.jpg','2003-08-14',107,'Released',NULL,'2 Girls',63239,1.0985,5.2,'AsAtxANerms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19593,_binary '\0','/7wDjGVCKHJLEwj53gxESNs9xG6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422491',6.6,2336,'fr','L\'Intrus','An emotionally cold man leaves the safety of his Alpine home to seek a heart transplant and an estranged son.','/zGsSkKVZq8RRB2TDuqfeqqYnyL2.jpg','2005-05-04',119,'Released','Your worst enemies are hiding inside, in the shadow, in your heart.','The Intruder',47143,1.0341,6.5,'GsLUmjA5pKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19594,_binary '\0','/9qWf12Pw93BUmpjeg0MgfmdYmwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422528',6.5,5787,'en','Sarah Silverman: Jesus Is Magic','Sarah Silverman appears before an audience in Los Angeles with several sketches, taped outside the theater, intercut into the stand-up performance. Themes include race, sex, and religion. Her comic persona is a self-centered hipster, brash and clueless about her political incorrectness. A handful of musical numbers punctuate the performance.','/uKuAGLz9eUWw3tnuXPRChpK7lYI.jpg','2005-02-11',70,'Released',NULL,'Sarah Silverman: Jesus Is Magic',16156,1.7217,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19595,_binary '\0','/mIlBJSY2AKCzW7nzbqsXfaX8Xlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422689',5.1,2702,'ta','மதுர','A vegetable vendor takes care of an elderly woman and her two young daughters, but he has a dark past that wants to catch up with him.','/oCykBqQkGwFK90SldyT6ILdwLXN.jpg','2004-08-29',160,'Released',NULL,'Madurey',63644,1.3405,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19596,_binary '\0','/6CFqrtP5EYSNA8lMFhIwgh2Xy3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422704',7.2,1282,'en','The Making of \'Kill Bill Vol. 2\'','The documentary of Kill Bill Vol.2, and how it was made. This is a documentary found on the DVD of Kill Bill Vol. 2. It consists of interviews, behind-the-scenes footage, and clips of the movie.','/grgHYamcm8EnxJp7mp6lzWUTLCH.jpg','2004-08-10',26,'Released',NULL,'The Making of \'Kill Bill Vol. 2\'',1145722,1.7118,8.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19597,_binary '\0','/yQX4E5VWf5MJzWgkDkdmfH9TlcY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422708',7.2,2433,'ar','ملاكي اسكندرية','When a woman is accused of a high-profile murder, a young lawyer takes on her defense, only to uncover a web of secrets, deceit, and hidden motives. As he digs deeper, the case becomes more personal—and far more dangerous than he ever expected.','/wK4022PbFe31NqSOe6uwCDDKvXd.jpg','2005-06-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Alexandria, Private',300420,0.9509,7.013,'p-7EduMu7zA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19598,_binary '\0','/9hxBNoRjEDZGjyR1JpmmtxJWmVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422720',6.5,133679,'en','Marie Antoinette','A retelling of the story of France’s iconic but ill-fated queen, Marie Antoinette - from her betrothal and marriage to Louis XVI at fifteen to her reign as queen at nineteen and ultimately the fall of Versailles.','/cybXGmv8Rjd5Os8Xml6YxMBQ0Zt.jpg','2006-05-24',123,'Released','Rumor. Scandal. Sex. Fame. Revolution.','Marie Antoinette',1887,10.0608,6.69,'yBWyKRoh98U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19599,_binary '\0','/kRuJtn6xhM7PxtC8YU9s0jdPOJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422774',4.4,24251,'en','Are We Done Yet?','Newlyweds Nick and Suzanne decide to move to the suburbs to provide a better life for their two kids. But their idea of a dream home is disturbed by a contractor with a bizarre approach to business.','/uZ9NZh4zB80phMxo5PucFyWagjG.jpg','2007-04-04',92,'Released','New house. New family. What could possibly go wrong?','Are We Done Yet?',10172,8.107,5.8,'Op8AlTe5Js8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19600,_binary '\0','/zw3Z9TklwXDlyMUynymAholGFjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422778',5.2,4351,'en','The Muppets\' Wizard of Oz','A young woman named Dorothy Gale dreams of becoming a singer but is unable to pursue her dreams. After being swept up by a tornado with her pet prawn Toto, Dorothy embarks on a journey to meet the Wizard of Oz, the person who both Dorothy and the citizens of Oz believe can help make her dream come true.','/gpPaN0kRKDVX9Vj8VgxsJyvxe8T.jpg','2005-05-20',100,'Released','Everyone\'s Favorite Story Becomes One Twisted Tale.','The Muppets\' Wizard of Oz',20910,3.1372,5.2,'SSlCCufCjWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19601,_binary '\0','/os1ZQgSgSEdDdKY3GQJtGNos87o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422779',3.7,4806,'en','Murder-Set-Pieces','A ferocious, misogynistic, and morally deprived serial killer is active in Las Vegas. Obsessed with the collapse of the Twin Towers, and with Nazi tendencies, he even targets underage girls.','/pvKVDtMLCsWMKtOq4YhraROmC9b.jpg','2004-12-04',105,'Released','Going to hell is easy—it’s getting out that’s hard','Murder-Set-Pieces',29559,2.6383,3.9,'nWJoidS7HVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19602,_binary '\0','/sr4b1mf98CKf0FYOcIbOmdJva5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422783',7.2,6270,'en','Music Within','After a confrontation with one of his idols dashes his dreams of studying public speaking in college, Richard Pimentel joins the Army and ships off to Vietnam. During his service, Richard loses nearly all of his hearing. Joining a new circle of friends, including a man with cerebral palsy and an alcoholic war veteran, Richard discovers his gift for motivational speaking and becomes an advocate for people with disabilities.','/9KwG84rESQbWjnY3nuQ7vVleC6Q.jpg','2007-01-05',94,'Released','Experience a movie that will make you believe anyone can change the world.','Music Within',14820,1.6434,6.5,'vRetit-e-l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19603,_binary '\0','/gXgsgMf2zNQ5I889QezABB5K6bE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422861',5.5,6796,'en','The Oh in Ohio','Frustrated with their relationship, Priscilla and Jack decide to take a break. While Jack moves into a new place of his own and starts dating a student, Priscilla discovers the joys of self-pleasuring and finds an unusual bedmate.','/4R2wqT72RApomtBnfYG4BUpyoGh.jpg','2006-03-30',88,'Released','One woman\'s story is about to climax.','The Oh in Ohio',14474,2.9527,5.254,'RnUQWxYJY3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19604,_binary '\0','/1X3g1nNPPwOXoNYl6UOjSo6OnqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422908',7.2,2045,'ta','பம்மல் கே. சம்பந்தம்','When Sambandham gets hurt, Dr Janaki performs a surgery in order to heal him. However, during the surgery, Janaki accidentally leaves her wrist watch in Sambandham\'s stomach.','/ypJ9WzEyriBqer4Z2z12HicdIta.jpg','2002-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Pammal K. Sambandam',66344,1.2645,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19605,_binary '\0','/oMuOoatSWwGDtCzFmuKeIOLUdOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422934',6.5,1905,'ta','பேரழகன்','A hunchbacked phone booth operator loves a blind street dancer and wants to help her regain her sight. His lookalike is a constable in love with the commissioner\'s daughter.','/kjVa2WukH3MGLiDVFMuPuiYOzjN.jpg','2004-04-16',148,'Released',NULL,'Perazhagan',77013,1.1884,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19606,_binary '\0','/mPFDNxIsuyWes97b7PjX1jKLx6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0422950',6.1,2571,'hi','फिर मिलेंगे','Tamanna Sahni (Shilpa Shetty) is a dedicated staff member of a top advertising agency, her ideas and designs have mainly contributed to the success of the agency. She leaves for a college reunion and meets her college sweetheart Rohit (Salman Khan). They rekindle their love for each other and share some intimate moments together. Eventually Rohit leaves and Tamanna settles back into her normal daily routine. When her sister, Tanya, has an accident she decides to give her own blood to save her. However her doctor, Dr. Raisingh (Revathi), tells her that she has been tested positive for HIV. Tamanna\'s world turns upside down and she desperately tries to get into contact with Rohit but in vain. Her situation is soon spread around the office and she loses her job. Angered by her unfair dismissal she searches for a lawyer to fight her case. Eventually Tarun Anand (Abhishek Bachchan) agrees to represent her...','/5W3BAwtHLgCkoXxg2bt5YzYoXup.jpg','2004-08-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Phir Milenge',161214,1.3174,4.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19607,_binary '\0','/pDu79URb96QRt3fqgGKnP5pVKXO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423034',6.2,1367,'ja','乱歩地獄','An anthology film consisting of four segments based on literary works by Edogawa Ranpo.','/xktqY1aq0944nlcAcXcQt38XOpn.jpg','2005-05-11',134,'Released','4 chilling tales into the mind of madness.','Rampo Noir',47408,1.747,5.7,'gBnbuoI7S_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19608,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423087',4.4,1918,'hi','Rok Sako To Rok Lo','A town in India has two schools, Valley High School, which is for the wealthy students, and Bharti High School for the middle-class. The annual sports fest has been always dominated by the Valley High School.','/bIkPG26DiP9bGYImcLC6SLrIfat.jpg','2004-12-10',NULL,'Released',NULL,'Rok Sako To Rok Lo',532017,1.4624,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19609,_binary '\0','/w6aLqgY8Cl4SgoJMoGmoviNYJ0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423166',7.6,1879,'fa','شب‌های روشن','A young university professor, who leads a quiet and reclusive life and fills his life with reading and teaching literature, meet a young girl who has altered the course of her life for the sake of a man she loves. She has promised to meet her beloved at a certain spot on four consecutive nights exactly one year after their last meeting. The young professor\'s encounter with the young and passionate girl during four nights brings about significant changes in both of their lives and beliefs. Now concepts like love, literature and expection have a new meaning for them.','/7Rmu8bfe5kl27e8NVopzkshbKg2.jpg','2003-11-26',103,'Released',NULL,'White Nights',409703,1.4343,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19610,_binary '\0','/pDRXjQ532gFVJWErdmhjvbMVLgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423169',6.6,12420,'en','Sherrybaby','After serving time in prison, former drug addict Sherry Swanson returns home to reclaim her young daughter from family members who have been raising the child. Sherry\'s family, especially her sister-in-law, doubt Sherry\'s ability to be a good mother, and Sherry finds her resolve to stay clean slowly weakening.','/iD7wuJwk4PscXIAR8dkJ9ANsqgO.jpg','2006-09-08',96,'Released','No one makes it alone','Sherrybaby',13075,2.2695,6.1,'713Ce4DlRn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19611,_binary '\0','/yT9InNC3DOwWHw6WGwQ3KUBqx21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423176',7.1,3800,'zh','世界','At Beijing World Park, a bizarre cross-pollination of Las Vegas and Epcot Center where visitors can interact with famous international monuments without ever leaving the city’s suburbs, a security guard betrays his dancer girlfriend by pursuing another woman.','/opwNfPbhwQxJYEOI80xfdiOq5sh.jpg','2004-09-01',140,'Released',NULL,'The World',41292,1.5841,7,'-lYKRFrytwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19612,_binary '\0','/Y50RfoNVKIj9dSJavE8uBdN377.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423294',6.7,104304,'en','Surf\'s Up','With a documentary crew in tow, Cody Maverick—a young surfer from Antarctica—travels to the pacific for his first professional competition. Determined to earn respect and live up to his idol, Big Z, Cody pushes himself to the limit. But all that changes when an encounter with a laid-back local forces him to rethink his values.','/tTDsCVlDA8QR4Dc6t6nERfwl5z.jpg','2007-06-08',85,'Released','A major ocean picture.','Surf\'s Up',9408,10.8609,6.5,'7mPdQRXFiPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19613,_binary '\0','/vFLekZuWMx6SwwDCqVrC1qlErTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423310',7.4,3592,'he','הכלה הסורית','In Majdal Shams, the largest Druze village in Golan Heights on the Israeli-Syrian border, the Druze bride Mona is engaged to get married with Tallel, a television comedian that works in the Revolution Studios in Damascus, Syria. They have never met each other because of the occupation of the area by Israel since 1967; when Mona moves to Syria, she will lose her undefined nationality and will never be allowed to return home. Mona\'s father Hammed is a political activist pro-Syria that is on probation by the Israeli government. His older son Hatten married a Russian woman eight years ago and was banished from Majdal Shams by the religious leaders and his father. His brother Marwan is a wolf trader that lives in Italy. His sister Amal has two teenager daughters and has the intention to join the university, but her marriage with Amin is in crisis. When the family gathers for Mona\'s wedding, an insane bureaucracy jeopardizes the ceremony.','/utTi2nN47xzt4SUmTUQzVXGuAlu.jpg','2004-11-11',97,'Released',NULL,'The Syrian Bride',22238,1.5596,6.75,'s0PkVJegZZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19614,_binary '\0','/hvPdS0mZUFt0qzviqlET9WjWhOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423382',6.1,3571,'sv','Tjenare Kungen','A story about a young girl who leaves her hometown to pursue her dream of becoming a famous punk artist.','/k7K0PGTnDeOBd03R0Xi3oFyaPHw.jpg','2005-09-16',94,'Released',NULL,'God Save the King',49717,1.0702,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19615,_binary '\0','/8MWKVstOmGUlCsS80iPTHDH7N22.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423409',6.7,13709,'en','A Cock and Bull Story','Steve Coogan, an arrogant actor with low self-esteem and a complicated love life, is playing the eponymous role in an adaptation of \"The Life and Opinions of Tristram Shandy, Gentleman\" being filmed at a stately home. He constantly spars with actor Rob Brydon, who is playing Uncle Toby and believes his role to be of equal importance to Coogan\'s.','/ww8nEKv3gPOfIkRMGS2A3j566Fr.jpg','2005-07-17',94,'Released','Because everyone loves an accurate period piece.','A Cock and Bull Story',8435,4.068,6.2,'6VtAJ6aYqMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19616,_binary '\0','/g64XkhIXpVZV1HeJJENieUuEKM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423455',6.3,11352,'en','Hemingway & Gellhorn','Writer Ernest Hemingway begins a romance with fellow scribe Martha Gellhorn.','/b3fdkG3S8z6ibGOIVZYWvQlZPl0.jpg','2012-08-27',155,'Released','We were good in war. And when there was no war, we made our own.','Hemingway & Gellhorn',111839,5.1703,6.1,'pWFuQlLqqZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19617,_binary '\0','/hiOw3abXEDNy0chgRADcrnnyRTr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423470',8,4411,'ta','வசூல் ராஜா MBBS','A goon, Rajaraman, enrols himself in a medical college to fulfil his father\'s dream. He defies the college rules and creates problems for Dr Vishwanathan.','/fJwUMkSMHGhvJmGnbXhxL1goz9u.jpg','2004-08-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Vasool Raja MBBS',48760,1.216,6.818,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19618,_binary '\0','/1OkfsGuEMv6yMjc2BUiDFxqXLce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423510',7.4,3580,'en','Warm Springs','Franklin Roosevelt, left a paraplegic from polio at 39 years of age, seeks out a miracle cure in the backwoods of Georgia.','/8tOtXpn4SeXqgaLpfocsRddSqBo.jpg','2005-04-30',121,'Released','The greatest challenge FDR faced was the one we never saw.','Warm Springs',46661,2.7799,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19619,_binary '\0','/41Rb2oIImEdLvrB4CMQgxmiNON7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423515',2,1713,'en','Way of the Vampire','Dr. Abraham Van Helsing is granted immortality by the Catholic Church until he can hunt down the last vampire prince.','/hB2Fzh6owoJPijSYwEJAmBDb5Jo.jpg','2005-02-22',90,'Released','The battle between good and evil ends tonight.','Way of the Vampire',28516,1.925,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19620,_binary '\0','/9N4FGao2fiG9s3j4M43PSXyRmDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423853',7.8,1522,'en','Be Here to Love Me','Chronicles the fascinating and often turbulent life of Townes Van Zandt.','/gjep5rHAkBTrL8VXFSEjMM8yJko.jpg','2004-09-13',99,'Released','What would you sacrifice to follow your dream?','Be Here to Love Me',37416,2.3595,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19621,_binary '\0','/nqY8yuxLU4K9cSCQpsW4PGyotlN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423866',7.9,61804,'ko','빈집','A drifter lives in people\'s houses while they are away and repays them by doing chores for them. His life changes when he meets a beautiful woman who wants to escape her unhappy marriage.','/hr8ghKbdo3UGUROYafpN38Sohfe.jpg','2004-10-15',88,'Released','In the quietness of empty houses, love finds a voice.','3-Iron',1280,4.9438,7.817,'S-S5n0JniDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19622,_binary '\0','/tvm6H8wpLv66kNZiVHUr08rEZXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423877',5.2,1356,'fr','Boudu','A modern remake of Renoir\'s classic film. Aix-en-Provence, a spring night. Christian Lespinglet, an over-indebted gallery owner, rescues a homeless man, Boudu, from the waters of a canal who was trying to drown himself. Heroic to his detriment, he brings him home, for a few hours only... The incongruous arrival of Boudu will act like a mad dog in the game of skittles that is Christian\'s life...','/givvJ7jorPyQ6nO9lnPx99HsBr4.jpg','2005-03-09',104,'Released','we have a BIG problem','Boudu',14644,1.6363,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19623,_binary '\0','/eCK6auUIfnQnIQ5ufVIl7fvllOb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0423977',6.9,68474,'en','Charlie Bartlett','Awkward teenager Charlie Bartlett has trouble fitting in at a new high school. Charlie needs some friends fast, and decides that the best way to find them is to appoint himself the resident psychiatrist. He becomes one of the most popular guys in school by doling out advice and, occasionally, medication, to the student body.','/l0jr9jSIW2TYFuunPtDQ1exyjtI.jpg','2008-02-22',97,'Released','Popularity is a state of mind.','Charlie Bartlett',8669,3.9495,6.682,'b_DVwLq0wn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19624,_binary '\0','/7xQk3HdCvkNmk3gblDGn9fVnbsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424095',6.6,151435,'en','Flushed Away','London high-society mouse, Roddy is flushed down the toilet by Sid, a common sewer rat. Hang on for a madcap adventure deep in the sewer bowels of Ratropolis, where Roddy meets the resourceful Rita, the rodent-hating Toad and his faithful thugs, Spike and Whitey.','/ahVxu86XwxMp8RkartqY4B3mK9l.jpg','2006-10-22',85,'Released','Someone\'s going down','Flushed Away',11619,16.788,6.344,'VhpmWK1nVck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19625,_binary '\0','/rITe4QKJAqrhl4fJChLv3epEIVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424129',6.5,1974,'en','Gunner Palace','American soldiers of the 2/3 Field Artillery, a group known as the \"Gunners,\" tell of their experiences in Baghdad during the Iraq War. Holed up in a bombed out pleasure palace built by Sadaam Hussein, the soldiers endured hostile situations some four months after President George W. Bush declared the end of major combat operations in the country.','/tImyhiczrnlmNVbONZiOXDieF4Y.jpg','2004-09-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Gunner Palace',30856,0.6908,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19626,_binary '\0','/9uYq1A9mx4wvQ8J6OF8BXUntciQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424136',7,175235,'en','Hard Candy','Hayley’s a smart, charming teenage girl. Jeff’s a handsome, smooth fashion photographer. An Internet chat, a coffee shop meet-up, an impromptu fashion shoot back at Jeff’s place. Jeff thinks it’s his lucky night. He’s in for a surprise.','/uHTmlcivbPeclEdmtuQg3zOQWPS.jpg','2006-04-14',104,'Released','Strangers shouldn\'t talk to little girls.','Hard Candy',2652,6.0825,6.804,'hvx0m2SeOSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19627,_binary '\0','/5ChBhGXIX7RgOMSjIlXgBp6UjMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424205',7.6,34512,'fr','Joyeux Noël','France, 1914, during World War I. On Christmas Eve, an extraordinary event takes place in the bloody no man\'s land that the French and the Scots dispute with the Germans…','/9Ka8lKCIiWjnZiMslPQeakS5UhW.jpg','2005-11-09',116,'Released','Without an enemy there can be no war.','Joyeux Noel',11661,5.0558,7.4,'KRrr-CDXijs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19628,_binary '\0','/iHtydgatlWw0G4IvGbYAkmJRNnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424227',8,23024,'ku','کیسەڵەکانیش دەفڕن','Turtles Can Fly tells the story of a group of young children near the Turkey-Iraq border. They clean up mines and wait for the Saddam regime to fall.','/iNJxHYyFpmqRjgZ4oa5qQna904i.jpg','2006-12-28',98,'Released',NULL,'Turtles Can Fly',8340,3.2898,7.8,'y6K2osE1NJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19629,_binary '\0','/5ypSneaQCsoz3IYscDQFToUODRr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424237',6.8,5247,'fr','Lila dit ça','Chimo develops a crush on the pretty, blond Lila, a girl who recently moved into his Arab ghetto with her aunt. When the leader of a rival gang also falls for Lila, the ensuing love triangle initiates a journey of sexual discovery -- and sets off a chain of devastating events.','/ev79tc0AdNRzn2e0m8uq3C2Qhsy.jpg','2005-01-26',89,'Released',NULL,'Lila Says',46825,1.7071,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19630,_binary '\0','/ArIoeXp9mIxPJHqOvehURsqIcrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424287',6.1,2163,'en','The Mostly Unfabulous Social Life of Ethan Green','Ethan Green (Daniel Letterle) has no problem finding guys who want to sleep with him or even date him, but finding someone to settle down with is a different story. Given three choices -- a sexy teenager, a hunky jock, or his ex-boyfriend who is about to get married -- will he find a Mr. Right, or is he destined to an unfabulous existence. Based on a popular gay-themed comic strip.','/pbZx18g9NlDzvsCCkajRbZu16cJ.jpg','2005-04-29',88,'Released','You think you have dating problems...','The Mostly Unfabulous Social Life of Ethan Green',33358,2.0567,5.4,'R0iKNZThLoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19631,_binary '\0','/nP7emwF9QnXBROiuzJpHrJCdXA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424297',5.6,1671,'de','NVA','Somewhere in the GDR, in 1988: young soldier Henrik Heidler starts his service in the National People\'s Army, a whole new world. Together with the weighty troublemaker Krüger, Heidler and his fellow soldiers try to somehow do their time between old hands and bureaucrats. It\'s not always fun, because the superiors are annoying with socialist propaganda from the day before yesterday, the material and equipment is scarce and not exactly new, while morale is at rock bottom. His relationship with his girlfriend isn\'t holding up either. But then Heidler meets Marie, the daughter of commander Kalt of all people, and falls in love. And then, at some point, the Wall comes down and everything changes ... for everyone in the NVA!','/ktayJKqGW7xvEPCsIWnQR2UtNv0.jpg','2005-09-29',94,'Released',NULL,'NVA',11514,1.3219,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19632,_binary '\0','/2EcRtl3bB9oCpaPiLnhgglYUtAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424338',5.6,2333,'fr','Palais royal !','Eugenia is the queen of an imaginary European country. When her husband dies, quite unexpectedly, the country is left without a king. According to the law, the new king needs to be married so that leaves out the eldest son. Her youngest son, Prince Arnaud is married to the lovely Armelle and they have two young children. They become the future rulers of the kingdom.','/2qMAOpqTH1RE6Jfp24tHPNuxDb6.jpg','2005-11-23',100,'Released',NULL,'Royal Palace',32390,2.0195,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19633,_binary '\0','/9qaTlXgurqg85Ya5AW4Ab8RixqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424345',7.3,145149,'en','Clerks II','A calamity at Dante and Randall\'s shops sends them looking for new horizons - but they ultimately settle at Mooby\'s, a fictional Disney-McDonald\'s-style fast-food empire.','/cLSW0nW94XT0DmBS69ublcLfQ9c.jpg','2006-07-21',97,'Released','With no power comes no responsibility.','Clerks II',2295,5.4772,6.9,'JeAgPiCi94o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19634,_binary '\0','/9aw7LtaLLjGns8uQqR6SR2b0BvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424430',7.2,4045,'ja','世界の中心で、愛をさけぶ','While searching for his fiancee Ritsuko, Sakutarou rediscovers through flashbacks the void deep within him caused by the events from his high school days.','/aoQyo9jszUXm0r04zEsazfRSprh.jpg','2004-05-08',138,'Released',NULL,'Crying Out Love in the Center of the World',36091,2.2794,7.2,'51CIGPLaKEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19635,_binary '\0','/xnouFRIm4E1HvZPhAJoSUgEbi04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424434',7.6,6983,'fa','شهر زیبا','Akbar, 18, has been held in a rehabilitation centre for committing murder at the age of sixteen. Now, Akbar is transferred to prison to await the day of his execution. A’la, a friend of Akbar, tries desperately to gain the consent of Akbar’s plaintiff so as to stop the execution.','/8NXGJn5NafFNI3DHH1uTXZsefrW.jpg','2004-06-09',101,'Released',NULL,'Beautiful City',89065,1.8208,7.694,'8hi2cirzz-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19636,_binary '\0','/sr9YJyOLcpsUzJDKmPpUMN5C9AP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424565',7.8,3263,'en','The Wild Parrots of Telegraph Hill','A homeless musician finds meaning in his life when he starts a friendship with dozens of parrots.','/kBLgd1Ep3oUItLHj23s6vGHAO80.jpg','2003-10-09',83,'Released',NULL,'The Wild Parrots of Telegraph Hill',17592,0.5784,7.2,'BvWYhAGxfW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19637,_binary '\0','/awLJ9PPxYtvyN6aOz45amueRwsU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424769',6.6,2436,'ar','عبود على الحدود','Abboud lives a reckless life with his two friends. He knows that he will not enter the army because he\'s an only child. But when his father marries another woman who gives birth to a boy, Abboud is forced to join the army in spite of being unfit, working at the border with his friends.','/qVS0DrO1VjZ4gMEAizoaAeZLVAh.jpg','1999-07-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Abboud on the Border',514120,0.82,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19638,_binary '\0','/qQNGhBijPIBlFkGwjtQk6sflml9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424774',3.9,47190,'en','The Adventures of Sharkboy and Lavagirl','Everyone always knew that Max had a wild imagination, but no one believed that his wildest creations -- a boy raised by watchful great white sharks and a girl with the force of a volcano -- were real. Now, these two pint-sized action masters will show Max that even an ordinary kid has what it takes to be extraordinary.','/xpFbHSkRgOxOoutKqXob9T8iBPA.jpg','2005-06-10',92,'Released','Smaller heroes. Just as super.','The Adventures of Sharkboy and Lavagirl',14199,7.823,5.22,'mJP65NQwII8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19639,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424789',6.5,2017,'da','Allegro','Famous pianist Zetterström returns home to his native Denmark, to give a concert, just to find out that the choices he has made in his life have affected his love life greatly.','/pO56LKrodEJPWbDOC9RWHLr94wj.jpg','2005-09-30',88,'Released','Allegro dwells on the romantic world in which character flaws and personal mistakes alter one\'s universe.','Allegro',52473,1.2145,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19640,_binary '\0','/cUDzGeQ5d4LVDu8ma1z9U02fo3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424823',5.4,47717,'en','Balls of Fury','Randy Daytona was a child ping pong prodigy who lost his chance at Olympic gold when his father is murdered by the mysterious Feng over a gambling debt. 15yrs later he\'s down on his luck and scraping a living doing seedy back room shows in Vegas; when the FBI turn up and ask for his help to take down Feng... who just happens to love Ping Pong.','/obrDHxgyGcrbCpKbfsqOICeYy7S.jpg','2007-08-29',90,'Released','A huge comedy with tiny balls.','Balls of Fury',9750,4.433,5.3,'UAZUiH5wJhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19641,_binary '\0','/i7SkG3M5Qhxxm9aRTJNaZkfqX5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424863',5.2,1752,'en','The Book of Revelation','An erotic mystery about power and sex, the entanglement of victim and perpetrator, and a man\'s struggle to regain his lost self.','/aE0ZjITXuqjn02JfRVS2J6tfgKS.jpg','2006-07-29',118,'Released','A secret he would not share. An obsession he could not control. A mystery he dare not resolve.','The Book of Revelation',44440,2.4918,5.2,'x28fSk1oaV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19642,_binary '\0','/eKglj2LzjbhURehNfw5qJ2iO8Ud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424873',3.1,4073,'tr','Büyü','A group of archeologists are determined to make digs on a ghost town to find an old book, ignoring that the town is cursed due to events occurred about seven hundred years ago. An evil spirit comes to haunt this team...','/fYVgFl8498tqEkJOej6jUeFwzLN.jpg','2004-12-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Büyü',32314,1.0735,3.2,'-73xnrIHG7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19643,_binary '\0','/r8J1GUYKfNFQhpg3dMhXwtmr6PL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424880',7.2,50133,'en','Candy','A poet falls in love with an art student, who gravitates to his bohemian lifestyle — and his love of heroin. Hooked as much on one another as they are on the drug, their relationship alternates between states of oblivion, self-destruction, and despair.','/9DvrEg2p3Hrdr1uGe0t7kRraWjl.jpg','2006-05-25',116,'Released','More is never enough.','Candy',4441,4.3687,7.1,'tdo-bnAM3Po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19644,_binary '\0','/inRtRgbluqwv4V735g3HctR18QV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424885',4.1,1422,'en','Celsius 41.11','This film attempts to correct the record when it comes to the left\'s attacks on President Bush, 9/11 and the war in Iraq and Kerry\'s 20-year tenure in the Senate.','/lsmYA3XniqkQUHWVPpD9uVb8VX2.jpg','2004-10-22',72,'Released','The Temperature at Which the Brain Begins to Die','Celsius 41.11',210864,1.7293,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19645,_binary '\0','/7b3cLZjiOIR8pqjnF2g2GkBwcZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424908',6.7,14508,'en','Copying Beethoven','Serving as Ludwig van Beethoven\'s copyist gives a conservatory student access to the composer\'s musical genius, but also exposes her to his cruelty.','/xplAbPXhZF9B3H4OnhjQsEKUESe.jpg','2006-09-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Copying Beethoven',1590,3.3861,6.5,'AZI9HFVy8Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19646,_binary '\0','/38kf3uz8Py0GfIAcrdy2JHHIF6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424938',5.4,6757,'en','Karla','Based on real events, Canada\'s most notorious serial killers, Paul Bernardo and wife Karla Homolka kidnap, sexually abuse, and murder three young girls.','/mzKbHdw4pXs4QBsNE77LXEbJhZ7.jpg','2006-01-20',99,'Released','Evil has a beautiful face.','Karla',9695,2.6861,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19647,_binary '\0','/r9BH2ERcQaP0xj3Ovi6MSnqf5h7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424958',5,1457,'en','Disaster! The Movie','A spoof of disaster films, an asteroid is coming towards earth and Harry Bottoms is in charge of saving us all...again...','/dwlmGCjwoADJExxnGRe7ODhRru4.jpg','2005-11-04',83,'Released','Stopping obstruction from here to uranus.','Disaster!',22817,2.4935,5.2,'Y7a6aOC0YdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19648,_binary '\0','/ILltzCMveyyJOneM7m0cJGtyEk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424971',6.7,2636,'da','Drabet','A college professor abandons his family and his career in order to champion his mistress, a student radical accused of killing a policeman.','/8JKV4aELfPXVlk3OK8WQSilbNRS.jpg','2005-08-26',100,'Released',NULL,'Manslaughter',15840,1.9897,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19649,_binary '\0','/x3Os9Hap9uEOiicb1rJ7o01cGBs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424986',8,4983,'ar','الناظر','Ashour, Salaah’s father, runs his school with severity and cruelty. after Ashour\'s death, Salah inherits the job and lets Sayed, his deputy, take charge. Hussein the teacher makes a great effort to guide Salah to succeed in managing the school and achieve good results, while salah is dealing with his trust issues and his need to prove himself by getting out of his father\'s shadow. with the help of Hussien, his girlfriend Wafaa, and his two friends Atef and Lemby .. can he run the school his own way?','/LCfNyXpldwNCC127HkwNP3I8Mm.jpg','2000-07-26',122,'Released',NULL,'The Headmaster',415488,1.8128,7.87,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19650,_binary '\0','/oCGXjcyvJ110utQrtHGJn4fethQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424992',7.1,2159,'de','Emmas Glück','Upon being informed that he is fatally ill with cancer, Max, who works at a used car store, steals money which his boss has gained through illegal means. When fleeing from the scene of the crime Max crashes his car. He is pulled unconscious from the destroyed vehicle by a homely young woman, Emma, who lives alone on a farm where Max decides to stay in order to hide from the police and his boss.','/56shiMeNu2OJNU03eXgQrPYhNx.jpg','2006-07-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Emma\'s Bliss',1543,1.2817,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19651,_binary '\0','/kXdV5vphVB9vU6T4BCa4fNQLWDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0424993',5.6,53561,'en','Employee of the Month','When he hears that the new female employee digs ambitious men who are the store employee of the month, a slacker gets his act together but finds himself in competition with his rival, an ambitious co-worker.','/vfALEF9wz4CEep071iOwM5Qqd17.jpg','2006-10-06',103,'Released','In order to get the girl, he\'s gotta get his shift together.','Employee of the Month',9794,6.5822,5.6,'uq96WOiaL08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19652,_binary '\0','/6ogrLzrUbeJn1zPbfIHgAfWHYf3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425027',6.7,4975,'en','Flywheel','Jay Austin wants to sell you a used car, but watch out! Many victims have fallen prey to his smiling face and hasty promises. Austin does everything his way until his dishonesty and manipulation are exposed. Like many men, he becomes disgusted by the masks he wears and the lies he tells. In every man\'s life, there can be a turning point. When Jay makes his turn, he never looks back.','/5M5h80QGQq5BXxcpoT1wkaxPdwm.jpg','2003-07-25',120,'Released','In every man\'s life, there is a turning point','Flywheel',17345,1.3541,7.2,'jG68TDaM8js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19653,_binary '\0','/sQWa3aLPZXYDt7qv2k1IUBTbuRE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425055',5.7,3221,'en','Game 6','Combining real and fictional events, this movie centers around the historic 1986 World Series, and a day in the life of a playwright who skips opening night to watch the momentous game.','/nwXLO5SWMt7xTIPhPMcM1qBZJxg.jpg','2006-03-10',87,'Released','Where were you on that night?','Game 6',80919,1.6723,4.6,'MDaL6g9F0No','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19654,_binary '\0','/u0yaNgikY92zkI0t3fiEGZP3UWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425061',6.5,240415,'en','Get Smart','When members of the nefarious crime syndicate KAOS attack the U.S. spy agency Control and the identities of secret agents are compromised, the Chief has to promote hapless but eager analyst Maxwell Smart to field agent. He is partnered with veteran and capable Agent 99, the only spy whose cover remains intact. Can they work together to thwart the evil world-domination plans of KAOS and its crafty operative?','/sZUjbtUS8qxXp4mj90evnqPJqX7.jpg','2008-06-19',110,'Released','Saving the world...and loving it.','Get Smart',11665,16.8486,6.218,'-fYuByCXniA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19655,_binary '\0','/kJUEtm3qsmbe8KFfOTiTqpzil4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425079',7.7,11207,'tr','Gönül Yarası','A retired teacher who returns to Istanbul after years away, Nazim tries to reacquaint himself with his hometown, which has changed significantly. While waiting for his pension to begin, Nazim takes a temporary job as a taxi driver and frequently ends up in the seedier parts of the city. …','/qeWO3ttq8lw32PL1m1yDxubRYmF.jpg','2005-01-07',142,'Released',NULL,'Lovelorn',29934,1.5388,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19656,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425080',6.1,2736,'tr','Güz Sancısı','When a nationalistic wealthy landowner\'s idealist son falls for a non-muslim prostitute, he finds himself in a conflict between his feelings and politics under the shadow of the events of September 6th-7th in 1955, the Istanbul Pogrom.','/7rb7BJV4ZiliODgXj9Djlkxf3UZ.jpg','2009-12-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Pains of Autumn',52178,1.13,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19657,_binary '\0','/csNqKEjOTKpIH8jht9HYGMKfTid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425090',6.5,1451,'ar','الحاسه السابعه','A young man wants to be a professional Kung-Fu player but figures out that the game is not popular in Egypt. He meets a fortuneteller who helps him to read and hear other’s thoughts.','/v3ohnpGik9QZh1qnOtShy4x00e6.jpg','2005-12-10',112,'Released',NULL,'The Seventh Sense',429612,0.9786,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19658,_binary '\0','/8s1YuZt26RsVNJbXy9nfDBjHWto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425094',6.6,1607,'en','Heavens Fall','Successful New York attorney Sam Leibowitz travels to the South in 1933 to defend nine young black men accused of raping two women on an Alabama freight train.','/q0SCPx3yl0rWllrR7iCr7PMlsiq.jpg','2006-07-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Heavens Fall',34898,2.702,7,'Ls8kROp2NBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19659,_binary '\0','/9rMSCFH9zhv1vILpEZQlUJs9iUm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425112',7.8,572761,'en','Hot Fuzz','Former London constable Nicholas Angel finds it difficult to adapt to his new assignment in the sleepy British village of Sandford. Not only does he miss the excitement of the big city, but he also has a well-meaning oaf for a partner. However, when a series of grisly accidents rocks Sandford, Angel smells something rotten in the idyllic village.','/zPib4ukTSdXvHP9pxGkFCe34f3y.jpg','2007-02-14',121,'Released','Big cops. Small town. Moderate violence.','Hot Fuzz',4638,14.7809,7.571,'L6PKkxn7pq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19660,_binary '\0','/k63j5qexRlpD3wxzETKfuZRVWiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425123',6.7,128556,'en','Just Like Heaven','Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Masterson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she\'s a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she\'s alive.','/2cLbyVNhEEaUJGg7rfbLtX6454I.jpg','2005-09-16',95,'Released','It\'s a wonderful afterlife.','Just Like Heaven',9007,10.4379,7,'pLp2tgybrKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19661,_binary '\0','/goc7dmAlxsK12eyuiHn3KqwBhyj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425151',5.8,1717,'en','Jimmy and Judy','Two misunderstood suburban kids challenge society and run from the police while documenting all of their deeds with a digital camera.','/eCrr9LMCYpHlKzzKNXlTcMBs9xD.jpg','2006-02-05',99,'Released','Love. Obsession. Murder. Caught on tape.','Jimmy and Judy',18869,1.7662,4.8,'eDZ7cCzde-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19662,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425162',8.2,3650,'ml','കാഴ്ച','Pavan is a boy who reached Kerala after he lost everything in the Gujarat earthquake on the Republic Day. Operator Madhavan happens to meet the boy among the beggars. Initially he dislikes the boy but soon he becomes a part of Madhavan\'s family. But soon they must part with him as the Govt. decides to send him back to Gujarat. Can the family bear that?','/5G2kSiEpgTu1s0t24KmiiuAKuxq.jpg','2004-08-27',138,'Released',NULL,'Kaazhcha',152784,1.3145,7.63,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19663,_binary '\0','/pUAJksayX1ggtD0R9598UHlR0rU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425196',6.3,6666,'en','Like Minds','A forensic psychologist must determine if a minor should be charged with murder.','/k7qCS5UPuDoUK2ElxFHW8Vbz9UO.jpg','2006-08-03',110,'Released','Fear and evil make deadly companions.','Like Minds',15714,3.581,6.4,'cmDNEiS7VlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19664,_binary '\0','/ShDHEWiJ4NL6ldn4W2m3bEkIBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425210',7.7,341321,'en','Lucky Number Slevin','Slevin is mistakenly put in the middle of a personal war between the city’s biggest criminal bosses. Under constant watch, Slevin must try not to get killed by an infamous assassin and come up with an idea of how to get out of his current dilemma.','/x21s3p5wPww534nYj1cWakTcqz4.jpg','2006-02-24',110,'Released','Wrong time. Wrong place. Wrong number.','Lucky Number Slevin',186,11.5401,7.475,'oYOiObTFtNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19665,_binary '\0','/a0FdVLFrrNuoATac7IIpLF8ycY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425235',7.3,3073,'da','Drømmen','A drama about a boy who\'s inspired by Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. and challenges repressive school authority in 1969 Denmark.','/n0MQPx5v2gCWqe9XbHKY6FFzuYl.jpg','2006-03-24',105,'Released',NULL,'We Shall Overcome',1838,1.2134,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19666,_binary '\0','/1gXEZDdsYnPLTKeLSrnuBhz7o5h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425236',5.8,2186,'en','Mary','The filming of a movie about Jesus’ death deeply affects three people — an egotistical director who cast himself as Christ, the actress playing Mary Magdalene who cannot bring herself to leave Bethlehem and a TV journalist whose spiritual doubts start to consume him.','/h8BwKOM75G8AOd1Z4zL0AWfI0zS.jpg','2005-11-18',83,'Released','It takes courage to walk in the truth.','Mary',64942,3.0832,5.8,'54pJe7wmLcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19667,_binary '\0','/po6hhqUxsey9qmTdlPLVpF6LkY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425253',5.8,9140,'en','Mini\'s First Time','Desperate to be free from her drunken, unloving mother Diane, the beautiful, scheming young Mini seduces her stepfather Martin and soon convinces him to join her in a sadistic scheme to have Diane declared insane. But their conspiracy soon escalates to murder and when John Garson, a young detective starts investigating, Martin and Mini begin to turn on each other.','/8LSbj1iwkxM7AZRTKxCxfdmE4Lt.jpg','2006-07-14',91,'Released','Sex. Murder. Blackmail. There\'s a first time for everything.','Mini\'s First Time',15314,2.884,5.5,'y10Pt1tWoGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19668,_binary '\0','/2Jef5u8tRHZCNC3wPhbwljoPGzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425308',6.1,4665,'en','Noise','A man who is being driven crazy by the noise in New York City decides to take vigilante action against it.','/gQJIimohAmY7oYXwMaxH1LVTzIq.jpg','2007-11-06',92,'Released',NULL,'Noise',15661,2.1463,5.8,'87pHHFMtVE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19669,_binary '\0','/dp9o4vhRCVURm9IGK04EcpBLUGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425321',7.5,8033,'ar','عمارة يعقوبيان','The lives of residents in an old Cairo building, \"The Yacoubian Building,\" are affected by issues like corruption, extremism, class disparity, and sexuality. Through diverse characters, the film offers a critical examination of Egyptian society.','/iA0XY4w6Nn7mDVfal7tAgKHqfTu.jpg','2006-06-01',161,'Released',NULL,'The Yacoubian Building',44085,1.7425,7.342,'Q4PHTUM9o9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19670,_binary '\0','/joINrtNt9cHnRY4dUQAKt88P4xj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425326',7,12667,'en','Outsourced','After his entire department is outsourced, an American novelty products salesman heads to India to train his replacement.','/mbsjim3GhRn1nPwbJ9GOkj2PKIV.jpg','2007-09-28',102,'Released','Todd just lost his job. Now he has to find his life.','Outsourced',7861,2.1591,6.4,'LImhTTFu4b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19671,_binary '\0','/uIwBNtrEHCr3t6mAQlzCr9rrmPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425333',8.1,24820,'tr','Pardon','Based on a true event, Pardon tells the tragicomic story of three friends who end up in prison when they are mistaken as members of a terrorist organization. Ibrahim\'s fear of uniforms makes him runaway whenever he sees one. Because of this, police mistakes him with a terrorist and takes him and his friend Muzo into custody. Fooled by the police during the interrogation they name another friend, Aydin, in hope of saving themselves. As they all end up in prison, they remember the families and lovers they left behind.','/9c5ZnVJvh5pZ5blwQRQ3fhVtlFG.jpg','2005-03-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Pardon',64433,1.62,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19672,_binary '\0','/mRqM7jaTPCdzRELR5sjOMgiDDwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425379',7.3,21487,'da','Pusher 3','Milo is aging, he is planning his daughter\'s 25th birthday, and his shipment of heroin turns out to be 10,000 pills of ecstasy. When Milo tries to sell the pills anyway, all Hell breaks loose and his only chance is to ask for help from his ex-henchman and old friend Radovan.','/kLBQtXaKv9LDh7ie4yIvgrv5TmD.jpg','2005-08-22',108,'Released','I\'m the angel of death.','Pusher 3',11330,7.2103,7.18,'d99iy7uHe8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19673,_binary '\0','/pPFGjPnQMBziFSSi96dphqC7yx5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425395',5.4,4768,'en','Relative Strangers','An uptight professional meets his lower-class biological parents for the first time.','/y7mk0AZKRqJoclcgRBaVfz7tDZz.jpg','2006-05-01',84,'Released','You can\'t pick your parents.','Relative Strangers',14930,2.7085,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19674,_binary '\0','/lfNNJkJJXjkRke18vsgCH4a0nu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425413',6.5,72020,'en','Run Fatboy Run','Five years after jilting his pregnant fiancée on their wedding day, out-of-shape Dennis decides to run a marathon to win her back.','/2MZNPXJquIG8OcwajiR8YkCr7ak.jpg','2007-09-06',100,'Released','Love. Commitment. Responsibility. There\'s nothing he won\'t run away from.','Run Fatboy Run',7942,5.5343,6.2,'OnJkCPpIngs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19675,_binary '\0','/wvPnmHoIC5NT3JHt8G4qQn0C8J6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425426',6.3,4933,'tr','Şans Kapıyı Kırınca','Kuddusi Yurdum, a minibus driver, competes in a TV quiz show to win a grand prize for his family. After narrowly missing the final question, they accept a consolation trip to Barbunya Island, where unexpected and funny adventures await.','/8A1PjDxSgL6Jv3fVavRzsc0L85K.jpg','2005-01-28',107,'Released',NULL,'When Luck Breaks the Door',331128,1.1853,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19676,_binary '\0','/7S6lCJ9ztPUY63mztz0g6toufsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425430',5.4,43048,'en','The Messengers','When the Solomons trade in the craziness of big-city life for the quiet of a North Dakota farm, little do they expect the nightmare that follows. Soon after arriving, teenage Jess and her younger brother see terrifying apparitions and endure attacks from a supernatural source. Jess must warn her disbelieving family before it is too late to save them.','/ituR560dbnV4WAFPY0jJlEenGiW.jpg','2007-02-02',90,'Released','There is evidence to suggest that children are highly susceptible to paranormal phenomena. They see what adults cannot. They believe what adults deny. And they are trying to warn us.','The Messengers',9966,6.642,5.754,'22XGp20H-A4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19677,_binary '\0','/b6IiUcxZrNLzKEJiNTZX5YIXYni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425468',6.4,2183,'en','Snow','Nick Snowden is reluctantly taking over the family business and with only three days before the big night, one of Nick\'s younger reindeer is stolen from the North Pole and taken to a zoo.','/xLJhBJrjXg5z0G9D3kGd3RG76kG.jpg','2004-12-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Snow',50332,1.6641,7,'ICqJlNcbFE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19678,_binary '\0','/ccygoEpryrDHueiUnc2oGfPF1ut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425598',7.2,9866,'en','Dave Chappelle\'s Block Party','The American comedian/actor delivers a story about the alternative Hip Hop scene. A small town Ohio mans moves to Brooklyn, New York, to throw an unprecedented block party.','/lGS9iKGGRjM049ZGK4J8TvQeBHg.jpg','2005-09-12',100,'Released','You\'re invited to the party of the decade!','Dave Chappelle\'s Block Party',292,2.6252,6.8,'w7DA-xtN6nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19679,_binary '\0','/4UKsprK4hMozdMXA2QJbRz0KwTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425600',6.2,1572,'en','Sorry, Haters','Against the anxieties and fears of post-9/11 America, an Arab cab driver picks up a troubled professional woman with unexpected results.','/3VQmTCFutGAX5Rpb6JtRO0LvJBD.jpg','2005-09-10',83,'Released','The dust has finally settled... for most of us','Sorry, Haters',4913,2.3408,5.6,'oRaNGNf7E28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19680,_binary '\0','/eTXZPwlNqS5HUVDndrAPeUfmas9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425601',7.1,14255,'en','Trailer Park Boys: The Movie','The boys get arrested for robbing an ATM machine and spend 18 months in jail, upon release they decide to pull off \"The Big Dirty\", a plan to steal a large amount of coins because they are untraceable and quit their life of crime forever.','/lBmoxMfxxIepgpoByFr78ygnjrZ.jpg','2006-10-06',95,'Released','You\'ll never guess who just got out of jail...','Trailer Park Boys: The Movie',9958,2.6527,6.5,'uhZyjwavUg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19681,_binary '\0','/AgFrceDa45lqEJVj1fi8jTKFOZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425622',6.9,4800,'pl','Vinci','The sophisticated thief of art Robert \"Cuma\" Cumiński is released on probation from the local prison by the corrupt Doctor Wiaderny to organize the theft of the famous Leonardo Da Vinci painting \"Lady with Ermine\" for the dealer Gruby. Three years ago, Cuma was accidentally arrested by the snoopy detective Wilk after a successful heist in the house of the collector Lehman, but he has not ratted his comrade Julian.','/ng7FrjExaJJzE1Y4v1TEmn9NZZG.jpg','2004-09-17',108,'Released','Crime... is a work of art.','Vinci',39788,1.223,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19682,_binary '\0','/xDuEjbVlPkXBNiu8Dd7lQyZiNEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425637',7.3,50669,'zh','赤壁','In 208 A.D., in the final days of the Han Dynasty, shrewd Prime Minster Cao convinced the fickle Emperor Han the only way to unite all of China was to declare war on the kingdoms of Xu in the west and East Wu in the south. Thus began a military campaign of unprecedented scale. Left with no other hope for survival, the kingdoms of Xu and East Wu formed an unlikely alliance.','/kKrvVZUxBPpyxnhdk5ZVdH91NyN.jpg','2008-07-10',145,'Released','The future will be decided.','Red Cliff',12289,8.8545,7.1,'pd0bqLQrtdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19683,_binary '\0','/sZDyCMPvTCbDtJY1yzlB9FjpSce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425661',6.3,2911,'ja','妖怪大戦争','A young boy with a troubled home life becomes \"chosen,\" and he stumbles into the middle of a great war of yōkai (a class of mythological creatures), where he meets a group of friendly yōkai who become his companions through his journey. Now he must fight to protect his friends and free the world of the yōkai from oppression.','/xk96VmT0IC2nvWJG9iRWJrzEpmB.jpg','2005-08-06',124,'Released',NULL,'The Great Yokai War',42000,2.8033,6.3,'a-h6_7VfQ34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19684,_binary '\0','/nRinl7vEjjIPJ9aOprUqNHFQaCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425743',3.5,2587,'en','American Soldiers','Iraq, 2004: during a routine sortie a US patrol is ambushed and the young soldiers are forced to put their training and skills into action fast. A determined foe with superior local knowledge, the Fedayeen insurgents soon draw them into close quarter combat and a desperate fight for survival.','/yYQ90QSdTjJxYHQeFfTmWYSSqIo.jpg','2005-05-11',103,'Released',NULL,'American Soldiers',41497,1.9844,4.2,'9NRKiOBAaZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19685,_binary '\0','/yef51R2zKwXANbh3FjOq8yITDNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0425985',6.6,2630,'fr','Les filles du botaniste','At the house of a famous Chinese botanist teacher his daughter and a female intern fall in love with each other - a forbidden love that must be kept secret.','/8FRnusvcTz3xfPL7GTChXHfeoH5.jpg','2006-04-26',95,'Released',NULL,'The Chinese Botanist\'s Daughters',1899,2.0208,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19686,_binary '\0','/dZSmxM3LywXofGEFKu1G70rgg2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426037',6.8,1526,'nl','De Indringer','Tom Vansant is an emergency physician from Brussels who is desperately searching for his daughter who ran away from home and is now missing for eighteen months. He meets a girl of whom he thinks that she knows what happened to his daughter but the girl doesn\'t want to talk about her past. In his search to find out why she doesn\'t talk about it he ends up in a small village in the Ardennes where no one wants to help him discover what really happened.','/66yu8Zvyv6TAx8gMXhZQjhdUvum.jpg','2005-03-16',110,'Released',NULL,'The Intruder',20388,1.4466,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19687,_binary '\0','/ykIkJ6Jg8vmms4YPYaW6UdaPcUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426075',4.7,1216,'hi','Lakeer: Forbidden Lines','Gangster and criminal Don, Suraj Rana, who is also known for his kindness, adopts a street urchin named Arjun, and teaches him all the tricks of the trade, so that he can succeed him, even though he has a son named Karan. Arjun and Karan grow up as brothers, and Arjun takes charge of all criminal activities after Suraj passes away. Karan has fallen in love with Bindiya, the daughter of Suraj\'s deceased employee, and would like her to marry him. But Bindiya is in love with Saahil, and only likes Karan. Karan now decides to take the matter into his own hands, and thereby force Arjun to take sides either for him or against him.','/1AMdpr8BUNZPwFVDEWauNIs6Xnl.jpg','2004-05-14',170,'Released','The forbidden lines','Lakeer: Forbidden Lines',336735,1.7053,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19688,_binary '\0','/vAOJJXd7PNyqTvaRnQ2zs35vniR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426148',6.3,1684,'en','Once Upon A Mattress','Queen Aggravain has ruled that none may marry until her son, Prince Dauntless marries. However, she has managed to sabotage every princess that come along. When Sir Harry and Lady Larken learn that they are going to be parents, wed or not, he goes off to the swamps and brings back Princess Winnifred (\"Fred\" to her friends).','/vaPoiz95GuY4xrsttL8OrB70fHu.jpg','2005-12-18',90,'Released','Tracey Ullmann in the third remake of this Broadway classic.','Once Upon A Mattress',18506,2.8072,6,'xsqf_6XgErY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19689,_binary '\0','/oXlRFkXwCEgX9NQfImwGdhNSqR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426155',7.3,2215,'he','האושפיזין','In Jerusalem\'s orthodox neighborhoods, it\'s Succoth, seven days celebrating life\'s essentials in a sukkah, a temporary shack of both deprivation and hospitality. A devout couple, Moshe and Mali, married nearly five years and childless, are broke and praying for a miracle...','/142hLVJZcMjQBDmA6n0WbofU3Yj.jpg','2004-07-11',90,'Released','THEY NEED A MIRACLE.','האושפיזין',15083,1.2349,6.5,'I98QNhD8TQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19690,_binary '\0','/cl6isqnEGZt1A2E3VmCY9lvqsAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426173',7.1,1404,'pl','Pręgi','Following the death of his mother in \'80s Poland, 12-year-old Wojciech has taken the brunt of his stressed father\'s frustrations with him; the boy frequently gets punished via belt. Wojciech\'s father occasionally tries to, instead, bond with him, but soon snaps back to his short-fused habits. Apart from Wojciech\'s friend Bartek, no one does anything to help. Jump to present day, Wojciech is a furrow-browed journalist who spends most of his spare time spelunking alone. Just like his father, he has serious anger management issues. Fellow caver Tania feels inexplicably attracted to him, but the love of a good woman may not be enough.','/biGYQDXFBjLhXrcgc0JLD8qDld.jpg','2004-10-08',91,'Released',NULL,'The Welts',36402,1.4146,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19691,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426396',2.6,1544,'en','Alien Abduction','After being abducted by extraterrestrials, Jean and her friends are committed to a top secret government-run mental institution to undergo tests and be brainwashed.','/dGlzXMQcEoxsvVdw5FC86UkOVzp.jpg','2005-01-01',96,'Released','The war of the worlds has already begun!','Alien Abduction',172002,1.2889,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19692,_binary '\0','/td9sPSL7plsJuuMEJR3dXd0WRYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426459',6.2,36389,'en','Feast','When a motley crew of strangers find themselves trapped in an isolated tavern, they must band together in a battle for survival against a family of flesh-hungry creatures.','/g9i3dfQRAyU8TPe1LrbvAdVoLfB.jpg','2005-10-14',87,'Released','They\'re Hungry. You\'re Dinner.','Feast',10070,4.7159,6.144,'SBxxrDaC-qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19693,_binary '\0','/3qkOusgbyjXOyKMlweZR6tPyYzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426462',4.9,2906,'en','Fifty Pills','Unless Darren can survive New York\'s largest drug mogul, write a paper on Dante\'s \"Inferno,\" escape three thugs chasing the wrong guy and sell fifty pills of ecstasy to make his tuition payment, he\'ll never date the girl of his dreams.','/vvRxQKMSI5SciTWJvWgTQ41IU4t.jpg','2006-04-26',85,'Released',NULL,'Fifty Pills',13414,2.5416,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19694,_binary '\0','/z2iexNFJ7M2MquHpQk5PrZFAdZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426501',5.5,1779,'en','Johnny Was','Johnny Doyle escapes a violent past in Ireland to lie low in London, until his former mentor Flynn breaks out of Brixton Prison...','/bODiBndUdqlZeQUM7ou66A87ZFs.jpg','2006-09-19',93,'Released','Stop running. Face the future.','Johnny Was',52452,1.6637,4.9,'--85qsvHPaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19695,_binary '\0','/me2CRfQvaOiylQDLjqANEt7Lb2Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426550',2.6,3268,'en','Popstar','A teenage girls life gets turned upside down when a new school friend turns out to be a popstar.','/s5QIkzyQR5ekNaZDWmLLAbeZy30.jpg','2005-11-08',94,'Released','He topped the charts. Can he top high school?','Popstar',31277,2.5044,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19696,_binary '\0','/mVvyRe5U3pNra0qQ2BUVWzbWzsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426568',6.1,3084,'en','Now You See It...','While producing a reality TV show, a teenager meets a magician whose powers are real but put him in danger.','/9rr9fg4Z3lOWIaB0l62T4aFxIhk.jpg','2005-01-14',96,'Released',NULL,'Now You See It...',26267,4.0353,5.7,'O-m-vPThlsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19697,_binary '\0','/4co3a3mx5BgoHCmJUPAI03MDOWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426578',7.6,30006,'de','Sophie Scholl – Die letzten Tage','In 1943, as Hitler continues to wage war across Europe, a group of college students mount an underground resistance movement in Munich. Dedicated expressly to the downfall of the monolithic Third Reich war machine, they call themselves the White Rose. One of its few female members, Sophie Scholl is captured during a dangerous mission to distribute pamphlets on campus with her brother Hans. Unwavering in her convictions and loyalty to the White Rose, her cross-examination by the Gestapo quickly escalates into a searing test of wills as Scholl delivers a passionate call to freedom and personal responsibility.','/aAbxubEzowWJNBWYG82wXcKuzZP.jpg','2005-02-13',117,'Released','The true story of a young woman who did what few in Nazi Germany dared even think!','Sophie Scholl: The Final Days',2117,6.4608,7.121,'XM5A4ETW_Io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19698,_binary '\0','/iA5yYNAclwXWGe46T7gatzGYcRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426592',4.8,86094,'en','Superhero Movie','Rick Riker is a nerdy teen imbued with superpowers by a radioactive dragonfly. And because every hero needs a nemesis, enter Lou Landers, aka the villainously goofy Hourglass.','/nAzo5OOmoE9SXOv4mHTuiu58QXA.jpg','2008-03-28',82,'Released','The greatest Superhero movie of all time! (not counting all the others)','Superhero Movie',11918,11.4323,5.3,'9QDtDtj0WcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19699,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426596',7.6,1256,'en','The Take','In suburban Buenos Aires, thirty unemployed ceramics workers walk into their idle factory, roll out sleeping mats and refuse to leave. All they want is to re-start the silent machines. But this simple act - the take - has the power to turn the globalization debate on its head. Armed only with slingshots and an abiding faith in shop-floor democracy, the workers face off against the bosses, bankers and a whole system that sees their beloved factories as nothing more than scrap metal for sale.','/5QiQFidOptA8MaScRu70n2nR6BZ.jpg','2004-09-03',87,'Released','Occupy. Resist. Produce.','The Take',16046,1.9652,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19700,_binary '\0','/1geGYUKUNKV3RZJMncJFLckaAxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426615',3,8728,'en','In The Mix','A successful DJ named Darrel, managed to rescue a powerful mobster one night. In order to repay Darrell, the mobster, Frank Pacelli, gives him the task of protecting his daughter, Dolly.','/iMpA1GqP4DcJrXUOp3uk1rHjtKs.jpg','2005-11-23',95,'Released',NULL,'In The Mix',17952,3.2597,6.1,'hrAJ4s8Uqzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19701,_binary '\0','/t0dum2M9gRlIcwtioDeVcEdGDYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426627',5.7,4297,'en','Stoned','A chronicle of the sordid life and suspicious death of Rolling Stones co-founder Brian Jones, who was found in the bottom of his swimming pool weeks after being let go from the band.','/xfgAKZRJz4QIflwtpY4PCeG6oon.jpg','2005-11-18',102,'Released','The story of the original Rolling Stone','Stoned',17741,1.4951,5.2,'TzYTheLQjVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19702,_binary '\0','/oxEvnbNAr1BFWX8XQ6KBU35uWN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426883',6.9,112298,'en','Alpha Dog','Johnny Truelove likes to see himself as tough. He\'s the son of an underworld figure and a drug dealer. Johnny also likes to get tough when things don\'t go his way. When Jake Mazursky fails to pay up for Johnny, things get worse for the Mazursky family, as Johnny and his \'gang\' kidnap Jake\'s 15 year old brother and hold him hostage.','/t9pirEsDxe102mSQGoDZWBbdcCD.jpg','2006-01-27',122,'Released','One crime. 38 witnesses. No way back.','Alpha Dog',7457,5.3478,6.7,'VPWjDJmbrak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19703,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426911',6.4,6775,'pl','Archangel',NULL,'/2PbDQWAvuJh6jGntdYu2ZRECN4s.jpg','2005-01-05',124,'Released',NULL,'Archangel',1689863,0.5954,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19704,_binary '\0','/i3pONuqGZSR3UYOOdBeU2CiQnxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0426931',7.4,115280,'en','August Rush','Evan, a musically gifted orphan, runs away from his orphanage and searches New York City for his birth parents. On his journey, he\'s taken under the wing of the Wizard, a homeless man who lives in an abandoned theater. After discovering his talent, the Wizard gives Evan the name \"August Rush\" and devises a plan to profit from his talent. Little does Evan know that his parents, Lyla and Louis, are searching for him too.','/oA6ZeICPINiS6YtD5WZeBaGVmuT.jpg','2007-11-21',114,'Released','An incredible journey moving at the speed of sound.','August Rush',5123,9.8719,7.4,'wH7bq_RjJqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19705,_binary '\0','/blVhbYHyMrEbO6mIfdQxLNXAMUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427089',5.7,5539,'en','Confetti','A mockumentary that follows three couples as they battle it out to win the coveted title of \'Most Original Wedding of the Year\'.','/cGDnpFYjSfiCwSVogP8vl7i6rX1.jpg','2006-05-05',100,'Released','Three weddings. One happy couple.','Confetti',10111,2.3602,5.4,'i2egth4DI5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19706,_binary '\0','/bvlZkXeaR3qhB4fmbUHuYGdooRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427152',5.9,117298,'en','Dinner for Schmucks','Rising executive Tim Conrad works for a boss who hosts a monthly dinner in which the guest who brings the biggest buffoon gets a career-boost. Tim plans on not attending until he meets Barry, a man who builds dioramas using stuffed mice. Barry\'s blundering but good intentions send Tim\'s life into a downward spiral, threatening a major business deal and possibly scuttling Tim\'s engagement to his fiancee.','/eqCyt9ILsInMYPa2iveiINeVOJD.jpg','2010-07-30',114,'Released','Takes one to know one.','Dinner for Schmucks',38778,7.1717,5.7,'CVY_IRA8NTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19707,_binary '\0','/vMNTypsHzKtV6i1iAHmPMZ0zvLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427157',6.4,1885,'en','Dirty War','After years of meticulous planning, a terrorist operation is reaching its final stages. The authorities have received no intelligence; they are in a race against time but don\'t yet know it. As the operation unfolds, we see the working lives of men and women directly affected by terrorism. Among them: a firemen worried about the increasingly dangerous conditions he and his men are expected to work under; the head of the anti-terrorist branch whose responsibility it is to protect London and a female Muslim detective brought into Scotland Yard to investigate another suspected terrorist cell. But it is too late to stop the attack.','/qGk7Q6E8Kx6hXhmN9A1yhNIpiP8.jpg','2004-09-26',90,'Released','On a quiet street the men next door are going about their business. The business of nuclear terrorism.','Dirty War',39182,1.4785,6.1,'ac9TzorKjew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19708,_binary '\0','/eOH72sU1ckl1EfO6fQmCJM7GIqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427208',6.3,3324,'tr','Eğreti Gelin','Ali is 18. His feet are firmly off the ground. The very idea of marriage seems like a game. But the bride\'s parents are ready and willing. Business ventures will be set up between the families; the arrangement will pay off all round. Ali, meanwhile, is more interested in playing with puppets and dressing up as a rooster for the travelling theatre. His fiancée has only so much patience... So what should his parents do? What was that? Hire a Borrowed Bride? Meaning exactly what? Well just that: borrow a bride, as the title of the film suggests......','/ifsEZXTJiHWFurdx7vvCoZRJvat.jpg','2005-02-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Borrowed Bride',133525,2.1364,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19709,_binary '\0','/2PdrZ5fj0Mcn5txXWgcxv1AxuoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427224',5.9,1306,'en','Eve\'s Christmas','A wealthy and successful career woman gets a second chance in life when a magical wish transports her back in time eight years to when she walked away from her fiance to lead a business life in New York.','/cpahlixGSaR3Dahs7tCHxMDOF1b.jpg','2004-12-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Eve\'s Christmas',69016,1.9238,5.4,'kfH9HTD7nQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19710,_binary '\0','/3fFVHmZcSIzG0ACExUz6pAhcSAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427229',5.7,96493,'en','Failure to Launch','At 35, Tripp has an interesting job, a hip car, a passion for sailing, an active dating life, and a great house - trouble is, he still lives with his parents, Al and Sue, who are not happy about it. Al and Sue are fascinated when friends whose adult son has recently moved away from home reveal they hired an expert to help. In desperation to push Tripp out of the nest once and for all, Al and Sue hatch a plan to hire Paula, an \"interventionist,\" who has a formula in these cases.','/omReuKQ8ItWYD5pOLmsKh3MF24w.jpg','2006-03-10',97,'Released','To leave the nest, some men just need a little push.','Failure to Launch',6877,12.3143,5.854,'4KZM3PRV0NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19711,_binary '\0','/7AOg5N5tFtB4yiSjbMnMouVNZS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427276',7.7,1453,'en','The Future of Food','Before compiling your next grocery list, you might want to watch filmmaker Deborah Koons Garcia\'s eye-opening documentary, which sheds light on a shadowy relationship between agriculture, big business and government. By examining the effects of biotechnology on the nation\'s smallest farmers, the film reveals the unappetizing truth about genetically modified foods: You could unknowingly be serving them for dinner.','/1j001mLedx9b95AVguAezMMUthP.jpg','2004-05-30',88,'Released',NULL,'The Future of Food',25465,0.9896,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19712,_binary '\0','/waOYBThLihaTKUFOAzjvhPjBmrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427309',7.5,66884,'en','The Great Debaters','The true story of a brilliant but politically radical debate team coach who uses the power of words to transform a group of underdog African-American college students into a historical powerhouse that took on the Harvard elite.','/nuF3DDlZzNb2qq0tEsYU0zpXf8K.jpg','2007-12-25',126,'Released','When the nation was in need, he inspired them to give us hope.','The Great Debaters',14047,6.4556,7.3,'IN2AGZThL-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19713,_binary '\0','/fTEvG1sGTVKHgiz4NyZBqPetM3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427312',7.7,68450,'en','Grizzly Man','Follows the story of \"Grizzly Man\" Timothy Treadwell and what the thirteen summers in a National Park in Alaska were like in his attempt to protect the grizzly bears. The film is full of unique images and a look into the spirit of a man who sacrificed himself for nature.','/zuZWpcuye25rpsiZ4XzsAvmLDHG.jpg','2005-08-12',103,'Released','In nature, there are boundaries. One man spent the last thirteen years of his life crossing them.','Grizzly Man',501,4.392,7.539,'uWA7GtDmNFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19714,_binary '\0','/zouKFSFvXS1gEIXyZFjAUO63YF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427323',3.5,8788,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Askerde','After the latest prank they pulled on Deli Bedri, the boys are sent to mandatory military service to learn discipline.','/zKAuLZEIa2bjdY8PBJ3MXRM1fpd.jpg','2005-01-14',112,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class in the Military',32313,1.1593,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19715,_binary '\0','/oO55Z71apssUy4Cf0obsK2kX3oK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427327',6.7,146855,'en','Hairspray','Pleasantly plump teenager Tracy Turnblad auditions to be on Baltimore\'s most popular dance show - The Corny Collins Show - and lands a prime spot. Through her newfound fame, she becomes determined to help her friends and end the racial segregation that has been a staple of the show.','/fgMka3HtFvI5OgW1eYdR9XpySxH.jpg','2007-07-19',116,'Released','When you follow your own beat, the world will follow you.','Hairspray',2976,6.8824,6.667,'hsFtWsRn99U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19716,_binary '\0','/thtZeT7WDcySfhqYr68u20s9hbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427339',7,4979,'no','Hawaii, Oslo','Hawaii, Oslo is the story of a handful of people who cross each other\'s path without necessarily knowing each other, during the hottest day of the year, in Oslo. We follow Frode and Milla. They are having their first child, who they are told will not live long. We follow Bobbie-Pop, a faded singer who tries to commit suicide. We follow Leon, an institutionalized kleptomaniac who is loking for Åsa, to whom he has a ten year old deal to get married. We meet Leon\'s brother, Trygve, who fetches Leon at the institution to celebrate his birthday, but who himself has plans to use his leave from prison to run away. And most of all we meet the angel Vidar, Leon\'s best buddy at the institution, who sees things no one else can see, and who may be able to save everyone - except himself?','/lxuaNcC4HNTFelky5yaDrhlLIKG.jpg','2004-09-24',125,'Released',NULL,'Hawaii, Oslo',14812,1.1119,6.8,'fUbTOrhAX9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19717,_binary '\0','/5MUMB3aPEPEQPCIAaygXFUTWE9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427340',6.4,121223,'en','Masters of the Universe','After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.','/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg','2026-06-03',141,'Released','Legends aren\'t born, they\'re forged.','Masters of the Universe',454639,50.7318,7.1,'RZ4dblwZ2TY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19718,_binary '\0','/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427392',5.9,89442,'en','The Invasion','Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.','/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg','2007-08-17',99,'Released','Do not trust anyone. Do not show emotion. Do not fall asleep.','The Invasion',4858,11.4539,6.1,'-TrCrxKimoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19719,_binary '\0','/k5exxQxF5ex2DVn9kNh1ONvC6Op.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427411',6.3,1330,'ko','주홍글씨','A cop\'s desire for love gets in the way of his job and his professional life. Secret love affairs begin to dangerously collide as he gets assigned to a new homicide case.','/kKX61echirKRwARuxp6HcAeTMq9.jpg','2004-10-29',115,'Released','Sex. Lies. Murder.','The Scarlet Letter',56485,1.9129,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19720,_binary '\0','/4iEg0LWTx9aTWOWMhpBu3UffXih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427470',6.9,62368,'en','The Lookout','Chris is a once promising high school athlete whose life is turned upside down following a tragic accident. As he tries to maintain a normal life, he takes a job as a janitor at a bank, where he ultimately finds himself caught up in a planned heist.','/wTYyXCoIBy2TDxetoGS4Sc0VBP1.jpg','2007-03-09',99,'Released','Whoever has the money has the power.','The Lookout',8270,4.9273,6.6,'e9oyHy_ZigY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19721,_binary '\0','/dNPJMRVJnDl0Rr1mQvTDt98tazP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427543',6.3,5038,'en','A Million Little Pieces','A young drug-addled writer approaching the bottom of his descent submits to two months of agonizing detox at a treatment center in Minnesota.','/loC9ptPrTT1e09frmddn6LU612d.jpg','2019-08-30',113,'Released','I\'m fine.','A Million Little Pieces',499566,3.5765,6.2,'Nkhmp4HtBDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19722,_binary '\0','/pynLOTijUVbAiJ727LWShTV6JCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427582',7.1,13032,'es','El método','Seven candidates to a high executive position on a multinational company show up for a selection test in a skyscraper at the financial district. Among them, the most disparate personalities: the winner, the aggressive, the insecure, the critic, the indecisive…','/rucoX7xqDizjvUsBfJ0PGD1re3X.jpg','2005-09-22',117,'Released','When HR goes too far.','The Method',21043,1.924,6.745,'-nYP7y6cmfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19723,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427910',5.5,1293,'en','Trip Out','An old grudge, a misunderstood sexual advance and a drug score hurl three suburban teens into a head on collision of lust, intoxication, and pent up aggression.',NULL,'2005-01-01',95,'Released','When a detour IS the destination.','Trip Out',57485,0.5882,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19724,_binary '\0','/bvPsCaurkBk2jzSJXWJJXb0kTCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427944',7.5,236860,'en','Thank You for Smoking','Nick Naylor is a charismatic spin-doctor for Big Tobacco who\'ll fight to protect America\'s right to smoke -- even if it kills him -- while still remaining a role model for his 12-year old son. When he incurs the wrath of a senator bent on snuffing out cigarettes, Nick\'s powers of \"filtering the truth\" will be put to the test.','/41bMmglWT72OaRXrMROEyksOf3J.jpg','2005-09-09',92,'Released','Nick Naylor doesn\'t hide the truth...he filters it.','Thank You for Smoking',9388,7.3044,7.202,'Df32RijORLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19725,_binary '\0','/b2NxliGN77rdu78HQv5peZBmkw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427954',7,40594,'th','ต้มยำกุ้ง','A young fighter named Kham must go to Australia to retrieve his stolen elephant. With the help of a Thai-born Australian detective, Kham must take on all comers, including a gang led by an evil woman and her two deadly bodyguards.','/uKE9BxgtT5g2pE3ZKC7MnzsAbTZ.jpg','2005-08-11',105,'Released','Vengeance Knows No Mercy.','The Protector',8982,6.3102,7.1,'4Pev6lkexo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19726,_binary '\0','/A4f5bTLP0qkhgfS3ry1fPFHKsl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427968',5.7,9057,'en','Trust the Man','Overachieving actress Rebecca must come to grips with her failing marriage to stay-at-home dad Tom. While Rebecca\'s slacker brother Tobey can\'t seem to commit to his aspiring-novelist girlfriend, Elaine. As both relationships spin out of control, the two couples embark on a quest to rediscover the magic and romance of falling in love in New York.','/njvBxeC3mj5XKjT9a2OdDglq9Yj.jpg','2005-09-01',103,'Released','Men play the game. Women know the score.','Trust the Man',14057,3.3583,5.2,'rWxWB8jwaqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19727,_binary '\0','/grBVNhFI7iNB54eFfXVzbYfDSQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427969',6.5,37259,'en','Hollywoodland','When Hollywood superstar George Reeves dies in his home, private detective Louis Simo is hired to investigate his death and gets caught in a web of lies involving a big studio executive\'s wife. Based on a true story.','/8FgNVvJEEwRgFURiAcW7VuXwvf1.jpg','2006-08-31',126,'Released','In a town full of fiction, everyone has a version of the truth.','Hollywoodland',1249,5.2266,6.1,'-HRkRfxfXt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19728,_binary '\0','/wl9oqSfAcufBsrKSUMwsEZNCVUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0427998',5.9,6160,'en','The Grand','The Grand is in the tradition of improvisational comedies like Best In Show and This Is Spinal Tap. The story is set in the world of professional poker and follows six players who reach the final table of the world’s second most famous high stakes tournament, the Grand Championship of Poker.','/3H4QTgFxt1lJps8U2tKfSTbsMl7.jpg','2007-06-07',104,'Released','A comedy about the fine art of losing.','The Grand',15378,2.397,5.8,'zQfoX6mS-0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19729,_binary '\0','/4lk8qws6n3nC3RsJqxzqVK3pjzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428038',7.1,4450,'en','Sweet Land','Set in 1920, Inge travels from Germany to rural Minnesota in order to meet the man destined to be her husband.','/qYxbJ0pWyuRBqVXrrhaDQnFAsNN.jpg','2005-10-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Land',31048,2.1638,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19730,_binary '\0','/kKsDxvDRfvAAsojZIIGS2hkojfR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428059',7.6,7048,'tr','Yazı Tura','Two soldiers return home from their military service in southeastern Turkey with disabilities.','/jsMKbjSdxgBKgarYbQdD0EzIdsd.jpg','2004-09-24',102,'Released',NULL,'Toss-Up',53301,1.6358,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19731,_binary '\0','/sx7zl90bNFBqrwMeeddvZluJjgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428144',5.2,2796,'en','Category 6: Day of Destruction','Three tornadoes converge to wreak havoc on Chicago, disrupting the power grid and creating the worst super-storm in history: a category 6 twister.','/vTV6y6DrdSo9nhAAZcJpEqqyFTH.jpg','2004-11-14',175,'Released',NULL,'Category 6: Day of Destruction',32128,2.2112,6.3,'23ukVzItvno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19732,_binary '\0','/ajtQrFLUIDBjzS0OIT9Zk7wgWEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428212',3.7,1643,'en','All Souls Day: Dia de los Muertos','During a Day of the Dead celebration, the dead come to life to prey upon the living. In the remote Mexican village of Santa Bonita, a nightmare lay buried for over a century. But when a group of hard-partying students from the OC are stranded in this strange town, they discover an innkeeper with a dark secret a sheriff with a shocking past and a holiday that demands the most horrific sacrifice of all. Now the ceremony can commence. The hordes of the undead have been unleashed. And on this day, an unstoppable feast of human flesh has begun!','/knT8Jzy9B5NfQlIYGChKn3hbyz8.jpg','2005-01-22',88,'Released','The dead shall have their day.','All Souls Day: Dia de los Muertos',37005,1.7843,4.6,'M7-q3Jn5elw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19733,_binary '\0','/wXCelVZcQE0bSsBC0r6LNsJIRnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428251',4.7,11850,'en','Venom','A group of teenagers fear for their lives in the swamps of Louisiana, chased by Mr. Jangles, a man possessed by 13 evil souls, and now relentless in his pursuit of new victims.','/z1oor8urdFc0w2mhYMdzryojMH.jpg','2005-09-16',85,'Released','He never hurt a soul until the day he died.','Venom',7182,3.4188,5.4,'shqN9ySL4w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19734,_binary '\0','/uq37aoBe8MOvorPN4yXwqLt3GOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428390',4.5,2253,'en','Severed','A multi-national forestry company engages in genetic experimentation to increase logging yield in a remote section of forest...','/fhAeJpm80H3L7jUAStQrJBVe3K3.jpg','2005-10-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Severed',10076,2.4696,4.8,'1JtFXTqOTCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19735,_binary '\0','/pOYxBeaOZQPqDbuyhSj9PxdaOZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428430',6.6,2169,'fr','Crustacés et coquillages','Crustacés et coquillages is a fresh French comedy film with numerous surprise turnarounds and about the tolerance of a family of four. The family spend an idealistic summer vacation together where each of the family members gets involved in a new or old relationship.','/eQPrrzj76pQxmprQ3LpHhriZqlJ.jpg','2005-03-30',93,'Released',NULL,'Cockles and Muscles',349,1.7183,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19736,_binary '\0','/tpCJEJRXQ0IGeQDngjCepYydXgM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428441',7.7,3321,'en','The Cutting Edge: The Magic of Movie Editing','Documentary about the art of film editing. Clips are shown from many groundbreaking films with innovative editing styles.','/eiMCb4qnOvbIdKjW91S1pdAuSl9.jpg','2004-10-12',99,'Released','SECRETS OF MOVIE MAGIC REVEALED — VIA THE CRAFT OF THE FILM EDITOR!','The Cutting Edge: The Magic of Movie Editing',44345,2.6798,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19737,_binary '\0','/v6klR6kjH22Trgk4Ahc6V9IVyUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428446',5.9,10810,'en','The Darwin Awards','After botching the capture of a notorious serial killer, idiosyncratic detective Michael Burrows loses his job with the San Francisco Police. He becomes an investigator for an insurance company and joins forces with a cynical field agent to probe suspicious and unusual deaths.','/6reChYRqaglz563iX2JgiK8eFS9.jpg','2007-06-25',94,'Released','A comedy... to die for.','The Darwin Awards',18437,4.2935,5.503,'KIEQXIkXrPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19738,_binary '\0','/fzT0tpTgLi8InbcAsw4YLe3mcr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428541',6.3,8610,'en','Five Fingers','Martijn, an idealistic Dutch pianist, travels to Morocco to help start a food program for malnourished children. Within moments of his arrival, however, Martijn is abducted by a group of terrorists, injected with a debilitating drug, and imprisoned. Under threat of death, the young man engages in a mental chess match with Ahmat, trying to learn his captor\'s true objective and avoid a horrible fate','/2rs9gCICykUKjWuHbT4Nbaecs9P.jpg','2006-05-01',87,'Released','What price would you pay for freedom?','Five Fingers',11650,3.0843,6,'vHxQ2L3RmQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19739,_binary '\0','/8DNw1DOVNse4CyRpPkQbfPvtcgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428579',5.4,7940,'en','Suburban Girl','Publishing assistant Brett Eisenberg wants to be a big-time editor. However, she lacks self-confidence, a problem that isn\'t helped by her new, overbearing boss. Brett soon enters into a relationship with Archie, an older man who has plenty of his own issues, including alcoholism, diabetes and a difficult relationship with his daughter. Intent on helping Archie get past his problems, she turns to her dying father for advice.','/fkXyvlMzlU9yszj6Y2TyjbxLUkj.jpg','2007-04-27',97,'Released','Rewriting her dream in the big city.','Suburban Girl',13525,4.5697,5.5,'DHBHBUuOPfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19740,_binary '\0','/klHmuT4S8wWRD1C8tsEmStNHZZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428646',4.9,3619,'de','Hui Buh, das Schlossgespenst','After 500 years, castle ghost Hui Buh finally has some royal residents to haunt, but he soon loses his license to scare and must get recertified.','/dQsaHfaa1og6HQ2kO4cB8D6wcCO.jpg','2006-07-20',103,'Released',NULL,'Hui Buh: The Castle Ghost',11651,2.9831,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19741,_binary '\0','/gJEiYZC1HYoaNZaBZu6a4qzX9yu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428649',6,3457,'en','I Am a Sex Addict','Just moments before his third wedding, Zahedi relates with utter sincerity and astonishing candor his obsession with prostitutes. He retraces his romantic and sexual history, including his ideological commitment to open relationships, that led to two disastrous marriages and several very pissed off ex-girlfriends.','/D9pZcSfKvUQij7x83DeIlDic1P.jpg','2006-04-12',98,'Released','A compulsively true comedy','I Am a Sex Addict',17628,1.7704,5.5,'l4VFrHKjB0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19742,_binary '\0','/lKs9gIp7T6Wv0yyXW2h87bufwaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428725',6.2,3187,'th','เกิดมาลุย','When a remote Thai village is overrun by terrorists armed with a nuclear missile, an elite undercover operative leads the most unique fighting force ever assembled in a heroic bid to save their nation.','/k4YPOpK9L9jHzKFN5Aa9uJuhvCn.jpg','2004-08-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Born to Fight',10254,2.2358,6.46,'Bs3dqJwnL2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19743,_binary '\0','/zNRz2YFy3Gv1k7PlQrW91cd9D1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428765',4.7,1688,'en','The Legend of Lucy Keyes','When an urban family moves to a rural New England town with secrets, little do they know that their new house holds a history of tragic sorrow.','/ljY0WXsYIHsCN9qAm5gNzBbtlZa.jpg','2006-02-03',93,'Released','250 years ago a child disappeared. Tonight she returns.','The Legend of Lucy Keyes',33502,2.6509,5.4,'XOXJJmSPrgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19744,_binary '\0','/lPsKI7VR1FJY3w8iEOBZEhWAESc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428803',7.5,62608,'fr','La Marche de l\'empereur','Every year, thousands of Antarctica\'s emperor penguins make an astonishing journey to breed their young. They walk, marching day and night in single file 70 miles into the darkest, driest and coldest continent on Earth. This amazing, true-life tale is touched with humour and alive with thrills. Breathtaking photography captures the transcendent beauty and staggering drama of devoted parent penguins who, in the fierce polar winter, take turns guarding their egg and trekking to the ocean in search of food. Predators hunt them, storms lash them. But the safety of their adorable chicks makes it all worthwhile. So follow the leader... to adventure!!','/o9xJ1xG1WKlHkl8ACqq0LShOuMu.jpg','2005-01-26',80,'Released','In the harshest place on Earth, love finds a way.','March of the Penguins',1667,4.4438,7.1,'JZWt5YkhVp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19745,_binary '\0','/cV8uAB5glyEtwIhyCK0Xr0ywnPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428856',6.6,5986,'fr','La Moustache','One day, on a whim, Marc decides to shave off the moustache he\'s worn all of his adult life. He waits patiently for his wife\'s reaction, but neither she nor his friends seem to notice. Stranger still, when he finally tells them, they all insist he never had a moustache. Is Marc going mad? Is he the victim of some elaborate conspiracy? Or has something in the world\'s order gone terribly awry?','/4xTwprpMi7KpMukbGl21CMCz4sk.jpg','2005-06-09',86,'Released',NULL,'The Moustache',16998,2.1226,6.1,'DfURXKUwbFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19746,_binary '\0','/uRkIlvBtvwOWBBY3GtpCJGJsGug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0428870',8.1,27555,'ko','내 머리 속의 지우개','A young couple\'s love is tested when Sun-jin is diagnosed with a rare form of Alzheimer\'s disease.','/s9ulpxLbkeJTTYxqLVUl6PreLGN.jpg','2004-11-05',117,'Released','Everything passes away, but I wish I could remember my love forever.','A Moment to Remember',15859,3.1402,7.788,'LFLSwFEiANg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19747,_binary '\0','/av3wawycT7eSW2MHN1nKFfQuK4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429032',6.6,2951,'en','Sherlock Holmes and the Case of the Silk Stocking','The corpse of a shabbily dressed young woman has been discovered in the mud flats of the Thames at low tide. Police assume she\'s a prostitute, but Dr. Watson suspects something more and goes to his old friend Holmes, now retired and at very loose ends.','/jsl7wdtyzhU3KdTyPtiZNCcTIda.jpg','2004-12-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Sherlock Holmes and the Case of the Silk Stocking',15722,2.2736,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19748,_binary '\0','/q6IqjnlVuJO178PS6Z9Fld842zw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429052',6.3,1488,'fr','Saint-Jacques… La Mecque','Three siblings who detest each other and hiking must complete together a pilgrimage to Santiago de Compostela in order to be eligible to inherit their mother\'s wealth.','/sqYxgJgfxSSX6oHVgEHwTMZWAru.jpg','2005-10-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Saint-Jacques… La Mecque',5171,1.7759,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19749,_binary '\0','/yT1TAWA5zW66kRLD5qnrVY3fiTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429068',6.4,1385,'en','The Second Chance','Ethan Jenkins and Jake Sanders are both passionate pastors who worship the same God from the same book--but that\'s where the similarity ends. When they are suddenly thrown together in a tough neighborhood and forced to work side by side, Ethan discovers there is no boundary between the streets and the sanctuary.','/3pDseePOrzRtoJKV9QaQCQvR2fT.jpg','2006-02-17',102,'Released',NULL,'The Second Chance',27919,1.4404,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19750,_binary '\0','/eQoMLDmceauQdIUH475VR0W7jJV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429078',6.1,10255,'zh','七劍','In the middle of the 17th century, the Manchus conquered China and founded the Ching dynasty. Due to widespread uprisings against the new rulers, the study and practice of traditional martial arts is forbidden and punishable by death. The unscrupulous leader of a troop of mercenaries takes advantage of this situation to make a fortune with the bounty on his head.','/irZQJV9fv6XSbWmwquKSWCLDqDg.jpg','2005-07-25',152,'Released','Seven heroes one adventures.','Seven Swords',10703,3.5489,6.239,'NB9O3BfHX4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19751,_binary '\0','/liUx6LFgpKN1N6lOk3LgjL2WhF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429095',3.6,1979,'de','Siegfried','The tale of Siegfried, a fearless dragon slayer who wins the heart of Celtic beauty Kriemhild.','/7c24IjdewTfL3W5NiRoRRYrwNun.jpg','2005-07-28',89,'Released',NULL,'Siegfried',10659,2.1292,4.5,'a2J1gjntfkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19752,_binary '\0','/zlf9DeW7f5XqTffT4kVAnF60Yrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429115',4.7,1417,'en','Splinter','A gang member, suffering from severe memory loss, searches for his brother\'s murderer. He secretly enlists the aid of the investigating Detective, while other members of his gang are mysteriously and sadistically murdered.','/wJZvRhd51hVgMKt9JIg9DiwHqAT.jpg','2006-08-17',90,'Released','Everyone dies dirty...','Splinter',15806,2.407,4.6,'uSXtIQSK6Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19753,_binary '\0','/7fQBvIoLoO2q2ox7ux03JINTfba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429153',6,2109,'en','Tara Road','A grieving Connecticut mother temporarily switches houses with a woman in Dublin, Ireland.','/1NFO90kY1mQ7eZg7PJj2yfJFk1d.jpg','2005-05-11',101,'Released','Sometimes the only way to find yourself... is to lose yourself in someone else\'s life.','Tara Road',3631,1.5559,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19754,_binary '\0','/7SVHupXElhckxx5PLP11s3yyuKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429177',6.4,2475,'en','The Thing About My Folks','Ben\'s dad Sam shows up one night with a note from Ben\'s mother (Sam\'s wife of 46 years), that she has left. While Ben\'s wife and his three sisters try to find her, Ben takes Sam on a day trip to see a farmhouse that\'s for sale. The day trip turns into a road trip while dad and son explore their past, their relationship, and why Sam\'s wife might have left him. The road trip includes fishing, drinking, playing pool, sleeping under the stars, and frank discussion. Anger simmers close at hand, as do love and hope. Where Sam\'s wife is - and why she left - leads to the movie\'s resolution.','/r0u9l2f5ktzDmsvnXXGOkhRDjqP.jpg','2005-06-02',96,'Released','Sometimes the fruit falls very far from the tree.','The Thing About My Folks',23703,1.9791,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19755,_binary '\0','/kbghVdYUdN0keybciKOpR7HkC3Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429277',3.8,1366,'en','Zyzzyx Road','A married man meets a beautiful woman in a Las Vegas casino and allows her to seduce him. When her jealous boyfriend finds them together, a scuffle results in the boyfriend\'s death. The lovers head to the desert to bury the corpse, but it disappears.','/63XsqpeRQToLJhlAWQpUG9tSx2Q.jpg','2006-02-25',90,'Released','Dead ahead.','Zyzzyx Road',41393,1.6952,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19756,_binary '\0','/mYs0wSCzJSJPYNG85pSWMsKjf9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429489',6.9,1525,'tr','A Ay','Eleven-year-old Yekta lives in a crumbling island mansion with her strict aunts and ailing grandfather, yearning for her absent mother. As dreams and surreal visions shape her solitude, she sets out in search of a mythical seagull with a child’s head.','/5rqjglWPOIYGlz6DKQEYk4KhO9s.jpg','1988-10-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Oh, Moon!',61387,0.9511,6.7,'Abkt3bbT4KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19757,_binary '\0','/puAUfSiVrQO2DPKOobHFjqVcXPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429493',6.7,278537,'en','The A-Team','A man who loves when a plan comes together, Col. Hannibal Smith leads a close-knit team of elite operatives and Iraq War veterans. Framed for a crime they didn\'t commit, Smith and his men, Capt. H.M. ‘Howling Mad’ Murdock , Sgt. Bosco ‘B.A.’ Baracus, and Lt. Templeton ‘Faceman’ Peck, break out and go rogue, using their special talents to clear their names and find the perpetrator. Hot on their trail is Capt. Charissa Sosa, who was once involved with a member of Smith\'s team and has sworn to capture them, no matter what it takes.','/bkAWEx5g5tvRPjtDQyvIZ7LRxQm.jpg','2010-06-09',117,'Released','There is no plan B.','The A-Team',34544,14.9939,6.419,'exyzEFrmLuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19758,_binary '\0','/wTcPEs307cPVYQ6lPXSjQEG416R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429573',5,28042,'en','An American Haunting','An invisible entity haunts a 19th century family, and family secrets soon begin to surface. Based on the true events of the only case in US History where a spirit caused the death of a man.','/5ePaCimd7cA9zYNib8WfIbWnrCf.jpg','2005-05-05',83,'Released','Possession knows no bounds.','An American Haunting',10008,3.1496,5.51,'8Mr1wMiihKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19759,_binary '\0','/bSAFxs1REUSNk50yjuiVugDKDxz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429589',5.8,44795,'en','The Ant Bully','Fed up with being targeted by the neighborhood bully, 10-year-old Lucas Nickle vents his frustrations on the anthill in his front yard ... until the insects shrink him to the size of a bug with a magic elixir. Convicted of \"crimes against the colony,\" Lucas can only regain his freedom by living with the ants and learning their ways.','/oFuqX0inTvbA1XAFv2x3CQnI65m.jpg','2006-07-28',89,'Released','The battle for the lawn is on.','The Ant Bully',9906,10.3331,5.8,'1UArmfHdeyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19760,_binary '\0','/aKp0rJwZ6lxp9yChuoSoyNEV8hU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429591',5.5,48240,'en','Aquamarine','Two teenage girls discover that mermaids really do exist after a violent storm washes one ashore. The mermaid, a sassy creature named Aquamarine, is determined to prove to her father that real love exists, and enlists the girls\' help in winning the heart of a handsome lifeguard.','/8mioUyXqn60cwSoLrRCaO5ZAsCV.jpg','2006-03-03',103,'Released','A Fish-Out-Of-Water Comedy.','Aquamarine',14191,7.7763,6.5,'UhzXwfatkvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19761,_binary '\0','/xrVJBKSqqQh0u8u0xmvtZSVvE3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429715',6.6,16320,'en','The Business','During the \'80s, a young man named Frankie dreams of escaping London\'s South East region, and his mother\'s thug of a boyfriend gives him just the opportunity. After beating up the abusive beau, Frankie runs off to Spain, where he lands a job delivering a package to the dapper Playboy Charlie, a gangster who takes him under his wing. Working as Charlie\'s driver, Frankie is immersed in a world of fast cars and pretty women -- but all the excess could be his undoing.','/fiDGny79xE3s9fydhaewKtFeaxe.jpg','2005-09-02',96,'Released','This firm will blow you away.','The Business',5145,2.0517,6.1,'wVZX9I6y97k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19762,_binary '\0','/xh0tMV0jiPzUZIxdDjFVXBGCtkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429727',6.7,5535,'it','Il caimano','Bruno Bonomo was a famous producer of B-movies in the ‘70s. After a long hiatus, Bonomo offers a screenplay to RAI centered on the figure of Italy’s prime minister and media tycoon Silvio Berlusconi, a subject so controversial that even the public television broadcaster refuses to produce it','/mPil7yQR4norsr2urNofv9Ym1Ql.jpg','2006-03-24',112,'Released',NULL,'The Caiman',31289,1.3591,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19763,_binary '\0','/2Eu0JLAjxhgRuBOd9vkCgwt2yqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429743',6.2,1243,'pt','O Casamento de Romeu e Julieta','The tomboyish, outgoing Julieta is the daughter of a member of the Palmeiras soccer club board. She is constantly frustrated by what she sees as institutional bias against women in soccer. One day while watching her beloved Palmeiras, she is struck by a handsome man, Romeu, that she sees rooting for the Palmeiras\' chief rivals, the Corinthians. After meeting the same man again in the middle of eye exam, Julieta and Romeu quickly become a couple. However, in order to avoid incurring the wrath of her parents, Romeu is forced to pretend to be an adoring Palmeiras fan, an increasingly difficult task for the die-hard Corinthiano.','/vVTKiWJSlbOHapbe8kUfaiGhCDT.jpg','2005-03-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Romeo and Juliet Get Married',49723,1.5423,6,'At4pNn9kMj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19764,_binary '\0','/64OfC3GtnZVjnM9ykYKlUjWX8pK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0429898',6.3,2098,'it','Cuore sacro','Irene, a workaholic, is forced to re-evaluate her priorities after the suicide of her two best friends.','/ruf42yD7jOSqMMPbjcr2ZbRg19A.jpg','2005-02-25',120,'Released',NULL,'Sacred Heart',43584,1.1854,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19765,_binary '\0','/60PJPzXtQmLQdaCNuWUrrHe1mzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430051',6.5,8479,'de','Elementarteilchen','Based on Michel Houellebecq\'s controversial novel, Atomised (aka The Elementary Particles) focuses on Michael and Bruno, two very different half-brothers and their disturbed sexuality. After a chaotic childhood with a hippie mother only caring for her affairs, Michael, a molecular biologist, is more interested in genes than women, while Bruno is obsessed with his sexual desires, but mostly finds his satisfaction with prostitutes. But Bruno\'s life changes when he gets to know the experienced Christiane. In the meantime, Michael meets Annabelle, the love of his youth, again.','/wpGpR7GewyApPgqPvuWadBAfmFc.jpg','2006-02-10',105,'Released',NULL,'The Elementary Particles',86,2.0292,6.154,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19766,_binary '\0','/jgbINW2p8Q5clYcreoM4XUVWE63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430082',6.5,1216,'tl','Feng Shui','After finding a Feng Shui amulet, Joy starts to see a string of fortunate events come her way. Soon, she realizes it is, in fact, a curse. Now she must break the cycle of good fortune and death in order to save her family.','/EucGWW5u528YjCqFCgMmGMp4cq.jpg','2004-09-18',108,'Released','Who can refuse good luck?','Feng Shui',127642,1.3399,6.5,'2EPeUWrZnAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19767,_binary '\0','/2pITFeesu6aikrEknoH6bNXOdhk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430105',6.8,170992,'en','Four Brothers','Four adopted brothers return to their Detroit hometown when their mother is murdered and vow to exact revenge on the killers.','/8cO39cnWSZQi2ncPG5TxL3YRzKc.jpg','2005-08-11',109,'Released','They came home to bury mom... and her killer','Four Brothers',8292,12.124,6.8,'vZPi0K6UoP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19768,_binary '\0','/nm5nC0vKRHSZZoQuhdmVuEML5kO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430164',6.8,5959,'es','La habitación del niño','Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby\'s room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.','/t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg','2006-11-04',80,'Released','You will never rest quietly again.','The Baby\'s Room',15021,2.4415,6.769,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19769,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430202',5.6,1281,'hi','Sandwich','Shekar has moved to Mumbai from his home in Punjab and has fallen in love with Nisha. However, he is called back to his home to hear that his disabled sister is to marry a young man named Harpreet, but on the condition that Shekar marry Harpreet\'s sister. Unable to refuse, Shekar must lead a double life until matters come to a head many years later.','/1tnz4nWAyulISTPHcDh0bwjPR1g.jpg','2006-07-31',152,'Released',NULL,'Sandwich',158708,1.0718,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19770,_binary '\0','/niqvNqx42P2rIG3Cir2q73lWSow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430224',6.7,2662,'fr','L\'Enfer','Three sisters who share a connection to a violent childhood incident reunite for the chance to come to terms with their past.','/haBIpMIilqSdKMFyFAdHlHospSD.jpg','2005-11-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Hell',17960,2.2506,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19771,_binary '\0','/5f5Ep98Lpzm7h7FoF93khsNIVqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430239',4,2595,'en','It Waits','A lone female park ranger tries to track down a vicious creature killing various people and terrorizing her at a remote national park.','/dAJd3tW4EEeP6RTzLirDgTefSYs.jpg','2005-11-10',88,'Released','It lurks...it prowls...','It Waits',24090,1.7142,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19772,_binary '\0','/3sF2wc5SRQaBs0kC7Jhanz5NnbO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430304',4.6,67112,'en','Little Man','After leaving prison, dwarf criminal Calvin Sims joins his moron brother Percy in stealing an expensive huge diamond from a jewelry store for the mobster Walken. They are chased by the police, and Calvin hides the stone in the purse of executive Vanessa Edwards, whose husband Darryl Edwards wants to have a baby. Percy convinces Calvin to dress like a baby and be left in front of the Edwards\' house to get inside the house and retrieve the diamond. Darryl and Vanessa keep Calvin for the weekend and decide to adopt him, while Walken threatens Darryl to get the stone back.','/9KzPw1VN0pMBnq1KIqBaLI8LAB7.jpg','2006-08-31',98,'Released','Big things come in small packages.','Little Man',9072,12.7514,5.943,'x9STUnqrE_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19773,_binary '\0','/bxJmFRjwWnpoLFkp5OSzA7xfzn6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430308',5.6,54895,'en','Get Rich or Die Tryin\'','A tale of an inner city drug dealer who turns away from crime to pursue his passion, rap music.','/aaEJu8vFKtrAoSRtw3xjCf1aM5d.jpg','2005-11-09',116,'Released','If you think you know the story... You don\'t know the man.','Get Rich or Die Tryin\'',10060,7.8804,6.8,'HJL2hh3jtoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19774,_binary '\0','/n66j8990F0vSkhRM9JKHIVOL3IC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430334',3.8,2118,'en','Mosquito Man','Police lieutenant detective Thomas \'Thom\' Randall\'s steady girl-friend, Dr. Jennifer \'Jen\' Allen, is Dr. Aaron Michaels\'s main assistant on his pharmaceutical firm Bellion\'s research program to cure the highly contagious, fatal infection Guinin. A convicted murderer, whom Thom arrested, is one of their special drug test subjects, but escapes. The convict and Jen are affected by radioactively altered DNA from an experimental reactor used on mosquitoes which transfer quinine. The convict soon mutates into a mosquito-like monster, which sucks its victims dry. By the time Thom and his junior murder brigade partner Charlie Morrison figure out what happens, Jen starts mutating herself.','/qXdMGior3vIiK0UMCE3eWzGMCFE.jpg','2005-03-05',92,'Released','A new breed of predator','Mosquito Man',35891,2.0461,5.3,'QoBYAfd77Jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19775,_binary '\0','/jYhMlpOJMIiDTGcwZsKikZ7FShq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430357',6.1,133675,'en','Miami Vice','A case involving drug lords and murder in South Florida takes a personal turn for undercover detectives Sonny Crockett and Ricardo Tubbs. Unorthodox Crockett gets involved romantically with the Chinese-Cuban wife of a trafficker of arms and drugs, while Tubbs deals with an assault on those he loves.','/iJPSls4taB09EUKtLj6FjFSprb3.jpg','2006-07-27',132,'Released','No Law. No Rules. No Order.','Miami Vice',82,8.0062,6.051,'rxv9ck8Xrio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19776,_binary '\0','/p2S8xran3Fw3rEyiYtRNukCLgmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430377',7.5,1684,'en','Muhammad: The Last Prophet','An account of the birth of Islam.','/dujTx4ZNu1xgIVMV22nge0jfwRs.jpg','2002-11-08',95,'Released','Childrens narrative about the origins of Islam.','Muhammad: The Last Prophet',45904,1.6187,6.3,'vauFFiN3PDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19777,_binary '\0','/6zGnkx5pxxKchH7gA8IMtYM6AEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430381',5.6,2098,'hi','Musafir','Betrayed in love and debt-ridden, Lucky, a small-time criminal, is on his way to Goa for a drug deal. But his life takes a turn when he falls for a dancer, who hires him to kill her abusive husband.','/51v4PPF9H2kSf3gVGDvOQSk5cZV.jpg','2004-12-09',152,'Released',NULL,'Musafir',117356,1.1225,5.521,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19778,_binary '\0','/7BCg6lPcoCIqTi3fMcvVw2Rc3v4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430431',6,8337,'en','One Night with the King','In Biblical times, a girl disguises her Jewish origins when the Persian king comes looking for a new bride among his subjects.','/9ejzABqu2bqjuqSSUk5OwPAnedZ.jpg','2006-10-10',123,'Released','Feel The Touch Of Destiny','One Night with the King',15005,4.7055,6.7,'GjLy-oYnXBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19779,_binary '\0','/cKr5V9W2qCIRoG3QsDxIRtZFCnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430454',5.4,1318,'es','El penalti más largo del mundo','Fernando (Fernando Tejero) is a loser. A gray type, without ambition, that works like bookcases distributor in a supermarket of the quarter. In his free short whiles, he is a substitute keeper of a football team, a third regional one. In all the season he has not played a single minute. But the last Sunday of the league the referee indicates penalty and the regular keeper injures itself. Fernando must occupy the goal for the first time. If penalty scores, the team of the district will proclaim champion. If no, all the effort of a year will not have been worth for anything. When the penalty is just about to be kicked, a group of indignant fans with the referee invades the field and prevents the kick. The competition committee decides that the penalty must play the following Sunday, in the same goal, with same players and the field closed to the public. El Penalti más largo del mundo, (The Longest Penalty Shot in the World) is exactly the history of that week of delay.','/hCHM8G50TUOpAf7CIdxKcKZo9Nu.jpg','2005-03-08',100,'Released',NULL,'The Longest Penalty Shot in the World',43431,1.9836,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19780,_binary '\0','/7eNnAuMW3jTi3DFFUv6XjEscgiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430576',7.4,13757,'en','The Secret Life of Words','A solitary nurse bonds with a badly burned patient who survived an accident on an oil rig.','/mgffUjCN2jvebZBqvyP0lvAoAhB.jpg','2005-12-15',115,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Life of Words',148,4.3163,7,'iPAFnmmJf_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19781,_binary '\0','/xyBfeOOPPs4ZFfuJSPNaNZqsQb8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430582',5.7,2249,'sr','Šejtanov ratnik','Trouble usually starts when the power falls into the wrong hands. That\'s how the book that hides an ancient evil fell to Stanislav. It does not matter whether Stanislav is a nice guy who helps old ladies cross the street, a psychopath, nerd, or a blood-thirsty young man.','/3Rw5z43Pd2jtwupc22TVQbrWiV3.jpg','2006-04-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Sheitan Warrior',112092,0.9155,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19782,_binary '\0','/ab3uHGb1QHg5tDSKJ2Kl5k2nrlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430589',4.1,1646,'hi','शादी करके फस गया यार','Ayaan tricks a model into marrying him, when she leaves her diary in his family\'s garage, allowing him to follow her around.','/wO7lSHuQxkeYpvEMJwY2oIBnc1c.jpg','2006-08-04',152,'Released',NULL,'Shaadi Karke Phas Gaya Yaar',161205,1.3207,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19783,_binary '\0','/2FJZAPXTp9dEORYB0i1ULxkVwWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430594',7.8,1958,'fr','Le silence de la mer','In a small town in the West of France, during the German Occupation, a room is requisitioned by a Wehrmacht captain, Werner von Ebrennac. The house where he now stays is inhabited by young Jeanne, who makes a living by giving piano lessons, and by her grandfather. Quite upset, the two \"hosts\" decide to resist the occupier by never speaking a word to him. Now Werner is a lover of France and its culture, and he tries to persuade them that a rapprochement between Germany and France would be beneficial for the two nations. Quite unexpectedly Jeanne, little by little, falls in love with Werner. At the same time, the Francophile officer loses his illusions, realizing at last that what Nazi Germany actually wants is to thrall France and to stifle its culture...','/9h6lKitROXrUQ7SWLL5cVPgCOkY.jpg','2004-09-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Silence of the Sea',336748,1.9867,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19784,_binary '\0','/81DlYvzoxYjPzFAxs6ruTRZzFRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430634',6.4,31814,'en','Stick It','Haley is a naturally gifted athlete but, with her social behavior, the teen seems intent on squandering her abilities. After a final brush with the law, a judge sentences her to an elite gymnastics academy run by a legendary, hard-nosed coach. Once there, Haley\'s rebellious attitude wins her both friends and enemies.','/uMcylxIC7nBpBd8Uf6Apr4MJ1pf.jpg','2006-04-21',105,'Released','Defy and Conquer.','Stick It',10115,3