ieve that two lovely young strangers may have conspired to commit a brutal murder.','/xs1dkhYaB3Xz5Ei3x1yQX5zDfSA.jpg','2005-03-19',93,'Released','Two divinely gifted geniuses = a diabolic thriller!','Do You Like Hitchcock?',14229,1.2623,5.2,'h3rZy9acCFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19789,_binary '\0','/n5YbupUvG4Ux6a7UgU0TDeoVAbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430710',7.9,2783,'ml','ഉദയനാണ് താരം','Udayabhanu is an assistant director and scriptwriter, who dreams of making it big in the film industry. His attempt is thwarted by his roommate, a junior artiste, Rajappan Thengamoodu who steals his script to become superstar Saroj Kumar','/1XwwwgzOcYkhRaueT2kSaMA1p7N.jpg','2005-01-20',162,'Released',NULL,'Udayananu Tharam',240541,1.4332,7.534,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19790,_binary '\0','/2b3qSViOlJeTMCEO5wy8wVqNfHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430768',5.9,2736,'en','Wild Tigers I Have Known','A lyrical telling of the coming of age of a 14-year-old boy who learns to cope with his new found sexuality and his unrequited love for the cool kid in school.','/ij0bRoMZiKJgRxpcnGnguk7VHgO.jpg','2006-07-12',88,'Released',NULL,'Wild Tigers I Have Known',59995,2.0478,5.7,'TLG6PYKcTrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19791,_binary '\0','/lrE14a3NfpDhSHHbJaQYScK6aSh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430770',5.1,24555,'en','The Women','The story centers on a group of gossipy, high-society women who spend their days at the beauty salon and haunting fashion shows. The sweet, happily-wedded Mary Haines finds her marriage in trouble when shop girl Crystal Allen gets her hooks into Mary\'s man.','/fqQksnbEfmUGL0zj3MIb53euAh6.jpg','2008-09-12',114,'Released',NULL,'The Women',13972,4.2376,5.2,'RlxwcwESDkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19792,_binary '\0','/dGsBaxjskigP9aiHvs5EWZDDsdv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430772',7,2995,'cn','旺角黑夜','A gangster\'s son is accidentally killed during a drunken dispute with a rival gang, and Officer Milo\'s task force is assigned to the case. He soon learns that a hitman has been hired to take out the rival gang leader. While Milo and his crew desperately try to find and stop the hired gun, fearing all-out war in the streets, Lai Fu, a smart but inexperienced killer from a small town in the mainland, arrives in Hong Kong to do his job.','/1LFv4ZmWZeM56f5swPgcWABTZ8w.jpg','2004-05-10',110,'Released','Fate can bring us together; so can sin!','One Nite in Mongkok',28772,2.1416,6.8,'J0KKV9jV_iI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19793,_binary '\0','/tcFFMP25n6zoB8R12ulx3lKgRzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430779',5.7,10642,'en','Everyone\'s Hero','A boy begins a grand journey to return Babe Ruth\'s baseball bat before the deciding game of the 1932 World Series comes to a close.','/zevMhG4AIAJpOKLqtUCxzC5T3JA.jpg','2006-08-04',87,'Released','No matter where life takes you, always keep swingin\'','Everyone\'s Hero',15213,8.1722,6.1,'FB4rJ0qn250','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19794,_binary '\0','/fszGfgBTnBMCDYq0k3Bp3FpDUvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430895',7.3,1804,'fr','Aurore','After the sudden death of her mother, Aurore Gagnon is abused by her disturbed step-mother as her town remains in the silence followed by her death. Based on a true story.','/zIoQKtII3DXRwelncLYEXrJ4ruC.jpg','2005-07-08',115,'Released',NULL,'Aurore',16147,1.4892,7.491,'-HgIwYVCOhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19795,_binary '\0','/g03rOxKeJJbgR3Lvzrcdii55dm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430912',4.4,44064,'en','Basic Instinct 2','Novelist Catherine Tramell is once again in trouble with the law, and Scotland Yard appoints psychiatrist Dr. Michael Glass to evaluate her. Though, like Detective Nick Curran before him, Glass is entranced by Tramell and lured into a seductive game.','/yNRSbx6AhOlW673t2073Wr2iH4U.jpg','2006-03-29',116,'Released','Everything interesting begins in the mind','Basic Instinct 2',3093,7.9929,5,'W7eAJ3f7C5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19796,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430916',7,1469,'en','Beautiful Losers','This documentary follows the lives and careers of a collective group of do-it-yourself artists and designers who inadvertently affected the art world.','/9gllAA4UnQWQVkpe2RVXTOMr90P.jpg','2008-04-01',90,'Released','Make Something From Nothing','Beautiful Losers',27286,0.8128,6.5,'hv2YiC__nvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19797,_binary '\0','/pN4ZMv4iq3KSFXZqFvkZybdikeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430919',5.9,4023,'en','The Best Man','When writer\'s block derails the literary dreams of Olly Pickering, he has to move in with his friend Murray after losing all his money. Things start to look up when Olly\'s college pal James asks him to be the best man at his wedding. Prior to the nuptials, Olly is drawn to a woman whom he thinks is the bride\'s sister -- only she turns out to be the bride, Sarah. Can Murray, who dislikes James, help get Sarah and Olly together?','/6Buo27SaY1tHBVLiHyUKiBS0X5B.jpg','2005-07-09',96,'Released','May the best man win... her heart.','The Best Man',27594,3.4994,5.4,'aJB20XOJ7E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19798,_binary '\0','/wEnMNW8rGX1RVhKY4Lj5sVDYSK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0430922',6.8,253428,'en','Role Models','Two salesmen trash a company truck on an energy drink-fueled bender. Upon their arrest, the court gives them a choice: do hard time or spend 150 service hours with a mentorship program. After one day with the kids, however, jail doesn\'t look half bad.','/ki79dSjh6Rr51xrsz4dT04UGxSU.jpg','2008-11-07',99,'Released','They\'re about to get more than they plea-bargained for.','Role Models',15373,8.6526,6.484,'wtFESEqa9fA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19799,_binary '\0','/4XrGpCg93lqOmoMGFHQb75AIAmB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21: