uple\'s uneventful lives are forever changed when they move into an isolated house in the country and befriend an odd, younger couple.','/upLGMmutOGS5FMKinRFxniaegjr.jpg','2005-08-24',98,'Released',NULL,'To Paint or Make Love',15702,2.9663,6.3,'2KqV7PaVKSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19811,_binary '\0','/gNlJjYsfOYj7X7jGx9uW1nkzn40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0431979',6.9,2799,'fr','Le Petit Lieutenant','A rookie policeman from provincial Le Havre volunteers for the high pressure Parisian homicide bureau and is assigned to a middle-aged woman detective.','/eIjrRfBacqZ1XbGbwbHtYVauBHj.jpg','2005-08-31',110,'Released',NULL,'The Young Lieutenant',12455,1.4664,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19812,_binary '\0','/5UgYt4ewCZZeX9HEG1Bk0ts4xu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0432021',6.2,218110,'en','Resident Evil: Extinction','Years after the Racoon City catastrophe, survivors travel across the Nevada desert, hoping to make it to Alaska. Alice joins the caravan and their fight against hordes of zombies and the evil Umbrella Corp.','/6yaLr7Ymg5cvbtSVi5hHwBKx35I.jpg','2007-09-20',94,'Released','All bets are off.','Resident Evil: Extinction',7737,6.9532,6.304,'eDMjVARsCOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19813,_binary '\0','/3yv0UfXwZ8cynd145vFuY1rGu1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0432044',5.2,1813,'sv','Sandor /slash/ Ida','Ida lives hard and fast with too much drinking and a string of boyfriends, Sandor has very few friends and his mother insists that he practices ballet. They meet in a chat room and despite appearances they discover they have much in common. Sandor and Ida lives in different cities and when Sandor unexpectedly visits her it ends with disaster.','/sd7O711T9fgYOA36Zi7AYKd3QSO.jpg','2005-02-04',93,'Released','Party girl meets a male ballet dancer on the Internet.','Sandor /slash/ Ida',32649,0.7654,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19814,_binary '\0','/4J0JAe2etX