 the US government to stop evil Leonard Saber, who plans to destroy the world with household appliances. But the government shuts them down and they are sentenced to a pet shop. Can they escape to defeat the villain and save the world?','/9Tly3ZXTTsQKM26fis8v9LR4GxG.jpg','2009-07-24',88,'Released','The world needs bigger heroes','G-Force',19585,9.064,5.5,'7GaEZ2e9Ijs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19889,_binary '\0','/xzDSOYk2WpbDZDSynFsN9S1Uv0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436364',6.2,8209,'en','Good','When John Halder\'s latest novel is enlisted by powerful political figures in the Nazi party to push their agenda, his career and social standing instantly advance. But after learning of the Reich\'s horrific plans for the future and the devastating effects they will have on people close to him, John must decide whether or not to take a stand and risk losing everything.','/AgNssumEnPaT6kzzJyj4oLypOOG.jpg','2008-12-31',96,'Released','Evil triumphs when good men do nothing.','Good',12410,2.9627,6,'9o5M7J9c1ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19890,_binary '\0','/oeyy49GIm1ZBLMcM5JLI6CY39fY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436374',6.7,6416,'es','El habitante incierto','Mysterious events lead an increasingly paranoid architect to believe a stranger is lurking in his large house.','/y7k9wy9kjxDqe5kIBqw210CZi0Q.jpg','2005-10-21',110,'Released','Open the door to your worst nightmare.','The Uninvited Guest',48594,2.1395,6.6,'fQWN6L-gttc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19891,_binary '\0','/dAHrR2Avzpdpii9RGRGglJqt0BU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436445',7.1,1797,'fr','Je ne suis pas là pour être aimé','Jean-Claude Delsart, a 50 years-old bailiff, with his worn-out smile and heart, abandoned a long time ago the idea that life could give him pleasures. Until the day, he dares to push the doors of a tango lesson...','/9nlF36ymCFTkss54lotmSSEmIaQ.jpg','2005-10-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Not Here to Be Loved',537,2.1412,6.7,'T3IjmIOBIIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19892,_binary '\0','/4WPfkd0CkKUem1OkfKkGbP8xjSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436460',4.9,1234,'en','Kiss Me Again','A married couple decides to test the boundaries of their relationship with a seductive Spanish woman. When an unlikely relationship ensues, all three are forced to rethink their definition of love.','/9coG0XpCv61NZeVWR2cFcWkwz6b.jpg','2006-04-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Kiss Me Again',24397,1.8978,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19893,_binary '\0','/9NwEqHBOjpOAcGCX5kGNujIRpEL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436546',6.7,2523,'fr','Ma vie en l\'air','Yann Kerbec is a flight instructor: he evaluates pilots’ abilities under extreme conditions on flight simulators. But Yann has a big problem: he is so airsick since he was born in a plane, that he couldn’t even follow the love of his life when she moved to Australia. Yann is now thirty years old and remembers with both nostalgia and humour the numerous love stories he spoiled because of his phobia. Will he finally accept to become a grown up or will he keep making plans in the air?','/jQouO8wPkHwrXOjHsWKHJhchJIa.jpg','2005-06-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Love Is in the Air',25197,1.7061,6.5,'RDa9CWeYmC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19894,_binary '\0','/fBJ9gbA47YRz3OTjihselG1h79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436607',6.6,1478,'en','The Motel','Thirteen-year-old Ernest Chin lives and works at a sleazy hourly-rate motel on a strip of desolate suburban bi-way. Misunderstood by his family and blindly careening into puberty, Ernest befriends Sam Kim, a self-destructive yet charismatic Korean man who has checked in. Sam teaches the fatherless boy all the rites of manhood.','/7dHilrksaDBIVulSBduS1dsHXai.jpg','2005-01-24',75,'Released','Out of Place in the Middle of Nowhere.','The Motel',20520,0.9802,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19895,_binary '\0','/doqhyJkdsM2djS43hiajZJwBmM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436613',7.7,10844,'en','Murderball','Quadriplegics, who play full-contact rugby in wheelchairs, overcome unimaginable obstacles to compete in the Paralympic Games in Athens, Greece.','/qxaXzZnGsHaAJpSaF72nDhhL58n.jpg','2005-07-22',88,'Released',NULL,'Murderball',14278,1.8952,7.1,'AmvXbrrOAkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19896,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436629',7.7,1911,'en','New York Doll','A recovering alcoholic and recently converted Mormon, Arthur \"Killer\" Kane, of the rock band The New York Dolls, is given a chance at reuniting with his band after 30 years.','/ejsAQPUusg83vXpzji54wMJXBsf.jpg','2005-01-20',75,'Released',NULL,'New York Doll',41566,1.3488,6.8,'jwD04NsnLLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19897,_binary '\0','/ld0GhLVT0f5p1OA5LuF77RWaw2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436639',6.1,1239,'ko','녹색 의자','When she falls in love with a handsome minor, a South Korean housewife finds herself at the center of a sexual scandal and hounded by hungry tabloid journalists. She vows to cut him out of her life but then he reaches the age of legal consent.','/yhqNlgI1rhcUTYuNGDb7ixjBbcj.jpg','2005-06-10',98,'Released','The Crime Was Their Passion.','Green Chair',30043,2.1589,6.1,'Ny7Kj86jsqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19898,_binary '\0','/8RojHhWXVx4N8OPLeYMZqUoUhFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436689',6.5,5535,'en','The Puffy Chair','Josh, a struggling musician, wins a vintage recliner in an eBay auction. Since he lives in New York and the chair is in Atlanta, this poses a bit of a problem. He asks his girlfriend, Emily, to accompany him on the trip, and his hippie brother Rhett joins the pair along the way.','/fybmkedrXx02p7i6TZMl9sC5NvM.jpg','2006-06-02',85,'Released',NULL,'The Puffy Chair',24055,1.6111,6.1,'85cmTNBH42k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19899,_binary '\0','/rGtA5izCGzWHXt3l7sfzv5Vr6xA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436697',7.3,120217,'en','The Queen','The Queen is an intimate behind the scenes glimpse at the interaction between HM Elizabeth II and Prime Minister Tony Blair during their struggle, following the death of Diana, to reach a compromise between what was a private tragedy for the Royal family and the public\'s demand for an overt display of mourning.','/v08RH5Cx9EFAQMBWQuE5jHAgHYs.jpg','2006-09-15',103,'Released','Our Leaders. Ourselves.','The Queen',1165,6.652,6.9,'BIvESE9A_gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19900,_binary '\0','/yTQ1nGUbXtFefSqrcjvGZd8unGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436724',7.1,3455,'en','Rize','A documentary film that highlights two street derived dance styles, Clowning and Krumping, that came out of the low income neighborhoods of L.A.. Director David LaChapelle interviews each dance crew about how their unique dances evolved. A new and positive activity away from the drugs, guns, and gangs that ruled their neighborhood. A raw film about a growing sub-culture movements in America.','/bx7UAcyumQZuNj3dZFK7Wh4dbRl.jpg','2005-01-15',86,'Released',NULL,'Rize',2287,1.1528,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19901,_binary '\0','/ufNhbfCI0Iwuf4Kf6Cz2Gr3A7hW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436854',7.1,3494,'kk','Тюльпан','Asa, a young and cheerful dreamer, returns from his Russian naval service to his sister’s nomadic family on the desolate Hunger Steppe of central Asia, so that he can begin his own life as a shepherd. But before he can tend a flock of his own, Asa must first win the hand of the only eligible girl for miles—his mysterious neighbor, Tulpan.','/p6LMvGgoL5pEDJtUJuuFPt9SCDP.jpg','2009-03-04',100,'Released','She\'s the only girl for him.','Tulpan',8939,0.9468,6.3,'aZaecdNHLxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19902,_binary '\0','/q6WypenFSf3lgvMVsZJ3YbwLyQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436855',5.7,1362,'en','12 Days of Christmas Eve','Calvin Carter, a successful business executive, has it all, but neglects those closest to him. On Christmas Eve, all that changes when the sign on his office building falls on him. He awakes in a hospital bed, attended to by Angie, a nurse who soon lets him know he has 12 days (12 chances) to get his act together and achieve the \"perfect\" Christmas Eve. If he doesn\'t, there will be dire consequences.','/256r0WmLu730bca8q52OxoSJZnD.jpg','2004-12-07',89,'Released','He\'s got twelve chances to get Christmas right.','12 Days of Christmas Eve',59700,1.8231,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19903,_binary '\0','/jhPVZsEQYG4cLJ5IJV7J1n3bcQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436889',6.4,4388,'de','Die weisse Massai','A girl, Carola, whose vacation in Kenya takes an interesting turn when she becomes infatuated with a Masai. Carola decides to leave her boyfriend to stay with her lover. There, she has to adapt to the Masai\'s way of life and get used to their food which includes milk mixed with blood. She also has to face her husband\'s attitude towards women and what he expects from a wife. Nonetheless, Carola is welcomed warmly into the tribe she has chosen to join.','/7hNAYqhwmVYtvxgSZFiKmWJDClP.jpg','2005-09-14',131,'Released',NULL,'The White Masai',6967,3.1676,6.3,'Gwlh7Hbd_0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19904,_binary '\0','/5eR0yLNVyalvzLdhuO8mWdd3ECk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0436971',8,10538,'en','Why We Fight','Is American foreign policy dominated by the idea of military supremacy? Has the military become too important in American life? Jarecki\'s shrewd and intelligent polemic would seem to give an affirmative answer to each of these questions.','/kfOmnlwt1rrhxmxc05X3i9mHSOs.jpg','2005-01-20',98,'Released','It Is Nowhere Written That The American Empire Goes On Forever','Why We Fight',14286,1.3111,7.5,'BcuStxJHv4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19905,_binary '\0','/8wP9qJc22Igr1LGTIDNqAF3B6P6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437084',6,1711,'te','బాలు','Balu helps the people of Mahankali market get the rights to their land. This means he\'ll have to face an old nemesis.','/xVTreXL4Q2fdDI6YM0mNfcbR5eu.jpg','2005-01-06',161,'Released','ABCDEFG: A Boy Can Do Everything For Girl','Balu',115268,1.0006,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19906,_binary '\0','/jXDselREPq8TOVGM4dzBBUM7xVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437086',7.3,327295,'en','Alita: Battle Angel','When Alita awakens with no memory of who she is in a future world she does not recognize, she is taken in by Ido, a compassionate doctor who realizes that somewhere in this abandoned cyborg shell is the heart and soul of a young woman with an extraordinary past.','/xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg','2019-01-31',122,'Released','​\"I do not stand by in the presence of evil.\"','Alita: Battle Angel',399579,19.4213,7.278,'U3D2vmWD88w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19907,_binary '\0','/AoyWbIC1QBHCWk7pJmeWJY3Z1KG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437088',6.9,1419,'en','A Bear Named Winnie','Based on the true story of a Canadian soldier, enroute to World War I from Winnipeg, who adopts an orphaned bear cub at White River Ontario. It is namned Winnie (for Winnipeg) and eventually ends up at the London Zoo where it became the inspiration for A.A.Milne\'s Winnie The Pooh stories.','/5AM32ouIdUFTk2NzyuKTEM5k3Oq.jpg','2004-12-12',90,'Released',NULL,'A Bear Named Winnie',73416,2.7866,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19908,_binary '\0','/QM7paiUdsP7svJqCQCM0BCGUM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437171',6.6,1707,'en','East Side Story','Diego is a gay but closeted Hispanic chef living in East Los Angeles who works in the restaurant operated by his grandmother. Frustrated by the secretive lifestyle he shares with his similarly closeted lover, Pablo, Diego finds himself attracted to Wesley, one of the openly gay Caucasian men he feels are gentrifying his neighborhood. Their relationship pushes Diego to consider the possibility of a life he had never imagined.','/bGgd7k09LaaZBkJDW0C1zmPkwnu.jpg','2006-01-01',88,'Released','Love thy neighbor... just don\'t get caught!','East Side Story',19151,1.1467,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19909,_binary '\0','/cYeGgYKWhqfDZxnXZKWqJSjqg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437179',5.1,31070,'en','See No Evil','A group of delinquents are sent to clean the Blackwell Hotel but little do they know reclusive psychopath Jacob Goodnight has holed away in the rotting hotel. When one of the teens is captured, those who remain band together to survive against the brutal killer.','/uA6hwY75mhewYK2tAib1LJclhbD.jpg','2006-05-19',84,'Released','Evil Gets Raw','See No Evil',10007,5.4435,5.441,'ey5LtoCV-80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19910,_binary '\0','/2Nc6eQpkwStCEe6AfAt9h8z4ZSM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437182',5.6,2128,'hi','Family: Ties of Blood','The story is on the concept of karma and bad deeds. It follows Viren Sahai (Amitabh Bachchan), underworld don who rules over India. His son Abhir (Sushant Singh) is spoilt and believes he can do anything due to his father\'s power. When Viren\'s enemy Khan (Kader Khan) attacks Abhir, Viren demands revenge.','/dMo4b6JqrpbP8bkQpdqu5VlYybC.jpg','2006-01-12',151,'Released','all the power on earth could not change his familys destiny...','Family: Ties of Blood',136542,1.457,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19911,_binary '\0','/TUTIdOleJX00J0A1ysYHtzRKv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437230',7,1355,'fr','Horloge biologique','The passage of time is probably the only concrete proof we have that justice exists in this cruel world. Some people would like to stop time in its tracks, while others choose to follow its path. In this story, three men in their early thirties have reached that age when it\'s time to start thinking about \"getting a life\", perhaps starting a family. But how do you handle the fact that your friendships are changing? That, slowly, your new family is becoming the center of your ever-shrinking world? What do you do when you realize your youth is a thing of the past?','/3zMilKNtdEeb2OiWRWL6rcnNdle.jpg','2005-08-01',100,'Released','A group of 30-somethings are forced to choose between the pleasures of single life or becoming parents.','Dodging the Clock',44791,1.0198,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19912,_binary '\0','/to5uhJxIin8Pi9WmREFLSUuS33L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437232',6.7,11124,'en','Catch a Fire','The true story of anti-apartheid activists in South Africa, and particularly the life of Patrick Chamusso, a timid foreman at Secunda CTL, the largest synthetic fuel plant in the world. Patrick is wrongly accused, imprisoned and tortured for an attempt to bomb the plant, with the injustice transforming the apolitical worker into a radicalised insurgent, who then carries out his own successful sabotage mission.','/2sgujWX2yWH7REnDI35ZZXsqPiV.jpg','2006-10-27',101,'Released','The spark that ignites us, unites us.','Catch a Fire',1123,2.7714,6.3,'8Z7N_pzL4C4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19913,_binary '\0','/OjP8C3HY5jdSE9Ob0H19e9ahpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437238',7.1,11207,'hi','हलचल','A man and woman from feuding families each pretend to fall in love, as part of a revenge plot. Chaos ensues when their fake romance becomes a reality.','/ve6YjkjNAbY2r2djFxrw6v9IXfy.jpg','2004-11-26',150,'Released','It\'s one crazy love story!','Hulchul',20364,5.0752,6.641,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19914,_binary '\0','/oec9dd990pRQ8W3meakCuAQKX6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437405',6.5,21224,'en','Paper Man','A coming-of-middle-age comedy that chronicles the unlikely friendship between failed author Richard Dunne and a Long Island teen who teaches him a thing or two about growing up, all under the disapproving eye of his long-suffering wife and his imaginary Superhero friend.','/wneK8G9E26FUqYo4KjPlsD0TIII.jpg','2009-06-15',110,'Released','A little imagination goes a long way','Paper Man',39414,3.995,6.3,'iumOefBwx00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19915,_binary '\0','/cAoYF7mQnYd9UFATCOnk62DAdbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437407',7.2,10147,'hi','Parineeta','Childhood sweethearts Lalita and Shekhar wish to get married someday. However, Shekhar\'s growing suspicions about Lalita coupled with his conniving father\'s antics threaten to tear them apart.','/6PupxvUzTVqkSJvvbDILOjLQwuB.jpg','2005-06-10',124,'Released',NULL,'Parineeta',20651,1.8629,6.474,'FQ5hBUPjld4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19916,_binary '\0','/jjyNoqCHrtTyNoor27nDucEtCtd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437447',7.3,5902,'zh','千里走单骑','Takada, a Japanese fisherman has been estranged from his son for many years, but when the son is diagnosed with terminal cancer his daughter-in-law, Rie, summons him to the hospital. Through a series of obstacles and relationships, he is brought unexpectedly closer to both an understanding of himself and of his son.','/shA3I9K9bjNVyFsefq73CxXsauQ.jpg','2005-12-22',109,'Released',NULL,'Riding Alone for Thousands of Miles',14226,2.0343,7.1,'dvelhd8zkWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19917,_binary '\0','/dm8yiYJBo4cTo3Yak5SxR89uVDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437459',5.4,1237,'en','Rollin\' with the Nines','Too Fine and his friends Finny, Pushy and Rage hope to set up a successful urban underground garage...','/cgF9c0xLUh9ImzWWEf5pf2hEmLx.jpg','2006-04-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Rollin\' with the Nines',10084,1.9788,4.7,'I6L3NK5vlwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19918,_binary '\0','/iVgUjIqsF9HczC84XFPQ8Md8HBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437498',3.8,1556,'en','Swarmed','Residents of a small town find themselves battling a swarm of wasps which has been sprayed by a super pesticide.','/5EZYd7m2Pl6O1Dt8UwhX2M1JTIR.jpg','2005-12-06',88,'Released','Man doesn\'t rule the planet anymore','Swarmed',37035,2.4183,4.3,'p2wCK0XvI8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19919,_binary '\0','/8rl2FnibCaAgn8LlkljVBayLwbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437526',6.2,4079,'fr','Une vieille maîtresse','Secrets, rumors and betrayals surround the upcoming marriage between a young dissolute man and virtuous woman of the French aristocracy.','/mlwZeO5eddSHTeoRbH5htWT3ZQU.jpg','2007-05-30',115,'Released',NULL,'The Last Mistress',2002,2.2413,5.8,'EQxF47Jq59k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19920,_binary '\0','/z3rXaWnmQTJJw9ioNxRQ23rYXHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437777',6.6,15895,'en','Something New','Kenya McQueen thought she had it all: a successful career, good friends and family. There was just one thing she didn\'t have under control: her love life. All that changes when she meets sexy, free-spirited Brian Kelly. But when her ideal man arrives on the scene, Kenya must decide between the relationship everyone expects and the romance no one expected.','/lcwB60GqQaWUgUw1CCE5gm5XHI1.jpg','2006-01-29',99,'Released','She had it all under control. Except her heart.','Something New',15363,6.359,6.4,'48e27D5XJLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19921,_binary '\0','/5cQG6wbizKfADPCNp4Tm801VMxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437800',7.4,23027,'en','Akeelah and the Bee','11-year-old Akeelah Anderson has a way with words. After winning her schoolwide spelling bee, she decides to enter the competition, despite her classmates\' derision and the antipathy of her mother Tanya. Thanks to the efforts of her teacher Dr. Larabee, she reaches the finals. As she gets to know her fellow competitors, Akeelah realizes that coming first isn\'t everything in life.','/tLejxaLJu8Qh5F2VKacWniMSZ3v.jpg','2006-04-28',113,'Released','Changing the world... one word at a time.','Akeelah and the Bee',13751,7.0031,7,'8Sf4Lwxg6lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19922,_binary '\0','/tIiPFKY7HynPQDyLYhG4CSbJNVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437806',8.6,4259,'en','Alone in the Wilderness','Dick Proenneke retired at age 50 in 1967 and decided to build his own cabin in the wilderness at the base of the Aleutian Peninsula, in what is now Lake Clark National Park. Using color footage he shot himself, Proenneke traces how he came to this remote area, selected a homestead site and built his log cabin completely by himself. The documentary covers his first year in-country, showing his day-to-day activities and the passing of the seasons as he sought to scratch out a living alone in the wilderness.','/fOzc4vwTG9d9tlhX6EyPHu3cuiq.jpg','2004-10-08',57,'Released','One man\'s 32-year Alaskan experience in the cabin he built by hand.','Alone in the Wilderness',14463,2.2014,7.9,'iYJKd0rkKss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19923,_binary '\0','/xJStAb7MXXJRK5JzMVQ6eBmtsWL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437857',6.7,27352,'en','Behind the Mask: The Rise of Leslie Vernon','The next great psycho horror slasher has given a documentary crew exclusive access to his life as he plans his reign of terror over the sleepy town of Glen Echo, all the while deconstructing the conventions and archetypes of the horror genre for them.','/vie8a3z219Zsw81eAsM58B6VFEn.jpg','2006-08-29',91,'Released','Freddy, Jason, Michael. We all need someone to look up to.','Behind the Mask: The Rise of Leslie Vernon',10961,3.1243,6.428,'7RiJDEZywlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19924,_binary '\0','/n5yh6oimGdcKIjxzNft5sNX46ip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437863',5.6,59234,'en','The Benchwarmers','A trio of guys try and make up for missed opportunities in childhood by forming a three-player baseball team to compete against standard little league squads.','/5yMPCr4qhuNg6fT538xicHaMaG7.jpg','2006-04-07',85,'Released','Get off the bench and get into the game.','The Benchwarmers',9957,6.6099,5.864,'DgLZGPfxpkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19925,_binary '\0','/cRXcuLS1z0820eZ4mOXF08VEdZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0437954',4.7,10298,'en','Virgin Territory','In Black Death era Tuscany, as in the Decameron, ten young Florentines take refuge from the plague. But instead of telling stories, they have lusty adventures, bawdy exchanges, romance, swordplay, randy nuns, Saracen pirates, and a sexy cow.','/zofWP7ZKhoVTh2VUltaDo4LRQXc.jpg','2007-12-17',93,'Released','Anything can happen when you\'re in ... Virgin Territory','Virgin Territory',14324,9.3498,4.992,'fMECUXfUNSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19926,_binary '\0','/ei2fqT3IlqVx1uAM4UKuNlqflLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438052',4.2,2969,'en','The Gene Generation','In a futuristic world, Michelle lives everyday battling with DNA Hackers who use their skills to hack into people\'s bodies and kill them. She is an assassin, trying to keep her younger brother, Jackie, out of trouble. When Jackie gets involved in a petty crime of robbery, he propels himself into the world of DNA Hackers, Shylocks (Loan Sharks) and Gangs','/7zoOytPe2KkWJZxIXS525cscSod.jpg','2007-09-27',96,'Released',NULL,'The Gene Generation',15166,2.3093,4.697,'XmncKHMqwkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19927,_binary '\0','/o1jr0UqVjxIZ1JnFzuVLN4ulWey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438097',6.8,321950,'en','Ice Age: The Meltdown','Diego, Manny and Sid return in this sequel to the hit animated movie Ice Age. This time around, the deep freeze is over, and the ice-covered earth is starting to melt, which will destroy the trio\'s cherished valley. The impending disaster prompts them to reunite and warn all the other beasts about the desperate situation.','/zDduhCHasKQ9YOTvlOreHem7Wbi.jpg','2006-03-29',91,'Released','Kiss your nuts goodbye.','Ice Age: The Meltdown',950,21.7384,6.7,'SNMXO74bw9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19928,_binary '\0','/yMjuDIX5GTnDC4NrmovuCoWIFz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438123',6.6,3223,'en','Mom at Sixteen','Pregnant sixteen year old Jacey\'s well-meaning mother forces her to keep the birth a secret and decides to raise the baby as her own.','/1P6ZMnC2a1YR8MY0gakCXZ0oQzo.jpg','2005-03-01',88,'Released','It\'s about the choices you make next.','Mom at Sixteen',64191,1.955,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19929,_binary '\0','/svzPuqoBRg8M91NcOJyXauKy6Zv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438204',4.5,1897,'en','Mad Cowgirl','A woman, who is dying of a brain disorder, begins a surreal journey which descends into violence.','/c449GO3bbQ1umBld9QBan1PnSO6.jpg','2006-02-03',89,'Released','If you eat it, you will be in Hell!','Mad Cowgirl',87280,1.0791,4.5,'WHJFd36lq6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19930,_binary '\0','/4cNTEZxxR2xbgoDZef9Zj24KXZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438205',7.4,3616,'en','Mad Hot Ballroom','Eleven-year-old New York City public school kids journey into the world of ballroom dancing and reveal pieces of themselves and their world along the way. Told from their candid, sometimes humorous perspectives, these kids are transformed, from reluctant participants to determined competitors, from typical urban kids to \"ladies and gentlemen,\" on their way to try to compete in the final citywide competition.','/1wDU19PTEdR30QdnLFw93scXto7.jpg','2005-05-13',105,'Released','Anyone can make it if they learn how to shake it.','Mad Hot Ballroom',14358,1.4177,6.7,'F5wEb_3S2VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19931,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438241',6.8,1305,'ro','Milionari de weekend','Following a competitive circumstances, Russian Federation returned the Romanian state treasury found in Moscow. Among the items brought into the country is also a bust of the early twentieth century (porcelain bust made ​​in 1915, signed I. Andropov) that is not in inventory; experts consider it a \"regular kitch\". The bust was stored at the Museum of Art in Bucharest.','/3r4CLldTCKVsbkOFz7f2zn1Vkqh.jpg','2004-10-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Weekend Millionaires',140666,0.9556,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19932,_binary '\0','/6nee7F86T21kBqNifjKr9t6jqQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438315',7.2,31837,'en','Peaceful Warrior','A chance encounter with a stranger changes the life of a college gymnast.','/r4VQCZe3aSo7TmmsxcyLqaoMR1l.jpg','2006-03-30',120,'Released','There are no ordinary moments.','Peaceful Warrior',13689,4.713,7.5,'gegNMYvY_yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19933,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438486',5.5,1327,'en','Ten \'til Noon','Between 11:50 and 12:00 noon, a crime is commited. In the same ten minute period, we follow the lives of the ten people, all connected to this crime. As we see each person\'s point of view, we are propelled closer and closer to the truth of what exactly happened...and why.','/xi4CB6gCx9C9iobBfgu6306YzQO.jpg','2007-03-30',88,'Released','In ten minutes, everything can change. For these ten people, it will.','Ten \'til Noon',14065,1.0486,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19934,_binary '\0','/uifaXfJxjTMeNttw5u04nHx1G5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438488',6.5,395357,'en','Terminator Salvation','All grown up in post-apocalyptic 2018, John Connor must lead the resistance of humans against the increasingly dominating militaristic robots. But when Marcus Wright appears, his existence confuses the mission as Connor tries to determine whether Wright has come from the future or the past -- and whether he\'s friend or foe.','/gw6JhlekZgtKUFlDTezq3j5JEPK.jpg','2009-05-20',115,'Released','The end begins.','Terminator Salvation',534,18.6342,6.102,'CYQqsFclbHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19935,_binary '\0','/ciSmAUpqtFGtAm6igrzeCjXggeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438859',7.1,12533,'en','Goodbye Bafana','The true story of a white South African racist whose life was profoundly altered by the black prisoner he guarded for twenty years. The prisoner\'s name was Nelson Mandela.','/omL85DnSNaZLLnF0KzqSZihuWAr.jpg','2007-02-11',115,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye Bafana',1874,2.3755,6.861,'IFqlLnAYwC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19936,_binary '\0','/tZJkjwgK4fz1Tu6gWEBHsQKD6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0438875',4.6,1638,'hi','इन्सान','A grieving policeman and a rickshaw driver are brought together by a dark, tragic secret that will change their lives forever.','/fNwCr9gCMPpsOfVDCnJ766sx2I6.jpg','2005-01-14',142,'Released',NULL,'Insan',233830,1.3115,5.192,'amtM-Y3ozHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19937,_binary '\0','/3FETWA800RYfsfhueNjzeD5wtM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439008',5.4,1652,'en','These Girls','Before heading off to college, a teenager and her two friends try to seduce a married man.','/bzPPz5iHhbmyBvDCrGoKfDv8RlF.jpg','2005-09-10',92,'Released','Best friends share everything.','These Girls',19676,1.8671,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19938,_binary '\0','/fBtaZ5QLYdfUiVgbcnTjzxGq6HD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439123',7.3,4362,'fr','Azur et Asmar','Raised on tales of a Djinn fairy princess, Azur, a young Frenchman goes to North Africa in search of the sprite, only to discover that his close childhood friend, Asmar, an Arab youth whose mother raised both boys also seeks the genie.','/hkjdx0FbNGOt5QDD18jt0ZkPiHQ.jpg','2006-10-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Azur & Asmar: The Princes\' Quest',19026,2.95,7.7,'XBgjlRipnb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19939,_binary '\0','/ajE3ix7UUhZqvwpz09OnpVY4bTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439182',6.2,1260,'en','Four Eyed Monsters','Apathy, technology, paranoia, disease and medication. Meet Arin. Arin is a shy videographer who finds it too much to handle to go out and meet girls, so he sets up an account on meester.net. The flood of responses never comes, save for one email from Susan, a struggling artist who finds her job as a waitress stifling her creativity. Susan is also on the shy side and is seeking an alternative to the classic dating situation. When Arin and Susan finally meet, that alternative dating situation comes to life as the two refuse to communicate verbally with each other, wanting to avoid bs small talk.','/dK6qTEus2V2xCKGgXJ8osTPIf1g.jpg','2005-01-21',71,'Released','Four glittering eyes, two pink mouths, and eight limbs wrapped around itself taking up two seats on the subway.','Four Eyed Monsters',46336,1.1161,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19940,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439284',6.8,1390,'en','The American Standards','At a crossroads in his life, Doc Jennings goes home to celebrate his mother\'s birthday and uncovers dramatic family secrets. Lies, affairs and afflictions bubble to the surface of his seemingly perfect family. Can they come back together or is it too late?',NULL,'2008-01-01',94,'Released','Can they come back together or is it too late?','The American Standards',145268,1.3251,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19941,_binary '\0','/8pkD8os8efLv2qYWc9xSjMvlaCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439289',6.1,23877,'en','Running with Scissors','Young Augusten Burroughs absorbs experiences that could make for a shocking memoir: the son of an alcoholic father and an unstable mother, he\'s handed off to his mother\'s therapist, Dr. Finch, and spends his adolescent years as a member of Finch\'s bizarre extended family.','/pbWUFYyyZzawsYljkbIKmDxQN8Y.jpg','2006-10-27',122,'Released','Do not disturb them. They already are.','Running with Scissors',7510,3.8061,5.8,'vYOzcty_81M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19942,_binary '\0','/1NyYTmUQ1ZKBlbLAvOjVy9Mb2sE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439418',7.9,3451,'ta','7ஜி ரெயின்போ காலனி','Kathir is a young underachiever who frequently vents his frustrations through public outbursts. When Anitha, a North Indian girl whose family has fallen on hard times, moves into his housing colony, he soon decides to pursue her with his love, but she keeps rejecting his advances.','/87qT4iZ3ksBBsiKdqHUJEtZcnum.jpg','2004-10-15',185,'Released',NULL,'7G Rainbow Colony',24448,1.5089,6.85,'on5MeDsSWks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19943,_binary '\0','/1KIV8i46uWNL4M6sW4PFXLbMFCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439477',6.5,2730,'fa','بوتیک','A clothing store worker (Jahan) meets a poor girl named Eti. Jahan tries to help the girl and solve her problems, but…','/xjQR1tjWbbbxuxAvAWMx331q1Hs.jpg','2003-08-23',113,'Released',NULL,'Boutique',362697,0.9519,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19944,_binary '\0','/yRDLX79lgo2DiiQuNYfNTYVyVBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439478',6.5,1273,'en','Boynton Beach Club','Residents of an adult community in Florida turn to one another for support and companionship after the deaths of their spouses. Lois has a rejuvenating affair with a younger man while acting as best friend to recently widowed Marilyn. Jack buddies up with Harry for a crash course in solo survival skills and deals with single gal Sandy\'s romantic overtures.','/fUcoCzSGBTm2xHnGqH0D5kQV9lH.jpg','2005-08-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Boynton Beach Club',55831,1.7914,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19945,_binary '\0','/h5gdvnhoKmgKr9LfgLmZsOIFE3e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439504',2.5,1912,'en','Brothers in Arms','The two \'most wanted\' cowboys in the New Mexico territory ride into Corazon for one last job - to rob the ruthless town boss.','/64lTF6AX2NF48o3jTyQdysMtla0.jpg','2005-01-01',85,'Released','Old West. New Soul. Big Payback.','Brothers in Arms',31390,2.4124,3.5,'zIwlJiB19s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19946,_binary '\0','/2VtpkzTFLJHdGQK4TM7cwXztA6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439533',7.1,5004,'ja','デッド リーブス','Pandy and Retro awaken naked on Earth with no recollection of their past. They embark on a crime spree in search of food and clothing, but are captured by authorities and sent to the infamous lunar penitentiary named Dead Leaves.','/jpsqSocm0o978PRChacBoTlTida.jpg','2004-01-16',52,'Released','Breaking out of prison was never this much… fun?','Dead Leaves',15981,2.0282,7.058,'cFBd7A_IvgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19947,_binary '\0','/3o13xtgr3GWu7zaSVryVmJELh6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439544',5.5,6200,'en','Dirty','Two gangbangers turned cops try and cover up a scandal within the LAPD.','/SmbCDYvQEJTWaGcwCUOxHAph39.jpg','2005-11-09',97,'Released','Violence Is A Language People Understand','Dirty',10598,3.4058,5.4,'28GIpDaI0f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19948,_binary '\0','/fzGvBBXOKmSCMTvaUdRkrf9A5kk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439547',6.9,7233,'pt','2 Filhos de Francisco','The story of Francisco, a very simple and poor man whose dream was to see his children become country music stars, and who made all the efforts to make it happen.','/ub8vYfI1zgW4WItWDQ5mT6q5tzQ.jpg','2005-08-19',132,'Released','The story of Zezé di Camargo & Luciano','Two Sons of Francisco',49367,1.9894,6.836,'qRlGVXuUqYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19949,_binary '\0','/yF1eOkaYvwiORauRCPWznV9xVvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439572',6.6,252161,'en','The Flash','When his attempt to save his family inadvertently alters the future, Barry Allen becomes trapped in a reality in which General Zod has returned and there are no Super Heroes to turn to. In order to save the world that he is in and return to the future that he knows, Barry\'s only hope is to race for his life. But will making the ultimate sacrifice be enough to reset the universe?','/rktDFPbfHfUbArZ6OOOKsXcv0Bm.jpg','2023-06-13',144,'Released','Worlds collide.','The Flash',298618,23.8291,6.604,'hebWYacbdvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19950,_binary '\0','/1F6fvY3oWLm9bZrR3HU01nLAaAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439581',6.9,1793,'ru','Гадкие лебеди','In the near future, writer Victor Banev gets himself on a UN commission to investigate the goings-on in the remote town of Tashlinsk, where reports tell of a virus-created race of brainiac mutants. His tween daughter Ira is enrolled at a school for gifted children which has been taken over by the mutants, who have grown to despise ordinary humanity.','/4On18W8CFxOakkHhBmpQLsjZV0U.jpg','2006-10-19',109,'Released',NULL,'The Ugly Swans',53252,1.2904,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19951,_binary '\0','/30lizKlY0X11ZBX6pc0xCEtWw0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439602',6.7,1450,'en','Haunting: A Haunting In Connecticut','A haunting documentary of a normal family living in Connecticut, who, after moving into their new house, are terrorized by an evil ghost that dwells in the home.','/p8C1kFIw4zTYV1tVLBVEF7j8knn.jpg','2002-10-18',94,'Released','Not All Spirits Who Wander Are Lost','Haunting: A Haunting In Connecticut',34072,0.7846,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19952,_binary '\0','/eGIG6DZMntVaIqEVqPw9jEZnsPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439615',3,1272,'en','Horrors of War','HORRORS OF WAR derives from the \"B\" movie, Grindhouse tradition, made to play like a like a midnight movie. It is an independently-produced film made in a B-movie style, yet with a dramatic grounding and an eye toward bigger production values.......FILM SYNOPSIS: \'Feeling the pressure from Allied advance, Hitler unleashes his secret weapons giving rise to a type of warfare the world has never seen. Throughout the European theater of WWII, Lieutenant John Schmidt comes face to face with these \"weapons.\" The Office of Strategic Services (O.S.S., precursor to the C.I.A.) initiates missions behind enemy lines to find the source of the weapons terrorizing U.S. soldiers fighting the Third Reich. Schmidt is joined by Captain Joe Russo and his group of war-hardened GIs who have experienced for themselves the all-too-real horrors of war in battle. Together, they must find and destroy Hitler\'s horde of nightmare weapons before his horrific vision can be fully realized','/lMQmob2GRdNxj5XpGEeWxszUZkU.jpg','2006-03-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Horrors of War',24716,1.2512,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19953,_binary '\0','/q0K6uqrVMs5UpRY7sb7rsPHiFYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439630',6.4,10730,'cn','頭文字D','After winning his first competition, Takumi focuses his attention on drift racing, a sport he has unknowingly perfected while delivering tofu in his father\'s Toyota AE86.','/xMSbtGNX9pftwfHwfTVeoEaVTSw.jpg','2005-05-12',109,'Released','How fast is 1 second?','Initial D',16411,4.9063,6.7,'tYbe9XB__eY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19954,_binary '\0','/i7hDmnO3f7BimMoDp38Y7P6A9oB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439654',6.3,1969,'ko','조폭 마누라 3','When Aryong, the daughter of a triad boss from Hong Kong is accused of killing the boss of a competing triad, she goes into hiding in Korea. Upon arriving, she is guided by a nimble but loyal Gi-chul and his motley crew, who are assigned to protect her until her return.','/yRYXOlZLsa3m3IF4jHI0RgiqXnr.jpg','2006-12-28',115,'Released','This time, she\'s from the Hong Kong triad.','My Wife is a Gangster 3',42324,2.5771,5.9,'AjnLKuWLw5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19955,_binary '\0','/r0gZkk6h3eXGv8l7dCy1HrzQwmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439662',7.1,37395,'hi','फ़ना','Zooni Ali Beg is a blind Kashmiri girl who travels without her parents for the first time with a dance troupe to Delhi to perform in a ceremony for independence day. On her journey, she meets Rehan Khan, a casanova and tour guide who flirts with her. Although her friends warn Zooni about him, she cannot resist falling in love with him and he takes her on a private tour of New Delhi. But there is more to Rehan than meets the eye and Zooni will have to make a heartbreaking decision.','/4A17fF6K6WAvv4Ces0CgpMZRee4.jpg','2006-05-26',168,'Released','Destroyed in love...','Fanaa',8453,2.0779,6.7,'De_HdhAWyHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19956,_binary '\0','/dDxew0gMKv7Y7hT8SGuMa1rWHHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439695',6.4,4376,'sv','Masjävlar','Mia returns from Stockholm to her parents\' home in a small town in Dalecarlia (Dalarna) to celebrate her father\'s 70th birthday. Her elder sisters Eivor and Gunilla welcome her, but their different lifestyles prevent them from really communicating. The tension builds, and the party that should be a celebration turns out to be a turning point for the family and their friends','/kNRtHq5QiyI0n3OV2IKq3pOhMtu.jpg','2004-12-17',98,'Released',NULL,'Dalecarlians',12604,1.947,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19957,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439714',6.1,1471,'ta','Mumbai Xpress','A young man\'s journey in Mumbai as a kidnapper.','/iRoC6isEOUBr8VEeSrKG2ZtRkih.jpg','2005-04-15',145,'Released',NULL,'Mumbai Xpress',69572,1.2014,5.933,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19958,_binary '\0','/kUpD6EnpnQBi3mjYxmiM4xvuh8g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439815',6.5,96098,'en','Slither','A small town is taken over by an alien plague, turning residents into zombies and all forms of mutant monsters.','/zNlJvCY3Pz7SE09Lf4G7uPs5XFZ.jpg','2006-03-31',96,'Released','Horror has a new face.','Slither',9035,8.9774,6.6,'2IBFP82BJ3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19959,_binary '\0','/1RNiQpOtr20vITxHOUj77DaLUI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439817',7.3,3121,'ru','Солнце','A re-imagination of Japanese Emperor Hirohito’s final days in power as WWII draws to a close.','/23G0iEbmqhWkgfpBiY7mLd6zxge.jpg','2005-02-17',111,'Released',NULL,'The Sun',98246,1.5986,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19960,_binary '\0','/p8sVqfqghgiiPBKCyZIDrOokVVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439856',8,4313,'en','The Trailer Park Boys Xmas Special','In this holiday prequel, it’s 1997 and Sunnyvale Trailer Park is getting ready for the holiday season. Julian’s got a great idea to make money this Christmas, Ricky gets confused between God and Santa, and Bubbles tries to get the Boys together for an annual Christmas bonfire. Meanwhile, Mr. Lahey is thrilled because Christmas is the only day of the year that his wife Barb allows him to have a few drinks. Directed by series creator Mike Clattenburg, this hour-long special takes place before Jamie was J-Roc, before Randy and Lahey were a couple, and before the Shitmobile was missing a door.','/fta1ZO9uLsFPgEMPDcgUf2PFxKI.jpg','2004-12-12',57,'Released',NULL,'The Trailer Park Boys Xmas Special',217720,1.7824,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19961,_binary '\0','/kA4S1soaM2AuxweFIJg5LEUvJJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439869',7.3,2852,'te','వర్షం','Venkat and Sailaja meet on a train and fall in love. But Sailaja\'s father disapproves of their relationship and decides to marry her off to Bhadranna, a ruthless landlord, who is obsessed with her.','/3OkbWNeRVQopeGwdocnwk0fXW3j.jpg','2004-01-14',150,'Released',NULL,'Varsham',82322,1.3692,6.396,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19962,_binary '\0','/k5WMoEE6xjnsjNjTXTXTROzeBXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0439876',5.4,1709,'en','What Love Is','It\'s Valentine\'s Day and Tom has big plans. He\'s about to get engaged and has a surprise party planned to share the good news with friends. But things take a turn for the worse. Tom returns home only to discover his girlfriend has packed up and left him. Now, instead of a surprise party, the surprise is on Tom. Fortunately, his friends are there to help him make sense of it all.','/c08XFez7JngaahzAZ2fojewfNrt.jpg','2007-0