 she fights to give women the opportunity to play competitive soccer.','/gPmRGO7iwVRWNd0n5ePWLfSHeuH.jpg','2007-06-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Gracie',15568,2.6031,6.2,'rYu4DEIjeQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19967,_binary '\0','/5vWEcjru7dUIuTgMbwOVfuGMU60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441048',6.6,33404,'hi','धूम २','Jai and Ali return, this time on the trail of an international thief who steals priceless artifacts and has chosen Mumbai as his next target.','/3zJLnrP9g9LSMpX5C1wau49gGUv.jpg','2006-11-24',151,'Released','Back in Action','Dhoom 2',14194,3.6005,6.6,'oRIIeyIa6nE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19968,_binary '\0','/Ar8v6mSkm8m55sBWA4rjcWI9Rps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441297',7.1,2711,'es','Habana Blues','When Spanish record producers express interest in Cuban musicians Ruy and Tito, the longtime friends are faced with the prospect of leaving their loved ones behind. After years of hoping and dreaming, they\'ve finally earned the opportunity to bring their music to the rest of the world. But are the emotional trade-offs worth it in the end?','/u3a2CBZmWgIMsDBh1scJ19PPKbB.jpg','2005-03-18',115,'Released',NULL,'Havana Blues',49256,1.6941,6.4,'mWzAM-Jd_A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19969,_binary '\0','/t7v1RgmQqEwQsHR2zTQWm0kdKhk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441402',5.6,1621,'tr','O Şimdi Mahkum','Sequel of He\'s in Army Now. The film has received four awards at the Antalya Golden Orange.','/1thqj0kBEgPxVf2vOBA89pB1YAF.jpg','2005-04-14',145,'Released',NULL,'He\'s Convict Now',447074,0.8838,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19970,_binary '\0','/tKD4Lwn8LnpWzI5Zw05iLpalaET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441611',5.5,1595,'fa','کما','This comedy narrates the many adventures of a millionaire\'s handsome, sassy son named Amir - born into a world of privilege, he is used to getting everything he desires. This time his eyes turn to a peerless lady but her untamable will, combined with a sudden rush of plucky hoodlums, makes his task harder than first thought. Will he prevail or will he be in for a rude awakening?','/w3qtIs3S4IIupZFohAnT566LeEB.jpg','2004-03-18',84,'Released',NULL,'Coma',562320,0.9147,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19971,_binary '\0','/kGNuU06310RmsMrwkwzXlOkwRvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441641',7.6,1809,'id','Janji Joni','A film delivery man promises a beautiful young woman to deliver a film reel on time to a movie theater, but the the whole city seems to conspire against him.','/a2Be0icT9HAY6ml6PgVVYLVsCRt.jpg','2005-04-26',83,'Released','In a city that never stops, he never slows down. Meet Jakarta\'s fastest courier','Joni\'s Promise',39064,1.2845,6.8,'Fe6-TV79Z4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19972,_binary '\0','/9MIVMcFo5B8R5pNuCg9gkc82mzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441761',5.7,3117,'en','Free Zone','Rebecca, an American who has been living in Jerusalem for a few months now, has just broken off her engagement. She gets into a cab driven by Hanna, an Israeli. But Hanna is on her way to Jordan, to the Free Zone, to pick up a large sum of money.','/ud4A2xRAa6j92dTuOy2B2Glv5xY.jpg','2005-06-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Free Zone',7483,1.7312,5.6,'cnnAD1eWHGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19973,_binary '\0','/a77jYoKnQuAPTirVl5kZ2KJgyF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441762',6.8,4509,'de','Ein Freund von mir','An introverted insurance executive at a car rental service is annoyed by his hyperactive, garrulous coworker, but the two end up becoming friends.','/yUbB44z9UTH4y4D7L02ruh4KfCB.jpg','2006-10-05',84,'Released',NULL,'A Friend of Mine',1964,1.8424,6.7,'HRE_NotP9MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19974,_binary '\0','/qdthf9WrRDSaIkGVQGhhJ9pz1hn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441773',7.6,590208,'en','Kung Fu Panda','Chosen by prophecy but doubted by all, Po is an unlikely choice for the mystical title of the Dragon Warrior—a clumsy panda thrust into the world of kung fu as a deadly enemy threatens the Valley of Peace. Under reluctant guidance by Master Shifu and the Furious Five, Po must embrace who he is to unlock the power that no scroll can teach.','/wWt4JYXTg5Wr3xBW2phBrMKgp3x.jpg','2008-06-04',90,'Released','Prepare for awesomeness.','Kung Fu Panda',9502,27.2296,7.339,'NRc-ze7Wrxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19975,_binary '\0','/cUh3QGvpXXdeNdms7I86XVDL4bv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441774',6.4,23357,'en','Lonely Hearts','In the late 1940s, a murderous couple known as the \'The Lonely Hearts Killers\' kills close to a dozen people. Two detectives try to nab the duo who find their targets via the personals in the paper.','/qnQK4JUwEUFDKt7dSMY2fJmhv2f.jpg','2006-04-30',108,'Released','True love can be murder.','Lonely Hearts',1252,5.4624,6.1,'V2CCvIru48k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19976,_binary '\0','/kvkZqQnKcC3dmTGZqbEOAvz4FNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441782',6,6810,'en','Restraint','Two fugitives land in hot water when they take a hostage who poses a threat to their well-being.','/2bguGmptNflshQgBdDimIlt028b.jpg','2008-08-19',94,'Released','Seclusion. Seduction. Survival.','Restraint',14215,4.195,5.929,'Vd2TKiamupE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19977,_binary '\0','/4TMrgGFbH22eQXy6hTcY0BzEPot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441796',5.1,35985,'en','Stay Alive','After the brutal death of a friend, a group of friends play an underground video game based on a 17th-century noblewoman, only to discover that dying in the game results in their real-life death.','/hsSJwroE7jugEROB8tmyxJP91Ho.jpg','2006-03-24',100,'Released','Play It To Death.','Stay Alive',10069,4.1172,5.842,'DjzqGzuZSfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19978,_binary '\0','/7uacpbrJd9g9xSTLgfyg1NwkAiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441881',6.8,16901,'en','Danger Close: The Battle of Long Tan','Vietnam War, 1966. Australia and New Zealand send troops to support the United States and South Vietnamese in their fight against the communist North. Soldiers are very young men, recruits and volunteers who have never been involved in a combat. On August 18th, members of Delta Company will face the true horror of a ruthless battle among the trees of a rubber plantation called Long Tân. They are barely a hundred. The enemy is a human wave ready to destroy them.','/aB1rCWGMsM2mm1kBDleaPkqUCFo.jpg','2019-08-08',119,'Released','Outnumbered. Outgunned. Never out of courage.','Danger Close: The Battle of Long Tan',508664,6.2948,6.8,'AyUqZLwOo2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19979,_binary '\0','/cLvcOx8RbSUPCbkynKzNIg1zc2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0441909',7.6,113723,'es','Volver','Three generations of women deal with family secrets while surviving the east wind, fire, insanity, superstition, lies and even death.','/ljRPzuI1xybiFUGU1uCRdx68h0K.jpg','2006-03-17',121,'Released',NULL,'Volver',219,5.4293,7.5,'ABSvppyQGdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19980,_binary '\0','/xkuESUYtHItKQbrrfXcbZuULhUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442207',6.2,2357,'fr','Enfermés dehors','Once upon a time, somewhere... a homeless guy finds a policeman\'s uniform...','/6PgKhKkyXYh9WR36O2jYu7jFHkR.jpg','2006-04-05',78,'Released',NULL,'Locked Out',13728,1.7808,6.2,'FUYjIftzHZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19981,_binary '\0','/7d1NO9R1Py41N5LTefhlmOSas3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442236',6.3,1290,'es','Fuga','Could a brilliant composer\'s music actually be killing his loved ones? Eliseo can\'t help but believe it when his younger sister dies tragically and then his pianist Georgina suddenly dies on the piano. Completely traumatized, Eliseo is taken to a mental hospital where he can find escape only through music.','/8oZ0me8AFv3181yiIsVjXkH11Db.jpg','2006-03-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Fuga',37004,1.8897,6.2,'Gusjdc954Y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19982,_binary '\0','/urrE4WNd46cQYeLs8oekmOOEfcQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442268',7.8,5341,'ja','いま、会いにゆきます','Takumi and his six-year-old son, Yuji, haven\'t come to terms with their wife and mother\'s death. One day, they meet a woman with an uncanny resemblance to her sheltering from the rain near their home.','/jiic8bZbH2kP2XufJqQz0l7CZim.jpg','2004-10-30',119,'Released','A six-week miracle, a lifelong love.','Be with You',36092,3.2073,7.5,'PEeyIjOKBos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19983,_binary '\0','/iwRcZAABRJlASo5XN27zZwsypZm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442286',7.6,7671,'ja','隠し剣 鬼の爪','Set in 19th Century Japan a young samurai who finds himself in love with a farm girl leaves his home to begin a new life. He has to take stock of his new life when he is put to the test and ordered to kill a traitor who just happens to be his dearest friend.','/j6eOTaZJqWG9lEFWfK9jJqd03Qo.jpg','2004-10-30',132,'Released',NULL,'The Hidden Blade',34019,1.6335,7.412,'Da0KvKm6hP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19984,_binary '\0','/j3tTN2rsfiTQBTmzbyZbumY9fM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442781',7.3,4153,'ta','வரலாறு','Shiva, the ageing business tycoon, bound to his wheelchair, sharing a strong bonding with his son Vishnu. Indulgent, while Vishnu whiles away his time with his cronies taking life easy. But then suddenly Vishnu starts behaving out of character, his drunken bouts and acts causing the father much shame and embarrassment. And when Vishnu professes to remember nothing of what he had done, the father takes him to a psychiatrist.','/t7dz2gl0LyJdnUU6sV4TMFO0vDd.jpg','2006-10-20',166,'Released','History of Godfather','Varalaru',69407,1.2226,6.35,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19985,_binary '\0','/lIruQxRCxw5ZI3CmBL6VxwpKtUe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0442933',6.3,180766,'en','Beowulf','A 6th-century Scandinavian warrior named Beowulf embarks on a mission to slay the man-like ogre, Grendel.','/7QsWYyJAV97N9jOh21pdRIqJeJq.jpg','2007-11-05',115,'Released','Face your demons.','Beowulf',2310,9.8251,5.924,'DaShOr5AeKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19986,_binary '\0','/2tWmU0ha209NlShTSzc8pdnloc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443072',6.2,1224,'fr','Entre ses mains','In Lille, Claire Gauthier is an ordinary married woman with a young daughter that works in an insurance company analyzing losses of insured properties. When the single veterinary Laurent Kessler claims damage in his basement caused by a flooding due to water leakage, Claire resolves the situation favorably for him. The weird Laurent visits Claire in her office successively, inviting her for drinks and lunch, and they get close to each other. Meanwhile, a serial killer is terrorizing Lille, killing women with a scalpel. Claire feels a great attraction for Laurent, who has an unusual behavior in her apartment. When Claire sees a scalpel in the pocket of Laurent\'s jacket, she fears him, but still loves him.','/gQiyRcFM78FDuZhkG3S11rQs6CD.jpg','2005-09-11',90,'Released',NULL,'In His Hands',38049,1.1029,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19987,_binary '\0','/maP6b3ZKQn4d2XgDAhB8NOGPbl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443205',6.3,1356,'ja','隣人13号','Juzo Murasaki is a young man traumatized by his experience of bullying at school. He returns to his hometown and takes a job on a building site with his old nemesis Toru Akai. But Juzo\'s trauma has created a monster; he harbors a second personality, Neighbor No. 13, a vicious, brutal and disfigured character intent on exacting a painful revenge on his bully.','/mp3oMd6WswqWqUJvBnbFK3ljicl.jpg','2005-04-02',115,'Released','What if your personality began to crumble… who would you become?','Neighbour No. 13',84251,1.2138,5.5,'GIEQnSkeJUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19988,_binary '\0','/uHQm8v8R1koLXx7fbjLgXtr75Hf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443231',5.5,1394,'ja','LOFT ロフト','A writer retreats to a secluded suburban house to work on her new novel. But her attention is instead occupied by her archaeologist neighbor\'s newly discovered mummy and a ghostly presence in her house.','/9DbxR4D5uPmol3gEAGMWzWhp1Xd.jpg','2006-09-09',115,'Released','Another misery is coming... I can feel it.','Loft',40592,2.2263,5.6,'E9v5kG0Oy3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19989,_binary '\0','/hwOFrwHladQ8FktYn3aJNAt8KA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443272',7.3,287178,'en','Lincoln','The revealing story of the 16th US President\'s tumultuous final months in office. In a nation divided by war and the strong winds of change, Lincoln pursues a course of action designed to end the war, unite the country and abolish slavery. With the moral courage and fierce determination to succeed, his choices during this critical moment will change the fate of generations to come.','/7mUYEkv9W3ek61eetZCfMQYVoi.jpg','2012-11-09',150,'Released','The hours that changed history.','Lincoln',72976,8.8806,6.839,'nvP-ZrzA2lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19990,_binary '\0','/5c3RpVjkNzrguLUBHqOG1kFI5Kb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443274',6.6,158569,'en','Vantage Point','During an historic counter-terrorism summit in Spain, the President of the United States is struck down by an assassin\'s bullet. Eight strangers have a perfect view of the kill, but what did they really see? As the minutes leading up to the fatal shot are replayed through the eyes of each eyewitness, the reality of the assassination takes shape.','/9xA1KaGoYQJveY3C87J41Au5Kkn.jpg','2008-02-01',90,'Released','8 strangers. 8 points of view. 1 truth.','Vantage Point',7461,8.542,6.417,'LGnLCP-lfrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19991,_binary '\0','/eyUXxRholD2QO9UzXWZYwW5kZw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443295',5.5,32838,'en','Yours, Mine & Ours','Admiral Frank Beardsley returns to New London to run the Coast Guard Academy, his last stop before a probable promotion to head the Guard. A widower with eight children, he runs a loving but tight ship, with charts and salutes. The kids long for a permanent home. Helen North is a free spirit, a designer whose ten children live in loving chaos, with occasional group hugs. Helen and Frank, high school sweethearts, reconnect at a reunion, and it\'s love at first re-sighting. They marry on the spot. Then the problems start as two sets of kids, the free spirits and the disciplined preppies, must live together. The warring factions agree to work together to end the marriage.','/1SfsoUYXRRrfL31br8q4DlTYvKK.jpg','2005-11-23',90,'Released','18 kids, one house, no way.','Yours, Mine & Ours',13499,6.7575,6.197,'Ct37x6Fhbx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19992,_binary '\0','/aPPFIsvzJYuKOusGEwxD1dNswB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443331',4.1,2171,'hi','मिलेंगे मिलेंगे','Hoping that destiny will re-unite them, a couple, on the verge of getting married, attempt to locate each other.','/qqKIyN0zTFudW945zAkYY4LMYru.jpg','2010-07-09',144,'Released',NULL,'Milenge Milenge',40779,1.3237,4.417,'iUBxbcwTlLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19993,_binary '\0','/xtS2up1CANcWbycoGuBAxGRIzYC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443334',2.7,1406,'en','Attack of the Sabretooth','In the Fiji islands, the greedy and unscrupulous owner of the Valalola Resort Primal Park invites investors and guests for an opening party of his compound composed of hotel and zoo aiming to find partners for his discoveries. When a bunch of college smalltime thieves puts a virus in the security system to participate in a scavenger hunt, the greatest attractions of the zoo - sabretoothes from the prehistoric age developed from DNA found in fossils - escape, killing the hosts and guards for fun.','/o6SEJ0EFun5IiDHIgOtf2Cw1GTG.jpg','2005-07-14',90,'Released','Extinct no more!','Attack of the Sabretooth',58788,2.0719,3.5,'O1oEG0TjUAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19994,_binary '\0','/ARthpcTa2Pm5rrlNuc9qxRG8qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443431',5,10014,'en','Another Gay Movie','Andy is your typical All-American eighteen-year-old gay virgin. Like everyone else, he\'s dying to have sex. Totally out of the closet and mad-crazy horny, this naïve high school senior is caught in that awkward vortex between child and adult. Much to the dismay of his mom (who wonders why all her carrots and cucumbers keep disappearing), Andy spends much of his private time practicing for the big moment when he\'ll finally take the plunge.','/yKdilPwtuoZRhw9A63qzduRkSbG.jpg','2006-04-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Another Gay Movie',12795,3.1914,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19995,_binary '\0','/hi8HXNUJkl9fHZiwUUtrMzIOlZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443435',5,7860,'en','Autopsy','Emily Johnson, her boyfriend Bobby and their friends Clare and Jude are recent college grads driving cross-country, taking a last vacation together before they face the \"real\" world. An accident leaves them hurt and stranded on a lonely Louisiana road. When the ambulance arrives, it whisks them to Mercy Hospital.','/z8Mlvh9YVkD4QnXMm5mYVWqzPZ4.jpg','2008-08-24',84,'Released','Evil cuts both ways.','Autopsy',16921,3.0333,4.9,'4VOPFsPLGZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19996,_binary '\0','/9IPSjVGRNf0052LXjP5U0UEQW14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443446',6.4,2674,'it','La bestia nel cuore','Sabina has a regular life. She is satisfied with her job and her love for Franco. Lately nightmares start disturbing her, and almost in the same time she discovers to be pregnant. Step by step she remembers her childhood spent within a severe middle-class family. But a big secret is hidden within her heart. Sabina wants to contact again her brother, a University teacher in the US, to try to understand what is happened in their past. What is the secret? She is determined to bring clarity and serenity in her life. She finally manages to free herself from her \"beast in the heart\".','/axdD8P7tBUp5cal0wZ1GemfQRBi.jpg','2006-01-13',116,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Tell',18219,2.1935,6.1,'c_262cH4ytk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19997,_binary '\0','/lMxpaFElskdtbAnVEPSvG01SM4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443453',7.4,483217,'en','Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan','Kazakh journalist Borat Sagdiyev travels to America to make a documentary. As he zigzags across the nation, Borat meets real people in real situations with hysterical consequences. His backwards behavior generates strong reactions around him exposing prejudices and hypocrisies in American culture.','/7g9kBHMN2KTr5KUf8aen187Mdn.jpg','2006-11-01',84,'Released','Come to Kazakhstan, it\'s nice!','Borat: Cultural Learnings of America for Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan',496,8.6569,6.8,'vlnUa_dNsRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19998,_binary '\0','/e6VVxwmW6RMnBU9nV2xVPpjB6RR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443455',7.3,3888,'en','Brand Upon the Brain!','After returning home to his long-estranged mother upon a request from her deathbed, a man raised by his parents in an orphanage has to confront the childhood memories that have long haunted him.','/aCnZaP8QUUYrqoMoE9JOkvUOvQd.jpg','2007-05-09',98,'Released',NULL,'Brand Upon the Brain!',27359,2.243,6.6,'YVl5Bnj_EO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(19999,_binary '\0','/qpeCN9X4QHxPh8yWF5gRp1wxfct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443456',6.5,23858,'en','Breaking and Entering','Set in a blighted, inner-city neighbourhood of London, Breaking and Entering examines an affair which unfolds between a successful British landscape architect and Amira, a Bosnian woman – the mother of a troubled teen son – who was widowed by the war in Bosnia and Herzegovina.','/4VZWsOQGbxfPuqMBcLaQLxNvLzR.jpg','2006-12-15',129,'Released',NULL,'Breaking and Entering',1253,3.8479,6.1,'g2Ekg4rYSKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20000,_binary '\0','/xlGQ44jpBneZu13VAnvU01dWA0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443465',6.8,69566,'en','Before We Go','A chance encounter between two strangers in Grand Central Terminal sparks a life-changing, nighttime sojourn through New York City. They grow into each other\'s most trusted confidants when an evening of unexpected adventure forces them to confront their fears and take control of their lives.','/qBnkNKjbJV0E8GvEPidBS1nIRWD.jpg','2014-09-04',95,'Released','One night can change your whole life.','Before We Go',283350,5.3143,6.7,'VrNwcGVGrBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20001,_binary '\0','/hHQ5b86b6Db3kKZEpdwmujatDoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443473',6,56273,'en','The Condemned','Jack Conrad is awaiting the death penalty in a corrupt Central American prison. He is \"purchased\" by a wealthy television producer and taken to a desolate island where he must fight to the death against nine other condemned killers from all corners of the world, with freedom going to the sole survivor.','/uC50pDHgQQtoDFNh9bBNDAvpsqu.jpg','2007-04-27',114,'Released','10 will fight, 9 will die. You get to watch.','The Condemned',14636,7.8754,6.105,'U0w3vKgka_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20002,_binary '\0','/8wYluVq5AVXhnFFMhUYD9D4rTz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443489',6.6,81452,'en','Dreamgirls','A trio of female soul singers cross over to the pop charts in the early 1960s, facing their own personal struggles along the way.','/sG5JyOj8Spe13QkNJMH8b5kzQUh.jpg','2006-12-25',130,'Released','All you have to do is dream.','Dreamgirls',1125,7.3874,6.7,'DTgGuFOh2M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20003,_binary '\0','/iE8NYo7lotfhLdBi0NSUxJ7iZr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443496',6.2,13208,'en','Edmond','Seemingly mild-mannered businessman Edmond Burke visits a fortuneteller and hears a remark that spurs him to leave his wife abruptly and seek what is missing from his life. Encounters with strangers and unsavory people weaken the barriers encompassing his long-suppressed rage, until Edmond explodes in violence.','/2VFdGJDrl5n9WoC7d4I07hN3v5c.jpg','2006-07-14',82,'Released','Every fear hides a wish.','Edmond',18191,3.4375,6,'JZVkLqcqmGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20004,_binary '\0','/ide7GiURV1XN0r3RpiKoFwfD9E3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443518',7.4,9052,'en','The Girl in the Café','Lawrence, an aging, lonely civil servant falls for Gina, an enigmatic young woman. When he takes her to the G8 Summit in Reykjavik, however, their bond is tested by Lawrence\'s professional obligations.','/rk3hm0syx3eBvov0uLFaZv9Rr4R.jpg','2005-06-25',94,'Released',NULL,'The Girl in the Café',28201,2.5178,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20005,_binary '\0','/j9R0JL7yPsENdto8MnsYCsH4aDS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443527',5,9243,'en','The Hamiltons','The Hamiltons seem to be the picture-perfect American family. They are hardworking community members; giving to their local charities, attending town hall meetings and always respectful of their neighbors...except for the fact that they usually end up killing them.','/womFanfTvwZ9nr594vZc1R0fWqL.jpg','2006-11-19',86,'Released','Every Family Has Its Secrets.','The Hamiltons',15495,1.5873,5,'OR-pbkIPT-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20006,_binary '\0','/wwvT9StGf9bbPwLIFSonkwW4QWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443533',6.3,1639,'en','The History of Love','The story of a long-lost book that mysteriously reappears and connects an old man searching for his son with a girl seeking a cure for her mother\'s loneliness.','/nNA1Ut2neRVxYkyJeNQ2AZaJ7Lf.jpg','2016-11-09',134,'Released',NULL,'The History of Love',410366,3.9056,6.4,'HCE1Bsl3L2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20007,_binary '\0','/97i5zrV5Kmhi3NYJ7PzcfHmMNx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443536',6.5,73084,'en','Hoodwinked!','Little Red Riding Hood: A classic story, but there\'s more to every tale than meets the eye. Before you judge a book by its cover, you\'ve got to flip through the pages. In the re-telling of this classic fable, the story begins at the end of the tale and winds its way back. Chief Grizzly and Detective Bill Stork investigate a domestic disturbance at Granny\'s cottage, involving a karate-kicking Red Riding Hood, a sarcastic wolf and an oafish Woodsman.','/kwPl1AKX4BLxrh5PCkrwYWeEV5I.jpg','2005-12-16',81,'Released','Red Riding Hood. The Woodsman. Granny. The Wolf. Not Your Typical Crime. Not Your Usual Suspects.','Hoodwinked!',10982,10.7353,6.3,'RGV-cTSr6zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20008,_binary '\0','/8ScGUtKTupr5rVLiXRmffjKMRhH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443543',7.5,406935,'en','The Illusionist','With his eye on a lovely aristocrat, a gifted illusionist named Eisenheim uses his powers to win her away from her betrothed, a crown prince. But Eisenheim\'s scheme creates tumult within the monarchy and ignites the suspicion of a dogged inspector.','/1O9jUvqkHaGBMVRyOJz1AlkmALW.jpg','2006-08-18',110,'Released','Nothing is what it seems','The Illusionist',1491,10.5901,7.3,'QngdF-55AGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20009,_binary '\0','/fAiOeRNSCfxEGHuVTd7g8F3JHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443559',6,23021,'en','Killshot','Beautiful Carmen Colson and her ironworker husband Wayne are placed in the Federal Witness Protection program after witnessing an \"incident\". Thinking they are at last safe, they are targeted by an experienced hit man and a psychopathic young upstart killer.','/ckUhio8KhGDcvFV7g34kYjVLEEW.jpg','2008-11-13',95,'Released','He never met a target he couldn\'t take. Until today.','Killshot',16164,4.2218,5.8,'jxiUMyqyWPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20010,_binary '\0','/7kG1sslDhtzhcQ9aXHQg7Zvwg5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443567',4.4,4524,'en','Left Behind: World at War','A year and a half ago, the globe was hit with the biggest catastrophe it had ever seen. Without warning and without explanation, hundreds of millions simply vanished off the face of the Earth. The world was in chaos like never before. Yet somehow one man seemed to rise to the challenge. One man had the strength and conviction to unite a shattered world. One man gave the world hope. That man was Nicolae Carpathia, who now rules the entire world.','/mSkkofYLcjFSkb2o3rZuUBWu92P.jpg','2005-10-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Left Behind: World at War',38828,2.9382,4.2,'jvsW46FzCd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20011,_binary '\0','/c6hFzNJIAGT84E6SfuuqEZNJlqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443584',4.7,7750,'it','Melissa P.','An adolescent girl, living with her mother and her grandmother, will have her first sexual experiences in a heavy and excessive way.','/3fjMLEVozmApiiDF75dnpSIaYZ3.jpg','2005-11-18',100,'Released','You have to lose yourself before you can find yourself.','Melissa P.',13461,5.8829,4.7,'CJLSYlCeGUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20012,_binary '\0','/ewbqfunOZKC3qcMx6dc3R2oXnDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443632',6.1,58583,'en','The Sentinel','Veteran Secret Service agent Pete Garrison investigates a colleague\'s murder and is subsequently framed as a mole in an assassination attempt on the President due to the machinations of a blackmailer who knows the secret he is hiding. Disgraced, dismissed, and now a fugitive with two relentless federal investigators hot on his heels, Garrison must both clear his name and save the president from assassination.','/wPFVeVYuFhCnnOAZZHpMROCbssE.jpg','2006-04-19',108,'Released','In 141 years, there\'s never been a traitor in the Secret Service... until now.','The Sentinel',5820,8.9198,6.1,'qacVtga4IYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20013,_binary '\0','/nZlvmbnx5ZJYkSVocuQvOgVlWli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443649',5.2,140154,'en','10,000 BC','A prehistoric epic that follows a young mammoth hunter\'s journey through uncharted territory to secure the future of his tribe.','/9I7gV6wRbGnbfI3XOKjHeLMjYEo.jpg','2008-03-04',109,'Released','The legend. The battle. The first hero.','10,000 BC',7840,9.412,5.514,'GMO8PC94egI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20014,_binary '\0','/3HvQ5PaxwQJEiRSZD5AyVuqEiNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443680',7.5,206335,'en','The Assassination of Jesse James by the Coward Robert Ford','Outlaw Jesse James is rumored to be the \'fastest gun in the West\'. An eager recruit into James\' notorious gang, Robert Ford eventually grows jealous of the famed outlaw and, when Robert and his brother sense an opportunity to kill James, their murderous action elevates their target to near mythical status.','/xMKn6EQS7eR5ubhPJbw5pQSBZMw.jpg','2007-09-20',160,'Released','Beyond the myth lies America\'s greatest betrayal','The Assassination of Jesse James by the Coward Robert Ford',4512,9.1393,7.065,'SrGmmitc62Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20015,_binary '\0','/6IDCYlcFAKgmEoSczfTxcYsVHep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443693',6.1,4147,'en','The Wild Blue Yonder','An alien narrates the story of his dying planet, his and his people\'s visitations to Earth and Earth\'s self-made demise, while human astronauts in space are attempting to find an alternate planet for surviving humans to live on.','/iEs4KhPaQ0F514PscPJDtp0YclB.jpg','2005-09-05',81,'Released',NULL,'The Wild Blue Yonder',8410,2.2053,6,'FWNNvMS8Y8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20016,_binary '\0','/fCdc3TZNNHGk1ZQBXENdWLqjUio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443701',5.9,97651,'en','The X-Files: I Want to Believe','Mulder and Scully are called back to duty by the FBI when a former priest claims to be receiving psychic visions pertaining to a kidnapped agent.','/3zQMhutUMJP6lK49x7i2YfsOHL9.jpg','2008-07-24',104,'Released','To find the truth, you must believe.','The X-Files: I Want to Believe',8836,8.7012,5.879,'Tp7YgMItHP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20017,_binary '\0','/3zCPI4JFc54xvLaJ71oI2KoP3az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443706',7.7,689305,'en','Zodiac','The story follows the manhunt for the Zodiac Killer, a serial killer who terrorized the San Francisco Bay Area during the late 1960s and early 1970s, taunting police with letters, bloodstained clothing, and ciphers mailed to newspapers.','/6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg','2007-03-02',157,'Released','There\'s more than one way to lose your life to a killer.','Zodiac',1949,19.7591,7.532,'yNncHPl1UXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20018,_binary '\0','/aapYQT7YOw2xEkV2C14dxFu3LU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443708',7.3,7196,'hi','Page 3','\'Page 3\' takes a behind-the-scenes look at the lifestyles of the A-list celebrities in metro cities. It explores the networking and the power play between the air-kissing','/wQnQ8BOiJpLze6wC01ujoQcjyeU.jpg','2005-01-21',139,'Released',NULL,'Page 3',20623,1.2868,6.155,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20019,_binary '\0','/xPXhDVKAKJhJQuamdroO20EBy1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443737',5.7,1947,'ja','デス・トランス','In an unknown place and unknown time, a lone Samurai known only as Grave thirsts for the ultimate battle.','/ibzV90cPb1omUslgkOntpjWVSC2.jpg','2005-12-09',90,'Released','His only desire is destruction','Death Trance',19504,1.2576,6,'YpLb9vDNggg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20020,_binary '\0','/eUFI2ywTluddrhZTqaC9ghsxlOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443771',6.3,1697,'en','Robotech: The Shadow Chronicles','In the year 2044 AD, the human race has amped-up its space exploration and reached out to the stars through the miracle of ROBOTECHNOLOGY, but not without bringing intergalactic war upon the Earth itself. Heroes will die and allegiances will shift. But in the midst of combat, perhaps peace will spring up through the charred remains of battered history. One of the greatest science fiction sagas of all time continues...','/7jkmi0MqIP6XNRaFt0fHTV9VbiQ.jpg','2006-08-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Robotech: The Shadow Chronicles',16364,2.4044,6.607,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20021,_binary '\0','/e6rmXm2b3OcmHjPDGfVYta0shwy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0443844',6.8,3166,'fr','Les Amants réguliers','1968 and 1969 in Paris: during and after the student and trade union revolt. François is 20, a poet, dodging military service. He takes to the barricades, but won\'t throw a Molotov cocktail at the police. He smokes opium and talks about revolution with his friend, Antoine, who has an inheritance and a flat where François can stay. François meets Lilie, a sculptor who works at a foundry to support herself. They fall in love. A year passes; François continues to write, talk, smoke, and be with Lilie. Opportunities come to Lilie: what will she and François do?','/A7L0bpB34LyybFmGNa4fSW3Ps5n.jpg','2005-09-30',183,'Released',NULL,'Regular Lovers',45126,1.7349,6.9,'A811TCyh35o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20022,_binary '\0','/5Je1MgEXyo3Yg8brZPcrmp55cxq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444112',6.7,4627,'fr','Fauteuils d\'orchestre','A young woman arrives in Paris where she finds a job as a waitress in bar next on Avenue Montaigne that caters to the surrounding theaters and the wealthy inhabitants of the area. She will meet a pianist, a famous actress and a great art collector, and become acquainted with the \"luxurious\" world her grandmother has told her about since her childhood.','/fgJwqYJ59daMvOS3JuZJcJiVRVn.jpg','2006-02-15',106,'Released',NULL,'Avenue Montaigne',10051,1.9696,6.1,'7OP-Q8uZsTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20023,_binary '\0','/eKYnSOV7UBj0zCSCmnD1GFVFMTs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444182',7,15692,'fr','Indigènes','1943. They have never stepped foot on French soil but because France was at war, Said, Abdelkader, Messaoud and Yassir enlist in the French Army, along with 130,000 other “indigenous” soldiers, to liberate the “fatherland” from the Nazi enemy. Heroes that history has forgotten...','/49Bq01x0hGe6wQeswmkI4CTnmoi.jpg','2006-09-27',128,'Released','The true story of World War II\'s forgotten heroes.','Days of Glory',2016,2.9916,6.7,'5O3Hgrc_dTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20024,_binary '\0','/yCzHRwVrMauBTIZLlPeultQGMAT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444505',5.6,7208,'es','Torrente 3: El protector','A popular and beautiful politician plans to expose the evil-doings of a multinational corporation. Hoping to silence her, the corporation\'s top executives decide to hire the most incompetent detective they can find to act as her bodyguard.','/l1RzG6SGfcAIftgCjaNNSfP7wEC.jpg','2005-09-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Torrente 3: The Protector',1285,3.0095,5.4,'nn7fhaEtAqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20025,_binary '\0','/z5PZG7EQPowxKF8fJoe4QHui70P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444518',8.1,3330,'fr','Un amour à taire','A young Jewish girl, Sara, is looking to escape the clutches of the Third Reich after seeing her parents and sister brutally slain by a smuggler who betrayed them while attempting to escape to England. Terrified, she is sheltered by her childhood friend Jean, a homosexual in a clandestine relationship with his lover Philippe.','/41ZFBfdWQsKbCiBBGitIp3Z6CgZ.jpg','2005-03-07',102,'Released',NULL,'A Love to Hide',19521,2.3351,7.2,'ZU4dKBDSuEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20026,_binary '\0','/uYbGYaF2CS1R6NSGTR8Y6EtE5xR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444519',5.3,1372,'fr','Un ticket pour l\'espace','Face à l\'incompréhension de la population française quant au montant des crédits alloués à la recherche spatiale, le gouvernement lance une vaste opération de communication. En partenariat avec le Centre spatial français, un grand jeu est organisé. \"Le ticket pour l\'espace\", un jeu à gratter, va permettre à deux civils de séjourner dans la station orbitale européenne.','/2lJFxH732BjLTQzuqMdASoX7IDz.jpg','2006-01-16',90,'Released',NULL,'A Ticket to Space',13748,1.6443,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20027,_binary '\0','/trY2Y74EzQuz1WLRjIL3A9gDnS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444628',6.1,5253,'en','Fay Grim','Many years after her notorious husband, Henry Fool, fled after killing a neighbor, Fay Grim receives a visit from CIA agent Fulbright, who tells her that Henry is dead, but that some of his journals have been unearthed in France. She sets forth on a globe-trotting odyssey that soon leads to the discovery that he is alive, and his journals are more than they appear to be.','/20C2aywxWMvkXRP7H1mIkpJvxS7.jpg','2007-05-18',118,'Released','Featuring the continuing adventures of Henry Fool.','Fay Grim',24200,2.2551,5.6,'QDi-a-MYp3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20028,_binary '\0','/wVsGQt9s7djp7cDhjRbCPIj7nEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444653',6.8,38342,'en','Keeping Mum','A pastor preoccupied with writing the perfect sermon fails to realize that his wife is having an affair and his children are up to no good.','/nkyS4lkiEOCx7mtlMtWLYodbVpb.jpg','2005-12-02',103,'Released','Some family secrets are best kept...buried.','Keeping Mum',9687,6.5972,6.7,'gDauvode-O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20029,_binary '\0','/obFSS3QYfPrfFgPbB0RFV2WFazP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444672',5.2,4005,'en','Moving McAllister','Rick Robinson, a law intern, is scheduled to take the bar exam in just four days. Anxious to score points with his boss Mr. McAllister, Rick unwisely agrees to help the man move. The next day, Rick finds himself in a moving van from Miami to Los Angeles, accompanied by McAllister\'s spoiled niece and her pet pig.','/s6zrsLcmQEeFVCvYzfOmHb3hmM3.jpg','2007-09-13',89,'Released','The road less traveled is about to get some company.','Moving McAllister',18035,2.0191,5.1,'ntmmfUdbZis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20030,_binary '\0','/4eakTJuJD3sRGfv1qVWW46iPq82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444682',5.6,46372,'en','The Reaping','Katherine Morrissey, a former Christian missionary, lost her faith after the tragic deaths of her family. Now she applies her expertise to debunking religious phenomena. When a series of biblical plagues overrun a small town, Katherine arrives to prove that a supernatural force is not behind the occurrences, but soon finds that science cannot explain what is happening. Instead, she must regain her faith to combat the evil that waits in a Louisiana swamp.','/o8Vl4Vxp5LBth9J6Aa3k6PAefxt.jpg','2007-04-04',99,'Released','Thousands of years ago, there was a series of bizarre occurrences that many believe to have been the Ten Biblical Plagues. No one thought they could happen again. Until now.','The Reaping',1683,6.5525,5.781,'uJmoEPwudN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20031,_binary '\0','/ehh43x6Nq3ONUV1CkcRFlvmiyPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444736',4.2,1325,'en','The Naked Brothers Band: The Movie','After making it to the top of the charts, members of the Silver Boulders, a popular tween rock band, find themselves undermined by internal squabbling as the bandmates seek different creative directions.','/zWfmmO86k7oEn7Y1zWuP1kX6RnT.jpg','2005-10-23',83,'Released','Real Brothers, Real Music, Not Really Naked.','The Naked Brothers Band: The Movie',160166,1.966,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20032,_binary '\0','/tlVhygnHZIUcvMJnjRT7JZq0NqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444759',4.8,1736,'th','คนเล่นของ','When Boom suffers abandonment and abuse by Prathan, she decides to use black magic to take revenge on him and his family.','/rxLlAzwihpsUQQXAbNVmKg2peBZ.jpg','2004-06-17',96,'Released','Love him, Own him, Kill him.','Art of the Devil',40127,2.6467,6.5,'z4NQ4uxx13o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20033,_binary '\0','/7grt1hkwPQMOMMp9ULeiO3hctER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444778',7.3,2069,'th','หมานคร','Pod decides to change jobs after losing his finger at a sardine packing plant. His new job as a security guard comes with an unexpected perk in the form of a lanky maid who carries a mysterious white book.','/A9Roojb8irRKPyyhDKCRzVc16NI.jpg','2004-12-12',100,'Released','A truly, weirdly wonderful love story.','Citizen Dog',25755,1.1681,6.8,'mvuvXfJttdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20034,_binary '\0','/7p7WdxwhKTijbylGEAx4MPaIyR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444781',5.7,6897,'hi','दीवाने हुए पागल','A man embarks on journey to find his love in Dubai, only to learn she has different suitors and admirers.','/rLb1IncCARJWbioGxYNDY5NUxb0.jpg','2005-11-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Deewane Huye Paagal',97341,2.049,5.237,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20035,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444840',5.2,4652,'hi','हमको दीवाना कर गये','Aditya, an engineer, travels to Canada for training. There he meets Jia, a beautiful woman from an influential family. Fate keeps pushing the pair together, and even though both are already betrothed to others, Adi and Jia fall in love.','/5Pe8sACQOQ6Ht6mPR5tUNwpGHgy.jpg','2006-04-14',152,'Released','One life... one moment... one coincidence... changed their lives forever.','Humko Deewana Kar Gaye',48569,1.4211,5.324,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20036,_binary '\0','/1dTkzop9cBR6eQnbw8Hddx8m728.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444845',7.4,1330,'fi','Joulupukki ja noitarumpu','A few days before Christmas Eve the last sack of letters arrives to Santa. At the bottom is a letter that is a bit older than the others, it\'s a drawing. While the curious Santa tries to figure out what the drawing looks like, strange things begin to happen.','/oE4NFNWSI3KDmWKGw0pAnXYXe3i.jpg','1996-12-24',51,'Released',NULL,'Santa Claus and the Magic Drum',61495,1.3091,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20037,_binary '\0','/ysmpkS3VcW4XIPDFj62DLGJizv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444849',5.7,1578,'hi','Karam','A hitman quits the killing business when a hit goes right but at the same time produces unfortunate results. Soon, he is forced to return in order to save his wife from the clutches of his boss who won\'t spare her unless some targets are executed within the limited time period.','/wyxJ3KkygtNApMpNS1t23nOjmGV.jpg','2005-03-11',117,'Released',NULL,'Karam',272220,1.722,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20038,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444874',5,1267,'hi','मैं ऐसा ही हूँ','A mentally challenged man fights his former father-in-law for custody of his daughter.','/87ueqnQ9HRSGEAXAhLGifgSyIxz.jpg','2005-05-06',162,'Released','A Normal Man In An Abnormal World','Main Aisa Hi Hoon',316812,1.0203,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20039,_binary '\0','/vRAVN6Pn3dWuQTC6JD88ZnhjH4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0444913',6.1,2603,'hi','Tango Charlie','Indian Army Sepoy Tarun Chauhan is assigned to proceed to Northeastern part of India that has been rocked by riots and violence with orders to report to his superior, Havaldar Mohammed Ali. Once there, he comes to know that things can be quiet for weeks, following by sporadic violence, and casualties on both sides. His group also comes under attack by vicious terrorists, who like to cut an ear from a dead body, then leave the body as bait, in order to kill anyone who comes to the rescue. This is where Tarun makes his first kill.','/jGfWsWcndUpzrdxZ8uddKYlJUsk.jpg','2005-03-25',143,'Released',NULL,'Tango Charlie',301687,1.0893,6.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20040,_binary '\0','/a2UHfSMJkG4SE6gcB7TNJUoDnzv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445033',6.6,2310,'te','మాస్','Mass, an orphan, bonds well with his landlord\'s son, Adi, who is in love with a mafia head\'s daughter. Attempting to separate the lovers, the gangsters kill Adi and Mass sets out to seek revenge.','/h0sU47Zph0iyTvlKrfOq0kKBKY3.jpg','2004-12-23',162,'Released','Dammunte Kasko...','Mass',81088,1.1913,6.188,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20041,_binary '\0','/1FIyqEY0Vz4GX3YYnyoZJQBnmXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445054',6.5,9529,'fr','Les 7 jours du talion','Like many happy people, Bruno Hamel is leading an uneventful life until one afternoon, when his daughter is raped and murdered. When the murderer is arrested, a terrible project germinates in Bruno\'s darkened mind. He plans to capture the \"monster\" and make him pay for his crime.','/ag662hfmscOMYuVXxcPzAcDfIJY.jpg','2010-06-22',105,'Released','Justice is blind. So is vengence.','Seven Days',39681,2.947,6.282,'S2_fpu7JCNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20042,_binary '\0','/5r3NmxYpzMGQT5gKNbDaXTbvBsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445161',6.5,2348,'ru','4','Two men and a woman happen to meet in a bar. We learn from their conversations both the intriguing and banal details of their lives. But is anyone really telling the truth?','/6NTYBptoe7cGNt3xiPxR9AX9hGx.jpg','2005-04-25',126,'Released',NULL,'4',31227,1.5813,5.411,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20043,_binary '\0','/xksy5U3DXiMhSMskfdQfzQ3LP1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445336',7.4,17100,'sv','Du levande','In the Swedish city of Lethe, people from different walks of life take part in a series of short, deadpan vignettes that rush past. Some are just seconds long, none longer than a couple of minutes. A young woman remembers a fantasy honeymoon with a rock guitarist. A man awakes from a dream about bomber planes. A businessman boasts about success while being robbed by a pickpocket, and so on. The absurdist collection is accompanied by Dixieland jazz and similar music.','/j4FAPvqjqUvs1YrQi76p6fIDRUB.jpg','2007-09-21',93,'Released',NULL,'You, the Living',5817,1.9091,7.1,'vwLBeFyi6b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20044,_binary '\0','/8wIWLEQ4XII9CgSiZwVG5YyxXpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445396',6.9,1677,'ko','그때 그사람들','On October 26, 1979, President Park Chung-hee, who had ruled South Korea since 1961, was assassinated by his director of intelligence. The film depicts the events of that night.','/yQnjTeypjtxfba8FGacitjNqoas.jpg','2005-02-03',102,'Released','When i fire the first shot, it\'s showtime!','The President\'s Last Bang',41338,1.9906,6.5,'w2Am1hL-lm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20045,_binary '\0','/vWG9MpawEn6qGm7VNwQCyC6Lqny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445570',5.8,1353,'fr','Mon petit doigt m\'a dit...','The Beresfords investigate mysterious deaths at an old people\'s home.','/nXLvN2bESWpNZja5kFsZJ1wfDzJ.jpg','2005-04-13',105,'Released',NULL,'By the Pricking of My Thumbs',31329,1.8202,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20046,_binary '\0','/rnuraNgw9zOlqdDkl8y6lNE2RJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445620',7.4,24989,'fr','Paradise Now','Two childhood friends are recruited for a suicide bombing in Tel Aviv','/qWZkYa8VdcDZk8uzRB2PfhpM9IL.jpg','2005-09-07',90,'Released','From the most unexpected place, come a new call for peace','Paradise Now',67,4.154,6.9,'9O5KYevUkPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20047,_binary '\0','/gygtjTTi3O9uDN5BevYAPWeVi2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445691',7.2,3579,'ca','Salvador (Puig Antich)','The story of Salvador Puig Antich, one of the last political prisoners to be executed under Franco\'s Fascist State in 1974.','/sckxel7UsvGbTc7DOJqLWy39SE1.jpg','2006-05-23',137,'Released',NULL,'Salvador (Puig Antich)',1896,2.437,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20048,_binary '\0','/hK6BUTrXSmlDHagC3fAlx1Dljmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445760',6.5,6012,'zh','天邊一朵雲','Hsiao-Kang, now working as an adult movie actor, meets Shiang-chyi once again. Meanwhile, the city of Taipei faces a water shortage that makes the sales of watermelons skyrocket.','/9982mkMphAfTGrXbCiOkCwTGVug.jpg','2005-03-25',114,'Released','Fruity, juicy and spicy.','The Wayward Cloud',36253,2.1597,6,'CMjbqhBdU7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20049,_binary '\0','/teGBD3OBdNAAFvA0XUfPBvo8Bgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445800',4.1,3954,'fr','Les Bronzés 3 : Amis pour la vie','After the Club Med and skiing, what happened to the Bronzés 27 years later? Early response: the same, and worse.','/ot2ZJ0mhQIDuExQjqBJfKcwxSy1.jpg','2006-02-01',95,'Released','Les mêmes... en pire! (The same... but worst!)','French Fried Vacations 3: Friends Forever',21435,2.6171,4.1,'VaSN-PdJlB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20050,_binary '\0','/s2mJnlqvRwVo1XpnmuPGvWso7pJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445922',7.3,118248,'en','Across the Universe','When young dockworker Jude leaves Liverpool to find his estranged father in the United States, he is swept up by the waves of change that are re-shaping the nation. Jude falls in love with Lucy, who joins the growing anti-war movement. As the body count in Vietnam rises, political tensions at home spiral out of control and the star-crossed lovers find themselves in a psychedelic world gone mad.','/447c8Te3DXC46rQvDEixKGO4dS6.jpg','2007-09-14',133,'Released','All you need is love.','Across the Universe',4688,5.5058,7.1,'OYa3K2kKfUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20051,_binary '\0','/brJ9nYhHNa8EsJRKRkJD4lv9c5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445934',6.3,187558,'en','Blades of Glory','When a much-publicized ice-skating scandal strips them of their gold medals, two world-class athletes skirt their way back onto the ice via a loophole that allows them to compete together as a pairs team.','/yclY3zyzrL1MS9b6Eygs9ks0ZTY.jpg','2007-03-30',93,'Released','Kick Some Ice','Blades of Glory',9955,10.5007,6.127,'YFE-6XlAAmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20052,_binary '\0','/fUdxWZPjTy7ghxp0wZVBfCvWhzV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445935',6,12071,'en','Bordertown','American corporations are using the North American Free Trade Agreement by opening large maquiladoras right across the United States–Mexico border. The maquiladoras hire mostly Mexican women to work long hours for little money in order to produce mass quantity products. Lauren Adrian, an impassioned American news reporter for the Chicago Sentinel wants to be assigned to the Iraq front-lines to cover the war. Instead, her editor George Morgan assigns her to investigate a series of slayings involving young maquiladora factory women in a Mexican bordertown.','/c0AR36VzvB5ileCoMfSlV9bFsVn.jpg','2007-02-22',112,'Released','Lies. Corruption. Murder. One reporter will break the silence.','Bordertown',4351,3.6933,6.276,'tikIenRQ_K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20053,_binary '\0','/ofEOYrUfaoG7LQeXwI5CFoMoiy3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445939',5.7,10391,'en','The Burrowers','It is 1879 in the Dakota Territories, a band of men who set out to find and recover a family of settlers that has mysteriously vanished from their home. Expecting the offenders to be a band of fierce natives, but they soon discover that the real enemy stalks them from below.','/usdEYNShCQi6IcQh2mMnnALTRhT.jpg','2008-09-09',96,'Released','Evil will surface.','The Burrowers',15846,2.3297,5.9,'HaaMPMrg8oY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20054,_binary '\0','/btd9VPSfnVh0pHZqbiUJLsOkBDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445946',5.6,27590,'en','The Contract','Attempting to recover from a recent family trauma by escaping into the woods for a peaceful hiking trip, an ex-lawman and his young son stumble across a dangerous contract killer.','/sU2yzV3T1LetBdQPAeBRDb4YwLo.jpg','2006-04-05',96,'Released','Every killer meets his equal.','The Contract',1441,5.5875,5.8,'lFELOkQbHDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20055,_binary '\0','/ethv9C6LcxQiCPr2ca7miSmZDO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445953',6.5,6055,'en','Disgrace','Disgrace is the story of a South African professor of English who loses everything: his reputation, his job, his peace of mind, his good looks, his dreams of artistic success, and finally even his ability to protect his cherished daughter. After having an affair with a student, he moves to the Eastern Cape, where he gets caught up in a mess of post-apartheid politics.','/xCM4H72gaXGXvJKcocAx8LKxaQC.jpg','2008-09-06',120,'Released',NULL,'Disgrace',12411,2.5691,6.2,'gpYlgpusS14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20056,_binary '\0','/8V8GyULImlunYQUgpuh77l68ehx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445965',5.3,6485,'en','Feed','A cybercrime investigator tracks a man suspected of force-feeding women to death.','/h0AtlijZmcg3q5KSquuOX5FC2eL.jpg','2005-05-11',97,'Released','Can you stomach it?','Feed',14566,1.9411,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20057,_binary '\0','/yvsHnHmfb1fkHaz0VQlqP0wXeZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0445990',7,80034,'en','Invincible','Inspired by the true story of Vince Papale, a man with nothing to lose who ignored the staggering odds and made his dream come true. When the coach of Papale\'s beloved hometown football team hosted an unprecedented open tryout, the public consensus was that it was a waste of time – no one good enough to play professional football was going to be found this way.','/oEaUMn5POAiMLnU6hKOBKoZbDpo.jpg','2006-08-25',105,'Released','Dreams are not lived on the sidelines','Invincible',11652,5.3664,7.034,'Aux_hRJYED8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20058,_binary '\0','/jebknLWJIkB652DqNWaGEUdXbbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446009',6.2,5864,'de','Neues vom Wixxer','Scotland Yard investigators have to prevent the murder of Victoria Dickman when her name is found on a death list.','/miD6UUIcikgDHWHhS9HxySDcS92.jpg','2007-03-10',98,'Released',NULL,'The Vexxer',1269,2.0029,6.539,'5oIhW9SNMhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20059,_binary '\0','/x1iHrvnxB3IuNBiTvqdfQqeh2mk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446013',5.4,47939,'en','Pathfinder','A Viking boy is left behind after his clan battles a Native American tribe. Raised within the tribe, he ultimately becomes their savior in a fight against the Norsemen.','/mME7efKNTU7jzXTgFkI1t0aQUiz.jpg','2007-01-11',99,'Released','Two Worlds, One War. The Ultimate Battle Begins.','Pathfinder',1534,5.5274,5.667,'hxOav6ojI4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20060,_binary '\0','/4OpR5ipMysUwIA2QHiH86d9qyP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446016',5.9,1413,'en','Pizza My Heart','Another modern spin-off of Romeo &amp; Juliet, this time about two families who each run rivaling pizza restaurants in New Jersey.','/7NxWTCWWyun4kR5hnf9UgAwsYLz.jpg','2005-07-24',85,'Released',NULL,'Pizza My Heart',127836,1.5038,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20061,_binary '\0','/6R9nT6m8wmzayV5XOQq3TRA6yZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446029',7.5,500973,'en','Scott Pilgrim vs. the World','As bass guitarist for a garage-rock band, Scott Pilgrim has never had trouble getting a girlfriend; usually, the problem is getting rid of them. But when Ramona Flowers skates into his heart, he finds she has the most troublesome baggage of all: an army of ex-boyfriends who will stop at nothing to eliminate him from her list of suitors.','/g5IoYeudx9XBEfwNL0fHvSckLBz.jpg','2010-08-12',113,'Released','An epic of epic epicness.','Scott Pilgrim vs. the World',22538,14.8479,7.485,'7wd5KEaOtm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20062,_binary '\0','/3I0ibLoqCBu3gCeN46wpnKL7gq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446046',6.6,27662,'en','Take the Lead','A former professional dancer volunteers to teach dance in the New York public school system and, while his background first clashes with his students\' tastes, together they create a completely new style of dance. Based on the story of ballroom dancer, Pierre Dulane.','/vkGSs0eeOOISEe9jddBZnRSkn46.jpg','2006-03-17',118,'Released','Never Follow','Take the Lead',12763,4.6462,6.9,'-yWRRvTBUz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20063,_binary '\0','/dIttEg63wjv2DCBMJmvd6Tw8f6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446051',6.6,1317,'en','Third Man Out: A Donald Strachey Mystery','Gay detective Donald Strachey is commissioned to protect gay activist John Rutka, known for \"outing\" prominent citizens.','/p6pMRG2QYQXt0ZGuruOrehsMtYM.jpg','2005-07-07',99,'Released','America\'s first gay detective.','Third Man Out: A Donald Strachey Mystery',47619,2.1153,5.8,'QmWe0CfqafE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20064,_binary '\0','/sumVr8uduhPwx4H3cWjrP76i3AB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446059',7.5,81786,'zh','霍元甲','After going through a series of tragic events in his life, martial arts master Huo Yuanjia returns to Tianjin and must fight four international soldiers, in order to safeguard his nation\'s pride.','/bBsikWKj4bVDNnebBgrLnh6NoEi.jpg','2006-01-26',103,'Released','Mastering others is strength. Mastering yourself makes you fearless.','Fearless',7549,5.7693,7.52,'4I3oUkBnFG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20065,_binary '\0','/iIv1phBPdTd0gnOdBsANvKeRSby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446298',6.2,3483,'en','Civic Duty','An American accountant bombarded with cable news and the media\'s obsession with terrorist plots in the post 9-11 world, receives a jolt when an unattached Islamic graduate student moves in next door.','/mmRTv1Ipg91Nxlvo7aj5dKt7UCA.jpg','2006-04-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Civic Duty',14041,2.3459,6.191,'eF3P5RWEYwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20066,_binary '\0','/17l4AEvFkd28p81FAr8ZZqaVEhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446312',5.6,1544,'es','Los 2 lados de la cama','Three years have passed and the boys seem to have matured. Javier is going to marry Marta and Pedro is very much in love with his new girlfriend Raquel. Rafa has also found happiness with Pilar, who loves him too and treats him in a very particular way. It can seem that everything is perfect in their lives. But what do the girls think? Marta and Raquel have different plans that will put their relationship with their boyfriends in danger. Even Pilar has got a lover and is being unfaithful to Rafa. But that\'s not all: a new woman, Carlota, appears in Javier and Pedro\'s lives','/fGoKnxgE8wrbJwfPnolup4bk3hX.jpg','2005-12-21',104,'Released',NULL,'The 2 Sides of the Bed',89764,1.5618,5.4,'oqv3Woq1kJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20067,_binary '\0','/yGieCRY6yhfoZpZTo7Hi9aVFRVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446313',5.3,1764,'cn','猛龍','A team of Interpol agents arrive in the city to testify against a local crime lord. However on the way to court the vehicle carrying the Triad boss is attacked and the crime lord snatched, not by his own people but by another foe.','/bG5psOQnLBiNR6HpGjSTEglWn6l.jpg','2005-11-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Squad',18816,2.7104,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20068,_binary '\0','/gLGwkgS15MgII9kgdo8vbokApxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446442',5.2,1896,'fr','Quelques jours en septembre','1 September 2001. Elliot, an American C.I.A. agent holding top secret information on the immediate future of the world, disappears. His sole aim was to meet his daughter Orlando, whom he abandoned ten years before. Irène, a French agent who used to work with him, and David, his adoptive son, will help him and lead the girl to her father. Chased by William Pound, a strangely poetic psycho, they will defy the dangers of international espionage from Paris to Venice and finally get to Elliot on 11 September 2001.','/3VoTZBbfHTu2Mp9ELkVk3H0p9by.jpg','2006-09-06',116,'Released',NULL,'A Few Days in September',38848,1.9436,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20069,_binary '\0','/sdrjP5FQkhzQE5nQGEWAChEsreI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446460',6,3544,'nl','Het Schnitzelparadijs','Schnitzel Paradise is a Dutch film about a young Moroccan man working in the kitchen of popular Dutch restaurant.','/n6rrJY8pGq7pWZOQeD0UdI0D51o.jpg','2005-09-08',82,'Released',NULL,'Schnitzel Paradise',908,0.9578,5.8,'WnpSyKmqK2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20070,_binary '\0','/vQTAB0mHYDS3fh7qpvn0K63JoyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446463',6.2,4122,'fr','Si j\'étais toi','Husband, wife, and daughter have moved from Boston to Williamstown. At 16, Samantha treats her mother shabbily, but when the two of them are in a horrific car crash, the mother wills Sam to live, somehow losing her own life while her spirit enters Sam.','/gDbUMwVkAGrokuvclmaiLVEFtSd.jpg','2007-10-10',92,'Released',NULL,'The Secret',14432,3.7373,6,'bP9GvhfofNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20071,_binary '\0','/lO6AgqiM2vksGEb2FJzLBkyjLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446476',5.6,2794,'sv','Storm','DD is a smug fellow, almost 30 years of age, who can manage all by himself. At least that\'s what he thinks. However, a strange woman - Lova - enters his life, hunted by evil men who want to hurt her. Against his will, DD is forced into a series of horrific events.','/kHoTQa6CToMsnPYP2Uy6K1B6H1x.jpg','2005-01-20',110,'Released','You may have forgotten your past, but it hasn\'t forgotten you…','Storm',46222,1.0977,5.9,'Ukugs-kpNzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20072,_binary '\0','/qiFH8HNZoVaGaEpmJPRoUDse413.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446559',6.2,2083,'ar','حرب أطاليا','Yaseen is a lawyer who works for senior attorney, Kamaal. When he discovers that Kamal is involved in an illegal business with a tycoon, he gets publicly disbarred and loses his job. His fiance gets abducted to Italy when he tries to redeem himself, so he relentlessly forms a plan to set things right.','/zbSoyR3f1v7JrdPz09ecaYEXjji.jpg','2005-07-27',113,'Released',NULL,'Italia\'s War',85922,1.1146,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20073,_binary '\0','/cDl0eV8ihSYgMUoXN6OTFLWPxYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446676',5.3,4786,'en','Deal','As an ex-gambler teaches a hot-shot college kid some things about playing cards, he finds himself pulled into the world series of poker, where his protégé is his toughest competition.','/zm1FN17vlQb3h5RdQfjPzNvDLWe.jpg','2008-01-29',85,'Released',NULL,'Deal',11115,1.9391,5.3,'zKkmfiGxY5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20074,_binary '\0','/uuMI1WBpkTq4Es9MxlIbBnsuqMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446685',6.4,1609,'ja','Drawing Restraint 9','The film concerns the theme of self-imposed limitation and continues Matthew Barney\'s interest in religious rite, this time focusing on Shinto.','/453zKeXErfTZoRDK8AldLBoJsM3.jpg','2006-02-11',135,'Released',NULL,'Drawing Restraint 9',34787,1.2321,6.32,'Wx6VnMrMMGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20075,_binary '\0','/1rTD60JNH2H8vnP4xeQGmK2kyoG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446687',6.6,11247,'en','Driving Lessons','A shy teenage boy trying to escape the influence of his domineering mother, has his world changed when he begins to work for a retired actress.','/uPRFM5co4v12ksWaZKr8niIHBrC.jpg','2006-09-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Driving Lessons',11404,2.5152,6.1,'0gWgt8YBggo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20076,_binary '\0','/no4PRDyy60XM9d6HAAZO4WwYojK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446707',5.6,1581,'fr','Pars vite et reviens tard','In Paris, many citizens go to the precinct after the doors of their apartments have been sprayed with a 4 and the letters \"clt\". When a dweller is found mysteriously dead in his apartment, Detective Jean-Baptiste Adamsberg and his partner Danglard investigate...','/66kLtrsbt83mcMsHwvvANXoqHdX.jpg','2007-01-24',116,'Released',NULL,'Have Mercy on Us All',14649,1.7987,5.9,'SnRC_rc7xEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20077,_binary '\0','/ghWikkRVDjLVIaFKLzdj7IvHLO5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446719',5.6,8617,'en','Isolation','On a remote Irish farm, five people become unwilling participants in an experiment that goes nightmarishly wrong.','/6CpGHO5cnZgWKKeqjCXaEwvk8Q8.jpg','2005-11-06',95,'Released','It didn\'t want to be born. Now it doesn\'t want to die.','Isolation',25967,2.1038,5.5,'zEAr9FG_PeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20078,_binary '\0','/y8n9w26LU9BYiMIyARv6dbg6NO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446724',7.1,5591,'en','Kim Possible Movie: So the Drama','Dr. Drakken has an evil new plot for world domination, but his ultimate success depends upon finding out KP\'s weakness which may involve a new hottie at Middleton High School named Eric, who suddenly sparks feelings in Ron about Kim that resemble much more than friendship. To make matters worse, Bueno Nacho, Ron\'s favorite fast food chain has turned sour on him by bombarding him with little Devils.','/rQ5WS0zWDRau2lI0FYpGYDGmDVS.jpg','2005-04-08',71,'Released','The adventure of their lives. A movie that changes everything.','Kim Possible Movie: So the Drama',20771,5.3056,6.9,'odSm5oecY9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20079,_binary '\0','/nbWnSvZNuxYQyebD7OHJAuyJuBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446747',6.7,2047,'en','Mutual Appreciation','Alan is a musician who leaves a busted-up band for New York, and a new musical voyage. He tries to stay focused and fends off all manner of distractions, including the attraction to his good friend\'s girlfriend.','/yjKHIcFue6Et3qsBbxcVUrGjGRM.jpg','2005-03-01',109,'Released',NULL,'Mutual Appreciation',40769,1.8167,6,'CBGLx1k2S08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20080,_binary '\0','/hABRubsWJ8nGXUZfNnf9PjphDai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446750',6.5,3676,'en','Nightwatching','An extravagant, exotic and moving look at Rembrandt\'s romantic and professional life, and the controversy he created by the identification of a murderer in the painting The Night Watch.','/vcwa1RqvoYLQIKOA4EjjPNhrkJx.jpg','2007-11-02',135,'Released','Murder, Conspiracy and the Masterpiece that Revealed the Truth','Nightwatching',4556,2.7965,6.2,'JN2eLySBIMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20081,_binary '\0','/DQIuVJmZmly58CQQw4bgo9T22L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446752',5.5,3797,'en','Full of It','A teenager tells outrageous lies at his new high school, only to have them suddenly come true.','/7N96JPo7psxZVpI8axl1gSeJQ7l.jpg','2007-03-01',91,'Released','He coudn\'t make it big, so he made it up.','Full of It',29362,5.2838,5.423,'VMVRmIs4BbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20082,_binary '\0','/9r2vUgsFoYIvEryW77chX5moedT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446755',7.4,100664,'en','The Painted Veil','A British medical doctor fights a cholera outbreak in a small Chinese village, while also being trapped at home in a loveless marriage to an unfaithful wife.','/k41IvHDLgZO2ae7RuU77wQjScIj.jpg','2006-12-09',125,'Released','Sometimes the greatest journey is the distance between two people.','The Painted Veil',14202,5.2511,7.257,'1oevR8c35Qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20083,_binary '\0','/kzmJxrZLvLSIGvJT9CgksfEOtMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446765',7.4,1724,'en','Punk: Attitude','From London\'s 1970 mod scene to Sonic Youth, punk music has always been about attitude and anarchy. This comprehensive rockumentary traces the roots of punk, from The Velvet Underground and the New York Dolls to the Sex Pistols and The Clash.','/39JHwg6fahbtL2qSgfxcVLbYv1t.jpg','2005-07-04',88,'Released',NULL,'Punk: Attitude',24616,1.045,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20084,_binary '\0','/1pWZm7nkG6MCBzPagrpPeCEbYQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446802',7.2,2066,'en','Have Dreams, Will Travel','West Texas, in the 1960\'s. A tale of two 12-year-olds who embark on an adventure to find new parents in order to escape their unhappy and emotionally unsatisfying family life.','/jMHkxZS8HEPbwyskI2KZRLKD4mb.jpg','2007-05-21',86,'Released','You\'re never too young to have a plan','Have Dreams, Will Travel',14552,2.5389,7.6,'j5awOuvQLQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20085,_binary '\0','/eutVuFoJ3Hoci8GEj1Zxhs2Wjpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0446930',6.2,3971,'tr','Bekleme Odası','Ahmet, a filmmaker on Dostoyevsky\'s \'Crime and Punishment\', sinks into depression, alienates loved ones, and abandons his film.','/o4OFHY4RfvGabSoVqB44HDRL9ly.jpg','2004-02-27',92,'Released',NULL,'The Waiting Room',52188,1.5755,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20086,_binary '\0','/z4HQoQVkWe99tXI1PfcwSb5H0Dd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447166',7.3,3497,'en','The Gamers: Dorkness Rising','All Lodge wants is for his gaming group to finish their adventure. Unfortunately, they\'re more interested in seducing barmaids, mooning their enemies, and setting random villagers on fire. Desperate to rein in his players, Lodge injects two newbies into the party: a non-player character controlled by Lodge, who the power gamers immediately distrust, and the rarest gamer of all... a girl. Can the group overcome their bickering to save the kingdom, or will the evil necromancer Mort Kemnon triumph unopposed? A fun parody of fantasy films and the adventure gaming community.','/qu4obP0b8D9UrTkqj3NHOdcSinq.jpg','2008-08-14',105,'Released','One roll to rule them all','The Gamers: Dorkness Rising',26235,1.0467,6.9,'DvH4PskPZ4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20087,_binary '\0','/cbfDxXvT29XCVKm8U5NJI5gTW7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447484',7.9,3732,'tr','Tatar Ramazan','In 1942 during the time of war, Tatar Ramazan goes to jail because murder after argument on lands. When he gets out, he finds out that the life outside is much harder.','/9zQfpL8zQNhavCmvI4Jo3AK9CbY.jpg','1990-01-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Tatar Ramazan',201662,0.8877,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20088,_binary '\0','/vwL1iuYXJC8CNwKijazMRTCPA4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447619',4.8,2484,'fr','Le Concile de Pierre','In France, the single translator Diane Siprien adopts an Asian baby named Liu-San in a foundation directed by Sybille Weber. Years later, a weird mark appears on the boy\'s chest and Diane and Liu share their dreadful nightmares. Diane is assigned for a three-day job in Germany and she leaves Liu with her friend Sybille. However, while going to the airport, Diane finds Liu hidden in the backseat and startles with an eagle flying toward the windshield, crashing her car. Liu falls into a coma and his digital recorder records the boy speaking in an unknown dialect. When Diane searches the translation and the origins of Liu, she is surrounded by mysterious murders. She discovers that the dialect is from the mystic Mongolian Tseven tribe and that Liu is a powerful Observer; further, he is in danger, threatened by sorcerers that need the boy for their Council of the Stone..','/9hFKhOI7bUnkXjE2gbG2bpFSVh9.jpg','2006-11-15',102,'Released',NULL,'The Stone Council',21775,2.3145,4.5,'5cyPg5vSvcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20089,_binary '\0','/wGxBLIJSsVlDf6kNxPsNdDU5Uct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447641',5.9,1663,'sv','Gitarrmongot','A 12-year-old boy making basic punk songs, grown men playing with guns, a neurotic woman with euphoric happiness targeting self destruction – a Swedish everyday life you\'ve never seen before.','/9ayYJCn1VnPCbg4sFxPgjZM7Idz.jpg','2004-10-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Guitar Mongoloid',69313,1.0857,5.5,'odatuvKn_xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20090,_binary '\0','/lQcGCiXmHH9LbfOdgG4qDNchzFq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447679',6.9,1408,'nl','Het Paard van Sinterklaas','There is only one thing Winky wants: a horse, a real horse to ride. But horses are expensive. Fortunately it is the season of Sinterklaas; Winky just asks Sinterklaas for a horse. Than everything will work out alright. Or will it?','/7IyD83Zu4EghaURBXjY8bEuLqev.jpg','2005-11-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Winky\'s Horse',50730,1.3868,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20091,_binary '\0','/daMfSs2k1LULA5vhfiW1YmhaZY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447907',6.4,1978,'es','Concursante','Martín\'s lucky hit when he wins the most lucrative prize in television history puts his life upside down.','/qCkAaDWTwrkUDZUORKcTpuxUVYi.jpg','2007-03-16',88,'Released',NULL,'The Contestant',48453,1.6938,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20092,_binary '\0','/6RzZ87YNB7HkmIChhyJxRCQn6pF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447987',5.6,4415,'en','Go Figure','Katelin Kingsford, an Olympic hopeful figure skater wants to train with a Russian figure skating coach. In order to go to go to the school that Natasha is at, Katelin gets a scholarship playing on the girls hockey team.','/3ngHrgIt33g0IEjl7rvzGLQ8wpj.jpg','2005-06-10',88,'Released','She shoots, She scores, She accessorizes...','Go Figure',55504,3.6132,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20093,_binary '\0','/nuDuXMKB5BJL3umAu45p8hvUtcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0447999',5.5,1369,'en','Hot Tamale','A road trip to Los Angeles inadvertently leads a young man from Wyoming into a wild maze of psychotic hit-men, racy women, jewel thieves and a salsa band.','/waEUrsiaRf6RCbDqHJVMRZaAKe0.jpg','2006-04-23',102,'Released','The heist of a lifetime just got complicated.','Hot Tamale',10026,6.6867,4.9,'ghbAOpbOw8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20094,_binary '\0','/oZqounvawm4hDxpDGDHLmVBGJBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','t