e are heroes. There are superheroes. And then there\'s Hancock.','Hancock',8960,14.4102,6.358,'6iFcGNOWnA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20102,_binary '\0','/6zZ47ilB3uQloFSV2XLiht0xxi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448166',6.4,2598,'en','Two Weeks','In this bittersweet comedy, four adult siblings gather at their dying mother\'s house in North Carolina for what they expect to be a quick, last goodbye. Instead, they find themselves trapped — together — for two weeks.','/jO7tUjxEVpx4RPuO8lw3lS8P57g.jpg','2006-10-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Two Weeks',17179,1.7226,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20103,_binary '\0','/cbjvYpR1zop0ukpVdhBbBEn3Q59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448179',4.5,5807,'en','Wild Things: Diamonds in the Rough','Two young women will stop at nothing for one to gain a $4 million inheritance of two priceless diamonds, while two detectives try to thwart their plans, but find complications abound.','/1O01MpwB6eV0ars0Jxk0yh4x5ED.jpg','2005-02-19',87,'Released','Bad girls just want to have fun.','Wild Things: Diamonds in the Rough',17124,4.2252,4.977,'oWdZ071Qwb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20104,_binary '\0','/x4cppAZNpyXTasHCEZYdL9wORt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448206',6.3,9335,'hi','बंटी और बब्ली','Bunty and Babli are two young people who randomly meet each other after running away from their homes to chase their dream. After facing hurdles in their path they decide to take up conning and soon become the best con artists in the country. However, their success is threatened as a relentless cop is on their trail.','/32OxUzs9ETQ3QvLFFYaDuuAtq3Y.jpg','2005-05-27',170,'Released',NULL,'Bunty Aur Babli',11763,1.5407,6.322,'IVI4ObUL7Yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20105,_binary '\0','/ql0QgdueoMTNB8McT6GAP82QIOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448245',5.4,1418,'fr','Quatre étoiles','Franssou, a charming Parisian English teacher, who shares part of her life with a boring middle-aged lover, dreams of another life. So, when she unexpectedly inherits 50,000 euros, she grasps the opportunity and goes to the French Riviera in order to take it easy in luxury. In the four-star hotel where she rents a room she comes across Stéphane, a strange guy who is in the process of arranging Elton John\'s next coming to the place. Intrigued by the noisy ostentatious fellow, she follows him until she finally comes into contact with him. She knows Stéphane is at bay and decides to take advantage of it.','/7LMcFXMGSNpsgM6ikntBvNhE2o2.jpg','2006-01-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Quatre étoiles',13739,2.2262,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20106,_binary '\0','/vK1lQDDOw57XcwupfCoqBFGlkpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448267',6.5,3484,'sv','Zozo','A Lebanese boy gets separated from his family during the civil war and ends up in Sweden.','/sQx60M59HMcarRH6IL8x21KwOD7.jpg','2005-09-02',105,'Released','There is always hope.','Zozo',49220,1.1948,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20107,_binary '\0','/8PmQSwI45C9Q4r1NNGUUmhJYzh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448400',5.1,3823,'de','Rohtenburg','In Germany, as graduate student Katie Armstrong researches cannibal killer Oliver Hagen for her thesis, she becomes obsessed with her subject and ultimately plunges into a lifestyle similar to Hagen\'s and the thousands of people like him.','/zNDcUgOiiAyjqQSmWbTFvRt2vjY.jpg','2006-08-27',87,'Released','Let the feeding begin.','Grimm Love',9639,1.6973,4.9,'QrL8JCkC5I0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20108,_binary '\0','/jzaxHfEtX9YVjvEr6Y4e8kAPsND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448564',5.7,7158,'en','Irresistible','A wife and mother is consumed by the thought that her husband\'s co-worker is trying to win him away from her and their family.','/oEjIshd5I8kMWgVY1Sw8sH4SlHH.jpg','2006-04-18',103,'Released','A secret is not safe if the truth has a witness.','Irresistible',18858,2.5296,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20109,_binary '\0','/9OfDayrzaDIuIeXt4vDBFelwDtN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448621',7.6,2647,'ko','말아톤','Cho-won is an autistic but happy young man who loves to draw zebras and run. His mother wants him to feel normal by accomplishing a feat that no one thought his son could achieve. With the help of a coach in exile, she trains him to become a marathon runner.','/iqZBClMG9JhyQq5NguKMQmvm8Mk.jpg','2005-01-27',117,'Released','His race with the world begins.','Marathon',59423,1.6364,7.2,'_EJv7JtUYq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20110,_binary '\0','/xtR4wRlYvqExfGoHTnn6yfzeDhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448663',6.6,2430,'ko','외출','A man and a woman are brought together after their spouses, who were having an affair, are hospitalized after a car crash.','/mEGr24FZBqS5S0gxRXoIYZAE7lJ.jpg','2005-09-07',107,'Released','Can this... be love?','April Snow',62569,3.2367,6.1,'qEU5ok0Ilgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20111,_binary '\0','/33xktrm1VvACeIk94sciMk9o0jh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448909',6.3,2910,'fi','Kummelin Jackpot','Kummelin Jackpot, was released in February 2006. It was about a divorced man portrayed by Silvennoinen, who realises a way to trick himself a jackpot in football betting.','/1kSQX4UGu2zCBcVVJfv9zrCl96v.jpg','2006-02-17',97,'Released',NULL,'Jackpot',78479,1.034,6.5,'fcVKTbsEZNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20112,_binary '\0','/6QZzrX0lvtSS5kv2Uc4T1W59M5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448927',6.1,6456,'pt','Se Eu Fosse Você','The publicist Claudio and the housewife and choral teacher Helena have been married for many years, but they do not understand and respect the feelings and view point of the partner. Claudio sees Helena as a shopper and \"little teacher of a choral\" and Helena sees Claudio as an insensitive and rough man. On the night before the fiftieth anniversary of Claudio, they changed places with each other.','/6ZQCy9TSZr1lhJqLtt6hSEDaxH6.jpg','2006-01-06',108,'Released',NULL,'If I Were You',34588,2.1405,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20113,_binary '\0','/4NSKpHojRcJfPPnuoxk5re0Wtah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0448993',6.3,2688,'en','The Art of Travel','High school grad. Conner Layne is about to marry his first love, but when wedding plans fail, he goes solo on his honeymoon to Central America, finding adventure with a ragtag group of foreigners who attempt to cross the Darien Gap in record time.','/1wZX3NitmlqBUhcHwByuyokUMRR.jpg','2008-01-08',100,'Released','The art of travel is to deviate from the current plan.','The Art of Travel',18175,1.9956,5.8,'JMN2lHfZWbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20114,_binary '\0','/2GB3sdsWn3drlkwGMMNQ3KFNbIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449010',5.1,135343,'en','Eragon','In his homeland of Alagaesia, a farm boy happens upon a dragon\'s egg -- a discovery that leads him on a predestined journey where he realized he\'s the one person who can defend his home against an evil king.','/mNu6QLUnKqPIjRA3pgEb5dkJye6.jpg','2006-12-14',104,'Released','As darkness falls, the last dragon will choose its rider.','Eragon',2486,6.4672,5.1,'MAqm-1zUyno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20115,_binary '\0','/eMoje0GifaAniyKmScxcVagSzRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449018',6.5,2980,'en','The Final Season','True story of Kent Stock, who in the early \'90s gives up a job and ditches his wedding plans to take over as head coach of the Norway High School baseball team. Kent must win over his players and convince them and himself that he can fill their former coach\'s shoes and that they can go out winners. In the summer of 1991 Norway High\'s baseball tradition ended on a triumphant but sombre note.','/jW0IQOUE3YN9WOxn3yUdLhL6bgV.jpg','2007-10-12',119,'Released','How Do You Want To Be Remembered?','The Final Season',15669,2.3875,5.4,'a-Kp8FjSGNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20116,_binary '\0','/twdtjJm31AExNx73DXaD4KRNU9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449059',7.8,566062,'en','Little Miss Sunshine','A family loaded with quirky, colorful characters piles into an old van and road trips to California for little Olive to compete in a beauty pageant.','/niNdhTpPHSgw22tK0PLjQMV640v.jpg','2006-07-26',102,'Released','A family on the verge of a breakdown.','Little Miss Sunshine',773,11.0301,7.691,'VWyH_twcMl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20117,_binary '\0','/uqchYxRnt7QRRRPa6Dm5NFigDXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449061',6.3,25896,'en','London','London is a drug laden adventure that centers on a party in a New York loft where a young man is trying to win back his ex-girlfriend.','/zvNHklUZcrwdN8xpL7Vsqedru5l.jpg','2005-09-03',92,'Released','One young man\'s incredible journey of self-discovery','London',7515,4.5613,6,'e8iSE9Cl694','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20118,_binary '\0','/vc31DWCeiEJn2eOe40CEVQiGXFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449086',5.1,15124,'en','Dominion: Prequel to The Exorcist','Father Merrin takes a sabbatical from the Church to devote himself to history and archaeology as he struggles with his shattered faith.','/nEkB6Y7DdEvWNCKWsHis76XYciR.jpg','2005-05-20',116,'Released','Go back before the beginning, to the place where evil was born.','Dominion: Prequel to The Exorcist',12700,5.9261,5.3,'MVODGSW_oxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20119,_binary '\0','/1jHxkVXMI5s3vRiyiZooUy1shB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449088',7.2,753114,'en','Pirates of the Caribbean: At World\'s End','After losing Captain Jack Sparrow to the locker of Davy Jones, Will Turner, Elizabeth Swann, and Captain Barbossa journey to the ends of the earth to rescue him. And as the East India Trading Company tightens its grip on the seas under Lord Cutler Beckett—now in control of Davy Jones—the fate of piracy hangs by a thread. Now, they must unite the pirate lords for one final stand. But as loyalties are tested and alliances shift, each must ultimately choose where they stand in the battle for freedom on the high seas.','/jGWpG4YhpQwVmjyHEGkxEkeRf0S.jpg','2007-05-19',169,'Released','At the end of the world, the adventure begins.','Pirates of the Caribbean: At World\'s End',285,32.418,7.278,'HKSZtp_OGHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20120,_binary '\0','/p2KLCS5l7i1tHR8bc1d2bEVKKdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449089',5.6,67917,'en','RV','Climbing aboard their mammoth recreational vehicle for a cross-country road trip to the Colorado Rockies, the Munro family – led by dysfunctional patriarch, Bob – prepares for the adventure of a lifetime. But spending two weeks together in one seriously small space has a way of cramping their style.','/eqV0JjfwcEJuK3JPZ2rsNvS1p30.jpg','2006-04-28',99,'Released','On a family vacation, no one can hear you scream.','RV',9530,6.7067,5.9,'foiHTT2rcso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20121,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449121',7.1,1516,'en','loudQUIETloud: A Film About the Pixies','When college rock darlings the Pixies broke up in 1992, their fans were shocked and dismayed. When they reunited in 2004, those same fans and legions of new listeners were ecstatic and filled with high hopes. loudQUIETloud follows the rehearsals and live shows of the band as they struggle through the reunion tour \"Sell Out\"','/haTQZD2MWhC1QoiJT6VgxaEVK2X.jpg','2006-04-21',85,'Released',NULL,'loudQUIETloud: A Film About the Pixies',22485,1.0114,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20122,_binary '\0','/xFCaYdVcRmeftt50HBclL0OCZDC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449228',5.3,2925,'hi','दोस्ती','Karan (Bobby Deol) was wealthy and a mansion was his habitat. Raj (Akshay Kumar) had empty pockets and the sky was his roof. Karan\'s jet ensured that he could fly if he wanted. Raj could only depend on his two feet. Karan had a family and yet craved love. Raj had love to share, but craved a family. Karan was the eternal Casanova. Raj was the proverbial one-woman man. Karan had it all, and yet felt empty. Raj had nothing, but his heart was full. They were two people as different as can be. Yet they found a common ground. One that led to the glorious road of Friendship! But can they sustain their friendship when new conflicts arise?','/FsbAjOevHYDjU7eXFFXS8aveWy.jpg','2005-12-23',142,'Released','Friends forever','Dosti: Friends Forever',225635,1.6062,4.425,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20123,_binary '\0','/foOSiTIB7E10uq62O2AOZtxqGse.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449306',4.6,4145,'hi','Lucky: No Time for Love','Mr. Sekhri is the Indian Ambassador in Russia, and his Chief Assistant is Mr. Negi. Sekhri is widowed with a son named Aditya, while Negi is married and has brought his wife, Anjali, and two daughters, Lucky and Dhara, with him to Russia. One day while going to school, Lucky\'s bicycle has a flat tire...','/hqBaHsrlg4ZavQWYtxtJpgW4nUk.jpg','2005-04-08',180,'Released','No Time For Love','Lucky: No Time for Love',46423,1.6166,4.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20124,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449393',2.3,1927,'en','Siren','She seems like your ordinary overweight middle-aged wife & mom except her dream of being a rock star still weighs heavy on her soul, \"they\" say she can\'t do it, watch her transform and over come life\'s brutal obstacles to turn her dream into reality.','/if5lsaBEcHvnptrGtVp67eMnISA.jpg','2006-01-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Siren',32310,1.2742,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20125,_binary '\0','/9YoLdWeBSxAdR6BqQ5uS88d3FWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449467',7.4,331033,'en','Babel','Tragedy strikes a married couple vacationing in the Moroccan desert, which jumpstarts an interlocking story involving four different families.','/bZByZbvU7u14WjoUJERqCRW9saN.jpg','2006-10-26',143,'Released','If you want to be understood... listen.','Babel',1164,8.4172,7.168,'PqPNksLZIAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20126,_binary '\0','/ny4gMEiBfIj6RpEySSvIKKgkDCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449471',4.5,9943,'en','Catacombs','A young woman in Paris goes to a party in the enormous labyrinth of limestone tunnels beneath Paris. When she becomes separated from her friends, she is convinced something is chasing her through the dark tunnels.','/j3LWOKFoeKJDn2dHXoJoRWeakRu.jpg','2007-06-01',92,'Released','Below the city of lights exists a world of darkness.','Catacombs',14126,2.2265,4.8,'d771G1b6WB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20127,_binary '\0','/a2oBd4B7x7Di8CVkDGCKcvy4TFm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449487',5.8,41789,'en','Passengers','After a plane crash, a young therapist, Claire, is assigned by her mentor to counsel the flight\'s five survivors. When they share their recollections of the incident -- which some say include an explosion that the airline claims never happened -- Claire is intrigued by Eric, the most secretive of the passengers.','/mUgzf27luTXvxrzH0jKgSNPwhMC.jpg','2008-09-26',93,'Released','The line between this world and the next is about to be crossed','Passengers',13944,4.7841,6.1,'KG7t3xvrqEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20128,_binary '\0','/xVZQKwDglCZhdSVW1xWFxSoDcFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449573',7.7,8212,'ro','Nesfârșit','1999. Kosovo War. In a small Romanian village, the chief of the railway station, who also happens to be a local gangster, stops a NATO train transporting military equipment. Their arrival in this small village dramatically changes its landscape.','/tPvlAyp6ZKoHWyHF4jYzMANHjjO.jpg','2007-06-01',155,'Released',NULL,'California Dreamin\'',24220,1.2827,6.5,'75NoNVMkQwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20129,_binary '\0','/XuvGhhRp3DqpSrD5b0QS1d6CW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449629',5,1366,'th','P','An orphan girl taught magic by her sick grandma must find work in seedy Bangkok, where she encounters a number of unsavory characters. She uses the magical skills her grandmother taught her to her advantage and to increasingly horrific consequences.','/z5CtmnbGyek9Yv40YecPlHXpy3z.jpg','2005-10-07',104,'Released','Innocence can be a dangerous thing to lose.','P',135195,1.7843,5.7,'3ByHsnR2zoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20130,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449662',7.1,1218,'sl','Tu pa tam','Four local boys borrow a lot of money from the local mafia. Incompedent as they are, they loose the money. They have to think of infinite ways to earn and return the amount. In seven days...','/2iNBD0PdUx5zcVLVr9kJ6Z5Ow9r.jpg','2005-01-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Here and There',57139,0.9571,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20131,_binary '\0','/57e5CjqUMIVOYP8hILJcCLDIpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449851',6.6,11586,'fr','La Doublure','Caught by tabloid paparazzi with his mistress Elena, a famous and beautiful fashion model, billionaire Pierre Levasseur tries to avoid a divorce by inventing a preposterous lie. He uses the presence of a passerby in the photo to claim to his wife that it\'s not him Elena is seeing but the other man, one François Pignon. Pignon is a modest little man who works as a parking valet. To make the story convincing, Elena has to move in with Pignon.','/eVP6mln9G4dOoRRrQsY55T0sHOR.jpg','2006-03-29',85,'Released',NULL,'The Valet',21427,3.7264,6,'x_4KXH-AUGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20132,_binary '\0','/zmn7qWSs4JqLAUzxNojS1Lq7ThB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449869',7.3,8208,'ta','சந்திரமுகி','Creepy happenings in an abandoned mansion are attributed to the ghost of an ancient courtesan, back for revenge.','/ro3TcXw9v542zIaOyelysYj3Gi5.jpg','2005-04-14',164,'Released','RAA RAA','Chandramukhi',53122,2.2259,6.829,'QaheOBHOJOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20133,_binary '\0','/b0Prc4rfqYHwYCPfgQnAj0AUAnC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449951',7.6,17147,'ta','கஜினி','After being hit by an iron rod, Sanjay Ramaswamy, a business tycoon, suffers from anterograde amnesia. He is unable to remember anything beyond fifteen minutes. Under such circumstances, he sets out on a quest to find the people who were responsible for his lover Kalpana\'s murder.','/fWCiwGeABg5APrLGHV2IgxoP20N.jpg','2005-10-14',182,'Released',NULL,'Ghajini',69636,1.5367,6.879,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20134,_binary '\0','/dwdH8HykILUADCIupGsqjcq1ygv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449994',7.5,36892,'hi','जोधा अकबर','A sixteenth century love story about a marriage of alliance that gave birth to true love between a Mughal emperor and a Rajput princess.','/gPjgeywFNTlh9IUuXWy85nn4h8J.jpg','2008-02-13',213,'Released','Love knows no religion.','Jodhaa Akbar',14073,2.829,7.296,'5B_X2xOBpFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20135,_binary '\0','/xXABOEnWAtsGmlAhxWbgObWkkt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0449999',6.1,25173,'hi','कभी अलविदा ना कहना','Dev and Maya are both married to different people. Settled into a life of domestic ritual, and convinced that they are happy in their respective relationships, they still yearn for something deeper and more meaningful, which is precisely what they find in each other.','/dkYQgRPuik4FGIUdGGVYGQJWrHa.jpg','2006-08-11',193,'Released','A Love.... That Broke All Relationships','Kabhi Alvida Naa Kehna',14395,2.025,6.5,'dXsEIW_Jc2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20136,_binary '\0','/yzMi5anGh034HO0LDcQNHq5nOYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450121',7.6,2214,'it','Rosso come il cielo','A nearly sightless boy is sent to a school for blind children, where he secretly discovers the possibilities of the recorded sound.','/wE6S0WLuH35yfPA1MvKH4NI78cq.jpg','2006-10-17',96,'Released',NULL,'Red Like the Sky',57965,2.0866,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20137,_binary '\0','/wwOoUAwehV1qJtWeekOb0AG3p4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450158',7,3423,'ru','Статский советник','Third film based on Boris Akunin\'s \"Priklucheniya Erasta Petrovicha Fandorina\" series of novels. On a train from St. Petersburg to Moscow general Khrapov was killed and no one else but Erast Petrovich is under suspicion because the killer pretended to be Fandorin. There are initials BG on the handle of the knife Khrapov was stabbed with, the initials belong to a terrorist organization which keeps both capital cities (Moscow and St. Petersburg) in fear. This time Fandorin is not the only one trying to solve the crime, general Pozharski, a famous detective takes over the investigation...','/uPRGZnY30gVKM2IuRklLR2PVdDD.jpg','2005-04-21',134,'Released',NULL,'The State Counsellor',59529,1.1787,5.6,'eqb7hu0BfYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20138,_binary '\0','/a9t1DRjU04RMzqcp5li9bIA2MaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450188',7.5,94652,'fr','La Môme','From the mean streets of the Belleville district of Paris to the dazzling limelight of New York\'s most famous concert halls, Edith Piaf\'s life was a constant battle to sing and survive, to live and love. Raised in her grandmother\'s brothel, Piaf was discovered in 1935 by nightclub owner Louis Leplee, who persuaded her to sing despite her extreme nervousness. Piaf became one of France\'s immortal icons, her voice one of the indelible signatures of the 20th century.','/3b9DAONAsFRhJKu25R33PE3VwDh.jpg','2007-02-14',140,'Released','The extraordinary story of Edith Piaf.','La Vie en Rose',1407,4.5721,7.366,'ovNIoQn5Tvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20139,_binary '\0','/z7BhlDkhAprUHugZlkVB9TPcB0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450232',6.6,139260,'en','16 Blocks','An aging cop is assigned the ordinary task of escorting a fast-talking witness from police custody to a courthouse, but they find themselves running the gauntlet as other forces try to prevent them from getting there.','/cBLqMVfTZpuKmMQKDLKusb93dbR.jpg','2006-03-01',105,'Released','1 witness… 118 minutes…','16 Blocks',2207,6.9968,6.5,'55nKvGV0APA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20140,_binary '\0','/vffPZUYScdWtGU0UrccFIRX4LbV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450259',8,631397,'en','Blood Diamond','An ex-mercenary turned smuggler. A Mende fisherman. Amid the explosive civil war overtaking 1999 Sierra Leone, these men join for two desperate missions: recovering a rare pink diamond of immense value and rescuing the fisherman\'s son, conscripted as a child soldier into the brutal rebel forces ripping a swath of torture and bloodshed countrywide.','/sYAUuiWpoXGKHxUfHyjTj7Apj2h.jpg','2006-12-08',143,'Released','It will cost you everything.','Blood Diamond',1372,15.8066,7.558,'stEtrTrDlrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20141,_binary '\0','/dF6GNQ0TnZkr1t4wBt36Xc0Pccd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450278',5.9,206417,'en','Hostel','Three backpackers head to a Slovakian city that promises to meet their hedonistic expectations, with no idea of the hell that awaits them.','/dDrtuWUKhgUGp12kgUWuP0NpTdF.jpg','2006-01-06',94,'Released','Welcome to your worst nightmare.','Hostel',1690,9.5058,6,'R0ShE0EbcCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20142,_binary '\0','/dqPZpQy6PJINOJtld17NgIERusH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450314',5.9,71999,'en','Punisher: War Zone','Waging his one-man war on the world of organized crime, ruthless vigilante-hero Frank Castle sets his sights on overeager mob boss Billy Russoti. After Russoti is left horribly disfigured by Castle, he sets out for vengeance under his new alias: Jigsaw. With the \"Punisher Task Force\" hot on his trail and the FBI unable to take Jigsaw in, Frank must stand up to the formidable army that Jigsaw has recruited before more of his evil deeds go unpunished.','/oOvKJgYUIpfswGHAdW6159bPbvM.jpg','2008-12-05',102,'Released','Vengeance has a name.','Punisher: War Zone',13056,9.4843,5.9,'liABMxEvPAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20143,_binary '\0','/qzUT12fLNpp5umxFWffsma1yb07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450326',3.5,2397,'en','Spring Break Shark Attack','A young teenager travels to Florida, unknowing that a group of dangerous tiger sharks are ravaging the beach.','/jqIIwaYI4to46Cc29as0BCECqNO.jpg','2005-03-20',88,'Released','Spring Break. Some come to party. Others come for the buffet.','Spring Break Shark Attack',44732,1.9044,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20144,_binary '\0','/oFAwGYk2SIAnNiHjRiTFONE14kI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450336',5.3,14001,'en','Blood Creek','A man and his brother on a mission of revenge become trapped in a harrowing occult experiment dating back to the Third Reich.','/3qlC48rdEac3w5STSLayC5X8rhP.jpg','2009-10-09',90,'Released','In the 1930s, Adolf Hitler believed the occult held the secret to immortality. Almost a century later, the nightmare has awakened.','Blood Creek',30685,3.8023,5.315,'bllPxoe-7to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20145,_binary '\0','/2AnWtbrtWgZBiul29Fe3ArddSsv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450340',6.4,32570,'en','Unknown','Five men wake up in a locked-down warehouse with no memory of who they are. They are forced to figure out who is good and who is bad to stay alive.','/h6hz8LjwyYM0jrz6pxAYicwwIrj.jpg','2006-11-03',85,'Released',NULL,'Unknown',9828,5.1966,6.2,'qRYPZvHPBg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20146,_binary '\0','/7t1ZMaVY92KqkaxJtRO89tARg6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450345',3.8,75522,'en','The Wicker Man','A sheriff investigating the disappearance of a young girl from a small island discovers there\'s a larger mystery to solve among the island\'s secretive, neo-pagan community.','/xsHrmfgDcEk5fGhSiieKvrDuofq.jpg','2006-08-31',102,'Releas