ist Giph has a hot girlfriend, doctor and model Samarinde. His crude, domineering and progressive mother Ria\'s suffering an incurable decease in which she suffers from paraplegia. Her inevitably ensuing death is brought forward with euthanasia. Giph is struggling to handle the situation with his mother. Shortly after his mother has passed he away, he decides to join his fun loving friends on La Palma for a holiday. There Samarinde tells her boyfriend she\'s expecting his baby','/sBtpSov672VWwCSywStUpBrmkpl.jpg','2006-03-09',110,'Released',NULL,'A Thousand Kisses',57768,1.4042,5.783,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20151,_binary '\0','/49KHGWe8ycoweTDlqkBUGvsGu7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450450',7.5,3425,'ru','Итальянец','Set in 2002, an abandoned 5-year-old boy living in a rundown orphanage in a small Russian village is adopted by an Italian family.','/eHZ51evGQBu6TEHRLMiHa84Gg8K.jpg','2005-09-21',90,'Released',NULL,'The Italian',17388,1.3063,6.796,'RPQTJ6Ugs6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20152,_binary '\0','/9Gz1nN5qRIyAzdLYSbJ9Fy4pqAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450455',4.9,1618,'en','Life Is Ruff','Calvin Wheeler is a scheming 13-year-old boy with everything going for him, except for an original issue of his precious comic book collection. When a prized show-dog chases him down while skateboarding one day, his owner inadvertently convinces him to adopt and train a dog of his own. However the only one available, is an uncouth stray Labrador/St. Bernard-mix named Tyko from a local animal shelter, who proves to be more than anybody can handle.','/qsEratlHP5R0o5YgczNHyXeo9Mz.jpg','2005-01-13',84,'Released',NULL,'Life Is Ruff',160155,2.6738,5.5,'Jyo3ar9sWSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20153,_binary '\0','/cqRtRIiG7CeUOZioclZzxnMBzPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450470',5.7,1406,'pt','Odete','After breaking up with her boyfriend, a woman named Odete descends into madness and claims to be pregnant with the child of her neighbour Pedro, who died in a car crash and is mourned by his boyfriend Rui.','/1JiLP1UuluW12k10asgdWeO6uyV.jpg','2005-05-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Two Drifters',12221,1.9995,6.2,'ImGZ8CoPSgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20154,_binary '\0','/snDJM2DH7RiQszu7Eoc8kJKYGlu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450506',5.7,1705,'en','Suburban Mayhem','Can you really get away with murder? Welcome to the world of Katrina, a 19-year-old single mum who\'s planning to do just that. Katrina lives in a world of petty crime, fast cars, manicures and blow-jobs. A master manipulator of men living at home with her father in suburban Golden Grove, Katrina will stop at nothing to get what she wants - even murder.','/3qsFZSW9eNAWpbX1E8t8Z6DVJls.jpg','2006-10-26',95,'Released','There are some things in life you can\'t control. Fame, Lust, Murder, ... And Katrina.','Suburban Mayhem',13943,1.2634,5.6,'NF1jOHluc7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20155,_binary '\0','/oftbHG2igMwfHuQM8ss5xR3S0bI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450664',6.7,3350,'fr','Je vous trouve très beau','Aymé Pigrenet, a recently widowed farmer, is eager to find a new wife to help him run his farm. Desperate, he seeks the aid of a local matchmaker who suggest that he go to Romania to find a new wife. There he meets Elena.','/8tn9qK9ulhBaI0SBQFaj0a2deBY.jpg','2005-11-07',97,'Released',NULL,'You Are So Beautiful',10268,1.9556,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20156,_binary '\0','/tpQDKZkEPHejcuvQl3KHQGZPP9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450680',6.5,3397,'fr','Flandres','André Demester secretly and painfully loves Barbe, his childhood friend, accepting from her the little that she gives him. He leaves home to be a soldier in a war in a far off land. Barbarity, camaraderie and fear turn him into a warrior. As the seasons go by, Barbe, alone and wasting away, waits for the soldiers to return. Will Demester’s boundless love for Barbe save him?','/qY8n5t12OBfiQI1X2rI4YrYxVoA.jpg','2006-08-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Flanders',36143,1.3006,6.3,'P9j1fTE414o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20157,_binary '\0','/9f3YCfDNLVWeBBPWDDSklyCtKQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450827',6.1,1930,'es','Cuento de Navidad','Cubelles, Spain, Christmas 1985. Five friends make an unexpected discovery in the forest: a woman disguised as Santa Claus trapped in a deep hole dug in the middle of nowhere.','/xQyNqN5coVrmUCPgmrOMmMg53Ba.jpg','2005-10-27',75,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Tale',75725,1.8302,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20158,_binary '\0','/8RblQZM2gy2K8AQ2RXP7UzEW8jW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450843',5.6,9999,'fr','Sheitan','A group of young people leave a disco and bump into a shepherd who is ready to spend his night worshipping Satan.','/f10fK5ELawYMG3VOLwD2I5MdMEF.jpg','2006-02-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Satan',13742,2.1525,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20159,_binary '\0','/cBpCtxMAViuM0uZYjD0yoRmAkgQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450972',6,4111,'en','As You Like It','Witty, playful and utterly magical, the story is a compelling romantic adventure in which Rosalind and Orlando\'s celebrated courtship is played out against a backdrop of political rivalry, banishment and exile in the Forest of Arden - set in 19th-century Japan.','/628YkM5wHmunTdXANWgJEJYbFdf.jpg','2006-09-01',127,'Released','Romance...or something like it.','As You Like It',19103,3.0122,5.8,'4JLw0kXO2N4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20160,_binary '\0','/vQPnfxzlsK2nQMHnfk8d2p5PF4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0450996',5.7,1802,'th','บอดี้การ์ดหน้าเหลี่ยม','Wong, bodyguard to a tycoon, is fired by his boss\'s son after he fails to save his boss. Now, the assassins are after the son, who takes refuge in a slum. Wong, meanwhile, tackles the villain\'s goons.','/u4Rjt0slnaWmptbHKrUoKWIxmmb.jpg','2004-01-21',97,'Released','Thailand\'s top bodyguard.','The Bodyguard',20256,3.2071,5.9,'lm4jLmw2-KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20161,_binary '\0','/3K0pO55d8GDUyQoyIRVBznKEKFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451010',5.4,4003,'ja','着信アリ2','A Japanese restaurant cook/owner dies after answering his daughter\'s cellphone. Other people are getting strange, same ringtone calls as well and dying painfully. It happened in Taiwan as well. Can the police stop it if it\'s a ghost?','/mbEtfU4WcwKG84dHpSPJV9KZTqq.jpg','2005-02-05',105,'Released','Let\'s play.','One Missed Call 2',14021,2.5182,6,'NVifnITGovU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20162,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451021',7.2,2677,'en','The Comedians of Comedy','The Comedians of Comedy is an occasional stand-up comedy tour featuring Patton Oswalt, Zach Galifianakis, Brian Posehn and Maria Bamford that was documented in a 2005 film and 2005 Comedy Central television series of the same name, both directed by Michael Blieden.','/z2iX8rxrFL3HAr8dWTbISJXZqM4.jpg','2005-03-01',103,'Released',NULL,'The Comedians of Comedy',16452,1.6609,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20163,_binary '\0','/5CPRHkV4L9OFGhkWGQ9Qz6gaEIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451038',5.5,1295,'en','The Derby Stallion','An alcoholic former horse-trainer perceives in a fifteen-year-old boy a unique gift of horsemanship and makes it possible for the boy to conceive his dream and pursue it.','/r9HYV3P2bWp9twNKmLDumyPgRn5.jpg','2005-07-04',98,'Released','The heart of a boy. The soul of a champion. The friendship of a lifetime.','The Derby Stallion',19183,1.8227,5.9,'X7xv_1aC0jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20164,_binary '\0','/f5hvI8WYL6p6diOf33iPdSK9Gh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451041',7.3,1347,'en','Dope Sick Love','Two heroin-addicted couples lead hard and stressful lives on the streets of New York.','/vJxd79LNFVsjVaLuxmNM0iii2SS.jpg','2005-03-1