51102',5.9,3068,'en','The Lost','A charismatic psycho suspected of killing two innocent campers in a cold-blooded double homicide grows increasingly unstable as his suburban empire starts to crack at the foundations.','/7umv0xy6252iBzQz4OgbII8xnQw.jpg','2006-03-11',119,'Released','What\'s the worst thing you\'ve ever done?','The Lost',15711,1.8239,5.4,'4wdGCshcPoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20169,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451109',1.6,2760,'en','The Maize: The Movie','A father\'s psychic abilities are put to the test when his two daughters are trapped inside of a corn maze haunted by the spirits of two young girls who disappeared a year earlier.','/emReYRfiMFTmI46Eoncp35HKYVg.jpg','2004-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Dark Harvest II: The Maize',31255,0.6701,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20170,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451130',4.9,3070,'en','Moussaka & Chips','Getaway driver Miles Foster is placed in witness protection after the murder of his friend Andres by Astin Brody, a shady underworld boss. Miles is hidden on the Greek Island of Zanthi with a recently graduated female MI6 officer, Charlotte Green. Shalom Godsall, Brody\'s disgruntled number two, has recommended two Irish assassins take out Miles, much to their surprise as a father and son assassin team they h ave a terrible track record. Godsall, however, is working with American secret service to oust his rival Astin Brody and take the top job. Nothing is going to plan; the assassins have found their target and are getting close. Miles and Charlotte are not getting on at all and the special relationship between the British and American secret service is at breaking point.','/vrrB2nWJzgU3mp2aPWIfDFy6bKp.jpg','2005-11-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Moussaka & Chips',939817,0.8991,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20171,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451134',3.2,1583,'en','Mustang Sally\'s Horror House','Looking for a little fun before resuming another grueling semester at college, six buddies visit Mustang Sally\'s whorehouse, where they expect the madam to introduce them to the girls of their dreams. As it turns out, however, the madam has more on her mind than passion, and the lads soon find themselves lured into a trap from which they may never escape in this campy horror treat starring Elizabeth Daily, Lindsey Labrum and Mark Parrish.','/8O4knPXkBVmuZtmrmO2gapa5eqs.jpg','2006-06-18',85,'Released','Sex you\'ll die for.','Mustang Sally\'s Horror House',64771,1.2573,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20172,_binary '\0','/iuZN4EzpPl9D21cteLyKRPQRoCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451176',6.9,4416,'es','Quinceañera','As Magdalena\'s 15th birthday approaches, her simple, blissful life is complicated by the discovery that she\'s pregnant. Kicked out of her house, she finds a new family with her great-granduncle and gay cousin.','/kJv276uU9K0Z9MRhz6F3BEEetEO.jpg','2006-06-05',90,'Released','Life\'s no walk in the park','Quinceañera',64499,1.3763,6.3,'9fe2RTwHX7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20173,_binary '\0','/5VfLKiLh4dvsORsTif710t10yeW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451180',7.7,2295,'en','I\'m Going to Tell You a Secret','A documentary that follows Madonna on her 2004 Re-Invention World Tour.','/4fOvOXO9cKmnsXcwAIFgO92NCD.jpg','2005-10-18',128,'Released','\"No matter what you did, no matter who you are, no matter where you\'ve come from, you can always change, become a better version of yourself.\"','I\'m Going to Tell You a Secret',36802,3.1355,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20174,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451223',5.9,2753,'en','Sweetzer','Dumped by a vindictive girlfriend (Jen Dede), broke and in need of therapy, Cooper (Wayne Reynolds) joins a support group for sex addicts. With the help of Mitch (Bryan Callen), a group member with a dark secret, and obscure celebrity Sergio (Jorge Garcia), Cooper tries to pick up the pieces. With a little luck, he may even get another chance at love. Reynolds wrote and directed this comic drama, based on his one-man play.',NULL,'2007-08-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Sweetzer',278663,1.3087,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20175,_binary '\0','/dkWllC5DOST1hfCwDjHp7JTyLop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451262',2.8,1833,'en','Within','In a Asian desert, a team of explorers learn of a newly discovered cave system and set out to explore it. However as soon as they begin the descent, it becomes clear that this was a secret that should have remained below the surface.','/lVEnRvjpWMPplRN5EX28cyNnVZk.jpg','2005-10-30',95,'Released',NULL,'Within',10042,1.6453,3.3,'yletMw5FdPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20176,_binary '\0','/AaABt75ZzfMGrscUR2seabz4PEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451279',7.3,741675,'en','Wonder Woman','An Amazon princess comes to the world of Man in the grips of the First World War to confront the forces of evil and bring an end to human conflict.','/v4ncgZjG2Zu8ZW5al1vIZTsSjqX.jpg','2017-05-30',141,'Released','Power. Grace. Wisdom. Wonder.','Wonder Woman',297762,21.5478,7.2,'1Q8fG0TtVAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20177,_binary '\0','/29Sj4r7lIRY27ZS5pfL8U0wmoMr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451284',3.2,4290,'en','Young, Single & Angry','Since girlhood, TAYLOR has believed that love and marriage are the most important events in every woman\'s life. Now she\'s 35 and single with no prospects in sight. As Taylor and her friends wade through the mire of the L.A. dating pool, they realize a lot more is involved in finding the right mate as they meet co-dependents, addicts and sexual deviants. As they hit bottom, thinking there maybe no happiness in their future, a trap door opens leading them to the discovery that they can find happiness within themselves.','/wO1FAcxyyC7iG43qLTevjD8PaBk.jpg','2006-01-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Young, Single & Angry',35367,0.971,4.1,'NmnfYB2dLM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20178,_binary '\0','/jMSJLvhyotHX6BYx0KVYIBxIVON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451631',7.4,5669,'hi','Apaharan','Story of a tumultuous and complex relationship between a father (Mohan Agashe) and son (Ajay Devgan), set against the backdrop of a thriving kidnapping industry in the Hindi heartland of Bihar.','/gZbY2w5NKuJZ8XBmIPZnG2P7X5L.jpg','2005-12-02',173,'Released',NULL,'Apaharan',28805,1.3906,6.275,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20179,_binary '\0','/gfJ1W2znqErRYCHey4e0mjw55tZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451787',5.6,5446,'hi','क्योंकि','After accidentally killing his fiancee, Anand becomes insane and is admitted to a psychiatric hospital. Tanvi, his doctor, falls in love with him, but her father does not approve, given his past.','/j77NdrLrVhyt0e0enEG0ZzWP2v6.jpg','2005-11-03',160,'Released',NULL,'Kyon Ki...',161212,1.6866,5.711,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20180,_binary '\0','/xnzvooJi1iY2MMIFs8KcAy7a18o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451803',5.6,6625,'hi','मैंने प्यार क्यूँ किया','Dr Samir is an absolute charmer when it comes to women, but he poses as a married man to keep them at bay. Love becomes a three-ring-circus for him after he ends up tangled in his web of lies with his girlfriend Sonia and pretend wife Naina.','/uV0P65zblJdjxeazaC4WC9UE6Ig.jpg','2005-07-15',145,'Released','Liar liar, love\'s on fire.','Maine Pyaar Kyun Kiya?',39217,1.6049,5.336,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20181,_binary '\0','/9NUOLAYVn2ulGWcypKr2rIS61UR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451829',6.6,2863,'ja','ナイスの森〜The First Contact〜','An outrageous collection of surreal, short attention span non-sequiturs largely revolving around Guitar Brother, his randy older sibling, and the pair\'s portly Caucasian brother.','/XuQF2LZH3duTm156vdqGPjQ3PA.jpg','2005-10-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Funky Forest: The First Contact',21136,2.3998,6.424,'wJaFdt4S8Yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20182,_binary '\0','/fIyvpyKBqO7uk3BkFEQTfdsbcS3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451833',6.6,14268,'hi','No Entry','Kishan has always been faithful to his wife, Kaajal, who constantly suspects him of having affairs. Meanwhile, Kishan\'s friend Prem frequently cheats on his doting wife, Pooja, without getting caught, incurring the disapproval of Kishan and photographer Sunny. Tired of listening to his moralistic pals, Prem introduces Kishan to Bobby, an attractive escort.','/h1ErmexOhpRsVYPil9PQOJVRu2j.jpg','2005-08-26',164,'Released',NULL,'No Entry',20390,1.7887,6,'b7nWm0N6PrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20183,_binary '\0','/1Vx4ewBt7ezYaEdjkeAgG64myOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451845',6.4,2613,'ja','男たちの大和／YAMATO','Directed by Junya Sato and based on a book by Jun Henmi, \"Yamato\" has a framing story set in the present day and uses flashbacks to tell the story of the crew of the World War II Japanese battleship Yamato. The film was never released in the United States, where reviewers who have seen it have compared the military epic to \"Titanic\" and \"Saving Private Ryan.\"','/tTCUAlGakuDkbltkSEEzUUOR7gL.jpg','2005-12-17',143,'Released',NULL,'Yamato',19659,2.8492,5.5,'NShzds5MIi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20184,_binary '\0','/7WoyOMp0wORdgYJimHeg0XuNaTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451850',6.4,15333,'hi','पहेली','Kishanlal marries the beautiful Lachchi, but the day after the wedding, he leaves on business for five years. When Kishanlal reappears only a few days later, Lachchi is delighted, but this new Kishanlal is in fact a spirit who has taken the form of Lachchi\'s husband, after having seen her by chance and fallen in love with her. Four years later, the real Kishanlal returns and the townsfolk must determine who is who.','/1oQ8mBfBKcVT758y1949ULkSXER.jpg','2005-06-24',141,'Released',NULL,'Paheli',33081,2.2217,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20185,_binary '\0','/ldFVwsPK3f3uFROxQzqfEXXOSV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451919',7.4,8415,'hi','सोचा ना था','Viren and Aditi refuse an arranged marriage and that creates a rift between their families. But when their friendship turns into love, it leads to chaos!','/8HbdfX0FGnQUQ8WtGWY5zLZB4lH.jpg','2005-03-04',145,'Released',NULL,'Socha Na Tha',21555,1.3357,5.888,'3DNs99fqfes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20186,_binary '\0','/jaVCJ1d8RrWUwrKVs8cYLzgUisq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451954',5.9,2169,'ja','東京ゾンビ','Two Japanese friends accidentally kill their boss and dump his remains in Black Fuji, a mountain/landfill hybrid. This leads to poor results when the chemicals of the landfill mix with the corpse (and many other corpses) to give rise to a zombie infestation in Tokyo.','/egyTHTGRyke8gTH7eYoEloqGADM.jpg','2005-12-10',104,'Released','We Will Protect The Future!','Tokyo Zombie',27843,1.4965,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20187,_binary '\0','/eetNZTQP2D83MerFEyBuYWlwwNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451966',7.6,2699,'es','El violín','In an unnamed Latin American country that closely resembles Mexico, the government fights a rural insurgency with torture, assault, rape, and murder. Soldiers descend on a town, cutting off the rebels from their cache of ammunition hidden in a field. A family of grandfather, son, and grandson are among the rebels in the hills. The grandfather, with his violin over his shoulder, tries to pass the checkpoint, ostensibly to tend his corn crop. The commanding officer lets him pass but insists on a daily music lesson.','/iMTKKdZIwRxIB9LflUfgUUgVIFD.jpg','2005-03-11',98,'Released',NULL,'The Violin',68259,1.2878,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20188,_binary '\0','/8QXxhlTmbXaDvi1nMFNV8EnwbbW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451983',5.6,2624,'hi','ज़हर','Siddharth and Sonia are happily married until Anna walks into Siddharth\'s life. Things go from bad to worse, when Anna gets killed and Siddharth finds himself sinking in troubled waters.','/ch9QmFsEmCKDvEWrDDY0jYCB8WM.jpg','2005-03-25',132,'Released',NULL,'Zeher',69346,1.3752,5.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20189,_binary '\0','/1Vlvu2CQZm2M9VLLj5CoDIm9d1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0451998',3.2,1849,'en','Absolute Zero','INTER SCI climatologist Dr. David Kotzman has evidence that a shift in the Earth\'s polarity triggered the last Ice Age...in a single day. Now, it\'s happening again, and there\'s no time to escape. As the temperature plummets, Miami is blasted with snow and ice. Evacuation routes are jammed. The only chance David, his old flame Bryn, and a few other hopeful survivors have is to hole themselves up in a special chamber at INTER SCI. A desperate race for survival is ignited as nature\'s fury rages and the temperature plunges toward -459.67° F...ABSOLUTE ZERO!','/53me8imWkUXeO95pL12LK1V4Rav.jpg','2006-03-01',86,'Released','A sudden 90 degree shift in Earth\'s magnetic pole plunges the equator into the deepest freeze possible - absolute zero. Florida has four hours before becoming an arctic tundra.','Absolute Zero',25012,1.8737,5,'rD_YrFnxR1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20190,_binary '\0','/4ojgIfQR9nAgUnO2ZbkgOVdvTWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452032',5.8,1518,'sv','Kocken','1969. A young chef takes a job on a ship with a friend. However, there they have to cope with the dangerous daily routine in the kitchen under a domineering head chef.','/dGo9QvOXFiQOcGobsBvlpIdpoKr.jpg','2005-02-25',116,'Released',NULL,'Kocken',35646,0.8249,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20191,_binary '\0','/19SRSM2ybfVpCBxBFLXwyD18WkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452039',7.7,12313,'ja','マインド・ゲーム','Nishi is a loser who has a crush on his childhood girlfriend. After an encounter with the Japanese mafia, he journeys to heaven and back, and ends up trapped in an even more unlikely place.','/e5mV1iVcjg7nkpJrskQOnFCR4H9.jpg','2004-08-07',103,'Released','This Story Has Never Ended.','Mind Game',21712,3.4884,7.5,'2fmmCsyK1dY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20192,_binary '\0','/qJtWFsJI9l6QqjLL0LgoSIypi3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452580',7.1,1723,'de','Im Winter ein Jahr','A renowned artist must uncover a young dancer\'s secrets in order to truly capture her likeness for a commissioned work.','/yPQwdxT2kHeJKtIERIGVFFUgstD.jpg','2008-11-13',129,'Released',NULL,'A Year Ago in Winter',8888,1.9262,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20193,_binary '\0','/kaVBHYKI329XiHh8eM5T7sLwPyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452592',5.6,11451,'en','Borderland','Three college students, Phil, Ed, and Henry take a road trip into Mexico for a week of drinking and carefree fun only to have Phil find himself a captive of a group of satanic Mexican drug smugglers who kill tourists and whom are looking for a group of new ones to prepare for a sacrifice.','/27DKHSvO9rF17cr7qRuGIYNZvSy.jpg','2007-11-09',105,'Released','The Devil\'s Playground is Just Around The Corner','Borderland',13548,2.6443,5.599,'p_zQfVepveQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20194,_binary '\0','/tukmcuDcTgFesqveQQWKhKXKEzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452594',5.8,148183,'en','The Break-Up','Pushed to the breaking-up point after their latest \'why can\'t you do this one little thing for me?\' argument, Brooke calls it quits with her boyfriend Gary. What follows is a hilarious series of remedies, war tactics, overtures and undermining tricks – all encouraged by the former couple\'s friends and confidantes …and the occasional total stranger! When neither ex is willing to move out of their shared apartment, the only solution is to continue living as hostile roommates until one of them reaches breaking point.','/ghCLIPRZNAndBoIZJ8f7lN5Mlly.jpg','2006-06-01',106,'Released','…pick a side.','The Break-Up',9767,10.3335,5.905,'SfTaJUh3_J4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20195,_binary '\0','/20KvYMRLJwFDDX6vbjZbCVzUPv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452598',5.6,67673,'en','Cheaper by the Dozen 2','The Baker family, while on vacation, find themselves in competition with a rival family of eight children.','/wD68dEtcKuboxd8bhbqiTTxn6cX.jpg','2005-12-21',94,'Released','Same Big Family... Even Bigger Adventure.','Cheaper by the Dozen 2',9641,8.2519,6.2,'KtrAqLXR2jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20196,_binary '\0','/5mbFEJStH59cNFcF7VkRgsSxMqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452608',6.4,229920,'en','Death Race','Terminal Island, New York: 2020. Overcrowding in the US penal system has reached a breaking point. Prisons have been turned over to a monolithic Weyland Corporation, which sees jails full of thugs as an opportunity for televised sport. Adrenalized inmates, a global audience hungry for violence and a spectacular, enclosed arena come together to form the \'Death Race\', the biggest, most brutal event.','/8ASwIBJSyUXUdlPLVjExnOghBar.jpg','2008-08-22',105,'Released','Get ready for a killer ride.','Death Race',10483,17.7937,6.3,'C8bxcJZrus0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20197,_binary '\0','/r9qIuaPPJQuuNvGQGKHjmDxntsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452623',7.6,313549,'en','Gone Baby Gone','When 4 year old Amanda McCready disappears from her home and the police make little headway in solving the case, the girl\'s aunt, Beatrice McCready hires two private detectives, Patrick Kenzie and Angie Gennaro. The detectives freely admit that they have little experience with this type of case, but the family wants them for two reasons—they\'re not cops and they know the tough neighborhood in which they all live.','/5BXDhjKZ4AL9VPxcygdG3oL60GP.jpg','2007-09-18',113,'Released','Everyone wants the truth... until they find it.','Gone Baby Gone',4771,10.5922,7.306,'itPTyd3DkEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20198,_binary '\0','/vr9xAWJeIkYJWAYmIov5WNHEAf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452624',6,27095,'en','The Good German','An American journalist arrives in Berlin just after the end of World War Two. He becomes involved in a murder mystery surrounding a dead GI who washes up at a lakeside mansion during the Potsdam negotiations between the Allied powers. Soon his investigation connects with his search for his married pre-war German lover.','/3LjHC2CWDkzoiPehf3GViujws0.jpg','2006-12-15',108,'Released','If war is Hell, then what comes after?','The Good German',182,4.6512,5.8,'z9pLfBQfwhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20199,_binary '\0','/5R4kLw5lxeiwX5hZfspK3YLg6wp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452625',5.6,99989,'en','Good Luck Chuck','Cursed since childhood, dentist Charlie Logan cannot find the right woman. Even worse, he learns that each of his ex-girlfriends finds true love with the man she meets after her relationship with him ends. Hearing of Charlie\'s reputation as a good-luck charm, women from all over line up for a quick tryst. But when Charlie meets the woman of his dreams, he must find a way to break the curse or risk losing her to the next man she meets.','/b2VgUoXR9iAtAf8nA0mvdTr7cOt.jpg','2007-09-21',96,'Released','He has to break his curse before she breaks his heart.','Good Luck Chuck',10030,11.7008,5.938,'AG6kMQuTyX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20200,_binary '\0','/sKM74o0O7dJLAtOI1jjtBXrHVs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452634',6.8,1232,'en','In a Day','A young woman spends a curiously unpredictable day with a stranger.','/rzOKwuenTBuq57eHeO9dfuyKUIv.jpg','2006-03-08',81,'Released','...anything can happen.','In a Day',41163,0.9115,7.5,'iXnRT3pv0eU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20201,_binary '\0','/lQgsnfkTGA8RXaoBEQ4oMtbJhIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452637',5.5,108541,'en','Lady in the Water','Apartment building superintendent Cleveland Heep rescues what he thinks is a young woman from the pool he maintains. When he discovers that she is actually a character from a bedtime story who is trying to make the journey back to her home, he works with his tenants to protect his new friend from the creatures that are determined to keep her in our world.','/ddNmoSy1Jd3PBF5XDZvrrBIfrja.jpg','2006-07-19',110,'Released','Time is running out for a happy ending.','Lady in the Water',9697,7.9268,5.6,'cT8qbVVU4HI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20202,_binary '\0','/on5Tlan06ZjetNN4pPw1RWfDlKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452640',3.7,1493,'en','Locusts','Dr. Maddy Rierdon, an investigator for the Department of Agriculture, is the only person who can protect America from a deadly breed of bioengineered locusts.','/ttF41Or3vKD4h50VPFfhK3cAwa6.jpg','2005-04-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Locusts',90831,1.8214,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20203,_binary '\0','/4x8R5fbLySPnSB1RchwExdN5wip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452643',6.1,15168,'en','Love and Other Disasters','Flighty Emily \"Jacks\" Jackson works for the British edition of Vogue magazine. Rather than pursue a relationship, Jacks regularly hooks up with her devoted ex-boyfriend, James Wildstone, and lives with Peter Simon, a gay screenwriter. When Jacks meets Argentinian photographer\'s assistant Paolo Sarmiento, she assumes he is gay and tries to bring him and Peter together, unaware that Paolo is straight and in love with her.','/A0bXqv83sOVBnDyFGQCDeEWb0Os.jpg','2006-09-09',91,'Released','A comedy that proves love is blind.','Love and Other Disasters',6641,4.5724,5.8,'9qmiH4ROTtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20204,_binary '\0','/oGEZcAYqevJvRVqZvu3ulZ1w5n9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452660',6.5,4542,'en','One Last Thing...','Sixteen-year-old Dylan is dying of cancer. When a charitable organization offers to grant Dylan his final wish, the teen has a surprising request: to meet supermodel Nikki Sinclair. Much to his mother\'s dismay, Dylan, with the help of his best friends, goes to New York to fulfill his dream.','/wjyod5CrKYCZnEGvf8ZkxhLOTk6.jpg','2005-09-12',96,'Released','If you had one last wish...','One Last Thing...',15075,2.1451,6,'mHEtcUiaix0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20205,_binary '\0','/bdCF6PrKfReCTwTLuYh2wriDNVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452668',3.2,2650,'en','Pterodactyl','A dormant volcano deep with the Turkish forest holds within it a deadly secret. Perfectly preserved, a nest of pterodactyl eggs are ready to hatch...','/cSSfDX8ixzA9Yb4nYIwEtqiKxPa.jpg','2004-10-17',89,'Released','Evil is in the air','Pterodactyl',27860,2.33,4.3,'7NFhjR6hYMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20206,_binary '\0','/dKOAAR2DY2zS7rQY2Qo7QO4IN4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452681',4.9,47022,'en','The Santa Clause 3: The Escape Clause','Now that Santa and Mrs. Claus have the North Pole running smoothly, the Counsel of Legendary Figures has called an emergency meeting on Christmas Eve! The evil Jack Frost has been making trouble, looking to take over the holiday! So he launches a plan to sabotage the toy factory and compel Scott to invoke the little-known Escape Clause and wish he\'d never become Santa.','/pvaWMSRzRwtcxyHKNLX6phiQp8d.jpg','2006-11-02',92,'Released','\'Twas the fight before Christmas...','The Santa Clause 3: The Escape Clause',13767,8.2733,5.576,'jpyBrTSUO5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20207,_binary '\0','/3B4DbexR2hXINqJN6LqhmmAaVeS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452694',7.1,167835,'en','The Time Traveler\'s Wife','Due to a genetic disorder, handsome librarian Henry DeTamble involuntarily zips through time, appearing at various moments in the life of his true love, the beautiful artist Clare Abshire.','/J3ewuzQwhFro0pDpdcbZ4j7MYy.jpg','2009-08-14',107,'Released',NULL,'The Time Traveler\'s Wife',24420,11.3821,6.958,'3_8WZxHScMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20208,_binary '\0','/7rTIZCubYsgITs7gZ0ysANb6kOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452702',6.2,114202,'en','Vacancy','A young married couple becomes stranded at an isolated motel and find hidden video cameras in their room. They realize that unless they escape, they\'ll be the next victims of a snuff film.','/1DdfXaXzi1sJysZ800GOUAwlLR4.jpg','2007-04-20',85,'Released','Once you\'ve checked in... The terror begins.','Vacancy',10294,5.5666,6.275,'9DCyrUheIpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20209,_binary '\0','/nmziixsoHkDeP8hSAn6703SbvI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452703',6.8,1534,'en','Walkout','Walkout is the true story of a young Mexican American high school teacher, Sal Castro. He mentors a group of students in East Los Angeles, when the students decide to stage a peaceful walkout to protest the injustices of the public school system. Set against the background of the civil rights movement of 1968, it is a story of courage and the fight for justice and empowerment.','/xOq9pHjNRinPZRTmjbuDUOGsSli.jpg','2006-03-18',110,'Released','Reading. Writing. Revolution.','Walkout',93511,1.7198,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20210,_binary '\0','/8aigoYYf9hN8mUj0S1NCvILcQk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0452971',7.1,8929,'es','AzulOscuroCasiNegro','Jorge feels suffocated by his menial job but can\'t break free of the obligations that keep him stuck — until he meets a woman who shakes his life up.','/oL4Pg64w1IfOTcwzmiRXeGa6iRM.jpg','2006-03-24',105,'Released','If your life is not the color you like... Change it!','Dark Blue Almost Black',3865,1.6574,6.7,'PJmCUvkMnNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20211,_binary '\0','/6yFMU0CrBSBWCbnxPkIj3z2ghFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453047',7.5,3805,'es','Elsa y Fred','When the retired seventy-seven years old hypochondriac widower Fred moves to an apartment in Madrid, his temperamental daughter Cuca has an incident with his next door neighbor, the elder Argentinean Elsa. Later, they meet each other and Elsa seduces Fred with her reckless behavior and view of life and they have a romance.','/4xjfBIP8BCCkKDmSBlAfguUiW8N.jpg','2005-07-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Elsa & Fred',22916,1.7188,7.682,'g39vTGrx3Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20212,_binary '\0','/fTBGgYTuNXXDGclRHquI1tuH35W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453190',7.8,1568,'ta','ராம்','Ram is falsely charged for killing his mother. His neigbours are also called for interrogation. Everyone\'s effort leads to tracking down the real killer.','/x2ABa7za51NlpojRlu2DE3wb3Rc.jpg','2005-03-04',160,'Released',NULL,'Raam',69556,0.8565,7.95,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20213,_binary '\0','/lPjDk0AwYul5Qy0ce8nODW3j7UE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453201',7.4,8253,'ta','சச்சின்','A happy-go-lucky college student falls in love with a beautiful young woman at first sight, but decides to use a unique approach to get close to her, as she has many admirers in the college. How will their relationship evolve?','/9AUF9tuykPsiAkjqewliulPNT4y.jpg','2005-04-14',151,'Released','The Miracle Of Love','Sachein',63641,1.5063,6.643,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20214,_binary '\0','/fUmDeZ2VCdfgj060MNvDVHEdL2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453365',5.5,2427,'fi','FC Venus','Pete is a football enthusiast, who plays as a goalkeeper for FC HeMan, a team playing in the lowest possible league. His girlfriend, Anna, hates the whole sport. Pete and his teammates are planning to travel to watch the Football World Cup held in Germany. Anna is not excited about Pete\'s plan to leave her alone for the summer. Therefore Anna decides to present a challenge to Pete: She will form a team from the wives and girlfriends of the FC HeMan players, and then the women\'s team (FC Venus) would play against FC HeMan. If the women\'s team wins, the men will have to give up football, and if the men\'s team wins, the women will never complain about their hobby.','/6ANEWhwuZV6aNx45gZv0iAsSAcv.jpg','2005-12-30',113,'Released',NULL,'FC Venus',26147,1.8568,5.4,'gTivshmxzQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20215,_binary '\0','/kPeq5cNqpaMEkRhsjxgWlH4zbQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453366',7.7,1907,'lt','Dievų miškas','The story about one man - an artist and an intellectual - who was imprisoned by two brutal regimes, the Nazis and the Soviets. \'The Professor\' is a man who lives by his own personal version of the Ten Commandments. After miraculously surviving imprisonment in a Nazi concentration camp through a bit of ironic fate, he writes a memoir of his life, which becomes the target of the Soviet censors. The so-called \"freedom\" of Communism becomes just as oppressive as the German concentration camp.','/4VCG0WcQNg2oAGTr7TDrEGOICmk.jpg','2005-09-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Forest of the Gods',144570,1.7431,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20216,_binary '\0','/k0tUeAfV591707I9A5Irl702Q8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453383',6.4,11378,'no','Naboer','After Ingrid leaves John, he allows himself to be pulled into a mystical and scary world where it is impossible to separate truth from lies.','/xqS5Y8f6EQy9i9YFuPuTlPRopV4.jpg','2005-03-11',75,'Released','Some doors should never be opened.','Next Door',572,2.8287,6.4,'4d0NHS0TUhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20217,_binary '\0','/gVRNPlvazHGVSoyDLsg54KA19dE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453446',7.2,1743,'en','Alien Planet','The dynamic meeting of solid science and futuristic simulation culminates in a dramatic exploration to another inhabited planet seven light years away. Alien Planet creates a realistic depiction of creatures on another world, where life is possible, if not provable, according to scientists\' theories. Take this fascinating journey created by state-of-the-art animation and photo-realistic effects.','/13cALR5mOLxz4K9kEA6uPmtaHYb.jpg','2005-05-14',94,'Released','TRAVEL 6.5 LIGHT-YEARS TO SEE WHAT SCIENCE PREDICTS IS REALLY OUT THERE.','Alien Planet',18606,2.3432,7.3,'cofrpjJa5pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20218,_binary '\0','/e8FC87nMR1Bv2Q8k79j6cAVcJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453451',6.4,143297,'en','Mr. Bean\'s Holiday','Mr. Bean wins a trip to Cannes where he unwittingly separates a young boy from his father and must help the two reunite. On the way he discovers France, bicycling and true love, among other things.','/bSSx9Sq6irWwN9NTQmoT9KE8kXn.jpg','2007-03-22',90,'Released','Disaster is just a small step away.','Mr. Bean\'s Holiday',1268,13.4271,6.404,'LZfIzJ6XwPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20219,_binary '\0','/uEexAGUv446GTHrn48NteqJzk45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453453',5.9,8922,'en','Beer League','An unemployed slacker inspires his softball teammates to improve their game to avoid getting kicked out of the local league.','/yoB3G8yGNLHdbr4TSKZqRp7UJ72.jpg','2006-09-15',86,'Released','No Gut... No Glory.','Beer League',14137,2.8046,5.146,'AaTvl23xRpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20220,_binary '\0','/mhi2fRCbEXtN43FNiq45WQg0DFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453467',7.1,348267,'en','Déjà Vu','Called in to recover evidence in the aftermath of a horrific explosion on a New Orleans ferry, Federal agent Doug Carlin gets pulled away from the scene and taken to a top-secret government lab that uses a time-shifting surveillance device to help prevent crime.','/eTX6hklzFOiEVqVukNCEedZKhix.jpg','2006-11-22',126,'Released','Déjà vu is thought to be a trick of the mind... but what if it\'s not?','Déjà Vu',7551,12.8677,6.9,'VdCRypsfZDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20221,_binary '\0','/qVrASD7cuRrGryDwhVK6RXlOwMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453494',5.6,9209,'en','Hoot','A young man moves from Montana to Florida with his family, where he\'s compelled to engage in a fight to protect a population of endangered owls.','/99VEv4lpXbV4VF9aWH8lzQaEVVU.jpg','2006-11-03',91,'Released','It\'s time to stand up for the little guys.','Hoot',18276,4.0224,5.6,'HgT_xT587MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20222,_binary '\0','/pVyhl9RWe93ULiSFQS2EC17km6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453533',5,8551,'en','Unrest','A young pathology med student suspects that the spirit of a dead cadaver in the hospital morgue where she works is killing off all those who handle or desecrate the body.','/mQhSNeAZaYpVn2CJwKSnqvM1Ek5.jpg','2006-11-11',88,'Released','The First Film To Use Real Bodies','Unrest',10085,2.6598,5.7,'VUgL_EF8V2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20223,_binary '\0','/8XcPTBlqdxLavdJ52Qh2Jh5mtDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453548',6.7,13465,'en','Snow Angels','Waitress Annie has separated from her suicidal alcoholic husband, Glenn. Glenn has become an evangelical Christian, but his erratic attempts at getting back into Annie\'s life have alarmed her. High school student Arthur works at Annie\'s restaurant, growing closer to a new kid in town, Lila, after class. When Glenn and Annie\'s daughter goes missing, the whole town searches for her, as he increasingly spirals out of control.','/hKtht1ezc31mH1cBIHoDPmScnk9.jpg','2007-03-07',106,'Released','Some will fall. Some will fly.','Snow Angels',14054,2.6108,6.5,'R1MH_8F0A24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20224,_binary '\0','/92mpNNg6v2PN2HN2C2Z4g0v3Tya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453556',6.2,72799,'en','TMNT','After the defeat of their old arch nemesis, The Shredder, the Turtles have grown apart as a family. Struggling to keep them together, their rat sensei, Splinter, becomes worried when strange things begin to brew in New York City.','/4gqJP2kr9dCvCHCrCjtbp1k0SU7.jpg','2007-03-23',87,'Released','A whole new breed of heroes.','TMNT',1273,7.7836,6.212,'Hhrw0JAvIvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20225,_binary '\0','/eyjWwMOgkq4nh0wMtyW8XPJ749H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453562',7.5,109891,'en','42','In 1947, Jackie Robinson becomes the first Black man to play in Major League Baseball facing unabashed racism from the public, the press and other players.','/iZ7jVGQWj3eBUdqwAPUlKk0BaS2.jpg','2013-04-12',128,'Released','In a game divided by color, he made us see greatness.','42',109410,7.1066,7.2,'9d8h6OrPJ5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20226,_binary '\0','/mPytPXwA3KnZkojXDZjwz1Rrf03.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453671',6.8,19624,'hi','गरम मसाला','Photographer and serial womaniser, Mac devises a scheme to keep three airhostesses, who are unaware of each other, as his live-in partners. Everything works fine as long as they only come home every third day. But changing schedules, a jealous friend and his fiancé might just break apart his elaborately structured life of deceit.','/puk8ca4bL9HG1R8BwORif8bHGqY.jpg','2005-11-03',142,'Released',NULL,'Garam Masala',19636,1.6016,6,'qc5yaw9zcS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20227,_binary '\0','/zKZnrVibEVUApzkcdyAZKM2jnwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453729',8.1,18540,'hi','Iqbal','This is all about chasing your dreams, no matter what the obstacles. The story involves a young deaf and dumb boy who is crazy about cricket.','/oPdtscy3BYDsM83wddWkmQxcTEg.jpg','2005-08-26',150,'Released',NULL,'Iqbal',21567,1.2563,7,'VbEISCo8FKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20228,_binary '\0','/nzmJPw9Kj2WfUGZjphWQi7jp1ns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0453740',7.6,1393,'ta','காதல்','Murugan is a diligent scooter mechanic in Madurai, whose life goes on smoothly until a rich schoolgirl named Aishwarya sets her eyes on him. The infatuation reaches dangerous levels when she coaxes Murugan to take her away from the clutches of her family, which has other plans about her future.','/rQlj2nfvkBJLiZA3OTvzZrsjavU.jpg','2004-12-17',150,'Released',NULL,'Kaadhal',79789,0.9151,7.278,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20229,_binary '\0','/xy7lAlRJh3aQCoqjdc5UpOQhaPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454065',7.3,4975,'es','La antena','An entire city has lost its voice. Mr. TV, the owner of the city\'s only television channel, is carrying out a sinister plan to control all of the city\'s inhabitants.','/yzIQjYVETJUVESS7H4ULZXj2gCf.jpg','2007-04-19',99,'Released','In a city without a voice... speaking can be very dangerous','The Aerial',13317,1.1993,7.2,'dMs0n0qUMUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20230,_binary '\0','/zhRCgJJqNyMV3GZjk5YX61IV7SU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454082',4.7,33328,'en','Black Christmas','As the residents of sorority house Pi Kappa Sigma prepare for the festive season, a stranger begins a series of obscene phone calls with dubious intentions...','/4eDKgdHcyIAB5pvGRCjdgFKh3eC.jpg','2006-12-15',92,'Released','Let the slay ride begin.','Black Christmas',9656,4.8601,5.229,'gvLUvfOtstw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20231,_binary '\0','/hA3ZAAzsTYYFim1MRKt0nhnNaxm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454084',6,13010,'en','Blind Dating','Danny is a blind man who does not let his impairment get in the way of living his life to the fullest, except when it comes to love. Danny\'s brother sets him up on a series of blind dates, but all of them go disastrously wrong. Just when Danny is about to give up, he meets Leeza, a nurse who works for Danny\'s doctor. There is just one catch: Leeza, who is from India, is promised to another man.','/ePdwljLE0jm2y1vVsds2nx5hhvH.jpg','2007-04-26',99,'Released','Date at your own risk.','Blind Dating',13162,2.5941,6,'3Xu-wHKdjKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20232,_binary '\0','/2yH3j4wGeTzX8gYeOfhl9PsT9Zm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454224',4.8,6848,'en','Penny Dreadful','Young Penny goes on a retreat with her psychologist; the intention is to help her overcome her phobia, an intense fear of cars. Unexpected events find her in a nightmarish situation where her worst fears come true.','/aHAUNz0qg8wUM9UFiT7rq2wiu50.jpg','2006-11-10',92,'Released','Don\'t forget to breathe...','Penny Dreadful',15543,2.1095,5.6,'HTa32-hUFBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20233,_binary '\0','/cKo6UYuO9oqGw6loxAhotPdFJHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454431',4.8,2474,'hi','Chocolate: Deep Dark Secrets','Pipi and Sim Chopra are accused of several terrorist attacks, and it is up to Advocate Krishan Pundit to prove their innocence.','/dAGpuhiI3kbvc5SAmuf839iaUIe.jpg','2005-09-16',159,'Released',NULL,'Chocolate: Deep Dark Secrets',20296,1.6377,4.1,'ImHeHLSULJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20234,_binary '\0','/uRoJVOxSAdF6Zsa7XcrW0K2qey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454435',6.8,1377,'hi','D','Deshu, a mechanic from Dubai, comes home to Mumbai, and gets embroiled in a crime by accident. The film shows his meteoric rise from common, law-abiding man to underworld kingpin.','/lDL3RikOCwbH6qEUtVHr7HJ6PFy.jpg','2005-06-03',107,'Released','Underworld Badshah','D',97361,1.5521,6.439,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20235,_binary '\0','/8dVKOpBNhI3cUWN0wA3MgWuPTly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454457',5.4,4365,'sv','Frostbiten','After Annika, a medical doctor, gets work at the local hospital, she and her 17-year old daughter Saga move to a small town in northern Sweden. Annika is keen to work with her idol, geneticist Professor Gerhard Beckert. However Beckert\'s sinister past in the Waffen-SS soon catches up with him when a couple of pill-popping interns mistake an experimental vaccine for party drugs. Mayhem ensues as the town\'s teenagers succumb one by one to the mysterious virus.','/uddXdHkiEq6MuzMqcmPHJZ1SokM.jpg','2006-02-24',98,'Released','Dawn is a month away.','Frostbitten',13319,1.7668,5.1,'5UJR8HOa8wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20236,_binary '\0','/9vFMRabZKwF4BTlrIqn7ltaUUMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454776',7.4,26706,'en','Amazing Grace','The true story of William Wilberforce and his courageous quest to end the British slave trade. Along the way, Wilberforce meets intense opposition, but his minister urges him to see the cause through.','/zr48JEuwxcYM03NcdJU6qWMHPtq.jpg','2007-02-23',117,'Released','Behind the song you love is a story you will never forget.','Amazing Grace',15163,3.3484,6.9,'cRuWRy5McCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20237,_binary '\0','/zrc7VsyKahpj0CKmSOUqf2EvL5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454792',6.5,8728,'en','Bubble','Set against the backdrop of a decaying Midwestern town, a murder becomes the focal point of three people who work in a doll factory.','/w56oo9nREcF54sNXVYuE9QxZFjT.jpg','2006-01-27',73,'Released','Another Steven Soderbergh Experience','Bubble',14788,1.5361,6.3,'MvymW83Zlbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20238,_binary '\0','/cI9tb2V8IubIO5rsDNOqcEunAwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454824',6.5,46625,'en','Flyboys','The adventures of the Lafayette Escadrille, young Americans who volunteered for the French military before the U.S. entered World War I, and became the country\'s first fighter pilots.','/xezeqrrno6ytLyLrbTXRGUk4rdu.jpg','2006-09-22',138,'Released','When the world first went to war, they were the first to fly.','Flyboys',9664,4.2433,6.5,'fpIXMVSnsOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20239,_binary '\0','/opmV2ZM7lKnvQHc6fcroUXh8Xba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454839',4.7,3086,'en','Broken','After dating a wonderful man, Hope comes back home, sees her daughter Jennifer and goes to sleep. She wakes-up in the woods with a psychopath...','/fNRu16flw7V19GwxbJSgk2WcvR.jpg','2007-04-12',110,'Released',NULL,'Broken',10041,2.0912,4.7,'7XOExI-RRoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20240,_binary '\0','/vrFI0I3M8ROZduj9XbFDoQKZyao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454841',6.4,197539,'en','The Hills Have Eyes','Based on Wes Craven\'s 1977 suspenseful cult classic, The Hills Have Eyes is the story of a family road trip that goes terrifyingly awry when the travelers become stranded in a government atomic zone. Miles from nowhere, the Carter family soon realizes the seemingly uninhabited wasteland is actually the breeding ground of a blood-thirsty mutant family...and they are the prey.','/2eJL1Ccr1FN3dm9OSDwyd8uaX1b.jpg','2006-03-10',107,'Released','The lucky ones die first.','The Hills Have Eyes',9792,14.751,6.489,'weZ6GEXeYl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20241,_binary '\0','/tOkSenL74N23O4S7wjJSUHz7Aeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454848',7.6,429315,'en','Inside Man','When an armed, masked gang enter a Manhattan bank, lock the doors and take hostages, the detective assigned to effect their release enters negotiations preoccupied with corruption charges he is facing.','/ffMUgkDZICNiyaws1Jkv8qG8uFW.jpg','2006-03-17',129,'Released','It looked like the perfect bank robbery. But you can’t judge a crime by its cover.','Inside Man',388,15.2584,7.409,'4G7n7O5pel0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20242,_binary '\0','/rkFufEtGjbsk2Bzu6Dqyc98RXQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454864',5.5,10817,'en','The Last Winter','In the Arctic region of Northern Alaska, an oil company\'s advance team struggles to establish a drilling base that will forever alter the pristine land. After one team member is found dead, a disorientation slowly claims the sanity of the others as each of them succumbs to a mysterious fear.','/uDHwjlPWcyNEkfgOVwIz3IaUNXC.jpg','2006-09-11',101,'Released','What if mankind only had one season left on Earth?','The Last Winter',15667,2.0494,5.4,'mY_BXNvbr8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20243,_binary '\0','/21YsCNMub5455NQCn3jh9SmRFyG.jpg','2026-10-06 1