TgV0MS6tDkBMQSSitttTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454921',8,631135,'en','The Pursuit of Happyness','A struggling salesman takes custody of his son as he\'s poised to begin a life-changing professional career.','/lBYOKAMcxIvuk9s9hMuecB9dPBV.jpg','2006-12-14',117,'Released','For his son, one man will reach for the impossible.','The Pursuit of Happyness',1402,22.8139,7.882,'DMOBlEcRuw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20248,_binary '\0','/dXzJFYJKz9Wa7YsilBWjB3okMf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454931',6.8,7002,'de','Requiem','Michaela, an epileptic, enrolls in college to study education. She goes off her medication and soon begins hearing voices and seeing apparitions that tell her to avoid religious objects, although she is devoutly Roman Catholic. One priest scoffs at the idea that Michaela could be possessed by demons, but a younger pastor arranges an exorcism for the young woman.','/Aquk2tb8RiU4uWhIGrrr6DDy37Z.jpg','2006-03-02',92,'Released','She claimed she was possessed. There was no way to know for sure.','Requiem',523,4.2844,6.6,'brRQf48QRQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20249,_binary '\0','/bIAxyd6YcVmFXG7CZFFEIHSCA5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454932',5.4,1484,'en','Roman','Roman (Lucky McKee) is a lonely young man who yearns to find love, happiness and companionship. Tormented by his ungrateful co-workers and trapped in a life of tedium as a welder in a local factory, Roman\'s one pleasure is his obsession with the elusive beauty (Kristen Bell) who lives in another apartment in his building complex. When a chance encounter with the young woman goes horribly wrong, a moment of frenzied desperation triggers a chilling turn of events leading to the girl\'s murder. As he teeters between deranged fantasy and cold reality, Roman\'s struggle to hide his grisly secret is further complicated by an eccentric neighbor named Eva (Nectar Rose) who develops an unlikely attraction to Roman and forces herself into his dark and tortured world.','/wjiWS95OglAYSPO1Ky99p3tclw7.jpg','2006-07-07',92,'Released','Sometimes Death Is Not So Natural','Roman',45593,1.6265,4.855,'nMAx9YrNBeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20250,_binary '\0','/9ys3pySjmZiONZWAy8QhOxv5SDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454945',6.4,196605,'en','She\'s the Man','Viola Hastings is in a real jam. Complications threaten her scheme to pose as her twin brother, Sebastian, and take his place at a new boarding school. She falls in love with her handsome roommate, Duke, who loves beautiful Olivia, who has fallen for Sebastian! As if that were not enough, Viola\'s twin returns from London ahead of schedule but has no idea that his sister has already replaced him on campus.','/8exPgs8jLGh26BGSrAyHa9MeFyO.jpg','2006-03-17',105,'Released','Everybody has a secret...','She\'s the Man',9655,15.0779,6.807,'D4OhwrMidSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20251,_binary '\0','/i7qzLQXFvE01f2CULgkdAkBatEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454970',5.4,42653,'en','Turistas','A group of young backpackers\' vacation turns sour when a bus accident leaves them marooned in a remote Brazilian rural area that holds an ominous secret.','/nvQqTMPVL8NDeHKEkzAL0ADIECS.jpg','2006-12-01',93,'Released','There are some places tourists should never go','Turistas',9796,3.793,5.5,'gRu91mkfHh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20252,_binary '\0','/l8GCuwL1mlcPBBZmlu3xbIrUFJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454976',6.7,6900,'en','Maradona by Kusturica','A documentary on Argentinean soccer star Diego Maradona, regarded by many as the world\'s greatest modern player.','/r0JzNHSQNL7ya96bnGSroSNRUwf.jpg','2008-05-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Maradona by Kusturica',8908,1.6508,6.3,'iHOc0Hs3dYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20253,_binary '\0','/1ZyZvbZlvA6fFLWEPmbJ84G3kG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0454987',5.9,27492,'en','Let\'s Go to Prison','When a career criminal\'s plan for revenge is thwarted by unlikely circumstances, he puts his intended victim\'s son in his place by putting him in prison...and then joining him.','/8p64GZR0xEQaAfHY2309ShgtMap.jpg','2006-11-17',89,'Released','Welcome to the slammer.','Let\'s Go to Prison',9809,6.1466,6,'SvLfSSULpEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20254,_binary '\0','/3r6LQd458zAcMJij4uvi2GDT36I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455135',4.6,2235,'cn','見鬼10','Ted, his cousin May, her best friend April and April\'s boyfriend, Kofei take a vacation to Thailand to visit their Thai buddy, Chongkwai, who shows them a book of ten ways to see ghosts. And the game begins.','/kyGFZeCOMylgpEC4LelxAL86Eeo.jpg','2005-03-24',86,'Released','When seeing is never believing...','The Eye 3: Infinity',33723,2.3609,5.1,'SHp8GUAf59k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20255,_binary '\0','/ggDcngtIQVXMQAsK0ucYbmi59Bv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455142',6.6,2050,'fr','Kirikou et les Bêtes sauvages','Kirikou\'s grandfather thinks that the story of Kirikou and The Witch was too short, so he proceeds to explain more about Kirikou\'s accomplishments. We find out how the little boy became a gardener, a detective, a maker of pottery, a merchant, a traveler and a doctor.','/yPWBxCxwMbwdvwcXagHNOPWrCig.jpg','2005-12-07',75,'Released',NULL,'Kirikou and the Wild Beasts',13679,4.6572,6.626,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20256,_binary '\0','/3SgSWsMO9BjOyjh5hLwGY0rnxbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455195',5.9,1337,'cn','三岔口','A cop, a lawyer, and an assassin cross paths after the murder of a federal witness and the kidnapping of a famous pop star.','/pR505fBCoezKBeImYV3cdQEejRo.jpg','2005-04-28',101,'Released',NULL,'Divergence',32164,1.9447,6.5,'el8esPPLD44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20257,_binary '\0','/2G5stKG4wTMsuedjUFdjWZF8y49.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455309',5.9,2057,'ta','ஆறு','A thug, with his partners, is chosen to work for a criminal gang and he becomes the left-hand man of the leader. The leader declares a war against another criminal and the thug has to protect him despite losing his friends.','/ihNGwszP89k2h4OHaYAnePQ15xc.jpg','2005-12-09',168,'Released',NULL,'Aaru',35643,1.0507,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20258,_binary '\0','/cKkYptSq2oO1B5DLFb6C6WEv0ow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455323',6.4,18313,'en','Being Flynn','Working in a Boston homeless shelter, Nick Flynn re-encounters his father, a con man and self-proclaimed poet. Sensing trouble in his own life, Nick wrestles with the notion of reaching out yet again to his dad.','/wL16oLapLVGK9MDdnkvgM9BioXC.jpg','2012-03-02',102,'Released','We\'re All Works In Progress','Being Flynn',78571,3.8561,6.1,'vKYISEQ18gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20259,_binary '\0','/dqSirC5ymrH0eZ6GjQVDHPJIrA5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455326',6.7,14933,'en','Aqua Teen Hunger Force Colon Movie Film for Theaters','An action epic that explores the origins of the Aqua Teen Hunger Force (better known as Master Shake, Frylock, and Meatwad,) who somehow become pitted in a battle over an immortal piece of exercise equipment.','/q3Ln4x4rv4nJsBBfukjvH2wiU28.jpg','2007-04-13',86,'Released',NULL,'Aqua Teen Hunger Force Colon Movie Film for Theaters',13158,4.0696,6.5,'0IOXw6NHCVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20260,_binary '\0','/81kbwVTU6Im3zcSnK0Pp2oP4piN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455362',5.1,15440,'en','The Breed','Brothers John and Matt have inherited an island cabin from their recently deceased uncle. Along with Matt\'s girlfriend, Nicki, and other mutual friends, the siblings travel to the cabin for a relaxing weekend getaway. But, not long after arriving, the group is besieged by ravenous dogs. They watch in horror as another vacationer, Luke, is eaten alive. Soon, they discover a training facility where the dogs have been bred to kill.','/84wIp36RZ1zpVBoJTjwzGjZVRxD.jpg','2006-05-17',90,'Released','Let the manhunt begin.','The Breed',10063,4.0056,5.5,'c7Aer6QJee4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20261,_binary '\0','/9iFRLkf5jzgA636ibRaIexYmpeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455385',6.2,1387,'te','చక్రం','Chakram (Prabhas) is a foreign returnee and has a dream of building a hospital at Pulivendula. He is in love with his colleague, Lakshmi (Asin Thottumkal) who studied with him abroad. But leaves her half-way through after he realizes that he was struck with cancer. Not wanting to tell her, he moves to Hyderabad and stays in place called ‘Sahara Colony’. There, he tries to solve people problem\'s in the colony. Seeing all this, another girl who is also named Lakshmi (Charmy) falls in love with Chakram. The rest is a heart-rending saga of the cancer-struck patient\'s love station.','/kDDXd66Oi3k5v7xkMdWakq9Q6Ky.jpg','2005-03-25',145,'Released',NULL,'Chakram',132437,1.2683,5.438,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20262,_binary '\0','/nQYol95buccUZWF8Kg6BpgauUQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455400',5.8,1446,'en','Comeback Season','First Down. Second Chance. Skylar is a star quarterback of his football team. He\'s got the skills, the looks, and the girls. His next-door neighbor, Walter is a loving husband, good father and all-round decent family man. When their worlds start to crumble they find themselves in jail together and suddenly these former enemies must rely on each other to rebuild their lives...','/ibgZljH0PDLiMquEnKoCm3qauHp.jpg','2006-01-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Comeback Season',14561,1.8822,6.2,'I114Mzw7pYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20263,_binary '\0','/n6wLCq16XxY5p0PG3EWU18LdFAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455407',6.5,138960,'en','The Crazies','Four friends find themselves trapped in their small hometown after they discover their friends and neighbors going quickly and horrifically insane.','/ggtG9DZELyTtM2Y0DRJDOJa5iP8.jpg','2010-02-26',101,'Released','Fear thy neighbor.','The Crazies',29427,8.4334,6.305,'TfeK0aN9w24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20264,_binary '\0','/lrUeu7XMNaKJn6v8ps0DHqUE11L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455499',5,51586,'en','Garfield: A Tail of Two Kitties','Jon and Garfield visit the United Kingdom, where a case of mistaken cat identity finds Garfield ruling over a castle. His reign is soon jeopardized by the nefarious Lord Dargis, who has designs on the estate.','/O2j1bwErQ6bbBVZM5Vxg3Tsoir.jpg','2006-06-15',86,'Released','2 much of a good thing is even better.','Garfield: A Tail of Two Kitties',9513,12.3483,5.608,'1u0rQ7J3oS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20265,_binary '\0','/odYYj1rmqz67NLDdHKiYYGz3dsk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455507',6.8,5125,'en','The God Who Wasn\'t There','Did Jesus exist? This film starts with that question, then goes on to examine Christianity as a whole.','/ySkzTtTuQDJ4Nzl1fC7NxsIUL9A.jpg','2005-05-21',61,'Released',NULL,'The God Who Wasn\'t There',13014,1.4792,6.1,'73_IjNPmIEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20266,_binary '\0','/vak4IwE0sZWBUEpmcoJJWYWXRgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455538',6.4,72307,'en','How to Lose Friends & Alienate People','Sidney Young is a down-on-his-luck journalist. Thanks to a stint involving a pig and a glitzy awards ceremony, Sidney turns his fortunes around, attracting the attention of Clayton Harding, editor of New York-based glossy magazine \'Sharps\', and landing the holy grail of journalism jobs. The Brit jets off to the Big Apple and moves from one blunder to the next.','/8Xd1mO861aK2OirTbxZrODNhihW.jpg','2008-10-02',110,'Released','He\'s across the pond, and out of his depth.','How to Lose Friends & Alienate People',13092,5.4288,6,'A37JEYMwgRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20267,_binary '\0','/a8ROQ0ATsV0y92D0kplsIqdXxCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455583',2.8,2427,'en','Komodo vs. Cobra','A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist\'s famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island. They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities. Upon arrival, however, they find no one. They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr. Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the island is dead, including her father. Richardson\'s team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own. They wanted to test the compound\'s effects on animals, and proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.','/2dLwpe18MC3nIF5MmkWuB8waba9.jpg','2005-08-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Komodo vs. Cobra',28509,1.9118,4.1,'FMJnoWe24B0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20268,_binary '\0','/ihX7NkakPzgf7y0W09xQex1bsQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455584',5.8,4624,'en','The Kovak Box','David Norton is used to being in control. As a best-selling author, he decides the fate of his characters, their lives and their deaths. But what happens when his fictional world becomes all too real?','/sUrutQD8Xaaf1byXupXDCVPq1lv.jpg','2006-07-18',102,'Released',NULL,'The Kovak Box',13686,3.1874,5.8,'OORhnFPFEq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20269,_binary '\0','/tO40eTUxPoKrmMKBDWViA9pVYg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455590',7.6,207292,'en','The Last King of Scotland','Young Scottish doctor, Nicholas Garrigan decides it\'s time for an adventure after he finishes his formal education, so he decides to try his luck in Uganda, and arrives during the downfall of President Obote. General Idi Amin comes to power and asks Garrigan to become his personal doctor.','/n1CgN2mS7RSxHhv2R1DdisYDvT6.jpg','2006-09-27',123,'Released','Charming. Magnetic. Murderous.','The Last King of Scotland',1523,6.7866,7.408,'R_W7PC6NnN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20270,_binary '\0','/bQWaivEhhL37cCsnnhni9R33KGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455596',6.2,17567,'en','The Librarian: Return to King Solomon\'s Mines','After retrieving the Crystal Skull in Utah, Flynn Carsen receives a map in the mail with the secret location of King Solomon\'s Mines. When the scroll is stolen, Judson explains the power of the Key of Solomon\'s book and assigns Flynn to retrieve the map. The map is useless without the legend piece to decipher it, which is located in Volubilis near the Roman ruins in Morocco. Flynn heads to Casablanca to the ruins where he is chased by a group of mercenaries leaded by General Samir. They too want to find the location of King Solomon\'s mines. Flynn teams-up with Professor Emily Davenport working in the dig and they escape from General Samir and his men. While traveling to Gedi, they save the local Jomo from death and the trio faces a dangerous journey through the wild Africa.','/4UxUdJUCLwirPdYzAsYg8ayKhGN.jpg','2006-09-09',92,'Released',NULL,'The Librarian: Return to King Solomon\'s Mines',14208,6.0466,6.3,'YHsqslpgRSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20271,_binary '\0','/vFNooLsEgurZjnTEmwS8FWHurDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455612',5.4,12817,'en','Madea\'s Family Reunion','Southern matriarch Madea has a lot on her plate. Her nieces, Vanessa and Lisa, have relationship troubles - Vanessa moves into Madea\'s house with her 2 young children and Lisa is engaged to a controlling man that her mother set her up with. In addition, Madea has just been court-ordered to become the guardian of Nikki, a rebellious runaway teenager. Madea must keep the peace and her family together while simultaneously planning her clan\'s reunion.','/lAzrDS5bJJSSdPAUxuctCoomXUc.jpg','2006-02-24',109,'Released','Come as you are. Leave different.','Madea\'s Family Reunion',16781,4.3701,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20272,_binary '\0','/povD3baqXxCb58cR8YtQpFXXAXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455663',7.9,4415,'te','నువ్వొస్తానంటే నేనొద్దంటానా','Siri and Santosh fall in love with each other and plan to get married. However, his mother disapproves of their relationship.','/zixbDSR1gOHgcATGdMaq20LjZEL.jpg','2005-01-14',165,'Released',NULL,'Nuvvostanante Nenoddantana',74154,1.6846,7.097,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20273,_binary '\0','/xMjAkXpCb55FTAV7By31p3TQMxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455760',6.2,109761,'en','Dead Silence','Jamie returns to his hometown in search of answers to his wife\'s murder, which occurred after receiving a weird package containing a ventriloquist dummy named Billy, which may be linked to the legend of ventriloquist Mary Shaw. Destined to find out the truth, Jamie goes to the town of Raven\'s Fair, where Shaw used to perform and is buried. But Jamie is in for more than he expected.','/rvcUVdATIHKZt7BSSttUkKbeBXN.jpg','2007-03-16',89,'Released','You scream. You die.','Dead Silence',14001,12.9168,6.5,'NvVPn1gD1Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20274,_binary '\0','/bucy9OUvrApA7tkLXIfetNvpv0f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455767',5.9,4274,'ta','சிவகாசி','Muthappa is forced to leave his house at a young age for a crime that his older brother, Udayappa, committed. When he returns home, he learns about his brother\'s antics and decides to punish him.','/cdyiZ7y9WBUwpGBk3B4cQmfgyAp.jpg','2005-11-01',180,'Released',NULL,'Sivakasi',48759,1.0084,5.581,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20275,_binary '\0','/k1dXZF6vyVgtmppyXWLZd9FmqmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455782',6.7,26916,'en','The Hunting Party','A young journalist, an experienced cameraman and a discredited reporter find their bold plan to capture Bosnia\'s top war criminal quickly spiraling out of control when a UN representative mistakes them for a CIA hit squad.','/kXUfQGa7BoW856hDYAFtZLtiAAQ.jpg','2007-09-03',101,'Released','How can they find the world\'s most wanted war criminal when the C.I.A. can\'t... By actually looking?','The Hunting Party',5353,4.7161,6.46,'mrGwQvqj2iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20276,_binary '\0','/rS5Yg5bDIaEzrYI0yW7G3XCzoum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455805',5.9,10762,'en','Then She Found Me','A New York schoolteacher experiences a midlife crisis when, in quick succession, her husband leaves, her adoptive mother dies, and her biological mother, an eccentric talk show host, materializes and turns her life upside down as she begins a courtship with the father of one of her students.','/yCyOeJRiCFVo09T2Rb80pt4Fvgo.jpg','2007-09-07',100,'Released','Life can change in a heartbeat.','Then She Found Me',13196,4.1106,5.662,'vdmgUFc7vdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20277,_binary '\0','/kPmdc2OhVONoxdGXA8oJ6dqC3HL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455824',6.6,134364,'en','Australia','Set in northern Australia before World War II, an English aristocrat who inherits a sprawling ranch reluctantly pacts with a stock-man in order to protect her new property from a takeover plot. As the pair drive 2,000 head of cattle over unforgiving landscape, they experience the bombing of Darwin by Japanese forces firsthand.','/tFQpccGMTWe24eWxK5U9rb7tK3M.jpg','2008-11-18',165,'Released','Welcome to Australia!','Australia',6972,5.8797,6.6,'4XED0wWC_jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20278,_binary '\0','/kZ0Gveo8254i8qwIEi2VipjOSPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455829',7.9,8914,'ta','வேட்டையாடு விளையாடு','DCP Raghavan sets off on the trail of the killers of Rani, the daughter of a police officer. Following this, many more murders take place, leading him to New York to capture the maniac killer.','/pdFuSN7rz8dk61jFBR9zjqhcwzK.jpg','2006-08-25',160,'Released',NULL,'Vettaiyaadu Vilaiyaadu',63670,1.6978,7.058,'ZyghQotMPIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20279,_binary '\0','/8nluZo04z9Y8iynYmnMmvO9bU9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455857',5.1,52252,'en','When a Stranger Calls','Far away from the site of a gruesome murder, a teenager named Jill Johnson arrives at a luxurious home for a baby-sitting job. With the children fast asleep, she settles in for what she expects to be an ordinary evening. Soon, the ringing of a phone and the frightening words of a sadistic caller turn Jill\'s routine experience into a night of terror.','/r5FAdQAtgRpHuSI4x5ydvcVHuFz.jpg','2006-02-03',87,'Released','Whatever You Do, Don\'t Answer The Phone.','When a Stranger Calls',10053,6.5,5.7,'xFxmelljiyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20280,_binary '\0','/iBWzuTut0U8VjwX6CEgECemErRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455915',6.9,2748,'en','Black Irish','In South Boston, where Irish roots run deep and Catholic tradition reigns, two brothers face similar hardships but lead far different lives. While older brother Terry descends into drugs and crime, 16-year-old Cole vies to make the state baseball championships - but must struggle to withstand his brother\'s destructive influence.','/kBzTbAziSGvfJORB8C2zz690Zre.jpg','2007-10-26',95,'Released','Two brothers, you can choose your dreams, but you can\'t choose family.','Black Irish',13071,1.4987,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20281,_binary '\0','/9vAoubhoZE8aSkUZoSfxs3UWZhO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455944',7.3,472421,'en','The Equalizer','McCall believes he has put his mysterious past behind him and dedicated himself to beginning a new, quiet life. But when he meets Teri, a young girl under the control of ultra-violent Russian gangsters, he can’t stand idly by – he has to help her. Armed with hidden skills that allow him to serve vengeance against anyone who would brutalize the helpless, McCall comes out of his self-imposed retirement and finds his desire for justice reawakened. If someone has a problem, if the odds are stacked against them, if they have nowhere else to turn, McCall will help. He is The Equalizer.','/9u4yW7yPA0BQ2pv9XwiNzItwvp8.jpg','2014-09-24',132,'Released','What do you see when you look at me?','The Equalizer',156022,32.8868,7.294,'BP_FwE0Z7no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20282,_binary '\0','/qDqp7ud3bGQQ72pOFsPKLNypkKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455957',6.9,33374,'en','Goya\'s Ghosts','Painter Francisco Goya becomes involved with the Spanish Inquisition after his muse, Inés, is arrested by the church for heresy. Her family turns to him, hoping that his connection with fanatical Inquisitor Lorenzo, whom he is painting, can secure her release.','/tyZhS8kA07oU5fO3ruamJkgAC0M.jpg','2006-11-08',114,'Released',NULL,'Goya\'s Ghosts',11515,4.1365,6.6,'AS5dIeKPiCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20283,_binary '\0','/cPm3ifvO90MZx0fu8e2bbjp8WvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455958',6,5059,'en','The Groomsmen','Blue-collar Paulie prepares for fatherhood and his forthcoming wedding to Sue by hanging out with his groomsmen. Brother Jimbo, cousin Mike, and his pals fill the reunion with drinking, boys-will-be-boys antics and a few unexpected personal confessions. But, when the bonding devolves into accusations and regret, Paulie has to decide whether he\'s ready to tie the knot and take this big step into adulthood.','/uIlcGSfSsw31aSAD2cTBkdFwZbR.jpg','2006-06-09',98,'Released','The boys are back in town.','The Groomsmen',14963,3.3185,5.2,'fAS42OPeEOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20284,_binary '\0','/mW4PtCR6h7XWEJVvSCZ8YWdJNCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455960',5.6,47935,'en','The Hitcher','While driving through the New Mexico Desert during a rainy night, college students Jim Halsey and his girlfriend Grace Andrews give a ride to a hitchhiker. While in their car, the stranger proves to be a psychopath threatening the young couple with a knife, but Jim successfully throws him out of the car. This sets off a chain of events that will change all of their lives forever.','/uc2lUHNB1bnoT5ejVCEYv6Vm9fS.jpg','2007-01-19',84,'Released','Never pick up strangers.','The Hitcher',8398,5.8081,5.9,'3_1aXWVl6DE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20285,_binary '\0','/aSr8Ee5mnfoLHovUicouuN8drfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0455967',5.8,93861,'en','John Tucker Must Die','After discovering they are all dating the same same guy, three popular students from different cliques band together for revenge, so they enlist the help of a new gal in town and conspire to break the jerk\'s heart, while destroying his reputation.','/l8B01BFBpIyycO2DopROessWzQU.jpg','2006-07-27',87,'Released','Don\'t get mad. Get even.','John Tucker Must Die',9293,8.0713,6.088,'hDmtPKruS6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20286,_binary '\0','/1adJZaEasOYc4VgM22htOXnYkCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456014',2.3,5249,'en','Surf School','A rag-tag bunch of seniors, complete outsiders at their surf-crazed Laguna Beach High School, decide to crash the biggest team surf contest. In order to prevail, however, they must do one important thing...learn to surf! We\'re taking your classic Cinderella story into the world of surfing, complete with hi-jinx and the aesthetic beauty of surf mecca Costa Rica, our spectacular set location','/yVaIiTUWo9ILZToJ6VPldYcnMGX.jpg','2006-09-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Surf School',32753,1.6646,2.8,'sRJOU0Fi9Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20287,_binary '\0','/kblkyMfm0E3qwMf9MIFz6YpMf1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456020',5.8,10953,'en','Waist Deep','An ex-convict gets tangled up with a gang after his car is hijacked with his son inside.','/xBshLPA17Sbq1AJEACpkDLnRvPd.jpg','2006-06-23',97,'Released','His son. His life. His freedom. He\'s taking them all back.','Waist Deep',9917,3.4136,6.577,'wUifvz4MYXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20288,_binary '\0','/vkAPMrIbuGeD1O83BBnhKaVePHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456041',7.4,2737,'it','Anche libero va bene','A young father and his two children struggle to find harmony after his wife leaves them for another man.','/18byYqbhtF6azO3BnprPuP97Vv3.jpg','2006-05-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Along the Ridge',30535,1.5019,7.1,'MnYtdJT2GpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20289,_binary '\0','/50XTa3vvRKPHZ2aSkL2CLwBiVDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456047',8.4,8173,'tr','Bizim Aile','A love story between a poor man and a rich girl. The rich girl\'s father tries to prevent their marriage and he declares a war against the poor boy\'s family.','/gZPmr1QT48IDYsMCczOVLGk7Ov8.jpg','1975-09-07',88,'Released','Story of Yasar Usta and his family.','Our Family',220002,1.028,7.8,'N7x-2ZYGSCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20290,_binary '\0','/AklBQlxFe4nb0dHqlqtSpsG2kCS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456111',7.1,3138,'es','La noche de los girasoles','Two speleologists, Esteban and Pedro, travel to a mountainous area located in northern Spain, near a small village, to study a newly discovered cave and determine if it is of scientific interest, while Gabi, Esteban\'s wife, awaits their return on a lonely road at the foot of the mountain.','/sBdfW1azCjFGEOTNGHuKg2dJ9Tu.jpg','2006-08-25',118,'Released','Gripping and superb!','The Night of the Sunflowers',58946,1.7926,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20291,_binary '\0','/tUesssR8s8wj7rLIlPxBl4FPA9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456121',6.7,2470,'ja','電車男','The purportedly true story of a 23-year-old otaku (Japanese geek) who intervened when a drunk man was harassing a woman on a train. The otaku ultimately started dating with her and chronicled his event and his dates with the woman (who became known as \"Hermès\") on the Japanese mega-BBS 2channel.','/ggENax2S0G5QKxlKvj2pXsqPaGU.jpg','2005-06-04',105,'Released','A True Love Story','Train Man',13299,1.7238,6.2,'dZXVSla4ZWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20292,_binary '\0','/69fxCutDF2geixYUXPawl6DDSpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456123',6.8,6158,'fr','Dikkenek','Jean-Claude is a loud-mouthed, know-it-all and full time boor who is best friends with Stef, a self-styled lady killer who would do better with the fairer sex if he could work up the ambition to wake up in the morning. Stef has decided that he may need some help in finding the woman of his dreams, and embracing loyalty rather than logic he turns to Jean-Claude for advice.','/kqI4z9Hzw2GqwzLpYYGO29xqb7K.jpg','2006-06-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Dikkenek',8736,2.1682,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20293,_binary '\0','/urxONLFFBKFWzsxLcvUaRgo4v4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456144',8,53991,'hi','लगे रहो मुन्ना भाई','Lovable goon Munna falls for a morning radio host by the name of Jahnvi, who also runs an elders\' home which an unscrupulous builder seeks to attain. In order to gain Jahnvi’s attention, he cheats his way to winning a Mahatma Gandhi radio quiz. When Jahnvi consequently expresses interest in Munna, he and his best friend Circuit attempt to keep up the facade.','/lgSn1tXDstMXSHJYkSibKkHqW8y.jpg','2006-09-01',144,'Released','They\'re back... and they\'re not alone!','Lage Raho Munna Bhai',21461,1.7753,7.3,'OE6f1oHgeDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20294,_binary '\0','/pU10J7w0FBaxStZXokKW0adLU16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456149',7.8,17134,'ro','Moartea domnului Lăzărescu','After suffering terrible headaches and stomach cramps, Mr. Lăzărescu, a lonely 63 year-old man, calls for an ambulance, beginning one man’s hellish journey through Bucharest hospitals in search of proper medical care. As the night unfolds, his health starts to deteriorate fast.','/c3B7GwMYgNi15VMdcKZawgt6mf5.jpg','2005-05-27',154,'Released','A black comedy with serious side effects.','The Death of Mr. Lazarescu',31032,2.4565,7.4,'oAwSHSv1BDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20295,_binary '\0','/5gsUoTh54NLaEJEXv7eNRWgR7Cl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456165',6.2,9001,'hi','Salaam Namaste','Two young Indian expatriates in Melbourne, Australia, Nick, a chef and radio host Ambar, who decide to live together without marriage, leading to conflict and unexpected parenthood when Ambar gets pregnant.','/wL1lm92Da9R7VEPXD0ZCSt1kuUd.jpg','2005-09-09',158,'Released','Let\'s get to know each other.','Salaam Namaste',15084,2.1507,6.19,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20296,_binary '\0','/j5VTKDRMDqCmQj4zK8TS0JQwQ9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456340',6.3,5037,'es','Caótica Ana','Ana, a teenager artist, is raised in Ibiza by her German father Klaus in a naturalist lifestyle. She meets Justine, who invites her to move to Madrid and get an artistic education and financial support. Ana befriends Linda, meets the problematic Said, a Saharawi youngster, and later she is hypnotized by Anglo, who opens a door to her memories and past lives.','/49HVU5cpbP5aVIDPfudwYCrLcFo.jpg','2007-08-24',119,'Released',NULL,'Chaotic Ana',2588,1.9033,6.02,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20297,_binary '\0','/rCNR48c7ysIXmF2uqn8alwF4HKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456396',7.4,20206,'fr','L\'enfant','A poor young Belgian mother wants her petty thief of a boyfriend to be gainfully employed to raise their newborn child, but he has other ideas.','/dk7ZpsVKLt2nwjQZZIde0WP4oQV.jpg','2005-09-14',96,'Released',NULL,'The Child',11490,2.6351,7.1,'1nbBpVo9_pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20298,_binary '\0','/cHnWx0QoVvtSNkDUpYcM9CXJhV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456413',3.6,1751,'hi','Fight Club: Members Only','Four friends head off to Bombay and get involved in the mother and father of all gang wars.','/aXFmWfWYCCxQTkCn7K86RvDiMHZ.jpg','2006-02-17',140,'Released','This winter... party in a club... that is more than drinks and dance...','Fight Club: Members Only',347807,1.5598,6.103,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.