pei, and Shanghai.','/w2RsbSjM4Kk91Za3GPNDdOneVhY.jpg','2005-04-12',102,'Released',NULL,'About Love',95164,1.1899,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20307,_binary '\0','/3he9tOMisKv5tEpZMl2sIyaVtVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456899',6.5,4900,'pt','Cidade Baixa','Best friends Deco and Naldinho co-own a cargo boat in Brazil\'s Salvador da Bahia. They give a ride to a sultry prostitute named Karinna, and soon both men fall prey to her considerable sexual charms, pushing the bounds of their friendship to the limit.','/qFWvDBCN2LpVczu6ZKQq8B0AIYG.jpg','2005-11-04',98,'Released','Love to live. Live to love.','Lower City',8443,2.0513,6.5,'BPsR2HfTlqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20308,_binary '\0','/t8EDE4bkYZBaSCo7Gq8uIWtW4pV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0456912',7.5,47983,'ko','달콤한 인생','Kim Sun-woo is an enforcer and manager for a hotel owned by a cold, calculative crime boss, Kang who assigns Sun-woo to a simple errand while he is away on a business trip; to shadow his young mistress, Hee-soo, for fear that she may be cheating on him with a younger man with the mandate that he must kill them both if he discovers their affair.','/iqUGAIQqHMMscatykpR6hVBxezA.jpg','2005-04-01',119,'Released','When doing right goes very, very wrong.','A Bittersweet Life',11344,4.4633,7.4,'q5O2tfiaTxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20309,_binary '\0','/tmoAUPjVnazSoZ9t23PReG1SY7C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457007',7.2,3244,'ko','주먹이 운다','Tae-sik, a troubled middle aged man and Sang-hwan, a troubled youth will meet in the ring with their respective mission. To change their life.','/h94psE0hXhSRUoysT8gQ0Uk1TCr.jpg','2005-03-31',121,'Released','Two men fight for their lives.','Crying Fist',40452,1.6447,7.3,'iYvtw9ufBDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20310,_binary '\0','/pMbw3FHjxFFmuQv0A92VpJSrIi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457020',7.1,1219,'tr','Kırık Bir Aşk Hikayesi','Fuat is forced into an \"advantegeous\" marriage to a rich girl due to his family financial lowness. He, however loves another, Aysel. After he loses his best friend, Bedri, to suicide, he rebels against the system with heartbreaking results.','/i85g153YWtfcUTxCORGwoxKlJ1s.jpg','1982-10-01',93,'Released',NULL,'A Broken Love Story',281895,1.4414,6.1,'38VX1R1rjnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20311,_binary '\0','/3QrmIQpsvFXqcjwri75DVEd7LfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457024',6.7,1309,'ru','Князь Владимир','The plot follows the events surrounding Vladimir from childhood and into adulthood. In the beginning of the film, being under the influence of the high priest Krivzha, the Prince is a young, impulsive and cruel pagan. Fighting for supreme power, Vladimir wins a battle that kills his brother. Regretting what he has done, Vladimir does not suspect a conspiracy between the priest and the Pechenegs. Vladimir is concerned about gathering the Slavic tribes into one united state. Solving this major task, he faces obstacles, which Vladimir overcomes in the end, defeating Krivzha and winning the battle against Kurya, a Pecheneg chief.','/1KntOHQB0tp2Ddtmx9H6YeKDuVq.jpg','2006-02-09',78,'Released',NULL,'Prince Vladimir',39170,1.2425,6.631,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20312,_binary '\0','/cb5tyDwX6rMDQfBVvgf2d9apWu6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457270',3.3,2294,'en','Cyber Seduction: His Secret Life','A high school kid develops an addiction to Internet porn so intense that it begins to destroy his life and tear his family apart.','/jwNPGYiK3VeBRRG4EGZOMcKJlfn.jpg','2005-06-20',84,'Released','What happens when simple curiosity turns into addiction?','Cyber Seduction: His Secret Life',63483,2.365,3.8,'cpa0syoSyK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20313,_binary '\0','/1qZpzoxhT5IBHcDftTm7oqpxyRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457275',5.6,11404,'en','Altered','Fifteen years ago, five men were abducted by aliens. Only four returned. Now, these same four men have managed to capture one of the creatures who killed their friend and ruined their lives.','/dhUA9wCbuZAdl1Nhq4bkwyZKst5.jpg','2006-12-19',88,'Released','They will find you.','Altered',14458,2.6802,5.5,'a-Ib1F-NT6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20314,_binary '\0','/woUBg7Se10brZajZjg2uBklwXlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457297',4.5,38927,'en','The Butterfly Effect 2','After his girlfriend, Julie, and two best friends are killed in a tragic auto accident, Nick struggles to cope with his loss and grief. Suffering from migraine-like seizures, Nick soon discovers that he has the power to change the past via his memories. However, his time-traveling attempts to alter the past and save his one true love have unexpected and dire consequences.','/g87nPhHf2xfENBV6PCbkO88sthd.jpg','2006-08-17',92,'Released','Can you change your past without destroying your future?','The Butterfly Effect 2',14620,5.9837,5,'zFFWys4sHvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20315,_binary '\0','/3rBP8uP67QDfBqwBxmgrbl0AoVs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457308',6.2,2986,'en','Come Early Morning','A thirty-something southern woman searches for love, despite the burdens she carries with her.','/5faIZQlDLIKEH8zLBf1oKrbHIXv.jpg','2006-01-10',97,'Released','Before you fall in love, you need to love yourself.','Come Early Morning',7547,2.6394,5.5,'bGOOOwPQm5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20316,_binary '\0','/6FTIgtJk1mqmBTg9AEBrRKhLG1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457400',5.4,80871,'en','Land of the Lost','On his latest expedition, has-been scientist Dr. Rick Marshall is sucked into a space-time vortex alongside his crack-smart research assistant Holly and redneck survivalist Will into a world populated by marauding dinosaurs and painfully slow creatures called Sleestaks. With no weapons, few skills and questionable smarts, the trio must rely on their only ally, a primate named Chaka, to try to survive long enough to figure out a way back home.','/hVCJzmK9l5FD01LFYAB1zcmmw7s.jpg','2009-06-05',102,'Released','Right place. Wrong time.','Land of the Lost',18162,8.6198,5.5,'uBPEr0csKCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20317,_binary '\0','/eEAnOXThUJnQlS2ytCqKdV0PeVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457414',7.3,1781,'en','Midnight Movies: From the Margin to the Mainstream','From 1970-1977, six low budget films shown at midnight transformed the way we make and watch films.','/pcJHdDK9r2R3ayB5yoNW2uygukP.jpg','2006-06-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Midnight Movies: From the Margin to the Mainstream',36883,1.4608,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20318,_binary '\0','/uUG9jtLft9FDkIyfcR9KclY5Kuu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457419',6.2,49540,'en','Mr. Magorium\'s Wonder Emporium','Molly Mahoney is the awkward and insecure manager of Mr. Magorium\'s Wonder Emporium—the strangest, most fantastic and most wonderful toy store in the world. After Mr. Magorium bequeaths the store to her, a dark and ominous change begins to take over the once-remarkable Emporium.','/rdFgWATSVhhFtNYZUFsGcHzltcG.jpg','2007-11-16',93,'Released','You have to believe it to see it.','Mr. Magorium\'s Wonder Emporium',2284,5.4595,6.3,'m4Mrga2aSL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20319,_binary '\0','/6G6nqSW9S7EHA9HrYl0Z8uo2H7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457430',8.2,753107,'es','El laberinto del fauno','In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.','/7wb2Ldp0oAx1lcZvffq9RfWoI2h.jpg','2006-10-11',118,'Released','Innocence has a power evil cannot imagine.','Pan\'s Labyrinth',1417,22.8104,7.768,'6tYUOAMsydg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20320,_binary '\0','/sNhYDvDbEwf9AUGip2fGRwP7x8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457433',5.7,54347,'en','Perfect Stranger','A journalist goes undercover to ferret out businessman Harrison Hill as her best friend\'s killer. Posing as one of his temps, she enters into a game of online cat-and-mouse.','/i7D5QqQ0q5EXU1UuZVY9KwIxoYR.jpg','2007-04-11',109,'Released','How far would you go to keep a secret?','Perfect Stranger',7183,6.9595,5.8,'AGH5w7cXGl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20321,_binary '\0','/yaZmxwhbrvBLRufuWcovR6fqU1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457477',6.4,1500,'en','Silver Bells','Manhattanite Catherine O\'Mara (Heche) bonds with a young man who has run away from his father. When the father returns to New York a year later to sell his Christmas trees, he and Catherine cross paths.','/14XQZ1m0e1rvdT2tcLZ5yOwj6an.jpg','2005-11-27',90,'Released','In every year... in every life... there is a season of love.','Silver Bells',55653,2.0413,5.5,'-tuk1n9Tr4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20322,_binary '\0','/sWO8C8QlyodOZU6eOdVxsGfSQvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457495',5.1,26635,'en','Stormbreaker','After the death of his uncle, 14-year-old schoolboy Alex Rider is forced by the Special Operations Division of the UK\'s secret intelligence service, MI6, into a mission which will save millions of lives.','/2KTfHVWvVLmghBabwoygdJuf6Y2.jpg','2006-07-21',93,'Released','Rule the school. Save the world.','Stormbreaker',9978,4.5331,5.233,'ynErGFnFbMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20323,_binary '\0','/9jQ1HfaioDfPqlGD52cpTEDi3Sq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457496',7.9,2166,'en','Street Fight','This documentary follows the 2002 mayoral campaign in Newark, New Jersey, in which a City Councilman, Cory Booker, attempted to unseat longtime mayor Sharpe James.','/1abhRslbpFUSCLD5S4c