rylluppet','A manager of an orphanage in India is sent to Copenhagen, Denmark, where he discovers a life-altering family secret.','/29t5x0Aj4cQJJC9jNR3VWS7l3JL.jpg','2006-02-24',124,'Released',NULL,'After the Wedding',3549,3.5498,7.1,'-lKCRdGXCeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20328,_binary '\0','/r6Sh5HNF1nJkhzYBYT88RUQ7GVR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457701',4.1,1284,'en','Solar Strike','When the sun\'s increasing expulsions of plasma threaten to ignite methane in our atmosphere, international tensions rise while scientists race for a solution to avoid natural disaster.','/dL5hDlxU8BLf1oVdnl9Llb2uoI.jpg','2006-05-25',91,'Released','Prepare for the Apocalypse...','Solar Attack',34862,1.8834,5.2,'DxHk7cAy3lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20329,_binary '\0','/yCgjdf1PbV0xBEzUICBFKQmoFRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457802',7.3,2312,'hi','थे ब्लू अम्ब्रेला','Young Biniya lives a poor lifestyle in a small village in the mountainous and snowy region of Himachal Pradesh in India along with her widowed mom and wrestler brother. She entertains various tourists, and while doing so with some tourists from Japan, trades in her bear-tooth amulet with a blue umbrella...','/tyfyLg2pGzSsrim0pFijDL8bNl1.jpg','2007-08-10',90,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Umbrella',46379,1.4573,6.8,'ZFX2wXFSr5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20330,_binary '\0','/y24rcoBjxDNdmZIUIJcbjVxBzua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457875',5.3,1899,'hi','Ek Ajnabee','Suryaveer, an ex-army officer, is assigned the task of protecting a young girl, Anamika. When Anamika gets kidnapped, he decides to use all his skills to rescue her.','/5zzicBnDDjxCzaIB8R0BUNr8P1H.jpg','2005-12-09',142,'Released','A Man Apart','Ek Ajnabee',87995,1.0988,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20331,_binary '\0','/9Ebn8atCcGk5OZrx4xmoTobAxoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0457939',7,371038,'en','The Holiday','Two women, one American 