g. Just another day at the office.','The Ex',13171,3.4308,5.3,'6kZ-3MdbhLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20338,_binary '\0','/6MRz7SEqTAGYQ2dSvFjyKVr6IYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458367',6,14928,'en','Right at Your Door','A dirty bomb goes off in Los Angeles, jamming freeways and spreading a toxic cloud.','/sBkCtdpkWRiisQ3vzyNOZ72biCB.jpg','2006-01-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Right at Your Door',15664,3.5625,5.8,'m2NgluePdfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20339,_binary '\0','/cA2lXcl4rVKsRltJwVYRqpSqvhq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458413',6.3,35803,'en','A Long Way Down','Four lost souls—a disgraced TV presenter, a foul-mouthed teen, an isolated single mother, and a failed musician—decide to end their lives on the same night, New Year\'s Eve. When this disillusioned quartet of strangers meet unintentionally at the same suicide hotspot, a London high-rise with the well-earned nickname Topper\'s Tower, they mutually agree to call off their plans for six weeks, forming an unconventional, dysfunctional family. They become media sensations as the Topper House Four and search together for reasons to keep on living.','/ibtYPDUQXKK2CIYzMEWgt1VNMlP.jpg','2014-03-20',96,'Released','Life is looking up.','A Long Way Down',141043,6.3396,6.2,'12jCVd5Evko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20340,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458425',7,2227,'en','McLibel','A deep dive into the historic 1997–2005 libel lawsuit, wherein fast-food conglomerate McDonald\'s sued environmental activists Helen Steel and David Morris over a critical factsheet. It became the longest trial in English legal history and a major free-speech PR disaster for the corporation.','/khlChZ2OxzbN6ImIUtejFbFcaTw.jpg','2005-05-20',85,'Released','The Postman and Gardener Who Took on McDonald\'s, and Won.','McLibel',23523,2.4114,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20341,_binary '\0','/mKOp7sXHbwUpOdd9WCClcg0wp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458455',6.7,9499,'en','Die Päpstin','A 9th century woman of English extraction born in the German city of Ingelheim disguises herself as a man and rises through the Vatican ranks.','/cYeodvtw9wlo5DWUVwoTiqjvfLJ.jpg','2009-10-22',149,'Released',NULL,'Pope Joan',9503,3.406,6.8,'DV3ZLsAQqXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20342,_binary '\0','/3Qk6Rf1FP8mWMRyVXv2z0GY6aUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458465',4.2,1217,'en','All You\'ve Got','Three friends\' love for volleyball is tested to the limit when their school burns to the ground and they are forced to join a rival school in order to win the national championship.','/rd3CrecSJKAQmLqGMntfSUaVGYr.jpg','2006-05-20',95,'Released','In life, some lines need to be crossed.','All You\'ve Got',14593,1.9469,6.2,'khXZAcP9Sl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20343,_binary '\0','/xhFkx7pnJCc1IuLTec48WqPdjXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458480',4.2,4028,'en','Simon Says','Five college friends choose to spend their vacation debauching at the riverside. They find the perfect place to camp out, but end up crossing paths with twin brothers, Simon and Stanley. The twins then begins to knock off the campers in some extremely creative (and extremely gruesome) ways.','/hr3gOhNVXmb5mFWxw3d257NOvcG.jpg','2007-09-25',87,'Released','You forgot to say...','Simon Says',21141,3.3715,5,'GWpVwow5HP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20344,_binary '\0','/rxMnmklIpunsNsRkQ7hw61ZJa84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0458481',6.5,180016,'en','Sin City: A Dame to Kill For','Some of Sin City\'s most hard-boiled citizens cross paths with a few of its more reviled inhabitants.','/50kALxDX4mmzIRljbNbPY0u4cie.jpg','2014-08-20',102,'Released','Walk down the right back alley in Sin City and you can find anything...','Sin City: A Dame to Kill For',189,14.4862,6.4,'WvAvEcxwglI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20345,_binary '