rossing the Bridge: The Sound of Istanbul','German musician Alexander Hacke explores Istanbul\'s rich music culture and attempts to create a portrait of Turkey through music genres. On this journey, he encounters a mosaic that covers countless genres from rock to arabesque, electronic to hip-hop.','/dPT26kzmlzOoBPzXEXqRvfWgVsM.jpg','2005-05-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Crossing the Bridge: The Sound of Istanbul',29138,1.5092,7.327,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20350,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459293',7.3,1906,'hi','Gandhi, My Father','Unable to live in his father\'s gigantic shadow, Mahatma Gandhi\'s eldest son, Harilal, gets distraught and resorts to alcoholism.','/sFzo2Ss4PQfNUlrzeTfwoVp5ajE.jpg','2007-08-03',136,'Released','To the People...He was a Father. To his Son...he was a Father he never had.','Gandhi, My Father',38428,0.9786,5.6,'E0jFSgXxZE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20351,_binary '\0','/iakWgJG6ScHX37TNBnYDLltUizW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459387',4.9,1493,'en','The Great Ecstasy of Robert Carmichael','In a small English coastal town, three teenage boys are drawn into a world of temptation and violence. Bored, troubled and excluded, the boys are unable to accept or even recognise moral boundaries. Their actions move inexorably towards a truly shocking act, that will horrify their sleepy community and expose its deepest, hidden fears.','/qEjuqo83fh4Qd5YSIJhc9R2pUag.jpg','2005-08-14',96,'Released',NULL,'The Great Ecstasy of Robert Carmichael',44986,1.594,5.1,'2GTFyoSEzHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20352,_binary '\0','/gKRxdn5ISLc36A4KgVujsTSDcPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459392',3.1,1889,'en','Hammerhead','When he began fusing human and shark DNA, his colleagues laughed at him. Now his creation is taking his revenge, and they aren\'t laughing anymore.','/5p2wodybxYlhNFYDnr7Up6cb8oB.jpg','2005-06-18',92,'Released','Half man, Half Shark, Total Terror.','Hammerhead',48333,1.3165,4.3,'u0ShkmRR6y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20353,_binary '\0','/dom2zcgJL5qY1g6ePCZqZVE4Q3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459449',7.2,1872,'ta','M. குமரன் Son of Mahalakshmi','Kumaran\'s life is all about his mother Mahalakshmi, who is separated from her husband Eshwar. Kumaran is passionate about kickboxing and he shares a very special relationship with his mother. In between, Kumaran falls in love with Malabar. But his life is destroyed after his mother\'s death. On the deathbed she tells her son to meet his father, a kick boxing champion, who lives in Malaysia. Kumaran goes to Malaysia to meet him and he comes...','/ArVe9XK7XyGtG8lP6o0n7TUP0FC.jpg','2004-09-03',166,'Released',NULL,'M. Kumaran S/O Mahalakshmi',63816,1.7252,6.768,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20354,_binary '\0','/9Rv5XZGi83SK659guCw30X39fTg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459505',6.9,2249,'pl','Pitbull','Police officers from the Warsaw Homicide Department are trying to arrest a dangerous Armenian criminal.','/nsYAQKRssp1LO2hA6jysA2IRNp1.jpg','2005-04-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Pitbull',74919,0.9278,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20355,_binary '\0','/M0ktNTFtel6IgcOiz5A2v8zYIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459516',8.4,9803,'ta','புதுப்பேட்டை','The story of ‘Kokki’ Kumar, a carefree teenager from a Chennai slum who runs away from home in the wake of his mother’s death, gets recruited into a local gang and quickly evolves into the dreaded, psychotic right-hand man of a dirty politician.','/blrGDOlcTbIit4BBS9gW4PsCuYv.jpg','2006-05-26',179,'Released','Survival of the Fittest.','Pudhupettai',69520,1.4173,7.415,'2e6MRXf4X2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20356,_binary '\0','/dRJitTV5evVM90WiSPByrjdnMav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459605',6,3639,'hi','एकलव्य','As the kingdom of Devigarh comes apart at the seams, an aging bodyguard attempts to protect the Royal Family, as well as keep its darkest secrets from ever coming to light.','/8IdT65RInyPf5Bo5wkqxKMituwJ.jpg','2007-02-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Eklavya: The Royal Guard',192675,1.2721,6,'-avN0AfPrd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20357,_binary '\0','/nUUfagmcm9Bg2lRbaObfbMifkit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459666',6.9,6434,'zh','最好的時光','In three separate segments, set respectively in 1966, 1911, and 2005, three love stories unfold between three sets of characters, under three different periods of Taiwanese history and governance.','/Ajd6uUZchc9AR2PHDaAiI79fFUl.jpg','2005-10-27',130,'Released',NULL,'Three Times',11554,2.2283,6.9,'d7_ExLi8X9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20358,_binary '\0','/mmA3ZXOzVfdoqKct6iZuIrLbuT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459748',6.7,4775,'ru','Generation П','Set in the ground zero of gangster globalism and driven by a truly manic energy, Generation P is at once a comedy, a tragedy and a fantasy about the rise of a poet-turned-adman through Russia’s nascent advertising business during the Moscow roaring 1990s.','/c7aMcRsKSU3oOhEdrfcR04iZEMS.jpg','2011-04-14',112,'Released',NULL,'Generation P',63375,1.3871,6.414,'ch3KGQg9klc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20359,_binary '\0','/jfHbKVLes49W1s1SaPua7ijhWJG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459880',6.7,4992,'fr','Lady Chatterley','After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband\'s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.','/A1Rk4mtHrai2harr7MM5Vn9mfwU.jpg','2006-11-01',167,'Released',NULL,'Lady Chatterley',3542,3.1796,6.2,'MDq0jqey5SI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20360,_binary '\0','/cBzqVB6O72DDW03kzDWdoKBiKAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0459924',4.9,2313,'ru','Параграф 78: Фильм первый','The peoples of the world has finally managed to agree on the most important issues on the planet and there was long overdue balance. Signed an agreement to terminate development of weapons of mass destruction, but in secret all the superpowers continue to build up military power on classified sites, which seemed never existed. Goodwin, a former commander of special forces, is tasked to collect his former people responsible for the mission. Something very serious has happened to the base where secretly working to develop a new combat the virus, and more recent cohorts, who have almost nothing left in common, have come together again...','/h1QqfK0cbtfBlJ9sdRcSh6LMMFh.jpg','2007-02-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Paragraph 78: Film One',53086,1.7331,5.08,'wzrMlU4u4vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20361,_binary '\0','/27RtmO3cI4UPLG0YvO7R2G8wrYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460012',6,4356,'ru','Сволочи','A \"Hitlerjugend\" kind of story, set in the Soviet Union during the Second World War, based on a fictitious story from the eponymous book by Vladimir Kunin.','/mSmPUpwMW0yHgR9g8EbefTMFeHV.jpg','2006-02-02',97,'Released',NULL,'Bastards',62678,1.5645,5.852,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20362,_binary '\0','/vmKeUJcPuXkXbVaURKP2qzBI52M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460394',7.9,1668,'te','ఐతే','With a price on his head, powerful Mumbai gangster Irfan Khan devises a plan to flee the country and hires four unsuspecting accomplices to help him hijack a plane to Kathmandu. As the four realize what he\'s up to, it becomes unclear whether Khan\'s scheme will get off the ground.','/pxRLgbwZu0vSZ3rj2pphCp14H5U.jpg','2003-04-11',140,'Released','అన్ని సినిమాలు ఒకేలా ఉండవు','Aithe',311777,0.9911,6.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20363,_binary '\0','/4WXThSSJ4F6E6eDNhgBFx7s92Zd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460401',7.3,1293,'fr','L\'audition','Louis is \"repo man\" who is no stranger to strong-arm tactics in his work, but he has dreamed of becoming an actor since he was a child. When his cousin helps him get an audition, Louis gets the help of a famous actor to secretly help rehearse his scenes. He doesn\'t even tell his girlfriend Suzie. But Suzie also has a secret; she\'s pregnant and doesn\'t want her child to grow up in an atmosphere of violence.','/kk24p9zkWafZgPOYKN6aG7Lq8QL.jpg','2005-09-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Audition',49735,1.1384,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20364,_binary '\0','/6uKa5AIzq2MQ6HOJj7ycs3ln7bj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460435',4.3,2904,'en','In a Dark Place','The disturbed arts teacher, Anna Veigh, is hired by Mr. Laing as a governess to raise Flora and her brother Miles. Anna believes that the ghosts of the former governess, Miss Jessel, and housekeeper, Peter Quint, are in the property haunting the children, and she decides to help them to face the spirits and get their souls free.','/xBjix0cL0SKr8TwnPIYL2Oz6osp.jpg','2006-07-21',95,'Released','The real story is what haunts them','In a Dark Place',21794,2.7926,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20365,_binary '\0','/n4WEtkX1bK7FN5xrd3sfAj9qOm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460480',6.8,1900,'pt','Juventude Em Marcha','After the Portuguese government demolishes his slum and relocates him to a housing project on the outskirts of Lisbon, 75-year-old Cape Verde immigrant Ventura wanders between his new and old homes, reconnecting with people from his past.','/7gXzGezgUDaYsauYGPhM3Dmbt2g.jpg','2006-11-23',156,'Released','Raise your arm, shout out your freedom','Colossal Youth',82404,1.168,7.2,'KlHBq86OIPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20366,_binary '\0','/ka4PUMFdvzu8x3mgtHC9JGcjrEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460485',5.3,3833,'es','KM 31: Kilometro 31','While driving through the kilometer 31 of a lonely road, Agata Hameran hits a boy. She leaves her car to help the victim and another car runs over her and she falls in a deep coma. Her twin sister Catalina telepathically feels the pain of Agata and hears her whispering for help. Together with her boyfriend Nuno and Agata\'s mate Omar, they return to the km 31 of the road, and find out that the place is surrounded by supernatural accidents caused by the ghost of a mother that lost her boy many years ago. Further, Catalina discloses that the spirit of Agata is trapped between the worlds of the living and the dead.','/w9Tr4hjRm8Z2rjliMomcOwGjsYp.jpg','2006-10-19',103,'Released',NULL,'KM 31: Kilometer 31',20015,1.8798,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20367,_binary '\0','/1lXNMnf5WkHDuEfege7kHoOfryY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460492',6.6,1662,'de','Der letzte Zug','A group of people are imprisoned in a rail car bound from Berlin to a concentration camp in 1945.','/sTsmkEMezkbmWHggQJT0o9lb1Wv.jpg','2006-10-26',123,'Released','The tragedy of human destinies, the battle of life and death.','The Last Train',34066,1.8428,7.2,'OZAJz6W0dxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20368,_binary '\0','/hV08RBcFOVsgTrHQAaPQrFH90vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460505',7.6,5643,'fr','Maurice Richard','The story of Quebec\'s most beloved hockey player, Maurice \"The Rocket\" Richard, focusing on the struggles of a French Canadian in the National Hockey League dominated by Anglophones.','/uH55rXL4ad8TEm0vtlsFtXhZwKv.jpg','2005-10-25',124,'Released',NULL,'The Rocket',49081,2.0815,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20369,_binary '\0','/bqjet8NTBkzfVtZkHhGZI9hUeoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460721',6.3,1571,'en','The Big Bad Swim','An adult swim class sets the stage for this sexually charged comedy-drama about love, loss, and second chances. Three strangers -- inextricably connected through personal heartbreak -- find themselves entering deep water as they learn that life isn\'t always about diving right in -- it\'s about getting your feet wet once in awhile.','/5zDACIUPPzlD5oNaKDwLZgJEebv.jpg','2006-04-26',96,'Released','Life is about keeping your head above water.','The Big Bad Swim',23817,1.8145,5.6,'MJNR5Nl2_VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20370,_binary '\0','/ovPpGP2173A2Ltksvk56W59pU4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460732',5.4,2949,'en','Caffeine','A fanciful battle of the sexes ensues when the relationships of the staff and patrons of a quirky London café are unexpectedly turned upside down by sudden revelations of terribly embarrassing secrets having to do with their sexual misadventures. The food is not that good, but you can be yourselves and show yourselves for what you are: maniacs, perverts, gays, cheaters, violent old women, cross-dressers, whining singers, broken hearts... Come in, there is room!','/9XOO0EkctFIxgUuy7YlJCV4kbnV.jpg','2006-08-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Caffeine',18654,1.6583,5.7,'Flh52xOogto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20371,_binary '\0','/3g8KRLnSoyG2vV7HctDPBsEqbFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460740',7.1,95333,'en','Cashback','After a painful breakup, Ben develops insomnia. To kill time, he starts working the late night shift at the local supermarket, where his artistic imagination runs wild.','/iXJKrcjHXrL148OfmovdGPBvnSw.jpg','2007-01-17',102,'Released','Sometimes love is hiding between the seconds of your life.','Cashback',12225,5.6762,7,'JEBhL6ks7E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20372,_binary '\0','/41jcP1qLW6dxr2FYaaW5jSERVPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460745',6.5,35266,'en','Chaos Theory','Frank Allen, a professional speaker who lectures on time management has a perfectly ordered and scheduled life, down to the minute. When his wife sets his clock forward 10 minutes as a joke, his day is thrown off. Deciding that his strictly ordered life has done him little good, he begins to make multiple choice index cards, choosing one at random and doing what is written on the card.','/iP4DJqTeMMQJ3J0eyt2RjRH6NZH.jpg','2008-04-11',87,'Released','This man will bring order to the universe...or not.','Chaos Theory',12912,3.7346,6.4,'wZ3g8Gx3RxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20373,_binary '\0','/6x01We226t1vmIZGaCkio2MoZaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460766',7.8,3468,'en','Deep Water','DEEP WATER is the stunning true story of the fateful voyage of Donald Crowhurst, an amateur yachtsman who enters the most daring nautical challenge ever – the very first solo, non-stop, round-the-world boat race.','/jcHJ3R1gasJh927n0bRKFwBDHRo.jpg','2006-12-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Deep Water',15030,1.7295,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20374,_binary '\0','/5M187YumwzNjEdc4AH14dl9yAeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460780',3.8,50957,'en','In the Name of the King: A Dungeon Siege Tale','A man named Farmer sets out to rescue his kidnapped wife and avenge the death of his son – two acts committed by the Krugs, a race of animal-warriors who are controlled by the evil Gallian.','/bbN1lmDk1PT0GsTFCy179sk5nIF.jpg','2007-11-29',127,'Released','Rise and Fight','In the Name of the King: A Dungeon Siege Tale',2312,7.4481,4.8,'Jo1zfiEeZZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20375,_binary '\0','/vNrXoT45xscHY6AN4IGf44vHxVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460791',7.8,131584,'en','The Fall','In a hospital on the outskirts of 1920s Los Angeles, an injured stuntman begins to tell a fellow patient, a little girl with a broken arm, a fantastic story about 5 mythical heroes. Thanks to his fractured state of mind and her vivid imagination, the line between fiction and reality starts to blur as the tale advances.','/ez7xavvDr5yDz4sSvI55xDp0BoU.jpg','2008-01-03',117,'Released','A little blessing in disguise.','The Fall',14784,11.3451,7.6,'sDs4Mwme-DM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20376,_binary '\0','/eV3ad3ALbIVwfKvLgw2f3T79zxh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460792',6.3,26224,'en','Fast Food Nation','A dramatised examination of the health issues and social consequences of America\'s love affair with fast food.','/vcRgWIj4p6FtezgZTl4YoxYbSJ7.jpg','2006-11-17',116,'Released','Do you want lies with that?','Fast Food Nation',8324,3.3215,6,'TwhLTpicFqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20377,_binary '\0','/dS3tKr9sVtVp7wOHQhYaw78xgPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460793',6.7,1490,'en','Felicity: An American Girl Adventure','A pre-American Revolution Virginian girl\'s love for the outdoors leads to the friendship of a lifetime. Felicity loves horses, and though her parents plead with her to remain indoors, she yearns to ride the open plains. When Felicity comes into contact with a beautiful mare which has suffered at the hands of its callous owner, she takes it upon herself to care for the creature.','/b5whGifOJWI6v93DJEClzxYiZKS.jpg','2005-11-29',86,'Released',NULL,'Felicity: An American Girl Adventure',25778,2.109,6.6,'RMN5q1Av39I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20378,_binary '\0','/bzjGojNGoLuGvbaeEbjI8BFhJ1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460810',6.4,15275,'en','The Great Buck Howard','When a law school dropout answers an advertisement to be a personal assistant he unknowingly signs on to work for a belligerent has-been magician struggling to resurrect his career. This leads to a journey across the country staging the comeback of a lifetime.','/iglKvmA7sq6Pnd6KWFnT6WW9Vpn.jpg','2008-01-18',90,'Released','Greatness is a state of mind.','The Great Buck Howard',16279,5.9453,6.021,'yuza5zUJRhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20379,_binary '\0','/fgcCpffc6bPXwVz29vcLbzrbxzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460812',6.9,8686,'en','Griffin & Phoenix','A terminally ill man falls in love with a woman who has a secret that threatens their time spent together.','/kL1Jh2ahQH62SLDETwD2TpDhljP.jpg','2006-09-12',102,'Released','A love story with no expectations.','Griffin & Phoenix',15534,3.4714,7.11,'ChEbwOJthOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20380,_binary '\0','/qyePa65qZVnuYWivT