t forty years, unexpectedly receives an old tarot card which seems to have for him a disturbing meaning, so he decides to return to the small village where he grew up.','/gr8JvPWmFtXrvhc3FdZHzkuAZ3x.jpg','2006-09-27',81,'Released','Would you sleep if your lover came back from the Other Side?','Spectre',46879,1.3157,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20385,_binary '\0','/c8nSzFW59HSL2eWc3Nz07d2VhoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460898',4.5,2609,'en','Pervert!','While visiting his Bible-thumping yet lecherous father in the desert, randy college student James tries everything he can to hook up with the local curvaceous cuties, but his sex quest stalls when a bloodthirsty killer targets every buxom beauty in sight.','/byRmwND80CVgsKoC5Im2dDXv4aM.jpg','2005-02-12',81,'Released','The Most Outrageous Movie Ever!','Pervert!',46333,2.4389,4.9,'55reKkON45c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20386,_binary '\0','/gnTrxJs6tuNnZ9AYUFhrZGtD4KM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460902',4.2,1576,'en','Played','An examination of the malevolent London underworld with it\'s despicable criminal underground. Ray (Mick Rossi) just finished an eight year prison sentence after getting set up. Now he is back on the streets to settle the score.','/5I8at2uTDCZRSImREtisF0kxdzY.jpg','2006-05-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Played',31979,1.7404,3.9,'fND4hxP3gmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20387,_binary '\0','/xTaj3tVozMfcCrrndYVPic91bWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460925',6.2,5585,'en','The Sasquatch Gang','Young fantasy and science fiction aficionado Gavin Gore and his friends stumble onto some huge footprints in the woods. A local cop, reporter, and a renowned Sasquatch authority investigate, while two of Gavin\'s dim-witted neighbors hatch a scheme to profit from the situation.','/f7Vnrik2tsozzG1DRfgIBmJvUCx.jpg','2006-03-08',88,'Released','An epic tale of nerds and turds.','The Sasquatch Gang',19033,2.2449,5.9,'BWFHE_CeIRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20388,_binary '\0','/sV5W2tLPdxBsOGG0I4CMyfT1RU4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460952',3.2,1293,'en','National Lampoon\'s TV: The Movie','A celebration of the ever increasing depravity of television in our society-- it\'s a channel surfing adventure through the most utterly ridiculous spoofed television programming and commercials.','/saBExhxD7B0r5v5sj4yWzfSPojQ.jpg','2006-08-06',86,'Released','A very special kind of stupid','National Lampoon\'s TV: The Movie',39163,1.7959,4.5,'uofA9O622co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20389,_binary '\0','/tGJX9KrYf21jDrdBPL59WLMv966.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460976',5.1,2521,'ta','வல்லவன்','A man loves a woman even though she is three years older than him. Although she reciprocates initially, the age difference and his past with a classmate lead her to break up with him.','/6B8pIy9jtiDqweVonX7jdb8hjI3.jpg','2006-10-21',183,'Released','He Knows What To Do','Vallavan',69624,0.9363,5.5,'Mie8aAUOgnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20390,_binary '\0','/fKrFGB96kVeJ9uE83Jc4fIWBgqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0460989',7.5,59728,'en','The Wind That Shakes the Barley','In 1920s Ireland young doctor Damien O\'Donovan prepares to depart for a new job in a London hospital. As he says his goodbyes at a friend\'s farm, British Black and Tans arrive, and a young man is killed. Damien joins his brother Teddy in the Irish Republican Army, but political events are soon set in motion that tear the brothers apart.','/yCb4LweL6U7KTgSda3Wb7vHiA9J.jpg','2006-06-23',127,'Released','War has cost them their innocence... Freedom will cost them their blood.','The Wind That Shakes the Barley',1116,5.3196,7.3,'6yvHe_ksnDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20391,_binary '\0','/aaGgm28mMBrX3iXviUIJv35Ysnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461336',5.9,2066,'es','Salvando al Soldado Pérez','La vida ha llevado a Julián Pérez por caminos equivocados, pero el destino le presentará a este hombre la oportunidad de encontrar su redención cuando es enviado a la misión más peligrosa y noble de toda su vida, una misión ordenada por la única autoridad que todavía respeta, su madre, Doña Elvira. Julián debe viajar hasta el otro extremo del mundo, a un lugar llamado Irak, a traer de vuelta vivo, a su hermano menor el soldado de infantería Juan Pérez. Con la promesa hecha, Julián Pérez regresa a su natal Sinaloa donde reclutará a un comando de elite, destinado a cumplir una misión suicida: viajar a Irak y salvar al soldado Pérez.','/ylXmX9vcP1W9La9FtOpV9OtXtMe.jpg','2011-03-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Saving Private Pérez',66607,2.0908,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20392,_binary '\0','/qeOvj6RyfXsUqej4lXKOjEFYyFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461613',6.7,1358,'en','Whole New Thing','Socially isolated by his parents, an androgynous teen enrolls in high school and develops a crush on his male teacher.','/58GCH9SepojAwKLtp23BuPMErb5.jpg','2005-09-15',92,'Released','Who was YOUR first crush?','Whole New Thing',14344,1.2441,5.8,'w4jldRJ4yss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20393,_binary '\0','/u6E3bMIleHpXDQ18LeYsu9poGjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461642',4.3,4477,'de','7 Zwerge - Der Wald ist nicht genug','Snow White asks the seven dwarfs for help, because if they don\'t manage to find out the name of a little boy (Rumpelstiltskin) within two days, her newborn child will be taken away from her. The journey takes the dwarves to a depressive, rhyming Pinocchio and the omniscient wizard Helge, among others, and all the way to the world of humans.','/x9fLyw1ihuyLodGnHvfFoKWq2su.jpg','2006-10-25',95,'Released',NULL,'7 Dwarves: The Forest Is Not Enough',10036,2.2221,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20394,_binary '\0','/xzFUKyogQNR8UwfNF4V47v92B29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461694',7.3,7716,'de','Vier Minuten','Jenny is young. Her life is over. She killed someone. And she would do it again. When an 80-year-old piano teacher discovers the girl’s secret, her brutality and her dreams, she decides to transform her pupil into the musical wunderkind she once was.','/qZusVWgu0Df9hD4JbT0R2yYL2ya.jpg','2006-06-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Four Minutes',1294,2.7528,6.8,'NK0RUwMLQw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20395,_binary '\0','/lQSDQZ7qL2Tiq5Guoovtv2uhjrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461703',4.5,14302,'en','Skinwalkers','Creatures, bound by the blood of the wolf, that can kill with curses and move at lightening speed, watching the night sky for the rise of the blood-red crescent moon. They are SKINWALKERS. They feed on our flesh and thirst for the taste of human blood. The red moon signals each pack, divided by principles, hell bent to survive an ancient prophecy.','/88YhyDVF1XYn7e7cM01UDmaGvMV.jpg','2006-03-20',110,'Released','For them to live, we must die.','Skinwalkers',14219,3.8929,5.1,'Jm3h9A_4ypg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20396,_binary '\0','/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461770',7.1,226954,'en','Enchanted','The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn\'t operate on a \"happily ever after\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?','/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg','2007-11-20',107,'Released','The real world and the animated world collide.','Enchanted',4523,15.9518,6.8,'rwTNJgffMco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20397,_binary '\0','/dG029SfXDwXDeUAvw9h5bpbsKU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461795',6.9,2394,'ko','극장전','In Seoul, a suicidal student meets a young woman who decides to join him in his fatal gesture. Dongsoo, an unsuccessful filmmaker, spots a beautiful young woman, who happens to be the lead actress in the film he has just seen. Their stories will cross paths thanks to their love for cinema.','/8YrfSqpiTtJvmYqstkFHyzX5SEe.jpg','2005-05-27',89,'Released',NULL,'Tale of Cinema',85550,2.0524,6.7,'BtREmJ8nLp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20398,_binary '\0','/jEOSmfYg365ievQ1GTXWwRMeasK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461857',7.6,1337,'ja','運命じゃない人','In one long Friday evening, Takeshi Miyata, a straight-arrow businessman, will encounter a number of people (some only fleetingly) who have intertwining fates.','/9aiQ5n0nPBvPEW922x2RHQR1yM6.jpg','2005-07-16',98,'Released',NULL,'A Stranger of Mine',38977,1.1143,6.8,'a8Gbg3GDogE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20399,_binary '\0','/f7ipX1Uc9XJFf2skYp4zptqVzS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461894',6.3,2880,'es','7 vírgenes','It is summertime in a blue-collar, marginal district of a city in the South of Spain. Tano, a teenager currently serving a sentence in a juvenile reform center, is given a 48-hour leave to attend his brother’s wedding.','/aIGNKsJFfaxIOtxjcLT0uy1HBLU.jpg','2005-10-14',86,'Released',NULL,'7 Virgins',481,1.9733,6.1,'47huIkkd6wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20400,_binary '\0','/edCPKBBiWwiLnvMyDwpDeEHL0Oz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461936',7.2,45012,'hi','डॉन','DCP DeSilva sees a way to bring to justice the feared head of a criminal empire by recruiting a man named Vijay, who looks exactly like the crime boss. The ruse works too well, and soon Vijay finds his life in danger when DeSilva, the only one who knows his true identity, dies.','/1d52h7aDRlc5IPUFno24XPNT6hA.jpg','2006-10-20',178,'Released','The Chase Begins Again','Don',17501,2.7176,6.929,'_cJRiAfr2PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20401,_binary '\0','/5SMfN1mRJM0OpsbhdwtXt1NBZFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461946',6,2077,'en','Everything\'s Gone Green','Ryan, a good-natured slacker, is tempted into a money laundering scheme while working for a lottery magazine. A capitalistic comedy that asks the question - when is \"enough\" enough?','/4UkXUnbb6xTgA2oamLKmZ2Kga21.jpg','2006-04-13',95,'Released','A new sort of comedy.','Everything\'s Gone Green',13164,1.6517,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20402,_binary '\0','/kVrb3FalKLxI0VSkKJwrIxlwye9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461970',6.5,1721,'th','คําพิพากษาของมหาสมุทร','After inadvertently killing his girlfriend, a man flees Macau for Thailand in an attempt to cope with his guilt, and avoid possible arrest. But the relocation doesn\'t prevent his problems from following him, as his new friends could be potential enemies.','/hkLRQNDOpaFRj8xyW6aTBhFxyLX.jpg','2006-03-02',115,'Released',NULL,'Invisible Waves',38025,1.1219,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20403,_binary '\0','/rujhbZDRXfSGZZHpWbIrsgbSKKx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0461989',6.5,2574,'en','The Magician','Following the dealings of Melbourne-based hitman Ray as seen through the eyes of his ex-neighbour and friend Max, an Italian film student. Max and his camera witness Ray\'s work life as it unfolds from day to day, giving an insight into a world we rarely see, and at the same time developing an unusual friendship with his subject.','/jWbwXZEmtOtftuRJ5C6RcmEaHlx.jpg','2005-06-18',85,'Released','He can make people disappear.','The Magician',14096,2.0523,6.4,'Jk8bPiTSKbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20404,_binary '\0','/yQGE8e3YkQgVpCkWeidjXhzxOvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462002',6.2,1506,'it','N - Io e Napoleone','Elba island, 1814. Martino is a young teacher, idealist and strongly anti Napoleon, in love with the beautiful and noble Baroness Emily. The young man finds himself serving as librarian to the Great Emperor in exile, whom he deeply hates, yet soon begins recording Napoleon\'s memoirs, getting to know and learning to value the man behind the myth. Among seductions and affairs, expectations and fears, he will craft a precise portrait that nevertheless will not manage to hide a final, inevitable, disappointment.','/xPVy5Jp7Lwc9RSnYGlJHM2EoggK.jpg','2006-10-13',110,'Released',NULL,'Napoleon and Me',24180,2.1586,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20405,_binary '\0','/16I2tmk4PNUgUYFd6cZSpClrJqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462023',6.6,4474,'en','Romulus, My Father','The story of Romulus, his beautiful wife, Christina, and their struggle in the face of great adversity to bring up their son, Raimond. It is a story of impossible love that ultimately celebrates the unbreakable bond between father and son.','/zejOjdvgaTlgDgDgTyaOFglSC5t.jpg','2007-05-31',104,'Released',NULL,'Romulus, My Father',14066,2.6858,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20406,_binary '\0','/qhbyin76W9z8sIUFNkgwrkQkbY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462160',4.6,3241,'en','Dead Tone','As another semester draws to a close at the University of Dreyskill, a simple game dreamt to help students avoid studying becomes a bloody battle for survival.','/63iXUIgEqUjfXz2AvD3QPUgYx0r.jpg','2007-05-16',100,'Released','Play The Game. Obey The Rules. Pray For Mercy','Dead Tone',15476,3.1362,4.7,'Dx-ss-xkHzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20407,_binary '\0','/idh8hP15F2JCphljNEmMJTuFE44.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462193',4.2,1566,'en','The Beast of Bray Road','Based on actual accounts of werewolf sightings in Walworth County, Wisconsin, the film follows a local sheriff who is finally forced to accept that a string of horrifying deaths is linked to a predator which possesses DNA of both man and wolf.','/1OOJU4ANI6mSqfeZoydbMMe4IDh.jpg','2005-09-01',80,'Released',NULL,'The Beast of Bray Road',68509,1.4721,5.3,'s3pKwuY412E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20408,_binary '\0','/i8x7qxJvtROen1yny3270RtKgEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462200',6.9,69307,'en','Black Snake Moan','A God-fearing bluesman takes to a wild young woman who, as a victim of childhood sexual abuse, is looking everywhere for love, but never quite finding it.','/8Yv7kxsqXSe4ZHl8uJEhmsPjhAP.jpg','2006-12-31',116,'Released','Everything is hotter down south.','Black Snake Moan',7874,5.8907,6.8,'VYMqX3SKIGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20409,_binary '\0','/xsD985jyvQuSD1NZi1zWXCcLvCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462219',5.9,5143,'en','Camille','A twisted honeymoon adventure about a young couple on their way to Niagara Falls.','/1rRHC7aOlDiijXJHyy4hkwLdJck.jpg','2008-04-13',94,'Released','A romantic comedy about a marriage that truly is forever.','Camille',22419,2.2083,6.2,'TQSlPA9ZR74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20410,_binary '\0','/cMMjICzBe5qTx1igspFYdX8B3o2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462229',4.6,12622,'en','Code Name: The Cleaner','Cedric the Entertainer plays Jake, a seemingly regular guy who has no idea who he is after being hit over the head by mysterious assailants. When he finds himself entangled in a government conspiracy, Jake and his pursuers become convinced that he is an undercover agent.','/wSQkv51ygnds56lylNavYJzLmNZ.jpg','2007-01-05',84,'Released','In a dirty world, he\'s our only hope.','Code Name: The Cleaner',14396,3.2315,5.1,'Elup9kTFKhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20411,_binary '\0','/4axaWjt4z9KVBWplj7inBui5wd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462244',3.3,19063,'en','Daddy Day Camp','Seeking to offer his son the satisfying summer camp experience that eluded him as a child, the operator of a neighborhood daycare center opens his own camp, only to face financial hardship and stiff competition from a rival camp.','/fhuhSVb3j8SShe6FhnVUAfSRg6h.jpg','2007-08-08',89,'Released','The summer is going to be in tents.','Daddy Day Camp',14144,5.7526,4.9,'fNibbOj7mOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20412,_binary '\0','/wdEY6oQq9Dneza5pltGaX2akSas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462295',5.9,3603,'en','Flakes','Aspiring rock musician Neal Downs manages a cereal bar. Stylish Miss Pussy Katz is the creator of radically-themed art clothing. When the cereal bar, brings in an offbeat crew of locals, who debate the arcana of cereal history and ideal milk/flake ratios, an aspiring capitalist rips off their concept.','/2e5t3EUL0gwYs78Ah4XFGpfmJZl.jpg','2007-12-19',84,'Released','A tasty tale of love & war!','Flakes',13021,1.9255,5.1,'Gk_trsgy5_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20413,_binary '\0','/gRd7O8TRijlJK81ONZSEZfV4Ubn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462322',7.5,197799,'en','Grindhouse','Grindhouse combines Robert Rodriguez\'s Planet Terror, a horror comedy about a group of survivors who battle zombie-like creatures, and Quentin Tarantino\'s Death Proof, an action thriller about a murderous stuntman who kills young women with modified vehicles. It is presented as a double feature with fictitious exploitation trailers preceding each segment.','/tvMBwJlmQTIQf5EBjHzzyE9tjcN.jpg','2007-04-06',191,'Released','A double feature that\'ll tear you in two!','Grindhouse',285923,5.7788,7.007,'j1cjXKdox0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20414,_binary '\0','/gsqKgZbXmge1FR7KHBKM5AQ93mb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462335',5.5,47927,'en','High-Rise','Life for the residents of a tower block begins to run out of control.','/tNBHTOdIoeT5PMnt4TJpTm1nohG.jpg','2015-11-22',119,'Released','Leave the real world behind','High-Rise',254302,6.5952,5.6,'9LG801J-fnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20415,_binary '\0','/zLJT6nCsTPpo8vKEUwdpqXcSBAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462338',6.6,17798,'en','The Hoax','In what would cause a fantastic media frenzy, Clifford Irving sells his bogus biography of Howard Hughes to a premiere publishing house in the early 1970s.','/u5KESAGmNa5NLsSbpHVUDWT4ENR.jpg','2006-10-14',116,'Released','Never let the truth get in the way of a good story.','The Hoax',9903,3.9614,6.273,'djWXQ9Pz1OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20416,_binary '\0','/kpRHjVdvo9N3G3WAB9lIvft6SO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462346',5.4,6521,'en','How to Eat Fried Worms','During the first day of his new school year, a fifth grade boy squares off against a bully and winds up accepting a dare that could change the balance of power within the class.','/6064mXPZqFylDWcVKD888D3sN5T.jpg','2006-08-25',84,'Released','New town. New friends. New menu.','How to Eat Fried Worms',24115,3.1574,6.2,'9a0F82VJTsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20417,_binary '\0','/6pgRs8W4gFTsfF0hBmbKviEuqik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462359',3,2213,'en','Incubus','Stranded after a car accident, a medical school student and her friends try to find shelter - only to cross paths with a deranged killer.','/rSLsgcL6u2Y3tHrTdF1vowj7Nzr.jpg','2006-06-06',84,'Released','If you think you can escape, you\'re dreaming.','Incubus',68116,1.6269,3.6,'a5tvws_Xmh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20418,_binary '\0','/bqlK7X9Q3aEweZeG79pC1SAUzZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462362',5.2,1684,'en','The Insatiable','A drab, run-of-the-mill guy witnesses a vampiress devour a bum and becomes so infatuated with her, he tracks her down and traps her in a basement so she can\'t kill again.','/txo0FpcTi5OOQqfmVFhB8TjTv0t.jpg','2006-11-01',103,'Released','What if you were in love with something evil?','The Insatiable',32220,2.4621,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20419,_binary '\0','/c91oWpYWSx9uLv0h1PHc6aUqSVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462395',3.5,12693,'en','Larry the Cable Guy: Health Inspector','A slovenly cable repairman becomes a big-city health inspector and is tasked with uncovering the source of a food poisoning epidemic.','/vlPadYpBkSvgTbGFhYTDgacAOEM.jpg','2006-03-24',89,'Released',NULL,'Larry the Cable Guy: Health Inspector',15639,2.8499,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20420,_binary '\0','/tgaMo8q1HpGTbtpmJm8TYKTpOr4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462396',5.4,38535,'en','The Last Legion','As the Roman empire crumbles, young Romulus Augustus flees the city and embarks on a perilous voyage to Britain to track down a legion of supporters.','/k2jaEoOsTEMqSskBJm3gfcuxNEc.jpg','2007-04-19',102,'Released','The end of an empire...the beginning of a legend.','The Last Legion',9703,8.6242,5.6,'p-01n4dptzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20421,_binary '\0','/ndv5HqSo9Nn05nlfgV0cCnA2btY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462441',8.1,1519,'en','Amazing Journey: The Story of The Who','A documentary on The Who, featuring interviews with the band\'s two surviving members, Pete Townshend and Roger Daltrey.','/1c0gwzn18r3A1YGH2w13Ff3zs8o.jpg','2007-09-14',119,'Released',NULL,'Amazing Journey: The Story of The Who',53204,1.7411,7.1,'AmLQaqX3-5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20422,_binary '\0','/3b973tk8kA9tiY85ppxPxpXIrP3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462465',6.2,82290,'en','Outlander','During the reign of the Vikings, a man from another world crash-lands on Earth, bringing with him an alien predator. The man must fuse his advanced technology with the weaponry of the vikings to fight the monster.','/nCZzrFonDkWfYkfxzsPByBY4Lvk.jpg','2008-04-24',115,'Released','It destroyed his world. He won\'t let it destroy ours.','Outlander',10529,6.914,6.5,'bwUB35s_hP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20423,_binary '\0','/e6OHi0av9ZKvWDtlzbn7EdtegYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462477',7.4,6056,'en','Pierrepoint: The Last Hangman','Following in his father\'s footsteps, Albert Pierrepoint becomes one of Britain\'s most prolific executioners, hiding his identity as a grocery deliveryman. But when his ambition to be the best inadvertently exposes his gruesome secret, he becomes a minor celebrity & faces a public outcry against the practice of hanging. Based on true events.','/4UtVig6YXpZ06AoLUIiC1hMJVu4.jpg','2005-12-07',98,'Released','1940\'s England. When the world needed a hero, he gave them what they wanted. But history can be cruel.','Pierrepoint: The Last Hangman',15185,2.2531,7.1,'cPHSw2X22Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20424,_binary '\0','/jtnFTuRejS925CJkXf3MNCqtT8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462485',6,9946,'en','Poultrygeist: Night of the Chicken Dead','When the American Chicken Bunker, a military themed fast food restaurant, builds its latest chain restaurant on the site of an ancient Native American burial ground, the displaced spirits take revenge on unsuspecting diners and transform them into chicken zombies! Now, it’s up to a dimwitted counter boy, his collegiate lesbian ex-girlfriend and a burqa-wearing fry cook to put an end to the foul feathered menace once and for all.','/vSeehH4s274kdZXEMKnPE2tlqco.jpg','2006-12-26',103,'Released','Humans... the other white meat...','Poultrygeist: Night of the Chicken Dead',17287,2.7896,5.87,'bLp1JJWJ5l4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20425,_binary '\0','/wzfTG1obTazlGXiIcfRIviBZ1QU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462499',7,258510,'en','Rambo','In Thailand, ex-Green Beret John James Rambo joins a group of mercenaries to venture into war-torn neighboring Myanmar to rescue a group of Christian aid workers who have been kidnapped by a ruthless local infantry unit.','/3mInub5c8o00H7EJ1TrjAqOzIuc.jpg','2008-01-24',92,'Released','Live for nothing, or die for something.','Rambo',7555,13.22,6.7,'2oVMgRVk4lE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20426,_binary '\0','/q4RamDqx4kXCrUvk49o4FmVBbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462504',7.2,117449,'en','Rescue Dawn','A US Fighter pilot\'s epic struggle of survival after being shot down on a mission over Laos during the Vietnam War.','/ymPlV2ymUBSctfRzpehFOxFmJiS.jpg','2007-06-23',125,'Released','A true story of survival... declassified.','Rescue Dawn',9952,6.3291,7,'oByaEHTGBUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20427,_binary '\0','/tYvVy9fZWkvWHiNe8qzXDGvvMIt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462517',3.6,1485,'en','Haunted Forest','The Indian descendent Sean comes to a forest with his friends Josh and Flipp trying to find the track to a mysterious cursed tree and a secret burial ground.','/x6AqBfOh10YRkXWXryYzztJEa3M.jpg','2007-06-27',81,'Released',NULL,'Haunted Forest',39171,0.8316,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20428,_binary '\0','/KT4E9HZWkx0rqEnoTWyNhInqPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462519',5.9,32020,'en','School for Scoundrels','In the hope of winning the woman of his dreams, Amanda, lovelorn meter-reader Roger Wadell enrolls in a secret confidence-building class. The course\'s title takes on much more meaning when he discovers that his egomaniacal professor Dr. P also wants the same woman. They begin a fierce rivalry that quickly spirals out of control, their pranks and insults get uglier as they try to prove who is the ultimate guy\'s guy.','/ffudFsgDUBfxbesYELDIrNtKdkz.jpg','2006-09-29',100,'Released','Life\'s a game. Learn how to play.','School for Scoundrels',9842,3.6653,5.474,'H3tN-udFc3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20429,_binary '\0','/8ln5VUVk7gnNGIb2VNgw8nICDVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462538',7.3,365542,'en','The Simpsons Movie','After Homer accidentally pollutes the town\'s water supply, Springfield is encased in a gigantic dome by the EPA and the Simpsons are declared fugitives.','/s3b8TZWwmkYc2KoJ5zk77qB6PzY.jpg','2007-07-25',87,'Released','See our family. And feel better about yours.','The Simpsons Movie',35,16.9721,7.023,'XPG0MqIcby8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20430,_binary '\0','/q2ZFyrDHq7vDk0buN4DE9ch6HQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462570',7.5,8017,'es','Tiempo de valientes','Mariano is a psychologist who must fulfill community service after losing a lawsuit by a traffic accident. He is forced to provide therapeutic support to Alfredo, a policeman depressed over his wife cheating on him. Mariano is then accidentally involved in a double homicide investigation being conducted by Alfredo.','/ZZ00teEWJMPEAqSYJ6xIxNTu4q.jpg','2005-09-29',112,'Released','Times change, so do heroes','On Probation',78237,1.5225,7.5,'Nx6TTK7PRiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20431,_binary '\0','/k3AGi4UD8Ql2dKosXh6FrBSKm0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462590',6.5,135560,'en','Step Up','Delinquent Tyler Gage receives the opportunity of a lifetime after vandalizing a performing arts school, gaining him the chance to earn a scholarship and dance with up-and-coming dancer Nora.','/fmw52kXk2kN8AQil7tgOD41gt4Q.jpg','2006-08-11',104,'Released','Every second chance begins with a first step.','Step Up',9762,8.6946,6.879,'2_g--dceQoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20432,_binary '\0','/ftpahi3HNNuyx2WrYQaJZ6uQ9yS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462667',5.8,1834,'fr','Les Brigades du Tigre','The film, set in 1912, is about the exploits of France\'s first motorized police brigade.','/2l1t2c2WySP5pxK5dTNr0HWAtor.jpg','2006-04-14',125,'Released','Paris. 1912. If you thought it was \"La Belle Epoque\"....Think again.','The Tiger Brigades',16276,2.6245,5.6,'8O2TDL3gO4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20433,_binary '\0','/8twIJYyRgWqAszl8PqSHwpF3UNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462684',6.5,1343,'ko','혈의 누','When a small island village is plagued with horrible murders, the government sends a special investigator who discovers dark secrets that trace back to a myriad of murders from the past.','/nMp2NCtAcU3tA2w4l4AKOdraXJD.jpg','2005-05-04',119,'Released','Period crime thriller.','Blood Rain',45089,1.5889,7,'UuKG-RNW0Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20434,_binary '\0','/ldL0NVRlRxUFtRnnw68mic0ExYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0462703',5.9,2266,'ko','남극일기','Arctic cold and paranoia take their toll as Korean explorers are beset by the same strange occurrences that preceded the disappearance of a British team in 1922.','/jnfYwQUnvdNLNV1nm2n20b6y6mH.jpg','2005-05-19',114,'Released','Point of impossibility where the Antarctic becomes madness.','Antarctic Journal',49190,1.4199,6,'QocFZxYjJxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20435,_binary '\0','/hkpLSTQGkRd9KQGrx18mrFdLJTr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463027',4.7,3443,'en','Descent','Following a brutal assault, a college co-ed\'s life spirals until she encounters her assailant while working as a dancer. The predator has become the prey, and the prey has set her sights on revenge.','/qYYfg0EB5vkEC4QZhJ5wFZZKhj1.jpg','2007-08-10',110,'Released','Revenge is seductive','Descent',21373,2.117,4.3,'YFct6L1xDEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20436,_binary '\0','/muMAXHW2RknY5kA9VCmFhVHLkYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463034',5.6,87278,'en','You, Me and Dupree','After standing in as best man for his longtime friend Carl Petersen, Randy Dupree loses his job, becomes a barfly and attaches himself to the newlywed couple almost permanently -- as their houseguest. But the longer Dupree camps out on their couch, the closer he gets to Carl\'s bride, Molly, leaving the frustrated groom wondering when his pal will be moving out.','/rtqbg1CKR4dFdmHxmsiM3u9n71I.jpg','2006-07-13',108,'Released','Two\'s company. Dupree\'s a crowd.','You, Me and Dupree',1819,8.2451,5.6,'TluIBiITdkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20437,_binary '\0','/eojywftaqRVeCNvMg8Ah9RsjH9g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463345',5.9,3730,'es','La mujer de mi hermano','After almost 10 years of marriage, attractive Zoe discovers that her marriage lacks passion and surprise, and is seduced by the possibility of finding those sensations already forgotten in her husband\'s brother. From this premise a series of events lead these three characters to a dangerous game of revenges, secrets and passions. Two brothers and one woman: the triangle is outlined in a disquieting way. It is a bomb that triggers family secrets, the contained rage of desire and the unmanageable power of love. An exciting story that subjugates the viewer from beginning to end. Even though Zoe/Sonia has been married to Ignacio/Ishan for about a decade, they are unable to have children. She wants to be intimate but he prefers to be ready for intimacy on Saturdays only, and she gets physically drawn to his artistic brother, Gonzalo/Rohan. Then things get complicated for her after she tests positive for motherhood and finds that her husband may be gay.','/kTfrtrBjmJABhC0micyNUEjzyv4.jpg','2005-11-04',89,'Released',NULL,'My Brother\'s Wife',50724,3.9784,6.5,'bEYmz74dZCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20438,_binary '\0','/vRdeN3ISZbgmCuD25zOaG0Kfkk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463381',6.6,2947,'fr','Transylvania','Zingarina arrives in Transylavania, accompanied by her close friend Marie and her guide and interpreter Luminitsa. She is not there only to visit this region of Romania but to trace her lover Milan, a musician who has made her pregnant and who left her without a word of explanation. When she finds him back, he brutally rejects her and Zingarina is terribly upset. She leaves her two companions and having become a wreck she hardly survives by following a wandering little girl. Her destiny changes for the best when she meets Tchangalo, a traveling trader...','/t6FJHhhi1sHtimPTLdaC4c2gNUr.jpg','2006-09-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Transylvania',32604,1.4102,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20439,_binary '\0','/hArxqEmvBXXgQCiBzTzNRkIIoml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463486',6.3,3231,'fr','L\'Ivresse du pouvoir','Magistrate Jeanne Charmant-Killman doggedly investigates CEO Michel Humeau, who is accused of participating in massive corporate malfeasance. As her investigation leads her into the upper echelons of government, Jeanne becomes intoxicated by the power she is amassing.','/8GqEwYLdnDjoMWXv8FARBhnC1VR.jpg','2006-02-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Comedy of Power',12713,2.4244,6.3,'-OUcjLx4WpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20440,_binary '\0','/vBUGlIQ92PlpUwxIWb7QBThXBeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463622',7.3,1843,'ml','നരന്‍','Velayudhan, an orphan, is loved by the people in his village, as he keeps it free from unsavoury people and practices. But the local moneylender and politician get jealous and try to get rid of him.','/qW2lHQDelSLMbQO69DBsedIvyGX.jpg','2005-09-05',165,'Released',NULL,'Naran',151639,1.1265,6.212,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20441,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463650',6.9,1258,'ml','പാണ്ടിപ്പട','Bhuvana wishes to sell his land to clear his debts. However, his life takes a turn for the worse when he finds himself caught in the power battle between two landlords.','/3l5uMxVWzT5SMwv9AUhEFoGjZgE.jpg','2005-07-04',148,'Released',NULL,'Pandippada',350787,1.7886,6.735,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20442,_binary '\0','/83ownpZPvBHJD5UVNShzQfa3LaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463854',6.8,368415,'en','28 Weeks Later','Twenty-eight weeks after the spread of a deadly rage virus, the inhabitants of the British Isles have lost their battle against the onslaught, as the virus has killed everyone there. Six months later, a group of Americans dare to set foot on the Isles, convinced the danger has passed. But it soon becomes all too clear that the scourge continues to live, waiting to pounce on its next victims.','/oix0aNv1lvW3nUGspUyvSIBlpbs.jpg','2007-04-26',99,'Released','When days turn to weeks...','28 Weeks Later',1562,16.055,6.592,'cH-9OTWwjxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20443,_binary '\0','/2PuEmuXQF3XQZp8Ki2mGJXUGEOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463872',5.3,35452,'fr','Astérix aux Jeux olympiques','Astérix and Obélix have to win the Olympic Games in order to help their friend Alafolix marry Princess Irina. Brutus uses every trick in the book to have his own team win the game, and get rid of his father Julius Caesar in the process.','/eNB2SrqmTJLByRDq3akDzA6Z9rC.jpg','2008-01-25',116,'Released',NULL,'Asterix at the Olympic Games',2395,6.3455,5.2,'I4IwYe5N1o0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20444,_binary '\0','/xdKyOK8MUGRskRSupZilrn7X2Ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463903',7,1815,'cn','Be with Me','Three tales of love wrap around the true story of a blind and deaf woman named Theresa Chan. In the first an elderly shopkeeper is devoted to his sick wife. In the second, two teenage girls become soul mates and lovers. In the third a chubby security guard tries to find the courage to woo a beautiful woman who works in his building.','/sP2Dmq7pANMhPxl8fbl04fxQHYH.jpg','2005-05-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Be with Me',29965,0.7507,6.1,'SURPbfYqNt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20445,_binary '\0','/neu8M7iKr6gDNHwgIT9HWHkympe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463935',3.4,1562,'en','Candy Stripers','After a car crash, Tammy and injured basketball players are hospitalized. When a nurse kisses dying Tammy, an alien infection spreads through the hospital staff and patients. The facility is quarantined as infected people seek sugar.','/6RtNbXjAm6MAPaGz0JtlzPrwOU4.jpg','2006-06-27',89,'Released','They\'re running out of patients.','Candy Stripers',53335,2.0692,5.1,'PqhpwzF2TRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20446,_binary '\0','/pNoIV82gHnnluCUFvJyXQU1dRJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463960',3.3,2055,'en','The Devil You Know','Kathryn Vale is a reclusive ex-movie star with a dark secret and a daughter hoping to follow in her mother\'s movie-star footsteps. When Kathryn attempts to make a career comeback, she is threatened by an anonymous blackmailer. The resulting events force Kathryn to confront the truth about herself and those around her.','/5Mg2mCW1oW5wlcSYva74bEjNyZl.jpg','2013-07-09',76,'Released','Every Family Has Its Secrets.','The Devil You Know',206349,2.2774,4.189,'7xbH_cEgpQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20447,_binary '\0','/dMARcKLrv0T7kVJ4iQR3vqTTdtT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463985',6.1,338657,'en','The Fast and the Furious: Tokyo Drift','In order to avoid a jail sentence, Sean Boswell heads to Tokyo to live with his military father. In a low-rent section of the city, Sean gets caught up in the underground world of drift racing','/46xqGOwHbh2TH2avWSw3SMXph4E.jpg','2006-06-03',104,'Released','On the streets of Tokyo, speed needs no translation.','The Fast and the Furious: Tokyo Drift',9615,7.0091,6.559,'K6RWbKMSDcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20448,_binary '\0','/oVCyqxwLkRPJC51w89Dwp6VL9vk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0463998',7.6,93684,'en','Freedom Writers','A young teacher inspires her class of at-risk students to learn tolerance, apply themselves, and pursue education beyond high school.','/81AdeUQT99N0xPg3j6RVh0YGOTk.jpg','2007-01-05',123,'Released','Their story. Their world. Their future.','Freedom Writers',1646,12.4927,7.934,'miz1V13QWsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20449,_binary '\0','/97PwLIedtl0kutNHcdcJ9jLSGD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464029',7.2,7201,'bs','Grbavica','A woman and her daughter struggle to make their way through the aftermath of the Balkan war.','/hzLRMGaQ9v3QDMSimCE12aBtJzG.jpg','2006-03-01',90,'Released','A mother. A daughter. A past that cannot stay buried.','Grbavica: The Land of My Dreams',317,1.8469,6.888,'hQiMvSdLk_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20450,_binary '\0','/YPN2Rpm3aTddvF5gJaSgo5Pb9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464038',6.6,2069,'ja','花よりもなほ','In a poor district of Edo lives a young samurai named Soza. He has been sent by his clan to avenge the death of his father. He isn\'t an accomplished swordsman however, and he prefers sharing the life of the residents, teaching the kids how to write etc. When he finally finds the man he is looking for, he will have to decide whether he follows the way of the samurai or chooses peace and reconciliation.','/AiJc6rbau0KNqhcp8GeGdIla6il.jpg','2006-06-03',127,'Released',NULL,'Hana',20525,1.7057,6.6,'TAPnbgdPNS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20451,_binary '\0','/g3aLgQI4aw7aCucYSqXM4CzNYMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464041',6,20627,'en','The Lazarus Project','After Ben Garvey foolishly turned back to crime, he thought his life was over when he was sentenced to death by lethal injection. But his death sentence isn\'t quite what it seems, as Ben regains consciousness near an eerie psychiatric ward, where he\'s told he\'s been hired as the groundskeeper. With the state of his soul in question, and the love for his wife and daughter all the more real and powerful, Ben must figure out if he\'s truly cheated death, or if he\'s become part of something far more sinister.','/qxf1AkFJskLrBM2WGwf8FpGcbiu.jpg','2008-10-24',99,'Released','Cheating death is only the beginning','The Lazarus Project',13825,5.639,6,'9PnR562GsZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20452,_binary '\0','/A159OAi9EAU9v4l3sfMhpMqSK5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464049',6.8,22500,'en','The History Boys','The story of an unruly class of bright, funny history students at a Yorkshire grammar school in pursuit of an undergraduate place at Oxford or Cambridge. Bounced between their maverick English master, a young and shrewd teacher hired to up their test scores, a grossly out-numbered history teacher, and a headmaster obsessed with results, the boys attempt to pass.','/klybhTU75GUcQbzdVXUhsZgq1EV.jpg','2006-10-02',109,'Released','History. It\'s just one bloody thing after another.','The History Boys',8618,3.7479,6.6,'Wr0gGySdMkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20453,_binary '\0','/udr5oGwXsCj9uYIodBPk6zXcEzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464061',5.7,4618,'en','I\'m Reed Fish','When an old high school crush returns to his small hometown, Reed Fish\'s once simple, calculated life begins to unravel. A drunken incident prompts Reed\'s fiancée and the entire town to turn against him.','/uAKVpiAKzqwfkqZgckoI1mGcrmT.jpg','2007-06-01',93,'Released','Reed Fish\'s life turns into chaos when a high school crush returns on the eve of his marriage to the small town\'s sweetheart.','I\'m Reed Fish',41044,3.3798,5.58,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20454,_binary '\0','/owrq4LDAQ3bZPkbGexJjWot8AYf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464071',7.1,4685,'ta','சில்லுனு ஒரு காதல்','Gowtham and Kundhavi married then she finds a diary from his time at college, five years earlier. She thinks he would rather be married to Aishwarya, his college sweetheart, so she makes arrangements for them to meet again.','/vMReGYKwnxSqmItDRKYiOiqmyku.jpg','2006-09-08',160,'Released',NULL,'Sillunu Oru Kaadhal',69635,1.4322,6.66,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20455,_binary '\0','/gVLGeaIeFscIQ3pdGCCmM3swotk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464105',7,3932,'en','Man Push Cart','Every night while the city sleeps, Ahmad, a former Pakistani rock star turned immigrant, drags his heavy cart along the streets of New York. And every morning, he sells coffee and donuts to a city he cannot call his own. One day, however, the pattern of this harsh existence is broken by a glimmer of hope for a better life.','/hGhGa4O6ztK5r3SeFlEmYZE7EUZ.jpg','2006-05-10',87,'Released',NULL,'Man Push Cart',5717,1.1477,6.9,'-kkm5IrfMLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20456,_binary '\0','/lDtEHoIn1MmH6uL5ZmOohOfO6GI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464106',7.2,3349,'ta','மன்மதன்','When Mythili meets Madhan, she\'s at once attracted towards and terrified of him since he looks exactly like the serial killer from her nightmares.','/wI6xh3sukAIkZqsDR2PHUo9hOd7.jpg','2004-11-12',160,'Released','Only God can judge him.','Manmadhan',69627,1.202,5.952,'LZ-gqoiGliY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20457,_binary '\0','/g6pNnKmvTkNlEvn0ScwstYvhFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464141',7.4,171781,'es','El orfanato','A woman brings her family back to her childhood home, which used to be an orphanage, intent on reopening it. Before long, her son starts to communicate with a new invisible friend.','/vIpi1KtHLXUOfSVC2m6MqpjSPgL.jpg','2007-05-20',105,'Released','A tale of love. A story of horror.','The Orphanage',6537,8.5312,7.2,'t-OlnNqnddQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20458,_binary '\0','/AF0PiDItegyUtlBGDMGlSQbtro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464154',5.5,103165,'en','Piranha 3D','Each year the population of sleepy Lake Victoria, Arizona explodes from 5,000 to 50,000 residents for the annual Spring Break celebration. But then, an earthquake opens an underwater chasm, releasing an enormous swarm of ancient Piranha that have been dormant for thousands of years, now with a taste for human flesh. This year, there\'s something more to worry about than the usual hangovers and complaints from locals, a new type of terror is about to be cut loose on Lake Victoria.','/o45mRbIDykJld6WktTuVtWm7s6E.jpg','2010-08-20',88,'Released','There\'s something in the water.','Piranha 3D',43593,10.7874,5.4,'AImr8U_7CX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20459,_binary '\0','/9c4soJ1f1IPAyoCj0CDwKNThsBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464160',7.1,16228,'hi','चुप चुप के','After surviving a suicide attempt in which his family and fellow villagers believe he drowned, a debt-ridden man decides to start his life afresh in another village. He pretends to be mute and starts working for a rich man where he falls in love with his mute daughter.','/daXoADAtEPis5bBvSrXVWfRa77X.jpg','2006-06-09',165,'Released',NULL,'Chup Chup Ke',19637,2.2638,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20460,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464162',3.3,1935,'te','కొమరం పులి','Puli joins the police force since he wants to avenge his father\'s murder at the hands of Al Saleem. He gets an opportunity to bring Al Saleem to justice after he saves the life of the PM of India.','/rTuRBrq4VPVSq0On20mYgOeW1ik.jpg','2010-09-10',163,'Released',NULL,'Komaram Puli',199800,1.1516,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20461,_binary '\0','/17V8xfI13uwhPePDoN2dzxzX9VF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464184',6.3,1685,'en','Sione\'s Wedding','Meet best friends Michael, Albert, Stanley and Sefa; the ladies\' man, the good boy, the weird one and the party boy. They\'re staring down the barrel of their thirtieth birthdays, but still act as if they\'re sixteen; they get drunk, they chase the wrong women and they have a remarkable record of misbehaving and causing chaos at every wedding they attend. But now Michael\'s younger brother Sione is getting married, and everything is about to change. Sione is their boy, the kid they used to look after, who grew up while they were still partying. And to ensure his big day isn\'t spoiled by his boys and their idiot antics, Sione has issued an ultimatum; the guys all have to bring dates to the wedding. And not just any dates; real girlfriends, someone they\'ve made a commitment to. They have one month. So just how hard can it be to get a date for your best boy\'s wedding?','/xDnYtSBp8W8DCp9xjJeyy9IBAeV.jpg','2006-03-29',97,'Released',NULL,'Sione\'s Wedding',13338,1.9222,6.2,'ZTc7TuVazy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20462,_binary '\0','/1lhFxRRadLuOirqN2THN7gZhJrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464196',6.4,43607,'en','Severance','Seven employees of an international weapons manufacturer are treated to a team-building weekend at the company’s newly built luxury spa lodge. Things quickly go awry as the colleagues find their corporate weekend sabotaged by a deadly enemy.','/yg1XRTyH5knwh3Tnij2sUV0ZZ5w.jpg','2006-05-19',96,'Released','Another bloody office outing.','Severance',5072,4.1892,6.3,'Yb6gBdtK9TQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20463,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464320',3.9,3605,'en','Wild Seven','In this darkly karmic vision of Arizona, a man who breathes nothing but ill will begins a noxious domino effect as quickly as an uncontrollable virus kills. As he exits Arizona State Penn after twenty-one long years, Wilson has only one thing on the brain, leveling the score with career criminal, Mackey Willis. As eccentric and intuitive as he is vicious, Mackey\'s own perfected criminal game will play right into the path Wilson has set for him. With the help of a prison bus driver, Lee Marvin, Wilson acts as a catalyst, putting a plan into action that will bring an untimely end to Mackey Willis. The problem is, nothing goes exactly as planned.','/y114dTPoqn8k2Txps4P2tI95YCS.jpg','2006-01-01',98,'Released','No Plan is perfect','Wild Seven',10006,1.2264,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20464,_binary '\0','/c1QOLYWiAO2jWev3F5zUV0IVT7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464636',6.8,1599,'ko','댄서의 순정','Chae-rin, who has come to Seoul from Yanbian after tricking as a sports dancer, becomes a partner of Yeong-sae who dreams of a coming back to field, and prepares for a dance competition.','/6oSuwlY5FHjzCltOgqVWsphY0KZ.jpg','2005-04-28',110,'Released','Turning twenty, longing to love…','Innocent Steps',50010,1.9363,6.438,'blEEF9on2FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20465,_binary '\0','/7Zx029d0X8xN9OSSBtyrmGtx4DH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464799',4.4,2700,'en','The Curse of King Tut\'s Tomb','Thousands of years ago, the great Child King Tutankhamen ruled. Few know the details of his life -- No one knows the secrets of his death. All that is about to change.Free -spirited archaeologist Danny Fremont (Casper Van Dien, Sleepy Hollow) is certain that if found, King Tut\'s Emerald Tablet would hold the power to control the world. Unfortunately, the only one who believes Fremont is his nemesis archaeologist Morgan Sinclair (Jonathan Hyde, Titanic), a member of a secret society who wants the tablet to harness unspeakable evil on the world and will stop at nothing to get it.','/lS8HiWOO7YcezktLKFmBJmitAzo.jpg','2006-04-11',170,'Released',NULL,'The Curse of King Tut\'s Tomb',15056,2.3493,5.1,'cqEYUdmFf1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20466,_binary '\0','/8RifFTTQ7XbR74owYUKPUsLM4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464828',6.4,2411,'fr','Quand j\'étais chanteur','Alain Moreau sings for one of the few remaining dance-bands in Clermont-Ferrand. Though something of an idol amongst his female audience he has a melancholic awareness of the slow disappearance of that audience and of his advancing years. He is completely knocked off balance when he meets strikingly attractive and much younger businesswoman Marion. She seems distant and apparently otherwise involved but soon shows quiet signs of reciprocating his interest.','/q2mwJ10bTevPwI7Sze4EP5XYxTm.jpg','2006-09-13',112,'Released',NULL,'The Singer',31325,2.2958,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20467,_binary '\0','/4ghgYQDO9MEYK8VDK1rYVlrO8LQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464907',6.5,2589,'en','The Boys & Girls Guide to Getting Down','Tongue-in-cheek look at 20-something singles clubbing and partying in L.A. Voice-over narration, charts and graphs, and visits to a research laboratory punctuate the story of a single night when groups of friends go out, drink alcohol, take drugs, dance and talk, and look for someone to go home with.','/2KDlKkjCKlGLdcltDI9ssamLj3.jpg','2007-03-23',92,'Released','A real life guide to sex, drugs, & bad behavior.','The Boys & Girls Guide to Getting Down',13170,1.8832,5.8,'xizY15m6PSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20468,_binary '\0','/mrRzR4Xbt64heUQF5YBMMfdMEXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464913',7,25612,'fr','OSS 117 : Le Caire, nid d\'espions','Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.','/dDVHVZVEbTV4JsB8ZjdXNmMK7rA.jpg','2006-04-19',99,'Released',NULL,'OSS 117: Cairo, Nest of Spies',15152,4.1943,7.2,'6T641no0uec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20469,_binary '\0','/9vMvm9GXW5XstQfpNKBBvy5mno0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0464955',7.4,1968,'hu','Fehér tenyér','Having suffered as a boy under a brutal Communist-era coach, champion Hungarian gymnast Miklos moves to Canada years later in search of a new start - only to find himself unwittingly perpetuating the very same cycle of abuse among his own pupils.','/4fZWMxdFaWBy0yOomDKGC2ygr4H.jpg','2006-01-15',97,'Released',NULL,'White Palms',35760,1.4129,7.079,'MNZXWh8MkP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20470,_binary '\0','/mVwHzPqOi5QlviMSDsOy0nEyicI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465142',5.5,25682,'en','American Dreamz','The new season of \"American Dreamz,\" the wildly popular television singing contest, has captured the country\'s attention, as the competition looks to be between a young Midwestern gal and a showtunes-loving young man from Orange County. Recently awakened President Staton even wants in on the craze, as he signs up for the potential explosive season finale.','/qwRbRvfJR7jjsaGfS741Tl3DRr7.jpg','2006-03-04',107,'Released','Imagine a country where more people vote for a pop idol than they do for their next President.','American Dreamz',9310,3.7136,5.1,'Q3jWiFc645c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20471,_binary '\0','/rXjSUFn6muQvKq78IQpiKFew2t9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465188',6.8,5338,'it','Nuovomondo','The story is set at the beginning of the 20th century in Sicily. Salvatore, a very poor farmer, and a widower, decides to emigrate to the US with all his family, including his old mother. Before they embark, they meet Lucy. She is supposed to be a British lady and wants to come back to the States. Lucy, or Luce as Salvatore calls her, for unknown reasons wants to marry someone before to arrive to Ellis Island in New York. Salvatore accepts the proposal. Once they arrive in Ellis Island they spend the quarantine period trying to pass the examinations to be admitted to the States. Tests are not so simple for poor farmers coming from Sicily. Their destiny is in the hands of the custom officers.','/gjSK4pyVDt8Pwt9KpB8OtC246DC.jpg','2006-09-22',118,'Released',NULL,'Golden Door',1993,2.9354,6.523,'v90thqbuu8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20472,_binary '\0','/xwSFvt9l7YilxS27wDmZuERIVrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465203',6.3,34111,'fr','Ils','Lucas and Clementine live peacefully in their isolated country house, but one night they wake up to strange noise. They\'re not alone... and a group of hooded assailants begin to terrorize them throughout the night.','/wqVy00nBhJRiHvlb3lFbmg6uEjj.jpg','2006-07-19',77,'Released','They\'re already inside.','Them',10832,2.513,6.1,'yFTbcDRkG1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20473,_binary '\0','/aqGVdM065tIcVmaMIeozk80lLf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465234',6.5,269541,'en','National Treasure: Book of Secrets','Benjamin Franklin Gates and Abigail Chase re-team with Riley Poole and, now armed with a stack of long-lost pages from John Wilkes Booth\'s diary, Ben must follow a clue left there to prove his ancestor\'s innocence in the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.','/xxoIBbvmTj1ZttzV439jAvoovTw.jpg','2007-12-19',124,'Released','The greatest adventure history has ever revealed.','National Treasure: Book of Secrets',6637,17.5176,6.383,'MBQm-ovrPho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20474,_binary '\0','/6IcKXawCxDd6QZ8CfQHamp3qFDO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465375',5.4,9073,'en','After Sex','Sex is a background to examine intimacy and vulnerability. Looks at the complexity of modern day relationships told through eight separate couples. Through dialogue and compromising situations, the film takes us from the beginning of a relationship to the aftermath of one, and examines every stage in between seeing humor within the drama, heartache and confusion of it all.','/4n41P5CKHFFkQ3s8VJieNmqUkn7.jpg','2007-09-26',77,'Released','Eight Couples. One Conversation.','After Sex',17097,4.4948,5.5,'I4RcvDavBvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20475,_binary '\0','/n7pj7eMjtajyIoiZgdITJwJOxok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465430',6.1,13855,'en','The Cottage','In a remote part of the countryside, a bungled kidnapping turns into a living nightmare for four central characters when they cross paths with a psychopathic farmer and all hell breaks loose.','/fFmU7cQAWVAeBpSfDRRauKgtKDD.jpg','2008-02-07',92,'Released','Sleeps Six Bloody Comfortably','The Cottage',13849,2.9811,6,'q1DIFtBcozI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20476,_binary '\0','/jWRS1mKv4EhCv6N3XKLTCO5JQaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465436',6.5,12725,'en','December Boys','For many years, four teenage orphans at an Australian outback convent have watched their younger comrades find new parents, and realize that they may never be adopted. The Reverend Mother sends the four boys away on a seaside vacation, where they meet Teresa and Fearless, a couple who would make perfect parents. The youths compete with one another to be the one Teresa and Fearless decide to adopt.','/28Q3BZgCI8imvbC8qQWDAL0nqjR.jpg','2007-09-14',105,'Released','After that summer nothing would be the same.','December Boys',4629,3.7045,6.035,'6c00yTRIksM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20477,_binary '\0','/sFAqIqo3ZvsXXLdwXYUEjB6owZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465494',6.2,187920,'en','Hitman','A genetically engineered assassin with deadly aim, known only as \"Agent 47\" eliminates strategic targets for a top-secret organization. But when he\'s double-crossed, the hunter becomes the prey as 47 finds himself in a life-or-death game of international intrigue.','/h69UJOOKlrHcvhl5H2LY74N61DQ.jpg','2007-11-21',89,'Released','Most believe his very existence is a sin. But others know he is a necessary evil.','Hitman',1620,9.692,6.2,'7A0DuqGfXqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20478,_binary '\0','/tJxCziFetEsrDawcdPBGVkRlkJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465502',5.9,25233,'en','Igor','A cliché hunchbacked evil scientist\'s assistant aspires to become a scientist himself, much to the displeasure of the rest of the evil science community.','/mI4SPs0bZQm7bGVZKToC8KUsTd.jpg','2008-09-19',87,'Released','All men aren\'t created Evil.','Igor',14248,5.0257,6.1,'FfOjqkDIw0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20479,_binary '\0','/8j6GP3wOkUDIC7DZDsAyaDsr1el.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465538',7.2,185240,'en','Michael Clayton','A law firm brings in its \"fixer\" to remedy the situation after a lawyer has a breakdown while representing a chemical company that he knows is guilty in a multi-billion dollar class action suit.','/hhkW4yVIGo8Bee3UITKvqOvhNMG.jpg','2007-09-28',120,'Released','The truth can be adjusted.','Michael Clayton',4566,7.104,6.8,'5kJRYBhG43Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20480,_binary '\0','/cn1AjfcI8B2CxekvYYZWkLf5muE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465551',7.4,89942,'en','Notes on a Scandal','A veteran high school teacher befriends a younger art teacher, who is having an affair with one of her 15-year-old students. However, her intentions with this new \"friend\" also go well beyond platonic friendship.','/ymFybaA0r7MpwWnmUCFHYAT6Djb.jpg','2006-12-25',92,'Released','One woman\'s mistake is another\'s opportunity.','Notes on a Scandal',1259,8.3723,7.094,'AruRpjQquQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20481,_binary '\0','/uQ5xARQz6BiKlppKCBnKmkfW76m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465580',6.1,120139,'en','Push','After his father, an assassin, is brutally murdered, Nick Gant vows revenge on Division, the covert government agency that dabbles in psychic warfare and experimental drugs. Hiding in Hong Kong\'s underworld, Nick assembles a band of rogue psychics dedicated to destroying Division. Together with Cassie, a teenage clairvoyant, Nick goes in search of a missing girl and a stolen suitcase that could be the key to accomplishing their mutual goal.','/fHStfRjQGstuqtUz4Q22lbFU58M.jpg','2009-02-04',111,'Released','One push can change everything.','Push',13455,8.6565,6.149,'Pl3KNqCEtQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20482,_binary '\0','/1bYY2WUsHyCl66gQAGoF40JIryW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465602',6.6,159891,'en','Shoot \'Em Up','A man named Mr. Smith delivers a woman\'s baby during a shootout, and is then called upon to protect the newborn from the army of gunmen.','/hZ4p0MvSUWnCCL0IUn47UXTVPCs.jpg','2007-07-26',86,'Released','Just another family man making a living.','Shoot \'Em Up',4141,10.3056,6.505,'jlx4n_ibNZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20483,_binary '\0','/lJkE6khRc6QRl54kem7VbsRkL05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465624',5.2,69870,'en','My Super Ex-Girlfriend','When New York architect Matt Saunders dumps his new girlfriend Jenny Johnson—a smart, sexy, and reluctant superhero known as G-Girl—she uses her powers to make his life a living hell.','/j4NCuEfLHzIjaWDns5fz6nGH2FD.jpg','2006-07-20',95,'Released','He broke her heart. She broke his everything.','My Super Ex-Girlfriend',4474,8.2749,5.2,'7FY2efhRS4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20484,_binary '\0','/81oBTSu9C062cIGvytezqElUeGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465653',6.9,3305,'en','Under The Greenwood Tree','Set in a rustic English village in the mid 19th century, Under The Greenwood Tree tells the story of a poor young man who falls for a middle-class schoolteacher and attempts to win her over.','/dnlGljwFgEM8y76rgVy90XuKpWm.jpg','2005-12-26',93,'Released',NULL,'Under The Greenwood Tree',18091,1.9801,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20485,_binary '\0','/AcLIOBgNwZziegEEuAjpfoWsbKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465670',6.1,10989,'en','Wilderness','Juvenile delinquents are sent to a small British island after a fellow prisoner\'s death, where they must fight for survival.','/sLtUVG7ORbTJueTmIWpO4YeHayS.jpg','2006-08-11',94,'Released','It\'s not about revenge. It\'s about punishment.','Wilderness',11494,2.1503,6.132,'fmtOktd1yMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20486,_binary '\0','/lgXIXfZiedBtGu2gbzaRdeGMEHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465676',6.4,7420,'zh','夜宴','Crown Prince Wu Luan is in love with Little Wan but left heartbroken when she marries his father, the emperor. The emperor\'s brother, Li, kills him and Wu Luan tries to avenge his father\'s death.','/yXy5AUyBu74wWfY5zrIo3zJvjnd.jpg','2006-09-14',131,'Released','Nothing is more poisonous than the human heart.','The Banquet',14449,2.4927,6.1,'MrS6_3zEyjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20487,_binary '\0','/8wgapku0sALso1xmpa3IAyyTV6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0465967',7,3475,'ru','Добрыня Никитич и Змей Горыныч','Dobrinya Nikitich goes on a quest to save the royal niece and finds out whether his old friend Zmey Gorinich is loyal to him. During the adventures, he is accompanied by the royal messenger who\'s in love with the royal niece.','/2j5ZhYMPf45JYFswlkFhw9dLYd1.jpg','2006-03-16',68,'Released',NULL,'Dobrinya and the Dragon',33534,1.5435,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20488,_binary '\0','/qNcAkpb2c4go7IiKWoFeeUa6eBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466043',6.2,2524,'ru','Хоттабыч','Gena is a hacker by heart and soul. He\'s a good fella. But he got himself in some real troubles. And the only thing that can save him - is a thousand years old Djinni, who attempts to learn how to live in the modern world.','/p8cwhs5JTy47f45b5GdqhEatLvr.jpg','2006-08-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Khottabych',57775,1.071,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20489,_binary '\0','/m1sAvhUQm5LcyBCkdervhaXObdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466103',7.1,1855,'ru','Пыль','The genre of the film DUST could be called fantastic realism or existential drama with elements of the fantastic. Dust means the haste in which people live. Dust is a common misconception, the natural clogging up of the brain. Specks of dust how scientists perceive people, scientists who think they know more than anyone else about the universe.','/dFb2ROLP54V3AKN7wcC75HYY2GB.jpg','2005-06-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Dust',65104,0.8932,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20490,_binary '\0','/vORtOIuQMp3h3DCC6acfv1tsqhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466342',2.8,64696,'en','Date Movie','Spoof of romantic comedies which focuses on a man, his crush, his parents, and her father.','/xjLK0EmD0MAM7B049SRCUQaqkdL.jpg','2006-02-17',83,'Released','The feel-you-up movie of the year.','Date Movie',10073,5.595,4.3,'23QoNhfK_qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20491,_binary '\0','/9RxquFVMauG3Nrs0KNqjfe9M4d2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466399',6.9,5378,'en','Ten Canoes','A story within a story within a story. In Australia\'s Northern Territory, an Aboriginal narrator tells a story about his ancestors on a goose hunt. A youngster on the hunt is being tempted to adultery with his elder brother\'s wife, so an elder tells him a story from the mythical past about how evil can slip in and cause havoc unless prevented by virtue according to customary tribal law.','/uF9xjL2IJ6Wa9F8FQ1Is6Htu0Ka.jpg','2006-06-29',90,'Released','Ten canoes, three wives, one hundred and fifty spears...trouble','Ten Canoes',14064,1.9268,6.753,'tH_MY8FJuYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20492,_binary '\0','/1KgRxUZt7gCw4fRS1G8L5zBfjBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466449',5.7,1961,'da','De fortabte sjæles ø','14-year-old Lulu moves to a small provincial town with her mother and younger brother. One night, her brother is struck by a beam of white light - actually the spirit of Herman Hartmann from the 19th-century. To her despair, Lulu realizes that Herman has possessed her brother, and the two of them are whirled into a fevered adventure.','/xkuiAd022FPEkDn8hfGF3LuaxDV.jpg','2007-02-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Island of Lost Souls',13626,1.9568,5.4,'UYkeCCW9Evc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20493,_binary '\0','/kMCfLwxnUgcXaubNxj6n6ujzELG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466460',8.2,27522,'hi','खोसला का घोसला','Kamal Khosla\'s (Anupam Kher) peaceful retirement plan doesn\'t go as planned when his land is grabbed by a land shark, Khurana (Boman Irani). In a bid to retrieve their land, the dysfunctional family hatches a clever plan to con Khurana with the help of their friends.','/nYcqtbv8Be6qpTcl6Y7qp0hvVdh.jpg','2006-09-22',135,'Released','Aap Party Hai Ya Broker?','Khosla Ka Ghosla!',15412,1.3398,7.3,'B47BNrgLZtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20494,_binary '\0','/mXtaEpYybwNiPT3bp6qxyQrvgFd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466500',6.3,1398,'da','Råzone','Christina is living in a suburb to Copenhagen. With her class mates Cecilie, Trine and Pernille she slacks her school work, living mostly for the weekends of gate crashing, getting drunk, experimenting with drugs and scoring guys. But her world is turned upside down when Cecilie\'s boyfriend Shaid starts hitting on her, and Cecilie mistakenly believes the two of them are making out.','/oB4zssXDoRvs12N1uIL2cONXTH1.jpg','2006-07-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Life Hits',16010,2.0704,5.933,'BXB4EyxZk8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20495,_binary '\0','/qPLevjAwozIvKRvLMualxH5ug0c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466561',7.6,7240,'hr','Karaula','At a small border-post on the Yugoslav-Albanian border, yet another generation of soldiers suffering the usual amount of boredom awaits the end of their service, counting days to the moment when they should take their uniforms off for good. However, when their liuetenant is secretly diagnosed with siphilis, he decides to keep them at their positions in order to ensure a safe and secretive treatment by the medic, inventing a fictional military conflict as a means to keeping them in line.','/yfJ5rIiS8HRSZTJJ2lC2oKsOgSs.jpg','2006-03-20',94,'Released',NULL,'The Border Post',33591,1.1017,7,'kqWT9NDbNUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20496,_binary '\0','/uxpclhxEonCOczYS0FkCISecCq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466664',5.9,7937,'en','Alien Autopsy','Humouristic reconstruction of the 1995 scandal when two British lads were accused of having faked a documentary from the Roswell incident in 1947.','/obs8CV4EvarndVWaa9KPGkuaoxX.jpg','2006-04-07',95,'Released','Prepare To Be Stitched Up!','Alien Autopsy',9773,2.6805,5.7,'95ATa2eC6Fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20497,_binary '\0','/oLfj5JIL57ukthZ0ow2Q95cdQBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466665',5.5,1505,'en','The Architect','An architect engages in conflict with an activist who lives in a dangerous complex the architect designed.','/jYdvNcumrVzbjkhTr1Y68pKIWN.jpg','2006-12-01',82,'Released','Sometimes you need to tear down to build up.','The Architect',18590,2.371,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20498,_binary '\0','/9W1zS3z130FPSBaorxtE4MCmzDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466669',5.4,1236,'en','Almost Normal','A gay man approaching a mid-life crisis is tired of being different because he is gay. He wants to be normal. Suddenly he is yanked back in time to when he was in high school. But this time, the world is gay and to be straight is considered deviant behavior. Then something else happens. He meets a girl. And suddenly normal becomes ...well almost normal.','/4ERCU895RF078FrePLJS0djpUVg.jpg','2005-05-26',90,'Released','What if everyone in the world was gay? Except for you.','Almost Normal',32633,1.158,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20499,_binary '\0','/3JCCxDWWsO2sJUVkLqVKY77jYrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466713',5.1,1687,'de','Kein Bund für\'s Leben','The movie deals with a guy who gets to join the German Bundeswehr involuntarily because a colleague loses his denial papers in order to get the chance to get down on his girlfriend. When entering the Bundeswehr he acts like a giant idiot and of course gets in one room with some of the biggest losers around. The loser turns out to be a hero and leads his loser-colleagues to win a contest with the local US army squad.','/5v55XXxQjmFAaPKK3jrpyJxI3ZI.jpg','2007-08-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Military Academy',4436,1.9842,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20500,_binary '\0','/vG68qip0ZSJOqdmpFV2eqIvz5vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466766',4.5,5201,'en','Drive Thru','A high-school student must save townspeople from a murderous clown who works at a fast-food place.','/kvWbBxshh4cuXsfEeBq4EWGCFDi.jpg','2007-05-29',82,'Released','At Hella Burger, It Won\'t Be The Food That Kills You... But You\'ll Wish It Did.','Drive Thru',46302,3.0278,5.4,'h4iIC10-UjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20501,_binary '\0','/iB0Cl2Z1tgE5gXz7AOEw3spSACZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466771',5.4,3747,'en','Puff, Puff, Pass','Danny Masterson (TV\'s \'That \'70s Show\') leads a hilarious ensemble cast in a tale about two hapless stoners who get involved in a scheme to rip off a shady character named Mr. Big after the duo sours on rehab.','/buDnPO63q8yjQGWQ1pFbjaRDeGQ.jpg','2006-05-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Puff, Puff, Pass',24701,2.6485,5.6,'ypUM4sIfCJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20502,_binary '\0','/n0b9FqOTm58LUaDjeluVim3WBJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466816',6.9,13687,'en','Hallam Foe','Hallam\'s talent for spying on people reveals his darkest fears-and his most peculiar desires. Driven to expose the true cause of his mother\'s death, he instead finds himself searching the rooftops of the city for love.','/2RzhxbVNu4BaPx0ETCiuNUpjJf.jpg','2007-08-30',95,'Released','This is my story','Hallam Foe',2239,5.3948,6.672,'duZ4rj5-fpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20503,_binary '\0','/ggU8dYR1w14L8mSpbsdr3sT0wYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466839',5.9,21087,'en','I Could Never Be Your Woman','A mother falls for a younger man while her daughter falls in love for the first time.','/kL5krXuuIqIxoMRJ96KWMZbhvPU.jpg','2007-05-11',97,'Released','Find yourself in love.','I Could Never Be Your Woman',15019,5.6606,5.9,'vwGN7HVgE_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20504,_binary '\0','/9pAL0tNWbkNUJj42khYEK1Gah6Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466856',6.2,13132,'en','ATL','As four friends prepare for life after high school, different challenges bring about turning points in each of their lives. The dramas unfold and resolve at their local rollerskating rink, Cascade.','/wi9VRukGburXfDwDKqcQQdgFK5S.jpg','2006-03-31',107,'Released','A New American Story','ATL',13960,3.7881,7,'jHi9GK7fvkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20505,_binary '\0','/ugDpO1cu2RxL1URucxPLkT31KG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466893',6.5,19801,'en','Margaret','17-year-old Lisa feels certain that she inadvertently played a role in causing a traffic accident that claimed a woman\'s life. In her attempts to set things right, she meets with opposition at every step. Torn apart with frustration, she begins emotionally brutalizing her family, her friends, her teachers, and, most of all, herself. She has been confronted quite unexpectedly with a basic truth: that her youthful ideals are on a collision course with the realities and compromises of the adult world.','/zqBao8uRH6TQAJd13tqC22vPB76.jpg','2011-09-30',150,'Released',NULL,'Margaret',44754,3.8214,6.38,'g85NSsbzlyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20506,_binary '\0','/cIdt86pqHfSZQRduKh0xFvnqtwE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0466909',5.5,66615,'en','The Omen','A diplomatic couple adopts the son of the devil without knowing it. A remake of the classic horror film of the same name from 1976.','/kf1Qq9b32jn4umll9qD2ue5ftnh.jpg','2006-06-06',110,'Released','From the eternal sea he rises. Creating armies on either shore. Turning man against his brother. Until man exists no more.','The Omen',806,7.0985,5.644,'Eo38zL1kLko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20507,_binary '\0','/2lQ6tUnjZMgOSXonuXI45vOIwtk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467003',7.4,3001,'te','సై','The story is set in the backdrop of a college that is riven by two groups led by Prithvi and Shashank. Though there is nothing malicious between the groups, they just can\'t see eye to eye on anything. The only thing common between the two are their abiding passion for rugby. Whenever a problem crops between the two, it is usually settled with a bitter scrum on the rugby field. As it happens, the college land falls into the hands of a local dadha Bikshu Yadav. This is good enough reason for the two groups to forge a common identity and fight for the land. Prithvi and Shashank bury the hatchet and get back the land. This is too much of a bitter pill for the dadha to swallow. And so he dares the students for a rugby match with his own group.','/yetEKct1tQ1RDLQJKReaYirh5BI.jpg','2004-09-26',167,'Released','A Challenge','Sye',87614,2.8707,6.409,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20508,_binary '\0','/1BEuoA7UpCF51WpiIZ7rypAhxfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467110',4.8,23525,'en','Underdog','A lab accident gives a beagle named Shoeshine some serious superpowers -- a secret that the dog eventually shares with the young boy who becomes his owner and friend.','/pqGahPUmqrXbkeTQg7HCUa4VeHV.jpg','2007-08-03',84,'Released','NO NEED TO FEAR.. UNDERDOG IS HERE!','Underdog',6589,6.2552,5.555,'6jooThaqeYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20509,_binary '\0','/epq172QpUtzOXyCOpwJXDI1yoqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467167',5.3,4702,'en','Beneath','Christy returns to her hometown years after a car accident that disfigured her older sister. Haunted by the accident in which she was the driver, she learns that her worst nightmares have either come true ... or are about to.','/vgwq4t5GVmLqzhp3dmBTQHDWCn5.jpg','2007-08-07',82,'Released','Terror lives below.','Beneath',21623,2.2068,5.4,'L_2CWeIFblM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20510,_binary '\0','/8tXo6o4cYzFxKYZPEKamWhkvN7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467197',5.3,134933,'en','Max Payne','A DEA agent whose family was slain as part of a conspiracy, and an assassin out to avenge her sister\'s death, join forces to solve a series of murders in New York City.','/dxy17rpjiWVmhaGvMlScZj96i8h.jpg','2008-10-15',100,'Released','When a man has lost everything, he only has revenge.','Max Payne',13051,7.9287,5.4,'GklHaGfncJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20511,_binary '\0','/jovVe4UGpmQEAE6ZEmV5xa6Kk1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467200',6.7,128019,'en','The Other Boleyn Girl','A sumptuous and sensual tale of intrigue, romance and betrayal set against the backdrop of a defining moment in European history: two beautiful sisters, Anne and Mary Boleyn, driven by their family\'s blind ambition, compete for the love of the handsome and passionate King Henry VIII.','/q2lgC8mmAltWTkbqPM8n5EYF4XL.jpg','2008-02-28',116,'Released','Two sisters divided for the love of a king.','The Other Boleyn Girl',12184,8.2745,6.7,'2YoiWr-yvws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20512,_binary '\0','/sRXMmeNHTSWRYdDz3zaHNyyPJ0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467406',7.4,575444,'en','Juno','Faced with an unplanned pregnancy, sixteen year old high-schooler, Juno MacGuff, makes an unusual decision regarding her unborn child.','/jNIn2tVhpvFD6P9IojldI3mNYcn.jpg','2007-12-05',96,'Released','A comedy about growing up… and the bumps along the way.','Juno',7326,9.4654,7.064,'K0SKf0K3bxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20513,_binary '\0','/biWonOe1GrPEMqvXhr7FbLox6xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467421',5.8,11069,'en','Twitches','Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they\'re witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?','/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg','2005-10-14',86,'Released','This Halloween, broomsticks are so not happenin\'.','Twitches',21481,5.9961,6.741,'W4ruy5AYbkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20514,_binary '\0','/lf6XuB9ooZBv0pyigZcyZGheQBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0467923',6.5,1711,'ja','小さき勇者たち ～ガメラ～','A young boy in a peaceful seaside town gets more than he bargained for when he takes home a mysterious egg. When it hatches, out comes a baby turtle that grows into a new version of Gamera. But will it become powerful enough in time to defeat the rampaging monster Zedus?','/l54UBF2L5eEULpaoXtHhs6ffHSQ.jpg','2006-04-29',96,'Released','Gamera fights for the boy, the boy fights for Gamera.','Gamera the Brave',60160,1.5197,7,'l4DXlgD9LCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20515,_binary '\0','/cvTmNqTn7Or7cIq5Rl93gbiGpXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468094',7.4,11723,'en','The Road to Guantanamo','Part drama, part documentary, The Road to Guantánamo focuses on the Tipton Three, a trio of British Muslims who were held in Guantanamo Bay for two years until they were released without charge.','/deM5htQLvRjcRkeIFtaOdd5TDrC.jpg','2006-03-09',95,'Released','How far will we go in the name of security?','The Road to Guantanamo',7872,2.3833,6.8,'rCpbOAFQXUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20516,_binary '\0','/ghUdl0VYOJeoPiT4fbBfKWxTLuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468445',7.7,2320,'en','The Amazing Screw-On Head','Based on the award-winning comic book by Mike Mignola (creator of Hellboy), The Amazing Screw-On Head chronicles the adventures of a Civil War-era secret agent with an extraordinary special power who serves under president Abraham Lincoln.','/gTANNf43FKKxN5bEGNGIhBF9Wg2.jpg','2006-08-20',22,'Released','Put the screw to villainy.','The Amazing Screw-On Head',213110,1.4192,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20517,_binary '\0','/anmjFs06G0ovO05k9iiiQm5fqAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468461',3.4,1356,'en','Caved In: Prehistoric Terror','An extreme adventure tour group headed by deep caving expert John Palmer descends into a 2000 Ft abandoned salt mine , that was mysteriously closed down years ago after an unexplained disaster trapped all of the miners . They prepare for rock slides , blackouts , cave-ins - whatever might threaten their journey and commence their descent into the depths.','/rlox07SRKkf9bkU8Yv0w1iGpkjk.jpg','2006-01-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Caved In: Prehistoric Terror',36622,2.1084,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20518,_binary '\0','/tutGoHgPKTrgr1T6sfMZxN1V4E6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468489',7.1,96562,'en','Half Nelson','Despite his dedication to the junior-high students who fill his classroom, idealistic teacher Dan Dunne leads a secret life of addiction that the majority of his students will never know. But things change when a troubled student Drey makes a startling discovery of his secret life, causing a tenuous bond between the two that could either end disastrously or provide a catalyst of hope.','/fdUCisMpTwy0oJOGwM7NrFFs400.jpg','2006-08-11',107,'Released','Secrets don\'t let go.','Half Nelson',7859,5.4306,6.7,'BNdg2Ds3Fpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20519,_binary '\0','/m0wczZyNfWpu5q9wNuhFUGGiLxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468492',7.1,144594,'ko','괴물','A teenage girl is captured by a giant mutated squid-like creature that appears from Seoul\'s Han River after toxic waste was dumped in it, prompting her family into a frantic search for her.','/dEDLY3KeghKFzks5nTDWdigVikr.jpg','2006-07-27',120,'Released','Man has made his newest predator.','The Host',1255,8.049,7,'1HRTy26s4hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20520,_binary '\0','/t9lOz9dFflcHo3QjdtDND6cKGnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468526',6.8,10155,'en','Old Joy','Soon to be a father, Mark feels the pressure of domestic responsibility closing in, so he is more than happy to accept when his old friend Kurt proposes a camping trip in the Oregon wilderness. During their time together, the men come to grips with the changes in their lives and the effect on their relationship.','/AdFKZOf0LtPpGq8be9T8qsNHTbs.jpg','2006-03-25',74,'Released',NULL,'Old Joy',26518,1.9983,6.4,'2bf8GqDcx0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20521,_binary '\0','/rBOb3v35qgTXkNHkOW2UYiTZjPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468536',4.8,9145,'en','Prey','An American family on holiday in Africa becomes lost in a game reserve and stalked by vicious killer lions.','/tPmURKjF15srICbmAjpz36PmZlP.jpg','2007-05-18',92,'Released','Out here, you\'re the endangered species...','Prey',14211,3.6568,5.8,'MDuRV_r7WE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20522,_binary '\0','/gLxgqHpJcMvB6cMTA4hUBxoOMJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468565',7.2,32475,'tn','Tsotsi','A young South African boy from the Johannesburg ghetto named Tsotsi, meaning Gangster, leaves home as a child to get away from his helpless parents. Now a teenage thug, Tsotsi finds a baby in the back seat of a car he\'s just stolen. He decides that it is his responsibility to care for the infant and in the process learns that maybe the criminal life isn’t the best way.','/r3ebTJFcDZ35GaKcuUQQe243z4f.jpg','2005-12-23',94,'Released','In this world... Redemption comes just once.','Tsotsi',868,2.4005,6.937,'yCO4FbYyZIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20523,_binary '\0','/9FE5eD92WfVCiivM9Pq9GVSrlWk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468569',9.1,3226379,'en','The Dark Knight','Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.','/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg','2008-07-16',152,'Released','Some men just want to watch the world burn.','The Dark Knight',155,63.6572,8.536,'LDG9bisJEaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20524,_binary '\0','/9ThzL85lSq7fUuWO1UoBXtPiT92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468644',7,8365,'nl','Alles is Liefde','A romantic comedy told with a set of interwoven Christmas tales about life, love, forgiveness and caring. A heroic vagrant becomes a TV sensation Santa Claws, while a prince takes a menial job at a department store to woo his sweetheart.','/lAskAoWgovXhlAOyP3PdlOHoOou.jpg','2007-10-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Love Is All',5497,1.1296,6.3,'sJqpLYYIm8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20525,_binary '\0','/aDfWZFp6JbZ8AaproxeHU1PNVSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468683',5.7,3370,'ko','분홍신','A woman who finds a pair of pink high heels on a subway platform soon realizes that jealousy, greed, and death follow them wherever they go.','/ai6ep1b506uXKRkkOtF9y0BOSQU.jpg','2005-06-30',108,'Released','One size kills all.','The Red Shoes',64792,2.3658,6.1,'N1a8Ni1ROaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20526,_binary '\0','/4NTM2UfehhQueBQd06DCzzHMW5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468704',7.4,7011,'ko','데이지','A painter in Amsterdam receives flowers from a mysterious admirer, while a hitman and cop find themselves in conflict.','/twmYZWjyrHm0fhJnPxHcC4XtrA3.jpg','2006-03-09',110,'Released','A cop. A criminal. A flower.','Daisy',18426,2.4555,7.107,'swOKUy_DG-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20527,_binary '\0','/Jc75L7KRKgAqeCHZ6mXx0dIzIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468795',7.5,6431,'ja','リンダ リンダ リンダ','Only three days before the school festival, a newly formed high school band rushes to put together a set for their big show — including a hit single by \'80s by the Japanese punk rock band The Blue Hearts.','/wX3xwuJ9uhCamndfGUePDkpAggZ.jpg','2005-07-23',115,'Released','High school girls play The Blue Hearts!','Linda Linda Linda',27337,3.4331,7.6,'YIIkWjdiF0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20528,_binary '\0','/7vazYoK298Y4Q4FsyodFSzoVdUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468820',7,5495,'ja','紀子の食卓','A teenager named Noriko Shimabara runs away from her family in Toyokawa, to meet Kumiko, the leader of an Internet BBS, Haikyo.com. She becomes involved with Kumiko\'s family circle, which grows darker after the mass suicide of 54 high school girls.','/mTusjr1v1IrzxR3krVxoWKQXmJk.jpg','2005-09-23',159,'Released','The family that eats together stays together.','Noriko\'s Dinner Table',42041,1.9913,6.952,'xRmpIwJQLFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20529,_binary '\0','/toe2itlLzkV52DmSpWY2mlf6aLL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0468965',5,1487,'en','When A Man Falls In The Forest','The intertwining lives of three men reveal that each deal with his problems in different, self-destructive ways.','/s5g4HMsW5RkOxjLMr5yyLDnhlG9.jpg','2007-02-12',86,'Released','In the end... she got what she wanted.','When A Man Falls In The Forest',24059,1.898,4.5,'8VNFt2Sx_Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20530,_binary '\0','/de5FcDrVhkhNQHkn6O5q6jaatKP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469021',6.9,34337,'en','Alan Partridge: Alpha Papa','When famous DJ Alan Partridge’s radio station is taken over by a new media conglomerate, it sets in motion a chain of events which see Alan having to work with the police to defuse a potentially violent siege.','/kwIXwAUQKzyJC5Co1eEBCH52WDY.jpg','2013-07-24',90,'Released','12 hostages. 24 hours. 1 Partridge.','Alan Partridge: Alpha Papa',177699,3.5542,6.6,'5J4z-jjvNto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20531,_binary '\0','/zE3WzRZKPZce5zKpX1Y43UhBCVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469045',5.4,1636,'en','Broken','A waitress confronts all the wrong turns she has made in her short life and ultimately ends up facing the biggest wrong turn of all: her dangerous ex-boyfriend who\'s determined to win back her love or die trying.','/ssT0amMqtlIZXermcOkvd5hLQ4t.jpg','2007-10-05',98,'Released','Sometimes the roads we take leave us stranded. And the choices we make leave us broken.','Broken',20786,1.665,5.6,'VH3m2p1W5as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20532,_binary '\0','/a6fxRf2ZXAWC835noPSZP3z3XNo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469062',5.5,4179,'en','Danika','Traumatized since childhood by her brother\'s accidental death, Danika Merrick hallucinates a bank robbery and quits her job. Despite support from her three children and loving husband, Danika continues to experience unnerving visions. She seeks help from therapist Evelyn Harris but pervasive reports of violent incidents involving children make Danika fear for her own family, and she grows increasingly paranoid, worrying she may be going insane.','/5Qk67gDdoR6eqJNYmb8ohBgbG1b.jpg','2006-06-10',79,'Released','Her visions are beyond your worst fears...','Danika',22105,2.8098,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20533,_binary '\0','/3eXpEzoTctHuCNWfbjWokTal3hn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469099',6.3,1549,'en','Hey Hey It\'s Esther Blueburger','With help from a new friend, a misfit at a fancy private school secretly enrolls at a public school as a foreign exchange student.','/dluxHdIEQZKpJOO1vFNFRHJQoUE.jpg','2008-03-20',103,'Released','Sometimes to fit in you need to stand out','Hey Hey It\'s Esther Blueburger',50700,1.6178,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20534,_binary '\0','/rdOhbdOKzcZfMsWsrlim2T9zQam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469184',6.6,5552,'en','Shanghai Kiss','Liam Liu unwittingly gets involved with a high school girl. He suddenly has to go to China after learning from his father that he has inherited his grandmother\'s home in Shanghai. He\'s not very appreciative of his Chinese roots, and at first, only wants to sell the house and get back to the U.S. as fast as possible. He gets a taste of the Chinese culture and ends up having some big decisions to make.','/yMXs40GxPhVSqzGudmqg8Yx5LDR.jpg','2007-03-17',106,'Released',NULL,'Shanghai Kiss',15361,1.9279,6,'7fFS6u5Om3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20535,_binary '\0','/3saL0FA5Tex5YL6q3mbpCL912bq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469233',6.2,1273,'de','Französisch für Anfänger','The story of Henrik, who takes part in a student exchange program with France. The only reason for this journey is to conquer the heart of his dream girl. Wild Partys, exciting trips, a crazy host family and of course his trouble with the French language turn the - at first unmeant - holidays into a memorable summer.','/5E2bKqUsUL2S7RucQgfTrAaIbNX.jpg','2006-06-08',98,'Released',NULL,'French for Beginners',10123,1.5064,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20536,_binary '\0','/l4hWbdxXompHvLIR0bl3m3WromI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469263',6.3,23921,'en','The Astronaut Farmer','Texan Charles Farmer left the Air Force as a young man to save the family ranch when his dad died. Like most American ranchers, he owes his bank. Unlike most, he\'s an astrophysicist with a rocket in his barn - one he\'s built and wants to take into space. It\'s his dream. The FBI puts him under surveillance when he tries to buy rocket fuel, and the FAA stalls him when he files a flight plan – but Charles is undeterred.','/19uGc8wW3Ert1QvMYxvnReQkFMc.jpg','2007-02-23',104,'Released',NULL,'The Astronaut Farmer',5172,4.6778,6.3,'390WaPcxnFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20537,_binary '\0','/7vEIJNKjOwKoMYYQjJGwju7y6ul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469318',5.3,5119,'en','Dark Country','Two honeymooners rescue a mysterious car crash survivor in the Las Vegas desert. But their decision to save the man becomes increasingly regrettable when he turns on them, forcing the newlyweds to do the unthinkable.','/w3DE4rxX5vY4ybq08zxQWrmbFaU.jpg','2009-10-05',88,'Released','One wrong turn... into the dark','Dark Country',23382,3.1616,5.3,'oHtyKiC-jx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20538,_binary '\0','/3JfykCBDnvThf4nPF0XuMvX6L2M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469429',5.4,2535,'en','Her Best Move','15 year-old soccer prodigy, Sara Davis, has a chance to join the U.S. National Team, but she must juggle high school, romance, sports, and parental pressure while deciding her own priorities.','/5HlN7oYzqRDJ8yTHPlc9PTRD9EP.jpg','2007-03-31',101,'Released',NULL,'Her Best Move',18598,2.8478,4.9,'QobrDZTSAFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20539,_binary '\0','/aHDSDj6d5vxFEt3mTozjJP5GZf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469443',6.3,2350,'no','Izzat','Three young immigrant boys, Wasim, Riaz and Munawar, come of age in the east end of Oslo, Norway. They find school boring and become attracted to the hard boiled gang East Side Crew, run by brothers Sadiq and Khalid. Petty theft soon develops into drug dealing, violence and murder.','/1fpJZOxKTBzSzbRamqfsADmvsKk.jpg','2005-10-07',102,'Released','Life\'s a matter of honor','Izzat',18132,1.0864,6,'8LPfaxxSFf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20540,_binary '\0','/9UAKA6ceZi6TgQwTAAMt7DWwYPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469494',8.2,719123,'en','There Will Be Blood','Ruthless silver miner, turned oil prospector, Daniel Plainview, moves to oil-rich California. Using his son to project a trustworthy, family-man image, Plainview cons local landowners into selling him their valuable properties for a pittance. However, local preacher Eli Sunday suspects Plainview\'s motives and intentions, starting a slow-burning feud that threatens both their lives.','/fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg','2007-12-26',158,'Released','There will be greed. There will be vengeance.','There Will Be Blood',7345,18.6501,8.062,'-bEwlq_7f4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20541,_binary '\0','/zrAg7jZ8k0yRK6fnpCmmXvJVrbC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469519',5.7,1334,'en','Park','Park takes place all in one day in a public park in Los Angeles, as 11 disaffected Angelenos find both love and loss in unexpected ways','/oh9kKeskxBIbM3kUT3O6CzDBwTJ.jpg','2006-06-12',86,'Released',NULL,'Park',15023,2.6033,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20542,_binary '\0','/wZoEYkZa3PfpF6dXyWf642W96nU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469623',7.1,30797,'en','Things We Lost in the Fire','A recent widow invites her husband\'s troubled best friend to live with her and her two children. As he gradually turns his life around, he helps the family cope and confront their loss.','/fyMziX8tPzPSguUgOpKWkKK322S.jpg','2007-09-26',113,'Released','Hope comes with letting go.','Things We Lost in the Fire',3877,3.9154,6.6,'JAwyB8kvvFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20543,_binary '\0','/95j6fQUOSJIcCxtTWQ1VS3LUYn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469636',6.7,1774,'tr','Turist Ömer Yamyamlar Arasında','Ömer, a clumsy tourist, finds himself captured by a cannibal tribe led by the imposing Chief Faruk. His bumbling antics soon charm the defiant Zeynep, turning his peril into a riotous clash of cultures and unexpected camaraderie.','/qqjFQi2dCaHdD1MPVXPiEgBGVrD.jpg','1970-01-01',82,'Released',NULL,'Omer The Tourist Among the Cannibals',452573,0.9412,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20544,_binary '\0','/yZjUslqxhYqvbUNlAk3HSOO5Xba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469640',5.8,4892,'en','Bathory','Bathory is based on the legends surrounding the life and deeds of Countess Elizabeth Bathory known as the greatest murderess in the history of mankind. Contrary to popular belief, Elizabeth Bathory was a modern Renaissance woman who ultimately fell victim to men’s aspirations for power and wealth.','/qZsQ02liDzz9Ydb1dzFwLxef7me.jpg','2008-07-10',141,'Released',NULL,'Bathory: Countess of Blood',15208,2.9722,5.7,'2xZUQDUMoHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20545,_binary '\0','/1PtzrpMbuYg9rfWpEkm6qwN63oW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469641',6,92873,'en','World Trade Center','Two police officers struggle to survive when they become trapped beneath the rubble of the World Trade Center on September 11, 2001.','/bfTiVc8kxq8uRXeblV3Ct35APGu.jpg','2006-08-09',129,'Released','The world saw evil that day. Two men saw something else.','World Trade Center',1852,8.0138,6.1,'8M9lz5R1K2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20546,_binary '\0','/dv1EZuFYXKKDGPbxSNHLfRa57vw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469683',3.6,2583,'en','Automaton Transfusion','Three teens find themselves in a town over run with zombies. Deciding to fight back, they go on a punch you in the throat, action packed, non stop ride through the city, woods, and schools.','/neZNJiOF1BPGvsX2tBPpSkUg7Wi.jpg','2008-05-19',75,'Released','Blood...Will...Run','Automaton Transfusion',18177,1.365,4.1,'AuUfo7G-lOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20547,_binary '\0','/gT2bi1NxL47NJUAyaC8ZVweg93p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469684',3.4,1515,'en','Bloody Mary','When a group of psychiatric hospital nurses invoke the spirit of Bloody Mary -- a supposed urban myth -- the slaughter begins. The legend is real, her vengeance is fatal, and to free her, all you have to do is say her name.','/cM3F9T96ugiohokjXzKYZmjQn0N.jpg','2007-01-28',93,'Released','To Release the Greatest Evil, All You Have to Do is Say Her Name','Bloody Mary',28344,1.1787,3.5,'mqhavT5UA8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20548,_binary '\0','/9RKkvmA9DMS3EPVV7v6iNUZFgqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469689',6,4303,'en','The Last Time','Ted Ryker is the top salesman in the New York office of a business machine company; the corporate stock lives by quarterly sales numbers, the competition is keen, and the economy may be in a downturn. Ted\'s company is marking time until a new product is ready – probably in a few months. Into the mix comes a new hire, a callow Midwesterner named Jamie, who\'s come East with his fiancée Belisa.','/vPz2CcAWin7X6QfruYj2hWMGvHd.jpg','2006-10-01',96,'Released',NULL,'The Last Time',27683,4.0988,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20549,_binary '\0','/tZnSELkhNmzDmRLzWWsQh74HNcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469754',6.6,13535,'da','Direktøren for det hele','The owner of an IT firm wants to sell his business for profit; however, when he started his firm, he invented a nonexistent president to hide behind when unpopular steps needed to be taken. When potential purchasers insist on negotiating with \'The Boss\' face to face, the owner hires a failed actor to play the part.','/rwEtK0YLHLzT13uPtXyXCHoWMwR.jpg','2006-12-08',99,'Released',NULL,'The Boss of It All',5206,3.317,6.58,'OyPBZsli7e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20550,_binary '\0','/vcnAjYkilqlSZnxo5OaWW94WZ2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469785',8.5,1461,'lv','Limuzīns Jāņu nakts krāsā','When old auntie Mirta succeeds in a lottery and wins a car which she cannot use herself, all sorts of family members suddenly appear by her side, hoping to get the car after their auntie\'s death. Until then, they had never helped Mirta, it was only her neighbours who supported her in her old age. Now, her nephew Ēriks with his wife and son, and her ex-daughter-in-law Olita with her second husband and daughter, would all love to get their hands on the car that\'s in the colour of Midsummer\'s Eve.','/nHQhJePRBxbsKNDtfOwIXeM1QS8.jpg','1982-02-01',87,'Released',NULL,'A Limousine the Colour of Midsummer\'s Eve',116432,1.3621,6.5,'4bOeYGieN_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20551,_binary '\0','/j3R9DcBXH7bRjNx2kpg6JjCiiTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469802',7.5,3597,'tr','Ne Olacak Şimdi','The funny love and marriage story of 4 people 2 of who is a couple that want to divorce and the other 2 are their attorneys.','/nQ0ZLXu0pKDogYMeL2j38FvOaRm.jpg','1979-06-04',83,'Released',NULL,'What Happens Now?',177325,0.859,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20552,_binary '\0','/5UIVUKwKV8vgx2tKHUllOpSJZlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469849',1.7,4721,'it','Troppo belli','Costantino and Daniele are two friends which have very success with girls. Their wish is to work in the show business and they can achieve their goal when meet Valeria, top model and actress, who offers both guys the chance they are looking for: meet Mr. Giampalmi, an important producer. But the producer is Valeria\'s father who wants the guys to be cheated...','/tnfoXyUleeBlJbK1sSdCmcgoUhO.jpg','2005-04-22',97,'Released','Maurizio Costanzo\'s ideas can be dangerous!','Too Beautiful',31247,0.7943,2.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20553,_binary '\0','/uvbMG3kZxWb337fMzJHHZMcTHfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469897',6.3,3332,'en','Diggers','In 1976, four working-class friends come of age in The Hamptons, on the South Shore of Long Island, New York, as clam diggers, as were their fathers and their grandfathers before them. They must cope with and learn to face the changing times in both their personal lives and their neighborhood.','/npNZT7xFFTMtEQjM7FrCe31fAxM.jpg','2007-04-27',96,'Released','No one can drift forever.','Diggers',17439,2.919,6,'IFXaS-39g50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20554,_binary '\0','/aIGwGMQFPniaRZ3YxKHX7BHhgz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469903',7.2,23738,'en','The Express','Follow the inspirational life of college football hero Ernie Davis, the first African-American to win the Heisman Trophy.','/l4bOPaxwx1WebQXTeqXzXwf9n3M.jpg','2008-10-10',130,'Released','He changed our country... one yard at a time.','The Express',14325,3.4711,7.1,'-gdiHS__LyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20555,_binary '\0','/fQcl7Og2vnEUBrB1vJH9XpVPMss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0469913',5.9,2572,'en','Good Time Max','Two genius brothers grow up and grow apart as one becomes a successful surgeon and the other pursues a drug-fueled high life.','/d9nD63awySRKwrIxIEiHOyLi0Nr.jpg','2008-10-28',79,'Released',NULL,'Good Time Max',15316,2.0688,5.4,'MN5mzYHO7Gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20556,_binary '\0','/62WHUNJ1yEFf5BTXcsS61sE4cD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470000',5,9142,'en','Wicked Little Things','Karen, Sarah, and Emma Tunney are all moving to a small town in Pennsylvania where, unknown to them, in 1913, a horrid mine accident trapped dozens of children alive, underground. But there\'s a problem. They\'re still alive.','/wXymWZpjkeHUIi0G2YZYdcO1OH0.jpg','2006-11-17',94,'Released','Prey for Them','Wicked Little Things',10854,3.7025,5.816,'4lWl1mmexBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20557,_binary '\0','/uxlYQKsoOkBgR9PxgeZDUh1GbhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470023',4,1637,'en','Android Apocalypse','Machines have taken over, but left humans thinking that they are still the ones in charge. The androids need humans because of the human brain fluid; without it the android brains can\'t work. Until the mad scientist finds out how to make this brain fluid artificially that is.','/h6DkAZAcDgoJQbKlkC4ZNgrdh9J.jpg','2006-06-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Android Apocalypse',17940,1.4309,4.2,'ltrcLWLuv_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20558,_binary '\0','/ApgpEdgtU9Y55mehnR9TV9wPyHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470055',5.2,21484,'en','Open Water 2: Adrift','A weekend cruise on a luxurious party yacht goes horribly wrong for a group of old high-school friends when they get stuck in the water many miles from shore and a happy reunion turns into a fight for survival.','/6bbQxUlPTBGYSWHMshG6K2MxtSl.jpg','2006-07-10',94,'Released','Fatigue. Hypothermia. Death.','Open Water 2: Adrift',9592,4.866,5.476,'CahcqFwnRfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20559,_binary '\0','/vfcbs9a5QjIggCAORRufvjYniR0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470102',5.6,2245,'ar','يا أنا يا خالتي','Henedy plays Taimor, a Young man studies music. He loves his colleague and intends to marry her. Her mother, who believes in magic, refuses their marriage.','/etUDmMO1lobnCG5cqOAu8pJpj5z.jpg','2005-05-22',105,'Released',NULL,'Me or My Aunt',406854,1.4875,6.1,'MUIrRkIsYHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20560,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470168',6.3,2162,'en','Winter\'s End','Winter\'s End is a thriller set on a rural, isolated farm. Amy Rose lives on this farm with her two brothers Henry and Sean and we follow Amy\'s progress from abuse and oppression at the hands of her older brother Henry, to independence.','/oBHAxTh1Cy4l6uaGnawB12dGqSC.jpg','2005-07-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Winter\'s End',903802,0.7812,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20561,_binary '\0','/sHRLKzIongCYOZof6q5FEwwuinJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470521',2.7,1553,'hi','Saawan... The Love Season','Raj and Kajal get married and after coming back from their honeymoon, Kajal meets a man who can predict the future. About her, he says she will die within two days and this does happens. After which, Raj kills that man and Kajal is back to life.','/9P3O21eApDBonAIFTXTgUFfh3NO.jpg','2006-04-07',116,'Released',NULL,'Saawan... The Love Season',161208,1.6852,6.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20562,_binary '\0','/1nnYs9Uj15CQgASrbVGg6DRCaJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470679',5.3,4463,'en','August','Two brothers, ambitious dot-com entrepreneurs, attempt to keep their company afloat as the stock market begins to collapse in August 2001, one month prior to the 9/11 attacks.','/8jvENQepW1ZrJ4KxN2H8eExWIzs.jpg','2008-05-16',88,'Released','Comes just before the fall','August',13692,1.8941,5.2,'WRCoiBMFYF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20563,_binary '\0','/aolzk4PV6yS2pVMIYfsEUPqrDHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470685',4.1,1808,'tr','Banyo','The film takes place in three bathrooms. Two of them are side-by-side and the third sees the two right across the street. In these 3 places, 3 different couples and a young voyeur boy (actually an art student who researches for a project) are described in stories. At the core of these stories there are determinations of the nature of men and women, marriage and betrayal.','/1MfAlH9bahd65OF9KK9o1VhG8fp.jpg','2005-09-02',87,'Released',NULL,'Banyo',52125,1.4882,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20564,_binary '\0','/frzhV7odH2zy3cZEWd3Yo7eULdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470705',6.1,40948,'en','Bug','In Oklahoma, Agnes, a lonely waitress living in an isolated and dilapidated roadside motel, meets Peter, a quiet and mysterious man with whom she establishes a peculiar relationship.','/yjTmmAngldFoyDhHxNM8fHblk3O.jpg','2007-02-21',98,'Released','First they send in their drone... then they find their queen.','Bug',12526,3.8993,6.1,'SlXPgld35ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20565,_binary '\0','/jQq673Fhr9osHRWmTQOM9CUXYP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470732',6.5,4923,'en','Bernard and Doris','Tobacco heiress Doris Duke develops an unlikely friendship with her butler, Bernard Lafferty.','/fa1U7EpUuF1G2UptP4L6hL7zK0u.jpg','2006-09-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Bernard and Doris',38163,2.4864,6.054,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20566,_binary '\0','/uqOuJ50EtTj7kkDIXP8LCg7G45D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470752',7.7,645776,'en','Ex Machina','Caleb, a coder at the world\'s largest internet company, wins a competition to spend a week at a private mountain retreat belonging to Nathan, the reclusive CEO of the company. But when Caleb arrives at the remote location he finds that he will have to participate in a strange and fascinating experiment in which he must interact with the world\'s first true artificial intelligence, housed in the body of a beautiful robot girl.','/dmJW8IAKHKxFNiUnoDR7JfsK7Rp.jpg','2015-01-21',108,'Released','There is nothing more human than the will to survive.','Ex Machina',264660,17.1899,7.571,'bggUmgeMCdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20567,_binary '\0','/lt3Y2FzWv5Yhtx4QxW3c8cDXXre.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470761',4.8,3712,'en','First Born','Laura\'s expecting. Her husband, Steven\'s a loving guy but has little time for her. Her mom lives thousands of miles away. Forced to give up on her dreams, she\'s always been a bit edgy. A C-section drives her over the edge, making her see things in a different light. A creepy babysitter doesn\'t make things any better. She begins seeing things, trusts no one, as she goes into self-destruct mode.','/khZhhaRd3imZBJE5R0HfRypvS33.jpg','2007-03-20',95,'Released',NULL,'First Born',15418,2.1586,5.2,'1e9E83op_dc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20568,_binary '\0','/y954tUsOdHP88gDD2lbYHuWI8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470765',6.3,17616,'en','For Your Consideration','The possibility of Oscar gold holds the cast and crew of an independent film in its grip after the performance of its virtually unknown, veteran star generates awards buzz.','/fvXClgY4ZJ7dBxalFuxPgb4nJ9s.jpg','2006-11-17',86,'Released','Success in Hollywood is as fragile as a rumor','For Your Consideration',14799,3.6689,5.8,'QYlsn7C24hQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20569,_binary '\0','/2hCM77e8vYb0qlSLSv3URpzQg8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470833',1.6,9751,'tr','Keloğlan Kara Prens\'e Karşı','Kelogan fights the black prince to serve justice.','/6thuMbPKWiH3PSqiF9qgUMIWnwW.jpg','2006-01-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Keloglan Vs. The Dark Prince',31387,1.2293,2.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20570,_binary '\0','/nTtI8LVFs0LLCIccyaS03WGgxl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470869',3.2,1901,'hi','Neal \'n\' Nikki','During a 21-day bachelor trip before his wedding, Neal falls in love with Nikki, a woman he slept with. Things get further complicated when Nikki turns out to be his fiancee\'s cousin.','/aCjfuhKLvnH4K1QaxB2GJkGicWY.jpg','2005-12-09',122,'Released','Nice is out...Naughty is in','Neal \'N\' Nikki',46415,1.4262,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20571,_binary '\0','/gnyZRWAwdGloChFlJ7OA2YSxt7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470883',7.4,37914,'tr','Organize İşler','A struggling, suicidal young comedian meets a car thief who is willing to teach him a few things about his profession.','/9hydImnaVkVv6PinLMzozFiPP1h.jpg','2005-12-22',106,'Released',NULL,'Magic Carpet Ride',30634,1.8723,6.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20572,_binary '\0','/uFcVCxoXdPBf4XJfyvvMTPZb9Oo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470967',6.2,1793,'ko','여고괴담 4: 목소리','While practicing after hours in her high school, an aspiring singer is mysteriously killed and her body vanishes. Her invisible ghost is trapped in the school, but her best friend is able to hear her voice.','/6YDFXt6TIq4k1SmwNxCbagTtZiN.jpg','2005-07-15',104,'Released','The Last Sound You\'ll Ever Hear.','Voice',32170,1.9908,6.7,'d0wpmPWOJ7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20573,_binary '\0','/dadmRyHwSLyt5YMA36dW6bNnQ2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0470993',3.8,3506,'en','Crazy Eights','Six people are brought together at the funeral of a childhood friend. While settling the estate, they discover a map, which leads them on a search for a time capsule. What they discover reawakens childhood traumas and leads them on a journey through their abandoned childhood home: a home with a terrible secret and a mysterious dead girl who will lead them to their strange fates.','/xgDdU9XkSukK5ADpCUFF6dcldfg.jpg','2006-10-31',80,'Released','No secret stays locked away forever.','Crazy Eights',16080,2.7727,4.5,'srsYbxcwqXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20574,_binary '\0','/x4x42AbArvItQusMifH3R97j7oN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471030',6.8,14382,'en','Red Road','Jackie is a CCTV operator. One day, a man shows his face on her monitor, a man she hoped never to see again. Now she has no choice and is compelled to confront him.','/o2SWtcm9bR7lqoCp3wsVp35fvmV.jpg','2006-10-27',113,'Released',NULL,'Red Road',11705,2.3624,6.5,'kCSKOQqIR0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20575,_binary '\0','/oRfGMshVwOh5gqRiVMsFDPolEXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471041',6,37287,'en','The Tournament','Every seven years, in an unsuspecting town, The Tournament takes place. A battle royale between 30 of the world\'s deadliest assassins. The last man standing receives the $10,000,000 cash prize and the title of World\'s No. 1 Assassin, which itself carries the legendary million dollar-a-bullet price tag.','/zVkPQAIoCNDc8khNjmSAiTb3lV5.jpg','2009-05-01',95,'Released','Every 7 years, the world\'s greatest assassins gather... Only one will survive.','The Tournament',24056,6.7536,5.948,'ZQzH98dSSk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20576,_binary '\0','/7BtEvieL4QRNW3j7OAw6Zv2CDap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471042',6.2,158515,'en','Tower Heist','A luxury condo manager leads a staff of workers to seek payback on the Wall Street swindler who defrauded them. With only days until the billionaire gets away with the perfect crime, the unlikely crew of amateur thieves enlists the help of petty crook Slide to steal the $20 million they’re sure is hidden in the penthouse.','/jQrroNwP8hbFiUlNMs20emauwPE.jpg','2011-11-02',104,'Released','It\'s not just a robbery. It\'s payback.','Tower Heist',59108,10.0199,6.119,'Z4KXF7NWFRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20577,_binary '\0','/z6jtevUdXzZyNGHDhFyUYtqEq7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471359',6.6,2137,'lv','Rīgas sargi','The film dramatizes November 11, 1919- a crucial date in the battle for Latvian independence. A year after the end of the official hostilities of WWI, a renegade German general and troops remain outside the Latvian capital. Latvian riflemen, most of them inexperienced volunteers, somehow managed to defeat a larger, better-armed force of German and Russian mercenaries.','/iHXjxW1pCcU52F6TAm0WyKRkaKB.jpg','2007-01-01',118,'Released',NULL,'Defenders of Riga',195834,1.2941,5.6,'blCIhGBdchw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20578,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471395',7.1,2008,'hr','Što je muškarac bez brkova?','A young widow, an aging widower-returnee and a priest from a bankrupt parish are struggling to come to terms with the post-war environment, complete with its prejudices, illusions, and unpleasant mentality. What follows is a romantic comedy set in rough landscape, about a woman who falls in love with a local priest. He is not blind to her love, but is unable to choose between the church and her, until the circumstances force him to make his choice.','/dFyxxz1rErNh48vLxk4hsL5TwXX.jpg','2005-07-23',109,'Released',NULL,'What Is a Man without a Moustache?',319632,1.116,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20579,_binary '\0','/8SByVmuLzQDpITwotmFFdTo1qEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471571',8.2,16586,'te','అతడు','A hitman, Nandu, is hired to stage the assassination of a politician. However, when the politician is actually killed and Nandu is framed for the murder, he assumes a dead man\'s identity to evade the law.','/ojZAu2KOemaDEfLnJXZeuU9QQko.jpg','2005-08-10',175,'Released','WANTED','Athadu',37172,1.5723,7.8,'KWt9dzrc1Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20580,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471725',6.3,1414,'cs','Gympl','This movie is about strange relationships in one \"noname\" gymnasium in Czech republic.','/orMm2Iz574vNAyBT8sIXhQcPLdJ.jpg','2007-09-27',110,'Released',NULL,'The Can',16517,1.5243,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20581,_binary '\0','/3wtsLfxItrVUkgQ2jOzFOKJPgus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471834',7,4436,'ja','NANA','Two girls named Nana meet on a train to Tokyo. Nana K. aims to reunite with her boyfriend and Nana O. hopes to make it big in the music business. Despite their differences, the pair hit it off and become roommates.','/1RMroK0KvR1lws3ukpKkVxv3uwo.jpg','2005-09-03',113,'Released',NULL,'Nana',29657,2.4955,6.8,'c-yniT-KteU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20582,_binary '\0','/ewoW3SLOyrXGs6Ngojw6UuYefxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471862',5.9,1538,'te','పౌర్ణమి','A dancer trains for an event where she has to perform a special dance in Lord Shiva\'s temple. But when she suddenly disappears, her younger sister Chandrakala decides to learn the dance.','/jsyMrJNBo8JR22HoRo905AY2YUE.jpg','2006-04-20',167,'Released',NULL,'Pournami',226200,1.1776,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20583,_binary '\0','/6acYndOZPhYKYKHzYomXCPdfD5K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0471957',6.5,3597,'fi','Tyttö sinä olet tähti','Even though Nelli\'s parents have the perfect career and man planned for her, she dreams of becoming a singer. In a studio, she meets a young hip hop artist Sune and asks him to help her make a demo tape.','/mFI69H3mY45zjMO1isfy3qGtOAM.jpg','2005-10-21',102,'Released',NULL,'Beauty and the Bastard',53296,1.4164,6.2,'gAYNH5y5Xmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20584,_binary '\0','/t4V34FTYzZl0ZMdAXAK0T7DE3ie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472033',7,158630,'en','9','When 9 first comes to life, he finds himself in a post-apocalyptic world. All humans are gone, and it is only by chance that he discovers a small community of others like him taking refuge from fearsome machines that roam the earth intent on their extinction. Despite being the neophyte of the group, 9 convinces the others that hiding will do them no good.','/3uqXGOH4BQ2CLJWkDJZ0PzbUzOn.jpg','2009-08-19',79,'Released','When our world ended, their mission began.','9',12244,12.06,6.967,'_qApXdc1WPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20585,_binary '\0','/nnmbJvYyDS1VkMOCbxSpdBi3WbJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472043',7.9,364386,'en','Apocalypto','Set in the Mayan civilization, when a man\'s idyllic presence is brutally disrupted by a violent invading force, he is taken on a perilous journey to a world ruled by fear and oppression where a harrowing end awaits him. Through a twist of fate and spurred by the power of his love for his woman and his family he will make a desperate break to return home and to ultimately save his way of life.','/cRY25Q32kDNPFDkFkxAs6bgCq3L.jpg','2006-12-07',138,'Released','No one can outrun their destiny.','Apocalypto',1579,20.5562,7.668,'gSw5l5jMnPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20586,_binary '\0','/bzy9vXkHmLMPeEAeJ2QQlh3Axh8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472044',4.5,5069,'en','The Armenian Genocide','Explores the Ottoman Empire killings of more than one million Armenians during World War I. The film describes not only what happened before, during and since World War I, but also takes a direct look at the genocide denial maintained by Turkey to the present day.','/mxz1TRwXxYQk17elyNGWw2YxwrS.jpg','2006-04-17',57,'Released',NULL,'The Armenian Genocide',335853,1.7449,7,'J3r35ycecjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20587,_binary '\0','/pO3Kx7DNNtvhKEFqkTwnfefxvxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472050',5.7,4237,'en','Bart Got a Room','High school loser Danny Stein needs a prom date. As a cause of anxiety for Danny, Bart Beeber, the nerdiest guy in school, has already found a date. At the same time, Danny\'s divorced parents are both seeking relationships again.','/ihPJgIvFxPiDfNdTj7kNhroT8Db.jpg','2008-04-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Bart Got a Room',20107,2.6544,5.7,'FJyNcgNlsV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20588,_binary '\0','/7k6VuqGQsAgxJBtnLiGOTtkznRU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472062',7,132304,'en','Charlie Wilson\'s War','A Texas congressman sets a series of events in motion when he conspires with a CIA operative to aid Afghan mujahideen rebels fighting the Soviets.','/45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg','2007-12-19',102,'Released','A stiff drink. A little mascara. A lot of nerve. Who said they couldn\'t bring down the Soviet empire.','Charlie Wilson\'s War',6538,9.5181,6.543,'eUWXQLIgk8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20589,_binary '\0','/AebJPcZC5mKRHYvRZTKljSupHcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472071',5.8,10862,'en','Death Defying Acts','On a tour of Britain in 1926, Harry Houdini enters into a passionate affair with a psychic out to con the famous magician.','/j8cw8NK9zAqH4dxbepBCgnHkc52.jpg','2007-09-13',97,'Released','Love is inescapable','Death Defying Acts',13910,5.3477,5.9,'4ZgR_7lBxTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20590,_binary '\0','/vZPD2vBwefrLCDJijcktSfX2Ayz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472126',6.8,1895,'en','Local Color','A successful artist looks back with loving memories on the summer of his defining year, 1974. A talented but troubled 18-year-old aspiring artist befriends a brilliant elderly alcoholic painter who has turned his back on not only art but life. The two form what appears to be at first a tenuous relationship. The kid wants to learn all the secrets the master has locked away inside his head and heart. Time has not been kind to the old master. His life appears pointless to him until the kid rekindles his interest in his work and ultimately gives him the will to live. Together, they give one another a priceless gift. The kid learns to see the world through the master\'s eyes. And the master learns to see life through the eyes of innocence again. This story is based on a real life experience.','/919NfleqwFRc59DcLbtfOza7m8r.jpg','2008-11-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Local Color',2324,1.8834,6.2,'tz5C32F1Tzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20591,_binary '\0','/yzqWXqoxdOn6PbzYYQfJn1PYeyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472156',6.7,4500,'en','Pu-239','A worker at a Russian nuclear facility gets exposed to a lethal dose of radiation. In order to provide for his family, he steals some plutonium and sets out to sell it on Moscow\'s black market with the help of an incompetent criminal.','/fRyusBzphrpoEfMNff0jlR0ulQ6.jpg','2006-09-12',97,'Released','His family\'s future depends on one unstable element.','Pu-239',26431,2.0877,6.7,'E4SrHwVILq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20592,_binary '\0','/kbD1di34NzIJAhorYxUob1PR7cR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472160',6.7,69777,'en','Penelope','Forlorn heiress Penelope Wilhern is cursed, and the only way out is to fall in love with someone of suitable stock. But how can she find her soulmate when she\'s sequestered inside her family\'s estate with only her parents to keep her company? This untraditional fairy tale is about a girl who bucks convention to create her own happy ending.','/stsGbgMhDo3VjLLsrbeiz0fuj8d.jpg','2007-11-17',104,'Released','A fairytale like no other.','Penelope',7985,4.643,6.7,'2k-oNOYRxnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20593,_binary '\0','/iYLimHUF0C0R61v1ofg79SUIja9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472181',5.4,105965,'en','The Smurfs','When the evil wizard Gargamel chases the tiny blue Smurfs out of their village, they tumble from their magical world and into ours -- in fact, smack dab in the middle of Central Park. Just three apples high and stuck in the Big Apple, the Smurfs must find a way to get back to their village before Gargamel tracks them down.','/vRhnslP2gW0QDym7BsMeSuioUfK.jpg','2011-07-29',103,'Released','Smurf happens.','The Smurfs',41513,19.2229,5.754,'ku40DEMg57k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20594,_binary '\0','/xlIxMddSdqyxfY02CilOK4VKWR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472198',6.7,48303,'en','Notorious','\"Notorious\" is the story of Christopher Wallace. Through raw talent and sheer determination, Wallace transforms himself from Brooklyn street hustler (once selling crack to pregnant women) to one of the greatest rappers of all time: The Notorious B.I.G. Follow his meteoric rise to fame and his refusal to succumb to expectations - redefining our notion of \"The American Dream.\"','/62NsZPgueSiE8y7dqtU3FSLFwYw.jpg','2009-01-16',122,'Released','No dream is too B.I.G.','Notorious',14410,4.4975,7,'kDDv6pAbN_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20595,_binary '\0','/dT8U5q0y8OybByQeZFBz3shQuNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472205',6.2,9941,'en','Watching the Detectives','Neil, a self-proclaimed film geek and owner of Gumshoe video, has always been content to live vicariously through his favorite films noir. But when he meets Violet, a real-life femme fatale, his mundane world gets turned upside down and the line between reality and the movies quickly begins to blur.','/wm2TaGTXpy30WNLuZaqagIMbf1K.jpg','2007-05-01',94,'Released','Sometimes love is stranger than fiction.','Watching the Detectives',22100,3.9502,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20596,_binary '\0','/ib7NDlxyJV79o5X1ik6TMPlmqGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472259',6,4348,'en','Alone With Her','The harrowing story of a disturbed young man\'s attempts to win the affections of an unsuspecting young woman. When Doug first sees Amy, he instantly falls for her and begins to watch her every move, going so far as to set up spy cameras in her apartment. However, as his fascination grows into obsession he\'s no longer satisfied with just watching.','/636EGinwlVDyXuDo4l27hETmze2.jpg','2006-04-28',78,'Released','Anytime. Anywhere. He\'s watching.','Alone With Her',18206,2.2351,5.863,'CapONa1mjUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20597,_binary '\0','/qzuszcFoBBo6enQ1x2W6zQRBbdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472268',7,6442,'en','The Flying Scotsman','Based on the incredible true story of amateur cyclist Graeme Obree, who breaks the world one-hour record on a bike he made out of washing machine parts.','/1ARffaR8ujlrxsGQrcpuPXwPaUS.jpg','2006-08-16',96,'Released','The true story of the unlikely champion that inspired a nation.','The Flying Scotsman',15008,3.1884,6.5,'h-ukBspc9D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20598,_binary '\0','/dYb6kgvoGjUH59n2uB4eV9xqmKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472399',6.5,184548,'en','The Mechanic','Arthur Bishop is a \'mechanic\' - an elite assassin with a strict code requiring professional perfection and total detachment. One of an elite group of assassins, Bishop may be the best in the business - with a unique talent for cleanly eliminating targets. When Harry McKenna, his close friend and mentor, is murdered, Harry\'s son comes to him with vengeance in his heart and a desire to learn Bishop\'s trade, signaling the birth of a deadly partnership.','/k37axEHszFP9WOVvbozxF0r7X7g.jpg','2011-01-13',93,'Released','Someone has to fix the problems.','The Mechanic',27582,15.1474,6.5,'39L8egLr518','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20599,_binary '\0','/aSLDG8l73T5SlabvZtYgv7m6OG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472458',6.7,11332,'cn','餃子','Aunt Mei\'s famous homemade dumplings provide amazing age-defying qualities popular with middle-aged women. But her latest customer, a fading actress, is determined to find out what the secret ingredient is.','/7btkd83yTWMyeAFei3ZlXiaiqu6.jpg','2004-08-19',91,'Released','You eat… that you are…','Dumplings',9060,2.8852,6.737,'5ixdhYr3a6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20600,_binary '\0','/r8ynW7XjBHPiiK7F8rnexSzKKhT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472465',4,1424,'en','Invasion','A meteor carrying an unknown infection, lands outside a Small Californian community, bringing terror and death. Just after midnight, a local rancher named Larry Jenkins discovers the meteor and calls the police. Inspector Bardo is sent to the scene to investigate. The small Lawton police department is short-handed, as it is the night of the high school prom. Arriving at a desolate forest road miles out of town, Bardo discovers that Jenkins has been infected by the alien organism. The officer is savagely attacked and infected. Both men head towards Lawton, terrorizing and contaminating everyone they encounter. Meanwhile, Cheryl and Timmy have left the prom and are parked atop Lover\'s Lane. Bardo comes upon the lovebirds and attacks them, infecting Timmy. Now Cheryl must run for her life through the pitch-black forest, escaping her pursuers and trying to reach the authorities before the infection spreads to L.A.','/6mEmhon5P1UfKOHGn07z8zlbeK1.jpg','2005-09-05',81,'Released','Not of this earth...','Invasion',36965,2.5436,3.9,'IYLQphfM0nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20601,_binary '\0','/gkludtGAtKFW6bFvScM6O0nmidC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472562',7.5,3974,'en','Shake Hands with the Devil','In 1993, Canadian Lieutenant General Roméo Dallaire was sent by the United Nations to Rwanda as commander of the United Nations Assistance Mission for Rwanda (UNAMIR). Its mission, to ensure the ceasefire, is underfunded, excessively bureaucratized and made up of military units which come from dozens of countries and which each have a very different program... These are Lt Gen Dallaire\'s efforts to stop the madness of the Rwandan Genocide, despite the complete indifference of his superiors.','/5PUO6gBb2w1GIjEvX3nWnvhTXfJ.jpg','2007-09-28',112,'Released','When the world turned its back, one man stood up.','Shake Hands with the Devil',30527,2.1056,7.2,'mikwRioy0eE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20602,_binary '\0','/fa4W1pswnXP7RNYS6HSzHOwrxFS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472582',6.7,7686,'en','2:37','A contemporary, ensemble drama that tells the complex tale of six high school students whose lives are interwoven with situations that so many of today\'s youth are faced with. The story takes place during a normal school day. At precisely 2:37, a tragedy will occur affecting the lives of a group of students and their teachers.','/lykOcDfUp2jOFQjeTCoaE9JNy0x.jpg','2006-05-26',91,'Released','It\'s only a matter of time.','2:37',2168,2.114,6.6,'GJQY1pALKk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20603,_binary '\0','/1RAULnp9qMHQbRDlJpb6D90hYFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0472767',6.2,1779,'no','Elsk meg i morgen','Three years have passed since Elling moved to town together with Kjell Bjarne, his roommate from the institution at Brøynes. Elling now lives on his own in the apartment. Kjell Bjarne has moved up one floor, to Reidun and her little daughter Mojo. Elling feels like an outsider, and he isolates himself more and more. He observes humankind with astonishment, and wonders at how everyone else seems to be adjusting so well. Finally, Kjell Bjarne takes care of the situation. Elling protests, but he is still pretty happy as he is transformed into a new man, clean, fully rested and well dressed. Deep inside, he also knows what\'s lacking, and one evening he finally finds the woman he knows is able to fill the void in his life. He\'s willing to do anything to win her trust and conquer her love. But when he is invited home to his new girlfriend for dinner, a few objections appear to Elling, and the story doesn\'t end quite the way he had thought it would.','/6tXmNkuZP73LLCaGBhLJefWu616.jpg','2005-09-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Love Me Tomorrow',12076,1.8611,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20604,_binary '\0','/w5F3im9eEAzu9DF3LfbslhOQIRq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473024',2.2,9549,'en','Crossover','The clock strikes midnight, money changes hands, the crowd is on their feet, and the court is alive with fast-paced razzle-dazzle basketball. These players don\'t play for a school or a pro team. They play for the street and it\'s underground...way underground.','/jMShqkxESzjcXWdhGJz65CPWi8L.jpg','2006-09-01',95,'Released','Play by your own rules.','Crossover',14351,1.4788,3.561,'RbtoIP14EdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20605,_binary '\0','/7TFW0MqEMcjj2DiLKYTTjmXj3Bk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473064',5.6,1611,'ja','日本沈没','In the aftermath of a major earthquake, scientists predict that Japan will sink into the sea. As further disasters follow, politicians plead with other countries to take refugees, while scientists struggle to save Japan itself.','/bRFIzzyChY726O3ICE453YjOOoQ.jpg','2006-07-15',135,'Released',NULL,'Japan Sinks',16766,2.3996,5.6,'cjTw9qaiE5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20606,_binary '\0','/zsqq2sPSG9eBKWRGLCnvlMLFvlR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473074',6.3,2366,'en','The Gymnast','The stunning Dreya Weber stars as a former top gymnast who discovers love and a new life path when she teams up with a dancer (played by former L.A. Lakers cheerleader Addie Yungmee) for an ambitious Las Vegas aerial act show.','/uJdFvnz9fVIqqrbUNh5JsskgbzT.jpg','2006-04-11',96,'Released','Rise Above.','The Gymnast',31421,1.1296,6.1,'ugm6UFV15Qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20607,_binary '\0','/iP0capCU4w5nxCDl398CH7yR1r9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473075',6.5,319811,'en','Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time','A rogue prince reluctantly joins forces with a mysterious princess and together, they race against dark forces to safeguard an ancient dagger capable of releasing the Sands of Time – gift from the gods that can reverse time and allow its possessor to rule the world.','/siNGMLdOUNYLEGtlsnmQcpO2XZX.jpg','2010-05-19',116,'Released','Defy the Future','Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time',9543,14.306,6.312,'SOlc7fV9zL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20608,_binary '\0','/7bfV7f4G6s1oVj06m6ztXPK4YzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473102',6.9,4685,'en','The Perfect Game','Based on a true story, a group of boys from Monterrey, Mexico who become the first non-U.S. team to win the Little League World Series.','/kwn02B0AyQYXzftAo9StX8JD2JY.jpg','2009-11-09',118,'Released','Dream for the fences.','The Perfect Game',56601,3.6475,7.3,'0HMND-uvUBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20609,_binary '\0','/wTNe6e1NtHVLuxqNkoZuCBfPazv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473105',4.3,1595,'en','Vampire Bats','A biology professor discovers a deadly species of vampire bats are responsible for a series of bizarre murders and now she must find a way to stop them before they are completely out of control.','/dYUSTL850ESJiP7ZApOt02szbq3.jpg','2005-10-30',90,'Released','It\'s Feeding Time.','Vampire Bats',96235,3.0117,4.5,'LWkSQB7k2Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20610,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473107',6.8,4629,'en','Wal-Mart: The High Cost of Low Price','This documentary takes the viewer on a deeply personal journey into the everyday lives of families struggling to fight Goliath. From a family business owner in the Midwest to a preacher in California, from workers in Florida to a poet in Mexico, dozens of film crews on three continents bring the intensely personal stories of an assault on families and American values.','/6PYx4HEbczd9QUCex5Wspkhjef5.jpg','2005-11-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Wal-Mart: The High Cost of Low Price',29595,1.2458,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20611,_binary '\0','/saP3SGw1lSV5aTkLUm1O38va4yl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473174',6.3,1571,'en','Coffee Date','Todd\'s life takes a turn when his friendship with a homosexual causes everyone in his life to start questioning his sexuality.','/1UANBKExOnOGgutmvZO3lBNa5NG.jpg','2006-11-10',94,'Released','A Comic Cup of Sexual Confusion','Coffee Date',40922,1.691,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20612,_binary '\0','/o1QOSrwY9cjkEi1f9RL3tYxUFta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473188',5.8,16171,'en','The Death and Life of Bobby Z','A DEA agent provides former Marine Tim Kearney with a way out of his prison sentence: impersonate Bobby Z, a recently deceased drug dealer, in a hostage switch with a crime lord. When the negotiations go awry, Kearney flees, with Z\'s son in tow.','/sgIthxRLUBTbaetVXvXwQEmbfn2.jpg','2007-07-23',97,'Released','To live a life of his own, he has to die first.','The Death and Life of Bobby Z',10425,5.4099,6.2,'yrdovgUUASs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20613,_binary '\0','/7q3sVBwlATr37bBWXLlT7dFfM8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473267',5.3,7398,'en','Solstice','While on a summer trip with her friends, Megan begins to feel the presence of Sophie, her twin sister who recently committed suicide.','/1chJQ1bNdxPliWcpRgCvRlwgqSc.jpg','2008-01-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Solstice',14660,1.9017,5.311,'YHsbF4eh4X4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20614,_binary '\0','/cmdaPEbxLhty4cvxXhJx8KFe5Bh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473308',7,51532,'en','Waitress','A small town waitress stuck in a lousy marriage finds love when an exciting out-of-towner enters her life.','/ux3SPTHHmJytSjWEaV7xlo9nbOZ.jpg','2007-05-25',105,'Released','If only life were as easy as pie.','Waitress',10758,3.7098,6.7,'hvus7pXX2Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20615,_binary '\0','/zj5GapwcGJw5IH51lCaUfYO6O9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473310',1.4,7258,'hi','राम गोपाल वर्मा की आग','A pair of bodyguards for a politician find their positions under threat when their employer is implicated in a scandal. Fleeing to Mumbai they find work with a gangster, but also find that the police are onto them.','/hqWnLZ766S2vBRH2ec1oFzFxlCT.jpg','2007-08-31',163,'Released',NULL,'Ram Gopal Varma Ki Aag',31248,1.2045,2.3,'P625FAaJGG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20616,_binary '\0','/lnak9QJorq9J84KR4R80MCZEMHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473333',5.7,6159,'es','Bosque de sombras','An English couple\'s holiday in Spain is interrupted when they discover a girl imprisoned in a cabin.','/tSyuca9qJbKYqEracw25m9HRlvN.jpg','2006-09-24',97,'Released',NULL,'The Backwoods',12677,4.3506,5.4,'kJaXCgAee24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20617,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473348',4,1418,'en','Dead Men Walking','A viral outbreak turns those who are infected into the walking dead. Soon, the undead are contained, being kept in a maximum security prison. However, those who contained the undead are also trapped in this zombie-infested prison. Their only hope is to escape; but once you\'re inside this prison, there\'s really no way of getting out safely.','/66YmdbDvQ09wknzOnEChN0bG3Pv.jpg','2005-10-25',82,'Released','A Maximum Security Prison - Thousands of Infected Inmates - Only One Way Out!','Dead Men Walking',65051,1.2195,3.8,'eOfoz0f5iuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20618,_binary '\0','/jB2kiCbss8bx1PtCxEw1Cr9xFyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473356',5.7,12878,'en','The Flock','Erroll Babbage has spent his career tracking sex offenders and his unorthodox methods are nearly as brutal as the criminals he monitors. When he links one of his deranged parolees to the disappearance of a local girl, he and his new partner must scour the S&M underground to find her before it\'s too late.','/baGgc6giS6kMBnsNbwH6WuybXn5.jpg','2007-08-04',105,'Released','Evil has many faces. He has seen them all.','The Flock',14148,3.5956,5.7,'qNG92NBzQ3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20619,_binary '\0','/tLRmdfHa4b3Zrcb7GeCQl1sDtJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473360',5.8,35659,'en','Goal II: Living the Dream','Tempted away from Newcastle United to join Real Madrid, rising star Santiago Munez finds this latest change of fortune the greatest challenge yet - personally as well as professionally. He is reunited with Gavin Harris, though they must compete to be on the team, and estranged from fiancee Roz, whose nursing career keeps her back home.','/ih87q15J13ntUPsLvNNO9nGsRtn.jpg','2007-02-09',115,'Released','This time the dream is real.','Goal II: Living the Dream',9815,5.1197,5.953,'lwrmYUyWJ5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20620,_binary '\0','/9HvoFDTsGQxrwDyFxL9bCCYg2X5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473364',4.9,2214,'en','The Heavy','Sibling rivalry turned into betrayal between two brothers. One a prime candidate for Prime Minister, the other a henchman for a successful, yet shady businessman. Presented with an opportunity to take revenge against his brother, our anti-hero must come to terms with the truth in a world where you can trust no one and loyalty is rare.','/mK6fRTKI1onEZLWcKozHIPeFQ8k.jpg','2010-04-08',102,'Released','Getting Out Means Getting Even.','The Heavy',35153,1.6213,4.93,'YFNI0nncXR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20621,_binary '\0','/4rJU6BxxcaeZN45j03n3z1aidca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473367',7.4,29719,'hi','जाने तू...या जाने ना','Two best friends being convinced that they are not in love search for each other\'s love.','/iV1W0IEtQYuBnnxNmZxSmPHK3Pu.jpg','2008-07-04',155,'Released','So when do you know it\'s love?','Jaane Tu... Ya Jaane Na',14467,1.6149,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20622,_binary '\0','/qQ8gvPDWP073sljX9HIbu0ReTsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473389',7.6,17160,'en','The Ron Clark Story','Passionate and innovative teacher Ron Clark leaves his small hometown to teach in one of Harlem\'s toughest schools. But to break through to the students, he must use unconventional methods, including his ground-breaking classroom rules, to help them reach their potential. Based on a true story.','/2RJiZzzfG3dT6rNrJnNFTG8GQiQ.jpg','2006-08-13',90,'Released','No one believed in them. Except him.','The Ron Clark Story',25527,5.9285,7.57,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20623,_binary '\0','/rTFfV5hTuKOqEra0dLiNgKw6TBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473434',8.1,3180,'en','49 Up','49 Up is the seventh film in a series of landmark documentaries that began 42 years ago when UK-based Granada\'s World in Action team, inspired by the Jesuit maxim \"Give me the child until he is seven and I will give you the man,\" interviewed a diverse group of seven-year-old children from all over England, asking them about their lives and their dreams for the future. Michael Apted, a researcher for the original film, has returned to interview the \"children\" every seven years since, at ages 14, 21, 28, 35, 42 and now again at age 49.In this latest chapter, more life-changing decisions are revealed, more shocking announcements made and more of the original group take part than ever before, speaking out on a variety of subjects including love, marriage, career, class and prejudice.','/AuS78iQMLMKRLKKVahtm8MnTTMh.jpg','2006-10-06',135,'Released','In 1964 a group of seven year old children were interviewed for the documentary \"Seven Up\". They\'ve been filmed every seven years since. Now they are 49.','49 Up',13365,1.8759,7.4,'wrTLjPS2gN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20624,_binary '\0','/m3zGXY61pnFZ12gXnJgO0Mg0RWG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473444',7,47759,'zh','滿城盡帶黃金甲','During China\'s Tang dynasty the emperor has taken the princess of a neighboring province as his wife. She has borne him two sons and raised his eldest. Now his control over his dominion is complete, including the royal family itself.','/gHkkDpfo5YnOrbVfwtDHi91BkrU.jpg','2006-12-14',114,'Released','Unspeakable secrets are hidden within the Forbidden City.','Curse of the Golden Flower',1494,6.1216,6.9,'RA7mae3ZePg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20625,_binary '\0','/yg0G5q4sAshCP6CAu9NFeKFBapr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473464',5.4,2874,'en','Cherry Crush','A high school photographer breaks his own rules and falls in love with his teenage model.','/2qfRDQgQ6eZGInAi9TlI6hROLRp.jpg','2007-02-16',89,'Released','Passion has a price.','Cherry Crush',14127,2.1292,4.786,'IVMflRnLbdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20626,_binary '\0','/mJc4c2eN1bwRhNZfjDKukzNerYx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473474',7.1,1379,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太とふしぎ風使い','After a typhoon hits Nobita\'s town, he and Doraemon discover a wind sprite who, with some help from Doraemon\'s 22nd-century tech, takes them and their friends to a fantastic world of wind and storm people. But the wind sprite, named Fuuko by Nobita, had brought them to her world for a reason, as her peoples\' gods are battling, and Suneo might be a key player in their feud.','/kdBLKFviJckRXOCgPqkTQK16Rq0.jpg','2003-03-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita and the Windmasters',98613,3.9185,7.213,'okf_8CeXbSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20627,_binary '\0','/89jLspWmm5dLIFeuIu0UToN4jB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473488',6.9,28791,'en','A Guide to Recognizing Your Saints','Dito Montiel, a successful author, receives a call from his long-suffering mother, asking him to return home and visit his ailing father. Dito recalls his childhood growing up in a violent neighborhood in Queens, N.Y., with friends Antonio, Giuseppe, Nerf and Mike.','/bGmqGYglMDNN15uGPpeTMWNml1s.jpg','2006-09-29',104,'Released','Sometimes the only way to move forward is to go back.','A Guide to Recognizing Your Saints',8194,4.8761,6.5,'IQnIZn980hQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20628,_binary '\0','/qDN9ebaXpLdyRvcN0LIX0sU6sMV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473492',7.1,1799,'nl','De Hel Van Tanger','In August 1996, bus drivers Marcel Van Loock and Wim Moreels are apprehended by the Moroccan Customs for drug trafficking. Inside their bus, hidden behind a false compartment, they have discovered 700 pounds of hashish. Although the owner of the bus company is arrested as well and makes a full confession clearly indicating that both drivers were unaware of the hidden drugs, the Moroccan judge sentences both men to 5 years in the Moroccan prison of Tangiers. Nothing could have prepared the two men for life inside a Moroccan prison. Without food, clothes or medical care, they must learn how to take care of themselves to survive their stay in prison. Corrupt guards, corrupt lawyers and judges, a consul who doesn\'t care and frequent beatings are only part of the terrible prison. Meanwhile their families at home are left without any information, any help or any hope - finding out that their own government doesn\'t care for Belgian people in prisons abroad.','/klDfluixEz58gMQMGPw1LtNE9cO.jpg','2006-03-15',105,'Released','Hell in Tangier','Tangier',22034,1.2545,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20629,_binary '\0','/uOXblZjvwKP305AQjGCW2RIE50M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473514',5.5,6639,'en','Mulberry Street','A deadly infection breaks out in Manhattan, causing humans to devolve into blood-thirsty rat creatures. Six recently evicted tenants must survive the night and protect their downtown apartment building as the city quickly spirals out of control.','/lFj91spTLqP5nqj82q0pNWTqi7Q.jpg','2006-05-23',84,'Released','The neighborhood is changing…','Mulberry Street',17245,1.8886,5.4,'SHEU22Sq4pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20630,_binary '\0','/99G6nYV4NNXNehiApn5oo8PtpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473567',7.4,1297,'hi','Yahaan','In the disputed territory of Kashmir, a young Muslim woman meets and falls in love with a Hindu man.','/dm0bTEpjffPceyl7kWc1tSdzLgk.jpg','2005-07-29',132,'Released',NULL,'Yahaan',216696,1.0317,5.5,'mm0WbSUDJWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20631,_binary '\0','/piY7mksAVKGX5MpX7WCjxiZSCBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473604',7.9,1989,'te','అనుకోకుండా ఒక రోజు','Sahasra, a struggling singer, attends a party and wakes up after a day without realising it. However, as the days pass, she feels something is amiss after getting chased by men who want to kill her.','/kH6Y45SenIyCMvFRiKWPm42LhkM.jpg','2005-06-30',145,'Released',NULL,'Anukokunda Oka Roju',80862,1.3335,6.441,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (20632,_binary '\0','/dEeclgUEcAOhBRwLjW58Qk6lRvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473658',7.2,2223,'ja','犬夜叉 紅蓮の蓬莱島','The mysterious island of Houraijima has reappeared after 50 years, and with its reappearance has brought the attack of four gods, the Shitoushin, who have their eyes set on the powers that protect and sustain the island. Now it\'s up to Inuyasha and his friends, along with Sesshoumaru, to find a way to defeat the powerful Shitoushin.','/jOPgzW6oDuuG8OXosY04JUphhDY.jpg','2004-12-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Inuyasha the Movie 4: Fire on the Mystic Island',34297,3.1985,7.567,'qnICP4lL4wM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20633,_binary '\0','/fHY9TfKwC702kPxEcjkxCoLqUv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473692',7.7,3434,'en','Neil Young: Heart of Gold','In March 2005, Neil Young was diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. Four days before he was scheduled for a lifesaving operation, he headed to Nashville, where he wrote and recorded the country folk album Prairie Wind with old friends and family members. After the successful operation and recovery period, he returned to Nashville that August to play at the famed Ryman Auditorium, once again gathering together friends and family for this special performance.','/c7DPRQN44hihnaijY69OWOVGqNZ.jpg','2006-02-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Neil Young: Heart of Gold',15675,1.6798,7.5,'JhqnFRoHiY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20634,_binary '\0','/jpIMFSCugevSN5jnZqDvVq7T5x7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473697',7.2,2157,'es','Satanás','Based on the Mario Mendoza\'s book and inspired by true events, tells three interconnected stories happening in the eve of the infamous Pozzetto Massacre.','/ruw3QrxGpHLlCr9lcgmncSvYpXT.jpg','2007-03-04',95,'Released','Do you believe in pain, in forgiveness, in fate? No matter what you believe in. You\'ll end up facing it','Satanás - Profile of a Killer',33817,1.8455,7.1,'8MD5dfLqu0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20635,_binary '\0','/8PTLzmVuXjvciPshk3Dj3qPw4gZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473700',5.8,3140,'en','September Dawn','A story set against the Mountain Meadows Massacre, the film is based upon the tragedy which occurred in Utah in 1857. A group of settlers, traveling on wagons, was murdered by the Mormons. All together, about 140 souls of men, women and children, were taken.','/hZomhyZMwrRk8D57BXz4xDcFT4H.jpg','2007-05-17',110,'Released','The untold story of an American tragedy.','September Dawn',14877,1.9493,5.3,'E0qxsaBkAiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20636,_binary '\0','/iwX4YnIcQTevc1H7hLN5x0cdRli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473705',7.1,167489,'en','State of Play','When a congressional aide is killed, a Washington, D.C. journalist starts investigating the case involving the Representative, his old college friend.','/mWsfeSFUM3NxWa62UrA9IIn240B.jpg','2009-04-17',127,'Released','Find the truth','State of Play',16995,11.1182,6.8,'s1Sp1QvyQQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20637,_binary '\0','/jsq2b32PcSVCdWTOWvQmBynhNER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473707',7.1,1650,'no','Sønner','Trouble starts when Lars, a 25-year-old with few prospects for the future, discovers that an older man is fooling around with the teenage boys in his suburb. A terrible rage is triggered in Lars, and he embarks on a crusade to stop the abuser. But it soon spins out of control, and Lars\' actions end up endangering those he set out to protect.','/qIdHM36qjHNAVbtHBUfLlKEV3sY.jpg','2006-09-15',103,'Released',NULL,'Sons',43076,1.0033,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20638,_binary '\0','/qvxpRdDNH2QoruMXGV5g44gItST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473709',6.5,6217,'en','The TV Set','As a writer named Mike struggles to shepherd his semi-autobiographical sitcom into development, his vision is slowly eroded by a domineering network executive named Lenny who favors trashy reality programming. The irony, of course, is that every crass suggestion Lenny makes improves the show\'s response from test audiences and brings the show a step closer to getting on the air.','/djR3SWD7ZEs5lcrjUifaWVCG7eY.jpg','2007-04-06',85,'Released','A place where dreams are cancelled.','The TV Set',17320,2.751,6.1,'aE1kEbWbH1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20639,_binary '\0','/z3xpnup2yshwV88pj3VmxQPO5F1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473753',7.1,37645,'fr','Angel-A','A beautiful and mysterious woman helps an inept scam artist get his game together... but is their meeting purely coincidence?','/ojUGHGfroGRwW7jO0727txepQbC.jpg','2005-12-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Angel-A',11227,4.1034,6.975,'IaoYTgbUmdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20640,_binary '\0','/pHqTQA8bDaXcnTiJ8fNmRVcpXGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0473829',5.2,4425,'fr','Camping','Plastic surgeon Michel Saint-Josse is on his way to Spain where he hopes to spend a stress-free holiday in a luxury hotel with his teenage daughter Vanessa. When his car breaks down near a camping, Michel accepts the offer of help from an extrovert gigolo camper named Patrick Chirac. Whilst their car is being repaired, Michel and Vanessa agree to stay in Patrick’s well proportioned tent, not knowing that, thanks to a series of mishaps, it will be their home for several days...','/7flI2OwTuWKQdZiWRZ6tw6ijvEB.jpg','2006-04-26',95,'Released',NULL,'Camping',13043,1.5666,5.5,'wYwZov5RRFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20641,_binary '\0','/ktPneDl4YnYw5zL4UKpWpxcPimA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0474622',6.8,1614,'es','Derecho de familia','A man in his thirties does not want to be like his father, but that seems to be unavoidable.','/50lgEhfkMuwLH55EmMnZUNU2lMm.jpg','2006-03-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Family Law',97548,1.1676,6.3,'YzxlOkczeBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20642,_binary '\0','/gkJ1QkZq3KxqoHpEIyoFTRa5Fvx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0474642',6.1,3652,'es','En la cama','It all begins at a party in Santiago, Chile, when a seemingly innocent gesture -- the offer of a ride home -- ends in a passionate night of lovemaking and intense conversation for young singles Bruno and Daniela. Shacked up at a flea-bitten motel for a one-night stand, the pair lingers deep into the night, alternating between powerful physical encounters and an ever-deepening emotional connection.','/nl1HMHXqsrTepnO33anCxGjLFxP.jpg','2005-08-03',85,'Released','Where you love. Where you betray.','In Bed',3041,2.3274,6.2,'BV92axPOADM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20643,_binary '\0','/xwfZcgSVzcLaqxCSxEtyZvGHy9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0474791',5.7,1386,'zh','女佣','Alone for the first time and away from her family in rural Philippines, Rosa Dimaano arrives in the cosmopolitan city state of Singapore to work as a maid. Her employers Mr and Mrs Teo runs a Chinese Teochew dialect opera troupe takes well to their new domestic help. So do their mentally disabled son, Ah Soon. In Chinese superstition, the seventh month of the lunar calendar is regarded as the month when the gates of hell open for forsaken spirits to walk the earth for 30 days. Unknown to Rosa, she arrives on the eve and her hell is about to begin.','/4xyVfbIb8KcIl1O0ym4uCqq6Qmb.jpg','2005-08-18',93,'Released',NULL,'The Maid',52494,1.7546,5.6,'-wokGQxKoAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20644,_binary '\0','/mmZvBvbAMPrDEJoP9YXUrRabQQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475169',7.3,18730,'fr','13 Tzameti','Sebastian, a young man, has decided to follow instructions intended for someone else, without knowing where they will take him. Something else he does not know is that Gerard Dorez, a cop on a knife-edge, is tailing him. When he reaches his destination, Sebastian falls into a degenerate, clandestine world of mental chaos behind closed doors in which men gamble on the lives of others men.','/kSpFeY6ibND9ygqSFcOzEKK0Cl.jpg','2006-02-08',93,'Released',NULL,'13 Tzameti',6077,2.3642,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20645,_binary '\0','/ebuyZzFXdxTmFVGqFxnPlZBTaj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475217',3.8,1428,'en','All In','Six medical students with unique talents pool their resources to win the World Series of Poker.','/b0Clmm3ujjU2k22x3y7hSfmewCM.jpg','2006-03-14',98,'Released',NULL,'All In',19342,1.4818,4.5,'y1yIc97HC6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20646,_binary '\0','/2VUtjy87wkeFbfTFJdValx68atm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475228',5.4,1287,'en','Bone Dry','Eddie finds himself being forced at a gunpoint, by an unseen assailant, on a dark and brutal journey through the harsh terrain of the Mojave desert. His nemesis is Jimmy, a man with an aberrant agenda; armed with a rifle, a scope, walkie-talkies and a truck, he has organized a series of ambushes and mantraps designed to push Eddie to the limits of his humanity and beyond.','/3P5JdJBHAZRDtksicmGYZAnQxkK.jpg','2007-05-17',100,'Released','Some secrets won\'t stay buried.','Bone Dry',23165,1.2997,5.3,'TGAb9UblX94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20647,_binary '\0','/zY2e3un1MiiKnwfFRgUoaNStpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475252',5.5,3186,'en','Jack and Jill vs. The World','Jack and Jill\'s Manifesto of Rules to Live By Rule 1 Be honest Rule 2 Believe in fairy tales Rule 3 Accept time as our friend Rule 4 Make sure the nooky is good Rule 5 Promote beauty. Wage a sustained campaign against ugliness Rule 6 Abandon the pursuit of happiness and its false promise Rule 7 Show compassion, except to pirates Rule 8 Less TV Rule 9 Always be willing to admit when you\'re wrong','/g5LSsxj3pPEFOo33eIjKFMRP6CS.jpg','2008-04-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Jack and Jill vs. The World',16216,2.6787,5.2,'7satsBcbTj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20648,_binary '\0','/wCOriuQU0QtMlN4jG9I1C1qYkSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475271',6.5,1543,'en','Fetching Cody','Art, a drug-addicted dealer and hustler, arrives at his girlfriend Cody\'s apartment to find that she has overdosed on heroin. He tries to fix things by traveling back in time in an attempt to prevent her death.','/p7vuoA0vIldc9t48CRwougpidoj.jpg','2005-09-12',87,'Released','How far would you go for love?','Fetching Cody',46729,1.3709,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20649,_binary '\0','/mRq6cmEk4jPSlEIqRYwP4dNNptR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475276',7.6,116858,'en','United 93','A real-time account of the events on United Flight 93, one of the planes hijacked on 9/11 that crashed near Shanksville, Pennsylvania when passengers foiled the terrorist plot.','/r3mdSgsnpoi4UiUufdybhjha68t.jpg','2006-04-28',111,'Released','September 11, 2001. Four planes were hijacked. Three of them reached their target. This is the story of the fourth.','United 93',9829,7.4783,7.136,'kHdqw6scuIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20650,_binary '\0','/s3fiEXB08iQOoftCRFCO61WZiuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475286',6.3,1814,'en','Graduation','Four best friends, about to graduate from high school, must find a way to raise money to help a family member in need. When one of them discovers her banker father having an affair, the foursome plots to rob his bank during graduation ceremonies. When things don\'t go according to plan, they end up learning more about themselves in one day than they ever did in school.','/idw9ugBWMuBYfnzebxfTU7pl54X.jpg','2007-04-24',89,'Released',NULL,'Graduation',19203,1.7897,5.8,'qkICtNPeLWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20651,_binary '\0','/jcJ0ZAfDizBXFaWW0SkWB1FxgpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475289',4.2,2374,'en','Hack!','Seven college students are picked to travel to a private island owned by the reclusive Vincent King and his film-obsessed wife Mary Shelley to study island wildlife. But is isn\'t long when a mysterious killer begins 