ary '\0','/7IYaAEw2dSvUzs9fMDw9Pg7veYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475298',4.1,3408,'en','Snoop Dogg\'s Hood of Horror','A hip hop horror anthology of three tales of terror told by the Hound of Hell (Snoop Dogg) that revolve around the residents of an inner-city neighborhood whose actions determine where they will go in the afterlife.','/98abrZgWTnGP0noaY2Cli7SNhVb.jpg','2006-06-27',85,'Released','It AIN\'T all good in da hood.','Snoop Dogg\'s Hood of Horror',15423,2.351,4.8,'MV2g1nqfT4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20656,_binary '\0','/feHFEUmqUpqgkyUeQrFoVYIWxMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475302',5.8,1719,'en','The Hunt for the BTK Killer','After 31 years at-large, detectives in Wichita, Kansas hone in on the serial killer known as BTK.','/psVRNJ46jPn5ub5RwXDC35nf6aW.jpg','2005-10-09',82,'Released','Bind, torture, kill...','The Hunt for the BTK Killer',26301,2.4611,5.4,'O88aUccRhJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20657,_binary '\0','/cFMl2jt9ABthgLbCgZ08jWLQMd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475317',7,3639,'de','Knallhart','From the youth directed novel of the same name by Greogor Tressnow comes a film by Detlev Buck that is a realistic portrait of life in the section of Berlin called Neukölln. It’s about power and weakness, delinquents and victims, and the difficulties a 15-year-old faces in a poor and criminal environment.','/3HcEEKSNs2m4k8ghZ9cgTaSfyoF.jpg','2006-03-09',98,'Released',NULL,'Tough Enough',434,2.1554,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20658,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475323',3.8,1523,'en','The Lodge','A young couple\'s weekend getaway at a secluded mountain ranch becomes an unfathomable nightmare when they discover the truth about the caretaker.','/13Z36tF6dxpBrkDQOsGaabxwHoz.jpg','2008-04-11',83,'Released','A young couple\'s weekend getaway at a secluded mountain ranch becomes an unfathomable nightmare when they discover the truth about the caretaker','The Lodge',35247,1.1224,5.2,'c6Ab68wWYxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20659,_binary '\0','/1HpAhiFAfXHS1EloEbBq9GGGCL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475331',6.5,1361,'en','The Magic Flute','During World War I, in an unnamed country, a soldier named Tamino is sent by the Queen of the Night to rescue her daughter Pamina from the clutches of the supposedly evil Sarastro. But all is not as it seems.','/qjUjatQEMIHtCngnyTib943x7TU.jpg','2006-09-07',133,'Released',NULL,'The Magic Flute',37028,1.6248,6.3,'sEeJWr-yXpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20660,_binary '\0','/tlVaqq5mSXdBRXxqcptGRqoqFhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475355',6.3,7205,'en','Pride','Coach Jim Ellis shocks the community and changes lives when, aided by a local janitor, he sets out to form Philadelphia\'s first black swim team. But the odds are against them as they battle rigid rules, racism and more.','/lBMqdt52wgU9soSD9Asq1eNx6iX.jpg','2007-03-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Pride',16385,2.1709,6.7,'tJRTDl3z87E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20661,_binary '\0','/aGISpdwLN94fR6fs6xinYsk2FQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475380',5.9,6491,'en','Scenes of a Sexual Nature','Sex and love. Some seek it, some need it, some spurn it and some pay for it, but we\'re all involved in it. Set on one afternoon on Hampstead Heath in north-west London, the film investigates the minutiae of seven couples. What makes us tick?','/gyDQY4mileMV4C1O1T4Ux6Mtuwn.jpg','2006-11-03',91,'Released','Love on the Heath','Scenes of a Sexual Nature',18558,3.4898,5.3,'8YDVb3euNjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20662,_binary '\0','/mvWYpXsgeZiJ1GKrl0Nb1pwJI7I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475394',6.6,158683,'en','Smokin\' Aces','When a Las Vegas performer-turned-snitch named Buddy Israel decides to turn state\'s evidence and testify against the mob, it seems that a whole lot of people would like to make sure he\'s no longer breathing.','/nrdnN8WqvyOt8Bnl3hgWcZD6ZyM.jpg','2006-12-09',109,'Released','Nobody gets away clean.','Smokin\' Aces',7516,9.7844,6.5,'202uOuNsgow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20663,_binary '\0','/cAepc4UUAisGU9KKkqe4ZxoFjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475417',4,4153,'en','Unearthed','In the desert area of Hat Creek, cows are found partially devoured and the farmers believe that a wolf is attacking the cattle. The alcoholic Sheriff Annie Flynn is called by the local farmer Rob Horn to witness the remains of an animal to request reimbursement from the government and for an accident with a tank truck that is blocking the road.','/oc0LUTfhDnYIVZRF5AlDZF4tbQE.jpg','2007-04-27',93,'Released','Nothing stays buried forever.','Unearthed',15426,1.8659,4.2,'8fGYPYYDIJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20664,_binary '\0','/qqSHWxEbZS3TJwKQDWdDzDN95Br.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475532',5.9,2863,'ko','첼로: 홍미주 일가 살인사건','10 years ago, Mi-ju lost her ambition to become a cellist when her entire family was brutally murdered. Due to the trauma, she now leads a quiet life as a teacher with her husband and children. However, dreadful events begin to occur.','/rwMonNICMmNqF94UyZ5POWcFmIg.jpg','2005-08-18',94,'Released','The music screams to the death of one family.','Cello',32161,1.0564,6.1,'utB_TFLwL5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20665,_binary '\0','/i9zP3Ie65He6WaeYSZ1RRaUiwob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475590',5.4,1435,'ko','가발','Su-hyeon, a patient with terminal cancer, gets a wig as a present from her sister, Ji-hyeon. Strange things happen as Su-hyeon wears the wig and horror starts to sweep over Ji-hyeon as she watches her sister getting slowly possessed.','/bkonX3gOXQ1KC7kr6ufITli4h3o.jpg','2005-08-12',106,'Released','Some memories are more than permanent.','The Wig',21797,1.4229,5.5,'utAB2430cAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20666,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475591',7.5,1358,'te','ఘర్షణ','Rama Chandra (played by Daggubati Venkatesh) is the Deputy Commissioner of Police of Hyderabad City. His upbringing as an orphan, and the special nature of his job as a policeman, have left him reluctant to form relationships with women. He doesn\'t have much faith in the judicial system and seeks to \'eliminate\' the criminals in the town through encounters.','/fWOWOkWHV2HDr6wW0O7E6SPx4oQ.jpg','2004-07-30',159,'Released','The Final Battle','Gharshana',63671,2.4163,7.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20667,_binary '\0','/jRrI8vNlXDQdE4Qo6gqWOoEn13b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475616',5.9,1498,'ko','형사 Duelist','Detective Nam-soon goes undercover with her partner Detective Ahn to investigate the counterfeit money. She discovers that one loyal henchman, Sad Eyes, a beautiful swordsman with a pale, blank face, is related to the truth. Nam-soon and Sad Eyes confront each other in a series of duels and become confused between love and obligation to duty.','/9AV1o7PKrzFkfYchXrpWUwdIoaq.jpg','2005-09-08',111,'Released','Two hearts with one destiny.','The Duelist',26138,3.6158,6.46,'QuPNPUYXGfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20668,_binary '\0','/1fh8kxXqyvsEHYPOvkzIctWLg3b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475627',5.2,1313,'hi','शिखर','Jai Vardhan is influenced by an overambitious man. He is unable to differentiate the good from the bad and is carried over into a world full of women and wealth.','/rJDQqXFq8nXeEe2z9doY7XEhgm1.jpg','2005-12-30',162,'Released','Take it, or leave it...','Shikhar',276387,1.1405,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20669,_binary '\0','/fEYR56k4ANXYWmPAF0l1CEwbzbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475645',5,6774,'hi','वाह! लाइफ हो तोह ऐसी!','As the only employed member of a large family, Aditya Singh a big-hearted mechanic, works hard to provide for his siblings, his grandmother and a bevy of nieces and nephews. But, when he is unexpectedly killed in a car accident, his family\'s future becomes a murky prospect. Fearful for their safety and happiness, Aditya convinces Yamraj the Hindu god of death, to give him a chance to return -- as a ghost -- to carry out the unresolved business of his life.','/1f4PGH7PDRWlcr5xml3uZCZBobC.jpg','2005-12-23',132,'Released','Christmas is a time for friends and family and unexpected visitors.','Vaah! Life Ho Toh Aisi!',83903,1.4149,5.261,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20670,_binary '\0','/dEhFMiKCWahRQjTG043RlpAc1fZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475711',7.2,3590,'ko','새드무비','These intertwining stories about romance and separation follow a firefighter who can\'t find the right time to propose, a shy theme park worker who falls for an artist, an estranged mother and son, and a man seeking to regain his lost love.','/2Ur9d6aHguQ752alSktjdCDLSbk.jpg','2005-10-20',108,'Released','Have you ever felt love is pain? Separation is another face of love. This is the story of us.','Sad Movie',18422,2.0334,6.583,'FuB8YjJq5vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20671,_binary '\0','/iikdh5bTdZudRPtLAqsuZN7neJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475723',6.8,13249,'ja','Shinobi','Even though Gennosuke and Oboro are from rival ninja villages, they are secretly in love. At an annual conference with the Lord, it is dictated that a competition--a fight to the death--will take place between the five best shinobi from each village. Gennosuke and Oboro\'s love is made even more impossible when they each got picked as the leader of the five to represent their respective villages.','/bMOX0TERbblQxukU5fveGXKKMBP.jpg','2005-09-17',107,'Released','Fated to love : destined to kill.','Shinobi: Heart Under Blade',10116,4.1112,6.6,'KI7YVeFf3Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20672,_binary '\0','/c3yVO9qwkumMgKBo3hVSMhGITC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475750',5.7,1463,'ko','태풍','A vengeful refugee-turned-pirate steals nuclear materials to attack and obliterate the Koreas in a Nuclear Typhoon. A top South Korean naval officer is assigned the task to stop his plans and execute him.','/rk0jK1Q5LRWIdDWFrHbdilhVgA2.jpg','2005-12-14',124,'Released','The fate of a nation hangs in the balance.','Typhoon',32168,1.9089,6.1,'4IJFDHsDGUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20673,_binary '\0','/ayCmP16hIifeLh9PcCXt9iOMeYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475756',6.6,5443,'ta','திருப்பாச்சி','Sivagiri, a blacksmith from a village, visits Chennai to meet his sister and her husband. When he sees the city is not a safe residence for commoners, he takes the matter into his own hands.','/2DLhmWDkJiAMKS2VDtjNVrYXm2F.jpg','2005-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Thirupaachi',63642,1.5492,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20674,_binary '\0','/1t3cpOlMmftKsK8MzFweJAftAxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475783',7.6,7953,'ko','웰컴 투 동막골','Based on the long running play by Jang Jin, the story is set in Korea during the Korean War in 1950. Soldiers from both the North and South, as well as an American pilot, find themselves in a secluded and naively idealistic village, its residents unaware of the outside world, including the war.','/3FQ8p7kXTqdHJ2EIvQ5Y9TDTSw0.jpg','2005-08-04',133,'Released','Story about a village where the miracle lives in.','Welcome to Dongmakgol',14968,2.1989,7.4,'gama8x1E0r4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20675,_binary '\0','/2OavvmWY1uAYoUd19R5b8YgSW04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475860',7,2371,'es','Paraiso Travel','Marlon Cruz, a young Colombian man who motivated by his girlfriend Reina, leaves his comfortable life in Medellin and flees with her through Guatemala and Mexico, across the borders, illegally into the United States.','/4XYARMrT88Z498hDY91rQ0ZAbgK.jpg','2008-01-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Paraiso Travel',20171,1.6154,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20676,_binary '\0','/plsdKhrNZ4vIN1qZJ8ccihiMZI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475937',5.5,13797,'en','The Abandoned','Marie, a film producer, returns to her native Russia to find her birth parents. She quickly learns they are dead, and she has inherited their long-empty farmhouse. At the farm, she meets Nicolai, who claims to be her twin brother. Events take a terrifying turn when the two spot a pair of ghastly doppelgangers and the house itself seems to propel them toward a fate they should have met 40 years earlier.','/32DhJlTTmLeaPNQeh2oHuDNRmqF.jpg','2006-09-11',99,'Released','Death never runs out of time.','The Abandoned',10790,2.4337,5.5,'VHXpeVGJg0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20677,_binary '\0','/vn9BFSlvwILE4wPUITi4XDD3fEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475944',5.2,55427,'en','The Covenant','Four young men who belong to a supernatural legacy are forced to battle a fifth power long thought to have died out. Another great force they must contend with is the jealousy and suspicion that threatens to tear them apart.','/r6jbhgqKao3K3in4eftu7gqgMNH.jpg','2006-09-07',97,'Released','Only the power of Hell can help them.','The Covenant',9954,9.154,5.6,'mNdijA2KlJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20678,_binary '\0','/75qqVcvbeJ6PWL5sJ5a7ZE3gRsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475984',6.4,8861,'en','Mister Lonely','In Paris, a young American working as a Michael Jackson lookalike meets Marilyn Monroe, who invites him to her commune in Scotland, where she lives with Charlie Chaplin and her daughter, Shirley Temple.','/2r9QMXMePZ1Ggx8mySiOleNLWPj.jpg','2008-02-02',112,'Released','You are whoever you want to be.','Mister Lonely',16135,1.6221,6.6,'pXMOhCo0m5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20679,_binary '\0','/qnrtxlmvWGYzNKxtNnh8sd29j9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0475998',5.7,3325,'en','The Pirates Who Don\'t Do Anything: A VeggieTales Movie','A boatload of beloved VeggieTales pals embark on a fun and fresh pirate adventure with their trademark humor and silly songs in The Pirates Who Don\'t Do Anything - A VeggieTales Movie! Larry the Cucumber, Mr. Lunt and Pa Grape find themselves on the ride of their lives when they are mysteriously whisked back to the time when pirates ruled the high seas.','/hwawxSwOkjeld4eQLSkIyyYNnqO.jpg','2008-01-11',85,'Released','Set sail for adventure!','The Pirates Who Don\'t Do Anything: A VeggieTales Movie',15511,2.8146,5.7,'OTYQpS0wsJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20680,_binary '\0','/sOReKdiBdHuMFE4pq2Nnl1rqaR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476013',6.2,1364,'en','Hello Sister, Goodbye Life','A college student must take care of her 7-year-old half sister after the death of their parents.','/jVvcYUzZUQWcW2Z08EVOjxhCfhk.jpg','2006-03-18',89,'Released',NULL,'Hello Sister, Goodbye Life',139200,2.635,6.105,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20681,_binary '\0','/gl6lHX2TF6NBvnZn2G0TkghwpoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476148',6.2,2935,'tr','Beyza\'nın Kadınları','As dismembered legs begin appearing across Istanbul, Commissioner Fatih and his partner Doruk—a U.S.-trained forensic psychiatrist—race to catch the killer, even as Doruk’s wife Beyza, haunted by mysterious blackouts, discovers a chilling connection between her missing time and the victims.','/9EV5nkwpxnIA9K9Vg4D5JaKqi55.jpg','2006-03-17',137,'Released',NULL,'Shattered Soul',33951,1.1701,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20682,_binary '\0','/g7wtmLZ5n0etZJ4blB06hdo5oJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476298',6.8,1940,'es','Madeinusa','Madeinusa is a girl who lives in an isolated village in the mountains of Peru. This strange place is characterized by its religious fervor, and seemingly odd custom: from Good Friday at three o’clock in the afternoon to Easter Sunday, the whole village can do whatever it feels like.','/f187ptaaH4E0SVTIyJ9yoZYj6V4.jpg','2006-01-26',100,'Released',NULL,'Madeinusa',46820,1.8899,6.2,'0tRs-Ignk-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20683,_binary '\0','/EEMIchYqEEwPTWqvGP4Hvfz8Mf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476406',6.7,1591,'tr','Turist Ömer Boğa Güreşçisi','Ömer goes on a trip to Spain as a reward for finding the wallet that belongs to singer Rodriguez; when he accidentally gets involved in a robbery, he disguises himself as a bullfighter.','/tOwbZvzpJ8uJAggciAHe9eKOyyq.jpg','1971-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Omer The Tourist: Bullfighter',452586,0.9732,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20684,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476508',6.8,4614,'hu','Üvegtigris 2','In the sequel to the surprise hit Üvegtigris (2001), we witness the 6 losers again as they run amok around the roadside buffet, which again fails to make their dreams come true, but which serves as the basis and end station of numerous funny adventures.','/xr4hnuPETl196ZscjMW5FqI8UUY.jpg','2006-01-19',103,'Released',NULL,'Glass Tiger 2',36558,0.7534,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20685,_binary '\0','/494ocs7nbj5aihFfa1cNSjn6b2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476527',6.6,7111,'hi','ब्लफ़ मास्टर','Roy, a professional conman, gets dumped by his girlfriend after she find out the truth about him. After being diagnosed with a fatal disease, he resolves to do some good by helping an amateur conman to hoodwink the mobster who hurt his family.','/pekKOkIrc1fOwurlwqXR4g6K5sB.jpg','2005-12-16',137,'Released',NULL,'Bluffmaster!',19620,1.548,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20686,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476550',3.8,5605,'hi','गॉड तुस्सी ग्रेट हो','When a rival steals his presentation and takes the credit for making it, a man gets fired from his job and lashes out on God for making his life miserable. However, God appears before him in human form and gives him his powers with a challenge to do better than him.','/5K8FCmGrNpaAGXaxXovU7LLC0HF.jpg','2008-08-15',152,'Released',NULL,'God Tussi Great Ho',26153,1.3683,4.138,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20687,_binary '\0','/s0gmpE2gWOiN0yZvHRYJ6YTdpsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476603',5.7,1793,'de','Die drei ??? – Das Geheimnis der Geisterinsel','The hobby detectives “The Three Investigators” want to take a little break. So they take advantage of an offer from Peter\'s father, who has accepted a job in South Africa and wants to take the detectives there. But Jupiter, Peter and Bob wouldn\'t be the three investigators marks feared by the criminal world if they just lounged around in the sun on their vacation. So it\'s no wonder that the clever boys soon have their next case to solve...','/6fSy3VGyC0JHlUC2cG1vl36QiqI.jpg','2007-11-07',91,'Released',NULL,'The Three Investigators in The Secret of Skeleton Island',4407,2.2016,6.208,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20688,_binary '\0','/n2lMQH3x1cwzJmgfC5S0Jksg4AH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476643',7.2,5842,'he','הבועה','The movie follows a group of young friends in the city of Tel Aviv and is as much a love song to the city as it is an exploration of the claim that people in Tel Aviv are isolated from the rest of the country and the turmoil it\'s going through. The movie looks at young people\'s lives in Tel Aviv through the POVs of gays and straights, Jews and Arabs, men and women.','/b73kg6GIuUBAHavvQm2AKSCBA1.jpg','2006-06-06',114,'Released',NULL,'The Bubble',15976,1.5258,6.2,'10KO7Qoq8Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20689,_binary '\0','/vJ4UhDEFFsF67SrZ7JGK8SFA4c8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476649',5.6,3025,'hi','डरना ज़रूरी है','Five children enter a haunted house and find an old woman. She promises to tell them six scary stories that they won\'t be able to handle.','/g5cEhoRiJXedCGAKMQZEPiT2cp5.jpg','2006-04-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Darna Zaroori Hai',31983,1.671,5.281,'nSy2voxFl5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20690,_binary '\0','/bW0Hr19Xo7LDnMmywXuH5YoTMY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476680',6.6,9617,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO 大活劇! 雪姫忍法帖だってばよ!!','Naruto is thrilled when he is sent on a mission to protect his favorite actress, Yukie Fujikaze, on the set of her new movie, The Adventures of Princess Gale. But when the crew ventures out to film in the icy, foreboding Land of Snow, Yukie mysteriously flees! Naruto and his squad set off to find her... unaware that three Snow Ninja lie in wait, with a sinister purpose that will force Yukie to face her hidden past!','/eUNRUeSNzm8LktH4HRaYiAReB6R.jpg','2004-08-21',82,'Released',NULL,'Naruto the Movie: Ninja Clash in the Land of Snow',16907,7.6037,7.3,'hoP4P5n-8xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20691,_binary '\0','/3XHpweHWwc9COfu9U6emjrX6o99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476681',6.9,3403,'nl','Ober','Edgar works as a waiter in \'Het Westen\', a restaurant. He is married and has a lover. His neighbors terrorize him with loud music and garbage. One day after he is mistreated by some customers he is sick of it all and goes to talk to his creator, the scenario writer.','/q1fZgIV63vZ8bkxTPH25xoRbp83.jpg','2006-09-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Waiter',5816,1.8554,6.26,'Jtpg_vmYRp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20692,_binary '\0','/If6lyIWtYGRSdBKsHdY8Bib84z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476695',5.8,1551,'ru','Слуга Государев','Europe, 1709. Russia and Sweden are at war. Two French duelists are exiled by King Louis XIV of France: one to the side of Czar Peter the Great of Russia, the other to the side of King Charles XII of Sweden. Although separated by war and allegiance, fate has not finished with them.','/3PyvVMdWXAbHrPQfovg4PF3Rsbp.jpg','2007-02-20',131,'Released',NULL,'The Sovereign\'s Servant',19798,2.069,4.6,'Bo20Dt8nwD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20693,_binary '\0','/7pRPIVgvAA2fDJHxGakPjP7F1wf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476706',6.7,2722,'ta','வசீகரா','Bhupathi\'s father sends him to live under the guidance of his best friend, Viswanath, and find a job. He gets close to the family and falls in love with Viswanath\'s daughter, who is already engaged.','/ph0HoT40bV1t8vGGHDj7I8ZKcna.jpg','2003-01-15',176,'Released',NULL,'Vaseegara',69646,1.5816,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20694,_binary '\0','/f8W6fSOVjV9Cc7wIoqdxa7VGMBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476729',5,1671,'hi','अक्सर','A love triangle where everybody is blackmailing the other two gets a nasty upset when one of them is suddenly found murdered.','/nNgA58yyd3tO5e3ti1MocKygKhn.jpg','2006-02-03',135,'Released','Seduction. Scandal. Suspense.','Aksar',324218,1.0533,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20695,_binary '\0','/ci8NMpK3HvuySQRGPMAPyBSlL7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476735',8.2,102224,'tr','Babam ve Oğlum','A left-wing journalist whose wife died while giving birth to his son during a military coup returns to his family\'s farm. Estranged from his father for turning his back on the family and wasting his life with political activism instead, he tries to reconnect with him so that his son will have a place to live as his health is deteriorating due to the extensive torture he had to endure.','/ephCcqJYZFUnkQC7Oudah2qUL6O.jpg','2005-11-18',112,'Released','Give Him a Room Dad, He Has Nowhere to Go...','My Father and My Son',13393,1.9689,7.369,'KTmrUXNxwWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20696,_binary '\0','/wRnreVEnfCF4gWfAWRyiV1T9xY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476755',6,1603,'pl','Czas surferów','Three young guys got work from unlucky gangster... they try to make a great job but everything goes wrong','/4jLC8McYrKNddgKKuilImpvxCu4.jpg','2005-08-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Surfers’ Time',31854,1.8805,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20697,_binary '\0','/rP7vR6pIFh1dprMw6COuokBJnhl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476805',7.1,9463,'hi','मालामाल वीकली','After one of his customers dies from the shock of winning a lottery, lottery ticket seller Lilaram hatches a plan to have that money all for himself. But others from the village have also got their eyes on the money.','/kGYn1rK0XBciKqnGHtLSnzJw6Gf.jpg','2006-03-10',138,'Released',NULL,'Malamaal Weekly',20494,1.8346,6.41,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20698,_binary '\0','/e9gr6PXYKqSbKZXVScaWhmxlmwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476848',6.6,1400,'hi','रामजी लोंदोंवालेय','Ramji Tiwari and his sister, Parvati, had their parents pass away at an early age. Ramji is a skilled cook and is familiar with all aspects of vegetarian cooking. He arranges Parvati\'s marriage with the Mishra family, promises to pay a large sum of dowry, which he manages to get by promising to get married to a wealthy man\'s daughter.','/dKhPd5eqmDJERinmwFw1tYhJ6aj.jpg','2005-09-02',154,'Released',NULL,'Ramji Londonwaley',258688,1.1702,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20699,_binary '\0','/jWgZRq67aG5UQGxHyBcbNy5TWPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476872',6.9,2603,'pl','Skazany na bluesa','The life of Ryszard Riedel, former leader of cult Polish rock-blues band Dzem, including the history of his family relationships, music career and addiction to alcohol and drugs.','/sTJcTM7qfmtafPikz8DhPxo02du.jpg','2005-08-01',101,'Released',NULL,'Destined for Blues',31855,0.9243,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20700,_binary '\0','/iHgg34LIB4Uovc04zIRbRlDkLg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476884',7.3,11503,'hi','टैक्सी नम्बर ९२११','A taxi driver and a businessman create havoc in each other\'s lives after a chance meeting.','/jemDSQcGlsd1rvWkIDPamMKDkAj.jpg','2006-02-24',116,'Released',NULL,'Taxi No. 9211',20931,1.6649,6.312,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20701,_binary '\0','/5YRfEqAcnqyJmpVkWtEQMhKBjE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476958',4.9,12961,'en','Amusement','While being interrogated by a police psychiatrist, the near-catatonic Tabitha tries to explain why she and two of her childhood friends are being hunted by a serial killer. The truth that\'s dying to come out weaves together three tragic secrets from their past. Two of the girls\' boyfriends become unwitting targets in their deadly game.','/1XosEzjwTxL4NrVhn7ldunA3kfr.jpg','2008-10-09',85,'Released','Your Torture, Your Pain, Your Fear, His Amusement','Amusement',13803,3.844,5.59,'4NIVMgs9BZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20702,_binary '\0','/42peqRwvHPIvl4gZWBa2X9xZ67T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476964',6.7,68378,'en','The Brave One','A woman struggles to recover from a brutal attack by setting out on a mission for revenge.','/tdbOFY9ZnmOcxbNThJqGaIGCOow.jpg','2007-09-12',122,'Released','How many wrongs to make it right?','The Brave One',4413,7.4191,6.581,'Y9Bpr_AhoO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20703,_binary '\0','/wISiqQ8gVvAocK7OaQ74NPcvSXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476991',6.8,6132,'en','Were the World Mine','If you had a love-potion, who would you make fall madly in love with you? Timothy, prone to escaping his dismal high school reality through dazzling musical daydreams, gets to answer that question in a very real way. After his eccentric teacher casts him as Puck in A Midsummer Night\'s Dream, he stumbles upon a recipe hidden within the script to create the play\'s magical, purple love-pansy.','/g59ynRRLSyBNpLul3pqd9o7WHWm.jpg','2008-06-24',97,'Released','a musical dream come true','Were the World Mine',19375,1.9678,6.3,'9sH-ro9JkG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20704,_binary '\0','/w2gpGtFz0KuNuNhUxKTGQUzvgfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0476995',5.6,6780,'en','Firehouse Dog','Rexxx, Hollywood\'s top canine star, gets lost and is adopted into a shabby firehouse. He teams up with a young kid to get the station back on its feet.','/q6wm2pmx8WiYrNa1vbCaabCUDcD.jpg','2007-04-04',111,'Released','The biggest DogGone family film of the year','Firehouse Dog',10107,6.9769,6.2,'TzRddC5mJLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20705,_binary '\0','/nMgQD51KzAqrt4F6iwxw5TetVLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477051',4.3,90581,'en','Norbit','A mild-mannered guy who is engaged to a monstrous woman meets the woman of his dreams, and schemes to find a way to be with her.','/XcZ5NzygPp54csxCnzvQKuxFL2.jpg','2007-02-08',102,'Released','Have you ever made a really big mistake?','Norbit',9757,11.5835,5.7,'HFIdZpc2L6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20706,_binary '\0','/esXYvlivZ8j0HGqob949CIjqnGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477071',5.9,86708,'en','Premonition','A depressed housewife who learns her husband was killed in a car accident the day previously awakens the next morning to find him alive and well at home, and then awakens the day after to a world in which he is still dead.','/vKW1XIYrIqVrbCaYj9FQDHKXR8R.jpg','2007-02-08',96,'Released','It\'s not your imagination.','Premonition',9963,5.6902,6.3,'2ALLgKiE4gU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20707,_binary '\0','/tMZZY7EVNqpEyyHndgCY8ek0CfD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477078',6.5,14069,'en','Rocket Science','Hal is a 15-year-old high-school student with a minor yet socially alienating (and painful) disability: he stutters uncontrollably. Determined to work through the problem, Hal opts for an extreme route – he joins the school debating team, which sends him on a headfirst plunge into breakneck speech competitions and offers a much-needed boost toward correcting the problem.','/d5MfQznQKNtTsLFhw4wVXoqfk5y.jpg','2007-01-19',101,'Released','Life is easier done than said.','Rocket Science',13068,2.5396,6.2,'yjRSX-s_GIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20708,_binary '\0','/5JdyKWEzY6MQmJcIEdhbP4HozzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477080',6.8,220887,'en','Unstoppable','When a massive, unmanned locomotive roars out of control, the threat is more ominous than just a derailment. The train is laden with toxic chemicals, and an accident would decimate human life and cause an environmental disaster. The only hope of bringing the train to a safe stop is in the hands of veteran engineer Frank Barnes, and young conductor Will Colson, who must risk their lives to save those in the runaway\'s path. Inspired by true events.','/zKvHwL0GqLOear8rTnUPSTRYY0r.jpg','2010-11-04',98,'Released','1,000,000 tons. 100,000 lives. 100 minutes.','Unstoppable',44048,10.1909,6.6,'l__gGyq21U8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20709,_binary '\0','/1aIM2oiOBH5TJsvjcdU6ca9zwQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477095',6.7,27219,'en','Starter for 10','In 1985, against the backdrop of Thatcherism, Brian Jackson enrolls in the University of Bristol, a scholarship boy from seaside Essex with a love of knowledge for its own sake and a childhood spent watching University Challenge, a college quiz show. At Bristol he tries out for the Challenge team and falls under the spell of Alice, a lovely blond with an extensive sexual past.','/m0NU3kgn87iNffUUDeItUXZKUKl.jpg','2006-11-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Starter for 10',14055,4.3042,6.4,'p5JwoOHPmbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20710,_binary '\0','/wDLgGI6Rswo30YkWoM6TGq0VWVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477139',7.2,60062,'en','Wristcutters: A Love Story','Zia, distraught over breaking up with his girlfriend, decides to end it all. Unfortunately, he discovers that there is no real ending, only a run-down afterlife that is strikingly similar to his old one, just a bit worse. Discovering that his ex-girlfriend has also \"offed\" herself, he sets out on a road trip to find her.','/qModiIR60IMLP28ruGZluQOtsOj.jpg','2007-10-19',88,'Released','Life is a trip, but the afterlife is one hell of a ride.','Wristcutters: A Love Story',13198,4.4037,7,'H1xRtrKq1kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20711,_binary '\0','/w7qdz7CaRbcIbNcn79BZ5aqHCRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477252',5.8,5988,'hi','३६ चाइना टाउन','An inspector heads to 36 China Town to investigate a murder, where every suspect is hiding a secret.','/F7yT3LkiVpKbBiuo3ivA97euEw.jpg','2006-04-21',140,'Released',NULL,'36 China Town',20145,1.5821,5.774,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20712,_binary '\0','/oWEIJEos84dt8Uo6GN9BSjzHS1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477253',4.4,2028,'hi','आशिक़ बनाया आपने','An introvert is unable to express his feelings to the girl he loves. His friend proposes to her and she accepts, but leaves him when she discovers he is a flirt; however, destiny has other plans.','/AoK87XkGXwPsUThzWhQGZcxHR0f.jpg','2005-09-02',115,'Released','Love Takes Over','Aashiq Banaya Aapne',49496,1.2734,4.45,'pN6Z6nOgWkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20713,_binary '\0','/9wu6jYCrVbobNy0ecf03KxcFMLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477273',5.5,1290,'es','El camino de los ingleses','A coming-of-age tale charting the first loves, lusts and obsessions of friends on vacation at the end of the 1970s.','/buEG63oPmdkc8813Bfp2K91UZrE.jpg','2006-11-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Summer Rain',51676,2.0702,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20714,_binary '\0','/hTc55dlCPMP4oqrUU66GjKjSblp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477302',6.9,108339,'en','Extremely Loud & Incredibly Close','A year after his father\'s death, Oskar, a troubled young boy, discovers a mysterious key he believes was left for him by his father and embarks on a scavenger hunt to find the matching lock.','/6pszViNvKr1r31pP7gJNYDHEx5P.jpg','2011-12-25',129,'Released','This is not a story about September 11th, it\'s a story about every day after.','Extremely Loud & Incredibly Close',64685,7.7025,6.996,'jgp8rR2fykU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20715,_binary '\0','/yLJQaBPkSQzss0qtPSnX8KPlRnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477311',6.2,3133,'es','Para entrar a vivir','Mario and Clara, his pregnant girlfriend, try to find a new apartment to settle in as soon as possible, so they go to visit one in a distant neighborhood that seems abandoned. Once there, things are not as they expected.','/WyHj8gB12x5pUEG62uPAm74vge.jpg','2006-03-21',67,'Released',NULL,'To Let',17214,1.7576,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20716,_binary '\0','/jjYoNyWnSh8F2RinSlKwzNiWywq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477323',6.7,2264,'ru','Мне не больно','Three friends are in the entrance of a luxury home in the heart of the city. They are young, full of strength and energy, they have the talent, skill and thirst for life and ... - well, they have all but one. But money...','/2uYelHxS8T2th0GHCRvlL53AECv.jpg','2006-06-08',101,'Released',NULL,'It Doesn\'t Hurt Me',65839,1.337,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20717,_binary '\0','/1ZVlzOBYCggLzvVYHK7Im6LohjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477347',6.5,416527,'en','Night at the Museum','Chaos reigns at the natural history museum when night watchman Larry Daley accidentally stirs up an ancient curse, awakening Attila the Hun, an army of gladiators, a Tyrannosaurus rex and other exhibits.','/pDsAAYf6Zn0yiAGJ6lYGs6hoZ4E.jpg','2006-12-20',108,'Released','Where history comes to life.','Night at the Museum',1593,20.4669,6.6,'Ltba1_-tRT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20718,_binary '\0','/gddUsvfyySrM5k8B8wwJy2VRlBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477348',8.2,1213508,'en','No Country for Old Men','Llewelyn Moss stumbles upon dead bodies, $2 million and a hoard of heroin in a Texas desert, but methodical killer Anton Chigurh comes looking for it, with local sheriff Ed Tom Bell hot on his trail. The roles of prey and predator blur as the violent pursuit of money and justice collide.','/6d5XOczc226jECq0LIX0siKtgHR.jpg','2007-11-09',122,'Released','There are no clean getaways.','No Country for Old Men',6977,24.6036,7.95,'A0oNrgumrlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20719,_binary '\0','/dwmwsrjOqpD4MzrulbuJmZkH228.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477349',6,2043,'ru','Охота на пиранью','Agent of special department \"Piranha\" Kirill Mazur and his colleague Olga go to the far north with the assignment to liquidate an underwater secret weapon lab in the guise of a mutual vacation. All of a sudden, they find themselves in the world where civilization laws are forgotten, and this deadly weapons are kept by gangsters who are controlled by a new \"master of taiga\" Prohor, whose leisure time is spent hunting at humans. Mazur didn\'t know that he would have to trade his familiar gun for a hand-made bone knife, and save his companion and himself instead of saving the world. For them, this safari in northern forests would be no less dangerous as for the live targets.','/pxP70XjV9h303wxZ16TPKV9SEdP.jpg','2006-04-06',125,'Released',NULL,'Piranha Hunt',53085,1.521,5.817,'M5En5HvA4NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20720,_binary '\0','/uq4WzytVWkvKXUJs5USd8puA8rI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477392',6,1986,'en','Broken Bridges','A fading country music star returns to his hometown, where he reunites with his childhood sweetheart and also meets his 16-year-old daughter for the first time.','/f4vynL22x06Ip6nwZEh5ouO0mSI.jpg','2006-09-08',105,'Released','Sometimes you have to go back to move forward.','Broken Bridges',13842,1.748,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20721,_binary '\0','/jt4z6PDiYq5gUlyMNJiSAQKoa49.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477470',6.4,3520,'ar','السفارة في العمارة','The film revolves around an engineer working for an oil company in Dubai. He had to return to Egypt after twenty years. He was surprised that the Israeli Embassy was next to his apartment and was trying hard to sell the apartment at first.','/mmbzuPcfrL2fKQxbmuvPFubCW3b.jpg','2005-07-19',105,'Released',NULL,'The Embassy in the Building',86911,1.2933,6.511,'q5jlTlnV0Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20722,_binary '\0','/cYXDmauz29YMVSeOg3QTh5LsclB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477585',7.3,2264,'fa','کافه ترانزیت','A young widow takes over her late husband’s truck stop café, keeping hidden in the kitchen so as not to cause a scandal in Iran’s conservative society. But her brother-in-law, out of familial obligation, wants to take her as a wife and also take over the café. Meanwhile a Greek trucker who is a frequent café customer is slowly entranced — at first by her sublime cooking ability, and then by her.','/ApR2Yf5tixtCf10lCh1Tjua1Pjg.jpg','2005-11-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Border Café',43768,0.8665,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20723,_binary '\0','/zxxmSDnl5OwIxOmWQbgPvjmSRv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477731',7.3,4962,'th','แสงศตวรรษ','A story about director Apichatpong Weerasethakul\'s parents who were both doctors, and his memories of growing up in a hospital environment.','/1XUMd93PRMUkCtE2NWn0zQb1NC6.jpg','2006-08-31',105,'Released',NULL,'Syndromes and a Century',27904,1.2814,6.8,'KnIXg6-8lic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20724,_binary '\0','/jEwRR0t6gmYEGnoeTsWSV91iKym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477857',7.7,2673,'hi','Sehar','Ajay Kumar (Warsi) is the newly appointed, honest SSP of Lucknow police who tries to crack down on the Uttar Pradesh mafia. He establishes a Special Task Force consisting of a physics professor (Pankaj Tripathi) to counter the politically backed criminal Gajraj Singh (Sushant Singh). Loosely based on the real-life late 1990s organized crime wave in Uttar Pradesh.','/mfLIFMSy7wNbGQPfZftqRTzfJoF.jpg','2005-07-29',135,'Released',NULL,'Sehar',33460,1.0123,7.357,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20725,_binary '\0','/goQ3L7Gzh65A1gcQHeZJxAaQAW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477877',6.9,3288,'de','Sommer vorm Balkon','An intimate study of two women friends who come to each other because of troubles with everyday life and with men and thus try to enjoy a life based on their ideas.','/9zu21w5SwWDSHZI7P5fv8wJqUz5.jpg','2005-09-09',105,'Released','That‘s the real life!','Summer in Berlin',410,1.5758,6.3,'QWBup_wvyuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20726,_binary '\0','/kzdKyioNrJGqxIw9Fjt25OEbVaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477988',6.2,2154,'fr','Jean-Philippe','A bourgeois office drone whose raison d\'être is the music of French rocker Johnny Hallyday awakens one day in an alternate universe where the famed musician never recorded a single song. When he’s not at the office dutifully plugging-away, Fabrice lives a deadly dull life.','/2ItX0Pueg1a4tWAJx0jigYkYkHa.jpg','2006-04-05',90,'Released','What if Johnny had never existed...','Jean-Philippe',13713,1.9978,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20727,_binary '\0','/bXkUOTPY0gAdLNbHayXKGuEzTJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0477991',4.6,3370,'el','Κινέττα','At a Greek hotel in the off-season, a chambermaid, a man obsessed with BMW cars, and a photo-store clerk attempt to film and photograph various badly re-enacted struggles between a man and a woman.','/bjgIJAcL0HonVzvvZ2ebTN1F9SA.jpg','2005-03-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Kinetta',91410,1.2699,5,'iwMPS0NHT9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20728,_binary '\0','/5zmeFn1JsTY6Z2wjGGOw4ZFwJIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478024',6.9,14048,'cn','殺破狼','Chan, an articulate senior detective nearing the end of his career, is taking care of the daughter of a witness killed by ruthless crime lord Po. Martial arts expert Ma is set to take over as head of the crime unit, replacing Chan who wants an early retirement.','/38xh96dcfj6Z3aDj5phYZwKwHDn.jpg','2005-11-18',93,'Released',NULL,'SPL: Kill Zone',13127,5.2039,7,'JmJyXOIgyV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20729,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478033',6.2,1627,'en','The Shore','Hungering for some quality alone time with her new boyfriend, Ray, single mother Kaliope Harris leaves her young daughter, Anna, in the care of loving grandmother Mrs. Harris. An idyllic day at the beach turns to tragedy for the Harris family, however, when in the blink of an eye the precious young Anna seemingly disappears into the vast sand. While Mrs. Harris struggles to accept the startling disappearance, her enraged husband hounds the authorities to step up their search and Kaliope and Ray comb the beach in a desperate bid to retrace Anna\'s every step on that fateful and tragic day.','/ihwjhnpbhf2xT2tk6MEMbpYgesp.jpg','2005-09-11',100,'Released',NULL,'The Shore',480791,1.3494,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20730,_binary '\0','/ahGpGhgGrGITmDkDypIOzSSPxPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478044',6.3,4250,'ja','Takeshis\'','Beat Takeshi lives the busy and sometimes surreal life of a showbiz celebrity. One day he meets his blond lookalike named Kitano, a shy convenience store cashier, who, still an unknown actor, is waiting for his big break. After their paths cross, Kitano seems to begin hallucinating about becoming Beat.','/e14XCjaYzzkaVcuM3hZn5UZRYbl.jpg','2005-09-02',108,'Released','500% Kitano - nothing to add!','Takeshis\'',20347,2.0895,6.1,'KpUILnEENjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20731,_binary '\0','/v4sG9F05Aj3OWIUZSPVXRbOLGt5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478049',7.3,5765,'en','The U.S. vs. John Lennon','A documentary on the life of John Lennon, with a focus on the time in his life when he transformed from a musician into an antiwar activist.','/rdzIiZmJ4lCSO48cNt3rViWk3CH.jpg','2006-09-15',99,'Released','Musician. Humanitarian. National Threat.','The U.S. vs. John Lennon',14201,2.0231,6.643,'NTfyVYqYL90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20732,_binary '\0','/u6OCGwhSWhfQX1LZ4NTq0bfcWxs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478087',6.8,283040,'en','21','Ben Campbell is a young, highly intelligent student at M.I.T. who strives to succeed. Wanting a scholarship to transfer to Harvard School of Medicine to become a doctor, Ben learns that he cannot afford the $300,000 tuition as he comes from a poor, working-class background. But one evening, Ben is introduced by his unorthodox math professor to a small but secretive club of five students, Jill, Choi, Kianna, and Fisher, who are being trained by Professor Rosa to count cards at blackjack.','/efG8Po57alqSlhqHU1lXJ3duG6t.jpg','2008-03-27',123,'Released','They proved the Vegas Blackjack System was beatable...by beating the hell out of it.','21',8065,9.6466,6.693,'0DpvqzPdXoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20733,_binary '\0','/hAwKWoRbJbXy5Bgbef3YaN8uC3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478126',4.5,2480,'en','Cthulhu','A Seattle history professor, drawn back to his estranged family on the Oregon coast to execute his late mother\'s estate, is reacquainted with his best friend from childhood, with whom he has a long-awaited tryst. Caught in an accelerating series of events, he discovers aspects of his father\'s New Age cult which take on a dangerous and apocalyptic significance.','/rgf0vEc19nRmscRPu9y410GbhgM.jpg','2008-08-22',100,'Released','Welcome home... to the end of the world.','Cthulhu',19205,1.4049,5,'tzXtrRybOnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20734,_binary '\0','/8u5IUOsk2xdfpSj0ljrNHf6MKM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478134',7.1,77799,'en','In the Valley of Elah','A career officer and his wife work with a police detective to uncover the truth behind their son\'s disappearance following his return from a tour of duty in Iraq.','/ufCkeypovY01Dm123I2aPvGUA5H.jpg','2007-09-14',124,'Released','Sometimes finding the truth is easier than facing it.','In the Valley of Elah',6973,7.483,6.78,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20735,_binary '\0','/bDEdXeD4fVyYcvMMG9kDdDs5TGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478160',7.3,2669,'de','Die große Stille','An intimate portrayal of the everyday lives of Carthusian monks of the Grande Chartreuse, high in the French Alps (Chartreuse Mountains). The idea for the film was proposed to the monks in 1984, but the Carthusians said they wanted time to think about it. The Carthusians finally contacted Gröning 16 years later to say they were now willing to permit Gröning to shoot the movie, if he was still interested.','/ctqLEwsIRYIPBGAJaDm4UxnTqpO.jpg','2005-09-04',162,'Released','A meditation on life. A contemplation of time. Silence. Repetition. Rhythm.','Into Great Silence',11225,1.9341,7,'sgNj2Sf_mgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20736,_binary '\0','/uRyZpgMY4OfV7mmTY7nH4a57bxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478165',3.6,1771,'en','The Butcher','A tragic car accident in the middle of nowhere finds six stranded college students fighting for their lives after making a horrifying discovery in a remote farmhouse in director Edward Gorsuch\'s rural frightener. With no place to run and no police station for miles, these doomed students are about to discover that down home hospitality is the last thing on the minds of the murderous family who stalks them through the woods.','/9fNBPCwhsB8OOd6MKWNnE7UtqFy.jpg','2006-07-11',85,'Released','Rest in Pieces','The Butcher',10250,2.2556,5.089,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20737,_binary '\0','/1wyiLeThfEJcEK11bmerezy1auJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478176',7.3,1461,'en','John & Jane','A new form of observational documentary that borders on science-fiction, John & Jane follows the stories of six Call Agents that answer American 1-800 numbers at a Mumbai call center.','/yJOhIcju96PsEJ6i689fAxMNCXl.jpg','2005-09-14',79,'Released',NULL,'John & Jane',185515,0.6215,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20738,_binary '\0','/sHHRxXKspHLrzSu1BAFbugaX9e6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478188',2.5,2101,'en','King of the Lost World','In this modern retelling of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle\'s fantasy action-adventure classic, a commercial airliner crashes deep in the heart of the Amazon. Now, the survivors must face a mysterious and hostile world inhabited by giant scorpions, dragons, and a simian beast that stands ten stories tall.','/2wWIbl85HcxvUjPjLU6Qi4dStWn.jpg','2005-12-13',85,'Released',NULL,'King of the Lost World',31394,2.0596,4.3,'GIgXC7avN-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20739,_binary '\0','/ufzvWvgHpLhUG2TvpYgUFbu0O8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478197',6.8,2431,'en','Leonard Cohen: I\'m Your Man','Poet, singer / songwriter and ladies man Leonard Cohen is interviewed in his home about his life and times. The interview is interspersed with archive photos and exuberant praise and live perfomances from an eclectic mix of musicians, including: Jarvis Cocker, Rufus & Martha Wainwright, Teddy Thompson, ANOHNI, The Handsome Family and U2\'s Bono and The Edge.','/5b2G1junuUkQn5MtMDXobzHUbDZ.jpg','2006-11-24',105,'Released','A documentary on the legendary singer-songwriter, with performances by those musicians he has influenced.','Leonard Cohen: I\'m Your Man',57406,2.0105,6.4,'odzdOYVhELI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20740,_binary '\0','/6DaakTMERMr805MLPh7DouHwkzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478209',8,12956,'en','Metal: A Headbanger\'s Journey','The film discusses the traits and originators of some of metal\'s many subgenres, including the New Wave of British Heavy Metal, power metal, Nu metal, glam metal, thrash metal, black metal, and death metal. Dunn uses a family-tree-type flowchart to document some of the most popular metal subgenres. The film also explores various aspects of heavy metal culture.','/8e1q6wP5XVcjh3yLVU1WNdZnppm.jpg','2005-09-14',91,'Released',NULL,'Metal: A Headbanger\'s Journey',20604,2.3076,7.6,'VXtsDoAreBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20741,_binary '\0','/o5ASl6gOpO9zCHU42vdFOoExBGo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478210',4.9,1737,'en','The Good Student','When Ally, a popular teen and local celebrity goes missing, her small suburban town erupts in panic.','/uOmBrbZBABF7G3F0QaaJJURJGCw.jpg','2006-01-01',80,'Released',NULL,'The Good Student',16053,2.358,4.654,'_Rfn19buKLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20742,_binary '\0','/dqrQBIuAV1hK15hskZHS6AYtURF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478216',4,2557,'en','Nightmare Man','Ellen receives an exotic mask by mistake and begins to have waking nightmares and hallucinations. Her husband and doctors believe she is a paranoid schizophrenic and take her to a psychiatric ward. On the way to the hospital the car breaks down, her husband rushes off to get gas, and the Nightmare Man appears. Ellen escapes and stumbles upon a country house where two young couples are spending the weekend. They do not know if the killer is real or just a figment of Ellen\'s tortured mind nor if the killer is outside or already inside the house.','/oRHFRKWF7Q2fqOp439iMyecfcCV.jpg','2006-06-13',89,'Released','Your dreams won\'t save you','Nightmare Man',24409,1.4327,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20743,_binary '\0','/f9XCWfjRjxMSSqXLUVQ7580cW6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478303',4.7,2013,'en','Trapped Ashes','Trapped in a house of horror, seven people discover that the only way they\'ll get out alive is to tell their scariest stories.','/ohS68wlrWOQcbHMyYz74YoTTa8x.jpg','2006-09-12',105,'Released','5 Tales of Terror From the Biggest Names in Horror','Trapped Ashes',29865,1.8654,5.1,'lj4mQa2G_DI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20744,_binary '\0','/xq1HIwZq9VbuvMQELAua1nqEkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478304',6.8,193446,'en','The Tree of Life','The impressionistic story of a Texas family in the 1950s. The film follows the life journey of the eldest son, Jack, through the innocence of childhood to his disillusioned adult years as he tries to reconcile a complicated relationship with his father. Jack finds himself a lost soul in the modern world, seeking answers to the origins and meaning of life while questioning the existence of faith.','/l8cwuB5WJSoj4uMAsnzuHBOMaSJ.jpg','2011-05-17',139,'Released','Nothing stands still.','The Tree of Life',8967,10.7292,6.7,'RrAz1YLh8nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20745,_binary '\0','/8uNx4YtClqB9duM4n6jOx8vWvvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478311',6.9,402668,'en','Knocked Up','A slacker and a career-driven woman accidentally conceive a child after a one-night stand. As they try to make the relationship work, they must navigate the challenges of parenthood and their differences in lifestyle and maturity.','/b4OaXw2MW97VvIiZE0Sbn1NfxSh.jpg','2007-06-01',129,'Released','Save the due date.','Knocked Up',4964,11.6659,6.305,'K6oqO-xMERc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20746,_binary '\0','/mr2WQjdfuIpNf1bmwNFTzPy8sc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478324',7.5,2519,'de','We Feed the World','A documentary that exposes the shocking truths behind industrial food production and food wastage, focusing on fishing, livestock and crop farming. A must-see for anyone interested in the true cost of the food on their plate.','/buVa28Mh962tUKetAwnbpadkKMm.jpg','2005-09-10',96,'Released',NULL,'We Feed the World',11214,1.3188,7.4,'gJzBuuwSbOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20747,_binary '\0','/cYM6uKCw4YPm82kYpUu7xDrWXF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478329',5.9,1962,'en','The Gray Man','In the late 1920s, Albert Fish, a seemingly benevolent father and grandfather who reared his family by himself after his wife deserted them, turns out to be a serial child molester and murderer. Based on a true story.','/mAUCnj5F9YXfsuvdXI6VB5JCJ3t.jpg','2007-08-30',97,'Released','A real life Hannibal Lecter.','The Gray Man',18096,1.7587,5.9,'E2pkX4q_UW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20748,_binary '\0','/8agMWRNcX71M4Woj5zw0mIVAwvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478331',7.9,1932,'en','Workingman\'s Death','Is heavy manual labour disappearing or is it just becoming invisible? Where can we still find it in the 21st century? Workingman\'s Death follows the trail of the HEROES in the illegal mines of the Ukraine, sniffs out GHOST among the sulphur workers in Indonesia, finds itself face to face with LIONS at a slaughterhouse in Nigeria, mingles with BROTHERS as they cut a huge oil tanker into pieces in Pakistan, and joins Chinese steel workers in hoping for a glorious FUTURE.','/7zCEfxS3LCNTBMfMCxfUDnZ2g1R.jpg','2005-11-25',122,'Released','A documentary on the extremes to which workers will go to earn a living.','Workingman\'s Death',63290,0.9699,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20749,_binary '\0','/cEXuaKbvUxjEzJIQ1VPYeZ89eof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478337',6.2,3220,'fr','Zidane, un portrait du 21e siècle','Halfway between a sports documentary and an conceptual art installation, \"Zidane\" consists in a full-length soccer game (Real Madrid vs. Villareal, April 23, 2005) entirely filmed from the perspective of soccer superstar Zinedine Zidane.','/6zvoqWwSEYz3L7gnp9RHqbIoSJg.jpg','2006-05-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Zidane: A 21st Century Portrait',8421,2.1059,5.8,'5yhUnZSq_wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20750,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478338',7.2,1782,'en','Žižek!','ŽIŽEK! trails the thinker as he crisscrosses the globe, racing from New York City lecture halls, through the streets of Buenos Aires, and even stopping at home in Ljubljana, Slovenia. All the while Žižek obsessively reveals the invisible workings of ideology through his unique blend of Lacanian psychoanalysis, Marxism, and critique of pop culture.','/uInmp8gcdIZksJJMTPIGDOE5MIM.jpg','2005-11-18',71,'Released',NULL,'Žižek!',16190,1.0704,6.8,'rbl74xHJDnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20751,_binary '\0','/me5RPIQEtv0qpjlKQlb1SLijVVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478394',5.8,3572,'da','Vikaren','6th Grade gets a new substitute teacher. She wants to train the class for an international competition in Paris. But something isn\'t right. How is she able read kids\' minds? Why is she so mean? And how does she manage to convince everyone\'s parents she is so great when the whole class knows she is really an alien?','/zHApRXaV1NckNtZh6PnKChie2l1.jpg','2007-03-13',93,'Released',NULL,'The Substitute',12416,2.0201,5.7,'PNp_TYlZYnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20752,_binary '\0','/2BXz2yUpSXWqDzfNWQkykDvzt28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478404',5.7,1658,'ar','بوحه','Booha, a butcher coming from the countryside to Cairo to find the man whom his late father left his money with, gets tangled in the big city, finds love with Kotta, and gets exploited by Farag.','/81NR0eJ2j7x4ioq9xBZWVQFZHiC.jpg','2005-07-05',106,'Released',NULL,'Booha',418077,1.1265,5.8,'5kh48nXGIjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20753,_binary '\0','/zhceTJ7NOzgtTRkvmD5bumw74Lj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478566',6.8,5595,'fr','Nos jours heureux','Set in 1992, a manager Vincent has to run a children\'s holiday camp for three weeks and to face the unexpected concerning the place, his colleagues, various problems linked to children about the rooms, trips, their belongings...','/hCBcTQPqNY0HzzCcnoem8NNgI6W.jpg','2006-06-28',103,'Released','This summer, let your kids drive someone else crazy!','Those Happy Days',19100,2.4569,7.3,'m9AVJneYFSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20754,_binary '\0','/igpbsI6LH5eV1gIrePmiI1cWc2M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478724',6.7,6960,'fr','Prête-moi ta main','Life is easy for 43-year-old Luis, a happy single guy, fulfilled in his job of star nose with a perfume creation company, cosseted by his mother and five sisters. It could have lasted for a whole life, but fed up with mollycoddling and helping him, his mother and sisters decide it\'s time he got married, and the sooner the better!','/jfeJwdtZpsAR6ap9kSrBg7c3bSL.jpg','2006-11-01',90,'Released',NULL,'I Do',19955,2.4041,6.4,'pLaqnK4UVIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20755,_binary '\0','/l7838ZJZvhoxqVvWnFihqZusGVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478737',2.6,4438,'en','Treasure Raiders','Michael, an American professor teaching history at Moscow University, finances his passion for treasure hunting with competitive street racing. His racing nemesis Wolf becomes his ally as they both embark on a quest to search for a famous ancient Russian treasure.','/pLwSRAKrFqMk6UR3kyaLju0ndSk.jpg','2007-04-20',95,'Released','Speed is part of the game...','Treasure Raiders',42247,2.4262,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20756,_binary '\0','/4Q3ASPABplnuTGD1G3pLjADCczi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478829',7.6,5395,'de','Vitus','Vitus tells the story of a highly-gifted boy (played by real-life piano prodigy Teo Gheorghiu) whose parents have demanding and ambitious plans for him.','/7t5heYtCikNOASRM0KQfXgmD6ge.jpg','2006-02-02',120,'Released',NULL,'Vitus',14804,2.9798,7.4,'JfAZ0nBV1Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20757,_binary '\0','/1K3JmSNUN8OpjYsCjc0Hy0SYxAb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478970',7.2,794649,'en','Ant-Man','Armed with the astonishing ability to shrink in scale but increase in strength, master thief Scott Lang must embrace his inner-hero and help his mentor, Doctor Hank Pym, protect the secret behind his spectacular Ant-Man suit from a new generation of towering threats. Against seemingly insurmountable obstacles, Pym and Lang must plan and pull off a heist that will save the world.','/rQRnQfUl3kfp78nCWq8Ks04vnq1.jpg','2015-07-14',117,'Released','Heroes don\'t get any bigger.','Ant-Man',102899,24.8552,7.067,'cx3joJnXydc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20758,_binary '\0','/bH0HBG088hmtPutVaUpjpOvZw8f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0478988',7.1,9797,'en','The Call of Cthulhu','A dying professor leaves his great-nephew a collection of documents pertaining to the Cthulhu Cult. The nephew begins to learn why the study of the cult so fascinated his grandfather. Bit-by-bit he begins piecing together the dread implications of his grandfather\'s inquiries, and soon he takes on investigating the Cthulhu cult as a crusade of his own.','/dCrOkzrWs8ux31oVCc1R8tt6zTC.jpg','2006-04-03',47,'Released',NULL,'The Call of Cthulhu',20981,2.102,6.961,'p6vTI7aDIHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20759,_binary '\0','/xV6SvtnKM49ooURx0qiKdjA2QXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479008',6.6,1596,'en','Dante\'s Inferno','A darkly comedic travelogue of the underworld - set against an all-too-familiar urban backdrop of used car lots, gated communities, strip malls, and the U.S. Capitol. And populated with a contemporary cast of reprobates, including famous - and infamous - politicians, presidents, popes, pimps. And the Prince of Darkness himself.','/cdwHFqp7Ix8vY6UI35VVFjCPRPM.jpg','2007-01-18',88,'Released',NULL,'Dante\'s Inferno',73103,1.5083,6.3,'whHDbGeJcts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20760,_binary '\0','/kl4VevHWM5XYsBaYAJr4ZCVzTJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479044',6.8,2994,'en','Crips and Bloods: Made in America','With a first-person look at the notorious Crips and Bloods, this film examines the conditions that have lead to decades of devastating gang violence among young African Americans growing up in South Los Angeles.','/3sRr4aYMjXFq453ru3slJi5nnWw.jpg','2009-08-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Crips and Bloods: Made in America',18529,2.3295,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20761,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479046',6.9,1972,'en','Ghosts of Cité Soleil','In the slum of Cité Soleil, President Aristide\'s most loyal supporters were ruling as kings. The five major gang leaders were controlling heavily armed young men; the Chiméres. The Secret army of President Jean-Bertrand Aristide. \"Ghosts of Cité Soleil\" is a film about Billy and Haitian 2pac. Two brothers. Gang Leaders of the Chiméres.','/xZWj1OY8Dz6hIvZ29bnIzDNjea9.jpg','2006-09-01',85,'Released','This ain\'t no Hollywood movie','Ghosts of Cité Soleil',38008,0.9594,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20762,_binary '\0','/wJFQiD4kWFnv9zKyrPFtWBvElnX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479125',4.5,5106,'en','The Plague','Ten years have passed since the world\'s children fell into a coma. Tonight they\'re waking up and all hell is breaking loose. An unholy battle between the generations is being waged, and time is not on the side of adults.','/mqRmq3iDyvhvYp8kNfjnGhsaDMe.jpg','2006-09-05',88,'Released','And the children shall lead them...','The Plague',15420,1.8928,4.9,'EI6tDZUa6M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20763,_binary '\0','/fsJn2mPXMhauXsEpNTtFqDdjSQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479143',7.1,245809,'en','Rocky Balboa','When he loses a highly publicized virtual boxing match to ex-champ Rocky Balboa, reigning heavyweight titleholder Mason Dixon retaliates by challenging the Italian Stallion to a 10-round exhibition bout. To the surprise of his son and friends, Rocky agrees to come out of retirement and face an opponent who\'s faster, stronger and thirty years his junior. Rocky takes on Dixon in what will become the greatest fight in boxing history!','/byBlJvZwCqgtIwrZNv0pyE974jC.jpg','2006-12-20',102,'Released','It ain\'t over \'til it\'s over.','Rocky Balboa',1246,12.7668,6.886,'8tab8fK2_3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20764,_binary '\0','/dLZycHDty6VvglZOqFUFgQORQcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479152',6.3,1535,'en','Crazy for Christmas','A girl loses her parents and husband and is left driving a limo trying to get by raising her young son. An interesting but strange rich man hires her limo on Christmas eve and has her drive him to various ice rinks where he gives out $100 bills to the people there. The news media catches on and starts following him.','/evsHNkS1XgRrxkuAUcXhYll21eq.jpg','2005-12-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Crazy for Christmas',28535,1.2872,5.7,'19OfhI2tMJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20765,_binary '\0','/bYdGWaxzKd8diGFj5LiW9v5FrGx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479162',6.7,6056,'en','Special','A lonely metermaid has a psychotic reaction to his medication and becomes convinced he\'s a superhero. A very select group of people in life are truly gifted. Special is a movie about everyone else.','/5oGxZ9Itu8buWnB15p6sri3zh9n.jpg','2006-11-17',81,'Released','He\'s not your ordinary superhero.','Special',13856,2.0709,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20766,_binary '\0','/drk6V6q14u0ksBclhzJ35Q0s3kd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479199',4,2566,'en','Buried Alive','A college prank at an abandoned house accidentally awakens a frightening spirit.','/nGjRzBdlSwUnv2zoxpChWyttIBo.jpg','2007-02-07',94,'Released','Evil Won\'t Stay Buried Forever','Buried Alive',18217,2.3311,4.6,'OzUVB0Ttbm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20767,_binary '\0','/adpNDHaF3h4OsV14rN6YTl3NzN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479201',4.6,2349,'en','Living Hell','In a top secret Cold War military project an unstoppable, malignant organism who feeds on light and energy is unleashed threatening to destroy everything in its path.','/o9wvCa5ycdK24GOHrGRxrq2tUyk.jpg','2008-02-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Living Hell',14192,2.6846,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20768,_binary '\0','/wHpNhTOaa2WAOiaKZerFcc2RZGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479230',7,1585,'es','Un franco, 14 pesetas','In 1960, Martín and Marcos are forced by their difficult personal circumstances to travel to Switzerland in search of work, leaving their families in the Madrid of Franco\'s Spain. But they undertake more than a simple journey; they begin the road to a new life.','/nbxndlfCBb3jspjS1mhm1gMoT5s.jpg','2006-03-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Crossing Borders',34594,1.6125,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20769,_binary '\0','/TPFxU3h7TXzXeX4wxIiIQTy9Cq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479289',6.4,5351,'en','The Go-Getter','When his mother dies, a teenager takes a road-trip in a stolen car to find his long-lost brother. Along the way he discovers a profound connection with the car-owner and with himself as well.','/6WMZHz3Im5B41g63COwQsZcY7F5.jpg','2008-06-06',93,'Released','Life doesn\'t come with a roadmap.','The Go-Getter',9867,2.27,6.3,'nQH2BNN7QZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20770,_binary '\0','/jBhZq4RpXnVA7mcpjgsGwIwXjnq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479341',6.2,4752,'en','Adam Resurrected','After again attempting to commit murder, a Jewish man with a mysterious past and extraordinary intelligence, charisma, and body control returns to an insane asylum, where he makes a startling discovery.','/k0Di5lSe0oIzpJle2O9T5di4w3M.jpg','2008-08-08',107,'Released','In a world gone mad, being insane was just a way to fit in.','Adam Resurrected',18516,3.4194,6.126,'GQ1hNtR-xhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20771,_binary '\0','/xc9YIOS8p3JTfTjBSNjSlLBm927.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479354',7.1,3850,'es','Crónica de una fuga','The true story of four men who narrowly escaped death at the hands of Argentina\'s military death squads in 1977. Claudio Tamburrini is a goalie for a minor-league football team when he is abducted by members of the Argentine military police and taken to an unofficial detention center on the false suspicion that he is a terrorist. As he is tortured by intelligence agents looking for information he doesn\'t have, Tamburrini fully expects to be killed. After many sessions of brutal torture, Tamburrini and his fellow captives Guillermo and Tano are being readied for execution when, in a final desperate act, Tamburrini dives out a window during a rainstorm.','/rjizxUO1zTNre3vOLyF6Zc9pAxf.jpg','2006-04-27',103,'Released','An Inside View of Political Detainees','Chronicle of an Escape',25532,1.9132,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20772,_binary '\0','/iHn0mBPLqteqGMvoYz35vatFVy9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479468',7.6,8828,'en','Gonzo: The Life and Work of Dr. Hunter S. Thompson','Fueled by a raging libido, Wild Turkey, and superhuman doses of drugs, Thompson was a true \"free lance, \" goring sacred cows with impunity, hilarity, and a steel-eyed conviction for writing wrongs. Focusing on the good doctor\'s heyday, 1965 to 1975, the film includes clips of never-before-seen (nor heard) home movies, audiotapes, and passages from unpublished manuscripts.','/a8cRVJTTofxF7TgCGEvC5Yr4GnC.jpg','2008-07-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Gonzo: The Life and Work of Dr. Hunter S. Thompson',13003,2.1836,6.9,'EOHCjGhy6vY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20773,_binary '\0','/v8QN8VZmKPPzcA6Z0RXTU9ohDy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479500',5.9,22614,'en','Nancy Drew','Intrepid teenage private eye Nancy Drew heads to Tinseltown with her father to investigate the unsolved murder of a movie star in this old-fashioned whodunit based on Carolyn Keene\'s popular series of books for young adults. But can the small-town girl cut through the Hollywood hype to solve the case?','/a1aAZolyLFRwKhs0IWhFyTa8Z2Z.jpg','2007-06-15',99,'Released','Small town girl. Big time adventure.','Nancy Drew',14043,4.4974,6.1,'Y9UEn5ojXkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20774,_binary '\0','/6CiQYtwq2YBYnyPj2khGVYOTW7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479506',7,1693,'tl','Ang Pagdadalaga ni Maximo Oliveros','Maxi, a boy on the cusp of his teens, is already comfortable with his homosexual feelings, with acceptance from his family. When Maxi is assaulted one evening, Victor, a police officer, comes to his aid. Maxi soon develops a crush on Victor, who shows a platonic affection for the young lad.','/1BaFuDD2L5ixPSiIH8Ex1Lj7Xmi.jpg','2005-11-30',100,'Released',NULL,'The Blossoming of Maximo Oliveros',46773,1.835,7.2,'nhgcrHilKbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20775,_binary '\0','/jIR5W0htw4WWEU7vIIpRQMV87rC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479519',6.9,7135,'sr','Завет','An old man named Zivojin Markovic, living in a remote village prays for his grandson Cane to go to the city, sell his cow and bring back a wife. In the city he is supposed to meet up with his grandfather\'s stepbrother, but this man is dead. Instead, he meets this man\'s two grandsons, two good-natured brothers who are nevertheless small-time criminals and experts in demolition. Cane soon clicks with these men, and also falls in love with a schoolgirl (Jasna), who he wants to marry as part of his testament with his grandfather. He gets involved in this girl\'s family affairs, rescuing both her and her mother from prostitution and gangsters headed by a man called Bajo, and the new group of people return to the small village in time to celebrate Zivojin\'s wedding to his neighbor, despite the gangsters\' best efforts to stop the celebration, which results in a double wedding.','/yuf28s9rgYrLgqhOWISZ8vxHBrw.jpg','2007-05-26',123,'Released',NULL,'Promise Me This',8269,1.8026,6.5,'0r97yHmZm1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20776,_binary '\0','/f1AwhrhefodXEBD5c5Z7zOyPnq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479528',6.2,36619,'en','Rogue','When a group of tourists stumble into the remote Australian river territory of an enormous crocodile, the deadly creature traps them on a tiny mud island with the tide quickly rising and darkness descending. As the hungry predator closes in, they must fight for survival against all odds.','/abFDVe71e7UE5MpAqjZvUYT2U7M.jpg','2007-11-08',99,'Released','How fast can you swim?','Rogue',13022,6.3818,6.296,'BFx00dpfApQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20777,_binary '\0','/kPNnBitz7R2A5XzFT9NanVQGoVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479537',6.6,37010,'en','Seraphim Falls','The Civil War has ended, but Colonel Morsman Carver is on one final mission – to kill Gideon, no matter what it takes. Launched by a gunshot and propelled by rage, the relentless pursuit takes the two men through frigid snow-capped mountains and arid deserts, far from the comforts and codes of civilisation, into the bloodiest recesses of their own souls.','/3WCcrCYq9mCyFGLpgx2IwhpURTe.jpg','2007-01-26',115,'Released','Never turn your back on the past.','Seraphim Falls',13249,6.5138,6.4,'NHUOiMn3N-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20778,_binary '\0','/vs7iShyjIulyAkWqE8LdjkVPwNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479547',7.1,1728,'en','Surfwise','The inspiring and tumultuous story of 85-year old surfer, health advocate and sex guru, Dr. Dorian \"Doc\" Paskowitz, his wife Juliette, and their nine children who were all home-schooled and raised in a small camper on the beach, where they surfed and had to adhere to the strict diet and lifestyle of animals in the wild.','/jUDhBB4UPEifhPmjwviul5KxhIM.jpg','2007-09-11',93,'Released','Reject normal.','Surfwise',26354,1.6461,6.8,'uw4sUEV8lL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20779,_binary '\0','/f8Vy1YNbHcZSwXAS8zCzZ2yiSQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479647',6.7,13796,'fr','Bon Cop Bad Cop','When the body of the executive of hockey Benoit Brisset is found on the billboard of the border of Quebec and Ontario, the jurisdiction of the crime is shared between the two police forces and detectives David Bouchard from Montreal and Martin Ward from Toronto are assigned to work together. With totally different styles, attitudes and languages.','/kidOf2K4pEM0Llsm8aIRcANTcSF.jpg','2006-07-06',116,'Released','Shoot first translate later','Bon Cop Bad Cop',15049,4.4322,6.4,'2TwhiLUCOwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20780,_binary '\0','/sVImmZxxflmCxhsMEgWyoPWoTTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479651',7.3,11704,'ta','தசாவதாரம்','Bio-technologist Govind K Somaiyya sets about on a precarious journey to India to retrieve a vial containing a deadly virus and prevent it from reaching the wrong hands of an ex-CIA agent and deadly assassins.','/iD6ilUABEPd1hbijxdWCYHSetoi.jpg','2008-06-13',188,'Released',NULL,'Dasavatharam',17888,1.4178,6.706,'3g89myQGBN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20781,_binary '\0','/vpVF5tPI5v7h9knuwnwpPSaRToW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479751',7.6,24234,'ta','சிவாஜி','A wealthy engineer arrives in India with the mission of serving the nation and investing in the country\'s welfare but is met with strong opposition from corrupt officials and politicians. After being faced with insurmountable hardships, he decides to take drastic measures.','/t5oPb8q91gdClkyJG2hxyebEglv.jpg','2007-06-08',189,'Released',NULL,'Sivaji: The Boss',24049,2.009,7.086,'pu8slCV36bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20782,_binary '\0','/d118NiMInfjuMRGmEmfF5qif9Wf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479760',6.8,3607,'en','Sweeney Todd','A BBC adaptation of the Victorian \"penny dreadful\" tale of 19th century \"demon barber\" Sweeney Todd, of Fleet Street, who cuts the throats of unsuspecting clients in his London shop.','/40ntPvTqjqEJlME1AtBEzwVUPHC.jpg','2006-01-03',91,'Released','The demon barber of Fleet Street.','Sweeney Todd',37924,2.3645,6.4,'6XLcRvf-slw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20783,_binary '\0','/auv8ZM16bNZYIBg077dlwZrhY8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479879',7,1467,'en','Chasing Ghosts','1982\'s Video Game World Champions share their philosophies on joysticks, groupies and life.','/kr8v3Pa6DSXBihSCxfan4mcRVaa.jpg','2007-01-19',90,'Released','An arcade adventure.','Chasing Ghosts: Beyond the Arcade',15725,1.3255,7,'aQ6JhtEC_7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20784,_binary '\0','/8JPz1636hMcaADngF4H4KOxXfp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479884',6.9,279949,'en','Crank','Chev Chelios, a hit man wanting to go straight, lets his latest target slip away. Then he awakes the next morning to a phone call that informs him he has been poisoned and has only an hour to live unless he keeps adrenaline coursing through his body while he searches for an antidote.','/rsKmhnvzJezjwC1Ud2Hh37oNpdQ.jpg','2006-08-31',88,'Released','There are a thousand ways to raise your adrenaline. Today, Chev Chelios will need every single one.','Crank',1948,10.6764,6.673,'218nsccFpag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20785,_binary '\0','/pDUtAEZ5BSwigThZc76kH7EV5Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479937',6.8,3020,'no','Kautokeino-opprøret','Religious and cultural reawakening inspires rebellion in a 19th century Norwegian village.','/4euGED9y7Lt6QzQWw7z9HDwtPW4.jpg','2008-01-18',100,'Released',NULL,'The Kautokeino Rebellion',13221,1.38,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20786,_binary '\0','/uhm5xEupVoaarufw4CZCEI7Hvvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479948',3.9,2066,'en','Living & Dying','Four desperate bank robbers are forced to abandon their lucrative heist plans and become the reluctant heroes when two of their hostages turn out to be psychotic killers who won\'t stop until everyone in the bank has been ruthlessly slaughtered. As the police surround the building and the killers begin methodically executing the hostages.','/x6fnlbV9jeNbwBvGJsmW3ZGFug.jpg','2007-03-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Living & Dying',17954,1.8803,4.4,'p1CqaRnXEsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20787,_binary '\0','/3yXLkSTrVhG66MIAr3X6C4gjccw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479952',6.7,275349,'en','Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa','Alex, Marty, and other zoo animals find a way to escape from Madagascar when the penguins reassemble a wrecked airplane. The precariously repaired craft stays airborne just long enough to make it to the African continent. There the New Yorkers encounter members of their own species for the first time. Africa proves to be a wild place, but Alex and company wonder if it is better than their Central Park home.','/agRbLOHgN46TQO4YdKR462iR7To.jpg','2008-10-30',89,'Released','Still together, still lost.','Madagascar: Escape 2 Africa',10527,17.2958,6.535,'hLVjIhPYq7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20788,_binary '\0','/oKxcdRb2a96BhtnF3qcCwb80ilC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479965',6.5,1576,'en','Off the Black','An aging, disillusioned alcoholic gets a younger friend and wants him to pose as his son at a school reunion.','/p9ZHBbq0PuBI8iTaKnmxP1LouBS.jpg','2006-12-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Off the Black',54910,1.9955,5.8,'eskirF_UILg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20789,_binary '\0','/t3pSR0WtmGpogFIj8JqBUXQrJbn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479968',4.1,35541,'en','One Missed Call','Several people start receiving voice-mails from their future selves -- messages which include the date, time, and some of the details of their deaths.','/9pIvQaQV0sMHx7d3Ys9qTK9YqTZ.jpg','2008-01-04',87,'Released','What will it sound like when you die?','One Missed Call',6933,6.1269,5.373,'H9-fOJHnjm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20790,_binary '\0','/9Lm94WVtV4HPxr7NWNlwkhLKSeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0479997',5.4,103499,'en','Season of the Witch','A 14th century Crusader returns with his comrade to a homeland devastated by the Black Plague. The Church commands the two knights to transport a witch to a remote abbey, where monks will perform a ritual in hopes of ending the pestilence.','/dNVqi8EsBtnnwfR6TgiWM51JOuS.jpg','2011-01-07',95,'Released','Not all souls can be saved.','Season of the Witch',23047,10.3545,5.534,'yjCg3WCzKaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20791,_binary '\0','/oU5y1lggEM9cU6CglNC5rOPjntS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480011',5.5,7926,'en','Straightheads','After surviving a gang rape and mugging, a businesswoman and her younger boyfriend plot to murder their attackers, but find themselves conflicted about carrying out their plans.','/5W8jG9kt2UfEq8Tn0rb3BRaOPqe.jpg','2007-04-27',88,'Released','Let the revenge fit the crime','Straightheads',13538,3.6431,5.305,'ITeGr62TQyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20792,_binary '\0','/9JpS3EPGWVidpVW6LjTlXJ6jrKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480025',7.7,136120,'en','This Is England','A story about a troubled boy growing up in England, set in 1983. He comes across a few skinheads on his way home from school, after a fight. They become his new best friends, even like family. Based on experiences of director Shane Meadows.','/6ZVx7wLrlgSKxkYC2CRg6Zek0fG.jpg','2007-04-27',102,'Released','Run with the crowd, stand alone, you decide.','This Is England',11798,2.0839,7.486,'SfoJx6t97RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20793,_binary '\0','/2pNwXhvBUAFOEIWrcs45mqHMubC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480083',6.3,3472,'de','Die Wolke','DIE WOLKE (The Cloud) is about a breakdown of a nuclear power station in Germany and the story of two teenager-lovers Hannah and Elmar who take refuge. 38.000 people die and Hannah unfortunately becomes contaminated.','/gwep9xu87p5hXrCXEO3iDmuuwmo.jpg','2006-03-16',105,'Released',NULL,'The Cloud',7456,1.5417,6.3,'qRnOLhrWgf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20794,_binary '\0','/8FsiFZhK03BvTQphFCMFgUNXGAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480163',6.9,2204,'pl','Komornik','Lucjan Bohme is a ruthless debt collector working in a post-industrial Silesian town. In the land of unemployment and misery, he\'s got a lot of work and no mercy at all. Until something happens.','/16SkV2qUXJjMdWdSBtJhO9QX6Gx.jpg','2005-09-14',93,'Released',NULL,'The Collector',31021,0.8887,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20795,_binary '\0','/9T6BFDrcLFr5R9To0yTToCURthf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480239',5.6,14920,'en','Atlas Shrugged: Part I','A powerful railroad executive, Dagny Taggart, struggles to keep her business alive while society is crumbling around her. Based on the 1957 novel by Ayn Rand.','/tYfZIQb6ZabSUy1s1TRqSrYaAoM.jpg','2011-04-14',97,'Released','Who is John Galt?','Atlas Shrugged: Part I',56780,4.1595,5.471,'6W07bFa4TzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20796,_binary '\0','/uAa5bEEQvLxAqbKcOk9rGPLkZrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480242',6.8,111724,'en','Dan in Real Life','Advice columnist Dan Burns is an expert on relationships, but somehow struggles to succeed as a brother, a son and a single parent to three precocious daughters. Things get even more complicated when Dan finds out that the woman he falls in love with is actually his brother\'s new girlfriend.','/wJkkkG4ditqNzlua0oJzoaICGiz.jpg','2007-10-26',98,'Released','Something\'s happening to Dan. It\'s confusing. It\'s awkward. It\'s family.','Dan in Real Life',7211,7.1742,6.579,'5t2lxao1MvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20797,_binary '\0','/ePgD1cwmklyrFBjl6z96IuixuSY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480249',7.2,888261,'en','I Am Legend','Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.','/iPDkaSdKk2jRLTM65UOEoKtsIZ8.jpg','2007-12-12',101,'Released','The last man on Earth is not alone.','I Am Legend',6479,24.3855,7.223,'4uDU6SUpr8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20798,_binary '\0','/tpIb9rQMJZG4qhHN8UXjaqaetaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480251',6.4,2470,'en','Ira & Abby','A neurotic, young psychology student, with low self-esteem, has a chance encounter with a free-spirited, extremely gregarious woman who works at the Paris Health Club in New York City, and who suggests that they immediately get married to see how it will work out. Both of the student\'s parents are analysts, and they provide the happy couple with a gift certificate for a year of marriage counseling as a wedding present.','/gK2XUjqWoqqYw6auny29W8tFwUG.jpg','2006-06-23',104,'Released','First comes love, then comes marriage, then comes therapy.','Ira & Abby',38007,1.5256,5.6,'oqF9eJp0o0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20799,_binary '\0','/hACMcim5NtMH3S62sQAWkdLVpIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480255',6.2,112713,'en','The Losers','On a mission deep in the Bolivian jungle, a team of elite commandos finds itself on the receiving end of a lethal betrayal. Now presumed dead, the men join forces with a mysterious operative named Aisha to hunt down their enemy and even the score.','/e5oD3fuQpjZ8Po6WNW0VkUJmW52.jpg','2010-04-23',97,'Released','Anyone else would be dead by now.','The Losers',34813,10.0082,6.259,'HvuFYc5ucgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20800,_binary '\0','/u7joMKgr6olZ4A8nGgztYJR1YDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480269',6.8,14257,'en','Interview','After falling out with his editor, a fading political journalist is forced to interview America\'s most popular soap actress.','/jObPGoyEcBFB8x5j3Htabavgcxx.jpg','2007-07-13',84,'Released','A journalist and a starlet take on media, truth and celebrity.','Interview',8414,2.5972,6.4,'vCHUibmnZi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20801,_binary '\0','/xm7dypK8AlW3LdVtjmwgMzez4or.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480271',4.8,24847,'en','Van Wilder 2: The Rise of Taj','Taj Mahal Badalandabad leaves Coolidge College behind for the halls of Camford University in England, where he looks to continue his education, and teach an uptight student how to make the most out of her academic career.','/yJmLmors19hXAZn8wmFLtbOs3Qq.jpg','2006-12-01',97,'Released','The legend is growing.','Van Wilder 2: The Rise of Taj',10032,4.6871,5.088,'oBuzbh4Pf4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20802,_binary '\0','/Abpe9oByksEKjP0WO8Ine6n0zAt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480273',5.4,1889,'en','Walker, Texas Ranger: Trial by Fire','Walker investigates a murder connected with a missing government weapon. In addition, he tries to track down a teen on the run from a crime syndicate.','/ebaCtQ4Bz7FYazWYjBb9k1BEOxJ.jpg','2005-10-16',86,'Released',NULL,'Walker, Texas Ranger: Trial by Fire',6958,2.4851,6.4,'oMQ2jw1jspU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20803,_binary '\0','/hzVS5HkTURFchojFkNt8NgQkv9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480572',6.8,3363,'hi','Pyaar Ke Side Effects','Siddharth Bose lives a middle-classed lifestyle in Delhi along with his mother, and sister, Shalini. Their dad had abandoned them years ago. Shalini gets married to Kapil Sharma and moves in with him, while Siddharth works as a DJ with his friend, known simply as Nanoo. While performing for a ceremony, where Punjabi-speaking Trisha Mallick is about to wed India\'s youngest C.E.O., Vivek Chaddha, Siddharth sneaks in to use the bathroom and finds out that the bride does not love the groom and is about to run away. He manages to convince her to stay put, uses the facility and leaves. He meets her six months later in Mumbai, and he finds out that she did run away, both are attracted to each other and start living together fairly harmoniously, even though Trisha is taller than him.','/vAMb2pLLYFd0JUOruj4zFETLBI5.jpg','2006-09-15',132,'Released','Watch love crash in this season.','Pyaar Ke Side Effects',59362,1.7246,6.271,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20804,_binary '\0','/anA2hEvG5SWrYETwcJ1SUPUfKDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480669',7.1,76661,'es','Los cronocrímenes','A man accidentally gets into a time machine and travels back in time nearly an hour. Finding himself will be the first of a series of disasters of unforeseeable consequences.','/zdxQRP7mzczMJBwKnv8MCPRq7rQ.jpg','2007-11-01',93,'Released','A trip back in time from the present to...','Timecrimes',14139,8.0329,7.024,'0XSAGj2liCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20805,_binary '\0','/zqoWOXXLUNr0MUl5cih0m8lNm4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480687',5.9,138463,'en','Hall Pass','When best buds Rick and Fred begin to show signs of restlessness at home, their wives take a bold approach to revitalize their marriages, they grant the guys a \'hall pass\'—one week of freedom to do whatever they want. At first, it seems like a dream come true, but they quickly discover that their expectations of the single life—and themselves—are completely and hilariously out of sync with reality.','/eol3uD6whQKOKCmmhF7z39fq2Pe.jpg','2011-02-25',105,'Released','One week. No rules.','Hall Pass',48988,7.5149,5.752,'UIMYNVkZBSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20806,_binary '\0','/brV0ZQvlmFPR3hf9VQyWmeZY5ib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480732',8.5,2573,'bn','শ্যামল ছায়া','Refugees from East Pakistan flee West Pakistani soldiers aboard a rickety steamboat.','/k0KIqsShCTtNEHm2B2crp4eWUI7.jpg','2004-11-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Shyamol Chhaya',341586,1.316,8.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20807,_binary '\0','/gZxyNXRXURQ7mjbsVObyTlyE071.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480919',5.2,7324,'it','Monamour','A housewife dissatisfied with her marriage seeks an affair during a book fair, following a friend\'s advice. The experience brings unexpected revelations about her relationship.','/l3kR5u3I6e54zYMNnr6XcRB8KFz.jpg','2005-03-08',104,'Released','Discover the most hidden secrets in Marta\'s diary.','Monamour',27063,0.0714,5.637,'xsQn1dA3guA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20808,_binary '\0','/22i5BQl7hvWQfPUdEVU70FdNa7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0480922',4.2,2011,'it','Natale a Miami','In Christmastime Miami, heartbroken divorcée Giorgio invites himself to stay at his best friend Mario\'s — unaware that the latter is having an affair with his ex-wife — and ends up pursued by Mario\'s barely-of-age daughter; nosy and out-of-touch Ranuccio crashes his son\'s sex-themed holidays before ending up in a series of mishaps with Giorgio.','/vLkYqGvSyTVZcY9M6XIjiLbBAmq.jpg','2005-12-16',95,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in Miami',42434,1.1587,5.134,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20809,_binary '\0','/rmlgq2gjiXBK3YNWj6WSdueLv0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481141',6.4,86024,'en','No Reservations','Master chef Kate Armstrong runs her life and her kitchen with intimidating intensity. However, a recipe for disaster may be in the works when she becomes the guardian of her young niece while crossing forks with the brash sous-chef who just joined her staff. Though romance blooms in the face of rivalry, Kate needs to look outside the kitchen to find true happiness.','/eKqfRSf0DZ0Qey1f9ZHuZfsmXVR.jpg','2007-06-15',104,'Released','Life isn\'t always made to order.','No Reservations',3638,7.8577,6.708,'qm68An_PzAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20810,_binary '\0','/mpUtXPrBrApRbAelyiLRcW3aChT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481273',6.5,3289,'en','The Curiosity of Chance','It’s the ‘80s once again, new wave angst and genderbending fashion are all the rage, but new kid at school, Chance Marquis, is trying to find new ways to stand out. Being an odd and somewhat awkward teenager makes him the target of the school bully. To deal with this dilemma, Chance turns to the opposite ends of the high school spectrum for help. On one side is the flamboyant drag queen and at the other, the varsity jock, Levi Sparks with whom Chance develops a unique friendship.','/wyxqgHEuryzwE0pJYqwJGDo98Cr.jpg','2006-10-21',95,'Released','The only way he could fit in was to stand out.','The Curiosity of Chance',12839,1.973,5.9,'Nwqwb737wfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20811,_binary '\0','/cIgCBisRZh2a8yIkd12eJRzzQAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481280',3.5,1744,'en','Live Feed','Five young adults are about to find themselves in a fight for their lives, pitted against evil itself! While on vacation in a foreign city, one of the five makes a seemingly innocent albeit ignorant mistake and soon all of them will realize the cost of such an inconsequential action. A stranger appears to help them, but is this too little, too late?','/qm5Pp22L9dJqeDilRgnQMQZSJrt.jpg','2006-09-26',77,'Released','Vacation to Hell','Live Feed',35721,1.745,3.9,'pJ7CinRKE08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20812,_binary '\0','/zBFbGxw22wY2VTNGbcknd84CIEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481369',6.4,222641,'en','The Number 23','Animal control officer Walter Sparrow becomes obsessed with a novel that he believes was written about him, as more and more similarities between himself and his literary alter ego seem to arise.','/iPJwdvgX3I5dEw9QhDOG3hxUvMp.jpg','2007-02-23',97,'Released','First it takes hold of your mind...then it takes hold of your life.','The Number 23',3594,11.2523,6.405,'TUTlOC4mVQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20813,_binary '\0','/6SEh1SjP2EZ6OAIfc8c9btpmcli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481390',6.1,3288,'en','Kokoda','A bitter battle is fought between Australian and Japanese soldiers along the Kokoda trail in New Guinea during World War II.','/99XSpD5ItqGbwECfpspHWQRkwXR.jpg','2006-04-25',92,'Released','Mates became heroes. The track became legend.','Kokoda',9774,1.6324,6.2,'nTGQeZscLBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20814,_binary '\0','/wFN8llYh215M8i2fqWAcPV8CSyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481499',7.1,255067,'en','The Croods','The prehistoric Croods family live in a particularly dangerous moment in time. Patriarch Grug, his mate Ugga, teenage daughter Eep, son Thunk, and feisty Gran gather food by day and huddle together in a cave at night. When a more evolved caveman named Guy arrives on the scene, Grug is distrustful, but it soon becomes apparent that Guy is correct about the impending destruction of their world.','/27zvjVOtOi5ped1HSlJKNsKXkFH.jpg','2013-03-15',99,'Released','The journey begins.','The Croods',49519,26.1812,6.948,'4fVCKy69zUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20815,_binary '\0','/sx4255jeBRwZuU6MBytkhvNLTsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481522',6.3,10409,'en','Flight 93','Flight 93 is a 2006 made-for-TV film, directed by Peter Markle, which chronicles the events aboard United Airlines Flight 93 during the September 11 attacks. It premiered January 30, 2006 on the A&amp;E Network and was re-broadcast several times throughout 2006. The film focused heavily on eight passengers, namely Todd Beamer, Mark Bingham, Tom Burnett, Jeremy Glick, Lauren Grandcolas, Donald Greene, Nicole Miller, and Honor Elizabeth Wainio. It features small appearances from many other passengers, namely Donald Peterson and his wife, Jean, and also from flight attendant Sandra Bradshaw.','/4l8syk51fHsmWzM2xdEouOzV4rb.jpg','2006-01-30',89,'Released',NULL,'Flight 93',10958,2.3878,6.5,'c3cvZkyN6oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20816,_binary '\0','/6purgydDOA74TsuAF0VJpp1hFYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481536',6.5,146779,'en','Harold & Kumar Escape from Guantanamo Bay','Having satisfied their urge for White Castle, Harold and Kumar jump on a plane to catch up with Harold\'s love interest, who\'s headed for the Netherlands. But the pair must change their plans when Kumar is accused of being a terrorist. Rob Corddry also stars in this wild comedy sequel that follows the hapless stoners\' misadventures as they try to avoid being captured by the Department of Homeland Security.','/gmXKlm8c8O7JEISYP4WiWq2x3We.jpg','2008-04-25',101,'Released','This time they\'re running from the joint.','Harold & Kumar Escape from Guantanamo Bay',13335,6.7598,6.318,'HCsrvuxF9AM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20817,_binary '\0','/nZJhuZMSlL21rm5HrrLWWIV6drP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481797',6.1,14805,'en','Youth Without Youth','Professor of language and philosophy Dominic Matei is struck by lightning and ages backwards from 70 to 40 in a week, attracting the world and the Nazis. While on the run, the professor meets a young woman who has her own experience with a lightning storm. Not only does Dominic find love again, but her new abilities hold the key to his research.','/yG902RF45xC0IsPZkjuJZMmB5C5.jpg','2007-10-26',125,'Released',NULL,'Youth Without Youth',7797,4.2112,6.1,'EXtD1vdxfa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20818,_binary '\0','/HoAvIhuS5BVjadg4ZlZZ5P2Edy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0481995',5.7,1321,'da','Fidibus','Kalle, a nice middleclass kid, who because of a debt and old friendship ends up as a \'fidibus\', a gofer, for the hash baron Paten. But only until Paten is anything but innocently jailed and asks Kalle to mind the store while he is gone. No one touches Paten\'s money, Paten\'s car or, least of all, Paten\'s girl, Saby, who is dumber than water.','/e5DBXiA40iIdkLTEXcJ0ekzOtOE.jpg','2006-10-13',105,'Released',NULL,'Fidibus',15928,1.7397,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20819,_binary '\0','/jJshJgCR8N67ol2VmppSbBzKlQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482088',7,34470,'fr','Hors de prix','A beautiful young gold-digger mistakes a lowly hotel clerk as a rich and therefore worthwhile catch.','/yWLlqlCu7HmmDcpyAXUpPQjcUSC.jpg','2006-12-13',104,'Released','She only dated men with money... until she met a man with a heart.','Priceless',6691,4.7631,6.4,'RqQaWB6u-p8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20820,_binary '\0','/kZjUKO3urZ01fJ6kKtFy9jECqeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482374',5.4,4596,'en','Gone','A contemporary psychological thriller in which a young British couple travelling through the Australian outback become involved with a mysterious and charismatic American whose motive for imposing his friendship upon them becomes increasingly suspect and sinister.','/gOqehYqxkjwx7dxZw9HJyxdtLmZ.jpg','2006-10-26',88,'Released','The trip of a lifetime.','Gone',10094,2.1035,5.1,'eSKlmiTBnTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20821,_binary '\0','/5tmkPoo7UsN6SOpjK3IS72JLrQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482389',7.8,2956,'ta','ஜென்டில்மேன்','Kicha is a modern-day Robin Hood, who along with his friend, Mani, steals from the rich to aid the poor. In society, he is a respected man who runs a small business.','/dCQ5YBMRGhTuDvbpeOx5NWGqt5J.jpg','1993-07-30',160,'Released',NULL,'Gentleman',66530,1.1859,7.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20822,_binary '\0','/foVE3jz33hNdNWEGqY6k0oBxnv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482461',5.8,4704,'en','Barry Munday','Barry Munday, a libido-driven wage slave who spends all his time either ogling, fantasizing about, or trying to pick up women, wakes up in hospital after a freak attack only to find that his testicles have been removed.','/ctHpUBRpnuGtwF4mYkKQVdjG8NI.jpg','2010-03-13',95,'Released','A comedy that hits you right where it counts.','Barry Munday',44594,2.768,5.7,'HwVluL889X8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20823,_binary '\0','/tkD3cj2Yh6TgAqkZaWYxqrBGd2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482463',7,11322,'en','Bella','An international soccer star is on his way to sign a multimillion dollar contract when something happens that brings his career to an abrupt end. A beautiful waitress, struggling to make it in New York City, discovers something about herself that she\'s unprepared for. In one irreversible moment, their lives are turned upside down.','/bNMzx71jw8OU9indcV5Hc7eE53w.jpg','2006-09-09',91,'Released','One person can change your life forever','Bella',12586,1.5386,6.3,'mJ9AkTrbxgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20824,_binary '\0','/hU2VwB1khhKPyKzzdsbNGsvJxCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482473',6.1,1771,'es','Los Borgia','A portrait of the bloody dynasty that spawned a pope, Alexander VI, as well as the role model for Machiavelli\'s “The Prince,” his son Cesare Borgia, and a legend of femme duplicity, daughter Lucrezia Borgia.','/tutRE6NaS01f5PVCvbiaUygY4va.jpg','2006-10-06',120,'Released',NULL,'The Borgia',15941,2.5394,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20825,_binary '\0','/ieTEC1HsZ69FVR6hcjdrdq3Ale5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482527',6.2,44793,'en','It\'s a Boy Girl Thing','A visit to a natural history museum proves catastrophic for two high school rivals, an overachiever and a jock, when an ancient Aztec statue casts a spell that causes them to switch bodies and see exactly what it\'s like to walk in the other\'s shoes.','/uA4ZJdlILmIGSqBjfM4mkWvtcTt.jpg','2006-07-15',95,'Released','They\'ve turned into the things they hated most... each other.','It\'s a Boy Girl Thing',37725,7.1447,6.6,'7uh2l0TQrdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20826,_binary '\0','/heXvhrTFCF8j84iFQtpXEKCFwGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482546',7,34170,'en','Miss Potter','Beatrix Potter, the author of the beloved children\'s book \"The Tale of Peter Rabbit\", struggles for love, happiness and success.','/fecGKwGABfZdMbiH1WQN9zMcOkS.jpg','2006-12-03',92,'Released','The life of Beatrix Potter is the most enchanting tale of all.','Miss Potter',13967,5.9694,6.7,'PqF25DJk-fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20827,_binary '\0','/1Vrp1NCeFXnvkbOse80mRtwYgw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482552',7.3,2153,'en','My Family and Other Animals','Escaping the dreary wet weather of 1930s England, an eccentric family uproot and ship themselves to the sunnier climes of the Greek island of Corfu.','/g53Z9aFT02lgSn2h3hX910DjS4f.jpg','2005-12-27',90,'Released',NULL,'My Family and Other Animals',44746,2.377,6.4,'fnOhXa1tRgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20828,_binary '\0','/yaExZh6qE2cfyK3o4kAMEq0mkgy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482571',8.5,1625833,'en','The Prestige','A mysterious story of two magicians whose intense rivalry leads them on a life-long battle for supremacy -- full of obsession, deceit and jealousy with dangerous and deadly consequences.','/Ag2B2KHKQPukjH7WutmgnnSNurZ.jpg','2006-10-19',130,'Released','Are you watching closely?','The Prestige',1124,28.1081,8.211,'ijXruSzfGEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20829,_binary '\0','/6QHec9iNhFEGR6UgxQPDa49PAfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482572',6.6,65887,'en','Pride and Glory','A saga centered on the Tierneys, a multi-generational family of New York City Police officers. The family\'s moral codes are tested when Ray Tierney investigates a case that reveals an incendiary police corruption scandal involving his own brother-in-law. For Ray, the truth is revelatory, a Pandora\'s Box that threatens to upend not only the Tierney legacy but the entire NYPD.','/8VZ1ABbtXqwPcc06yXbf3gj3anG.jpg','2008-09-09',130,'Released','Truth. Honor. Loyalty. Family. What are you willing to sacrifice?','Pride and Glory',13150,7.3217,6.3,'626pWrVEAN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20830,_binary '\0','/nzievM20bSwmUMV6ELFA3w2uKtz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482599',5.2,40256,'en','Shutter','A newly married couple discovers disturbing, ghostly images in photographs they develop after a tragic accident. Fearing the manifestations may be connected, they investigate and learn that some mysteries are better left unsolved.','/t5AEelR6nS0ISwaSZCcUrF2GKZi.jpg','2008-03-21',85,'Released','The most terrifying images are the ones that are real.','Shutter',10885,4.6864,5.537,'BSNg47ntpt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20831,_binary '\0','/xBHa6D7XBiSDzCV4592iiF6bHNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482603',4.5,13503,'en','Space Chimps','When an unmanned space shuttle crashes on an uncharted planet, a trio of astronaut chimpanzees are launched by NASA into a wormhole to investigate.','/ecAKgzlt78OvEVpZURYYdSz8K5v.jpg','2008-06-25',81,'Released','From one of the primates that brought you Shrek.','Space Chimps',11802,6.7742,4.9,'PiFnm57c8nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20832,_binary '\0','/y27M2hIwZRRvMAVEadFPP5hCPg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482606',6.1,159172,'en','The Strangers','After a 4 a.m. knock at the door and haunting voices, Kristen McKay and James Hoyt’s remote getaway becomes a psychological night of terror as three masked strangers invade. Now they must go far beyond what they thought themselves capable of if they hope to survive.','/gwsg4qFmLOvlhwXj4OZuxfFUdP0.jpg','2008-05-29',86,'Released','Lock the door. Pretend you\'re safe.','The Strangers',10665,10.1804,6.118,'jKGiF5m-FNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20833,_binary '\0','/t6ohjYxnEolUGupwvsIHioWfVxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482629',7.3,23516,'en','The Ultimate Gift','When his wealthy grandfather finally dies, Jason Stevens fully expects to benefit when it comes to the reading of the will. But instead of a sizable inheritance, Jason receives a test, a series of tasks he must complete before he can get any money.','/8BdVk1u110lwHFELTEO9HrPrIDa.jpg','2007-03-09',114,'Released','Life is how you live it... not how you spend it.','The Ultimate Gift',14624,5.7877,7.7,'2KyFXNkcL_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20834,_binary '\0','/eNxbG6gaAS0kdDiCh4qplnnnxuv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482901',7.2,2997,'es','El baño del Papa','In 1998, a small South American village is in a flurry over the Pope\'s upcoming visit for the business opportunities that it will provide. While most of the residents plan to sell food at the parade, a smuggler family man decides to build a pay toilet.','/igpaNzJ1RNvF9moUyBBDxFyGfx0.jpg','2007-05-21',90,'Released',NULL,'The Pope\'s Toilet',8267,1.5609,7.1,'ukrNTgX2cjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20835,_binary '\0','/gOsmhLqpHcahFQJsUwHvqHG436S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482930',6.1,7490,'cn','龍虎門','Three young martial arts masters emerge from the back streets of Hong Kong to help the powerless fight injustice.','/qamxFxSDtxFk4WPOp5bOYroLqFa.jpg','2006-07-27',94,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Tiger Gate',15860,3.6524,6.7,'2-dr3SOiaow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20836,_binary '\0','/wX0jMgZVMHEkBedariBs6fUJZXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0482957',5.8,2362,'sv','Exit','There is a thin line between money and loyalty. Thomas Skepphult runs an investment company, and is arrested for the murder of his business partner when his fingerprint is found on the murder weapon. When he tries to call his lawyer, the phone is answered by someone who he thought had committed suicide years ago.','/1qLiAfCLQIpdjWte073jXPlCZE1.jpg','2006-10-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Exit',9345,1.7657,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20837,_binary '\0','/qMiPVNWRwLWPujUgiaRpwYjidCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483022',7.2,3092,'ja','かもめ食堂','On a quiet street in Helsinki, Sachie has opened a diner featuring rice balls. For a month she has no customers. Then, in short order, she has her first customer, meets Midori, a gangly Japanese tourist, and invites her to stay with her.','/2J1Pkw1DPMbFRuN07RI6TlZbNmt.jpg','2006-06-11',102,'Released','Have a meal and go on a walk.','Kamome Diner',25657,2.3104,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20838,_binary '\0','/jMBh2kcxc22QNuFbVCIALUAeotl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483131',7.8,3301,'ml','രാജമാണിക്യം','Bellary Raja is disowned by his stepfather in his childhood. Years later, his stepfather calls him to resolve the disputes between his children and makes him the caretaker of his properties.','/9ZuFyhpIu7vDFRuWvVVAYvVq0XW.jpg','2005-11-03',125,'Released',NULL,'Rajamanikyam',152359,1.3704,7.411,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20839,_binary '\0','/6MDi1agZzCX9jCO7osJZZbP3KeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483180',8.4,5535,'ml','തന്മാത്ര','A man leading a happy life with his loving wife and two children suddenly starts getting forgetful and lost. Then, he is diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s disease leaving his family devastated.','/v8Z4PlXRvhc56LFVHvq5nMBLjAS.jpg','2005-12-16',160,'Released','Molecule of life','Thanmathra',81168,1.5124,7.784,'wksaWg17yP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20840,_binary '\0','/bQI85ouoSyFozoMcUUTCOOGZ1fY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483577',4.7,1748,'es','El búfalo de la noche','Unable to cope with the fact that his girlfriend cheated on him with his best friend, a 22-year-old schizophrenic sets an elaborate revenge plan into motion before taking his own life.','/z9MCUZPV9CRPkNNJDw04hCM0ysC.jpg','2007-01-20',102,'Released','A schizophrenic man commits suicide after his girlfriend cheats on him with his best friend.','The Night Buffalo',71277,1.6797,4.6,'n_dgsThDdvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20841,_binary '\0','/sSyezBTzkIJzoGuTJN0Zw9KRHwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483578',7.7,4641,'ja','武士の一分','A look at the relationship between a young blind samurai and his wife, who will make a sacrifice in order to defend her husband\'s honor.','/gTzeKY4YzAlGtWq7zHs2cCoI2YV.jpg','2006-12-01',121,'Released',NULL,'Love and Honor',20527,2.4277,7.4,'bxNR7mE6cwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20842,_binary '\0','/2GmnhciVW262POiTCx43TTSvys3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483607',5.9,82718,'en','Doomsday','The lethal Reaper virus spreads throughout Britain—infecting millions and killing hundreds of thousands. Authorities brutally and successfully quarantine the country but, three decades later, the virus resurfaces in a major city. An elite group of specialists is urgently dispatched into the still-quarantined country to retrieve a cure by any means necessary. Shut off from the rest of the world, the unit must battle through a landscape that has become a waking nightmare.','/cKUmTyXgmhv8cMRCY9RYTKcAeTn.jpg','2008-03-14',108,'Released','Mankind has an expiration date.','Doomsday',13460,7.7972,5.9,'fJDVi0BMabU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20843,_binary '\0','/880DQZOSHxtGwBkwZ5ykuyBatVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483703',7.4,2964,'fa','خیلی دور، خیلی نزدیک','Dr. Alam, a prolific neurologist and a successful surgeon has drowned himself in his professional and social work in a way that has caused his estrangement from his son. On the night of his son\'s birthday a shocking fact about his son\'s health is revealed to him so he tries to track him down.','/xVGY67aelus4W8hHHGiLx3rYMJn.jpg','2005-10-08',121,'Released',NULL,'So Close, So Far',341470,1.038,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20844,_binary '\0','/zeZBKon9Sf0LsREbTQOAyfx9H4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483719',5.8,2571,'en','The Living and the Dead','Lord Donald and Lady Nancy reside in the magnificent but run-down Longleigh House with James, their mentally disabled adult son. Nancy has fallen seriously ill and Donald is preparing to sell the house to raise enough money to pay for an operation. He arranges for the family nurse, Mary, to take care of Nancy while he leaves to tend to the sale. However, James wants to prove to his father that he can look after his mother on his own and decides to lock Mary out of the house. It isn\'t long before James starts mixing his mother\'s pills and forgetting to take his own medication, and as the stress of looking after his mother increases, so too does the severity of his own condition.','/fxdORa3kVs4wPtI0ZmdRSsjNHYn.jpg','2006-09-23',83,'Released',NULL,'The Living and the Dead',13254,1.7877,6.3,'bZ8cDRkaK8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20845,_binary '\0','/uZO3UptXcRgcaZQUtirLo9fTI1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483726',6.2,37696,'en','Man of the Year','The irreverent host of a political satire talk show decides to run for president and expose corruption in Washington. His stunt goes further than he expects when he actually wins the election, but a software engineer suspects that a computer glitch is responsible for his surprising victory.','/s1etp9ZqcRqZVfonrdFJbQ6mgk9.jpg','2006-10-09',115,'Released','Elections are made to be broken.','Man of the Year',9895,7.8064,6,'qmUxABTagIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20846,_binary '\0','/vfubmDHN4kuQsFcjQI8ZxkkfPyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483756',6.1,6366,'en','Nobel Son','Soon after his insufferably arrogant father wins the Nobel Prize for chemistry, Barkley Michaelson is kidnapped by Thaddeus James, a young genius who claims to be Barkley\'s illegitimate half-brother. Motivated not so much by money as revenge, Thaddeus tries to convince Barkley to help him carry out a multimillion-dollar extortion plot against their patriarch.','/9fA6M3zAnS09x1hUth4AviCMWFZ.jpg','2007-04-28',110,'Released','Keep your eyes on the prize.','Nobel Son',15676,2.7017,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20847,_binary '\0','/itjMLkPvPf78TS6vbCbiPdEMOfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483812',6.2,2019,'en','Stephanie Daley','Stephanie collapses in a pool of blood while on a school skiing trip. A doctor discovers that the blood is the after-effects of giving birth. Soon afterward, the body of a newborn baby is found in a toilet, its mouth blocked with toilet paper. Despite Stephanie\'s insistence that her child was stillborn and that she had no idea that she was pregnant, she is arrested for the murder of the child.','/sSDxceWMWT30XlnXzy70FCS7vR0.jpg','2007-04-20',92,'Released','The truth is what we believe.','Stephanie Daley',20308,1.9686,5.8,'yFoky5z7fkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20848,_binary '\0','/ud2BLX99WuWEyADwumNCips1YTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0483817',6.1,1250,'es','Sultanes del sur','A band of thieves steals from a Mexican bank and travel to Argentina to launder the money. Upon their arrival, the plan goes south and it\'s up to them to figure out what went wrong.','/jy6jaofP0fEIEhwnlFitfQvFrrB.jpg','2007-12-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Sultans of the South',30232,1.5107,6.8,'fWpZ3JmzQXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20849,_binary '\0','/x7IChuFW13z0qQsKMQmGPBb8bxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484039',6.3,1633,'es','Glue','A teenage summer in a small town in the desert, a dysfunctional family, a rock band, a can full of glue, two boys, one girl, loads of tongue kisses, dry heat, wind in Patagonia, existential angst... A teenage story in the middle of nowhere.','/hs2t9b50iFwCE3mXlO12Vb72rAM.jpg','2006-02-02',110,'Released','Things can get sticky when you\'re a teenager.','Glue',10817,1.1756,5.7,'aWNVni3DTbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20850,_binary '\0','/qn5HfQcouuCk40FNXCnq8HKzpav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484090',6.4,6273,'th','แฝด','When Pim and Ploy, twins conjoined at the stomach, are separated, the operation leaves Pim the surviving sister, haunted by Ploy\'s vengeful ghost.','/vNsCrJSTsSLnldhdpc9koXf2IcO.jpg','2007-03-29',90,'Released','We promised to stay together forever.','Alone',37973,2.3645,7.148,'06LuRZAzCC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20851,_binary '\0','/92ByOurbPtxJG3jAuJexNWkpWJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484111',5.7,8912,'en','The Good Night','Gary, a musician, is trapped in an unhappy relationship with his live-in lover, Dora. He becomes enthralled with a beautiful seductress who enters his dreams, and tries to control his dream-state so he can spend more and more time with her. When Gary sees his mystery woman\'s face on a bus billboard, he discovers she is real, and fate brings him an opportunity to meet her.','/74TDF1OMKOkTonAUbtbsJOdqtVy.jpg','2007-01-25',93,'Released','Dreaming is believing.','The Good Night',13501,2.7883,5.361,'s8rd4VQrrLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20852,_binary '\0','/agOT5AGuU751175Mp4idwFeVGdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484207',3.5,1923,'en','Homo Erectus','Ishbo is a caveman living in the prehistoric age who thinks there\'s more to life than hunting and gathering. He tries to better the lives of those in his tribe by inventing things like spoons and the toothbrush, which leave everyone, including his parents, unimpressed. He also has a thing for cavewoman Fardart, but she only has eyes for his brother Thudnik. Can Ishbo prove his worth when a rival clan attacks?','/xSq1sUbExLnA6WY2FDyDTBzz2By.jpg','2007-07-10',98,'Released','It\'s Pre-Hysterical!','Homo Erectus',14641,2.8216,4,'vIdAZSqKg90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20853,_binary '\0','/absFB96aPHqqoBmNhmhKOJrmsHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484273',5.7,2195,'es','La hora fría','The eight years boy Jesús has been living in a crumbling underground facility since he was born with eight survivors of an apocalyptical war: the leader Maria and her lover Pablo; the gays Lucas and Mateo; the astronomer Magdalena and the teenager Ana; the soldier Pedro and the lonely Judas. They are permanently is state of surveillance, threatened by the contaminated mutants The Strangers and once a day they have to lock themselves in their rooms without heating to protect against the dangerous ghosts The Invisibles that attack in the Cold Hour. They cannot go to the surface, destroyed by a nuclear war. When they need supplies, medications and ammunitions, they organize expeditions to a store. When the menace of The Invisibles affects the safety of the group of survivors, they need to reach the surface. Written by Claudio Carvalho, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil','/l7plpd2fK9pgrxprjecADaSpjjY.jpg','2006-10-06',92,'Released',NULL,'The Dark Hour',58432,2.339,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20854,_binary '\0','/6CVsi2VmhdsHwNblI9siJuRIw1a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484275',7.2,1299,'en','Da Kath & Kim Code','The squabbling mother and daughter, Kath and Kim, embark on an excursion into the unexplored crannies of life at Lagoon Court, Fountain Lakes.','/n1UWAQ0FjC0XiCaDSMk3SbWp8L6.jpg','2005-11-27',82,'Released',NULL,'Da Kath & Kim Code',46463,1.8109,6.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20855,_binary '\0','/zDelLiuFKne00fNZlIbTJmJQVmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484349',5.7,2223,'tr','Döngel Kârhanesi',NULL,'/mjkIaP6HJr4PocyR68SPquF4sn8.jpg','2005-10-28',NULL,'Released',NULL,'Döngel Kârhanesi',63321,0.9341,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20856,_binary '\0','/5j0FescSUu5GYkpOgonv6a0enqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484368',6.1,2939,'da','Sprængfarlig bombe','Tony has recently been released from a sentence for violent behaviour. He promises to improve his ways and is finally granted a few hours alone with his two children. They celebrate the reunion by going to the movies to see a new film by the famous, critically acclaimed Danish director Claus Volter. But the film is not the masterpiece it is said to be on the poster; the children are crying and Tony cannot get the money back he spent on tickets and candy. Tony does not give up; he seeks out Claus Volter in order to get an explanation and a refund. It is however easier said than done to get money out of a world-renowned filmmaker.','/bxYzzyZlMFy6taJ7zdycjQ9S96L.jpg','2006-08-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Clash of Egos',16014,1.4342,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20857,_binary '\0','/dXNFmjsPzPmScIBDNDujYmtibi4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484382',6.1,3485,'en','One Way','To cover up his infidelities and protect his upcoming marriage, a star advertiser helps free an accused rapist by giving a false alibi and suffers the brutal revenge of the victim.','/1cJmiDpBgjdqUY02mfDAKMBM5YB.jpg','2006-10-21',116,'Released',NULL,'One Way',7298,2.5004,5.603,'hog1CdMjxos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20858,_binary '\0','/huvTqZl7pLOIIAGyDXfpBcgUnGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484437',6.5,3383,'ro','Legături bolnăvicioase','Love. It just happens. No rules. It may look sick, but it\'s deep and it hurts. For everyone, Alex and Kiki are just good friends. They happen to be two girls experiencing another kind of love. For their family, Kiki and Sandu are sister and brother who sometimes fight. They happen to be lovers. Love Sick is about their stories.','/lZtX6Cg4yzVtFnsuMPhEnwqh85t.jpg','2006-03-16',86,'Released',NULL,'Love Sick',48116,2.1547,5.6,'eI1RQTpCmlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20859,_binary '\0','/lTxRQzTfGwApLoxQlRldgOIcx55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484562',4.8,16277,'en','The Seeker: The Dark Is Rising','A boy\'s life is turned upside down when he learns that he is the last of a group of immortal warriors who have dedicated their lives to fighting the forces of the dark.','/65oKWdrQRwtkOolnCQMUQkvUryS.jpg','2007-10-05',99,'Released','Even the smallest of light... shines in the darkness','The Seeker: The Dark Is Rising',2274,5.1469,5.4,'fDCwHOPLUr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20860,_binary '\0','/qD4oylPXPLxQCULTWPzhwWSeEVI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484740',6.4,24952,'en','Love in the Time of Cholera','In Colombia just after the Great War, an old man falls from a ladder; dying, he professes great love for his wife. After the funeral, a man calls on the widow - she dismisses him angrily. Flash back more than 50 years to the day Florentino Ariza, a telegraph boy, falls in love with Fermina Daza, the daughter of a mule trader.','/lU3uvWGQlWeySxrUlJpxNaHW2Ra.jpg','2007-10-04',139,'Released','How long would you wait for love?','Love in the Time of Cholera',6639,5.2434,6.7,'KkDpvgncboQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20861,_binary '\0','/xpg20zdrhY4gDUDOBoUdNhxmPsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484831',4.5,1797,'en','Spy School','Spy School is the story of a twelve year old boy known for telling tall tales who overhears a plot to kidnap the President\'s daughter. When he goes public with his story, no one believes him, and he is forced to save her on his own.','/z9ten14NpRfFyrqXMFylUotTCFh.jpg','2008-03-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Spy School',31377,1.8325,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20862,_binary '\0','/aurQNWiJoRB2pEDc73uCahcN4BF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484877',5.6,19530,'en','Wedding Daze','After losing the woman of his dreams, Anderson is convinced he\'ll never fall in love again. But at the urging of his best friend, he spontaneously proposes to a dissatisfied waitress named Katie and an innocent dare evolves into the kind of love that both have been looking for all along.','/pDqYrYciP76wfzmAqB8SLO5j6f.jpg','2006-09-09',90,'Released','Marrying a complete stranger is a life sentence.','Wedding Daze',7839,4.7813,5.6,'Bn10w6WQAJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20863,_binary '\0','/vA5Mm6oFfwdHP1kvTOGmjBNypR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484881',4.3,1268,'en','Puffball','Architect Liffey moves to the Irish countryside with her American fiancé, Richard, to refurbish a long-abandoned cottage. Their neighbours are elderly Molly Tucker and her adult daughter, Mabs, who has three daughters but wants a son. After Richard returns to New York City, Liffey learns she\'s pregnant, which angers Molly and Mabs. Convinced Liffey has the baby her daughter deserves, Molly tries to use black magic to eliminate the fetus.','/lP2surwy23seOTzXCzZyqYeI8Z9.jpg','2007-10-28',120,'Released',NULL,'Puffball',33510,1.4494,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20864,_binary '\0','/i4ZX8I9JwqPSaEpHL6kGx3WsAki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0484905',4,5830,'en','Valley of Angels','A young man sells drugs to rich kids, but finding love gives him reason to leave the gritty life. However, the gritty life has trouble letting go.','/efFqtRrraafEucBZsOUtBoeBZ0Q.jpg','2008-03-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Valley of Angels',216865,0.9441,3.4,'PabgxlL8sV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20865,_binary '\0','/dpmyo8N5dW3D9uKbDKw78KUQnwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485061',6.3,3291,'en','uwantme2killhim?','Based on the Vanity Fair article of the same title, a story about a young boy drawn into a web of lies through an online chatroom.','/3auviYvP6IpcD1oqqDHfqaHfGP4.jpg','2013-06-24',93,'Released','Based on a true story','uwantme2killhim?',202960,2.0039,5.89,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20866,_binary '\0','/tK4krB6KQUrUSk3MsleWDoQQ2qe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485161',5.2,1807,'en','Totally Awesome','Do you prefer to wax on or wax off? Preacher won\'t let you dance? Well then, put Baby in the corner and come on down, \'cause VH1 is bringing back more of the \'80s you love in this feature-length film, Totally Awesome. The Gundersons have just moved across the country and the kids - Charlie, Lori, and Max - are trying their best to acclimate themselves into a new school and all kinds of dilemmas therein: the need to dance, the pitfalls of young love, the quest for popularity, scientific genius and of course the quirky but loveable Japanese gardener. Totally Awesome takes all your favorite \'80s-flick mainstays and weaves them into the biggest and baddest plotline ever conceived. Tot say it is radical would be an understatement.','/2OGYEK2Jl5E520LHJ51a2IryVDw.jpg','2006-11-07',94,'Released','Where the dancing is dirty, the pink is pretty, and the foot runs loose.','Totally Awesome',23134,1.6432,4.9,'norByDEjjw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20867,_binary '\0','/y0eyUFB8dBLKjbQFeAgFMiklQDq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485241',7.3,11830,'fr','Je vais bien, ne t\'en fais pas','A 19-year-old searches for her twin brother after he runs away from home, following a fight with their father.','/yD6skMZZq0Rgn2NhI9dk4B2Dipu.jpg','2006-09-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Worry, I\'m Fine',1254,2.8461,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20868,_binary '\0','/22Yf5NK8YyVlWwh7Z5uLkxzHT25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485272',5.2,6222,'hi','सलाम ए इश्क','Six couples who do not know each other are brought together by destiny, fate and love','/mMS86AP7rqKPaFZLvJwqkBoBiUv.jpg','2007-01-26',216,'Released','A Tribute To Love','Salaam-e-Ishq',25869,1.8636,4.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20869,_binary '\0','/gFzBLipMi8pBn3KkoL4WSgkIUu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485323',7.3,13054,'ja','劇場版 鋼の錬金術師 シャンバラを征く者','Munich, Germany, 1923. Two years have passed since Edward Elric was dragged from his own world to ours, leaving behind his country, his friends and his younger brother, Alphonse. Stripped of his alchemical powers, he has been all this time researching rocketry together with Alphonse Heiderich, a young man who resembles his own brother, hoping to one day find a way back home. His efforts so far had proven fruitless, but after lending a hand to a troubled gipsy girl, Edward is thrown in a series of events that can wreak havoc in both worlds. Meanwhile, at his own world, Alphonse Elric ventures deeper into the mysteries of alchemy in search for a way to reunite with his older brother.','/kdovrjrKighUFEh9ZRQul0Evx6L.jpg','2005-07-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Fullmetal Alchemist the Movie: Conqueror of Shamballa',14003,6.3532,7.3,'M_4nfoT93Rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20870,_binary '\0','/kAyWL8g6jkg9qehdpvkqTUgZxO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485376',4.9,2779,'en','Dark Corners','A troubled young woman wakes up one day as a different person - someone who is stalked by creatures.','/vVXNvAL2QoBfymaNsV0VgoLnX1V.jpg','2006-05-10',92,'Released','Terror Breeds in the Shadows of the Soul','Dark Corners',21927,1.5394,5.1,'qLGsEF78GOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20871,_binary '\0','/2TmNSAOjGPAPkBUIg177KS2ckR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485486',7.1,1597,'ta','சம்திங் சம்திங் உனக்கும் எனக்கும்','The story starts in a jail, where prisoner Muthupandi (Prabhu) is being interrogated by a police officer (Vijayakumar) about his past. Without hesitation, Muthupandi tells. Muthupandi is a son of the soil, a very hard working self-made man who dotes on his only sister Kavitha (Trisha Krishnan). Their mother died very early and it was Muthupandi who brought up Kavitha with a lot of love and affection. Kavitha’s best friend Lalitha (Richa Pallod), who is getting married, takes Kavitha to her house for the nuptial ceremony. As an emotional scene prior to this notes, this is the first time Kavitha has been away from her brother.','/2jBF95UVce5prCBVbBSRCApulrC.jpg','2006-06-18',175,'Released',NULL,'Something Something… Unakkum Enakkum',63815,1.5718,6.357,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20872,_binary '\0','/ba6XfZcA84HTYtI1RDqezsIcF7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485510',7.5,14523,'tr','Hacivat Karagöz Neden Öldürüldü?','Killing The Shadows is a bawdy comic fable set in the Ottoman Empire during the mid-14th century based on two legendary figures in Turkish folkore, the jester Hacivat (Beyazit Ozturk) and the nomad Karagoz (Haluk Bilginer), men who apparently lived and died by their sense of humour.','/q74W88WLCrld7x1YDyJneSffPLr.jpg','2006-02-17',135,'Released',NULL,'Killing the Shadows',50046,1.9263,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20873,_binary '\0','/mZxI4yqDsBkzZx5YkKBlZdFFXbM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485513',7.3,2874,'hi','मैं मेरी पत्नी और वह','A nondescript man weds the woman of his dreams, but his insecurities kick into high gear when her charismatic childhood friend arrives.','/hedAEBVB4TzodNZeixNP9xrqZ5t.jpg','2005-10-07',128,'Released','Love comes in all sizes','Main, Meri Patni Aur Woh',39218,1.172,6.104,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20874,_binary '\0','/uE9sa2uby1SyDe4Y7kJ7PmoS1vh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485522',5.4,2184,'hi','Umrao Jaan','Bollywood film about the famous courtesan of the title. Aishwarya Rai stars in the lead role. The film is directed by J.P. Dutta and also stars Shabana Azmi, Sunil Shetty, Abhishek Bachchan, Divya Dutta, Himani Shivpuri and Kulbhushan Kharbanda. A remake of the original directed by Muzaffar Ali and released in 1981.','/ttSoeSxv1OfbM0R0Xy3s6ZowmA5.jpg','2006-11-02',188,'Released',NULL,'Umrao Jaan',46618,1.3166,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20875,_binary '\0','/740KCabjLKjsrxvEakmmJtDtAGY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485601',7.5,41261,'en','The Secret of Kells','Adventure awaits 12 year old Brendan who must fight Vikings and a serpent god to find a crystal and complete the legendary Book of Kells. In order to finish Brother Aiden\'s book, Brendan must overcome his deepest fears on a secret quest that will take him beyond the abbey walls and into the enchanted forest where dangerous mythical creatures hide. Will Brendan succeed in his quest?','/vBymyj7QsXiW4TICD2JC5pAuBHO.jpg','2009-02-09',79,'Released','Turn the darkness into light','The Secret of Kells',26963,6.0805,7.4,'lw2_HZTuQBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20876,_binary '\0','/1wOyx3m5dag3cY20A3xHfjIdLXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485774',4,1477,'en','Heartstopper','Two hospitalized young people discover that things can get even worse when the dilapidated institution is stranded by a severe storm and a maniac stalks the corridors butchering the patients and staff.','/skjeHVCnU7fAym5HKkkl6Mx0uEh.jpg','2006-10-31',84,'Released','Each beat may be your last...','Heartstopper',10124,2.5,3.921,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20877,_binary '\0','/41D8Z0OXw3qCUhFxACBSMilGTIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485851',6.7,35621,'en','The Air I Breathe','A gambler’s bet spiraling into chaos, a gangster\'s prophetic visions, a pop star’s dark entanglement, a doctor’s desperate race against time to rescue his beloved... Four interconnected stories reveal life unfolding through four emotional pillars — joy, passion, grief, and love.','/hx89b5sinoXmkMNyK1PUgwjWQX4.jpg','2007-02-07',95,'Released','The question is not whether we will die, but how we will live.','The Air I Breathe',13641,6.0194,6.298,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20878,_binary '\0','/xnMUx6Nwi8hfodHSsjIBeyCSMhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485863',6.6,4554,'zh','墨攻','In 370 B.C, China was separated as seven nations and several other small tribes, one of these being the city state of Liang. The nation of Zhao is led by the terrifying Xiang Yangzhong who orders his troops to conquer the small city. Leaping to the defense of the people of Liang is \'Ge Li\' from the Mo-Tsu tribe, their last hope from the terrors of Yangzhong\'s troops.','/90DnSPn76GJVBlkcqqUR4ssMtH4.jpg','2006-11-23',133,'Released',NULL,'Battle of the Warriors',14808,3.0048,6.433,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20879,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485909',5.3,2286,'en','Gamers','Gamers is a comedy about the lives of four slacker friends (and one obsessive interloper) living at home, -\"with my parents... it\'s just temporary... \'til they die\"- working in the real world but playing in a fantasy world. Obsessed with a role playing game called Demons, Nymphs and Dragons these \"gamers\" are the subject of this hilarious comedy.','/t0e6VlmnHa5Yvyk4O5YebLFnSAx.jpg','2006-03-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Gamers',14339,1.6661,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20880,_binary '\0','/4Fa5zxtrRNjFGH4r3mQiS5SeG0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485922',7.2,1219,'ml','കീര്‍ത്തിചക്ര','When Major Mahadevan receives news of terrorists hiding inside a mosque, he and his team set out to apprehend them and then, he takes help of his team member, Jai, and plans to execute the mission.','/zyiFEPQvVqL4M9LxA34umyAJFFp.jpg','2006-06-06',140,'Released',NULL,'Keerthi Chakra',69554,1.0485,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20881,_binary '\0','/y9zcjxEilWr44c4vJbEaLTgE0Uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485947',7.7,259325,'en','Mr. Nobody','Nemo Nobody leads an ordinary existence with his wife and 3 children; one day, he wakes up as a mortal centenarian in the year 2092.','/qNkIONc4Rgmzo23ph7qWp9QfVnW.jpg','2009-11-06',141,'Released','Nothing is real, everything is possible.','Mr. Nobody',31011,8.8772,7.785,'-GzJ1gA6Mg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20882,_binary '\0','/vdbLewJrL6zf1FBezpFHihS6r6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485976',6.6,17250,'cn','寶貝計劃','For never-do-well compulsive gambler Fong, there\'s only one thing more fearsome than debtors at his doorstep - having to coax a crying baby. But what if the baby becomes his golden goose to fend off his debtors? Can he overcome his phobia of diapers, milk bottles, and cloying lullabies?','/aJZ8i1KEy5Kdc6hXNlLiHOlhdTA.jpg','2006-09-28',136,'Released','This September! Crawl Baby crawl!','Rob-B-Hood',25676,8.9319,7,'BjHdKRhQCRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20883,_binary '\0','/j89IzBAT9Ob0zGLR30h7coB6YVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0485985',5.9,38824,'en','Red Tails','The story of the Tuskegee Airmen, the first African-American pilots to fly in a combat squadron during World War II.','/dXmhYTdeMiuQFW4VpiWbfjtxtl9.jpg','2012-01-19',125,'Released','Courage has no color.','Red Tails',72431,4.8054,6.691,'NVq6Xr5fcfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20884,_binary '\0','/d4dkc0QhuEv1tRtqtaFzijky0OD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486028',4.9,4805,'en','Thr3e','Innocent lives hang on the whim of an elusive psychopathic murderer whose strange riddles and impossible timelines force three people into a mission to end the game before one or all of them die.','/fGXWsdhfJ4UIdCnsCJMkT2Ulo9p.jpg','2007-01-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Thr3e',13569,1.6066,5.1,'mdOFvLZx-Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20885,_binary '\0','/bWRdniW80LnVTm9SI16BKLx4MaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486051',5.7,29792,'en','Wind Chill','Two college students share a ride home for the holidays. When they break down on a deserted stretch of road, they\'re preyed upon by the ghosts of people who have died there.','/hCHJNA3ZhfwmbMARfj0XqwYI0hC.jpg','2007-05-18',91,'Released','There Are Worse Things Than Dying.','Wind Chill',14223,6.0089,5.8,'4Zce1kRTb6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20886,_binary '\0','/wR2sN3apgtzFPpt95JsROTBIoSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486099',3.7,1411,'en','Kraken: Tentacles of the Deep','Thirty years ago, Ray Reiter witnessed the brutal death of his parents at sea by a strange, octopus-like creature. Now determined to exact revenge, he joins archaeologist Nicole on a perilous high-seas expedition to find a legendary Greek Opal - said to be guarded by the very beast that murdered his family. As they come face to face with the killer Kraken, they must also battle a ruthless crime lord, who will stop at nothing to seize the coveted treasure for himself.','/d2H1CkZ0cmxgaE33mAK5Z8wyAWW.jpg','2006-09-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Kraken: Tentacles of the Deep',42905,2.6642,3.6,'tL9B8oODL2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20887,_binary '\0','/teZ2kPm9ruLUeD00hSXsRs0glaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486138',6,2127,'it','Il mio miglior nemico','When a neurotic hotel manager fires a maid for allegedly stealing a laptop, her son swears revenge and begins to expose his deepest secrets — only to regret it after falling for his daughter.','/gI5kiWur7p2TcdFXB741Cl1xnqR.jpg','2006-03-10',110,'Released','Verdone Vs Muccino','My Best Enemy',38327,1.7453,6.126,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20888,_binary '\0','/jDmsdUZbkBMY0cCZPwD5xJOKGd4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486219',6.9,4732,'hu','Szabadság, szerelem','During the ill-fated Hungarian revolution of 1956, Karcsi Szabo, star player on the water polo team, is torn between his love for a revolutionary student and his training for the Melbourne Olympics.','/nItIaVLewCOqeEWt8Kamj8TBM9B.jpg','2006-10-23',123,'Released',NULL,'Children of Glory',13616,2.1214,6.8,'F6WNqrWddUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20889,_binary '\0','/wMgPFZLAlOztdzQuadaGmYW5w4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486259',6.4,4260,'en','American Teen','A documentary on seniors at a high school in a small Indiana town and their various cliques.','/3wyLydrkvf4BbfBOzpX9amhx5MU.jpg','2008-07-25',95,'Released','Remember high school? It\'s gotten worse.','American Teen',13259,2.1449,6.4,'AEfZzcmL6vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20890,_binary '\0','/u3tlgsuYsZ4Y71c4Lp7hh0JcU5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486321',4.5,5007,'en','Fly Me to the Moon','Three young houseflies stow away aboard the Apollo 11 flight to the moon.','/wdjn8YldRIgusHRf8aqdKqriRnp.jpg','2008-08-15',81,'Released','First ever animated movie created for 3D','Fly Me to the Moon',13956,4.7594,5,'3TCI9Ptkyeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20891,_binary '\0','/8bPFRgV1kdJuta36UsNAbEbfXng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486358',7.4,29589,'en','Jesus Camp','A documentary on kids who attend a summer camp hoping to become the next Billy Graham.','/6ueSRBYaicEYvR2sFHVvptKNaxI.jpg','2006-09-15',84,'Released','America is being born again.','Jesus Camp',1776,1.8515,7.011,'QBxATt-sP7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20892,_binary '\0','/qqSFrmnX1vWGFBu6eyj0bgdtzTr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486420',7.1,2589,'en','Love\'s Long Journey','Missie\'s surprise pregnancy sets her on a new course that is both thrilling and terrifying. After all the planning and dreaming, she and her husband Willie are headed west in a covered wagon, leaving behind the prairie home of Missie\'s parents. Now, caught between the excitement of the new adventure and the pain of not knowing when she\'ll see her family again, Missie copes with the challenges, and cherishes the rewards, of her new homestead.','/bYPJFCO5h2Cd46ObIqeuelNX8EW.jpg','2005-12-03',88,'Released',NULL,'Love\'s Long Journey',20583,3.0849,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20893,_binary '\0','/lLzq1cBN3Q86xLLdlwGSPMMC8yq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486474',6.5,2749,'fr','Le serpent','A ruthless gang led by private detective Joseph Plender is extorting rich people and famous fashion photographer Vincent Mandel seems the next victim. He is married to Hélène, daughter of one of the richest people in Europe, but not quite happily. In fact the marriage is on the brink of a divorce and a judge is deciding who will take the two children. Can Hélène take them to Germany or will they stay with Vincent? Vincent has a lot on his mind and he improvises when model Sofia Kippiani comes to his studio, but his makeup crew doesn\'t show up. Before he knows it, he is accused of a rape. Things go worse and worse for Vincent, he sees his entire life slipping away and, most importantly, he might lose his children. But why does his former schoolmate Joseph Plender seek contact with Vincent and even solve a nasty problem for him? Does Plender want something more than money?','/5nG8gVE1GmMdltOL4gHKlCWDXNc.jpg','2006-10-21',119,'Released',NULL,'The Snake',21382,2.3945,6.134,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20894,_binary '\0','/tP7kiti9RdIB3ZoCC0CbAaYRMZ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486480',6.4,3668,'zh','詭絲','A scientist uses his invention - the \"Menger Sponge\" - to capture the energy of a dead child\'s spirit in an old building. In trying to determine why the energy of the ghost does not dissipate, the team discovers the identity and the dramatic story of the boy.','/rpfPg7MuQLaDeteKLMgopE9eozG.jpg','2006-09-28',108,'Released','The World\'s First Caught Spirit.','Silk',25875,2.5664,6.2,'9KIaJorCc_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20895,_binary '\0','/gaxp1zVG3sLaNsMufRCdXsToARF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486506',6.7,1789,'en','The Valley of Light','The Valley of Light is a beautifully-filmed, sentimental movie of a young man\'s quest to make sense of his experiences and find new meaning in life. While this film deals with weighty material such as the suicide of Eleanor\'s husband and Mathew\'s untimely death, the content is handled with reverence and sensitivity. Parents can feel confident in sharing this and many other Hallmark films with their families.','/nIRWOrMrcsE0VpxEhdldnXIQ1Lq.jpg','2007-01-28',97,'Released',NULL,'The Valley of Light',56552,2.7222,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20896,_binary '\0','/sO4a6w1zLdPAJquqxT1cicDJKam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486541',7.2,1678,'en','Scott Walker: 30 Century Man','A documentary on the influential musician Scott Walker.','/foDbZTQKsbJmdOuu2QfIJ8dbaen.jpg','2007-04-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Scott Walker: 30 Century Man',30867,1.4849,7.2,'TD1TMfysMGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20897,_binary '\0','/u0UWED5zd7r3U1QehrpL4FNf6ON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486544',5.5,1430,'en','Albert Fish: In Sin He Found Salvation','Albert Fish, the horrific true story of elderly cannibal, sadomasochist, and serial killer, who lured children to their deaths in Depression-era New York City. Distorting biblical tales, Albert Fish takes the themes of pain, torture, atonement and suffering literally as he preys on victims to torture and sacrifice.','/p8OPZXDYjLvVyL7ol2EilBiHYcV.jpg','2007-08-13',86,'Released','In sin, he found salvation.','Albert Fish: In Sin He Found Salvation',17901,1.3354,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20898,_binary '\0','/fTCnyskFAtus040PpyQR3LLwsso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486551',6.3,74154,'en','Beerfest','During a trip to Germany to scatter their grandfather\'s ashes, German-American brothers Todd and Jan discover Beerfest, the secret Olympics of downing stout, and want to enter the contest to defend their family\'s beer-guzzling honor. Their Old Country cousins sneer at the Yanks\' chances, prompting the siblings to return to America to prepare for a showdown the following year.','/5srGbSv3zhEUjXFOZR9qHkgJO6l.jpg','2006-08-25',110,'Released','Prepare for the ultimate chug of war.','Beerfest',9988,4.975,5.847,'4ZBJxhjqUgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20899,_binary '\0','/bWikMeweQL8T7uXl6hp3PcXgFdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486569',3.8,1245,'en','Sasquatch Mountain','A lonely tow-truck driver gets caught in a deadly struggle between a pair of bank robbers with a beautiful hostage, local cops, and a monster that has come down from the Arizona mountains to eat human flesh.','/5IdRVswrdk4vD951naavsZRVADt.jpg','2006-09-09',90,'Released','Believe the legend.','Sasquatch Mountain',78561,1.5961,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20900,_binary '\0','/gVmmXIK8plxTy3Md241vgUR0GUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486572',6.2,3467,'en','The Dog Problem','In the film, Solo is a down-on-his-luck writer who is encouraged by his psychiatrist to get a dog. Solo meets his love interest, who he assumes to be a dog owner when meeting her at a dog play park, but dog problems stand in their way.','/hErQSzvfemQDawgMvbNmN1UgcCA.jpg','2006-09-11',88,'Released','Eat. Sleep. Therapy. Repeat.','The Dog Problem',14848,1.7964,6.1,'Y97-o-rTKn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20901,_binary '\0','/o2wYH40zW0JIYiYUTu6L4gsNy7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486576',5.6,303041,'en','Fantastic Four: Rise of the Silver Surfer','The Fantastic Four return to the big screen as a new and all powerful enemy threatens the Earth. The seemingly unstoppable \'Silver Surfer\', but all is not what it seems and there are old and new enemies that pose a greater threat than the intrepid superheroes realize.','/pyk3c1a4U6nxRJPljPQbP8elTSU.jpg','2007-06-13',92,'Released','Discover the secret of the Surfer.','Fantastic Four: Rise of the Silver Surfer',1979,13.9236,5.636,'7whodtti908','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20902,_binary '\0','/vWcJ4qWHNwxxXPs9NwTWoWEHlXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486578',4.7,12699,'en','First Sunday','Durell and LeeJohn are best friends and bumbling petty criminals. When told they have one week to pay a $17,000 debt or Durell will lose his son, they come up with a desperate scheme to rob their neighborhood church. Instead, they end up spending the night in the presence of the Lord and are forced to deal with much more than they bargained for.','/9l0sdc7ohLe6TdFsYyCTBnVn1F8.jpg','2008-01-11',96,'Released','Keep the faith. Steal the rest.','First Sunday',14423,4.0225,5.6,'mhrNZYA4Cyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20903,_binary '\0','/nf9Y9KtrSFqUz3gNbsrgmFJV1S4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486583',5.7,51308,'en','Fred Claus','Fred Claus and Santa Claus have been estranged brothers for many years. Now Fred must reconcile his differences with his brother whom he believes overshadows him. When an efficiency expert assesses the workings at the North Pole and threatens to shut Santa down, Fred must help his brother to save Christmas.','/9gATbvoRMxVeoHInwS8nR0KZMVc.jpg','2007-11-09',115,'Released','Everybody has that one relative who can\'t help but cause problems over the holidays. Even Santa.','Fred Claus',5375,7.634,5.9,'dv9ce8cJVfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20904,_binary '\0','/gBzrll2riZVBQIq9MhlRuK2vmYV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486585',7,4346,'en','Fuck','A documentary on the expletive\'s origin, why it offends some people so deeply, and what can be gained from its use.','/26KoTqt7297hMcyU98hzlENhZJc.jpg','2006-11-10',93,'Released','The one word that brings all people together - and then sets them apart','Fuck',21710,2.2724,6.4,'7HY-2mMcq9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20905,_binary '\0','/lUtxnhJioCdwLCSZc4efuqjqSX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486615',5.4,5252,'hi','London Dreams','When famous musician Arjun (Ajay Devgan) invites his childhood friend Mannu (Salman Khan) to join his band and tour Europe, jealousy and betrayal threaten to destroy the lives and dreams of both men.','/uyheGrkRkOLTlGq2dfvZd05kF0S.jpg','2009-10-30',151,'Released','When your dreams come true for your best friend..','London Dreams',25511,1.4533,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20906,_binary '\0','/z1UPixrVMCLVO80veFx19XJQdW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486636',6.3,2463,'fr','Odette Toulemonde','Objectively, Odette Toulemonde has nothing to be happy about, but is. Balthazar Balsan has everything to be happy about, but isn’t. Odette, awkwardly forty, with a delightful hairdresser son and a daughter bogged down in adolescence, spends her days behind the cosmetic’s counter in a department store and her nights sewing feathers on costumes for Parisian variety shows. She dreams of thanking Balthazar Balsan, her favorite author, to whom – she believes – she owes her optimism. The rich and charming Parisian writer then turns up in her life in an unexpected way.','/dwpuTxb9JkBhPBqZs13iTpTjOAw.jpg','2007-02-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Odette Toulemonde',4171,1.1779,5.7,'4OMF83Upynk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20907,_binary '\0','/hv4vkURVXnYDZ0VJiGN3titWrIw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486640',4.5,26107,'en','Postal','The story begins with a regular Joe who tries desperately to seek employment, but embarks on a violent rampage when he teams up with cult leader Uncle Dave. Their first act is to heist an amusement park, only to learn that the Taliban are planning the same heist as well. Chaos ensues, and now the Postal Dude must not only take on terrorists but also political figures.','/2U91KS7t6HA1dI6YMiA6TpPRVqU.jpg','2007-10-18',100,'Released','Some comedies go too far... others start there.','Postal',2728,3.5031,4.653,'ZKfMhUrjoCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20908,_binary '\0','/9xmJFgtVlBf6lb3PPx8olu2VRG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486651',4.7,1584,'en','Dark Mirror','The story about a photographer who moves her family into a home filled with mirrors which seem to reflect a different reality.','/2ECVnTEVPI5CTWIReuyPQoMLKi1.jpg','2007-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Dark Mirror',24874,1.639,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20909,_binary '\0','/nSJpWFfD6r6UcF2Ll9VnuGw1PhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486652',3.9,1758,'en','Sisters','A reporter witnesses a brutal murder and becomes entangled in a mystery involving a pair of twins.','/nfOtl6NfmeMQ5gzPoYeeHyG5CsM.jpg','2006-11-10',92,'Released','Joined in body, soul… and murder','Sisters',52788,1.4095,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20910,_binary '\0','/x2LTysjFSpeK0d40zHw6Lqd4oAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486655',7.6,300742,'en','Stardust','In a countryside town bordering on a magical land, a young man makes a promise to his beloved that he\'ll retrieve a fallen star by venturing into the magical realm. His journey takes him into a world beyond his wildest dreams and reveals his true identity.','/le1gPiqeWrCj5FkjBtcF9clFmdX.jpg','2007-08-10',127,'Released','This summer a star falls. The chase begins.','Stardust',2270,12.9059,7.292,'VfYBKDyF-Dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20911,_binary '\0','/d8azJCepCuGlJeEc4kw3AxzzvYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486674',5.6,29419,'en','What Just Happened','During the course of an ordinary week in Hollywood, movie producer Ben must navigate his way through shark-infested waters as he struggles to complete his latest projects. A demanding studio boss demands extensive changes to a movie starring Sean Penn, while another chief won\'t greenlight a project unless star Bruce Willis shaves his beard. Meanwhile, Ben tries to reconcile with his wife and maintain a relationship with his young daughter.','/o88aPDDMtdwQsPyXqSKhu98jjru.jpg','2008-10-17',104,'Released','Admit nothing.','What Just Happened',8944,5.7533,5.437,'Ovc0UZ4vPHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20912,_binary '\0','/9N4FG8BqeDFg35pmRazYL3jPncK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486708',4.5,6982,'tr','Maskeli Beşler: İntikam Peşinde','An incompetent gang of criminals attempting the biggest robbery of their lives, which was the sixth highest-grossing Turkish film of 2005.','/4IW7rNtgjBrg1ANBu7DsnlC72U4.jpg','2005-10-28',89,'Released',NULL,'The Masked Gang',109671,1.5263,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20913,_binary '\0','/i3A6FzGsKaxhenvMTKl47sTh5nq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486751',5.7,1491,'fr','Chacun sa nuit','A story about bunch of people who live in a town in provincial France. At the center of it all is Pierre, a conceited and vain bisexual musician in his late teens who acts as a magnet, to varying degrees, for a whole array of characters - from his sister Lucie, with whom he has a heated incestuous relationship, to a city councilor with whom he participates in gay orgies. When Pierre turns up dead, Lucie investigates the reasons for his demise and charts the network of sadomasochistic relationships that crisscross the town.','/AnF2ewdZax4tGhzUU7JYqBGa7FX.jpg','2006-07-21',95,'Released',NULL,'One to Another',12838,3.1812,5.9,'nZOiSholzNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20914,_binary '\0','/ve38VxE3qVdk5xbEluWTqFa9oGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486822',6.8,276661,'en','Disturbia','Kale has a life most teenagers would envy. He spends his days endlessly playing video games, surfing the net, eating junk food and watching cable. He has complete free reign of the house, and a beautiful young hottie named Ashley has just moved in next door. There’s only one problem—he’s not allowed to leave the house. Kale’s under court-ordered house arrest for three months, and if he takes one step beyond a 100-foot perimeter of the house, his next confinement will be in a real prison.','/3f9KwSrieczuH9nRrwfOsoMoMNd.jpg','2007-03-27',105,'Released','Every killer lives next door to someone.','Disturbia',8271,8.2009,6.7,'LoemUrP3EKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20915,_binary '\0','/es74vwJqbT6cwMdJmTeSIcjJjoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0486946',5.9,128683,'en','Wild Hogs','Restless and ready for an adventure, four suburban bikers leave the safety of their subdivision and head out on the open road. But complications ensue when they cross paths with an intimidating band of New Mexico bikers known as the Del Fuegos.','/qYyPCZcpNGZwbyBo1gwdCiW5hHC.jpg','2007-03-02',100,'Released','A lot can happen on the road to nowhere.','Wild Hogs',11199,9.2147,5.971,'r6SSpOJ_aS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20916,_binary '\0','/mnn5pRH0rFRDngSCVHK9250zHgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487011',7.3,1319,'ml','അനന്തഭദ്രം','To honour his mother\'s final wish, Ananthan returns to his ancestral village from America and attempts to light a lamp at the family temple. However, his quest is thwarted by an evil magician named Digambaran who seeks to harness the temple\'s hidden powers.','/d7f3ZFCobD9Em3dUMDP2Rk7NB40.jpg','2005-11-03',130,'Released',NULL,'Anandabhadram',194809,1.461,7.482,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20917,_binary '\0','/yLHJofL1EB1RppxXfycRjPd0pDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487027',5.9,1287,'de','FC Venus','Anna is persuaded by her boyfriend Paul to move from Berlin to his home town of Imma. What the notorious soccer hater doesn\'t know, however, is that joining his best friend Steffen\'s law firm is just a pretext. In reality, Paul and his buddies are there to save the soccer club he co-founded, Eintracht Imma 95, from relegation. Anna soon realizes that the players\' wives have nothing to say to their soccer junkies: Artificial turf in the bedroom, Effenberg bedding and weekends on the soccer pitch. When she finds out the real reason for the move, she mobilizes her fellow sufferers to counter-attack after a fierce bout of frustration and challenges Paul and his friends to the ultimate duel on the soccer pitch. The bet is on: women against men. If the women win, soccer is over - and Paul has to go back to Berlin with Anna. Forever. If the men win, there will be no more complaining.','/7IGAt9Q6vSy9zArm6GFfNCgaKG7.jpg','2006-04-26',95,'Released',NULL,'FC Venus',1914,1.0979,5.9,'jJxq-bchFec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20918,_binary '\0','/qgykOCD2gj4Hjpv5o0C7bRZ0sbW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487037',3.6,2571,'en','Mammoth','On a hot summer afternoon in the sleepy town of Blackwater Louisiana, a meteor streaks across the sky and crashes through the roof of the local Natural History Museum. The meteor is actually a spaceship containing an alien life form which animates the museum\'s partially frozen Woolly Mammoth and begins a rampage. Local authorities and Government Investigators join forces with Frank Abernathy, the Museum Curator, and his father Simon, a B-Movie enthusiast, to bring down the giant mammoth in this alien-invasion flick!','/r6KHt6MXWnLTRZgb9uO6dt0xl3d.jpg','2006-04-22',90,'Released','We hunted it into extinction... Now it\'s hunting us.','Mammoth',41419,2.3352,4.4,'D2wpZuCQ6fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20919,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487092',7,1329,'en','Who the #$&% Is Jackson Pollock?','After semi-truck driver Teri Horton bought a large splatter painting for her friend for $5, she was forced to sell it in her own garage sale when her friend said she had no place for it. Eventually someone commented on the painting stating it might be an original Jackson Pollock. This documentary follows Teri, her son, and a forensics specialist as they attempt to prove to the world, or more specifically the art community, her painting is a true Jackson Pollock','/lPG9kD993EpbGu7gas2zeEU1Pok.jpg','2006-11-09',74,'Released','An Art Film','Who the #$&% Is Jackson Pollock?',45664,0.7696,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20920,_binary '\0','/dRA90Cnr3l5T6aJh8rZMfgR5LRU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487156',3.7,1227,'en','In Her Line of Fire','When the Vice President\'s plane goes down near a remote Pacific island, he is kidnapped by rebel forces and held for ransom. It is up to his female Secret Service agent and a press secretary to infiltrate the camp and save him.','/oAIWeBpaJUXCdv1UDlYvFoawk7c.jpg','2006-04-21',88,'Released','Behind Enemy Lines No Man Can Stop Her. Only One Woman Can Touch Her.','In Her Line of Fire',56491,1.9394,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20921,_binary '\0','/tfEHpLYiDczbUqBqMyLVv4qC8wu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487195',6.1,3022,'en','Bonneville','Faced with the decision of a lifetime, Arvilla Holden enlists her two best friends and sets off in a vintage \'66 Bonneville convertible to deliver her late husband\'s ashes to Santa Barbara.','/kCNLAuRo3K70QgWlXCNWQadox1n.jpg','2006-09-11',93,'Released',NULL,'Bonneville',16700,2.061,5.6,'xqWtT64u0PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20922,_binary '\0','/bu3haiMt2ML5NmO8WOhGbw0j08X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487271',6.3,6261,'de','Wo ist Fred?','In order to catch a basketball from the favorite team of his girlfriend\'s spoiled son, Fred poses as a numb, wheelchair-bound fan. But when he catches the ball, he also catches the attention of young, attractive filmmaker Denise, who wants to feature an invalid fan in an image film for the team. Fred has to keep playing his role, while real invalid and really furious fan Ronny might call his bluff at any moment. Worse, still, love sets in...','/9DkMHl3XHEYRBUXCOm3WVbmBn8G.jpg','2006-11-15',107,'Released',NULL,'Where Is Fred?',6733,2.2403,6.275,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20923,_binary '\0','/frfk0ZmvUmRAUt00GTnmN0zqJeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487273',6.9,2955,'fr','Les Témoins','Paris, 1984. A group of friends contend with the first outbreak of the AIDS epidemic.','/QIFx2KuCcoHqzE2tN8lQD3jh3g.jpg','2007-03-07',112,'Released',NULL,'The Witnesses',38282,1.5628,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20924,_binary '\0','/rj9X1BQkfLgvIlPhelrYVlladww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487419',7.4,8332,'fr','La Graine et le Mulet','In southern France, a Franco-Arabic shipyard worker along with his partner\'s daughter pursues his dream of opening a restaurant.','/mqPwap2uS7d7yLJVGjQYTdG9I1P.jpg','2007-12-12',155,'Released','It takes will, courage and determination to realise a dream. But most of all it takes family','The Secret of the Grain',8280,2.9327,7,'uuHAJy6wXB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20925,_binary '\0','/uyZMq9VTihrWBVXzIQUkB8P8Nnq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487503',7,7550,'fr','La Tourneuse de pages','Mélanie Prouvost, a ten-year-old butcher\'s daughter, is a gifted pianist. That is why she and her parents decide that she sit for the Conservatory entrance exam. Although Mélanie is very likely to be admitted, she unfortunately gets distracted by the president of the jury\'s offhand attitude and she fails. Ten years later, Mélanie becomes her page turner, waiting patiently for her revenge.','/lBomGoLZKklJWb5hMvcy44WbUsd.jpg','2006-08-09',85,'Released',NULL,'The Page Turner',8436,2.0956,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20926,_binary '\0','/8LBgsQTcljexdOO6EpfLyamICkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487504',5.6,1652,'fr','Truands','A Parisian criminal gang fall apart after challenges to the gang\'s leader lessen his influence.','/9J3vkz3ZlYLOjUAepLGrqpd1536.jpg','2007-01-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Crime Insiders',13747,4.5997,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20927,_binary '\0','/teuxirfgZMvqINZRvo44IyiXCG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487887',5.4,2731,'pt','O Crime do Padre Amaro','A young priest commits a crime when he falls in love with a beautiful and troubled woman. Based on O Crime do Padre Amaro (\"The Crime of Father Amaro\"), a novel by the 19th-century Portuguese writer José Maria de Eça de Queiroz. It was first published in 1875 to great controversy.','/b100qiTWwnPEQCLy14U5L1W09Tw.jpg','2005-10-27',120,'Released','A story of love and desire.','The Crime of Father Amaro',32925,1.7331,5.3,'zeDmHIgBZTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20928,_binary '\0','/iYzeI1DxZliyYv4Xab06MIaDwLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487907',6.9,2201,'en','Gideon\'s Daughter','Bill Nighy and Miranda Richardson star in a story of grief and celebrity, set in the intense spring and summer of New Labour\'s election victory and Diana\'s death. Nighy is a PR guru who has to stop and re-evaluate his world when his daughter threatens to leave his life, perhaps as revenge for his serial infidelities. Richardson plays a mother trying to bury her grief in an unconventional way after the loss of her young son.','/7QNYM2gCTBEWuW5KqOJ8wS2dABb.jpg','2005-10-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Gideon\'s Daughter',59958,1.8808,6.4,'HvDEEOWKNkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20929,_binary '\0','/cdaslM0fCLGCbeR9qKtO6NiHcZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0487928',4.8,6095,'fr','Dante 01','Deep space, at the edge of the galaxy. The future. A new prisoner arrives on top security prison ship and psychiatric research unit Dante 01. Sole survivor of an encounter with an alien force, Saint-Georges is a man possessed by inner demons, caught up in the battle to control the monstrous power within him. It\'s a power that will infect the other highly dangerous occupants of Dante 01, gaolors and prisoners alike, unleashing a violent rebellion that turns this terrifying, labyrinthine world upside down. In the otherworldly hell of the ship\'s depths, through danger and redemption, each must journey to his very limits... each must confront his own Dragon.','/dJxksg2IicE90KOsEanpozZC4rE.jpg','2008-01-02',82,'Released','In deep space, there is no rescue.','Dante 01',15125,2.0704,5,'0OL8lGoJ8rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20930,_binary '\0','/qQHc4QqfWFxKMGUiAiu6Q94csxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488027',7.4,2007,'pl','Plac Zbawiciela','A story of a married couple with two children, whose housing problems, the man\'s infidelity and the woman\'s fragility lead the family to destruction.','/5aZOkIlf0vQHzofkQ3EwuRfHFAC.jpg','2006-09-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Saviour Square',131116,1.2547,6.6,'Lmfg339mB-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20931,_binary '\0','/kmEGwnFOCYEd6fClxsqmoFOwppQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488085',6.7,33270,'en','Big Nothing','A frustrated, unemployed teacher joins forces with a scammer and his girlfriend in a blackmailing scheme.','/1A4DUWrFLchciMhC0hNJAJa92gU.jpg','2006-12-01',86,'Released','They wrote the book on how not to be criminals.','Big Nothing',9843,3.6804,6.4,'uwLruD9jDtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20932,_binary '\0','/mujUrk2diGe5vRCb3kdpHZeobRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488120',7.2,238727,'en','Fracture','A husband is on trial for the attempted murder of his wife, in what is seemingly an open/shut case for the ambitious district attorney trying to put him away. However, there are surprises for both around every corner, and, as a suspenseful game of cat-and-mouse is played out, each must manipulate and outwit the other.','/qNen8x5gaikjIg9CFihgxYcJwQe.jpg','2007-04-19',113,'Released','I shot my wife... prove it.','Fracture',6145,9.1251,7.3,'B9jSN5CXO-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20933,_binary '\0','/eD2npNUJVkVaHq6MD3PVcbIAaAt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488164',3,1940,'en','Moscow Zero','In Moscow, the priest Owen hires a team to guide him in the underworld to find his friend Sergei that is missing while researching the legend about the existence of demons and an entrance to hell beneath the city.','/zkQHPAJ4iqC4BlnsQXzcigU0KO.jpg','2006-11-05',82,'Released','The gates to the underworld have been opened','Moscow Zero',25974,2.3438,3.4,'TnH4W4ZA7K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20934,_binary '\0','/54H4ZcKqK2rOuq8RyHt69vps866.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488174',6.5,1357,'ko','오로라 공주','A woman gets killed in a department store. No one imagines this could lead to serial murders, but two days after the first murder, another homicide occurs. A woman is suffocated to death and the only evidence left at the crime scene is a sticker of the cartoon character “Princess Aurora”.','/5r5yritUHl1UZJA84MoqUTfaDZE.jpg','2005-10-27',106,'Released',NULL,'Princess Aurora',38054,1.6965,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20935,_binary '\0','/xMSlGT3XeytPjxTJBEQ9YZz01BQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488177',7.1,2806,'ko','파랑주의보','Su-ho is a plain high school boy, and Su-eun is a bright and beautiful girl in the same school. For some unknown reason, Su-eun has a crush on the boy, and for equally mysterious reasons she rescues Su-ho in the sea though he doesn\'t know who actually saved him.','/eGzQ4xmUQ6RaRVQ16pLzyZh7Sz4.jpg','2005-12-22',95,'Released','You\'re the heart of my universe.','My Girl and I',13407,1.36,6.595,'EGLasZc2EFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20936,_binary '\0','/zJVKeRlRVK2Zs1BWWsZcCUF0gnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488380',6.5,5140,'en','Closing the Ring','During the 1940s, a group of young men go off to war, leaving behind Ethel Ann, who is in love with one of them, Teddy. In modern-day Belfast, a man named Jimmy endeavors to return a ring found in the wreckage of a crashed plane. He travels to Michigan, where the grown Ethel Ann, who married another man after Teddy was killed in battle, now lives. Ethel Ann must decide whether to go with Jimmy to meet the soldier who last saw Teddy alive.','/rsQp6ZlVN9DFj6wcxDcwgpFrOaH.jpg','2007-09-14',118,'Released','Discover the love of a lifetime.','Closing the Ring',13957,3.4722,6.2,'1kjm4oXC6NA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20937,_binary '\0','/zPqWJZuvFHcwhAw806p2u7FuPK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488381',6.6,2250,'hi','Corporate','Two corporate giants compete in order to recklessly maximize their respective profits.','/jwGU00goh5oU2olCF6owqi3cXnf.jpg','2006-07-07',142,'Released',NULL,'Corporate',20092,0.8819,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20938,_binary '\0','/cXulQFjxTCdXu0COX5WRDcxE8Ak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488400',7.5,3522,'tr','Korkuyorum Anne','Reha Erdem’s innovative group portrait of the inhabitants of an apartment building in Istanbul serves as a comic exploration of what it means to be human. The drama revolves around hapless taxi driver Ali, who suffers from amnesia as a result of an accident the cause of which he does not remember. As he struggles to regain his memory, his neighbors—embodying a variety of physical, mental, and emotional states—wrestle with their own difficulties, helping one another along the way.','/fLU70fX6Fwx0DDnNnReZrQ320ZC.jpg','2006-03-17',124,'Released',NULL,'Mommy, I\'m Scared',37419,3.129,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20939,_binary '\0','/5iizVp90UAHVvnKzHaDiPsTl0cU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488403',6.1,2442,'tr','Kısık Ateşte 15 Dakika','The paths of Resul, a blind sculptor who served time for murder; Kader, a famous actress; Fazıl Bir, a deranged director who turned into a human bomb in order to force Kader to star in his film; Güngör, a hard-working classical musician; and Muhtar, Güngör\'s incompetent manager who caused him to become a loser, intersect at a French restaurant called Le Chic , and within 15 minutes, a series of extraordinary events unfold and come to a head.','/qiAev0ig6s5hqma3agayNI3HxJz.jpg','2006-05-19',90,'Released',NULL,'15 Minutes Over Low Heat',75460,1.624,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20940,_binary '\0','/teqDcEN4mWsi6Qdc4vMQFC2Fugv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488414',8,24239,'hi','ओमकारा','Half-caste bandit Omkara Shukla abducts his lady love, Dolly Mishra, from her family. Thanks to his cleverness, he gets away with the kidnapping. A conspiracy, however, forms against him when he denies his right-hand man, Langda Tyagi, a promotion. Ultimately, this plot threatens not only his relationship with Dolly, but their lives and those of their associates as well.','/hRPFHoyvqWd1iu27muybtZMlbou.jpg','2006-07-28',155,'Released','Once upon a time in the East . . .','Omkara',14705,2.4144,6.9,'OXm25a2qSs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20941,_binary '\0','/fiRs0tMsgYoOg8EVOvzjTFghfTN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488478',7.5,16052,'ru','12','A loose remake of “12 Angry Men”, “12” is set in contemporary Moscow where 12 very different men must unanimously decide the fate of a young Chechen accused of murdering his step-father, a Russian army officer. Consigned to a makeshift jury room in a school gymnasium, one by one each man takes center stage to confront, connect, and confess while the accused awaits a verdict and revisits his heartbreaking journey through war in flashbacks.','/xIWq2DZedeY4I9lNpeEQ66qInIP.jpg','2007-06-06',159,'Released',NULL,'12',20714,2.4229,6.6,'AoMqk73iZ4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20942,_binary '\0','/dz2hynXcuntfrG97wruGkmMakJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488508',6.9,1978,'en','Arctic Tale','Arctic Tale is a 2007 documentary film from the National Geographic Society about the life cycle of a walrus and her calf, and a polar bear and her cubs, in a similar vein to the 2005 hit production March of the Penguins, also from National Geographic.','/o3xE1J14VtRDuERA9kOxSEdimws.jpg','2007-06-17',86,'Released','A real adventure in the coolest place on Earth.','Arctic Tale',4658,1.7276,6.766,'hHFyY0nS6Xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20943,_binary '\0','/vjTpCH4ZQ2n5lYoE9L0D21SnTT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488535',6.1,1571,'en','Expired','The film revolves around Claire, a kind soul who resents having to enforce the law at all times, and Jay, an angry Traffic Officer who loves his job, being the perfect outlet for his anger and frustrations. Coming both from a place of despair and loneliness, Jay and Claire meet and engage in a tumultuous relationship which will eventually teach them that love can spread redemption.','/riVxpKf2xWNMQhiGsUwhZTeyEEx.jpg','2007-01-19',107,'Released',NULL,'Expired',18803,1.3686,5.9,'HQEu9O7xyeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20944,_binary '\0','/mxDKl54b4S4gQG5N1hNRDw7zXsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488539',4.1,5134,'en','Farce of the Penguins','In this spoof of \"March of the Penguins,\" nature footage of penguins near the South Pole gets a soundtrack of human voices. Carl and Jimmy, best friends, walk 70 miles to the mating grounds where the female penguins wait. The huddled masses of females - especially Melissa and Vicki - talk about males, mating, and what might happen this year. Carl, Jimmy, and the other males make the long trek talking about food, fornication and flatulence. Until this year, Carl\'s sex life has been dismal, but he falls hard for Melissa. She seems to like him. A crisis develops when Jimmy comes upon something soft in the dark. Can friends forgive? Does parenthood await Carl and Melissa?','/bb3f1catVid2yDqHvhygai2RUoM.jpg','2006-12-01',80,'Released','What Happens In Antarctica... Stays in Antarctica','Farce of the Penguins',12486,2.1493,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20945,_binary '\0','/v91aGneMO7dT45KEbutrY85JMta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488604',6,32156,'en','The Oxford Murders','At Oxford University, a professor and a grad student work together to try and stop a potential series of murders seemingly linked by mathematical symbols.','/aPGyZg44eCxccfoaNNbJwTJj66J.jpg','2008-01-18',107,'Released','There is no way of finding a single absolute truth','The Oxford Murders',12245,3.7233,5.976,'ID5lJ32PveE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20946,_binary '\0','/sDriqBgGZnFRKJDkfw0oJAnCNHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488658',5.4,13180,'en','Unaccompanied Minors','Five disparate kids snowed in at the airport on Christmas Eve learn some lessons about friendship when they launch a bid to get back to their families and outsmart a disgruntled airport official who wants to keep them grounded.','/7yhaXxwxs1fIOyuPv3YuE2fea0t.jpg','2006-12-08',90,'Released','No plane, no parents, no problem!','Unaccompanied Minors',18147,5.2883,6,'9lMY2F8-iyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20947,_binary '\0','/bYs3TKUT7MlxrrUssUuB5UvMARo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488763',6.4,3044,'ko','무영검','927 AD. The Killer-Blade Army has toppled the ruling dynasty, plunging the kingdom into chaos. The only remaining heir, Prince Jung-Hyun is living in exile, unaware of his family\'s dark fate. Still loyal to the dynasty, the beautiful and deadly warrior Soha sets out to find Jung-Hyun and guide him to become the great leader he was born to be. But with the Army\'s greatest assassins and the criminal underworld hunting them, Soha and Jung-Hyun are swept into an explosive, non-stop battle of swords, wits and bloodshed as they fight to reclaim the fallen throne.','/g8zYKidsjUXDjftPWo9DkrV2gcC.jpg','2005-11-18',117,'Released','The killer blades versus the killer babe!','Shadowless Sword',14763,2.2701,6.257,'sk9SesrN28s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20948,_binary '\0','/hXqGVk7IGiybUxODz7o3OaD3Gid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488798',7.2,30323,'hi','Welcome','Two gangsters meet Rajiv, who belongs to a respectable family, and want to fix their sister\'s wedding with him. However, when Rajiv\'s uncle refuses to the match, a series of hilarious situations occur.','/fudxnXlTTBIDCkpR7XhlIgkNaUY.jpg','2007-12-21',150,'Released','Marry or die... Mafia style.','Welcome',20294,2.0978,6.9,'QJCMdzuLG0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20949,_binary '\0','/s4swyQ0KzENERjgxzndajGS3lCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488834',6.3,6929,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Güle Güle','Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Especially, the new teacher for literature receives his share.','/l4p185nAApEDZGHeqRXJON3HbEp.jpg','1981-05-01',78,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class: Bye Bye',83656,1.2261,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20950,_binary '\0','/glvetKZGeeYwJbms1lNKmjpHWOj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488836',8.1,2542,'hi','Hanuman','After being granted immortality by the Hindu gods -- including his father, Vayu, the god of the wind -- Hanuman sets off on an epic journey.','/lnGhItGVyiet1Um0y2qfgEHihg.jpg','2005-10-21',138,'Released',NULL,'Hanuman',16111,0.9625,6.556,'Mz-dOCxUqb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20951,_binary '\0','/l6UjzZwof9wEevrE7JJWmgLlEA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488853',6.3,1287,'sv','Stockholm Boogie','We are following the two cousins and best friends, Jerka and Hoffa, during a typical night out in Stockholm. It\'s summertime and anything can happen.','/ogiQYGipiKce94DNC0ceT5XmKxj.jpg','2005-10-28',81,'Released',NULL,'Stockholm Boogie',23681,1.9983,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20952,_binary '\0','/6Hvyh6Li71yAqsNpA3SN294jc8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488870',7.7,2688,'ja','ALWAYS 三丁目の夕日','In 1958 postwar Tokyo, the residents of a humble Third Street neighbourhood struggle, dream, and grow together as rapid modernisation transforms their lives beneath the shadow of the newly rising Tokyo Tower.','/20lchzT4J5v8VwEIud6CicAwBoZ.jpg','2005-11-11',133,'Released',NULL,'Always - Sunset on Third Street',13430,2.8934,7.7,'5gdbJwf5Aww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20953,_binary '\0','/5blB7Dhk5AGCah0JhFw3SLjGz7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488905',7.5,9720,'ru','Изгнание','While vacationing in the countryside at his childhood home, a woman suddenly reveals to her husband that she is expecting a child – but not his.','/hD5Dg3VztZbvk2aqQsHh1e5jUP4.jpg','2008-03-27',158,'Released','If you want to kill, kill. If you want to forgive, forgive.','The Banishment',25142,1.6407,7.1,'1MC84Ox34EA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20954,_binary '\0','/vngRPSVDXeV8G8tkOga7LnRuFBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488906',4.8,3992,'hi','Zinda','After being held imprisoned in a room for 14 years, Balajeet Roy is suddenly released. Thereafter, he goes on a quest to look for the people who wronged him.','/8dnHugvmE4CV2BLGHBcajmzBWpB.jpg','2006-01-12',116,'Released',NULL,'Zinda',20971,1.1155,4,'tYw5qLSnwK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20955,_binary '\0','/7I17lhkbNjZcoIaq2qR0qzYH0kH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488962',5.2,3051,'en','Big Bad Wolf','In Cameron, a group of hunters is attacked by a wild animal, and Charlie Cowley survives, but sees his brother Scott dying. Seven years later, his teenage nephew Derek Cowley steals the key of his stepfather\'s cabin in the isolated Fire Road 13, and travels with four classmates and his friend Sam to spend the weekend having a party with booze and sex. However, they are attacked by a Beast that kills his friends in a sadistic way. Sam and Derek survive, and they suspect that his stepfather, Mitchell Toblat, is a werewolf. When Charlie meets Derek and Sam, they decide to collect evidence to prove that Mitchell is the Beast and kill him, but Mitchell discovers their plot and chases the trio.','/31nFN67QsO3oJ4DDaytejEKKB1J.jpg','2006-10-25',95,'Released','Where man ends... evil begins.','Big Bad Wolf',39341,2.5457,6.4,'LD0-Q3845xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20956,_binary '\0','/6TCkbdywBFuTSmih31awDSCCHss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0488988',5.6,12108,'en','Chapter 27','A film about Mark David Chapman in the days leading up to the infamous murder of Beatle John Lennon.','/mvjreS7Mgz13IkyhmWNCiEbmhlh.jpg','2007-12-15',84,'Released','He came to New York to meet John Lennon... and the world changed forever.','Chapter 27',8319,2.2978,5.434,'TktOCF-iBTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20957,_binary '\0','/98vriu4J6KwqYoggvpxAgLUP5qC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489007',5.2,7827,'en','Cow Belles','In order to learn how to be responsible, two wealthy teen sisters are forced to work in the family business by their exasperated father. When company funds goes missing, it\'s up to the girls to save the day.','/kA15KXpFHGKSqrRaJHAf0bhjQcT.jpg','2006-03-24',90,'Released','From Spoiled Rotten to Cream of the Crop','Cow Belles',24801,3.5126,5.5,'P9faXAgmve0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20958,_binary '\0','/2I0pJ1IEoPTlB1K807CSTw7SQ5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489010',5.6,2181,'en','A Crime','Vincent\'s life is on hold until he finds his wife\'s killer. Alice, his neighbor, is convinced she can make him happy. She decides to invent a culprit, so that Vincent can find revenge and leave the past behind. But there is no ideal culprit and no perfect crime.','/ms5tA7A2xc1EOqc2mVvcFrnH6gO.jpg','2006-09-11',103,'Released',NULL,'A Crime',341,2.2919,5.6,'fWwka2LIsU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20959,_binary '\0','/vb4BE2jdiUR6lCumcFGA0MZxEZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489037',7.6,12958,'en','Who Killed the Electric Car?','In 1996, electric cars began to appear on roads all over California. They were quiet and fast, produced no exhaust, and ran without gasoline... Ten years later, these cars were destroyed.','/uMamC9o5zNU9wn8fyuAo2gUCMiD.jpg','2006-08-04',92,'Released','A lack of consumer confidence... or conspiracy?','Who Killed the Electric Car?',13508,2.7658,7.2,'nsJAlrYjGz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20960,_binary '\0','/5XeSSkjxmXaLmnLWTyeuihDWx14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489049',6.5,63541,'en','Fanboys','In 1999, Star Wars fanatics take a cross-country trip to George Lucas\' Skywalker Ranch so their dying friend can see a screening of The Phantom Menace before its release.','/fitksX4J3xfBjT38YgDUXOlBkHk.jpg','2009-02-06',90,'Released','Never tell them the odds.','Fanboys',13532,6.7572,6.162,'OdoJujK7hSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20961,_binary '\0','/zC0fwAHdQnR7lb1xOc370U95jh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489062',7.2,3776,'en','Going to Pieces: The Rise and Fall of the Slasher Film','This historical and critical look at slasher films, which includes dozens of clips, begins with Halloween, Friday the 13th, and Prom Night. The films\' directors, writers, producers, and special effects creators comment on the films\' making and success. During the Reagan years, the films get gorier, budgets get smaller, and their appeal wanes. Then, Nightmare on Elm Street revives the genre. Jump to the late 90s, when Scream brings humor and TV stars into the mix.','/yztO70IoLnK5bRhRUn8gJ7meiGN.jpg','2006-10-13',88,'Released','Every Evil, Every Nightmare, Together in One Film','Going to Pieces: The Rise and Fall of the Slasher Film',50787,2.4382,6.8,'C4WJDFFNub0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20962,_binary '\0','/34flDjx4wkLAl0aqOWkw00OgBZ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489085',5.4,2981,'en','I-See-You.com','A 17-year-old boy buys mini-cameras and displays the footage online at I-see-you.com. The cash rolls in as the site becomes a major hit. Everyone seems to have fun until it all comes crashing down....','/fscHts499XahFEaHquyowRUzOC5.jpg','2006-03-08',92,'Released','Reality bytes!','I-See-You.com',14569,3.4797,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20963,_binary '\0','/1R4DZbEwWTPnRShBumJsOwsfAiB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489099',6.1,339839,'en','Jumper','David Rice is a man who knows no boundaries, a Jumper, born with the uncanny ability to teleport instantly to anywhere on Earth. When he discovers others like himself, David is thrust into a dangerous and bloodthirsty war while being hunted by a sinister and determined group of zealots who have sworn to destroy all Jumpers. Now, David’s extraordinary gift may be his only hope for survival!','/3pPZ9JhNz3VMmASVir5SMHvTDUU.jpg','2008-02-13',88,'Released','Anywhere is possible.','Jumper',8247,11.1889,6.177,'3BgwRL3wOy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20964,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489225',7,1758,'en','Man in the Chair','The story of an aspiring young filmmaker\'s encounter with a grumpy fount of movie lore.','/q7VJ3lK8oMPyusCGzDGzXKJCQsW.jpg','2007-01-27',107,'Released',NULL,'Man in the Chair',15148,1.5193,6.3,'Gwk3c9HmH0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20965,_binary '\0','/snPM5sBGoZSm8g81yyqxsXmyzP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489235',6.1,26387,'en','My Name Is Bruce','B-movie Legend Bruce Campbell is mistaken for his character Ash from the Evil Dead trilogy and forced to fight a real monster in a small town in Oregon.','/et2f1JBW533ZzYiCEA2T7nwzcs1.jpg','2007-10-01',84,'Released','Fearless! Unstoppable! Ready For His Close-Up!','My Name Is Bruce',1961,2.8488,5.799,'I8ny7K9bq68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20966,_binary '\0','/t5gmdPLPHSaEuGpSwxiH5wco0XS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489237',6.2,68238,'en','The Nanny Diaries','A college graduate goes to work as a nanny for a rich New York family. Ensconced in their home, she has to juggle their dysfunction, a new romance, and the spoiled brat in her charge.','/8hX6rcxnCidaqegPCyeFm9PODBn.jpg','2007-08-24',105,'Released','A comedy about life at the top, as seen from the bottom.','The Nanny Diaries',12435,6.6078,6.4,'Fwb8euJ-Evk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20967,_binary '\0','/uqMxVuoIIG34O6uMPzSmWkG1eow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489244',3.2,4155,'en','Night of the Living Dead 3D','Barricaded in a farmhouse, a woman and a collegian must contend with flesh-eating zombies and a malevolent mortician.','/7tt8cyI6FnPoneb9cZLN6uJifMS.jpg','2006-11-10',80,'Released','The Dead Will Never Look So Alive','Night of the Living Dead 3D',24927,2.3965,4,'_ZvCxFkJayg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20968,_binary '\0','/aF8mUccuwKzo020gF8rhoqSEOCg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489247',7.2,1601,'en','Once in a Lifetime: The Extraordinary Story of the New York Cosmos','In the 1970s the North American Soccer League marked the first attempt to introduce soccer to American sports fans. While most teams had only limited success at best, one managed to break through to genuine mainstream popularity - the New York Cosmos. The brainchild of Steve Ross (Major executive at Warner Communications) and the Ertegun brothers (Founders of Atlantic Records), the Cosmos got off to a rocky start in 1971, but things changed in 1975 when the world\'s most celebrated soccer star, the Brazilian champion Pele, signed with the Cosmos for a five-million-dollar payday. With the arrival of Pele, the Cosmos became a hit and the players became the toast of the town, earning their own private table at Studio 54. A number of other international soccer stars were soon lured to the Cosmos, including Franz Beckenbauer, Rodney Marsh, and Carlos Alberto, but with the turn of the decade, the team began losing favor with fans and folded in 1985.','/ubgZkHS1KoVILTH051zr47vMfDv.jpg','2006-09-03',97,'Released','The untold story of the team that had America at its feet.','Once in a Lifetime: The Extraordinary Story of the New York Cosmos',39183,1.508,7.1,'MKjJ62TQSjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20969,_binary '\0','/qx8Pb3nVnHLBizI9792pbRN5nnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489270',6.2,230602,'en','Saw III','Jigsaw has disappeared. Along with his new apprentice Amanda, the puppet-master behind the cruel, intricate games that have terrified a community and baffled police has once again eluded capture and vanished. While city detectives scramble to locate him, Doctor Lynn Denlon and Jeff Reinhart are unaware that they are about to become the latest pawns on his vicious chessboard.','/4iO9n24Rb10peXV0JH2EldIOrAp.jpg','2006-10-26',108,'Released','Suffering? You haven\'t seen anything yet...','Saw III',214,12.0413,6.4,'Whxt7ewIbGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20970,_binary '\0','/bMkwq0BYNHgdU9zhOFGr3Q4V85s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489281',6.4,21669,'en','Stop-Loss','A veteran soldier returns from his completed tour of duty in Iraq, only to find his life turned upside down when he is arbitrarily ordered to return to field duty by the Army.','/5lR2o3EQ6keYI7R2NtO40fHpvGZ.jpg','2008-03-28',113,'Released','The bravest place to stand is by each other\'s side.','Stop-Loss',8988,4.3801,6.1,'Mv2-oQj1R-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20971,_binary '\0','/k7z6Yig0XHge7BdcKLcfGPwjdrF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489282',5.2,23961,'en','Strange Wilderness','With the ratings dropping for a wilderness-themed TV show, two animal fans go to the Andes in search of Bigfoot.','/6tamhOw4dSgn4lonjZyhEhIt9Wm.jpg','2008-02-01',85,'Released','They could solve nature\'s biggest mystery if only they had a clue.','Strange Wilderness',14220,3.6222,4.872,'ZKyowLXH8sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20972,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489318',5.4,1516,'en','The Ungodly','When struggling filmmaker inadvertently records a notorious serial killer in the middle of a murderous act, he decides to use the footage to blackmail the madman into being the subject of a disturbing new documentary.','/69l0scoORONAILNDtcG2InPkt4w.jpg','2007-01-01',100,'Released','Do you fit his profile?','The Ungodly',21800,1.1213,5.1,'ViwDMH73QrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20973,_binary '\0','/dryI4Ga4FYv1LRCIStd7RrNeed5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489325',6.2,2696,'fi','V2 – Jäätynyt enkeli','The tough Detective Vares, get hired by a friend accused of murdering a girl. His job is to find the real killer, but people aren\'t talking. Before he can get traction another homicide takes place- and things move toward a dire conclusion.','/mgEhBCWTV4ezab7dr4mHmtLCi6A.jpg','2007-01-12',97,'Released',NULL,'V2: Dead Angel',29670,1.3883,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20974,_binary '\0','/dbjB4IGM3smsuDzJZt16SKG4jDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489327',7,13887,'en','Venus','Maurice is an aging veteran actor who becomes taken with Jessie, the grandniece of his closest friend. When Maurice tries to soften the petulant and provincial young girl with the benefit of his wisdom and London culture, their give-and-take surprises both Maurice and Jessie as they discover what they don\'t know about themselves.','/pY1B5ipgUkxtBN3fkJWuKAeFL2G.jpg','2006-09-02',95,'Released','She\'s a real work of art.','Venus',13771,2.5524,6.646,'N5jv6sorNeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20975,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489342',7.8,1302,'en','Which Way Home','Follows unaccompanied child migrants, on their journey through Mexico, as they try to reach the United States.','/3V6f3vwAkWPMs0wuj7nuhKL1XPT.jpg','2009-01-31',90,'Released','They are the ones you never hear about – the invisible ones.','Which Way Home',55204,1.416,7.9,'o6XLDqsc9Ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20976,_binary '\0','/dwKjLOKZPLCrpDCpzPAltiprYmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489458',7.3,6089,'pt','O Cheiro do Ralo','A pawn shop proprietor buys used goods from desperate locals – as much to play perverse power games as for his own livelihood, but when the perfect rump and a backed-up toilet enter his life, he loses all control.','/hsimQm7sD4ezSPhcMrVAc5cEDn3.jpg','2006-09-27',112,'Released',NULL,'Drained',40860,2.1205,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20977,_binary '\0','/45yfSKEf0UTWexHwERzUfzmqika.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489461',6.5,1835,'pt','Coisa Ruim','An urban family inherits an old country house located in a small village. Upon their arrival they try to adapt to the new lifestyle, but they soon learn that the village is overshadowed by superstition and mysterious folklore. As they are plagued by strange events, they learn more about the history of their family, and slowly begin to believe by inheriting the house, they also inherited a curse.','/wEh60lxju9UissGcXirDMmLvB0Q.jpg','2006-02-24',97,'Released',NULL,'Blood Curse',30447,1.0366,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20978,_binary '\0','/337tdyrMVjpbuVRc69w0EOqFT7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489486',4,2216,'hi','गुड बॉय बैड बॉय','Two college students exchange their classes after the college management mixed their identical names by mistake.','/6jF4GKaEgEFjMeU0udVJaJr4xLd.jpg','2007-05-11',115,'Released','When good meets bad... It sparks magic!','Good Boy, Bad Boy',159434,1.0047,4.565,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20979,_binary '\0','/7al64Hp3RPaMNB5AWTdFH7RggnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489664',6.6,35299,'en','Butterfly on a Wheel','A sociopathic kidnapper methodically pushes a desperate pair of parents to their absolute breaking point.','/qcjjYcMaaSKD2C8xn0hy6o6yj2L.jpg','2007-07-27',95,'Released','Lives will be broken','Butterfly on a Wheel',13250,5.6522,6.4,'H0W2LCesfu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20980,_binary '\0','/lQgr7iVIJ1H7RPDFkfw204kGwgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489682',6.5,2616,'en','Conversations with God','\"Conversations with God\" is the true story of Neale Donald Walsch that inspired and changed the lives of millions. The journey begins after he unexpectedly breaks his neck in a car accident and loses his job.','/1JYNHj83ELXg38427fnAc02auBV.jpg','2006-01-25',109,'Released',NULL,'Conversations with God',24590,2.6589,6.864,'Fk0dXxeJRk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20981,_binary '\0','/9SBk4cYrTgIxY753YhGecDJL9t1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489713',6.2,1319,'tr','Gırgıriye','A bear-leading gypsy from the slums struggles to get back his sweetheart who works for a pavilion runner in the city, until she feels a wistful longing for where she thinks she is belong to and turns recalcitrant against the pavilion runner.','/ei05DaYZ0aBAHDBnea9nq5Eofcv.jpg','1981-03-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Girgiriye',248750,2.1345,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20982,_binary '\0','/l5YHH6wkTWCfpcNSX8dZTjwqpU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0489964',9,2103,'tr','Gülizar','Gülizar is a young and beautiful village girl. Against her will, she is betrothed to a young man from her village at her family\'s request. Her fiancé goes to Istanbul to work in order to earn a dowry. One day, Gülizar\'s fate suddenly changes with the arrival of a new teacher in the village. Gülizar secretly falls deeply in love with the teacher, İsmail. They eventually decide to marry. However, the teacher\'s death in an accident shatters Gülizar\'s world. Her fiancé returns to the village with the dowry money after some time. While Gülizar endures the immense pain of losing her beloved without being able to share it with anyone, she is forced to marry her fiancé. Yet Gülizar has become the woman of the young teacher she loves. Gülizar\'s father is caught between tradition and his daughter, as according to custom, her honor can only be cleansed by her death.','/oNGE64f3QztQaTCuvty59QNMmkS.jpg','2004-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Gülizar',814365,2.2315,8.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20983,_binary '\0','/7LpFPbE1AdzGQnO5Ib7fpSRMsvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490076',5.4,36602,'en','All the Boys Love Mandy Lane','Beautiful Mandy Lane isn\'t a party girl but, when classmate Chloe invites the Texas high school student to a bash in the countryside, she reluctantly accepts. After hitching a ride with a vaguely scary older man, the teens arrive at their destination. Partying ensues, and Mandy\'s close pal, Emmet, keeps a watchful eye on the young males making a play for Mandy. Then two of the students are murdered.','/9t7n7K0xqw0gMvrxyhdiyqEF3W1.jpg','2006-09-09',90,'Released','Everyone is dying to be with her. Someone is killing for it.','All the Boys Love Mandy Lane',9022,4.4308,5.6,'y9lA94P7shQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20984,_binary '\0','/urEAbS3EmdH259mLcwWAZLAjMRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490084',5.6,42456,'en','Because I Said So','In an effort to prevent family history from repeating itself, meddlesome mom Daphne Wilder attempts to set up her youngest daughter, Milly, with Mr. Right. Meanwhile, her other daughters try to keep their mom\'s good intentions under control.','/wQtGQnr5RPnmzSfV9zUcgh8R9NX.jpg','2007-02-02',102,'Released','She\'s just your normal, overprotective, overbearing, over-the-top mother.','Because I Said So',1257,6.1954,5.8,'aUE8gHEPJ_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20985,_binary '\0','/zdxWO47KatCZhQRGaNMDXfz6DPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490086',6.2,53438,'en','Big Stan','A weak con man panics when he learns he\'s going to prison for fraud. He hires a mysterious martial arts guru who helps transform him into a martial arts expert who can fight off inmates who want to hurt or love him.','/zS1uUwKEFcd8ak0NTXxw97DlbAa.jpg','2007-11-03',109,'Released','He\'ll have to kick some butt to save his own.','Big Stan',13161,7.9308,6.7,'kCdtAFar0XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20986,_binary '\0','/lD9IzWlJO8UHCkdiuBrJik77C0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490126',7.3,1302,'en','Kenneth Williams: Fantabulosa!','Kenneth Williams was the star of the Carry Ons and Round the Horne. Despite his fame, he led a life full of mental torture as he tried to overcome his homosexuality in 1950s Britain. This film follows his life and eventual death based on the many diaries he kept','/7jUsf4GLLbdeCpheDz3C8lHpegu.jpg','2006-03-16',79,'Released',NULL,'Kenneth Williams: Fantabulosa!',39307,1.3997,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20987,_binary '\0','/wMPZhW3fGgDpMj9jWtiFWzfTuJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490166',6.9,9006,'en','London to Brighton','After a violent confrontation leaves a wealthy man bleeding to death, two distressed women seek refuge in a rundown London bathroom, setting off a desperate hunt as both the victim\'s seeking son and a ruthless pimp race to track them down.','/gIWaX9DXgUVesbiJceitZirTyj2.jpg','2006-12-01',85,'Released','Innocence has nowhere to hide','London to Brighton',14823,1.4344,6.3,'KU3G7EEFnwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20988,_binary '\0','/xzjMdrhVh4KuF75D3RVceLmmeUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490170',2.7,2844,'hi','Love Story 2050','Tells the story about Karan, a young, spirited, sporty boy who lives life off the rules and Sana, a young petite, shy girl who lives life by the rules. This develops into a magical love story. Karan\'s uncle, Dr. Yatinder Khanna\'s much developed time machine finally works. Sana expresses her wish to travel ahead in time to Mumbai in the future. We land in Mumbai 2050 in the time machine... along with Uncle Yatinder, Rahul, and Thea (Sana\'s younger brother and sister). Flying cars, 200-story buildings, robots and sky rails have changed the very face of Mumbai. Through a series of twists and turns, the time traveler Karan finds himself separating from his love. QT, a friendly femme robot, and Boo, a small robotic teddy bear play their distinct roles in bringing their love story together but soon find themselves under the threat of the demi-god of the future, Dr. Hoshi. Will Karan be able to overcome the threat of Dr. Hoshi and win his love and travel back in time?','/rBQ6MeIKHqD67JJSryBzlYu3nUz.jpg','2008-07-04',180,'Released',NULL,'Love Story 2050',20493,1.2972,3.071,'e_919lhNi4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20989,_binary '\0','/6gFKEYJ3UugiIm6JUGcoaEDah9M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490181',5.2,27848,'en','Mutant Chronicles','It\'s the year 2707. Earth\'s natural resources have all but been exhausted by mankind. Battles rage for the remainder between the competing Corporations. During one such battle the seal is broken and awakens an ancient and deadly machine that was once defeated thousands of years ago. The order that awaited its return must now lead a small group of soldiers to destroy it once and for all.','/vHH9VnQZYdhWE9PMMKUpYrG1Z0Z.jpg','2008-08-07',111,'Released','Welcome to the 23rd century. The new dark ages.','Mutant Chronicles',13256,4.2365,5.3,'0R-GoZ5RG_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20990,_binary '\0','/gObRW97OyPQy34PDEkfdPOPF1Kc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490196',3.4,9679,'en','Phat Girlz','Two large women struggle to find love and acceptance in a culture where thin is in. Their lives take a dramatic turn when they meet the men of their dreams in completely unexpected ways.','/zzylksiJ8hmzvsHIDBTuqYZJYTe.jpg','2006-04-07',99,'Released','Her dreams are about to get a whole lot bigger','Phat Girlz',30139,3.96,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20991,_binary '\0','/inPupECvfe7cHuAwaEVBkDJjXZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490204',7.4,105672,'en','Reign Over Me','A man who lost his family in the September 11 attack on New York City runs into his old college roommate. Rekindling the friendship is the one thing that appears able to help the man recover from his grief.','/b5EtDvwj2gdG1qMBLijamlLfJLB.jpg','2007-03-22',124,'Released','Let in the unexpected.','Reign Over Me',2355,6.2794,7.2,'yzQYokimcg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20992,_binary '\0','/qkmE4BAg9iMWdWX2vLw3hxxiled.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490210',6.7,8199,'hi','सर्कार राज','When Anita Raja, CEO of Sheppard power plant, brings a power plant proposal to set up in rural Mahrashtra before the Nagres, insightful Shankar is quick to realise the benefits the power plant can bring to the people.','/93xsKSBQLY2RndYOg0e4Nqf11OR.jpg','2008-06-06',125,'Released','Power Cannot Be Given It Has To Be Taken','Sarkar Raj',14394,1.3285,6.471,'KFvBUjCTjBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20993,_binary '\0','/2tE0A6WjLowwQOUY8se1Xlf3O6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490215',7.2,136094,'en','Silence','In the 17th century, two Portuguese Jesuit priests travel to Japan in an attempt to locate their mentor, who is rumored to have committed apostasy, and to propagate Catholicism.','/x5T0cQDYws0xRBVG4Q3wpcrcmax.jpg','2016-12-23',161,'Released','Sometimes silence is the deadliest sound.','Silence',68730,11.5527,7.119,'IqrgxZLd_gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20994,_binary '\0','/a6oFmNjZict8M6FwgWj69lSyeSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490234',6.8,3453,'fr','Un secret','In 1953, a sensitive French boy finds out from a neighbor that his family\'s Jewish. François Grimbert becomes a physician, and gradually peels the layers of his buried family history which resulted in his difficult upbringing, raised as Catholic by his \"Aryan\" appearing parents. His athletic father labored to stamp out stereotypical Jewish characteristics he perceived in his son, to keep the family\'s many secrets, as most relatives fought in World War II, and later were hauled off to labor and death camps by the Gestapo.','/8KcpHL8hjqBxZnMTMITGh8MNAhh.jpg','2007-10-03',105,'Released','A 15-year-old boy unearths a shocking family secret.','A Secret',13726,1.7123,6.456,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20995,_binary '\0','/t8i4hi3R6qDohf7MHyxTV69oyv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490377',5.9,1628,'nl','De Brief voor de Koning','Young Tiuri has to pass the final test before before being knighted by king Dagonaut. He has to pass a night in the chapel, what is suddenly disturbed by a strangers request of help. With his decision to help the stranger, Tiuri abandons his given task and starts into an adventure, that will shape the destiny of Dagonaut. On his journey he learns about the true meaning of love, friendship, courage and loyalty.','/4erOTqJHX6voWqkQy8S6vXjFlNv.jpg','2008-07-16',110,'Released',NULL,'The Letter for the King',13639,1.5529,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20996,_binary '\0','/fcIXHxXFCI28SkRVVq8qT0StAoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490499',5.8,1556,'en','The Tiger\'s Tail','After a chance encounter, a Dubliner is stalked by a murderous facsimile of himself.','/tjmEMHtngREqVm2NOzIrE4Lx52L.jpg','2006-09-26',107,'Released','When your past is a lie... and your future is not your own.','The Tiger\'s Tail',10097,2.0701,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20997,_binary '\0','/AgDOUyKi00ggALz3hJL2xQckcze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490579',6.6,7368,'en','Dedication','A modern love story in which a misanthropic, emotionally complex author of a hit children\'s book is forced to team with a beautiful illustrator after his best friend and collaborator passes away. As Henry struggles with letting go of the ghosts of love and life, he discovers that sometimes you have to take a gamble at life to find love.','/w0kzH6zMTOtvEDY9LVYAQxwZx7l.jpg','2007-08-24',95,'Released','Life is a thin line between love and fate.','Dedication',14118,1.5487,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20998,_binary '\0','/zbNJKDGFSwcxkVdWcHPGnP8MFOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0490701',5.4,1308,'en','Spin','Six young people spend the morning after a wild club spree trying to piece together their misadventures from the night before, including a trip to the veterinarian hospital, at least one breakup and the unexpected discovery of a mobster\'s corpse. As the group shares their fragmented memories, some of their stories start to fit together while others just lead to more questions.','/eMOcq5ipUOOwNl4o4rV2pg6JLSt.jpg','2007-01-26',78,'Released','One night, so many versions.','Spin',57655,1.3322,5.2,'7fl-zGch3z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(20999,_binary '\0','/iQFrafT0xVpVMUD38Xa7RTOS6HX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0491005',4.3,2834,'en','Kaw','On the last working day of Sheriff Wayne, his small town is attacked by blood thirsty ravens that eat human flesh. Meanwhile his wife Cynthia visits a farm where a Mennonite family lives to say farewell to her friend Gretchen and discloses a dark secret about the origin of the fierce ravens.','/lYfWo6bS9IX8rMIkTyDb1LN3GmD.jpg','2007-04-07',93,'Released','Objects in the mirror may be closer and more terrifying than they appear.','Kaw',39158,2.2667,4.6,'nQJbqwM0RWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(21000,_binary '\0','/y04q3suXkkqB7YtJXdVdEZHxCsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0491044',6.7,3338,'cn','文雀','Kei is the experienced leader of a team of pickpockets — also known as \"Sparrows\" in HK slang. He enjoys a carefree lifestyle taking photos. One day a dashing beauty, Chun-Lei, suddenly appears in Kei\'s viewfinder. Kei is mesmerized. But behind Chun-Lei\'s attractive facade lies a mysterious past and a mission to set herself free.','/yPA5QWpMtUXQHgKW9AdjhhgLlAX.jpg','2008-06-19',87,'Released','Free as a Bird...','Sparrow',7346,1.8393,6.4,'CelOAYji8NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(21001,_binary '\0','/rll7Ok68Ycwcb0NMecruBAW9qgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491046',5.7,3488,'es','Manolete','Scandal erupts over a famous bullfighter\'s affair with a left-wing actress.','/8M4ydEC8LJaAM5kfwhJWMO95dNw.jpg','2008-09-06',92,'Released','He defied death like a god... he succumbed to love as a man.','A Matador\'s Mistress',45127,1.6891,5.8,'7O1ClATw47o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21002,_binary '\0','/ucE0spVwy08jej5YgCIKHoKiFJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491109',6.4,3663,'en','Purple Violets','Patti Petalson is a promising writer, but her marriage and conventional job keep her from her dream. She longs to return to her writing, especially after running into her first love Brian Callahan, a successful crime novelist. Kate is Patti\'s best friend since college; she\'s a tough-talking schoolteacher who plays therapist to all Patti\'s problems, while she\'s got a few of her own.','/n61vWKkNn1cq8p6a0foAqgrcAwu.jpg','2007-04-30',103,'Released','A second chance for a first love.','Purple Violets',20065,1.8774,5.8,'dH0K6_e-FTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21003,_binary '\0','/k3UzcwmLLcTVqWq0nFdDTtJaFPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491145',4.8,2810,'en','Shadow Puppets','Director Michael Winnick\'s chilling tale stars James Marsters as Jack, one of eight captives who awaken in an abandoned asylum not knowing who they are or why they are together. They discover that they\'ve been used in an experiment to erase disturbing memories, but instead, a murderous creature has been unleashed. Reaching out from the shadows, the monster hunts the eight strangers as they race to escape the asylum.','/fxuUnZxJsRz6DHlZ1yKByoyeORj.jpg','2007-04-16',103,'Released','You can\'t hide from your own shadow','Shadow Puppets',19551,1.4513,5.1,'Bj1OfwHePas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21004,_binary '\0','/pKh2qMYoC5vXaRiU0qBK3IPXk76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491152',5.8,67931,'en','Something Borrowed','Though Rachel is a successful attorney and a loyal, generous friend, she is still single. After one drink too many at her 30th-birthday celebration, Rachel unexpectedly falls into bed with her longtime crush, Dex -- who happens to be engaged to her best friend, Darcy. Ramifications of the liaison threaten to destroy the women\'s lifelong friendship, while Ethan, Rachel\'s confidant, harbors a potentially explosive secret of his own.','/66VZu75VeLGc6tcAypqyGzWcPeN.jpg','2011-05-05',112,'Released','It\'s a thin line between love and friendship.','Something Borrowed',49022,6.9349,6.2,'IoiZtWDO6CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21005,_binary '\0','/jS82cGBJF3PEYFnJ6TE07SSaI7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491162',6.3,4060,'en','Spiral','A reclusive telemarketer has only one semblance of a friend: His telecommuter boss. But the telemarketer\'s social circle seems to improve greatly when a whimsical co-worker enters his life. Only, as he begins to sketch his new friend\'s portrait, disturbing \"voices\" from the phone man\'s past threaten to lead him into a network of destruction.','/cyzyZ8HA2zqL9C3QrpHI7QqGr0r.jpg','2007-01-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Spiral',18467,2.1097,6.092,'riL5PAtYNIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21006,_binary '\0','/dmgFJdivUmV4vGLkbPD49KVjlHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491175',5.8,50358,'en','Suburbicon','In the quiet family town of Suburbicon during the 1950s, the best and worst of humanity is hilariously reflected through the deeds of seemingly ordinary people. When a home invasion turns deadly, a picture-perfect family turns to blackmail, revenge and murder.','/yqYwf0kPK2SaCWM80msl4nYK6U7.jpg','2017-10-26',105,'Released','Welcome to the neighborhood','Suburbicon',395458,6.364,5.886,'IYga2m0V2O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21007,_binary '\0','/oMLC1KgQVhg86Gi03uP6mPxrpaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491203',6.2,24755,'en','Tulip Fever','An artist falls for a married young woman while he\'s commissioned to paint her portrait. The two invest in the risky tulip market in hopes to build a future together.','/aGBRTDMuYDKCA9g7NTGwtMZBWd.jpg','2017-07-13',107,'Released',NULL,'Tulip Fever',257785,8.2637,6.5,'vN8mT5iXK5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21008,_binary '\0','/g0iK0FIS2KP67D0QCxAtMo3iaX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491244',7.4,7599,'cn','黑社會2：以和為貴','As election time nears, current Triad chairman Lok faces competition from his godsons. At the same time, Jimmy looks to increase his business relations with mainland China.','/bjIwRS0DfwJQxFlDGk2HpH3gg1C.jpg','2006-04-27',92,'Released','Even a criminal can serve his country.','Election 2',15077,3.6698,7.43,'d_e-eApXem4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21009,_binary '\0','/5RBD3JV6hs3Xl0k3Q0xx8uee43y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491399',6.4,3464,'ja','ヘイズ','A man awakes to find himself trapped in a dirty, confined crawlspace. He barely has enough room to move. He also has no memory of why he\'s there, or why he\'s bleeding from a stomach wound. Apparently drugged, he occasionally \'zones out\' of his surroundings as he tries to edge towards his way to freedom. But the more he explores, the more pain he has to endure, and the more frightening his predicament becomes.','/hIqlsqwfcrAxGiVaZGK3ofI18fR.jpg','2005-04-28',49,'Released','You will experience the palpable feeling of terror and all encompassing sense of claustrophobia as you watch this intense exercise in basic fear and dread...','Haze',26040,1.3963,6.5,'dM_xrV9BOGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21010,_binary '\0','/qLBxz0WDFDabPHyk1BnDbeIM9DP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491720',5.3,1512,'it','L\'inchiesta','In 35 A.D., a Roman tribune is sent to Palestine to investigate the death and possible resurrection of a certain Jesus from Nazareth.','/uYNu0pjYxQTDkIfrMW79SnM98KR.jpg','2007-04-04',112,'Released','One truth could destroy an Empire.','The Final Inquiry',24365,3.2973,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21011,_binary '\0','/zA9G3qYEyGMK1vu9G0s8cwYpFQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491747',7.5,23899,'en','Away from Her','Fiona and Grant have been married for nearly 50 years. They have to face the fact that Fiona’s absent-mindedness is a symptom of Alzheimer’s disease. She must go to a specialized nursing home, where she slowly forgets Grant and turns her affection to Aubrey, another patient in the home.','/oyPE6i9sylR1UhTPFmniOHcQpKb.jpg','2007-05-04',110,'Released','It\'s never too late to become what you might have been.','Away from Her',1919,3.4455,7,'e-uNrAwb8-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21012,_binary '\0','/8K4yr5Ak7lFBCbLffPjdSe78dlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491764',3.6,2379,'en','Earthstorm','A massive asteroid impact on the moon begins causing storms on earth due to the sudden changes in ocean tides. But when further examination is conducted it\'s discovered that the moon\'s structure is now entirely unstable -- threatening all life on earth. With time running out, a team of scientists turn to one man, demolitions expert John Redding, in effort to find a solution and secure the moon.','/9X6UjDn8GLFBrmJl63vWyQkk4U3.jpg','2006-06-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Earthstorm',15858,1.6743,4.8,'FkO5CdxkB0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21013,_binary '\0','/mHifdKxrxVSYsheHReNy87XihVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491775',7.2,4342,'te','హ్యాపీ','A politician refrains his daughter from finishing college as it would affect his politics. He decides to get her married to a police officer of the same caste, but things don\'t go as planned.','/sLAm3iTltaHViglqcjUTJmmxHXO.jpg','2006-01-27',152,'Released',NULL,'Happy',81060,2.0591,6.378,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21014,_binary '\0','/vaVee327SNdPJT5Fxyyct3EayAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0491977',7.2,2947,'tr','Dolap Beygiri','Ali, an honest and honorable man, moves to Istanbul when he is transferred there. He moves in with his sister Hacer and brother-in-law Yakup. Yakup\'s niece Ayşe also lives in the same house. From the day he starts his job as a civil servant, Ali reacts against the swindlers and bribe-takers around him. As a result, his boss and other civil servants become uncomfortable with the situation. When Yakup runs away with the money he collected to build a mosque, Ali and Ayşe are left alone. Not wanting to leave each other, the two get married. Ali is fired from his job for preventing the civil servants from taking bribes and goes to the village with Ayşe. Yakup, who has fled to Istanbul, calls Ali and Ayşe to join him at his insistence. Ali and his family, who go to Yakup\'s side out of desperation, will never be able to escape their troubles.','/9SSUxzwbyFcIaUoTWaHdr3arHfh.jpg','1982-10-01',90,'Released','Neither Martyr, Nor Veteran.','Mill Horse',205056,1.7086,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21015,_binary '\0','/uxQW0C3TkbasUJbShlFTnvaaZP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492044',5.9,68469,'en','The Haunting in Connecticut','When the Campbell family moves to upstate Connecticut, they soon learn that their charming Victorian home has a disturbing history: not only was the house a transformed funeral parlor where inconceivable acts occurred, but the owner\'s clairvoyant son Jonah served as a demonic messenger, providing a gateway for spiritual entities to crossover.','/dTfL0YbTa7S59vZYmWbk6UofHkI.jpg','2009-03-27',102,'Released','Some things cannot be explained.','The Haunting in Connecticut',18781,5.7059,6.172,'MRJA3lN0xCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21016,_binary '\0','/8u4txPmXjaBTAYWnOdVQikzbqiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492330',5.5,1335,'fr','Poltergay','Marc and Emma move into a new house but have no idea that their basement was a gay nightclub. To make matters worse, the club was destroyed by fire, and now the house is haunted by the ghosts of five gay clubbers.','/4POmYYaHJSHUWGmDG3QPUv2crbP.jpg','2006-10-25',93,'Released',NULL,'Poltergay',27614,1.9006,5.3,'p361h7wiNE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21017,_binary '\0','/AwWMcB5lFPLe8nZVXrBqPdHQ26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492389',3.9,19364,'en','Furry Vengeance','When real estate developer Dan Sanders finalizes plans to level a swath of pristine Oregon forest to make way for a soulless housing subdivision, a band of woodland creatures rises up to throw a monkey wrench into the greedy scheme. Just how much mischief from the furry critters can the businessman take before he calls it quits?','/604qqquWBgFy34jLhHLtebFPQy6.jpg','2010-04-30',92,'Released','He came. He saw. They conquered.','Furry Vengeance',35169,5.426,5,'FQAx4_So3UE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21018,_binary '\0','/zcqL8FoVKxZjuzO4znqvqdvLJtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492466',7.1,1706,'ku','Iraq in Fragments','An opus in three parts, Iraq In Fragments offers a series of intimate, passionately-felt portraits: A fatherless 11-year-old is apprenticed to the domineering owner of a Baghdad garage; Sadr followers in two Shiite cities rally for regional elections while enforcing Islamic law at the point of a gun; a family of Kurdish farmers welcomes the US presence, which has allowed them a measure of freedom previously denied. American director James Longley spent more than two years filming in Iraq to create this stunningly photographed, poetically rendered documentary of the war-torn country as seen through the eyes of Sunnis, Shiites and Kurds.','/snVhUvp5Cq8Vaxr19sPl33eeYX0.jpg','2006-01-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Iraq in Fragments',34389,0.8894,6.6,'hiu8cXhjpX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21019,_binary '\0','/qeWfikPxQWpcBY6oXfYvB6ClEUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492473',6.7,1604,'zh','看上去很美','Qiang a rebellious 4-year-old is put in boarding school where he causes havoc by defying the teachers and principal who try to impose some discipline on him.','/yg7AfgmCXmZIj1yjbXmi61mAdCf.jpg','2006-04-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Little Red Flowers',36615,1.342,6.3,'ghOad7MKzfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21020,_binary '\0','/2glRhdYuvvX5xOy7VGuQyYtMOWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492481',6,2541,'en','Puccini for Beginners','When her inability to commit leads to a breakup with her girlfriend, opera-loving writer Allegra winds up in the bed of amiable professor Philip. He is so smitten with Allegra that he dumps his lover, Grace, and convinces Allegra to continue their affair. When Allegra meets Grace, sparks fly, and she begins a parallel romance, unaware that her new lover is the woman Philip left to be with her.','/b5yBAYkXa6jSfBr0iayon8CkXC9.jpg','2006-09-02',82,'Released','A love triangle of operatic proportions.','Puccini for Beginners',20405,1.6837,5.5,'7xwlqctWV8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21021,_binary '\0','/qDlPT4EStkbQxczswCQsq23OGQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492486',4.6,18642,'en','Shrooms','A group of American teens comes to Ireland to visit a friend who takes them on a camping trip in search of the local, fabled magic mushrooms. When the psychedelics start taking hold, the panicked friends are attacked by ghostly creatures; but how can they determine whether what they are experiencing is reality or hallucination?','/pU4lcKfjf0U8pM036FHyoVGLev7.jpg','2007-08-16',84,'Released','Get ready to get wasted.','Shrooms',14456,2.9339,4.9,'qDhRhmrC80g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21022,_binary '\0','/t5xPav2PM0J3laYoZT6qkshBePy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492492',5.9,3659,'en','Sleeping Dogs Lie','A recently engaged woman\'s life is thrown into turmoil after confessing to her fiancé that she once experimented with bestiality.','/hJpRHWsYu67BXIduUYLv5CXxPhc.jpg','2006-10-20',87,'Released','Everyone has a secret','Sleeping Dogs Lie',43673,2.2164,5.8,'ylkIcpv3PhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21023,_binary '\0','/kOGV6HCA4Z0y315TX2V6L1vuAmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492496',7.4,2256,'en','Thin','The story of four women suffering from anorexia and bulimia in South Florida.','/8yaeLnIOBL8NuY9FByEojOqWusH.jpg','2005-01-21',102,'Released','If it takes dying to get there, so be it.','Thin',45051,1.3138,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21024,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492499',7.9,1792,'en','An Unreasonable Man','An Unreasonable Man is a 2006 documentary film that traces the life and career of political activist Ralph Nader, the founder of modern consumer protection. The film examines Nader\'s advocacy for auto safety features, such as federally mandated seat belts and air bags, as well as his rise to national prominence following an invasion of privacy lawsuit against General Motors.','/g1u0Aelw5r7sJeKrF9ssz7uBeJD.jpg','2007-01-31',122,'Released',NULL,'An Unreasonable Man',30365,0.9662,7.8,'GYFroVL2rGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21025,_binary '\0','/1F5udd0LhzxTCXmFnhCbiyC0yBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492506',7.4,3893,'en','Wordplay','From the masters who create the mind-bending diversions to the tense competition at the American Crossword Puzzle Tournament, Patrick Creadon\'s documentary reveals a fascinating look at a decidedly addictive pastime. Creadon captures New York Times editor Will Shortz at work, talks to celebrity solvers -- including Bill Clinton and Ken Burns -- and presents an intimate look at the national tournament and its competitors.','/8AY7EkxJwB8Ow5iPe41GOJesxzn.jpg','2006-06-26',94,'Released','Discover a world that thinks inside the box','Wordplay',35199,1.2314,7,'JLK7de9juXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21026,_binary '\0','/kScVB7SdGhCk7nOWpCuxKIXFq2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492533',5.7,1244,'ko','애인','Her lover has never taken a dangerous risk in his life. She has been for seven years and is going to get married next month. One day she meets a handsome stranger, who asked her to spend one day with him. It might be a mistake to accept his proposal, but over the next day she will experience a level of excitement and intimacy, she has never experienced before, and this could change her life all of sudden.','/2V783yXuFOHW0FSCg4fvufs2iBi.jpg','2005-12-08',98,'Released','One day… is all he asked.','The Intimate',142093,5.8014,6.1,'Bu1F-W-N0EE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21027,_binary '\0','/8WdK71mYHqQzZGBFH9gYLaZNNsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492619',6.2,14462,'en','The Foot Fist Way','An inept taekwondo instructor struggles with marital troubles and an unhealthy obsession with fellow taekwondo enthusiast Chuck \"The Truck\" Williams.','/jyrlFaRWrjf3FUfLDzS9JpNGHzm.jpg','2008-05-30',83,'Released','The story of a man who teaches people how to kick other people in the face','The Foot Fist Way',13484,2.3197,5.727,'B8bwGEoEi4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21028,_binary '\0','/sg3M27H0F4k6FPfh8Ea9qpaPChm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492650',6,1610,'ko','작업의 정석','A man and woman have great success in all of their dating pursuits. The woman uses her dating rules and fakes a car accident to capture the guy\'s attention, but she can\'t get him to succumb to her charm.','/zsl8l97CtFONXiYFwI4AIxCq6eI.jpg','2005-12-21',100,'Released','Seductress vs Seducer.','The Art of Seduction',20969,1.7193,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21029,_binary '\0','/gM3uhKnz9RGACakLQrjQruoqgdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492754',5.2,2996,'en','Salvage','Claire Parker is going to die. At the hands of a sadistic and depraved killer, she will endure a terrifying, unimaginable brutal death--and it will all happen again. After being beaten, dragged, sliced, and stabbed, Claire awakens at work--where it all began--untouched and unharmed. But the hellish ordeal is far from over. The madman is back and he\'s ready for more blood...','/rINSO6I0CX3zJT7FV1ZuLEwBgU0.jpg','2006-11-02',80,'Released','What if every day you relived your own murder?','Salvage',38065,2.5841,4.863,'EssRq85tFKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21030,_binary '\0','/2CPsXJw4qZ00dp6PM0AleCoczk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492784',6.9,6925,'ja','奇妙なサーカス','The erotic novelist Taeko is writing a morbid story of a family destroyed by incest, murder and abuse. Her assistant, Yuji, sets on a mission to uncover the reality of this story, but the reality might be too much to bear.','/8uEvy8cVVomN82atiLp5i7JIuI4.jpg','2005-12-24',108,'Released','Reality is the mystery…','Strange Circus',10842,2.0186,7.227,'728UDCNk964','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21031,_binary '\0','/eWQpSZct3VNqW2O6eQYcjywEFKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492835',7.3,6364,'ko','왕의 남자','Two clowns living in Korea\'s Chosun Dynasty get arrested for staging a play that satirizes the king. They are dragged to the palace and threatened with execution but are given a chance to save their lives if they can make the king laugh.','/ilNM1LndM1ybOid2wYd2FhjsKIh.jpg','2005-12-29',121,'Released','Forbidden desire, sumptuous tragedy.','King and the Clown',45035,2.5525,7,'JfGpTWM-TNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21032,_binary '\0','/hh6sS2gVDjAoVLxszYG1wHXbSvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492878',6.7,5868,'en','Drake & Josh Go Hollywood','When Drake and Josh accidentally send their little sister Megan on a plane to L.A., they soon find themselves in the middle of a dangerous situation.','/iU1jCuzySjhgMYqT86NIVI6fSaX.jpg','2006-01-06',73,'Released','They have to get free, foil the bad guys, and get to the TRL studio in time','Drake & Josh Go Hollywood',43960,2.876,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21033,_binary '\0','/vQ3Jf0mLPtdZdhqq1yMRqSfPbGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492881',4.6,1383,'en','The Fifth Commandment','In Bangkok, an assassin who turns down a job that hits too close to home finds himself targeted by the elite members of his profession','/fTGr7lGtLIpnXM2JZkx3EUyzFIN.jpg','2008-08-21',87,'Released',NULL,'The Fifth Commandment',14075,2.137,5.7,'S-4MaD5QCro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21034,_binary '\0','/sF5U6R6dpyyiONraHUuShdQ3E12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492896',7.1,2971,'en','My Suicide','After declaring that he\'s going to film himself committing suicide for a school project, Archie videotapes his surprising interactions with worried family members, interested classmates, unreliable medical experts and the hottest girl in school.','/xgLWcqUkmV0u9xUcFBF3vPqhrIx.jpg','2009-02-07',107,'Released','A self-inflicted comedy','My Suicide',81434,2.1517,6.1,'yIXkuWUZpm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21035,_binary '\0','/uGT8IaRedSNFe7HdbXIuqC8429F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492912',5.4,1671,'en','Subject Two','A doctor invents a resurrection formula and tests it by killing his assistant over and over and over again.','/qxvWkn9sgiJwaKz2KUEzKc449Sa.jpg','2006-01-20',93,'Released','Death has its side effects.','Subject Two',31463,1.0837,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21036,_binary '\0','/rf1a61N3QGiXVUwC19WV3TRfwOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492931',7.2,6075,'en','The 11th Hour','A look at the state of the global environment including visionary and practical solutions for restoring the planet\'s ecosystems. Featuring ongoing dialogues of experts from all over the world, including former Soviet Prime Minister Mikhail Gorbachev, renowned scientist Stephen Hawking, former head of the CIA R. James Woolse','/9ZQyqJhoqSXYhu27oRDqz3Tzl10.jpg','2007-08-17',95,'Released','It\'s our generation that gets to change the world... forever.','The 11th Hour',4832,2.5867,6.8,'7IBG2V98IBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21037,_binary '\0','/qCKO6xQMLgB1goL1v20tMOfMLBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492956',6.2,104724,'en','The Game Plan','Bachelor football star Joe Kingman seems to have it all. He is wealthy and carefree, and his team is on the way to capturing a championship. Suddenly, he is tackled by some unexpected news: He has a young daughter, the result of a last fling with his ex-wife. Joe must learn to balance his personal and professional lives with the needs of his child.','/fcLFvIqCUrhY96mkSmr3okxaMEw.jpg','2007-09-28',110,'Released','Joe Kingman had the perfect game plan to win the championship... but first, he has to tackle one little problem.','The Game Plan',13680,10.7206,6.517,'xo3XEQxbaEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21038,_binary '\0','/1wR7sU0l6gfZMQ6EDH6BfGvkKkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0492962',4.4,3149,'en','Destricted','A compilation of erotic films intended to illuminate the points where art meets sexuality.','/dCf1g7GjugKNw7Iizs0O093rKqj.jpg','2006-09-15',116,'Released',NULL,'Destricted',208478,2.4356,4.3,'xdAnQTYGkec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21039,_binary '\0','/twio8SQ4gHB0j74nM7lHanCVyar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493076',5.4,3222,'en','Nina','The story of the late jazz musician and classical pianist Nina Simone including her rise to fame and relationship with her manager Clifton Henderson.','/bgu5NoLBb8Pf84qKiVqK54BsRrr.jpg','2016-04-22',90,'Released','Singer. Activist. Survivor. Legend.','Nina',360389,3.0612,5.2,'W3EWygLE_No','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21040,_binary '\0','/825HOL4TaTQF5OgkTll7lVOR7UP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493171',5.9,2104,'it','Ti amo in tutte le lingue del mondo','A divorced high school PE teacher falls in love with a single mom before learning that her daughter is the student who\'s been hitting on him between classes.','/sAD8wEFbGwVIJHrps9Zll9Ov2Rt.jpg','2005-12-16',99,'Released',NULL,'I Love You in All Languages of the World',44894,1.2414,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21041,_binary '\0','/dS1rOjnhgqTbEebLLAIQ7tG7hyB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493247',6.3,5078,'ja','銀色の髪のアギト','It is 300 years into the future. Earth\'s environment had been devastated by mankind\'s own foolish plans and humankind is beleaguered by the sentient forests which they have awoken. The world balance is tipped when a young boy named Agito stumbles across a machine that glowed in a strange blue hue inside a forbidden sanctuary.','/deky1Av1w6wgSzcFbtcsFgrKKtV.jpg','2006-01-07',95,'Released','Together, we can face the future...','Origin: Spirits of the Past',14945,3.097,6.9,'Vns32-58YZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21042,_binary '\0','/hueisAmshI3LcK5HnGDOQESZOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493264',5.7,19637,'tr','Kurtlar Vadisi: Irak','The film covers through fiction real-life events like the occupation of Iraq, the execution of Daniel Pearl, the Hood event and the Abu Ghraib torture scandal.','/s7NOQ6u6elKB7KiZVd3uUY3igW0.jpg','2006-01-31',122,'Released','War Without Rules','Valley of the Wolves: Iraq',11818,3.1178,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21043,_binary '\0','/80G63mIJ1Ae6oEuPO1Zz7aOoy82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493393',8,4584,'en','Ashes and Snow','Ashes and Snow, a film by Gregory Colbert, uses both still and movie cameras to explore extraordinary interactions between humans and animals. The 60-minute feature is a poetic narrative rather than a documentary. It aims to lift the natural and artificial barriers between humans and other species, dissolving the distance that exists between them.','/os5iwmKFD2Q1b66zeBa8nkDOXkR.jpg','2005-03-05',62,'Released','If you come to me at this moment your minutes will become hours your hours will become days and your days will become a lifetime.','Ashes and Snow',20110,2.0273,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21044,_binary '\0','/hqixVDzkIOUclyRvLnS6bS8kTOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493402',5.1,4435,'en','Boarding Gate','A beautiful woman, Sandra, seduces a wealthy businessman, Miles Rennburg. Little does he realise that she has been sent to kill him at the behest of her boyfriend/crime partner, Lester. Controlling all this is Sue, Lester\'s wife.','/wPUwneHOwxWTOdIVQPjamHpr8Dm.jpg','2007-08-22',106,'Released','She\'s losing control again.','Boarding Gate',14735,2.4668,4.988,'gkIihhbi93c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21045,_binary '\0','/pEcThOf7KBmPxPQeITSf1iykcng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493404',3.5,3398,'en','Brotherhood of Blood','Driven by vengeance, thirsty for blood... and damned to hell! Guarded by vampires and chained in a dark cellar by the mighty vampire King Pashek, crack vampire hunter Carrie Rieger\'s time is running out.her relentless quest to crush the world\'s undead scourge has brought her to the home of Pashek. But she is not here to hill him. Instead she wishes to join forces with her immortal enemies in an effort to rise up against an even more terrifying threat, one that would chill the soul of even the most blood-thirsty vampire; the mighty vampire demon Vlad Kossel.Thought to have been killed many hundreds of years ago, Kossel has now returned to wreak bloody vengeance on his kind before enslaving humanity. He will destroy everything in his path and there is only one hunter who can stop him...','/j0eXT7qxXpVxw6zQbbrWyiCefoI.jpg','2007-10-11',90,'Released','Hell has come to Earth!','Brotherhood of Blood',12682,1.7428,3.6,'8vpOPFAcNic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21046,_binary '\0','/lk5hfcUf6oAibrkyshaXtSjBzda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493405',6,54473,'en','CHiPs','The adventures of two California Highway Patrol motorcycle officers as they make their rounds on the freeways of Los Angeles.','/mIHA8Xf6WmxbS83ia4vQ5ojvxV8.jpg','2017-03-23',101,'Released','Chip happens.','CHiPs',417644,7.4076,6.1,'NErwOWW7aCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21047,_binary '\0','/nYaChE5HqJDAbreITxgrwBY2YEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493407',4.5,1754,'en','Cook-Off!','Amateur \'chefs\' from around the country compete for a million dollar prize in the ultimate food fight.','/iZW0qabQHbSo89Qm5fNusCLqL2W.jpg','2017-11-17',98,'Released','Let the flour fly!','Cook-Off!',370301,3.0984,5.3,'1QWLyi03twg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21048,_binary '\0','/uxHl9Zmfg1L4oLTr4uNfK6S337a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493409',4.7,1317,'en','Devil\'s Den','Quinn Taylor and his friend Nick are on their way back from Mexico with a load of Spanish Fly to sell in the States. They stop at a gentlemen\'s club called The Devil\'s Den and decide to test out their product on the unsuspecting women there. Only, these women aren\'t really human, and the two men find themselves in a very fatal position. Also tossed in are a female-assassin on the hunt for Quinn, a monster hunter!','/z3bGF7BWlA6POS7okgB5V6J1Bz0.jpg','2006-10-22',84,'Released','Killing from Dusk till Dawn.','Devil\'s Den',28640,1.4435,4.5,'tB3RyjaMVpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21049,_binary '\0','/mGNOVkGsghE6K7qx59Le49mebVW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493417',3.7,2575,'hi','Fool N Final','A bunch of misfits and gangsters embarks on a journey to find a lost and stolen diamond.','/msMbABeZerP6DefVN5izbOD7Wl1.jpg','2007-06-01',142,'Released',NULL,'Fool N Final',156288,1.4629,3.8,'1P3ZoQ17E5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21050,_binary '\0','/kT0g9B4LQIScVyFF2CUQzcjFkOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493420',7.8,1552,'en','The Great Happiness Space: Tale of an Osaka Love Thief','Welcome to The Great Happiness Space: Rakkyo Café. The club\'s owner, Issei (22), has a staff of twenty boys all under his training to become the top escorts of Osaka\'s underground love scene. During their training, they learn how to dress, how to talk, how to walk, and most importantly, how to fake relationships with the girls who become their source of income. Join us as Osaka\'s number one host boy takes us on a journey through the complex and heartrenching world of love for sale in the Japanese underground.','/yoRCRrUGsAhmooGpYFrjiWQvgma.jpg','2006-01-22',78,'Released','A Cold-Eyed Study of Love For Sale','The Great Happiness Space: Tale of an Osaka Love Thief',24999,0.5857,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21051,_binary '\0','/eCP3PAiu442zkJWczdLdvALePNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493430',7,84538,'en','Jackass Number Two','Jackass Number Two is a compilation of various stunts, pranks and skits, and essentially has no plot. Chris Pontius, Johnny Knoxville, Steve-O, Bam Margera, and the whole crew return to the screen to raise the stakes higher than ever before.','/u73V8dMqUwjtPL6gWesCE7ji9GU.jpg','2006-09-22',93,'Released','Guess who just made number two?','Jackass Number Two',12094,5.0718,6.6,'qBZPCE0jr6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21052,_binary '\0','/gaFtnsm5rF6djSweigbAEp7xlvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493437',5.5,2608,'hi','Apna Sapna Money Money','Kishan is a young man from Goa whose brain is full of every conceivable trick to make a quick buck. He cons people by slipping into different outfits and by assuming many guises. Julie, is a sexy club dancer with quite a local reputation, but behind her raunchy exterior is a compassionate, kind-hearted woman who goes out of her way to help the needy...','/xnNupI8KTspafM3ubwCyz3ndOgj.jpg','2006-11-10',134,'Released',NULL,'Apna Sapna Money Money',46371,1.5142,5.413,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21053,_binary '\0','/qA4vY4X0OChCTMB5EPbdwvvOBD5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493439',5.2,1679,'en','On the Doll','A lurid, dark look into the lives of sex workers, where victims of child abuse deal with the consequences later in life.','/jKBGglWtxEvbUg91rQIl3lzz4aV.jpg','2007-10-12',102,'Released','Do You Wanna Play?','On the Doll',30680,2.2144,5.163,'KihOV1anN2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21054,_binary '\0','/lDBsmCe0NQiHdOxjvS1LpGxJWcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493450',6.7,3284,'en','Sixty Six','A boy\'s Bar Mitzvah looks set to be a disaster when it coincides with the 1966 World Cup Final.','/tslE4UT0p4z6Qju2cdqpfFC46Hr.jpg','2006-11-03',93,'Released','it\'s his year, and he wants it back.','Sixty Six',31082,2.0357,6.6,'qK_TtDZVlMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21055,_binary '\0','/4VCo3qgQZM3x5jnQIz3sIhLsI0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493451',5.5,4700,'en','The Skeptic','After the mysterious death of his Aunt, a confirmed skeptic lawyer, Bryan Becket, dismisses reports that her house is haunted and moves in. Immediately occurrences begin he cannot explain. And beyond the occurrences there is something about the house which gnaws at Becket - some strange connection he senses he has with the house\'s past. Soon, the haunting turns personal.','/x7K5DIDhCwqDD9VIMVCMdDld9pK.jpg','2009-05-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Skeptic',24116,2.1126,5.3,'GQ0cl8yH2a8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21056,_binary '\0','/uz8uAXwsewDRXMhuAfnkUW0QHpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493452',5.2,1843,'nl','Sl8n8','After her father gets killed in an automobile accident, Kristel Lodema discovers that her dad was investigating an old mine where convicted child killer Andries Martiens died back in 1857. Kristel decides to check out the mine along with a group of young adults. However, said mine turns out to be haunted by the dangerous and murderous spirit of Martiens.','/ApQQkbfATstZ1DN2kSsGqqHMl3F.jpg','2006-10-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Slaughter Night',50450,1.126,5.2,'MWFCp8coCJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21057,_binary '\0','/sN8K7JQZkcz7Kq4Mp20Vy4mb8q9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493459',7.4,28930,'en','This Film Is Not Yet Rated','Kirby Dick\'s provocative documentary investigates the secretive and inconsistent process by which the Motion Picture Association of America (MPAA) rates films, revealing the organization\'s underhanded efforts to control culture. Dick questions whether certain studios get preferential treatment and exposes the discrepancies in how the MPAA views sex and violence.','/nXo26FkBBdiEaEDzOPkrSFZC7zO.jpg','2006-09-01',98,'Released','Censorship, uncensored.','This Film Is Not Yet Rated',16070,2.9279,7.091,'jCHLP0dY_P4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21058,_binary '\0','/vjwuT8EzWY96W6nrJKZNI2WJU87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493464',6.7,431226,'en','Wanted','Doormat Wesley Gibson is an office worker whose life is going nowhere. He meets an attractive woman named Fox and discovers that his recently murdered father - whom Wesley never knew - belonged to the Fraternity, a secret society of assassins which takes its orders from Fate itself. Fox and Sloan, the Fraternity\'s leader, teach Wesley, through intense training, to tap into dormant powers and hone his innate killing skills. Though he enjoys his newfound abilities, he begins to suspect that there is more to the Fraternity than meets the eye.','/njy7Pz7ZHZceO7lNfGIHKphY8Hd.jpg','2008-06-19',110,'Released','Choose your destiny.','Wanted',8909,16.43,6.5,'b9YEdjEKme0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21059,_binary '\0','/2iMiJaNF0azeIvS1vxNA4uIyKbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0493949',6.5,21333,'en','Ramona and Beezus','Ramona is a little girl with a very big imagination and a nose for mischief. Her playful antics keep everyone in her loving family on their toes, including her older sister Beezus, who\'s just trying to survive her first year of high school. Through all the ups and downs of childhood, Ramona and Beezus learn that anything\'s possible when you believe in yourself and rely on each other.','/bW1YWFyocIY8DDgwOUroZG2FYNe.jpg','2010-07-23',103,'Released','A little sister goes a long way.','Ramona and Beezus',38843,6.5334,6.593,'VP5FW5KA6Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21060,_binary '\0','/9QMbzoO8Xwsjo2Enyvhns6yHDck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0494199',4.4,3853,'en','5ive Girls','Five wayward teenage girls are sent to a reformatory and discover they possess unique powers to battle the ancient demon, Legion, which holds thrall over the sinister institution.','/9EKL1Ta42cj9rSqopfu3QJFE3G1.jpg','2007-02-0