Everyone loves a good scandal.','The Walker',13251,2.6204,5.305,'daQ7iYY80H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21325,_binary '\0','/eZwwJ5yRpMDhZzfMS7XeWwUzLSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0783640',6.8,15600,'en','The Last Full Measure','The incredible true story of Vietnam War hero William H. Pitsenbarger, a U.S. Air Force Pararescuemen medic who personally saved over sixty men. Thirty-two years later, Pentagon staffer Scott Huffman investigates a Congressional Medal of Honor request for Pitsenbarger and uncovers a high-level conspiracy behind the decades-long denial of the medal, prompting Huffman to put his own career on the line to seek justice for the fallen airman.','/bMG8c80lyEkBXVgyHVqsdQhjgf6.jpg','2020-01-23',110,'Released','The ultimate sacrifice deserves the highest honor.','The Last Full Measure',442065,6.223,7.275,'Go8zI2sytEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21326,_binary '\0','/5EdeVKfWyUOYkVqpD8S0cc7zBWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0783695',5.6,1288,'es','El cielo dividido','Gerardo is deeply in love with longtime lover Jonas. When Jonas falls for a stranger he met at a local nightclub, heartbroken Gerardo soon seeks solace in the arms of Sergio. Despite other interests, Gerardo and Jonas can\'t bring themselves to end it.','/9FOSnAcpjRiY66l0VssB7FgLO1Y.jpg','2006-02-14',140,'Released',NULL,'Broken Sky',22093,4.4816,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21327,_binary '\0','/iQDErfqkPq8RMvhMYqKSGCq5vTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0783767',5.8,5819,'en','Angel','Edwardian England. A precocious girl from a poor background with aspirations to being a novelist finds herself swept to fame and fortune when her tasteless romances hit the best seller lists. Her life changes in unexpected ways when she encounters an aristocratic brother and sister, both of whom have cultural ambitions, and both of whom fall in love with her.','/iWJKPVsTvQK04TAZxErMymfEiyB.jpg','2007-02-17',134,'Released','A dreary city tenement provides backdrop to this tale of exclusion and the magic it takes to become accepted','Angel',11801,2.3373,5.5,'ZpdLCREdUYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21328,_binary '\0','/dTpzTEUlAcuXhRiR3FatZowz8L7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0784962',4.3,1223,'en','7-10 Split','An aspiring actor whose career is in the dumps, exploits his amazing bowling skills to take the PBA by storm and becomes rich and famous, only to lose his best girl and best friend...','/ru8yAyF7B1VHA6l3NptMTz1mLRl.jpg','2007-02-21',90,'Released',NULL,'7-10 Split',15046,1.8918,4,'28y7iMAQRDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21329,_binary '\0','/tXrqV2ZCVzGmiFjltlmm2qNRSM2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0784972',5.3,11916,'en','The Brothers Solomon','A pair of well-meaning, but socially inept brothers try to find their perfect mates in order to provide their dying father with a grandchild.','/63u2QZZZIaME05TSv3tLKpibII1.jpg','2007-09-07',93,'Released','They want to put a baby in you.','The Brothers Solomon',10071,3.2025,5,'LuCV3ZGPkZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21330,_binary '\0','/eU3AGzWTaj0pRhAfqdHIv0ueG4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785000',6.4,1600,'fa','قرمز','Hasti, a widowed nurse who has a daughter, marries a paranoid wealthy man.','/1Kcn7qZAJerUKOpjsrOMdTlTrZf.jpg','1998-08-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Red',306900,0.8478,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21331,_binary '\0','/rQ0L0jHa8dA75W8x9KPKNypKSh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785002',5.4,1776,'sv','Heartbreak Hotel','Elisabeth and Gudrun are two Swedish divorcées, both over 40, who meet when Elisabeth parks her car on a loading zone and is ticketed by Gudrun. Despite this shaky start, a friendship grows between the two. Elizabeth, a gynecologist, is sexy and confident. She leads the shy Gudrun through the dangerous waters of single life. But as they cavort through the dance floors and bars of Stockholm\'s nightlife they are led to a deeper examination of the relationships with men.','/u0WuLfarKGKG0AEYZphdwhJEY5L.jpg','2006-03-24',101,'Released',NULL,'Heartbreak Hotel',2180,1.0561,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21332,_binary '\0','/hovfur18TPFABZIuJYvgjLpln8V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785006',5.5,26757,'en','Hotel for Dogs','Placed in a foster home that doesn\'t allow pets, 16-year-old Andi and her younger brother, Bruce, turn an abandoned hotel into a home for their dog. Soon other strays arrive, and the hotel becomes a haven for every orphaned canine in town. But the kids have to do some quick thinking to keep the cops off their tails.','/xD2AssTeySNCamlGueai4yAZZfX.jpg','2009-01-16',100,'Released','No stray gets turned away.','Hotel for Dogs',15189,8.4676,6.1,'5m-QGsAN_Fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21333,_binary '\0','/xyE226IdU7ydSb1MxhsVPAqHr61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785007',5.3,26400,'en','Over Her Dead Body','After his fiancée, Kate, dies in an accident on their wedding day, veterinarian Henry grows depressed. To help him move on, his sister has him visit psychic Ashley and gives her Kate\'s diary. Ashley uses the journal\'s details to convincingly deliver the fake message that Kate wants Henry to move on. However, Kate\'s ghost is watching over Ashley and Henry. Furious when they fall for each other, she vows to sabotage their relationship.','/85moNqAncGlJXEwt4Ja3DfNbiQY.jpg','2008-02-01',95,'Released','She\'s passed on... But she\'s not moving on.','Over Her Dead Body',13160,5.2505,5.5,'uCE24UP6srU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21334,_binary '\0','/cbRdPNPmLRk2HSiOZGgHAZFpTnK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785012',5.7,2989,'en','In Tranzit','Nazi POWs suspected of heinous acts are locked up in a Soviet women\'s prison run by vengeful female guards. To weed out the guilty, the innocent must pay. Can supposed enemies turn into great loves? Based on a true post-World War II story, this drama stars Thomas Kretschmann, John Malkovich and Vera Farmiga in a bitter game of cat and mouse and a battle between hate and humanity, mercy and revenge.','/dgdO3WvlTD9PfTQzoXIH9xYqBbD.jpg','2008-03-04',113,'Released','From her greatest enemy came her greatest love.','In Tranzit',24786,4.1424,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21335,_binary '\0','/3ZH69oLWaAmnR0WNGnTQkituwSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785035',6.2,33378,'th','องค์บาก 2','Tien, the son of Lord Sihadecho — a murdered nobleman — is taken under the wing of Chernang, a renowned warrior and leader of the Pha Beek Krut.','/ohlebuI95t8lLc6ukIN06L1vZ89.jpg','2008-12-04',98,'Released','Warrior. Conqueror. Legend.','Ong Bak 2',16353,5.5401,6.5,'Bx08Cumv-wc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21336,_binary '\0','/vBkK0ggvfWxylvW4Mp8StTNITae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0785077',2.3,15847,'en','Who\'s Your Caddy?','Superstar rap mogul C-Note wants to join the Carolina Pines Golf & Country Club, but faces stiff opposition from the establishment\'s snooty members. C-Note forces the issue by purchasing the land adjacent to the golf course\'s 17th hole. As the club leaders search for a way to revoke his membership, C-Note realizes his family\'s honor and golf history are at stake, and digs in for the fight of his life.','/5wBBy7y5woqSICjbQekzZjwJBe7.jpg','2007-07-27',91,'Released','It\'s the street vs the elite.','Who\'s Your Caddy?',15581,3.7664,3.4,'KUhzCS4AD8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21337,_binary '\0','/r4a9qLKpaQ55e7AURBLpEOWNmYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787442',7.1,4795,'en','The Attack','An Arab surgeon living in Tel Aviv discovers a dark secret about his wife in the aftermath of a suicide bombing.','/gNJzPOnQ2RBr51PdULm89b4BlLx.jpg','2012-09-01',102,'Released',NULL,'The Attack',121791,2.3833,6.8,'NObn1g6Hzo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21338,_binary '\0','/9cy44nYsWmNblqcqCuPXZc74FuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787462',7,6491,'en','Elvis & Anabelle','A small-town beauty queen and an unlicensed mortician set out across the Texas plains on a journey of self-discovery.','/eYucJWWJiTQVDwwbjhHIu1aDp5C.jpg','2007-03-10',106,'Released','The awakening of love.','Elvis & Anabelle',19554,1.9496,6.754,'-11tP8-hnjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21339,_binary '\0','/xHzK6MAvXDoh5G7is0wCNI7GHO6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787470',5.4,10755,'en','Balls Out: Gary the Tennis Coach','An overenthusiastic high-school maintenance man attempts to lead an unlikely group of misfits to the Nebraska state tennis championship in Balls Out: The Gary Houseman Story? director Danny Leiner\'s underdog sports comedy. American Pie star Seann William Scott stars as the ambitious janitor who believes he has what it takes to coach the winning team.','/s8LMr71B3ByCm2E1U33d9uynudY.jpg','2009-01-13',87,'Released','Small balls. Big ambition.','Balls Out: Gary the Tennis Coach',14141,2.4957,5.1,'IKy_bvHa1wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21340,_binary '\0','/q2vz5DeLbegD2teJU29Gtb4t2sO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787474',6.8,65631,'en','The Boxtrolls','An orphaned boy raised by underground creatures called Boxtrolls comes up from the sewers and out of his box to save his family and the town from the evil exterminator, Archibald Snatcher.','/npBf0yc5Gt7aAyyVOcYtFyT2IPa.jpg','2014-09-10',97,'Released','Heroes come in all shapes and sizes... even rectangles.','The Boxtrolls',170687,12.0708,6.7,'FR5PuJNMTFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21341,_binary '\0','/R0p2aJVD7NTrCJFbDlTPKoVCCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787475',6.7,100259,'en','Hot Rod','For Rod Kimble, performing stunts is a way of life, even though he is rather accident-prone. Poor Rod cannot even get any respect from his stepfather, Frank, who beats him up in weekly sparring matches. When Frank falls ill, Rod devises his most outrageous stunt yet to raise money for Frank\'s operation -- and then Rod will kick Frank\'s butt.','/jRkt03dXCVKnbvcQm3ygU1cjg9Y.jpg','2007-08-03',88,'Released','Smack destiny in the face.','Hot Rod',10074,6.7883,6.413,'DhdrA9qz79o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21342,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787484',7.3,2192,'en','A Girl Like Me: The Gwen Araujo Story','The story of Gwen Araujo, a transgender teen who was murdered in California in 2002.','/w0Tc3HGHiGxtgMhNyJN9GvN7Ay2.jpg','2006-06-19',96,'Released',NULL,'A Girl Like Me: The Gwen Araujo Story',30303,1.9107,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21343,_binary '\0','/gYciO0sT4vlFRMaJp3t8oHw2A7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787485',4,1559,'en','Killer Pad','Three naïve guys, in their 20s, drive from Illinois to LA. A sleazy real-estate agent gives them a great deal on a house in the Hollywood Hills. The night they arrive, a solitary Mexican, who speaks only Spanish, tries to warn them that the place is possessed by Satan. They don\'t understand him, move in, and plan a party after they meet Lucy, their gorgeous neighbor from down the hill. An old friend of theirs, studying to be a priest, joins them. In the basement is a portal to Hell, so at the party, guests meet their end in various ways. Lucy and her friends may not be who the lads think. Is there any hope for these innocents? Maybe their neutered dog can help.','/oOZOKZYD51wD2gjvd9lGXliE5WB.jpg','2008-02-05',84,'Released','Three pals move into a haunted house in the Hollywood Hills.','Killer Pad',58096,1.1105,3.8,'xYijjTndThI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21344,_binary '\0','/sIwWLjL2WesMxsar64OnXAwmbGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787495',5.5,1533,'en','Netherbeast Incorporated','An offbeat comedy with a quirky twist on the vampire tale set in modern day corporate America.','/n9SSp7xmVkV888obVgbSybW8e3j.jpg','2007-03-30',89,'Released',NULL,'Netherbeast Incorporated',31080,1.8727,4.8,'ZD0ATSviLak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21345,_binary '\0','/n5dYsccOhJxgamKj7HEa9SLDjOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787515',5.1,1657,'en','Strength and Honour','A single father decides to break his dying wife\'s last wish to not box again in order to save his young son from certain death.','/7ZPi7uOlukxi3O05mB6AhmKp8JM.jpg','2007-11-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Strength and Honour',13077,1.2411,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21346,_binary '\0','/ipZASZJS4jcKHUMVeacuVlFUwHG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787523',6.9,12361,'en','Towelhead','A young Arab-American girl struggles with her sexual obsession, a bigoted Army reservist, and her strict father during the Gulf War.','/2j8CNzvRzdICkwRXojdrDyT65J1.jpg','2008-09-12',111,'Released','How can you find yourself if no one can see you?','Towelhead',10190,3.6877,6.226,'SYmYgKHzZ2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21347,_binary '\0','/cJ6dqrHhts085zJTMaXECjp0RfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0787524',7.2,67578,'en','The Man Who Knew Infinity','Growing up poor in Madras, India, Srinivasa Ramanujan Iyengar earns admittance to Cambridge University during WWI, where he becomes a pioneer in mathematical theories with the guidance of his professor, G.H. Hardy.','/v2X1BtkxaV8pzLbmM8a5gTdpg7B.jpg','2016-04-08',108,'Released','What does it take to prove the impossible?','The Man Who Knew Infinity',353326,6.7186,7.1,'NP0lUqNAw3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21348,_binary '\0','/tYY8AaWGkYmCOT6szHJyAufySWL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790590',5.6,6880,'en','Botched','Ritchie Donovan is a professional thief whose luck has just run out. The only survivor from a heist that goes terribly wrong, Ritchie is forced to take the rap and is sent to Russia to steal a priceless antique cross locked in a safe on the penthouse floor of a Moscow skyscraper.','/cWW38LAxTGKBeIv9ov1fvSfcYe6.jpg','2007-10-04',95,'Released','And you thought you were unlucky?','Botched',17153,1.7939,5.6,'R5Fkz6E4BuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21349,_binary '\0','/tyzhxKntPy1sl4Mlb6A01BvgQOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790602',5.4,1862,'fr','Nitro','Max leads a good life with Alice and their son Théo; that is until Alice is threatened with death while waiting for a heart transplant. Max promises Théo that he will save Alice, but to keep his word he must find a heart, and fast. Since time is running out and he must find a solution, Max decides to reconnect with his troubled past. His decision will change his life in ways he could never imagine','/iYiHJHIAkrdEQ8qQITARkBKslnK.jpg','2007-06-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Nitro',16143,2.291,5.4,'QegqLS83FFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21350,_binary '\0','/lVSj3d2dvTaK3qO9K2aD1W4L7R0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790604',5.1,39301,'en','Deck the Halls','Determined to unseat Steve Finch\'s reign as the town\'s holiday season king, Buddy Hall plasters his house with so many decorative lights that it\'ll be visible from space! When their wives bond, and their kids follow suit, the two men only escalate their rivalry - and their decorating.','/smJDzhYGhl6j9OrucsB7IkMNy82.jpg','2006-11-22',93,'Released','There glows the neighborhood.','Deck the Halls',9969,7.3076,5.6,'7mGT_IC4oxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21351,_binary '\0','/zNnCdjKsNXkkB78mEeuJT2KQVPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790618',5.6,4284,'en','Remember the Daze','During the summer of 1999, a group of teenagers, through interconnected narratives, live through their last day of high school and prepare for the future. Holly, once the new girl in school, does whatever it takes to remain popular. Dawn, who is secretly a lesbian, battles drugs. Tori is the valedictorian of her class, but, on the eve of graduation, she decides to experiment with drugs for the first time.','/nQajjglgJ6liZnVo6jeNzlkn9Na.jpg','2008-04-11',101,'Released','A perfectly good year... wasted.','Remember the Daze',20224,2.2672,4.9,'exKe1SXOCqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21352,_binary '\0','/tQeYoSH2z0vqiBff3wUHOUqyZA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790623',6.1,21948,'en','Meet Bill','A mild-mannered bank executive mentors a teenage con artist and tries to make a career change as a doughnut merchant.','/u5EqwPmzc40qIyUUSMvoaWVsSMc.jpg','2007-09-07',93,'Released','A comedy about someone you know.','Meet Bill',13243,4.0573,6.055,'FK159S6cz8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21353,_binary '\0','/d9Dwuoqc0ZjCnRcCtbaw48PNhZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790627',5.4,3778,'en','Brief Interviews with Hideous Men','After her boyfriend mysteriously leaves her with little explanation, a doctoral candidate in anthropology at a prestigious East Coast university is left looking for answers as to what went wrong.','/iPiqZKtF3rvuCW0fPsXc4Yzt8hw.jpg','2009-09-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Brief Interviews with Hideous Men',29151,2.5938,5,'bCXtxnOKOZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21354,_binary '\0','/sBuVOxCAn6GEMB3sbfnzZoRJoTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790628',5.9,78696,'en','The Incredible Burt Wonderstone','After breaking up with his longtime stage partner, a famous but jaded Vegas magician fights for relevance when a new, \"hip\" street magician appears on the scene.','/Bl95sg5Ljo3Hu9SSL0JOvLerLh.jpg','2013-03-14',100,'Released','Abracatastic!','The Incredible Burt Wonderstone',124459,6.794,5.758,'11TzXCWnUao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21355,_binary '\0','/sbVKj98cq0FztCukzu47bu0H8o7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790636',7.9,552628,'en','Dallas Buyers Club','Loosely based on the true-life tale of Ron Woodroof, a drug-taking, women-loving, homophobic man who in 1986 was diagnosed with HIV/AIDS and given thirty days to live.','/7Fdh7gUq3plvQqxRbNYhWvDABXA.jpg','2013-11-01',117,'Released','Dare to live.','Dallas Buyers Club',152532,9.476,7.905,'KDvPcBeOn8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21356,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790657',5.7,2050,'en','Everybody Wants to Be Italian','Are all relationships based on lies? Jake Bianski runs a fish market in north Boston, surrounded by Italians. For years, he\'s carried a torch for Isabella, an ex-girlfriend now married with three children and no interest in Jake. Yet, he tells everyone she\'s his girlfriend, including Marisa, a veterinarian his employees set him up with at the Italian singles club. She\'s interested in him until he tells her about his girlfriend, then he\'s persistent in asking her to be his friend. As the friendship bumps along, Jake realizes that reality may be better than fantasy, but what if Isabella changes her mind about Jake, and what if it comes out that Marisa, like Jake, isn\'t Italian?','/jsguL1TrXJ8qyfHgw6Daex721co.jpg','2007-09-18',105,'Released','When it come to love, it\'s always better to be Italian.','Everybody Wants to Be Italian',12818,1.6055,6.5,'6oVwMkUgg4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21357,_binary '\0','/rVcFwDqzvH5G1flAdv74Mo0Sw8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790662',4.9,2884,'en','Fingerprints','Fresh out of rehab, a young woman moves back in with her parents and sister, and soon becomes involved in a mystery that has left people in her town paralyzed.','/uF8jp3w025guyPBZDEisSwPPIlL.jpg','2006-10-16',95,'Released','Even the dead leave them.','Fingerprints',27253,1.7714,5.7,'mW2PlyNHzrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21358,_binary '\0','/tQRygoT0GWUvlZe0mcTAKf9RDbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790663',7.4,5084,'en','The First Grader','The true story of an 84 year-old Kenyan villager and ex Mau Mau freedom fighter who fights for his right to go to school for the first time to get the education he could never afford.','/jstfYxEYMFfSO6tQaYL6O0AMUol.jpg','2010-09-12',103,'Released','It\'s never too late to dream.','The First Grader',47559,2.1487,7.1,'ns030fCDorE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21359,_binary '\0','/8RHqeBwgHIZnNeswqLJdm0pz05Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790665',4.8,7504,'en','Flood','Timely yet terrifying, The Flood predicts the unthinkable. When a raging storm coincides with high seas it unleashes a colossal tidal surge, which travels mercilessly down England\'s East Coast and into the Thames Estuary. Overwhelming the Barrier, torrents of water pour into the city. The lives of millions of Londoners are at stake.','/s0F2iDMtj6uYQPqbjwCPlwug2O4.jpg','2007-08-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Flood',6309,3.8812,5.3,'aUWlmED6m5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21360,_binary '\0','/g31A26h7KXkOdrsRux4pDJWwyPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790676',6.4,2377,'en','The Good Life','A movie about the travails of Jason (Mark Webber), a young gas station attendant and movie projectionist living in Nebraska. His encounters with various social difficulties and with Frances (Zooey Deschanel), a beautiful and enigmatic young woman leads to dramatic changes and decisions in his life.','/2FRYcXaRMfyB1BYpzjlwXfuoXvS.jpg','2007-01-20',90,'Released',NULL,'The Good Life',24050,1.7147,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21361,_binary '\0','/pDjZE6hTt4YN2cC1Z1bYZfmH9bs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790686',6.1,120169,'en','Mirrors','An ex-cop and his family are the target of an evil force that is using mirrors as a gateway into their home.','/bt5a4ThyLpLTsia2e2ZTLzQjXO0.jpg','2008-08-14',111,'Released','There is evil...On the other side.','Mirrors',13515,6.3217,6.309,'O92QxxgeCO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21362,_binary '\0','/xiAnU9CMhKZG6xbdPBRj5lBktvE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790706',7,3032,'en','Crazy Love','Filmmaker Dan Klores examines the strange love affair of Burt Pugach and Linda Riss. Pugach is a successful attorney in 1950s New York when he meets much-younger Riss. The pair date, but Riss breaks off contact with Pugach upon learning his claims of divorce are false. Discovering that Riss was engaged to another man, Pugach hires some men to throw lye in her face, and he serves 14 years in prison for the crime.','/pCjz6UnRemWGKXSrPMafjwRvHt7.jpg','2007-11-22',92,'Released','A love story stranger than fiction','Crazy Love',26336,1.4412,6.5,'B62xvVk9VEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21363,_binary '\0','/1AoLBTknFVs7n9ieTLAqZe1LwWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790712',7.1,38798,'en','The Messenger','Will Montgomery, a U.S. Army Staff Sergeant who has returned home from Iraq, is assigned to the Army’s Casualty Notification service. Montgomery is partnered with Captain Tony Stone, to give notice to the families of fallen soldiers. The Sergeant is drawn to Olivia Pitterson, to whom he has delivered news of her husband’s death.','/p4fJyH7mMbasiFYwiw2nE7D6pMY.jpg','2009-11-13',113,'Released','The Scars of War Will Last Forever.','The Messenger',28089,6.2826,6.7,'WJHKBCcI-D4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21364,_binary '\0','/fbtaPTbbtbAixaTKfQ9VuJWHjKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790721',5,2656,'en','Normal Adolescent Behavior','High school student Wendy has an odd relationship with her five friends: They\'re openly sexual with each other, swapping partners every week. But this is all thrown into turmoil when she meets Sean, a new student in school who has a crush on her. Wendy wants to be with Sean, but doesn\'t want to disappoint her friends, whom she has known since grade school. When she does decide to leave them, her best friend, Billie, threatens revenge.','/4XtjR1MM0jgjJSr1TI4hyvbl9sz.jpg','2007-04-27',95,'Released','No secrets. No inhibitions. No apologies.','Normal Adolescent Behavior',20478,1.6105,4.5,'cDTU4MFQ9Do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21365,_binary '\0','/zUUSzq2lIlc1hvosFC39eISjlUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790723',5.6,3417,'en','Just Add Water','An offbeat romantic comedy about a decent guy, Ray Tuckby, with a dead-end life in the dead-end town of Trona, CA. After encouragement from a stranger whom he happens upon, Ray begins to dream again. He sheds the parasites in his life, musters the nerve to pursue his childhood love, and finally takes back his community by toppling the local teenage Meth-baron.','/8zK8ScSnJGA0lxK9xt1lPKLDJUx.jpg','2008-03-18',95,'Released','Because a life can grow anywhere.','Just Add Water',15936,2.1162,5,'3SEyZSKUliI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21366,_binary '\0','/iwvP8XVpYVmJ3xfF9xdBi5uAOWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790724',7,395447,'en','Jack Reacher','One morning in an ordinary town, five people are shot dead in a seemingly random attack. All evidence points to a single suspect: an ex-military sniper who is quickly brought into custody. The interrogation yields one written note: \'Get Jack Reacher!\'. Reacher, an enigmatic ex-Army investigator, believes the authorities have the right man but agrees to help the sniper\'s defense attorney. However, the more Reacher delves into the case, the less clear-cut it appears. So begins an extraordinary chase for the truth, pitting Jack Reacher against an unexpected enemy, with a skill for violence and a secret to keep.','/uQBbjrLVsUibWxNDGA4Czzo8lwz.jpg','2012-12-20',130,'Released','The law has limits. He does not.','Jack Reacher',75780,23.039,6.678,'kAbxn_F8lps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21367,_binary '\0','/6KJcFFE1iBPC0Xj0iPCcmMvS5WK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790736',5.6,152687,'en','R.I.P.D.','A recently slain cop joins a team of undead police officers working for the Rest in Peace Department and tries to find the man who murdered him.','/rS0kByPD4YF8pQ85KjzMdGiu7Xf.jpg','2013-07-18',96,'Released','To protect and serve the living.','R.I.P.D.',49524,11.1161,5.865,'nt59JjtWFSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21368,_binary '\0','/h2wvbEKgBpALcniJ4SP4fn1MlDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790769',7.2,3960,'en','Kurt Cobain: About a Son','An intimate and moving meditation on the late musician and artist Kurt Cobain, based on more than 25 hours of previously unheard audiotaped interviews conducted with Cobain by noted music journalist Michael Azerrad for his book \"Come As You Are: The Story of Nirvana.\" In the film, Kurt Cobain recounts his own life - from his childhood and adolescence to his days of musical discovery and later dealings with explosive fame - and offers often piercing insights into his life, music, and times. The conversations heard in the film have never before been made public, and they reveal a highly personal portrait of an artist much discussed but not particularly well understood.','/9BSHkt8VU2V22lCIewCqn4gJQVC.jpg','2007-10-03',97,'Released','Kurt Cobain in his own words.','Kurt Cobain: About a Son',25630,1.4933,6.9,'tHOpP27K044','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21369,_binary '\0','/1nr8LMoOPER3a6UeAvIS1uYBpSK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790770',6.4,11091,'en','Miles Ahead','An exploration of the life and music of Miles Davis.','/rdk0epUSHFo1NyWXueKANUwIFQi.jpg','2016-01-22',100,'Released','If you gonna tell a story, come with some attitude.','Miles Ahead',316000,3.8736,6.4,'wqq63ZJ5q3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21370,_binary '\0','/kuXldgiMg0YZMD8XV4n2orFa1FX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790781',5.5,8668,'en','Wendy Wu: Homecoming Warrior','It is the story of an average, popular American teenager named Wendy Wu who discovers that in order to win the coveted crown she must first learn the way of the warrior. Wendy Wu has a one track mind, and that track leads directly to the title of homecoming queen -- no unscheduled stops, and no unnecessary detours. When a mysterious Chinese monk named Shen arrives to mold Wendy into a fearless kung fu warrior, however, her royal aspirations suddenly jump the track as she desperately attempts to juggle her boyfriend, her homework, and of course, the fierce competition to become homecoming queen. Now, as Wendy begins to train her mind, body, and spirit in the ancient tradition of the martial arts and her inner warrior gradually begins to emerge, the girl who once obsessed over popularity finally begins to put that popularity into perspective as she gradually realizes what truly matters in life.','/5E5qT8Q3pLDurJZqrO8meYZc60g.jpg','2006-06-16',91,'Released','Pretty. Tough.','Wendy Wu: Homecoming Warrior',61717,3.9468,6.2,'VpVTYOd7kT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21371,_binary '\0','/3TsM2caW7smtHtw3TMIrRYO4hDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790788',5.6,1926,'en','The Yellow Wallpaper','The Yellow Wallpaper (Motion Picture) is an \"Origins Myth\"... rather than a direct adaptation of the famous Charlotte Perkins Gilman story. Drawing from the original short story and a number of Gilmans\' other gothic works (The Giant Wisteria, The Unwatched Door, etc.), The Yellow Wallpaper is an original narrative of events that unfold around the actual writing of \"The Yellow Wallpaper\" short story. After a devastating fire, Charlotte and John rent a countryside house and attempt to start life over, though Charlotte, upon seeing visions of her deceased daughter, retreats to the house\'s attic and pulls away from her husband and sister. Written by Max Visconti','/3yoyIUEpzr8UMoa8B9uWlbcSDNo.jpg','2011-11-10',115,'Released','Are we already dead?','The Yellow Wallpaper',102693,1.4337,4.5,'H7YLpnsymxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21372,_binary '\0','/oFINFcjQTihaZpYuVfg9msTW6rm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790799',6.7,3700,'en','$9.99','Have you ever wondered \"What is the meaning of life? Why do we exist?\" The answer to this vexing question is now within your reach! You\'ll find it in a small yet amazing booklet, which will explain, in easy to follow, simple terms your reason for being! The booklet, printed on the finest paper, contains illuminating, exquisite colour pictures, and could be yours for a mere $9.99.','/nX4pmuluKq4MqgrmgfIpOr8Orgo.jpg','2009-04-29',78,'Released','Joy. Sorrow. Desire. Love. Pain. Fear. Lust. Redemption. Want to know the Meaning of Life? It\'ll cost you only...','$9.99',19311,1.6563,5.893,'Ls4t_y6lTUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21373,_binary '\0','/bRCGGwV2tZXroKIsmNBjiMaWQIw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790804',4.3,12437,'en','The Comebacks','Out-of-luck coach Lambeau Fields takes a rag-tag bunch of college misfits and drives them towards the football championships. In the process, this life-long loser discovers that he is a winner after all by redeeming himself, saving his relationship with his family and friends, and finding that there is indeed, no \"I\" in \"team\"!','/eY9cDrjSIzsLeMpMRJ0b6dm4oDB.jpg','2007-10-19',107,'Released','Keep your eye on the ball.','The Comebacks',10759,3.6727,4.8,'SPquANwCfJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21374,_binary '\0','/5NwBbP8BQMSP8ehqy1aQe3ns2u2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0790816',4.4,2830,'en','Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud','During a bitter family feud, Jodie Hatfield, and her boyfriend Ricky McCoy, decide to leave town to avoid being found out, but are soon caught in the act. Wanting vengeance, he seeks out the monster Pumpkinhead, and resurrects it seek revenge on the family. Despite being warned away by the ghost of Ed Harley, his vengeance plan starts out, and the Hatfield family is soon under siege by the powerful demon. Not accepting the legend of the creature and believing their arch-rivals are the real cause, the two families attempt to go to war, only to be stopped when Pumpkinhead attacks the Hatfield house. Putting aside their differences, they band together to stave off the creature before it\'s vengeance pact is completed.','/beh3X6LZKd7kai0RaxqeiP5WHHy.jpg','2007-02-05',95,'Released','Vengeance will be his.','Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud',35979,2.0946,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21375,_binary '\0','/ldwWnaWoW8ziEFflimoraZouyvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0791188',6.3,6233,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO -ナルト- 大激突!幻の地底遺跡だってばよ','Naruto, Shikamaru, and Sakura are executing their mission of delivering a lost pet to a certain village. However, right in the midst of things, troops led by the mysterious knight, Temujin, attack them. In the violent battle, the three become separated. Temujin challenges Naruto to a fight and at the end of the fierce battle, both fall together from a high cliff...','/itKMldwL6uhUZYO3X78NOFU4zzO.jpg','2005-08-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Naruto the Movie: Legend of the Stone of Gelel',16910,5.3194,6.8,'4EiTuiYlvgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21376,_binary '\0','/oOzl6SnWieiYR7zwKHaoYDuciEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0791303',6,7010,'en','Genova','A man moves his two daughters to Italy after their mother dies in a car accident, in order to revitalize their lives. Genoa changes all three of them as the youngest daughter starts to see the ghost of her mother, while the older one discovers her sexuality.','/sxYarCXOudBzSyFbBBNt723R7q3.jpg','2009-04-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Genova',12408,1.6165,5.7,'dzFe-iz8jM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21377,_binary '\0','/kE3HQaJx9IuQCMIn3VVCXazXTea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0791304',5.9,29478,'en','Georgia Rule','Rebellious, uncontrollable teenager, Rachel is hauled off by her dysfunctional mother to spend the summer with her estranged grandmother, Georgia. Her journey will lead all three women to revelations of buried family secrets and an understanding that - regardless what happens - the ties that bind can never be broken.','/9C7VaTib40dBaBrefxFesQ7pbKW.jpg','2007-05-10',113,'Released','Mother. Daughter. Grandmother. In this family, attitude doesn\'t skip a generation.','Georgia Rule',13159,4.7729,5.965,'tdG7UdD0XtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21378,_binary '\0','/vQsFWT2uT9VQPxxNxF273e5r5xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0791309',5.4,7878,'en','I Want Candy','Two hopeful lads from Leatherhead trying to break into the movies stumble upon the opportunity of a lifetime. Frustrated by their arty film teacher, wannabe producer Joe and his talented but neurotic director friend Baggy head to London to sell what they know is a script made of gold.','/vRdZtvhy6tAhQx8DASW5BNYBoFy.jpg','2007-03-23',87,'Released','They\'re making a movie... And it\'s gone pear-shaped!','I Want Candy',13687,3.3398,5.1,'Pek3H1DyBEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21379,_binary '\0','/e3YKCD0LueC1grjBHEl0Sk92Zh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0792948',5.4,3610,'fr','Les Anges exterminateurs','A filmmaker holds a series of boundary-pushing auditions for his latest project: a thriller on the subject of female pleasure.','/oYx8T7LeALZcdGF0JhshWDZxeoH.jpg','2006-09-13',103,'Released',NULL,'The Exterminating Angels',19976,3.1184,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21380,_binary '\0','/2StTZG7zzlXRN7tY1LnoTqkFAJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0792965',6.7,13032,'fr','Ensemble, c\'est tout','When Camille falls ill, she is forced to live with Philibert and Franck.','/dNgTyFxp84SWeOkgdWeZDiXsADG.jpg','2007-03-21',97,'Released','Love might be closer than you think.','Hunting & Gathering',2882,3.4565,6.5,'tK1B-RUc9Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21381,_binary '\0','/a2ku60IXRzazfSbn8TDsQ3iAOCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0792966',7.5,5337,'fr','La Faute à Fidel!','A 9-year-old girl weathers big changes in her household as her parents become radical political activists in 1970-71 Paris.','/cMhgXisVDyoOGaXzFe0x1SAifF4.jpg','2006-11-29',99,'Released',NULL,'Blame It on Fidel!',17460,1.6245,7.1,'VyKB8OYL8nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21382,_binary '\0','/7MXBayedYNqrikpsZfVlyZrQXmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0792986',6.6,3339,'fr','Peur(s) du noir','Several scary black-and-white animated segments in different styles appeal to our fear(s) of the dark.','/9i48eXAo1fviuN6PBhkjl6HT7WS.jpg','2007-10-21',85,'Released',NULL,'Fear(s) of the Dark',16137,1.93,6.2,'CrAQdV622Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21383,_binary '\0','/gI00Sa5jUNRY4GCgwJ4qcGkHYPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0792992',6.3,1834,'fr','Tous à l\'ouest : Une aventure de Lucky Luke','The Daltons have escaped to New York, where their accumulated loot is hidden in the carts of Monsieur Pierre\'s group of honest, naive European immigrants, who naively bought land in California from Crook, who inserted a clause they must claim it within 80 days. Joe emotionally blackmails Luke to guide them there, hoping to escape on the way. The usual route must shortened from 6 to 2 months, so no danger can be avoided. Given Lucky\'s reputation, Crook decides to shadow them to add sabotage, just to be sure- or is it?','/6FXVZVTvHojnjCy2pNnyPYl2iVY.jpg','2007-07-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Go West: A Lucky Luke Adventure',34655,1.6894,6.2,'FjZIN-QSchg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21384,_binary '\0','/9LqKdr37SBSlNQxVVCvKNwl53Tc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0794338',6.8,2341,'ja','さくらん','Kiyoha rises from the lowly courtesan ranks to the high class position of Oiran in the steamy red-light district of Yoshiwara. She is determined to stand on her own two feet and live life as she pleased.','/3t4R6fVHSnHSOalxskq4f6i8OWa.jpg','2006-12-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Sakuran',20431,3.0428,6.5,'XgdNUUMiMP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21385,_binary '\0','/uRcTOiiSEsoHYgWGcvXgunZUH40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0794350',7.6,2000,'ja','それでもボクはやってない','A young man is falsely accused of molesting a high-school girl on a train. He is arrested and charged, and goes through endless court sessions, all the while insisting that he is innocent.','/8SWnHY5wBJioLuofYSBvnsYertg.jpg','2007-01-20',143,'Released',NULL,'I Just Didn\'t Do It',22449,3.3098,7.4,'PygE33pnQSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21386,_binary '\0','/p2ssbuL7NZSpBGIDjthP9S39d7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0794374',7.2,5108,'zh','颐和园','Yu Hong leaves her home village and starts university in Beijing, where she develops a consuming and compulsive relationship with another student. The student riots from 1989 then ensue and take a toll on their lives.','/kr0UdRRdjZigVfdYoik9kPy97hk.jpg','2006-05-18',135,'Released','Where did our love go…','Summer Palace',17422,6.8179,7.3,'D2frDPkiJmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21387,_binary '\0','/718OXoweHeTpiMA3NOnchI7Ylp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0794399',7.2,2993,'pl','Wszyscy jesteśmy Chrystusami','Adaś Miauczyński, a Polish intellectual, has severe alcohol problems which affect his relationship with his son Sylwek.','/a5nkwbcZ8a2i9rpjRUZcVDzYsJT.jpg','2006-04-21',105,'Released',NULL,'We\'re All Christs',36416,0.9117,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21388,_binary '\0','/1i1Jfc9e15uRM3fGp7Detsjsapw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795351',6.2,100296,'en','Case 39','In her many years as a social worker, Emily Jenkins believes she has seen it all, until she meets 10-year-old Lilith and the girl\'s cruel parents. Emily\'s worst fears are confirmed when the parents try to harm the child, and so Emily assumes custody of Lilith while she looks for a foster family. However, Emily soon finds that dark forces surround the seemingly innocent girl, and the more she tries to protect Lilith, the more horrors she encounters.','/b16EjFeHd2AwoYXWUne7DA346pU.jpg','2009-08-13',109,'Released','Some cases should never be opened.','Case 39',28355,9.4151,6.3,'oTXOxLI0kVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21389,_binary '\0','/gkE0BG8p3LjynsGU3RTvKGvTPdr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795361',4,3748,'en','Cougar Club','When Spence and Hogan graduate from college, life is bleak. They have to work for heinous divorce lawyers that torture them with gruesome jobs. Spence has a girlfriend from hell, and Hogan just wants to start his life. As luck would have it, these two young men are presented with an opportunity, and develop a club of young men devoted to older women, whom they call “Cougars.”','/rVgEeVZTbGz2RouAQUYU1URDz4F.jpg','2007-05-19',93,'Released','The hunt is on.','Cougar Club',14666,3.1947,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21390,_binary '\0','/lIXNL1uoEyuTLqaTAqtBYoc71WF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795368',7.3,129070,'en','Death at a Funeral','A myriad of outrageous calamities befalls an eccentric English clan with more than a few skeletons in its closets when the family\'s patriarch dies an unexpected death.','/xyTxrJnjbSJQzcbKIP6S1uqLuxy.jpg','2007-08-17',91,'Released','Last rites... and wrongs.','Death at a Funeral',2196,8.175,6.9,'SPbXMBZhFc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21391,_binary '\0','/tCqvD2AzIJ3vakoSTlwCfj9rS6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795370',5.7,1339,'fr','Le Deuxième Souffle','Gu, a famous gangster, has just escaped from jail. All french police is after him. Before leaving the country with Manouche, the woman he loves, Gu needs a final job to get some money. The job works, but a police\'s scheming makes Gu appear as a traitor to his own accomplices. Gu will do whatever it takes to clean his honor...','/auxgoI3jxk7S5ht0bq1wN135w9M.jpg','2007-10-24',155,'Released',NULL,'The Second Wind',59918,1.8334,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21392,_binary '\0','/luUZAWrsGnPBF9MzDAujMIdlZZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795376',6.2,4324,'en','Eating Out 2: Sloppy Seconds','How far would you go to get the person of your dreams? With the help of Gwen and Tiffani, Kyle pretends to be heterosexual in order to land Troy, the new guy (and nude model) who\'s turning the heads of both men and women. He soon finds himself joining the campus ex-gay support group and nabbing a girlfriend! Kyle\'s ex-boyfriend Marc is horrified at the plan and decides to pursue the confused Troy with his own tactic -- being his \"out\" gay self. Who will win Troy first?','/lcncbunLP4cz51SsPNjvKgEE8H0.jpg','2006-07-13',79,'Released','Are you ready for seconds?','Eating Out 2: Sloppy Seconds',17028,2.7469,6.1,'pJIauU-tURI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21393,_binary '\0','/afrihTfqFM1CE4dCvdSH0qTV6Rh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795403',5,1965,'en','The Initiation of Sarah','A sorority girl unwittingly becomes the focus of a battle between good and evil.','/gEKsxnAzllNBIL1OaI7NWnxqYdr.jpg','2006-10-22',96,'Released','Sisters. Sororities. Sacrifices.','The Initiation of Sarah',23691,2.1655,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21394,_binary '\0','/90sDsHugeRU5dtTG3zEVIOXXl4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795421',6.5,312128,'en','Mamma Mia!','A spirited young bride-to-be living with her single mother on a small Greek island secretly invites three of her mother\'s ex-boyfriends in hope of finding her biological father to walk her down the aisle.','/xYLiCWmAMHJubx5jNZ7HuXKjAbV.jpg','2008-07-03',108,'Released','A mother. A daughter. Three possible fathers. A trip down the aisle you\'ll never forget.','Mamma Mia!',11631,13.7329,6.959,'8RBNHdG35WY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21395,_binary '\0','/jg3S4v9wE348Sw4U4eSCpDb5zeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795434',7.1,24428,'hi','Namastey London','On a trip to India, Jasmeet\'s father forcefully marries her off to Arjun. However, when they return to London, Jasmeet announces her intention of marrying her boyfriend, Charlie Brown.','/dO0F66lM1jehIH5bsooKSbdz7xG.jpg','2007-03-23',131,'Released','A BRITISH BRAT MEETS A \'FUNJABI\' BOY.','Namastey London',20360,2.2937,6.2,'CnUqNCeBz84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21396,_binary '\0','/fEzQMQwJQQmESQuEXYdIyz0qySm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795438',6.1,3492,'en','Not Easily Broken','A car accident and shifting affections test the bond between a married couple.','/8gmdToawg8gaSe9yWZjQ10v7noL.jpg','2009-01-09',99,'Released','Life tries to break you. Love holds you together.','Not Easily Broken',14834,3.5132,6.3,'CRQdnPgZuH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21397,_binary '\0','/8qEykcDqSdG6LUKgDtsmBVmJVlg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795439',6.5,9097,'en','Numb','Hudson Milbank is a successful Hollywood screenwriter who suddenly and strangely finds himself without any emotional feelings. He tries doctor after doctor and shrink after shrink, but nothing works. The Golf Channel, lesbian exercise classes and a dizzying variety of pills get him through the day, but don\'t quite solve his problem. His writing partner tries everything to get him back to normal, but it\'s not until Hudson meets Sara that he finds a real motivation to get better and to actually start feeling again. From the writer of Deuce Bigalow, comes NUMB, a romantic comedy following an unusual man looking for strange love.','/tH8olC1mCnxqqby8xdNOiy15B1q.jpg','2007-04-30',93,'Released',NULL,'Numb',17106,2.9233,5.9,'-78EZfaxow0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21398,_binary '\0','/dotY8NsIZvhpCj9MZhK8LUADWdr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795441',7,14206,'nl','Oorlogswinter','During World War II in the freezing winter of 1944-45 the western Netherlands are in the grip of a famine. Many people move east to provide for their families. Fourteen year old Michiel can\'t wait to join the Dutch resistance, to the dismay of his father, who, as mayor, works to prevent escalations in the village.','/xwPAQjLoIqqAAGRZ5ke5j7OpKSH.jpg','2008-11-17',103,'Released','A country occupied... A child\'s innocence lost.','Winter in Wartime',16564,3.4417,6.665,'YrtnYwQXr6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21399,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795457',2.5,1355,'en','S.S. Doomtrooper','A genetically bred Nazi super soldier fights Allied troops.','/917SvDVaphDr53KIRMmjq0vuOoB.jpg','2006-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'S.S. Doomtrooper',71556,1.2147,5.3,'H1oYwIn877k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21400,_binary '\0','/2eW8VlLXjUq4OKk8SYf5KTr91Kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795461',3.6,87526,'en','Scary Movie 5','Home with their newly-formed family, happy parents Dan and Jody are haunted by sinister, paranormal activities. Determined to expel the insidious force, they install security cameras and discover their family is being stalked by an evil dead demon.','/vBqLLxE6GaAPhO6v9EFvFbLZ7Ap.jpg','2013-04-11',86,'Released','Evil is coming. Bring protection.','Scary Movie 5',4258,13.0267,4.8,'-2juYFzh7MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21401,_binary '\0','/5Xb2e63jvhJqL6IUO2SqtuRIJRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795493',6.6,55623,'en','Cassandra\'s Dream','The tale of two brothers with serious financial woes. When a third party proposes they turn to crime, things go bad and the two become enemies.','/rZLKa5mXJzfmJsC9DFNkcpZ5vS0.jpg','2007-10-31',108,'Released','Family is family. Blood is blood.','Cassandra\'s Dream',4787,4.1345,6.3,'tJ6nOkkuJtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21402,_binary '\0','/fQ94z5yMIlpHHS5GgnS8zK6oryd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0795505',5.1,2236,'en','Undead or Alive: A Zombedy','Elmer Winslow is a soldier on the run from the Union Army, and Luke Budd is a cowboy with a broken heart. When the two misfits rob the corrupt sheriff of an old west town, they have no idea that a plague of zombies is sweeping the country, or that Geronimo\'s sexy niece may be their only hope of survival.','/xH4WnW0QVOYIePdM1hmN9aiLV9j.jpg','2007-03-10',91,'Released','Guns don\'t kill people. Zombies kill people.','Undead or Alive: A Zombedy',25533,1.8415,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21403,_binary '\0','/znDXTRP0RL3G3Get8gyWvRqqgHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796212',7.2,10425,'cn','放‧逐','A friendship is formed between an ex-gangster, and two groups of hitmen - those who want to protect him and those who were sent to kill him.','/kIvGTEAtmhe46Zf55TCr6K8Pfxw.jpg','2006-10-19',108,'Released','Leaving it all behind...','Exiled',13807,2.981,7.2,'XfiLZ1WLV0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21404,_binary '\0','/hKHX04i2zQrgZJdxS9UuFsgPUd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796302',5.6,14051,'en','The Babysitters','Seventeen-year-old Shirley is a good student who works as a babysitter in order to make money for college. One night Michael, a father Shirley works for, confesses he\'s unhappy with married life. Shirley has a crush on Michael, and seizes this moment to kiss him. Michael is so happy he presents Shirley with a big tip, which gives her an idea. Shirley plans to make extra money by setting up her teenage friends with other unhappy fathers.','/nsrNUqGXI95unRKZEu8BJ584xWn.jpg','2008-05-09',88,'Released','These girls mean business.','The Babysitters',13078,7.269,6,'BBq9SXpWZDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21405,_binary '\0','/kWdffGZqFJgnk6FUKIadbIkJ0d7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796306',3.1,1481,'en','Bone Eater','Ancient Native American legend of the Bone Eater rises up and begins terrorizing the local townspeople','/lQPHTuJOJJp1QNeAu00yR3HlaJy.jpg','2008-02-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Bone Eater',58791,2.2236,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21406,_binary '\0','/zonIwzSHU4i8Mh1XG6w0JrPpLJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796307',7.3,8007,'es','La misma luna','Tells the parallel stories of nine-year-old Carlitos and his mother, Rosario. In the hopes of providing a better life for her son, Rosario works illegally in the U.S. while her mother cares for Carlitos back in Mexico.','/wx9DwdcgvLhoQJP3AOXpvMISgtM.jpg','2007-07-27',106,'Released','The love between a mother and a son knows no boundaries.','Under the Same Moon',32579,5.0455,7.953,'9jCZgUiPixE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21407,_binary '\0','/vnuUCpMswBNviOGbBq4QZ260Mai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796314',6.6,3871,'en','A Dog\'s Breakfast','If you\'ve never been good at anything in your life, why would murder be any different? Patrick has always had a somewhat combative relationship with his little sister Marilyn, but when she brings home her new sci-fi soap star fiancé Ryan, it\'s all out war. When Patrick fails to drive a wedge between the happy couple, he reaches for sharper instruments.','/w1Fgu2GxGTy4I5zQN3lkMNu4z6e.jpg','2007-03-03',88,'Released','Man\'s best friend makes the worst accomplice.','A Dog\'s Breakfast',18632,2.0177,6.3,'wmN6u8iYFlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21408,_binary '\0','/9t328N5MiH6QgCkeEswUi5WSA3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796335',7.1,6803,'fr','Molière','Molière, a down-and-out actor-cum-playwright up to his ears in debt. When the wealthy Jourdain offers to cover that debt so that Molière\'s theatrical talents might help Jourdain win the heart of a certain widowed marquise, hilarity ensues.','/3nfp9JCCzt1QlRhEzQfz5EkjLYn.jpg','2007-01-31',115,'Released',NULL,'Moliere',21494,2.0578,6.4,'NySWrKfEa4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21409,_binary '\0','/cqXEwYFcwyKPZCKl1jAPaG3cMsl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796366',7.9,641323,'en','Star Trek','The fate of the galaxy rests in the hands of bitter rivals. One, James Kirk, is a delinquent, thrill-seeking Iowa farm boy. The other, Spock, a Vulcan, was raised in a logic-based society that rejects all emotion. As fiery instinct clashes with calm reason, their unlikely but powerful partnership is the only thing capable of leading their crew through unimaginable danger, boldly going where no one has gone before. The human adventure has begun again.','/lV5OpzAss1z06YNagOVap1I35mH.jpg','2009-05-06',127,'Released','The future begins.','Star Trek',13475,16.9947,7.437,'iGAHnZ555nI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21410,_binary '\0','/7v7NGRbRcih7vItQluyjBOGQsz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796368',7.3,10738,'en','Talk to Me','The story of Washington D.C. radio personality Ralph \"Petey\" Greene, an ex-con who became a popular talk show host and community activist in the 1960s.','/pT5BkLuOXhUXB2W1mOhQFVj3yB5.jpg','2007-07-13',118,'Released',NULL,'Talk to Me',6535,2.0837,6.8,'WzvLkuJbTFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21411,_binary '\0','/8WXGl3bMf363K3CZhy1nVsuAEiB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0796375',6.4,19485,'en','You Kill Me','While drying out on the West Coast, an alcoholic hit man befriends a tart-tongued woman who might just come in handy when it\'s time for him to return to Buffalo and settle some old scores.','/4C5VQVdE2YRBPhpZLnExk1XUzDZ.jpg','2007-02-09',90,'Released','Professional alcoholic hit man gets life back on track thanks to her','You Kill Me',8141,4.5631,6.146,'lW-yEUdtdJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21412,_binary '\0','/5852tg85v9vs4dt0WnEB2mOMSAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0798796',8,2222,'tr','Tatar Ramazan Sürgünde','In the sequel to Tatar Ramazan, the events begin with Ramazan\'s arrival at the Adana closed prison. Abdurrahman Çavuş, who has established a feudal system in prison for years, and his right-hand man Akseli Bey have oppressed the prisoners. When Tatar Ramazan\'s reputation reaches the prison, the two worry that the cycle of robbery will come to an end. Their fears are justified. The oppressed prisoners, however, see Ramazan as their savior.','/aXE4MYFiNM0gH1EU4Lua4LwjyUD.jpg','1992-07-22',80,'Released',NULL,'Tatar Ramazan Sürgünde',350823,1.2653,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21413,_binary '\0','/hkUXAhF2oYDGiWeEVpCVQA8cE2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0798817',6,46271,'en','13','A naive young man assumes a dead man\'s identity and finds himself embroiled in an underground world of power, violence, and chance where men gamble behind closed doors on the lives of other men.','/eJAVjARKe3YBabnbhdbYWXD7Hdg.jpg','2010-03-12',91,'Released','Spin. Aim. Survive.','13',44982,5.2523,5.8,'Y41fFj-P4jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21414,_binary '\0','/oPrYqUSNfiJswLc5aWLxY7TrKun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0799915',7.1,1399,'en','Air Guitar Nation','If your bedroom has become too small a stage for your air guitar antics, take inspiration from the competitors featured here as they battle their way from the inaugural U.S. Air Guitar Championship to the world championship in Oulu, Finland. Along the way, filmmaker Alexandra Lipsitz documents the fierce rivalries that develop as would-be rock legends vie for top honors in technical accuracy, stage presence and \"airness.\"','/fVaEPdGlkotFhckwDDjHgZjLplm.jpg','2006-03-09',81,'Released',NULL,'Air Guitar Nation',13070,0.9326,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21415,_binary '\0','/nbmPpumlhuR8jcmW4buPQzliKU3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0799934',6.4,96814,'en','Be Kind Rewind','A man whose brain becomes magnetized unintentionally destroys every tape in his friend\'s video store. In order to satisfy the store\'s most loyal renter, an aging woman with signs of dementia, the two men set out to remake the lost films.','/f0oX20YrQEiVPDH9InCQ1d3Cm66.jpg','2008-02-21',102,'Released','You name it, we shoot it.','Be Kind Rewind',4953,5.2531,6.289,'Dko0wesoCRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21416,_binary '\0','/tXVpprSIir1fL1O1sAHeLIOxxuD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0799949',2.5,114381,'en','Epic Movie','When the Pevensie siblings each follow their own path, they find themselves at Willy\'s Chocolate Factory. Walking through a wardrobe, they discover the world of Gnarnia, ruled by the White Bitch. Meeting up with characters such as Harry Potter and Captain Jack Swallows, the newly reunited family must team up with Aslo, a wise-but-horny lion to stop the White Bitch\'s army.','/l0lGJiTzU2Ce6T31DIRWv7I0kaC.jpg','2007-01-25',85,'Released','We know it\'s big. We measured.','Epic Movie',9760,7.9932,3.9,'1ltiqNTYZbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21417,_binary '\0','/l1OU6OcIA8pMnrBbSXE2FdRAqkx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0799954',7.2,12905,'en','The Bridge','The Bridge is a controversial documentary that shows people jumping to their death from the Golden Gate Bridge in San Francisco - the world\'s most popular suicide destination. Interviews with the victims\' loved ones describe their lives and mental health.','/oAUA3oYIiDKwzKZoZuXEkHx6zG.jpg','2006-10-27',93,'Released','Be afraid of what lies beneath...','The Bridge',1666,2.8542,6.8,'07gup1pWsTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21418,_binary '\0','/p4qsVHxf7gtsxnqdBjID0ZxN9s1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0799991',7.1,3305,'ro','Cum mi-am petrecut sfârșitul lumii','Bucharest 1989 - the last year of Ceausecu\'s dictatorship. Eva lives with her parents and her 7 year old brother, Lalalilu. One day at school, Eva and her boyfriend accidentally break a bust of Ceausescu. They are forced to confess their crime before a disciplinary committee and Eva is expelled from school and transferred to a reformatory establishment. There she meets Andrei, and decides to escape Romania with him. Lalalilu becomes convinced that Ceausescu is the main reason for Eva\'s decision to leave. So with his friends from school he devises a plan to kill the dictator.','/gIjQQ7XR2CBB58XSmmYeH2G0fFg.jpg','2006-09-15',106,'Released',NULL,'The Way I Spent the End of the World',96010,1.7277,5.8,'FfoKkIYYKx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21419,_binary '\0','/m6a2m5fiw4SdOVRNwlWqzPCk9e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800003',3.7,11844,'en','Delta Farce','Three bumbling Army reservists are hustled onto a plane headed for combat in Iraq -- but the fact that the plane drops them in Mexico doesn\'t stop them from \"liberating\" what they believe to be the Middle East.','/8OkLfZGETr199O1hBV2iC95UBuB.jpg','2007-05-11',90,'Released','A funny thing happened on the way to Iraq.','Delta Farce',14547,4.275,4.626,'nKcttiLQCLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21420,_binary '\0','/gIlXBaTyjZLgTZBlMRkKr3SpDXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800022',6.7,4698,'fr','Electroma','Two robots embark on a quest to become human.','/m60OOcOVzniybIuVxzsMORMZNME.jpg','2006-05-21',72,'Released',NULL,'Electroma',13529,1.4853,6.763,'dERo02LTokc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21421,_binary '\0','/krC37EnKGPLTa1MMEVpi45wicDc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800027',6.5,17738,'en','Feast of Love','A meditation on love and its various incarnations, set within a community of friends in Oregon. It is described as an exploration of the magical, mysterious and sometimes painful incarnations of love.','/6Uyl94M1Yi8U0o6GddMRqAfa466.jpg','2007-09-28',101,'Released','A story for anyone with an appetite for love.','Feast of Love',14313,5.489,6.199,'kUSMZIgvARM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21422,_binary '\0','/s39aQY3dK1s6ARrUKP5yeq824nR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800039',7.1,322394,'en','Forgetting Sarah Marshall','When actress Sarah Marshall dumps aspiring musician Peter Bretter for rock star Aldous Snow, Peter\'s world comes crashing down. His best friend Brian suggests that Peter should get away from everything and to fly off to Hawaii to escape all his problems. After arriving in Hawaii and meeting the beautiful receptionist Rachel Jansen, Peter is shocked to see not only Aldous in Hawaii, but also Sarah.','/d4elOzyhNWVlxpG7BwigrumkFTe.jpg','2008-04-17',111,'Released','You lose some, you get some.','Forgetting Sarah Marshall',9870,7.6201,6.51,'FObBKrIDNyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21423,_binary '\0','/9V529yHwmYay2wmYo0YcgUijeJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800069',5.1,71912,'en','The Hills Have Eyes 2','A group of National Guard trainees on a routine mission find themselves up against cannibalistic mutants in the New Mexico desert.','/3SX2UGSmAjIZsVACpshPpKtjbDr.jpg','2007-03-22',89,'Released','There are fates worse than death.','The Hills Have Eyes 2',9793,9.3696,5.586,'Fy2t5N2WljM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21424,_binary '\0','/xfBnQ4mgf1jYZsscJGJjr6ce0Ar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800080',6.6,577513,'en','The Incredible Hulk','Scientist Bruce Banner scours the planet for an antidote to the unbridled force of rage within him: the Hulk. But when the military masterminds who dream of exploiting his powers force him back to civilization, he finds himself coming face to face with a new, deadly foe.','/gKzYx79y0AQTL4UAk1cBQJ3nvrm.jpg','2008-06-12',114,'Released','You\'ll like him when he\'s angry.','The Incredible Hulk',1724,30.1218,6.261,'dz6eBeW19Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21425,_binary '\0','/byGOLsnQrTzxjC5NofjwT6aa7S9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800095',7.1,6300,'en','Jesse Stone: Death in Paradise','When Jesse Stone looks into the murder of a teen-age girl whose body is found floating in a local lake, it brings him up against the Boston mob and into the affluent world of a bestselling writer who exploits troubled teens.','/zbRvYD01GzgwBqe5vHBFeoscuQA.jpg','2006-04-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Jesse Stone: Death in Paradise',30347,3.5255,6.9,'MWWrlkZRGn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21426,_binary '\0','/xOogAfICU29sbTWvY2KtEHGjjFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800099',7.5,4447,'en','Joe Strummer: The Future Is Unwritten','As the front man of the Clash from 1977 onwards, Joe Strummer changed people\'s lives forever. Four years after his death, his influence reaches out around the world, more strongly now than ever before. In \"The Future Is Unwritten\", from British film director Julien Temple, Joe Strummer is revealed not just as a legend or musician, but as a true communicator of our times. Drawing on both a shared punk history and the close personal friendship which developed over the last years of Joe\'s life, Julien Temple\'s film is a celebration of Joe Strummer - before, during and after the Clash.','/oWFvG5b7128EQvi06Hg4nm5Iw6b.jpg','2007-05-18',123,'Released',NULL,'Joe Strummer: The Future Is Unwritten',18893,2.1206,7.3,'sv102hoBDUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21427,_binary '\0','/1kOI7JVp3hALkzoh5xCktgc64Ib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800115',6.4,1530,'en','The Road to Christmas','High-powered fashion photographer Claire Jameson finds herself stranded in middle America on the way to her dream Christmas-time wedding in Aspen. Unable to get another flight or rent a car, Claire is reduced to begging for a ride. When the rugged former artist turned teacher, Tom Pullman and his 13-year old daughter Hilly kindly offer to take her, none of them realize that their journey is just beginning, and it will leave all of them in a very different place than where they began.','/rmZv73RLatQu78OCJmkSdF3nz0P.jpg','2006-12-17',88,'Released',NULL,'The Road to Christmas',51790,1.8149,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21428,_binary '\0','/8TjGIr1ACctKqDc8e1Uc5fzwgSn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800159',6.1,1392,'de','Pingpong','The film shows the apparently intact world of a middle class family, whose harmonious façade crumbles due to the unexpected visit of their relative Paul, a young man of 16 years. Paul arrives looking for love and support after the suicide of his father.','/xwRkRCySguUIAUOwmQOprmp7G5q.jpg','2006-11-16',89,'Released',NULL,'Pingpong',80136,2.4019,5.9,'8x3qVA48XmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21429,_binary '\0','/xSD0q1FiuZkvHuy7uscOLbmd1hR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800175',4.7,9835,'en','Red Sonja','A young girl rises from the ashes of tragedy to become the most feared warrior woman of all time: the She-Devil with a Sword.','/aE3yh4y0h96CZZpLo0UDFMWZAA9.jpg','2025-07-31',111,'Released','A hero will rise... An empire will fall.','Red Sonja',13494,8.1129,5.6,'-Oqql6RErHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21430,_binary '\0','/A68agruFq6vg5oYCMFyllmqMsI0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800240',6,42389,'en','Deception','As a corporate auditor who works in a number of different offices, Jonathan McQuarry wanders without an anchor among New York\'s power brokers. A chance meeting with charismatic lawyer Wyatt Bose leads to Jonathan\'s introduction to The List, an underground sex club. Jonathan begins an affair with a woman known only as S, who introduces Jonathan to a world of treachery and murder.','/lfkdTvfmaqlGiHymJl6EAdIaN1J.jpg','2008-04-24',107,'Released','When you\'re in this world, no one is who they seem, and everyone is playing the game.','Deception',13018,5.1229,5.963,'cz8LnuSOA3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21431,_binary '\0','/dpSrTZIWeI3u025LSUOjV9FHFvf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800241',6.6,56947,'en','TransSiberian','A TransSiberian train journey from China to Moscow becomes a thrilling chase of deception and murder when an American couple encounters a mysterious pair of fellow travelers.','/dhTOda5CLp9tEdDzQZiqBTdv5lR.jpg','2008-01-18',111,'Released','You can\'t escape your lies.','TransSiberian',6687,3.5765,6.4,'386HCnvhQ2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21432,_binary '\0','/Ge8qhLW6RaBRMcYgNcTNQYKyHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800268',4.2,2809,'en','Wieners','A road trip comedy about three friends who travel across the country in a Wiener Wagon to beat up a popular daytime talk show therapist.','/bEvjo0S31AproMQ0jA4EqpXj0RK.jpg','2008-06-03',89,'Released','Size does matter!','Wieners',17728,2.6323,4.3,'sWcaARhUXek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21433,_binary '\0','/dIy6yJ22rKoqxGXpCOHjZPfoCba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800308',6.7,68437,'en','Appaloosa','Two friends hired to police a small town that is suffering under the rule of a rancher find their job complicated by the arrival of a young widow.','/kQB0uxR3RDS2tGTZtBuFow9SF1T.jpg','2008-09-19',115,'Released','Feelings get you killed.','Appaloosa',12690,5.3374,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21434,_binary '\0','/98MW3zxRdBzlnyLpAQvMdY0pe6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800318',5.2,7690,'en','The Cheetah Girls 2','Best friends Galleria, Chanel, Dorinda, and Aqua, A.K.A. the girl band \"The Cheetahs,\" get the opportunity of a lifetime when they strut their way to Barcelona, Spain, to perform in an international music festival. Along the way, the \"amigas Cheetahs\" learn that, although their paths are not the same, they are lucky to have one another for the journey.','/cKLATvYcVUn6FfmgOU811TJgHWl.jpg','2006-07-31',96,'Released',NULL,'The Cheetah Girls 2',37609,4.0183,6.3,'VcXp7SSvFmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21435,_binary '\0','/zRx1HyM1wF6wqEvxV12Ha2WrvlJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800320',5.8,307736,'en','Clash of the Titans','Born of a god but raised as a man, Perseus is helpless to save his family from Hades, vengeful god of the underworld. With nothing to lose, Perseus volunteers to lead a dangerous mission to defeat Hades before he can seize power from Zeus and unleash hell on earth. Battling unholy demons and fearsome beasts, Perseus and his warriors will only survive if Perseus accepts his power as a god, defies fate and creates his own destiny.','/6iHYLipwEyZUPNO8MM3l1yHDaFE.jpg','2010-03-26',106,'Released','The clash begins.','Clash of the Titans',18823,13.4779,5.9,'TfyunOnMGqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21436,_binary '\0','/lFLwxSd9JReOBBxoUwQFBANcyIl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800325',7,61463,'en','The Dirt','The story of Mötley Crüe and their rise from the Sunset Strip club scene of the early 1980s to superstardom.','/xGY5rr8441ib0lT9mtHZn7e8Aay.jpg','2019-03-18',108,'Released','Their music made them famous. Their lives made them Infamous.','The Dirt',327331,4.6698,7.4,'-NOp5ROn1HE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21437,_binary '\0','/q9UiMyR8K6UsPOpL2tqNMrDHn5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800328',4.4,5464,'en','The Dukes of Hazzard: The Beginning','When mischievous teenaged cousins Bo and Luke Duke are arrested, both boys are paroled to the care of their Uncle Jesse in Hazzard, sentenced to a summer of hard work. It\'s not long before the Duke boys learn of Boss Hogg\'s plans to foreclose on Uncle Jesse\'s farm. Together, with help from their cousin Daisy, Bo and Luke vow to save the family\'s property and its storied history of producing the best moonshine in all of Hazzard.','/1kqpqfIhCvuPRqNuH0ox3T5MBHZ.jpg','2007-03-04',95,'Released','These are the Duke boys... from the beginning!','The Dukes of Hazzard: The Beginning',19580,4.4366,6.2,'6d0iwpQldpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21438,_binary '\0','/7mnzL4UupfwUs9HiuHBTUDlNPGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800341',6.9,1509,'ko','화려한 휴가','The citizens of Gwangju lead a relatively peaceful life, until one day the military takes over the city, accusing the residents of conspiracy and claiming that they are communist sympathisers preparing a revolution against the current government. Seeing as the soldiers beat defenceless people, mainly students, to death, the citizens are in for retaliation and form a militia.','/prfKmhgM3HiUSU1tfXvIw831iEA.jpg','2007-07-25',118,'Released','The day a nation\'s conscience died.','May 18',58069,1.911,6.9,'FxuwDDt8ON4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21439,_binary '\0','/nBWoGZH5pkybVNnFh7QA0nJAzGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800367',5.8,8545,'en','Storm Warning','A couple becomes lost in a massive storm and seek refuge at a nearby farmhouse, only to be captured by deranged killers.','/a52a97dlHjYWnNTzeJJohlPOSLG.jpg','2007-10-19',86,'Released','Survival Can Be Murder','Storm Warning',14459,2.2574,5.5,'ssSIBvwgcwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21440,_binary '\0','/cDJ61O1STtbWNBwefuqVrRe3d7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800369',7,984014,'en','Thor','Against his father Odin\'s will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth.','/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg','2011-04-21',115,'Released','Courage is immortal.','Thor',10195,29.4215,6.772,'JOddp-nlNvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21441,_binary '\0','/edWbaauLICPqYBz8aMpeRf7QFY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0800956',7.4,15334,'hi','Life in a Metro','A group of Mumbai up-and-comers search for love and struggle for success in this ensemble drama that centers on an eager young call centre executive.','/wWRFOMKftC33wv1GAJXaJdhXkEM.jpg','2007-05-11',132,'Released','One City. Countless Emotions.','Life in a Metro',20492,2.4944,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21442,_binary '\0','/7KPnd9oxvzrr968h2ODd0xnfFp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0801526',6,7800,'en','The Tracey Fragments','Tracey Berkowitz, 15, a self-described normal girl, loses her 9-year old brother, Sonny. In flashbacks and fragments, we meet her overbearing parents and the sweet, clueless Sonny. We watch Tracey navigate high school, friendless, picked on and teased. She develops a thing for Billy Zero, a new student, imagining he\'s her boyfriend. We see the day she loses Sonny and we watch her try to find him.','/9a99MNftmHNTLIYHfKXtGdAV6oF.jpg','2007-09-12',77,'Released','Something\'s Missing...','The Tracey Fragments',16725,1.5555,5.9,'v0jEN2_REy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21443,_binary '\0','/7Ww2p8mXVVOyj3RLKRg6GzeYIAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0802948',7.2,40241,'en','An American Crime','The true story of suburban housewife Gertrude Baniszewski, who kept a teenage girl locked in the basement of her Indiana home during the 1960s.','/de8angoHVE5GHcK0OO37D4pMkkJ.jpg','2007-07-27',97,'Released','The true story of a child\'s punishment that became a woman\'s crime.','An American Crime',13008,4.923,7.316,'Yn-RqhFl3Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21444,_binary '\0','/jfTL29RnWaVRqW3VEcAtXUGx53v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0802983',7.2,2295,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の恐竜2006','After bringing a fossilized egg back to life with the Time Cloth, Nobita finds himself the owner of a baby dinosaur. Everything is fine until it grows up. Nobita and friends use Doraemon\'s time machine to return it back to its own time.','/g0D94CrNm8bTCgHdpURTmR46s1Q.jpg','2006-03-04',107,'Released','Love and courage that transcend time and space.','Doraemon: Nobita\'s Dinosaur',70841,4.0603,7.385,'m1ScW_PgUzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21445,_binary '\0','/3WLHzUlF4xvQ6mQwjZFpZdFH6yt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803029',7.1,3081,'pt','Linha de Passe','In the periphery of São Paulo, the pregnant single mother Cleuza works as maid in the apartment of a middle-class family. Each of her sons has a different unknown father: the oldest, Dênis, has a baby son that lives with his mother and he works as motorcycle courier.','/xKx5msZOhp71R7w9LPudDfrFQsz.jpg','2008-09-05',108,'Released','Life is what you make of it.','Linha de Passe',8902,1.6871,6.7,'gl4vrUutD90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21446,_binary '\0','/aRW9w4ZLbUVDSUqRczGurTHOFjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803052',6.4,1221,'hu','Ópium: Egy elmebeteg nő naplója','A drug-addicted doctor who works in an asylum discovers that one of his patients is a gifted writer.','/4FNH0Eq5WMSy6Ivjh3PYwXGjPt.jpg','2007-03-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Opium: Diary of a Madwoman',20907,2.3533,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21447,_binary '\0','/79CbsN6xOoTRJtclYVhBNrMBWeY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803057',5.6,20821,'en','The Promotion','Two assistant managers of a corporate grocery store vie for a coveted promotion.','/eceGYZLpbyq9Fhqqlj3zGzbqp0i.jpg','2008-06-06',86,'Released','Two guys. One job. No rules.','The Promotion',13172,3.2033,5.3,'oppYLqzG4gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21448,_binary '\0','/jNGxNW6POZvxecTcfWhSmP1uU2m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803061',7.3,21178,'en','Red Dog','The legendary true story of the Red Dog who united a disparate local community while roaming the Australian outback in search of his long lost master.','/cbLh0tVqjqcDnob7w79XkIQ7gGI.jpg','2011-08-04',92,'Released','He\'s Been Everywhere Mate.','Red Dog',66125,4.2437,7.3,'GTExiWzvJlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21449,_binary '\0','/aTGvZ3F8QnAD8cPpJRaaqRRxFK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803096',6.7,298110,'en','Warcraft','The peaceful realm of Azeroth stands on the brink of war as its civilization faces a fearsome race of invaders: orc warriors fleeing their dying home to colonize another. As a portal opens to connect the two worlds, one army faces destruction and the other faces extinction. From opposing sides, two heroes are set on a collision course that will decide the fate of their family, their people, and their home.','/eGi5aoxaZveqNLtE7BZJCuWwR3G.jpg','2016-05-25',123,'Released','Two worlds. One home.','Warcraft',68735,17.3629,6.418,'2Rxoz13Bthc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21450,_binary '\0','/3n0MwFSjTZNYnHgtSrDmvxBS2Zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0803100',6.2,1998,'de','Vorstadtkrokodile','Ten-year-old Hannes, growing up with his young, poor and single mother wants to join the coolest gang in the area, the Vorstadtkrokodile. When the ‘entry test’ goes wrong, Hannes’s life is saved by Kai, who is desperate to join too but is wheelchair bound and unable to even run away when things get hot. Hannes would accept Kai but the other gang members don’t seem happy to accept a handicapped member...','/fZJIGpVj1j3oeSfwT7S3eYomroX.jpg','2009-03-26',98,'Released',NULL,'The Crocodiles',12137,2.6147,7.2,'8MIQvB-xDSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21451,_binary '\0','/zDAUVVuLFnjzBd1WKzWPuWxrDEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804443',4.1,4298,'en','Asylum','The teenager Madison McBride is traumatized by the loss of her deranged father when she was nine years old and the suicide of her beloved brother Brandon one year ago. She decides to join the Richard Miller University, where Brandon committed suicide, to overcome her demons. While walking to her dorm, she meets the weird janitor Wilbur Mackey that tells her that the place is haunted.','/7BqosTy8fBZxoo06vuCAnRKwXUs.jpg','2008-03-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Asylum',19116,2.4772,4.1,'FehgW7anqMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21452,_binary '\0','/A1CCx5tX8owG0CMQH0fvMHpkk6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804452',3.2,21157,'en','Bratz','The popular Bratz dolls come to life in their first live-action feature film. Finding themselves being pulled further and further apart, the fashionable four band together to fight peer pressure, learn what it means to stand up for your friends, be true to oneself and live out your dreams.','/nkhA8Crs7K0JHIZgSdvBeBe2QF2.jpg','2007-08-03',102,'Released','High school is about to get a make-over.','Bratz',14123,3.7377,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21453,_binary '\0','/tlPAcPTRJmHgULtUVIasQWQQiVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804461',6.7,78300,'en','Death Sentence','Nick Hume is a mild-mannered executive with a perfect life, until one gruesome night he witnesses something that changes him forever. Transformed by grief, Hume eventually comes to the disturbing conclusion that no length is too great when protecting his family.','/3rdEAMh4a3pc7GO6fSkJwpt7BWX.jpg','2007-08-31',105,'Released','Protect what\'s yours.','Death Sentence',11835,6.9473,6.8,'NZuJuuZabx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21454,_binary '\0','/yQmfDrOejqxem5DG2CRqo7ex9ig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804463',6.1,25855,'en','Devil\'s Knot','The savage murders of three young children sparks a controversial trial of three teenagers accused of killing the kids as part of a satanic ritual.','/8DMDx7XMylIL7lpBEOMzIjuwhw0.jpg','2013-05-09',114,'Released','They say the crimes were satanic. The truth may be scarier.','Devil\'s Knot',152792,5.8018,6.2,'5somY6jf5ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21455,_binary '\0','/jsJRZe8iiDPE50Jz91TncaX9FWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804492',2,38527,'en','The Hottie & The Nottie','Nate moves to L.A. to track down Cristabel, the woman he\'s been in love with since childhood, only to discover that his plan to woo her only has one hurdle to overcome: what to do with June, Cristabel\'s ever-present, not-so-hot best friend? What\'s even more complicating is Nate\'s growing feelings for June, whose true beauty starts to emerge.','/jnYubDjKUAMAxvYE2IveCJkDuuC.jpg','2008-02-08',91,'Released','Love never needed to be so blind.','The Hottie & The Nottie',63315,3.6219,2.8,'BH-P8J8tDTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21456,_binary '\0','/l7gkk5K0NnVSqZ0Qr4zkNskH9AC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804497',7.1,152376,'en','It\'s Kind of a Funny Story','A clinically depressed teenager gets a new start after he checks himself into an adult psychiatric ward.','/hQE4q8Szeaae4davgB7o8MTLmwr.jpg','2010-10-08',102,'Released','Sometimes what\'s in your head isn\'t as crazy as you think.','It\'s Kind of a Funny Story',43923,6.3736,6.943,'0dSk92CbuFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21457,_binary '\0','/fvIj8fo9j6DifyMWopHevGVhFUQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804505',6.2,10283,'en','Married Life','A very gentle middle-aged man is married, but when he falls in love with another woman, he decides that to divorce his wife would humiliate her too much – so instead he decides to kill her.','/AdJKmRh3AKX5CVCdwdw1dNTqEJ8.jpg','2008-03-28',90,'Released','Do you know what really goes on in the mind of the person with whom you sleep?','Married Life',8060,3.0234,5.76,'qZuwODsFRC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21458,_binary '\0','/tEJf6vcobkTzIk2cRJYvLKeUuLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804507',5,12014,'it','La terza madre','An ancient urn is found in a cemetery outside Rome. Once opened, it triggers a series of violent incidents: robberies, rapes and murders increase dramatically, while several mysterious, evil-looking young women coming from all over the world are gathering in the city. All these events are caused by the return of Mater Lacrimarum, the last of three powerful witches who have been spreading terror and death for centuries. Alone against an army of psychos and demons, Sarah Mandy, an art student who seems to have supernatural abilities of her own, is the only person left to prevent the Mother of Tears from destroying Rome.','/6ewz6PCWBzKZnQBbG4wODnjwvDm.jpg','2007-10-31',102,'Released','What you see does not exist. What you cannot see is truth.','The Mother of Tears',15206,1.6665,4.6,'J4aiF2GF7rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21459,_binary '\0','/8eB5fvJ5ArGDtqrxmjCvSYV2ZSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804513',7.3,1563,'ja','虹の女神 Rainbow Song','Tomoya Kishida is working as a staffer in a television studio when he hears about the death of his close friend, Aoi Sato. This sparks his recollection of the events in life they shared from meeting at a record store, shooting a short film as part of their university film club, to saying their last goodbyes. Though in love with each other, neither had the courage to confess their feelings before it was too late.','/ekEECcNnVXZ49S0My8sftEn9pD6.jpg','2006-10-28',117,'Released','so close, yet so distanced.','Rainbow Song',45349,1.8008,7.5,'TTDJdpD0VcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21460,_binary '\0','/aYMvNOHPozMqpRu76EmzCH0PksC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804516',5.9,39492,'en','P2','A businesswoman finds herself locked with a unhinged security guard in a parking garage after getting stuck working late on Christmas Eve.','/3mTtQSKoFNyvhbcqBUJl8tPRqMz.jpg','2007-11-09',98,'Released','A new level of terror.','P2',13474,5.3882,6.2,'cYEgrQ8kdmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21461,_binary '\0','/hVgbeqLYbbrT23pryiR0Oz009CM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804522',6.8,60099,'en','Rendition','When an Egyptian terrorism suspect \"disappears\" on a flight from Africa to Washington DC, his American wife and a CIA analyst find themselves caught up in a struggle to secure his release from a secret detention facility somewhere outside the US.','/uW8gNhIJkNabd0AIafWqFRxB8Os.jpg','2007-09-07',120,'Released','What if someone you love... just disappeared?','Rendition',5125,5.2945,6.421,'GGE35fYuV1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21462,_binary '\0','/kfBhgDnMzo050dJJq1NqDwWmAzf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804529',6,6832,'en','Sleep Dealer','Set in a near-future, militarized world marked by closed borders, virtual labor and a global digital network that joins minds and experiences, three strangers risk their lives to connect with each other and break the barriers of technology.','/kFXQ4oMJkXAWjyo7Tr5GrLjmk61.jpg','2008-12-10',89,'Released','Crossing the border just got easier. Plug into the new American dream.','Sleep Dealer',20764,2.1317,5.899,'xW8oSRSzS7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21463,_binary '\0','/xaqRnNe81o1vJGg75Im16pfbEZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804540',5.6,33516,'fr','Taxi 4','Before being extradited to Africa to stand trial, a notorious Belgian criminal is entrusted to the Marseilles police department for less than 24 hours. But the wily crook convinces bumbling policeman Emilien he\'s a lowly Belgian embassy employee who got railroaded by the brilliant master criminal.','/zqjMGQzdMohCL66uCqbyvWBP896.jpg','2007-02-10',91,'Released',NULL,'Taxi 4',2335,5.0678,5.614,'i9KDTzVN2jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21464,_binary '\0','/6oJiTcSBra0w1DDonE9kn4zw9cN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0804552',5.7,9890,'en','WΔZ','There is something horribly wrong with the bodies found in the dark city streets. Some are mutilated while others have the Price equation (wΔz = Cov (w,z) = βwzVz) carved into their flesh. Detective Eddie Argo and his new partner Helen Westcott unearth the meaning of the odd equation and realise each victim is being offered a gruesome choice: kill your loved ones, or be killed. Before long it becomes clear that the perpetrator has suffered a similar fate and is now coping by seeking a way to solve this philosophical dilemma.','/bf11TuyZCWUnSDaGxsmq4jBrmwx.jpg','2007-05-19',104,'Released','Would you kill the one you love to save yourself from death?','WΔZ',15069,2.5456,5.6,'ibjhBxn2s1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21465,_binary '\0','/73DMYsmzV0MbdVn4CIVITw7keDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805184',6.8,18049,'hi','Bhagam Bhag','After their lead actress quits their drama troupe; Bunty, Babla and their boss Champak search for a new heroine in London where they have just arrived, and get embroiled in a murder case involving a mysterious woman.','/wJqdwEgMiMzU0zIEnKBWEbTfeUS.jpg','2006-12-22',157,'Released',NULL,'Bhagam Bhag',41188,1.8987,6.5,'ihCaohTJYCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21466,_binary '\0','/z1LIEQXHFnWdLF0NTKmr7u9NsNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805185',3.5,1676,'de','Blood Trails','The biker Anne has a violent one night stand with the supposed cop Chris after a minor infraction. Two days later, feeling guilty and traumatized, she decides to go hiking with her boyfriend Michael in the Whistler chain of mountains, a spot where bicycles are prohibited. When she sees Chris riding a bike, she tells Michael about her affair, and Chris unexpectedly kills Michael. Along the rest of the day and night, Anne is chased by Chris in a sick and mortal mouse-and-cat game.','/5q7ZuKYvHE7Xl59PV9Kt154Mx96.jpg','2006-04-20',87,'Released','\"You can\'t outride death.\"','Blood Trails',25395,1.1871,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21467,_binary '\0','/xONxtVdecfe5wE3XdIZxAufeycH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805188',7.8,2126,'ro','Marilena de la P7','Andrei, a 13 year old teenager, living on Bucharest outskirts, decides one day to steal a trolleybus in order to impress Marilena, a prostitute he fell in love with.','/3UQnjmVC4poRnszfgkSc4Cb58tL.jpg','2006-02-15',45,'Released',NULL,'Marilena from P7',34064,1.6305,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21468,_binary '\0','/hZoXUcBN0CgD7s1QgmO7OZSHzBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805526',6.5,19419,'en','Facing the Giants','A losing coach with an underdog football team faces their giants of fear and failure on and off the field to surprising results.','/1eY8O7fIGcmwetNqvwnnkQB0LYK.jpg','2006-09-29',111,'Released','Never give up. Never back down. Never lose faith.','Facing the Giants',18925,4.3923,7.6,'ma_h5uycCz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21469,_binary '\0','/uFZuaesH3fb3GYqQslLbKLA9Qjq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805540',8.1,2662,'ja','はじめの一歩 -Champion Road-','Makunouchi Ippo is the new Featherweight champion of Japan and is now ready for his first title defense. His opponent, the former Jr. Featherweight champion and a medical student, Sanada Kazuki. In addition to this feud, Sanada is being coached by Kamogawa\'s former rival, Hama Dankichi. What makes things worse is that Sanada works at the same hospital where Kumi is a nurse at and everybody at the hospital wants Sanada to win. Not only does Ippo have to defend his title, he has to reclaim his love.','/8OEX6C9h85Hg7rtsCBKIwyrpoRh.jpg','2003-06-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Fighting Spirit: Champion Road',45287,3.1053,6.9,'Bl9edsWHfvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21470,_binary '\0','/hWa0pFOHTnNMl5kxHTFtltF8Yhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805559',5.5,9414,'en','Jump In!','A young boxer, Izzy Daniels, trains to follow in his father\'s footsteps by winning the Golden Glove. But when his friend, Mary asks him to substitute for a team member in a Double Dutch tournament, the young man discovers a hidden passion for jump roping, all while finding love with Mary and navigating conflict with himself and his father about boxing.','/bC15nPOGIOXohhqzC2GTg0DlqIy.jpg','2007-01-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Jump In!',13968,2.8773,6.4,'kFtKUzFVg-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21471,_binary '\0','/2KeicelocjfYzViherowQn69moR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805564',7.3,170814,'en','Lars and the Real Girl','Extremely shy Lars finds it impossible to make friends or socialize. His brother and sister-in-law worry about him, so when he announces that he has a girlfriend he met on the Internet, they are overjoyed. But Lars\' new lady is a life-size plastic woman. On the advice of a doctor, his family and the rest of the community go along with his delusion.','/nkAt4a7KIPc7Fi1BhxNHhYYbe2b.jpg','2007-10-12',107,'Released','The search for true love begins outside the box.','Lars and the Real Girl',6615,7.1743,7.2,'tVWXhZz5SAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21472,_binary '\0','/tcV7eCdGFN3RzB2ByWRrH5Xf7cU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805570',6,76095,'en','The Midnight Meat Train','A photographer\'s obsessive pursuit of dark subject matter leads him into the path of a serial killer who stalks late night commuters, ultimately butchering them in the most gruesome ways.','/x5YbfyUA8huK0shr008xwzNVJ5Y.jpg','2008-08-07',103,'Released','The most terrifying ride you\'ll ever take','The Midnight Meat Train',10185,7.3508,6.2,'wtUiRfMy_uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21473,_binary '\0','/fQevReZg4KnLytqwby2qmapbPq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805576',6.8,5773,'is','Mýrin','A murder opens up a bleak trail of long buried secrets and small town corruption for a worn out police detective and his squad.','/eY5Iq6oxvPKPX4a1Na2oBzQbqTL.jpg','2006-10-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Jar City',16170,1.6416,5.9,'DSdkE6CX9n4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21474,_binary '\0','/3tbyb1ZZAoFl7TiufWX15hQBYTs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805605',7,1704,'ja','聖闘士星矢 天界編 序奏 ~overture~','After the bloody battle against Hades, the goddess Athena and her saints are still recovering when they find themselves face to face with their newest and most formidable foe: the dreadful moon goddess Artemis. Artemis replaces Athena as the earth guardian deity and takes over the Sanctuary, turning Athena\'s Saints into her servants. Upon invading the Sanctuary, the Bronze Saints learn that Athena was banished by Artemis and decide to fight the moon goddess in order to rescue their true goddess and free the Earth from Artemis\'s ominous control.','/w1id1iEKogRjmMffAM01ZcWwBLR.jpg','2004-02-14',83,'Released',NULL,'Saint Seiya Heaven Chapter: Overture',50253,4.4699,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21475,_binary '\0','/24PjzHMBESqwnOcxItPKiJmDosa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805613',7.2,1364,'de','Shoppen','An almost bombproof method of staying single is called \"speed dating\". 18 people participate in such an event. Nine men and nine women are sitting opposite each other in order to sell optimally under the pressure of time and to find a partner. They are looking for a date - and have nothing else in common. They talk about allergies, cappuccino, consumer behavior, buses and designer clothes: the list of serious embarrassments is long. Yet none of the lonely hearts has given up the hope of romance.','/gDyQPCMTMov5DKzOuTXdoZxV4Sw.jpg','2007-05-02',91,'Released',NULL,'Shoppen',1736,0.7297,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21476,_binary '\0','/uQHHqiPMaHWN5YNTaV7G3SxZB3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805619',4.5,2638,'en','Stir of Echoes: The Homecoming','A soldier returns home from the Iraq war only to be haunted by visions of the dead.','/cHfi643JkyJe647vtLE8SSZICI9.jpg','2007-08-11',89,'Released','This time, the door cannot be locked.','Stir of Echoes: The Homecoming',34734,2.5308,4.9,'xJJt1QlBvls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21477,_binary '\0','/4lWr2j3ZSEe8qlt3W3ma8TiiMQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0805647',5.4,52807,'en','Roald Dahl\'s The Witches','In late 1967, a young orphaned boy goes to live with his loving grandma in the rural Alabama town of Demopolis. As the boy and his grandmother encounter some deceptively glamorous but thoroughly diabolical witches, she wisely whisks him away to a seaside resort. Regrettably, they arrive at precisely the same time that the world\'s Grand High Witch has gathered.','/betExZlgK0l7CZ9CsCBVcwO1OjL.jpg','2020-10-26',104,'Released','Witches are real!','Roald Dahl\'s The Witches',531219,12.8804,6.34,'9nlhmJF5FNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21478,_binary '\0','/ryBUkjVLKjSJOTgBfxHrdu7rxG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806027',5.3,15624,'en','Blood: The Last Vampire','On the surface, Saya is a stunning 16-year-old, but that youthful exterior hides the tormented soul of a 400-year-old \"halfling\". Born to a human father and a vampire mother, she has for centuries been a loner obsessed with using her samurai skills to rid the world of vampires, all the while knowing that she herself can survive only on blood like those she hunts.','/uzuYpbdFkNYqnBdOvhWqZxhHa5C.jpg','2009-04-02',91,'Released','Where evil grows, she preys.','Blood: The Last Vampire',1450,5.6789,5.9,'Z0-k5PmGryE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21479,_binary '\0','/fTU3MD5wYR774CvVftKYKDrYQEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806029',6.9,7223,'fr','L\'Affaire Farewell','An intricate thriller about an ordinary man thrust into the biggest theft of Soviet information of the Cold War. Right after the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan. A French businessman based in Moscow, Pierre Froment, makes an unlikely connection with Grigoriev, a senior KGB officer disenchanted with what the Communist ideal has become under Brezhnev. Grigoriev begins passing Froment highly sensitive information about the Soviet spy network in the US.','/uNTJBINBZH9jk0R5OnyUDg9haSD.jpg','2009-09-23',113,'Released','Some secrets have the power to change the course of history.','Farewell',33996,2.2865,6.5,'R8MHdj86Ye8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21480,_binary '\0','/ajlctX9dRbHbsNIdI5gRNz5DRCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806088',6.1,18029,'hi','हे बेबी','Three womanisers find a baby left at their doorstep. Chaos ensues as they try to contact their former girlfriends to determine who is the father amongst them.','/9XxhqihX1kcZXcvJ48aQlPYHPQo.jpg','2007-08-24',150,'Released',NULL,'Heyy Babyy',4157,2.0094,5.9,'4AF-IQAMmnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21481,_binary '\0','/fPdENfgMlDHLOVs0YxkPZkS2m7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806147',3.7,12066,'en','Extreme Movie','A sketch comedy movie about the joys and embarrassments of teen sex. But mostly the embarrassments.','/3N5XjwUITJo5MFhvWCJHVJt8pAg.jpg','2008-12-05',86,'Released','A film with many happy endings...','Extreme Movie',15544,5.093,4.3,'2JAcu5SORog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21482,_binary '\0','/21mAnWSUYLAIJpmqUd1QgzblpcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806165',6.3,12247,'en','The Ramen Girl','An American woman is stranded in Tokyo after breaking up with her boyfriend. Searching for direction in life, she trains to be a ramen chef under a tyrannical Japanese master.','/sK7hW0quKwlYxP2urLirsDFPabD.jpg','2008-02-08',102,'Released','Her romance is on pins and noodles.','The Ramen Girl',18585,5.4487,6.546,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21483,_binary '\0','/uYxAGovHS4mCGsIeSZCTtwOQ5Po.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806203',5.9,53710,'en','Carriers','A deadly virus has spread across the globe. Contagion is everywhere, no one is safe, and no one can be trusted. Four friends race through the back roads of the American West on their way to a secluded utopian beach in the Gulf of Mexico where they could peacefully wait out the pandemic. Their plans take a grim turn when their car breaks down on an isolated road starting a chain of events that will seal their fates.','/jxjnjHtHXgvjdhkwpelE9ZwVMg6.jpg','2009-09-04',84,'Released','The rules are simple. You break them, you die...','Carriers',25769,4.9512,6,'IwH4bxNK8Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21484,_binary '\0','/4GeaiLZkVtCDMoPHPsDEXVQSGjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806686',6.7,4650,'de','Yella','A young East German woman leaves her controlling husband/business partner and relocates to a West German city to start anew as an accountant, but he soon catches up with her.','/axC6pBrFc7Y2I6pFzvvte9uRf9x.jpg','2007-09-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Yella',3037,1.1158,6.2,'vVsoJTXozrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21485,_binary '\0','/v4EprJwkvDEAg6LloIIgQA7OTcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0806940',5.3,2399,'es','Niñas Mal','Defiant 18-year-old Adela León pushes her father and an unbending headmistress to the limit in this delicious comedy.','/1tnxyJ18qmSfafLOpS3cRXVsAym.jpg','2007-03-09',102,'Released','Good girls go to heaven. Bad girls go wherever they want.','Charm School',20223,2.4821,7,'fElQDhzh95c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21486,_binary '\0','/dY32etkQkznV4vSgtoODOL6i0iV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807028',4.6,2774,'en','The Pool Boys','A pool boy and a gardener turn an empty mansion into a home for women who belong to the world\'s oldest profession.','/ewmXUCT61YxIj2xICKCX4YZJJdF.jpg','2009-09-30',84,'Released',NULL,'The Pool Boys',31880,2.1448,5.8,'BE3azQxdxeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21487,_binary '\0','/vCRAkSIr04Kju0a79PhshY8ZEh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807054',7,6593,'en','It\'s a Free World...','Working-class Angie, sacked from a recruitment agency for bad public behaviour, teams up with her flatmate to run a similar business from their kitchen. With immigrants desperate for work, the opportunities are considerable, particularly for two girls so in tune with these times.','/mf21jW15cjoe95yIW1DvlYUN4YO.jpg','2007-09-28',96,'Released',NULL,'It\'s a Free World...',7992,2.9026,6.6,'fFOfjb_y9Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21488,_binary '\0','/9CqboaMPLvZ4u9qufERalkby9Ny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807716',5.8,2165,'no','Lange flate ballær','Six guys from Norway go on a trip to Germany to cheer on Norway in the world Championship of football. But it isn\'t easy to put their normal life aside, not even for football.','/300TGpRbNSujb6jINnrKf7Bhr1l.jpg','2006-03-31',97,'Released',NULL,'Long Flat Balls',39501,1.3648,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21489,_binary '\0','/jKk80Ma0EOB3PmV0dd3OpUwFkaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807721',7,2814,'he','מדוזות','Meduzot (the Hebrew word for Jellyfish) tells the story of three very different Israeli women living in Tel Aviv whose intersecting stories weave an unlikely portrait of modern Israeli life. Batya, a catering waitress, takes in a young child apparently abandoned at a local beach. Batya is one of the servers at the wedding reception of Keren, a young bride who breaks her leg in trying to escape from a locked toilet stall, which ruins her chance at a romantic honeymoon in the Caribbean. One of the guests is Joy, a Philippine chore woman attending the event with her employer, and who doesn\'t speak any Hebrew (she communicates mainly in English), and who is guilt-ridden after having left her young son behind in the Philippines.','/hTCagyFazmGez993bLX9XgG3GiP.jpg','2007-06-28',82,'Released','Life Stings','Jellyfish',6391,1.2144,7,'auYqkwrnOho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21490,_binary '\0','/zhPceqLVVkgkgJG1rL0yctGx5wD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807758',5.9,15286,'hi','Partner','Prem, a love guru who shares tips on dating women, helps his client, Bhaskar, woo his boss. Things get complicated when he falls for a single mother and tries to hide his profession.','/5KFGl7Do8Zna8oQ4OG0x5jHnj9j.jpg','2007-07-20',143,'Released','Do You Wanna Partner?','Partner',27298,1.5738,5.6,'bu3MxE-Nj7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21491,_binary '\0','/mF52lhsQMXQmZIId6CqQo2FJfux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807943',7.3,4842,'te','ఢీ','Babloo (Vishnu) likes to have fun and is always getting in trouble so his father (Chandramohan) gets him a job with Shanker Goud (Srihari). Shanker Goud and Bhallu are rivals and Bhallu is determined to kill Shanker Goud\'s sister Pooja (Genelia D\'Souza). Babloo falls in love with Pooja but Shanker is planning an arranged marriage for her with Ajay (Akash) so Babloo and Pooja elope. The rest of the story is about how Babloo saves Pooja from Bhallu.','/pi39lj9U806VIj6EHUScSTpjGLt.jpg','2007-04-13',143,'Released','Kotti Choodu','Dhee',38628,1.2678,6.813,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21492,_binary '\0','/sNVbwtmuKfs3FMrq0eKdZrPeLas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807944',7.1,3176,'ta','தீனா','A local gangster and his adopted brother rule over a town together. However, their relationship turns sour after the man\'s sister dies due to the gangster\'s mistake.','/mL8HvuTOo4SNGkUOjUVATqP4HB4.jpg','2001-01-14',157,'Released',NULL,'Dheena',69401,1.252,5.729,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21493,_binary '\0','/rAgTpVdm8HAjeh5KuaHM1xChDFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0807956',8.1,2687,'en','Occupation 101: Voices of the Silenced Majority','A thought-provoking documentary on the current and historical causes of the Israeli-Palestinian conflict and U.S. political involvement.','/3aBwQwNrUOKaRdw1IdXaFz31vyF.jpg','2006-03-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Occupation 101: Voices of the Silenced Majority',18152,0.6135,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21494,_binary '\0','/olz8Xw3yOLpBAHKgPoSRwmomdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808151',6.7,328508,'en','Angels & Demons','Harvard symbologist Robert Langdon is recruited by the Vatican to investigate the apparent return of the Illuminati – a secret, underground organization – after four cardinals are kidnapped on the night of the papal conclave.','/tFZQAuulEOtFTp0gHbVdEXwGrYe.jpg','2009-04-20',139,'Released','The holiest event of our time. Perfect for their return.','Angels & Demons',13448,18.8563,6.729,'arb2-aZMDFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21495,_binary '\0','/4oNqLwhCrABbf9L78YE3y5WIqrY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808185',7.2,19230,'no','Den brysomme mannen','Forty-year-old Andreas arrives in a strange city with no memory of how he got there. He is presented with a job, an apartment - even a wife. But before long, Andreas notices that something is wrong. Andreas makes an attempt to escape the city, but he discovers there\'s no way out. Andreas meets Hugo, who has found a crack in a wall in his cellar. Beautiful music streams out from the crack. Maybe it leads to \"the other side\"? A new plan for escape is hatched.','/mHDeIKvmWYLyXwqXzN4F7Q2CHRT.jpg','2006-05-26',95,'Released',NULL,'The Bothersome Man',13318,2.2796,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21496,_binary '\0','/wEiCnOy1r2ca610ZTEykToeP06G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808230',5.6,1589,'fr','Les Deux Mondes','A French tradesman travels in time and liberates an oppressed tribe in another world.','/tg56a1u0pmjDVIt8cUMTxUo0Gme.jpg','2007-11-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Two Worlds',14791,2.5067,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21497,_binary '\0','/oDq3CrLiwWCdKWHSNLvdMnWx9cm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808232',6,4159,'en','A Dog Year','Jon Katz is close to burnout. He\'s a writer with writer\'s block; his wife has left for her sister\'s because he\'s emotionally distant; he rarely answers his phone. A kennel sends him a border collie that\'s undisciplined because of abuse. Despite a series of mishaps, Jon decides to keep trying with the dog, and he rents a dilapidated farm house to give the dog room to run. A local handyman refers Jon to a woman who might be able to help him train the dog. Reluctantly, Jon gives her a try. Is the dog the problem, or the owner?','/gHV1B2wNGahuMCH7ST3osXGs2Cf.jpg','2009-09-03',80,'Released','Inspiration comes from all walks of life.','A Dog Year',41496,2.0253,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21498,_binary '\0','/gD4BVaEAeAdpeC6b0olF01WrK9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808237',5.8,1478,'es','Drama/Mex','Two stories unfold over the same long, hot day in Acapulco. The first involves Fernanda, who is forced to deal with the emergence of her ex-lover. Her boyfriend must compete with the sexual tension they share. The second concerns Jamie, a worker attempting suicide, until a girl disrupts his plan.','/rIH6SOsb5iKkJO79LHT8e4AIMqb.jpg','2006-05-23',105,'Released','Your misery is my joy','Drama/Mex',63883,1.1126,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21499,_binary '\0','/2RA6pbNRt3wQ81PeR4YHSqhodsx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808240',1.6,17039,'tr','Dünyayı Kurtaran Adamın Oğlu','The year is 2055, and the universe is in a state of turmoil, awaiting the formation of a government that can establish universal peace. Until such a time, the Orion Union stands in its stead, an uneasy alliance made up not of planets, but of their individual states, overlorded by unruly gangs, short-sighted tyrants and hissing, domineering queens. In short, chaos reigns.','/jx84cf4HUufwOjHIgG9fDTc5RI2.jpg','2006-12-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Turks in Space',31279,1.6464,2.1,'Gn-GgoqVBOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21500,_binary '\0','/yxpWmblcrFeX0uLvDbLJYBJqYvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808244',6.6,23502,'en','Easy Virtue','A young Englishman marries a glamorous American. When he brings her home to meet the parents, she arrives like a blast from the future - blowing their entrenched British stuffiness out the window.','/k9bGewoi6SWPTFQfUbn6ve06TY9.jpg','2008-11-07',93,'Released','Let\'s Misbehave!','Easy Virtue',16899,4.7777,6.5,'LJRltEiIzHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21501,_binary '\0','/szrPv1bsMPeewM6xLUNHQm9vG0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808265',4.7,2040,'en','The Ferryman','Out on a dead calm ocean, in a thick fog, a group of tourists on a pleasure craft are about to cross paths with an ancient and terrible evil. Sharing the same ocean, a sick, dying old Greek man drifts alone on a stricken yacht.','/7KyC0r5HzvHniHBD0I0lpQggaiS.jpg','2007-07-28',100,'Released',NULL,'The Ferryman',18547,1.443,4.6,'RSj5hXTO3J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21502,_binary '\0','/99xMo0iXjCUzV1sYuANA4eUujXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808276',6.2,21353,'no','Fritt vilt','When one of them breaks a leg, five friends snowboarding in the Norwegian mountains take shelter in an abandoned ski lodge and soon realize they’re not alone.','/sxYjsslcs5FSsAkEfjr50gAQWNo.jpg','2006-10-13',97,'Released','You\'ll Catch Your Death.','Cold Prey',21786,3.9293,6.2,'wmbQXrnPpxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21503,_binary '\0','/zsx28vZqh9ACu8gfWaMhJyOuPKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808279',6.5,111202,'en','Funny Games','When Ann, husband George, and son Georgie arrive at their holiday home they are visited by a pair of polite and seemingly pleasant young men. Armed with deceptively sweet smiles and some golf clubs, they proceed to terrorize and torture the tight-knit clan, giving them until the next day to survive.','/zs92sAOh3Q0kDIJkgaJFTBzSFka.jpg','2008-03-14',111,'Released','You must admit, you brought this on yourself.','Funny Games',8461,7.2452,6.537,'_bq_oqer-oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21504,_binary '\0','/yMPKlAScFj19It2QaTe7nk20JWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808285',6.8,5386,'en','The Good Heart','Jacques is the curmudgeonly owner of a gritty New York dive bar that serves as home to a motley assortment of professional drinkers. Jacques is determinedly drinking and smoking himself to death when he meets Lucas, a homeless young man who has already given up on life. Determined to keep his legacy alive, Jacques deems Lucas is a fitting heir and takes him under his wing.','/cSoUB8SFcVNaCFs1b3dTN3niYck.jpg','2009-09-11',95,'Released','Everyone needs a refuge from the world.','The Good Heart',5178,2.3781,6.4,'oJ6zsKE5Bvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21505,_binary '\0','/of9up0V1Q1CPy6x4PKfZGjyJEun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808306',6.1,3198,'hi','Honeymoon Travels Pvt. Ltd.','Six newly-married, diverse, honeymooning couples face marital bliss and discord, finding out more about themselves, their significant others and life in this happy-go-lucky, quirky drama.','/fgJdZPJOFDLxje9PSHbTJTZKFAv.jpg','2007-02-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoon Travels Pvt. Ltd.',46386,1.6657,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21506,_binary '\0','/L7EFekOOIN1bw9gj8NCHNmrZlN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808315',5.5,2733,'de','In 3 Tagen bist du tot','When Nina and her high school friends receive eerie text messages declaring that they will all die within three days, they dismiss it as a hokey prank - until one by one, the pals start turning up dead in the alpine countryside. With the cops stymied, Nina and her remaining friends must scour their past for clues to identify the madman before he kills them all.','/9OqDWRgUDtrkLZ57RwyMz8NzV81.jpg','2006-07-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Dead in 3 Days',1256,2.4104,5.5,'XHpXfMBF8KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21507,_binary '\0','/veCjJV6Zk2hRXGfWv73RHca4hAJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808331',5.8,13977,'en','Joshua','The arrival of a newborn girl causes the gradual disintegration of the Cairn family; particularly for 9-year-old Joshua, an eccentric boy whose proper upbringing and refined tastes both take a sinister turn.','/91yHfa0apWqMr8HmuwUPrVKYuDR.jpg','2007-01-21',105,'Released','The story of a perfect boy who had the perfect plan.','Joshua',5956,2.4021,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21508,_binary '\0','/qWSjUUPWHwDvFhUisPan5BPGFPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808339',6.4,15725,'fr','Largo Winch','After a powerful billionaire is murdered, his secret adoptive son must race to prove his legitimacy, find his father\'s killers and stop them from taking over his financial empire.','/bmJU3EEuQP3Ho52FhuiulZ2LKTu.jpg','2008-12-17',108,'Released',NULL,'The Heir Apparent: Largo Winch',14400,5.1636,6,'swgom5tFwWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21509,_binary '\0','/qCj01SeDibPZhvzEq9UulnDldJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808348',6.7,1404,'en','Life Support','The true-life story of a mother who overcame an addiction to crack and became a positive role model and an AIDS activist in the black community.','/s5W14btMJb2EeZ8zND2jXeSokHr.jpg','2007-03-10',90,'Released','You Can\'t Live Without It.','Life Support',56555,2.016,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21510,_binary '\0','/lU1fQews2gye23PocVE48CsTmOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808357',7.5,48354,'zh','色‧戒','During World War II, a secret agent must seduce, then assassinate an official who works for the Japanese puppet government in Shanghai. Her mission becomes clouded when she finds herself falling in love with the man she is assigned to kill.','/6c1tqfJEBuIyhQC19SLlLQAUAvJ.jpg','2007-09-24',158,'Released','To kill the enemy, she would have to capture his heart... and break her own.','Lust, Caution',4588,14.0703,7.286,'CizN-DvGhrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21511,_binary '\0','/fK2vufQvIo8c7CxLnF67UKjawke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808399',6.2,50291,'en','New York, I Love You','New York, I Love You delves into the intimate lives of New Yorkers as they grapple with, delight in and search for love. Journey from the Diamond District in the heart of Manhattan, through Chinatown and the Upper East Side, towards the Village, into Tribeca, and Brooklyn as lovers of all ages try to find romance in the Big Apple.','/85pnbEkyGi211Rq9DmnqbNX18aK.jpg','2008-09-06',103,'Released','Every moment... love begins.','New York, I Love You',12572,8.0953,5.956,'VJVtzGhuDf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21512,_binary '\0','/4pfb85bv0rKkmslTp2hzAqA7RT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808417',8,107107,'fr','Persepolis','In 1970s Iran, Marjane \'Marji\' Satrapi watches events through her young eyes and her idealistic family of a long dream being fulfilled of the hated Shah\'s defeat in the Iranian Revolution of 1979. However as Marji grows up, she witnesses first hand how the new Iran, now ruled by Islamic fundamentalists, has become a repressive tyranny on its own.','/aU8i2QAdTyRR1nYb36Gq51xXP8p.jpg','2007-06-27',95,'Released','The film Iran didn\'t want the world to see.','Persepolis',2011,4.7591,7.879,'3PXHeKuBzPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21513,_binary '\0','/9hfOwUrWDAauq3eaTZuQ6EmkJCu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808435',6.5,2232,'en','A Raisin in the Sun','Walter Lee Younger is a young man struggling with his station in life. Sharing a tiny apartment with his wife, son, sister and mother, he seems like an imprisoned man. Until, that is, the family gets an unexpected financial windfall.','/pUoE6wFKPTm9fWy0Qio38OqUDFG.jpg','2008-02-25',131,'Released',NULL,'A Raisin in the Sun',25781,2.1652,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21514,_binary '\0','/6m2qbAqSMJTX4HUwRvVEQI6ioiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808506',7.6,76696,'ja','時をかける少女','When 17-year-old Makoto Konno gains the ability to \'leap\' backwards through time, she immediately sets about improving her grades and preventing personal mishaps. However, she soon realises that changing the past isn\'t as simple as it seems, and eventually, will have to rely on her new powers to shape the future of herself and her friends.','/fmK92C7HGu6sK0axItlQ0YsO9qR.jpg','2006-07-15',98,'Released','There is a future that we can\'t wait for.','The Girl Who Leapt Through Time',14069,10.3488,7.8,'boZINHGDxMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21515,_binary '\0','/dfeCwxegv4rting4xftkHxmIdyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808510',5.1,53971,'en','Tooth Fairy','When minor-league hockey player Derek Thompson -- who has a penchant for knocking out his opponents\' teeth every time he plays -- disillusions a fan, he is sentenced to a stint for one week as a bona fide, tutu-clad, real-life tooth fairy. Soon, Derek is inspired to rekindle his youthful dreams.','/cRZvw3bPomtucIUtMHZ3qPIYtYs.jpg','2010-01-14',101,'Released','You can\'t handle the tooth.','Tooth Fairy',23023,7.6075,5.5,'JqnjK79fGSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21516,_binary '\0','/vMRPkdf3m3Ra6ZI3EyZPdKRi9m5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808526',6.4,8353,'en','Life During Wartime','Friends, family, and lovers struggle to find love, forgiveness, and meaning in an almost war-torn world riddled with comedy and pathos.','/qXCuzXPqd21orMT59JbGV01VRMT.jpg','2010-04-16',97,'Released','The scars of the past haunt us, even in our quest for redemption.','Life During Wartime',39800,2.719,5.9,'b5Gu30hb6mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21517,_binary '\0','/mrjXQuq2c0x1qPF5Gqgsn3lEGHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0808532',7.8,1388,'en','Hacking Democracy','Documentary film investigating allegations of election fraud during the 2004 U.S. presidential election. Electronic voting machines count approximately 90% of America\'s votes in county, state and federal elections. The technology is also increasingly being used across the world, including in Canada, the United Kingdom, Europe and Latin America. The film uncovers incendiary evidence from the trash cans of Texas to the ballot boxes of Ohio, exposing secrecy, votes in the trash, hackable software and election officials rigging the presidential recount.Ultimately proving our votes can be stolen without a trace \"Hacking Democracy\" culminates in the famous \'Hursti Hack\'; a duel between the Diebold voting machines and a computer hacker from Finland - with America\'s democracy at stake.','/8JsyixMw0i6wVWKToBbRyKZXNJg.jpg','2006-11-02',82,'Released','Is voting controlled by 100 million voters or one guy sitting in his grandmothers basement?','Hacking Democracy',32013,0.9888,7.6,'B-N5TIyZVMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21518,_binary '\0','/ttTmzzIeaOvYWouvg3iWJHEldF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809407',7.3,8614,'ro','A fost sau n-a fost?','It\'s the 22nd of December. Sixteen years have passed since the revolution, and in a small town Christmas is about to come. Piscoci, an old retired man is preparing for another Christmas alone. Manescu, the history teacher, tries to keep up with his debts. Jderescu, the owner of a local television post, seems not to be so interested in the upcoming holidays. For him, the time to face history has come. Along with Manescu and Piscoci, he is trying to answer for himself a question which for 16 years has not had an answer: \"Was it or wasn\'t it a revolution in their town?\"','/a7bBUXKWzhtqaPDyksOebSHeD6N.jpg','2006-09-29',89,'Released','Whose revolution was it anyway?','12:08 East of Bucharest',24159,2.2333,6.883,'AZ7MfFB14xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21519,_binary '\0','/4poxKOjyFeSlgzb60h1Xkhsk5iD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809425',6.8,2739,'es','En la ciudad de Sylvia','A man returns to a city to try to track down a woman he met six years earlier.','/lbqLCtBAILEtu4jhOuCvzyQbW6C.jpg','2007-09-14',82,'Released',NULL,'In the City of Sylvia',29568,1.6405,6.8,'dv2VKhY5w9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21520,_binary '\0','/wBxsxb27gCgcMZuNwLl9EoxSt03.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809504',5.6,26997,'en','The Accidental Husband','Emma, a radio host, is about to be married to Richard, her perfect match. But right before her wedding, she learns she\'s already married to Patrick, a charming but irresponsible fireman. Furthermore, Patrick has a secret: he has arranged this little trick because Emma advised Patrick\'s ex-fiancée to end their relationship. However, Patrick may find that the trick is on him, for he soon begins to fall in love with his uptight adversary.','/hbmHBXL7KyqNapDj6m3pqdV1qx3.jpg','2008-02-29',90,'Released','Falling in love...even the expert is confused.','The Accidental Husband',13401,5.5588,5.6,'P_znsXp0j5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21521,_binary '\0','/263koDAEckD9nZFw4ESBUht5gz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809533',6.7,2369,'es','Las 13 rosas','True story of thirteen totally normal young women that suffered harsh questioning and were put in prison under made up charges of helping the rebellion against Franco back in the 1940s. Despite of their innocence, the thirteen were soon executed without even a trace of evidence of any wrong doing.','/nsU48KgwfXuygvY92plG5NSqalw.jpg','2007-10-19',100,'Released',NULL,'The 13 Roses',27605,1.744,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21522,_binary '\0','/z6ea9p4X4v25MlGNkfjOntjU2KO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809535',7.1,1294,'ja','ゆれる','A psychologically thrilling portrait of the severe dysfunction behind a family clinging to decorum and pride.','/g98xhef5v538WA4RMFnp5lguwS4.jpg','2006-07-08',120,'Released',NULL,'Sway',45797,2.6775,5.9,'KRmNRtrYg_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21523,_binary '\0','/7VAUvHV0gFnmg1RhG8I1OlAKhK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809931',6.6,2797,'en','Noise','The community reels after an incident on a suburban train. A young cop, beset with doubt and afflicted with tinnitus, is pitched into the chaos that follows this tragic event. He struggles to clear the noises in his head while all around him deal with the after burn of the crime.','/wdEKJx4xiqTQlx2u9naqFSWYQqL.jpg','2007-05-03',108,'Released','Wrong Man. Right Place. Wrong Time.','Noise',20351,1.2075,6.1,'KMsgMuvA9pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21524,_binary '\0','/7kLXQKIp5VCRs0tRMREWQCyZf6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0809951',7.2,5274,'cs','Vratné lahve','Czech literature teacher Josef Tkaloun, who is past retirement age, realises one day that he no longer understands his pupils, and so he quits… dramatically. What he does not predict is that in doing this he will lose his sense of place in society.','/2R5W3HyTg6mW33UPsisTqCRllir.jpg','2007-03-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Empties',6079,1.3652,6.835,'gdeOs02BXEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21525,_binary '\0','/t42vyDCkReeiWLLkW1yaPgw36iP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810089',6.7,1640,'sh','beogradski fantom','Belgrade, Yugoslavia, 1979; a mysterious \"Phantom\" occupies the attention and hearts of Belgrade. Every night, he exhibits spectacular driving maneuvers using a stolen white Porsche car through the city streets.','/hA7nYyg6he3sf23FtwDSSvclfpD.jpg','2009-03-27',82,'Released',NULL,'The Belgrade Phantom',21026,1.8687,5.6,'aL-7C0c92f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21526,_binary '\0','/kWE5m0tsknQuhHtvYbRNvnU25Xx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810444',3.4,1779,'en','The Pumpkin Karver','After mistaking him for a masked killer, Jonathan fatally stabbed his sister\'s boyfriend on Halloween. One year later to the day, the siblings find themselves fighting for their lives against a very familiar masked murderer.','/cqrafGaza9MZrcUJQWExaRy6oa.jpg','2006-10-31',90,'Released','Every face is a work of art.','The Pumpkin Karver',45052,1.652,5.2,'srtHmKXMd-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21527,_binary '\0','/nlEPUAvVwjhUffpCOO9Q8st5G0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810746',7.2,2366,'en','9/11: The Falling Man','An examination of an image - a falling man from the North Tower, frozen in mid air - circulated by the press immediately after the September 11 attacks, the public\'s reaction, and why it was later deemed un-newsworthy.','/4gxBt6Vt9Xx8Pal1oZeKPlpm2Px.jpg','2006-03-16',71,'Released',NULL,'9/11: The Falling Man',76040,1.5964,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21528,_binary '\0','/qFPlPEJoZiZM0LLbfQXiYbMlI5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810772',5.1,1602,'en','Belle du Seigneur','English-language adaptation of Albert Cohen\'s epic Swiss tale of a tortured love affair between a high-ranking Jewish official and the Protestant wife of one of his employees.','/90pbOSh1EH2Xz6iOBYqEyaC9DXu.jpg','2012-11-29',124,'Released',NULL,'Belle du Seigneur',201365,2.8049,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21529,_binary '\0','/nnyaQslEbd2ST1FAhuDyF4228mb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810784',6.9,30004,'en','Bright Star','In 1818, high-spirited young Fanny Brawne finds herself increasingly intrigued by the handsome but aloof poet John Keats, who lives next door to her family friends the Dilkes. After reading a book of his poetry, she finds herself even more drawn to the taciturn Keats. Although he agrees to teach her about poetry, Keats cannot act on his reciprocated feelings for Fanny, since as a struggling poet he has no money to support a wife.','/csN6y4nq2kaBiegHaGw0DGp4plf.jpg','2009-09-18',119,'Released','First love burns brightest.','Bright Star',29963,5.1079,6.615,'K2FkxivSuVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21530,_binary '\0','/8FYaFGZR0MkYVT7V4aTtUtQ3Ens.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810809',7.1,1243,'fr','Congorama','Michel is a Belgian inventor. He cares for his father, a paralysed writer, is married to a Congolese woman and is the father of an interracial child whom he reassures as to his parentage. He discovers at the age of 41 that he was adopted, actually having been born in Sainte-Cécile, Quebec. In the summer of 2000, he travels to Quebec, supposedly to sell some of his inventions. While on a near-impossible quest to find his birth family in the town where he was born, he crosses paths with Louis Legros, son of another inventor, in a meeting which will change their lives.','/vR92CiqJG5dj6m7389B1M6fPCPc.jpg','2006-05-25',105,'Released',NULL,'Congorama',61783,1.2634,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21531,_binary '\0','/d0tzLbn62WANaq5mnyLpCJsJq1B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810819',7.1,207489,'en','The Danish Girl','When Gerda Wegener asks her husband Einar to fill in as a portrait model, Einar discovers the person she\'s meant to be and begins living her life as Lili Elbe. Having realized her true self and with Gerda\'s love and support, Lili embarks on a groundbreaking journey as a transgender pioneer.','/kiJTZ5oFRO961wWn7mLxjUcRlf3.jpg','2015-11-27',119,'Released','Find the courage to be yourself.','The Danish Girl',306819,9.3194,7.5,'WAVj7WQfMaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21532,_binary '\0','/g4YR7t02w3JPMXDQkigeJZ2u2MZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810823',5.5,13566,'en','The Deaths of Ian Stone','Deaths tells the story of an all-American guy who is murdered each day by horrifying pursuers, only to wake up in slightly different lives to experience the terror of being murdered again.','/guhprfoix4DCKnbPeVQXuF08rHt.jpg','2008-07-18',87,'Released','Live everyday like it\'s your last.','The Deaths of Ian Stone',12171,4.0349,5.58,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21533,_binary '\0','/8swHho6hoIlHERMrX2Z83OBQJCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810827',7.1,18642,'ja','デスノート the Last name','In the second installment of the Death Note film franchise, Light Yagami meets a second Kira and faithful follower Misa Amane and her Shinigami named Rem. Light attempts to defeat L along with Teru Mikami (a Kira follower) and Kiyomi Takada (another Kira follower) but in the end will Light win? or will a Shinigami named Ryuk make all the difference in Light\'s victory or his ultimate death?','/zFwCNC5LfmPKBsqMuAhzcG5Jubm.jpg','2006-10-28',140,'Released','The last name to be written in the DEATH NOTE... Whose name will it be?','Death Note: The Last Name',16140,4.7664,7.071,'MT04dmyrreU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21534,_binary '\0','/v6ZKREYbiRITI6kyusyzm009o6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810836',5.4,1220,'en','Dirt Music','Georgie is slowly suffocating in a loveless marriage to fishing tycoon Jim Buckridge. Handsome poacher Lu is an irresistible symbol of the excitement she craves. A passionate affair follows that reveals the dark secrets in Lu’s past and forces him to take flight into the blistering heat of the outback. Georgie follows, determined to find him and bring him back.','/9FbR35fAEr6vMiQLyxeCSgHkgvW.jpg','2020-10-08',105,'Released','Lose yourself... Find yourself... In love.','Dirt Music',540414,3.1584,6.3,'njIoUGIDrwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21535,_binary '\0','/pqVDgmktHuSAGdL7sDzQTd1MjJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810868',6.7,4792,'de','Free Rainer - Dein Fernseher lügt','Frustrated, because he is forced to produce bad TV-shows, a manager of a TV-station, enters the station and manipulates the ratings, to initiate a TV-revolution.','/15zoYqclJF6bcHHL0wZ4nsNJ1Qi.jpg','2007-09-11',129,'Released','Your TV lies','Reclaim Your Brain',1912,2.1035,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21536,_binary '\0','/mUZfZf8Doaxka3hsQDOqDUUWL0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810892',4.4,2228,'en','The Haunted Airman','An injured RAF pilot, confined to a wheelchair is committed to an eerie hospital where he starts to lose his mind.','/71PbHyrUdowV9HhW7fixWAPwH2l.jpg','2006-10-31',68,'Released',NULL,'The Haunted Airman',21505,1.5969,4.9,'IdRhcxRJ-7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21537,_binary '\0','/d8VGgwr2WApwFewrL5yZQgo78E0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810895',6.4,5490,'en','Hellboy Animated: Sword of Storms','A folklore professor becomes unwittingly possessed by the ancient Japanese demons of Thunder and Lightning. But when The Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense dispatches a team of agents to investigate, a cursed samurai sword sends Hellboy to a supernatural dimension of ghosts, monsters, and feudal mayhem. Now while pyrokinetic Liz Sherman and fishboy Abe Sapien battle one very pissed-off dragon, a lost and cranky Hellboy must find his way home.','/vUCrcikFCDsvA6IiS59kdfQkseU.jpg','2006-10-28',77,'Released',NULL,'Hellboy Animated: Sword of Storms',16774,3.4496,6.329,'VX6Ye9xNAD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21538,_binary '\0','/aS7M839gMmcokvUwNM3DFqOLqzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810900',5.3,73135,'en','High School Musical 2','The East High Wildcats are gearing up for big fun as they land the coolest summer jobs imaginable. Troy, Gabriella, Chad, and Taylor have scored sweet gigs at the Lava Springs Country Club owned by Sharpay and Ryan\'s family. Sharpay\'s first rule of business: Get Troy. As Troy experiences a life of privilege he\'s never known, will he give up the Wildcats and Gabriella to rise to the top?','/kqImEYXsDIlzPpu0KxyTXIx7smW.jpg','2007-08-17',111,'Released','Are you ready for the start of something new?','High School Musical 2',13649,6.615,6.499,'8UiHFHF-Nqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21539,_binary '\0','/kye3Xz5ojZcOy9sWYcFHvXLTNCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810913',3.3,97020,'en','Jack and Jill','Jack Sadelstein, a successful advertising executive in Los Angeles with a beautiful wife and kids, dreads one event each year: the Thanksgiving visit of his twin sister Jill. Jill\'s neediness and passive-aggressiveness is maddening to Jack, turning his normally tranquil life upside down.','/p6xV65iiz9agN2IAtf7cgbZC3YF.jpg','2011-11-11',91,'Released','His twin sister is coming for the holidays... and it ain\'t pretty.','Jack and Jill',71880,7.9669,4.387,'Aft-IW9fO5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21540,_binary '\0','/enxf96h8wGxqnByfVg3ZlsPTu7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810922',6.3,57961,'en','Take Me Home Tonight','Recent MIT grad Matt Franklin should be well on his way to a successful career at a Fortune 500 company, but instead he rebels against maturity by taking a job at a video store. Matt rethinks his position when his unrequited high-school crush, Tori, walks in and invites him to an end-of-summer party. With the help of his twin sister and his best friend, Matt hatches a plan to change the course of his life.','/nInduPOusI1alDIC0UttFjDIKsO.jpg','2011-03-04',97,'Released','Best. Night. Ever.','Take Me Home Tonight',50725,5.2378,5.97,'ZsSNCmGUK2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21541,_binary '\0','/ffCyX3jtEGtnfv4seCmCpjUnS2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810928',5.7,2113,'en','The Last Sin Eater','In seeking her own redemption from the one man of whom she is most afraid, 10-year-old Cadi Forbes discovers a secret sin haunting her community of Welsh immigrants in 1850s Appalachia.','/nSFmT13VqhdVqRhU08ADMxy8cGX.jpg','2007-02-09',117,'Released',NULL,'The Last Sin Eater',9916,2.2206,5.6,'iUyN5-9AMRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21542,_binary '\0','/a8esZgBRtP5lY0g0Ui8kLn6rceW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810945',5.8,5342,'en','Live!','A mockumentary following an ambitious TV network executive trying to produce a controversial reality show where contestants play Russian Roulette.','/91FAYeluKya14DmtENl8yzzWBv.jpg','2007-11-01',96,'Released','You Only Get One Shot...Take It','Live!',25218,2.498,5.5,'o9R5iG4UYBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21543,_binary '\0','/eaw3jR0irBio4hkc08xMAEnscZb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810951',6.6,1868,'en','Look','Interconnected stories are told entirely through images captured on security cameras in storage rooms, police cars, parking lots, shopping malls and other locations. Store manager Tony has affairs with the women who work under him, high schooler Sherri schemes to seduce teacher Berry, a pedophile stalks his next victim at a mall food court and two thieves go on a killing spree that links to other tales witnessed by the unseen electronic eyes.','/w5zponAf51C6jEouArKeKhJSwfe.jpg','2007-12-05',98,'Released','Who is watching?','Look',17025,1.8573,5.4,'8wX8-l1IIsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21544,_binary '\0','/cR39VUrIKWrv9TfoiOzfim5D9p9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0810988',6.2,35431,'en','The Nines','A troubled actor, a television show runner, and an acclaimed videogame designer find their lives intertwining in mysterious and unsettling ways.','/AkIyPzbxBnR815XNCKH5D9T4RaE.jpg','2007-01-21',100,'Released','Y9u never kn9w when y9ur number is up.','The Nines',12994,4.9231,6,'4_xd_UemIo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21545,_binary '\0','/jMxCZ5ndcxeXwqMk9ISP9Ucj8aH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811011',2.3,1216,'en','Pirates of Treasure Island','The humdrum life of an innkeeper takes a thrilling turn after finding a treasure map and enlisting Long John Silver to set off for Skeleton Island.','/70oZMpJvu6IIvqgIILFFGc525Zg.jpg','2006-06-27',86,'Released','Swashbuckling adventure in the high seas as you\'ve never seen before!','Pirates of Treasure Island',25043,2.2894,3,'fduI1byuG1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21546,_binary '\0','/4RiZrHiT5qBKyzNTBaK28QCHDK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811066',7.1,11741,'hi','Shootout at Lokhandwala','An account of the gangster Maya Dolas and his gang which terrorized Mumbai City, and the ensuing standoff between Mumbai Police and the gang on 16 November 1991.','/6p8ddG6t8FzJTFNYODG27Er0Pdn.jpg','2007-05-25',145,'Released','Based on true rumours','Shootout at Lokhandwala',20742,1.4503,6.19,'zafeG8_n52Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21547,_binary '\0','/4CLeg52cRU2hBZk2O6bvsAf57sD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811080',6.1,85061,'en','Speed Racer','Speed Racer is a young and brilliant racing driver. When corruption in the racing leagues costs his brother his life, Speed must team up with the police and the mysterious Racer X to bring an end to the corruption and criminal activities.','/rVNpkV6ksY1hqjkun1WCTxqyK9v.jpg','2008-05-07',135,'Released','Go!','Speed Racer',7459,10.6374,6.385,'M_RpBi3W1Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21548,_binary '\0','/TAun5NrYvv5OFzodpd76pZ14AN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811106',4.9,17512,'en','The Ten','Ten stories, each inspired by one of the ten commandments.','/byhpbEcL1tuoNhU3x5vYF45QM8X.jpg','2007-08-03',96,'Released','If He\'d meant the commandments literally, He\'d have written them in stone.','The Ten',13173,3.926,4.8,'m6pnqyDTUL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21549,_binary '\0','/1EkO1AFRycEqsyi7zXpzvCAvhen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811124',3.9,1986,'en','The Lost Tribe','After a devastating boat crash, a group of friends are stranded on an uncharted island where they encounter an ancient tribe of humanoid creatures.','/8unm1Ui0ypBLnsCwtiQvyK7CIQX.jpg','2009-11-07',86,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Tribe',59120,2.4515,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21550,_binary '\0','/lGrDCRoW9tbL9TTVsN10Xz0o4kV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811128',5.8,1996,'en','Turn the River','A pool shark takes the ultimate gamble when she kidnaps her own son and flees her ex-husband.','/8XF05cxDYCeGe9LpqfdzabGe9at.jpg','2008-05-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Turn the River',13993,2.1724,5.269,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21551,_binary '\0','/4aJ8qWazwP9Y9WDqztrMC4KmMWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811136',7.6,5081,'en','Dixie Chicks: Shut Up and Sing','Shut Up and Sing is a documentary about the country band from Texas called the Dixie Chicks and how one tiny comment against President Bush dropped their number one hit off the charts and caused fans to hate them, destroy their CD’s, and protest at their concerts. A film about freedom of speech gone out of control and the three girls lives that were forever changed by a small anti-Bush comment','/7aZ8uWvCckLTbalbiqut3Vrt33c.jpg','2006-10-27',93,'Released','Freedom of speech is fine, as long as you don\'t do it in public.','Dixie Chicks: Shut Up and Sing',2152,1.5292,6.7,'lPWgQIULDOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21552,_binary '\0','/akBPODeGc96xscK5oZEUEoRWKZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811137',6,1857,'en','The Do-Deca-Pentathlon','Two brothers compete in their own private 25-event Olympics.','/93kF9UusrLOhHkiXIABCkl28WYO.jpg','2012-07-06',76,'Released',NULL,'The Do-Deca-Pentathlon',96987,1.5676,5.2,'J8EaCnbHdQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21553,_binary '\0','/9E7RHTs5hyVCwZ8vmw0UtrcwfFD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811138',3.8,57190,'en','The Love Guru','Born in America and raised in an Indian ashram, Pitka returns to his native land to seek his fortune as a spiritualist and self-help expert. His skills are put to the test when he must get a brokenhearted hockey player\'s marriage back on track in time for the man to help his team win the Stanley Cup.','/sp8AV64ftAZCT9uWfgbCb3olGDW.jpg','2008-06-20',87,'Released','His karma is huge.','The Love Guru',12177,5.6889,4.059,'0KUA1d8-6eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21554,_binary '\0','/kcERl3Rkh8ogn48QJt7boGiMMPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0811159',3.7,1311,'de','Die Wilden Kerle 4','With the victory against \"The Beastly Beasts\", \"The Wild Soccer Bunch\" showed it to everyone and then won every single game. Only one victory now separates them from the \"Pott\", the Freestyle Soccer Cup. For this they have to compete against the \"Wolves of Ragnarök\". But the wolves are not normal opponents! They have a dark secret - and behind them lurks a power stronger than all of them: the girl Horizon and the \"Silver Lights\" from the fog...','/hfTuyoAIE6KtrrwAW26NXBXVFJI.jpg','2007-02-01',110,'Released','The Attack of the Silver Lights','The Wild Soccer Bunch 4',1264,2.1206,5.3,'2L9rVjob01M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21555,_binary '\0','/mIYSIgQjTU0Y7e1yZ08E588A8av.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0812243',6.9,11633,'nl','Ex Drummer','Three musicians form a band. But they\'re not just any musicians: each has a disability that makes them particularly unsuitable for their instrument. The guitarist is deaf, the singer is tone deaf, and the bassist has a stiff arm. They lack a drummer, and to respect the group\'s uniqueness, they turn to a famous writer who has never played the drums. He accepts, but begins a manipulation that will wreak further havoc on the already largely dysfunctional band.','/7VxXp2h9UtJP6XbeuQGqqbQzoE1.jpg','2007-01-31',101,'Released',NULL,'Ex Drummer',14019,1.4181,6.8,'bkttiSWZlhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21556,_binary '\0','/3oqEHukB0ELkERw4QBBybgnTshQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0812352',5.2,4407,'en','Nine Miles Down','In the Sahara desert, a sandstorm batters a deserted drilling station. A security patrolman battles through the high winds to investigate why all contact with the station has been lost. Originally built for gas exploration, and then abandoned, the site had recently been taken over by a multi-national research team intent on drilling deeper into the earth’s crust than ever before.','/lX9SCW24HhO889tOHCxnIUWKhXF.jpg','2009-10-01',86,'Released','Lead us not into temptation but deliver us from evil.','Nine Miles Down',26722,1.9551,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21557,_binary '\0','/ttWCXpqDLPMfc2r871iQQzsCriY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0812377',6.6,1517,'es','La soledad','Adela and her baby move to Madrid in search of a new start after a tough separation. Antonia is a shop owner with three adult daughters. The film is divided into five chapters revolving around their health, work, relationships and money.','/gWnmLBW72Z3bBWcg3YAPZSViNja.jpg','2007-06-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Solitary Fragments',39489,0.8965,5.8,'G0lUYTlR9gA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21558,_binary '\0','/y8RTjr5Wl2AHHJ6NJmUBFk4lqbn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813129',5.4,2010,'el','Το Κακό','An evil force is awakened in downtown Athens transforming the unsuspecting citizens into raving zombies. The few survivors will have to fight hard for their lives. To the death.','/8OyP5WP0wHS1PjsSijdxCEY2nVI.jpg','2005-09-23',83,'Released','Greece Just Got Scary...','Evil',39897,0.7869,5.5,'7Bvas9DDGk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21559,_binary '\0','/r1xiYu9tXCOCuBfzwXZL7GpyTJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813540',3.7,1538,'hi','नक्शा','20 years after the death of an archaeologist, Kapil Malhotra, his younger son, Vicky attempts to uncover his father\'s mission with the help of an ancient map.','/9986J5aprOCPylNaO2HR6tQIF7V.jpg','2006-09-08',130,'Released',NULL,'Naksha',236007,0.9191,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21560,_binary '\0','/1mhrwIVNdhqnkEakDTm80X3TNr8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813541',7,4338,'ru','Питер FM','Masha, who works for a radio station, and Maxim, a street sweeper with an architectural degree, cross paths with each other when they are at an indecisive point in their lives.','/5OBg9S8JCH7AFNQ7LDb3pJbBX4f.jpg','2006-04-20',85,'Released','It’s not the radio. It’s a movie!','Piter FM',64736,2.3622,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21561,_binary '\0','/f6c63X99xkhWtdfet0aZqXgW2vc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813547',7.5,48816,'de','Die Fälscher','The story of Jewish counterfeiter Salomon Sorowitsch, who was coerced into assisting the Nazi operation of the Sachsenhausen concentration camp during World War II.','/Af6I9RZF0SIPeNnp8hAleGDTnKd.jpg','2007-03-22',98,'Released',NULL,'The Counterfeiters',7862,4.486,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21562,_binary '\0','/xt4unBHDk2jd8UMHdUcKtHI9I0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813548',8,1986,'te','గోదావరి','Sreram, an idealist recovering from heartbreak, and Seetha, an independent fashion designer facing setbacks, both cross paths on a cruise on the Godavari River.','/3SDynWhHwPrQ3pjouFgTKqBrI02.jpg','2006-05-19',157,'Released',NULL,'Godavari',81051,1.1536,7.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21563,_binary '\0','/t1mHDnHW8yzHA2qUMO38xV9uR1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813549',6.4,1848,'zh','黑拳','A young man learns the fighting techniques of Sanda from a coach. The two become best friends as the young man prepares to enter an underground tournament, competing against some of the top fighters of the world.','/koUrJtsoeKH5z63554SXWCl2b1t.jpg','2006-10-05',110,'Released','No rules. Only one winner...','Fatal Contact',30942,2.1592,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21564,_binary '\0','/u1JM6DB8nS51KoxehwpG1xiTD5D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0813996',3.7,1546,'hi','अलग','When an old widow passes away, the police searches his house and finds his son locked in the basement. They take the boy to an institution, where it is discovered that he possesses supernatural powers.','/kmrla9Y9mCr3O4gMkZ0GzT3EgLZ.jpg','2006-06-16',122,'Released',NULL,'Alag',53590,1.4907,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21565,_binary '\0','/nR4YOCt6DDYVa47lKs2fOZTU5S4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814014',6.1,3902,'hi','Apne','An ex-boxer Baldev Choudhary (Dharmendra) has had a stain in his boxing career. He wanted to wash it with his son Angad\'s (Sunny Deol) success, but times were hard and a financial crunch kept him from achieving this dream. Though Angad pulled through fine, Baldev never forgot who ruined his chance to wash the stain. An opportunity strikes Baldev in the form of a T.V. Show. He trains a local boy to get into this media hyped boxing show, but is ditched for a better coach at the last minute. Baldev\'s younger son Karan (Bobby Deol) has just launched his first music album. Realizing his father is in crises of his life, he gives up his dream of a musical career to get into the game of boxing.','/mG8hffG2xOjncmKwENQ6fJeAPiC.jpg','2007-06-29',174,'Released',NULL,'Apne',60124,1.1555,6.141,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21566,_binary '\0','/ueXbXSehnVK62UqfLrdJdWZ7gla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814022',5.3,59882,'en','Bangkok Dangerous','When carrying out a hit, assassin Joe always makes use of the knowledge of the local population. On arriving in Bangkok, Joe meets street kid Kong and he becomes his primary aide. But when Kong is nearly killed, he asks Joe to train him up in the deadly arts and unwittingly becomes a target of a band of killers.','/iTRftxHW8i4H7ONaOiCIwEXjNDJ.jpg','2008-08-21',99,'Released','It\'s all in the execution.','Bangkok Dangerous',13184,5.2658,5.321,'e_b2QVAVRpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21567,_binary '\0','/4dZ88NOFhz2Ja5XQzwfyS7f18LF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814075',7.9,11379,'en','Deliver Us from Evil','Documentary filmmaker Amy Berg investigates the life of 30-year pedophile Father Oliver O\'Grady and exposes the corruption inside the Catholic Church that allowed him to abuse countless children. Victims\' stories and a disturbing interview with O\'Grady offer a view into the troubled mind of the spiritual leader who moved from parish to parish gaining trust ... all the while betraying so many.','/4FSBT712p6OwawSqLCkloNSqMaM.jpg','2006-06-24',101,'Released','For the victims, there\'s no such thing as salvation.','Deliver Us from Evil',13364,1.7472,7.1,'WcRzvCQWN6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21568,_binary '\0','/e5Cmgg5BestVd7egZZM6KtyJDdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814130',7.1,6467,'en','The Hammer','Approaching forty, Ferro is unsatisfied with his life as a construction worker and part-time boxing instructor in Los Angeles, CA. After a successful bout with a young pro boxer, Ferro decides to don the gloves one last time. The movie recounts his unlikely quest for Olympic gold.','/6Q7z71vQD7Rl8ehdlFu5qfmvenv.jpg','2007-04-01',88,'Released','Some Guys Don\'t Know Their Destiny Till It Hits Them In The Face.','The Hammer',14014,1.4382,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21569,_binary '\0','/4ue2WLBuHSkYHQ1vJw9NIby06dh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814131',5.8,1653,'en','Hank and Mike','Two blue-collar Easter Bunnies get fired and try their hand at an assortment of odd jobs, failing at each. Fighting depression, debt and eventually each other, their lives start to unravel until they realize that without their job they are nothing.','/AlHcI3lDMPwaGwiWBWiyk2Buhpr.jpg','2008-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Hank and Mike',13119,1.7472,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21570,_binary '\0','/6OnJoCqeRzoOdzXogm64OD3QGzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814243',6.8,10139,'ja','ワンピース','There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost one-third of the world\'s gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate\'s existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tobio, who\'s a captured part of El Drago\'s pirate crew. El Drago\'s love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan\'s island, and thanks to Woonan\'s treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy\'s crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan\'s gold.','/6QOrTYafoqzXPWLnR2K8129jTHH.jpg','2000-03-04',51,'Released','Set sail for the island of gold!','One Piece: The Movie',19576,5.465,7.051,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21571,_binary '\0','/ugiV9SpJburMOPeIyjBJyAnO1So.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814255',5.9,218084,'en','Percy Jackson & the Olympians: The Lightning Thief','Accident prone teenager, Percy discovers he\'s actually a demi-God, the son of Poseidon, and he is needed when Zeus\' lightning is stolen. Percy must master his new found skills in order to prevent a war between the Gods that could devastate the entire world.','/brzpTyZ5bnM7s53C1KSk1TmrMO6.jpg','2010-02-01',118,'Released','Worlds collide.','Percy Jackson & the Olympians: The Lightning Thief',32657,18.0193,6.2,'R86InkfdboA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21572,_binary '\0','/mDu3nkdjzkJ9loy3QyppGcLjaI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814314',7.6,327953,'en','Seven Pounds','An IRS agent with a fateful secret embarks on an extraordinary journey of redemption by forever changing the lives of seven strangers.','/85zUipgVy2QbvAJ6djZXYaGckMv.jpg','2008-12-18',123,'Released','Seven names. Seven strangers. One secret.','Seven Pounds',11321,13.6661,7.601,'hvu2F6t26hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21573,_binary '\0','/wKdhYJZNqqwSt4dUBMr3ppwLE9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814331',4.8,4952,'en','Spring Breakdown','Three women in their thirties head to a popular Spring Break destination and try to relive the Spring Break they never had.','/g9wU95xHvsWl7ZRMhUeXBOkpExY.jpg','2009-05-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Spring Breakdown',18826,3.2873,5.5,'71FwopTBZuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21574,_binary '\0','/n0HbNGwIgfhwtHkAXfyVuIgTyzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814335',5.6,42717,'en','The Stepfather','Michael Harding returns home from military school to find his mother happily in love and living with her new boyfriend, David. As the two men get to know each other, Michael becomes more and more suspicious of the man who is always there with a helpful hand. Is he really the man of her dreams or could David be hiding a dark side?','/bTolBUgHeU4Tcq8HjBxL92f9wLm.jpg','2009-10-16',101,'Released','This fall, daddy\'s home.','The Stepfather',19904,6.8592,5.8,'Ki5GyO0tRWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21575,_binary '\0','/8BTufM1NnGuZS7sCHVKcDdvBrjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814380',5.2,2625,'it','Notte prima degli esami - Oggi','In 2006, as World Cup fever sweeps Italy, high school senior Luca falls hard for dolphin trainer Azzurra and stumbles on a family secret -- right before his exams.','/zc43153cFR9uqbxILOqZnuaByyB.jpg','2007-02-14',102,'Released',NULL,'The Night Before the Exams Today',54309,1.4843,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21576,_binary '\0','/7A3eqkMybEi8QjiwxIfVUSrzt1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814666',6.7,1650,'fr','Bamako','Caught in the stranglehold of debt and structural adjustment, Africa is fighting for its survival. In the face of disaster, representatives of African society bring an action against international financial institutions. The trial takes place in Bamako, in the yard of a house, among its inhabitants.','/5QC4URE5MKnzBwk8vNNtvMoLIxl.jpg','2007-02-23',115,'Released',NULL,'Bamako',62652,2.3671,6.99,'hgRIcBIJJZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21577,_binary '\0','/tvcx12hEMeJMcKViZxIn6MxGC8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814685',6.2,31247,'fr','Frontière(s)','A gang of young thieves flee Paris during the violent aftermath of a political election, only to hole up at an Inn run by neo-Nazis.','/6GISAjE0XiSucmzXIhb1tdnV2yC.jpg','2007-07-01',108,'Released','What are your boundaries...','Frontier(s)',13492,4.5245,6.2,'GmmpJSiqU3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21578,_binary '\0','/65ts1lojgafFFsfIJIybb5IGzsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0814768',5.6,1290,'fr','Le Prix à payer','Jean-Pierre, a wealthy businessman, is lonely. He still desires his wife but she only seems interested in shopping and the beauty salon. Tired of lunching alone every day, one day he decides to invite his chauffeur to join him, and a relationship quickly develops as the two find they have much in common. Are they just cash machines for their wives? Don\'t they deserve some love in return? Jean-Pierre confiscates his wife\'s credit card, but things don\'t turn out exactly the way he\'d hoped...','/AbFKuolhEAVcLOgx4iPXlpf4aZn.jpg','2007-04-04',95,'Released','No sex? No dough!','The Price to Pay',13045,1.665,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21579,_binary '\0','/pLBvz8nVHOowZQfPH89Wn32dGKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815138',5.8,1764,'en','Take','The lives of two strangers - a struggling mother and a gambling addict - meet in tragedy. Years pass, and they must come to terms with themselves, and one another.','/iHpPFevxOBi5Czwd1VN5AWQKh5q.jpg','2008-07-25',98,'Released','It takes a moment to steal a lifetime.','Take',13941,1.9136,5.3,'2MISNzoTDEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21580,_binary '\0','/crwSXtFrmH3y9IAdzy3JzYVenSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815178',6.2,15390,'en','The Life Before Her Eyes','As the 15th anniversary of a fatal high school shooting approaches, former pupil Diana McFee is haunted by memories of the tragedy. After losing her best friend Maureen in the attack, Diana has been profoundly affected by the incident - her seemingly perfect life shaped by the events of that day.','/1Kmy4EfYegTyQNQeHZomTWvmFPe.jpg','2007-09-08',90,'Released','Your life can change in an instant. That instant can last forever.','The Life Before Her Eyes',13079,3.9137,6,'JGbHCXeYVW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21581,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815181',7.5,1697,'en','Iraq for Sale: The War Profiteers','Documentary portraying the actions of U.S. corporate contractors in the U.S.-Iraq war. Interviews with employees and former employees of such companies as Halliburton, CACI, and KBR suggest that government cronyism is behind apparent \"sweetheart\" deals that give such contractors enormous freedom to profit from supplying support and material to American troops while providing little oversight. Survivors of employees who were killed discuss the claim that the companies cared more for profit than for the welfare of their own workers, and soldiers indicate that the quality of services provided is sub-standard and severely in contradiction to the comparatively huge profits being generated. Also depicted are the unsuccessful attempts by the filmmakers to get company spokesmen to respond to the charges made by the interviewees.','/nIAgVj3KtdJiyFRUmUFdGAMxcRE.jpg','2006-09-01',75,'Released',NULL,'Iraq for Sale: The War Profiteers',40862,1.193,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21582,_binary '\0','/i80wifLk9w3q4Pq9UOPlfrsjKY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815236',6.4,154663,'en','She\'s Out of My League','When he starts dating drop-dead gorgeous Molly, insecure airport security agent Kirk can\'t believe it. As his friends and family share their doubts about the relationship lasting, Kirk does everything he can to avoid losing Molly forever.','/mpYHjyPX0DAxbsnWKmSK5jZ1s4T.jpg','2010-03-11',104,'Released','When she\'s this hot, you get one shot.','She\'s Out of My League',34016,10.6064,6.5,'oWJJGXvL7PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21583,_binary '\0','/lsTgf0YfoBUUAwm79xDVEpsq3tQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815241',7.6,60847,'en','Religulous','Commentator-comic Bill Maher plays devil\'s advocate with religion as he talks to believers about their faith. Traveling around the world, Maher examines the tenets of Christianity, Judaism and Islam and raises questions about homosexuality, proof of Christ\'s existence, Jewish Sabbath laws, violent Muslim extremists.','/hBv5LCbWxPB8iU77dwurSGMVZ3N.jpg','2008-10-01',101,'Released','Heaven help us.','Religulous',13007,3.602,7.036,'XdkyLrDpaUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21584,_binary '\0','/bB2L8pB8Qdy3sd4b94Vw75EUEpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815244',6.2,55240,'en','Sydney White','College freshman Sydney White arrives at Southern Atlantic University, determined to pledge her late mother\'s sorority. Unfortunately, she finds that the sisterhood has changed since her parent\'s day. Banished to a condemned house, Sydney joins forces with seven outcasts to take over the student government and win equal rights for nerd and noted alike.','/ce3NNmhVZY5NkUe5Y8Je8CciKqf.jpg','2007-09-21',108,'Released','Freshman year is no fairytale','Sydney White',10760,5.1295,6.457,'N-Hua-wJzVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21585,_binary '\0','/yGsKygpcJl7WXn2UfGFoi1Mdrze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0815245',6.3,90245,'en','The Uninvited','Anna returns home after spending time in a psychiatric facility following her mother\'s tragic death and discovers that her mother\'s former nurse, Rachel, has moved into their house and become engaged to her father. Soon after she learns this shocking news, Anna is visited by her mother\'s ghost, who warns her that Rachel has evil intentions.','/cg1SBFMIkxi3ZM76ZGAHwxs6XyN.jpg','2009-01-30',87,'Released','Can you believe what you see?','The Uninvited',14254,7.5939,6.5,'SMAgwJrBeJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21586,_binary '\0','/gU2lUPzA59vY0thkz8LrJOZiYJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816150',6.6,7058,'tr','Dondurmam Gaymak','Ali, who is ice cream salesman in Mugla, tries to survive in the face of fierce competition from the big ice cream brands. While trying to promote his ice cream, he tours the village with his brand new yellow ice cream motorbike. However the naugthy boys of the town who are chasing him to have free ice cream, steal the motorbike while he is away. Still repaying the debts for the loan on his motorbike, Ali becomes furious and accuses the big ice cream brands of stealing the car in order to destroy him. He starts investigating the theft of his motorbike asking one by one to the sellers of the big brands, while all along the naugthy boys are enjoying their free ice cream','/nM3rXq2EpfpcwQ80TEeSOIpqv5f.jpg','2006-11-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Ice Cream, I Scream',81550,1.1336,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21587,_binary '\0','/z3mlTunM7Ck7WB6inIuKJ6b8hjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816258',8,17186,'te','పోకిరి','Pandu is a contract killer and will accept any contract provided the amount is right. The police want him for questioning, while the underworld needs him to silence their opponents. No one really knows this assassin\'s background. It is only Pandu who knows his real identity, and he has no intention of sharing it with anyone.','/rQ8NH5f3CxRrmqZWMZNYPwLmjDS.jpg','2006-04-27',163,'Released',NULL,'Pokiri',23381,1.5853,7.6,'rdIwjSBIW4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21588,_binary '\0','/zKciMUA5pn4mDJTKiSkhjq3s3hm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816436',5.8,17532,'en','Black Water','Based on true events, Grace, her boyfriend Adam, and her younger sister, Lee, are on holiday in Northern Australia when they decide to take a tour down a river. As they drift into a swamp, their boat suddenly capsizes. Stranded in the flooded swamp, the three tourists must figure out what to do to survive as they realize they are being watched through the black water.','/7hd6iyViluCMOqIJz5TsiyBFqp9.jpg','2008-02-22',90,'Released','What you can\'t see can hurt you.','Black Water',14138,3.4331,5.929,'ElZ65JmwK0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21589,_binary '\0','/arFPEDEW4PzPaMBXgTPzJlumfGw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816442',7.5,148478,'en','The Book Thief','While subjected to the horrors of WWII Germany, young Liesel finds solace by stealing books and sharing them with others. Under the stairs in her home, a Jewish refugee is being sheltered by her adoptive parents.','/wj4U5sMLcJMa3WR9CpRR9e2sdgZ.jpg','2013-11-08',131,'Released','Courage beyond words.','The Book Thief',203833,13.007,7.5,'38K6u_z5Gug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21590,_binary '\0','/6B5bTuZEyLrAYNG1IX1GeBQZP11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816462',5.2,106521,'en','Conan the Barbarian','A quest that begins as a personal vendetta for the fierce Cimmerian warrior soon turns into an epic battle against hulking rivals, horrific monsters, and impossible odds, as Conan realizes he is the only hope of saving the great nations of Hyboria from an encroaching reign of supernatural evil.','/sSMjZmOtqzlRTYSUFPmIXTV4rhh.jpg','2011-08-17',113,'Released','Enter an age undreamed of','Conan the Barbarian',37430,11.0836,5.3,'P3L7tRQzDEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21591,_binary '\0','/2oHTGGcBCnS3hhm1hvnb0aXFoTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816520',5.3,8587,'en','Return to Halloweentown','As Halloweentown prepares to celebrate its 1,000th anniversary, Marnie Piper and her brother Dylan return to Witch University, where trouble is in session from the Sinister Sisters and from someone who\'s plotting to use Marnie\'s powers for evil.','/9lkAYfaaUf46lkXKEWq94wuUs3m.jpg','2006-10-20',88,'Released','Unlock The Ultimate Secret This October!','Return to Halloweentown',34204,3.534,6.6,'ihXBE-mPe5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21592,_binary '\0','/iXteoPlqw9Gtsshu5I5QwwyrGMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816539',5.9,6905,'en','Jack Brooks: Monster Slayer','As a child Jack Brooks witnessed the brutal murder of his family. Now a young man he struggles with a pestering girlfriend, therapy sessions that resolve nothing, and night classes that barely hold his interest. After unleashing an ancient curse, Jack\'s Professor undergoes a transformation into something not-quite- human, and Jack is forced to confront some old demons... along with a few new ones.','/xAieCaFdEiIwhHS7FKcltPDUnRc.jpg','2007-10-09',85,'Released','...I used to be a plumber','Jack Brooks: Monster Slayer',16205,2.3202,5.607,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21593,_binary '\0','/kyptilG2S4jhCvM7pWL4rycw1fS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816545',6.5,4663,'en','Kabluey','Leslie is left with few options when her husband is sent back to war in the Middle East. A modest amount of help arrives in the form of his brother, Salman, who is less than prepared to care for the couple\'s two preadolescent boys. When Leslie still can\'t make ends meet on her own, Salman is forced to find employment, but, with minimal qualifications, his only option is to become a mascot for a digital company by donning a bulbous blue costume.','/cb7kNCC6he2cXqejMWsmow9dPjD.jpg','2007-06-25',86,'Released','Every family has a black sheep. This one is blue.','Kabluey',15654,2.3928,6.101,'du_SdqV188E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21594,_binary '\0','/5eaS62YjA5Z7WPcf4quyZa5VpeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816556',6.2,39172,'en','Lake Mungo','After 16-year-old Alice Palmer drowns at a local dam, her family experiences a series of strange, inexplicable events centered in and around their home. Unsettled, the Palmers seek the help of a psychic and parapsychologist, who discovers that Alice led a secret, double life. At Lake Mungo, Alice\'s secret past emerges.','/g0zCELYfBfSv8TOGC13buABVN53.jpg','2009-07-30',87,'Released','In 2008, Alice Palmer died…Her nightmare didn\'t.','Lake Mungo',27374,4.5536,6.145,'4n8WNQ9kOac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21595,_binary '\0','/5YePprD8fmHNKkjKSBJLbXH0oRH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816616',6.3,1458,'en','Poor Boy\'s Game','Donnie Rose went to prison for beating a young man so brutally it left him handicapped for life. Nine years later, Donnie is out. He\'s a different man with only one place to go: back home to the same violent and racist neighborhood that created him. At the other end of town, the black community still wants revenge. The instrument of justice will be Ossie Paris, a devastatingly talented boxer who challenges Donnie to a match; a match Donnie\'s family and peers won\'t let him refuse. George Carvery has waited nine years to avenge his son\'s fate at the hands of Donnie. When finally they meet face to face, however, both realize they share a similar desire to overcome the past.','/4mKbDppyNBwws5e8nH889E4Ejqb.jpg','2007-02-11',104,'Released',NULL,'Poor Boy\'s Game',15020,2.1974,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21596,_binary '\0','/fey7NzJ61KAAVPfUgcpaahW5gZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816671',7,8005,'en','Teen Titans: Trouble in Tokyo','After a battle with a high-tech villain named, Saiko-Tek, the Teen Titans travel to the city of Tokyo where they find themselves embroiled in a conflict with an ancient enemy.','/4wMlDE1HzkVyYeDKuY1oDOWQlN2.jpg','2006-09-15',75,'Released','The Titans go ninja on the notorious villain Brushogun in their awesome first feature-length movie.','Teen Titans: Trouble in Tokyo',16237,4.9612,7.883,'zPQei7nDZUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21597,_binary '\0','/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816692',8.7,2606472,'en','Interstellar','The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.','/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg','2014-11-05',169,'Released','Mankind was born on Earth. It was never meant to die here.','Interstellar',157336,73.4799,8.488,'827FNDpQWrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21598,_binary '\0','/kg2FOT2Oe5PSCgs3L4vLel6B7ck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0816711',7,794668,'en','World War Z','Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.','/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg','2013-06-19',116,'Released','There will come a day when the world we know will end.','World War Z',72190,29.4763,6.852,'TvRCQM2HrXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21599,_binary '\0','/wdOGA0LC1NiWgAX1OaiKtNA247i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817177',7.6,109705,'en','Flipped','When Juli meets Bryce in the second grade, she knows it\'s true love. After spending six years trying to convince Bryce the same, she\'s ready to give up - until he starts to reconsider.','/6zDYFigohwncqFL00MKbFV01dWb.jpg','2010-08-06',89,'Released','You never forget your first love.','Flipped',43949,9.2959,8.017,'shN4dt583Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21600,_binary '\0','/bJd4hoeLCQIqqZnyQ9W1Bh5dIY7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817225',7.5,10993,'ko','밀양','Shin-ae moves to her recently late husband’s hometown. Despite her efforts to settle in this unfamiliar and too-normal place, she finds that she can’t fit in. After a sudden tragedy, Shin-ae turns to Christianity to relieve her pain, but when even this is not permitted, she wages a war against God.','/vee1jyUrqUEmi5ZStWI1JJzLQJH.jpg','2007-05-23',143,'Released',NULL,'Secret Sunshine',2015,3.4744,7.216,'yFt-i-LTXpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21601,_binary '\0','/4XBh28mlEbnbVxBlQYMEdiix8Yk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817228',5.1,3344,'en','The Tattooist','American tattoo artist Jake Sawyer wanders the world, exploring and exploiting ethnic themes in his tattoo designs. At a tattoo expo in Singapore, he gets his first glimpse at the exotic world of traditional Samoan tattoo (tatau), and, in a thoughtless act, unwittingly unleashes a powerful angry spirit. In his devastating journey into Pacific mysticism, Jake must find a way to save his new love, Sina and recover his own soul.','/qwOZo4ACw54IxcjnAJW71pXfaFO.jpg','2007-11-28',92,'Released','Evil in ink.','The Tattooist',14440,2.6815,5.1,'dEiBw4R-LbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21602,_binary '\0','/ceVkF5gRQSBhuceWnraTHBmH2TY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817230',5.8,131930,'en','Valentine\'s Day','Intertwining couples and singles in Los Angeles break-up and make-up based on the pressures and expectations of Valentine\'s Day.','/qOTcfD2DdnOTmhH0r1TOE09VvNh.jpg','2010-02-10',125,'Released','A love story. More or less.','Valentine\'s Day',32856,9.9155,5.9,'fXyHuuYtR00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21603,_binary '\0','/yd750mff5FTjwMenmBMWRezbuSe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817538',5.7,64785,'en','Drillbit Taylor','Dealing with a sociopathic school bully, three high school freshmen hire a low-budget bodyguard to protect them, not realizing he is just a homeless beggar and petty thief looking for some easy cash.','/shqO696kFnM8Z4ODa3JglcjP97u.jpg','2008-02-04',110,'Released','You get what you pay for.','Drillbit Taylor',8457,8.9404,5.9,'j3-_AgJnTyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21604,_binary '\0','/usnSs0fHKBiaQvR60Zl551yoYep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817544',6.4,1774,'ko','두번째 사랑','When an American woman begins a dangerous relationship with an attractive immigrant worker, in order to save her marriage, she finds her true self.','/suYzZLU0Ogdk3NHuaflVZCBAm5P.jpg','2007-06-20',90,'Released','A moving experience!','Never Forever',18514,2.1683,6.6,'FdQoVrcAlzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21605,_binary '\0','/r6kxASJb64Vx6nWM7o7hbFHJp9e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817545',5.1,4405,'en','The Power of Few','Spies, cops and armed children cross paths on a day of danger, mystery and possible transformation. Five unusual characters are unknowingly connected to an extraordinary smuggling operation, as religious conspiracy collides with urban crime.','/s2gEURN3dQ2JmUjoFRD7m6Ox1rV.jpg','2013-02-15',96,'Released','We are all watching.','The Power of Few',161321,2.8175,5.2,'Ho5Z6ozSfpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21606,_binary '\0','/iwAQV8m7jknUflreDmQpSdmmCmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0817910',6.6,4796,'en','Hellboy Animated: Blood and Iron','When Hellboy, Liz Sherman, and Abe Sapien are assigned to investigate the ghost-infested mansion of a publicity-hound billionaire, they uncover a plot to resurrect a beautiful yet monstrous vampire from Professor Bruttenholm’s past. But before they can stop her bloodbath, Hellboy will have to battle harpies, hellhounds, a giant werewolf, and even the ferocious goddess Hecate herself.','/itj3KXrYL6iSa7eBDLYIVWZuZtW.jpg','2007-03-10',75,'Released','Beware your destiny','Hellboy Animated: Blood and Iron',13204,3.6292,6.347,'_2uelrpovBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21607,_binary '\0','/suQSf09B77kB2mmuR9TpsKUKQmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0818165',5.2,9486,'en','The Alphabet Killer','Based on the true story of double killings occurring in Rochester, NY during the 80’s and the troubled police officer determined to solve them, with or without the help of her department','/wrS1nnsCSoRrrlEKGXIqpF96g2N.jpg','2008-11-07',98,'Released','Based on a true story.','The Alphabet Killer',13942,3.7353,5.1,'vk9zbVviOOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21608,_binary '\0','/fiRxDoAHRLko3ycPtw1EeWaKxTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819714',6.1,20134,'en','The Edge of Love','When the Welsh poet Dylan Thomas and his flirtatious wife Caitlin sweep into war-torn London, the last thing they expect is to bump into Dylan\'s childhood sweetheart Vera. Despite her joy at seeing Dylan after so many years, Vera is swept off her feet by a dashing officer, William Killick, and finds herself torn between the open adoration of her new found beau and the wily charms of the exotic Welshman.','/uo7ZDvipL2OZu6G44hDP0sjDZ9n.jpg','2008-06-20',110,'Released','The only thing more dangerous than war... is love.','The Edge of Love',14061,4.5142,6.2,'8fNabjyaKUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21609,_binary '\0','/iCWymyYyqWQieMkWKHxf2nwVhxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819755',5.4,8345,'en','Babysitter Wanted','When she takes a job babysitting a young boy for a night at his family\'s remote farmhouse, sweet college co-ed Angie Albright becomes the target of a scar-covered creep making mysterious phone calls and prowling outside the windows. Angie gets the drop on the would-be killer, but quickly discovers that her nightmare has just begun.','/7DQlbb4ax5L5NZvMjr54KOsXGyF.jpg','2007-07-19',93,'Released','No experience necessary...','Babysitter Wanted',60086,2.5472,5.5,'CEl4OEXTMzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21610,_binary '\0','/ig3M6gDKC05FqwVt1PzlxHerL1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819765',6.5,2851,'cn','狗咬狗','A young Cambodian man who has been trained to fight for money in his country is hired to kill someone in Hong Kong. He performs the hit and then flees from Hong Kong police, who are wrestling with internal problems of a model cop and his son, who is also on the force and who was told by his dad not to become a police officer.','/itNA7ItpFZBeMfdI6MV7O9tnaKi.jpg','2006-08-17',109,'Released','Prepare to be annihilated!','Dog Bite Dog',14816,2.2411,6.589,'HxdgKPWk24E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21611,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819796',7.5,1641,'hr','Pjevajte nešto ljubavno','Wanting to publish their first solo album, an up and coming rock band decides to give up on following the unwritten \"Rock and Roll Code\" in order to play a few cheesy love songs for the upcoming wedding of Siniša, a corrupt and violent police officer. What they don\'t know is that Siniša\'s bride-to-be is none other than Anja, the ex-girlfriend of their founder Stream, and that the ceremony won\'t be just a wedding, nor merely a moneymaking opportunity, but, rather, a high-stakes rescue operation, started by a reignited flame.','/qn5BV4L2VXV9SFm0S7IMCwWRAiO.jpg','2007-07-14',106,'Released',NULL,'Play Me a Love Song',209375,1.1209,8.4,'_lbpy-5sXbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21612,_binary '\0','/wkkN3zRm0ubGaafCGYIbk58lpGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819810',6.6,1873,'hi','Traffic Signal','Silsila is the \"manager\" of one traffic signal, that is he collects the \"hafta\" (protection tax) from each signal squatter plying his trade. There\'s Tsunami, a little scavenger boy, there\'s Rani - a Gujrati girl selling ethnic clothes on the sidewalk, and there\'s Dominic - a drug addict and the prostitute who feels for him...','/1xA7cF9oz6JWYrEJXCIsstG1f0z.jpg','2007-02-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Traffic Signal',46426,0.9166,5.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21613,_binary '\0','/anlEeAZnZJBS7gH0bxpDv34AksV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819895',7.6,2291,'ro','Hîrtia va fi albastrã','Out of enthusiasm, a Militia soldier abandons his platoon and decides to fight for the cause of the Revolution. His Lieutenant and the rest of the crew look for him during the confused night of 22-23 December 1989.','/4MlOWyZpZEDK7kYzW3mAR3P4vsf.jpg','2006-10-11',92,'Released',NULL,'The Paper Will Be Blue',73682,1.862,7.4,'v5ewa0xE7pI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21614,_binary '\0','/r7AugkHQAsXGp9j5sU6QBehXV66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0819953',6.8,3315,'fr','L\'âge des ténèbres','Jean-Marc is a man without qualities living in times that are out of joint. His wife and children ignore him; he\'s a mid-level government functionary in Montreal doing his job without care. He has an active imagination of sexual conquest, but his only real feelings come when he visits his aged mother, whose health is failing. When his wife leaves abruptly to work in Toronto, Jean-Marc sets out to reorder things with his daughters, his social life, and at work. In a world that at best is a farce, does he stand a chance?','/syTfHveVRGPre7TT2D60UmQ8L2a.jpg','2007-09-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Days of Darkness',24173,2.934,6.5,'JwXg_vxpaXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21615,_binary '\0','/dH9McW4c8TKpQfdL6MGUTyL28Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0820096',7.1,3108,'ru','Изображая жертву','A young man drops out of university and goes to the police. He\'s done nothing wrong he just wants a job. A particular job. Playing the victim in murder reconstructions. Maybe by getting close to death he can manage to cheat on his own.','/nmeKDPvieULQZecpRBeToxQB4qk.jpg','2006-06-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Playing the Victim',64484,0.898,6.507,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21616,_binary '\0','/qZhUJbgNRhD2eUxwi8r7X32kHFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0820111',5.7,2547,'ja','ミートボールマシン','Capable of making bio-mechanical weapons out of human flesh, alien parasites grotesquely invade the Earth, turning their hosts into maniacal killers who seek and destroy each other to the bloody death! And yes, it s also a human love story, even though the budding romantics are infested with slimy, tumor-like globules.','/szggz8oSi9ZIszL14rHTiahOLMm.jpg','2006-09-23',90,'Released','They come from beyond','Meatball Machine',27351,1.549,5.3,'DkERZbWDeUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21617,_binary '\0','/2ep1f9H1ijP3u7xKuoCpIggK5Nr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0820117',5.2,2621,'sr','А3 – Рокенрол узвраћа ударац','We Are Not Angels III is a Serbian film. In 1973 during a Youth Work Action, budding musician Borko Pavić (Nikola Pejaković) is disappointed to find out that the majority of his fellow young workers prefer to dance kolo to folkish harmonica sounds rather than listening to him play his acoustic guitar. Heartbroken and depressed he confides in his best friend that he read that in America the young people make the devil appear by playing the music backwards who then makes them rich and famous. He becomes the mega popular rock\'n\'roll superstar Dorijan. Cut to 30+ years later Dorijan is still a debauched, coke-snorting, and alcoholic superstar, except that he\'s now playing turbo folk instead of rock\'n\'roll. He lives with a silicone trophy girlfriend Smokvica and his best friend from childhood is his business manager. Despite still having his women, fame, and fortune, Dorijan is unhappy about having to resort to playing a musical style he hates in order to have all that.','/vIdXEGi5HjuxF6arRraaUWrOQAv.jpg','2006-10-11',87,'Released',NULL,'We Are Not Angels 3: Rock & Roll Strike Back',33608,1.2088,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21618,_binary '\0','/wjluPJYlI0cJxi55Z1nkyGJ8SGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0820142',4.2,4913,'en','Shark Bait','After losing everything, a young fish, Pi, goes to live with his family on the Reef. There he meets the love of his life but finds that she already has the unwanted affections of a bully shark. He must follow his destiny to save her and rid the Reef of this menace for good.','/xmFSuoUfA1t4xsGKFR6i4kFvmWM.jpg','2006-07-07',77,'Released',NULL,'Shark Bait',19595,7.5912,4.9,'R5PUetXbl3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21619,_binary '\0','/nHeUqmbEjtth8XqaTgyw85WNXBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0821442',7.3,9793,'ko','비열한 거리','A small-time thug who collects debts for the local triad is torn between his criminal aspirations and his devotion to family.','/ag6d5exA6s8VjxxHTXg756wnfGh.jpg','2006-10-17',141,'Released','A world without trust and mercy.','A Dirty Carnival',23538,3.9574,7,'IyJs-zScIHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21620,_binary '\0','/e7ALownnual6u8tRmyQN0As7qXO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0821470',6.6,5114,'ko','짝패','Tae-su, a detective fighting organized crime, returns to his hometown for his high school friend Wang-jae\'s funeral. There, he meets his old friends Pil-ho, Dong-hwan and Seok-hwan and they reminisce. Suspecting something fishy about Wang-jae\'s death, Tae-su and Seok-hwan start investigating it, each in his own way. Their investigations lead to a land development project that Pil-ho is directing.','/l2W7qEQejWlclNixeG8pbnnekkr.jpg','2006-05-25',92,'Released','The rowdy pair is in town.','The City of Violence',20605,3.1101,6.561,'51m4vRhZNDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21621,_binary '\0','/rEovUFDH1BSNipOt5T80G8FDGs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0821638',7.1,8484,'en','Bury My Heart at Wounded Knee','Beginning just after the bloody Sioux victory over General Custer at Little Big Horn, the story is told through two unique perspectives: Charles Eastman, a young, white-educated Sioux doctor held up as living proof of the alleged success of assimilation, and Sitting Bull the proud Lakota chief whose tribe won the American Indians’ last major victory at Little Big Horn.','/w8FeAVNxe17rQUqaBhKy5F0wpBf.jpg','2007-05-27',125,'Released','The Epic Fall of the American Indian','Bury My Heart at Wounded Knee',13470,3.8713,6.5,'irjRMmQ1n-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21622,_binary '\0','/oy9Ox4WGPkOJ3656CNKasVjAnKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0821640',5.8,101019,'en','Ghosts of Girlfriends Past','Celebrity photographer Connor Mead lives life in the fast lane, committed to lifelong bachelorhood and simultaneous relationships with multiple women. On the eve of his younger brother Paul\'s wedding, Connor\'s mockery of love proves a real buzz-kill for everyone - including his childhood crush, Jenny, the one woman who always seemed immune to his considerable charms. Later that night, he gets a wake-up call from the ghost of his late Uncle Wayne, the hard-partying, legendary ladies\' man who was Connor\'s mentor. Uncle Wayne has an urgent message which he delivers through three ghosts who guide Connor on an eye-opening tour of his romantic past, present and future. Along the way, they attempt to discern whether he will ever be able to change his ways -- and if there is any hope of him finding true love.','/azzg0lv5vpQRoOrZfNVkJn04f1M.jpg','2009-05-01',115,'Released','You can\'t always run from your past.','Ghosts of Girlfriends Past',12556,8.0843,5.969,'wHLufMUep0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21623,_binary '\0','/7gsAibNmbrBxxWGzuCR5NVLjRyx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0821642',6.7,56977,'en','The Soloist','A Los Angeles journalist befriends a homeless Juilliard-trained musician, while looking for a new article for the paper.','/6GnFN9OTkaoeKNzd2Fbp3ZyJjKi.jpg','2009-04-24',117,'Released','Life has a mind of its own','The Soloist',17332,5.0265,6.668,'z1YHoyCxdVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21624,_binary '\0','/hxs85R5t2flRV0UOXmDi7lUyU0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822389',7.2,7694,'en','Kenny','From the biggest festival to the smallest church social, Kenny Smyth delivers porta-loos to them all. Kenny tackles every septic challenge that comes his way, culminating in a visit to the International Pumper and Cleaner Expo in Nashville Tennessee - or as Kenny affectionately calls it, \"Poo HQ\".','/wolfQamiBBjpFR06GqeWu1KCOFy.jpg','2006-08-17',99,'Released','A Knight in Shining Overalls.','Kenny',13140,1.0835,6.2,'ZHjc0cu9CgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21625,_binary '\0','/gACeaDtApPTzOyzeyNbvuUAZDAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822827',2.6,1223,'en','Lightspeed','Government agent Daniel Leight has his radiation treatments sabotaged. He soon finds that he can now move at super speeds but only by risking metabolic damage which could prove to be fatal. \'Lightspeed\' must now use his powers to go after old friend turned terrorist who is now a mutant half-snake called Python.','/gnjmthhMcBmQlYUKrxxYXaOcO8R.jpg','2006-07-22',90,'Released','From the creator of Spider-Man, X-Men, Daredevil, Fantastic Four, The Hulk','Lightspeed',31985,1.8285,3.1,'PLOayZJOYfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21626,_binary '\0','/tVoWbAAfTDIhTeo78SbA2V6mv8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822832',7,176912,'en','Marley & Me','A newly married couple, in the process of starting a family, learn many of life\'s important lessons from their trouble-loving retriever, Marley. Packed with plenty of laughs to lighten the load, the film explores the highs and lows of marriage, maturity and confronting one\'s own mortality, as seen through the lens of family life with a dog.','/pnB6hjTKylb0Ve2nUWt16gzkErr.jpg','2008-12-25',115,'Released','Heel the love.','Marley & Me',14306,10.0074,7.175,'KR5UBtAxseo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21627,_binary '\0','/pv82OBJIF3v5inCkpxfb2XZFYta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822833',3.9,3415,'es','Mentiras y gordas','A youth group is preparing for what will be the summer of their life, including secrets, lies, sex, confusion, evenings and holidays.','/8D16rdCmTYCg66EMwK1ZZDWiK3x.jpg','2009-03-27',107,'Released','How long can the party last...','Sex, Party and Lies',17899,6.7638,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21628,_binary '\0','/srrzHjAzhYzUulBbllQCNekgnQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822847',5.7,130752,'en','Priest','In an alternate world, humanity and vampires have warred for centuries. After the last Vampire War, the veteran Warrior Priest lives in obscurity with other humans inside one of the Church\'s walled cities. When the Priest\'s niece is kidnapped by vampires, the Priest breaks his vows to hunt them down. He is accompanied by the niece\'s boyfriend, who is a wasteland sheriff, and a former Warrior Priestess.','/fYHiA7LPGl9DG7m3DUs0Td1VMcO.jpg','2011-05-05',87,'Released','The war is eternal. His mission is just the beginning.','Priest',38321,10.1904,5.9,'hinWQiv2rVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21629,_binary '\0','/dMm33jCotfT5AvzVwtwWeQIotny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822849',6.6,4430,'en','Rails & Ties','A deadly collision between a train and car lead to an unlikely bond between the train engineer and a young boy who escapes the carnage.','/bTV4tqQ3CujkRcs8Ha4KDjF1mG6.jpg','2007-09-01',101,'Released','When life comes apart, love puts it back together.','Rails & Ties',15006,2.3978,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21630,_binary '\0','/uy2trYgO8MOQfQXlvMaLhBnkUqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822854',7.2,379327,'en','Shooter','A top Marine sniper, Bob Lee Swagger, leaves the military after a mission goes horribly awry and disappears, living in seclusion. He is coaxed back into service after a high-profile government official convinces him to help thwart a plot to kill the President of the United States. Ultimately double-crossed and framed for the attempt, Swagger becomes the target of a nationwide manhunt. He goes on the run to track the real killer and find out who exactly set him up, and why, eventually seeking revenge against some of the most powerful and corrupt leaders in the free world.','/2aWGxo1E5polpBjPvtBRkWp7qaS.jpg','2007-03-22',124,'Released','Yesterday was about honor. Today is about justice.','Shooter',7485,19.7271,7.127,'A3lPVwYOdzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21631,_binary '\0','/bP3VlqMCzb2QownCtTa3iZNMCAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0822868',5.4,6692,'en','Make It Happen','Embarking on a journey to fulfill her dreams as a dancer, a young girl discovers a new style of dance that will prove to be the source of both conflict and self-discovery.','/dB19WsdFSap1hL8GX3vxneMjHrE.jpg','2008-08-08',90,'Released','Hear The Music. Feel The Beat.','Make It Happen',14871,2.757,6,'Qk8bPVF-wl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21632,_binary '\0','/mLkUeEcGpAf0QIVMC95YSCnBpCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0823158',6,2158,'en','Wedding Wars','Ben, a slightly uptight man, ends up hiring his gay brother Shel, a party planner, to be his wedding planner. The two seem to be getting along famously, but then in the midst of planning, politics enters the fray. Ben is engaged to the governor\'s daughter, and the governor has taken a public stance against same sex marriage. Though his constituents seem to approve of his political agenda, Shel doesn\'t. And he shows his displeasure by walking off the job and going on strike for equal rights.','/gnFmK2rQ7pbSEpRujxJ0VSSPGzQ.jpg','2006-12-11',88,'Released','His brother is out. His wedding is off. The war is on.','Wedding Wars',20085,2.534,5.5,'dShK22fIoYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21633,_binary '\0','/1nzdtdIeQxhs0hwVwBCmSadXI7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0823240',6.3,1831,'fr','Les Amours d\'Astrée et de Céladon','In an enchanted forest, back in the time of the Druids, the shepherd Céladon and the shepherdess Astrée share a pure and chaste love. Fooled by a suitor, Astrée dismisses Céladon, who throws himself into a river out of despair. She thinks he\'s dead, but he\'s been secretly rescued by some nymphs. Faithful to the promise he made to Astrée to never appear before her again, Céladon must overcome many obstacles to break the curse. Mad with love and despair, coveted by the nymphs, surrounded by rivals, and obliged to disguise himself as a woman to be near the one he loves, will he manage to make himself known without breaking his oath? A romance filled with doubt, hazards, and delicious temptations.','/3kXhylg76Hxx4gUtdPN0RHvnjIi.jpg','2007-09-02',109,'Released','A Rohmerian delight, another ritualized romance','The Romance of Astrea and Celadon',45458,3.0401,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21634,_binary '\0','/xnJe4ddaWgKXMy7dRHPrF7Ufm3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0823451',5.7,1816,'hi','दस कहानियाँ','An anthology of ten short films dealing with diverse subjects such as infidelity, companionship, lust and a spectrum of human emotions.','/lqqdfQIq8yLeYyPijzYv5aU6CaX.jpg','2007-12-07',110,'Released','Six visionary directors... Ten spectacular stories... One cinematic journey.','Dus Kahaniyaan',46383,1.1672,4.238,'Lx0RAg1SX9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21635,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0823668',6,1598,'en','Screamers','Internationally known director Carla Garapedian follows the rock band System of a Down as they tour Europe and the US pointing out the horrors of modern genocide that began in Armenia in 1915 up though Darfur today.','/4n5jHP93l0YjDedmdaMo5UHKsgC.jpg','2006-12-08',91,'Released','Never Again!','Screamers',45057,0.7608,4.2,'2FqD6ReQHNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21636,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824316',7.9,6506,'hi','Dor','Two woman, from different backgrounds and living miles apart, are linked by tragedy. Their new-found friendship is tested as one holds the fate of the other\'s husband in her hands.','/j29JyRQENX0JWYWBgeg7DlWsA7y.jpg','2006-09-22',124,'Released',NULL,'Dor',44827,2.0498,7.383,'IuiKIF9LIHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21637,_binary '\0','/91EdS983zWz6gjwq3nPN1D8ZIHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824330',6.7,8405,'fr','Les Femmes de l\'ombre','May 1944, a group of French servicewomen and resistance fighters are enlisted into the British Special Operations Executive commando group under the command of Louise Desfontaines and her brother Pierre. Their mission, to rescue a British army geologist caught reconnoitering the beaches at Normandy.','/drOSLa0lNoitjRyku7wBgf6bNyu.jpg','2008-02-08',117,'Released','In the shadow of war, heroines write history.','Female Agents',8266,4.507,6.6,'mOa66pgDAL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21638,_binary '\0','/ho1uUzjSg9vmK3a2bXpymmWbL2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824375',5.3,1904,'hi','निशब्द','Vijay enjoys the good life: happily married, wealthy and a beautiful daughter. However, one summer, when his daughter brings a friend back to stay, their familial bliss is shattered.','/wi8TJkpD52h5ZUIgnDQ2Ts7hoxO.jpg','2007-03-02',109,'Released','He Is 60. She is 18. Some Love Stories Are Never Meant To Be Understood','Nishabd',20535,1.1026,4.5,'5nmMuaeJZvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21639,_binary '\0','/bdo313RjHEymI0W5tKYBKE54Las.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824696',6.6,1780,'es','Una película de huevos','A small egg named Toto decides that he wants to fulfill his purpose in life and become a chicken instead of dying in a frying pan; so he starts a quest to return to the farms along with his new friend, the noisy egg Willy and a crazy bacon stripe. The three friends will face lot of obstacles in their quest.','/eHqGqr5xBat3P2b9YdRbKMLli4J.jpg','2006-04-21',90,'Released',NULL,'A Movie of Eggs',16761,3.1744,7.868,'b_I54aXqe9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21640,_binary '\0','/yWs9QUP2kamsnfdV4cloxLM5RUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824747',7.7,276580,'en','Changeling','Los Angeles, 1928. When single mother Christine Collins leaves for work, her son vanishes without a trace. Five months later, the police reunite mother and son. But when Christine suspects that the boy returned to her isn\'t her child, her quest for truth exposes a world of corruption.','/y9Qi39dL3PceGCH8afyC7QrhbhI.jpg','2008-10-24',142,'Released','To find her son, she did what no one else dared.','Changeling',3580,9.5024,7.569,'IF5hwg4FNEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21641,_binary '\0','/6ab5nkZ14mAVTxC0EszMXF3psEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0824758',6.9,19899,'en','The Last Station','A historical drama that illustrates Russian author Leo Tolstoy\'s struggle to balance fame and wealth with his commitment to a life devoid of material things. The Countess Sofya, wife and muse to Leo Tolstoy, uses every trick of seduction on her husband\'s loyal disciple, whom she believes was the person responsible for Tolstoy signing a new will that leaves his work and property to the Russian people.','/nf9cYwKcvxTbSsCz4o6eRJ8P0IH.jpg','2009-09-04',112,'Released','Intoxicating. Infuriating. Impossible. Love.','The Last Station',36811,4.119,6.4,'W9SVyURGqvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21642,_binary '\0','/6OpluXPGIE8hfVrhpeygR7p4XwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825232',7.3,274971,'en','The Bucket List','Corporate billionaire Edward Cole and working class mechanic Carter Chambers are worlds apart. At a crossroads in their lives, they share a hospital room and discover they have two things in common: a desire to spend the time they have left doing everything they ever wanted to do and an unrealized need to come to terms with who they are. Together they embark on the road trip of a lifetime, becoming friends along the way and learning to live life to the fullest, with insight and humor.','/idbNSe8zsYKQL97dJApfOrDSdya.jpg','2007-12-25',97,'Released','Find the joy.','The Bucket List',7350,10.5844,7.191,'f-eyQswdc-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21643,_binary '\0','/xg3HpC1I0eDEREqF3RyDY21kzUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825236',7.1,15400,'ar','سكر بنات','In a beauty salon in Beirut the lives of five women cross paths. The beauty salon is a colorful and sensual microcosm where they share and entrust their hopes, fears and expectations.','/3YAAZuO0Rz33CrIO66NqxMS6R4y.jpg','2007-08-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Caramel',7973,2.7348,6.882,'7d2zGROWPSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21644,_binary '\0','/geLvA85NzaIWcpkp3JoKLSkiT3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825239',6.7,4148,'fr','Contre-enquête','A cop investigates whether the man convicted of murdering his daughter is really guilty.','/huswFtH8wSaezEtGEs4AmgvhVw8.jpg','2007-03-07',85,'Released',NULL,'Counter Investigation',21946,1.9172,6.828,'EPmO_-6Pemk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21645,_binary '\0','/ii3WNOfgEp62jkJAHAOJyYwRfhl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825244',7.1,4066,'fr','Dialogue avec mon jardinier','A successful artist, weary of Parisian life and on the verge of divorce, returns to the country to live in his childhood house. He needs someone to make a real vegetable garden again out of the wilderness it has become. The gardener happens to be a former schoolfriend. A warm, fruitful conversation starts between the two men.','/q3xyafrkgnAv0ErKJacHE5MA6ef.jpg','2007-06-06',109,'Released',NULL,'Conversations with My Gardener',4519,2.1656,6.5,'8VK74mCBcbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21646,_binary '\0','/uYwkie6GONadcf2MiL3TwGy4r2Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825248',6.9,3590,'fr','L\'Ennemi intime','A drama following a French platoon during Algeria\'s war of independence.','/mQlekXRJwYB10yvMKkR6cCMvjQv.jpg','2007-10-03',108,'Released','The scars of war last forever','Intimate Enemies',13507,2.2019,6.4,'SnopWkzUL_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21647,_binary '\0','/ike0ydQU9xfPtQpsem3VAGtxn07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825279',3.2,1634,'en','20 Years After','In the middle of nowhere, 20 years after an apocalyptic terrorist event that obliterated the face of the world!','/bAfYiDYkWXLLGOAEdeEWDiYsLoQ.jpg','2008-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'20 Years After',14642,1.2929,3.1,'eN8TvyQ8xGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21648,_binary '\0','/1YhAGVbRSJdCzxlq8XAXkYMF9FY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0825283',3.6,4827,'en','Maximum Ride','Six children genetically cross-bred with avian DNA, complete with wings, take flight around the country to discover their origins.','/9xMMUsqz7MxQUPToJqhfYAebQBo.jpg','2016-09-30',88,'Released','Welcome To Her Nightmare','Maximum Ride',339116,2.6152,4.921,'lhQiwVi3jdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21649,_binary '\0','/1GjAbK6NzFcd6s2nMh9gvT1xosk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826027',5.6,2379,'nl','Afblijven','Melissa is a 15-year-old girl who loves to dance. Her parents think she is taking classes in classical ballet, but once at the dance school she devotes herself to the hip-hop dance classes. Melissa is good friends with Jordi and he is very happy for Melissa when she is asked to dance in the music video of the famous rapper Brainpower. But because of bad influences, her life becomes a nightmare. Until her real friends decide to get her out of there.','/yCrdAWHHfRDbOyaTtpzLC8mZa5C.jpg','2006-10-04',100,'Released',NULL,'XTC Just Don\'t Do It',28011,1.2292,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21650,_binary '\0','/uq6JzvW00Ynw2dQsaKdSH8nsJ0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826031',5.9,1932,'ko','아랑','Veteran detective So-young and her rookie partner Hyun-gi happen onto an incendiary homicide case. They discover that the present case is somehow related to the mysterious death of a girl ten years previously.','/osSqqnw0LOWxhdCLkFt1klKG4rG.jpg','2006-06-28',97,'Released','Her Spirit Will Be Avenged.','Arang',33794,2.0309,5.6,'AF2N5zgKFxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21651,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826547',6.7,1349,'en','Great World of Sound','When a man answers an ad to train as a record producer, he\'s excited by the prospect of signing undiscovered artists only to discover his new job isn\'t all it\'s cracked up to be.','/6p4FlQ89dLNLKOvRAeWkvb2Pv9n.jpg','2007-01-20',106,'Released','They\'re coming to make you a star!','Great World of Sound',25919,1.7578,5.4,'5kNTJ22sHv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21652,_binary '\0','/iM1BKZfV1cJqNJQNFjOIDnc3ph2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826559',6.5,1822,'en','The Indian','\"The Indian\" is a touching drama about a negligent father who must face the son he abandoned years earlier, and the emotional wreckage he caused, in order to obtain a life-saving transplant.','/dpB0hBASrMoW7EDoXLR3iQj1j3V.jpg','2007-01-01',91,'Released',NULL,'The Indian',32226,1.4852,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21653,_binary '\0','/wTxTawURzeCew67bv7gZisnET2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826570',5.3,2441,'hu','Macskafogó 2. - A sátán macskája','20 years after the events of the Cat Catcher, there is only one cat tribe left in Central Africa, who, after learning of what happened at the end of the first part, summon Moloch to help liberate the tamed cats and regain power over Earth.','/i0Khw03lhslBAMdbRft6adtK4sP.jpg','2007-12-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Catcher: Cat City 2',79880,1.8136,6.1,'G8-62aVJMzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21654,_binary '\0','/enjB5G0litcuEQLWvJKVvOx8ltT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826606',6.6,6502,'tr','Polis','Musa Rami, who has become a legend with his struggle against the mafia, is a police officer at homicide division. One day prior to celebrating his 63rd birthday, with a surprise party arranged by his family, he finds out that he has cancer and two months left before his death. In these two months, will he be able to fight against the mafia that has intensified its threats against his family and simultaneously reveal his deep love to Funda, who is a university student 40 years younger than him?','/nUsPkVtkRyULFk7rt26sdeAFCP6.jpg','2007-02-16',110,'Released',NULL,'Police',49828,0.8047,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21655,_binary '\0','/jkcxKC43syOKHh9roYLb3UMFcuQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826631',6.7,12716,'tr','Sınav','Five high school students plans to steal University Entrance Exam booklets.','/t53xz110VXSYtBciCuRkYvZsw9Z.jpg','2006-10-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Heist School',27959,1.3118,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21656,_binary '\0','/eSbQAEzjljkfI8iGmeUILGtvlP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826711',6.5,4340,'fr','Le Voyage du ballon rouge','The first part in a new series of films produced by Musée d\'Orsay, \'Flight of the Red Balloon\' tells the story of a French family as seen through the eyes of a Chinese student. The film was shot in August and September 2006 on location in Paris. This is Hou Hsiao-Hsien\'s first Western film. It is based on the classic French short The Red Balloon directed by Albert Lamorisse.','/9DUY5Xg0bIAa6k8HR6lbwNhpDrD.jpg','2008-01-30',117,'Released',NULL,'Flight of the Red Balloon',12198,2.1048,6.2,'pYq2tBf3p5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21657,_binary '\0','/qH3hxGVGhU8hZk7CDQ28Yh0dzJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0826756',6.4,1714,'en','Watercolors','Carter, a troubled teen stays with a friend of his dads and starts flirting with her son Danny. After the weekend school returns, however Carter a school jock tells Danny he does not want to be seen with him at school. Their relationship grows outside school hours though &amp; soon enough Danny falls in love with Carter &amp; after Danny is attacked romance ensures, but can it last.','/6oD7elDr3or573nxmPb28n4h3BZ.jpg','2008-06-07',114,'Released','Two boys make a splash at love.','Watercolors',26823,1.1512,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21658,_binary '\0','/lPCCepei2Ii62IkVfd6Vtowxi9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827181',5.1,1322,'en','Hide','A modern day Bonnie and Clyde - with a twist - that follows two lovers down a path of destruction, mayhem, and murder as they live in a world where it is acceptable to take whatever they want with murderous consequences.','/iKizezJWWm3Kf6DS1pknWTRlkDd.jpg','2008-12-17',96,'Released','Love is Hell','Hide',37970,2.0749,5.2,'xl0W0sgIPmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21659,_binary '\0','/vFM9L9xioqt25pFdqXu8qTIaJZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827498',7,2053,'en','Blood Tea and Red String','The aristocratic White Mice and the rustic Creatures Who Dwell Under the Oak battle over the doll of their hearts\' desire.','/uLjGWaK6riaa8jSuSmaE5FNFRtR.jpg','2006-10-04',70,'Released',NULL,'Blood Tea and Red String',39510,0.8847,7.1,'FR2zL-qErX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21660,_binary '\0','/sOCcxun86m48iqjJ8RxTxrjJlD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827503',7.4,36873,'tr','Hokkabaz','Failed magician Iskender decides to do a tour to save his career, but has to bring his grumpy and senile father along. The tour is quite unexpectedly interrupted when a bride actually disappears from the stage.','/95LhqrzaGi1UjLA1QAPFevqI4cr.jpg','2006-10-20',122,'Released',NULL,'The Magician',13296,1.2579,6.9,'szFSdLzXpto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21661,_binary '\0','/l9OZmtjVoFhicaY0PtdmTRKiaSR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827517',7.3,18441,'no','Reprise','Fueled by literary aspirations and youthful exuberance, two competitive friends endure the pangs of love, depression, and burgeoning careers.','/9GdptmzKh5Sx1KFiABJeUEt9eS.jpg','2006-09-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Reprise',12197,2.9371,7.1,'J6xhnSp5Gdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21662,_binary '\0','/Xos2Kemyyz1eB7S9p0RQhDBC20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827713',7.1,2299,'fr','J\'ai toujours rêvé d\'être un gangster','Told in four vignettes, this existential comedy relates the exploits of four aspiring criminals who hope to improve their lot, but find that they might not have what it takes for a life of crime.','/4SAADo3TZ7quY7GSrmoYdEIxeBN.jpg','2008-03-26',108,'Released',NULL,'I Always Wanted to Be a Gangster',8281,1.6657,7.302,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21663,_binary '\0','/gd1eweuOiY8XT8rtLdPUKvpXRKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827739',6.6,1899,'tr','Sev Kardeşim','A factory owners son falls in love with a worker who works at the factory.','/61J9T2vO0E1VyQE4BBld0EObRkk.jpg','1972-06-26',86,'Released',NULL,'Sev Kardeşim',325626,1.7003,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21664,_binary '\0','/isk2f0tI9Ie9H7PRVs8vwNShmYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0827788',6.6,4506,'ar','زكي شان','Trouble follows Zaki wherever he goes, until he finds out that his father\'s boss needs a bodyguard for his kids and he decides to apply for the job even though he doesn\'t really fit the requirements.','/8qq6zrQcI6xOgxym0q9VU6uGEUK.jpg','2005-05-04',114,'Released',NULL,'Zaki Chan',191159,2.0174,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21665,_binary '\0','/rP8fJxhxV5belv0Dr3EdvZSfHYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828065',6.3,1560,'en','Moondance Alexander','Curiously named teen Moondance Alexander lives with her eccentric mother, and is faced with another uneventful summer until she discovers a lost pinto pony named Checkers. Although Moondance returns the horse to his rightful owner, the gruff and mysterious Dante Longpre, she is convinced that Checkers is a champion jumper in disguise and is determined to help him realize his full potential.','/jd1TXn1IMz257h0rMSvnbmfTCmi.jpg','2007-04-22',94,'Released','Sometimes Being Different Is The Best Way To Fit In.','Moondance Alexander',41281,2.049,6,'4DLXTf4vuD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21666,_binary '\0','/zQs9C5jcoZkvMRDyO0H4Zk2rJeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828103',4.4,1508,'en','Taking Chances','When he discovers that an Indian casino is about to be built over the town\'s historic battlefield, Chase Revere, the self-appointed protector of a small town\'s rather meager place in American history, joins forces with sexy but dangerous town siren Lucy Shanks to launch an all-out offensive against the project - earning the wrath of the entire town.','/oNyahBbrFSD0cwky3keePg5O6bu.jpg','2009-11-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Taking Chances',25451,1.776,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21667,_binary '\0','/gsUS2ngyoOmbPDioUsHNXWPhD7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828154',7.7,7721,'en','The Pervert\'s Guide to Cinema','A hilarious introduction, using as examples some of the best films ever made, to some of Slovenian philosopher and psychoanalyst Slavoj Žižek\'s most exciting ideas on personal subjectivity, fantasy and reality, desire and sexuality.','/9AAxgfwAnpBmQCspuwlMITekcsW.jpg','2006-10-06',151,'Released',NULL,'The Pervert\'s Guide to Cinema',34283,1.9291,7.3,'mL5McgLd-xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21668,_binary '\0','/v62fLT86ljdYJh0bLGuV3Wq6ez8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828158',5.8,2608,'en','The Take','After he\'s shot during a heist in East L.A., an armored truck driver wrestles with rehabilitation and tracking down the man who committed the crime.','/kbJ8bjRr0U2wIhomhllEGUQ9071.jpg','2008-08-22',96,'Released','The crime was only the beginning','The Take',18056,2.3915,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21669,_binary '\0','/mIxjqyjweVXFikn824oo1gmvzx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828393',5.5,3655,'en','Garden Party','Are you young, sexually confused, just trying to get by? Do you sing, dance or possess some other talent? Welcome to the Garden Party. At the center of the story is 15-year-old April. She is running from one bad situation into another, hoping to find an answer that doesn\'t involve taking off her clothes.','/x00Zg8Jmr0nJvalp3Xthx5mVbAA.jpg','2008-07-11',88,'Released','Come with a Dream. Leave with a Story.','Garden Party',14196,2.0324,5.8,'hg_SlvzQgFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21670,_binary '\0','/1h6PlRMXXLyUMVVuXZYjIbEluGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0828450',4.9,1379,'en','Shredderman Rules','Nolan Byrd is a scrawny and shy 9th grader who, like all the other kids, is bullied by Bubba Bixby. When their teacher, Mr. Green allows the students to do a computer project, Nolan, who has a particular knack with technology, decides to catch Bubba in action.','/yi3ebCS5REMLY7sHsDdefC24cf2.jpg','2007-06-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Shredderman Rules',27353,2.2002,5.2,'MpOgwCPi6OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21671,_binary '\0','/3xKimqRf6atT2aKQv95ieOEuKej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829098',6.8,4848,'en','And When Did You Last See Your Father?','The story of a son\'s conflicting memories of his dying father.','/fWzhqUMGva7sKENr4L6M1RC7BlA.jpg','2007-10-05',92,'Released','Between every father and his son there is a story to be told.','And When Did You Last See Your Father?',45791,2.8161,6.5,'4W5q8SwoMt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21672,_binary '\0','/oa0bHsnrD96miW3Yx10HWb211Sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829150',6.3,224603,'en','Dracula Untold','Vlad Tepes is a great hero, but when he learns the Sultan is preparing for battle and needs to form an army of 1,000 boys, he vows to find a way to protect his family. Vlad turns to dark forces in order to get the power to destroy his enemies and agrees to go from hero to monster as he\'s turned into the mythological vampire, Dracula.','/m5h3NtZ2ZfryIHl1MvatmANvIqQ.jpg','2014-10-01',92,'Released','Every bloodline has a beginning.','Dracula Untold',49017,10.3539,6.467,'8YlAKXhL2u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21673,_binary '\0','/cBIGV9LYgJtb3xHETpgBgN7Mi3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829176',3.6,8778,'en','Gallowwalkers','When a nun broke her covenant with God to save the life of her unborn son, Aman, he was cursed for life. As an adult, Aman has killed those who have crossed him. But his curse brings his victims back to life and they pursue him for revenge, so Aman enlists a young gunman to fight by his side against his undead victims.','/cGBmTiNomYCk6Lr4Gkhbssg0m82.jpg','2012-10-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Gallowwalkers',46429,3.337,4.798,'RaBdUGCuTi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21674,_binary '\0','/r0CYBrnAbTbcG3TmGia911PUnYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829193',6.7,2287,'en','Honeydripper','In 1950s Alabama, the owner of the Honeydripper juke joint finds his business dropping off and against his better judgment, hires a young electric guitarist in a last ditch effort to draw crowds during harvest time.','/x1L0yIPOKWL8KVx6oWlPRl4ExaC.jpg','2007-09-10',124,'Released','This Better Be Some Saturday Night!','Honeydripper',14414,1.9027,5.9,'r7j1M-Rf9-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21675,_binary '\0','/mrInvVTK1iqCZlWD9suLICOnLw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829251',5.3,1448,'es','No-Do','Francesca is a pediatrician who is dedicated to both motherhood and children, married to another physician, Pedro. After the birth of a new child, Francesca begins to suffer from postpartum depression. Following the advice of friend and psychiatrist Jean, the couple move to a new home away from the city…','/hLANgbaulRfGfhthqwGLQkCOooh.jpg','2009-02-07',95,'Released',NULL,'The Beckoning',35212,1.0012,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21676,_binary '\0','/mECuKagaQtUKOplO5VhhCdKIoHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829297',7.3,14648,'en','Ten Inch Hero','Four friends search for love and happiness while working at a California sandwich shop.','/58yQktFXU8bMytpvda6USX2vkgS.jpg','2007-04-25',97,'Released','Stop by, grab a sandwich, fall in love.','Ten Inch Hero',14843,2.9843,7,'6zj5KgtG_zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21677,_binary '\0','/diVeYnI8as4HMkBZZBzywDde5xQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829424',3.9,4385,'en','Charles Band\'s Evil Bong','Straight-laced nerd Alistair moves into a college dorm with hardcore marijuana users, who order an old giant bong that proves to have strange magical powers, which sends people to a bizarre drugged-out alternate realm from which there is no easy escape.','/tQlUiiQD5PviCm5pJ21cgb8Qxw0.jpg','2006-10-31',84,'Released','Dude, it\'s one scary trip!','Charles Band\'s Evil Bong',10089,2.8518,3.6,'Kg2HunWsI6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21678,_binary '\0','/zjVE6yJE3UvQbBTB6QbiN3fK52m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829459',6.6,28812,'en','A Mighty Heart','Based on Mariane Pearl\'s account of the terrifying and unforgettable story of her husband, Wall Street Journal reporter Danny Pearl\'s life and death.','/z5f7KPg8vqqYXtaF0wUkSWryDIg.jpg','2007-06-22',108,'Released','One woman dared to keep hope alive.','A Mighty Heart',1988,4.1583,6.4,'G7EDc354h1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21679,_binary '\0','/coru98UcFBzJIU7bxZguxaePgu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0829482',7.6,703897,'en','Superbad','Two co-dependent high school seniors are forced to deal with separation anxiety after their plan to stage a booze-soaked party goes awry.','/ek8e8txUyUwd2BNqj6lFEerJfbq.jpg','2007-08-17',113,'Released','Come and get some!','Superbad',8363,17.5844,7.274,'LvKvus3vCEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21680,_binary '\0','/uGs5Z7dMguf7kxWubGFcp9EhKcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830515',6.5,503102,'en','Quantum of Solace','Betrayed by Vesper, the woman he loved, 007 fights the urge to make his latest mission personal. Pursuing his determination to uncover the truth, Bond and M interrogate Mr. White, who reveals that the organization that blackmailed Vesper is far more complex and dangerous than anyone had imagined.','/e3DXXLJHGqMx9yYpXsql1XNljmM.jpg','2008-10-29',106,'Released','Have regrets. Get revenge.','Quantum of Solace',10764,15.3439,6.345,'BBqYaFEWBxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21681,_binary '\0','/9M7CfAYjhdXJk7em6khWH2aUjq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830558',6.4,32515,'en','The Girl Next Door','In a quiet suburban town in the summer of 1958, two recently orphaned sisters are placed in the care of their mentally unstable Aunt Ruth. But Ruth\'s depraved sense of discipline will soon lead to unspeakable acts of abuse and torture that involve her young sons, the neighborhood children, and one 12-year-old boy whose life will be changed forever.','/dXjLp7k7ILyg22T0s9VvpPKc9jn.jpg','2007-07-19',91,'Released','In this town, murder became the neighborhood game.','The Girl Next Door',15356,7.2536,6.654,'biRvF7UwW4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21682,_binary '\0','/crUMmliCpduKqMKsAcT3tPx6e3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830570',6.4,10295,'en','I Can\'t Think Straight','Tala, a London-based Palestinian, is preparing for her elaborate Middle Eastern wedding when she meets Leyla, a young British Indian woman who is dating her best friend. Spirited Christian Tala and shy Muslim Leyla could not be more different from each other, but the attraction is immediate and goes deeper than friendship. But Tala is not ready to accept the implications of the choice her heart has made for her and escapes back to Jordan, while Leyla tries to move on with her new-found life, to the shock of her tradition-loving parents. As Tala\'s wedding day approaches, simmering tensions come to boiling point and the pressure mounts for Tala to be true to herself.','/ePbH29RdMlz8mDEQyUkxRVcsB73.jpg','2008-06-01',82,'Released','Two cultures. Two women. One love.','I Can\'t Think Straight',31216,3.1352,7.494,'KIetcsELZvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21683,_binary '\0','/efHg4fTpRwd6Wk0N64ogcsYeHsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830700',6.9,4367,'ar','ظرف طارق','Tarek is a young man who is working at a telecommunications company,and he fell in love with a girl when he heard her voice in a radio talk show. A customer of the company he works at asks him to spy on a girl which stole a valuable thing from him. When Tarek does his searches, he discovers that she is the girl he have dreamed about.','/twE4XKly7N8KNpTm5nIKsYwPEyX.jpg','2006-01-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Tarek\'s Situation',42322,1.6889,6.9,'jnnmukbW8S8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21684,_binary '\0','/3NyvmfxxK9FRbxvyr7KdTWdeZqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830861',1.3,9148,'hu','Kis Vuk','The film is about Little Vuk, the son of the legendary fox who proves its excellent mind and courage.','/9JmD7mrimja0tpHMhiA231h6JHx.jpg','2008-04-17',85,'Released',NULL,'A Fox\'s Tale',31250,1.2572,1.7,'JkAf3lV0GV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21685,_binary '\0','/7yIowSjFg6UX2H3rnX1RjQRTmia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0830882',7.1,2789,'nl','Dagen zonder lief','When Black Kelly gets back from New York, she discovers that more has changed than just her hair color while she\'s been away. Frederic found himself a girlfriend and plans to move. Kurt and Blonde Kelly live together with their one-year-old child. And Patrick\'s gone. Reunited with the old gang, Black Kelly realizes that life went on during her absence and that things will never be the same...','/hSggXGkUJhUynU82EX36a57irsx.jpg','2007-03-21',100,'Released',NULL,'With Friends Like These',23565,0.9214,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21686,_binary '\0','/7zcuK9WwK7zO92pTDVFzCrRc70L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0831275',6.2,1369,'en','Bigga Than Ben','Spiker & Cobakka are two self-confessed \'pieces of Moscow scum\' who come to London to rip it off. This is their guide.','/A4TLaZo05yphmD198C5MyL5pYrm.jpg','2008-07-24',82,'Released','The Russians\' Guide to Ripping Off London','Bigga Than Ben',17155,1.6508,6,'8rb7dh-d2AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21687,_binary '\0','/aZgWBWyRHuBFqnzFVlYgq7JWYPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0831280',5.5,1647,'en','Waking Madison','A woman suffering from multiple personality disorder tries to piece back together her life.','/jmcg9Wy6YmXXzIoK