31848',7.8,1856,'ja','クレヨンしんちゃん 嵐を呼ぶ モーレツ！オトナ帝国の逆襲','Shin-chan must rescue the adults of Kasukabe when they mysteriously abandon their responsibilities to relive their youth at the new 20th-century expo.','/heJkgOCx4pHqdooYA1h7B65ghvf.jpg','2001-04-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Crayon Shin-chan: The Storm Called: The Adult Empire Strikes Back',37280,4.7312,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21692,_binary '\0','/jCpkP51DUg09LFxc5mhPbGVJV9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0831884',6.6,26125,'en','Reservation Road','Two fathers\' lives intersect when one of them is involved in a terrible and sudden hit-and-run car accident that leaves the other\'s son dead. In response, the two men react in unexpected ways as a reckoning looms in the near future.','/pZaYofgshgEkeW4Huo3o6tEX89C.jpg','2007-09-13',102,'Released','To find the truth you have to find who\'s hiding it.','Reservation Road',8954,3.7413,6.5,'Wul7wZScsjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21693,_binary '\0','/xqgSXgSIkTvyU9vfUcBOd6GYflJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0831887',4.8,64527,'en','The Spirit','Rookie cop Denny Colt returns from the beyond as The Spirit, a hero whose mission is to fight against the bad forces from the shadows of Central City. The Octopus, who kills anyone unfortunate enough to see his face, has other plans:g to wipe out the entire city.','/rZovzd9Oz3fQChXdKo3aT7EUVkj.jpg','2008-12-25',103,'Released','Down these mean streets a man must come. A hero born, murdered, and born again.','The Spirit',8285,5.4512,4.763,'1CPyav6hQlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21694,_binary '\0','/iAlJWcoEqKTmfxVMQ6pDyizPRsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0831888',7.5,15790,'ja','鉄コン筋クリート','Two penniless orphans, Black and White, struggle to survive on the mean streets of Treasure Town. When a megacorporation threatens to tear down the town to build an amusement park, Black and White engage in the fight of their life.','/e2x1YDuZPpQiaQS25Ego7xMZYOI.jpg','2006-12-23',103,'Released','You can see everything from here','Tekkonkinkreet',13754,4.1454,7.4,'8Hh6mIBdCt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21695,_binary '\0','/myH9ZNzJqJJVldyZJIeGDoqPFfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0832266',7.1,182758,'en','Definitely, Maybe','When Will decides to tell his daughter the story of how he met her mother, he discovers that a second look at the past might also give him a second chance at the future.','/7eS5RurcMyi8eVUDenaCjPGAzJ2.jpg','2008-02-08',112,'Released','Three relationships. Three disasters. One last chance.','Definitely, Maybe',8390,9.8454,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21696,_binary '\0','/yXy6kFKJtQqtO20XrBbrnKUgGU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0832318',5.3,2025,'en','What Goes Up','Set in the mid-80s, when a reporter is sent to cover the Challenger Space Shuttle launch only to become mixed up in the lives of some local students.','/8mTwq6K6zdZ3kHLKMVOMDBx0Vwn.jpg','2009-05-29',104,'Released','A Different Class of Misfits','What Goes Up',19874,1.6654,5.1,'Kyyjv-oRu0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21697,_binary '\0','/pmMdke4HG8xq6Tu4gfE4QFM7OQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0832449',6.6,4052,'ja','ワンピース ねじまき島の冒険','Relaxing on a cozy beach, the Straw Hat Pirates are taking a rest from their quest. Right until Luffy noticed the Going Merry has been hijacked and sailed off from the beach. This leads them to search the ship and find the thief who took it from them. They ran into a duo named the Theif Brothers, who informed them that their ship was stolen by a group of pirates called the Trump Kyoudai. When they encountered the Trump Pirates, Nami ended up getting kidnapped as well as Luffy\'s hat. They tracked down the pirates to their base on Clockwork Island. Now Luffy, Zoro, Sanji, Usopp, and the Theif Brothers must reclaim the Going Merry, Save Nami, and get back Shank\'s straw hat.','/phrVSY5cpUkybc0gU41crWi2XIP.jpg','2001-03-03',60,'Released',NULL,'One Piece: Clockwork Island Adventure',23446,4.42,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21698,_binary '\0','/3Klsy1O5Hh9CFYgGShlarrq2yff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0832903',7.2,3184,'en','Manufactured Landscapes','MANUFACTURED LANDSCAPES is the striking new documentary on the world and work of renowned artist Edward Burtynsky. Internationally acclaimed for his large-scale photographs of “manufactured landscapes”—quarries, recycling yards, factories, mines and dams—Burtynsky creates stunningly beautiful art from civilization’s materials and debris.','/bkU59j039xv2er6Y6V8PbFRcFUX.jpg','2006-09-09',90,'Released','Beauty transformed.','Manufactured Landscapes',24582,1.0987,7.2,'ie5SJ39LsDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21699,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833444',7.9,1258,'mr','डोंबिवली फास्ट','It is the story of a middle class bank employee, Madhav Apte, an ordinary, law-abiding and honest citizen who faces constant frustration with the injustice and corruption that pervades in all walks of his life. The film portrays Apte\'s mental breakdown as he reaches his breaking point, and his rampage as a vigilante across Mumbai to set things right.','/7xiMtkgw69HnWDsQ9vCwz2nEmvb.jpg','2005-12-16',112,'Released',NULL,'Dombivali Fast',227600,0.7074,8.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21700,_binary '\0','/j1jNQw2qVp1YES9G0YwX8Rik2WD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833476',3.7,3712,'hi','Jhoom Barabar Jhoom','London, an overcrowded cafe, one table to share. Two strangers tell each other “how I met my fiancé” stories to kill time. Rikki met his fiance Anaida at the Ritz in Paris and Alvira met her prince charming Steve at Madame Tussauds','/u1KsUXW4Rjageid0zSYRQMFoUte.jpg','2007-06-15',138,'Released',NULL,'Jhoom Barabar Jhoom',14162,1.2655,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21701,_binary '\0','/2rNjWZQRCxxqLjieWC3zDeRy2QW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833484',4.8,1484,'hi','The Killer','A cold-blooded contract killer hires the services of a cab driver for a full night. He forces the driver to go around Dubai as he keeps finishing off witnesses scheduled to testify against a gangster.','/l5CUToJuYslpNhXHUCi0QRgMkIV.jpg','2006-07-21',122,'Released','A stranger. A taxi driver. A bar girl. A night of love and death.','The Killer',493622,1.228,3.563,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21702,_binary '\0','/whxg6N0RNh7rF6foXs46BnRLTch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833553',5.9,10095,'hi','Ta Ra Rum Pum','Ace car racer RV and his wife have the world at their feet. But he has an accident and his world is turned upside down. Can he reclaim his lost glory?','/2KfeenEAF4rgGW6wX9o6ejzL53G.jpg','2007-04-27',153,'Released',NULL,'Ta Ra Rum Pum',14165,2.2321,6.19,'zW_CvNUGzQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21703,_binary '\0','/s8W2WMxX6rSlurdMetqNxLBsNiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833557',5.9,6550,'en','Visioneers','Visioneer George Washington Winsterhammerman lives a comfortable but monotonous life in this slightly futuristic black comedy. When people start exploding from stress and George is showing early symptoms, he\'s forced to examine his life. Taking a look at his nice job, his sexless marriage and his resistance to life coaching, George reconsiders the philosophy of happiness through mindless activity.','/n62k6E1V0RjH5bJ1tANEw3XZra8.jpg','2008-06-12',94,'Released','Did you ever feel you were about to explode?','Visioneers',20382,2.2568,5.7,'sM480nMeTVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21704,_binary '\0','/c0oP8T9eeWC32jBsZGgCoX0L93B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833561',6.5,1767,'hi','वह लम्हे','Based upon the life of actress Parveen Babi, this film describes the life of a schizophrenic actress Sana Azim, and the love of her life - Aditya Garewal.','/4JqykmmlLuEoXDOfV33A9PGcNTY.jpg','2006-09-26',132,'Released',NULL,'Woh Lamhe',46432,1.0367,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21705,_binary '\0','/khNT4HVFPcFiMhOOWipwkW18dXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0833960',6.7,5158,'en','Gardens of the Night','After being abducted as children, and suffering years of abuse, a teenage boy and girl find themselves living on the street.','/bhaR49fQIoXZ13MSed8os1R3Z4A.jpg','2008-11-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Gardens of the Night',16867,2.424,6.2,'y710WJF-Vus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21706,_binary '\0','/rT7Kn7aT5owqpPSRSbxUmqRNz4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0834001',6.5,176321,'en','Underworld: Rise of the Lycans','A prequel to the first two Underworld films, this fantasy explains the origins of the feud between the Vampires and the Lycans. Aided by his secret love, Sonja, courageous Lucian leads the Lycans in battle against brutal Vampire king Viktor. Determined to break the king\'s enslavement of his people, Lucian faces off against the Death Dealer army in a bid for Lycan independence.','/yW9gF7rGn8EoV8B8rxOx1xjxVZf.jpg','2009-01-22',92,'Released','Every war has a beginning.','Underworld: Rise of the Lycans',12437,10.4746,6.5,'pexrer4SweU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21707,_binary '\0','/ydhG7zTT5zHv2wjz8groV9G4CsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0834102',6.7,2151,'mk','Сенки','A successful young doctor with a beautiful wife, a happy child, and a comfortable house finds his life suddenly changed in ways he never thought possible after being injured in a serious car accident. To the outside eye Lazar Perkov has everything -- indeed his friends and colleagues have even gone so far as to christen him with the nickname \"Lucky.\" But appearances can sometimes be...','/aJrWSOtYlskcL9IKh23qjjXCZcN.jpg','2007-06-06',120,'Released','Sometimes the dead speak louder than the living.','Shadows',18178,0.7801,5.2,'jvPvZLMFETU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21708,_binary '\0','/apMLs7nB6goZpU7GV4Wnou3THmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0834170',7,2218,'et','Sügisball','Autumn in Estonia, where six people live, six solitudes, prisoners of the monotonous architecture of Soviet-era concrete buildings, in search of human companionship, of love, of a ray of light in an ocean of gray.','/ecW82xTHctX1999ivXOP3uLJnel.jpg','2007-09-13',123,'Released','Film for all men with a gentle soul and a bad liver. For those who stand alone in the night. In their underwear.','Autumn Ball',46847,1.2745,5.5,'E7vUDOXIYwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21709,_binary '\0','/oNofblVwO3VI3a7WqvuAd8UHv8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0834902',6.5,2906,'cn','傷城','In a city of love and prosperity, a city of lost hope and premature death, veteran detective Hei feels it all: the hurt, the helplessness, the horror. When his father-in-law, the billionaire benefactor Kim, is gruesomely murdered in his palatial mansion, he enlists the assistance of his former partner turned private detective.','/xzj1XnM3TIF3OQ95DC94Nsa5zdh.jpg','2006-12-21',110,'Released','The heart is a lonely hunter...','Confession of Pain',18877,2.733,6.3,'6gVgR6p5DtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21710,_binary '\0','/gMFmp0fwKqTh1gUsOYr0FMKP8Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0834938',6.8,1246,'es','Padre nuestro','A Mexican boy smuggles himself to Brooklyn to meet his long-lost father - only to have his identity stolen upon arrival by an impostor who seeks to steal the fathers\' fortune.','/8ZlRI1lDYhRkGM8MDX7KKJWJ0Do.jpg','2007-10-05',110,'Released',NULL,'Blood of My Blood',79983,1.9477,7.3,'HUKxo1eEHBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21711,_binary '\0','/pwXWrg4EKbHoe2AnFuwuBX9G2Gz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0835418',5,9103,'en','The Babymakers','After he flunks a fertility test, a man realizes that the only way he can get his wife pregnant is by robbing a sperm bank to take back the last of the deposits he made there years earlier.','/hiJYF8wPkXVtWrMXni0YlUMJQJw.jpg','2012-08-03',98,'Released','She\'s fired up. He\'s firing blanks.','The Babymakers',98066,4.4194,5,'TGE28RKJD2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21712,_binary '\0','/6bFE0lj2QkcNc6Y9CTSdlqr0WPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0835787',6.8,1527,'ko','해변의 여인','A movie director entices his young friend to come to the beach on the pretext of writing a script. He then starts an affair with the friend\'s girlfriend.','/4Yw28aC4jy9eLvfMqcLyx1GUS4r.jpg','2006-08-31',127,'Released',NULL,'Woman on the Beach',54659,1.5632,6.2,'O4DIbVKvA7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21713,_binary '\0','/5wjCAZ8LrmOsEKS6FcZY8V4AwUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0835802',5.5,1897,'en','Krystal','A young man living a sheltered life develops a crush on a stripper and joins her Alcoholics Anonymous group just so he can be in the same room with her.','/5Do7HKvKPgjiBVJieMAOt8aZXAB.jpg','2018-04-13',90,'Released','She turns men into boys and boys into men.','Krystal',10148,2.6334,5.1,'wCc25I_y7oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21714,_binary '\0','/fe8KVFQxHdJZypSnbEtBpbBUhhV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0835834',7.5,1233,'pl','Pora umierać','An impressionistic, black-and-white portrait of the day-to-day of a nonagenarian woman as she experiences the final act of her life. Danuta Szaflarska stars as Aniela, who lives in a massive yet rapidly-deteriorating wooden house, filled with souvenirs and treasures of eras gone by. Aniela runs into conflict in her dealings with others, particularly a nasty neighbor who sees her property as an eyesore and wants to do everything in his reach to buy it up and tear it down, and her married adult son, who - though kindly - triggers paranoia within Aniela (she cannot help but believe that he is scheming and planning to wheedle the property away from her). Driven aback by these individuals, Aniela finds one of her only sources of comfort and reassurance in her daily talks with her dog, Fila - and develops a great affinity for spying on the neighbors\' doings whenever boredom creeps in.','/fUeBWbv5lmoLdZPRkvo6es1HgKk.jpg','2007-10-19',104,'Released',NULL,'Time to Die',155939,0.7442,7.1,'CMmty_a59KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21715,_binary '\0','/ad1XvK3C1CfzXyL6iZqKYx2yh5N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0836682',7.2,2789,'en','Nocturna','An orphan boy named Tim is afraid of the dark. However, when the stars start going out in the sky, he finds himself exploring the world of the night, alongside his new friend, the Cat Shepherd.','/ulAjLGPTbPtiJS9QsFosNSUhIgY.jpg','2007-10-11',83,'Released',NULL,'Nocturna',26700,2.8402,7.1,'_GEQ3PEPcv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21716,_binary '\0','/q3p1k089JNLzMihnJUZu9tKqOlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0836683',6,1775,'es','Aparecidos','One night Malena and Pablo, a sister and brother traveling together in Argentina, discover a diary that details crimes committed twenty years ago.','/iAKghPD3agGcjUfkvdTfI6lhb5I.jpg','2008-12-12',104,'Released','How Can You Save The Already Dead?','The Appeared',16092,1.6169,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21717,_binary '\0','/dQoQYlnbbI08gotToAO5ZyS1v63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0836700',7.1,8750,'fr','L\'Heure d\'été','After the death of a septuagenarian woman, her three children deliberate over what to do with her estate.','/dUBEHjL1qa5y0uKQauwPdWoMVUM.jpg','2008-03-05',103,'Released',NULL,'Summer Hours',8282,2.408,6.4,'ikERoS8Tvss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21718,_binary '\0','/9QODF6sKJQL7Lw5tUPVW9vRg66W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0836710',6.4,1668,'sv','Underbara älskade','The mother and the younger son in a happy family dies in a car-accident. The father and the teenage-son Jonas survives the accident. Now they have to move on with their lives together.','/ja07dM3gYcAsZjbKDOzefS9ljof.jpg','2006-12-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Suddenly',40785,1.0055,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21719,_binary '\0','/dUg9UcQgfMhTdvLqrHnel5YEMVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837106',6.6,24384,'sv','Arn: Tempelriddaren','Arn, the son of a high-ranking Swedish nobleman is educated in a monastery and sent to the Holy Land as a knight templar to do penance for a forbidden love.','/kN8C9K9bSQ01lItuEqYzROYErAX.jpg','2007-12-25',139,'Released','A Knight in the Holy Land. A Woman in the Frozen North. A War that Kept Them Apart.','Arn: The Knight Templar',13491,4.0082,6.3,'1EAqu28Dd-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21720,_binary '\0','/5VZ3GramsLcNS8RjypzmLU4h5hH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837113',7.4,1764,'en','Codename: Kids Next Door: Operation Z.E.R.O.','The villains of the Kids Next Door, lead by Father, join forces to resurrect the Ultimate Evil, Grandfather, a tyrant who once ruled the world many years ago when most of the villains were themselves kids. However, Father disgraced him that he can\'t even try to destroy the KND and the Villains were quickly betrayed when they are turned into Senior Citizombies, creatures that are immortal and can transform any living creature into one of them and slaves who are forced to make Tapioca to refuel Grandfather so he can find and destroy the Book of K.N.D.','/fwgLVVHcDT2XtR3I9ozHN2CwC0v.jpg','2006-08-11',73,'Released','Every hero starts from zero.','Codename: Kids Next Door: Operation Z.E.R.O.',205081,3.0221,7.966,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21721,_binary '\0','/6UWkQY3osYYH70kzHCxAtadzE4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837156',6.1,9997,'en','Pee-wee\'s Big Holiday','A fateful meeting with a mysterious stranger inspires Pee-wee Herman to take his first-ever holiday.','/k5bZS2NsgVswuThBfyJYaV6T6zu.jpg','2016-03-17',89,'Released','He is back!','Pee-wee\'s Big Holiday',347689,3.1462,6.126,'Quo-Oen1wkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21722,_binary '\0','/5rARlA8beRAVXPYzSaF2NoS8Ry5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837562',7.1,319670,'en','Hotel Transylvania','Welcome to Hotel Transylvania, Dracula\'s lavish five-stake resort, where monsters and their families can live it up and no humans are allowed. One special weekend, Dracula has invited all his best friends to celebrate his beloved daughter Mavis\'s 118th birthday. For Dracula catering to all of these legendary monsters is no problem but the party really starts when one ordinary guy stumbles into the hotel and changes everything!','/eJGvzGrsfe2sqTUPv5IwLWXjVuR.jpg','2012-09-20',91,'Released','Where monsters go to get away from it all.','Hotel Transylvania',76492,22.5236,6.971,'Wv6dx0qKBjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21723,_binary '\0','/8iZjnNSIH4teZERl0VjUeHHVrec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837563',5.7,106693,'en','Pet Sematary','Dr. Louis Creed and his wife, Rachel, move from Boston to Ludlow, in rural Maine, with their two young children. Hidden in the woods near the new family home, Ellie, their eldest daughter, discovers a mysterious cemetery where the pets of community members are buried.','/7SPhr7Qj39vbnfF9O2qHRYaKHAL.jpg','2019-04-04',101,'Released','Sometimes dead is better.','Pet Sematary',157433,14.2221,5.7,'VllcgXSIJkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21724,_binary '\0','/yHNpv4kK6PGzHbz3XmIac8z6vil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837791',4.8,3352,'en','The Devil\'s Chair','With a pocketful of drugs, Nick West takes out his girlfriend Sammy, for a shag and a good time. When they explore an abandoned asylum, the discovery of a bizarre device - a cross between an electric chair and sadistic fetish machine - transforms drugged-out bliss into agony and despair','/qTdheraVT2tTvz9zJV5LgRrcULi.jpg','2007-09-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Chair',20919,2.9549,4.147,'YCGbTeb4USk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21725,_binary '\0','/uACjOVSQ6XoonumbbSVMW6w0fKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837796',4.5,6450,'en','House','Trying to recover from the nearly marriage-breaking stress following the death of their child, Jack and Stephanie spontaneously take off on a road trip. But when their car breaks down in a remote area, they find themselves in a horrific nightmare. Seeking shelter in a house, they soon realize that more danger lurks inside than outside in this spine-chiller based on Ted Dekker and Frank Peretti\'s best-seller.','/5QPnbZLJIO1r6vP9Uejf96V1U1w.jpg','2008-11-06',101,'Released','The guilty cannot hide.','House',14833,3.1812,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21726,_binary '\0','/aBTlOObBe5iYVTikWhqirb93Aog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837800',6.4,1616,'en','The Mark of Cain','After a bomb kills their company commander in Iraq, British soldiers Treacle and Shane are ordered to round up suspects and use torture on the detainees. Back home, the press gets the story and the pair achieves instant infamy.','/cteE3AMNHAgSFMsaFTjvHaVxNXm.jpg','2007-10-18',87,'Released','The scars of war run deep.','The Mark of Cain',14531,2.1886,5.2,'fXKt0zCXyW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21727,_binary '\0','/fCoOG0eE7ct84pwymhvPlJmItqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0837803',4.8,4602,'en','Sex and Breakfast','Two young couples using anonymous sex as a catalyst to fix their troubled relationships must rethink what makes a connection work.','/xLyBfUq2FCnB0V8MmRhf6C4KFeh.jpg','2007-11-29',81,'Released','Inhibition is the enemy...','Sex and Breakfast',15053,2.3824,5.254,'CGFraxRBnBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21728,_binary '\0','/c69Y7M1FYpNDu42axjGQMrwsLCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838192',6.6,1245,'de','Reine Geschmacksache','At 52, traveling salesman Wolfgang Zenker (Edgar Selge) is in old school territory: he peddles the company\'s classic clothing line to boutiques that cater to women over 35. When Wolfi loses his drivers license in his brand-new Mercedes but can\'t afford to lose the season\'s sales because his frustrated wife (Franziska Walser) desperately wants a new bathroom, their son\'s vacation plans take a back seat as Karsten (Florian Bartholomäi) is forced to making sales rounds with his father instead of celebrating his high school graduation in Spain. Also making the rounds in small town southern Germany is successful and attractive sales rival Steven Brookmüller (Roman Knizka), 33. As the men\'s paths cross, long-hidden secrets are revealed and things come to a hilarious head.','/zsm1SBWwQLjn29fN078mFdxWxR9.jpg','2007-08-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Fashion Victims',60850,2.1794,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21729,_binary '\0','/hKJ513GbmTSmTXJU1uCXclh5Wkh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838221',7.2,238676,'en','The Darjeeling Limited','Three American brothers who have not spoken to each other in a year set off on a train voyage across India with a plan to find themselves and bond with each other -- to become brothers again like they used to be. Their \"spiritual quest\", however, veers rapidly off-course (due to events involving over-the-counter pain killers, Indian cough syrup, and pepper spray).','/oSW5OVXTulaIXcoNwJAp5YEKpbP.jpg','2007-09-07',91,'Released','I want us to be brothers again, like we used to be.','The Darjeeling Limited',4538,5.2832,7.14,'aO1bYukdvLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21730,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838231',6.8,1449,'en','Unfinished Sky','An Outback farmer takes in an Afghani woman who has fled from a brothel.','/oWABudeYhleEGyi2vASrbwA0SG2.jpg','2007-08-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Unfinished Sky',103902,1.2365,6.2,'d2sX4emqUq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21731,_binary '\0','/ia6qY2XV4uvrrhSFcqqKZphizXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838232',5.6,52364,'en','The Pink Panther 2','When legendary treasures from around the world are stolen, including the priceless Pink Panther Diamond, Chief Inspector Dreyfus is forced to assign Inspector Clouseau to a team of international detectives and experts charged with catching the thief and retrieving the stolen artifacts.','/aPg6iZjnBUlsmnCSGHX85T82AJ4.jpg','2009-02-06',92,'Released','Inspect the unexpected.','The Pink Panther 2',15159,7.207,5.7,'rXoA6HRjDro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21732,_binary '\0','/zdSWO2kfmw4IZoWv37dAmQXdVgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838233',6.7,1236,'en','A Thousand Years of Good Prayers','The film follows Mr. Shi, a retired widower from Beijing. When his only daughter, Yilan, who lives in Spokane, Washington and works as a librarian, gets divorced, he decides to visit her to help her heal. However, Yilan is not interested. She tries keeping an emotional distance but when this finally fails she begins physically avoiding her father. He confronts her about an affair with a married Russian man and she, in turn, lets loose about all the gossip she\'d heard as a young girl about his alleged affair with a female colleague back in China.','/vBc0NbqTZb1MBOnKNlBHgx1YNvR.jpg','2007-09-25',83,'Released',NULL,'A Thousand Years of Good Prayers',4890,1.7063,6.2,'2NMoc1KCv3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21733,_binary '\0','/qxUxCMfN64oew35HHpF2Axdlco2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838241',6.1,1561,'en','Street Dreams','Derrick Cabrera, like all skateboarders, dreams of being sponsored one day. He has all the talent in the world to make it happen but some major roadblocks to overcome before he can make the dream a reality.','/lu7BaXyDvZgAV2c7uWRo49Xk5bU.jpg','2009-06-12',88,'Released','There are 10 million street skaters in the U.S. alone... This is their story.','Street Dreams',50417,1.3514,6.2,'yt6-TTlB5a8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21734,_binary '\0','/2Ircr5htx54lRNaCgahf7KyIgNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838247',5.9,43290,'en','After.Life','Following a terrible car crash, a woman awakes to find an enigmatic mortician preparing her for burial.','/ty43RTdSBpL3VjBJWeRoKhFg7hF.jpg','2009-11-07',103,'Released','Life is the symptom. Death is the cure.','After.Life',36419,7.6102,6.3,'SGLjqTKtD34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21735,_binary '\0','/sWtZuT1pYDVmUuGbbIfAW4L7l1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838254',5.2,3002,'fa','آتش بس','A couple (Golzar &amp; Afshar) who have been bickering &amp; fighting from day one, are contemplating divorce until by chance they both end up visiting a therapist (Pesiani) who dishes them the secrets of a good relationship. Various episodes from the couple\'s married life are represented as flashbacks in a lighthearted manner.','/ArjTFGU8POraLBIqZPMWZfvpd9Q.jpg','2006-04-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Cease Fire',44074,0.8578,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21736,_binary '\0','/247H2jS9Te9TTmKDcAMg3LN5gmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0838283',6.9,345014,'en','Step Brothers','Brennan Huff and Dale Doback might be grown men. But that doesn\'t stop them from living at home and turning into jealous, competitive stepbrothers when their single parents marry. Brennan\'s constant competition with Dale strains his mom\'s marriage to Dale\'s dad, leaving everyone to wonder whether they\'ll ever see eye to eye.','/nvggBbEraUTAVR6ffP3AaBUWSHs.jpg','2008-07-25',98,'Released','They grow up so fast.','Step Brothers',12133,14.7476,6.563,'CewglxElBK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21737,_binary '\0','/okFPlw9hmtsUbT8AyvEFJjZnsSm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839739',7.2,1475,'en','The Beales of Grey Gardens','Mother and daughter - Big Edie and Little Edie Beale - live with six cats in a crumbling house in East Hampton. Little Edie, in her 50s, who wears scarves and bright colors, sings, mugs for the camera, and talks to Al and David Maysles, the filmmakers. Big Edie, in her 70s, recites poetry, comments on her daughter\'s behavior, and sings \"If I Loved You\" in fine voice. She talks in short sentences; her daughter in volumes. The film is episodic: friends visit, there\'s a small fire in the house, Little Edie goes to the shore and swims. She talks about the Catholic Church. She\'s ashamed that local authorities raided the house because of all the cats. She values being different.','/t9csh8HyBEgp6rW1RQW88ua5iTo.jpg','2006-07-21',91,'Released','Utilizing hours of unseen archival footage, The Beales is a new take on the women of Grey Gardens','The Beales of Grey Gardens',47491,1.2868,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21738,_binary '\0','/isjykga49mt2SVy0rdybYMGnIsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839742',7.1,2281,'en','A Prayer for Rain','Thirty years on from the 1984 Union Carbide plant malfunction, the consequences of which are tragically ongoing, A Prayer for Rain is the powerful and moving story of the Bhopal tragedy, one of the great corporate and environmental scandals of the last half-century. It dramatises the dependence of the local community on the chemical plant that will eventually cause catastrophe, and the series of oversights that led to an event that stands as a benchmark for corporate irresponsibility in the developing world.','/qlO2QOYWnvN8Zd1VXqlKg9t50MA.jpg','2014-12-05',103,'Released','30 years have passed. It\'s time to tell their story.','A Prayer for Rain',258665,2.0754,6.323,'znvcQBua--w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21739,_binary '\0','/aDYpxTWadpqOjYkZgmJNRmtSXq1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839773',5.9,1673,'da','Daisy Diamond','A tragic story about Anna who dreams of one thing only: making it as an actress. She moves from Sweden to Copenhagen to pursue her dream. But fate has something else in store for her. Though she struggles to give her 4-month-old daughter a good start in life, she ultimately fails to unite her dream of acting with a safe and loving environment for her child, culminating in a desperate act that has fatal consequences for Anna and her daughter.','/deiYoL49RvZ6PLTlkC5wiHtFRyY.jpg','2007-11-23',94,'Released',NULL,'Daisy Diamond',35297,2.0221,5.625,'ArPpXeC16mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21740,_binary '\0','/8FSd4MmW9IegQPdpwJfKHcjBvrk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839811',7.1,1610,'ar','في شقة مصر الجديدة','Najwa, a music teacher from the city of Minya, Upper Egypt, seizes the opportunity to come to Cairo on a trip with her students to search for Tahany, her first teacher that taught her music and used to live in an apartment in Heliopolis.','/5rUSem6hMzfVenSRTxfKpB6zOat.jpg','2007-03-14',118,'Released',NULL,'In the Heliopolis Flat',258770,0.8451,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21741,_binary '\0','/ndrSIJ58NXTAAjuqqtt4ZO5Lw5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839880',4.1,3986,'en','Lake Dead','Three sisters and a group of their friends take a trip to the home of the recently deceased grandfather -- who died a particularly grisly death -- to learn more about the promise of an inheritance, only to encounter a family of psychos who have taken up residence in the old man\'s cabin.','/ghGlBeist58eJQkzGUZOPiQQqC3.jpg','2007-11-09',90,'Released','Beneath the calmest surface lies the deepest nightmare.','Lake Dead',14025,1.1434,4.3,'Rv5cyeie7J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21742,_binary '\0','/6VGBULr5lfEHEez5REk6MDTszSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839938',7.1,4254,'en','Out of the Blue','Ordinary people find extraordinary courage in the face of madness. On 13–14 November 1990 that madness came to Aramoana, a small New Zealand seaside town, in the form of a lone gunman with a high-powered semi-automatic rifle. As he stalked his victims the terrified and confused residents were trapped for 24 hours while a handful of under-resourced and under-armed local policemen risked their lives trying to find him and save the survivors. Based on true events.','/ngaAaP0DOxv1QDXVfy085yOpUkA.jpg','2006-10-12',103,'Released','The true story of a small town massacre','Out of the Blue',10844,2.332,6.4,'VijH6syr7rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21743,_binary '\0','/PThabMZiyNediEQduZtNazryc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839949',5.6,1286,'en','A Perfect Day','A family man is warned he has only forty days to live.','/hiuP1MbWva4aSd62EOKoodiMDAo.jpg','2006-12-18',87,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Day',53659,1.889,4.4,'VfoFOwWEfiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21744,_binary '\0','/uYrXySVtP3IicCEOUQNZUmMCeO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839967',8,3053,'ro','Restul e tăcere','In 1911-12, the Romanian movie director Grigore Brezianu and the financial tycoon Leon Popescu made together the 2 hours long movie \"Romania\'s Independence\" - an as faithful as possible screen adaptation of the real Independence War that had been fought in 1877. Now, \"Restul e tacere\" tells us, in a loose and half-fictionalized way, the story of this movie making.','/rhClCWtvABM70xxQlTX5NwGhU67.jpg','2008-03-07',133,'Released',NULL,'The Rest Is Silence',29358,1.0616,6.7,'HaGRpaoaM3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21745,_binary '\0','/yvB9wgUNyArVMDW4knhbEec5Xlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0839980',5.8,89978,'en','Semi-Pro','Jackie Moon is the owner, promoter, coach, and star player of the Flint Michigan Tropics of the American Basketball Association (ABA), the worst team in the league. In 1976 before the ABA collapses, the NBA plans to merge with the best teams of the ABA at the end of the season. Only the top four teams will make the move and the worst teams will fold. If the Tropics want to make it to the NBA, Jackie Moon must rally his team and start winning.','/7KJrvJf96UpkXsWVOjzCo1IbnW6.jpg','2008-02-28',91,'Released','Putting the funk into the dunk.','Semi-Pro',13260,5.5971,5.6,'-gv-sxP-4Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21746,_binary '\0','/76hm9Opobsum55TLo36lBCaTdu1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0840303',5.6,1521,'en','Christmas Do-Over','Kevin just wants a normal Christmas with his son and ex-wife’s family—until a wish makes it Christmas every day. Caught in a festive loop, Kevin learns new talents and big lessons.','/51DoG45RuZCiXJc49MA6QUgX1FX.jpg','2006-12-16',90,'Released','Ever wish Christmas was every day?','Christmas Do-Over',26987,1.7043,5.7,'ig8f3Wgmu20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21747,_binary '\0','/iiZTbKx9lT9vWuITvqRVG6jQgu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0840304',3.2,3201,'en','Ice Spiders','When a young ski team training for the Olympics arrives at the remote and isolated Lost Mountain Ski Resort to focus on training, they\'re thrilled to find a retired Olympic skier is there to help them train. But their plans are halted when a scientist working at a nearby government lab arrives with the horrifying news that a top secret Government project has produced giant spiders and they have escaped, killing and eating everything in sight.','/Asp7hjh1CfZoOxSJ3cr2RiVx3yt.jpg','2007-06-09',90,'Released','Hell Has Just Frozen Over.','Ice Spiders',17306,2.0549,4.2,'fvYCtxAqgN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21748,_binary '\0','/18XYi4dmUp1YVR9kokREH4Nmpa4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0840322',7.1,11610,'en','Forever Strong','Hotshot rugby player Rick Penning was the star player of his Arizona high school team until a fateful brush with the law forces him to ponder the consequences of his actions in a Salt Lake City juvenile detention center.','/zEc17IDqnAAkLiyRcCzPT0oXO7j.jpg','2008-09-26',112,'Released','The greatest victories are born in the heart.','Forever Strong',31451,2.5668,7.1,'sLks2oO2mTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21749,_binary '\0','/owAe5rRStnX7ibVAPmza3NCXjCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0840361',7.5,453818,'en','The Town','A proficient group of thieves rob a bank and hold the manager hostage. Things begin to get complicated when one of the crew members falls in love with her.','/3NIzyXkfylsjflRKSz8Fts3lXzm.jpg','2010-09-15',125,'Released','Welcome to the bank robbery capital of America.','The Town',23168,13.8381,7.226,'bUYlUk1j68A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21750,_binary '\0','/ddTYdFOVJ2OhbaTOcJ7fBbjwA5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0840787',5.8,2625,'en','Nora Roberts\' Carolina Moon','A woman who has psychic visions returns to her hometown to exorcise her demons. Once there she finds both danger and love.','/m7Y94tBFhvnEFya2muyLrpVPogI.jpg','2007-08-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Carolina Moon',24810,2.7455,5.5,'SDt5q523UJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21751,_binary '\0','/7l2Qwo1VfIFv3hT6hM7F513hjLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841027',6,6032,'en','Magicians','A pair of rivaling stage magicians are forced to confront their falling out over a guillotine mishap when they compete in a magic competition.','/bNdA5ebwyaE9gwUUiTrdvQ3Ll6j.jpg','2007-05-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Magicians',10078,1.6071,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21752,_binary '\0','/9euC6vIanP8hw184Mri03yAxC1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841032',4.9,3541,'en','The Perfect Holiday','Nancy Taylor, a divorced mother of three, feels especially lonely during the holidays. All she wants for Christmas is to meet a nice man - even just a nice compliment would make her day. Sensing her sadness, Nancy\'s little girl, Emily, has a plan to make her mom happy again. She shares her Mommy\'s wish with shopping mall Santa, Benjamin Armstrong. And Benjamin, who is also a struggling songwriter, knows exactly the right words to say.','/AoGUYjqPWTyF1DSlM9sJhG8QPGU.jpg','2007-12-12',96,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Holiday',26990,2.126,5.3,'QQsZgY8xF8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21753,_binary '\0','/jyaCqYH5gLEp0Z9oZJ8nQrQM9pA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841044',6.7,32747,'en','2 Days in Paris','Marion and Jack try to rekindle their relationship with a visit to Paris, home of Marion\'s parents — and several of her ex-boyfriends.','/4yf8vcgJtADTTPP0Ltq2KhqLfdE.jpg','2007-02-09',96,'Released','He knew Paris was for lovers, he just didn\'t think they were all hers.','2 Days in Paris',1845,4.7616,6.3,'BePjI5H-tjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21754,_binary '\0','/axg73mVxiZcE9Pzynu2uj1TYIgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841046',6.9,82598,'en','Walk Hard: The Dewey Cox Story','Following a childhood tragedy, Dewey Cox follows a long and winding road to music stardom. Dewey perseveres through changing musical styles, an addiction to nearly every drug known and bouts of uncontrollable rage.','/Aa1IQ4Cuin3d7qIahvPheMmR4E5.jpg','2007-12-21',96,'Released','Life made him tough. Love made him strong. Music made him hard.','Walk Hard: The Dewey Cox Story',6575,5.8213,6.6,'-Mv9PMbpkZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21755,_binary '\0','/gsLIPjKTKA8Hr46Br9Nlc92SsMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841108',5.6,2564,'en','Hannah Takes the Stairs','Hannah is a recent college graduate interning at a Chicago production company. She is crushing on two writers at work, Matt and Paul, who share an office and keep her entertained. Will a relationship with one of them disrupt the delicate balance of their friendship?','/hy0wRpAtjed2yV1WE78gWj4BLrJ.jpg','2007-08-22',83,'Released','When you don\'t know what you want, how can you know who you want?','Hannah Takes the Stairs',5761,1.8612,5.2,'bf0ksFCaeI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21756,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841119',8.1,2843,'en','Lake of Fire','An unflinching look at the how the battle over abortion rights has played out in the United States over the last 15 years.','/uFdUv0neGCpaYLRJN45mnpc0pdR.jpg','2006-09-09',152,'Released','Exploring the Issue that Divides the World','Lake of Fire',44260,1.1772,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21757,_binary '\0','/3YQKH7lzJ4L4rGFi6tnCLYqRxjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841150',7.2,6214,'cn','門徒','A special agent has for 8 years been deep undercover in Asia\'s lucrative organized crime trade as he plays protégé to one of the key players, Banker. Now, Nick has but he has started to feel loyalty to his new environment and to the money.','/giSOmGcEMfRg3hLluMiEtvZPDT1.jpg','2007-02-13',106,'Released','Honor… Obligation… Betrayal… There\'s Only One Choice!','Protégé',16657,2.8145,6.8,'AiY7BbhQCBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21758,_binary '\0','/8ZyLo0z8kYBFzrY6lnBYqb1qy0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841175',7.1,2478,'pt','O Céu de Suely','In northern Brazil, Hermila patiently waits for her husband. However, he has abandoned her. Sexy, restless and resolute, she raffles off \"a night in paradise\" with herself. This beautifully-shot portrait doesn\'t shy away from the burdens of a young scarred woman, but it also celebrates her courage to live according to her own rules.','/6FOBw7lqYBwQiXWV9QtwzFXhNpW.jpg','2006-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Love for Sale',95342,1.5638,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21759,_binary '\0','/f8ZaysR12HMHFkKTYqYZx1rXlKb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841922',6.2,1566,'es','Los Bastardos','A 24 hour period in the lives of Fausto and Jesus, two undocumented Mexican day-laborers in L.A. Each day another task, each day the same pressure to find money. They go about their daily routine, standing on the corner at the Home Improvement Store waiting for work to come. Today, the job they are given is well paid compared to their poor usual wages.','/9IWueGE4lsO3xEvqzd9zsYi5I3C.jpg','2008-05-20',87,'Released',NULL,'The Bastards',8931,1.139,5.284,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21760,_binary '\0','/gdQCvXF7TpBez8F4Ud6Chw94oJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841925',7.2,7245,'es','Luz silenciosa','Johan and his family are Mennonites from the north of Mexico. Against the law of God and Man, Johan falls in love with another woman.','/kniOoQky3GX9ljyzobwRUGFgQUT.jpg','2007-10-12',136,'Released',NULL,'Silent Light',2012,2.5518,6.9,'9mf6CejhaN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21761,_binary '\0','/djFNCjrAoy6g1E0Nx5oKd3zlWye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0841993',4.7,2034,'ja','1303号室','While celebrating with her friends in her new cheaply rented apartment on the thirteenth floor of a building, the young Sayaka unexpectedly jumps off the balcony committing suicide. Her mother goes insane and her older sister, Mariko, decides to investigate the mysterious death of her sister.','/8UsoGkO7UAWv5o3UxVMMcdMdYUv.jpg','2007-06-16',94,'Released','Open the door to the ultimate terror…','Apartment 1303',24417,1.4169,4.8,'F1uSi5z-5AI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21762,_binary '\0','/kokPRmOdEmWZi3SR1dcdvsiq9lF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0842926',7,137901,'en','The Kids Are All Right','Two women, Nic and Jules, brought a son and daughter into the world through artificial insemination. When one of their children reaches age, both kids go behind their mothers\' backs to meet with the donor. Life becomes so much more interesting when the father, two mothers and children start to become attached to each other.','/xQ5XqZc82dDCcGjxY7voRKjhaKQ.jpg','2010-07-09',106,'Released','Nic and Jules had the perfect family, until they met the man who made it all possible.','The Kids Are All Right',39781,5.1002,6.592,'RixlpHKfb6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21763,_binary '\0','/xRTTlWBks6IAmkehS2JjOtzdZXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0842929',6.6,33177,'en','Paranoid Park','A teenage skateboarder becomes suspected of being connected with a security guard who suffered a brutal death in a skate park called \"Paranoid Park\".','/qdxQ8vZJoZuLqU9MXYW2vnRwhan.jpg','2007-07-12',85,'Released','Could you hide a deadly secret?','Paranoid Park',1990,2.4694,6.5,'8-pKxaN34K0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21764,_binary '\0','/sT1zNPFY4imEZNTszcF8Hhssu2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843270',7.6,4937,'zh','疯狂的石头','Three thieves try to steal a valuable jade that is tightly guarded by a security chief. But the security guards are not the only obstacle these thieves are facing. An extremely unlucky internationally known master thief is also trying to get a hand on this piece of precious jade. What would be the final destination of this piece of crazy stone?','/4NVNv2sQKZKb1HtGExUqp3Ukd7f.jpg','2006-06-30',98,'Released','​Humor born out of nowhere.','Crazy Stone',45380,2.6558,7.622,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21765,_binary '\0','/yOPlxFSHKgrnB9KofFJBaKkWx5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843302',6.4,4196,'ja','叫','A detective investigates a series of murders. A possible serial killer might be on a rampage, since the crimes are in the same vicinity, by the same method. However, as evidence points towards the detective, a ghost in red follows him, and he begins questioning his identity. His realization of what seems to be reality results in something far larger and more sinister.','/sAFaKQv2tgGffy4y4cpxPzPmcYH.jpg','2007-02-24',104,'Released','The ghosts of the past always come back.','Retribution',46164,2.3444,6.5,'FZTDfNmQpiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21766,_binary '\0','/6MrXT2kyeoWiruFNkxlhovM3plj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843326',8.2,11064,'te','బొమ్మరిల్లు','Siddu is the son of an over-protective business man. Every decision of his is made by his father, which leads him into frustration. He half-heartedly agrees to become engaged to a rich man\'s daughter, but then falls for a middle-class man\'s daughter called Haasini. The film focuses on his realization that he has to stand on his own and come out of his father\'s protective shell - and try to succeed in love.','/oYN5XJzV9dYGwzq4fmp41xcIaDS.jpg','2006-08-09',168,'Released','Love makes life beautiful...','Bommarillu',31626,1.6486,6.734,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21767,_binary '\0','/i4DC8qD8TWjgTyCYgNRZ7lYqABY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843328',7.6,6807,'te','ఛత్రపతి','Sivaji and his family are uprooted from their community in Sri Lanka and wind up as bonded labourers in Vishakhapatnam. Like his legendary namesake, he rises up to become the saviour of the oppressed.','/f9SjU4lj4jraX9WBYZAasbc79GX.jpg','2005-09-30',158,'Released',NULL,'Chatrapathi',79210,2.5186,7.014,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21768,_binary '\0','/ssdg1U6ValPdos6EekPy8LJDZO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843335',6.2,2865,'te','దేశముదురు','After Bala, who works for a TV channel, gets into trouble with a goon, he is sent away for an out-of-town assignment. There he meets and falls in love with a girl who gets kidnapped by a gangster.','/3d6LhrRYxTv7oG51cmULdBJQ0GN.jpg','2007-01-12',142,'Released',NULL,'Desamuduru',117058,1.4602,5.017,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21769,_binary '\0','/qCPe2T20o8Z04SFtU1c3hv9C3b5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843358',6.8,1840,'en','My Dog Tulip','The story of a man who rescues a German Shepherd and how the two become fast friends. Based on the 1956 memoir of the same name by BBC editor, novelist and memoirist J. R. Ackerley.','/8Q71A1mENLzE8jUlNe1HGybMJKW.jpg','2010-01-05',83,'Released','Sometimes, love really is a bitch.','My Dog Tulip',52032,1.6063,6.4,'nLqkJJEEGlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21770,_binary '\0','/dZwxgej5cKCU5qLgJyb9leYrVin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843372',5.1,2190,'te','సైనికుడు','Siddharth strives to help flood victims and saves the relief material from falling into the wrong hands. This sets off a war between him and a corrupt politician, which leads to many twists and turns.','/oDzzdzyqiVNiOSRmTZQBFkjT5ZO.jpg','2006-11-30',169,'Released',NULL,'Sainikudu',85824,1.1901,6.211,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21771,_binary '\0','/d5akwm4LezKbwLuLCa3ru73YlCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0843850',5.9,1937,'en','Finishing the Game: The Search for a New Bruce Lee','In 1973, martial arts great Bruce Lee died, his final film, Game of Death, left unfinished. With the public hungry for more Lee, movie execs decide to find a replacement. This outrageous satire looks at the entire process, from the oddball candidates to the greed and racial motivations that drive the final decision. There\'s big business in the movies, and Finishing the Game skewers it with an eye for \'70s detail.','/9UwmkpujGoJhgL4Krnm6Fy0IyxD.jpg','2007-01-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Finishing the Game: The Search for a New Bruce Lee',13983,1.3487,5,'wnCKTlV-6MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21772,_binary '\0','/sT8XPGZ0rsL2r52pFotGcAzKAi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844029',2.1,6156,'en','Ace Ventura Jr: Pet Detective','\"I will try to be normal\" 12-year-old Ace Ventura Jr. promises. Thats cool, except whats normal for him is finding missing mutts, kidnapped kitties or gone gators and creating hilarious chaos every step of the way.','/wnLBkPxGn2w8GwHw44MDDFX4R95.jpg','2009-03-24',93,'Released','He\'s the burping, farting, snorting, spitting image of his dad.','Ace Ventura Jr: Pet Detective',15338,3.0971,3.3,'5Iv1xs0hl4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21773,_binary '\0','/pPoaq7dEGA2xP1FNXTCECRuG4JS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844286',6.7,54315,'en','The Brothers Bloom','The Brothers Bloom are the best con men in the world, swindling millionaires with complex scenarios of lust and intrigue. Now they\'ve decided to take on one last job – showing a beautiful and eccentric heiress the time of her life with a romantic adventure that takes them around the world.','/xIz8iwzyjgWGzcIwHKpqhBs77ML.jpg','2008-09-09',114,'Released','They\'d never let the truth come between them.','The Brothers Bloom',21755,4.6727,6.556,'BFwQSk6WWgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21774,_binary '\0','/b5xKYj18Fh1dPlqwOcS9pABwAlW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844319',6.1,1307,'ja','怪談','Japan, 250 years ago. Soetsu is a moneylender who is killed by the cruel samurai Shinzaemon. His body is dumped in the Kasenega-Fuchi river. According to legend, all who drown in the river will never surface again. 20 Years later, Shinkichi, the handsome son of Shinzaemon, coincidentally meets Toyoshiga, the daughter of Soetsu. They fall in love. It is a doomed love, as the spirit of Soetsu is far from dead','/movnIIJVG6LVZaRDsOP2BHiDcx3.jpg','2007-08-04',115,'Released',NULL,'Kaidan',73043,1.6488,6.7,'SIdQHdc6n8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21775,_binary '\0','/dd4KuEWZNoLp733pPmrWFTvhCp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844330',7.4,17982,'en','Persuasion','Anne Elliot was once in love with Frederick Wentworth, a commander in the Royal Navy who was rejected by her snobby parents eight years ago. When the family hits hard times and are forced to rent out their mansion to his brother-in-law, Frederick returns as a captain - but will he remember Anne?','/rDv38jqf3t0n4F9wGkQXBLx7wN9.jpg','2007-04-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Persuasion',13949,3.164,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21776,_binary '\0','/84FkxSPCucyEfGtMnH6gmiC1hyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844347',7.1,2052,'ja','タイヨウのうた','Kaoru has a sickness that hindered her to go out when the sun is up. Despite this sickness, she fell in love with a boy named Koji. If she decides to pursue her love, it will mean risking her life.','/lx1Aoe2CyyBEr2hAagzJbV2Sl1d.jpg','2006-06-17',119,'Released','A girl hated by the sun... A miracle given by the night.','Midnight Sun',62691,1.3066,7.2,'gqpKakxKKr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21777,_binary '\0','/vqQnFM5AkuuPZUa6eUa3MK7bsXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844457',7.4,17234,'de','Nordwand','North Face tells the story of two German climbers Toni Kurz and Andreas Hinterstoisser and their attempt to scale the deadly North Face of the Eiger.','/onTd66RoxdrLKUhtcS1IOwdvjCv.jpg','2008-10-23',126,'Released','A true story','North Face',16436,2.9922,7.2,'7lkEfgPsOa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21778,_binary '\0','/doNIj6jX27hhfcbD6GEb22ydLSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844471',6.9,290117,'en','Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs','Inventor Flint Lockwood creates a machine that makes clouds rain food, enabling the down-and-out citizens of Chewandswallow to feed themselves. But when the falling food reaches gargantuan proportions, Flint must scramble to avert disaster. Can he regain control of the machine and put an end to the wild weather before the town is destroyed?','/qhOhIKf7QEyQ5dMrRUqs5eTX1Oq.jpg','2009-09-17',90,'Released','Prepare to get served.','Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs',22794,18.7903,6.67,'BPH0ct2oXBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21779,_binary '\0','/ywsta3d1MtV0MjQXs6uu0nnMjxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844479',6.3,80679,'en','The Collector','Desperate to repay his debt to his ex-wife, an ex-con plots a heist at his new employer\'s country home, unaware that a second criminal has also targeted the property, and rigged it with a series of deadly traps.','/e33HSokiAxhj8ptpAr2xAU4jnd8.jpg','2009-07-09',90,'Released','He always takes one','The Collector',21407,8.3235,6.6,'EE1sL7QWL5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21780,_binary '\0','/n73pshsMK0rHyl5bjNcV882OoF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844666',5,4159,'en','Blackout','Three people from different walks of life find themselves trapped inside a stalled elevator. What at first seems like an inconvenience rapidly escalates into a nightmare.','/a6Z2OGtGTolqfmGaMvuVi8CUSxq.jpg','2008-05-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Blackout',16611,1.4725,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21781,_binary '\0','/geuDBT7for76MkmeyO1yN7Y7YxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844671',4.6,12898,'en','College','A wild weekend is in store for three high school seniors who visit a local college campus as prospective freshmen.','/lY2AHNzHEtlWLisRj0ezSRmnDAt.jpg','2008-08-28',94,'Released','Best. Weekend. Ever.','College',13991,2.3344,4.652,'_tv93-6uHl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21782,_binary '\0','/114yPZmKgsQVTSt0BDx5WagBOvW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844708',6.5,109351,'en','The Last House on the Left','When athletic teen Mari Collingwood opts to hang out with her friend Paige in town rather than spend an evening in with her parents vacationing at the family\'s remote lake house, it marks the beginning of a night no one is going to forget.','/2Y35XCUS8U8vC8vs0HDEVkPu1BM.jpg','2009-03-13',113,'Released','If bad people hurt someone you love, how far would you go to hurt them back?','The Last House on the Left',18405,8.5923,6.5,'2EZyJxabVck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21783,_binary '\0','/k5bAZUer22aXtlZfhjpXNTuzAYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844761',7.6,1797,'en','This Filthy World','In this filmed version of cult film director John Waters\' popular one-man show, the Pink Flamingos and A Dirty Shame director takes the stage to discuss everything from his early influences, fondest career memories, and notorious struggles against the MPAA rating system. Part endearing memoir and part hilarious lecture, This Filthy World touches on everything from the insanity of contemporary pop culture to the director\'s unforgettable early collaborations with inimitable Pink Flamingos star Divine.','/eQS4FYQ5ba5urrcLGUEyP7P6ljB.jpg','2006-11-24',86,'Released','John Waters brings his unique world view to theatre audiences.','This Filthy World',47658,1.619,7.6,'5ECWd_YXjtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21784,_binary '\0','/wNsEfWWAkwzo6meuzidiR7X0XRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844768',6.2,1696,'en','Wild West Comedy Show: 30 Days & 30 Nights - Hollywood to the Heartland','In the spirit of the old west variety shows, Vaughn played host to the ensemble of comedians and performed improvisational sketches with surprise celebrity and musical guests. The film chronicles the journey of Vaughn and the comedians as travel over 6,000 miles and perform 30 shows in 30 consecutive nights in cities across the nation.','/3wC87PJ84NAg18Mwy9ZDN7TlCHR.jpg','2006-09-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Wild West Comedy Show: 30 Days & 30 Nights - Hollywood to the Heartland',32666,1.934,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21785,_binary '\0','/rQkF0by2AmYTOlTd1ynlvnsif2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844794',7.1,17595,'en','Northanger Abbey','A young woman\'s penchant for sensational Gothic novels leads to misunderstandings in the matters of the heart.','/gEuCp3fiWp3SBy2gnLR4HH2iAVQ.jpg','2007-10-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Northanger Abbey',18093,3.3928,6.8,'84pIV2MjYLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21786,_binary '\0','/soXbrOOu5mo1hK1i4fPhSF76C9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844894',3.9,8448,'en','Species: The Awakening','A scientist, Dr. Hollander, takes his niece Miranda to Mexico in an attempt to reverse the effects of the alien DNA he used to create her. However the treatment goes horribly wrong, and sets Miranda on a killing spree as she sets out to find a mate.','/wPsu2NM0eUpoqycgjjnRJIwxK13.jpg','2007-10-17',98,'Released','Irresistible beauty. Unstoppable instincts.','Species: The Awakening',15212,5.1667,4.666,'jDt8xJXoHaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21787,_binary '\0','/iBqBY74J0DZ9QPZSfuHMWfjwdGW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844948',6.4,2458,'no','Varg Veum - Bitre blomster','Karsten Aslaksen, chief engineer of a large chemical company, disappears without trace. His married lover, a successful politician named Vibeke Farang, approaches private investigator Varg Veum to track him down discreetly.','/cgSuKTdjdej79OFddifggwbqQSP.jpg','2007-09-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Varg Veum - Bitter Flowers',16686,1.9933,5.9,'az-3DrrFLiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21788,_binary '\0','/75P2ocwRhLuxNDJ5HrNFjtiqEqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0844993',4.7,15070,'en','Hoodwinked Too! Hood VS. Evil','Red Riding Hood is training in the group of Sister Hoods, when she and the Wolf are called to examine the sudden mysterious disappearance of Hansel and Gretel.','/3ofAJDO8A7ulJwgMGKcwEOPNWV3.jpg','2011-04-29',86,'Released','Not all fairy tales go by the book.','Hoodwinked Too! Hood VS. Evil',57089,6.0699,5.2,'74JYfPAFLCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21789,_binary '\0','/v6O8vBT6vlzVIC35wWe3TR7RIi0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845046',7,33839,'en','Son of Rambow','Will is looking for an escape from his family when he encounters Lee, the school bully. Armed with a video camera and a copy of Rambo, Lee plans to make his own action-packed video epic.','/hOCdlpTs91eDohj5LhCGQF4bxqe.jpg','2007-01-22',95,'Released','Make believe. Not war.','Son of Rambow',13258,4.0572,6.728,'hMsRJE9UM3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21790,_binary '\0','/aoRMMAjVBWRThq5yYQ5s6KK98pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845424',2.5,4288,'tr','Araf','Eda and Cenk are a young couple who met and married during their college years. Their happiness is sealed when Eda learns she is expecting a baby. However, as her pregnancy progresses, Eda begins to experience unusual events. A soul stuck between heaven and hell has returned to earth to seek revenge. As Eda struggles to awaken from this relentless nightmare, an unprecedented horror will engulf the young couple.','/4XhBOBVhe2Kuq6dop38OEPNaWvy.jpg','2006-01-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Araf',32312,1.4229,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21791,_binary '\0','/mW1gMqO2pdAPDKPIFLEVDXdWFoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845439',7.6,14931,'fa','چهارشنبه سوری','Rouhi, a young bride-to-be, is hired as a maid for an affluent family in Tehran. Upon arriving, she is suddenly thrust into an explosive domestic conflict. The wife is convinced her husband is having an affair and enlists Rouhi as a spy, to follow her husband, and confirm her suspicions. What Rouhi discovers, however, threatens not only their marriage but her own future.','/7PHP13zg4Ym5kzTwts6WM2xovxn.jpg','2006-02-08',102,'Released',NULL,'Fireworks Wednesday',43766,1.2837,7.418,'rvv67kVjKjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21792,_binary '\0','/vX51ZEwLuVrKpeX1o7Eo4KTroX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845442',5.4,1686,'ko','신데렐라','With a renowned plastic surgeon for a mother, Hyun-soo is always surrounded by girls in line for beauty consultations. But her happiness comes to an end as her friends who have received facial surgery from her mother start to commit mysterious suicides by cutting out their faces.','/meRMLuM4Hd29TPA3J0t15xVqRzY.jpg','2006-08-17',94,'Released','Beauty is only a cut-away.','Cinderella',41401,1.4655,6.1,'PvJclItUhfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21793,_binary '\0','/kUwdutAY5MveQMkhkmYcsERni4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845448',7.6,23417,'hi','धमाल','Four friends meet an underworld don who, on his deathbed, clues them in on hidden treasure buried in Goa. The group race towards Goa, not knowing that their plans will soon be foiled, albeit hilariously, by a police officer, who is also after the money.','/pQgU9W1OyHDxBOZcJpVLc2E8gQa.jpg','2007-09-07',135,'Released',NULL,'Dhamaal',20413,1.6911,6.8,'2VaA6wiu5P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21794,_binary '\0','/fURkrWhK03gtLFJvMSa7lKvhf6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845452',6.8,2080,'tr','Eve Dönüş','September 1980. Mustafa \'Mehmet Ali Alabora\' and his wife, who\'re both laborers are married for 5 years. The couple has nothing to do with politics and spend their days happily with their 3 year old daughter and their TV, despite the clamor of guns clashing outside every night. One Friday morning, they wake up and hear the voice of Hasan Mutlucan on radio and observe soldiers marching through the streets, the very confirmation of the military coup that has taken place. Arrests begin instantly in workplace and neighborhood. Yet Mustafa, far from being disturbed, assumes that all apprehensions must have rightful reasons. Until the night he\'s taken into custody, charged with the crimes of a militant code named \"Sehmuz\".','/ksTG2MRGFajc12tZ6EYjaepk24K.jpg','2006-11-03',101,'Released',NULL,'Home Coming',52130,1.8913,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21795,_binary '\0','/3CsHGtb2lPH7CArgz2xGeYHzFFa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845474',6.3,2898,'tr','Küçük Kıyamet','Having lost her mother in the 1999 earthquake, Bilge and her family go on a vacation to the south. On the way to their rented house, she sees a series of visions. Things get worse when a small earthquake occurs, bringing back memories of her loss and releasing her inner demons.','/cZ66GfBwI7Ah1WuW7eR7DK6qoZj.jpg','2006-12-22',90,'Released',NULL,'The Little Apocalypse',52137,2.0752,5.364,'UG49hDXSXx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21796,_binary '\0','/tESEx8Ly3a9HJ6GGTxeyGaHmMNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0845537',6.8,7110,'tr','Son Osmanlı: Yandım Ali','After the First World War, the Allies occupy Istanbul. The protagonist, Yandim Ali is a rogue, discharged from the navy, who doesn\'t believe that the country can be saved, until he meets Mustafa Kemal (Ataturk), who plans to start a resistance in Anatolia against the occupying Allies, as well as the collaborators of an Ottoman government, that exists only on paper.','/la8LmZSfBgGZKd7uDssR7EjAHCD.jpg','2007-01-19',119,'Released',NULL,'The Last Ottoman: Knockout Ali',54269,1.2754,6.4,'Fcy8iohlC3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21797,_binary '\0','/jzt28N70y6LJ3chW618Z5tdS8FA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0846017',6.2,2008,'cn','鐵三角','Life has not been kind to drinking buddies Sam, Fai, and Mok as they struggle to make ends meet, until one stormy evening when a mysterious old man appears before them in a bar with a \'get rich quick\' scheme: an ancient treasure buried under a high-security government building.','/2BhKMrlbuwTbaQZAvxRLF7FF7kE.jpg','2007-10-01',93,'Released','Temptation. Jealousy. Destiny.','Triangle',32151,1.8455,6.5,'F1ndN1QVTSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21798,_binary '\0','/wYA0JQkcveqKpc3dC0TOTpKdanG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0846040',7,6947,'it','Mio fratello è figlio unico','Accio and Manrico are siblings from a working-class family in 1960s Italy: older Manrico is handsome, charismatic, and loved by all, while younger Accio is sulky, hot-headed, and treats life as a battleground — much to his parents\' chagrin. After the former is drawn into left-wing politics, Accio joins the fascists out of spite, but his flimsy beliefs are put to test when he falls for Manrico\'s like-minded girlfriend.','/rSOjjhIY9OidNPqgJcguGfHeTg.jpg','2007-03-28',108,'Released','Sometimes the things we fight about are what brings us closest together.','My Brother Is an Only Child',9789,2.7037,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21799,_binary '\0','/vstpnfQNVyilkmXjmCzfIVwGwjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0846308',6.5,6683,'en','Kit Kittredge: An American Girl','The Great Depression hits home for nine year old Kit Kittredge when her dad loses his business and leaves to find work. Oscar nominee Abigail Breslin stars as Kit, leading a splendid cast in the first ever \"American Girl\" theatrical movie. In order to keep their home, Kit and her mother must take in boarders - paying house - guests who turn out to be full of fascinating stories. When mother\'s lockbox containing all their money is stolen, Kit\'s new hobo friend Will is the prime suspect. Kit refuses to believe that Will would steal, and her efforts to sniff out the real story get her and friends into big trouble. The police say the robbery was an inside job, committed by someone they know. So if it wasn\'t Will, then who did it.','/niHi0hJSryO5DpSVNCMASc3EELc.jpg','2008-07-02',100,'Released','Kit Kittredge, a resourceful young girl, helps her mother run a boardinghouse after her father loses his job.','Kit Kittredge: An American Girl',8359,3.0526,6.469,'F_tl7YF2tFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21800,_binary '\0','/iw4Q9ugphYb6nguDyNKMyW8q6zc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0846713',4.2,1218,'en','Maneater','When a dismembered body is found in the Appalachian Mountains, a county Sheriff is shocked to discover that the predator is a six-hundred pound Bengal tiger.','/vMVx3okb05J3CxCRGx8IY9QiDlJ.jpg','2007-07-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Maneater',30938,1.6741,4.6,'lf6oHJF4O1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21801,_binary '\0','/v4yu1doU0QeLduwmhFqkDrE34d4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847050',7.2,3309,'ku','نیوه مانگ','Mamo, an old and legendary Kurdish musician living in Iran, plans to give one final concert in Iraqi Kurdistan. After seven months of trying to get a permit and rounding up his ten sons, he sets out for the long and troublesome journey in a derelict bus, denying a recurring vision of his own death at half moon. Halfway the party halts at a small village to pick up female singer Hesho, which will only add to the difficulty of the undertaking, as it is forbidden for Iranian women to sing in public, let alone in the company of men. But Mamo is determined to carry through, if not for the gullible antics of the bus driver.','/1GzUo9d4E6K13j9xbLmNc5ouNVj.jpg','2006-08-21',108,'Released','A passion able to cross borders.','Half Moon',43985,1.1783,6.5,'FirNV9DfoUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21802,_binary '\0','/yrLH3f5ZUDQVGv5RJT2BUX1BEwP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847154',7,1276,'pt','Anjos do Sol','In Northeastern Brazil, twelve-year-old Maria is sold to have a better life as a housemaid. However, Maria is resold and sent to a brothel in the Amazon gold fields and put to work by the despicable Saraiva.','/8BEucdM9eJ27omJACKfwfhTGSa6.jpg','2006-03-04',92,'Released','You need to know this story.','Angels of the Sun',37993,1.6301,6.9,'rbGItqe9Kdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21803,_binary '\0','/voeohYDmWCmkzg5XDnh9hQe9FO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847161',5.2,1833,'en','Dracula','The Romanian count known as Dracula is summoned to London by Arthur Holmwood, a young Lord who is one the verge of being wed. Unknown to Arthur\'s future bride Lucy, her future husband is infected with syphilis and therefore cannot consummate their marriage. Arthur has laid his hopes of being cured on the enigmatic count; as it is said that Dracula has extraordinary powers. But these supernatural powers have sinister origins. The Count is a vampire. Soon Arthur realizes his serious mistake as all hell breaks loose and the Count infects others with his ancient curse. But Dracula has not counted on the young Lord acquiring the assistance of the Dutch Vampire expert Prof. Abraham Van Helsing.','/d3f2Be6nIIrdu7B9yl5jup2ZL8w.jpg','2006-12-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Dracula',40631,1.6738,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21804,_binary '\0','/aytZusrwoW5F5s6slH0dm0rYbXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847167',6.3,4516,'en','The Girl in the Park','A mother, enduringly traumatized by the disappearance of her three-year old daughter 15 years ago, has cut herself off from her ex-husband and son. However, when a troubled young woman with a checkered past enters her life, old psychic wounds painfully resurface, as does the illogical and increasingly irrational hope that the young woman may be the daughter she lost so long ago.','/2BK61BwA9rWjfOtWVbwJtM70IiW.jpg','2007-09-09',109,'Released','A mother\'s love never dies.','The Girl in the Park',16204,3.2949,6,'ydgPzxl7HdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21805,_binary '\0','/fqNMqfKFq7UxPpPyf7DeYzDa61R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847182',6.2,7954,'en','Mansfield Park','Fanny Price is sent to live with her wealthy relatives, the Bertrams, where she is treated poorly by most except her cousin Edmund. Her life is complicated by the arrival of the worldly Mary and Henry Crawford','/vnjpMB6wJymfpX3CraHw3zeXONF.jpg','2007-03-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Mansfield Park',16236,3.4611,6.095,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21806,_binary '\0','/bRJw7IYsJIiPyWePSiiHNstmeJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847520',4.1,3059,'en','Scar','Joan Burrows returns to her hometown for her niece\'s graduation, only to be confronted by the serial killer she thought she offed years ago -- after he kidnapped and tormented her and her best friend.','/rGriXcu1LouvATDIE5AqUvEcs1W.jpg','2007-05-19',84,'Released','Some Wounds Never Heal','Scar',24499,1.9706,4.318,'4wd4CqQmsBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21807,_binary '\0','/i7KYJQAk3OjvOzCFguuye5Rivmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847526',5.8,1368,'en','Sugarhouse','Determined to kill his wife\'s lover, a middle-class accountant attempts to purchase a .38 from an inner-city crackhead, unaware the gun actually belongs to a psychotic drug lord who\'d kill to get his weapon back.','/pdAJFLq569E48Oz4hJgtqVgFYl2.jpg','2007-08-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Sugarhouse',52764,1.708,5.5,'mv68H46_lEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21808,_binary '\0','/asFQViBQ0LraXtFZOI1TwTCkSPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847745',5.5,2368,'it','Manuale d\'amore 2 (capitoli successivi)','Paralyzed from a crash, Nicola falls for his physiotherapist Lucia. Franco and Manuela seek fertility treatment in Barcelona. Filippo and Fosco, a gay couple, plan their wedding. Ernesto, a waiter, has an affair with Spanish cook Cecilia.','/2mDPqJ8HQNs9oyziI88EelJCzoO.jpg','2007-01-19',125,'Released',NULL,'Manual of Love 2',20069,3.1322,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21809,_binary '\0','/d6wAzGpnIXDZznEuqGNCEqb33Qy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847817',7.2,8481,'en','Helvetica','Helvetica is a feature-length independent film about typography, graphic design and global visual culture. It looks at the proliferation of one typeface (which will celebrate its 50th birthday in 2007) as part of a larger conversation about the way type affects our lives. The film is an exploration of urban spaces in major cities and the type that inhabits them, and a fluid discussion with renowned designers about their work, the creative process, and the choices and aesthetics behind their use of type.','/s47TOnvnwfSnAflQvsBxJbOLnmP.jpg','2007-09-12',80,'Released','Typography, Graphic Design and Global Visual Culture','Helvetica',13348,1.5637,7.2,'wkoX0pEwSCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21810,_binary '\0','/c1L67dzf8sLTPBSl6i0g6sYqzdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847825',4.8,1995,'en','The Speed of Thought','Joshua Lazarus (Nick Stahl) is a telepath who has been raised in a NSA foster home. Lazarus helps the government by using his abilities. He is told by the agency that the telepathy is a side effect of Widmann\'s Disease, and that he will become insane in time and eventually die from the illness. However, Lazarus meets a woman with similar powers (Mía Maestro) who does not have any sign of the disease, launching Lazarus to confront the lies he has been told','/iesdeGm2Honb13C6HrchbajnbS.jpg','2011-04-29',94,'Released','They know Everything but the Truth','The Speed of Thought',60164,2.2623,4.5,'_-Z__sPOCnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21811,_binary '\0','/eVFXgMabDcQIFcXYLJgnBHRATNT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847877',6.5,1381,'ru','Эйфория','They saw each other only once. At a wedding with lots of alcohol. Their eyes met and that was it. They didn\'t understand rationally what happened to them but they felt that they cannot keep living and breathing without each other. Cosmic magnetism with irresistible intensity pulled them together. They no longer belonged to themselves, their families and friends and that\'s how a tragedy evolves.','/bZVSkGNqd4oz3rhqbhIeIpvAEKy.jpg','2006-02-11',74,'Released','Love is strong as death; jealousy is terrible as hell','Euphoria',72891,1.2951,5.7,'v_cATYchsJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21812,_binary '\0','/dfViHCYAIEm3BVaCu1zk4GvugIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847880',7.1,14275,'ru','Груз 200','While returning to Leningrad from a visit to his brother, Professor Artyom\'s car breaks down and he finds assistance at an isolated farmhouse occupied by Alexey, his wife, a Vietnamese laborer, and a stranger who wanders around the farm. When his car is repaired, Artyom leaves, drunk on moonshine, and students Valera and Angelika arrive. After Valera gets drunk, the stranger abducts Angelika.','/8F0vN9BNabjIO6edSlFe3RB7dCy.jpg','2007-06-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Cargo 200',34869,2.6968,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21813,_binary '\0','/vy2gH0Sx4aGfHQGzQr3v6qynNmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0847897',6.1,1855,'en','The Stone Angel','The feisty aging Hagar Shipley has lived an unconventional life. Her rebellious heart has always ruled and her choices have put her at odds with family and friends. Faced with her own mortality, and desperate to find solace, she goes on the run. In both the past and the present, she is forced to come to terms with the pain and pleasure, the disappointments and the exhilarations of her life.','/iUmjFO2ZjdbqLvSyX4CENOY1aRI.jpg','2007-09-12',116,'Released','Sometimes it takes your whole life to get it right.','The Stone Angel',14634,2.0112,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21814,_binary '\0','/9BBTo63ANSmhC4e6r62OJFuK2GL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848228',8,1583157,'en','The Avengers','When an unexpected enemy emerges and threatens global safety and security, Nick Fury, director of the international peacekeeping agency known as S.H.I.E.L.D., finds himself in need of a team to pull the world back from the brink of disaster. Spanning the globe, a daring recruitment effort begins!','/RYMX2wcKCBAr24UyPD7xwmjaTn.jpg','2012-04-25',143,'Released','Some assembly required.','The Avengers',24428,68.7592,8.078,'eOrNdBpGMv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21815,_binary '\0','/fw002ZpDu8OqnNk1dEhhtF037YI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848281',5.6,3897,'en','The Deal','Charlie Berns is a veteran Hollywood movie producer who has given up on his career and life. That is until his idealistic screenwriter nephew comes bearing the script of a lifetime and Charlie decides to give his career one final shot. The only thing standing in his way is Diedre Hearn, a sharp-witted studio executive brought in to keep Charlie in line.','/mFv4W2S7t3bygIYOweDd14FSRph.jpg','2008-11-20',98,'Released',NULL,'The Deal',16511,2.651,5.4,'cJ1ypLMHnbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21816,_binary '\0','/zFyuN8vF2XNSzxIdACES0IyNrhK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848537',6.6,115280,'en','Epic','A teenager finds herself transported to a deep forest setting where a battle between the forces of good and the forces of evil is taking place. She bands together with a rag-tag group characters in order to save their world—and ours.','/81cSsWzjTfR3cJSqnTiHwy1eyPK.jpg','2013-05-15',102,'Released','Discover a world beyond your imagination.','Epic',116711,11.5088,6.6,'9G_gOvATM8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21817,_binary '\0','/2h6LQBRGuzMkqFvazRx4fZFiU7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848538',4.8,3958,'zh','功夫灌篮','Shi-Jie is a brilliant martial artist from the Kung Fu School. One day, he encounters a group of youths playing basketball and shows off how easy it is for him, with his martial arts training, to do a Slam Dunk. Watching him was Chen-Li, a shrewd businessman, who recruits him to play varsity basketball at the local university.','/cNxnBgszvHzx2QrqCORhhzl6JcM.jpg','2008-02-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Kung Fu Dunk',17108,2.8703,6,'nmnXFKJv8Z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21818,_binary '\0','/yYKHcFFpBodfYideeIniUDFez7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848542',7.3,3188,'en','Arranged','ARRANGED centers on the friendship between an Orthodox Jewish woman and a Muslim woman who meet as first-year teachers at a public school in Brooklyn. Over the course of the year they learn they share much in common - not least of which is that they are both going through the process of arranged marriages.','/yzgj2voZLFoeZOv3eCowTgbluu7.jpg','2007-03-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Arranged',18290,2.5048,6.2,'wPnYPtbjUVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21819,_binary '\0','/oXwyU1RQEhF2e5fncI16hj0QMof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848552',4.7,2006,'en','The Mad','A doctor and his teenage daughter are trapped in a truck stop, and terrorized by a horde of flesh-eating zombies.','/nNo3xYVDwpZnDOX4iLU8a9Bcubl.jpg','2007-05-22',83,'Released','The dead will feed','The Mad',24632,1.3936,5.4,'q7oV6aAyqvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21820,_binary '\0','/Gfk1gYXbEUKynbdTHza5DaPWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0848557',5.5,51382,'en','Diary of the Dead','A group of young filmmakers encounter real zombies while filming a horror movie of their own.','/tGktSJW5dPf8QIjmcqum4KOEZPZ.jpg','2007-05-26',96,'Released','Where will you be when the end begins?','Diary of the Dead',13025,6.4065,5.5,'c_8kL7L7arE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21821,_binary '\0','/vLUqy3lVMvtdOMwa5ToIxlXa3cJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0850253',6.6,15617,'en','Battle in Seattle','Thousands of activists arrive in Seattle, Washington in masses to protest the WTO Ministerial Conference of 1999 (World Trade Organization). Although it began as a peaceful protest with a goal of stopping the WTO talks, it escalated into a full-scale riot and eventually, a State of Emergency that pitted protesters against the Seattle Police Department and the National Guard.','/jO8tKM4mCMXpLVd5GnmlfJByghF.jpg','2007-09-07',99,'Released','Six lives, six battles, one city.','Battle in Seattle',13177,3.886,6.3,'pQyaZ8wlNCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21822,_binary '\0','/AmFI0bO30mOxdqmPrD0swnSxldI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0850667',6.7,3767,'en','Faith Like Potatoes','Frank Rautenbach leads a strong cast as Angus Buchan, a Zambian farmer of Scottish heritage, who leaves his farm in the midst of political unrest and racially charged land reclaims and travels south with his family to start a better life in KwaZulu Natal,South Africa.','/aDbCnYtGf850s9EfU3LOh1gejm4.jpg','2006-10-27',116,'Released','Where\'s there\'s love there\'s hope','Faith Like Potatoes',29697,1.7622,7.4,'vVE5-sd4IQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21823,_binary '\0','/iYcYlFINz3vCFRlYl87yjeq4IhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0850669',5.3,2930,'en','Slacker Uprising','Michael Moore visits colleges in swing states during the 2004 election with a goal to encourage 18–29 year olds to vote.','/aZappNo0qadtT2qyrPREAZ6GVoZ.jpg','2007-09-07',97,'Released','They slept till noon… but still had time to vote','Slacker Uprising',13516,1.7139,5.3,'TJEtX9m2J8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21824,_binary '\0','/aCK5ty4EFSaeqjdqMzlcWnj4DA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0850677',4.5,3363,'en','Jack & Diane','The romance between two teenage girls quickly manifests as terrifying, violent and inexplicable.','/yz7Fck16GLYTL0CK6EfDYIqrhEl.jpg','2012-11-02',110,'Released','Love is a monster.','Jack & Diane',105531,1.6957,4,'hWGDNaj-oSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21825,_binary '\0','/nYrWLaYTMSr9MKH1awmdrnL7Poy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851430',7.1,5882,'en','My Boy Jack','Author Rudyard Kipling and his wife search for their 17-year-old son after he goes missing during WWI.','/ugsEKXt0VVlUfns0VUUgggFPbmh.jpg','2007-11-11',93,'Released','A young man fights for his country.','My Boy Jack',25143,1.8935,6.6,'7dMSHbGFf1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21826,_binary '\0','/1UJdkLLBDZBCXrgfv2bnU9hhfMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851515',7.4,2852,'zh','疯狂的赛车','Assassins, scammers, gangsters, cops, a washed-up bicycle racer, and a body continually cross paths; usually with negative outcomes.','/ggTqQBLLiDx2MRBp4q3hOPsXDcV.jpg','2009-01-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Crazy Racer',33106,1.5776,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21827,_binary '\0','/roePaYv9lb1h5lYqEKmL0iXPhTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851530',5.7,5842,'en','The Lodger','Follows a seasoned detective on the trail of a ruthless killer intent on slaughtering prostitutes along West Hollywood\'s Sunset Strip. It appears that the murderer\'s grisly methods are identical to that of London\'s infamous 19th century psychopath Jack the Ripper – a relentless serial killer who was never caught by police. To make matters worse, the detective soon notices the parallels between the crimes committed by the West Hollywood stalker and those of a serial murderer incarcerated years ago. Could the wrong man be behind bars?','/prfQla0ZriFC9PecssAiladiby4.jpg','2009-01-14',95,'Released','Everyone is suspect.','The Lodger',15052,2.9278,5.7,'R5C47hShhEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21828,_binary '\0','/nWUSXWOvm3rQwwVm7kgclTt9uRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851532',6.7,1676,'zh','梅蘭芳','The epic story Mei Lanfang, who overcame the prejudice against artists in 1930s China to become the country\'s greatest opera star.','/dRmQBP1AAt3NgQ2WgVSjy4upEYu.jpg','2008-12-05',146,'Released',NULL,'Forever Enthralled',44837,1.3028,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21829,_binary '\0','/lG7r39HFZrc9B7agZcWZNmInz3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851577',7.8,13423,'ru','Остров','Somewhere in Northern Russia in a small Russian Orthodox monastery lives an unusual man whose bizarre conduct confuses his fellow monks, while others who visit the island believe that the man has the power to heal, exorcise demons and foretell the future.','/wSDxhbDj95lsE25myWgJuWYCyzI.jpg','2006-11-23',112,'Released',NULL,'The Island',22358,1.6791,7,'jTpSSQdVegc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21830,_binary '\0','/3fgcEjBNrhstYgPlG1c8WT7UpIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0851578',7.7,115808,'ja','パプリカ','Dr. Atsuko Chiba is a research psychologist who uses a device called the DC Mini to enter her patients\' dreams, wherein she adopts the alter-ego \"Paprika\". When the device is stolen, she must stop rogue elements from merging the dream and waking worlds.','/nHJljo2Pi7XimYEgV9hvRchQWmg.jpg','2006-10-01',90,'Released','This is your brain on anime.','Paprika',4977,10.0528,7.8,'PIUqozzyW2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21831,_binary '\0','/vz6iY1MtETWRtZMn379JYZGVCX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0852713',5.6,97148,'en','The House Bunny','Shelley is living a carefree life until a rival gets her tossed out of the Playboy Mansion. With nowhere to go, fate delivers her to the sorority girls from Zeta Alpha Zeta. Unless they can sign a new pledge class, the seven socially clueless women will lose their house to the scheming girls of Phi Iota Mu. In order to accomplish their goal, they need Shelley to teach them the ways of makeup and men; at the same time, Shelley needs some of what the Zetas have - a sense of individuality. The combination leads all the girls to learn how to stop pretending and start being themselves.','/4oGGJ824vqIqDtyMvMuK44pDEmx.jpg','2008-08-22',97,'Released','For the girls of ZETA house college life was no party, until Shelley showed up.','The House Bunny',12620,12.1508,5.684,'cBGZbm8ipPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21832,_binary '\0','/trRiN0nO2QtflDRUV8tqPIM0YQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0852726',6,2958,'ja','悪夢探偵','When a number of suicide victims slash themselves in their sleep, detective Keiko Kirishima is called to investigate.','/thfveexklQEuFf0X9Y1MGYYkr3l.jpg','2007-01-13',105,'Released','You die in the dream, you die for real.','Nightmare Detective',43713,1.7615,6.1,'pwGUboh4jKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21833,_binary '\0','/fy9DOJO07EaVun1HcGdjFAVdtkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0853060',7,3383,'de','Deutschland. Ein Sommermärchen','A documentary of the German national soccer team’s 2006 World Cup experience that changed the face of modern Germany.','/pQ7p8zGxy0OTy6RwDA0Y2mlqmdu.jpg','2006-10-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Germany: A Summer\'s Fairytale',286,1.1135,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21834,_binary '\0','/24Zl2vXpos8BHra1ISLbM3GVINq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0853096',6.3,7085,'en','Death of a President','A fictional investigative documentary looks back on the \"assassination\" of George W. Bush and attempts to answer the question of who committed the murder. Perhaps less morbid and disturbing to watch now than during Bush\'s presidency, the film doesn\'t address Bush\'s policies at all, instead focusing on the way a nation assigns blame in a time of crisis.','/wX7DyNdbQ5B0IxykO0Phtxdun9p.jpg','2006-10-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Death of a President',21173,2.0731,5.6,'HOZOEmBK-QQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21835,_binary '\0','/rwTNWPrWC1OCane7eoOEEYPcAZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0853153',7.6,16674,'en','Stuart: A Life Backwards','Story about the remarkable friendship between a reclusive writer and illustrator and a chaotic homeless man, whom he gets to know during a campaign to release two charity workers from prison.','/vpzjn5QQ9AFNoY6Lr7M8evFXK3l.jpg','2007-09-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Stuart: A Life Backwards',50032,3.4455,7.4,'fJCXTbHR9ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21836,_binary '\0','/5foOQp8rlcO2AjAY0gEzeuoL9xU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0854672',6.5,2404,'it','La masseria delle allodole','The Lark Farm is set in a small Turkish town in 1915. It deals with the genocide of Armenians, looking closely at the fortunes, or rather, misfortunes of one wealthy Armenian family.','/lyEo8Hywxa1W4Yav4DkXiqHpr1h.jpg','2007-05-04',122,'Released',NULL,'The Lark Farm',2361,2.2095,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21837,_binary '\0','/huPeSJqMSpVxss67W6wrGilQrgE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0854678',7.4,17840,'en','Taxi to the Dark Side','An in-depth look at the torture practices of the United States in Afghanistan, Iraq and Guantanamo Bay, focusing on an innocent taxi driver in Afghanistan who was tortured and killed in 2002.','/ttCOk1fQGvFJvPIJS7D8J2jOjpo.jpg','2008-01-18',106,'Released','In 2002, a young cab driver picked up a few passengers near his home in Afghanistan... He never returned','Taxi to the Dark Side',13362,1.8447,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21838,_binary '\0','/3hTYls51mtB4vh1p8MzIicl81wC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855729',7.2,4603,'tr','Beş Vakit','In a small, poor village leaning over high rocky mountains, the villagers are simple and diligent people who struggle to cope with a harsh nature. They earn their living off the earth and a few animals they feed. Fathers always prefer one of their sons. Mothers command their daughters ruthlessly. Ömer, the son of the imam, wishes hopelessly for the death of his father. When he understands that wishful thinking does not have any concrete results, he begins to search for childish ways to kill his father. Yakup is in love with his teacher, and one day after seeing his father spying on the teacher he dreams too, like Ömer, of killing his father. Yıldız studies and tries to manage the household chores imposed by her mother. She learns with irritation about the secrets of the relationship between men and women.','/rNFveNOjsQPSjacdQ6kNzJfP6ib.jpg','2006-09-29',111,'Released',NULL,'Times and Winds',5850,1.0278,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21839,_binary '\0','/w5q7ELMzKgRw53hhOjJcDYPYZyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855805',6.3,3065,'sv','Farväl Falkenberg','The last summer the five boys are together in Falkenberg. They are now grown up to be young men, on their way out into the world. At least most of them.','/pPvk2JRFTuJVrOt7TktQwZlyozV.jpg','2006-09-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Falkenberg Farewell',25585,0.9513,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21840,_binary '\0','/vIV7L533tKrsQpftxIiwQ0wFoN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855822',8.3,3595,'sr','Хадерсфилд','Raša is 30, lives with his alcoholic father and trying, and failing, to make ends meet by giving literature lessons to teenage girls and hosting a program on the local radio, presenting new books and interviewing authors. Ivan, a promising judo fighter in his teenage years, has since had a history of neurosis, psychotic episodes, hospitalization, being heavily medicated, involvement in various occult groups and practices, prior to having been baptized in the Orthodox Church.','/gKGxKRGrFvmb5RAYJARwNEteUIX.jpg','2007-05-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Huddersfield',63840,1.6649,6.5,'jjUP1x7bW94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21841,_binary '\0','/mRKR3WiDJpLyldvKU0JiTmqCUmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855824',6.9,2537,'zh','黑眼圈','Rawang, an immigrant from Bangladesh living in awful conditions, takes pity on a Chinese man, Hsiao-kang, who is beaten up and left in the street. Rawang lovingly nurses him on a mattress he found. When he is almost healed, Hsiao-kang meets the waitress Chyi. His love for Rawang is put to the test.','/shrlbNjWJ5WYSICJEbs2YIw1gaV.jpg','2006-12-02',118,'Released',NULL,'I Don\'t Want to Sleep Alone',12130,1.1232,6.6,'Azu197bM2Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21842,_binary '\0','/t2JVomKXhwVvIPp85vxIAJdLjEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855852',7.6,1588,'ja','母べえ','Set in Tokyo in 1940, the peaceful life of the Nogami Family suddenly changes when the father, Shigeru, is arrested and accused of being a Communist. His wife Kayo works frantically from morning to night to maintain the household and bring up her two daughters with the support of Shigeru\'s sister Hisako and Shigeru\'s ex-student Yamazaki, but her husband does not return. WWII breaks out and casts dark shadows on the entire country, but Kayo still tries to keep her cheerful determination, and sustain the family with her love. This is an emotional drama of a mother and an eternal message for peace.','/eRa4rdjTYCQzc6urELb0qlEycTE.jpg','2008-01-26',133,'Released','An inspiring story of a mother\'s courage in a time of war.','Kabei: Our Mother',25746,1.8459,7.6,'5BrRQ7aRoug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21843,_binary '\0','/aeycICct7U9OtXjW2ndSqrJOpio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855895',6.8,1874,'fr','Nue propriété','Pascale leads a lonely life with her adult sons François and Thierry at a rural estate subsidized by her ex-husband\'s alimony payments. When Pascale falls for neighbor Jan, she makes plans to move in with him. But Pascale\'s twin sons -- loafers who treat her like a servant and refuse to accept the responsibilities of adulthood -- won\'t let her go. The family remains locked in a stalemate until someone makes a startling move.','/vmtN0M5KVcB38dedSa3p2L4rMEA.jpg','2006-09-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Private Property',12156,1.2484,6.5,'D4nZEtFDMio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21844,_binary '\0','/5iyr4uA6O5hrWgCjJM9lZ18a8me.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0855975',6.7,3585,'da','Prag','Christoffer and Maja\'s trip to Prague to bring back Chistoffer\'s deceased father, evolves into the story of a break-up. With the dead father lurking in the background, secrets gradually emerge threatening to destroy their marriage.','/8oL1kQ1JMzcNQ48eFQR9md7rkqV.jpg','2006-11-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Prague',16017,1.5349,5.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21845,_binary '\0','/ysgjr7a6Cu77VGTK5TWCOYw5I3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856008',7.8,5142,'en','Sharkwater','Driven by passion fed from a life-long fascination with sharks, Rob Stewart debunks historical stereotypes and media depictions of sharks as bloodthirsty, man-eating monsters and reveals the reality of sharks as pillars in the evolution of the seas.','/kLsTIdlsnJnPioWGiCsLFQzLdzP.jpg','2006-09-11',89,'Released','The truth will surface.','Sharkwater',13894,1.5571,7.6,'HGM8jnpFFkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21846,_binary '\0','/89NmGMurl7pkvCenGQk6dTpM0iP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856052',7.1,1800,'ko','예의없는 것들','A mute hit-man vows to kill only the rude, and save up enough money for tongue surgery.','/FDLbrP3cuNkWbziYaxxE59GvbH.jpg','2006-08-24',113,'Released','Bullies, Pimps and Drug Dealers beware!','No Mercy for the Rude',43987,1.5815,6.5,'OcfqXq9u60A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21847,_binary '\0','/iumvooyF68waPmQUJ5gfxAurEWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856288',6.7,49073,'fr','À l\'intérieur','Months after a tragic accident, Sarah, a young pregnant woman, must spend Christmas Eve alone in her house before giving birth the next day. But in the middle of the night, a creepy visitor knocks at her door willing to do anything to get what they want, setting off a night of pure terror.','/7gPOYKxoBzhfC8cLNMU3CKgURcm.jpg','2007-06-13',83,'Released','Terror comes calling.','Inside',13312,4.2653,6.7,'0-Aqb1lFNtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21848,_binary '\0','/oK7uXWvInvsSzgakgioOd5hCrOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856778',6.7,3903,'en','Clubbed','An underworld drama set in the early 1980s, about a lonely factory worker whose life is transformed when he becomes a nightclub doorman.','/h6M5pTXg8s5EA9hINpk80uHQx71.jpg','2008-10-02',95,'Released','A journey through family and fear in the violent world of \'80s clubland.','Clubbed',14476,1.5063,6.669,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21849,_binary '\0','/2cAF92mFPS9vcRs5BFCmHy4HjZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856791',6.7,1975,'tr','İlk Aşk','A Turkish coastal town, in 1990: The unexpected visit of his long lost brother Asaf disturbs Azmi Arifoglu. 40 years ago Asaf was a prisoner of war, and Azmi managed to let him pronounce dead to marry his fiancée Nevin. After Nevin\'s decision to live with Asaf, Azmi feels his honor insulted. The conflict shakes the whole family. Meanwhile 13-year-old Arif falls in love with Bahar his age. An unexpected rival shows up and he gets jealous','/cix28JKk6TAfKePG5iiJaTRAWEz.jpg','2006-11-17',116,'Released',NULL,'First Love',238802,1.2859,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21850,_binary '\0','/xl7yVV8WH71aOBfcTgnkoGOx2qz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0856797',7.8,8041,'ja','攻殻機動隊 STAND ALONE COMPLEX Solid State Society','The story takes place in the year 2034, two years after the events in Ghost in the Shell: S.A.C. 2nd GIG. Female cyborg Major Motoko Kusanagi has left Public Security Section 9, an elite counter-terrorist and anti-crime unit specializing in cyber-warfare, which has expanded to a team of 20 field operatives with Togusa acting as the field lead.','/tExdDYmxqv30rtf2dMkTAVpzORf.jpg','2007-09-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex - Solid State Society',18874,3.5431,7.5,'JFwwv8FvLgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21851,_binary '\0','/mfYG7D6fQdnKopR6DqnXyfkWG8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857190',6.1,21243,'en','The Sweeney','Jack Regan, a hardened cop who doesn’t play by the rules, is confronted with a criminal from his past. With sidekick George Carter they are put on the case of a jewellery store heist that ends in a killing. But is that killing really an execution in disguise? With pressure from his boss and the fact that Regan is having an affair with that boss’s wife, it’s not going to be easy for him to stay out of trouble.','/nwGo7AoYXG4C03wbyfdeYvcVbnV.jpg','2012-09-11',112,'Released','Act like a criminal to catch a criminal.','The Sweeney',116613,4.9139,5.7,'EaNAtkzaKe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21852,_binary '\0','/8Bd7vVrxSyeKO8JraeVe2YNLLeg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857191',7.6,46571,'en','The Visitor','A college professor travels to New York City to attend a conference and finds a young couple living in his apartment.','/9XRRSD7swlYrGBhZ8vOR2yngIKZ.jpg','2008-02-21',104,'Released','Connection is everything.','The Visitor',12473,4.6332,7.1,'KY0FEt3mBog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21853,_binary '\0','/7wazgiTbygqijaduEiapT43YxTJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857265',6.3,34031,'en','Sleuth','Locked in a high-tech English manor, bound in a deadly duel of wits, Andrew Wyke and Milo Tindle come together as English gentlemen to discuss the matter of Wyke\'s wife: the woman both are sleeping with.','/y70r13kOHp7pcYToG25uwMYm562.jpg','2007-10-12',89,'Released','Obey the rules.','Sleuth',4520,3.314,6.279,'x1uminNbJbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21854,_binary '\0','/AmMftKRKsQ7NqOJUItvSO6D1dvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857275',6,2541,'en','Wonderful World','Ben Singer is a failed children\'s folk singer, a career proofreader, a less-than-extraordinary weekend dad, and perhaps the most negative man alive. Floundering in all aspects of his life, Ben\'s only comfort comes from regular chess games and friendly debates on game theory with his Senegalese roommate Ibou. When Ibou is suddenly struck ill, Ben\'s pessimistic worldview seems unequivocally confirmed. It takes an extended visit from Ibou\'s sister Khadi for Ben to realize that cynicism may be all a matter of perspective.','/30uwX2GkaHdB6sPcG0b2RUWb2KF.jpg','2009-01-08',89,'Released','Happiness is a state of mind','Wonderful World',27735,2.934,5.2,'vVYXUPSSDy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21855,_binary '\0','/pjbrBZaWbb98hhZ0xt4Uf9O64Eg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857295',5.2,6931,'en','Timber Falls','A weekend of camping in the mountains becomes an excursion into hell for a young couple, who become pawns in a grotesque plot hatched by deranged locals.','/v6Lgqh0OYLpeKzbIqxPeDXYstKE.jpg','2007-12-07',97,'Released',NULL,'Timber Falls',8875,3.4836,5.7,'xo70gmH2wjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21856,_binary '\0','/y5wbOY7O3vyCdUKzSzniQVBJgS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857300',8,2903,'te','ఆనంద్','A rich guy falls in love with an independent and strong-minded girl, and moves into her simple neighborhood to earn her love.','/nEy1ue2wOGPfGsgVAhRzurRo6Xt.jpg','2004-10-15',179,'Released','Manchi coffee lanti cinema!','Anand',154913,1.2607,6.94,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21857,_binary '\0','/bJkz0osfRO2RwLCr7LVqLFyd2pL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857355',7.3,6993,'pt','O Ano em que Meus Pais Saíram de Férias','A boy is left alone in a Jewish neighborhood in the year of 1970, where both world cup and dictatorship happen in Brazil.','/nwa1Xo1sldbiLIOfFWLvF3rgdKG.jpg','2006-11-02',103,'Released',NULL,'The Year My Parents Went on Vacation',14421,2.2182,7.2,'phXWKkxsrgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21858,_binary '\0','/381VJtVELz6gH7NwsLNVeXHIxVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857376',5.5,14643,'en','Gabriel','Gabriel tells the story of an archangel who fights to bring light back to purgatory - a place where darkness rules - and save the souls of the city\'s inhabitants.','/pH5ieqe5s2ZuZeEhloJZk9WeCTL.jpg','2007-11-15',109,'Released','Far From Grace','Gabriel',9997,3.0208,6.01,'bbs_TiENOAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21859,_binary '\0','/z03RTABBen6de998co1GVjFv8wn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0857381',4.4,1280,'hi','आई सी यू','Dr Shivani Dutt living and working in a hospital in London, notices some of her colleagues delving in organ trafficking. Before she can expose them she is involved in an accident, leaving her on a life support machine.','/z4ReGLUPzh4QiIsbX7K0A4PMOQ.jpg','2006-12-29',122,'Released',NULL,'I See You',65956,1.4513,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21860,_binary '\0','/wtCH8dPzp6r5e5pRNdzHc5bNmOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0858411',3.1,2802,'en','2001 Maniacs: Field of Screams','When this year\'s round of unsuspecting Northerners fail to show up for their annual Guts N\' Glory Jamboree, the residents of Pleasant Valley take their cannibalistic carnival on the road and head to Iowa where they encounter spoiled heiresses Rome and Tina Sheraton, the cast and crew of their \"Road Rascals\" reality show. Performing \"The Bloodiest Show on Earth\", our Southern Maniacs prove more than ratings killers in what John Landis has called \"one of the rare sequels that surpasses the original\".','/et5rRWZz4NMf40YPbXwXNqHWRvQ.jpg','2010-03-06',86,'Released','If They Kill You, They Will Come!','2001 Maniacs: Field of Screams',40912,2.8718,3.804,'qel456978RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21861,_binary '\0','/bdtqo9gTmj18QCmH28B5RiYKrnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0858433',4.1,2014,'en','Diamond Dogs','An ex-Special Forces officer agrees to lead an obsessed fortune hunter and his men on a dangerous quest for a legendary relic, the Tangka Tapestry. But great dangers await from a gang of ruthless Russian mercenaries bent on stealing the fabled treasure and also from a deadly curse said to protect the incredibly valuable relic from tomb raiders.','/eVYgVZx0KTEn8Tbzzn9tuW7cteD.jpg','2007-08-31',94,'Released','The expedition needed a leader. It got a warrior.','Diamond Dogs',15791,2.0496,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21862,_binary '\0','/9PMYysg4BJKyOSPdaZdkFLLTVkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0858479',6.1,23734,'en','Smart People','Professor Lawrence Wetherhold might be imperiously brilliant, monumentally self-possessed and an intellectual giant -- but when it comes to solving the conundrums of love and family, he\'s as downright flummoxed as the next guy.','/igIl4RKxOEYvhQGKCvM6vCRMiVm.jpg','2008-04-11',95,'Released','Sometimes the smartest people have the most to learn','Smart People',12890,3.6547,5.8,'be0bBWnUrnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21863,_binary '\0','/zRHVwKp1rwevnf9HRP2UVhXgdNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0858486',6.5,12606,'en','Battle for Terra','A peaceful alien planet faces annihilation, as the homeless remainder of the human race sets its eyes on Terra. Mala, a rebellious Terrian teenager, will do everything she can to stop it.','/iAcPYIsYwFqAyY7KctWkkdkJGhI.jpg','2007-09-06',85,'Released','Their world is mankind\'s only hope for survival.','Battle for Terra',16873,5.765,6.141,'ii7qUrDZaSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21864,_binary '\0','/5lDo87DQIQNo5nnN5xehLtP83bM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0858492',7.7,5518,'te','విక్రమార్కుడు','A thief\'s life changes after he discovers a little girl who claims he is her father, and what follows is violence after a gang hunting for his lookalike closes in on him.','/cRwUQdFPqNmECWLElxBxonuCixX.jpg','2006-06-23',161,'Released',NULL,'Vikramarkudu',40909,1.4353,6.786,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21865,_binary '\0','/W034dd7w2malON26KWyZm4y37W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0859163',5.3,182169,'en','The Mummy: Tomb of the Dragon Emperor','Archaeologist Rick O\'Connell travels to China, pitting him against an emperor from the 2,000-year-old Han dynasty who\'s returned from the dead to pursue a quest for world domination. This time, O\'Connell enlists the help of his wife and son to quash the so-called \'Dragon Emperor\' and his abuse of supernatural power.','/A3acM1lX5PNWQa6r5qeMAJOxbnT.jpg','2008-07-01',112,'Released','A new evil awakens.','The Mummy: Tomb of the Dragon Emperor',1735,18.2713,5.5,'ol-U0ibnVD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21866,_binary '\0','/sMJqDtLCdv9nlgU8BCj4VFfyzAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0859635',6,31083,'en','Super Troopers 2','When an international border dispute arises between the U.S. and Canada, the Super Troopers- Mac, Thorny, Foster, Rabbit and Farva, are called in to set up a new Highway Patrol station in the disputed area.','/57SZgdugVClIy22rfnANeBJ5KsN.jpg','2018-04-19',99,'Released','The mustache rides. Again.','Super Troopers 2',50022,9.4726,5.875,'eEed-o8fVpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21867,_binary '\0','/wCkamXqCv6GuJRAl3yHEH06nala.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0859760',6.6,2048,'es','Ladrón que roba a ladrón','Emilio, a Colombian con man, arrives in LA with two weeks to complete his plan to rob a former colleague, Claudio Silvestrini, who\'s made a fortune using infomercials to peddle snake oil to Latin immigrants. Emilio\'s friend Alejandro, who sells pirated DVDs, has assembled a team of amateurs, who, as Alejandro says, will go unnoticed because they\'re immigrants. The team must gain entry to Silvestrini\'s well-guarded mansion, steal two keys to access a vault, and then get the money off the property. A father and his tomboy daughter, a nervous Cuban actor, a techie, and a muscle man make up the team, plus Alejandro has been courting Silvestrini\'s nanny. Will they be enough?','/px4hQ1HvJBDSzRuY3zNIkrFTlrd.jpg','2007-08-31',98,'Released',NULL,'To Rob a Thief',38140,1.7034,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21868,_binary '\0','/b56dRYUjuaHndelcGaswYhou53Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0860454',7,2485,'hi','MP3: Mera Pehla Pehla Pyaar','Delhi-based Rohan Sood lives a wealthy lifestyle along with his businessman dad, Shekhar, and mom, Renu. He attends St. Lawrence High School and is friendly with Vasu, Sudhir and Javed, and together the friends land in hot water virtually everyday. Then everything changes when he first sets eyes on heart-achingly beautiful new student..','/kCImzTKC3sypFQb4cM9926yzP6z.jpg','2007-06-08',117,'Released',NULL,'MP3: Mera Pehla Pehla Pyaar',46409,1.4235,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21869,_binary '\0','/dJjs2YxRv1Lt3idC7SFq1w6P6tZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0860467',6.1,2354,'en','Nora Roberts\' Montana Sky','The wealthy stock dealer bequeaths his Montana farm to the three daughters provided they would live there together at least for a year.','/qivNMkGRJQatBQ86DonJWBnS0Gc.jpg','2007-02-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Montana Sky',18033,3.2994,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21870,_binary '\0','/rOzQTb1CWIiRlDk8ILMULOSuktG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0860866',6.1,3394,'en','Far North','In the arctic, as Saiva is being born, a shaman declares that she is evil and will bring harm to all who become involved with her. Saiva is cast out of her tribe of herders and grows up to live a nomadic existence with Anja, a young woman she adopts as an infant. Then Loki, an injured and starving soldier, stumbles into their isolated lives. The women nurse him back to health, but treachery, violence and doom await them all.','/d31sugp9MHWv7YHGxgM5iYQVmXB.jpg','2008-10-09',89,'Released','In this brutal land, a stranger threatens their survival.','Far North',8471,1.645,6,'57cxOMgMnP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21871,_binary '\0','/pzsVGcufDdBLmvagKyLFKaeA4O5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0860906',7.9,29519,'ja','ヱヴァンゲリヲン新劇場版：破','Under constant attack by monstrous creatures called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind, U.N. Special Agency NERV introduces two new EVA pilots to help defend the city of Tokyo-3: the mysterious Makinami Mari Illustrous and the intense Asuka Langley Shikinami. Meanwhile, Gendo Ikari and SEELE proceed with a secret project that involves both Rei and Shinji.','/7VLYN2CfJpB6PrcuzDKKqdGSUi6.jpg','2009-06-26',112,'Released','In the War Between Heaven and Earth, Salvation is Machine.','Evangelion: 2.0 You Can (Not) Advance',22843,6.0109,7.8,'e2K-l0t3hvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21872,_binary '\0','/q0PBB2RCrOAZrZjqJKhL3ibTV8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0860907',6.9,22563,'ja','ヱヴァンゲリヲン新劇場版:Q','Fourteen years after Third Impact, Shinji Ikari awakens to a world he does not remember. He hasn\'t aged. Much of Earth is laid in ruins, NERV has been dismantled, and people who he once protected have turned against him. Befriending the enigmatic Kaworu Nagisa, Shinji continues the fight against the angels and realizes the fighting is far from over, even when it could be against his former allies. The characters\' struggles continue amidst the battles against the angels and each other, spiraling down to what could inevitably be the end of the world.','/d0s1xvykzl0kz7fP5S2ROYqphdz.jpg','2012-11-17',96,'Released','What was destroyed can (not) be rebuilt.','Evangelion: 3.0 You Can (Not) Redo',75629,6.4628,7.199,'Ua75H0k7-N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21873,_binary '\0','/sN0czEtCT1jEFQVajWBsKwdFBKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0861689',6.5,77513,'en','Blindness','When a sudden plague of blindness devastates a city, a small group of the afflicted band together to triumphantly overcome the horrific conditions of their imposed quarantine.','/deBsx5IxyqCC217j3VY24TkkE0Z.jpg','2008-05-14',121,'Released','Your vision of the world will change forever.','Blindness',8338,6.2509,6.519,'HAR2w1zNrlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21874,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0861704',6.1,1488,'en','Emotional Arithmetic','An emotionally scarred fifty-something female, a high-profile but haunted British novelist, and a heroic dissident-cum-Soviet psychiatric hospital veteran, all reunite decades after bonding and surviving together in a detention camp during World War II.','/zFeEZUEqzHSWIRd5UjhuOTaxTJC.jpg','2008-04-18',99,'Released',NULL,'Emotional Arithmetic',27693,1.833,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21875,_binary '\0','/huUgrGkCetYSkDl5fMvZCXCbFKl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0861739',8,121207,'pt','Tropa de Elite','In 1997, before the visit of the pope to Rio de Janeiro, Captain Nascimento from BOPE (Special Police Operations Battalion) is assigned to eliminate the risks of the drug dealers in a dangerous slum nearby where the pope intends to be lodged.','/lwIXz785N2fXi8hsBr1IXciFlkM.jpg','2007-10-05',115,'Released','On the streets of Rio only the elite survive','Elite Squad',7347,9.1617,8.063,'WNrC-vLpTGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21876,_binary '\0','/90IuSXiKgOap8w8JYyQQoCJMaQh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862467',6,67075,'en','Valhalla Rising','Scandinavia, 1,000 AD. For years, One Eye, a mute warrior of supernatural strength, has been held prisoner by the Norse chieftain Barde. Aided by Are, a boy slave, One Eye slays his captor and together he and Are escape, beginning a journey into the heart of darkness. On their flight, One Eye and Are board a Viking vessel, but the ship is soon engulfed by an endless fog that clears only as the crew sights an unknown land. As the new world reveals its secrets and the Vikings confront their terrible and bloody fate, One Eye discovers his true self.','/7LBMcAx6XHwEduIsBYipvUke9n.jpg','2010-03-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Valhalla Rising',37861,4.2953,6.1,'Es-CEAWXcfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21877,_binary '\0','/50se5wzP3VVsl3QaBzDAyiRhpfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862647',9,1753,'tr','Aşk Yolu','Deniz goes to his hometown for his aunt Feraye\'s funeral. Nigar first offers her condolences to Deniz, then hands him her card and invites him to her home to discuss an important matter. Nigar wants to buy the land that Deniz inherited from his aunt, which includes a vineyard, a workshop, and olive groves. She makes a good offer. While Deniz is packing up her aunt\'s belongings at her aunt\'s house, she finds her aunt Feraye\'s diary.','/uQeLjqxpikHnhxQqdfmvuDAI6wI.jpg','2006-01-01',NULL,'Released',NULL,'Aşk Yolu',648933,0.8393,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21878,_binary '\0','/5AOEFyxkJ4g7aaOvSaEPhGRzbYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862748',5.5,1901,'ja','ルパン三世','Interpol Inspector Zenigata begins a world-wide hunt for the infamous thief Arsène Lupin III, who, with his cavalcade of collaborators infiltrate a highly secured fortress-like safe named the \'Ark of Navarone\' to claim the \"Crimson Heart of Cleopatra\".','/2xgRjTYDVFEVQeRUrsbQQtKA6I5.jpg','2014-08-30',133,'Released','Eyes on the world\'s most beautiful prize.','Lupin the 3rd',241868,2.7462,6,'m8un2tLnsU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21879,_binary '\0','/3Ke0f7c6InUpoUn2Pi12ayX9EIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862846',6.8,76490,'en','Sunshine Cleaning','A single mother and her slacker sister find an unexpected way to turn their lives around in this off-beat dramatic comedy. In order to raise the tuition to send her young son to private school the mom starts an unusual business – a biohazard removal/crime scene clean-up service.','/xwtJyfme086wcz9MXpP0i5Hrgxy.jpg','2008-01-18',91,'Released','life\'s a messy business.','Sunshine Cleaning',13090,4.152,6.6,'syGGh1rbFCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21880,_binary '\0','/wYI3r4DGKhwjPoDpfPfGdLMrPLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862856',6.7,115399,'en','Trick \'r Treat','Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.','/w0nmol4g7n6MFfhfphV7GzHHYjB.jpg','2007-12-09',82,'Released','Poison, drowning, claw, or knife. So many ways to take a life.','Trick \'r Treat',23202,9.4448,6.99,'CzfRvyJ1wjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21881,_binary '\0','/qiKvPktpTdPKLDsuMeKsWo4l3Br.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0862946',6,1243,'ja','蟲師','Mushi are beings in touch with the essence of life, far more basic and pure than normal living things. Most humans are incapable of perceiving Mushi and are oblivious to their existence, but there are a few who possess the ability to see and interact with Mushi. One such person is Ginko who travels from place to place to research Mushi and aid people suffering from problems caused by them.','/ydEKy39NhjgVHF4hEcEEVo7FqXC.jpg','2007-09-20',131,'Released',NULL,'Mushi-Shi: The Movie',21959,1.5143,6,'FfyCQC9Amkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21882,_binary '\0','/1o5D0SQnqsiQ0BUkfPbzO4WIydk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0863041',6.5,1589,'el','Uranya','A group of young boys must decide whether to buy a TV set to watch the launch of Apollo 11 or visit Uranya to learn about the secrets of love.','/luktB4GWM4Pk9Q01uBRJjfk9EGO.jpg','2006-12-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Uranya',47017,4.0989,5.9,'C_rjs4ARn4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21883,_binary '\0','/qY6jnp4cNUYMz6FBG7ATtVmWttM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0864761',6.9,91506,'en','The Duchess','A chronicle of the life of 18th century aristocrat Georgiana, Duchess of Devonshire, who was reviled for her extravagant political and personal life.','/77ckyYrWmR12kl3qToqmDySnuwv.jpg','2008-09-05',110,'Released','Based on the incredible true story.','The Duchess',12783,9.0323,6.977,'FFg-oduezDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21884,_binary '\0','/los2ehK8gvPdL0E7JWWIAJG7pMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0864770',6.9,2615,'fr','Le Fils de l\'épicier','Antoine Sforza, a thirty-year-old young man, left his village ten years before in order to start a new life in the big city, but now that his father, a traveling grocer, is in hospital after a stroke, he more or less reluctantly accepts to come back to replace him in his daily rounds.','/1sHrsllHOtr1voW5Pc8dNOQIiN.jpg','2007-06-15',96,'Released',NULL,'The Grocer\'s Son',8049,1.6606,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21885,_binary '\0','/bJKoNFCLC0C3viZtsvP4lSDDXNO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0864835',6.8,85450,'en','Mr. Peabody & Sherman','A young boy and his dog, who happens to have a genius-level IQ, spring into action when their time-machine is stolen and moments in history begin to be changed.','/hPcImYndWESKHzT2GHVCDsUxzYg.jpg','2014-02-07',92,'Released','History is catching up with them.','Mr. Peabody & Sherman',82703,10.4521,6.736,'aMl2tTVwsZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21886,_binary '\0','/ndqSvTEt3ZiGUCCra2UVQF45aWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865297',7.2,9481,'en','The Black Balloon','Thomas is turning 16. His dad\'s in the army and they\'ve just moved to a town in New South Wales; his mom is pregnant; his older brother, Charlie, who\'s autistic, has his own adolescent sexual issues. Thomas finds Charlie an embarrassment in public, so when Thomas is attracted to Jackie, a girl in his swim class, Charlie presents any number of obstacles when she drops by their house, when the three of them go for a walk, and during a family birthday dinner. Can Thomas find a way to enter the world of teen romance and still be his brother\'s keeper, or is Charlie\'s disability going to prove more than Thomas can handle?','/3D0PF1xpZHfyO3787TP6KS24Cme.jpg','2008-03-08',97,'Released','Normal is relative.','The Black Balloon',8747,1.9438,6.33,'IiyAfaXmbrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21887,_binary '\0','/3HJBIGN4ZjX6xwNQsM9GlvZgZCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865554',4.9,18179,'en','The Informers','A collection of intersecting short stories set in early 1980s Los Angeles, depicts a week in the lives of an assortment of socially alienated, mainly well-off characters who numb their sense of emptiness with casual sex, violence, and drugs.','/yiXkvghbkYMQ3iMyhiI08GgtonC.jpg','2008-11-05',98,'Released','Greed is good. Sex is easy. Youth is forever.','The Informers',17436,5.9685,4.8,'HxkvJkSIOGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21888,_binary '\0','/9a59H9qoAzMcj1NWurMgvg9iLaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865556',6.5,114114,'en','The Forbidden Kingdom','An American teenager who is obsessed with Hong Kong cinema and kung-fu classics makes an extraordinary discovery in a Chinatown pawnshop: the legendary stick weapon of the Chinese sage and warrior, the Monkey King. With the lost relic in hand, the teenager unexpectedly finds himself travelling back to ancient China to join a crew of warriors from martial arts lore on a dangerous quest to free the imprisoned Monkey King.','/z8chF1Z7hyuSVqLYTgElkQZh2VB.jpg','2008-04-17',104,'Released','The battle for eternity is the fantasy of a lifetime.','The Forbidden Kingdom',1729,11.4261,6.7,'KPtXwW-Erww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21889,_binary '\0','/4s0AurNfsPuC0M6RdPk12trhb6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865559',6,21647,'en','My Life in Ruins','A Greek tour guide named Georgia attempts to recapture her kefi (Greek for mojo) by guiding a ragtag group of tourists around Greece and showing them the beauty of her native land. Along the way, she manages to open their eyes to the wonders of an exotic foreign land while beginning to see the world through a new set of eyes in the process.','/f695mVyU0LyBb99rx7zkrtFcpxR.jpg','2009-06-05',95,'Released','The most fun you can have without a passport.','My Life in Ruins',23049,6.0743,6.138,'AkRMBRxC_Gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21890,_binary '\0','/g80CiHfus4JbLRQtRp0x3UzUToN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865560',5.1,2676,'en','Now & Later','Sex, politics and American culture are mixed into a combustible combination in Now & Later. Angela is an illegal Latina immigrant living in Los Angeles who stumbles across Bill, a disgraced banker on the run. She takes him in. Through passionate sex, soul-searching conversations ranging from politics to philosophy, and other worldly pleasures, Angela introduces Bill to another worldview. As their affair heats up, the course of Bill\'s life begins to take an abrupt and unexpected turn.','/1jzfAMLbTfHaGiNn6hGKty0OzDq.jpg','2009-02-18',99,'Released','When now is all you\'ve got.','Now & Later',68335,4.605,5,'bYtNFBH4RZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21891,_binary '\0','/r9AEn0sJkXHllnjo7l8AtohdF5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0865951',6.1,3045,'pl','Testosteron','The wedding of Kornel, a young, well known TV scientist, to the famous singer, Alicja, is to be the social event of the year. In the suburban reception hall, the final preperations are being made. The waiter, Tytus, who is somewhat touchy having just found out he is to become a father, lays out the cutlery on the tables.','/dBJdulDRXSG9etoYLfspsAyoHDR.jpg','2007-03-02',116,'Released',NULL,'Testosteron',39561,1.1304,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21892,_binary '\0','/6Uw2IGTqNAz8l5wXxKc9LJB99Dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0866437',6.7,30080,'en','The Jane Austen Book Club','Six Californians start a club to discuss the works of Jane Austen. As they delve into Austen\'s literature, the club members find themselves dealing with life experiences that parallel the themes of the books they are reading.','/9O8LgoBqOGrKXpYFQXVHOxoRNg2.jpg','2007-09-09',106,'Released','You don\'t have to know the books to be in the club','The Jane Austen Book Club',5951,4.3156,6.5,'N15xTA50Rns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21893,_binary '\0','/qpzhGsHV6GJuEcZrOxNX8tw2j5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0866439',5.9,81548,'en','Made of Honor','Tom and Hannah have been platonic friends for 10 years. He\'s a serial dater, while she wants marriage but hasn\'t found Mr. Right. Just as Tom is starting to think that he is relationship material after all, Hannah gets engaged. When she asks Tom to be her \'maid\' of honor, he reluctantly agrees just so he can attempt to stop the wedding and woo her.','/pDg8D0jNqmz7RbCBgblWvmPswHE.jpg','2008-04-30',101,'Released','It takes a real man to become a maid of honor.','Made of Honor',10761,9.6772,6.472,'XFQN3biQ4x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21894,_binary '\0','/jX8xkxOfT4WNZJNBNGHjklZ0k1l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0867145',8.1,4697,'ml','ക്ലാസ്‌മേറ്റ്സ്','Years after graduating from college, a few friends from across the world decide to get together for a reunion. But on the night of the reunion, one of them attempts suicide and goes into a coma.','/dJlCWyOdQek6so8sbHNeeizfDhP.jpg','2006-08-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Classmates',234838,1.4934,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21895,_binary '\0','/jrvHnbg3lqgU6YJYNUuq4n6ozDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0867286',4.3,1645,'en','Eye of the Beast','This menacing monster yarn stars James Van Der Beek as government scientist Dan Leland, who\'s sent to investigate reported sightings of a giant squidlike beast that\'s put the entire population of a fishing village on edge. Though Leland starts his journey confident that this sea creature with an insatiable appetite is the stuff of old legends, a string of horrific occurrences soon begins to change his mind.','/fqDYQBx7qYPONr0MsQTc6f7BvvA.jpg','2007-12-08',90,'Released','From the Depths of the Ocean Comes Man\'s Darkest Fear.','Eye of the Beast',59127,2.1408,5.1,'unoZEGo66ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21896,_binary '\0','/qaJk7k0e45Cby5aVFfFoBX35md3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0867334',6.4,5563,'en','Jolene','A teenage orphan spends ten years traveling to experience life.','/5udqbFUVTzevHpDkel4CElpNEBR.jpg','2010-10-29',121,'Released','A life between the exit signs.','Jolene',43727,2.2157,6.2,'lC5OyE-BgcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21897,_binary '\0','/uw0NIQpqCd9FEumwpBkM31cWVyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0867465',7.2,1273,'ml','വിനോദയാത്ര','Vinod, a quarrelsome young man, moves to his sister\'s house in a village to get his life in order. There, he happens to meet Anupama and falls in love with her.','/37uwZINDg8ca0gG7paj50IuGrd8.jpg','2007-04-05',151,'Released',NULL,'Vinodayathra',234833,1.033,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21898,_binary '\0','/AtpMuzGkHlrUm5UQ2v7Sh1ntO9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0867591',4.7,3193,'en','Smother','After he\'s fired from his job, an everyday guy faces pressure from his wife to have a baby and from his mom, who has decided to move in with the young couple.','/2vLLJG71kmrCcTbnIztn13NHKZF.jpg','2008-09-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Smother',16699,2.5441,5,'48KmAQn5WLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21899,_binary '\0','/8WVMEXmwszrJFZIElyxpzcza5vE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0869019',6.5,1268,'en','Candles on Bay Street','DeeDee returns to her hometown with her 11 year old son, Trooper, 13 years after she ran off with her boyfriend. Her childhood best friend, Sam, is now married and he and his wife, Lydia, are the town\'s veterinarians. Lydia is a little wary about DeeDee after Sam tells her that they were best friends growing up and DeeDee was his first crush. But DeeDee and Trooper find their way into many hearts of the townspeople with their sweet helpfulness and friendships. DeeDee sets up a candle making business in town square and invites many of the ladies of the town to weekly candle making parties, and through these parties she and Lydia become good friends. One evening after dinner with Lydia and Sam, DeeDee tells Sam she\'s very sick and she doesn\'t have much longer to live and she needs his help to find a good family in town to adopt Trooper. Sam later tells Lydia everything and they decide to adopt Trooper themselves if/when something happens to DeeDee.','/1hVLkIo03gG1FERwcdTQcIJH7Am.jpg','2006-11-26',93,'Released','One woman\'s hope brought light to an entire town','Candles on Bay Street',52311,2.1665,6.1,'hbC3q66jfZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21900,_binary '\0','/i0YmyRXtybvlPqa70YZvaz25GG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0869152',5.4,3667,'en','They Wait','Jason and his wife, Sarah, leave their adopted home of Shanghai and travel to Vancouver, British Columbia, for his uncle\'s funeral, staying with his Aunt Mei. Already disoriented, Jason and Sarah are unnerved when their son, Sam, begins seeing ghosts and violent deaths. After Sam is hospitalized, Sarah consults with a pharmacist who\'s well-informed about Chinese mythology and who tells her that supernatural forces threaten her son.','/25qmTS29waISYV2KynNcTfx6KfA.jpg','2007-09-06',89,'Released','Bad things happen to those who wait.','They Wait',17158,2.3344,5.3,'jqtQFOZ-MAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21901,_binary '\0','/7xyxlgb7dOymJtnGuyRSTxf25vU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0869921',5.7,2066,'en','Nora Roberts\' Angels Fall','A woman starts a new life in a small Wyoming mountain town after suffering a traumatic event on the other side of the country - but one day, she witnesses a murder in the woods...','/dIaAXZmxxqG369VOf3uGNlb2bjs.jpg','2007-01-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Angels Fall',30335,1.8662,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21902,_binary '\0','/zZRbCsecON0xIiJjbMvQvuDCsCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0869977',6.7,15529,'fr','Naissance des pieuvres','Set during a sultry summer in a French suburb, Marie is desperate to join the local pool\'s synchronized swimming team, but is her interest solely for the sake of sport or for a chance to get close to Floriane, the bad girl of the team? Sciamma, and the two leads, capture the uncertainty of teenage sexuality with a sympathetic eye in this delicate drama of the angst of coming-of-age.','/oNrs9disgGDtOORToDt5dIqYFBi.jpg','2007-05-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Water Lilies',10818,3.2334,6.5,'Gurt0LXHw94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21903,_binary '\0','/mCjL4UL11lW0XzvYI7KnK1vL94b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0869994',6.8,13274,'fr','Paris','Pierre, a professional dancer, suffers from a serious heart disease. While he is waiting for a transplant which may (or may not) save his life, he has nothing better to do than look at the people around him, from the balcony of his Paris apartment.','/bcJAgm2N0FW0PkCew9A1yv8r6zF.jpg','2008-02-20',130,'Released',NULL,'Paris',8279,2.7429,6.5,'rcSOD06HbUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21904,_binary '\0','/vOQjANTdUkb2ysjFTGKVIGryG9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870089',6.6,2647,'en','Ciao','A man learns that his late friend had a secret online lover who is on the way from Italy.','/pvmEaE0lzlLqMpAXVLOGaf5rLX5.jpg','2008-12-05',87,'Released','Every ending has a new beginning','Ciao',19603,0.9916,5.8,'pnVbfO-jw_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21905,_binary '\0','/1mJFeIf51DKAz84895htRmRzhs7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870090',7.2,17045,'pt','Cidade dos Homens','Best buddies Acerola and Laranjinha, about to turn 18, discover things about their missing fathers\' pasts which will shatter their solid friendship, in the middle of a war between rival drug gangs from Rio\'s favelas.','/eVqTDE0seY23gw9aCpBmWTjIPdc.jpg','2007-08-31',106,'Released','An unforgettable tale of friendship and survival in a city where the greatest challenge is growing up.','City of Men',7343,3.0872,7,'fTX9BuWTxv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21906,_binary '\0','/20wSDAS6rUWhkZQ2PxPC9TRsAd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870111',7.6,116403,'en','Frost/Nixon','For three years after being forced from office, Nixon remained silent. But in summer 1977, the steely, cunning former commander-in-chief agreed to sit for one all-inclusive interview to confront the questions of his time in office and the Watergate scandal that ended his presidency. Nixon surprised everyone in selecting Frost as his televised confessor, intending to easily outfox the breezy British showman and secure a place in the hearts and minds of Americans. Likewise, Frost\'s team harboured doubts about their boss\'s ability to hold his own. But as the cameras rolled, a charged battle of wits resulted.','/nLrRrHZQ40tWqLTY3kxgS4x7GUw.jpg','2008-10-15',122,'Released','400 million people were waiting for the truth.','Frost/Nixon',11499,6.3604,7.276,'O9S1RKNgdLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21907,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870112',7.8,1471,'en','Future by Design','Future by Design shares the life and far-reaching vision of Jacque Fresco, considered by many to be a modern day Da Vinci. Peer to Einstein and Buckminster Fuller, Jacque is a self-taught futurist who describes himself most often as a \"generalist\" or multi-disciplinarian -- a student of many inter-related fields.','/hcKPEIgILWv8uAtZKlfvjAqRWvq.jpg','2006-06-10',86,'Released',NULL,'Future by Design',19275,0.7238,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21908,_binary '\0','/xYxPm3ZW78RHYuwJzMkaKxJ8jZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870122',6.2,2927,'en','Humboldt County','Peter is a medical student about to graduate and begin his residency. When his professor fails him, he winds up in bed with an actress and singer named Bogart rolling through Los Angeles. He accompanies her to the redwoods of northern California, where he encounters her eccentric family of pot farmers. But when Bogart runs away without a word, Peter is thrust into the picturesque and bizarre world.','/o5x5YXmXOtW9Kk9FH9MNbdEIfq5.jpg','2008-09-26',97,'Released','Welcome to the Lost Coast','Humboldt County',14232,1.7563,5.7,'xW5UJo8Lm8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21909,_binary '\0','/7WJjFviFBffEJvkAms4uWwbcVUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870154',6.5,229826,'en','Jungle Cruise','Dr. Lily Houghton enlists the aid of wisecracking skipper Frank Wolff to take her down the Amazon in his dilapidated boat. Together, they search for an ancient tree that holds the power to heal – a discovery that will change the future of medicine.','/yKy9ELL8CON5sqDg4yIvBb5LTZL.jpg','2021-07-28',127,'Released','Only one adventure gets this wild.','Jungle Cruise',451048,15.4516,7.27,'f_HvoipFcA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21910,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870195',6.5,2226,'en','Before the Rains','Set in southern India in the late 1930s, this provocative tale traces the story of three people caught in an inexorable web of forbidden romance and dangerous secrets. After a British spice planter falls in love with his alluring servant, an idealistic young man finds himself torn between his ambitions and his family, his village and his past.','/ucM4aS8hPxO6XLSXiGgx8vqm1kB.jpg','2007-09-07',98,'Released',NULL,'Before the Rains',26506,1.498,4.8,'Q37yxRpKzx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21911,_binary '\0','/monpF0nc8wPYGCZ37mcyLPoFeyb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870204',5.8,9645,'en','Boot Camp','A group of troubled teens are sent to a rehabilitation program housed in a remote camp on the island of Fiji. What their parents believe is a state-of-the-art deluxe institution in a beautiful natural environment turns out to be a prison-like boot camp where they are abused and brainwashed.','/rSAIVxNJGRGcfvnzUzsL2VZJL7g.jpg','2008-02-07',99,'Released','Every year troubled teens are sent away to change their lives. On this island they must fight to save them.','Boot Camp',14643,3.4744,5.9,'f7KQtJEdbvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21912,_binary '\0','/m0edcSYyX4A4EgzsI9wtXIPsV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870211',6.9,7727,'en','Battle for Haditha','An investigation of the massacre of 24 men, women and children in Haditha, Iraq allegedly shot by 4 U.S. Marines in retaliation for the death of a U.S. Marine killed by a roadside bomb. The movie follows the story of the Marines of Kilo Company, an Iraqi family, and the insurgents who plant the roadside bomb.','/jHyRWich4t0CQtgHiN7nnrbcEVv.jpg','2007-09-11',97,'Released','There are many ways to see the same story','Battle for Haditha',14111,1.6733,6.2,'H_Q4D4s3HSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21913,_binary '\0','/7SGIZ1NrZVtuPFlXXNYceKVnt5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870937',4.2,3998,'en','Open Graves','One day, Jason finds an unusual board game called Mamba. When his surfer friends start to play, the games unleashes its deadly curse, killing the losers in a gruesome fashion. Supposedly it will grant the winner a wish. As his companions die off, Jason decides that the only way he can reverse the tragedy is by continuing to play. With his girlfriend, Erica, Jason rolls the dice and hopes to make his wish before one of them suffers a horrible fate.','/dgW8IftK7Bi4PitRTjB0HuzO6mQ.jpg','2009-09-19',88,'Released','Curses last forever.','Open Graves',28499,2.3138,4.9,'NYWQDAyGrJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21914,_binary '\0','/k7MnhJvh1PlY3MIgckNk9weKO9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870944',6.7,1268,'ja','涙そうそう','A love story about two step-siblings, Yota and Kaoru. Long ago, Yota\'s mother married Kaoru\'s jazz-playing father, effectively merging the two families. Unfortunately, Kaoru\'s father skipped town, and Yota\'s mother passed away, but not before imparting a dying wish to her young son to take care of Kaoru.','/iBcS61e3MWVFcsJJ7PA5975KMGc.jpg','2006-09-30',118,'Released',NULL,'Tears for You',75679,1.7031,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21915,_binary '\0','/ci8VXvLW40fKmr4bwBJCTxBCG1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870958',5.9,2783,'ko','스승의 은혜','Mi-ja, who has been taking care of a retired teacher, Ms. Park, invites several of her former students to her house 16 years after their graduation. Since the end of her teaching career, Park has been residing in the countryside, suffering from an illness while an ex-student, the kind and pretty Mi-ja cares for her.','/kTlqhcERlOwaWUV2e12yCTJ9ZeM.jpg','2006-08-03',93,'Released','Class Dismissed.','Bloody Reunion',27428,2.5342,6.7,'2b7G_Gtu9lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21916,_binary '\0','/vn4bYPJ7l2NZcdYnoboxx1czA4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870967',7.4,1553,'ko','우리들의 행복한 시간','Yu-jeong is suicidal, yet she reluctantly goes to prison for volunteer work. There, she meets a prisoner who is waiting for death penalty. The two quickly fall in love despite their differences, yet they do not have much time.','/uQoVrNNCkplnOIKVvqnkaAYKCvu.jpg','2006-09-14',120,'Released','Our Happy Time.','Maundy Thursday',63963,1.8707,7,'qDcqcRHNprU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21917,_binary '\0','/utABPVjXBlM8NUOBecCyLLuzQSe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0870984',6.5,146177,'en','Antichrist','A grieving couple retreats to their cabin \'Eden\' in the woods, hoping to repair their broken hearts and troubled marriage. But nature takes its course and things go from bad to worse.','/ge7zbYvpfsDP3luKi0iSpzOgncM.jpg','2009-05-20',104,'Released','Chaos reigns.','Antichrist',17609,7.3346,6.609,'BO_wu_M2xjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21918,_binary '\0','/hM6AttTwVdiL00jSAiIMsUutqMX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0871426',6,50174,'en','Baby Mama','A successful, single businesswoman who dreams of having a baby discovers she is infertile and hires a working class woman to be her unlikely surrogate.','/xZOwucsL5NInPyFcmqJzytHkaJR.jpg','2008-04-25',99,'Released','Would you put your eggs in this basket?','Baby Mama',8780,3.6715,5.968,'stc7RUABPaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21919,_binary '\0','/dRl7PCVhBgosXuivxRg4fCz5G7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0871510',8.1,92763,'hi','चकदे! इंडिया','A team of rag-tag girls with their own agenda form Team India competing for international fame in field hockey. Their coach, the ex-men\'s Indian National team captain, returns from a life of shame after being unjustly accused of match fixing in his last match. Can he give the girls the motivation required to win, while dealing with the shadows of his own past?','/mmFMgEsTRCAGAtwffGpuo3mJsxN.jpg','2007-08-09',148,'Released',NULL,'Chak De! India',14163,2.1843,7.203,'6a0-dSMWm5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21920,_binary '\0','/v41bl9IXnqsZdaBQG6AYQpOMfM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0872022',7.4,3771,'ja','ただ、君を愛してる','Amateur photographer Makoto and the homely but endearing Shizuru meet during their university entrance ceremony and become instant friends. Shy by nature, Makoto finds himself opening up around Shizuru, who is secretly in love with him.','/uqcKoM8KlgKeMw0XvKhjp3qwUag.jpg','2006-10-28',116,'Released',NULL,'Heavenly Forest',40243,2.1099,7.5,'kaXCFOjpSRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21921,_binary '\0','/a2O6xnqKBdf4F3lTBUDOGWnhgI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0872190',3.5,2209,'en','Cash','When two groups of thieves compete to pull off a successful heist of a priceless diamond, they get caught in a web of murder and lies.','/9hnTkDmNAwcb74gqiLImsGawgmv.jpg','2007-08-03',137,'Released','Earn money the hard way... steal it!','Cash',20063,1.0718,4.5,'IK1vnkSDPls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21922,_binary '\0','/ozF1sfvlwcz9WFbVQtdJtq5VjaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0872224',7,2120,'en','Street Thief','Kaspar Carr is a professional burglar who lives and works in Chicago. Carr loves his job and is good at it, and two documentary filmmakers are granted access to his private world when he agrees to let them make a film about him.','/5ZNxu35mALan9GTQaPPo3Dd3S7f.jpg','2006-08-07',86,'Released',NULL,'Street Thief',18652,1.6098,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21923,_binary '\0','/s2k1T7LbdRJ7EbtdeO9B8pmG47p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0872230',4.8,22775,'en','My Soul to Take','On the day the Riverton Ripper vanished without a trace, seven children were born. Today, they\'re all turning 16... and turning up dead.','/3dOFUWCue0ovlGpUhuEDmOikTPk.jpg','2010-10-08',107,'Released','Only One Has The Power To Save Their Souls.','My Soul to Take',43931,5.0791,5.462,'RmByUgdi6wE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21924,_binary '\0','/kEr29qsdYt5FQ2sBORL9DBgGrJw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0873886',6.1,70384,'en','Red State','Set in Middle America, a group of teens receive an online invitation for sex, though they soon encounter Christian fundamentalists with a much more sinister agenda.','/7GTlxS2Es337MHgCE3g9Xdp32S7.jpg','2011-08-19',88,'Released','Fear God.','Red State',48572,5.9398,6,'uJ1v6oFHefc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21925,_binary '\0','/iOTw9c8MHGMVNWuhtQrhgwRJNbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0874271',5.3,3642,'en','Elsewhere','A teen girl disappears after trying to meet men online in order to escape her small town. Apparently, only her best friend worries enough to investigate the mystery.','/oWDtcTBtOnNRQOlD8MgTuZigWAO.jpg','2009-01-15',106,'Released','Every town has its secrets.','Elsewhere',28891,2.863,5.8,'xlOzp6vqbIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21926,_binary '\0','/5APqNzAYmpDnMpDIr8z5g8rbKl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0874306',4.3,1794,'it','Natale a New York','Lillo (Christian De Sica) married Milena, one of the richest women in Europe. The marriage contract provides that Lillo undertakes to never cheat on her, under penalty of divorce and not even a penny of alimony. But one day he meets Barbara (Sabrina Ferilli) and it\'s immediately irresistible passion... Filippo Vessato (Fabio De Luigi) is a young surgeon who, to make a career, is forced to suffer the harassment of his head, Professor Benci (Claudio Bisio). Filippo is about to go to New York to get married and Benci does not miss an opportunity to further harass him by asking him to bring a gift to his son, a \"model\" student at Riverside College.','/leRNWKJJevN5Hug6Z8KyWM1ZPPz.jpg','2006-12-15',111,'Released',NULL,'Natale a New York',42435,1.5779,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21927,_binary '\0','/3BBabxY8dnYtcAWu8cCMYvZO1j2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0874423',5.5,3172,'en','Zoo','Through interviews and recreation, Zoo tells the story of \"zoos,\" or men who \"love\" animals, through a group of men involved in the fatal incident involving man-horse love.','/ycX4mJHFqfnot7IEyjtgzhnGQbs.jpg','2007-01-20',76,'Released',NULL,'Zoo',18902,1.5175,4.8,'QQGGcb3F4KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21928,_binary '\0','/vmWhIMc3RB5AEAiKPhkXKXx1HlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0874425',5,2403,'en','Pretty Ugly People','Lucy has always used food to escape life\'s problems, but when this self-titled \"fat friend\" lures her group of old college buddies to the Montana wilderness, she reveals a new self - skinny, beautiful and still flawed.','/togHIE3Bs2alz7CNt8o7x1QVXGz.jpg','2008-11-14',99,'Released','Is losing the weight worth losing your friends?','Pretty Ugly People',24450,2.2107,4.3,'0DOAnKbwde4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21929,_binary '\0','/1AzcUrslZJYlLd1jvLy6mswihU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875025',7.1,3224,'ko','타짜','Go-ni tries his best to worship Pyung Gyung-jang as his teacher, and promises to stop gambling after winning his money back. But people\'s desires are endless.','/lIIGKcD9CmCYPYaCOZg3rTw0bRS.jpg','2006-09-28',139,'Released','It\'s time to deal, bet your life if you dare.','Tazza: The High Rollers',38015,4.1399,6.9,'Syg9jGbgXSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21930,_binary '\0','/3ixn2R4tPEUQuq5AWw5EngopyWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875034',5.8,46704,'en','Nine','Arrogant, self-centered movie director Guido Contini finds himself struggling to find meaning, purpose, and a script for his latest film endeavor. With only a week left before shooting begins, he desperately searches for answers and inspiration from his wife, his mistress, his muse, and his mother.','/bSxdTXktgPQPNwlkQ0DZtuAJXlb.jpg','2009-12-03',118,'Released','This holiday season, be Italian.','Nine',10197,4.5684,5.5,'cSAmAP_yWpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21931,_binary '\0','/wHwpdFBkvHRKS1zXptaskCFJ8BK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875113',7.1,21904,'fr','99 Francs','Paris, France, 2001. Octave Parango, a young advertiser working at the Ross & Witchcraft advertising agency, lives a suicidal existence, ruled by cynicism, irresponsibility and debauchery. The obstacles he will encounter in developing a campaign for a new yogurt brand will force him to face the meaning of his work and the way he manages his relationship with those who orbit around his egotistic lifestyle.','/8yj6tkyp7dvdzkkIasX2SUmZd81.jpg','2007-09-26',104,'Released','I\'m the most influential bastard in 2000 years.','99 Francs',8827,2.0472,6.688,'sF4EL5G7qhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21932,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875575',5.2,2398,'en','Being Michael Madsen','Actor Michael Madsen turns the tables on notorious paparazzo, Billy Dant, by hiring a trio of documentary filmmakers to chronicle Dant\'s life, loves, and troubles.','/7XFI67uVviE2ESjQqXIo44N3yiK.jpg','2007-09-28',84,'Released',NULL,'Being Michael Madsen',30398,1.9079,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21933,_binary '\0','/jYK9cND4eD6hEqEdQxTAf0RmSHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875581',6.5,1564,'sv','Darling','Eva is beautiful, irresponsible, self-absorbed and emotionally disconnected. Her life is all about the right clothes, the right people and the right places. Her life is turned upside down when she loses her job and alienates her friends by cheating on her boyfriend. She soon finds herself among \"common\" people where she makes a surprising new acquaintance.','/uIX7yZKwmHiFBOoUzrPp0K03Fs0.jpg','2007-02-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Darling',25228,0.9375,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21934,_binary '\0','/wIlo3H6s1kjwnJQcTg8KtexCIVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875595',7.7,20997,'tr','Kader','Bekir loves Uğur, who loves Zagor, who is about to get out of jail. An already tense love triangle is thrown into turmoil on a hot summer night, when Zagor kills someone, and Uğur disappears.','/bPlu0FpmWNEQIiUrpHpzDThBaXL.jpg','2006-11-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Destiny',44105,1.5733,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21935,_binary '\0','/7qzuPx3ukGxCyLR9j0Ahg3fFI7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875609',6.8,6123,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター アドバンスジェネレーション ミュウと波導の勇者 ルカリオ','In the legendary past, before Poké Balls were invented, an aura-guiding hero Pokémon named Lucario sensed two groups of armies about to clash, and a threat of a massive war in front of Oldoran Castle in Kanto that would leave no survivors. He transferred this message to his master, the legendary hero Arlon, while he was being attacked by a violent group of Hellgar. During the battle, his sense of sight was lost and he was rendered unable to see. He used the detection of his Aura, and so with the offensive Wave Bomb, he eliminated them. Though by the threat, the queen of Rota, Lady Rin was resolute to die with her civilians, and so Arlon made a choice.','/3A3WiPXPmWVhXC7bGSiqtsYY9z6.jpg','2005-07-16',103,'Released','A very familiar Aura Guardian...','Pokémon: Lucario and the Mystery of Mew',34067,5.0141,7,'cksY3fTkc_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21936,_binary '\0','/bdznWFyutvK10bfwRcj2BfwdAJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875695',7.7,1546,'en','The Iceman and the Psychiatrist','For the third time, HBO cameras go inside Trenton State Maximum Security Prison--and inside the mind of one of the most prolific killers in U.S. history--in this gripping documentary. Mafia hit man Richard Kuklinski freely admits to killing more than 100 people, but in this special, he speaks with top psychiatrist Dr. Park Dietz in an effort to face the truth about his condition. Filled with more never-before-revealed confessions, it\'s the most chillingly candid Iceman special yet as it combines often-confrontational interview footage between Kuklinski and Dietz with photos, crime reenactments and home movies that add new layers to this evolving and fascinating story.','/11b2ebyJ951PSTyGh2k8uqj1sVf.jpg','2004-06-01',48,'Released',NULL,'The Iceman and the Psychiatrist',278388,1.2162,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21937,_binary '\0','/pcJJdAiQTGHdjMnTrtcWzj9maiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0875696',4.1,1650,'en','Lost Colony: The Legend of Roanoke','English colonists arriving on Roanoke Island in 1587 find the fort built years before deserted. Soon after, members of the colony begin to die in horrible ways. Before returning to England for provisions, leader John White puts his son-in-law Ananais Dare in charge, and Dare realizes the island is haunted by Norse spirits. Enlisting the aid of a friendly Native American, Dare attempts to free the spirits from their earthly captivity before the entire colony is lost.','/4OZh4upE5dBsqRmATBpQjmvOTHH.jpg','2007-10-13',95,'Released','They came from England to tame the New World, only to become the prey of an ancient evil.','Lost Colony: The Legend of Roanoke',24643,2.1435,5,'mMxwzk34qgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21938,_binary '\0','/4LyM6wxYVakVhOUoIcRuRbl4lyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0876233',6.2,3385,'en','The Last Word','When an eccentric poet who makes a living ghostwriting suicide notes falls for the free-spirited sister of his latest client, he must desperately maintain a web of lies to conceal how he knew her deceased brother.','/2Aou5FwwTlMhiS63J49vcOoVCwv.jpg','2008-04-20',90,'Released','A romantic comedy where opposites distract.','The Last Word',17175,2.3433,5.8,'r7SJyrKX64I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21939,_binary '\0','/g1jMBL8IY8II7E89VYQ542THvit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0876294',4,4958,'en','The Zombie Diaries','In the early part of the 21st Century, an unknown virus began spreading among the populous. Within weeks it had engulfed the entire planet, from the smallest communities to the greatest cities. Upon the death of its host, the virus would reanimate the corpse until it was no longer able to support itself. Soon the planet was infested with a new threat - the undead. So begins our journey into the dystopian world of the zombie diaries.','/fzysJPoM5METy0ccLEv8UNXADCC.jpg','2006-10-29',81,'Released','Brace Yourself...This Time It\'s for Real.','The Zombie Diaries',25035,1.5415,4.3,'pJQ9RL8996o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21940,_binary '\0','/1QmEcK0w2Ub4Hm094fHbZT8vA7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0876563',7.6,189062,'ja','崖の上のポニョ','When Sosuke, a young boy who lives on a clifftop overlooking the sea, rescues a stranded goldfish named Ponyo, he discovers more than he bargained for. Ponyo is a curious, energetic young creature who yearns to be human, but even as she causes chaos around the house, her father, a powerful sorcerer, schemes to return Ponyo to the sea.','/yp8vEZflGynlEylxEesbYasc06i.jpg','2008-07-19',100,'Released','Welcome to a world where anything is possible.','Ponyo',12429,12.0117,7.763,'CsR3KVgBzSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21941,_binary '\0','/flWQA4sdKEAUpUjyjsSEVMpqWxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0877522',4.5,1612,'it','Ho voglia di te','A macho type man becomes entangled with an independent-minded girl.','/cFGEqTIz82FjZbSY1U4M8O7WLhM.jpg','2007-03-09',106,'Released',NULL,'I Want You',21943,1.6999,4.9,'hQKbm5Cx9M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21942,_binary '\0','/5cDHzU5vKAJzAIjQJrAHGygBZua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0877700',5.8,1464,'fr','Donne-moi la main','Quentin and Antoine are 18-year-old twins. Without their father knowing it, they set out on a voyage to Spain, where their mother\'s funeral is to take place. The two brothers barely knew their mother. Their hitchhiking journey is full of encounters, arguments, reconciliations, and experiences. Their time on the road also reveals their differences, the splits in their attractions, and the confusion of their feelings.','/nBBSXf7B9MXcBr3ihshJwqndfSv.jpg','2008-02-18',80,'Released',NULL,'Give Me Your Hand',40421,2.2559,5.4,'2McaIvOWgEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21943,_binary '\0','/3Nj3mJ3UdLzglbvtqVSBQi90abV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878657',4.1,1333,'en','The Cellar Door','Having developed an uncontrollable obsession with the beautiful young Rudy, crazed serial killer Herman kidnaps her and locks her in a cage in his basement. The only way for Rudy to survive this nightmare is to outsmart her psychopathic tormentor. But Herman has experience on his side: He\'s entrapped and tortured other women before, playing sick and twisted mind games with his frightened victims.','/gkWjhSqwbXgav7IPKCwdlK4EhZQ.jpg','2007-06-01',85,'Released','THE GIRL NEXT DOOR ISN\'T THERE ANYMORE','The Cellar Door',18496,1.5824,3.7,'6_6qfb5urmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21944,_binary '\0','/lZ7bMu1vag8Tl1UrcrPNlunJEuN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878674',7.1,3259,'en','Garage','Due to a learning disability, Josie\'s life in a tiny town revolves around a menial job taking care of a garage that could close at any day. Things start to change, however, when David, the son of his boss\' girlfriend, comes to work with him. Josie hangs out with David and his teenage friends, bringing them beer, and despite being a grown man himself, finds that the new company lifts his spirits. But his simple-mindedness blinds him to some potential legal dangers.','/kXAgwhwMNZk49KGLF0zJO8cMZiH.jpg','2007-10-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Garage',18595,1.2667,6.6,'A61PWlWh_ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21945,_binary '\0','/6zogcLM0wuJdSrKNxie0lRv8KmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878695',5.8,13056,'en','Murder Party','A random invitation to a Halloween party leads a man into the hands of a rogue collective sparking a bloodbath of mishap, mayhem and hilarity.','/gzwNjaoamQ8WMuD62WTfu7NWoA1.jpg','2007-10-12',79,'Released','Everybody Dies...','Murder Party',13561,1.4636,5.617,'AIyjXcODchM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21946,_binary '\0','/5P6hWD4zxAMntRuRnB4MmPLijNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878804',7.6,392071,'en','The Blind Side','The story of Michael Oher, a homeless and traumatized boy who became an All American football player and first round NFL draft pick with the help of a caring woman and her family.','/PhpAdRopu0sOWf0BY7vVtxrRD3.jpg','2009-11-20',129,'Released','Based on the extraordinary true story','The Blind Side',22881,17.8857,7.661,'KA56LqFszYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21947,_binary '\0','/3okQ2xus2KMBkCJBmOsGAhUOHnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878814',4.5,1937,'en','Jewtopia','Smitten with a Jewish woman, a gentile asks his Jewish pal to advise him on how to act like a member of the community.','/wnPBdEQzCSnNcb42mSGNZFxgzrw.jpg','2012-04-26',90,'Released','The story of a gentile who wants to marry a Jewish girl... so he\'ll never have to make another decision.','Jewtopia',220746,2.0498,4.7,'7a0zZSVeW-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21948,_binary '\0','/fUvwgWXOejXIwVbYPg9qPeAGKZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0878835',6.6,12019,'en','Please Give','In New York City, a husband and wife butt heads with the granddaughters of the elderly woman who lives in the apartment the couple owns.','/kft7oy2SoImjDUXgeFbUxhICdc2.jpg','2010-04-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Please Give',40247,2.4561,6.2,'zi9WlsYCr-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21949,_binary '\0','/Pbr2ImzoDbE8CdGyencQpdEOdw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0879843',7,18392,'pl','Katyń','On September 1st, 1939, Nazi Germany invades Poland, unleashing World War II. On September 17th, the Soviet Red Army crosses the border. The Polish army, unable to fight on two fronts, is defeated. Thousands of Polish men, both military and government officials, are captured by the invaders. Their fate will only be known several years later.','/qLErcyMV88odARIYAv5gV5dGREM.jpg','2007-09-21',122,'Released','The untold story of the crime Stalin could not hide','Katyn',13614,4.001,6.696,'40odyHxnXNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21950,_binary '\0','/elzrIY3nfzWz4AXh0lxxBsXLCGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0879870',5.9,115163,'en','Eat Pray Love','A married woman realizes how unhappy her marriage really is, and that her life needs to go in a different direction. After a painful divorce, she takes off on a round-the-world journey to \"find herself\".','/gjR5zUeMGV6UNqtI0OuzqrLQcjU.jpg','2010-08-12',133,'Released','Let yourself go.','Eat Pray Love',38167,13.4969,6.245,'mjay5vgIwt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21951,_binary '\0','/vwKVSLkfPMFMuLnTOS8YZf4xj7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0880440',5.9,1593,'fr','L\'Auberge rouge','A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard. The story unfolds as the monk tries to save the guest\'s lives without violating the holy secrecy of the confession.','/fsYIPEzzUc2PgyjVIykaH16XBlO.jpg','2007-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'The Red Inn',13732,3.1324,5.519,'Eef6SUnN8yY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21952,_binary '\0','/s3kGgVwM946SWj3iXShDbeJALiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0880502',7.7,35727,'de','Auf der anderen Seite','The lives of six German-Turkish immigrants are drawn together by circumstance: An old man and a prostitute forging a partnership, a young scholar reconciling his past, two young women falling in love, and a mother putting the shattered pieces of her life back together.','/kqhVVpXFtOotSlK0npVaBHXUqxV.jpg','2007-09-27',122,'Released',NULL,'The Edge of Heaven',2014,2.9332,7.233,'JxjCqy6hVRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21953,_binary '\0','/8Em2MEWPKtS9SFVUeRPhBLKDJUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0880570',4.5,1545,'en','The Ministers','A NYPD detective attempts to avenge the death of her father, but unwittingly becomes involved with one of his killers.','/voQjcICAdz11ukMPI1TndkTAWNW.jpg','2009-10-16',89,'Released',NULL,'The Ministers',26861,2.0117,4.4,'voWx2L37v4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21954,_binary '\0','/eIjrpeXSiSq0CN6AE44trDAPRau.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0880578',6.2,55049,'en','Untraceable','Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.','/ySUwDRDEn01lKIMPQorpFCMLWqE.jpg','2008-01-22',101,'Released','A cyber killer has finally found the perfect accomplice: You.','Untraceable',8090,7.2366,6.246,'oIqnESZW0qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21955,_binary '\0','/aIpBYcmf05ivH8xj5mF8Tk6v7uV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0880648',5.6,6531,'en','Shuttle','When two friends return from a girls weekend vacation in Mexico, they find themselves stranded at the airport. Trying to get home safely, they board an airport shuttle for the short trip. But once their feet cross the threshold of the shuttle, a night that had started like any other turns terrifying, and the ride home becomes a descent into darkness.','/xZWYVT0YC5kDf6fetNAAifN1aAx.jpg','2008-03-08',107,'Released','Never ride with a stranger.','Shuttle',17027,2.0505,5.3,'8kobmtKcpsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21956,_binary '\0','/cSR493LjJxDmRy3hPpk9YCPHfZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881200',7.3,7630,'zh','集结号','Follows a soldier trying to gain recognition for comrades who died in 1948, at a turning point in the civil war between the communists and the nationalist forces of the Kuomintang.','/pv04qa9RxD41XLnJGECq1f4cr9I.jpg','2007-10-09',123,'Released','Every sacrifice deserves to be immortalized.','Assembly',14044,2.4593,6.9,'H3_DBNwZon4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21957,_binary '\0','/AfJdtxxhbA0E6vlzRRcXDUNdBEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881320',5.9,58913,'en','Sanctum','Master diver Frank McGuire has explored the South Pacific\'s Esa-ala Caves for months. But when his exit is cut off in a flash flood, Frank\'s team—including 17-year-old son Josh and financier Carl Hurley are forced to radically alter plans. With dwindling supplies, the crew must navigate an underwater labyrinth to make it out.','/zRUNv1CbeVtmTCNr6RLHnxV2QYm.jpg','2011-02-03',108,'Released','The only way out is down.','Sanctum',48340,5.6223,6.056,'OgW7L2uq2VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21958,_binary '\0','/7qdeWU6XNrMFuemM2TAHD6Rc6NS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881891',4.8,46570,'en','All About Steve','After one short blind date, Mary Horowitz, a brilliant and eccentric crossword constructor, is convinced that Steve, a CCN cameraman, is her soul mate. Because his job takes him hither and yon, she crisscrosses the country following Steve, with the encouragement of a reporter, turning up at media events he\'s at to convince him they are perfect for each other. Along the way, she befriends an assortment of misfits who accept her for who she is, leading her to reassess her reasons for this strange journey.','/k7lmf0OeOpQLUoTRLG7e5JZ7H4B.jpg','2009-08-06',99,'Released','A comedy that clings.','All About Steve',23706,6.4731,5,'mtJfr-a_oHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21959,_binary '\0','/3wRqOlQ67slaLh9F0iJ2rw5yLe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881894',6.3,1899,'ta','அட்டகாசம்','Twin brothers Jeeva and Guru are separated in childhood by tragedy and fate. When their paths cross years later—one a humble driving instructor, the other a feared gangster—their identities collide, leading to a tale of revenge, redemption, and the enduring bond of family.','/yrG9GWyTz2EYXko1leZSEqNnZdf.jpg','2004-11-12',157,'Released',NULL,'Attagasam',69394,0.8758,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21960,_binary '\0','/qqYSkNGpF1hjwn8NsaGCTYP3Eig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881934',6.1,1567,'en','The Killing of John Lennon','The film follows the travels and accounts of Mark Chapman (Jonas Ball) and gives the watcher an insight into his mind. It starts with him in Hawaii and how he does not fit in with anyone including his job; family; friends etc. He says he is searching for a purpose in his life and that it has no direction. He seeks refuge in the public library where he finds the book, \'The Catcher in the Rye\'. He becomes obsessed with the book and believes that he himself is the protaganist in the book, Holden Caulfield. He believes the ideas in the book reflect his own personal life and how he does not fit in anywhere and he reads it constantly. He then finds another book in the library about The Beatles singer John Lennon and begins a personal hatred for him.','/gV15wMko8RJ5o4O8uQpvBO2mx1O.jpg','2007-12-07',114,'Released','I was nobody until I killed the biggest somebody on earth.','The Killing of John Lennon',44054,1.3283,5.875,'pGj2Iywj99A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21961,_binary '\0','/ueJ35gDpbJvgMmyLxFKiMggD3TH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0881948',5.4,8886,'tr','Şaşkın','The movie Saskin (Silly) is about a young guy Mehmet, who falls in love with a girl who happens to comment about perfect love on a radio show and follows her to a holiday resort where she possibly work.','/rvvvqU5D17oKU9f4nls04BsT5Lk.jpg','2006-11-09',90,'Released',NULL,'The Silly',447082,1.9603,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21962,_binary '\0','/5vMfZbXbIb7xYg85ao93KYgreZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0882742',5.2,1358,'en','Alice Upside Down','Still mourning the death of her mother a few years back, Alice McKinley finds her life seriously disrupted when her father Ben buys a store and moves her and her older brother Lester to a new town.','/QNYxepooPEhC3CpGYVPXZzIMtG.jpg','2007-10-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Alice Upside Down',49162,1.4752,5.7,'mehQlK2enH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21963,_binary '\0','/ryq7WZp961IuZ9vceswWHyNo47L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0882791',6,1274,'ja','NANA2','Two girls with the same name but very different personalities share an apartment in this sequel to Nana. The rising fame of Nana Osaki\'s band, the Black Stones, is beginning to take a toll on the best friends\' relationship. Meanwhile, Nana Komatsu struggles to make sense of her love triangle with Black Stones\' guitarist Nobu and rival group Trapnest\'s bassist Takumi.','/bumSqgYZ3h6eYe3762mpi6VcJd3.jpg','2006-12-09',130,'Released',NULL,'Nana 2',35752,1.7098,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21964,_binary '\0','/80seex5P196f7pff3R8xqwd2Zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0882977',6.4,96458,'en','Snitch','Construction company owner John Matthews learns that his estranged son, Jason, has been arrested for drug trafficking. Facing an unjust prison sentence for a first time offender courtesy of mandatory minimum sentence laws, Jason has nothing to offer for leniency in good conscience. Desperately, John convinces the DEA and the opportunistic DA Joanne Keeghan to let him go undercover to help make arrests big enough to free his son in return. With the unwitting help of an ex-con employee, John enters the narcotics underworld where every move could be his last in an operation that will demand all his resources, wits and courage to survive.','/1suKSCm8gVUIIOh4MgtWAtzkMe4.jpg','2013-02-21',112,'Released','How far would you go to save your son?','Snitch',134411,8.3377,6.133,'gLqP1oOFSB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21965,_binary '\0','/i9rOssqYdCpUGSJoWLXEJuwgx40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0882978',6.1,6959,'cn','三国之见龙卸甲','The aging Zhao embarks on his final and greatest campaign, a road to adventure that will crown his name in glory for all time.','/wOouWlgSMxlAQow8YdxyssywPJN.jpg','2008-04-03',101,'Released',NULL,'Three Kingdoms: Resurrection of the Dragon',14538,3.323,6.1,'1TJEyLqB6JY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21966,_binary '\0','/z1YBx1vYv6Ax482pw8CG0iDVfTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0883995',6.7,6771,'th','13 เกมสยอง','After losing his job, his car and his money, Phuchit, races against time to complete 13 tasks ordered by an anonymous caller who promised 100 million Baht upon completion.','/2Y0mGD2jZ456V4Wmnemlii54lgM.jpg','2006-10-05',114,'Released','13 Challenges. $100 Million. How Far Would You Go?','13: Game of Death',13436,1.713,6.4,'rdaColwGyFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21967,_binary '\0','/tzV7P6YJXZ9Hda2W5U9hn7eZt5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884214',4.2,1317,'en','Wreckage','Jared, Kate, Rick, and Jessica find themselves stranded in a wreckage yard after their car breaks down during a drag race. Meanwhile, the sheriff\'s office receives notice that a convict escaped from a local state prison. As the teenagers mysteriously disappear one by one, the killer grows hungry and the thriller continues to unravel.','/e37ScWw4qkWDHX7WBbH303N5TnZ.jpg','2010-11-04',87,'Released','Beware. The spare parts may be your own.','Wreckage',73085,1.5847,4,'F23NeUZkehc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21968,_binary '\0','/laydWR0K1bwk4HVKWyW13BEPzHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884224',5.5,23137,'en','War, Inc.','In the future, the desert country of Turaqistan is torn by a riot after private corporation Tamerlane, owned by the former Vice President of the United States, has taken over. Brand Hauser, a hitman who suppresses his emotions by gobbling down hot sauce, is hired by the corporation\'s head to kill the CEO of their competitors.','/nlGsWWYC9n4lkbIoTXmI42dkJqb.jpg','2008-04-28',106,'Released','When it comes to war... America means business','War, Inc.',13191,3.3201,5.5,'G9SFoiYIs_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21969,_binary '\0','/76J14zgwVWyOciri7X7F3DGP3TA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884328',7.1,380347,'en','The Mist','After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.','/c4UgUKZjM0Qzy5t4hAXSOFHYsnb.jpg','2007-11-21',126,'Released','Fear changes everything.','The Mist',5876,16.5338,6.955,'E-NF55EZ5tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21970,_binary '\0','/TE5CVXntRDFF2VleOQh7c7Gnrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884335',5.4,3048,'fr','Chrysalis','Paris 2020, a high tech surgeon and her daughter are involved in a horrific car accident, the surgeon saves her daughter\'s life at the cost of manipulating her dreams and memories.','/kXcr4eCpyt1Lan00znjRJKO7SVm.jpg','2007-06-25',94,'Released','There are things that can\'t be forget.','Chrysalis',13336,1.9232,5.304,'anP8ALC-05s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21971,_binary '\0','/3UPdg8QO6CF5UqmOIJoLKhRM6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884726',4.9,6578,'en','Legends of Oz: Dorothy\'s Return','Dorothy wakes in post-tornado Kansas, only to be whisked back to Oz to try to save her old friends, the Scarecrow, the Lion, the Tin Man, and Glinda, from a devious new villain, the Jester. New comrades Wiser the Owl, Marshal Mallow, China Princess, and Tugg the Tugboat join Dorothy on her latest magical journey through the colorful landscape of Oz to restore order and happiness to Emerald City.','/5XiNCjFudNX0Wj5LanPuIb8E9pU.jpg','2014-05-08',88,'Released','There\'s trouble in OZ...','Legends of Oz: Dorothy\'s Return',59981,4.0225,6.3,'HN7xNSNsWGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21972,_binary '\0','/aan0KdhVgJfAwUJ3n2HDFOWcxZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884732',6.6,85549,'en','The Wedding Ringer','Doug Harris is a loveable but socially awkward groom-to-be with a problem: he has no best man. With less than two weeks to go until he marries the girl of his dreams, Doug is referred to Jimmy Callahan, owner and CEO of Best Man, Inc., a company that provides flattering best men for socially challenged guys in need. What ensues is a hilarious wedding charade as they try to pull off the big con, and an unexpected budding bromance between Doug and his fake best man Jimmy.','/ciR2suRkfJen9lQvfz22lgCj7g7.jpg','2015-01-16',101,'Released','He\'s the best man... money can buy.','The Wedding Ringer',252838,9.73,6.5,'R3TeI9jPPuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21973,_binary '\0','/dzVnYTHkub3YrtOYNBadJ11HMyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884805',5.9,2076,'tr','Pars: Kiraz Operasyonu','A story describing Turkish narcotic police team named \"Pars\" who are trailing the traffic through Afghanistan, Turkey, Europe and USA.','/rua6kocNl3vrn3DdGqZpyJH6TSI.jpg','2007-04-20',145,'Released',NULL,'Pars: Operation Cherry',54267,1.1533,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21974,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0884853',6.7,1946,'sr','Црни Груја и камен мудрости','Based on a comedy TV series about Serbian \"aristocracy\" during the Turkish \"answer\" to the Serbian Uprising during the Serbian-Turkish war in the 19th century. During this time it was of the utmost importance to take the right steps and wisdom is really needed for making those right steps. With the help of a fortune teller, Karadjordje (the leader of the Uprising) learns that, according to a legend, somewhere in the hills exists a Stone of Wisdom which makes you, if you hit your head against it three times, more wise. So he employs his nephew Crni Gruja, with assistants Ceda Velja and Bole, to find him this miraculous Stone. Crni Gruja finds the Stone and, convinced that he is really becoming more wiser, decides to make some business.','/hVpqIref2m5OBDbTGoTiDFQWvqh.jpg','2007-01-31',91,'Released',NULL,'Black Gruja and the Stone of Wisdom',33581,0.7907,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21975,_binary '\0','/uxP8y6KOdsurjvaHvfQoaiV4u0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0885415',6.1,4349,'fi','Niko: Lentäjän poika','A young reindeer named Niko dreams about flying like his father, whom he has never met. Despite constant teasing from others, he sneaks out of his home valley to take flying lessons from Julius, a flying squirrel.','/vEv1FpWQntCYeLW8QUwnE0uFQXa.jpg','2008-09-22',80,'Released','An All-New Holiday Movie About Santa And His Little Helpers!','Niko and the Way to the Stars',25741,3.4774,5.8,'NtZX7SOPDi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21976,_binary '\0','/1uiNWPTB9DJuTooVPWJL68ggm7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0885470',6.5,1459,'tr','Adem\'in Trenleri','Imam Hasan, his wife Hacer and his daughter Fatma arrive at Karaağaçlı, a small railway town in the middle of the Anatolian wilderness. Besides carrying out the duties of the imam, Hasan will be teaching religion to the children of the town during the holy month of Ramadan. His unusual behavior towards his wife and little daughter arrests the attention of the townsfolk. Meanwhile Adem, the son of the stationmaster who is crazy for trains begins to learn about and get into a world he has never heard of before in the lessons given by Hasan: trains, sin, good deeds, heaven and hell.. everything gets jumbled. Condemned of being harsh and merciless towards his family, Hasan one day finds himself obliged to reveal the \"secret\" about himself and his family and this changes everything in the eyes of people. Yet there has remained another secret of which anyone, even Hasan is hardly aware. The people of the town, including Adem, will remember this Ramadan throughout their lives.','/9v3gAAXJjGmK56QwUZTv8Sn53F0.jpg','2007-03-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Adam and the Devil',52100,0.8227,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21977,_binary '\0','/4LHq5tlnDCZl4ywbj4hL08BDtJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0885520',6.9,3668,'zh','盛夏光年','Three high school students experience the perks and pitfalls of love in director Leste Chen’s sensitive tale of friendship and yearning.','/l8uLKtlvhhCIArwiLhf8Yz7uFeF.jpg','2006-10-13',96,'Released','No One Wishes To Be Lonely, Neither Do We.','Eternal Summer',57005,1.9451,6.086,'UN3eWwmVcdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21978,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0886531',6.9,1517,'en','Shades of Ray','American-born Ray Rehman comes home one night to find his Pakistani father on his doorstep. Ray\'s Caucasian mother threw him out. It\'s an awkward time for his father to move in as Ray just proposed to his Caucasian girlfriend - who hasn\'t given him an answer. While trying to get his parents back together, Ray meets a South Asian girl of mixed descent, just like him, and must decide where his identity truly lies.','/1grSWwgARYV9ypa9yRbio7e0U1R.jpg','2008-10-18',87,'Released','Life\'s not always brown or white.','Shades of Ray',79519,1.5386,6.6,'uY25_ndE8lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21979,_binary '\0','/7H1DzmyW35OK2XrfLKjUs5lWfl8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0886539',7.1,11917,'hi','Luck by Chance','Not wanting the same fate as befell her sisters, Sona Mishra re-locates to Mumbai to try to make a living making movies, but she soon finds that the path she has chosen is not an easy one.','/19Qh3fEXsqB0pBl5DRnCBsgj7Ot.jpg','2009-01-30',155,'Released',NULL,'Luck by Chance',16344,2.375,6.546,'XphAPuNppQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21980,_binary '\0','/3r3tZgKTw1554hcFoUfydLHE38w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887261',5.9,56450,'en','Hellraiser','A young woman struggling with addiction comes into possession of an ancient puzzle box, unaware that its purpose is to summon the Cenobites, a group of sadistic supernatural beings from another dimension.','/f9ZAIUxTTk23vo1BC9Ur1Rx5c2E.jpg','2022-09-28',121,'Released','Unlock your fears.','Hellraiser',338947,6.7503,6.2,'oUlgwJNdu2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21981,_binary '\0','/etczwrJie84nkORpem2pNiNd21s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887719',4,6365,'en','Blonde Ambition','A young professional woman unwittingly becomes the pawn of two business executives in their bid to oust the head of a mega-conglomerate.','/t3H5WVxxkNyFoaXfwKKkvKq7G0y.jpg','2007-12-21',93,'Released','Small-town girl. Big-time dreams.','Blonde Ambition',15017,2.9599,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21982,_binary '\0','/gtwZNWy7Z86OJcWpmoEeMqtZctL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887732',6.9,3538,'it','Giorni e nuvole','Set in Genoa, the film concerns the financial struggles and emotional strain that occur after Michele loses his job. He and his wife Elsa are forced to give up their affluent lifestyle and cope with the tensions of moving into a smaller home, finding new work, and making sacrifices.','/gMppKd5bHuc68674vJVEod7HQRw.jpg','2007-10-26',116,'Released',NULL,'Days and Clouds',12823,1.846,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21983,_binary '\0','/wMmBKmLSwwBk5UFTZ317M8R9YtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887745',6.6,1909,'en','How About You...','A young woman, struggling with the direction of her life, spends Christmas watching over a retirement home filled with demanding residents.','/dXqjA5CxL2RksY9J8clZhUjxQ2A.jpg','2007-11-16',100,'Released',NULL,'How About You...',28871,1.7884,6.3,'yB3B5-uVcMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21984,_binary '\0','/q9uvIR5RJXK2T9G1vYt09m8czZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887769',7.6,3577,'ml','കേരള വർമ്മ പഴശ്ശിരാജ','Set in the backdrop of the seventeenth century, the royal family of Kottayam is ruled by Pazhassi. The British government begins to impose heavy taxes on the locals in the Thalassery region of Kerala.','/rcGgTyNLrob5bshxdgNvGiedSmL.jpg','2009-10-16',197,'Released',NULL,'Kerala Varma Pazhassi Raja',78642,1.5769,6.9,'kKYZdDKiQSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21985,_binary '\0','/dGaV9hfxztBIaCs0MsMlamRw9hC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887883',7,380269,'en','Burn After Reading','When a disc containing memoirs of a former CIA analyst falls into the hands of gym employees, Linda and Chad, they see a chance to make enough money for Linda to have life-changing cosmetic surgery. Predictably, events whirl out of control for the duo, and those in their orbit.','/jdwSkQu3XirmX18MNj8CqFWsCk.jpg','2008-09-05',96,'Released','Intelligence is relative.','Burn After Reading',4944,10.0824,6.679,'jksnxStXol0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21986,_binary '\0','/off0xgvtfHY82l3MC4mDpCk1APY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887912',7.5,499891,'en','The Hurt Locker','During the Iraq War, a Sergeant recently assigned to an army bomb squad is put at odds with his squad mates due to his maverick way of handling his work.','/io2dfBJhasvGbgkCX9cCGVOiA99.jpg','2008-10-10',131,'Released','You don\'t have to be a hero to do this job. But it helps.','The Hurt Locker',12162,12.0513,7.248,'4mgWq9wZs2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21987,_binary '\0','/d8twGjhgFmsapoUpY4K6WoieobH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0887971',4.8,7834,'en','While She Was Out','Della Myers, a suburban housewife, lives with her twin children and her abusive husband, Kenneth. On Christmas Eve, she drives to the local mall to buy gift-wrap. In the jam-packed parking lot, she notices an old car taking up two spaces and decides to leave a note on the windshield calling them out. After the mall closes, her car is blocked by the old car and she\'s threatened by four thugs. She escapes in her vehicle, but they drive after her. She crashes at a dead end construction site at the edge of a forest. What unfolds in the desolate woods is Della\'s lone fight for survival against a gang of angry young men with murderous intent.','/ehhJzxVV566RxPKmotY4E6xU477.jpg','2008-10-27',82,'Released','Everyone has a breaking point. Tonight, she reaches hers.','While She Was Out',15749,4.1207,5.5,'TNr__wrv_IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21988,_binary '\0','/wJzIUrt0cKvQHOlrSbVmIrrkDDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0888019',2.6,1811,'en','Five Across the Eyes','On their way home from a high school football game, five teenage girls become hopelessly lost. When they stop to get directions at a desolate store, the girls are involved in a minor fender bender which leaves an unattended SUV one headlight short. Inexperienced and frightened that they\'ll get into trouble, the girls flee the scene of the accident and speed away down the dark and unfamiliar roads. As they blindly make their way across an area the locals call THE EYES, the girls are suddenly shocked to see one lone headlight appear behind them. As the driver of the damaged SUV begins one terrifying assault after another, the five girls will lose their innocence and possibly their lives in this brutal and shocking thrill ride.','/wxJ7U3dyXz6wanaokZrxZPEhJ9z.jpg','2006-10-01',95,'Released','Getting home by curfew is gonna be hell...','Five Across the Eyes',43639,0.9162,3.3,'reDZgf5auXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21989,_binary '\0','/wLEGgP8JzTsALFNObh3np7tWcJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0888496',6.8,1450,'it','Fascisti su Marte','In 1938 a group of fascists led by the general Gaetano Maria Barbagli decides to invade the planet of Mars.','/qmaCV3ClPWwb9SVclPKrMOdBLeW.jpg','2006-10-27',100,'Released',NULL,'Fascists on Mars',48250,1.2283,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21990,_binary '\0','/kUJ4eNKuBrAcJP6Ueq6f7QC0aNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0888503',7.8,1714,'ta','Imsai Arasan 23rd Pulikecei','Set in the late 18th century during the early stages of the British Raj, the film tells the story of twin brothers separated at birth. Pulikesi XXIII, the foolish elder brother, becomes a puppet of his uncle, the Chief Minister, while Ukraputhan, the wise younger brother, becomes a patriot intent on saving his land and his brother.','/7hznECYaMhreYbpnQyiESUuibac.jpg','2006-07-08',142,'Released',NULL,'Imsai Arasan 23rd Pulikecei',79665,1.7799,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21991,_binary '\0','/gHZujwfeAgQtug2HPFyzWizcOu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0888693',6.1,6368,'en','Sleepwalking','When her boyfriend is arrested for marijuana possession, Joleen Reedy and her 11-year-old daughter, Tara, take refuge with Joleen\'s aimless brother, James. Joleen soon runs off with a truck driver, and James is unable to meet his responsibilities. After Child Protective Services takes possession of Tara, James abducts her from a foster home, and the two travel from California to Utah, where his abusive father lives.','/sQ2YMtrzHBEVNW6fGwd45DzmHOG.jpg','2008-03-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Sleepwalking',14349,2.0204,6.1,'18LPln2nByE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21992,_binary '\0','/m9t2c1LiVPApCUMNsPDr5BOoX6j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889134',5.5,3445,'en','Finding Amanda','A television producer with a penchant for drinking and gambling is sent to Las Vegas to convince his troubled niece to enter rehab.','/9GS6a3EjW8Bs1Wvhztqt01jveUk.jpg','2008-06-27',96,'Released','When it comes to screwing up their lives, some people don\'t know when to cry uncle.','Finding Amanda',13065,2.9852,4.851,'WnYilclYyn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21993,_binary '\0','/2Byrd5b6gl90rauwU5VaZrufbq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889139',5.3,1434,'de','Warum Männer nicht zuhören und Frauen schlecht einparken','Jan is an absolute heartthrob and a diehard Hertha fan. Katrin is attractive, just as successful and an incorrigible romantic. Chance makes the two the ideal couple. At least almost. Everything would be perfect if the two flagship models of their species did not lapse into primeval behavioral patterns. And so Jan sinks a little too deep in the cleavage of his secretary Melanie, and Katrin can not resist the adventurer Jonathan\'s lead role.','/lRsSvgnmKatNQm52WMzGfstNGiN.jpg','2007-11-28',103,'Released',NULL,'Why Men Don\'t Listen and Women Can\'t Read Maps',5338,1.6774,4.5,'akYT6TFqBrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21994,_binary '\0','/gh3uqEZQp4nhkyJqkGUJSgGr6AJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889573',6.1,118298,'en','The Switch','Kassie is a smart, fun-loving single woman who, despite her neurotic best friend Wally’s objections, decides it’s time to have a baby – even if it means doing it herself… with a little help from a charming sperm donor. But, unbeknownst to her, Kassie’s plans go awry because of a last-minute switch that isn’t discovered until seven years later… when Wally gets acquainted with Kassie’s cute, though slightly neurotic, son.','/oJdMT6RGtbvQ26Tk7EHGfG8xZ6.jpg','2010-08-20',101,'Released','The most unexpected comedy ever conceived.','The Switch',41210,7.5804,6.2,'EEYqgyXyk9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21995,_binary '\0','/vxeo16JiRxxpRYCteDPlmLIZwrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889583',5.9,159627,'en','Brüno','Flamboyantly gay Austrian television reporter Bruno stirs up trouble with unsuspecting guests and large crowds through brutally frank interviews and painfully hilarious public displays of homosexuality.','/wcUc7TYtsb72dHVb51sYaGIvQsr.jpg','2009-07-08',83,'Released','Borat was so 2006.','Brüno',18480,6.5769,5.638,'pxyJ_ZQVhTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21996,_binary '\0','/lP1lJJFCchOWwwqauM1C2ZC63vY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889588',7,10272,'zh','黃石的孩子','About young British journalist, George Hogg, who with the assistance of a courageous Australian nurse, saves a group of orphaned children during the Japanese occupation of China in 1937.','/qjmo26BnSimVjhCE97cH8VCtEUV.jpg','2008-04-03',125,'Released','War made them orphans, one man made them legends','The Children of Huang Shi',13405,3.3144,6.7,'NIhSnm1j3go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21997,_binary '\0','/slP4SViyYshben5abJhh6ObYn2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889595',6.2,4749,'en','Dream Boy','The story of Nathan, a young teenager who tries to flourish in a romantic relationship with neighbour Roy. The two young men will have to face the brutal reality of the rural south of the United States in the late 1970s.','/hLgAHTNN6468EuyDO9sX7CzeV4z.jpg','2008-10-24',88,'Released',NULL,'Dream Boy',40925,2.442,6.137,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21998,_binary '\0','/d3fvLuBfByYslZbG8RTQooUI2vz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889600',5.6,2749,'en','To Be Fat Like Me','Pretty, popular, and slim high-schooler Aly Schimdt had plans of earning a sports scholarship to college but a knee injury ruins her chances. She decides to enter a documentary contest in the hopes of winning money for college. She believes that overweight people, like her mom and brother, seem to make excuses about how the world perceives them. So Aly decides to attend a rival high school as a heavily overweight person for the documentary, but not change her personality. Aly intends and hopes to prove that personality will outshine physical appearance. But when she\'s met with ridicule, harassment, and name-calling she begins to see things differently.','/hVahuQRcaat4mobU1iBJSoLaxNT.jpg','2007-01-08',89,'Released','One thin teen. One fat suit. One shocking exposé.','To Be Fat Like Me',39562,2.3178,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(21999,_binary '\0','/mNWPDlmHQhFA8vwFiybQrMNuWpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889652',7.1,2746,'fr','Roman de gare','The successful novelist Judith Ralitzer is interrogated in the police station about the disappearance of her ghost-writer. A serial-killer escapes from a prison in Paris. A missing school teacher leaves his wife and children. In the road, the annoying and stressed hairdresser Hughette is left in a gas station by her fiancé Paul while driving to the poor farm of her family in the country. A mysterious man offers a ride to her and she invites him to assume the identity of Paul during 24 hours to not disappoint her mother. Who might be the unknown man and what is real and what is fiction?','/k6F68SR9Ps8gQPfPlv4p8tchPBR.jpg','2007-06-27',103,'Released','Some meetings are more fatal than others.','Crossed Tracks',14949,1.2886,6.6,'48cA6PJHqD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22000,_binary '\0','/bBcwHo2KmadOh1W4MuCt42QtGJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889665',6,3285,'fr','Steak','George is the scapegoat of his classmates. One day he cracks and shoots them. His best and only friend Blaise is accused in his place and sentenced to 7 years in a psychiatric hospital. At the day of his release, Blaise realizes he only has one family: his best friend George. But he does not want to hear about his childhood friend, as he tries to integrate with the “Chivers” a gang whose members wear red jackets and boots, drink milk, drive sport trucks and play an incomprehensible and violent game that mixes cricket and mental arithmetic.','/IugtyTSEBusqT9F8nIcc3tD6hN.jpg','2007-06-20',80,'Released',NULL,'Steak',49084,1.223,5.6,'OlYRBSXmf2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22001,_binary '\0','/nJ9vstl9ITPcvOaYxQjIM0rfOmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0889671',7.4,1314,'en','Trumbo','Through a focus on the life of Dalton Trumbo (1905-1976), this film examines the effects on individuals and families of a congressional pursuit of Hollywood Communists after World War II. Trumbo was one of several writers, directors, and actors who invoked the First Amendment in refusing to answer questions under oath. They were blacklisted and imprisoned. We follow Trumbo to prison, to exile in Mexico with his family, to poverty, to the public shunning of his children, to his writing under others\' names, and to an eventual but incomplete vindication. Actors read his letters; his children and friends remember and comment. Archive photos, newsreels and interviews add texture. Written by','/27TwpK0pbkkOeuKnmgjg5cyIcPb.jpg','2007-09-10',96,'Released','Hollywood Blacklisted Him… But He Had The Last Word.','Trumbo',60230,1.5665,6.7,'rb4PcTssCb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22002,_binary '\0','/3lrNJ5jNqKq9UpQrXo8FNFzyoE4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0890870',5.9,178665,'en','Saw IV','Despite Jigsaw\'s death, and in order to save the lives of two of his colleagues, Lieutenant Rigg is forced to take part in a new game, which promises to test him to the limit.','/ku1QdCXOU4ckz3zxLLlis8MIJVm.jpg','2007-10-25',93,'Released','You thought it was over...but the games have just begun.','Saw IV',663,10.0251,6.2,'OxwdZMMymqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22003,_binary '\0','/sxnAZsk6rbafimZTiO1BMDv1RNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0890882',6.5,2460,'fi','Miehen työ','Juha is 38 years old and has three small children and a depressed wife. He sees himself as strong and believes a man should provide for his family. But one day Juha is fired from his job. Ashamed, he weaves a web of lies to hide the fact from his family. With the help of his friend Olli, Juha begins prostituting himself to support his wife and children. With this he makes in two hours what it took him two days to earn before. The shame and deception mushroom, but the pay from the new profession seems to offset the downside.','/p6GpLrvjBWpdorKnVIo7q6jKVj8.jpg','2007-02-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Man\'s Job',20163,1.1759,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22004,_binary '\0','/dy4V7RcdOtoBhyAl2WFkySFI1WU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0890883',6.7,2864,'fi','Musta jää','Saara is a middle-aged doctor who one day finds out that her architect-husband Leo is having an affair with a younger woman, Tuuli. Instead of revealing her true identity, Saara pretends to be someone else and makes friends with Tuuli. At the same time she is planning the best way to revenge her husband and his lover.','/l84cc4yrpUGii37FWKBabbjp4iK.jpg','2007-10-19',107,'Released',NULL,'Black Ice',25004,1.221,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22005,_binary '\0','/xLjv2ah3MeLrkm6EoViJR9ZGznj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0890885',6.7,5298,'it','Saturno contro','This film focuses on contemporary 30- and 40-somethings trying to make sense of their lives in an age in which the old certainties have disappeared. Lorenzo and Davide make their lives together within a circle that includes Antonio and Angelica, married with children; Nerval and her policeman husband.','/qpzR06PrVDaJGBaSngEMUhVhhw.jpg','2007-02-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Saturn in Opposition',22373,2.0877,6.854,'TcHt0DwYcZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22006,_binary '\0','/hszsENCd2zuAGKO2Jpm3uMXNQyB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0890888',5.3,2491,'de','Vollidiot','Based on Tommy Jaud\'s bestselling novel, this comedy focuses on a dispassionate clerk and his set-backs in life. 29-year-old Simon works in a phone shop, but his thoughts just circle around finding a new girl-friend after being left by his last one year ago. While his Croatian cleaner tries to procure him, his efforts to chat up women in clubs also fail. However, he finds the woman of his dreams (and mother of their future children) in his most hated coffee shop, although not having a clue how to win her heart...','/bbtlSUOiNLEV1JvS99WtwKpBtE5.jpg','2007-04-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Vollidiot',1419,1.969,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22007,_binary '\0','/cD0zPoMQbMWFJVpa1LkRCHFON2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0891457',6.1,2278,'zh','刺青','When Jade, a web-cam girl, visits Takeko\'s tattoo studio she becomes entranced with the image of the spider lily and with Takeko as well. In order to get closer to the object of her desire, Jade asks Takeko to give her the same lily tattoo, challenging Takeko\'s monastic existence and opening up memories which threaten to tear the two women apart.','/zAoEHYqsr90pQG6C9ORNPzKDP6d.jpg','2007-03-30',94,'Released','A daring portrait of forbidden love.','Spider Lilies',43088,1.6722,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22008,_binary '\0','/84dfDEb8UGjdLWl2QAPGcul8Ced.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0891520',5.4,3618,'ja','口裂け女','Legend holds that 30 years ago, a suburban town was terrorized by the spirit of a woman whose horrid face had been grotesquely disfigured. Roaming the streets wearing a long coat and carrying large scissors, the spirit would approach her young victims and, while removing the mask, ask if she was pretty. The victim’s response would almost always lead to their violent death.','/mUwHLq5SFq0rQF9DhvoOEKt8AIi.jpg','2007-03-16',90,'Released','Am I Pretty...?','Carved: The Slit-Mouthed Woman',25744,2.4935,6,'coQlOBId2Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22009,_binary '\0','/tfE55NmC3tF2U0DtZkAYKvUHn5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0891527',6.2,57331,'en','Lions for Lambs','Three stories told simultaneously in ninety minutes of real time: a Republican Senator who\'s a presidential hopeful gives an hour-long interview to a skeptical television reporter, detailing a strategy for victory in Afghanistan; two special forces ambushed on an Afghani ridge await rescue as Taliban forces close in; a poli-sci professor at a California college invites a student to re-engage.','/37L6IoLhTgLzq6XYWpWUlbbEzMj.jpg','2007-10-22',92,'Released','If you don\'t STAND for something, you might FALL for anything.','Lions for Lambs',4515,6.7272,6,'VvooOSNWrDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22010,_binary '\0','/ee6AZ0B098pTSbQH6AwVZCT6Pag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0891592',3.7,26446,'en','Street Fighter: The Legend of Chun-Li','When a teenager, Chun-Li witnesses the kidnapping of her father by wealthy crime lord M. Bison. When she grows up, she goes on a quest for vengeance and becomes the famous crime-fighter of the Street Fighter universe.','/lbNemoc9bRIAIVck0e2cv1cgftN.jpg','2009-02-27',97,'Released','Some fight for power. Some fight for us.','Street Fighter: The Legend of Chun-Li',15268,6.0597,4.285,'EctFEyCMDL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22011,_binary '\0','/qWGOkL6QbInEmVlP177Ymu9Egq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892051',5.3,1479,'en','Evil Angel','Set in present day Chicago, the ancient avenging demon Lilith, attempts to destroy a young paramedic\'s life while destroying anyone who interferes with her plan.','/oFUxxu68hZ3HN86Lq6H28pmsKFf.jpg','2009-02-05',123,'Released','Killing her, only makes her angry.','Evil Angel',35908,3.7725,5,'Q326eH9uK4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22012,_binary '\0','/4ZvUlPQsErH3V7q2itGuNUBuCds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892109',5.2,4479,'en','Trailer Park of Terror','Six troubled high school students and their chaperon, an optimistic youth ministries Pastor, return from an outdoor character building retreat in the mountains. During a raging storm, their bus crashes, hopelessly stranding them in the middle of the Trucker\'s Triangle, a forgotten locus of consummate evil in the middle of nowhere.','/2wipDrSAa6xXLGREzZBfyLauFxq.jpg','2008-10-21',98,'Released','Fear has a new home.','Trailer Park of Terror',20016,2.2815,4.8,'CgYmf6OaVZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22013,_binary '\0','/wWschc3KS0Fe2Rk01KR2tbFWmmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892255',7.1,50046,'en','Che: Part One','Ernesto Guevara, known as \'Che\', leads a group of Cuban exiles under Fidel Castro in a revolution to overthrow Fulgencio Batista, the dictator of Cuba.','/ndxoK8RZF1nfHvZzQ3f2sNlkkzg.jpg','2008-09-05',134,'Released','Everyone knows the icon. Few know the man.','Che: Part One',8881,6.4856,6.795,'fqTw2dtVQzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22014,_binary '\0','/2dCkaxVGvXnPfQC07cweMAT2n3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892318',6.5,115646,'en','Letters to Juliet','An American girl on vacation in Italy finds an unanswered \"letter to Juliet\" -- one of thousands of missives left at the fictional lover\'s Verona courtyard, which are typically answered by the \"secretaries of Juliet\" -- and she goes on a quest to find the lovers referenced in the letter.','/y9DdvY1IRNS2hWLq161hmP2gXn.jpg','2010-05-13',105,'Released','What if you had a second chance to find true love?','Letters to Juliet',37056,9.8187,7.004,'165tXUPESnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22015,_binary '\0','/62fRvoQhnp7ufDxX0XyI5iYFCS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892375',8.4,2980,'en','U2 3D','A 3-D presentation of U2\'s global \"Vertigo\" tour. Shot at seven different shows, this production employs the greatest number of 3-D cameras ever used for a single project.','/5OT1s7NOpnJ5IVlpe5hGC7dYGoK.jpg','2008-01-23',85,'Released','Hear. See. Experience.','U2 3D',37003,1.2136,7.4,'hhHjqmjeZww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22016,_binary '\0','/cwKs4mwPNJNalMWXaTHBRJTkPO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892391',7.3,1766,'en','The Meerkats','A coming of age story following a young meerkat pup, Kolo, growing up in the Kalahari desert; and an inspiring look at how one family\'s connection to each other and their surroundings is a model of resilience and fortitude for us all. Shot using ground-breaking techniques, this dramatised documentary is a one-of-a-kind presentation from The Weinstein Company and the BBC, featuring narration by Paul Newman.','/pi9WB2zAVruUryVhZhuXFZ4BpG8.jpg','2008-10-15',83,'Released','Heroes so small they have to be seen on the big screen.','The Meerkats',16971,1.9289,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22017,_binary '\0','/wp6TAn7fL4vKRf0qbJn11w5yT98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892422',6.2,2527,'el','Πέντε Λεπτά Ακόμα','Poor Tasos and was so young! But also very jealous. A defect that ultimately cost him his own life as during his last jealousy crisis for of his beautiful girlfriend Alice, he will fall victim of a traffic accident. Archangels will sympathize with him, granting him another five invisible, on land, minutes, where he will have the opportunity to touch his favorite - and not - persons and to intervene in their lives.','/nKsgL9pmAZfpNtsvrpZZvMOqm5M.jpg','2006-10-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Extended Play',47247,0.7988,5.7,'D0Eyqp4IiP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22018,_binary '\0','/7Sa30cQm9jtSGDZq3jViW8x2C6Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892737',7.4,1373,'en','Last Stand of the 300','This is the true and astounding saga of the Spartans at Thermopylae. It is among the greatest tales of war ever recounted. All the glory and grit of these warriors\' last stand is captured in this exceptional documentary. It is almost impossible to understand how 300 Spartans managed to hold off the million-man Persian army for even a moment, much less seven days. To a man they paid with their lives but their stunning Last Stand assured that their sacrifice would resonate throughout history. Transporting dramatizations and incisive graphics put you in the heat of the battle and show the lay of the land. The complications and strategies of the conflict are revealed through careful analysis, and critical moments are reconstructed to show exactly what happened. Discover what the Spartans were fighting for, what made them capable of such heroics and what drove them to such sacrifice.','/tJw6JNjglltIiuG9JzEHIcgyNuh.jpg','2007-05-27',90,'Released','The Legendary Battle at Thermopylae','Last Stand of the 300',37122,1.762,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22019,_binary '\0','/tUlysdR3Sg4I3i5WCZPKl62SlKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892767',5.5,26080,'en','Horsemen','A recently widowed detective still grieving over his wife\'s death discovers a shocking connection between himself and the suspects in a serial killing spree linked to the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse.','/sIVBGmRXsPuI1TES9sKUImMOw2Q.jpg','2009-02-06',90,'Released','Four victims. Four painful secrets.','Horsemen',18476,3.6664,6,'ygvH7K3s1WI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22020,_binary '\0','/59vDC1BuEQvti24OMr0ZvtAK6R1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892769',8.1,908762,'en','How to Train Your Dragon','As the son of a Viking leader on the cusp of manhood, shy Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III faces a rite of passage: he must kill a dragon to prove his warrior mettle. But after downing a feared dragon, he realizes that he no longer wants to destroy it, and instead befriends the beast – which he names Toothless – much to the chagrin of his warrior father.','/ygGmAO60t8GyqUo9xYeYxSZAR3b.jpg','2010-03-18',98,'Released','What started as fire and fury will become friendship.','How to Train Your Dragon',10191,26.5563,7.868,'1huZhKwhIQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22021,_binary '\0','/fbxZeJEcyf76oEQIGmotlclwmiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892782',6.4,191381,'en','Monsters vs Aliens','When Susan Murphy is unwittingly clobbered by a meteor full of outer space gunk on her wedding day, she mysteriously grows to 49-feet-11-inches. The military jumps into action and captures Susan, secreting her away to a covert government compound. She is renamed Ginormica and placed in confinement with a ragtag group of Monsters...','/hpHarddVj34j53T7NsoUGdKj4mP.jpg','2009-03-19',94,'Released','Saving the day the monster way.','Monsters vs Aliens',15512,22.7059,6.271,'KrGiuIY-gDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22022,_binary '\0','/uzzTystB8lL0mRDII5Sfs5HxgkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892791',6.4,249700,'en','Shrek Forever After','A midlife-crisis burdened Shrek, longing for the days of when he felt like a real ogre, makes a pact with magic deal-maker Rumpelstiltskin. But when he\'s duped and sent to a twisted version of Far Far Away—where Rumpelstiltskin is king, ogres are hunted, and he and Fiona have never met—he sets out to restore his world and reclaim his true love.','/6HrfPZtKcGmX2tUWW3cnciZTaSD.jpg','2010-05-16',93,'Released','It ain\'t ogre... til it\'s ogre.','Shrek Forever After',10192,31.638,6.414,'WV8bbMxPBdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22023,_binary '\0','/ai3QrCcz5fSKVdfXwTKHduvRWLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892874',6,2534,'hi','हल्ला बोल','Ashfaque (Ajay Devgan) is a small town boy aspiring to be a film star in the Hindi film industry. He joins a street theatre group run by a reformed dacoit Sidhu (Pankaj Kapur) who uses street theatre as a medium to bring about an awakening in the masses. Ashfaque struggles to give a creative vent to the actor in him in order to realize his dreams.','/deVwN1G189jS89OSR5gLgg38zs3.jpg','2008-01-11',150,'Released',NULL,'Halla Bol',23848,1.5017,4.913,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22024,_binary '\0','/1CenT4kUoFejc82ME5qP5RBDbIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0892899',5.8,18687,'en','Outpost','In a seedy bar in a town ravaged by war, scientist and businessman Hunt hires mercenary and former Royal Marine D.C. to assemble a crack team of ex-soldiers to protect him on a dangerous journey into no-man\'s land. Their mission is to scope out an old military bunker in Eastern Europe. It should be easy – 48 hours at the most. Lots of cash for little risk. Or so he says...','/rwWEsWV1DNCqZudEiHvk1NPeUla.jpg','2008-03-11',90,'Released','You can\'t kill what\'s already dead!','Outpost',9017,3.1202,5.9,'fEI-v5pdivA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22025,_binary '\0','/ikPcpj7FBEOfMmMAJH8h3ogFls2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893346',5.6,1777,'en','Kiss the Bride','In high school, Matt and Ryan were best friends. More than friends, actually. But in the ensuing ten years, they\'ve lost contact. So when Matt receives an invitation to Ryan\'s wedding he\'s surprised - especially that Ryan is marrying a woman!','/m1ycnhkFufW4NDFG38QaHtAWqDN.jpg','2007-07-23',100,'Released','Guess who\'s coming out for the wedding?','Kiss the Bride',19844,2.4122,5,'b_-C52xOMXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22026,_binary '\0','/gLn5OiBrWGq97iQx5d7VBSn8tBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893356',7.7,3677,'en','Nanking','The story of the rape of Nanking, one of the most tragic events in history. In 1937, the invading Japanese army murdered over 200,000 and raped tens of thousands of Chinese. In the midst of this horror, a small group of Western expatriates banded together to save 250,000. Nanking shows the tremendous impact individuals can make on the course of history.','/64Zh7gcfnpcfga3p36fGiEzKAqR.jpg','2007-02-10',88,'Released','The true story of how a few brave souls saved the lives of thousands.','Nanking',17181,2.2064,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22027,_binary '\0','/zzAuxUpfZDEspL33N3KlOCWxOLH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893382',7.1,12759,'en','Shine a Light','Martin Scorsese’s electrifying concert documentary captures The Rolling Stones live at New York’s Beacon Theatre during their A Bigger Bang tour. Filmed over two nights in 2006 with an all-star team of cinematographers, the film combines dynamic performances with archival footage and rare glimpses behind the scenes, offering a vibrant portrait of the band’s enduring energy and legacy.','/rMVrNWWaO3xAWZHFUbeamWPzVAC.jpg','2008-04-04',122,'Released','A master director shining his light on the best rock band on the planet.','Shine a Light',7944,2.7102,6.8,'V2dGuxTsuxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22028,_binary '\0','/dEN17PeJ2FD4fm5lUAd8gNkR4X5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893397',5.5,1451,'en','Nora Roberts\' Blue Smoke','After witnessing an uncontrollable blaze burn her family\'s pizzeria to the ground when she was just 11 old, it\'s no wonder that Reena decides to become an arson investigator. Now, years later, she decides to visit the old neighborhood, where she finds true romance with a hunky carpenter named Bo Goodnight. But Reena is swiftly knocked off cloud nine when she discovers that a psycho connected to her past has resurfaced to wreak havoc in her life.','/6vE5mONRfjxBl8YoTq2fsKNRJhi.jpg','2007-02-12',95,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Blue Smoke',54699,2.2493,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22029,_binary '\0','/b7LOACQd3yEYbNq9nGEuiOrt0XQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893401',6,2043,'en','Daylight Robbery','Alex masterminds an ambitious plan to steal millions of untraceable cash that is stacked in the underground vaults of The London Exchange Bank, waiting for its last journey, Incineration. Lucky, Matty, Terry, Chubby, Norman and Jay make up his unlikely gang of robbers. Setting up their alibi, the gang check in for a flight and join in with thousands of England supporters that are part of a mass exodus to The World Cup Tournament in Germany.','/va1wc0OCPlS4EtKP8DR55hSM46c.jpg','2008-08-29',90,'Released','7 Men..1 Bank..90 Minutes..THE FUSE IS LIT','Daylight Robbery',17635,1.8791,5.5,'url-aS_2VQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22030,_binary '\0','/6hQgTpZVNHrLafE6IeSAoThQwkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893402',6,18661,'en','Franklyn','Set between the parallel worlds of contemporary London and the futuristic faith dominated metropolis of Meanwhile City, Franklyn weaves a tale of four souls, whose lives are intertwined by fate, romance and tragedy. As these worlds collide, a single bullet determines the destiny of these four characters.','/5yns10om8I19j4OHy1zoVRilAnw.jpg','2008-10-16',98,'Released','Reality is a state of mind.','Franklyn',8884,3.0297,6,'08Nj6a8U2uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22031,_binary '\0','/fXc9lr6rAcgendfvafCMRdw15tr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893406',4.5,2937,'en','Loaded','A young, wealthy club kid\'s life spirals downward into an out-of-control world of drugs, sex and violence.','/lWRpBSkMdg3VLdQjkIjrb0nYQU.jpg','2008-03-25',98,'Released',NULL,'Loaded',14607,1.7265,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22032,_binary '\0','/cQrKK6nh6QEXuesBN3x9JMiBe1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893412',5.6,16359,'en','From Prada to Nada','Two spoiled Beverly Hills sisters who have been left penniless after their father\'s sudden death are forced to move in with their estranged aunt in East Los Angeles.','/mWyHCPbMB6jNjcCwSnkGL1Tj9ZB.jpg','2011-01-28',107,'Released','A riches to rags story.','From Prada to Nada',50217,4.1891,5.441,'EvF6RkxMxGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22033,_binary '\0','/wVzsDt2BCZAdWDeh8Oxb95XGByg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893507',7.2,8876,'tr','Beynelmilel','It is 80\'s Turkey, local musicians of Adiyaman are hired by the military and trained to welcome one of the forceful generals of coup regime.','/lZoYN6OFLcg15Mp6jsF1z8SqCoT.jpg','2006-12-29',106,'Released',NULL,'The International',49834,0.9752,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22034,_binary '\0','/5Eu8YflOSGy2Dhd7iNn9MX67OLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893509',2.9,4063,'en','Blonde and Blonder','Comic mayhem ensues when two lovely blondes, Dee and Dawn, are mistaken as international mob killers.','/yPHIqPLnUtGr5qeKKOTpRd13u3K.jpg','2008-01-18',95,'Released','It\'s a no-brainer','Blonde and Blonder',10120,3.4349,3.8,'OwKAdY8m0e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22035,_binary '\0','/cvSdrCkajfzEWMVFN8FD3w5cOg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0893532',5.4,7882,'en','Kill Theory','While celebrating a graduation at a secluded vacation home, a group of college students find themselves targeted by a sadistic killer who forces them to play a deadly game of killing one another in order to survive.','/pMKJS9yP1eh5DMC1ndwXgsomtqa.jpg','2009-10-07',82,'Released',NULL,'Kill Theory',19237,2.5568,5.3,'HoIPVF-AgsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22036,_binary '\0','/aQtgaQ4nOIKaPtbyqLLQs94DRvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0895777',6.4,2857,'pt','Ó Paí, Ó','During the Carnival in the historical site of Pelourinho, Salvador da Bahia, we follow the lives of the tenants of a falling-to-pieces tenement house who try to get by using creativity, irony, humor, and music.','/BFVGUEQxhORXLRsclpzvGsIIFY.jpg','2007-03-30',96,'Released',NULL,'Ó Paí, Ó: Look at This',37817,1.2809,6.9,'LxsXqWw5_3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22037,_binary '\0','/y6Rf8owtSj1P1Wpt8DTtLVdt5lw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896031',5.8,2942,'en','The Loss of a Teardrop Diamond','Fisher Willow is the disliked Memphis débutante daughter of a plantation owner with a distaste for narrow-minded people and a penchant for shocking and insulting those around her. After returning from studies overseas, Fisher falls in love with Jimmy, the down-and-out son of an alcoholic father and an insane mother who works at a store on her family\'s plantation.','/2immR0qBuTDab4Wx3iigKepAOV7.jpg','2008-09-12',102,'Released','An American legend is back','The Loss of a Teardrop Diamond',28424,2.8132,5.255,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22038,_binary '\0','/5kZAyG9lLKrqiWW6NkZxW6z8akv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896529',6.6,7054,'en','Cairo Time','In Cairo on her own as she waits for her husband, Juliette finds herself caught in a whirlwind romance with his friend Tareq, a retired cop. As Tareq escorts Juliette around the city, they find themselves in the middle of a brief affair that catches them both unawares.','/10zKAyONGXQbtojOWeiZ176o8IQ.jpg','2009-10-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Cairo Time',31189,1.8432,5.971,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22039,_binary '\0','/bokJAhrUdypl3ZwRdtoG134R9de.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896533',4.6,1643,'en','Conjurer','After moving to the country to start life anew after their child\'s death, photographer Shawn Burnett and his wife, Helen, begin to suspect that a ramshackle cabin on their property is haunted by the malevolent spirit of a long-dead witch who once lived there.','/3LLzs60zYGpcupLMWCpjU4RvevU.jpg','2008-11-25',88,'Released','Some sins cannot be forgotten','Conjurer',25573,1.9155,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22040,_binary '\0','/cxBbDUlZ10GibvyQ2iThASBm1Dj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896534',5.5,20985,'en','Deadgirl','When high school misfits Rickie and JT decide to ditch school and find themselves lost in the crumbling facility of a nearby abandoned hospital, they come face-to-face with a gruesome discovery: a body of a woman stripped naked, chained to a table and covered in plastic and soon realize she is anything but dead. Quickly the boys find themselves embarking on a twisted yet poignant journey testing the limits of their friendship, and forces both to decide just how far they\'re willing to stretch their understanding of right and wrong.','/ff00BtvdnSHO8qoblBhiXmJKvCm.jpg','2008-09-06',101,'Released','You’ll never have anything better.','Deadgirl',23966,3.7021,5.264,'-2SSL6Ipnvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22041,_binary '\0','/dVFF7UEIyadASYWgZP3MyeV7Ui9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896585',3.3,2325,'en','Yeti: Curse of the Snow Demon','Surviving the plane crash was only the beginning ... After their plane crashes into uncharted territory in the Himalayas, the survivors set out to find help in the freezing cold. As the days pass and with no sign of a rescue, tensions begin to mount. The survivors wrestle with their consciences as they realise that in order to survive, they must use the bodies of the dead as food. But when it appears that something else is already feeding upon the dead, the survivors realise that their biggest danger is not hunger but something infinitely more sinister: a legendary Yeti is stalking them and is moving in for the kill. Can they outsmart the beast or will they die trying?','/AtHGZ525XUnEybYfHoGjxmcfnyS.jpg','2008-11-08',85,'Released','It kills in cold blood','Yeti: Curse of the Snow Demon',53245,2.2619,4.9,'TT5TBJpFHec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22042,_binary '\0','/z6ueaizIb3vH3l1l4xSr2bET2Am.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896798',6.1,50199,'en','Cleaner','Single father and former cop Tom Cutler has an unusual occupation: he cleans up death scenes. But when he\'s called in to sterilize a wealthy suburban residence after a brutal shooting, Cutler is shocked to learn he may have unknowingly erased crucial evidence, entangling himself in a dirty criminal cover-up.','/8KhDbFg9STRlvrOLvaQ7PjOo7XT.jpg','2007-09-11',88,'Released','Solving a crime can be dirty work','Cleaner',13252,7.8196,6.098,'fdF699_b2wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22043,_binary '\0','/1gelbdolq0BtkXdBer8F3MqENy9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896816',2.6,1889,'en','Grizzly Rage','After accidentally killing a bear cub while celebrating graduation in the woods, four teens become the target of a seemingly unstoppable Grizzly.','/cILatTixNGrWtqh7odw8Kn8coYn.jpg','2007-06-07',86,'Released','Ripped apart at the screams!','Grizzly Rage',30641,1.9386,4,'Ipqdmi39Jio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22044,_binary '\0','/fnxnea3loMg5pIV0poyuaXfGzgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896866',7.4,4223,'en','Standard Operating Procedure','Investigating the infamous Abu Ghraib scandal, Errol Morris interviews American guards and Iraqi prisoners who were at the military jail before images of prisoner torture emerged in 2004. One female guard, who posed alongside fallen Iraqis in notorious images, tells Morris that her crimes were inspired by her love for another soldier, and another explains why she took photographs of her fellow troops. In the process, Morris suggests that the scandal resulted from systemic flaws in the military.','/v2QCXsisMLYsozC2qJtYGa3Rvsi.jpg','2008-02-12',117,'Released',NULL,'Standard Operating Procedure',8847,1.8922,6.8,'InXqFEK6I00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22045,_binary '\0','/iLVaVS2L7KgHxpY5UOHrUBJS17O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896872',7.1,37429,'en','The Whistleblower','Nebraska cop Kathryn Bolkovac discovers a deadly sex trafficking ring while serving as a U.N. peacekeeper in post-war Bosnia. Risking her own life to save the lives of others, she uncovers an international conspiracy that is determined to stop her, no matter the cost.','/iIVcea2BHHi7RJgucGEmpt3zkED.jpg','2010-09-13',112,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than the truth.','The Whistleblower',65760,5.2008,6.7,'E56OYUV7BWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22046,_binary '\0','/wAysW57aZpCBlZ6n9KSvhEERdOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896923',6.3,3434,'en','The City of Your Final Destination','28-year-old Kansas University doctoral student Omar Razaghi wins a grant to write a biography of Latin American writer Jules Gund. Omar must get through to three people who were close to Gund – his brother, widow, and younger mistress – so he can get authorization to write the biography.','/cZnLXkvocKkB2FVBNycouH5AopG.jpg','2009-03-21',114,'Released',NULL,'The City of Your Final Destination',42819,3.2619,5.7,'QIhFvZ-XUro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22047,_binary '\0','/tYB710df8h0E6cm2xHLlfno0V8s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0896927',6,3551,'es','Eskalofrío','Santi, a young high-school student with a serious physical reaction to sunlight, is forced by his health to move with his single mother to a shadowy, isolated village in the mountains of Spain where the inhabitants begin to reveal themselves as strangely xenophobic. When terrible, violent events begin to occur, Santi becomes first a pariah at school and then strongly suspected by the police of hideous murders. Santi himself, however, wonders if he is not the next victim.','/mDwh6cUbDMN0jIBmyHpmMag1g5a.jpg','2008-02-08',91,'Released',NULL,'Shiver',30713,2.3907,6.1,'ILvcptJMujs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22048,_binary '\0','/hPbxpNgmptuudgBQ0iaApiGH9kA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0897287',5.6,1245,'zh','天堂口','Three best friends who are barely getting by as fishermen seek their fate in 1930s Shanghai. Upon arriving in the bustling city, the naïve trio gradually find their innocence corrupted as they fall into the deepest depths of the criminal underworld.','/4AbR965SBXlyuaE7lxuxnrINJ77.jpg','2007-08-16',95,'Released','The days of innocence have passed. They must make their choices like men. But at what costs? Is blood really thicker than water?','Blood Brothers',45425,1.6661,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22049,_binary '\0','/nnLRfMFh4JiXyiEC6wBRiSHxbCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0897347',5.5,6346,'en','The Echo','An ex-prisoner moves to an old apartment, where one gets to see in the middle of a domestic problem between a police officer, his wife and his daughter. When he tries to intervene, he will be caught in a mysterious curse.','/r1yCRk3MgXIfGRR7fTNAw9VAJsH.jpg','2008-05-25',96,'Released',NULL,'The Echo',25329,2.6302,6.1,'Jc_Mdg8XGAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22050,_binary '\0','/oQ7TqsrASWnIK7C5jLEme9ONQdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0897361',3.6,29861,'en','I Know Who Killed Me','An idyllic small town is rocked when Aubrey Fleming, a bright and promising young woman, is abducted and tortured by a sadistic serial killer. When she manages to escape, the traumatized girl who regains consciousness in the hospital insists that she is not who they think she is and that the real Aubrey Fleming is still in mortal danger.','/m5AsIT2YPG12Z5YrBlcaElxhQ6m.jpg','2007-07-27',106,'Released','There are two sides to every crime.','I Know Who Killed Me',5857,5.1319,4.445,'KSZ98kUVQFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22051,_binary '\0','/ThUoGy27GL9n5Wb4Ks00RWSvnf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0897374',5.6,1737,'te','మున్నా','Munna (Prabhas) is a college student. His aim is to finish off mafia don Kakha (Prakash Raj) who keeps the entire city under his grip. Munna has personal vengeance to take on Kakha. An honest politician Srinivasa Rao (Kota Srinivasa Rao) relentlessly works to expose Kakha but gets killed. Meanwhile, Munna’s classmate Nidhi (Ileana D\'Cruz) falls in love with him. The twist in the tale is that Kakha is none other than his estranged father who tries to sell off his mother and was responsible for the death of his mother and his kid sister. Another don in the city named Aatma, who is the opposition of Kakha (Rahul Dev) asks Munna to join him. But Munna refuses his proposal. Munna starts to beat Kakha and the mind game begins. Kakha\'s second wife and son-daughter left him and join Munna. After some incidents including the death of his best friend, Munna finds out that Aatma was working for Kakha all along.','/jUR8iaz5mJDXJ1hVuzLlTHHljHb.jpg','2007-05-02',167,'Released',NULL,'Munna',199229,1.3142,4.865,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22052,_binary '\0','/6188iOmUAitGThYUjyx20fO4LJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0898367',7.2,273610,'en','The Road','A father and his son walk alone through burned America. Nothing moves in the ravaged landscape save the ash on the wind and water. It is cold enough to crack stones and, when the snow falls, it is gray. Their destination is the warmer south, although they don\'t know what, if anything, awaits them there.','/qLaXnLzqleBWQtjvZ6JGVSaKoC3.jpg','2009-11-25',111,'Released','In a moment, the world changed forever.','The Road',20766,11.2515,7.02,'P8PyedKdTIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22053,_binary '\0','/aD7FXrm2GErTmzrIFBntPyhAqS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899043',6.5,103117,'en','The Amateur','After his life is turned upside down when his wife is killed in a London terrorist attack, a brilliant but introverted CIA decoder takes matters into his own hands when his supervisors refuse to take action.','/SNEoUInCa5fAgwuEBMIMBGvkkh.jpg','2025-04-09',123,'Released','Don\'t underestimate him.','The Amateur',1087891,22.6634,6.925,'DCWcK4c-F8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22054,_binary '\0','/g4EeIAOwhsL7PVk934dWv6TRcJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899052',6.7,2291,'en','Capturing Mary','A young man ushers an older woman into a dark exploration of her past - back to the time when, as a young girl, she met a stranger who affected her life forever.','/3FmbUlNedw3b6KeXRRfSqwco31z.jpg','2007-11-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Capturing Mary',132426,1.8266,6.3,'irwm7ziY-6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22055,_binary '\0','/efBP1knbiG3zGM6apxsURKSNT0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899106',5.7,36125,'en','Love Happens','Dr. Burke Ryan is a successful self-help author and motivational speaker with a secret. While he helps thousands of people cope with tragedy and personal loss, he secretly is unable to overcome the death of his late wife. It\'s not until Burke meets a fiercely independent florist named Eloise that he is forced to face his past and overcome his demons.','/ijRJlhAZ7QMkTIVAUkIY8stWfk1.jpg','2009-09-18',109,'Released','Sometimes when you least expect it...','Love Happens',25643,5.5802,5.8,'XInj3WyRerI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22056,_binary '\0','/hxc8LayEJQj9CrN1LbgF5z3AsfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899109',6.8,1498,'en','Joe\'s Palace','A drama centered on the relationship between Elliot, a strange and wealthy Londoner, and Joe, a teenager who takes care of an empty house Elliot owns.','/rreuvn5HKOWIFAT8U8QGlElTwy6.jpg','2007-11-04',108,'Released',NULL,'Joe\'s Palace',43741,1.7058,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22057,_binary '\0','/jZu09TyQAiUaQRHa7L18eVBPzdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899128',5.4,13795,'en','100 Feet','After Marnie Watson kills her abusive husband in self-defense, she is condemned to house arrest... only to discover that the house is possessed by the enraged and violent spirit of her dead husband.','/ryocnetNNLWs0Oefkqkea6HccqV.jpg','2008-07-22',105,'Released','Her husband is dead and he\'s taking the news badly...','100 Feet',14098,4.0101,5.744,'KutBj9AZcl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22058,_binary '\0','/ytowTIMDyC1CuE3Q9elkh6n0Kw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0899138',6.2,2508,'en','An American Affair','In the early 1960s, teenager Adam Stafford (Cameron Bright) becomes obsessed with his new neighbor, Catherine Caswell (Gretchen Mol), a divorcée and free spirit. Stafford spies on Caswell as she meets with strange men, and, despite the warnings of his conservative parents, he begins working for her as a gardener. Amid rumors of her affair with President Kennedy, the two become close, but political intrigue surrounding her acquaintances soon infringes on their friendship.','/qvvxmZJich3ai0f8T65PAXPMeYi.jpg','2008-11-27',93,'Released','What can you do for your country?','An American Affair',20263,1.9942,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22059,_binary '\0','/tu0ci5qZNsozmMvGpLU3SX0Vyz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0900357',5,9387,'en','Boogeyman 2','A young woman attempts to cure her phobia of the boogeyman by checking herself into a mental health facility, only to realize too late that she is now helplessly trapped with her own greatest fear.','/zPtDUBYzbbTnTsLXIfoOHGg8Gux.jpg','2007-10-20',93,'Released','Fear. In The Flesh.','Boogeyman 2',14913,3.0561,5.5,'_dS0lxEUTus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22060,_binary '\0','/j82SfPOqas5rvHbAHAPq7OgaSir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0900387',7,30833,'en','Suite Française','France, 1940. In the first days of occupation, beautiful Lucile Angellier is trapped in a stifled existence with her controlling mother-in-law as they both await news of her husband: a prisoner of war. Parisian refugees start to pour into their small town, soon followed by a regiment of German soldiers who take up residence in the villagers\' own homes. Lucile initially tries to ignore Bruno von Falk, the handsome and refined German officer staying with them. But soon, a powerful love draws them together and leads them into the tragedy of war.','/mPgijY9f79FfD7K8MmzsynXpq0R.jpg','2015-03-12',103,'Released','Forced to host the enemy. Tormented by intruders. Tempted by desire.','Suite Française',271674,4.7812,7.238,'B-9B1gfvqLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22061,_binary '\0','/3Wr9M9Pee1kLgfbRSrG0LHy0GsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901475',6.9,5347,'ko','숨','A condemned prisoner slowly falls in love with the married female artist who decorates his prison cell. Jin is a convicted killer awaiting execution on Death Row; Yeon is a lonely artist locked in a loveless marriage.','/uDkDzSUluhC3ONk25VbaVaqe8kH.jpg','2007-04-26',84,'Released','Love Can Take Your Breath Away.','Breath',25647,2.5928,6.7,'9LtyR4kyhAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22062,_binary '\0','/bDYeMDIKeetY6J3ZM6POwnf1xc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901476',5.5,125293,'en','Bride Wars','Two best friends become rivals when their respective weddings are accidentally booked for the same day.','/eyXT8tmUoyHrg7YX1UVjmecHCWP.jpg','2009-01-09',89,'Released','Even best friends can\'t share the same wedding day.','Bride Wars',10521,12.3656,6.247,'KBDE4uznmIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22063,_binary '\0','/4syTf7B40I3xKXySMdDBi0nnHi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901481',5.9,3804,'en','Eichmann','Based upon the final confession of Adolf Eichmann, made before his execution in Israel, of his role in Hitler\'s plan for the final solution.','/zoxl3RaZiCBmZIk3fmmw61rOV69.jpg','2007-09-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Eichmann',14687,2.3235,6,'F3YuFQ1ZQA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22064,_binary '\0','/dFHJB93XClheLwdUMCWqdmu1YL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901485',6.2,3929,'fr','La Fille coupée en deux','A TV weather girl is torn between an older man, a famous married author whom she loves but who won\'t leave his wife, and a semi-deranged young heir to an industrial fortune who loves her.','/z4WMZsWINlXbZmGZDgAoVa8Cd69.jpg','2007-08-08',115,'Released','One man\'s love is another man\'s lust.','A Girl Cut in Two',5592,3.0474,5.9,'pj5PaLxpwgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22065,_binary '\0','/gec3e76TRGUBx1Ut0c6yuSahVDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901487',7.2,40018,'ko','좋은 놈, 나쁜 놈, 이상한 놈','The story of three Korean outlaws in 1930s Manchuria and their dealings with the Japanese army and Chinese and Russian bandits. The Good (a bounty hunter), the Bad (a hitman), and the Weird (a thief) battle the army and the bandits in a race to use a treasure map to uncover the riches of legend.','/lbPZ0aNoF0cHisg6DubFO2eS8so.jpg','2008-07-16',130,'Released','One map. Three villains. Winner takes all.','The Good, the Bad, the Weird',15067,4.93,7.157,'6Tk80iXCspM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22066,_binary '\0','/y4yIR8E6nSadaExxZL0KeEJiUdz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901488',6.7,2221,'cn','跟蹤','The head of an elite Hong Kong surveillance unit keeps one eye on his rookie apprentice and the other on a notorious criminal he suspects of masterminding a recent jewel heist in this tense thriller from filmmaking duo Johnnie To and Nai-Hoi Yau. Of course, the criminal knows all along he\'s being watched. But that doesn\'t stop him from trying to pull off the biggest score of his career.','/dY5A36rodvUBp4NkMrlH6HiDJrF.jpg','2007-06-21',90,'Released','I am invisible. I am inaudible. The enemy\'s fate is in my hands.','Eye in the Sky',37984,2.0253,6.7,'zQy_zqlaLDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22067,_binary '\0','/u44wc4bo3tGziVbPtZDFx9YOkIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901494',6.1,1952,'en','Life Is Hot in Cracktown','Various stories of how crack cocaine has infiltrated the inner-city streets. Based on Buddy Giovinazzo\'s novel \"Life is Hot in Cracktown\".','/zppNLGxL0ttNhcd36wBXb4JQbYA.jpg','2009-06-26',99,'Released','Be cool. You\'re so cool. Life is cool in Cracktown.','Life Is Hot in Cracktown',21372,2.1476,5.9,'4iDjswFhicw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22068,_binary '\0','/ofH4XAARGBndUSaVNPAcPYpIw1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901504',4.4,2526,'en','Psych:9','A young woman with a troubled past takes a job at recently closed down hospital. Working the night shift alone she begins to experience a series of unsettling events that lead her to believe that the hospital may be connected to a number of recent murders in the area. To uncover the truth she will have to revisit the past behind the walls of Psych:9.','/nGxy7Jd7VCSwpjMXJ7ZwWJuFGnC.jpg','2010-05-07',98,'Released','It\'s time to confront your demons.','Psych:9',55045,1.5053,4.7,'UiIMn80_Sg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22069,_binary '\0','/omalLKaiwcLE1H9K22T6rLXmxtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0901507',6.7,23222,'en','Rise of the Footsoldier','Carlton Leach rises from one of the most feared generals of the football terraces to becoming a member of a notorious gang of criminals who rampaged their way through London and Essex in the late \'80s and early \'90s.','/k8lbsM0Nl0c1Qp7NnARWjS6TTRA.jpg','2007-09-07',119,'Released','Based on the shocking true story.','Rise of the Footsoldier',13054,4.2442,6.3,'SF81Myp0-Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22070,_binary '\0','/atlEDufyaGEQcOjwOwzvsfX8AWW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0902254',6.6,1289,'it','Anplagghed al Cinema','A queue at the ATM machine, a displaced family after a seismic shock that has half-washed their home, a tour within an art gallery, moments of everyday life that become the cues for the emergence of comic, farce, paradoxical situations – trademarks of one of the most successful Italian comic groups.','/fJEAiAfCgItEMedF1I4HQpStaxn.jpg','2006-11-26',95,'Released',NULL,'Anplagghed al Cinema',50472,0.8933,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22071,_binary '\0','/9lPCj5JIgw5UJhtMOJ3L09vmS0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0902290',6,11613,'en','I Sell the Dead','18th century justice catches up with a pair of grave robbers. With only a few hours to go before his date with the guillotine, Arthur Blake tells his life story to Father Francis Duffy. Before long, Arthur spills the beans on how he got started in the grim corpse peddling business with seasoned ghoul Willie Grimes.','/1KjIGzUho6NCE7dDJP1QyRnMRRK.jpg','2008-08-07',85,'Released','Never trust a corpse.','I Sell the Dead',21910,3.0352,5.9,'sIQ-xcI1zKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22072,_binary '\0','/gC6fm9GtGFchDJkegDyD4wDOwfp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0902952',5.5,2601,'en','Acolytes','Three teens blackmail a serial killer into helping them get rid of a violent bully.','/7N6F986uq85UC1MROaWaZ2gQZ2O.jpg','2009-03-25',91,'Released','Nothing stays buried forever.','Acolytes',18557,1.9633,5,'Z98_ANutn2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22073,_binary '\0','/htWRtXe7ezdCYTHSNuE3HBna8N3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0902955',7,17377,'tr','Barda','A group of drug-influenced lumpen teenagers from the suburbs of the city descends into the center where they do not belong, where they are excluded. They adopted a brutal method to seize rights that were not granted to them. Unaware of what will happen to them, cheerful and well-to-do university students are helpless in the face of this gun-wielding mob that suddenly raids the bar where they are having fun.','/4Fd5wFCqiWMCdCG2nhGsKkrsD5N.jpg','2007-02-02',95,'Released',NULL,'At the Bar',27721,1.3409,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22074,_binary '\0','/9NGWEU7qIOOlziz6MmoTtyJkhuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0902967',7.3,1537,'en','The Crimson Wing: Mystery of the Flamingos','In the remote and forgotten wilderness of Lake Natron, in northern Tanzania, one of nature\'s last great mysteries unfolds: the birth, life and death of a million crimson-winged flamingos.','/zq3vC7rimcP74BwofNJCjyNce8L.jpg','2008-12-17',78,'Released','One lake, a million birds, an incredible story!','The Crimson Wing: Mystery of the Flamingos',36569,2.719,7.3,'a8tKgBHFSVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22075,_binary '\0','/g7JHjZ0xWjXyrkqzA4UcFZS1ePo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903021',6.6,1286,'tr','Sis ve Gece','Fog and the Night is the search of an investigator who has lost his confidence in his organization and whose happy \"family father\" order has been disrupted by his young lover.And introverted man due to his profession, not a big talker or well in expressing his feelings, Sedat is being consumed, going through the hardest time of his life, not able to silence his guilty conscience because he was unsuccessful in solving the murder of his partner, whom he saw as a brother. His faith in his organization is shaken as he witnesses the schemes in machination inside the organization and between the organization and the state. Meanwhile, while trying to find his lover who has disappeared after falling for a former militant, he does not refrain from making use of the filthiest methods of his profession.','/rCQQM0hXAWSuoTPg5wj1RiFtf9A.jpg','2007-02-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Fog and Night',37999,1.2945,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22076,_binary '\0','/9z9iIhvOzzg23rMwYSdE6hSMFIc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903606',2.6,1981,'en','Hooking Up','After \"hooking up\" with a series of guys at a house party, April is the talk of her high school.','/uWLoODORHZMjHvy8HW7HsUw3B74.jpg','2009-03-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Hooking Up',20983,1.8258,3.1,'7YX-h_yZ2Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22077,_binary '\0','/xyXmtuvsoM5J3yNad0nvcetpBdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903624',7.8,937301,'en','The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey','Bilbo Baggins, a hobbit enjoying his quiet life, is swept into an epic quest by Gandalf the Grey and thirteen dwarves who seek to reclaim their mountain home from Smaug, the dragon.','/yHA9Fc37VmpUA5UncTxxo3rTGVA.jpg','2012-12-12',169,'Released','From the smallest beginnings come the greatest legends.','The Hobbit: An Unexpected Journey',49051,29.1528,7.382,'9PSXjr1gbjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22078,_binary '\0','/dV5PCRW7Cytf0CdMdWjD6jwouMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903627',7,7243,'en','Julia','An alcoholic becomes involved in a fellow A.A. member\'s plan to kidnap her young son from the boy\'s wealthy grandfather.','/AxVVUjSpzv2wjyuuMvPZj5UXL3.jpg','2008-03-12',144,'Released',NULL,'Julia',7351,2.2882,6.7,'VDDWeWknMl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22079,_binary '\0','/l19ruhwCLotkG5wTcelrqVvmPX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903657',7.4,46105,'en','Love & Mercy','In the late 1960s, the Beach Boys\' Brian Wilson stops touring, produces \"Pet Sounds\" and begins to lose his grip on reality. By the 1980s, under the sway of a controlling therapist, he finds a savior in Melinda Ledbetter.','/4jn0hDsl6lsv4qEc7aiLlgbaIjo.jpg','2015-05-29',120,'Released','The Life, Love and Genius of Brian Wilson','Love & Mercy',271714,5.3839,7.1,'Xne-_S34T1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22080,_binary '\0','/vXbbYeSTsReXP0p5RJnlUikoaHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0903849',6.1,2917,'en','Heckler','HECKLER is a comedic feature documentary exploring the increasingly critical world we live in. After starring in a film that was critically bashed, Jamie Kennedy takes on hecklers and critics and ask some interesting questions of people such as George Lucas, Bill Maher, Mike Ditka, Rob Zombie, Howie Mandel and many more. This fast moving, hilarious documentary pulls no punches as you see an uncensored look at just how nasty and mean the fight is between those in the spotlight and those in the dark.','/wDcnCvPTBqAhMqyfpxVtA2WZwd8.jpg','2007-11-04',80,'Released','Everyone\'s a critic.','Heckler',13611,1.7611,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22081,_binary '\0','/cqD0SYxePs5oQOqDcM1HQRhB9iB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0904049',6.3,3757,'ja','エクステ','An aspiring hairdresser becomes the infatuation of a tricophilic man who sells hair extensions to nearby salons. The source is the corpse of a girl whose corpse continues to grow beautiful, voluminous, black hair that comes alive, either driving the extension user insane or killing them.','/hhfjXQxMoZkknfO0TVQGZrGzIk5.jpg','2007-02-17',108,'Released','Wear them, and they will come after you…','Exte: Hair Extensions',21784,1.8286,5.9,'_ucDY4hfvms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22082,_binary '\0','/fdB09CFOYNsBH587QuBULia3ci2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0905329',6.5,5234,'en','El Greco','The story of the uncompromising artist and fighter for freedom, Domenicos Theotokopoulos, known to the world as \"El Greco\".','/aBxPj6oB0XdjUo5HcAd60xZruH1.jpg','2007-10-11',119,'Released','Can Darkness Win Light?','El Greco',29272,1.1646,6,'tqB4IBj6dGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22083,_binary '\0','/ocg8wp2bZJlW3yWJEYB51k1vNns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0905345',7.1,5747,'en','Jesse Stone: Sea Change','Police Chief Jesse Stone\'s relationship with his ex-wife worsens, and he fears he\'s relapsing into alcoholism. To get his mind off his problems, Jesse begins working on the unsolved murder of a bank teller shot during a robbery. Also, his investigation of an alleged rape draws him into conflict with the town council — which hopes to preserve Paradise\'s reputation as an ideal seaside resort.','/cjJVPwyTwR89APErU7SE0LmBaPl.jpg','2007-05-22',88,'Released',NULL,'Jesse Stone: Sea Change',26114,3.1384,7,'fK2TK6JqGQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22084,_binary '\0','/qv8zxzAzvbpwqyewnsoP4VN99YD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0905357',5.6,1645,'en','Normal','A deadly car accident brings together a group of previously unrelated people, each of whom is forced to deal with the emotional fallout.','/i833frx7UyaJCW8y0RK5wj4xBzn.jpg','2007-09-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Normal',38051,3.2776,5.2,'OKmyIxrp1sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22085,_binary '\0','/qgSlGJurPzgSHKYlqBiDmr3vjrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0905372',6.3,155852,'en','The Thing','When paleontologist Kate Lloyd travels to an isolated outpost in Antarctica for the expedition of a lifetime, she joins an international team that unearths a remarkable discovery. Their elation quickly turns to fear as they realize that their experiment has freed a mysterious being from its frozen prison. Paranoia spreads like an epidemic as a creature that can mimic anything it touches will pit human against human as it tries to survive and flourish in this spine-tingling thriller.','/dmn2nVo8h7LMnk694JxCRIwK06p.jpg','2011-10-12',103,'Released','It\'s not human. Yet.','The Thing',60935,11.6292,6.3,'JIdw2B6zipc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22086,_binary '\0','/h0WQobrkYMkUxtHamuOk5un3Ygy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0905979',7.3,1495,'en','Chicago 10','Archival footage, animation and music are used to look back at the eight anti-war protesters who were put on trial following the 1968 Democratic National Convention.','/5Do5BUtU3VNMJ5eKi3RXgortMLO.jpg','2008-02-29',110,'Released','The convention was drama. The trial was comedy.','Chicago 10',28816,1.7932,5.8,'M9uJL7lWdFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22087,_binary '\0','/zAhOAlbQF5ABYkfQCNNMDCDaitO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906083',6.4,1968,'sr','Свети Георгије убива аждаху','Love triangle story between the village gendarme Đorđe, his wife Katarina and the young disabled war veteran Gavrilo during the time between First Balkan War and World War I.','/yyWTQSxnEOxfFlDRl6o8KVunI96.jpg','2009-03-11',120,'Released',NULL,'St. George Shoots the Dragon',47435,1.1617,5.7,'JUCBrL3DfTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22088,_binary '\0','/eM8qR3lOb48oz3SHX6E69npM37a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906108',6,15191,'en','Why Did I Get Married?','Eight married college friends plus one other non-friend (all of whom have achieved middle to upper class economic status) go to Colorado for their annual week-long reunion, but the mood shifts when one couple\'s infidelity comes to light. As secrets are revealed, each couple begins to question their own relationship.','/9kmqgVuELTEoMt0dqRt3H48VcOM.jpg','2007-10-12',113,'Released','Because we complete each other\'s sentences.','Why Did I Get Married?',17202,6.2694,6.6,'H0IgfAs3tWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22089,_binary '\0','/5r81GxuDpYshz2fFfkoigsr2z7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906326',6,2531,'en','Just Buried','A young man inherits a nearly bankrupt funeral home from his estranged father. He falls in love with the alluring young mortician, only to find out she\'s offing people to keep the place in business!','/1gLnBaOGMaTVP7EumjWs9IBqeV7.jpg','2007-09-09',94,'Released','A (very) dark comedy about sex, greed and death.','Just Buried',15182,1.9264,5.9,'aYa2ZcMTCsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22090,_binary '\0','/qjiiIuv1SkMPFbskL0FbZyd3dUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906665',6.1,16384,'ja','Sukiyaki Western Django','A nameless gunfighter arrives in a town ripped apart by rival gangs and, though courted by both to join, chooses his own path.','/tnB7lpBknu510z9ATWbfpamPKZa.jpg','2007-09-15',121,'Released',NULL,'Sukiyaki Western Django',13637,3.8373,6.2,'5BjjQQKIbjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22091,_binary '\0','/5nXkgjQ1TqhqSWut8TNoIGogId9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906734',5.4,11719,'en','The Broken','The life of a successful radiologist spirals out of control when she sees the spitting image of herself driving down a London street. While attempting to uncover who the imposter could be, she stumbles into a terrifying mystery that her family and closest friends are somehow involved in, leaving her with no one to trust.','/3cHCv6SE9UmBrfkczRmT4JHBQCq.jpg','2008-11-15',93,'Released','Face your fear.','The Broken',3511,3.0754,5.4,'Q0nKZd9UxuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22092,_binary '\0','/v6LfAhJSYOHkKRpYDSOPLU6mCso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906777',5.9,1233,'es','La señal','During the last days of Eva Peron, a pair of low-ranking detectives are thrust into a case of corruption involving the Mafia.','/x7JFpxMSJHaKf9KmzU1iFYcAjda.jpg','2007-09-13',95,'Released',NULL,'The Signal',127702,1.0207,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22093,_binary '\0','/4b2CmNqYj1M3ZNkgjqYAN5ZMDwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0906778',6.2,2423,'nl','Black Butterflies','Confronted by Apartheid and a father who was Minister of Censorship, Ingrid Jonker searched for a home, searched for love. With men like Jack Cope and André Brink she found much love, but no home. Later, in his first speech to the South African Parliament Nelson Mandela read her poem \"The Dead Child of Nyanga\" and addressed her as one of the finest poets of South Africa.','/kLOeBrmJ4MCZnuf6Wy16YraEAPs.jpg','2011-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Black Butterflies',72049,1.9546,5.6,'J0uCLdt-Ci4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22094,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907106',7.3,1973,'te','ఆది','Aadi, who is raised by his father\'s faithful employee, learns about how his parents were cheated and killed by Nagi Reddy. Enraged by the injustice done to his family, he decides to confront Nagi.','/op0EYFNDWM3ab6TaGC3e1XxH9Ca.jpg','2002-03-28',156,'Released','The Power of Emotion','Aadi',80395,1.1464,5.536,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22095,_binary '\0','/4QpdiCI1UzEeaVWrtKbOUX88KRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907134',7.5,4749,'pt','Saneamento Básico, O Filme','When they discover their town lacks funding for a sewage system, but does have a federal grant to make a movie, a group of villagers decide to make a sci-fi joint about a monster who lives in the building site of a septic tank.','/oIiIV61Q2x7vE62sE1TyNGxraT2.jpg','2007-07-20',112,'Released','If it is to be done, it’s better to do it well','Basic Sanitation, the Movie',64397,1.7675,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22096,_binary '\0','/ngqv6LUealQ4q4KQ2WksprxX60h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907618',7.6,1713,'te','ఆడవారి మాటాలకు అర్ధాలు వేరులే','Ganesh, an unemployed man, lands up in a company where Keerthi, the girl he loves, works but who is already engaged to someone else. Sudden incidents ruin his life and he again comes across her, but refuses to marry her.','/5ODOTnYdBPucewTglpjR3AvnxzG.jpg','2007-04-27',163,'Released',NULL,'Aadavari Matalaku Ardhalu Verule',80826,0.8191,7.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22097,_binary '\0','/vQANZjRSgEKrJaaT5KnTWe6I70U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907619',6.5,2319,'te','అర్జున్','A young man risks his life to guarantee his twin sister\'s happiness and protect her from murderous in-laws.','/q2teoYFPNUgQnClFoPRBOo0luio.jpg','2004-08-18',166,'Released',NULL,'Arjun',80856,1.4031,5.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22098,_binary '\0','/p1XSyBriqz7oBWoVcRqYlB6Kve3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907657',7.8,126545,'en','Once','A vacuum repairman moonlights as a street musician and hopes for his big break. One day a Czech immigrant, who earns a living selling flowers, approaches him with the news that she is also an aspiring singer-songwriter. The pair decide to collaborate, and the songs that they compose reflect the story of their blossoming love.','/7nW363kSYRCkr4VGOMvuSGwtzKs.jpg','2007-03-23',85,'Released','How often do you find the right person?','Once',5723,4.1453,7.4,'iBYTsu3L6r4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22099,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907674',7.5,2360,'hi','अमल','Autorickshaw driver Amal is content with the small, but vital, role he serves - driving customers around New Delhi as quickly and safely as possible. But his sense of duty is tested by an eccentric, aging billionaire, who, moved by Amal\'s humility, bequeaths him his entire estate before passing away. With only one month to discover and claim the inheritance, Amal\'s struggles with duty and wealth are threatened by all those around him - from a young injured beggar girl and a lovely store merchant, to the danger of the old man\'s upper-caste friends and siblings, all seeking to claim their share of the riches.','/9VlgLuSE7QRote3WnAtCF4Sb7vQ.jpg','2007-09-13',101,'Released',NULL,'Amal',25803,0.8817,7.6,'WYfVg_RZiYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22100,_binary '\0','/9av38IfHu7DOhrEXvRkcwiWT20G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907680',5.6,2628,'en','Walk All Over Me','Alberta, a mousy young woman with the survival skills of a snail, loses cash that isn\'t hers, so she runs from her small town to Seattle where her old babysitter, Celene, lives - a dominatrix with a classy apartment and a life plan. She lets Alberta stay. Alberta gets a job as a checker at a supermarket and becomes fascinated with Celene\'s work.','/7uaidDfupjHRmAKsEFPTjPxJtAq.jpg','2007-09-11',98,'Released','«Love. Larceny. Latex»','Walk All Over Me',13412,3.1862,5.5,'Oof5FSxmv34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22101,_binary '\0','/kVYLMd4YkA89oCLIioMrJbzHNZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907681',3,1455,'en','Wicked Lake','Two clans of deranged males make the mistake of stalking four young women they assume to be easy prey, only to find out that at the stroke of midnight the tables will be turned and all hell will break loose.','/smM6OKykgl5xctEloc6VfBohRen.jpg','2008-04-26',95,'Released','Life\'s a witch and then you die.','Wicked Lake',25579,1.5204,3.1,'dNDZzBeWdDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22102,_binary '\0','/r0KnVIAPy4htZHGqrtLdQALknWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0907848',6.4,3474,'en','Dakota Skye','For as long as she could remember, Dakota Skye has been cursed with a super power. She has the ability to see the truth in any lie she hears. From small, harmless white lies, to the more devious kind, they have come from the people that she should trust the most; her family, friends and teachers. These lies have snowballed, leading to her becoming bitter and apathetic towards the world around her.','/sNenZySmzku77zfYCJDGaJCEFgV.jpg','2008-03-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Dakota Skye',20513,1.8939,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22103,_binary '\0','/xi94K8trq1GTkusLaZC9lhcHYwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0909010',6.2,1650,'en','The Bad Mother\'s Handbook','Karen Cooper wants to domineer her family and believes she\'s its pillar. In fact she does everything wrong. Thus she messes up all their lives and futures, rather then help her loved-ones.','/4oWpuGqm2pVVw4enBHHF3ehw7v2.jpg','2007-02-19',71,'Released',NULL,'The Bad Mother\'s Handbook',50364,2.0108,7,'pGoD5GQDZyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22104,_binary '\0','/oCJ5FCKdXMDV8dDrrXM2YPT9Pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0909388',6.2,2187,'fi','Ganes','Remu grew up in modest conditions. He dropped out from schoold during his teen age years and is making career as a small time criminal. His family\'s destiny is about to come true, and it\'s going to be the usual: jail, alcoholism and violent death. After learning about rock music Remu learns to play drums and pushes himself into different bands. His first time in jails interrupts his music career, but after being released he starts his own band; Hurriganes.','/vEHLop4MdZie11G5hAx8pBNwge.jpg','2007-09-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Ganes',20158,1.5626,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22105,_binary '\0','/hw3XpVWJ0XJlnevjpDHIHO2bY7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910554',6.9,38992,'en','Frequently Asked Questions About Time Travel','Follows three social outcasts -- two geeks and a cynic -- as they attempt to navigate a time-travel conundrum in the middle of a British pub.','/r67KzlHkdiwe3fBWzImEkNOg1Y.jpg','2009-04-24',83,'Released','Three guys. One pub. Too much time on their hands.','Frequently Asked Questions About Time Travel',22494,3.6812,6.9,'WBV340x3GcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22106,_binary '\0','/9uS6bx6GWZKKeIeWnFYAsNHa76q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910559',7.6,6364,'de','Kirschblüten - Hanami','After finding out that her husband, Rudi, has a fatal illness, Trudi Angermeier arranges a trip to Berlin so they can see their children. Of course, the kids don\'t know the real reason they\'re visiting -- and the catch is, neither does Rudi...','/xiBgWmeYFVjo4tHaZYvN7k36dWH.jpg','2008-03-05',127,'Released',NULL,'Cherry Blossoms',6461,1.3633,7.3,'GrgC9VfD8tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22107,_binary '\0','/fgdoGvjfhyMY8rkfD71HSGr4IkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910847',6.8,3377,'en','Breakfast with Scot','The lives of Eric, an ex hockey player, and his partner Sam, are thrown into turmoil when they are forced to take in Scot, a flamboyant 11-year-old.','/4Awq2OLMA56LNvs7wMhOdkpyqiy.jpg','2007-11-16',95,'Released','He\'s staying for dinner, too!','Breakfast with Scot',16240,2.0437,6.1,'KDO6ImFasS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22108,_binary '\0','/9M2iAt1RczwXHR6n6Fhzlw20nYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910860',6.3,1851,'hu','Delta','A man comes home to meet his mother and sister after many years away. He finds his mother living with a new boyfriend, and his sister to be grown-up. He begins to settle down in this new place by building a new home for himself on the delta. But when his sister moves in with him and the two begin a romance, there are tragic consequences.','/qXfD0rh8kec7FTsPuf9L6iYGlJN.jpg','2008-09-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Delta',8896,1.1875,5.3,'nL3rcKLmfbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22109,_binary '\0','/39pBk3APJjE1AQuUNgk90d01F5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910885',5.2,9032,'en','A Merry Friggin\' Christmas','Boyd Mitchler and his family must spend Christmas with his estranged family of misfits. Upon realizing that he left all his son\'s gifts at home, he hits the road with his dad in an attempt to make the 8-hour round trip before sunrise.','/yiBwooPaWWPI0Q3B8XqvY6AJn3L.jpg','2014-11-07',82,'Released','Spend it with the ones you loathe','A Merry Friggin\' Christmas',286532,5.5867,5.4,'TGkBu_qALpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22110,_binary '\0','/bS5JamW3vbZsP2E5H3NiqjyHFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910905',6.1,21144,'en','In the Electric Mist','Lt. Dave Robicheaux, a detective in New Iberia, Louisiana, is trying to link the murder of a local hooker to New Orleans mobster Julie \'Baby Feet\' Balboni, who is co-producer of a Civil War film. When the star of the film, Elrod Sykes, reports finding another corpse in the Atchafalaya Swamp near the movie set, Robicheaux starts another investigation, believing the corpse to be the remains of a black man whose murder he witnessed 35 years earlier.','/gsyUJovik2t5vzPyXL5tq5VWLym.jpg','2009-04-15',117,'Released','NO ONE CAN ESCAPE THE SINS OF THE PAST','In the Electric Mist',13975,5.8747,6.059,'I5NPIpRRhPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22111,_binary '\0','/aO6Z7ErkEoahGFKYdEs4k4ilWFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910936',6.9,375474,'en','Pineapple Express','A stoner and his dealer are forced to go on the run from the police after the pothead witnesses a cop commit a murder.','/6E50WjeOYjDZg9HXgPjYdGtY2jG.jpg','2008-08-06',112,'Released','Put this in your pipe and smoke it.','Pineapple Express',10189,10.3336,6.639,'2T2o2WPNMXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22112,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910955',7.5,1487,'bs','Teško je biti fin','Story about a forty-something Sarajevo taxi driver named Fudo (Saša Petrović) who decides to take control of his own destiny. Fudo doesn\'t earn much, so he supplements his income by offering tips to the local criminal syndicate and turning a blind eye to their nefarious dealings. One day, after offering a particularly bad bit of advice to a violent gangster, Fudo is badly beaten. When Fudo\'s wife Azra (Daria Lorenci) discovers what has happened, she decides to take the couple\'s infant son and move out. Now determined to win his wife back and restore peace in the home, Fudo decides to go straight. But cleaning up his act isn\'t going to be easy, because after borrowing enough cash from black market dealer Sejo (Emir Hadžihafizbegović) to purchase a van and then refusing to aid him in any underhanded dealings, the only person willing to cut him any slack is the sympathetic Azra.','/yvdh970QHnS8Irx8qqo7qbTtYIx.jpg','2007-10-17',86,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Hard to Be Nice',86999,1.5455,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22113,_binary '\0','/nYs4ZwnJBK4AgljhvzwNz7fpr3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0910970',8.4,1341693,'en','WALL·E','After hundreds of years doing what he was built for, WALL•E— a robot designed to clean up the earth—discovers a new purpose in life when he meets a sleek search robot named EVE. EVE comes to realize that WALL•E has inadvertently stumbled upon the key to the planet\'s future, and races back to space to report to the humans. Meanwhile, WALL•E chases EVE across the galaxy and sets into motion one of the most imaginative adventures ever brought to the big screen.','/hbhFnRzzg6ZDmm8YAmxBnQpQIPh.jpg','2008-06-26',98,'Released','After 700 years of doing what he was built for, he\'ll discover what he was meant for.','WALL·E',10681,38.4298,8.125,'geplBr2fcZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22114,_binary '\0','/rwZ97vnPTI0R3hYcjBa7nQrYFKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0911010',8.2,2593,'en','White Light/Black Rain: The Destruction of Hiroshima and Nagasaki','Steven Okazaki presents a deeply moving look at the painful legacy of the first -- and hopefully last -- uses of nuclear weapons in war. Featuring interviews with fourteen atomic bomb survivors - many who have never spoken publicly before - and four Americans intimately involved in the bombings, White Light/Black Rain provides a detailed exploration of the bombings and their aftermath.','/43YQd9JMZvgjEtIBuC27EsAYyKP.jpg','2007-08-06',86,'Released',NULL,'White Light/Black Rain: The Destruction of Hiroshima and Nagasaki',33588,1.4492,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22115,_binary '\0','/603WeGxKN1U2qlZEwapAZZEymHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912580',7.7,1652,'en','The Devil Came on Horseback','While serving with the African Union, former Marine Capt. Brian Steidle documents the brutal ethnic cleansing occuring in Darfur. Determined that the Western public should know about the atrocities he is witnessing, Steidle contacts New York Times reporter Nicholas Kristof, who publishes some of Steidle\'s photographic evidence.','/e9TKVFoAxeMWmL4ZYN4xowoTuaz.jpg','2007-01-19',85,'Released','A witness to evil. A force for peace. An unbelievable true story.','The Devil Came on Horseback',13023,1.2567,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22116,_binary '\0','/uJivsg5dT1XG5z79LKG5A6UYOYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912583',7.8,4575,'en','For the Bible Tells Me So','An exploration of the intersection between religion and homosexuality in the U.S. and how the religious right has used its interpretation of the Bible to stigmatize the gay community.','/sz7ucLIEpu1KPmrBW2eB5fyqv4E.jpg','2007-10-05',98,'Released',NULL,'For the Bible Tells Me So',15651,1.1759,6.9,'HpJAucyX7RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22117,_binary '\0','/4vNJEhPTiVuXGxik4kXxofEfwMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912585',7.6,1323,'en','Ghosts of Abu Ghraib','An examination of the prisoner abuse scandal involving U.S. soldiers and detainees at Iraq\'s Abu Ghraib prison in the fall of 2003.','/hj21BloUZcDg5Fp1lSuKJ1h2nYy.jpg','2007-01-19',78,'Released','Facing The Darkness Within','Ghosts of Abu Ghraib',36926,1.9172,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22118,_binary '\0','/tiNOKqWRnTVxp7F5348aoXTDN63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912590',7.2,1231,'en','Manda Bala (Send a Bullet)','Manda Bala (Send a Bullet) is a cinematic bullet into the cerebral cortex, a documentary that unflinchingly exploring the cycles of violence that plague Brazil\'s upper and lower economic classes in fits of rampant corruption and violent kidnappings. The film chronicles these cycles by utilizing highly personalized stories that reflect the growing truth about Brazil\'s huge economic disparities.','/tqOeWnvERdq0vNdB1beQK1Gom2J.jpg','2007-01-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Manda Bala (Send a Bullet)',18181,1.049,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22119,_binary '\0','/9E5VGsifBboMIX0lcfFmHq6VHQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912592',7.1,3597,'en','My Kid Could Paint That','A look at the work and surprising success of a four-year-old girl whose paintings have been compared to the likes of Picasso and has raked in hundreds of thousands of dollars.','/wJiYxHp3aqFbq3LOSLK8qM6EIp8.jpg','2007-10-05',82,'Released',NULL,'My Kid Could Paint That',14279,0.6569,7,'K5YH9zwleFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22120,_binary '\0','/xFZT3PycLvZMM5tOLam4eMQeCy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912593',8.2,8927,'en','No End in Sight','Chronological look at the fiasco in Iraq, especially decisions made in the spring of 2003 - and the backgrounds of those making decisions - immediately following the overthrow of Saddam: no occupation plan, an inadequate team to run the country, insufficient troops to keep order, and three edicts from the White House announced by Bremmer when he took over.','/vNLK1fRPHTHFfWfy63NJFDwX7MQ.jpg','2007-07-27',102,'Released','The American Occupation of Iraq. The Inside Story From the Ultimate Insiders.','No End in Sight',12901,1.971,7.7,'vINM0CAysc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22121,_binary '\0','/m4qM1XvABr1mVKWKohvHA7obLsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912597',6,9263,'ja','L: Change the World','\"The human whose name is written in the Death Note shall die.\" After making the hardest decision ever, another serious case confronts L. There are only 23 days left and without his best partner Watari, L has to solve the case all by himself for the very first time.','/aTV14kh4YVXafBZtyNjQ2GrWsNh.jpg','2008-02-07',128,'Released','The final death note showdown!','Death Note: L Change the WorLd',20329,5.0933,6,'TQ2-Y51wvl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22122,_binary '\0','/dOsFxHgM5dJiTeVMei2KSQMOYF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0912599',7.7,1233,'en','War Dance','Three children living in a displacement camp in northern Uganda compete in their country\'s national music and dance festival.','/mZxKlZSaL0VvBfmiZX3dv3BKVH5.jpg','2007-02-15',105,'Released','The war stole everything, except their music.','War Dance',16666,1.5305,7.2,'gZKbo8kJIso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22123,_binary '\0','/kq0zwccbh7WcdNxGcH67cMwhjBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913262',6.4,1222,'en','The Shadow in the North','Sally Lockhart crosses paths with the nefarious industrialist Axel Bellman, the richest and most powerful man in Europe. She\'s determined to prove him guilty of corruption and fraud, whilst Bellman will stop at nothing to destroy her case.','/ptDvV42gIkdKbYLtPrhOpUks9os.jpg','2007-09-15',94,'Released',NULL,'The Shadow in the North',46513,1.893,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22124,_binary '\0','/EOAv4NeWOxB5rfGmDJTofX3j3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913354',5.7,32859,'en','Armored','A crew of officers at an armored transport security firm risk their lives when they embark on the ultimate heist against their own company. Armed with a seemingly fool-proof plan, the men plan on making off with a fortune with harm to none. But when an unexpected witness interferes, the plan quickly unravels and all bets are off.','/oQrAXGkBy84FyGpWrY71ptqs7zD.jpg','2009-12-04',88,'Released','To protect and serve yourself.','Armored',4597,4.782,5.8,'5c2UWHeknkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22125,_binary '\0','/cltMRmx0SaGvMI51T92ZJjouOj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913401',5.7,4430,'no','Kill Buljo','Jompa Tormann and his guests and family are brutally gunned down during an engagement party. Sami- and women-hating police officer Sid Wisløff is put on the case. Together with his colleague and a Sami guide, Wisløff tries to find the guilty party, but Tormann survived and he wants revenge!','/lHne3zKSBk96UVhBs0q9Wm2N0GL.jpg','2007-03-23',93,'Released','In Kautokeino no one can hear you scream.','Kill Buljo',17285,1.1577,6,'o3Wxqm-08fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22126,_binary '\0','/zk8JWZmqLJeDhktNGrDs3eiFvSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913413',4.1,2390,'en','The Marc Pease Experience','Former high school musical star, Marc Pease, finds himself still living in the past, eight years after graduating.','/A6HMlmkZ9v71JZT2wTs59gDtmkz.jpg','2009-08-21',84,'Released','Hold your applause.','The Marc Pease Experience',25154,2.8125,4.4,'EH5sZezYhs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22127,_binary '\0','/shrpF5ZivObmV3hnCK8sSS0DP5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913425',7.2,44480,'es','Los abrazos rotos','Harry Caine, a blind writer, reaches this moment in time when he has to heal his wounds from 14 years back. He was then still known by his real name, Mateo Blanco, and directing his last movie.','/uPTOKnc9bzPp1emH3TyuKOGIylQ.jpg','2009-03-18',127,'Released','Passion, obsession, wealth, jealousy, family, guilt, and creativity.','Broken Embraces',8088,5.5539,7.2,'bN0SlBE8yGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22128,_binary '\0','/24n13gyUjKHZXR31XGmGFef9BQM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913445',6.2,19941,'en','Young People Fucking','On a Tuesday night, five couples have separate sexual adventures. Matt and Kris, friends for years, want to have an only-once, no-strings good time. Abby and Andrew, married, celebrate his birthday, but it\'s marred by angst and miscommunication. Mia and Eric are exes, making sure they are over each other. Jaime and Ken work together and this is a first date. Inez and Gord invite his roommate, Dave, to join them. By the time each couple has gone through a prelude, foreplay, sex, an interlude, orgasm, and afterglow, they\'ve answered basic questions: can sex be anonymous, are we bored, is our marriage really finished, does anyone tell the truth, and how do we make someone happy?','/g5LhutkdYsKyDePtqrRw7c3OTce.jpg','2007-09-05',90,'Released','Coming Together Has Never Been So Complicated.','Young People Fucking',13019,4.669,5.847,'2WnKLHpgaJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22129,_binary '\0','/qEjNT69I4xtibfHVHPvDQQKMT8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913446',4.2,1641,'ru','ЖАRА','Four good folks from schools got reunion in a summer café on the bank of River Moskva, and they had an unthinkable trouble to deal with check, though one of them is so rich. One by one, a friend left the table to find solution and everyone of them met with different stories. The rich one got caught, ended up in jail for a night with the help from other folks. Friendship never ends...','/jr3YgraBproRryWsMCRB0F7LgSi.jpg','2006-12-28',95,'Released',NULL,'The Heat',71381,1.7753,3.879,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22130,_binary '\0','/cUtujOgc5QxC3jHcM7uU3F1Oji2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0913968',7,28895,'zh','投名狀','The civil war in China has ruined many lives including General Pang\'s. A wounded General Pang is saved by a beautiful young woman along with two other men. Together they vow to eradicate the rebels.','/9sAWyaASakMW9f3LSXK8Br3RCED.jpg','2007-12-12',126,'Released',NULL,'The Warlords',14392,5.4916,6.774,'ejn1KNti35c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22131,_binary '\0','/wUd7pa3JJZfcwI2PAuKFlDCwoaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914382',6.3,1545,'en','Quiet City','Jamie is 21. She\'s from Atlanta. She\'s come to Brooklyn to visit her friend Samantha, but she can\'t find her. Jamie meets a stranger named Charlie on the subway and spends 24 hours hanging out with him.','/gWeR5wKhyyyPL5rUPazzsjhZVgY.jpg','2007-08-29',78,'Released',NULL,'Quiet City',46883,1.9879,5.8,'JgRzs5qzb_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22132,_binary '\0','/eiI7A6i0Ipnst2H9NIT5P3fSm3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914797',6.8,19415,'en','Bottle Shock','Paris-based wine expert Steven Spurrier heads to California in search of cheap wine that he can use for a blind taste test in the French capital. Stumbling upon the Napa Valley, the stuck-up Englishman is shocked to discover a winery turning out top-notch chardonnay. Determined to make a name for himself, he sets about getting the booze back to Paris.','/3Y6E1iHlfS588TASj3cfi2BoApm.jpg','2008-09-05',110,'Released','Based on a true story of love, victory, and fermentation','Bottle Shock',13996,3.6939,6.4,'5V-QsiPiN_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22133,_binary '\0','/6aRuABAdhuuDypLGscM7HoEWHx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914798',7.7,278220,'en','The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas','When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel\'s fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp\'s walls.','/2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg','2008-05-07',94,'Released','Lines may divide us, but hope will unite us.','The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas',14574,15.1417,7.818,'uwysOfnX2Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22134,_binary '\0','/7eurtLHEkwxspF0tJ4Yt70K3Oss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914799',5,1459,'en','Brain Dead','A sleepy fishing port town is consumed with terror when a small crater crash-lands nearby and releases a slimy parasitic agent that transforms the residents into brain-eating zombies. Cornered in an abandoned fishing lodge, six strangers are forced to band together to stave off the blood-sucking monsters clawing the walls outside.','/wqur2OKhF31Xirjb95NYvljx9Qm.jpg','2007-10-17',95,'Released','A Mind Is A Terrible Thing To Taste','Brain Dead',29833,1.6708,4.7,'oCA1yz_JdP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22135,_binary '\0','/1S0H4RgJCC6hAD2Rv3Yv6K5WgYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914813',3.5,1508,'en','Mega Snake','Duff Daniels (John T. Woods), the younger, stupider brother of Les (Michael Shanks), can\'t help himself from stealing a rare snake that\'s been kept in a jar by a Native American snake dealer (Ben Cardinal), and which has to follow some rules: don\'t let it out of the jar, then don\'t let it eat anything anything living, and never fear the heart of the snake.','/7ke1UaoEootRB5v01RqloxaSF4k.jpg','2007-07-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Mega Snake',57203,1.7449,2.8,'j3V_8ioieII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22136,_binary '\0','/bFugFL3mVUmOMHfOX0880WemjOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914837',5.8,7369,'en','44 Inch Chest','Colin is in agony, shattered by his wife’s infidelity, so his friends kidnap the wife\'s lover so he can have his revenge.','/vKuW2TzCyNstKcAGnWLXsFJxmjM.jpg','2009-10-08',95,'Released','The Measure Of Revenge','44 Inch Chest',29182,2.487,5.5,'B9oiZZMqoKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22137,_binary '\0','/p80dRTtTQE5U7FeDoJXanxFX2xO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0914863',7,101361,'en','Unthinkable','The government gets wind of a plot to destroy America involving a trio of nuclear weapons for which the whereabouts are unknown. It\'s up to a seasoned interrogator and an FBI agent to find out exactly where the nukes are.','/6yQqguytl10FhImngDHV90Aqewa.jpg','2010-05-26',97,'Released','Right and Wrong no longer exist','Unthinkable',38199,9.3646,6.818,'F_7b3kzWzg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22138,_binary '\0','/prpf1opT1lXIbH5L51ICvQNAqR3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0915457',6.8,1592,'de','Falco - Verdammt, wir leben noch!','Deals with the life, work, and tragic death of Johann \"Falco\" Hölzel. The biopic portrays his work through his early days, as member of the Viennese band \"Drahdiwaberl\", and later with his own hits as solo artist, like \"Der Kommissar\", \"Wiener Blut\", and his worldwide smash-hit \"Rock Me Amadeus\".','/aOOLXTUSLg0blT0IamsUwwQ1lak.jpg','2008-02-07',114,'Released',NULL,'Falco: Damn It, We\'re Still Alive!',42862,1.5204,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22139,_binary '\0','/t5w2oQLB9dKxulYuEuODg3sdG6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0915460',4,2647,'en','Grizzly Park','A giant grizzly bear stalks 8 troubled young adults and a park ranger in a forest reserve called Grizzly Park after making the demise of an escaped serial killer.','/zyr06ktRtCfRPXgwZMLxzRlFJij.jpg','2008-02-07',91,'Released','Nature\'s most vicious killing-machine is about to get angry.','Grizzly Park',18505,2.068,4.7,'LJRofZUwF48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22140,_binary '\0','/wRYniGwsMpDPH1v02wwvdDQGhX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0915463',5.3,1585,'en','Jackboots on Whitehall','A satirical alternative history of World War II where the Nazis seize London and England must band together to prevent a full on invasion.','/2OEDmBDoLeR0vwkUKZ5NDrXBeRZ.jpg','2010-10-08',87,'Released','The smallest epic film you\'ll ever see!','Jackboots on Whitehall',58760,1.5683,4.9,'H2uspRqElks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22141,_binary '\0','/bILdzL6BYFo2tgtkPL0KMMndWl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918557',6.1,1564,'en','Saving Sarah Cain','When Sarah Cain, a self-involved big-city newspaper columnist, travels to Pennsylvania for the funeral of her Amish sister, she soon discovers that she is the legal guardian of her five Amish nieces and nephews. Rather than choose to move to Lancaster County to finish raising them there herself, or let them be separated by the foster care system, Sarah decides to take them with her back to Portland where she believes she can make a new life for them. However, she soon realizes that the modern world has forced them to compromise who they are, and that she has moved them there for all the wrong reasons - a motive which is soon exposed - because secrets can really never be kept secret. In order to find her own redemption, she knows she must make a choice to give them back their lives in Amish Country. And whether she remains part of their lives will have a lot to do with how much she has grown to love them.','/A6s9fCd0cKkOuWBawFPOT4YoDyt.jpg','2007-08-19',103,'Released','Happiness comes when you least expect it','Saving Sarah Cain',45757,1.6141,5.2,'BjiJXOM16eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22142,_binary '\0','/aSx966Rf07qHo93ISkLlpZ08Alb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918575',5.4,5273,'en','Victim','After being mysteriously kidnapped by a Doctor and his violent henchman, a young man is held captive in the converted cellar of an old mansion. For reasons unknown, he\'s forced to endure heinous physical and psychological torture, but slowly realizes the worst is yet to come when the Doctor\'s brutal plan for him is finally revealed….','/z6cNA5BLhfPjF4jAoqXN6W9WklF.jpg','2010-11-17',74,'Released','It\'s not always who you think.','Victim',60306,1.2229,4.9,'ahjiwzjLr2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22143,_binary '\0','/6mCQEuflbGr39cOxtQLvwensOTV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918627',4,1357,'en','The Cook','Over a long holiday weekend, unable to escape the confines of their sorority house, a handful of unsuspecting girls are left behind to enjoy the quiet sanctuary. The normal house staff has taken off for the weekend, leaving the girls to fend for themselves. Thankfully someone was kind enough to send them a temporary replacement chef to cook their meals.','/4t0fNV8HIKAyqpbpphKmEdRFtW5.jpg','2008-04-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Cook',21509,0.9658,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22144,_binary '\0','/1mpPqmQxXV4rGxgMbms1JoZjvWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918628',4.7,2055,'en','Fishtales','A Greek History Professor & his daughter travel to a Greek Island for one last chance to finish his thesis on ancient love spells before he loses his research grant. His daughter attempts to match her father with the local women without success until she meets a beautiful Mermaid with whose help the Professor might finally find true love for himself.','/Ag0Hb68U5vNK69LFHqbBP5JmIxp.jpg','2007-08-24',94,'Released','A funny catch!','Fishtales',15888,2.3037,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22145,_binary '\0','/A1eQaKerCsVQhSb478l7g0C3g8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918645',3.2,1304,'es','Left for Dead','Set in Mexico, Left For Dead is a bloody and sick dream ... A spaghetti western in terror. A desperate criminal will be caught in the ghost town of Amnesty alongside a vengeful demon ...','/cnbD44UZqQfgcE1RF7AALBzTwzS.jpg','2007-03-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Left for Dead',128598,1.0937,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22146,_binary '\0','/sd37prLFqNbL9ES2OTUBiEAcwIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918927',7.5,148685,'en','Doubt','In 1964 Bronx, two Catholic school nuns question the new priest\'s ambiguous relationship with a troubled African-American student.','/9lypT2ghNuUPYVJf66oe4fKvUqI.jpg','2008-12-12',104,'Released','There are no simple truths.','Doubt',14359,5.0058,7.208,'f8S0ANEp4vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22147,_binary '\0','/btCaMm9aVW1PG485Ef8RMBBALzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0918940',6.2,199513,'en','The Legend of Tarzan','Tarzan, having acclimated to life in London, is called back to his former home in the jungle to investigate the activities at a mining encampment.','/eJrfz178xBGlxjDGxnBXTzWWa4w.jpg','2016-06-29',109,'Released','Human. Nature.','The Legend of Tarzan',258489,16.4134,5.923,'Aj7ty6sViiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22148,_binary '\0','/42eShFAK1UPPVCey7mcLJjZrXgX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920457',7.3,8778,'ta','பில்லா','The intertwined stories of an international Don in Malaysia, David Billa, chased by the cops, an Indian police officer, a woman who wants to avenge the death of her brother, and a lowly thief, Velu who shares with Billa, an unusual connection.','/g9skD62F7y6VJR5nPZOgpz1ckso.jpg','2007-12-14',130,'Released',NULL,'Billa',23767,1.6687,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22149,_binary '\0','/trZRS3RfDnWBe3bQW1UUlOS210F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920458',7.2,21023,'da','Flammen & Citronen','Gunman Flame and his partner Citron assassinate Nazi collaborators for the Danish resistance. Assigned targets by their Allies-connected leader, Aksel Winther, they relish the opportunity to begin targeting the Nazis themselves. When they begin to doubt the validity of their assignments, their morally complicated task becomes even more labyrinthine.','/32CKp29QyqimkjtdJRBzSRHPx4j.jpg','2008-03-25',130,'Released','Heroes will rise, Enemies will fall','Flame & Citron',8883,4.5222,6.8,'qJnfNAEwQ8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22150,_binary '\0','/iyro6YoMgxapgUR6ZbSlXr49GwT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920459',6.7,3112,'nl','De Gelukkige Huisvrouw','Lea is an immaculate 30-something wife whose husband’s job in real estate allows her an enviably glossy lifestyle. The word ‘emancipation’ simply isn\'t in her vocabulary and as long as the money rolls in, all is rosy. So, when Harry Jr. arrives, she is a little traumatized at having to swap canapés for nappies.','/3jLBVMeEG0vrJ7kDF4d5KExa2a8.jpg','2010-04-15',97,'Released',NULL,'The Happy Housewife',46024,1.2597,5.87,'wAOVh9CFBWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22151,_binary '\0','/y6tl5o9Rx2eGavzdAdvrJRxEKOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920461',6.5,1551,'fi','Käsky','There is civil war in Finland between \"Whites\" and \"Reds\". A woman soldier of the Reds is captured by the Whites. She is ordered to be executed. A lieutenant is enforced into a homosexual relationship with his commanding officer to save the Red female with whom he is infatuated.','/7tXAvn1fZmyTYQzt1BgMpgyJyZp.jpg','2008-08-29',116,'Released',NULL,'Tears of April',54669,1.364,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22152,_binary '\0','/mIu95QezXe20KYKI1u7DjzisAUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920462',4.7,6443,'en','Lost Girls & Love Hotels','Searching for escape in Tokyo\'s back alleys, a haunted English teacher explores love and lust with a dashing Yakuza, as their tumultuous affair takes her on a journey through the city\'s dive bars and three-hour love hotels.','/vQgXwuJrlpzGDI8169tRQRy71Nv.jpg','2020-09-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Lost Girls & Love Hotels',479259,3.9594,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22153,_binary '\0','/zEIzNUKiQiaJh4H1qds878oEtoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920464',7.5,9895,'hi','Manorama Six Feet Under','Satyaveer is an engineer suspended for allegedly accepting a bribe. However, Satyaveer, proud author of a tawdry and thoroughly unsuccessful crime novel, is approached by a woman named Manorama to investigate her husband, whom she suspects of having an affair.','/1b5ZrBI48xbAVmCbNNhvFXz474y.jpg','2007-09-21',137,'Released','In The Desert, Nothing Is What it Seems','Manorama Six Feet Under',46404,2.0258,6.467,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22154,_binary '\0','/qtkAtQalRCLKS7JpI6kGiETYlQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920470',6.6,6876,'fr','MR 73','A washed-up Marseilles cop (Auteuil) earns a chance at redemption by protecting a woman from the man who killed her parents as he is about to be released from prison.','/eo0VXzqKA5xkWUVDGqgaEzIpo8k.jpg','2008-03-12',125,'Released','Let the hunt begin!','The Last Deadly Mission',14765,2.8574,6.428,'d_LTyiM9uDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22155,_binary '\0','/pFRDIaoFofC8ZSBWlWLDUri2R20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0920473',6.7,2808,'fr','Un baiser s’il vous plaît','When Gabriel and Emilie meet by chance, he offers her a ride, and they spend the evening talking, laughing and getting along famously. At the end of the night, Emilie declines Gabriel\'s offer of \"a kiss without consequences\". Emilie admonishes him that the kiss could have unexpected consequences, and tells him a story, unfolding in flashbacks, about the impossibility of indulging your desires without affecting someone else\'s life.','/1LviJDLStrDRtHtfdA8jlqlRgla.jpg','2007-09-04',100,'Released','True love is a complicated affair.','Shall We Kiss?',10541,1.9848,6.2,'vi3TqzWAOJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22156,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0922379',7.4,1321,'fa','چند کیلو خرما برای مراسم تدفین','The film is set around three protagonists. Two run a gas station on the outskirts of town, on a road that gets next to no traffic anymore, and so they get next to no customers. They live and work out of a decrepit van on site, its windows covered in plastic. Sadry is a former strongman, now blind in one eye. He is the boss of the station. Yadi is his eager to please assistant, who usually annoys more than pleases. Finally there is the postman, Abbas, who longs to trade in his brakeless bicycle for a motorcycle, while he must care for his mentally ill brother.','/pT1jDRXnZmytvgQv1ekMAXK7Ql.jpg','2006-02-01',85,'Released',NULL,'A Few Kilos of Dates for a Funeral',45895,0.7816,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22157,_binary '\0','/zcGdi9MKNQZFh8ab4GFb6AQZyqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0922547',5.1,2678,'en','Parasomnia','Laura Baxter is a young woman, literally a \"sleeping beauty,\" who suffers from a medical condition called \"parasomnia.\" A childhood accident victim, she is actually sleeping her life away, awakening briefly on rare occasions. Art student Danny Sloan falls in love with her, unaware that her hospital neighbor, a terrifying mass murderer and mesmerist named Byron Volpe has other, more sinister plans.','/k4Rx1dwoKkZrtSD0mZBRBo22jmb.jpg','2008-10-17',103,'Released','Where dreams end and nightmares begin.','Parasomnia',19222,2.925,4.9,'CPF8B6OWvXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22158,_binary '\0','/uA4qHthqXgJ0FPnly4umi2vKkXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0922642',4.7,4082,'en','Tooth and Nail','In a post-apocalyptic world, a small group of survivors, who call themselves Foragers, plan to rebuild civilization from their headquarters in an empty hospital based in what is left of Philadelphia. But they\'re soon forced into a face-off war with the Rovers, another gang of survivors whom are a brutal gang of cannibals.','/dzvYRaXpvX0q5lYOUi7zBGxfISL.jpg','2007-10-16',94,'Released',NULL,'Tooth and Nail',15425,2.0827,4.5,'ttYDI0xnBag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22159,_binary '\0','/k5uh8veAdTC7VLkcNsFerWFGedh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923600',6,5912,'en','Baghead','Four actors go to a cabin in the woods to write, direct, and act in a film that will jump-start their careers. Their idea is a horror film about a man with a bag over his head, but what happens when that man mysteriously shows up?','/pO3Au8iDpZsJt7Xco6fRsNvm3vz.jpg','2008-01-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Baghead',5759,1.8819,5.794,'RHHdIXSNgyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22160,_binary '\0','/zQKwwd0weLIIS71UVBlwzGySyut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923703',7.2,1380,'ko','그해 여름','An assistant to a TV producer, eager to stay off his bad side, promises to convince her former professor, a famous but reclusive academic, to appear on their show, which helps locate long-lost persons. Who does grey-haired Professor Yun Suk-young want to see again more than anything? The answer to that question lies decades in the past.','/4tspdRzqP4rEhLI4WUjJb7WI176.jpg','2006-11-30',121,'Released','10 days are forever.','Once in a Summer',25937,1.6429,6.805,'QYG7tqFm__4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22161,_binary '\0','/nvtb7j1eYr2ujgLYs7nF6usjhv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923714',7.2,2770,'ko','해바라기','Tae-sik gets out of a prison after spending 10 years for killing a man and wishes nothing but an ordinary life. A local lady welcomes him into her household like a son and he gets a second chance in life. His former gang tries to destroy his new home in order to build a night club but he won’t let them destroy his new family.','/qgxZrB4r4OimjYMUZlt6ZmaUm81.jpg','2006-11-23',116,'Released','A ray of hope and darkness','Sunflower',49283,2.5095,6.9,'0SE5ioy3vCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22162,_binary '\0','/cXN62FQwOoBcKlIJ9uE3Cn5wHAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923752',8,38741,'en','The King of Kong: A Fistful of Quarters','In this hilarious arcade showdown, a humble novice goes head-to-head against the reigning Donkey Kong champ in a confrontation that rocks the gaming world to its processors! For over 20 years, Billy Mitchell has owned the throne of the Donkey Kong world. No one could beat his top score until now. Newcomer Steve Wiebe claims to have beaten the unbeatable, but Mitchell isn\'t ready to relinquish his crown without a fight. Go behind the barrels as the two battle it out in a vicious war to earn the title of the true King of Kong.','/wACtXGiO08EBbJhqsD2nUzPsrKe.jpg','2007-03-25',83,'Released','Don\'t get chumpatized','The King of Kong: A Fistful of Quarters',13958,2.2384,7.73,'L5XvArGGIzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22163,_binary '\0','/ktzhr2m6y98PtwOdfOtTA0X232m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923811',7.5,32398,'ja','ヱヴァンゲリヲン新劇場版：序','After the Second Impact, Tokyo-3 is being attacked by giant monsters called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind. The child Shinji’s objective is to fight the Angels by piloting one of the mysterious Evangelion mecha units. A remake of the first six episodes of GAINAX’s famous 1996 anime series. The film was retitled “Evangelion: 1.01” for its DVD release and “Evangelion: 1.11” for a release with additional scenes.','/pETU4GurpeEjBOM8oytMH0yNBHx.jpg','2007-09-01',101,'Released','Witness the rebuild of a legend.','Evangelion: 1.0 You Are (Not) Alone',15137,7.7085,7.597,'q9tcjD5GrBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22164,_binary '\0','/dhFQ1XYIe34u9DaTQ9KqSjP0ufT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0923824',3.8,2382,'en','Ogre','A vicious Ogre rules over a town that has been stuck in time since the 1800\'s.','/pJsxsaFnvt964EB4y4Uf7J79npV.jpg','2009-04-24',90,'Released','No donkey. No fairy tale. Just terror.','Ogre',18044,1.9066,5.295,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22165,_binary '\0','/91KxAtv1KHW7bH0A2asXzXNyeXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924129',6.7,25627,'en','Crossing Over','Immigrants from around the world enter Los Angeles every day, with hopeful visions of a better life, but little notion of what that life may cost. Their desperate scenarios test the humanity of immigration enforcement officers. In Crossing Over, writer-director Wayne Kramer explores the allure of the American dream, and the reality that immigrants find – and create -- in 21st century L.A.','/6A4WdvbWHJoIN4Y9Q5HXG8R1VYV.jpg','2009-02-10',113,'Released','Every day thousands of people illegally cross our borders... only one thing stands in their way. America.','Crossing Over',15577,8.0472,6.1,'J3vAjpip1Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22166,_binary '\0','/mTXQG4pN8VwgT6k4CyeyzUDnZa0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924165',6.2,1222,'en','A Very British Gangster','A documentary about one of Britain\'s most dangerous crime families and introduces us to its magnetic, larger-than-life leader, Dominic Noonan (aka Lattlay Fottfoy).','/y2YAox1eooEKxSP2WgEFJAUles7.jpg','2007-07-17',97,'Released','Look after those that look after you F*ck off those that f*ck off you','A Very British Gangster',13137,0.9462,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22167,_binary '\0','/o3yQIO38JObUWwxo89dnYzbu76n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924213',7.1,1960,'ml','ഛോട്ടാ മുംബൈ','Vasco and his family witness a murder carried out by a local goon. Problems start brewing in their lives when this criminal starts plotting against him.','/4lvX5OvpI7YyoBKmSOolWJKu8Oh.jpg','2007-04-06',140,'Released',NULL,'Chotta Mumbai',234532,1.2942,7.212,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22168,_binary '\0','/zwb17cml9eMiWZCOAHiFF82ayqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924225',6.7,1348,'ml','ഹലോ','A brilliant lawyer turns alcoholic due to failure in love and ends up losing his job. His life changes for the better when a young woman approaches him to save her life and wealth.','/314ZG5Qojj6PmHJvGJYs2D8Lc5E.jpg','2007-07-06',145,'Released',NULL,'Hallo',280184,1.204,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22169,_binary '\0','/tx8vmCZIFbEilUkVdzJYsRZWSwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924252',6.8,1542,'ml','മായാവി','Mahi, a seasoned convict who is well-known for attacking his enemies stealthily, decides to murder someone in order to raise money for his friend.','/sYHVQaJxSIgHpmyqe499xOCSrfq.jpg','2007-02-03',124,'Released',NULL,'Mayavi',151351,1.112,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22170,_binary '\0','/ePWyz0yslY8Gp6gdAtsE1OgfuMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924274',6.4,1702,'te','రాఖీ','An ambitious and young man named Rama Krishna avenges his sister\'s death after her in-laws burn her alive due to their greed for dowry. Thereafter, he starts killing every man that harasses a woman.','/lpxVMynqh1I7bbRqab77uI83K1q.jpg','2006-12-22',166,'Released','Highly Inflammable','Rakhi',81002,1.2205,5.563,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22171,_binary '\0','/lxK7KzZEk6aIQsOt5GryKQpxa8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0924317',7.2,5512,'te','యమదొంగ','Raja, an orphaned thief, dies while helping a gang in kidnapping a wealthy heiress, Mahi, in exchange of money. He then lands in Yamlok and fights with Yama, the god of death, to get his life back.','/6U8CDbD4mniW5FnvyILoYjr3i0I.jpg','2007-08-15',178,'Released',NULL,'Yamadonga',77043,2.0401,6.278,'KRcibCmRPts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22172,_binary '\0','/plO8XyDagV9iCnikOFBsy4tmfMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0925248',8,7138,'en','In the Shadow of the Moon','Archival material from the original NASA film footage – much of it seen for the first time – plus interviews with the surviving astronauts, including Jim Lovell, Dave Scott, John Young, Gene Cernan, Mike Collins, Buzz Aldrin, Alan Bean, Edgar Mitchell, Charlie Duke and Harrison Schmitt.','/xvthKnu7EjK0QvEBPY9ZnO3SiHe.jpg','2007-01-19',109,'Released','Remember when the whole world looked up.','In the Shadow of the Moon',14284,2.2475,7.6,'h9d9-pHZzIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22173,_binary '\0','/a47QIHxJnLLBDnTOwopZ8YBhxfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926063',5.8,12382,'en','Dance of the Dead','With Prom only hours away, the usual suspects of Cosa High (Cheerleaders, geeks, bad boys and the happy-go-lucky student council alike) are preoccupied with the annual rituals of teendom. On the night of the big dance when the dead unexpectedly rise to eat the living, polar opposite groups will be forced to unite in their final chance to save the town from the zombies.','/oUyLXz372Wd0r4xURDsYqX2m98w.jpg','2008-10-14',87,'Released','Prom. It\'s their night to come alive.','Dance of the Dead',13094,3.2951,5.7,'vF1BJGl4nMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22174,_binary '\0','/5i2QAYnbN5vOZUUolLPYHTb9spe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926084',7.7,674960,'en','Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1','Harry, Ron and Hermione walk away from their last year at Hogwarts to find and destroy the remaining Horcruxes, putting an end to Voldemort\'s bid for immortality. But with Harry\'s beloved Dumbledore dead and Voldemort\'s unscrupulous Death Eaters on the loose, the world is more dangerous than ever.','/iGoXIpQb7Pot00EEdwpwPajheZ5.jpg','2010-11-17',146,'Released','Nowhere is safe.','Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1',12444,33.718,7.7,'Su1LOpjvdZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22175,_binary '\0','/w0p2HbU7IYPFU2jqjquo1buEdg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926110',5.1,2769,'en','Missionary Man','A mysterious stranger rolls into town on a unique motorcycle. All he carries is the bible and a desire for justice. Past vengeance collides as Ryder rights an injustice from his past and liberates the small town from a malicious oppressor.','/73uGeN1RJaKycOo5QHaRXhpcXeO.jpg','2007-11-29',93,'Released',NULL,'Missionary Man',13723,2.0225,5.2,'V7CwOyOs0JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22176,_binary '\0','/3jjOF43iyBeauKuPivyA1WDZbII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926129',4,40278,'en','Prom Night','Donna\'s senior prom is supposed to be the best night of her life, though a sadistic killer from her past has different plans for her and her friends.','/pKSeyN02R5khphImEIpAdBjQgEP.jpg','2008-04-10',89,'Released','A Night To Die For.','Prom Night',8617,5.9408,5.088,'Bb3Oh-i0Kpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22177,_binary '\0','/aXm9lEpYSU3eASPRrZdu0Q4MJQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926208',6.6,2019,'fa','خواهران غریب','A young, inquisitive girl named Nargess encounters a girl from another school who could pass as her twin. Amazed by the strange coincidence, the two girls rush to their respective parents, but neither side has the time to hear them out. Nargess finds herself caught between her mother and father as she tries in vain to make herself heard, and when that fails, the two girls hatch a plan to swap places and see if their parents notice. While everything goes smoothly at first, it\'s not long until they start encountering problems in this double-sided family drama.','/bvudqIX0kM45CGPXQltfLVavQ18.jpg','1995-04-10',93,'Released',NULL,'The Double Lottie',392254,1.0409,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22178,_binary '\0','/sbrDFDBT7xizvnOmrXoIScAnAtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926380',6.8,10690,'en','The Boys Are Back','When the wife of sports-writer Joe Warr dies of cancer, he takes on the responsibility of raising their 6-year-old son, and his teenage son from a previous marriage. As Joe rejects the counsel of his mother-in-law and other parents, he develops his own philosophies on parenting.','/6sIPtMC5GxLrsSXgdMHXJf8X4qV.jpg','2009-09-25',104,'Released','Inspired by a true story.','The Boys Are Back',23512,3.2366,6.3,'l6GigOJPdZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22179,_binary '\0','/dg675RUDeQ26oyx9rBY4fQtyMow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926759',7.5,10525,'fr','Le Premier Jour du reste de ta vie','A sprawling drama centered on five key days in a family\'s life.','/zsB93OKgO3HjsYfYuKoDbHy7FCP.jpg','2008-07-23',114,'Released','This family is your family','The First Day of the Rest of Your Life',12169,2.2514,7.5,'qgb6TDobtPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22180,_binary '\0','/eUM3rcy8tQjOJKqyp1VXxqJWCn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0926762',7.2,26175,'nl','Loft','Five close friends, all of them married, share a loft to meet their mistresses. One day they find the body of a young woman in the loft. Since there are only five keys to the loft, the five men begin to suspect each other of murder.','/gbFwIV5cxwMD3qUPiU91kfALTjN.jpg','2008-10-21',118,'Released','Five friends, one loft, one dead body','Loft',17845,3.817,6.868,'OVp8-7OTiH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22181,_binary '\0','/oi82LbvQs5i1OSYBvKCbDraHfOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0928152',7.8,4466,'te','మల్లీశ్వరి','A man falls in love with a woman, unbeknownst to the fact that she is a princess in hiding.','/kY5BFcSodBPz3P2KVNLaT6DZyLW.jpg','2004-02-18',150,'Released','The Princess','Malliswari',81082,2.0854,7.22,'1fypb_eHZUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22182,_binary '\0','/3Vgbq364enirFB3qEbP9oNO5I5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0928154',6.5,2190,'ko','Mr. 로빈 꼬시기','A Korean company analyst rear-ends an American man\'s car then discovers he\'s her new boss. Unlucky at love, she begins to take romance lessons from him in order to seduce him.','/yj4AXMYp7KQGkhd1NwNeZzyAEEq.jpg','2006-12-07',109,'Released','A tug of war in office begins.','Seducing Mr. Perfect',52444,1.8387,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22183,_binary '\0','/axvA2FtmG7sjc4ZGrSoRvujWSPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929261',6.1,2121,'ko','중천','After Yi-gwak, a demon hunter, loses his beloved Yon-hwa, he enters a realm that has only spirits. He meets her there, but she has no memory of him.','/r5MesvVjxP34hLcwT8BvAEMKC7C.jpg','2006-12-20',102,'Released','Between heaven and earth, where love became a legend.','The Restless',32158,3.5028,5.9,'lXVNZqKd_Bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22184,_binary '\0','/jilAAQ4NNFyna5wlgp5DFOJxr2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929412',6.8,4258,'it','Caos calmo','Pietro is a successful businessman with a wife and a daughter. One day he helps his brother save two women from drowning at the beach. When he returns home he finds that his wife has died. Now Pietro has to take care of his daughter, Claudia. When he drives her to school soon after, he decides to wait for her all day in front of the school, and soon that\'s what he does every day.','/3wx2fd6UnFBQRKV6dTBKhRze4ep.jpg','2008-02-08',108,'Released',NULL,'Quiet Chaos',22274,2.0243,6.5,'0E6CqtTqRJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22185,_binary '\0','/dmxAEDURAwfz6iTXTWu1GCYcOR3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929425',7,53535,'it','Gomorra','An inside look at Italy\'s modern-day crime families, the Camorra in Naples and Caserta. Based on a book by Roberto Saviano. Power, money and blood: these are the \"values\" that the residents of the Province of Naples and Caserta have to face every day. They hardly ever have a choice and are forced to obey the rules of the Camorra. Only a lucky few can even think of leading a normal life.','/3XcCTqSovFZE5GRebJmh1kHwziw.jpg','2008-05-16',137,'Released',NULL,'Gomorrah',8882,3.8734,6.9,'HT7Wok6jPzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22186,_binary '\0','/pKgigNSWPKnueswsCSDQc41kQJ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929618',3.5,1610,'en','The Penthouse','Girl trouble starts when a man and two good buddies becomes roommates.','/2mboKAsrYQdUIDlbNBwmRjm7Cry.jpg','2010-03-02',85,'Released','Everyone\'s trying to get on top.','The Penthouse',26353,1.6707,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22187,_binary '\0','/81ME78JndOYu7IluTi1rxh0cLY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929632',7.3,121921,'en','Precious: Based on the Novel \'Push\' by Sapphire','In Harlem in 1987, Claireece \"Precious\" Jones is a 16-year-old African American girl born into a life no one would want. She\'s pregnant for the second time by her absent father, and at home she must wait hand and foot on her mother, an angry woman who abuses her emotionally and physically. School is chaotic and Precious has reached the ninth grade with good marks and a secret – she can\'t read.','/d4ltLIDbvZskSwbzXqi0Hfv5ma4.jpg','2009-11-06',110,'Released','For precious girls everywhere.','Precious: Based on the Novel \'Push\' by Sapphire',25793,8.3751,7.3,'urFY3jp759c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22188,_binary '\0','/nl6WvxakEE7UW4xcKVfpNG08sJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929775',6.6,1623,'tr','Mavi Gözlü Dev','The beloved poet of Turkey, Nazım Hikmet, is featured on the silver screen for the period he spent in prison after 1941. Imprisoned for communist propaganda, Nazım became legendary within the prison walls as his fame grew by word of mouth. A group of friends formed around him, inspired by his poetry and painting. However, the only thing on Nazım Hikmet\'s mind was his wife, Piraye. He was very curious about his wife, from whom he had not heard for a long time. As the misery of the war years made itself felt, the devastating news for Nazım was not long in coming. His 28-year prison sentence was confirmed.','/tLHCy8yTyiEDw1RNv7kOe4hZlNs.jpg','2007-03-09',118,'Released',NULL,'Mavi Gözlü Dev',350680,0.9127,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22189,_binary '\0','/uIxt6kPcgmr2pTHrTzDp8JB5aQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929809',2,4112,'tr','Çılgın Dersane','Class of teenage students attempting to save their unconventional school from getting shut down but things don\'t go as planned.','/NlnhmDH35Q3KAVEX4SSWyWudkC.jpg','2007-03-15',100,'Released',NULL,'The Class',467843,1.2006,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22190,_binary '\0','/ps4CZ1tF6an1T4KXqMvWeqESE1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929860',6.9,4465,'ja','僕の彼女はサイボーグ','A lonely university student develops a romance with a beautiful interesting woman, who turns out to be a cyborg from the future.','/kt2wjQjJqTh15IRirPOBByFVAEe.jpg','2008-05-31',120,'Released','Is This Love Or Just Programming?','Cyborg She',19486,3.0385,7.2,'iAkzga9mA6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22191,_binary '\0','/epuUlbrsSrwVzBMi4A9E8MtSr8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0929864',6.9,1873,'en','Love\'s Unending Legacy','Missie three years later: being a single mother after her husband Willie was shot during a poker scuffle. She and Maddy move back in with her parents Clark and Marty. She finds a new home, and finds a new teaching position that she settles right into, but Missie has lost all faith in herself, until a chance encounter at her father\'s church where she adopts homeless orphan Belinda Marshall.','/xi57bQTg33RpduDphkvtdWkEI7b.jpg','2007-04-07',84,'Released',NULL,'Love\'s Unending Legacy',30975,2.5823,7.2,'hfl9m3oW3qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22192,_binary '\0','/rJ4dehxA9O5Uhqpo9OE28oU6Aa8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0930072',4.1,2346,'en','Beyond Loch Ness','James Murphey is a rugged cryptozoologist, who thirty years earlier, during a trip to Loch Ness, Scotland, had a fatal encounter with the fabled \"Nessie\" creature that killed his father, and left James with deep facial scar. Twenty years later, James is hunting for Nessie, when his search leads him to the sleepy town of Pike Island, Ashburn, on Lake Superior. Hiring Josh Riley as his guide, James and Josh bond over their mutual scientific interests and deceased fathers, while James tries to convince Josh\'s mother, Sheriff Karen Riley, that the 60-foot plesiosaur is killing and breeding.','/qFv5G3Io0hF0ruAO1z0KBTXCHEh.jpg','2008-01-05',91,'Released','It\'s Hunt Or Be Hunted','Beyond Loch Ness',48397,2.3188,5,'hJsFtpu86g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22193,_binary '\0','/9gF8o7nNCWtzYiiAkvPNGw4yxsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0930083',6.8,20061,'ja','ノロイ','A documentary filmmaker explores seemingly unrelated paranormal incidents connected by the legend of an ancient demon.','/vA7uZSMx8VL6LIuNFPnymwkRPBV.jpg','2005-08-20',115,'Released','Everything is real, everybody died.','Noroi: The Curse',21506,4.8469,6.9,'UgQ-KRkvTG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22194,_binary '\0','/tec2VVHoEzBd8Cuk93BrhJygu2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0930098',7.6,1581,'tr','Yılanların Öcü','Kara Bayram is a poor farmer living in a Turkish village with his wife, 3 kids (4th on the way) and his old mother Irazca Ana. They live on their own until another villager, Haceli who is backed up by the Mukhtar (local administrator of the Village) starts to build a new house right in front of their\'s. Kara Bayram and Irazca Ana do not accept these uninvited neighboors from the first day and unwanted events start right away.','/9CZt7StiS5Y58m3GCffgktRjt0O.jpg','1985-01-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Revenge of the Snakes',692105,2.1345,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22195,_binary '\0','/hY0rTVgrqkcSb8E6zW2sm3okDxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0930856',7.2,4919,'sr','Četvrti čovek','A man awakens from a two-month-long coma. Total amnesia. A bullet fired point blank. He doesn\'t remember anything. He\'s told that he had a wife and a son. They\'ve been killed. He\'s revealed his past identity by the Colonel, who insists they are best friends. He\'s a Major of the Military Security Agency. An inspector from the State Security Agency appears affirming that he has information on people responsible for the massacre of his family. The Major is discharged from the hospital. He tries to patch together a normal life but is confronted with emptiness and despair. His only chance of discovering his identity and the assassin of his family is to accept the game that the Inspector has set up for him with the Businessman, the Mafioso and the Politician. He agrees... Discovers that he was a war criminal... Realizes who took a shot at him... Finds out who killed his family... Discovers the Fourth Man!','/5gVdjv2UWIL8xtivrSOyPFLf7Si.jpg','2007-02-20',103,'Released',NULL,'The Fourth Man',26836,1.7707,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22196,_binary '\0','/hII4gDYkG9DJZ6iysUO4cNjkD2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0930902',6.2,5269,'ja','地下幻燈劇画 少女椿','After losing her parents, young flower selling Midori is put up by a fairground group. She is abused and forced to slavery, until the arrival of an enigmatic magician of short stature, who gives her hope for a better future.','/iv3TU7RAuWnMwhsYd7eaAIJ3NuO.jpg','1992-05-02',55,'Released','The camelia girl.','Midori',53064,11.4053,6,'GSL2M2DdkHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22197,_binary '\0','/aH3ShqPW6Y2jtpFdGsphUDAIRiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0932533',5.1,1751,'pl','Job, czyli ostatnia szara komórka','Three friends from the neighborhood – Adi, Pele and Chemist – are often referred to as freeloaders, morons, losers. This is a gross simplification! In fact they are underestimated by the world. It hasn\'t appreciated them YET. Life presents them with challenges and difficulties, like bad luck at work or mentally ill neighbor\'s dog or a grandmother who steals their hashish. But they do not give up!','/bu0kqwhtQ2ZPSecvlLWS7u6IPaI.jpg','2006-11-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Job: The Last Grey Cell',26314,1.126,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22198,_binary '\0','/7tmxa65Pjuhc2khvgrkXmBBcq21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0932669',5.2,1296,'en','Older Than America','The truth of the past come to light in a series of haunting visions in this drama. The strange visions grow more vivid with each passing day, a young woman of Native American heritage begins piecing together a Catholic priests diabolical plot to prevent her mother from revealing the atrocities that unfolded at a Native Indian boarding school.','/hyYmrGcvkV9rIq25ITbqN8xQ009.jpg','2008-03-08',102,'Released',NULL,'Older Than America',49429,1.9204,4.4,'mU9hr0JKW5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22199,_binary '\0','/4KuuH9g7806XUw8fw7D6sB5Twr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0934584',2.1,1304,'en','Supercroc','A team of soldiers must stop a giant, bloodthirsty crocodile from reaching a nearby city, while trying to avoid being a meal for the beast themselves.','/31CEurmrlKD0RoTtllFDln1Yi9Y.jpg','2007-04-03',86,'Released',NULL,'Supercroc',62962,1.589,3.2,'7Z-7TwlQWlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22200,_binary '\0','/kgUhrJSLesy71iDf1x5Ab94HnEv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0935075',6.9,53030,'en','Rabbit Hole','Life for a happy couple is turned upside down after their young son dies in an accident.','/zTUQXwMn4ndt5AAcDvJCi14ZY2B.jpg','2010-12-16',91,'Released','The only way out is through.','Rabbit Hole',27585,7.3584,6.634,'2vXjg_UApr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22201,_binary '\0','/y7y5F8PAuTEWWFcdeeTv0oDjTAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0936471',3.8,3026,'en','Transylmania','Spoof horror in which a group of college kids do a semester abroad in Romania and realise that if the partying doesn\'t kill them, the vampires just might!','/qup755rk1zDeNmQrYOJg3B45ik.jpg','2009-12-04',96,'Released',NULL,'Transylmania',37190,2.7727,4.444,'ZWZvodwo-RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22202,_binary '\0','/ysCmtf9Y9fLDChZ88PXId5RbLP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0936501',7.7,678452,'en','Taken','Bryan Mills, a former government operative, is trying to reconnect with his teenage daughter Kim. After reluctantly agreeing with his ex-wife to let Kim go to Paris on vacation with a friend, his worst nightmare comes true. While on the phone with his daughter shortly after she arrives in Paris, she and her friend are abducted by a gang of human traffickers. Working against the clock, Bryan relies on his extensive training and skills to track down the ruthless gang that abducted her and launch a one-man war to rescue his daughter.','/ognkaUSNgJe1a2pjB4UNdzEo5jT.jpg','2008-02-18',94,'Released','They took his daughter. He\'ll take their lives.','Taken',8681,19.4943,7.412,'ZxKDnpiJaVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22203,_binary '\0','/6lUwQFGksZzYVYeJC5NxTEeA10J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0937237',6.1,11749,'en','Redacted','A fictional documentary discusses the effects the Iraq war has had on soldiers and local people through interviews with members of an American military unit, the media, and local Iraqis.','/ofXlW8FtBGVGSgRiaOIfnzR5koU.jpg','2007-11-16',90,'Released','Truth is the first casualty of war','Redacted',11600,3.4583,6,'J9pASqOR6Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22204,_binary '\0','/iwp6FdxTBfLKCzDwaACfaxsW3He.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0937347',5.6,2174,'en','Already Dead','When Thomas Archer\'s happy and successful life is all but ruined following a horrific attack he is presented with a perfect opportunity to exact physical revenge upon the man who caused all his grief. However the immediate consequences of his actions and in-actions are much more complicated than he imagined.','/rgYotrZoOwjcUKlkeItp3Oy5e6p.jpg','2007-12-11',93,'Released',NULL,'Already Dead',14105,2.2082,5.6,'9yK3kDA4o0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22205,_binary '\0','/tvWEAZMkN51vMOBHN5FZZuFZTIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0937373',4.5,2033,'uk','Сафо','On honeymoon on the island of Lesbos, a woman falls for the daughter of a Russian archaeologist.','/bR6qld7NylpyKxfs1w8qdL0o2Wa.jpg','2008-02-29',86,'Released','Love has no rules.','Sappho',27283,1.845,4.3,'B6_m_yTJU88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22206,_binary '\0','/qUTY0w0ZQ15siNdu3Nfa88T5gqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0937375',6.4,11420,'en','This Christmas','This year Christmas with the Whitfields promises to be one they will never forget. All the siblings have come home for the first time in years and they\'ve brought plenty of baggage with them. As the Christmas tree is trimmed and the lights are hung, secrets are revealed and family bonds are tested. As their lives converge, they join together and help each other discover the true meaning of family.','/dBuLAw4mRlO83LPA2s4zOlVesUe.jpg','2007-11-27',117,'Released','You can\'t exchange family.','This Christmas',15250,3.7981,6.6,'0V0q_lhEa8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22207,_binary '\0','/c52EkSN4uA5Ouak7tKJEBfkEiPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0937378',6.1,1500,'sv','Varg','A story from the wilderness, where conditions of survival challenge the rules of modern society, Wolf is a contemporary drama set in northern Scandinavia. Klemens and Nejla own a small herd of reindeer. Klemens lives in tune with nature and according to the rhythm dictated by his work. His young nephew, Nejla admires him and wants to follow in his footsteps. But neither his mother nor society will allow that to happen. The herd is attacked and they react without regard for the law. A well aimed stroke of the axe puts relationships to the test. What are the consequences and who will take the blame?','/tum3dIHcqKg4BJbvLxZLJYVOw6l.jpg','2008-04-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Wolf',14074,0.956,5.9,'FdrAGkMsFFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22208,_binary '\0','/gU5cR9LKtDD8YvzE7T7GvmzCEAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0938283',3.9,182726,'en','The Last Airbender','A century has passed since the Fire Nation declared war on the other three nations of air, water, and earth in its attempt for global domination. Aang, the long-lost Avatar, is found by Water Tribe siblings Katara and Sokka and must learn to master water, earth, and fire bending to defeat the Fire Nation and restore balance to the world.','/zgwRTYWEEPivTwjB9S03HtmMcbM.jpg','2010-06-30',103,'Released','Four nations, one destiny.','The Last Airbender',10196,12.214,4.64,'WdoiHMCVqMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22209,_binary '\0','/8ye8c0SnkHclA56tbkg5avnpb6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0938305',5.6,24111,'en','Freaky Deaky','Set in 1974, a pair of \'60s radicals rely on their bomb-making skills on their way to becoming capitalists.','/1rMr42ppp05ikGgoJf1efx0ouJZ.jpg','2012-04-22',90,'Released','Crime is such a trippy thing','Freaky Deaky',168027,4.4201,5.082,'IwCL9wdiPyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22210,_binary '\0','/zhLcgqoIDvxNZPtvQ1PYloGalXs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0938330',4.9,72441,'en','Silent Hill: Revelation 3D','Heather Mason and her father have been on the run, always one step ahead of dangerous forces that she doesn\'t fully understand. Now on the eve of her 18th birthday, plagued by horrific nightmares and the disappearance of her father, Heather discovers she\'s not who she thinks she is. The revelation leads her deeper into a demonic world that threatens to trap her forever.','/rkAh9cPkb5PoTzEGWfBkhdFNIsf.jpg','2012-10-10',94,'Released','You should never have come back.','Silent Hill: Revelation 3D',61012,11.1449,5.565,'f06VJSsh8II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22211,_binary '\0','/1aAR1XHBYaqnKzRUH3bL7KpXMhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0938341',7.6,14076,'ja','トウキョウソナタ','The winds of change blow as a family grapples with unemployment, alienation, mistrust and a lack of communication. When a Japanese salaryman loses his job to outsourcing to China, it\'s simply the beginning of a series of shattering incidents, leading to the implosion of the family unit.','/6Y0ZRyh5eH7WLY4fcF92swhtgUz.jpg','2008-09-27',120,'Released','Every family has its secrets.','Tokyo Sonata',8937,3.5784,7.423,'X6k7uCTWP6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22212,_binary '\0','/lttAmV82m4SlQHlk0FVYEqF9utP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0938666',6.1,8276,'en','Holiday in Handcuffs','A ne’er-do-well thirty-something attempts to appease her family by kidnapping herself an attractive boyfriend for the family Christmas. Despite unlikely odds and dysfunctional family moments, the two fall in love and share a magical Christmas.','/cOHe3Otd2VUbvFlkuD3wKC0braB.jpg','2007-12-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Holiday in Handcuffs',24446,2.7211,6.3,'I24mL7Ax1aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22213,_binary '\0','/k2UCLlYQIy0nj2M8jtSwAHW442u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940580',5.7,4312,'en','Afterwards','Newly divorced lawyer Nathan Del Amico is shaken up after he meets a doctor who claims that he can sense when select people are about to die. Though he doesn\'t believe the doctor, events in Nathan\'s life slowly make him think he\'s not long for this world.','/byElFR4rU7aU8FQoorVNmIxCSUV.jpg','2008-10-01',107,'Released',NULL,'Afterwards',1782,3.1304,5.509,'uK5rjw2t_Ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22214,_binary '\0','/a4DAiEJj7TU50l4jy6sFUTQjF8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940585',6.6,3375,'en','Brick Lane','The grind of daily life as a Brick Lane Bangladessi as seen through the eyes of Nazneen (Chatterjee), who at 17 enters an arranged marriage with Chanu (Kaushik). Years later, living in east London with her family, she meets a young man Karim (Simpson).','/fOi0il1YvBj0d6wE5OyGIqMPV4S.jpg','2007-11-16',102,'Released',NULL,'Brick Lane',21074,1.4041,5.511,'NhRs8GeWzGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22215,_binary '\0','/j3dtgAjcnc0a9KOFyOQofHua5gz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940642',6.7,9486,'ko','미녀는 괴로워','An overweight singer is tired of being mocked about her appearance and dreams of love and fame. But will having cosmetic surgery fix her problems – or create new ones?','/daD4wsrfo16ksDtwh6tyv0BnhEu.jpg','2006-12-14',116,'Released','Does beauty tell your fate or what?','200 Pounds Beauty',18377,3.5618,6.812,'Ys5MuQ3U3ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22216,_binary '\0','/2yN5oSXcjAypZEEWQPVEJFWg0KJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940651',2.2,1595,'tr','Amerikalılar Karadeniz\'de 2','One of the missile launchers deployed by the US on the seabed of the Black Sea to strike Tehran in response to a potential threat is accidentally fired due to an unexplained mishap. The officers manage to divert the smart missile\'s coordinates and safely land it on Turkey\'s Black Sea coast without causing an explosion. All that remains is to go back and retrieve the missile from the village without anyone noticing...','/7YifQCknVhphT0ENOiNrj6Ccve4.jpg','2007-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Amerikalılar Karadeniz\'de 2',123739,0.9962,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22217,_binary '\0','/qA8IqLOzdRFvFxXqg5bV6Fto21f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940656',5.5,11823,'fr','Arthur 3: la guerre des deux mondes','With Maltazard now seven feet tall and Arthur still two inches small, our hero must find a way to grow back to his normal size and stop the Evil M once and for all, with the help of Selenia and Betameche.','/wBT40NqmBz65WYmIGhDnWcgzPcA.jpg','2010-08-22',101,'Released','The final...','Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds',42949,5.733,5.8,'jc3muhC5HKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22218,_binary '\0','/fgur8M7AcLoMhB71FkAaOd0xaJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940657',5.3,12722,'fr','Arthur et la vengeance de Maltazard','Arthur answers a distress call from Princess Selenia, who is menaced by the nefarious Maltazard.','/rHCL0HwlQvU01TLRRHZFlvsVEqt.jpg','2009-11-26',93,'Released',NULL,'Arthur and the Revenge of Maltazard',26505,7.7234,5.8,'oRSI_b6jlqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22219,_binary '\0','/7y0ol1zsvs0GbYR0BdTvWdOIDHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940709',6.4,19145,'cn','長江七號','A poor construction worker, who struggles to keep his son in private school, mistakes an orb he finds in a junkjard for a toy which proves to be much, much more once the young boy starts to play with it.','/sRzSfpSb3wYYshbaiMRIuFCJJGU.jpg','2008-01-30',88,'Released','It\'s out of this world.','CJ7',13688,8.3652,7.335,'pMELrGHqKSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22220,_binary '\0','/cyEtaaKLC4qNlPGOEPcQmS55Od0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0940723',5.9,3066,'nl','Linkeroever','When Marie moves into her boyfriend\'s apartment, she uncovers a disturbing mystery about the fate of the previous tenant.','/eZgQhrl7Jso80Eoj9lFBStkREW2.jpg','2008-03-26',102,'Released','Sometimes the truth is better left unsaid.','Left Bank',12135,1.1733,5.7,'kPEUGnrppbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22221,_binary '\0','/1QWuNHhdmWZrbnj59wwPQB4Il5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0942378',5.5,2648,'en','Johnny Kapahala: Back on Board','Johnny Kapahala, a teen snowboarding champion from Vermont, returns to Oahu, Hawaii, for the wedding of his hero -- his grandfather, local surf legend Johnny Tsunami -- and to catch a few famous Kauai waves. When Johnny arrives, he meets his new family including \"Uncle Chris\" (the 12-year-old son of his new step-grandmother) who resents the upcoming marriage. Chris\'s only interest is to join a mountain boarding crew led by a teenage bully. When Johnny\'s grandfather and his new wife open a surf shop that also caters to mountain boarders, they are soon embroiled in a turf war with a rival shop owner who wants to shut their business down.','/nYSEqCT49HsxOs8MVXRnOHxfgFx.jpg','2007-11-17',90,'Released','He\'s Back! And Catching More Waves!','Johnny Kapahala: Back on Board',62527,2.7641,6,'VGRjkS_WLBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22222,_binary '\0','/iXVBtpBRqSQvkGZHZSlYTANulHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0942384',7.6,25990,'en','Shelter','Forced to give up his dreams of art school, Zach works dead-end jobs to support his sister and her son. Questioning his life, he paints, surfs and hangs out with his best friend, Gabe. When Gabe\'s older brother returns home for the summer, Zach suddenly finds himself drawn into a relationship he didn\'t expect.','/eYA8KiSnIAbxtoIgg4lpZjB0dfz.jpg','2007-06-16',89,'Released','The power of being true to yourself.','Shelter',17483,2.8198,7.752,'zbL9lyk2kqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22223,_binary '\0','/4pLi4QMm0MZ9TSoF3l8qQmY9HNO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0942385',7.1,497637,'en','Tropic Thunder','A group of self-absorbed actors set out to make the most expensive war film ever. After ballooning costs force the studio to cancel the movie, the frustrated director refuses to stop shooting, leading his cast into the jungles of Southeast Asia, where they encounter real bad guys.','/zAurB9mNxfYRoVrVjAJJwGV3sPg.jpg','2008-08-09',107,'Released','Get some.','Tropic Thunder',7446,13.0753,6.729,'VsEdmjAudSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22224,_binary '\0','/xoyFxI9QRWqj0tnFQVH9vSE559c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0942891',6.4,3246,'en','The Guitar','The life of a woman is transformed after she is diagnosed with a terminal disease, fired from her job and abandoned by her boyfriend. Given two months to live, she throws caution to the wind to pursue her dreams.','/ziFNRplx5VuteBHnUODL7pth1xi.jpg','2008-11-07',95,'Released',NULL,'The Guitar',16890,1.3355,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22225,_binary '\0','/sDdlZfz3NrQ1OIbWjS0SvlBP3sL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0943326',5.2,3320,'en','Naked Fear','Diana arrives in a town to start a new job. She\'s threatened into working as an exotic dancer. She\'s later kidnapped and let loose naked in the wilderness as prey for the psycho hunter, like many women before her. Will she survive?','/niJO1FhGO5rjBHJgrht0xAve1QU.jpg','2007-04-01',104,'Released','Hunting Humans is the Ultimate Thrill','Naked Fear',30155,2.946,5.1,'qB4Y-CxPmbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22226,_binary '\0','/zkJuRdmXCWqPdfb6WZWXq78EiIE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0943946',4.2,2129,'en','100 Tears','After being accused of crimes he did not commit, a lonely circus performer exacts his revenge on those who unjustly condemned him. The act sparks something inside of him which he cannot stop and now, years later, his inner-demons have truly surfaced. Part urban legend, part tabloid sensationalism... he is now an unstoppable murderous juggernaut, fueled only by hate.','/hfaOWS6UCYCrVMO3YZUN3JhRRUI.jpg','2007-06-23',91,'Released','Everyone loathes a clown.','100 Tears',28109,1.0056,4.2,'s_HUxkzIgaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22227,_binary '\0','/cPlNdSZeVPqgvea2qt8E5m8Wbm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0944101',6.3,8459,'en','Good Dick','A fidgety, wisecracking video store clerk develops a fixation on a particularly reclusive customer, a frequent visitor to the pornography section of Cinefile, the video store where he works in Los Angeles. After multiple failures to impress her during their brief daily transactions, he finds her street address in the store\'s database, drives to her apartment building and initiates an unconventional campaign to win her affections.','/a1DGYt4boLrfsHUnqbHxhUIVoe9.jpg','2008-10-03',86,'Released','A hard man... is good to find.','Good Dick',14758,2.0249,5.904,'dSqKqTjyYWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22228,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0944195',6.5,1322,'te','Dubai Seenu','Seenu (Ravi Teja) is fondly called as Dubai Seenu. His sole aim in life is to fly to Dubai and earn tonnes of money. In the process, he gets hold of a broker and gets duped by him in Mumbai. He along with his friends starts a small canteen to earn his llivelihood. and eventually falls in love with a girl called Madhumati (Nayana Tara). He then witnesses an incident that prompts him to return back to Hyderabad. The rest of the story is all about how he helps out Madhumati.','/iccrGs6CXsZbTE2xFClxS2xq37i.jpg','2007-06-07',150,'Released',NULL,'Dubai Seenu',80926,1.4568,5.417,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22229,_binary '\0','/nCPRg4KPq1zq5DWWqnem9luxB6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0944233',5.3,1236,'te','శంకర్ దాదా జిందాబాద్','A goon falls for a girl who manages an old-age home, and she mistakes the goon for a professor. She seeks his help not knowing that the man who wants the old-age home demolished is his boss.','/glL5C66ihfOjDrBjo5Bm3WjMql9.jpg','2007-07-27',142,'Released','Coming Again With Mahatma','Shankar Dada Zindabad',63811,1.0937,4.941,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22230,_binary '\0','/eK1GCPvhUnWW65yWdGf4QyoBC18.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0944834',6.5,14120,'fr','Chasseurs de dragons','Dragon Hunters is a fantastic tale telling the adventures of two dragon hunters: the world has become a vast conglomerate of islands of varying size and shape. This babbling universe is mainly peopled with ruthless rogues, surly peasants and illiterate, petty lords Their main concerns revolve around two fundamental rules : Eat and don\'t get eaten.','/bhHhTCh43aT3kAeknSd5T5BcZcJ.jpg','2008-03-19',82,'Released','Dragon hunting isn\'t a fairy tale','Dragon Hunters',10800,3.9615,6.545,'33ESpP63b4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22231,_binary '\0','/sgTnSgLfLAARam9Fz9CMblOBiwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0944835',6.5,344857,'en','Salt','As a CIA officer, Evelyn Salt swore an oath to duty, honor, and country. Her loyalty will be tested when a Russian defector accuses her of being a Russian sleeper spy. She goes on the run, using all her skills and years of experience as a covert operative to elude capture, protect her husband, and stay one step ahead of her colleagues at the CIA. Her efforts to prove her innocence only serve to cast doubt on her motives, as the hunt to uncover the truth behind her identity continues and the question remains: \"Who is Salt?\"','/ppXyhOe8UCEOrBRSYqE3SkHwrcR.jpg','2010-07-21',100,'Released','Who is Salt?','Salt',27576,10.5364,6.42,'LbkQTB-OJsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22232,_binary '\0','/9lcVC0k5JgBRjT8hJBgncAq8XSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0945356',7,3923,'no','Kunsten å tenke negativt','The local disability support group visits an involuntary member, not realizing that it will bring them to a critical mass.','/1Ze2048EyOqImLuDo2XNNEduqSe.jpg','2006-11-03',93,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Negative Thinking',12167,2.0308,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22233,_binary '\0','/mDb4uku4zEElsITXDpbir4fR0HW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0945513',7.5,588228,'en','Source Code','When decorated soldier Captain Colter Stevens wakes up in the body of an unknown man, he discovers he\'s part of a mission to find the bomber of a Chicago commuter train.','/nTr0lvAzeQmUjgSgDEHTJpnrxTz.jpg','2011-03-30',93,'Released','Make every second count.','Source Code',45612,17.2178,7.312,'0dafmG_c8kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22234,_binary '\0','/eDLp4uFdqP1gpy9oMrutwH6Q64I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0947798',8,897679,'en','Black Swan','A committed dancer struggles to maintain her sanity after winning the lead role in a production of Tchaikovsky\'s \"Swan Lake.\"','/viWheBd44bouiLCHgNMvahLThqx.jpg','2010-12-03',108,'Released','\"I just want to be perfect.\"','Black Swan',44214,23.1363,7.7,'2Pxc_5f27Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22235,_binary '\0','/6WfnLguRcpYQlJ6Wkx5CO7c8LpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0947802',6.2,59947,'en','Lakeview Terrace','A young interracial couple has just moved into their California dream home when they become the target of their next-door neighbor, who disapproves of their relationship. A tightly wound LAPD officer has appointed himself the watchdog of the neighborhood. His nightly foot patrols and overly watchful eyes bring comfort to some, but he becomes increasingly aggressive to the newlyweds. These persistent intrusions into their lives cause the couple to fight back.','/A1kqp2hALf8Gd03vDACnR0EtFWo.jpg','2008-09-19',110,'Released','What Could Be Safer Than Living Next to a Cop?','Lakeview Terrace',13279,5.6849,6,'7dY9qARW9xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22236,_binary '\0','/3EE9h3xYxIastf5xVLbezH3eGps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0947810',6.8,148677,'en','Green Zone','During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert. Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.','/czFIaeukSxNEccysQeys1PCkuOG.jpg','2010-03-11',115,'Released','Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller is done following orders','Green Zone',22972,9.1664,6.485,'e3KJ21TLKVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22237,_binary '\0','/r9P7Fwhu7b7CnVev8VtNrEmjn98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948462',7.5,3659,'ta','பிரியமானவளே','A modern man, Vijay, marries his father\'s sincere secretary who hails from a poor family. But their stringent prenuptial agreement grants him the power to end his marriage after 12 months.','/ne9ILFrEQP2VsSy00ACNuPJ7s56.jpg','2000-10-26',160,'Released',NULL,'Priyamaanavale',69659,1.1359,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22238,_binary '\0','/HVcza6tJtWFrLriuh3Ano4Vt46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948470',7,787935,'en','The Amazing Spider-Man','A teenage Peter Parker grapples with both high school and amazing super-human crises as his alter-ego Spider-Man.','/jexoNYnPd6vVrmygwF6QZmWPFdu.jpg','2012-06-23',136,'Released','The untold story begins.','The Amazing Spider-Man',1930,37.1892,6.763,'-tnxzJ0SSOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22239,_binary '\0','/bgjiZJN1bwLhNmw3kMLqWqN3jG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948530',7.2,4429,'nl','Aanrijding in Moscou','‘Moscou’ is a densely populated working class neighbourhood on the outskirts of Ghent, Belgium. Matty, mother of three, bumps her car into a truck on the parking lot of a supermarket. Johnny climbs down from the cabin. He is infuriated by the dent in his front bumper and yells at Matty. Although impressed by the accident, Matty fights back with sharp words. Their discussion turns into a row, and the police have to intervene. Matty goes home, the trunk of her car dancing up and down. Back in her apartment, Matty takes a hot bath to recover from the afternoon’s emotionswhen the phone rings. It’s Johnny, apologizing for his behaviour on the parking lot. Matty tells him to stay out of her life. A dramatic comedy begins about a woman whose soul is full of dents and bruises.','/wsD91vZB893Nc0vWkhUwbgRv1MI.jpg','2008-01-30',102,'Released',NULL,'Moscow, Belgium',13646,1.1838,6.6,'fwWNgde39I8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22240,_binary '\0','/4s3pTsxokjSVIGqyGbUSdBsEJO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948532',5.7,2058,'nl','Moordwijven','When three wealthy women hire a hit man to get rid of one of their cheating husbands, everything goes wrong.','/jcBIaYspp9ZR9ESGxd4ghxS3YQG.jpg','2007-12-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Killer Babes',16177,2.0777,5.4,'24wV5J63ecg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22241,_binary '\0','/3DhtxvX7jzGEQsgVMPhwWrMRdXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948535',6.5,3043,'fr','Faubourg 36','A star is born in a time of both celebration and instability in this historical drama with music from director Christophe Barratier. In the spring of 1936, Paris is in a state of uncertainty; while the rise of the Third Reich in Germany worries many, a leftist union-oriented candidate, Léon Blum, has been voted into power, and organized labor is feeling its new power by standing up to management.','/mgLxYWhbq1nCPgs9SqvBZvsNOax.jpg','2008-09-24',120,'Released','Music halls, romance, and danger. This is Paris, 1936.','Paris 36',15457,2.118,6.1,'fs9vTC2kc38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22242,_binary '\0','/AkTWab7p4WnuYVqLzTH9AOOZLRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948542',5.4,1499,'nl','Timboektoe','Isa and her older brother Kars\' parents change course and start a campsite in France. Isa and Kars feel like they are moving to Timbuktu and losing everything. Fortunately, they don\'t complain for long, because they soon make new friends. But while new friendships blossom, Camping Timbuktu runs into trouble. Not far from them, another campsite has opened, and its unsympathetic owner tries to damage Camping Timbuktu in every way possible. It even looks like the campsite will have to close... Will Isa and Kars manage to keep Timbuktu open?','/goC3Jec3wYMxC2JZN2kDn50ePdh.jpg','2007-10-04',104,'Released',NULL,'Timboektoe',75702,0.8766,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22243,_binary '\0','/d91Bkd7D9lOCLQfFIf0mi7eKf4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948544',7.5,6432,'no','DeUsynlige','A man with a troubled past is released on parole. He finds work as a church organist and develops a rewarding relationship with a priest and her young son. However, his past soon catches up with him.','/cIjQCJn1L31sssAtoNg8F6AdLAu.jpg','2008-09-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Troubled Water',16095,2.1615,7.1,'McNee5wDNaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22244,_binary '\0','/eW81T3E28s40VFW8AgAJPCZqE2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0948547',5.6,7697,'en','Winged Creatures','A psychotic man opens fire in a diner, murdering numerous people before