ning',8645,13.0835,5.41,'TIQ21m1Ks08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22248,_binary '\0','/2KIoOfCiLuHnI9Se3n7BFdnoSgJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0949751',4,6173,'tr','Maskeli Beşler: Irak','A Turkish comedy film about an incompetent gang of criminals attempting to capture an oil installation in northern Iraq in order divert the oil to Turkey, which was the third highest-grossing Turkish film of 2007.','/c00A26utg1OZPHmme2e2bAxzKv7.jpg','2007-01-25',104,'Released',NULL,'The Masked Gang: Iraq',410867,1.0215,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22249,_binary '\0','/xRPrWB3v3c2HUyc7f0NYV6lNtia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0949815',7.6,1448,'en','Mr. Warmth: The Don Rickles Project','The documentary consists of tape of Don\'s show (never been filmed before), interviews with Don\'s contemporaries, (Steve Lawrence, Bob Newhart, Debbie Reynolds, etc.), established comedians (Billy Crystal, Rosanna Barr, Robin Williams, Chris Rock, etc.) and young comedians (Jeff Atoll, Jimmy Kimmel, Sarah Silverman, etc.).','/g2s6F0KeasorYfn3UhiEmxQQJwm.jpg','2007-10-13',89,'Released','No one is safe.','Mr. Warmth: The Don Rickles Project',26765,1.9694,6.8,'0P5x71CvZHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22250,_binary '\0','/IKfJwfyxd6JBpLnlSB78WjHC8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0950739',6.6,9183,'sv','Arn: Riket vid vägens slut','Arn has served his term in the Holy land and returns home to be reunited with his beloved Cecilia. When he returns home, he discovers that political forces tries to separate him and Cecilia - but thanks to queen Blanka they can finally get married. Arn knows that war is looming and with his martial knowledge he starts to build an army at his new home at Forsvik.','/6yu0RmSffk4sVeEGIRO1LSvtYvq.jpg','2008-08-22',128,'Released',NULL,'Arn: The Kingdom at Road\'s End',13522,2.9271,6.272,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22251,_binary '\0','/z1JxqSucPE9xj3OXgmkTTenNYx1.jpg','2026-10-