y9B5pFKeTTmATPTz.jpg','2008-12-17',133,'Released',NULL,'Trouble at Timpetill',21788,2.6046,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22263,_binary '\0','/bAqygtJYC0KEUPAKdVz3BOu1BiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0953981',7.5,1218,'ja','ALWAYS 続・三丁目の夕日','A year has passed in postwar Tokyo, and struggling writer Chagawa enters the Akutagawa Prize competition in hopes of securing a better future for the boy in his care, while the Suzuki family unexpectedly take in a new relative who looks down on their humble way of life.','/uu91ySPA3sh5tAZCWd6D1sa447K.jpg','2007-11-03',146,'Released',NULL,'Always: Sunset on Third Street 2',41177,1.843,7.1,'3DLXYndDXPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22264,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0953989',1.5,7110,'tr','Emret Komutanım: Şah Mat','Once a year a group of handicapped people are allowed to visit army barracks. There, they have the opportunity of feeling like and being real soldiers.','/y5tgpsJitcvbCo1aEH6HBPEG1nO.jpg','2007-01-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Yes Sir',31241,1.226,1.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22265,_binary '\0','/daLg05WVY2cadvW4uCo6WgUWboX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0954005',6.2,1953,'tr','Sevimli Hırsız','Metin Mertoğlu is the son of a wealthy family. He falls in love with Selma. To win her over, he pretends to be a thief and gets himself into trouble.','/x2ij2i94WbADNavi7tbr5GbOCHU.jpg','1989-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Sevimli Hırsız',237385,0.8138,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22266,_binary '\0','/ejQVKPkr2zwD1NLrzU3uHNVnogv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0954914',5.6,2495,'te','అతిథి','While the nation is terrorized by a slew of kidnappings and murders, a young woman falls in love with a mysterious man; not realizing that he is the one who went to jail for the murder of her parents, thirteen years earlier.','/jD5qUBrYWzpFNgn4i9xZU2k3n1A.jpg','2007-10-18',172,'Released',NULL,'Athidhi',56996,1.7329,5.947,NULL,NUL