ands the second child over to Caroline without his wife\'s knowledge. Henry\'s fateful decision yields grave consequences for his family over the next 20 years.','/gq8nK7OnNjjrGq08jXVhIBsSTKW.jpg','2008-04-12',90,'Released',NULL,'The Memory Keeper\'s Daughter',14772,2.9411,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22271,_binary '\0','/gxJnDz2W566PRdYKCaJrp1FpRRI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0955308',6.6,298845,'en','Robin Hood','When soldier Robin happens upon the dying Robert of Loxley, he promises to return the man\'s sword to his family in Nottingham. There, he assumes Robert\'s identity; romances his widow, Marion; and draws the ire of the town\'s sheriff and King John\'s henchman, Godfrey.','/9NS5QGOfck24yL3bZqWeW06PgPC.jpg','2010-05-12',140,'Released','Rise and rise again, until lambs become lions','Robin Hood',20662,14.8986,6.4,'3f3toYy63KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22272,_binary '\0','/u4aYt9ho1Zpr81eui3hTrdc3AEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0955411',2.9,2594,'en','The Ten Commandments','This vibrantly animated feature recounts the biblical epic of the Hebrew prophet Moses and the Ten Commandments. Led by the word of God, Moses challenges the ominous Egyptian pharaoh, performs miracles and guides the chosen people on a 40-year journey through the desert to free them from captivity and lead them to the Promised Land.','/yeake9TDNiyIFtqDjIAPMSJhO1u.jpg','2007-10-19',88,'Released','An ordinary man. An extraordinary calling.','The Ten Commandments',22331,2.4617,5.6,'daUYb6bN_aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22273,_binary '\0','/wFfGk3kwGJGz43Ffup9SZ7pICW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0956038',6,27719,'en','Nights in Rodanthe','Adrienne is trying to decide whether to stay in her unhappy marriage or not, and her life changes when Paul, a doctor who is travelling to reconcile with his estranged son, checks into an inn where she is staying.','/nyB5BeSNJUcWwKN7ypCMjbvnarq.jpg','2008-09-26',97,'Released','It\'s never too late for a second chance','Nights in Rodanthe',14326,4.6384,6.25,'6_r1Y6zgCSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22274,_binary '\0','/lvNG1UF8IVmHnDJ3tYIvGxSoSjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0956101',7.3,1670,'en','Big River Man','Follows Martin Strel as he attempts to cover 3,375 miles of the Amazon River in what is being billed as the world\'s longest swim.','/7sSFRmf0YvYgQQ4dqhADkPSXHpt.jpg','2009-01-15',100,'Released','When I see a swimmer, I paint a drowned man.','Big River Man',26694,0.6686,6.6,'ce432_JmdB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22275,_binary '\0','/a8ukBc7LrT26qnxSMD8rYjNeJ1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0959285',5.2,4433,'ta','அழகிய தமிழ் மகன்','Guru has the ability to predict future events. With his unique ability, he identifies several future events, including the attempted murder of his lover by a look-alike.','/mft5HEwgoUz9Ve393y0ruXlV6Pc.jpg','2007-11-08',171,'Released',NULL,'Azhagiya Tamil Magan',63636,1.8966,5.4,'Kg34OISUzlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22276,_binary '\0','/AmjUi3wBU4bSmhC7woKnXhgoXIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0959306',4.9,3592,'en','Reach Me','Each member of a group of people has a connection to a self-help book authored by a reclusive former football coach.','/cJl2GTmQsL6ygHabO2YLVA8Kb9i.jpg','2014-03-14',95,'Released','There\'s no stopping someone who will stop at nothing!','Reach Me',251994,3.2813,5.2,'FTgn12w7JEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22277,_binary '\0','/1Oak5sa1L51ytCxM2KHmrwKE7qF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0959329',5.4,15128,'en','Nine Dead','Communication is the key to the survival for nine strangers who have been kidnapped by a masked gunman and told that one of them will die every ten minutes until they discover how they are all connected. Who of the nine lives and who dies?','/3zAYW3q6gawnV68XdXtkBNBgUEX.jpg','2010-03-09',98,'Released','It doesn\'t have to end this way.','Nine Dead',34335,3.8856,5.263,'QP8B7gxo-nE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22278,_binary '\0','/ra9aXj8PpUbUHwwTRSl5zsL6WHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0959337',7.3,238589,'en','Revolutionary Road','A young couple living in a Connecticut suburb during the mid-1950s struggle to come to terms with their personal problems while trying to raise their two children. Based on a novel by Richard Yates.','/cvkD3yiVXLg3as8EAG3LaTycONQ.jpg','2008-12-19',119,'Released','How do you break free without breaking apart?','Revolutionary Road',4148,12.814,7,'J_l8p1cjJ5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22279,_binary '\0','/z3iOv6d4emyQ5W30mQ64NAFITWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0959342',5.3,2324,'sv','Se upp för dårarna','Two girls from different backgrounds, one an immigrant from Turkey and the other a girl who needs to get out of her father\'s shadow, apply to the police academy, where they become close friends.','/2sQlcnBvCnhLXoF6rknxFdeUWbJ.jpg','2007-02-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Se upp för dårarna',26645,1.4676,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22280,_binary '\0','/8bE1VSdUBeUmdFsHBCkFmuCNaUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960066',4.4,1499,'en','The Black Waters of Echo\'s Pond','Nine friends take a holiday at a Victorian home on a private island and uncover a game that when played brings out the worst in each of them. Jealously, greed, hatred, lust, all of the things they keep buried deep inside themselves rise to the surface and come to a boil.','/wRnXoeGfgMtASlz0iZ0ko7idie7.jpg','2010-04-09',92,'Released','Where your deepest secrets are revealed.','The Black Waters of Echo\'s Pond',116983,1.7535,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22281,_binary '\0','/1jpf8Q7RExFoEzqahV9eeSLcoxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960084',6.3,2140,'ar','الرهينة','When Mostafa arrives to Ukraine, he witnesses the kidnapping of an Egyptian scientist. Eventually he gets involved in rescuing him, in a country he knows nothing about.','/4FYiEot1ERkgUzgCEPueQWnwy7g.jpg','2006-12-20',94,'Released',NULL,'The Hostage',418433,0.8512,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22282,_binary '\0','/wUQMYTjB7Ygkd56JzUi1Qpq9Xxm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960097',5.5,2097,'en','Wake','When things get tough for offbeat Carys Reitman, she does what any emotionally isolated, modern girl would do - she goes to strangers\' funerals...','/4QgPZpf8GIJOqzCqvIGvNyZxEU2.jpg','2009-02-25',97,'Released','Meet Carys. She\'s a mourning person...','Wake',37665,2.5453,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22283,_binary '\0','/k66qfHgZo4Fj5WyI6PTemoMpWz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960143',6.9,1557,'en','Love\'s Unfolding Dream','Centers on Missy\'s adopted daughter Belinda Tyler as she follows her dream. Belinda wants to be a doctor, but this time period does not look kindly on women with careers, especially one in the medical field. But Belinda is a strong-minded woman and deeply wants a career as a doctor. She manages to prove her abilities while assisting the local doctor and caring for an old woman who recently experienced a stroke. Belinda nurses her back to health and helps her regain the use of her arm again. Belinda also meets the nephew of their deceased neighbor. Drew comes to town to get his uncle\'s farm in shape to sell. After that he intends on returning to New York to join his father\'s law practice. He has no desire to stay in this small, unsophisticated town. But after meeting Belinda he has second thoughts. Belinda also feels something for Drew, but she is conflicted because she wants to be a doctor...','/7OCcCfioaoUS1q5nemO8uSciKRj.jpg','2007-12-15',87,'Released',NULL,'Love\'s Unfolding Dream',49857,2.2252,6.993,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22284,_binary '\0','/tfUotS2rLaIu7ieJPDonyDn5EqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960144',5.6,229790,'en','You Don\'t Mess with the Zohan','An Israeli counterterrorism soldier with a secretly fabulous ambition to become a Manhattan hairstylist. Zohan\'s desire runs so deep that he\'ll do anything -- including faking his own death and going head-to-head with an Arab cab driver -- to make his dreams come true.','/gBhLQmpCPoKFMCGsulMbIFzrBID.jpg','2008-06-05',113,'Released','Lather. Rinse. Save the world.','You Don\'t Mess with the Zohan',10661,12.0476,5.72,'MGyPEt2sucY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22285,_binary '\0','/msW5LXd7kKvAfYQA6bPaPwMTNFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960721',5.8,2044,'en','Adventures of Power','In his quest to become the world\'s greatest air-drummer, a small-town dreamer must overcome obstacles and ridicule to save the day.','/bbq8h3hIbIeVB9Iu5vOar46FFhL.jpg','2008-01-17',89,'Released','March to the beat of your own drum. Even if you don\'t have one.','Adventures of Power',30023,1.5869,5.063,'OVISHNekLSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22286,_binary '\0','/gu9SE1fuuc5cA8w8om21lc4at3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960731',6.1,107196,'en','Bedtime Stories','Skeeter Bronson is a down-on-his-luck guy who\'s always telling bedtime stories to his niece and nephew. But his life is turned upside down when the fantastical stories he makes up for entertainment inexplicably turn into reality. Can a bewildered Skeeter manage his own unruly fantasies now that the outrageous characters and situations from his mind have morphed into actual people and events?','/rSOnWm8ahvgThYp8TKGRUTcvsyw.jpg','2008-12-24',99,'Released','Whatever they dream up... he has to survive.','Bedtime Stories',10202,13.7037,6.161,'e-6N1NZrQAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22287,_binary '\0','/AuQAN9r9gLdD0ogTtkS0CC9pTLw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960741',5.8,5484,'en','The Canyon','A survival story about a honeymooning couple who get lost in the wide expanse of the Grand Canyon.','/tKqqIuCCOCbjze3LzoP3Oxt84rI.jpg','2009-10-23',102,'Released','Surviving is just the beginning','The Canyon',26223,2.2396,5.636,'jjN3-u-lCoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22288,_binary '\0','/aNKTayM919m4nOsHuFSk461CYNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960770',5.4,1516,'en','Holding Trevor','After finally breaking up with his drug-addicted lover, Trevor begins a new romance that unexpectedly complicates his other relationships.','/tS7hKzRrR6OeQvaLmMNHwnZ2Le5.jpg','2007-06-16',88,'Released','Moving forward doesn\'t always mean leaving something behind.','Holding Trevor',14205,1.0577,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22289,_binary '\0','/bYWYTg4Reni6H7AHn4PfIlcty0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960790',6.5,19510,'de','Keinohrhasen','Rainbow press reporter Ludo is sentenced to 8 months, but is released on probation. But he has to work 300 hours for a local daycare center and meets Anna who has unfinished business with him.','/4b7dPkUYGoU52xFgVnvUoJhOc8i.jpg','2007-12-01',116,'Released','You always meet twice...','Rabbit Without Ears',6076,3.5221,6.128,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22290,_binary '\0','/r1GnyDcTV0WkwqLsI52QPM04aTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0960890',4.1,19742,'en','Zombie Strippers!','In the not too distant future a secret government re-animation chemo-virus gets released into conservative Sartre, Nebraska and lands in an underground strip club. As the virus begins to spread, turning the strippers into \"Super Zombie Strippers\" the girls struggle with whether or not to conform to the new \"fad\" even if it means there\'s no turning back.','/iQcOzXCpewM9pbEwLoIrHLjpMvB.jpg','2008-04-18',94,'Released','Live Dead Nudes','Zombie Strippers!',13009,5.324,4.8,'ekh3hsLpuSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22291,_binary '\0','/jLnwPw9UOR7kBHgOyzGH7EzzqVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961043',5.1,1349,'it','Come tu mi vuoi','Giada is a overachieving student who works to pay for college. Riccardo is a spoiled brat who answers her tutoring ad in order to improve his abysmal grades. She\'s shy and homely. He\'s handsome and brazen. As they say, opposites attract.','/vMICBSko76xJLjngUMss9aqhiVj.jpg','2007-10-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Come tu mi vuoi',60049,1.5251,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22292,_binary '\0','/btlEOyb3XB9lVYkJmv0RNnWtVrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961066',7.5,6217,'sv','Maria Larssons eviga ögonblick','In a time of social change and unrest, war and poverty, a young working class woman, Maria, wins a camera in a lottery. The decision to keep it alters her whole life.','/2gdlWWktx5s5x1KEIBK9IOD083N.jpg','2008-09-24',131,'Released',NULL,'Everlasting Moments',17077,2.006,7.3,'mOnLN2veR1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22293,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961079',7.7,1724,'en','Reclaiming the Blade','The Medieval and Renaissance blade, a profound and beautiful object handcrafted by master artisans of old. An object of great complexity, yet one with a singular use in mind- it is designed to kill. The truth of the sword has been shrouded in antiquity, and the Renaissance martial arts that brought it to being are long forgotten. The ancient practitioners lent us all they knew through their manuscripts. As gunslingers of the Renaissance they were western heroes with swords, and they lived and died by them. Yet today their history remains cloaked under a shadow of legend.','/8Tr8EtQtAOnJ0m1tdjd01OQo4QI.jpg','2009-04-15',90,'Released','In a confusing and ambiguous world, nothing makes more sense than a good, old-fashioned sword fight.','Reclaiming the Blade',55858,1.6741,5.9,'WxcBWl8-d0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22294,_binary '\0','/ps7JhQJuQ5djXnpzNZ1iqJVYSeg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961088',5,1525,'en','While the Children Sleep','A prosperous couple find the perfect live-in nanny but soon discover she intends to do her job to deadly perfection.','/5U7rpZQ1MzIcwtqqxiO2U5wvhHn.jpg','2007-09-16',90,'Released',NULL,'While the Children Sleep',39824,2.8474,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22295,_binary '\0','/uLg9t6c34soxT4UAebbL3Cnlbl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961097',6.7,24573,'fr','Un monstre à Paris','Paris, 1910. Emile, a shy movie projectionist, and Raoul, a colourful inventor, find themselves embarked on the hunt for a monster terrorizing citizens. They join forces with Lucille, the big-hearted star of the Bird of Paradise cabaret, an eccentric scientist and his irascible monkey to save the monster, who turns out to be an oversized but harmless flea, from the city\'s ruthlessly ambitious police chief.','/wSYZR2QL58jWPIEe9TG7G9PlTya.jpg','2011-10-12',90,'Released','You can find love anywhere… even in insects','A Monster in Paris',77459,6.9631,6.9,'4PqBTnqIHu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22296,_binary '\0','/1qtQv0zlqz75q75DVGjE692pXQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961108',6.4,14225,'en','Fireflies in the Garden','The semi-autobiographical story centers on the complexities of love and commitment in a family torn apart when faced with an unexpected tragedy.','/ozRz07oyk4ZKu5fbYHE33DnnuM9.jpg','2008-08-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Fireflies in the Garden',7353,4.1379,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22297,_binary '\0','/vnmOVJbzS546L1lnxtO2EgRzAXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961117',5.8,2177,'en','Manufacturing Dissent','\"Michael Moore doesn\'t like documentaries. That\'s why he doesn\'t make them.\" A documentary that looks to distinguish what\'s fact, fiction, legend, and otherwise as a camera crew trails Michael Moore as he tours with his film, Fahrenheit 9/11.','/3OkdoxIC6v2afGttvSpZFxPMkod.jpg','2007-02-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Manufacturing Dissent',27827,1.0607,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22298,_binary '\0','/wDW4fRTgxckqGAdgVdfJ4v7uCqX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961198',6.7,1257,'hr','Armin','Kind-hearted, but slightly possesive, Ibro, takes his quiet, epileptic son Amir on a journey from their small, backwards Bosnian village to Zagreb, so that the latter can partake in an audition for the role in a big-budget drama about the role of the German UNPROFOR soldiers during the events of The Bosnian War. Ibro\'s overprotectiveness and constant praise start annoying Amir, putting their relationship and the latter\'s ptoential future acting career on the line.','/2q7crxLLw4R2PA0lk7WwyYPUYyN.jpg','2007-02-09',82,'Released','What would you say to your father if he told you that he wanted you to turn out famous?','Armin',74994,0.7837,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22299,_binary '\0','/rimhdm7tiOdZqTz0QKckoJ7mGac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961722',4.3,16495,'en','Cabin Fever 2: Spring Fever','A high school prom faces a deadly threat: a flesh-eating virus that spreads via a popular brand of bottled water.','/RmQpuArPv71IuDLn8CP710fNgk.jpg','2009-08-11',87,'Released','This time it\'s spreading.','Cabin Fever 2: Spring Fever',28739,4.3213,4.5,'AL9REcSH3IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22300,_binary '\0','/iTpdIuDoccKFAGdRVeEI5GygS79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0961728',6.7,17948,'en','The Escapist','Frank Perry is an institutionalized convict twelve years into a life sentence without parole. When his estranged daughter falls ill, he is determined to make peace with her before it\'s too late. He develops an ingenious escape plan, and recruits a dysfunctional band of escapists - misfits with a mutual dislike for one other but united by their desire to escape their hell hole of an existence.','/9eyKD0mvE0ZSbuxPzmm5wvQaNRr.jpg','2008-06-20',102,'Released','5 Men. 4 Walls. 1 Plan.','The Escapist',14851,3.0564,6.2,'qBBiLLjK5XY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22301,_binary '\0','/c7UcFuuG2pgsYVypGjX3EkaW0RB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962711',5.4,8830,'en','The Objective','A team of US Special Ops forces is dispatched to a remote mountain region of Afghanistan with orders to locate an influential Muslim cleric. While on the mission they find themselves lost in a Middle Eastern \'Bermuda Triangle\' of ancient evil and faced with an enemy that none of them could have imagined.','/7Kp8e43AjcNKWvfpLMD3DaCHMwW.jpg','2008-04-28',90,'Released',NULL,'The Objective',14878,2.1618,5.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22302,_binary '\0','/spyZFUG0lR6FEbvMn3YBcxT8vdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962726',5.1,73524,'en','High School Musical 3: Senior Year','As seniors in high school, Troy and Gabriella struggle with the idea of being separated from one another as college approaches. Along with the rest of the Wildcats, they stage a spring musical to address their experiences, hopes and fears about their future.','/aq2o1wT0crBOTxof36O6KTyjpgE.jpg','2008-10-11',112,'Released','The year of their lives begins.','High School Musical 3: Senior Year',11887,10.078,6.539,'1S8RTKL5cW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22303,_binary '\0','/28XFhXIlmeg19bSOpWKWaWFBEkQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962736',7.2,69553,'en','The Young Victoria','As the only legitimate heir of England\'s King William, teenage Victoria gets caught up in the political machinations of her own family. Victoria\'s mother wants her to sign a regency order, while her Belgian uncle schemes to arrange a marriage between the future monarch and Prince Albert, the man who will become the love of her life.','/iGyuReyij3bPCtzJdSjTR8PR0pa.jpg','2009-03-04',105,'Released','Love rules all.','The Young Victoria',18320,5.9869,7.2,'MElrsyE_QAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22304,_binary '\0','/5HBrONjnQ4dDuOnNOfZkmj0B9se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962762',6.9,1882,'ja','Genius Party','The seven short films making up GENIUS PARTY couldn’t be more diverse, linked only by a high standard of quality and inspiration. Atsuko Fukushima’s intro piece is a fantastic abstraction to soak up with the eyes. Masaaki Yuasa, of MIND GAME and CAT SOUP fame, brings his distinctive and deceptively simple graphic style and dream-state logic to the table with “Happy Machine,” his spin on a child’s earliest year. Shinji Kimura’s spookier “Deathtic 4,” meanwhile, seems to tap into the creepier corners of a child’s imagination and open up a toybox full of dark delights. Hideki Futamura’s “Limit Cycle” conjures up a vision of virtual reality, while Yuji Fukuyama’s \"Doorbell\" and \"Baby Blue\" by Shinichiro Watanabe use understated realism for very surreal purposes. And Shoji Kawamori, with “Shanghai Dragon,” takes the tropes and conventions of traditional anime out for very fun joyride.','/e0jqLkjEOtfRhugXs84tfZtT9i8.jpg','2007-07-07',102,'Released',NULL,'Genius Party',40123,2.4149,6.5,'4AlCRIoVzLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22305,_binary '\0','/xAbJd9OnuGODnO0iiO9whdAcmpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962774',6.7,4061,'no','O\' Horten','Odd Horton is dependable and contained: he\'s a train driver retiring after 40 years of service, living a simple life. His idea of adventure is to fly from one city in Norway to another. Starting on the night of his retirement dinner, Odd has a series of dislocating experiences: a boy insists that Odd sit by his bedside while he falls asleep; misadventure causes Odd to miss his last run; he witnesses an arrest; he assists an old man and makes a friend; he takes a trip with a blindfolded driver; he adopts a dog; he takes stock late one night at the roundhouse; he revisits his mother\'s disappointment in him. How should he live the rest of his life?','/bOTDPnPVykfS2WprAJc5mkq5ltu.jpg','2007-12-26',90,'Released',NULL,'O\'Horten',8933,3.1967,6.3,'wzhTSydSpU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22306,_binary '\0','/2v7CE53X4aXdtiU22SgSdq0Oha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0962782',6.5,1235,'fr','Survivre avec les loups','In 1942, the young Jewish girl Misha, her Russian mother Gerusha and her German father Reuven hide from the Germans in a small house in Ardennes, Belgium. Misha is very connected to her mother that advises her that if one day a person comes to her saying \"love of my life\", she would follow him or her without any question. When her parents are captured by the Nazis, Misha is delivered to a German family and the abusive matriarch gives a bad treatment to the girl. However, she finds support in the family of Ernest and his deranged wife Marthe that supplies groceries to foster family. Misha loves Ernest\'s dogs and the old man gives a compass to her and tells that her parents have been sent to East to forced labor. When the old couple is denounced for sheltering the girl and arrested by the Germans, Misha flees through the woods heading east. Along her journey seeking out her parents...','/vlcyVOnKEMzMMoTg8oAcPCyoiSg.jpg','2007-11-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Surviving with Wolves',8268,2.2394,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22307,_binary '\0','/rX7EDn70R2L0ijCPRbz5cjoQ73h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963178',6.5,104696,'en','The International','An interpol agent and an attorney are determined to bring one of the world\'s most powerful banks to justice. Uncovering money laundering, arms trading, and conspiracy to destabilize world governments, their investigation takes them from Berlin, Milan, New York and Istanbul. Finding themselves in a chase across the globe, their relentless tenacity puts their own lives at risk.','/fneofXacvudxNUKyM61UtoilHRI.jpg','2009-02-03',118,'Released','They control your money. They control your government. They control your life. And everybody pays.','The International',4959,9.8296,6.3,'0xaoEjhsSX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22308,_binary '\0','/xLH9jvY4tNzcKvopgEGYI7YeAy7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963194',6.4,28748,'en','Repo! The Genetic Opera','By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet. The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan — and those unable to fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed. In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.','/2G5LczM1clXu3byEudWk9w0KDYD.jpg','2008-11-07',98,'Released','Not Your Parents\' Opera.','Repo! The Genetic Opera',14353,4.1759,6.3,'LWqUDEsyMts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22309,_binary '\0','/yG8A1qG9jeKREDro9eFld52HyEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963208',6.5,6120,'en','Where in the World Is Osama Bin Laden?','Morgan Spurlock tours the Middle East to discuss the war on terror with Arabic people.','/izbPng3zkyT6jA8EcZQROb32oMk.jpg','2008-01-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Where in the World Is Osama Bin Laden?',12179,2.0922,6.141,'fYmEA4O6a10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22310,_binary '\0','/4FmtbkjHHdZRlsaceN8JeFQ8nE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963743',6.3,32163,'en','Angus, Thongs and Perfect Snogging','Georgia Nicolson is fourteen, lives with nosey parents who don\'t understand her, an annoying three year old sister and has to wear a beret to school. She would, however, rather be blonde, have a smaller nose and a boyfriend. Revolving around her hilarious journal entries, prepare to be engulfed in the world of the soaring joys and bottomless angst of being a teenager.','/3WLMr49X84qGiFn1pkCyhS5SEBZ.jpg','2008-07-25',100,'Released','Georgia Nicolson\'s not going mental, but her life is.','Angus, Thongs and Perfect Snogging',12689,5.3594,6.5,'ogBjxasdQR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22311,_binary '\0','/rYqjPTWtgswEh7gTMbponxsy0tR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963794',5.9,91915,'en','The Ruins','Americans Amy, Stacy, Jeff and Eric look for fun during a sunny holiday in Mexico, but they get much more than that after visiting an archaeological dig in the jungle.','/6HpicbiT7xmlMjQXOSCeNoLZGpf.jpg','2008-04-02',91,'Released','Terror has evolved.','The Ruins',11152,6.4095,5.957,'cyglpQU5sJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22312,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963807',7.4,1966,'en','I.O.U.S.A.','With the country\'s debt growing out of control, Americans by and large are unaware of the looming financial crisis. This documentary examines several of the ways America can get its economy back on the right track. In addition to looking at the federal deficit and trade deficit, the film also closely explores the challenges of funding national entitlement programs such as Social Security, Medicare and Medicaid.','/8M8TjVNxo9Y9cEizJjtIVI3YL3T.jpg','2008-01-19',85,'Released',NULL,'I.O.U.S.A.',15320,1.0572,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22313,_binary '\0','/4aqCW6eXcRXovWJc8yNNbB3rXYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963915',5.1,1750,'th','ฅนไฟบิน','The story is set in 1890s Siam. Siang is a young Muay Thai warrior and rocketry expert who steals back water buffalo taken from poor Isan farmers by unscrupulous cattle raiders. He is searching for a man with a tattoo who killed his parents.','/7yRZYBeYJgM49MGWEX1LQNgzqza.jpg','2006-12-21',98,'Released','One will stand and fight.','Dynamite Warrior',14818,2.0733,6.3,'ty49dLu4XjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22314,_binary '\0','/sDd8fQMUyE3HnIwpKjL61FTW4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963965',5.6,8021,'en','Dolan\'s Cadillac','Robinson, a once peaceful, law-abiding school teacher, has turned into an obsessed vengeance machine, intent on killing the man who murdered his wife - ruthless Las Vegas mob boss James Dolan. But to do so, Robinson must infiltrate the dangerous underworld, and devise a diabolical plan that will bury Dolan once and for all.','/5R9MivzBtRpZCq3amYmNjEmfChT.jpg','2009-07-01',89,'Released','An eight-cylinder fuel-injected coffin.','Dolan\'s Cadillac',19823,3.3023,5.938,'J6pvZZbtX-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22315,_binary '\0','/mtrfLUfUoQunolDhmQy0GfbRclC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0963966',6.1,177916,'en','The Sorcerer\'s Apprentice','Balthazar Blake is a master sorcerer in modern-day Manhattan trying to defend the city from his arch-nemesis, Maxim Horvath. Balthazar can\'t do it alone, so he recruits Dave Stutler, a seemingly average guy who demonstrates hidden potential, as his reluctant protégé. The sorcerer gives his unwilling accomplice a crash course in the art and science of magic, and together, these unlikely partners work to stop the forces of darkness.','/b5pIUsGll0418NyfNA5eYCI9aoK.jpg','2010-07-13',109,'Released','It\'s the coolest job ever.','The Sorcerer\'s Apprentice',27022,14.981,6.1,'NDPPUJqFgks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22316,_binary '\0','/l9x37Pvu2JR7TE04fRqxjBMW2qV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964185',6.8,14335,'en','Tetro','In Buenos Aires, 17-year-old Bennie seeks out his estranged brother Tetro, a once-promising writer haunted by their family’s past. As Bennie uncovers Tetro’s hidden manuscript, old secrets and rivalries resurface, forcing both men to confront the truth about their father and the tangled legacy that tore their family apart.','/t2FKTAf9aQoRgU0Z5KTJJwBfDCF.jpg','2009-06-11',127,'Released','Every family has a secret.','Tetro',11928,3.3837,6.8,'XJ_XTIsMKig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22317,_binary '\0','/mTYd8acAX1hwHwnyyyydjYXz1lw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964516',6.9,13829,'hi','Fashion','A small-town girl finally realizes her dream of becoming a famous supermodel but soon finds out that there\'s a price for her glamorous new life.','/uBTULkbgheo2LucoV5FFTH2BR60.jpg','2008-10-29',167,'Released',NULL,'Fashion',19624,2.1631,6.4,'WPWcIw5xF4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22318,_binary '\0','/2kqmEQZqime0G3ULgrKtAq3WVdH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964517',7.8,411315,'en','The Fighter','Boxer \"Irish\" Micky Ward\'s unlikely road to the world light welterweight title. His Rocky-like rise was shepherded by half-brother Dicky, a boxer-turned-trainer who rebounded in life after nearly being KO\'d by drugs and crime.','/xfsFerGhO1h6rLk8vwLgMyQ8WVJ.jpg','2010-12-10',116,'Released','Every dream deserves a fighting chance.','The Fighter',45317,12.9828,7.374,'LRIZ4mCi5Ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22319,_binary '\0','/A3gPNP5DOY0s6S1V3BPw8GHXoIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964539',5.9,34862,'en','Pathology','Medical student Ted Grey graduates at the top of his class and quickly joins an elite pathology program, whose top students invite him into their circle. There he uncovers a gruesome secret: They play a game in which one tries to commit the perfect, undetectable murder, then the others compete to determine the victim\'s cause of death.','/tK9DvIwAuX5AExgEZqLCnf7qy5k.jpg','2008-04-11',95,'Released','No body is safe.','Pathology',12192,4.2839,5.7,'OtKpgs9cXSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22320,_binary '\0','/8ntTGtJCT9SbfZ2TjRDZTICr0Yv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964586',6.9,3867,'en','Skin','Based on the true story of a black girl who was born to two white Afrikaner parents in South Africa during the apartheid era.','/lRKQ0CXJF1cIO1kc2XqdWptbaAX.jpg','2009-07-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Skin',29989,2.7173,6.4,'wbj691Z1Z1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22321,_binary '\0','/sWnYaMtPvrW4PXqSys0XKcw4Yhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0964587',5.8,25193,'en','St Trinian\'s','When their beloved school is threatened with closure should the powers that be fail to raise the proper funds, the girls scheme to steal a priceless painting and use the profits to pull St. Trinian\'s out of the red.','/aOVxLigLjkix69vq6iiu0XXPnai.jpg','2007-12-21',101,'Released','Taking higher education to a new low.','St Trinian\'s',10748,4.5883,5.9,'sFAwSum6zfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22322,_binary '\0','/9ltOP98SISgfNuDKA9RcQzvK2eM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0965367',4.1,1473,'el','Alter Ego','Alter Ego: a successful Greek rock group, with a potential that surpasses the limits of the local music industry and hundreds of thousands of fans getting wild at every concert and public appearance of theirs. Fame, success, money, in a world of glamor and vanity. But what\'s hidden behind the mirror? How do the members of Alter Ego experience their success, their day to day life, their dreams?','/vDjG9SQYXQcwwqAzs5n87R959jD.jpg','2007-05-09',99,'Released',NULL,'Alter Ego',173421,0.7562,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22323,_binary '\0','/dWAACwE9TzLGRXWCgHw05UUB6KP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0965382',8.6,2402,'en','Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers: Runnin\' Down a Dream','Directed by Peter Bogdanovich and packed with rare concert footage and home movies, this documentary explores the history of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers, including Petty\'s famous collaborations and notorious clashes with the record industry. Interviews with musical luminaries including Jackson Browne, George Harrison, Eddie Vedder, Roger McGuinn, Jeff Lynne, Dave Stewart and Petty himself shed some revelatory vision.','/9mdIZkWQ1rGy3pTTDOHzx6DhY5X.jpg','2007-10-14',239,'Released',NULL,'Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers: Runnin\' Down a Dream',31147,1.5673,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22324,_binary '\0','/aIiwPYdKM0P0gbzh1J1xk3mraUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0965411',6.1,1511,'da','Det som ingen ved','When Thomas´ sister dies in an accident, he discovers that her death may be connected to their deceased father´s work in military intelligence. As Thomas embarks on an investigation he soon finds himself and his family under surveillance by an unknown group of people.','/7Bk00Fm5xw07ixndNAXrWG6WzAI.jpg','2008-02-11',99,'Released',NULL,'What No One Knows',15837,1.6146,5.6,'f41LcC42OjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22325,_binary '\0','/6Bev1r0VbGp8Riv9QiSgt832OoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0965649',7.3,4009,'ja','名探偵コナン 14番目の標的','Ran’s secret past revealed! Ten years ago, something happened between her mom and dad. Now, plagued by nightmares, Ran is starting to remember… Meanwhile, a murderous card dealer breaks out of jail to seek revenge. His target: Ran’s father. Can Conan stop him in time and save his girlfriend’s family?','/2W1FwcYpHarzO5GKBYucoGnDffA.jpg','1998-04-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Case Closed: The Fourteenth Target',21452,4.8244,7.2,'BlJsEmOWQ1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22326,_binary '\0','/w6zXYxMCigUMOZqQ33rdRDyj5I4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0967945',6.3,3836,'en','The Merry Gentleman','A woman who leaves an abusive relationship to begin a new life in a new city, where she forms an unlikely and ironic relationship with a suicidal hit man (unbeknownst to her). Enter a worn, alcoholic detective to form the third party in a very unusual triangle as this story begins to unfold.','/xN5nQC6vdxb17WRvgcpN7KsL3IG.jpg','2008-04-16',110,'Released','A man with a secret. A woman with a past.','The Merry Gentleman',24053,1.6194,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22327,_binary '\0','/i4YjA78Tf60YW5tfBJmW8Q8X1QU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0968264',6.9,31241,'en','The Conspirator','Mary Surratt is the lone female charged as a co-conspirator in the assassination trial of Abraham Lincoln. As the whole nation turns against her, she is forced to rely on her reluctant lawyer to uncover the truth and save her life.','/a2ubkGUjGYeKRN1C2Tib0rmjuWf.jpg','2011-04-15',122,'Released','One bullet killed the President. But not one man.','The Conspirator',60309,5.101,6.6,'CmoESMxbIIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22328,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0968311',5.5,1701,'en','Taken in Broad Daylight','Every 24 hrs. after a child\'s been kidnapped by a stranger, chances of finding them alive diminishes to almost 100% ... The true and inspiring survival story of kidnapped teen, Anne Sluti, and how she manages to stay alive by manipulating her captor, engineering her own rescue and negotiating her safe release after 6 days of hell.','/cZdxdNJSh8qgqLz0TZoPcpG2YyM.jpg','2009-11-10',89,'Released','Based on an inspiring true story of survival','Taken in Broad Daylight',19560,1.5582,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22329,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0968712',7.3,2463,'lt','Zero. Alyvine Lietuva','ZERO is an 0 sucking in a young deserter, a casino victim and three heroin brothers. That is a destiny, a mixture of objectives and desires of heroes. That is a lifestyle balancing on the edge - bullets, numbers and needles.','/wP3HcLOSWoqssQIFibDPWiZdxRk.jpg','2006-09-08',81,'Released','Who is going to die on such a beautiful day?','Zero. Lilac Lithuania',60867,1.0414,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22330,_binary '\0','/zf2bEdkV2i9kJEUKiFs7K2qWksR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0969268',6.7,2352,'ko','그놈 목소리','After Gyeong-bae\'s son is kidnapped, he receives a call from the kidnapper asking for 100 million won. The detectives are teamed up for the case, yet the culprit gets away at every opportunity.','/1qpKJuE3cwxaOcWXYwMNNC8f1om.jpg','2007-02-01',122,'Released','44 days of nerve-racking phone threats.','Voice of a Murderer',104176,1.7883,6.6,'pBSz2W-FtyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22331,_binary '\0','/hQQYobrobIgnT6trUV0E3ofdBEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0969269',7.1,8699,'zh','神探','Bun, a schizophrenic, former police inspector comes out of retirement to help a rookie detective solve a complex murder case involving a missing colleague and a suspected policeman suffering from a multiple personality disorder.','/ft2zEgggkK2qQxsmrN1NXGPLbl1.jpg','2007-11-29',91,'Released','I can see a person\'s inner personality.','Mad Detective',14016,4.1618,7.1,'rotL2JpoBcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22332,_binary '\0','/poP7B207rbxL9q3zDquQfOE3re5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0969345',6.8,1895,'en','Strange Frame','28th century, 200 years after the Great Earth Exodus. Naia, a feisty, young singer/songwriter, falls in love with the beautiful saxophonist Parker in Ganymede, one of Jupiter\'s moons. The two form a band - and now they have to not only make it as musicians but also to fight for their freedom. Dramatically rendered in rich, hand drawn animation, Strange Frame brings us into a world of space pirates, indentured slaves and genetic mutations - infused with music throughout, to create a dreamlike tale unlike anything you\'ve ever seen.','/kuOGun9Nw5WZg5MWynKTQLm5qX4.jpg','2012-05-03',98,'Released','How fortunate are those who can frame the beauty of the strange.','Strange Frame',205392,1.5719,5.2,'CW-tfaT8rVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22333,_binary '\0','/weNIhzw1siUIoD25TzdqPtLsKeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0969653',3.1,6603,'en','White Wall','In the near future, everything has changed. Basic human rights have become the rarest of luxuries. No one knows when this started but everyone knows how. The VXII, the deadliest virus ever created, spread like wildfire and decimated the majority of the world\'s population. The non-infected survivors now cling to life in four quarantined cities behind a wall. Shawn Kors and his brother, Jude, survived the VXII only to grow up in a squalid internment camp for orphaned children. Under the care of the militia, they were pitted against other children in backwoods death matches. Shawn, Jude, and the few who escaped became notorious for their incredible fighting skills. They have since parted ways. Shawn now makes a comfortable living as a janitor at the local medic station. He spends his days dreaming of curing the VXII. When Shawn discovers the discarded body of a fellow internment camp friend, he is forced out of hiding and pulled into a rabbit hole of conspiracy and violence.','/gvEIllqeRp8tKoV8llpnvPcPqJZ.jpg','2010-05-07',91,'Released','Blood Hurts!','White Wall',36511,0.9129,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22334,_binary '\0','/Aj81Gu3u1a64qXFOLDuF5gdxyy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970179',7.5,351440,'en','Hugo','Orphaned and alone except for an uncle, Hugo Cabret lives in the walls of a train station in 1930s Paris. Hugo\'s job is to oil and maintain the station\'s clocks, but to him, his more important task is to protect a broken automaton and notebook left to him by his late father. Accompanied by the goddaughter of an embittered toy merchant, Hugo embarks on a quest to solve the mystery of the automaton and find a place he can call home.','/1dxRq3o3l3bVWNRvvSb7rRf68qp.jpg','2011-11-22',126,'Released','One of the most legendary directors of our time takes you on an extraordinary adventure.','Hugo',44826,10.3394,7.2,'Hv3obL9HqyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22335,_binary '\0','/n8KxhAnfoAFoOrYLQcHi7nhp1zB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970411',6.4,73481,'en','City of Ember','For generations, the people of the City of Ember have flourished in an amazing world of glittering lights. But Ember\'s once powerful generator is failing and the great lamps that illuminate the city are starting to flicker. Now, two teenagers, in a race against time, must search Ember for clues that will unlock the ancient mystery of the city\'s existence, before the the lights go out forever.','/xHYxFNsl8KuT4tHai8d1Y5gJI0F.jpg','2008-10-07',95,'Released','Escape is the only option','City of Ember',13600,14.4299,6.383,'U4qNrdYmsj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22336,_binary '\0','/nIxFtd6gcmGGvFxyb1z3mt46CrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970416',5.5,188765,'en','The Day the Earth Stood Still','A representative of an alien race that went through drastic evolution to survive its own climate change, Klaatu comes to Earth to assess whether humanity can prevent the environmental damage they have inflicted on their own planet. When barred from speaking to the United Nations, he decides humankind shall be exterminated so the planet can survive.','/vBgFSYmG5tb7GsZ3tHR0WNaWaxA.jpg','2008-12-10',104,'Released','We thought the Earth was ours. We were wrong.','The Day the Earth Stood Still',10200,14.2293,5.7,'7eCVD3WTEtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22337,_binary '\0','/5BqdQshlGWtn43YIFHIlYJzhFsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970452',6.1,81065,'en','Solomon Kane','A nomadic 16th century warrior, condemned to hell for his brutal past, seeks redemption by renouncing violence, but finds some things are worth burning for as he fights to free a young Puritan woman from the grip of evil.','/jwwVNuGRUBXcudG6wOKP9U60BzU.jpg','2009-12-23',104,'Released','Fight evil... With evil.','Solomon Kane',32985,8.6721,6,'VKZBb6p4lk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22338,_binary '\0','/mr7RYg69jt5KcC7G218Bxp68kzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970462',4.8,5351,'en','Tunnel Rats','During the Vietnam War [1959-1975] a special US combat unit is sent out to hunt and kill the Viet Cong soldiers in a man-to-man combat in the endless tunnels underneath the jungle of Vietnam. Suicide squads of a special kind.','/cm3a0SeO6DvoMbSlsZZSfINohbP.jpg','2008-05-31',96,'Released','Hell is for Heroes','Tunnel Rats',20181,2.7241,4.9,'RmEuGECjMls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22339,_binary '\0','/aJGSoNe4sjCrYwUtIgkA3x05B43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970468',7,30851,'en','Miss Pettigrew Lives for a Day','London, England, on the eve of World War II. Guinevere Pettigrew, a strict governess who is unable to keep a job, is fired again. Lost in the hostile city, a series of fortunate circumstances lead her to meet Delysia LaFosse, a glamorous and dazzling American jazz singer whose life is a chaos ruled by indecision, a continuous battle between love and fame.','/A8ylf9VH21E9uxcl7vslJpPXnwQ.jpg','2008-03-07',92,'Released','Every woman will have her day.','Miss Pettigrew Lives for a Day',12178,4.0516,6.8,'9UsfT_NJdiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (22340,_binary '\0','/i7oKytMBPC0uJwPFDpfr3DsDxkL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970472',6.7,8005,'ja','ベクシル 2077日本鎖国','2067: Isolation: Japan seals herself off from the eyes of the world in the face of unilateral international policy setting strict limits on the use of robotic technology. The island nation exists only behind a veil of seclusion. No soul shall enter. No soul shall leave. 2077: Revelation: The veil is breached. Japan is infiltrated by agents of the organization S.W.O.R.D., a fighting force operating outside of the protection of the United States and her allies. Their mission: Determine if the Japanese are developing banned robotic bio-technology, forbidden due to its threat to humankind. In the battle between machine and man, humanity stands to suffer most.','/xF5je4N99eoh94Zahus2Nhm45Yl.jpg','2007-08-18',109,'Released','The dark secret of future Tokyo!','Vexille',13391,3.2662,6.693,'4rFNNBfIdfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22341,_binary '\0','/sLDoVwrzmKNdiBmykPSxaJA7uQh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970866',5.5,127561,'en','Little Fockers','It has taken 10 years, two little Fockers with wife Pam and countless hurdles for Greg to finally get in with his tightly wound father-in-law, Jack. After the cash-strapped dad takes a job moonlighting for a drug company, Jack\'s suspicions about his favorite male nurse come roaring back. When Greg and Pam\'s entire clan descends for the twins\' birthday party, Greg must prove to the skeptical Jack that he\'s fully capable as the man of the house.','/90mwPRNMmX9RUGVgKMJMJNQnYX8.jpg','2010-12-21',98,'Released','Kids bring everyone closer, right?','Little Fockers',39451,11.7989,5.664,'Fs2MZIA4Sjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22342,_binary '\0','/mvzJMPBZh93iox2S0tF7tEfA6KV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970933',6.3,1696,'en','Film Noir','Private detective Sam Ruben\'s clever plan falls apart with the onset of amnesia. Everyone is trying to kill him and he doesn\'t know why. The classic film noir milieu now comes to you in the form of an animated feature.','/9ZyoFvgUADnYqOPqZfmQAgVWGLU.jpg','2007-03-02',97,'Released',NULL,'Film Noir',14233,1.8874,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22343,_binary '\0','/7W1ULkSyI09WOWybrLXTMThHE6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0970946',5.2,1256,'el','Μία Μέλισσα τον Αύγουστο','Harris, his wife, his mistress and his half German sister arrive with a boat to a distant Aegean island, assessable only by boat. The boat man forgets them and they are stranded there. Harris gets stung by a bee, and he develops an allergy. He gets terribly swollen and his alter ego emerges. Suddenly all secrets, hidden truths and feelings come into the open.','/6vHabOQefLc9IztmG1rwAkjlOvr.jpg','2007-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'A Bee in August',47241,0.9923,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22344,_binary '\0','/wQE7BCTo9sdGEG5hywmC0hz8NoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0971209',6.5,82745,'en','A Perfect Getaway','For their honeymoon, newlyweds Cliff and Cydney head to the tropical islands of Hawaii. While journeying through the paradisaical countryside the couple encounters Kale and Cleo, two disgruntled hitchhikers and Nick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they\'re being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.','/ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg','2009-06-08',98,'Released','Welcome to paradise. Enter at your own risk.','A Perfect Getaway',12403,7.2488,6.3,'izudtkH3rkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22345,_binary '\0','/wsHuH5Y3WBqA9xdhvmIbvY101PW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972542',6.7,1988,'ko','아치와 씨팍','Sometime in the future, mankind has depleted all energy and fuel sources, however they have engineered a way to use human excrement as fuel. To reward production, the government hands out extremely addictive, popsicle-like \"Juicybars\", which in turn also act as a laxative. Aachi and Ssipak are street hoodlums who struggle to survive by trading these bars in the black market.','/1ib8yTKDDYIxj0X8ywGomFPLpJE.jpg','2006-06-28',88,'Released','A blockbuster-class bullshit action for fiery 18-year-olds.','Aachi & Ssipak',22520,1.9365,6.3,'4i7bAC2Y_XI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22346,_binary '\0','/kToac37LEGYzfmL87uc4YQWOadG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972544',6.3,5763,'en','Back Roads','A young man cares for his younger sisters after their mother is imprisoned for murdering their abusive father. When he strikes up an affair with a married woman, long-dormant family secrets bubble to the surface.','/va3CVH59k7b79JLl4t2TLJAh0fZ.jpg','2019-11-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Back Roads',465929,2.6632,5.859,'K_nkQQ-o1EY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22347,_binary '\0','/ne6QvgV5qzc7XfxGJ3PQFihHTa5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972555',6.1,4481,'en','Exhibit A','Exhibit A tells the timely story of a normal family disintegrating under financial pressure. All is not as it seems as the King family go about their day-to-day lives oblivious of the horror to come. Dad Andy (Bradley Cole) is nursing a secret that ultimately leads to terrible consequences for them all. We witness these chilling events unfold through daughter Judith\'s video camera, which subsequently becomes Exhibit A.','/2rh0TE5qEKZ6LuIDSOEvU8jA7YT.jpg','2007-10-01',85,'Released','The camera never lies...','Exhibit A',49341,1.3183,5.715,'VyHoYDNM8TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22348,_binary '\0','/835uK7ASQSf1fWlNuPpJYEWoNGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972558',5.1,6127,'ru','Обитаемый остров','On the threshold of 22nd century, furrowing the space, protagonist from the Free Search Group makes emergency landing on an unknown planet where he must stay. People who are living on this planet have remained at the stone level of the 20th century, with its social problems, miserable ecology and shaky world..','/dQ6Cox1ycTpvEgLKAHRzRerwEL8.jpg','2009-01-01',115,'Released',NULL,'The Inhabited Island',16911,2.4176,5.3,'v5mPfF2bILM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22349,_binary '\0','/8YMdNZQEZMl8nPlve88M66V3lMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972857',3.4,1905,'en','Ninja Cheerleaders','3 college cheerleaders use their martial arts know-how to save their Sensei from mafia kidnappers, but must keep their extra curricular activities a secret in order to make it into an Ivy League school.','/yvtpbxEgIOO92WTBNYVi15VdytH.jpg','2008-05-10',81,'Released','Fight to cheer another day','Ninja Cheerleaders',19829,2.0559,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22350,_binary '\0','/he3tSbGMewQLt92dPcJruwc3ctk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0972883',6.9,14016,'en','Red','Avery, a reclusive older man, has a best friend in his dog, Red. When three teens kill Red without reason, Avery sets out for justice and redemption, attempting to follow the letter of the law. But when the law fails him, and the boys\' father clearly defines right and wrong in his own way, Avery must avenge himself by any means possible.','/eCDOdRVL4SQcUJWA9SAOpTeggIx.jpg','2008-08-08',93,'Released','They should have told the truth...','Red',13200,3.185,6.3,'tI6TZUBW7TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22351,_binary '\0','/opOMPDfqvmPdX62yc3ReVBJ4P1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0973783',7.7,4493,'ml','ബിഗ് B','Four brothers try to find the mystery behind the murder of woman who raised them.','/bXmioH1kqrKQ7TUVZNCznuT73Pp.jpg','2007-04-13',130,'Released','Yo Big B','Big B',79634,1.3012,7.179,'A0Pb113tk50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22352,_binary '\0','/eMyC1vaYQzW27bLangjmtcf6SaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0973790',4.3,2047,'en','Steel Trap','A who-is-it setting in the claustrophobic corridors of an abandoned and locked-off office building that has several guests invited to a party by their mysterious, unknown host. Only it is they who are the victims of their crimes. Suspense and mistrust are not the only stalker in this cat and mouse game of wits and fear. Who is the stalker? Why is he killing? And what is it exactly that everyone here has in common?','/fqbyYbURgpHyEr0ZXko5kZNDjhE.jpg','2007-11-07',89,'Released','Surviving Each Floor Is The Name Of The Game.','Steel Trap',18556,1.5482,4.8,'FjYdEf39_B0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22353,_binary '\0','/20vIC3JXCFrsLwv0TpiBbK7IKh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0973844',6.7,5869,'fr','Chacun son cinema ou Ce petit coup au coeur quand la lumiere s\'eteint et que le film commence','Commissioned to mark the 60th anniversary of the Cannes Film Festival, \"To Each His Own Cinema\" brought together 33 of the world\'s pre-eminent filmmakers to produce short pieces exploring the multifarious facets of cinema and their perspective on the state of their chosen artform in the early 21st century.','/1bTniamnmxv8TY3AUrxddrNy9rV.jpg','2007-10-31',100,'Released','A declaration of love on the big screen.','To Each His Own Cinema',36108,3.202,6.423,'m8M4r8Uw9vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22354,_binary '\0','/tgos39ApfFnVfJ73JvAek9toRpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974014',6.6,15703,'en','Creation','A psychological, heart-wrenching love story that provides a unique and inside look at Charles Darwin. Torn between faith and science, he struggles to finish his legendary book \"On the Origin of Species,\" which goes on to become the foundation for evolutionary biology.','/vS6ne76vjRH7Z88rAqYLCcQatB4.jpg','2009-09-25',108,'Released','Faith evolves.','Creation',30431,3.0696,6.4,'knH9vK4zgGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22355,_binary '\0','/2nyaeISu2xIxIgZYNpX4UayY8PN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974015',6,509893,'en','Justice League','Fuelled by his restored faith in humanity and inspired by Superman\'s selfless act, Bruce Wayne and Diana Prince assemble a team of metahumans consisting of Barry Allen, Arthur Curry and Victor Stone to face the catastrophic threat of Steppenwolf and the Parademons who are on the hunt for three Mother Boxes on Earth.','/eifGNCSDuxJeS1loAXil5bIGgvC.jpg','2017-11-15',120,'Released','You can\'t save the world alone.','Justice League',141052,22.2987,6.1,'3cxixDgHUYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22356,_binary '\0','/qHYsm2im7bn4QTz8cvs2aPbN2WB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974536',4.7,1759,'en','Chemical Wedding','A shy, stuttering professor brings satanist Aleister Crowley back to life.','/zPZCBkOgdtaubIQw23CfVFIksG8.jpg','2008-05-04',106,'Released','In three days, his resurrection will be complete…','Chemical Wedding',14814,1.6285,4.2,'14t7nR2nEwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22357,_binary '\0','/taLjmy5TN0GKg1jzyLQs6p7SJOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974554',6.7,23961,'en','Elegy','Cultural critic David Kepesh finds his life -- which he indicates is a state of \"emancipated manhood\" -- thrown into tragic disarray by Consuela Castillo, a well-mannered student who awakens a sense of sexual possessiveness in her teacher.','/tKyu97cR5Me2n9LOYPaLby2x9G3.jpg','2008-08-08',112,'Released',NULL,'Elegy',11671,3.8368,6.295,'z2qTmdKfSjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22358,_binary '\0','/u1bsHeDuH96NLcWCskUsiHQj6HJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974583',3.2,8181,'en','Lake Placid 2','Man-eating crocodiles return to the lake as two males and one aggressive female crocodile, which is protecting her nest, wreak havoc on the locals.','/8XJlJZClpMi48PB51NXt5ZWm4Vr.jpg','2007-04-28',88,'Released','You\'ll never know what bit you.','Lake Placid 2',17038,4.2524,4.9,'cUaNgKfOZls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22359,_binary '\0','/fY0oDU9Tq9U2gROvwqIRFgiPDGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974613',5.4,13250,'en','The Other Man','The story of a husband who suspects his wife of adultery, and sets out to track down the other man in her life.','/qtHxTrhdLjToXz1nR0lTYf75t5k.jpg','2008-12-25',90,'Released','What If everything you believed was a lie?','The Other Man',17606,3.8314,5.4,'0Eux285RUUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22360,_binary '\0','/8urrLPW6HFaIuRhJ1G3iQ7usEo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974661',6.4,234256,'en','17 Again','On the brink of a midlife crisis, 30-something Mike O\'Donnell wishes he could have a \"do-over.\" And that\'s exactly what he gets when he wakes up one morning to find he\'s 17 years old again. With his adult mind stuck inside the body of a teenager, Mike actually has the chance to reverse some decisions he wishes he\'d never made. But maybe they weren\'t so bad after all.','/yEcfFXEWpuXcfsR9nKESVCFneqV.jpg','2009-03-11',102,'Released','Who says you\'re only young once?','17 Again',16996,11.3667,6.321,'2wn6pAIRjjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22361,_binary '\0','/xpTfTzGgfHVe6qeVzGTbZGcMxzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0974977',4.7,5068,'en','Bad Biology','Driven by biological excess, a young man and woman search for sexual fulfillment, unaware of each other\'s existence. Unfortunately, they eventually meet, and the bonding of these two very unusual human beings ends in an explosive and ultimately over-the-top sexual experience, resulting in a truly god awful love story....','/yIPDDjtCQv8MPEmTFOD1n9WGOB2.jpg','2008-02-08',84,'Released','Death By Orgasm','Bad Biology',15991,2.4121,4.573,'3qE7r6AXoAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22362,_binary '\0','/ktY9QTrPToBZ1RlpSOcD7CaExdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0975645',6.8,83804,'en','Hitchcock','Following his great success with \"North by Northwest,\" director Alfred Hitchcock makes a daring choice for his next project: an adaptation of Robert Bloch\'s novel \"Psycho.\" When the studio refuses to back the picture, Hitchcock decides to pay for it himself in exchange for a percentage of the profits. His wife, Alma Reville, has serious reservations about the film but supports him nonetheless. Still, the production strains the couple\'s marriage.','/zlG4QzB00VM6QHUmRkKaboCOgat.jpg','2012-11-22',98,'Released','Behind every Psycho is a great woman.','Hitchcock',112336,4.5329,6.6,'_Uw6fweoB8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22363,_binary '\0','/vXzzkZq6spOAMtqZUF0P7FkMTnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0975684',7.2,2082,'en','Kisses','Two kids, Dylan and Kylie, run away from home on Christmas Day and spend a night of magic and terror on the streets of inner-city Dublin.','/rPzxkRMb4WXL3hchssrr7pRtyEs.jpg','2008-07-11',72,'Released',NULL,'Kisses',34025,2.0605,7.1,'p2rYbhW03ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22364,_binary '\0','/lMwQkhhhzIz57ldqxXk6GdApUak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0975705',6.6,1406,'ja','ONE PIECE ルフィ落下! 秘境・海のヘソの大冒険','The Straw Hat Pirates stumble upon an enormous hole in the ocean, at the bottom of which lies a mysterious island known as the \"Ocean\'s Navel\". The Straw Hat Pirates resolve to find the island\'s treasure, which can supposedly grant any wish, but the island\'s inhabitants possess agendas of their own for their new guests...','/uJCR5fDGxY98T6WrkswRHPwvDg1.jpg','2000-12-20',49,'Released',NULL,'Luffy\'s Fall! The Unexplored Region - Grand Adventure in the Ocean\'s Navel',1051942,2.899,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22365,_binary '\0','/nBHgWrFtySBrKAnCAyZpExHsBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976026',6.8,6067,'hi','Cheeni Kum','Buddhadev Gupta, a 64-year-old chef, falls in love with a 34-year-old software engineer, Nina. However, their future becomes uncertain when he discovers that her father is six years his junior.','/qjjIQC9v0lH8kfYWSF0lz7jhhDL.jpg','2007-05-25',136,'Released','A Sugar Free Romance','Cheeni Kum',16576,1.9405,6.076,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22366,_binary '\0','/tzkgh2LvESwte4e1xyWBGxBguCJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976030',6.9,2660,'tr','Delisin','A shy introvert falls for the photographer who took her pictures during high school. Confused and worried, she doubts that love will elapse and can never open up to her lover. Yet she cannot runaway from love.','/lZWbKvZFpH8uKQZ6xyjXbgM96w4.jpg','1975-04-04',75,'Released',NULL,'You\'re Crazy',447091,0.6954,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22367,_binary '\0','/cJNWYKTVzwWVNNrmbs9k3veheN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976050',6.5,2009,'el','Η Ψυχή Στο Στόμα','Takis is trapped. Takis tries to escape. Takis wants money. He\'s got a family, a baby, a home... Takis is being cheated. He loves her and he suffers... Takis can\'t take it at work. He\'s besieged by savages. But his boss tops them all... Takis has one friend and relatives. Woe is him!... Takis has run out of time. Yet, in his mind, a heavy black cloud has settled, turning everything dark... Takis is silent. He lies down and fills with rage. He fills with rage and sinks deeper...','/45C1eWzflVHCCsVFsGWoAleimpO.jpg','2006-11-13',117,'Released',NULL,'Soul Kicking',75867,0.7258,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22368,_binary '\0','/waMGsUEoHfYj3A1uRMUUgpBa71d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976051',7.6,275596,'en','The Reader','The story of Michael Berg, a German lawyer who, as a teenager in the late 1950s, had an affair with an older woman, Hanna, who then disappeared only to resurface years later as one of the defendants in a war crimes trial stemming from her actions as a concentration camp guard late in the war. He alone realizes that Hanna is illiterate and may be concealing that fact at the expense of her freedom.','/r0WURbmnhgKeBpHcpDULBgRedQM.jpg','2008-12-10',124,'Released','Behind the mystery lies a truth that will make you question everything you know.','The Reader',8055,11.1975,7.461,'JA1J2WmFGUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22369,_binary '\0','/hUpP1NUVKCg66xFBWjSSxaLzJx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976060',7,12775,'ja','TOKYO!','Three distinct tales unfold in the bustling city of Tokyo. Merde, a bizarre sewer-dweller, emerges from a manhole and begins terrorizing pedestrians. After his arrest, he stands trial and lashes out at a hostile courtroom. A man who has resigned himself to a life of solitude reconsiders after meeting a charming pizza delivery woman. And finally, a happy young couple find themselves undergoing a series of frightening metamorphoses.','/6xbq2EBAOwy0V7bzd1um3sJX1jd.jpg','2008-08-16',112,'Released','Three tall tales. one big city.','Tokyo!',8938,3.2341,6.9,'jSfYTHhDEDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22370,_binary '\0','/A1fRmLEr3gYO39H9TsrGOK3hBrq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976209',5.1,1581,'ru','Любовь-морковь','Andrei and Marina are married for 7 years and they feel there is no more love. They ask a famous doctor to help them, and he helps... by putting their minds into the bodies of each other. Now Andrei is in his wife\'s head, so he lives the life of his own wife, who runs an art gallery, and Marina in the body of Andrei becomes a lawyer...','/4EMYCSipBxoecQD9GNc5A8rqMU2.jpg','2007-03-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Lovey-Dovey',62731,0.8665,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22371,_binary '\0','/p1HlvWjMfBJIM71B9Kov9IAiB3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976216',5.8,3247,'el','Straight Story','This film is about an upside down world, where being homosexual is considered \"normal\" and heterosexual is considered \"not normal\".','/8jDMrCwArFKzQ6CFFL8saA6VTkE.jpg','2006-12-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Straight Story',48128,0.8014,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22372,_binary '\0','/5YSHbGte3wLCZLe3bVu5Pe9LlmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976222',6.3,15701,'en','Bandslam','A new kid in town assembles a fledgling rock band — together, they achieve their dreams and compete against the best in the biggest event of the year, a battle of the bands.','/z654TmQygFasbyi52vwHv8fWxoi.jpg','2009-08-06',111,'Released','Band together','Bandslam',23367,3.4883,5.8,'jEMYlDrjuc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22373,_binary '\0','/q11l98jbETEsPHp5PYf34mcA30o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976238',5.3,41061,'en','Old Dogs','Charlie and Dan have been best friends and business partners for thirty years; their Manhattan public relations firm is on the verge of a huge business deal with a Japanese company. With two weeks to sew up the contract, Dan gets a surprise: a woman he married on a drunken impulse nearly nine years before (annulled the next day) shows up to tell him he\'s the father of her twins, now seven, and she\'ll be in jail for 14 days for a political protest. Dan volunteers to keep the tykes, although he\'s uptight and clueless. With Charlie\'s help is there any way they can be dad and uncle, meet the kids\' expectations, and still land the account?','/u056hk3at4ukf9DWASVjogXyZfn.jpg','2009-11-24',88,'Released','Sit. Stay. Play Dad.','Old Dogs',22949,6.3583,5.6,'I3Urdwvu8W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22374,_binary '\0','/r1xMeJsNMAnBktFpWVm94edtTqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976246',5.9,5544,'en','Staten Island','Sully is desperate to give his unborn son the chance he never had. Jasper wants to escape the mobsters that have infiltrated his life and business. Parmie, a local mob boss, dreams of crushing the competition. All three men live in Staten Island, and once their lives intersect, nothing will ever be the same.','/dQ7Fr2amTUigFLH55eTRlzVJL9y.jpg','2009-02-07',96,'Released',NULL,'Staten Island',25927,1.8197,6.008,'pfevfBvR0Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22375,_binary '\0','/cZ4uvNu0fbMOjbXn1U24O56wqdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0976247',4.6,9561,'en','Surfer, Dude','A wave twisting tale of a soul searching surfer experiencing an existential crisis.','/948AdP72iLQUjWvKp9r8981PT28.jpg','2008-09-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Surfer, Dude',13827,3.8946,4.5,'7ekfP43ZLa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22376,_binary '\0','/s9jIHkouHIb08eXOt97UE6Vf49U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0977214',5.5,7612,'en','Hero Wanted','Liam Case is a garbage man whose life hasn\'t quite turned out the way he expected it would. In order to impress the girl of his dreams, Liam plans an elaborate heist that will culminate with him jumping in to save the day at the last minute. When the day of the heist arrives, however, the plan takes an unexpected turn and Liam winds up in the hospital.','/d7QsvWn92eTpSsOv0JHmpsWXY8X.jpg','2008-03-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Hero Wanted',16450,4.1769,5.3,'JZroWBh6Klo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22377,_binary '\0','/eyaUh8DNLbqznswqrJvm3O7JLQ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0977648',7.7,1762,'en','Every Little Step','Follows the plight of real-life dancers as they struggle through auditions for the Broadway revival of A Chorus Line and also investigates the history of the show and the creative minds behind the original and current incarnations.','/5VsB0uvQE1wSUbyzgpaZCFPGzUO.jpg','2008-09-06',96,'Released','The journey of \'A Chorus Line\'.','Every Little Step',23997,1.1727,6.4,'-jn9qQATNRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22378,_binary '\0','/pHNF5ATl8x2jsseY6kwNtJFFvA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0977663',3.7,1722,'en','Sands of Oblivion','The film tells the story of a prop from the 1923 movie The Ten Commandments that was actually an authentic artifact from antiquity with cursed powers. In the modern day these resurface leading to murder and mayhem.','/xhleoNJeavnKo8fQMovGkzFfBrn.jpg','2007-07-28',94,'Released','Some Secrets Should Never Be Unearthed','Sands of Oblivion',23816,2.3069,4.347,'W7xMGFB35yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22379,_binary '\0','/zXFutRw15r9KbChv8vHLgkzL1r2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0977669',3.2,1595,'en','The Vanguard','The year is 2015 and overpopulation and famine have plunged our planet into chaos and one desperate survivor finds himself being hunted and pursued by hordes of rage-crazed zombies.','/97P4QE9z3X2kRek659u0ZoTlzDy.jpg','2008-02-07',89,'Released',NULL,'The Vanguard',11926,1.8163,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22380,_binary '\0','/2PmX0FeigeZa2UBK7UYeQYS5ZL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0977855',6.8,53057,'en','Fair Game','A devoted wife and mother leads a secret life as a CIA agent until her husband’s article exposes a scandal, putting her identity and loved ones at risk. As her world crumbles, she must navigate the fallout of her double life.','/tX2cafjaDnEOi50xnUIloAc2fp2.jpg','2010-05-20',108,'Released','Wife. Mother. Spy.','Fair Game',38363,5.6451,6.5,'MpMGQgXbOgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22381,_binary '\0','/4BzKSTinmdgyAXzk76oxyhh44In.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978649',7.5,8048,'tr','Mutluluk','A young woman of about 17 years old, named Meryem (Ozgu Namal), has been raped, and her village\'s customs call for her to be killed to restore honor and dignity to her family and village. The eldest son of the village leader, Cemal (Murat Han), is ordered to take Meryem to Istanbul and kill her, but at the last minute he cannot complete the task.','/eYNqq7qd8mHrCyoi4bbfJShrScA.jpg','2007-03-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Bliss',23112,1.4049,6.961,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22382,_binary '\0','/nI1bA3zGz2Id2bNdGOlaEKgnzsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978670',5.4,1234,'en','The Neighbor','A businessman watches as his life begins to unravel after learning his ex-wife is going to marry his best friend. A distracting battle of wills with a real estate developer, however, might just be the thing that turns his life around.','/2Q3gt6v2WtNlD6x3MOkx441kX6N.jpg','2007-12-15',98,'Released',NULL,'The Neighbor',17174,1.8598,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22383,_binary '\0','/gOhtvGwrVkEM5hCFdyyWKJEOBk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978759',7.1,27297,'en','Frozen River','A financially strapped mother joins a Mohawk woman to smuggle illegal immigrants into the United States.','/qZRcN4JLwYQWTxKlycZPLQb37mO.jpg','2008-03-26',97,'Released','Desperation Knows No Borders','Frozen River',10183,3.3991,6.64,'Ql3ae21LV8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22384,_binary '\0','/8UxYHvKBNFnoyfHjgjMwzj4zOuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978762',8.1,203332,'en','Mary and Max','A tale of friendship between two unlikely pen pals: Mary, a lonely, eight-year-old girl living in the suburbs of Melbourne, and Max, a forty-four-year old, severely obese man living in New York.','/ebmsM382m9IClLUzKYY2U5biFwM.jpg','2009-04-09',92,'Released','Sometimes perfect strangers make the best of friends.','Mary and Max',24238,10.0102,7.879,'kGATShQbydk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22385,_binary '\0','/cnWVCPDrX29kX7AwA9sfNlLx5vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978764',6.1,263124,'en','Sucker Punch','A young woman, institutionalized by her abusive stepfather, retreats into a vivid fantasy world where she envisions a plan to escape. Gathering a group of fellow inmates, she embarks on a quest to collect five mystical items, blurring the lines between reality and imagination.','/3Cuzw1KSzItbKAKvMcMYsMfuse.jpg','2011-03-24',110,'Released','You will be unprepared.','Sucker Punch',23629,13.5358,6.207,'vJ0xYZ5mVMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22386,_binary '\0','/2x4wiLhhmuqm3bGN3vU1Yqgc5Ls.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0978797',4.9,2502,'ja','着信アリFinal','The timid, young Asuka is bullied by her classmates. When they embark on a class field trip to Korea, Asuka plans revenge by sending them a cursed phone message they can either pass on or die.','/u3CUkjgEAJoYpcI5MKhhOYnL3lM.jpg','2006-06-24',104,'Released','The only way to live is pass the curse on, who you will forward it to?','One Missed Call 3: Final',55470,2.3434,5.7,'y2i5FEbkd5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22387,_binary '\0','/uDXY0rVk8J1zLoem43udEfGBTqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0979434',5.1,12137,'en','Lottery Ticket','Kevin Carson is a young man living in the projects who has to survive a three-day weekend after his opportunistic neighbors find out he\'s holding a winning lottery ticket worth $370 million.','/6Eg93S0cMHLMFkeunqpmMkzs10A.jpg','2010-08-20',99,'Released','Winning is Just the Beginning Surviving is Another Story','Lottery Ticket',41382,3.3846,5.6,'TBtplgiBm2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22388,_binary '\0','/oc3be3waruLd0PB9h4bomN7Le3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0980970',6.3,179384,'en','The Chronicles of Narnia: The Voyage of the Dawn Treader','This time around Edmund and Lucy Pevensie, along with their pesky cousin Eustace Scrubb find themselves swallowed into a painting and on to a fantastic Narnian ship headed for the very edges of the world.','/pP27zlm9yeKrCeDZLFLP2HKELot.jpg','2010-12-02',113,'Released','Return to magic. Return to hope. Return to Narnia.','The Chronicles of Narnia: The Voyage of the Dawn Treader',10140,13.0066,6.445,'LuGUVkO0cRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22389,_binary '\0','/opd2WXOqrYkvsBPWGssmJzCGIzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0981042',7,3498,'en','Like Dandelion Dust','Rip Porter is sentenced to seven years in prison for beating his wife, Wendy. When he is released, he discovers that Wendy gave up their child, and the privileged Campbell family adopted him. The two families are soon in a legal battle for the child they both love.','/ys9LGuwyT4g32WXfWBuaksWKGwU.jpg','2009-02-05',100,'Released','Sometimes the greatest love is letting go.','Like Dandelion Dust',43937,2.7227,7,'_SI6lftXrI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22390,_binary '\0','/lxY2W0JNmrL2M7QEZBGgDEkOfMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0981072',6.8,15044,'en','The Lucky Ones','The story revolves around three soldiers — Colee, T.K. and Cheaver — who return from the Iraq War after suffering injuries and learn that life has moved on without them. They end up on an unexpected road trip across the U.S.','/zZv0mXxd7kfyKuCLMyS0DFCk0JC.jpg','2008-09-26',113,'Released',NULL,'The Lucky Ones',16005,3.4617,6.4,'XhYvY250p9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22391,_binary '\0','/nhybqPA5m1uUJkXb5W5MDWZHcJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0981224',5.1,4545,'en','Midnight Movie','At a seedy theater in a sleepy suburban town, a group of friends get together for a midnight screening of an early 1970s horror film, unaware that the director has something more in store for them.','/t04hiJUR5EiUjobsYdvQNgJkxbI.jpg','2008-10-24',82,'Released','The New Face of Horror','Midnight Movie',14686,1.9366,5,'L780ilIHWcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22392,_binary '\0','/q9m40JSqittqMWYQet2TCzVWSPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0981227',6.6,97721,'en','Nick and Norah\'s Infinite Playlist','Nick cannot stop obsessing over his ex-girlfriend, Tris, until Tris\' friend Norah suddenly shows interest in him at a club. Thus begins an odd night filled with ups and downs as the two keep running into Tris and her new boyfriend while searching for Norah\'s drunken friend, Caroline, with help from Nick\'s band mates. As the night winds down, the two have to figure out what they want from each other.','/cndxWgZEHnSUtytrMjal97ye34E.jpg','2008-10-03',89,'Released','Every night has a soundtrack.','Nick and Norah\'s Infinite Playlist',12182,5.2681,6.4,'0yYcfsYZaWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22393,_binary '\0','/6A54cXx6X1lnbd6mnPneTNKDhBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0981352',6.7,5210,