,90,'Released','When hearts beat to the rhythm of melody.','Love Songs',14448,2.8007,6.9,'s54vpKAFmS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22477,_binary '\0','/wMWaB0oWhcBiY5UKaOJ9ijkK1p8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996661',6.9,2817,'el','Τσίου','Athens, mid-August. Tsiou, addicted to substances, while trying to get his dose, mixes a number of people to his search through his sister and her mobster husband. A chain of meetings follows where the pressure passes from one to another.','/yEfYUtrIO8Fa5U8P5ibzdsdHOdg.jpg','2005-10-04',83,'Released',NULL,'Tsiou',166733,0.9608,5.913,'76QhV1fvbIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22478,_binary '\0','/gCcvCGtHnCRPRNZVlPf5oa5VetJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996930',7.1,3894,'fr','Deux Jours à tuer','Antoine Méliot is around 40 years old and has everything he needs to be happy: a beautiful wife, two adorable children, friends he can count on, a pretty house in the Yvelines and money. But one day he decides to ruin everything in one weekend.','/g7n9ax9lKXdj6w9FZCptIcC3sgW.jpg','2008-04-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Love Me No More',9736,2.5941,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22479,_binary '\0','/o1mGhEucElyVtYfdQG40Ip5va2K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996934',5.5,2699,'en','Farm House','Stranded in the remote countryside after wrecking their car, a couple seeking to start over discovers that there\'s no escape from the sins of their past.','/5o5Hab1TGNlQ6yAYmo7RuE54bSJ.jpg','2008-10-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Farm House',14866,1.5378,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22480,_binary '\0','/kDl2Mz4wB0IlvxxJY4ntUKScSXD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996948',6.9,2280,'ko','후회하지 않아','Su-min is an orphan trying to balance work in a factory with study at an art college and an evening job. One night, a rich young businessman makes an advance on him during one of his driving jobs.','/pGk0qv3WpOriF0r0ltLOPlDkpsz.jpg','2006-11-16',113,'Released','Divided by class, united by passion.','No Regret',33199,1.9777,5.8,'ydm45GXlCb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22481,_binary '\0','/qGNMhRE7hHP5KIXaAkNELpYrZCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996966',7.6,4870,'en','Not Quite Hollywood','As Australian cinema broke through to international audiences in the 1970s through respected art house films like Peter Weir\'s \"Picnic At Hanging Rock,\" a new underground of low-budget exploitation filmmakers were turning out considerably less highbrow fare. Documentary filmmaker Mark Hartley explores this unbridled era of sex and violence, complete with clips from some of the scene\'s most outrageous flicks and interviews with the renegade filmmakers themselves.','/n4J0mFMjeondUYT2zqlYb350tWL.jpg','2008-08-28',103,'Released','The wild, untold story of OZploitation!','Not Quite Hollywood',16194,2.22,6.75,'8v-JZb3vXE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22482,_binary '\0','/h9M8axNzZ8kPu1YQtrLLXvrUJ0O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996967',5.9,5436,'en','Otis','After being captured and tortured by the psychopath Otis, teen cheerleader Riley Lawson escapes and informs her parents, who quickly sidestep sluggish FBI agents and take matters into their own hands. But the Lawsons\' revenge plan hits a snag when Otis\'s unusual brother enters the picture.','/hDujIe7PxXxxkWK844sCTkwqxCu.jpg','2008-03-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Otis',15527,2.2188,5.5,'kBTjk7c0sIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22483,_binary '\0','/yn8KXHXI6KTyJzTCpqPVei8NF4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996979',5.6,9543,'en','Alien Raiders','It\'s the end of yet another night at Hastings Supermarket, a grocery store in Buck Lake, Arizona. But just before closing, a group of masked and armed to the teeth militants invades the store and take everyone hostage','/gBz8ueJSWIVwB3LO80BiuUFpiWY.jpg','2008-09-21',85,'Released',NULL,'Alien Raiders',13954,2.492,5.4,'dl1rRf7PW58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22484,_binary '\0','/4dfU75v8GslBSyfCgHRtS3ihcJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0996982',7.3,3614,'sr','Turneja','Year 1993, the bleakest time of war in Bosnia and Herzegovina. A group of actors from Belgrade, utterly unaware of what they\'re setting themselves up for, embark on a search for quick earnings - on a \"tour\" around the Serbian Krajina. However, there they are thrust into the heart of war and begin to wander from war front to war front, from one army to the next.','/6tVU4ohs0aoSPqAuCcecut31IyL.jpg','2008-08-30',102,'Released',NULL,'The Tour',17094,1.4328,6.6,'tvbLRfMPsBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22485,_binary '\0','/34yqBsKxBqk0XW3D1Px5Yi1SQfL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997035',7,2102,'hu','Bibliothèque Pascal','A single mother\'s struggle to support her child leads her into the surreal netherworld of illegal sexual enterprises, with her finally ending up in the Bibliothèque Pascal; an elegant but bizarre house of prostitution in which men can re-enact sexual scenarios inspired by great works of literature for a hefty fee.','/2YZuPFTur5MiJhADI8pd7jFwgzP.jpg','2010-06-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Bibliothèque Pascal',51403,2.064,6.1,'UISiPxL7Kls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22486,_binary '\0','/9fiwOwDgGEzJtzbm0ghPzbtcGDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997047',4.4,17325,'en','College Road Trip','When an overachieving high school student decides to travel around the country to choose the perfect college, her overprotective cop father also decides to accompany her in order to keep her on the straight and narrow.','/8kcBMzhqW2eo058SmIKvbTbakYr.jpg','2008-03-07',83,'Released','They can\'t get there fast enough.','College Road Trip',13493,5.7593,5.4,'GMsD0Y3vUsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22487,_binary '\0','/fdh8MV2tC6k4dB5LuSRgfPv1AcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997057',7.1,1740,'en','An Englishman in New York','Biographical drama based on the last 20 years of Crisp\'s life. The literary figure and gay iconoclast emigrated to New York in 1981 and lived there until his death. The film observes Crisp in both his public and private lives, from his seemingly cavalier response to the outbreak of AIDS to his tender relationship with his friend Patrick Angus and his own response to growing old.','/ddADQWD3BL8Ozqe3T4dfpc6FRdz.jpg','2009-02-07',75,'Released',NULL,'An Englishman in New York',34937,1.7673,6.4,'ICoqvmq-doU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22488,_binary '\0','/A9Yy4ZRJgTXlKa1KOV92YLTCppn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997084',6.2,2994,'ja','ワンピース 珍獣島のチョッパー王国','As the Straw Hat Pirates sail through the Grand Line, a sudden eruption of geysers beneath the Going Merry sends the crew flying over a nearby island. In the chaos, Chopper falls overboard and becomes separated from his friends. While Luffy and the others land on the far side of the island, Chopper finds himself hailed as the new king by the local animals. However, danger looms as a group of human “horn hunters” arrives. Their leader, Count Butler, is a violin-playing man who consumes horns to gain strength, and he seeks to devour the island’s greatest treasure to inherit immense power. Can Luffy and the crew stop Count Butler’s scheme and save the island? And will they be able to show Momambi that not all pirates are the villains he believes them to be?','/9YFUMvTV4zOkpUsPAiPgjaMKWYd.jpg','2002-03-02',56,'Released','Tony T. Chopper, the new Animal King!','One Piece: Chopper\'s Kingdom in the Strange Animal Island',44725,3.4834,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22489,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997088',7.7,1790,'en','The Rape of Europa','World War II was not just the most destructive conflict in humanity, it was also the greatest theft in history: lives, families, communities, property, culture and heritage were all stolen. The story of Nazi Germany\'s plundering of Europe\'s great works of art during World War II and Allied efforts to minimize the damage.','/fAtPsP6gv2Fr1xz0cL6LD4CqjmM.jpg','2007-03-17',117,'Released','Imagine The World Without Our Masterpieces','The Rape of Europa',22905,1.3155,7.4,'tK55VI23uXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22490,_binary '\0','/dCZ7RhOIM1E0NEkowGNzDyFYw8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997147',6.2,4174,'ja','大日本人','Daisato, a second-rate, third-generation superhero, annoys his neighbors with the noise and destruction he causes on the job. But a heroic public image is the least of his concerns. Besides defending Japan from bizarre monsters, he must deal with an agent seeking to brand him with ads, a superhero grandfather with Alzheimer\'s and a family embarrassed by his incompetence.','/pT5ze3fjW8rYPVtqDyHSRNExHTq.jpg','2007-05-19',113,'Released',NULL,'Big Man Japan',11693,1.9346,6,'JTAoxSspBJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22491,_binary '\0','/dKJM7ASnbe2owv92S4OwtqBG8wl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997152',6.4,60262,'en','The Experiment','20 men are chosen to participate in the roles of guards and prisoners in a psychological study that ultimately spirals out of control.','/zy6hJYii2PJfMRoUBlULhfuLsgL.jpg','2010-07-15',96,'Released','They never imagined it would go this far','The Experiment',43549,5.8167,6.4,'Bi76npKs0X8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22492,_binary '\0','/sWnK3fEvYkCcefIDqEFGmVwiECA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997184',7.1,1859,'ja','天然コケッコー','Soyo, a student in a school with only six students, develops feelings for the new student, Hiromi, who has moved from Tokyo.','/2bm9KgW7o4vDXl7FyGc0WtgdmS0.jpg','2007-08-04',121,'Released',NULL,'A Gentle Breeze in the Village',83214,2.0734,7,'hJK7cBUd6p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22493,_binary '\0','/mqxLzkpj4aMDsFV2aBPYmJAZn1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997188',6.8,2672,'fi','Tummien perhosten koti','Haunted by his traumatic past and cautious about the prospects of an uncertain future, a fourteen year old boy named Juhani winds up in an isolated boys\' home known as The Island. Juhani has been shuttled between foster homes and temporary families for the past six years, leaving any prospect of stability in his life a faded dream. When Juhani winds up in a remote shelter for troubled youth known as The Island, he has little idea of how ruthless superintendent Olavi Harjula can truly be.','/9sIldYzYdooHVU2NaGVfp484mBR.jpg','2008-01-11',108,'Released','A past to forget - a future to find','The Home of Dark Butterflies',20548,1.1651,6,'Er4Zlsq47hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22494,_binary '\0','/qV5Ukl74Uo6i8W55YmXAN6PKzYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997229',6.6,2114,'ko','세븐 데이즈','A successful lawyer who, in order to save her daughter, is pressured into defending the innocence of a man slated to receive the death penalty.','/2C5ZLHaXk7vuckR9DW8bzG8UwFR.jpg','2007-11-14',125,'Released','Time is running out...','Seven Days',24822,1.8783,6.685,'5nW-BIGS39Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22495,_binary '\0','/mixKEc8cFWfssGjtjvyC5DSoovk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997246',7.9,12206,'fa','آواز گنجشک‌ها','When an ostrich-rancher focuses on replacing his daughter\'s hearing aid, which breaks right before crucial exams, everything changes for a struggling rural family in Iran. Karim motorbikes into a world alien to him - incredibly hectic Tehran, where sudden opportunities for independence, thrill and challenge him. But his honor and honesty, plus traditional authority over his inventive clan, are tested, as he stumbles among vast cultural and economic gaps between his village nestled in the desert, and a throbbing international metropolis.','/hPevXwgadyU6ce5F4CZY1XRfq3I.jpg','2008-10-01',96,'Released','Chasing dreams. Finding hope.','The Song of Sparrows',54254,1.8632,7.429,'je_cEzbR2u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22496,_binary '\0','/ntj3OWQ1up6FdnPcjeQDXbzQ0Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997263',6.4,2619,'en','Unmade Beds','Axl wants to find his long-lost father and rediscover his past. Vera just wants to forget hers as she tries to move on from heartbreak. Their stories come together in the melting-pot of 21st century London.','/gx7nLNLSgCJOvPhjP9bRLVEB8ma.jpg','2009-09-02',97,'Released','Bright lights, lost souls...','Unmade Beds',36115,1.4186,5.6,'ZA1iM5XcOwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22497,_binary '\0','/oPaDTUGaqIfUo40LangGZgeZBmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997274',7.3,2533,'ja','CLANNAD -クラナド-','Plagued by a seemingly endless stream of haunting dreams, Tomoya drifts through life with an almost overwhelming sense of anger and emptiness. Then, one fateful day, he meets the mysterious and beautiful Nagisa, and his world begins to change. While helping Nagisa revive the defunct Drama Club at their high school, Tomoya discovers that she has the same dreams. Their story starts beneath the cherry blossoms, but where will fate lead them?','/crJYdKEriRiyimMr5TUHxNW0XP5.jpg','2007-09-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Clannad: The Motion Picture',16516,3.3337,7.2,'lOWFsJpC7z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22498,_binary '\0','/d8XvcvtR1doG3aRsNKKyYS6GSmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0997282',5.2,2115,'sv','Solstorm','While in a party promoted by her chief and friend Måns Wenngren, the fiscal attorney, Rebecka Martinsson, receives a call from her former sister-in-law, Sanna Strandgård, telling that her brother and preacher Viktor was murdered, stabbed and with severed hands, and she would be arrested. Rebecka heads to her hometown Kiruna and defends Sanna, but the evidences found by the police in her house prove her guilty and she is arrested. While investigating the crime, Rebecka is haunted by her past and faces the bigoted and fanatic religious dwellers that worship the local church, and is more convinced of the innocence of Sanna.','/v7t0VsozxqgvH9sbTCRWCyqJBUn.jpg','2007-11-02',103,'Released',NULL,'Solstorm',39903,1.8367,5.3,'wpIWfodyZ-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22499,_binary '\0','/wnwK6gkKBJCjqFmZUnpKVZaNYHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0999864',6.5,2675,'it','Il 7 e l\'8','6th January 1975, in an infant nursery in Palermo (Italy), for a mysterious reason, a male nurse exchanges the labels of baby number 7 and 8. Thirty-one years later Tommaso (7) and Daniele (8) meet each other by accident.','/bI6iauRIdIHQMrKTa34Vn6UuGre.jpg','2007-03-16',93,'Released',NULL,'7 and 8',48175,1.7154,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22500,_binary '\0','/AaS3uD7RUMGMXdZzhI4ITa4aSMO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0999872',6.3,3093,'en','Christmas Cottage','Inspired by the picturesque paintings of Thomas Kinkade, The Christmas Cottage tells the semi-autobiographical tale of how a young boy is propelled to launch a career as an artist after he learns that his mother is in danger of losing the family home.','/xgVxmbD4mLtvelP8U5jbT7Rxjiv.jpg','2008-10-15',96,'Released','Love is the brightest light of all','Christmas Cottage',13610,2.5932,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22501,_binary '\0','/prrK4EH1WmCwwIMo2SpAOZDHV96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt0999913',5.9,38083,'en','Straw Dogs','A young couple moves to a quaint southern town. Soon their perfect getaway turns out to become a living hell when dark secrets and lethal passions spiral out of control.','/hSW5Msz5Cr6vUQxChPSPdxufnss.jpg','2011-09-16',110,'Released','Everyone has a breaking point.','Straw Dogs',64639,6.6705,5.936,'H_-fjojMBBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22502,_binary '\0','/ul2wwmdczRdwL0wFYlYD363oYJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000070',7.3,2024,'en','Billy & Mandy\'s Big Boogey Adventure','When the Boogey Man causes Grim to lose his powers, rank, and title in the Underworld Court for misusing his powers, he plots to seek out Horror\'s Hand and take over the world. It\'s up to Billy, Mandy, Irwin, and Grim to get to Horror\'s Hand before the Boogey Man does.','/nMWGHdVUrGQwo1SQ4JdDUv556L8.jpg','2007-02-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Billy & Mandy\'s Big Boogey Adventure',17305,3.0571,7.5,'aJ7zvnjU9Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22503,_binary '\0','/y9I6h1NrGdzX99QKcoqLhsFfVWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000095',5.9,3493,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター アドバンスジェネレーション ポケモンレンジャーと蒼海の王子 マナフィ','On their way through the Battle Frontier, Ash and friends meet up with a Pokémon Ranger who\'s mission is to deliever the egg of Manaphy to a temple on the ocean\'s floor. However, a greedy pirate wants the power of Manaphy to himself.','/jZOi06xHjsG1VqbiIwS8GkyrAOn.jpg','2006-07-15',105,'Released','It all started with a legend passed down from the people of the water','Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea',16808,4.0001,6.5,'jt1Ui72oBlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22504,_binary '\0','/hwzBIfrje4mGYC1WiPGee2ZDYI6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10003008',5.7,44033,'en','The Rental','Two couples on an oceanside getaway grow suspicious that the host of their seemingly perfect rental house may be spying on them. Before long, what should have been a celebratory weekend trip turns into something far more sinister.','/3ynPnBXQVT2Y0s19fDIPlWKUlxH.jpg','2020-07-23',88,'Released','Secluded getaway. Killer views.','The Rental',587496,8.2198,5.55,'MGdcTUMGxB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22505,_binary '\0','/v0bFTXnLNh9cjvpIckJpIM2t9nf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10004108',4.7,3031,'en','Sacrifice','Isaac and his pregnant wife visit a remote Norwegian village to claim an unexpected inheritance. The couple finds themselves caught in a nightmare when they encounter a sinister cult that worships a sea-dwelling deity.','/xXI5Lg6mJLEesTggRJBrq50vrqU.jpg','2021-02-09',87,'Released','Dream Well','Sacrifice',631583,2.2001,4.5,'igUyQPawlps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22506,_binary '\0','/8C4V55AosFZ8eX0ZoyIWZ3bdZo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10004368',7,1582,'pl','Jak najdalej stąd','Ola sets off to Ireland to bring her father\'s body back to Poland after he dies in a building site accident. But never mind her dad, Ola wants to know if he had saved money for the car he had promised her. Dealing with foreign bureaucracy in her own streetwise way, Ola will get to know her father.','/11B50N0J0BHBdvB8SYOa6krouNS.jpg','2020-09-25',98,'Released','Sometimes it takes a death to understand a life.','I Never Cry',736225,1.5615,6.833,'cIuouvN8tWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22507,_binary '\0','/uuCj46exjP6UOo976MAWACWFv1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10006006',5.4,8907,'en','A Christmas Prince: The Royal Baby','Christmas brings the ultimate gift to Aldovia: a royal baby. But first, Queen Amber must help her family and kingdom by finding a missing peace treaty.','/4RErLw0APt8qQiee0d8VCKasWwl.jpg','2019-12-05',85,'Released','Baby Makes 3','A Christmas Prince: The Royal Baby',587693,2.8375,6.3,'RK0zCsxBG3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22508,_binary '\0','/y1wd7YlAmYVnS45x2kK9ryydixM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000764',7.9,5188,'en','Louis Theroux: The Most Hated Family in America','Louis meets the Phelps family — the people at the heart of the controversial Westboro Baptist Church. The Phelps have rabid anti-homosexual beliefs, and often campaign at the funerals of American soldiers. They believe that every tragedy in the world is God\'s punishment for homosexuality.','/yniNmsxw0xcgpNZW2EmfsrgzGuU.jpg','2007-04-24',60,'Released','Meet the Westboro Baptist Church','Louis Theroux: The Most Hated Family in America',63581,1.515,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22509,_binary '\0','/qFD7K9A6ZjHZbQ2VCTSWdT8lg3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000769',7.2,1794,'en','Prince of Broadway','A New York street hustler specializing in name-brand knock-offs finds his highly profitable game suddenly complicated when his ex-girlfriend shows up toting the son he never knew he had.','/6rcVFsEwOyXsG0e7L9ql6KEPGJX.jpg','2010-09-03',102,'Released','It\'s a hard knock-off life.','Prince of Broadway',87081,1.4423,6.741,'OlXMjgxjO84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22510,_binary '\0','/ri49L0eo6bShmOydcZu63RJbUdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000771',7.3,14309,'en','Recount','In 2000, the election of the U.S. Presidential boiled down to a few precious votes in the state of Florida — and a recount that would add \"hanging chad\" to every American\'s vocabulary.','/7I3WMof3AJuLkildBxpGZkuvQwj.jpg','2008-05-25',116,'Released','The future of the nation was hanging by a... chad.','Recount',14050,2.8308,6.799,'GVd1LuadnDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22511,_binary '\0','/osHKguxvXPIUJJzsO3DEORZZ8QD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1000774',5.7,134160,'en','Sex and the City','When Carrie\'s big step forward in her relationship goes awry, best friends Charlotte, Miranda and Samantha are there to help her pick up the pieces.','/AhNfnsGW95RKHQNLdgFH48UN0Zy.jpg','2008-05-12',146,'Released','Get Carried away.','Sex and the City',4564,13.6984,6.537,'8lofhd7Ubnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22512,_binary '\0','/px3rRG4Rwlx4IoWLphCzCR0Q4Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10008784',6.3,4213,'en','Bull','In a near-abandoned subdivision west of Houston, a wayward teen runs headlong into her equally willful and unforgiving neighbor, an aging bullfighter who\'s seen his best days in the arena; it\'s a collision that will change them both.','/tLyntMhWx9ywJOmw78YOX3lt7ye.jpg','2020-08-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Bull',595940,1.5395,6.2,'ZmO7rbB-VfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22513,_binary '\0','/iFaqCE6XK7bpduXNBGSs1jOvVW5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10009030',5.9,3861,'en