,6.4,1327,'es','Máncora','Following the suicide of his father, haunted by inner demons and his hatred for the world, Santiago decides to escape from Lima and take refuge in Máncora, a beach to the north of Peru where it is always summer.','/bgBBMJIEiTWDKuYZAqSQl9V5FKp.jpg','2009-03-20',100,'Released','Sometimes paradise has a price.','Máncora',56948,1.2478,5.2,'9GCL6nqfFW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22548,_binary '\0','/hvIwXxtPjR3BuibN3BiY7GX7XYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1003034',6.3,8215,'en','Perrier\'s Bounty','A gangster named Perrier looks to exact his revenge on a trio of fugitives responsible for the accidental death of one of his cronies.','/rZnWNxcIFNaTdshmkaFkmFkpQsB.jpg','2010-03-18',88,'Released','Blood is thicker than water. Nothing is thicker than thieves.','Perrier\'s Bounty',41009,2.7016,5.787,'v9Sl9y29wCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22549,_binary '\0','/88LtzhMzoWeXUnI558rBoHy0t5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1003052',6.3,3910,'fr','Secret Défense','In France, terrorist groups and intelligence agencies battle in a merciless war everyday, in the name of radically opposed ideologies. Yet, terrorist and secret agents lead almost the same lives. Condemned to secrecy, these masters of manipulation follow the same methods. Alex and Al Barad are two of them. The former is the head of the D.G.S.E.\'s (Direction Générale de la Sécurité Extérieure, the French equivalent of the CIA or the MI6) counter-terrorism unit while the latter reigns over a terrorist network, and both fight using the most ruthless of weapons: human beings.','/zE8Jxg6hUZW6YGkfUS1tj78u08l.jpg','2008-12-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of State',18940,2.2941,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22550,_binary '\0','/evUhOMCfzM6fGhGnpcUYHnYyshJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1003080',5.3,4241,'ru','Зелёный слоник','Two Russian prisoners are abused mentally and physically.','/ziIQkTkfG2kSBFDWDva7XAao47.jpg','1999-12-07',87,'Released',NULL,'The Green Elephant',132030,2.7576,5.791,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22551,_binary '\0','/bxSBOAD8AuMHYMdW3jso9npAkgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10032342',7.7,1387,'es','Cosas imposibles','After the death of her abusive husband, Matilde finds her new best friend in Miguel, her young, insecure, and disoriented neighbor.','/t2Ew8NZ8Ci2kqmoecZUNQUFDJnQ.jpg','2021-06-17',88,'Released','There are encounters that change your life','Impossible Things',667257,6.1729,8.446,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22552,_binary '\0','/dJR6dZJHXcXOBbNkVzsjuquWFU4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10037014',6,11690,'en','Fear of Rain','A teenage girl living with schizophrenia begins to suspect her neighbor has kidnapped a child. Her parents try desperately to help her live a normal life, without exposing their own tragic secrets, and the only person who believes her is Caleb – a boy she isn’t even sure exists.','/5hmaACPJfI2M0v38DeltW3dSggT.jpg','2021-02-12',109,'Released','Some voices you can\'t outrun.','Fear of Rain',599281,5.2275,6.9,'jFxOxLLzjG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22553,_binary '\0','/jGq40i1j9lrxt6HVKLFKSqREjXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10039344',5.4,54415,'en','Countdown','A young nurse downloads an app that tells her she only has three days to live. With time ticking away and a mysterious figure haunting her, she must find a way to save her life before time runs out.','/qCDPKUMX5xrxxQY8XhGVCKO3fks.jpg','2019-10-24',90,'Released','Death? There\'s an app for that.','Countdown',599975,10.4295,6.209,'S6O4iy3Twwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22554,_binary '\0','/2fy54PBr20kMC9myipOJVIjuzow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10045434',6.9,2535,'tr','Kapı','Yakup and Şemsa are Assyrians living in Berlin with their three children and grandchildren. Twenty-five years ago they migrated from Mardin to Berlin. One day they receive a phone call from Mardin. This unexpected call deals with their son Mikhael, whom they lost twenty-five years ago. All the suffering of the family is refreshed. Yakup and Şemsa go to Mardin with their grandchildren, Nardin, who do not want to leave them alone. This trip will be the beginning of all their personal journeys. When the craftsman Yakup, who had not come for years, abandoned his village and saw his house looted; He will go after his house door. On his journey of finding the door, he will be accompanied by her granddaughter Nardin and the smuggler Remzi.','/lFqKxeNVDJBhSQTMld8cswDfUXi.jpg','2019-09-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Opening the Door',595171,0.8826,5.4,'P8_qxept2VE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22555,_binary '\0','/4ayyIZEt0IIzcR9CyfSiKK7XRvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10047958',3.5,4801,'en','Bad President','This black comedy answers the question that has obsessed America and the world since November 08, 2016. How did Donald Trump become President of the United States?','/4hkIjnCGz0DuHl8HQEltGJiuQp3.jpg','2020-10-13',90,'Released','Make comedy great again.','Bad President',750101,0.9715,3.9,'PGoXOi4UpxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22556,_binary '\0','/71QShuRVcS1talu2CxhMXTwGd6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10050766',7.7,1951,'en','Brené Brown: The Call to Courage','Brené Brown is a research professor at the University of Houston Graduate College of Social Work. She has spent more than a decade studying vulnerability, courage, authenticity and shame. With two TED talks under her belt, Brené Brown brings her humor and empathy to Netflix to discuss what it takes to choose courage over comfort in a culture defined by scarcity, fear and uncertainty.','/cnjzskLPzbQiQCwJGRt05FFTUpH.jpg','2019-04-19',76,'Released',NULL,'Brené Brown: The Call to Courage',596204,1.1659,7.2,'gr-WvA7uFDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22557,_binary '\0','/6E12GMPxBBbeo4P9wkOdTGOIdZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10050782',7.1,1664,'en','Grass Is Greener','Weed. Marijuana. Grass. Pot. Whatever you prefer to call it, America’s relationship with cannabis is a complicated one. In his directorial debut, hip hop pioneer Fab 5 Freddy presents an unparalleled look at the racially biased history of the war on marijuana. A range of celebrities and experts discuss the plant’s influence on music and popular culture, and the devastating impact its criminalization has had on Black and Latino communities. As more and more states join the push to legalize marijuana, this documentary dives deep into the glaring racial disparities in the growing cannabis market.','/mmOzTN4DFjtswjx5zb3mJc5e2Ah.jpg','2019-04-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Grass Is Greener',589871,1.3656,6.7,'IET4K5npNOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22558,_binary '\0','/ltEBcy1KzBmSlZbkIbzfPGtQ3FE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10054316',4.4,2893,'en','Guest House','A newly engaged couple finds the home of their dreams and it quickly becomes a nightmare when the previous owner\'s friend continues squatting in their guest house. It leads to a turf war that ultimately ruins their house, their marriage and their lives.','/joSZjIzoXWqdtb2tRGlIlibscv8.jpg','2020-09-04',84,'Released','They\'re kicking him to the curb. He\'s just kicking back.','Guest House',594084,2.6674,5.3,'yoXFhob6AmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22559,_binary '\0','/iamS2MqyuJCuNDCly3Mrr5Mlw5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10055546',5.4,1730,'fi','Supercool','Best friends, Neil and Gilbert start their senior year of high school with high hopes and aspirations. Neil has always fantasized about being cool enough to date his long time crush and Gilbert has always dreamed of being a social media super star. After what is, by all accounts, a very disappointing and embarrassing first day in school, Neil makes a magical wish to be cool just at the magical moment when the clock strikes 11:11. The next morning, Neil wakes up to a reality that is straight from the comics of his dreams.','/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg','2021-07-02',91,'Released','One cool wish is all it takes','Supercool',514466,2.3896,5.7,'XViu4tzzQ-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22560,_binary '\0','/5Ohp73uKlQly1TWZ7D4Asfmwx9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10055770',7.1,2028,'ta','வெள்ளைப்பூக்கள்','A retired cop goes to the US to live with his son and becomes involved with a kidnapping case. Even as he is trying to track down the kidnapper, the case becomes too personal.','/luD1w7nim7jejDlOBYkX7ARBLhB.jpg','2019-04-19',130,'Released',NULL,'Vellai Pookal',592675,0.8729,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22561,_binary '\0','/wXk9y36eTmNl6XwEuOfw6yNNClr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10059518',6,88176,'en','Unhinged','Rachel is a divorced single mother whose bad day gets even worse. She\'s running late to drop her son off at school when she honks her horn impatiently at a fellow driver during rush-hour traffic. After an exchange of words, she soon realizes that the mysterious man is following her and her young son in his truck. A case of road rage quickly escalates, at horrifyingly psychotic proportions, into full-blown terror as Rachel discovers the psychopath\'s sinister plan for revenge. He is single-mindedly determined to teach her a deadly lesson.','/xfIcONZO4AiWpzm3jEpbR4llzVX.jpg','2020-07-16',90,'Released','He can happen to anyone.','Unhinged',625568,7.2188,6.424,'vNJ0szhjvdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22562,_binary '\0','/YZMpzCAQ8Ljnq2XOWkWOasexsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10060094',5.6,22685,'en','The Knight Before Christmas','A medieval English knight is magically transported to present day where he ends up falling for a high school science teacher.','/ivymBQYzYqZoLhvgYg77gSzXKsA.jpg','2019-11-21',92,'Released','A modern day romance with a medieval twist.','The Knight Before Christmas',611207,4.5436,6.4,'-JtwROpSVWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22563,_binary '\0','/oC6pfvQ7YTrOJxstrA6x59k4308.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10062338',5.3,1864,'en','Earwig','Somewhere in Europe, mid-20th century. Albert is employed to look after Mia, a girl with teeth of ice. Mia never leaves their apartment, where the shutters are always closed. The telephone rings regularly and the Master enquires after Mia\'s wellbeing. Until the day Albert is instructed that he must prepare the child to leave.','/jW8OX7yyNDUO7loiYUYmSoGLWnZ.jpg','2022-06-15',114,'Released',NULL,'Earwig',657826,1.253,5.5,'ri22ywNW26E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22564,_binary '\0','/Aoq4QMrrBJcFt6WQcwj6px2LXQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10062556',4.2,26576,'hi','भुज: द प्राइड ऑफ इंडिया','Set in the backdrop of the 1971 Indo-Pakistan War, the film tells the story of the IAF Squadron Leader Vijay Karnik, and his bravery, patriotism and determination.','/zc0OzUOF8B4x4AH4bubxw0mHCnF.jpg','2021-08-13',113,'Released','The greatest battle ever fought','Bhuj: The Pride of India',590397,1.391,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22565,_binary '\0','/t7yjtDJXAxc0p5awbRGoWCOewsm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10062614',5.4,5019,'hi','Guilty','A young woman from a small town accuses the college heartthrob of sexual assault.','/3bt9PrQqQv1Wtk2RaS74JjgarIQ.jpg','2020-03-06',119,'Released',NULL,'Guilty',675592,1.2707,6.6,'6sQ85MrpOPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22566,_binary '\0','/vSZOMuSfXScuxExCtxZsDIFDQCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10065694',5.8,32119,'en','Antebellum','Successful author Veronica finds herself trapped in a horrifying reality and must uncover the mind-bending mystery before it\'s too late.','/irkse1FMm9dWemwlxKJ7RINT9Iy.jpg','2020-09-02',106,'Released','If it chooses you, nothing can save you.','Antebellum',627290,5.7935,6.3,'7MPib67BDHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22567,_b