apher almost gets him killed, he goes to Palermo, Sicily to take a break. Can the beautiful city and a beautiful local woman calm him down?','/hDTuyypuDHngXat0tt49wYoBBXg.jpg','2008-11-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Palermo Shooting',8886,2.0541,6.1,'nD8o4lrsKvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22582,_binary '\0','/6cqogY7SYppI0ZNchaTKszSkxwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10080270',5.8,1790,'es','En brazos de un asesino','Victor (William Levy) is one of the world’s most handsome men, but he has a deep secret – he is a cold blooded assassin. Smooth talking and seductive, Victor was raised to do one thing only, which is to kill for money. When he is sent to the home of a brutal drug lord to collect payment for his most recent hit, he encounters the beautiful Sarai (Alicia Sanz), who has been forced to spend the last 9 years of her life with the drug lord.','/vOF2dVniPoc2Y5yVG1F3GvbP4Y9.jpg','2019-12-06',101,'Released',NULL,'In the Arms of an Assassin',652722,2.772,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22583,_binary '\0','/mBijGSEEkIVt24ruvTxFuQWRKJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10081762',6.1,7082,'sv','Breaking Surface','Two Swedish/Norwegian half sisters go on a winter diving trip in Northern Norway, when they get trapped after a rockslide.','/zlOvKg5WkXcwcmqy2KaiXoXLAky.jpg','2020-02-14',82,'Released','There is only you','Breaking Surface',616803,4.1501,6.652,'SRrTJ5BLx6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22584,_binary '\0','/c8r7AYVoX2RCp3WtguXisbFMMAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10083174',4.2,5507,'en','The Stairs','In 1997, 11-year-old Jesse finds a mysterious staircase in the woods and disappears - - 20 years later, a group of hikers sets off into the very same woods. Unfortunately for them, they come face-to-face with the very same set of stairs...','/hsOG8D1e9aeE6a2qkqmEF6zzq7J.jpg','2021-02-26',92,'Released',NULL,'The Stairs',800748,1.4342,4,'Zd6Iuy78e4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21: