s, fields and car-parks of Northern Ireland. Made with unprecedented access, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH is an up-close and personal portrait from the trenches of production, following the crew and the cast as they contend with extreme weather, punishing deadlines and an ever-excited fandom hungry for spoilers. Much more than a “making of” documentary, this is a funny, heartbreaking story, told with wit and intimacy, about the bittersweet pleasures of what it means to create a world – and then have to say goodbye to it.','/tVyKpOYDtKzs4SOYCbZn4YNFWHI.jpg','2019-05-26',115,'Released','A farewell to Westeros with the people who built the realm','Game of Thrones: The Last Watch',591278,5.7453,7,'9K7c0jXkaGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22592,_binary '\0','/1NSjj7AnAbAUXHAJv3a14yC3h4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10091530',5,3477,'en','Holiday Rush','After his sudden firing, a popular radio DJ moves in with his aunt, bringing along his four spoiled children, and a plan to return to the airwaves.','/ccL8XtMJSAl5VRoOdyKn7Cd0QA2.jpg','2019-11-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Holiday Rush',639609,2.3888,5.6,'c2U6diYTnxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22593,_binary '\0','/5xiAQ1b9HNSRCf510Dw1qCdYy4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10091696',4.3,1447,'en','Dybbuk Box: True Story of Chris Chambers','The encounters recorded by Chris Chambers have been studied by industry professionals and proven to be accurate recorded paranormal accounts. Currently documented as one of the most supernatural recorded events to date.','/e8V11mOV7BFTu6WS6D15IjfU52L.jpg','2019-05-15',60,'Released','Currently documented as one of the most supernatural recorded events to date','Dybbuk Box: True Story of Chris Chambers',606960,0.9938,4.4,'qBVcpeThzoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22594,_binary '\0','/e4bxrONDwldFb8eUgwdRHBDoneh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10092170',6.1,1442,'en','The Line','Tom, a passionate ‘brother’ 