00','tt10098288',4.3,11647,'hi','रूही','In a fictional North Indian town, two boys Bhaura and Kattanni are stuck in a forest with Roohi. But there’s an insidious spirit following them with feet turned backwards.','/10kCy34fbgU9nI5ScfMcCGebNgo.jpg','2021-03-11',134,'Released',NULL,'Roohi',694103,2.1534,4.393,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22602,_binary '\0','/m42PtAhEtEqbNV8Cs8TsXcTN4ha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10098448',7.1,16923,'en','Jesus Revolution','In the 1970s, aimless teenager Greg Laurie searches for all the right things in all the wrong places until he meets Lonnie Frisbee, a charismatic hippie/street preacher. Together with local pastor Chuck Smith, they open the doors of a languishing church to an unexpected revival.','/A3qqrl8lJvlpRCwkbUEADXzVaDC.jpg','2023-02-23',120,'Released','When you open your heart...there\'s room for everyone.','Jesus Revolution',719256,7.6098,6.9,'8vmHFvnjPDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22603,_binary '\0','/1wZoVT9RJsZmNjg8CecXqSgFUd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1010048',8,915459,'en','Slumdog Millionaire','A teenager reflects on his life after being accused of cheating on the Indian version of \"Who Wants to be a Millionaire?\".','/5leCCi7ZF0CawAfM5Qo2ECKPprc.jpg','2008-11-12',121,'Released','What does it take to find a lost love?','Slumdog Millionaire',12405,14.4786,7.726,'AIzbwV7on6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22604,_binary '\0','/hiUY16irOAebelGeATnlF7Tcjmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1010055',5.9,2137,'ja','ヤッターマン','Gan and his girlfriend Ai are mild-mannered toy shop owners by day but, when evil lurks, they transform into superheroes Yatterman 1 & 2. With the help of a dog-shaped robot, Yatterwoof, they take on the Doronbow gang, lead by the sexy Lady Doronjo. Together, they must stop the evil gang from finding the four magical skull pieces that will allow them to control the world!','/s3ig9QssXPf64Telz4wmMe93jFA.jpg','2009-02-06'