tivist for gay rights and inspires others to join him in his fight for equal rights that should be available to all Americans.','/ot4ImF4b7QbS6XsTdMH3pWxNmX2.jpg','2008-11-05',128,'Released','Never blend in.','Milk',10139,5.5531,7.212,'0rMzrruIIm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22643,_binary '\0','/Avrq28yMYjCjDIYtus01bsbsdkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1013856',6.2,1908,'pt','Singularidades de uma Rapariga Loura','On a train to Algarve, a young man recounts to a fellow passenger his past relationship with an eccentric young woman.','/fQfRqJH8OAR5WcFeBqkwnOkQIKm.jpg','2009-04-30',64,'Released',NULL,'Eccentricities of a Blonde-Haired Girl',44411,1.9641,6.2,'8qZrxtE-TmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22644,_binary '\0','/mbxu6J4qZ69JWNKITrHiR60IXx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1013860',5.1,16178,'en','Dylan Dog: Dead of Night','Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.','/nZdYn5IktnGVg7pRA2JHD1rdZDH.jpg','2011-03-16',107,'Released','No pulse? No problem','Dylan Dog: Dead of Night',43935,3.6765,4.773,'_mqp4QA9Om0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22645,_binary '\0','/41yQLOPAG2H9IIRbVQh58PYjDFC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014079',5,1399,'ar','كتكوت','While escaping being forced to present himself for sacrifice to redeem his family, Katkout is discovered by a National Security Agency who find he bears a strong resemblance to Yousef Khoury, the international terrorist. He is then persuaded him to enter a training mission that will allow him to impersonate Yousef Khoury.','/dDb2307qbRNgiT8UHnmUZPLc6fa.jpg','2006-08-08',125,'Released',NULL,'Katkout',376487,1.2718,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22646,_binary '\0','/ad8fgh4JYGXkPHPW7IwCKrNXuFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10143498',6.3,2721,'fr','Mon chien stupide','Henri is a middle-aged writer with fading inspiration who has published nothing worthy of note in years. Feeling increasingly misunderstood by his wife and four grown up deadbeat kids, he dreams of running away to start over again. Yet when he discovers an unattractive, bad-mannered dog in his garden, he decides to adopt him and both start developing an unexpected friendship that inevitably upsets Henri’s family and neighbors.','/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg','2019-10-30',106,'Released','You Don\'t Choose Your Family, Or Your Dog.','My Dog Stupid',536506,3.5054,6,'JDAqNdWLTwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22647,_binary '\0','/q24PFUkXci5bqFrnbp4QM8dc2TU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10145122',6.6,8892,'de','Das perfekte Geheimnis','Seven friends - three women and four men - meet for dinner. Everyone should put their cell phone on the table. No matter what message comes in - anyone can read it and listen to the phone calls. However, this leads to a lot of chaos.','/ej8QuSK03YmF3VojH6h2pI7aJIf.jpg','2019-10-31',111,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Secret',620881,2.0359,6.5,'FlqjqR8ymGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22648,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014672',7.6,12803,'hi','भेजा फ्राई','Ranjeet Thadani is a bored and arrogant music producer who along with his friends hosts a party every Friday where they invite an \'idiot\' to ridicule them and have fun at their expense. One day, he invites Bharat Bhushan, a kind hearted yet annoying Income Tax inspector, who ends up messing things for people when he tries to help them who makes Ranjeet regret inviting him.','/2Wqlcf63EvabGzVffPppfpWlx2B.jpg','2007-04-13',95,'Released','Ranjit, who makes fun of idiots, gets completely annoyed when he invites a tax inspector and a singer to his house.','Bheja Fry',15411,1.096,6.594,'W_DrlzzPiFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22649,_binary '\0','/q5qNDQV34vDBxQMFhuWuCJAkHYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10147382',6.3,2558,'zh','我和我的祖国','Anthology of short films directed by several different directors.','/dsOn5Wd1AfTTh4TDLn14cIPrgzQ.jpg','2019-09-30',154,'Released',NULL,'My People, My Country',612845,2.1983,6.5,'bvrJS1LL_HY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22650,_binary '\0','/rfqUYH6gav0P2uwvSSwjahAwzwk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10147546',7.6,8484,'en','HOMECOMING: A film by Beyoncé','This intimate, in-depth look at Beyoncé\'s celebrated 2018 Coachella performance reveals the emotional road from creative concept to cultural movement.','/nKdP4K3Bj3qnjtDCq9lTg7UOHVy.jpg','2019-04-16',137,'Released',NULL,'HOMECOMING: A film by Beyoncé',593691,3.8383,8,'fB8qvx0HOlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22651,_binary '\0','/cVRI4BHo4egESBdWkIfdDJGZ2Hb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10147580',5.7,3295,'no','Tre nøtter til Askepott','Cinderella, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother\'s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she\'s granted a single wish for each one of them.','/4kqH4d9FBQv5Sel39Ns7TMd13RT.jpg','2021-11-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Three Wishes for Cinderella',660262,5.0602,6.9,'B0KR3Axi6fA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22652,_binary '\0','/ocOWbTzHcJVTw9Tz173KPeskDOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014759',6.4,472582,'en','Alice in Wonderland','Alice, now 19 years old, returns to the whimsical world she first entered as a child and embarks on a journey to discover her true destiny.','/o0kre9wRCZz3jjSjaru7QU0UtFz.jpg','2010-03-03',108,'Released','You\'re invited to a very important date.','Alice in Wonderland',12155,27.9746,6.642,'9POCgSRVvf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22653,_binary '\0','/1WKtWXw6yfi5yGknLSvmJLhLa0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014762',8.5,23357,'fr','Home','In 200,000 years of existence, man has upset the balance on which the Earth had lived for 4 billion years. Global warming, resource depletion, species extinction: man has endangered his own home. But it is too late to be pessimistic: humanity has barely ten years left to reverse the trend, become aware of its excessive exploitation of the Earth\'s riches, and change its consumption pattern.','/2Ph0vzTiORSSlYjsXLFM1OZHkI8.jpg','2009-06-03',95,'Released','A stunning visual portrayal of Earth','Home',62320,3.399,7.807,'RoLYZf-1E8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22654,_binary '\0','/sjsaxwNsgBbrWrJIXtCT5DNo9Mt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014763',6.4,80276,'en','Child 44','Set in Stalin-era Soviet Union, a disgraced MGB agent is dispatched to investigate a series of child murders -- a case that begins to connect with the very top of party leadership.','/xDlRanz2LwuKrPbcbVtwQCtvP5W.jpg','2015-03-15',137,'Released','How do you find a killer who doesn’t exist?','Child 44',181283,11.883,6.3,'Uia6y9SRsj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22655,_binary '\0','/sVBJsi0xuQ79qm9IUPzAKmbPnP3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014774',7.1,2632,'en','A Shine of Rainbows','An orphaned boy named Tomás is adopted by Maire O’Donnell to live on a whimsical Irish isle filled with new friends, secret caves and a lost baby pup seal stranded on the coast. But when Maire\'s reluctant husband Alec refuses to accept Tomás as his own son, the boy drifts down a fateful path of adventure and self-discovery, illuminating how rainbows can shine around - and within - us all.','/9FWxI20tzm9LuP3KT9cbmp5YN6Q.jpg','2009-10-01',101,'Released','An abandoned child brings the colors of love into their lives.','A Shine of Rainbows',37206,2.5052,6.446,'T3UiG6AXKrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22656,_binary '\0','/vKCiYKgTYVlsDaecEKFOYG7ZM15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014775',4,27772,'en','Beverly Hills Chihuahua','A pampered Beverly Hills chihuahua named Chloe who, while on vacation in Mexico with her owner Viv\'s niece, Rachel, gets lost and must rely on her friends to help her get back home before she is caught by a dognapper who wants to ransom her.','/2aRvqtLoE06hTjG93lASvO7r1as.jpg','2008-10-03',91,'Released','50% Warrior. 50% Lover. 100% Chihuahua.','Beverly Hills Chihuahua',14405,6.0305,5.4,'sXvSEVO1Heo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22657,_binary '\0','/zhHOhLmO3rx4pcJRFTjpJ2uFlFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10147910',5.6,1407,'th','สาวลับใช้','Joy is the new maid of a royal house, whose previous maid disappeared under mysterious circumstances and is now haunting and terrorizing the family. Joy works to uncover the reason behind the former maid\'s disappearance.','/6ttn2RPsJxNom7XsDg16cuH5a6O.jpg','2020-07-13',102,'Released','Dark secrets serve no one.','The Maid',709717,2.249,5.8,'xrGgOLAvMss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22658,_binary '\0','/cZMToH66ApCtzuZ58O9S7j5bZfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014806',6.2,6296,'en','The Poker House','Agnes and her two sisters struggle through a day in a home overrun by gamblers, thieves, and johns.','/yTaqEbszsqhunQIjIMkkfwNMiiv.jpg','2008-06-20',93,'Released','Lust, drugs and violence... no place for a kid.','The Poker House',63287,3.0978,6.2,'fbJOR5XHSN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22659,_binary '\0','/tTOYeamnYF9K0u7y1yj209H6Nad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1014809',7,7186,'en','Until the Light Takes Us','Chronicles the history, ideology and aesthetic of Norwegian black metal, a musical subculture infamous as much for a series of murders and church arsons as it is for its unique musical and visual aesthetics. This is the first film to truly shed light on a movement that has heretofore been shrouded by rumor and obscured by inaccurate and shallow depictions. Featuring exclusive interviews with the musicians themselves, Until the Light Takes Us explores every aspect of the controversial movement that has captured the attention of the world.','/sPg2fepwnhGzhRbVZ7bYoneOYaK