s, this collection of vignettes captures the follies of several men as they fumble with fidelity and relationships.','/nCATbnGxYI271PyDPVjzbpm2sxD.jpg','2020-07-15',88,'Released',NULL,'The Players',608649,2.5028,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22693,_binary '\0','/1jXebnKdnb580YOzGuyhuujSGbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10171472',6.4,8445,'en','Goodrich','Andy Goodrich\'s life is upended when his wife enters a rehab program, leaving him on his own with their young kids. Goodrich leans on his daughter from his first marriage, Grace, as he ultimately evolves into the father Grace never had.','/silxnsoelZ0qXp4Bm2spBY949iP.jpg','2024-10-17',111,'Released','If life isn\'t kicking your ass, it\'s not doing its job.','Goodrich',1088096,4.5424,6.386,'89EEdQKTfA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22694,_binary '\0','/qrnwOY3hpu3oVUUYKRgWJxTtMQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10172266',7,67611,'en','Red, White & Royal Blue','After an altercation between Alex, the president\'s son, and Britain\'s Prince Henry at a royal event becomes tabloid fodder, their long-running feud now threatens to drive a wedge in U.S./British relations. When the rivals are forced into a staged truce, their icy relationship begins to thaw and the friction between them sparks something deeper than they ever expected.','/dD3vhyDRCCT90hf4rldHU6Wu3Va.jpg','2023-07-27',118,'Released','Love who you want. It\'s good foreign policy.','Red, White & Royal Blue',930094,19.5384,7.9,'pt56IC8gDZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22695,_binary '\0','/ftbb1caDooPJnCrCq6k1kga6S83.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017428',7.3,1864,'en','Captain Abu Raed','Abu Raed is an old airport janitor who has always yearned to travel the world but has never been able to afford it. One day, he finds an old discarded pilot\'s hat, and discovers a calling: a group of children in his poor neighborhood assume he\'s an airline captain and beg him to share stories of the world outside of Amman, Jordan. Through imaginary tales, a friendship forms, and Abu Raed is soon faced with the grim realities of the children\'s home life. Thus he takes it upon himself to make a difference in their lives.','/f3mBW8AR5y6at3jj7FyLgMvBqGO.jpg','2008-02-06',102,'Released','A humanistic triumph...','Captain Abu Raed',35637,1.3783,7.6,'sNMNp8-VhMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22696,_binary '\0','/jW0qxSKoyeyPnEov9nZZeiybwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017451',6.5,52900,'en','The Runaways','Joan Jett and Cherie Currie, two rebellious teenagers from Southern California, become the frontwomen for The Runaways -- the now-legendary group that paved the way for future generations of female rockers. Under the Svengali-like influence of impresario Kim Fowley, the band becomes a huge success.','/byeTXKg9paqiFQbtfI28FOIhebg.jpg','2010-03-19',107,'Released','It\'s 1975 and they\'re about to explode.','The Runaways',27586,3.302,6.5,'39qrViRxCqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22697,_binary '\0','/adXrYSpn7enPPsKpe6YMRX5qQww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017456',6.7,17458,'hi','Race','Action-thriller about two brothers, Ranvir and Rajiv, whose rivalry in the world of horse racing turns into a deadly game of betrayal, greed, and revenge, investigated by Inspector Robert D\'Costa.','/krMI3hRmlgKcuNc3XBWtl8APasR.jpg','2008-03-20',161,'Released','Two Brothers... One Plays to Win... One Plays to Defeat','Race',19658,2.3022,6.1,'0vSsBXtD-EE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22698,_binary '\0','/pjocJEjenTiJOi6o1vG8JArgt1h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017460',5.8,107191,'en','Splice','Elsa and Clive, two young rebellious scientists, defy legal and ethical boundaries and forge ahead with a dangerous experiment: splicing together human and animal DNA to create a new organism. Named \"Dren\", the creature rapidly develops from a deformed female infant into a beautiful but dangerous winged human-chimera, who forges a bond with both of her creators - only to have that bond turn deadly.','/4oqaWnO3dKYAt3vZWAD4oLfOXOC.jpg','2010-06-03',104,'Released','She\'s not human...not entirely.','Splice',37707,7.3691,5.876,'NL3Glfcx4_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22699,_binary '\0','/A4PlSROl7LMLWgQMgeJXFd5il5U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017464',5.4,8717,'en','The Tortured','An upper-middle-class couple\'s life is destroyed when their only child is kidnapped and killed. Obsessed with revenge, the couple seizes an opportunity to kidnap the killer.','/s5kXFJaRYaR0KEROXhWlQaM7Wje.jpg','2010-06-15',78,'Released','How far would you go?','The Tortured',47518,2.3961,5.3,'CdEfmMlpq1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22700,_binary '\0','/siidi1AD6JNwWqrepY5DhqCCuEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1017465',5.7,6653,'en','Twitches Too','Reunited witch twins Camryn and Alex adjust to their new life as supernatural beings while at the same time trying to maintain a normal existence in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches. But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces of darkness that threaten to destroy their world. Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.','/70aurzbqFMuJnwhIVW2aXeyzBAp.jpg','2007-10-12',83,'Released',NULL,'Twitches Too',46169,7.776,6.7,'W4ruy5AYbkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22701,_binary '\0','/tRnMeKhKOU4jdwbmUDF5smu4kHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10176734',6.6,1220,'en','A Storybook Christmas','If event planner Celeste Everett is going to save her business and give her niece a happy Christmas season, she is going to need help. When the nanny she hires turns out to be a man, Celeste surprisingly realizes she may have also found Christmas love for herself.','/uSuwoiwP6HVCEG7vyyCPWbMydXn.jpg','2019-11-04',90,'Released',NULL,'A Storybook Christmas',615585,1.4962,6.5,'yZzq_WgVk9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22702,_binary '\0','/z2yawpS9dv25HOif1oR6SlFORid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10182822',6.7,8420,'it','Loro','Internationally released Director\'s Cut of \"Loro 1\" and \"Loro 2\", which were released separately as two movies in Italy. The film talks about the group of businessmen and politicians – the Loro (Them) from the title – who live and act near to media tycoon and politician Silvio Berlusconi in the years between 2006 and 2009.','/yAogxeovs5HpzhD4UbrDsSybtp7.jpg','2018-09-13',157,'Released','Welcome to the party.','Loro',541660,2.9297,6.7,'0SC9H6LnZxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22703,_binary '\0','/tuqv0jb0o7sBOivgkagKJHuO6X4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10183816',5.4,20328,'en','Dangerous Lies','After losing her waitressing job, Katie Franklin takes a job as a caretaker to a wealthy elderly man in his sprawling, empty Chicago estate. The two grow close, but when he unexpectedly passes away and names Katie as his sole heir, she and her husband Adam are pulled into a complex web of lies, deception, and murder. If she\'s going to survive, Katie will have to question everyone\'s motives — even the people she loves.','/6G1v6iFroz0Xw3VNxhMWjiS5hLa.jpg','2020-04-30',96,'Released',NULL,'Dangerous Lies',689723,4.3004,6.262,'EzJJo0whbJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22704,_binary '\0','/odKqOY6VE6C59YAdGHB0b5Havye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10187208',6.7,31510,'en','A Boy Called Christmas','An ordinary young boy called Nikolas sets out on an extraordinary adventure into the snowy north in search of his father who is on a quest to discover the fabled village of the elves, Elfhelm. Taking with him a headstrong reindeer called Blitzen and a loyal pet mouse, Nikolas soon meets his destiny in this magical and endearing story that proves nothing is impossible…','/1sRejtiHOZGggZd9RcmdqbapLM5.jpg','2021-11-24',104,'Released','Experience the magic.','A Boy Called Christmas',615666,5.6766,7.272,'1EuLrGUk6pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22705,_binary '\0','/xGJBLsiY0quc2pOcCH1MdnF5P8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018764',7.2,4351,'ja','ワンピース the movie オマツリ男爵と秘密の島','The Straw Hats visit a recreational island, run by Baron Omatsuri, who asks them to complete a series of ordeals if they wish to stay on the island. Luffy accepts and the Straw Hats work together to complete them, but as the island\'s mysteries unfold, their lives and friendships are put to the test. It\'s up to Luffy to stop the Baron\'s plot and keep his crew together.','/ueIR4LM4k8eKhSB8gGT9NMhCwGW.jpg','2005-03-05',91,'Released',NULL,'One Piece: Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island',44729,7.8549,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22706,_binary '\0','/cZo0oHZA9dG06vkTcYR0khALAHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018765',6.1,24209,'en','Our Brand Is Crisis','Based on the documentary \"Our Brand Is Crisis\", this feature focuses on the use of American political campaign strategies in South America.','/tE7oaFegUgfBC0FMZbHdwB9I1lC.jpg','2015-09-11',107,'Released','May the best campaign win.','Our Brand Is Crisis',10317,6.0783,5.9,'BLZo_ILZhfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22707,_binary '\0','/wSLnlXS706V2PbssEVAtnRbrVRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10187680',6.8,7172,'ml','ഫോറന്‍സിക്','A forensic analyst and an investigation officer are on a chase to hunt down a gruesome serial killer and crack one of the most famous cold cases in the history of their departments.','/5nnOFdY23oTr1f8NjsebvREjJdf.jpg','2020-02-28',134,'Released','The Science of a Crime','Forensic',676792,1.5698,6.649,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22708,_binary '\0','/24zOL9kXeGDvXw9yB1RskQDLX3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10187686',7.7,1400,'ml','തമാശ','Sreenivasan, a bald 31-year-old, finds it tough to get a girl to like or marry him. Will lady love ever bless him?','/aRmBYDa6TfBCGaTFhGc42WOSvxY.jpg','2019-06-05',120,'Released',NULL,'Thamasha',600428,0.8303,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22709,_binary '\0','/1ZxO1yMAe6GvhcOLQQ4PwXX2npB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018785',6.2,32118,'en','The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants 2','Four young women continue the journey toward adulthood that began with \"The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants.\" Now three years later, these lifelong friends embark on separate paths for their first year of college and the summer beyond, but remain in touch by sharing their experiences with each other.','/LCzsRo4RTxtWeBYMHnWAmk33U3.jpg','2008-08-06',117,'Released','Some friends just fit together.','The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants 2',10188,6.1821,6.3,'6gWcI4MkR3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22710,_binary '\0','/iftApuvvTp40BaLbHu9RmlZQrAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018818',6.2,16825,'en','Assassination of a High School President','After the theft of copies of SAT exams from a principal\'s office, teenage reporter Bobby Funke sets out to unmask the thief.','/vHpyczADOGI0OXLliT4k4A1stFd.jpg','2008-01-17',94,'Released','Politics, popularity, paranoia, pharmaceuticals. Are you in?','Assassination of a High School President',18176,4.8538,5.8,'WxHZA_1Hf8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22711,_binary '\0','/kxpLmoCqRp5my3HHARy0JRDqCQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018820',4.9,1636,'en','Devil\'s Diary','When a group of small-town teenagers find the “Devil\'s Diary,” a book that embodies the evil of Satan by physically manifesting any evil thought that is written in it, all hell breaks loose. Unearthed after centuries of concealment, the Devil\'s Diary wreaks havoc and destruction on the high school students who found it, and their entire community. Can their town be saved from complete ruin?','/gHcPoeL0UZpF54mYP9EzxyMWjX6.jpg','2007-09-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Devil\'s Diary',37434,1.4946,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22712,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1018829',3.4,1450,'en','Super Sweet 16: The Movie','Two best friends try to outdo each other as their respective sweet 16 parties approach.','/lm4Pluk7HEHwMlHHNqKprhqpa02.jpg','2007-07-07',86,'Released','A party so expensive, it may cost a friendship.','Super Sweet 16: The Movie',34786,1.6886,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22713,_binary '\0','/boGRStbspjqtNtDVpqvj28sI5V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10189300',7.5,8508,'dz','ལུང་ནག་ན','A teacher, in search of inspiration, travels to the most remote school in the world, where he ends up realizing how important his job is and appreciating the value of yak dung.','/mL1OQc1cxGsOIVHgjDvyvmPSmad.jpg','2019-11-16',109,'Released','Find what you seek in a place you never expected','Lunana: A Yak in the Classroom',627087,3.3127,7.424,'-R-LX0qdghw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22714,_binary '\0','/tZDdwUFL9OLhx2AhSMjKsg4abNb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10189514',8.6,132945,'ta','சூரரைப் போற்று','Nedumaaran Rajangam \"Maara\" sets out to make the common man fly and in the process takes on the world\'s most capital intensive industry and several enemies who stand in his way.','/5uimlxPCgAei8JfQUDFEUQLoyyh.jpg','2020-11-12',149,'Released',NULL,'Soorarai Pottru',595228,1.988,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22715,_binary '\0','/r3i7iTIVSSQtW7TdglUyIREWJCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10189536',4.7,3391,'en','Barbarians','A civilized dinner party in a country house sees four friends, Lucas, Adam, Chloe, and Eve, coming together for a birthday celebration. As the night progresses secrets and lies force themselves into the light and polite pretensions are dropped. A knock at the door reveals three masked intruders with an agenda of their own. Will their friendship stand the test? Can they survive the night or will their secrets eventually catch up with them?','/6dSolFhaf5JOQjgwKCYnEoeJB8z.jpg','20