in 1966.','/zajwv6MwIweYlyhu1ibMojr65wB.jpg','2021-11-19',114,'Released',NULL,'The Real Charlie Chaplin',788396,2.6993,7.7,'0ApMSyQkk1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22720,_binary '\0','/6j3YrwkG4TZo8oNR4U4SDpql4pP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1019452',7,159794,'en','A Serious Man','It is 1967, and Larry Gopnik, a physics professor at a quiet Midwestern university, has just been informed by his wife Judith that she is leaving him. She has fallen in love with one of his more pompous acquaintances Sy Ableman.','/5gGxDS8WmrebPlMHexVS8EVehiP.jpg','2009-10-02',106,'Released','Accept mystery.','A Serious Man',12573,6.7588,6.689,'mDKHWRbK2_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22721,_binary '\0','/kSKz1rGzYdCp3cXwaJgmDzZfs2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1019454',7.4,18881,'en','Taking Chance','Lt. Col. Michael Strobl, a volunteer military escort accompanies the body of Lance Cpl. Chance Phelps to his hometown in Wyoming.','/2gPpwshMJHiaIcbL2K234zPGvK1.jpg','2009-09-21',77,'Released','When one falls, another brings him home.','Taking Chance',25405,4.3636,7.2,'MtmiLdzzgGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22722,_binary '\0','/hD4FaB3tmUvQ1Gg6Jef47nhhrBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10195452',7,4298,'en','American Skin','A Marine veteran working as a school janitor tries to mend his relationship with his son after a divorce. When his son is killed by a police officer found innocent without standing trial, he takes matters into his own hands.','/9HDLsZVWtGFRrXv9FMYMgfIFySk.jpg','2019-09-01',90,'Released','It\'s Time To Change The Narrative.','American Skin',621476,2.7693,7,'Enuuxflk-m4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22723,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10195614',2.6,1528,'en','The Haunting of La Llorona','The screams of the children echo throughout the night as a violent reminder of a demon of the past. La Llorona, a paranormal force has returned and seeks the blood of the innocent, proving that the legend is real.','/ogpb8E4tNc9TJ6YxuCnueOeoICW.jpg','2019-05-17',71,'Released',NULL,'The Haunting of La Llorona',610394,1.0599,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22724,_binary '\0','/av78O62v9mtMRzWJzSV6t2Iywok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196140',6.4,1511,'tr','Küçük Şeyler','Onur is sacked from his job as manager of a pharmaceutical company. He’s not too bothered about being unemployed, but the same cannot be said of his wife Bahar. Onur doesn’t listen to her and becomes indifferent not only to her anxieties but also to the world around him. He’d rather be surrounded by more zebras. A drama with dashes of absurd comedy about events that are no laughing matter: a personal crisis that impacts their marriage.','/imiDwyZwo1Z1SBOa3TRvvChNaLt.jpg','2019-07-01',94,'Released',NULL,'La Belle Indifference',605279,0.6979,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22725,_binary '\0','/xVzIsuUNdJTp6m4ldh6nLSOLsZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196142',4.5,3256,'fa','رحمان ١۴۰۰','Rahman is the custodian of a company and the doctor has told him that he will die soon. He decides to with the help of his friend Anush make a plan and inherit some money for his family.','/qrArizSHRFD6qbghisnMk51aQr5.jpg','2019-03-16',110,'Released','Haw far do you go for money?','Rahman 1400',591906,0.8652,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22726,_binary '\0','/qbpsf5UcelWhslcw8sk0UIKJ1Oh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196368',7.6,3522,'en','Nothing Compares','Since the beginning of her career, Sinéad O’Connor has used her powerful voice to challenge the narratives she was surrounded by while growing up in predominantly Roman Catholic Ireland. Despite her agency, depth and perspective, O’Connor’s unflinching refusal to conform means that she has often been patronized and unfairly dismissed as an attention-seeking pop star.','/2GndW8LtfOonZsqmV3XKgxvmNeY.jpg','2022-09-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Nothing Compares',913845,2.1857,7.8,'FkucxJtqaVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22727,_binary '\0','/sBtBtQ7DigbXx4o1rqp80Pzr1qa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196398',6.7,8044,'fr','Adieu les cons','When 43-year-old hairdresser Suze Trappet finds out that she\'s seriously ill, she decides to go looking for a child she was forced to abandon when she was only 15. On her madcap bureaucratic quest she crosses paths with JB, a 50-year-old man in the middle of a burnout, and Mr. Blin, a blind archivist prone to overenthusiasm. The unlikely trio set off on a hilarious and poignant helterskelter journey across the city in search of Suze\'s long-lost child.','/iEzAKYpwdfFprRV39B7GxJoz9LV.jpg','2020-10-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Bye Bye Morons',651881,4.471,7.164,'QnjEw9uw1Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22728,_binary '\0','/kPGDJMDlOaIyFWTjcxVScWQolMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196464',7.4,7250,'hi','रामप्रसाद की तेहरवी','Ramprasad\'s entire family gathers under one roof for 13 days after his death, to perform and observe the Hindu traditions and rituals called the tehrvi. During the course, the family’s dynamics, politics, and insecurities come out, and then they realise that the importance of people and things are only evident in retrospect.','/isiZRJmqQ0Wu7ELJrBdqD8P2HI6.jpg','2021-01-01',106,'Released',NULL,'Ramprasad Ki Tehrvi',643807,1.2593,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22729,_binary '\0','/r4HFuuth5EkvNJNoCTKRPCRjjMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10196620',4.9,1473,'en','Shepherd','When a deadly secret rots the mind of a grieving widower, the decision to work alone on a deserted island morphs into a terrifying race to save his sanity and his life.','/zZr7DFP1kP9s7cRnqWuVP72EB7X.jpg','2021-11-26',103,'Released','Red sky in mourning.','Shepherd',749727,1.6012,5.3,'pXUUOi4Y4ZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22730,_binary '\0','/5EzpTMkpg3DecNoP2DAOBlh0Fi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10198564',4.4,1994,'en','Bullet Proof','The Thief pulls off the robbery of a lifetime when he robs the psychotic drug lord, Temple. The plan goes off without a hitch until the Thief discovers a stowaway in his getaway car - Temple\'s pregnant wife, Mia.','/cj6YmTAU7Jvn3w6d2NfjQzpX7Pw.jpg','2022-08-19',81,'Released','Get out. Fast!','Bullet Proof',993145,3.6288,5.4,'-hOfNvRaPuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22731,_binary '\0','/kWkAWQQrlI5Rq2CtC5aYac9dx9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199586',6.7,11290,'fr','Atlantique','Arranged to marry a rich man, young Ada is crushed when her true love goes missing at sea during a migration attempt — until a miracle reunites them.','/zRnZM6HqglFK31MYyrTSQVlj1dQ.jpg','2019-10-02',106,'Released','Every love story is a ghost story.','Atlantics',496967,2.0556,6.7,'vhcXyK8s-io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22732,_binary '\0','/6K74rGGGjKGrblGTa7S9yRcUtnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199590',7.6,30862,'fr','Les Misérables','Stéphane has recently joined the Anti-Crime Squad in Montfermeil, in the suburbs of Paris, France, where Victor Hugo set his famed novel “Les Miserables”. Alongside his new colleagues Chris and Gwada – both experienced members of the team – he quickly discovers tensions running high between local gangs. When the trio finds themselves overrun during the course of an arrest, a drone captures the encounter, threatening to expose the reality of everyday life.','/2ZQV9rPFXF0iFfKbsAvVIweQ1yM.jpg','2019-11-14',104,'Released',NULL,'Les Misérables',586863,5.8439,7.6,'YFfdlLW9Rwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22733,_binary '\0','/t3BM7zeE7T0i12ZTA0PFDc92rGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199640',7.2,13282,'ru','Дылда','1945, Leningrad. World War II has devastated the city, demolishing its buildings and leaving its citizens in tatters, physically and mentally. Two young women, Iya and Masha, search for meaning and hope in the struggle to rebuild their lives amongst the ruins.','/nKVrJm1dOwALdr2KHxNFhkbTSZc.jpg','2019-06-20',134,'Released',NULL,'Beanpole',517148,2.097,7.029,'2vGC55okPcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22734,_binary '\0','/xi1Ys1SGeGaxIaGVUKtV0WuIXDC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199664',7.2,2333,'ar','آدم','Abla runs a modest local bakery from her home in Casablanca where she lives alone with her 8-year-old daughter Warda. Their routine of housework and homework is interrupted one day by a knock on the door. It is Samia, a young woman looking for a job and a roof over her head. The little girl is immediately taken with the newcomer, but her mother initially refuses to allow a pregnant stranger into their home. Gradually, however, Abla\'s resolve softens and Samia\'s arrival begins to offer all of them the prospect of a new life.','/a5XfgVcGz54bTYUWLtYJZC6lMuN.jpg','2019-10-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Adam',595875,1.9042,7,'WSaCJaNZkyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22735,_binary '\0','/4evYVAzIHXSSVFxCQhBgkgj52pH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199670',4.5,1668,'fr','Liberté','1774, shortly before the French Revolution, somewhere between Potsdam and Berlin. Madame de Dumeval, the Duke de Tesis and the Duke de Wand, libertines expelled from the puritanical court of Louis XVI, seek the support of the legendary Duc de Walchen, German seducer and freethinker, lonely in a country where hypocrisy and false virtue reign. Their mission is to export libertinage, a philosophy of enlightenment founded on the rejection of moral boundaries and authorities, but moreover to find a safe place to pursue their errant games, where the quest for pleasure no longer obeys laws other than those dictated by unfulfilled desires.','/6r9NoFRNbWMA9vXWHrgqE4wsIZp.jpg','2019-09-04',132,'Released',NULL,'Liberté',595924,1.4485,4.9,'x14qCjZ1yC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22736,_binary '\0','/wX1n8ndD7l6PsHSUmo66GRJHcwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199914',6.8,19696,'en','The Boys in the Band','At a birthday party in 1968 New York, a surprise guest and a drunken game leave seven gay friends reckoning with unspoken feelings and buried truths.','/2D2gi13hnrXWaspWuWmdbEZ8bef.jpg','2020-09-30',122,'Released',NULL,'The Boys in the Band',597156,4.2544,6.8,'862Pb9oDDAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22737,_binary '\0','/pnHeh2zU7OEnyUAbgw9GyjCV1Le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10199974',8,4945,'hi','परीक्षा - एक आखिरी इम्तिहान','The film revolves around the story of an ordinary rickshaw driver in Bihar who aspires and dreams of providing maximum possible quality education to his son by making arrangements for him to study at a private English medium school.','/v41UlOFbZH4wDAOzEYwKgrHhSBd.jpg','2020-07-26',102,'Released','The Final Test','Pareeksha',725311,0.9177,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22738,_binary '\0','/vJ8vQcNTB5mvZeTcVTPBvlmRkwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020027',6.5,2090,'de','The Great Global Warming Swindle','This film tries to blow the whistle on what it calls the biggest swindle in modern history: \'Man Made Global Warming\'. Watch this film and make up your own mind.','/wxL8AOvegjwMpQfQsftk2qwPBRj.jpg','2007-03-08',74,'Released',NULL,'The Great Global Warming Swindle',3048,0.9589,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22739,_binary '\0','/s1jUZ5zQnlh44MY8d6zL3Dto5Da.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020055',5.7,10322,'en','Night Train','Two Passengers and the conductor discover that a person has passed away on their Night Train cabin. They come across valuable diamonds on his person, that they decide to keep for themselves...','/1HD6zcvzQqc3xQtRm1NULuIHFYo.jpg','2009-04-15',87,'Released',NULL,'Night Train',14549,2.8382,5.6,'S5MuGIwj9_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22740,_binary '\0','/bTnUxw2qH4oBGDMM0w4r6KQ11BD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020072',7.5,99727,'en','Selma','\"Selma,\" as in Alabama, the place where segregation in the South was at its worst, leading to a march that ended in violence, forcing a famous statement by President Lyndon B. Johnson that ultimately led to the signing of the Voting Rights Act.','/2QyUcitU0hrxy6B2zkyJ0EhNlqm.jpg','2014-12-25',128,'Released','One dream can change the world.','Selma',273895,5.0914,7.4,'kPgs2zshD9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22741,_binary '\0','/5oWCrtWuV2tXAzFv081TDydt5h9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10203842',7.2,1435,'ru','Государственные похороны','The enigma of the personality cult is revealed in the grand spectacle of Stalin’s funeral. The film is based on unique archive footage, shot in the USSR on March 5 - 9, 1953, when the country mourned and buried Joseph Stalin.','/xI23GezfuoyYnmaxqO4MwILt04l.jpg','2019-10-22',135,'Released',NULL,'State Funeral',618362,1.129,6.6,'JSvGX6syd_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22742,_binary '\0','/ddzRcwIdxC5ujgL8nwSkoiGp5tF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10204366',6.7,2507,'fr','Trois jours et une vie','Christmas 1999, in a peaceful little village in the Ardennes. The life of a young boy named Antoine will soon be devastated by three tragic events : the death of a dog, the vanishing of a child, and a big ravaging storm.','/pdBLfn0oTOa56828eTMaXnhOZSx.jpg','2019-09-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Three Days and a Life',617986,3.7721,6.5,'xmxr3IZLpb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22743,_binary '\0','/A9Ub7OXDS0OuEP2DelhYJM8yvrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10204940',7.3,3347,'fr','Donne-moi des ailes','Christian, a visionary scientist, studies wild geese. For his son, a teenager obsessed with video games, the idea of spending a holiday with his father in the wilderness is a nightmare. However, father and son will get together around a crazy project: save a species endangered, thanks to the ultralight of Christian! Then begins an incredible and perilous journey ...','/y6GqD6MabPjvPrJeTmRmgd896Py.jpg','2019-09-12',113,'Released',NULL,'Spread Your Wings',589982,6.809,7.5,'WxGXbsiDhw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22744,_binary '\0','/34fIB4TBdYHerdbcXoMVPZiX7q0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020530',6.7,112838,'en','Eden Lake','When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.','/tOg6ElTe1mJwaCFN0172U4oso22.jpg','2008-09-12',91,'Released','A weekend by the lake, with views to die for.','Eden Lake',13510,9.2212,6.827,'rJkO9HBXuhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22745,_binary '\0','/cWZnx8IvlfILMkemHx6fK2zMW8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020543',5.8,10307,'en','Infestation','After being stung by a giant insect, Cooper learns that these bugs are attacking the whole city. He joins forces with the survivors, in order to find a way to counter-attack.','/xIjmllDEP8UvH8eDZOtsTI3jigO.jpg','2009-02-05',91,'Released','Prepare for global swarming!','Infestation',22476,3.0354,5.84,'axbACw0jQUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22746,_binary '\0','/idcccRSENk7fv4aRMHo7BY6jHoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020558',6.3,90182,'en','Centurion','Britain, A.D. 117. Quintus Dias, the sole survivor of a Pictish raid on a Roman frontier fort, marches north with General Virilus\' legendary Ninth Legion, under orders to wipe the Picts from the face of the Earth and destroy their leader, Gorlacon.','/9ZdfrcP2QCqoRSk7JF06tDWtrhP.jpg','2010-02-15',97,'Released','History is written in blood','Centurion',23759,5.6485,6.2,'yiQCofKrYAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22747,_binary '\0','/65kzedD84S4ViWzh5k0LvjzZ3pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10207710',4.9,1520,'en','The Gateway','A social worker assigned to the care of the daughter of a single mother intervenes when the dad returns from prison and lures them into a life of crime.','/gUilTInQpzoK7iCkPjysamiVmjS.jpg','2021-09-03',91,'Released','He watches over her. Now they\'re watching him.','The Gateway',713711,2.9503,5.301,'dhzRU54jQtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22748,_binary '\0','/slNzn4E0XA1WE0yh9I53oIzXQ4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020773',7.2,29308,'fr','Copie conforme','In Tuscany to promote his latest book, a middle-aged English writer meets a French woman who leads him to the village of Lucignano.','/soBvtCR33Gv1j6gXwXOIc3JTlNc.jpg','2010-05-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Certified Copy',48303,4.5987,7,'7sTf6PRFylU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22749,_binary '\0','/vh3Bz8SefqPR0VuMiEUZMY65WPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10208194',6.7,3439,'en','Family Romance, LLC','Love is a business at Family Romance, a company that rents human stand-ins for any occasion. Founder Yuichi Ishii helps make his clients’ dreams come true. But when the mother of 12-year-old Mahiro hires Ishii to impersonate her missing father, the line between acting and reality threatens to blur.','/igtALo7638WulIIdBSQetdjFGWN.jpg','2019-10-24',110,'Released','Followers, friends, family. All available for hire.','Family Romance, LLC',595900,1.538,6.2,'ABkxpYJnYa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22750,_binary '\0','/jJJQ1PPXUEchqyZ9YyWzgSNU39Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10208198',7,35215,'ko','악인전','After barely surviving a brutal attack by a sadistic serial killer, crime boss Jang Dong-su is left humiliated. Determined to catch the killer known as K, he forms an uneasy alliance with Jung Tae-seok, a relentless and incorruptible detective who often disrupts his illegal business. However, while Jang Dong-su wants K dead, Jung Tae-suk is determined to bring him to justice. With a deal in place—whoever finds K first will decide his fate—the hunt begins, blurring the lines between crime and law.','/oHlM4abRm6BzrRcz9Nup1uidw9H.jpg','2019-05-15',110,'Released','Don\'t let the devil win.','The Gangster, the Cop, the Devil',581528,19.0854,7.9,'D1XANQUYSvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22751,_binary '\0','/rw7mN0B8wkZcSuaEARJPIooUyBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020885',5.1,21821,'en','Lesbian Vampire Killers','With their women having been enslaved by a pack of lesbian vampires, the remaining menfolk of a rural town send two hapless young lads out onto the moors as a sacrifice.','/3IROnPMgDnI1TYQ4PZBB0nn6CwX.jpg','2009-03-16',86,'Released','After Twilight, The Real Party Starts.','Lesbian Vampire Killers',18238,3.3312,5.2,'Ug60BEOdrB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22752,_binary '\0','/hNHvjW48NwXKwncvU8XuTbr210o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020937',7.4,11352,'hi','आवारापन','A loyal henchman is ordered by his boss to keep an eye on his mistress, and trouble begins when he refuses to kill her.','/cXE5iWUbh7RMaz3BULTYsacaPrg.jpg','2007-06-29',124,'Released','Love was his only destination!','Awarapan',22448,3.6097,6.974,'VH0aDSbAeCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22753,_binary '\0','/m5InPcwZSJx1J49XSKl1WEB4JCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020938',7,7680,'fr','Bébés','A non-narrated documentary following the lovesome lives of four infants from birth to their first birthday. The babies featured are two from rural areas: Ponijao from Opuwo, Namibia, and Bayar from Bayanchandmani, Mongolia, as well as two from urban areas: Mari from Tokyo, Japan, and Hattie from San Francisco, USA.','/zfXmRDjbMewZWAIGfKwMG5xjxzj.jpg','2010-05-07',79,'Released','Everybody loves...','Babies',44737,1.9685,7,'FPDSu9v3odM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22754,_binary '\0','/gCjvl23R1MiHsTz6JbWK93xPDFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020955',6.1,2367,'es','Fuera de carta','Maxi thinks his life is perfect. He is a famous cook who owns a successful restaurant in Chueca and is living his life as a gay man without much complex. But when his son Edu and his daughter Alba appear, and a new attractive neighbor comes along, it will have a strong effect on his life resulting in his values being challenged for ever.','/kpDxrZD4L84UmA8foham5DWdmf1.jpg','2008-04-11',111,'Released',NULL,'Chef\'s Special',15953,2.4926,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22755,_binary '\0','/gyWQES8SdLH7pwNReQnpqu7Pz7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020956',6.5,3679,'ar','جعلتني مجرماً','The movie is about a very naive young man, who wants to fix his house before it falls, but does not have the money, and rich girl who likes to spend money uncontrollably, whose father is scrooge, who would not give her access to her trust fund. In order to force her father to give her money, she stages a kidnapping with the assistance of her best friend and the naive young man, who ends up falling in love with her.','/9InvbMsehKRhHMSbPvAJrK0boCz.jpg','2006-03-15',104,'Released',NULL,'She Made Me a Criminal',48658,1.3237,6.6,'Q847g6Zr7Gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22756,_binary '\0','/phI5uHzKbNwiADYVJebqVqUeZWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020972',7.5,2309,'zh','盲山','Young student Bai Xuemei is cheated and sold as a wife by human traffickers to a remote village. Raped and beaten, she leads the life of a sex slave and child-bearer with no hope of escape because of the villagers apathy and selfishness.','/gabbyvJQ8i48qgJYesABMR7S5bc.jpg','2007-05-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Blind Mountain',51520,1.3754,7.603,'60FGITLGCto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22757,_binary '\0','/xPrBcdZemW2xfjz3HOFPo2sK9wz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1020978',5.5,1755,'hi','Naqaab','The story revolves around the life of Sophia (Urvashi Sharma) who lives in Goa. When she is stalked and then attacked by a rapist named Rakesh, Sophia re-locates to Dubai. Here she rents a room in a villa near Jumeirah Beach, owned by wealthy star Karan Oberoi (Bobby Deol). Six months later he proposes to her, and she accepts. Shortly before the marriage, she meets with an unemployed actor, Vicky Malhotra (Akshay Khanna), and is attracted to him, but decides to go ahead and marry Karan. At the altar, she changes her mind, ditches him and decides to move in with Vicky. But things take a turn for the worse.','/yb9pluBcX7xK1yPOKtpLgGCTg7W.jpg','2007-07-13',115,'Released','Veil/Mask','Naqaab',277608,0.9486,4.6,'bbJplx2owF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22758,_binary '\0','/muKfk9HrM7hSi59GAtUfVXC5iEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1021004',6.5,6028,'tr','Yumurta','Poet Yusuf (35-38) returns to his childhood hometown, which he hadn\'t visited for years, upon his mother\'s death. He is faced with a neglected, crumbling house. Ayla, a young girl (17-19) awaits him there. Yusuf has been unaware of the existence of this distant relation who had been living with his mother for five years; He stays by his dead mother\'s bedside for a while on the morning of his return...','/xcTlvAq4JPURVqmaVVWdIVSe33f.jpg','2007-11-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Egg',37586,1.1022,5.8,'bjKTTL04lG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22759,_binary '\0','/jV5NHS96uWoGJpS1sTi1NN05ks5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10210182',6.5,1383,'en','Christmas a la Mode','The dairy farm Emily has been running since her father passed away has fallen on hard times. When Emily’s sister, Dorothy, and her handsome business partner, Charlie, show up with a proposition to sell the farm, Emily comes up with an ingenious plan to buy out her sister\'s shares. She holds an online holiday ice cream flavor contest that goes viral with the help of a key ingredient, Charlie\'s amazing apple pie. Still, as the Christmas Eve deadline for the buyout approaches, Emily needs a Christmas miracle to save the family farm and her father\'s legacy.','/sbS4DFd1AUNnaVmPWsMsSur7231.jpg','2019-11-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas a la Mode',626299,1.5889,6.7,'tcyseNDkuUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22760,_binary '\0','/6nWLa3rmBhACSP3I0XQXpq9ibjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10213380',6.5,1494,'ro','Malmkrog','Among the guests who come to the mansion of aristocratic landowner Nikolai over Christmas are a politician, a young countess, and a general with his wife. They dine and discuss topics such as progress and morality. As the debate becomes more heated, cultural differences become increasingly apparent.','/3a18dQrXHzippSG9MsXVgoHBp8Q.jpg','2020-07-08',201,'Released',NULL,'Malmkrog',575448,1.1662,6.7,'bD014gW4pJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22761,_binary '\0','/u1OtWduhkRvGreEMWOMHDrzi29Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10214496',7.2,1302,'en','The Donut King','Cambodian refugee Ted Ngoy builds a multi-million dollar empire by baking America\'s favourite pastry: the doughnut.','/8eN5x0DkXB4ByG2mLIopETdTwVg.jpg','2020-08-24',94,'Released',NULL,'The Donut King',674882,1.2707,7,'aLKugGKgJsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22762,_binary '\0','/s7QvyLoxJ1PWMGasGpqluQqhUT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10214826',8.3,22513,'te','ఏజెంట్ సాయి శ్రీనివాస అత్రేయ','Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya is a brilliant, underrated detective from Nellore who runs an agency called FBI which sees no business. He gets more than what he asked for when a case happens to fall right into his lap out of nowhere.','/jMVfhhWfHLawVp3kd55KBy3VBsW.jpg','2019-06-21',144,'Released','Sherlock Holmes is Fiction , Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya is Original','Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya',610482,1.4618,7.4,'iPfVbR5oAWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22763,_binary '\0','/uAK6Sv89ty32mYH2m8jJx2odvKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10214842',4.2,1667,'ru','Миллиард','An influential banker is doing everything possible not to share the property with his illegitimate sons. But when he is 