s to win her trust and her ranch, Sam finds he might also be winning her heart.','/nYGLSQElCEkf8mA63KzKf2qTEXD.jpg','2019-08-17',90,'Released',NULL,'A Summer Romance',612315,2.2927,6.9,'GGOh9IBgdWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22772,_binary '\0','/1M2i4Mxd03elGOTmEkIvqrHfmyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1022603',7.6,627507,'en','(500) Days of Summer','Tom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.','/qXAuQ9hF30sQRsXf40OfRVl0MJZ.jpg','2009-07-17',95,'Released','Boy meets girl. Boy falls in love. Girl doesn\'t.','(500) Days of Summer',19913,18.4613,7.307,'ILCB_f0IIyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22773,_binary '\0','/4JGfKaX81wp5YDATOG7JHYVMSTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1022606',7,3523,'es','Leonera','Julia, a 25 year-old university student, two weeks pregnant, with no criminal record, is sent to prison. Julia murdered the father of her child. This story addresses maternity, jail and Justice; confinement, guilt and solitude; but above all it deals with Julia and her son, Tomas, born inside an Argentinean prison.','/mpYcisTwGJDnmlmjRrvySGcmbkX.jpg','2008-05-29',113,'Released',NULL,'Lion\'s Den',8900,1.4179,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22774,_binary '\0','/wPjtacig0kIkVcTQmXoNt6jbMwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10228134',5.6,39788,'en','Jolt','A bouncer with an anger management problem goes on a furious and resentful rampage after the murder of a friend.','/b0fBzqCmHr0a0XkeAdhc02XhKXG.jpg','2021-07-15',91,'Released','You\'re in for a shock.','Jolt',617502,7.8277,6.497,'3BSSoD73TSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22775,_binary '\0','/xxA5AJBxgi1EPq9GO6cZtryAn1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10228168',6.7,8892,'ja','初恋','One night in Tokyo, Leo, a young boxer, meets his first love, Monica, an imprisoned sex worker. Caught up in a drug-smuggling scheme, they find themselves pursued by a corrupt cop, a yakuza, his nemesis, and a female assassin.','/oCf0l04CXswtzRMExzbalGYftRM.jpg','2019-05-31',108,'Released',NULL,'First Love',597094,3.5223,6.72,'IzU5q_dPANQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22776,_binary '\0','/aQuDaHRtOI1ZqZbnApB126TlnoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10228204',6.3,1476,'fr','Perdrix','Pierre Perdrix has been enjoying an enchanted though restless existence since the enigmatic Juliette Webb burst into his life, a stranger who landed in his family\'s unique world like a meteorite, and who by her presence alone will force this tight-knit microcosm to redefie their boundaries and finally begin to fully live their lives.','/9K3ULLZx4NqtSBskjagxFXpaASB.jpg','2019-08-14',100,'Released',NULL,'The Bare Necessity',592798,2.7624,5.9,'ChHmEeTqRfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22777,_binary '\0','/hl5sCHidVygRXynPeSnevQxPVOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1022883',4.7,2811,'en','Pig Hunt','When John takes his San Francisco friends to his deceased uncle\'s remote ranch to hunt wild pigs, it seems like a typical guys weekend with guns - despite the presence of John\'s sexy girlfriend Brooks. But as John and his crew trek deeper into the forest, they begin tracking the awful truth about his uncle\'s demise and the legend of The Ripper -- a murderous three-thousand-pound black boar!','/u0Q5NQX0Q9CAQSQTzP2EPreZ9yn.jpg','2008-07-31',100,'Released','Get Muddy! Get Bloody! Kill Or Be Killed!','Pig Hunt',22731,1.5664,4.7,'9ld5P2kywds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22778,_binary '\0','/7uEioqlOZrjmUQSX9jYVM00E7hk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10229558',6.1,30462,'en','The Dark and the Wicked','On a secluded farm in a nondescript rural town, a man is slowly dying. His family gathers to mourn, and soon a darkness grows, marked by waking nightmares and a growing sense that something evil is taking over the family.','/4DB9VFVTp0IQEWFEIf9f3f2z3t5.jpg','2020-04-16',95,'Released','She told you not to come','The Dark and the Wicked',680593,5.3739,6.1,'FwN8Crl_DxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22779,_binary '\0','/my4AWiSj36dKWbLAgaIN9W43nFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10229598',6.7,3568,'en','The Pickup Game','Generating over a billion dollars a year, the pickup industry is shocking, secretive and—to put it politely—scummy. Built upon myths and manipulation, expensive workshops and training videos push an agenda that women are biologically attracted to alpha males. If men can learn techniques to overcome their shyness and become socially dominant, they\'ll be 21st-century Casanovas. At least, that\'s what the brochure says. Ross Jeffries\'s 1992 self-published book How to Get the Women You Desire into Bed inspired a generation of macho men to push their techniques with aggressive online marketing. With insider access to the movement\'s founders and current leaders, this riveting exposé dismantles the \"date and mate\" methods hustled by modern snake-oil salesmen. From chat rooms to conference halls, these self-help-styled seminars are poised to take advantage of anyone desperate enough to fall for their dangerous promises.','/2ytnj5lTJMZOmsBNnLiTKwQwFXV.jpg','2019-04-30',96,'Released',NULL,'The Pickup Game',589382,0.5254,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22780,_binary '\0','/nHp7zscPb54ft6XwCFTKAN9lWqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10229982',6.7,3902,'en','My First Summer','Isolated on a remote property, 16-year-old Claudia finds her world transformed when a spirited girl named Grace wanders into her garden.','/7GBMVO09clB7HUgfqbjZmOVAPOi.jpg','2020-10-24',78,'Released','First Love, first breath','My First Summer',741011,2.5479,8,'LU64l9y71vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22781,_binary '\0','/dKSykSoV8eG