7.000000','tt10235600',3.7,1579,'hi','काली खुहि','When a restless spirit curses a Punjab village that has a history of female infanticide, the town\'s fate lies in the hands of a 10-year old girl, Shivangi.','/6zssTYgFelEo9XIzflrEvjhti6l.jpg','2020-10-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Kaali Khuhi',744876,1.2034,4.6,'kji5F02FemY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22796,_binary '\0','/auftwkAjB6wYm2MfVoa3p8Pnnli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10235718',4.9,3424,'en','Love, Weddings & Other Disasters','A fussy celebrity caterer, a blind woman, a tour-bus guide and an inexperienced wedding planner search for love.','/5NyNfNop1gOLapYUdCA2VwCwbvk.jpg','2020-12-04',96,'Released','A match made in madness.','Love, Weddings & Other Disasters',627103,3.7466,6,'E3HXNZ3c0z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22797,_binary '\0','/uwACVNL5OpiI3oT72DVGxnU4SRV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10236164',7.5,21004,'da','Pigen med nålen','Struggling to survive in post-WWI Copenhagen, a newly unemployed and pregnant young woman is taken in by a charismatic elder to help run an underground adoption agency. The two form an unexpected bond, until a sudden discovery changes everything.','/2xkyx8v9G3ePxe1IcFugFQkXHzQ.jpg','2024-09-06',123,'Released',NULL,'The Girl with the Needle',1232827,6.8394,7.569,'NdjhUNH5v3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22798,_binary '\0','/32HqRM2XTccuEpYuERTSLnbAeBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10240612',3.7,3659,'en','Critters Attack!','Mysterious alien Critters have crash-landed in a small college town, devouring every living thing they encounter. Drea and the kids she\'s babysitting must try desperately to save themselves from the ravenous, rolling beasts. Will Drea discover her inner badass, and will it be enough to stop the Critter onslaught?','/iQJQNElDQqQ3iXf46pyMmhReoyp.jpg','2020-11-06',89,'Released','Everyone is on the menu.','Critters Attack!',597856,3.6243,6,'kuIc4yd7ZpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22799,_binary '\0','/zuOusg5xXMpzAXouktOGQICzkwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10241772',5.3,3206,'en','Dakota','Dakota, an ex-service dog, joins single mum Kate and her daughter Alex to live on their small-town family farm. Dakota quickly adjusts to her new home and becomes somewhat of a local hero, soon becoming inseparable from Alex. But when the farm’s existence is threatened by the town’s rogue sheriff, Dakota must help the family band together and save the land.','/j3eUOPUoDwkupwTPTDk6ESqrzGt.jpg','2022-04-01',96,'Released','No dog left behind.','Dakota',955740,1.9035,6.1,'nEC9ZcV-ehk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22800,_binary '\0','/nAHysRXM17o6TurhobGtL1MCDDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10242388',5.7,36653,'en','Last Seen Alive','After Will Spann\'s wife suddenly vanishes at a gas station, his desperate search to find her leads him down a dark path that forces him to run from authorities and take the law into his own hands.','/qvqyDj34Uivokf4qIvK4bH0m0qF.jpg','2022-05-12',95,'Released','He\'ll stop at nothing to get her back.','Last Seen Alive',961484,8.8117,6.4,'BNOtkWjZbZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22801,_binary '\0','/zjobTF54Z1P1hpa3w2RePqL42is.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024255',6.1,69440,'en','Wild Child','Sixteen-year-old Poppy has everything her unlimited credit cards can buy, and a spoiled attitude to match. After a final thoughtless prank, her exasperated father ships her off to boarding school in England. There, Poppy meets her match in a stern headmistress and a class full of girls who will not tolerate her selfishness.','/xwbFEPubG4wroLDZdmTWRGNnnWf.jpg','2008-08-15',98,'Released','New Girl. New School. New Rules.','Wild Child',13971,10.0396,6.692,'BgIMeJXiPho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22802,_binary '\0','/6euea0NQBP5ZrCRJmXquj7bRRbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10243672',7.1,12150,'en','JOY','A young nurse, a visionary scientist and an innovative surgeon face opposition from the church, state, media and medical establishment, in their pursuit of the world’s first ‘test tube baby’, Louise Joy Brown.','/inL3nv3hAqlvoBSIWFMYydlwULE.jpg','2024-11-15',115,'Released','Three pioneers, one vision: the birth of IVF.','JOY',1184495,3.1291,6.9,'Qoyn5BCm37o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22803,_binary '\0','/croBEXnr8sbqyjLmFrMRpDfnSbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10243676',5.4,1299,'fr','After Blue (Paradis sale)','In a faraway future, on a wild and untamed female inhabited planet called After Blue, a lonely teenager named Roxy unknowingly releases a mystical, dangerous, and sensual assassin from her prison.','/uzlk8JZbialeyduUjgtbsqwH3yX.jpg','2022-02-16',129,'Released',NULL,'After Blue (Dirty Paradise)',660715,2.2837,5.4,'EGJcWb11W14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22804,_binary '\0','/oCTGMFt7JEnbc1U5Jbdei6SLZCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10243678',6.5,5660,'hi','चॉपस्टिक्स','A gifted but insecure woman is in for a transformative experience when she enlists the help of an enigmatic con artist to recover her stolen car.','/ejFfjFbK7t3kGFJJiANUQBWxITk.jpg','2019-05-31',100,'Released','Shit just goat real','Chopsticks',601801,1.3012,6.132,'dxbCuuc-jp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22805,_binary '\0','/5XKMS1dJFfnEOrl1koJyb31p5js.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10243992',6.2,10712,'en','I\'m Your Woman','A woman is forced to go on the run after her husband betrays his partners, sending her and her baby on a dangerous journey.','/uTcJAxIV8BzNXuvcViBSibQSBid.jpg','2020-10-15',120,'Released','No one survives alone.','I\'m Your Woman',643612,4.2908,5.9,'fAveuCPBYSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22806,_binary '\0','/qI4vRv7BcrVxfTzphpGbI40Lidp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10244726',6.8,1362,'pt','O Filme do Bruno Aleixo','Bruno Aleixo was invited to write a biopic about his own life. Lacking ideas, he decided to ask his closest friends for inspiration. Reunited in a cafe, each of his friends suggests a different idea, more or less biographical.','/kP4CHFLlfGa4R2ao8mxTv5FE2LF.jpg','2020-01-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Bruno Aleixo\'s Film',637595,1.2254,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22807,_binary '\0','/hJpTWcFlucIOOo5WEuYN0w69fJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10245072',5.6,42724,'en','Salem\'s Lot','Author Ben Mears returns to his childhood home of Jerusalem\'s Lot only to discover his hometown is being preyed upon by a bloodthirsty vampire.','/vCUpo94Qm6DhV5fkQF4xMPsKCP8.jpg','2024-10-03',113,'Released','Be careful what you invite inside.','Salem\'s Lot',748230,10.1147,6,'QtVzKkv03ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22808,_binary '\0','/eSDz22g7f0pRK9XJXXQnnywUo4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10245106',6.3,1786,'en','Dreamin\' Wild','The true story of the Emerson family and the tumult that followed the success of their self-recorded pop-funk album of the same name, which went largely unnoticed until critics rediscovered and reappraised it decades later. Now, as an adult, Donnie is forced to confront the ghosts from the past and grapple with the emotional toll his dreams have taken on the family who supported him.','/58eMSDfgXAUO2wK1y26uN2zcNro.jpg','2023-08-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Dreamin\' Wild',887321,2.0302,6.1,'CV9Q05R66Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22809,_binary '\0','/iVk4mVKwNE66JbBcoDwcYFvuUXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024648',7.7,672984,'en','Argo','As the Iranian revolution reaches a boiling point, a CIA \'exfiltration\' specialist concocts a risky plan to free six Americans who have found shelter at the home of the Canadian ambassador.','/m5gPWFZFIp4UJFABgWyLkbXv8GX.jpg','2012-10-11',120,'Released','The movie was fake. The mission was real.','Argo',68734,12.5721,7.285,'3RrtxIci4T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22810,_binary '\0','/8NT8cPiD9yTAI2iEfsDPQZAYFsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024715',6.4,35014,'en','Choke','A sex-addicted con-man pays for his mother\'s hospital bills by playing on the sympathies of those who rescue him from choking to death.','/7osy71os3YLiFpNYn567koOnAKZ.jpg','2008-09-26',92,'Released','If this movie doesn’t touch you, go ahead and touch yourself.','Choke',13973,3.4603,6.1,'yMZ3Mi1vT-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22811,_binary '\0','/5TuZNG4RxpQkOAOz8jngzKswkcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024733',6.3,3860,'en','$5 a Day','After being released from jail, the son of a con man joins his father on the road.','/3KYu8bLD8Bx7dYlO8cHv2IWnkht.jpg','2008-09-06',98,'Released','Relationships don\'t come cheap!','$5 a Day',4204,1.7677,5.6,'DsC3fxNTyno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22812,_binary '\0','/y3NQjQOWoxhBLCbviEKecwxkKGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024744',5.4,3470,'en','I Come with the Rain','Kline, a former Los Angeles police officer turned private detective, is hired by a powerful pharmaceutical conglomerate boss to investigate in Asia the disappearance of his only son, Shitao, whom he has not seen in person since the boy was ten. Now in his 30s, Shitao has gone missing in the Philippines where he had been helping in an orphanage.','/wOJZ3XvHjcGfLBh0GLJU3HhsJKE.jpg','2009-05-14',114,'Released',NULL,'I Come with the Rain',31166,3.072,5.6,'l_CymtKfZxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22813,_binary '\0','/2mnTP90bGvHlqPhbuOWbPgl2CkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10247678',3.2,4147,'en','Sensation','When a lowly postman is inducted into a top-secret superhuman DNA program at a research facility, it\'s revealed that he\'ll be able to receive, control and send information based on the senses of others.','/pRYvHo5VuBiUOueZT3nJOIlpWHB.jpg','2021-12-31',90,'Released','Protect your DNA.','Sensation',800762,1.1182,5.5,'au750jTS_2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22814,_binary '\0','/4kafB13wLSdJXD35L9IHd6ih8oo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024855',5.1,1461,'en','London Heist','Armed robber and career criminal Jack Cregan seeks to discover the truth behind his father\'s murder and his stolen heist money and in doing so puts his life in danger. The devastation that Jack soon discovers puts his very own existence into question.','/eehIEkSGYVWJnT85R8iOgJsBrk5.jpg','2017-06-17',91,'Released','Mark my words I\'m gonna kill every last one of em...','London Heist',453759,2.3686,5.568,'1LiNufQjSGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22815,_binary '\0','/77mYHavZygvpTVfyXi8JzntjTvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024942',7.1,5109,'da','Kærlighed På Film','Jonas is a Copenhagen homicide scene photographer, happily married, with two kids. One day, his car stalls, another car slams into him, runs head on into a third car and flips into the ditch. The other driver, Julia, is critically injured. He visits her in the hospital and is greeted by her family, who assumes he must be the Sebastian she told them about, the new fiance she met in Vietnam.','/9kEh1eILiAQ7aL5o0nb9ZUpCZR2.jpg','2007-08-22',100,'Released','What do you do when wrong feels right?','Just Another Love Story',14898,1.7816,6.921,'yqGUOcomEb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22816,_binary '\0','/mBdT7nvhXmvZKK1mieS261IApcI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024943',6.8,57217,'hi','ओम शांति ओम','In the early 70s, aspiring actor Om Prakash Makhija, and a famous starlet Shantipriya, are murdered. Thirty years later, his reincarnation Om Kapoor sets out to discover the mystery of their demise.','/oArsQTD4bPPMtRjqr03SO9W6phF.jpg','2007-11-07',169,'Released','For some dreams, one lifetime is not enough.','Om Shanti Om',8079,4.4608,7.1,'9oeGoQGt7Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22817,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1024964',7.8,1255,'en','A Map For Saturday','On a trip around the world, every day feels like Saturday. A Map For Saturday reveals a world of long-term, solo travel through the stories of trekkers in 20 countries on four continents. The documentary finds backpackers helping neglected Thai tsunami victims. It explains why Nepal\'s guesthouses are empty and Brazil\'s stoplights are ignored. But at it\'s core, A Map For Saturday tracks the emotional arc of extreme long-term travelers; teenagers and senior citizens who wondered, \"What would it be like to travel the world?\" Then did it.','/y8VKXYsSX57jiPmNZWizaEGKxty.jpg','2007-08-07',90,'Released','One Year Around The World','A Map For Saturday',44095,0.5555,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22818,_binary '\0','/gXsBmxVL0BuseS8afWLMGvSb9k5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10249780',7.1,1603,'bg','Доза щастие','The real story of the journalist Vesela Toteva (in the role is her daughter -Valentina Karoleva) searching for her own happiness during the dynamic and uncertain 90\'s in Bulgaria. A tale about drugs, fall, fear and redemption.','/uqj8o9mWWU7Fz0qnMNlZCDalvnl.jpg','2019-11-08',100,'Released',NULL,'A Dose of Happiness',632464,1.1542,6.2,'l08wBPBIqZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22819,_binary '\0','/hmv300bqfZmxvdXCtCsruDH0ycT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1025100',5.7,132622,'en','Gemini Man','Henry Brogan is an elite 51-year-old assassin who\'s ready to call it quits after completing his 72nd job. His plans get turned upside down when he becomes the target of a mysterious operative who can seemingly predict his every move. To his horror, Brogan soon learns that the man who\'s trying to kill him is a younger, faster, cloned version of himself.','/uTALxjQU8e1lhmNjP9nnJ3t2pRU.jpg','2019-10-02',117,'Released','Who will save you from yourself?','Gemini Man',453405,15.4976,6.255,'6orc_lHvJKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22820,_binary '\0','/gDro13mA61bhq9mvhMaqt0dBlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1025103',6.3,1459,'en','A Room with a View','When Lucy Honeychurch and chaperon Charlotte Bartlett find themselves in Florence with rooms without views, fellow guests Mr Emerson and son George step in to remedy the situation. Meeting the Emersons could change Lucy\'s life forever but, once back in England, how will her experiences in Tuscany affect her marriage plans?','/4uR15nurpHACScRR9b7ZzgLKuKd.jpg','2007-11-04',93,'Released','Open your heart','A Room with a View',13361,2.3741,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22821,_binary '\0','/4y8hoQAveC7dVwAAsJJ78Y89lh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10251538',5.5,1607,'fr','10 jours sans maman','Antoine is the Head of HR of a big company. Managing people is his thing, so when his overwhelmed wife suddenly decides to go on holiday and leave him with the responsibility of the house and their four kids, he knows it will be a piece of cake for him. But Antoine has drastically underestimated the mess that four mischievous kids can cause...','/ih0727BoT24cg87aOVfppZyqzNQ.jpg','2020-02-19',104,'Released',NULL,'10 Days with Dad',605735,2.8178,6,'-MYq-fkbSm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22822,_binary '\0','/eo6mtsq5KPbzp7taUPpwVC7Mrbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10253466',5.6,3488,'en','Badland','Detective Matthias Breecher, hired to track down the worst of the Confederate war criminals, roams the Old West seeking justice. His resolve is tested when he meets a determined pioneer woman who is far more than she seems.','/217ddlMrnXll436baw7y5ERmz3x.jpg','2019-11-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Badland',634524,3.4638,6.354,'pi_-0lE2S2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22823,_binary '\0','/pJOYBevz1tMTtexr3KeSx8G6SCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10253816',6.8,2148,'ja','甲鉄城のカバネリ 海門決戦','In the midst of an industrial revolution, the people of Hinomoto fight hordes of undead creatures, known as Kabane, using powerful armored trains. Half a year after the events of the original TV series, the heroes of the Iron Fortress attempt to take back Unato Castle.','/1O5jE1w2wYkFInDHnWYa91TemOO.jpg','2019-05-10',82,'Released',NULL,'Kabaneri of the Iron Fortress: The Battle of Unato',567006,4.1581,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22824,_binary '\0','/6Zw3WVdF8mpD9pyBLzApcOIDFTN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10256570',6.7,3128,'it','La dea fortuna','Alessandro and Arturo have been together for over 15 years and, despite the feeling they still have for each other, their relationship is now at crisis. When Alessandro’s best friend, out of the blue, asks them to take care of her two kids for a few days, something changes in their daily routine and love will drive them to a crazy and unexpected turn in their life.','/j8ArEpu81pYN77zMcodSPvH3S0J.jpg','2019-12-19',114,'Released',NULL,'The Goddess of Fortune',606952,2.5359,7.1,'4cCrNJPLv08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22825,_binary '\0','/7p8uiXXprRzbw7uyaER4AG86gLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10260042',7,2046,'fr','Antigone','Sophie Deraspe’s adaptation of the classic Greek tragedy of the same name reimagines the story of a woman’s quest for justice as a commentary on the immigrant experience in contemporary Montreal.','/whn30vLHgM5IyMorCVGAsXzB3Zp.jpg','2019-11-08',109,'Released',NULL,'Antigone',582309,1.7871,6.8,'yoxlCXluK_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22826,_binary '\0','/7oACGfZo31AEg722XVohvOetm19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10260294',4.1,1229,'ru','Гости','Young Katya meets a merry company of visiting guys who have a specific entertainment - to organize parties in other people\'s empty houses. And Katya knows the right place: an old country house on the coast, the owner of which left for a long time. The secluded house, in which the spiritualist salon was at the beginning of the last century, seems to everyone an excellent option. Alarming, even the terrible abandonment of this place does not frighten anyone ... In the midst of the party, someone whom Katya never expected to see appears: the mysterious master of the house ... The man she loved. A man in the grip of otherworldly forces.','/ywonhtQGMatFC4jVuMvAN3I4mKl.jpg','2019-03-07',87,'Released','Don\'t Let Them In!','Guests',541977,1.194,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22827,_binary '\0','/31WLnNHLGqm0nVwDUx3kfjyCD1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10260692',5,1459,'en','Faith Based','When two idiot friends realize all \"faith based\" films make buckets of cash, they set out on a mission to make one of their own.','/2EobXh41lnhIo9RPoH3Sf2exxu2.jpg','2020-10-09',92,'Released','Salvation is rich','Faith Based',616982,2.447,4.7,'OK2yBVQFCIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22828,_binary '\0','/1VOXM9E6Cdu98sAanLb6TyCns1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10262380',5.9,6673,'en','Boys from County Hell','A crew of hardy road workers, led by a bickering Father and Son, must survive the night when they accidentally awaken an ancient Irish vampire.','/5DAmmAxTeZd2oh6cveD0yyysjcT.jpg','2021-08-06',89,'Released','Hard work never killed anyone... until now.','Boys from County Hell',680631,2.8471,5.6,'vssvkhvq6O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22829,_binary '\0','/h0uGdJyZ5o74p0E600oKYyaoDhw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10262648',7.2,18829,'fi','Hytti nro 6','A young Finnish woman escapes an enigmatic love affair in Moscow by boarding a train to the arctic port of Murmansk. Forced to share the long ride and a tiny sleeping car with a larger than life Russian miner, the unexpected encounter leads the occupants of Compartment No. 6 to face major truths about human connection.','/3KUsYQmQXVCMrnGnQIoqkj5MJUP.jpg','2021-10-29',106,'Released',NULL,'Compartment No. 6',588182,4.8169,7,'gw4M4heQMlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22830,_binary '\0','/g6QEH57CLdtXnImqr5ZzSVCkV62.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10263320',1.4,10360,'tr','Enes Batur: Gerçek Kahraman','In the first film, Enes Batur was shy and unable to relate to those around him, showing the audience how his life changed through his social media posts. In this sequel, he becomes a part of \"Justice Warriors\" and embarks upon an adventure which will eventually make him a superhero.','/64AkLwxDD9disfXNVwWSFYingQj.jpg','2019-05-31',99,'Released',NULL,'Enes Batur: Gerçek Kahraman',607971,1.2941,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22831,_binary '\0','/oEo07EvQHihYTAqFJTR4GWNSnhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10264340',2.4,3325,'en','Light From the Tower','A costume designer is sent to the Catskills for an interactive theatre piece set in the 1920s. When she arrives things seem dark, strange and off. She soon realizes she is part of a student film.','/pUV7rlynU2EXB8nuaj5XMJUfKGk.jpg','2020-04-14',77,'Released',NULL,'Light From the Tower',696513,1.1618,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22832,_binary '\0','/2ZzmfwgvVh2KLH4A8HMzX5TytAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10265034',6.7,17785,'en','Land','Edee, in the aftermath of an unfathomable event, finds herself unable to stay connected to the world she once knew and in the face of that uncertainty, retreats to the magnificent, but unforgiving, wilds of the Rockies. After a local hunter brings her back from the brink of death, she must find a way to live again.','/6pYhDPzYPGKvDYpxdf0IUE3RDAS.jpg','2021-02-12',89,'Released','A story of humanity, in the face of uncertainty','Land',598896,4.364,6.704,'sOw20FDNnHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22833,_binary '\0','/7bjaAcbrJDVvdF2Uew6rGp9Tp05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10268488',6.8,38136,'en','The Greatest Beer Run Ever','Chickie wants to support his friends fighting in Vietnam, so he does something wild—personally bring them American beer. What starts as a well-meaning journey quickly changes Chickie\'s life and perspective.','/ggf37TpcKaxwguhvtNn6MQpyqBn.jpg','2022-09-23',127,'Released','Friendship has no last call.','The Greatest Beer Run Ever',597922,8.2216,7.481,'NqxziDlZOIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22834,_binary '\0','/2ZL1rdcz5BX2SJUg0QXDISxYnRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10268550',6.5,1382,'en','Minyan','In a rapidly changing New York of the 1980s, a Russian Jewish teenager wrestles with his identity, faith, and sexuality, all of which seem irreconcilable until he befriends two closeted men in his grandfather\'s senior housing complex.','/kbihQtYEe7V6u5WZ1H9WfMk3ln1.jpg','2020-08-28',119,'Released','Wherever ten men gather in prayer, there the divine presence resides.','Minyan',665761,2.021,5.2,'ZeN6DCTgfsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22835,_binary '\0','/h3weAFgg06GqchI2xDfufBgSFTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10272386',8.2,249776,'en','The Father','A man refuses all assistance from his daughter as he ages and, as he tries to make sense of his changing circumstances, he begins to doubt his loved ones, his own mind and even the fabric of his reality.','/pr3bEQ517uMb5loLvjFQi8uLAsp.jpg','2020-12-23',97,'Released',NULL,'The Father',600354,14.0129,8.095,'4TZb7YfK-JI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22836,_binary '\0','/seQOxcSm29t7JRQ3TEQr1vmAtM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10272534',6.2,9058,'fr','Lux Æterna','Charlotte Gainsbourg agrees to play a witch condemned to be burned at the stake in the first film directed by Béatrice Dalle. But the chaotic production, technical problems, and psychotic breakdowns gradually plunge the shoot into a chaos of pure light.','/5oStzv8gUrAAevtIiv0icGcvAbq.jpg','2020-09-23',51,'Released',NULL,'Lux Æterna',599377,3.8888,6.1,'f6z5u_YY-Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22837,_binary '\0','/dR3AnN8i3TlAJtD9T5ZQ6CJGNWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10273738',4.3,2954,'en','The Abandon','Injured U.S. soldier Miles Willis awakens to discover he is trapped in a mysterious cube armed only with his combat gear. As Miles begins to question his sanity, he finds a lifeline – a voice on the other end of his satellite phone who claims to be a prisoner in a similar space. As the walls close in, these two strangers must put their heads together if they are to outwit their captors and unlock this deadly puzzle.','/vjno0bsWumTvpjQt4D910nUTG3a.jpg','2024-07-19',97,'Released','The real test lies within.','The Abandon',933088,1.7021,4.4,'KPrao47fD8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22838,_binary '\0','/2Pz0oF6TYsQxPuEdwuOjuDDideN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10274284',5.2,9973,'en','Girl Lost: A Hollywood Story','Interweaving stories of four different women involved in the sex industry offers a glimpse into the dark underbelly of Los Angeles and the taboo lifestyle of a sex worker. A teen runaway, single mother and two career escorts interconnect through their own personal journeys filled with loss, betrayal and the struggle to survive.','/6Dr0DRIbeioM62cIPQzZphX95la.jpg','2020-12-01',90,'Released','Behind the glitz and the glamour lies the truth...','Girl Lost: A Hollywood Story',771185,2.5596,5.933,'YCv-KKatM64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22839,_binary '\0','/T5xXoFqyc9jNXZIbH4Sw0jwWjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10275534',6.6,58015,'en','To Catch a Killer','Baltimore. New Year\'s Eve. A talented but troubled police officer is recruited by the FBI\'s chief investigator to help profile and track down a mass murderer.','/mFp3l4lZg1NSEsyxKrdi0rNK8r1.jpg','2023-04-06',119,'Released','A city at the center of chaos. A detective with special skills. A madman testing her limits.','To Catch a Killer',605886,8.7872,6.8,'KVO1LnqzxpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22840,_binary '\0','/oAcV4179Kdpvb2xk9TtS8Ewrp8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10276470',6.1,18295,'en','Work It','A brilliant but clumsy high school senior vows to get into her late father\'s alma mater by transforming herself and a misfit squad into dance champions.','/b5XfICAvUe8beWExBz97i0Qw4Qh.jpg','2020-08-07',93,'Released','Dance to your own beat.','Work It',612706,4.287,7.5,'OqcP_wkcl2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22841,_binary '\0','/jv9WTuEk7kW8JxgpjQ872CyiifP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10276482',5.9,19360,'en','Love Again','Mira Ray, dealing with the loss of her fiancé, John, sends a series of romantic texts to his old cell phone number… not realizing the number was reassigned to Rob Burns\' new work phone. Rob, a journalist, is captivated by the honesty in the beautifully confessional texts. When he’s assigned to write a profile of megastar Céline Dion, he enlists her help in figuring out how to meet Mira in person and win her heart.','/koswMk0y7jGcyofV1sBccnNtY0B.jpg','2023-05-04',104,'Released','Destiny has a plan.','Love Again',758336,8.8921,6.7,'CQDXtD2HJAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22842,_binary '\0','/vLyLITDzfsxyHNtgkqLC5bvR9CR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027658',6.7,1799,'de','Absurdistan','An allegorical comedy centered on two childhood sweethearts who seem destined for one another until the women of their isolated village, angered by male indifference toward the water shortage, go on a sex strike that threatens the young couple\'s first night of love.','/r6RchJPk6PiSX8LCw1PjQEyTyS0.jpg','2008-01-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Absurdistan',7344,0.871,6.118,'nLdyGDJWuBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22843,_binary '\0','/qySEOp4MLscb9JDl89ooUJKpbVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027683',3.8,2040,'en','Kill Speed','KILL SPEED is a high-octane, youth oriented, TOP GUN meets FAST & FURIOUS tale about best friends who fly home-built, high-tech planes to deliver Mexican manufactured crystal meth throughout rural California in order to fund their Hollywood, rock-star lifestyle.','/w64IOlFCuM2s7XRqW3pO5wTeHg6.jpg','2010-07-02',113,'Released','Live Fast Or Die Trying','Kill Speed',47467,1.7538,3.9,'KcEi28sQpFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22844,_binary '\0','/1JsfP7WQw8Mwi6s0u3wUetm7L2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027718',6.2,110389,'en','Wall Street: Money Never Sleeps','As the global economy teeters on the brink of disaster, a young Wall Street trader partners with disgraced former Wall Street corporate raider Gordon Gekko on a two tiered mission: To alert the financial community to the coming doom, and to find out who was responsible for the death of the young trader\'s mentor.','/gtonVdZZMWES6GyhasAX0xhUdrF.jpg','2010-09-20',133,'Released','Gordon never gives up.','Wall Street: Money Never Sleeps',33909,7.5382,6.094,'q7j8leLG8fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22845,_binary '\0','/1QX6QERf39ius66rzWmoJg3P8go.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027747',4.8,2853,'en','Stiletto','The seemingly random killings of an assassin puzzle her former lover, a wealthy Greek crime boss whose organization is jeopardized by his love for her, and the detective following her rising body count','/IGs3VTIpUdZqjJtM2QVs3Q4D8V.jpg','2008-04-29',118,'Released','Revenge never looked so good.','Stiletto',15542,2.4958,4.7,'MVaxz3EdJ_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22846,_binary '\0','/5paVClTdRK03JK793o2voEYhqio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027762',5.7,3638,'en','Wasting Away','Brain freeze has never been so bad once you’ve tasted Ale Cream, as four friends inadvertently eat some radioactive ice-cream, turning them into zombies. Only problem is they don’t see themselves as the undead, but as super soldiers.','/vOVG6bW0KZ6CKmyGUfDxsgBJtBO.jpg','2007-10-16',91,'Released','Zombies Are People Too!','Wasting Away',33789,1.2965,5.5,'XYgoKUWBgzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22847,_binary '\0','/lyyCKESFs9zeyJ353Ri4ws2oGyv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027820',5.6,5746,'en','The Incident','A group of cooks at an asylum for the criminally insane get locked in with the inmates during a massive thunderstorm','/5xjm939J8yb8jCfSi8T9ABopqhS.jpg','2012-05-04',85,'Released','When the lights go down, the inmates will rise.','Asylum Blackout',96648,2.163,5.6,'vwN9AZyelAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22848,_binary '\0','/79oCgYdfWJv6Wfew0xcsLgNZPIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1027862',6.1,20318,'en','Swing Vote','In a remarkable turn of events, the result of the presidential election comes down to one man\'s vote.','/aa5pWY2IVObKS7JZpfEw7Fe4FJk.jpg','2008-08-01',120,'Released','One ordinary guy is giving the candidates a reason to run.','Swing Vote',10187,3.3874,5.8,'fPICta8Rb9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22849,_binary '\0','/4mDvrSNZuEc4OrbJdXnEJO8LLmO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10279362',5.9,9672,'en','French Exit','“My plan was to die before the money ran out,” says 60-year-old penniless Manhattan socialite Frances Price, but things didn’t go as planned. Her husband Franklin has been dead for 12 years and with his vast inheritance gone, she cashes in the last of her possessions and resolves to live out her twilight days anonymously in a borrowed apartment in Paris, accompanied by her directionless son Malcolm and a cat named Small Frank—who may or may not embody the spirit of Frances’s dead husband.','/l5iZuQr62YCs72AZ9P3HwApowaC.jpg','2021-02-12',113,'Released',NULL,'French Exit',599960,5.015,5.62,'bqMJeE15YiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22850,_binary '\0','/cvpgZt6bxHLWUqdQTAxn0ZJri8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10279472',3.7,11659,'en','The Black Demon','Oilman Paul Sturges\' idyllic family vacation turns into a nightmare when they encounter a ferocious megalodon shark that will stop at nothing to protect its territory. Stranded and under constant attack, Paul and his family must somehow find a way to get his family back to shore alive before it strikes again in this epic battle between humans and nature.','/6ecSjKSjgIULyHfrfyyg9vgAI33.jpg','2023-04-26',101,'Released','Nature bites back.','The Black Demon',890771,10.9408,5.9,'1FRtbDz6U1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22851,_binary '\0','/x8yGoWB87AoRCHMX6TSICpG05jC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10280276',4.2,74908,'hi','Coolie No. 1','Insulted by Rosario, a rich businessman, Jai Kishen a Matchmaker teaches him a lesson by getting his daughter married to Raju, a Coolie, who poses to be a millionaire. They sense something fishy and Raju\'s deceptions are discovered. In an attempt to cover it up, he cooks up a story of having a filthy rich twin. One lie leads to another and things start to go awry culminating in a comedy of errors.','/vcUt45vSNZpf3G7AoMAXGaD9Lez.jpg','2020-12-25',135,'Released',NULL,'Coolie No. 1',614179,1.5925,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22852,_binary '\0','/oZftUn6yOt61LItXE4zPOz4rca9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10280296',8.3,51329,'hi','सरदार उधम','A young Sardar Udham Singh left deeply scarred by the Jallianwala Bagh massacre, escaped into the mountains of Afghanistan, reaching London in 1933-34. Carrying an unhealed wound for 21 years, the revolutionary assassinated Michael O’Dwyer on 13th March, 1940, the man at the helm of affairs in Punjab, April 1919 to avenge the lost lives of his beloved brethren.','/d4fpJXhUNukd5XnzRO1XfWf7v88.jpg','2021-10-16',162,'Released','An assassination which shook the British Empire','Sardar Udham',598826,1.5529,7.192,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22853,_binary '\0','/7rIMWTcvFDuTNhVpZwF57tTTUav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10283270',6.1,1743,'cn','神探大戰','A disgraced ex-police chief battles hallucinations and vigilante killers, risking his sanity to uncover a shocking truth about justice gone wrong.','/jFRXy8lMrUbm672ioKo0hc9Xpgr.jpg','2022-07-02',101,'Released','There is no chosen sleuth among us.','Detective vs. Sleuths',543504,2.2433,6.8,'vLo3Qfu0p0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22854,_binary '\0','/cK7H0HPiu6FDS2zyOZwboDsqoXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10283902',4.7,2876,'en','Feral State','A misfit gang of runaways and orphans are taken in by a dark and charismatic father figure, who together wreak havoc throughout swamps and trailer parks of central Florida.','/x6qTBIZdEmAaXCvaQqmBHYWe1lQ.jpg','2021-05-28',78,'Released','Out here, there are no rules','Feral State',794379,1.5131,3.7,'jDQ1NWmwoCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22855,_binary '\0','/4PXjYqkuBabnSAOaacAERf2D9zE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10284944',4.9,4116,'en','The Fix','When a troubled model takes a new drug at a party, she suffers a shocking transformation. Pursued by authorities and a dangerous gang, she hunts for a fix to reverse these effects, only to discover her mutations could save the human race.','/vY7bY2xZymoIOti4WM5K29OMzCS.jpg','2024-06-23',98,'Released','We\'re the problem. She\'s the solution.','The Fix',931940,3.0071,5.175,'GXtuqdImzp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22856,_binary '\0','/qbVCChwbGWDAgsCXKZxyjBrRiWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1028528',7,336923,'en','Death Proof','Austin\'s hottest DJ, Jungle Julia, sets out into the night to unwind with her two friends Shanna and Arlene. Covertly tracking their moves is Stuntman Mike, a scarred rebel leering from behind the wheel of his muscle car, revving just feet away.','/vtu6H4NWnQVqEp3aanUq3hNeeot.jpg','2007-05-22',113,'Released','A crash course in revenge.','Death Proof',1991,14.1673,6.8,'EAPy76vxF5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22857,_binary '\0','/gOeSj4YzwxZb6FgcYPRK2hEzTdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1028532',8.1,348378,'en','Hachi: A Dog\'s Tale','Professor Wilson discovers a lost Akita puppy on his way home. Despite objections from his wife, Hachi endears himself to the family and grows to be Parker\'s loyal companion. As their bond grows deeper, a beautiful relationship unfolds.','/lsy3aEsEfYIHdLRk4dontZ4s85h.jpg','2009-06-08',93,'Released','A true story of faith, devotion and undying love.','Hachi: A Dog\'s Tale',28178,18.1788,8.003,'Y6U7mAnPtw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22858,_binary '\0','/y2QZ8qCE4YWHo5hGYos26Jy5Req.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1028576',7.2,33037,'en','Secretariat','Housewife and mother Penny Chenery agrees to take over her ailing father\'s Virginia-based Meadow Stables, despite her lack of horse-racing knowledge. Against all odds, Chenery - with the help of veteran trainer Lucien Laurin - manages to navigate the male-dominated business, ultimately fostering the first Triple Crown winner in 25 years.','/6YJ39NqRJ0ljUQohizHmE2hB6Wh.jpg','2010-08-20',123,'Released','The Impossible True Story','Secretariat',39486,6.624,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22859,_binary '\0','/8nFmUlT0YzoKSsvHPVxPpBdBN9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1028581',5.4,2002,'en','Love n\' Dancing','When a bored-with-life English teacher meets a West Coast Swing champion dancer, they have an instant connection. Both feel that the other can fulfill what was missing in their lives. Jake and Jessica must try to elude all obstacles, romantic or otherwise, to stay focused on the goal – winning the World Title and winning each other. Will they give in to the pressure or come out like champs?','/xQiKnCSs1W158nQ30jqGZgRO4cv.jpg','2009-04-02',93,'Released','Let the passion take you away.','Love n\' Dancing',16004,2.4783,5.4,'3hKtIWLQF2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22860,_binary '\0','/tAbDYp1b7zK2oOhJKcza63dUtOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10287954',7,28089,'it','L\'incredibile storia dell\'Isola delle Rose','In 1968, engineer Giorgio Rosa established the independent state called \"The Isle of Roses\" off the coast of Rimini, built on a platform outside the territorial waters, with Esperanto as the official language. The Italian authorities did not take it well because the micronation was seen as an expedient to not pay taxes on the revenues obtained thanks to the arrival of numerous tourists and curious people.','/fbmYUDOo6tNq3A1VWhhxE6pjNEB.jpg','2020-12-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Rose Island',636565,4.2363,7,'qS2NtbEoIc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22861,_binary '\0','/a2pPepVPtKY7E4XEkT7W3ZxUOY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10288566',7.7,230809,'da','Druk','Four stagnant high school teachers decide to test out a theory that maintaining a constant level of intoxication will improve their overall lives.','/aDcIt4NHURLKnAEu7gow51Yd00Q.jpg','2020-09-24',117,'Released','What is youth? A dream. What is love? The content of the dream.','Another Round',580175,9.2647,7.629,'xlwAgvn1e5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22862,_binary '\0','/3otb50i2hzoToonuOaKn1ZQws9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10289996',7.5,1652,'en','The Black Godfather','Follows the life of Clarence Avant, the ultimate, uncensored mentor and behind-the-scenes rainmaker in music, film, TV and politics.','/3BQArnXPwM5nHeS1tlGKLY7eapP.jpg','2019-06-06',118,'Released','Music. Power. Respect.','The Black Godfather',606215,1.7828,6.6,'Gp_MsziYf4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22863,_binary '\0','/luKCKzm0sB0ikYjCn6GRxk44QQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10290116',5.9,1635,'kn','Gaalipata 2','Life surprises you with its weird plans and events which changes our lives so much so that we can never go back to being what we were earlier. At such times we have to rise against the wind just like a kite does. It is the same with the story of Gaalipata 2. Its story is set in two different time zones, in two different places but with the same characters. It\'s about a turbulent yet fun filled journey of three friends and their love interests.','/bA68sKaX8aOnWeKKpLLUriCmY2C.jpg','2022-08-12',149,'Released',NULL,'Gaalipata 2',691704,0.7759,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22864,_binary '\0','/ipkrxvlu0j5h7yNn5gT1SMSALcr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10290244',7.1,1306,'fr','Le Petit Nicolas - Qu\'est-ce qu\'on attend pour être heureux ?','Somewhere between Montmartre and Saint-Germain-des-Prés, Jean-Jacques Sempé and René Goscinny lean over a large white sheet of paper and bring to life a mischievous and endearing boy, Little Nicolas. From schoolyard games and fights to summer camp pranks and camaraderie, Nicolas lives a merry and enriching childhood – and brings friendship and newfound life to his creators, too.','/yTsaoXtBndypAQJj5C16d3Zmfxf.jpg','2022-02-15',86,'Released',NULL,'Little Nicholas: Happy as Can Be',893366,2.6674,6.8,'jTnqaOsozxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22865,_binary '\0','/yIDjueqZWVwLWvkqGXvuWbincoC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029120',6.4,13399,'en','Henry Poole Is Here','Henry Poole abandons his fiancée and family business to spend what he believes are his remaining days alone. The discovery of a \'miracle\' by a nosy neighbor ruptures his solitude and restores his faith in life.','/jUDrRxSuA7ZSHsIVd1MnFRtwLOf.jpg','2008-08-15',99,'Released','Changing his attitude will take a miracle.','Henry Poole Is Here',13107,4.4776,5.9,'Mf97fnD3ed0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22866,_binary '\0','/UQEjE4qPnfaD11Y8n24pQkBI3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029134',6,5746,'en','Birds of America','A regular guy struggles with a repressive home and professional life, as well as making amends for the trouble his free-spirited brother and sister cause about town.','/7E3AfrlN9DGHWTqWuKGRgz6aypo.jpg','2008-10-09',85,'Released','Some families defy classification.','Birds of America',14422,2.5377,5.5,'UsvbJ-c26fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22867,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029172',8.1,2557,'en','The War on Democracy','Set both in Latin America and the United States, the film explores the historic and current relationship of Washington with countries such as Venezuela, Bolivia and Chile. Pilger says that the film \"...tells a universal story... analysing and revealing, through vivid testimony, the story of great power behind its venerable myths. It allows us to understand the true nature of the so-called \"war on terror\". According to Pilger, the film’s message is that the greed and power of empire is not invincible and that people power is always the \"seed beneath the snow\".','/12oQAIiqYSjWmZtIY1XtHYpCk7Z.jpg','2007-06-15',96,'Released','Never believe anything until it is officially denied','The War on Democracy',22452,1.5793,7.5,'Hzq-DrjiMU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22868,_binary '\0','/rG2pFglPrNS1H0UmFu5z5KTTPtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029231',5.4,29211,'hi','कृष ३','Krrish and his father must team up to save the world from a psychokinetic evil man named Kaal and his army of mutants.','/tuHHTj59CNXGhI9eRZM47aa3zuC.jpg','2013-11-01',152,'Released',NULL,'Krrish 3',204435,2.6293,5.6,'_6Ix1VF_yWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22869,_binary '\0','/fO1hwjlUqDe1ixO7eMfxTby62Ut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029234',7,122747,'fr','Martyrs','A young woman’s quest for revenge against the people who kidnapped and tortured her as a child leads her and her best friend, also a victim of child abuse, on a terrifying journey into a living hell of depravity.','/sT5ITTlTcnPOeFzHEu5j0hTZUvD.jpg','2008-06-12',99,'Released','They haven\'t finished being alive.','Martyrs',9539,10.1497,7.293,'1a9AgSIpobc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22870,_binary '\0','/ji8AsF2vqsg88LzbOXakGGbRXSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029235',7.3,31720,'no','Max Manus','Max Manus is a Norwegian 2008 biographic war film based on the real events of the life of resistance fighter Max Manus (1914–96), after his contribution in the Winter War against the Soviet Union. The story follows Manus through the outbreak of World War II in Norway until peacetime in 1945.','/v9Z7CUGW1Q5L8GdGH3rY5SkU72L.jpg','2008-12-18',118,'Released',NULL,'Max Manus: Man of War',13752,3.8724,7.1,'WbK4WTQFf9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22871,_binary '\0','/nz38b87zXy5XnY3OKGXlUx64tcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029241',5.2,6307,'en','Vinyan','Six months after losing her only child in the Southeast Asia tsunami, Jeanne is convinced she sees him in a film about orphans living in the jungles.','/dzFmPTbLiOOciDS0MzfZw0hJGxy.jpg','2008-08-30',96,'Released',NULL,'Vinyan',16350,2.3757,5.091,'8xjc-Qu0PIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22872,_binary '\0','/gAsHuCQMN7mv4uFIvM4ACQ09hPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10293406',6.8,245008,'en','The Power of the Dog','A domineering but charismatic rancher wages a war of intimidation on his brother\'s new wife and her teen son, until long-hidden secrets come to light.','/kEy48iCzGnp0ao1cZbNeWR6yIhC.jpg','2021-10-25',127,'Released',NULL,'The Power of the Dog',600583,10.3377,6.731,'LRDPo0CHrko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22873,_binary '\0','/cuih9Rn2y72KhGkJYSmmkw1Y597.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1029360',4.9,64948,'en','Poltergeist','A family\'s suburban home is invaded by angry spirits. When the terrifying apparitions escalate their attacks and take the youngest daughter, the family must come together to rescue her.','/jBXupXZ7WEPUpkYFpkQsdipwBQn.jpg','2015-05-20',93,'Released','They know what scares you.','Poltergeist',243688,10.0073,5.2,'hVdzNlNxLxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22874,_binary '\0','/AguDwIJdqUFEUXlmXyixotE0WnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10295212',8.3,137572,'hi','शेरशाह','Inspired by the life of Captain Vikram Batra (PVC), the film celebrates his bravery, valiant spirit and honors his invaluable sacrifice during the Kargil War of 1999, at the age of 24.','/zGvFnwoXJKrYnKhoVPytqkqCJ8V.jpg','2021-08-12',135,'Released','How a soldier became a legend','Shershaah',599925,2.2078,7.277,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22875,_binary '\0','/hwUxHPkuUleJeoick4uZsrKDXxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10298810',6.1,138765,'en','Lightyear','Legendary Space Ranger Buzz Lightyear embarks on an intergalactic adventure alongside a group of ambitious recruits and his robot companion Sox.','/ox4goZd956BxqJH6iLwhWPL9ct4.jpg','2022-06-15',105,'Released','Infinity awaits.','Lightyear',718789,12.6738,6.856,'0ir3Z8hLeHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22876,_binary '\0','/5wDBVictj4wUYZ31gR5WzCM9dLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10298840',5.7,51329,'en','Strange World','A journey deep into an uncharted and treacherous land, where fantastical creatures await the legendary Clades—a family of explorers whose differences threaten to topple their latest, and by far most crucial, mission.','/a9x70QUXs6uEwtin1SGNKoFXoia.jpg','2022-11-23',102,'Released','Journey to a place where nothing is as it appears!','Strange World',877269,11.8736,6.22,'5lR0pkUjzb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22877,_binary '\0','/tGvE8tpY4WLvMkSH9YV7Mvhrdcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10298896',6.3,1608,'en','Over the Moon in Love','With her match-making business on the verge of closing, Brooklyn finds herself in the unique position to be featured in a magazine, but has to set up the writer with her childhood friend Devin who she may have feelings for.','/2JVwrut5sFraOrzHYVOzPblR13d.jpg','2019-10-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Over the Moon in Love',626267,2.3306,6.4,'XlDozmkZlV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22878,_binary '\0','/nTFleA0vJNfphRaurvDoItnzTkr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10300570',8.7,11164,'ta','கடைசி விவசாயி','Maayandi, the only farmer in a village that has abandoned farming, is charged with a petty case that leads to his imprisonment.','/8TNnEojAEc8Kt6HMWgQNRPcL9J3.jpg','2022-02-11',145,'Released','The Last Farmer','Kadaisi Vivasayi',613703,2.572,8.571,'cGorkMwcjd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22879,_binary '\0','/7Ssj4PL1jTfOlhKXUZ4oPnDIcdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10303324',4,12475,'en','Survive the Night','A disgraced doctor and his family are held hostage at their home by criminals on the run, when a robbery-gone-awry requires them to seek immediate medical attention.','/z3YyfWhzqvYqdd8YV6eixFEZJ3X.jpg','2020-07-03',89,'Released',NULL,'Survive the Night',686245,4.0521,4.8,'RHayO7NVl9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22880,_binary '\0','/cMcn5W38E5FVao1FqIZllO11nSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10303430',5.5,11284,'en','Sightless','After an attack renders her blind, Ellen withdraws from the world to recover. But soon she plunges into paranoia, unable to convince anyone that her assailant has returned to terrorize her by hiding in plain sight.','/rYCVKmkl1l9tbcCvrDSMERsRpmE.jpg','2020-09-29',89,'Released','You can\'t escape what you can\'t see.','Sightless',733156,2.9147,6.73,'oOAFdru_lQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22881,_binary '\0','/c40JjDfx1OJFY9fv9Mh0lbU6OoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10303892',4.7,1724,'en','The Outsider','A railroad worker unwittingly finds himself on the wrong side of a group of corrupt lawmen in the Old West. When tragedy forces him to seek justice, he soon sets out on a bloody quest for revenge to wipe out his ruthless enemies.','/36HLSziHVip4umkEjspf4IW9TKU.jpg','2019-06-14',86,'Released',NULL,'The Outsider',605347,1.4345,4.1,'DfImT3_2G34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22882,_binary '\0','/qyI3NAVrzq0THorufGdY91CK0Ea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10304142',6.2,109203,'en','Amsterdam','In the 1930s, three friends—a doctor, a nurse, and an attorney—witness a murder, become suspects themselves and uncover one of the most outrageous plots in American history.','/6sJcVzGCwrDCBMV0DU6eRzA2UxM.jpg','2022-09-27',134,'Released','Let the love, murder and conspiracy begin.','Amsterdam',664469,9.314,6.1,'GLs2xxM0e78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22883,_binary '\0','/4sPvEqb4XcCo0ZVoYuAOpbjyEm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10305616',5.9,1566,'hi','मलाल','When a rowdy Shiva’s world collides with that of a demure Aastha’s, whose family has just moved into the chawl he resides in, sparks fly between them. But given their completely different backgrounds, is there any scope for their romance to bloom and survive?','/AsnZdUdmfxEenKH3GNMtqIFAzDh.jpg','2019-07-05',136,'Released',NULL,'Malaal',611537,0.7795,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22884,_binary '\0','/3Fp07TNoYXBYly13LMCDv2P46xK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10306206',9,1390,'en','A Heist with Markiplier','You join Markiplier on the heist of a lifetime, but in this original comedic interactive story you decide how the heist turns out in the end. Choose wisely.','/QwfGRbVFDXpMSAUU4whDHUvEQR.jpg','2019-10-30',144,'Released','You\'ll be just fine. Hehe.','A Heist with Markiplier',645576,2.2981,7.6,'trYqU6kShPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22885,_binary '\0','/gmGJtBKnhf7FvhQGK9MCkPQQbjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10306228',6.9,2220,'en','This Is Paris','Meet the real Paris Hilton for the very first time as she embarks on a journey of healing and reflection, reclaiming her true identity along the way.','/44nWhN7Zkyi86K2waw7beJW8l9A.jpg','2020-09-14',105,'Released','Everyone knows her. No one knows her story.','This Is Paris',665052,1.9496,6.2,'rZUTFDjDZSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22886,_binary '\0','/9gXOA57zkxDko4yEE6vjFF538Xn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10307440',6,10771,'fr','Jusqu\'au déclin','Anticipating a disaster, Antoine, a father, attends a survivalist training given by Alain in his autonomous hideout. In fear of a natural, economic or social crisis, the group trains to face the different possible apocalyptic scenarios. But the disaster they will experience will not be the one they predicted.','/sIPNjDEf1iXOqULOXiRhqprllbz.jpg','2020-02-27',83,'Released',NULL,'The Decline',674607,2.4619,6.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22887,_binary '\0','/nFfXSe79XsJXkkcXZxcQDwbkBm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10307724',5.5,4511,'fr','Madame Claude','Paris, the late 1960s. Madame Claude is at the head of a flourishing business dedicated to prostitution that gives her power over both the French political and criminal worlds. But the end of her empire is closer than she thinks.','/9miY5tHWmvVAft4gjqyaXyhLYHY.jpg','2021-04-02',112,'Released',NULL,'Madame Claude',660006,2.4774,5.7,'OfWDTj5uLXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22888,_binary '\0','/3h2BxJPIwrPoHRzz0RRt8RVHoFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10308634',7.4,1745,'ko','어린 의뢰인','A success-hungry lawyer finds himself unable to turn his back on a suspicious case involving a child who claims she murdered her brother.','/fLss1W1DuAI9kL0Kc8iI9bnJt0.jpg','2019-05-22',114,'Released','The hideous truth concealed. i should correct it.','My First Client',591322,2.9155,8.467,'ZKfDdo0Anlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22889,_binary '\0','/5nOVWQD2sRNxYtYX9LBai7VGeRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10308878',3.4,1689,'en','Big Gold Brick','Recounts the story of fledgling writer Samuel Liston and his experiences with Floyd Deveraux, the enigmatic, middle-aged father of two who enlists Samuel to write his biography.','/pioc0HaWG2Cf3zoDEGjTgJOSBvv.jpg','2022-02-25',132,'Released','A \'cerebral\' comedy.','Big Gold Brick',624798,3.6462,4.8,'uDoQ2qzO8Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22890,_binary '\0','/5pfk7bITD5nBqYGJE2slHn4nx3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10308928',4.6,14605,'en','Force of Nature','A gang of thieves plan a heist during a hurricane and encounter trouble when a disgraced cop tries to force everyone in the building to evacuate.','/ucktgbaMSaETUDLUBp1ubGD6aNj.jpg','2020-07-02',91,'Released','When the perfect crime meets the perfect storm.','Force of Nature',619592,7.4556,5.1,'5PCBcCHwXuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22891,_binary '\0','/2LL1jHtNKJhTDc3tA1difsAnLui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10309552',5.5,5977,'en','12 Hour Shift','It\'s 1999 and over the course of one 12-hour shift at an Arkansas hospital, a junkie nurse, her scheming cousin and a group of black market organ-trading criminals start a heist that could lead to their collective demise.','/y40lD9qpKxnzsdKqAA1TiEKX5gb.jpg','2020-10-02',88,'Released','Pull your shift together.','12 Hour Shift',667141,2.3335,5.508,'vs_DkzeY0CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22892,_binary '\0','/ooRitBGGEalBFmnPFQCcQpehkBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10309902',6.2,29079,'hi','चेहरे','An ad agency executive takes shelter at an old man\'s home in mountains amid a dangerous snow storm, but soon finds himself trapped with no way out when the man and his clan of veterans hook him for a game of crime and punishment.','/egpv58u11MxepnNwXtzdMOagRdg.jpg','2021-08-27',139,'Released','Face the game.','Chehre',695951,1.2665,6.4,'-nKW5QfbcMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22893,_binary '\0','/nhNonVuTRJmAWu6tOaPUeipMxVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10309906',5.8,11339,'hi','शुभ मंगल ज़्यादा सावधान','Partners Karthik and Aman don\'t have it easy in their road to achieving a happy ending, while Aman\'s family tries to get him married to someone else, Karthik doesn\'t step down unless he marries Aman. A sequel to the 2017 film, titled Shubh Mangal Saavdhan.','/il9y4odx9el9Imwz6VMQrz9BcNz.jpg','2020-02-21',120,'Released','Jeetega Pyaar Seh-Parivaar','Shubh Mangal Zyada Saavdhan',606535,1.301,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22894,_binary '\0','/zEUKFDjxUPymRxa1GkPKAaW45qt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10310074',5.9,2266,'en','True Things','A young woman living on the fringes of society becomes intoxicated by a stranger who overwhelms her quiet life.','/sOgJH6gte9HtKWpulsLuEfiFZPx.jpg','2022-04-01',102,'Released',NULL,'True Things',682533,2.6302,5.3,'Uoh91HFx1Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22895,_binary '\0','/ckfwfLkl0CkafTasoRw5FILhZAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10310140',5.9,35736,'en','Fatman','A rowdy, unorthodox Santa Claus is fighting to save his declining business. Meanwhile, Billy, a neglected and precocious 12 year old, hires a hit man to kill Santa after receiving a lump of coal in his stocking.','/4n8QNNdk4BOX9Dslfbz5Dy6j1HK.jpg','2020-10-19',100,'Released','You Better Watch Out.','Fatman',602211,5.0812,5.578,'DWfPGIMDhNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22896,_binary '\0','/kiekkPuAC0VtTJdYt8EXLpIsogG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10310222',6.2,2175,'ru','Сторож','The protagonist Vlad is a man of about forty; he lives and works as watchman in an old sanatorium that is due to be demolished. He obviously needs this work to live the life of a hermit. One night a married couple appears at the sanatorium: Vera and Stas. They are on the run. They are pursued by former friends and business partners of Stas. Vlad decides to help them, because he too is hiding from the past. Each character is threatened with the inevitable payment for wrong choices in the past, but helping each other, they try to expiate these faults.','/67w4MXBPE0AA47QRDh0yuIJO2rf.jpg','2019-10-24',106,'Released',NULL,'The Watchman',575184,1.3227,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22897,_binary '\0','/kIsyRhnS3v88Z29Vg5gpdjR9XDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10311018',7.3,4289,'tr','Okul Tıraşı','Yusuf and his best friend Memo are pupils at a boarding school for Kurdish boys, secluded in the mountains of Eastern Anatolia. When Memo falls mysteriously ill, Yusuf is forced to struggle through the bureaucratic obstacles put up by the school\'s repressive authorities to try to help his friend. But by the time the adults in charge finally understand the seriousness of Memo\'s condition and try to get him to the hospital, the school has been buried under a sudden, heavy snowfall. With no way out and now desperate to reach help, teachers and pupils engage in a blame game where grudges, feelings of guilt and hidden secrets emerge, as time ticks mercilessly on and threatens to run out.','/yTqV0pzQkbpTs8olGghxOy3gwUX.jpg','2021-08-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Brother\'s Keeper',776659,2.2378,7.238,'xqTooDAQRgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22898,_binary '\0','/mhBAhE2Nam28Wl32fKe9Xaln9p9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1031241',6.7,7021,'en','From Time to Time','A haunting ghost story spanning two worlds, two centuries apart. When 13 year old Tolly finds he can mysteriously travel between the two, he begins an adventure that unlocks family secrets laid buried for generations.','/4qVw09ZMpyXWsHt1odiFzdAPCFB.jpg','2009-10-15',95,'Released','Unlock the secrets of the past...','From Time to Time',49391,3.456,6.3,'19bYsqvlXp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22899,_binary '\0','/4S5Po0vnveeABvV7ekI92IVn74W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1031243',5.3,1369,'en','Garden of Eden','A young American writer completes his service in WWI and travels across Europe with his wife and her attractive Italian girlfriend. Based on the novel by Ernest Hemingway.','/vWC2rQgaVEK5HZoCBD5BvQ4Wyv8.jpg','2008-10-26',111,'Released',NULL,'Garden of Eden',8368,1.5241,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22900,_binary '\0','/pm6CXRPzeLyDaKLSBaotED2gmyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10312668',8.2,3226,'pl','Tylko nie mów nikomu','Documentary film about sexual abuse in the Catholic Church in Poland.','/ouwDwzZcHW0KpJTh25qZULknYfz.jpg','2019-05-11',121,'Released',NULL,'Tylko nie mów nikomu',601818,1.0611,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22901,_binary '\0','/qJJHILLr0IIlDkpQ7OJnyPXfERJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1031280',6.1,44825,'en','Splinter','When their plans for a nature trip go awry, Polly and boyfriend Seth decide to check into a motel. On their way, they\'re carjacked and kidnapped by low-rent crooks Dennis and Lacey, who take the victims and their SUV to a nearby gas station. Along the way, they encounter an increasingly terrifying horde of parasites, and if any of them intend to survive, they\'ll have to outsmart the deadly organisms.','/tFNReQlU92jmN7uuR1HHLiFkEua.jpg','2008-10-31',82,'Released','It will get under your skin.','Splinter',13220,4.3956,6.19,'LYfvKLhG4Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22902,_binary '\0','/8SXjxL4nVxLQouaNkazQAklDX4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10314040',4.4,1308,'en','Unplugging','Think a rustic getaway with no cell service, Internet or social media is a romantic way to repair your marriage and sex life? Think again. Meet Dan and Jeanine Dewerson. The only spark in their bedroom is from the wall socket. Their daughter\'s best friend is her iPad. Dan\'s not going to take it anymore and plans a quiet, relaxing weekend in a remote mountain town. No kids, no phones, no social media, only clean fresh air and lots of romance. But what starts as the perfect weekend quickly becomes disastrous with unearthly encounters, strong edibles, and cranky odd locals. Without GPS to guide them or social media to stave off their boredom, Dan and Jeanine are forced to reconnect with each other. Can a \"digital detox\" really save their marriage and their sanity?','/tFL9lRtVUEmsVcggoag0u4H14mJ.jpg','2022-04-22',94,'Released',NULL,'Unplugging',606237,1.8908,4.9,'pkL_L7U2oYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22903,_binary '\0','/jmE8wxLSS90K1K01mCBaS4rQq23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10314450',6.1,32123,'en','Becky','A teenager\'s weekend at a lake house with her father takes a turn for the worse when a group of convicts wreaks havoc on their lives.','/9wqKF883Kn9c0SZV4ZmkIkFhBLh.jpg','2020-07-23',93,'Released','There once was a little girl...','Becky',601844,5.0812,6.333,'LQAJ5QvD8BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22904,_binary '\0','/k9IrG4stjLGYNZOhbe3Z8ZZWoEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10314548',6.1,4141,'en','Heart of Champions','During their last year at an Ivy League college in 1999, a group of friends and crew teammates\' lives are changed forever when an army vet takes over as coach of their dysfunctional rowing team.','/yhBhe8DjdFspNjMOyrqD8i9Gy60.jpg','2021-09-16',119,'Released','Talent wins races. Courage creates champions.','Heart of Champions',647581,3.3812,6.7,'sM-sndlCkuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22905,_binary '\0','/97bwlJw220Z5XE3xAHF6G8gA8g6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10315050',5.3,3787,'it','Dampyr','In war-torn Balkans, bogus monster hunter Harlan Draka is hired by soldiers who happen to be under attack by an army of actual vampires, uncovering the hidden truth about his past in the process: he is half-human and half-vampire... a Dampyr.','/xdWjqmX4x0ObKIPqkr8Vptj99AZ.jpg','2022-10-28',109,'Released','Shall a vampire unite with a human woman, she will give birth to a...','Dampyr',644124,4.005,6.2,'5oltja9prKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22906,_binary '\0','/bkEldbreK5i8TYtQaenM89OULx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10318332',6.9,1614,'hi','Badnaam Gali','A single pregnant woman living without her husband or any man, alone, in a society of people where everyone questions her character and mysterious lifestyle. Reluctantly, Divyendu Sharma finds himself involved in her life. His aunt, played by Dolly Ahluwalia, is a woman who lives in Badnaam lane (name of the residential complex in Delhi) and keeps track of the society she lives in and keeps her nephew informed about the whereabouts of its residents, particularly the Bengali surrogate woman, Patralekhaa.','/8W7qKTyTjdcdgvhmlkL8mm8oOMp.jpg','2019-05-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Badnaam Gali',601469,1.0989,6.455,NUL