coming a son-in-law to a second family might be the financial solution he needs.','/SPikoRuqAujpKJbayupR7h5mkT.jpg','2019-05-24',109,'Released',NULL,'Brother in Love',606413,1.7098,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22911,_binary '\0','/lqEjBR3osI3Ezup9onTXYz7RyNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10322274',7.4,27872,'de','Schumacher','Through exclusive interviews and archival footage, this documentary traces an intimate portrait of seven-time Formula 1 champion Michael Schumacher.','/ucNYfsbX1Z4tjMSr3waxsHMVjve.jpg','2021-09-14',112,'Released','Rise and shine of the Red Baron.','Schumacher',855823,3.0606,7.3,'OQs9ZtdZjY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22912,_binary '\0','/rSrJW3MHZLWBtiNV3fbVaqNYVpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10323676',5.8,36137,'en','The Contractor','After being involuntarily discharged from the U.S. Special Forces, James Harper decides to support his family by joining a private contracting organization alongside his best friend and under the command of a fellow veteran. Overseas on a covert mission, Harper must evade those trying to kill him while making his way back home.','/rJPGPZ5soaG27MK90oKpioSiJE2.jpg','2022-03-10',103,'Released','The mission is not what it seems.','The Contractor',628900,9.1912,6.3,'e7glvM8Xh0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22913,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10323688',5.6,1507,'bn','Password','Revolves around an underworld don, who loses the USB password of his Swiss bank account.','/4XsU4e57ykrDpgeJJ5n1KXtqXIk.jpg','2019-06-05',138,'Released',NULL,'Password',1159226,1.8284,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22914,_binary '\0','/c5m5MfjKFdQVCfUak84Lg9lxYiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10324122',5.1,7063,'en','Secret Society of Second-Born Royals','Sam is a teenage royal rebel, second in line to the throne of the kingdom of Illyria. Just as her disinterest in the royal way of life is at an all-time high, she discovers she has super-human abilities and is invited to join a secret society of similar extraordinary second-born royals charged with keeping the world safe.','/qnO3aXSqkKCDw5cEVyNUDexI4NJ.jpg','2020-09-25',97,'Released','Born to defend. They just have to learn how.','Secret Society of Second-Born Royals',621870,6.788,6.6,'Zq2OLayDn9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22915,_binary '\0','/wN5e6gMVBTEihohzFkuGyZGbDOw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10324144',8.1,41969,'hi','Article 15','A young IPS officer’s new posting in rural India has him confronting caste disparities and uncomfortable truths in the face of a gruesome crime. When three girls go missing in the fictional village of Lalgaon, two of them are found dead and there is no trace of the third one. Where is she and who is responsible for this heinous act?','/puyn1J1NOTG7P2dYxpOIl1583yf.jpg','2019-05-28',130,'Released','Made a difference, now we will make a difference','Article 15',597089,1.875,7.577,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22916,_binary '\0','/4Q9Ifxv58LePmYLfjWSVyzaf8p9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10324166',6.9,6698,'en','Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt: Kimmy vs. the Reverend','It\'s an interactive Kimmy special! Kimmy\'s getting married, but first she has to foil the Reverend\'s evil plot. It\'s your move: What should she do next?','/3lOYicrgvA6982iVUpD9860qf7X.jpg','2020-05-12',80,'Released',NULL,'Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt: Kimmy vs. the Reverend',683287,3.2996,6.4,'LZWmRUxOj9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22917,_binary '\0','/ciKBP3tgzUxp7sHFNZxofBXUS8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10327252',5.4,49516,'en','The Forever Purge','All the rules are broken as a sect of lawless marauders decides that the annual Purge does not stop at daybreak and instead should never end as they chase a group of immigrants who they want to punish because of their harsh historical past.','/lB068qa6bQ0QKYKyC2xnYGvYjl7.jpg','2021-06-30',103,'Released','The rules are broken.','The Forever Purge',602223,13.3165,6.9,'xOrXpK-rUaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22918,_binary '\0','/6FhmSHAmSjm5FGpLe2xqAl7ekFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032751',6.3,28064,'en','The Warrior\'s Way','A warrior-assassin is forced to hide in a small town in the American Badlands after refusing a mission.','/otjBqNDpZ3C9mzfDOI4kaiib3Qd.jpg','2010-12-01',100,'Released','Assassin. Hero. Legend.','The Warrior\'s Way',46528,5.6096,6.6,'Kq64CHaV8yA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22919,_binary '\0','/11V6JMreBokxvTZTsxmSQsibaRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032755',7.2,276925,'en','RocknRolla','When a Russian mobster sets up a real estate scam that generates millions of pounds, various members of London\'s criminal underworld pursue their share of the fortune. Various shady characters, including Mr One-Two, Stella the accountant, and Johnny Quid, a druggie rock-star, try to claim their slice.','/6mLXG2f7LBRpbZZgxsOFO5scgzd.jpg','2008-09-04',114,'Released','A story of sex, thugs and rock \'n roll.','RocknRolla',13809,7.1953,6.95,'QiQCdLIz3BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22920,_binary '\0','/arg5WXuhRFg2eDU0UIdPJsTnZTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032763',5.4,2257,'en','形影不离','A troubled engineer faces pressure at work and problems at home with his moody wife. American expat Chuck, rescues him from the brink of despair and becomes an unlikely mentor.','/pEh8Dz0bNnwULHXbZPhD84vtaM2.jpg','2012-05-04',97,'Released','Unleash your inner hero','Inseparable',51245,2.016,6.1,'ARVv_DtL95Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22921,_binary '\0','/6iA2Qv0jng4Dnhyyc8FB8CekdD7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10327842',3.2,1400,'en','Portals','A series of worldwide blackouts cause millions of mysterious cosmic anomalies to appear everywhere across the planet. Some people are drawn into them with horrifying consequences.','/rqJhdpyu8s9CPSqNEXlfBubROgU.jpg','2019-10-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Portals',636514,2.603,3.877,'_HKL8pGBigI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22922,_binary '\0','/axCh3DpOgISsPoMxKslQW9l4PO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032815',5.4,40136,'en','I Love You, Beth Cooper','A valedictorian\'s declaration of love for a high-school cheerleader launches a night of revelry, reflection and romance for a group of graduating seniors.','/mUi6nEbo04DR1YwflbZX1RR7UwS.jpg','2009-07-10',102,'Released','Popularity is nice. Popular girls are not.','I Love You, Beth Cooper',19840,6.8105,6.1,'-2iBfm1x7vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22923,_binary '\0','/2ygeX2Uh9stTu6weVKaYgryDiF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032817',6.4,4189,'en','Middle of Nowhere','The film follows Grace, a young woman whose irresponsible mother blows her college fund on her younger sister\'s beauty pageant campaign.','/4uhy3iCEBnY2SyXDo4lUpuj5j8N.jpg','2008-09-06',95,'Released','Life Without a Road Map...','Middle of Nowhere',19688,3.1487,5.8,'ExgqYawSqqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22924,_binary '\0','/NvUkrXYs7Md9Y39UlQu8Ylts4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032819',6.2,15817,'en','Powder Blue','On the gritty streets of LA, the destinies of four people desperate for connection and redemption are about to collide.','/o1wQcqOoQQF7tt1HijnmQRLjTo4.jpg','2009-05-08',106,'Released','Every life has a breaking point.','Powder Blue',17740,3.9725,6.1,'x5Dfuhm-zwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22925,_binary '\0','/9S2EjjcccmwrNb9MGsAFgwbHhj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032821',7.4,13240,'en','Tyson','Director James Toback takes an unflinching, uncompromising look at the life of Mike Tyson--almost solely from the perspective of the man himself. TYSON alternates between the controversial boxer addressing the camera and shots of the champion\'s fights to create an arresting picture of the man.','/ektR7eqmndjaYlYPciy4tJfrgh7.jpg','2008-05-16',90,'Released','The man. The legend. The truth.','Tyson',8940,2.7175,6.8,'3ItHFhH1tng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22926,_binary '\0','/nCKebrEB0kTPN10NUxoHumMTsnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032825',6.3,20439,'en','The Other Woman','Emilia, a law-school graduate, falls in love with her married boss, Jack. After Emilia marries Jack, her happiness turns unexpectedly to grief following the death of her infant daughter. Devastated, Emilia nonetheless carries on, attempting to forge a connection with her stepson William and to resist the interference of Jack\'s jealous ex-wife.','/pqbRrPwSpOUgMG8tyjwdT4enfHs.jpg','2010-10-28',98,'Released','Love makes everything possible.','The Other Woman',52505,5.4056,6.2,'VzWY97XJR2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22927,_binary '\0','/phYwx0HKSdcQyOuK5bMMO8woETT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032846',7.9,66530,'ro','4 luni, 3 săptămâni și 2 zile','Two college roommates have 24 hours to make the ultimate choice as they finalize arrangements for a black market abortion.','/acEtvzFPeOQwbzRWncjRLenhnKV.jpg','2007-08-24',114,'Released','At what moment do we begin to live?','4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days',2009,4.7751,7.5,'UjS7v4AEYco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22928,_binary '\0','/9RRPJpI7CqKXEyS3SDI85twA9FD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032854',7.1,1784,'fr','L\'avocat de la terreur','A documentary on Jacques Vergès, the controversial lawyer and former Free French Forces guerrilla, exploring how Vergès assisted, from the 1960s onwards, anti-imperialist terrorist cells operating in Africa, Europe, and the Middle East. Participants interviewed include Algerian nationalists Yacef Saadi, Zohra Drif, Djamila Bouhired and Abderrahmane Benhamida, Khmer Rouge members Nuon Chea and Khieu Samphan, once far-left activists Hans-Joachim Klein and Magdalena Kopp, terrorist Carlos the Jackal, lawyer Isabelle Coutant-Peyre, neo-Nazi Ahmed Huber, Palestinian politician Bassam Abu Sharif, Lebanese politician Karim Pakradouni, political cartoonist Siné, former spy Claude Moniquet, novelist and ghostwriter Lionel Duroy, and investigative journalist Oliver Schröm.','/10HlzNT0pqblQKgfo8fe7vPNxvG.jpg','2007-06-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Terror\'s Advocate',22521,1.5049,6.6,'MAqhvkUr-8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22929,_binary '\0','/hzcwTv5I0vBmzrs6k53e5xuCuqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1032856',7.5,14725,'he','ביקור התזמורת','A small Egyptian police band travels to Israel to play at the inaugural ceremony of an Arab arts center, only to find themselves stuck in the wrong town.','/gZPUNtSWnn23Zd88wxL5xzqYYqy.jpg','2007-09-13',83,'Released',NULL,'The Band\'s Visit',5259,2.539,7,'QWYlLb0jm8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22930,_binary '\0','/rhsvTWUeH6RKXk8pQ830oBw56qb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10329134',7.3,10209,'zh','刻在你心底的名字','In 1987, as martial law ends in Taiwan, Jia-han and Birdy fall in love amid family pressure, homophobia and social stigma.','/ynNO5FhArEz68wRKOn4NgqVntmS.jpg','2020-09-30',115,'Released','Who is the one linger in your heart after all these years?','Your Name Engraved Herein',719410,4.7254,7.891,'mzfVBg54BGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22931,_binary '\0','/2nMCDgLekQA2mumJLXJvGY4RUx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10329560',6.6,2608,'en','H Is for Hawk','After losing her beloved father, Helen finds herself saved by an unlikely friendship with a stubborn hawk named Mabel. Through the bond, Helen rediscovers the beauty of being alive.','/eg301AEGyYX4gtc0A8DEXQ0VMhK.jpg','2025-11-26',120,'Released',NULL,'H Is for Hawk',1243006,4.4465,7.1,'73V6kQfGyt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22932,_binary '\0','/eVFfdrBbDX1B3y1yIxoRjrGM24i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10329566',6,3799,'pt','Ricos de Amor','Working incognito at his rich dad\'s company to test his own merits, Teto falls for Paula and tells her he grew up poor, a lie that spins out of control.','/dVqRATKlpCoWy96lfxiHc9TY9An.jpg','2020-04-30',104,'Released',NULL,'Rich in Love',656563,2.5572,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22933,_binary '\0','/biUrxGIyrJjMGwASrPECVbrh6w4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10329614',5.9,23697,'en','Censor','A screener at the British Board of Film Classification (BBFC), who has earned an unsavory reputation for being the strictest censor of violent films, begins to spiral out of control after viewing a low-budget horror with similarities to the disappearance of her sister.','/1FOEEtGFPp5cgpLfPQVMB0UNVpI.jpg','2021-06-11',84,'Released','You can\'t edit reality.','Censor',663866,3.5841,5.8,'KRrhXjH1M70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22934,_binary '\0','/6fwE5d4Wp0uwjCvsj5R9BPtpw7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10329842',4.7,3714,'ru','Герой','An alumni of the Russian Foreign Intelligence Service who is settled in Europe gets a call from his father who was considered dead and he sets on a mission to find him with the help of his first love.','/9SCrT0CeD4ndjj5kGlyN0xMyViF.jpg','2019-09-26',120,'Released',NULL,'The Hero',575075,2.9962,5.9,'_iRg7as0O7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22935,_binary '\0','/yImmxRokQ48PD49ughXdpKTAsAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10332588',6.1,12892,'en','Finding ʻOhana','Two Brooklyn siblings\' summer in a rural Oahu town takes an exciting turn when a journal pointing to long-lost treasure sets them on an adventure, leading them to reconnect with their Hawaiian heritage.','/tTWl37oAYRXS3D5mEHmjveXXyrN.jpg','2021-01-29',123,'Released','Home is where ʻohana is.','Finding ʻOhana',644092,5.3587,6.221,'FTqLUEpWqEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22936,_binary '\0','/aOqxY4shYrlj8tPLbpH2l8UidhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10332672',5.9,2240,'tr','Annem','A self sacrificing, selfless mother who makes the impossible \"possible\" for her daughter - a daughter who is ashamed of her mother and wants to run away from her mother and her life with her. Her journey to the college drives Nazli away from the village she has grown up - but years later, she wants to go back to the village where she was born, back to her mother - after all those years passed by with tons of \"I wish\". Candan Ercetin performed her song \"Annem - Mom\" once again for the movie twenty years later.','/4jgF7lAjTD2i3ctUkm5BKy9FWrf.jpg','2019-09-20',104,'Released',NULL,'My Mother',630191,1.8674,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22937,_binary '\0','/yA3kt5sn0kAihfm2GybwOfvOusQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10332854',3.5,1283,'en','Alone','\"Alone\" follows a writer seeking peace and solitude in the countryside in an attempt to recover from tragedy and finish her book. However, as the welcoming country house turns into a living hell, she soon realizes that her inner demons are not the worst of her problems.','/muQIpXQD5I1ibJgxysDgtuayVHH.jpg','2020-01-17',81,'Released',NULL,'Alone',664425,1.0369,4,'R-YDmQY-_is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22938,_binary '\0','/eSl9MRMvWJ0Hm5yePHgsRhFtPTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10333426',5.4,22035,'en','Bliss','A mind-bending love story following Greg who, after recently being divorced and then fired, meets the mysterious Isabel, a woman living on the streets and convinced that the polluted, broken world around them is just a computer simulation. Doubtful at first, Greg eventually discovers there may be some truth to Isabel’s wild conspiracy.','/b7BllsQkD6nTkAdtd28UVCmKqVi.jpg','2021-02-05',104,'Released','Chase something real.','Bliss',613911,3.7122,5.5,'ZHtPm8v-yNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22939,_binary '\0','/ae1vyvzNIjhkSuwswAaHvwfvwpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10333912',6.3,14220,'hi','गुलाबो सिताबो','Set in present-day Lucknow, Gulabo Sitabo is a social satire about two impossibly peculiar human beings, Mirza Chunnan Nawab, who stays in a dilapidated mansion and one of the tenants, Bankey Rastogi.','/6ABuPqPqRv2iSDyLf9KJrLoNV2A.jpg','2020-06-12',124,'Released',NULL,'Gulabo Sitabo',611356,1.172,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22940,_binary '\0','/qwBhq38RDycERnJUmMKiaLiQxUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334148',5.5,9769,'en','Blithe Spirit','A spiritualist medium holds a seance for a writer suffering from writers block but accidentally summons the spirit of his deceased first wife which leads to an increasingly complex love triangle with his current wife of five years.','/phX4R5hjaavV2w1EcMXCtL5uDP.jpg','2020-11-10',99,'Released','True love never dies.','Blithe Spirit',644831,5.3219,5.738,'ug9dTP4KlDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22941,_binary '\0','/yzk1YugOFHPrzsLKZzEKB7c7Ppp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334222',6,1385,'sk','Svetlonoc','A mysterious woman returns to her mountain village home to confront her painful past. As she tries to uncover the long-buried truth, the local villagers accuse her of witchcraft and murder.','/pu632OPOiSAbMrBhAXh2gXuYcFF.jpg','2022-09-29',110,'Released',NULL,'Nightsiren',997660,2.2791,5.6,'3EruuDQvq44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22942,_binary '\0','/aVXmCGXBEdu0o13nESxTAeyMtqe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334410',6.1,1918,'fr','Le bonheur des uns...','Lea and her husband Marc have known Francis and his wife Karine for a very long time. Over the years, each one of them has been assigned a specific role. The balance and dynamic of the group is blown up when Lea decides to write a novel, which turns into an immediate bestseller…','/13VPJpQRcwoS0WbPgFtPenSfrdQ.jpg','2020-09-09',104,'Released',NULL,'A Friendly Tale...',598049,3.1553,5.817,'7ZbzDaZhN4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22943,_binary '\0','/8RL9atBsuRnRAhh0I2gWIV3AGfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334438',7.1,1740,'en','Becoming Cousteau','Adventurer, filmmaker, inventor, author, unlikely celebrity and conservationist: For over four decades, Jacques-Yves Cousteau and his explorations under the ocean became synonymous with a love of science and the natural world. As he learned to protect the environment, he brought the whole world with him, sounding alarms more than 50 years ago about the warming seas and our planet’s vulnerability. In BECOMING COUSTEAU, from National Geographic Documentary Films, two-time Academy Award®-nominated filmmaker Liz Garbus takes an inside look at Cousteau and his life, his iconic films and inventions, and the experiences that made him the 20th century’s most unique and renowned environmental voice — and the man who inspired generations to protect the Earth.','/qS1wLXuGjyXgsBoGW3gaok40IaU.jpg','2021-10-22',94,'Released','The extraordinary life of the ocean\'s great protector.','Becoming Cousteau',774823,3.2794,6.914,'P8Ph5ntmWGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22944,_binary '\0','/2WVauxJJwaZsN4mlxOsTtjKbA7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334456',7.4,2496,'en','Once Were Brothers: Robbie Robertson and the Band','A confessional, cautionary, and occasionally humorous tale of Robbie Robertson\'s young life and the creation of one of the most enduring groups in the history of popular music, The Band.','/sazERgUKcQ7gHFlUH4vBHoiqdHP.jpg','2020-02-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Once Were Brothers: Robbie Robertson and the Band',617771,1.9086,6.8,'ZYTpMZjZxwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22945,_binary '\0','/oHr3eZXgen7b0UuzLRMQnPdDEUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10334602',7.1,2374,'ta','சிவப்பு மஞ்சள் பச்சை','A street racer and a traffic cop end up becoming brothers-in-law. Can they accept each other given their previous hostile history?','/iiipCUNieXTIhzRF4fDH4S8rb8J.jpg','2019-09-06',140,'Released',NULL,'Sivappu Manjal Pachai',596652,1.0836,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22946,_binary '\0','/9gj3AbA08i0dbrV8XY91LORpYhU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1033467',7.7,1663,'en','American Drug War: The Last White Hope','Texas filmmaker Kevin Booth delves into a world of deceit and corruption controlled by a drug dealing government who\'s only allegiance is to its corporate masters.','/w0vpYFhUlBh6abcGKZgU53UOOst.jpg','2007-01-01',118,'Released',NULL,'American Drug War: The Last White Hope',25572,1.2424,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22947,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1033483',4.9,10220,'en','Kandisha','Shattered by the loss of her child, Nyla Jayde, a brilliant criminal defense attorney, takes on a case involving a 14th century Moroccan legend, a vengeful spirit named Kandisha.','/ovshbPjUeLQPYu2aRFwq8eXcmm5.jpg','2008-12-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Kandisha',197497,1.9362,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22948,_binary '\0','/afC5IhoNZb8MqDHuiWOAcLjqi6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1033575',7.3,260884,'en','The Descendants','With his wife Elizabeth on life support after a boating accident, Hawaiian land baron Matt King takes his daughters on a trip from Oahu to Kauai to confront a young real estate broker, who was having an affair with Elizabeth before her misfortune.','/8cDq5UlOPYeKm39okALCEOsZPxk.jpg','2011-09-09',115,'Released','The South Pacific ain\'t that terrific.','The Descendants',65057,9.3241,6.8,'3R7OzS54hbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22949,_binary '\0','/bNzptaU34tK2AHU859M5ca0devW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1033643',6.1,198194,'en','What Happens in Vegas','During a wild vacation in Las Vegas, career woman Joy McNally and playboy Jack Fuller come to the sober realization that they have married each other after a night of drunken abandon. They are then compelled, for legal reasons, to live life as a couple for a limited period of time. At stake is a large amount of money.','/n7bQ7Lj6UhArgnx49wmkaTxM4iU.jpg','2008-05-07',99,'Released','Get Lucky','What Happens in Vegas',9029,11.3683,