tLofRwuX0mdqcybPz03xhpIgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10341034',7.2,20276,'fr','Boîte noire','After being assigned to investigate the aftermath of a catastrophic plane crash, an NTSB black box analyst uncovers chilling audio anomalies that no one else seems willing to acknowledge. As he digs deeper for the truth, he provokes powerful forces determined to silence him before he exposes a shocking conspiracy.','/gIYxQoxQC78kQBxIKCR41hheqwb.jpg','2021-09-08',130,'Released','Some clues are better left unheard.','Black Box',663260,7.4197,7.3,'KDJMbKGonzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22955,_binary '\0','/dq9ShpvPDB7CmjgfPHHPUvshCLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10341196',6.7,2590,'en','Gigi & Nate','A young man with a bright future suffers a near-fatal accident and recreates his new life with the help of an unlikely animal friend.','/xP1GXV1gms9b5BpHZP7S8qs8FO.jpg','2022-09-02',114,'Released','Inspired by the true story of a life-changing friendship.','Gigi & Nate',829503,3.2219,7.654,'n_tgQ105coQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22956,_binary '\0','/aWuESNzOu1hfpBxCKR8v5kf5zwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10341248',4.9,1426,'ko','0.0MHz','The members of a supernatural exploration club called 0.0MHz explores a haunted house to prove the existence of frequencies that attract ghosts.','/4Ufe3fAm3VMvNezlKZaCVEfOzbo.jpg','2019-05-29',102,'Released','It only ends with a death.','0.0MHz',584586,3.0398,5.1,'3qW-Cosj3ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22957,_binary '\0','/8cdGniwh3vysVRFeWDJNa3bPQbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10342228',3.5,6181,'en','Narco Sub','A former U.S. Navy Seal is forced to become the international criminal he once fought against when a powerful and violent drug cartel kidnaps his wife and daughter.','/7p0O4mKYLIhU2E5Zcq9Z3vOZ4e9.jpg','2021-01-22',93,'Released','A man will become a criminal to save his family.','Narco Sub',706972,2.5579,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-