tiful neighbor, watching her through the windows of her home --- until she invites him in for coffee. He is drawn into a relationship with the young woman whose boyfriend goes missing; Robert becomes a murder suspect, gradually sensing he is the target of a larger plot.','/h9VizOOadBJixcbpswSqM0bb30c.jpg','2009-02-07',101,'Released','What would you do if someone was watching you?','The Cry of the Owl',18530,2.6752,5.7,'6XvJF56X3YU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22962,_binary '\0','/pqCfTRzYzojsyHvKtS6mHfC7Wc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10343028',6.4,18357,'en','Armageddon Time','In 1980, Queens, New York, a young Jewish boy befriends a rebellious African-American classmate to the disapproval of his privileged family and begins to reckon with growing up in a world of inequality and prejudice.','/wMK717aDWhboXOiVbZ9sLBqLmKh.jpg','2022-10-28',114,'Released','The end of an era. The beginning of everything.','Armageddon Time',615952,6.5512,6.4,'ZKLu3t-G9Do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22963,_binary '\0','/cwVwPnsMHrgfM0dkpAJIeU4YEQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034303',7.1,161812,'en','Defiance','Based on a true story, during World War II, four Jewish brothers escape their Nazi-occupied homeland of West Belarus in Poland and join the Soviet partisans to combat the Nazis. The brothers begin the rescue of roughly 1,200 Jews still trapped in the ghettos of Poland.','/kEF847cC9yAkgoeEZPQwnF08p6p.jpg','2008-12-31',137,'Released','Freedom begins with an act of defiance','Defiance',13813,6.8324,6.84,'7APcuF5nNfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22964,_binary '\0','/u03Ve0i2lIDN349IqThr9tdNjQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034305',3.1,1843,'en','Don\'t Look Up','While filming in Transylvania, a crew unearths celluloid images of a woman’s murder and unleashes the wrath of evil spirits.','/v7p4AO8GjtOJnuDsriwHNYx72Ua.jpg','2009-09-24',98,'Released','Lights. Camera. Terror.','Don\'t Look Up',4