n the U.S. Army hoping in vain that it will change her life.','/49hl7b0s6YCtO1qWDulBZ0RPmgo.jpg','2008-11-07',100,'Released','The Army Will Never Be The Same','Private Valentine: Blonde & Dangerous',15616,3.9269,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22969,_binary '\0','/lGWT72QzlEkICmYXw3nNjoLtNcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034324',6.6,2080,'en','The Mighty Macs','In 1971, Cathy Rush becomes the head basketball coach at a tiny, all-girls Catholic college. Though her team has no gym and no uniforms — and the school itself is in danger of being sold — Rush looks to steer her girls to their first national championship.','/frNp8Rmkr8wBDyKrZ89gYvrtxBa.jpg','2011-10-21',102,'Released','She dared to dream. They dared to believe.','The Mighty Macs',48620,2.0768,5.2,'mzcklOZ0WvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22970,_binary '\0','/stRc4geXiW3F2wZGxNt6EkasqfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034325',7,8301,'en','Phoebe in Wonderland','The fantastical tale of a little girl who won\'t - or can\'t - follow the rules. Confounded by her clashes with the rule-obsessed world around her, Phoebe seeks enlightenment from her unconventional drama teacher, even as her brilliant but anguished mother looks to Phoebe herself for inspiration.','/iiLMczPwwJE9sKjkg4Khdh3oFFn.jpg','2008-02-07',100,'Released','Dare to dream your life.','Phoebe in Wonderland',19079,2.857,7.211,'ZgA2UsaMe94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22971,_binary '\0','/29zDvVtGcJSzGTocSHqHDSNCQMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034331',6,96699,'en','Righteous Kill','Two veteran New York City detectives work to identify the possible connection between a recent murder and a case they believe they solved years ago; is there a serial killer on the loose, and did they perhaps put the wrong person behind bars?','/wKL5pzUfGOqOFjf0VN47nXlZOAL.jpg','2008-09-11',101,'Released','Most people respect the badge. Everybody respects the gun.','Righteous Kill',13389,7