,'tt1034419',7,1940,'en','White Lightnin\'','Deep in the heart of the Appalachian Mountains in West Virginia, where every man owns a gun and a moonshine still, abides living legend Jesco White, \"the dancing outlaw\". As a boy Jesco was in and out of reform school and the insane asylum. To keep him out of trouble, his daddy D-Ray taught him the art of mountain dancing, a frenzied version of tap dancing to wild country banjo music. After his father\'s death, crazy Jesco dons his father\'s tap shoes and takes his show on the road.','/5x6CYk5KwRT3Q4CJ7y8tuZ3btBr.jpg','2009-01-19',92,'Released',NULL,'White Lightnin\'',43817,1.7656,6.9,'qvstena8_2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22976,_binary '\0','/cyNQ1DRIQEBUekV5aZ9WMhfcd78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034427',6.8,2826,'ru','Александра','Elderly Aleksandra visits her Russian soldier grandson, Denis, at the Chechen war front, providing comfort as she tours his army. All the while, Denis ponders the reason for her unexpected appearance.','/6U6akMnCZyss1EVOR5P2SPHnDRz.jpg','2007-06-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Alexandra',17479,1.0189,6.1,'2Xg465lKEHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22977,_binary '\0','/zeF15T5ENMUeXc0hYXNpJ0ZDwrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034431',5.7,1237,'ta','பீமா','A constant tug of war between two underworld gangs trying to outsmart each other is offset by the arrival of a man of steel.','/p5Kl5NqdNL6DeRcUbVo9OV5R47l.jpg','2008-01-15',180,'Released',NULL,'Bheema',63673,1.0263,5.5,'moARYJlgkaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22978,_binary '\0','/paYpYBBEbsx5A7AHbSH8aQRB7fU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034447',3.2,1674,'en','Hydra','The Most Dangerous Game formula gets a monstrous twist as the mythical Hydra turns the tables on a group of wealthy human-hunters. Kidnapped along with three ex-convicts, former Marine Tim Nolan is transported to a deserted island where the super rich pay a fortune to hunt human prey. But this island isn\'t exactly deserted; it\'s actually home to Hydra the Beast!','/yS4UuZ3kDqUUl6pkPK1Fb8cn7lY.jpg','2009-02-20',94,'Released','Prepare to be consumed.','Hydra',24778,2.3016,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22979,_binary '\0','/yBBjPzpmgZb1r1gnBMPM0ND3F4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1034449',4.6,2716,'hi','किडनैप','A fortnight before her eighteenth birthday, Sonia goes missing. Her family receives a call informing them that she has been kidnapped and her estranged father, a US-based businessman, must now follow the kidnapper’s instructions to the letter if he is to entertain any hopes of seeing her alive again. Is this a mere kidnapping or is there more to it than what meets the eye?','/ewELRO32JnBBDTcYRtyrVD2Uyw6.jpg','2008-10-02',165,'Released',NULL,'Kidnap',19669,1.3462,4.362,'tvglWnRkUlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22980,_binary '\0','/serQTpLKTSNdGhmNMZarfa6wnah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10344522',6.6,16264,'en','Four Good Days','A mother helps her daughter work through four crucial days of recovery from substance abuse.','/uaJmqZxwAsdFLLjPGH5DzIEnbpj.jpg','2021-04-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Four Good Days',641960,5.4741,6.784,'uDDCulgiqs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22981,_binary '\0','/bCvrKrfXWcO6sNmFJ1UENEGlUII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10344956',6.6,3212,'en','Christmas in Rome','An independent-minded American tour guide is fired from her job in Rome just before Christmas. She crosses paths with an American executive named Oliver, who wants to buy a high-end Italian ceramics company. Oliver hires Angela to be his tour guide around the Eternal City, as the owner of the ceramics company won’t sell it to him until he learns “the heart and soul of Rome.” But is there another heart and soul that he may win?','/q5QaNyeS5TA7F0v4oTv652XGUUc.jpg','2019-11-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in Rome',626315,2.2345,6.6,'up_B5xyS0xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22982,_binary '\0','/n688PpHrRjtzJfu5YEZ4S9iem39.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10344986',6.8,2507,'en','Christmas Town','Lauren Gabriel leaves everything behind in Boston to embark on a new chapter in her life and career. But an unforeseen detour to the charming town of Grandon Falls has her discover unexpected new chapters - of the heart and of family - helping her to embrace, once again, the magic of Christmas.','/jgot7PGO2RTU2AK9n3MFMvSGCW9.jpg','2019-12-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Town',626318,2.5293,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22983,_binary '\0','/iumitnLEf97nK2iA9o23BjirT4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10345008',6.8,4156,'en','Write Before Christmas','A recently single Jessica sends Christmas cards to people who have impacted her life—the aunt who raised her, her younger brother in the military, a popstar who was part of the soundtrack of her life, the music teacher who inspired her, and the best friend who always tells the truth.','/jiC9CTgWVi9ytFrP01PtfvBamuK.jpg','2019-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Write Before Christmas',626319,2.5112,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22984,_binary '\0','/g8suShTJuiTjpsfhuY6IYxO8jtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10345022',6.4,2384,'en','Merry & Bright','Cate, CEO of the Merry and Bright Candy Cane Company, meets Gabe during the busy Christmas season. She assumes Gabe is the suitor her well-meaning mother is trying to set her up with when in reality, he works for Empire Corporate Recovery, which has been hired to take a closer look at Merry and Bright\'s operation and find ways to make the company more profitable. As Cate and Gabe begin to work together, they find ways to elevate the business and find that they have more in common than savvy business sense.','/gtEBjPz7xGkmvWPdLLdiIq19fhg.jpg','2019-11-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Merry & Bright',626307,1.6229,6.2,'S7xd4q1PA8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22985,_binary '\0','/A0zBBU1mXrtvIdVK7gD7SfwU1Mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10345024',6.3,1472,'en','A Taste of Summer','Gabby Ferrar moves to the town of Bright Shore, Massachusetts to open a restaurant after a stint as a sous chef in New York. Upon arrival, she encounters Caleb Delaney, a single father who runs his own restaurant and coaches the girls’ softball team. Both restaurants will compete in the Taste of Summer Food Festival hosted in Bright Shore. During the course of the summer, Gabby finds joy in running her own restaurant as she rediscovers her passion and gets to know Caleb.','/43i6SAmBASqhtCKluSQ4H7IGdQH.jpg','2019-08-10',90,'Released',NULL,'A Taste of Summer',612308,2.8664,6.4,'3QvEleU-xn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22986,_binary '\0','/kDQdFs5XL6G8TuXvd0NnJfQ59GP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10345590',5.8,6801,'fr','Comment je suis devenu super-héros','Paris 2020. While superheroes have assimilated into the Parisian society, they discover a new drug that gives themselves personal superpowers to mere mortals. Lieutenants Moreau and Schaltzmann are investigating the case with the support of two ex-superheroes, Monte Carlo and Callista. They\'ll do whatever it takes to dismantle the traffic. But Moreau\'s past resurfaces, and the investigation becomes more complicated.','/d0wn9YtEnmbucx8ZUsT918ctoiK.jpg','2020-11-19',101,'Released',NULL,'How I Became a Superhero',641501,4.2569,6.1,'CI6MV7ZTCbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22987,_binary '\0','/kYJNrQ5say16fewLCdOVGjNpsX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10345782',5.6,4293,'it','La scuola cattolica','Three well-off young men—former students at Rome’s prestigious all-boys Catholic high school San Leone Magno—brutally tortured, raped, and murdered two young women in 1975. The event, which came to be known as the Circeo massacre, shocked and captivated the country, exposing the violence and dark underbelly of the upper middle class at a moment when the traditional structures of family and religion were seen as under threat.','/WTTXAtuyQY93oe1yetWYMGbO7K.jpg','2021-10-07',107,'Released',NULL,'The Catholic School',747687,3.6552,6.166,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22988,_binary '\0','/ezaMkH1y6fFvJydpsc3Hf3oXcIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10350626',5.6,36417,'hi','गुंजन सक्सेना: द कारगिल गर्ल','Inspired by the life of a fearless young officer who made history by becoming the first Indian female Air Force officer to fly in a combat zone during the 1999 Kargil War','/llWz6LbVpGPChnNnhAiGJyPMDwP.jpg','2020-07-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Gunjan Saxena: The Kargil Girl',645489,2.0189,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22989,_binary '\0','/hJHfqLvYPz9nMPEZamjifHiXZbr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10350922',2.6,60025,'hi','लक्ष्मी','Aasif\'s belief in logic and science shatters when he gets possessed by a transgender\'s ghost.','/6COHwokEERAjjvlmNF44Xg9BK1y.jpg','2020-11-09',141,'Released',NULL,'Laxmii',603673,2.0651,4.5,'O7qj0uHi6i0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22990,_binary '\0','/7843Ecmas8f48gSFfwCMM5XLFWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10351180',6.4,8634,'hi','Bad Boy','A light comedy about a good-for-nothing boy who falls in love with a studious girl from a conservative family. Thus the funny conflict and situations that pop up.','/1GW9dRhoy7ahG4rIFbZkPPwFae0.jpg','2023-04-28',122,'Released',NULL,'Bad Boy',604198,0.9434,3.5,'bXOD_YOIh_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22991,_binary '\0','/tOfJuyfEbUMSSyBK24CAehphKwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10354106',5.5,5024,'fr','Stars at Noon','In present-day Nicaragua, a headstrong American journalist and a mysterious English businessman strike up a romance as they become embroiled in a dangerous labyrinth of lies and conspiracies and are forced to try and escape the country.','/viR50oQCs8ObciADFGWHUyChexZ.jpg','2022-10-14',138,'Released','A sumptuous tale of romance and espionage.','Stars at Noon',603204,10.9609,5.813,'Yg3EQ1_zRow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22992,_binary '\0','/pYSecGuGHH6izo0ExKbnCBwsDy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1035729',6.5,1349,'fr','Le Bal des actrices','A director wants to make a documentary about actresses, all actresses: the popular ones, the unknown ones, the intellectuals, the comedians, the forgotten ones... Filming everything, with or without their consent, the director gets caught up in the game and lets herself be devoured by these women, who are as fragile as they are manipulative.','/sjTGM0O0MSlq4QRWke4INJiA1QQ.jpg','2009-01-28',105,'Released',NULL,'All About Actresses',14720,2.3151,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22993,_binary '\0','/fgGaJdh1XfRgs8KxpzAVxhNyKX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1035730',7,7496,'de','Anonyma - Eine Frau in Berlin','A woman tries to survive the invasion of Berlin by the Soviet troops during the last days of World War II.','/6ZMkrrmR21rTibFzTeSCollOpbt.jpg','2008-10-23',131,'Released','World War II ends and her story begins...','A Woman in Berlin',12832,2.8627,6.64,'xEZxcSf9HwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22994,_binary '\0','/kZkk6iLvFPOiF6Xze2fYSiTbJ1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1035736',6.6,44004,'fr','Coco avant Chanel','Several years after leaving the orphanage, to which her father never returned for her, Gabrielle Chanel finds herself working in a provincial bar. She\'s both a seamstress for the performers and a singer, earning the nickname Coco from the song she sings nightly with her sister. A liaison with Baron Balsan gives her an entree into French society and a chance to develop her gift for designing.','/nNpP1P2EufA6TN7fQOBeHUIVmeH.jpg','2009-04-22',110,'Released','Before she was France\'s famous mademoiselle…','Coco Before Chanel',11156,6.2263,6.861,'isEnyrd2Moc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22995,_binary '\0','/oTb6rOgKkJYTbryxwNX41A4eUjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10358022',5.7,3464,'de','Nightlife','Milo works as a bartender in Berlin and one night gets to know his dream woman Sunny through a series of coincidences. The two meet for a date, but the perfect romantic evening so far.','/g2VSMJnixa53UreCI7Ol8iZsj8X.jpg','2020-02-13',111,'Released',NULL,'Nightlife',653910,1.9727,6.064,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22996,_binary '\0','/wSlseKhsG5VrL8zRvZG8ckqtsuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10358198',4.2,8005,'en','The Dinner Party','A budding playwright and his wife attend a dinner party hosted by wealthy, cultural elites, who have promised to bankroll the writer\'s latest play to Broadway, but, in fact, have darker designs in mind for the couple.','/grW6YaFYZgqSoO0DBkKuGC4cgAI.jpg','2020-05-29',115,'Released',NULL,'The Dinner Party',686003,2.0556,4.3,'1fNntz-mjUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22997,_binary '\0','/3oQUBXkuqM6YgiRLU9CECVF0aGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10358782',6.8,1566,'ja','ジャーニー 太古アラビア半島での奇跡と戦いの物語','As a ruthless invader threatens to enslave their people and destroy the Kaaba, a sacred sanctuary, the people of Mecca take up arms. Only able to muster a small force against the massive army, defeat seems all but inevitable. Aus, a seemingly simple potter fighting to protect his family, is forced to reveal his dark past. Abraha\'s army is fast approaching, and the fate of Mecca and its people hangs in the balance. Will the people of Mecca defeat the colossal army with nothing but their simple defenses and their love for their city?','/noA8RnhSDDhW8Od4C7s0J9muNYA.jpg','2021-06-25',110,'Released',NULL,'The Journey',641951,1.9877,6.9,'EP6FKs1JsnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22998,_binary '\0','/8R8K2CeyHKVX5QX6CuYcu0hIuGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10360104',5.2,1821,'en','Silent Hours','Private detective John Duval, an ex-lieutenant commander in the Royal Navy and Naval Intelligence, finds himself the prime suspect in a police hunt for a sexual killer when three women are brutally murdered.','/re09M47jDGgoumSBrKtaOpIeLp7.jpg','2021-09-01',155,'Released',NULL,'Silent Hours',882251,2.0574,5.3,'X4JAF7rt0OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(22999,_binary '\0','/giutn8OjG6WPQ7eqlk9PoJQyCae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10360772',6.3,6613,'nl','Mijn beste vriendin Anne Frank','Based on the real-life friendship between Anne Frank and Hannah Goslar, from Nazi-occupied Amsterdam to their harrowing reunion in a concentration camp.','/6codIHEKVYwbQ9Ey6CNoqWA9yxD.jpg','2021-10-07',103,'Released',NULL,'My Best Friend Anne Frank',788045,2.6404,6.793,'1ygQATx7_4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23000,_binary '\0','/mHn7lH73n4Q6x3ncW11SXXCRBwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10360862',6.9,7881,'ar','الرجل الذي باع ظهره','To be able to travel to Europe and find the love of his life, Sam Ali, a Syrian refugee, accepts to have his back tattooed by one of the most sulfurous contemporary artist; becoming that way a precious work of art.','/oQyivgBwqfIp9Bu7LAssj3HQpOz.jpg','2021-03-15',104,'Released','What price would you pay for freedom?','The Man Who Sold His Skin',669363,2.5973,6.558,'lZ2-d_cWVq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23001,_binary '\0','/6hgItrYQEG33y0I7yP2SRl2ei4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10362466',5.1,45110,'en','After We Collided','Tessa finds herself struggling with her complicated relationship with Hardin; she faces a dilemma that could change their lives forever.','/kiX7UYfOpYrMFSAGbI6j1pFkLzQ.jpg','2020-09-02',105,'Released','Can love overcome the past?','After We Collided',613504,10.4005,7.151,'2SvwX3ux_-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23002,_binary '\0','/mjIuTXM4FhLAT1apxHULetAZAfj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10362566',5.3,6497,'en','The Exorcism of God','An American priest working in Mexico is considered a saint by many local parishioners. However, due to a botched exorcism, he carries a secret that’s eating him alive until he gets an opportunity to face his demon one final time.','/hangTmbxpSV4gpHG7MgSlCWSSFa.jpg','2022-03-11',98,'Released','God and the Devil cannot exist in the same body.','The Exorcism of God',836225,7.3949,7.1,'VdLI8I4jZD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23003,_binary '\0','/iEFuHjqrE059SmflBva1JzDJutE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10364034',6.1,8510,'fr','Miraculous - le film','After a guardian of magical jewels turns an awkward girl and a popular boy into superheroes, they can never reveal their identities — even to each other.','/dQNJ8SdCMn3zWwHzzQD2xrphR1X.jpg','2023-07-05',105,'Released','The fate of the world is in their hands.','Miraculous: Ladybug & Cat Noir, The Movie',496450,17.0705,7.621,'3fzFvZToh8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23004,_binary '\0','/zjqvYpo7SZ23QI8GO77zRO68kEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10365912',7.5,9605,'en','Becoming Led Zeppelin','The individual journeys of the four members of the band, as they move through the music scene of the 1960s, playing small clubs throughout Britain and performing some of the biggest hits of the era, until their meeting in the summer of 1968 for a rehearsal that changes their lives forever.','/zK67RUQeVXv01q6E1TnS4g3Hlw2.jpg','2025-02-05',122,'Released','An access-all-areas journey to','Becoming Led Zeppelin',857800,4.3846,7.431,'EDKC77QS8WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23005,_binary '\0','/1xhcEecvRJXQ2OAVO7l9btlrN6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10365998',6,75309,'en','Infinity Pool','While staying at an isolated island resort, James and Em are enjoying a perfect vacation of pristine beaches, exceptional staff, and soaking up the sun. But guided by the seductive and mysterious Gabi, they venture outside the resort grounds and find themselves in a culture filled with violence, hedonism, and untold horror. A tragic accident leaves them facing a zero tolerance policy for crime: either you\'ll be executed, or, if you’re rich enough to afford it, you can watch yourself die instead.','/cQKyNm0Nz6KWiDBQF9w4aZAmOfC.jpg','2023-01-27',118,'Released','Find out what kind of creature you really are.','Infinity Pool',667216,8.4086,6.033,'PVnIMvVEkrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23006,_binary '\0','/7I6VUdPj6tQECNHdviJkUHD2u89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10366206',7.6,419605,'en','John Wick: Chapter 4','With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick uncovers a path to defeating The High Table. But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.','/vZloFAK7NmvMGKE7VkF5UHaz0I.jpg','2023-03-21',170,'Released','No way back, one way out.','John Wick: Chapter 4',603692,33.6459,7.711,'qEVUtrk8_B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23007,_binary '\0','/xHN6SbfKqnDS7BWDRIMJvSAmdMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10366428',6,1235,'fr','Le sens de la famille','Husband does not understand his wife? Conflict with children? Do you want to be heard and stood in your place? Be afraid of your desires. In this family, everything changed places, including grandmother.','/qXeJkpKnG5wl2UqnudHapIEjyaY.jpg','2021-06-30',92,'Released',NULL,'Family Swap',606236,2.9167,5.9,'35p4fEEgL78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23008,_binary '\0','/v85FlkbMYKa5du1glm0YfYNsL2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10366460',8,232653,'en','CODA','As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family\'s fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.','/BzVjmm8l23rPsijLiNLUzuQtyd.jpg','2021-08-13',112,'Released','Every family has its own language.','CODA',776503,15.3004,7.9,'0pmfrE1YL4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23009,_binary '\0','/AfrGOrPC85hte5sSb94zlSizalT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10366514',6.3,9343,'fr','Eiffel','The French government is asking Gustave Eiffel to design something spectacular for the 1889 Paris World Fair, but he simply wants to design the subway—until he crosses paths with a mysterious woman from his past.','/lG2gzXq2ZhZ806Ac7KCKsvNJ6yK.jpg','2021-10-07',108,'Released','You will never look at it the same way again.','Eiffel',655082,2.942,6.231,'STXwmr01J0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23010,_binary '\0','/wLdRx7aCc1i3P3kknIVKjcMZYQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10366574',7.3,4761,'es','Noche de fuego','Ana and her two best friends, Maria and Paula, navigate life in their oppressive countryside village. Whilst their families struggle in the poppy fields harvesting opium, the girls try to grow alongside the creeping terror of their cartel oppressors.','/n9nMTsuaWRwKe0GfAmEGMEILqog.jpg','2021-09-16',110,'Released','Find the light in the darkness.','Prayers for the Stolen',670981,3.5891,7.58,'hUwh3w6lv-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23011,_binary '\0','/zA3Ttc2jey61xlXADh777Oxdj2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10369966',7,1589,'en','Mystery 101: Playing Dead','The local theater is producing a mystery that crime fiction expert Amy unearthed. When one of the actress\' life is threatened, Amy & Travis must uncover which character is playing for keeps.','/zzrV6Zf06GmQuNxtHOzmJImtYjx.jpg','2019-06-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Mystery 101: Playing Dead',606462,2.4254,7.5,'xum_8zBTeeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23012,_binary '\0','/1catVWt8NTkJ3MlyMPRe4VQoSfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10369978',7.2,1787,'en','Love and Sunshine','Ally Craig has been fostering retired military dog, Sunshine, as she recovers from a broken engagement. But sparks fly again when Sunshine\'s military partner, Jake Terry, returns to claim the dog.','/vKNq4Q9o6TeQ2gpsDBMQ0pZLDV7.jpg','2019-08-03'