0'),(23021,_binary '\0','/mSEG0pGyCEwAWh7qNgxnuPnd8jU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037116',6.7,2815,'ja','劇場版ワンピース エピソードオブアラバスタ 砂漠の王女と海賊たち','The Straw Hat Pirates are on a quest to save the desert kingdom of Alabasta. A civil war brews among the sands, one started and stirred by the hand of none other than Crocodile and his corrupted Baroque Works gang. The stakes run ever higher as Princess Vivi\'s homeland threatens to tear itself apart. More than lives are on the line.','/qryaZLg7DkBkZtwKWTH6dfXjT3r.jpg','2007-03-03',90,'Released','Six pirates may be all that stand between salvation and total destruction!','One Piece: The Desert Princess and the Pirates: Adventure in Alabasta',25278,4.1199,6.9,'FgtOfTYjPB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23022,_binary '\0','/aRTPt9ZK8oKlolgLZzlMm8UDvop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037156',6.7,4868,'en','Stone of Destiny','Tells of the daring heist of The Stone of Destiny in the 1950s by a charming group of idealistic Scottish undergraduates, whose action rekindled Scottish nationalistic pride.','/rZWhnQY4Efi0iYQpnagP4vyaYps.jpg','2008-12-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Stone of Destiny',12407,2.1358,6.5,'-vnBvDPXZk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23023,_binary '\0','/caMQlCtw1Qn44OQx2zEfn9ZN5eb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037163',7.1,3348,'ar','الزمن الباقي','An examination of the creation of the state of Israel in 1948 through to the present day. A semi-biographic film, in four chapters, about a family spanning from 1948 until recent times. Combined with intimate memories of each member, the film attempts to portray the daily life of those Palestinians who remained in their land and were labelled \"Israeli-Arabs,\" living as a minority in their own homeland.','/e5TZB7yvSr7LDoVrlVeeSotpRD0.jpg','2009-08-12',109,'Released',NULL,'The Time That Remains',44898,1.7997,7.3,'ZmUPHXAC3Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23024,_binary '\0','/7QxRFKMchuASEMkUM1lnBqoG6Ek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037218',6.8,13408,'en','Flashbacks of a Fool','An aging Hollywood star, Joe Scott, lives a life of narcissistic hedonism, observed by his laconic personal assistant, Ophelia. The death of his childhood best friend, Boots, takes our protagonist, and the movie, into an extended flashback to a sea-side town in 1970s Britain.','/z5lGyJD8nHZt0cKf2n6uR7svBbS.jpg','2008-06-05',110,'Released',NULL,'Flashbacks of a Fool',13793,4.1501,6.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23025,_binary '\0','/trReRS0zTUuOIaOGNtaMac9bvRO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037222',5.2,2305,'en','Robosapien: Rebooted','A robotic boy and a human boy join forces to save their parents from the organization that funded the robot\'s creator.','/gaqSskw7kNNpyZjtW5QA8nnKQUn.jpg','2013-04-01',86,'Released','The ultimate secret weapon and your best friend','Robosapien: Rebooted',187462,2.1985,5.5,'vvFaHPF2LFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23026,_binary '\0','/UupaJ5hncoJCS8xMwLoNWHceut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037228',6.6,1645,'de','Wolke 9','A romantic drama about a woman who enters into an affair after 30 years of marriage.','/qMy6iMc4aygfw3wuCtCdbRyjG5a.jpg','2008-05-17',98,'Released','A Story of New Love in Old Age','Cloud 9',8906,1.7061,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23027,_binary '\0','/ndTjjoXdkExEo4on7iCv0Y1k70S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10373344',6.5,2686,'en','Fisherman\'s Friends: One and All','Following the unexpected success of the band’s debut album “No Hopers, Jokers and Rogues”, we re-join them almost a year later, struggling with the pressures, pitfalls and temptations of their newfound fame, second album syndrome, and performing on the pyramid stage at Glastonbury.','/WeMkqQizO3GAdgTvm5wLeQBFUK.jpg','2022-08-19',112,'Released','The buoys are back in town.','Fisherman\'s Friends: One and All',684006,2.3079,6.5,'-Ef0XMH2bwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:2