be a competitor in the love department. Jorrit falls deeply for the attractive and free-spirited Lola , a Dutch woman settled in Miami, who is also a stripper and who counts Pablo as one of her suitors. Jorrit will have to find out where the boundaries of seduction and freedom lie in their work. Meanwhile, an ego clash between Bas and Jorrit leads to a disastrous opening of their club. Ultimately, it is the camaraderie that made our boys successful in the first place, that will save their enterprise.','/sy8MmXSNmJButdK9N5D7CngJQCb.jpg','2020-01-30',115,'Released',NULL,'Men at Work 2',641167,1.5843,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23032,_binary '\0','/srCp0GBqeTOCtPprRoPjzJX4XQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10375396',6,4417,'en','God\'s Creatures','In a windswept fishing village, a mother is torn between protecting her beloved son and her own sense of right and wrong. A lie she tells for him rips apart their family and close-knit community.','/4xjkwZ8EwDzZ3dsQRvyW1fntqXT.jpg','2022-09-30',101,'Released','A mother\'s love forsaken.','God\'s Creatures',828558,3.9862,6.1,'fyOk1QVDlsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23033,_binary '\0','/BjLgTDAcZc94KomcQAxMVye0yI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10375470',6.9,16258,'en','Supernova','Sam and Tusker, partners of 20 years, are traveling across England in their old RV visiting friends, family and places from their past. Since Tusker was diagnosed with early-onset dementia two years ago, their time together is the most important thing they have. As the trip progresses, however, their ideas for the future clash, secrets come out, and their love for each other is tested as never before. Ultimately, they must confront the question of what it means to love one another in the face of Tusker’s illness.','/c21Vwt4shqVxCQziFz0Hf91wSow.jpg','2020-11-20',94,'Released',NULL,'Supernova',642208,4.0366,6.851,'I4Vk0CVcDts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23034,_binary '\0','/2WU6Y6aonzD6uAaCmNnEFlesxxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10375624',7.3,53265,'en','Voicemails for Isabelle','A young woman\'s hilariously confessional voicemails to her late sister are unknowingly redirected to a stranger, who begins to fall in love from afar.','/canZTWSxACSnAluir3dCtMxKpA1.jpg','2026-06-20',119,'Released','Sometimes the universe leaves you a message.','Voicemails for Isabelle',614945,20.3202,8.3,'9mi3YVYm3ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23035,_binary '\0','/l8m1yRpUVkgE3ok7AmvpBWQOFeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10375682',6.8,2268,'de','Leberkäsjunkie','While dealing with a burnt-down house, smelly diapers and brutal lack of sleep, a Lower Bavarian police officer faces his worst adversary: cholesterol.','/gMCNiOVCSxg4C7per145CVVFd18.jpg','2019-08-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Leberkäsjunkie',571756,1.5126,6.926,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23036,_binary '\0','/1Bpp8ka23S4gRVJYipfayXViaMQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10375972',6.4,1980,'da','Vores mand i Amerika','The Danish ambassador to Washington declares himself to be the sole representative of a free Denmark during the Nazi occupation of the country.','/5dwG9e4vtKTVEhSec8bQJsLut4t.jpg','2020-08-13',116,'Released',NULL,'The Good Traitor',702557,2.5842,5.5,'sNcIUlpkGJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23037,_binary '\0','/aPrrrGtSjXbw8XnpzsVJgF0ioq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037705',6.8,364253,'en','The Book of Eli','A post-apocalyptic tale, in which a lone man fights his way across America in order to protect a sacred book that holds the secrets to saving humankind.','/1H1y9ZiqNFaLgQiRDDZLA55PviW.jpg','2010-01-14',118,'Released','Some will kill to have it. He will kill to protect it.','The Book of Eli',20504,18.5641,6.8,'yAQcwKY0Dik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23038,_binary '\0','/gm9REvuEjb3p2gylDsAzoT1G0r7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1037850',7.5,9985,'zh','不能說的秘密','Ye Xiang Lun, a talented piano player is a new student at the prestigious Tamkang School. On his first day, he meets Lu Xiao Yu, a pretty girl playing a mysterious piece of music.','/pOqdX6e4y2F9JTyoe4qorBtXVaR.jpg','2007-07-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Secret',20342,4.0099,7.512,'DTDuOkNSJA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23039,_binary '\0','/qQArpaoclJyynR5DCVoFCChQ7OC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038011',3.8,1897,'en','The Tomb','Successful writer and scholar Jonathan Merrick falls under the spell of the irresistible, bewitchingly beautiful Ligeia. She\'s fighting a fatal illness and she will stop at nothing to defeat death, her one true enemy.','/jlUzImT4x2Gkm46dUpw47AhuYFR.jpg','2009-11-05',89,'Released','Her body, your soul.','The Tomb',36686,3.0521,4.3,'tqCBn48x95U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23040,_binary '\0','/65MrvoxmfzOG31JUYkwW8qur1gk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038043',6.8,10766,'en','Mammoth','When Leo travels to Thailand on business, he unwittingly sets off a chain of events that will have dramatic consequences for everyone.','/4im5yJARbUQo4bQO7BTIosXS9cf.jpg','2009-01-19',125,'Released','What keeps you together when you\'re worlds apart?','Mammoth',33974,2.38,6.149,'dKg9gJ7dWQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23041,_binary '\0','/gf7p8SjbqJN2ENJC8ftA3v5jIY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038072',3.4,3152,'en','Pulse 2: Afterlife','The world has been reshaped by the invasion of ghosts via the wireless internet. Cities are deserted, technology has been destroyed and the few remaining human beings eschew anything electrical in order to avoid a confrontation with the soulless ghosts that now wander the planet. Most of the ghosts are doomed to a repetitive loop of something they did while they were still despairing humans (a man repeatedly hangs himself, for example), but there are some ghosts so locked in denial, they do not know they are dead. They continue to haunt their homes, wrapped in fear that their souls will soon be torn from them.','/z0SGvrvvTlGosfA16yPmp4HpfWg.jpg','2008-09-30',89,'Released',NULL,'Pulse 2: Afterlife',14212,2.7177,4.3,'T3CQpSRkp94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23042,_binary '\0','/pYrJw5JfNPdl19JKKMS7IS3ZhA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10380900',6.6,3694,'ru','Петровы в гриппе','With the city in the throes of a flu epidemic, the Petrov family struggles through yet another day in a country where the past is never past, the present is a booze-fueled, icy fever dream of violence and tenderness, and where – beneath layers of the ordinary – things turn out to be extraordinary.','/21tEnMDu4eZ2kYPcdcwibxEqiYr.jpg','2021-09-09',145,'Released',NULL,'Petrov\'s Flu',609490,2.1312,6.3,'93Gqd0gw4p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23043,_binary '\0','/yijEAXwKqQJbK07VIKBAyQ5injW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10380908',6.2,1446,'nl','Patsers','On the streets of Antwerp, Badia, Junes and Volt are trying to tear themselves away from their past, but the underworld is inexorably pulling them back in. Adamo has worked his way up to become one of the most influential figures in the Antwerp drug trade. He becomes ever more entangled in a web of power and danger. His friends have to make a choice: stay loyal to Adamo or choose safety.','/kn7Rh0CnfsH1LhijZIOTu4zUmLB.jpg','2025-02-19',118,'Released',NULL,'Gangstas',1316070,1.6034,5.9,'ESCQ5xkduvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23044,_binary '\0','/5DS1YPuxnl6LK53uZ6xMMJM291q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10381014',6.5,4452,'en','The War Below','During World War I, a group of British miners are recruited to tunnel underneath no man\'s land and set bombs from below the German front in hopes of breaking the deadly stalemate of the Battle of Messines.','/cdr6n7CuOyexmLUTynRgT3QRQSc.jpg','2021-09-10',97,'Released','Hope runs deep.','The War Below',810413,3.0014,6.6,'j__6C_Lb2BQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23045,_binary '\0','/unOSRoUq6OgCYMFMsdrEh0py7qs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038110',6.7,1768,'ko','우아한 세계','A middle-aged gangster\'s lifetime of mistakes catch up with him as his personal and professional life is destroyed.','/r32KWFc2jRItbAzHypGu9yHSfNs.jpg','2007-04-05',112,'Released','Part-time Gangster. Full-time Daddy.','The Show Must Go On',55771,1.4436,6.5,'fr8Ny0GNqsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23046,_binary '\0','/rGLyAibq9uE5Grc4McrJ5SEoEjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10381102',6.5,1820,'en','Brave the Dark','When Mr. Deen discovers one of his students has been living out of his car and thrown into jail, he decides to bail him out. Determined to curb Nate’s self-destructive behavior, Deen quickly discovers a host of dark secrets slowly tearing Nate apart. What began as a good deed becomes a desperate fight to save Nate from his own demons. As Nate spirals deeper into despair, Deen must decide how far he’s willing to go to save a kid on the brink of losing everything—even himself.','/sMmy9CICGEyFDcXM9fIXU2bDEcH.jpg','2025-01-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Brave the Dark',659956,2.671,6.7,'643rJ7pl5p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23047,_binary '\0','/cWaaCIrwqnAvESS3Jv7c5VEhalh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10383902',6.6,1300,'en','The Christmas Chalet','A recently divorced mother books a chalet in a beautiful Christmas village in Vermont to try and rekindle Christmas magic for her teenaged daughter who feels like her family is ruined forever. When they arrive, they find that the house has been double booked and now they must share their family holiday with a grumpy writer who hates Christmas. Together, they’ll learn that a little Christmas magic heals even the most broken heart.','/AvY8kZ3gIfzKqjqfE5Qcbj0LAVA.jpg','2019-12-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Chalet',643195,2.0813,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23048,_binary '\0','/1lVzpmCxVd7SNSswEIfFND4I2si.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10384744',7.2,15542,'es','La odisea de los giles','In a town in the Northwest of the province of Buenos Aires, a group of neighbors is organized to recover the economy of the area, but when the corralito is implemented in the country and they suffer a fraud, their hopes disappear. Now, they will unite to recover the lost money and give the blow of their lives to their greatest enemy.','/9MaAzW8sERDcIEYORE7jzeCew3P.jpg','2019-08-15',116,'Released','They messed with the wrong losers.','Heroic Losers',596054,4.6939,7.6,'JLGouIpUrXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23049,_binary '\0','/bb5gFmzWoXYrwH7eRnohKGmqMhg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038685',3.1,4785,'en','The King of Fighters','The surviving members of three legendary fighting clans are whisked away to other dimensions by an evil power. As the fighters enter each new world, they battle that universe\'s native defenders, while the force that summoned them seeks to find a way to invade and infect our world.','/qDI6PbIjeEdLUoPHGaZqDMV9Fdx.jpg','2009-11-05',93,'Released','A tournament of legends.','The King of Fighters',44571,4.3728,4.746,'oy-LMbfTAGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23050,_binary '\0','/7HzdWt7Rz3VeoHk5QEBEZaa0m1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038686',5.3,121181,'en','Legion','When God loses faith in humankind, he sends his legion of angels to bring on the Apocalypse. Humanity\'s only hope for survival lies in a group of strangers trapped in an out-of-the-way, desert diner with the Archangel Michael.','/ykocDqwg5PRUopnBVb1x1DWnEJF.jpg','2010-01-21',100,'Released','When the last angel falls, the fight for mankind begins.','Legion',22894,8.2187,5.91,'P6p01-in6-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23051,_binary '\0','/2OnV8ULU0GVsRvXX0BvpUiD5wdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038693',7.1,3395,'en','The Story of Luke','Sheltered by his grandparents, Luke, a young man with autism, is thrust into a world that doesn\'t expect anything from him. But Luke is on a quest for a job and true love. And he isn\'t taking no for an answer.','/dSXad96zPtphKHnDNiOD34EhcA0.jpg','2013-04-05',95,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Luke',176088,2.0757,6.8,'i3c6Jy5sHhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23052,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038915',6.1,1742,'en','Shoot on Sight','Tariq Ali, a Muslim police officer of Scotland Yard, is asked to hunt-down suspected suicide-bombers against the backdrop of July 7 bombings in London. Tariq\'s task gets complicated as an innocent Muslim is killed by the commando shooters of Scotland Yard. On the other hand, Tariq - a British citizen is himself a suspect in the eyes of his boss, despite his long service in the Scotland Yard','/sf3mAhPe2FOCfbVaLH7tV8v2Qtq.jpg','2007-12-15',112,'Released',NULL,'Shoot on Sight',14076,1.7671,6.2,'T6tU1nXp6fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23053,_binary '\0','/zoBpc8yHzZMpOyFiiMP1iKSZzwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038919',5.6,141463,'en','The Bounty Hunter','Milo Boyd, a down-on-his-luck bounty hunter, thinks he\'s seeing an upswing in fortune when he gets a call to bring in his bail-jumping ex-wife, a reporter named Nicole. Milo considers the job an easy payday, but Nicole quickly escapes to chase a lead on a murder case. The former spouses play an escalating game of one-upmanship, until they suddenly find themselves on the run for their lives.','/fJPKar0jnAsS09l3xfP6LL8sUkX.jpg','2010-03-16',110,'Released','It\'s a Job. It Isn\'t Personal. Well, Maybe a Little...','The Bounty Hunter',27573,9.0234,5.9,'t1EcJJ6XzBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23054,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038971',5.4,2224,'en','How to Be a Serial Killer','HOW TO BE A SERIAL KILLER is the story of Mike Wilson, a charismatic, educated, and articulate young man who has found his life\'s purpose in exterminating people. Mike is determined to spread his message about the joy of serial killing and recruits a lost soul named Bart to be his pupil. Mike leads Bart through the ethics of serial killing as well as teaching him various lessons in disposing corp','/u1I4MbZi1LWKLrNVQRtV3at5BYq.jpg','2009-07-24',91,'Released',NULL,'How to Be a Serial Killer',23532,1.8005,5,'AoRZdLqafpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23055,_binary '\0','/xfrguTH6maYiGsC8FXiQ9N3lZXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1038988',7.4,220197,'es','[REC]','A television reporter and cameraman follow emergency workers into a dark apartment building and are quickly locked inside with something terrifying.','/hgyJR4sgMsee6xMFM3xYiG6cDCh.jpg','2007-11-23',78,'Released','Experience fear.','[REC]',8329,10.3234,7.239,'OeaUokzE9fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23056,_binary '\0','/cXGpQsr2Ha0NSZYINSqRokIvnhV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10393870',6.1,44587,'hi','जयेशभाई जोरदार','A non-confrontational Jayesh decides to defy his patriarchal family and flee with his pregnant wife Mudra to save their unborn daughter from foeticide. A screwball, hilarious chase begins as Jayesh\'s father assembles all his might to nab them. Will this unlikely hero manage to create a safe and equal haven for his daughter?','/dv93VspYwwNPbvdB0AcddhiDrGU.jpg','2022-05-13',124,'Released',NULL,'Jayeshbhai Jordaar',678999,1.2406,6.034,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23057,_binary '\0','/lRPt9Xyy06g1gEyitBBTen9qpS0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10394738',7.5,8624,'sv','Greta','Greta Thunberg, a 15-year-old student in Sweden, started a school strike for the climate as her question for adults was, if you don’t care about my future on earth, why should I care about my future in school? Within months, her strike evolved into a global movement as the quiet teenage girl on the autism spectrum becomes a world-famous activist.','/xTCduzgBJ57ZzMM9MOyBPpauB9t.jpg','2020-10-16',97,'Released','A force of nature.','I Am Greta',728123,3.6693,5.906,'xDdEWkA15Rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23058,_binary '\0','/oaUqqVD8vbaYcwZfpRdkFKFxerz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10395866',6.6,2745,'pt','Medida Provisória','In a dystopian future, the Brazilian government decrees a measure that forces black citizens to migrate to Africa in an attempt to return to their origins. Seeing themselves in the center of terror, two cousins take refuge in an apartment, where they debate social and racial issues, and share the same yearning for the change of country.','/8wdCvVsQGf76QOWDqcrgobLjWLb.jpg','2022-04-14',102,'Released',NULL,'Executive Order',614282,1.7453,6.9,'ILEcUPviEyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23059,_binary '\0','/yN7NiKs2HQY3M8IbUrfYal9EiTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039647',8.1,7898,'en','The Union: The Business Behind Getting High','Filmmaker Adam Scorgie explores the illegal marijuana industry in British Columbia, revealing how the international business is most likely more profitable than it would be if it was lawful in this enlightening documentary. Marijuana growers, law enforcement officials, physicians, politicians, criminologists, economists and celebrities—including comedian Tommy Chong—shed light on this topical subject in a series of compelling interviews.','/6szDJcCbjyAilGVaqUbT9k5bD7G.jpg','2007-05-08',104,'Released',NULL,'The Union: The Business Behind Getting High',36443,1.4532,7.3,'3HLzmH9VB6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23060,_binary '\0','/rhd57BgQkFOoKPviEOP9siUQ5o6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039652',7,5798,'es','La Zona','Residents of an enclosed neighborhood in the middle of Mexico DF are shocked by a violent crime, and for one resident in particular, young Alejandro, the drama is ratcheted up when he encounters the lone kid who escaped the event and is hiding out within the neighborhood\'s borders.','/tAnUU7OB6QdnmYEd0R9veXVCXBr.jpg','2007-09-01',97,'Released',NULL,'The Zone',15865,1.6818,6.358,'rcvdaF_sOdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23061,_binary '\0','/2jgu73W78Vi6vVbhJdipdE907Ku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10397854',5.9,1648,'ru','Робо','Twelve-year-old Mitya Privalov dreams of becoming a superhero comics artist. But his robotics engineer parents want him to follow in their footsteps.','/1hR8d4uGwUMhafWkmgdOEhfWPAx.jpg','2019-10-31',90,'Released',NULL,'Robo',579878,1.7202,6.9,'uxc7b8VWjWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23062,_binary '\0','/f87aoFNafuHF3sEkDPNHrfGKnpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10398318',4.8,1882,'en','The Nan Movie','Catherine Tate\'s iconic character Nan hits the big screen as she goes on a wild road trip from London to Ireland with her grandson Jamie to make amends with her estranged sister Nell. Militant vegan arsonists, raucous rugby teams, all night raves and crazed cops on motorbikes all make for a proper day out. An origin story that mixes Nan\'s present with her past where we finally find out what\'s made her the cantankerous old bastard she is today.','/rHOQEt5x3MIznoqXtuTJWblHtYz.jpg','2022-03-18',95,'Released','A coming of age movie.','The Nan Movie',647808,1.9067,5.7,'F4ephzAakrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23063,_binary '\0','/blK2eQv18Hdn6txAh7YDp4c65f4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039889',6.3,2412,'sr','Čitulja za Eskobara','Serbian crime drama focusing on Belgrade\'s violent criminal underworld. Obituary For Escobar distinguishes itself from other recent crime dramas with its strong visual style and energetic approach. Borko was a young effeminate boy bullied at school by the self-styled \'Ghandi\'. Years on, Ghandi is now a warlord, wrecking mayhem in pursuit of his ambition to become the leading drug lord in the Balkans. His execution of the rival \'Serbian Escobar\' coincides with the mysterious placement of an obituary for the real Escobar by two stoners. In Ghandi\'s pursuit of the assailants he meets Lela, a stunning mystery woman who leads Ghandi to reconsider both \"Borko\" and his life in crime.','/xNfmU24e7Ldbnl6qq1Zj0qKY7Ur.jpg','2008-03-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Obituary for Escobar',33580,1.0806,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23064,_binary '\0','/yTGmGjAd0gfpVK0ezoqWgx7AJkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039952',7.3,3946,'ta','சிட்டிசன்','Three prominent members of society, a judge, a police official and a district collector are kidnapped in broad daylight by a man who calls himself \'Citizen\'. As CBI Officer Sarojini (Nagma) follows his trail she finds clues to a shocking mystery, of a village called Attipatthi which simply disappeared off the map of India, and to which each of these men is connected','/A7OYNRIbsDA91PIE3EgzfyA1Swb.jpg','2001-06-08',157,'Released',NULL,'Citizen',69399,1.2376,6.271,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23065,_binary '\0','/3Os2EXMHcV9EkO0PWNIvT4phksL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039960',7.8,10456,'pt','Estômago','In a dog-eat-dog world, Raimundo Nonato has found an alternative way to move ahead: he cooks. No matter what social strata this deceptively innocent young man inhabits, he hones his skills and sharpens his knives—and then he falls in love. Jorge\'s nimble comic fable provides a smartly constructed gastronomic allegory for ambition and survival.','/mo9utQQ9nurl2ELWUzS4e3WHGDm.jpg','2008-04-11',113,'Released','An adult fable on power, sex and cooking','Estômago: A Gastronomic Story',69335,2.6859,7.875,'Awq6P5Bjvgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23066,_binary '\0','/2iGUavwv86Hubv3V5Iq4qEQXDfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10399608',6.1,16424,'es','Cerdita','A bullied overweight teenager sees a glimpse of hope when her tormentors are brutally abducted by a mesmerizing stranger.','/pIFeu5gF7ofAxI9NqrWbJAjjKn6.jpg','2022-10-07',99,'Released','Adolescence can be brutal.','Piggy',848058,5.069,6.5,'AmxqoA0VNjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23067,_binary '\0','/z94oO4k3bvOrtI5b3Dksv7k3M3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10399622',6.7,2052,'vi','Bên Trong Vỏ Kén Vàng','After a Vietnamese woman dies in a car crash in Saigon, her brother-in-law and her young son transport her body back to the former’s hometown in rural Vietnam, where they plan to give her a funeral.','/7k1QaP44m4jpavnmn1G1Fs2mGFD.jpg','2023-08-11',179,'Released',NULL,'Inside the Yellow Cocoon Shell',1114816,2.2199,6.3,'IqdAUaqbhmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23068,_binary '\0','/wmZqlsmnEirYLEo4jFJkmi5qFpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039989',5.5,3497,'hi','संडे','It is about a woman who wakes up with amnesia and discovers she can’t remember anything that happened on Sunday, which connects her to a murder investigation','/rEFD2MOV4XrjVTmNwPP7p2Sm7hp.jpg','2008-01-25',130,'Released',NULL,'Sunday',20917,1.1808,4.907,'RTlZKNNIPMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23069,_binary '\0','/cEuaStim4rKuba7K1uhlKQXo6aG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1039995',5.9,2795,'hi','U Me Aur Hum','While on a cruise, Ajay Mehra falls in love with Piya and soon marries her. However, their marital bliss is shattered when Piya is diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s disease.','/6FZEcmTr9EK6BNf8jBVQxgpRAkY.jpg','2008-04-11',157,'Released','Sometimes the greatest journey is the distance between two people','U Me Aur Hum',31897,1.9052,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23070,_binary '\0','/qhjPl6x3xUIpEZ0RNc9h2LDxSCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10400028',6.2,5425,'sv','Jag är Zlatan','Coming-of-age story depicting Zlatan Ibrahimovic\'s upbringing in a rough Swedish suburb. Born to Balkan immigrants, football was Zlatan\'s release in a tough environment where his remarkable talent and self-reliance catapulted him against all odds to the top of international football playing for clubs like Ajax Amsterdam, Juventus, Inter, Milan, Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain and Manchester United.','/4PTCd7jeylZdj6PZXqUlHWfKu9V.jpg','2021-11-11',100,'Released','The rise of a legend.','I Am Zlatan',763109,2.7684,5.7,'uaMAwPIi_8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23071,_binary '\0','/4QJtcL4D3abqdX6Snrk8ciRkroa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10403420',6,84658,'en','Terrifier 2','A year after the Miles County massacre, Art the Clown is resurrected by a sinister entity. Art returns home, where he must hunt down and destroy teenage Sienna and her younger brother Jonathan on Halloween. As the body count rises, the siblings fight to stay alive while uncovering the true nature of Art\'s evil intent.','/qEAlwXbYk6IHA4ztoS2XFFaa7Xo.jpg','2022-10-06',138,'Released','Who\'s laughing now?','Terrifier 2',663712,15.5122,6.7,'6KkONLf_ZKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23072,_binary '\0','/vkIJ2QgcKMJRvi6pBW4Tr2kgLdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10404944',6.9,15887,'fr','BAC Nord','Tired of the small-time grind, three Marseille cops get a chance to bust a major drug network. But lines blur when a key informant makes a big ask.','/nLanxl7Xhfbd5s8FxPy8jWZw4rv.jpg','2021-08-18',105,'Released',NULL,'The Stronghold',637534,5.2449,7.3,'WJg1c3TyikY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23073,_binary '\0','/a0VwprxXWIhQcHPPWsQeKr1LzSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10405142',6.1,5168,'fr','Qu\'est-ce qu\'on a tous fait au Bon Dieu ?','Claude and Marie Verneuil will soon be celebrating their 40th wedding anniversary. For the occasion, their four daughters - Isabelle, Odile, Ségolène and Laure - decide to organize a big surprise party in their family home in Chinon. They also decide to invite, each, the parents of their respective husbands - Rachid Benassem, David Benichou, Chao Ling and Charles Koffi.','/hQfCJjbAAyk4IwRR8IqdCzPOJE4.jpg','2021-12-21',97,'Released','Just when you thought you already knew the whole family','Serial (Bad) Weddings 3',714869,3.9534,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23074,_binary '\0','/y7wQmV5lJeytievqX5zGPau8Gt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10406410',6.5,1937,'en','Lies We Tell','An orphaned heiress is forced to embrace her family\'s dark legacy.','/82Q9dbJPLXE58IWDQvLgfh8wcMG.jpg','2023-10-13',89,'Released','Take what is yours.','Lies We Tell',1154265,1.644,6.524,'a8Gc7EB0Bj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23075,_binary '\0','/p7SQUTyTX7AxFDX4tRTAlXtHqnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10406596',5.8,7214,'en','You Are Not My Mother','In a North Dublin housing estate, teenage Char\'s mother mysteriously goes missing. When she returns without explanation, Char resolves to uncover the truth behind her disappearance and shed light on her family\'s dark secrets.','/yy4fAZ69rNmnlcdY2Hk5Q9JK429.jpg','2022-03-04',93,'Released','Every family has their secrets.','You Are Not My Mother',771536,2.7177,5.6,'5-Ii8-40cng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23076,_binary '\0','/vMgpILNM1lMfGgYlNrQUF67fU9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10407272',6.6,6143,'fr','Deux moi','Rémy and Mélanie live next door to each other in Paris but have never met. The two thirty-year-old Parisians search for connections online, but never have much success. Falling deeper into loneliness and depression, both decide to start attending regular therapy. With the help of their therapists, they uncover the real roots of their issues, and find that the connection they were both searching for is much closer than they thought.','/fvLIx12fkIbroJ6mPIFdOryfFzG.jpg','2019-09-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Someone, Somewhere',583268,3.574,6.396,'UVwCgPwfopo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23077,_binary '\0','/gKs2sjPNlk72CiWjFf1XTbpZLNR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10409498',7.1,9495,'fr','Seules les Bêtes','Following the disappearance of the glamorous and secretive Evelyne Ducat during a blizzard in the highlands of southern France, the lives of five people inextricably linked to Evelyne are brought together to devastating effect as the local police investigate the case.','/zdAS6PT1AZIL7s1q9xTkOMDjU5z.jpg','2019-12-04',116,'Released',NULL,'Only the Animals',574321,3.0453,6.69,'5HYJ6CjOzi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23078,_binary '\0','/ymhJxRgtAJUb5kF2hJp0Rs6DZs1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10410506',6.3,1256,'en','Brainwashed: Sex-Camera-Power','Investigates the politics of cinematic shot design, and how this meta-level of filmmaking intersects with the twin epidemics of sexual abuse/assault and employment discrimination against women, with over 80 movie clips from 1896 - 2020.','/zqklSVRTxlC92VnhXyCPCVEnAzH.jpg','2022-10-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Brainwashed: Sex-Camera-Power',817127,2.4234,5.9,'8iuxFubOWBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23079,_binary '\0','/8TiYxxck4kfKwXAAdi6aZLeQd5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10413566',5.7,5260,'it','Tolo Tolo','Checco is a young Apulian entrepreneur dreamer who has opened a sushi restaurant in his Apulia. However, after one month, the restaurant went bankrupt and he chose to emigrate to Africa to escape from debt. Here he adapts to being a waiter in a resort in Kenya, but at the outbreak of a civil war he decides to embark on a stowaway trip on a boat for migrants to Europe and chooses to do it with his African friends. However, he would not like to return to Italy, but rather to go to Liechtenstein where banking secrecy is in force and there is a lower tax burden than in Italy.','/CqUxog8F6aaK97RYh8YXhv3NDL.jpg','2020-01-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Tolo Tolo',593402,1.7159,6.102,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23080,_binary '\0','/vNRHiJj0c6VuXvnQzFruNgl9EiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10415494',5.6,1385,'kn','ಏಕ್ ಲವ್ ಯಾ','Amar, a bright young boy, falls in love with Anitha, but when she rejects his advances, Amar turns into a different person with dim prospects. Produced by Rakshitha Prem, it is touted to be a musical love story.','/zuuh7idcfM8emLlDjpstsw5jZkm.jpg','2022-02-24',151,'Released',NULL,'Ek Love Ya',680484,1.0106,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23081,_binary '\0','/wP6iDRKnnweTzJYAX2GjZ01Siq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10415600',6.9,1411,'kn','ಸಲಗ','Vijaykumar, alias Salaga, is unknowingly pulled into the realm of the underworld. Samrat, an honest and upright cop, sees through him and decides to bring about justice.','/c9wX2wGrmMigiNlSw2624jtB3pN.jpg','2021-10-14',124,'Released',NULL,'Salaga',679659,0.9142,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23082,_binary '\0','/arNnHbtaPyfyBumPkeXZ6CK5aUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1041753',5.4,2010,'en','Harold','A teenager with an early onset of male-pattern baldness befriends his high school\'s janitor.','/iGM5plNRXY6ORJVK1ovf2sALNlx.jpg','2008-07-13',90,'Released','New town. New school. Bad hair day.','Harold',13578,2.0612,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23083,_binary '\0','/y6ttkVRr6S3FCLxlohx9tyNdeIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1041804',4.1,4578,'en','The Nutcracker','On Christmas Eve in 1920s Vienna, a young girl named Mary and her brother are visited by their eccentric uncle Albert, who gifts a magical wooden nutcracker that comes to life and takes her to a fantasy world to fight the evil Rat King.','/8qpovUSOZiqFOpsHoByfKojI8iC.jpg','2010-11-24',108,'Released','Experience the Holiday Classic as You\'ve Never Seen it Before','The Nutcracker',49852,4.5211,5,'dgv6W7xkomk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23084,_binary '\0','/ojgXOhVi9Yk8irDpRfDkIzdD1LK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1041829',6.8,403637,'en','The Proposal','When she learns she\'s in danger of losing her visa status and being deported, overbearing book editor Margaret Tate forces her put-upon assistant, Andrew Paxton, to marry her.','/6stnAm1wSek8ZrislwK4xGTyCnt.jpg','2009-06-02',108,'Released','Here comes the bribe...','The Proposal',18240,25.9433,7.181,'jHraHCjK094','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23085,_binary '\0','/tuJNAYQo9ode2OUl6NFMKmNCShu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10418630',7,2338,'ja','朝が来る','After suffering through a long and unsuccessful series of fertility treatments, Satoko and her husband Kiyokazu make the decision to adopt a child. Six years after adopting a boy they named Asato, Satoko has quit her job to concentrate fully on her husband and son. The family lives a peaceful existence until the arrival of a stranger.','/4DsehYX87jeDN8edQBYttcYcArm.jpg','2020-10-23',140,'Released',NULL,'True Mothers',660713,3.4337,7.363,'Fx0FzUGPnYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23086,_binary '\0','/3RMbkXS4ocMmoJyAD3ZsWbm32Kx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10418662',4.9,29445,'en','Awake','After a sudden global event wipes out all electronics and takes away humankind’s ability to sleep, chaos quickly begins to consume the world. Only Jill, an ex-soldier with a troubled past, may hold the key to a cure in the form of her own daughter. The question is, can Jill safely deliver her daughter and save the world before she herself loses her mind.','/d8WJFQyNNAEmuGeDwxPhBpx0G4B.jpg','2021-06-09',96,'Released','Disorientation. Hallucinations. Hysteria. Sleep is survival.','Awake',615658,3.7553,5.8,'2fuowcxdrYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23087,_binary '\0','/y8EijsAJLyipw9cbbcMmdkPEGK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10419266',7.4,1378,'ms','BoBoiBoy Movie 2','BoBoiBoy and his friends must protect his elemental powers from an ancient villain seeking to regain control and wreak cosmic havoc.','/5wFIkx7aLhTHxwztj8AXgF17rHj.jpg','2019-08-02',116,'Released',NULL,'BoBoiBoy: Elemental Heroes',616473,1.4681,8.2,'t3yFQPwV4so','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23088,_binary '\0','/n9uNOn3gmvqqrB2KMUJfQBpsgfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10420532',7.1,3643,'tr','Aşk Tesadüfleri Sever 2','An unforgettable love that overcomes all obstacles, even time, distance and falling apart.','/aIqxnTSRAmmfBvWHLZCbb0xq9A1.jpg','2020-01-31',120,'Released',NULL,'Love Likes Coincidences 2',659764,1.5822,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23089,_binary '\0','/zTiyzmdh6ZDMN0DO3rk5Riisbam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10422658',8.8,2087,'tr','25 Litre','This semi scripted documentary hosted by Gokhan Ozoguz revolves around the issue of water crisis. In a near future, Istanbul will be on the verge of a water crisis, and if the people of 2019 refuse to change their habits, that future is very dark.','/usGOzM2BRrruD6CvaACYujCu3LC.jpg','2019-04-22',53,'Released',NULL,'25 Litre',713497,1.3364,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23090,_binary '\0','/y4sWnBV6z92nhCeWavndfUggRoz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1042424',6.7,3713,'en','Johnny Mad Dog','A cast of unknown performers are used in this drama about child soldiers fighting a war in an unnamed African country.','/7YspfHUzOSpqdEiGJIR9P6ab0g.jpg','2008-05-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Johnny Mad Dog',8929,2.4964,6.2,'4m465VOV1_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23091,_binary '\0','/wHvdmUIP8EsoLFOwpgZ7p1ozlDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1042497',5.3,2808,'en','Exit Speed','On Christmas Eve, ten strangers board a bus traveling across Texas and are forced off the road by a motorcycle gang. The passengers then take refuge in an abandoned scrap yard. When their defense against the gang weakens and their numbers dwindle they must do the unthinkable go on the offense.','/9WU9FDMdkUBMNXbqQ7rwu7WmhcT.jpg','2008-08-26',93,'Released',NULL,'Exit Speed',17144,2.5894,5.2,'YySX8iV6ut0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23092,_binary '\0','/6SfHwoQR7WYm0A4o5KC1gPF4Ecp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1042499',5.4,2684,'en','Filth and Wisdom','Filth & Wisdom is a poignant view of the lives of three not quite ordinary friends settled into meaningless jobs that barely keep them afloat while helping to finance their dreams of bigger and brighter futures. Their unique yet universal stories capture their struggles that are at turns funny and tragic but always brutally honest. Their intertwined lives explore the inevitable: a path paved with filth will often end in wisdom and one paved with wisdom will often end in filth.','/viVPhoFlBftjPjlEdjDhzjervU.jpg','2008-09-17',81,'Released',NULL,'Filth and Wisdom',18548,2.0355,5.6,'H9nx6YW3qAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23093,_binary '\0','/vKuwZeAwJZ9NoZJ9pWTcBRbnUYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10425640',5,2238,'tr','Siccîn 6','A girl is haunted by an evil spirit in her family home. Several bad things begin to happen around her house and to her family members. An old character rises back and tries to save the family from their doomed fate.','/2sQWnbH1sFvA1Ug9Jtm8HBDnL16.jpg','2019-08-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Sijjin 6',615982,1.9377,5.3,'G6WLG6If5UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23094,_binary '\0','/ypZFuSU6ofmx6j8CXlq2E19tL8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10426796',3.8,1289,'en','Bridge of the Doomed','A group of soldiers are ordered to hold a bridge during a zombie outbreak, but what lives underneath the bridge, proves to be even more deadly.','/s0cijKdZ0YZtxrZ0L3g63BIeyke.jpg','2022-04-30',82,'Released',NULL,'Bridge of the Doomed',995810,1.8765,4.9,'AK3QtKIbRZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23095,_binary '\0','/vdoJZC5TBeUm5ohlxGcAhCo962a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10426916',6.4,2826,'fr','Tout simplement noir','A failed 40 year old comedian wants to organize the first Black protests in France but meeting with other French celebrities of the Black community will make it a whole new adventure.','/pRjcKOBOnSZpLRn5vYjIacG98Km.jpg','2020-07-08',90,'Released','Just Black','Simply Black',679989,1.8458,5.916,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23096,_binary '\0','/h9uTBH7o9u3FjXw9NbOdP8nwgvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10428246',4.2,2271,'tr','Geniş Aile: Komşu Kızı','When Cevahir crosses paths with his old flame Zeynep, she seeks his help in untangling an arranged marriage that spurs even more predicaments.','/cy3XPESP6eosutP1s13Gpq9OkGT.jpg','2019-08-02',104,'Released',NULL,'Geniş Aile: Komşu Kızı',656917,1.3992,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23097,_binary '\0','/ubgl0v0crnOGYPGkR2hhIwv7Chm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1042877',7,24733,'en','Cadillac Records','The story of sex, violence, race and rock and roll in 1950s Chicago, and the exciting but turbulent lives of some of America\'s musical legends, including Muddy Waters, Leonard Chess, Little Walter, Howlin\' Wolf, Etta James and Chuck Berry.','/u2GtllItFwaXMLj4uCeKYt9wf4l.jpg','2008-12-05',109,'Released',NULL,'Cadillac Records',14299,5.7358,7.1,'k4SWGJjP9zI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23098,_binary '\0','/injkpgCYfAUSZ3ajX6r118GeFVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10430850',5.7,3266,'en','Rushed','Barbara O’Brien, an Irish Catholic mother, has her life turned upside-down when her son, a freshman in college, is involved in a tragic hazing incident. Taking justice into her own hands, she travels across the country recording mothers who have lost sons to hazing in an effort to prove the university’s liability. When she is confronted by corruption and cover ups, she seeks revenge on the one person she finds truly responsible, proving that hell hath no fury like a mother scorned.','/prPR4srMj4KJDRc9uqKbdIz36Bx.jpg','2021-08-27',101,'Released','Revenge can become an obsession.','Rushed',828305,1.6831,6.7,'szE47rZ3dXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23099,_binary '\0','/rcGX63ZIuUcpr3UOyUa8yflIh41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10431010',7.4,2462,'ta','ராட்சசி','The headmaster of a government school brings in several changes at her institution despite facing odds from various quarters.','/uwGChfkDcxljj4pgb53A7JonOqU.jpg','2019-07-05',153,'Released',NULL,'Raatchasi',606157,1.2919,6.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23100,_binary '\0','/inEy3A5OPgeYW4rjRiGycfEeQzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10431500',8.2,64097,'tr','7. Koğuştaki Mucize','Separated from his daughter, a father with an intellectual disability must prove his innocence when he is jailed for the death of a commander\'s child.','/bOth4QmNyEkalwahfPCfiXjNh1r.jpg','2019-10-10',132,'Released',NULL,'Miracle in Cell No. 7',637920,7.2744,8.3,'bDAkHkR6fwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23101,_binary '\0','/uvxgr5tcF6oYCn2wUgfxzHZdDN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10431572',6.5,2128,'ko','소리도 없이','Two guys who are working for cartels as cleaners get a request to monitor an 11-year-old kidnapped girl, but the situation gets worse when their supervisor gets killed.','/vQZ9xinTItmEmFIqfxJ8bKwOCOH.jpg','2020-10-15',99,'Released','Never meant to be kidnappers.','Voice of Silence',606740,2.1665,7.4,'z0Vc5riZdtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23102,_binary '\0','/5Dv6aQcqU5FlYVE3lx4kD14pNdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10433222',5.9,1636,'en','A Merry Christmas Match','Corey Calvin lives in a ski village where she works at her late father\'s local antique shop, having sidelined her her big city dreams of becoming a theater director. When Los Angeles hunk Ryder Donnelly comes into her shop, sparks fly and she starts to wonder what could be.','/a8jfnsl5NQO2vz9Ml3bqRVOrgae.jpg','2019-10-25',81,'Released',NULL,'A Merry Christmas Match',607217,2.3949,6.1,'h9ZAs4Efqf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23103,_binary '\0','/z0Vf0WAWOiDBdxj2h46E0MWkpSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10434142',6.4,2982,'es','Las niñas','In early 1990s Spain, eleven-year-old Celia lives with her mother and studies at a convent school in Zaragoza. When Brisa, a confident new classmate from Barcelona, arrives, Celia is drawn into a world that challenges the strict religious teachings and sheltered life she has known. Their friendship pushes her to confront hidden truths at home and the uncertainties of adolescence, leading her to explore questions of identity, independence, and belonging.','/zjGKPswRF0TB1hP7iolirFbjmXs.jpg','2020-09-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Schoolgirls',619443,2.6602,6.6,'uQfvsX6285M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23104,_binary '\0','/651jsqXQNA8VTweqOnyoWi0I2DY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043451',6.2,9028,'hi','दिल्ली ६','Roshan, an NRI, arrives in Old Delhi with his ailing grandmother and starts to rediscover himself before getting caught in a religious dispute that shakes the once peaceful neighborhood.','/lTUCuZepDeM2DxOGRhdnFPsWoCJ.jpg','2009-02-20',141,'Released','The journey within','Delhi-6',20027,1.6679,5.948,'rahLN2TUAqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23105,_binary '\0','/dZunqN8GZwcIsrDZOViQ8o8XJDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043635',5,2460,'en','Fast Track: No Limits','Four young thrill-seekers race cars on the streets of Germany.','/aTnstXEsEMvBUisyYlyAaOsMVV2.jpg','2008-02-21',96,'Released','This street race is about to get deadly','Fast Track: No Limits',17143,3.3823,5.8,'ISqueosPMyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23106,_binary '\0','/x8tzywln22VRCaBy58lPF0UJVCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043651',3.3,1602,'en','Dark Island','After losing contact with its researchers on a remote island, a military corporation hires a group of scientists and soldiers to find out what went wrong. But when they arrive, the team quickly discovers that the weapons testing performed on the island has unleashed and powerful and deadly entity that will stop at nothing to destroy them all.','/s2eTKF5WxgTUtGU3HBGcCFUqE8a.jpg','2010-05-22',87,'Released','Welcome to the last level of evolution...','Dark Island',37816,1.4352,3.7,'hBE2RGRDnUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23107,_binary '\0','/1OlinE4r38dgYbGSvkTVgY6iNDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043726',4.3,57948,'en','The Legend of Hercules','In Ancient Greece 1200 B.C., a queen succumbs to the lust of Zeus to bear a son promised to overthrow the tyrannical rule of the king and restore peace to a land in hardship. But this prince, Hercules, knows nothing of his real identity or his destiny. He desires only one thing: the love of Hebe, Princess of Crete, who has been promised to his own brother. When Hercules learns of his greater purpose, he must choose: to flee with his true love or to fulfill his destiny and become the true hero of his time. The story behind one of the greatest myths is revealed in this action-packed epic - a tale of love, sacrifice and the strength of the human spirit.','/aAnRHLq50AbGWEibXHjmLbp2Tze.jpg','2014-01-10',99,'Released','Every man has a destiny.','The Legend of Hercules',188207,6.7141,4.8,'g0GMzQwO2l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23108,_binary '\0','/mJRmMlZ1nouM1zCL2g8EGUIcCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043800',6.2,2095,'es','El mal ajeno','Diego is a doctor so used to working in extreme situations that he has immunized himself to others\' pain. He has switched off from his work, his partner and his commitment as a father. Over the course of a disturbing meeting, Diego is threatened with a gun. Hours later, he can only remember the sound of a bang and the strange feeling of having being hit with something more than a bullet. Diego has to take an irreversible decision which will affect his own life and that of his loved ones.','/pHldiqoslN9BUAtY8PQyGKv9mhG.jpg','2010-06-03',102,'Released',NULL,'For the Good of Others',53739,1.6347,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23109,_binary '\0','/7vhPz2ThhZjSp4xTI5HPjFtwI8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043835',6.3,2463,'pt','Call Girl','A powerful entrepreneur wants to build an exclusive resort hotel in Villanova, but he discovers the location he has in mind is protected by local land-use regulations. He hires Maria, a beautiful and elegant prostitute, to seduce the mayor, leaving him open to blackmail if he won\'t give the entrepreneur what he wants. Maria has no trouble twisting Meireles around her finger, but police detectives Madeira and Neves get wind of the plan and set out to expose the plot...','/p4zKW6OFl2CLqHZ7xkw8aTw390w.jpg','2007-12-27',145,'Released',NULL,'Call Girl',13959,1.3458,5.8,'7G3erpUu6S8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23110,_binary '\0','/y5g9mSbOpwX9gQk7LG4Lysfh7kA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043838',4.7,4339,'en','Conspiracy','A Gulf War veteran with PTSD heads to a small town to find his friend. When he arrives his friend and his family have vanished and the townsfolk afraid to answer questions about their disappearance. He soon discovers that the town is owned and controlled by one man, and he doesn\'t like people asking questions.','/isJpvxaaZd8mHH3E4FFpdExSYEt.jpg','2008-02-15',90,'Released','Hell hath no fury like revenge...','Conspiracy',13255,2.5886,5.4,'e4EzWumTPN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23111,_binary '\0','/5jbIVp6dwGoVovMSXqJfCOGfryP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043842',7,10127,'ja','エクスマキナ','As members of ESWAT, the elite forces serving Olympus, Deunan and Briaereos are deployed anywhere trouble strikes. Olympus finds itself under a stealth attack - cyborg terrorism, deadly nanotech zealots, and rioting citizens are just some of the threats that Deunan must contend with as she fights to save Olympus!','/mxhr2e2Xky4cQ96NpI24xc2GUPn.jpg','2007-10-19',105,'Released','Where there\'s despair, hope comes in threes: a Human, a Cyborg and a Bioroid.','Appleseed: Ex Machina',13981,2.7829,6.5,'tZkag7M_i5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23112,_binary '\0','/1CzjJ4QDAQ3EdUlHwX4rxwtAWHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043844',4.9,2334,'en','Eyeborgs','Following a major terrorist attack, the US government initiates the ODIN surveillance system, made up of millions of mobile, robotic security cameras known as \"Eyeborgs.\" When the physical evidence in a string of odd murders doesn\'t line up to the surveillance recordings, one federal agent finds himself working outside the system to find out who\'s really controlling the Eyeborgs.','/uUzsdMgukSsWLJ4OfmS2rZiTBOb.jpg','2009-04-29',103,'Released','You Are Being Watched!','Eyeborgs',40537,2.2336,4.5,'20Oa5KAL_dQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23113,_binary '\0','/6nUQxbLI0MT44tyuy9CbwrxDg1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043852',6.9,1864,'fr','Lascars','It’s summer in the hood. As every year, there are those who stay, those who leave, and... those who should have left. Some, like Joe Hustleton, work «under the table» in the rich neighborhoods and fall head over heels for a pretty girl. Some, like Tony Pepperoni, play businessman and spend the summer fleeing a local gang leader and a psychopathic girlfriend. Some, like Sammy and Harvey, pretend to have left. Tropics are far for the homies... and summer promises to be very hot!','/myw0jbvci1Z84dMKMtQkCLBaY5u.jpg','2009-06-17',96,'Released',NULL,'Round Da Way',19106,1.9401,6.6,'e0YFtydM79A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23114,_binary '\0','/nQdb6OFhuKATNnSrJTRRD4u4el8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043860',6,1828,'en','Newcastle','17-year old Jesse lives in the shadow of his older brother Victor\'s failure to become surfing\'s Next Big Thing. Even when he\'s in his natural habitat of magnificent surf breaks, his blue-collar future is brought home by the coal barges that constantly line his horizon. Jesse has the natural skills to surf his way out of this reality and onto the international circuit but can he overcome his equally natural ability to sabotage himself? A momentous weekend away with his mates that includes first love and tragedy leads him to discover what\'s really important, and also to the performance of a lifetime.','/47XuBP7OAoRMEtaxJkxRM7vOtee.jpg','2008-04-25',107,'Released','You\'re only young forever once.','Newcastle',40502,1.3177,4.9,'AhhJYe2nUdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23115,_binary '\0','/dTNBlVRYm6KVXv2CgMUJGV4MFz4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1043903',7.2,3282,'en','Clapham Junction','Set in the Clapham district of south London, England, the film is inspired by true events. The paths of several men intersect during a dramatic thirty-six hours in which their lives are changed forever.','/tFfbPg1prSGZIybOEdc1azYnjcA.jpg','2007-07-22',99,'Released','Their lives will never be the same.','Clapham Junction',39517,1.8049,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23116,_binary '\0','/bPuRLnwc6n2uvJOHWf2YaSODqKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10441806',5.6,6331,'tr','Biz Böyleyiz','A group of old friends get together to be with their beloved aunt/grandmother who took care of them when they were kids for her last days. And things get complicated.','/m270dUDEoLA4YDqVOVERE9RfDUp.jpg','2020-01-10',121,'Released',NULL,'The Way We Are',645292,1.4466,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23117,_binary '\0','/taOoT5pTwwF4tWKDzIItDbsX1He.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10441822',5.6,1784,'en','The Nowhere Inn','When St. Vincent sets out to make a documentary about her music, the goal is to both reveal and revel in the unadorned truth behind her on-stage persona. But when she hires a close friend to direct, notions of reality, identity, and authenticity grow increasingly distorted and bizarre.','/4X6IwZnQzWqnYc9J40DMUBprvU7.jpg','2021-09-16',92,'Released','Identity is a work of art.','The Nowhere Inn',653572,2.5042,5.888,'6GeJ3gxQUdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23118,_binary '\0','/74efFx6ogyK2c1SKoI54A6PJw2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10441958',5.8,2563,'fr','La Bonne Épouse','Paulette Van Der Beck and her husband have been running the housekeeping school of Bitche in Alsace for many years. Their mission is to train teenage girls to become the perfect housewives at a time when women were expected to be subservient to their husband. After the sudden death of her husband, Paulette discovers that the school is on the verge of bankruptcy and has to take her responsibilities. But while preparations are underway for the best housekeeping competition TV show, she and her lively students start questioning their beliefs as the nation-wide protests of May 1968 transform society around them. Reunited with her first love, André, and with the help of her eccentric stepsister Gilberte and strict nun Marie-Therese, Paulette joins forces with the schoolgirls to overcome their suppressed status and become liberated women.','/CHOlO9KitnyFxw7nZi6vxn2Tp3.jpg','2020-03-11',108,'Released',NULL,'How to Be a Good Wife',575291,4.0679,5.7,'TNWhw0SlA5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23119,_binary '\0','/uce77WMOY76zDnKoIEC7wYfHmW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10442108',8.1,1251,'en','Kinky Boots: The Musical','Charlie Price is a shoe factory owner struggling to save his family business, and Lola is a fabulous entertainer with a wildly exciting idea. With a little compassion and a lot of understanding, this unexpected pair learn to embrace their differences and create a line of sturdy stilettos unlike any the world has ever seen!','/20QfQHWGw0ZSfYaSinnsJoiVZCd.jpg','2019-06-25',122,'Released',NULL,'Kinky Boots: The Musical',607181,1.9679,7.8,'8jnECAOdhvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23120,_binary '\0','/3r9aPVVNuCXNOFFXsL03abZs9xF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10442352',5.7,3572,'en','Thelma the Unicorn','Thelma dreams of being a glamorous unicorn. Then in a rare pink and glitter-filled moment of fate, Thelma\'s wish comes true. She rises to instant international stardom, but at an unexpected cost. After a while, Thelma realizes that she was happier as her ordinary, sparkle-free self. So she ditches her horn, scrubs off her sparkles, and returns home, where her best friend is waiting for her with a hug.','/yutiEZ7taGDNau2jGjKIdDwQpDw.jpg','2024-05-17',93,'Released',NULL,'Thelma the Unicorn',739547,7.3206,6.883,'BOEMUudvYAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23121,_binary '\0','/k7AHR0cIC2tfcdyhFWe1RbYPxbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10443252',4.4,3203,'en','ECCO','A former covert assassin seeks redemption by hunting the people responsible for his sinful past.','/6tfpba5OWScEbQ9azOIAZUbj68y.jpg','2019-08-09',123,'Released','Anonymity is his name.','ECCO',607231,0.9835,3,'46QiZu6vOwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23122,_binary '\0','/9RKGDZ5PAX3LGER44ieTrkLOj6j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10443794',7.2,1511,'en','The United Way','The United Way is the legendary story of one of the most iconic sports teams in the world, Manchester United, from their humblest of beginnings to a behemoth with over 650 million supporters worldwide. Presented by Eric Cantona and featuring Charlton, Best, Cantona, Beckham, and Ronaldo, alongside stunning archival and never-before-seen footage, The United Way celebrates the global phenomenon of a unifying club for the people, by the people.','/bF1E2UnkDm17xxBpLqqsyhGPQDB.jpg','2021-05-10',90,'Released','The Epic Story of the World\'s Greatest Football Club','The United Way',811959,1.3186,7,'AdMjrS5m9m4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23123,_binary '\0','/pnmaQyEH4EmYUrQLfq0glNTkUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10443808',7,2881,'ar','الممر','A platoon of Commandos’ soldiers, lead by a fearless commander, Nour, and their journey through heroic battles from The Six Days War to the commencement of The Attrition War.','/o1k1sH3i4idKxucryiS81ziHb8s.jpg','2019-06-04',144,'Released',NULL,'The Passage',603400,1.5399,7,'tEA65DeF360','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23124,_binary '\0','/pieDnLArEw43kZxYejn3XbrNZdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10443844',6.6,1401,'ja','PSYCHO-PASS サイコパス Sinners of the System Case.1「罪と罰」','In the winter of 2117, a runaway vehicle crashes into the Public Safety Bureau Building. The driver is identified as Izumi Yasaka, a psychological counselor at the Sanctuary, a Latent Criminal Isolation Facility in Aomori Prefecture. But right before her interrogation, Inspector Mika Shimotsuki and Enforcer Nobuchika Ginoza are tasked with promptly escorting Yasaka back to Aomori. What awaits them there is a False Paradise.','/qnG8ZcmQoncPB58RZwy3wofxm5y.jpg','2019-01-25',60,'Released',NULL,'Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System - Case.1 Crime and Punishment',510242,2.8761,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23125,_binary '\0','/7c8sJIqXRPk9LMEV9jzFwrHLhrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10443846',7.8,5160,'hi','ये साली आशिकी','When Sahil met Mittee in a hotel management school, it was love at first sight for both of them. Their love was everything - picture perfect and flawless. But an unlikely event at school turns their dream-come-true romance into a nightmare and makes them realize how important it is to know your partner thoroughly before getting into any kind of romantic relationship.','/z83KrUMwgXPZM442lhl0Mth0pPk.jpg','2019-11-29',127,'Released','Lovers, Beware!','Yeh Saali Aashiqui',646173,1.4703,8.5,'BP0k4SdquG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23126,_binary '\0','/oTO7B5ID9ZTQso9lVVXi8Q7gRIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10446930',4.5,1360,'en','Hareket Sekiz','Three bumbling, incompetent cops are in way over their head when they must investigate a Russian crime godfather who\'s engineering a smuggling plot.','/d9JNZ2zxDXdEAVXaZk6KB9twzot.jpg','2019-10-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Hareket Sekiz',636075,0.7377,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23127,_binary '\0','/aUcpuhhQ98YpO39IPZUOvoYmKpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10449052',5.5,1517,'en','No Man\'s Land','Late one night, Bill Greer and his son Jackson patrol their ranch when Jackson accidentally kills an immigrant Mexican boy. When Bill tries to take the blame for his son, Jackson flees south on horseback, becoming a gringo \"illegal alien\" in Mexico. Chased by Texas Rangers and Mexican federales, Jackson journeys across Mexico to seek forgiveness from the dead boy\'s father only to fall in love with the land he was taught to hate.','/7PloiGUSH2OUWrk6ctchGhMOL3s.jpg','2021-01-22',114,'Released','The only way back is to cross the line.','No Man\'s Land',678491,3.2234,6.2,'hMMD7J73oS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23128,_binary '\0','/b6H9dBlLEkAXo3qprUuMJrjztFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10449276',5.3,11648,'en','Get Away','A family\'s vacation to a remote getaway takes an unexpected turn when they discover the present-day implications of the island\'s cannibalistic past.','/ser6ZCKHMXhQISKULYCxz6Saf3I.jpg','2024-12-06',86,'Released','Get ready for a killer holiday.','Get Away',1201753,3.0539,5.2,'HxR_vM0ZdI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23129,_binary '\0','/q49ZmYf880daaaE23deNLmSMYNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10451312',5.4,4470,'da','Marco effekten','When a homeless Romani boy is arrested at the Danish border for possession of a missing public servant\'s passport, police inspector Carl Mørck and Department Q are tasked with finding the connection.','/iedopRnMHIDyQlZzTTfroJfHhSN.jpg','2021-05-27',125,'Released',NULL,'The Marco Effect',659940,4.2759,5.746,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23130,_binary '\0','/wLewdoshX7fqzsDoMlTP5njnckP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10451852',6.8,13958,'en','Nine Days','A bureaucrat interviews five souls to decide which of them will be given a life on Earth. But he soon faces an existential challenge of his own.','/6ZemGof32GQRpAMfIK9Q2VFJdwt.jpg','2021-07-15',124,'Released',NULL,'Nine Days',607430,5.4323,6.832,'A73FnWETvr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23131,_binary '\0','/lOSdUkGQmbAl5JQ3QoHqBZUbZhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10451914',5.5,49309,'en','Outside the Wire','In the near future, a drone pilot is sent into a deadly militarized zone and must work with an android officer to locate a doomsday device.','/6XYLiMxHAaCsoyrVo38LBWMw2p8.jpg','2021-01-15',116,'Released','Defiant by design.','Outside the Wire',775996,7.2189,6.3,'iwYhA5YvdNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23132,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10452480',7.5,2449,'ml','കെട്ട്യോളാണ് എന്‍റെ മാലാഖ','Sleevachan, a simple farmer, struggles to navigate the emotional and physical intimacies of marriage with his wife Rincy. This leads him on a journey toward understanding consent and building a meaningful bond with his wife.','/2tM8cGy8KKN4cnzUZz4aObRHWo7.jpg','2019-11-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Kettiyollaanu Ente Maalakha',651353,1.156,6.421,'UBwvF56p-xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23133,_binary '\0','/fd3kDkzXeZzp9zewlB3pz4pf0qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10452854',6.6,1535,'en','The 24th','The incredibly powerful and timely true story of the all-black Twenty-Fourth United States Infantry Regiment, and the Houston Riot of 1917. The Houston Riot was a mutiny by 156 African American soldiers in response to the brutal violence and abuse at the hands of Houston police officers.','/ofLGHOHFEOr3bS8dYFbaWgnZESa.jpg','2020-08-21',101,'Released','I am a man','The 24th',664478,1.9373,6.1,'Jv9cjDwrNdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23134,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045642',7.1,1570,'en','Tales from the Script','Shane Black (\"Lethal Weapon\"), John Carpenter (\"Halloween\"), Frank Darabont (\"The Shawshank Redemption\"), William Goldman (\"The Princess Bride\"), Paul Schrader (\"Taxi Driver\"), and dozens of other Hollywood screenwriters share hilarious anecdotes and penetrating insights in \"Tales from the Script,\" the most comprehensive documentary ever made about screenwriting. By analyzing their triumphs and recalling their failures, the participants explain how successful writers develop the skills necessary for toughing out careers in one of the world\'s most competitive industries. They also reveal the untold stories behind some of the greatest screenplays ever written, describing their adventures with luminaries including Harrison Ford, Stanley Kubrick, Joel Silver, Martin Scorsese, and Steven Spielberg. The film was produced in tandem with the upcoming HarperCollins book of the same name.','/dnKAvhpt9unt7nBx86Ma4bk9aFc.jpg','2009-01-10',105,'Released','Hollywood screenwriters finally get the last word.','Tales from the Script',38124,1.7014,6.6,'x43dxTNcEfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23135,_binary '\0','/qK4akU35K67XyaZd9LhsnuWaEgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045655',3.9,10503,'en','The Haunting of Molly Hartley','When teenage Molly Hartley moves to a new town, she\'s haunted by terrifying visions that may have to do with dark secrets from her past. Something evil lurks just beneath the lush surfaces of her private-school world, and it holds the rights to her very soul. On the eve of her 18th birthday, Molly is about to discover the truth of just who or what she is destined to become.','/XSy8BKHIa19yMAt7XyO2s9oIT5.jpg','2008-10-31',82,'Released','Her past is yet to come.','The Haunting of Molly Hartley',14745,2.5357,4.5,'Ka0BtFqv_xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23136,_binary '\0','/12GpsUm9nVVKFlcjDTflKLClFVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045658',7.7,778141,'en','Silver Linings Playbook','After losing his job and wife, and spending time in an institution, a former teacher winds up living with his parents. He wants to rebuild his life and reconcile with his wife, but his father would be happy if he shared his obsession with the Philadelphia Eagles. Things get complicated when he meets Tiffany Maxwell who offers to help him reconnect with his wife if he will do something very important for her in exchange.','/fhHB1uvfFKKFbj6bTKE8xdtsjKi.jpg','2012-11-16',122,'Released','Watch for the signs.','Silver Linings Playbook',82693,13.932,7.154,'EI_3ywJLQio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23137,_binary '\0','/nrKkpJ4qOWWXl2v4a9UAw5nXYex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045670',7,42837,'en','Happy-Go-Lucky','A look at a few chapters in the life of Poppy, a cheery, colorful, North London schoolteacher whose optimism tends to exasperate those around her.','/sO9ZZsqDfreFxiCPrUuBYeqsAHi.jpg','2008-04-18',118,'Released','The one movie this fall that will put a smile on your face.','Happy-Go-Lucky',10503,4.8975,6.6,'cMwD7Zy6Vno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23138,_binary '\0','/xQm6l23RBVV3MM7bJxnxHmaZR9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10456740',6.4,17008,'fr','Balle perdue','A small time delinquent, turned police mechanic for a go fast task force, is forced to defend his innocence when his mentor is killed by dirty cops.','/qnlChF8U4diiykXQYs1miigGy7t.jpg','2020-06-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Lost Bullet',706503,4.5459,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23139,_binary '\0','/hGc9gAIywD3pR7n6xtgkeBpkoIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10457128',6.9,16639,'fr','Été 85','What do you dream of when you\'re 16-years-old and in a seaside resort in Normandy in the 1980s? A best friend? A lifelong teen pact? Scooting off on adventures on a boat or a motorbike? Living life at breakneck speed? No. You dream of death. Because you can\'t get a bigger kick than dying. And that\'s why you save it till the very end. The summer holidays are just beginning, and this story recounts how Alexis grew into himself.','/etH2pm1eMxEjY2dlltpQGLVspv.jpg','2020-07-14',101,'Released','Whoever dies first, the other promises to dance on his grave.','Summer of 85',659959,4.426,7.4,'Bgz9IUKPcmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23140,_binary '\0','/sGelj98GTvGgx9yq2vNdvRoyXH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045772',6.6,104270,'en','I Love You Phillip Morris','Steven Russell leads a seemingly average life – an organ player in the local church, happily married to Debbie, and a member of the local police force. That is until he has a severe car accident that leads him to the ultimate epiphany: he’s gay and he’s going to live life to the fullest – even if he has to break the law to do it. Taking on an extravagant lifestyle, Steven turns to cons and fraud to make ends meet and is eventually sent to the State Penitentiary where he meets the love of his life, a sensitive, soft-spoken man named Phillip Morris. His devotion to freeing Phillip from jail and building the perfect life together prompts him to attempt (and often succeed at) one impossible con after another.','/qtAuWLGQ7N4PNQ6boZeqqoUY2l9.jpg','2010-02-04',98,'Released','The Conman who wouldn\'t go straight.','I Love You Phillip Morris',8952,5.4972,6.403,'01dljIcgiMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23141,_binary '\0','/21RU5YYiLk3UVF9lRhf2fs1tRUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1045778',5,109526,'en','Year One','When a couple of lazy hunter-gatherers are banished from their primitive village, they set off on an epic journey through the ancient world.','/qF573jdJYwtCbXVXPDn4xu8nW2a.jpg','2009-06-18',97,'Released','Meet your ancestors.','Year One',17610,6.2426,5,'4H_Eepvg3aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23142,_binary '\0','/pe43Ut5GMyeXkuyY9aSfya1GV3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046163',5.8,48307,'en','My Best Friend\'s Girl','Lovestruck Dustin is dating Alexis, his ideal girlfriend, but when she dumps him for coming on too strong, Dustin takes drastic measures to win her back. He asks his best friend Tank to take her on the worst rebound date imaginable - his side job - so that she will come running back to him, and Tank reluctantly agrees. However, Alexis is more than a match for Tank\'s shock tactics and he begins to really fall for her, leaving him torn between loyalty to Dustin and his growing attraction toward Alexis.','/4Zn149rIsfIwBZZwIwuryRzVbon.jpg','2008-09-19',101,'Released','It\'s funny what love can make you do...','My Best Friend\'s Girl',13596,5.5967,5.647,'PsIt1K1C2c4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23143,_binary '\0','/wpnR72kVUb7Pyw8kOn8xb9OlAlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046171',4.4,2491,'ru','You and I','Janie Sawyer, an American teenager, is forced to live in Moscow because of her father\'s job. Janie is trying to escape her lonely life in Moscow through her deep love of music and the internet. Janie and Lana Starkova meet on a fansite for the pop-band t.A.T.u. Trapped in a small Russian town, Lana wants desperately nothing more than to flee her mundane life causing the two girls to develop an instant connection through their love of t.A.T.u.\'s music.','/sxBziq7H5aKlwvLg0lJFXrfLzyM.jpg','2011-02-03',101,'Released','Love and desire... It gets complicated.','You and I',61294,2.1209,4.5,'DWzgMBY-yt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23144,_binary '\0','/jE5wVBRCGQzjHjvFUcYwGS4x0ux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046173',5.7,222667,'en','G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra','From the Egyptian desert to deep below the polar ice caps, the elite G.I. JOE team uses the latest in next-generation spy and military equipment to fight the corrupt arms dealer Destro and the growing threat of the mysterious Cobra organization to prevent them from plunging the world into chaos.','/mc9b25IAprHfsaOz0wTshOwGHcY.jpg','2009-08-03',118,'Released','When all else fails, they don\'t.','G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra',14869,12.575,5.8,'aFtzNHTB4C0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23145,_binary '\0','/1ZZj5v1yUaEmvAUSCsbds17f7rM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046183',6.4,1893,'es','Mirageman','After being brutally assaulted, an incident which also saw the death of his parents and the rape of his younger brother (which mentally scarred him to the point of having to be institutionalized), Maco Gutierrez has devoted his life to fitness and practicing martial arts to ensure his safety in the future.','/iBVOz5z6kq3id0N34zM2bQScEfE.jpg','2007-03-03',90,'Released','He has no superpowers, just his fists and guts.','Mirageman',37709,1.2056,5.3,'QP5mWY4wU1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23146,_binary '\0','/oaYeZs1DMdyJC1Q2WJNBZ6uT6no.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10462154',7.1,2475,'fr','La Plus Précieuse des marchandises','Once upon a time, a poor woodcutter and his wife lived in a great forest. Cold, hunger, poverty, and a war raging all around them meant their lives were very hard. One day, the woodcutter\'s wife rescues a baby. A baby girl thrown from one of the many trains that constantly pass through the forest. This baby, this \"most precious of cargoes\", will transform the lives of the poor woodcutter\'s wife and her husband, as well as those whose paths the child will cross—including the man who threw her from the train. And some will try to protect her, whatever the cost. Their story will reveal the worst and the best in the hearts of men.','/9bcxbzKTE0bPQCHw5AvXo3in57m.jpg','2024-11-20',81,'Released',NULL,'The Most Precious of Cargoes',842859,3.5827,7.7,'6gW-rrODeLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23147,_binary '\0','/ratK3y95kTyFdH0ciiPZx0dD8LI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10462646',5.4,2040,'mn','Говийн домог','The ruffles king forbids music for his kingdom and gets cursed for it. The king\'s right hand secretly wishes to take the throne and tries to kill the king, but the cursed king just would not die. Later when the king\'s right hand figures out how to kill the king and takes over the kingdom. The left-for-dead king gets local\'s support whom secretly kept practicing the art of music aids the king for the final battle to get the kingdom back from murderous king\'s right hand.','/31PQoIPEXwRvJBTxuHWpCy3UpmI.jpg','2018-04-12',158,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Gobi',617913,1.0927,6,'qTqvQifJMBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23148,_binary '\0','/hbVQ8B6k1XyRCa1aGQluyyT4LOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10463030',5.4,6136,'hi','Bhoot: Part One - The Haunted Ship','When an abandoned haunted ship called \'Sea Bird\' washes up on the shores of Mumbai, surveying officer Prithvi is assigned to solve the mystery and close the case','/5rSRVvlIlelgKM58MAnnk4FId86.jpg','2020-02-21',114,'Released',NULL,'Bhoot: Part One - The Haunted Ship',616880,1.5215,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23149,_binary '\0','/hmouOXx7Sm6gm9HNZyI36qaxVSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10468636',6.7,3053,'ta','தம்பி','Brother and sister who get separated and reunite years later when the brother has grown to be a criminal.','/fAEziBYH3XwLmFwjZC4fDk77wHp.jpg','2019-12-19',150,'Released',NULL,'Thambi',648698,1.2022,6.424,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23150,_binary '\0','/luWp6gftSHtz1670079e5VepJOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10469118',8.5,1868,'gu','હેલ્લારો','A group of suppressed women from a village in Gujarat find someone in the desert and their lives are changed forever.','/b1rnAdQe2wxnBMqYhhvC34O3lLC.jpg','2019-11-08',121,'Released',NULL,'Hellaro',629278,1.1769,7.2,'qb8uOylK3R4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23151,_binary '\0','/37uTV0cY3LJ7SQ1tBTwHnp9l7If.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046930',3.9,1333,'en','Headless Horseman','Seven college kids take a shortcut on their way to a party and unfortunately end up in Wormwood – a \"lost\" town in the middle of nowhere. They find something strange and sinister happening there – bones and weird decorations line Main Street. The cause: local Wormwood legend says on All Hallows Eve one hundred years ago, a crazed man tortured the youngsters in town and then cut off their heads. In retaliation, the townspeople killed him by cutting off his head. Seeking revenge every seven years, he returns and takes seven heads from children in the town. Now the seven visitors find themselves hunted one by one as the Headless Horseman claims his due.','/xeixE2DRLuednYsaO8dHBwwYlcX.jpg','2007-10-27',87,'Released','Don\'t lose your head','Headless Horseman',43585,1.7311,4.7,'o7xwudH_tWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23152,_binary '\0','/F4vho6xaKN9x7MPrlyol7Uwywr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046936',5,1718,'en','Hurt','There are terrible things happening in the desert...unexplainable, frightening things. Tragic, inexplicable incidents… ever since she arrived.','/tdNezpPJAnXgDXUyGRNZPozMIAh.jpg','2009-11-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Hurt',26293,1.3425,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23153,_binary '\0','/iwHNDkAaG43o9XTNRKTfAThGSWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10469384',7.1,1884,'en','The Rise of Jordan Peterson','A rare, intimate glimpse into the life and mind of Jordan Peterson, the academic and best-selling author who captured the world\'s attention with his criticisms of political correctness and his life-changing philosophy on discovering personal meaning.','/ySAYFwMQCVjOX747rnGeImzIeJV.jpg','2019-08-19',90,'Released',NULL,'The Rise of Jordan Peterson',626595,0.8792,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23154,_binary '\0','/7RZTIpPZMK9pZhkFCFZNJMn3AIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046947',6.6,23430,'en','Last Chance Harvey','In London for his daughter\'s wedding, a struggling jingle-writer, Harvey Shine, misses his plane to New York, and thus loses his job. While drowning his sorrows in the airport pub, Harvey meets Kate, a British government worker stuck in an endless cycle of work, phone calls from her mother, and blind dates. A connection forms between the unhappy pair, who soon find themselves falling in love.','/er7IVSXCIxZt3RBOXqddePlRYua.jpg','2008-12-25',99,'Released','When it comes to love, is it ever too late to take a chance?','Last Chance Harvey',16409,7.0465,6.3,'P-oiajgQLJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23155,_binary '\0','/ji9XFo11aN2zkDcSvwDd6bhvkaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10469804',6,2210,'fr','Teddy','In a rural French town, twenty-something Teddy is scratched by an unknown beast and slowly undergoes frightening changes.','/dVm8RMd5rAU7z2t5n0FVpCcSVOL.jpg','2020-09-05',89,'Released',NULL,'Teddy',712123,1.7191,6,'PyUYfQhbNF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23156,_binary '\0','/hY3O9tTA6xlk5l7xamO4uVNxEN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1046997',6.1,19772,'en','Miracle at St. Anna','Miracle at St. Anna chronicles the story of four American soldiers who are members of the all-black 92nd \"Buffalo Soldier\" Division stationed in Tuscany, Italy during World War II.','/7PqmgaQBuD0Zp9pDIkkEjkhCJUj.jpg','2008-09-15',160,'Released','World War II had its heroes and its miracles.','Miracle at St. Anna',12412,4.8993,6.1,'I-cUpdiehsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23157,_binary '\0','/a0pWbtHTNzo2VbLgF6MtfwH5bLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047007',7.9,4137,'en','Young at Heart','Documents the true story of the final weeks of rehearsal for the Young at Heart Chorus in Northampton, MA, and many of whom must overcome health adversities to participate. Their music goes against the stereotype of their age group. Although they have toured Europe and sang for royalty, this account focuses on preparing new songs for a concert in their hometown.','/yxBmL96MrP0OQLXXMIsmSi6urGe.jpg','2008-10-02',107,'Released','You\'re Never Too Old To Rock!','Young at Heart',21182,1.3154,7.3,'CjnfoFg7i7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23158,_binary '\0','/1FRwB0SoelIeSjv9NvmU9FAWmip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047011',6.9,8250,'en','Song for Marion','Arthur is a grumpy pensioner who can\'t understand why his wife Marion would want to embarrass herself singing silly songs with her unconventional local choir. But choir director Elizabeth sees something special in the reluctant Arthur and refuses to give up on him. As she coaxes him out of his shell, Arthur realizes that it is never too late to change.','/xPsgQM36NxFGqINruFUceFYyyOd.jpg','2012-09-15',93,'Released','Open your heart. Find your voice.','Song for Marion',127370,3.6829,6.815,'jtQ6cAaMzKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23159,_binary '\0','/601jj1XYHewV6nkR6RPbnpC0NLQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047102',3.7,1405,'en','National Lampoon Presents: Endless Bummer','From National Lampoon, the masters of raunchy comedy, comes a summer tale of beers, babes, and bros! In the surf town of Ventura, California, JD\'s surf board is stolen by a surfer from Los Angeles...a crime that cannot go unpunished. Gathering his friends and the local surf hero, Mike Mooney, they take a road trip to LA to get the surfboard back, then return to Ventura for the wildest summer party ever!','/aez4qjFTRvhwkWOt7vuLTsBLf1e.jpg','2009-10-20',87,'Released','Summer Unleashed','National Lampoon Presents: Endless Bummer',250622,2.238,4.739,'H2lBRT86FWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23160,_binary '\0','/1rHZ4n9lhdmS505ehcIAZNfn51R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10471748',6.5,1457,'en','Random Acts of Christmas','While uncovering who is behind the random acts of Christmas popping up around her city, investigative journalist Sydney meets a competing reporter, Cole, who ignites her Christmas spirit and captures her heart, but may not be the man he claims to be.','/kQ1eqZddqCi7eXPqZse3XB60Cxz.jpg','2019-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Random Acts of Christmas',626300,2.2758,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23161,_binary '\0','/k0D2ecNSBUpt5weV7tJHeNraD0A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10472102',5.6,8598,'tr','Karakomik Filmler 2: Emanet','Birol has given up his true passion, dancing, after getting injured in an accident. Birol leaves his job as a quilt maker at his father’s shop when his father passes away and travels to İstanbul to dance his way to the top at a talent show. But his dreams soon run up against uncanny realities.','/uPPN4UWDOP932SwaPYQ8tJrkgxO.jpg','2020-01-17',60,'Released',NULL,'Comidark Films 2: The Pawn',665089,1.448,5.338,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23162,_binary '\0','/70aVSo3fuZ94jyQ3rT64afEf8lV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10473036',6.2,6777,'en','The Amazing Maurice','Maurice is a streetwise ginger cat who comes up with a money-making scam by befriending a group of self-taught talking rats. When Maurice and the rodents meet a bookworm called Malicia, their little con soon goes down the drain.','/ydhZeUjbzVEFclUpMhLfDZSavUY.jpg','2022-12-16',93,'Released','A furry tale about me.','The Amazing Maurice',676710,11.5835,6.658,'fotvV-Ty9rU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23163,_binary '\0','/rcWqCmRwLU9P8ENDgfTa1hZM5CZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047449',3.4,2562,'en','Camp Hell','At the end of every summer, the children of a Christian community from a suburb of New Jersey attend Camp Hope. They travel deep into the woods far from any distractions the world provides. Here, the children are taught the ways of the Lord, the perils of the flesh, and the horror of the Devil. A charismatic priest leads them in their training. But, he unknowingly has brought something with him, something evil. What was supposed to be a safe place, a spiritual retreat has now turned into a nightmare that not even faith can end.','/ouZMwWVcU4X3H6WSjNAsx96ogR8.jpg','2010-08-13',99,'Released','Ways of the Lord, Perils of the Flesh and Horror of the Devil','Camp Hell',45778,3.0026,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23164,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047459',8,1280,'hi','Dharm','When a priest\'s wife brings home an orphan boy, her husband is against it. Over time, he develops a connection with him, but is shocked when he finds out the boy\'s religion.','/lgSC9owErpJ18de9yk2fJuw9Y4Q.jpg','2007-06-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Religion',39817,0.892,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23165,_binary '\0','/pO1SnM5a1fEsYrFaVZW78Wb0zRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10474606',6.8,3250,'en','We Bare Bears: The Movie','When Grizz, Panda, and Ice Bear\'s love of food trucks and viral videos get out of hand, the brothers are now chased away from their home and embark on a trip to Canada, where they can live in peace.','/khtIr0Gxtz52T10RRQZ42o1a5Ry.jpg','2020-06-30',69,'Released','FUGITIVES, FRIENDS AND FOREVER BROTHERS.','We Bare Bears: The Movie',677638,7.3853,7.828,'0ZNsLy2IwcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23166,_binary '\0','/akQu20RiJjOjDnKngtgVfyjH1A4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047490',6.4,3092,'en','Lo','Love presents many challenges to couples... but none so daunting as the one Justin faces with his girlfriend April...','/ma6gQjFaEEDWCtr1h7uXXcHhNtC.jpg','2009-07-01',81,'Released','Love is Hell','Lo',36628,2.0515,6.7,'XhFsK7e8wUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23167,_binary '\0','/cOuWAiDW2n9c1NYlODMo7lZejZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047494',4.6,7674,'en','Meet the Browns','A single mother living in inner city Chicago, Brenda has been struggling for years to make ends meet and keep her three kids off the street. When she\'s laid off with no warning, she starts losing hope for the first time - until a letter arrives announcing the death of a father she\'s never met. Desperate for any kind of help, Brenda takes her family to Georgia for the funeral, but nothing could have prepared her for the Browns, her father\'s fun-loving, crass Southern clan. In a small-town world full of long afternoons and country fairs, Brenda struggles to get to know the family she never knew existed... and finds a brand new romance that just might change her life.','/61qE0TunNdJiPELBdywMlpvZXDB.jpg','2008-03-21',101,'Released','Check your baggage at the door.','Meet the Browns',16710,2.9475,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23168,_binary '\0','/6MVi1xNKVDl5ceLMfcEZ9s1KVOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047540',6,27712,'en','Parental Guidance','Artie and Diane agree to look after their three grandkids when their type-A helicopter parents need to leave town for work. Problems arise when the kids\' 21st-century behavior collides with Artie and Diane\'s old-school methods.','/815zxi87kTUvleFHjnE5SNzWmVZ.jpg','2012-12-25',104,'Released','Here come the grandparents. There go the rules.','Parental Guidance',88042,4.5095,5.965,'sP-uO3B8ip0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23169,_binary '\0','/fgUacNwfO5paHavroHtHeMHZMDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10477558',7.5,8998,'ja','ヴァイオレット・エヴァーガーデン 外伝 - 永遠と自動手記人形 -','Violet Evergarden, a former soldier returned from war, comes to teach at a women\'s academy and changes a young girl\'s life.','/3BV1M10SuSi5jOJbSDQQtjX96ov.jpg','2019-09-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Violet Evergarden: Eternity and the Auto Memory Doll',610892,5.0703,8.1,'CcJvT_aiKMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23170,_binary '\0','/f84WPU8Y4oV3RKX2bv5znju1cmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1047832',5.5,3145,'en','Linewatch','Academy Award Winner Cuba Gooding, Jr. is a Border Patrol Officer in the New Mexico desert with a secret past that is about to catch up with him. When his old gang leader tracks him down and forces him to smuggle drugs across the border, he must choose between the life he swore to leave behind and saving his family at any cost.','/AnwkCEBHKZexU1Bj4KSfWvDc6wy.jpg','2008-10-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Linewatch',15012,2.0386,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23171,_binary '\0','/ayEMeQUUvwtHzzA9Qurw4bc1oVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10480532',5.5,1519,'it','Il primo Natale','A thief and a priest end up magically transported in the year 0\'s Palestine, where they\'ll have to make sure that the Nativity will follow its course.','/pNfGE8n1iv1DIBNSG1kQLtHV290.jpg','2019-12-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in Bethlehem',613080,2.6842,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23172,_binary '\0','/cSN7XoA3oQdgxEa6F5hfdoKLjit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1048144',5.2,1825,'ar','عندليب الدقي','A poor guy want to be famous singer but he is a failure one when his mother dies he knows from her that he has a millionaire twins brother.','/z5tlX0LXqtD3PFLYXKDRV2dVCcq.jpg','2008-02-21',115,'Released',NULL,'The Nightingale of Dokki',514133,1.1074,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23173,_binary '\0','/2FWuV97IdRNgCQcBEsnfCY7nyyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1048147',6.4,1304,'fr','Borderline','Borderline, a film version of the novels Borderline and La Brèche, tells the story of Kiki at various stages of her life. With her mother institutionalized, she is raised by her grandmother, where left to her own devices, she takes refuge in school. Her life before 30 is a far cry from fairy-tale. Sex and alcohol are her only outlets and her daily reality. She goes through men one after another.','/qhM2WRNxa9qr1JJzDiijUdXKiEL.jpg','2008-02-08',110,'Released',NULL,'Borderline',23962,1.5546,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23174,_binary '\0','/fR9Ck2vZqPOiNUKXcxkVOTL8ZKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1048171',7.4,6829,'fr','Séraphine','The tragic story of French naïve painter Séraphine Louis aka Séraphine de Senlis (1864-1942), a humble servant who becomes a gifted self-taught painter. Discovered by prominent critic and collector William Uhde, she came to prominence between the wars grouped with other naïve painters like Henri Rouseau only to descend into madness and obscurity with the onset of the Great Depression and World War II.','/nSA2iRp6BxhqDPzJsdk6CXALgjr.jpg','2008-10-01',125,'Released',NULL,'Séraphine',14415,1.5132,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23175,_binary '\0','/de5qoScjzBibediKS4o8notvu9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1048174',6.5,5128,'en','The World Unseen','A drama centered on two women who engage in a dangerous relationship during South Africa\'s apartheid era.','/faYQvkW1hGNHFwtaGnkCtru4cnd.jpg','2007-09-09',94,'Released','Nothing can stop you from falling in love','The World Unseen',31031,2.3759,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23176,_binary '\0','/sljpNfrfQtYvDOjGGIH18BMTwhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10481868',3.5,21785,'en','Black Christmas','A group of sorority pledges are stalked by a stranger during their Christmas break. That is until the young women discover that the killer is part of an underground campus conspiracy.','/iMBlUzqwpz9ffbeLsYjyHPp8tn8.jpg','2019-12-11',92,'Released','Slay, girls.','Black Christmas',551808,6.2676,4.538,'gF4yRYbo1WE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23177,_binary '\0','/lnH9D6Bw2vgREZbRRhDkxt4r5PJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10481990',6.7,1268,'en','Rabia and Olivia','The story of illegal immigrant Rabia who migrates to canada and A nine year old mentally stressed child Olivia. When both comes solace for each other until Rabia makes mistake to be arrested. The search begins of Olivia for Rabia and the dramatic situations follows with twists and turns. The film is shot in Canada And India.','/goRKDzysaYPxcjq9sr6VMHUm8om.jpg','2023-02-24',86,'Released',NULL,'Rabia and Olivia',1089254,0.5839,0,'j-y52ZyC-6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23178,_binary '\0','/60bjY85m7hBf5beqd4HV6xzFDWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10482348',6.3,1347,'en','A Christmas Wish','Every December in the small town of Ponchatoula, Louisiana a wooden wishing box is placed in the park as a Christmas tradition. After a night out together, Maddie encourages her sister Faith to put a wish in the box - a wish to experience true love for the first time. Faith and Maddie are surprised the next day when she meets the very handsome and eligible Andrew. As Christmas nears, Faith begins to wonder if Andrew is really perfect for her, or if the wish is leading her to her best friend, Wyatt.','/bHtond3wOw85ZqDBzTaKHRM5vvp.jpg','2019-11-28',90,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Wish',626285,1.8977,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23179,_binary '\0','/4melAXMgacNtfRhmH3K5XRSpq1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10482504',6.6,5155,'en','The Trip to Greece','Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon continue their travelogue series with a visit to Greece.','/jeO1whXLtQrCNAvjlO4XeAea0rP.jpg','2020-07-02',110,'Released',NULL,'The Trip to Greece',611179,2.1751,6.1,'NgwpeZafRfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23180,_binary '\0','/rbUPJoJJquPbX1AiV6GzOqcmJME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10483152',6.9,3216,'es','Unicorn Wars','An army of bear cubs train and indoctrinate young recruits for the war against the unicorns, which threatens the safety of the cubs. Brothers Bluey and Tubby, along with a group of inexperienced cadets, are sent on a dangerous mission to save the Magic Forest, where the unicorns live, and start a terrible battle.','/kEEFo2CpBP1m7zjZzIHG0P6v6ma.jpg','2022-10-21',93,'Released','Bear witness.','Unicorn Wars',587092,2.4716,7.7,'G_I23TmiHMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23181,_binary '\0','/brM6gi1UKO0BJwppl7vqeRDG5S7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10483386',5.7,10240,'hi','मुंबई सागा','The film, set in the 1980s and 90s, chronicles the transformation of Bombay to Mumbai. The story is a cat and mouse game between a deadly don, Amartya Rao, who doesn’t think twice before killing, and there’s nobody who could stop him and a cop, who is dogging his every step.','/4xTtLkGEmUD5Oqjsv3lrkeLr2NW.jpg','2021-03-19',125,'Released','They rose from the streets of Bombay to rule Mumbai.','Mumbai Saga',608746,1.7604,5.643,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23182,_binary '\0','/1zvw95e1c8cnnh4jdY3MMAOjz2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10484164',4.8,2251,'en','A Song from the Dark','Ashionye, a reluctant Nigerian Shaman living in the south of England, who has been hired by an old family friend, Isioma Williams, to investigate and expel a malevolent spirit that has been tormenting her family after the death of her estranged husband, Magnus. To the chagrin of her demon hunting partner, Marv Taylor, Ashionye reluctantly accepts the job as a way to repay an old debt she owes Isioma. As Ashionye digs deeper into Isioma’s family situation, she finds herself standing against a familiar force that brought about her trauma since childhood.','/g6i9eFrqqNUTsrIpIVULlx1mIT1.jpg','2023-11-08',105,'Released','Even death has a song.','A Song from the Dark',1027465,1.104,4.1,'391ZE9IAq9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23183,_binary '\0','/jxogKMmZrycTK2yHN0q3JgoDfD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10487722',7.3,1231,'ja','音楽','A bored trio of high school delinquents start a rock \'n\' roll band together. They have no skill, money, or even a full set of drums, but are determined to jam out and impress their only friend.','/iUbxhvPFNthEDwZEZDEPwOJZL4Y.jpg','2020-01-11',71,'Released','And our \'Our Sound\' begins.','On-Gaku: Our Sound',626767,1.7272,7.3,'2TVJ2cCXDAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23184,_binary '\0','/gh4J8vtYSXb3XumRtJxDNJC1W8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10492998',6.7,4529,'it','Odio l\'estate','Three families end up in the same rented house. Throughout the summer, they become friends and rediscover how to enjoy life.','/f0l06BUo5PlW7h3XOaPZMFn3mEt.jpg','2020-01-30',105,'Released',NULL,'I Hate Summer',606954,2.2206,7.047,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23185,_binary '\0','/uk4Tb0SrJFBowZgi0zCj2szm78M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10493490',6.8,1710,'en','Two Turtle Doves','Dr. Sharon Hayes searches for a beloved family heirloom in a small Christmas town. When she unexpectedly discovers an adorable little girl and her disheartened father, she realizes that Christmas miracles really do happen.','/ayz1EFvswh1C3FyjOCI1KSHoXIj.jpg','2019-11-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Two Turtle Doves',626310,1.5183,6.9,'DyqMcyOuJoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23186,_binary '\0','/5b0wmQVsOoCht1nO4YnxQRIMqTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1049400',7.5,1806,'en','Outrage','An indictment of closeted politicians who lobby for anti-gay legislation in the US.','/1t77eunGNzJfeYqyDBBlHFKAbFG.jpg','2009-04-24',90,'Released','A searing exposé of the secret lives of closeted gay politicians','Outrage',30312,1.1452,6.1,'mduJRZuWfFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23187,_binary '\0','/tUAdGt5trb0H3kKCdHWGdLyt3Rt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1049402',6.6,13717,'en','Howl','It\'s San Francisco in 1957, and an American masterpiece is put on trial. Howl, the film, recounts this dark moment using three interwoven threads: the tumultuous life events that led a young Allen Ginsberg to find his true voice as an artist, society\'s reaction (the obscenity trial), and mind-expanding animation that echoes the startling originality of the poem itself. All three coalesce in a genre-bending hybrid that brilliantly captures a pivotal moment-the birth of a counterculture.','/4gy0rUIaaao1nx6pr1Dj1WpslcO.jpg','2010-08-26',84,'Released','The Obscenity Trial That Started a Revolution. The Poem That Rocked a Generation.','Howl',38568,3.2738,6.46,'C4h4ZY8whbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23188,_binary '\0','/kDACJi8eHur78ycoIc7L8fE6zlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1049405',6.1,6528,'en','The Other End of the Line','An employee at an Indian call-center travels to San Francisco to be with a guy she falls for over the phone.','/uiLgARBzUiE7PPRiJILXSh4zOIW.jpg','2007-03-23',106,'Released',NULL,'The Other End of the Line',17334,3.478,6.5,'JZ9s8n-gtXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23189,_binary '\0','/hGGC9gKo7CFE3fW07RA587e5kol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1049413',8.3,1256001,'en','Up','Carl Fredricksen spent his entire life dreaming of exploring the globe and experiencing life to its fullest. But at age 78, life seems to have passed him by, until a twist of fate (and a persistent 8-year old Wilderness Explorer named Russell) gives him a new lease on life.','/mFvoEwSfLqbcWwFsDjQebn9bzFe.jpg','2009-05-28',96,'Released','Change is in the air.','Up',14160,30.355,7.96,'Ajcdb4FAL7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23190,_binary '\0','/oPBa5C23Z7EKhf0gSO5ThvX3xmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10495746',7.7,2245,'id','Dua Garis Biru','Young love leads to heartbreak for two star-crossed high school students when an unplanned pregnancy has agonizing consequences for their families.','/rqHzHops7SudBKvxjbB15ZnUABp.jpg','2019-07-11',112,'Released','Did They Cross the Line?','Two Blue Stripes',585026,1.2006,7.3,'WYz3AnnXBME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23191,_binary '\0','/ripsaXE9rbwpeJSMZH6JlBrEVsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10497826',6.1,1621,'ar','كازابلانكا','Three friends form a gang of pirates, “Sea Burglars”, get assigned to a mission against the Mob, after a large cargo of diamonds was heisted. Things turn into a web of rivalries and paybacks, when one one of them decides to do the mission on his own and escape to Morocco.','/yOHJYF9chII7UOsf5Lk7GKiXUsn.jpg','2019-06-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Casablanca',603404,1.6887,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23192,_binary '\0','/fA5A3DfA0r6KtiivjiVz4rkFLjq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10498588',6.6,2979,'en','Revealing Ukraine','A sequel of Oliver Stone-produced conspiracy film \"Ukraine on Fire\", analyzing the current political backstage and its supposed dangerous potential for the world.','/zIrLH9bwvWHlKCMvlOoLqVvhp38.jpg','2019-05-01',93,'Released','Between the line of world politics','Revealing Ukraine',616914,1.4717,4.4,'Nj_bdtO0SI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23193,_binary '\0','/sfJHgrkhjUcEyqU5evsmsk0lDII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10498810',2.4,1376,'en','Annabellum: The Curse of Salem','After unearthing a wooden crate containing a seemingly innocuous porcelain doll in the dusty attic of the historic Warwickshire Museum, unsuspecting curator David Whittaker starts to experience unusual and hair-raising happenings. Utterly unaware of the haunted artifact\'s dark heritage rooting back to 1692 Salem, David, his family, and his colleagues come face-to-face with an ancient, malevolent force that craves innocent souls.','/9cMiaJOtIorpr0IiQPyTlb9tYVk.jpg','2019-08-12',64,'Released','Don\'t let her out','Annabellum: The Curse of Salem',706862,1.0041,3.4,'tPeMxNlKfDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23194,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1050001',3.8,1630,'en','Albino Farm','College students exploring the Ozark Mountains for a school assignment, stumble upon a group of scary, redneck cave-dwellers.','/zgRyyJdJFywhVFAreAlrX2lnl75.jpg','2009-09-09',85,'Released','The legend is real...','Albino Farm',25693,0.9751,4.7,'Qbk1wFMX80I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23195,_binary '\0','/yYgMli9yDx3P017uPzf716KUnfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1050002',5.7,2127,'en','My Last Five Girlfriends','Depressed and suicidal, thirtysomething bachelor Duncan – determined to find the secret to a healthy, strong relationship, – flashes back to his last five relationships (in the last four years) and considers what caused each one to fail. Based on the novel \'Essays in Love\' by Alain de Botton.','/i5GMognHQIBFKhhNmz2uTkDbmD5.jpg','2010-03-19',87,'Released',NULL,'My Last Five Girlfriends',43550,1.9753,5.3,'7fODEKnFAeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23196,_binary '\0','/iHwZL5pehrFhSISA9pXFErrLuNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1050160',5.9,11291,'ja','片腕マシンガール','The life of a young, Japanese schoolgirl is destroyed when her family is killed by a Ninja-Yakuza family. Her hand cut off, she replaces it with various machines-of-death, and seeks revenge.','/ln2ld7e5BwNqcBgUO7lqaBtAsuh.jpg','2008-01-02',96,'Released','It\'s Payback Time!','The Machine Girl',13964,2.4201,5.973,'x-4JfYQpRmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23197,_binary '\0','/u2Kb3hYppQs0FzqgJDHXcteQBIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10503934',7.1,1358,'ar','الكنز 2: الحب والمصير','A sequel to The Treasure (Part 1) - Reality & Fantasy (2017) The movie resumes with the stories of Hatsheput in the Pharaonic era, Ali al-Zaibaq during the Ottoman era and Beshr al-Katatini, head of State Security Investigations Service, who faces new challenges in work and love, whilst pointing his son, Hassan, towards a treasure through his recorded will.','/jhZrWzE5qqBVgXtADQ6oXofAikt.jpg','2019-08-10',123,'Released',NULL,'The Treasure : Love & Destiny',585218,1.3768,6.6,'LaXs58wgOLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23198,_binary '\0','/12zVyzQ7ITwULyK8RSLZk8iobjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10503988',4.4,1401,'en','Exploited','A college freshman becomes obsessed with the previous owner of his school issued laptop, a webcam model whose last session may have ended in murder.','/4fuyUJCQkCGCgW6Zs3M8vxfr9F0.jpg','2022-01-28',82,'Released','He\'s watching your every move.','Exploited',947612,2.4314,4.2,'DW3aTkGCXcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23199,_binary '\0','/5G2dGIvtx2N38VjzY6LkNGYtjCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10504904',3.5,1532,'en','Blind','Faye, a former actress that lost her vision due to botched laser eye surgery, struggles to put her life back together while living alone in her dream house in the Hollywood Hills. Supported by her friend Sophia, she starts opening up to Luke, a personal trainer who is mute and can only communicate through his cell phone. When a masked stranger named Pretty Boy shows up, Faye will realize that she isn\'t as alone as she thinks.','/yVJG3yYneoeX7b6PZHiXR2uhIya.jpg','2019-07-10',88,'Released','Love is blind.','Blind',626743,1.3817,4.1,'-eyVAaoSC3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23200,_binary '\0','/90wzgdWauPROU6cMzsavhU12Ipf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10504966',6.2,1270,'sv','Jag kommer hem igen till jul','The story of two brothers and their musical family, forced to confront their secrets over an intense Christmas break.','/cHRieEBkLKEGnT8bAjSHNCA33Cj.jpg','2019-11-08',113,'Released',NULL,'I\'ll Be Home for Christmas',637176,1.5461,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23201,_binary '\0','/gsqJEai2EvRfuMzxSb6uSgRwrRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10505316',7.4,7893,'fr','Illusions perdues','Lucien de Rubempré, a young, lower-class poet, leaves his family\'s printing house for Paris. Soon, he learns the dark side of the arts business as he tries to stay true to his dreams.','/zV0ZeO2ajYzoE0OTtKZNfX3MKlY.jpg','2021-10-20',149,'Released','Criticism is easy, and art is difficult','Lost Illusions',660000,5.1553,7.362,'6ltI1Zuar_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23202,_binary '\0','/jYaoVDJ9J6Me3J0EQCABzQ99YVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10505918',6.1,14374,'ml','L2: എമ്പുരാൻ','Five years after becoming Chief Minister of Kerala, Jathin Ramdas\' move to align with communal forces led by Balraj \'Baba\' Bajrangi, triggers Stephen Nedumpally aka Khureshi Ab\'raam to return with his Man Friday Zayed Masood to save his home state and settle scores.','/rlK1u6zJp8AJ93XX8dgiZVsE5w8.jpg','2025-03-27',179,'Released',NULL,'L2: Empuraan',627336,2.2502,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23203,_binary '\0','/ei3Zc4thycgKtWqqEl78jVJGb5V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1050739',4.9,1959,'hi','Roadside Romeo','This is the story of Romeo. A dude who was living the life. He had the works - the mansion to live in, the chicks to party with and the cars to be driven around in. Until one day, the family he was the favourite pet of, decided to move and left him back, abandoned on the mean streets of Mumbai. Romeo is now faced with situations he has never been in before. He encounters four strays, who scare the daylights out of him. But soon, he smooth talks his way into their hearts and he makes friends. Then, Romeo finds love! He encounters the beautiful, ravishing Laila, the most beautiful girl he has ever seen - and he loses his heart to her at first sight. Finally, he encounters a villain! The dreaded Don of the area - Charlie Anna. The Don who everyone is scared of. So hop on to the adventure as Romeo, wins friendship, love and a new life - in spite of Charlie Anna and his gang!','/p2CBDCVzTPjnXaKXN21bEoPWBeQ.jpg','2008-10-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Roadside Romeo',20653,1.5805,4.663,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23204,_binary '\0','/ekjm6VTCu64gk0UcGWnCMxuwbdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10508258',6.2,3037,'ru','Красный призрак','December 30, 1941. Vyazma (\'Vyazemsky cauldron\') is a small detachment of Soviet soldiers, by fatal coincidence, in an unequal battle with a special unit of the Wehrmacht. However, none of them think about giving up. Each of them was ready to sacrifice his life in order to protect his native land. None of these brave people was born a hero. The myth of the red ghost is a heroic deed without a soldier\'s Soviet soldier in the Great Patriotic War who instilled in the animals, deadly fear of German soldiers. In place of one of the dead hero was inserted another, and the born myth of the invincible Soviet soldier. The film \'Red Ghost\' is about the hope that each soldier will have.','/9OFF92pkqDgR5d5yp0JhdjXXwrc.jpg','2021-08-30',96,'Released','The snow will be painted red with Nazi blood.','Red Ghost',575842,2.9967,5.9,'HL6-rvt36fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23205,_binary '\0','/90yhXKTDNfaV7JnC7RcTpZcRTGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10508838',6.2,5107,'zh','征途','Keen to bring honor to his clan, young villager Dong Yilong embarks on a perilous journey to compete in a tournament that selects warriors for battle.','/lv3RonWge4GlC9ymNzC0oWpFCfv.jpg','2020-07-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Double World',611395,3.1666,6.703,'i4das8_tUUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23206,_binary '\0','/odzicYxlSOKTtLIO3PJvPsBmXS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10509906',3.8,2495,'en','The Long Night','A devoted couple\'s quiet weekend takes a bizarre turn when a nightmarish cult and their maniacal leader come to fulfill an apocalyptic prophesy.','/iLHGciBl5kwUVJCUj8xKtDqkP7V.jpg','2022-02-04',91,'Released','Fear the darkness inside you.','The Long Night',925705,1.7879,4.81,'RSIcJNkR4tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23207,_binary '\0','/kc3DTrAtAJ0Fa1U1sNACx1NUygZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10510280',5.5,1374,'en','School\'s Out Forever','No sooner has 15-year-old Lee Keegan been expelled from his private school than an apocalyptic event wipes out most of the world\'s population. With his father dead and mother trapped abroad, Lee is given one instruction: go back to school. But safety and security at St. Mark\'s School for Boys is in short supply. Its high walls can\'t stop the local parish council from forming a militia and imposing marshal law, while inside the dorms the end of the world is having a dangerous effect on his best friend and his unrequited crush on the school nurse isn\'t helping him concentrate on staying alive.','/7oSb5tqGlKnb8foQYfx4g7vadEe.jpg','2021-02-15',105,'Released','Survival just made the syllabus','School\'s Out Forever',784058,1.6432,5.5,'LRSyWvJKbNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23208,_binary '\0','/e8I1vKXXPNNhNcFIaVHDdJvQckI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1051213',4,1238,'en','Boy Toy','Jake: an unsuccessful - yet well endowed - underwear model in L.A, who finds a lucrative new line of work as a platonic escort for women of a certain age. But, just as he finds himself a deep-pocketed \"sugar mama\" in Barbra, he meets Norah: a stunning and laid back Yoga instructor. As Jake\'s success blooms, so does his love life; leading him to a crossroad that will change everything.','/AkswCcEZ0vvdLLC8WgSqwS5owmf.jpg','2011-08-31',91,'Released','An unsuccessful underwear model gears up for the role of his life.','Boy Toy',77665,2.3452,4.1,'xTGPXyDEKvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23209,_binary '\0','/4mK222kB3vyrNjYl8eHliYacvJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10514222',6.9,78707,'en','Ma Rainey\'s Black Bottom','Tensions rise when the trailblazing Mother of the Blues and her band gather at a Chicago recording studio in 1927. Adapted from August Wilson\'s play.','/pvtyxijaBrCSbByXLcUIDDSvc40.jpg','2020-11-25',93,'Released','It would be an empty world without the blues.','Ma Rainey\'s Black Bottom',615667,4.8498,6.643,'ord7gP151vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23210,_binary '\0','/ztodH4WL9ljCII99J37dKGKp6Aa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10514468',1.8,1300,'nl','Project Gio','When Youtuber Gio\'s parents go on holiday, a party in their brand new home gets completely out of control and half the house burns down. Gio has two weeks to repair the house while he continues to upload videos as if nothing is wrong.','/w51UWEKuiGDoGHVTfXpiNlp2KdX.jpg','2019-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Project Gio',613461,0.8091,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23211,_binary '\0','/c5x29VOoMgl4ic1aQAt6iiF3kBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10515086',8,12139,'ar','الفيل الأزرق ٢','A meeting with a new inmate in the psychiatric hospital flips Dr. Yehia\'s life upside down. She prophecies that the death of his entire family is only three days away.','/o5mG2rs6W4Q1lNUJ3aCn7gAkTlV.jpg','2019-07-25',129,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Elephant 2',599672,4.5855,7.596,'WA2NvFSHchk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23212,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10515340',3.2,2209,'en','At The Door','A strange disease is plaguing the city. Hoping to escape contamination, Eva and Sam, an estranged married couple, are forced to barricade themselves in their apartment despite the palpable tension between them. Now forced into isolation in their small living space, they struggle with their own frailty in a world that can only offer the worst horrors imaginable.','/j43961n8sLnYPJxvpy9SoVoGBjH.jpg','2018-04-24',99,'Released',NULL,'At The Door',531678,0.8774,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23213,_binary '\0','/kAJK8Kp6oPYb3T2gIHfp2SNitJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10515398',5.9,4735,'ml','പള്ളിച്ചട്ടമ്പി','Set in the politically turbulent late 1950s, Krishnan Pillai, a playful ruffian chosen by the Church to lead a defensive force, the Christopher Sena. His mission to resist the Communist government takes a detour when he experiences an ideological awakening and falls in love with a comrade, sparking an epic tale of rebellion against feudal power and oppression.','/pEzXdyJhdWc2msM0oBC9N8pKtMY.jpg','2026-04-15',128,'Released','An Epic Of A Crusader','Pallichattambi',959894,2.921,5.167,'2Pr2v2RpkVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23214,_binary '\0','/tSHHqsVJPuoh0vRftcOj7nVlE0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10515526',7.5,19800,'hi','लूटकेस','Nandan, a middle-class man, finds a suitcase full of money near his workplace and steals it. However, he is soon chased by a police officer, a notorious gangster and a corrupt politician.','/4F4T7fSxSaak4XQHrskRPcqL9yz.jpg','2020-07-31',132,'Released',NULL,'Lootcase',635503,1.2336,6.457,'Q9ij1MUCXVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23215,_binary '\0','/re3ZvlKJg04iLpLRf1xTKHS2wLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10515852',7.7,11486,'en','Steven Universe: The Movie','Two years after bringing peace to the galaxy, Steven Universe sees his past come back to haunt him in the form of a deranged Gem who wants to destroy the Earth.','/8mRgpubxHqnqvENK4Bei30xMDvy.jpg','2019-10-07',83,'Released','The true kinda love.','Steven Universe: The Movie',5