hould not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.','/gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg','2020-12-10',136,'Released','A Magical Journey Awaits You!','Silver Skates',576920,3.3904,7.531,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23238,_binary '\0','/4Q46zwUOiriDMP03VZkmfGXpdUN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10528948',4.5,1473,'en','Hero Mode','A teenage coding genius has just 30 days to create the world\'s greatest video game or his family loses everything. No pressure.','/yh8FKfdoddaOQjyVVBUPebdoB1x.jpg','2021-06-04',89,'Released','Every hero has a code.','Hero Mode',764068,2.4984,5.7,'wVvi4AK9Aag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23239,_binary '\0','/iDw6J49rf7Xlu9QZBWpvmrMqSzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10530176',7.1,54732,'ko','콜','Connected by phone in the same home but 20 years apart, a caller puts a woman’s past — and life — on the line to change her own fate.','/oz8hvZHg7tIdGwh0ErPRhobJKPR.jpg','2020-11-23',112,'Released','A call from a serial killer... She\'ll begin to hunt your past.','The Call',575604,5.4946,7.5,'hxkKeniT-0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23240,_binary '\0','/x4sWIpK2EeI9bxwpMzV6yOQWPXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10530286',6.1,1788,'ko','비스트','Two rival detectives with different methods try to solve the murder of a missing girl after discovering her mutilated body in the tidelands of Incheon.','/aspGoLIV8QU1dVcdLVxPeqeguqb.jpg','2019-06-26',130,'Released','Who is the beast?','The Beast',575754,2.5361,6.7,'_KWlFUhEsOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23241,_binary '\0','/nzaKfVskNDpKAAfWPUxYzd96pZm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10530838',6.3,2358,'en','How to Please a Woman','When her all-male house-cleaning business gets out of control, a mature woman must embrace her own sexuality, if she is to make a new life for herself.','/feSeUyEBWUrkfbk2jO0kPVayml2.jpg','2022-05-19',107,'Released','Pleasure is a serious business.','How to Please a Woman',894686,3.0868,6.3,'5ZLv4v4odkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23242,_binary '\0','/wQLcXBc0b4yNT542qxcZfb0KM40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1053424',6.3,114710,'en','Repo Men','In the future, medical technology has advanced to the point where people can buy artificial organs to extend their lives. But if they default on payments, an organization known as the Union sends agents to repossess the organs. Remy is one of the best agents in the business, but when he becomes the recipient of an artificial heart, he finds himself in the same dire straits as his many victims.','/1ZA5kEKuA6HgbyzZXXlyU4piNI.jpg','2010-03-18',111,'Released','Consider them your final notice.','Repo Men',31867,8.6795,6.34,'P0LkMrPMMhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23243,_binary '\0','/4pmn9WZgoFzXvC9eLEyA5BfMMhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10534500',8.7,20158,'ml','ഹോം','The humble, technology-challenged Oliver Twist struggles to keep close with his sons as they grow up and become active on social media.','/pNG5VujToJkZNm6ZR9i6pJx5tsY.jpg','2021-08-19',162,'Released',NULL,'#Home',859987,1.0927,7.826,'0xrCuNa_zZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23244,_binary '\0','/qRAImBDZ8zjC6Pg9vDHRUJqlMvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10534996',7.3,2380,'fr','Josep','February 1939. Overwhelmed by the flood of Republicans fleeing Franco\'s dictatorship, the French government\'s solution consists in confining the Spanish refugees in concentration camps where they have no other choice than to build their own shelters, feed off the horses which have carried them out of their country, and die by the hundred for lack of hygiene and water... In one of these camps, two men, separated by barbwire, will become friends. One is a guard the other is Josep Bartoli (Barcelona 1910 - New York 1995), a cartoonist who fights against the Franco regime.','/o0pwyA3PqgqfguXUKc475SJYR2x.jpg','2020-09-30',74,'Released',NULL,'Josep',680952,2.054,7.448,'5PYUhA7P6rY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23245,_binary '\0','/eEdNeXUbh1zssFxc4xOCC13TcV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10537660',5,2243,'fr','Mystère à Saint-Tropez','Every summer, the Billionaire Tranchant and his wife Eliane host the glamorous world of celebrities in their luxurious mansion in the south of France. When a criminal car sabotage related to threatening letters wreak havoc in the villa, Tranchant goes in search of the best agent for the investigation. In the middle of this hot summer, only the arrogant and incompetent agent Boullin is available... To catch the suspect and solve the mystery, he will have no choice but to impersonate a newly hired butler and will turn everyone’s vacation into a hilarious game of ‘Cluedo’!','/bWpIB5MWhH3vDmNUOC1PuE0ejt1.jpg','2021-07-14',89,'Released','Everyone Has A Motive But He Does Not Have A Clue','Do You Do You Saint-Tropez',611408,2.791,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23246,_binary '\0','/3WD1vyCtqMyqC6QZbDc0DblywNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1053810',6.2,51358,'en','The Big Year','Three fanatical bird-watchers spend an entire year competing to spot the highest number of species as El Nino sends an extraordinary variety of rare breeds flying up into the U.S., but they quickly discover that there are more important things than coming out on top of the competition.','/q6Pr8fWKh664seri2MaQeIJ6eSI.jpg','2011-10-13',102,'Released','Everyone is searching for something.','The Big Year',73937,7.3345,6,'JCBAP2wId5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23247,_binary '\0','/lenULbl7U24ZCkqarrwqoYAvh9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1053859',4.6,21032,'en','The Grudge 3','Jake Kimble, the sole survivor of the Chicago massacre, is killed while in solitary confinement. His doctor begins investigating the claims he made about a long-haired woman in white, as a mysterious Japanese woman arrives at his old apartment building to help them get rid of the curse.','/uEOWWRr8BbgPM0BiJiSTwHGaRx4.jpg','2009-05-12',90,'Released','You can\'t escape the curse.','The Grudge 3',1977,6.3745,5.4,'VjzP0i0sBeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23248,_binary '\0','/jLpQOi8S2DuNdTgCIjyfuP6DYGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1053880',3.8,1791,'en','Little Fish, Strange Pond','Mr. Jack and Sweet Stephen cruise aimlessly through the streets of LA speculating about life, death, divine will and the force of power that predetermines their existence. Mr. Jack attempts to illustrate to his sidekick the delicate and natural forces of the universe. Sweet Stephen\'s superficial charm and bloodsucking lifestyle sends him and Mr. Jack on a voyage that is relentless, engaging, and darkly hilarious.','/4l4yTy9WihabZ4rSdzintWTCQgb.jpg','2009-10-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Little Fish, Strange Pond',49848,2.313,3.7,'KYwJKcM29Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23249,_binary '\0','/dueiWzWc81UAgnbDAyH4Gjqnh4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10539608',5.7,95506,'en','The Midnight Sky','A lone scientist in the Arctic races to contact a crew of astronauts returning home to a mysterious global catastrophe.','/l8lXesOLXKS0VYjzWNZN6gDxv2F.jpg','2020-12-10',118,'Released','There\'s a universe between all of us.','The Midnight Sky',614911,9.0124,5.732,'DXUUqr3AFKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23250,_binary '\0','/c6JmDkXh0o9Fs2aJ8dF7AVLem0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10540242',4.8,3015,'en','The Main Event','An 11-year-old aspiring wrestler enters a competition to become the next WWE superstar by using special powers from a magical mask.','/tzg5AEEu1T7nFOCq4gKbGBObhdk.jpg','2020-04-10',102,'Released','Big dreams need a little magic','The Main Event',637157,3.7819,6.4,'qt1sP3TBgPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23251,_binary '\0','/b0wvlhQdnBMKjkxDDs3OqHVYgCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10540510',7.1,3352,'ja','犬王','A cursed dancer and a blind musician — both ostracized by society — become business partners and inseparable friends as their larger-than-life concerts propel them to stardom in 14th century Japan.','/67WmijqW7fjmLcc0eKZtW59Hf4d.jpg','2022-05-28',98,'Released','Bring it on, Japan\'s Romantic','Inu-Oh',642538,4.1883,7.4,'EgHPfTl05J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23252,_binary '\0','/wVQt4A4ivat2pnHR8qD62hHDmjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10541028',7.5,1557,'bn','গোত্র','An elderly woman strikes a unique bond with the ex-convict who is entrusted with taking care of her, in this heartwarming story of love, faith and redemption, with a message of strong communal harmony.','/syObU9FOLGTK15q7nEddFVBkwtP.jpg','2019-08-23',141,'Released','Embraces Humanity','Gotro',626939,0.7399,5.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23253,_binary '\0','/am5OWeUqnv2wxJVIjXr0HGac815.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054113',6.2,3081,'da','Kandidaten','Jonas Bechmann, a defense attorney, is a man of the system. Until the day he himself is accused of murder. Taking matters into his own hands, he throws himself into the hunt for a group of blackmailers who threaten to expose him as the killer. But nothing is what it appears to be, and the blackmail links back to his father\'s death under mysterious circumstances a year and a half earlier.','/jhQyKXi1BPsYUEzlY1ncxeknb6S.jpg','2008-08-29',90,'Released',NULL,'The Candidate',15932,2.5016,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23254,_binary '\0','/hbcFlkImTTRCIxDdW2ajOmOB1DO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054115',5.1,4682,'no','Rovdyr','Its the summer of 1974. Four friends have planned a recreational weekend hiking and camping in the forest. At a remote truck stop they pick up an anxious hitchhiker who only after a short ride demands they stop the vehicle. She is clearly frightened of somethingbut what she cant begin to describe in her carsick terror. Suddenly the group are ambushed and left unconscious.','/lldkGJ70mspipKkhiS2GV8tvYmI.jpg','2008-01-04',78,'Released',NULL,'Manhunt',11927,1.5844,4.963,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23255,_binary '\0','/aDID5kJeH3wPUmA3rwhV38mxQQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054116',6.3,2320,'no','Den siste revejakta','The decade of the hippies is at an end and the 80\'s are approaching fast. Carl and Robert are two doped out guys who lives in harmony with the world around them and let life pass by in an eternal hash high. They have been peddling hashish for a decade, hitting an all time high with this last batch: 45 Kilos of pure, high grade Nepalese Hashish. Following the delivery, the police are on their tail.','/aVGwqT9vEUddcQIHRWoOXTltV7E.jpg','2008-08-29',84,'Released',NULL,'The Last Joint Venture',13774,1.2507,6.2,'ExZyw-bEY70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23256,_binary '\0','/2oEbG4dwwzjcaXYvMJkMV3idBOb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054122',6.6,5680,'ja','Goemon','Follow the infamous ninja bandit named Ishikawa Goemon in an epic story. One night while looting treasure from Nanban, Goemon finds a mysterious box hidden inside a secret grave. A forgotten relic from the past containing untold powers.','/kHo5yDjgpH5brCT2wCgjW2HdSLq.jpg','2009-03-17',128,'Released',NULL,'Goemon',24293,2.4026,6.888,'a_BzNsDvpRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23257,_binary '\0','/5t6xPRvtpuWvhmFHoOYugIkudW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10543680',5.7,6230,'hi','गिन्नी वेड्स सन्नी','Delhi girl Ginny lives with her matchmaker mother and is set up with Sunny, who has given up on the idea of love. He just wants to get married and settle down. But, the match is not that simple. As Ginny meets Sunny, there’s a lot more that comes to the fore than previously imagined in this tale of love, life, weddings and music.','/1LhWNRcLkHmtQPf9aYK534uxHP9.jpg','2020-10-09',125,'Released',NULL,'Ginny Weds Sunny',744676,1.5569,5.959,'21xdmUQUjTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23258,_binary '\0','/nQRTynJcXF5GRcyEHF09yZIuQ7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545076',8.4,3182,'ko','브링 더 소울: 더 무비','A glimpse into K-pop group BTS’ world away from the stage, featuring intimate group discussions alongside spectacular concert performances from their world tour.','/7x5CguA0MxHqbSjhi14UEuK7c95.jpg','2019-08-07',105,'Released','Forever, we are young.','Bring the Soul: The Movie',611291,3.8599,8.292,'AwrClxIhsYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23259,_binary '\0','/7qeBDneOZhFOFHEGeurOjbmSLxc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545214',5,2861,'hi','Aliya Basu Gayab Hai','Ex-convicts Deepak Kumar and Vikram Singh abduct Aliya Basu, a rich man\'s daughter for ransom. But, Vikram is unaware that Deepak has a different plan.','/pPbLh3EuvcGrxhpOMfK5XIUT1az.jpg','2024-08-09',103,'Released','Have You Seen Her?','Aliya Basu Gayab Hai',1327907,1.246,0,'uL_q0_0g5r8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23260,_binary '\0','/bk1TitfD4YIGrM6AvljonMCtfnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545296',6.6,190047,'en','The Hunger Games: The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes','64 years before he becomes the tyrannical president of Panem, Coriolanus Snow sees a chance for a change in fortunes when he mentors Lucy Gray Baird, the female tribute from District 12.','/mBaXZ95R2OxueZhvQbcEWy2DqyO.jpg','2023-11-15',157,'Released','Everyone hungers for something.','The Hunger Games: The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes',695721,23.7659,6.953,'NxW_X4kzeus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23261,_binary '\0','/7I2OsWdv9rEgH7ajRLqAs9TsJWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545470',6.8,1655,'fr','Au nom de la terre','Pierre is 25 when he returns from Wyoming to his fiancée and take over the family farm. Twenty years later, the farm expanded and so did the family. It\'s the time of happy days, at least at the beginning. The debts accumulate and Pierre is exhausted at work. Despite the love of his wife and children, he is slowly falling...','/4n4Mrn3StPtzWu8IOBII4k1T127.jpg','2019-09-25',103,'Released',NULL,'In the Name of the Land',612368,2.1745,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23262,_binary '\0','/oodlsWgLSFStFvu4mODNXy3i0e0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545484',8.1,10185,'te','ఎవరు','When a high-ranking police officer is killed by his alleged rape victim, Sub-inspector Vikram Vasudev is entrusted with investigating what seems like an open-and-shut case. However, as he delves deeper, Vikram finds the case spiralling into a dark tale filled with unexpected surprises.','/kRxKI0ZuKTIp3BZJPHF9YoDYkaR.jpg','2019-08-15',118,'Released','All answers shall be Questioned','Evaru',607310,1.7358,7.061,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23263,_binary '\0','/gHUmEf35h35kRpnpt0U4sRqlpZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545696',5.9,3860,'fr','Maigret','In Paris, a young girl is found dead in a Parisian square, wearing an evening dress. Commissioner Maigret will try to identify her and then understand what happened to the victim.','/qWmJyzqXVSLzsq4XKXr4lIDlLBg.jpg','2022-02-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Maigret',752564,3.1431,5.771,'9Q1NTvyLxgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23264,_binary '\0','/7I1Yj4vz57L6BF6theOaKOs9QYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10545704',7.1,3734,'fr','Adieu Monsieur Haffmann','Paris 1942. François Mercier is an ordinary man who only aspires to start a family with the woman he loves, Blanche. He is also the employee of a talented jeweler, Mr. Haffmann. But faced with the German occupation, the two men will have no other choice but to conclude an agreement whose consequences, over the months, will upset the fate of our three characters.','/7PnzcmLH5j4gek0Z8OT3uTilAQT.jpg','2022-01-12',115,'Released',NULL,'Farewell, Mr. Haffmann',670243,2.2389,6.883,'ynh8hXoLza8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23265,_binary '\0','/ivgsXGoQDskwfvyMJy7jgSfEsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054580',7.3,15629,'en','Desert Flower','The autobiography of a Somalian nomad who was sold in marriage at 13, fled from Africa a while later to become finally an American supermodel and is now at the age of 38, the UN spokeswoman against female genital mutilation.','/ciH58y8eF7XG5GBg9m8ILNQImAq.jpg','2009-09-24',127,'Released','The extraordinary true story of the woman who crossed the desert and changed the world.','Desert Flower',33997,5.8251,7.6,'gxQqzlISV9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23266,_binary '\0','/ApZcctYdXNkRTjQH5Yr6eFMkmYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054588',7,18417,'en','Flash of Genius','In this David vs. Goliath drama based on a true story, college professor Robert Kearns goes up against the giants of the auto industry when they fail to give him credit for inventing intermittent windshield wipers. Kearns doggedly pursues recognition for his invention, as well as the much-deserved financial rewards for the sake of his wife and six kids.','/14gyR9JMVfngQlolzD2N365ZeRz.jpg','2008-09-07',119,'Released','Corporations have time, money, and power on their side. All Bob Kearns had was the truth.','Flash of Genius',14914,3.9766,6.6,'0Biy-okZ0l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23267,_binary '\0','/vBw4z7l3NI32th7nR34zqRgdvXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054606',6.7,158327,'en','The Imaginarium of Doctor Parnassus','After a carnival troupe saves his life, a man agrees to help its immortal leader collect five souls and win a bet with the devil.','/DtrqQHa0wT9AWrk2WA9beROJJx.jpg','2009-10-01',123,'Released','The man who tried to cheat the devil.','The Imaginarium of Doctor Parnassus',8054,8.9631,6.4,'Iqe85ffv9-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23268,_binary '\0','/t1oXsgTKeUynLOnntPpiKfaBApb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054631',4.6,2515,'en','House Broken','In order to enjoy his retirement, a father takes drastic measures to get his twentysomething, slacker sons to move out and fend for themselves.','/s8zNIRU3SNIkMGTi3gmzV8iMYkP.jpg','2009-12-12',84,'Released',NULL,'House Broken',28210,3.0605,5.1,'N019b7VK8bM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23269,_binary '\0','/oT8fFm8h1gsqvEO5kDXnyL3tCVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1054677',7.2,1729,'pt','As Melhores Coisas do Mundo','Everyday family life as perfectly normal madness. “As Melhores Coisas do Mundo“ follows a few days in the life of the 15-year-old Mano, who is fighting on two fronts: his parents have just got divorced and he is going through puberty. Mano tries to make his way through life, with its first sexual experiences, his depressed brother and his self-centered parents. It’s a humorous homage to the pitfalls of daily life and the diversity of life.','/ykvUvNuqb61Fw6k6oI6Xeo4GSZU.jpg','2010-05-22',106,'Released',NULL,'The Best Things in the World',24243,1.3795,6.3,'Q6oa7FMZKKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23270,_binary '\0','/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10548174',6.6,227266,'en','28 Years Later','Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.','/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg','2025-06-18',115,'Released','Time didn\'t heal anything.','28 Years Later',1100988,30.1632,6.606,'IYGG55qwQZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23271,_binary '\0','/6nlwVQe1BFoeCBWNJQEPYnQVcpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10549312',4.6,3984,'tr','Baba Parası','A group of siblings that share nothing but a father come together after the patriarch\'s death to compete for his fortune. He left a save for his children, but took the password to the grave with him.','/emy9RWQ4YbpBqfxY5dINQdzJeKy.jpg','2020-01-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Baba Parası',657247,1.7637,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23272,_binary '\0','/4MDYpCwqSVO5RcTiZ4GEfePzDdl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10550884',6.3,5390,'ko','사자','After waking up with mysterious wounds on his hands, a champion fighter finds himself in an otherworldly battle against evil forces that wreak havoc in the human world.','/9Z2qT9iZYLzzsCSYu7A4SEQsKX0.jpg','2019-07-31',129,'Released','Will you stand with good or evil?','The Divine Fury',571627,3.108,6.701,'xLrYXoeanxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23273,_binary '\0','/3PlHbkANRZRcIYPi5sPLvb4oGAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10551118',3.6,1649,'en','Zombie Tidal Wave','A fisherman contends with an ocean-borne outbreak that threatens his seaside island community.','/bdlWPVFMsBchv07HxF2khcdCEwZ.jpg','2019-08-17',86,'Released','Landfall Means Our Downfall','Zombie Tidal Wave',623464,2.296,4.4,'oaf63JYTGrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23274,_binary '\0','/pWZkKA9nyvBspZ0E3y348tBDtjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10551608',7.8,4233,'ml','തണ്ണീർ മത്തൻ ദിനങ്ങൾ','Jaison, a teenager, has a crush on Keerthy, but she does not reciprocate his feelings. To make things worse, he gets in trouble with Ravi, the new teacher who is liked by everyone, especially Keerthy.','/5DbCWsIRUC1j2EG7oxQhoDOhPh2.jpg','2019-07-26',133,'Released',NULL,'Thanneer Mathan Dinangal',618435,1.5442,7.613,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23275,_binary '\0','/59sQOjOP5ktav9DtxgnXBF2oaja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10551654',5.9,1949,'en','Under the Boardwalk','Two crabs embark on an epic journey to get home after a storm sweeps them away. Their courage soon unites their families, paving the way for great summers to come.','/pJzk88QM8USoEY6VWAEQFoubkFd.jpg','2023-10-27',87,'Released',NULL,'Under the Boardwalk',609271,5.1542,7.27,'vQmTVrNuxAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23276,_binary '\0','/cesoxNaFtgehjh72GDniFfrbcws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10551904',5.8,2194,'fr','L\'Origine du monde','One day, Jean-Louis discovers that his heart has stopped. He is not dead, can walk and talk, but his heart is no longer beating. With the help of his wife and a friend, he tries to understand the origin of this mystery.','/9btM1KTckYffLNMGy5x5Qen9noI.jpg','2020-10-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Dear Mother',615684,2.6827,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23277,_binary '\0','/5ix2oWtVKcLYdPBjMm6srqq4Pd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1055292',6.5,146381,'en','Life As We Know It','After a disastrous first date for caterer Holly and network sports director Messer, all they have in common is a dislike for each other and their love for their goddaughter Sophie. But when they suddenly become all Sophie has in this world, Holly and Messer must set their differences aside. Juggling careers and social calendars, they\'ll have to find common ground while living under the same roof.','/zLzS2aOqKsS0QvEaY6SfBw4VBqh.jpg','2010-10-02',114,'Released','A comedy about taking it one step at a time.','Life As We Know It',38408,8.5825,6.9,'ZNSeUYw95NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23278,_binary '\0','/gcY97HjmSgHnYVx6ruvQuFuB0Yc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1055300',6.3,5582,'zh','画皮','Painted Skin is based on one of Pu Songling\'s classic short stories in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio. Zhou Xun stars as Xiao Wei, a fox spirit that feasts on human hearts in order to maintain her lovely, youthful appearance. When General Wang Sheng (Chen Kun) \'rescues\' her from a band of bandits and brings her home, trouble brews as the demon falls in love with the general.','/5F7F