 Christmas','An extreme-sports photographer returns home for the holiday to take care of her grandmother, only to have a neighbor grab her attention as he needs assistance watching his young nephew.','/6j8XUqPooxOzx8yLQIwFnvhf7k6.jpg','2019-11-09',84,'Released',NULL,'Picture a Perfect Christmas',626323,2.7659,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23283,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10554196',4.2,1847,'en','Pungo: A Witch\'s Tale','A burned-out ex-Navy SEAL and an emotionally-damaged firefighter work together as handymen in Tidewater Virginia. Things turn surreal when a simple renovation job becomes a journey to another world to rescue their client from a trans-dimensional witch bent on revenge in this imaginative take on Grace Sherwood-the Witch of Pungo.','/6BQYbbUv4gVQBWPAtV5eRfSzzt5.jpg','2021-03-23',101,'Released','Wrongs. Rage. Revenge.','Pungo: A Witch\'s Tale',809668,1.034,4.9,'sgB5_jFhONg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23284,_binary '\0','/rOL34MIxUmWgDk7OMguteWAVzum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10554232',8,82465,'sr','Дара из Јасеновца','During the Nazi-occupied Ustasha regime \"NDH\" in former Yugoslavia during WWII, little girl Dara is sent to the concentration camp complex Jasenovac in Croatia also known as \"Balkan\'s Auschwitz\".','/inXhGdmfE6GCV1NpnZPUd6ECF2c.jpg','2020-11-25',130,'Released',NULL,'Dara of Jasenovac',733740,1.8002,7.536,'7RDs2Vuw_AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23285,_binary '\0','/nuBzJ5yXN5T9XjFdB1np50qkLpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10555668',4.7,3514,'en','Backwoods Blood Feud','A group of criminals on the run in a cold, winter forest find themselves caught in the middle of an ancient feud between the monsters that rule the day and the creatures that rule the night.','/wzuvYevKZRJ91DVAo6pIEeQ3xlE.jpg','2025-01-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Backwoods Blood Feud',1104999,2.2048,4,'7pvW9PBktyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(232