ased','The chase is on.','Supercell',842945,4.3116,5.7,'JYNAQGXjwH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23290,_binary '\0','/p0nSYgoT6exwHNmw9YT3rZb5dXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1056067',6.4,1760,'it','Un giorno perfetto','Antonio and Emma have been separated for years, but he does not accept when Emma dates other men. Indeed Antonio proves obsessive, aggressive and intrusive, and again threatens Emma to hurt the children: little Kevin, shy and introverted, and the adolescent Valentina.','/4OAoOukTHtkQjyT25tagOhlcESa.jpg','2008-08-30',105,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Day',12432,1.2717,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23291,_binary '\0','/xUFGn7gs1QC8fso0g5d6TUi2VLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10563420',5.7,3480,'en','The Deeper You Dig','14-year old Echo and her mother Ivy, a tarot card reader, live a quiet life in a rural area. When reclusive Kurt moves down the road to restore an abandoned farmhouse, an accident leads to Echo’s murder, and suddenly three lives collide in mysterious and wicked ways. Kurt assumes he can hide his secret under the ground. But Echo burrows into his head until he can feel her in his bones. As she haunts his every move, trying to reach her mother from beyond, Ivy must dig deep to see the signs and prove that love won’t stay buried.','/ciLziMBBQQfqwtQ5gmGAIROJRyY.jpg','2019-07-11',95,'Released','Love won\'t stay buried.','The Deeper You Dig',611640,1.8763,5.7,'Q64Bng5_oEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23292,_binary '\0','/dEplQmVuHWPPPdW4DQa2PIW6ssT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1056416',5.7,1722,'es','Sexykiller','In medical school of an elite university, campus starts sown with corpses. The police have no clue who is responsible for the carnage. Nobody suspected Barbara, a beautiful young innocent looking whose only concern seems to be the fashion. However, under the facade of frivolity, hides the most lethal and unforgiving of the killer: Barbykiller…','/8