r','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23308,_binary '\0','/7wJha5vZqbtmCVDHnR64qugJaAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1058601',5.9,1678,'de','Buddenbrooks','Mid-19th-century, Baltic Sea port city of Lubeck, Germany. Follows the fourth generation of the Buddenbrook mercantile family as Tony and Thomas reach the age of marriage. Fatefully impeded every step of the way, the Buddenbrooks struggle as economic hardship and personal defeats weigh down family relations.','/1boBJGtCZ4wH82sz5LBYgmo3tnQ.jpg','2008-12-25',151,'Released',NULL,'Buddenbrooks',2333,1.5999,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23309,_binary '\0','/qr5FU0Ueye47b9qbHAbMVaj5pav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1058743',5,1232,'en','Pretty Bird','A comic tale of three would-be entrepreneurs who set out to invent a rocket belt. The clash of their mismatched personalities soon dissolves the business into a morass of recriminations and retaliations, kidnapping, and murder in this parable of American dreams and delusions.','/tFPwhvFvLeJ3b4bsvxsYiYNjniC.jpg','2008-08-08',98,'Released','A Rocket Propelled Misadventure','Pretty Bird',40818,1.6586,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23310,_binary '\0','/9aWXBrBe9ZnejsgGvDuN70prKEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10588750',7.1,2092,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の新恐竜','Nobita accidentally finds a fossil dinosaur egg mixed with rocks in the dinosaur fossil exhibition site that he had visited before. He returns it to its original state with the \'time blanket\'.','/wxCZmXRJa8hSv1Tpih8TBSR4o6b.jpg','2020-08-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita\'s New Dinosaur',682153,3.9245,7.3,'BJtSICq4RNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23311,_binary '\0','/aydE5GnUgwAwIQMdce6z0l89QBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10589914',6.2,3290,'ja','愛なき森で叫べ','A con man and a would-be filmmaking crew force themselves into the lives of two grief-scarred young women. But nothing is as it seems.','/A7ve6RmC8C4VmfMEMhwRCwKWeim.jpg','2019-10-10',151,'Released','Is it love or is it a lie?','The Forest of Love',631997,2.5494,6.299,'z6TNDOKEyUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23312,_binary '\0','/yssmPz1bsEOOl1dEO68b01I4zMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10590458',3.1,1647,'en','Don\'t Speak','Upon arriving at their grandparents farm, a family soon realise the entire town has been taken out by an unknown monster that hunts by sound. And soon, they become its prey.','/4hxCrEQm1hRVkfpIZAYnDBueGsg.jpg','2020-03-10',84,'Released','It wasn\'t supposed to escape.','Don\'t Speak',673168,1.3705,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23313,_binary '\0','/lV8ATYQbehA30fgMx3eNGqouN7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10590530',6.2,1686,'pl','Psy 3: W imię zasad','Having spent years in prison, Franz Maurer is released and goes out into a new Poland, where nothing is as he remembered it to be. Who and what is waiting for the man who, for the last 25 years... hasn’t been doing anything? How will he find himself in a world where old principles and loyalty have ceased to exist? We will get to know that when fate reunites Franz and “Nowy”. Their meeting will change everything.','/zACDb1jD9P5M6R5lW6XC0tCwGAS.jpg','2020-01-17',126,'Released',NULL,'Pigs 3',642700,1.4913,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23314,_binary '\0','/601lG0zdVEwOSOBvaoaKwdPec0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10592082',7.4,1944,'bn','পরিণীতা','A teen learns that her love interest is dead.','/fy2FvHSmJEjycOqTmAsWlkXw1WT.jpg','2019-09-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Parineeta',628595,1.1269,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23315,_binary '\0','/iwBBrMGF2ZX3IDLB6JhBQHe8VJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10593750',3.2,1404,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı: Yaz Oyunları','At a school tournament in Cyprus, Yakışıklı, Racon, Format and Dede wind up competing — and goofing off — on behalf of the Private Çamlıca School.','/lqzRg4ewAXLzbB6zH5rQQWg7YUn.jpg','2021-07-02',103,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos