L,'Dhaakad',712863,1.8004,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23320,_binary '\0','/jo63jBLg9sulbjc8P24TtvBz3VJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059836',5.8,12205,'en','Transit','Nate takes his family for a camping trip to reconnect. When they pull off at a rest stop, a gang of thieves hides their stash from an armored car robbery among the family belongings. They soon find themselves on the run and the gang will stop at nothing to get their money back.','/6NmsF4LgWTefgEbigUE86O0kIr2.jpg','2012-03-22',88,'Released','This is not a perfect getaway.','Transit',82485,2.8913,5.8,'LYHl_xe0pas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23321,_binary '\0','/ookMrUuZmE1MfQB2E7vky3Hsl45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059887',4.2,3518,'en','National Lampoon\'s The Legend of Awesomest Maximus','A clueless Trojan general must meet an unbeatable Greek warrior on the battlefield.','/6IsqWxYEmF4BWTQyIj1nCOgpTvR.jpg','2011-08-05',87,'Released',NULL,'National Lampoon\'s The Legend of Awesomest Maximus',51261,2.7459,3.867,'Y3CU2Z_Xl6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23322,_binary '\0','/gRIOGqLYjMzOEo5vVVpZ60avE1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059925',6.1,10780,'en','According to Greta','Dumped on her grandparents for the summer by her indifferent mother, acerbic and self-destructive teenager Greta disrupts the elderly couple\'s staid life on the Jersey Shore. Eventually, a romance helps Greta face down her demons.','/aDq2E0zGXc9SwMHbTFjvyWK8cJa.jpg','2009-11-25',92,'Released','She\'s a trip, but she\'s no vacation.','According to Greta',26035,2.3371,6,'0rHx1_ssaLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23323,_binary '\0','/4NyJEGke7B5bZcRaImkTFc5FcZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059950',6.4,2487,'ja','ワンピース カラクリ城のメカ巨兵','The Straw Hats visits an island, known as Mecha Island, where a fisherman sings an old folk song about a Golden Crown. Searching for that mysterious treasure, they find a hidden entrance into the island. The island\'s leader, Ratchet, impressed with the find and in search of the Golden Crown himself, invites the crew to join him in his search and the crew along with Ratchet and his henchmen enter the cave. As it turns out, the islands true form, is that of a giant turtle. Ratchet, who had known this all along, uses his mechanical castle to take control of the turtle, in order to use it, to take over the world. Now the Straw Hats have to stop not only Ratchet, but also the helpless turtle, from crashing into a nearby island.','/4Pu26TQNiyl8kjNe1sI3NMG2OQG.jpg','2006-03-04',94,'Released',NULL,'One Piece: Giant Mecha Soldier of Karakuri Castle',44730,5.4135,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23324,_binary '\0','/jbdvzJvNu0swWURJp71Fxwd54Fm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059955',7.7,7465,'en','The Pixar Story','A look at the first years of Pixar Animation Studios - from the success of \"Toy Story\" and Pixar\'s promotion of talented people, to the building of its East Bay campus, the company\'s relationship with Disney, and its remarkable initial string of eight hits. The contributions of John Lasseter, Ed Catmull and Steve Jobs are profiled. The decline of two-dimensional animation is chronicled as three-dimensional animation rises. Hard work and creativity seem to share the screen in equal proportions.','/vhK51wJybwZTRCPVUOkGpSI4auN.jpg','2007-08-28',87,'Released','Documentary about the history of Pixar animation','The Pixar Story',15302,5.8784,7.5,'1uaDma1o6VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23325,_binary '\0','/7HvbATFNRLM63QMiCqb51RogIjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059969',6.6,2955,'en','Spud','It\'s South Africa 1990. Two major events are about to happen: The release of Nelson Mandela and, more importantly, it\'s Spud Milton\'s first year at an elite boys only private boarding school. Spud is a boy from an ordinary background who wins a scholarship to a private school in Kwazulu-Natal, South Africa. Surrounded by boys with nicknames like Gecko, Rambo, Rain Man and Mad Dog, Spud has his hands full trying to adapt to his new home.','/eZptpTY1VMMcyGdj3Hp5SY3M1IN.jpg','2010-12-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Spud',61410,2.3994,7,'C94Az3LFrtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23326,_binary '\0','/zYrG10Hvjv9izdXWfPC3U7fDYL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1059980',5,1343,'en','Soccer Mom','A warm-hearted comedy about a compulsive soccer mom who masquerades as a famous Italian soccer star hired to coach her daughter\'s floundering soccer team, then struggles frantically to keep her wacky charade going long enough to see the girls win their big tournament.','/hKQhXoWStscF9Xmy5KQYYPkLt3B.jpg','2008-09-30',92,'Released',NULL,'Soccer Mom',25432,1.6186,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23327,_binary '\0','/y6FYAhaeFMj9Lsk8OdF2NeWQkbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10600398',4.7,20002,'en','We Can Be Heroes','When alien invaders capture Earth\'s superheroes, their kids must learn to work together to save their parents - and the planet.','/1S21HpcKY6uQ9UAw68aICmrJaq6.jpg','2020-12-25',97,'Released','Power comes in all sizes.','We Can Be Heroes',615677,10.769,5.926,'omn2PJEuOTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23328,_binary '\0','/hp34FQVZrOkEGSokJYerwfv9QDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10601552',5.1,3180,'en','Slapface','A boy deals with the loss of his mother by creating a relationship with a dangerous monster.','/xFR5TrTfhjaKN2z17rP09hoQXXs.jpg','2022-04-21',86,'Released','Where do monsters come from?','Slapface',812320,1.9924,5.9,'PjX2jAQPYtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23329,_binary '\0','/cBueKI86rE4f0ommhkVo4snHUxp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10602132',5.9,2005,'es','Que nadie duerma','After losing her job as a computer programmer, Lucía decides to become a cab driver.','/plNar0h9w9BYweIT84IohZFmoy.jpg','2023-11-17',123,'Released',NULL,'Something Is About to Happen',828936,1.3896,6,'yUCMgpLg0aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23330,_binary '\0','/j7Dk5Zc5eR06DtCXhAg56TxsBY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1060249',2.1,2880,'hi','Drona','Aditya is an orphaned and lonely young man. He soon learns that he belongs to a family of ancestral warriors who guard a mystic source of cosmic energy, and he must now take up his responsibilities.','/7l5lejRwvkEnQ3s1dOLQ1qUXGRf.jpg','2008-10-02',150,'Released',NULL,'Drona',19623,1.482,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23331,_binary '\0','/fkUXPvrZ80sKu0R8tnobfQrg8rn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1060255',6.5,5812,'en','The Horseman','A tender drama unfolds between a grieving father and a troubled teenage girl as they drive northbound along the quiet outback roads of Australia. What she doesn\'t know is that between stops, he is leaving behind a bloody trail of bodies in a revenge motivated killing spree.','/wf4N27XD78B5MVKae7j9hHYZWAN.jpg','2008-08-03',96,'Released','He has some questions.','The Horseman',33134,2.0636,5.983,'NffTvJCwbTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23332,_binary '\0','/AwdOSr7SMmW73t1AVnM9XewXfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1060256',6.5,4134,'ja','ICHI','Ichi is a blind entertainer that travels the countryside with her traditional Japanese guitar and walking stick. She’s in search for the kind man that brought her up as a child, but because of her beauty she encounters problems every step of the way. Fortunately for Ichi, she is also a gifted swordswoman and carries a lethal blade within her walking stick.','/oLiCuvbIci52akNwPhxI0uIOz1v.jpg','2008-10-25',120,'Released','Justice is blind.','ICHI',19506,2.8902,6.764,'c6S8qoE_nCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23333,_binary '\0','/6ms6RdNcQUAnjBY26aM85xC2wV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1060277',7,447729,'en','Cloverfield','Five young New Yorkers throw their friend a going-away party the night that a monster the size of a skyscraper descends upon the city. Told from the point of view of their video camera, the film is a document of their attempt to survive the most surreal, horrifying event of their lives.','/qIegUGJqyMMCRjkKV1s7A9MqdJ8.jpg','2008-01-15',85,'Released','Some thing has found us.','Cloverfield',7191,11.4112,6.73,'wxqSIsxMlYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23334,_binary '\0','/bIqwnFmZVZ2AWo0dcMIpLhoEyHa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10605812',5.9,4209,'pt','A Menina que Matou os Pais','Based on one of the most shocking and gruesome murder cases in Brazil, the film presents Daniel Cravinhos\'s point of view of the events that led to the death of Marísia and Manfred von Richthofen, his girlfriend’s parents.','/7gqZyGlLjNKXIk8RBswqAGJygVz.jpg','2021-09-24',85,'Released','The crime that shocked the country.','The Girl Who Killed Her Parents',608804,2.0805,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23335,_binary '\0','/xhMiTYo5756I4mBuGvICpaGKkdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10606866',6.4,1733,'en','Love in Store','Two rival home shopping hosts are forced together while competing for a promotion. Along the way they find their on-air chemistry kindles an off-air spark.','/bp38RHebj0UKLy4C5cqtWcLaqq.jpg','2020-02-22',82,'Released',NULL,'Love in Store',661336,1.5709,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23336,_binary '\0','/k2TBrH1rDY96NyxLds4vWBtfuOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10608668',7.4,2720,'ml','വികൃതി','Mistaking the sleeping passenger on his train for a drunk, a young man posts a picture of him online, unaware of his impulsive act\'s ugly repercussions.','/lhyf1hRUXib411aUWtEARVvZb3z.jpg','2019-10-04',123,'Released','It Happens...','Vikruthi',637805,0.8698,6.467,'dq6iuEzlhgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23337,_binary '\0','/19vTfircuojU00I6xtRdy3DrF1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10611372',7.1,3566,'pt','Minha Mãe é uma Peça 3: O Filme','Dona Hermínia will have to rediscover and reinvent herself because her children are forming new families. This supermom will have to deal with a new life scenario: Marcelina is pregnant and Juliano is getting married.','/zw77BFPGJ73Lig8GwRzYj1XHq53.jpg','2019-12-26',110,'Released',NULL,'My Mom Is a Character 3',620683,2.0378,8.179,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23338,_binary '\0','/6kW718vGPA6Mg9NtdO90dGkVckq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10611992',4.3,1237,'en','Cyst','In the 1960s, a nurse\'s last day on her job is ruined when a doctor inadvertently creates a cyst monster that terrorizes the office.','/5nJwS765eHzCb5M8BTT2sl0lxxv.jpg','2020-09-24',68,'Released',NULL,'Cyst',741592,2.4837,4.6,'8ApgxHRuv3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23339,_binary '\0','/yUyuDacqA0IhWqEbPQPXBsEIbPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10612922',7.1,36250,'en','One Night in Miami...','In the aftermath of Cassius Clay\'s defeat of Sonny Liston in 1964, the boxer meets with Malcolm X, Sam Cooke and Jim Brown to change the course of history in the segregated South.','/1DLUb9PTDqXMSgsD7RmiJs7ZJIx.jpg','2020-12-25',114,'Released','Four legends. One legendary night.','One Night in Miami...',661914,5.981,6.991,'K8vf_Cmh9nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23340,_binary '\0','/brPBs99Kcv4D0J5VG0tlxboSTrV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10613002',6,1423,'ms','Roh','Cut off from civilisation, a single mother puts her children on high alert when they bring home a young girl caked in clay. She tells of spirits and spirit hunters, but these are not mere superstitions. As more strangers show up on her doorstep, she quickly finds another reason to fear the forest.','/2BQHnlpZrjXCZmK8rlqpSb0TUsZ.jpg','2020-08-06',82,'Released','All we need to do is whisper.','Roh',641548,1.607,5.5,'RCzo_Wpi3Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23341,_binary '\0','/spzAUftam5GtqcjoW9VeX3ybYZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10613992',6.9,2017,'fi','Seurapeli','Group of old friends gather in a summer villa to celebrate a surprise birthday party for Mitzi, who is the dramatic focal point of the group. The weekend starts ominously when Mitzi does not respond well to the surprise party. It turns out that Mitzi has just filed for divorce and has been looking forward to a peaceful weekend. The tense situation takes a new turn when Mitzi\'s best friend brings her new boyfriend for a visit, who happens to be a Swedish film star. Familiar surroundings and the old rituals get to the core of the group and make them forget their adulthood. Revelations, not meant to harm the balance, make them reassess their past as well as their present.','/zNN5VoXuiz0VOjlD2s1A0EVyiD.jpg','2020-06-25',105,'Released','It\'s their last weekend of being young','Games People Play',657430,1.0508,5.3,'ywk4yy_qLH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23342,_binary '\0','/9NQlrgoAgbotfLYPB4IRyQH2lB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10617192',6.7,1338,'en','Once Upon a Lifetime','As a boy copes with his difficult home life and his parents\' failing marriage, a mysterious girl suddenly appears. Faith, family and a special kind of magic come together as his new friend teaches them all about love, forgiveness and healing.','/fakZDQCmcbCkjno5CJy2lcJmCOm.jpg','2021-12-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Lifetime',1019721,1.1759,7,'GemP2g7OYWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23343,_binary '\0','/hBOH4PNnhcGPgZbZjBwkx9gnNxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10618286',6.8,105773,'en','Mank','1930s Hollywood is reevaluated through the eyes of scathing social critic and alcoholic screenwriter Herman J. Mankiewicz as he races to finish the screenplay of Citizen Kane.','/4yzTcAtvzyZLLto4z04xobUK9el.jpg','2020-11-13',132,'Released',NULL,'Mank',614560,5.241,6.663,'aSfX-nrg-lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23344,_binary '\0','/k2SY15W9QXH9qL8f4a4BbytV1BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10620868',6.3,56354,'ko','#살아있다','As a grisly virus rampages a city, a lone man stays locked inside his apartment, digitally cut off from seeking help and desperate to find a way out.','/lZPvLUMYEPLTE2df1VW5FHTYC8N.jpg','2020-06-24',98,'Released','You must survive.','#Alive',614696,7.5827,7.202,'jQ8CCg1tOqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23345,_binary '\0','/sk5KCRdQ0GVP6fngh03PVkRMBb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10621032',6.9,4399,'ja','ルパン三世 THE FIRST','The iconic \"gentleman thief\" Lupin III returns in an action-packed, continent-spanning adventure, as Lupin III and his colorful underworld companions race to uncover the secrets of the mysterious Bresson Diary, before it falls into the hands of a dark cabal that will stop at nothing to resurrect the Third Reich.','/yEKzkOF0uImcs4CdhPQpF8TwVDE.jpg','2019-12-06',93,'Released','Well, let\'s get started.','Lupin III: The First',614587,5.6051,7.309,'6C2ZsWobs68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23346,_binary '\0','/rKpnClqDyYu8QWM07gzUyPqA7xB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1062161',3.2,2021,'en','The Hive','When ants, displaying never-before-seen behavior, seize an island, the controversial Thorax Team is called in to stop the massive threat, only to discover that the ants are controlled by something beyond this world.','/yWiSAvc5QnjIrenvjlQJbnLrH8.jpg','2008-02-17',90,'Released','Death is Their Picnic.','The Hive',35429,1.6945,4.1,'DLdMK1Dz7dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23347,_binary '\0','/DwTyJZKMH7rcJFDpQ5X3fZs6K9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10622410',6.8,1474,'vi','Mắt Biếc','Ngạn\'s unrequited love for Hà Lan, a stubborn girl with dreamy eyes is a love story with many facets, from childish playfulness and innocent high school romance to a poignant chase that, despite numerous events, becomes a bittersweet pursuit of love, yet one that never loses hope. The story becomes even more complicated when Trà Long, Hà Lan\'s daughter, grows up and develops feelings for Ngạn.','/fSDrH9rI2TgMqcYb05qw8cLtXmS.jpg','2019-12-20',117,'Released','She\'s a good girl. She has beautiful eyes. Dreamy eyes. But I fear, she won\'t live a happy life.','Dreamy Eyes',618010,1.5024,6.7,'MNm77lvTfi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23348,_binary '\0','/1QrEQHXX8nqquTBam25HiMrTRTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10622790',6.3,2776,'pt','Primos','Lucas is a young man who lives with his religious aunt Lourdes in a quiet country town. He helps his aunt by holding religious meetings with the ladies of the area, in the living room, playing biblical songs on the keyboard. This quiet life will end as soon as the charitable aunt communicates the arrival of another nephew, Mario, just out of jail. The clash of reality between the cousins ends up causing unusual situations, and an unexpected attraction among the boys.','/2o0pzmuQKFhuPnz4hvpfjd3BlNR.jpg','2019-12-10',83,'Released',NULL,'Cousins',613868,5.1352,7.728,'snNSFiD7WC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23349,_binary '\0','/vtyhGpDBEZp8Yg53qzlGdhhiSDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10622972',7.4,3069,'mr','झिम्मा','The movie revolves around a group of seven women travelling to London and discovering themselves.','/txTAULwiztstw29PJUHgl5EBdxK.jpg','2021-11-19',130,'Released',NULL,'Jhimma',904137,0.6178,7.3,'L3hNlo7mVGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23350,_binary '\0','/g7BLrCt4YTMGy2owE9qHxjC8ES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10623524',7.5,3338,'pa','ਚਲ ਮੇਰਾ ਪੁੱਤ','A lighthearted comedy about a group of illegal immigrants living in the City of Birmingham trying to better their lives. Chal Mera Putt explores the struggles they face, the lasting friendships they make and the challenges they overcome all whilst trying to get their PR.','/i4ckFOOeyvU3EGnxbARsoORWbCT.jpg','2019-07-26',124,'Released',NULL,'Chal Mera Putt',617483,1.0332,7,'L4SWVmkwQvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23351,_binary '\0','/ifiw0r2wMSP8ERz7QcJwJV5wHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10627352',5.7,2274,'fr','Effacer l\'historique','In a provincial suburb, three neighbours come to terms with the consequences of the new world of social media. Marie, who lives off her husband’s family allowance, is afraid of losing her son’s respect because of a sex tape. Bertrand can’t say no to advertising calls and is fighting to protect his daughter, who is being bullied online. Christine, after losing everything because of her addiction to TV series, wonders why her rating as an Uber driver is not taking off. These three lone fighters are incapable of finding a solution to their problems on their own — until they join forces to declare war on the tech giants.','/5JXC451k9TD9zE4FSrASv66MowV.jpg','2020-08-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Delete History',659699,2.1312,5,'KuEYEc9yL_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23352,_binary '\0','/4HPcsQP2qdwtTyezK5dUo75OiVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10627548',5.2,3395,'en','Dolly Parton\'s Christmas on the Square','A rich and nasty woman returns to her hometown to evict everyone but discovers the true meaning of Christmas thanks to the local townsfolk – and an actual angel. Features 14 original songs with music and lyrics by Dolly Parton!','/2fmnCR1UpojTl5FRBu7OzZTibA4.jpg','2020-11-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Dolly Parton\'s Christmas on the Square',747349,2.684,5.8,'M5anWrBFPmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23353,_binary '\0','/rjzkLxLm4RDVGHIzhZWXJr3rUeG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10627564',6.2,1667,'en','Christmas at Dollywood','Event planner Rachel lands her biggest job yet – Dollywood\'s 30th Smoky Mountain Christmas celebration, where she’s teamed with operations director Luke to plan an event as glamorous as Dolly Parton herself. Sparks fly, but it takes matchmaking by Dolly to help them find their way.','/wJS8MfxkzdjjfCweZUKdlXKZamr.jpg','2019-12-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at Dollywood',626309,1.7567,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23354,_binary '\0','/bU3dXiQ1ffO7HodBbvv3UZkbcaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10627584',6.8,16588,'it','La vita davanti a sé','In seaside Italy, a Holocaust survivor with a daycare business takes in a 12-year-old street kid who recently robbed her.','/6oTn5kXRS84exXTC7XcqotKZu9B.jpg','2020-11-03',94,'Released','The bonds we forge can change us forever.','The Life Ahead',667869,3.0542,6.7,'a0ejncDxgCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23355,_binary '\0','/k1pJslKr4aDayw9kWwWnlC3MIP3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10627720',7.3,24141,'zh','哪吒之魔童降世','A young boy is born as the reincarnation of a demonic power, into a society that hates and fears him. Destined by prophecy to bring destruction to the world, Nezha must choose between good and evil to see if he can change his fate.','/phM9bb6s9c60LA8qwsdk7U1N2cS.jpg','2019-07-26',110,'Released','Fight your fate','Ne Zha',615453,19.1383,7.912,'0S7_LgTiHnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23356,_binary '\0','/4D0LwwHmhgd3R3nmln13wEEjKHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10628092',6.8,6007,'de','Contra','With his uncouth manner, Professor Pohl doesn’t enjoy the best reputation at the university where he works. To make matters worse, he makes a racist remark when student Naima arrives late for his lecture. Unfortunately for him, a video of his verbal outburst spreads like wildfire on the Internet, and the university’s president, Lambrecht, is called to deal with the incident. But Pohl is not dismissed. Instead, he is put to the task of helping Naima prepare for an important debating competition. The lecturer and the student could not be more different, yet they are thrown together to work as a team.','/m2p8j2qVJNV26GyoEF4GJOv0xQg.jpg','2020-10-28',104,'Released',NULL,'Contra',664698,1.6702,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23357,_binary '\0','/owoOf2hXNIdIArXFu2QPffU96vb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1063056',5.6,8275,'en','From Within','When the citizens of a small evangelical town systematically begin committing suicide, a young girl struggling to reconcile her Christian upbringing with her desire to experience the outside world finds her faith put to the ultimate test.','/yyAiGq6SycABwV9m9KqqB2i6Ctl.jpg','2008-04-25',89,'Released','Death is catching.','From Within',16167,2.6503,5.6,'tTNtrVJ7Rs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23358,_binary '\0','/qUBGfFx8ZEGFLE1ng8MrOdbm2Gq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1063111',5.3,1374,'en','Small Town Saturday Night','Just days before Rhett (Chris Pine) is leaving for Nashville to pursue a lifelong dream of being a singer/songwriter, his girlfriend Samantha (Bre Blair) realizes that \"his\" future may not be \"their\" future. This news comes as a shock to Rhett, and he is faced with having to choose between following his dream and staying in his hometown in order to be with the woman he loves.','/4lcfwIpI1YfZzot7fP1N243vK8n.jpg','2010-05-31',94,'Released',NULL,'Small Town Saturday Night',39477,2.1926,5.2,'0zVdCKlEXMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23359,_binary '\0','/Aig3ARMsgC1n7Zm7orI4HDgFGPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10631148',5,1351,'en','They Live in the Grey','While investigating a child abuse case, Claire discovers that the family is being tormented by a supernatural entity. In order to save the family, she must confront her own fears and use her emerging clairvoyance to stop the malevolent force.','/qWAbfMXbzGRD6GOoC242lrpXz2T.jpg','2022-06-16',124,'Released',NULL,'They Live in the Grey',892771,1.9787,4.8,'GBZkcrwRYDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23360,_binary '\0','/bKCpRjjTKcr3KAITmwjVMobbBYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10633456',7.4,127441,'en','Minari','A Korean American family moves to an Arkansas farm in search of its own American dream. Amidst the challenges of this new life in the strange and rugged Ozarks, they discover the undeniable resilience of family and what really makes a home.','/6mPNdmjdbVKPITv3LLCmQoKs9Zw.jpg','2021-02-12',115,'Released','A timeless story of what roots us.','Minari',615643,6.8898,7.324,'KQ0gFidlro8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23361,_binary '\0','/1y4sTs4pAbilS9eyx8OZV4E66Qa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10635042',7,1965,'ja','劇場版 美少女戦士セーラームーンEternal 前編','After a total solar eclipse, a dark circus troupe appears, Mamoru is stricken with a mysterious malady and bad things start happening across the city. Sequel to the Sailor Moon Crystal TV series.','/dJaGPwYJh3c6EXNX8JlHBYQH0Ij.jpg','2021-01-08',81,'Released',NULL,'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon Eternal the Movie Part 1',618851,3.9009,7.9,'XDnKDYpvEgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23362,_binary '\0','/bxQT6xCjejpGtgKl0QH8WUtrs33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1063669',7.6,122865,'de','Die Welle','A school teacher discusses types of government with his class. His students find it too boring to repeatedly go over national socialism and believe that dictatorship cannot be established in modern Germany. He starts an experiment to show how easily the masses can become manipulated.','/vtJ4u0fpTZhibxAJHzXtcdCxhsL.jpg','2008-03-13',107,'Released','Their teacher became their leader. His students became his soldiers.','The Wave',7735,7.5166,7.49,'JbTkdqYivuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23363,_binary '\0','/46Os8U0DEPmI0OnvKDxucl6SLVZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10638522',7.1,224796,'en','Talk to Me','When a group of friends discover how to conjure spirits using an embalmed hand, they become hooked on the new thrill, until one of them goes too far and unleashes terrifying supernatural forces.','/kdPMUMJzyYAc4roD52qavX0nLIC.jpg','2023-07-26',95,'Released','You call. They\'ll answer.','Talk to Me',1008042,18.4562,7.1,'PGo4wfCejsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23364,_binary '\0','/5fxTB08O7CW1hAcN2MWOKodp1h1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10640346',7.1,209990,'en','Babylon','A tale of outsized ambition and outrageous excess, tracing the rise and fall of multiple characters in an era of unbridled decadence and depravity during Hollywood\'s transition from silent films to sound films in the late 1920s.','/wjOHjWCUE0YzDiEzKv8AfqHj3ir.jpg','2022-12-22',189,'Released','Always make a scene.','Babylon',615777,31.7781,7.34,'5muQK7CuFtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23365,_binary '\0','/pOYcG9URkRGLbMuFGqdh57DAdh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10641972',7.3,1261,'vi','Thưa mẹ con đi','Văn comes back to Ho Chi Minh City from the US with his boyfriend Ian to visit his mother. Being the male heir of the family, everyone expects him to take a wife soon. And to top it all, his grandmother, who has Alzheimer, mistakes Ian for her grandson.','/9LgTrVsiXqX4r4eMsKLhtefFvJC.jpg','2019-08-16',100,'Released','What\'s important is that you\'re here.','Goodbye Mother',623897,1.8386,6.8,'DkrxQbFwto0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23366,_binary '\0','/71kAv6hJ8G9zmjZJQhWUtC9ubp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10642834',7.2,5831,'en','The Forty-Year-Old Version','Desperate for a breakthrough as she nears the big 4-0, struggling New York City playwright Radha finds inspiration by reinventing herself as a rapper.','/ilMExVn5xyfIWAnqngqAB0OFsE5.jpg','2020-10-02',123,'Released','Find your own voice.','The Forty-Year-Old Version',620897,2.5387,6.7,'RRpGNnaDzeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23367,_binary '\0','/1nsPxFiclxmpoAtGdaQPwx8JxtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10643926',6.7,5108,'en','The Storied Life of A.J. Fikry','This comical love story follows the story of A.J. Fikry, whose life is not at all what he expected it to be. His wife has died, his bookstore is experiencing the worst sales in its history and now his prized possession, a rare edition of Poe poems, has been stolen. He’s given up on people and even the books in his store offer another reminder that the world is changing too rapidly. But when a mysterious package arrives at the store, it gives Fikry the chance to make his life over and see things anew.','/jBAYPL15J3BecGujAydLZ1a06mF.jpg','2022-10-07',105,'Released',NULL,'The Storied Life of A.J. Fikry',841733,2.7763,6.5,'SqhHtZncOPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23368,_binary '\0','/lzAQPU1AXEcSedo0w5NYehZSiqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10644282',5.1,2803,'ml','ഷൈലോക്ക്','A ruthless moneylender must tackle a wicked man\'s plan to outsmart his way out of the debt to achieve what\'s rightfully his.','/irfywGm8kWiQphsSLaKQES3pCJ6.jpg','2020-01-23',130,'Released','The Money Lender','Shylock',663771,1.1816,3.476,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23369,_binary '\0','/nfdCy7T53WMGsCTkWlj4ppnq2px.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10644708',6.2,12748,'hi','Dhokha: Round D Corner','When a delusional housewife with a personality disorder is taken hostage by a terrorist on the loose and a husband accused of cheating on his wife have their own versions of reality, how do we know who\'s saying the truth?','/mcNf2j9e5iDWAfLr7pS9uusgXx5.jpg','2022-09-22',108,'Released',NULL,'Dhokha: Round D Corner',1005581,1.8749,5.371,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23370,_binary '\0','/jbLhPErePs1MRwht2FvQTA9Lcc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10645682',4.3,3618,'en','The Jack in the Box','When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is un-earthed and opened, it\'s new owners soon have reason to believe the creepy clown doll within has a life of its own.','/suaQ6oScsa5rrfx3osJHyQp1ZXb.jpg','2019-11-09',87,'Released','Once you open the box... you can\'t escape it.','The Jack in the Box',622420,3.9761,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23371,_binary '\0','/4KbFv3dnhS0SURJcpZjWanf6oBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1064744',5.3,5369,'en','Dying Breed','An extinct species, the Tasmanian tiger. A long-forgotten legend, “The Pieman” aka Alexander Pearce, who was hanged for cannibalism in 1824. Both had a desperate need to survive; both could have living descendants within the Tasmanian bush. Four hikers venture deep into isolated territory to find one of these legends, but which one will they come upon first?','/x8PQSt7nHAbMEbHX0nSLaUIPj4Z.jpg','2008-04-26',92,'Released','Some species are better off dead.','Dying Breed',18029,2.3847,5.2,'dtnPGuvmnug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23372,_binary '\0','/8JWfh0F9PE7nvg2S3HNnrxbKjuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10648146',2.5,1254,'en','The Haunting of Margam Castle','A team of American parapsychologists travel to Wales to conduct a study of Margam Castle, one of the UK\'s most haunted buildings.','/r2BlIxjAaj0WERGrIehnczNE0On.jpg','2020-09-01',81,'Released','The most haunted building in the United Kingdom.','The Haunting of Margam Castle',738542,1.6601,5,'KBbJsuCaM-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23373,_binary '\0','/7W2ob4ALcwstMFdRfwLrcjUIHmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10648198',5.7,1272,'es','Dime cuando tú','After his grandfather\'s death, a young man decides to fulfill his elder\'s last wish with the help of his new friends. The problem starts when he falls in love with a female friend who may not feel the same.','/6XVcNvXQoa0z1QPQOr1Dd0ZHPAd.jpg','2020-12-25',96,'Released','☑ Sing ☑ Get drunk ☑ Make friends ☐ Fall in love','Tell Me When',676859,1.8906,6.46,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23374,_binary '\0','/jsoz1HlxczSuTx0mDl2h0lxy36l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10648342',6.1,474329,'en','Thor: Love and Thunder','After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.','/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg','2022-07-06',119,'Released','The one is not the only.','Thor: Love and Thunder',616037,28.7208,6.356,'Go8nTmfrQd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23375,_binary '\0','/wx9dK8ke3hcC4qBZsovI1SICZl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10648440',7,9192,'ko','엑시트','At his mother\'s 70th birthday party, Yong-nam runs into Eui-joo, who rejected him in college. When the city is engulfed in toxic gas from a terrorist attack, the two must find a way to escape using all the techniques they learned in their college rock climbing club.','/zf16eomhCB13cwMb4iFEbBT0Tsr.jpg','2019-07-31',103,'Released','There\'s no way out.','EXIT',572164,4.7255,7.618,'Sp_Uex375YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23376,_binary '\0','/snkRCV3ED99mYwo962fxohaTfrI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10648714',5.2,11920,'ru','Чернобыль','The aftermath of a shocking explosion at the Chernobyl nuclear power station made hundreds of people sacrifice their lives to clean up the site of the catastrophe and to successfully prevent an even bigger disaster that could have turned a large part of the European continent into an uninhabitable exclusion zone. This is their story.','/AmJLuHjxPdIJO6vmymeWADG6jK5.jpg','2021-04-15',136,'Released',NULL,'Chernobyl: Abyss',589761,7.1234,6.2,'G8xJb6-ZNKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23377,_binary '\0','/fKJLHP7tPE5lvH9coVjmqazRuDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1064884',7.1,5265,'en','Jesse Stone: Thin Ice','Jesse Stone and Captain Healy are shot during an unauthorized stake-out in Boston. Meanwhile, a cryptic letter sent from Paradise leads the mother of a kidnapped child to Stone. Though her son was declared dead, she hopes he will reopen the case.','/qLI3yvi9JOueey6ifydSzmvGRcK.jpg','2009-03-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Jesse Stone: Thin Ice',22555,3.4329,6.9,'iKh-eRMmy9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23378,_binary '\0','/pYp4rYNHp3n1dSUbPh3aHtf60wX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10649016',6.8,5696,'en','Safety','The story of Ray-Ray McElrathbey, a freshman football player for Clemson University, who secretly raised his younger brother on campus after his home life became too unsteady.','/qakkhhfyPv9YAm7225oGL00YBbo.jpg','2020-12-11',122,'Released','The strength of family will build an unstoppable team.','Safety',727306,3.292,7.467,'m0j8O2swT5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23379,_binary '\0','/iEsM1GlqDyvYMDLnCbZ3STDzwxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1064931',6.5,7751,'tr','Beyaz Melek','The film is a love story. However, it is not a story about the love between two people, but rather a story about the love and affection that a group of people feel for life and for each other. The film depicts all kinds of love, from east to west, from schoolchildren to villagers, from young to old, in both an emotional and humorous way.','/650kW1gSGLnLWKZ7wpEM3gdK6ru.jpg','2007-11-14',117,'Released',NULL,'White Angel',27947,2.2202,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23380,_binary '\0','/sBmLZreEkVK3bc6LLEyZFgKuxjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1064932',7.1,48074,'fr','Bienvenue chez les Ch\'tis','Although living a comfortable life in Salon-de-Provence, a charming town in the South of France, Julie has been feeling depressed for a while. To please her, Philippe Abrams, a post office administrator, her husband, tries to obtain a transfer to a seaside town, on the French Riviera, at any cost. The trouble is that he is caught red-handed while trying to scam an inspector. Philippe is immediately banished to the distant unheard of town of Bergues, in the Far North of France...','/cnUkc60SkI1PCY1SyfLFpZc0T7C.jpg','2008-02-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Welcome to the Sticks',8265,5.5641,6.7,'SLRTtHByPn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23381,_binary '\0','/3KlJThMkFl5XEZZoV7rA5VVbOg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1064953',5.8,2020,'ko','GP506','A small band of Korean soldiers is sent to patrol near a guard post and they find corpses scattered all over the area. They launch an investigation to find the truth behind the mystery.','/2UxvS5BzKQepzJnCushZCSYoGTI.jpg','2008-04-03',121,'Released','I have to end this myself.','The Guard Post',16882,2.0173,5.452,'gWyjqPUE2Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23382,_binary '\0','/lFdAiLuRclyRz1TfY6N4PPCpMC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10650610',6.4,2144,'en','Sense, Sensibility & Snowmen','Christmas enthusiast party planners Ella and her sister, Marianne, clash with their client, Edward, who is a not-so-jolly toy company CEO.','/57WPZHvKzcPvzJn5Ar5DrYuH3QS.jpg','2019-12-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Sense, Sensibility & Snowmen',627491,1.91,6.8,'bdxEE0QZTE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23383,_binary '\0','/Ac2s9RJEi1ZeaQopoLsqlsmWQmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065073',7.9,383767,'en','Boyhood','The film tells a story of a divorced couple trying to raise their young son. The story follows the boy for twelve years, from first grade at age 6 through 12th grade at age 17-18, and examines his relationship with his parents as he grows.','/2BvtvDUyxiMJ4dmKfiQf4qdOHQN.jpg','2014-06-05',165,'Released','12 years in the making.','Boyhood',85350,8.3579,7.492,'Y0oX0xiwOv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23384,_binary '\0','/2Fg6USAspjh717Tm0fFKPWHBQBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065092',3.6,1336,'en','In the Spider\'s Web','When a team of backpackers sets out to explore the Indian jungles, one of them is bitten by a poisonous spider and killed.','/2pLLgbkZQCThY4iMZpls2kO2O4n.jpg','2007-08-26',88,'Released','Prey for a quick death','In the Spider\'s Web',42901,2.3748,4.7,'mDQb8oEKdSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23385,_binary '\0','/pik8Pw3SjVhkprsSt354R5brdTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10650924',6.1,2059,'en','Same Time, Next Christmas','Olivia Anderson is a successful young woman who met her childhood sweetheart during her family’s annual Christmas visit to Hawaii. After being separated by distance and years, the two reunite at the same Hawaiian resort years later, and the old chemistry between them flares up anew—but circumstances conspire to keep them apart.','/rxnyJpZpL6nAQKhs13hX0MvztmO.jpg','2019-12-05',90,'Released','Say aloha to the one you love.','Same Time, Next Christmas',639422,2.1449,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23386,_binary '\0','/9x2CmGKYyZhGq7MgAAD3HRxxCUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065106',4.5,3599,'en','Pigs','A college ladies man accepts a challenge from his dorm buddies - sleep with the entire alphabet, A through Z, before graduation. The rules are simple: the rarer the first letter of the girl\'s last name, the higher the payout. All goes well until he falls for the \"X\". Now he\'s torn between his feelings for the girl and winning the bet for his friends.','/aYsi3rb3PJdR0M5mZ99nSXTV6XZ.jpg','2007-11-05',85,'Released','26 girls. 26 letters in the alphabet. 1 campus legend.','Pigs',18755,1.8664,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23387,_binary '\0','/6U6F2OnHTLs1Pxk8ZVDCRbd3a76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10651230',7.5,9542,'pl','Chłopi','Peasant girl Jagna is forced to marry the much older, wealthy farmer Boryna, despite her love for his son Antek. With time, Jagna becomes the object of envy and disdain with the villagers and she must fight to preserve her independence.','/8ATsQJx6SnG1EQgmbm3NNeUzwmw.jpg','2023-10-13',115,'Released','Love comes and goes but land stays.','The Peasants',734002,5.3503,7.5,'RfsoP--5_NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23388,_binary '\0','/39X0ZOKv0AwZQxuDqEtdYU91aVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10651668',6.6,1630,'en','My One & Only','Contestants on the popular reality dating TV show \"The One\" try to determine if they\'re fated to be together. Meanwhile, sparks fly between the female contestant and the handsome ranch owner who acts as their guide.','/u8zXclsKAAOewYLyCGc8gWyrhDV.jpg','2019-08-31',84,'Released',NULL,'My One & Only',622332,1.701,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23389,_binary '\0','/etRDWNFJhNVDXYhpYPXUke3kX64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065318',7,3622,'da','To verdener','17-year-old Sara leads a sheltered existence with her family, members of Jehovah’s Witnesses, when she meets the outsider Teis and falls in love. Sara, herself a believer, now faces an important turning point in her life as she is forced to choose between religion and love.','/5NQ98gYGwQjoh9eJe2lmmWVxobP.jpg','2008-02-22',116,'Released',NULL,'Worlds Apart',16015,1.4554,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23390,_binary '\0','/u1jyuVJtNOgE5eSq4BNedf9sjg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065329',4.2,1395,'it','Natale in crociera','Paolo Cioffa, as Christmas approaches, is ready to leave on a cruise with his mistress Magda Venni, freed by his wife Francesca Zanchi and his son Federico, who is about to go skiing.','/7uhGi38gRQa68S6Da9Smsqiv2zp.jpg','2007-12-14',103,'Released',NULL,'Natale in crociera',42436,1.3528,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23391,_binary '\0','/nL5nU3Mi65vb0HT3SEqPQbG7tU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1065332',6,2047,'fr','Parlez-moi de la pluie','Agathe Villanova is a self-centered, workaholic feminist politician who, upon reluctantly returning to her home in the south of France to sort out her mother\'s affairs, runs for a local election. Upon her arrival, Agathe grudgingly agrees to take part in a documentary being made by the blundering duo of Karim, an aspiring filmmaker, and self-professed \"reporter\" Michel, on the subject of \"successful women.\" As Agathe\'s life hilariously unravels, the camera is there to capture it all.','/yg6CvMBpzz2wdnlUgB3Fhw4fKvP.jpg','2008-09-17',98,'Released',NULL,'Let It Rain',15436,2.0002,5.5,'1QBAX6Rmsz