’t control, once and for all.','/q06saepaXeBdkMibuN4R2fXmgIw.jpg','2022-10-12',111,'Released','Only one of them will survive.','Halloween Ends',616820,13.3505,6,'i_mAWKyfj6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23403,_binary '\0','/fCtikvfjbyIINQyP1JF6qv9jCDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10667026',6.7,1865,'en','The Christmas Club','Two busy strangers meet when they help an elderly woman find her lost Christmas savings. Thanks to fate and Christmas magic, they also find something they were both missing: true love.','/sXOTaZi8uo6DLJ4G0qiL8lYgV6K.jpg','2019-11-27',84,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Club',628332,1.3597,6.3,'4Un9mZaFW9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23404,_binary '\0','/bkENfmxUY3UYsRLizJAhF5IQPvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10669888',5.3,2682,'en','Blood for Dust','Reckless Ricky makes serious money dealing illegal weapons throughout the tri-state area and loves to flaunt it. Traveling salesman Cliff, covers the same territory Ricky runs guns through. Desperate to find some financial relief for his struggling family, Cliff agrees to partner with Ricky, to commit cross-state drug and gun deliveries for a mid-level American cartel boss John. When a simple exchange turns into a bloodbath after Ricky kills everyone in a territory grab, the pair find themselves in a pressure cooker situation where unlikely drug dealer Cliff must fight as hard as he can to stay alive.','/nvaCnkl8RilLhVAQXPFei0tqkqW.jpg','2024-04-19',98,'Released',NULL,'Blood for Dust',1025596,3.5779,5.915,'xczqIyLshww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23405,_binary '\0','/YnVakBWRGZymBvWh7cLJz2nMjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10670442',6.6,1592,'zh','夺冠','After 12 years, the Chinese women\'s volleyball team again reached the Olympic final. The ups and downs of the Chinese women\'s volleyball team for more than three decades have slowly spread away.','/uX2JYxu1riaaPD2sQID6SMPct6d.jpg','2020-09-25',135,'Released',NULL,'Leap',638032,1.9901,6.6,'2ejQWvtjbQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23406,_binary '\0','/RIQzND9YCz1oSJPdmcSmVtqPZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067086',6.8,1290,'ja','Sweet Rain: 死神の精度','Chiba appears seven days before a person dies an unexpected death. His job is to observe the person for seven days then decide either to ‘execute’ or ‘pass over’. Today, again, in the rain, he waits. His subject, her death due in seven days, is Kazue Fujiki. She works for a manufacturing company in the complaints department. Exhausted after her day, she emerges from her office. It’s time for the Reaper to go to work.','/rYxR64OzLf3Ak7EEwQtDAMG0g8x.jpg','2008-04-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Rain: Accuracy of Death',13128,1.3659,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23407,_binary '\0','/uocpNfrP0Vvnf2UxykXuIR1HNUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067106',6.8,142281,'en','A Christmas Carol','Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.','/xNwlAIdx1Ln28GRiQttUP9Gojy2.jpg','2009-11-04',96,'Released','It only takes one night to change your life.','A Christmas Carol',17979,13.814,6.911,'HqK7ETwEE94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23408,_binary '\0','/gjUz5E0xrNsTiI5Th3LCFO6uhh4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10671436',7.1,2204,'hi','Barot House','A series of inexplicable and gruesome killings tear the Barot family apart and destroy the close relationship between father and son. Who could be behind this mindless slaughter? When the truth is discovered, it throws the family into further turmoil. But is the truth really the truth or games of a troubled mind?','/abzKYvfeFYCLJvwc4ZUpdU3YQ7Q.jpg','2019-08-07',90,'Released',NULL,'Barot House',621385,1.4218,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23409,_binary '\0','/gKfmVuT9WIKZrpAlR8a8vIVEBGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10675136',5.1,8192,'en','Hell House LLC III: Lake of Fire','Set one year after the events of Hell House LLC II, the hotel is on the verge of being torn down when it is purchased by billionaire Russell Wynn as the new home for his popular interactive show, Insomnia. He invites journalist Venessa Sheppard and her crew to record everything happening inside the hotel leading up to the performance - but they soon encounter a more nefarious plot, one that threatens to unleash a veritable hell on earth.','/gchygJq6AnzGFg0uYRDKn7mqsyU.jpg','2019-09-19',86,'Released','The Abaddon Hotel will once again open its doors to the public and the evil lurking within shall finally be unleashed.','Hell House LLC III: Lake of Fire',614722,2.587,5.181,'J3142NyU1j8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23410,_binary '\0','/xC9s8cOWtojn5UAmrDvB7iaakrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10675392',6.8,1407,'ja','囀る鳥は羽ばたかない The clouds gather','In the hyper-masculine criminal underworld, a masochistic high-ranking yakuza and his newly-assigned bodyguard become increasingly drawn to each other.','/rFfA75af7x1IVZq25IWVqvDhgN8.jpg','2020-02-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Twittering Birds Never Fly: The Clouds Gather',650498,3.7377,6.6,'JbAjlysKdic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23411,_binary '\0','/bbJxCgZETPJFRXInSndtaSx42EJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10675724',5.3,8730,'fr','La Nuée','A single mother breeds locusts as high-protein foods but has trouble getting them to reproduce until she finds they have a taste for blood.','/A734mQnqdLfraDMJ2Ad1lyE8wwP.jpg','2021-04-09',101,'Released',NULL,'The Swarm',661930,2.016,5.8,'si5irFBLe5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23412,_binary '\0','/12xU204ABgr31iCTM57JT6wGFMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067583',6.9,124653,'en','Water for Elephants','In this captivating Depression-era melodrama, impetuous veterinary student Jacob Jankowski joins a celebrated circus as an animal caretaker but faces a wrenching dilemma when he\'s transfixed by angelic married performer Marlena.','/8T7Hvb9trKvCAmbSI8cEIU0Sl2T.jpg','2011-04-15',122,'Released','Life is the most spectacular show on earth.','Water for Elephants',55787,8.0974,6.9,'CFxM3M0mwHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23413,_binary '\0','/qIsfHC5LEZ8vVOFvZknK6qsfvWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10675966',5.5,2134,'te','నేను లెను','Eeshwar, an orphan who falls for Parvati\'s honesty in the first sight and convinces her to marry him after much effort. In time, a gang of goons hunt for him and take him away. Later, news comes out that Eeshwar killed three of them and one is missing. Cops find Eeshwar under mysterious circumstances and are shocked when he claims to be already dead.','/ApJuDvWrfiLEPZR3SRJO1jKBsPS.jpg','2019-07-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Nenu Lenu',623189,0.5306,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23414,_binary '\0','/qjhcTGnjxYJqwBGlDzZkYWmne6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10676012',6.3,40850,'en','To All the Boys: Always and Forever','Senior year of high school takes center stage as Lara Jean returns from a family trip to Korea and considers her college plans — with and without Peter.','/iepqdM52f4w75fNcvgRF5QoIAjm.jpg','2021-02-12',114,'Released','You never know where love will lead you.','To All the Boys: Always and Forever',614409,7.1749,7.5,'2jPdejek5QA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23415,_binary '\0','/feSiISwgEpVzR1v3zv2n2AU4ANJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10676048',5.4,170915,'en','The Marvels','When her duties send her to an anomalous wormhole linked to a Kree revolutionary, Carol\'s powers become entangled with that of Jersey City super-fan Kamala Khan, aka Ms. Marvel, and Carol\'s estranged niece, now S.A.B.E.R. astronaut Captain Monica Rambeau. Together, this unlikely trio must team up and learn to work in concert to save the universe.','/9GBhzXMFjgcZ3FdR9w3bUMMTps5.jpg','2023-11-08',105,'Released','Higher. Further. Faster. Together.','The Marvels',609681,23.5801,5.908,'iuk77TjvfmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23416,_binary '\0','/s94NjfKkcSczZ1FembwmQZwsuwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10676052',6.8,290806,'en','The Fantastic 4: First Steps','Against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel\'s First Family is forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, while defending Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer.','/nf5qaSEvyYSNeFH0YhSs5EsBLX9.jpg','2025-07-23',115,'Released','Welcome to the family.','The Fantastic 4: First Steps',617126,37.4531,6.944,'0uDUlDmGhUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23417,_binary '\0','/hQGol0FW93iZvadddPwQ8Bn8RQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067733',6.9,10799,'sv','Patrik 1,5','Göran and Sven have been cleared for adoption and they have a possibility to adopt a swedish orphan, Patrik 1,5. But when Patrik arrives he turns out to be someone else, not the little boy they were expecting. A comma had been misplaced, and in comes a 15-year-old homophobic with a criminal past.','/zFHcajKXeiPVOArumZOqjFYDx1T.jpg','2008-09-12',98,'Released','Little typo. Big problem.','Patrik, Age 1.5',15179,1.605,6.8,'4slgrOOK66A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23418,_binary '\0','/3misyCAXrCVLg2S6M42Pj0iTyPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067765',6.1,19308,'en','Adult World','Amy, a naive college graduate who believes she\'s destined to be a great poet, begrudgingly accepts a job at a sex shop while she pursues a mentorship with reclusive writer Rat Billings.','/gI3AmarNB7eJXG0Qe8DzWiYjBWv.jpg','2014-02-14',107,'Released','When life gets hard, rise to the occasion.','Adult World',143049,4.3738,6.014,'yrHVFpdOetY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23419,_binary '\0','/n5GRWcdHCL7cLgDPVjSPI77ChhS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067773',4.8,2996,'en','The Gauntlet','A group of misfits find themselves trapped in what they believe to be an underground incinerator, and come together in the hope of discovering a way out. But they quickly realize that to get out alive, they\'ll each be tested in ways that are specific to their past - ways that will leave their future changed forever.','/2WYWj47Ff8BAE11PUhQYX9I3gPI.jpg','2013-08-23',85,'Released','In Hell only your sins can save you.','The Gauntlet',224778,1.8359,4.7,'WICPRf4kUZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23420,_binary '\0','/aD7XtR408aKDiBo4wJcO0sksvBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067774',5.8,52885,'en','Monte Carlo','Three young women vacationing in Paris find themselves whisked away to Monte Carlo after one of the girls is mistaken for a British heiress.','/dcbqyycrWA56HXq5lm41HYuED8Y.jpg','2011-07-01',109,'Released','She\'s having the time of someone else\'s life.','Monte Carlo',59860,6.9019,6.8,'X0n3Q_VDQk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23421,_binary '\0','/uAzdAGerv6i1XVl4ACfpuoWtq21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1067920',7.6,3939,'ja','名探偵コナン 世紀末の魔術師','Kaitou Kid dares to challenge the police once more, setting his sights on the Russian Imperial Easter Egg. With the date, time, and place, the Osaka police force scrambles to stop him. But this time, Kid may have bitten off more than he can chew—Conan Edogawa, Heiji Hattori, and numerous others are also trying to get their hands on the jeweled egg.','/q2v6JmGMVQR0UhUirXuuzXUcAnN.jpg','1999-04-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: The Last Wizard of the Century',28808,4.5601,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23422,_binary '\0','/4JQI1VVokGlofEaH0DxLd6nltGD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10681070',7.6,1220,'en','Leap of Faith: William Friedkin on The Exorcist','A lyrical and spiritual cinematic essay on The Exorcist, the last film of Alexandre O. Philippe explores the uncharted depths of William Friedkin’s mind’s eye, the nuances of his filmmaking process, and the mysteries of faith and fate that have shaped his life and filmography.','/mrTFBhWs8A0XKM7kho2A4aZpPpk.jpg','2019-10-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Leap of Faith: William Friedkin on The Exorcist',618375,1.7679,7.4,'p5FXjdKxgrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23423,_binary '\0','/aOeshAxAhiDVIiHsXVFmF6bgclh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10682266',5.3,69519,'en','Hubie Halloween','Hubie Dubois, despite his devotion to his hometown of Salem, Massachusetts (and its legendary Halloween celebration), is a figure of mockery for kids and adults alike. But this year, something really is going bump in the night, and it’s up to Hubie to save Halloween.','/dbhC6qRydXyRmpUdcl9bL9rARya.jpg','2020-10-07',102,'Released','Fear. Less.','Hubie Halloween',617505,6.9685,5.879,'kY3SuNvqQPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23424,_binary '\0','/fW1GatD12zbltefRvKR6b4iouQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068242',5.9,56009,'en','Footloose','Ren MacCormack is transplanted from Boston to the small southern town of Bomont where loud music and dancing are prohibited. Not one to bow to the status quo, Ren challenges the ban, revitalizing the town and falling in love with the minister’s troubled daughter Ariel in the process.','/cDUW5RWmyHcTxu7eg9eMqhBQy2J.jpg','2011-10-06',113,'Released','There comes a time to cut loose','Footloose',68817,6.8535,6.575,'fVyU-Hvzpt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23425,_binary '\0','/xi9AzSV14o9Xx70IISFgvr6ppf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068284',5.9,2982,'en','Snowglobe','A young woman discovers a Christmas-themed dreamworld inside a magical snowglobe. Angela loves Christmas more than anything. However, her family does not share her love for the holiday at all. When she is about to breakdown because of her family, she receives a snowglobe in the mail. When she opens up the snowglobe, she is transported into the world inside, where Christmas is the heart and soul for everyone who lives there. She discovers she can return to her world by going down a small path in the small forest at the edge of the village, and can return whenever she winds up the snowglobe. After a long set of visits to the globe, she accidentally gets trapped inside.','/llVnL8pX7Z55WL75SyodKAwOqFB.jpg','2007-12-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Snowglobe',68591,2.0932,6,'qaFweYEmWzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23426,_binary '\0','/7BSSLv4MvBjEmercZIolaOUR42q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068641',6.7,22376,'en','The Burning Plain','A trailer is burning in the middle of a plain. The bodies of two adulterous lovers are found. Scenes from both families, before and after the dramatic events, suggest an unusual connection between them. But what is their secret?','/lZlChM3LmOLUCQCfnbaf2dQKe9J.jpg','2008-11-07',111,'Released','Their passion has marked them for life.','The Burning Plain',12165,4.4315,6.6,'_dimnFPHCUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23427,_binary '\0','/vGtICaExlrMmQwMPlzt6HLiRKV1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068646',7.5,37640,'fr','Entre les murs','Teacher and novelist François Bégaudeau plays a version of himself as he negotiates a year with his racially mixed students from a tough Parisian neighborhood.','/8yFgK1YgfrnbsRXTg4Hko98nIUt.jpg','2008-09-24',128,'Released','The greatest lessons are learnt when life enters the classroom.','The Class',8841,3.4536,6.989,'lq5qNzm3w-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23428,_binary '\0','/y9Vcx8he3TErcPKSY56PX5tRMTl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068649',7.6,21134,'fr','Il y a longtemps que je t\'aime','A woman struggles to interact with her family and find her place in society after spending fifteen years in prison.','/14i0SnmWzgejS4ZRcBbzkvXD6dp.jpg','2008-03-19',115,'Released',NULL,'I\'ve Loved You So Long',8276,3.4497,7.3,'TAK6ZmDVlNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23429,_binary '\0','/nXshlVcrJ6x0UHBhw58Oc0k3fZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068664',6.2,1494,'fa','روز سوم','During the Iran-Iraq War, a disabled young woman is taken captive by Iraqi Baathist forces in Khuzestan Province. Her brother, along with his fellow combatants, tries to free his sister from the clutches of the enemy.','/khPM3xtwQdR5BrStmIrUQSEfqP6.jpg','2007-06-13',115,'Released',NULL,'The Third Day',428568,0.5496,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23430,_binary '\0','/1VMIGDUtAisGor1nHKjTLWk4yDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068669',6.5,2055,'en','Telstar: The Joe Meek Story','Set against a backdrop of early \'60s London, Telstar is the story of the world\'s first independent record producer, Joe Meek. A maverick genius who enjoyed phenomenal success with Telstar – the biggest selling record of it\'s time – before bad luck, depression, heartbreak and paranoia led to his downfall.','/ykswGEkVWYDMVFMuG1lANyPG54s.jpg','2008-06-19',119,'Released','Hit after hit... Someone\'s bound to get hurt.','Telstar: The Joe Meek Story',26796,2.1495,5.5,'LmPXX6JEdVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23431,_binary '\0','/bh1YOzQ5HiJZ0yZFQIdYhFhznBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068678',6.3,13629,'en','Veronika Decides to Die','After a frantic suicide attempt, Veronika awakens inside a mysterious mental asylum. Under the supervision of an unorthodox psychiatrist who specializes in controversial treatment, Veronika learns that she has only weeks to live.','/oUo9CNSKz4ELnxAh4l3BPcXcxKq.jpg','2009-05-16',103,'Released','For Veronika, confronting death... is discovering life.','Veronika Decides to Die',25968,3.7612,5.8,'gfkPD-yvZko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23432,_binary '\0','/l9kUuYVqiZV1r6d4nKUKcQvtLR3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068680',6.8,408800,'en','Yes Man','Carl Allen, a guy whose life is going nowhere, signs up for a self-help program based on one simple covenant: say yes to everything…and anything.','/8Vk2nQF1kY34x53YnWd5zDaTht.jpg','2008-12-09',104,'Released','One word can change everything.','Yes Man',10201,13.7396,6.694,'M3ar1tBj_Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23433,_binary '\0','/u6vFOUjFoPOLDH1f2fG2WQqyHch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10687070',8.3,10053,'ta','மண்டேலா','An underprivileged hairdresser becomes the game changer in a local body election in a village where caste politics rules the roost. Will he be able to bring some changes to people\'s lives?','/t9A7nv8ac8VrXDt6tgu4UXi2zAq.jpg','2021-04-05',140,'Released',NULL,'Mandela',806067,0.9366,7.186,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23434,_binary '\0','/yeXCUUSaAZFH4Zyd4Spgq4nl1xr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10687116',7.4,21534,'en','Entergalactic','Ambitious artist Jabari attempts to balance success and love when he moves into his dream Manhattan apartment and falls for his next-door neighbor.','/oMU3JpuKuasjAWIbUQgCaT6pco1.jpg','2022-09-28',93,'Released','Love will find us all.','Entergalactic',1027014,3.1601,7.7,'2C2lyCIusKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23435,_binary '\0','/5taScILscWm17F3ndboj3FnMCZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10687158',7.6,2078,'en','Western Stars','The incomparable Bruce Springsteen performs his critically acclaimed latest album and muses on life, rock, and the American dream, in this intimate and personal concert film co-directed by Thom Zimny and Springsteen himself.','/aT5lsPynkYhDgFZH48jdNLobnZY.jpg','2019-10-25',83,'Released',NULL,'Western Stars',617773,2.3882,7,'nGqjav-KbDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23436,_binary '\0','/r8QNPw7zJMDGJzJieYxIWvv8rIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10687220',2.8,1806,'hi','निकम्मा','A lazy slacker struggles to get along with his diligent sister-in-law - until they must step up and fight together against a common enemy.','/5t3gD5epzIuRH5L86nOF95yDUZY.jpg','2022-06-17',147,'Released',NULL,'Nikamma',693841,1.5593,3.778,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23437,_binary '\0','/vwtvQochfV2XZgQsxLueUSvdmPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10687506',6.8,24152,'en','The Electrical Life of Louis Wain','The extraordinary true story of eccentric British artist Louis Wain, whose playful, sometimes even psychedelic pictures helped to transform the public\'s perception of cats forever.','/jmlul0Y8KBXPqJ0LUcTfsCoRcoI.jpg','2021-10-21',111,'Released',NULL,'The Electrical Life of Louis Wain',617762,7.0391,6.903,'XEnTW8jaXVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23438,_binary '\0','/wHJrerp9snJtRSYhDRmjZhtgwYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068773',7.5,3942,'ja','名探偵コナン 瞳の中の暗殺者','Police officers around Tokyo are being murdered by an unknown assailant. When Ran witnesses an attempt on the life of one of her friends in the police, she loses her memory. Now, Conan and Inspector Megure must find the murderer while Ran attempts to regain her lost memories.','/o0ta1yBaKQRjEWLhOU8jmE9TdGa.jpg','2000-04-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Captured in Her Eyes',20677,7.6794,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23439,_binary '\0','/gF7CwZm2UK510z9H8j2NkO1rKz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068953',4.9,4481,'en','House of Good and Evil','After a family tragedy in the chaotic city, Chris and Maggie Conley, in a last-ditch effort to save their dying marriage, purchase an isolated home in the deepest woods, to which they quickly discover evil has a key.','/qzZKXW6cfKfozYE8qUy1DruD1T4.jpg','2013-04-26',108,'Released','Some things are better kept apart.','House of Good and Evil',239019,1.46,4.7,'K70WzFXy7XI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23440,_binary '\0','/8lpFXicKpHquzTZLFJ51LPPeEf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068956',8.3,9787,'ur','خدا کے لیے','The film is about the difficult situation in which the Pakistanis in particular and the Muslims in general are caught up since 9/11. There is a war going on between the Fundamentalists and the Liberal Muslims. This situation is creating a drift not only between the Western world and the Muslims, but also within the Muslims. The educated and modern Muslims are in a difficult situation because of their approach towards life and their western attire. They are criticized and harassed by the fundamentalists and on the other hand the Western world sees them as potential suspects of terrorism just because of their Muslim names.','/4QaOrupHDRLgWRJEndFKERx9I5y.jpg','2007-07-29',168,'Released',NULL,'Khuda Kay Liye',23717,2.448,6.6,'EX65wpFll9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23441,_binary '\0','/2ABWCoX2kF6jdinOBADC30XtA7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1068961',5.8,1987,'en','Midnight Son','MIDNIGHT SON is the story of Jacob, a young man confined to a life of isolation, due to a rare skin disorder that prevents him from being exposed to sunlight. His world opens up when he meets Mary, a local bartender, and falls in love. Tragically, Jacob’s actions become increasingly bizarre as he struggles to cope with the effects of his worsening condition. Forced by the disease to drink human blood for sustenance, he must control his increasingly violent tendencies as local law enforcement narrow their focus on him as a suspect in a series of grisly murders.','/xwVaMTmE0qzKRQMzvvwZY1vBEBm.jpg','2011-03-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Midnight Son',48837,1.4275,5.6,'LS2nLbEoMy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23442,_binary '\0','/twWLgj5hHFUI9PWE5vpet0OIxjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10691162',5.3,20032,'en','Aftermath','Desperate to save their marriage, a young couple takes a deal to move into their dream home, but disturbing events reveal the house\'s troubled history.','/fzEb71u0HOucjdjcVoOqfCqOM0T.jpg','2021-08-04',114,'Released','Lock the doors. Set the alarm. Trust no one.','Aftermath',763149,3.7111,6.2,'nzLT0SGN9ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23443,_binary '\0','/AoWW2J4PoDe0IPuCVQOk50QFS4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1069238',8,57874,'ja','おくりびと','Daigo, a cellist, is laid off from his orchestra and moves with his wife back to his small hometown where the living is cheaper. Thinking he’s applying for a job at a travel agency he finds he’s being interviewed for work with departures of a more permanent nature – as an undertaker’s assistant.','/2RkoGK7RcDoWdXm2pCJ1B9dXcTg.jpg','2008-09-13',130,'Released','The gift of last memories.','Departures',16804,7.3519,7.849,'RXTP_wRSHQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23444,_binary '\0','/xgxdY4puoffYlCrfSumQt9xULFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10692788',7.3,5078,'en','After Love','Set in the port town of Dover in the South-East of England, Mary Hussain suddenly finds herself a widow following the unexpected death of her husband. A day after the burial, she discovers he has a secret just twenty-one miles across the English Channel in Calais.','/mXaNg69iWEs0Qsj4AJxcvCXuWKw.jpg','2021-06-04',89,'Released',NULL,'After Love',714011,2.4467,7.065,'wUVHzMgbW4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23445,_binary '\0','/z6biP69riQFX1n18rrIOWQUQmbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10692888',6.7,3310,'ta','பொன்மகள் வந்தாள்','A resident in Ooty named ‘Petition’ Pethuraj reopens a case from 2004 that involved a serial killer ‘Psycho Jyoti’ who was convicted for the kidnapping and murder. Venba, his daughter and a passionate lawyer, seeks to unveil the truth.','/61Tv9lyhcvgmOIJ1vD4PI1tabI3.jpg','2020-05-29',120,'Released','Delay in Justice is Injustice','Ponmagal Vandhal',615911,1.2082,6.274,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23446,_binary '\0','/sj0m6XN5Vy7Ezkxr5jnr0DCfy2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10695464',4.4,1473,'en','The Source of Shadows','This horror anthology film depicts ten tales of horror from twelve visionary directors as they take us on a journey to experience one of humanity’s most carnal fears; the fear of the unknown.','/kzYtpIlEAMFLsRGNjZ3NYJVTqmJ.jpg','2020-04-28',83,'Released',NULL,'The Source of Shadows',697953,1.6402,5.5,'9-tnVLm9rrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23447,_binary '\0','/kZM1X9ftMqt4vFtZUWIdsLHlXcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10696586',5.3,1710,'ar','البعض لا يذهب للمأذون مرتين','When a technical error annuls the union of all married couples in Egypt, a journalist sets out to investigate rising marital issues— including his own.','/8MfzGJ2Qrfskcwfdk4BXNuXWMAu.jpg','2021-07-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Marry Me Again?',793332,1.0912,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23448,_binary '\0','/d0mpUFKzoPwF1KsdjHpkkaYSvKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10696784',6.6,78625,'en','The Harder They Fall','Gunning for revenge, outlaw Nat Love saddles up with his gang to take down enemy Rufus Buck, a ruthless crime boss who just got sprung from prison.','/su9WzL7lwUZPhjH6eZByAYFx2US.jpg','2021-10-22',137,'Released','A new day is dawning.','The Harder They Fall',618162,12.571,6.614,'Poc55U2RPMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23449,_binary '\0','/gOvc4gCWE2OPHegH3zrktZTAnBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10696882',4.8,1514,'ar','خيال مآتة','The story revolves around a grandfather who stole a rare masterpiece belonging to the late singer (Umm Kulthum) in his youth, but after years passes, he finds himself chased by those who want to have this piece, which makes him resort to the help of his only grandson.','/5U6mMQ438DvdXNaKXwjZJOEHEta.jpg','2019-08-22',126,'Released',NULL,'Scarecrow',621333,1.2825,4.6,'A9hN0X9xvdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23450,_binary '\0','/70xJCPOvP16XnrtO9WSkCek12sv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10696896',6.6,65066,'en','Stillwater','Bill Baker, an American oil-rig roughneck from Oklahoma, travels to Marseille to visit his estranged daughter, Allison, who is in prison for a murder she claims she did not commit. Confronted with language barriers, cultural differences, and a complicated legal system, Bill builds a new life for himself in France as he makes it his personal mission to exonerate his daughter.','/1lrPR7ah1KElPKnCsxmIRE1OlIh.jpg','2021-07-29',139,'Released','Secrets run deep.','Stillwater',616651,6.7648,6.631,'9cq1lPPeMUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23451,_binary '\0','/gU4MTmcZeNoFy0jlKwADO3NKAe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10698174',5.1,13175,'en','Wolf','Jacob, a man who believes he is a wolf trapped in a human body, is sent to a clinic by his family where he is forced to undergo increasingly extreme forms of \"curative\" therapies at the hands of The Zookeeper. Jacob’s only solace is the enigmatic Wildcat, with whom he roams the hospital in the dead of night. The two form an improbable friendship that develops into infatuation.','/39SHAfnH7xoP2SH7BQoUXMeXjUQ.jpg','2021-12-03',100,'Released','Once upon a time, there was a wolf and a wildcat...','Wolf',673121,2.9611,5.3,'oG1xjm0GZgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23452,_binary '\0','/nsV5Mfi9FAV4w8eDsdr7uqVswOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10698680',8.2,172865,'kn','ಕೆ.ಜಿ.ಎಫ್: Chapter 2','The blood-soaked land of Kolar Gold Fields (KGF) has a new overlord now - Rocky, whose name strikes fear in the heart of his foes. His allies look up to Rocky as their Savior, the government sees him as a threat to law and order; enemies are clamoring for revenge and conspiring for his downfall. Bloodier battles and darker days await as Rocky continues on his quest for unchallenged supremacy.','/khNVygolU0TxLIDWff5tQlAhZ23.jpg','2022-04-14',168,'Released','The World Is My Territory','K.G.F: Chapter 2',587412,4.6197,7.443,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23453,_binary '\0','/cg7mbrc4HauDdanEW04GlmYf3pe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10699086',5,37447,'hi','बच्चन पांडे','A budding director tries to research a merciless gangster for making a film on gangsterism. But her secret attempts to conduct the research fail when she gets caught for snooping.','/nuUtbT376pIhgTxJuEVGFx9sBvz.jpg','2022-03-18',147,'Released',NULL,'Bachchhan Paandey',715765,1.6865,5.541,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23454,_binary '\0','/dotJA0nM30QwsT2jzupfoItHvk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10699348',5.7,1784,'nl','Rundfunk: Jachterwachter','The harried manager of a rundown RV park gets pulled into chaos after a troubled former child star arrives with problems in tow.','/gjgSXIqnPa32b5opAKK82Q049Pa.jpg','2020-06-08',89,'Released','What an incredibly sh*tty campsite.','Rundfunk: Jachterwachter',619019,1.0748,5.7,'dR8jUzLI5_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23455,_binary '\0','/zfrgXBeGi8AQUcQq56r2OYrMZ6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10699362',6.8,4952,'af','Moffie','A young man in 1981 South Africa must complete his brutal and racist two years of compulsory military service while desperately maintaining the secrecy of his homosexuality.','/5MmpFYN4DnQLK7J7cVe3tACnQcO.jpg','2020-03-13',104,'Released',NULL,'Moffie',618228,1.8758,6.649,'D9sVz2FSnr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23456,_binary '\0','/nrVpYaBw0kqm2ySiwbxo33LnRkr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10701074',7.5,38834,'ta','பொன்னியின் செல்வன்: பாகம் 1','The Chola kingdom is under threat from forces both internal and external, and with crown prince Aaditha Karikalan, his younger brother Arunmozhi Varman and the emperor, Sundara Cholar separated by situations, it is up to a messenger to ensure the safety of the kingdom. Can he succeed in his mission, especially with Karikalan\'s former girlfriend, Nandhini, plotting to bring down the entire Chola empire?','/zSNyZUeqDdii0doQ9970E90kCkb.jpg','2022-09-30',167,'Released','The Cholas Are Coming','Ponniyin Selvan: Part I',660046,2.8903,7.138,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23457,_binary '\0','/1WDITmJAHz4rAnjVv1XYN4IfjKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10701458',4.3,1978,'en','Castle Freak','After she’s permanently blinded in a tragic car accident, Rebecca receives some bizarre news: her long-lost mother has recently passed away, leaving her their family’s ancestral castle in rural Albania. Traveling to the estate with a group of friends, Rebecca hopes it will be an opportunity for her to reconnect with a past she never knew and a mother who seemingly left her behind. When mysterious events begin to occur and her friends begin to die, Rebecca must unravel the secrets of her family’s history before she too falls prey to the Castle Freak.','/HJEosQRIdBzAHEdZJCUF7e5FmF.jpg','2020-12-04',106,'Released','Night has fallen','Castle Freak',593655,2.6206,4.3,'mUc2Kr8P4kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23458,_binary '\0','/zvZm9q9r2D3VTXihKhnkqvm8llA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10702148',6.8,5976,'en','The Killing of Two Lovers','In a rural Utah town, David, a father of four, grapples with his separation from wife Nikki as she pursues a new relationship.','/1Y3EmEl00UjmFvu2jP67JK0At2S.jpg','2021-02-23',84,'Released',NULL,'The Killing of Two Lovers',653712,2.7024,6.4,'DEid4LWdLS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23459,_binary '\0','/h3StNE0j4jc1qFt88t7IR2w4wVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10702760',8.3,3923,'en','National Theatre Live: Fleabag','Fleabag may seem oversexed, emotionally unfiltered and self-obsessed, but that\'s just the tip of the iceberg. With family and friendships under strain and a guinea pig café struggling to keep afloat, Fleabag suddenly finds herself with nothing to lose.','/ym3Jo2mo2dK9Z27ryMr5mmkDljx.jpg','2019-09-12',81,'Released',NULL,'National Theatre Live: Fleabag',620350,2.0996,7.8,'Q847tRfANXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23460,_binary '\0','/sG52QrADMKzh7O8wLru0jEXDPc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10703826',7.2,1804,'ru','Гражданин Х','The strange case of Mikhail Khodorkovsky — once believed to be the wealthiest man in Russia — who rocketed to prosperity and prominence in the 1990s, served a decade in prison, and became an unlikely martyr for the anti-Putin movement.','/3ioP2NNbMcxaz0tocCaEigewGN9.jpg','2019-12-13',126,'Released','Oligarch. Prisoner. Dissident.','Citizen K',618360,1.6243,6.8,'cMUMNyJQHMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23461,_binary '\0','/trZxnOhW1DUwrlbwpUFLRu9LrYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10703978',4.7,2343,'en','The Free Fall','Sara wakes from a coma to a life she doesn\'t remember; a fragile, slippery reality that spirals into a nightmare where nothing is as it seems.','/exjf5UDJTrOHALugoBAxFUfEPwe.jpg','2022-01-14',82,'Released','It lives within.','The Free Fall',860135,2.2594,5.2,'V6-l_ogeV-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23462,_binary '\0','/m2SJTezG29RWgS8BjFiFZCYkwOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10706602',8.1,14355,'ro','Colectiv','In the aftermath of a tragic fire in a Romanian club, burn victims begin dying in hospitals from wounds that were not life threatening. A team of investigative journalists move into action uncovering the mass corruption of the health system and of the state institutions. Collective follows journalists, whistle blowers, and authorities alike. An immersive and uncompromising look into a dysfunctional system, exposing corruption, propaganda, and manipulation that nowadays affect not only Romania, but societies around the world.','/oR93n0CAn2GznyHDFSRTp0J1t8c.jpg','2019-02-13',109,'Released','When government fails, we all pay the price.','Collective',618363,2.5541,7.5,'KLgGoT7v3ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23463,_binary '\0','/eTzhRPD1wgAGBFiY3tDPIYr0ZO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1070858',7,1791,'en','The Secrets of Jonathan Sperry','The lives of twelve year old buddies Dustin, Albert, and Mark, sharing a carefree existence in the summer of 1970, suddenly changes when Dustin makes an unexpected friend after cutting the lawn of 75 year old Jonathan Sperry. As the old man shares lessons in faith with the preteen trio, a spiritual transformation occurs.','/ApDGWWKLULc8gZuZlEnK9CZgYU1.jpg','2008-04-27',96,'Released','What he teaches you...will last forever.','The Secrets of Jonathan Sperry',39401,1.5564,6.9,'0M6bdIt-O2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23464,_binary '\0','/v8Nf6Y1qL1Q3PWTBezXNPPaXqza.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1070874',7.7,207223,'en','The Trial of the Chicago 7','What was supposed to be a peaceful protest turned into a violent clash with the police. What followed was one of the most notorious trials in history.','/ahf5cVdooMAlDRiJOZQNuLqa1Is.jpg','2020-09-25',130,'Released','In 1968, democracy refused to back down.','The Trial of the Chicago 7',556984,8.1921,7.7,'FVb6EdKDBfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23465,_binary '\0','/2TqjUeaEBXAbccnIqFd6L4UU9gT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1070887',6.5,2022,'en','The War Boys','Home from his freshman year of college, David is reunited with his childhood buddies Greg and George - the War Boys are together again. They used to sit in their pick up truck on the US-Mexican border waiting to chase illegal immigrants across the wasteland– just for fun. Now the boys hijack a semi hoping to sell what they think are black market televisions and make a quick buck.','/i57UvoI66TU8kWCrxViusgfLoIO.jpg','2009-05-30',93,'Released','The heart knows no borders.','The War Boys',39958,1.7942,5.9,'WiOgAm7xuUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23466,_binary '\0','/eQM0i0f2ZOCMIcedqzJ9SfO09Uf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709048',7.1,1478,'en','Mystery 101: Words Can Kill','When a guest at the college book festival is killed, Amy and Travis clash after he arrests an unlikely person for murder. Amy must fight to prove he\'s got the wrong person behind bars.','/vp1AgRE4nRwO6ceooNuglOQQQNL.jpg','2019-09-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Mystery 101: Words Can Kill',620744,1.7435,7.9,'Q_Dfo4P4tfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23467,_binary '\0','/gAdbQaRqU8u2yNJOdvudPSGD9na.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709058',7.2,1473,'en','Mystery 101: Dead Talk','Amy heads to Seattle to give a TEDTalk-style lecture. When a tech genius dies, Amy suspects foul play. When local cops shut her out, Travis joins forces with Amy to figure out whodunit.','/5qyj1YwuMhZRey0dgRLQV9arNgf.jpg','2019-09-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Mystery 101: Dead Talk',620743,2.6708,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23468,_binary '\0','/2BkN7HxQI4UoWC3f0r0t24NwDTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709114',8.5,2855,'en','Immediate Family','If you listen to 1970s pop music, you’ve undoubtedly heard these guys play, but do you know their names? This documentary highlights five talented men—Danny, Leland, Rus, Waddy, and Steve— who shunned the spotlight for themselves yet enjoyed decades of success as session musicians on iconic tracks. Interviewees include their collaborators James Taylor, Don Henley, Lyle Lovett, Jackson Browne, Phil Collins, Carole King, Stevie Nicks, Keith Richards, Steve Jordan, and dozens more who take us behind the scenes on the songs that shaped an era.','/ajTMBYqfQtuNgipWsDlkkukmCbY.jpg','2022-09-30',102,'Released',NULL,'Immediate Family',1018061,1.3053,7.4,'mr4OB8r56Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23469,_binary '\0','/6nI7VfewE0afDs2QczEfc24m6NH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709232',6.3,2983,'ta','ஹீரோ','A fraudster gets to fulfill his childhood dream of being a superhero when he takes on a ruthless businessman whose business strategy is to crush the dreams of children.','/5353SqWG4xlTVs1YLk1OzmGMdOg.jpg','2019-12-18',159,'Released',NULL,'Hero',617385,2.1159,6.219,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23470,_binary '\0','/a9Voe1NZtWL2dNE4rLW8q1TzaJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709404',6,2108,'ta','நம்ம வீட்டு பிள்ளை','Arumpon wants his sister to get married into a good family, but is forced to accept her marriage to a local goon, with whom he is at loggerheads. Will the brother-sister relationship survive?','/4v4lArw7kpFBmipcJYghFpP1WHx.jpg','2019-09-27',153,'Released',NULL,'Namma Veettu Pillai',310421,1.2814,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23471,_binary '\0','/7jvFJEsWyLxvnKawNy9GXImhu4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10709484',6.8,13078,'ta','டான்','A youngster who is still figuring out what his passion is gets into an engineering college where he clashes with a disciplinarian faculty.','/fbh3maleH24FiSGlTKvoVVe0txC.jpg','2022-05-12',164,'Released','Students Assemble','Don',895033,2.2502,6.039,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23472,_binary '\0','/j1GpsgRW8133dc2nLjVMb1JpC1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10710246',8,6286,'el','Ευτυχία','A young girl, recently married, is traveling from Aidini to Greece with her mother and her two daughters. On board the ship she decides not to let life pass her by, but to live her own way. And she goes ahead! She writes endlessly wherever she can, on napkins and cigarette boxes, to bills. She smokes, she passionately falls in love, casually gambles in luxurious salons, but also in illegal basements. A teacher who becomes an actress and plays in streets and in theaters, a poet who becomes the greatest Greek folk songwriter. She collaborates with all the famous music personalities of the country, from Vassilis Tsitsanis and Apostolos Kaldaras to Manolis Ηiotis, Antonis Repanis and Manos Hadjidakis, bravely asserting herself to a cruel and typically male-dominated world.','/oXK69ImFmvBUpop1UVn7KCuHW2a.jpg','2019-12-19',123,'Released','I lived the life I wanted','My Name Is Eftihia',654387,0.8484,8.2,'986_9-ki12w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23473,_binary '\0','/qCwJYb225SnXUt2bdPcC8QwD9Yz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10711648',7,5154,'ta','கோமாளி','A youngster in his mid-30s goes through a series of struggles after coming to terms with the fact that he was in coma for 16 years.','/a6ruupinOM7HwjcR3Uafx9YfwM8.jpg','2019-08-14',142,'Released',NULL,'Comali',591102,1.2626,6.059,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23474,_binary '\0','/tHWcDKYyO5hNWm5lMaImUL9fMxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071228',7,1255,'et','Mina olin siin','Living alone in an Estonian slum and unable to afford basic needs, a top high school student reluctantly enters the drug game to make ends meet.','/vS6AmLBM1sLj2tFnX0tN9JTfGnj.jpg','2008-09-12',95,'Released','Nobody was born to be a drug dealer.','I Was Here',46927,1.0302,5.6,'JOK7xPVjOMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23475,_binary '\0','/ziFEa9ZrKKV015QjLDod6WVYADL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10712928',5.7,1776,'en','Stars Fell on Alabama','Successful Hollywood agent Bryce Dixon is returning to Alabama for the first time in 15 years for his high school reunion. When he learns he\'s the only one of his friends who isn\'t married with children, he convinces his client, starlet Madison Belle, to pretend to be his girlfriend. But he soon learns that success has different meanings, and romance may be closer than he thinks.','/aGMa5XCyUFFWaIlKZoQvW6gCwGp.jpg','2021-01-06',103,'Released',NULL,'Stars Fell on Alabama',767979,2.1428,6,'Il8j8WpnsG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23476,_binary '\0','/1a8iiHGZ43kKAsVLQAl9lvBi9Hg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10713340',5.3,3385,'en','Held','A couple\'s ailing marriage is put to the test when they are held hostage in an isolated vacation rental by an unseen Voice that commands their every move and threatens harm if they don’t obey.','/c8NqVX14i0d9gmKsZFcTRa8xuac.jpg','2020-10-21',94,'Released','To survive, they must obey.','Held',744750,1.4923,5.5,'_pZ7AhmPRbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23477,_binary '\0','/bR0GpnGUCN7uxRmXtnJr9s19Jrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071358',5.8,33197,'en','Another Cinderella Story','A guy who danced with what could be the girl of his dreams at a costume ball only has one hint at her identity: the Zune she left behind as she rushed home in order to make her curfew. And with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity in front of him, he sets out to find his masked beauty.','/bW957WNXiiUvIGFaUVL7wMeD776.jpg','2008-09-16',92,'Released','Dancing ever after...','Another Cinderella Story',15157,7.6909,7.3,'AIeKQRj6lXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23478,_binary '\0','/fZBQOScjDT8TAipEyCkLVeDTu5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10714856',6.3,15605,'en','Feel the Beat','After failing to make it on Broadway, April returns to her hometown and reluctantly begins training a misfit group of young dancers for a competition.','/Af2jt7m9GLFpR4V11xOsFmT8OKD.jpg','2020-06-19',107,'Released','Take your chance. Make your move.','Feel the Beat',707886,4.7597,7.5,'PhLSDnxLp-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23479,_binary '\0','/ox4pq0LSUnRgoHpGPZQGMUGSv4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10715194',5.3,1522,'fr','La Grande Classe','Two adults go to their middle school reunion in order to show off their success to old bullies teenage crushes.','/jNdGAHxiuYB1vnvFBAWVc67SCAn.jpg','2019-08-30',83,'Released',NULL,'Back to School',624060,1.6909,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23480,_binary '\0','/8nxNn4FdWnMy04tWYVAXCcKyBKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10715446',4.8,5053,'pt','A Princesa da Yakuza','In Brazil, Akemi finds out that she\'s the heiress to the Yakuza empire. Just after that, her destiny enters a spiral of violence and mystery, where a gaijin (foreigner) who\'s been protecting her all this time, Shirô, may have been actually sent to kill her.','/7EVjgNKIKVa8LyhwgLHhoT1yKjQ.jpg','2021-08-26',112,'Released','Every sword has a story.','Yakuza Princess',661595,2.8998,6.1,'LHLE8tnduU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23481,_binary '\0','/nyv6bC3nkFwQHy9QI1btneSBTZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10717738',7.9,12771,'ml','അഞ്ചാം പാതിരാ','A psychologist with a keen interest in criminology gets entangled in a tough serial killer case which the police find hard to crack.','/38AT5UZ276dRO1dNzgvQSiYYQ7u.jpg','2020-01-10',144,'Released',NULL,'Anjaam Pathiraa',657593,2.8107,7.638,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23482,_binary '\0','/bDB9NAjkB1J7ab3lgydj75aLo7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071804',6.8,22989,'en','Ink','Invisible forces exert power over us in our sleep. A mercenary named Ink, on a literal nightmare mission, captures the spirit of 8-year-old Emma in the dream world. To save her, the dream-givers marshal all their resources, focusing on saving the soul of Emma\'s tragically broken father.','/9vYyX7c8gZtxuqd6SiRukRb4gRd.jpg','2009-01-23',106,'Released','dreams','Ink',24869,1.7145,6.3,'ZBGeErufQdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23483,_binary '\0','/tPgTNKrWSXajxYqpW8Yn8gBjkt2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071812',7.3,8581,'en','Mao’s Last Dancer','At the age of 11, Li was plucked from a poor Chinese village by Madame Mao\'s cultural delegates and taken to Beijing to study ballet. In 1979, during a cultural exchange to Texas, he falls in love with an American woman. Two years later, he managed to defect and went on to perform as a principal dancer for the Houston Ballet and as a principal artist with the Australian Ballet.','/mvHW6UTlrn60RhyYsoqxXxTPIFn.jpg','2009-10-01',117,'Released','Before you can fly, you have to be free.','Mao’s Last Dancer',33870,2.9532,6.6,'BMaI83hdPJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23484,_binary '\0','/j2oX7UeZJJD6tUczrVECcJCdLaG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071815',6.3,5796,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO -ナルト- 大興奮!みかづき島のアニマル騒動だってばよ','Naruto Uzumaki, Kakashi Hatake, Sakura Haruno, and Rock Lee are assigned to protect the prince of the Land of the Moon, Michiru, during his world trip; other escorts had been hired, but quit due to being treated poorly. The Land of the Moon is a very wealthy nation, so Michiru tends to buy whatever he wants, and has a very materialistic worldview. His Hikaru, also acts in much the same manner.','/mmKiJ93x6uhTwJlrxCoY38R4qo6.jpg','2006-08-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Naruto the Movie: Guardians of the Crescent Moon Kingdom',18861,6.4113,7.071,'5aqLi1XhGdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23485,_binary '\0','/ebNcAJfWsSbbv7VhboAvpUdOduJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071875',4.4,136327,'en','Ghost Rider: Spirit of Vengeance','When the devil resurfaces with aims to take over the world in human form, Johnny Blaze reluctantly comes out of hiding to transform into the flame-spewing supernatural hero Ghost Rider -- and rescue a 10-year-old boy from an unsavory end.','/xEoBT6lYfQNpSpTm8gJMTrQytiw.jpg','2011-12-10',96,'Released','He rides again.','Ghost Rider: Spirit of Vengeance',71676,13.9469,5.023,'UUObgxCoUgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23486,_binary '\0','/zbuqfxZyOGk2VCjulPEFjKSGxX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1071880',5.9,2873,'en','The Crew','Hoping to raise enough capital to finance a legitimate business and leave behind his life of crime, Liverpool underworld boss Ged Brennan sends his brother Ratter and a crew to pull a daring final heist. But when Ratter kills a drug kingpin during the job, Brennan must turn to rival crook Franner to avert an all-out gangland war.','/eDSuRzCRM9a2N8L6nDC5KQFoHRA.jpg','2008-10-01',117,'Released',NULL,'The Crew',14575,2.8894,5.993,'gs9alpOXLKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23487,_binary '\0','/1eKFWBEGYfAvcMf4Lr8SvmOjaXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10719958',4.4,2201,'en','The Birthday Cake','On the 10th anniversary of his father\'s death, Giovanni reluctantly accepts the task of bringing a cake to the home of his uncle, a mob boss, for a celebration. Just two hours into the night, Gio\'s life is forever changed.','/kI3lTv3f24Fzl2kD0sYVCvCOZh2.jpg','2021-06-18',93,'Released','Revenge never tasted so sweet','The Birthday Cake',624481,3.3755,5.1,'tRV8E1OC5jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23488,_binary '\0','/jw4SNkaSgbrO7VJPsZUZqbBg1Ph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10720352',7,41635,'en','Arthur the King','Over the course of ten days and 435 miles, an unbreakable bond is forged between pro adventure racer Michael Light and a scrappy street dog companion dubbed Arthur. As the team is pushed to their outer limits of endurance in the race, Arthur redefines what victory, loyalty and friendship truly mean.','/zkKB3kOun5DKAkm61pHvLbrjxfa.jpg','2024-02-22',107,'Released','An unexpected encounter. An unlikely bond. An unforgettable adventure.','Arthur the King',618588,13.1396,7.5,'wjDJNEPghNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23489,_binary '\0','/qT6xwk6Dkn8Vr9sMhL5vpu7BVI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10720816',6.5,1299,'en','All Summer Long','Tia\'s dream job of captaining a dining cruise hits rough water when her ex Jake is hired as the restaurant\'s chef. Will they be able to open a new business, navigate the sea, and each other? Stars Autumn Reeser and Brennan Elliott.','/cGPJZdCU9QCBdH9ZeUBZh3hWQqF.jpg','2019-08-24',84,'Released',NULL,'All Summer Long',616808,1.6225,6.8,'oMn2u2eJ8OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23490,_binary '\0','/dt3PYimWfMvl7iSmH1uQCaHr7Qg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10723416',7.6,2096,'en','Look at Me: XXXTENTACION','Explore how Florida teenager Jahseh Onfroy became SoundCloud rapper XXXTENTACION, one of the most streamed artists on the planet. Through frank commentary from family, friends and romantic partners, and unseen archival footage, this documentary offers a sensitive portrayal of an artist whose acts of violence, raw musical talent and open struggles with mental health left an indelible mark on his generation before his death at the age of 20.','/3BUCbEMFdizaBrNbH6lEfDdNtku.jpg','2022-03-15',108,'Released','Fame is a monster.','Look at Me: XXXTENTACION',934042,2.127,6.5,'uJVgJFzgdJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23491,_binary '\0','/kBNkJs1Dz9b1hIjVWP7mdwiD8rz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1072438',5.4,2237,'en','Not Since You','A romantic drama about a tight-knit group of college friends who graduated from NYU the year of 9/11 and reunite years later for a weekend wedding in Georgia. Unresolved conflicts and love affairs spark again.','/4TuMMOJP1EnnkkxUSOjD35WcrUO.jpg','2009-10-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Not Since You',49674,1.6875,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23492,_binary '\0','/sJd4xoxnqLz9k8lTKnUbsucfTDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10726604',6.2,3134,'ko','나쁜 녀석들: 더 무비','A respectable village head decides to keep his son away from the violent politics of rural life. However, fate intervenes, forcing the young man to not only return home, but also take up the sickle.','/ksQ563iNQLdMUngNKheZNsOKBbD.jpg','2019-09-11',114,'Released','Sometimes Justice Requires Force.','The Bad Guys: Reign of Chaos',585831,3.6036,7.04,'4YwgHuSZhIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23493,_binary '\0','/q9p7v4KRuwDOzR6TRedXGMADBn0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1072748',5.5,39686,'en','Winchester','San Jose, California, 1906. Isolated in her labyrinthine mansion, eccentric firearm heiress Sarah Winchester believes that she is being haunted by the souls of those killed by the guns manufactured by her company.','/4D9Bby0pNtRUYeI5mNJ3F0mSmXG.jpg','2018-02-02',100,'Released','Terror is building.','Winchester',416234,5.882,5.885,'0Juc2cL26mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23494,_binary '\0','/uTX4CPryKPVzrI42unG1VrI002o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1072754',4.9,2307,'en','Messages Deleted','A quivering voice begs to screenwriter, Joel Brandt, to pick up the phone on a message from his answering machine. Thinking it a prank, Joel deletes the message. The caller is found dead. Another caller leaves Joel a message; there is another murder...then another...then another. The killer has Joel\'s attention, and Joel has the attention of the police. Now the prime suspect in a series of murders, Joel discovers this psychotic killer has targeted him for a reason found within his body of work. Will Joel be able to re-write his ending, or be forced to pay the ultimate price?','/5khvKgALf9czLPCEZU6hZWr68UT.jpg','2010-02-05',92,'Released',NULL,'Messages Deleted',79073,2.2513,5.3,'yQUwjSn98Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23495,_binary '\0','/avZiwvh0XEsA3poI49UPrcT4Qix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1072755',5.8,7234,'en','Minutemen','When three high-school friends invent a time-machine, they decide to use it to go back in time and prevent other youngsters from making humiliating mistakes.','/2y00QZiT3XUGwIxQxY5WLvvd1Y6.jpg','2008-02-29',90,'Released','It\'s a short trip from zero... to hero.','Minutemen',22371,3.4681,5.8,'BnE4sdrvZGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23496,_binary '\0','/cUPrCDQt23ZdJ6Mk8kO8cBcPcxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10728764',6.5,5340,'es','Nadie sabe que estoy aquí','Memo lives on a remote Chilean sheep farm, hiding a beautiful singing voice from the outside world. A recluse with a glittery flair, he can\'t stop dwelling on the past, but what will happen once someone finally listens?','/c7CTxNNPeg6MH9VA9BBvMKdPmSh.jpg','2020-04-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Knows I\'m Here',698432,2.1927,6.6,'0CZXhNcZuEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23497,_binary '\0','/3i9UdfrkyLfQTefDmaYbEvH9HjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073105',5.7,56804,'en','The Descent: Part 2','Distraught, confused, and half-wild with fear, Sarah Carter emerges alone from the Appalachian cave system where she encountered unspeakable terrors. Unable to plausibly explain to the authorities what happened - or why she\'s covered in her friends\' blood - Sarah is forced back to the subterranean depths to help locate her five missing companions.','/dOURlcw2MO0xys0Dl2NiAcUxlWA.jpg','2009-10-14',94,'Released','Fear runs deeper.','The Descent: Part 2',34480,8.6868,6,'-ET78z023aA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23498,_binary '\0','/yXBCykztvdEA9smAPiq10p53f9T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073122',8.1,4034,'bn','ঝিন্দের বন্দী','Gauri Shankar Roy looks much like the king of Jhind. When the actual king, Shakar Singh, goes missing, a person from the kingdom approaches Gauri to pretend to be the king.','/ifvrAhJDcrFvB4MLNanqLFW6qIZ.jpg','1961-03-01',103,'Released','Prisoner of Jhind','The Prisoner of Jhind',328105,0.5924,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23499,_binary '\0','/tfCNMP37jRX3TOetuce7FLkxNKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10731256',6.3,180855,'en','Don\'t Worry Darling','Alice and Jack are lucky to be living in the idealized community of Victory, the experimental company town housing the men who work for the top-secret Victory Project and their families. But when cracks in their idyllic life begin to appear, exposing flashes of something much more sinister lurking beneath the attractive façade, Alice can’t help questioning exactly what they’re doing in Victory, and why.','/wjAJWfuE5OQm5zerlOAbTxdHFMV.jpg','2022-09-21',123,'Released','Are you ready to live the life you deserve?','Don\'t Worry Darling',619730,12.3991,6.8,'FgmnKsED-jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23500,_binary '\0','/68HpzRudbHeWwYSuy52gxo15Czf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10731264',6,5633,'hi','सूरज पे मंगल भारी','In the 1990s, a wedding detective has to perform background checks on prospective grooms. In the time before social media and mobile phones, everything has to be done in person.','/mbwcuXBp554Ef6s9aFE1x5Wq1pV.jpg','2020-11-15',134,'Released',NULL,'Suraj Pe Mangal Bhari',738567,1.563,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23501,_binary '\0','/wwqqve2nxCehew4CM9KavQxCd4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10731386',7.1,2928,'en','Audrey','An unprecedented and intimate look at the life, work and enduring legacy of British actress Audrey Hepburn (1929-1993).','/ikAgImz1rkedYM2mW0TeGZP1xdi.jpg','2020-11-30',101,'Released',NULL,'Audrey',757388,2.7794,7.1,'DOY77nyd6fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23502,_binary '\0','/rNRjYQSorwbzPrlQrfwd1PCwclT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10731748',5.2,3358,'pt','Modo Avião','When Ana, an influencer, crashes her car while talking on the phone, she\'s shipped to her grumpy grandfather\'s farm -- and forced into a digital detox.','/fLXisj0j39zaktmoU72tVtOXx6W.jpg','2020-01-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Airplane Mode',652483,2.2595,6.2,'2Jn3s33ca44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23503,_binary '\0','/nprqOIEfiMMQx16lgKeLf3rmPrR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10731768',5.6,38672,'en','Sweet Girl','A man vows to bring justice to those responsible for his wife\'s death while protecting the only family he has left, his daughter.','/cP7odDzzFBD9ycxj2laTeFWGLjD.jpg','2021-08-18',110,'Released','Family fights as one.','Sweet Girl',619297,8.688,6.6,'NiFuJV2GLkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23504,_binary '\0','/c2eS21PMf9dZcIGETQ6o8WnaZQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073223',7.6,3754,'ja','名探偵コナン 天国へのカウントダウン','As a pair of towers in Tokyo are being prepared for their grand opening, there is a series of murders of people connected to the towers. Conan suspects that the mysterious Syndicate may also be involved.','/1giFCODG6Bnik84NsyjHwvuX9Da.jpg','2001-04-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Case Closed: Countdown to Heaven',32022,4.8468,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23505,_binary '\0','/k5SLaqFAEdDLlMv6KaNOj5eL0SA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073241',7.1,42008,'en','Nothing But the Truth','When reporter Rachel Armstrong writes a story that reveals the identity of a covert CIA operative, the government demands that Rachel reveal her source. She defies the special prosecutor and is thrown in jail. Meanwhile, her attorney, Albert Burnside argues her case all the way to the U.S. Supreme Court.','/ueJXKG3PFoDPEhcKtIjP52fCRQ5.jpg','2008-12-19',108,'Released','Don\'t Reveal the Source.','Nothing But the Truth',14637,4.6974,6.9,'rYa2rSTPYow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23506,_binary '\0','/tb2MBG5Ww4UbbqeflVspBb4lxa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10733228',5.6,45311,'hi','गहराइयाँ','Alisha Khanna, 30, ambitious, now finds herself at crossroads in life. Her six year long relationship has grown monotonous, her career seems to be going nowhere. But just when she had begun to accept this reality as unchangeable, her life is usurped by the arrival of her cousin, Tia and her fiancé, Zain, with whom she bonds over a troubled past and a common wish to break from its confines.','/AqqMoV3o83oiPZSUrBBeujKnk1n.jpg','2022-02-11',148,'Released',NULL,'Gehraiyaan',911645,1.7908,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23507,_binary '\0','/gLthCYKUEqB2urQiqOfiWVgOS2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10734864',4.4,3117,'en','Honeydew','Strange cravings and hallucinations befall a young couple after seeking shelter in the home of an aging farmer and her peculiar son.','/r3Dy8RTD8M5j9e1uaRMxZK235aB.jpg','2021-03-12',106,'Released','You must be starving','Honeydew',675575,1.2941,4.882,'hHR9xvOCgGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23508,_binary '\0','/niMCrXNVxEYXHSeQU0GPos0vdED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10734928',7.4,4718,'zh','罗小黑战记','When cat spirit Luo Xiaohei\'s home is deforested by humans, he must find a new one. He runs into a group of other spirit creatures who take him under their wing with dreams of reconquering the land they say is rightfully theirs. However, they run into a human known as Wuxian who separates Luo Xiaohei from the other spirits and the two go on a journey, with the cat spirit learning to control his abilities as well as forming his own thoughts on whether or not he should ally with the spirits or the humans.','/nWdES36hGwADWWBGzvgT1Z3Xn86.jpg','2019-08-27',102,'Released','One Small Spirit Will Determine the Fate of the World.','The Legend of Hei',620249,9.901,8.409,'NC9M8QYRZpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23509,_binary '\0','/8D3dBwSoPSGWRusbTYS8oR1tAu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073498',2.8,113716,'en','Meet the Spartans','The heroic Leonidas, armed with nothing but leather underwear and a cape, leads a ragtag group of thirteen Spartans to defend their homeland against the invading Persians (whose ranks include Ghost Rider, Rocky Balboa, the Transformers, and a hunchbacked Paris Hilton). No one is safe when the Spartans take on the biggest icons in pop culture!','/DWQOjAPvM8Kk1Qp3Xq0zae0Z6w.jpg','2008-01-24',84,'Released','The bigger the hit, the harder they fall.','Meet the Spartans',7278,8.7542,4.092,'RY-zJtYYolo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23510,_binary '\0','/9BrhCgffilZPr3VOnDAKP9vBrU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073510',8,19463,'en','Prayers for Bobby','Bobby Griffith was his mother\'s favorite son, the perfect all-American boy growing up under deeply religious influences in Walnut Creek, California. Bobby was also gay. Struggling with a conflict no one knew of, much less understood, Bobby finally came out to his family.','/1viFwXluAettogGDsTrSUUg29lZ.jpg','2009-01-24',89,'Released','She loves everything about her son...except who he is.','Prayers for Bobby',21634,4.7548,8.1,'QEAVfdZDb_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23511,_binary '\0','/A3QRfRpairXHEG2L4TDttKQL6iP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10735202',7.7,4068,'ml','ഹെലൻ','An ordinary suburban girl faces the biggest battle of her life when her sudden disappearance for a brief period leads to a desperate search by her loved ones.','/166Gz2EQFwvGEyWU1sDtxOiGVAE.jpg','2019-11-15',117,'Released','Sometimes even to live is an act of courage','Helen',640052,1.0768,7.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23512,_binary '\0','/gjCABBFPLkdgHPCbXWJ8dUqfF9G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1073535',6.4,1341,'fr','La Frontière de l\'aube','A celebrity is caught by her husband with a young lover.','/aP3wEVHW0RJ9BnQKSi4VECrMnKl.jpg','2009-03-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Frontier of Dawn',8897,1.5264,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23513,_binary '\0','/6BsSGsgVArJHb9qXAI2rEzCpdWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10735686',7,3299,'hu','Toxikoma','Biopoic of actor Győző Szabó\'s younger years struggling with his drug addiction.','/7WxLxRyNrowN9DxqGc3TCXsT5J.jpg','2021-09-02',124,'Released',NULL,'Toxikoma',738035,0.7799,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23514,_binary '\0','/svq4dJkZ2WUeqOctyQabuhjrjT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10735778',7.6,1242,'uk','Наші котики','In 2014 Russia’s hybrid war against Ukraine turns hot. An engineer, actor, soccer coach and florist volunteer to fight on the front line. Unaware of the pivotal role they will play in the war, they discover the meaning of true leadership.','/qnWsWoWnAVu44W1i8lSqcen6FE7.jpg','2020-01-30',113,'Released','Patriotic politically incorrect comedy','Lethal Kittens',664958,1.2926,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23515,_binary '\0','/6S5ZxRbTAfcECEi5EQg5cbOUibY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10736336',6.7,1766,'tr','Aşk, Büyü, vs.','In their youth, Eren and Reyhan, who grew up in Büyükada, had a great love. As soon as their families heard about this relationship, they separated them. Eren, the daughter of a wealthy family, returns to the island years later and finds Reyhan in an unexpected situation.','/1BwKqh7oe0ZGBuRHIi3AkOiVCHj.jpg','2021-07-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Love, Spells and All That',636553,1.0851,5.4,'Uy