1-11-19',93,'Released','While they feast, she waits.','The Feast',795615,1.6565,5.569,'7IGBcWQVsyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23520,_binary '\0','/80cXy6LF1SXcdonuMr21S1z5y70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10739666',3.3,16498,'hi','सत्यमेव जयते 2','Satya Azad, an upright Home Minister wants to cleanse the country of corruption with his Anti-Corruption Bill. However, it fails to get enough ‘Ayes’, not only from his allies, but also from his wife Vidya a member of the Opposition, who votes ‘Nay’ in the Vidhan Sabha. When a couple of gruesome killings take place in the city, ACP Jay Azad is brought in to nab the murderer, never mind his motive.','/y1ebOObyi97slwBTljIifE67PR5.jpg','2021-11-25',141,'Released',NULL,'Satyameva Jayate 2',695973,1.212,5.5,'v553ormStVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23521,_binary '\0','/zJEl8gjYkJrlMNetrMwtb2r8KJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10740926',6.5,3395,'en','Rob Peace','An underprivileged, gifted young black man from Newark reaches Yale University, only for shadows and injustices from his past to threaten his future.','/1BwKbTidW5QaEKb1pVY3p4u9cVg.jpg','2024-08-02',120,'Released','Your future\'s worth fighting for.','Rob Peace',1084514,3.1938,6.9,'bugi-UdtjzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23522,_binary '\0','/dUudp3ePfKxrWoNnYbCO73v1LHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10741542',6.8,12389,'hi','शेरनी','A jaded forest officer leads a team of trackers and locals intending to capture an unsettled tigress while battling intense obstacles and pressures, both natural and man-made.','/pSID1DRy6oOvC74oVzbc3rDuqF4.jpg','2021-06-18',130,'Released',NULL,'Sherni',830891,1.4889,6.279,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23523,_binary '\0','/3YUDie8xndNcH7n19wdpGV6MLIp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1074191',5.8,2796,'en','The Betrayed','Kidnappers force a young mother to recover money stolen by her shady husband.','/ypozb9oWIDZZIwDQZo0s7JgMa6K.jpg','2008-09-27',98,'Released','What she doesn\'t know could kill her.','The Betrayed',20055,2.7184,5.8,'lfc07JbUiTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23524,_binary '\0','/7s4LVZy7BwO0GYTbq2P9BbZlpFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1074213',6.1,5754,'it','Scusa ma ti chiamo amore','Alex Belli is a 37 year old advertising executive whose fiancée Elena has just left him, and who is having difficulty at work trying to think of a good advertising campaign for a new Japanese product. Niki is a bubbly 17 year old student. She has three best friends with whom she shares all her problems, and an annoying ex-boyfriend Fabio who is set on getting her back, but Niki\'s not interested. One day on his way to work, Alex collides with Niki on a city street. They soon begin a romance, despite their 20-year age gap.','/z395gVQdI8hKA9EVYOe7DYhTzhC.jpg','2008-01-25',105,'Released',NULL,'Sorry if I Love You',34494,2.5454,5.975,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23525,_binary '\0','/4JEIqhbea9O0wPCDw3sRu7V9TS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1074214',5.1,3684,'en','The Six Wives of Henry Lefay','A presumed-dead man\'s current wife and former wives squabble over his funeral arrangements.','/kYLjeWQUDuJzLFuqt0oxUS4HE87.jpg','2009-06-18',95,'Released','Can\'t live with them - can\'t live without them.','The Six Wives of Henry Lefay',29919,3.5155,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23526,_binary '\0','/gT9Hx6UtKAlBkhRaKYqUDAGSYfu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10743534',5.6,3047,'en','The Oak Room','During a raging snowstorm, a drifter returns home to the blue-collar bar located in the remote Canadian town where he was born. When he offers to settle an old debt with a grizzled bartender by telling him a story, the night\'s events quickly spin into a dark tale of mistaken identities, double-crosses and shocking violence.','/bVvNpT2D14K7nuweGzJpoUyfnKi.jpg','2020-11-27',89,'Released','You\'re not going to believe what happened at The Oak Room.','The Oak Room',717021,1.6899,5.8,'PDcB1L0-6cI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23527,_binary '\0','/r6JDDWmVQaLy4OZBnJgH3yi4s8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10746342',8.3,2086,'en','Our Planet: Behind the Scenes','Years spent recording footage of creatures from every corner of the globe is bound to produce a bit of drama. Here\'s a behind-the-scenes look.','/rLQWByPlwOyLfQAoDA1t9pQaEKV.jpg','2019-04-05',63,'Released',NULL,'Our Planet: Behind the Scenes',621561,1.6688,7.6,'qVJzQc9ELTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23528,_binary '\0','/wkA622CCN2X0uwpgqYEOnUYEDf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1074638',7.8,780505,'en','Skyfall','When Bond\'s latest assignment goes gravely wrong, agents around the world are exposed and MI6 headquarters is attacked. While M faces challenges to her authority and position from Gareth Mallory, the new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee, it\'s up to Bond, aided only by field agent Eve, to locate the mastermind behind the attack.','/d0IVecFQvsGdSbnMAHqiYsNYaJT.jpg','2012-10-24',143,'Released','Think on your sins.','Skyfall',37724,18.1333,7.267,'24mTIE4D9JM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23529,_binary '\0','/ioQ70Q1M0Rak90vZbQ4H70ch1id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1074929',6.3,3612,'en','Adoration','For his French-class assignment, a high school student weaves his family history in a news story involving terrorism, and goes on to invite an Internet audience in on the resulting controversy.','/dnbb6ffJ7ebWCR7IgJoJXSfzCbD.jpg','2009-04-15',100,'Released','Some stories are too dangerous to tell.','Adoration',8895,2.1833,5.8,'MRFJ59YMqsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23530,_binary '\0','/iFtW0rCJ3VIp0DI7F5o0vgJZV4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10749760',7.2,1439,'ar','بيك نعيش','Tunisia, summer 2011. The holiday to the South of the country ends in disaster for Fares, Meriem and their 10-year-old son Aziz, when he is accidentally shot in an ambush. His injury will change their lives: Aziz needs a liver transplant, which leads to discovery of a long-buried secret. Will Aziz and the relationship survive?','/eZStVC3LeOy4g5jI4a7xFBtFRU.jpg','2020-01-15',96,'Released',NULL,'A Son',618224,1.6499,7.111,'_K4qawhyasA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23531,_binary '\0','/zXVSr2AovV17IAJjBy25Juc2DmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10749786',6.9,3014,'uk','Атлантида','A soldier suffering from PTSD befriends a young volunteer hoping to restore peaceful energy to a war-torn society.','/8dtC60nTU9h8L71QtPYpkMuO0C.jpg','2020-09-17',106,'Released',NULL,'Atlantis',618245,1.0166,6.5,'ZyIe9_YgfDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23532,_binary '\0','/eFmJuICe4W2LVhE5HrdLG9TxErk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10749998',4.6,1555,'ar','الفلوس','Sief is a conman who is hired by the beautiful rich woman, Hala, to help her get her money back from another conman. Their relationship gets them entangled in a web of deceit as they start questioning their stances regarding love, friendship, and the meaning of life.','/q2XYRga26rupQaJAthmG4Ks85a3.jpg','2019-12-24',109,'Released',NULL,'The Money',621319,0.8996,5.3,'Dw_42T7rb8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23533,_binary '\0','/oOV0TOdcxKuctnxTkO3VhcJak8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10750020',6.5,4003,'ta','பட்டாஸ்','A petty thief learns about his father\'s illustrious legacy and decides to attack the man who murdered him in order to bring the ancient martial art form that his father had practiced to limelight.','/A7sFExysd0q4QkiB6kglSJdDd6h.jpg','2020-01-14',142,'Released',NULL,'Pattas',619188,1.5015,5.85,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23534,_binary '\0','/uC1DElMFoTyypRBcuTMXTuHcP80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1075110',7.3,12088,'nl','De helaasheid der dingen','13-year-old Gunther Strobbe grows up surrounded by alcohol, trash and his completely useless father and uncles. Slowly but surely, he\'s being prepared for the same hapless life. Can he defy his destiny?','/9RjVHr752QAaoQ1SHCx0JwnZwtY.jpg','2009-10-07',108,'Released',NULL,'The Misfortunates',33806,2.0695,7.2,'U-pkqjmzVPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23535,_binary '\0','/62V5KHpwLQPbzKd1NEIbfGQyACL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1075113',5.8,7988,'fr','Ne te retourne pas','Panic attacks and memory loss signal the plight of a writer whose body is inexplicably being taken over by another woman.','/pvbhKQMP4Vi2BLyA38MqUBRPZPM.jpg','2009-06-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Look Back',18897,4.2022,5.6,'vehEo8dc-DY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23536,_binary '\0','/j0d7j5PmYccvNH1shYUr8UG9Sj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1075114',6.9,3469,'it','Tutta la vita davanti','25-year-old philosophy major Marta faces the ugly truth for many young Italians — a complete lack of career opportunities. While babysitting for single mother Sonia, she starts to work as a telemarketer, experiencing first-hand the fanatical and exploitative rat-race culture pushed on employees while quickly rising through the ranks of the company. Around her revolve people like delusional supervisor Daniela, her womanizing boss Claudio, fragile coworker Lucio \"2\", and well-meaning but inconsistent union rep Giorgio.','/kmoSWKB2pgnUyN1E9RP5ETU0q20.jpg','2008-03-28',117,'Released',NULL,'A Whole Life Ahead',51917,1.645,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23537,_binary '\0','/pa0Mq5rGm2QnzdpFmugTu4Mghf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10752004',6.3,69324,'en','Love Hard','An LA girl, unlucky in love, falls for an East Coast guy on a dating app and decides to surprise him for Christmas, only to discover that she\'s been catfished. But the object of her affection actually lives in the same town, and the guy who duped her offers to set them up if she pretends to be his own girlfriend for the holidays.','/issJnV3iSZCMxUHXJPnqC56d7PE.jpg','2021-11-05',105,'Released','A romantic comedy about the lies we tell for love.','Love Hard',734265,5.2311,6.924,'3boMRfx6cjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23538,_binary '\0','/rlEQAN7vPn0mUUaHFjfgtUOQRtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1075417',5.7,66853,'en','Race to Witch Mountain','A taxi driver gets more than he bargained for when he picks up two teen runaways. Not only does the pair possess supernatural powers, but they\'re also trying desperately to escape people who have made them their targets.','/5RBZsOKMMxnp8L6UmOiylKOw4yo.jpg','2009-03-13',98,'Released','The race is on.','Race to Witch Mountain',13836,11.3549,5.8,'SX2PWpcJlrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23539,_binary '\0','/7JubXPFBKGpJ7mvpMJQ7M0s8DG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1075419',6.9,14656,'cn','新宿事件','A simple Chinese immigrant wages a perilous war against one of the most powerful criminal organizations on the planet.','/8zWliijoTsk3kUdUJpbjqWgV617.jpg','2009-03-22',119,'Released','They destroyed his life... Now he\'ll destroy them all.','Shinjuku Incident',20083,4.9448,6.6,'PJqi2rj6LDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23540,_binary '\0','/rcIXalQXmjf4uxcvHdpiREIQWb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10756134',3.7,1669,'en','The Ghost in the Darkness','While exploring the deep woods, Youtuber Morgan stumbles upon a camera containing footage of a Satanic ritual and possible murder. When the police dismiss it as a fake, she and her friend Amber set out to prove otherwise, putting themselves right in harm\'s way.','/swf8REzxo95Ghapo1c5R4vQeJyJ.jpg','2019-10-25',65,'Released',NULL,'The Ghost in the Darkness',650672,0.7164,1,'SDMr28to51A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23541,_binary '\0','/r7hzMaElAQrRJV9EhglVg21CtsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10756184',6.1,3636,'fr','Saloum','Three mercenaries extracting a druglord out of Guinea-Bissau are forced to hide in the mystical region of