rever home.','/ittuYKPaYAvmBP9AtWL4zDlN5Lm.jpg','2019-11-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at Graceland: Home for the Holidays',627493,1.6169,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23563,_binary '\0','/2w1bCr1D5Imte2THRCXGMSgaO5G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10768456',6.4,2142,'en','Holiday Date','When Brooke’s boyfriend, Ethan, breaks up with her just before the holidays, she agrees to go home with Joel, an actor who will pose as her boyfriend.','/o8XDtQQbplfbVLEa0RlQlbuXVBI.jpg','2019-12-14',84,'Released',NULL,'Holiday Date',630924,2.7468,6.4,'njcSLCVSAb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23564,_binary '\0','/rLvCBm8SBx51mtzfepgbw7FPX1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10768536',6.7,1778,'en','A Beautiful Place to Die: A Martha\'s Vineyard Mystery','After being forced into early retirement, former detective Jeff Jackson returns to a quiet life on Martha\'s Vineyard. Quiet, at least, until a body washes up and he\'s drawn back into crime solving.','/3FGGJh5S9G29YGIRYqe3zca40yL.jpg','2020-01-12',85,'Released',NULL,'A Beautiful Place to Die: A Martha\'s Vineyard Mystery',657018,2.2179,7.5,'0HxFoVQYS-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23565,_binary '\0','/8bytZBIhsMdQ2AXM0t02OamM7db.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10768548',6.1,2319,'te','రాహు','Bhanu suffers from \'conversion disorder a.k.a hysterical blindness\' where she goes temporarily blind under severe stress, in her case triggered upon seeing blood, must fight her enemy who inflicts more bloodshed than she ever imagined.','/fufWceNdIZRZLwL3WcQEeXJ7ubL.jpg','2020-02-28',123,'Released',NULL,'Raahu',679053,0.7707,4.5,'Bsosz3-P11Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23566,_binary '\0','/bYcsJJVj70YHHMOZGCBaDLxBI2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1077026',5.5,1677,'it','Grande, grosso e... Verdone','A comic movie divided in three episodes.','/q1uFyN8W9xvC2BcGNZRGc545ZeD.jpg','2008-03-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Grande, grosso e... Ve