ssing brother who may have been killed by Palestinians.','/wA7rM6zoWqJDT9BG5Vj92WbEJEp.jpg','2009-08-29',120,'Released',NULL,'Ajami',24424,1.3261,7.1,'-pBRCqaA338','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23574,_binary '\0','/imOkJziqCFpf0IVwvV8JSNAejqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10772662',5.7,6712,'en','The Boy Behind the Door','Bobby tries to save himself and his best friend when they are kidnapped on their way home from school.','/6e53nMgW5pXBMCc6AMvnXLWspFJ.jpg','2020-09-27',88,'Released',NULL,'The Boy Behind the Door',741613,3.1189,6.199,'3HEmC-ASveA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23575,_binary '\0','/xPwx3woiX40RN2uaFu9tuXpLaak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10773090',5.8,10233,'te','సరిలేరు నీకెవ్వరు','A tough army major is deployed to Kurnool on a mission to keep the country safe from external threats.','/66MSawKC7nkqjD1BMlQHXl6y3C.jpg','2020-01-10',169,'Released',NULL,'Sarileru Neekevvaru',607313,2.033,5.848,'YaCGtGfoI1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23576,_binary '\0','/xkSxIf8vBYQ8lhoiasKppljuv6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10773114',7.3,1822,'id','Nanti Kita Cerita tentang Hari Ini','Harboring a deep secret, a seemingly happy family confronts the trauma of years past as a clash between generations threatens to separate them.','/n84V5KItbDoTQiWSzxGVbixnpzJ.jpg','2020-01-02',121,'Released','Every Family Has a Secret.','One Day We\'ll Talk About Today',613710,1.6305,7.2,'TcHh986XvI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23577,_binary '\0','/cJYerfZVf2rNwfGMK3MQ8lTbMnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1077368',6.2,296338,'en','Dark Shadows','Vampire Barnabas Collins is inadvertently freed from his tomb and emerges into the very changed world of 1972. He returns to Collinwood Manor to find that his once-grand estate and family have fallen into ruin.','/fd9Ck4cxVlmtXsbeGtQW7WFuUFI.jpg','2012-05-09',113,'Released','Every family has its demons.','Dark Shadows',62213,1