10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10782366',6.2,1290,'en','Love Under the Olive Tree','The prize of Sunset Valley\'s annual olive oil contest is a land parcel with disputed ownership. When feisty Nicole and competitive Jake face-off, they never expect sparks to fly. Starring Tori Anderson and Benjamin Hollingsworth.','/hAw4AUAHER1IYJpyVCf4GLfNtWj.jpg','2020-06-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Love Under the Olive Tree',627456,1.8974,6,'YP2_8OvG70g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23582,_binary '\0','/zpVMWiNJgcwHB0zIMGjXQMnSKPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078588',7.3,103508,'en','My Sister\'s Keeper','Sara and Brian live an idyllic life with their young son and daughter. But their family is rocked by sudden, heartbreaking news that forces them to make a difficult and unorthodox choice in order to save their baby girl\'s life. The parents\' desperate decision raises both ethical and moral questions and rips away at the foundation of their relationship. Their actions ultimately set off a court case that threatens to tear the family apart, while revealing surprising truths that challenge everyone\'s perceptions of love and loyalty and give new meaning to the definition of healing.','/atRGqnG7pe0hZP97RWDLrT2hRGZ.jpg','2009-06-26',109,'Released','A tale of life, love, and letting go.','My Sister\'s Keeper',10024,9.9243,7.37,'EiOWevDj1mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23583,_binary '\0','/kTrgUltMvymnPR33tvrqwaM4lBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078600',5.7,1833,'es','Sólo quiero caminar','A woman and her three partners-in-crime plan a revenge heist against her violent narco husband in order to get rid of him and steal his money.','/s5XgSslUhaEhs8LPefLUlja3tob.jpg','2008-10-31',129,'Released','Alone they walked, together they killed','Walking Vengeance',32695,2.3796,5.4,'z3g-Gqsw6GE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23584,_binary '\0','/kGpaa9ufi6gFJqLdDtl9mTOEIXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10786774',7.7,22090,'hi','सैम बहादुर','Based on the life of Sam Manekshaw, who was the Chief of the Army Staff of the Indian Army during the Indo-Pakistani War of 1971, and the first Indian Army officer to be promoted to the rank of Field Marshal.','/nFYf3g3CObjx9ri3PMWkK1lWFhr.jpg','2023-11-30',150,'Released','His Life. Our History.','Sam Bahadur',814215,1.8977,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23585,_binary '\0','/cdEVfwkVwFeL9LuTlGHTfezso8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10788058',3.7,2063,'en','Come Out Fighting','In WWII, a squad of U.S. African-American soldiers are sent on a rescue mission behind enemy lines to locate their lost commanding officer and a downed fighter pilot.','/sERwJxz0sqsbcUoTm66l9pI6HcH.jpg','2023-05-19',86,'Released','Victory in brotherhood.','Come Out Fighting',1047925,3.2754,4.526,'FD9JlpJ_f7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23586,_binary '\0','/cB0hIQ08dAjg521bBJ1IUoggoAZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078885',4.4,4396,'en','Deep in the Valley','Best friends, Carl and Lester, find themselves magically transported into an alternate universe straight out of a real-life adult movie. Hilarity ensues as they embark upon a journey of adult-themed mayhem while Carl ultimately finds true love in the most unlikely of places.','/obMNcO8izVF6Zv7crsmwvsDeyK9.jpg','2009-08-28',91,'Released','Where Every Fantasy Comes True','Deep in the Valley',21862,4.2263,4.9,'UoyXyLALqgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23587,_binary '\0','/zdhICEDUlBTQ43fQMa2KJt8fDFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078912',6,232391,'en','Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian','Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a pickle now that they\'ve been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution. Larry\'s (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.','/l9yAQn6TyrA3gv5xZZkiMMoZsiw.jpg','2009-05-20',105,'Released','When the lights go off the battle is on.','Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian',18360,13.6541,6.154,'lPLY8O1y0qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23588,_binary '\0','/vHDYDknnjIbuP0Poy0EJurtgjQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10789216',5.6,1876,'en','Diary of a Spy','Anna is a washed-up intelligence officer whose last mission left 7 people dead. Drunk, broke, and alone she is given the chance for one last mission: to seduce and recruit a valuable asset connected to the Saudi Royal Family. As she gets closer and closer to her target, Anna finds she is in over her head and she must decide between accomplishing her mission or finding a way to save herself.','/1Edo6T4MQRxlH5IeQalb1UTSYUb.jpg','2022-07-14',99,'Released','Love is not a real thing','Diary of a Spy',990337,1.637,4.8,'jqwS6sZBnQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23589,_binary '\0','/y99uiMxcV56AtpkZ9emzBd1Er43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078927',3.4,1605,'en','Shark Swarm','A fisherman and his family fight to take down a greedy real estate developer who has released toxins into the ocean, turning the area\'s sharks into bloodthirsty hunters.','/yaNa3QHUTZjAWDyvUGtG6hSPIgg.jpg','2008-03-09',158,'Released','Fear travels in packs...','Shark Swarm',100669,2.0081,5.3,'D0r3KnNkdW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23590,_binary '\0','/uKrfP5T5EwlR5RPGDEbFzDSaljJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1078940',5.6,122332,'en','Couples Retreat','Four couples, all friends, descend on a tropical island resort. Though one husband and wife are there to work on their marriage, the others just want to enjoy some fun in the sun. They soon find, however, that paradise comes at a price: Participation in couples therapy sessions is mandatory. What started out as a cut-rate vacation turns into an examination of the common problems many face.','/igXVSRZsNX3TZsKrQqSyEJvzHRF.jpg','2009-09-19',113,'Released','It may be paradise... but it\'s no vacation.','Couples Retreat',19899,8.9395,5.6,'X4j_NTFos9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23591,_binary '\0','/m0wysQlESsyG7NdlyGfdv06kwuO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10791152',6.7,2075,'it','Supereroi','The story of a loving couple who struggles to keep its relationship alive against the inescapable passing of time, told in a nonlinear way over the course of ten years in their lives.','/9ZDnrgn6Iw9z2XtaQ99G0p1DFP0.jpg','2021-12-23',122,'Released','Can love stand the test of time?','Superheroes',612491,2.2209,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23592,_binary '\0','/lkiXHIYFgEkGGtSqKcBy5gkdfOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10791618',6.3,1685,'en','Forever in My Heart','Jenna and Charlie found love in Ireland but their dreams drove them apart. Five years later, they reunite and Jenna has to decide where her heart belongs—back home or in the Emerald Isle.','/bECgGdJgq1D6FMdieVIhUDvShD2.jpg','2019-09-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Forever in My Heart',627370,2.3358,6.8,'RPPO7OIuBqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23593,_binary '\0','/jKqQKhjNeMzBR0sspFLQ4R7mGGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1079360',4.8,2218,'en','The Girl from the Naked Eye','Jake is a driver for a seedy escort service operating out of \'The Naked Eye strip club\', he\'s a street thug type who falls for a witty high-class escort named Sandy. Except one night Sandy is found murdered, the only clues left behind are cell phone calls made the night she died. To avenge Sandy\'s death Jake must risk everything and walk a bloody path to find her killer.','/yWIIlDEij3CSDoDR7qws6mNKzQS.jpg','2012-06-15',80,'Released','How far would you go if the only girl you ever loved was murdered?','The Girl from the Naked Eye',80973,2.0505,4.4,'h2dcyG1lqiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23594,_binary '\0','/2v6tOt3yedtb9urqXr7qCBS2gyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10793644',5.8,11592,'en','The Vigil','A man providing overnight watch to a deceased member of his former Orthodox Jewish community finds himself opposite a malevolent entity.','/hSrDrWjRxUk4U8U5UvL1ct8vi4F.jpg','2020-07-01',88,'Released','Say your prayers.','The Vigil',621707,4.2261,5.8,'JarbtubycQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23595,_binary '\0','/kQjoo1BCMaItNOrLxZU3g5X75NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10796286',7.4,6557,'ru','Дорогие товарищи!','When the communist government raises food prices in 1962, rebellious workers from the small industrial town of Novocherkassk go on strike. The massacre that ensues is seen through the eyes of a devout party activist.','/ds7T5PEplJQeKzpLWbIvW9xpHX1.jpg','2020-09-14',121,'Released',NULL,'Dear Comrades!',587609,1.6274,7.1,'XdBp0KktXpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23596,_binary '\0','/v285GDYJ6wKslA83nvgIZl7HQG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10798072',6.1,1364,'it','Padrenostro','Two young boys, Valerio and Christian, form a powerful friendship over the summer.','/woa5t4LuiJ14Pl2Bqjn8DtLHne8.jpg','2020-09-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Our Father',669665,2.0745,6.6,'ltlJi9VRg6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23597,_binary '\0','/su6k9YqTRKifzAkokpN36uDO1td.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1079968',4.7,2311,'en','Jack and the Beanstalk','A fairy tale character who is about to flunk out of fairy tale school, Jack must perform a heroic deed by Monday or fail miserably, just like his father before him. Anxious to make good, Jack sells his C.O.W. (Computer of Wonder) for a handful of magic beans and a mysterious book that records his adventures as he\'s having them. Accompanied by his sidekick Grayson -- a goose who ate a bean and underwent an amazing transformation -- Jack climbs the magic beanstalk to recover the fabled Harp of Destiny from the evil Giant who lives in the sky. Helping Jack on his perilous quest is the spunky Jillian, a fearless young girl whom Jack meets on his journey -- and who just may have a hidden agenda...','/kQKwVj1xvWh2jN1GeBsubpVgdFn.jpg','2009-11-06',94,'Released','An adventure of gigantic proportions.','Jack and the Beanstalk',36550,3.3243,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23598,_binary '\0','/oIJjO1CvEdTMFNkWfHaV0RB584G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10799690',5.5,8843,'en','Trap House','An undercover DEA agent and his partner embark on a game of cat and mouse with an audacious, and surprising group of thieves – their own rebellious teenagers, who have begun robbing from a dangerous cartel, using their parents\' tactics and top-secret intel to do it.','/6tpAPeuuqbVnYWWPoOLEDLSBU7a.jpg','2025-11-14',103,'Released','This isn\'t a raid. It\'s a reckoning.','Trap House',628847,9.9417,6.635,'mZJYxUqXuCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23599,_binary '\0','/5Xu9vTZfvg1rgXHidmTVYvjw2zR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1079980',4.6,1287,'en','Death in Love','Death in Love is a psychosexual-thriller about a love affair between a Jewish woman and a doctor overseeing human experimentation at a Nazi German concentration camp, and the impact this has on her sons\' lives in the 1990s.','/bhHslpe5QunkPS6CbWj3zrDRkY9.jpg','2008-07-17',97,'Released','Sin. Suffer. Repeat.','Death in Love',30302,2.0564,4.7,'xW_yag6QuA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23600,_binary '\0','/w85ZG3MruMujyS3laS6D37WzHyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1080012',6.2,1259,'en','Faintheart','A romantic comedy set in the world of battle re-enactments, about an irresponsible guy who has to shape up in order to win back his wife.','/dUGySvz2Hhb4Nt8jJlD9TADl9mu.jpg','2009-01-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Faintheart',18739,1.8777,6.3,'Ci_Q-j6FzLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23601,_binary '\0','/6Ybbh8TrO8bkEfQXDedekLwVDfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1080016',6.9,289571,'en','Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs','Times are changing for Manny the moody mammoth, Sid the motor mouthed sloth and Diego the crafty saber-toothed tiger. Life heats up for our heroes when they meet some new and none-too-friendly neighbors – the mighty dinosaurs.','/cXOLaxcNjNAYmEx1trZxOTKhK3Q.jpg','2009-06-26',94,'Released','What killed the dinosaurs?','Ice Age: Dawn of the Dinosaurs',8355,25.8589,6.8,'byUCa2vjDik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23602,_binary '\0','/9HOLHuNTqOwLU1nRmYIYUV4Nkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10800758',5.9,2169,'ko','변신','An evil spirit that changes faces infiltrates one family placing one brother in danger while the other tries to save him.','/somL0rNxv9q60m9DgKhzOVNrJ3Q.jpg','2019-08-21',113,'Released','Do not be deceived.','Metamorphosis',581531,3.0955,7,'IyttrCKrFVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23603,_binary '\0','/gSRPK8Xtwj9by1EnI7qMi0SrX1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10801398',5.3,1513,'ko','암전','A struggling director makes a desperate bid to dig into the urban legend about a film shot by a ghost, at the risk of her own life.','/bn3fXKmDe3fssntJ776lleJakn3.jpg','2019-08-15',85,'Released','Watch at your own risk.','Warning: Do Not Play',602508,2.4436,6.3,'k8IT13ivLC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23604,_binary '\0','/rzR6LXFoBaO4ZvBBGvlgFm6hfE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10803634',5.9,1290,'ms','Tiger Stripes','A carefree student at an all-girls school shows unusual symptoms when she begins puberty, forcing her to grapple with a mysterious and visceral power.','/aF09HuGro1aBHoEIbRZypGtJAih.jpg','2023-10-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Tiger Stripes',1077693,1.5439,5.8,'BzLBZp-67hE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23605,_binary '\0','/qr7lV5dELXDt7VeEFgbHH9HNiEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10803866',6.1,1258,'it','10 giorni con Babbo Natale','Carlo and Giulia are grappling with new problems regarding the division of their respective tasks within the family. Since Giulia has started working again, it is Carlo who takes care of the children and the household chores. However, he starts to find the role of “Mr. Mom” a bit tight-fitting. Just when he decides to get back into the game and look for a job, Giulia reveals to him that she is up for a promotion that would lead her to move to Sweden. As if that weren’t enough, she will have to take the interview on December 24 in Stockholm. Everything seems to threaten the family unity. What should they do? Carlo comes up with a \"brilliant\" idea… To recover the old camper and drag the family into an adventure that will lead them on a journey to the North to spend Christmas all together lovingly. Unexpected events along the way and a hilarious encounter/confrontation with a self-styled Santa Claus will make the trip unforgettable.','/zRTauOf9RcgD8Qf6bavSc8mECqW.jpg','2020-12-30',100,'Released',NULL,'When Mom Is Away... With the Family',614420,2.0922,6.2,'mQXGvvGa-pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23606,_binary '\0','/pHvHLrbvMogNMH1l7Uon3VzE3px.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10804178',6.9,5726,'pl','Jak zostałem gangsterem. Historia prawdziwa','The action of the film begins in the 1970s – even then, the young protagonist knows that adrenaline tastes better than powdered milk. Over time, he also discovers a desire for money, power, and being above the law. A transformation begins, and his gangster talent blossoms. Together with a friend, they build their own army.','/oEvk45mBpE6s6wmIjvCTbdaMMpB.jpg','2019-12-25',140,'Released',NULL,'How I Became a Gangster',660033,2.9062,6.943,'6p8nuJ6-JDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23607,_binary '\0','/4NikiRtIvSAy2cAXYfX8fhFwnV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10805432',6.6,4452,'zh','返校','In the 1960s, two classmates go looking for their missing friends and teachers, all of whom took part in an illegal book club, only to come face to face with ghosts and deformed monsters that have taken over their school.','/8cKs4cPTAhAjjRAOjjXFbVnYc1l.jpg','2019-09-20',102,'Released','Back to School...','Detention',614017,2.2212,6.761,'BDM693sTP4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23608,_binary '\0','/lYXoJWYLKyimbVVqzx54I7DN9Iy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10805970',4.8,1471,'ta','ராங்கி','Thaiyal Nayagi, a journalist from Chennai, happens to connect with a terrorist in Tunisia through a fake account in the name of her 16-year-old cousin, Sushmitha. Little she knew that this would put herself and her cousin in danger.','/zld0TGM1hOzRrbzzzQWWXqqT8v5.jpg','2022-12-30',121,'Released',NULL,'Raangi',618907,1.1118,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23609,_binary '\0','/tKBDhCFlnA3wAH39pnhIBlb8O46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10806040',6,21586,'ta','வலிமை','A honest cop tries to track down the brain behind a series of robberies and murders, but things turn personal when his family become pawns in the criminal\'s game.','/zlh80l4fmOZy8KL34QVBtVjqYFs.jpg','2022-02-24',179,'Released','Power is a State of Mind','Valimai',640484,1.5587,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23610,_binary '\0','/hUCVvhScr97kqMwuwGuxr6R1Hle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1080716',7.5,1316,'cs','Karamazovi','Dostoevsky’s latter-day opus about the siblings and their father is among the masterpieces of world literature. It asks profound questions about ethics and religion. Is there a God? Does the devil exist? Is everything allowed because we live in a world without morality? And if so, does patricide even constitute a crime? One of the most interesting adaptations of the material is The Karamazovs by Czech director Petr Zelenka. We witness a group of thesps from Prague on a trip to Krakow in Poland to stage the novel as a play in a derelict steelworks as part of the Closer to Life Festival. The project, however, is born under the bad sign, apparently doomed from the start. When they arrive, the roof is about to cave in, so that the actors are told to wear safety helmets. Their sole consistent audience is a laborer (Andrzej Mastalerz) who rather follows each dress rehearsal than watching over his seven-year-old son who has suffered a tragic accident in the factory.','/dzxB3MYdAfyLae4C0vPpZbLqDWh.jpg','2008-04-24',110,'Released',NULL,'The Karamazov Brothers',122794,0.9386,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23611,_binary '\0','/u6Y510S63IXrXkDHcHlQ49Fecmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10808832',6.1,14724,'en','Let Them All Talk','A celebrated author takes a journey with some old friends to have some fun and heal old wounds. Her nephew comes along to wrangle the ladies and finds himself involved with a young literary agent.','/4mhZqZ7nXL6Dj6PKZSseJxv1qXZ.jpg','2020-12-10',113,'Released','Write your wrongs','Let Them All Talk',623856,6.0067,5.588,'tlUNudYUmfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23612,_binary '\0','/vFyRrJQc7KW0ShQUoj2mow0IbEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10809742',4.2,1248,'en','Collision','Over the course of one fateful day, a corrupt businessman and his socialite wife race to save their daughter from a notorious crime lord.','/k4KWmmV51Cc7bIFbaS4jzz9PYGf.jpg','2022-06-16',99,'Released',NULL,'Collision',975714,2.58,5.846,'UmDxTrJa3XA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23613,_binary '\0','/o0lQnIaYo5N05mfsltdl3ZCAXpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10811166',8.5,579917,'hi','द कश्मीर फ़ाइल्स','Based on a true tragedy, the emotionally triggering film sheds light on the plight of Kashmiri Pandits (Hindus), a religious minority in the 1990s Kashmir valley, who were compelled to flee their homes by the Islamic militants.','/2VvjJFDBFYkVgr89BjqbUl26QyW.jpg','2022-03-11',170,'Released','Right to Justice','The Kashmir Files',900783,1.7135,7.071,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23614,_binary '\0','/dJZG7aaNq6K9Q3Du6wIN9kaKbi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10814876',6.2,1562,'it','7 ore per farti innamorare','When his girlfriend Giorgia leaves him for his boss, journalist Giulio suddenly finds himself without a woman and with no job. Determined to win back his ex, he attends Valeria\'s classes, who teaches single men the art of seduction, convinced that relationships between people are motivated by simple biological stimuli.','/nhho6s14PwqceHXEx6D4D4uBEHw.jpg','2020-10-04',95,'Released',NULL,'‎7 Hours to Win Your Heart',614418,2.0437,6.3,'Th_OAY5KTEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23615,_binary '\0','/oZibPrp183EI5yjKvVFZ1lhA3Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10816484',6.9,4641,'it','18 regali','Elisa is only forty when an incurable disease takes her from her husband and their daughter. Before her heart stops, Elisa finds a way to stay close to her: a gift for every birthday up to her adult age, 18 gifts to try to accompany her child\'s growth year after year.','/lS7lqDT3NF2LcSPdxXNJY9pMxZ6.jpg','2020-01-02',110,'Released',NULL,'18 Presents',630220,2.2477,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23616,_binary '\0','/lyRmpBEAJHbmzmCQ8Gv8l20YVfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10817348',3.5,1772,'en','Cupid','After being embarrassed by the mean girls at school, Faye, a practicing witch, summons the evil Cupid to take revenge on all those who wronged her. On Valentine’s Day, Cupid does in fact rise and will stop at nothing until the walls are covered in blood. The students must figure out a way to stop Cupid and undo the spell before their hearts get broken… literally.','/b1QQPNKNSqhE45HxofvAmLgGLki.jpg','2020-02-11',83,'Released','It\'ll be a bloody Valentine this year','Cupid',663706,1.1475,3.6,'e7loZg7IspY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23617,_binary '\0','/xdoOMpsmUChKUvTGPBDTztGavnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1081929',6.9,1957,'pt','Aquele Querido Mês de Agosto','In the heart of Portugal, amid the mountains, the month of August is abuzz with people and activity...','/jlYXLt0ZOki0fVNWOXVk9qBZ3UH.jpg','2008-08-21',147,'Released',NULL,'Our Beloved Month of August',54384,0.9796,6.7,'wmF0pAuylhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23618,_binary '\0','/itDxEnPTXXmOFwIfpAhRjItWvWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1081935',6.9,8467,'it','Baarìa','In 1920s Bagheria, Giuseppe \'Peppino\' Torrenuova works as a shepherd to financially help his poor family. Over the next fifty years, Giuseppe\'s life, as well as the life of the village, is observed. Giuseppe grows up, joins the Communist Party, marries a local girl, has children, and forges a political career for himself.','/8gMju8daHITnaqjJFQfxJbVVtPJ.jpg','2009-09-25',160,'Released',NULL,'Baaria',25846,3.5197,7.195,'rnFhbq1n0_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23619,_binary '\0','/6ojoFGnSIDvD2eMUwbgoQGFJOFJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082007',5.6,1258,'it','Italians','Two stories of Italians abroad: in Dubai, a truck driver who smuggles Ferraris for a living teaches the tricks of the trade to his young disciple; in Russia, a clumsy dentist experiences the consequences of sex tourism.','/z1wtboHEdLHj75nrcN01HAqMJn.jpg','2009-01-23',116,'Released','We always stand out...','Italians',23509,0.974,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23620,_binary '\0','/xl4z1E8ER6PK5o8b8tH1GIhOe7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082009',6.9,3460,'fr','Joueuse','Hélène, a housekeeper at a ritzy hotel in Corsica, is devoted to her family but lacks any passion in her own life. When she sees a handsome couple play a passionate game of chess, she becomes inspired to play herself. Hélène\'s working-class husband and spoiled daughter are soon bewildered by her obsession with chess. They also grow suspicious of Hélène\'s close relationship with Dr. Kröger, her eccentric American expat tutor.','/d168CM9USKT9rx4xgvxeys5KWgO.jpg','2009-08-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Queen to Play',42973,2.0193,6.618,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23621,_binary '\0','/pk6A8WMfLSpdKzn4SzA4K0BXfXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082064',3.8,1249,'en','Perfect Hideout','A young couple on the run take a family father as a hostage and are shocked to realize that he actually is a serial killer who just murdered the family. With the police on the outside and the killer on the inside they now have nowhere to run and nowhere to hide, all whilst trying to solve their relationship problems... This is an action packed thriller with tongue in cheek','/A5KpAPeqHYrIOkbIJmNIHuLgnV2.jpg','2008-06-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Hideout',24350,1.1675,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23622,_binary '\0','/rIabrKhfikB7shrO8YP8hJxrhAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082577',5.2,2832,'en','Deadly Impact','Deadly Impact follows hard-nosed cop Thomas Armstrong (Flanery) whose life was shattered when he became the helpless target of a mastermind murderer. Returning home after a much-needed break, Armstrong joins the FBI to seek revenge and help track down the same killer that threatened his existence, however this time the assassin is back to terrorize not just a single person, but the entire city.','/ki0QFWOe1C3PrGjgoD654N7CawK.jpg','2010-04-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Deadly Impact',36147,2.274,4.949,'gfcTHNCjHWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23623,_binary '\0','/gSZ7t9K3dY8tSy0oHZTpHTInDZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082599',4.8,3772,'en','Stag Night','Four guys on a bachelor party get off the subway at a station that shut down in the 70\'s and, after watching a transit cop get brutally murdered, find themselves running for their lives beneath the streets of NY.','/gscnLqGWWC1q1HBvzfu35uwsQC0.jpg','2008-06-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Stag Night',24421,1.8555,4.7,'ARgyiwKCPTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23624,_binary '\0','/lB6qOoGFKxkDZXApXqJNLi6BUJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082601',5.6,35443,'en','Fighting','Small-town boy Shawn MacArthur has come to New York City with nothing. Barely earning a living selling counterfeit goods on the streets, his luck changes when scam artist Harvey Boarden sees that he has a natural talent for streetfighting. When Harvey offers Shawn help at making the real cash, the two form an uneasy partnership.','/xP1uogi5Gjnf6ybSN10lyDpqDlW.jpg','2009-04-24',105,'Released','Some dreams are worth the fight.','Fighting',17336,5.1159,6,'uZAVd_KjNOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23625,_binary '\0','/10OzC1HoKp2AwkaPktH3HsQM2u5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082807',6.2,68114,'en','The Belko Experiment','A group of eighty American workers are locked in their office and ordered by an unknown voice to participate in a twisted game.','/faJK0dP3S92kQoKtO4LZMjy41kf.jpg','2017-03-17',89,'Released','Who dies first?','The Belko Experiment',341006,6.1092,6.176,'L7ogzhx2P8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23626,_binary '\0','/5JENkUpYQjkbg2zKZ6UuTyolnHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082853',5.8,19202,'en','Management','A traveling art saleswoman tries to shake off a flaky motel manager who falls for her and won\'t leave her alone.','/roum0tVUqDWRbxBPlvdBzrxjMpK.jpg','2009-02-08',94,'Released','Some moments just feel right.','Management',21583,3.1767,5.4,'0FcMpO34kG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23627,_binary '\0','/v3yQYRScLl8WIqS1DnPub3hPuiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082868',6,84688,'en','Quarantine','A television reporter and her cameraman are trapped inside a building quarantined by the CDC after the outbreak of a mysterious virus which turns humans into bloodthirsty killers.','/rGfOD8IC1x4PqmnqRuA8KyCckia.jpg','2008-10-10',89,'Released','On March 11, 2008, the government sealed off an apartment complex in Los Angeles. The residents were never seen again. No details. No witnesses. No evidence. Until now.','Quarantine',13812,7.218,5.8,'KoBh5S_aWwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23628,_binary '\0','/5GlBEqiG0vpnnRWc7Vi5O4ao6Yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1082886',6.9,31853,'en','The Wackness','Set in New York City in the sweltering summer, The Wackness tells the story of a troubled teenage drug dealer, who trades pot for therapy sessions with a drug-addled psychiatrist. Things get more complicated when he falls for one of his classmates, who just happens to be the doctor\'s daughter. This is a coming-of-age story about sex, drugs, music and what it takes to be a man.','/gmtlqHZs8YBXcpMw4BgA3SGJfg8.jpg','2008-07-03',99,'Released','Sometimes it\'s right to do the wrong things.','The Wackness',13990,2.6308,6.4,'3VwN-KCpM6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23629,_binary '\0','/dSgQ7Er6VLYw8mZiha38Coa4iih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10831086',5.9,6144,'en','Pixie','To avenge her mother\'s death, Pixie masterminds a heist but must flee across Ireland from gangsters, take on the patriarchy, and choose her own destiny.','/zvQpvZneVLM3dssUyqYvnQsHovk.jpg','2020-10-16',93,'Released','Shall we go see the big scary drug dealer now?','Pixie',651610,2.3371,5.86,'LRrrsYBIT4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23630,_binary '\0','/kwXycPsLA6SV3KUOagn343TtMOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10831486',5,2222,'en','Levels','After witnessing his girlfriend\'s murder, a man risks everything - including reality itself - to discover the truth.','/y1xm0jMIlx9Oo2a3jWNyLGm43sJ.jpg','2024-11-01',92,'Released','Question reality. Discover truth.','Levels',791042,2.951,5.7,'cCggBmznfTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23631,_binary '\0','/sSinyqGb3sXrOeYWjjJM8RG1iPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10832274',7,4467,'en','Swan Song','An aging hairdresser escapes his nursing home to embark on an odyssey across his small town to style a dead woman\'s hair for her funeral, rediscovering his sparkle along the way.','/wvjlNWpwtAwVksnMirtNKohf1kh.jpg','2021-08-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Swan Song',794602,3.1208,6.9,'heN0JtJu4pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23632,_binary '\0','/mY1oJ6IzTXdo8QiPsKvJK6PabkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10832720',4.7,2128,'en','The Last Ghost Hunters','A team of paranormal investigators search an old abandoned home hoping to solve the mystery of its missing inhabitants. They soon discover spirit activity much stronger than anticipated and are unavoidably drawn into the evil that awaits.','/wKaH5Z9hEbA9DFPr9O83PUe7G0t.jpg','2021-11-03',76,'Released',NULL,'The Last Ghost Hunters',739590,1.2083,6,'EIs-A4kzQ2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23633,_binary '\0','/1SZuV2Qp1RD13MhdTdqTGBVhcyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10833270',5.4,2508,'en','Upside-Down Magic','Nory and her best friend Reina enter the Sage Academy for Magical Studies, where Nory’s unconventional powers land her in a class for those with wonky, or “upside-down,” magic. Undaunted, Nory sets out to prove that that upside-down magic can be just as powerful as right-side-up.','/r2MfnMmFzGvRvjGVLIuyx3R16a6.jpg','2020-07-31',96,'Released','Find your magic.','Upside-Down Magic',671583,6.0094,7.1,'sQ3PiZTEOBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23634,_binary '\0','/dGIH3Zq8jMFMA0WRTDYh9wXY16z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10833378',6.1,5378,'en','Beyond the Neon','Based on true accounts, a Las Vegas escort is recognized by her sister in a viral social experiment video. Looking to reunite the sisters, and secretly motivated to capture the reunion on camera, Joey Salads and his apprehensive crew are thrown into the dangerous and corrupt world of escorting, documenting every step of their desperate effort to rescue the woman from human sex trafficking in Las Vegas.','/mVwPd5dsh1UWMvofayzDQez4DXw.jpg','2022-10-14',87,'Released','Girls Direct To You in 20 Minutes','Beyond the Neon',1031918,1.1238,4,'v9bl4nziPuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23635,_binary '\0','/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1083448',6.4,9798,'en','A Princess for Christmas','After her sister and brother-in-law\'s tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law\'s father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.','/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg','2011-12-03',91,'Released','Sometimes dreams come true','A Princess for Christmas',79113,3.7518,7,'UeqkKQv5SiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23636,_binary '\0','/jbcEWHYpnlZ1aiMCLcRyiIhwUwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1083452',7.3,108609,'en','Eddie the Eagle','The feel-good story of Michael \'Eddie\' Edwards, an unlikely but courageous British ski-jumper who never stopped believing in himself—even as an entire nation was counting him out. With the help of a rebellious and charismatic coach, Eddie takes on the establishment and wins the hearts of sports fans around the world by making an improbable and historic showing at the 1988 Calgary Winter Olympics.','/r562gvTRVHnDSvG7MrKHEECSn1V.jpg','2016-02-25',106,'Released','Win or lose, always aim high.','Eddie the Eagle',319888,8.3294,7.2,'hyzQjVUmIxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23637,_binary '\0','/vitMfWMWdOSCqD3DqKQC1h8Cphy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1083456',6.1,48716,'en','Fired Up!','Popular high schoolers and best friends Shawn and Nick decide to ditch football camp for cheerleader camp. For the girls and for the glory.','/ifTjxzY6ZlFOVEypy1B9FFpiZUp.jpg','2009-02-20',90,'Released','2 Guys. 300 Girls. You Do the Math.','Fired Up!',17927,7.5301,6.1,'8VZ7bKZ4FWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23638,_binary '\0','/uUogHb46ykdT5GdvjrTIKdyoYb4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1083462',5.1,7121,'en','Mardi Gras: Spring Break','For three college guys, it’s senior year and the co-ed experience has left them high and dry. Their solution: A road trip to Mardi Gras, where beautiful babes are happy to lift their shirts and open containers are always welcome. But after dressing in drag, breaking into Carmen Electra’s hotel room, starring in a scandalous sex show and accidentally exploding a feces bomb in a swank hotel lobby, will the Mardi Gras magic kick in and their wildest fantasies come true?','/lFcWzKt2Sbt8GRJGHvSWkbHulU2.jpg','2011-09-23',88,'Released','A group of college buddies sow their wild oats in New Orleans.','Mardi Gras: Spring Break',58231,5.3069,5.699,'hBeT3bBTBqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23639,_binary '\0','/8eG8c632K0rjzkQhN8atVBGNaFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10834986',7.8,2996,'bn','গুমনামি','Gumnaami is a film based on the Mukherjee Commission Hearings which happened from 1999 to 2005 where the three theories about Netaji Subhas Chandra Bose\'s death were discussed and debated. It is a dramatization of the hearings where an investigative journalist supporting the Gumnaami Baba theory locks horns with the official lawyer who supports the plane crash theory. In their clash, the Death in Russia theory also comes up.','/8t4rsFgYKd95AxywMJW9N5kJtNa.jpg','2019-10-02',142,'Released',NULL,'Gumnaami',641304,1.2013,7.917,'aF6m7TrpBJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23640,_binary '\0','/eNI7PtK6DEYgZmHWP9gQNuff8pv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10838180',5.6,306820,'en','The Matrix Resurrections','Plagued by strange memories, Neo\'s life takes an unexpected turn when he finds himself back inside the Matrix.','/8c4a8kE7PizaGQQnditMmI1xbRp.jpg','2021-12-16',148,'Released','Return to the Source.','The Matrix Resurrections',624860,15.9954,6.303,'9ix7TUGVYIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23641,_binary '\0','/vHC79hM1bQG5JR9E8nlZn3pwyPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1083845',6.6,9548,'en','Ballet Shoes','An unusual explorer named Gum and his kindly niece adopt three orphans -- Pauline, Petrova and Posy -- and raise them as sisters in 1930s London. But the girls must fend for themselves when Gum doesn\'t return from one of his adventures. Together, they nurture their passions for acting, aviation and ballet in this charming TV adaptation of Noel Streatfield\'s novel.','/sG1ef5gIObTeItweZZxhSLJVs8B.jpg','2008-08-26',85,'Released','Dreams do come true.','Ballet Shoes',20497,3.138,6.3,'uq7plj_h2DI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23642,_binary '\0','/rRC1g3a4xRhz2EluSDUi1J7ZNoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1084019',6.9,1809,'ja','黒帯','Set in 1932, amid the rise of militarism after the establishment of the Manchukuo colony in Northeast China, the story centers on a trio of karateka. Studying under their aging master in a small dojo in the woods of central Kyushu, Choei, Taikan and Giryu face a company of kempeitai military police come to requisition their dojo for use as a military base.','/idWqTc6DSpeNWSmREKh9xGc71N0.jpg','2007-10-13',95,'Released','Real Fight, Real Karate, Real Japan.','Black Belt',20225,1.4828,6.742,'430cNrrdCiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23643,_binary '\0','/yKTe3LQB4AnZe4VjSuByGOQgDbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10840884',7.3,6291,'hi','Gray Man','A revenge drama, which revolves around two families based out of London. One family which plans an elaborate countryside wedding and the other is a violent criminal family of moneylenders. Amidst a week-long function, both these worlds collide. A past secret sparks an incident of violence - in turn changing all their lives drastically.','/f6Ri4CZieXT2s1hJEfbxN1pk3Ve.jpg','2020-10-29',143,'Released',NULL,'Taish',605456,1.9401,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23644,_binary '\0','/qqthj8EUL4QKlDBoMcPqeWvi6Ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10841088',5.6,2712,'en','Riverdance: The Animated Adventure','A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life. Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.','/i6TRDlVuuEXMyLSlIkDd8YhBN0r.jpg','2021-05-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Riverdance: The Animated Adventure',756403,3.8708,5.971,'ZN6TgXnNVGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23645,_binary '\0','/tGevRq6AGHM6T98MpPbb3WnoyHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10843306',5.3,9935,'en','The Beach House','A romantic getaway for two troubled college sweethearts turns into a struggle for survival when unexpected guests – and the surrounding environment – exhibit signs of a mysterious infection.','/wyMjZJNAsvfnW8OS4JWh6TdKWzk.jpg','2020-10-22',88,'Released','Wish you were here.','The Beach House',632304,2.4563,5.363,'GLa9mY4FUBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23646,_binary '\0','/xb9I042F9WdwGUtbShR6HU0e2yT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10845262',7.5,2131,'tl','Miracle in Cell No. 7','Joselito is a mentally-challenged man who is wrongfully charged with sexually assaulting and murdering a little girl. In prison, he becomes friends with his fellow inmates and together they form a plan to smuggle his young daughter inside the cell! Years after, his daughter becomes a lawyer and is determined to prove her father\'s innocence.','/4FPlIQWRUSVEpuda19izUDO2GKr.jpg','2019-12-25',123,'Released','A tale of miracle inside a notorious cell.','Miracle in Cell No. 7',638240,3.014,7.2,'1ShRHfyLHtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23647,_binary '\0','/eP3LmZUUvIrEBtB1OcdzPawg0nd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10846008',5.7,1881,'en','Bobcat Moretti','An obese multiple sclerosis patient takes up his late Father\'s sport of boxing to overcome personal tragedy and find inner peace. \"Bobcat Moretti\" was filmed over the course of ten months, during COVID-19, allowing our lead actor to lose 154 pounds and embody the role.','/qG6qW33A9i9RV3q2cRKVSBKwQT.jpg','2023-08-04',96,'Released','Do more than try.','Bobcat Moretti',1025881,2.6402,5.8,'6DCauJi5oy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23648,_binary '\0','/6L4LISre666baQA9kFpfRTwDNuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10847138',4.9,2256,'en','Hello, Privilege. It\'s Me, Chelsea','In this documentary, Chelsea Handler explores how white privilege impacts US culture – and the ways it’s benefited her own life and career.','/2YR2kFW3H9VsMDUo26bznfDLo1r.jpg','2019-09-13',64,'Released',NULL,'Hello, Privilege. It\'s Me, Chelsea',628039,1.8888,5.5,'tPsLcrVlwt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23649,_binary '\0','/8CPbvLS1kNXQxKmryGVjQQ1V8VB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1084950',6.6,54882,'en','Rachel Getting Married','A young woman who has been in and out from rehab for the past 10 years returns home for the weekend for her sister\'s wedding.','/bumaq3lqe4YSsq6LlYoge7e9ABk.jpg','2008-10-03',113,'Released','The perfect weekend for a wedding… but the storm is coming.','Rachel Getting Married',14976,6.4719,6.297,'1wDDgSwEo1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23650,_binary '\0','/oTriUKBP348iFQ6wHAoxL2A4HcQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10849514',7.3,1727,'st','This Is Not a Burial, It\'s a Resurrection','Amongst the mountains of Lesotho, an 80-year-old widow winds up her affairs and makes arrangements for her burial. But when her village is threatened with resettlement due to the construction of a reservoir, she finds a new will to live and ignites a spirit of resistance within her community.','/9crWLzqUrFEoJHj8kbrUaRulKM.jpg','2020-06-17',120,'Released',NULL,'This Is Not a Burial, It\'s a Resurrection',618208,1.8098,7.4,'IZcr2T-eNPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23651,_binary '\0','/upklLOnKnIkt6LggorkGStjxfvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1084955',5.6,2925,'en','Falling Up','A nursing student forced to quit school for family reasons winds up taking a job as a doorman in an elite apartment building in New York City, where he sparks to one of his residents.','/v3bkmfSuhrFEdW6svkMQorFOAl9.jpg','2009-09-29',98,'Released','Let love in','Falling Up',29501,2.1709,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23652,_binary '\0','/pPvXyMjF7x5EMtxkURdbhpU4jGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1084972',6.6,29849,'hi','वांटेड','Radhe is a hardcore gangster. A sharpshooter with a sharp brain, he works for Gani Bhai, the dreaded Mafioso, but on his own terms. Totally fearless, Radhe single handedly eliminates Gani Bhai\'s enemies one by one; making more enemies than he bargained for.','/nymzAr2uEWxnDTfoIjUbh7a1UuB.jpg','2009-09-18',155,'Released',NULL,'Wanted',22717,2.3777,5.9,'fxm4KcKDQl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23653,_binary '\0','/zLIXyxOXccfn9hghdcHH86Hoca1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10850264',7.7,2213,'en','Squaring the Circle (The Story of Hipgnosis)','In 1968, art students Storm Thorgerson and Aubrey “Po” Powell made a trippy photo collage for their musician friends Syd, David and Roger. The resulting album and album cover, A Saucerful of Secrets, helped launch two careers: that of Pink Floyd, one of the 70s megabands, and of Hipgnosis, which, over the course of the next 25 years, designed a stream of iconic album covers.','/1ksxdRaNfsLMr6ml9s3sFfUk4ej.jpg','2023-06-07',100,'Released','Experience the story behind the artwork that defined a generation.','Squaring the Circle (The Story of Hipgnosis)',949808,2.2629,7.4,'-OYQNAk_krQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23654,_binary '\0','/eABCN2xGq9bhC1U4Fg8aDmSLagC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10851414',7,1405,'no','a-ha: The Movie','When \"Take On Me\" reached nr 1 on Billboard in the US in 1985, the dream came true. Or did it? The band was not prepared for what the success could bring, including tension between the three band members.','/prbQbRBKoNDGo6OPB05Zu6Y5HaF.jpg','2021-09-03',109,'Released','The story of three young boys who chose to follow the impossible dream.','a-ha: The Movie',655738,1.6763,6.9,'PjOZZ23ctBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23655,_binary '\0','/7OJ2FUlCQKILEfPZXzqKWp3mbUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10851618',8.1,1959,'en','Rising Phoenix','Elite athletes and insiders reflect on the Paralympic Games and examine how they impact a global understanding of disability, diversity and excellence.','/oso09gID2bFk9q3Cni8GNOuzTWZ.jpg','2020-08-26',106,'Released',NULL,'Rising Phoenix',726887,1.4117,8.1,'-W7Bek4jvos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23656,_binary '\0','/lC29yzn2tSHlkjzgt277YMWAV32.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085382',5.9,1425,'en','Chicago Overcoat','The fates of an aging hitman and a washed up detective become entwined when one last job leads to one last chance to settle an old score.','/6saeAm5xt4vVM632Hxw3tV0tRsJ.jpg','2009-10-10',95,'Released','The glory days are back','Chicago Overcoat',43213,1.72,5.382,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23657,_binary '\0','/axZ5RVlDACxVz7YJE7IE43ABIvw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085492',4.6,19738,'en','The Prince','A family man who turns out to be a retired mob enforcer must travel across the country to find his daughter who has gone missing.','/22b2fmxhZveWSyWkgUz2y94fp3w.jpg','2014-08-22',93,'Released','Mercy is for the Weak','The Prince',241254,6.8243,4.926,'uMNKLvD2F1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23658,_binary '\0','/n0pdzTiHioGUYagRQjsDRs0UxOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085496',5.5,1719,'en','Rock Haven','The coastal California community of Rock Haven is the perfect place for cute eighteen-year-old Brady and his loving mother to begin a fresh start. Their mission: to spread the word of the Lord. But while roaming the beach one day, Brady meets Clifford, a young man who is the complete opposite of him: outgoing and athletic as well as incredibly handsome. Their initial encounter stirs up feelings of homo desire that Brady has been suppressing. Once Clifford makes it clear that their attraction is mutual, Brady\'s conflicting feelings of religious obligation and natural impulse go into overdrive, and the two young men must navigate their confusion, lust and beliefs in order to come to a mutual understanding.','/rq7OZ2qBrme0oweoO0RPTpJt9it.jpg','2007-06-21',78,'Released',NULL,'Rock Haven',27215,0.9963,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23659,_binary '\0','/th91qSRruUjA7sKbcMhNCT7JosG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085507',6.7,6772,'en','The Square','Ray, a construction worker trapped in an unhappy marriage, pursues an affair with his neighbor, Carla. Carla\'s husband, Greg, is a mobster who keeps large sums of drug money in their home. With this in mind, Carla comes up with a plan: She and Ray will steal Greg\'s money, burn down her house, convince Greg the money was lost in the fire and then run away together. Carla\'s scheme, however, doesn\'t go off as planned.','/kLed7chodgFBAC2hUFqtVt9KyGk.jpg','2008-06-30',105,'Released','Some things can\'t be buried.','The Square',15912,1.7579,6.2,'Dic0G75Uv9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23660,_binary '\0','/cAqw3u48GzHwF4tNGOKil3O1H5G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085515',5.8,3410,'en','Weather Girl','Succumbing to the stresses of her personal and professional lives, Sylvia, a Seattle morning show weather forecaster, has a meltdown live on-air. Now, unemployed, lacking career prospects, and with a mess of a romantic life, she moves in with her little brother. She must learn how to cope with being 35-years-old and unfortunately famous for melting down on live television.','/p22bXXTDQvRbezyEcLU6mKiRikB.jpg','2009-07-10',92,'Released','Partly cloudy with a 90% chance of meltdown.','Weather Girl',19900,3.0033,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23661,_binary '\0','/tVH1qEFyKiCpP6kNDFyXKW2Tiif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10855768',7.1,73093,'en','Missing','When her mother disappears while on vacation in Colombia with her new boyfriend, June’s search for answers is hindered by international red tape. Stuck thousands of miles away in Los Angeles, June creatively uses all the latest technology at her fingertips to try and find her before it’s too late. But as she digs deeper, her digital sleuthing raises more questions than answers... and when June unravels secrets about her mom, she discovers that she never really knew her at all.','/wEOUYSU5Uf8J7152PT6jdb5233Y.jpg','2023-01-19',111,'Released','No one disappears without a trace.','Missing',768362,8.5013,7.379,'seBixtcx19E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23662,_binary '\0','/25lmSs1aYZsCcr6a9lapQse55Qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10856726',6.3,6036,'en','Travis Scott: Look Mom I Can Fly','While crafting his Grammy-nominated album \"Astroworld,\" Travis Scott juggles controversy, fatherhood and career highs in this intimate documentary.','/oNOXntnRY7dFrgu1x6bQQmWBVdu.jpg','2019-08-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Travis Scott: Look Mom I Can Fly',625561,2.8383,6.8,'CpR3rI_rjtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23663,_binary '\0','/zK4ST48F7pmhBmMILhv6vvQO4n4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085779',5.7,25378,'en','The Hole','After moving into a new neighbourhood, brothers Dane &amp; Lucas and their neighbour Julie discover a bottomless hole in the basement of their home. They find that once the hole is exposed, evil is unleashed. With strange shadows lurking around every corner and nightmares coming to life, they are forced to come face to face with their darkest fears to put an end to the mystery of THE HOLE.','/tQMxsrsVtpB2D2n01nUqgOMmSWD.jpg','2009-09-12',92,'Released','What Are You So Afraid Of?','The Hole',45650,4.5956,5.8,'b5VGhWJlG5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23664,_binary '\0','/bxJHzSYrzME9s3S0rM5KgtD7jPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085799',7.2,3125,'ar','هي فوضى..؟','Hatem is a corrupt police officer, who loves his neighbor Nour, who in turn loves the prosecutor, Sherif. Hatem tries to win Nour’s attention even if by force.','/bUo2rjMHGp4qDICzKLAaJ1tdQ8E.jpg','2007-11-28',120,'Released','Youssef Chahine\'s final film','Chaos, This Is?',163660,0.8816,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23665,_binary '\0','/7BC1PM7TDeqh6Ejmamxi8HEZ63O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1085862',6.1,3487,'es','El rey de la montaña','Quim drives around an isolated rural area through a maze of lanes. When he drives into the woods, he gets lost. Trying to find his direction, he suddenly gets shot from the hill. On his escape from gunshots, he meets Bea, an attractive young woman, who apparently is lost as well. Suspicious of each other, they join forces to run away through the forest, unprotected, cold, hunted...','/idQRgWr21C9kVLtQWScMcpJhRYy.jpg','2008-07-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The King of the Hill',14657,1.8509,5.75,'irlzqWLgX4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23666,_binary '\0','/ceVaixg5VUfx8j0N81FT0hRayRm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1086064',5.9,57321,'en','Bill & Ted Face the Music','Yet to fulfill their rock and roll destiny, the stakes are higher than ever for the now middle-aged Bill and Ted who set out on a new adventure when a visitor from the future warns them that only their song can save life as we know it.','/4V2nTPfeB59TcqJcUfQ9ziTi7VN.jpg','2020-08-27',92,'Released','The future awaits.','Bill & Ted Face the Music',501979,8.6933,5.884,'0hAL7emClFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23667,_binary '\0','/xyWtcPWG3zxKE0B9B98YejrdZLA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10862050',3.2,1391,'en','It Came from Below','Jessie and her friends go deep underground to find out what happened to her father who claimed a monster lurks in the caves and has killed his friends. Wanting to uncover the truth, they will soon be hunted by a deadly creature from another world.','/atcScspT9Hpyic05bchtHyevQR.jpg','2021-08-23',81,'Released','Miles below the earth, it has been awakened','It Came from Below',860869,1.2814,4.9,'M85RnHnUgnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23668,_binary '\0','/x0gF02Jz1lfI78zc0STKj7AvNYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1086216',5.7,6781,'en','Uncertainty','Every choice has a consequence. But what if the flip of a coin could trigger two separate but parallel destinies? Bobby and Kate are a young New York couple at a crossroads whose lives are about to take very different directions. A seemingly ordinary July 4th is cleaved in two by the flip of a coin. One path leads them to gentle discoveries about family, loss and each other on a visit to Brooklyn, and the other plunges them into an urban nightmare of pursuit, suspense and murder in Manhattan.','/2ExRSYW80CZhhFI3DQaiweTlAGs.jpg','2009-11-15',101,'Released','The choice is theirs.','Uncertainty',28520,1.8129,5.4,'H5Yh2uP6OGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23669,_binary '\0','/g5haoqEqt5VwVwQKEkoXY9zqSxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1086772',6.5,160360,'en','Blended','Recently divorced mom Lauren and widowed dad Jim let their friends push them into a blind date, which goes disastrously wrong. Unsurprisingly, neither wants to see the other ever again. However, fate intervenes when both Jim and Lauren, unbeknownst to each other, purchase one-half of the same vacation package at a South African resort for families, during spring break. They and their children are forced to share the same romantic suite and participate in a slew of family activities together.','/o2YrH9jS7CAfWjETHFeL0tth79E.jpg','2014-05-21',117,'Released','Single dad, no clue. Single mom, flying solo.','Blended',232672,10.6287,6.898,'V6cKLTmDB-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23670,_binary '\0','/zlfAxrhFXR8qVyzLre1BksxmhbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1086841',4.2,1441,'en','Impact Point','Pro Beach Volleyball star, Kelly Reyes, faces challenges everyday, fierce competitors, the press, but nothing could prepare her for him.','/p2SeFLxPU0fZno9XTYgx3w8IZAX.jpg','2008-06-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Impact Point',14156,1.6408,4.2,'sRzfTg_P_YY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23671,_binary '\0','/emWkqZ5RnmIpfbJu8jUtumQZ7Yp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10869474',5.9,1290,'ml','സേഫ്','Shreya opens an investigation against a celebrity based on the complaints of sexual abuse. Amidst rising crime and violence, Arundhati, a social activist starts a public movement called \"SAFE\" to protect women, children and the aged.While the investigation proceeds, Shreya came to know many hidden details and it points to many other questions.','/bLKtWBSVsPJMSw9xipslImhCOKd.jpg','2019-10-18',144,'Released','Change Begins Here','Safe',659098,0.9492,4.714,'UzaORDiU0Ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23672,_binary '\0','/zqLWsOw9RaVjtI1ke8rQocv3ODJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10869778',7.9,23668,'hi','मैदान','Inspired by the Indian national football team coach and manager Syed Abdul Rahim, who is regarded as the architect of Indian football, encapsulating the golden era from 1952 to 1962.','/eKbAVKQf6choCfasNWuYoSTOPBP.jpg','2024-04-10',181,'Released','One Man. One Belief. One Spirit. One Nation.','Maidaan',668340,1.6336,7.8,'kDzAKXNnAVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23673,_binary '\0','/xwcuaxlajh5fr0e2P9UCfn1m2JR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10869956',5.5,1460,'en','Before Dawn','After leaving his family\'s sheep farm in the Australian outback, a young man joins his countrymen on the western front of World War I with hopes of helping expedite an end to the bloody conflict. But as war rages on, he is forced to grapple with the brutal realities of trench warfare, including a near-constant battle to keep himself alive—without leaving another man behind. Inspired by the real-life diary entries of local ANZACs, the feature film details the untold story of some of Australia’s greatest military victories.','/a51x5NWJqdzWbFA58dwRgwfgQDj.jpg','2024-04-04',101,'Released','War leaves scars. Heroes leave legends.','Before Dawn',981063,3.7652,6.874,'q-ibQNR11tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23674,_binary '\0','/iQFcwSGbZXMkeyKrxbPnwnRo5fl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10872600',8.1,1074164,'en','Spider-Man: No Way Home','Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.','/1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpg','2021-12-15',148,'Released','Enter the Multiverse.','Spider-Man: No Way Home',634649,61.5699,7.947,'1mTjfMFyPi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23675,_binary '\0','/3MEvO5gNLAdH8kMVnYZ8dkY8VCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087458',4.3,1492,'fi','Kummeli Alivuokralainen','A farce about blackmailing, a kidney transplant operation performed at home, deviants and human relationships.','/gjPMY8SZj8vmd8BnqPwgUviEF23.jpg','2008-09-12',104,'Released',NULL,'The Subtenant',22554,1.4143,4.5,'OAOeURTfsYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23676,_binary '\0','/hGTK2dnm1vXYpr26QGWjXIVpI9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087461',4.6,21712,'en','Megan Is Missing','Fourteen-year–old Megan and her best friend Amy spend a lot of time on the internet, posting videos of themselves and chatting with guys online. One night Megan chats with a guy named Josh who convinces her to meet him for a date. The next day, Megan is missing—forever. Based on actual cases of child abduction.','/lDmIqn0HJDjQJZDZaofuyaAnw2X.jpg','2011-05-01',86,'Released','Megan and Amy are best friends. They share secrets. They chat with guys online. And in a few days, they will never be seen again.','Megan Is Missing',63197,5.0535,6.1,'5-jsFEm9Xqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23677,_binary '\0','/sgRrJ7mC0uubOfeMLC4d04QCMhX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087474',2.5,2271,'en','Sharks in Venice','The seemingly tranquil waterways of Venice are terrorized by the perfect killing machine. In search of his father who has mysteriously disappeared diving in the city, David stumbles across the cryptic trail leading to the long-lost fortune of the Medici. As the unwitting pawn in a Mafia plot to recover the treasure, David\'s girlfriend is kidnapped at gunpoint, plunging him into a desperate race against time. If he has any hope of saving her he must enter the deadly waters. Can David out-gun the Mafia assassins and survive the voracious sharks laying in wait beneath the surface, or will he succumb to the same fate as his father?','/hIZZNyOVg5E7nHElp4w93KvT9dw.jpg','2008-10-06',88,'Released','Welcome to the perfect tourist trap','Sharks in Venice',45009,1.4933,4.2,'iKhT7ePmBB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23678,_binary '\0','/b1qv44eFNnspBctJazkHNhFjrYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10875068',3.6,1299,'en','Deadly Promises','Dillon Copeland is an attractive, talented teenager who resides with his uncle in Colorado. He has a crush on Megan who is also interested in him. But Travis, the popular High School jock, likes her too and it\'s only a matter of time before the tension gets out of control. As the plot thickens, some VERY disturbing secrets are revealed... the kind of secrets that are better kept in the basement. How could Uncle Max keep this secret for so long? Promises are made as the story unfolds. And promises, even deadly ones, must be kept!','/1A9bstg72xHy984KS8Z6cYgpFgz.jpg','2020-07-10',81,'Released','Every promise made will be kept','Deadly Promises',752127,1.7223,4.3,'ptyFnzqQvGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23679,_binary '\0','/TIDU7z586pmSOaTLYMurFRWAA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087524',4.7,1544,'en','Once Fallen','When Chance (Brian Presley) returns home after five years in jail, he is determined to escape his past, start a new life and make peace with his father, (Ed Harris, Golden Globe® winner), who is the head of the Aryan Brotherhood prison gang and serving a life sentence for murder. Upon his release, his dreams of a crime-free future begin to disintegrate when he is forced to assume his best friend\'s outrageous debt to a local mobster. Despite being thrust back into a world of organized fighting, drug dealing and ties to corrupt police agents, Chance falls in love with Pearl (Academy Award® nominee Taraji P. Henson) and the prospect of living a normal life seems almost within reach. But will he be able to escape the crimes of his father and his past?','/8ebXl6daqC7PdOr9OKxMqsjh40z.jpg','2010-11-02',89,'Released','The hardest part about moving on is saying goodbye','Once Fallen',44862,2.2972,5.2,'OxhMP7rzgN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23680,_binary '\0','/yiDfBGXBrd1O2yF9gCf8lyKFb0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087527',6.5,3758,'en','Trucker','Loner Diane Ford is a truck driver with an 11-year-old son, Peter, whom she never sees, and that\'s fine with her. But, when Peter\'s father, Len, falls ill, he asks Diane to take care of their son for a while. Eventually, Diane reluctantly agrees, but she quickly realizes that caring for a child interferes with her independent lifestyle - and Peter isn\'t all that thrilled with the arrangement, either.','/kiOEBjIsTiGtYBDfaoaCwwXGIFP.jpg','2008-04-24',90,'Released','Some Things in life you can\'t leave behind','Trucker',29406,2.1727,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23681,_binary '\0','/gnBDjxHIMz7JHEMPDDdvqBtzA0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10875678',5.2,1218,'hi','Happy Hardy And Heer','Happy and Heer grow up as best friends, with Happy falling for Heer over the years. When she moves to London, Happy goes with her on the pretext of getting a job. He hopes that she will fall for him too but she soon meets Hardy, who was born and brought up in the UK. Hardy is a self-made entrepreneur while Happy is light-hearted and carefree. Who will Heer choose?c','/rtnetNVIRV5ZuqmfJBrihCuvhvJ.jpg','2020-01-31',123,'Released',NULL,'Happy Hardy And Heer',671539,1.0885,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23682,_binary '\0','/lvSB0bnLzuxwrfTlI2l13gctWRn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087578',7.9,21416,'ja','歩いても 歩いても','A family gathers together for a commemorative ritual whose nature only gradually becomes clear.','/FWJbhAPdwiwKhUaAyz841jpYa1.jpg','2008-06-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Still Walking',25050,4.6308,7.8,'9gPbHqmjhNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23683,_binary '\0','/rsRfFz0ifHSFjKcRtVzMzhoM7zk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087832',4.5,1479,'ru','Код Апокалипсиса','Terrorist Jaffad Ben Zayidi steals four nuclear bombs from a sunken American submarine and hides them in four major cities throughout the world. The charges can be activated by an 11-digit code. Zayidi dies and his accomplice, nicknamed \"The Executioner,\" is about to blow up the bombs. The Executioner is chased by FSB, whose agent Marie has previously infiltrated Zayidi\'s team.','/7Cel7xcLMkvzlwbzpcx2cGBxDx3.jpg','2007-10-02',110,'Released',NULL,'The Apocalypse Code',27379,1.8179,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23684,_binary '\0','/vcoTSpHkBGV9XtaCYV0jqEeKchD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087841',4.6,1263,'da','Disco ormene','It\'s not easy to be Barry. An earthworm gets no respect. He lives at the bottom of the food chain. But one day, an old disco record turns his life upside down. Suddenly he sees before him his own destiny, the star of the world\'s greatest disco band: Sunshine Barry &amp; The Disco Worms! Okay, he\'s got no arms, no rhythm and no band. But as Barry says: \"We\'ll do it anyway!\"','/3uxs4tA0YnB5PxGoWbVHRiuw3y8.jpg','2008-10-10',79,'Released','Disco will never be the same again','Sunshine Barry & the Disco Worms',15838,2.909,5.3,'oB4OJrnYeaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23685,_binary '\0','/tawwFh0DxfBEechnWxB046lS97c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087842',5.2,7037,'fr','Eden Log','A man wakes up deep inside a cave. Suffering amnesia, he has no recollection of how he came to be here or of what happened to the man whose body he finds beside him. Tailed by a mysterious creature, he must continue through this strange and fantastic world. Enclosed, Tolbiac has no other option to reach the surface than to use REZO ZERO, secret observing cells in this cemetery-like abandoned mine.','/lNLAMUw2Cm2TJCS3764ZlAh6l1y.jpg','2007-12-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Eden Log',14235,1.522,5.1,'Xv5lYKC2D74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23686,_binary '\0','/1Eqo5oZYStjC1lTtamkIbyxZxf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087853',4.5,4001,'en','Gutterballs','A brutally sadistic rape leads to a series of bizarre gory murders during a midnight disco bowl-a-rama at a popular bowling alley. One by one, players of two teams meet blood-drenched gruesome deaths at the hand of a black bowling-gloved masked killer. This alley runs red with blood by sunrise.','/4RUGAafVnWNIiJzy1OJMgQGjYYW.jpg','2008-01-18',96,'Released','I Warned You Not To Bowl Tonight','Gutterballs',16915,1.4992,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23687,_binary '\0','/bNYxr3GGXRthtDRFCnloXO4r3xC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087856',3.3,2447,'hi','Hello','Call-center workers receive a phone call from God.','/qpN7Td4djkQp4vFDjaGGAWgueTQ.jpg','2008-10-10',129,'Released','A bad boss, and a phone call from god.','Hello',20365,2.0542,5.7,'sYViHvwYPw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23688,_binary '\0','/yVMZKT5auV0XfOiXIKl6maO5bSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1087890',6.7,7442,'da','Frygtelig lykkelig','Robert Hansen, 34, a young police officer from Copenhagen, is transferred against his will to the small town of Skarrild in Southern Jutland as a substitute Marshall. The transfer is Robert’s chance to start over. Whether he is allowed to return to his job in Copenhagen, all depends on how well he performs in this frontier town.','/fQNXTutWu7Jyau5hIvufPxrqTlU.jpg','2008-07-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Terribly Happy',15952,1.7227,6.3,'qsslA308XV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23689,_binary '\0','/pLB0WpANERn96iR1iGgyH9HEkf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10879920',7,1663,'es','Tengo miedo torero','Among gunshots and boleros, a passionate relationship flourishes between a lonely transvestite and a young guerrilla during the Pinochet dictatorship.','/7mM9PVIqMJh37pocDuuJH5Q56mt.jpg','2020-10-15',93,'Released',NULL,'My Tender Matador',651170,1.4152,7.4,'Ib7GpYf6D1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23690,_binary '\0','/d7deqdwnVOstSj3S3YALk2SEdWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10880402',6.1,2367,'fr','De Gaulle','Paris, June 1940. The de Gaulle couple is confronted with the military and political collapse of France. Charles de Gaulle joins London while Yvonne, his wife, finds herself with her three children on the road of the exodus.','/riglPR73CUgNdnNqZ47LWKmad7r.jpg','2020-03-04',108,'Released',NULL,'De Gaulle',661804,2.6268,6.067,'7vdeUNEwbR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23691,_binary '\0','/gwksBTz60lVeGWKqDr0n8ij0hfp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10883004',6.7,8870,'en','Bikram: Yogi, Guru, Predator','The spectacular rise and scandalous fall of hot-yoga evangelist Bikram Choudhury is chronicled through archival footage and extensive insider interviews.','/4qzgxaWtAtl19YwHvtQ1E8Kju6P.jpg','2019-09-10',86,'Released',NULL,'Bikram: Yogi, Guru, Predator',621753,1.9382,6.3,'AbsaUHdxGHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23692,_binary '\0','/r0DFmENrZIM1qHeDofxYQS4v07T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10883124',6.9,1522,'en','Dads','A joyful exploration of modern fatherhood, this doc gathers the testimonies of dads around the world, from famous comedians to everyday parents. Their unfiltered stories speak to the beauty, struggles, and ridiculous hilarity of being a dad today.','/lDBHH2oQJJtSIsUZfruBEDXra2n.jpg','2019-09-06',81,'Released','You got this. Even when you don\'t.','Dads',621757,3.4943,6.9,'7clwrlPI64U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23693,_binary '\0','/qPzKhV1syepFo3Rh795u3ZaMQQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10883302',5.9,4254,'kn','ರಾಬರ್ಟ್','Raghava lives in Lucknow with his son Arjun and is the head cook in a Brahmin\'s catering unit. He leads a peaceful existence, wanting the best for his son. All seems to go well, until some skeletons come tumbling out of his closet and he is forced to take on his original avatar.','/gBCkf1rk9KyJt9o6wC866BM6WWi.jpg','2021-03-11',124,'Released',NULL,'Roberrt',673779,1.6055,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23694,_binary '\0','/aCVLHPMlwIMhf4Y06dFjBTqTRGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10883506',7.6,11704,'zh','陽光普照','A family of four fractures under the weight of unmet expectations, unexpected tragedy, and uncompromising pride.','/oMdGYF0IBSJKgiNOuDoagmnOstu.jpg','2019-11-01',156,'Released',NULL,'A Sun',622951,2.1138,7.705,'y5-FEtJTg44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23695,_binary '\0','/dPNwxlULqvc90FX5j9hZmWgc83P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10885444',2.6,10262,'hi','खाली पीली','The story is about two childhood sweethearts Pooja and Blackie who gets separated due to certain circumstances when they were kids. Pooja, who is now aprostitute, decides to escape the brothel on turning 18, with a bag full of stolen money. She bumps into Blackie who is now a very ‘chalu’ Bombay taxi driver. He agrees to ‘drive’ her to freedom, in exchange for a hefty amount.This leads to a series of chase and escape – with the goons on Pooja\'s trail and the cops on the goons’ trail.','/ovmbklvzSu8pbIthunlKPgIjlOo.jpg','2020-10-01',113,'Released','One Boy, One Girl and One Mad Ride','Khaali Peeli',693836,1.3278,5.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23696,_binary '\0','/29mZ5bR5m2w3xuvwJH7BHMFQQwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10886166',3.3,110179,'pl','365 dni','A woman falls victim to a dominant mafia boss, who imprisons her and gives her one year to fall in love with him.','/6KwrHucIE3CvNT7kTm2MAlZ4fYF.jpg','2020-02-07',114,'Released',NULL,'365 Days',664413,10.638,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23697,_binary '\0','/mNYRNP3QcWDjZylEu3hkRMlsKS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10887492',6.3,1779,'en','Country at Heart','A struggling country singer meets a Nashville songwriter in need of inspiration. Teaming up to write a song, their work gets complicated but results in both a hit song...and true love.','/j5RN7ciOcgg0mCVJdkY4PsCyFOC.jpg','2020-10-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Country at Heart',631278,3.1583,6.447,'c_ByvUgnGbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23698,_binary '\0','/qYckYSDHjLjdINCpXimlEqhlhhz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10887504',6.5,1626,'en','Love, Fall & Order','When Claire goes home to save her dad\'s annual Fall Fest on her family\'s pumpkin farm, sparks fly with an old rival – the opposing lawyer she now faces in court.','/kM8ZCOHDvRE8Qs499w0tfP06t0a.jpg','2019-10-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Love, Fall & Order',631049,2.8116,6.5,'iiNVcPqOj4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23699,_binary '\0','/xqx0xajcGk7QW6NwrUl2qjiyZEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10887902',5.6,3950,'en','I Used to Go Here','Following the lackluster launch of her debut novel, 35-year-old writer Kate Conklin receives an invitation from her former professor and old crush to speak at her alma mater. With her book tour canceled and her ego deflated, Kate takes the trip, hoping it will give her the morale boost she sorely needs. Instead, she falls into a comical regression—from misadventures with eccentric 20-year-olds to feelings of jealousy toward her former professor’s new favorite student.','/7cN1YBcuBKrxdtxUDig29cXKfKR.jpg','2020-09-17',87,'Released',NULL,'I Used to Go Here',664301,3.1799,5.6,'a9xVoRoWmnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23700,_binary '\0','/yMvSHjRZv90IiJ64S2zRn2csZvA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10888594',1.8,182010,'hi','राधे','As Mumbai’s youth are falling prey to rampant drug abuse, suspended cop Radhe is recalled for a clean-up mission. But Radhe is up against a dangerous new outlaw Rana, who will stop at nothing to rule the city.','/n6kZfTjuTK3P9ByRFTkBlUwdBRA.jpg','2021-05-12',135,'Released',NULL,'Radhe',679844,1.4451,3.8,'n5MVzhwupBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23701,_binary '\0','/mQngZ4DtXqdkX9fOQRsm9iym5OW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10888708',5.7,13647,'en','The Sleepover','Two siblings who discover their seemingly normal mom is a former thief in witness protection. Mom is forced to pull one last job, and the kids team up to rescue her over the course of an action-packed night.','/9iEc34Qje2V3FZnrSXKfZsbiHjW.jpg','2020-08-21',101,'Released','To rescue their parents, they need to get a clue.','The Sleepover',626393,4.6882,6.373,'zqhfd79fbFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23702,_binary '\0','/xRyg0PJ13JrgJ5z7vI8E9kNyeuN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10888824',6.3,3692,'ta','Teddy','Srividya had a minor accident and was taken to a hospital. But while getting treated, she is instead kidnapped with the help of the hospital staff. While her kidnappers keep her in a medically induced coma, she has an out-of-body experience, where she gets into the body of a teddy bear. Shiva, who has a photographic memory, remembers everything in his life. Shiva completed many master\'s degrees and a PhD in no time with this capability. While Shiva saves a teenager from local goons on a public train, the teddy watches him and decided to get help from him. Teddy (as Sri\'s soul) seeks Shiva who helps find her kidnapped body, which they find in Azerbaijan. What happens to Sri and how Shiva defeats the mastermind behind this forms the crux of the story.','/cy9UzsNLgCFcmNdrooO5c4D2eF1.jpg','2021-03-12',130,'Released',NULL,'Teddy',587186,1.7701,6.524,'JjMM0W4NDAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23703,_binary '\0','/6QzkRJsAZrW6VyuNhE2stCmGYqf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10893170',4.6,3440,'ta','பூமி','Bhoominathan, a NASA scientist, returns to his drought-affected village in Tamil Nadu and decides to fight against the evil corporates and corrupt politicians responsible for the plight of his people.','/7nyzGexU2ftCySiwRKqNIJ3CdIJ.jpg','2021-01-14',127,'Released',NULL,'Bhoomi',644468,1.2376,4.472,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23704,_binary '\0','/ljgaL0au2HSXePvSaYsCXB4EzXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10895556',7.1,12827,'hi','रश्मि रॉकेट','Born in the small-town of Kutch, Rashmi overcomes all societal barriers to become a national-level athlete. But her glory is hindered when she is asked to undergo a gender test.','/bsN3BlxpQ77XZH22GAXPFfbTflO.jpg','2021-10-15',129,'Released','Haar jeet toh parinaam hai, Koshish humara kaam hai','Rashmi Rocket',794819,1.3879,6.029,'4TA--toEwwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23705,_binary '\0','/nZUIFepKU3QYwdnfMPN7Oqv6KYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10895576',7.8,46660,'hi','मिमी','An aspiring actress in a small town in Rajasthan agrees to bear a child for a visiting couple seeking a surrogate mother, but her experience takes an unexpected turn when they refuse to have the child anymore.','/AtCUHSf5sG31FL0vugxplft5FXW.jpg','2021-07-26',132,'Released','Nothing like what you\'re expecting!','Mimi',653457,1.9767,6.872,'_sc3HyeNxPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23706,_binary '\0','/2adIpWwFAjAJePFrrfRWeOCfqTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10896398',5.2,2806,'en','Boogie','Alfred “Boogie” Chin is a basketball phenom living in Queens, New York, who dreams of one day playing in the NBA. While his parents pressure him to focus on earning a scholarship to an elite college, Boogie must find a way to navigate a new girlfriend, high school, on-court rivals and the burden of expectation.','/n5xmNu7Lb4IqOahsE8K6W8xBTC7.jpg','2021-03-05',89,'Released','Shoot your shot.','Boogie',631058,2.1737,5.7,'xEpSdb_f1pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23707,_binary '\0','/w80kFufwkLNqoiLJVUBaO9pe1UL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10896634',6.6,7805,'en','Long Story Short','Teddy wakes up the morning after his wedding to discover that he\'s jumped forward a year in his life to his first anniversary. Trapped in an endless cycle of time jumps, transported another year ahead every few minutes, he is faced with a race against time as his life crumbles around him.','/oAJ95mBgB0yAKCS5a3Tw5UxjLEp.jpg','2021-02-11',90,'Released','Love... blink and you\'ll miss it.','Long Story Short',763532,4.3521,6.7,'BZNN9AttdBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23708,_binary '\0','/hnx9IBQEZjiD09HN5m9dVJXShcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10899402',4.2,7763,'en','Hideout','Evading police at a remote farmhouse after fumbling a robbery, four criminals discover that the family living there is not who they appear to be.','/yD4zJJhWDCJRGMyBC3MAajuQxRC.jpg','2021-11-09',114,'Released','No One Can Hide Forever','Hideout',783546,0.9152,5,'DlXFpvUu2Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23709,_binary '\0','/l2Upv3mCWoIYPxBbZYhn0IFbfYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10901588',6.7,1795,'en','ブライトン・ミラクル','Inspired by true events, the story begins with Japanese rugby officials dwelling on a humiliating anniversary, a 145-17 defeat by the New Zealand All Blacks in the 1995 World Cup. Officials question their decision to appoint Eddie Jones, to coach their national team for the 2015 World Cup. Jones plans to defy convention in order to put a stop to Japan being the laughing stock of world rugby.','/8lPJIUe3N8BtqRvqKfj