 complicated undertaking — one that takes her further from her comfort zone than she\'d imagined.','/uWGCcevFpXGo3P7sx5Drofmz9T3.jpg','2008-09-03',109,'Released',NULL,'Salt of This Sea',8932,1.0818,5.8,'1yMAWXLaEyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23714,_binary '\0','/p95z66NPdo66sQ5YJCuf32qocJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1090750',4.8,3508,'en','Dadnapped','Melissa has a bad case of sibling rivalry, only her competition is a fictional character in her father\'s best-selling novel about a teenage super spy. When her father is \"dadnapped\" by a group of overzealous fans, it\'s up to Melissa to help him by tapping her inner superhero.','/xMuG07VLv8YHYT6OURunveDOdO.jpg','2009-02-16',84,'Released','Melissa’s vacation just turned into a rescue mission.','Dadnapped',22084,3.4371,5.3,'SE5uzBQHlaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23715,_binary '\0','/hmEbQB5UlcwobldcSDNlLZiUnmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091191',7.5,326486,'en','Lone Survivor','Four Navy SEALs on a covert mission to neutralize a high-level Taliban operative must make an impossible moral decision in the mountains of Afghanistan that leads them into an enemy ambush. As they confront unthinkable odds, the SEALs must find reserves of strength and resilience to fight to the finish.','/zaBIrloyhGK7iNTZMb3f9SARsl8.jpg','2013-12-24',121,'Released','Based on true acts of courage','Lone Survivor',193756,16.2992,7.429,'0cPJ1ifjBDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23716,_binary '\0','/7e7TU0vx6ZtEudW7FZ82EV1x234.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091207',7,3122,'en','Teenage Dirtbag','A popular high school girl is harassed by a delinquent boy until they are placed in creative writing class together. Through written words, they create a bond, but tragically a bond that cannot withstand her social pressures or his brutal home life.','/52E75FIew5tmVI4QSpFODDuZzTB.jpg','2009-10-20',106,'Released','Death is fleeting... Love lasts forever.','Teenage Dirtbag',33582,1.5432,6.5,'84_v2EOYgbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23717,_binary '\0','/v8r6FWUGmtcHClXgiHhVjZ8ej4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091229',4.4,10701,'hi','चांदनी चौक टू चाइना','A cook from Chandni Chowk gets mistaken for the reincarnation of an ancient peasant warrior by the residents of an oppressed Chinese village.','/tGUVeDAsNArrogQBoV7jVhjkqHh.jpg','2009-01-15',154,'Released',NULL,'Chandni Chowk to China',20002,1.9328,4.919,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23718,_binary '\0','/tOOfXpIKyY80kY108pwSgLozgRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10914452',4.8,5263,'it','Il legame','While visiting her fiancé\'s mother in southern Italy, a woman must fight the mysterious and malevolent curse intent on claiming her daughter.','/w5zUq6OgL87MARwReUUXABx1Xeo.jpg','2020-10-02',93,'Released',NULL,'The Binding',741998,2.2174,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23719,_binary '\0','/cVdYaAQmd5DZNdo0KFJruz7JpUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10915060',6.7,4957,'es','Crímenes de familia','When her son is accused of raping and trying to murder his ex-wife, Alicia embarks on a journey that will change her life forever.','/bw4Sk7pXeZOw65mDWuOIy2oKYdv.jpg','2020-08-20',99,'Released',NULL,'The Crimes That Bind',632618,2.3185,6.468,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23720,_binary '\0','/p4u1TYHqpIsmoNFy5eF53CxMY2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10915286',7.6,20482,'en','Tell Me Who I Am','In this documentary, Alex trusts his twin, Marcus, to tell him about his past after he loses his memory. But Marcus is hiding a dark family secret.','/v5D745JdnDLVaFsp0eTmSoV8OBV.jpg','2019-10-18',85,'Released',NULL,'Tell Me Who I Am',627070,3.567,7.4,'OLjaRjaGjRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23721,_binary '\0','/UJB2XsMvpqDy83vE3I10iEi8h0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10916102',7.1,4441,'hi','बहुत हुआ सम्मान','With their planned heist gone wrong, Bony and Fundoo get inextricably involved in the pursuit of \'Kohinoor\' - quite possibly the biggest scandal the country will ever witness.','/6kDAeEiOkL14fwinIXzqwozjxKT.jpg','2020-10-02',125,'Released',NULL,'Bahut Hua Sammaan',748457,0.9123,6.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23722,_binary '\0','/q7SLqXTuj0W8P7LLbYoQzevu6m9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091617',3.8,12325,'en','Expelled: No Intelligence Allowed','Pro-intelligent design scholars and scientists are often chastised, fired or denied tenured positions by those who believe in Darwin\'s theory of evolution.','/fQgNm7DK6DxfBuSfhQSjtGZYALf.jpg','2008-04-18',90,'Released','Big science has expelled smart new ideas from the classroom...What they forgot is that every generation has its Rebel!','Expelled: No Intelligence Allowed',13359,1.7175,3.9,'7M0DJz5sH-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23723,_binary '\0','/xmwHKkDrTAOFK2odRJFpeKp3eEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10916810',5.4,1697,'fr','Megalomaniac','Felix and Martha, the two offspring of legendary serial murderer The Skinner of Mons, grapple with the grotesque legacy bequeathed to them. While Martha works a menial janitorial job, Felix continues his father\'s reign of terror. But following a brutal attack at work, Martha quickly descends into madness, finding she must come to terms with the infamous blood that flows through her veins.','/8HKjrjwTjvDscC9uZNk6dCRHcfd.jpg','2023-09-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Megalomaniac',841742,1.5154,5.5,'Hdjlt-n6fcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23724,_binary '\0','/4dm60JrE7rCWQvqio1KdzQvfCvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091722',6.8,175444,'en','Adventureland','It\'s the summer of 1987, and recent college grad James Brennan can\'t wait to begin his long-anticipated dream trip to Europe. Unfortunately, James\' plans come to a screeching halt when his parents announce that they are unable to subsidize his trip. Forced to take a job at the local amusement park, James prepares for the worst summer ever, until he finds love with a captivating co-worker named Em.','/eeSJNAR1aWcgANq26KWIHm3cbyB.jpg','2009-04-03',107,'Released','It was the worst job they ever imagined… and the best time of their lives.','Adventureland',16614,6.2956,6.4,'4F--nHysJkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23725,_binary '\0','/1xWY8gN8fTpiunMIKjCJAGOR4zJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091751',5.6,4778,'en','The Longshots','The true story of Jasmine Plummer who, at the age of eleven, became the first female to play in Pop Warner football tournament in its 56-year history.','/mrejNUR8giaAYIJkaLztELRrVXe.jpg','2008-08-22',94,'Released','The new coach has a secret weapon.','The Longshots',13579,2.5338,6.474,'0ls_1-UQVO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23726,_binary '\0','/oMo1C8KgkHpFKReNdRW5oZIHDuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10919074',5,1762,'ja','犬鳴村','After her brother goes missing, a young psychologist visits an infamous haunted and cursed location known as ‘Howling Village’ to investigate his disappearance and uncover her family’s dark history.','/doM8q4gqgLSFDbajjvJTlng4ZkN.jpg','2020-02-07',108,'Released','Horror comes home.','Howling Village',635199,3.081,5.8,'b_aR_H5boag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23727,_binary '\0','/5VPIkLkBHKBd1QvewF4iDRPQK2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10919132',8.1,5034,'kn','ಲವ್ ಮಾಕ್‌ಟೇಲ್‌','Love Mocktail is a 2020 Indian Kannada-language romantic drama film directed by Krishna in his director debut and jointly produced by Krishna, Milana Nagaraj. The film stars Krishna, Milana Nagaraj in the lead roles. The film was released on 31 January 2020.','/2zZHKvynaGFYxzqqWXoKXP3M1WH.jpg','2020-01-31',153,'Released',NULL,'Love Mocktail',672125,2.4111,6.619,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23728,_binary '\0','/hCjCg4dq6SimBHMVhs27jkJVAXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10919240',8,15359,'ml','മാലിക്','A past ridden with crime, death and pain is recounted to Freddy, a juvenile criminal, who has been assigned to eliminate his estranged uncle Sulaiman, an aging patriarch, while behind bars.','/kFBvlw5oiHghwqraQNhqpljsg91.jpg','2021-07-15',161,'Released',NULL,'Malik',665133,1.3417,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23729,_binary '\0','/ngpC8wikrZDnhjkFQMEjWSh7HAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10919380',6.4,83128,'en','Freaky','A mystical, ancient dagger causes a notorious serial killer to magically switch bodies with a 17-year-old girl.','/8xC6QSyxrpm0D5A6iyHNemEWBVe.jpg','2020-11-12',102,'Released','Basic switch. Killer new look.','Freaky',551804,10.0819,6.543,'EqPnIcDW9g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23730,_binary '\0','/9HWn7bsoUPRTP35UmtbLIePOF9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1091992',6,1228,'fr','Cliente','Marco leads a double life. As Marco, he is a construction worker but rich ladies craving sexual excitation know him as Patrick. As Marco he is married to Fanny, an ambitious young woman who has opened her own hairdressing salon in partnership with her friend Rosalie. Marco/Patrick is not a male prostitute at heart: in fact he does the job in order to support his wife\'s business. Which doesn\'t prevent Judith, an elegant tele-shopping presenter who buys his services, from falling in love with him. But when Fanny learns what Marco does and with whom, she first gets mad but soon starts interfering in their affair.','/7VXfz9WqmAqWqW25O5G9YM1yXb6.jpg','2008-10-08',105,'Released',NULL,'A French Gigolo',15460,2.1959,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23731,_binary '\0','/zeSJtqZXLqCVZ3D7G5wfIQYFCCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092005',5.3,10780,'hi','गोलमाल रिटर्न्स','Stuck all night on a yacht with a damsel in distress, Gopal lies to his soap opera junkie wife to avoid drama. This sets off a chain of chaotic events that ultimately land him smack dab in the middle of a police case.','/2X6ZSlnBpgsOpH0ELDraWTD4QO7.jpg','2008-10-29',136,'Released',NULL,'Golmaal Returns',14546,4.3608,5.43,'VItvb2uK_Po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23732,_binary '\0','/2fZSKrMrdxq7hKuK8UTDrWDZClL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092011',5.2,11225,'tr','Kutsal Damacana','Former sailor Fikret is having trouble settling into his new life in Istanbul and has begun to make use of the local church\'s facilities. When priest Artin goes on a trip to Vatican, Fikret starts selling off the church\'s cellar of expensive wines and stays in the priest\'s room at night. Fikret spends most of his remaining time gambling on horse races and lecturing Asim, a naïve young boy working at the car wash located next door to the church who perceives him as a surrogate as a father figure. Fikret and Asim learn of a rich widowed businesswoman, Deniz, who thinks that her sister, Selen, has had a spell put upon her and is prepared to pay anything to have it lifted. Fikret decides to go to Deniz\'s house disguised as a priest but gets more than he bargained for.','/iWXTV2ElMaxBl9HsiQFJCrfEvpk.jpg','2007-12-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Kutsal Damacana',53298,0.7575,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23733,_binary '\0','/uAX6NW8kFFrGmc0nJTWL7ajymQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092016',7.2,8969,'pt','Meu Nome não é Johnny','The true story of João Guilherme Estrella (\"Johnny\"), a young middle-class bon vivant who became a big-time cocaine dealer in Rio de Janeiro in the early 1990s.','/mKDKutX0bCvg401k68U9Nt7EG0y.jpg','2008-01-04',124,'Released','He had everything but limits','My Name Ain\'t Johnny',17358,2.1632,7.088,'hitjyeros2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23734,_binary '\0','/hHzNYDhICUwPtpwM4gVT4mlG3ez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092019',7.1,3543,'nl','TBS','A man convicted of killing his own father and sister escapes from a long-stay criminal hospital to track down his estranged mother, whom he believes can prove his innocence.','/si4L3xy6GM7NMVcbqYPEjHqpOWx.jpg','2008-01-31',90,'Released',NULL,'Nothing to Lose',7267,1.2237,6.658,'wstgZwdTw2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23735,_binary '\0','/vKF9jWhyKgblygDmqkcaDdnLclq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10920190',3.3,3459,'en','Righteous Villains','A modern day tale of good vs evil, secret societies, sorcery and Satan.','/jTUmpv5yrf91mXllwySJXIk2hKP.jpg','2020-12-01',76,'Released','Before the Apocalypse, there will be war.','Righteous Villains',780822,1.3037,2.7,'paxa_Wa6a-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23736,_binary '\0','/t7XMsc1mZUmEkdjGuiW4N078TQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092021',7.4,2848,'hu','A nyomozó','Tibor Malkáv is an andaverage 37-year-old man, who though not rich, leads a comfortable and uncomplicated life. All this changes when he finds out his mother is dying of cancer and the cost of surgery is well beyond his means. A one-eyed man known as the Cyclops offers Tibor a solution to his financial woes, however, there is a catch and Tibor has to kill someone in return. What follows is a chain reaction that has long-lasting and unexpected results.','/rxgDkvaV9RtTDoM0Br45i84lnVo.jpg','2008-07-10',107,'Released',NULL,'The Investigator',40895,0.8893,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23737,_binary '\0','/kl3rMfydlxyLDsZidSUCEWm8K0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1092026',6.9,285357,'en','Paul','For the past 60 years, a space-traveling smart-ass named Paul has been locked up in a top-secret military base, advising world leaders about his kind. But when he worries he’s outlived his usefulness and the dissection table is drawing uncomfortably close, Paul escapes on the first RV that passes by his compound in Area 51. Fortunately, it contains the two earthlings who are most likely to rescue and harbor an alien on the run.','/dKhexH8nS08lVlSmwSs00cHFxbY.jpg','2011-02-14',104,'Released','Who\'s up for a close encounter?','Paul',39513,11.56,6.75,'16Jfld1-kOI','YouTube','Trailer','2