ind themselves falling for each other.','/qR7u96cUlmZ7B9jB8Yyv0teszrm.jpg','2019-11-28',88,'Released','Nothing unimportant ever happens at the Plaza.','Christmas at the Plaza',630916,2.5911,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23742,_binary '\0','/8UpCgQG4b5JVAEdjTJJKkuupe7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10922632',6.2,1249,'en','Angel Falls: A Novel Holiday','Hannah is a book editor and she must work with her former rival Ryan to help a potential writer find her way. However, life seems to have other plans for Hannah as Angel Anthony reminds the duo about the miracle of Christmas and the value of community.','/50SEuVmS3uK5amzHGzxJntYwY9r.jpg','2019-12-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Angel Falls: A Novel Holiday',630920,1.9123,6.3,'UIp_G0xf3Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23743,_binary '\0','/a4sgSnNU2hecZ1TzBSsm3Kt9yb8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10922658',6.8,2745,'en','Christmas Under the Stars','When Nick is fired from his high-powered investment firm at Christmastime, he takes a job at a Christmas tree lot. There, he meets Julie, an astronomy teacher who’s always looked to the stars for hope. As the Christmas spirit washes over him—and he begins falling for Julie—the once self-centered Nick discovers the joy of helping others.','/zjNW72nSDBNYduhD1wf0EBWVhNl.jpg','2019-11-16',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Under the Stars',629985,1.9594,6.5,'knF-OXlZHVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23744,_binary '\0','/29byWUx6rSB24PJKGIB2H6CvC6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10925434',6.6,1509,'en','Holiday Hearts','While planning an annual Christmas party, Peyton is forced together with Ben to care for a friend\'s daughter. While finding their Christmas spirit, will there be some romance along the way?','/2Nryi61rn5hAIZlKWl6qw6mHsb1.jpg','2019-11-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Holiday Hearts',638806,1.335,6.1,'IJWOTp9ta6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23745,_binary '\0','/kuEjG5Zt5HwGlCgHyYb