 much more personally connected to the history of the club than she could ever imagine.','/4ZocdxnOO6q2UbdKye2wgofLFhB.jpg','2020-11-13',98,'Released','Hit like a girl.','Chick Fight',682377,4.5524,5.8,'qHFssXdRGQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23780,_binary '\0','/a8Bbbpqi6sd58Nr4BzbMQa8VFPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10944596',6.7,6609,'en','Here Today','Veteran comedy writer Charlie Berns, who is slowly but surely losing his grip on reality, befriends a talented young New York street singer Emma Payge. Together, they form an unlikely yet hilarious and touching friendship that kicks the generation gap aside and redefines the meaning of love and trust.','/xp64qD0V9SRE3jU6sEtQufAzYRk.jpg','2021-05-07',117,'Released','You never know who\'s going to change your life.','Here Today',711475,5.7591,6.9,'U3v8n_8-QqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23781,_binary '\0','/dVOlJVHYRWx7DhMQRNLnbf5bT1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10944760',6.4,67673,'fr','Titane','A woman with a metal plate in her head from a childhood car accident embarks on a bizarre journey, bringing her into contact with a firefighter who\'s reunited with his missing son after 10 years.','/mBlpouG3gqB8WLdP65LCOXb3jFb.jpg','2021-07-14',108,'Released','Titane: A metal highly resistant to heat and corrosion, with high tensile strength alloys.','Titane',630240,6.2641,6.331,'AYm2RETn_oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23782,_binary '\0','/vo9MRyCMBAdSqZgkI70AfVg8ISI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10945274',6.4,3174,'fr','Mystère','Stéphane decides to move to the beautiful mountains of Cantal in order to reconnect with his 8-year-old daughter, Victoria, who has been silent since her mother\'s disappearance. During a walk in the forest, a shepherd gives Victoria a puppy named \"Mystery\" who will gradually give her a taste for life. But very quickly, Stéphane discovers that the animal is in reality a wolf… Despite the warnings and the danger of this situation, he cannot bring himself to separate his daughter from this seemingly harmless ball of hair.','/xXZ4yhyss7DGrp7a1EVHaAStfwr.jpg','2021-12-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Vicky and Her Mystery',754067,3.2882,7.105,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23783,_binary '\0','/lKvMfb4A7AHy4UzIWzFR8vJbaeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10945288',6.3,5073,'en','Le Loup et le Lion','After her grandfather\'s death, 20-year-old Alma decides to go back to her childhood home - a little island in the heart of the majestic Canadian forest. Whilst there, she rescues two helpless cubs: a wolf and a lion. They forge an inseparable bond, but their world soon collapses as the forest ranger discovers the animals and takes them away. The two cub brothers must now embark on a treacherous journey across Canada to be reunited with one another and Alma once more.','/x3JsrunysUwsIV9XS7hQtZG4knm.jpg','2021-10-13',99,'Released','An unlikely friendship. An incredible adventure.','The Wolf and the Lion',780382,5.5254,7.5,'R2jpRwSFenU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23784,_binary '\0','/wZo7uXSGZHdd1d4Dj0LGKkWFqT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1094594',8.4,8393,'is','Heima','Ethereal post-rock pioneers Sigur Rós play a string of impromptu gigs in their native Iceland after finishing a world tour in 2006. As they travel through the country, the band visits a wide variety of venues, from a large outdoor festival to a coffee shop.','/hopfH0rWbTTNYJmEb8R07f3ZUzc.jpg','2007-09-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Heima',14793,1.6943,7.7,'EuftN2ViiN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23785,_binary '\0','/pNaAm9WiwrNEHvfeBzTjcQs7iPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1094627',7.3,2493,'fa','بودا از شرم فرو ریخت','A young girl zealously wants to go to school and learn to read and write. Almost everywhere she is met with hostility or indifference. The only young boy who takes her to his school is thrown out by the teacher, because helping her prevented him from arriving in time. On her way home she and other girls are taken as prisoners by boys playing as Taliban fighters. They tear her school book to pieces and threaten to stone their female captives.','/lFXFC2Sh7yalggvA4jVXVv2Uewe.jpg','2007-09-09',81,'Released',NULL,'Buddha Collapsed Out of Shame',61820,1.5877,7.141,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23786,_binary '\0','/z85WQHW3KeYg9e0wPpJBFjoXKp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1094661',6.8,4010,'en','Coco Chanel','Fashion icon Coco Chanel, steeped in wealth and fame, still issues game-changing designs and collections. The audience is taken backwards in time to the woman\'s upbringing in an orphanage, and traces her path to ubiquity as it winds through poverty, wars, doomed romances, and rather glamorous betrayals.','/bhEJi25lP4HPntBpO48ZO93D4dT.jpg','2008-09-13',139,'Released',NULL,'Coco Chanel',24475,2.3666,6.6,'kvdA-XZXgyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23787,_binary '\0','/uTwGIzz6KQ8c0hYEqfNlSkIMLkf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1094666',6.9,1941,'en','Hamill','A coming of age drama following the life of Matt Hamill, the first deaf wrestler to win a National Collegiate Wrestling Championship.','/iL6kBELX23KEBvL5Ro1EFEdWOWP.jpg','2010-10-26',108,'Released','He knew he could be a champion. They knew he could be much more.','The Hammer',74447,1.4514,6.8,'neTdq1lHyxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23788,_binary '\0','/9UZhdhsuVrgpzgav24jIlrReQsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1094668',6,1637,'fr','Jusqu\'à toi','Jack is encouraged to take the romantic Paris vacation he won, despite just being dumped by his girlfriend. His trip soon devolves into chaos and adventure, when his luggage is swapped for a French businesswoman\'s belongings who soon takes a liking to his belongings -- especially his shoes -- and sets out to find him.','/8D4amgkaqVGIe50oE8wm2b57tox.jpg','2009-07-29',81,'Released',NULL,'Every Jack Has a Jill',32338,2.3206,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23789,_binary '\0','/o33acwn7KliNpJRbjy4FrMSpiQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10946934',6.5,1759,'es','Como caído del cielo','Returning to Earth as an imitator, the legendary Mexican artist Pedro Infante must prove that he is no longer a womanizer to enter paradise.','/o9cSEHrXzPOO4OIoT9yrdxc216w.jpg','2019-12-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Out of the Clear Blue Sky',654299,3.9353,8.282,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23790,_binary '\0','/wEVSupeNO7EjjCFieEv2zt4oJei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10948718',7.1,12586,'es','El robo del siglo','In 2006, a group of thieves performed what is considered one of the most famous and smart bank heists in the history of Argentina. How they robbed the Rio bank is as surprising as what happened afterwards. This is their story.','/1zL4VCVin4S8kOXhszMDqfwWPCM.jpg','2020-01-16',114,'Released','The Story Of The Theft That Made History','The Heist of the Century',609242,6.5744,7.7,'u3rtVNSC-FU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23791,_binary '\0','/tceubGZTFAwdRH1dqXf9UBxZqkf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10948820',6.2,1419,'it','I predatori','This is the story of two completely opposite households: the Pavone are intellectual and bourgeois, the Vismara are proletarian and fascists. They are two tribes sharing the same jungle: Rome. A trivial accident brings these two poles together. The madness of a 25-year old youth will set them on a collision course, discovering the cards to reveal that everyone has a secret. People are never what they seem – but we are all predators in the end.','/kkXak83SO83ASJoSyu7Nlf9MSXI.jpg','2020-10-22',109,'Released',NULL,'The Predators',624484,2.597,6.7,'OUzg-TP-z_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23792,_binary '\0','/zzdYUb09RM3OSVA5bOihONC1XQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10949028',5.8,2085,'en','As They Made Us','Abigail, a divorced mother of two, is struggling to balance the dynamics within her dysfunctional family as she attempts to cultivate new love.','/qypGmqMTIT6PmDzmM3i2Aexaxug.jpg','2022-04-08',96,'Released','If you don\'t laugh, you\'ll cry.','As They Made Us',644100,3.0529,5.3,'u8fcdbzThrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23793,_binary '\0','/brH3hR0w3LniremsJHJ5NPEBtCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10949778',5.2,4503,'en','100 Days to Live','When a serial killer abducts a young woman’s fiancé, she must race against the clock to discover the identity of the killer, and more importantly – his motive.','/eB6nWq0dd3VGtJVKeFdYMfZ3alb.jpg','2019-10-17',90,'Released','Time is running out.','100 Days to Live',639133,1.7935,5.4,'Ex3YYeR5SLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23794,_binary '\0','/67A2glwulDwV5p14RPFRnMb15eQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10950320',5.5,10015,'en','Rumble Through the Dark','In the dark landscape of the Mississippi Delta, a former bare-knuckle fighter must win one last fight to pay off his debts to the local mob boss and save his childhood home—the stakes nothing less than life or death.','/oz0ELid5Vg9VJxgFfwA93STzj40.jpg','2023-11-03',116,'Released','There is no in between.','Rumble Through the Dark',844416,4.2862,6.3,'qtmxg3QgW5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23795,_binary '\0','/tZF23SGsjhvzZvtorHLni1BcYYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1095174',5.7,26651,'en','New in Town','Lucy Hill is an ambitious up-and-coming executive living in Miami. She loves her shoes, her cars, and climbing the corporate ladder. When she is offered a temporary assignment — in the middle of nowhere — to restructure a manufacturing plant, she jumps at the opportunity, knowing that a big promotion is close at hand. What begins as a straightforward assignment becomes a life-changing experience as Lucy discovers greater meaning in her life and, most unexpectedly, the man of her dreams.','/OMCGtMmmBE9NwmawLGZlaErdLk.jpg','2009-01-30',97,'Released','She\'s an executive on the move. But her career is taking her a little farther than she expected.','New in Town',14536,4.5529,5.8,'_K_JXt8qJqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23796,_binary '\0','/jJlM7XxfWdAhWx6BeqFYJWIceId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10952042',6.1,1312,'en','It\'s Beginning to Look a Lot Like Christmas','When a New England Christmas decorating competition searches for the town with the most Christmas spirit, the Mayors of East and West Riverton go all out to get their towns to the top of the holiday heap.','/vYEpId8nCN9wcE4cXSSqG3cw82p.jpg','2019-12-22',90,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Beginning to Look a Lot Like Christmas',630923,2.2364,6.2,'T40kagQELPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23797,_binary '\0','/abF5X1C7KMJEJnbB7KidfHOIszj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1095217',6.6,85290,'en','Bad Lieutenant: Port of Call New Orleans','Terrence McDonagh is a New Orleans Police sergeant, who receives a medal and a promotion to lieutenant for heroism during Hurricane Katrina. Due to his heroic act, McDonagh injures his back and becomes addicted to prescription pain medication. He then finds himself involved with a drug dealer who is suspected of murdering a family of African immigrants.','/zRULXsd0rb1lVfnSyQkYPi2nLcB.jpg','2009-09-11',122,'Released','The only criminal he can\'t catch is himself.','Bad Lieutenant: Port of Call New Orleans',11699,9.5842,6.2,'R0zPHEAphTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23798,_binary '\0','/dIFmlaFdfsxngMoepdPpwCI3KFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10952782',5.6,6959,'es','Malasaña 32','Malasaña neighborhood, Madrid, Spain, 1976. While political turmoil ravages the streets all over the country, the Olmedo family arrives in the big city and settles into their new apartment. They soon discover that they are not the only ones roaming its corridors.','/neCS8vPAtsj9cJDGNaEH76ImSd7.jpg','2020-01-17',105,'Released','Meet your new neighbours','32 Malasana Street',639798,3.9186,6.454,'I3gRqsw-nHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23799,_binary '\0','/gtBnA3NtWd505YCeTuKDsT8IC8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1095421',7.5,1304,'ur','Ramchand Pakistani','Based on a actual events, the story is about a Pakistani Hindu boy and his father who accidentally cross the border into India from their village in Pakistan at a time of extreme war like tension between the 2 countries and end up spending 5 years in an Indian prison while the mother left behind wonders what has happened to them.','/eA1JGt1FoGhCHTHuspQR4g6wysN.jpg','2008-04-20',105,'Released','He crossed one line. And three lives changed forever.','Ramchand Pakistani',185345,0.7142,8.1,'yINsUwSqshM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23800,_binary '\0','/k8ALJxeyPPfwJiLGCGWPWAXDcVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1095423',5.7,3474,'da','Rejsen til Saturn','A Danish crew of misfits travel to Saturn in search for natural resources. However, the planet is colonized by a ruthless army of Aliens that turn their eye on Earth and invade Denmark. Thus, the crew change their mission to liberate Denmark.','/lB8iKvq6UTDvp1C60JcALvdH1gX.jpg','2008-09-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Journey to Saturn',16016,1.4552,5.8,'v5djq2HCugU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23801,_binary '\0','/5oHpey5QY41OyrNkgutHbovMltY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1095442',7.3,6281,'en','Goodbye Solo','A man planning to commit suicide hires a taxi driver to take him to his jumping-off point.','/hmM9AS5hzxjjzViY5WkJD4O8BgS.jpg','2009-03-27',91,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye Solo',21371,2.0219,6.9,'U5IGC59Q9y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23802,_binary '\0','/m8JTwHFwX7I7JY5fPe4SjqejWag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10954600',6,278883,'en','Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania','Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope\'s parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott\'s daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.','/qnqGbB22YJ7dSs4o6M7exTpNxPz.jpg','2023-02-15',125,'Released','Witness the beginning of a new dynasty.','Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania',640146,24.1276,6.213,'5WfTEZJnv_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23803,_binary '\0','/32yqxyLlWcO81UCx51Jfq9aeJdA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10954652',5.8,186569,'en','Old','A group of families on a tropical holiday discover that the secluded beach where they are staying is somehow causing them to age rapidly – reducing their entire lives into a single day.','/vclShucpUmPhdAOmKgf3B3Z4POD.jpg','2021-07-21',108,'Released','It\'s only a matter of time.','Old',631843,11.9466,6.3,'A4U2pMRV9_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23804,_binary '\0','/iXU87IdtNsYt7n6OigPJBDdbFf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10954718',6.3,14632,'en','Dog Man','When a faithful police dog and his human police officer owner are injured together on the job, a harebrained but life-saving surgery fuses the two of them together and Dog Man is born. Dog Man is sworn to protect and serve—and fetch, sit and roll over. As Dog Man embraces his new identity and strives to impress his Chief, he must stop the pretty evil plots of feline supervillain Petey the Cat.','/89wNiexZdvLQ41OQWIsQy4O6jAQ.jpg','2025-01-24',89,'Released','Part dog. Part man. All hero.','Dog Man',774370,11.4559,7.4,'QaJbAennB_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23805,_binary '\0','/yRutvYkM3OP8N9oqqfjSK1VC7fs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10954984',6.8,323011,'en','Nope','Residents in a lonely gulch of inland California bear witness to an uncanny, chilling discovery.','/AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg','2022-07-20',130,'Released','What’s a bad miracle?','Nope',762504,16.0383,6.83,'HUgmq_8PlRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23806,_binary '\0','/86akrZmEWmzkNHb6GA7ZWJf2rkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10955148',4.6,3044,'en','Rising Free','Amidst the rugged Oregon territory, Rising Free is a visual masterpiece that showcases the harrowing journey of a young woman running from the throes of prejudice. Taken in by a gracious pioneer family, she learns to stand in newfound hope but is soon tested by unforeseen tragedies. In a vast and unforgiving wilderness, she must embrace this foreign hope within or surrender to shadows of darkness that loom over her.','/9Pp4r55rdscI5eMrrN4zVnTuiPr.jpg','2019-12-06',109,'Released','Out of darkness she found hope to rise again','Rising Free',649395,1.0534,4.7,'Rehb2qYDoxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23807,_binary '\0','/vQi3ShvWL02YTexH9l5yDRByWly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10955578',4.8,2564,'ta','ஆக்‌ஷன்','An Indian army officer goes after the mastermind behind a terror attack that also resulted in personal loss to him.','/9PpaVbWWyVYJZSdof8P3lIDylbE.jpg','2019-11-15',158,'Released',NULL,'Action',623364,1.5503,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23808,_binary '\0','/fm30gY7bWBYRlDMAy5deIb6wspK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10957044',3.6,2622,'en','Deadlock','Mack is a former soldier who, after the war, moved to a town with a nuclear power plant, where nearly everybody works. Life is peaceful for him there, until a gang of mercenaries led by Ron storm the reactor and take everybody hostage, including a group of children on a school trip. Now Mack is in a race against the clock and must use his military training to defeat Ron before he puts the reactor into meltdown. Along the way he discovers Ron’s motive, which unravels a greater secret Mack’s town is hiding.','/nNZOJnWWaCnfst7LIU8dOuB9h8q.jpg','2021-12-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Deadlock',718949,2.7942,5.1,'jlYkQf_QlK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23809,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10958102',4.1,1576,'en','Our Scripted Life','A daytime television actor hatches a plan to produce a film starring him and his co-star, hoping it will make her fall in love with him.','/zDUQbFKGAa2CwLpHgNaL63WYuyV.jpg','2020-05-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Our Scripted Life',671194,0.8531,1,'9chQm0RvCJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23810,_binary '\0','/jH1f7VaYtMCyqgJRoG7lCg8krxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10958282',6.4,2412,'fr','Banlieusards','Noumouké, from the suburb of Paris, is about to decide which brother\'s foot steps to follow - the lawyer student Soulaymaan or the gangster Demba.','/rhOFpiEDA9S2rmuz5990KBjLgcP.jpg','2019-10-12',95,'Released',NULL,'Street Flow',614488,3.2952,6.914,'Ui9woY0lHKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23811,_binary '\0','/mVdQlzKKLXlErVSqmBwgtwAqF4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10960102',6.4,1668,'it','E noi come stronzi rimanemmo a guardare','Arturo loses his tech job to an algorithm he created and ends up working as a delivery man, monitored by an unreasonably strict app. His only solace comes from Stella, a hologram-for-girlfriend whose free trial is running out. Unable to renew the subscription due to his financial uncertainty, Arturo decides to take a stand.','/fliDojAYPtosZrKSlXmTMaQ37zN.jpg','2021-10-25',108,'Released',NULL,'On Our Watch',647809,1.7646,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23812,_binary '\0','/vl8c6eG2i61nqKnU1uXOlYvRalG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10962368',5.3,41790,'en','Things Heard & Seen','A young woman discovers that both her husband and their new home harbor sinister secrets after they leave Manhattan for small-town life.','/9tSkNmGt1K5Lgf0L0BTHHYJNz0W.jpg','2021-04-29',120,'Released','Mistrust your senses.','Things Heard & Seen',631060,7.4633,5.7,'HCAaonjgDEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23813,_binary '\0','/wUwFMnbFxuDfcRSGGT7QQIGDRrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10963926',4.8,4685,'en','Two Witches','A matriarchal witch passes on her sinister inheritance to her grand-daughter, triggering the most horrific curses.','/a6JHz23BOfbzWxL5JsrBWQHqMuh.jpg','2023-03-02',95,'Released','Witches don\'t die before leaving their legacy...','Two Witches',785759,2.8408,5.958,'-VXQPfgH_uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23814,_binary '\0','/eqL1qVqynUPw3pfaJ7u99m1bZPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964168',6.2,1519,'en','Twinkle All the Way','To pull off a spectacular Christmas-themed wedding, a wedding planner joins forces with the co-owner of a family-run Christmas decoration and house-lighting company.','/qHdX3ws03MPW3DdUM4SFY5Lhz2S.jpg','2019-11-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Twinkle All the Way',627470,2.7866,6.3,'wWdXx_Db68w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23815,_binary '\0','/wK4v4t33NW1JBR06Q2bzeZloQXt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964346',6.3,1506,'en','Grounded for Christmas','When a winter storm hits Cleveland and grounds flights, the nearby hotels quickly fill up with stranded travelers. Nina, a pilot, reluctantly agrees to let her arrogant but charming fellow pilot, Brady, stay at her nearby parents\' home. But when they discover her family is hosting a tree trimming party that night and that her ex will be there, Brady pretends to be her boyfriend to help her out.','/4SIcl29jOLaiAHxXkHpBsfVZvlz.jpg','2019-12-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Grounded for Christmas',627478,2.0601,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23816,_binary '\0','/4CGBZuEfG2VmxDb2mNtQdHwPurq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964430',7,28001,'hi','थप्पड़','A young woman\'s life is shattered into pieces when her husband slaps her at a party, causing her to question what this relationship stands for.','/nSOgDTClgfbIOBgv4Itf3GSEkWA.jpg','2020-02-27',144,'Released','Bas itni si baat?','Thappad',668435,1.4307,7,'OONSPIaFy8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23817,_binary '\0','/6vno6PtfMenTlHPrCRmg6DZFROb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964468',6.2,10158,'hi','शकुंतला देवी','Based on the life of Shakuntala Devi who is a well-known mathematical genius and calculating progidy from India. She has been nicknamed \'Human Computer\' because of her extraordinary talent and skill in solving complex mathematical problems without any mechanical aid.','/8KBmoMHfdrjednxWAvkh7ARhrRJ.jpg','2020-07-31',127,'Released','Human Computer','Shakuntala Devi',679045,1.3721,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23818,_binary '\0','/jaeMl8p5BAmhkBV8lO25XIHPOyi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964530',6.5,4402,'en','The Furnace','To escape the outback, a young Afghan cameleer falls in with a mysterious bushman on the run with stolen Crown gold.','/frcZigoOJhom4UM6eJ1E5VO0Fyp.jpg','2020-12-10',116,'Released','There is no Grace of God here. Just the land, and all its spoils.','The Furnace',728136,1.954,6.76,'N8DT_zVzxhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23819,_binary '\0','/srnFenJObmgXcMC5gaFI7f3Aidt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10964992',6,3071,'en','Agatha and the Curse of Ishtar','On an archaeological dig in Iraq, author Agatha Christie uncovers a series of murders.','/vpKLc5LCxuI7VJ57ZYIpAEpF0bp.jpg','2019-12-15',95,'Released','Has Agatha met her match?','Agatha and the Curse of Ishtar',655730,3.1191,5.7,'YX-xoD73B7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23820,_binary '\0','/vlQmFjAPrCdzGhzBxhsBTakhmiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10969656',5.6,2191,'en','Dirty Sexy Saint','Clay Kincaid hates the nickname \'Saint\', he got for being too kind to stray animals and desperate people. Especially when it comes to women. With a rough and damaged past that has left him jaded, he doesn\'t do committed relationships. This is before he meets Samantha Jamieson, an heiress turned runaway in need of help. When she starts to work as a waitress at his bar, he discovers that she is someone truly special and amazing… someone that could warm his damaged heart.','/x96lVzJuFqGinfsG0EcwYwBmuom.jpg','2019-12-08',104,'Released','Of all the bars in all of Chicago, she walks into his.','Dirty Sexy Saint',655355,3.1219,6.3,'sUjXjC3Q2Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23821,_binary '\0','/8jDvAbxbwnVtErXS4rP8en8KBpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1096997',4.5,2231,'en','The Pagan Queen','A visionary Slavic queen and her faithful allies draw on everything in their power to overthrow the queen\'s despotic husband.','/sYJeGbyp2QMAgrIDEgozsuODly1.jpg','2009-09-08',95,'Released','The epic true story of...','The Pagan Queen',46694,1.1631,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23822,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097000',2.9,2261,'en','The Falling','Amidst his broken life, Police Officer Grayson Reed is about to be thrown into the middle of a feud between the five angels of Heaven and the leader of Hell. As faith ends in the world around him, Grayson will be faced with an ultimate choice that could decide the fate of our world.','/qQrG7F6yBq3Mby3xQBg6VnWCGdn.jpg','2006-11-26',114,'Released','...No Longer A Question of Faith','The Falling',983904,0.6133,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23823,_binary '\0','/jfPlonHxKl6Vsygu3TLrL9io5IJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097013',5.7,11501,'en','Next Day Air','Two inept criminals are mistakenly delivered a package of cocaine and think they\'ve hit the jackpot, triggering a series of events that changes ten people\'s lives forever.','/wLNzff5sWBWrKU4EI5gf4ZhUBKs.jpg','2009-02-06',84,'Released','It\'s all in the delivery.','Next Day Air',18065,2.4856,5.143,'nr9tEYi6DIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23824,_binary '\0','/dVRAaw1XWM6kiJQIJISSfKA0eNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097239',7.7,4131,'en','Joy Division','A chronological account of the influential late 1970s English rock band.','/si2Kgb6NRkIUmI5NfWQH1Y8TBVV.jpg','2009-01-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Joy Division',15260,1.3162,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23825,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097256',7.8,1509,'zh','请投我一票','At Evergreen Primary School in Wuhan, China, a Grade 3 class learns what democracy is when an election for class monitor is being held. Three children are chosen by the teacher as candidates and they have a few days to campaign and convince their classmates to vote for them. The little candidates are seen at school and at home, where their parents do their best to make sure their child will win the election.','/jIcEOqPZr2yWbG48hVPibK8sucg.jpg','2007-09-06',58,'Released',NULL,'Please Vote for Me',38052,0.979,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23826,_binary '\0','/ikHvLZnfhzIQcQuW3QDiKDgSEDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10973118',5.8,3462,'ta','நெற்றிக்கண்','A cat-and-mouse game engages between a blind woman and a serial killer when the former becomes the witness of a kidnap performed by the latter.','/ptBc2wSha97kvWIDxi0zZX91Zir.jpg','2021-08-13',146,'Released',NULL,'Netrikann',791315,1.3673,5.885,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23827,_binary '\0','/fTKp5t05CVlFRlrLyySHpWFWMGe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10975520',7.1,1819,'cn','叔・叔','One day Pak, a taxi driver who refuses to retire, meets Hoi, a retired single father, in a park. Although both are secretly gay, they are proud of the families they have created through hard work and determination. Yet in that brief initial encounter, something is unleashed in them which had been suppressed for so many years. As both men recount and recall their personal histories, they also contemplate a possible future together.','/jH9tcfk6UsJ8xwRU4ZKPMrCxhcM.jpg','2020-02-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Twilight\'s Kiss',630878,1.4335,6.8,'pvfasD3SKos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23828,_binary '\0','/h5CgKFEvFEcexzOr9KrgcUsrTj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10975604',6,3522,'pt','O Menino Que Matou Meus Pais','Based on one of the most shocking and gruesome murder cases in Brazil, the film presents de Suzane von Richthofen\'s point of view of the events that led to the death of her parents.','/h9onDM7U8KCv2nXQNCCayuGzt4z.jpg','2021-09-24',88,'Released','The crime that shocked the country.','The Boy Who Killed My Parents',800305,1.7504,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23829,_binary '\0','/y24Sf4aManpX9HewtV9oOTMrdJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10976066',5.5,1731,'ml','സൂഫിയും സുജാതയും','Dr. Rajeev and his wife SUJATA come from Dubai to participate in the last rituals of Sujata\'s friend and ex love affair who was a Sufi. The events which happen when they land in the village forms the rest of the plot.','/5v32Sj1OwKLcFARvO1YBUF2FqTZ.jpg','2020-07-03',121,'Released',NULL,'Sufiyum Sujatayum',718659,1.3067,4.265,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23830,_binary '\0','/uFsJQVQnWyRX35jaIL493IcEoiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097643',6.8,11976,'en','Fifty Dead Men Walking','It\'s 1989, and in a Belfast torn apart by conflict and terrorism, petty criminal Marty McGartland is recruited by the British police to infiltrate the IRA. Guided by Special Forces officer \'Fergus\', McGartland gains unparalleled insight into the organisation\'s dealings, providing his British handler with priceless, life-saving information. Based on a true story.','/ahHguslRzE5Qgx8KTJvlDeSEJE2.jpg','2008-09-10',117,'Released','When you cross the line there\'s no going back.','Fifty Dead Men Walking',17622,2.9985,6.3,'pUzFs3rbwDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23831,_binary '\0','/kXKPpMIwSTQT8j1GDm0xumqmsx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1097649',6.7,2031,'en','The Russell Girl','Sarah Russell, a 23-year-old aspiring medical school student, visits her loving family to share some important news, but instead finds herself attempting to finally confront a difficult period from her past.','/kJhxajiBsW3BiH7qzLyubaBxiOQ.jpg','2008-01-27',90,'Released','She had almost lost hope.','The Russell Girl',18445,1.8878,6.1,'BV1hwGB9Nx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23832,_binary '\0','/vx4bevtt3ZVgezPZsuiVxm90l5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10978398',5.6,5353,'es','Hasta el cielo','A commentary on Spanish society dressed as a thriller about the misadventures of a gang of young petty criminals after the real estate crash.','/pUT5Fa1TskzkTmATpYGiW49PTEg.jpg','2020-12-18',121,'Released',NULL,'Sky High',651589,2.5688,6.1,'AAgy0loDzdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23833,_binary '\0','/qnrraeUQhRRvlZdB9DIFM5J6OYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10980638',5.4,1576,'en','Devil\'s Peak','In North Carolina\'s Appalachian Mountains, eighteen-year-old Jacob McNeely is torn between appeasing his meth-dealing kingpin father and leaving the mountains forever with the girl he loves.','/rtlxPYO9zSSz5cv9a1UEna2RtQA.jpg','2023-02-17',98,'Released',NULL,'Devil\'s Peak',920654,3.1293,5.5,'uG9oFlpUBJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23834,_binary '\0','/pi9dwpXCPH9z9XVAsQ1OthWN1CM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10981012',6.3,2750,'ta','வீரமே வாகை சூடும்','Following his sister\'s strange death, a hot-headed police aspirant begins his investigation for the true cause of his sister\'s death. During this time, he meets a ruthless entrepreneur named Nedunchezhiyan. What is the connection between Nedunchezhiyan and his sister\'s tragedy?','/lokTyhRjuQpfBHjZv4KLGvuc0NK.jpg','2022-02-04',165,'Released',NULL,'Veerame Vaagai Soodum',828827,1.5273,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23835,_binary '\0','/k1jWHgAICsNGM5roYcIwaDpryYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10981202',6.8,2360,'ja','空の青さを知る人よ','High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister\'s burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane\'s ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke \"Shinno\" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters\' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.','/c2UTAPcfIrvgDVYzpX4R8RSV6tF.jpg','2019-10-11',108,'Released',NULL,'Her Blue Sky',615165,4.2809,7.4,'YGzSrGnIm5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23836,_binary '\0','/qYqzB5n8cEueyGbAlRCQq63AFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10981304',7.2,3495,'te','శ్రీ‌కారం','Karthik hails from Rayalaseema and is doing well in his career as a project lead in an IT company. Wanting to pursue the family’s vocation of farming, he quits his job and returns back to his village. Will he be able to bring back lost glory to the profession?','/3csTaJ5fZ0XyCegpGP3MjmGieWI.jpg','2021-03-11',132,'Released',NULL,'Sreekaram',726027,1.3709,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23837,_binary '\0','/wnyHmzdSevXD1c2o6nUnVIRguW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1098226',7.2,3311,'ja','転々','A thug offers to pay a law student\'s gambling debt if the student will accompany him on a trip across Tokyo.','/yjB0njL8aBTPeVeoGlnNataDxiJ.jpg','2007-11-10',101,'Released',NULL,'Adrift in Tokyo',14525,2.1583,7.1,'3Om6r_Ocfps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23838,_binary '\0','/5sXBW3XYwCA3FZxVoaIVI1hGOK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1098327',2.5,85505,'en','Dragonball Evolution','On his 18th birthday, Goku receives a mystical Dragonball as a gift from his grandfather. There are only six others like it in the whole world, and legend has it that whoever possesses all seven will be granted one perfect wish. When the arrival of a dark force triggers a tragedy, Goku and his companions are propelled into an epic quest to collect the seven Dragonballs and save the Earth from destruction.','/sunS9xhPnFNP5wlOWrvbpBteAB.jpg','2009-03-12',85,'Released','The legend comes to life.','Dragonball Evolution',14164,5.7501,2.935,'T4_wHfz2qUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23839,_binary '\0','/y1OcayHujFSFIbUGR7tt2rW81JX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1098356',5.1,6654,'en','Long Weekend','Peter and Carla, a couple whose marriage is faltering, decide to go on a camping weekend. When they become lost, the pair sets up camp on a remote beach that doesn\'t seem to be on any map. At first the trip is the romantic getaway they imagined – then slowly things begin to go wrong. After Peter disrespects the unspoiled habitat, it seems as if the surroundings are exacting revenge on the couple, as insects, animals, and then nature itself become the enemy.','/szfiY3ycr0SBAjb81og8tIzKgGj.jpg','2009-08-14',87,'Released',NULL,'Long Weekend',20323,2.2687,5.193,'V7jr_Iq4Hig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23840,_binary '\0','/zRVXLgtpBg2oTGZCYYzIhR6Qzyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10984580',7.1,2514,'es','Utama','In the Bolivian altiplano, Virginio and Sisa, an elderly Quechua couple who have lived a quiet life for years, face an impossible dilemma during an unusually long drought: resist or be defeated by the hostile environment and the relentless passage of time.','/AqqIIXR3f47PxOGYBFYOwAzBTWU.jpg','2022-05-11',88,'Released','Time has gotten tired','Utama',913820,2.4955,7.2,'RragIUAAK-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23841,_binary '\0','/zs1I3ZFUDEWa5rFyph7OrMH1aJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10986222',7.3,43417,'en','C\'mon C\'mon','Johnny and his young nephew forge a tenuous but transformational relationship when they embark on a cross-country trip to see life away from Los Angeles.','/1oOyJsdcJnnE7cl9bZdUQvBjKNH.jpg','2021-11-19',110,'Released','Be funny, when you can.','C\'mon C\'mon',632617,8.3798,7.1,'0GnOo5-j4Ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23842,_binary '\0','/zguReD4Tx0rkbQSLKcl0uVvceg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10991188',5.1,4412,'te','వరల్డ్ ఫేమస్ లవర్','An aspiring writer channels his grief and heartbreak into four distinct love stories, exploring the complexities and pain of romantic relationships.','/7zlyNE6CtDTzXhnaYNP4c4dXZS4.jpg','2020-02-14',156,'Released',NULL,'World Famous Lover',659674,1.2279,5.173,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23843,_binary '\0','/isRUP7Xk9S1inbqwmtaOACaOHxy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1099196',6.9,3024,'hi','Dil Dosti Etc','Two college boys from diverse backgrounds believe that since time is on their side, anything is possible. Consequently, their arrogance leads them to challenge each other to prove their efficiencies.','/vQOhm6acL9QSOPS3eEYIpTsIrqv.jpg','2007-09-28',106,'Released',NULL,'Dil Dosti Etc',20454,0.9992,5.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23844,_binary '\0','/weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1099212',5.4,534162,'en','Twilight','When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward\'s repeated cautions, Bella can\'t stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.','/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg','2008-11-20',122,'Released','When you can live forever, what do you live for?','Twilight',8966,29.6501,6.273,'7tQk8pKnnVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23845,_binary '\0','/vF94nDYvUSjZb5MAi8WOXifcktI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1099227',5.6,3465,'pt','Se Eu Fosse Você 2','Claudio and Helena are on the verge of breaking up, until the couple experiences another strange phenomenon that looks to help them understand one another more.','/jruDMExMKeUz7PHgkk4ROlWwCFO.jpg','2009-02-01',96,'Released',NULL,'If I Were You 2',21752,1.6504,6.093,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23846,_binary '\0','/uNTciMXpCQDg7gvgMsPCdnxo6Re.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10993078',4.2,6600,'en','Boneyard','After Police Chief Carter discovers the remains of eleven women, FBI Special Agent Petrovick is recruited to profile the serial killer responsible for the infamous \"boneyard\" killings. As the police force, narcotics agency, and FBI lock horns, a tangled web of intrigue turns everyone into a suspect.','/At4aWmOnKwH9k1ciB5ZNe0dP1jH.jpg','2024-07-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Boneyard',1114738,3.9023,5.4,'GS5OoPsRkKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23847,_binary '\0','/uQg8UCXEqPqMavYiObrqmUhvDNo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10993566',6.1,12715,'ro','Miami Bici','Miami Bici is the story of Ion and Ilie, two young people from a small dark city in Romania who go to Miami in the middle of winter, to live both the \"American Dream\" and the Romanian dream of \"getting rich quick\". Once there, they find themselves in the middle of the Machiavellian plan of Mișu, a Romanian of the lowest species, established in Florida.','/ebbFi9j56KryfLJ3NXLwWd8mMJ1.jpg','2020-02-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Miami Bici',677640,2.5404,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23848,_binary '\0','/1947na4bAQtIbMswdEjxhifPA6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10994688',5.3,5085,'en','The Binge','In the not-so-distant future, all drinking and drugs have been made completely illegal by the government, except for one night a year. High school seniors Griffin, Hags, and Andrew make a pilgrimage to get to the best party in town where all their dreams will come true. They will have to avoid their crazed principal, violent siblings, and the wild animals roaming the streets.','/sQlkeVkziJe3Jb9tdGSYnNGisSM.jpg','2020-08-28',98,'Released','One nation under the influence','The Binge',647265,2.1551,5.3,'qg3ZjDFZaIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23849,_binary '\0','/atn3cbaqNJl7mw7p9QDiMIfHAK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10994712',6,1965,'id','Sri Asih','Alana discover the truth about her origin: she’s not an ordinary human being. She may be the gift for humanity and become its protector as Sri Asih. Or a destruction, if she can’t control her anger.','/rEmMqgcXvA5Nc5YufekDt57GHTJ.jpg','2022-11-17',134,'Released','Welcome the incarnation of Dewi Asih…','Sri Asih',624091,3.0126,6.6,'Za-KBkJqi68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23850,_binary '\0','/1F2CmKOaYnArCmI2MrGrjHgSETE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10998174',6.1,1311,'en','Just for the Summer','Penelope Campbell loves her annual summer vacations visiting her Grandma Dot, despite Dot\'s constant attempts to set her up with every single man in town. This year, she bumps into Jason Humphrey, her childhood sweetheart. In order to evade the efforts of their matchmaking grandmothers, they make a pact pretending to date each other, but will the old sparks return?','/d5yEwLueHzlPO0v6FmUIhObKcA3.jpg','2020-05-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Just for the Summer',690483,2.4672,6.6,'Pexd1D8NTLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23851,_binary '\0','/fHDvGGPFry65ou79WLi6JsjCZrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt10999120',6.6,60256,'en','Spirited','Each Christmas Eve, the Ghost of Christmas Present selects one dark soul to be reformed by a visit from three spirits. But this season, he picked the wrong Scrooge. Clint Briggs turns the tables on his ghostly host until Present finds himself reexamining his own past, present and future.','/h3zAzTMs5EP3cKusOxFNGSFE1WI.jpg','2022-11-10',127,'Released','Start your holidays on a high note.','Spirited',632856,6.6805,6.835,'tnAJntI3NNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23852,_binary '\0','/adTOBZgIPow1QT4sqzEzwJo1RBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1100048',7.1,5725,'fr','35 Rhums','A widower and his daughter witness the retirement of a colleague of his and the closing of her department at her university.','/joOoCuOaiZXZZRiS4JpontBL3Gz.jpg','2009-02-18',101,'Released','We all live such withdrawn lives... Everyone in his corner.','35 Shots of Rum',26191,1.7705,6.8,'PPDvNGruo2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23853,_binary '\0','/fmPfRSDkdegZ6HHN9yKkHCPwMLQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1100051',5.1,8759,'en','Bereavement','In 1989, six year old Martin Bristoll was kidnapped from his backyard swing in Minersville Pennsylvania. Graham Sutter, a psychotic recluse, kept Martin imprisoned on his derelict pig farm, forcing him to witness and participate in unspeakable horrors. Chosen at random, his victim\'s screams were drowned out by the rural countryside. For five years, Martin\'s whereabouts have remained a mystery, until 17 year old Allison Miller comes to live with her Uncle, Jonathan. While exploring her new surroundings, Allison discovers things aren\'t quite right at the farmhouse down the road. Her curiosity disturbs a hornet\'s nest of evil and despair that once torn open, can never be closed.','/5Zd0NzvT3x8EhuE5lYMJz5ShcH1.jpg','2010-07-16',103,'Released','There are some evils...so unspeakable...they will scar you forever.','Bereavement',55890,3.3341,5.367,'C03r8eWOYU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23854,_binary '\0','/6n2rXlZavOgZAOCmY6GSA0w2Kpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1100053',5.1,6716,'en','Tormented','Driven to suicide by relentless bullying and neglect, a resurrected teenager returns from the dead to exact lethal revenge on his former tormentors.','/jPaZJjxfJM4cIHeDS9Isfqyat6l.jpg','2009-05-22',91,'Released','A new class of terror.','Tormented',23173,2.4554,5.1,'deDMdV6YWtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23855,_binary '\0','/tT8vexYdyHG0nHyXQkhzt8tbFkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1100089',7,155946,'en','Foxcatcher','The greatest Olympic Wrestling Champion brother team joins Team Foxcatcher led by multimillionaire sponsor John E. du Pont as they train for the 1988 games in Seoul - a union that leads to unlikely circumstances.','/w6Sl079QtUcQ9dVQ2RP6aN9NBXx.jpg','2014-11-14',134,'Released','Ambition. Power. Control.','Foxcatcher',87492,6.5231,6.6,'Jhkj1TVITf8','YouTube','Trailer','2