 bio-hacking babies’ DNA to enable her clients to reverse the aging process. When Mia goes to investigate, she finds herself trapped, branded and tortured in a grim underground facility. Familiar faces start to appear, and she realises that she is not alone in this. Can she somehow find inner strength and escape from the nightmare?','/p4RwOjzPQ4lpA4pGll5DKXuGlr3.jpg','2020-10-31',107,'Released','Unnatural selection','Breeder',718135,2.8832,5.2,'S5B-UV0154E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23860,_binary '\0','/7YI3LxKLTxHjes9OaBUYrKdXqh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11005128',4.7,2233,'en','Into the Deep','Follows a woman desperate to escape her town, she meets a stranger who promises a romantic escape, but it results in deceit, mistrust, and violence.','/bPyBqGBYjGzyLVHJEIsCwlZejk.jpg','2022-08-26',91,'Released','At sea, there are no boundaries.','Into the Deep',948333,2.9312,5.5,'tljVzdNtss0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23861,_binary '\0','/YXuEHJKI1Xon4P055rrCqQOlN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11007444',6.8,4400,'fi','Tove','Helsinki, 1945. The end of the war brings a new sense of artistic and social freedom for painter Tove Jansson. While focusing her artistic dreams on painting, the enchanting tales of the ‘Moomin’ creatures she told to scared children in bomb shelters, rapidly take on a life of their own, bringing international fame.','/6BBT3SeNz4OM3HYa8CqjPpsiCeb.jpg','2020-10-02',103,'Released','In search of freedom and desire','Tove',608232,2.2594,6.5,'pw_JrV8HYHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23862,_binary '\0','/zNVKhT0js1UF7ZT9Lb4ioaa8jk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11010144',4.6,1417,'en','Seriously Single','While her free-living bestie urges her to embrace singlehood, a commitment-craving social media expert can\'t stop following the life of a former love.','/qptLj4WxATqp3MZq97JmhYjtc9B.jpg','2020-07-31',107,'Released',NULL,'Seriously Single',661747,2.5887,6.8,'V2S