rocess her anger and protect her on her journey into womanhood.','/hPrsnuigEuHsFIqCs71Cu78RdMj.jpg','2022-08-25',101,'Released','I know what I saw.','Blaze',767254,1.6682,5.4,'KMMxLCQkOHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23877,_binary '\0','/aRTTzUIiG6uakLiIuAagxvhRzKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11020728',6.2,2338,'en','Long Weekend','Bart\'s chance encounter with the enigmatic Vienna leads to a whirlwind weekend together. The two fall fast and hard, but both carry secrets that could be their undoing or the chance for a fresh start.','/OyKfblQX6SR2rL6R26g5eYCLHq.jpg','2021-03-12',91,'Released','They found each other just in time.','Long Weekend',635012,3.5485,6.8,'HphL31Hw2x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23878,_binary '\0','/ylDxZwmMIZQ29j1Ev4Parkzxihn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11023732',6.6,3381,'te','విరాట పర్వం','Vennela has fallen for Aranya aka Ravanna’s poetry and the man both. What happens when she sets out on an arduous journey to be with him?','/pebVSzYPI9qR4xlmDt5dQXoVxP3.jpg','2022-06-17',150,'Released','Revolution is an act of LOVE','Viraata Parvam',609096,1.4409,5.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23879,_binary '\0','/3imrWA0rQYlHU34V241wnGyGVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11023922',7.5,1435,'en','Spirits in the Forest','A look at Depeche Mode\'s final moments of their 2017 Global Spirit Tour, featuring intimate stories from select fans.','/b5TxqFcqQ6eyAOp4i3hgUY2BLiY.jpg','2019-11-21',83,'Released','A Depeche Mode film','Spirits in the Forest',634571,1.8159,7.2,'-ldu3SqE4II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23880,_binary '\0','/qDV3sQRhqyXflUfH6gOTGkPXTaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11024272',5.8,61481,'en','The Babysitter: Killer Queen','Two years after defeating a satanic cult led by his babysitter Bee, Cole\'s trying to forget his past and focus on surviving high school. But when old enemies unexpectedly return, Cole will once again have