ate and survive or die together.','/44zhSoVvpLDye6rJmU63TIpasUg.jpg','2022-09-16',113,'Released','Imagination will set you free.','The Silent Twins',812025,3.751,6.3,'lEN2rk__Xms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23919,_binary '\0','/tzXcnv2XgjGcTKgm4HGsGMnKzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11052808',7.3,4991,'ko','82년생 김지영','Kim Ji-young, an ordinary woman in her 30s, suddenly shows signs of being inhabited by other women from her life, past and present.','/gA4J1jio3O5monA9GrAnxjlcvqw.jpg','2019-10-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Kim Ji-young: Born 1982',586048,3.1897,7.424,'Nbjks9yrtcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23920,_binary '\0','/nRSSQrtg8r5cmU3ydyVnoS2suHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11053476',4.7,1408,'en','Sound of Violence','As a child, the brutal murder of her family made Alexis regain her hearing along with synesthetic abilities. Now as an adult, she finds solace in the sounds of bodily harm. But when she’s told she might lose her hearing again, she escalates her gruesome sound experiments in a quest to compose her masterpiece.','/i3umQVtEGpwPTYIkRm2QsDAlrv8.jpg','2021-05-21',94,'Released','Her Music Kills.','Sound of Violence',766358,1.6661,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23921,_binary '\0','/h0YBqSr5nnsYkbUZwwzP3UHgLXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1105355',6.7,1647,'en','Growing Up Smith','In 1979, an Indian family moves to America with hopes of living the American Dream. While their 10-year-old boy Smith falls head-over-heels for the girl next door, his desire to become a \"good old boy\" propels him further away from his family\'s ideals than ever before.','/ncALkAajnctju0CYKH4bFm40QJD.jpg','2017-02-03',102,'Released','It’s better to stand out than to fit in.','Growing Up Smith',426469,1.9175,7.1,'KTmHUA4q0wE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23922,_binary '\0','/2UcDOPaJjCTW0YrvyeMkAof5wub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11054164',5.9,7296,'nl','Yummy'