ibwwPho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23956,_binary '\0','/28rEDmMP8hrpdSPNSjUo6q3IQL5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11078522',7.2,1299,'ja','PSYCHO-PASS サイコパス Sinners of the System Case.3「恩讐の彼方に＿＿」','Following the incident in the Southeast Asia Union in 2116, Shinya Kogami resumes his vagrant journey. In a small South Asian nation, Kogami rescues a bus of refugees under attack by armed guerrilla forces. Among the refugees is a young lady by the name of Tenzin, who begs Kogami to teach her how to retaliate against the enemy. Just what does the girl who wishes for revenge and the man who has exacted revenge see as they gaze upon the edge of a world from which there is no escape?','/snAdedewKhxu1SU9ZUAh156Trlt.jpg','2019-03-18',70,'Released',NULL,'Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System - Case.3 On the Other Side of Love and Hate',559566,3.0538,6.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23957,_binary '\0','/ihURVgowKHaXGBsl8ltglt4numm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1107860',6,18782,'en','The Maiden Heist','A comedy centered on three museum security guards who devise a plan to steal back the artworks to which they have become attached after they are transferred to another museum.','/vrp0dqlp74A02YaUiwNpLElgTR0.jpg','2009-05-09',91,'Released','They\'re not bad guys, just bad thieves.','The Maiden Heist',24271,4.9753,5.7,'UOWUwTlnxhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23958,_binary '\0','/gg9zZB9xLPWmuxOpKw0HX0QLMN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11080108',6.8,34247,'en','The Map of Tiny Perfect Things','Two teenagers trapped in an endless time loop set out to find all the tiny things that make that one day perfect.','/6y3ev0rJFbHA1hU22UPmmfzBjrG.jpg','2021-02-12',99,'Released','One day. Infinite possibilities.','The Map of Tiny Perfect Things',672647,5.7971,7.1,'ZOxsfKQWrUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23959,_binary '\0','/oJiDHTVrwaWxXQIT0dbh4icypX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11080676',6.8,4597,'de','Nebenan','Berlin, the Prenzlauer Berg district. Daniel is a movie star accustomed to success. His loft apartment is stylish and so is his wife, and the nanny has the children under control. Everything is tip-top, bilingual and ready for him to jet off to an audition in London where a role in an American superhero film awaits the celebrated German-Spanish actor. Popping into the local bar on the corner, he finds Bruno sitting there. As transpires by the minute, Bruno has been waiting for this moment for a long time. And so this eternally overlooked man – one of reunification\'s losers and a victim of the gentrification of what was once East Berlin – takes his revenge. With Daniel as his target...','/uCDPV0QtbQkKILMzQlCUd7kDnjX.jpg','2021-07-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Next Door',681349,2.2958,6.5,'oi2dC87kZIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23960,_binary '\0','/rVttzFfjuFABzVoafvUxwuGtgV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11081050',6.5,7945,'da','Shorta','The exact details of what took place while Talib Ben Hassi was in police custody remain unclear. Police officers Jens and Mike are on routine patrol in Svalegården\'s ghetto when news of Talib\'s death comes in over the radio, igniting uncontrollable, pent-up rage in the ghetto\'s youth, who lust for revenge. Suddenly, the two officers find themselves fair game and must fight tooth and claw to find a way out.','/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg','2020-10-08',108,'Released',NULL,'Enforcement',711017,3.2655,6.321,'a6Rsm7fp-y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23961,_binary '\0','/4co2y08OSf8TRXSsKCH3lZKYHIw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11081744',7.4,1368,'sr','Реална прича','The movie takes us through the saga of the actor, Veljko Radisavljević, who has the impression that the entire universe has conspired against him.','/ypRlb4EcrTy4S2qR3WkVujCMJTo.jpg','2019-11-12',91,'Released',NULL,'Common Story',647734,0.8705,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23962,_binary '\0','/70AV2Xx5FQYj20labp0EGdbjI6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11083552',7.1,243033,'en','Wrath of Man','A cold and mysterious new security guard for a Los Angeles cash truck company surprises his co-workers when he unleashes precision skills during a heist. The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from. Soon, the marksman\'s ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.','/M7SUK85sKjaStg4TKhlAVyGlz3.jpg','2021-04-22',119,'Released','A one man army.','Wrath of Man',637649,33.1156,7.6,'EFYEni2gsK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23963,_binary '\0','/cCRbIwMOqBBARK06rogWPsmInxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11084432',6,3832,'en','My Heart Can\'t Beat Unless You Tell It To','Dwight and his sister Jessie reach a crossroads over what to do about their little brother Thomas, a sickly child with a mysterious affliction.','/p2E9firwz4tqDLedpvtS0byyDek.jpg','2020-10-13',89,'Released',NULL,'My Heart Can\'t Beat Unless You Tell It To',690248,2.2362,5.91,'JfbypuuR-JA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23964,_binary '\0','/fZkhO3JhRajayNejQUaIiBegayM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11084896',5.5,5598,'en','Spirit Untamed','Lucky Prescott\'s life is changed forever when she moves from her home in the city to a small frontier town and befriends a wild mustang named Spirit.','/fLE2mvuvhvzmSICOsqR9uE50Ave.jpg','2021-05-20',88,'Released','Adventure awaits.','Spirit Untamed',637693,9.8981,7.223,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23965,_binary '\0','/oc8f5Edg2V3n3G9g0bhs45yuaD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11086194',7.1,3991,'ml','തങ്കം','Thankam follows the story of Muthu and Kannan, two gold agents from Thrissur, known as the gold capital of India. As they travel across Kerala and Tamil Nadu, delivering consignments of gold, their lives take a dark turn when a routine trip leads to unexpected complications.','/lB4VhlVcJGxBTHtSgFaCJdFrmxL.jpg','2023-01-26',145,'Released',NULL,'Thankam',797186,1.0181,6.368,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23966,_binary '\0','/sXyy9VSf5XphIM5Q0HawcTA2Xeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11087960',7.3,5290,'fr','Un monde','When Nora witnesses Abel being bullied by other kids, she rushes to protect him by warning their father. But Abel forces her to remain silent. Caught in a conflict of loyalty, Nora will ultimately try to find her place, torn between children\'s and adult\'s worlds.','/lTAfmBEaTYyPf3bre8hdIYiE3RB.jpg','2021-10-20',72,'Released',NULL,'Playground',785209,2.1277,7.053,'2aigDz3f5w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23967,_binary '\0','/lBsbWXGn9maPKGhN3fozTU3BH0r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11092020',4.7,6011,'en','Shadow Force','Kyrah and Isaac were once the leaders of a multinational special forces group called Shadow Force. They broke the rules by falling in love, and in order to protect their son, they go underground. With a large bounty on their heads, and the vengeful Shadow Force hot on their trail, one family\'s fight becomes all-out war.','/9LCpHFXZgkqp2AWiYq0mGbfZauk.jpg','2025-05-01',103,'Released','Family over everything.','Shadow Force',757725,10.7068,6.33,'M7LhGytiHFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23968,_binary '\0','/A2g1tlceVs7liy765ozaJ27aH0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11092178',7,2669,'no','Snøsøsteren','A young boy whose grieving family has forgotten about Christmas forms an unexpected, healing bond with a bubbly girl full of holiday spirit.','/ArMZ9DEw3ajkLYNmj3iXdveO9oQ.jpg','2024-11-28',98,'Released',NULL,'The Snow Sister',1365044,2.6663,6.8,'ekgJs0D0RYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23969,_binary '\0','/pRPWczd6IFWNjfWHbUJNLQmhCU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1109477',5,2506,'en','The Human Contract','A free-spirited woman leads a businessman down a path of reckless abandon.','/fGzk7eIGscDHzTaIRrIUDdece7Z.jpg','2008-09-12',107,'Released','Bound by desire.','The Human Contract',22633,2.9539,4.4,'n22rva9vo44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23970,_binary '\0','/jZTnq3dkO5n2aHlikRcpK81ryWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1109574',4.8,1221,'en','Between Us','A New York couple and their Midwestern friends find that drastic changes have occurred in their respective lives since they last met.','/uieZWH2BOzJhANaSo60M1zjn72r.jpg','2012-09-13',91,'Released','Four Friends. Two Couples. One Night They Will Never Forget.','Between Us',137566,2.5315,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23971,_binary '\0','/pQfqBfO1UIXz3rSOJN6WbyDW4k4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11095742',7.5,6245,'en','Boys State','This raucous journey into the heart of democracy captures an unusual rite of passage: 1,100 teenage boys from across Texas coming together to build a representative government from the ground up.','/cuvt3ImM3wQdijib7OeIH48uRfQ.jpg','2020-01-24',110,'Released','Democracy isn\'t a spectator sport.','Boys State',653723,3.7061,7.09,'ViiYJZqGC5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23972,_binary '\0','/fH1KdO4SJMuJhEcIRPaL96IFXE4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1109583',5.1,4633,'en','Fear Island','Five students on spring break meet at a secluded island cabin for a weekend getaway. Stranded on the island they become the prey of a mysterious killer who seems bent on revenge for something the friends have done.','/ozq6b1kgFdEpHdJdaBVnet1cbeW.jpg','2009-09-08',95,'Released','A beautiful secluded Island.... Five good friends... And a killer out for revenge.','Fear Island',42309,2.6123,5.3,'qu51kiiDDDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23973,_binary '\0','/kfofK4GzJsJZhCShqZY438c8Y4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1109624',7.3,158958,'en','Paddington','A young Peruvian bear travels to London in search of a home. Finding himself lost and alone at Paddington Station, he meets the kindly Brown family, who offer him a temporary haven.','/wpchRGhRhvhtU083PfX2yixXtiw.jpg','2014-11-23',95,'Released','Please look after this bear. Thank you.','Paddington',116149,13.1567,7.1,'7bZFr2IA0Bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23974,_binary '\0','/mGiSArFhUhdPxeNAC6GWSa2REws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11096888',5.6,1733,'en','A Christmas Movie Christmas','Eve is a Christmas movie fanatic and dreams of having a movie-perfect Christmas with a movie-perfect boyfriend. On Christmas Eve, when Eve and her cynical sister Lacy make wishes to Santa, they wake up in Christmas Town and find themselves trapped inside a Christmas movie where they are the stars. But when things start to go wrong, and Eve\'s knowledge of all things Christmas movie fails to fix things, Eve and Lacy try to find a way out of the picture-perfect Christmas and back to reality.','/5H9Xvprh7PU1rFTGm2ZcnbaeP7s.jpg','2019-10-27',90,'Released','Is true love only in the movies?','A Christmas Movie Christmas',642949,1.896,5.6,'-G-kI3HzVK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23975,_binary '\0','/9ZFNRs58TTnvf3utagd0uSJluXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11097384',5.7,48597,'en','Spaceman','Six months into a solo mission, a lonely astronaut confronts the cracks in his marriage with help from a mysterious creature he discovers on his ship.','/f46WvKEsBn98WJbPJcO47ZoKn6B.jpg','2024-02-23',108,'Released','I just want to go home.','Spaceman',636706,7.0087,6.698,'rNZ0xKaCdus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23976,_binary '\0','/lAOxpKM3Go7PfuckuA5VOEb5OXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11100168',4.4,1250,'en','The Mummy','An Egyptologist in possession of a haunted Bride of the Dead amulet is the target of a tech billionaire who believes the ancient Egyptian mummy artifact holds forbidden magic that could awaken a deadly mummy curse and unlock eternal life.','/cgGC1l5ZnpDyHzR5WWY94KxBGgI.jpg','2026-04-03',95,'Released',NULL,'The Mummy',1662599,3.5157,3.4,'TBIuNurnOn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23977,_binary '\0','/wq9Az2iGf33CvwuIEA6Z5AN76dV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1110048',4.7,1678,'en','The Haunting of Sorority Row','Samantha Willows, a college freshman, looks to pledge a sorority. Unbeknownst to Sam, it is haunted by a former pledge taking revenge on those who wronged her.','/dtR6HRn8fDM3hp4or5vlKHtospR.jpg','2007-10-06',90,'Released',NULL,'The Haunting of Sorority Row',28593,1.9924,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23978,_binary '\0','/cSrzq2d1NqrsuFGvs2cjdQ47JD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11100776',6.5,2167,'en','Christmas On My Mind','When Lucy wakes up with a wedding dress in hand, she believes that she is late to her wedding with her ex-boyfriend Zac. However, she has no recollection of the past 2 years, including the fact that she is engaged to another man.','/4qF8PmqmLSrqf81Zk2GgXa9knz2.jpg','2019-12-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas On My Mind',630922,2.1608,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23979,_binary '\0','/i6X9J6AgGhR3FNTtEc5GRs9e3ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11100856',5.6,20628,'en','Love, Guaranteed','A lawyer takes on a new client that wants to sue a dating website because it guarantees love.','/6K22JB6fZZLBuM0knfl8rs9Zoxg.jpg','2020-09-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Love, Guaranteed',644090,5.0924,6.4,'TcilGWIzvdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23980,_binary '\0','/dqm09gnToqrjuQ3x5nwHzobS2Y9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11101698',8.2,3199,'en','Dancing with the Birds','Some of the world\'s most majestic birds display delightfully captivating mating rituals, from flashy dancing to flaunting their colorful feathers.','/uzc72pDxEZ6ziC4n7IUX9YQorDO.jpg','2019-10-23',51,'Released','Shake a tail feather','Dancing with the Birds',634541,2.1271,7.727,'i6po8dWuvCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23981,_binary '\0','/y08KcyCOL7M35UN73FPLryDm1Ew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1110207',6.7,1230,'es','Bajo la Sal','A series of murders leads Commander Trujillo to Santa Rosa de la Sal a town close to a salt mine, where he meets Victor Zepeda - a lonely teenager who works in his father\'s funeral home and spends his free time making crude animated horror films - who\'s strange behavior seems to point at him as the culprit of the crimes.','/cpIg14zalUbSnp0TBEGw7O0cZCq.jpg','2008-10-17',127,'Released','Some things should be kept beneath.','Under the Salt',25272,1.1219,6.3,'CjZtNsI4VWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23982,_binary '\0','/kVyN6OW1Ka7hLDcC6Yc0SqCwVCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1110209',5.8,4589,'da','Blå mænd','Jesper Jensen is a successful IT salesman who stops at nothing, even if it means backstabbing his best friend. Being number one in the company and having a beautiful wife and a lovely home, Jesper seems to lead a perfect life, but one day his arrogance and self confidence hits him in the face like a boomerang and he loses everything overnight. Jesper is sentenced to do community service at a recycling center with the odd and funny characters Dion, Theodor, and Lotte. At first he looks down on these people and doesn\'t want to be associated with them. When he begins to loosen up, however, he discovers that he can learn a lot from their straight forward and honest approach to life.','/fWStUAZoG3g4gAJIgxJCgUJgm9j.jpg','2008-08-15',80,'Released',NULL,'Take the Trash',15149,1.6182,6.6,'dI-WXTLdyxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23983,_binary '\0','/l6IMuxPLRS9u2Il1MCz9Eb7NaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11102262',6.5,4237,'ta','கடாவர்','A pathologist and a police commissioner try to solve a series of murders involving a prisoner. Their journey leads to shocking revelations!','/f7R2AEvAYOUsS5JBFpbZU5915YT.jpg','2022-08-12',119,'Released',NULL,'Cadaver',1006463,1.9216,6.292,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23984,_binary '\0','/rf1GLwpT0LU20DDFROHBAz8SHI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11102314',6.3,4746,'hi','त्रिभंग','When her estranged mother falls into a coma, a self-made single mom grapples with regret and resentment while reflecting on their strained relationship.','/6OWTh12f8gmZ8uo4O2rE5TPKvzc.jpg','2021-01-15',95,'Released','Tedhi Medhi Crazy','Tribhanga',744991,1.2277,7.129,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23985,_binary '\0','/bqQEa0VJXMgCcXPorOirlwtFcL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1110272',6.3,1270,'sv','Ping-pongkingen','Rille, an ostracized and bullied teenager, who only excels in the ping pong room, descends into a life-and-death struggle with his younger, more popular brother when the truth about their father surfaces during their spring break.','/s1QaILITE5b0k1sT8qZrJJ4kgIQ.jpg','2008-01-18',107,'Released',NULL,'The King of Ping Pong',14357,0.8346,6.4,'aq71tl5weeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23986,_binary '\0','/4KJN0JtDN81mzJyb6EDgTrfYPA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1110626',6.1,3564,'en','The Cutting Edge: Chasing the Dream','A world class ice skater eager to take the top prize in the biggest competition around finds his dreams going up in flames after his partner suffers a debilitating injury in this romantic sports drama starring Matt Lanter, Francia Rosa, and Christy Carlson Romano. Zack (Lanter) was headed for the gold when his partner suffered an injury that made competing impossible, but could a feisty female hockey player prove the key to keeping his illustrious career on track? Alexandra is an amateur Latina hockey player who has never skated professionally and doesn\'t much care for Zack, though a little determination goes a long way in helping Zack convince her to join him on the ice. Now, as this unlikely pair begins the arduous training process that could make them both bona-fide superstars, the girl with the icy attitude finds her handsome partner\'s warmth and charm bringing about a most unexpected thaw.','/pwhDGNlBplpLxnZsI1x3SbnZb5q.jpg','2008-03-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Cutting Edge: Chasing the Dream',15088,3.3745,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23987,_binary '\0','/9guoVF7zayiiUq5ulKQpt375VIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11107074',7.8,13300,'ja','僕のヒーローアカデミア THE MOVIE ヒーローズ：ライジング','Class 1-A visits Nabu Island where they finally get to do some real hero work. The place is so peaceful that it\'s more like a vacation... until they\'re attacked by a villain with an unfathomable Quirk! His power is eerily familiar, and it looks like Shigaraki had a hand in the plan. But with All Might retired and citizens\' lives on the line, there\'s no time for questions. Deku and his friends are the next generation of heroes, and they\'re the island\'s only hope.','/kpWsIkfXrnQ1pmR79qAHHq7DPxc.jpg','2019-12-20',104,'Released',NULL,'My Hero Academia: Heroes Rising',592350,10.0489,8.129,'W6LxpZeIxNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23988,_binary '\0','/zMVEyqrJrEiqpac19k3GGp5PP5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11111286',4.5,1913,'en','Reboot Camp','After finding out that his wife has blown their life savings on self-help gurus, Seymour teams up with his brother Danny, a filmmaker, to document how easy it is to start a fake self-help group and con people into believing just about anything. But once started, the Reboot Camp takes on a life of its own, and grows into a full-blown cult.','/aodDtQIGweNRDsgWkte1KcfRUSq.jpg','2020-10-22',97,'Released','Fake guru. Real story.','Reboot Camp',750600,1.6503,4.1,'Htfy1mWI71Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23989,_binary '\0','/lI2AHx0QQrNnEkUqUG01QHUdLDW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112140',7.3,8512,'en','How to Train Your Dragon: Homecoming','It\'s been ten years since the dragons moved to the Hidden World, and even though Toothless doesn\'t live in New Berk anymore, Hiccup continues the holiday traditions he once shared with his best friend. But the Vikings of New Berk were beginning to forget about their friendship with dragons. Hiccup, Astrid, and Gobber know just what to do to keep the dragons in the villagers\' hearts. And across the sea, the dragons have a plan of their own...','/kXj2Qrfm994yLeuADqbOieU1mUH.jpg','2019-12-03',22,'Released','Family never leaves you.','How to Train Your Dragon: Homecoming',638507,7.8762,8.034,'CehPixdKUuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23990,_binary '\0','/qHuY7MvlHvV5wIceZJtA5SXzoIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112338',6.1,1758,'ml','ഹലാൽ ലവ് സ്റ്റോറി','A group of friends attempts to make a \'halal\' film that conforms to the guidelines and descriptions of an Islamic organization which they are a part of.','/4vkle9iPfE1eSsHJQf14nyzSQ19.jpg','2020-10-15',116,'Released',NULL,'Halal Love Story',679247,0.8616,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23991,_binary '\0','/pu9uJL70t7fMEBRJO0CaxS3bSCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112526',3.4,6886,'hi','इंदु की जवानी','A feisty girl from Ghaziabad makes her profile on an online dating app and her left and right swipes on the app lead to hilarious consequences.','/sqFi1T7MMUSZ0nTGL1UphBykz3a.jpg','2020-12-11',115,'Released',NULL,'Indoo Ki Jawani',693838,1.0842,3.773,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23992,_binary '\0','/lkyqbxyG4ZQpQvaNMxACkbvgAaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112532',5.5,1752,'hi','Agra','The story of a family and an exploration of space in an increasingly crowded world. It follows the quest for a sexual odyssey of an individual.','/biX8D3kSh4HuZzf1r0ynRgaEJte.jpg','2025-11-14',115,'Released',NULL,'Agra',1059007,4.0128,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23993,_binary '\0','/isV94MOHL3BG4GrY2O2DLH2z2pO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112784',5.8,5803,'ar','أصحاب... ولا أعزّ','A dinner party unravels when a tight group of friends agree to leave their phones unlocked on the table, exposing juicy interactions and dark secrets.','/xanRnnwGExIEXvXlOAls9Hhq54l.jpg','2022-01-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Strangers',833591,1.6286,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23994,_binary '\0','/jfbN09FuWw5cQNl248pL5KAyjZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11112808',4.2,25026,'hi','सर्कस','Two sets of identical twins are accidentally separated at birth. Several years later, when they are coincidentally in the same town, there is a lot of confusion and misunderstanding when people mistake them for each other.','/if1EDRozDB2LJ8IO2d7lzt46Ahh.jpg','2022-12-23',139,'Released',NULL,'Cirkus',755045,1.4527,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23995,_binary '\0','/lgi9SXqkmHPycLq3ql7majZnOU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111313',7.3,1268,'en','The Elephant in the Living Room','A film about the controversial world of exotic animal ownership within the suburbs of the United States. \"The Elephant in the Living Room\" offers an unprecedented glimpse into the fascinating subculture of trading and raising the most deadly and exotic animals in the world as common household pets.','/jtip2iGRS3VnFBAlT4vbZ06tjHS.jpg','2010-02-11',96,'Released','Coming Soon - To a backyard near you.','The Elephant in the Living Room',56441,1.2534,6.7,'IGXLsvZHouA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23996,_binary '\0','/jh5rBSc5hoVYiC25apHuqskvKWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111358',6.5,2737,'fa','کلاه‌قرمزی و سروناز','This entertaining real action, puppets movie narrates the adventures of a stouthearted boy who is kidnapped by two bandits. During the abduction, he will help a girl, he meets, who has been held prisoner in her room for her entire life. After failing a course for several times, Kolah Ghermezi finally passes it and enters a higher level. He returns home and happily shows his marks to Aghaye Mojri and Narges; who are supposed to be his parents now. Aghaye Mojri promises to buy a bicycle for him as a gift. However, he does not have adequate money to buy that. The news of Kolah Ghermezi’s success is broadcasted on TV, then his uncle calls him and invites all of them to his luxurious house. He gives a nice and huge bicycle to Kolah Ghermezi as a gift.','/pG0ERDY1PhxFedPMjCFLvzC9MeA.jpg','2002-12-18',95,'Released','Redhat, RedhatAnd Sarvenaz','Redhat and Sarvenaz',386770,0.9114,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23997,_binary '\0','/kBWPHSszi8jKLqW5tMaQV1bISB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111422',6.4,218920,'en','The Taking of Pelham 1 2 3','Armed men hijack a New York City subway train, holding the passengers hostage in return for a ransom, and turning an ordinary day\'s work for dispatcher Walter Garber into a face-off with the mastermind behind the crime.','/rEnyQiBu6goqJfvQXpUZQjpoHVp.jpg','2009-06-10',106,'Released','I can\'t get it out of my head. I\'m gonna die today.','The Taking of Pelham 1 2 3',18487,12.6406,6.368,'6-8DF96kLtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23998,_binary '\0','/exBkMJkhxnwrflC6HMYy6SRmXdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11116374',4.3,2764,'it','Non mi uccidere','After Mirta dies of a drug overdose with her lover, she resuscitates alone and discovers she\'s part of a violent world she never knew existed.','/vqtUe4hUrO8u5zYgQCgI0SYOLXi.jpg','2021-04-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Kill Me',734796,2.0266,4.591,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(23999,_binary '\0','/vMy75yfojBxjJtJU6loQYchNlHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11116642',6.2,2325,'en','Press Play','Laura and Harrison have the picture-perfect romance built on the foundation of a shared love of music. After a deadly accident, Laura gets the chance to save the love of her life when she discovers that their mixtape can transport her back in time.','/d0dcVRrRvfOZi1jDrVsw4pVQ945.jpg','2022-06-16',85,'Released','Rewind and love again.','Press Play',668047,3.8685,6.4,'AThHBsWUJgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24000,_binary '\0','/ml2Nl1JzWV0WlniVuF5YLrYt1ot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11116912',5.8,59878,'no','Troll','When an explosion in the Norwegian mountains awakens an ancient troll, officials appoint a fearless paleontologist to stop it from wreaking deadly havoc.','/ulgKdif3ubMACDltr8VZy6fyVjW.jpg','2022-11-30',104,'Released','Mountains will move.','Troll',736526,6.8745,6.5,'AiohkY_XQYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24001,_binary '\0','/mFI65UvOMPrCzsb4t3UOJEPKGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111833',6,13245,'en','Super High Me','Determined to find out the true effects of marijuana on the human body, stand-up comedian and former Stoner of the Year Doug Benson documents his experience avoiding pot for 30 days and then consuming massive amounts of the drug for 30 days. More than just an amusing story of one man\'s quest to get superhigh, this documentary also examines the hotly contested debate over medical marijuana use.','/80Y1Te0aZwBoImgFo7D2PgUzQna.jpg','2007-10-13',89,'Released','4:20 • 24/7 • 30 Days','Super High Me',14236,2.8964,5.749,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24002,_binary '\0','/psCHwXZIUnlKlqYmozJTf9B66A8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111876',7,3080,'en','Balibo','As Indonesia prepares to invade the tiny nation of East Timor, five Australian based journalists go missing. Four weeks later, veteran foreign correspondent Roger East is lured to East Timor by the young and charismatic José Ramos-Horta to tell the story of his country and investigate the fate of the missing men. As East\'s determination to uncover the truth grows, the threat of invasion intensifie','/xjb9lDIk7uf5o77MhxRaRFfEEhV.jpg','2009-07-21',111,'Released','One Man Searches For The Truth. One Man Fights For Justice.','Balibo',31686,2.0548,6.5,'jjPjIjn-Dws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24003,_binary '\0','/s7MXg9Srra1aptzaTkvtnHVYSF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111890',5.6,12318,'es','Diario de una ninfómana','A chronicle of the life of a middle-class French girl\'s sexual adventures, her then fall into prostitution, and her ultimate redemption.','/yVYTeiFv7oQsSQF9OBRngg7ZqLg.jpg','2008-10-17',102,'Released',NULL,'Diary of a Nymphomaniac',19173,11.3696,5.658,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24004,_binary '\0','/g17xmo7U9377MkG2nky0zf5zaUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111914',7.7,1788,'ml','കഥ പറയുമ്പോള്‍','the film is about how a barber\'s life is turned upside down when a film unit comes to the village for a shoot, and the news spreads that superstar Ashok Raj (Mammootty) is the barber\'s childhood friend. The script also by Srinivasan is so layered that every frame has a comment to make about the world and every line of the dialogue, on the mores of the society. The craze for celebrities and the problems of leading a principled life are discussed without being preachy.','/sIkw1Y75HJ2MFb6uQLixoMgvSOg.jpg','2007-12-14',130,'Released',NULL,'Katha Parayumbol',67890,1.0557,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24005,_binary '\0','/rGlBRCfxRHOJwGreTYu05Ez6I5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111918',5.1,4105,'en','La Linea','The story centers around veteran assassin Mark Shields as he tracks down, Pelon, the elusive head of the Salazar Crime Cartel. Through twists of fate, Shields ends up with a local woman, Olivia who is also fighting her own demons for the sake of her daughter. Set in the rich and atmospheric backdrop of Tijuana, Mexico, La Linea (The Line) is full of action and drama.','/nqFJRRM4uK3DWXEwsluAP1Pb5fH.jpg','2009-05-11',95,'Released','Stay on your side.','The Line',21878,2.7843,4.8,'DVzpQAAeXm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24006,_binary '\0','/v6A68pZ2BWqxFMFdSuCCZBPPj8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1111948',6.4,12443,'en','Soul Men','Two former backup soul singers, Louis and Floyd, have not spoken to each other in 20 years, and reluctantly agree to travel across the country together to a reunion concert to honor their recently-deceased lead singer. Cleo, a beautiful young woman who is believed to be Floyd\'s daughter, accompanies them as a new singer.','/ewU8w8IPlAkauFutzSwYYFILiU8.jpg','2008-11-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Soul Men',14655,2.672,6.161,'SrP7tzXuqqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24007,_binary '\0','/5YFSmzxcqWWQ8ARSP6Y1yKgLXCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11120378',6.9,1368,'en','The Once and Future Smash','In 1970, Mikey and William both portrayed football cannibal Smash-Mouth in the influential cult hit, End Zone 2. Now, 50 years later, only one can wear the mask.','/nMgCXWT8G4sldtVe9e7s1j8HOf0.jpg','2022-12-04',87,'Released',NULL,'The Once and Future Smash',662288,1.7066,5.7,'WaroTiNMahs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24008,_binary '\0','/iLPkoWoTcgSyyaxLG96irMCZqdo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1112115',7,2142,'en','King Corn','King Corn is a fun and crusading journey into the digestive tract of our fast food nation where one ultra-industrial, pesticide-laden, heavily-subsidized commodity dominates the food pyramid from top to bottom – corn. Fueled by curiosity and a dash of naiveté, two college buddies return to their ancestral home of Greene, Iowa to figure out how a modest kernel conquered America. With the help of some real farmers, oodles of fertilizer and government aide, and some genetically modified seeds, the friends manage to grow one acre of corn. Along the way, they unlock the hilarious absurdities and scary but hidden truths about America’s modern food system in this engrossing and eye-opening documentary.','/zVHWzV9o2FU1SasNxuiJMW2FY0V.jpg','2007-10-12',88,'Released','You Are What You Eat.','King Corn',15281,1.2013,6.3,'Pr5HQrgg9mM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24009,_binary '\0','/wETWXzbvn0LhrPGLeRqyIeIl0E8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11121664',7.1,11920,'en','Blue Bayou','As a Korean-American man raised in the Louisiana bayou works hard to make a life for his family, he must confront the ghosts of his past as he discovers that he could be deported from the only country he has ever called home.','/a4xykTie8BOSW0y6K5u1AcmW4HW.jpg','2021-09-10',117,'Released','It\'s not where you\'re from. It\'s where you belong.','Blue Bayou',644089,5.2693,7.413,'Jh59H_d19Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24010,_binary '\0','/qitxPMBXFEAq1rmZgXLvmJf6W70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11122910',5.6,1974,'bn','ব্যোমকেশ ও দুর্গ রহস্য','As Byomkesh Bakshi tries to solve a murder mystery, a myth of a buried treasure at the fort surfaces following a bizarre series of deaths. How does BB demystify the case? Adaptation of the adventure detective novel written in 1952 by Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay.','/iy34f2SgVKaOj8HRHOj1V358CRk.jpg','2023-08-11',118,'Released',NULL,'Byomkesh O Durgo Rohosyo',1079705,0.8376,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24011,_binary '\0','/6SDfJMJWqngxXEmwy218vLH8Yox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11123012',5.7,9027,'en','The Secret of Sinchanee','An industrial tow truck driver suffering from insomnia returns to his childhood home after the untimely death of his father, to discover that a paranormal presence has been living in the house and haunting the sacred land it was built on.','/5TcVPNaoIlfQHJchqYQ7mehBcaH.jpg','2021-10-08',115,'Released','The secret is buried within.','The Secret of Sinchanee',874728,1.9852,6,'wYXhpuqpZ50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24012,_binary '\0','/xhMjZhD2BKwXVCSjxCJhAUFHiJk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11123132',6.8,1396,'el','Πρόστιμο','Vangelis, a remnant of the rave party generation of the late 90s, sells weed for a living. Wants a steady job, no risks involved. Petros, a smalltime gangster. Wants a family. Demands respect. Katerina unwillingly brings them together under the same roof.','/nKBKrQEipduBcC5LRIh5VDtcao5.jpg','2021-05-21',101,'Released',NULL,'Amercement',757758,0.9316,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24013,_binary '\0','/wfrfxivLOBtGMC98tIr2LSOe