hsGTQR4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11134856',6.2,1581,'hi','Chhappad Phaad Ke','Meet the Gupchups, a typical Indian middle-class family, financially weak but morally rich. Their ordinary life takes an extraordinary twist when they find a bag containing ₹ 5 crores. Will they give up ethics for money?','/6iuQY6fskvN6nOcctzG5IJXocxn.jpg','2019-10-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Chhappad Phaad Ke',640746,0.8719,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24023,_binary '\0','/dqcZi5qWufkKUZXAxG3EqWjAM9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11136276',6.5,3346,'fr','Azor','Yvan De Wiel, a private banker from Geneva, is going to Argentina in the midst of a dictatorship to replace his partner, the object of the most worrying rumors, who disappeared overnight. Between hushed lounges, swimming pools, and gardens under surveillance, a remote duel takes place between two bankers who, despite different methods, are the accomplices of a discreet and merciless form of colonization.','/qciSIhwpjS3NtzW4VcgSzxK04sG.jpg','2021-09-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Azor',659954,2.0301,6.3,'JuHYkSpqAKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24024,_binary '\0','/pDQuheZ02F2OX22Brou9PJPEYw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11137248',5.1,1694,'en','Vaxxed II: The People\'s Truth','An exploration into a possible link between various vaccinations and illness, injury, and death.','/uSbp3YBF3yyD2Hnby49ucHoCYUH.jpg','2020-01-24',92,'Released','The Film They Can\'t Let You See','Vaxxed II: The People\'s Truth',680002,1.248,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24025,_binary '\0','/3SijFsB54c5c4CK0yCGkVuuVnV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11137920',7.7,3419,'kn','Garuda','Garuda revolves around the efforts of Vikram, a man on a mission to capture an evil mastermind who destroyed his family and is also a threat to the country.','/ghZO5BXVuSv06WonZwSPivxdGYG.jpg','2022-05-20',142,'Released',NULL,'Garuda',1081252,1.2149,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000')