:21:07.000000'),(24053,_binary '\0','/nzDMlEi6h2HMyRDU02eGsa9hncm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11160650',7,10630,'en','On the Count of Three','Val has reached a place where he feels the only way out is to end things. But he considers himself a bit of a failure—his effectiveness lacking—so he figures he could use some help. As luck would have it, Val’s best friend, Kevin, is recovering from a failed suicide attempt, so he seems like the perfect partner for executing this double suicide plan. But before they go, they have some unfinished business to attend to.','/mv5v3xtiRqpMyP1XWRnRl5s38lV.jpg','2022-05-13',86,'Released','It’s a great day to be alive.','On the Count of Three',776512,2.8004,6.4,'q7KFDgTySuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24054,_binary '\0','/AopMTry2Pt1nyQGRv7gGlmPQeiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11161374',3.6,3579,'en','Beyond the Law','When a former detective learns of the murder of his estranged son, he ventures back to the darkened streets he once knew so well. Armed, dangerous and with nothing to lose, he must take on the ruthless local mob in his mission for revenge.','/3yIhZPJuoo0LATK9TxVhxmQWGy3.jpg','2019-12-06',90,'Released','Justice at any price.','Beyond the Law',650272,3.7838,5.2,'uWFVPgU23Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24055,_binary '\0','/izNpxVcjKbF9BiYF4GVqxCOfewL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11161474',7,60714,'en','Pieces of a Woman','When a young mother\'s home birth ends in unfathomable tragedy, she begins a year-long odyssey of mourning that fractures relationships with loved ones in this deeply personal story of a woman learning to live alongside her loss.','/OgUfLlhfBFx5BPK6LzBWFvBW1w.jpg','2020-12-30',127,'Released',NULL,'Pieces of a Woman',641662,6.5803,7,'1zLKbMAZNGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24056,_binary '\0','/iYsBDryYLTwkhcLKwP8u83ArwzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1116182',6.2,2364,'en','Affinity','A grieving upper class woman becomes a \"Lady Visitor\" at Millbank prison, hoping to escape her troubles and be a guiding figure in the lives of the female prisoners. Of all her friendships with prisoners, she is most fascinated by Selina - a medium.','/riT2rqSggvjG2NeXFu4Z1KIvbul.jpg','2008-12-28',120,'Released','The most mysterious spirit is desire','Affinity',14766,1.5485,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24057,_binary '\0','/2RmJI0jfXMFF0br3pXQsHiy3lgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1116184',7,71704,'en','Jackass 3D','Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Steve-O, Wee Man and the rest of their fearless and foolhardy friends take part in another round of outrageous pranks and stunts. In addition to standing in the path of a charging bull, launching themselves into the air and crashing through various objects, the guys perform in segments such as \"Sweatsuit Cocktail,\" \"Beehive Tetherball\" and \"Lamborghini Tooth Pull.\"','/uPirN07su7LFixyZyLrNMMQ9u1E.jpg','2010-10-15',94,'Released','3 Times the Laughs. 3 Times the Stupid. 3 Times the Pain.','Jackass 3D',16290,5.0383,6.643,'fKwjU_pSSW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24058,_binary '\0','/sSrU5zYRqraYqNl2xsQOonNQbhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11162260',5.6,3668,'en','Grafted','When an awkward but brilliant Chinese student wins a scholarship into a prestigious New Zealand University, she finds a new way of achieving the popularity she craves one bloody body at a time.','/u53wFzLoJD7om52Hjma8G27LS2h.jpg','2024-09-12',93,'Released','Beauty is only skin deep.','Grafted',1201262,3.1877,5.765,'pNMhYjISQz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24059,_binary '\0','/zQNWUUyg96tWxWU7rP2Vyg9lv1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11162490',6.5,2422,'en','The Drover\'s Wife: The Legend of Molly Johnson','In 1893, heavily pregnant Molly Johnson and her children struggle in isolation to survive the harsh Australian landscape after her husband left to go droving sheep in the high country. One day, she finds a shackled Aboriginal fugitive named Yakada wounded on her property. As an unlikely bond begins to form between them he reveals secrets about her true identity. Realizing Molly’s husband is actually missing, new town lawman Nate Clintoff starts being suspicious and sends his constable to investigate.','/uvPHL0ADhbYGFBVpAaWiV0wOrOJ.jpg','2022-05-05',109,'Released',NULL,'The Drover\'s Wife: The Legend of Molly Johnson',722800,2.6583,5.9,'Ph34_UEOH5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24060,_binary '\0','/r5kRuUAGwCB4Hb5qJPaJahEnMCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11163028',5.5,1928,'hi','House Arrest','A world-weary man’s self-imposed home confinement becomes a comedy of errors with the simultaneous arrivals of a peculiar package and a curious journalist.','/xHAx1klAv4wYfraTYbpoaDtGPw2.jpg','2019-11-15',104,'Released',NULL,'House Arrest',645998,2.4151,6.3,'Rzr4OPNZtY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24061,_binary '\0','/yAk1PpHMG6BY6ABlpWAXPyKZDmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11165716',5.9,3432,'en','North Hollywood','A kid must decide between choosing the future his father wants and following his dream of becoming a pro skater.','/rLVxpEkiSs8OnOqg8QmLT7Bs09e.jpg','2021-03-26',94,'Released','Your board. Your rules.','North Hollywood',681355,2.352,5.4,'Uxku-2gH6Nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24062,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11166002',3.9,3174,'en','Stanley Stanton','Forced to watch flashbacks of his life, a pious man comes to the realization he\'s dead and on his way to hell. Inspired by a true event.',NULL,NULL,62,'Released',NULL,'Stanley Stanton',753942,0.4244,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24063,_binary '\0','/2PArtmq7XyzjKreYpQo6nYbr92l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11167818',4.5,1327,'tr','Türkler Geliyor: Adaletin Kılıcı','The period after the Sultan Mehmed II (the Conqueror) conquered Constantinople, moving towards Europe in the fifteenth century , and Sultan Mehmed\'s determination to spread Islam in Europe by the superb morals of Muslims then.','/ygjhsV4Hoeif83yf0Evk5BKLz8D.jpg','2020-01-23',125,'Released',NULL,'The Turks are Coming: The Sword of Justice',665766,1.2743,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24064,_binary '\0','/mu2zE9NwTFZFG2ITRSGidV4YR8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11171322',6.3,1284,'en','Our Christmas Love Song','When country star Melody Jones is accused of plagiarizing her holiday single, she returns home to spend Christmas with her estranged family and old flame and learns what is important in life.','/y9rOT7fNTGN74FdLe4S9i8saluw.jpg','2019-11-24',80,'Released',NULL,'Our Christmas Love Song',631403,2.0164,6,'9nU7Dxwzm28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24065,_binary '\0','/f37yoKQgfR458v4AkTK6CIOgVoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11173106',8,2488,'pa','ਸੁਫਨਾ','Sufna, Dream, there is saying that, “dream is not, which you have while sleeping, dream is the one, which doesn’t let you sleep. This is story about that kind of dream. How a young man from very humble background achieve, what he aims for, and in this journey how a young girl from humble background only, become his back bone, become his strength and motivational source.','/ozso0mV2H6Yke5L6mgZnripGwez.jpg','2020-02-14',144,'Released',NULL,'Sufna',672143,0.7588,9.4,'5Z0XEsuJPX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24066,_binary '\0','/11q5P8kjb5sJFC7DwpArL4ikd3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11173160',6.8,1929,'pa','ਕਿਸਮਤ 2','A story about unrequited love – the shapes it takes, the ways it changes us, and the exhilarating and often heartbreaking ride it takes us on. It is the journey of three characters – Shiv, Bani, and Majaz, on how their lives intertwine and navigate through life, love, and heartbreak.','/tze9VKYpS02E0h6A0RvSb9jw6FI.jpg','2021-09-23',150,'Released',NULL,'Qismat 2',860878,0.8916,5.8,'fF2zgAIGgBU','YouTube','Trailer','202