derestimate the politics of friendship','The Special Relationship',45371,1.8802,6.4,'uWHjHMrRiE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24075,_binary '\0','/6Urx7y2CQQvxIlzk5R0BpOKI2NR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11177804',6.6,3003,'zh','姜子牙','Atop the ruins of war, top commander Jiang Ziya is given the task to banish the Nine-tailed Fox Demon who threatens all mortals\' very existence. When he discovers the Nine-tailed Fox\'s life linked to the soul of an innocent girl, he is faced with a challenging decision: follow the will of heaven or find his own path to righteousness.','/eDq4dGgNHxPbT3Y5S6mfymsQ0rQ.jpg','2020-10-01',105,'Released','No soul should be denied salvation.','Jiang Ziya',635389,3.0401,7.288,'wc4vZdG3bZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24076,_binary '\0','/AfWtIzrdB0HMQ0Swequza4Jo1Kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11182810',4.5,1289,'th','เอไอหัวใจโอเวอร์โหลด','A modern love story set in the near future where an AI building is powered by human feelings. Due to a software glitch, it falls in love with a real girl, escapes the building into the body of a real man, and tries to win her affections.','/sBiJOvHCSWORnFpc4yItflIkdTi.jpg','2022-02-15',95,'Released','No life doesn\'t mean no feelings, No heart doesn\'t mean no love.','AI Love You',928769,2.051,6.2,'kVlPF24TXsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24077,_binary '\0','/lsTmgg4l4vsl014G58YLcw7lRuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11182984',5.2,1692,'ml','കാവൽ','Thampan and Antony are a long time best friends and business partners who owned a saw mill at Kattappana in the past. A family tragedy and its falling-out separates them for good. But now Antony and his family faces a grievous situation, and he is forced to ask his old friend for a help out. The timeline of the story spans over two generations','/uP15yTnZHc12JztbTCF00q94UTh.jpg','2021-11-25',148,'Released',NULL,'Kaaval',834666,0.8364,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24078,_binary '\0','/rxOh6SQzLmrl5sRhPTsTRQvthU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11182994',7.2,4233,'nl','Zillion','It\'s 1997. Frank Verstraeten, a computer genius with a nose for business, a fascination for nightlife and an unhealthy urge to prove himself, only wants one thing: his own disco that not only outperforms the competition but simply humiliates it. The futuristic mega discotheque Zillion is a fact and Frank turns from computer dealer to the pivotal figure of the Antwerp nightlife. He parades with the most beautiful women in Belgium and forges an alliance with Dennis Black Magic, the porn king who provides the spicy extras. Unfortunately, beautiful songs don\'t last long either.','/ns7LIqVWrPbO2FYPQ0ec6mfziSc.jpg','2022-10-26',138,'Released','The rise and fall of the country\'s biggest disco ever.','Zillion',678870,1.8723,7,'TWyw2Yxjsok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24079,_binary '\0','/lTbbch1mAfPSjuYkDgeG2Xn2suA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1118687',4.4,1916,'en','Plague Town','An American family visiting their Irish roots accidentally stumbles on a horde of bloodthirsty mutant children.','/rLIdcCXTZ10iE3fazzQk6nIxp6G.jpg','2009-04-03',85,'Released','It\'s in the blood.','Plague Town',27612,1.1659,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24080,_binary '\0','/iBrj90zbTVhrY18Bkc7UMcqklzy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11187484',4.8,1341,'ar','لص بغداد','In an atmosphere of suspense and excitement, Yousef, Khaled, and Nadia embark on a journey to locate the tomb of Alexander the Great, which has been sought by everyone for years.','/5fIi95LZBATgdMfNkASLBdqodh8.jpg','2020-01-22',102,'Released',NULL,'The Thief of Baghdad',638796,1.1693,4.9,'aiZZ2g8BO88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24081,_binary '\0','/8Tn0Hgwqi4FX5QnhcCqIImMV6Ma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11188154',6.6,4046,'en','WeWork: or The Making and Breaking of a $47 Billion Unicorn','Explore the rise and fall of one of the biggest corporate flameouts and venture capitalist bubbles in recent years – the story of WeWork, and its hippie-messianic leader Adam Neumann.','/yfRPVpEwlTFmnUyB4CpyFG2Wtz1.jpg','2021-03-17',104,'Released','Fake it until you break it.','WeWork: or The Making and Breaking of a $47 Billion Unicorn',795622,1.6403,6.6,'HVAESeO7dgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24082,_binary '\0','/rdgyJHQJjGEySwHuh69NQtpjpLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11188560',6.3,2581,'da','Smagen af sult','Maggie and Carsten love each other, they have two wonderful children and run their own gourmet restaurant; Malus. They want it all. And they have it all. Almost. They are missing the coveted Michelin Star. It has been their dream, on which they gambled everything to win. One day Carsten receives a letter saying that his wife loves somebody else. But who sent the letter and why? In their continuous passion and pursuit for the ultimate recognition, they forget that the meals of life are best enjoyed together.','/aMy7XXgivypcXjPUeLiYOdVxX8f.jpg','2021-06-24',104,'Released',NULL,'A Taste of Hunger',766105,5.433,6,'Z4to5MMqjWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24083,_binary '\0','/5lqXZh4X1dbX7stB4dF0xuBEpcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11188624',5.2,5087,'en','Seance','At an elite boarding school for girls, six friends jokingly engage in a late night ritual, calling forth the spirit of a dead former student who reportedly haunts their halls. Before morning, one of the girls is dead, leaving the others wondering what they may have awakened.','/roYaaPorqPvazR0sh1aTl64Fjsu.jpg','2021-05-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Seance',641668,5.5422,5.581,'KXF5dCtiwAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24084,_binary '\0','/zyYALOPogydDZgBQEcaCIBhkS5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11188850',7.7,1247,'de','Biking Borders - eine etwas andere Reise','Best friends Max and Nono bike from Berlin to Beijing, collecting donations to build a school for a unique fundraising adventure in this documentary.','/quNvMJFtFtzjj9cfcnIr5MXtIDF.jpg','2021-02-19',89,'Released',NULL,'Biking Borders',798727,1.0225,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24085,_binary '\0','/4tgufJtAu4YfO2Uth1WTQs8I3Iv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11189056',6.9,1576,'te','జార్జ్ రెడ్డి','George Reddy is a biopic based on the life of a student leader, boxer and Gold medalist, who influenced the politics of Andhra Pradesh state in Osmania University between 1967 and 1972. He is often remembered for inspiring revolutionary thoughts until he was brutally murdered at his hostel in 1972.','/kuDHRHN4GlMPT8EHXmC15SRMmrP.jpg','2019-11-22',153,'Released',NULL,'George Reddy',649956,0.8852,6.688,'v5ykabwjjxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24086,_binary '\0','/qykwO2eb5lpbPyv5oQPkc932lN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11190652',6.4,1452,'fr','La Fine Fleur','Eve used to be one of the most famous rose creators in the world. Today, her company is on the verge of bankruptcy. On top of that, her secretary Vera has hired three outcasts with absolutely no gardening skills. Though they have nothing in common, they come up with the most crazy plan that could change their lives forever...','/n483iObdjFSkz2AOivAAHloDBr2.jpg','2021-06-30',105,'Released','Every garden blooms in its own season','The Rose Maker',716920,2.4502,6.6,'9XRxGj_ZKXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24087,_binary '\0','/uBZQOYZLIU9dBmd62fdzBAoropu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11191124',8.4,2979,'en','Primal: Tales of Savagery','Genndy Tartakovsky\'s Primal: Tales of Savagery features a caveman and a dinosaur on the brink of extinction. Bonded by tragedy, this unlikely friendship becomes the only hope of survival.','/9NBBkdxH0TjQEBSN2AzeE1sgsF9.jpg','2019-11-21',85,'Released',NULL,'Primal: Tales of Savagery',704264,3.3495,8.423,'vaOn8koDa9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24088,_binary '\0',