ary '\0','/wddNG1To5jUwmX8gwcGjZSpckwg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11204094',6.9,16476,'en','The Duke','In 1961, a 60-year-old taxi driver steals Goya’s portrait of the Duke of Wellington from the National Gallery in London. It was the first (and remains the only) theft in the Gallery’s history. What happens next becomes the stuff of legend.','/zXlj7NgSWg0NbK2zfUh0nbGZVuz.jpg','2021-07-23',96,'Released','A priceless true story.','The Duke',645689,6.8815,6.947,'2B2bxcnt4S4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24104,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11204286',7,2151,'hi','Vellapanti','Vellapanti story revolves around four childhood friends who struggle to fulfill their ambitions but each time find themselves in a soup.','/gvR7WpoMstnmx6zzXOslQtFLNEi.jpg','2025-05-30',139,'Released',NULL,'Vellapanti',1493846,1.0734,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24105,_binary '\0','/sQq5ueqHpBUk5DJZv81haIKalcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11204372',3.1,1351,'en','Goblin','A young woman fights to protect her son from her abusive new husband and a ferocious creature lurking in the shadows.','/soxA2JbZcmyEPNzloScDYzJiPCp.jpg','2020-10-29',72,'Released',NULL,'Goblin',758897,1.5446,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24106,_binary '\0','/iLkzQbxrkTxuAjZMnOiVeVY4pG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11206302',5.5,2686,'fr','30 Jours Max','Rayane is a scared and clumsy young cop who is constantly mocked by other cops. The day his doctor wrongly tells him that he has only thirty days to live, he understands that this is his last chance to become a hero within his police station and impress his colleague Stéphanie. The eternal fearful man then turns into a real hothead who will take all the risks to catch a big drug lord...','/pWacsD87962qkDniAz1odA7mGRI.jpg','2020-10-14',87,'Released',NULL,'30 Days Max',613377,3.1487,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24107,_binary '\0','/kUF5a6TFzb84peU832mH7q0AXGm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11207902',4.9,1650,'es','Lejos de casa: éxodo venezolano','Samuel, a young Venezuelan, emigrates from his country in search of a better life and to help his family, without knowing the difficult situations that he will face as an immigrant.','/tT1bupD3e8pOu7USF4PMx3FrOFC.jpg','2020-03-13',70,'Released',NULL,'Far from Home: Venezuelan Exodus',714916,0.4382,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24108,_binary '\0','/4rG1plEZf2QCV1Ps5CK6s0Jy13e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1120897',5.2,3138,'hi','धन धना धन गोल','A bankrupt soccer team must win the championship or break apart.','/blecQPVoYDTNKPMYlOm2WNHuSYw.jpg','2007-11-23',167,'Released','Heroes Will Rise','Dhan Dhana Dhan Goal',41511,1.3869,5,'Qniw6e8iUOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24109,_binary '\0','/tzNx4y7kYf1Xw3F3T6QxrE7PPwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11209212',5.8,8685,'en','See for Me','When blind former Olympic skier Sophie Scott cat-sits in a secluded mansion, she gets caught in the crossfire of a home invasion scheme. She must rely on a sighted Army veteran via the See for Me app to help her survive the night.','/qk1ZERG6yhwAJqTobmDgw8jRL2C.jpg','2022-01-07',92,'Released','Seeing is surviving.','See for Me',825808,3.3662,6,'8VflBX5Sr6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24110,_binary '\0','/x1ys59FVBENl3F1nchwxL1hjQer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1120945',6.2,3914,'en','Tony','Unemployed and unemployable, Tony is a sympathetic recluse with severe social problems, an addiction to VHS action films and a horrible moustache. Occasionally he snaps and murder is the result…','/cPztnCyi5LB3uo98UnoGbAay9wy.jpg','2010-02-05',76,'Released','Keeping a neighbourhood watch.','Tony',32904,1.4481,6,'Qa5LrbGOXws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24111,_binary '\0','/fAqpfILTPsaKpAzoAvkXf5glgSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1120985',7.3,228397,'en','Blue Valentine','Dean and Cindy live a quiet life in a modest neighborhood. They appear to have the world at their feet at the outset of the relationship. However, his lack of ambition and her retreat into self-absorption cause potentially irreversible cracks in their marriage.','/dc8BdKnDY5Iy28KzUGtHIXuqqFK.jpg','2010-12-26',112,'Released','A Love Story.','Blue Valentine',46705,7.6523,6.97,'aw0NChcdQfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24112,_binary '\0','/hdoHevtldtX0ke5b1OUR1nNdhC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11210032',6.8,2278,'zh','误杀','Li and his wife A Yu run a small business in Thailand and enjoy a happy home life with their two daughters. When their eldest daughter is violently assaulted, blackmailed and left traumatised by another student, her parents intervene, leading to a dead body which needs to be hidden, and every trace of the boy buried to cover up the accident.','/1pjSsjhkv4tiFe2wTE3VPycQY6a.jpg','2019-12-13',112,'Released',NULL,'Sheep Without a Shepherd',652783,2.8193,7.561,'F6M8GIq7xFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24113,_binary '\0','/k2pIYrDQPxAuErkyXrGOOruf8Uv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11210390',5.1,13983,'fr','Astérix & Obélix : L\'Empire du Milieu','Gallic heroes and forever friends Asterix and Obelix journey to China to help Princess Sa See save the Empress and her land from a nefarious prince.','/ifOqT5SmA4ANjmyEacLw3KAFKUd.jpg','2023-02-01',111,'Released',NULL,'Asterix & Obelix: The Middle Kingdom',643215,8.78,4.8,'poBI837NxbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24114,_binary '\0','/2EyK8wpLdYFaS35o0worjqsiuZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121096',5.5,85233,'en','Seventh Son','John Gregory, who is a seventh son of a seventh son and also the local spook, has protected the country from witches, boggarts, ghouls and all manner of things that go bump in the night. However John is not young anymore, and has been seeking an apprentice to carry on his trade. Most have failed to survive. The last hope is a young farmer\'s son named Thomas Ward.','/7Q8DfXSjcFSSQDOxz1Sk865wNqI.jpg','2014-12-12',102,'Released','When darkness falls, the son will rise.','Seventh Son',68737,14.2307,5.5,'5i90Qr0Qi6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24115,_binary '\0','/mIrNZQw4u9fpGyllxoYEmQrdYR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11212572',5.8,9237,'en','Nocebo','A fashion designer suffers from a mysterious illness that puzzles her doctors and frustrates her husband until help arrives in the form of a Filipino caregiver who uses traditional folk healing to reveal a horrifying truth.','/3FPnDTlX0LsaU4VD5mc82BMbchA.jpg','2022-11-03',96,'Released','Sanity hangs by a thread.','Nocebo',782936,4.1077,6.035,'09CnuYQe1fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24116,_binary '\0','/uG6VVzU97dqIpZg1o39oHgJpvOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11213372',6,12022,'tr','Azizler','Entrenched in a midlife crisis, Aziz seeks solace from his mundane job, lonesome friends and rowdy family while pretending to have his act together.','/wMVAcoYtfQuoEBxtZhCJAAJTafE.jpg','2021-01-08',96,'Released',NULL,'Stuck Apart',646955,1.2683,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24117,_binary '\0','/3sYwP6EA66g4pi7Z3TH2k3zMuEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11213600',4.3,5552,'hi','सरदार का पोता','A devoted grandson\'s mission to reunite his ailing grandmother with her ancestral home turns into a complicated, comic cross-border affair.','/nlQFKybBpJrpKS65wd7lhiSpnkt.jpg','2021-05-18',140,'Released',NULL,'Sardar Ka Grandson',734780,1.5239,7.052,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24118,_binary '\0','/hTCr9dDf0EcBGZSUaY0YCeBjBr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11214558',6.3,77719,'en','The Smashing Machine','In the late 1990s, up-and-coming mixed martial artist Mark Kerr aspires to become the greatest fighter in the world. However, he must also battle his opioid dependence and a volatile relationship with his girlfriend Dawn.','/cwwvrdYeIrARXdiv09GIO6XWK5l.jpg','2025-10-01',123,'Released','The unforgettable true story of a UFC legend.','The Smashing Machine',760329,10.3481,6.4,'21OUFEZGXIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24119,_binary '\0','/6VZF8JVNOgJX56WCapYaqcVQiAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11214590',6.6,177011,'en','House of Gucci','When Patrizia Reggiani, an outsider from humble beginnings, marries into the Gucci family, her unbridled ambition begins to unravel the family legacy and triggers a reckless spiral of betrayal, decadence, revenge, and ultimately… murder.','/oJCQjD2byiVF1EG408F9dBn9ndU.jpg','2021-11-24',158,'Released','A legacy worth killing for.','House of Gucci',644495,11.2715,6.56,'eGNnpVKxV6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24120,_binary '\0','/xKG5h7UXdKL5ve7ewtvXvLHM6l5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121786',6.1,1554,'en','Formosa Betrayed','In the early 1980s, an FBI Agent is assigned to investigate the murder of a respected professor. Through his investigation, he unearths a spider web of international secrets that has been thriving within college campuses across America for decades. His investigation takes him across the Pacific to the island nation of Taiwan, where with the help of the outspoken widow and an unlikely spy, he learns that the Professor\'s killing was not a random act, but a desperate move by a scandalous government intent on keeping its nefarious activities under wraps. Our detective soon finds himself on a collision course against the U.S. State Department, the Chinese Mafia, and the Nationalist Chinese Government - in a land where the truth is not what it seems and the only people he can trust, cannot be trusted at all. Inspired by actual events.','/yN0qqQwoeTiTudll2Q1AVPM9qrT.jpg','2010-02-26',103,'Released',NULL,'Formosa Betrayed',41616,1.6587,6.1,'2KbAGhECVZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24121,_binary '\0','/mfu8cTvpJwrnu3sm2vDqh7o4yXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121794',7.7,20151,'ja','ストレンヂア -無皇刃譚-','Pursued by formidable Chinese assassins, young Kotaro and his dog run into No Name, a mysterious stranger who gets pulled into the chase. The unlikely companions form a bond over saving the dog from a poison attack, but chaos erupts when the assassins find Kotaro, and No Name must face his past before a horrible fate is met again.','/lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg','2007-09-29',103,'Released',NULL,'Sword of the Stranger',13980,3.956,7.6,'ECRj6TKwPBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24122,_binary '\0','/893hqH2OLQo1Vv0dwHtQmrfP3fT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11219254',7.5,5135,'ja','花束みたいな恋をした','Two people meet each other after missing the last train home, leading to a beautiful relationship over five years.','/73EMVPCQ3G2mTLgXJrFuOgxJfkp.jpg','2021-01-29',124,'Released','My heart was pounding as I had a feeling that something was about to happen.','We Made a Beautiful Bouquet',695932,3.6475,7.746,'l4BWZ8lwzYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24123,_binary '\0','/oTbIfHSLNxi9ihV6SG4K6jZ2PvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121931',6.1,168684,'en','Crank: High Voltage','Chelios faces a Chinese mobster who has stolen his nearly indestructible heart and replaced it with a battery-powered ticker that requires regular jolts of electricity to keep working.','/tzTC4EEvF0OPL63frEiogxL2T8M.jpg','2009-04-16',96,'Released','He was dead... but he got better.','Crank: High Voltage',15092,12.6259,6.091,'t2koYVqwzT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24124,_binary '\0','/tCQfubckzzcuCbsGugkpLhfjS5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121948',5.7,18949,'en','The Killer','Zee is a feared contract killer known as \"the Queen of the Dead,\" but when she refuses to murder a young blind woman, she finds herself hunted both by criminal colleagues and a determined police detective.','/6PCnxKZZIVRanWb710pNpYVkCSw.jpg','2024-08-22',126,'Released','Some alliances form. Others will crumble.','The Killer',970347,8.2636,6.3,'zgNOS5ofQhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24125,_binary '\0','/f8CoZJ57F0KAZbcZEEzB1e8ZCp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1121977',7.2,13407,'en','Mother and Child','The lives of three women have a commonality: adoption. Karen is a physical therapist who regrets that, as a teenager, she gave up her daughter for adoption. Elizabeth was an adopted child and is now a successful lawyer, but her personal life lacks warmth. Lucy and her husband have failed to conceive and now hope to adopt a baby to make their family complete.','/k5CjH4scjbBlGWLdZyUS7NEZf16.jpg','2009-11-07',125,'Released',NULL,'Mother and Child',37080,4.0843,6.6,'o8L7bLS2ro0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24126,_binary '\0','/G3vrVlsqsNPSYvyoG2lTRxVGom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11224358',6.5,3936,'en','Pray Away','In the 1970s, five men struggling with being gay in their Evangelical church started a bible study to help each other leave the \"homosexual lifestyle.\" They quickly received over 25,000 letters from people asking for help and formalized as Exodus International, the largest and most controversial conversion therapy organization in the world. But leaders struggled with a secret: their own “same-sex attractions” never went away. After years as Christian superstars in the religious right, many of these men and women have come out as LGBTQ, disavowing the very movement they helped start. Focusing on the dramatic journeys of former conversion therapy leaders, current members, and a survivor, PRAY AWAY chronicles the “ex gay\" movement’s rise to power, persistent influence, and the profound harm it causes.','/1wikrtZZZoThwnHulB7klQek4Ai.jpg','2021-06-16',101,'Released',NULL,'Pray Away',685264,1.5805,6.7,'tk_CqGVfxEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24127,_binary '\0','/fKxGUfI09ubxe594Nl8Om2cMuxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11225626',6.1,15728,'en','Am I OK?','Lucy and Jane have been best friends for most of their lives and think they know everything there is to know about each other. But when Jane announces she\'s moving to London, Lucy reveals a long-held secret. As Jane tries to help Lucy, their friendship is thrown into chaos.','/qKkaG7HVFVe7C1JuxTGwNz0eSyL.jpg','2024-06-06',86,'Released','It\'s never too late to figure it out.','Am I OK?',641934,4.8212,6.349,'b80FbdimIHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24128,_binary '\0','/oKHWB7SSs8jG7HeJHooMFNhbi6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11225756',7.4,3251,'en','The Lost Leonardo','London, England, 2008. Some of the most distinguished experts on the work of Italian artist Leonardo da Vinci (1452-1519) gather at the National Gallery to examine a painting known as Salvator Mundi; an event that turns out to be the first act of one of the most fascinating stories in the history of art.','/nVXECwOa4g5ZHND6dOxXjQ5bbpT.jpg','2021-08-20',95,'Released','The inside story of the painting that seduced the world.','The Lost Leonardo',822099,2.9081,7.2,'j0lXLGgQjYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24129,_binary '\0','/xY2KqycNihucvl7lODD2gtppHLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1122614',7.1,1411,'en','And Everything Is Going Fine','From the first time he performed Swimming to Cambodia - the one-man account of his experience of making the 1984 film The Killing Fields - Spalding Gray made the art of the monologue his own. Drawing unstintingly on the most intimate aspects of his own life, his shows were vibrant, hilarious and moving. His death came tragically early, in 2004; this compilation of interview and performance footage nails his idiosyncratic and irreplaceable brilliance.','/eKZS0Pib1D2RgfKDvyJM2EulBql.jpg','2010-06-04',89,'Released','A tribute to Spalding Gray','And Everything Is Going Fine',50779,1.4886,6.5,'gNGe1c0C7Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24130,_binary '\0','/cNODQdBJ6FsXMGCDYHeqLsaKhmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1122836',5.8,4608,'en','Alien Trespass','In 1957 a fiery object crashes into a mountaintop in the California desert, bringing the threat of disaster to Earth. Out of the flying saucer escapes a murderous creature, the Ghota, bent on destroying all life forms on the planet. A benevolent alien from the spaceship, Urp, inhabits the body of Ted Lewis, an astronomer and with the help of Tammy, a diner waitress, sets out to save mankind.','/3W6DuB0dp5SSZCvqaJxD25M6Evt.jpg','2009-04-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Alien Trespass',16634,1.9287,5.1,'q0TDh6WdeV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24131,_binary '\0','/1WmkLTcInwkb7Y6s1hnCKs7ea3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11229134',4.1,5814,'hi','दुर्गमती - एक कल्पना','In the skullduggery world of politics and crime, an innocent Chanchal has to pull all on the line to prove her innocence and bring justice to Shakti and the people that he loved so much. As she gets embroiled deep in a web of deceit, Chanchal must face powers both natural and supernatural to fulfill her destiny.','/rjKGGWBAbFApSIljxQNTlFKE5Pj.jpg','2020-12-11',156,'Released',NULL,'Durgamati: The Myth',702550,1.4446,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24132,_binary '\0','/8pZ6XJ2qPsPYqDmA5VwFN20c6rH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11229780',5.6,4281,'en','Infidel','An American is kidnapped while attending a conference in Cairo and ends up in prison in Iran on spying charges. His wife goes to Iran, determined to get him out.','/vglivF7KG7YcojCsqWkkRwad0VE.jpg','2019-11-08',107,'Released','Prisoner. Believer. Fighter.','Infidel',649401,3.5171,5.6,'vBac7GckXnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24133,_binary '\0','/nH41REzItDOt5WlB6fD7sOeslYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11230868',7.5,4069,'ml','കപ്പേള','Falling into an over-the-phone romance with a rickshaw driver, a young woman visits his city when an encounter with a stranger derails their meeting.','/5e6yMw6ipz7DvLbtKAvHjbQAjHr.jpg','2020-03-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Kappela',713854,1.129,6.271,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24134,_binary '\0','/5fTM84fkYowA5szBo7d0YMcsNv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11231440',6.1,4463,'hi','दूर के दर्शन','When the matriarch of a dysfunctional family wakes up after a long induced coma, the members of the household set aside their differences to help her adapt to the changes.','/5oVlpDcPhb2AqH2VCxafMqi4iiR.jpg','2020-02-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Door Ke Darshan',678798,1.091,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24135,_binary '\0','/af3gx7Tuu08pf8ioJU0ok6r407J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1123373',6.6,12496,'zh','狄仁傑之通天帝國','When the future empress Wu Zetian\'s two courtiers die in a mysterious fire, she gets Di Renjie, a former detective and rebel, released from prison to solve the mystery of the fire.','/qWOBV05kNeLyaiA31DFkZlMpta5.jpg','2010-09-18',123,'Released','The Fate of an Empire Is in His Hands.','Detective Dee and the Mystery of the Phantom Flame',48492,4.728,6.6,'qYWsgyisOik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (24136,_binary '\0','/kbOB9DGl8qwhDRcXOmXfmcmadeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11233960',7.2,129828,'en','The Unforgivable','A woman is released from prison after serving a sentence for a violent crime and re-enters a society that refuses to forgive her past.','/1b3dNFDuE7i05TJlXrIC571yR01.jpg','2021-11-24',112,'Released','No one walks free of their past','The Unforgivable',645886,12.1738,7.41,'JNUjx7LZoiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24137,_binary '\0','/5hMDPclWQtw4R3To7Y8BBV2fCra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11235142',8,8297,'kn','ದಿಯಾ','Dia tells the story of a young, introvert girl whose routine life brightens up when she falls for Rohith, one of her fellow college mates. Being an introvert girl and trying to express her love becomes the biggest challenge of her life. This romantic drama will make you lose yourself in the emotional journey of a girl falling in love.','/n038AswpNaZgIWfMEr5cxVAqcsB.jpg','2020-02-07',137,'Released','Life is full of surprises.','Dia',672128,1.8907,6.212,'8GR-W0jGVak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24138,_binary '\0','/5KGrBXvE0cYDwqfEaymvNBVspkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11235772',6.1,52594,'en','The Voyeurs','When Pippa and Thomas move into their dream apartment, they notice that their windows look directly into the apartment opposite – inviting them to witness the volatile relationship of the attractive couple across the street. But what starts as a simple curiosity turns into full-blown obsession with increasingly dangerous consequences.','/8Y4XOIWhpOvSOEn8XrxbkH9yAXO.jpg','2021-08-25',117,'Released','How far will you go for one more look?','The Voyeurs',645710,18.0328,6.532,'_fiCdELSwwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24139,_binary '\0','/ub4jt1vFlcqOPUWMdKW56nM5yPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11236228',6.9,1290,'en','Peace by Chocolate','After the bombing of his father\'s chocolate factory, a young Syrian refugee struggles to settle into his new Canadian small-town life, caught between following his dream and preserving his family\'s chocolate-making legacy. Based on the incredible true story.','/7SXPnOYZscdtyCwH8h2lInnSpGs.jpg','2021-06-17',97,'Released','Starting over is bittersweet.','Peace by Chocolate',681478,1.728,7.1,'vpjDYNSirtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24140,_binary '\0','/4Tn3rRMWlq3GMDNvaoMoJAwcUvx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11238648',4.1,1695,'fa','ما همه با هم هستیم','The adventure of a plane crash with passengers who have different secrets; the secrets that are not supposed to remain hidden forever...','/dlJC3OA9YzDn9jYqT7YL0rXGNoX.jpg','2019-06-05',95,'Released',NULL,'We Are All Together',608976,0.6526,3.4,'12ifPJf_DgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24141,_binary '\0','/acGKpM38ks3FVzs3RHqTweMHB9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11238932',5.7,1302,'es','Explota, explota','Spain, 1970s. While a cruel dictatorship rules an eternally grey country through fear, violence, repression and censorship, María, a young dancer, dreams of bringing bright colours into her life and the lives of others, as she makes her way towards personal freedom and pursues her crazy dream of becoming a TV star; a very funny journey in which she will be comforted by the pop songs of the incomparable Italian singer and dancer Raffaella Carrà.','/wSfwZlSSffa8Cak70S6xWzebnnI.jpg','2020-10-02',116,'Released',NULL,'My Heart Goes Boom!',681509,1.6429,6.2,'VW3wIWqzct0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24142,_binary '\0','/fuPbrgvjHMjGd23jQASJw6mIElx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1123894',3.9,1892,'en','And Then Came Lola','A talented, but distracted photographer, Lola, on the verge of success in both love and work, could lose it all if she doesn\'t make it to a crucial meeting on time. But, as usual, Lola is late. With her job and girlfriend on the line, she has three chances to make it right. In a desperate race through the streets and back rooms of San Francisco, time grows short-will Lola make it? Will she come at all? With a pop sensibility that mixes live action, animation and still photography, And Then Came Lola explores love\'s age old question in a fresh new way, \"If you try, try again, will you finally get it right?\" (Written by M. Siler and E. Seidler)','/hug5nbikVlOC4feNhOq19Vl1vuP.jpg','2009-06-19',71,'Released',NULL,'And Then Came Lola',38645,1.8286,5.2,'M1TV7m1koZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24143,_binary '\0','/93dDAqtrFQk5zeofDtQGExPlYjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11240348',4.2,14277,'en','The Exorcism','A troubled actor begins to unravel while shooting a supernatural horror film, leading his estranged daughter to wonder if he\'s slipping back into his past addictions or if there\'s something more sinister at play.','/ar2h87jlTfMlrDZefR3VFz1SfgH.jpg','2024-05-30',96,'Released','They were making a cursed movie. They were warned not to. They should have listened.','The Exorcism',646683,7.4963,5,'I1lNNd_klK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24144,_binary '\0','/lO3QqiOh2AO47oUVJcgr7axxftH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124035',7.1,240749,'en','The Ides of March','Dirty tricks stand to soil an ambitious young press spokesman\'s idealism in a cutthroat presidential campaign where \'victory\' is relative.','/w8t4UnJnC24S9ygoaFgmMzRbErd.jpg','2011-10-07',101,'Released','Ambition seduces. Power corrupts.','The Ides of March',10316,7.82,6.7,'Uha0XfGBdMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24145,_binary '\0','/crVDxx9KgNW7Bm1wyXqBYpzG2TS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124037',6.9,68817,'en','Free State of Jones','In 1863, Mississippi farmer Newt Knight serves as a medic for the Confederate Army. Opposed to slavery, Knight would rather help the wounded than fight the Union. After his nephew dies in battle, Newt returns home to Jones County to safeguard his family but is soon branded an outlaw deserter. Forced to flee, he finds refuge with a group of runaway slaves hiding out in the swamps. Forging an alliance with the slaves and other farmers, Knight leads a rebellion that would forever change history.','/fTB6p9QwPRKIuK5LtB5CZXlkx5b.jpg','2016-06-24',140,'Released','For justice. For pride. For freedom.','Free State of Jones',316152,6.9141,6.8,'3EMkxEKKSQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24146,_binary '\0','/rmJrzo3dXgEwS2Pgwsr8v2Jwsw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124039',5.7,20414,'en','Echelon Conspiracy','Mysterious cell phone messages promise a young American engineer untold wealth - then make him the target of a deadly international plot. Dangerous security operatives chase the engineer across the globe, while a powerful government official pursues a mysterious agenda that threatens the stability of the entire world.','/eQgT8kdjWJots3dX5Xy11le2vHk.jpg','2009-02-27',105,'Released','Security comes at a price...','Echelon Conspiracy',16325,3.8895,6.141,'UVEusP3F_V0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24147,_binary '\0','/nblp2tk59sOOwt5YN5WAnPo86Wx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124048',3.1,1579,'en','The Last Resort','They were looking for the ultimate getaway, they planned for the perfect paradise vacation; what they’re about to get is a trip no one is prepared for. When a group of five girlfriends heads for the tropics, they relax, hit the beach and step out for a night of partying. All is fun and games, until someone gets hurt. Robbed by their tour guide and left for dead, the girls take shelter in a deserted Mexican resort that is haunted by the unspeakable atrocities of past.','/eYeIUrFnfxC1ehdd3AHPeyakTR0.jpg','2009-08-11',75,'Released',NULL,'The Last Resort',21166,1.3774,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24148,_binary '\0','/j7LyxWitM4Pxoic5hJ7FxYlPHHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11240506',4.9,16498,'pl','W lesie dziś nie zaśnie nikt','Addicted to technology, a group of teens attends a rehabilitation camp in the forest, but a sinister force there intends to take them offline forever.','/5vFCHFVLPcU4M8uNXM1ba9y83Iu.jpg','2020-03-20',102,'Released','They died without internet.','Nobody Sleeps in the Woods Tonight',681019,4.5467,5.221,'tzNyYx-3udQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24149,_binary '\0','/bUxiZrkdLbDAV89ICbKNsuvnfu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124052',7.7,12591,'zh','南京!南京!','In 1937, during the height of the Second Sino-Japanese War, the Imperial Japanese Army has just captured Nanjing, then-capital of the Republic of China. What followed was known as the Nanking Massacre, or the Rape of Nanking, a six week period wherein tens of thousands of Chinese soldiers and civilians were killed.','/xY6OUM2aRCmmq1ySTg2eu5rVmcq.jpg','2009-04-22',132,'Released',NULL,'City of Life and Death',21345,3.2151,7.416,'KGvrEIIQDj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24150,_binary '\0','/k92xXjOcVJxPpIDPKXRFsy8D6gn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11241514',5,1220,'en','A Cheerful Christmas','Lauren and her best friend Colleen think they have landed their dream job – giving people the best and most magical Christmas ever as their personal ‘Christmas Coaches.’ This holiday season promises to be their biggest ever when they land a royal client, the Anderson family, who has moved from England. When Lauren meets James, the eldest son, he wants nothing to do with planning Christmas as he’s busy negotiating a big acquisition for his father’s company. But Lauren won’t be thwarted in helping this royal family embrace the true spirit of Christmas. The more she prods James about their family holiday traditions the more he opens up. Sparks start to fly but she faces competition in the form of an old childhood friend and business colleague of James. Now Lauren must win his heart while giving the Andersons their best Christmas ever.','/nFz39wwxg559fRF870HLn212Hcn.jpg','2019-12-15',83,'Released',NULL,'A Cheerful Christmas',642333,1.3708,5.6,'wpHqUEvQ4EQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24151,_binary '\0','/nGzP8nBJrVvb8YWcS0NByTBvNnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124215',4.6,1235,'en','Queen Sized','Maggie Baker has a weight problem, and her high school classmates won\'t let her forget it. They shamelessly ridicule her, and even go so far as to nominate her for Homecoming Queen as a joke. Maggie, however, decides to take the nomination seriously, collects the required signatures and starts campaigning. A number of students get behind her, threatening the chances of the popular clique -- who resolve to sabotage Maggie\'s campaign by any means necessary.','/f9SAkEbXB8eCu8SshN2Ce1hdVpZ.jpg','2008-01-12',87,'Released','Based on a true story','Queen Sized',73198,1.3683,4.8,'UXbAqSTxsVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24152,_binary '\0','/uKL39lSf3rQbcMG8XbByoHBwGId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11242162',7,9322,'en','Rise','After emigrating to Greece from Nigeria, Vera and Charles Antetokounmpo struggled to survive and provide for their five children, while living under the daily threat of deportation. Desperate to obtain Greek citizenship but undermined by a system that blocked them at every turn, the family\'s vision, determination and faith lifted them out of obscurity to launch the careers of three NBA champions.','/slkVQhehnP3h40y7mfbYDfv8sWB.jpg','2022-06-23',113,'Released','A king will come from across the sea.','Rise',759054,2.7856,7.554,'numzJtJWT8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24153,_binary '\0','/oLA6GlYvfUAAzITiXo56NEKjVQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11242218',5.6,12081,'en','Books of Blood','A journey into uncharted and forbidden territory through three tales tangled in space and time.','/bXLVZGgLgd7OwbfP6fC5GCfrxuD.jpg','2020-10-07',107,'Released','All stories end here.','Books of Blood',715123,4.3408,6.3,'vj3sRzcvCJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24154,_binary '\0','/hrICi1rF4HkCyMYt9fFnRGixZcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11242242',5.3,2753,'zh','女鬼橋','Four years after five students mysteriously committed suicide after taking part in a courage test on the ghost bridge in Donghu university, a reporter and a cinematographer are back to that place and try to get everything clear.','/iUEu2FZLWZlLKoFqifK5o33mBHk.jpg','2020-02-27',87,'Released','Never look back.','The Bridge Curse',678489,2.1245,6.286,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24155,_binary '\0','/hpze04ypaOpiErQaCOLqSzbaarv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11242718',5,1325,'en','The Last Victim','Set in the American Southwest, Sheriff Hickey tries to solve the worst case he has seen in his small town, likely caused by a violent local gang led by a fearsome criminal.','/lkMotc2mM4VuJmMPWUkZ8niEFbP.jpg','2022-05-13',103,'Released','No bodies. No convictions.','The Last Victim',866254,2.3908,5.1,'P-bDgXew_AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24156,_binary '\0','/zekovlyvNZ3sxVr9u6CvM3ou78j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11243364',7.8,1379,'en','Andy Murray: Resurfacing','A documentary film that tracks the tennis star’s devastating injury journey between 2017-2019. From the front lines of surgical theatres, to the intimate corners of his home, we live alongside and witness Andy at his most vulnerable. Considered Britain’s greatest sportsman ever, we see why Andy puts himself through the unimaginable to get back to the sport he loves.','/vmkxfwJIl3wQ61g6DYx7DZkEPdY.jpg','2019-11-29',108,'Released',NULL,'Andy Murray: Resurfacing',652074,1.1348,6.8,'_e2jjv4Tl6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24157,_binary '\0','/kLLSSF0Tyuxj0l4tcbZrpxIoesn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124374',4.3,1228,'en','Tomtar & troll: Den hemliga kammaren','Junior, a teenage gnome, wants nothing more than to invent gizmos and gadgets in his tree-house laboratory. But Junior\'s old school father, Jalle, the head gnome of the forest, would prefer his son follow in his footsteps and one day be in charge of his own forest. In spite of their differences, on the eve of the first winter storm Junior helps Jalle distribute food rations. Then disaster strikes.','/vImAazWXNGAHZM3az3RItbwd5W2.jpg','2008-01-31',70,'Released',NULL,'Gnomes and Trolls: The Secret Chamber',29614,1.8007,5.4,'TfjCxwukLVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24158,_binary '\0','/aswmZ0JixLRM0eRiPHGXT6eaTJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124377',7.2,7023,'de','John Rabe','A true-story account of a German businessman who saved more than 200,000 Chinese during the Nanjing massacre in 1937-38.','/y0zOMcRghgJv0CecTRoAFAU9xBh.jpg','2009-04-02',134,'Released','History Needs Extraordinary Heroes','John Rabe',5937,2.4712,7.1,'Eic4y6DI5Ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24159,_binary '\0','/c1WY9jsG3FzS1Hc9BEmSnIZpHui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124378',6.2,1315,'ko','기담','A man and his wife investigate a string of murders, a medical student sees visions of a dead girl, and a child is haunted by her dead parent\'s ghosts.','/dBHVpUMWvSofq7AO1iQ1w9htKvN.jpg','2007-08-01',102,'Released','Love is the kiss of death.','Epitaph',77449,1.5589,6.6,'x0zun0hOK88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24160,_binary '\0','/1AiTSzD75UmKMK6mFtgiuFf94ei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124388',6.3,2977,'en','Play the Game','When ladies\' man David Mitchell (Paul Campbell) gives his lonely grandfather, Joe (Andy Griffith), some pointers on dating, Joe becomes a big hit with the women in his retirement community. But David strikes out with his own tricks when he tries to woo a girl named Julie (Marla Sokoloff). Now it\'s up to Joe to teach his grandson how to win at love without playing games. Doris Roberts and Liz Sheridan co-star in this award-winning comedy.','/48vqo9NZ6SyPohEepFiQNnYvnOg.jpg','2009-02-27',105,'Released','If you want to win at love, you have to play the game.','Play the Game',45708,1.9943,5.8,'rNbriNtEGSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24161,_binary '\0','/yNwoVVgx3avrfwJSgyBtXd7oSGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124394',6.2,7864,'fi','Sauna','It is 1595. Brutal wars have just ended in an uneasy peace between Protestant Sweden and Orthodox Russia. We focus on the spiritual defeats of two conquered Finnish brothers, one a hardened near-psychopathic war hero, the other a gentle scientist in an age with no use for such men. They find themselves in the swampy interior, demarcating the new border with a unit of sadistic Russians.','/9OnBhOx8kAyA3BLi8bx83L2dQbA.jpg','2008-10-17',83,'Released','Cleanse Your Sins.','Sauna',16166,2.0889,6.21,'Zl4NinKU6WA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24162,_binary '\0','/59hXewWkOMqPQTU7fWnz5RNtaLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124396',3.1,2597,'ru','Гитлер Капут!','A Russian WW2 spy spoof following misadventures of a clueless Soviet secret agent trapped inside Hitler\'s inner circle.','/vje50IVDvpphUfzJfIBqxQgeyej.jpg','2008-09-18',99,'Released',NULL,'Hitler\'s Kaput!',52891,1.7033,3.664,'o83pBhBfZh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24163,_binary '\0','/t3K4DIqty4biETEjUGrPP92lZS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1124401',5.5,1523,'en','True Confessions of a Hollywood Starlet','When Hollywood starlet Morgan Carter passes out from alcohol poisoning on the red carpet of her movie premiere, she is whisked away to rehab, then sent to live with an aunt to complete her recovery in rural Indiana. There, she attends high school - changing her name and look to fit in-and live the life of a typical teenager, complete with the mysteries of geography, gym class, real friendship, love and jealousy.','/9AhcV0tblzJ1fp2rHAjW7yMqGz8.jpg','2008-08-09',87,'Released','From red carpet... to rehab.','True Confessions of a Hollywood Starlet',41808,2.1791,5.2,'UJ_PY8zX1fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24164,_binary '\0','/ddJcIY7jO6qipzvrlBzLXR2APcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11245776',6.7,1695,'en','Skin: A History of Nudity in the Movies','The definitive documentary on the history of nudity in feature films from the early silent days to the present, studying the changes in morality that led to the use of nudity in films while emphasizing the political, sociological and artistic changes that shaped that history. Skin will also study the gender inequality in presenting nude images in motion pictures and will follow the revolution that has created nude gender equality in feature films today.','/zjQNcvUianPh2qx98hYttIVaeYa.jpg','2020-08-18',131,'Released',NULL,'Skin: A History of Nudity in the Movies',722926,3.9694,6.5,'fy_miFO0eSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24165,_binary '\0','/ifUfE79O1raUwbaQRIB7XnFz5ZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11245972',6.3,191247,'en','Scream','Twenty-five years after a streak of brutal murders shocked the quiet town of Woodsboro, a new killer has donned the Ghostface mask and begins targeting a group of teenagers to resurrect secrets from the town’s deadly past.','/nD4M4Bx457ryLuKYpxFwQ2IBJ5w.jpg','2022-01-12',114,'Released','It\'s always someone you know.','Scream',646385,17.4084,6.7,'beToTslH17s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24166,_binary '\0','/gXByCtZXMgzrK4pFgCwr3BKmPxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11250720',6.2,3267,'ml','വൺ','Story of Kadakkal Chandran, the Chief Minister of Kerala whose uncompromising attitude towards corruption and his dictatorial actions has gained him a lot of enemies. The events gets more intense when he faces an allegation.','/A4ObXXllNPSo620iCFK321zxCEk.jpg','2021-03-26',151,'Released',NULL,'One',803639,1.3372,5.719,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24167,_binary '\0','/92pRcyIOyPNjzHbiAhhp9JLmZY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1125188',5.5,1593,'en','Frayed','Pat Baker is a small town sheriff. His son, Kurt, is a deranged young man with a dark secret. Sheriff Baker\'s worst nightmare comes true when Kurt escapes from a psychiatric hospital where he was locked away for the brutal murder of his mother thirteen years earlier. Gary, a hospital security guard, sets out into the woods to stop him, but soon finds himself relentlessly hunted by the deranged psychopath intent on killing him and anyone who crosses his path. Sheriff Baker launches an intense search to find his son, only to discover that his daughter, Sara, and her friends are camping in the same woods where Kurt has escaped. Kurt\'s psychosis escalates, as does his vengeful killing spree, culminating in a terrifying, climactic confrontation with Kurt, the sheriff and his family.','/d79orWLtNE9I9vJQb3q8Ze9OxIm.jpg','2007-10-17',111,'Released','Evil burns within the mind of madness','Frayed',50376,2.4332,5,'CYDpuwW-uOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24168,_binary '\0','/cGnaZm6EQOJESde3Vv4v53Zk4gN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11252248',6.5,53160,'en','Dog','An army ranger and his dog embark on a road trip along the Pacific Coast Highway to attend a friend\'s funeral.','/zHQy4h36WwuCetKS7C3wcT1hkgA.jpg','2022-02-17',101,'Released','A filthy animal unfit for human company and a... dog.','Dog',626735,7.5813,7.28,'JL6p4IAI23Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24169,_binary '\0','/aLDQl8iUzrapHOob3VHgmyX1ijj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11252440',6.3,17288,'en','PG: Psycho Goreman','Siblings Mimi and Luke unwittingly resurrect an ancient alien overlord. Using a magical amulet, they force the monster to obey their childish whims, and accidentally attract a rogues’ gallery of intergalactic assassins to small-town suburbia.','/28Y3pxfkRZMhLsw4if6e3J0HD7Q.jpg','2020-09-11',95,'Released','Little girl. Big psycho.','PG: Psycho Goreman',670428,3.5613,6,'L4tizc0IAVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24170,_binary '\0','/28s3uS8WJfBpe1phnh5ApuvGb6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11252490',3.5,1421,'en','Creatures','A group of astronomy students get more than they bargained for after finding an injured alien who is being targeted by a group of bloodthirsty CREATURES!','/f0mO09HUkeYv6DGU51vouK33rCt.jpg','2021-11-26',103,'Released','Jingle Hell, Jingle Hell, Creatures On The Way','Creatures',713479,2.1739,5.1,'KMWMAK0EjlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24171,_binary '\0','/lQpNbp6T8UFI3iPppm8MGDNcGbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1125254',7,9757,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ とびっきりの最強対最強','After defeating Frieza, Goku returns to Earth and goes on a camping trip with Gohan and Krillin. Everything is normal until Cooler - Frieza\'s brother - sends three henchmen after Goku. A long fight ensues between our heroes and Cooler, in which he transforms into the fourth stage of his evolution and has the edge in the fight... until Goku transforms into a Super Saiyan.','/uqTSXqjaSgSAT2lCv3GyZeodQPG.jpg','1991-07-20',48,'Released','Frieza is gone. Vengeance is coming.','Dragon Ball Z: Cooler\'s Revenge',24752,9.1838,7.1,'nqT9HQma79A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24172,_binary '\0','/wKMprNDrGTVKTNWTvRZ0MSt59up.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11253090',4,11567,'ta','அண்ணாத்த','Kaaliyan is a village president in the Madurai district, who is fondly called Annaatthe. His nieces compete with each other to marry him. But, he falls in love with another woman who visits their village. Kaaliyan has a sister who gets married and shifts to Kolkata where she faces some unknown threats. Soon, her brother comes to her aid.','/1T5BAF0RsrQfQik5WtXA30gJlk7.jpg','2021-11-04',163,'Released',NULL,'Annaatthe',752961,2.0102,4.673,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24173,_binary '\0','/odb22pd53XAdk1FvDNKFl0NqKF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11253526',5.4,1380,'ru','Девятая','Petersburg at the end of the 19th century was embraced by a massive enthusiasm for the occult sciences and esotericism. British medium Olivia Reed arrives in the capital of the Russian Empire on tour and gathers crowds of people at her public spiritualistic sessions. At this time, a series of ritual mysterious murders takes place in the city. Girls are abducted on the streets, their mutilated bodies are found in various parts of the city. The investigation is carried out by a young police officer Rostov and his assistant Ganin. With each new victim, things are becoming more confused. Suspicion leads Rostov to Olivia, and he decides to turn to her in the hope that her genuine or imaginary ability to summon the spirits of the dead can help to get on the trail of the killer.','/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg','2019-11-07',99,'Released',NULL,'The Ninth',577028,2.1852,6.3,'So9T0h01uBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24174,_binary '\0','/hxTzMLBHgVVxZ0Vabl6sIxxTJkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11254858',6.5,1475,'es','Yo, adolescente','After the suicide of his best friend and the fire of a local dance called Cromañón, including recitals, illegal parties in an abandoned warehouse and high school, a year passes by in the life of Zabo who writes everything he feels and lives in his blog, \"Memories of a teenager\".','/tBuYNodLru48rGFbBUM8TGBIxb6.jpg','2019-11-18',93,'Released','Someone somewhere has to be going through the same thing.','Memories of a Teenager',649058,2.6587,7.9,'-IoeS5470Dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24175,_binary '\0','/wcJmFsz8RqIhozMwvU81hreTX4i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1125849',7.9,332718,'en','The Wrestler','Aging wrestler Randy \"The Ram\" Robinson is long past his prime but still ready and rarin\' to go on the pro-wrestling circuit. After a particularly brutal beating, however, Randy hangs up his tights, pursues a serious relationship with a long-in-the-tooth stripper, and tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter. But he can\'t resist the lure of the ring and readies himself for a comeback.','/7QH5p5BF582k6qHufCKjftfkqWH.jpg','2008-12-17',109,'Released','Love. Pain. Glory.','The Wrestler',12163,9.2638,7.54,'61-GFxjTyV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24176,_binary '\0','/6HT2Ep7riT2gOf9atuxW6gOY13G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1125929',5.6,3519,'en','Love Ranch','Story of a couple that starts the first legal brothel in Nevada and a boxer they own a piece of.','/INezZQ0bkYMRHUl0AHX699NJak.jpg','2010-06-30',117,'Released','When It Comes To Love... Everyone Pays A Price.','Love Ranch',39845,2.0901,5.4,'I3p_ZNFBqKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24177,_binary '\0','/pL4HULSTKFvncr0YClBFRE5vVqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11260832',6.1,24417,'hi','Bell Bottom','By the early ‘80s, India had already witnessed multiple airplane hijacks. In 1984, the country was made to face another such challenge. BellBottom, a RAW Agent, sees through the plan and thus begins India\'s first overseas covert operation. An operation, lead by a forgotten hero, that went on to create one of the most defining moments for India.','/aSY5LBwNdpMReaZjGBbcB1kvrHU.jpg','2021-08-19',123,'Released',NULL,'Bell Bottom',721048,1.6701,6.2,'A6eZ49O67YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24178,_binary '\0','/7Gt4XQDQ8wOCmumMqg6KA9SXSi0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11261270',2.6,1426,'tr','Zengo','A housewife with a big passion for fashion and with the help of her tailor Fazilet, she is turning her ideas into reality, but she gets competition from her school day friend and rival Menkibe.','/60Xh1xJPS0M2FyHTmnmUGHwlwLw.jpg','2020-03-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Zengo',683809,1.8569,2.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24179,_binary '\0','/z6Pi72HrGhc50GDhDdREUTEh2xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11261532',4.7,1307,'en','The Mannequin','A stylist assistant investigates her sister\'s death in a historic LA building, only to face a vengeful ghost of a serial killer who dismembered victims decades ago. She must escape before she\'s next.','/oFTpB1gzS02LtrsenTWxOKbsMpM.jpg','2025-08-24',85,'Released','She likes to watch.','The Mannequin',1169210,2.6802,5.3,'CDmQaYnyTes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24180,_binary '\0','/mM2U4ZfXlOXS3KmpGT1zf3OHMuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11261830',5.3,2810,'en','The Retaliators','An upstanding pastor uncovers a dark and twisted underworld as he searches for answers surrounding his daughter\'s brutal murder.','/vz4GSAFdKeLQUBoHNGynd716atQ.jpg','2022-09-08',96,'Released','Thou shalt not kill.','The Retaliators',770684,2.5044,5.7,'pw-dmnWt0jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24181,_binary '\0','/bZ3fnTP5mglwmofBuEcroeGsu66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11262098',6.8,1708,'en','Jasper Mall','A year in the life of a dying shopping mall.','/edWew4SOOAiU3Ejz5oqcyKR6Lz5.jpg','2020-01-24',84,'Released','Everything must go','Jasper Mall',654911,0.7996,7.2,'9V7ytbs3y5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24182,_binary '\0','/xH23sRbfMtwZ2oBtBf607VUNrGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11263022',4.6,6179,'en','The Seventh Day','A renowned exorcist teams up with a rookie priest for his first day of training. As they plunge deeper into hell on earth, the lines between good and evil blur, and their own demons emerge.','/dtt2dfMdmlCcgaJZkPPQsIY5oR6.jpg','2021-03-26',87,'Released','God help us.','The Seventh Day',645856,5.1651,5.2,'HJThAgic45Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24183,_binary '\0','/65Db7tvwFObhEEN9cQZ7ubgY6w0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1126514',7.2,1617,'en','Louis Theroux: Under the Knife','Louis Theroux: Under the Knife is a TV documentary written and presented by Louis Theroux about the people and doctors involved in plastic surgery operations. Filmed mostly in the USA, in the programme, Louis himself ends up getting liposuction.','/puy9CWRe7pWzY4h6e2jtiR4ikZm.jpg','2007-10-07',60,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Under the Knife',182979,0.982,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24184,_binary '\0','/2yk1p4atSNCh0DLucGiWd68TL4b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11265320',4.5,5535,'en','Escape the Field','Six strangers suddenly awaken in a remote, endless cornfield. Stripped of their possessions, they are left with only six items: a gun with a single bullet, matches, a lantern, a knife, a compass, and a flask of water. As mysterious sirens blare in the distance and traps appear at every turn, the group realizes it’s been plunged into a cat-and-mouse game with an unseen evil, and survival depends upon solving a diabolical and deadly puzzle.','/3qDumKWwi3YZacMI9u2UoPHWVDi.jpg','2022-05-06',89,'Released','The hunt is on.','Escape the Field',739643,4.3152,4.9,'D-iZ9sdOm18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24185,_binary '\0','/qis71iUABx2eTxN9FzOnLbnJ2OA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1126590',6.9,105369,'en','Big Eyes','In the late 1950s and early \'60s, artist Walter Keane achieves unbelievable fame and success with portraits of saucer-eyed waifs. However, no one realizes that his wife, Margaret, is the real painter behind the brush. Although Margaret is horrified to learn that Walter is passing off her work as his own, she is too meek to protest too loudly. It isn\'t until the Keanes\' marriage comes to an end and a lawsuit follows that the truth finally comes to light.','/203HAjJcLMl7xThcTqZx4zmEGcV.jpg','2014-12-24',106,'Released','She created it. He sold it. And everyone bought it.','Big Eyes',87093,6.5427,7,'lHDNhWUUhFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24186,_binary '\0','/t5S0EaBud0lT4lbn4HvIFZ4EBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1126591',6.4,100217,'en','Burlesque','Ali leaves behind a troubled life and follows her dreams to Los Angeles, where she lands a job as a cocktail waitress at the Burlesque Lounge, a once-majestic theater that houses an inspired musical revue. Vowing to perform there, she makes the leap from bar to stage, helping restore the club\'s former glory.','/3U9zBIibERQZqYKM3N1a4MYgBsN.jpg','2010-11-23',119,'Released','It takes a legend... to make a star','Burlesque',42297,7.4348,7.2,'_KqN85L-Vzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24187,_binary '\0','/cSztWfASWpNVkWtu9Xm44EnxlWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1126596',6.6,13596,'en','Adulthood','After serving six years for killing his schoolmate, a young man learns that someone is out for revenge.','/pKyfNRTkpY5MmoAOCvL2ZmPoPn1.jpg','2008-06-16',99,'Released','After Kidulthood comes...','Adulthood',13058,2.0082,6.2,'rhrJBUMxNMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24188,_binary '\0','/a0Q5G7FFWWI451B5gZncoB34sLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1126618',6.5,88005,'en','Morning Glory','A young and devoted morning television producer is hired as an executive producer on a long-running morning show at a once-prominent but currently failing station in New York City. Eager to keep the show on air, she recruits a former news journalist and anchor who disapproves of co-hosting a show that does not deal with real news stories.','/aFRXEoB3QkeHNHYmVGC3uzFSol8.jpg','2010-11-10',107,'Released','What\'s the story?','Morning Glory',38357,9.5041,6.4,'s9lWUqraDoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24189,_binary '\0','/iDLtDgxLiYsarfdQ4msUhUqoNPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11266868',3.5,1930,'en','Solitary','A man wakes up inside a room to discover he\'s a prisoner sent into space to form Earth\'s first colony, and worse - his cell mate Alana is hell bent on destroying everything.','/ApwmbrMlsuOay5rXQA4Kbz7qJAl.jpg','2020-08-31',89,'Released','The greatest punishment imaginable.','Solitary',725273,2.2876,5,'an_rs7Zx7Qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24190,_binary '\0','/mMMJefGnlHVljm7SLWMW1IsbAnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11267076',6.2,3601,'tr','Dayı: Bir Adamın Hikâyesi','Sent away by his exasperated family to work for the village coffeehouse owner Seyfi in Istanbul, the brave, compassionate, and justice-driven young hero is drawn into the city’s underworld of toughs.','/3OnMKxVftp5KKOHCNMvp5bUsB0.jpg','2021-12-10',125,'Released',NULL,'Uncle: The Story of a Man',718488,1.35,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24191,_binary '\0','/s90hYiKk8vwCXKCDewFrrfzAdV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11269026',5.8,4176,'es','Amor de madre','A young man is stood up at the altar. His overprotective mother decides to join him is what would have been his honeymoon, so as not to waste the trip. He ails while his mum enjoys the trip of her life.','/zmXaK4ajfTUOeb8K13uQ4fNfE8L.jpg','2022-04-29',110,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoon with My Mother',955971,2.6371,6.296,'Y3jXdxCS05U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24192,_binary '\0','/ayvHuuCRijQRQJ439bIMZu0adJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11270054',6.2,1384,'es','La hija','Irene is a fifteen-year-old who lives in a center for juvenile offenders. She just got pregnant and is determined to turn her life around with the help of Javier, an educator at the center. Javier offers her to secretly come live with him and his wife Adela in the house they have in a remote and rugged spot in the mountains so she can hide and comfortably carry out her pregnancy. The only condition is that in exchange, she agrees to give them the baby she is carrying in her womb. This feeble pact will be put in jeopardy when Irene starts to feel like the life growing inside her belongs to her.','/86BwDaGCiPmvCsX86Z4qF3UDlL3.jpg','2021-11-26',122,'Released',NULL,'The Daughter',661931,1.3647,6,'m32DM8RNohE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24193,_binary '\0','/fkn5KBUUKxbG7MjOs9poAOAik40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11271038',7.1,163509,'en','Licorice Pizza','The story of Gary Valentine and Alana Kane growing up, running around and going through the treacherous navigation of first love in the San Fernando Valley, 1973.','/ivXtvzfliGvoJ1DhSHIGyYBToWe.jpg','2021-11-26',133,'Released',NULL,'Licorice Pizza',718032,11.7298,6.944,'ofnXPwUPENo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24194,_binary '\0','/gOQLPvoMhiQHlIxNgIgvYvGkJPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127177',3.8,1874,'en','Croc','A large man-eating crocodile terrorizes tourists and locals near Krabi, in Thailand. Michael Madsen plays a hunter stalking the immense reptile, while sub-plots include a rivalry between a foreigner, who owns a crocodile-farm, and a Thai man who plays a part in framing the foreigner for the crocodile\'s rampage.','/c3moWZrfZRp38FWystfNYTrGOh4.jpg','2007-09-20',100,'Released','It\'s Hunting Season and You\'re the Prey','Croc',35040,1.3917,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24195,_binary '\0','/3tvwsRSIDgwJuaGdh67XZ942UMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127180',6.6,233127,'en','Drag Me to Hell','After denying a woman the extension she needs to keep her home, loan officer Christine Brown sees her once-promising life take a startling turn for the worse. Christine is convinced she\'s been cursed by a Gypsy, but her boyfriend is skeptical. Her only hope seems to lie in a psychic who claims he can help her lift the curse and keep her soul from being dragged straight to hell.','/fdyejM5Zd6dsa0YyWa02ZAKwQzK.jpg','2009-05-27',99,'Released','Christine Brown has a good job, a great boyfriend, and a bright future. But in three days, she\'s going to hell.','Drag Me to Hell',16871,14.1434,6.5,'PPOaxHqoYxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24196,_binary '\0','/zxL056OkVNcJ9PSIH4hyklm4Hat.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11271800',4.5,2487,'en','Mayday','Ana is transported to a dreamlike and dangerous land where she joins an army of girls engaged in a never-ending war. Even though she finds strength in this exhilarating world, she realizes that she\'s not the killer they want her to be, and time is running out for her to get home.','/dNyaHdnXM5ewq0zI0qsdjrpMJ0g.jpg','2021-10-01',100,'Released','Time to wake up.','Mayday',672521,2.5161,5,'BozcVHzX65U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24197,_binary '\0','/2ZlEEDW9MZOhPjmDCbxCIBdChyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11271990',7,1893,'id','Ali & Ratu Ratu Queens','After his father\'s passing, a teenager sets out for New York in search of his estranged mother and soon finds love and connection in unexpected places.','/57qni9eU4dBXponOJ9SJ7rc6Isy.jpg','2021-06-17',100,'Released','A Journey to Find.','Ali & Ratu Ratu Queens',650129,2.1349,6.3,'gl6to9XVpw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24198,_binary '\0','/vVDEI6hCDSIfFKnBjyGM6qPrrTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127221',4.7,3046,'en','Not Forgotten','Set in a Tex-Mex border town, Not Forgotten is a classic psychological thriller about Jack and Amaya Bishop, a couple who must come to terms with their tortured pasts in order to save their kidnapped daughter. It is a tale taut with intrigue and steeped in Latino mysticism, where the line between what\'s real and what\'s imagined becomes hopelessly blurred.','/hRFrQ7XeD25ErwZMRgawcPrWlTK.jpg','2009-09-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Not Forgotten',22135,2.6442,4.963,'q8__vXT0_e4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24199,_binary '\0','/lCwreSN077FKOciOttNxlz7Swp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11272506',6.4,1724,'en','Love in Winterland','Ally, a final contestant on a dating show, must face her high school sweetheart when she is chosen for the Hometown Date.','/jCyQdA1rZBUrCMj81tZy6bak9G9.jpg','2020-01-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Love in Winterland',631430,2.2155,6.6,'IG2-ylVz40Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24200,_binary '\0','/k5XqPLQeK8Jo8daEiCO6pDd9mBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11272898',4.4,2298,'en','Let It Snow','Separated from her fiance after sneaking onto a restricted slope, Mia, a free riding snowboarder, must survive not only against nature, but the masked snowmobile rider in black who\'s out for her blood.','/rAeQaySpt5iSdK8eWOpBnSB8mGQ.jpg','2020-10-09',86,'Released','They were warned','Let It Snow',720395,2.2472,5.093,'UBBmsQQx8kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24201,_binary '\0','/s8GWJcoif5bt4woQAXGlfe7LwoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11274100',5,3932,'en','Archenemy','Max Fist claims he’s a hero from another dimension who has somehow landed on Earth and been stripped of his powers. Instead of treating him like a powerful champion, no one believes Max’s claims — except for a teenager named Hamster and his sister Indigo. The siblings convince Max to help them take out a local drug gang, where Max’s abilities are put to a violent and harrowing test.','/4H54bQrCM6NBm9sqw911scGd4hb.jpg','2020-11-30',90,'Released','A hero comes from within.','Archenemy',727097,3.3114,5.241,'H1Cf8bk6Zhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24202,_binary '\0','/vlHOA4nGo7h0AdZXg6BIi2KQk8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11274306',6.6,1835,'en','A Valentine\'s Match','Fired from her job as a reality TV host, Natalie returns home for Valentine\'s Day, only to find herself running the town festival\'s auction with her ex-fiancé thanks to two scheming mothers.','/oFt5aETu3TnANmS7N6zmZgJL8hh.jpg','2020-02-01',80,'Released',NULL,'A Valentine\'s Match',661331,2.7164,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24203,_binary '\0','/fjWcAbHRxCSR4kLGvsPEhNjR2ts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11274492',5.4,42375,'en','The Out-Laws','A straight-laced bank manager is about to marry the love of his life. When his bank is held up by infamous Ghost Bandits during his wedding week, he believes his future in-laws who just arrived in town, are the infamous Out-Laws.','/5dliMQ2ODbGNoq0hlefdnuXQxMw.jpg','2023-07-07',95,'Released','Meeting the in-laws has never been this dangerous.','The Out-Laws',921636,8.7336,5.985,'R8xepj9wpi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24204,_binary '\0','/bNjhGMu5sF8cnkFTssdGl6WdNYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11274564',6.3,1574,'en','Love on Iceland','Searching for a fresh podcast idea for work, Chloe heads on a spontaneous trip to Iceland with her college friends. She doesn’t expect to run into her ex, Charlie, but what starts as begrudgingly spending more time together, results in new beginnings for them both.','/6Ms64L6H4ffrjz6NwA6NAw1rGjZ.jpg','2020-01-18',84,'Released',NULL,'Love on Iceland',649880,1.4169,6.4,'IT6dslIpHM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24205,_binary '\0','/bftdQMCkQa3KXHWXwAaW0g1p6ZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11276598',3.7,3545,'en','Pets United','When Roger (a Robin Hood-esque, stray dog) and Belle (an elegant yet spoilt pet cat) are thrown together amidst the chaos of a robot take-over of their home city, they must push all their preconceptions aside in order to survive, as they embark on a high-stakes, action-packed adventure.','/gtwqIYSOCRwEndZTg9s6iWjEZc1.jpg','2019-11-08',89,'Released',NULL,'Pets United',638134,8.4853,5.874,'l5VKjgVI00A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24206,_binary '\0','/tFtDA2jR26pb4F0WHHL8qHp150m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127702',7.1,6452,'ru','Мисия Лондон','A concert to celebrate Bulgaria joining the EU is being planned at the Embassy in London and it is the job of VARADIN, the new ambassador, to ensure the Queen attends. But with corrupt staff, criminal gangs operating out of the kitchen, falling in love with a stripper and a little misunderstanding with a PR firm that provides look-alike royalties - his simple task turns into a chaotic nightmare.','/kBodUopMDwI55kpyh7ARzA8ZIup.jpg','2010-04-16',107,'Released',NULL,'Mission London',50400,1.6065,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24207,_binary '\0','/dPJ6Phs6crwoVXiLHntQk2lHz2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127715',7.5,35186,'es','Sin nombre','Sayra, an Indigenous Latina American teenage girl from Honduras, Central America, hungers for a better life. Her chance for one comes when she is reunited with her long-estranged father, who intends to emigrate to Mexico and then enter the United States. Sayra\'s life collides with a pair of Indigenous Latino American gang members from Mexico, North America who have boarded the same USA-bound train.','/dubZwiGWp6TwYNGYtyGEUC7XAin.jpg','2009-03-20',96,'Released','The greatest sin of all is risking nothing.','Sin Nombre',21191,4.3226,7.63,'HFlTivEUlTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24208,_binary '\0','/zQG1FYDqoWo2hYhE5GVZ1yrWSfh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11278476',7.2,14235,'en','Rescued by Ruby','Chasing his dream to join an elite K-9 unit, a state trooper partners with a fellow underdog: clever but naughty shelter pup Ruby. Based on a true story.','/tPlJEodEn0SSV4avo8KSawtlTlN.jpg','2022-03-17',93,'Released',NULL,'Rescued by Ruby',921655,6.5988,7.5,'-Pwxr307O4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24209,_binary '\0','/hbkxvvACRaram9JNEZEPG8730cb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127877',6.4,10666,'en','Cold Souls','Paul is agonising over his interpretation of \'Uncle Vanya\' and, paralysed by anxiety, stumbles upon a solution via a New Yorker article about a high-tech company promising to alleviate suffering by extracting souls. He enlists their services—only to discover that his soul is the shape and size of a chickpea.','/4ejJjTwoEqIKiZJOyPaHlTJh2jL.jpg','2009-08-07',101,'Released','A soul searching comedy.','Cold Souls',30250,2.9369,5.989,'EiPAkcsqgFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24210,_binary '\0','/jccbVVWVtiMAa2VluokCVDwkO4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127881',6.2,2753,'en','Farming','Based on the writer/director\'s childhood, FARMING tells the story of a young Nigerian boy, \'farmed out\' by his parents to a white British family in the hope of a better future. Instead, he becomes the feared leader of a white skinhead gang.','/wndlhQGs0KAwQFhaKTVgPd9lkgM.jpg','2018-09-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Farming',475214,2.1702,6.224,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24211,_binary '\0','/xxNSGfFTDAZrmx5EOVp6wOsKnv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127883',6.2,1441,'en','The Girl','A young Texan mother who loses her child to foster care begins smuggling Mexicans across the border.','/fTHfgbqUjwz3g4Iy8vQSBFEMvQa.jpg','2012-01-15',95,'Released','The journey will change her forever','The Girl',140443,1.9909,6.1,'Tf0mgVMQT8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24212,_binary '\0','/p3Vloy8XQwVFDMmbmM3pu1fCQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127884',2.8,9168,'en','Hannah Montana & Miley Cyrus: Best of Both Worlds Concert','In this concert film, \'Hannah Montana\' star Miley Cyrus performs a slew of hit songs, including \'Just Like You\' and \'Life\'s What You Make It.\'','/wrI1LW6RkiClbEV6wKu19spxhQF.jpg','2008-02-01',82,'Released',NULL,'Hannah Montana & Miley Cyrus: Best of Both Worlds Concert',253353,3.3214,5.7,'62N-cbJeT04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24213,_binary '\0','/uhPAPblYLrp6UJXi0LdUHPTovkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1127896',6.7,31006,'en','Taking Woodstock','The story of Elliot Tiber and his family, who inadvertently played a pivotal role in making the famed Woodstock Music and Arts Festival into the happening that it was. When Elliot hears that a neighboring town has pulled the permit on a hippie music festival, he calls the producers thinking he could drum up some much-needed business for his parents\' run-down motel. Three weeks later, half a million people are on their way to his neighbor’s farm in White Lake, New York, and Elliot finds himself swept up in a generation-defining experience that would change his life–and American culture–forever.','/wIdyAJCvIj3QUoNmmDdnhXpCMpp.jpg','2009-08-26',120,'Released','A generation began in his backyard.','Taking Woodstock',26320,6.0773,6.2,'rDDeqPuIME0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24214,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11280556',4,1380,'en','The Madness Inside Me','Madison Taylor (Merrin Dungey) is a forensic psychiatrist, spending her days interviewing prison inmates and her evenings with her husband Jeremy. When Jeremy is killed in a home invasion by Francis Tate (Devon Graye), her world begins to turn itself inside out.','/hg2fd5pE5zUwxSs2CM8S00ept3s.jpg','2020-09-16',87,'Released',NULL,'The Madness Inside Me',739611,1.4429,4.2,'Kdw4vu0ELP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24215,_binary '\0','/ywVxppdRe8KN53P937p94mcXEoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1128075',8,18435,'ja','愛のむきだし','The story of a teenage boy called Yu, who falls for Yoko, a girl he runs into while operating for the sake of sin as an upskirt photographer in an offshoot of the porn industry. His attempts to woo her are complicated by a spot of cross-dressing - which convinces Yoko that she is lesbian - dalliances with kung-fu and crime, and a constant struggle with the guilt that\'s a legacy of his Catholic upbringing.','/iCjpPMQRh1jcMQl7CZ5P2fR8aXN.jpg','2008-11-29',237,'Released','Jesus, forgive these morons.','Love Exposure',28422,4.9309,7.9,'5Fxa5NuVrqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24216,_binary '\0','/2hWGEtAixfrG8G85nDMB51lENnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11281192',6.4,2514,'ml','ഖല്ബ്','Qalb tells the story of two young hearts falling in love. The ride takes you through the 7 stages of love. The title song \'Qalbee\' describes the spiritual elements of love. Like faith there is no compulsion in love either.','/a49keeFVFV8LN3H7spGrVWuofTn.jpg','2024-01-12',147,'Released',NULL,'Qalb',967353,1.8788,5.273,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24217,_binary '\0','/5nyXTZ1upvFdFmM6LVvHBTqTdr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11281220',6.8,15579,'tr','مست عشق','Story of Rumi, his friendship with Shams Tabrizi, the love he had for him and the great influence of Shams over him in his life, his poetry and his love for God.','/kFz3NdX7zJoBRlSOEGP2eRea0rD.jpg','2024-04-24',118,'Released',NULL,'Intoxicated by Love',678856,2.2024,7.6,'7eRuzyXz7jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24218,_binary '\0','/pgBXz60Rf4zUaXleeIfR0ukIDhS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11284280',5.2,13733,'no','Kadaver','In the aftermath of a nuclear disaster, a starving family finds hope in a charismatic hotel owner. Lured by the prospect of a free dinner, they discover that the evening\'s entertainment blurs the lines between performance and reality. Will they wind up the spectators or the spectacle?','/j8pltHMcL3sAFqd6udZ1kMAlbQg.jpg','2020-10-22',86,'Released',NULL,'Cadaver',692969,2.5455,5.631,'Bc8sZbEEO8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24219,_binary '\0','/aP1Rxa39OdDXx0bP5l4R3LTRxVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11284502',5.8,2563,'en','South of Heaven','Convicted felon Jimmy gets early parole after serving twelve years for armed robbery. Upon his release, he vows to give Annie, his childhood love, now dying from cancer, the best last year of her life – unfortunately it’s not that simple.','/tGOWLmvfmqqdkdHtK5PndZPAduQ.jpg','2021-10-08',120,'Released',NULL,'South of Heaven',645861,3.494,6.4,'nBFlIvCJTo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24220,_binary '\0','/bHBMsK1LPmF9YbKeKcny684kIkK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11285280',6.4,10105,'en','Together Together','When young loner Anna is hired as the surrogate for Matt, a single man in his 40s, the two strangers come to realize this unexpected relationship will quickly challenge their perceptions of connection, boundaries and the particulars of love.','/7cFawQz0urWvzsTbxTojbq11JJE.jpg','2021-04-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Together Together',776515,4.0884,6.34,'Ouq-Bjaiz3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24221,_binary '\0','/2TgMAAstOJjRywwmPeBnpyDiQMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11285908',6.2,7402,'ko','백두산','A group of unlikely heroes from across the Korean peninsula try to save the day after a volcano erupts on the mythical and majestic Baekdu Mountain.','/gCZ0RHifBxZGedde7WPWSgjpyZt.jpg','2019-12-19',128,'Released','Only one chance to save the nation.','Ashfall',581387,6.1731,6.883,'jTiHbwUWkns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24222,_binary '\0','/bcvfG4p48Bh42ju7vxamkP7PZa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11286210',5.3,6439,'en','Master','At an elite New England university built on the site of a Salem-era gallows hill, two black women strive to find their place. Navigating politics and privilege, they encounter increasingly terrifying manifestations of the school\'s haunted past… and present.','/gxbwRHsQ2v6DQv28ttp7pIx7Utj.jpg','2022-03-18',98,'Released','This school is cursed.','Master',680829,3.3401,5.2,'0gShIU_i7O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24223,_binary '\0','/nvxrQQspxmSblCYDtvDAbVFX8Jt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11286314',7.1,681005,'en','Don\'t Look Up','Two astronomers go on a media tour to warn humankind of a planet-killing comet hurtling toward Earth. The response from a distracted world: Meh.','/th4E1yqsE8DGpAseLiUrI60Hf8V.jpg','2021-12-08',138,'Released','Based on truly possible events.','Don\'t Look Up',646380,19.9772,7.054,'RbIxYm3mKzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24224,_binary '\0','/wrEbKIbW1q6AOaZrpiscjTgfBvp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11286640',7.4,9795,'en','Nowhere Special','John, a 35-year-old window cleaner, has dedicated his life to bringing up his 4-year-old son, Michael, after the child\'s mother left them soon after giving birth. When John is given only a few months left to live, he attempts to find a new, perfect family for Michael, determined to shield him from the terrible reality of the situation.','/tqLI37bbDZP9um0Xu9AFWWYvXzB.jpg','2020-09-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Nowhere Special',728142,4.299,7.249,'NOv_J9JzSqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24225,_binary '\0','/r1BmcsQb41zAR