ary '\0','/cB4QEzduhjcwogYVjScWL6aYk7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11295974',6,1598,'ml','എല്ലാം ശരിയാകും','Despite their family\'s disapproval, Vineeth and Ancy elope and get married. After 3 years, Ancy is pregnant and wishes to get in touch with her family. Will the two families belonging to opposing political factions make peace?','/pw5jpZyV7nlaGPPB1Vfp3khL7n6.jpg','2021-11-19',138,'Released',NULL,'Ellam Sheriyakum',865826,0.8257,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24240,_binary '\0','/xgje6VloPsZtGW0KCt24RbDismZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11296058',7.5,4661,'no','Kunstneren og tyven','When two of artist Barbora Kysilkova’s most valuable paintings are stolen from a gallery at Frogner in Oslo, the police are able to find the thief after a few days, but the paintings are nowhere to be found. Barbora goes to the trial in hopes of finding clues, but instead she ends up asking the thief if she can paint a portrait of him. This will be the start of a very unusual friendship. Over three years, the cinematic documentary follows the incredible story of the artist looking for her stolen paintings, while at the same time turning the thief into art.','/ldcenmrQen5x8ZJ4NerYhXESc8z.jpg','2020-09-05',102,'Released',NULL,'The Painter and the Thief',654170,1.5886,7.4,'hcifoEG_Mkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24241,_binary '\0','/c6Rhht2AyPmnDyQg1bxhmuFabvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11296132',4.4,2068,'fa','مطرب','An Iranian family who goes to Istanbul, Turkey. Ibrahim is a nightclub singer who, like other singers of that era, is being removed from the scene with the 1979 revolution. But since Abraham was not well-known at the time, he cannot become a Los Angeles singer. Eventually he becomes the singer of various ceremonies. They just don\'t agree with us and tell us Motreb','/i3xAYEK3U3fsYFVsmLlBtIez3j6.jpg','2020-03-07',107,'Released',NULL,'The Singer',651783,0.9789,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24242,_binary '\0','/VaC0yb0XeXEDrmMFX6FshwUB9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11297214',6,1427,'bn','মিশন এক্সট্রিম','Nabil Al Shahriar is a conscientious police officer of CTTC, is trying to track down a group of terrorists, who want to create inquietude and rampancy of terrorism. To stave them off, he along with his associates tries to find out what they’re up to.','/izz6vcGp7MQXWvNrzLPrXxp1m0u.jpg','2021-12-03',100,'Released','A WAR AGAINST INVISIBLE ENEMY !!','Mission Extreme',708510,1.3705,5.9,'dKW-XTerOdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24243,_binary '\0','/gDgSTQfkDG4y3SyGE2XVRBX80gy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130080',6.5,70340,'en','The Informant!','A rising star at agri-industry giant Archer Daniels Midland (ADM), Mark Whitacre suddenly turns whistleblower. Even as he exposes his company’s multi-national price-fixing conspiracy to the FBI, Whitacre envisions himself being hailed as a hero of the common man and handed a promotion.','/eV8u5crNe4QYWcu0zjKxFVq2Qem.jpg','2009-09-18',108,'Released','Based on a tattle-tale','The Informant!',11323,5.4453,6.2,'21uA1eWi59s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24244,_binary '\0','/ApFIhEYIxYPgW7T3qIQ2e0VAMnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130088',6.6,5147,'en','Is Anybody There?','A young boy who lives in an old folks\' home strikes up a friendship with a retired magician.','/tgCW935L5JCY1tYgJ810kgXPFkf.jpg','2009-04-17',95,'Released',NULL,'Is Anybody There?',22447,2.0852,6.3,'6pTMPnJR53w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24245,_binary '\0','/cyKH7pDFlxIXluqRyNoHHEpxSDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11301886',6.8,105970,'en','Rebel Ridge','A former Marine confronts corruption in a small town when local law enforcement unjustly seizes the bag of cash he needs to post his cousin\'s bail.','/xEt2GSz9z5rSVpIHMiGdtf0czyf.jpg','2024-08-27',131,'Released','Their laws. His rules.','Rebel Ridge',646097,9.9016,6.969,'gF3gZicntIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24246,_binary '\0','/dVViUXK436JNODkj5NwWjMm8NYu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11301946',5.2,39747,'ta','பீஸ்ட்','A former RAW officer, who is among the hostages in a mall taken over by terrorists, has to foil their plans and prevent the government from releasing a dreaded terrorist, who he had helped put in prison at great personal cost.','/yE8bsjy9hvuSY5JdtFlJGXyaTeH.jpg','2022-04-12',155,'Released','The beast is yet to come.','Beast',800383,2.7812,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24247,_binary '\0','/noCgyITVoRxC3huC9zSOQq23sVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11304504',6.3,2791,'en','Catch the Fair One','A Native American boxer embarks on the fight of her life when she goes in search of her missing sister.','/35QvPu5nOGlzDIGOdvtRNNkfjLZ.jpg','2022-02-11',85,'Released','The predators are her prey.','Catch the Fair One',821420,3.859,6.361,'lITIDvp1_o8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24248,_binary '\0','/ehumsuIBbgAe1hg343oszCLrAfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11304740',5.5,51433,'en','Wish','Asha, a sharp-witted idealist, makes a wish so powerful that it is answered by a cosmic force – a little ball of boundless energy called Star. Together, Asha and Star confront a most formidable foe - the ruler of Rosas, King Magnifico - to save her community and prove that when the will of one courageous human connects with the magic of the stars, wondrous things can happen.','/nesuSdJakNkf0zs7OfoasB6Clxf.jpg','2023-11-13',95,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Wish',1022796,13.1344,6.217,'RUu1FjoV9Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24249,_binary '\0','/sLTe3l1SX2h7xjfO0vwKhoQm3hx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11306376',7.4,8946,'te','జాతిరత్నాలు','Three young men leave their village to find decent jobs in the city. However, they find themselves in a pickle when a minister blackmails them for a lost mobile phone.','/7MzvmgHRmhbJH1UZJhRCkAtxvEy.jpg','2021-03-11',148,'Released',NULL,'Jathi Ratnalu',796368,1.6528,7.097,'Hgc07_BX4_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24250,_binary '\0','/k385LkgCMPUTcU1Bne5T1CGfxYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11306518',5.7,2215,'te','హీరో','Arjun is a middle-class guy who wants to become an actor. Along with his friend, he tries to audition for various roles and meet different directors. He has a girlfriend, Subbu, whose father is against Arjun becoming an actor. One day, he accidentally receives a gun as a parcel, which turns his life upside down.','/gUSvQSpR2TXsRbBX2b9Bhwh3jl9.jpg','2022-01-15',132,'Released','Hero','Hero',852357,1.3498,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24251,_binary '\0','/5njql59eLhOqzvygsXocBJxwsGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11306926',7.3,1800,'kn','ಬಡವ ರಾಸ್ಕಲ್','Badava Rascal is the journey of Shankar who lives life on his own terms. When he gets kidnapped along with his friend over trivial issues by goons, how does he get out of the trouble and what is the motto of abduction unravels the theme of the story.','/dzupoaiww3vkobMF8d74aOHeYEE.jpg','2021-12-24',133,'Released',NULL,'Badava Rascal',676223,1.6673,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24252,_binary '\0','/7foER4eomRTlpm6qz9adninUALL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11306932',6.6,1433,'es','Ruido','Julia is a mother, or rather, one of many mothers, sisters, daughters, colleagues, who have had their lives torn apart by the widespread violence in a country waging a war against its women. Julia is searching for Ger, her daughter. And in her search, she will weave through the stories and struggles of the different women she will meet.','/6GemI78Ge0ABs5qM6CnvCPduKEU.jpg','2022-10-13',105,'Released','Where are they?','Noise',960519,1.5617,7.2,'Yzvrpm9bDT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24253,_binary '\0','/hwrR53NC0rQV24ESbqsQxj4nmht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11307724',5.1,7007,'en','John and the Hole','While exploring the neighboring woods, 13-year-old John discovers an unfinished bunker — a deep hole in the ground. Seemingly without provocation, he drugs his affluent parents and older sister and drags their unconscious bodies into the bunker, where he holds them captive. As they anxiously wait for John to free them from the hole, the boy returns home, where he can finally do what he wants.','/vZ28AYbKm8cZdvnWlfCASOmH2ag.jpg','2021-08-06',103,'Released',NULL,'John and the Hole',682532,5.3635,5.4,'uddPHOuQh7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24254,_binary '\0','/7KL4yJ4JsbtS1BNRilUApLvMnc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11307814',5.5,16129,'sv','Red Dot','On a hiking trip to rekindle their marriage, a couple find themselves fleeing for their lives in the unforgiving wilderness from an unknown shooter.','/cMhoSGFMOOZUyvZYB6Q9AR4t6fV.jpg','2021-02-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Red Dot',649087,3.1555,5.9,'t7FwypV69qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24255,_binary '\0','/rbZvGN1A1QyZuoKzhCw8QPmf2q0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130884',8.2,1683866,'en','Shutter Island','World War II soldier-turned-U.S. Marshal Teddy Daniels investigates the disappearance of a patient from a hospital for the criminally insane, but his efforts are compromised by troubling visions and a mysterious doctor.','/nrmXQ0zcZUL8jFLrakWc90IR8z9.jpg','2010-02-14',138,'Released','Someone is missing.','Shutter Island',11324,33.0012,8.197,'qdPw9x9h5CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24256,_binary '\0','/4NQt80Beh9CYf3fMDpbEVl5MTgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130964',5.6,1806,'en','The 5th Quarter','In the wake of a car crash that killed his brother, football player Jon Abbate leads his school\'s struggling team to its most successful season ever.','/syFkrTRZ5aaHqia45cQbhLADkFB.jpg','2010-04-08',97,'Released','Rising from tragedy to triumph','The 5th Quarter',59728,1.9144,5.5,'7Ioj6k0YfcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24257,_binary '\0','/ekvoB0FWr9qwP19ERtNVTikN3qd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130969',6.1,6113,'en','Sinners and Saints','In lawless storm ravaged New Orleans, eleaguered Detective Sean Riley is trying to cope with the death of his young son and the abandonment of his wife. Facing a probable suspension from the department, Riley is teamed with a young homicide Detective, Will Ganz, to help solve a series of brutal murders that have plunged the city into a major gang war. The two quickly realize there is something far more sinister going on than either could have ever imagined.','/UJxJhntlNmceBCxgbXDNi4gG5e.jpg','2010-06-30',104,'Released','His city. His rules. No prisoners.','Sinners and Saints',66193,2.6677,5.6,'kM-vzkPnfNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24258,_binary '\0','/5MBQyk3vnxX420dTSLWROuMk8HN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130980',6.2,2615,'en','Three and Out','A London tube driver considers pursuing a third fatal accident to collect a huge payout.','/fXpNfBlpfKapNg9i5fgtHPabABX.jpg','2008-04-25',98,'Released','1... was an accident. 2... was bad luck. 3... was his chance of a lifetime!','Three and Out',14921,1.7916,5.5,'mlpLfhyB8Y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24259,_binary '\0','/8CJiFI1nRXFngWwFZz97gCDJzvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130981',7.4,3168,'es','Arráncame la vida','A young girl recounts her girlhood and eventual marriage to a general of the Mexican revolution. by one of the most outstanding writers of the new feminist Mexican literature, it is at once a haunting novel of one woman\'s life and a powerful account of post-revolutionary Mexico from a female perspective.','/iYklD0eR48grqzxal49I8XjEo8w.jpg','2008-09-12',107,'Released',NULL,'Tear This Heart Out',16382,3.2366,7.919,'Pn3F_7nGbiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24260,_binary '\0','/dFWN4kqaEm0hONzigZ0obY08m72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130988',7,41557,'fr','JCVD','Between his tax problems and his legal battle with his wife for the custody of his daughter, these are hard times for the action movie star who finds that even Steven Seagal has pinched a role from him! This fictionalized version of Jean-Claude Van Damme returns to the country of his birth to seek the peace and tranquility he can no longer enjoy in the United States, but inadvertently gets involved in a bank robbery with hostages.','/hTvdsXH0jYmQgIbs1eJFM8DnOQg.jpg','2008-06-04',96,'Released','The Biggest Fight of His Life!','JCVD',13672,2.8443,6.6,'_T_Whr4tQOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24261,_binary '\0','/tEqdsY06GpjwVaQVKGNfI0HKTZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130989',5.3,1398,'no','Lange flate ballær II','Six beer-bellied guys from the Ed Garage find their plans for the week totally changed by a draft for a National Guard maneuver. After an accidental meeting with a U.S. Admiral (Don Johnson), we find our six misfits are the only ones between us and a nuclear holocaust.','/mW8DNYaa6379tLPeMSfySrszSbc.jpg','2008-03-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Long Flat Balls II',30085,1.2137,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24262,_binary '\0','/u0Gh11AlZTfWb09Z2NGRr49gJOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1130993',5.4,3687,'fr','Le Premier Cercle','The Malakian clan, a family of ruthless gangsters, controls the underworld of Southern France. At its head, the violent godfather Milo Malakian rules his world with an iron fist. His son and heir, Anton, dreams of breaking free and making his own choices. But the gang\'s inner circle is engraved in blood. To escape, not only does Anton have to counter his own destiny, but also the man who has sworn to bring his father down.','/9YFYG4vwxrviT3PKS0VJ8JcwyI7.jpg','2009-03-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Ultimate Heist',15638,2.3455,5.3,'C96w5z1o8us','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24263,_binary '\0','/uUPsIfuQVDTijFg3sSh1AhVA7gh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11310004',5,3664,'pt','A Primeira Tentação de Cristo','Jesus, who\'s hitting the big 3-0, brings a surprise guest to meet the family. A Christmas special so wrong it must be from comedians Porta dos Fundos.','/kdNCaVDTK7a5KKCU7baLwY2gavx.jpg','2019-12-03',46,'Released',NULL,'The First Temptation of Christ',652020,1.6602,5.6,'RP7Xv0utRNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24264,_binary '\0','/fu8cHHdmySIX0MEafUv6QkslFlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11310608',6.4,2595,'fr','En attendant Bojangles','A boy and his eccentric parents leave their home in Paris for a country house in Spain. As the mother descends deeper into her own mind, it\'s up to the boy and his father to keep her safe and happy.','/i7zWGYTXPN0KgcbuTnIEV3qGpEC.jpg','2021-10-13',124,'Released',NULL,'Waiting for Bojangles',851303,2.927,7.3,'VS-4EJnjkkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24265,_binary '\0','/djvmjphhq512QG4jCCePkyRUbM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11310670',6.2,2196,'fr','Madeleine Collins','Judith leads a double life between Switzerland and France. On the one hand Abdel, with whom she is raising a little girl, on the other Melvil with whom she has two older boys. Little by little, this fragile balance, made up of lies, secrets and back and forth, cracks dangerously. Trapped, Judith chooses to head forward, at the risk of losing everything.','/aHBlnHHV3x3GWMkWbgWxT0eLIyt.jpg','2021-07-21',102,'Released',NULL,'Madeleine Collins',659988,1.9202,6,'nXbTWY6OF5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24266,_binary '\0','/wx7pSbh4ebbetu8UppYOoKzeQ8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11310884',6.3,2456,'es','Historia de lo oculto','During the last broadcast of 60 Minutes Before Midnight, the most watched journalistic program on television, Adrián Marcato could expose a conspiracy and link the government to a obscure secret society.','/b8qA9L6ZZyX57zprm9GlZ9Ta3uv.jpg','2023-08-17',82,'Released','Future is over','History of the Occult',649294,3.0646,7.2,'B2j