ping of her first child, Ajay. Soon, she embarks on a harrowing mission to solve the mystery of Ajay\'s disappearance.','/7ZreoBmdJKS3o9rBX08xRexq3yc.jpg','2020-06-19',132,'Released','Rise destined','Penguin',713496,0.9087,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24292,_binary '\0','/wdGgmoVt8SBQ6xC0UlqBJ4vEXKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11323746',5.6,1601,'en','Echo 8','An assassin flashes between a nightmarish dream and her reality at a secret underground organization. When her latest mission involves killing a grieving mother, she discovers her target is closer to home than she realizes.','/rA5cILhxrxqyYQN0xL1twYnPKlc.jpg','2024-02-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Echo 8',711384,0.6875,4.2,'Q2Yv8Y0zvTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24293,_binary '\0','/8DdQN1Hv18mhkn2qSMLvgWtQ2aB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132449',4.9,12616,'en','Lay the Favorite','A former stripper\'s talent with numbers lands her a job with a professional gambler who runs a sports book in Las Vegas.','/n57AyhFm5Jhe2qu0yuShYlokPmQ.jpg','2012-06-22',94,'Released','How far can a losing shot take you?','Lay the Favorite',84305,4.2147,5.2,'Jr30OocHzVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24294,_binary '\0','/mTRrGeLphIlj4JM7EauuEYpS3iv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11324534',6.9,6520,'en','The Thing About Harry','Two high school enemies, uber-jock Harry and out-and-proud Sam, are forced to share a car ride to their Missouri hometown for a friend\'s engagement party on Valentine\'s Day. Things take a turn when Sam learns Harry has come out.','/sdn5NdFMcsub3QUwlovOA9fPJoW.jpg','2020-02-15',86,'Released','Boy meets boy.','The Thing About Harry',647325,2.4914,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24295,_binary '\0','/sa85yRz5asOPKx49aubcbCmKj2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132474',6.8,3932,'de','Chiko','This is the story of Isa, who grows up in a Hamburg suburb. It might be one of the world\'s richest cities but every beast has its belly and here, in the very underbelly, Chiko lives in a world where violence, staking and keeping a claim, and drug taking are the norm. Where down is not an option, Chiko is determined to rise to the top, whatever and whomever it costs.','/7jvu0BUsrsojDVDmar3QddRgCEF.jpg','2008-02-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Chiko',8064,1.3393,6.324,'z3NzF2CWn0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24296,_binary '\0','/9GchP4scivxi2TW1cTAz2nw9EnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132578',7,2268,'ro','Boogie','On his spring break at the seaside, with his wife and his four year old son, Bogdan Ciocazanu runs into his best friends from high-school at the precise date and time that reminds all of them of their most glorious drinking trips and sexual escapades of their younger days. Frustrated that, between his job and his family, time is no longer his to manage and play with, Boogie now takes his shock dosage of freedom and spends a night to tick off all the items on the map of his youth (drinking, games, flirting, prostitutes). In the morning, after the disillusionment of the remake he experiences with his former friends, he returns to his wife.','/e3zU3mtfoZbUx9i0I6ZpxLVpTt6.jpg','2008-06-17',103,'Released','Boogie finds himself caught between family obligations and the temptation of a night out like in the good old days.','Boogie',39395,0.8882,5.9,'i-sA2hc4Jik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24297,_binary '\0','/5kYZSD8iIUZV0QzSjaiW5FhlDR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132594',6.5,2669,'fr','Louise-Michel','In this radical and endearing black comedy, a group of retrenched female factory workers decide to pool their compensation money… and hire a hit man to liquidate their boss.','/hVBndYreVtlBhIb0K4uSwmnGVSf.jpg','2008-11-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Louise-Michel',21145,2.179,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24298,_binary '\0','/dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132620',7.8,232204,'sv','Män som hatar kvinnor','Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson\'s novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger\'s niece','/r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg','2009-02-27',152,'Released','Based on the Worldwide Best Seller','The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo',15472,9.4326,7.537,'JlF-hk3IJQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24299,_binary '\0','/9BMEUvc5TxYJF5xmygls2hnhnMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132623',7.5,32160,'en','You Don\'t Know Jack','Controversy and legal problems follow Dr. Jack Kevorkian as he advocates assisted suicide.','/xl4x8aILt9v91TUOKXHIVDZwkXy.jpg','2010-06-27',134,'Released','Is this the face of a killer?','You Don\'t Know Jack',36950,4.5497,7.011,'PSv0U94kiZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24300,_binary '\0','/jIjVPKDow5ai8dbs4PgWmtqg9Ol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1132626',5.8,150034,'en','Saw V','Following Jigsaw\'s grisly demise, Detective Mark Hoffman is commended as a hero, but Agent Strahm is suspicious, and delves into Hoffman\'s past. Meanwhile, another group of people are put through a series of gruesome tests.','/rKl79KqLXg60KFyKsLe4wSSjQ08.jpg','2008-10-23',95,'Released','You won\'t believe how it ends.','Saw V',11917,9.6466,6.172,'J9TpHotLQk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24301,_binary '\0','/sfgT356mZLE41jbh7HIVa7ROEPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11327400',6.1,1274,'en','Finding Nicole','Based on a true life story of Nicole Beverly and her children surviving and overcoming domestic violence.','/9HkxZrJK4GWM7TjJKt7E9OkWLjK.jpg','2025-05-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Finding Nicole',780272,1.0784,3,'Wa-ZSieQRKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24302,_binary '\0','/bfnUoHV9IPDGmxQmGAEOKIBNIWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11327514',7.3,25089,'en','Uncle Frank','In 1973, when Frank Bledsoe and his 18-year-old niece Beth take a road trip from Manhattan to Creekville, South Carolina for the family patriarch\'s funeral, they\'re unexpectedly joined by Frank\'s lover Walid.','/u3yozs3oGY0ubwf4cKQKOMWqNx3.jpg','2020-11-25',95,'Released','No one comes home without baggage.','Uncle Frank',634544,4.2977,7.3,'QsNgR-dguhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24303,_binary '\0','/88cPdcG1679J04lHCjRq7d7ZRfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11328762',6.4,3209,'da','Vildmænd','Armed only with a bow and an ensemble of animal skins, Martin sets off into the forest in a misguided attempt to overcome his midlife crisis. A chance meeting with a fugitive named Musa leads to a twisted trip through the fjords with police, drug runners, and Martin\'s family not far behind. As an unlikely friendship develops and wildly original set-pieces unfold, Martin\'s quest for manhood leads to deep and hilariously uncomfortable realizations about the presumed masculine ideal.','/jbnCh0al5gaWQozLBbt9ncuC2ya.jpg','2022-02-03',101,'Released',NULL,'Wild Men',776717,2.7654,6.1,'6ivj3xIapyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24304,_binary '\0','/n3PsU3RjZJL2jJVUA7GFKqAJSHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11331792',7.4,2137,'en','Great Photo, Lovely Life','A photojournalist turns her lens on the decades of sexual abuse her family and community experienced at the hands of her grandfather in this unflinching portrait of intergenerational trauma, family secrets, and redemption.','/7cvGCKzqnuf3oXt8DUzB038RA1A.jpg','2023-03-10',112,'Released',NULL,'Great Photo, Lovely Life',1073097,1.4588,7,'EXgPKxxQ8E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24305,_binary '\0','/AheN2aPRkiN1lZqCOGg4eyTI4Uj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11332484',7.1,2360,'en','The Road Dance','A young girl lives in the Outer Hebrides in a small village in the years just before WWI. Isolated and hard by the shore, her life takes a dramatic change when a terrible tragedy befalls her.','/aHEV0oXxludb6QfT3KS1DMRbY2n.jpg','2022-05-20',116,'Released',NULL,'The Road Dance',864866,2.3165,6.7,'DbDSzYMQuPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24306,_binary '\0','/z4T0CZxl8WQqNA8K5tZoBQib4jL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133559',7,2962,'ja','名探偵コナン 銀翼の奇術師','Once again, Kaitou Kid crosses swords with Conan Edogawa in this annual installment of the Detective Conan movie franchise. After receiving a letter from the thief, famous actress Juri Maki seeks the help of private detective Kogorou Mouri to protect the Star Sapphire—the \"Jewel of Destiny,\" said to represent faith, fate, and hope.','/y23gqg2y2ckCcqjhe4WKlIHq63B.jpg','2004-04-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Magician of the Silver Sky',39203,4.5378,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24307,_binary '\0','/x4PHVkC6W5DYbMA0OkD4yKbn134.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133922',7.5,1388,'ko','크로싱','Yong-soo is an ex-soccer player who lives in a small coal-mine village in North Korea with his wife and young son, Joon. Although living in extreme poverty like many other families in North Korea, the family is happy just to be with each other. Then one day, Yong-soo\'s pregnant wife becomes critically ill. Let alone medicine, Yong-soo can\'t even find food for her in North Korea. So he decides to secretly cross the border to China hoping to find the medicine for his wife.','/j3ARmpUH2wPyc4Rc4qiRKBEfPMU.jpg','2008-06-05',107,'Released',NULL,'Crossing',49556,1.6932,7.1,'qyYilOhGw40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24308,_binary '\0','/bIlgVsRkASYjLh5BABmAMAMeHji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133935',7.1,3196,'ja','名探偵コナン 迷宮の十字路','Mouri Kogoro is called to a special case in the ancient capital of Kyoto. There, Conan meets Heiji and they team up once again to solve the case, recover the stolen Healing Buddha statue, and even discover the identity of Heiji\'s first love.','/qsP5o8Z5xPgjnerByjHzOq1MUI0.jpg','2003-04-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Crossroad in the Ancient Capital',39202,5.2821,7.124,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24309,_binary '\0','/A7nW6vbOJXH0uz0SrScdPdvJ416.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133936',7,2617,'ja','名探偵コナン 水平線上の陰謀','Fifteen years ago in a barren stretch of the Pacific, a cruise ship collided with an iceberg and was lost at sea. More than a decade later, Hideto Yashiro—a ship engineer—died in a fatal car accident. The unlikely connection between these events only comes to light on the luxury liner St. Aphrodite during her maiden voyage. Aboard it on a much needed vacation, Kogorou Mouri, his daughter Ran, Conan Edogawa, and the Detective Boys enjoy a trip provided by Sonoko Suzuki\'s family. But their fun is soon cut short when a game of hide-and-seek leads to Sonoko\'s disappearance.','/enhiUd7MOuLjKa4NkZmLaN7dDWH.jpg','2005-04-09',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Strategy Above the Depths',39204,4.6014,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24310,_binary '\0','/tS3ByIQR6V61DaWhEIFbLSuLK5Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133985',5.5,312519,'en','Green Lantern','For centuries, a small but powerful force of warriors called the Green Lantern Corps has sworn to keep intergalactic order. Each Green Lantern wears a ring that grants him superpowers. But when a new enemy called Parallax threatens to destroy the balance of power in the Universe, their fate and the fate of Earth lie in the hands of the first human ever recruited.','/fj21HwUprqjjwTdkKC1XZurRSpV.jpg','2011-06-14',114,'Released','In brightest day. In blackest night.','Green Lantern',44912,21.7811,5.201,'7-GO9fo9DtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24311,_binary '\0','/gb8V2O3eya3X0hDS4MfESo0zSgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133989',6.6,3017,'en','Medicine for Melancholy','Waking from a one-night stand that neither remembers, Micah and Joanne find themselves wandering the streets of San Francisco, sharing coffee and conversation and searching for a deeper connection.','/gyO8w5lpK3kwBojTulRpYcA4MAo.jpg','2009-01-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Medicine for Melancholy',24885,1.4872,6.065,'bMb8xziXXqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24312,_binary '\0','/xpXkdDAw1ilEtkhiCcUSgIwrttX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133991',6.5,14537,'en','What Doesn\'t Kill You','Two childhood friends from South Boston turn to crime as a way to get by, ultimately causing a strain in their personal lives and their friendship.','/mmQfRKCJ6jDeNiI6Lb3UeYfztPk.jpg','2008-12-12',100,'Released','Everyone has a choice. Every choice has a consequence.','What Doesn\'t Kill You',15801,3.8754,6.002,'Fgg_ri-PuiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24313,_binary '\0','/dJuiJHokAKwjdfNOIYNQfykPCaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133993',5.3,9248,'en','Serious Moonlight','After her adulterous husband asks for a divorce, a high-powered attorney takes him captive, refusing to release him until he commits to working on their marriage together. When his impatient mistress shows up, not to mention an opportunistic gardener, things start to get seriously complicated.','/qZsA9Qec44amt3jJLvvNrX4nqSc.jpg','2009-12-04',84,'Released','A Love/Hate Comedy.','Serious Moonlight',27989,2.8988,5,'GkiFBq36WiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24314,_binary '\0','/fDtOTaS6kouECTRZM2PFkUjWzQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1133995',3.2,2759,'en','The Way of War','Paramilitary operative David Wolfe stumbles upon an international conspiracy connecting presidential cabinet members to a Middle Eastern terrorist plot. Wanting to expose the truth, Wolfe defies orders and returns to the US as an army of one fighting for American security and integrity','/24dZfEqkJnLTYjPJfPUJGr2GrX8.jpg','2009-04-20',90,'Released','He has a single mission. To explore the truth.','The Way of War',15945,3.0908,3.6,'f0Sp6sFEFng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24315,_binary '\0','/2jOEfIIzbEwMiSpPq91tUZoYzUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11341742',7.7,1405,'en','In Search of Tomorrow','A nostalgic journey through ’80s Sci-Fi-films, exploring their impact and relevance today, told by the artists who made them and by those who were inspired to turn their visions into reality.','/n7tRI2GK1fLnXcmNO8cpFBAtSO2.jpg','2022-02-19',306,'Released',NULL,'In Search of Tomorrow',617031,1.9901,6.765,'4kdtrChdosE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24316,_binary '\0','/yfIeuUzqQKyD1xbHppKaVmcr7Dg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11343320',2.7,1716,'en','Body of Night','When a woman begins seeing a mysterious man who challenges her to a series of tests, she enters the dangerous and dark side of online dating.','/gPQ7Eijzf5pUAa2x9uXNyxzi9yn.jpg','2020-04-24',73,'Released',NULL,'Body of Night',718632,1.0821,2.5,'BVIGGR2kDjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24317,_binary '\0','/lcYpO6C3cm8WVZCSkl0BcsmpN1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11343416',2.9,2483,'en','Acrylic','A colorful neighborhood salon is threatened by a new addition. The pot is stirred by a local magazine competition and a long standing rivalry. Which salon has what it takes to win the grand prize?','/ypQf0th11CHASVenIlJXxajHioa.jpg','2020-05-01',78,'Released',NULL,'Acrylic',711974,0.9507,5.3,'-eSqBIYxvHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24318,_binary '\0','/1X25DjYM0COPuGYcH17qJIt1OFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11344264',5,1608,'sr','Kuća od blata','After inheriting an old mudbrick house in his home village in Eastern Europe, a man returns after spending his whole life in England, only to find out that inhabitants are hiding a dark secret about the pagan Slavic cult and his own past.','/paVJNyxq5odaAHC9YlmNUlceQpu.jpg','2024-10-10',83,'Released',NULL,'Mudbrick',1180648,1.8306,5.85,'LlcCdWkQufM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24319,_binary '\0','/2GVgf1V6fB8lt6x2q2fWbcs7IoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134549',6,1609,'tr','Bayrampaşa: Ben Fazla Kalmayacağım','The story of a man who was wrongfully arrested and forced to spend years in prison without being able to explain his situation.','/p38gseSv0neSFmmgcWKRbvejvwr.jpg','2008-02-22',106,'Released',NULL,'Bayrampaşa: Ben Fazla Kalmayacağım',51433,1.3602,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24320,_binary '\0','/ayEMwa3URnwQEG7LXhzRBHkfOGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134629',6.3,14802,'en','The Private Lives of Pippa Lee','After her much older husband forces a move to a suburban retirement community, Pippa Lee engages in a period of reflection and finds herself heading toward a quiet nervous breakdown.','/eHN6AaAcks2c8HTVaQzJKSJLp7h.jpg','2009-07-07',98,'Released','She lived many lives ― except her own.','The Private Lives of Pippa Lee',4475,4.9551,5.854,'JU_FTUQ1iLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24321,_binary '\0','/8L159knc8X0JnV5wdSGDpuhlemx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134664',5.1,4402,'en','Boogie Woogie','In London\'s contemporary art world, everyone has a hustle. Art Spindle runs a high-end gallery: he hopes to flip a Mondrian for millions. One of his assistants, Beth, is sleeping with Art\'s most acquisitive client, Bob Macclestone. Beth wants Bob to set her up in her own gallery, so she helps him go behind Art\'s back for the Mondrian. Bob\'s wife, Jean, sets her eye on a young conceptual artist, Jo, who lusts after Art\'s newest assistant, Paige. Meanwhile, self-absorbed videographer Elaine is chewing her way through friends and lovers looking to make it: if she\'ll throw Dewey, her agent, under the bus, Beth may give her a show. And the Mondrian? No honor among thieves.','/plnHFNGI1ToCFhyyYU3bb0AmDpl.jpg','2010-04-16',94,'Released','Seduction. Betrayal. Death. There\'s an Art to Everything.','Boogie Woogie',36939,3.4081,5.1,'Vxx0iDP5Y4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24322,_binary '\0','/AuZzTAbFpPQE2rsQluoCW2HqzwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134674',4.9,4486,'en','ZMD: Zombies of Mass Destruction','An idyllic peninsula town is under attack by that most invasive of pests: zombies! Port Gamble is being overrun with braineaters, and the people seem powerless to stave them off. But wait, a ragtag band of rebels is trying to turn the tide and push the invading hordes of undead back!','/3K80OoyUb93qhx5jMUsNuKlV3IT.jpg','2010-01-29',92,'Released','They\'re just like you ... only dead','ZMD: Zombies of Mass Destruction',34592,1.9606,5.071,'dUFjHjU0bK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24323,_binary '\0','/gdBn7MSTrd08C74HbbtWkEJSS1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11347146',5.5,1987,'ms','Mat Kilau: Kebangkitan Pahlawan','The rise of a Malay warrior named Mat Kilau and his friends against the British colonialists who came to Pahang in 1892. The greed of British officials and policies, which have imposed excessive taxes, confiscated land belonging to the Malays to reap the treasures of Pahang and disrupted the Islamic way in Pahang has caused dissatisfaction among the rulers and the Malays. The patriotic spirit of Mat Kilau and his friends who rose up against British violence had caused Captain Syers to launch an attack on Mat Kilau. Witness the heroic spirit of Mat Kilau, Tok Gajah and Mat Kilau\'s best friends use their wisdom to fight in the jungle against the British soldiers. Did Mat Kilau and his friends succeed in driving out the barbaric and greedy British army to reap gold and tin in Pahang?','/tdtYxbL9uARITgWw3FyIgucF4Ax.jpg','2022-06-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Mat Kilau',988595,1.8807,6.875,'h1vfzjY5LXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24324,_binary '\0','/uQ9ZK4mo6ZWbNjVOc95lSzKWHFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11348164',5.2,3389,'en','Iké Boys','Two Japan-obsessed teenagers in Oklahoma must discover their inner hero when a magical anime transforms them into its super-powered characters.','/wzAZnkTQZBGCxZTvZk5g5VzgKuR.jpg','2022-10-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Iké Boys',786415,1.04,5.8,'FAhvH1dJlYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24325,_binary '\0','/95BrRDodn9NcYaYNSpuYx0Z15Bf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134817',6.9,2994,'tr','Erkek Güzeli Sefil Bilo','Bilo is released from prison..','/lPssQdMeGy1KlPenLqFOmmkKiIH.jpg','1979-09-07',80,'Released',NULL,'Handsome Poor Bilo',220004,1.345,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24326,_binary '\0','/eVSa4TpyXbOdk9fXSD6OcORJGtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11348232',2.6,8575,'en','The Requin','A couple on a romantic getaway find themselves stranded at sea when a tropical storm sweeps away their villa. In order to survive, they are forced to fight the elements, while sharks circle below.','/i0z8g2VRZP3dhVvvSMilbOZMKqR.jpg','2022-01-28',89,'Released','Terror will surface.','The Requin',803114,4.0946,4.8,'kWXK5fibfko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24327,_binary '\0','/z3RFv1Uo0RZmvarqXHhmpc8epS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134828',7.2,2576,'hu','Kaméleon','While cleaning offices at night, Zsolt Kovàcs learns a lot about his invisible employers by examining what they leave behind, carefully choosing his targets, often disillusioned women whom he seduces, methodically taking their money. An artist of manipulation, with a generous dose of humor and the ability to assume different personalities, Zsolt begins to work in a psychologist\'s practice, where he meets Hanna, a 30-year-old dancer who is physically incapacitated and the daughter of a millionaire. The ideal victim if love doesn\'t get in the way.','/1RA2m7hDZRHENInYQfKmavPWNKt.jpg','2008-12-03',108,'Released','I am whoever you want me to be','Chameleon',57330,1.0335,6.2,'xom7Y0gjfes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24328,_binary '\0','/my7iRgEZyvw7GO09vUJ06fe5oO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1134854',4.8,23635,'en','Survival of the Dead','Off the coast of North America, locals simultaneously fight a zombie epidemic while hoping for a cure to revert their undead relatives back to normal.','/2BmqSRt10J2mpJmCgZbo5YYkQLj.jpg','2010-05-06',90,'Released','Death isn\'t what it used to be.','Survival of the Dead',29426,4.4835,4.8,'V_ELfwOkOps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24329,_binary '\0','/uwKZJpsSKvM76TSazEZfUAr6ukY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11348542',3.8,2125,'en','Agnes','Rumors of demonic possession at a religious convent prompts a church investigation into the strange goings-on among its nuns. A disaffected priest and his neophyte are confronted with temptation, bloodshed and a crisis of faith.','/jDskIhzLfZc8SB4ybkcWOgmI98M.jpg','2021-12-10',93,'Released','Face your demons.','Agnes',804755,1.8455,4.1,'WEWQbBOFcz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24330,_binary '\0','/oiz2JFxXwbyyfu2VUZejnak9JyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11348926',6.9,1517,'en','The Angel Tree','A writer seeks the identity of the person who helps grant wishes that are placed upon the angel tree, and in the process, reconnects with her childhood friend.','/3ykv13npXiwTQiMv3Qf2VXIOdPW.jpg','2020-11-21',84,'Released',NULL,'The Angel Tree',746466,4.9958,6.5,'TiJHLtUc21c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24331,_binary '\0','/aTUFQx4NPEIQqH4DrKCJShaI66J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11348950',6.5,1535,'en','You\'re Bacon Me Crazy','Cleo Morelli, an aspiring Portland chef, tries to win a food truck competition while the competition tries to win her heart.','/e6FSxn0Myqq3uffXjdZXpOTGCn4.jpg','2020-04-04',88,'Released',NULL,'You\'re Bacon Me Crazy',677209,2.2969,6.7,'i3XeyHntG2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24332,_binary '\0','/3z7F491qQla8CgKCnSdG2IP3EH1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11350284',3.8,4004,'en','400 Bullets','One cold winter night in Afghanistan is about to get a whole lot worse for Rana Rae, a Gurkha soldier left to guard a British military outpost, when Captain Noah Brandt arrives looking for refuge from a group of rogue special ops and a cell of heavily armed Taliban. The two soldiers must fight for their lives as they attempt to call for backup before the rogue squad, led by the backstabbing Sergeant Bartlett, can hunt them down to retrieve a case of missile guidance chips that Noah intercepted. But Bartlett and his men do not count on Rana, whose ferocious Gurkha training makes him a force to be reckoned with.','/burp795vripHCoq8VAT0Dm5SPE.jpg','2021-01-14',90,'Released','Only one way out.','400 Bullets',788672,1.3782,7,'4ZZZiG13Dhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24333,_binary '\0','/2MmcWazB76kabQ1livKMqIUfN80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135084',6.2,68856,'en','Takers','A seasoned team of bank robbers, including Gordon Jennings, John Rahway, A.J., and brothers Jake and Jesse Attica successfully complete their latest heist and lead a life of luxury while planning their next job. When Ghost, a former member of their team, is released from prison he convinces the group to strike an armored car carrying $20 million. As the \"Takers\" carefully plot out their strategy and draw nearer to exacting the grand heist, a reckless police officer inches closer to apprehending the criminals.','/s2zx7JA87rkQcmsV40k0vbVJ6oh.jpg','2010-08-26',107,'Released','Who\'s Taking Who?','Takers',22907,7.9605,6.252,'0DItbZIVKhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24334,_binary '\0','/c2Av25HOoF3hKWGO2MRicHtiqJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135092',6.2,22035,'en','The Limits of Control','A mysterious stranger works outside the law and keeps his objectives hidden, trusting no one. While his demeanor is paradoxically focused and dreamlike all at once, he embarks on a journey that not only takes him across Spain, but also through his own consciousness.','/5e4hjFt3V8LTUXPxvZ2plPpgGLk.jpg','2009-05-01',116,'Released','For every way in, there is another way out.','The Limits of Control',8284,4.4726,6,'XPFRaCnkVzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24335,_binary '\0','/tAesS5XvdKnew1tGUYYtE7VIkgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135095',5.3,5438,'en','Tell-Tale','A man\'s recently transplanted heart leads him on a frantic search to find the donor\'s killer before a similar fate befalls him.','/4j37Dnkl4LD47O0rYUdOTRHWWF1.jpg','2009-04-24',92,'Released','Every heart hides a secret.','Tell-Tale',27135,2.6788,5.3,'BeTN6Y2oMMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24336,_binary '\0','/4xqJfciK7O0GRs69yqv0nFrZDht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11354168',7.2,1274,'en','The Perfect Weapon','Explore the rise of cyber conflict as the primary way nations now compete with and sabotage one another. As fear mounts about how potential cyberattacks will affect 2020 elections in the U.S., the film features interviews with top military, intelligence and political officials and includes on-the-ground reporting from the frontlines of the cyber wars.','/bXphpQgetq4FZJN1cNnX1FpGcS5.jpg','2020-10-16',87,'Released','Chaos is a click away.','The Perfect Weapon',728209,1.4186,7,'eeLHlOUNOmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24337,_binary '\0','/nmElbl3SyII4gJ8uo1jYYHFjmlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135487',6.1,54097,'en','Duplicity','Two romantically involved government operatives Claire Stenwick and Ray Koval team up to manipulate a race between opposing corporations to corner the market on a medical innovation that will reap huge profits and allow them to lead an extravagant lifestyle together. They find themselves on opposing sides as corporate spies; however, as they each try to outdo the other, neither one can decide how far to trust the other in this high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse.','/vpWQs3CjwG6Er3DgZlv4L3NFjXg.jpg','2009-03-18',125,'Released','She\'s ex-CIA. He\'s ex-MI6. Together they\'re stealing a fortune.','Duplicity',16558,5.8232,5.9,'c_CNK9g9Kj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24338,_binary '\0','/kF7wNxASM21cvHwDofFIt6Asyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135493',4.3,2820,'en','Fire and Ice: The Dragon Chronicles','Princess Luisa and knight Gabriel must face a dragon to save their kingdom.','/rIctEnkOra3vjZP1I31fepIgUjF.jpg','2008-09-18',84,'Released','When danger strikes from above, it either burns your soul or freezes you to death.','Fire and Ice: The Dragon Chronicles',16999,3.5204,5.1,'TSIsIiH5KW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24339,_binary '\0','/mOWeZlcpdAraOSA3ReYWqu2JJt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135500',5.3,4839,'en','Homecoming','A jilted ex-girlfriend plots revenge after her former beau comes back to their hometown with a new lover.','/ALPTyUklWtULWAzaf0J9vrRfUN.jpg','2009-07-17',88,'Released','A girl never forgets her first love...','Homecoming',22681,2.5668,6,'RC32k9oCEsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24340,_binary '\0','/1tWpsnSelznXfkdssCWQGgavRZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135503',7,137514,'en','Julie & Julia','Julia Child and Julie Powell – both of whom wrote memoirs – find their lives intertwined. Though separated by time and space, both women are at loose ends... until they discover that with the right combination of passion, fearlessness and butter, anything is possible.','/1QZNWOOwfRi86ZApGvr2TtJZPBK.jpg','2009-08-06',123,'Released','Based on two true stories.','Julie & Julia',24803,9.3389,6.712,'ozRK7VXQl-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24341,_binary '\0','/5eQsXKGVowcKHnZYd9AwOrwGPsH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135525',6.4,16853,'en','The Slammin\' Salmon','The brutal former heavyweight boxing champion Cleon \"Slammin\'\" Salmon (Duncan), now owner of a Miami restaurant, institutes a competition to see which waiter can earn the most money in one night: the winner stands to gain $10,000, while the loser will endure a beating at the hands of the champ.','/yX9skMoAc1JAimJFtczEif4f1jS.jpg','2009-12-11',98,'Released','Bring a bib, it\'s gonna get messy.','The Slammin\' Salmon',34423,4.5204,5.839,'qGM67hJ9rxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24342,_binary '\0','/he8uCRWfg0FMJp2a3PWkgH13tIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11357580',6.6,5847,'en','LUZ','Ruben and Carlos become cellmates in a minimum-security prison. While Ruben struggles to learn the ropes of daily life and where he falls in the complex hierarchical prison system, Carlos becomes a mentor and then eventually a lover. The two men develop feelings for one another they can\'t easily express. As time moves on and one of them is released before the other, there are questions looming as to whether what they had was real or simply out of the need for human connection.','/h1MkE9K1tMT5dGWCIjf1YhhHiIo.jpg','2020-10-01',118,'Released',NULL,'LUZ',732498,1.9847,5.5,'ksWTW2K3IjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24343,_binary '\0','/xztGD5dAyXLxw1VUJEbwSjnvTBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11358166',7.2,4259,'en','Some Kind of Heaven','Behind the gates of a palm-tree-lined fantasyland, three residents and one interloper at America\'s largest retirement community strive to find happiness.','/4L0OAHeo2B413QKK5HRiWMzdKUy.jpg','2021-02-19',83,'Released','We all leave this Earth the way we came.','Some Kind of Heaven',638741,2.5904,6.938,'gmRnGHrjl1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24344,_binary '\0','/nHbsOoAESokKFaIPQGGHR0jJiAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11358390',6.4,121513,'en','Renfield','Having grown sick and tired of his centuries as Dracula\'s lackey, Renfield finds a new lease on life — and maybe even redemption — when he falls for feisty, perennially angry traffic cop Rebecca Quincy.','/p6yUjhvNGQpFZilKwOKbxQ1eHlo.jpg','2023-04-07',93,'Released','Sucks to be him.','Renfield',649609,11.4313,6.435,'6LmO6rmDW08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24345,_binary '\0','/2BlOZRfQpy3nwi4nE2v4ktJJsic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11358398',7,5173,'ko','남산의 부장들','When the investigation of \'Koreagate\' takes place, Park Yong-gak, a former KCIA director who knows everything about the government\'s operations, heads to the United States in exile.','/rXvGB9uDdpg1vq1UKLgfdBR6KQe.jpg','2020-01-22',114,'Released','Loyalty. Betrayal. Execution.','The Man Standing Next',566397,3.1285,7.094,'7764OsNo2O4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24346,_binary '\0','/q7hVT5UzQOgIyG4FT1U8oQ0a3yk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135922',6.3,1732,'da','Den du frygter','Michael needs a change in his life, so when he hears about clinical trials for a new anti-depressant, he signs up to be a guinea pig - without telling his family. Because of dangerous side effects, the trial is subsequently abandoned but Michael continues to take the pills. Having lost all control, Michael\'s repressed instincts resurface with a force and violence that no-one could have predicted.','/xBBJPyr77jPpKDUH9tsOUTvU52W.jpg','2008-12-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Fear Me Not',15834,1.5939,5.1,'8SAJCMlCvsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24347,_binary '\0','/xpbYF8qfEFO716wQA33kF5VzjDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135933',4.6,2662,'en','Never Cry Werewolf','Loren doesn\'t like her new neighbor, Jared, or his vicious dog. Along with her friend Steven, Loren spies on Jared and begins to suspect he\'s a werewolf, responsible for a rash of disappearances. But Jared is watching her just as closely because Loren reminds him of his dead wife. As a full-moon night nears, Loren enlists the help of TV star Redd Tucker, who knows how to hunt -- and who believes her werewolf theory.','/w7jZwDFv2ExZvfmPuh9m7vFF4RW.jpg','2008-05-11',87,'Released','An Immortal Battle for Survival','Never Cry Werewolf',29896,2.7621,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24348,_binary '\0','/kZLZXBafZs0Jx0jvR98MYVtrPOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135940',5.8,1499,'de','Mord ist mein Geschäft, Liebling','A hit man whose mission is to prevent the printing of a tell-all book written by a former Mafioso, falls in love with the employee who may lose her job if the book doesn\'t get published.','/cmB9lxrLPgeHeeJEz3Rf7YVzon3.jpg','2009-02-26',109,'Released',NULL,'Killing Is My Business, Honey',15640,1.6683,6.7,'9UrhlSc8a1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24349,_binary '\0','/5anmzoXQVusVeT9Mpa6diylVA36.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135941',5.5,2356,'sv','Morgan Pålsson - världsreporter','Foreign correspondent Morgan Pålsson and his photographer Robert Flycht are sent on assignment to an unknown North African country – Matóbo. The assignment is to cover the country\'s elections, but instead a military coup breaks out and Morgan turns out to be the only foreign journalist on the scene. This is his chance to show what he\'s made of.','/a9vcYce628ryKvzwMT9JKNEtrlA.jpg','2008-02-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Morgan Pålsson - World Reporter',14078,1.1298,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24350,_binary '\0','/88wLsdc8aDTOJfJpJ1Ax3yOuoTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135952',6.9,9055,'fr','White Material','In the midst of a volatile regime change in a Francophone African state, Maria Vial is fighting to sustain her family’s coffee plantation. With rebels and the army struggling for control, French peacekeeping forces move out, warning the remaining white residents that they’re on their own. But Maria refuses to be driven off the land, even as tragedy looms.','/qqQOsXOf7HvoWVWjOLuKpGQFjMh.jpg','2010-03-24',106,'Released','In the African heat, one woman stands alone','White Material',46207,2.9716,6.7,'s3nh5zcGUsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24351,_binary '\0','/rG2hqBGXQZSzdZkBDJDDkNAWAIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135961',5.8,1600,'th','เพื่อน…กูรักมึงว่ะ','An unlikely, forbidden love blossoms between a police informant and the icy assassin sent to kill him in this steamy Thai crime drama.','/rjf3HMiVLMcS4cEgUcs5e9gjlMk.jpg','2007-09-13',105,'Released','Love is Dangerous.','Bangkok Love Story',47547,1.0648,5.2,'EbBXEi88UXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24352,_binary '\0','/fMU2rI5nrvUQTdmdbtgkfVhdDdO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135968',7.2,4062,'en','Dean Spanley','Set in Edwardian England where upper lips are always stiff and men from the Colonies are not entirely to be trusted, Fisk Senior has little time or affection for his son, but when the pair visit an eccentric Indian, they start a strange journey that eventually allows the old man to find his heart.','/d27eaUjLc0l1mT2hM8Jwwt7iWMz.jpg','2008-12-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Dean Spanley',18117,2.736,7.4,'6d91Ol7rui4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24353,_binary '\0','/csljXcumBnpmrLCXtlrjrspEnIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135985',6.5,96718,'en','Sex Drive','A high school senior drives cross-country with his best friends to hook up with a babe he met online.','/aO4swvDjqW635lesjYbytrEhBsn.jpg','2008-10-16',109,'Released','He\'s leaving virgin territory.','Sex Drive',13523,10.3544,6.4,'2xOUCZH14Is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24354,_binary '\0','/kdSY08cMaoBYSIYSfuN9mlhFUiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1135989',6,4612,'he','סיפור על אהבה וחושך','The story of young Amos Oz, growing up in Jerusalem in the years before Israeli statehood with his parents; his academic father, Arieh, and his dreamy, imaginative mother, Fania.','/1wvj1fegZmEeFpNFMKgc0DjL6Zc.jpg','2015-09-03',95,'Released',NULL,'A Tale of Love and Darkness',336029,3.4023,5.722,'HjWOl-K04BM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24355,_binary '\0','/u80GriC4Nq33HcCWkLExTCeWq3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11361714',6.4,1516,'da','Hvor kragerne vender','The film is a comedy drama about a young woman, Laura, who has distanced herself from her family in the country to settle in Copenhagen as an author and live the artistic bohemian life she has always dreamed of. When she, with much reluctance, goes back home for her brother’s wedding, she realises that he is about to marry her childhood enemy, Catrine. At the same time, Laura finds out that Catrine has in fact taken over her place in the family – and what if Laura wants it back … A film about how we, no matter how hard we try, cannot escape from our past, nor from our roots.','/kUjyxK7BiJVNOHdKh6ef87CwG7B.jpg','2021-07-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Persona Non Grata',750223,1.2091,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24356,_binary '\0','/cSgQ5ETwZKpwjNWKmfc0F7OUBsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11362866',6.6,2108,'es','Historias lamentables','This satirical anthology tells the surreal stories of a gift for Don Horacio, a trip to the beach for Bermejo, a life-changing relationship between Tina and the young immigrant Ayoub, and a new client for a company that specializes in excuses.','/vijoU09NBYoQ5VpawXj2AfGOmCw.jpg','2021-06-11',129,'Released',NULL,'Historias lamentables',650747,1.5112,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24357,_binary '\0','/8pMLz5lWvJFhyXjklwK2X4jEkzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11363582',6.7,1611,'en','A New Year\'s Resolution','When a morning show producer makes a New Year\'s resolution to say yes more, she crosses paths with a confirmed Yes man who just might hold the key to her biggest story and to her heart.','/l9l1v24dqbAlHdYHpt9T84zs17J.jpg','2021-01-09',85,'Released',NULL,'A New Year\'s Resolution',630926,1.9566,6.3,'jqP_L6hTqlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24358,_binary '\0','/mwvNmLVdHn5BPWyTCX2pn14PGh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11364772',4.6,15702,'kn','ಕಬ್ಜ','During the British rule in India, Arakeshwara, an air force soldier and son of a freedom fighter Amareshwara,due to unavoidable circumstances, kills Khaleed, the don of Amarapura and thus gets trapped in the mafia world and later becomes the king of the underworld. However, trouble ensues for Arakeshwara as he has to deal with his rivals and Bhargav Bhakshi, a cop sent by the British to eradicate him and the underworld.','/vFpw8DbiGdhrqcvzpuiuRQBZJPb.jpg','2023-03-17',136,'Released','The Rise of Gangsters in India','Kabzaa',683876,1.3361,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24359,_binary '\0','/lD8dFIk9wDEvOwZw0RB47e346io.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11365186',6.8,21210,'en','Redeeming Love','A young couple\'s relationship clashes with the harsh realities of the California Gold Rush of 1850. Angel, experiencing love for the first time and facing demons unsurmountable, runs from the new life she doesn\'t believe she deserves. When Michael sets out to find her, Angel discovers that she indeed has the power to choose the life she wants.','/2iu0lBF7sfAioLfSnSJtdKxlms6.jpg','2022-01-21',134,'Released','Never look back. Never look forward.','Redeeming Love',698508,11.1468,7.864,'6Z-0C02cqFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24360,_binary '\0','/jhM3wgWUrrOkz9r4xwV5cV5RhI4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1136608',7.9,757714,'en','District 9','Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens\' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.','/tuGlQkqLxnodDSk6mp5c2wvxUEd.jpg','2009-08-05',112,'Released','You are not welcome here.','District 9',17654,17.5354,7.478,'DyLUwOcR5pk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24361,_binary '\0','/f9Atch0jlzcOT9RbF8UccqfNOpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1136617',6.7,227665,'en','The Killer','After a fateful miss, an assassin battles his employers, and himself, on an international manhunt he insists isn\'t personal.','/ipkcgvN7h3yZnbYowthloHLKsf4.jpg','2023-10-25',118,'Released','Execution is everything.','The Killer',800158,15.4959,6.6,'5S7FR_HCg9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24362,_binary '\0','/6Mrf1ABhhXnzkRs7JxWNrOZH6Kf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11366674',6.4,3974,'en','LOLA','Sussex, England, 1938. Shortly before the outbreak of World War II, Thomasina and Martha Hanbury, two ingenious sisters, create LOLA, a miraculous machine.','/6IQEDnHKMvzforhtQW9mwW5kSHB.jpg','2023-04-07',79,'Released','Making history will never be the same again','LOLA',941019,2.9128,6.45,'a93TGgGLFd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24363,_binary '\0','/xkWDtiWohSdgGjuLrI5duTQJMIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11366736',5.9,1488,'en','Deadly Cuts','A black comedy set in a working-class Dublin hair salon where the stylists become accidental vigilantes and community heroes as they take on the gang members and gentrifiers threatening their community.','/8ywnFVEWYVcdwe7NaF6F4ZBCqCw.jpg','2021-10-08',90,'Released','No Time To Dye. Combing Soon.','Deadly Cuts',793511,1.2847,4.5,'RLZ_cE-vFQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24364,_binary '\0','/sVcz734Zf5oOxEW1iIeIALlcbOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1136684',4.1,3486,'en','Run! Bitch Run!','Things go horribly wrong when Catherine and Rebecca, two Catholic School girls, knock on the wrong door while selling Religious paraphernalia.','/m0vcux2QJ2K9MGBqi6O9TLrSwgU.jpg','2009-09-25',90,'Released','Payback\'s a Bitch!','Run! Bitch Run!',26334,1.875,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24365,_binary '\0','/tA2xZFJtJNF1v8GPmwt6haNThV4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1136688',2.2,1778,'en','Tales of an Ancient Empire','A princess is on a quest to unite the five greatest warriors to save her kingdom from a demon sorceress.','/nJN1ptRJjMmx4m0gup0ppO7Cmgb.jpg','2010-07-31',86,'Released',NULL,'Tales of an Ancient Empire',47065,2.0372,2.867,'HffsixOZn78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24366,_binary '\0','/sSVDsoRNMzp2bkxJPsqMw5B7c4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11368998',7.5,1423,'pl','25 lat niewinności','Tomasz Komenda was 23 years old when his normal life was brutally interrupted. Overnight he was arrested, thrown into prison and charged with murder. Subsequent expert opinions confirmed his participation in the crime, and any evidence was against him. For nearly two decades in prison, he was beaten, intimidated, humiliated and on his own. Finally, after 18 years of imprisonment, prosecutors and a policeman appeared on his way, who decided to discover the truth behind the mysterious case of the detainee.','/xYv28JRaDzm1p7Zz2fGpA519tfl.jpg','2020-09-18',112,'Released',NULL,'25 Years of Innocence',741652,1.517,7.8,'8ugos2Kef7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24367,_binary '\0','/6vGRmwpzZY9qEKWV5u1vcRMtlv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11369540',6.8,2561,'pl','Mistrz','It is 1940. The first transport of prisoners arrives at the newly created concentration camp Auschwitz. One of them is Tadeusz “Teddy” Pietrzykowski, pre-war boxing champion of Warsaw. The camp officers force him to fight in the ring for his and other prisoners’ lives. However, his every win strengthens the hope that Nazis are not invincible. Auschwitz officers notice the growing resistance. The confrontation with the authorities of the camp becomes inevitable.','/iURB8iTHLYnOMvGmeIyUSH8QURO.jpg','2021-08-27',91,'Released',NULL,'The Champion',845875,2.6554,7.7,'5CS7KWnRU64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24368,_binary '\0','/qFbvukPNbGTyd5TmOulEJlRZ3X8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11372428',6.2,1445,'en','Closed for Storm','The story of Six Flags New Orleans, a theme park devastated by Hurricane Katrina that has become a holy grail of sorts for urban exploration and the efforts to restore the park to its former glory.','/1OKe4jKKld64LRlYuisNBkjJ5vG.jpg','2020-11-07',77,'Released','The incredible true story of an abandoned American theme park.','Closed for Storm',709192,1.4189,6.3,'8rYzoskylbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24369,_binary '\0','/hbkKUwPxR3X7CtQXAEq6LUuLzqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137436',5.7,4014,'en','Awaydays','On the Wirral in the grim early years of Margaret Thatcher\'s premiership, the opportunities for thrill seeking young men looking to escape 9 to 5 drudgery are what they\'ve always been: sex, drugs, rock n\' roll, fashion, football and fighting.','/qFQcC0KVWdbQp2QUp3nR3yG753T.jpg','2009-04-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Awaydays',21988,1.2873,5.2,'CD_ttGnZQJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24370,_binary '\0','/ne0n4qnoLZqZtdIkgqWehehAqnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137437',5.7,1331,'en','Between Love & Goodbye','A modern gay drama about falling in and out of love, and the rocky road in between.','/ACoxfEKvrLmTdnogtwaLRefbMk.jpg','2009-01-30',97,'Released','Can you promise forever?','Between Love & Goodbye',43547,1.2088,5.9,'vpi31bV6vE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24371,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137439',7.6,1259,'en','Blue Gold: World Water Wars','Wars of the future will be fought over water as they are over oil today, as the source of human survival enters the global marketplace and political arena. Corporate giants, private investors, and corrupt governments vie for control of our dwindling supply, prompting protests, lawsuits, and revolutions from citizens fighting for the right to survive.','/anlIDmM1Gldamc4VpakLDAUS3eu.jpg','2008-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Blue Gold: World Water Wars',18046,1.0535,7,'Ikb4WG8UJRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24372,_binary '\0','/uQqQvmptJLPTcWDrZXn22p7j7s3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137450',6.3,84175,'en','Death Wish','A mild-mannered father is transformed into a killing machine after his family is torn apart by a violent act.','/g0eEEZAqMf98ULQnoiORuazjOpn.jpg','2018-03-01',107,'Released','They came for his family. Now he\'s coming for them.','Death Wish',395990,13.2706,6.2,'HzILu6yyA20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24373,_binary '\0','/rFoRdUFIHQhWRX9ZXK79uilOSWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137470',4.1,9689,'en','Accidental Love','A small town waitress gets a nail accidentally lodged in her head causing unpredictable behavior that leads her to Washington, DC. Sparks fly when she meets a clueless young senator who takes up her cause - but what happens when love interferes with what you stand for?','/znPsDmQVKW0BuBnaErIAPo49X3i.jpg','2015-02-10',101,'Released','Sometimes you nail love. Sometimes it nails you.','Accidental Love',316002,4.749,4.3,'jmPhRNz60MI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24374,_binary '\0','/6E91q6VhpVpBuS7ZYwa1yHelfY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137477',4.2,1249,'en','Scourge','The ancient creature, The Scourge, long confined in a church, wreaks havoc in a small town. Bodies accumulate as Scott and Jessie, rekindling their love, become the town\'s last defense against the unleashed menace.','/85ATyd5A3SAyHtWTuxNBuW3BYCR.jpg','2008-01-31',92,'Released','You are what it eats','Scourge',16925,1.3222,4.3,'YvpcsLFfzzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24375,_binary '\0','/vP9I3436K6AYvO1UR9R9YMsT6NY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11374902',7.4,22082,'ta','டாக்டர்','An army doctor helps his love interest\'s family to find their kidnapped daughter.','/ySPT0USsuDFG9pqHjI50GYOeQmj.jpg','2021-10-09',150,'Released','A journey into the world of kidnapping.','Doctor',673692,1.8463,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24376,_binary '\0','/mrupP5GXx8O4dmhUTTjxND4TMEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11375428',8,21553,'ml','ഹൃദയം','Arun and Darshana are first-year engineering students and they fall in love soon after their college begins. And just as how things work generally in teenage, the road ahead isn\'t too easy for them. Life offers many twists and turns that they least expect.','/rMNzpbruCuBmYPWhaNLrKOlNKcu.jpg','2022-01-21',172,'Released',NULL,'Hridayam',653221,1.6398,7.185,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24377,_binary '\0','/iTozFZZOklA4tZbrl3rDftvFXmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11376010',6.8,4286,'en','People Just Do Nothing: Big in Japan','Since the end of their pirate radio station, life has been quiet for the Kurupt FM boys, but everything is about to change. News reaches them that one of their songs has been used on a popular game show in Japan. They\'ve made it. Their music is reaching hundreds of thousands of people. It\'s finally time for them to enjoy the fame and fortune that they\'ve always known they deserved. Chabuddy G steps excitedly back into his management role as Grindah, Beats, Steves and Decoy begin their journey to international stardom - but is Japan really ready for Kurupt FM?','/d2wft3qQX1fCqPTUdujwxhj9S23.jpg','2021-08-13',97,'Released','Britain\'s finest exports','People Just Do Nothing: Big in Japan',685169,1.4777,6.5,'Qy6cAyHXrE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24378,_binary '\0','/9KDFobjmeU4TK1FFBybwmEhKWXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11377298',5.3,3538,'en','Castle Falls','Rival gangs seek out millions of dollars hidden inside a luxury condominium that\'s scheduled to be demolished, but first they have to deal with the demolition prep crewman who found the loot first.','/g918jDm2NxYtnOQ83nda82otfdG.jpg','2021-12-03',90,'Released','Get in. Get the cash. Get out alive.','Castle Falls',683311,3.4873,6.19,'XetRSFqprNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24379,_binary '\0','/iA4oABeuOxCN2awpXBGTJFGoUyy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11378264',7.3,3625,'en','Mucho Mucho Amor: The Legend of Walter Mercado','Once the world\'s most famous astrologer, Walter Mercado seeks to resurrect a forgotten legacy. Raised in the sugar cane fields of Puerto Rico, Walter grew up to become a gender non-conforming, cape-wearing psychic whose televised horoscopes reached 120 million viewers a day for decades before he mysteriously disappeared.','/lKwNuRdEWqZ94VXMbXjZHAANbvO.jpg','2020-01-24',96,'Released',NULL,'Mucho Mucho Amor: The Legend of Walter Mercado',653735,1.5314,7.3,'XEJqiucxyrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24380,_binary '\0','/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11378946',7.4,186714,'en','Michael','The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.','/dueFqKLvjftnELZaGYwY7xinfaI.jpg','2026-04-22',128,'Released','Discover the making of a king.','Michael',936075,52.0036,8.628,'k-YAcjaLuSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24381,_binary '\0','/oRe8THVApYoyz80eyCQFsJaUrMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11379584',6.9,2189,'mt','Luzzu','Jesmark, a struggling fisherman on the island of Malta, is forced to turn his back on generations of tradition and risk everything by entering the world of black market fishing to provide for his girlfriend and newborn baby.','/qFz8Mna6oc8YAmK4jwZRAC79Mzl.jpg','2021-10-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Luzzu',776544,2.406,6.8,'1kPHPM8kYQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24382,_binary '\0','/rmB5vs4KqJdo767gncUrS9vAsRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137996',2.8,9965,'en','Anaconda 3: Offspring','A mercenary-for-hire accepts a mission from a billionaire to capture a dangerous snake that could possibly help cure a terminal illness.','/3PI6dXS0UlNlB6IXnngfEtufFxm.jpg','2008-10-23',91,'Released','They can taste your fear.','Anaconda 3: Offspring',14863,8.7004,4.611,'56v3LxpSZK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24383,_binary '\0','/7UfURdDIu8UDg9RxRZ21aHKSXvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11379988',7.3,9350,'kn','ಜೇಮ್ಸ್','Santhosh Kumar, who goes by the name James, runs a security agency and has been commissioned to take care of a family that owns a drug cartel. He is swift, agile and deft with his work and wins the appreciation of everyone. But is there more to who Santhosh really is?','/3Fr7Utykumz4G7ZOxtZuNAQudX2.jpg','2022-03-17',122,'Released','The Trademark','James',683056,1.7269,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24384,_binary '\0','/2o2HsGA2bcmUfh2IYstV9vO5iAa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1137999',5.2,1524,'en','Blood River','A psychological thriller following a successful young married couple on their way to visit family. After a blowout on a desolate stretch of highway in Nevada, they head to the next town only to discover it long abandoned. Here they meet a mysterious stranger who seems to know decidedly more than he is sharing.','/5SJ7zfWaPRBSJXP1e4pfKafL9xK.jpg','2009-04-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Blood River',31549,2.7531,4.8,'XLOp2eg6n84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24385,_binary '\0','/fZ7c5VDBIcWD6APnEObOJvW7Kh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11380884',6.9,1812,'en','Farewell Amor','Reunited after a 17-year separation, Walter, an Angolan immigrant, is joined in the U.S. by his wife and teenage daughter. Now absolute strangers sharing a one-bedroom apartment, they discover a shared love of dance that may help overcome the emotional distance between them.','/evH5FR3TGbRDWfftpdpQf5jIq5T.jpg','2020-01-25',101,'Released',NULL,'Farewell Amor',653665,1.9999,6.7,'J364vYbwpzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24386,_binary '\0','/jOpJZjxC7ixLySefhBRhGCBr9m6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11382384',7.8,31088,'en','The Dissident','When Washington Post journalist Jamal Khashoggi disappears after entering Saudi Arabia’s consulate in Istanbul, his fiancée and dissidents around the world are left to piece together the clues to a brutal murder and expose a global cover up perpetrated by the very country he loved.','/wDG6K0uLtJvJyp1cJmluqjBh79v.jpg','2020-12-25',119,'Released','The untold story of the murder that shook the world.','The Dissident',653746,2.1368,7.254,'2I6hjwblA_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24387,_binary '\0','/5GTPOaWAH1LQIdNvEp41Btnx84p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11384004',6.8,4891,'te','లవ్ స్టోరీ','Revanth and Mouni dream big when it comes to their lives. But with their social standing and gender proved to be a hindrance, will they manage to find a way to let their love prevail?','/meFpLRe0ORU4nCQNc80tYynpPEI.jpg','2021-09-24',165,'Released',NULL,'Love Story',663909,1.5597,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24388,_binary '\0','/bMw5POIwZihu8HhpSCM9Igyj3qf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11384306',7,2257,'te','హేజా','A musician and his wife are haunted by an evil eye hex witch who tries to find her source for mortal life through them. The protagonist slums into unrest to escape from the demonic witch\'s grave peal.','/lzBEqdkmif3cSq6AjTJ8cWo0jUF.jpg','2019-12-12',134,'Released',NULL,'Heza',682612,1.2334,5,'CGXouP64_sY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24389,_binary '\0','/8e0kKu4Bp9WksXZBqUX5rztwOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1138442',5.7,1233,'ko','무적자','An idealistic policeman must bring down his estranged older brother, now a powerful gangster in a South Korean port city.','/jpdclGx9P6P67YYUrh8x7XU9II.jpg','2010-09-16',124,'Released','Brothers. Enemies. Killers.','A Better Tomorrow',58959,1.81,6,'KqfJ2CbJmPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24390,_binary '\0','/6BwnmSTQusCJ0uscuvKVarXjXHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1138481',6.8,3614,'nl','Sonny Boy','Waldemar Nods, a young man from Suriname, meets the older Dutch woman Rika van der Lans and they fall in love. In pre-WWII Netherlands they could not be more different. The one black, the other white, 17 years between them and on top of that Rika already has four children with another man. They love each other, but then Rika appears to be pregnant.','/dGv3oVnO03RoCLSCt4DVThbpO5q.jpg','2011-01-27',130,'Released','United by love, torn by fate','Sonny Boy',59424,1.4071,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24391,_binary '\0','/iSmtFTDby0B86HLIu4RnteYnkiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1138482',6.9,2366,'ml','ട്വന്‍റി 20','Advocate Ramesh saves Devan from a murder case. Later, he realize Devan was the actual culprit. Ramesh tries for a payback, unaware of Devan\'s real intentions and the reason for the murder.','/g5YOqZaI06tvcZqE5qBO8jywiBB.jpg','2008-05-11',165,'Released','Celebrate...','Twenty 20',84967,2.0275,6.097,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24392,_binary '\0','/9ThXvPQB0BDOZuKZ8StxY6wh1Qm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1138489',6.2,9563,'en','Personal Effects','Walter is a rising star in the NCAA wrestling world until his life is ripped apart by the brutal murder of his sister. Returning home to console his mother Gloria he seeks vengeance on the man who is accused of the crime. A chance meeting with a beautiful mature woman gives him solace to the situation. Will this unlikely pairing bloom into a romance and heal a wound the world cannot see or will the loss of his sister push him over the edge?','/rrHOhH51iFLCCxKmyogecd1osLo.jpg','2009-03-05',110,'Released','The space between loss and love.','Personal Effects',14857,5.2763,6,'gxzc4yP77ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24393,_binary '\0','/lGKJmltdVrfkI1tWWQ1v7cPeacT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11385066',2.8,1524,'it','The App','Loving girlfriend, family fortune, breakout movie role: he\'s got it all. Until an app awakens a powerful new yearning. While in Rome to shoot his first movie, actor and industrial heir Niccolò becomes obsessed with the dating app \"US\" that sends him into a self-destructive spiral.','/wJcBQreAkGf6RYl91i8RO00c91Q.jpg','2019-12-26',79,'Released',NULL,'The App',653522,1.12,3,'lLvzvgwaVWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24394,_binary '\0','/e9vwRKeJAiu2UUV3qSfWgsxr1t7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11385078',5.6,4759,'te','టక్ జగదీష్','In a village with greedy property fights among the families, Jagadish carries on his father\'s legacy to reform all the property issues in his village while trying to reunite his family, which is also split due to property issues.','/dwRfi1cV9oKjVEll12DJqjLWyOD.jpg','2021-09-09',145,'Released',NULL,'Tuck Jagadish',784963,1.4766,4.042,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24395,_binary '\0','/9yDsyTDXb0V7CrM1YYb79rj50IF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11385128',6.8,10167,'te','V','A celebrated cop, DCP Aditya, faces his toughest challenge when a taunting serial killer begins targeting victims and leaving notes meant for him. Teaming with an aspiring crime novelist, he must stop four more murders to save his medals, career, and reputation while uncovering the killer\'s past.','/iBVcwOVZNGNCNlOLFmcYJW83tTu.jpg','2020-09-05',140,'Released',NULL,'V',683342,2.126,6.544,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24396,_binary '\0','/2l8Mcy6MD8MoqYmQIuGcKz63Sra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11385336',7.2,3003,'es','El olvido que seremos','In the polarized and violent Medellín (Colombia\'s \'City of Eternal Spring\') of the 1970s, doctor Héctor Abad Gómez is concerned about both his children and children from less favored classes. After a devastating loss in the family, Héctor gives himself to the greater cause of public health programs for the poor in Medellín to the consternation of the city\'s authorities.','/hgSnMFJuRsNvwXPD5SadM5shuVs.jpg','2020-08-22',136,'Released',NULL,'Memories of My Father',660943,2.0636,7.5,'Plk8CzFYBcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24397,_binary '\0','/2VnghbG2qWChcE6CdZBMDtDQKCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388278',5.8,6171,'en','A Week Away','Troubled teen Will Hawkins has a run-in with the law that puts him at an important crossroad: go to juvenile detention or attend a Christian summer camp. At first a fish-out-of-water, Will opens his heart, discovers love with a camp regular, and sense of belonging in the last place he expected to find it.','/htTS07IvYv3rv57ftzNEprefwSq.jpg','2021-03-26',95,'Released',NULL,'A Week Away',699102,4.1307,6.9,'dpLaoYw8xug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24398,_binary '\0','/6vLCEAVBCLCOtDxZOlnp2fkVUCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388406',6,22141,'en','Horse Girl','A socially awkward woman with a fondness for arts and crafts, horses, and supernatural crime shows finds her increasingly lucid dreams trickling into her waking life.','/hNQ7st9dFXUXENMcsAuVxcrIBfA.jpg','2020-01-27',103,'Released',NULL,'Horse Girl',653601,5.2074,5.7,'ieqemSsMxek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24399,_binary '\0','/weneJTnAb1IFI94SKcaXzBFmPKH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388416',5.6,2800,'en','Ida Red','Ida Red may not survive her 20-year prison sentence for armed robbery. She turns to her son, Wyatt, for one last job and a chance to regain her freedom.','/etMxKseW67499tUJonLNHXTF538.jpg','2021-11-05',111,'Released',NULL,'Ida Red',818192,2.8135,5.7,'ProGvt36CBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24400,_binary '\0','/A7AjlQTR1UlaNSYwwPRQ5gQTHyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388580',7.4,26815,'en','Miss Americana','A raw and emotionally revealing look at one of the most iconic artists of our time during a transformational period in her life as she learns to embrace her role not only as a songwriter and performer, but as a woman harnessing the full power of her voice.','/z1HiEB1UEfdA5fPkngekjQ2vlCC.jpg','2020-01-31',85,'Released',NULL,'Miss Americana',653567,3.8357,7.8,'40RsbcFRwNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24401,_binary '\0','/2uUxzE7II3verbbXyirh48VQpoz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388822',6.2,1367,'en','Romance on the Menu','New York restaurateur Caroline inherits a café in Lemon Myrtle Cove, Australia. While there, she starts falling for the place and its people, particularly Simon, the café’s charming local chef.','/dKV4BszFD8QioDJqgoH0CwpNjvN.jpg','2020-09-24',92,'Released','A life in New York, a love in Australia.','Romance on the Menu',728204,2.3457,6.9,'MFNKHY86oFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24402,_binary '\0','/pEaswlPhx6ocV5w0J6lpNBs2GjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11388990',6.7,1963,'es','Te llevo conmigo','An epic love story spanning decades is sparked by a chance encounter between two men in provincial Mexico. Based on a true story, ambition and societal pressure propel an aspiring chef to leave his soulmate and make the treacherous journey to New York, where life will never be the same.','/yI3XakDqPSElfJACmk3mYnrPn78.jpg','2021-06-25',111,'Released',NULL,'I Carry You with Me',653594,2.0891,7,'ueldqg6D-Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24403,_binary '\0','/cv6Nn8Yt9mgFoUSievEdW9JK82A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11389748',7.5,19996,'en','Mass','Two couples meet for a painful and raw conversation in the aftermath of a violent tragedy.','/c3MQ3YZKJadrH2Yv45i07qMHGPM.jpg','2021-10-08',111,'Released',NULL,'Mass',423333,2.9948,7.3,'WgvsfKhGdgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24404,_binary '\0','/unK6POhCN6ta6l5yH8oqlRS1UJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11389868',6.2,2535,'en','Marvelous and the Black Hole','A teenage delinquent befriends a surly magician who helps her navigate her inner demons and dysfunctional family with sleight of hand magic.','/p8JiuRrSdg6qXNnJWTqOftTy6D.jpg','2022-04-22',81,'Released',NULL,'Marvelous and the Black Hole',685411,1.6903,6.6,'ayAgQxXRcas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24405,_binary '\0','/fypydCipcWDKDTTCoPucBsdGYXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11389872',6.8,172341,'en','Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes','Several generations following Caesar\'s reign, apes – now the dominant species – live harmoniously while humans have been reduced to living in the shadows. As a new tyrannical ape leader builds his empire, one young ape undertakes a harrowing journey that will cause him to question all he\'s known about the past and to make choices that will define a future for apes and humans alike.','/gKkl37BQuKTanygYQG1pyYgLVgf.jpg','2024-05-08',145,'Released','No one can stop the reign.','Kingdom of the Planet of the Apes',653346,30.3239,7.05,'Kdr5oedn7q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24406,_binary '\0','/qeoAcUAw1xNYJ9PP7m1Wc7kKZZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11390036',5.9,19019,'en','A Fall from Grace','When a law-abiding woman gets indicted for murdering her husband, her lawyer soon realizes that a larger conspiracy may be at work.','/uQqmFcKOSg7RVtaIKOTtv1vWQPx.jpg','2020-01-17',120,'Released','Every Woman Has A Breaking Point','A Fall from Grace',651070,5.9214,6.985,'eVXwBwQdBrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24407,_binary '\0','/9Ttizfo7RkG7rbZZ71vIEkHIQde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11390180',5.7,1656,'ru','Конёк-Горбунок','Romantic John the Fool and his friend Foal set out on a series of unpredictable adventures in different magical worlds. The two buddies will have to outsmart an evil tyrant king, catch the firebird, and find John’s true love.','/kY4tmwZaBZitnDRcWFp3Wy197Um.jpg','2021-02-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Upon the Magic Roads',576784,5.5484,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24408,_binary '\0','/dBwi6eHcxmWQfOMSCUMgq86HJTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11390442',7.1,3330,'no','Den største forbrytelsen','During World War II, millions of Jews from all over Europe are deported and killed in German concentration camps. When the German troops invade Norway, the Norwegian Jews feel safe and protected. But anti-Semitism knows no borders and as the war escalates in Europe, the situation changes drastically. Suddenly, their radios are taken away; their passports are stamped with a big J and one day, all the men men over the age of 15 are arrested and taken to prisons camps. Many of the women left behind are too frightened to escape and are desperately waiting for their husbands and sons to come back home. On November 26, 1942, hundreds of Jews are picked up by the police in the middle of the night and are transported to the dock in Oslo. Unknowing and frightened men, women, children, sick and old are forced on board the awaiting German cargo ship \"SS DONAU\". The ship leaves with 532 Norwegian Jews onboard; 302 men, 188 women and 42 children. The end station is Auschwitz.','/AhllNkf3UE4VdlmPQmTIbAQTiZ6.jpg','2020-12-25',126,'Released','Separated by war. Driven by hope.','Betrayed',598439,2.446,6.9,'jSPfhwlUI40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24409,_binary '\0','/gwaPhVsbuN7dF6PNUZgl6wxhUeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139085',5.6,2386,'ru','1612: Хроники смутного времени','The czar of Russia has died and a power vacuum has developed. This period in the late 16th and early 17th century has been called \"The Time of Troubles.\" There are many impostors who claim to the right to rule, but there\'s only one heir, the Czarina Kseniya Godunova. She has married a Polish military leader who wants to claim the Russian throne in her name so he can rule all of Russia. As the Poles move in on Moscow in an attempt to install the czarina on the throne, Andrei, a serf with a life-long infatuation of the czarina attempts to save her from her brutal Polish husband.','/ArIJqMWe2NkaQq3ZMmmKAQdlUNv.jpg','2007-10-28',135,'Released','The Tsar is dead. Chaos reigns.','1612: Chronicles of the Dark Time',52256,1.7072,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24410,_binary '\0','/cRHBTHe5g6TSNu217I9Yy6ZqhJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11390864',4.4,2070,'ml','കേശു ഈ വീടിന്റെ നാഥൻ','Simple yet smart, sexagenarian Keshu has a loving family and a driving school to call his own. Everything\'s perfect until he wins a lottery worth crores.','/vKCC7ohugDxKqLO9z5E2E0cabs3.jpg','2021-12-31',142,'Released',NULL,'Keshu Ee Veedinte Nadhan',834732,1.0923,5.9,'b9yE8cOThsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24411,_binary '\0','/4EOjxjMPHUmqQI7hdEmPCAlh25D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11392114',7.2,1779,'en','Bloody Nose, Empty Pockets','A portrait of the lives of a disparate group of patrons and employees at an American watering hole today.','/lc0IIAGaVgUoKs6PSQIC34HOBkG.jpg','2020-02-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Bloody Nose, Empty Pockets',605437,1.3835,6.6,'i0npVmJOL0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24412,_binary '\0','/zh4YAP3T8UUlT8ZjwG62QMJa2r1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11392272',4.9,2299,'en','The Retreat','Renee and Valerie, a couple at a cross roads in their relationship, leave the city to spend the week at a remote cabin with friends. But when they arrive, their friends are nowhere to be found. As they stumble through their relationship woes, they discover they are being hunted by a group of militant extremists who are determined to exterminate them.','/xDlc336bLsy9dgkvuGEm0bGz6Mb.jpg','2021-05-21',82,'Released','The only way out is to fight.','The Retreat',821390,2.8537,5,'d4BzPkBpDFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24413,_binary '\0','/l7MH1RtEiKeM3p7vL1HsZnkYYNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139282',6.1,6251,'en','Stolen Lives','A detective becomes obsessed with solving a child\'s 50-year-old murder, uncovering striking similarities between the case and his son\'s disappearance.','/8DjMTNlipJjOVYewxKcWKvphp2i.jpg','2009-10-10',97,'Released','Secrets from the past don\'t stay buried.','Stolen',38850,3.0408,5.894,'Bzxq_JmFlpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24414,_binary '\0','/386dpSzzDNvW4dc0XcyBdmjyzVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139319',6.6,4029,'en','A Film with Me in It','A dissolute scriptwriter and a dejected actor become unwittingly drawn into a labyrinthine mess when several people experience bizarre accidental deaths in their flat. Though the men didn\'t deliberately cause any of the incidents, they fear that they will be unfairly pegged as murderers if they relay information to the cops, and promptly set about disposing of the corpses in gruesome ways.','/57GQHC3i251zv1efn85wTxYSykb.jpg','2008-10-17',89,'Released','A black comedy about screenwriting and slightly fatal accidents','A Film with Me in It',33035,2.0857,6.2,'af43xf2jl5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24415,_binary '\0','/dXWJ3cNNx3BOk124s7VT5xrklTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139328',7.2,177631,'en','The Ghost Writer','A writer stumbles upon a long-hidden secret when he agrees to help former British Prime Minister Adam Lang complete his memoirs on a remote island after the politician\'s assistant drowns in a mysterious accident.','/rK7m2Ba0ieXa37NaAmrx4dfRvvM.jpg','2010-02-12',128,'Released','Read between the lies.','The Ghost Writer',11439,8.9189,6.8,'WrvkY6rAgHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24416,_binary '\0','/n0uefHZH2sX0HxU5Ec1w1tF8n3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394158',6.5,2427,'en','Miss Juneteenth','Turquoise, a former beauty queen turned hardworking single mother, prepares her rebellious teenage daughter for the “Miss Juneteenth” pageant, hoping to keep her from repeating the same mistakes in life that she did.','/5aueUTOvA8Y6A4eteDwhgo8ReX8.jpg','2020-09-25',103,'Released',NULL,'Miss Juneteenth',653668,1.5609,6.4,'Vb3oREG_DdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24417,_binary '\0','/ogtf9Xub7mweKlznWvFVNddmFmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394168',7.3,2372,'en','Be Water','In 1971, after being rejected by Hollywood, Bruce Lee returned to his parents’ homeland of Hong Kong to complete four iconic films. Charting his struggles between two worlds, this portrait explores questions of identity and representation through the use of rare archival footage, interviews with loved ones and Bruce’s own writings.','/yUDtBBQEpmYptyk6wbYR54Sa2OD.jpg','2020-01-25',105,'Released','Before the myth, a life lived.','Be Water',653733,2.2085,6.825,'8-R7SZ1wgNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24418,_binary '\0','/525TvWDI3alGFaZaqM3qThcbFja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394170',6.8,2939,'en','Coded Bias','Exploring the fallout of MIT Media Lab researcher Joy Buolamwini\'s startling discovery that facial recognition does not see dark-skinned faces accurately, and her journey to push for the first-ever legislation in the U.S. to govern against bias in the algorithms that impact us all.','/2PknXfJbjxIkrC5RqiNEmywSPOY.jpg','2020-11-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Coded Bias',653734,1.8839,6.9,'jZl55PsfZJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24419,_binary '\0','/qhG2hGAf4kgNUphdvsOZMn4z6QY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394180',7.4,7716,'en','Dick Johnson Is Dead','With this inventive portrait, director Kirsten Johnson seeks a way to keep her 86-year-old father alive forever. Utilizing moviemaking magic and her family’s dark humor, she celebrates Dr. Dick Johnson’s last years by staging fantasies of death and beyond. Together, dad and daughter confront the great inevitability awaiting us all.','/vnfI34kmi3fcdgP7HZjIgGOJHGY.jpg','2020-01-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Dick Johnson Is Dead',653574,2.3206,7.1,'wfTmT6C5DnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24420,_binary '\0','/lHqIXIZVgQkVmAygvwnRYedADUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394182',7.5,6049,'en','Feels Good Man','When indie comic character Pepe the Frog becomes an unwitting icon of hate, his creator, artist Matt Furie, fights to bring Pepe back from the darkness and navigate America\'s cultural divide.','/osN5whpwiXN5j7umqemCKoCiXKi.jpg','2020-09-04',94,'Released','I heard you pull yer pants all the way to go pee.','Feels Good Man',653578,3.3218,7.053,'97akfYZv28I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24421,_binary '\0','/etBgjhHHvnkqFw2njIqRkyAgX7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394188',6.4,2337,'en','Spaceship Earth','In 1991 a group of countercultural visionaries built an enormous replica of earth’s ecosystem called Biosphere 2. When eight “biospherians” lived sealed inside, they faced ecological calamities and cult accusations. Their epic adventure is a cautionary tale but also a testament to the power of small groups reimagining the world.','/XVFKgCseqUmGCrXTw2I4jgeffi.jpg','2020-03-13',115,'Released',NULL,'Spaceship Earth',653575,1.1847,6.2,'mGvYFB6GHRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24422,_binary '\0','/csuz4zkcyckKn5dVVRkOhCmkWJs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394200',7.9,3415,'en','Welcome to Chechnya','This searing investigative work shadows a group of activists risking unimaginable peril to confront the ongoing anti-LGBTQ program raging in the repressive and closed Russian republic. Unfettered access and a remarkable approach to protecting anonymity exposes this under-reported atrocity–and an extraordinary group of people confronting evil.','/wR1b8w3fFPQR5wpbkekviLmo4wW.jpg','2020-01-26',107,'Released','Inside the Russian Republic\'s deadly war on gays','Welcome to Chechnya',653579,1.7932,6.9,'WtJkS-oFw3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24423,_binary '\0','/4lvijrIf4s9q73KiLbKD1MP9eYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394276',7.5,3139,'en','Assassins','True crime meets global spy thriller in this gripping account of the assassination of Kim Jong-nam, the half brother of the North Korean leader. The film follows the trial of the two female assassins, probing the question: were the women trained killers or innocent pawns of North Korea?','/guEH393qNWWh2wBJoGP7oqmjTK5.jpg','2021-08-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Assassins',653740,3.1943,6.8,'LNkmnVd9wHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24424,_binary '\0','/bwJr93o3nhqmYC4DSXijgdyF4PQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394282',7.3,2835,'es','Sin señas particulares','Magdalena makes a journey to find her son, who has disappeared on his way to the Mexican border with the United States. Her odyssey takes her to meet Miguel, a man recently deported from the US. They start to travel together, Magdalena looking for her son, and Miguel hoping to see his mother again.','/muB0BuXV3UIABCiVC6sm0oJOza0.jpg','2020-11-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Identifying Features',653658,1.5539,7,'eMUypshyFKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24425,_binary '\0','/14So9mTE0kOdKXHwlZgiNHJDmjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394296',6.5,5005,'en','Into the Deep: The Submarine Murder Case','When journalist Kim Wall disappears after boarding inventor Peter Madsen\'s submarine, his changing story about her fate masks a terrifying truth.','/jdeKTPotIrwt4qSAr6rC7VAsPqs.jpg','2020-01-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Into the Deep: The Submarine Murder Case',653588,1.981,6.6,'IrRJYc-KdUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24426,_binary '\0','/bah2TMqbDs5DAvJclOd8DqhkuYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394298',7.5,10354,'es','El agente topo','When a daughter becomes concerned about her mother\'s well-being in a retirement home, private investigator Romulo hires Sergio, an 83-year-old man who becomes a new resident—and a mole inside the home, who struggles to balance his assignment with becoming increasingly involved in the lives of several residents.','/eWKySzO45iIbT4yL2zVkVB2w6MR.jpg','2020-12-11',90,'Released','It\'s never too late to become a spy.','The Mole Agent',653756,2.0248,7.766,'5Z1hPH3b5RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24427,_binary '\0','/2yAeit9stzwfRB5tIRBQQyoRQ4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394318',7.3,4384,'it','The Truffle Hunters','In the secret forests of Northern Italy, a dwindling group of joyful old men and their faithful dogs search for the world’s most expensive ingredient, the white Alba truffle. Their stories form a real-life fairy tale that celebrates human passion in a fragile land that seems forgotten in time.','/A8kuHpb1AKvRVbYbxBK4hua008p.jpg','2020-12-25',84,'Released',NULL,'The Truffle Hunters',653762,2.7061,7.5,'KFYhrc0AnVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24428,_binary '\0','/2wKOO39vOvWK1vBDb72NuNfkE55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394332',5.9,22474,'en','Spree','Desperate for an online following, a rideshare driver has figured out a deadly plan to go viral and he will stop at nothing to get his five minutes of fame.','/tbYvzpy4QFhUHRBHe4VeUKJst96.jpg','2020-08-14',93,'Released','Murder is trending.','Spree',653598,3.5799,6.4,'erM9PAi_QYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24429,_binary '\0','/2QDgTgyfjDzEsbhzXYeDyGDzqLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11394468',7.4,1845,'en','The Go-Go\'s','As the first all-female band to play their instruments, write their songs and have a No. 1 album, The Go-Go’s made history. Underpinned by candid testimonies, this film chronicles the meteoric rise to fame of a band born in the LA punk scene who became a pop phenomenon.','/c5bktp3aUDplX9xCPrPrKxwOnVY.jpg','2021-03-08',97,'Released',NULL,'The Go-Go\'s',653748,1.8298,7.1,'GsiRfL11I08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24430,_binary '\0','/l49X7KxytkRCdXrpAu92QqxVrN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139592',3.9,27281,'en','Jeepers Creepers 3','Taking place on the last day of the Creeper’s twenty-three-day feeding frenzy, as the skeptical Sergeant Tubbs teams up with a task force hellbent on destroying the Creeper for good. The Creeper fights back in gory glory as its enemies grow closer than ever before to learning the secret of its dark origins.','/pK7ge28ubs45av9aGEbVWW7ZbA8.jpg','2017-09-26',100,'Released','Third time\'s the charm.','Jeepers Creepers 3',55341,8.0852,4.9,'qP_wHtDUA3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24431,_binary '\0','/t5rjRHHmwyqbZdT31MFnwCJiPQy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11396226',7.9,4294,'ta','முதல் நீ முடிவும் நீ','A refreshing tale of a bunch of high school students, their dreams, first love, music, guitar, football, video cassettes and more.','/6SMQwH8ZRq7iMJdqzg5DkDLTWbJ.jpg','2022-01-21',148,'Released','You\'re the Beginning, You\'re the End','Mudhal Nee Mudivum Nee',861996,0.9263,7.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24432,_binary '\0','/2VlpjpaUeX7hFNxwJ6euBhUaln1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11396290',6,2299,'ta','பேச்சுலர்','A carefree young man gets into a live-in relationship with his colleague, and gets her pregnant. What happens next?','/569NxKoT8wFcDOiRokFsbpqfiPR.jpg','2021-12-03',175,'Released',NULL,'Bachelor',631632,0.9261,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24433,_binary '\0','/zHcOppWpmIfbmbuvF98xTnqf4jk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11396310',8.1,12209,'ta','விடுதலை: பாகம் I','Kumaresan, a police constable, gets recruited for an operation implanted to capture Perumal Vaathiyar, who leads a separatist group dedicated to fighting against the authorities for committing atrocities against innocent village women in the name of police interrogations.','/oTxPji8PY3PL0SK9e4mkt2laJKg.jpg','2023-03-30',146,'Released',NULL,'Viduthalai: Part I',786345,1.6049,7.9,'GYeSfq_bj_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24434,_binary '\0','/b7QjZbmKj2wLnKlqwHTXP0GKjzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139668',4.7,55058,'en','The Unborn','A young woman fights the spirit that is slowly taking possession of her.','/42H2aaD5UubsHyWt6zfrFMRP8y1.jpg','2009-01-09',87,'Released','Evil will do anything to live.','The Unborn',13788,7.4463,5.2,'sc3Cba0qOco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24435,_binary '\0','/tu9RF8tzmT3umpWUBWYXQhxN77R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139797',7.8,241644,'sv','Låt den rätte komma in','When Oskar, a sensitive, bullied 12-year-old boy, meets his new neighbor, the mysterious and moody Eli, they strike up a friendship. Initially reserved with each other, Oskar and Eli slowly form a close bond, but it soon becomes apparent that she is no ordinary young girl.','/7IG4WjaAOVDlLvLUkh513HSwhW8.jpg','2008-10-24',115,'Released','Eli is 12 years old. She\'s been 12 for over 200 years, and she just moved in next door.','Let the Right One In',13310,6.9461,7.543,'ICp4g9p_rgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24436,_binary '\0','/mfSXuVi1ePDfmMEUGcfHfxRkW4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1139800',5.8,2445,'fr','La Fille de Monaco','A brilliant and neurotic attorney goes to Monaco to defend a famous criminal. But, instead of focusing on the case, he falls for a beautiful she-devil, who turns him into a complete wreck... Hopefully, his zealous bodyguard will step in and put everything back in order... Or will he ?','/xAe375gjZjrBkbfL4cS6k9R2Ffk.jpg','2008-08-20',95,'Released',NULL,'The Girl from Monaco',15342,2.2596,5.1,'bnQGv59WQgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24437,_binary '\0','/c872xfad1PmqdGOJOiOwUIw0Bln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11398346',6.5,3636,'en','Strawberry Mansion','In the not-too-distant future, an all-seeing surveillance state conducts “dream audits” to collect taxes on the unconscious lives of the populace. Mild-mannered government agent James Preble travels to a remote farmhouse to audit the dreams of Arabella “Bella” Isadora, an eccentric, aging artist. Entering Bella’s vast VHS archive, which contains a lifetime of dreams, Preble stumbles upon a secret that offers him a chance at love—and hope for escape.','/xJtBlQIJaioDugwl5ZQbgrMRSi5.jpg','2021-07-22',91,'Released','Do you believe that your dreams are your own?','Strawberry Mansion',776561,2.083,6.753,'dpPsvOSc1Gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24438,_binary '\0','/pt2zfjKf8vAOi7yd40HnewTNJyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11399896',4.5,1678,'en','The Last Manhunt','In 1909, Willie Boy and his love Carlota go on the run after he accidentally shoots her father in a confrontation gone terribly wrong. With President Taft coming to the area, the local sheriff leads two Native American trackers seeking justice for their “murdered” tribal leader.','/95Bn6HZBBJcG7LOBMAzNH0gmLih.jpg','2022-11-18',103,'Released','In 1909, they entered the desert. Now, the truth will finally emerge.','The Last Manhunt',754452,4.6568,5.768,'wvCw2FoTXwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24439,_binary '\0','/hp6fGWF1e2BMmMg0s6hzR8Me5rT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11400902',4.7,1704,'en','A Banquet','Widowed mother Holly is radically tested when her teenage daughter Betsey experiences a profound enlightenment and insists that her body is no longer her own, but in service to a higher power. Bound to her newfound faith, Betsey refuses to eat but loses no weight. In an agonizing dilemma, torn between love and fear, Holly is forced to confront the boundaries of her own beliefs.','/4FlSYrcjO4z3McJ6UP3V5npb4B4.jpg','2022-02-18',97,'Released','Family or famine.','A Banquet',775400,2.4349,4.297,'zVZfglJ6bS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24440,_binary '\0','/vkbwqkJv7KzhYgqyXNHYVLgXBdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11402172',3.1,1535,'tr','Kırk Yalan','During a wedding celebration, a tasting of imported fruit offered by the groom\'s buddy turns the joyous occasion into one fueled by wild intoxication.','/cxrIWQgPFsI9YaKS639kLja1U27.jpg','2019-12-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Big Liar',656505,1.3667,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24441,_binary '\0','/1LLyFDrw3fdjyikDspNPesIxcKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11409736',6.6,1432,'de','Unrueh','New technologies are transforming a 19th-century watchmaking town in Switzerland. Josephine, a young factory worker, produces the unrest wheel, swinging in the heart of the mechanical watch. Exposed to new ways of organizing money, time and labor, she gets involved with the local anarchist movement.','/yFPkFOBDxDBZxpfjhqhjl3bJaGu.jpg','2022-11-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Unrest',749136,2.3817,6.5,'ABVxQX4gGK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24442,_binary '\0','/4c8YNkfRAEZ7xKgpoqmWlh5EW5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11410312',7.3,4333,'ml','ഫാലിമി','During a dysfunctional family\'s chaotic pilgrimage to a spiritual shrine, their elderly patriarch goes missing.','/eqOCGqzLUh76zrE1aNs4cI7L8vY.jpg','2023-11-17',125,'Released',NULL,'Falimy',1044558,1.0687,7,'upgFiKwsv8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24443,_binary '\0','/gInasAxA43twaEUZ6sIR1Csvt2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11416594',6.5,10314,'tr','Karakomik Filmler 2: Deli','Güven, a taxi driver is desperately in love with Meral, but he’s too shy to open up to her. One day he picks up a customer, gets accused of a crime he didn’t commit and his world is turned upside down.','/675Ajv7Udpv2c4XGRazyQfRa74y.jpg','2020-01-17',60,'Released',NULL,'Comidark Films 2: Insane',665090,1.5992,6.302,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24444,_binary '\0','/zqMT7xmPdN5WLwxP2UonlESFaiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11416746',6.8,6601,'en','Time','Fox Rich, indomitable matriarch and modern-day abolitionist, strives to keep her family together while fighting for the release of her incarcerated husband. An intimate, epic, and unconventional love story, filmed over two decades.','/2yLZmlf6vdpkhTaD0oUmIFu8SsM.jpg','2020-10-09',81,'Released',NULL,'Time',653729,1.7233,6.7,'kq6Hh07oLvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24445,_binary '\0','/ugSkna6kFW4wRZvZWCaaMprhE0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1141702',6.1,2400,'en','I Believe in Unicorns','Feeling awkward and isolated, an imaginative and strong-willed teenage girl runs away from home with an older punk rock drifter.','/gxquUhh9IleBnWJFoNJQmfjXqgG.jpg','2015-05-29',80,'Released',NULL,'I Believe in Unicorns',253257,3.2358,6.636,'EFfkK0AeZ9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24446,_binary '\0','/zw38XzfM7AGBrKQCJDnPU3mz9WC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11417856',6.4,1379,'ja','鹿の王 ユナと約束の旅','Following a brutal war, former soldier Van toils in a mine controlled by the ruling empire. One day, his solitary existence is upended when a pack of wild dogs carrying a deadly and incurable disease attack, leaving only Van and a young girl named Yuna as survivors. Finally free, the pair seek out a simple existence in the countryside but are pursued by nefarious forces. Intent on protecting Yuna at all costs, Van must uncover the true cause of the plague ravaging the kingdom—and its possible cure.','/tE6bhyMR973XcWr2gqeCmAgvvYW.jpg','2021-10-28',113,'Released','Fight to survive.','The Deer King',633844,3.4861,6.8,'YP_dnbUC9kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24447,_binary '\0','/xDlcgq80BiRr9ZIA5u5CBtperKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11417886',6,1340,'es','El prófugo','Inés works as a dubbing actress and sings in a choir in Buenos Aires. While on an idyllic trip she suffers a traumatic episode that she can’t recover from. She has trouble sleeping and experiences very vivid nightmares as strange sounds begin to emerge from inside her. Awake, Inés feels suddenly surrounded by people that seem to come from her dreams.','/zGD9CiO6vCk1nmvk0SzlhgYB5fz.jpg','2021-07-30',95,'Released',NULL,'The Intruder',667757,1.9037,5.9,'h4gg2Jdl0mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24448,_binary '\0','/qkurjJVQUs4u417GfiMAKlurkcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11418452',6.6,6696,'ru','Холоп','Grigory, born into an oligarch family, is so spoiled that he believes he\'s above the law. When he faces jail, his father decides to \'rehabilitate\' his son. An abandoned village is reconstructed, 19th century style. Grigory \'goes back in time\', reincarnated as a serf, to learn how to appreciate life and to work hard.','/m98QuZX72UaMfqcQPHvGF0ZTC2R.jpg','2019-11-24',109,'Released','From Hero To Zero','Son of a Rich',575828,2.7655,6.82,'goGvFuBM23M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24449,_binary '\0','/5uXav1wZpkH9JG1zBjSed4gBvFu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11421396',6.8,1602,'en','The Secret Ingredient','Small-town baker, Kelly, gets a big surprise when she is invited to compete on a Valentine\'s Day baking show in New York City - and an even bigger surprise when she runs into her ex-fiance.','/loyO1ZVWGQeqSfBGJBsjdYnPvD8.jpg','2020-02-15',80,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Ingredient',661334,1.6069,6.7,'Bo7qFCeVs_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24450,_binary '\0','/vKgfx1uglYlSACBnKBhO9P478OO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11423214',3.6,7707,'en','Girl Next','A young woman is abducted by a strange group of human traffickers who use drug and trauma based mind control to turn women into \"Sofia\" dolls. Trapped in a waking nightmare she fights for a way to escape, to avoid becoming Girl Next.','/zx8bTpZRVPzjicmzwgWhRAEjD5I.jpg','2021-06-18',102,'Released','Being curious won\'t help you, being obedient will.','Girl Next',842169,2.536,4.4,'0leFDscDkpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24451,_binary '\0','/yn6HPKA7reVnSVYMGQZ5M8O0FfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11423420',5.6,1553,'en','Please Baby Please','After witnessing a murder in the gritty streets of 1950s Manhattan, newlyweds Suze and Arthur become the dangerous obsession of a greaser gang that awakens a sleeping quandary into the couple\'s sexual identity.','/csdPm6ROtpfvZCvLmPioi48jg6M.jpg','2022-10-28',96,'Released','Give yourself to desire!','Please Baby Please',703285,1.9551,5.7,'5IutqDKERXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-1