tato Salad 3: The Musical',661037,1.1031,4.4,'hKKViilfEO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24496,_binary '\0','/Aec0DEgQEwzfGa9551qpiS85V3j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1145144',6,6453,'en','Center Stage: Turn It Up','All self-taught dancer Kate Parker has ever wanted to do was perform with the American Academy of Ballet. But when she doesnt make it after auditioning, she learns that it takes more than precision and perfection to succeed in the dance world.','/ngD6GbYx9auu95YMgfNImOnC6uj.jpg','2008-10-30',95,'Released',NULL,'Center Stage: Turn It Up',16346,3.6021,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24497,_binary '\0','/dStHGSXRiXFbuF4WB7ocOhVBsYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1145157',5.4,3924,'en','The Jerk Theory','An aspiring recording artist, Adam, is burned by a bad relationship experience and decides that if women won\'t respond to the \"nice guy\" then he\'ll be \"the jerk.\" This is wildly successful with meaningless relationships, but when Adam meets and falls for Molly, who doesn\'t fall for his jerk routine, Adam is forced to reconsider his dating philosophy.','/iimMsIA5xrTMNoyaiXzJkH7QSh1.jpg','2009-02-05',93,'Released','Treating girls wrong never felt so right... Until he met her.','The Jerk Theory',34188,1.8047,5.8,'VrnezHLLHdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24498,_binary '\0','/vc7OE84UDe6qreX4mVTEOHrCbxC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11454066',7.1,2636,'en','You Cannot Kill David Arquette','Following his infamous championship as part of a marketing stunt for the film Ready to Rumble, David Arquette is widely known as the most hated man in pro-wrestling worldwide. Nearly 20 years after he \"won\" the initial title, through ups and downs in his career, with his family, and with his struggles with addiction, David Arquette seeks redemption by returning to the ring...for real this time.','/tdYm50Tfvyp4jmv96WdCFLSlEJL.jpg','2020-08-21',90,'Released',NULL,'You Cannot Kill David Arquette',672035,2.7015,6.702,'ryHmKssMGak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24499,_binary '\0','/ngzOH1Sjk3Ax5cY1ivqU9OIsMRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11454170',6.5,1700,'ko','시동','Two boys are becoming real adults during a turbulent time as they experience a world that doesn\'t go their way.','/l4pTmfKWYCyZIVgNV158JyWlhzW.jpg','2019-12-18',102,'Released','It\'s time to grow up.','Start-Up',581530,2.8891,6.9,'kBkeYEN6aG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24500,_binary '\0','/mKuwJENuTkasTdAgB1wot5eQRS8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11454320',4.9,3186,'en','Offseason','Upon receiving a mysterious letter that her mother\'s grave has been vandalized, Marie travels to the desolate island town where she\'s buried. Just as she arrives, the island closes for the season, leaving Marie trapped in a nightmare.','/zlX4WdEMzVomRukPjVQx6U9jtBS.jpg','2022-03-11',83,'Released','Something is off on this island.','Offseason',796256,2.1048,5.2,'QPtKRTlnWNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24501,_binary '\0','/apwZwJqqqPA8ZvaaMjylD9LxJyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1145446',5.6,4652,'no','Fatso','Overweight loner Rino spends his days in seclusion, until his dad rents a room to an overtly sexual girl who challenges Rino to break down his walls.','/9OVAzfeTRPI16iXbDaxdo0wmHVz.jpg','2008-10-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Fatso',16324,2.937,5.5,'86G3DmKlskA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24502,_binary '\0','/sFxRU341P2iVlXicthm9iMbpFhX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11454718',6.4,5863,'zh','晴雅集','Every few hundred years, the most powerful demon on earth—a snake demon—awakens, and the Yin-Yang Masters are summoned to the capital. Meanwhile, the Princess of the realm has her own plans, as she conspires to claim the demon’s power.','/odgDN1po1j7cEVLeBhkVS0Oh4kC.jpg','2020-12-24',132,'Released',NULL,'The Yin-Yang Master: Dream of Eternity',757860,3.1692,7.243,'DdZPRVpJXB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24503,_binary '\0','/hUfnYsVMmXcbcwzWHr62jTtpdkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11456054',6.3,30722,'en','Run Hide Fight','A 17-year-old girl uses her wits, survival skills, and compassion to fight for her life, and those of her fellow classmates, against a group of live-streaming school shooters.','/wlP25H14OvKoFORIwuKomZzioA5.jpg','2021-06-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Run Hide Fight',629017,7.0021,6.6,'2Kh3jccZocc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24504,_binary '\0','/aAm4qRCzWB9l5XTuuCdrhNpiyyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11457736',5.5,2619,'en','My Dad\'s Christmas Date','It’s Christmas and the charming city of York, home to Jules, 16, and her dad, David, is decked out ready for the festive season. In many ways, David and Jules’ relationship is no different from that of most fathers and their sixteen-year-old daughters. He struggles to understand her, she refuses to communicate with him. He wants to be involved in her life, she wants her own space. In one important respect, however, David and Jules share a profound bond: the death of Jules’ mum, and David’s wife, in a car crash two years before. With both struggling to cope with everyday life in the shadow of their loss, Jules, inspired by happy memories of her mum, decides to take matters into her own hands.','/mAfeEGYIwEG4YmVk77pv8fk0Dpr.jpg','2020-12-03',91,'Released',NULL,'My Dad\'s Christmas Date',754053,2.6361,6.1,'YSk9TPDtTF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24505,_binary '\0','/8ys6VgwZCIQ7nN4Nv4z7GPPuFMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11459366',7.7,9926,'en','Billie Eilish: The World\'s a Little Blurry','This documentary offers a deeply intimate look at extraordinary teenager Billie Eilish. Award-winning filmmaker R.J. Cutler follows her journey on the road, onstage, and at home with her family as the writing and recording of her debut album changes her life.','/bDQ95W5LPHW9FHlPj3QX3jvM9Z7.jpg','2021-02-26',140,'Released',NULL,'Billie Eilish: The World\'s a Little Blurry',654754,7.0787,8.174,'7JUQvUv7QxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24506,_binary '\0','/khKie13svIF1nL1a8A0D4XWlJTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11460512',6.7,1746,'de','Nahschuss','The ambitious scientist Franz Walter doesn\'t hesitate when he is promised a professorship at the university. He immediately accepts, pledges absolute loyalty to the system and agrees to work for the GDR\'s foreign intelligence service until he can take up his new position. Together with his colleague Dirk, he is sent on foreign assignments to West Germany. Franz soon has to use blackmail to get innocent people to talk. But his superiors go even further: GDR refugees and their relatives are targeted to be psychologically destroyed, forged letters, medical diagnoses, surveillance and wiretapping are on the agenda. However, this is more than Franz can bear: he feels powerless and increasingly isolates himself. When he then decides to steal secret documents for a later defection to the West, this results in an unfortunate chain reaction leading to his arrest and ultimately to his execution...','/wZZExOfjt668GsQzey3dIN7ZOD6.jpg','2021-08-12',116,'Released','Based on the true story of the secret death penalty in East Germany','The Last Execution',802121,1.6306,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24507,_binary '\0','/AeTcDA1gQKH2SuN7aPn8hA35yZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11460816',6,1311,'pt','Fogo-Fátuo','On his deathbed, His Majesty Alfredo, King without a crown, is taken back to distant youth memories from the time when he dreamt of becoming a fireman. His encounter with instructor Afonso from the fire brigade, opens a new chapter in the life of the two young men devoted to love and desire, and the will to change the status quo.','/11DCSb6hWSok3zF0MDFalLCkCiB.jpg','2022-09-14',67,'Released','A musical fantasy by João Pedro Rodrigues','Will-o\'-the-Wisp',964704,1.9503,6,'yhxLSXpMUhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24508,_binary '\0','/mZnzpRdoZsz8SrXeIKUJyMzH3hC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11460818',6.5,3605,'hi','हेल्मेट','Desperate to make some quick money, Lucky and his friends rob an e-commerce company truck. But to their surprise, the looted boxes contain condoms instead of electronic gadgets. They decide to sell them directly to the people, who want the product but are too embarrassed to buy it publicly.','/sNCDdvzlZR3tQIVQtyV9I5Z65QY.jpg','2021-09-03',105,'Released','Chahiye sabko, maangta koi nahi','Helmet',862717,1.095,6.167,'DgdhtcD6qrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24509,_binary '\0','/2Vc0BTGCKRhbJcZnMD46V5zzjQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11460976',5.2,2103,'pl','Prime Time','On the last day of 1999, 20-year-old Sebastian locks himself in a TV studio. He has two hostages, a gun, and an important message for the world. The story of the attack explores a rebel’s extreme measures and last resort.','/dIzmgtt51M4ZtHxOuxSLggc7FnV.jpg','2021-01-30',93,'Released',NULL,'Prime Time',745078,2.4665,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24510,_binary '\0','/7yoL7Us73bYKprDhZAeyv9lOtp9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11460992',7,31814,'hi','रनवे ३४','A flying prodigy, Captain Vikrant Khanna\'s flight takes a stirring and mysterious trajectory after take-off from an international destination. Concurrently, it follows the tenacious Narayan Vedant in his pursuit to uncover the truth.','/8RlQEuxeRqHh7sWTRswdUC9kP3H.jpg','2022-04-29',141,'Released','The truth is hidden 35,000 feet above the ground.','Runway 34',766116,1.7422,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24511,_binary '\0','/mX9QW5M6DXseQ2bbdVjhi0bHpAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146283',4.1,1664,'en','Foreign Exchange','Four high school friends plan to ride out their senior year taking easy classes, including a program for housing foreign exchange students and eventually all attending Ohio State. Hurdles befall each of the four: grades, higher aspirations, love. Is it the Foreign Exchange students that learn from their host or the hosts that do more of the learning?','/q9fyDLLOGWcLsMcYXC4kIWQ3emD.jpg','2008-09-09',85,'Released','Senior year just got hotter!','Foreign Exchange',19365,2.6298,4.103,'1Nd50UrJj3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24512,_binary '\0','/h5RPSswlgc2KvvkvfW7pipBtPLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146290',6.3,2289,'ja','名探偵コナン 紺碧の棺 （ジョリー・ロジャー）','The Isle of Koumi, a beautiful island in the Pacific Ocean. On the island, people pass an old legend down from generation to generation that there was the Seabed Palace, an ancient ruin at the bottom of the sea, where the treasure of female pirates Anne Bonny and Mary Reed was left. When Conan and his friends visit Koumi while on vacation, they meet some suspicious treasure hunters.','/3qiBRbIsfpw6O32TfD1FZ81MiKw.jpg','2007-04-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Jolly Roger in the Deep Azure',39206,4.4749,6.5,'QbhvRNnJbdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24513,_binary '\0','/dqy3KiBqfSC1LEbpW7XlPaOMdSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146295',7,1216,'bs','Snijeg','The daily hardships of a war-scarred Bosnian village, where all that remains are widows and orphans, are painstakingly documented in this first feature from director Aida Begic. Snow offers insight about the psychological aftereffects of the 1992-95 civil war from a distinctively female point of view without showing any of the brutality or carnage.','/kWUGsFZ2i18iu0Kf4cyqxaYV7tv.jpg','2008-10-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Snow',126732,0.8593,5.5,'Aearwv0vmUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24514,_binary '\0','/vCD6Yo3zbTjTGupUm7TtAeVGcwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146320',5.5,4426,'fr','Mutants','A nasty virus has spread throughout the human race turning the population into something ...else. After a brief setup (and a messy hit and run) we’re introduced to an ambulance and its four occupants. Sonia and Marco are together and riding with two police officers. Tensions rise between them as they head for a mythical research facility called NOAH that is reportedly infection free and working on a cure, and circumstances lead to Sonia and Marco holing up alone in an abandoned building. She’s pregnant, in love, and apparently immune to the virus… and she realizes that he’s been infected. He slowly transforms but her love for him refuses to give up on a cure, so she sets out to survive the onslaught of infected, attacks from still-human marauders, and the growing threat from her baby’s daddy.','/wXElN0L7FXYv0K9bOP2e3BWNxDs.jpg','2009-05-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Mutants',17886,2.735,5.2,'VCsxFId1y-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24515,_binary '\0','/7rQSyfBE7WTRShRJQ8HRVfQzp2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146325',5.8,18189,'hi','Singh Is Kinng','A comic caper about Happy Singh, a Punjabi villager who goes through a series of misadventures and eventually becomes the King of the Australian underworld.','/w2szK0vL9NzFsp3FHHEaeqGigjX.jpg','2008-08-08',135,'Released','Summer 2008: The gang of Punjab arrives with a bang!','Singh Is Kinng',12273,1.7166,5.7,'ZDk5taBABGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24516,_binary '\0','/5iqk9TjyF71PdmVoJLCvUIP2if9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11464016',7.1,3248,'xx','Gunda','A glimpse into the raw and simple power of nature through encounters with farm animals: the eponymous Gunda, a mother pig; two cows, and a one-legged chicken.','/XMlouldLxRt0RkH34GdGst9pxo.jpg','2021-04-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Gunda',664601,2.4745,7.2,'05Gc2lANyTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24517,_binary '\0','/7QBaH0AOs4vDiIw0q16Hbzvkd6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146431',7.5,5976,'en','Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix','After a battle with Dr. Animo in a power plant, Ben notices something strange is happening with the Omnitrix but doesn\'t tell anyone. Tetrax arrives and tells them the Omnitrix is broadcasting a self-destruct signal. Tetrax and Ben go to find the creator of the Omnitrix to fix it before it destroys itself and the universe along with it. Gwen stows away to help her cousin.','/vPND6Qff1KVYAtjaQuZtij8wtAj.jpg','2007-08-10',71,'Released','Better set your watch, you don’t wanna miss…','Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix',15403,4.8054,7.453,'a4PR597Hlv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24518,_binary '\0','/fWnWHEYVYDOMGSLfiRki2FyKGvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1146438',6.4,15631,'en','The Librarian: The Curse of the Judas Chalice','While on a dangerous mission to recover the historic Judas Chalice, Flynn is saved by Simone. But when double-crossed by a respected professor and ambushed by a ruthless gang, Flynn realizes Simone\'s secret, his true mission and a shocking discovery are all lying within a decaying New Orleans crypt.','/qzpTcjPdhmKmEYx9oJO8y4ZZLU6.jpg','2008-10-25',95,'Released','The world\'s most unlikely hero is back for his biggest adventure.','The Librarian: The Curse of the Judas Chalice',14728,5.7573,6.265,'Ay1P1owkW-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24519,_binary '\0','/uc427uPu7q12bT27IkhZ4aPPyjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11464446',5.7,2032,'en','Anything\'s Possible','Anything’s Possible is a delightfully modern Gen Z coming-of-age story that follows Kelsa, a confident high school girl who is trans, as she navigates through senior year. When her classmate Khal gets a crush on her, he musters up the courage to ask her out, despite the drama he knows it could cause. What transpires is a romance that showcases the joy, tenderness, and pain of young love.','/aLeswI1zxf2xN5iIdcJpqx9XEnX.jpg','2022-07-14',96,'Released','Love isn’t ordinary.','Anything\'s Possible',787787,2.2688,5.8,'20WlagB4vFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24520,_binary '\0','/ugZbX5lKx4L9ONEu0WTNbR96J0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11464730',5.2,2344,'en','Motherly','Kate and her daughter Beth live alone in an isolated farmhouse in the woods, but when Kate slowly begins to suspect that something sinister is happening, her motherly instincts are put to the test.','/wmh1likQEetSLIUs5MAvfWjEayY.jpg','2022-08-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Motherly',768447,2.8643,6,'iphXg62pycA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24521,_binary '\0','/iYqoT9VBGdGTuLl3cjfbG7ZXDkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11464826',7.6,95124,'en','The Social Dilemma','This documentary-drama hybrid explores the dangerous human impact of social networking, with tech experts sounding the alarm on their own creations.','/jcaM6V2tCtu6iMHDsGLBUbaYgYp.jpg','2020-01-26',94,'Released','The technology that connects us also controls us.','The Social Dilemma',656690,7.0369,7.5,'uaaC57tcci0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24522,_binary '\0','/dN3oLtT3seVwRFXWM2qry1IjzFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11465692',3,1262,'en','C.I.Ape','When a criminal plot is discovered, the C.I.A. turns to its first ever ape, their most unique operative, to foil the plot from the inside.','/oaW0zqkYJxgdYdgykKY89jr118X.jpg','2022-03-17',82,'Released','A secret agent who does not work for peanuts!','C.I.Ape',859719,1.3261,5.9,'uf9BjbBxrhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24523,_binary '\0','/f2J8DpT5bqV0AiI9VVcfiuqKo5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11466222',6.8,56236,'en','Jackass Forever','The Jackass crew, along with some newcomers, returns for one more round of hilarious, absurd, and dangerous stunts.','/ruHDFumJfW7F2vEqTZEQQ9xT7CA.jpg','2022-02-01',96,'Released','Some people never learn.','Jackass Forever',656663,10.3812,6.809,'FNq-QT2Jpng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24524,_binary '\0','/uGWcAdXTjOxA7sAmZnKGR6XR7pO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11468258',6.9,4930,'ta','எப்.ஐ.ஆர்','Irfan, an innocent Muslim chemical engineer with an ordinary life, is caught in inexplicable circumstances, when accused of being a most-wanted terrorist, that alter his life & everyone around him.','/gWzHTCh3ZCUsotpP7zyOBkb2bB7.jpg','2022-02-11',156,'Released',NULL,'FIR',667255,0.96,5.938,'eVKIjoK7FnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24525,_binary '\0','/txHo4VMR50p9wSU4R9KDb4ufMO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11469196',5.5,1281,'en','I Blame Society','A struggling filmmaker senses her peers are losing faith in her ability to succeed, so she decides to prove herself by finishing her last abandoned film and committing the perfect murder.','/aUD6KPsuOw0Bn8HMvHYRv64E3ph.jpg','2020-01-27',85,'Released','Filmmaking needs some new blood.','I Blame Society',662903,1.7359,5.6,'S5bsNdbHMfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24526,_binary '\0','/iEIQlhT9AZhMPVsCd8aoxIOfMiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11469744',8.2,6100,'te','మత్తు వదలరా','Babu is a delivery boy living with his friends Yesu and Abhi. Due to his meagre salary, he decides to quit, but then Yesu gives him an idea. The idea, however, soon spirals out of control and Babu finds himself deep in trouble. Will he survive the circumstances of his own actions?','/lo0ALsfiSv5sxNBhCNh35AD1p0x.jpg','2019-12-25',130,'Released',NULL,'Mathu Vadalara',657853,1.1774,7.661,'tmb2G-C6byM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24527,_binary '\0','/zPeMn87CADz6hWLUGrkp1NFephH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147508',7.4,1692,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太のドラビアンナイト','Shizuka ends up in the fantasy world of the \'Arabian Nights\' story. However, Doraemon, Nobita, Suneo, and Jyaian must find her from the imaginary Middle East and bring her back to the real life.','/gJL5GgPWOvtcGo8ozEXCkFv3ub0.jpg','1991-03-09',91,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita\'s Dorabian Nights',188403,3.8759,7.062,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24528,_binary '\0','/1zzzuJF7jYhFPsMJ9Nm7ciUNtcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147513',7.2,1506,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の太陽王伝説','Doraemon and its friends open a hole in the time and they\'re travel to the Country of Mayana, a lost Mayan civilization in the jungle.','/aBPaU4bnqrnKrKe0gi6nC9qvlLj.jpg','2000-03-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita and the Legend of the Sun King',31352,3.9343,6.952,'Rc_5zL13XWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24529,_binary '\0','/fLsag4bC5DuHX2mdM38Ik63aWsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147517',7.4,1435,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の恐竜','When Suneo does not show Nobita the fossil of a dinosaur claw, he takes up a challenge to find a dinosaur. He digs up a hillside and finds an egg, which later hatches and becomes a dinosaur.','/oBWtnb9kmROgziBXOh4P3IMXHKz.jpg','1980-03-15',107,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita\'s Dinosaur',64789,4.7914,6.778,'lH-odjTP5QY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24530,_binary '\0','/j0IwNIMXOKmEQ16h4a8lOTBxQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147524',7.5,1602,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太と夢幻三剣士','Nobita is exhausted from having constant nightmares and pleads Doraemon to arrange a dream machine that will enable him to dream of anything he wishes for. As Nobita dreams of him and his friends in the roles of gallant musketeers, the dream world starts to break down due to a dark force, and Nobita will have to put his fantasy to the test and become a hero, both in the real world and imagined.','/oCQtdezF7Ap5wm8ICiB3Pzx6wM4.jpg','1994-03-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita\'s Three Visionary Swordsmen',161715,3.5618,7.4,'z8fW6omLWwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24531,_binary '\0','/af4fSKXcLasXRoCjt0Hto9W53Ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147528',7.8,1414,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太と鉄人兵団','Doraemon and Nobita decide to build a perfect toy robot. However, their creation turns out to be a little more uncanny than an object of appreciation and wonder.','/q7tqrZ3nsNUywMTqzPo5t534afF.jpg','1986-03-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita and the Steel Troops',88625,3.8665,6.688,'zNs2PCg_b20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24532,_binary '\0','/jcFXDAJ2LkgNPQHD873U0YDIPBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147684',5.1,7160,'en','Forget Me Not','It\'s graduation weekend, and Sandy Channing, the popular class president of her small-town high school, should be enjoying the time of her life. But when her friends start disappearing, Sandy discovers they have unwittingly awakened the vengeful spirit of a girl they wronged long ago. Fighting for her sanity, Sandy must unlock a dark secret from her own past before it\'s too late.','/jDux50AIllCTIeAwg8wJ32oN1EE.jpg','2009-10-22',103,'Released','Some friendships never die','Forget Me Not',27588,2.5203,5.3,'Sfj7a5GfyoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24533,_binary '\0','/lDlc1NeSqgJzEhxCakNeiss3kJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1147687',3.7,7386,'en','The Devil\'s Tomb','Captain Mack leads an elite military unit on a search for a missing scientist, and comes face-to-face with an an ancient evil lying beneath the Middle Eastern desert. Evil that is not of this world. Evil that should never be unearthed.','/ex0dNOuABfkWVrNFfhsC0qTviA2.jpg','2009-05-26',90,'Released','An evil entombed for 2000 years... until now.','The Devil\'s Tomb',17577,3.4376,4.7,'0YjAFH3nTUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24534,_binary '\0','/8a00YiXut68tymakaAHL2tHpu99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1148165',6.2,2117,'en','Bran Nue Dae','In the Summer of 1965 a young man is filled with the life of the idyllic old pearling port Broome - fishing, hanging out with his mates and his girl. However his mother returns him to the religious mission for further schooling. After being punished for an act of youthful rebellion, he runs away from the mission on a journey that ultimately leads him back home.','/7tB7mr0OqHsgATo58PAtSNJpaP7.jpg','2009-08-09',85,'Released','Going home never felt so good.','Bran Nue Dae',38415,1.6402,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24535,_binary '\0','/jx744afQpw67FuIxMdYuujmmHMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1148200',4.1,5947,'en','Chain Letter','Six friends receive a mysterious chain letter via text messaging and in their email accounts from a maniac who\'s hunting down teenagers who fail to forward his online chain letter. Who knew they should take the threats in the chain letter seriously? Or that chain letters using the teens\' favorite technologies to track them can kill? This maniacal game pits friend against friend as they race to beat rules that seem impossible to escape. Break the chain, lose a life. Do you pass it on? Does friendship mean anything?','/Qkz89qeK3gJh49x3T85KiecTZi.jpg','2010-10-01',96,'Released','If you don\'t forward it, you die.','Chain Letter',38033,3.5488,4.4,'6PlqNRNEuWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24536,_binary '\0','/hHlFspcHTLGFo8BwOSCsX9eHtbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1148204',7,280770,'en','Orphan','After losing their baby, a married couple adopt 9-year old Esther, who may not be as innocent as she seems.','/lCGpOgoTOGLtZnBiGY9HRg5Xnjd.jpg','2009-07-24',123,'Released','There\'s something wrong with Esther.','Orphan',21208,12.7578,6.989,'m5BSLNAKIZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24537,_binary '\0','/vmuvk8DSUyk6IUyrvgyxZAAITmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1148261',7,4483,'ja','劇場版 BLEACH The DiamondDust Rebellion もう一つの氷輪丸','When an artifact known as the \"King\'s Seal\" is stolen during transport from Soul Society, Hitsugaya Toushirou is assigned to retrieve it. Toushirou goes missing after a battle with the thieves, leading Seireitei to suspect him of treachery. They order his immediate capture and execution. Unwilling to believe him capable of such a crime, Ichigo, Rangiku, Rukia, and Renji set out to find Toushirou.','/1PV8OKvHSYvgmdVnU2wcuzQGthP.jpg','2007-12-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Bleach the Movie: The DiamondDust Rebellion',17101,4.5412,6.8,'ZutJnBCn8tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24538,_binary '\0','/cxGcMVsRFxRhMbtKpfQ8JdA1HRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11486994',3.8,3146,'en','Incision','Beauty Blogger Alexa Landry only had one fear, plastic surgery. She ultimately had to face this fear when she was kidnapped with her friends by Dr. Cunningham. A deranged plastic surgeon who is obsessed with beautifying his victims.','/xxKyBzg3IwU3tCyXovqwbZbDKKw.jpg','2020-10-28',79,'Released','Some obsessions are painful.','Incision',763368,1.6426,5.4,'S9SfCkbzzMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24539,_binary '\0','/A45uq2S4JHBVLGaMWrtawOLp08i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11490170',7.6,10976,'te','హిట్: ది ఫస్ట్ కేస్','Vikram Rudraraju is a 30-year-old cop working for the Telangana State Police. While Vikram is battling with his own traumatic past, the stakes get high when a girl called Preethi mysteriously disappears in Hyderabad and Vikram has to solve the case at any cost.','/dMxentLHEJPBMQCPXHrUKluODpe.jpg','2020-02-27',126,'Released',NULL,'HIT: The First Case',678391,1.7804,6.659,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24540,_binary '\0','/kzY6EOitaLo1ykGLCTRmMQAznOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11493006',3.4,2065,'ar','ماكو','Eight documentary makers decide to go to the location of Elsalam Ship which sunk years ago to make a new documntary where they face unforseen dangers.','/uGKyGHX1j9maWSvkaRS1yaqx0Nw.jpg','2021-09-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Mako',772307,1.1434,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24541,_binary '\0','/7GFSzcT9E57UPO2YEbMVCSR9UuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11493232',6.4,1604,'tr','Sıfır Bir','Sifir Bir tells the story of Savaş, Cihat and Azad who left their criminal lives in Adana and settled in İzmir. Adana gang leader Savaş, together with Cihat and Azad, decide to leave their violent past behind them. The three friends leave Adana, open a car wash and settle in Izmir to start a new life. However, when a little girl named Melek takes shelter with Savaş and his friends after all the bad things that have happened to her, the team takes action. They decided to chase after the men who hurt Melek and find themselves on a path of no return.','/5yUJTtMm0v92LltVlQNnrIiYuoU.jpg','2020-01-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Zero Zone',663209,2.5217,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24542,_binary '\0','/awhWLCEmA4Suxf3po9xXAGDwzZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1149361',7.1,32218,'fr','Micmacs à tire-larigot','While standing in the doorway of the video shop where he works, Bazil is inadvertently shot in the head. Now homeless and jobless, he is taken in by a troupe of misfits who live in a giant mound of trash. There Bazil begins his quest for revenge against the people who produced the gun that shot him.','/yiqooJWNDEVsp8lbdTrTBvLAk0m.jpg','2009-10-28',104,'Released','Non Stop Madness.','Micmacs',27936,3.7992,6.7,'TjKW0tG7I8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24543,_binary '\0','/9Cxi5RQzYAlkNI5FROWkoKgiNkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1149362',7.8,82140,'de','Das weiße Band - Eine deutsche Kindergeschichte','An aged tailor recalls his life as the schoolteacher of a small village in Northern Germany that was struck by a series of strange events in the year leading up to WWI.','/54dlnGDexrwAFlDb8HWKfmmX4LB.jpg','2009-09-24',144,'Released',NULL,'The White Ribbon',37903,6.102,7.483,'9JOXs8KEiDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24544,_binary '\0','/w1F8yd3agUW2ZVY8qx0Z0gJ0PQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1149405',7.3,2136,'en','Trouble the Water','\"Trouble the Water\" takes you inside Hurricane Katrina in a way never before seen on screen. The film opens the day before the storm makes landfall--just blocks away from the French Quarter but far from the New Orleans that most tourists knew. Kimberly Rivers Roberts, an aspiring rap artist, is turning her new video camera on herself and her Ninth Ward neighbors trapped in the city. Weaving an insider\'s view of Katrina with a mix of verité and in-your-face filmmaking, it is a redemptive tale of self-described street hustlers who become heroes--two unforgettable people who survive the storm and then seize a chance for a new beginning.','/yRFpcdRnq2ixzb0pAig7ALURKJH.jpg','2008-01-20',93,'Released','It\'s not about a hurricane. It\'s about America.','Trouble the Water',22319,1.7604,7,'FqpcUxEkHy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24545,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1149583',7.5,1223,'en','Flow: For Love of Water','From both local and global perspectives, this documentary examines the harsh realities behind the mounting water crisis. Learn how politics, pollution and human rights are intertwined in this important issue that affects every being on Earth. With water drying up around the world and the future of human lives at stake, the film urges a call to arms before more of our most precious natural resource evaporates.','/c6PhyYIhcKwmPpEwIvyNAo0Dsvu.jpg','2008-09-12',84,'Released','How Did a Handfull of Corporations Steal Our Water?','Flow: For Love of Water',18187,1.021,6.6,'EOaXu_PlsQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24546,_binary '\0','/hTbbfQlD5VGnmhRgaXc1worhDHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11497402',6.7,1593,'ta','வி1','An intelligent forensic officer starts investigating a murder, but he faces a slew of challenges as he suffers from nyctophobia. Will he be able to solve the case?','/yMzSvOGjsON3xzLlj3P9vZAqtM2.jpg','2019-12-27',112,'Released',NULL,'V1 Murder Case',663174,1.1167,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24547,_binary '\0','/c28Cg4NPbO5dryAajRfA8eQvpii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11497480',7.1,1731,'bn','অসুর','Kigan, an artist, decides to create the world\'s largest Durga idol at Deshbandhu Park in South Kolkata. However, the enmity between friends and bruised egos threaten to destroy his mammoth endeavour.','/hJn71rU1VXNJpAMiWwvSxxaFU00.jpg','2020-01-03',136,'Released',NULL,'Asur',668097,1.0133,0,'Tn1Hxo4GYVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24548,_binary '\0','/fOTdnriTm9qNM3fQyfpb5W2GcMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11497544',7.4,2029,'en','Dolly Parton: Here I Am','Dolly Parton leads a moving, musical journey in this documentary that details the people and places who have helped shape her iconic career.','/b3xBAVhFAAD3ap8if1my8td4LfU.jpg','2019-12-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Dolly Parton: Here I Am',658092,2.6539,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24549,_binary '\0','/7zKvkhAn8QZFeKXqyKQEB58ASef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11497716',4.5,29558,'ta','தி லெஜண்ட்','A scientist is spurred by the death of his friend to find a cure for diabetes, but can he take on the might of the pharma mafia and succeed in his mission?','/5FBNGvrUYIhM61XdnY588Vp2oP9.jpg','2022-07-28',161,'Released',NULL,'The Legend',961223,1.27,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24550,_binary '\0','/aT4NkQOdkycPEcXLMOuQ0ynSCcj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11499506',5.2,5198,'it','La Belva','To rescue his daughter, an unstable Special Forces veteran unleashes his inner beast as he pursues her kidnappers — and soon becomes a suspect himself.','/4zbKISdp5UBgWY2a28dfJY8ouIK.jpg','2020-11-27',90,'Released',NULL,'The Beast',654905,1.9678,6.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24551,_binary '\0','/vLanw88oSsTJCFDyLxacuQG8INa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11502940',6.2,5316,'ta','சுல்தான்','A man raised by gangsters tries to reform them, and a hired job to protect a village presents him with the perfect opportunity.','/z9TqB7GcyM0tMOFlI5mZuqNq351.jpg','2021-04-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Sulthan',792334,1.5922,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24552,_binary '\0','/bdZS1xmow1avubmpM0p0GXkQaGE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11503178',6.1,2565,'te','Wild Dog','Wild Dog aka Vijay Varma is an NIA agent who’s brought back to field from a desk job to handle a terrorism case. Despite having a personal motive, he moves heaven and earth to ensure justice is served for the sake of the country.','/8377XckHbfJDMrkSpEa9ZQJlVE0.jpg','2021-04-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Wild Dog',802068,1.3455,5.458,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24553,_binary '\0','/6VKj5vvUmY9rrL9JMwmWCFl1rB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11505692',4.5,2090,'en','Stay Out of the Attic','A diverse group of ex-cons-turned-movers are convinced by their creepy client, Vern Muller, to pull an all-nighter for a generous pay bump. As the night progresses and rooms are cleared, they slowly uncover the horrors that exist inside his old Victorian mansion, which include boobytraps, human experimentation, Nazi monsters and more. Will they survive the night?','/kEKQjLYZiIy78eEiMrtBfqSm3LU.jpg','2020-10-15',80,'Released',NULL,'Stay Out of the Attic',787009,1.7202,5.5,'4I0pQaXFhl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24554,_binary '\0','/bznONoUN9WyvWNQIlwEkfw1WJNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11506054',7.6,1942,'te','ఉమామహేశ్వర ఉగ్రరూపస్య','Defeated and humiliated in a fight while trying to defuse a conflict among his fellow villagers, a photographer vows revenge on his attacker.','/k0IqarTyIOPfSM4R1OrJXtxWtsn.jpg','2020-07-30',136,'Released',NULL,'Uma Maheswara Ugra Roopasya',727030,0.8754,7.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24555,_binary '\0','/n5GGpjVlPRDPQuhWegt7NKCWRV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11506284',5.6,2297,'es','Padre no hay más que uno 2: la llegada de la suegra','The success of the Conchy virtual assistant (which was developed by Javier) has earned him a favorable spot in the parents chat room - until something unexpected ruins it all.','/rwPb2AfNzQXjb8sUM6mCzMvN5T3.jpg','2020-07-29',96,'Released',NULL,'Father There Is Only One 2',668742,2.2965,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24556,_binary '\0','/d2SwXmLhTSJCryPoumvtLiT5H4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11508438',7.2,1483,'th','วันสุดท้าย..ก่อนบายเธอ','Boss, an elusive bar owner living in New York, reunites with his estranged best friend, Aood, for a roadtrip in Thailand after Aood has been diagnosed with terminal cancer.','/xDpFHT2dXI2IDdYwGCSWql6uoql.jpg','2022-02-10',128,'Released','Some journeys end where they begin.','One for the Road',776545,1.3532,6.9,'zj7kvTNDrJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24557,_binary '\0','/zzJxwLTX5QCWkWsq7RnRhNKFBBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1150934',2.9,6960,'en','Anacondas: Trail of Blood','A genetically created Anaconda, cut in half, regenerates itself into two new aggressive giant snakes, due to the Blood Orchid.','/916jenbMstGCE20hceYDTo8psf4.jpg','2009-07-16',89,'Released','Bigger, faster, hungrier.','Anacondas: Trail of Blood',19543,6.7219,4.601,'QeNnOMn80K4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24558,_binary '\0','/avwnjFQMCsKG4aVTKXLhd368eza.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1150947',7,2494,'en','Lovely, Still','A holiday fable that tells the story of an elderly man discovering love for the first time.','/p5o2waFH3ioBOZuHKlx1kzk9Rdi.jpg','2009-10-03',92,'Released','Something mysterious, new, unexpected and lovely is happening to Robert Malone.','Lovely, Still',51384,2.4777,6.6,'jPv_gCK7m5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24559,_binary '\0','/6H2Yz7ztGuCOs4423z8b6ygDdHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151309',7.5,14103,'en','Bigger Stronger Faster*','In America, we define ourselves in the superlative: we are the biggest, strongest, fastest country in the world. Is it any wonder that so many of our heroes are on performance enhancing drugs? Director Christopher Bell explores America\'s win-at-all-cost culture by examining how his two brothers became members of the steroid-subculture in an effort to realize their American dream.','/4sZNQ7OQgkJj7kLFx4su21yEHTB.jpg','2008-05-30',105,'Released','Is it still cheating if everyone\'s doing it?','Bigger Stronger Faster*',13636,4.9117,6.8,'3KzGfuFFSxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24560,_binary '\0','/uhQS0C251mo32ZJkcjfFtJ0RN9P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151359',6.4,28832,'en','Leaves of Grass','An Ivy League professor returns home, where his pot-growing twin brother has concocted a plan to take down a local drug lord.','/dkIfBUewNDrJYL0UlNsKRUKZJYp.jpg','2009-09-13',104,'Released','Drugs, Murder, and Brotherly Love.','Leaves of Grass',12834,4.4407,6,'rGRiuTbpjLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24561,_binary '\0','/8mGRw6FPEEPT8G2ZfFQczT9Zwsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151384',5.2,2174,'en','Otto; or, Up with Dead People','A young zombie named Otto appears on a remote highway. He has no idea where he came from or where he is going. After hitching a ride to Berlin and nesting in an abandoned amusement park, he begins to explore the city. Soon he is discovered by underground filmmaker Medea Yarn, who begins to make a documentary about him with the support of her girlfriend, Hella Bent, and her brother Adolf, who operates the camera. Meanwhile, Medea is still trying to finish Up with Dead People, the epic political-porno-zombie movie that she has been working on for years. She convinces its star, Fritz Fritze, to allow the vulnerable Otto to stay in his guest bedroom. When Otto discovers that he has a wallet that contains information about his past, before he was dead, he begins to remember details about his ex-boyfriend, Rudolf. He arranges to meet him at the schoolyard where they met, with devastating results.','/xGmyTOXACi6Va1RX5pqCCQgckss.jpg','2008-01-19',94,'Released','Is it possible to come back from the dead?','Otto; or, Up with Dead People',26901,1.6806,5.3,'bUln983oZao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24562,_binary '\0','/ceqx5sLqBlLqskux7pjtnJnK8NM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151410',5.7,4199,'en','Tanner Hall','A manipulative childhood acquaintance worms her way into a teenager\'s circle of friends at an all-girls boarding school.','/qoGtVlqaFWngUXuUzAS6uuNcwsI.jpg','2011-09-09',96,'Released','Lose your way. Find yourself.','Tanner Hall',71866,2.533,5.569,'rDuR_Qhpq8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24563,_binary '\0','/isxWigGBWpXtc2xOxybiYWxHzWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11514780',4.8,29545,'en','Choose or Die','In pursuit of an unclaimed $125,000 prize, a broke college dropout decides to play an obscure, 1980s survival computer game. But the game curses her, and she’s faced with dangerous choices and reality-warping challenges. After a series of unexpectedly terrifying moments, she realizes she’s no longer playing for the money but for her life.','/jEYE5BPFd5FuPa1judcjpW6xqKp.jpg','2022-04-15',85,'Released','Sometimes a curse can be a gift.','Choose or Die',838484,5.6474,5.246,'7vUQYzZ_UZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24564,_binary '\0','/kQn1rnxX6gyMyDWEg0pwKa0SBbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151808',7.4,1222,'tr','Asiye Nasıl Kurtulur','After receiving a letter from a woman named Asiye asking for help to save her, the President of the Associations Against Prostitution visits the brothel to save Asiye. However, she finds herself in a strange musical show.','/co2XK1QpgOdHInsL8VMhZP1A8Fx.jpg','1987-03-09',105,'Released',NULL,'How to Save Asiye',287007,0.8527,6.4,'k5fFAanBcoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24565,_binary '\0','/yrIkRJOYMrO1D76nqmuAu3jMQTK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151911',4.3,1488,'en','Cornered!','During their nightly poker game a group of lowlifes are terrorized in their own convenience store by a masked killer.','/i5abuNGk5ocEZNN8K7SByhZT1Gt.jpg','2009-11-22',86,'Released','Face The Evil','Cornered!',32285,1.5131,4.3,'JCwqAumipRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24566,_binary '\0','/ptQuFjrTV6ZiPSZvuTS4B4RyQXb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151915',6.1,5094,'en','Nothing Like the Holidays','It’s Christmastime and the far-flung members of the Rodriguez family are converging at their parents’ home in Chicago to celebrate the season and rejoice in their youngest brother’s safe return from combat overseas.','/veP26wuib65SnkFjyLgFeIWeFzd.jpg','2008-12-12',98,'Released','They’re just a typical American family. Minus the typical.','Nothing Like the Holidays',25852,3.2571,6.3,'I2LFm1r_fHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24567,_binary '\0','/Mn5uO1hCqgILucGElc3WpuntbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151922',5,23153,'en','Miss March','A young man awakens from a four-year coma to hear that his once virginal high-school sweetheart has since become a centerfold in one of the world\'s most famous men\'s magazines. He and his sex-crazed best friend decide to take a cross-country road trip in order to crash a party at the magazine\'s legendary mansion headquarters and win back the girl.','/rJovsKIjVsSMuwURASoTZJB6jvI.jpg','2009-03-13',93,'Released','After four years in a coma, Eugene Pratt is going to be reunited with his high school sweetheart... on pages 95-97.','Miss March',19556,5.6632,5.6,'wk1_kDJhyBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24568,_binary '\0','/vJR2D2h88MXlenyviN2JDmfDT7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1151923',6.3,1222,'es','Rabia','A romantic thriller about a construction worker in hiding for killing his foreman who hides in the mansion where his girlfriend works as a maid.','/jYBnT05o0kWRY8yH6Rrw08eHuLq.jpg','2009-08-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Rage',61539,1.3871,5.6,'ApOPNfEwx1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24569,_binary '\0','/ZChLx699FmyPTZ4kb9zCprARY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11519834',5,1387,'uk','Гола правда','Eight friends meet in Odesa to look at their friend\'s new entertainment club. The club has many exciting rooms where you can play the usual games - \"mafia\" or \"crocodile\", but the main concept of the club is \"Detectorroom\" - a room with an unique and super-accurate lie detector. The owner of the club tries to dissuade his friends to play a dangerous game, but everyone wants to nerve their nerves and to find out each other\'s private secrets. Friends have a good time and joking with each other, but after four game tours (Fun, Strip, Full Play and Duel), they will never be the same again. But who knows, maybe, it\'s even better?','/u7trnkWF6KCbFIlfmX7wtqC1Cwj.jpg','2020-02-13',82,'Released','A film that bares the soul. And not just the soul...','Naked Truth',672532,0.9023,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24570,_binary '\0','/ridroLVzGGwqVU0qVaNhjPWR7Xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152282',7.7,4491,'th','รักแห่งสยาม','Best friends as children, Mew and Tong run into each other years later as young men and find they have unexpected feelings for each other.','/aygb9QAy4PDVnU1i1gD9F9LW3lo.jpg','2007-11-22',154,'Released','Love of family. Love of friendship. Love of lovers.','Love of Siam',56295,1.8226,7.321,'dkfPii1xuMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24571,_binary '\0','/zWC4ozvv7KbnXqbjY1WxcZLqbqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152397',6.9,2932,'en','American Violet','A young single mother of four living in a small Texas town. Arrested during a drug raid and accused of a crime she didn\'t commit, Dee goes against the wishes of her mother, Alma, and rejects the plea-bargain that would free her from jail, but brand her as a felon for life. As word begins to spread that similar incidents are occurring in poor communities all across the country, Dee realizes that there are more mothers out there like her, and decides to take a stand against powerful district attorney Calvin Beckett. Now, despite being well aware of District Attorney Beckett\'s fierce reputation, Dee enlists the aid of ACLU attorney David Cohen and former narcotics officer Sam Conroy in overcoming the seemingly insurmountable obstacles that, if not navigated with the greatest of caution, now threaten to destroy her life. With the custody of her children on the line, one brave mother wages a valiant battle to strike at the very heart of the corrupt Texas justice system.','/nNpD3w3wWwV1ICNXAazwFVd5qLu.jpg','2008-08-28',103,'Released',NULL,'American Violet',21179,2.213,6.7,'Qv8Jq09qU1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24572,_binary '\0','/hU4OdICqRXj3JFnSJsrR0SJejZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152398',5.5,82328,'en','Beastly','A modern-day take on the \"Beauty and the Beast\" tale where a New York teen is transformed into a hideous monster in order to find true love.','/uSAXWZsSD0pE4HYVUiDgusnEyyl.jpg','2011-01-21',86,'Released','Love is never ugly.','Beastly',38117,10.152,6.3,'0ENvJkKdjqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24573,_binary '\0','/yfgXw2jGGTklONdSUj7hunuTrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152403',3.4,1570,'en','Vipers','A set of vipers has been taken by scientists to mutate them to make a cure for cancer. As their experiment goes awry, the vipers escape into the woods - they\'re not only biting people, they\'re actually killing people, in a little town.','/v85BI2yvtMPVl0di7JLW6CoCCpi.jpg','2008-08-12',95,'Released','First Comes The Slither, Then Comes The Slaughter.','Vipers',44548,1.6336,3.9,'zWYwi6RmLKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24574,_binary '\0','/f4r44unFU6uS9bdlhm72htW2l2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11525022',6.8,6130,'es','El baile de los 41','Mexico City, November 1901. The police raid a private home where a secret party is being held. Among those attending is the son-in-law of President Porfirio Díaz.','/jcSqwsEtT7wKfQ8oKaaulMMGUdS.jpg','2020-11-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Dance of the Forty One',660637,2.9972,7.8,'LEHpiFZlGcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24575,_binary '\0','/ok7RdHhVngnwkvKj09tvtOvypG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11525644',6.4,46235,'en','No Sudden Move','A group of criminals are brought together under mysterious circumstances and have to work together to uncover what\'s really going on when their simple job goes completely sideways.','/kARdPEc4b32GQlHmJXMhGOCplEA.jpg','2021-06-24',115,'Released','Trust is a setup.','No Sudden Move',649409,10.5097,6.374,'kybqUuHscrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24576,_binary '\0','/birfwAyzq34B6FZemYZ5LC5Qhxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152758',8.5,46605,'en','Dear Zachary: A Letter to a Son About His Father','In 2001, Andrew Bagby, a medical resident, is murdered not long after breaking up with his girlfriend. Soon after, when she announces she\'s pregnant, one of Andrew\'s many close friends, Kurt Kuenne, begins this film, a gift to the child.','/yYVHGe7U55Ojx11y5A82phPpCHv.jpg','2008-10-31',94,'Released',NULL,'Dear Zachary: A Letter to a Son About His Father',15584,2.5121,8.1,'l7ughuxTn_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24577,_binary '\0','/omo0IBMbkAFtq1XQmw6W9eO1cLm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11527964',4.6,4799,'tr','Bayi Toplantısı','How much chaos can three white goods dealers who come to İstanbul from Anatolia get into in three days? The paths of Namık, Adem and Sadık, three men going through difficult periods in their lives, intersect at a dealer meeting. After a series of unexpected events, they find themselves caught in a crazy plan. To survive, the three dealers have no choice but trust each other and move fast.','/1NDdIO4LhCtYgYgF0iEiAwx2vOE.jpg','2020-02-20',115,'Released',NULL,'Vendors\' Meeting',674349,1.8826,4.9,'PTzi-16k_dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24578,_binary '\0','/vLaaHMLYMZe5AdD4hf8oBRPagik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152822',6.3,7424,'en','Freakonomics','Some of the world\'s most innovative documentary filmmakers will explore the hidden side of everything.','/cPXdZeUKmIylEG8ml0tQOPt9SJ9.jpg','2010-10-01',93,'Released','Six Rogue Filmmakers Explore The Hidden Side Of Everything','Freakonomics',43942,2.3332,6.1,'LrceH3952Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24579,_binary '\0','/18tOywxDCzLgUimj378jnisQyS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152827',4.1,2150,'en','Super Hybrid','Late one night, a mysterious car is brought into the Chicago police impound garage after a deadly traffic accident. The on-call mechanics soon discover the car has a mind of its own. With hundreds of horsepower and two tons of reinforced steel at its command, it\'s a seemingly unstoppable killing machine capable of outrunning -- and outwitting -- humans.','/iK3RR1bNWN99jt3EwEAqYanw6Br.jpg','2011-01-28',95,'Released','Most cars run on fuel. This one runs on blood.','Super Hybrid',69270,1.7499,5.1,'rFQjYuWeyAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24580,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152828',6.7,1742,'en','I Think We\'re Alone Now','Every celebrity deals with his or her share of obsessed fans. \"I Think We\'re Alone Now\" is a documentary that focuses on two individuals, Jeff and Kelly, who claim to be in love with the 80\'s pop singer Tiffany. Jeff Turner, a 50-year-old man from Santa Cruz, California has attended Tiffany concerts since 1988. Diagnosed with Asperger\'s syndrome, he never had a girlfriend. Jeff spends his days hanging out on the streets of Santa Cruz, striking up conversations with anyone who has a moment to spare. Kelly McCormick is a 38-year-old intersex woman from Denver, Colorado, who claims to have been friends with Tiffany as a teenager. She credits Tiffany as the shining star who has motivated her to do everything in her life. Both Jeff and Kelly have been labeled stalkers by the media and other Tiffany fans. This film takes you inside the lonely lives these two characters, revealing the source of their clinging obsessions...','/8qBY7PzmUQfKa4KCYiDAVsKqheM.jpg','2008-01-20',64,'Released','Two individuals, Jeff and Kelly, claim to be in love with the 80\'s pop singer Tiffany.','I Think We\'re Alone Now',56967,1.1763,6.6,'0MxXqF-fgJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24581,_binary '\0','/rlKB2moKVOPasy4Dr19QluzbJgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152836',6.9,337156,'en','Public Enemies','Depression-era bank robber John Dillinger\'s charm and audacity endear him to much of America\'s downtrodden public, but he\'s also a thorn in the side of J. Edgar Hoover and the fledgling FBI. Desperate to capture the elusive outlaw, Hoover makes Dillinger his first Public Enemy Number One and assigns his top agent, Melvin Purvis, the task of bringing him in dead or alive.','/3KgtekisQBrHRsm2cD5UOB6Ce3k.jpg','2009-07-01',140,'Released','America\'s most wanted.','Public Enemies',11322,13.2731,6.686,'pv0DMzFwEW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24582,_binary '\0','/wUScRcpPtfFPZpWZmUIIbHLEsBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1152850',7.1,21317,'en','Wendy and Lucy','A near-penniless drifter\'s journey to Alaska in search of work is interrupted when she loses her dog while attempting to shoplift food for it.','/cVtF8SW4zMbculTXD52RDvmQAAR.jpg','2008-12-10',80,'Released','On the long road, friendship is everything.','Wendy and Lucy',8942,3.6687,6.8,'pASs3rerRCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24583,_binary '\0','/o05JApHmBzkhuaUxxGu9c7xsOOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11529348',2,3451,'ro','5Gang: Un Altfel de Crăciun','To keep the band together, Selly tries to earn money by making an appearance at the birthday party of a mobster\'s daughter - until he gets kidnapped.','/dnbpootwUhvYzYwWGtuakzICtWE.jpg','2019-12-27',96,'Released',NULL,'5Gang: A Different Kind of Christmas',659153,1.1175,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24584,_binary '\0','/uAfPjNvfHjFuvdtSa8J3iuD1CkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153040',5.5,5825,'ko','해운대','On Haeundae Beach, a guilt-ridden fisherman takes care of a woman whose father accidentally got killed. A scientist reunites with his ex-wife and a daughter who doesn\'t even remember his face. And a poor rescue worker falls in love with a rich city girl. When they all find out a gigantic tsunami will hit the beach, they realize they only have 10 minutes to escape.','/1mE5jde5SJqUnZ58MAweW9GuhzK.jpg','2009-07-22',120,'Released','There is No Escape from Nature\'s Wrath.','Tidal Wave',33196,4.8788,6.9,'Zi5l32T2om8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24585,_binary '\0','/jkmYuutROJtHs9h4sEo7zZiofp9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153053',6.6,6901,'en','Today\'s Special','Young Manhattan chef Samir rediscovers his heritage and passion for life through the enchanting art of cooking Indian food.','/lil1zu2THmFE0p6vHiqvod1kgIn.jpg','2009-10-14',99,'Released','Life Has No Recipe','Today\'s Special',46641,1.5065,6.241,'YEDIj1ZUB3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24586,_binary '\0','/sb4LfxlItdre7Oj4o6p0s8urC2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153085',4.9,4129,'tr','Semum','Rising from a pitch-black pit of hell, Semum sets his sights on an earthly target: Canan. The quiet, peaceful life that Canan and her husband Volkan dreamed of in their newly moved home is soon shattered. Driven by cruel and malevolent intent, Semum begins a slow and terrifying transformation, turning Canan into something no longer human. As hellish nightmares bleed into reality, Satan’s most loyal servant Semum, takes possession of Canan’s body. Why has this innocent woman been chosen as his target? And will the gates of hell opened for an ordinary human ever be closed?','/vIQcDDnZomLfj4KzX9pDBvYZ2Bm.jpg','2008-02-08',117,'Released',NULL,'Semum',47791,1.7385,4.484,'A0BNizAPKEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24587,_binary '\0','/aglHcfB4pFPafZpiS5KsgS7XKd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153100',4.5,2299,'en','Backwoods','A group of friends embark on a camping trip for a ten-year high school reunion. Their celebration soon turns into a battle for survival when they realize that the locals, who are not what they seem, are hunting them down.','/lDhcwYPefuiHuXutA4VcxcREKPU.jpg','2009-07-24',85,'Released','A weekend retreat... where no one returns.','Backwoods',19241,2.1177,4.5,'si610WSdqGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24588,_binary '\0','/34eDYOrQcMzQ3fUADoUg8uhOwD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153102',4.4,1732,'en','The Devil\'s Ground','While traveling from California to Bangor through a lonely road, Carrie Mitchel is advised by the gas station attendant Jimmy to rest in a hotel; however, she decides to continue driving through the night and almost hits a wounded teenage girl with blood on her face. She gives a lift to the girl and listens to the tale of her passenger and her friends.','/nBMqLCC3t2M3jAJo4hGZfJHHtUg.jpg','2008-05-19',89,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Ground',14143,2.0938,4.718,'4HxF9doMNcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24589,_binary '\0','/9RLQ4oahXHoO8x7pxznJr7qnkio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153112',7.2,1358,'de','Mogadischu','The incredible true story of Lufthansa Flight 181, which was hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine in October of 1977, and the noble efforts of stewardess Gabriele Dillmann (Nadja Uhl) to ensure the safety of the terrified passengers throughout the harrowing ordeal. When terrorists sympathetic to the cause of the German Red Army Faction seize control of the flight, German chancellor Helmut Schmidt refuses to negotiate. Meanwhile, terrorist leader \"Captain Martyr Mahmud\" grows increasingly agitated, and the Yemeni government refuses to let the plane land on their soil. After Captain Schumann (Thomas Kretschmann) makes an emergency landing in the sand, he is brutally executed in front of the passengers by \"Captain Martyr Mahmud\" (Said Taghmaoui), who then forces the co-pilot to fly the plane to Somolia. Once there, counter terrorism measures quickly get underway as the passengers brace themselves for the worst.','/2MrHTQ6hI05BS6NsFi0m7CNoqzg.jpg','2008-11-30',108,'Released',NULL,'Mogadischu',30775,1.1279,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24590,_binary '\0','/4VMaNlyZg7HNCTwkAIdi39j8463.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11531182',7.1,10308,'ml','അജയന്റെ രണ്ടാം മോഷണം','Set in the Northern Kerala in 1900, 1950 and 1990, Three generations of heroes Maniyan, Kunjikelu and Ajayan, try to protect the most important treasure of the Land.','/OClpEeRlHK3DrFO7QtWXtpDIOK.jpg','2024-09-12',147,'Released',NULL,'A.R.M - Ajayante Randam Moshanam',890138,2.1586,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24591,_binary '\0','/wCyz9jIwRLreppYqF15XtN8FfSa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11531530',6.9,4042,'ml','വരനെ ആവശ്യമുണ്ട്','A divorced woman trying to get hired as a French tutor and teaching classical dance, and she has a daughter. Her brother Manuel also resides in a flat in Chennai. Their next door neighbours are Unnikrishnan, a retired Major who has a pet dog, Prabhakaran and Bibeesh who lives with a serial-actress aunt (not related by blood) and his young school going brother. The story revolves around the divorced mother and daughter finding happiness of love in their own ways. The film explores commonality of romantic love in different stages of life.','/7CzcHo5GeqScKLFBC7p5Yyxnehk.jpg','2020-02-07',145,'Released',NULL,'Varane Avashyamund',659731,1.7419,6.613,'M3i-VGCY69c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24592,_binary '\0','/p65KvZIFrlYxB3LZU2e5WtYvmfZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11534720',5.9,1504,'en','All Dirt Roads Taste of Salt','Tender caresses and enveloping embraces are portals into the life of Mack, a Black woman in Mississippi. Winding through the anticipation, love, and heartbreak she experiences from childhood to adulthood, the expressionist journey is an ode to connection — with loved ones and with place.','/m1Rap5zhPUBctPcX8h7TBFJQth4.jpg','2023-11-03',97,'Released','Time is a tender embrace.','All Dirt Roads Taste of Salt',800227,6.0487,5.4,'qiQvFKfpCi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24593,_binary '\0','/fI8hv1IqWUIUjx4YRfl6TWhdqHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11535228',6.8,12584,'ko','비상선언','While investigating a terroristic threat that goes viral online, Korean authorities discover that a suspect has recently boarded an international flight bound for the United States. When a healthy passenger on the same flight suddenly dies a gruesome death of unknown cause, panic erupts both in-flight and on the ground. With steadily decreasing fuel and international refusals to offer aid, the captain and crew will be forced to take unprecedented emergency measures in an attempt to save the lives of their passengers.','/h7kaQG5MbraSLibOuTpo0gtMxRz.jpg','2022-08-03',140,'Released','Take your seat.','Emergency Declaration',626872,5.6786,7.4,'ZHN9bN7PyLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24594,_binary '\0','/sNvMfjRApaGhi1hMyGrPLrppQCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11535358',4.8,3144,'en','Family Camp','When workaholic Tommy\'s wife insists that he spend more time with his family, he agrees to sign up for Family Camp. What Tommy didn\'t count on was being forced to share a yurt at camp with the larger-than-life Sanders family.','/kbldvA34IVNwfKv8aUumZBg0D5E.jpg','2022-05-13',111,'Released',NULL,'Family Camp',846528,1.9334,5.3,'UufZhnWpc_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24595,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11536216',7.3,1237,'te','శివన్','Shivan revolves around a couple who are very much in love but one day the woman is found dead and the man is found guilty and imprisoned. But once he is in jail he recollects certain memories that change everything.','/thLur3AEYY9nc4tzqpfJ4G0KEld.jpg','2020-03-13',119,'Released','A Phenomenal Love Story','Shivan',682976,0.4931,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24596,_binary '\0','/9h8z7R3prR3rszyklTbRcZyMbdp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11536262',4.5,2968,'te','మోసగాళ్ళు','Arjun and Anu are fraternal twins who manage to run a scam in the US from India via a call center. With police officer Kumar hot on their heels, will they manage to escape the system?','/dgtYU0HwzlEa43us5JB1SemSzZW.jpg','2021-03-19',138,'Released','The Story of The World\'s Biggest I.T. Scam','Mosagallu',807079,1.2116,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24597,_binary '\0','/lXFarz134R1JOq144WiPbTRQpeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153690',6.9,2489,'en','Ballast','A single mother and her embattled son struggle to subsist in a small Mississippi Delta township. An act of violence thrusts them into the world of an emotionally devastated highway store owner, awakening the fury of a bitter and longstanding conflict.','/rjMhIWlNRiAJ5ie88PwuvdRmbs9.jpg','2008-10-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Ballast',25112,1.6362,7,'YZ0FFI8X8LM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24598,_binary '\0','/yTg0O6dYknEp3yPDnsI1jp4Aj8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1153706',3.7,13528,'en','Dance Flick','Street dancer Thomas Uncles is from the wrong side of the tracks, but his bond with the beautiful Megan White might help the duo realize their dreams as they enter in the mother of all dance battles.','/qqaM8jQhALhULwvm3eEepkBTQHJ.jpg','2009-05-22',83,'Released','The funniest dance movie of all time.','Dance Flick',21724,4.9587,5,'GXvZv9RW6Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24599,_binary '\0','/1ZnEOaOUj2e2Fq6Y7wo9KeH5rS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11539996',7,40910,'en','Relay','A broker of lucrative payoffs between corrupt corporations and the individuals who threaten them breaks his own rules when a new client seeks his protection to stay alive.','/mpwccO2L8LUVtVTJTdgUVgoQqAo.jpg','2025-08-21',112,'Released','No callers are identified. No conversations are recorded. No phone records are kept. Now speak clearly and when you are finished say: \'Go ahead\'.','Relay',1088166,8.4687,7,'Hhkoa2LWImA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24600,_binary '\0','/ldF6EQUJ58Tvrpq7lsRRtJnuhxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11540272',6.2,3045,'en','Lapsis','In a parallel present, delivery man Ray Tincelli is struggling to support himself and his ailing younger brother. After a series of two-bit hustles and unsuccessful swindles, Ray takes a job in a strange new realm of the gig economy: trekking deep into the forest, pulling cable over miles of terrain to connect large, metal cubes that link together the new quantum trading market. As he gets pulled deeper into the zone, he encounters growing hostility and the threat of robot cablers, and must choose to either help his fellow workers or to get rich and get out.','/sXw5f1O5t930kWa9tJAr90BCeOM.jpg','2021-02-12',108,'Released','Your life belongs to the machines.','Lapsis',665888,2.005,6.052,'qO40oJzRLcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24601,_binary '\0','/lMudh9ouUHsJ1jhKVSbx2ErGdzf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11540284',6.7,25581,'en','8-Bit Christmas','In suburban Chicago during the late 1980s, ten-year-old Jake Doyle embarks on a herculean quest to get the latest and greatest video game system for Christmas.','/5YwaISdOwp8Zu6O7kwBeUn8a7Pu.jpg','2021-11-24',98,'Released','How far would you go to score the ultimate gift?','8-Bit Christmas',802217,6.6997,6.425,'CI-YWRK0VPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24602,_binary '\0','/v2oPRCnWADeQhEAAUKD7DfMdScP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11540468',4.3,8700,'en','Breathe','Air-supply is scarce in the near future, forcing a mother and daughter to fight for survival when two strangers arrive desperate for an oxygenated haven.','/wTW2t8ocWDlHns8I7vQxuqkyK58.jpg','2024-04-04',93,'Released','Time is running out.','Breathe',720321,4.9862,5.637,'Hv3Q7uAY60M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24603,_binary '\0','/sDzrUYdN9WWcuN9UFAp8dgdwtpn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11540726',5.9,14086,'en','Resurrection','A woman\'s carefully constructed life is upended when an unwelcome shadow from her past returns, forcing her to confront the monster she\'s evaded for two decades.','/kfRr8Jm1gaEnLTXCIfHkSw8QW6t.jpg','2022-07-29',104,'Released','Maintain control.','Resurrection',872497,3.8588,5.9,'59RjB4m2KSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24604,_binary '\0','/uQUquwEvPuCg0ACRxU5NiCGgJLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11541872',5.5,11630,'fr','Bigbug','Set in the world of 2045, where communities have robotic helpers, a group of suburbanites are locked in for their protection by their household robots, while a rogue, self-aware AI android revolt uprising takes place outside.','/jDJOojbuqgnNVGmKgmuYzBpaIgP.jpg','2022-02-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Bigbug',665828,3.0235,5.26,'FWUkh23vBhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24605,_binary '\0','/j47N6TJIT9X8lMMmlAkY2AxKX6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11542194',4.7,1672,'mr','काळ','Anil , Ganesh , Rahul and Yogesh are four youngsters who make video\'s of ghost and post in on their social media page.But have never recorded videos related to paranormal activity.Mr Deshmukh offers the youngsters to shoot at a farmhouse in remote Konkan village.Which is where the boys will face real horror.','/rTIdYEF2ASSt0ECuMFyRYj3Tky5.jpg','2020-01-31',109,'Released',NULL,'Kaaal',670027,0.7169,3.7,'Vnp534hQ3WY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24606,_binary '\0','/kVKHuO8nSQloDBuZdqZ1mQpuHvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11542214',5.8,6083,'tr','Eltilerin Savaşı','Two sisters-in-law live as neighbors in the same apartment building with the mother-in-law who promised to give a beautiful sea-view penthouse to the one who delivers the first grandchild. A battle of egos erupts on social media.','/u9yDCxsVLUag3WXyB52S5eeAGed.jpg','2020-01-31',118,'Released',NULL,'Sisters-In-Law',664593,1.9884,5.9,'0YwmqXtMeRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24607,_binary '\0','/klLIEGjT6iNRnIlUFd3C9M34sMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11543916',5.7,1927,'ml','ചതുർ മുഖം','An ambitious young woman faces a supernatural force through technology. Will she be able to survive the onslaught and solve this unheard phenomenon?','/zgO1PfPPAiYYZWlj3w7fLfImQKm.jpg','2021-04-08',138,'Released',NULL,'Chathur Mukham',811549,1.2442,6.05,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24608,_binary '\0','/dUasP5TGFk1dhTgtNhk5uLRPRx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11547520',6.6,6414,'ru','Калашников','A Russian military propaganda film about the tank commander Kalashnikov, severely injured in battle in 1941. The accident leaves him incapacitated and unable to return to the front line. While recovering in the hospital, he begins creating the initial sketches of what will become one of the world’s most legendary weapons. A self-taught inventor is only 29 when he develops the now iconic assault riffle — the AK-47. Shot in occupied Crimea.','/wck8uKybfkHttcjoNlKoC0f7oBw.jpg','2020-02-20',105,'Released','The weapon that would change the world','Kalashnikov AK-47',592279,3.839,7.435,'V1LhswawPTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24609,_binary '\0','/kCF4tIyvLN9BieEUzUOVFwgGUPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11548822',7.1,2821,'en','Cow','A close-up portrait of the daily lives of a pair of cows: told by way of some narrative-free, intimate POV photography, with plenty of close shot images, we follow the daily routine of these animals as they live what can only be described as mundane, boring lives - all with an ultimate purpose within the human food chain.','/faszRX0wSzGqjIzDXt79H9ibsXa.jpg','2022-01-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Cow',661348,1.7,6.4,'NkCXJfdJE5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24610,_binary '\0','/9bvn5SWwAK6qB79UevNi0jqhfke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155053',7.1,5822,'ko','쌍화점','A despotic king orders his male lover to produce an heir for him with his Queen. But when they instead fall in love, will tragic consequences follow?','/jvGmbNUh0eq9ShQmMSof0DXXHWY.jpg','2008-12-30',133,'Released','For his last love, fate led him to betray his first love.','A Frozen Flower',17903,10.0821,6.9,'qUlfJXWenIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24611,_binary '\0','/zLXACaQzLLKmzbSBPpgXW6wfGdv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155056',7,227060,'en','I Love You, Man','Peter Klaven is a successful real estate agent who, upon getting engaged to the woman of his dreams, Zooey, discovers, to his dismay and chagrin, that he has no male friend close enough to serve as his Best Man. Peter immediately sets out to rectify the situation, embarking on a series of bizarre and awkward \"man-dates.\"','/xr4zAYsvgTzvMMiWu6qCAP9WBer.jpg','2009-03-20',105,'Released','Are you man enough to say it?','I Love You, Man',16538,9.6031,6.569,'um5DuTLzw-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24612,_binary '\0','/st5i3QHRh954CcudqR5aQqGqCkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155060',5.9,1545,'en','Down the Shore','Set on the Jersey shore, the lives of three childhood friends begin to unravel when a secret from their past is revealed','/7O9Oxlj3Ar8VYpZdwfDVFgemnix.jpg','2011-01-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Down the Shore',180607,1.3466,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24613,_binary '\0','/v8DepuF6gizphLzIyNZeQiB0hij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155076',6.3,230130,'en','The Karate Kid','12-year-old Dre Parker could\'ve been the most popular kid in Detroit, but his mother\'s latest career move has landed him in China. Dre immediately falls for his classmate Mei Ying but the cultural differences make such a friendship impossible. Even worse, Dre\'s feelings make him an enemy of the class bully, Cheng. With no friends in a strange land, Dre has nowhere to turn but maintenance man Mr. Han, who is a kung fu master. As Han teaches Dre that kung fu is not about punches and parries, but maturity and calm, Dre realizes that facing down the bullies will be the fight of his life.','/b1RBy3l297N0c7PHjlz35cClWju.jpg','2010-06-10',140,'Released','A challenge he never imagined. A teacher he never expected.','The Karate Kid',38575,19.8263,6.568,'2SmmxvHLsKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24614,_binary '\0','/AoHTT28aKNNVCRleEDqqnUJHwJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11552344',5.4,3668,'en','Murder at Yellowstone City','A former slave who arrives in Yellowstone City, Montana, a desolate former boomtown now on the decline, looking for a place to call home. On that same day, a local prospector discovers gold - and is murdered.','/58UKdNFfSSvx8TuecGAzqja3NTZ.jpg','2022-06-24',126,'Released','In a town of suspects, one man stands accused.','Murder at Yellowstone City',974961,5.2873,5.531,'3b1zQDcyPhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24615,_binary '\0','/fiG2E2FFYtdT8VaL51mHU889yKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11555492',8,91116,'ar','Farha','Palestine, 1948. After the withdrawal of the British occupiers, tensions rise between Arabs and Jews. Meanwhile, Farha, the smart daughter of the mayor of a small village, unaware of the coming tragedy, dreams of going to study in the big city.','/X4kRsdyP9FgMfKKn9LZiVscZY5.jpg','2021-09-14',92,'Released',NULL,'Farha',856437,1.7265,7.2,'2UT6Zw4-Yg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24616,_binary '\0','/yKEe2nFu4fRYcmVdeAwZxTZvP3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155592',7.7,61392,'en','Man on Wire','On August 7th 1974, French tightrope walker Philippe Petit stepped out on a high wire, illegally rigged between New York\'s World Trade Center twin towers, then the world\'s tallest buildings. After nearly an hour of performing on the wire, 1,350 feet above the sidewalks of Manhattan, he was arrested. This fun and spellbinding documentary chronicles Philippe Petit\'s \"highest\" achievement.','/1mS4rhIgHZcHIvf1beP9Av0Ui33.jpg','2008-08-01',94,'Released','1974. 1350 feet up. The artistic crime of the century.','Man on Wire',14048,2.3303,7.4,'EIawNRm9NWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24617,_binary '\0','/x4pfbhYvn0Nr5mYqBkJAD9LwLoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155650',6.9,3281,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第一章 俯瞰風景','The story starts following an incident: a young girl jumps from the top of a building. The image provokes a certain dread, as the girl appears to have been a corpse even before she jumped. The case is dismissed, yet more and more of these suicides occur, and all from the same building. Thus began the rumour, that a ghost inhabited the rooftop of the building.','/bMmHdhAM1xCQTQ4O3XhXLuXQ0k.jpg','2007-12-01',50,'Released','\"People do not cease to exist immediately after dying, as long as there are people who remember them.\"','The Garden of Sinners: Overlooking View',23150,2.7243,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24618,_binary '\0','/7tYw1CqTyFPWqjtaCdEC3vi0gI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155651',7.1,2475,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第二章 殺人考察（前）','August 1995: Mikiya first meets Shiki in a white kimono during a snowing day. Later on, at the high school freshmen ceremony, Mikiya sees Shiki in the crowd and chases after her, introducing himself to her. But Shiki hides a big secret: A wave of bizarre murders occur around many loose ends, and no suspects. there are still many questions: Who to believe? Who is the murderer? What is the secret of Shiki? and especially: Who is SHIKI?','/zxNZpMkis5XnD81Y3gqJhh9ZOmk.jpg','2007-12-29',60,'Released','\"Have you ever wanted to kill someone?\"','The Garden of Sinners: A Study in Murder - Part 1',23151,2.4019,6.7,'djYFAV1gO6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24619,_binary '\0','/3r9Oi2pzvhGCH3XLQT03Tf9Biyp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155652',7.3,2366,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第三章 痛覚残留','July 1998 - After a group of delinquents is found dead in their hangout place with all their limbs twisted and torn off, Aozaki Touko receives a request to find the murderer and asks Shiki for help. The main suspect is Asagami Fujino; a girl who was the boys\' plaything until recently, who Shiki believes to be \"one of her kind\".','/3TeeCstvdqb6E72dMPEb43rCD0U.jpg','2008-02-09',58,'Released','\"You enjoy hurting others, that\'s why your pain will never go away.\"','The Garden of Sinners: Remaining Sense of Pain',23153,2.617,7,'JX3FGlakyPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24620,_binary '\0','/93Q9fyIsSpY9C92IDRncWSMEDTD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155696',6.7,2485,'ja','名探偵コナン 戦慄の楽譜（フルスコア）','Serial murders involving all kinds have happened. All the victims are from a Music School led by a famous pianist. Conan and company have been invited to a opening concert of the Music Hall built by the pianist. The biggest attraction of this concert is the world famous violin called \"Stradivarius\" and a special appearance of a singer who has perfect pitch.','/qxq2TfGy1Vfh9miCjKPo0nNxmW6.jpg','2008-04-19',115,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Full Score of Fear',39207,4.343,6.9,'TmmAxKQlqNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24621,_binary '\0','/cDyYWcavuvNKtf7VpNR86nWh5XF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1155705',6.6,2980,'ja','20世紀少年 －第1章－ 終わりの始まり','In 1969, Kenji, an elementary school kid and his friends built a secret base during their summer holidays. They fantasized that they had to fight villains who were out to conquer the world and wrote them in the Book of Prophecies. Years later in 1997, Kenji becomes a convenience store manager and leads a regular life after giving up his dreams to become a rock star. His boring life is suddenly turned upside down when his old classmate dies mysteriously and an entire family in the neighbourhood disappears. At the same time, a religious cult and its mysterious leader, Friend emerges and a strange chain of events duplicating exactly the events described in the Book of Prophecies follow. Is this the beginning of the end of the world? Who is Friend?','/nb1fd4nZyBLUhkjnAQx5607aBMq.jpg','2008-08-19',142,'Released',NULL,'20th Century Boys: Beginning of the End',36683,3.1412,6.7,'XGGBRkZM9Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24622,_binary '\0','/nCZuAZZH4Yz268BwZkCFRwRa32d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11558688',4.2,2133,'en','The Spy Who Never Dies','A world-class spy falls for an unlikely woman and must work out how to build a relationship with a normal person while others around him try and destroy both the relationship and much more.','/xhVglqsfTPKP75VT3ChK85RQafX.jpg','2022-02-03',99,'Released','Spies are people too.','The Spy Who Never Dies',934196,1.9385,5.563,'0iJ44DA84Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24623,_binary '\0','/r2JmewF2iCH3jdad5RjcTk7pY5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11559138',6,1705,'es','El cazador','Ezequiel is home alone while his parents are away. He bears the burden of desiring other boys and keeping it a secret—until he meets \"Mono,\" an attractive skater who represents something more than the desire and experimentation he was seeking.','/ufLW18r5L29dCWZ6FCCZ8eabsEY.jpg','2020-05-28',101,'Released',NULL,'Young Hunter',623666,1.994,6.2,'9Co6JL4yM1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24624,_binary '\0','/5qGNF9AyAeOwxgqkrBuLlg7gvpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11559472',6.7,3587,'en','Ali & Ava','Sparks fly after Ali and Ava meet through their shared affection for Sofia, the child of Ali’s tenants whom Ava teaches. Ali finds comfort in Ava’s warmth and kindness while Ava finds Ali’s complexity and humour irresistible. As the pair begin to form a deep connection they have to find a way to keep their newfound passion from being overshadowed by the stresses and struggles of their separate lives and histories.​','/phBaAgc4EGxs0ScOb16ZfOShyfQ.jpg','2022-03-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Ali & Ava',661365,1.6349,6.7,'f1l6lg8Au_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24625,_binary '\0','/auohlYJDG6tYWawUSAPIYuc9vWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156067',5.7,1649,'en','The Lightkeepers','Set in the year 1912 on Cape Cod, a lighthouse keeper who has disavowed any association with females, must deal with the appearance of two attractive women who move into a nearby cottage for the summer.','/gSBgOybkf1y1OcW7e8F0ENqNXgh.jpg','2009-12-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Lightkeepers',50042,1.8291,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24626,_binary '\0','/uauoVKKCkNA9iWjgJCL8TdSfLf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11561116',6.2,48516,'en','The Whisper Man','When his young son vanishes, a widower enlists help from his estranged father, a retired detective who put away the serial killer now linked to the case.','/ndRs5lADYm0PeVjuOxaMcInY0o2.jpg','2026-08-27',111,'Released','If you leave a door half open, soon you\'ll hear the whispers spoken.','The Whisper Man',860508,53.3116,6.87,'ZHRR-1CKYIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24627,_binary '\0','/dlz39SUUy3TQZS77vgqnJG9So3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156132',6.2,2715,'nl','De hel van \'63','When extreme weather suddenly hits the Netherlands in 1963, a 120-mile tour skating event taking place on natural ice forces its contestants to contend with life-threatening race conditions.','/v1p3Idi1lOaJ162A7eZk1cOcTkz.jpg','2009-12-16',100,'Released',NULL,'The Hell of \'63',35840,1.6304,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24628,_binary '\0','/sqY6S4lrGk7u3YdNwqx3M7HWSmK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156143',6.2,4117,'fr','Les Herbes folles','A quirky woman who spends her free time as a pilot has her purse stolen; a mysterious man finds her wallet, and they embark on a peculiar romance.','/wLy9Tp03uaQLV5IRHtjAYGiURdW.jpg','2009-11-04',104,'Released',NULL,'Wild Grass',37842,2.0084,6,'f6p73NwAcAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24629,_binary '\0','/vgfATZOtNSAhf0tLVUNTkW0pVg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156148',2.3,1534,'hi','कर्ज़','Singer/Dancer Monty Oberoi meets and falls in love with Tina. He then starts hallucinating and having visions of an unknown place. His doctors advise him to take a break and he decides to travel to Kenya, where Tina resides with her uncle, Kabira, and guardian, Kamini. Monty experiences more incidents and feels as if he has been here before, while Tina notices that he appears to be more attracted to Kamini than herself. Neither are aware that Monty will soon be entrapped in a plot that will result in his sudden death.','/i6GpnblgEqcBgRMhW5ZdGYxtVhK.jpg','2008-10-17',142,'Released','Vengeance is Back','Karzzzz',55376,1.0716,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24630,_binary '\0','/rUVkyw6hhLpDClAqX9SCbMi11X5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156173',6.9,6157,'it','Vincere','The story of the descent into madness of Mussolini\'s secret first wife, Ida Dasler, who was seduced by his passion and vigor but blind to the fascist dictator\'s many flaws.','/zt9yAFfkOia3NltkhjMT5WaPlcV.jpg','2009-05-20',128,'Released','The story of Mussolini\'s secret lover, Ida Dalser, and their son Albino.','Vincere',30239,2.2523,6.7,'HEWyWDeWx6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24631,_binary '\0','/oIV1mfVTxnFMUhI1JhOS1RyHi0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11561866',5.9,2763,'ar','مسامير','Danah, a Saudi girl with a passion for artificial intelligence embark on a journey to create good in the world using robotics. Meanwhile, three friends Saad, Saltooh and Kalb hit rock bottom and go on a journey of their own to prove themselves to society by becoming crime fighting superheroes.','/uKNvAIGwYzk8sSx8MILQkbRkzur.jpg','2020-01-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Masameer: The Movie',659676,1.6696,6.348,'6t8Chcw_FpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24632,_binary '\0','/s3uWMC7FThbY99puaMy1pTaxmgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11563070',3.8,5581,'te','ఆచార్య','Acharya, a middle-aged Naxalite-turned-social reformer, launches a fight against the Endowments Department over misappropriation and embezzlement of temple funds and donations.','/9GZbNfzE33xbxzMQHK9vQckSBge.jpg','2022-04-29',152,'Released',NULL,'Acharya',679919,1.7523,3.889,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24633,_binary '\0','/otugS74HEHdca4aTCtt8HtXvPYV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11563598',7.3,122388,'en','A Complete Unknown','New York, early 1960s. Against the backdrop of a vibrant music scene and tumultuous cultural upheaval, an enigmatic 19-year-old from Minnesota arrives in the West Village with his guitar and revolutionary talent, destined to change the course of American music.','/llWl3GtNoXosbvYboelmoT459NM.jpg','2024-12-25',141,'Released','The ballad of a true original.','A Complete Unknown',661539,17.1567,7.065,'FdV-Cs5o8mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24634,_binary '\0','/i75MAPKBay1CHIyPxEhlJi5RqEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156395',6.5,2227,'ja','K-20 怪人二十面相・伝','In an alternate version of 1949 Japan in which World War II never happened, the Japanese capital of Teito is home to both an ultra rich upper class and the dirt poor masses. The city is thrown into a state of panic when a phantom thief called “The Kaijin (Fiend) with 20 Faces” (K-20 for short) begins to use his mysterious abilities to steal from the rich and give to the poor. One day a circus acrobat named Heikichi Endo (Takeshi Kaneshiro) is framed for K-20’s crimes and becomes determined to clear his name. He teams up with K-20’s next target, a wealthy duchess named Yoko Hashiba (Takako Matsu) and her detective fiancé (Toru Nakamura), to take K-20 down once and for all.','/a9La4mShK0wkISGSFahKCy0U9HN.jpg','2008-12-20',137,'Released',NULL,'K-20: The Fiend with Twenty Faces',24410,1.8224,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24635,_binary '\0','/oihWVx3imvRKujnGmSDYhfG1gI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156398',7.5,674297,'en','Zombieland','Columbus has made a habit of running from what scares him. Tallahassee doesn\'t have fears. If he did, he\'d kick their ever-living ass. In a world overrun by zombies, these two are perfectly evolved survivors. But now, they\'re about to stare down the most terrifying prospect of all: each other.','/dUkAmAyPVqubSBNRjRqCgHggZcK.jpg','2009-10-02',88,'Released','Nut up or shut up.','Zombieland',19908,14.8354,7.258,'8m9EVP8X7N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24636,_binary '\0','/4lYLo7tn34z6gJACMHCakw2HOB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156444',5.7,1246,'cn','奪帥','In the midst of a violent gang war, a series of misfortunes threaten the fate of a gang boss and his mob.','/hkR9GwWsvPuo80Tip9Y6YudS2I8.jpg','2008-02-29',112,'Released','One bad move...kills them all.','Triad Wars',25655,2.7915,6.095,'WHFvr7-nk7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24637,_binary '\0','/9rNnFGN3kUL3andAUHjVvEhDK57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156454',4.1,2102,'en','Journey to the Center of the Earth','Set in the late 1870\'s - A woman hires an anthropologist/adventurer to track down her husband, who has disappeared while searching for an elusive passage to the center of the earth','/ub9DfwfRe8SAM4fA3zO3RakK8IA.jpg','2008-01-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Journey to the Center of the Earth',16929,3.2723,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24638,_binary '\0','/y3uOfZAYwLkbvhunswBCskNMrfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11564570',7.1,533524,'en','Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery','World-famous detective Benoit Blanc heads to Greece to peel back the layers of a mystery surrounding a tech billionaire and his eclectic crew of friends.','/vDGr1YdrlfbU9wxTOdpf3zChmv9.jpg','2022-11-23',140,'Released','When the game ends, the mystery begins.','Glass Onion: A Knives Out Mystery',661374,20.4307,7.02,'-xR_lBtEvSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24639,_binary '\0','/fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156466',7.3,48321,'en','Undisputed III: Redemption','Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.','/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg','2010-04-17',96,'Released','One deadly tournament. Last fight for freedom.','Undisputed III: Redemption',38234,10.2749,7.6,'qq-yqajCo6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24640,_binary '\0','/v4nKDuW6h89rDmeUSyZlL8skYGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156470',7.3,1264,'ja','禅','In the early 1200s, Dogen brought Chinese Zen philosophy to Japan, and established the Japanese Zen school of Buddhism. He taught that a person was capable of realizing Buddhahood within himself, by way of Zazen. Zazen is extended hours of sitting and meditating to achieve a state of “Mu” (nothingness, or empty existence).','/jv9dXTSZSEIUwFV5Wrsov41XKZ4.jpg','2009-01-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Zen',28632,1.9873,7.1,'pwKXTj1IQUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24641,_binary '\0','/46VuM3nKfMYITAurDdqFQS1QPVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156506',6.6,2737,'cn','保持通話','A debt collector receives a call from a woman who is kidnapped by an unknown gang. He thinks it is a joke but soon, he realises that it is not a prank.','/ypZQQ9R8uXiRpTKtRoT5gcQM5RM.jpg','2008-09-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Connected',19611,2.7783,6.427,'WawVnyspImw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24642,_binary '\0','/uDzelyg1xCMYMzLHj2SvOx69GdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156516',7.2,1769,'te','రెడీ','A brave man decides to kidnap his friend\'s beloved from a forced marriage, but ends up abducting the wrong bride. Ironically, the bride he kidnapped is ecstatic because she was already planning an escape. On the run, they fall in love, but in order to get married, they must convince their families.','/7OMenpYP2riOMS4FVdFgrTrYntc.jpg','2008-06-19',171,'Released','Ready For Anything','Ready',73583,1.6633,5.978,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24643,_binary '\0','/msPrmq4nXKhS6M6BstyeJnunrgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11565160',5.2,2654,'hi','The Y','A young woman, Deeksha, loses her voice and memory after a road accident that claims her parents’ lives. As she moves into a mansion inherited from her grandmother, she has ghostly encounters that the doctor blames on PTSD. Is it really her psyche playing tricks, or is the house haunted?','/6YjyVezHvoFbuFPvxSRMFBLV1hX.jpg','2023-01-06',110,'Released',NULL,'The Y',1057228,0.6511,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24644,_binary '\0','/3PgYZ2Rhk7YqKymTmXlWKI2m62b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156519',5.7,1505,'de','Die drei ??? – Das verfluchte Schloss','A new case for the cult detectives! Not by coincidence, a mysterious videotape falls into the hands of Jupiter Jones, Pete Crenshaw and Bob Andrews during Jupiter\'s birthday party in Rocky Beach. On it is a recording of Jupiter\'s long dead parents. In their message they want to communicate to their son the key to an especially tricky riddle.','/n0Gf1z98KXdiGIKczOSRZUQb6p3.jpg','2009-03-19',97,'Released',NULL,'The Three Investigators in The Secret of Terror Castle',28479,2.4352,6.329,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24645,_binary '\0','/usWY7HLI6SGT23RaUpsYorLNyIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1156531',6.9,2172,'bs','Na putu','Loving young couple Luna and Amar try their best to overcome unexpected obstacles that threaten their relationship. After Amar\'s dramatic change in a fundamentalist community, Luna tears herself apart searching if love is truly enough to keep the couple together on the path to a lifetime of happiness...','/idj2bOOBhcx2ry0KylfED5xloLo.jpg','2010-08-10',100,'Released',NULL,'On the Path',50817,1.352,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24646,_binary '\0','/hc8Y3Xz9YS3DQxVem61qrhkHxtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11566164',6.2,2468,'ko','해치지않아','A lawyer is given the mission of revitalising a bankrupt zoo that has no animals. When he and a group of zookeepers come up with the idea to dress like animals and his fake polar bear goes viral, the zoo becomes a hit, before his law firm’s real intentions are revealed.','/sN7qH8ynEmcodtgPBwKyd2VbFr6.jpg','2020-01-15',117,'Released','Just chill we won\'t bite anyone.','Secret Zoo',575718,3.0479,6.3,'oZdsbVRYEn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24647,_binary '\0','/1XMDerNzsqUNdkcoTIn5xKnEw7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11569658',3.1,1934,'en','Snow Falls','After a winter storm strands five friends in a remote cabin with no power and little food, disorientation slowly claims their sanity as each of them succumbs to a fear that the snow itself may be contaminated or somehow evil.','/ueZUfAa98hAsxWOp9Zv3JIRuNkS.jpg','2023-01-17',80,'Released','The weather outside is frightful.','Snow Falls',737853,2.1515,4.5,'mxi1V5yrGqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24648,_binary '\0','/6Y86bAQjLBMQoIEffcSpIxypWhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1157549',6.9,1926,'ro','Cea mai fericită fată din lume','Delia, a young Romanian girl, comes to Bucharest with her parents to collect a prize she has won in a contest organized by a soft-drinks company. The prize is a beautiful new car. All Delia has to do now is appear in front of the camera in a commercial. All goes well until it becomes clear that Delia and her parents have very different ideas about what to do with the new car. Meanwhile, the contest\'s sponsor needs a radiant prize-winner with a gleaming smile. A wicked satire and a psychological portrait of a society perverted by its slavery to capitalism and consumerism','/bkOFTDSEMZKydS4ZSimW7yAUcCt.jpg','2009-05-08',99,'Released',NULL,'The Happiest Girl in the World',80115,1.3794,6.8,'NW5dihx3-Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24649,_binary '\0','/2AMk0Df2Lr0WtFDHGsEo1UE8IHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1157605',7.9,17464,'en','Anvil! The Story of Anvil','At 14, best friends Robb Reiner and Lips made a pact to rock together forever. Their band, Anvil, hailed as the \"demi-gods of Canadian metal\" influenced a musical generation that includes Metallica, Slayer, and Anthrax. Following a calamitous European tour, Lips and Robb, now in their fifties, set off to record their 13th album in one last attempt to fulfill their boyhood dreams.','/rDrMuFaWBKwjwEnw4C06Sm97huY.jpg','2008-01-14',81,'Released','At fourteen, they made a pact to rock together forever. They meant it.','Anvil! The Story of Anvil',18094,2.8677,7.6,'t92nKWryKXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24650,_binary '\0','/x4UkhIQuHIJyeeOTdcbZ3t3gBSa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11576124',4.2,10841,'en','Rogue','Battle-hardened O’Hara leads a lively mercenary team of soldiers on a daring mission: rescue hostages from their captors in remote Africa. But as the mission goes awry and the team is stranded, O’Hara’s squad must face a bloody, brutal encounter with a gang of rebels.','/uOw5JD8IlD546feZ6oxbIjvN66P.jpg','2020-08-20',106,'Released','When the hunter becomes the prey.','Rogue',718444,3.9454,5.6,'fX_ddBDYjkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24651,_binary '\0','/7IywP8SChAvLVGWHIebTDAl9IIc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1157631',6.6,1940,'es','Perro come perro','In the crime world of Colombia, there is an unwritten code. When Víctor and Eusebio, two hoods who bungle a shake-down job, break that code, they unwittingly sign their own death sentence.','/fbh7D8kaSLezUdh3dpiLHHMDFDA.jpg','2008-04-18',106,'Released',NULL,'Dog Eat Dog',33558,1.2819,6.632,'AMEu9PeASVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24652,_binary '\0','/nz51oc6hnGrMGrYUE0s25FWgVWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1157705',7.2,5370,'en','Roman Polanski: Wanted and Desired','Examines the public scandal and private tragedy which led to legendary director Roman Polanski\'s sudden flight from the United States.','/1W8t1iBSTRFr5Q0G3iJhw5BaP3w.jpg','2008-01-18',99,'Released','The truth couldn\'t fit in the headlines.','Roman Polanski: Wanted and Desired',16800,2.5494,6.3,'hMieQzq1snc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24653,_binary '\0','/10qHzowpyIpROMBAiUNGSdlTsFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1157720',8,1552,'es','Stranded: I\'ve Come from a Plane That Crashed on the Mountains','The story, told by the survivors, of a group of young men, members of a Uruguayan rugby team, who managed to survive for 72 days, at an altitude of almost 4,000 meters, in the heart of the Andes Mountains, after their plane, en route to Chile, crashed there on October 13, 1972.','/3Uu9M1y36vI727Ec2oDMeS3V3Ys.jpg','2007-11-24',127,'Released','The Andes crash survivors in their own words','Stranded: I\'ve Come from a Plane That Crashed on the Mountains',21508,1.8709,8,'WNgU5Qn3fmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24654,_binary '\0','/3gLffhgP3aOCCdCbXpZLFETmXr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11579538',6.4,1674,'es','El sustituto','Spain, 1982. Andrés Expósito, a young police inspector, accepts a posting in Denia, a small town on the Mediterranean coast, in the hope of leading a quieter life and that the natural environment will help improve the fragile health of his daughter; but once in his new post he becomes involved by chance in the investigation of the strange death of the inspector he has come to replace.','/7HEMT4mHLr0YvAwuwxvNbPfELrI.jpg','2021-10-29',118,'Released',NULL,'The Replacement',776279,2.1506,6.1,'DZOFj7y2LvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24655,_binary '\0','/j9fWBx3rAjXmCHK7M0hltRYvn3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11580854',8.4,29029,'ta','சார்பட்டா பரம்பரை','When Sarpatta Parambarai is challenged to a do-or-die match, Kabilan, a young labourer, must choose whether to put on the gloves himself and lead his clan to victory, or be dissuaded by his disapproving mother and dangerous politics.','/3f2KrEoOTmQxfDWgeqqLQ1rCYWP.jpg','2021-07-22',174,'Released',NULL,'Sarpatta Parambarai',796011,1.5797,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24656,_binary '\0','/tJBQ4LuxO0UyqbQhpkamr40m3eo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11580914',5.1,1481,'ta','யாதும் ஊரே யாவரும் கேளிர்','A refugee struggles hard to find an identity for himself in order to accomplish his dreams.','/i8broKyZelH6nKk92ucxMd7Y9M2.jpg','2023-05-19',150,'Released',NULL,'Yaadhum Oore Yaavarum Kelir',752883,0.9846,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24657,_binary '\0','/dOEQG8AbHoFYjIlKvqStWWZuczr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11580944',5,1481,'te','సీటీమార్','All a full-time bank employee and part-time kabaddi coach wants is to bring national relevance to the school his father built and help young kabaddi players in his village win the national championship. It might prove difficult than just coaching them though.','/5Q72n3TFHBSEqw0RUCfpzu5p8pR.jpg','2021-09-10',138,'Released',NULL,'Seetimaarr',791303,1.1169,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24658,_binary '\0','/t4BafoETA8JKbB9x5cbqEA5gLMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11581174',8,25353,'ta','கர்ணன்','Karnan, an angry young man, fights for the rights of his oppressed people. Can he save them from those who wield power and weapons?','/z5SxDcVWa9nokynVqBHb2IKk78J.jpg','2021-04-09',152,'Released',NULL,'Karnan',680652,1.4087,7.2,'6WzOtGgXF9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24659,_binary '\0','/vQU0UMJceDplsMg4t2SwQfAwq9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11581264',3.9,4799,'ta','திரௌபதி','A man who is accused of killing his wife and her sister on the basis of casteism goes on a rampage to kill those who cheat upper-caste women in the pretense of having a romantic relationship.','/55ySI8fh0J1KtcpEsj8iYhPiWIj.jpg','2020-02-28',159,'Released',NULL,'Draupathi',639743,1.2494,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24660,_binary '\0','/HfiHcS91SjIvWNbPRWGozqnxsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1158278',7.2,1419,'ja','キサラギ','The fanclub of a deceased Japanese idol gather together for the one year anniversary of her death. By combining forces they try to unearth the true circumstances surrounding her supposed suicide.','/1K5Sz9GBbAyytWPC6xXWX426Pue.jpg','2007-06-16',108,'Released',NULL,'Kisaragi',27698,1.6733,6.9,'8OsyeDHIoag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24661,_binary '\0','/hIrnrdhZYh4x8uyyDDUAlu4zoX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11585172',6.7,1392,'en','Much Ado About Christmas','Haley is a wealthy heiress known for her acts of kindness. Haley meets hopeless romantic Claud, and she keeps her wealthy family a secret. When Claud pitches an ad campaign to Haley\'s mom and Haley\'s secrets are revealed, things get...complicated.','/xK8H6giNmGTKBR1xC6Mg2Lnns3Q.jpg','2021-10-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Much Ado About Christmas',878410,1.5745,6,'YG-1x8IIj-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24662,_binary '\0','/5xlPkbp46bmtnS26bAwzuNjmob6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11585200',7,2966,'en','Christmas Waltz','After Avery’s storybook Christmas wedding is canceled unexpectedly, dance instructor Roman helps her rebuild her dreams.','/6YewfKDTQmzVwwBKog6IWOLhENP.jpg','2020-11-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Waltz',733032,2.7418,6.9,'GInBvm_eULs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24663,_binary '\0','/jUGDIO443VErnhjHN4wbNwY2HU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11586384',5.5,5135,'en','Masking Threshold','Conducting a series of experiments in his makeshift home-lab, a skeptic IT worker tries to cure his harrowing hearing impairment. But where will his research lead him? \"Masking Threshold\" combines a chamber play, a scientific procedural, an unpacking video, and a DIY YouTube channel while suggesting endless vistas of existential pain and decay. Glimpse the world of the nameless protagonist in this eldritch tale, which is by no means for the faint of heart.','/88HS7YXsCFdVMVNfDHCIOgILC32.jpg','2022-09-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Masking Threshold',764086,0.8535,5.6,'ZQzaYXYcYWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24664,_binary '\0','/wizhQYQyWi4UuJOL32oI5mZymeN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1158700',1.2,7204,'hi','देशद्रोही','Raja (Kamal R. Khan) leaves the rural life behind and heads for the big city of Mumbai to pursue his dreams. But when he inadvertently gets involved in a drug deal gone bad soon after his arrival, everything is put into jeopardy. He meets the lovely Sonia (Gracy Singh), who works for a notorious narcotics dealer to pay for her young brother\'s care. Now, Raja is trying to save their lives in this drama that co-stars Harshita Bhatt and Kim Sharma.','/yaqUEsNpGfRLFe21l0G9sDbUAhe.jpg','2008-11-14',139,'Released',NULL,'Deshdrohi',309698,0.8454,1.9,'-1EusoDTKlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24665,_binary '\0','/kvc7XErRfXsMXGYFZp6NLrVnQAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1158936',6.8,2856,'fr','Eden à l\'ouest','Desperate to break free from the poverty of his homeland, Elias boards a ramshackle people-smuggling trawler to France. But when the boat is raided by police, Elias leaps into the ocean, eventually finding himself washed up on a Mediterranean beach resort called Eden. So begins Elias odyssesy across Western Europe to Paris, where wondrous promise, helpful new friends and perilous dangers await him every step of the way.','/tij0ItjV75Fa15rxX6tXUvIN3KC.jpg','2009-02-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Eden Is West',15036,2.0898,6.2,'M1CaZCR41ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24666,_binary '\0','/aP9mLFp6uX4LYk2VmGFxty2QmIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1158939',6,5525,'en','Never Grow Old','An Irish undertaker profits when outlaws take over a peaceful town, but his own family come under threat as the death toll increases dramatically.','/3WGh8RtXOCG6Onrju1SBO67fCGb.jpg','2019-03-15',101,'Released','Greed digs the deepest graves','Never Grow Old',498743,3.2271,6.014,'Q8sRCnCiqAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24667,_binary '\0','/u42VsSHBbvYMHyG9Y518ECs36o6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11591306',6,8402,'ml','ദ പ്രീസ്റ്റ്','The culprits behind multiple deaths in a family over a few years are exposed, but there is more to it than meets the eye.','/julViamz4kL8bnUf6unYKTJhnYN.jpg','2021-03-11',140,'Released',NULL,'The Priest',663143,1.2639,5.548,'IYfdQOGqL1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24668,_binary '\0','/ftmt85I5BHXkCaPaQSRFHVqsqu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11591424',4.1,6141,'en','The Stay','Two couples rent a secluded house for a weekend getaway, and encounter an odd caretaker while facing a dangerous secret.','/sGCjXwGtmb38h1CKXugvucaWW5i.jpg','2021-03-16',87,'Released','Good friends and some time to kill.','The Stay',803861,1.0877,3.8,'PuuNFz7letA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24669,_binary '\0','/36NYs5FPCai8uGpnM0dUshBgRIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11592014',6.2,1435,'es','Hoy se arregla el mundo','David Samaras, \"el Griego\", is the general producer of the popular talk show \"Hoy se arregla el mundo\", where supposedly ordinary people resolve relationship, couple, friendship, work, parent and child conflicts. The most enduring bond in his life is Benito, his 9-year-old son, the fruit of a casual relationship. The story changes completely when he learns that Benito is not his son. The search for the real dad will lead them to a crossroads much bigger than the one they set out to face.','/oNAOqq4x2qXdER1HLThRHRRUeTf.jpg','2022-01-13',113,'Released',NULL,'Today We Fix the World',656796,2.0201,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24670,_binary '\0','/bro3aAx14EfSG5SQqL4P3mLDkfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159231',5.3,1823,'it','Una moglie bellissima','Mariano has been married for 10 years with Miranda, a woman way out of his league. Their small-town life is disrupted by womanizing photographer Andrea, who — struck by her good looks — offers Miranda a one-time modelling job. Albeit hesitant, the couple eventually accepts his invitation to the Seychelles...','/4nXWGRq30f9gQfRuiQoXZjvClvJ.jpg','2007-12-14',96,'Released',NULL,'A Beautiful Wife',52214,1.6705,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24671,_binary '\0','/nw1p11yEzd1XSTK1iuUrvJ8qoB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11594766',5.4,1224,'pt','Diários de Intercâmbio','Two best friends embark on a life-changing adventure abroad as exchange students.','/tladXTnCvsMDqJI8RiU3LpasSbT.jpg','2021-08-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Diary of an Exchange Student',760154,1.868,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24672,_binary '\0','/4fxw0JvL71W7uCS9D4hV2GRcZZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159721',4.5,1537,'en','Order of Chaos','Almost rich, almost thirty, he never lies or cheats, even when his beautiful fiancé orders him around and his ball-busting boss uses threats as motivation. John never makes a sound, eager to do right. Rick Carlson is not. A smooth talking and coercive, Rick turns John\'s life upside down when he not only moves into his building, but starts working at his competitive law firm.','/kpPlLFbCVpSl5jPf9PgtGiqwlKl.jpg','2010-02-12',90,'Released','In a world of no absolutes, right and wrong is just a matter of perspective.','Order of Chaos',35004,1.6197,4.3,'n0XJOstgncg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24673,_binary '\0','/9UXry7u8t7pzZiGSfBLgHH55Dr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159922',5.6,2540,'en','Cheerful Weather for the Wedding','England, 1932. Today is Dolly Thatcham\'s wedding day, and her family is arriving at the manor house with all the cheerfulness, chaos and grievances that accompany such gatherings. Trouble soon appears in the shape of Joseph, Dolly\'s lover from the previous summer, who throws her feelings into turmoil. But Dolly\'s mother will not allow her carefully laid plans for her daughter\'s future to be threatened...','/4guVWudT2zUSjFDnTY4p5rpWMA6.jpg','2012-12-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Cheerful Weather for the Wedding',110272,2.2741,5.4,'ZFUOgjcwsz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24674,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159926',6.8,1462,'en','City of Life','A privileged young male Arab at odds with his cultural identity and his less fortunate street smart friend; a disillusioned Indian taxi driver who bears an uncanny resemblance to a famous Bollywood star; and a former Romanian ballet dancer now working as a flight attendant and searching for love and companionship ... these individuals all live in Dubai and their lives are about to collide for better or for worse in a city where ambition, growth and opportunity are encouraged and dreams can still manifest. \"City of Life\" is an urban drama that tracks the various intersections of a multi-ethnic cast, examining how random interactions and their consequences can irrevocably impact another\'s life.','/3TyuTCNQfGj6xhvNfFXtBDtcTnk.jpg','2009-12-11',119,'Released','Every day you can change another persons life without ever knowing it.','City of Life',44529,1.2129,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24675,_binary '\0','/2FgXSJFdosxU3ypMT5HSGg3r2k7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11599576',6.6,2442,'en','Juniper','When a self-destructive teenager is suspended from school and asked to look after his feisty alcoholic grandmother as a punishment, the crazy time they spend together turns his life around.','/ziDXGs2Up7o51Lp55zAeyrQo6JH.jpg','2021-08-26',94,'Released','Life. Don\'t ever water it down.','Juniper',833257,2.2191,6.527,'XwR4CIeMCzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24676,_binary '\0','/1x8qZSDzqFFth4ijstLEwzHLUOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159961',7.5,3482,'en','Waking Sleeping Beauty','By the mid-1980s, the fabled animation studios of Walt Disney had fallen on hard times. The artists were polarized between newcomers hungry to innovate and old timers not yet ready to relinquish control. These conditions produced a series of box-office flops and pessimistic forecasts: maybe the best days of animation were over. Maybe the public didn\'t care. Only a miracle or a magic spell could produce a happy ending. Waking Sleeping Beauty is no fairy tale. It\'s the true story of how Disney regained its magic with a staggering output of hits - \"Little Mermaid,\" \"Beauty and the Beast ,\" \"Aladdin,\" \"The Lion King,\" and more - over a 10-year period.','/hywGLq5tMOuKwXfOhYUzoqNNAnU.jpg','2010-03-26',86,'Released','From 1984 to 1994 a perfect storm of people and circumstances changed the face of animation forever.','Waking Sleeping Beauty',47813,2.891,7.2,'EyeoyRjEiUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24677,_binary '\0','/uvE8dYx33mFjesdsjMmEzfdODoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1159984',4.6,1453,'en','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde','Dr. Henry Jekyll is a well-regarded physician whose evenings are spent researching a rare and sacred Amazonian flower so potent it\'s said to literally separate the soul, giving life to man\'s Dark Self. The obsessive experiments to isolate its psychotropic properties happen to coincide with a series of brutal murders gripping the city with fear. Jekyll knows it\'s no coincidence. While his nights are lost to him, he awakens with bloody mementos and violent memories of the screams of his victims.','/1Jzp8UnjXDqMirART2HPDaN2AZf.jpg','2008-05-17',89,'Released','Everyone has a dark side','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde',35801,1.8683,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24678,_binary '\0','/dCTOCAHNIdZ1jDhUbMjcYwhKTL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160022',6.8,1871,'fr','Rumba','Teachers in a rural school, happy couple Fiona and Dom have a common passion: Latin Dancing. One night, after a glorious dance competition, they have a car accident and see their lives turn upside down.','/iJLXLPUAfifEMXx1FTtZBzAYnYI.jpg','2008-09-10',77,'Released',NULL,'Rumba',51871,0.9381,6.1,'oNjjlJGHe1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24679,_binary '\0','/rI2UVV8IDnouus8ioIjyFDPrEu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160313',4.7,1401,'en','The American Mall','The executive producers of High School Musical keep the good times rolling with this upbeat musical comedy set in the one place every American teenager\'s home away from home - the local shopping mall. Ally (Nina Dobrev) is an optimistic adolescent singer/songwriter whose hard working mother owns the mall music shop frequented by every teen in town. When Ally shares her music with Joey (Rob Mayes), a janitor in the mall who harbors rock star ambitions, she is thrilled to find someone who can truly relate to her songs as well as her heart. Trouble looms on the horizon, however, in the form of the mall owner\'s spoiled rotten daughter Madison (Autumn Reeser). Madison is the kind of girl who\'s used to getting whatever she wants, and what she wants now could prove disastrous for both Ally\'s ambitions, and her mother\'s popular music store.','/48wxXQeOl4T8sJx4BMV0IFntmF1.jpg','2008-08-11',100,'Released','Love and dreams are not for sale','The American Mall',25041,1.424,5.4,'P9_oBrQKup4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24680,_binary '\0','/8ye2cE8SsE8vkFkmUrcWiBFidP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160315',6.4,1307,'th','บอดี้ ศพ #19','A man tries to prove that his nightmares about a girl who screams for help and is then murdered are real, and contain a message reaching out to her murderer.','/aM2YWL7U7wwa4AoiW59h6TXZssC.jpg','2007-10-04',125,'Released','Every little piece will return...','Body',21785,1.3897,6.1,'MAG0ER559uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24681,_binary '\0','/hjtxJj4oK9VxZU13yBEYj3jXbV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160317',4.3,2281,'en','Death of a Ghost Hunter','Renowned \"ghost hunter\", Carter Simms is paid to conduct a paranormal investigation of a supposedly haunted house. Along with a cameraman, a reporter, and a spiritual advocate, she embarks on a three night journey into terror.','/YNQw2Qw4UW9m5qb5iB4SppNyYi.jpg','2007-10-28',107,'Released',NULL,'Death of a Ghost Hunter',18441,1.0521,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24682,_binary '\0','/c2EpOiIhpMtGCnG6HyHgbpyryPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160368',5.6,32014,'en','12 Rounds','When New Orleans Police Detective Danny Fisher stops a brilliant thief from getting away with a multimillion-dollar heist, the thief\'s girlfriend is accidentally killed. After escaping from prison, the criminal mastermind enacts his revenge, taunting Danny with 12 rounds of near-impossible puzzles and tasks that he must somehow complete to save the life of the woman he loves.','/7k7qhrO57sVoBLrNo5HYoTp24sT.jpg','2009-03-19',108,'Released','Can you survive 12 rounds for the one you love?','12 Rounds',17134,5.948,5.901,'2NvznP_gp_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24683,_binary '\0','/bjDmpahuIzEf3Ej2SZW7mOSG7kM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160374',4.2,1483,'en','Sweatshop','A group of friends break into an abandoned factory in order to throw a impromptu party; unaware that it is not as empty as they originally believed.','/3PUoSJh7ien2YAT3CzpPElw0kEX.jpg','2009-11-20',86,'Released','\"One Hammer\" \" No Prisoners\"','Sweatshop',55684,1.5601,3.4,'5IjW6PfkZaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24684,_binary '\0','/2ACeljeo8BLDeEAMugaAjTFGPTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11603828',4.3,1804,'te','సూపర్ మచ్చి','A humble middle class singer in his 20s get pursued by a beautiful woman who claims to be a girl friend whereas he hasn\'t seen that women in her life before. Things get mysterious and much complicated as he learns she officially registered herself as his wife without his knowledge..','/wQAyybjuXoJ6uLwZ8GLXtvG3fF8.jpg','2022-01-14',132,'Released',NULL,'Super Machi',889595,1.2157,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24685,_binary '\0','/zRKQW58MBEY078AxkHxEJzUskCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160419',8,1090307,'en','Dune','Paul Atreides, a brilliant and gifted young man born into a great destiny beyond his understanding, must travel to the most dangerous planet in the universe to ensure the future of his family and his people. As malevolent forces explode into conflict over the planet\'s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence - a commodity capable of unlocking humanity\'s greatest potential - only those who can conquer their fear will survive.','/v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg','2021-09-15',155,'Released','It begins.','Dune',438631,45.0375,7.8,'8g18jFHCLXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24686,_binary '\0','/qoQlyVqDiKTHMvjDUrA1m3m6QJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11604676',8,10613,'ml','നായാട്ട്','Three police officers are forced to go on the run when they get tangled in the death of a youth, a few days before the election.','/t1BC6XuqEGAAH0AAWXko0LUle1A.jpg','2021-04-08',124,'Released',NULL,'Nayattu',753946,1.6277,7.47,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24687,_binary '\0','/5lDGto4oxjoWDt2bMFgT3rhJZ0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160524',6.8,6388,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO -ナルト- 疾風伝 絆','A mysterious group of ninjas makes a surprise attack on the Konohagakure, which takes great damage. The nightmare of another Shinobi World War could become a reality. Sasuke, who was still a missing nin from Konoha trying to kill his brother, Itachi, appears for the second time in front of Naruto at an unknown location to prevent it from happening.','/bBqEiQbbfyt4MWR3NhDZMbS4Wp8.jpg','2008-08-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: Bonds',17581,5.6758,7.313,'OkI3ZCEbx_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24688,_binary '\0','/b5NH2rjQFATYfkd1XYbGQWeyevx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160525',6.1,3545,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ダイヤモンド&パール ギラティナと氷空（そら）の花束 シェイミ','When Giratina is discovered to be able to create parallel dimensions, it\'s up to Ash and his friends to stop a mysterious stranger from using its powers for evil.','/e3T08IL68EVcrUPiJLVN9KSGlXs.jpg','2008-07-19',100,'Released','In a Reverse World, a Legendary battle rages on...','Pokémon: Giratina and the Sky Warrior',47292,4.5018,6.8,'7DliP7EX9To','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24689,_binary '\0','/A9N7iQqin4z7REObPKjoGRcjdCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160539',6.8,1668,'ja','花より男子F','Four years have passed since that emotional marriage proposal at Tsukushi Makino\'s high-school prom, and Tsukasa Dōmyōji announced his engagement to Tsukushi to the entire world. At an engagement dinner between their families, Dōmyōji\'s mother, who has been strongly against their relationship before, presents Tsukushi a tiara, which is estimated to be worth roughly 10 billion yen, as a token of their engagement. But that night, the tiara is stolen by somebody! Then, Dōmyōji and Tsukushi travel around the globe to Las Vegas, Hong Kong, and even a deserted island to get the tiara back—the legendary tiara that has been believed to \"bring eternal love.\" In the meantime, where and what are the \"F4\" fellows, who have just gone separate ways, doing now?','/lmZDPf57XO9a76D3W9t9P7RotcM.jpg','2008-06-28',131,'Released',NULL,'BOYS OVER FLOWERS the movie',32486,1.5412,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24690,_binary '\0','/hxDV5Kdl7sQvoB2JPKOTXUsX001.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160629',7.4,4525,'ja','容疑者Xの献身','A male corpse is discovered with a smashed face and burned hands. Strangely, the cause of death is determined to be strangulation. When Detective Kaoru Utsumi attempts to corroborate the victim’s ex-wife’s alibi she discovers the mysterious neighbor and only a few small clues to help her disprove a seemingly \"airtight\" alibi...','/kKV6Tj4BqrFyRV03rkwHNYIQJY0.jpg','2008-10-04',128,'Released',NULL,'Suspect X',42341,3.1366,7.6,'9ORCFn57kbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24691,_binary '\0','/jZ5E1XXHaayI32dDQ9UE2KhjdPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11608126',4,1275,'en','Heir of the Witch','An underprivileged seamstress, haunted by her past, seeks love and acceptance in high society but is faced with the curse from her evil roots.','/rgx6Zm3y2P31Iohd2noJO4uOFKl.jpg','2023-08-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Heir of the Witch',981006,1.2272,3.5,'GC34fDuvCuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24692,_binary '\0','/uFjqB95kxb3iAK1cohxNx8MbPzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1160996',5.3,49712,'en','The Colony','Forced underground by the next ice age, a struggling outpost of survivors must fight to preserve humanity against a threat even more savage than nature.','/t7d9Zk4ltloYgDCMj0qHIpQBAIs.jpg','2013-04-12',95,'Released','One day, it started to snow .. and it never stopped','The Colony',178809,6.3225,5.5,'kRfXdS2q08k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24693,_binary '\0','/hKcPqtUfcESNyJUBVqPEUmiPaEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1161064',3.2,1219,'en','Super Capers','Would-be superhero, Ed Gruberman, who possesses no super powers must join a team of misfit heroes-in-training known as The Super Capers. Having only faith, Gruberman must travel through time to uncover an evil plot involving some gold bullion, a fiery femme fatale, and a criminal mastermind with a dark secret about Ed\'s past.','/hH3luraymJhy8Fkpv7C5zNLwtr6.jpg','2009-03-20',98,'Released','Fighting evil has never been funnier!','Super Capers',20177,1.8015,3.3,'3Cikl8GlDik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24694,_binary '\0','/lRFAjHmx5foEU89AaTxj7Ppjvr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11610804',6.2,1579,'fr','Haute Couture','Esther is at the end of her career as Head Seamstress at Dior Avenue Montaigne workshop. One day, she gets her handbag stolen in the metro by a 20 years old girl, Jade. Instead of calling the police she decides to take care of Jade. She sees in her the opportunity to pass on her skills, the craft of dressmaking, her only wealth. In the frenetic world of Haute Couture, Esther will give Jade la beauté du geste, a way to reach beyond herself.','/srN0iA97EfjZReGlGyDNcDh8ZPs.jpg','2021-11-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Haute Couture',719463,4.5626,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24695,_binary '\0','/yBki0Lpj2Ogi23tJkQ6hEMn2nVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11611064',6.4,1489,'sv','Dag för dag','Five people embark on a motorhome road trip through Europe to fulfill an elderly man\'s last wish. \"Day by Day\" is a life-affirming comedy with a lot of humor and some seriousness. Friendships develop, love arises and life-changing decisions are made, a story that it is never too late to rethink in life.','/b8RxNWE6ZDck2icsznfGtwT6MJZ.jpg','2022-02-05',110,'Released','The roadtrip of a lifetime.','Day by Day',925856,0.8039,6.1,'qK-AfvkpMis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24696,_binary '\0','/6qJiYMpEvrdIIPu455BbVxfISXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11611486',6.6,1438,'fr','Les Intranquilles','Leila and Damien are deeply in love. Despite his bipolar disorder, he tries to pursue his life with her, knowing he may never be able to offer her what she desires.','/e2hoo5SZNL2Y8dOL6fnCy1f6Osb.jpg','2021-09-29',117,'Released',NULL,'The Restless',788942,3.0019,6.8,'Ss3hmF45yFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24697,_binary '\0','/8aDD9JsrkT44ZGR2VX02if0j1Nn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11612144',7.6,2420,'kn','Koli Taal','Excited about their grandson\'s visit, an elderly couple plan to cook chicken curry for dinner. But, things begin to fall apart when the chicken goes missing.','/cqt1btAbKvmj25rv4QEG8efVH1D.jpg','2021-10-30',92,'Released','Dinner Will Be Served!','Koli Taal',829477,1.1514,10,'VCLSttZ1Adc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24698,_binary '\0','/gMvZ49FHjTaqyGlTLsVyKTkPxXK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11612890',3.9,3030,'en','Night Night','After waking up from a horrific car accident, April must find a way to work through her trauma and a will to survive a recovery from hell.','/s21fiJT7C2IjKN0xICtrWmvlEM4.jpg','2021-11-16',92,'Released',NULL,'Night Night',889753,1.5587,5.3,'ufo0QyegfPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24699,_binary '\0','/zIER3rK5eWn2B4cYgUfAgDu3YMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11613184',2.6,1296,'kn','ಮೌನಂ','When a person is alone, there are many emotions that start running off in his mind. This film is a psychological thriller that captures these emotions of a different kind. When a person is silent, the mind is making a lot of sound.','/v3KYipBzfiNIFG5P2EH9pBloYI4.jpg','2020-02-21',147,'Released',NULL,'Mounam',708113,0.8115,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24700,_binary '\0','/zjcTCvpyrWb38tdHF8N91GMd10q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1161404',4.4,2589,'en','Blood Night: The Legend of Mary Hatchet','Local teens have long commemorated the death of \'Mary Hatchet\' - a girl who took an ax and killed her family in the 1970s - with the aptly named Blood Night. But things never got truly bloody until Mary\'s ghost decided to make an appearance. Dead bodies are piling up, and Mary seems to be calling the shots. But there are secrets about her past that have yet to be uncovered.','/1ChjBLtmxPZZ77eVCZ5pxLN7ZkN.jpg','2009-10-10',83,'Released','Will you make it through the night?','Blood Night: The Legend of Mary Hatchet',47194,2.1769,4.5,'jDDUjEdNDx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24701,_binary '\0','/ypEJQtPUsqb4oD4Z3qpbDfwekup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1161418',6.2,14689,'en','Gentlemen Broncos','A teenager attends a fantasy writers\' convention where he discovers his idea has been stolen by an established novelist.','/eRnUC60trqoRZuAtM8M3gOFT6ED.jpg','2009-09-30',89,'Released','Oinus, Ainous, Anous, Odious.','Gentlemen Broncos',22820,2.9285,5.7,'qdpFpfIBkXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24702,_binary '\0','/uEux5EvCGNzul5PPQ0L3SQ7CDLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1161443',6.1,2294,'es','Pagafantas','Bilbao, Spain. After breaking up with Elisa, his girlfriend for several years, Txema meets Claudia, a gorgeous Argentinian girl, in a very awkward situation. They become friends so soon and so easily that Txema misinterprets Claudia\'s feelings for him.','/6ZmQLbzOkrNfcnqUhmqKWeyDps0.jpg','2009-07-03',80,'Released','All girls want him… as a friend','Friend Zone',20071,1.0871,5.4,'mli1_K0JvTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24703,_binary '\0','/dvy5CN6NlEvvHhFbNFLGwVlCzLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11614912',5,7982,'en','She Dies Tomorrow','Amy is ravaged by the notion that she is going to die tomorrow, which sends her down a dizzying emotional spiral. When her skeptical friend Jane discovers Amy’s feeling of imminent death to be contagious, they both begin bizarre journeys through what might be the last day of their lives.','/ogTna9bUzldTV5l2nyuyJV4tbCH.jpg','2020-07-31',85,'Released','Your deepest fear is spreading.','She Dies Tomorrow',664297,3.3689,5.1,'hcMFjCPkP3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24704,_binary '\0','/7fWnVNoG1GIkk9V6LHCI3UCGgXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11615038',7,2067,'en','After Truth: Disinformation and the Cost of Fake News','An investigation into the ongoing threat caused by the phenomenon of “fake news” in the U.S., focusing on the real-life consequences that disinformation, conspiracy theories and false news stories have on the average citizen.','/e0O1IMV3DtLiXtw9m8wLsazfyA9.jpg','2020-03-19',95,'Released','Enrage. Suppress. Divide.','After Truth: Disinformation and the Cost of Fake News',680438,1.493,6.6,'GLi7cNAJKA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24705,_binary '\0','/lv