nal wish it was to meet the studios stars - The Tiny Terrors.','/1hd6zLMDvs5hLTTcaTIYanNmauy.jpg','2008-07-04',72,'Released',NULL,'Gingerdead Man 2: The Passion of the Crust',16846,2.187,4.5,'RSmzPGi3hdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24709,_binary '\0','/laoolYvTVis3Ld5tVm8ACdBgdG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11617052',6.6,10788,'de','Undine','Undine is a historian and tour guide at the Berlin City Museum specializing in urban development, while Christoph is an industrial diver. Linked by a love of the water, the two form an intense bond, which can only do so much to help Undine overcome the considerable baggage of her former affair.','/7PeaXj2EKef84zEZazxiGL8bXRH.jpg','2020-07-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Undine',615761,3.5027,6.456,'77guSAUb6qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24710,_binary '\0','/bcJhfQanCg6eCZuF95Vu6foeJin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11617476',6.7,1283,'en','Riddled with Deceit: A Martha\'s Vineyard Mystery','Former detective Jeff Jackson teams up with Dr. Zee Madieras to track down their friend\'s missing emerald brooch, a thief, and also... a murderer.','/p6XxEalyrxAaXEWrBP7ZUxq9sbS.jpg','2020-02-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Riddled with Deceit: A Martha\'s Vineyard Mystery',661329,2.3984,7.4,'h57FWyTwKFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24711,_binary '\0','/qa7qLyWllw8l3bq4XmTLIYXlTay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11618350',3.3,1220,'en','Nemesis','An underworld kingpin\'s past catches up with him when he returns to London, igniting an explosive chain of events which ends in revenge and murder.','/aYZqOjtouDag7EGjRigdr3YEoKC.jpg','2021-03-29',97,'Released','Betrayal. Lust. Revenge.','Nemesis',794461,1.0694,3.8,'lI-xPIPWPxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24712,_binary '\0','/4KajfHWJ190Qm6J1NR2qxFNntPb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11618536',6.9,7993,'en','Shithouse','Lonely college freshman Alex has closed himself off from his peers, who all appear to have this whole \"college thing\" figured out. But everything changes one night when Alex takes a leap and attends a party at Shithouse - a legendary party fraternity - where he forges a strong connection with Maggie.','/lyOajZgP8Iy3JdVgvaiBv9K5OMH.jpg','2020-10-16',102,'Released','College stinks.','Shithouse',637053,2.0392,6.882,'PkA7m1DbeH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24713,_binary '\0','/qJxSCLGqkSdlvDBIbPqCnCnvV70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1161864',6,108002,'en','The Rite','Seminary student Michael Kovak reluctantly attends exorcism school at the Vatican. While he’s in Rome, Michael meets an unorthodox priest who introduces him to the darker side of his faith, uncovering the devil’s reach even to one of the holiest places on Earth.','/gRTxM95huMwIDfZBJWjuifMTfpx.jpg','2011-01-28',114,'Released','You can only defeat it when you believe.','The Rite',48171,8.0799,6.119,'nPtuzw1PXgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24714,_binary '\0','/vENyxfv7Zh8gXWjaWpAYuCHfsGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11622272',6.9,2123,'sv','Spring Uje spring','Uje, a pop star in the 1990s, gets diagnosed with Parkinson\'s. This is a film about his everyday struggles.','/nG0tDOxYANVERJV11tUyAEV5227.jpg','2020-12-18',78,'Released',NULL,'Run Uje Run',662977,1.0726,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24715,_binary '\0','/1koDX96vRbXbhV4mlCdpRLpRzi2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11623722',6.5,1283,'el','Πράσινη Θάλασσα','Anna has lost her memory but she hasn’t forgotten how to cook. One night she shows up in a working-class neighborhood. There she meets Roula and gets a job as a cook and a place to stay at his shabby seaside tavern. In the kitchen, amidst the scents of spices and old forgotten recipes, Anna struggles to rebuild her past. Her simple but delicious food awakens memories for the regulars who in turn help her to reconnect with herself. The story takes an unexpected turn when Roula suddenly stumbles upon the Green Sea and discovers Anna’s true identity.','/7TtFZ3QY5T59NB4HzxXIBfAwwr5.jpg','2021-11-25',94,'Released',NULL,'Green Sea',757796,1.1324,6.4,'xbz4sZrspIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24716,_binary '\0','/d8GnSzK7hE4mmcv3A2UxQrYxYkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11625100',7.4,1833,'pt','A Metamorfose dos Pássaros','Filmmaker Catarina Vasconcelos sifts through the memories of her ancestors. Her naval officer grandfather, Henrique, who married her grandmother, Beatriz, on her 21st birthday, spent extended periods at sea, leaving her with six children. This is the beginning of a generational saga.','/qsXOh2SG9yMb8i5zwCBVqByYJPg.jpg','2021-07-30',101,'Released',NULL,'The Metamorphosis of Birds',664576,1.5223,6.7,'b38OJa3qNFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24717,_binary '\0','/6b0qE39yTt8xGa20z9zjekgRbmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11626108',3.8,1652,'en','Immanence','Radio astronomers discover a mysterious signal in the deep sea that could be contact with extraterrestrials. After several terrifying manifestations threaten their beliefs, the team must fight to survive the ultimate evil.','/6LSDQPjtDpkMLfGzzYhKAjrNn9V.jpg','2022-02-04',93,'Released','The search for God is an open door for the Devil.','Immanence',852696,1.8708,4.5,'BbzwLMIgcNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24718,_binary '\0','/nJYAAOk74VjPlwz34jWFh8MPw2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11628854',5.8,25740,'en','Silent Night','Nell, Simon, and their boy Art are ready to welcome friends and family for what promises to be a perfect Christmas gathering. Perfect except for one thing: everyone is going to die.','/bfUO1SBTfgcK77em3lOuRFY2uLc.jpg','2021-12-03',92,'Released','Surviving Christmas just got a little harder.','Silent Night',664574,7.0826,5.9,'u1dOECVgqIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24719,_binary '\0','/zbCHHKDap6HoALl0evOTaxwRvQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11636880