 never stop until they are all dead.','/nTpCXudkD7CFKmysgB4fIW4b9b5.jpg','2021-10-08',84,'Released','They destroyed his life. Now they\'ll fear his fury.','Vengeance Is Mine',876684,1.9139,4.9,'XlBMThLDt48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24727,_binary '\0','/oASzl9kWKPZLUFrTRBZMR5UCWin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11651550',8,6057,'ml','ഓപ്പറേഷൻ ജാവ','B. Tech graduates Antony and Vinay Dasan are talented, but unemployed. That changes, however, when they approach the cyber cell with a new perspective to a film piracy case.','/ku1gEhoJgFV2vWe2hBENqSKmLna.jpg','2021-02-12',146,'Released',NULL,'Operation Java',792750,1.7754,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24728,_binary '\0','/6jCOU7gnjS1z8izCwRrdHn0CXwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11651780',5.7,6041,'hi','चोक्ड: पैसा बोलता है','A bank employee weighed down by her jobless husband\'s debts - and her own broken dreams - finds a secret source of seemingly unlimited cash in her home.','/1jqDl2cuBlOBfrbjEIJhqwQVZnR.jpg','2020-06-05',114,'Released',NULL,'Choked: Paisa Bolta Hai',706783,1.5282,6.423,'KY3D-htXKFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24729,_binary '\0','/qM9xmkvCpQvOHgikuKE6ik3TXjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11651796',6.9,15986,'hi','AK vs AK','After a public spat with a movie star, a disgraced director retaliates by kidnapping the actor\'s daughter, filming the search for her in real-time.','/4ULEEvH0hDYnbWN3nClrb88sYCF.jpg','2020-12-24',108,'Released',NULL,'AK vs AK',735919,1.5678,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24730,_binary '\0','/kyOJHvdwquOqgytBfL3qWC7Q0pt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1165253',6.5,4192,'ko','비몽','In the aftermath of a car crash, a man discovers his dreams are tied to a stranger\'s sleepwalking.','/fwGaqe9YWSHSQZf7VdMw6EuHjhO.jpg','2008-10-09',95,'Released','A dream is a dream is a dream.','Dream',8652,1.1308,6.595,'ZNJ_GIzd2LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24731,_bin