12kgvK6ubQVxAQ3fLrP6te.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11656220',4.6,12940,'en','Midnight in the Switchgrass','FBI Agent Karl Helter and his partner Rebecca Lombardo are very close to busting a sex-trafficking ring. When they realize their investigation has crossed the path of a brutal serial killer, they team up with a FDLE agent to put an end to the infamous \'Truck Stop Killer\'.','/1OTSuh2HNcTRfme8caU8DjgJ39K.jpg','2021-07-23',99,'Released','Can they stop a serial killer who can\'t stop himself?','Midnight in the Switchgrass',693113,5.6213,5.78,'1pNN66fRumw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24736,_binary '\0','/x3JeJcqwl90v8qa6hfDHOEuOo8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11656548',6.8,3747,'ja','MOTHER マザー','Shuhei is leading a tough life. His alcoholic mother Akiko can only hook up with bad guys and order Shuhei to go get money from his disapproving grandparents instead of going to school. Except raising the little half-sister, his rock-bottom life seems to have no end.','/dpjTywNoMJ4VpQb9a7VYQ7Jqdkn.jpg','2020-07-03',127,'Released','She was the world to him.','MOTHER',698860,3.3113,6.942,'SLqygrwnF9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24737,_binary '\0','/aRdbCuyAaGHHmz87OsMiaazH7L5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11656836',6.9,2306,'en','Just My Type','Pop culture writer and aspiring novelist Vanessa Sills lands the interview of a lifetime with the illustrious, elusive and reclusive mystery author Martin Clayborne in his quaint rural town only to realize her own aspirations, dreams and romantic life have taken a back seat along the way. When Vanessa returns home to Portland and a mysterious gift arrives from Martin, she then makes a surprise decision, and finally takes her own advice to “go boldly in the direction of your dreams and live the life you imagine.”','/93cw0Sin2TxjOColXn0YeuFeaGQ.jpg','2020-03-28',84,'Released',NULL,'Just My Type',676619,1.596,6.8,'VympX86OpWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24738,_binary '\0','/orGlr1vHTgbDkGJPwuBjd8ncVjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11657662',7.2,55645,'en','The Witcher: Nightmare of the Wolf','Escaping from poverty to become a witcher, Vesemir slays monsters for coin and glory, but when a new menace rises, he must face the demons of his past.','/3sLz2yv6vBDWqBbd8rdnNeoJ2kJ.jpg','2021-08-22',83,'Released','Face your demons.','The Witcher: Nightmare of the Wolf',666243,8.4553,7.421,'J365hQpaWRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24739,_binary '\0','/gGSm6ZmWtGazs2H1m0gOp7cx1ZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11658120',5.8,5678,'es','Xtremo','Two years after the murder of his son and father, a retired hitman sets in motion a carefully crafted revenge plan against the killer: his own brother.','/cwUhVcDeMYYeu8fq5q1OPOoSbZ7.jpg','2021-06-04',111,'Released','Running away is not an option. Revenge is his only plan.','Xtreme',726429,3.778,6.337,'X2O1OW6i820','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24740,_binary '\0','/eOU2Z5g0RKYav9el6bCAaOPjiuF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1166085',7.2,7292,'en','120','During the Sarikamis Battle, the Ottoman army runs out of ammunition and appeals to the people of Van for help, who happen to have supplies. However, the First World War is on and all men are fighting at four corners of the empire and therefore can not respond to to the appeal. The young children of Van want to do something...','/qfuusVNYVYyKQcmr0LGS7zsAUxT.jpg','2008-02-15',114,'Released',NULL,'120',10821,0.9661,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24741,_binary '\0','/rwywuA4irKO1zoMLBhJJaiUHv3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1166100',7.4,72835,'hi','गजनी','A man suffering from anterograde amnesia as a result of a violent attack in the past sets out to avenge his girlfriend\'s death with the aid of photographs, notes and tattoos all over his body.','/cPLzHxPFRjzNvoyncdtDGBAxjp.jpg','2008-12-25',186,'Released','Remember Dec 25','Ghajini',14070,3.5796,7,'jEccwrX6AgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24742,_binary '\0','/a0GywD3uJesvWDCEZ5pAPZ4prBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11662610',6.8,1986,'en','Matching Hearts','As Valentine\'s Day nears, a matchmaker is tasked by her mentor to find a match for an entrepreneur who believes staying single is the key to success.','/zvQGosiD0rF7bWaI5W39O8s3n5U.jpg','2020-02-08',80,'Released',NULL,'Matching Hearts',661332,2.0052,6.5,'_InGRGtiX7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24743,_binary '\0','/ownDZBS9ecoPbWjW5V5L8jknGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11663228',7.2,46853,'ta','ஜெயிலர்','Muthuvel Pandian, a retired, stern yet compassionate jailer lives a peaceful life with his family, but trouble knocks his door when his cop son’s tryst with an antique mafia gang goes awry and forces Muthu to step back into a dark world he had voluntarily took a break from.','/pTmMxAHqX4vsIDE6HPPxOR0Q6TN.jpg','2023-08-10',165,'Released',NULL,'Jailer',937020,3.6499,6.5,'xenOE1Tma0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24744,_binary '\0','/jmNW6WeZNrsnUa7BluSfXvyDTZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11667452',7.2,1668,'pt','Não Vai Ter Golpe!','\"People on the street will not end in anything.\" How many times have you heard this phrase? Even so, at each protest, you took to the streets, invited people, mobilized. Why? What was the strange stubbornness that made you strive without the slightest idea if it would work? This is the story we want to tell. Not only MBL\'s history, but yours. You saw, lived and won. And now you can remember how it all started…','/uYGkR0qORAPcWfKWx70Y2UFJLLi.jpg','2019-09-02',134,'Released',NULL,'Não Vai Ter Golpe!',618431,0.9357,7.1,'eM-gP3O0fok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24745,_binary '\0','/v0CBdiZ5riqcJjvaR8oEE4Zxi2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1166810',6.5,3157,'es','Gordos','Due to many reasons, ranging from insecurity to trauma, a group of people have gained a lot of weight in recent times.','/50PWvVJXnuZaOCthrdml01KPao.jpg','2009-09-11',110,'Released','...we all have one inside.','Fat People',28478,1.6641,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24746,_binary '\0','/7zpSLhe3CBzMXEjtRxPwA4qLShd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11668320',6.9,3013,'en','Crazy, Not Insane','Fascinated by the human brain and its capacity for ruthlessness, psychiatrist Dr. Dorothy Otnow Lewis has spent her life investigating the interior lives of violent people. With each case, she came closer to developing a unified field theory of what makes a killer. Along the way - steering away from the conventional wisdom of her colleagues - she explored the world of multiple personality disorder.','/5NCSkyVXVpMOUc6u8yhyXo107Qu.jpg','2020-03-18',117,'Released','Murderers are made, not born.','Crazy, Not Insane',682589,2.4688,7.2,'FVrOVlS5TMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24747,_binary '\0','/1ME6w8CpfKRW7i03rnaurxA1Y5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11668530',4.7,1472,'zh','狂蟒之灾','A struggling circus crew gets deceived by its former partner, as it embarks on a tour in Thailand. During the journey through a Southeast Asian rainforest, they encounter attacks by a giant python. They meet a mysterious man named Jeff who offers to help, but they soon realize he\'s a poacher. As they search for Jeff\'s boat, they face life-and-death struggles with the python and Jeff himself.','/pPfsEXzfk2URkQ1OxhUShAXdxMr.jpg','2024-03-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Anaconda',1252428,4.6538,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24748,_binary '\0','/cw1BkYi8bP62hTw5HoEngVZfTTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11671006',5.9,67978,'en','The Man from Toronto','A case of mistaken identity forces a bumbling entrepreneur to team up with a notorious assassin known as The Man from Toronto in hopes of staying alive.','/uTCfTibqtk4f90cC59bLPMOmsfc.jpg','2022-12-23',113,'Released','Hitman meets dead man.','The Man from Toronto',667739,10.1534,6.412,'urqy8DrcGBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24749,_binary '\0','/sPgQg5DK8GL6uCcUw9s8PuE2Y80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11674072',7.6,1609,'pt','Turma da Mônica: Lições','In the sequel to Turma da Mônica: Laços, we follow Mônica, Jimmy Five, Maggy and Smudge dealing with the consequences of a mistake made at school. At the same time, they face transformations from childhood to adolescence and are about to discover the value of friendship.','/gzaLnQ2CctXaHqatSlRbSVp8Bh4.jpg','2021-12-30',97,'Released','It\'s possible to grow up without having to stop being a child.','Monica and Friends: Lessons',662745,1.8198,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24750,_binary '\0','/wy92wLmcjfEy6Gp3v0Q30gxNWrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11674730',6.9,26317,'en','The Last Stop in Yuma County','While awaiting the next fuel truck at a middle-of-nowhere Arizona rest stop, a traveling young knife salesman is thrust into a high-stakes hostage situation by the arrival of two similarly stranded bank robbers with no qualms about using cruelty—or cold, hard steel—to protect their bloodstained, ill-gotten fortune.','/u6ae2MMh8PpSamO3cIttLM5B18v.jpg','2024-05-10',90,'Released','Never bring a knife salesman to a gunfight.','The Last Stop in Yuma County',1047020,6.5907,6.915,'-ZrZWuLBh54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24751,_binary '\0','/sturDKNlcLCRBeX6qjogvvlkiF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1167599',5.6,3830,'de','Wickie und die starken Männer','One morning our little Viking village of Flake is raided by frightening looking spooky demons who kidnap all the children… except for Wickie, who was stuck in a tree trying to use a kite to learn to fly.','/hmqR1ic1VSxhETjObl1EhGW0AJb.jpg','2009-09-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Wickie the Mighty Viking',22355,2.9933,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24752,_binary '\0','/dwzjaCNn4qzAY0Fu0AdqxhovSWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1167611',7.1,5821,'it','Non essere cattivo','A story set in the 90s and in the outskirts of Rome to Ostia. A world where money, luxury cars, night clubs, cocaine and synthetic drugs are easy to run. A world in which Vittorio and Cesare, in their early twenties, act in search of their success.','/taSfNqBkM6fVexayWLKcqHxMg7a.jpg','2015-09-08',102,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Be Bad',359156,1.8437,7.8,'8WxlD7Wm2hE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24753,_binary '\0','/ulv4h7NglaqDl68RZKnpvOPqT2t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1167638',6.6,38319,'fr','L\'Immortel','A retired mobster goes on a revenge spree after being left for dead with 22 bullets in his body by his former childhood friend.','/4spRV4Qw0YGaWBHYJ6enu84sR81.jpg','2010-03-23',117,'Released','The revenge of the Professional.','22 Bullets',37645,7.0401,6.7,'P0SzfMNmqxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24754,_binary '\0','/t1LMwZqFXjoa7KM4QWGZxmUYD4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1167660',6.8,18120,'fr','OSS 117 : Rio ne répond plus','In 1967, OSS 117 is sent to Brazil in order to retrieve a microfilm list of French Nazi sympathizers, only to once again unknowingly set foot into a bigger international intrigue.','/rhv06T3gTFOShIVkQ0UipZFIyDw.jpg','2009-04-15',100,'Released',NULL,'OSS 117: Lost in Rio',15588,4.2543,7.1,'T8qeDWjAypo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24755,_binary '\0','/zS48AK8SQmQ1zG4h5wm6wSxK22O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1167675',5.6,10289,'nl','Sint','A horror film that depicts St. Nicholas as a murderous bishop who kidnaps and murders children when there is a full moon on December 5.','/pEPd4mgMwvz6aRhuWkmPUv98P1O.jpg','2010-10-31',85,'Released','December 5 will never be the same...','Saint',45756,2.154,4.926,'QK55nao-vvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24756,_binary '\0','/wiPwqz6HsDzQQ8T7EYNvlHHO5zA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11680472',4.9,1294,'pa','Posti','Stray, poor, idle, addicted common people can be found easily around us. The politicians and system treat them as puppets. Such people are not considered as human beings. Most of their questions can\'t be solved but they themselves are a big question for society. These \"unimportant\" people either get trapped or become revolutionary for the society. Revolutionary people serve as the flag of humanity, the colors of which cause irritation in other\'s eyes. Posti is the story of the irritation caused by these revolutionary colors. Why it happened in the past, happening now and how long will it continue?','/4tEQ29JjaSJk3rLcabMOIeYVEmi.jpg','2022-06-17',126,'Released',NULL,'Posti',988623,0.8063,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24757,_binary '\0','/kfb5LjuuvMz0xmhMXE9EnUU2Y4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11681056',5.9,1510,'hu','Természetes fény','World War II, occupied Soviet Union. István Semetka is a simple Hungarian farmer who serves as a Sub-Lieutenant in a special unit scouting for partisan groups. On their way to a remote village, his company falls under enemy fire. As the commander is killed, Semetka has to overcome his fears and take command of the unit as he is dragged into a chaos that he cannot control.','/yws7TVzBWNK6zvrfRuD2TFFCFwU.jpg','2021-09-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Natural Light',669661,2.9947,5.595,'IpiAgvmSn6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24758,_binary '\0','/9hT855BbX7yypRbxb8yPrQQ5CcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11681250',6.1,15085,'en','Godmothered','A young and unskilled fairy godmother that ventures out on her own to prove her worth by tracking down a young girl whose request for help was ignored. What she discovers is that the girl has now become a grown woman in need of something very different than a \"prince charming.\"','/80tDCErk6ymHS7YfvqJcbnnTtqa.jpg','2020-12-04',110,'Released','Be careful who you wish for.','Godmothered',662546,5.1155,6.7,'KYWzEqX-J-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24759,_binary '\0','/oS6w2tQBaWeEZlmREbMHqxnHm8y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11681282',6.7,5251,'fr','Le Bal des folles','A woman who is unfairly institutionalized at a Paris asylum plots to escape with the help of one of its nurses. Based on the novel \'Le bal des folles\' by Victoria Mas.','/A8KeSPmFDxqHKwNzyiuwUvPIrw0.jpg','2021-09-12',122,'Released',NULL,'The Mad Women\'s Ball',680531,4.8634,7.051,'YW-69FfY7z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24760,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11682998',5.7,1359,'en','Jill-Michele Meleán: White / Latina','Jill-Michele Melean has finally filmed her one-hour standup special. From Miami to L.A. She\'s half Bolivian, half Irish but raised in Miami so Cuban by association. Not white enough to play the Stepford wife or Latin enough to play the gangsta but relatable to all ethnicities. From impressions, to family to dating, this special has her last 15 years of hilarious stories.','/1lY1Cb7gQh4rHjBOD243fwApSyG.jpg','2019-03-26',62,'Released',NULL,'Jill-Michele Meleán: White / Latina',596149,1.1062,0,'XHtBnkdqW6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24761,_binary '\0','/69i5e6aDJUTZhAe9xSJORzqWxbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11685322',7,1496,'en','Sweet Thing','For Billie and Nico, life with their father is a roller-coaster ride of playfulness and unease. When he is in the grip of alcohol, tears flow and their apparently idyllic family life collapses. Their mostly absent and irresponsible mother is not much help either. But their friendship with Malik, a boy of Billie’s age, frees them from their shackles. Together they embark on a journey full of intense moments of freedom. The colourful, emotional world of the three young people is depicted in kaleidoscopic black and white imagery, which opens space for their own notions of childhood. Alexandre Rockwell\'s tale portrays a profound sense of solidarity and deep love: for cinema and Billie Holiday, and also for risk and adventure.','/jxBeb2FXPOCuOJo8APu8hfUTCnu.jpg','2020-10-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Thing',626882,1.6682,6.7,'TKcLhide_7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24762,_binary '\0','/6FwucgqYlKoJV6YToK4VOH8nj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11686326',6.9,1349,'en','Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: Heist and Seek','When a priceless crown is stolen during a benefit gala held by the Lawrenceton library, Aurora and the Real Murders Club must investigate who would kill to get their hands on it.','/s0Jh029ZNtTmjEG8X4DUblFN8nl.jpg','2020-05-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Aurora Teagarden Mysteries: Heist and Seek',681638,2.4861,7.4,'arOhF3TZxlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24763,_binary '\0','/j6JwDJwkYkWvD66B1E9hx06zWGx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11686346',7.3,1416,'en','Mystery 101: An Education in Murder','A young writer\'s research prompts the police to revisit a famous murder case that convicted Amy\'s colleague at Elmstead, so Travis & Amy get a second chance at clearing the professor\'s name.','/xy3GWpfmiHjKR5DS49HT4G7GEC9.jpg','2020-03-29',83,'Released',NULL,'Mystery 101: An Education in Murder',676621,2.1235,7.1,'cVCTzX7BGWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24764,_binary '\0','/53rX6LU5sTZQnQCpreqauMUFeii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11686354',7,1231,'en','Crossword Mysteries: Riddle Me Dead','Tess gets invited to be a part of a popular game show, but when the host is unexpectedly murdered, she and Detective Logan O\'Connor seek to uncover who was behind it all.','/7AC6r7wgq8gToysiVSZYlRnB4Rs.jpg','2021-04-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Crossword Mysteries: Riddle Me Dead',784410,2.5161,7.4,'CnyxAgiERYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24765,_binary '\0','/hzPcEqyxZauvKZmUT2aJxntWPVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11686490',5.3,20074,'en','The Deep House','While diving in a remote French lake, a couple of YouTubers who specialise in underwater exploration videos discover a house submerged in the deep waters. What was initially a unique finding soon turns into a nightmare when they discover that the house was the scene of atrocious crimes. Trapped, with their oxygen reserves falling dangerously, they realise the worst is yet to come: they are not alone in the house.','/5xhAPxRr64oQPEFnUOrttuI4ZEU.jpg','2021-06-30',85,'Released','Breathe while you still can.','The Deep House',672582,5.5281,6,'hgqjv1endGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24766,_binary '\0','/8xTvH93bQl0AxMMeVkrlao2bMui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11687002',6.9,23352,'en','The Outrun','Fresh out of rehab, Rona returns to the Orkney Islands—a place both wild and beautiful, right off the Scottish coast. Now 29 and after more than a decade of living life on the edge in London, where she both found and lost love, Rona attempts to come to terms with her troubled past. As she reconnects with the dramatic landscape where she grew up, memories of her traumatic childhood merge with more recent challenging events that have set her on the path to recovery.','/zfRR2CkbvYrLuOPQFm8vBaENyMy.jpg','2024-01-19',118,'Released','You can\'t outrun your fate','The Outrun',785542,10.8683,6.763,'YgzzDQ3OpOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24767,_binary '\0','/cSjccCESfkHq2AltVkY3WRYXqdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11687104',5.6,15129,'en','Alice, Darling','Pushed to the breaking point by Simon, her psychologically abusive boyfriend, Alice becomes an unwitting participant in an intervention staged by her two closest friends while on vacation. As she rediscovers the essence of herself and gains some much-needed perspective, she slowly starts to fray the cords of codependency that bind her. However, Simon\'s vengeance is as inevitable as it is shattering, and once unleashed, it tests her strength, her courage, and the bonds of deep-rooted friendships.','/3QpO7dxLXBdPgWpNLKvRNojz7bv.jpg','2022-12-30',90,'Released','Sometimes the hardest thing to see is the truth.','Alice, Darling',850028,5.4245,5.6,'2D2ZRfqKUD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24768,_binary '\0','/2cDxY1Mz8Sj7rxfiMsIsdjTGw54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11691722',7.5,1248,'de','SCHW31NS7EIGER: Memories - Von Anfang bis Legende','Schweinsteiger\'s glittering career, which peaked with lifting the World Cup in 2014.','/1fjpHduILKlov1LAN8LemvNPe07.jpg','2020-06-05',112,'Released',NULL,'SCHW31NS7EIGER: Memories - Von Anfang bis Legende',700785,1.4361,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24769,_binary '\0','/2HXZnAYHY52WhoaDl8ugBqCjMJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11692148',6.8,1358,'ar','غزة مُونامور','In Gaza, 60-year-old fisherman Issa has been secretly in love with Siham, a widow who works at the market. One day, the discovery of an ancient phallic statue of Apollo in his fishing net changes his life. With newfound confidence, he decides to approach Siham but problems arise when authorities become involved with this mysterious and potent treasure.','/slznW1Vgp3kS3g6VfaV5OZG4Lpg.jpg','2021-06-04',87,'Released',NULL,'Gaza Mon Amour',725561,1.8566,6.3,'siBNQPhaiE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24770,_binary '\0','/tIQANPdcejimp4F7yAXauMcMNHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1169270',5.9,1930,'te','డాన్','Suri and Raghava, mafia kingpins of Andhra Pradesh, are benevolent gangsters who ensure the safety of their people. However, a bigger don, Feroz, enters their lives and challenges their authority.','/muDvHnqcS0R6gxWnw8IqfKMlmPG.jpg','2007-12-20',145,'Released',NULL,'Don',66107,1.1092,5.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24771,_binary '\0','/d9lrBo21k0rut8Jws13qXHBvXrn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11692986',5.6,1702,'pl','Jak zostać gwiazdą','Talent and passion for music can take one to the very top. On the way, however, there are going to be showbiz traps.','/umvhAr6eqwC10WcGG6RPSSJm9GA.jpg','2020-10-02',118,'Released',NULL,'Fierce',768503,1.4796,6.2,NULL,NULL,NUL