2nq7oEFi0JY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24786,_binary '\0','/sdgAVpyAFYKYUM0v14Lki5OOYzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11701774',4.9,3126,'en','Lucky','May, a self help author with all the answers, suddenly finds herself stalked by a masked man who mysteriously reappears every night. Even when she kills him. May struggles to get help from the people around her as she fights to stay alive. Is this paranoia, or is she doomed to accept her new reality?','/4cOWAuejsbqbzQ1AVb46mtglHOR.jpg','2020-03-16',83,'Released',NULL,'Lucky',670426,1.8295,5.4,'Jqt5AwfSnzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24787,_binary '\0','/hk4PwhKhT7q7jp1lvA8aiYqDluy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11703050',6.8,26391,'en','The House','Across different eras, a poor family, an anxious developer and a fed-up landlady become tied to the same mysterious house in this animated dark comedy.','/xhE1EYcD6U7m5R8AT7yf29CCxia.jpg','2022-01-14',97,'Released','Three visionary tales. One unforgettable place.','The House',926899,5.3969,7,'wqbZlAEUb5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24788,_binary '\0','/iHSE8lEkPFHHPqaCv6Eh2aUfe6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11703244',6,27802,'en','The Blackening','Seven black friends go away for the weekend, only to find themselves trapped in a cabin with a killer who has a vendetta. They must pit their street smarts and knowledge of horror movies against the murderer to stay alive.','/n2aS9FE0C3VUHtSb3Ak41aU9K3y.jpg','2023-06-15',97,'Released','We can\'t all die first.','The Blackening',1008392,3.9547,5.8,'ImM2EkqSFfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24789,_binary '\0','/vmw9pDOVL160k394FDWz12NdwRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170350',4.2,1771,'en','Crush','Julian is perfectly happy in his relationship with the pretty blond Clare. That is, until he meets Anna, a dark-haired, bikini-clad beauty who he encounters while he is house-sitting. Passion reigns in their relationship, and soon Julian learns that Anna is more dangerous than he ever would have thought.','/gT8g35uxLV5fZCuFzOlYKi6qeYr.jpg','2009-04-01',82,'Released','Attraction can be fatal.','Crush',24091,1.1483,3.7,'fvHOo9qiVew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24790,_binary '\0','/5ZYxL6k4ZHrEmrFvmY4HZVzerxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170358',7.8,761565,'en','The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug','The Dwarves, Bilbo and Gandalf have successfully escaped the Misty Mountains, and Bilbo has gained the One Ring. They all continue their journey to get their gold back from the Dragon, Smaug.','/xQYiXsheRCDBA39DOrmaw1aSpbk.jpg','2013-12-11',161,'Released','Beyond darkness... beyond desolation... lies the greatest danger of all.','The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug',57158,28.2895,7.578,'Os1G8RtqY2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24791,_binary '\0','/nBHKT3pm5DmidZd5VS4bD5Hc2S3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11703710',7.4,39413,'en','Downton Abbey: A New Era','The Crawley family goes on a grand journey to the south of France to uncover the mystery of the dowager countess\'s newly inherited villa. Meanwhile, a Hollywood director seeks to film his latest production at Downton.','/r5n4CLoIjUcnT3shWDi6MHdJ25a.jpg','2022-04-27',124,'Released','A cinematic return.','Downton Abbey: A New Era',820446,7.5533,7.2,'GLKTPdIrjuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24792,_binary '\0','/wHt1D1utCc0VT2K9reBB1nWwAPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170391',5.2,1792,'en','Beautiful','After another teenager disappears from the idyllic suburb of Sunshine Hills, Suzy, the girl-next-door of every boy\'s dreams, persuades Daniel, a fourteen-year-old with an obsessive crush, to help her uncover the truth.','/ngMcCfLiFFMcr9T8NFhXXJrpzRD.jpg','2009-08-28',97,'Released','Get me some secrets','Beautiful',21033,1.2351,4.8,'HcjRXI4FELE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24793,_binary '\0','/s3aj728BSHfxRiyUpMQHiieFUXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170393',6.9,4971,'fa','دایره زنگی','Mohammad is sent to an apartment situated in uptown Tehran to install their satellite dishes, while having satellite TV is illegal in Iran. He arrives there with a girl named Shirin who seems to be his girlfriend and is in need of some money to repair her father\'s car with which she has had an accident the day before. Each of the house\'s residents have their own fish to fry and they also want their satellites installed as soon as possible.','/a6Tz8rCEO0oikQ0pOd4FKK2hzNK.jpg','2008-03-19',111,'Released',NULL,'Tambourine',230647,1.0878,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24794,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170399',5.5,1550,'hi','सी कम्पनी','Akshay Kumar is a crime reporter, Mr. Joshi is a retired accountant trying to deal with his ungrateful son and Lambodar are friends. These three share their respective plight with one another and find solace in each others company. On one occasion, they play a harmless prank to tackle their problems. One thing leads to another, and before they realize, the incident becomes news. But things don’t stop there. They put their new founded fame to good use, and this in turn triggers off a series of incidents, which propel them to such heights that the three become the talk of the nation. Things get beyond their control, and the three are left with no choice but to be mute spectators to their newly acquired fame, especially since no one knows their identity.','/ndEFSdqZjjIVZVZiWAYf3ZK86S.jpg','2008-08-29',130,'Released',NULL,'C Kkompany',20295,1.5711,5.107,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24795,_binary '\0','/niltoQ9yVkCSMfBqxUuVM1IiQNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170402',5.5,2407,'el','Ι-4: Λούφα Και Απαλλαγή','A group of new recruits, each of whom, for their own reasons, wants to be exempted from military service, is forced to serve as I4. The group finds itself on a remote island with a specific mission: they must play the role of \"hares\" and coexist with the locals who are preparing for a major exercise.','/yAqaamw7Ci4XJzEfSeU14H83iB9.jpg','2008-04-27',90,'Released','Morons on a mission? Impossible.','I-4: Loafing and Camouflage',16513,1.2527,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24796,_binary '\0','/1GLhh55QymON35bp9gXZdRldGrk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170404',5.6,3280,'hi','Mere Baap Pehle Aap','Apart from running a mall, Gaurav Rane has to take care of his widower father Janardhan and bail him out of the misadventures he gets into due to the influence of his father\'s eccentric friend Mr. Mathur. Gaurav soon falls in love with his former classmate Shikha and they find out about Janardhan\'s long lost love and they decide to reunite the lovers.','/sfwlA2IPIRX62wJDoaaCcKsbFHU.jpg','2008-06-13',163,'Released',NULL,'Mere Baap Pehle Aap',33206,1.5299,4.984,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24797,_binary '\0','/dLqW3V7VbYlDsgWdFEN7W1DaybF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1170405',4.5,1268,'el','Μόλις Χώρισα','Electra is an ordinary woman, without any karmic connection to the tragedy of her name. The most important relationship in her life is with Petros. However, he announces their separation on her birthday with a phone message while her friends are preparing a surprise party. The message is heard by all her friends except her, who is absent. They decide to hide the incident from her, in order to celebrate her birthday first. Thus, all the misunderstandings begin…','/3biKIC1en01KwJILsNs6mo8zKwi.jpg','2008-02-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Just Broke Up',47092,0.9444,4.1,'dzWWBdMjHeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24798,_binary '\0','/kOYhD2b0NqAVt9iYVyxrRV9cuTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11708140',4.8,1699,'en','Asylum: Twisted Horror and Fantasy Tales','Brandon prepares to give his last stand-up comedy show. As his stories and jokes pass, the public begins to cheer up. But at that precise moment Brandon will realize that these stories have a strong relationship with his past. More than he imagines.','/3rxKic2PDrheSXMCG82vm9LAm8e.jpg','2020-07-02',105,'Released','Madness has no limits','Asylum: Twisted Horror and Fantasy Tales',704630,2.4156,5.9,'WU6xeVTnQvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24799,_binary '\0','/ta31idy1pxZHH9LyTZpej9Yf84Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1171222',5.1,10138,'en','Baggage Claim','Although she has traveled all over the world, flight attendant Montana Moore has yet to find a man with whom she wants to settle down. However, with her sister\'s upcoming wedding and pressure from her oft-married mother, she\'s determined to get engaged in the next 30 days. In that time, her best friends (and fellow flight attendants) conspire to help her re-encounter her exes as she flies all over the country.','/qSKvf23QuEJGt8MMrKvoFk85TZo.jpg','2013-09-27',96,'Released','She\'s done flying solo.','Baggage Claim',175528,4.1875,5.3,'KBKVy8Mhnkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24800,_binary '\0','/ynOeIMxvDY36Yc8lxqjTglNUTLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1171226',6,1221,'en','A Bunch of Amateurs','Jefferson Steel, a washed-up Hollywood action star, is desperate to revive his flagging career. When his sleazy agent signs him up for what he believes is a high-profile Royal Shakespeare Company production of King Lear at Stratford upon Avon, Steel thinks he has finally landed the plum role he has been waiting for. However, he soon discovers that he has been tricked into joining an amateur dramatics group for a charity production.','/cXSvLIDBFhzFdXK8x9tio5QCsCp.jpg','2008-11-17',96,'Released','They wished for a star, then wished they hadn\'t','A Bunch of Amateurs',18034,2.2744,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24801,_binary '\0','/gkDdiM2baZ0pm9VnuLdTa2HqmYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1171701',8,37185,'tr','Nefes: Vatan Sağolsun','A small task force of the Turkish army have to defend a relay station in the middle of nowhere against a possible terrorist raid.','/wFQW9HE7NrZQgWnKR8zl6mvHidx.jpg','2009-10-15',128,'Released',NULL,'The Breath',27957,1.637,7.3,'Md6KwLs3usg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24802,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1171709',3.3,9816,'tr','Plajda','Cem and Ali, two buddies, find themselves in the middle of a mafia showdown at a party where they are DJing. Not knowing what to do, the pair try to escape by putting on women\'s clothes they find in the costume room. But a perverted member of the mafia takes them to a resort and holds them captive, and the pair suddenly find themselves working as entertainers at a hotel. During their first attempt to escape the hotel, they see 20 girls who have come to the hotel for a beauty pageant and are stunned. They don\'t want to leave this paradise-like environment. But flirting with girls and living as women is difficult. Even when they try to escape from the hotel a second time, the duo, who have fallen in love with Cansu and Ebru from the TV crew, stay at the hotel. Meanwhile, the mafia also arrives at the hotel.','/bsKg9o8c9mbADRJeT06Gt2lvP6X.jpg','2008-02-29',85,'Released',NULL,'Plajda',248760,1.3578,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24803,_binary '\0','/bgFlhK9Qx63Mj1fT1TmSVuyNjaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1171721',6.9,2670,'tr','Son Ders: Aşk ve Üniversite','What a Turkish lecturer from abroad will teach university students will not be limited to the school curriculum. Yet this new teacher is unassuming; he begins his first lesson by saying, “No one here needs this lesson.” However, when the students—and especially one of them—notice him, a whole new world opens up before them. As Ulaş learns about Saffet Hoca’s past, his life strangely intersects with Saffet Hoca’s.','/wuWtVPN0BeHZBxmai6pin0tfaDv.jpg','2008-02-08',99,'Released',NULL,'Son Ders: Aşk ve Üniversite',52154,1.086,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24804,_binary '\0','/A2avUoNFstnBhAnHiogXQs4c9Bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11718516',6,7814,'es','Huesera','Valeria\'s joy at becoming a first-time mother is quickly taken away when she\'s cursed by a sinister entity. As danger closes in, she\'s forced deeper into a chilling world of dark magic that threatens to consume her.','/zgpj76z9byUgcWnxLDmtZ3XqfvN.jpg','2023-02-10',97,'Released',NULL,'Huesera: The Bone Woman',772515,3.1313,5.873,'22g-vksXD8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24805,_binary '\0','/sqoOj7o44BveONtkb4tC6GCNyQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11718526',7.5,1666,'te','నిన్నిలా నిన్నిలా','In London, Dev, an overweight, genius chef who suffers with muscle spasms, meets Tara and love blossoms, but things take an interesting turn when he crosses paths with Maya.','/7vGK8p7XR7O32HMuw4JHyUtM9jE.jpg','2021-02-26',118,'Released',NULL,'Ninnila Ninnila',755166,1.3069,7.036,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24806,_binary '\0','/yhkqXMOlmQWaLWd5qdkwMkqkjdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11718902',6.7,2418,'ml','അജഗജാന്തരം','Aranjali is all set to celebrate the annual temple festival. Some unforeseen chain of events involving an elephant, a few young men, a notorious criminal, a drama troop and some trouble-loving villagers brings complete mayhem to the place','/9SKsMvNArp0ytrjrx5h6rCf1wxN.jpg','2021-12-23',122,'Released',NULL,'Ajagajantharam',843729,1.0506,6.636,'Sj2go4Uxeao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24807,_binary '\0','/4k5b00TYT0qz8c51BohmsJF83Lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11719648',6.4,1644,'pt','Vento Seco','The area around Catalan in Brazil’s state of Goiás is dry, very dry. Sandro’s life here is somewhat monotonous. He works in a fertiliser factory, goes swimming and spends his evenings doing jigsaw puzzles of landscapes. When Maicon, a man straight out of a Tom of Finland illustration, shows up in their small town and flirts with Ricardo, Sandro’s burgeoning feelings of jealousy set a change in motion.','/fe4f6sseXTATIjoShUGRkraUBnM.jpg','2020-02-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Dry Wind',665783,2.0827,6.4,'6nCWUNcREp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24808,_binary '\0','/xiqkR69oluHI5cC11jSYJA7L5Vu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11720440',5.8,11876,'pa','Carry On Jatta 3','Advocate Dillon\'s son, Jass, is in love with Meet but her brothers get in a tussle with Adv. Dhillon. As a result, Adv. Dhillon rejects Meet\'s hand in marriage. Left with no option, Jass weaves a madhouse plan to propose to his friend, Goldy\'s wife, Diljit. Will the plan work?','/pJqAHS4a1GrtqreALTPG5cqqLKf.jpg','2023-06-29',133,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Jatta 3',1084013,1.6239,6.4,'QJ67Pf8PLdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24809,_binary '\0','/dapUorbOMzlaB12dACCtaiuaTQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172049',7,139532,'en','Demolition','An emotionally desperate investment banker finds hope through a woman he meets.','/4t56LZ1KbOOxgKfqMKN6truBDVc.jpg','2016-04-06',101,'Released','Life: Some disassembly required.','Demolition',303991,7.3153,6.86,'3UnSXelOJo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24810,_binary '\0','/zVUePi0JakbEXjS6Kv7xZV3w103.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172060',3.5,3133,'en','It\'s Alive','When Lenore Harker learns that she\'s pregnant, she leaves graduate school to set up a home with her boyfriend Frank in the country. The happy new family\'s lives takes a gruesome turn when animals and people end up brutally dead – all with a mysterious connection to their newborn.','/uDm89EnXGswts0v5l8TSoqAvyij.jpg','2009-08-15',82,'Released','Please be quiet. Do not wake him up.','It\'s Alive',23174,1.7855,4.1,'8RXavh4luFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24811,_binary '\0','/u1zRxIN8FLmdXTcGkl2Gt64tREA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172203',7.5,5117,'en','Sita Sings the Blues','Utilizing the 1920s jazz vocals of Annette Hanshaw, the epic Indian tale of exiled prince Ramayana and his bride Sita is mirrored by a spurned woman\'s contemporary personal life, and light-hearted but knowledgeable discussion of historical background by a trio of Indian shadow puppets.','/hrtW78FNfwFSiIetgey0cR8AT0g.jpg','2008-02-11',82,'Released','The Greatest Break-Up Story Ever Told.','Sita Sings the Blues',20529,2.2952,6.989,'Ot0BNbXnz5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24812,_binary '\0','/xvkd89TxnLzHWWiQPE9MDHP6Om3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172206',6.8,6960,'en','Somers Town','Two teenagers, both newcomers to London, forge an unlikely friendship over the course of a hot summer. Tomo is a runaway from Nottingham; Marek lives in the district of Somers Town, between King\'s Cross and Euston stations, where his dad is working on a new rail link.','/kr5B00hkWbdMTOe43coJZ1yVhI2.jpg','2008-08-22',71,'Released',NULL,'Somers Town',14298,1.6665,6.8,'S-CmRhFa6pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24813,_binary '\0','/yn9WHNSdf0SOXvwvYLJSxB7nMie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172230',5.1,1466,'fr','Diamant 13','A cop goes up against his lifelong friend, who has become one of the city\'s biggest drug traffickers.','/zDq4dbbWCKaJWZyPlJsc9hfDVA.jpg','2009-06-21',102,'Released',NULL,'Diamond 13',31172,1.809,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24814,_binary '\0','/9kMaKIhwkRuDSfShep5dVxiezgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172233',6.9,72665,'en','Whip It','In Bodeen, Texas, an indie-rock loving misfit finds a way of dealing with her small-town misery after she discovers a roller derby league in nearby Austin.','/iRUviw0Dxs0FZI1IcSDYFX02i8s.jpg','2009-04-09',111,'Released','Be your own hero.','Whip It',22798,5.1334,6.7,'RQGPdXnb2Gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24815,_binary '\0','/y0XEqAqynGW4uVG8gkOnAf5vcYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11724920',5.2,6419,'en','Dead Sea','Stranded in the open sea after a fatal accident, a young woman and her two friends are rescued by a fishing vessel\'s captain, unaware that the ship harbors a chilling secret.','/ohisXa9ArEoV05ajLfX2T5D6NNF.jpg','2024-07-26',88,'Released','Survival has its price.','Dead Sea',1308757,3.9925,6.301,'QXO439zDgLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24816,_binary '\0','/5cGdTg3DTYC8R5vGx1JzWiTBZxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172522',7.7,2441,'si','මචං','Two friends, Manoj (Gihan De Chickera), a bartender, and Stanley (Dharmapriya Dias), a fruit vendor, wish to immigrate to the West to seek their fortune, but have difficulties getting their visa applications approved. They come across an application to a handball tournament in Bavaria, and not even knowing what the game is, they submit themselves and a group of friends as the \"Sri Lanka National Handball Team\". For appearance\'s sake, they begin minimal training and then seek travel visas from the German Embassy. Their plans to simply escape into the West upon arrival in Germany are thwarted by the quick appearance of the tournament organizers and an arena of fans eager to see the prowess of the Sri Lanka National Handball Team.','/znwd1119mgoU9FDeeTnPfS3T7Ij.jpg','2009-05-07',109,'Released',NULL,'Machan',57507,1.3758,6.9,'HaYaf4KpAkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24817,_binary '\0','/7UzMqtX7cvAvli5anUh0yOWd6zN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11725680',6.2,4188,'te','Most Eligible బ్యాచ్‌లర్','A well-educated, ‘settled’ NRI falls for a stand-up comedian and wants to marry her. But when she knows what she wants from her husband, will he fit the bill?','/1hkHmLMqZZWYMs40eOjI8EIbMu7.jpg','2021-10-15',149,'Released',NULL,'Most Eligible Bachelor',716255,1.3607,6.265,'oFJxjVVovQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24818,_binary '\0','/uc8FwdCQi3eD7JIbyiZuzo5n6Jv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172570',7,151463,'en','Bronson','A young man who was sentenced to 7 years in prison for robbing a post office ends up spending 30 years in solitary confinement. During this time, his own personality is supplanted by his alter ego, Charles Bronson.','/6diyyGIbBNiANsdIaCGtyv4IofR.jpg','2009-03-13',92,'Released','The Man. The Myth. The Celebrity.','Bronson',18533,4.0836,6.9,'Ey5VRdEGhNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24819,_binary '\0','/sfUgGs1KtMWpcywgPWmH4c7J8eC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172571',5.9,19781,'en','The Children','A relaxing Christmas vacation turns into a terrifying fight for survival as the children begin to turn on their parents.','/vTyc2ahe0qq7BVBlPD3L4zAl7WU.jpg','2008-12-05',84,'Released','You brought them into this world. Now ... They will take you out.','The Children',16342,2.941,6.072,'GAgCHQCF9Jo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24820,_binary '\0','/1xRES1c8zBLy4iotyMlBCk8WjI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172587',5.6,2281,'en','Delhi Safari','A group of animals in Sanjay Gandhi National Park plans to stop humans from building an apartment complex on their land.','/lOHkT0UMej8KXKqm0VxQMysSvDw.jpg','2012-10-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Delhi Safari',51485,1.8142,5.2,'Iwc3c0FwEMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24821,_binary '\0','/lkUYS8K3tqOJsYHCKSWIMbG7ptj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11727052',5.7,3190,'ko','클로젯','After moving into a new house, a young girl begins displaying strange and disturbing behavior until, one day, she disappears behind a closet. While the devastated father is left with no clue about his daughter\'s disappearance, an exorcist shows up to help.','/aK9R6Xnm0Xcx9E0XapAbvTr8UtD.jpg','2020-02-05',98,'Released','It\'s calling you.','The Closet',571625,3.2484,7.1,'xB73RYULMJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24822,_binary '\0','/7t5ALGBUOHafXpf25sXDLjm0GNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11727866',6.6,9694,'en','Catherine Called Birdy','A teenage girl in Medieval England navigates life and tries to avoid the arranged marriages her father maps out for her.','/a6welBP7DtjHDsr6fwT5IuCS33f.jpg','2022-09-23',108,'Released','Don\'t call me lady.','Catherine Called Birdy',795109,2.328,6.1,'fPiztxYR9sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24823,_binary '\0','/jUJP67Lqmwc0hyaDeLKBS2WuS5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11729298',7.1,28768,'en','American Underdog','The true story of Kurt Warner, who went from a stockboy at a grocery store to a two-time NFL MVP, Super Bowl champion, and Hall of Fame quarterback.','/bzWkU9E1wUEywduYg3cX6iXGMk9.jpg','2021-12-25',112,'Released','Some dreams become destiny.','American Underdog',673309,7.5545,7.1,'_6rn-6lKBJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24824,_binary '\0','/nz5RVgTU0NzhGjcB4Q8xenxQKXr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172963',7.3,7130,'he','עץ לימון','Salma Zidane, a widow, lives simply from her grove of lemon trees in the West Bank\'s occupied territory. The Israeli defence minister and his wife move next door, forcing the Secret Service to order the trees\' removal for security. The stoic Salma seeks assistance from the Palestinian Authority, Israeli army, and a young attorney, Ziad Daud, who takes the case. In this allegory, does David stand a chance against Goliath?','/ja6wxZbjuv6hwnZ7LCHfN85kd0u.jpg','2008-02-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Lemon Tree',7860,1.7087,7,'e_j1llK3Fco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24825,_binary '\0','/nGYko5jtVcdk2csEDX66e87aBWJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172991',6.7,51410,'en','The Company Men','Bobby Walker lives the proverbial American dream: great job, beautiful family, shiny Porsche in the garage. When corporate downsizing leaves him and two co-workers jobless, the three men are forced to re-define their lives as men, husbands and fathers.','/tKX6E1nOf4vZN903YbkjQe7x1fv.jpg','2010-10-21',104,'Released','In America, we give our lives to our jobs. It\'s time to take them back.','The Company Men',44129,5.1998,6.5,'4D2ieQvJQTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24826,_binary '\0','/7ruEP348zJuAPfR02D7lsJM3JKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172994',6.3,56188,'en','The House of the Devil','A young college student who’s struggling financially takes a strange babysitting job which coincides with a full lunar eclipse. She slowly realizes her clients harbor a terrifying secret, putting her life in mortal danger.','/4abKUbc9IbsndbaY1hacN1iPM0Y.jpg','2009-10-30',95,'Released','Talk on the phone. Finish your homework. Watch TV. Die.','The House of the Devil',25983,4.8941,6.228,'z9vJF61_NLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24827,_binary '\0','/ySdpEXCGAoKwHD5m3NjGeKyfVSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1172998',6.6,3508,'en','Hurricane Season','Based on true events amid the wreckage and chaos dealt by Hurricane Katrina; one basketball coach in Marrero, Louisiana just will not give up. Coach Al Collins, gathers other players from hard-hit schools and builds a team actually worthy enough to go to the state playoffs.','/axzk9UTvnV68brpqmmVNp4z2kj5.jpg','2010-02-09',103,'Released','They turned a tragedy into a triumph.','Hurricane Season',32007,2.5917,6.6,'drvTvl9o9zE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24828,_binary '\0','/6EoqBrVN7LyZU7Mr2axjmtcbmkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11730914',4.4,2923,'ta','மாறன்','An investigative journalist gets into trouble when he publishes an article that exposes bitter truths about a corrupt politician.','/sOFK5KIBJA6JwBt6nijxfYP2F5k.jpg','2022-03-11',130,'Released','The Pen is mightier than The Sword','Maaran',759989,1.6025,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24829,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11730940',5.8,2280,'hi','Bamfaad','A passionate love story set in Allahabad between Naate and Neelam who meet accidentally and fall in love. They make brave choices and go through a path of love and loss to be with each other.','/aIVXIYYyjstoBMhCts52x6jX77.jpg','2020-04-10',101,'Released',NULL,'Bamfaad',691449,0.6927,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24830,_binary '\0','/6PwUZXVT28l6scy83TPIGGcXNoK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11731024',6.5,2033,'ta','இரவின் நிழல்','A man on the run looks back on his crime-filled life, the people who have shaped it up, his sins and his one last hope at redemption.','/6wuyQ6rmDoHdorGO2wrmxPclqgW.jpg','2022-07-15',94,'Released','Shadow of the Night','Iravin Nizhal',817194,0.7909,5.9,'cjBK6y0tOYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24831,_binary '\0','/axsYltNv7trUkgs8Pr4HmcBRrDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11731768',7.2,2236,'ta','க/பெ. ரணசிங்கம்','Ariyanchi is married to Ranasigam, who works in Dubai, and the couple has a little daughter. On the day of their daughter\'s ear piercing ceremony, a shocking news reaches the family.','/gvNft4f5eXidHf7kTlJv8aP1cHI.jpg','2020-10-02',177,'Released',NULL,'Ka/Pae. Ranasingam',745275,1.0022,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24832,_binary '\0','/suNieOOgWZ4lhFk6K94HtKIuptj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11732164',6.7,10389,'ta','பத்து தல','An undercover cop goes into the big bad world, a place taken over by a don, where his safety may be compromised.','/rNI3Y4mfsOUpQidwBtZj9EjwImb.jpg','2023-03-30',150,'Released',NULL,'Pathu Thala',882392,1.2292,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24833,_binary '\0','/eTgQlyIQH0nA5BsmYpvCzSPAorg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11734264',4.8,9285,'fr','Sentinelle','Transferred home after a traumatizing combat mission, a highly trained French soldier uses her lethal skills to hunt down the man who hurt her sister.','/jt9NNFFAjvMouzHt06U3uANBpUm.jpg','2021-03-05',80,'Released',NULL,'Sentinelle',793723,2.5573,5.828,'wAJcykyq7DU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24834,_binary '\0','/hwFhSUK0bM30s4CD0ytOd9jqfvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1173494',7.6,4239,'en','God on Trial','In the Jewish tradition of arguing with God, Jewish prisoners in Auschwitz decide to put God on Trial.','/oMSFccYqe8kLm52Hmp44DGuLM5r.jpg','2008-09-03',86,'Released',NULL,'God on Trial',31890,2.0885,6.8,'0W9uRPuo7hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24835,_binary '\0','/c1rIiuvMP5k3c1CJNxD2fxpdoh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11735544',6.9,1243,'en','Beans','Twelve-year-old Beans is on the edge: torn between innocent childhood and reckless adolescence; forced to grow up fast and become the tough Mohawk warrior she needs to be during the Oka Crisis, the turbulent Indigenous uprising that tore Quebec and Canada apart for 78 tense days in the summer of 1990.','/2LkLGOTHOvMCxKwJBav607Hqmgw.jpg','2021-03-30',92,'Released',NULL,'Beans',726220,1.2471,6.3,'ItjJduXxWAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24836,_binary '\0','/nECmtKg0BgDEjLuDg1thIvCfcsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1173687',6.9,12034,'en','The Bang Bang Club','In the early to mid \'90s, when the South African system of apartheid was in its death throes, four photographers - Greg Marinovich, Kevin Carter, Ken Oosterbroek and João Silva - bonded by their friendship and a sense of purpose, worked together to chronicle the violence and upheaval leading up to the 1994 election of Nelson Mandela as president. Their work is risky and dangerous, potentially fatally so, as they thrust themselves into the middle of chaotic clashes between forces backed by the government (including Inkatha Zulu warriors) and those in support of Mandela\'s African National Congress.','/xyBDhcgxyffS7uomHDLIuvNwvd9.jpg','2011-04-22',106,'Released','Sometimes you get too close','The Bang Bang Club',60011,2.7353,6.6,'5Zxxf2Laax8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24837,_binary '\0','/oqKqtlL2OUZLwChNSowqpihFLxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1173745',7.5,17392,'de','Revanche','Alex, an ex-con working as muscle in a Vienna brothel, dreams of escaping with his girlfriend Tamara, who also works there. Their attempt to break free sets off a chain of events that links their fate with a rural police officer and his troubled marriage. As their lives intersect, a quiet struggle unfolds between guilt, grief, and the desire for redemption.','/7EQ7EOXWwPirccqVfp6QoJV19UY.jpg','2008-05-16',121,'Released','Whose fault is it if life doesn\'t go your way?','Revanche',15451,2.0749,7.2,'ZEcRo5GeSls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24838,_binary '\0','/u72FEhMOaRHOJfraXj4oTYdPSAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11737466',3.2,1864,'en','American Insurrection','Set in a dystopian America where all people who aren\'t straight, white, Christian and cis gender are kept track of by the government with bar codes.','/yPp2J0f4NrmeJkpDsgEl4MC5c3f.jpg','2021-10-04',115,'Released','Fear is their weapon','American Insurrection',851870,2.3619,5.2,'7F0FQqBG0Yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24839,_binary '\0','/itX3uCksEUcg37jfPW8Ja2cYVPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11737772',8.3,3826,'pa','ਚੱਲ ਮੇਰਾ ਪੁੱਤ ੨','A tale of everlasting love between illegal immigrants struggling for their PR in the UK as they challenge they multiple struggles.','/nz1EnqItS3KmeRnRiuWjONnrNVE.jpg','2020-03-12',125,'Released',NULL,'Chal Mera Putt 2',680956,2.6646,7.7,'N1l670JGSlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24840,_binary '\0','/sVZENs6EIYCIQl4YeRdbJBXvH6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11737936',7.5,3093,'ku','درخت گردو','Qader, a bricklayer from Sardasht in Kurdistan Iran whose wife is pregnant with her 4th child, suddenly found himself amid a war crime perpetrated by the Saddam regime. On June 28th, 1987 Iraqi air fighters dropped mustard gas bombs on the city...','/l7ubGL0fNU9qgBLRS7PCI9c8sRU.jpg','2020-02-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Walnut Tree',669417,1.271,7,'BuQfCHi9hjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24841,_binary '\0','/6IDpbCTxUrOlz61HJScgWXCnJxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11738830',6.1,7361,'en','The Beta Test','An engaged Hollywood agent receives a mysterious letter for an anonymous sexual encounter and becomes ensnared in a sinister world of lying, infidelity, and digital data.','/jSk3TkqPMWvzlwRBtejZ1UzMhgf.jpg','2021-10-15',94,'Released','Embrace temptation.','The Beta Test',749645,3.0374,6.022,'HpVYrVEUqfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24842,_binary '\0','/xGBFhNxvN7hpYt4iE1txmCJyEZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11738870',6.1,1397,'en','Christmas on Ice','Courtney Bennett, a former US figure skating hopeful, runs the city’s public skating rink but when the Mayor announces its closing, Courtney is heartbroken but determined to save it. After Courtney’s attempts to warm the Mayor’s Scrooge-like heart fail, she enlists the help of Noah Tremblay, a former professional hockey player and single dad, who owns the new indoor skating center, to help her, and together they find more than just the spirit of holidays on the ice.','/seK2Gr5SfDcvDeWV06BTOkcBMnv.jpg','2020-10-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Christmas on Ice',744925,1.7085,6.9,'d78sjzPttzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24843,_binary '\0','/ljKQrvh1zs7azD4FkF0KUofkBfL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1173901',7.8,4608,'ar','الجزيرة','Mansour El-Hefny’s wealthy family rule an Upper Egyptian island. Some police officers facilite their arms dealing in exchange for information, and corrupt parliament members use their immunity to par-take in their drug trade.','/dOi6bm9M2K1XZBFYeMtdAdrVwLW.jpg','2007-12-18',143,'Released',NULL,'The Island',58476,1.3104,7.2,'LMJgL8rxDiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24844,_binary '\0','/q2zHomyjs3MVjeCRTmmr2XeM724.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1173907',7.3,3339,'en','Life After People','In this special documentary that inspired a two-season television series, scientists and other experts speculate about what the Earth, animal life, and plant life might be like if, suddenly, humanity no longer existed, as well as the effect humanity\'s disappearance might have on the artificial aspects of civilization.','/vDeK0Oc3SsxbfKjXWKH8XIChcLA.jpg','2008-01-21',94,'Released','Welcome to Earth... Population: Zero.','Life After People',23190,1.2533,7,'02LHzofl9ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24845,_binary '\0','/3KoPkJZthgaiKMlpPgZSpJWLTpL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11739498',8.1,4908,'te','30 రోజుల్లో ప్రేమించటం ఎలా?','Two college students, Arjun and Akshara, get off on the wrong foot and develop an instant hatred for each other. However, they land in a pickle and realise their connection from a past life.','/8vLHOxRXCES2MzT05rvo5l9bEYF.jpg','2021-01-29',143,'Released',NULL,'30 Rojullo Preminchadam Ela?',791390,1.2122,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24846,_binary '\0','/cq7jQt9AiIDc334TrQM1mG8gYs5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174041',3.4,3581,'hi','मैं और मी.खन्ना','Three people, each having different aspirations from life, are caught in a tangle of emotions and don’t know the way out. There’s a husband and wife with love eroding from their life. And there’s a single, happy-go-lucky dude who falls in love with the wife.','/hsx9kbzMIDRP8qSrrWZO89MllZh.jpg','2009-10-16',115,'Released',NULL,'Main Aurr Mrs Khanna',24604,1.0456,4.983,'v6zH-DNLZCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24847,_binary '\0','/g3ssu6APqfJ2z64VEzzZIzK5AY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174042',6.3,5171,'en','The Myth of the American Sleepover','Four young people navigate the suburban wonderland of metro-Detroit looking for love and adventure on the last weekend of summer.','/q77L4LZgcjOBvsOtKZ5zuk9GVZy.jpg','2011-04-07',96,'Released',NULL,'The Myth of the American Sleepover',70588,2.4999,6,'WyjK109Ty1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24848,_binary '\0','/jqXisF5UNWeYu8nrYg9keeAxKSh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174047',7.2,1686,'fr','Stella','Paris, 1977. Eleven year old Stella knows poker better than grammar when she starts the year at a prestigious new school. There, she discovers the possibilities of a whole new world outside her parents\' bar.','/oBE57Qwhr0f2GEazH1XCbZNKSR0.jpg','2008-11-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Stella',17605,1.2947,6.9,'VaoesW5CCvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24849,_binary '\0','/pua7gLu3O5beOq46xQg6BfLzORl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11742798',5.8,11918,'en','Afterlife of the Party','A social butterfly who dies during her birthday week is given a second chance to right her wrongs on Earth.','/1bkcOEt4zvc5tBl6xFxTbkSqhEQ.jpg','2021-09-02',109,'Released','She\'s got one more chance to fix the life she left in pieces.','Afterlife of the Party',785457,3.822,6.676,'kFIbSnJ9tQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24850,_binary '\0','/igkgaF6ZSFSqivNBCYMyoV6VO7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11744358',7.4,1495,'bg','Голата истина за група Жигули','The members of a music band that separated 30 years ago are forced to reunite.','/oov93gvhHrUNEUWsP8Tu5G1LZly.jpg','2021-04-16',111,'Released',NULL,'The Naked Truth About Zhiguli Band',817880,1.0461,6,'xY0CWcjpHDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24851,_binary '\0','/9PJc8wYqp2Z484pBRnoDaIZSNTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174691',7,1567,'pt','Era uma Vez...','Situated just above the awe-inspiring Ipanema beach in Rio is the Cantagalo slum. Every day, floods of Cantagalo residents make their way down the mountain, only to disappear into their surroundings as part of the invisible working-class that cleans apartments, works in restaurants, and sells food along the scenic, sun-drenched shores. Young Dé (Thiago Martins) is just such a man. Dé lives with his mother Bernadette (Cyria Coentro) in a cramped Cantagalo apartment, selling hot dogs on the beach in order to make the rent. His brother Beto was killed when Dé was just a young boy, and his adopted brother Carlão (Rocco Pitanga) has been jailed for a robbery that he didn\'t commit. One day, while working on the beach, Dé meets Nina (Vitória Frate). Nina is the only child of a successful lawyer named Evandro (Paulo César Grande), who\'s none to happy to discover that his daughter is dating a member of the lower class. How...','/iw5KVyuWtRK0mT7HIYpWzVFOdUn.jpg','2008-07-25',117,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in Rio',39393,1.4091,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24852,_binary '\0','/ikZJAllwYCcDsBYmpHd7nx7d5Vx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174693',5.6,2789,'en','The Four-Faced Liar','A story of love and lies for four twenty-somethings looking to find themselves in New York City. A pair of best friends and a seemingly perfect couple meet at a local Irish pub tucked in the winding streets of the West Village. Through their chance meeting, the four bond and over time all of their relationships with one another morph into love, betrayal and heartbreak for all.','/81Poo7kSBjYGjA7ytdHtu4fhaGN.jpg','2010-01-21',87,'Released',NULL,'The Four-Faced Liar',44991,1.4927,5.4,'mplY9cYnBfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24853,_binary '\0','/vy0vzHqPF4PsEip4IF4zwhKNy4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174730',7.3,33555,'en','City Island','The Rizzos, a family who doesn\'t share their habits, aspirations, and careers with one another, find their delicate web of lies disturbed by the arrival of a young ex-con brought home by Vince, the patriarch of the family, who is a corrections officer in real life, and a hopeful actor in private.','/t7LJY2LCcGRLP9E4QbwBkLpZ2W7.jpg','2009-03-06',104,'Released','Truth is stranger than family','City Island',28053,4.1047,6.9,'nkilMXjv0YE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24854,_binary '\0','/9Cw5fOWLfHwFHjg88dC5oBZEmL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174732',7.2,141526,'en','An Education','Despite her sheltered upbringing, Jenny is a teen with a bright future; she\'s smart, pretty, and has aspirations of attending Oxford University. When David, a charming but much older suitor, motors into her life in a shiny automobile, Jenny gets a taste of adult life that she won\'t soon forget.','/gLIvvUdlocGjm8XVLxhWHAKWrRq.jpg','2009-10-29',100,'Released','An education isn\'t always by the book.','An Education',24684,5.9191,6.932,'DUeYKwxTCGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24855,_binary '\0','/2492yYEOJ39RKmc3OrHw0EdKRS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11748354',6.6,2368,'fr','Les Parfums','Anne Walberg is a celebrity in the world of perfume. She creates fragrances and sells her incredible talent to companies of all kinds. She lives as a diva, selfish, with a strong temper. Guillaume is her new driver and the only one who is not afraid to stand up to her. No doubt this is the reason why she does not fire him.','/72YP5UTHWi62LGHCS1A0RtZYbWd.jpg','2020-07-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Perfumes',658905,3.0939,6.45,'isamgE_BYP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24856,_binary '\0','/3obAUx0CGvn8CSFKPLyHJJgfV5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11749480',6.9,1408,'pa','Shooter','A ruthless Punjabi gangster and his friends clash with a rival gang protecting a corrupt politician.','/aDbEoU2J0NSBePJsY7HQtKxt2Pl.jpg','2022-01-14',143,'Released',NULL,'Shooter',688266,0.9886,9.5,'HbJFQ8ViRzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24857,_binary '\0','/3JgfNUCoN6pyXlO7wZOJ4PgQgW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1174954',6.4,35494,'ja','バイオハザード：ディジェネレーション','Leon S. Kennedy and Claire Redfield must battle a rogue warrior seeking revenge after unleashing the deadly G-Virus, whilst a mutated monster goes on a rampage.','/1x5OaFOo38JAwR5yXxeuvQg3VWH.jpg','2008-02-13',97,'Released','Evil never rests.','Resident Evil: Degeneration',13648,14.8141,6.809,'bbfIAiCwfwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24858,_binary '\0','/h00iFXMpGuls2GEnXIGFzQUeaFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11750282',6.1,19619,'es','Voces','After a tragic turn of events at the new home he\'s fixing up, Daniel hears a ghostly plea for help, spurring him to seek out a famous paranormal expert.','/lXvBgevABC9n5R6Gg76R3pN1h2M.jpg','2020-07-24',98,'Released','Don\'t listen to them.','Don\'t Listen',726208,3.5057,6.429,'uZvF-YB39YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24859,_binary '\0','/wurw1SCnmGdzMPF3gKNIG16jIQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11753696',7.6,1650,'fr','Petite fille','7-year-old Sasha has always known that she is a girl. Sasha’s family has recently accepted her gender identity, embracing their daughter for who she truly is while working to confront outdated norms and find affirmation in a small community of rural France.','/kciAX2iBP09RfZ9d2ldLjgHiL2u.jpg','2020-09-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Little Girl',656274,2.1101,7.8,'akSaVMmOZgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24860,_binary '\0','/xly3gFyw440fmety8emBYXthyoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1175491',6.3,51723,'en','W.','The story of the eventful life of George W. Bush—his struggles and triumphs, how he found both his wife and his faith—and the critical days leading up to his decision to invade Iraq.','/nJm8UF4zbUYEoku9seEtz1PTJGS.jpg','2008-10-17',129,'Released','A life misunderestimated.','W.',10523,3.5456,6.148,'ZdJd5y3mHEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24861,_binary '\0','/34trFNOpgzkVK09EAxjklrOeUeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1175505',5.4,2364,'pl','Lejdis','Four friends are facing problems like infidelity, infertility and disease. But together, they can solve every single problem.','/uiqwXT3TOhGALo69Tp4IFYPce0I.jpg','2008-02-01',134,'Released',NULL,'Ladies',14558,0.9385,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24862,_binary '\0','/yr5SDUn21j124pQDyr0B9Zsu4Ks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1175506',6.7,12393,'en','Me and Orson Welles','New York, 1937. A teenager hired to star in Orson Welles\' production of Julius Caesar becomes attracted to a career-driven production assistant.','/jU7KFn4O1HLgzj9WkkmBkzJNPlN.jpg','2008-09-05',114,'Released','All\'s Fair in love and Theater.','Me and Orson Welles',12404,3.4712,6.4,'JVm7t1udP-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24863,_binary '\0','/yOMEFfUGPEI774wO9DzvFGyy6fy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11755300',7.2,2463,'bn','গোলন্দাজ','Based on true events, Nagendra Prasad Sarbadhikari, \"The Father of Indian Football\", was the first Indian to play the sport and open a professional football club in the country.','/nFa4Utyaic4Y1Y2tUntq75dolKn.jpg','2021-10-10',150,'Released','based on the life of Nagendra Prasad Sarbadhikari, \"Father of Indian football\"','Golondaaj',713037,1.0772,5.667,'1R6EMkBdGTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24864,_binary '\0','/aTSA5zMWlVFTYBIZxTCMbLkfOtb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11755740',4.7,71756,'en','Texas Chainsaw Massacre','After nearly 50 years of hiding, Leatherface returns to terrorize a group of idealistic influencers who accidentally disrupt his carefully shielded world in a remote Texas town.','/7sKiGNWFM15WNyY7LYd5vmb3brO.jpg','2022-02-18',83,'Released','The face of madness returns.','Texas Chainsaw Massacre',632727,7.2244,5.2,'zcI6SFiK_yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24865,_binary '\0','/mP6YfpOBBub03BMKzQssw9GnNgb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1175709',6.2,64335,'en','All Good Things','Newly-discovered facts, court records and speculation are used to elaborate the true love story and murder mystery of the most notorious unsolved murder case in New York history.','/3RM8SyB0yHanJbYeHdgi5eLv21C.jpg','2010-12-03',101,'Released','The perfect love story. Until it became the perfect crime.','All Good Things',46503,7.2026,6.1,'Ca6hW4J7Jeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24866,_binary '\0','/pg8jjaVU1AZEmV47WaE0Ad4wU0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1175713',5.4,2169,'en','The Family Tree','A mother and wife stricken with memory loss allows a dysfunctional family a second chance at harmony and happiness.','/aMBS0985HkeFLGylTrTDIYcjmX5.jpg','2011-09-26',87,'Released',NULL,'The Family Tree',73846,2.3191,5,'7m1JOSkWMyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24867,_binary '\0','/aBrRGGEXESOVKS3UF27Y86G8t2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11758792',4.4,1553,'en','Reloaded','During his investigations in an increasingly criminal metropolis, detective Jimmy Cloud gets into a world of gangsters, espionage, murder, prostitution and drugs, in which a terrorist group also targets his girlfriend to stop him.','/q27o7yOkWsdCIhOGcVYU522ewJ1.jpg','2021-07-10',41,'Released','Do what you have to do.','Reloaded',854250,1.5077,5.5,'O19yoh2K64k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24868,_binary '\0','/qB2EGbOrxOrGCMdN7dbZKfFbFDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176096',7.1,1463,'ko','밤과 낮','Kim Seong-nam travels to Paris to escape an arrest, leaving his wife behind in Korea. After he arrives, he meets an ex-girlfriend and is introduced to a small community of Korean artists.','/cC1UL5y00LqsnEEjfhzYTJlkOlw.jpg','2008-02-28',144,'Released','Everything is what it seems.','Night and Day',57859,1.8249,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24869,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176142',2,1950,'tr','Çılgın Dersane Kampta','After winning a competition organized by the Antalya Tutoring Centers Association, Istanbul Özlem Tutoring Center is saved from debt and returns to its building in Istanbul to continue its education. Meanwhile, Kerem and Özlem leave to study at a university in London on scholarships. At the same time, thanks to the successful program in Antalya, many new students enroll in the tutoring center. One of them is the famous pop singer Berksan. Months pass, and with just one month left before the university exam, it is decided to go on a camping trip to a natural paradise with rivers and waterfalls, following Hadi Hoca\'s idea, to have fun, escape exam stress, consume plenty of oxygen, and continue with accelerated courses to prepare for the exam.','/vrjpobx9mOz4ddFlqoWk7ODipiI.jpg','2008-04-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Çılgın Dersane Kampta',86319,1.1443,2.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24870,_binary '\0','/accTIUygtg24TM7wT7uQMMdvYUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11762114',5.5,42063,'en','Mean Girls','New student Cady Heron is welcomed into the top of the social food chain by the elite group of popular girls called ‘The Plastics,’ ruled by the conniving queen bee Regina George and her minions Gretchen and Karen. However, when Cady makes the major misstep of falling for Regina’s ex-boyfriend Aaron Samuels, she finds herself prey in Regina’s crosshairs. As Cady sets to take down the group’s apex predator with the help of her outcast friends Janis and Damian, she must learn how to stay true to herself while navigating the most cutthroat jungle of all: high school.','/fbbj3viSUDEGT1fFFMNpHP1iUjw.jpg','2024-01-10',113,'Released','Plastic is forever.','Mean Girls',673593,15.877,5.837,'9xgPEplWACQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24871,_binary '\0','/umAoDwLZMBrYeCDfbJYFRMuXWAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11762434',2.5,16167,'en','Cosmic Sin','In the year 2524, four centuries after humans started colonizing the outer planets, retired General James Ford gets called back into service when a hostile alien fleet attacks soldiers on a remote planet. The threat against mankind soon escalates into an interstellar war as Ford and a team of elite soldiers try to stop the imminent attack before it\'s too late.','/6Wm7P6y22UZA40QuPYHyWyJ6leI.jpg','2021-03-12',88,'Released','First contact has been made. It\'s war.','Cosmic Sin',681887,5.8956,4,'9HTWDnKs6hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24872,_binary '\0','/lwx7W2NBoRLZeBPHYzZd3Y1G3tp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176244',7.2,2042,'en','Valentino: The Last Emperor','Film which travels inside the singular world of one of Italy\'s most famous fashion designers, Valentino Garavani, documenting the colourful and dramatic closing act of his celebrated career and capturing the end of an era in global fashion. However, at the heart of the film is a love story - the unique relationship between Valentino and his business partner and companion of 50 years, Giancarlo Giammetti. Capturing intimate moments in the lives of two of Italy\'s richest and most famous men, the film lifts the curtain on the final act of a nearly 50-year reign at the top of the glamorous and fiercely competitive world of fashion. (Storyville)','/aQP33BMBuRrDQwOTSdTVHvmOVnv.jpg','2008-09-07',96,'Released',NULL,'Valentino: The Last Emperor',22774,2.3874,6.5,'xsBhANYsdRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24873,_binary '\0','/fPemjaVm3avxjyPgtWgkl8Lgi6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176251',6,10177,'en','Gigantic','Young mattress salesman Brian decides to adopt a baby from China but is distracted when he forms a relationship with quirky, wealthy Harriet whom he meets at his mattress store. As their relationship flourishes, unbeknownst to them, a hitman is trying to kill Brian.','/cYYE7rm6cC773PAJDVZmlNJA3Rs.jpg','2008-09-09',99,'Released','When it comes to family and relationships, there are no small surprises.','Gigantic',14940,1.9906,5.6,'QVuOh8mIUmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24874,_binary '\0','/2EKGftWlHKRwVIXQfXiCpeu6gcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176252',5.2,6081,'en','Hunger','Five strangers face the unthinkable when they wake up and find themselves trapped. With no idea how they got there they frantically try to figure out how to escape. The disoriented group quickly realise the truth about their situation when they discover another room containing enough water to survive for 30 days… and a razor sharp surgical knife. The intention becomes quite clear. Whoever put them in this place wants to see just how long it will take before the hunger makes them commit unspeakable acts and cross a very deadly line.','/c90ogtGY5k90D38ynTUBu3KWWMp.jpg','2009-05-12',101,'Released','How far would you go to survive?','Hunger',173672,1.8654,5.2,'A0shVsHcU4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24875,_binary '\0','/33DSti6PqvPphI94iOb0EyS1qbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11763296',4.1,2007,'en','Decrypted','A mismatched NSA team who kidnap the creator of Bitcoin - Satoshi Nakamoto - and attempt to torture him for the information they need to destroy cryptocurrencies','/sJvGJBjmA7qzgYPnxLzibAxFxFb.jpg','2021-07-01',112,'Released','No more secrets','Decrypted',892452,1.2891,4.8,'Y_4F6Yo6ARE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24876,_binary '\0','/mdOE4NdJqh5VXzkYKi50qJM1st7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176416',5.4,2483,'en','鉄男 THE BULLET MAN','When the son of an American man and a Japanese woman is killed in a car crash, the man transforms into a rageful metallic being thirsty of blood and vengeance.','/sYcYjZ65YEEelekUgJcUp4HkRmw.jpg','2010-02-27',71,'Released','Vengeance will become his way of life','Tetsuo: The Bullet Man',52034,1.8175,5.4,'-3v2e0SIDTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24877,_binary '\0','/2zNtEnYGjbYwL3n9mu0XCzIoEDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11766802',6.8,3764,'fa','جهان با من برقص','Since Jahaan only has a few months left to live, his brother Bahman organizes a get-together with his closest friends at Jahaan\'s farmhouse up north to celebrate what will likely be his final birthday.','/qiz7JfdlSlcDx2pkGuIDnIQjxql.jpg','2019-12-31',96,'Released','My Friends are All I Have','Dance With Me',661839,0.8822,4.6,'WVeVm5QPARI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24878,_binary '\0','/l7IhQJnI9BXWntyYuHfW8hc2KMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176724',5.8,5113,'en','Across the Hall','Convinced that his fiancee is cheating on him, a man follows her to a hotel and calls his best friend to help him avoid a calamity.','/eH92tHb7A3jrPw0OBgwZeBWKlk1.jpg','2009-08-27',93,'Released','Your worst fears are waiting...','Across the Hall',21469,4.0231,5.977,'ydQV56Tj0bQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24879,_binary '\0','/y5f73ik0NW6K0j5202PU0IBmVG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176726',6.7,3249,'en','Cocaine Cowboys 2','Set in 1991 on the inner-city streets of Oakland, California, cocaine dealer Charles Cosby has his life is changed forever when he writes a fan letter to the \"Cocaine Godmother\" Griselda Blanco, who is serving time at a nearby federal prison. Six months later, Cosby is a multi-millionaire, Blanco\'s lover, and the head of her $40 million a year cocaine business.','/ebdMmTdoqAHEFFgKxxQfSvSGOYV.jpg','2008-07-29',97,'Released','Hustlin\' with the Godmother','Cocaine Cowboys 2',26769,0.841,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24880,_binary '\0','/rSEZ4e8rWCk9SsRvuwyxtLLUV0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176740',7,56842,'en','Away We Go','Verona and Burt have moved to Colorado to be close to Burt\'s parents but, with Verona expecting their first child, Burt\'s parents inexplicably decide to move to Belgium, now leaving them in a place they hate and without a support structure in place. They set off on a whirlwind tour of of disparate locations where they have friends or relatives, sampling not only different cities and climates but also different families. Along the way they realize that the journey is less about discovering where they want to live and more about figuring out what type of parents they want to be.','/zWxjopWXpnC1vSbnO7mw2URna22.jpg','2009-06-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Away We Go',19255,3.9042,6.669,'Hp_ZwQH2nfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24881,_binary '\0','/eOJwfR1F1FFujG8bNkQXLb3fvAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11767484',7.4,6976,'fa','شنای پروانه','After leaking of a video of her class in a women only swimming pool, Parvaneh is brutally murdered by her husband, Hashem, who seeks a way to redeem his reputation and dignity as the godfather in the neighborhood. Hashem’s brother, Hojat, embarks a journey into the labyrinths of underground in Tehran to find out who is responsible for this dirty game. Once wrongfully accused for smuggling drugs, he returns to the world of crime to trace his brother’s rivals…','/nNrWknSzUh5yFiKhRQtaIRgpDE2.jpg','2020-02-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Drown',670336,1.0208,6.375,'QNmy0qTeJbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24882,_binary '\0','/tlNRU13h3xr7AV0uQ5Gamoh8ssx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11767722',7.1,4599,'fa','خورشید','The story of 12-year-old Ali and his three friends. Together they work hard to survive and support their families, doing small jobs in a garage and committing petty crimes to make fast money. In a turn of events that seems miraculous, Ali is entrusted to find hidden treasure underground. He recruits his gang, but first, to gain access to the tunnel, the children must enroll at the Sun School, a charitable institution that tries to educate street kids and child laborers, close to where the treasure is located.','/2G3BazaiReAM8bazC1HuQHaltA0.jpg','2021-05-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Sun Children',670343,1.999,7,'_paWTOKcRLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24883,_binary '\0','/qANe4dAaaLXcxcS1DgfAouy40Gr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11767724',7.3,2214,'nl','Skunk','The story of Liam, a neglected teenager who lives in a family where alcohol, violence and sex play the main role. He grows up to be a confused youngster which ends in a very aggressive act to break with his past.','/uZ9xz8ugGi5lxLnJlJwMnKyjxvO.jpg','2024-03-13',105,'Released',NULL,'Skunk',885246,1.3321,6.537,'QZdvXLmZzZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24884,_binary '\0','/1sWLVybHa27QvfzChPuzNlWaesn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11768008',6.1,1765,'ro','Câmp de maci','A young Romanian gendarme, Cristi, tries to find the balance between two apparently opposing parts of his identity: that of a man working in a macho hierarchical environment and that of a closeted gay person who tries to keep his personal life a secret. Cristi is called in for an intervention at a movie theatre, where an ultra-nationalist, homophobic group has interrupted the screening of a queer film. After one of the protesters threatens to out him, Cristi spirals out of control.','/ic4xTc3uLinMeMLVtPh4HJfcKL3.jpg','2022-04-08',83,'Released',NULL,'Poppy Field',763605,1.1768,5.5,'En6KZDnnMjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24885,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11768018',6.1,1461,'fa','روز صفر','A different story from a contemporary inflamed event','/yyoeWJFYi32o8Iu9drMHWopFagR.jpg','2020-02-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Zero Day',670340,1.1268,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24886,_binary '\0','/r6ZQxjyGOCm0NQwDOEPEL5sFQTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176954',6.6,2261,'fr','Eldorado','Yvan finds a burglar in his house. After some consideration, Yvan decides not to call the police and to drop the lad near the nearby city but he ends up giving him a lift home to his parents. Together, they travel through Belgium and meet some extraordinary people and find themselves in ditto situations.','/uHRo3ODUGBEiUmQYWG3uRwFUXnG.jpg','2008-06-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Eldorado',15126,2.0631,6.667,'3-7Yj5XWh5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24887,_binary '\0','/ijHy6DSH39pmgOoefbBUd9lyRP0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1176960',5.6,3593,'hi','वन टू थ्री','Laxminarayan lives a poor lifestyle in Mumbai along with his widowed mother, Kanta, who wants him to be a successful gangster like Batlabhai, and would like him to kill a few people, make enough money, then get married to Khujli\'s daughter, Meena. In order to fulfill his mother\'s wish, Laxminarayan accepts a contract to kill D\'Mello Yadav, a Pondi-based gangster, who has stolen a diamond from Batl','/8NZvA9tT1eHAL3fSM10cnWFX9JL.jpg','2008-03-28',135,'Released',NULL,'One Two Three',18610,1.3647,5.182,'AEqTR6d