-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24892,_binary '\0','/yLFiMcOAUqy6S3AGk659l627lPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773276',5.9,1855,'te','Krishna and His లీల','Torn between his past and present girlfriends, a confused bachelor’s indecisiveness spins a web of lies and cheating as he struggles to commit.','/vWbB3gTKMZahD2s37vj2Tpx2klj.jpg','2020-06-24',125,'Released',NULL,'Krishna and His Leela',718745,0.9168,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24893,_binary '\0','/yYo2JNt1fZrfa5DBlPA6pYC1cCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773308',8,6294,'te','రంగమార్తాండ','After retirement, a Shakespearean theater actor, divides his property amongst his two children. However, their ungratefulness leaves him and his wife homeless during their old age.','/75hXBoN1iqyPxIsJRFIEkPdbvgB.jpg','2023-03-22',151,'Released',NULL,'Rangamarthanda',1064247,1.1828,5.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24894,_binary '\0','/dTD3wlEjhEzKztFyzKWSeICGMFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773378',6.7,20458,'te','అఖండ','Brothers Murali Krishna and Akhanda are separated at birth. They grow up to lead completely separate lives, Murali as a local hero, and Akhanda as a secluded Shiva devotee. But when the lives of Murali and his family are in danger, his long-lost brother finally returns.','/1mjw3CdnDJk3W0gki3N9K5Ol0EL.jpg','2021-12-02',167,'Released','When hope dies, when there is no faith, when evil spreads its wings, Akhanda arrives.','Akhanda',794961,1.4405,5.603,'5BDRm_g6mFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24895,_binary '\0','/ssDPH5LjnOcmDf17Jt0g2Amevvx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773426',5.5,5647,'te','కింగ్డమ్‌','Soori, a modest police constable, is unintentionally dragged into a dangerous undercover spy operation in Sri Lanka for the Indian government. His journey is intimately linked to his estranged brother Siva, and the risks involved on their reunion.','/6x0wmp2LlLqhEbd8XKjJpTHdHsT.jpg','2025-07-30',160,'Released','From the shadows of betrayal shall rise a king.','Kingdom',1124838,2.6549,5.943,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24896,_binary '\0','/7p01zWOLLxtjf1G3I9YHkppo3dS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773456',7.8,4940,'te','నాంది','Surya is an IT employee leading a happy life till he’s marked as a suspect in a high-profile murder case. As an under-trial prisoner, he doesn’t just have to prove his innocence in court; he also has to face abuse in custody. Advocate Aadhya takes up the case, fresh off law school. How the duo manages to navigate rough waters forms the tale.','/j2t4J5qKvxN2UmPjggKiaaHbGE9.jpg','2021-02-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Naandhi',797967,1.1251,7.385,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24897,_binary '\0','/4mbe5uXblcgS3zdd2ubPl4DaZsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773484',7.1,3145,'fa','قصیده گاو سفید','Mina\'s life is turned upside down when she learns that her husband was innocent of the crime for which he was executed, so she starts a silent battle against a cynical system for her own and her daughter\'s sake.','/8yTPga1RA9BFsgKNFFPf7c4jELx.jpg','2021-10-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Ballad of a White Cow',669401,1.8564,6.9,'-m8kYkQeIe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24898,_binary '\0','/hu2K1XlEyRjO2JvzIHBa6cPQRAi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11773810',5.2,8843,'en','Invitation to a Murder','A reclusive billionaire invites six seemingly random strangers to his island estate in the south of England. Aspiring detective Miranda Green finds the mysterious invitation too alluring to pass up. When another guest turns up dead, Miranda must get to the bottom of the malicious plot behind the gathering.','/ucYuml5QqkcGKmWmJj7JpJdsPc1.jpg','2023-05-05',93,'Released','Everyone is a suspect.','Invitation to a Murder',989473,6.0163,5.5,'B_HOii1vVg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24899,_binary '\0','/a8ppJJIQmEJcLSFfhxupc4aT4KW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11777040',6.3,7935,'ko','사냥의 시간','Four young men want to leave their dystopian world behind and go to a distant paradise to execute a money robbery, a daring act that will have unexpected consequences.','/bkuuvDoPkOJpg0ZDzHkUWt8ZG5A.jpg','2020-02-22',135,'Released','We became its prey.','Time to Hunt',571785,2.9397,7.116,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24900,_binary '\0','/rXRf5Okqg0FzDpmZkt4wly2asB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11777738',7.5,33614,'fa','قهرمان','Rahim is in prison because of a debt he was unable to repay. During a two-day leave, he tries to convince his creditor to withdraw his complaint against the payment of part of the sum. But things don\'t go as planned. Is he truly a hero?','/5VBPRWW13OJoiLA6suLofnjLKou.jpg','2021-12-15',127,'Released',NULL,'A Hero',672208,3.2874,7.3,'zAJ6_lmr_HQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24901,_binary '\0','/m06dOSnShSmGfVgz4iSQhx6bzWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11778102',6,2183,'ar','موسى','An engineering college student invents the first of its kind robot in the Middle East, in an attempt to avenge his father\'s death and achieve justice, which gets him pursued by the authorities.','/8MO3nkwF8dbsz7dC5rGZuP3m3RS.jpg','2021-08-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Mousa',775244,1.5535,6.7,'Hq_EhvJyY8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24902,_binary '\0','/zWPV41i5AmLOou0yjCVBp5iFXY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11778118',6.5,9443,'en','Vicious Fun','Joel, a caustic 1980s film critic for a national horror magazine, finds himself unwittingly trapped in a self-help group for serial killers. With no other choice, Joel attempts to blend in with his homicidal surroundings or risk becoming the next victim.','/jCz4Pv0rilnkBgqwbe5Y3JT5899.jpg','2021-11-04',103,'Released','We\'re going to have a lot of fun tonight.','Vicious Fun',728054,2.5451,6.48,'1qVHB4y3pYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24903,_binary '\0','/pf4Iq014Vq3DZwNj28M2juXDHas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11778144',6.2,2314,'ar','العارف','The film tackles cybercrime through the story of Younis, a man who lives with his wife and their baby girl, as he decides to rob a bank through the internet, but then finds himself chased by a dangerous gang.','/8VW9mR2YIS2YORfTHcJy9VLZmeu.jpg','2021-07-12',121,'Released',NULL,'The Knower',823353,1.2352,6.5,'PIaqyTlYWTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24904,_binary '\0','/3Sg4rEi3NaXwoKAIHWkFVpgpSzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11778272',7.7,2216,'en','Crock of Gold: A Few Rounds with Shane MacGowan','A celebration of the Irish punk/poet Shane MacGowan, lead singer and songwriter of The Pogues, that combines unseen archive footage from the band and MacGowan’s family with original animations.','/O25m9xEWCP9okDsXI823P0Mfd2.jpg','2020-12-04',124,'Released',NULL,'Crock of Gold: A Few Rounds with Shane MacGowan',730506,2.0494,8,'1_xZGoYU1eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24905,_binary '\0','/iaGuduJH7T4D5FNHHDrooF7NjBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11779616',7.1,2130,'kn','ಶಿವಾಜಿ ಸುರತ್ಕಲ್: The Case of ರಣಗಿರಿ ರಹಸ್ಯ','Shivaji Surathkal, who is the Sherlock Holmes of the Karnataka Police Department, is handed over a high-profile case – the murder of the Home Minister\'s son. This brings him to an eerie resort in Ranagiri, near Madikeri, which seems to throw Shivaji off his game.','/glR6Qjw3hXB6fMYELUmEfZxK0XQ.jpg','2020-02-21',124,'Released','The Case of Ranagiri Rahasya','Shivaji Surathkal: The Case of Ranagiri Rahasya',682614,1.1926,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24906,_binary '\0','/3yd8EOmcZTChBLjdKrr8dQWSJl7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1178197',7.9,6269,'bg','Светът е голям и спасение дебне отвсякъде','The story of Alex, who, with the help of his charismatic grandfather, embarks on a journey in search of his real self.','/qsaVc5UmB8RuoZzxNbnFMR88vU6.jpg','2008-03-14',105,'Released',NULL,'The World Is Big and Salvation Lurks Around the Corner',5871,1.43