3ailxdFPBZ8F1xiBQJUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1178663',7.1,79629,'en','Whatever Works','Whatever Works explores the relationship between a crotchety misanthrope, Boris and a naïve, impressionable young runaway from the south, Melody. When Melody\'s uptight parents arrive in New York to rescue her, they are quickly drawn into wildly unexpected romantic entanglements. Everyone discovers that finding love is just a combination of lucky chance and appreciating the value of \"whatever works.\"','/upIYOZbiutCBnvejGYaZlJxxKcs.jpg','2009-06-19',92,'Released','A new comedy!','Whatever Works',19265,4.8445,7.1,'8NgdravJjjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24912,_binary '\0','/oXj7C4IuTTtA2iR7hCYtGRy0BS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1178665',6.4,32636,'en','A Walk in the Woods','After spending two decades in England, Bill Bryson returns to the U.S., where he decides the best way to connect with his homeland is to hike the Appalachian Trail with one of his oldest friends.','/zJmNuWakSSaJvywYyxZIS9EGWPN.jpg','2015-09-02',104,'Released','When you push yourself to the edge, the real fun begins.','A Walk in the Woods',232572,5.1419,6.1,'1NjYUr1k8rA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24913,_binary '\0','/biE76VbMmwla9AutpXHT5GCpFmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11788956',2.9,1605,'en','Habit','The story of a streetwise party girl who gets mixed up in a violent drug deal and finds a possible way out - by masquerading as a Catholic nun.','/piDplaWgc73jAuOohiFhTucBSYN.jpg','2021-08-20',81,'Released','They\'re still bad girls underneath.','Habit',682376,1.929,4.6,'d9mqpESX5-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24914,_binary '\0','/oktRqHfL2ORYAwpIZh7ZfXw72TE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179025',6.3,24770,'fr','Les Aventures extraordinaires d\'Adèle Blanc-Sec','An adventure set in the early part of the 20th century, focused on a popular novelist and her dealings with would-be suitors, the cops, monsters, and other distractions.','/1nYv7H0XJFgrJ5LewGlyNDvjqdq.jpg','2010-04-09',107,'Released',NULL,'The Extraordinary Adventures of Adèle Blanc-Sec',35552,8.2606,6.276,'a6djPGS3RCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24915,_binary '\0','/erszaeysMaU83F5XKBa1oUGHF5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179031',6.7,39952,'en','Cold in July','While investigating noises in his house one balmy Texas night in 1989, Richard Dane puts a bullet in the brain of a low-life burglar. Although he’s hailed as a small-town hero, Dane soon finds himself fearing for his family’s safety when Freddy’s ex-con father rolls into town, hell-bent on revenge.','/gzHS4ehNU6wapLt9UpA1rNnljiO.jpg','2014-05-23',109,'Released','How many men can one bullet kill?','Cold in July',244509,4.5079,6.5,'XkyuV69YZcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24916,_binary '\0','/fra7Gk8xHPWaY4g8p6ue0o2yKOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179034',6.4,128221,'en','From Paris with Love','James Reese has a good job as an ambassador\'s aid in France, but his real passion is a side gig—working in a minor role in the CIA. He would love to be a full-fledged agent and can\'t believe his luck when he lands an assignment with Charlie Wax. Trigger-happy Charlie soon has James crying for his desk job, but when he learns that the same guys they\'re trying to catch are after him, James realises that Charlie may be his only hope of survival.','/poVoLKLxUqsTLSntA40Po2F78dZ.jpg','2010-02-04',92,'Released','Two agents. One city. No merci.','From Paris with Love',26389,12.9928,6.474,'-jAbatBqqSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24917,_binary '\0','/Aur8dDhjDDJBuSDa9Y9GNrvlPI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179056',5.2,116039,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street','Teenagers Nancy, Quentin, Kris, Jesse and Dean are all neighborhood friends who begin having the same dream of a horribly disfigured man who wears a tattered sweater and a glove made of knives. The man terrorizes them in their dreams, and the only escape is to wake up. But when, one by one, they start dying violently, the friends realize that what happens in the dream world is real, and the only way to stay alive is to stay awake.','/nsmW28GcNabCUZfP5YtUEe8Li0f.jpg','2010-04-30',95,'Released','Welcome to your new nightmare.','A Nightmare on Elm Street',23437,8.2131,5.521,'CIyLNm_-qH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24918,_binary '\0','/aX9SCQpx5rBklkRQBaowtkaoi2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179067',3.1,3182,'ru','Самый лучший фильм','Vadik Volnov (Garik Kharlamov) dies on his own wedding of cannabis overdose and has to prove to God that he is worthy to enter Heaven. During his conversation with God\'s secretary, Vadik recalls numerous memorable moments of his earthly existence, such as getting drunk on cognac on his 8th birthday, service in the Soviet Army in Afghanistan, bandit showdowns in crime-ridden 1990s Russia, and, finally, meeting the love of his life.','/2AHQFjDUgSdNcnGkD3qvtdYLOkf.jpg','2008-01-23',105,'Released',NULL,'The Best Movie',62737,0.9406,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24919,_binary '\0','/ggvoTWkjcrztXL12ftbklr6kU9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11790674',6.7,6133,'en','Oslo','The true story of negotiations between implacable enemies — the secret back-channel talks, unlikely friendships and quiet heroics of a small but committed group of Israelis, Palestinians and one Norwegian couple that led to the 1993 Oslo Peace Accords.','/tULZeNNlwLvXPdQpERfrfYyZfTC.jpg','2021-05-29',118,'Released','How do enemies find common ground?','Oslo',553087,3.0746,6.6,'QsRlXQcHd8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24920,_binary '\0','/fBp0V9RW5MJqq3t9odMZXpPjIoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179069',6,39403,'en','6 Souls','A female forensic psychiatrist discovers that all of one of her patient\'s multiple personalities are murder victims. She will have to find out what\'s happening before her time is finished.','/3GWyCrlyYU1gOEP0knib8IDuQtc.jpg','2010-03-27',112,'Released','Evil will rise.','6 Souls',41505,4.54,6,'fcQ5LG9ZS4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24921,_binary '\0','/JwvfAOnxakTwUzygwKNF0BpgUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179071',3.9,1855,'en','The Orphan Killer','The Orphan Killer is a tour de force murder flick that defies classification. It goes far beyond current trends in gore and breaks open a new suffering genre of horror. Marcus Miller is a serial murderer hellbent on teaching his estranged sister Audrey what it means to have family loyalty. His lessons are taught in massive doses of vulgar and unimaginable pain. Throughout her brutal torture we learn that Marcus is not the only Miller with Killer in the bloodline as Audrey proves to be a formidable adversary.','/AL08WJi46mvn0iLXLcWlpPduc7.jpg','2011-11-01',83,'Released','True Pain is Screamless.','The Orphan Killer',71033,1.8443,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24922,_binary '\0','/uhhTABBddHoOTV0BarymFTgOee6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11790780',7.9,17359,'en','The Alpinist','The life of Canadian mountain climber Marc-André Leclerc as he pushes the boundaries of climbing while on an expedition to Patagonia.','/tYbSGAVbyACEExptLu63CxCGm4O.jpg','2021-02-07',93,'Released',NULL,'The Alpinist',682587,4.7429,7.8,'BRn9H_I8LXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24923,_binary '\0','/oFRqN9YjpJ8ftFSU6SBTJdv4UHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11791964',6.6,1516,'kn','Old Monk','Narada is cursed and banished to earth by Lord Krishna after he creates a quarrel between Krishna and Rukmini. The only way he can redeem himself is by getting married to someone he loves on the earth. Now, Narada, christened as Appanna, is born into a family that only believes in arranged marriage and he has no chance of finding love with his father playing the villain. When he does find an interest, there are many hurdles.','/rqZymTrvHveuuEjROSbBJrvOzCX.jpg','2022-02-25',129,'Released',NULL,'Old Monk',815873,1.16,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24924,_binary '\0','/xaHEopBVf5BZCrHiSdzvYgA3vdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179258',6.1,12187,'en','Chéri','The son of a courtesan retreats into a fantasy world after being forced to end his relationship with the older woman who educated him in the ways of love.','/b35rv11ebJdqCe5chVmSUZ0RIlX.jpg','2009-04-08',86,'Released','Indulge in a wicked game of seduction','Chéri',22215,3.1883,6.1,'S_dCJ7NQLxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24925,_binary '\0','/kbPOZ7dxvoCJuuJE8rATyILnLVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11792734',3.7,8380,'tr','9 Kere Leyla','A resilient housewife, her husband and their marriage therapist become mired in a toxic love triangle and a plot to obtain an antique manuscript.','/8RnMjhdXAMdZjo56dGMKxYY6AHq.jpg','2020-12-04',112,'Released',NULL,'Leyla Everlasting',668156,1.2439,3.8,'HD_RxbXKzQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24926,_binary '\0','/xa6VgSN4kLaFymJKCemXag8irMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11795652',7,2365,'en','Wildhood','Link and his brother flee their abusive father and embark on a journey where Link discovers his sexuality and rediscovers his Mi’kmaw heritage.','/y6ShzPuitNifo5XkWuSC7ZQ04x.jpg','2022-06-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Wildhood',856496,1.5675,6.6,'bpq5vqx70nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24927,_binary '\0','/5s7zDN0nAuio5eMcWqsrsB2ibjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11797376',5.5,1840,'es','Objetos','Mario, a worker in \"lost and found\" department, finds a suitcase with a dead baby inside.','/7hrSRxsd7nZ7Myg7SpvxJ7EWItO.jpg','2022-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Lost & Found',946706,2.3501,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24928,_binary '\0','/fMzTeudMs25huf4gRxvlnrcPvbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179773',7.4,2436,'ja','河童のクゥと夏休み','A small, lone Kappa miraculously survives over 200 years into modern day Japan, when he is found by young Koichi. Coo, who is secretly adopted by Koichi\'s family, searches with his new human friend for unpopulated places in hopes of finding any remaining of his kind.','/4Hk82Tw50Qevknz3qb8N7Nd5Ti3.jpg','2007-07-28',138,'Released',NULL,'Summer Days with Coo',17234,3.5859,7.8,'AodqtH60OqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24929,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179781',3.5,1372,'hi','Mission Istaanbul','A news reporter must uncover the secret on the 13th floor of a News Station.','/7pZ6LXXO7j7FWVi1UU33hvEsaA1.jpg','2008-07-25',125,'Released',NULL,'Mission Istaanbul',20976,1.8364,3.278,'8X3OWvw8TQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24930,_binary '\0','/vf25Y2k4l0Pj5lYZGrkJFHB5jDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179782',7,2394,'hi','मिथ्या','A two-bit actor faces challenges after he is asked by Police to impersonate a look-alike gangster.','/d9Ie3fr346SlNFwWaniUiAesUfm.jpg','2008-01-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Mithya',21571,1.0477,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24931,_binary '\0','/fYrWYtAQoeW00vflpeVbvJjkEjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179794',6.4,15036,'en','TiMER','When implanted in a person\'s wrist, a TiMER counts down to the day the wearer finds true love. But Oona O\'Leary faces the rare dilemma of a blank TiMER. Her soul mate - whoever and wherever he is - has yet to have a TiMER implanted. Staring down the barrel of thirty and tired of waiting for her would-be life partner to get off the dime, Oona breaks her own rules and falls for Mikey, a charming and inappropriately young supermarket clerk with a countdown of four months.','/i9QHzVqko9YxNCGdH8vnruy78nK.jpg','2009-05-14',100,'Released','You can\'t hurry love.','TiMER',39545,3.3106,6.3,'pxS_FWBOW0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24932,_binary '\0','/6GmgWNha6oK1oxgClrNIxPepBAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179855',5.8,2121,'fr','Go Fast','Marek, a crime squad officer, sets out to avenge the death of his partner and best friend, who was killed by drug traffickers. He asks for a posting to a new undercover unit created to infiltrate a drug gang that imports hashish from Morocco using the \"Go Fast\" method. A fleet of high-powered speedboats and cars races across the Mediterranean to Spain and then France, loaded with drugs.','/mXESPPvjKWtcl0uVXnuRipPxz2q.jpg','2008-10-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Go Fast',15942,2.1843,5.9,'fslYsa1umyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24933,_binary '\0','/lhYlBOsmwoFlGQg9FmTsS7UMz1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179891',5.5,65752,'en','My Bloody Valentine','Ten years after a Valentine\'s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.','/9biIVOMTdvv4aj4a5HClmrK5EHB.jpg','2009-01-16',101,'Released','Get your heart broken.','My Bloody Valentine',14435,6.2502,5.6,'afxUFef1fNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24934,_binary '\0','/wfCdJ0MD1hYJzlaHulolNw5pYtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179904',6.3,274505,'en','Paranormal Activity','After a young, middle-class couple moves into what seems like a typical suburban house, they become increasingly disturbed by a presence that may or may not be demonic, but is certainly the most active in the middle of the night.','/tmclkEpjeo4Zu564gf3KrwIOuKw.jpg','2007-09-14',86,'Released','What happens when you sleep?','Paranormal Activity',23827,9.5393,6.061,'5od3NGHrXrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24935,_binary '\0','/dMERTVrObB7TkRVIFmcndR2sZFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179933',7.2,389447,'en','10 Cloverfield Lane','After a catastrophic car crash, a young woman wakes up in a survivalist\'s underground bunker, where he claims to have saved her from an apocalyptic attack that has left the outside world uninhabitable.','/q8A39vcBDruhvoDTJd6L8a4lnTi.jpg','2016-03-10',104,'Released','Monsters come in many forms.','10 Cloverfield Lane',333371,12.9134,7,'yQy-ANhnUpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24936,_binary '\0','/imtyiqjJtzpp5nXz3JmBV7MOLJx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1179947',7.7,5093,'en','American: The Bill Hicks Story','American: The Bill Hicks Story is a biographical documentary film on the life of comedian Bill Hicks.','/8YGb2712WLwfcV6ZagNaolNfeYv.jpg','2010-04-10',102,'Released','The greatest comic of his generation. Kicked ass. Took names. Changed the game.','American: The Bill Hicks Story',46105,1.0754,7.4,'GaUvt81gH9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24937,_binary '\0','/rxkG4Gh4vX3oaD8I1lYro5w9G6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11799790',7.7,2194,'id','Sabar Ini Ujian','Sabar relives the same day and gets the opportunity to alter his ex-girlfriend\'s wedding ceremony over and over until he gets the girl of his dream.','/7JsOrZqRdmskTyxr52qf9qy43O.jpg','2020-09-05',126,'Released',NULL,'Sabar Ini Ujian',671046,0.8531,8,'cpVTtFCaMF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24938,_binary '\0','/eXZkcXLaM362rBExUfuZ7CMi1gS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11799822',7.7,1384,'id','Miracle in Cell No. 7','Dodo Rozak just wants to be a good father to his daughter, Kartika, despite his limited intelligence, acts and behaves like children. In fact, it is Kartika who takes care of her father most of the time. Both live happily.','/7UkcMbrurCHTe2CDu9WuIZkCisu.jpg','2022-09-08',145,'Released',NULL,'Miracle in Cell No. 7',665042,1.7475,8,'0uf6QUacVgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24939,_binary '\0','/9Xz0bzUFTVgDZd4WZz1cJDQjLkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11802992',7.7,3462,'ja','映画 ギヴン','Haruki secretly had feelings for Akihiko for years, but Akihiko was still in a relationship with his roommate, the violinist Ugetsu Murata. Haruki, Akihiko, and Ugetsu\'s love clashes and starts to move forward.','/pegCub2zdYD5As43AOmGsIctuKc.jpg','2020-08-22',6