 Aayiram',38637,1.8247,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24944,_binary '\0','/t6sTd4xrODKmAQiGUW3BWM60PzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11807888',5.9,6465,'es','La abuela','Susana leaves her life in Paris, where she works as a model, and returns to Madrid to take care of her grandmother Pilar.','/ri3KIjGp3Ek6iKUsTzMigmxTvdw.jpg','2022-01-28',101,'Released',NULL,'The Grandmother',661791,2.8176,5.9,'ryRCexUiACw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24945,_binary '\0','/smkjSDuCRlOcOAASYTRCZG0MgUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11809034',7.2,12451,'ja','るろうに剣心 最終章 The Final','In 1879, Kenshin and his allies face their strongest enemy yet: his former brother-in-law Enishi Yukishiro and his minions, who\'ve vowed their revenge.','/7bbEASVf9XWtfxWiuWUMY3uyhTb.jpg','2021-04-23',138,'Released','The Future Starts Here','Rurouni Kenshin: The Final',602063,8.9287,7.689,'n1iL-DveFUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24946,_binary '\0','/1vXD5HXqkhvsXFHE7KmCPZGPR1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11813216',7.6,300193,'en','The Banshees of Inisherin','Two lifelong friends find themselves at an impasse when one abruptly ends their relationship, with alarming consequences for both of them.','/4yFG6cSPaCaPhyJ1vtGOtMD1lgh.jpg','2022-10-20',114,'Released','Everything was fine yesterday.','The Banshees of Inisherin',674324,12.8302,7.467,'9-R9u2UD3FU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24947,_binary '\0','/4ehqtwnjbYby9Brk6B1ECtmSiWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11815960',4.9,6883,'ru','Кольская сверхглубокая','In 1984, a Russian research team goes below the surface to find out what secret the world\'s deepest borehole is hiding. On their expedition, something unexpectedly gruesome awaits the researchers.','/1HhlR1XbG1cw7dfAq3rme6Qs1lh.jpg','2020-11-04',113,'Released','No light. No salvation.','Superdeep',579828,4.2162,5.894,'2vfmCzuTsaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24948,_binary '\0','/zg0RRrVBPQus9oPt5ADBOPr14ak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11816092',6.1,8300,'hi','हम दो हमारे दो','Self-made man Dhruv and social media star Anya fall in love and decide to marry. Just one problem - he\'s an orphan because Anya will only marry a guy, who has an adorable family, so the only solution - arrange a \'fake\' set of parents.','/hzBUHsALNaxnoIyUij2qsN71iIh.jpg','2021-10-29',129,'Released',NULL,'Hum Do Hamare Do',798159,1.4077,5.458,'t3efdEAkMgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24949,_binary '\0','/9ObUDVAFRjF1J9fJ7aYD33hM85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181614',6,12745,'en','Wuthering Heights','Yorkshire moorlands, northern England, in the late 18th century. Young Heathcliff, rescued from the streets of Liverpool by Mr. Earnshaw, the owner of Wuthering Heights, an isolated farm, develops over the years an insane passion for Cathy, his foster sister, a sick obsession destined to end tragically.','/7gEcoCve3lmPOIPRp54K73b6rDv.jpg','2011-09-09',124,'Released','Love is a force of nature','Wuthering Heights',9364,4.408,5.9,'dNRAOAxaN74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24950,_binary '\0','/dQhVu7ZSgvgAuYAEoD9mXvqpp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181791',6.4,55061,'en','Black Death','As the plague decimates medieval Europe, rumours circulate of a village immune from the plague. There is talk of a necromancer who leads the village and is able to raise the dead. A fearsome knight joined by a cohort of soldiers and a young monk are charged by the church to investigate. Their journey is filled with danger, but it\'s upon entering the village that their true horror begins.','/gXRERDpyT9s3m2yk6wNmrTWbZfG.jpg','2010-06-07',102,'Released','In an age of darkness, one man will face the ultimate battle against evil.','Black Death',41215,5.7021,6.1,'JkOwLCib1Tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24951,_binary '\0','/n55bDZJxKxMqCew6fDHul1kpXfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181795',6.1,21124,'en','Bunraku','In a world with no guns, a mysterious drifter, a bartender and a young samurai plot revenge against a ruthless leader and his army of thugs, headed by nine diverse and deadly assassins.','/6VG9XFig4djqZEEot3PGGWeIpkf.jpg','2010-09-01',125,'Released','A civilized weapon for uncivilized times','Bunraku',30618,4.152,5.841,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24952,_binary '\0','/rjXK74vrvmFMN0vuFw3TViZ18Ha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181840',6.9,8347,'fr','Jack et la mécanique du cœur','Jack is born with his heart frozen solid on the coldest day in history. A wise midwife saves him by replacing it with a cuckoo clock. Now Jack must abide by three rules to keep his mechanical heart safe: never touch the clock\'s hands, master his anger, and never fall in love. He tries his best, but when he meets a girl named Acacia he falls in love, threatening the delicate balance of his artificial heart.','/ZSrU2mvlzM5Jr30XtKCU1fziIj.jpg','2014-01-29',94,'Released','He must never touch the hands of the clock. He must master his anger. He must never, ever fall in love.','Jack and the Cuckoo-Clock Heart',204436,5.044,7.2,'v7VHN4hGlk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24953,_binary '\0','/w1zCG16xT77PuRD3wZRGKVPPLHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11818818',5.6,4985,'en','God\'s Country','When a grieving college professor confronts two hunters she catches trespassing on her property, she\'s drawn into an escalating battle of wills with catastrophic consequences.','/aZp190Qx33oRO8KGSkO1sFjEqC2.jpg','2022-09-15',102,'Released',NULL,'God\'s Country',879990,4.0424,5.564,'92kQD4fc0a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24954,_binary '\0','/7QtKvkNypPoVSi1n4FNmxluOLB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181919',6.5,1357,'ja','20世紀少年 －最終章－ ぼくらの旗','The final showdown, and the final reveal. Who is Friend? How can he be stopped?','/zf5wTUqciMcSEUjPF5E9O8fBNo9.jpg','2009-08-19',156,'Released',NULL,'20th Century Boys 3: Redemption',39123,2.035,6.7,'qDZZ8bi-e6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24955,_binary '\0','/Ad1D9qkQqICgWrnTFEmciQAgOY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181920',6.3,2090,'ja','20世紀少年－第2章－ 最後の希望','Set 15 years after \"Twentieth Century Boys,\" Kanna (Airi Taira) reunites with several main characters from the first film in an attempt to stop Friend\'s increasing influence over the world and continued plans to eliminate humanity, as detailed in the New Book of Prophecy.','/ej5rGwbyybno1pKDqqTLy7Gwc1T.jpg','2009-01-30',140,'Released',NULL,'20th Century Boys 2: The Last Hope',25114,2.1722,6.7,'lDkoAEmLseM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24956,_binary '\0','/jlEEzu7dXJPli4e8j1u2PW0VMf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1181927',7.4,5062,'de','Der Knochenmann','Set in a sleepy Austrian mountain village, ex-detective Simon Brenner has grown weary of his job repossessing cars and embarks on an extended getaway to the countryside. But before long he becomes embroiled in the convoluted world of the locals of a supposedly quiet town.','/o17Qj2gT4HkU83kU6IlCH2k6jVU.jpg','2009-02-09',117,'Released',NULL,'The Bone Man',21467,1.3945,7.358,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24957,_binary '\0','/4KpNHvQIjyg1YFovRAoUXoFrGnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11819890',6.4,3135,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ココ','In the Forest of Okoya, Koko is a feral child who has been raised as a Pokémon by the Mythical Pokémon Zarude. Koko has grown up never doubting that he is a Pokémon even though he can\'t really use any sort of moves. Ash Ketchum and Pikachu meet Koko and help him protect the Great Tree from the crooked scientist Dr. Zed.','/9Ow7PJcAHMMxgSIjCW6RnRqE9OA.jpg','2020-12-25',101,'Released','A bond like no other...','Pokémon the Movie: Secrets of the Jungle',662708,6.1416,7.2,'ByzhuRr8StU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24958,_binary '\0','/drNH9o8DHvFh648LRdxAm8BMZVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11820950',6.2,13016,'en','The Portable Door','Paul and Sophie, interns at a mysterious London firm, become steadily aware their employers Humphrey and Dennis are anything but conventional – they are disrupting the world of magic by bringing modern corporate strategy to ancient magical practices.','/49NQGuvaMWYeAD22h135tFd2Grs.jpg','2023-03-23',116,'Released',NULL,'The Portable Door',830896,4.5151,6.477,'TLc8IBe1T5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24959,_binary '\0','/23ejgG8aYI702wq6l2uvc0GeWfk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11821818',5.7,1708,'pt','Pai em Dobro','While her mom is away, a teen sneaks out of the hippie commune where she lives and embarks on a life-changing adventure to discover who her father is.','/4oO0eRoCtA8pDV67VRpGeXBhtxH.jpg','2021-01-15',103,'Released','She will find more than an answer.','Double Dad',773998,2.2441,6.6,'Yjq-LSl98Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24960,_binary '\0','/hAQnXxOwCjgYcKRgTdYPRC8neqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11821912',6,23930,'te','Devara: Part 1','Devara, a fearless man from a coastal region, embarks on a perilous journey into the treacherous world of the sea to safeguard the lives of his people. Unbeknownst to him, his brother Bhaira is plotting a conspiracy against him. As events unfold, Devara passes on his legacy to his mild-mannered and timid son, Varada.','/lQfuaXjANoTsdx5iS0gCXlK9D2L.jpg','2024-09-26',175,'Released','When courage turns into a Disease... Fear is the only cure','Devara: Part 1',811941,6.7056,6.8,'S5wQD_0WGTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24961,_binary '\0','/mvUAo9ACgmLpS4Ofc2IwD4n7WCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1182345',7.8,398487,'en','Moon','With only three weeks left in his three-year contract, Sam Bell is eager to return to Earth. Stationed alone at a Moon-based facility with his computer assistant GERTY, an unexpected accident sets off a series of unsettling events that shake his isolation.','/35IU0Mq0zFsN1mYwDGts5mKc77n.jpg','2009-06-12',97,'Released','250,000 miles from home, the hardest thing to face... is yourself.','Moon',17431,8.7392,7.562,'xV5udqNpP94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24962,_binary '\0','/etTUz6C0jTC6uRwTJCYM7NOGidw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1182350',6.3,48990,'en','You Will Meet a Tall Dark Stranger','Two married couples find only trouble and heartache as their complicated lives unfold. After 40 years of marriage, Alfie leaves his wife to pursue what he thinks is happiness with a call girl. His wife, Helena, reeling from abandonment, decides to follow the advice of a psychic. Sally, the daughter of Alfie and Helena, is unhappy in her marriage and develops a crush on her boss, while her husband, Roy, falls for a woman engaged to be married.','/oBhnI8UZQzTkAH1LMEtrBUmfpjS.jpg','2010-09-22',98,'Released',NULL,'You Will Meet a Tall Dark Stranger',38031,5.7666,5.9,'BMOpyl14mII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24963,_binary '\0','/kKTcsbVim7p7hnLpJyZEzn9cYFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1182609',4.2,3277,'en','Direct Contact','An imprisoned ex-US Special forces operative in Eastern Europe, is offered his freedom and money to rescue an American woman, who has been kidnapped by a ruthless warlord. But, shortly after freeing her discovers that the kidnap story was just a ruse to bring her out into the open.','/kVEoVHjy9ULTp28XefHRYkMwZsk.jpg','2009-04-16',90,'Released','They thought he was dead... They were dead wrong.','Direct Contact',20236,5.9482,4.5,'fY2uigFgs_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24964,_binary '\0','/vtlLcXCfUZT8Z2zkh5S26FcKg4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11826240',6.1,2023,'ml','ലളിതം സുന്ദരം','Three siblings, Sunny, Annie, and their younger brother Jerry are disconnected from their roots due to their busy schedule. The siblings reunite for their mother\'s death anniversary and decide to fulfill her last wish. This reunion leads to a series of hilarious incidents that eventually help them repair their dysfunctional familial bonds.','/bYLRXkWe9xyBqWzeP0jaE375uyN.jpg','2022-03-18',119,'Released',NULL,'Lalitham Sundaram',868545,1.0201,5.214,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24965,_binary '\0','/q9y4cNAdKjHPFPEpcmqrmzQO7eA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11826450',5.4,2649,'en','Lady of the Manor','Past and present collide when aimless slacker Hannah gets hired to portray Lady Wadsworth -- a Southern belle from the 1800s -- for tours at Wadsworth Manor. Hannah figures she can fake it well enough, until the ghost of Lady Wadsworth appears and tells her it\'s time to change her wild ways -- or she\'ll haunt her forever.','/n3G5XLqmJSs4RvozoIsqaTWTHRq.jpg','2021-09-17',96,'Released','A high-spirited comedy.','Lady of the Manor',761388,3.7215,5.6,'Hjh92f8Faxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24966,_binary '\0','/9zXPnbVpaDfTniLBuc5vgXGfzAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11827628',5.8,42848,'en','Memory','Alex, an assassin-for-hire, finds that he\'s become a target after he refuses to complete a job for a dangerous criminal organization. With the crime syndicate and FBI in hot pursuit, Alex has the skills to stay ahead, except for one thing: he is struggling with severe memory loss, affecting his every move. Alex must question his every action and whom he can ultimately trust.','/4Q1n3TwieoULnuaztu9aFjqHDTI.jpg','2022-04-28',114,'Released','His mind is fading. His conscience is clear.','Memory',818397,10.3733,6.7,'ye63hQLDj4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24967,_binary '\0','/uwAH0sWz51fXG5d0d86i7UV3o9a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11827806',5.3,1696,'es','Corazón loco','A bigamist with one family in Buenos Aires and the other in Mar del Plata sees his life turned upside down when his wives discover what he has hidden from them for so many years and unite to take revenge.','/uSwCLbElGgz7HzWEHwnSfQtP2OC.jpg','2020-09-09',108,'Released',NULL,