lien soldier with no intention of letting her escape.','/hBLJzYriF9zZAHc2Gjb3KTQGTGT.jpg','2020-10-24',98,'Released',NULL,'Dune Drifter',744738,1.7446,4.6,'_7q1l0ohQQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24984,_binary '\0','/xJO5o209Ok1p0uJafkk1WHtrUJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183665',6.6,22311,'en','Cracks','Jealousy flares after the headmistress of an elite boarding school for girls becomes obsessed with a new student.','/pSVWV04CAWfswP6rqiKJWv0XWzE.jpg','2009-12-04',104,'Released','Innocence isn\'t lost. It\'s taken.','Cracks',35052,4.0256,6.6,'tU2xyM_2jIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24985,_binary '\0','/nEXgu556SPLT6lTv2qAiRaTxlko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183672',6,1760,'fr','La fille du RER','Jeanne is a young woman, striking but otherwise without qualities. Her mother tries to get her a job in the office of a lawyer, Bleistein, her lover years ago. Jeanne fails the interview but falls into a relationship with Franck, a wrestler whose dreams and claims of being in a legitimate business partnership Jeanne is only too happy to believe. When Franck is arrested, he turns on Jeanne for her naivety; she\'s stung and seeks attention by making up a story of an attack on a train. Is there any way out for her?','/nche2N7Iu9hGJJcAKLpmeW4bEcM.jpg','2009-03-18',105,'Released',NULL,'The Girl on the Train',41248,1.8468,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24986,_binary '\0','/yrrxAcoO2vRFGt7nLsrxunLMPCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11836852',6.3,1427,'en','Love in the Forecast','After swearing off dating for a full year, Leah quickly learns her new commitment has made her a magnet for men.','/jM2D5NgBvl7ifSJ5PsreYAxO9vA.jpg','2020-06-13',80,'Released',NULL,'Love in the Forecast',696817,1.9211,6.9,'zVuSCMqYeXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24987,_binary '\0','/6NRBZsOi3sRIbjhYIu1I7IKtqub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183732',5.9,14211,'ja','東京残酷警察','In a futuristic Tokyo where police have been privatized and bitter self-mutilation is so casual that advertising is often specially geared to the \'cutter\' demographic, Ruka is on a mission to avenge her father\'s assassination. Ruka is a cop from a squad whose goal is to destroy homicidal mutant humans known as \'engineers\', that possess the ability to transform any injury to a weapon in and of itself.','/d1LqkFMhFO5lfV3uwEpwyTLxXgR.jpg','2008-10-04',110,'Released','Tokyo Is Burning.','Tokyo Gore Police',16061,3.005,6,'1VqtYgQ0ZXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24988,_binary '\0','/2hxfGpzda1L5OTETxX2qoeS4kN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183907',7.8,4964,'te','మురారి','A family is haunted by a goddess\'s curse, claiming the life of a male every 48 years due to an ancestral sin.','/uVpP7prS0DKqxxVkjz2jFjiasbG.jpg','2001-02-17',170,'Released',NULL,'Murari',85813,1.1429,6.72,'h6oGhK7kE7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24989,_binary '\0','/3txmEFhQDsAM3XMchdQ55G0Lg1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183908',5.6,1877,'en','New Town Killers','Two private bankers, Alistair and Jamie, who have the world at their feet get their kicks from playing a 12 hour game of hunt, hide and seek with people from the margins of society. Their next target is Sean Macdonald a parentless teenager who lives with his sister on a housing estate on the outskirts of Edinburgh. She\'s in debt, he\'s going nowhere fast. Sean agrees to play for cash.','/p6s0Tz8ybCL5TSozJBUM6FQT7vh.jpg','2008-10-28',97,'Released','A game. A hunt. A kill.','New Town Killers',23385,1.6533,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24990,_binary '\0','/83bv87Lgoqx1cPmWWhHqubdgix3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183911',6.4,8302,'en','Mr. Nice','Biopic about 1970s Welsh marijuana trafficker Howard Marks, whose inventive smuggling schemes made him a huge success in the drug trade, as well as leading to dealings with both the IRA and British Intelligence. Based on Marks\' biography with the same title.','/uag1ajVUMuHTXqkX0H52z0FveON.jpg','2010-10-07',121,'Released','43 Aliases. 89 Phone Lines. This is the Story of Howard Marks.','Mr. Nice',46934,1.8806,6.1,'vk_jsXRb17U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24991,_binary '\0','/9mEqSUgNvZXQJnYtQ1TYNuis4o2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183917',4.2,1690,'hi','तीन पत्ती','A professor uses the three-card game to prove his probability thesis. He involves some of his students on his research and later realizes it was a big mistake','/AswMnBevN0MYxAFqvSX3CFg5U9f.jpg','2010-02-26',142,'Released','An Equation That Changed All Other Equations','Teen Patti',34418,1.3191,3.8,'4moFF6kmlf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24992,_binary '\0','/rDuPM3eSQYL4mwGT2lrFyjBFeT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183919',7.9,15041,'en','Marley','Bob Marley\'s universal appeal, impact on music history and role as a social and political prophet is both unique and unparalleled. Directed by Academy Award-winning director Kevin Macdonald (The Last King of Scotland), MARLEY is the definitive life story of the musician, revolutionary, and legend, from his early days to his rise to international superstardom. Made with the support of the Marley family, the film features rare footage, incredible performances and revelatory interviews with the people that knew him best.','/1UQM8zsQ4HhUr4dMgDDDMBrsq5d.jpg','2012-04-20',144,'Released',NULL,'Marley',90125,2.4587,7.5,'YvNlAZ3xqwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24993,_binary '\0','/tl3B9WLoPEUhntU5r7EndEhL0kq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183921',6.8,8371,'en','The Vicious Kind','A man tries to warn his brother away from the new girlfriend he brings home during Thanksgiving, but ends up becoming infatuated with her in the process.','/krPQzshOanbgWiwk7VUO1TF71pg.jpg','2009-12-11',92,'Released','How would you protect someone from their first love?','The Vicious Kind',32868,2.1013,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24994,_binary '\0','/aKess0g91BMSYpq1VLqwaqz83JF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183923',6.9,26127,'en','Welcome to the Rileys','Years after their teenage daughter’s death, Lois and Doug Riley, an upstanding Indiana couple, are frozen by estranging grief. Doug escapes to New Orleans on a business trip. Compelled by urgencies he doesn’t understand, he insinuates himself into the life of an underage hooker, becoming her platonic guardian.','/tt9pBPoXjFu36rPqObwrgkYCY3t.jpg','2010-10-29',110,'Released',NULL,'Welcome to the Rileys',31007,4.5839,6.6,'rH4abdt0Pbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24995,_binary '\0','/5HPaBSYgNUqzFxnxuvYpQMmOvx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1183946',7.3,4011,'hi','The Stoneman Murders','In 1980s Bombay, a serial killer starts targeting homeless street dwellers, whilst a suspended police officer attempts to solve the case.','/crTG6pzI0gQEK8Za5YOtN25Bng4.jpg','2009-02-13',95,'Released',NULL,'The Stoneman Murders',85708,1.0921,6.7,'dNj4SxVqdag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24996,_binary '\0','/gjQPx8PtKIHr3RX73zUV3yTI3oW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11840988',5,1890,'en','Antidote','A young woman is held captive in an underground medical facility where selected individuals are perpetually mutilated and then healed using an experimental miracle drug: a panacea.','/aes8w7v22L1uZCeo28qkfSshqOC.jpg','2021-05-15',87,'Released','Immortality comes with pain','Antidote',720109,1.1939,5.1,'yH8P-puEO-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24997,_binary '\0','/2vDftymNaVXhRULlc2ZGHHDsdnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11847410',7,44065,'en','The Fallout','In the wake of a school tragedy, Vada, Mia and Quinton form a unique and dynamic bond as they navigate the never linear, often confusing journey to heal in a world that feels forever changed.','/4ByHl9XRKR2iXbvF0ZilMRD1RcL.jpg','2021-03-17',96,'Released','Nothing will ever be the same.','The Fallout',795514,8.9166,7.5,'Gtl-6RCOl84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24998,_binary '\0','/ynjC4jKmbGQ04z0G8IxRCww0wHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11847642',6.6,1627,'en','Deliver by Christmas','Bakery owner Molly meets Josh, a widower who recently moved to town with his young son, but she is also charmed by a mysterious client whom she’s never met in person and she doesn’t realize that they’re the same man.','/uFCTa0dj4xJu2RotzrXTTXSkhkf.jpg','2020-10-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Deliver by Christmas',737777,1.8999,6.5,'dRUXBYYJ4bQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(24999,_binary '\0','/mVM9zFpGHHRQ1pS4iPXzenr5EcK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11847972',6.5,1247,'it','Lasciarsi un giorno a Roma','Aspiring writer Tommaso makes a living by penning the self-help column of a women\'s magazine. One day he receives a letter from a reader asking for advice on how to break up with her man: it is none other than Zoe, his partner of ten years, unaware of his pseudonymous side job. Tommaso can\'t believe his eyes and answers her in private to learn more.','/QBRtW9mFjbcginDFQWAL3Q0Lhh.jpg','2021-11-30',116,'Released',NULL,'Breaking Up in Rome',666622,1.8028,6.6,'cMZfFcuLP8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25000,_binary '\0','/twQU6qJMWke3TFoGefYUvDcSvcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1184952',6.2,1627,'tr','Battal Gazi\'nin İntikamı','After the Byzantine emperor\'s brother, Knight Alyon, is killed, Knight Andrea swears revenge and decides to take revenge on Battal Gazi. He first kills Ahmet Turani, then raids the village where Battal lives and the banquet hall, killing people. After killing his wife and kidnapping his beloved child, Battal Gazi takes revenge on the Byzantines. Battal Gazi, who had imposed tribute on the Byzantines and inflicted heavy losses with his incredible bravery, suffers an unexpected blow. The Byzantines set a trap for Cengaver, killing his wife and kidnapping his child. By drugging his son and hypnotizing him to turn him against his father, the Byzantines aim to pit father and son against each other. The young child is raised to believe he is the son of the Byzantine Alyon and to seek revenge on Battal Gazi, whom he believes to be his father\'s killer. Battal Gazi, however, swears to rescue his son at any cost and to mete out the punishment the Byzantines deserve.','/xV8BSLd73IqkKk9srT5aSWFZxIZ.jpg','1973-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Battal Gazi\'s Revenge',452969,0.9479,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25001,_binary '\0','/iSrPHIfvQG5LTR4PU2l2r2d1WW5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11851430',6.8,2898,'el','Η Μπαλάντα της Τρύπιας Καρδιάς','In a small town in Greece, when amorous passion meets with greed money, dead bodies start pilling up and \"Sleeping Beauty\" Olga will never know the horrors she has been spared of.','/oKa3eZpoqG6Rt6tW7li81LuY4k6.jpg','2020-03-05',140,'Released','A million ways to love.','Ballad for a Pierced Heart',691853,1.1808,6.9,'ByYdD632sJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25002,_binary '\0','/e77LAFvZq5KteWsKxuc5nP9B6OD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11851548',5.9,55007,'en','Orphan: First Kill','After escaping from an Estonian psychiatric facility, Leena Klammer travels to America by impersonating Esther, the missing daughter of a wealthy family. But when her mask starts to slip, she is put against a mother who will protect her family from the murderous “child” at any cost.','/pHkKbIRoCe7zIFvqan9LFSaQAde.jpg','2022-07-27',99,'Released','There\'s always been something wrong with Esther.','Orphan: First Kill',760161,12.8491,6.6,'_uX6of3vBu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25003,_binary '\0','/4X5zGNdTJM8FgJ7SjE37AlPINmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11851698',8.4,1787,'en','Dio: Dreamers Never Die','This career spanning documentary on heavy metal legend Ronnie James Dio delves deep into his incredible rise from 50\'s doo-wop crooner, to his early classic rock days in Ritchie Blackmore\'s Rainbow, to replacing the iconic lead singer Ozzy Osborne in Black Sabbath, to finally cement his legend with DIO. Ronnie\'s biography is completely unique to the tired sex, drugs and rock and roll cliches. The film is about perseverance, dreams and the power to believe in yourself.','/a8AR4SkNm9aDSMTwbobKVEave2P.jpg','2022-09-28',116,'Released',NULL,'Dio: Dreamers Never Die',934670,1.7228,7.7,'nrB_wPHV9BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25004,_binary '\0','/3Nv0rwP9u1CFyXbkqHGuNybtKHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185242',5.2,2717,'en','Finding Bliss','Jody Balaban, an aspiring filmmaker, is fresh to L.A. with New York film school accolades and the dream of making her movie. Unable to get a job where she can use the skills she so finely honed, Jody must edit adult entertainment to make ends meet. The uncompromising desire to make her movie, leads Jody to secretly film in the porn studio facilities at night - until she is caught in the act.','/btTbG2BGuyL9s3Ne3GFZMKB8oBT.jpg','2009-01-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Finding Bliss',31896,1.8243,4.6,'bAcvFHfP5QM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25005,_binary '\0','/2pi332EvEQjhV2YaqOeSC4VgVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185264',4.9,3125,'en','Red Mist','A young doctor in a US hospital administers a powerful and untested cocktail of drugs to a coma victim. But instead of curing him, it triggers a powerful \"out-of-body\" experience and enables the patient - a depraved and dangerous loner - to inhabit other people\'s bodies and, through them, take revenge on the bullying medical students who were accidentally responsible for his condition.','/9R3lcDTyb2342Dx0KEsMpWgWtU.jpg','2008-08-22',98,'Released','Do Not Resuscitate','Red Mist',15011,1.8317,5,'gdqmGlaDvBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25006,_binary '\0','/8K4E1Cniy5HRbpGO26lj5fYvZRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185266',3.6,16078,'en','Stan Helsing','A spoof on many horror movie series. Ending his shift at the video rental, Stan\'s picked up by his BFF and 2 cute girls, all going to a Halloween party. Will they even get there?','/qDlmKahejt0NoQzw65tnLayEhHZ.jpg','2009-10-23',90,'Released','The most feared monsters in cinematic history have met their match...','Stan Helsing',23988,3.9848,4.2,'srbmLtGc6vQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25007,_binary '\0','/dppFQVBFjqJXTdBAqrlkfPOrAZf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185344',6.2,1999,'en','Princess Ka\'iulani','Ka\'iulani, a 19th-century Hawaiian princess, is raised in England but determined to maintain her people\'s independence from aggressive American businessmen. After being sent to England as a child by her Scottish father, Ka\'iulani returns to Hawaii and becomes a political activist who fights to retain her throne, even though she must leave her English paramour.','/6dsQxILe0AHmQoxhK8O9dXpLTYd.jpg','2010-05-14',130,'Released','Her heart was torn between love and the future of Hawaii...','Princess Kaiulani',39806,1.9791,5.7,'9_l0XK43IZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25008,_binary '\0','/2BAnYQIHPpPBByMZrc5oObYPHmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185371',7.5,2882,'en','Corman\'s World','A chronicle of the long career of American filmmaker Roger Corman, the most tenacious and ingenious low-budget producer and director in the US film industry, a pioneer of independent filmmaking and discoverer of new talent.','/wnHm6TWNLjwHjfqpocxgPCMEQvS.jpg','2011-12-16',91,'Released','Some men dream of conquering the world. Roger Corman created his own.','Corman\'s World',56591,2.6031,7.039,'ngsD17ZAglE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25009,_binary '\0','/6DpC5bWMK4ojqDraYW9J8yIFMtw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185376',5.9,2609,'en','Map of the Sounds of Tokyo','A Japanese assassin falls in love with the Spanish wine seller she was hired to kill.','/fXUvJlnQdB8hBiBRumpFj8hj0Wl.jpg','2009-12-02',109,'Released',NULL,'Map of the Sounds of Tokyo',46458,2.1575,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25010,_binary '\0','/vz1D3veOdcvwrA21iIkmamhxMa2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185412',4.6,10257,'hi','वीर','A Pindari Prince goes to England to study military tactics so that he can avenge his people, but while there, he falls in love.','/v09SoSyKjooHn4pmOwa4v58lE5U.jpg','2010-01-22',160,'Released',NULL,'Veer',30886,1.7661,5,'9DOnWSzszgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25011,_binary '\0','/raQIYTSZ7vtHgqzZBX4oDj9Tp1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185416',5.5,67438,'en','When in Rome','Disillusioned with romance, Beth, an ambitious New Yorker, travels to Rome for her sister\'s wedding, where she plucks magic coins from a special fountain of love. The coins attract unwanted attention from an assortment of odd yet ardent suitors: a sausage merchant, a street magician, an artist, and a male model. But when the best man from the wedding, persistent reporter Nick, throws his hat in the ring, Beth wonders if his love is the real thing.','/pteIGpJpgh2aUh3jMqZnomB1rw1.jpg','2010-01-29',91,'Released','All is fair in love and Rome.','When in Rome',13477,7.1379,5.9,'1tl9EMqLrWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25012,_binary '\0','/p26jL2P6AQ6B9Kw3fx4VxO3vKR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185418',7.7,4306,'en','The Wrecking Crew','A celebration of the musical work of a group of session musicians known as \"The Wrecking Crew.\" a band that provided back-up instrumentals to such legendary recording artists as Frank Sinatra, The Beach Boys, and Bing Crosby.','/kttijtZRFbuFQe0s7S3Fvv8JiTI.jpg','2008-03-11',101,'Released','There was one band behind them all...','The Wrecking Crew',70027,2.0123,7.3,'SX5BCgmr7tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25013,_binary '\0','/yxW0sz9kZS37g52JUp07kSdV1dv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185420',6.4,17483,'hi','दोस्ताना','Two straight guys pretend to be a gay couple to secure a posh Miami apartment, but fall for their gorgeous roommate. Hilarity ensues as they strive to convince everyone of the ruse while secretly trying to win her heart.','/obwjlgNI2NFZupMuJBbKgH3IhQp.jpg','2008-11-13',141,'Released','A story about two guys... a girl... and one little lie. Believe it!','Dostana',14071,2.2722,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25014,_binary '\0','/jaz6VRUvwmYxvfovS5iUxsqM85j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185431',6.5,10082,'en','My One and Only','A mother takes her two sons on an unusual road trip from New York to Pittsburgh, St. Louis and eventually Hollywood in her quest to find a man to take care of them all.','/niwRJ18nJurSFEVHoeVaPsJVWoL.jpg','2009-08-21',108,'Released',NULL,'My One and Only',26820,4.228,6.6,'ofKlVWEKGxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25015,_binary '\0','/lj75MIYF4fnnONdkLphFrwZ67DM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185442',5.7,5859,'hi','क़ुरबान','When a handsome young Indian couple (Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor) moves into the suburbs to claim their stake in the American dream, they are shocked to discover that they\'ve become enmeshed in a secretive terrorist plot. But as tensions escalate, the bride begins to wonder if her husband has told her everything he knows.','/eLG5R5pgVpTMFQbVeGhcUu1xSH1.jpg','2009-11-20',161,'Released','Some Love Stories Have Blood On Them','Kurbaan',24613,2.0875,4.979,'sq21uDe5Zok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25016,_binary '\0','/cMoiIk3tD6qshxccYRjjym7l5YV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185616',8,62934,'he','ואלס עם באשיר','A film director from Israel interviews fellow veterans of the 1982 invasion of Lebanon to reconstruct his own memories of his term of service in that conflict.','/zQaCv7lKwHsh0YSHkt1QNjIOZ1c.jpg','2008-06-12',90,'Released','One man\'s journey to uncover his past.','Waltz with Bashir',8885,3.4884,7.7,'XbXdwBNkCmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25017,_binary '\0','/eVA4ztLIuPEsokkgQ3NRt9rTRVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185834',6,84463,'en','Star Wars: The Clone Wars','As the Clone Wars sweep through the galaxy, Anakin Skywalker and his new Padawan learner Ahsoka Tano plunge into a dangerous mission to rescue the kidnapped son of crime lord Jabba the Hutt.','/iJQfixW818LUdSXlCDL3JZm0S0g.jpg','2008-08-05',98,'Released','A galaxy divided!','Star Wars: The Clone Wars',12180,8.7874,6.163,'Tas9_TYri4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25018,_binary '\0','/qTlWKxm3HP3i97CiUQEdpXPDZKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1185836',7.1,36944,'en','Adam','Adam, a lonely man with Asperger\'s Syndrome, develops a relationship with his upstairs neighbor, Beth.','/sSN5ec7llAzv0Up7wAQ9qeOM0lS.jpg','2009-07-07',99,'Released','A story about two strangers. One a little stranger than the other...','Adam',22051,2.9434,6.8,'92U6OnVZG3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25019,_binary '\0','/kjQBrc00fB2RjHZB3PGR4w9ibpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11858890',6.7,205086,'en','The Creator','Amid a future war between the human race and the forces of artificial intelligence, a hardened ex-special forces agent grieving the disappearance of his wife, is recruited to hunt down and kill the Creator, the elusive architect of advanced AI who has developed a mysterious weapon with the power to end the war—and mankind itself.','/3dSivDtOuyxLDxPH4v2tcNG1fP7.jpg','2023-09-27',134,'Released','This is a fight for our very existence.','The Creator',670292,22.8447,7.025,'573GCxqkYEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25020,_binary '\0','/zb85NiC3cjrH8HR1E2tB5gU5nxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11859012',5.3,9644,'en','The Girl Who Got Away','A female serial killer who killed four young girls is sent away to prison, but a fifth victim escaped with her life. Twenty years later, the killer escapes and begins hunting for the one who got away.','/eCzmo6Lt8YUdq62QzurbgHe4gLS.jpg','2021-08-20',117,'Released',NULL,'The Girl Who Got Away',855228,2.907,6.265,'TheZLR9m0ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25021,_binary '\0','/eyY9JyVaVdKIRV6WbnHxGwxHWiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1186248',5.8,2076,'en','Nights and Weekends','A man and woman must face the tension that builds between them during a long-distance relationship.','/zFPvD0dxmqrfKu0qqAgzGVEfCn3.jpg','2008-10-10',80,'Released','Distance is not always measured in miles.','Nights and Weekends',48204,1.2933,5.6,'5PyE0BJiZtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25022,_binary '\0','/3m0IVsFwO8p0Nz0jEzyJnbFLUtO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11863046',6.6,3673,'en','Black Holes: The Edge of All We Know','Black holes stand at the limit of what we can know. To explore that edge of knowledge, the Event Horizon Telescope links observatories across the world to simulate an earth-sized instrument. With this tool the team pursues the first-ever picture of a black hole, resulting in an image seen by billions of people in April 2019. Meanwhile, Hawking and his team attack the black hole paradox at the heart of theoretical physics—Do predictive laws still function, even in these massive distortions of space and time? Weaving them together is a third strand, philosophical and exploratory using expressive animation. “Edge” is about practicing science at the highest level, a film where observation, theory, and philosophy combine to grasp these most mysterious objects.','/b9q9K2OqagIIMd1JcmDo38cDFzK.jpg','2020-03-18',99,'Released','The quest to understand the most mysterious object in the universe.','Black Holes: The Edge of All We Know',686002,2.0422,6.6,'5yOExnfxJ8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25023,_binary '\0','/uTCdCQMMpiiicIzkSmyI5vw42lP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1186366',7.2,4827,'ru','Морфий','The year is 1917. We are in the Russian countryside. It is the middle of freezing winter. A pale young, newly educated doctor arrives. Having to deal with one medical challenge after another he soon becomes the center of everyone\'s attention. To soothe the impressions of human suffering he turns to morphine.','/xj1qdtzJp1XDdobTSVULVYTSbDM.jpg','2008-11-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Morphine',51284,1.362,6.846,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25024,_binary '\0','/44Yi72Ut3NchXewQzx814ViE2dy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1186367',6.3,80375,'en','Ninja Assassin','Ninja Assassin follows Raizo, one of the deadliest assassins in the world. Taken from the streets as a child, he was transformed into a trained killer by the Ozunu Clan, a secret society whose very existence is considered a myth. But haunted by the merciless execution of his friend by the Clan, Raizo breaks free from them and vanishes. Now he waits, preparing to exact his revenge.','/ipJ4mgqse6uoTRsDyU3TXmva1rt.jpg','2009-09-29',99,'Released','Fear not the weapon, but the hand that wields it.','Ninja Assassin',22832,16.4092,6.779,'H6tg0YwLJQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25025,_binary '\0','/rnxoI9ojYhReuBgb1gxkejpS55i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1186369',7.1,9463,'fr','Le Silence de Lorna','Lorna is a young Albanian woman in a marriage of convenience with Claudy, a heroin addict. Just as Lorna is about to be granted Belgian citizenship, Claudy finds the strength to detox; this presents a problem not only for Lorna, but for the criminal who brokered the deal.','/rwQPg2DgFygbZjdupJcedPEm0JN.jpg','2008-08-27',105,'Released','The destiny of a woman caught between love and the laws of the underworld.','Lorna\'s Silence',8899,2.6252,6.767,'QFgSmuu-q20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25026,_binary '\0','/s9F5NR4Iic3RaE9qk1MkjA1mz3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1186370',5.8,43573,'en','Spread','A gigolo must contend with the prospect that he has found true love.','/27iaV68VjKWQabPhnklWD1kCqb1.jpg','2009-01-16',98,'Released','It\'s a business 