Alexandria and her relationship with her slave Davus, who is torn between his love for her and the possibility of gaining his freedom by joining the rising tide of Christianity.','/1xsFa6I5vDd2UI1AJ1tsW7BUChv.jpg','2009-05-17',127,'Released','Alexandria, Egypt. 391 A.D. The World Changed Forever.','Agora',26428,5.3089,7,'RbuEhwselE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25036,_binary '\0','/vJRKUPV4MCBfYDwkhLdniWXzpyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1187041',6.4,7921,'en','The Answer Man','Twenty years ago, Arlen Faber wrote a book about spirituality that became wildly popular. These days, he\'s a curmudgeonly recluse who only enjoys the company of his chiropractor, Elizabeth. As Elizabeth\'s warmth starts to melt Arlen\'s cold heart, he comes to realize what love really means.','/51oHIuuWq2s8Cpd3knNMJRsawoY.jpg','2009-07-23',95,'Released','He wrote the book on life\'s big questions. But the truth is he hasn\'t got a clue.','The Answer Man',20407,2.376,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25037,_binary '\0','/u7kuUaySqXBVAtqEl9vkTkAzHV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1187043',8.4,489619,'hi','3 Idiots','Rascal. Joker. Dreamer. Genius... You\'ve never met a college student quite like \"Rancho.\" From the moment he arrives at India\'s most prestigious university, Rancho\'s outlandish schemes turn the campus upside down—along with the lives of his two newfound best friends. Together, they make life miserable for \"Virus,\" the school’s uptight and heartless dean. But when Rancho catches the eye of the dean\'s daughter, Virus sets his sights on flunking out the \"3 idiots\" once and for all.','/66A9MqXOyVFCssoloscw79z8Tew.jpg','2009-12-23',171,'Released','Aal Izz Well!','3 Idiots',20453,15.2009,8.011,'zIKu9k50SDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25038,_binary '\0','/aqt3fUGbTlxvHAnsZeWXCwq32Dq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1187044',7.3,6886,'es','La nana','Raquel has been the live-in housekeeper for a kind, reasonably wealthy family for half her life, and the joyless repetition of the job has begun to take its toll. Increasingly dependent on painkillers, Raquel resorts to pranks and childish avoidance to antagonize the family’s college-age daughter and a procession of new servants, all in the hopes of protecting her precarious power within the home. Her antics successfully push everyone away, until new maid Lucy actually pushes back.','/1JeiuLk0xBHgc4tX0FxoZYb0OpV.jpg','2009-08-13',96,'Released','She\'s almost part of the family.','The Maid',27567,1.8158,6.7,'mTY8CJhvjOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25039,_binary '\0','/fsvgx9jc55cw9gWliLh8KKVMyA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1187047',3.7,2667,'de','1½ Ritter - Auf der Suche nach der hinreißenden Herzelinde','The story of Lanze who is in love with the princess. One day the princess is kidnapped by the Dark Knight and Lanze starts his journey to rescue her. But he is not alone because Erdal, a turk, joins him on his journey.','/nk3fmnVbnrtJ4tukuuwpIoxbcRk.jpg','2008-12-17',116,'Released',NULL,'1½ Ritter - Auf der Suche nach der hinreißenden Herzelinde',9510,2.1935,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25040,_binary '\0','/rlVpm5r7vZYyU9JHWf9UGOVDo5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1187064',6.9,152149,'en','Triangle','When Jess sets sail on a yacht with a group of friends, she cannot shake the feeling that there is something wrong.','/cRlMrbc4Iof7vN0ZqHwJnMBYBLi.jpg','2009-10-16',99,'Released','Fear Comes in Waves','Triangle',26466,9.6866,6.9,'17XqBdCiHOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25041,_binary '\0','/9eA8jtC0efg3BGnUmhEthETbVFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11871074',5.3,4564,'pl','Dziewczyny z Dubaju','Based on a true story, Emi — a young, ambitious girl, dreams about life outside her small town. When an opportunity arises to become an exclusive escort, she jumps in without hesitation. Soon she climbs the ranks and starts her own VIP escort service; recruiting Polish celebrities, actors, singers, and models. However, the luxurious and enticing world eventually shows its dark side.','/oAdg6estkW0Ud9yBxEPPpHflszZ.jpg','2021-11-26',136,'Released','What\'s your price?','Girls to Buy',881764,7.9056,5.949,'Yjs8Q16pKnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25042,_binary '\0','/bcHKkBPbHvZBMCi3TtgtxrmKZSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11873440',2.2,28305,'hi','Heropanti 2','Babloo is a computer genius and Inaaya is a self-made billionaire. The two fall in love but due to unforeseen circumstances they suddenly part ways as the cybercrime lord, Laila wants him dead.','/cfKTqIwMRYblzesiidC91E1g5Cf.jpg','2022-04-29',142,'Released','The world wants him dead.','Heropanti 2',678835,1.3673,3.6,'HC1nKHybA24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25043,_binary '\0','/sHJmDOvewSELRmTUbYovR5nSFiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11873472',6.5,1319,'rw','Neptune Frost','In the hilltops of Burundi, a group of escaped coltan miners form an anti-colonialist computer hacker collective. From their camp in an otherworldly e-waste dump, they attempt a takeover of the authoritarian regime exploiting the region\'s natural resources – and its people. When an intersex runaway and an escaped coltan miner find each other through cosmic forces, their connection sparks glitches within the greater divine circuitry.','/emlTdAiMcJDomw6Tjz2lFCSen8W.jpg','2022-06-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Neptune Frost',671109,1.7116,5.8,'acfBNIXovww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25044,_binary '\0','/nveMpkEf1XNu325Ahxk65BI41Qp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11874226',8.2,6041,'en','David Byrne\'s American Utopia','A filmed version of David Byrne\'s Broadway show, a unifying musical celebration that inspires audiences to connect to each other and to the global community.','/sHVeVCNhlY2asvoGsSMP5HOLbCI.jpg','2020-09-10',105,'Released',NULL,'David Byrne\'s American Utopia',668800,2.2262,7.5,'lg4hcgtjDPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25045,_binary '\0','/fEQZhYwDsnlkVRJYTMB682et3tE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11876896',7.4,2241,'en','Torn','When world renowned climber Alex Lowe was tragically lost in a deadly avalanche, his best friend and climbing partner went on to marry his widow and help raise his three sons. This profoundly intimate film from eldest son Max, captures the family\'s intense personal journey toward understanding as they finally lay him to rest.','/A2FQq9rXzIp9uMLnhB15686Y6uJ.jpg','2021-12-03',92,'Released','The bigger the life, the greater the risk.','Torn',730057,5.4228,7,'BuAH6MjKFRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25046,_binary '\0','/At1pczTcm5IxIymUBvJz9B7anz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11877386',6.5,2165,'it','L\'ombra di Caravaggio','The Catholic Church secretly investigates Caravaggio as the Pope weighs whether to grant him clemency for killing a rival.','/cwP6AsukkXRguAHMgjM3DOWfITH.jpg','2022-11-03',120,'Released',NULL,'Caravaggio\'s Shadow',693349,3.3447,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25047,_binary '\0','/tVcpdJQjrI1pcWRf4rpiQNHMXQT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11879338',6.5,1519,'ar','تسليم أهالي','When Khalil and Zahia discover a deep dark secret about their newly married parents, they find themselves on a rollercoaster of unexpected events.','/ecLiw0R09wvmKLQLs4u4dUCztDk.jpg','2022-08-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Handing Them Over',973921,1.1588,6,'a_wtuNPA-is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25048,_binary '\0','/k39ygrzNnTJg1igFCpxZZcpTyBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188113',6.2,13424,'en','Peacock','A minor train accident in rural Nebraska gradually unveils a mystery involving the town\'s reclusive bank clerk.','/iEtrsxfNw9qmAeML3QSzOe0hrS0.jpg','2010-04-20',90,'Released','If he only knew what she was doing?','Peacock',11761,2.6356,6.122,'NPEzcAG4E5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25049,_binary '\0','/hm8gTyliPMvcC9ikt0njV18cS3Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11881160',5.6,7944,'en','Gaia','In the depths of an ancient forest, something has been growing. Something older than humanity itself, and perhaps greater too. When a park ranger discovers a man and his son living wild, she stumbles onto a secret that is about to change the world.','/v8cwfPwjHDWf5s5MxvLvcfnxPLL.jpg','2021-06-18',97,'Released','She will transform us','Gaia',795853,3.1204,5.927,'3Srz5g8PWAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25050,_binary '\0','/2M5V8VcK02o4R5cxe7Ew1ltaxKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188729',6.7,169328,'en','Pandorum','Two crew members wake up on an abandoned spacecraft with no idea who they are, how long they\'ve been asleep, or what their mission is. The two soon discover they\'re actually not alone – and the reality of their situation is more horrifying than they could have imagined.','/mNMfa6r3pl0EzFIKEkVcxyr6Rc7.jpg','2009-09-08',108,'Released','Don\'t fear the end of the world. Fear what happens next.','Pandorum',19898,6.805,6.6,'9q42L4XNVhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25051,_binary '\0','/ezx6Rub8x4Xq6MyiEpWHhHtLBeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11887316',7.5,4349,'es','El maestro que prometió el mar','The buried memories of the Spanish Civil War are unearthed as a woman searches for the remains of her grandfather\'s father and discovers the story of an idealistic young teacher from Tarragona.','/sPc3cUblFw527YslR5ISAfQ3xSN.jpg','2023-11-10',105,'Released','Based on the true story of Antoni Benaiges.','The Teacher Who Promised the Sea',1024541,2.9849,7.7,'B_Ifh-5E_9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25052,_binary '\0','/980k2RFQNW4aJTibTlGe35cRryU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188982',5.1,22920,'hi','जय हो','An upright ex-army man, Jai fights a solitary war against corruption and injustice. With a simple mantra to pay forward, he starts off by helping one person and forms an ever growing circle of people helping each other.','/AqBZOaWfRBkq64ASen8ulETPWrx.jpg','2014-01-24',145,'Released',NULL,'Jai Ho',244237,2.3256,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25053,_binary '\0','/l5EJbCalhOnGeSo3iJ4SGCU57xS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188983',5.9,2335,'fr','Bellamy','A well known Parisian inspector becomes involved in an investigation while on holiday.','/l1BSVVS4byoPRqm9MeYvlTZin3G.jpg','2009-02-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Bellamy',15576,2.2017,5.7,'aYRnEQ45qPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25054,_binary '\0','/gRLLj1qQwERu3EOApCiCYCz5fK4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188985',5.6,1748,'es','Castillos de cartón','In an attempt to help his friend Marcos with his impotence, Jaime sets up him up with another friend Josita. But the sex date fails, and so he comes in to help. What first appears to be just another sexual experience for all three evolves to a full romantic relationship.','/h61c54Dc5Ax6PbCVNxr3aIywKLA.jpg','2009-10-25',94,'Released',NULL,'3some',44114,2.0679,5.985,'8E7m2A4UFDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25055,_binary '\0','/lePVhFlkuRsE24agMApfg1V4wrB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188988',6.2,2370,'it','Ex','Six people struggling with their relationship, or lack thereof, cross paths with their respective exes — and discover they might still harbor feelings for each other.','/hQ5R1mZMaAT7wuyytBHxUeXuzZC.jpg','2009-02-06',120,'Released',NULL,'Ex',15681,1.6549,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25056,_binary '\0','/kSKMR5Fn1ICS4nTwyQ9YZR5rTgG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188990',6.1,10851,'no','Fritt vilt II','After surviving the events in the Jotunheimen mountains in which four of her friends were murdered, the badly injured Jannicke is brought to the local hospital. But when she wakes up, the building is dark and deserted... and she soon realizes that her nightmare isn’t over yet.','/bDLIGTF9gGbnyJOezqJJ7VO9dv9.jpg','2008-10-09',90,'Released','She thought her nightmare was over... She was wrong!','Cold Prey II',15440,4.332,6.31,'EZrr1EXoDEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25057,_binary '\0','/r9cM1DqMs734SmSbLpIpBAcqVnk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188992',6.4,1438,'fi','Haarautuvan rakkauden talo','The story recounts the breakup of a thirty-something professional couple - Juhani, a family therapist, and his wife, Tuula, a successful business trainer.','/y8au9fWMhLYPjXbXZwnqCFgvobu.jpg','2009-08-21',107,'Released',NULL,'The House of Branching Love',29007,1.5035,5.6,'cTuOH0MUTZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25058,_binary '\0','/zGCnIADWwpjGllYv8DgT8HIuIQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188996',7.9,124270,'hi','My Name Is Khan','Rizwan Khan, a Muslim from the Borivali section of Mumbai, has Asperger\'s syndrome. He marries a Hindu single mother, Mandira, in San Francisco. After 9/11, Rizwan is detained by authorities at LAX who treat him as a terrorist because of his condition and his race.','/5Y36lCiNyyV71mjq6LavgiggbhT.jpg','2010-02-10',165,'Released','An ordinary man, an extraordinary journey... FOR LOVE.','My Name Is Khan',26022,8.7858,8,'nqxgYT3TYzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25059,_binary '\0','/26nwpTOCxzx0YeOzWORxfhQN8vo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1188998',6.3,2247,'fi','Kielletty hedelmä','Two 18-year old girls from a christian fundamentalist community flee to a city for a summer job.','/pLLeYpYp71klc00YnYvAjT5tcP6.jpg','2009-02-13',104,'Released','Do you remember the first time you did something forbidden?','Forbidden Fruit',22326,1.023,6.3,'jRQ1Yog85SE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25060,_binary '\0','/c8iNCIaeYf57pwnJtkkoH2kesTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189004',5.9,1469,'en','Radeloos','In Radeloos, Yara has had a crush on Paco for a while. He goes to her school and DJs at parties. But Paco is into Floor and doesn\'t notice her. Could it be because she\'s too fat? Yara\'s mother wants her daughter to become a model, but Yara actually wants to go to art school. She decides to lose weight by eating less.','/9d3OE77SYgGZo2rgjtg8lNeKp4R.jpg','2008-10-02',115,'Released',NULL,'Radeloos',17892,1.5542,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25061,_binary '\0','/rkHHuoxxzN5FlDwNTm9qDFhYpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189006',5,5278,'hi','टूनपुर का सुपरहीरो','There is trouble brewing in the land of cartoons-Toonpur. The good guys of Toonpur and the bad guys are at constant war. That\'s when Devtoons decide to take superstar action hero Aditya\'s help and get him down to Toonpur. But things are not as simple as the Devtoons had thought.','/2apBkbLd19aivVAES4lboFeqtwC.jpg','2010-12-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Toonpur Ka Superrhero',58046,1.3664,4.941,'zxNcFnOTtCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25062,_binary '\0','/rO1jhonjv2ABa72c0YTPc1a7MVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189008',5.9,1236,'nl','Wit Licht','Eduard Zuiderwijk (Marco Borsato) runs a restaurant in Africa. When his wife (Ricky Koole) suddenly dies, he is left to take care of his son Thomas (Siebe Schoneveld) on his own. When his son\'s best friend Abu (Andrew Kintu) is abducted by a rebel leader to be trained as a child soldier, Eduard goes in pursuit to save the boy and regain his son\'s respect.','/lx0BSGJmmNRHvVo8AWu173Ou9RA.jpg','2008-12-11',115,'Released','A Father. A Missing Child. A Mission.','The Silent Army',17772,0.8895,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25063,_binary '\0','/oPxTkDKK2NcHcAEADATWiXKOkFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189073',7.6,182317,'es','La piel que habito','A brilliant plastic surgeon creates a synthetic skin that withstands any kind of damage. His guinea pig: a mysterious and volatile woman who holds the key to his obsession.','/xa7uCwGYykrf8MMI8iF5dZvNlrG.jpg','2011-08-17',120,'Released','The things the love of a madman can do...','The Skin I Live In',63311,10.9579,7.5,'PavJUoZNT7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25064,_binary '\0','/jMioXFCbMiuE20nx6HQaqhJnFfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189076',5.8,3411,'fr','Ricky','When Katie meets Paco, they fall in love. From this an extraordinary child is born: Ricky, who quickly develops into something wonderful and not so normal.','/p7vFsyUDvoGbhmuXZs97vv5TVdO.jpg','2009-02-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Ricky',22136,2.4839,5.738,'sKt75X1tuo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25065,_binary '\0','/9oEbhx52BOgHvnOYisrVROfwt94.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11891246',4.9,3239,'en','Lullaby','A new mother discovers a lullaby in an ancient book and soon regards the song as a blessing. But her world transforms into a nightmare when the lullaby brings forth the ancient demon Lilith.','/vmE4gZ9vy8ammgS2UsEh0Z1OCia.jpg','2022-12-16',86,'Released','Have you checked the baby?','Lullaby',702621,2.6704,5.2,'6G160zudOAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25066,_binary '\0','/xE0ZIQ0uUwyVBugVCobrhU5hyme.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11891850',7.1,9523,'en','Hard Truths','Pansy is a woman so full of rage that every interaction she has devolves into lashing out, whether at her utterly cowed husband and son, or random strangers who have the temerity to address her. In contrast, her younger sister Chantelle lives with her two vivacious daughters and plies a successful trade as a hairdresser, putting clients at their ease all day long. Yet beneath Pansy’s abrasive exterior are hints of a more fragile psyche, one motivated by fear and damaged by repressed pain.','/eEj1TGrGc4IQ8bscFC17Ggdg6ft.jpg','2024-12-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Hard Truths',1013154,4.9404,6.4,'nftgaoHrEDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25067,_binary '\0','/3DBhIX9FRf2g3svswkJKGvTrvX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11891870',7.1,1495,'ml','ബിരിയാണി','The movie chronicles the life of Khadeeja, a married muslim woman confined within the four walls of the household, forced to conceal her desires in the name of religious and societal norms. When fate brings her to an abandoned life, she chooses a different way of financially and sexually liberating herself- to be a sex worker; soon to realize that her soul is still dissatisfied. Finding a new way of hope, she decides to give back to the forces that pushed her to live an orphaned life of humiliation and misery.','/9AdKBT5pLaD1fUPOtCdCnITWSAD.jpg','2021-03-26',95,'Released','Flavors of Flesh','Biriyaani',716330,1.4444,6.364,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25068,_binary '\0','/vJ3ED2jPblACDqaJPZlbN6T1yjy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11892272',6.9,5678,'es','Las leyes de la frontera','Introverted Girona student Nacho meets two delinquents from the city\'s Chinatown and gets caught up in a summer onslaught of burglaries and hold ups that will change his life.','/qrq7sGXraFM6H9OcHFKQTKe8A3f.jpg','2021-10-08',125,'Released',NULL,'Outlaws',776821,3.1653,6.864,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25069,_binary '\0','/sQcjtTZ8tsIvPysJL1znHjtHRjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11892482',6.6,1410,'eu','Ilargi guztiak','During the final throes of the last Carlist war, a little girl is rescued from an orphanage by a mysterious woman who lives deep inside the forest.','/cqvw0kxVQ4HPYFZYRzESNGr4psz.jpg','2020-12-25',102,'Released','Not all stories are for children','All the Moons',776670,2.2909,7.4,'nXtRZmotkHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25070,_binary '\0','/3isn5fRNoOEZmtz1LARV9rMoagJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189259',6.1,2268,'en','The Pleasure of Being Robbed','A curious and lost Eleonore looks for something everywhere, even in the bags of strangers who find themselves sadly smiling only well after she\'s left their lives. They owe her their thanks.','/u4TVFGuAgx75OEsYwpVn1ESp6iC.jpg','2008-10-03',71,'Released',NULL,'The Pleasure of Being Robbed',42585,1.7307,5.7,'phEGtIyBH0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25071,_binary '\0','/syuRL8LkPz4HguGAxAwvUt3HWlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11892916',5.1,2624,'it','Security','After the assault of a young woman in their seaside town, a security expert and his family get caught in a powerful riptide of secrets and lies.','/wLjN3vIw63GJ6m1J2fhGL3D2VXd.jpg','2021-06-07',118,'Released',NULL,'Security',666624,1.8079,5.505,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25072,_binary '\0','/5CUdP1wrg4S6yZrDHuW3JLohYLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11893274',7.4,15089,'en','Downfall: The Case Against Boeing','Investigators reveal how Boeing’s alleged priority of profit over safety could have contributed to two catastrophic crashes within months of each other.','/LRPi6b6gpDyKuveut38S8R38NI.jpg','2022-02-09',89,'Released',NULL,'Downfall: The Case Against Boeing',913862,4.6452,7.1,'vt-IJkUbAxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25073,_binary '\0','/j9QaQVuyQIEwckUbjHpAgA7E4jJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189340',7.3,272815,'en','The Lincoln Lawyer','Mick Haller is a charismatic defense attorney who does business out of his Lincoln Continental sedan. Mick spends most of his time defending petty crooks and other bottom-feeders, so it comes as quite a surprise when he lands the case of a lifetime: defending a Beverly Hills playboy who is accused of attempted murder. However, what Mick initially thinks is an open-and-shut case with a big monetary reward develops into something more sinister.','/gOn8Ve9Yi8fxjRkmLr5BZoOc7KV.jpg','2011-03-17',119,'Released','This case is a dangerous game of life and death.','The Lincoln Lawyer',50348,9.293,7.208,'IFwE3UgCMIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25074,_binary '\0','/fKCTy4ehmdY1EihznRkGnVVtWf4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189345',8,1886,'fr','Le Monde selon Monsanto','Monsanto is the world leader in genetically modified organisms (GMOs), as well as one of the most controversial corporations in industrial history. This century-old empire has created some of the most toxic products ever sold, including polychlorinated biphenyls (PCBs) and the herbicide Agent Orange. Based on a painstaking investigation, The World According to Monsanto puts together the pieces of the company’s history, calling on hitherto unpublished documents and numerous first-hand accounts.','/lOv3zZWY1XS3SNIwJJ8AiqOTmRB.jpg','2008-02-17',108,'Released',NULL,'The World According to Monsanto',27865,1.0117,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25075,_binary '\0','/8mnswbAAq9kvkUpzcbTfSrt1DpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11893676',5.3,3546,'en','Lord of Misrule','When the daughter of the town\'s new priest goes missing during the harvest festival, a desperate search begins, uncovering the town\'s dark history and resurfacing tales of a mysterious, malevolent spirit that demands sacrifice.','/3cxMwPuV5BroI91DZLGdio6WB34.jpg','2023-10-26',104,'Released','Beware the Harvest.','Lord of Misrule',853387,3.4497,5.7,'3FMdCZCuyCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25076,_binary '\0','/iRuQRxWnIgM86Bd5DBk7CRM2OIE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1189383',3.3,6284,'tr','Maskeli Beşler: Kıbrıs','An incompetent gang of criminals attempt to go straight.','/seoVNB330yIJMDOydm6Q0Ewrj2d.jpg','2008-02-17',87,'Released',NULL,'The Masked Gang: Cyprus',194963,1.4356,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25077,_binary '\0','/trh0IcpVct5WMwf9Eu7le8a8ReP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11897340',6.3,1424,'ar','صالون هدى','Based on real events, Huda’s Salon is a heart-racing, entertaining feminist thriller, where two women fight for their freedom. Reem, a young mother who is married to a jealous man, goes to Huda’s salon in Bethlehem for a haircut and an attentive ear. However, this ordinary visit turns sour after Huda puts Reem in a shameful situation, blackmails her to work for the secret service of the occupiers and betrays her people.','/1YygInxVfEC5Be7f8H7UDLFi2Ti.jpg','2022-03-04',91,'Released','Some betrayals you don\'t live to regret.','Huda\'s Salon',782648,1.4102,6.111,'3xsJRrlqGKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25078,_binary '\0','/h37garYpEwYeKBGZq9cHTbtEHPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11897478',6.6,31222,'en','The Stranger','Two strangers strike up a conversation on a long journey. However, neither is who they appear to be, each carry secrets that threaten to ruin them — and in the background, one of the nation\'s largest police operations is closing in.','/bqhU34c2mWSUiOPP7vHP7Vdc112.jpg','2022-10-06',117,'Released','The closer you get...','The Stranger',848791,4.8903,6.2,'umIeYcQLABg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25079,_binary '\0','/pXRggAbfIlZAYvANE686C99IPtU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11900398',4,3287,'id','Ashiap Man','Since childhood, Zulkarnaen has been obsessed with heroes who are always told by his father, Mr. Ibrahim. Aisyah is the only person who always supports Zul to become a knight to defend their village. One day Zul meets a mysterious girl named Kiara, who amazes Zul. But after Zul failed to save his father, Zul was discouraged. Can Zul as Ashap Man be a hero? And who will Zul, Aisyah or Kiara choose?','/65oyFx9TWo7qGCKLZcTvPYmOq0e.jpg','2022-11-17',102,'Released','Everyone Can Be a Hero.','Ashiap Man',682367,0.9561,2.7,'40BEiMgXwLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25080,_binary '\0','/6lJfehiHKmVSsT1s81hJNWBlMou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11900404',7.9,2106,'cs','V síti','Everyone knows something like this is happening. But this is the only experiment to fully demonstrate what excessive openness on the internet means. The filmmaking couple hired youthful-looking (but over 18) actresses to pretend to be prepubescent girls and communicate with strangers who approached them based on their fake accounts. They attracted dozens of men in the first ten days, then hundreds, and finally thousands...','/jt61E2pvsexKH903PaGFnm2csHi.jpg','2020-02-27',100,'Released','When the hunters become the hunted.','Caught in the Net',599876,1.3648,7.9,'dMJ95a6tAjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25081,_binary '\0','/egK0iqTbvIXtyK7ZUkFON2vXCXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190072',6.2,1622,'fa','شکارچی','In an act of vengeance, a young man randomly kills two police officers. He escapes to the forest, where he is arrested by two other officers. The three men are surrounded by trees, the woods. They are lost in a maze, a desolate landscape, where the boundaries between the hunter and the hunted are difficult to perceive.','/fl1qrf9HPOtGoIZVRvOU8bZEUzo.jpg','2010-04-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Hunter',52767,0.9831,6.5,'K__lXagtZsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25082,_binary '\0','/4P71rDf6roxVskbvdcbNayVMpXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190080',5.9,426957,'en','2012','Dr. Adrian Helmsley, part of a worldwide geophysical team investigating the effect on the earth of radiation from unprecedented solar storms, learns that the earth\'s core is heating up. He warns U.S. President Thomas Wilson that the crust of the earth is becoming unstable and that without proper preparations for saving a fraction of the world\'s population, the entire race is doomed. Meanwhile, writer Jackson Curtis stumbles on the same information. While the world\'s leaders race to build \"arks\" to escape the impending cataclysm, Curtis struggles to find a way to save his family. Meanwhile, volcanic eruptions and earthquakes of unprecedented strength wreak havoc around the world.','/c2PkTPT5D9zB8SIm5wNlDAANEqM.jpg','2009-10-10',158,'Released','We were warned.','2012',14161,20.5743,5.897,'ce0N3TEcFw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25083,_binary '\0','/lPw2nRM7r677zyowGA3znJIzBhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11903004',6.2,2180,'ru','Отель «Белград»','Pasha, a Serbian womanizer and entertainer, owns a luxurious hotel in Belgrade. He lives carelessly until one day he accidentally breaks a mafia kingpin’s new collectable that is worth a few million. To cover the debt the mafia kingpin makes Pasha marry his daughter. While the girl is preparing to marry the charming hotelier, Pasha by chance meets his Russian love Dasha, who he has not seen for four years. Their love is about to flare up in the romantic atmosphere of the ancient city… if not for the future father-in-law, a real husband, a blind grandad, and a friend with no money.','/A3bNX4gmaWTRMmRUDekWjm55iik.jpg','2020-03-05',107,'Released',NULL,'Hotel Belgrade',592717,2.4796,6.6,'42FRjxcA3kk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25084,_binary '\0','/gpcJuvH1tRWfdGv6ysWVRN3EZXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190536',7.4,54809,'en','Black Dynamite','This is the story of 1970s African-American action legend Black Dynamite. The Man killed his brother, pumped heroin into local orphanages, and flooded the ghetto with adulterated malt liquor. Black Dynamite was the one hero willing to fight The Man all the way from the blood-soaked city streets to the hallowed halls of the Honky House.','/u3oWQDz0JggzzsVlsuHY7XVxp5Y.jpg','2009-10-16',85,'Released','He\'s super bad, he\'s outta sight. He\'s...','Black Dynamite',24804,4.3898,7.071,'96Y24a0cyCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25085,_binary '\0','/urBBFQrrVxy7T8uytrn7dOoHqZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190539',7.8,82518,'ko','추격자','Joong-ho is a dirty detective turned pimp, who\'s in financial trouble as several of his girls have recently disappeared without clearing their debts. While trying to track them down, he finds a clue that the vanished girls were all called up by the same client, whom one of his girls is meeting with right now.','/hy49xJiKN1nakkN1ZmKuOf6vQYR.jpg','2008-02-14',125,'Released','The hunter and the hunted, the ultimate chase begins.','The Chaser',13855,8.6514,7.784,'akiHkFxV24w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25086,_binary '\0','/pKItm4sW0Xji31QXm8YiAmCGo4b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11905462',7.6,13593,'en','Athlete A','Follow the Indianapolis Star reporters that broke the story about USA Gymnastics doctor Larry Nassar\'s abuse and hear from gymnasts.','/jUVbqKcDgcLSS5s4UV82XUkMKlU.jpg','2020-06-23',105,'Released','Was winning worth the cost?','Athlete A',684700,1.8143,7.534,'I3tF46qzSAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25087,_binary '\0','/pe2kAmZr2OghIIC12SYW1gx8qn0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11905514',7.1,3207,'fr','Kubrick by Kubrick','American filmmaker Stanley Kubrick (1928–1999), one of the greatest in history, but also one of the most reserved, gave few interviews throughout his long career, and none of them were filmed. A first-person journey through his life and work, based on a recorded conversation with French film critic Michel Climent.','/hgmWmo2xBghbWXKK8YpJHSR8n1x.jpg','2020-10-22',74,'Released',NULL,'Kubrick by Kubrick',689705,5.0575,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25088,_binary '\0','/3a2kfDZT3Fx17mXU2iC15suHrtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11905536',6.5,7932,'hi','गुमराह','A murder investigation becomes complicated after the cops discover a pair of lookalike suspects.','/tFaQuuz26BKMXdcDxLrlmVNQlM7.jpg','2023-04-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Gumraah',974025,1.661,6.7,'lNzZqCb4ero','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25089,_binary '\0','/mxOWmI0sXlohxl5UTrb3Wp7hjA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11905922',6.9,1885,'tr','Stray','Experience the bustle of Istanbul street life through the eyes of three stray dogs – Zeytin, Nazar and Kartal.','/1Px7fGwiNEhVfdme3vouaXXSjKz.jpg','2021-11-25',72,'Released',NULL,'Stray',684697,1.2599,6.2,'uC38BqP2_fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25090,_binary '\0','/90Hjx5iXwNRIqm3MvgYMKNuHoQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11905962',6.4,30591,'ru','Спутник','At the height of the Cold War, a Soviet spacecraft crash lands after a mission gone awry, leaving the commander as its only survivor. After a renowned Russian psychologist is brought in to evaluate the commander’s mental state, it becomes clear that something dangerous may have come back to Earth with him…','/eAUzmhP54bE1vPXaY7FbuZREJlR.jpg','2020-07-24',113,'Released','The only survivor did not come back alone.','Sputnik',594718,3.9675,6.5,'Qh-oOnZ2Di0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25091,_binary '\0','/2yVYx8v0UfAI7IeATLBNaoE1Vlr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190617',4,10518,'en','An American Carol','A cynical anti-American Hollywood filmmaker sets out on a crusade to abolish the 4th of July holiday. He is visited by three spirits who take him on a hilarious journey in an attempt to show him the true meaning of America.','/uEDdzt1ZTB1BRo95gMkBytl0NqM.jpg','2008-10-03',82,'Released','WARNING! This Movie might be offensive to Righties, All Lefties, Retards, Terrorists, Pacifists, War-Mongers, Believers, the ACLU, Conservatives, Republicans, Democrats, People of Color, Non-Speakers, & Ivy League Profs., Native Americans should be Okay.','An American Carol',13948,3.2952,4.215,'IgSEIE5qPA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25092,_binary '\0','/7DROnfY5uKzpWYkK6jcq2yYqnll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11908062',5.2,2405,'ru','Зима','On their way home through an unknown city, Alexander and his father are attacked and seriously injured by some drunken juvenile delinquents. The father dies, and Alexander becomes a dangerous witness, which must be eliminated.','/jBQI84IKSDF2kJLHIcV7ITzI0Ig.jpg','2020-02-27',76,'Released',NULL,'Winter',614424,0.9299,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25093,_binary '\0','/bylJq7JEA87YqHMObZUnaP292T2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11908172',5.5,10259,'en','The Kill Room','A hitman, his boss, an art dealer and a money-laundering scheme that accidentally turns the assassin into an overnight avant-garde sensation, one that forces her to play the art world against the underworld.','/ciEZWh4fkq394ToQBr91UDUK45O.jpg','2023-09-14',98,'Released','Crime is an art form.','The Kill Room',958006,7.2813,5.854,'Kk89vbx_k3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25094,_binary '\0','/wlqLbsMK7vpWT4cAoLq2DVHQx1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190858',7,3790,'en','Amreeka','Eager to provide a better future for her son, Fadi, divorcée Muna Farah leaves her Palestinian homeland and takes up residence in rural Illinois -- just in time to encounter the domestic repercussions of America\'s disastrous war in Iraq. Now, the duo must reinvent their lives with some help from Muna\'s sister, Raghda, and brother-in-law, Nabeel.','/tMQEHscCqKLz7JXFfU87kdZU8uE.jpg','2009-06-17',96,'Released','Life\'s best adventures are journeys of the heart.','Amreeka',29134,1.3132,6.7,'nHeD5JCsjSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25095,_binary '\0','/1Py8VLUgNZpAINoLM5idzFORZ4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1190894',6.7,1815,'hi','Road, Movie','Vishnu has a bleak future before him, he must join his father in the family\'s oil business and try and boost the sales of the stinking oil in small town India. He sees his chance to escape by offering to transport a ramshackle truck, with a make-shift cinema, to a distant museum that lies across the expansive desert of Kutch. His companions: a chai-wallah chokra, a gypsy girl and a burlesque mechanic.','/kO2waE5hERjSuCzfYC4CLGUUJ9N.jpg','2010-03-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Road, Movie',37438,1.3217,5.667,'K-mttPHA70g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25096,_binary '\0','/4wVUvEljeoClD7oCI5iSv3dnprW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11908982',5.5,4740,'en','Jakob\'s Wife','After a chance encounter with \"The Master\", Anne discovers bite marks on her neck, a new sense of power, and an appetite to live bigger and bolder than ever.','/hsOSdY9ALwBLP41c6tAF5UXkpc0.jpg','2021-04-16',98,'Released','She will prey on you.','Jakob\'s Wife',786110,2.2223,5.8,'xA8ALfbP_hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25097,_binary '\0','/ml8YBTJq7UkALfI022FWscCQuQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11909878',6,59927,'en','Hocus Pocus 2','29 years since the Black Flame Candle was last lit, the 17th-century Sanderson sisters are resurrected, and they are looking for revenge. Now it\'s up to three high school students to stop the ravenous witches from wreaking a new kind of havoc on Salem before dawn on All Hallow\'s Eve.','/7ze7YNmUaX81ufctGqt0AgHxRtL.jpg','2022-09-27',104,'Released','Back and more glorious than ever.','Hocus Pocus 2',642885,11.9377,7.13,'ecJRvz9nk-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25098,_binary '\0','/2Mlw0JRNZHXLYxbeJ0LmiCCTiok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1191111',7.2,95613,'en','Enter the Void','This psychedelic tour of life after death is seen entirely from the point of view of Oscar, a young American drug dealer and addict living in Tokyo with his prostitute sister, Linda. When Oscar is killed by police during a bust gone bad, his spirit journeys from the past -- where he sees his parents before their deaths -- to the present -- where he witnesses his own autopsy -- and then to the future, where he looks out for his sister from beyond the grave.','/krKnsfvSJM1PL40tLicRhVQ6kuG.jpg','2010-05-05',161,'Released',NULL,'Enter the Void',34647,6.6345,7.3,'HkPMjoUqYXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25099,_binary '\0','/hhpOEvI8MTF8F17eJzITPxg0gJr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1191113',5.7,2660,'en','Fab Five: The Texas Cheerleader Scandal','Based on a true story. Five high school cheerleaders, including the daughter of the school principal, run amok -- and teachers, parents and administrators allow them to get away with a wide range of scandalous behavior. Known as the \"Fab Five,\" the girls disregard school rules, drink alcohol and post suggestive pictures on the Internet. But when the new cheerleading coach attempts to discipline them, her superiors ask her to resign.','/A0OlzhHEfzGeibxgz6iltsCB8QC.jpg','2008-08-02',88,'Released',NULL,'Fab Five: The Texas Cheerleader Scandal',37432,2.0441,5.854,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25100,_binary '\0','/g4AnaSh8fR3puCIzSVgabTi54Yt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1191121',7.4,7138,'te','జల్సా','Sanjay falls in love with Indu. Her father Rammohan Reddy doesnt approve of it and she is married to someone else. Later, Bhagyamathi falls for him and he goes to meet her father who turns out to be Rammohan Reddy. Somewhere in between Sanjay\'s life as a Naxal is depicted.','/xVzwnGouqZtBDDfp3Q2fGr0Sh16.jpg','2008-04-02',161,'Released',NULL,'Jalsa',73578,1.5643,6.926,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25101,_binary '\0','/5ZfCyyxqkaoVYtnuNMtnNRWlPhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1191138',5.1,4806,'hi','Thoda Pyaar Thoda Magic','One day they pray to God for help and he does help them. He sends his most mischievous, childlike, lovable angel to the rescue, with a mission to bring Ranbeer and the kids together. Geeta (Rani Mukerji) comes bicycling down a rainbow… and bursts into Ranbeer\'s house as the selfproclaimed new nanny. And then starts the roller coaster ride of fun, emotions, magic and love.','/sILNLbwCDFHsQhCzLfxU89R1dni.jpg','2008-06-27',145,'Released',NULL,'Thoda Pyaar Thoda Magic',14214,1.5221,5.491,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25102,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11912390',6.5,1401,'ml','2 സ്റ്റേറ്റ്സ്','A son, his father and his grandfather lead a happy life in a village in Kerala. One day, a girl from Tamil Nadu comes to their village. Their world turns upside down when she and the son fall in love with each other and decide to elope.','/vzB3xS4kCW7cAo0Olz4Jpchy9sm.jpg','2020-03-06',129,'Released','Oru Olichotta Kadha','2 States',737900,0.7974,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25103,_binary '\0','/869a5acZOHlxbRJJeQBxyGKahxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11915042',7.1,3307,'te','18 పేజెస్','When a heartbroken Siddhu stumbles upon a two-year-old diary, he finds himself drawn into the enigmatic world of a young woman named Nandini and falls for her.','/d6SdWIh7gY6x84isJkfrD9SNiJ7.jpg','2022-12-23',137,'Released',NULL,'18 Pages',894758,1.5834,5.063,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25104,_binary '\0','/7jS69IM8bK7ooOWGFmM9G6JcenO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11916254',7.1,2561,'en','Lucy Shimmers and the Prince of Peace','Second chances start when a hardened criminal crosses paths with a precocious little girl who is helped by an angel to change hearts during the holiday season.','/yfnJ5qIYx7q33fY4jqv9Pu95RSg.jpg','2020-10-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Lucy Shimmers and the Prince of Peace',770156,6.2797,8.4,'bu2yPlLTfZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25105,_binary '\0','/jYzNKWYermxipANIwbcMhTEAk8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11916302',8.2,6094,'en','Derek DelGaudio\'s In & of Itself','Storyteller and Conceptual Magician Derek DelGaudio attempts to understand the illusory nature of identity and answer the deceptively simple question \'Who am I?\'','/bgnXNBdjqQmVrIthQI5B8eKDKp1.jpg','2020-10-24',90,'Released','Identity is an illusion.','Derek DelGaudio\'s In & of Itself',681459,2.7409,7.597,'_62BeXxd_jo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25106,_binary '\0','/sePlBkSsV4b43QXQXwZEmU5vp30.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11917942',6.6,3534,'ja','スパイの妻','It’s 1940, and the population of Japan is divided over its entry into World War II. Satoko, the wife of a fabric merchant, is devoted to her husband but is beginning to suspect he’s up to something. Soon she allows herself to be drawn into a game in which she enigmatically conceals her intentions.','/A3lmLpCmeYiZQMP4ZzlmrDDKeE8.jpg','2020-10-16',114,'Released','Who should I trust?','Wife of a Spy',688301,2.3414,6.7,'9Uf8yEsKLdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25107,_binary '\0','/cb18RpO7cPwK4zSQko026nkzDkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1191971',3.8,3426,'en','Zona mrtvih','A police-escorted prisoner transport supervised by Interpol sets off to Belgrade. The route leads the transport through Pančevo, where they encounter an ecological disaster and infected people who are trying to kill them. Interpol agents Mortimer Reyes and Mina Milius soon realize that their only chance for escape from the zombie hordes lies in allying with the dangerous, mysterious prisoner.','/foKgf8xnIzvw7THHzjqmdzC8rWF.jpg','2011-01-20',101,'Released','This City is a Living Hell','Zone of the Dead',28925,1.7291,4.3,'twpHPwsHSuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25108,_binary '\0','/wBHrFVmEp2NriJcWeOTAbEbamFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11923304',6.5,2268,'ja','東京リベンジャーズ','An unemployed man learns that his ex-girlfriend was murdered. He suddenly finds himself travelling through time to his middle school years and has chance to change the future and save the girl. He aims to rise to the top of the most brutal delinquent gang.','/q8Q2VBt3rP0cSG3hNerIQuogLAH.jpg','2021-07-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Revengers',698201,3.2331,7.8,'UY_diXXl4UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25109,_binary '\0','/naNEpMPkUaFoA87Qbj7waH2eZCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11923962',5.2,2480,'ta','தணல்','Fuelled by a lifetime of suffering, an ex army man embarks on a vengeful quest. Standing in his way is a police constable whose own past pain transformed into a dutiful son. When their paths converge, hero either can flee for his life or take a stand against the villain’s scheme of things.','/5CVSHJZBlTG5xF7UqrWTHquBLtX.jpg','2025-09-12',126,'Released',NULL,'Thanal',1090991,0.8477,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25110,_binary '\0','/p0KvLBiaLdDPgzfVG2qrScnqzhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11924110',5.1,2343,'hi','लड़की','Heavily influenced by Bruce Lee’s wisdom and his martial art techniques, Pooja aspires to be like him. Will she be able to follow in his footsteps, or will she be forced to compromise her desire to lead a tranquil life like other girls?','/tV69fiUL9oCtWItvHmUYEr3WXPG.jpg','2022-07-15',134,'Released','Enter The Girl Dragon','Ladki: Dragon Girl',651534,1.1735,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25111,_binary '\0','/eeevSp6EnsV3zvbID8WSeCW9uRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11924476',3.7,2427,'en','A Werewolf in England','In Victorian-Era England, a Parish Councillor and criminal take refuge from a storm, at a remote countryside Inn. Forced to stay the night, they soon uncover a deadly pact between the strange Innkeepers and the flesh-hungry werewolves that inhabit the surrounding woodlands... now, as the werewolves close in, the guests must band together and fight tooth and nail to survive the night!','/tkCUc5l4vPrW09D0ipdnTQusC68.jpg','2020-09-28',85,'Released','Bark at the moon.','A Werewolf in England',710217,2.2145,5.7,'1B46CwkwyRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25112,_binary '\0','/hPEOBD7eeQh7plm9TYoECNkK4b3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11924738',5.4,3643,'es','La familia perfecta','Lucía is a woman for whom leading a model life and taking control of her life is the most important thing. Since she got married, she has focused all of her efforts on caring for her family, until achieving what for her is a perfect family. However, her entire world begins to collapse with the arrival of Sara, the girlfriend of her son; a young girl with great freedom and without mincing words who has a very different family from what Lucia always dreamed of as a political family. Now, Lucia must accept that the perfect family was not exactly what she thought.','/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg','2021-12-03',110,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Family',826241,2.0789,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25113,_binary '\0','/bqndNQXKGkQXgbAsGXcwO7S9fP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1192613',4.6,1465,'ja','お姉チャンバラ','In the year 20xx, scientifically created zombies roam the world in record numbers. Despite this, Aya is determined to track down her father\'s killer, a person who was once close to her. With sword in hand and wearing nothing but her trademark bikini and cowboy hat, she sets off to settle the score.','/8g6cykcOUfdCYeIii84bzNL0gpd.jpg','2008-04-26',86,'Released',NULL,'Onechanbara: Bikini Samurai Squad',37223,1.9726,4.9,'p9hSxftQ0vY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25114,_binary '\0','/mOtKQlXdL5J4lwqcSFlkZmgmFeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1192628',7.3,324399,'en','Rango','When Rango, a lost family pet, accidentally winds up in the gritty, gun-slinging Western town of Dirt, the theater-loving lizard suddenly finds himself the newly appointed sheriff. Welcomed as the last hope the town has been waiting for, Rango is forced to play his new role to the hilt and uncover the truth behind a looming water crisis—before his act catches up with him.','/A5MP1guV8pbruieG0tnpPIbaJtt.jpg','2011-03-02',107,'Released','No man can walk out on his own story.','Rango',44896,15.0136,6.921,'_gQys92pTqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25115,_binary '\0','/aHAHmatqL6fuXJo9SCBRyadoW9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11930126',7,9635,'ca','Alcarràs','In a small village in Catalonia, the peach farmers of the Solé family spend every summer together picking fruit from their orchard. But when plans arise to install solar panels and cut down trees, the members of this tight-knit group suddenly face eviction – and the loss of far more than their home.','/3nqXPBmlxbX5BC4FNWixpiKOebp.jpg','2022-04-29',118,'Released','For every family, there is a season.','Alcarràs',804251,3.1004,6.8,'5__6yoPMBRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25116,_binary '\0','/o1FTMcZz3Uq2UP4MafwkZ7BoqGU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193088',5.8,2269,'fr','Le Code a changé','So called friends at a dinner party end up acting like a dysfunctional family.','/nQ2azQZlWFKFl9mwkBqMslAYi07.jpg','2009-02-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Change of Plans',14688,2.3015,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25117,_binary '\0','/zT0gHcGOXEtVd0K4MIiByIq9jf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193126',7.2,8874,'en','Locke & Key','Three children become the caretakers of a New England mansion that is home to a bevy of secrets and magic.','/55gcNVeDdgFrV9RYk8Z2Ex58rfe.jpg','2011-01-01',54,'Released',NULL,'Locke & Key',348536,2.4935,6.9,'r_KmKC5K8QU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25118,_binary '\0','/yTweHAwEokqAgZg1Io8e0zCJQvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193138',7.4,362844,'en','Up in the Air','Corporate downsizing expert Ryan Bingham spends his life in planes, airports, and hotels, but just as he’s about to reach a milestone of ten million frequent flyer miles, he meets a woman who causes him to rethink his transient life.','/useGH8nfwlaHK44IWEZdUYJOE2N.jpg','2009-12-04',110,'Released','The story of a man ready to make a connection.','Up in the Air',22947,11.866,6.903,'En0DYdjMVoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25119,_binary '\0','/fM5W9e57B4DoutCPnbPgSjOmApc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193460',7.3,2448,'ko','바르게 살자','The chief of Sampo City Police Office, Seung-u, organizes a simulation of a bank robbery, but a by-the-book cop gets too caught up in the role playing in which the simulation doesn\'t go the way he had anticipated.','/gBX9cpJ6MNuYiLpAfP2Du7MgWXN.jpg','2007-08-18',102,'Released','Always give it your best even for a robbery.','Going by the Book',38963,1.986,7.3,'PeyaAnq5u3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25120,_binary '\0','/r22A4fUX8EXodOtZxtqE0uDcx1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11934846',7,23262,'hi','बधाई दो','A gay cop and a lesbian teacher enter a sham marriage to pacify their families but find that relationships — both real and fake — aren\'t all that easy.','/2IOCys56t4iOMj9ZoVZ7zmi2RHL.jpg','2022-02-11',147,'Released','Atrangi wedding. Satrangi Setting.','Badhaai Do',754716,1.7224,6.8,'hjxoPh4DM_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25121,_binary '\0','/cXuizqYBAKHvv2DKfcOD20Lw650.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193490',6.1,1283,'ko','검은 집','Jun-oh, an insurance claims agent, faces off with a client who he suspects of committing murders with the intention of collecting insurance premiums.','/wghwvk7PmEBQEmgqpdzuFzmMJaq.jpg','2007-06-21',104,'Released','Where lies the darkest secret.','Black House',107976,1.5608,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25122,_binary '\0','/jrZAbmYzGyWyzBwU10AOKeuckvX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193507',5.8,1934,'en','My Own Love Song','A wheelchair-bound singer and her best friend embark on a roadtrip to Memphis.','/aO4tSR7YdVUhM7QyXMRlNWNYGcg.jpg','2010-04-07',100,'Released',NULL,'My Own Love Song',43609,3.1786,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25123,_binary '\0','/olS4KdjwGkk5sbgRAxTBZeSvbHu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193516',5,31911,'tr','Recep İvedik','A man finds the wallet of a rich man and takes a rigorous trip in an old car to return it, finding an old love and a new life of luxury awaiting.','/heKqSDyQuVzPrQIuvY5mqC3oc6M.jpg','2008-02-22',102,'Released','A folk hero','Recep Ivedik',31060,2.7454,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25124,_binary '\0','/kHI5s7CcIRgKqUt2awHhxtRfMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11935566',6.9,3704,'el','Σμύρνη μου Αγαπημένη','Members of the Baltatzis family recount the 1922 burning of Smyrna, Greece, including the assault on vibrant Greek and Armenian communities.','/xcyaxeidhLF4pv2napCQMj2Y6FS.jpg','2021-12-23',138,'Released',NULL,'Smyrna',917539,1.4288,7.8,'JpYy_SYDAhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25125,_binary '\0','/iHUp2Ojhi6qhx4wIYtRR6ux7YbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1193631',6.2,62799,'en','Step Up 3D','A tight-knit group of New York City street dancers, including Luke and Natalie, team up with NYU freshman Moose, and find themselves pitted against the world\'s best hip-hop dancers in a high-stakes showdown that will change their lives forever.','/rPcqa5TZ7S63RNmCuY45ZizFBen.jpg','2010-08-04',107,'Released','Two worlds. One dream.','Step Up 3D',41233,9.6237,6.835,'Ee7V9sJv030','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25126,_binary '\0','/qw0nzEPtZ3TVz3kEerwFsz0IX7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11937680',7.8,3538,'fr','La Panthère des neiges','High up on the Tibetan plateau. Amongst unexplored and inaccessible valleys lies one of the last sanctuaries of the wild world, where rare and undiscovered fauna lives. Vincent Munier, one of the world’s most renowned wildlife photographers takes the adventurer and novelist Sylvain Tesson (In the Forest of Siberia) with him on his latest mission. For several weeks, they’ll explore these valleys searching for unique animals and try to spot the snow leopard, one of the rarest and most difficult big cats to approach.','/sWGaJQDoJFbkshYdABhctrAtx7N.jpg','2021-12-15',92,'Released',NULL,'The Velvet Queen',842356,2.3576,7.9,'Q7k4P-A2gPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25127,_binary '\0','/xBNVh73hj5opRZWG1kk1OcSOyAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194104',6.3,2897,'te','బుజ్జిగాడు','Bujji runs away from his home in his childhood because of a dispute with his girlfriend Chitti. He ends up in Chennai for 12 years, and the rest of the story is about how they meet now to make their love successful.','/fVDPpKS4ylQf1qtEvfaDjh6ehhP.jpg','2008-05-23',160,'Released',NULL,'Bujjigaadu: Made in Chennai',117029,1.3379,5.583,'H8yaV6QCjio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25128,_binary '\0','/viPfna8tjU7eEI4GMBGGNMXlx0h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11941694',7.3,1473,'es','La estrella azul','The 90s. A famous Spanish rock star travels around Latin America in the endeavour to reconnect with his vocation. There he meets an old musician down on his luck, prompting the birth of an unlikely duo with every chance of becoming an epic commercial failure.','/wiOJMisF5bXFuygrHayEYYrPZRS.jpg','2024-02-23',128,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Star',1160878,1.8567,7.4,'D6rB8KpDPlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25129,_binary '\0','/ayH0oUci9rvPmmRLTrxGHJmjV33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11941700',7.6,2098,'bn','টনিক','75 years Jaladhar Sen and spouse Umarani plan for a foreign trip and come across Rhea and Tonic, the travel agents. The story shows how Tonic takes the couple to Darjeeling instead and becomes the best medicine.','/uzYStMqlqOBjLKUz5LM67sinban.jpg','2021-12-23',128,'Released',NULL,'Tonic',717917,1.5076,7.333,'FoAmO6eQE3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25130,_binary '\0','/akNBILfG0vh7WhuzjA1bXfrgpYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194173',6.6,330300,'en','The Bourne Legacy','New CIA operative Aaron Cross experiences life-or-death stakes that have been triggered by the previous actions of Jason Bourne.','/1aExL5DTGHj25ZfIC3dDwS84RWi.jpg','2012-08-08',135,'Released','There was never just one.','The Bourne Legacy',49040,14.9383,6.253,'43WTCO8-C4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25131,_binary '\0','/uck1c4HIysro9LO9ok0R5Qhbcsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11941800',6.8,3422,'it','Maschile singolare','Antonio is a 30 year old family man, whose life finds an unexpected twist when he\'s suddenly dumped by his husband, whom he depends both psychologically and economically: he needs to find a new place to stay, a job and a new purpose in life. Antonio finds a room in an apartment owned by Denis and starts to work in a bakery owned by Luca, while attending pastry school. Through this process he discovers that it was wrong of him to give up his independence for the sake of his relationship in the past.','/4n1qEqPMcxRzE383b7fcHysizwA.jpg','2021-11-24',101,'Released','Life. Love. Pastry.','Mascarpone',826353,2.2755,6,'4XBlQoYL6sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25132,_binary '\0','/jLDYuWxpmLfk3jl3QAxHu3HueSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194236',5.1,2226,'hi','पाठशाळा','A new English school teacher ends up leading both teachers and students to revolt against the school management.','/2MwfQpuOMCcN9D1vOnNNW1MgdTH.jpg','2010-04-16',126,'Released','Get Educated','Paathshaala',37690,1.2686,5.05,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25133,_binary '\0','/rD6VVei45TLnkCdDucJDDUmb3e3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194238',7.2,21614,'fr','Polytechnique','A dramatization of the École Polytechnique massacre in Montreal, on December 9, 1989, where 14 female engineering students were murdered (and 13 were wounded) by a 25 year old psychotic misogynist armed with a semi-automatic weapon.','/bmIhSm9GN1BR0srtjLCEGsAxQqF.jpg','2009-02-06',77,'Released',NULL,'Polytechnique',22302,2.5801,7.1,'o_H17moBp2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25134,_binary '\0','/4xzGQgT1OJ3q0WkNsk0Zv5C0THX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194242',6.3,1605,'fr','Le Vilain','With gun-toting rivals on his tail, a daring bank robber takes refuge in the quiet residential street here he grew up and where his mother, Maniette, still lives. An unscrupulous property developer, Korazy, is buying up the neighborhood to turn it into a gleaming new banking district, but to her son\'s disgust Maniette leads the inhabitants resistance. Her ingenious methods provoke her boy\'s admiration, but he fights back with sneaky traps and underhand tricks when Maniette tries to force him to do the right thing just once in his life.','/2v4Lsd6SBnp3GoFGphjWr1T0ink.jpg','2009-11-25',86,'Released',NULL,'The Villain',35436,2.06,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25135,_binary '\0','/zvMMye9YBD7sfcGyBEYSW6Lw4Ts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194263',7,24926,'en','Get Low','A movie spun out of equal parts folk tale, fable and real-life legend about the mysterious, 1930s Tennessee hermit who famously threw his own rollicking funeral party... while he was still alive.','/6uUaQ5zn9neK1VLqO2sGClbJrb9.jpg','2010-07-30',103,'Released','A true tall tale.','Get Low',44718,3.3819,6.716,'C25TG5kLJGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25136,_binary '\0','/oRRUH6ckp2nQBexR4k6XQvKKcSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194417',6.2,18306,'en','Casino Jack','Based on a true story, a hot shot Washington DC lobbyist and his protégé go down hard as their schemes to peddle influence lead to corruption and murder.','/3Dpicp6VEtCSj39XBG5mnbe5TQ9.jpg','2010-09-16',108,'Released','Honor. Integrity. Principles. Everything is negotiable.','Casino Jack',45324,2.8582,5.869,'Dw9WAvpdabY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25137,_binary '\0','/mS2ffsVP3PlIX8TcWOvdWUPbWY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11944928',5,6699,'en','Red Stone','With one bullet, Motley’s life spirals out of control as he’s forced to go on the run from the ruthless crime lord, Jed Haywood. The brother of Haywood\'s best friend Boons recently died in a terrible car accident and today is the funeral. He has 10 hours to bring Motley in and get to the cemetery. Over the course of a day, Motley and Boon play a game of cat and mouse as their fate brings them together for a climatic showdown.','/qQ77Uk77bCVR5d1ZvfPSag6qIIp.jpg','2021-12-03',100,'Released','His business is vengeance.','Red Stone',823216,3.757,5.8,'fji751XNd0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25138,_binary '\0','/bxb3GXUZghnns7n5zee4mBxq4AF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194577',6.5,2793,'en','Az ajtó','Emerenc, an elderly and private woman, is hired to be the housekeeper of a struggling writer, Magda. An event in the writer\'s life prompts Emerenc to disclose details of her traumatizing past, which will bond the two women forever. Based on the novel by Magda Szabó.','/FKe79d7RnKf2uDwm89iiqtH9TW.jpg','2012-03-08',97,'Released','There are those who sweep and those who pay others to sweep.','The Door',90130,1.5445,6,'LQvd2pTVI1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25139,_binary '\0','/Afbqq5hnWF5hL5e5mX9soIp7npc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194607',6.8,1493,'ru','Домовой','A novelist struggling with writer\'s block enlists the aid of an assassin for some inspiration -- fully unaware that he is being set up to take the blame for a murder.','/AjiUm5NzFaGp5466rAxwHUs04PE.jpg','2008-11-13',145,'Released',NULL,'The Ghost',20449,1.1612,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25140,_binary '\0','/eswWsgXpjV4vHbJA97VKHcvJz59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194612',7.3,3142,'en','Into Eternity: A Film for the Future','Every day, the world over, large amounts of high-level radioactive waste created by nuclear power plants is placed in interim storage, which is vulnerable to natural disasters, man-made disasters, and to societal changes. In Finland the world’s first permanent repository is being hewn out of solid rock – a huge system of underground tunnels - that must last 100,000 years as this is how long the waste remains hazardous.','/hzINyIeovFPMwtwMteSuXdByCby.jpg','2010-11-12',75,'Released','This hiding place should never be disturbed.','Into Eternity: A Film for the Future',54527,0.9696,7.2,'qoyKe-HxmFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25141,_binary '\0','/68fnREIWiYQdzcgx9FsLBqLVxee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11946138',7.3,3107,'fr','Rebel','Kamal resolves to change his life for the better, and so leaves Belgium to help victims of the war in Syria. But when he arrives, he is forced to join a militia and is left stranded in Raqqa. Back home, his younger brother Nassim quickly becomes easy prey for radical recruiters, who promise to reunite him with his brother. Their mother, Leila, fights to protect the only thing she has left: her youngest son.','/5ddPvvVL4Fba226RI8un8br66KL.jpg','2022-08-31',135,'Released','He must fight for his future.','Rebel',853332,2.301,7.682,'-gFMt2Au21w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25142,_binary '\0','/kTsTU0cIZAh6lDOiA4PzNR68Xjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194616',6.3,10412,'fr','LOL (Laughing Out Loud)','Lola is a striking teenaged girl who is on the cusp of adulthood and longs to rush into the adult world of independence, freedom and sexual exploits, but is tenaciously held back by her mother.','/cqAlMlnCh2pTaM7us9bO2WlODEY.jpg','2009-02-04',103,'Released',NULL,'LOL (Laughing Out Loud)',21861,3.119,6.516,'z-7JKhbSUI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25143,_binary '\0','/t6gJMFAjBGUSnUUJ6cHUQ0lzf8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194620',7.8,7421,'ro','Nunta mută','In a small village of Communist-era Romania a young couple wish to marry, but Joseph Stalin dies the night prior to their wedding ceremony forcing the bride and groom to marry in silence.','/9lnJtOSbLtrYs7K0SRqCLUq3J6V.jpg','2008-11-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Silent Wedding',26752,1.5907,7.2,'VuHNsCDmetQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25144,_binary '\0','/eCVak2cYV6OvsJ5GajrTIFzzcOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194624',5.5,2308,'cn','神鎗手','A police sniper teams up with a hot-headed rookie to take down his former friend and teammate, who is exacting revenge on the police force.','/A7aBssjWennxvNxWT6be3PzFvSC.jpg','2009-03-24',90,'Released',NULL,'The Sniper',17082,2.7729,6.1,'uG9AL64RaKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25145,_binary '\0','/vDEM9XXWpaUb5sxDzpcEGBXgzIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1194664',6.8,4089,'ja','恋空','Mika is a fresh high school student who starts texting a mysterious boy. She is shocked when he reveals who he is - Hiro, a delinquent attending her school. What she doesn\'t know is that Hiro isn\'t as bad as he seems.','/9JiXOxIpTvkq7ewp8YQoY8vqse3.jpg','2007-11-03',129,'Released',NULL,'Sky of Love',40713,2.4215,7.715,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25146,_binary '\0','/qhVZ45o4rk1LSvdG3U5X99Omfvh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11947100',5.7,1574,'en','Love in Taipei','A young American woman is sent by her parents to a cultural immersion program in Taipei where she begins a new journey of self-discovery and romance.','/8iQuQcGHnxlv19rb8yz9Rk8HKnk.jpg','2023-08-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Love in Taipei',745391,3.1796,6.8,'roN5jqd235k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25147,_binary '\0','/umty8dbAoZWluyTsnXqGJRdtSDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11947158',4.4,17242,'hi','एक विलेन रिटर्न्स','When a singer goes missing amid a serial killing spree, a cabbie and a businessman\'s son cross paths in a twisted tale where good and evil is blurred.','/4BqMeSSPaC7spmj4Zl7htiigCkV.jpg','2022-07-29',127,'Released','Heroes don\'t exist','Ek Villain Returns',682401,1.8471,5.974,'swPhyd0g6K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25148,_binary '\0','/14nLhFCNYbZM3Em4sZTOyDK4kRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11947256',7.1,2014,'ta','Oh மணப்பெண்ணே!','A wannabe businesswoman and a happy-go-lucky guy meet each other during an arranged marriage blind date but eventually team up to start a food truck on their own.','/ktnozJlcNH9ffkvuKvn0gvnLxsn.jpg','2021-10-22',140,'Released',NULL,'Oh Manapenne!',884000,1.7867,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25149,_binary '\0','/hhkoj6ozKkseTrQXIOAia1pr8Gi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11947282',4.5,1990,'en','A Loud House Christmas','Lincoln Loud gears up for the ultimate Christmas, until he finds out that most of his sisters have plans to be elsewhere for the big day. Determined to remind his family that they all need to be together, Lincoln and his best friend Clyde McBride embark on a mission to preserve the family’s holiday traditions.','/572kONypScXTz8detAOarXGbijI.jpg','2021-11-26',64,'Released',NULL,'A Loud House Christmas',674610,2.5819,7.1,'dwfBmvLQqks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25150,_binary '\0','/6TevRjFV0tGusMEZD8IyBNOuaO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11948256',6.5,3965,'ta','லிப்ட்','A usual working day turns unusual for Guru and Harini when they get trapped in their haunted office. A patterned game unlocks a mystery and a lift is their only way out.','/2OLXrzIw6s8F3UgpapxspLcK9mb.jpg','2021-10-01',134,'Released',NULL,'Lift',879803,1.1143,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25151,_binary '\0','/3CXCdAhvHefOUztcUMboPQJskWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11950888',5.2,8056,'en','Cellar Door','Looking for a fresh start after a miscarriage, a couple find themselves being gifted the house of their dreams with one caveat – they can never open the cellar door. Whether they can live without knowing triggers shocking consequences.','/9vasnPh69RoUg9oUpzXoErMVDB7.jpg','2024-10-31',97,'Released','Discover what lies behind the cellar door.','Cellar Door',1361292,4.8213,5.689,'54ecFoxQtN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25152,_binary '\0','/hZgl3mdHx1kfnIIVBdgBAm2sWNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11951276',5.9,14622,'en','The Other Zoey','Highly intelligent computer major Zoey Miller is uninterested in romantic love, but her life is turned upside down when Zack, the school\'s soccer star, gets amnesia and mistakes Zoey for his girlfriend.','/rh9fwqA98ufdx9vP7V6lLhfpfk1.jpg','2023-10-19',91,'Released','Love is the one thing she can\'t outsmart.','The Other Zoey',912916,8.2535,7,'3vAUkn41zeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25153,_binary '\0','/ormr6cDBYhT4XEnmvuUUgYg4vGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11952238',6.7,1284,'fr','Sous le ciel d\'Alice','In the fifties, young Alice leaves her natal Swiss mountains for the sunny and vibrant shores of Beirut. She falls madly in love with Joseph, a quirky astrophysicist intent on sending the first Lebanese national into space. Alice quickly fits in among his relatives, but after years of bliss, the civil war threatens their Garden of Eden.','/4l4cgDejw3gL0UzJzouXfWFBxId.jpg','2021-06-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Skies of Lebanon',712345,2.1094,6.6,'v7GvHwRzjz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25154,_binary '\0','/AkMP3PyFoZr0BmARXuqH4NNHOUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11952606',5.3,3280,'en','Easter Sunday','Comedian and actor Joe Valencia returns home for an Easter celebration with his riotous, bickering, eating, drinking, laughing, loving family, in this love letter to the Filipino-American community.','/u7HNcXZDsf2fhWdgQhLZnSBnc1g.jpg','2022-08-04',96,'Released','Home is where the crazy is.','Easter Sunday',824281,5.0357,5.7,'YIixb42aJPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25155,_binary '\0','/iV2lCf8bVPE6L3OU8qv650OwgFn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11953194',6.3,5771,'ta','ஹே! சினாமிகா','A wife who feels suffocated by her husband\'s incessant attention hires a psychologist to make him fall in love with her so that she can separate from him.','/3t6kgGJqsSMtKitIXXBPgWSqeCf.jpg','2022-03-03',149,'Released',NULL,'Hey! Sinamika',803736,1.6845,5.741,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25156,_binary '\0','/kNghJfQyWCXYIot7y5HTmQCml7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11953248',8.2,9498,'kn','ಗರುಡ ಗಮನ ವೃಷಭ ವಾಹನ','Shiva and Hari, two friends who are polar opposites in demeanour, are the terror in Mangaladevi. What happens when ego, ambition and jealousy creeps in between their strong friendship?','/5jWfzHXvqLllbsVL7bvV1UVTq8s.jpg','2021-11-19',151,'Released',NULL,'Garuda Gamana Vrishabha Vahana',678466,1.3672,7.667,'BnuDHJcSd0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25157,_binary '\0','/awqM5h2Z9O6ZUA3evPES7akLRNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11953628',5.9,1643,'hi','Maska','Determined to make it in showbiz, an aspiring young actor considers turning his back on the beloved Irani café run by his family for generations.','/4tYTGLcsuxhmBtiKq57yGqh0xQO.jpg','2020-03-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Maska',686919,0.8477,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25158,_binary '\0','/hpCVGnsOzdciHsPSgdDdj4FKwuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1195478',6.2,105682,'en','The Five-Year Engagement','Exactly one year after Tom meets Violet, he surprises her with a wedding ring. By all accounts, Tom and Violet are destined for their happily ever after. However, this engaged couple just keep getting tripped up on the long walk down the aisle.','/4Bj6pw3ZCo1f2DXP4k7AUDwMTFX.jpg','2012-04-27',124,'Released','A comedy about the journey between popping the question and tying the knot.','The Five-Year Engagement',72207,7.1681,5.8,'Us-5iN5aFqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25159,_binary '\0','/eHTZoXmB4vnDqANZXPZcdAiYQo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11958344',6.7,18665,'ja','泣きたい私は猫をかぶる','A peculiar girl transforms into a cat to catch her crush\'s attention. But before she realizes it, the line between human and animal starts to blur.','/6inkRM1XGBG5vRhclCPWfMenp7N.jpg','2020-06-18',104,'Released','The magic that brought us closer.','A Whisker Away',667520,7.0373,7.9,'aXc9DVfLTGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25160,_binary '\0','/fAklbOohvdjsQaoKTsI32VLbjT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196134',5.5,7618,'en','Crazy on the Outside','A recently paroled ex-con who has trouble adjusting to the wacky normalcy of life outside of prison. He has spent the last three years behind bars after getting caught committing a crime and taking the rap for his much more dangerous pal.','/2IHI9w18OcTcAWk44sqgiP3t9o0.jpg','2010-01-08',96,'Released','He survived three years of hard time. Now comes a little family time.','Crazy on the Outside',35458,2.5913,5.3,'aRZF1Xpj1po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25161,_binary '\0','/hCjoIDVSxR2j1qEXKso385v9JgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196141',6.3,68749,'en','Diary of a Wimpy Kid','Greg Heffley is headed for big things, but first he has to survive the scariest, most humiliating experience of any kid’s life – middle school! That won’t be easy, considering he’s surrounded by hairy-freckled morons, wedgie-loving bullies and a moldy slice of cheese with nuclear cooties!','/iLAGiPnSuODt9cn332bkFElrRig.jpg','2010-03-19',92,'Released','It\'s not a diary, it\'s a movie.','Diary of a Wimpy Kid',33217,11.3415,6.287,'CnzjbsyY4lY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25162,_binary '\0','/pZeOUR7fNfXdSZJhWLnReK8kaJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196204',6.8,24765,'en','Cemetery Junction','In 1970s England, three blue-collar friends spend their days joking, drinking, fighting and chasing girls. Freddie wants to leave their working-class world but cool, charismatic Bruce and lovable loser Snork are happy with life the way it is. When Freddie gets a new job as a door-to-door salesman and bumps into his old school sweetheart Julie, the gang are forced to make choices that will change their lives for ever.','/9fyzMdRX1kWd9UnceWc2Duh4eFt.jpg','2010-04-14',94,'Released','Be young. Be free. Be somebody.','Cemetery Junction',36801,3.5422,6.524,'XYDeHIszUqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25163,_binary '\0','/v0lanDXrJ28gAVgxI25zuafRTBp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196334',1.6,8588,'en','After Last Season','Two neurology students create a telepathy experiment together to visualize a murderer, who recently knifed another student.','/2OKaj3yFHYxwJDXW1RgA4mwkCDt.jpg','2009-06-05',91,'Released','The end of a season means the beginning of a new one.','After Last Season',64104,1.2912,3.3,'kPPRB6ErOIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25164,_binary '\0','/fAPuRLDC1SHFdv3epZJbLLJsZFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196339',5.7,29443,'en','Princess Protection Program','When her nation is invaded, a young princess is taken into the Princess Protection Program. She is relocated to Louisiana, where she stays with a covert agent and his tomboyish daughter, and must learn how to behave like an ordinary teenager.','/tPKD9hmuYxclAQnfup47qLx8a5T.jpg','2009-06-08',89,'Released','Royality meets reality.','Princess Protection Program',19458,5.9511,6.6,'g-6pg6TnArI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25165,_binary '\0','/bslsY8dqOvpZlr2eQdrXt4uS4HJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196340',6.5,6891,'en','Inhale','A couple goes to dangerous lengths to find a lung donor for their daughter.','/x1JpxURGHRkaGM819kVipNdtgR0.jpg','2010-08-27',100,'Released','One man, one chance, no rules.','Inhale',12645,2.1832,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25166,_binary '\0','/8aopmYtI10HUtbZQOqairMJzG8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11963736',7.4,2207,'bn','Dracula Sir','A small town school teacher with protruding canine teeth finds that he has striking similarities with the legendary Count Dracula.','/jD5FLgvUYn0O7BB0xSM6VWtPVVw.jpg','2020-08-14',124,'Released',NULL,'Dracula Sir',718011,1.713,7.75,'itGk6foxWr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25167,_binary '\0','/26yXlqfkTsFrgl9lf286jDYwADU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11964084',2.5,3898,'hi','Virgin Bhanupriya','Bhanupriya, a conservative girl decides to lose her virginity but fails in her every attempt. A soothsayer predicts that it is an impossible task and it will not happen to her. She decides to overcome this bad luck.','/cbPHqUpeHcHwVZkb4Jtqhv6dPJ9.jpg','2020-07-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Virgin Bhanupriya',683395,1.0057,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25168,_binary '\0','/ok89LpYshIMUBRAAtKBZHdYAdbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11967116',6.6,1952,'fr','Médecin de nuit','Mikael is doctor on night call. It’s a vocation. Between two patient-visits in slum areas, he cares for those whom no one else wants to see: the drug addicts, the homeless… He rubs shoulders with destitution. His life is in shambles. Especially when it comes to his pharmacist cousin who makes him write false prescriptions for Subutex. Overnight, he decides to get out of drug trafficking and rebuild his life. But there will be a heavy price to pay.','/stD3UNUIfqrLzyjzdop4pE0GArR.jpg','2021-06-16',82,'Released',NULL,'The Night Doctor',712124,1.7839,6.5,'glktyjc14H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25169,_binary '\0','/nU4o2WDFKG18FZMC5XHrR2Dndjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11967484',6,1915,'de','Das Mädchen und die Spinne','Lisa is moving. Upheaval all around: Her mother flirts with a handyman. An eccentric woman seems to be preparing for a glamorous event, a family next door returns from vacation, and a girl documents the adventurous day. As boxes are transported, walls painted white, and furniture is assembled, underlying problems in need of fixing are revealed, a to-do list expands, and desires and needs flair up.','/4tBtcy3vidUUvKm0MU29dyvfxQD.jpg','2021-05-13',99,'Released',NULL,'The Girl and the Spider',517815,2.0336,5.978,'auLH71spvwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25170,_binary '\0','/9iKFQ0Ka2tWL1k9baXwYoyCjZ0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196948',6.3,30939,'en','Charlie Countryman','A young American falls hard for a Romanian cellist whose father has recently died -- and whose violent past could bring about his own demise.','/7BbrgKfnRfEFIePqdRcWzuHs3KI.jpg','2013-02-09',108,'Released','The only way to save the one you love, is to die.','Charlie Countryman',41602,4.1294,6.4,'YKzWBjENRwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25171,_binary '\0','/o8QeIgs4CVNjFDZuAzXE1OIEuZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1196956',6.8,14096,'en','One Chance','This film follows the remarkable and inspirational true story of Paul Potts, a shy, bullied shop assistant by day and an amateur opera singer by night.','/v7J3MW82NXvothqsN7gBizljnVj.jpg','2013-09-09',103,'Released','The incredible true story of an underdog who never gave up.','One Chance',209361,6.3862,6.7,'OdYt32WlvTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25172,_binary '\0','/lexEx0B4WDOXGfqPTj4R8FCrE7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11976134',4.3,76513,'hi','सिंघम अगेन','The cop universe expands with newer additions while the old ones return led by Bajirao Singham. Singham Again interweaves the mythological epic Ramayana\'s good vs evil narrative when his wife Avni Kamath gets abducted by Danger Lanka setting Bajirao and his gang of Sangram Bhalerao and Veer Sooryavanshi along with Satya and Shakti Shetty on a mission to rescue her.','/2JbNkHg8m7LaBy61LyrnnlenaxY.jpg','2024-11-01',145,'Released',NULL,'Singham Again',1014214,3.1789,5,'DovbhJavvfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25173,_binary '\0','/nazre7z7MoUwAqimnrSlMlfLR5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1197624',7.4,349299,'en','Law Abiding Citizen','A frustrated man decides to take justice into his own hands after a plea bargain sets one of his family\'s killers free. He targets not only the killer but also the district attorney and others involved in the deal.','/fcEXcip7v0O1ndV4VUdFqJSqbOg.jpg','2009-10-15',109,'Released','Justice at any cost.','Law Abiding Citizen',22803,15.8406,7.395,'LX6kVRsdXW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25174,_binary '\0','/aMUBgI9LyeX4QJ5Y1cizPFPpAYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1197628',5.8,67759,'en','Observe and Report','Mall security guard Ronnie Barnhardt is called into action to stop a flasher from turning shopper\'s paradise into his personal peep show. But when Barnhardt can\'t bring the culprit to justice, a surly police detective is recruited to close the case.','/zHuouWUKlRK0SeIjzTlmtoPLrFA.jpg','2009-04-10',86,'Released','Right now, the world needs a hero.','Observe and Report',16991,4.234,5.419,'O83-RR1UjWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25175,_binary '\0','/jwFBzWabfWpnN9P5YIVVX5W8WUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11976532',6.8,42173,'en','Vengeance','Ben, a journalist from New York City, travels to West Texas in order to investigate the death of a girl he was hooking up with while recording a murder mystery podcast along the way.','/n1SlTeEv3dNJB3gF9AHAVElQ6LO.jpg','2022-07-29',108,'Released','Find the story before it finds you.','Vengeance',683340,5.6122,6.582,'POtgL_2qEHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25176,_binary '\0','/7IGu4NCYnXYgPRn96i7jhsuDC8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198075',4.9,4377,'en','Cougars, Inc.','When Sam learns his mother cannot afford to send him to another school after he is kicked out, he and his friends start their own escort service for mature women to pay for his tuition.','/qDK4wYJyM3CGQdXbKcnXSb2wbWl.jpg','2011-04-21',81,'Released','It\'s 10 p.m. Do you know where your mother is?','Cougars, Inc.',60302,2.0622,4.8,'2II9IKrUoMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25177,_binary '\0','/iBbMy4mxmdxDOLm8HTb412qMacg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198101',6,14503,'hi','Kites','A wounded man searches for his sweetheart in the Mexican desert while on the run from the police, bounty hunters, and others.','/lYJhUIsKtlke4gNNHkYZNppYlTZ.jpg','2010-05-21',123,'Released',NULL,'Kites',37737,2.8561,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25178,_binary '\0','/b7yqwo79l1KSMZPUY8iHEfVL0wX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11981274',2.6,1615,'en','The Huntress of Auschwitz','A young American girl travels to Europe to track down the Nazi guard responsible for the murder of her great-grandparents.','/2Swo97IutuMDSUulAfpPvmZ7ybp.jpg','2022-05-23',82,'Released','Judge, jury and executioner.','The Huntress of Auschwitz',978928,2.0232,3.8,'Oe7JD2Y4vrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25179,_binary '\0','/4b6qkETAmQiOcUtCSppe6kREXA3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198138',5.1,36411,'en','Obsessed','Things couldn\'t be better for Derek Charles. He\'s just received a big promotion at work, and has a wonderful marriage with his beautiful wife, Sharon. However, into this idyllic world steps Lisa, a temporary worker at Derek\'s office. Lisa begins to stalk Derek, jeopardizing all he holds dear.','/x98L6eO7MsvNmXFy8TNza9UdsFI.jpg','2009-02-26',108,'Released','Sharon and Derek have all they\'ve ever wanted... but someone else wants it more.','Obsessed',17335,5.7308,5.8,'bXk6H17Ecjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25180,_binary '\0','/eztduq6HLq1PMAdJKy7SH9VWotZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198153',5.7,3221,'he','קירות','In an old apartment building on the wrong side of the tracks, two women, unknown to each other, live across the hall on the second floor. Galia is an assassin involved against her will with the local sex-traffic mafia. All she wants is to reunite with her little daughter that she left back home in Ukraine . Eleanor is a grocery store cashier and a battered wife. She dreams of winning the lottery and running away from her abusive husband. Galia and Eleanor don\'t know each other, but as neighbors they share two things: an adjoining wall and a strong need to plan their escape. As Galia disobeys her latest contract, a woman target, and Eleanor discovers that she\'s pregnant, the two women decide to take action against their oppressors in a fight for survival and freedom.','/EWG78UUowHBMOsDXvDtHol07N3.jpg','2009-12-03',102,'Released','Beware of thy neighbor.','The Assassin Next Door',37714,2.3078,5.466,'lBl_j4rrrJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25181,_binary '\0','/d3eUH2Cb9C121I43kpYaPjyEDq1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198156',7.3,28808,'en','You\'re Not You','When an accomplished pianist is diagnosed with the devastating and incurable disease ALS, she hires a directionless young woman who becomes her full-time caregiver. Complete opposites, the strangers form a life-changing bond inspiring each other to live life to fullest, while being brought together by the most challenging of circumstances.','/jvrdukoeCuVckHlbAxU0MPoIzPI.jpg','2014-10-10',104,'Released','Life is measured in moments that leave you breathless.','You\'re Not You',290542,7.2647,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25182,_binary '\0','/89Kj6Z7IF2UHESfI9zW3dQ7hALR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198186',6.9,1386,'id','Ayat-Ayat Cinta','Fahri attracted many women, including Maria, Nurul, and Naora. They hide their feelings until Fahri\'s marriage with Aisha which broke their hearts.','/pWFTabzMwSbso1DsRwE8My4IL1h.jpg','2008-02-28',125,'Released',NULL,'Verses of Love',12275,1.3667,5.917,'0wLLD16zAts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25183,_binary '\0','/3pOUSIi5gDNgjiOSiqt1rvuzYDT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198196',7.4,4497,'ru','День выборов','The employees of a radio station in Moscow are forced to organize the elections campaign for a future governor in one of Russia districts.','/9QtqntCWyOwUxPQCgEEyxlSV2fr.jpg','2007-10-18',122,'Released',NULL,'Elections Day',20963,1.4386,7.1,'V23ItIy4ma4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25184,_binary '\0','/mFKNCKxGqDES41XgFIY7JDMZRrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198333',3.2,1709,'en','Autumn','The virus came so fast no one had time to prepare. Before the day was over, entire towns were decimated, and large cities became monumental tombs. Left with nothing but fading hope and the will to live, reclusive software consultant Michael (Dexter Fletcher) and temperamental mechanic Carl (Dickon Tolson) lead a small group of survivors into the country in hopes of riding out the coming winter. But now the decaying victims of the plague are reanimating, growing more smart and vicious with each passing day. Now, the only hope for the survival of the human race is Phillip (Carradine), a man who refused to leave the city, and has somehow avoided becoming food for the flesh-eating masses.','/l3vNdN57edCqvbfxnNlHaQn11Ki.jpg','2009-10-24',110,'Released','Silence is your savior.','Autumn',22177,1.5455,2.9,'xZyl2UdIwZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25185,_binary '\0','/8LtpsVPP80jEsOX4sDk4PD7pvJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198340',6.2,1247,'es','Dieta mediterránea','Sofia\'s story, the best chef in the world, and the two men who helped her to become a legend.','/jJ7O4pQqQ1zN3GhvcTjdwBNSBrD.jpg','2009-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Mediterranean Food',26971,1.5532,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25186,_binary '\0','/8yCut2YAYfdYnm48YzJXVBdgWuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198349',7.1,4150,'te','పరుగు','A group of friends are forcibly transported to a village and kept imprisoned, as the village head, who believes that they have helped in his daughter\'s elopement with her lover.','/3RYvVIZyNfYI6DRdljL42hA8zMr.jpg','2008-05-01',173,'Released',NULL,'Parugu',23776,1.693,5.779,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25187,_binary '\0','/knA4WWECPHgZPSSk9MLRjOlNWW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198385',7.1,2758,'fr','À l\'origine','France, present day. A professional conman passes himself off as the boss of a construction site building a highway extension. He cons the whole region, hires dozens of workers and cynically enjoys the profits of his scam until he meets the lady mayor of a small village that the road will go through. She intrigues and unsettles him, before revealing to him a world he never knew: feelings. How far will he go now to save his victims and save himself from his own lies?','/mmSS9WKmtjBzax2amx60p3HAu3L.jpg','2009-11-11',130,'Released',NULL,'In the Beginning',35164,1.7236,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25188,_binary '\0','/r0iNCRDGJf1WerF7ADzOhNhhnWQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198396',5.6,1459,'ko','차우','A black comedy about the events that are set into motion in a town after a man-eating boar goes on a rampage.','/ya1y9xZ0RVyWyXYxougUeBO6vBd.jpg','2009-07-15',121,'Released','This Time Mankind Is Pork.','Chaw',59450,2.14,5.7,'pC5tszUZ7PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25189,_binary '\0','/eFflMtL918pSG1qr8yRQkOTjJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198403',4,2899,'de','Lost City Raiders','The year is 2048, and global warming has flooded much of Earth\'s land areas. A father and his two sons try to salvage treasures from sunken buildings when they are given an important assignment by the New Vatican.','/v6tBlrlrPEaCPxfJ8zK44CaQy5C.jpg','2008-10-31',102,'Released','They set out to salvage the past, and ended up fighting to save the future.','Lost City Raiders',31201,2.3932,4.7,'txf_57OjLoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25190,_binary '\0','/t7tzEh7FqegHnZvtAHs4upL2hYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198408',6,2942,'en','Tenure','Despite his outstanding intellect, associate professor Charlie Thurber is a chronic underachiever and has never received university tenure. Aided by his nutty best friend, Charlie launches a final effort to make the grade at Gray College. But a beautiful new teacher whose ascending star threatens to eclipse him shakes up Charlie\'s plans.','/yntsMAC3bMpncw5n6fsYNJRHTEN.jpg','2010-02-19',89,'Released','He\'s having a mid-term crisis.','Tenure',33215,1.4548,5.6,'RGuEDI_t6pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25191,_binary '\0','/mD7ct7EA7PdQtQ1BjC5QR1WDXBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1198412',5.3,1455,'tr','Vicdan','Centers on a passionate and complicated love story that connects three small-town people trying to survive solely on their labor. Aydanur is a young woman living in Anatolia who wants to break away from whatever life has--or doesn\'t have--to offer her. Meanwhile, Mahmut is stuck between Aydanur and his wife, Songul. However, Aydanur starts covering a much bigger space in his heart. The roads of the two intersect at a tavern.','/xS2seq2KjrzUim8mz3J7te2ixKw.jpg','2008-10-10',77,'Released',NULL,'Conscience',52148,1.8851,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25192,_binary '\0','/o293eLODW22BME8XokbS09SHD6B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11987082',5.7,2210,'te','పాగల్','After his mother\'s death, Prem, a young man, searches for love in every woman he comes across. However, when he finds true love in Theera, they face several challenges in their quest to unite.','/5D7OCKLqf68V6h0HO4dCo30cVtH.jpg','2021-08-20',135,'Released',NULL,'Paagal',859946,2.6145,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25193,_binary '\0','/ieVXSMUK0mdjWWprR1WNJuO6YwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11988512',5.6,5822,'tr','Yarına Tek Bilet','Two strangers meet on a journey from Ankara to Izmir. Although having a rough start, their relationship takes a different path when they realize they have to confront themselves and would like to clean the slate as they get to know each other.','/mZ7TH5x2VVZgazvUxbLm4CSdHNK.jpg','2020-06-19',90,'Released',NULL,'One-Way to Tomorrow',682426,1.4661,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25194,_binary '\0','/hHL4pwGzYS4njLpXhIjfc9skAQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11989890',8.9,36409,'en','David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet','The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.','/zSKwyUDKDHiFU5syTTvQRDcGBPS.jpg','2020-09-28',83,'Released',NULL,'David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet',664280,7.3366,8.434,'64R2MYUt394','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25195,_binary '\0','/yYkXxk9cr5jBPUDCNDrdswsxMls.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11991132',7.5,1524,'ta','கமலி from நடுக்காவேரி','Kamali is a happy-go-lucky girl from a small town. She is a weak student who is hardly interested in studies when she falls in love with a studious boy in Chennai who aspires to make it to IIT Madras. She decides to take her studies seriously and convinces her father to go for higher studies. With the help of a retired professor in her village, she starts preparing for exams to join IIT Madras if only to meet her love.','/3j3Lu8CIv4368Lwz2AcQ3t3goYV.jpg','2021-02-19',150,'Released','Believe in Yourself','Kamali from Nadukkaveri',773288,1.0704,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25196,_binary '\0','/iGmfHHa3CSqKrH3yeS9CQVLAVUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11991748',7.4,12860,'ja','るろうに剣心 最終章 The Beginning','Before he was a protector, Kenshin was a fearsome assassin known as Battosai. But when he meets gentle Tomoe Yukishiro, a beautiful young woman who carries a huge burden in her heart, his life will change forever.','/rODS466qSdrwMlGdbUwPENhDN2c.jpg','2021-06-04',138,'Released','This is how it ends, this is where it began.','Rurouni Kenshin: The Beginning',672322,8.7784,7.7,'s0vN_2MRR50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25197,_binary '\0','/oZK07PoV0MAG8ts7n95foyRfU3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11991786',6.4,2132,'fr','Le guide de la famille parfaite','A couple in Québec deals with the pitfalls, pressure and high expectations of raising kids in a society obsessed with success and social media image.','/cBhkSwZpb3QpUwFuFdWAXTqWAtS.jpg','2021-07-14',102,'Released',NULL,'The Guide to the Perfect Family',633954,2.3973,6.5,'uOnf4K9ACmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25198,_binary '\0','/3J1V1rSV0Rlk5AGsMO7ahD92spD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11992424',8.2,10360,'kn','ಸಪ್ತ ಸಾಗರದಾಚೆ ಎಲ್ಲೊ - ಸೈಡ್ ಎ','In the heart of \'Sapta Sagaradaache Ello’ resides an ardent love story between Manu and Priya. Set in 2010, the couple hails from a middle-class background. Circumstances land Manu in jail, putting his relationship with Priya in jeopardy.','/qjvSMN5dhSh7cymjj6if2aJ4ejW.jpg','2023-09-01',140,'Released','Somewhere Beyond the Seven Seas','Sapta Sagaradaache Ello – Side A',1168104,1.6604,8.07,'hcJ1ZHHahMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25199,_binary '\0','/p9R163gjE6Z5g4eWY1qnvU4vbW2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11992694',6.5,11700,'de','Corsage','A fictional account of one year in the life of Empress Elisabeth of Austria. On Christmas Eve 1877, Elisabeth, once idolized for her beauty, turns 40 and is officially deemed an old woman; she starts trying to maintain her public image.','/bhS9oqoJdMSoejB8keZpg9G5uVC.jpg','2022-07-07',114,'Released','No pain, no reign.','Corsage',888321,4.9935,6.07,'P7LpMtLRe2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25200,_binary '\0','/tLMXo6vtR7dAQdFiG8oBVPp3XHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11994750',7,5180,'en','Made You Look: A True Story About Fake Art','A woman walks into a New York gallery with a cache of unknown masterworks. Thus begins a story of art world greed, willfulness and a high-stakes con.','/6ANquD7ZQTU4yZVLG478BbzRMAG.jpg','2020-04-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Made You Look: A True Story About Fake Art',693906,1.4379,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25201,_binary '\0','/qTFc6NH2laI49ErQgrmISmdJqNv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11995784',2.5,1368,'en','The Haunting of Pendle Hill','When a respected historian vanishes investigating the infamous Pendle Witch Trials of 1612, his daughter must undertake a rescue mission while uncovering the truth about the evil Demdike.','/mTSQ8P1WYCouhrANAK1hEGgAxQA.jpg','2022-04-04',90,'Released','Death is not the end.','The Haunting of Pendle Hill',854890,1.445,2.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25202,_binary '\0','/fjd6RKx4Zh8UKQfjpSSkM53eJw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt11998558',5.9,41626,'ta','வாரிசு','Vijay, The prodigal son of business tycoon Rajendran agrees to take over the reins of the business, much to the chagrin of his brothers. But can Vijay prove himself to be a worthy varisu and also reunite his now-broken family?','/iMUIsV6u0pPqfv1j8tGxbJw40sw.jpg','2023-01-11',169,'Released','The Boss Returns','Varisu',835017,2.3974,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25203,_binary '\0','/dAY5UyVchFsLPlH3vY1ETLrqiaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1200065',4.7,1306,'te','కంత్రి','The opening scenes give you an indication of how the movie is going to shape up. NRI Krishna returns to his village with his wife and child to work for the upliftment of the village folk. However, when the family, along with his old father, is on its way home with the money, PR Pothuraju (Prakash Raj) betrays everyone by killing them and running away with the money, leaving his wife and son behind. Pothuraju is the head of a huge empire and is known for his nefarious connections and illegal dealings. He is supported at every step by his friend and partner Seshu (Ashish Vidyarthi). Enters our hero Kantri (Jr. NTR), who flexes his muscles, shakes his leg, and gets into Pothuraju\'s gang to earn money for his orphanage where he grew up (he is orphaned at a very young age). Kantri falls in love with Varalakshmi (Hansika Motwani), who is such a lucky girl that she wins a foreign trip, house, and household gadgets for her family. However, she initially does not like Kantri. Cast','/kpwaPlWaQA1yif6NCWyIHAB2p5k.jpg','2008-05-09',160,'Released',NULL,'Kantri',81065,1.2606,2.818,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25204,_binary '\0','/4KN06gns94rQFoYQWDGunK7Cob4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12001534',6.5,92675,'en','The Thursday Murder Club','A group of senior sleuths passionate about solving cold cases get plunged into a real-life murder mystery in this comic crime caper.','/jbnazCHr8S2l2glyvjPTpa4NbEw.jpg','2025-08-22',118,'Released','Join the club.','The Thursday Murder Club',744653,10.578,6.6,'50DYgzRBhFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25205,_binary '\0','/rSle4ix2IZ6UMgCDY8L3ngdOmSZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1200263',6.8,20837,'en','The Color Purple','A decades-spanning tale of love and resilience and of one woman\'s journey to independence. Celie faces many hardships in her life, but ultimately finds extraordinary strength and hope in the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood.','/h5bqIxM8GO4TewJ0u6Rzkg58ssJ.jpg','2023-12-25',141,'Released','A bold new take on the beloved classic.','The Color Purple',558915,9.8824,6.964,'ndg_SfB48es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25206,_binary '\0','/nLtceJoF7LERxBIBqlIT4YPwBNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1200272',7,2079,'en','La Mission','Growing up in the Mission district of San Francisco, Che Rivera has always had to be tough to survive. He\'s a powerful man respected throughout the Mission barrio for his masculinity and his strength, as well as for his hobby building beautiful lowrider cars. A reformed inmate and recovering alcoholic, Che has worked hard to redeem his life and do right by his pride and joy: his only son, Jes, whom he has raised on his own after the death of his wife. Che\'s path to redemption is tested, however, when he discovers Jes is gay. To survive his neighborhood, Che has always lived with his fists. To survive as a complete man, he\'ll have to embrace a side of himself he\'s never shown.','/8X9rNpLLPklX8uGRUgbdYHPfter.jpg','2009-01-19',117,'Released','Growing up in the Mission district of San Francisco, Che Rivera has always had to be tough to survive.','La Mission',43219,1.5434,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25207,_binary '\0','/sBOenwOZGRN5nZZGw4TxwtnfrEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12003946',6.7,122672,'en','Violent Night','When a team of mercenaries breaks into a wealthy family compound on Christmas Eve, taking everyone inside hostage, the team isn’t prepared for a surprise combatant: Santa Claus is on the grounds, and he’s about to show why this Nick is no saint.','/e8CpMgdyihz9Td7amQDqubPuzfN.jpg','2022-11-30',112,'Released','You better watch out.','Violent Night',899112,13.9261,7.207,'a53e4HHnx_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25208,_binary '\0','/2cQMVHBaP1wK0UBX5SGDahB3lp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12004038',6.3,62681,'en','Watcher','As a serial killer stalks the city, Julia — a young actress who just moved to town with her husband — notices a mysterious stranger watching her from across the street.','/dXCjoI3jdtBrwPHgVsyNLkl8Rvs.jpg','2022-06-03',96,'Released','Evil wants to be seen.','Watcher',807356,6.6458,6.5,'KDc6ZLo8sjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25209,_binary '\0','/kBHBPB6xs4PaXDvUE9XAo8rZmFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12004238',4.8,1463,'en','Altered Reality','Oliver\'s life transforms with an alien-marked miracle drug, riches, family woes, and a vanished daughter in \'Altered Reality\'—a gripping tale of redemption and choices.','/aSSIKUtveEn7tDkKLCagPNBFHGk.jpg','2024-02-16',99,'Released','When you change the past, there will be consequences!','Altered Reality',680027,1.6469,5.1,'8xJQ6yQ0dlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25210,_binary '\0','/j8rrinSi8z5cN5XkzlfIOZCMFV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1201167',6.3,127875,'en','Funny People','Famous and wealthy funnyman George Simmons doesn\'t give much thought to how he treats people until a doctor delivers stunning health news, forcing George to reevaluate his priorities with a little help from aspiring stand-up comic Ira.','/gEYKD5cWCBGg8Za3hhwDBk3gEsP.jpg','2009-07-30',146,'Released','George Simmons was prepared to die, but then a funny thing happened.','Funny People',20829,7.9225,5.9,'kzciY15Q3BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25211,_binary '\0','/gzycjJWGw04DF6C7IYOA1F0cWhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12013758',5.8,1716,'it','Sulla stessa onda','A summer fling born under the Sicilian sun quickly develops into a heartbreaking love story that forces a boy and girl to grow up too quickly.','/j9O2WXJqF45ynkng4SAsZ1h0OCt.jpg','2021-03-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Caught by a Wave',694256,2.1879,6.6,'n4Uv5VHRDZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25212,_binary '\0','/zjBotOQpewbtkxeG0YLugEft5NE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12015102',6.9,29769,'kn','ವಿಕ್ರಾಂತ್ ರೋಣ','Almost half a century ago, a remote village in the middle of a tropical rain forest starts witnessing a series of unexplainable events which they attribute to the supernatural. Vikrant Rona, An eccentric police officer, is assigned to solve the mystery. A mysterious game unfolds where everyone in the village is a potential victim and everyone is a suspect.','/jq1yH1pT8VMZONLMTgOFUDgitNh.jpg','2022-07-28',147,'Released','The World of Phantom','Vikrant Rona',680334,1.0413,6.1,'6Zu56qzH_6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25213,_binary '\0','/eKUk4oN4ucwnLJml7wRnjuB9AQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1201607',8.1,1062786,'en','Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2','Harry, Ron and Hermione continue their quest to vanquish the evil Voldemort once and for all. Just as things begin to look hopeless for the young wizards, Harry discovers a trio of magical objects that endow him with powers to rival Voldemort\'s formidable skills.','/c54HpQmuwXjHq2C9wmoACjxoom3.jpg','2011-07-12',130,'Released','It all ends.','Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2',12445,36.2006,8.1,'5NYt1qirBWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25214,_binary '\0','/kvRPSdJhboDtPcmsDpO2VRej7qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1202363',6.4,5683,'tr','O... Çocukları','After the coup d\'état on September 12, 1980, a husband and wife wanted for political crimes decide to flee abroad. But their children are the biggest obstacle to this plan. Before fleeing abroad, they search for a safe place to leave their children. The couple finally chooses Mehtap Anne\'s home as the \"safest place\" for their children. The place where they left their children is actually the \"Emanetçi Anne\" house, where Mehtap, a former prostitute, takes in the children of other prostitutes who continue to work in the trade after she has left it... Some time after the couple flees abroad, they send an Italian girl to Turkey to retrieve their children. The Italian girl, who wants to take the child left with the \"Emanetçi Anne\" and bring it to its parents, finds herself caught up in a series of interesting events.','/brfNqPvCjCu1wXqlRzXWasieqd0.jpg','2008-05-16',120,'Released',NULL,'O... Çocukları',27956,1.8738,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25215,_binary '\0','/c4FyrpbvhSwYWtQqWC4Gjmdmle1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12024308',6.9,6104,'en','Wildflower','The story of Bea Johnson from birth to graduation as she navigates life with an intellectually disabled parent and an extended family who can\'t quite agree on the best way to help.','/jsNulf9CgHSSRSCgdhNsLynUTvm.jpg','2023-03-17',105,'Released','A little heartache, a lot of love.','Wildflower',915523,5.4069,7.4,'Ug3FVmA7yuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25216,_binary '\0','/auUuv1dVlmdCsUhXZXL8B1BJBhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1202514',6.6,4149,'cn','意外','A self-styled accident choreographer, the Brain is a professional hitman who kills his victims by trapping them in well crafted accidents that look like unfortunate mishaps. When the team\'s next assignment goes disastrously wrong, Brain begins to suspect that someone else has planned an ‘accident’ on them.','/8CwreRof98cUJFJhQlqc5YVdZ7C.jpg','2009-09-24',89,'Released','When life is the shadow of death.','Accident',25474,2.3261,6.732,'H8R-W7VXay4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25217,_binary '\0','/v2MLX1Kr3PpNQC3Fss85OugK0er.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1202517',6.7,1421,'hi','Barah Aana','Three impoverished roommates have the chance to change their fates when one of them stumbles upon a seemingly low-risk way to earn some extra cash.','/pUtLT7wxkkxOXB14BIwvnsGMCPf.jpg','2009-03-13',97,'Released',NULL,'Barah Aana',21224,1.1843,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25218,_binary '\0','/4WQCJM8xpSwbWcmxAiBasveBWWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1202540',4.7,5090,'hi','दिल बोले हडिप्पा!','Veera, a fire-cracker of a girl who lives in a small village but dreams of playing cricket in the big league. Rohan is an accomplished captain of a county cricket team in England. Rohan returns to India to captain his father\'s cricket team which has been losing for the last 8 years. In a Village where girls don\'t play Cricket, Veera has to put on a put on a turban & beard to live her dream.','/6u2yY1K04TiPi7sn38BBIiclvVL.jpg','2009-09-18',148,'Released',NULL,'Dil Bole Hadippa!',22609,1.8011,5.539,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25219,_binary '\0','/vqFwKTK4NGKgZ7PgVFY8vMeqkrC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12027020',7.2,2105,'en','LA Originals','Photographer Estevan Oriol and artist Mister Cartoon turned their Chicano roots into gritty art, impacting street culture, hip hop and beyond.','/pqQCq63H8J8aV5tlaqgRjhyr43o.jpg','2020-04-10',92,'Released','The story of two Chicanos that changed culture forever','LA Originals',688848,1.915,6.8,'y_01QJYDavw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25220,_binary '\0','/1gO7S3pqiqHeLKNlnYZgdKdazYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12032938',6.1,4042,'ml','മഡ്ഡി','Muthu and his cousin Karthi have fallen out, but when the latter\'s mud racing rival looks set to win an important competition, will the brothers unite?','/jNWrDYMSstertJKFhIozPfhAmgA.jpg','2021-12-10',137,'Released',NULL,'Muddy',885240,1.0801,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25221,_binary '\0','/uSSxLX7FhJJm8K4iFdP2AY7FcP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1203517',3.6,2263,'en','The Graves','Two inseparable sister\'s visit to a remote mine town turns into a mind-bending fight for survival against menaces both human and supernatural.','/rhhVCz4ZlQMOZ8oMLtMHcNm7DpT.jpg','2010-01-29',88,'Released','Sometimes death is the least of your problems.','The Graves',34231,1.8149,3.7,'_xiq9rlw6nM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25222,_binary '\0','/jqEaYZQTwvvq6CThrtXDTfVfk7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12036052',7.3,2541,'en','Elephant','Disneynature’s Elephant follows African eleph