ey Back Guarantee',1033845,1.1348,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25226,_binary '\0','/8Tfys3mDZVp4tNoH2ktm06a0Tau.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12042730',8.2,545801,'en','Project Hail Mary','Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.','/AdpvqIhgaqg5JHzH3M6532XV3PG.jpg','2026-03-15',157,'Released','Believe in the Hail Mary.','Project Hail Mary',687163,101.9608,8.6,'5VYsnngkS_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25227,_binary '\0','/iPt0HhkT4RXM5LjfXtbGsLXNUbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204340',7.5,35693,'en','Tyrannosaur','The story of Joseph, a man plagued by violence and a rage that is driving him to self-destruction. As Joseph\'s life spirals into turmoil a chance of redemption appears in the form of Hannah, a Christian charity shop worker. Their relationship develops to reveal that Hannah is hiding a secret of her own with devastating results on both of their lives.','/p6PJGuO6K94YylUcAsTTn7Q4cQn.jpg','2011-10-07',87,'Released',NULL,'Tyrannosaur',76543,2.8822,7.2,'nvyqXFmV-LI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25228,_binary '\0','/60PR4UC3D20dycVAoWadUzFio5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204342',7.1,101623,'en','The Muppets','When Kermit the Frog and the Muppets learn that their beloved theater is slated for demolition, a sympathetic human, Gary, and his felt-faced brother, Walter, swoop in to help the gang put on a telethon show and raise the $10 million they need to save the day.','/h5N6x5gS45wAALt5fsWVn0oCYQR.jpg','2011-11-23',103,'Released','Get ready for Muppet domination.','The Muppets',64328,10.2441,6.668,'C4YhbpuGdwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25229,_binary '\0','/moMzzwovYkk5ZO1cawc1uznySaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204773',6.6,4315,'de','Alle Anderen','While on a Mediterranean vacation, a seemingly happy boyfriend and girlfriend find their connection to one another tested as they bond with another couple.','/zwncG9rCrVCoA20mGAx0TV31Kp6.jpg','2009-03-26',119,'Released',NULL,'Everyone Else',33809,1.4215,6.034,'0OqI9gxz7tY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25230,_binary '\0','/j9QsqWuRhe7OR2V0CRdQ0zikzui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12048234',6.5,1743,'en','Save the Cinema','The true story of Liz Evans, a hairdresser and leader of a youth theatre in Carmarthen, Wales, who began a campaign in 1993 to save the Lyric theatre from closure. Alongside then Mayor of Carmarthen Richard Goodridge, they enlisted the help of Steven Spielberg, securing a special premiere of Jurassic Park.','/pRYbrkvHV2TCt2dT0G8aGoFK2hR.jpg','2022-01-14',109,'Released','A future worth fighting for.','Save the Cinema',790386,2.0832,6.2,'dG9Qfab6Z2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25231,_binary '\0','/2cKQ0zLJFIe9mnlhtjricpPEZoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204883',4.6,5725,'en','Boogeyman 3','When a college student witnesses the alleged suicide of her roommate, it sets into motion a series of horrific events that cause her to fear the supernatural entity. As she tries to convince the rest of her dorm that the Boogeyman does exist, the evil force grows stronger and her friends begin to pay the price. Now she must stop this ultimate evil before the entire campus falls prey.','/iOCBPiNeQ7tPuQDwxapNYuSLKT5.jpg','2008-10-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Boogeyman 3',15262,3.0471,5.2,'4FBrn8VW3bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25232,_binary '\0','/aDgkqsFurAuN5hBQIJZ6bbV5lS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204975',6.6,140898,'en','Last Vegas','Aging pals Billy, Paddy, Archie, and Sam have been best friends since childhood. When Billy finally proposes to his much-younger girlfriend, all four friends go to Las Vegas to celebrate the end of Billy\'s longtime bachelorhood and relive their glory days. However, the four quickly realize that the intervening decades have changed Sin City and tested their friendship in ways they had not imagined.','/9Aht200Eu2jYiE9cEQdFfNDtHl6.jpg','2013-10-31',105,'Released','It\'s going to be legendary','Last Vegas',137093,8.5703,6.398,'TvK3m0wJutI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25233,_binary '\0','/fsuA3wUYixjLeE97CyyPGdPoQF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204977',4.5,62544,'en','Ouija','A group of friends must confront their most terrifying fears when they awaken the dark powers of an ancient spirit board.','/gwjHlGjK2xXKpjd65BWyAMwzTWC.jpg','2014-10-24',89,'Released','Keep telling yourself it\'s just a game.','Ouija',242512,7.7629,5.1,'xBLmBdn2QF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25234,_binary '\0','/q2QyAgK4u24SDjQEsI5XaBwScQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1204979',4.9,9189,'en','Vacancy 2: The First Cut','Three young people check into the Meadow View Inn for a night\'s rest, fully unaware of the inn\'s sick-minded employees and their nefarious intentions.','/qp0xpheiKwK2ASjX3YUwDPVOzHx.jpg','2008-10-24',86,'Released','If the camera is on, you\'re dead.','Vacancy 2: The First Cut',15641,3.5327,5.3,'I50jQDlPKiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25235,_binary '\0','/bW4HVjN96ecZDmw5sxZeOeWKjUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205071',3.8,2725,'en','Paintball','Eight strangers engaged in an intense game of experts-only paintball find their friendly game taking a terrifying turn when one member of the team begins playing by a different set of rules. It started as a remote raw battle of wits and wiles set against the backdrop of majestic wilderness. With each shot fired, the stakes grew higher. But something horrible has happened, and what was once a team sport has become a relentless struggle for individual survival. The danger growing by the minute, the combatants gradually come to realize that their greatest adversary may be the very game they set out to play.','/cGzGlsrRiLJA5S81CPguLDDZNZD.jpg','2009-04-24',86,'Released','There\'s nothing like a brush with death to make you feel alive.','Paintball',25377,1.6887,3.9,'vhJFLJMnfUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25236,_binary '\0','/rPC7u38IEAgOZQ6WbnM7CVtXy64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12054850',8.7,1461,'or','ପ୍ରତୀକ୍ଷା','An unemployed graduate faces the dilemma of securing a government job and saving his father after the family meets a medical crisis.','/n5T8NqVwzp68kIgI9DHcMNkeKPJ.jpg','2022-12-02',137,'Released',NULL,'Pratikshya',1031996,0.8934,0,'E_p4kHzZBTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25237,_binary '\0','/sP4vNXFhPviUJevrD7X8fJV1OD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205489',8.1,870261,'en','Gran Torino','Disgruntled Korean War veteran Walt Kowalski sets out to reform his neighbor, Thao Lor, a Hmong teenager who tried to steal Kowalski\'s prized possession: a 1972 Gran Torino.','/zUybYvxWdAJy5hhYovsXtHSWI1l.jpg','2008-12-12',116,'Released','Get off my lawn.','Gran Torino',13223,11.2447,7.988,'F8zue_BzNsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25238,_binary '\0','/xoWErrVQWvkgi9jCUwUlRb5ZKnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205535',6.3,52706,'en','The Rebound','Upon discovering her husband\'s infidelity, Sandy leaves the suburbs and moves into the city. There, she befriends Aram, a guy whose wife only married him so she could get a green card. Sandy hires Aram to be her nanny, and it isn\'t long until Aram and Sandy find out they get along wonderfully and start to date. But is their relationship real or is it, in fact, just a rebound for both of them?','/j82RTG8dNyOYhIKspjk5Z0bEmdi.jpg','2009-09-16',95,'Released','She\'s still got it. He\'s just getting it.','The Rebound',24122,8.8344,6.505,'uGyLFdzhw-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25239,_binary '\0','/6KaCzcVKsdxlsTIq35xAix5U3Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205537',6.2,144383,'en','Jack Ryan: Shadow Recruit','Jack Ryan, as a young covert CIA analyst, uncovers a Russian plot to crash the U.S. economy with a terrorist attack.','/m7HcLUodrD4lM4s0Hui1tzO2pjO.jpg','2014-01-15',105,'Released','Trust no one.','Jack Ryan: Shadow Recruit',137094,10.3329,6.126,'S8EaxDvZt4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25240,_binary '\0','/cHDaR8kaFzZPLaI1GdpqxW0Z8yb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205551',6.8,1738,'ko','서양골동양과자점 앤티크','Jin-hyeok opens a cake shop in an old antique shop, hiring Seon-woo, Korea\'s best pastry chef, who fell in love with him in high school. Also there, are Su-young, crushing on Seon-woo, ex-boxer Ki-beom, and Seon-woo\'s French ex-boyfriend.','/wtjJAFaHL5GEzOzHZaCKI9TjyN6.jpg','2008-11-13',111,'Released','Love. Life. Cakes.','Antique',30843,1.3617,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25241,_binary '\0','/w9VGzSCTgqiLDDOVCQkJd7yvICw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205558',5.5,21828,'en','Hick','A pistol-packing teen meets an unstable rebel and a cocaine-snorting drifter as she hitchhikes her way out West.','/ziXCRCci5BFLEUwSgO0V83M9LGw.jpg','2012-05-11',99,'Released','Trouble travels together.','Hick',94363,3.0328,5.704,'UelE68sqROE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25242,_binary '\0','/o2OSpKzXuB1edCDyVC2MXAxXwyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12057168',4.7,1417,'ru','Приворот. Чёрное венчание','Terror strikes when a heartbroken woman uses black magic to get her husband back.','/2AbGdSGlU6CpiV3lswHUgE5CdAA.jpg','2021-02-11',93,'Released','Until Death Tears Them Apart','Dark Spell',633802,2.3613,6.6,'kR0RVnMbnOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25243,_binary '\0','/fZiBrK65HsBYTJXKaHvuQKDt8Cq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12057234',4.2,1223,'ru','Вдова','Based on real events. In a densely forested area north of St. Petersburg people have been going missing for three decades. The few corpses ever found were naked. On October 14, 2017 a team of volunteers went out into the woods in search of a missing teenager. Soon, all communication with them was lost. Locals believe they were taken by the same dark spirit that took the others. They call it the Limping Widow.','/kjaOjS3QMiyUhU14LCnJGzORR22.jpg','2020-10-02',80,'Released','An urban legend. A terrifying truth.','The Widow',579872,1.6198,5.6,'cGAf-kaEe-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25244,_binary '\0','/1X46oSUSqvmAeFmQnopwhPnb7oE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12058582',3.6,2266,'en','Demigod','Upon the death of her grandfather, a woman and her husband return to her birthplace in Germany\'s Black Forest, only to find a terrifying secret awaits them.','/xTUhRLblPHTJmyFEiqHWUuY4Wcg.jpg','2021-10-08',94,'Released','His time has come.','Demigod',760871,1.4223,4.6,'_hWNgDFoMGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25245,_binary '\0','/zICIR1kQERtCFa9Ybn6c6n8zIXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12058584',6.8,5828,'de','Schachnovelle','1938. While the Nazi troops march into Vienna, the lawyer Josef Bartok hastily tries to escape to the USA with his wife but is arrested by the Gestapo. Bartok remains steadfast and refuses to cooperate with the Gestapo that requires confidential information from him. Thrown into solitary confinement, Bartok is psychologically tormented for months and begins to weaken. However, when he steals an old book about chess it sets him on course to overcome the mental suffering inflicted upon him, until it becomes a dangerous obsession.','/2IWHrRYTsmVc7N0TdgkSoa3vYFK.jpg','2021-09-23',110,'Released','He turned resistance into a game.','Chess Story',748787,4.6982,6.8,'El2m-caHDHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25246,_binary '\0','/AuGLK3pnhFZ55F3HWWcko9mqUsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12059016',5,2422,'en','Red Snow','A struggling vampire romance novelist must defend herself against real-life vampires during Christmas in Lake Tahoe.','/gKpsfpUtleiVTBInYnVRHq669nV.jpg','2021-04-14',80,'Released','Season\'s bleedings.','Red Snow',774454,1.9703,5.9,'XoXzOYGq7ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25247,_binary '\0','/bBpxIkVq6MZMS0JBMm7Xu7sKYRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1205913',3.6,1376,'en','NYC: Tornado Terror','An unexplained, local split in the atmosphere causes a series of total unpredictable, yet devastating tornadoes. Rookie fireman Brian Flynn gets trapped in the underground sewage with his girlfriend, deputy mayor James \'Jim\' Lawrence and climatologist Dr. Cassie Lawrence\'s niece Lori. Mayor Leonardo of New York initially refuses to pay proper attention to the phenomenon, a \'reelection threat\', so the alert status remains too low for long. Atypical lightning discovered inside tornadoes adds unprecedented dangers. The Lawrences and aeronautics renegade Dr. Lars Liggenhorn conceive a possible solution by launching rockets, but NASA\'s Dr. Quinn overrules them, imposing standard silver iodine.','/lQKNYo6qxCaQZoXKZswq0GPIDSv.jpg','2008-10-04',90,'Released',NULL,'NYC: Tornado Terror',55281,1.5451,5.1,'RMh4H6H2f9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25248,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206082',4.1,1382,'en','The Dead Outside','A neurological pandemic has consumed the population. Drug-resistance has mutated the virus into a ravaging psychological plague, rendering the \'the dying\' desperate, paranoid and violent','/4VmiOxVqV391jpADc2zTFrPAEqu.jpg','2008-08-24',86,'Released',NULL,'The Dead Outside',34195,0.7762,4,'c5-tCcHqknw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25249,_binary '\0','/jCg3EBjvZtXyFJ2zDokn3fFfCXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206086',4.6,1502,'ja','Rain Fall','A hit man looks to protect the daughter of one of his victims against CIA assassins.','/jpcy33dy2fkUeUI45OZuDql1KVx.jpg','2009-04-24',111,'Released',NULL,'Rain Fall',27944,2.1869,4.781,'v_29Rs4H5X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25250,_binary '\0','/s5ju92bKUbx4am1qHLKK2PVnaj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206285',7.4,5588,'es','Camino','A religious organization interferes with the life of a terminally ill girl.','/sTE5F8m7itOL6iw90WISna0Vc43.jpg','2008-10-16',143,'Released',NULL,'Camino',17893,1.3275,7.6,'NkNBeG078NQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25251,_binary '\0','/yJetT9PknmMbgwPdhrpxVU8tDKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206326',6.9,2234,'ja','ＯＮＥ ＰＩＥＣＥ（ワンピース） エピソードオブチョッパー＋冬に咲く、奇跡の桜','When Nami falls ill, the Straw Hats seek medical care for her on Drum Island. There they meet reindeer doctor Tony Tony Chopper and the Wapol Pirates.','/rGgZ3nIJt1anC1hOT4Do5mCOqAJ.jpg','2008-03-01',113,'Released',NULL,'One Piece: Episode of Chopper Plus: Bloom in the Winter, Miracle Cherry Blossom',44731,4.0158,7.021,'zUYVRPpzM70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25252,_binary '\0','/c9lMQ7mVG3kq7B9W3qDVe4TVFD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206478',6,1322,'fr','Le crime est notre affaire','Loosely based on \"4.50 from Paddington\" by Agatha Christie.','/w1RfhaiRN9TjEaQ5wAoHQm0YuPr.jpg','2008-10-02',109,'Released',NULL,'Crime Is Our Business',15437,1.6236,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25253,_binary '\0','/u1N34argMlLDuS7zUIekPVk9Imz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206488',6.7,7715,'es','La teta asustada','Fausta is suffering from a rare disease called the Milk of Sorrow, which is transmitted through the breast milk of pregnant women who were abused or raped during or soon after pregnancy. While living in constant fear and confusion due to this disease, she must face the sudden death of her mother. She chooses to take drastic measures to not follow in her mother\'s footsteps.','/bdg1wZ76HSVEtEKh7FUXYGqW9nW.jpg','2009-02-13',94,'Released',NULL,'The Milk of Sorrow',28644,2.9331,6.3,'KXja-e_XmAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25254,_binary '\0','/joXz5iPvhDvrHUejlviswMCZaEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206543',6.7,133582,'en','Out of the Furnace','Two brothers live in the economically-depressed Rust Belt, when a cruel twist of fate lands one in prison. His brother is then lured into one of the most violent crime rings in the Northeast.','/cOuQQ4eRpSBxb0G9OXzWE1pHPeq.jpg','2013-11-12',116,'Released','Sometimes your battles choose you.','Out of the Furnace',164457,7.2284,6.558,'YhsGY8jZnR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25255,_binary '\0','/pz5iPl72ORLQiS6Z5tBe8BGoC5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206585',5.8,1851,'it','Winx Club - Il segreto del regno perduto','Sixteen years ago the most powerful warrior wizards of the Magic Dimension sacrificed themselves to fight against absolute evil. Now the fate of a kingdom is in the hands of a young girl - Bloom, the fairy of the Dragon\'s flame. Accompanied by her Winx Club girlfriends, Bloom must overcome the greatest challenge of all: enter the depths of the obscure dimension, fight against evil to bring her parents back to life and reveal the mystery linked to her origins. The destiny of the entire Magic Dimension depends on the outcome of this conflict.','/9T37TmZ7WV8qgJNoE1mTQchUXug.jpg','2007-11-29',85,'Released',NULL,'Winx Club: The Secret of the Lost Kingdom',80797,5.6978,7.3,'FgzfQdROjNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25256,_binary '\0','/spYx9XQFODuqEVoPpvaJI1ksAVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1206885',6.1,121245,'en','Rambo: Last Blood','After fighting his demons for decades, John Rambo now lives in peace on his family ranch in Arizona, but his rest is interrupted when Gabriela, the granddaughter of his housekeeper María, disappears after crossing the border into Mexico to meet her biological father. Rambo, who has become a true father figure for Gabriela over the years, undertakes a desperate and dangerous journey to find her.','/kTQ3J8oTTKofAVLYnds2cHUz9KO.jpg','2019-09-18',89,'Released','Everyone has one more fight in them.','Rambo: Last Blood',522938,14.0132,6.5,'4vWg5yJuWfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25257,_binary '\0','/rp89EBT2enxYMQvi9mWE7fVBCYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12077032',6.5,1782,'ru','Китобой','Everything changes in the life of a young 15-year-old Chukchi hunter Lyoshka with the advent of the Internet in the village. He falls in love – for the first time and deeply – with the silent video chat girl. Upon learning that she lives in Detroit, Lyoshka decides on the most desperate act in his life.','/lM2iC1cDJZqMNkRHRzKRpzGvbou.jpg','2020-10-08',93,'Released',NULL,'The Whaler Boy',598268,1.373,5.9,'uVxdnBlhIFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25258,_binary '\0','/bcm0pfzkZl3K6KHCbpJqmwTM06F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12077970',6.6,1307,'fr','Une histoire d\'amour et de désir','Ahmed, 18, is French of Algerian origin. He grew up in the Parisian suburbs. On the benches of the university, he meets Farah, a young Tunisian full of energy recently arrived from Tunis. While discovering a body of sensual and erotic Arabic literature that he never knew existed, Ahmed falls deeply in love with this girl, and although literally overwhelmed by desire, he will try to resist it.','/84TEK0sWiH7bSIs1WdXpqk6GCE4.jpg','2021-09-01',102,'Released',NULL,'A Tale of Love and Desire',820702,3.223,6.2,'ShBbalC64qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25259,_binary '\0','/mWWBP07HlM6TiI5HgjwWtZH9F1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12078076',6.4,2031,'kn','ಭಜರಂಗಿ 2','When a group of lost villagers chance upon a Guruji at a shrine, he begins to narrate the story of two unlikely heroes, Anji and Bhajrangi, who lived across two different timelines.','/AhgT7FQxUE9PTinUca0S8QMeEv3.jpg','2021-10-29',122,'Released','Jai Bhajarangi','Bhajarangi 2',735134,1.129,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25260,_binary '\0','/yEBBtk1eyZltGgJt8Z2zi3KIvvX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12078990',7.5,4031,'es','La Casa de Papel: el fenómeno','A documentary on why \'Money Heist\' sparked a wave of enthusiasm around the world for a lovable group of thieves and their professor.','/AboUXTrDWEi0PuZUqaft0iwBTm7.jpg','2020-04-03',57,'Released',NULL,'Money Heist: The Phenomenon',689249,3.5241,7.4,'aGcYHaFaj8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25261,_binary '\0','/mK1MS8GHWnT9waxrVOEXa2u9421.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12091980',7.7,2574,'ml','തിങ്കളാഴ്ച നിശ്ചയം','Set in Kanhangad, a modest town in North Kerala, arrangements are underway for Vijayan\'s second daughter, Suja\'s engagement. On what should be a perfect ceremony, the bride is having second thoughts, her father is in a financial mess, and as members of their family arrive one by one, family secrets start to surface. Set within the two days preceding the ceremony, the entire film happens in and around Vijayan\'s house.','/75Zy1UjitISQGF5x1ue3MYGthOs.jpg','2021-10-29',107,'Released','Made in Kanhangad','Thinkalazhcha Nishchayam',854587,0.8987,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25262,_binary '\0','/cgbXqYSMKDMqoOQcRIdWXtlvJwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1209319',5.1,1495,'en','Everyman\'s War','No one in high command believed that German forces would attack in the sub zero temperatures and near blizzard conditions. As the pre-dawn attack comes, with communications down Sgt. Smith is left with no choice but to make his way through enemy fire, unarmed and wounded, into town and warn of the coming attack. Based on actual accounts \"Everyman\'s War\" explores the heroic events of this decorated veterans courage and the struggle between duty and desire. Between the prospect of the life and love, Dorine that waits at home and the harsh realities of war which marks the pivotal epoch in his life as he discovers that the loss of hope can be worse than the loss of life. One man\'s courage... One man\'s hope...Everyman\'s War.','/8LpGhP4IssE4kx0UQreRrOErxmw.jpg','2009-05-22',104,'Released','When all hope is lost...heroes emerge.','Everyman\'s War',37531,1.594,5.161,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25263,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1209361',4.1,1597,'en','Sutures','A group of longtime friends converge on a fatal course with destiny when they cross paths with Alexander Tatum, a mercenary surgeon. He is a hunter with the keen skill of one who has also been hunted. Prey turned predator. The victims quickly realize that Alexander is just the beginning of their problems, as they find themselves enmeshed in a fight for survival against a sociopath business man and his demonic staff, who will stop at nothing to prevail in the sale of Black Market Body Parts.','/sLxE5clGRjSx7ldPk7JJarRVGej.jpg','2009-10-04',83,'Released','Somewhere between Heaven & Hell lie the nightmares of man\'s transgressions against himself. Against his children... and their children...','Sutures',54612,1.5364,4.2,'Vy128Dsh24M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25264,_binary '\0','/pxIqKinRFYnXPtKcEFWUXECDqXD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1209367',5.8,1533,'sv','Allt flyter','A wild bachelor party and an agonizing defeat in floorball awakens Fredrik\'s passion for male synchronized swimming.','/s0Y6Si02DbqX582C4ixQTwK0NsA.jpg','2008-12-25',98,'Released',NULL,'The Swimsuit Issue',20995,1.2841,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25265,_binary '\0','/sZ73dWsTFa3vI8BCUdyskpUmaog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1209377',6.6,4422,'en','Beautiful Kate','Ned Kendall is asked to return to the remote and isolated family home by his sister, to say goodbye to his father who is dying. Ned also brings his young aspiring actress fiancee who struggles with the isolation. When home he starts having memories of his childhood many involving his beautiful twin sister and his older brother. These memories awaken long-buried secrets from the family\'s past.','/6z9mpf6cm3syWpDVNH8FhPy4xkR.jpg','2009-08-06',90,'Released','The past is always present.','Beautiful Kate',29483,2.9144,5.662,'VNRtgAYbR20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25266,_binary '\0','/yPdONozFhjFWMmM1bKzZFNAc48g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1209378',5.2,3087,'en','ExTerminators','Three women from a rage-therapy group band together to dole out justice to the men who wronged them.','/kYggIgOYQmlTnD1rALMC7sMyZxR.jpg','2009-03-13',92,'Released','A girls\' club with killer attitude.','ExTerminators',25891,1.7387,5.5,'jj_pYR9ZyOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25267,_binary '\0','/f5o7KiOdcM9mqbobPbLDFcVqjcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12093860',6.3,2328,'ja','名探偵コナン 緋色の弾丸','At the opening ceremony of the WSG (World Sports Games) Tokyo Games, a sports festival held once every four years, it is announced that the world\'s first vacuum superconducting maglev with a maximum speed of 1,000 kilometers per hour will open. While attracting attention from around the world, top executives of large companies are kidnapped from the party venue where WSG tournament sponsors gather. Conan moves toward a solution and eventually finds a connection with the WSG abduction case that occurred 15 years ago in Boston, USA.','/wowJzvF1KqEFSZoArkgngRy1r4L.jpg','2021-04-16',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: The Scarlet Bullet',662638,4.4127,6.5,'HSow7Ep6l_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25268,_binary '\0','/o0H6PjNX3wPS1JLOvw9Z0sEDDgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210027',4.6,9046,'en','Afterburn','Set against the backdrop of a postapocalyptic Earth whose Eastern Hemisphere was destroyed by a massive solar flare, leaving what life remains mutated from radiation and fallout. The story revolves around a group of treasure hunters who extract such objects as the Mona Lisa, the Rosetta Stone and the Crown Jewels while facing rival hunters, mutants and pirates.','/fSXZFZVfJmC2v0TkW711QD5o76N.jpg','2025-08-20',106,'Released','The apocalypse isn\'t for everybody.','Afterburn',507244,8.0109,6.2,'M7QhCm98eIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25269,_binary '\0','/l2QlhHlggJEaPdgkfpTt0IA2mHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210042',6.7,69240,'en','Brooklyn\'s Finest','Enforcing the law within the notoriously rough Brownsville section of the city and especially within the Van Dyke housing projects is the NYPD\'s sixty-fifth precinct. Three police officers struggle with the sometimes fine line between right and wrong.','/9ZyJJpMsc3bF8gduDaxo0zo1gwK.jpg','2010-03-04',132,'Released','This is War. This is Brooklyn.','Brooklyn\'s Finest',26390,6.6041,6.291,'7XfcwkjnknI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25270,_binary '\0','/jsbQxz3dMWq5Nv7jSasYXyUylCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210071',5.1,2012,'en','Janky Promoters','Two shady concert promoters get into hot water when their chance to book a superstar rapper goes awry.','/sQTn0iUDsfwSLOznzOzfDhC3J8I.jpg','2009-10-16',85,'Released',NULL,'Janky Promoters',25186,2.103,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25271,_binary '\0','/2YgPWELbDaL9BBJx41EuZQB7t8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210106',5.3,9448,'en','St Trinian\'s 2: The Legend of Fritton\'s Gold','After a wealthy philanthropist expresses an unusual interest in a ring found by her niece Annabelle, Miss Fritton explains that she\'s descended from a pirate who, in 1598, stole treasure from another: the philanthropist\'s ancestor. This discovery sends the racuous girls of St. Trinians on the hunt for buried treasure.','/pkLP6uusA3RlgKHUZZ1uWVwbucc.jpg','2009-12-18',106,'Released',NULL,'St Trinian\'s 2: The Legend of Fritton\'s Gold',37565,3.3672,5.6,'-EwEFLnlxvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25272,_binary '\0','/kYlBNDkB5qFdpTDpnlQdH0CdK3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210166',7.6,517135,'en','Moneyball','The story of Oakland Athletics general manager Billy Beane\'s successful attempt to put together a baseball team on a budget, by employing computer-generated analysis to draft his players.','/4yIQq1e6iOcaZ5rLDG3lZBP3j7a.jpg','2011-09-23',134,'Released','What are you really worth?','Moneyball',60308,12.7747,7.301,'D1R-LwHbld4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25273,_binary '\0','/ix0IK25phXkczybPgT6ubvgsyO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210344',3,1630,'en','Cyclops','The corrupt Emperor Tiberius forces his bravest general, Marcus, to subdue the monstrous Cyclops that has been decimating the countryside...','/jPGmwuZ2TZ52NssmIXRnV6b6llf.jpg','2008-12-06',94,'Released','The rise of cyclops... is the fall of Rome!','Cyclops',41550,2.4874,4.9,'zbpjTBa3ue0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25274,_binary '\0','/w3sqSIZDQLthCPpOCkcN5CkLRYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12105554',6.4,2373,'fr','Le Discours','Meet Adrien! He\'s 35. He\'s stuck in a mid-life crisis. He\'s neurotic and hypochondriac. Tonight he\'s stuck in an endless family dinner and his girlfriend is not answering his texts. On top of that, his dumb brother-in-law asks him to prepare a speech for his wedding. Could it get even worse?','/i2G0QrM10xCkrJmzgky53DlNjn2.jpg','2020-09-01',87,'Released',NULL,'The Speech',712150,3.057,6.3,'BqIvdLGLNWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25275,_binary '\0','/ylhLw8raj75BwWjguLfPPCuE2ro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210801',5.5,3677,'en','Command Performance','When the Russian Premier is taken hostage at a rock concert in Moscow, it\'s up to a drummer, an ex-biker, to save him.','/zncZEZl1PhNySnRaftfFifbGZFj.jpg','2009-07-18',93,'Released','Dying is easy, Rock and Roll is hard.','Command Performance',23404,2.4153,5.2,'76X-E_GcPJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25276,_binary '\0','/vHd8RTXTGFwexUC2Mj1HOgSy9J3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210819',6.4,254645,'en','The Lone Ranger','The Texas Rangers chase down a gang of outlaws led by Butch Cavendish, but the gang ambushes the Rangers, seemingly killing them all. One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian named Tonto, who nurses him back to health. The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.','/yDuJGq8biNMW7zM3w95UaDJv0KG.jpg','2013-07-03',149,'Released','Never take off the mask.','The Lone Ranger',57201,12.1244,6.133,'LoVhgaj6PiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25277,_binary '\0','/efiDNmExd9GweIqmQKcwIt09hi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12108272',6.1,2393,'en','Close Encounters of the Fifth Kind','Dr. Steven Greer’s previous works, SIRIUS and UNACKNOWLEDGED, broke crowdfunding records and ignited a grassroots movement. CLOSE ENCOUNTERS OF THE FIFTH KIND features groundbreaking video and photographic evidence and supporting interviews from prominent figures such as Adam Curry of Princeton’s PEAR Lab; legendary civil rights attorney Daniel Sheehan, and Dr. Russell Targ, who headed the CIA’s top secret remote viewing program. Their message: For thousands of people, contact has begun. This is their story.','/R0rmE1wDbxMb2W0MyDE3HKPhOR.jpg','2020-04-07',120,'Released',NULL,'Close Encounters of the Fifth Kind',688335,1.9445,6.827,'CRK6IA--Swk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25278,_binary '\0','/3KmpNFjYDB6tS6G5U3JCpsJETFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1210837',6.9,1234,'ko','순정만화','Kwon Yeon-woo is a thirty year old low-level civil servant who works in a district office; quite innocent for his age, he has been on numerous blind dates in an unsuccessful bid to find a wife. After moving into a new place, he begins to encounter a high school girl, Soo-yeong, on his way to work every morning, and she begins to develop feelings for him. Meanwhile, Kang Sook has just started working at the district office straight out of high school, and falls head over heels for older woman Kwon Ha-kyeong.','/tmuG77YQEoXDQu3ypJadgc8FDmJ.jpg','2008-11-27',113,'Released','Would you like to be alone this year again?','Hello, Schoolgirl',40580,1.8164,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25279,_binary '\0','/3UbGbdhXfbE9nnDS0CbmNmOtHGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12108622',4,10093,'en','Infinitum: Subject Unknown','Jane is the subject of a twisted science experiment where she is placed in a parallel world and is forced to find a way to either alter her reality or be stuck in a time-loop, destined to repeat the same test over and over again, with no memory of her doing it before. But with each \'reset\' she starts to retain fragments of memory. With clues pointing to the mysterious Wytness Quantum Research Centre, she tries to find a way out. (The film was shot entirely on an iPhone during the UK’s first lockdown.)','/qrcqNcct1Y2bAUoVDQalMQZg29o.jpg','2021-03-03',86,'Released','Destined to repeat forever... The test is to find a way out.','Infinitum: Subject Unknown',797861,2.1867,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25280,_binary '\0','/aIFRwMkiJSMGTrhQE7vxDpqFgjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12109842',4.6,3037,'en','Trump Card','Trump Card is an expose of the socialism, corruption and gangsterization that now define the Democratic Party. Whether it is the creeping socialism of Joe Biden or the overt socialism of Bernie Sanders, the film reveals what is unique about modern socialism, who is behind it, why it’s evil, and how we can work together with President Trump to stop it.','/sC0IJKJHlfXnTkBgFyXWBhbbQZk.jpg','2020-08-07',102,'Released','Beating socialism, corruption and the deep state.','Trump Card',692250,0.796,4.9,'_Q2iuGq_IDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25281,_binary '\0','/GZgnE4ZHSOQdSn8NJ5WS4kjWff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12117860',6.6,2049,'nl','Alles Op Tafel','Seven friends meet up for dinner and decide to play a revealing game. During the evening deep personal secrets will surface and threaten their relationships.','/iHlcgk1sQc244sBpu8VIw2z8G7E.jpg','2021-11-04',102,'Released','One dinner. Seven phones. How many secrets?','Alles Op Tafel',777769,1.0537,6,'v-TiosHDXQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25282,_binary '\0','/kkoiH8ZWxJ9WSAjOadGtuHUQxbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1211837',7.5,897407,'en','Doctor Strange','After his career is destroyed, a brilliant but arrogant surgeon gets a new lease on life when a sorcerer takes him under her wing and trains him to defend the world against evil.','/uGBVj3bEbCoZbDjjl9wTxcygko1.jpg','2016-10-25',115,'Released','The impossibilities are endless.','Doctor Strange',284052,28.7626,7.426,'HSzx-zryEgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25283,_binary '\0','/nPlv6si1wBGHh3Oclm6d2EuYCTa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1211890',6.6,2147,'en','Middle of Nowhere','When her husband is sentenced to eight years in prison, Ruby drops out of medical school in order to focus on her husband\'s well-being while he\'s incarcerated - leading her on a journey of self-discovery in the process.','/s0Jtw4YYRQ460vo0QfrjrdLqJCf.jpg','2012-10-12',101,'Released','Love can lead us where we least expect.','Middle of Nowhere',83588,1.9149,6.1,'NUZEcoJFg0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25284,_binary '\0','/ix9WYBqQ2xSZCgyeQ1vVdrbaFa4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1211956',6.7,272523,'en','Escape Plan','Ray Breslin is the world\'s foremost authority on structural security. After analyzing every high security prison and learning a vast array of survival skills so he can design escape-proof prisons, his skills are put to the test. He\'s framed and incarcerated in a master prison he designed himself. He needs to escape and find the person who put him behind bars.','/qOZPLflxDqKogu9v9hYw3lolxGs.jpg','2013-10-09',115,'Released','No one breaks out alone.','Escape Plan',107846,14.7784,6.719,'BrV-SXI6Nmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25285,_binary '\0','/sx8dsHlsZAoT1BbWDwFGDgWAOlZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12121582',5.7,6567,'en','When You Finish Saving the World','Evelyn has devoted herself to helping people in hard times, and she struggles to connect with her son Ziggy, an aspiring internet star oblivious to the problems of the world. As Evelyn attempts to become a parent figure to an unassuming teenage boy she meets at her women\'s shelter, Ziggy fumbles through his pursuit of a politically conscious girl at his high school.','/pZyeoBDQJFPGfd0Mu8XIElGBjZz.jpg','2023-01-20',88,'Released',NULL,'When You Finish Saving the World',691422,3.7454,5.8,'XbgJPKFxHXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25286,_binary '\0','/bRDtgPHs0PhsKzQgfgUFlY3AU7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212408',5.9,1759,'en','Dog Tags','Raised in a single parent family by his mother Nate Merritt, develops a friendship with a gay man whilst on leave from the US marines.','/wV1kYlJBBep9HmfHbHkodqVD6nO.jpg','2008-01-01',90,'Released','Don\'t ask, don\'t tell.','Dog Tags',19235,1.4555,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25287,_binary '\0','/f2z00VIPyrrfFabw0RnoY5M8uYt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212419',6.5,98870,'en','Hereafter','Three people — a blue-collar American, a French journalist and a London school boy — are touched by death in different ways.','/nOy0X8XSmSDOuwV8pqT70WoWHwT.jpg','2010-10-22',129,'Released','Touched by death. Changed by life.','Hereafter',44603,5.3115,6.146,'toJPUHh3EKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25288,_binary '\0','/upatBMqiS0gSiNy52cwxKKcNne2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212428',6.6,107095,'en','The Lost City of Z','A true-life drama in the 1920s, centering on British explorer Col. Percy Fawcett, who discovered evidence of a previously unknown, advanced civilization in the Amazon and disappeared whilst searching for it.','/8SxHVNk6tqXYwygmDzz1YuJEm2J.jpg','2017-03-15',141,'Released','A man\'s reach should exceed his grasp... or what\'s a heaven for?','The Lost City of Z',314095,12.8973,6.386,'AiM3cX3kSeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25289,_binary '\0','/fudUJZpEKRhFVzYz8iIIO7Wnvtw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212436',5.3,55177,'en','The Back-Up Plan','When Zoe tires of looking for Mr. Right, she decides to have a baby on her own. But on the day she\'s artificially inseminated, she meets Stan, who seems to be just who she\'s been searching for all her life. Now, Zoe has to figure out how to make her two life\'s dreams fit with each other.','/fB6PxwdydGzdq5jSWrxwSMEqSFs.jpg','2010-04-23',106,'Released','Fall in love, get married, have a baby. Not necessarily in that order.','The Back-Up Plan',34806,10.0235,6.1,'cut4IW0oz1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25290,_binary '\0','/fEI7I233M9hkw1MRSBXEgauXhRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212450',7.2,264208,'en','Lawless','In 1931, the Bondurant brothers of Franklin County, Virginia, run a multipurpose backwoods establishment that hides their true business — bootlegging. Middle brother Forrest is the brain of the operation; older Howard is the brawn, and younger Jack, the lookout. Though the local police have taken bribes and left the brothers alone, a violent war erupts when a sadistic lawman from Chicago arrives and tries to shut down the Bondurants operation.','/Ahtzwts22ayviD3LEVslfL4nRWB.jpg','2012-08-29',115,'Released','When the law became corrupt, outlaws became heroes.','Lawless',82633,8.2162,7.071,'HK-Q3wYsOgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25291,_binary '\0','/xMhcAI4empreYKCHj063km2p7kJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212454',5.3,4588,'en','An Invisible Sign','Mona Gray is a 20-year-old loner who, as a child, turned to math for salvation after her father became ill. As an adult, Mona now teaches the subject and must help her students through their own crises.','/w5bSVpGnqL2XDG22ddubcD9ik5U.jpg','2010-10-06',96,'Released','Count on the unexpected.','An Invisible Sign',59435,3.6293,5.2,'4x2RzV1UrW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25292,_binary '\0','/qGJdKkoTzgmhbkKwulPwM10xE1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212456',7.3,1225,'es','Entre Nos','Abruptly abandoned by her husband in a country completely foreign to her, Colombian native Mariana struggles to take care of herself and her two young children on the unforgiving streets of New York City.','/zcBswFQ4gocTG0CKvAuRboKkrJV.jpg','2009-04-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Between Us',71575,1.3046,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25293,_binary '\0','/tdgce7OwwUwF7atRiar1y1AS6eh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212974',4.5,14548,'en','Bitch Slap','Three bad girls - a down-and-out stripper, a drug-running killer, and a corporate powerbroker - arrive at a remote desert hideaway to extort and steal $200 million in diamonds from a ruthless underworld kingpin.','/uwpDERT9drTPhvoV8cWzuV6xhdt.jpg','2009-05-16',109,'Released','Prepare to get slapped...','Bitch Slap',26715,4.8114,4.8,'JddoqqicPCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25294,_binary '\0','/r8IY5K9lNt11U4QAQQSfSeqLqGW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1212986',5.5,2494,'en','Spectacular!','A high school choir is fading in popularity, as it continues to lose most of its\' members one by one. A wannabe rock singer is convinced to join the choir, in hopes of winning the upcoming competition and cash prize.','/kFHsKP8hPp4x3l1wH0EG1JGbtTs.jpg','2009-02-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Spectacular!',18247,1.6712,6.4,'SbBB9Q0DmXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25295,_binary '\0','/fkekk4fFBaQVtvJ26yXqIRDAmvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1213012',5.1,16273,'en','Alpha and Omega','Two young wolves at opposite ends of their pack\'s social order are thrown together into a foreign land and need each other to return home, but love complicates everything.','/7YVyH5sS6kLQRsSDF5dhhR0BWeh.jpg','2010-07-05',88,'Released','A Pawsom