ly 20, 1969.','/i91mfvFcPPlaegcbOyjGgiWfZzh.jpg','2018-10-10',141,'Released','One giant leap into the unknown.','First Man',369972,13.025,7.039,'O9Y7DTCn7Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25300,_binary '\0','/5V6jAFS0Q49SI07qjyFRMYlbfR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1213644',1.9,98474,'en','Disaster Movie','Over the course of one evening, an unsuspecting group of twenty-somethings find themselves bombarded by a series of natural disasters and catastrophic events.','/3J8XKUfhJiNzwobUZVtizXYPe8b.jpg','2008-08-29',87,'Released','Your favorite movies are going to be destroyed.','Disaster Movie',13805,4.8135,3.2,'tihG_2BSUqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25301,_binary '\0','/kuxLjp8ufk066O5YyNU116iVku7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1213648',6.2,52238,'en','London Boulevard','A parolee falls for a reclusive movie star while trying to evade a ruthless gangster.','/naQKmThKMtlur92CDgCP6b9aoQE.jpg','2010-11-10',103,'Released','Not every criminal wants to be one.','London Boulevard',48838,4.6439,5.895,'Hsm9jQcq0Ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25302,_binary '\0','/stAPkorBeBkvEZ6DQs30Ke4cPyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1213663',6.9,315126,'en','The World\'s End','Five friends who reunite in an attempt to top their epic pub crawl from 20 years earlier unwittingly become humankind\'s only hope for survival.','/kpglnOBYmKn0AkkWDzGxzKHDbds.jpg','2013-07-18',109,'Released','Good food. Fine ales. Total annihilation.','The World\'s End',107985,12.0137,6.812,'YF-4c8U-mUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25303,_binary '\0','/xo0bsMDMKvwxHzI1HWMSW5wXAbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12137964',6.3,13772,'en','Anything for Jackson','A bereaved Satanist couple kidnap a pregnant woman so they can use an ancient spellbook to put their dead grandson\'s spirit into her unborn child, but they end up summoning more than they bargained for.','/r8C0eUGpqiJZqoU84UjXAMS474B.jpg','2020-0