ciliana ribelle','Inspired to a true story, on November 5th 1991, Rita Atria a young 17-year-old Sicilian girl, goes to see an anti-Mafia judge Paolo Borsellino to denounce the Mafia system that was responsible for the murder of her father and her brother. It is the first time that such a young woman from a Mafia family rebels and betrays the Mafia. From that moment on, Rita\'s days are numbered. She only has nine months to live...','/4uJv2reiF1EgwVzslS2LtlZoVxL.jpg','2008-12-31',113,'Released','What would drive a seventeen-year-old girl to betray her family? And if that family was the mafia?','The Sicilian Girl',31111,1.5867,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25308,_binary '\0','/eyPqSGbSldk0Sruujqe6xrQyctC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12139700',5.5,1537,'en','Jungle Beat: The Movie','The Jungle Beat animals think it’s the best thing ever when an alien arrives in the jungle bringing with him the power of speech. They also surprisingly think it’s the best thing ever when they find out that he’s been sent to conquer them.','/cgC67SOxd9xkjN4Bnvjtuj1vI8T.jpg','2020-06-26',89,'Released','Home is where the hugs are.','Jungle Beat: The Movie',663459,3.1307,6.9,'7lpFfuSACzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25309,_binary '\0','/nj1sc2adxEk7fseElV8RIuCaoZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12141112',6.7,37526,'en','Metal Lords','For teenage misfits Hunter and Kevin, the path to glory is clear: Devote themselves to metal. Win Battle of the Bands. And be worshipped like gods.','/r97txZRmBb75SGsIAWqmplWJnO3.jpg','2022-04-08',97,'Released','Metal up your ass.','Metal Lords',739993,4.5841,6.8,'TzAAtZx6xzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25310,_binary '\0','/44F9TlManv2lvJ70oLect1lVe4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12142854',7.2,1492,'it','Mi chiamo Francesco Totti','Francesco Totti retraces his entire life while watching it on the silver screen together with the audience. Images and emotions flow among key moments of his career, scenes from his personal life and memories he has never shared before.','/cvB1CpIwqeyNPbuljkFjFl7OIU7.jpg','2020-10-19',105,'Released',NULL,'My Name Is Francesco Totti',605255,1.5847,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25311,_binary '\0','/tFUolWDR3XzfBpXyuhizTImqDeK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12143990',5.5,6754,'en','The Re-Education of Molly Singer','In college, attorney Molly Singer was the life of every party. Now, she\'s about to be fired because she can\'t leave her partying ways behind. Molly\'s boss, Brenda, tells Molly there\'s one way to save her job: re-enroll at her old alma mater, befriend Brenda\'s socially awkward son, Elliot, and take him from zero to campus hero.','/zCF5HpbSjMELIYiV9aZKY9ka4Jq.jpg','2023-09-29',120,'Released',NULL,'The Re-Education of Molly Singer',856156,2.6545,5.7,'yzypF35o6f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25312,_binary '\0','/zoiu5kJuVPBXJu1o7ubrd5qZVxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12147800',6.3,1425,'ml','കുറ്റവും ശിക്ഷയും','A five-member Kerala Police have to use their best policing skills when they go to Rajasthan to nab a gang behind a jewellery shop theft.','/mdNAbOEuojfY7DKKNbeSYa7zYHU.jpg','2022-05-27',136,'Released',NULL,'Kuttavum Shikshayum',857346,0.7581,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25313,_binary '\0','/yxe6Eln5J6UJWbh5yjxP8mo6zGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1214961',7.9,6813,'te','హ్యాపీ డేస్','Eight youngsters become a close-knit group after attending engineering college and sharing their experiences.','/9PTzngN3VOmxQg6vFOkAGFMSxWi.jpg','2007-09-28',160,'Released',NULL,'Happy Days',199160,1.6137,6.5,'BYy7gkao5cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25314,_binary '\0','/3luwjhBo76a7swVxqfjcOh3e8tR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1214962',6.1,49587,'en','Seeking Justice','After his wife is assaulted, a husband enlists the services of a vigilante group to help him settle the score.','/fJCBxeeKLmxOG