eliance on comfort. On certainty. Something had happened. But nobody knew what. Until now.','/tm6DsDRnMZw0P1msX0at3ldaWtx.jpg','2020-04-17',95,'Released','(Fear+Faith) Ideology = Control','Trigger Points',696609,0.4482,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25319,_binary '\0','/9FMm7kvD497o2iZif4MXjRZyJNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216275',6.7,1896,'de','13 Semester','When Momo leaves his small home town to go to university, he is full of enthusiasm and confidence, but slowly the pressures of study and campus living begin to grind him down. Half way through his course he finds himself at a crossroads with both his relationship and studies.','/o2gpyPWurLpHFUJi6zFizrlr0Tg.jpg','2009-10-29',101,'Released',NULL,'13 Semester',38813,1.0686,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25320,_binary '\0','/lJH4Ml80gkbbyBGTIYVbU64tU5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216300',7,8580,'hi','जन्नत','A gambler turns into a cricket bookie banking on his sixth sense for the game. But his urge to make quick money pushes him into match-fixing and he loses control of his life and love.','/4QRFa5FjA27hC3ZnHfzAjeTUt0Q.jpg','2008-05-16',140,'Released','In Search of Heaven','Jannat',25510,1.603,6.177,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25321,_binary '\0','/tZWTkJFJe5DwzSSkCc4L7VghJmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12163074',3.1,4800,'en','The Resort','Four friends head to Hawaii to investigate reports of a haunting at an abandoned resort in hopes of finding the infamous Half-Faced Girl. When they arrive, they soon learn you should be careful what you wish for.','/bXZUVJP8Fr3RId7SSsV4RXvjnIh.jpg','2021-04-30',75,'Released','The perfect staycation','The Resort',810271,2.5006,5.4,'5bQotiZhSaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25322,_binary '\0','/robYRZk9LxJTwD7GlZCginji5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216475',6.2,264052,'en','Cars 2','Star race car Lightning McQueen and his pal Mater head overseas to compete in the World Grand Prix race. But the road to the championship becomes rocky as Mater gets caught up in an intriguing adventure of his own: international espionage.','/okIz1HyxeVOMzYwwHUjH2pHi74I.jpg','2011-06-11',106,'Released','The mission begins.','Cars 2',49013,36.3535,6.192,'MGHwlExcaqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25323,_binary '\0','/nra78PoXu2lQhdgFKJ8y8zL7HGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216487',7.1,102718,'sv','Flickan som lekte med elden','Mikael Blomkvist, publisher of Millennium magazine, has made his living exposing the crooked and corrupt practices of establishment Swedish figures. So when a young journalist approaches him with a meticulously researched thesis about sex trafficking in Sweden and those in high office who abuse underage girls, Blomkvist immediately throws himself into the investigation.','/A8UjhPjINIBgmoH37aqt40u53PQ.jpg','2009-09-18',129,'Released','Fight Fire with Fire','The Girl Who Played with Fire',24253,6.505,7,'oSsodK7KFXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25324,_binary '\0','/hYVAvYJXE4taTIh2y6F5mGJWfPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216491',6.9,50477,'en','Kill the Messenger','A reporter becomes the target of a vicious smear campaign that drives him to the point of suicide after he exposes the CIA\'s role in arming Contra rebels in Nicaragua and importing cocaine into California. Based on the true story of journalist Gary Webb.','/8gaNZiKZHvKCqMDByY00dUIV0YC.jpg','2014-10-09',112,'Released','Can you keep a national secret?','Kill the Messenger',245916,6.5147,6.6,'2N2nuDtJX0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25325,_binary '\0','/6wlM6qQIiB7nb9mUYX95XjDLikX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216492',6.5,117457,'en','Leap Year','When yet another anniversary passes without a marriage proposal from her boyfriend, Anna decides to take action. Aware of a Celtic tradition that allows women to pop the question on Feb. 29, she plans to follow her lover to Dublin and ask him to marry her. Fate has other plans, however, and Anna winds up on the other side of the Emerald Isle with handsome, but surly, Declan -- an Irishman who may just lead Anna down the road to true love.','/i86hMi5iEF3WnYLCaGHdT5FPdYg.jpg','2010-01-08',100,'Released','Anna planned to propose to her boyfriend on February 29th. This is not her boyfriend.','Leap Year',25195,8.1191,6.9,'wUwju8fo9tQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25326,_binary '\0','/mnNkHbs2onvP54zND5c1Ah5Usaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216496',7.7,81738,'ko','마더','A mother lives quietly with her son. One day, a girl is brutally killed, and the boy is charged with the murder. Now, it\'s his mother\'s mission to prove him innocent.','/8oBnSkZE6GDVugAbLPO6uJd4GcS.jpg','2009-05-28',129,'Released','She\'ll stop at nothing.','Mother',30018,5.8805,7.71,'0oBwQHWeYxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25327,_binary '\0','/dFBua0bSUCQgsrUgqRuiJHp3ZjS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1216520',6.3,16375,'en','Womb','A woman\'s consuming love forces her to bear the clone of her dead beloved. From his infancy to manhood, she faces the unavoidable complexities of her controversial decision.','/raTEzBZBflPyVhOls4PmrryvPos.jpg','2010-07-15',111,'Released','Death was not the end but the beginning','Womb',59457,3.8515,6.101,'Sdqcmqfhciw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25328,_binary '\0','/mbzlnUM9QFoAJpU0kxu54PFVpyh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12169664',7.5,1222,'ku','سفر نۆ','A detective abandoned his daughter right after his wife\'s death for a governmental mission. This made her daughter angry. He risks his life to find his daughters missing best friend in order to fix their relationship. Their search leads them to face a deadly organ trafficking band who has blackmailed a doctor for harvesting the organs.','/ApDVfmharRoU0HriWxDrTMI7nGH.jpg','2021-03-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Zero Nine',717378,1.1354,5,'3SLVMnIoRzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25329,_binary '\0','/yLqD4mKGLR4pZRP42DxGqPlIG1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217070',6.5,10987,'en','Triage','The wife of a photojournalist sets out to discover why he came home from a recent assignment without his colleague.','/qH3QzgkqJYcTVs5QoH9SOE80B8q.jpg','2009-11-13',99,'Released','Some live. Some die. Some are changed forever.','Triage',33195,3.3234,6.008,'pz5QdNuEvwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25330,_binary '\0','/qx9ts2hBYJrkIQxhryitxnLlm2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217209',7.1,485568,'en','Brave','In the mystical Scottish Highlands, Merida is the princess of a kingdom ruled by King Fergus and Queen Elinor. An unruly daughter and an accomplished archer, Merida one day defies a sacred custom of the land and inadvertently brings turmoil to the kingdom. In an attempt to set things right, Merida seeks out an eccentric old Wise Woman and is granted an ill-fated wish.','/1XAuDtMWpL0sYSFK0R6EZate2Ux.jpg','2012-06-21',93,'Released','Change your fate.','Brave',62177,25.859,7.036,'AtrDBQ_qmlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25331,_binary '\0','/2AeE4Op9qjDSXe8GbfCtlbHFxhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217213',7,16750,'en','Secret of the Wings','Tinkerbell wanders into the forbidden Winter woods and meets Periwinkle. Together they learn the secret of their wings and try to unite the warm fairies and the winter fairies to help Pixie Hollow.','/aPudKEzwwmwc5lS8sdxvG3WX86t.jpg','2012-08-17',75,'Released','Two Worlds. One Magical Secret.','Secret of the Wings',75258,11.7734,7.3,'UpFv8M2HdQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25332,_binary '\0','/fDYLcb1jGehVsYD3WmpQa4ecZ4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217243',7.3,4045,'ja','アキレスと亀','Machisu is a painter. He never had the success he thinks he is entitled to. Regardless of this, he always remains trying to be successful. His wife Sachiko keeps supporting him, despite all setbacks.','/5PEfwcJf2JlbbXqfqOWSGHwdsVL.jpg','2008-09-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Achilles and the Tortoise',12166,1.7964,7,'IDHxVIXKWpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25333,_binary '\0','/bYDbpFkkoWXNqrplnjwSPb3G1J1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217565',7.3,4253,'ru','День радио','It\'s the day of radio in Russia. The radio station staff decides to invite famous bands, who will perform live for the ship with animals stranded in the Sea of Japan. And something goes wrong!','/vTgBZx0cPalFmYFoLJLA4jfLsRj.jpg','2008-03-20',98,'Released',NULL,'Radio Day',25936,1.1682,7.2,'QXdO1d8s3Vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25334,_binary '\0','/buspsNeIGOAznaYQsnGDmQLZakW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217613',5.7,191554,'en','Battle: Los Angeles','When once distant UFOs become a terrifying threat and an alien invasion force begins attacking Earths major costal and riverside cities, a U.S Marine staff sergeant and his team are sent into battle only to find they must take it upon themselves to defeat an unknown enemy and protect what remains of Los Angeles.','/jloyGeVYZSxM9zsLFvVOWuj2ey4.jpg','2011-03-08',116,'Released','It\'s not war. It\'s survival.','Battle: Los Angeles',44943,11.6498,5.8,'Yt7ofokzn04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25335,_binary '\0','/q3pD0oLk1PF5EFqcAsK2fYagHwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217616',6.2,2940,'en','Endgame','The time is the late \'80s, a crucial period in the history of South Africa. President P.W. Botha is hanging on to power by a thread as the African National Congress (ANC) takes up arms against apartheid and the country tumbles toward insurrection. A British mining concern is convinced that their interests would be better served in a stable South Africa and they quietly dispatch Michael Young, their head of public affairs, to open an unofficial dialogue between the bitter rivals. Assembling a reluctant yet brilliant team to pave the way to reconciliation by confronting obstacles that initially seem insurmountable, Young places his trust in ANC leader Thabo Mbeki and Afrikaner philosophy professor Willie Esterhuyse. It is their empathy that will ultimately serve as the catalyst for change by proving more powerful than the terrorist bombs that threaten to disrupt the peaceful dialogue.','/b8WzwCABwVRVdw14OcE6pmezJjK.jpg','2009-01-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Endgame',15102,1.7625,5.9,'RY8DdS38P44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25336,_binary '\0','/fezKVCfPieamGuVcTjBDz8cqgb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1217637',7.1,10397,'fr','Pour elle','Lisa and Julien are married and lead a happy uneventful life with their son Oscar. But their life radically changes one morning, when the police comes to arrest Lisa on murder charges. She\'s sentenced to 20 years of prison. Convinced of his wife\'s innocence, Julien decides to act. How far will he be willing to go for her?','/jYqFLb9d2dfJjIix7PCKoDqdbw6.jpg','2008-12-03',96,'Released','In a second, their life will change...','Anything for Her',14556,2.624,7,'RBZVsLoSsDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25337,_binary '\0','/lLyG2Cp7njdtvGWhokCZjVTPMLL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12182440',6.5,1311,'nl','Buladó','Headstrong girl Kenza lives with her father Ouira and grandfather Weljo on a car wrecking yard in the countryside of Curaçao. The two men are opposites that don\'t particularly attract: Ouira is a determined and rational police officer, while Weljo identifies with the original inhabitants and spirituality of the island. As Weljo wishes to prepare his passing to the world of spirits, the relationship between Ouira en Weljo starts to escalate and the eleven-year-old Kenza searches for her own path in-between the two extremes. The down-to-earth and avoidant mentality of Ouira no longer offers her all that she needs and slowly she opens up to the more mystical and comforting traditions of her grandfather.','/6VrgsPwvfFC3ZyWLUUhKoibWPCc.jpg','2020-10-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Buladó',737756,1.3134,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25338,_binary '\0','/riDrpqQtZpXGeiJdlmfcwwPH7nN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12192190',5.2,3144,'en','One Night in Bangkok','A hit man named Kai flies into Bangkok, gets a gun, and orders a cab. He offers a professional female driver big money to be his all-night driver. But when she realizes Kai is committing brutal murders at each stop, it\'s too late to walk away. Meanwhile, an offbeat police detective races to decode the string of slayings before more blood is spilled.','/i4kPwXPlM1iy8Jf3S1uuLuwqQAV.jpg','2020-08-25',105,'Released','Six hours. Five hits. Who will survive?','One Night in Bangkok',721452,3.6665,6.555,'Q5VFAn0qmic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25339,_binary '\0','/hvjPxqOJx01QE8U8dxihqqd7D0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12192654',6.9,3483,'en','Planet of the Humans','Forget all you have heard about how “Renewable Energy” is our salvation. It is all a myth that is very lucrative for some. Feel-good stuff like electric cars, etc. Such vehicles are actually powered by coal, natural gas… or dead salmon in the Northwest.','/91UfoJxsLVRt3A6M2GGbTTzMMD8.jpg','2019-07-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Planet of the Humans',622014,1.4129,6.4,'4pXCftKF4uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25340,_binary '\0','/9V6Yq2ZVUmyAPcPyDcCBPnkluKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219289',7.4,654550,'en','Limitless','The life of an unsuccessful writer is transformed by a top-secret \'smart drug\' that allows him to use 100% of his brain and become a perfect version of himself. His enhanced abilities soon attract shadowy forces that threaten his new life.','/r8anWUCVK7MZEolcfPrM9eFkRO4.jpg','2011-03-17',106,'Released','What if a pill could make you rich and powerful?','Limitless',51876,15.3252,7.204,'4TLppsfzQH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25341,_binary '\0','/4fTrtFGuSOVLekMdfrPYn3jqRjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219336',4.9,1284,'en','The Donner Party','Based on the real events of The Donner Party tragedy. The Donner Party was a group of California-bound American settlers caught up in the western expansion of the 1840s. After becoming snowbound in the Sierra Nevada during the winter of 1846-1847, a number of the trapped settlers joined together in a final effort to reach California and organize a rescue party.','/aAEShYuCENTEogTh1Qog0P3DXNU.jpg','2009-10-23',95,'Released','Survival lies within','The Donner Party',33159,1.6194,4.7,'XiMxdMTVuwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25342,_binary '\0','/4Zh7sDqopYZrGaI3FItQ3KL3k0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219342',6.9,92675,'en','Legend of the Guardians: The Owls of Ga\'Hoole','When a young owl is abducted by an evil Owl army, he must escape with new-found friends and seek the legendary Guardians to stop the menace.','/qweKCtPdnIP2uGp1PgWZyCV7gzj.jpg','2010-07-10',97,'Released','On his way to finding a legend...he will become one.','Legend of the Guardians: The Owls of Ga\'Hoole',41216,10.6531,6.8,'I_vJ0jS3i3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25343,_binary '\0','/AcKPLFva3hnfdsArF5bcPTESVCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12193804',6.6,27437,'en','Whitney Houston: I Wanna Dance with Somebody','The joyous, emotional, heartbreaking celebration of the life and music of Whitney Houston, the greatest female R&B pop vocalist of all time. Tracking her journey from obscurity to musical superstardom.','/oodPJ3Op1pWBhnEFyw5fampRCWf.jpg','2022-12-20',144,'Released','Celebrate the untold story of an icon.','Whitney Houston: I Wanna Dance with Somebody',696157,6.2761,6.984,'9tfemzaMkoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25344,_binary '\0','/3py9U2EdJOzTw4MKwEBSkhzEheE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12194006',7,4004,'de','Wunderschön','After two pregnancies, Sonja struggles with her body feeling and the relationship with her husband Milan. Frauke, shortly before her 60th birthday, shares this fate and feels almost invisible to her husband. Daughter Julie is working on her modeling career, but a flaw is discovered on her body again and again ...','/qTbPjy6F9HPxZkN5FO2820JaiN1.jpg','2022-02-03',132,'Released',NULL,'Wonderfully Beautiful',750466,2.9792,7.4,'przVUdwnm10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25345,_binary '\0','/dDVqfmCzSy3TKSmiS2pJ9QB5E3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219827',6.3,241639,'en','Ghost in the Shell','In the near future, Major is the first of her kind: a human saved from a terrible crash, then cyber-enhanced to be a perfect soldier devoted to stopping the world\'s most dangerous criminals.','/zCtL3UBgCoZzd7XTVGhvl6XY75E.jpg','2017-03-29',107,'Released','There\'s nothing sadder than a puppet without a ghost.','Ghost in the Shell',315837,17.5578,6.1,'5XnptKCeaJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25346,_binary '\0','/1UXZVp7nYKZgFE99gB8xpw8yMQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219828',5.2,1677,'en','Happy Tears','Two sisters return home to care for their aging father.','/aeLEwPg2bgUIgUGSw4zXtU33XdN.jpg','2009-10-16',96,'Released','There\'s an art to going home without going crazy.','Happy Tears',39072,2.5858,5,'otsSvWhmFKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25347,_binary '\0','/r1EmRz5vRkM6hLC4HTCvnH0cQnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1219836',5.7,4312,'en','Virtuality','Twelve extremely talented men and women have been chosen to be part of the Phaeton mission, a 10-year trek to explore a distant planetary system. In order to endure the stress of being confined to their high-tech vessel, the crew passes the time using advanced virtual reality modules that allow them to take on various identities. But as the ship approaches a critical phase of their journey, a deadly flaw is discovered in the virtual system, forcing them to question if someone onboard might be a killer.','/vhQu9vNP2LoyDyp3z3LxQaQpqW3.jpg','2009-06-26',87,'Released','Reality is only the beginning.','Virtuality',37178,2.4062,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25348,_binary '\0','/3lPAOi2GsTpaaE7R4M9MIDIho6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12198524',4.3,1240,'en','The Retreat','A man finds himself alone and lost after a horrifying encounter with a monster during a backpacking trip into the Adirondack High Peaks. Now, he must fight for his life, and sanity, as he battles the evil Native American legend, The Wendigo.','/dm6QRx9HVtRTbF25ABY0XBfAyHZ.jpg','2021-01-25',88,'Released',NULL,'The Retreat',754325,0.8134,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25349,_binary '\0','/3VPzi0Z0zHf69gDIj07D1kOELzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12200256',6.5,2153,'ru','Огонь','Fires are raging in the Moscow region, and the forest protection airbase is on a rotation. However, experienced firefighters are in short supply and team leader Andrey Pavlovich has to take on a new recruit, Roman.','/wi7poYZy9b4CqmPMod0n1su8Quo.jpg','2020-12-24',131,'Released','Some fires can\'t be tamed.','Fire',585257,3.4142,7.835,'CtjdpU-1GJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25350,_binary '\0','/4Ue8De8AXVrSWvFQMzmoJQn4Pxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220198',5.9,86988,'en','The Fourth Kind','Since the 1960s, a disproportionate number of the population in and around Nome, Alaska, have gone missing. Despite FBI investigations, the disappearances remain a mystery. Dr. Abigail Tyler, a psychologist, may be on the verge of blowing the unsolved cases wide open when, during the course of treating her patients, she finds evidence of alien abductions.','/vfnsGUwurUQqlpvArBvUVc9rYXa.jpg','2009-11-05',98,'Released','There are four kinds of alien encounters. The fourth kind is abduction.','The Fourth Kind',22824,7.5467,6.4,'JQBU4HvN5MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25351,_binary '\0','/AkOC0HFLxoD8509rc6Gl7gKa07C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220213',5.2,8468,'en','Grace','In the wake of a horrific car accident that kills her husband, Michael, expectant mother Madeline Matheson discovers that her daughter, Grace, has died in the womb. Ignoring her doctor\'s warnings that the fetus must be removed from her body, a grief-stricken Matheson demands to carry the child to term -- even if it endangers her own life to do so. Curiously, little Grace emerges undead -- and with a craving for human blood.','/aygXzr6TaeC9jaPC6FfbKxNwZsN.jpg','2009-08-14',84,'Released','Love. Undying.','Grace',21398,1.8766,5.408,'OQIAdsmS-D4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25352,_binary '\0','/hLwVn3QFct0gTogzFJauiAUHDLx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220214',5.9,10569,'en','Heartless','Jamie Morgan is a troubled young man with a facial birthmark, which has left him isolated and fearful, hiding from the world outside. He lives in the East End, notorious for its violent hooded gangs. According to news reports, the gangs are now wearing demon masks. But, one night, after the murder of his mother, Jamie discovers the terrifying truth.','/pk6cnJFCZ5mmDKOKESVeXM0j71T.jpg','2010-05-21',114,'Released','The darker it gets the more you see.','Heartless',38150,1.8753,5.9,'9oNUIj9_EdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25353,_binary '\0','/8ic41TNDfkewNkN9lcZMbST1fdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220220',4.6,4934,'en','Motherhood','In Manhattan, a mother of two preparing for her daughter\'s sixth birthday party has no idea of the challenges she\'s about to face in order to pull off the event.','/bzQCsmvPJU0L4tnPtQHlVliw2zn.jpg','2009-01-21',90,'Released','There are no time-outs in...','Motherhood',22805,2.2257,5,'3t1wAAO9x6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25354,_binary '\0','/7YGUFykvWYmFyGqjfqJXzHmNLiL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220627',2.9,1552,'en','Hard Breakers','Tired of the dating scene, Lindsay and Alexis take matters into their own hands, clubbing potential mates and dragging them back to their house.','/fYIP4AzBQanch0SfxXAeU7oZQP4.jpg','2011-05-20',98,'Released','The battle of the sexes just got harder.','Hard Breakers',52306,1.7309,3.6,'qLwgCmTYrOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25355,_binary '\0','/wZ7njCHjE4iplwFoR2mmdvpCd3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220628',5.2,8950,'en','I Hope They Serve Beer in Hell','A tireless and charismatic novelty seeker, Tucker tricks his buddy Dan into lying to his fiancée Kristy, so they can go to an legendary strip club three and a half hours away to celebrate Dan’s last days of bachelorhood in proper style.','/oBBood3JcOu0LQstdL9FeqCxMwa.jpg','2009-09-25',106,'Released','One HELL of a party.','I Hope They Serve Beer in Hell',30128,2.4734,4.7,'2vOQdCZmNEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25356,_binary '\0','/8AvzydMm6vKICPOUuUG2KIW2on.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220634',5.8,189757,'en','Resident Evil: Afterlife','In a world ravaged by a virus infection, turning its victims into the Undead, Alice continues on her journey to find survivors and lead them to safety. Her deadly battle with the Umbrella Corporation reaches new heights, but Alice gets some unexpected help from an old friend. A new lead that promises a safe haven from the Undead takes them to Los Angeles, but when they arrive the city is overrun by thousands of Undead - and Alice and her comrades are about to step into a deadly trap.','/qZHDnt8bnsD2cSJfIbjWbCkIq3G.jpg','2010-09-01',97,'Released','Experience a new dimension of evil.','Resident Evil: Afterlife',35791,1.1534,6.057,'SRRN6MvCdeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25357,_binary '\0','/xWu4JOltqruhxRicgLutbAqkG5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220706',4.3,3793,'en','Breathing Room','Thrown naked into a desolate room with thirteen strangers, Tonya discovers that she is the final contestant in a deadly game. Restrained by lethal electronic collars, the players must utilize hints and tools from a box marked \"pieces\" to find both an exit and the reason for their abduction. One by one the players are eliminated as their \"curfew\" begins and the lights go out. With each dead body comes another clue, which they use to discover that one of them is the killer. The question is ... which one?','/aaz4rgsEjApkUz87OrFT6sNZDks.jpg','2008-08-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Breathing Room',16179,1.7985,4.3,'8hi5x6JU0lA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25358,_binary '\0','/69QJSMkm5Hh0x9fLElZ8hjv5N4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220719',8,245255,'cn','葉問','A semi-biographical account of Yip Man, the first martial arts master to teach the Chinese martial art of Wing Chun. The film focuses on events surrounding Ip that took place in the city of Foshan between the 1930s to 1940s during the Second Sino-Japanese War. Directed by Wilson Yip, the film stars Donnie Yen in the lead role, and features fight choreography by Sammo Hung.','/9bUIrDKnesNbBL1nAl1nt7gtocE.jpg','2008-12-12',106,'Released','The celebrated Kung Fu master of Bruce Lee.','Ip Man',14756,6.0431,7.8,'3IUR6P5VwGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25359,_binary '\0','/eLTdgR6f4MrnqAA42NDVGHp7xXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220888',5.9,22452,'en','Henry\'s Crime','An aimless man is sent to prison for a crime he did not commit, an ex-con targets the same bank he was sent away for robbing.','/1i1sDWOZecbUZ4Yp9DG5UiTBBRl.jpg','2010-01-14',108,'Released','The real crime is not committing to your dreams.','Henry\'s Crime',53172,4.8711,5.8,'6OkJht5KB-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25360,_binary '\0','/rfmMVhSJEJdsf5CnrwkeNgeOSLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12208980',5.7,1744,'en','Greatest Days','Based on the Take That musical, five best friends have the night of their lives seeing their favourite boy band in concert. Twenty-five years later, their lives have changed in many different ways as they reunite for one more epic show by their beloved band, to relight their friendship and discover that maybe their greatest days are ahead of them.','/xCPAatRJPqZi1gGJliExFb6BK6G.jpg','2023-06-16',112,'Released','Never forget.','Greatest Days',974861,3.0753,6.1,'sZ0oNP1qVQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25361,_binary '\0','/vq2TVlQmOUE6uZnRIZD475IcoAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1220911',4.9,1491,'fr','Pourquoi j\'ai pas mangé mon père','Based on the novel \'Evolution Man\' by Roy Lewis, this tells the story about the first man - young Edward - to descend from apes. Edward is ejected by his tribe, but is very resourceful. He learns to walk, discovers fire, manages to hunt - and we follow him as he evolves. He has a generous nature, and search for true humanity - a world where we don\'t eat our fathers.','/7qccdwXUMazLqkMKm4ZJ7lAnzUF.jpg','2015-04-08',91,'Released','These feet are made for walkin\'','Animal Kingdom: Let\'s Go Ape',280391,2.8198,5.2,'Yq894xqmDDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25362,_binary '\0','/k7WfpmOq9hWB7KRUF37r4IknnTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1221139',6.9,3487,'hi','Welcome To Sajjanpur','Mahadev (Shreyas Talpade) is an unemployed graduate with a Bachelor of Arts from Satna college, who is forced to make a living writing letters for the uneducated people of his village. His real ambition is to become a novel writer. Through his humble occupation, Mahadev has the potential to impact numerous lives. The movie is a satirical, but warm-hearted portrait of life in rural India.','/aKutRHnTtuuVJsaX4BHE275871.jpg','2008-09-19',134,'Released',NULL,'Welcome To Sajjanpur',35695,1.5367,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25363,_binary '\0','/aXE1bX9jl3YLq9D5WuNYBNTERZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1221141',6.5,6284,'es','La mujer sin cabeza','After running into something with her car, Vero experiences a particular psychological state. She realizes she might have killed someone.','/qzDfJLfKQZY9D6zpaadFiugtphK.jpg','2008-08-21',87,'Released',NULL,'The Headless Woman',8898,1.9275,6.2,'hGiO1c-woNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25364,_binary '\0','/w0ZnQ7vACztp4pCWdXuSu6bk8Pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1221188',6.3,2507,'ca','Eloïse','A sensuous and ethereal story of two young women falling in love for the first time. Young, beautiful Àsia lies in a coma, her mother and boyfriend keeping constant vigil by her side. In flashback we see what led up to her accident, her life studying architecture at university, the somewhat overbearing relationship she has with her mother and her passionless relationship with Nathaniel.','/gSLg9z7eS4rTIiKXDNpgLzk7XJX.jpg','2009-10-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Eloise',44620,1.374,6.6,'2bc4DjMX4nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25365,_binary '\0','/1GDaLZQoMRW3JoNFEdj8jybnoGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1221207',5.3,2384,'en','Demoted','What go around comes around for a pair of prank-playing tire salesmen who find themselves placed in secretarial jobs by their put-upon boss.','/svBLwgbE2skHjGOejqmZoSzpDLu.jpg','2011-03-12',94,'Released','He got promoted. They got demoted. They\'ll get even.','Demoted',100416,2.3112,4.8,'gCV8LX0Ktqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25366,_binary '\0','/dX2vh8CewoLIOlQfW8JjW3GtiS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1221208',6.4,6115,'en','Frankie & Alice','A drama centered on a go-go dancer with multiple personality disorder who struggles to remain her true self and begins working with a psychotherapist to uncover the mystery of the inner ghosts that haunt her.','/4zXkZirn2QezrEFHWeAOkOxdjxj.jpg','2010-12-10',101,'Released','Turn back, look forward','Frankie & Alice',55061,3.1289,6,'y10yyl_MJ4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25367,_binary '\0','/ljYHyD0ZOQqIKDjRyxHYzlmvY2t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12215252',6.4,2310,'it','Corro da te','Gianni is a serial seducer but his life is destined to change when he meets Chiara, a beautiful woman who has had an accident and is paraplegic.','/vWgcIHKARoGFtbEPP9Ut7y2fmoP.jpg','2022-03-17',113,'Released',NULL,'Run to You',654895,2.5066,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25368,_binary '\0','/x7hnhzmZLyVNJEEYj2l5qWakaOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12216986',6.5,2325,'ru','Подольские курсанты','The story of the Podolsk cadets’ heroic stand outside Moscow in October 1941. Cadets were sent to the Ilyinsky line, fighting alongside units from the Soviet 43rd Army to hold back the German advance until reinforcements arrived. Hopelessly outnumbered, young men laid down their lives in a battle lasting almost two weeks to obstruct the far superior German forces advancing towards Moscow. Around 3,500 cadets and their commanding officers were sent to hold up the last line of defense outside Moscow. Most of them remained there for eternity.','/eHsSgvOsKkrmIynVzR8aDd3Lewm.jpg','2020-11-04',130,'Released','They fought for Moscow','The Last Frontier',579831,3.1285,6.6,'gR3fbtXm1nA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25369,_binary '\0','/l6trIrFvJbQIvHYpaFCKuwqLUbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12221748',7.2,8712,'en','Becoming','Join former first lady Michelle Obama in an intimate documentary looking at her life, hopes and connection with others.','/f0vo1yoEVlbpJ0Fkn0FgU7dTrO8.jpg','2020-05-06',89,'Released','Your story is your power.','Becoming',699280,1.9121,7.2,'wePNJGL7nDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25370,_binary '\0','/2xsh0pT7uyI16LMXAYylSWtQCsU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12221824',2.8,1463,'en','After Masks','Journey through the human experience as the pandemic tests what we are made of both as individuals and as a culture.','/zNQ2LnlJ4ANMwvGcRTqlSfnKKIE.jpg','2021-05-18',100,'Released','Everyone has a story. What\'s yours?','After Masks',832539,1.5722,2.9,'zkMGE0whTMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25371,_binary '\0','/5g5gp5tfSgA7OGZXACYYaGfSDQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1222329',4,2114,'en','Wild Cherry','A virginal high school senior decides to get revenge on her jock boyfriend when she discovers he\'s only dating her in hopes that she\'ll end up in his team\'s \"bang book.\"','/dxmKhXpIznlYvIjAKJKQKKb3T8r.jpg','2009-02-07',120,'Released','Never give it up.','Wild Cherry',53729,2.8235,4.4,'pkKvjLkEMWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25372,_binary '\0','/csnvGN0ciWcYEMNUZ5xgMDFdTAd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12223548',4.3,5805,'en','The Bezonians','In the Bezonians social club in North London, A group of down and outs scheme, plot and dream of becoming rich and breaking out of the monotony of their dreary and financially impotent lives.','/w42KoVU0GSDAHLcj0mZgRBmzvq6.jpg','2022-09-15',98,'Released','A new class of gangster.','The Bezonians',893508,2.2543,4.8,'5BbUwkh76r0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25373,_binary '\0','/xLsMxgMjko1rWbIUbvf6UBjToBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12226632',6.7,13026,'en','Big George Foreman','Fueled by an impoverished childhood, George Foreman channeled his anger into becoming an Olympic Gold medalist and World Heavyweight Champion, followed by a near-death experience that took him from the boxing ring to the pulpit. But when he sees his community struggling spiritually and financially, Foreman returns to the ring and makes history by reclaiming his title, becoming the oldest and most improbable World Heavyweight Boxing Champion ever.','/fdVd6thTstt0MQ4dUC1IXiOXpxv.jpg','2023-04-27',129,'Released','When life gives you a second chance, don\'t do it for yourself. Do it for everyone you love.','Big George Foreman',878361,8.0602,7.628,'urKDu40iaXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25374,_binary '\0','/q1uvFLmL7lz0ofBRhal8DchBEaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12226872',4.5,2728,'en','The Scary of Sixty-First','Two roommates’ lives are upended after finding out that their new Manhattan apartment harbors a dark secret.','/iP2x1rjh6H2dKSm5eFxAo2e46Jb.jpg','2021-12-03',81,'Released',NULL,'The Scary of Sixty-First',723377,1.8795,5.5,'gyyIyTBG3oU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25375,_binary '\0','/fJkPTmjYlNWX1yTDkQjw7jbroaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1222815',7.1,6558,'en','Chimpanzee','A nature documentary centered on a family of chimps living in the Ivory Coast and Ugandan rain forests. Through Oscar, a little chimpanzee, we discover learning about life in the heart of the African tropical forest and follow his first steps in this world with humor, emotion and anguish. Following a tragedy, he finds himself separated from his mother and left alone to face the hostility of the jungle. Until he is picked up by an older chimpanzee, who will take him under her protection.','/zmqWHkCXHM9n28zqL2LrPmJ5a7W.jpg','2012-04-20',78,'Released','For Oscar, every day is an adventure','Chimpanzee',72334,3.4711,6.9,'KokQL4aLfrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25376,_binary '\0','/rzTw6K1TbmF8qCUHWFrGhgXkBp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1222817',5.2,70615,'en','Zookeeper','Kindhearted Griffin Keyes is one of the best-loved caretakers at the Franklin Park Zoo, but he\'s more comfortable with the animals than with females of his own species as proven by his failed marriage proposal to the self-absorbed Stephanie several years ago. The animals have listened to Griffin pine over her for years and, after she reappears in his life, they decide to help Griffin rekindle the relationship and become the alpha male she wants him to be. They inadvertently reveal their secret ability to talk and, after Griffin\'s initial shock, teach him the rules of courtship, animal-style. Surprisingly, the animals\' advice really works and Griffin is about to get everything he\'s ever dreamed of--or is he?','/y3b4AYw8dr4hIKTfEAjxUxx0z8G.jpg','2011-07-06',102,'Released','Don\'t talk to the animals...unless they talk to you first.','Zookeeper',38317,6.6934,5.446,'pNJxxRi7AeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25377,_binary '\0','/duetX6n8iTEKSsGHeQvcR7oYRZ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1222818',5.3,3339,'en','Hatching Pete','Pete is very inconspicuous at school, unlike his extrovert mate Cleatis who\'s happy to don a chicken suit and be the school mascot, but unfortunately, Cleatis is allergic to the suit. When there\'s an uproar at the chicken\'s disappearance, Pete is forced into the limelight as the school\'s basketball reputation is at stake.','/eo4vvO4ddYDclzcGRUxMRA3JEe4.jpg','2009-04-24',90,'Released','Cock-a-doodle-who????','Hatching Pete',52699,3.6587,5.5,'EJ9n9b2Gm9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25378,_binary '\0','/ltVm9tMK32x56ezpHgJp0U5YQdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12229370',6.1,6340,'en','Mothering Sunday','On a warm spring day in 1924, house maid and foundling Jane Fairchild finds herself alone on Mother\'s Day. Her employers, Mr. and Mrs. Niven, are out and she has the rare chance to spend quality time with her secret lover. Paul is the boy from the manor house nearby, Jane\'s long-term love despite the fact that he\'s engaged to be married to another woman, a childhood friend and daughter of his parents\' friends. But events that neither can foresee will change the course of Jane\'s life forever.','/unZ7vPgxMTxWrpPGIkAVSqgdryv.jpg','2021-11-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Mothering Sunday',718838,7.9444,5.4,'ZEyCyI__09Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25379,_binary '\0','/mFTlNXsPzny0geJLxdo3ddzFR1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1223236',7.5,6981,'en','African Cats','African Cats captures the real-life love, humor and determination of the majestic kings of the savanna. The story features Mara, an endearing lion cub who strives to grow up with her mother’s strength, spirit and wisdom; Sita, a fearless cheetah and single mother of five mischievous newborns; and Fang, a proud leader of the pride who must defend his family from a once banished lion.','/nERPMF2kHjc1slLHZYZGwcWX9kg.jpg','2011-04-21',89,'Released',NULL,'African Cats',57586,3.67,7.3,'Iw41OjRgymg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25380,_binary '\0','/zTCcpYpRIBnjdcZGJdlfENcZPrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1223922',3.8,5626,'hi','Blue','Sagar, Sam, and Aarav decide to go underwater to find the sunken ship Lady in Blue to retrieve the treasure in it to help Sameer clear his debt, but one of them has a hidden agenda.','/g9bpZSbBRRfbx86s61lgormparP.jpg','2009-10-16',119,'Released','250 feet deep lies the secret of...','Blue',24595,1.8288,3.961,'znhp_GRdtT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25381,_binary '\0','/vBjAQOBs2Qy3UI34esYnZYtO5PU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1223934',6.6,7075,'de','Die Tür','A successful artist loses control of his life after his young daughter\'s death. A chance for a new start appears, but all is not what it seems.','/quSIt48GX1rp6AfOaHjeOHPohym.jpg','2009-11-26',103,'Released','If you could go back in time, would you?','The Door',51365,2.4737,6.222,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25382,_binary '\0','/zS4As7ntcbxb4Dy5ay3Mz4GgoIG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1223975',6.8,4778,'es','Tony Manero','A man is obsessed with John Travolta\'s disco dancing character from \"Saturday Night Fever\".','/moNodAj8wcthRY6jqhyIz99KBvB.jpg','2008-08-28',97,'Released','It\'s murder on the dance floor...','Tony Manero',33774,2.1005,6.3,'qaX2bavetsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25383,_binary '\0','/vqRoUBMb4NllIZkaFtHychxp3D7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1223980',5.5,1504,'nl','Zwart Water','Nine-year-old Lisa discovers her sinister new friend is the ghost of the dead twin of Lisa\'s mother. Then Lisa\'s father also begins to suspect his wife of hiding a terrible secret, resulting in deadly consequences…','/dbOGgPLCUxb9F3QoyB65zQNfImG.jpg','2010-03-11',112,'Released',NULL,'Two Eyes Staring',42833,1.3036,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25384,_binary '\0','/bH8hdULT5NogEbuKuQYxFyAOPl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224153',7,3840,'de','Jerichow','In a small Northern German town, a dishonourably discharged Afghanistan veteran is offered a job as a deliveryman by an alcoholic Turkish entrepreneur, through which the former meets the latter\'s gorgeous wife.','/n2UA8DNugSAOeFww2vNseczjIpj.jpg','2008-09-07',92,'Released',NULL,'Jerichow',12161,1.8262,6.5,'VlgHdr2-SBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25385,_binary '\0','/aH7aikfUkIbcBoZXJUMsf8fzhQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224366',6,5176,'en','Afterschool','A prep-school student accidentally films the drug-related deaths of two classmates, then is asked to put together a memorial video.','/s6U0XTaEy1zuQ70u3EkIFeruNEq.jpg','2009-02-10',107,'Released','There\'s always someone watching…','Afterschool',8926,1.9133,5.5,'LyDjjYN2utA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25386,_binary '\0','/mY9o9uybRY3Kg2JLgFTTfsCinOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224369',6.8,2349,'hu','Made in Hungária','Miklós Fenyö\'s parents returned to Communist Hungary in the mid sixties - when everyone else was fleeing to the West. Miki\'s old friends don\'t know what to make of his outrageous clothes, flawless American accent and collection of original Buddy Holly 45s. His childhood sweetheart is cold and distant while local tough guy Röné is unmoved by the challenger to his rock \'n\' roll crown. But that\'s not all. When the authorities see the effect Miki\'s gyrating hips and lewd music have on teenage girls, they won\'t stand for it. His father\'s job is on the line, and, for the first time, Miki must play by the rules. He has no choice but to enter the local talent show...','/fzu5uSoZurUJAM5dLvyiH5NYxUn.jpg','2009-02-05',109,'Released','Music sets you free!','Made in Hungaria',60279,1.1023,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25387,_binary '\0','/qK8nxkESWu4ZKw2lMfh6gzqKQH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224373',6.2,3455,'sl','Slovenka','Aleksandra is a student from Krško, a small town in Slovenia. She has a plan to conquer the world. Working as a prostitute, her life is heading to where she wants it, but an accidental death has her wrestling with new feelings of fear, loneliness, confusion and responsibility','/vcknyawJdopmWlZYoZyXgPP9Okj.jpg','2009-09-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Slovenian Girl',34989,1.4924,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25388,_binary '\0','/cEWHahSWm24GFg9GAeUkoAXy0Sq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224376',5.8,1269,'cs','Tobruk','It is the story of Jiri and Jan, two Czech soldiers, battling alongside the allied forces against the Germans, during World War II in Tobruk, Libya. Jiri Pospichal, eighteen years old, signs up as a volunteer in the Czechoslovak army. His naive ideas about heroism are rawly confronted with the hell of the African desert, complicated relationships in his unit and the ubiquitous threat of death.','/lIJAtOv2KKlIU6Xm50qLIOhr2uk.jpg','2008-09-04',99,'Released',NULL,'Tobruk',26651,1.3974,5.275,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25389,_binary '\0','/d7SWh0taIIfWyO2Yuy2wrO6z6p6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1224378',5.2,7125,'ru','Вий','Early 18th century. Cartographer Jonathan Green undertakes a scientific voyage from Europe to the East. Having passed through Transylvania and crossed the Carpathian Mountains, he finds himself in a small village lost in impassible woods. Nothing but chance and heavy fog could bring him to this cursed place. People who live here do not resemble any other people which the traveler saw before that. The villagers, having dug a deep moat to fend themselves from the rest of the world, share a naive belief that they could save themselves from evil, failing to understand that evil has made its nest in their souls and is waiting for an opportunity to gush out upon the world.','/q0o9JQDp6PHY4zK0Aw1NHpyQyeo.jpg','2014-01-30',128,'Released','The truth is in you','Forbidden Empire',208763,3.968,5.9,'Wsp0CPYXvo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25390,_binary '\0','/u7zUIy794nH7r0OE7yll2bQBbUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12244822',4.2,8151,'ar','أميرة','Amira, a 17 year old Palestinian, was conceived with the smuggled sperm of her imprisoned father, Nawar. Although their relationship since birth has been restricted to prison visits, he remains her hero. His absence in her life is overcompensated with love and affection from those surrounding her. But when a failed attempt to conceive another child reveals Nawar\'s infertility, Amira\'s world turns upside down.','/djrr4soQVEMNqcs64u700HcjmTr.jpg','2021-10-19',98,'Released',NULL,'Amira',796162,1.5102,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25391,_binary '\0','/7KNGGrDmKBEdCAuThfrGE6fwVhR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12246266',7.2,2531,'ar','٢٠٠ متر','Mustafa and his wife Salwa come from two Palestinian villages that are only 200 meters apart, but separated by the wall. Their unusual living situation is starting to affect their otherwise happy marriage, but the couple does what they can to make it work. Every night, Mustafa flashes a light from his balcony to wish his children on the other side a goodnight, and they signal him back. One day Mustafa gets a call that every parent dreads: his son has been in an accident. He rushes to the checkpoint where he must agonisingly wait in line only to find out there is a problem with his fingerprints and is denied entry. Desperate, Mustafa resorts to hiring a smuggler to bring him across. His once 200-meter journey becomes a 200-kilometer odyssey joined by other travellers determined to cross.','/gyWlOsvU6S7FQ6SxMdYwLuAbe4s.jpg','2020-09-08',96,'Released',NULL,'200 Meters',727012,2.0086,6.768,'dPDOlMhq5l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25392,_binary '\0','/wKx6ApPLUO5yHqg2On9tB30p9wG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1225290',6.8,1948,'pl','Cztery noce z Anną','Leon falls in love with a nurse and obsessively tries to get close to her.','/l7GeLmLIeAL9R2L6jfMqhSu8zov.jpg','2008-07-17',87,'Released',NULL,'Four Nights with Anna',44442,1.8796,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25393,_binary '\0','/jOdfYXyhLmkBj0hPF0fwzPUuEqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1225296',6,2083,'tl','Serbis','A struggling family owns a Filipino porn theater where prostitutes conduct their business.','/qJXdfE1VTYQFLvljHIzAWulQyXD.jpg','2008-06-24',90,'Released','Service. It\'s the family business.','Serbis',8904,1.9662,5.9,'bGddTbxs2lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25394,_binary '\0','/8OYuNqwAaTn77S4LihlnU27Kh7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1225302',5.2,1335,'en','The Big I Am','A cruel twist of fate catapults small time crook Mickey Skinner into the big league, as head of a brutal London gang poised on the brink of a lucrative human-trafficking deal.','/3DNC7wT7c0VbRHHOFHc3WIHcSrc.jpg','2010-04-07',105,'Released','Hitting The Big Time Has Its Price','The Big I Am',38156,1.8759,4.8,'degCvEkGw8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25395,_binary '\0','/wkZ3SBTK4j5n5LcX3eUyYCL8J22.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12253164',6.6,1987,'ro','Metronom','Bucharest, 1972. Ana, 17, dreams of love and freedom. One night, while partying with her friends, they decide to send a letter to Metronom, the musical program which Radio Free Europe broadcasts clandestinely in Romania. It is then that the Securitate, Ceausescu’s secret police, arrives…','/pITFIRteNQy5jJ2BGzePtUQ2Wdr.jpg','2022-11-04',102,'Released','We all keep the secret.','Metronom',962562,1.9808,6.3,'x958ymCcRxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25396,_binary '\0','/vSUz6gjbK0x9LfaDxZcIKk84Dxs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1225822',6.1,53458,'en','Extract','The owner of a factory that produces flavor extracts, Joel Reynold seems to have it all, but really doesn\'t. What\'s missing is sexual attention from his wife, Suzie. Joel hatches a convoluted plan to get Suzie to cheat on him, thereby clearing the way for Joel to have an affair with Cindy, an employee. But what Joel doesn\'t know is that Cindy is a sociopathic con artist, and a freak workplace accident clears the way for her to ruin Joel forever.','/cjen0vxjybwItQPH3NNCJuME2MY.jpg','2009-09-03',92,'Released','Sticking it to the man has never looked so good.','Extract',12569,3.8473,5.9,'KQrjlWZmM8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25397,_binary '\0','/a2Equ3sr2n3uE3IUe5y7u1wswsf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1225831',7.8,1485,'es','Historias extraordinarias','X arrives in a small town and witnesses a violent act; Z takes the job of a dead manager and discovers that he had a notebook written in code and a map; H is hired to go down a river and investigate a series of mysterious monoliths built on the shore.','/mj0hS9Ekg09FsM4N5SeDSOc18sJ.jpg','2008-10-04',242,'Released',NULL,'Extraordinary Stories',111188,1.8263,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25398,_binary '\0','/eSVu1FvGPy86TDo4hQbpuHx55DJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12261776',5.4,108592,'en','65','65 million years ago, the only 2 survivors of a spaceship from Somaris that crash-landed on Earth, must fend off dinosaurs to reach the escape vessel in time before an imminent asteroid strike threatens to destroy the planet.','/rzRb63TldOKdKydCvWJM8B6EkPM.jpg','2023-03-02',92,'Released','When past meets future.','65',700391,12.3089,5.951,'M6YfhX83Cj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25399,_binary '\0','/tHR34A5n0my4maACNdLpWGd6QYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12262116',7.8,81325,'en','Thirteen Lives','Based on the true nail-biting mission that captivated the world. Twelve boys and the coach of a Thai soccer team explore the Tham Luang cave when an unexpected rainstorm traps them in a chamber inside the mountain. Entombed behind a maze of flooded cave tunnels, they face impossible odds. A team of world-class divers navigate through miles of dangerous cave networks to discover that finding the boys is only the beginning.','/yi5KcJqFxy0D6yP8nCfcF8gJGg5.jpg','2022-07-18',147,'Released','5000 people, 17 countries, 1 miracle that united the world.','Thirteen Lives',698948,8.8502,7.829,'R068Si4eb3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25400,_binary '\0','/99XKAb7zFAKDogB0DYl87bA9Hi1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226229',6.3,191224,'en','Get Him to the Greek','Pinnacle records has the perfect plan to get their sinking company back on track: a comeback concert in LA featuring Aldous Snow, a fading rockstar who has dropped off the radar in recent years. Record company intern Aaron Green is faced with the monumental task of bringing his idol, out of control rock star Aldous Snow, back to LA for his comeback show.','/6g0li87w8LIK77QRUtOkQkM6bD7.jpg','2010-06-03',109,'Released','Aaron Green has 72 hours to get a rock star from London to L.A. Pray for him.','Get Him to the Greek',32823,7.084,6,'N6ixkr0-qvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25401,_binary '\0','/fQehemJNDIKfGcmTnvm5SqQ7kgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226232',6.6,9900,'en','The Greatest','Teenagers Rose and Bennett were in love, and then a car crash claimed Bennett\'s life. He left behind a grieving mother, father and younger brother, and Rose was left all alone. She has no family to turn to for support, so when she finds out she\'s pregnant, she winds up at the Brewer\'s door. She needs their help, and although they can\'t quite admit it, they each need her so they can begin to heal.','/ivOjH2EXQ3MlttsIaM7byaflFRb.jpg','2009-02-07',99,'Released',NULL,'The Greatest',32395,3.3924,6.2,'TfjNuq9Yq3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25402,_binary '\0','/z2HOdnH2LIrNOpF42eNw8bpOkkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226236',7,25813,'it','Io sono l\'amore','Emma has left Russia to live with her husband in Italy. Now a member of a powerful industrial family, she is the respected mother of three, but feels unfulfilled. One day, Antonio, a talented chef and her son\'s friend, makes her senses kindle.','/ss57QaZX5OE3YxoTZeKW5Y6U83S.jpg','2010-03-19',120,'Released',NULL,'I Am Love',41110,3.9818,6.7,'A6ew8N8piFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25403,_binary '\0','/rVmBmaXyvjDiumChLQNLW08nhDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226240',7.1,16031,'en','A Late Quartet','When the beloved cellist of a world-renowned string quartet is diagnosed with a life threatening illness, the group\'s future suddenly hangs in the balance as suppressed emotions, competing egos and uncontrollable passions threaten to derail years of friendship and collaboration. As they are about to play their 25th anniversary concert — quite possibly their last — only their intimate bond and the power of music can preserve their legacy.','/yuoVwE4CFDDqdQyHj3Ur8A6ViOT.jpg','2012-11-02',106,'Released','No arrangement is more beautiful … or more complicated.','A Late Quartet',121879,3.654,6.7,'O1VCyikozys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25404,_binary '\0','/dGulOAB9N4qJlafWxI4YczXDA4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226251',6.4,4870,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ダイヤモンド&パール ディアルガVSパルキアVSダークライ','Ash and friends (this time accompanied by newcomer Dawn) arrive at an idyllic village on their way to their next Pokemon contest, where chaos will soon erupt with the prophecy of two Pokemon Gods (Dialga and Palkia) and the arrival of a mysterious, seemingly deadly Pokemon named Darkrai, which has the power to distort space and time.','/yElGG6lxLtQXcgBVzF7Xxq7YRa2.jpg','2007-07-14',95,'Released','Somewhere between time & space... a legend is born.','Pokémon: The Rise of Darkrai',25961,4.9993,7,'koKPESdDzYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25405,_binary '\0','/cw8z9H963CtcqchtEEzqs3Ls1wC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226271',7.5,48836,'en','The Damned United','Taking over Leeds United, Brian Clough\'s abrasive approach and his clear dislike of the players\' dirty style of play make it certain there is going to be friction. Glimpses of his earlier career help explain both his hostility to previous manager Don Revie and how much he is missing right-hand man Peter Taylor.','/ftlbCma6QoRiZgiflVmLuPKHrkq.jpg','2009-03-27',97,'Released','They love me for what I\'m not... ...they hate me for what I am.','The Damned United',21641,4.2323,7.242,'RVnHpLho18c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25406,_binary '\0','/8srpvfRNT9qenQZACPTXDZYXitL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226273',6.6,104195,'en','Edge of Darkness','As a seasoned homicide detective, Thomas Craven has seen the bleakest side of humanity. But nothing prepares him for the toughest investigation of his life: the search for his only daughter Emma\'s killer. Now, he is on a personal mission to uncover the disturbing secrets surrounding her murder, including corporate corruption, government collusion and Emma\'s own mysterious life.','/pvHjp1vEFmp5FquSCPQ2O95tIZJ.jpg','2010-01-28',117,'Released','Some secrets take us to the edge.','Edge of Darkness',12201,9.2773,6.5,'hVOH8xrCI9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25407,_binary '\0','/wRxLAw4l17LqiFcPLkobriPTZAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12263384',7,176487,'en','Extraction 2','Back from the brink of death, highly skilled commando Tyler Rake takes on another dangerous mission: saving the imprisoned family of a ruthless gangster.','/7gKI9hpEMcZUQpNgKrkDzJpbnNS.jpg','2023-06-09',122,'Released','Prepare for the ride of your life.','Extraction 2',697843,19.1462,7.4,'Y274jZs5s7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25408,_binary '\0','/n5QLk1pm2Z4EW3PM1BYFgxSXbP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12264966',6.4,3422,'fr','Notre-Dame brûle','A film relating from the inside the Notre-Dame de Paris fire of April 2019.','/kXj3FqzQABWsElUuT9y3WhfGPdT.jpg','2022-03-16',109,'Released',NULL,'Notre-Dame on Fire',811596,4.7256,6.6,'GvMSR1FeOIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25409,_binary '\0','/2VMuMLAThKwQoY09UVcXPz005js.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226681',6.5,38867,'en','Pontypool','When disc jockey Grant Mazzy reports to his basement radio station in the Canadian town of Pontypool, he thinks it\'s just another day at work. But when he hears reports of a virus that turns people into zombies, Mazzy barricades himself in the radio booth and tries to figure out a way to warn his listeners about the virus and its unlikely mode of transmission.','/4wWMvurzg1AoArX57pqsPWwhps2.jpg','2009-03-06',96,'Released','Shut up or die.','Pontypool',23963,3.3448,6.5,'0W6y6pncMJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25410,_binary '\0','/keD9Bv4V5iq6dO9Tp8XOVgBOiuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226752',3.6,1256,'en','The Dunwich Horror','In Louisiana, in the wicked Whateley House, Lavina delivers two babies whose fate is written. Ten years later, three scholars of the occult discover that one page of the “Necronomicon,” the unspeakable book, is missing and the Black Brotherhood has summoned the ancient gate keeper to free legions of evil gods and monsters from the dimension of chaos.','/hHfF2sKfI6ssK6F2Y7CpLwffIsP.jpg','2009-12-13',91,'Released','The devil’s spawn is about to open the gates of hell','The Dunwich Horror',45663,1.4168,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25411,_binary '\0','/zKK43d0ilNFmhmLUARWow5WlHVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226753',6.8,74703,'en','The Debt','Rachel Singer is a former Mossad agent who tried to capture a notorious Nazi war criminal – the Surgeon of Birkenau – in a secret Israeli mission that ended with his death on the streets of East Berlin. Now, 30 years later, a man claiming to be the doctor has surfaced, and Rachel must return to Eastern Europe to uncover the truth. Overwhelmed by haunting memories of her younger self and her two fellow agents, the still-celebrated heroine must relive the trauma of those events and confront the debt she has incurred.','/zlavkPAIzIIQppcU9vcQrKZjfmb.jpg','2010-09-30',113,'Released','Every secret comes with a price.','The Debt',48289,5.7036,6.548,'ApMEDQbV2cI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25412,_binary '\0','/3yQtrRGrJHDgT3OhafZM8w2XwnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226766',6.5,5796,'en','The Great Gilly Hopkins','Young and feisty Gilly Hopkins devises a scheme to escape from her new foster home and reunite with her birth mother.','/twSO8TPhEB9AKWGwXZYI40ImnfP.jpg','2015-10-05',99,'Released','Family is where you find it','The Great Gilly Hopkins',331588,3.6562,6.596,'K37cOnb3VvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25413,_binary '\0','/baRFkHjBNSEF2frf0Gh8dZBFewl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226774',7.4,64568,'en','In the Loop','The US President and the UK Prime Minister are planning on launching a war in the Middle East, but—behind the scenes—government officials and advisers are either promoting the war or are trying to prevent it.','/jL6txnziFSeEifQkqnPBtaPaiXU.jpg','2009-01-22',106,'Released','The fate of the world is on the line.','In the Loop',19833,3.9229,7.017,'NSTdPxndUzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25414,_binary '\0','/sOhtC4cmaYPOlcjXCWxxrx2NKKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1226837',7.4,132776,'en','Beautiful Boy','After he and his first wife separate, journalist David Sheff struggles to help their teenage son, who goes from experimenting with drugs to becoming devastatingly addicted to methamphetamine.','/u2Gfv0mz3xePsgyCPHovrnFL1sB.jpg','2018-10-12',121,'Released','A true story of addiction, survival and family.','Beautiful Boy',451915,10.035,7.557,'8NR8w8s9zWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25415,_binary '\0','/5kCwzf43iPs1fr0H31MrOQBA8Xz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227183',6.2,3885,'en','Swallows and Amazons','Four children dream of escaping the tedium of a summer holiday with their mother. When finally given permission to camp on their own on an island in the middle of a vast lake, they are overjoyed. But when they get there they discover they may not be alone… The battle for ownership of a lonely island teaches them the skills of survival, the value of friendship and the importance of holding your nerve.','/y5ZVbjos0CqhKLMV77YzX6r12Ls.jpg','2016-08-19',97,'Released','Some summers you treasure forever','Swallows and Amazons',347035,2.2305,6.3,'ztIQkixuOmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25416,_binary '\0','/eFoCsoymZyGEcRu1LDRdSEacI7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227189',6.4,2899,'ru','Все умрут, а я останусь','One Monday morning Katya, Vika and Zhanna learn that there will be a school disco, their first disco, on the coming Saturday night. The girls feverishly start preparing for the event, which rapidly becomes the most important moment ever in their universe, and looks like the ideal way to escape their daily lives...','/lxEP7J9RGn80rQLObnExy49cktK.jpg','2008-10-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Everybody Dies But Me',31418,1.4513,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25417,_binary '\0','/7mOrfsKbyuaBFWNDs7s5XoV4fiW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12273762',4.2,3888,'en','Overrun','Former military extraction specialist Marcus Lombardi, whose only chance of saving his informant sister and their family is to track down a mysterious briefcase.','/h14HFfHfsy1CY1PyAhDdxZ6AapR.jpg','2021-08-16',105,'Released','Frame him. Hunt him. Good luck stopping him.','Overrun',862193,1.7171,5.308,'X5MTFyzO480','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25418,_binary '\0','/yoUNp320JQvzHNQO7tKzBUOwt1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227378',7.5,9075,'en','Fat, Sick & Nearly Dead','100 pounds overweight, loaded up on steroids and suffering from a debilitating autoimmune disease, Joe Cross is at the end of his rope and the end of his hope. In the mirror he saw a 310lb man whose gut was bigger than a beach ball and a path laid out before him that wouldn\'t end well— with one foot already in the grave, the other wasn\'t far behind. FAT, SICK &amp; NEARLY DEAD is an inspiring film that chronicles Joe\'s personal mission to regain his health.','/yKXRwMValA4ZbCaC68ANO24ALcY.jpg','2010-04-16',97,'Released','FAT, SICK & NEARLY DEAD is an inspiring film that chronicles Joe\'s personal mission to regain his health.','Fat, Sick & Nearly Dead',72914,0.815,6.7,'x9SGWcZwk7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25419,_binary '\0','/6QwmJyFl4iKgincmi2W1AvjraEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12273972',6.4,1648,'tr','Sardunya','Just before her final exams, 19 years old Defne, has to return to her hometown after her father\'s stroke. His rehabilitation sessions will give the pair a chance to heal their fragile relationship in this beautiful Mediterranean town.','/1wSXkRK5ZNO6HMsWU37dTgHn2Xw.jpg','2020-12-04',82,'Released',NULL,'Geranium',819213,0.7025,5.6,'Jho5D0hUPBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25420,_binary '\0','/aDyHYVjMzc5YdX0hM27lLnerjjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12274228',6.3,7048,'en','Rent-A-Pal','Set in 1990, a lonely bachelor named David searches for an escape from the day-to-day drudgery of caring for his aging mother. While seeking a partner through a video dating service, he discovers a strange VHS tape called Rent-A-Pal. Hosted by the charming and charismatic Andy, the tape offers him much-needed company, compassion, and friendship. But Andy\'s friendship comes at a cost, and David desperately struggles to afford the price of admission.','/wFaO4uc8po7uNCTSdvbqduMTyuu.jpg','2020-10-10',108,'Released','He talks to you. He listens to you. He understands you.','Rent-A-Pal',707408,1.8933,6.5,'N_kraLkWdbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25421,_binary '\0','/j7rKil35TTidYd6cYUWjaXzbofN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227524',7.1,1409,'hi','आशाएं','The story revolves around Rahul Singh (John Abraham), a compulsive gambler who wins Rs. 20 million from a bet and throws a party to celebrate. Everyone has a good time drinking and partying till late night during which Rahul proposes to Nafisa (Sonal Sehgal). He announces their engagement to all present, then collapses on the floor. In hospital, he learns that he has only 90 days to live. Wanting to make the most of his last days, he leaves everything behind and moves into a soothing hospice. The inmates he meets change his outlook on life. As his relationships grow with each one of them, Rahul tries to rise above his own needs and live life to the fullest, learning from the courage of those around him.','/dGkDAowxcCNbaNm1EGQEnDHmgXI.jpg','2010-08-27',115,'Released','Prepare for Life','Aashayein',44070,1.4954,6.692,'vItdHlpkSAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25422,_binary '\0','/jr6l9e5tg7tOeoSjkcKKeJcz9Fy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227536',6.7,4033,'fi','Rööperi','In the mid-1960s, three small-time Finnish bootleggers seize control of their Helsinki neighborhood\'s black-market liquor business.','/yafmxsqHx3IVqlMdoPpuvbvg3dv.jpg','2009-01-09',136,'Released','Happiness, jail or the grave?','Hellsinki',25335,1.0959,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25423,_binary '\0','/tF5PM6BExQak5cvQp9zGECAMDwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227555',5.9,1233,'sv','Isolerad','Lonely medical student Frank is pleased with his flat, a quiet place to focus on his coming exams. But when he meets the girl upstairs, the intrusive Lotte, he realizes there is something wrong with the place. Each time he leaves his apartment, Frank is scared... the talkative concierge, the annoying child, the love-sick Lotte, her brutal ex-boyfriend and above all, her new jealous boyfriend, the scary Micke, they all seem to be Frank\'s enemies.','/tlQjppTYMqG35Dx2O9aQAVdDzXL.jpg','2010-02-05',75,'Released',NULL,'Corridor',56532,1.4552,6,'tNwAZ-0sgqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25424,_binary '\0','/etgX6vgk0NXhV0UAPBTFH0rG4TK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12276028',4.8,1812,'en','Krazy House','When Russian workers in Bernie’s house turn out to be wanted criminals, Bernie has to man up and save his ’90s sitcom family.','/36gDjx56RDhjIpynKkrseJCJJDi.jpg','2024-05-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Krazy House',607338,3.0394,4.9,'mnfILVm8aMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25425,_binary '\0','/bu9myTp9Ia0e1crLVwoEIMUZmU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227762',4.7,3808,'hi','Aladin','Aladin, an orphan tormented by bullies, discovers a magic lamp that grants him incredible powers. Later, with the help of a genie, he embarks on thrilling adventures to defeat the evil Ringmaster.','/rqXLyzAPk7yAygwRAyBrHcVL3os.jpg','2009-10-29',132,'Released',NULL,'Aladin',25868,2.5977,6.1,'JMQ9bNix4XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25426,_binary '\0','/kYRwGg1SNIT97DD5wPks5H7iPDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227787',6.9,3965,'en','London River','After traveling to London to check on their missing children in the wake of the 2005 terror attacks on the city, two strangers come to discover their respective children had been living together at the time of the attacks','/dyHvnoxN6yXzwbcYSY53d5VGPCX.jpg','2009-02-09',87,'Released',NULL,'London River',39358,2.2268,6.7,'sRsZ23K2rUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25427,_binary '\0','/pblSPSwDzl26QN1SsibHAw21gnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227789',4.5,2399,'en','Rites of Spring','A ransom scheme turns into a nightmare for a group of kidnappers who become victims of a horrifying secret that must be paid every spring.','/iUzwDAaYvceIqSoN4apE5SldS3V.jpg','2012-09-22',81,'Released','Fear has a season','Rites of Spring',92397,1.174,4.2,'3gp1nAYgG_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25428,_binary '\0','/uRmzVlAnXx2ABGZLiJH4vV1YCnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1227931',4.5,1434,'en','Slightly Single in L.A.','Dale hopes for a meaningful relationship in LA but it eludes her. Then she bumps into a musician she knew before he became a star.','/jVHfthjAfvgM9WKHJ6vJyNbiG9C.jpg','2013-09-03',88,'Released',NULL,'Slightly Single in L.A.',147367,1.9786,4.758,'Dnk7H4C2Bck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25429,_binary '\0','/8OtK8v2BD67OHOMRhoOVvQBjpfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12280566',5.8,1513,'en','Love in Dangerous Times','With the world in a pandemic, Jason and Sorrel meet on a dating app and build a romance as the situation gets worse.','/3v7Euo26chIhFCqUpJe1hsXzgxI.jpg','2020-11-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Love in Dangerous Times',756189,0.8973,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25430,_binary '\0','/prnq2ONhqo9Tga7dOMZKgFJMofs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12282598',5.6,3390,'es','La corazonada','Police officer Pipa works on her first big case while simultaneously investigating her boss, who is suspected of murder. The prequel to \"Perdida\".','/m2rJGjlesDKxugl7ypW8n3Mipjl.jpg','2020-05-28',116,'Released','Everyone is guilty.','Intuition',620883,2.1617,6.235,'0Qskzp5tnJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25431,_binary '\0','/9HRuufyaDwTajlFpMKgki9cr2wQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12283036',4.3,2452,'en','Room 203','Two female roommates were tormented by the vengeful spirits dwelling in their gothic-style, rented apartment, which contains an ornate centerpiece.','/t4M0n5kfToiU9TIf22bccSbNugG.jpg','2022-04-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Room 203',885121,1.6595,5.327,'1HZF7PEQQ3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25432,_binary '\0','/A9lQNd5o3TIVnbD6Pc67xJZ9Cb8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12283738',3,2831,'en','Quarantine Girl','A woman\'s mental state deteriorates as she isolates herself during an epidemic.','/gf7l6OJecG5laNMKknL3Dcgl1tt.jpg','2020-09-04',61,'Released',NULL,'Quarantine Girl',744273,0.8385,4.3,'mZKc8M_tOyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'