 15:21:07.000000','tt1230165',7.7,23590,'hi','Rock On!!','Aditya, Joe, Kedar and Rob form a rock band, but break up after they fail to make a success of it. They establish regular lives until they decide to reunite and take another shot at fulfilling their dreams.','/cckTZXVpchMrljPouFf7u2wqUTX.jpg','2008-08-29',144,'Released','Live Your Dream','Rock On!!',19672,1.5288,6.855,'P7aJlKdHgWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25458,_binary '\0','/nbGrRIF7zpbTP98nrEa7JbThyP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230168',6.6,9425,'en','Same Kind of Different as Me','International art dealer Ron Hall must befriend a dangerous homeless man in order to save his struggling marriage to his wife, a woman whose dreams will lead all three of them on the journey of their lives.','/bHh5W7YuMorc4orn8DQ6c8YEnBm.jpg','2017-10-20',119,'Released','Based On The Incredible True Story That Inspired Millions','Same Kind of Different as Me',300687,4.5405,6.8,'o1EsLulr2q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25459,_binary '\0','/vLrYs1tQuT8VbETvTd1CGLXEv3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230194',6.2,3294,'nl','De storm','A fictional story within the historical context of the disastrous flood that engulfed the Dutch coastal province of Zeeland in 1953. When their farmhouse is destroyed by the flood, teenage mother Julia gets separated from her baby boy, whom she kept hidden in a box. She is saved from drowning by a young air force lieutenant, who agrees to go help looking for Julia\'s little son.','/6tUtLfBhI9HTpOFdviuzPR2XTal.jpg','2009-09-17',96,'Released',NULL,'The Storm',29602,1.2831,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25460,_binary '\0','/rhJJ1ws02oRcwQzxoM8c6pP6U3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230204',6,8985,'en','A Turtle\'s Tale: Sammy\'s Adventures','Born on a Baja, California beach in 1959, new hatchling Sammy races across the beach to the ocean while avoiding being caught by seagulls and crabs. Thus begins Sammy\'s incredible fifty-year ocean journey where he overcomes obstacles, both natural and man-made, while trying to fulfill his dream of travelling around the world. Along the way he meets his best friend, a fellow turtle named Ray, and never forgets about Shelly, a turtle he saved that first day on the beach and the one he\'s always loved.','/jYz1FQjspxQCUCMXuB4ihnH9Y03.jpg','2010-08-04',88,'Released','Hatch Me If You Can','A Turtle\'s Tale: Sammy\'s Adventures',49953,7.3781,6.067,'ZAg-6UCKrs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25461,_binary '\0','/5vGRBRKMaBBGwTiDDYuaP7BZm4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230206',4.5,2378,'en','Slaughter','A young woman looks to escape her abusive life by moving to her family\'s farm near Atlanta. Unfortunately, she learns her place of supposed comfort offers more terrifying forms of abuse.','/i5W6kmPWWzfrIlENjOJZ1nydPYt.jpg','2009-01-09',96,'Released','Find a good hiding place.','Slaughter',17240,1.4921,4.3,'epgZ1Dy8Hck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25462,_binary '\0','/91kH9D1cr8GF7jgvUXiirAw3EK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230211',5,2439,'en','Perkins\' 14','Ronald Perkins builds an army of 14 people brainwashed through cult-like methods to protect him from his parents\' killers. When Perkins is imprisoned, the police unwittingly unleash his followers on a small town and they\'ve only got one thing on their mind: \"Kill for Mr. Perkins.\"','/m20PFFDOp6KWtpqzhsrp67aa4Wc.jpg','2009-01-09',95,'Released','Years have gone by... not heard from, nor seen. Destined to KILL. Its...','Perkins\' 14',18278,1.0835,4.7,'5P-2rXS5LS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25463,_binary '\0','/bR9JE8Y5YNYIBqXaDQuTaWKv5B5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230213',5.6,6768,'en','Bound to Vengeance','A young woman, Eve, fights back and manages to escape a malicious abductor. However, after discovering she may not be the only victim, Eve unravels a darker truth and decides to turn the tables on her captor.','/bA6GPWd69RBlcD1wpowtMhgOmFr.jpg','2015-06-26',80,'Released','Escape is just the beginning.','Bound to Vengeance',310137,3.0278,5.6,'m1_a_SLwnvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25464,_binary '\0','/szOA2o6ztv7wrKp8UOWDGr4Hfv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230215',6,5192,'en','Not Fade Away','Set in suburban New Jersey in the 1960s, a group of friends form a rock band and try to make it big.','/gm35kM2WURKQtw59EkE4zT2ptsp.jpg','2012-12-21',112,'Released','there is no past no future either. just the Now--','Not Fade Away',128270,2.3304,5.4,'wIUST22f0VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25465,_binary '\0','/irMy4NnEVR9nNB0wN17OMKo2Gnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12302540',5.5,1600,'en','Wicked','Ivy Morgan, a college student in New Orleans, falls for Ren Owens, the last person she expected to enter her rigidly controlled life.','/2Gp6TJEs5atttH9xFqEootyQz5o.jpg','2021-05-27',114,'Released',NULL,'Wicked',834143,2.6651,7.8,'KtKIiARak8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25466,_binary '\0','/lnxXvGylX41RRTuSXIEM7P0eBYu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230385',7.3,25404,'ko','황해','A Korean man in China takes an assassination job in South Korea to make money and find his missing wife. But when the job is botched, he is forced to go on the run from the police and the gangsters who paid him.','/yPJMDxam5HP0DAc1rMk0aNRpSc5.jpg','2010-12-22',156,'Released','The only thing he must not have crossed.','The Yellow Sea',57361,5.1481,7.357,'eZ9cUe0j9l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25467,_binary '\0','/vp0Hy2M1Y0cmf8sEhoRBgjxyPYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230414',6.6,104384,'en','It\'s Complicated','Ten years after their divorce, Jane and Jake Adler unite for their son\'s college graduation and unexpectedly end up sleeping together. But Jake is married, and Jane is embarking on a new romance with her architect. Now, she has to sort out her life—just when she thought she had it all figured out.','/bmjPrJgrGENFRrERP7lCJ9FGIVB.jpg','2009-12-23',121,'Released','First comes marriage. Then comes divorce. And then...','It\'s Complicated',22897,8.7851,6.518,'FtbsGSzTOyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25468,_binary '\0','/rTjWmPjBviBZrSUJ95rcatXjGZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230448',6.5,15264,'hi','बिल्लू','When a famous Bollywood actor visits a small village for a film\'s shoot, a poor hairdresser\'s claim that they were once childhood friends soon makes him the centre of attention.','/nmWKskigmvBow3uOP4RPQOIaUux.jpg','2009-02-13',137,'Released',NULL,'Billu',16345,2.4073,6.401,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25469,_binary '\0','/NlXqUUOiW9Etq8GacF5dOxe36Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12304596',6.9,3916,'en','#UNFIT: The Psychology of Donald Trump','Medical doctors and mental health professionals go on camera, on the record, for the record, for a discussion, analysis, and science-based examination of the behavior, psyche, condition, and stability of President Donald Trump. Also examines Trump\'s effect on our citizenry, culture, and institutions.','/3DgSiNMiHh1JreAOjWseAO3vyJb.jpg','2020-10-22',83,'Released','Science. Truth. Duty To Warn.','#UNFIT: The Psychology of Donald Trump',581802,1.8662,6.7,'vWCJoqgkrD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25470,_binary '\0','/merlZy8U3uhVAcZCvLIKphnRzJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1230544',7,1406,'te','కొంచెం ఇష్టం కొంచెం కష్టం','Geeta\'s father disapproves of her relationship with Siddhu as he isn\'t too pleased with the fact that the latter\'s parents are divorced. Determined to marry Geeta, Siddhu promises to reunite his parents.','/dT3MwBS3X0FJx22GngeMom8mKI4.jpg','2009-02-05',165,'Released',NULL,'Konchem Ishtam Konchem Kashtam',85810,1.2802,6.605,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25471,_binary '\0','/mmyPXpBXEuVvpfrvR01nCZ81CpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12306964',6.6,2828,'es','En los márgenes','A day in the life of Azucena, who is running out of time to keep herself and her family from being evicted; Rafael, a lawyer who sets out to reunite a mother with her daughter; and Teodora, a sick old woman who searches for her long-lost son before it is too late.','/5Prjpx6Vt1hoRh9B7Fsh1o36aub.jpg','2022-10-07',103,'Released',NULL,'On the Fringe',714339,2.4681,6.7,'_2F1Ww3oDns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25472,_binary '\0','/36FtYEYmqrp7kIQqjrYhWXBnXJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12311620',6.3,10757,'en','Breaking','Desperate for money and running out of options, Marine veteran Brian Brown-Easley holds several people hostage inside a bank, setting the stage for a tense confrontation with police.','/rKbgbzJbVM7MLjN7EwdO1QcIXCz.jpg','2022-08-25',103,'Released','Based on the true story of one man\'s demand to be heard.','Breaking',801965,3.2976,6.5,'5Vi3EhaNOII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25473,_binary '\0','/q2qzgZnp0cW4D9DJveoQpaJ9U54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12311866',3.8,5654,'en','Children of the Corn','A psychopathic twelve-year-old girl in a small town in Nebraska recruits all the other children and goes on a bloody rampage, killing the corrupt adults and anyone else who opposes her. A bright high schooler who won\'t go along with the plan is the town\'s only hope of survival.','/ooZbBL28oXDHfc8xSt2VRHU8jkO.jpg','2020-10-23',93,'Released','Every parent\'s nightmare as you\'ve never seen it before.','Children of the Corn',701121,4.1913,5,'PWCGoGdkM7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25474,_binary '\0','/2oxlor4lQrP2JX40ammAQdOqkEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231277',3.6,15092,'en','S. Darko','Seven years after the events of the first film, Samantha Darko finds herself stranded in a small desert town after her car breaks down where she is plagued by bizarre visions telling of the universe\'s end. As a result, she must face her own demons, and in doing so, save the world and herself.','/djuhoG2GizTa9SLi2LBuCPAt6N7.jpg','2009-04-28',103,'Released','It\'s time to travel forward.','S. Darko',17532,3.4466,4.315,'uxSewEtDtkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25475,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12312854',5.3,2543,'en','Dark Obsession','The story follows Anne, a painter who struggles with inner demons after being forced into a life of solitude when her husband leaves mysteriously.','/r9CKTVIMr7w8OSRFYMj2XMIKnKu.jpg','2023-08-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Dark Obsession',863413,2.0413,1,'yqyu15TayGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25476,_binary '\0','/6epafgrlSnOJrNakHgY7pbYr513.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231287',4.9,12750,'en','Labor Pains','A young woman pretends to be pregnant in order to avoid being fired from her job. When that gets her a bunch of special treatment by everyone involved in her life, she tries to keep up the lie for nine months.','/mIjFpM6pPaGAXSaf2rhvxdj9uhV.jpg','2009-06-19',89,'Released','Some stories just keep on growing','Labor Pains',19794,4.0467,5.39,'30-bg7ukP9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25477,_binary '\0','/3lf6YCItKcF3Wrrs7tp1PL0eyOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231580',4.6,62229,'en','Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel','Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville\'s twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school\'s music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.','/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg','2009-12-21',89,'Released','The Boys are back in town... and they have competition.','Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel',23398,13.6782,5.657,'HwVzCtRvcyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25478,_binary '\0','/naV4PO7ftzNThYKGX44F8vRY2z3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231583',6.5,375249,'en','Due Date','Peter Highman must scramble across the US in five days to be present for the birth of his first child. He gets off to a bad start when his wallet and luggage are stolen, and put on the \'no-fly\' list. Peter embarks on a terrifying journey when he accepts a ride from an actor.','/sBxWS09pOOyXZ0dcnqfqqCAQGan.jpg','2010-11-03',95,'Released','Leave your comfort zone.','Due Date',41733,9.4548,6.392,'7FcTcgjZzq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25479,_binary '\0','/oqN7CoEzxAABrGBlS8s4PyU3xLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231586',6.1,24694,'en','A Good Old Fashioned Orgy','A group of 30-year-olds who have been friends since high school attempt to throw an end-of-summer orgy.','/1lyMNAAaKb3pZHoVXVDQExCmzVI.jpg','2011-09-02',95,'Released','A comedy about old friends in new positions.','A Good Old Fashioned Orgy',69778,4.8706,5.85,'CrW8oewmwWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25480,_binary '\0','/wwzuxanisjA7GhZOPYaWlfmlCKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1231587',6.4,199979,'en','Hot Tub Time Machine','Four pals are stuck in a rut in adulthood: Adam has just been dumped, Lou is a hopeless party animal, Nick is a henpecked husband, and Jacob does nothing but play video games in his basement. But they get a chance to brighten their future by changing their past after a night of heavy drinking in a ski-resort hot tub results in their waking up in 1986.','/wjzbVXAes1acbh6k4OO5xVfy5.jpg','2010-03-26',101,'Released','Forget the present. Change the future. Kick some past.','Hot Tub Time Machine',23048,9.1628,6.048,'Bbkr8_-Hehk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25481,_binary '\0','/zvYyXc4wfevrxDRhkdyANMqu9KD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232047',8.1,3678,'en','Ed, Edd n Eddy\'s Big Picture Show','When a scam goes horribly wrong and leaves the neighborhood kids furious, the Eds embark on a journey to find Eddy\'s brother in the \"Ed, Edd, n Eddy\" series finale.','/uwuNrGrGJlkqInCZ9Kunf9JYWUG.jpg','2009-06-05',88,'Released','A motion picture event of Ed-normous proportion!','Ed, Edd n Eddy\'s Big Picture Show',50300,3.5131,7.5,'a-rHWZdbFQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25482,_binary '\0','/p2mJPQc9ADr75RrMtbtBjxRXjj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232200',5.6,123675,'en','That\'s My Boy','While in his teens, Donny fathered a son, Todd, and raised him as a single parent up until Todd\'s 18th birthday. Now, after not seeing each other for years, Todd\'s world comes crashing down when Donny resurfaces just before Todd\'s wedding.','/oaLhdRsZ5Mq8VfZtA4Wlvjzzn0X.jpg','2012-06-14',116,'Released','The story of a child… and his son.','That\'s My Boy',87428,13.1387,5.825,'KoWkFkWiiTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25483,_binary '\0','/1KXxNTawX5cYuutpKkypJhShU0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232206',7.2,2145,'en','Teenage Paparazzo','A documentary that examines the relationship between celebrity and society.','/5tWz4G0Nwyz58TM92yusCtHqM2Y.jpg','2010-08-27',91,'Released','He thought he knew everything about celebrity. Until he met one.','Teenage Paparazzo',54994,3.5469,6.97,'QBiH86gV0Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25484,_binary '\0','/2cBCFvMDLZowXKvMaCGot5dmHUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232207',7.4,44365,'en','Capitalism: A Love Story','Michael Moore comes home to the issue he\'s been examining throughout his career: the disastrous impact of corporate dominance on the everyday lives of Americans (and by default, the rest of the world).','/zJBkIPakBXdu3cEgGqKCPHUNXVE.jpg','2009-09-06',128,'Released','Ask not what your CEO can do for you, but what you can do for your CEO','Capitalism: A Love Story',22074,3.8381,7.1,'IhydyxRjujU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25485,_binary '\0','/18pvm5koeoCZNw8aPEY4jcMUGFn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12322986',7.1,1516,'fr','Petite nature','Ten-year-old Johnny stands out from his family and his tough neighborhood in Eastern France. He\'s sensitive, intelligent and interested in all kinds of things way beyond his years. With curiosity, he observes the ups and downs of his young single mother\'s turbulent love life. Things change when a new teacher, fresh from the big city, takes over Johnny\'s class. Mr. Adamski believes in Johnny and wants to open a new world to him. The sophisticated young teacher also intrigues the boy.','/zUZmlHCjqxUQyts0RcoIfAI9HW7.jpg','2022-03-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Softie',661925,1.9017,7,'fSTHDerNGH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25486,_binary '\0','/4VgiVdd2I3AktHkOpCeSjtP4t8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232776',7.3,68717,'en','Fish Tank','Fifteen-year-old Mia is in a constant state of war with her family and the world around her. When she meets her party-girl mother’s charming new boyfriend Connor, she is amazed to find he returns her attention, and believes he might help her start to make sense of her life.','/rI3MKBDsWzQHi9PWDAMKkgmYcff.jpg','2009-09-11',123,'Released','Live, love and give as good as you get.','Fish Tank',24469,3.7151,6.947,'xf5VOvB5MHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25487,_binary '\0','/rZExqdRARUSMdpQpEWlG4LRrGNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232783',5.2,34484,'en','Sorority Row','When five sorority girls inadvertently cause the murder of one of their sisters in a prank gone wrong, they agree to keep the matter to themselves and never speak of it again, so they can get on with their lives. This proves easier said than done, when after graduation a mysterious killer goes after the five of them and anyone who knows their secret.','/voIQd9TDplumz9wInHwj6bRyHnu.jpg','2009-09-09',101,'Released','The sisters of Theta Pi are dying to keep a secret.','Sorority Row',26688,6.623,5.6,'4IG5UyZIbE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25488,_binary '\0','/oaymUCmgnw6pAsQyWsB8cdCbc6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232790',7.2,2391,'en','Of Time and the City','British director Terence Davies reflects on his birthplace of Liverpool - his memories of growing up there and how it has changed in the years since - in the process meditating on the internal struggles and conflicts that have wracked him throughout his life and the history of England during the second half of the 20th century.','/1kdvuMUOTBkcjtWNwL9W0sEmaQG.jpg','2008-10-31',74,'Released','A love song and a eulogy','Of Time and the City',29785,1.1143,7.1,'0f_Hnf7V-5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25489,_binary '\0','/h7srk5ZZQl5fMws9HIevUtBmJvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232826',6.9,6948,'sv','De ofrivilliga','In several unrelated stories, the consequences of putting one\'s foot down – or failing to do so – are explored.','/r3x3SxiNj6qzJVHmdoaYUs7AiLZ.jpg','2008-11-28',98,'Released',NULL,'Involuntary',8927,1.7615,6.4,'MJMtun664tY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25490,_binary '\0','/rXrpYOveFl76ivMmyb2612T7Q8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232829',7.2,655374,'en','21 Jump Street','When cops Schmidt and Jenko join the secret Jump Street unit, they use their youthful appearances to go undercover as high school students. They trade in their guns and badges for backpacks, and set out to shut down a dangerous drug ring. But, as time goes on, Schmidt and Jenko discover that high school is nothing like it was just a few years earlier -- and, what\'s more, they must again confront the teenage terror and anxiety they thought they had left behind.','/8v3Sqv9UcIUC4ebmpKWROqPBINZ.jpg','2012-03-14',109,'Released','The only thing getting blown tonight is their cover.','21 Jump Street',64688,18.0784,6.883,'BjRs18rV1FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25491,_binary '\0','/q2wxcc9xsqLptpVTIsCyYGYWomm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232831',7.2,5970,'ja','クローズZERO II','Genji and his victorious G.P.S. alliance find themselves facing down a new challenge by the students of Hosen Academy, feared by everyone as \'The Army of Killers.\' The two schools, in fact, have a history of bad blood between them. And the simmering embers of hatred are about to flare up again, burning away any last remnants of the truce they had so rigorously observed until now.','/wHLXk6cgXhcSXksdXcMOEoUIvC4.jpg','2009-04-11',133,'Released',NULL,'Crows Zero II',25716,4.0227,7.222,'hTPZW28r_K0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25492,_binary '\0','/u0lqlsS7lPDOFP2SyPRX3Lu6jLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1232838',5.7,5237,'en','Triple Dog','On the night of a sleepover, a group of teenage girls venture out in a competitive game of challenging dares. As the antics escalate, and the dares become more extreme, the girls unravel the truth behind a former student\'s rumored suicide.','/iqnTnSDrFb5rkzIFNWCkEgQgimj.jpg','2010-09-21',92,'Released','I Dare You to Play.','Triple Dog',46665,2.2326,5.7,'WLWRWXHM3xY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25493,_binary '\0','/mSnLi8vmQ4gGqlg1BLapFNeAGx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233192',5.7,7052,'en','Brighton Rock','Charts the headlong fall of Pinkie, a razor-wielding disadvantaged teenager with a religious death wish.','/7uq3onOHexPe4Xcj5bdRL7NKkIi.jpg','2010-09-13',111,'Released','Love. Murder. Revenge.','Brighton Rock',62728,2.1862,5.7,'-cpUIf2QH3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25494,_binary '\0','/7FjtqbxCdQssnQFyoRTTgpO3mjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233219',6.1,11705,'en','My Son, My Son, What Have Ye Done','Brad has committed murder and barricaded himself inside his house. With the help of his friends and neighbours, the cops piece together the strange tale of how this nice young man arrived at such a dark place.','/sUS8WNlJblq2GMCFPKBHzhu0XDC.jpg','2010-07-08',91,'Released','The mystery isn\'t who. But why.','My Son, My Son, What Have Ye Done',44027,2.8012,6.1,'cPz6WEjW6Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25495,_binary '\0','/gqR59DjJGr6i8mxRD1VfOzCueTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233227',6.1,137312,'en','Saw VI','Special Agent Strahm is dead, and Detective Hoffman has emerged as the unchallenged successor to Jigsaw\'s legacy. However, when the FBI draws closer to Hoffman, he is forced to set a game into motion, and Jigsaw\'s grand scheme is finally understood.','/jBr7bBPA4PYPaf4O6nfjYViyRWK.jpg','2009-10-22',90,'Released','The game has come full circle.','Saw VI',22804,10.5468,6.296,'MW8BaH-w7-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25496,_binary '\0','/rprg34i9MfIRAJdBcjAWaV7JXRe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233301',6.1,45648,'en','Ironclad','In the year 1215, the rebel barons of England have forced their despised King John to put his royal seal on the Magna Carta, a seminal document that upheld the rights of free men. Yet within months of pledging himself to the great charter, the King reneged on his word and assembled a mercenary army on the south coast of England with the intention of bringing the barons and the country back under his tyrannical rule. Barring his way stood the mighty Rochester castle, a place that would become the symbol of the rebel\'s momentous struggle for justice and freedom.','/h7CP12wAThhw2WSOA1uIAqxg1fS.jpg','2011-03-03',121,'Released','Heavy metal goes medieval.','Ironclad',38543,4.8185,6.2,'2Ebfqkv2Yg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25497,_binary '\0','/fRN20mOGFGI8j9hAEIhbpTpSpsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233334',7.2,8161,'en','Pariah','A Brooklyn teenager juggles conflicting identities and risks friendship, heartbreak, and family in a desperate search for sexual expression.','/lX9Ss9LH3bsAoGWDvsPv4zZG9fa.jpg','2011-12-27',86,'Released','Who do you become when you can\'t be yourself?','Pariah',73939,2.0342,6.9,'yPcx3nS288Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25498,_binary '\0','/tD7zvUWcx6Uw54GiE0xzpGK15pT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233381',7.3,24404,'tr','Üç maymun','A family battles against the odds to stay together when small lies grow into an extravagant cover-up. In order to avoid hardship and responsibilities that would otherwise be impossible to endure, the family chooses to ignore the truth, not to see, hear or talk about it. But does playing “Three Monkeys” invalidate the truth of its existence?','/tyIKP8SSTkw9xEXAG9lj5jEnIfW.jpg','2008-05-16',109,'Released',NULL,'Three Monkeys',8905,2.0419,6.8,'7wBznN7c8YE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25499,_binary '\0','/zJ5thPoPuEnH38UCUzIMrBEGa0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233461',7.3,1678,'ko','바보','Seung-ryong owns a small toast shop, who is sick from taking in briquette gas in the past after his parents died. One day, his first love comes back to Korea, and they become close. However, he finds out that his little sister is sick.','/xxBPduPo0K8QCZY2rgxbpl2IFEN.jpg','2008-02-28',99,'Released',NULL,'BA:BO - Miracle of Giving Fool',18526,1.6316,6.714,'ir21a5IEQk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25500,_binary '\0','/uUqvPLW2hcKi3zIUoFA7CG61Az6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233474',7.1,2166,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第四章 伽藍の洞','June 1998: After spending two years in a coma caused by a traffic accident, Shiki Ryougi awakens with amnesia. She is visited by Touko Aozaki, a wizard and proprietor of a studio called Garan no Dou. Shiki has lost not only the memory of her accident, but also any real sense that she\'s even alive. Strangely, enigmatic beings begin to attack her...','/5jycWY9V9Chf8XlAwrjBSVWONTi.jpg','2008-05-24',45,'Released','\"Everything is full of happiness, but humans are so alone.\"','The Garden of Sinners: The Hollow Shrine',23154,1.8302,6.9,'Z8e0sce_PC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25501,_binary '\0','/wH2RtKsUjGc3ycRvxqOSbzov0av.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233487',5.9,3567,'es','No mires para abajo','A sexy Spanish siren named Elvira schools a young man in tantric lovemaking.','/s7igxMxtKQKHdnDxnSAJej7RTGp.jpg','2008-10-18',80,'Released','When sexual fantasies come true.','Don\'t Look Down',45722,91.431,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25502,_binary '\0','/3DrPK1WwqCcmd55gGKB8tyrJb0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233499',7.5,1242,'cn','天水圍的日與夜','Cheung, a single mother living in an area with high crime rates, works hard to provide for her son while helping out her elderly neighbor.','/11rB0GJxfafjWTp5RZfjqSDQ1KO.jpg','2008-07-17',91,'Released',NULL,'The Way We Are',56575,1.2551,7.1,'ZQpeYYRY1Qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25503,_binary '\0','/t4To8feUSysyBs4tlBAbXIrKlCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12335692',3.5,14624,'en','Last Man Down','After civilization succumbs to a deadly pandemic and his wife is murdered, a special forces soldier abandons his duty and becomes a hermit in the Nordic wilderness. Years later, a wounded woman appears on his doorstep. She\'s escaped from a lab and her pursuers believe her blood is the key to a worldwide cure. He\'s hesitant to get involved, but all doubts are cast aside when he discovers her pursuer is none other than Commander Stone, the man that murdered his wife some years ago.','/4B7liCxNCZIZGONmAMkCnxVlZQV.jpg','2021-03-30',87,'Released','They will pay.','Last Man Down',860623,4.6183,6.1,'Cs5AVa6-M6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25504,_binary '\0','/AcN9dpKF8Ec18z4VkFVoB4Igfr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1233576',6.7,2525,'is','Reykjavík Rotterdam','A former sailor who has served prison sentences for alcohol smuggling fights to keep his family afloat. He is offered pay for a last tour of cargo between Reykjavik and Rotterdam. He agrees, in the hope to get out of debt, but unexpected events occur.','/zDohZKlkQSJk6sNWI4CqFmgLVzf.jpg','2008-09-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Reykjavik-Rotterdam',63907,1.3726,6.3,'30CxmO-wKCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25505,_binary '\0','/hg5M9nWjOEiTDOQS67IIAtWamdh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12336480',7.5,1946,'en','Daughters','Four young girls prepare for a special Daddy Daughter Dance with their incarcerated fathers, as part of a unique fatherhood program in a Washington, D.C., jail.','/nPX9mJE3fe3WIRoLNQqJ0uhwUfU.jpg','2024-08-09',108,'Released',NULL,'Daughters',1214521,1.5851,7,'SMTgDRqfLPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25506,_binary '\0','/wSRjfYluAv22Mv3v4r7UYQMjwgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12338246',4.4,2858,'en','Death Count','Strangers awaken in individual holding cells with no memory of how they arrived. They realize if they don\'t acquire enough online \"likes\" in a timely manner, they\'ll die horribly at the hands of a sinister executioner.','/tOlEzzNllLd9Z5QwXXmhLdJVMuy.jpg','2022-07-19',82,'Released','Time Waits For No-one','Death Count',984142,1.2916,2.9,'udV3XnNjwdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25507,_binary '\0','/fBqXHXBbPjfWLNQqOLxGQD9dhRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234435',6.6,2248,'ru','Новая Земля','A story, which takes place in 2013, describes the world overflowing with \"dangerous\" criminals due to the official termination of death penalty. The UN \"blue helmets\" under the directive from the central authority (i.e., One World Government) decided to conduct a social \"experiment\" by forcibly dumping the outlaws on the deserted island...','/5YopFtvwt2hJ8h3pwbl3XzXX3iE.jpg','2008-08-08',119,'Released',NULL,'Terra Nova',30858,1.5096,5.8,'IEYHUocLoAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25508,_binary '\0','/dZ1Uk7mCn1CHmeDYnlYGo0P0b2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234541',5.5,21853,'en','The Butterfly Effect 3: Revelations','The story revolves around a man trying to uncover the mysterious death of his girlfriend and save an innocent man from the death chamber in the process, by using his unique power to time travel. However in attempting to do this, he also frees a spiteful serial-killer.','/7utgDyfae053YExAuUKcwkzUKMs.jpg','2009-01-09',90,'Released','Death repeats itself.','The Butterfly Effect 3: Revelations',16258,5.8519,5.5,'4aamMJ_8qZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25509,_binary '\0','/zmEfhW451c6M1k4TS7sJJHRdJxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234542',5.4,1331,'fr','Le Dernier Vol','Aviator Marie Vallières de Beaumont goes on a journey to find her lover Bill Lancaster after his plane disappears in the Sahara. After her plane is forced down in the Ténéré she meets Lieutenant Antoine Chauvet of the French Camel Corps who joins in the hunt for Lancaster. As the two endure hardships in the desert, they begin to develop feelings for each other.','/n9snMDPL6jKB4HZv4xwa535QQup.jpg','2009-11-05',98,'Released',NULL,'The Last Flight',37779,1.9369,5,'Yay3vuCVQzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25510,_binary '\0','/lAJpYAepH7bic2TmE7ZP8q404P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234548',6.2,142512,'en','The Men Who Stare at Goats','A reporter in Iraq might just have the story of a lifetime when he meets Lyn Cassady, a guy who claims to be a former member of the U.S. Army\'s New Earth Army, a unit that employs paranormal powers in their missions.','/5boJKypPQmgABssbKOk2RvsCnSv.jpg','2009-10-17',94,'Released','No goats. No glory.','The Men Who Stare at Goats',10313,7.4771,5.968,'2qmdTQxvSHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25511,_binary '\0','/fC0abSfZCJexnCNLtIoBVb1V4Wu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234554',5.5,1216,'de','Tannöd','Bavaria, Germany, 1950s. The sudden return of the young Kathrin to the small village where she was born stirs up the feelings of guilt and personal ghosts of its inhabitants, haunted by dark memories related to a multiple murder that happened two years earlier at the Tannöd farm, a hideous crime that remains unsolved.','/wxSxf9pniqCLBAtSXTC7LBlb7fy.jpg','2009-11-19',93,'Released',NULL,'The Murder Farm',23517,1.2495,5.1,'0CDiIcntjL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25512,_binary '\0','/51csyYHV1S4KTHRjvx6zbcKOwVv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234559',7.1,2165,'pt','Chico Xavier','A biography of spiritual medium and author Francisco Candido Xavier.','/yBrPBKHU69tKiic4UgF9Z4iO9P0.jpg','2010-04-02',124,'Released','The life of the greatest spirit medium that the world has ever seen.','Chico Xavier',41520,1.7327,7.119,'UFB9jF7s8dY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25513,_binary '\0','/yatLdOw4i5roDD2fgd5jtEx0gs7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234654',6.1,40440,'en','Greenberg','Roger Greenberg, a failed musician now making a living as a carpenter in New York, returns to Los Angeles to house-sit for his brother. He\'s stranded there—since he doesn\'t drive—until his brother\'s assistant, Florence, comes to his rescue. She\'s as much a lost soul as he is, and the pair form a significant connection—giving Roger a much-needed reason to be happy.','/jAsN4vPpycVxC89QlA6NYBXRuK7.jpg','2010-03-26',107,'Released','He\'s got a lot on his mind.','Greenberg',27583,3.7297,5.9,'cwdliqOGTLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25514,_binary '\0','/jFh87Hj9Yp8QQPYmcNBAZNaa4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234719',5.3,84389,'en','Red Dawn','A city in Washington state awakens to the surreal sight of foreign paratroopers dropping from the sky—shockingly, the U.S. has been invaded and their hometown is the initial target. Quickly and without warning, the citizens find themselves prisoners and their town under enemy occupation. Determined to fight back, a group of young patriots seek refuge in the surrounding woods, training and reorganizing themselves into a guerrilla group of fighters.','/pwOcFK1hFZ5NJybBGfvzU6UHCPg.jpg','2012-03-15',93,'Released','Welcome to the home of the brave.','Red Dawn',60747,11.204,5.742,'qtzL95vq3xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25515,_binary '\0','/xACuC5FwpCdayrcCsJPxYzrl8BO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1234721',6.1,250590,'en','RoboCop','In RoboCop, the year is 2028 and multinational conglomerate OmniCorp is at the center of robot technology. Overseas, their drones have been used by the military for years, but have been forbidden for law enforcement in America. Now OmniCorp wants to bring their controversial technology to the home front, and they see a golden opportunity to do it. When Alex Murphy – a loving husband, father and good cop doing his best to stem the tide of crime and corruption in Detroit – is critically injured, OmniCorp sees their chance to build a part-man, part-robot police officer. OmniCorp envisions a RoboCop in every city and even more billions for their shareholders, but they never counted on one thing: there is still a man inside the machine.','/gM5ql3BKYmHG3WtZ0buKXN7xY8O.jpg','2014-01-30',118,'Released','Crime has a new enemy.','RoboCop',97020,12.8919,5.9,'7PAOsS3HM78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25516,_binary '\0','/1eoCL8fPUZKlho03XVeNzZ3nlds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12349832',5.6,36227,'en','Cuckoo','After reluctantly moving to the German Alps with her father and his new family, Gretchen discovers that their new town hides sinister secrets, as she\'s plagued by strange noises and frightening visions of a woman pursuing her.','/4bGP5cnSZbfBJfIidZNSEIKnav7.jpg','2024-02-16',103,'Released','Fear its call.','Cuckoo',869291,4.6017,5.7,'NuON7HH0UkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25517,_binary '\0','/Agd5K40vwjYk9UYy5cvvYQyJXGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235075',6.8,3911,'hu','Valami Amerika 2','The three brothers, Akos, Tamas and Andras - known from the first part - try to get back their 60 million forints stolen by impostor Alex who ran away with the money and the girlfriend of the oldest brother.','/nZjYbpYS1WBlPitxgyrJk0dctXp.jpg','2008-12-18',110,'Released',NULL,'A Kind of America 2',17780,0.7369,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25518,_binary '\0','/ij9ai1FDd2ErfRJ8PJrAWakzVEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235124',6.2,71570,'en','Dorian Gray','Seduced into the decadent world of Lord Henry Wotton, handsome young aristocrat Dorian Gray becomes obsessed with maintaining his youthful appearance, and commissions a special portrait that will weather the winds of time while he remains forever young. When Gray\'s obsession spirals out of control, his desperate attempts to safeguard his secret turn his once-privileged life into a living hell.','/uRKt8nYdy7EO4uqeKVVpZRmqrxF.jpg','2009-09-09',112,'Released','Forever Young. Forever Cursed.','Dorian Gray',23488,6.82,6.043,'YVbdd8oOwOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25519,_binary '\0','/wHy1M9ZESEpIHxyobW0NfeXdbex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235142',6.6,2759,'en','Last Ride','A young boy travels across Australia with his father, who\'s wanted by the law.','/xjwqAsatWpCYbUJc6iS5sCov60X.jpg','2009-07-02',101,'Released','Are some bonds meant to be broken?','Last Ride',27480,2.2929,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25520,_binary '\0','/jEJDjDBT6KCoS4WOBq68vZMbFk2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235166',7.8,108324,'fr','Un prophète','Sentenced to six years in prison, Malik El Djebena is alone in the world and can neither read nor write. On his arrival at the prison, he seems younger and more brittle than the others detained there. At once he falls under the sway of a group of Corsicans who enforce their rule in the prison. As the \'missions\' go by, he toughens himself and wins the confidence of the Corsican group.','/x9Jb8kewBHPzjTtgCQvoQoDsy4d.jpg','2009-08-26',155,'Released','Escaping the prison of life.','A Prophet',21575,5.678,7.6,'l69ARbQt-Ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25521,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235170',6.1,9467,'en','The Future','When a couple decides to adopt a stray cat their perspective on life changes radically, literally altering the course of time and space and testing their faith in each other and themselves.','/gu9zd9rzYaQj2eU1IGeOqcpytoW.jpg','2011-07-29',91,'Released',NULL,'The Future',54662,2.7376,5.946,'X3ZfQ-b5J-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25522,_binary '\0','/2reDfi3bl3givTawULOVvjEF1rR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235187',6.6,6412,'en','Where Hands Touch','Germany, 1944. Leyna, the 15-year old daughter of a white German mother and a black African father, meets Lutz, a compassionate member of the Hitler Youth whose father is a prominent Nazi soldier, and they form an unlikely connection in this quickly changing world.','/omKzydOrom9kpdfQUE0G9Y9sPl0.jpg','2018-09-14',122,'Released',NULL,'Where Hands Touch',426618,4.0625,7.9,'lJezTw0t4gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25523,_binary '\0','/pcRb4kQ8AtmCyskyOZkOT6k0Bul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235189',6.7,43038,'en','Wild Target','Victor Maynard is a middle-aged, solitary assassin who lives to please his formidable mother, despite his own peerless reputation for lethal efficiency. His professional routine is interrupted when he finds himself drawn to one of his intended victims. After sparing her life, he unexpectedly acquires a young apprentice. Believing Victor to be a private detective, his two new companions tag along, while he attempts to thwart the murderous attentions of his unhappy client.','/ejKD5DQ7jouzEkz1fx5Fr8li2ZA.jpg','2010-06-17',98,'Released','They said \'Take her out\'. He got the wrong idea.','Wild Target',44147,5.4419,6.5,'PmS3ePcA6VU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25524,_binary '\0','/5Ll2ubw5iazB3p5kUnokmQo52EK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235200',5.9,1397,'en','Mercy','A young novelist tries to write about love, but realizes he will first need some real-life experience before taking on the subject.','/nSYJuCz2t09r2pAKXkPtmBXnCNu.jpg','2009-11-11',87,'Released',NULL,'Mercy',45020,1.5823,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25525,_binary '\0','/5df3793jyBeUQupx0uq1cA6lGF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235448',5.2,14310,'en','The Thaw','At a remote Arctic research station, four ecology students discover the real horror of global warming is not the melting ice, but what\'s frozen within it. A prehistoric parasite is released from the carcass of a Woolly Mammoth upon the unsuspecting students who are forced to quarantine and make necessary sacrifices, or risk infecting the rest of the world.','/6oxJ75L6rB88TeSspcnPA7JqjWw.jpg','2009-08-30',94,'Released','Extinction will find you.','The Thaw',23410,3.8359,5.674,'u94EM7RAkZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25526,_binary '\0','/lZ9OGovrjamAVz3n6TjJts2npxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235522',6.1,86343,'en','Broken City','In a broken city rife with injustice, ex-cop Billy Taggart seeks redemption and revenge after being double-crossed and then framed by its most powerful figure, the mayor. Billy\'s relentless pursuit of justice, matched only by his streetwise toughness, makes him an unstoppable force - and the mayor\'s worst nightmare.','/hqa5FwNZC55zqSpdeGFtBDqw55y.jpg','2013-01-18',109,'Released','Proof Can Be a Powerful Weapon.','Broken City',98357,8.1224,6,'oJWfM40Sklc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25527,_binary '\0','/bjcbXAvIbHxuH0Ypdvnxi1UiZMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235534',7.7,2288,'en','Louis Theroux: Behind Bars','For two weeks, Theroux visits the San Quentin State Prison.','/b5qaKmEC3QZYpJji1Tiam621UTy.jpg','2008-01-13',60,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Behind Bars',112722,1.0366,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25528,_binary '\0','/y1wd7YlAmYVnS45x2kK9ryydixM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235535',7.4,1640,'en','Louis Theroux: Gambling in Las Vegas','Louis heads to Las Vegas, to reveal the world behind the myths of casino culture. Among the people he meets are two of the casino\'s \'high-rollers\' and an employee who looks after them as well as a retired doctor who says she has gambled away $4million in seven years.','/iXAEQBRhgs78TJDTeRKTZSyudPw.jpg','2007-02-20',60,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Gambling in Las Vegas',210250,0.9949,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25529,_binary '\0','/V9ZfSj8nXGsRBKLYnAiAgpNTc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235536',4.7,4794,'fr','Lucky Luke','Fearless gunslinger, Lucky Luke, is ordered by the President to bring peace to Daisy Town.','/sO2jtEp8DGz9X9EOpXatpBMz4mX.jpg','2009-10-21',103,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Luke',35026,3.2825,4.5,'v9tII11QWZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25530,_binary '\0','/e3AwTLfByC96w1sTgtpbag9Jqwp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235548',6.6,3580,'pt','VIPs','Marcelo leaves his family and moves to Mato Grosso do Sul, where he learns how to fly airplanes by himself watching the pilots. One day, he responds the call of a drug dealer and uses his boss\' plane to help the man to transport his cargo. He is hired by the drug lord to work transporting drugs in his airplanes. When he is arrested by the Federal Police, he does not rat his gang and the leader of the cartel gives a large amount of money as a bonus and asks him to leave the gang since he is known by the police. Marcelo uses the money to promote a party in the Carnival of Recife pretending to be the son of the owner of the Gol (a Brazilian air flight company). He lures the high-society, including the television presenter Amaury Jr. Marcelo is arrested again and is sent to prison. During a rebellion, he uses his leadership to present the claims of the prisoners and help to control the situation.','/vVkXbIxrgRkXr0mir5iDVrCh657.jpg','2011-03-25',95,'Released',NULL,'VIPs',70666,1.8746,6.4,'ROOK2BBIwpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25531,_binary '\0','/gsD7WrMlOG45eKhLP9ENxp5A31M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235552',5.4,2519,'fr','À l\'aventure','Fed up with her present lifestyle, and more particularly sexually unsatisfied by her boyfriend Fred, Sandrine decides to find a new way in life. Intrigued by her friend Sophie, who tells her about her sexual experimentations, she will find, through various encounters, new pleasures and new experiences, whether physical or spiritual.','/aoRutQ7FRrxgDZ7iNW9aZeJirzF.jpg','2009-04-01',104,'Released',NULL,'À l\'aventure',64124,2.0342,4.9,'quALJIyHges','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25532,_binary '\0','/oqltxpnJapKwTVG7OnwtWosluM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235790',6.8,1787,'en','Magic Trip: Ken Kesey\'s Search for a Kool Place','A freewheeling portrait of Ken Kesey and the Merry Prankster’s fabled road trip across America in the legendary Magic Bus. In 1964, Ken Kesey, the famed author of “One Flew Over the Cuckoo’s Nest,” set off on a legendary, LSD-fuelled cross-country road trip to the New York World’s Fair. He was joined by “The Merry Band of Pranksters,” a renegade group of counterculture truth-seekers, including Neal Cassady, the American icon immortalized in Kerouac’s “On the Road,” and the driver and painter of the psychedelic Magic Bus.','/7CF9XGrtKq9PGGf58SP9ijJMjLM.jpg','2011-08-05',107,'Released','A drug-fuelled road trip in the 60s','Magic Trip: Ken Kesey\'s Search for a Kool Place',57211,0.5905,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25533,_binary '\0','/myYFabjrPz1Gbt3bB3GnEo6OlSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235796',6.8,23706,'en','Ondine','On the coast of Cork, Syracuse is a divorced fisherman who has stopped drinking. His precocious daughter Annie has failing kidneys. One day, he finds a nearly-drowned young woman in his net; she calls herself Ondine and wants no one to see her. He puts her up in an isolated cottage that was his mother\'s. Annie discovers Ondine\'s presence and believes she is a selkie, a seal that turns human while on land. Syracuse is afraid to hope again.','/rQSQisWjIjXnGGenrpjG1GlQcRf.jpg','2010-03-05',111,'Released','The truth is not what you know. It\'s what you believe.','Ondine',38448,3.2058,6.4,'rs8DiJaLhlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25534,_binary '\0','/ftKsKMicBLzwZaIAiFvX0mA6PbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235807',4.9,3778,'en','Stay Cool','A successful author is forced to confront an unrequited high school crush when he returns home to deliver a commencement address to graduating seniors. Shasta O\'Neil, a sexy high school senior flirts with the visiting author and invites him to the prom.','/8VDrfWam5pVH0vxE1nyLMVwYuIm.jpg','2011-09-16',94,'Released','Shoulda. Coulda. Woulda.','Stay Cool',11388,2.4665,4.8,'eo9nxcC8IJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25535,_binary '\0','/Aqp47Dbz8f1wnVU1qKvFFXQFROr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12358104',4.3,5834,'es','Dos','Two people, a man and a woman, wake up naked and with their abdomens attached to each other.','/5P7QwmoYl70tsRZ8e0VnI9RI1MF.jpg','2021-07-23',71,'Released',NULL,'Two',811072,2.5864,5.391,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25536,_binary '\0','/rNlT8SCVyDJinTQdMR2QU7eGaFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235827',6.3,1736,'es','Boogie, el Aceitoso','Hoping to make some money, Boogie, a violent and ruthless assassin, kidnaps a witness a mafia boss wants dead.','/7AkYQbzcr2q0ls8YKGaKSJktUrX.jpg','2009-10-22',85,'Released','Based on the work of the great Fontanarrosa.','Boogie',35837,1.4808,6.996,'SIjExs4VhEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25537,_binary '\0','/nHH8swSbK1NehS8yry3qNUg9pUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235830',7.2,10119,'es','Chico & Rita','Chico is a young piano player with big dreams. Rita is a beautiful singer with an extraordinary voice. Music and romantic desire unites them, but their journey - in the tradition of the Latin ballad, the bolero - brings heartache and torment.','/Kj9JAhMNSektw6RVYR1oJWGZWa.jpg','2010-11-19',93,'Released','Do you know this guy?','Chico & Rita',63498,3.0919,7.2,'pmgTLktAn8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25538,_binary '\0','/8RD8XoU4A20RujPtqejNQl8flPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235837',3.7,2252,'en','Happily N\'Ever After 2','Fairy tales collide when Mambo and Munk tip the scales of good and evil once again.','/qovxyp1QbwN179Ay65zQYDjNsuV.jpg','2009-03-24',75,'Released',NULL,'Happily N\'Ever After 2',16652,4.5114,4.9,'omxbDkvXhXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25539,_binary '\0','/yrRugvRSlou1IBxodPePd9T3vkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235841',7.5,17644,'es','Medianeras','Martin is a neurotic web designer taking baby steps out of the isolation of his one-room apartment and his virtual reality. Mariana is an artist fresh out of a long relationship. They are perfect for each other, live on the same street, in opposite buildings, but they never meet. Can the movement of a modern city of three million people bring them together?','/4LkufGzat0GMRDEr88w0oHQM2CD.jpg','2011-06-01',94,'Released','How do you find love when you don’t know where it is?','Sidewalls',76696,2.9207,7.5,'ntVyIw2n3jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25540,_binary '\0','/c55tuVYLWqfERpj1gKl0dZDGCsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1235842',5.8,2475,'es','El niño pez','A desperate love story between two young girls of extremely different social backgrounds who, unable to find a place for their love in the world they live in, are pushed to commit a crime.','/7BSSYgo7r9FZcKxSlGPSuikCZko.jpg','2009-04-09',96,'Released',NULL,'The Fish Child',26864,1.5397,5.7,'NJNHuW4rBvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25541,_binary '\0','/n9tgWao5nRVoseKcDnUGSDnWwPb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12359080',4,2882,'en','Zero Contact','Produced in 17 different countries entirely virtually during the 2020 global pandemic, the film follows five characters based all over the world, connected only by their devotion to the late founder and tech titan Finley Hart. Forced to work together to shut down Hart’s most secret invention, a machine that is either the solution to mankind’s problems or the end of the earth.','/r7HHBpntE8ygag10eiglEbkFDi.jpg','2022-05-27',96,'Released','The truth lies at the beginning.','Zero Contact',872170,2.859,4,'T5Vj9r3AfJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25542,_binary '\0','/yiyIRnUzvSpZIrxedabpiwHpl9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12359272',7.3,1426,'zh','親愛的房客','A boy lives with his Grandma and Mr. Lin, the tenant who looks after him and Grandma. But when Grandma passes away, the boy\'s uncle returns to Taiwan and discovers that ownership of the apartment was transferred to other people.','/cf1snn7PSimx4jTjvNF9HKJBhi9.jpg','2020-10-23',106,'Released','An unbreakable bond.','Dear Tenant',721482,1.4556,7,'sx6FGb-NQ7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25543,_binary '\0','/2C6yyoCStz7jcwjINdJTF5zAbi4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12361178',8.4,45944,'ml','ദൃശ്യം 2','Seven years after the events of the first film, the family lives with the trauma from that fateful night. A gripping tale of an investigation and a family threatened by it. Will Georgekutty be able to protect his family this time?','/8RJBCUGE27LX06tAES4jTELN0KA.jpg','2021-02-19',153,'Released','The Resumption','Drishyam 2',706872,1.5817,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25544,_binary '\0','/9WoLTsRgrupkvCgs3bhsl2EjLhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12361974',7.9,480131,'en','Zack Snyder\'s Justice League','Determined to ensure Superman\'s ultimate sacrifice was not in vain, Bruce Wayne aligns forces with Diana Prince with plans to recruit a team of metahumans to protect the world from an approaching threat of catastrophic proportions.','/tnAuB8q5vv7Ax9UAEje5Xi4BXik.jpg','2021-03-18',242,'Released','Us united.','Zack Snyder\'s Justice League',791373,25.4933,8.1,'ZrdQSAX2kyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25545,_binary '\0','/nOQ476lfPPpz0bvTsDbAmTH1JAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12363162',6.4,1273,'zh','我和我的家乡','In different parts of rural China, various people explore what makes their communities unique.','/4qfw1tUGd9xwYMmfQ9oMR1xe1Uf.jpg','2020-10-01',153,'Released',NULL,'My People, My Homeland',734778,1.6832,6.2,'ev2sCnsYv9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25546,_binary '\0','/euLNfQFJ6SPP2vEmAynN7dFOPXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1236370',6.1,2163,'cn','狼牙','An assassin who is fresh from his latest kill becomes stranded in an island, when he inadvertently befriends a female police officer. As the night progresses, the unspoken truth honored by the two sides of the law is broken. After the remains of a body that belonged to a drug lord and syndicate crime leader are found, chaos ensues and criminals ravage the once peaceful streets in a race against time to find the mysterious murderer that\'s loose and out for blood.','/erSXACAv01EnWdCwaThOcFxYJGj.jpg','2008-12-05',89,'Released','Every Move Kills.','Legendary Assassin',26010,2.9567,6.441,'6byXGg7iHu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25547,_binary '\0','/cOgCWwLTggdHvPOY5v6Qga9U47J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1236397',6.3,4360,'pt','A Mulher Invisível','A man is abandoned by his wife and then falls in love with his neighbor, the perfect, ideal woman. The only problem: she doesn\'t exist!','/kcmKSsjIJFHgvOmP0bkst8odCHX.jpg','2009-06-05',106,'Released',NULL,'The Invisible Woman',30127,2.224,6.103,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25548,_binary '\0','/uYiKSrGpx15avBLriS5rWXq7OK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1236471',5.8,2945,'en','Darfur','American journalists in Sudan are confronted with the dilemma of whether to return home to report on the atrocities they have seen, or to stay behind and help some of the victims they have encountered.','/mkM5DKevVQmWRXnuY2o42nZEa5T.jpg','2009-11-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Attack on Darfur',46217,2.8023,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25549,_binary '\0','/gP4XEzA1qIYM2pIMPkjNhBq1K4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1236472',7.8,8956,'en','Lemmy','Over four decades, Motorhead frontman Lemmy Kilmister has registered an immeasurable impact on music history. Nearly 65, he remains the living embodiment of the rock and roll lifestyle, and this feature-length documentary tells his story, one of a hard-living rock icon who continues to enjoy the life of a man half his age.','/xj6YpG93RjzryMdue93rcbUHK4r.jpg','2010-03-15',116,'Released','49% Motherf**ker, 51% Son of a Bitch','Lemmy',53344,1.7946,7.6,'dRENbQIuoLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25550,_binary '\0','/vqVBrVobLfvs86qmZDXxYomgocT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1236484',5.2,3078,'en','Stoic','A heated game of poker causes three men incarcerated for nonviolent offenses to brutalize their cellmate before taking drastic measures in order to cover up their crime.','/d2G7eOduq6KvmcxgYxGx1on1uQb.jpg','2009-06-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Stoic',24757,1.2187,5.1,'iIEnL0Nj3xE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25551,_binary '\0','/7DrLrDf3vVVjgOGRUf37knUu7Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12374656',6.8,10555,'en','Emily','The imagined life of one of the world’s most famous authors, Emily Brontë, as she finds her voice and writes the literary classic Wuthering Heights. Explore the relationships that inspired her – her raw, passionate sisterhood with Charlotte and Anne; her first aching, forbidden love for Weightman and her care for her maverick brother whom she idolises.','/tgVBMIiJczfBWINRRd9yxE8ESln.jpg','2022-10-14',130,'Released','The imagination behind Wuthering Heights.','Emily',707103,3.9263,6.9,'lCa5rx_8WCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25552,_binary '\0','/j0Vk3K98HVsMq7b4NafV4s9wxB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1237838',6.6,10161,'en','Mystery Team','A group of former Encyclopedia Brown-style child-detectives struggle to solve an adult mystery.','/AbqRb1hlCb8jPVqFXL5hwrj8hQO.jpg','2009-08-28',98,'Released','No case too hard. No case too tough.','Mystery Team',38087,3.0743,6.1,'m1CM1xwpoW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25553,_binary '\0','/aIQXuLOVFQwtXEgYwTIAF2pcBge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12380422',5.9,2150,'en','The Subtle Art of Not Giving a #@%!','Mark Manson cuts through the crap to offer his not-giving-a-f*ck philosophy: a dose of raw, refreshing honesty that shows us how to live more contented, grounded lives.','/cdd3fTUY4oNtOaTfR58jt8Bcn1E.jpg','2023-01-04',97,'Released','A counterintuitive approach to living a good life.','The Subtle Art of Not Giving a #@%!',1032696,2.2359,6.1,'3gU1yoYiCEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25554,_binary '\0','/oW7xP4yoatCrAbBv5mCDGhrjhCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1238291',6.5,13627,'en','Five Minutes of Heaven','The story of former Ulster Volunteer Force member Alistair Little. Twenty-five years after Little killed Joe Griffin\'s brother, the media arrange an auspicious meeting between the two.','/5TVniqOcXh3nKHVyVys1nUjgrgO.jpg','2009-01-19',89,'Released','To face the future, they must face the past.','Five Minutes of Heaven',16759,3.5424,6.1,'uZOE7HgvI3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25555,_binary '\0','/3JMugahZuvhVS6qASKGxXaTVC3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1238304',5.4,3249,'en','Table for Three','A suddenly single guy invites what he thinks is a perfect couple to move into his apartment, only to discover they quickly insert themselves into all aspects of his life.','/dUEEgmdNMkPIAU3vS40sT9w7OdV.jpg','2009-06-23',93,'Released','Never trust a perfect couple.','Table for Three',19238,2.1466,4.662,'MAgtyoparUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25556,_binary '\0','/9CyFLGfeDOrOOPouHp446T5MSNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12383460',5.4,22771,'en','Hypnotic','A young woman seeking self-improvement enlists the help of a renowned hypnotist but, after a handful of intense sessions, discovers unexpected and deadly consequences.','/miEj4kNc4efZ5WbPJqWl1UXWrvS.jpg','2021-10-27',89,'Released','His wish is her command.','Hypnotic',864873,3.3618,6,'eHsWYmnXk1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25557,_binary '\0','/fjgKMNFo6uj7znrWwTbLzNBVzIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12390572',5.1,5055,'en','The Twin','Every parent\'s worst nightmare is just the beginning for Rachel\'s ordeal as in the aftermath of a tragic accident, she and her husband Anthony decide to move to the other side of the world to focus on their surviving twin son Elliot. What begins as a time of healing and isolation in the Finnish countryside turns into a desperate battle for the very soul of their son as an entity claiming to be his dead twin brother takes over Elliot — setting Rachel on a diabolical journey to unravel the horrible truth about her twin son.','/uUUSkKQEptTHjYejxzaT5TVkiAG.jpg','2022-04-06',109,'Released','Evil only a mother could love.','The Twin',477462,3.7709,5.8,'OIyU2i_xAMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25558,_binary '\0','/1yD7scPEKxKugzgn8Ydcua2odza.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1239276',7,2172,'hi','Rang Rasiya','A look a the life of 19th century Indian painter Raja Ravi Varma.','/e2ypUUowSJvGjoHAfJXtuFpvTmq.jpg','2014-11-07',132,'Released','Story about a person who gives faces to our God and Godess.','Rang Rasiya',302431,1.5777,6.135,'_TC8o690ns0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25559,_binary '\0','/rfxj5AoOuvbqi0019TVZLy6gyCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12393526',6.6,16913,'hi','बुलबुल','A child bride grows up to be an enigmatic woman presiding over her household, harboring a painful past as supernatural murders of men plague her village.','/4XYEqHqvcf6vxFhNyeKZz5xbUfV.jpg','2020-06-24',94,'Released','A fairy tale like no other','Bulbbul',714338,2.0871,6.6,'4MGReT9-cAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25560,_binary '\0','/zAsNb9VGNsO0vX44yA8Ud2feyqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1239401',6.1,1603,'el','Βank Bang','Two brothers, the honest Michalis and the swindler Nontas, are forced to resort to bank robberies in order to pay off the latter\'s entanglements with the mafia. Michalis\' love for a secret police officer, a strange couple of her colleagues and Nontas\' greed will make things even more complicated.','/n8WJxKmQNeBtdpwbdy2NCjNej1u.jpg','2008-12-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Βank Bang',47442,0.8649,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25561,_binary '\0','/ix3jEwl1OJFzWWdxtkLwZ5cH7pI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1239426',7,5742,'ru','Стиляги','In this hit Russian musical, a group of friends flaunts Soviet authority in 1950s Moscow by embracing jazz. When Communist Mels falls for Polly, a free-spirited jazz fan, he risks losing his party membership by associating with her rebellious crew.','/ongsJQScENi8QPrt8hXIjh0PKR.jpg','2008-12-25',130,'Released','Moscow 1955. Hot Jazz Meets Cold War.','Hipsters',38336,1.6747,6.538,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25562,_binary '\0','/rtJLgTCah95waJMm0CUckiRWzWb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1239446',6.8,2436,'nl','De Laatste Dagen Van Emma Blank','In a large country home, the owner Emma Blank is very ill and is cared for by her household staff: Haneveld the head housekeeper, Bella the cook, Gonnie the maid and Meier the man-servant. Despite her desperate need for loving care, Emma is a steely, avaricious dictator whose demands become ever more absurd, to the extent that her staff are driven to madness. That is, until the day they discover that they stand to inherit nothing whereupon they drop their charade of caring and concern and instead plot their revenge...','/uSuiA2UpxySDupnFW4TqJD5BJI4.jpg','2009-05-07',89,'Released',NULL,'The Last Days of Emma Blank',42346,1.6369,6.1,'LIQ2rc60_GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25563,_binary '\0','/Ak50LksxlxmXnaFt8C7TlQj7RQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1239462',3.1,1263,'fr','La véritable histoire du Chat Botté','Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.','/va4tC2RBC0uwpmq0cctruJmZgFs.jpg','2009-04-01',82,'Released',NULL,'The True Story of Puss \'n Boots',25353,2.5309,4.8,'zen6Pt4WYNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25564,_binary '\0','/2hiODkNnTrJ8vipY15YuFGQnIMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12396992',7.1,1374,'zh','無聲','Hearing-impaired teenager Chang Cheng transfers to a school for children with special needs. However, the world of the hearing-impaired doesn’t seem quiet at all. When Chang witnesses the game taking place in the last row on the school bus, his excitement about blending into a new environment immediately turns into fear.','/mzdEAxwkTCXBG1EKOblIkemQ6l8.jpg','2020-10-15',104,'Released',NULL,'The Silent Forest',717395,2.6357,7.7,'kdbczzlIvdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25565,_binary '\0','/5eyduSReSrheNIMshrUmBji1i76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12397078',7.2,3009,'zh','孤味','A story about a karaoke-addicted old woman struggling with her self-worth and a sense of betrayal at her long-lost husband\'s funeral where she encounters his younger and more sophisticated girlfriend while she finds out her kids might have been secretly in touch with her late husband all these years.','/e0ckGIEN2ZTzQa4foHWWGCHa4Yd.jpg','2020-11-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Little Big Women',739269,1.7027,7.1,'TPxtIK7bug0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25566,_binary '\0','/ciIx6jRtGkZnPue195dSJM4zUrw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12399056',4.8,1962,'en','Bloodthirsty','When indie singer Grey struggles to write her sophomore album, she teams up with a mysterious producer at his secluded cabin. Though their bond strengthens her music, it also starts to irreparably alter Grey’s body and mind.','/49a2fQEFO2R190Ng5ksJedRJun6.jpg','2021-04-23',82,'Released','Ambition can be killer.','Bloodthirsty',741636,2.08,4.9,'WVvxIpudj00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25567,_binary '\0','/aRTiGPgzE1S2F8IercFUmR19kxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12404266',6.8,4685,'en','The Last Rifleman','A WWII veteran escapes his care home in Northern Ireland and embarks on an arduous but inspirational journey to France to attend the 75th anniversary of the D-Day landings, finding the courage to face the ghosts of his past.','/co1GhkWdgt2J0LRTEJjHntkMrj3.jpg','2023-12-07',100,'Released','Meet Private Artie Crawford. He’s 92¾ and he’s just gone AWOL.','The Last Rifleman',763144,4.7566,6.6,'upuLjGMvyrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25568,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12406160',4.4,2974,'en','The Last Regret','Sam is a young woman whose father died when she was a teenager, overcoming that tragedy, she gets her happily ever after with the man she loves until it all falls apart. Now she is back in her hometown, rebuilding her life.','/eXsGaK5kxTn2HUgvqYtcKZeZno4.jpg',NULL,90,'Released',NULL,'The Last Regret',1675789,0.4862,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25569,_binary '\0','/1Fjrl1o7CJBETQoXc1cYmrZ8iqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12408808',6,4253,'en','Clairevoyant','Spoiled rich girl, Claire Rivers, hires a camera crew to document her journey as she attempts to shed her ego and attain enlightenment.','/k81d47GVVzThJtbIXHiWycYoiDW.jpg','2021-06-22',88,'Released','Holistically funny','Clairevoyant',843712,1.42,5.4,'7BPUDbYu8BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25570,_binary '\0','/7P7aZ9ozRWlsruPVaTB2dLXI7aF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1240982',5.5,108387,'en','Your Highness','A fantasy movie about an arrogant, lazy prince and his more heroic brother who must complete a quest in order to save their father\'s kingdom.','/zw1tEKhR1ncGGtuYkkf30GYlvYQ.jpg','2011-04-08',102,'Released','Get your quest on.','Your Highness',38319,6.4492,5.3,'1nB2pWEW9yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25571,_binary '\0','/qp34uuljSczYq3qoC9epulqT1j0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1241017',4.1,3213,'en','How to Make Love to a Woman','When Andy hears his girlfriend Lauren sigh after sex, he panics. But even with the help of his friends, porn stars and tantric experts, he continues to stumble in the bedroom, finally realizing that in order to give Lauren the \'O\' word, he first needs to say the \'L\' word. Starring Josh Meyers, Krysten Ritter, Ian Somerhalder, Jenna Jameson and Ken Jeong.','/A3LppVfwslUokTyETpclKwGAXSM.jpg','2010-07-13',91,'Released','A comedy of miscommunication between the sheets.','How to Make Love to a Woman',40722,2.5633,4.4,'qC4gPYIMyhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25572,_binary '\0','/atzNUWxoXfUg320Rf48W0Ol5Rav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1241195',7.6,12007,'hi','Aamir','A doctor of Indian origin returning to Mumbai from London is forced to participate in a terrorist plot.','/jqEe6evAE8WpCIkJiNLaRkP7eXj.jpg','2008-06-06',99,'Released','Who Says That Man Scripts His Own Destiny By Himself?','Aamir',13123,1.0873,6.7,'vHgYGTvMpBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25573,_binary '\0','/sHgzLcGV1SLTxXZxy5JWM6A3nTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12412166',5.2,3695,'es','Veneciafrenia','When a group of young Spanish tourists travel to Venice for a bachelorette party, they are met by angry locals who are not keen on foreigners and soon they find themselves fighting for their lives.','/90ZsEVSiZZABzO8bh1OcqguomIn.jpg','2022-04-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Veneciafrenia',756681,3.0175,6,'_MVMEIh-7ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25574,_binary '\0','/xuLA0pii2IMJW2puT7EvJtgpg0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt124