my of giants','/6gs0642LLTa5Nl6vUR06ZQ3stTu.jpg','2011-10-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Legends of Valhalla: Thor',106631,2.5157,5.4,'mqkqao2m6xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25583,_binary '\0','/jNcf5p8y7CieOu9uHYzTVm1Qgtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12422308',5.6,11995,'te','సర్కారు వారి పాట​','After being conned by the woman he loves, a finance agent arrives in India from the USA to retrieve his money from her father, a powerful MP and industrialist.','/jFwdKKDmgzKjZGFnSJma7I5XMpk.jpg','2022-05-11',162,'Released',NULL,'Sarkaru Vaari Paata',784696,1.4812,5.033,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25584,_binary '\0','/y831uA4mYpByjC31P1g9C5W6sED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12423052',4.9,1691,'en','Namaste Wahala','A Nigerian woman and an Indian man won\'t let cultural differences get in the way of their romance.','/rx3p97KAUDaz7PXt9xwlEWn8CZd.jpg','2020-12-01',106,'Released',NULL,'Namaste Wahala',796649,1.5598,6.9,'wJzCtDD-FDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25585,_binary '\0','/rhfhCRt5R71ujjRjuwuTzODKUya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242422',7.6,74448,'es','Celda 211','The story of two men on different sides of a prison riot -- the inmate leading the rebellion and the young guard trapped in the revolt, who poses as a prisoner in a desperate attempt to survive the ordeal.','/koap5B3bQHQi3yaZ39vpWR66TGP.jpg','2009-11-06',108,'Released','To survive inside, he has to become one of them.','Cell 211',33273,4.1671,7.44,'Et37NAjAG7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25586,_binary '\0','/zMUJQLvqNPUr0ym0md9223sOnQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242423',6.3,1342,'en','Dear Lemon Lima','After being dumped by Philip, her one true love, the infatuated Nessa enrolls at his private school in the hopes of winning him back.','/vuwv0uJxpYiolFbwoOACgXCEV2X.jpg','2009-10-23',87,'Released',NULL,'Dear Lemon Lima',71394,1.5564,5.6,'ENJoUsm1xsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25587,_binary '\0','/f4QIQvecRkKD5t7aPclyIr3SEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242432',6.2,104508,'en','I Spit on Your Grave','A beautiful woman from the city, Jennifer Hills, rents an isolated cabin in the country to write her latest novel. Soon, a group of local lowlifes subject her to a nightmare of degradation, rape, and violence.','/sD5mBllYcBR5sQTyR2VGYhpHf6B.jpg','2010-06-17',108,'Released','The revenge of Jennifer Hills.','I Spit on Your Grave',43947,14.5303,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25588,_binary '\0','/sUhsqltHTgcKQ5z8dx61ECbCfJW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242447',6.5,15087,'en','Nativity!','Paul, charged with directing his school\'s Nativity play, falsely boasts that his ex-girlfriend plans to turn the production into a film.','/2APY35DdgOmQIJlVpnjI7Kanjyb.jpg','2009-11-27',106,'Released','This show needs a miracle.','Nativity!',49522,2.7534,6.315,'d_lLpFYdKj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25589,_binary '\0','/zz9t3xKXXrUggesevkO2YjFo86j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242457',5.7,3757,'ru','Тарас Бульб','Set in the 16th century, this is a story about Ukraine\'s Cossack warriors and their campaign to defend their lands from the advancing Polish armies.','/UZRCyTlgOBPT4jxiIaJb3c1YZF.jpg','2009-04-02',131,'Released',NULL,'Iron & Blood: The Legend of Taras Bulba',17935,2.346,5.1,'fkOHSmDFDFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25590,_binary '\0','/k7lwdrpZ92BDahx6TLdkPE65cpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242460',7.4,183581,'en','We Need to Talk About Kevin','After her son Kevin commits a horrific act, troubled mother Eva reflects on her complicated relationship with her disturbed son as he grew from a toddler into a teenager.','/AtdYbs1SqYwFOLyi2v6ldVTawbn.jpg','2011-09-28',113,'Released','This conversation is long overdue.','We Need to Talk About Kevin',71859,9.6624,7.5,'M7UD_WThLME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25591,_binary '\0','/gEem8qmrk754Q2kdRmSbCmxyCyd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242516',4.4,1508,'en','Barbarossa','Year 1100. Italy.The Northern lands are ruled by a German emperor: Fredrick aka \"Barbarossa. His dream is to conquer also the lands in the Center and in the South so as to revive the Empire that was once of the one Charles Magno.But in the North a young man from Milan has formed an army of 900 young men coming from different cities: the \"company of death\". This young man\'s name is Alberto Da Giussano. His dream is to defeat the Emperor and to give back freedom to the Northern lands.','/haxJ5T4Id5ztqdrGoZFEA1MSekO.jpg','2009-10-09',139,'Released',NULL,'Barbarossa',45559,2.0713,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25592,_binary '\0','/sXOiYtFLGSs0YW4rh2GdyuBNH2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242521',6.9,3032,'fr','L\'ordre et la morale','April 1988, Ouvéa Island, New Caledonia. 30 gendarmes are taken hostage by a group of Kanak freedom fighters. 300 soldiers are sent from France to re-establish order. 2 men confront each other: Philippe Legorjus, chief of the terrorist squad, and Alphonse Dianou, head of the kidnappers. Through their shared values, they will attempt to make discussion triumph. But, in the middle of a presidential election, when the stakes are political, order isn\'t always dictated by morality. A violent and troubling epic that marks the return of Mathieu Kassovitz in front and behind the camera.','/5HF02jsytCLnQxGKYbJoznJcKPT.jpg','2011-11-16',136,'Released',NULL,'Rebellion',76609,2.0146,6.7,'wImzK1ADH38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25593,_binary '\0','/7e3BDKLVHDTxS2DKvDPssd9IlFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242522',7.1,1700,'fr','Oscar et la dame rose','Listening in to a conversation between his doctor and parents, 10-year-old Oscar learns what nobody has the courage to tell him. He only has a few weeks to live. Furious, he refuses to speak to anyone except straight-talking Rose, the lady in pink he meets on the hospital stairs. As Christmas approaches, Rose uses her fantastical experiences as a professional wrestler, her imagination, wit and charm to allow Oscar to live life and love to the full, in the company of his friends Pop Corn, Einstein, Bacon and childhood sweetheart Peggy Blue. Written by American Film Market','/xjBERQq2t1MKhlDnKuob8OTnHsI.jpg','2009-11-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Oscar and the Lady in Pink',51880,2.3832,6.5,'i-dyWR7A70s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25594,_binary '\0','/As1ZejbL3QcFvRnMpaVI7Uh5FfJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242527',5.9,2016,'da','Ved verdens ende','An english tv-team discovers a special white flower in the indonesian rainforest, but they never get to investegate it further, before the danish recluse Severin has shot them down. A danish special enforcement with a psychiatrist in front is sent off, and they find out, that Severin claims, that he is 129 years old, and it\'s the flower, which keeps him young. Soon all hunts the white flower, which apparently gives eternal life.','/d7A9uSwsqZHQJdPmrgRQcmuTrep.jpg','2009-10-09',99,'Released',NULL,'At World\'s End',19306,1.9381,5.484,'ETrtPN6qSK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25595,_binary '\0','/tIPDFuGpOVFpGepIwf6KOM6MQz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242530',4.8,2980,'hi','What\'s Your Raashee?','What\'s Your Raashee? Yogesh Patel, a young man in a hurry. Yogesh must find his dream girl within 10 days to save his family from utter ruin. Finding the dream girl is tough enough. Finding her in a hurry is even tougher.','/ksSz2bRSpksZ0aRupQ1cINb7ibC.jpg','2009-09-25',192,'Released',NULL,'What\'s Your Raashee?',24864,1.9588,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25596,_binary '\0','/icoVNPIItqVohOdDspsG5hVWWBD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242543',7.1,1397,'de','Dschungelkind','A family of a German linguist lives with an indigenous tribe in Papua New Guinea.','/1attOCQq326foyqVl9zOrZ0MkzH.jpg','2011-02-16',131,'Released',NULL,'Jungle Child',54517,1.195,7.057,'9wVmLWCQveg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25597,_binary '\0','/zVr1ftXM5SsDex3S7LJSH7zVQBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242545',7.1,18768,'en','Looking for Eric','Middle-aged postman and football fan Eric Bishop struggles with his increasingly chaotic existence, but receives some life coaching from the famously philosophical Éric Cantona.','/fTHUY0E1FYMFKiQ8UDKx793LtW0.jpg','2009-05-27',116,'Released','To win back the love of his life, Eric\'s going to need a little training.','Looking for Eric',18898,3.307,6.5,'j852L4afUJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25598,_binary '\0','/AcLGQQjkAGCc08EIPwsyqLooCgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242599',6.3,8277,'en','Bellflower','Two friends spend all their free time building flame-throwers and weapons of mass destruction in hopes that a global apocalypse will occur and clear the runway for their imaginary gang \"Mother Medusa\".','/4bGB2k4JngWLVABKIw1S7cnlh5h.jpg','2011-04-16',106,'Released','A love story with apocalyptic stakes.','Bellflower',58699,1.2217,5.88,'IY3FRWcK_LI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25599,_binary '\0','/yuDpWB983LgLk42Eba9QSZwKOtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242618',4.6,6195,'en','Deadline','A screenwriter travels to an abandoned house to finish a script on time, but a series of strange events lead her to a psychological breakdown.','/2gwL5G32dif9ITRFu60x9psEoxn.jpg','2009-10-05',89,'Released','Focus your fear','Deadline',25073,1.781,5,'1WzQH9jO_1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25600,_binary '\0','/Hl5hQoZxU8Tz39HyQAJ9MW8yRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242642',5.4,2409,'en','Judas Kiss','A quirk in time and space gives a failed filmmaker the chance to reshape his destiny when he visits his peculiar alma mater.','/7AI0hUYnzGXOsFcMiULJAaUKo94.jpg','2011-04-01',94,'Released','If you had a second chance, would you grab it?','Judas Kiss',71208,2.688,5.4,'cb2l5_bLHlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25601,_binary '\0','/7NTGZTzqWHgBJeoNaWsAxvHtRy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12427158',6.9,9405,'en','A Thousand and One','Struggling but unapologetically living on her own terms, Inez is moving from shelter to shelter in mid-1990s New York City. With her 6-year-old son Terry in foster care and unable to leave him again, she kidnaps him so they can build their life together. As the years go by, their family grows and Terry becomes a smart yet quiet teenager, but the secret that has defined their lives threatens to destroy the home they have so improbably built.','/yW97MlBddOeiw17zUSf2iWvOmkr.jpg','2023-03-31',116,'Released','Times change. Love stays the same.','A Thousand and One',855263,4.7235,6.599,'wBM0_6JJw1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25602,_binary '\0','/vOtyASZTONSu9TibRRTNGHPfgFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242744',5.4,2098,'es','La herencia Valdemar','Luisa Llorente, an expert on taxation of old buildings, had recently gone to the Victorian mansion Valdemar to conduct an inventory of property ownership. After she mysteriously disappeared, Maximilian, president of her company, engaged the services of a private detective to help find her. But soon they will discover that it is not the first disappearance at Valdemar mansion!','/tYTe2HRLBWgHpgNfEoRASxee60C.jpg','2010-01-22',104,'Released','Some houses have their own legend, their own tragedy...','The Valdemar Legacy',28396,1.4639,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25603,_binary '\0','/AdtdnOREtG989WcjCsQOL0Jrd9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242782',4.9,3435,'hi','लक','Born lucky, Karim Moussa takes to exploiting it instead of focusing on studies. Now a wealthy gambler, he decides to recruit about a dozen lucky people to participate in a deadly game of survival.','/mNiO9E1KQ7GH3I0yHUDdyXaByP7.jpg','2009-07-24',130,'Released',NULL,'Luck',20290,1.4012,4.734,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25604,_binary '\0','/4FqplLyn1mxc2sDkeulBCNhnMiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1242881',5.3,2200,'pl','Wojna polsko-ruska','An aggressive thug has problems with his girlfriend. Over the course of several chaotic days he walks around the hood, takes drugs and confronts himself with other women.','/crexBWmgSnwHIIVomVMoF9PiY27.jpg','2009-04-21',108,'Released',NULL,'Snow White and Russian Red',36415,1.1581,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25605,_binary '\0','/kN6Yvil5A8P1hYfQwH3AayA4sw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1243375',6.1,1517,'es','El baile de la victoria','Present day. Chile. Legendary bank robber Vergara Grey is getting out of prison after 5 long years and is looking forward to a quiet, uneventful life together with his wife and son whom oddly he hasn\'t heard from in years. But soon his resolve is tested when he meets 19 year old Angel a young thief who insists the two join up to score the biggest heist of all time. Though tempted, he resists until he finds out that his beloved wife has gone off with a millionaire and his son wants to change his last name. Then Victoria, a graceful and mysteriously mute dancer living in a conservatory, steps into the picture. She captivates Vergara and Angel, as well as all others that cross her path, drastically changing their lives.','/vlPNrTEsaIGnzBpfRM2YLQ7SJzo.jpg','2009-11-27',127,'Released',NULL,'The Dancer and the Thief',35411,1.7054,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25606,_binary '\0','/pox3bMVshOQw9cGp0K2jRnoJufT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12439248',7.2,1962,'ja','映画大好きポンポさん','Operating out of the movie capital \"Nyallywood,\" Pompo has been shooting one B-grade entertainment flick after another that anyone would enjoy. One day, Pompo\'s \"movie buff\" assistant Gene spots a new script written by Pompo and is moved by its exquisite story. In a fit of passion, he proclaims, \"I want to see this as a finished work in theaters as soon as possible!\" However, Pompo tells him, \"So you shoot this film.\" Thus, Gene takes on his first directing gig. Meanwhile, Natalie, an ordinary girl who just arrived in town with movie actress dreams, has been discovered by Pompo...','/tGcPqDLE2LkSKrTmFWvvtRongHb.jpg','2021-06-04',94,'Released','Bright lights. Big dreams. No experience.','Pompo the Cinephile',678458,3.396,7.2,'kG2Z3otv8-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25607,_binary '\0','/gZOi0h57OoM5QfZqcqhJhHXuh8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1243955',5,4446,'en','The Shortcut','When Derek moves to a new town and discovers a shortcut through the woods to his high school, he learns about a crazy old man who lives near its path: Legend has it that he abducted a group of teenagers years ago. Ignoring the warning, Derek and his friends set out to uncover the dark secret that\'s buried deep in the woods. But will they survive to tell it?','/wAW0WNevBmmyaN8m1QkQkWyZGW7.jpg','2009-02-07',100,'Released','Some urban legends are real.','The Shortcut',22175,2.6959,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25608,_binary '\0','/kxslqKKfx89vxU7Mq296f8bBOmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1243957',6,270310,'en','The Tourist','American tourist Frank meets mysterious British woman Elise on the train to Venice. Romance seems to bud, but there\'s more to her than meets the eye.','/vVmek9VTnsfpQTIFWtL9h4HhOIP.jpg','2010-12-08',103,'Released','It all started when he met a woman.','The Tourist',37710,13.0569,6.189,'HgNiFN_gttA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25609,_binary '\0','/rxUtDYZURJPyFfiAG61DidXu11I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1243974',5.4,78582,'en','Aloha','A celebrated military contractor returns to the site of his greatest career triumphs and re-connects with a long-ago love while unexpectedly falling for the hard-charging Air Force watchdog assigned to him.','/58Y4CjcRX8AtMNtI0AXu9H7iebP.jpg','2015-05-29',105,'Released','Sometimes you have to say goodbye before you can say hello.','Aloha',222936,6.24,5.5,'hZGP4AR46Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25610,_binary '\0','/iiiuiYp8kHCvltv3NClIFnsGi01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12440140',6.8,1306,'ja','あのこは貴族','Hanako is looking for stability with her man. She gets dumped instead. She begins dating. Miki studied and worked hard to get to where she is and is holding down a job. They are introduced through an intermediary man.','/nZ5XppGKvHcVPm7iZe1n1e5ftkL.jpg','2021-02-26',124,'Released','Different worlds under the same sky.','Aristocrats',718498,1.8831,6.9,'biSKKKnNIs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25611,_binary '\0','/iWpsVDT36YxGxxf23DUEwiHSBe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244093',2.9,2028,'hi','Hisss','After being diagnosed with brain cancer, a desperate American man kidnaps the reptilian lover of the snake goddess in hopes of gaining immortality.','/iSCkImhJUgyagR7FxXxasXnNsDv.jpg','2010-10-22',98,'Released','She\'s sexy... venomous... and she\'ll swallow you whole...','Hisss',47655,1.3736,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25612,_binary '\0','/qMxpGzmmnY1jLd4p7EhhoW43wWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12441478',4.7,7174,'ja','アーヤと魔女','A headstrong orphan discovers a world of spells and potions while living with a selfish witch.','/9oK820JieICOcfUhI6mkpFrcA9m.jpg','2021-02-03',83,'Released','Enter a world of magic and music','Earwig and the Witch',683127,5.0939,5.9,'Lk5YWIbwzRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25613,_binary '\0','/pHFHcQJS6uZDEzyhxUSwuDkMidN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12443220',6.1,1716,'es','Mamá o papá','Flora and Victor are fun, modern, caring parents. That is, until they decide to get a divorce, and the perfect job opportunity turns up for them. They now have one problem: custody.','/oErlcO8d4PU4tu4th6GkpNURPKv.jpg','2021-12-17',103,'Released',NULL,'You Keep the Kids',755437,3.5678,7.1,'o_eZKGXmUR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25614,_binary '\0','/lB4BOSe6Nt6u3KnkVGcQbnHGiLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12443930',6.9,3518,'fr','Les choses qu\'on dit, les choses qu\'on fait','Vacations in the French countryside. Daphne, three months pregnant, finds herself alone to welcome Maxime, her boyfriend François’ cousin. François had to leave in a hurry for Paris to cover for a sick colleague. For four days, while waiting for his return, Daphne and Maxime get to know each other and share very intimate stories that bring them closer...','/2LenuIIbbOFzl0fTs0PjP8i3xvF.jpg','2020-09-16',122,'Released',NULL,'Love Affair(s)',661935,2.571,6.3,'SW3ACQaoz30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25615,_binary '\0','/qMwhUTSPYNags3VzVY0Zke5MBc3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12443946',6.5,4827,'pl','Sweat','Three days in the life of fitness motivator Sylwia Zając, whose presence on social media has made her a celebrity. Although she has hundreds of thousands of followers, is surrounded by loyal employees and admired by acquaintances, she is looking for true intimacy.','/x2ig0aim7IbrsNWUKmpk9QTPlgq.jpg','2020-09-14',107,'Released','Who needs friends when you have 600,000 followers?','Sweat',712121,2.1003,6.2,'IAOK1NrjN44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25616,_binary '\0','/xAAYm7bUC5LnAj2Hs2hePOMHh2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444168',4.2,1937,'en','Don\'t Tell Mom the Babysitter\'s Dead','Seventeen year old Tanya\'s plans for a carefree summer are derailed when her stressed-to-the-limit mom takes off for a wellness retreat and puts Tanya and her three siblings in the charge of a crotchety (and racist) old babysitter. The babysitter’s sudden death leaves the kids short on cash and reluctant to pull mom prematurely out of her much-needed R&R, so Tanya is forced to get a job. Posing as an adult, she gets a gig as the executive assistant at a fashion company and overnight is thrust into the world of adulthood and parenting.','/etmcxYbebpYh2r3ClALrn6LOtFU.jpg','2024-04-12',99,'Released','Respect your elders.','Don\'t Tell Mom the Babysitter\'s Dead',1251687,3.593,5.7,'fdT5YyVeW8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25617,_binary '\0','/bAzddruImRkd1h9X7MUhFUdUQ1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444424',6.7,3052,'fr','Gagarine','Yuri, 16, has lived all his life in Gagarin Towers, a vast red-brick housing project on the outskirts of Paris. He dreams of becoming an astronaut. When plans to demolish Gagarin Towers leak out, Yuri joins the resistance. With his friends Diana and Houssam, he embarks on a mission to save their home, which has become his “starship.”','/5KnhgAYi62EK2RhuzgPtBw5TF7q.jpg','2020-11-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Gagarine',712178,2.9811,6.599,'XBEz83b27X4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25618,_binary '\0','/gXDbv3iP3TkAXXxKJobQK8U5oBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444426',5.8,1347,'fr','Seize printemps','A 16-year-old girl, bored with her own age group, becomes involved with an older man at a theater she passes.','/HLoCMVvU36t3uvm1KSPhSZQyG4.jpg','2021-05-17',73,'Released',NULL,'Spring Blossom',712134,2.0016,4.2,'Y-vz9X_8k8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25619,_binary '\0','/eKSAlfxRtjjzrSgASfc49ecxbTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444440',7,3756,'fr','Un triomphe','Etienne, an often out of work but endearing actor, runs a theater workshop in a prison, where he brings together an unlikely troupe of prisoners to stage Samuel Beckett’s famous play Waiting for Godot. When he is allowed to take the colorful band of convicts on a tour outside of prison, Etienne finally has the chance to thrive.','/nMhPX99PvJ1WaIo8CRgEyJYHJtR.jpg','2020-08-28',105,'Released',NULL,'The Big Hit',712152,4.3052,7,'-1Xx--JBi-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25620,_binary '\0','/gjDR7XfpigdkUdyQnJ5vTcQ4XKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444572',6.6,2767,'ka','დასაწყისი','In a sleepy provincial town, a Jehovah’s Witness community is under attack from an extremist group. In the midst of this conflict is Yana, the wife of the community leader, whose familiar world is slowly crumbling around her. Meanwhile, a detective intrudes on her home with devastating consequences.','/u1kgNoUSgC5bwdfIFhU8t860L1T.jpg','2020-12-04',126,'Released',NULL,'Beginning',712167,1.4662,5.8,'NuUG4VxWbak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25621,_binary '\0','/3f2xX0r2x0RbMR2spoqkdUIhuuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12444934',3.8,2062,'en','Devil\'s Workshop','Desperate for a role as a demonologist, struggling actor Clayton contacts Eliza, an expert in devil lore, to help him prepare. As he spends the weekend at her home, Eliza forces Clayton to confront his troubling past, perform dark rituals, and sacrifice a goat. Does she want to help Clayton, seduce him—or destroy him?','/C6mM4ZozL7PCi7d3DrtaW9reKS.jpg','2022-09-30',86,'Released','We all have our demons.','Devil\'s Workshop',1023086,2.4408,5.7,'ER69QmWbnKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25622,_binary '\0','/ubf4XerMVaRGMQfdZQ1HnLbatvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244588',2.1,1229,'en','Magic Man','In order to see magic idol Krell Darius perform his world-famous magic act, a beautiful aspiring young-magician, Tatiana, travels from New York to Las Vegas with her closest friends, BFFs, Elena and Vera. As the layers of illusion unfold, so too do the dark windows into Tatiana\'s past','/6wxmdj4szJUMhLhOvvmJnFearjh.jpg','2009-11-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Magic Man',24797,1.4153,3.2,'CVODN44CE38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25623,_binary '\0','/pKfSeodDgNOiK6zZ6k02h5hDljE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244658',5.8,8773,'en','Burning Bright','After her lousy stepfather steals her savings to buy a vicious tiger, Kelly loses all hope of going to college. But Kelly\'s situation worsens when a hurricane leaves her and her autistic brother boarded up in their house with the man-eating beast. This edge-of-your-seat thriller follows the gutsy heroine and her younger sibling as they struggle to outwit the ravenous predator and find a way to survive.','/fRzCoP6quj8SuLjklN3k1nkhqP8.jpg','2010-08-17',89,'Released','His Feeding. Your Frenzy.','Burning Bright',39957,3.7092,6.3,'cgeSk6uJ-UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25624,_binary '\0','/o2AFwD4v62296mxkF74EMYL6P7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244659',6.4,18724,'en','Extraordinary Measures','Working-class father John Crowley is finally on the fast track to corporate success when his two young children are diagnosed with Pompe disease—a condition that prevents the body from breaking down sugar. With the support of his wife, John ditches his career and teams with unconventional specialist, Dr. Robert Stonehill to found a bio-tech company and develop a cure in time to save the lives of his children. As Dr. Stonehill works tirelessly to prove the theories that made him the black sheep of the medical community, a powerful bond is forged between the two unlikely allies.','/bmBCMoCc6OdINBOC7P6pOIs1MuO.jpg','2010-01-21',106,'Released','Don\'t hope for a miracle. Make one.','Extraordinary Measures',27569,4.8362,6.3,'cmnMdwYAhTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25625,_binary '\0','/ubcXF21nUkm1ijkH7ZFCm0pzkMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244666',7.5,3617,'ja','フィッシュストーリー','A rock band writes a song called \"Fish Story\" that is foretold to save the world. The song exceeds the boundaries of space and time and ties people and their stories together.','/9boTcyjQ4IMnosjrFYhTyFsD7F4.jpg','2009-03-20',112,'Released','Can punk save the world?','Fish Story',38010,1.6941,7.162,'vC5E4-LRrTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25626,_binary '\0','/tzCBj6duyr0h3Y2SACNprdL5WsB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244668',7.2,42960,'de','Soul Kitchen','In Hamburg, German-Greek chef Zinos unknowingly disturbs the peace in his locals-only restaurant by hiring a more talented chef.','/9Y2OQ7MFouzmVCMqqvZPLrzHF0F.jpg','2009-09-09',99,'Released','Life is what happens when you\'re busy making other plans.','Soul Kitchen',31175,2.6518,6.9,'Ua86x-J4ubA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25627,_binary '\0','/tT8xjbKPHxz9T37fWM3ohlHP3TW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1244754',7.2,48462,'en','Conviction','When Betty Anne Waters\' older brother Kenny is arrested for murder and sentenced to life in 1983, Betty Anne, a Massachusetts wife and mother of two, dedicates her life to overturning the murder conviction. Convinced that her brother is innocent, Betty Anne puts herself through high school, college and, finally, law school in an 18 year quest to free Kenny. With the help of best friend Abra Rice, Betty Anne pores through suspicious evidence mounted by small town cop Nancy Taylor, meticulously retracing the steps that led to Kenny\'s arrest. Belief in her brother - and her quest for the truth - pushes Betty Anne and her team to uncover the facts and utilize DNA evidence with the hope of exonerating Kenny.','/rUxznyFz7D0HgC5zcYigzP1XUi4.jpg','2010-10-15',107,'Released','An extraordinary journey of how far we go to fight for our family.','Conviction',45094,4.3013,7.1,'NrPtr0aQx3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25628,_binary '\0','/mXBth6deOA3XLU6HKwoNor9UivP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12447796',5.4,8505,'en','Unwelcome','Londoners Maya and Jamie escape their urban nightmare to the tranquility of rural Ireland only to discover malevolent, murderous goblins lurking in the gnarled, ancient wood at the foot of their new garden. When heavily pregnant Maya’s relationship with a local family turns sour, who – or what – will come to her rescue and to what extremes will she go to protect her unborn child?','/88bGObx8YKLQDOOhcrBHHzXpiAv.jpg','2023-01-27',104,'Released','Break a promise. Pay the price.','Unwelcome',758769,3.2432,5.8,'Ei-eolHMSeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25629,_binary '\0','/xtQgJMmPdQOwfS0cgp0po2Zgfd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12449586',4.8,2883,'en','The Seed','What starts out as a girls weekend away in the Mojave desert becomes a tale of horror, death and alien invasion.','/KDm1MEARoQAUauqfdBuCpbjbsj.jpg','2021-10-05',91,'Released',NULL,'The Seed',831438,3.6057,4.8,'1-_pi6iQf3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25630,_binary '\0','/svZPLmBwYHjlwDwHkZz4EotpXqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1245112',6.5,85638,'es','[REC]²','The action continues from [REC], with the medical officer and a SWAT team outfitted with video cameras are sent into the sealed off apartment to control the situation.','/n9okN1DnWQWI2fuByXTrv9DCL7u.jpg','2009-09-15',84,'Released','Fear revisited.','[REC]²',10664,5.5328,6.634,'XPNY-94UfG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25631,_binary '\0','/tuJMYSFTOqt3QYq0BuZx8Lmeiq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12453124',5.4,1744,'fi','Odotus','The idyllic and secluded Finnish archipelago. The pandemic soars across the world. Elli’s world trembles as her husband’s old friend arrives at the island.','/e5qhyVvLkK5e0B5XTvThrSzNyJf.jpg','2022-04-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Wait',716814,2.9545,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25632,_binary '\0','/sXfN4ir91SfTeoWidIukQWane43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1245492',6.6,459143,'en','This Is the End','While attending a party at James Franco\'s house, Seth Rogen, Jay Baruchel and many other celebrities are faced with the apocalypse.','/tNIW0NhX1hKvUsy6PQ80DOKUhkD.jpg','2013-06-12',106,'Released','Nothing ruins a party like the end of the world.','This Is the End',109414,17.1931,6.234,'kliQSsD_npo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25633,_binary '\0','/5tqBeCUaNHptScH3rBixjE5z2NV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1245526',7,341028,'en','RED','After surviving an assault from a squad of hit men, retired CIA black ops agent Frank Moses reassembles his old team for an all-out war. Frank reunites with old Joe, crazy Marvin and wily Victoria to uncover a massive conspiracy that threatens their lives. Only their expert training will allow them to survive a near-impossible mission -- breaking into CIA headquarters.','/8eeK3OB5PeSRQD7BpZcGZKkehG.jpg','2010-10-13',111,'Released','Still armed. Still dangerous. Still got it.','RED',39514,12.5663,6.708,'JlFkRY9xLmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25634,_binary '\0','/1BA01qCg6ElPdRyu4zpFupwYt44.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1245735',3.6,1627,'en','Smash Cut','Television news celebrity April Carson turns to the services of private investigator Isaac Beaumonde to seek her missing sister, a stripper known as Gigi Spot. Carson assumes a role in a horror movie in the process, eventually learning that the movie\'s director, Able Whitman, is not only the culprit, but that he has rendered her sister\'s body into props for the production.','/uvPMUcCz0D0MJCtkaOAwFTm1CgR.jpg','2009-07-18',82,'Released','Lights... Camera... Body parts!','Smash Cut',22335,1.5006,3.7,'U-MDOhPnjMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25635,_binary '\0','/mw0WT5VHK1B69LY4LpDR9EU6fP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1245774',6.3,1476,'hi','Jail','Parag Dixit is living a dream life with a great job and his loving girlfriend Mansi! However things take an ugly turn when after a series of unfortunate events he suddenly wakes up in jail; handcuffed and randomly beaten up by the cops.','/coZ3oOyOBwqrSSe1gFdMWVeoxUM.jpg','2009-11-06',155,'Released',NULL,'Jail',20130,0.94,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25636,_binary '\0','/n1YgWb7ablpAl5RwRSEAlfnbCqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12459520',5.6,3542,'nl','De Familie Claus','When his grandfather suddenly falls ill, holiday-hating Jules learns of his family\'s magical legacy and realizes he\'s the only hope to save Christmas.','/nSYgOCTC8lIys1exhKE9Ivo0ZAE.jpg','2020-12-07',96,'Released',NULL,'The Claus Family',767896,2.3093,6,'mOgHcgm-riI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25637,_binary '\0','/oSyVAH0o7nv6sMHhZUgDqxhpFHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12472554',7.7,19631,'ta','மகான்','A man\'s family leaves him when he strays from the path of ideological living in his search for personal freedom. However, as he realizes his ambitions, he also misses the presence of his son in his life. Having fulfilled his dream of becoming a billionaire, does life give him a second chance to be a father?','/rHcwUUy3gRVUEUepYOd7xkesiNf.jpg','2022-02-10',163,'Released',NULL,'Mahaan',804337,3.422,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25638,_binary '\0','/36uneUgJWBhWcz9EFQoJodyst29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247400',3,1858,'en','The Lazarus Papers','Lonny Smith, a young man with a suitcase full of money, who might drop dead at any moment is searching for love with each dying breath even if he has to pay for it...','/kaHippEnqztEl0GeZsJMrcX2AKz.jpg','2010-01-01',90,'Released','Who say you only die once?','The Lazarus Papers',68712,1.2063,3.7,'GtXKB04mdSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25639,_binary '\0','/rCQp2lOfGeiUnXxRk3B3FEq59rC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12474056',6.5,11292,'es','Nuevo orden','In the near future, a popular uprising in Mexico City interrupts a wedding held at the home of a wealthy family. After the riots have been quashed, they discover the bride has gone missing and plea with the military to help locate her.','/v6NodCMzqilx0Xw541P65WFnDfE.jpg','2020-10-22',88,'Released',NULL,'New Order',575446,4.9644,6.444,'5sys2WJfIxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25640,_binary '\0','/hvjERDDFvqFwMroa0MxDYcgwaNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12476270',4.2,5843,'en','Brut Force','Newly-fired reporter Sloane Sawyer reluctantly returns to her rural California hometown to investigate the harassment of local vineyard workers and uncorks a tangled web of crime and corruption behind wine country\'s shiny facade.','/rai1NpvlCgZiaKzxaNAjbUY72GJ.jpg','2022-04-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Brut Force',959617,1.9165,4.714,'AV7hQzKR1ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25641,_binary '\0','/nMHPn12sJb2LCHsWmHvSYDLHZcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247640',6.5,48187,'fr','Banlieue 13 - Ultimatum','Damien and Leito return to District 13 on a mission to bring peace to the troubled sector that is controlled by five different gang bosses, before the city’s secret services take drastic measures to solve the problem.','/qhadETc2y1ImTQ51all8tOd45aw.jpg','2009-02-18',101,'Released',NULL,'District 13: Ultimatum',15357,6.8844,6.4,'jDDFNpj9xBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25642,_binary '\0','/hYL1LVJNRTNuJmUsoj96tA2NGOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247644',6,1497,'en','Breaking Upwards','\'Breaking Upwards\' explores a young, real-life New York couple who, four years in and battling codependency, decide to intricately strategize their own break up. Based on an actual experiment devised by director/actor Daryl Wein and actress Zoe Lister-Jones, the film loosely interprets a year in their lives exploring alternatives to monogamy, and the madness that ensues. An uncensored look at young love, lust, and the pangs of codependency, \'Breaking Upwards\' follows its characters as they navigate each others\' emotions across the city they love. It begs the question: is it ever possible to grow apart together?','/mEA5Vs7LoVS4dtotal9dc0kdgHz.jpg','2009-03-14',88,'Released',NULL,'Breaking Upwards',44990,1.3686,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25643,_binary '\0','/c4gD4bwVRpDhyQfxcsavx5JuvqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247657',6.5,5962,'de','Friendship!','A young man from East Germany travels to San Francisco to search for his father, who fled 12 years ago. Together with his best friend, he starts the journey from New York with no money and the only word they ever learned in english-lessons: \"friendship\".','/a9wd9gJyEHrUVT4FuLfCADhmDzw.jpg','2010-01-13',110,'Released',NULL,'Friendship!',35217,2.0871,6.3,'UI51rZmd66Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25644,_binary '\0','/byp4HzUPBJgLp96BVcxwd5PicXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247662',5.7,10079,'en','The Good Guy','Ambitious young Manhattanite and urban conservationist Beth wants it all: a good job, good friends, and a good guy to share the city with. Of course that last one is often the trickiest of all. Beth falls hard for Tommy, a sexy, young Wall Street hot-shot. But just as everything seems to be falling into place, complications arise in the form of Tommy\'s sensitive and handsome co-worker Daniel. Beth soon learns that the game of love in the big city is a lot like Wall Street -- high risk, high reward and everybody has an angle.','/xwSQ62M3B1LTpHhau4MaREIwfSy.jpg','2009-04-25',90,'Released',NULL,'The Good Guy',39037,2.4781,5.478,'3rE3mPAtnWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25645,_binary '\0','/bGKHMU4ufiBt2r19g1fsi0u12dT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247667',5.7,8222,'en','High School','A high school valedictorian who gets baked with the local stoner finds himself the subject of a drug test. The situation causes him to concoct an ambitious plan to get his entire graduating class to face the same fate, and fail.','/3pZzS9R1r6qHvstMxmGq54JkFDR.jpg','2010-06-03',99,'Released','Random drug tests? You just can\'t study for them.','High School',27584,3.2716,5.6,'QP36NIUt0nQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25646,_binary '\0','/epbiXapnWDfEj8SFHB7ev61ncQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247683',6.4,1650,'en','Norman','A teenager pretends to be dying from cancer as a way to cope with the realities of his daily existence and his father\'s terminal illness.','/2uN5YbewCGghe6htT6cjyrtuORm.jpg','2010-06-11',97,'Released','The only thing he cares about is not caring.','Norman',50590,1.2535,6.1,'BUE8EiBsriY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25647,_binary '\0','/orr90ueWzej1w9HpZzDru5AaZDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247690',5.5,32281,'en','Serena','North Carolina mountains at the end of the 1920s – George and Serena Pemberton, love-struck newly-weds, begin to build a timber empire. Serena soon proves herself to be equal to any man: overseeing loggers, hunting rattle-snakes, even saving a man’s life in the wilderness. With power and influence now in their hands, the Pembertons refuse to let anyone stand in the way of their inflated love and ambitions. However, once Serena discovers George’s hidden past and faces an unchangeable fate of her own, the Pemberton’s passionate marriage begins to unravel leading toward a dramatic reckoning.','/6P1IgM4T3cOmEiBL01AFtPbHk9E.jpg','2014-10-12',109,'Released','Some loves can never let go.','Serena',164251,4.4652,5.592,'AaCAby0GicI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25648,_binary '\0','/rDSg1WfkvQKKSZJ2R0IxHdQcRO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247692',6.6,19713,'en','Shrink','Unable to cope with a recent personal tragedy, LA\'s top celebrity shrink turns into a pothead with no concern for his appearance and a creeping sense of his inability to help his patients.','/pg6649ymX3M5otI7siheMggBsz7.jpg','2009-07-24',104,'Released','The Doctor is Out','Shrink',22640,2.9716,6.2,'heBOLodYfUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25649,_binary '\0','/7SKhWZMci419L6LoWbj2e1ylhu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247696',7.1,1451,'et','Püha Tõnu kiusamine','A mid-level manager who develops an aversion to being a good person questions his morality as he faces the challenges of middle age and loses control of his life.','/7uJEHRGq6kR9et77FJv4uWbGNbl.jpg','2009-10-10',115,'Released','The most stupendous and bone chilling tragedy about the agony and decline of one middle-level manager','The Temptation of St. Tony',46756,1.3475,6.9,'NRmLdP2CGGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25650,_binary '\0','/pFmwPXtw1HWNtHAvcvfqmt0yqnc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1247704',5.6,6830,'en','Women in Trouble','Several women (and one girl) in L.A. are hiding something from someone else, or discovering something hidden from them. Maxine, a therapist, discovers her husband cheating on her with the mother of Charlotte, a 13-year old patient. Addy (the other woman) and her sister Doris have withheld from the girl the truth of her parentage. Holly, an adult film actor, isn\'t telling her friend Bambi how she feels about her, and another actor, Elektra, who discovers she\'s pregnant, hasn\'t told the baby\'s father that she loves him. A stuck elevator, a car crash, mid-air turbulence, a flight attendant, a shotgun-wielding bartender, and her roommate, who\'s a masseuse, help these women communicate.','/iY1L1QuJS4PFiw3Kc5fiVBD0gJ0.jpg','2009-11-13',92,'Released','High Hopes, High Anxiety, High Heels.','Women in Trouble',31723,3.2795,5.1,'fjdBwE44RT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25651,_binary '\0','/uUXgaOxPsr0jsBhGnkyIgw0g2ge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12477480',7.2,71391,'ko','헤어질 결심','From a mountain peak in South Korea, a man plummets to his death. Did he jump, or was he pushed? When detective Hae-joon arrives on the scene, he begins to suspect the dead man’s wife Seo-rae. But as he digs deeper into the investigation, he finds himself trapped in a web of deception and desire.','/zI8KZ4EdLUymWKX1YEkpZ0gtPUa.jpg','2022-06-29',139,'Released','The closer you look, the harder you fall.','Decision to Leave',705996,10.545,7.3,'97YCtcT470g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25652,_binary '\0','/jygdR2JLcHbL1MO11sr0ZlT04DU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12482898',7.5,3343,'en','Attica','Follows the largest prison uprising in US history, conducting dozens of new interviews with inmates, journalists, and other witnesses.','/8dpc49O7G9B0y2crRbI7hHtbQzB.jpg','2021-09-09',117,'Released',NULL,'Attica',858059,1.4452,6.767,'aElB8oEfbiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25653,_binary '\0','/1pFSJ9lxMYLkgLS5gmnwm1AEiqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12483708',3.6,3853,'en','Doors','Without warning, millions of mysterious alien “doors” suddenly appear around the globe. In a rush to determine the reason for their arrival, mankind must work together to understand the purpose of these cosmic anomalies.','/Akgp7BJd58nT78lTmT6TdQV7WXm.jpg','2021-03-23',84,'Released','Forget everything you know about the universe.','Doors',798141,3.4873,4.801,'2kKnbsstui0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25654,_binary '\0','/rft7UdViCJI6vkmFHGsjksYC9mw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12484724',6.8,2951,'hi','मेरे देश की धरती','Encompasses the journey of two engineering friends who go on a new adventure in the farming industry.','/53VStqbu6cS6HlfswFsSe4WMOm1.jpg','2022-05-06',142,'Released','The country is changing...','Mere Desh Ki Dharti',913532,1.0976,7.071,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25655,_binary '\0','/llyzjqc0xYRzZjK7quUybU8H32i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1248971',5.8,7676,'en','Cherrybomb','Teenagers Luke, Malachy, and Michelle embark on a wild weekend of drink, drugs, shop-lifting and stealing cars. But what starts out as a game turns deadly serious when the three discover that they can\'t get off the wild ride they\'ve set in motion.','/q3NdckfHKjXyrsRNoZyAidMf9em.jpg','2009-02-08',86,'Released','Two guys. One girl. Game on.','Cherrybomb',40850,2.5327,5.5,'zBZ8mTtoI9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25656,_binary '\0','/xZOrbl25pVTGNUR9KxhldzMGwZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12491064',6.1,2519,'ko','침입자','Seo-jin is a widower still grieving his wife\'s death. Then he receives the news that his long-lost younger sister, Yoo-jin, who went missing 25 years ago, has turned up. Unlike the rest of his family, who welcome her into their arms, Seo-jin feels that Yoo-jin is a stranger.','/6RafKT94L6pFatwbWBTkV0zEaWm.jpg','2020-06-04',102,'Released','Long gone sister came back as a stranger.','Intruder',602291,2.9976,6.7,'sVd2zaC8rqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25657,_binary '\0','/vm6Vcgj1m1W9osKnFwX6K7Njztn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1249171',7.9,5019,'en','Global Metal','In GLOBAL METAL, directors Scot McFadyen and Sam Dunn set out to discover how the West\'s most maligned musical genre - heavy metal - has impacted the world\'s cultures beyond Europe and North America. The film follows metal fan and anthropologist Sam Dunn on a whirlwind journey through Asia, South America and the Middle East as he explores the underbelly of the world\'s emerging extreme music scenes; from Indonesian death metal to Chinese black metal to Iranian thrash metal. GLOBAL METAL reveals a worldwide community of metalheads who aren\'t just absorbing metal from the West - they\'re transforming it - creating a new form of cultural expression in societies dominated by conflict, corruption and mass-consumerism.','/28f1iaERjW8pk39Ye5KpG7Xfqa4.jpg','2008-06-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Global Metal',16919,1.3356,7.3,'4FcFzzJI3Z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25658,_binary '\0','/1f0G7KtLFHwDMFVsvx48WfPVoA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1249300',6.6,4914,'en','Merry Christmas, Drake & Josh','Step brothers Drake and Josh must give a foster family the best Christmas ever or face years in jail for a Christmas party gone wrong.','/59GoXODSKpd3yMXgM4xXlNmf7jq.jpg','2008-12-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Merry Christmas, Drake & Josh',33871,3.1723,7.4,'ldZlTBWH7GU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25659,_binary '\0','/AtGJHovLPOv2dLRJgEbtsSvVQH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12494638',6.3,1670,'he','הברך','An Israeli filmmaker throws himself in the midst of two battles doomed to fail: one against the death of freedom in his country, the other against the death of his mother.','/rNoaBDAC1fknNNpl93uSkFsz3NP.jpg','2021-08-05',109,'Released',NULL,'Ahed\'s Knee',662029,1.6064,6.41,'I6lnWirRxhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25660,_binary '\0','/48amFhZCg4PoToQu6KukUmmGdhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12496582',3.7,1229,'en','Devil\'s Island','A young woman inherits a small island in New York and discovers it has a dangerous history.','/eVamYkW77fGAv2GyFiGYehqj5Ne.jpg','2021-03-15',71,'Released',NULL,'Devil\'s Island',838594,1.0552,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25661,_binary '\0','/sxmazOtNWi6IiZ1QqG0wkliHzgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12496706',6.3,7929,'fr','Le Calendrier','Eva, an ex-dancer, is now living in a wheelchair, unable to walk. When her friend Sophie gives her an old wooden antique advent calendar before Christmas, she realizes each window contains a surprise that triggers repercussions in real life: some of them good, but most of them bad... Now Eva will have to choose between getting rid of the calendar or walking again… even if it causes death around her.','/psaYUHDotafhVNAE1pZN2GkRXJY.jpg','2021-12-01',104,'Released','Will you live until Christmas this year?','The Advent Calendar',762079,3.5365,6.692,'4bIDME7VA54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25662,_binary '\0','/q3bL22Hup2h243smzrob5nML56k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12497408',6.7,1265,'zh','送你一朵小红花','Tells a warm and realistic story, thinking and facing the ultimate problem that every ordinary person will face-imagining that death may come at any time, the only thing we have to do is love and cherish.','/vvzi5LmOog3Nc7HIri6LsC8mF7D.jpg','2020-12-31',128,'Released',NULL,'A Little Red Flower',716815,1.6469,6.531,'N7Q72fwBTq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25663,_binary '\0','/8qo1ZKKTCHa4Ph63qpJIm77g6rn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12503708',6.8,1841,'te','A (ఏ డి ఇన్ఫినిటమ్)','Sanjeev cannot recollect his past but keeps dreaming of it. But what he ends up finding out is much more than what he bargained for.','/eZ2zwzbrAf3X84Bhh1UACp1yEEo.jpg','2021-03-05',153,'Released','Sometimes Facts are Stranger than Fiction','A (Ad Infinitum)',802773,1.41,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25664,_binary '\0','/P4bGyJQF0shAcRku3I2perNUQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1250777',7.6,624692,'en','Kick-Ass','Dave Lizewski is an unnoticed high school student and comic book fan who one day decides to become a super-hero, even though he has no powers, training or meaningful reason to do so.','/iHMbrTHJwocsNvo5murCBw0CwTo.jpg','2010-03-26',118,'Released','Shut up. Kick-ass.','Kick-Ass',23483,16.7742,7.124,'RdBiTjy7AEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25665,_binary '\0','/bwC1PdVuCq0szRDzQBuvE27siB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12508520',7,2300,'de','Sörensen hat Angst','Detective Chief Inspector Sörensen is anxious. More precisely, he suffers from a chronic anxiety disorder that makes life difficult for him. That is why he is moving from Hamburg to the Frisian village of Katenbüll, where he hopes for a more peaceful working life. But that is not how the cookie crumbles. The place is grey and bleak, it rains continuously, and the locals are not very enthusiastic in welcoming him. He also finds his new colleagues, Jenni Holstenbeck and Malte Schuster, somewhat suspect. And then things go from bad to worse. Mayor Hinrichs is found dead in his stables. Sörensen quickly realises that there is a lot of bad blood hidden behind the small town\'s tranquil facade and some well-founded reasons for anxiety...','/9APuzYQ66dNIDUHdOJ6nXjMKZvs.jpg','2020-09-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Sörensen\'s Fear',762426,0.9927,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25666,_binary '\0','/bmExGJbH5RHxphv1ICL0Zhj3LSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12510594',5.9,1401,'tr','Gelincik','Ayhan is a police officer who has left his job. He starts a new life in the forest house, far from the organization and everything he has been struggling with for years. During an uneasy hunt, he shoots a weasel. Karadayı, who appeared at that time, warns Ayhan about weasels. Karadayı looks like a good person despite his strange demeanor, but his prophecy about weasels is terrifying. Facing with the memories of the past at home, Ayhan also struggles with the weasel that has haunted him.','/dgBN9ehMJ6ClYvDx9gk39C2PBwf.jpg','2020-10-08',83,'Released','There are wounds like leprosy that gnaw at one\'s soul','Weasel',745514,1.6229,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25667,_binary '\0','/t7d0ybowQgeLGPppePJHlwRGcxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12515958',6.6,2313,'ko','결백','A lawyer tries to prove her mother\'s innocence and uncover the secrets of a small village with the help of the local mayor. Her mother was accused of murder after the rice wine was poisoned at her husband\'s funeral, but she is suffering from memory loss and cannot defend herself.','/27XVfpJ7MBC8zIVP5FWNRBw4uNd.jpg','2020-06-10',110,'Released','The truth behind the secret.','Innocence',602296,2.5439,7.68,'2kajvWRtTDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25668,_binary '\0','/dRjArFKEh4MczXzMjRWJQ4WQULq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12516292',6,1684,'tr','Seni Buldum Ya!','Istanbul is under quarantine. Felek and Kerim find the best way to make profits in this period. They will access people\'s computers and introduce themselves as government officials, making them confess their \"crimes\". However, the city in question is Istanbul and all kinds of people live here.','/c3jsmFjBxPRgJlg9AqI7kgY8IEb.jpg','2021-03-13',82,'Released',NULL,'Hey There!',799020,0.686,5,'vy52S-eUWAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25669,_binary '\0','/jxefES6XpXeijRJAgtkSrkln5Sr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1251725',6.6,5331,'en','Bunny and the Bull','A young shut-in takes an imaginary road trip inside his apartment, based on mementos and memories of a European trek from years before.','/ercbL2Oavgu296aGwKsdFofKTTW.jpg','2009-11-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Bunny and the Bull',35395,2.0206,6.1,'FbtB9uJYHIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25670,_binary '\0','/apMLieYY9z6tgBHLbCA7wsuar02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1251743',5.3,4953,'en','Salvation Boulevard','Set in the world of mega-churches in which a former Deadhead-turned-born-again-Christian finds himself on the run from fundamentalist members of his mega-church who will do anything to protect their larger-than-life pastor.','/q8kPPcpPUGhdAOP5LYHDMKZBXYP.jpg','2011-07-15',96,'Released','Faith alone doesn’t cut it anymore','Salvation Boulevard',51995,2.124,5.3,'TYiYHfciJwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25671,_binary '\0','/wiyGkY94gw6K38hjqdB961GmCuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1251757',6.8,39088,'en','Middle Men','Chronicles Jack Harris, one of the pioneers of internet commerce, as he wrestles with his morals and struggles not to drown in a sea of conmen, mobsters, drug addicts, and pornstars.','/l56cv8FczzEk4pe3W8BHiRNCC05.jpg','2009-05-17',105,'Released','Business is a lot like sex ... getting in is easy, pulling out is hard.','Middle Men',38842,4.0909,6.5,'m3gcb_9Q10E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25672,_binary '\0','/bnXGwFBomUseQIc9Xqiymy9p8qP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12519030',6.2,18379,'fi','Pahanhautoja','12 year old Tinja is desperate to please her mother, a woman obsessed with presenting the image of a perfect family. One night, Tinja finds a strange egg. What hatches is beyond belief.','/jgJACjJIpcbFfEEmEglinfQWQPO.jpg','2022-03-04',87,'Released','She\'s coming out of her shell.','Hatching',517302,3.6785,6.3,'DS1oDoElwqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25673,_binary '\0','/8DW82CIg3LRYN8Mrvj9JJ7GXKM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12519802',3.2,3694,'en','War of the Worlds: The Attack','Three young astronomers fight to survive a deadly Martian invasion.','/wtar1NytLPRnd8hlwspeRRW5NVm.jpg','2023-04-21',87,'Released','They are here.','War of the Worlds: The Attack',1103825,4.3534,4.9,'5BCzlUXIpGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25674,_binary '\0','/nAivkMvSb3Nl5BQRwjvtv2Szr2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1252329',5.6,1747,'en','Redwoods','Both original and incredibly romantic, Redwoods tells the story of an already-partnered man whose love is tested when a mysterious drifter passes through his small Northern California town.','/9VZu6hXM0DOTTnpgY0N0fhOL7RN.jpg','2009-12-01',82,'Released','Love is worth the wait.','Redwoods',26731,1.0173,5.5,'N5Q5ODeJod4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25675,_binary '\0','/tGgDjve3sY6me6JtefocFycCgyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1252380',5.3,23780,'en','Camp Rock 2: The Final Jam','Mitchie can\'t wait to go back to Camp Rock and spend the summer making new music with her friends and superstar Shane Gray. But the slick new camp across the lake, Camp Star, has drummed up some serious competition – featuring newcomers Luke and Dana. In a sensational battle of the bands, with Camp Rock\'s future at stake, will Camp Star\'s flashy production and over-the-top antics win out, or will Camp Rockers prove that music, teamwork, and spirit are what truly matter?','/8RSdWqC259zR72Jjo6ANAM4ndhM.jpg','2010-09-17',104,'Released','It\'s all about the music.','Camp Rock 2: The Final Jam',44244,5.3847,6.329,'1yKLEoImqw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25676,_binary '\0','/iracY0nh7yTQfOYIMFhq2ZgcT3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1252596',6.5,19361,'hi','अजब प्रेम कि ग़ज़ब कहानी','When his love interest doesn\'t show up for a meeting, a man and his friends go to Goa in order to find her, where they discover she loves someone else.','/6IC8PQZAynsUAh0MDvopR3zDTRk.jpg','2009-11-06',150,'Released',NULL,'Ajab Prem Ki Ghazab Kahani',24827,2.0185,6.2,'6GUZ5G72rh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25677,_binary '\0','/5VkX1VsfQXeZjhecPL4vsFzOWln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1252610',6.7,3219,'no','Nord','Following a nervous breakdown, ski athlete Jomar has isolated himself in a lonely existence as the guard of a ski park. When he learns that he might be the father of a child way up north, he sets on a strange and poetic journey through Norway on a snowmobile, with 5 liters of alcohol as sole provisions. On this trip through amazing arctic landscapes, Jomar seems to do everything in his power to avoid reaching his destination. He meets other tender and confused souls, who will all contribute to push Jomar further along his reluctant journey towards the brighter side of life.','/rwGHjCALrH2PACg5WQzyItnZDFq.jpg','2009-02-06',78,'Released','An anti-depressive off-road movie','North',26584,2.1302,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25678,_binary '\0','/cjcEZW4DzJgdzF3MeA9XhIdq4z5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12528166',3.4,6616,'en','Out of Death','As Shannon, a woman who wants to put her father\'s ashes away in the woods witnesses a corrupt cop dealing drugs with a junkie, she has to try and run away after she gets rampaged by two discreditable cops after they see her taking secret photographs of their crime maneuver. They then do a cat-and-mouse game around the woods as Shannon teams up with a retired sheriff along the way for more reinforcement. It\'s just a diversion of survival and egalitarianism.','/zan6xYKNGKgkp2hFajU398I1iTD.jpg','2021-07-16',95,'Released','Justice is just a moving target.','Out of Death',774714,4.4543,5.305,'XR2tg6h39B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25679,_binary '\0','/1jZ3wNpON50whGEH7YOcTQrU45B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12530246',6.3,31926,'en','Emancipation','Inspired by the gripping true story of a man who would do anything for his family—and for freedom. When Peter, an enslaved man, risks his life to escape and return to his family, he embarks on a perilous journey of love and endurance.','/AkdNXEquLf4GIkw