1,1933,'en','The Loneliest Boy in the World','After losing his mother, a lonely boy decides to (literally) dig up some new friends, but when they mysteriously come back to life, he’s launched into a series of misadventures as he tries to keep their secret safe from neighbors, classmates and social workers alike.','/A6McNUszcZnRkSa8ZhwlKoLchrT.jpg','2022-10-06',90,'Released','They\'re dying to be his friend.','The Loneliest Boy in the World',992277,2.2436,4.8,'zBhGbSrixtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25694,_binary '\0','/5Zvu4SrY3p9qgnITkCn4jAQwKvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1255919',4,42896,'en','Holmes & Watson','Detective Sherlock Holmes and Dr. John Watson join forces to investigate a mysterious murder at Buckingham Palace. It seems like an open-and-shut case as all signs point to Professor James Moriarty, the criminal mastermind and longtime nemesis of the crime-solving duo. When new twists and clues begin to emerge, the world\'s greatest sleuth and his trusted assistant must now use their legendary wits and ingenious methods to catch the killer as they only have four days before the queen becomes the next victim.','/orEUlKndjV1rEcWqXbbjegjfv97.jpg','2018-12-25',90,'Released','Weapons of mass deduction.','Holmes & Watson',426563,7.5585,4.284,'bDJBrRM12dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25695,_binary '\0','/oGqm34dOutHl1FlSqHjSUbEgKRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1255951',6.1,13220,'hi','De Dana Dan','Two down on their luck men try to kidnap a wealthy businesswoman\'s dog to demand a hefty ransom from her. But things go haywire when the dog goes missing.','/htOpALyz5x1Ee7YuZpaRCPEwEuX.jpg','2009-11-27',166,'Released',NULL,'De Dana Dan',25867,1.7233,5.8,'oBMW4EticlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25696,_binary '\0','/f3ATwil5vmUeTsogBaMEKbBYBth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1255953',8.3,259356,'fr','Incendies','A mother\'s last wishes send twins Jeanne and Simon on a journey to Middle East in search of their tangled roots. Adapted from Wajdi Mouawad\'s acclaimed play, Incendies tells the powerful and moving tale of two young adults\' voyage to the core of deep-rooted hatred, never-ending wars and enduring love.','/yH6DAQVgbyj72S66gN4WWVoTjuf.jpg','2010-09-17',131,'Released','2 letters. One for the brother. One for the father.','Incendies',46738,13.7875,8.103,'XJ69WnwvZhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25697,_binary '\0','/2Nr70tjW1l7E0gHNGnkcxCu0Pr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1255955',6.3,5448,'de','Männerherzen','Follows six very different men and their struggles with women, family and work. Yet, they are somehow connected to each other.','/jiN2PHryLSHz3qMrYT4wUsnjilf.jpg','2009-09-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Men in the City',28938,1.289,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25698,_binary '\0','/rB3m8znoh2OT0FwLXPqRntXzgby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12564514',6.5,3096,'hu','Felkészülés meghatározatlan ideig tartó együttlétre','Márta, a 40-year-old neurosurgeon, falls in love. She leaves her shining American career behind and returns to Budapest to start a new life with the man she loves. But she waits for him at the Liberty Bridge in vain – he does not appear at their rendezvous. Márta starts to search for him desperately, but when she finally finds him, the love of her life claims that they have never met before.','/6amfHFPFbdmoJeAifTjYeZtD5hY.jpg','2020-09-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Preparations to Be Together for an Unknown Period of Time',727002,2.2316,5.9,'gOm3v_FauoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25699,_binary '\0','/lwZyObPbSo2t57EsRIm6e8KF5WD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12567088',7.2,23037,'hi','रात अकेली है','When a newly married landlord is murdered, a misfit cop’s investigation is complicated by the victim’s secretive family and his own conflicted heart.','/lQPWcvQiv1D1xBlpnn5o0hepXkX.jpg','2020-07-31',149,'Released',NULL,'Raat Akeli Hai',589615,2.2