workers. But with no help from the locals, bringing the responsible parties to justice becomes a frustrating exercise. As Bravo rails against indifference and local corruption, she finds herself on a collision course with Mickey Santos, a Mexican mogul with a taste for young prostitutes.','/c8tW88xV002Dfrf835t17dSDKwh.jpg','2009-02-20',122,'Released',NULL,'Backyard',26773,1.4177,6.4,'ebPEc9IGT4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25709,_binary '\0','/oJgGtVqdI6z06TQ4ZFzDS1lgDT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12578564',6.9,7390,'tr','Bergen','Bergen, a valuable Turkish arabesque singer, fights to stay afloat despite all the difficulties in her life.','/mxGDZUBAP5bsEONiiYvMhc4GJS5.jpg','2022-03-04',145,'Released','The Woman of Sorrows','Bergen',776654,1.1816,6,'Zk9atuBNEzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25710,_binary '\0','/ujAHEr1smB5pzNYUMZpIj1Bm6uq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12579470',5.6,8992,'en','Robots','A womanizer and a gold digger trick people into relationships with illegal robot doubles. When they unwittingly use this scam on each other, their robot doubles fall in love and elope, forcing the duo to team up to hunt them down before the authorities discover their secret.','/5BAqLXrPD4ra3zA07lVsozK6sEj.jpg','2023-04-26',93,'Released','Some people just - click.','Robots',723347,4.6707,5.528,'5-QlB-CCozc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25711,_binary '\0','/gryOH9i7v6wQhIeui8HTmDgdQNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12581150',6.7,1355,'bn','ধর্মযুদ্ধ','The small town of Ismailpur suffers an apocalyptic night when a sudden riot breaks out and the town descends into anarchy. Four victims of the riots, rival to each other, take shelter in an old woman`s home. As the woman awaits her son`s arrival, conflicts break out between the four members, leading to a fateful night that none of them will forget.','/hQHgoiEAtbljk1a9n67SjArJce0.jpg','2022-08-12',111,'Released','All my sons','Dharmajuddha',718565,0.9092,7,'GhPSzW5wjrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25712,_binary '\0','/d6Z9I3zzXZJzFtkfmQ5VPAJgeCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258120',6.7,3750,'fr','L\'Armée du crime','This gripping historical drama recounts the story of Armenian-born Missak Manouchian, a woodworker and political activist who led an immigrant laborer division of the Parisian Resistance on 30 operations against the Nazis in 1943. The Nazis branded the group an Army of Crime, an anti-immigrant propaganda stunt that backfired as the team\'s members became martyrs for the Resistance.','/jWlDUuOi1GiCjauunAR2OuDDkst.jpg','2009-09-16',139,'Released',NULL,'Army of Crime',30432,2.1601,6.4,'K9qx_6eURWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25713,_binary '\0','/ej3R8gwocFDDGFWZefMSdq8Ary9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258134',6.7,2170,'fr','De père en flic','To save the life of fellow cop kidnapped by a biker gang, a father and a son who cannot stand the sight of each other infiltrate an outdoor adventure group-therapy for fathers and sons. Their biggest challenge is to survive the therapy without killing each other.','/ldIwA1FU8xAwqDtWn69cKUuPclP.jpg','2009-07-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Father and Guns',26566,2.0443,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25714,_binary '\0','/vbezIEiIaeBnxedakuAs3ZCay85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258137',5.8,6882,'en','Give \'em Hell, Malone','A tough as nails private investigator (Malone) squares off with gangsters and their thugs to protect a valuable secret. Malone goes through hell to protect the information but he dishes some hell as well...','/cs8U9er6RDr7dFsVVSPgQZbfEGU.jpg','2009-01-04',96,'Released','Hard to love... Harder to kill.','Give \'em Hell, Malone',28019,2.8694,5.7,'06cXoom5l10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25715,_binary '\0','/7C8RrRE8u6cdDpW5XiQNtHvnNFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258141',6.6,1370,'fr','Je l\'aimais','One night, Pierre decides to reveal his painful secret to his daughter-in-law, who\'s just been abandoned by her husband. Pierre\'s secret is about his secret love to Mathilde, the woman he left to instead follow an easier path in life.','/uX2QSatxilNGJPX2iwIzLxjEJGi.jpg','2009-05-06',112,'Released',NULL,'Someone I Loved',17658,1.8598,6.109,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25716,_binary '\0','/cMdzPC7K1FmKNOBMVnqyyfEfxSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258157',5.3,8465,'en','Scooby-Doo! The Mystery Begins','Unjustly accused of staging a spooky practical joke complete with ghosts, Daphne, Velma, Fred and Shaggy are suspended from Coolsville High. To clear their names, they team up to solve the supernatural mystery…and head straight into nonstop laughs and adventure.','/fUbx2NFwRTmRMtwcTbzEd804WQj.jpg','2009-09-13',82,'Released','The greatest mystery is how it all began.','Scooby-Doo! The Mystery Begins',22620,7.391,6.394,'JXM8k0xRJ60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25717,_binary '\0','/rwQx6uQAt3ImucZQL0Ymr9NVxTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258197',6.7,136215,'en','Exam','Eight talented candidates have reached the final stage of selection to join the ranks of a mysterious and powerful corporation. Entering a windowless room, where an armed guard keeps watch, they are given 80 minutes to answer one simple question.','/i1J2zBCyOQJKsQipqJ0qXERC1Ma.jpg','2009-06-19',101,'Released','How far would you go to win the ultimate job?','Exam',29917,5.9781,6.674,'hbivC9ztGOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25718,_binary '\0','/mNUciC3vHhoskveYsO3hiFypqMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12583926',6.7,16384,'en','Anniversary','When Ellen and Paul’s son Josh introduces his new girlfriend at their 25th anniversary party, no one suspects that it is the beginning of the end for this happy family. The new girlfriend is Liz, Ellen’s former student, who left the university, some years before, after Ellen called her out in class for her radical ideology.','/sSdpXGBNt3mQzjZZVK6eV5NcPdc.jpg','2025-10-29',111,'Released','What holds them together will tear them apart.','Anniversary',1126336,9.9684,6.9,'Uk6LhwvTYrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25719,_binary '\0','/58D6ZAvOKxlHjyX9S8qNKSBE9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12584954',6.5,200438,'en','Twisters','As storm season intensifies, the paths of former storm chaser Kate Carter and reckless social-media superstar Tyler Owens collide when terrifying phenomena never seen before are unleashed. The pair and their competing teams find themselves squarely in the paths of multiple storm systems converging over central Oklahoma in the fight of their lives.','/pjnD08FlMAIXsfOLKQbvmO0f0MD.jpg','2024-07-10',123,'Released','Chase. Ride. Survive.','Twisters',718821,13.7802,6.757,'AZbEi95SuMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25720,_binary '\0','/rk860hTM0kpu8oNhQkpnDv320rH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12585076',5.6,6890,'en','Moonshot','In a future where Mars is terraformed and colonized by the best humanity has to offer, two very different college students wind up joining forces and sneak onboard a space shuttle to the red planet in order to be united with their significant others.','/thqgzBPEDYQX0taszVus5nYMtTZ.jpg','2022-05-05',104,'Released','Find the space to connect.','Moonshot',767825,3.8392,6.5,'oHqfe3LcOOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25721,_binary '\0','/vBwpFKgAXWkXBm7IaGf3445u5nY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12585254',6.4,1673,'it','Lacci','Naples, early 1980s. The strained marriage between Aldo and Vanda is fractured one evening when Aldo admits, unprompted, his infidelity. Equally hurt and bewildered, Vanda attempts to hide her pain from the couple\'s two school-age kids, lest they discover that their cramped apartment is not a home of trust and love. 30 years later, Aldo and Vanda are still tied together, but their relationship with each other and their children continues to be defined by what happened all those years ago.','/sdxSGa9cqsvlOZuvRtcH2Nu0ebE.jpg','2020-10-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Ties',659290,2.0034,6.7,'I3A9cRp-bHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25722,_binary '\0','/81RGgMQW0O2jCNYDPPzgCCAXuqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12587564',6.2,1217,'en','Coastal Elites','A socially distanced comedic satire that spotlights five characters breaking down and breaking through as they grapple with politics, culture, and the pandemic.','/oKe5dPzGHXCgDHqlVoqVcAM3qeN.jpg','2020-09-12',87,'Released','Five confessions about coping with the new abnormal...','Coastal Elites',728203,1.8367,5.8,'-PPxOYC_kgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25723,_binary '\0','/bTeyNpG9PczQbgeQuSndkMuLlna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1258972',5.4,65872,'en','The Man with the Iron Fists','In feudal China, a blacksmith who makes weapons for a small village is put in the position where he must defend himself and his fellow villagers.','/nHgkRj6Igx3QsHmTyF4oAfBjAE7.jpg','2012-11-02',96,'Released','You can\'t spell Kung Fu without F and U!','The Man with the Iron Fists',97430,7.9732,5.515,'3swVdu41Ixg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25724,_binary '\0','/nnSjkUOJGfKTy4bnVPsbl4pyL0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1259014',7.5,36884,'fr','L\'Instinct de mort','Jacques Mesrine, a loyal son and dedicated soldier, is back home and living with his parents after serving in the Algerian War. Soon he is seduced by the neon glamour of sixties Paris and the easy money it presents. Mentored by Guido, Mesrine turns his back on middle class law-abiding and soon moves swiftly up the criminal ladder.','/zCyuiyIhbhgEOZde81qTgXbO0pw.jpg','2008-10-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Mesrine: Killer Instinct',13635,5.2314,7.3,'n0O-P4bSWfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25725,_binary '\0','/aqm0i13UOmow0K30gB1hrNYpJca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12592252',4.8,12915,'en','Songbird','During a pandemic lockdown, Nico, a young man with rare immunity, must overcome martial law, murderous vigilantes and a powerful family to reunite with his love, Sara.','/pm7pstYup0ZHpImjT0k6YyxGVkX.jpg','2020-12-10',85,'Released','The only way out is together.','Songbird',721625,8.8118,6.149,'IgxXSfto6Vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25726,_binary '\0','/neTa6DHyNtV3QHXFIB0NI2dd4vi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1259227',5.9,1232,'en','SoulBoy','1974. Amidst power cuts, strikes and boot-boy aggro on the football terraces, Joe McCain is bored of a life that\'s going nowhere. Enter hair-dresser Jane: blonde, beautiful, and moving to the beat of a whole new world of sound, movement and all-nighter dancing at The Wigan Casino - the home of Northern Soul. Swept along on this tide of pulsating dance and lust, Joe becomes embroiled in the darker side of soul scene that will put his friendship to the test.','/a1pnapf4byyR7mOQsNexFF8O8mu.jpg','2010-06-04',80,'Released',NULL,'SoulBoy',50715,1.1228,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25727,_binary '\0','/y2Ca1neKke2mGPMaHzlCNDVZqsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12593682',7.3,547655,'en','Bullet Train','Unlucky assassin Ladybug is determined to do his job peacefully after one too many gigs gone off the rails. Fate, however, may have other plans, as Ladybug\'s latest mission puts him on a collision course with lethal adversaries from around the globe—all with connected, yet conflicting, objectives—on the world\'s fastest train.','/j8szC8OgrejDQjjMKSVXyaAjw3V.jpg','2022-07-20',126,'Released','The end of the line is just the beginning.','Bullet Train',718930,28.56,7.4,'0IOsk2Vlc4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25728,_binary '\0','/xqWBALRFiprKpUoTY1GB28Ev4xw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1259520',6,1221,'es','Bon appétit','A romantic comedy centered on two young cooks and a female sommelier working in a famous Zurich luxury restaurant.','/v8XW