ut his or her surroundings and environment molds him or her growth as well. With the growth, his or her music begins to take a shape and changes too,\" A musical spectacle featuring mega stars and melodious voices contributed by leading singers of Indian Film Industry.','/i51JVxfkGTRfKCQFhoCk1dHIfh0.jpg','2022-08-19',157,'Released',NULL,'Bismillah',718574,1.2303,4,'LN64hQOrRBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25748,_binary '\0','/cdU26QAHSfjmswI5L4IR4VZrxoK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261393',7.1,1286,'es','El estudiante','After retiring to the beautiful Mexican town of Guanajuato, a 70 year old decides to follow his dreams and enroll at the university where he stumbles upon a new generation and they are bound together by the novel Don Quijote de la Mancha.','/yxVME0RZEHPthkR5yLYsLgGTwWF.jpg','2009-08-14',95,'Released',NULL,'El estudiante',48502,1.0484,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25749,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261414',3.4,1293,'en','Penance','A young mother becomes a stripper to earn some fast cash, only to find her worst nightmares are about to begin.','/txsEnkPtOiOyvdWTluWrrDz8NoE.jpg','2009-05-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Penance',30286,1.4946,3.6,'e0KCcucRHeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25750,_binary '\0','/ptwrDEMi22n9ejCA7DIs0igF7f4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12616480',5.7,12814,'en','Slingshot','An elite trio of astronauts aboard a years-long, possibly compromised mission to Saturn\'s moon, Titan, gears up for a highly dangerous slingshot manoeuvre that will either catapult them to Titan or into deep space.','/e6cCBe7DQOn9OFdFJ0eyVwSC8hR.jpg','2024-08-30',109,'Released','Some fears are darker than space.','Slingshot',916728,4.4763,6.054,'YxNGunBCDtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25751,_binary '\0','/1KrolNvmvd2axR1a8ilq8aXwQhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261843',6.6,1606,'en','Kobe Doin\' Work','A documentary following Kobe Bryant during one day of the 2008 NBA playoffs.','/wQs3bTIAe6jyerGR2RJnK3ZYzZW.jpg','2009-05-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Kobe Doin\' Work',30599,1.228,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25752,_binary '\0','/w81qHqr1CdbdRco8jpmu6lXMqyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12618926',7.1,40900,'es','Madres paralelas','Two unmarried women who have become pregnant by accident and are about to give birth meet in a hospital room: Janis, in her late-thirties, unrepentant and happy; Ana, a teenager, remorseful and frightened.','/gDaxYkYNbHuM2VlUazbcpnFZB6d.jpg','2021-10-08',123,'Released',NULL,'Parallel Mothers',766798,8.3425,6.8,'37w22jtmdRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25753,_binary '\0','/gYtYSp17dEpQybJSDsuJmi8bUJZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261900',7.1,2252,'en','Lovecraft: Fear of the Unknown','A chronicle of the life, work and mind that created the Cthulhu mythos.','/2pQUzBpALk2aSApgQW43xJE7l1H.jpg','2008-07-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Lovecraft: Fear of the Unknown',44038,1.84,7.2,'QqQBNMh_zm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25754,_binary '\0','/gPqqEBBpSl7E4Fz8uMBqoBLxcTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261945',4.6,89188,'en','Sex and the City 2','Carrie, Charlotte, and Miranda are all married now, but they\'re still up for a little fun in the sun. When Samantha gets the chance to visit one of the most extravagant vacation destinations on the planet and offers to bring them all along, they surmise that a women-only retreat may be the perfect excuse to eschew their responsibilities and remember what life was like before they decided to settle down.','/6CtFxG3WbeS8khj0Wzshmqg2zLM.jpg','2010-05-26',146,'Released','Carrie on.','Sex and the City 2',37786,8.328,6.039,'pY7sAJm8Fuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25755,_binary '\0','/xR75PgmIxhS6ChjNUKgz4krC9MR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12619462',4.7,4110,'en','The Man in My Basement','Down on his luck, Charles Blakey agrees to rent his basement to a mysterious stranger, unaware he may be letting in a force much darker than he imagined.','/1zpeH8wOrM8p2TTAmBetwhe2BIx.jpg','2025-09-12',115,'Released',NULL,'The Man in My Basement',957121,3.3164,5.4,'TzTBiay8-zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25756,_binary '\0','/aWKUP5B1NwonHoViRh8HG2N3icY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1261954',6.8,8589,'en','Take Me Home','In New York City, Thom is broke and jobless, illegally working as a taxi driver. Claire is a successful business-woman, but personally she\'s in shambles - then comes the phone call that her estranged father is in the hospital. Not knowing what to do, Claire hops in Thom\'s cab and orders him to just drive and so he does. They find themselves in Pennsylvania and Claire makes the rash decision to drive across the country to California. On the road, there are many detours as the obstacles and secrets force them to learn about themselves and each other.','/4kYbG53ka8Wc8tctkaBbzcRA5CB.jpg','2011-03-02',97,'Released',NULL,'Take Me Home',85431,2.5814,6.5,'F5K-Dl4DUV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25757,_binary '\0','/8CUMTiKTPTyr4ww0VODd3m5Zz70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262406',3,1855,'en','Fading of the Cries','Jacob, a young man armed with a deadly sword, saves Sarah, a teenage girl, from Mathias, a malevolent evil that has begun plaguing a small farmland town while in search of an ancient necklace that had belonged to Sarah\'s uncle. Jacob sets out to get Sarah home safely, running through streets, fields, churches and underground tunnels, while being pursued by hordes of demonic creatures. Along the way, both come to terms with the demons within themselves - Sarah begins to understand her hatred towards her mother and sister may be unjustified and Jacob discovers the secrets of his past, realizing the only way to truly defeat the demons is to return to the very place his family was murdered.','/dyV2nITyo5GyGmrLnDeipjRpizd.jpg','2009-08-11',90,'Released','The journey home is just the beginning','Fading of the Cries',42916,1.9721,3.5,'BMOMrGch2TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25758,_binary '\0','/uk1OsdDBulhrSA3LFx7mBfIDKYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262413',4.9,3427,'en','Offspring','The local sheriff of Dead River, Maine, thought he had killed them off ten years ago -- a primitive, cave-dwelling tribe of cannibalistic savages. But somehow the clan survived. To breed. To hunt. To kill and eat. And now the peaceful residents of this isolated town are fighting for their lives...','/jiQbghAlmvVTW0eFBbuPNGTO73y.jpg','2009-02-05',79,'Released','They’ll lust for your life.','Offspring',24868,1.542,5.109,'86EePnIkyV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25759,_binary '\0','/c5EmNhLQsTTKAyUHULnKYQjlloz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262416',6.3,194187,'en','Scream 4','Fifteen years after the original Woodsboro murders, Sidney Prescott returns home to promote her new book about surviving trauma, only for a new Ghostface killer to emerge, targeting a new group of teens.','/3cf8p2qw9qnsaaFWc64AG6U05eT.jpg','2011-04-13',111,'Released','New decade. New rules.','Scream 4',41446,13.2013,6.5,'HQUmkietlYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25760,_binary '\0','/w22GVYotTIVC1dUd58mRhwPqiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262426',7.3,257463,'en','Wicked','In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two\'s unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.','/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg','2024-10-16',162,'Released','Everyone deserves the chance to fly.','Wicked',402431,24.1004,6.9,'6COmYeLsz4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25761,_binary '\0','/75mjiGG6ZJdibckg3gfoTrytDKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12624584',4.8,1624,'en','Untitled Horror Movie','Set on computer screens and found footage style content, the movie follows six actors who decide to shoot their own horror movie as their hit TV show is on the brink of cancellation. In their search for a plot, they unintentionally summon a spirit with an affinity for violence, who starts picking them off one by one.','/HizqO0Htv6e68pWu0gzsoDthXq.jpg','2021-06-12',87,'Released','You\'ll die laughing.','Untitled Horror Movie',720407,2.0439,4.454,'LBdH8yFGCDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25762,_binary '\0','/2J1ZBQKaRBuVjqd2VvZtMtZyjVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12625756',7,6178,'ml','ചുരുളി','Two cops undercover trailing a fugitive enter a hamlet inside a dense forest. At every turn, they encounter a mysterious character who further misleads them into new labyrinths.','/gSjykY5ZuVWHK0C7k4CXZ5566No.jpg','2021-02-12',114,'Released',NULL,'Churuli',721636,1.4553,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25763,_binary '\0','/q7jEo6UkM7HsBioHJ3BpUnfgnjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12627606',6.4,2422,'en','Midas Man','When Brian Epstein set foot in the Cavern Club in November 1961 to watch The Beatles perform, he saw something no one else could – a glimmer of gold. Sharply dressed and well-spoken, Brian was hardly the most obvious radical – but being Jewish, closeted and having grown up as an outsider who had failed at pretty much everything, he was a 26-year old with something to prove and who wanted to tear up the rulebook.','/4nAfF0Szcb72eRn9WwRFsdvZu5q.jpg','2024-08-23',112,'Released','Managing The Fab Four was the easy part','Midas Man',819277,2.7393,6.3,'CzDYxAwoUWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25764,_binary '\0','/cMW3hiXiGuAP6X3Nbjr7AvxEszc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262877',3.5,1794,'fr','Coco','Coco is a French comedy released in 2009 and produced by Gad Elmaleh. This is the first embodiment of the actor, adapted from a sketch in the show La Vie Normale. Coco talks about organizing a Bar Mitzvah.','/xQ7gSJIlF4wG6qcaRmiVGBiTKWW.jpg','2009-07-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Coco',18955,1.7975,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25765,_binary '\0','/tsEVQYXcmvjbMlZO8q2ypRjaajR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262981',6.8,42514,'en','World\'s Greatest Dad','In the wake of a freak accident, Lance suffers the worst tragedy and the greatest opportunity of his life. He is suddenly faced with the possibility of fame, fortune and popularity, if he can only live with the knowledge of how he got there.','/1ESsZLvZPIvbCPCh7CPCSnF4EeH.jpg','2009-08-20',99,'Released','Lance Clayton is about to get everything he deserves.','World\'s Greatest Dad',20178,6.0181,6.604,'VBzZvAzAMvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25766,_binary '\0','/fDPgKRIjbtVcJXTMETyQjJNhhXq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1262990',5,3791,'en','Paradise','After surviving a plane crash a young conservative woman suffers a crisis of faith.','/ghBJXpOeQ6IQN00Eq2d9WVtnefH.jpg','2013-10-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Paradise',152756,2.279,4.9,'Blu3_Mxpimc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25767,_binary '\0','/xW7JwirAmeVP26bkV98vV1JgHvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12631654',5.7,1358,'ml','രണ്ട്','Randu is a socio-political satire that hilariously portrays how the quite normal life of a village youth namely Vava is disturbed by the acts of some communal groups in the village. The current social atmosphere and political events add to his challenges. Can he make things straight through his wit and innocence?','/hZV7RFihxEqrX3T9GbLqtaTwrGh.jpg','2022-01-07',122,'Released',NULL,'Randu',893680,0.6742,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25768,_binary '\0','/v46Cqa8w2dS3beMLP2H2iEKf8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263670',7.2,99737,'en','Crazy Heart','When reporter Jean Craddock interviews Bad Blake—an alcoholic, seen-better-days country music legend—they connect, and the hard-living crooner sees a possible saving grace in a life with Jean and her young son.','/zwao2YMsqf27IzNEtDNWSe0W9jH.jpg','2009-12-16',112,'Released','The harder the life, the sweeter the song.','Crazy Heart',25196,5.1114,6.91,'Y0349E7kFEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25769,_binary '\0','/ig4YEivtgePAKLms4bEzuR475m4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263679',7.3,2746,'hi','फ़िराक','Firaaq is an Urdu word that means both separation and quest. The film is a work of fiction, based on a thousand stories. The story is set over a 24-hour period, one month after a campaign that took place in Gujarat, India, in 2002. It traces the emotional journey of ordinary people- some who were victims, some perpetrators and some who choose to watch silently.','/6p7eoDgHughtjhr2O3Akkbt1165.jpg','2009-03-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Firaaq',22241,1.2456,6.158,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25770,_binary '\0','/rHMNpe68Nf006rc2w1br4HxQ95D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12636872',3.2,3736,'en','Karen','A racist woman makes it her personal mission to displace the new black family that has just moved in next door to her, but they won\'t back down without a fight.','/a8J5xyJIPiNG2FGQVMt4IHHaY9M.jpg','2021-09-03',89,'Released','Not all neighbors are friendly.','Karen',735981,1.673,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25771,_binary '\0','/sTFCld3IiB9V5apfY8tiD3UavJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263704',7.5,1433,'en','Stanley Kubrick\'s Boxes','A few years after his death, the widow of Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999) asks Jon Ronson to look through the contents of about 1,000 boxes of meticulously sorted materials Kubrick left. Ronson finds that most contain materials reflecting work Kubrick did after the release of \"Barry Lyndon\" in 1975, when Kubrick\'s film output slowed down. Ronson finds audition tapes for \"Full Metal Jacket,\" photographs to find the right hat for \"Clockwork Orange\" or the right doorway for \"Eyes Wide Shut\" -- thousands of details that went into Kubrick\'s meticulous approach. Ronson believes that the boxes show \"the rhythm of genius.\" Interviews with family, staff, and friends are included.','/svi87pIHWohYQrI0yowbdLhPcSp.jpg','2008-07-15',48,'Released',NULL,'Stanley Kubrick\'s Boxes',97394,1.3164,7,'htQq3oYO5sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25772,_binary '\0','/zdjEslgEvwiAAGDNpterAfan3L7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12637442',6.7,1879,'es','Clara Sola','In a remote village in Costa Rica, Clara, a withdrawn 40-year-old woman, experiences a sexual and mystical awakening as she begins a journey to free herself from the repressive religious and social conventions which have dominated her life.','/hiNpCAQJiE812sdfhanGsUecRrh.jpg','2021-10-01',106,'Released',NULL,'Clara Sola',785212,2.136,6.5,'S96QRt8VHL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25773,_binary '\0','/abQxLSkGxpHyUxRjRXACt8NbiGf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263750',6,28425,'es','Habitación en Roma','A hotel room in the center of Rome serves as the setting for Alba and Natasha, two sexy and recently acquainted women, to have a physical adventure that touches their very souls.','/w90ItYf9qagQKVEBr1uFxPomAtf.jpg','2010-05-07',109,'Released','A night of passion that will change their lives.','Room in Rome',48650,19.5564,6.411,'27gpqR5ADUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25774,_binary '\0','/3w0Kl9ZvRRGKFlE3lUXBGZOOzoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12637548',7.5,1860,'te','అర్థ శతాబ్దం','After five decades of Independence, India\'s rural landscape still throws up unanswerable questions. Can a love story bring a revolution? Witness this earthy love story set in the early 2000s.','/sjGMCA1U4K0jMiPa8mtyMqDnVLs.jpg','2021-06-11',116,'Released',NULL,'Ardha Shathabdham',839207,0.7846,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25775,_binary '\0','/xxYMApIgM0LGqvaqO8cMIfFnASG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263778',6.6,8650,'fr','La Belle Personne','In the wake of her mother\'s tragic death, French teenager Junie transfers to a different high school. Though Junie lives mostly inside her own head, her beauty and stoicism win her the attention of the entire male student population. Junie begins dating the gentle Otto Cleves, but finds herself intensely drawn to her youthful Italian language teacher, Nemours. When Nemours begins to reciprocate, serious complications ensue.','/qRMvvfrRL7VDeLOMusggY1RC8pb.jpg','2008-09-17',97,'Released',NULL,'The Beautiful Person',38846,3.3185,6.513,'_mRnDlRNDhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25776,_binary '\0','/daDwKRXzcOVlb2weZhDzCADGuFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263790',7.4,1660,'ta','காதலா! காதலா!','Two friends, both with the name of Lingam, create a comedy of errors and consequent chaos with their girlfriends and their families.','/a499eAixHz3C3P7WbGnKzy8sSvv.jpg','1998-04-10',160,'Released',NULL,'Kadhala Kadhala',66349,1.3439,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25777,_binary '\0','/5LReUv8Xr9F2AKUcvB7Ia8lu2BM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1263800',2.9,3437,'en','Hole in One','Eric, a highly-gifted golfer but radically-undisciplined college undergrad, finds his world drastically altered after losing a golf bet to a pair of sadistic plastic surgeons. Eric\'s bad-boy attitude lifestyle comes to a screeching halt as he loses his money, his girlfriend, his dignity and his golf swing. Eric and his best friend Tyler decide to take on the doctors, in a final golf match of \"Best-Ball\" to get his life back and become the man he should have been all along.','/Af7Vt2GaMDIfzEnrUVJevYk0Kek.jpg','2009-09-12',95,'Released','Big Risk, Big Rewards & Big Attitude!','Hole in One',45781,2.3531,4.5,'X8CJYm3EAfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25778,_binary '\0','/lgZwNFTIkahQRrOA3owdEFdDPiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1264068',6.8,1563,'en','Aftermath: Population Zero','Aftermath: Population Zero investigates what would happen if every single person on Earth simply disappeared. Explore the interactive world without us.','/hJwrpM6W4Jr6uFoysG1XBsFSQTY.jpg','2008-03-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Aftermath: Population Zero',16091,1.551,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25779,_binary '\0','/s8Mdcgn07ia1q0xYrBQ96SAZ6id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1264115',5.7,2122,'en','The Trial','After the horrific death of his wife and two sons, suicide seems to be the only escape for small town attorney Kent \"Mac\" McClain... until he\'s assigned a capital punishment case that begins to transform his life and those around him forever.','/jM5jAE7lHznh2JbK5yGxThGkL4l.jpg','2010-09-10',100,'Released','He lost his family. Now he must rediscover his faith.','The Trial',49057,2.0251,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25780,_binary '\0','/lY8H3cv8IKnW4hvyoUCnyTDSvc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12642180',7.9,1793,'hi','रामसिंह चार्ली','An avalanche hits Ramsingh\'s life when his bread and butter as a Charlie Chaplin impersonator comes to a halt. With this sudden dip in his life, will he be able to walk the tightrope between responsibility & passion?','/5p1ceaanKLs3nzwKDmzukh2qdSp.jpg','2020-08-28',97,'Released',NULL,'Ram Singh Charlie',735182,0.9908,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25781,_binary '\0','/bDd8wcvenWh8Gx84DnDKJgwXmNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12648266',6.3,4124,'en','Accused','After a revenge obsessed society incorrectly selects its next target, a young man must survive the night as the online witch-hunt arrives at his front door.','/jiXcYP1JwPj57JljO8mOIvFqPpx.jpg','2023-10-05',88,'Released','Wrong time. Wrong place. Wrong man.','Accused',912974,2.4847,6.2,'HvWCrdDz5pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25782,_binary '\0','/3Htc2zBX8hjRj1lDJkGz8AmvimX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1264895',6.1,1723,'en','Moonlight & Mistletoe','After three years, Nick\'s estranged daughter Holly returns home to find the spirit of Christmas in Santaville has dwindled, taking the family business with it. What starts out as an attempt to bail out her dad, ends up rekindling Holly\'s belief in Christmas all over again.','/jgYquX1UtZmsGULe5v5PtC104nL.jpg','2008-11-29',88,'Released','A little town. A little romance. A little miracle.','Moonlight & Mistletoe',51443,1.53,5.8,'Jp6J9g1xyRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25783,_binary '\0','/cKPGIs0T8FMHMukaOEanP9Yxgbg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1264904',7.1,15047,'fr','Le Petit Nicolas','Nicolas has a happy existence, parents who love him, a great group of friends with whom he has great fun, and all he wants is that nothing changes. However, one day, he overhears a conversation that leads him to believe that his life might change forever, his mother is pregnant! He panics and envisions the worst.','/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg','2009-09-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Little Nicholas',31203,3.0737,6.1,'t2mfwvWCsfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25784,_binary '\0','/yWyc4MZqX2O3LmvQNOal7ZzZaeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1264914',7.2,5774,'bg','Дзифт','Moth is freed on parole after spending time in prison on a wrongful conviction of murder. Jailed shortly before the Bulgarian communist coup of 1944, he now finds himself in a new and alien world— the totalitarian Sofia of the 60s. His first night of freedom draws the map of a diabolical city full of decaying neighborhoods, gloomy streets, and a bizarre parade of characters.','/lc1YoLe1VZ2jUvEy7dqIh176o03.jpg','2008-06-27',92,'Released','The night of the man who chewed asphalt.','Zift',19152,1.6984,6.2,'rR4EiUSoCqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25785,_binary '\0','/1L47D6QqZdiTvcAkgPp8aZKq8MZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12653060',6.7,1622,'sr','Necista krv Greh predaka','The film follows the story of Hadzi Trifun, a prominent Serbian merchant, who tries to keep the peace with the Turkish authorities, but also maintains his reputation and influence in Vranje, an important Turkish town near the border with liberated Serbia. While Trifun is preparing his two sons to succeed him as the leaders of the Serbian people, he is suffering not only from powerful Turkish beys, but also from his family. Trifun makes difficult decisions that will later affect his descendants, the heroes of the novel Impure Blood by Serbian writer Bora Stankovic.','/iIqLWdL1SN3d49rHcOc3zn8IVyB.jpg','2021-08-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Necista krv Greh predaka',865561,1.4092,2.75,'-iFqVz-zhC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25786,_binary '\0','/l57Hoy9prfwpewKm7PEYxOiJeMr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12655436',5.3,4687,'en','Honk for Jesus. Save Your Soul.','In the aftermath of a huge scandal, Trinitie Childs, the first lady of a prominent Southern Baptist Mega Church, attempts to help her pastor-husband, Lee-Curtis Childs, rebuild their congregation.','/gC5HfzG2xUbqSPaXPdqTiE94c79.jpg','2022-09-02',103,'Released','Lord help us.','Honk for Jesus. Save Your Soul.',848331,2.9389,4.6,'YuI_R9JEkRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25787,_binary '\0','/5tjLs17GK6XHAU1oztx97U97WF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1265621',3.1,2399,'en','Quantum Apocalypse','A group of talented but rebellious \'rock-star scientists\' find themselves in a race against time to save Earth when a comet makes an unexpected turn towards our blue planet where all life may cease to exist within days if our small town heroes fail to find a solution.','/7hMBhDknvIDFtkohTcggXvIwYxg.jpg','2010-02-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Quantum Apocalypse',32206,2.0383,3.8,'tNVV5n0N_hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25788,_binary '\0','/501U1FiY8ylubAlDbz6UcTHxvfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1265990',4.8,44480,'en','The Roommate','When Sara, a young design student from Iowa, arrives for college in Los Angeles, she is eager to fit in and get to know the big city. Her wealthy roommate, Rebecca, is more than eager to take Sara under her wing and show her the ropes. The two become close, but when Sara begins to branch out and make more friends on campus, Rebecca becomes resentful. Alarmed, Sara moves in with her new boyfriend, causing Rebecca\'s behavior to take a violent turn.','/kQZcOn5rDuwpbQTluC4Wm0amYmR.jpg','2011-02-04',91,'Released','2,000 colleges. 8 million roommates. Which one will you get?','The Roommate',49950,6.4237,5.4,'7NX30f8b1Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25789,_binary '\0','/4rNjTccVltQHKKJd6INzqHtfV5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1265998',7.1,10223,'en','Afro Samurai: Resurrection','Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman from his past. The sparks of violence dropped along Afro’s bloody path now burn out of control – and nowhere are the flames of hatred more intense than in the eyes of Sio.','/6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg','2009-04-24',101,'Released','There\'s no such thing as final vengeance!','Afro Samurai: Resurrection',14711,3.1169,6.9,'GDLv1x2bi4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25790,_binary '\0','/ouMbyjN1WJKyRqgvwovGl58e4eR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266029',7.1,41146,'en','Nowhere Boy','A rebellious teenager, future Beatle John Lennon lives with his Aunt Mimi in working-class mid-1950s Liverpool, England. Mimi\'s husband suddenly dies, and John spies his mother Julia at the funeral. Despite Mimi\'s misgivings, John intends to have a real relationship with his mother. Julia introduces him to popular music and the banjo and, though a family conflict looms, young John is inspired to form his own band.','/hNSxa74x44QN3sohb44dtUYGjw6.jpg','2009-12-25',98,'Released','As a boy all John Lennon needed was love.','Nowhere Boy',33511,4.6098,7.159,'a-lAIGGK8O4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25791,_binary '\0','/l9lK7UeF7LslXhbUsINJBrZ3VI0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266036',5.5,4603,'en','Valley Girl','Set to a new wave \'80s soundtrack, Julie, a girl from the valley, meets Randy, a punk from the city. They are from different worlds and find love. Somehow they need to stay together in spite of her trendy, shallow friends.','/3ZdJN62RyjoQJ9S4zCbjtMQrYqE.jpg','2020-05-08',102,'Released','The awesomest love story ever told.','Valley Girl',482273,4.5462,5.6,'pLhYFWwACo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25792,_binary '\0','/42NVkOpoy9p88v8acxqZDzuB22q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266037',7,2075,'fr','Quartier Lointain','Thomas, a father in his fifties, returns by chance to the town where he grew up. He collapses and wakes up forty years earlier in the body of his teenage self. Thrown back into his past, Thomas will not only have to re-live his first love, but also try to understand the reasons for his father’s mysterious departure. Can you change the past by living it again?','/wLLx74H0789Vvf4u5TTJEkdIh2p.jpg','2010-05-20',98,'Released',NULL,'A Distant Neighborhood',62871,2.5242,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25793,_binary '\0','/19rGXWNlivV7U9atopacKBQwRtD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12660882',6.9,1659,'en','Wedding Every Weekend','Nate and Brooke are going to the same four weddings, four weekends in a row. To avoid the singles tables and set-ups, they agree to go together as \"wedding buddies.\" But what starts as a friendship soon becomes something deeper.','/p4SuUiPEtsk61VNVKpO8ayF9M4A.jpg','2020-08-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Wedding Every Weekend',725854,1.5927,6.6,'xC8NsGH9zCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25794,_binary '\0','/eirYxyg8B0NfQBKgblOgyYGNRji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266121',3.7,1312,'en','Wolvesbayne','A supernatural thriller that follows Russel Bayne who quickly finds himself in the middle of a supernatural war between vampires, werewolves, and human hunters after being bitten by a werewolf. To make matters worse, it seems a civil war has erupted among the vampires, with a clan breaking from the others in a quest to return a vampire goddess back to power.','/pY6mkRIZnU1qUWxPx26u2uJdLgz.jpg','2009-10-12',87,'Released','Part human. All terror.','Wolvesbayne',24799,1.7438,4.4,'UmpT4L3sOIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25795,_binary '\0','/hXTWVJMsI9BkxMLliqL1j0FT55t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12663250',6.3,5396,'ko','야차','Nicknamed after a human-devouring spirit, the ruthless leader of an overseas black ops team takes up a dangerous mission in a city riddled with spies.','/whZ8OkI7W8cBOmtoiFyb72Ekt3U.jpg','2022-04-08',125,'Released','The battle of spies begins.','Yaksha: Ruthless Operations',606402,5.5626,6.633,'G71-DM4X01A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25796,_binary '\0','/bDFI9ix7k6FAeZ0O4urYuY3XNzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12663772',6.8,1365,'ko','이상한 나라의 수학자','Ji-woo, an outcast at a prestigious private school, meets Hak-sung, the school janitor who is actually a mathematical genius who defected from North Korea.','/ypUHhgPyawYu2SeTHMmaYUZ9HaF.jpg','2022-03-18',117,'Released','A genius mathematician with a hidden past and a needy student given up on math.','In Our Prime',628802,2.2795,8,'0iynF8yAgFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25797,_binary '\0','/nhZtDAivYEpOHQZKJRoVFoJb2a9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12664618',6.2,3565,'ko','싱크홀','A working class family move into a new condo purchased after 11 years of hard work. They throw a housewarming party to show his co-workers when overnight a heavy downpour creates an extremely deep sinkhole that engulfs the entire building.','/5FrWufyfRvmR1oVFKoEUslTBaS.jpg','2021-08-11',113,'Released','A house earned after 11 years of effort falls deep into the ground in a minute.','Sinkhole',623135,4.3133,6.9,'yplV4VqoLVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25798,_binary '\0','/xD2M9BAaeCmITCwojKI8Ek1R1yF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266542',4.8,1659,'en','The Break-up Artist','A woman who gets paid to break people up is forced to become a matchmaker when some new competition muscles her out of the break-up business. Now, in order to save her company (and keep her high-priced wardrobe) she\'ll have to rely on her old nemesis: love.','/lqa5c7se84Pm0lJgd1AJsZtEnA3.jpg','2009-03-07',105,'Released','Breaking up is easy to do!','The Break-up Artist',25356,1.7636,4.3,'Ok8zYlkQ6WQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25799,_binary '\0','/xzYUQDElwbz4J60iygomc7cJYwP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1266583',7.6,6805,'hi','Mumbai Meri Jaan','When a series of bombs explode in train stations throughout Mumbai, a disparate group of locals are affected in different ways. Thomas, who sells tea, meets Rupali, a reporter coping with the death of her fiancé. Meanwhile, Suresh, who is struggling with financial woes, begins to be overly suspect of all Muslims. For Sunil, a policeman working on the case, there is frustration at realizing his corrupt boss is still on the take.','/pzxh642LtRJLpCksGjCdUk9aiIk.jpg','2008-08-22',119,'Released',NULL,'Mumbai Meri Jaan',16537,1.1958,7.145,'patArYFVrho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25800,_binary '\0','/5duczg2TFa1PqaoA7vMEgVKxCCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1267160',7,4647,'zh','海角七號','Aga, a band singer, returns to Hengchun with frustration. Tomoko is a Japanese model assigned to organize a local warm-up band for the Japanese super star beach concert. Together with other five ordinary Hengchun residents who were not expected to be great or anything, they formed an impossible band.','/7LUTL0OJcDiF9NbXgVQkCVJlEMc.jpg','2008-08-22',129,'Released','Everyone\'s heart contains an undelivered love letter.','Cape No. 7',19939,1.5083,6.5,'wq2IGmNajy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25801,_binary '\0','/lx89oBeJIastndjbQxznnfSYpmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12672536',6.7,27580,'fr','Les Trois Mousquetaires : D\'Artagnan','D\'Artagnan, a spirited young Gascon, is left for dead after trying to save a noblewoman from being kidnapped. Once in Paris, he tries by all means to find his attackers, unaware that his quest will lead him to the very heart of a war where the future of France is at stake. Aided by King\'s Musketeers Athos, Porthos and Aramis, he faces the machinations of villainous Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter, while falling in love with Constance, the Queen\'s confidante.','/hfExJPcbBtDeFDEb7I1By72Drlr.jpg','2023-04-05',121,'Released','One for all and all for France!','The Three Musketeers: D\'Artagnan',796185,13.5623,6.903,'IAizCzFkHI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25802,_binary '\0','/tWVXGyDNQM7zRKp162PSdBSgCzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12672620',6.4,13160,'fr','Les Trois Mousquetaires : Milady','D\'Artagnan, on a quest to rescue the abducted Constance, runs into the mysterious Milady de Winter again. The tension between the Catholics and the Protestants finally escalates, as the king declares war — forcing the now four musketeers into battle. But as the war goes on, they are tested physically, mentally and emotionally.','/3biswIjw14uDVil12nMOxcTAfmH.jpg','2023-12-13',115,'Released','The epic adventure continues...','The Three Musketeers: Milady',845111,7.7688,6.4,'P1HfovIccgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25803,_binary '\0','/nl18gyzai02Tu99VkURu7kCFrR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1267297',6,174011,'en','Hercules','When a new enemy threatens the innocent, Hercules must lead his fearless team of warriors in a battle against overwhelming odds.','/sKNIwY6UENCJ36FvYvnBW3Vdzt7.jpg','2014-07-23',98,'Released','Before he was a legend, he was a man.','Hercules',184315,20.4439,5.8,'HydiAICZq6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25804,_binary '\0','/6IZqrGf06xdaHCt3FmROZcJ7aeu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1267299',4.2,8285,'en','The Rocky Horror Picture Show: Let\'s Do the Time Warp Again','After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr. Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.','/56KEpnJWe5KvpiPu5XmK14L7Wyr.jpg','2016-10-20',88,'Released','Transcend your expectations','The Rocky Horror Picture Show: Let\'s Do the Time Warp Again',377448,3.0527,5.072,'YkYPkO0ckdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25805,_binary '\0','/jTCg5QJGahmKpqD6i7wnFGtystc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1267319',5.5,5410,'en','Home Movie','Reverend David Poe and his psychiatrist wife trade hectic New York life for an idyllic rural farmhouse; the perfect place for 10 year old twins Jack & Emily to run, play and imagine. Documenting this lifestyle change, David decides to film every holiday and special family event. To the Poe\'s horror their home movies reveal an increasing malice and evil within their children.','/iy3c2eeEW714ZJ8t0NtsS1wZTiK.jpg','2008-10-23',77,'Released','Some memories are best forgotten.','Home Movie',27258,2.1821,5,'B6AhOAhvcWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25806,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1267500',4,1482,'hi','फूँक','A realtor fires one of his co-workers and out of spite, the co-worker and his wife does black magic on his daughter. Being an atheist, he shuns his mother and wife\'s theories on the supernatural and relies on a doctor for his daughter\'s treatment.','/6v5Tcek4RzzlopN7bVF8jjnh9gs.jpg','2008-08-22',179,'Released','It\'s Supersitions Until It Happens To You','Phoonk',15979,0.9477,3.5,'sXXZfuPHcLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25807,_binary '\0','/nGpSo9gDtHOM9lpFCqOD3rjbhd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12676006',5.3,5543,'en','Borrego','A young botanist relocates to a small desert town to study an invasive plant species. While out on research, she comes to the aid of a downed plane only to find herself taken captive by an inexperienced drug mule who forces her to lead a trek across the sweltering desert to his drop. A local sheriff is drawn into the hunt as his rebellious daughter sets out to find the missing botanist, all the while being pursued by a local drug receiver.','/kPzQtr5LTheO0mBodIeAXHgthYX.jpg','2022-01-14',102,'Released','Fight your way out.','Borrego',728366,2.4861,5.9,'LfDUXeQKJ0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25808,_binary '\0','/xLsM5yTg9he5PWXXbrwzw1Wg8xp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12676326',6.6,44283,'en','Malcolm & Marie','As a filmmaker and his girlfriend return home from his movie premiere, smoldering tensions and painful revelations push them toward a romantic reckoning.','/bdidDnAZwchN5vTenoNuhGPJTri.jpg','2021-01-29',106,'Released','Madly in love.','Malcolm & Marie',722913,5.2773,6.996,'CGZmwsK58M8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25809,_binary '\0','/xYG1gq4jBZuPF9IF01cfuUSAOjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12677092',7.6,7378,'ml','സീ യൂ സൂൺ.','Jimmy meets Anu on an online dating website and decides to marry her. Jimmy\'s mother entrusts his cousin Kevin to get details about Anu. Now it\'s Kevin\'s turn to search for his cousin\'s fiancee who vanished without a trace, only to discover dark, shocking truths about her.','/or5qouMAtv86TMeSgHpMGMWG4IN.jpg','2020-09-01',98,'Released',NULL,'C U Soon',735120,1.1299,7.228,'91vZbFLP754','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25810,_binary '\0','/9hhRzLzP1enjENXiGJocAHyWFmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12678146',5.2,1871,'es','La pasajera','Four people traveling in a van run over a lone woman while she is walking in the dark down a country road. After loading her into the vehicle to take her to the nearest hospital, they notice that she is behaving rather strangely. The occupants of the van soon realise that the time has come to fight for their lives, and together they agree on one very simple rule: \"do not sit next to her.\"','/6bYCDIYqT3GpE6ICnMP6HvUlJMT.jpg','2022-06-03',91,'Released','Don\'t sit next to her','The Passenger',869399,2.0233,5.9,'ldSbEpwQIdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25811,_binary '\0','/2hMyqceKKpr0Ff1QSNvejWZvNal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12680508',5.1,4951,'en','Minor Premise','Attempting to surpass his father\'s legacy, a neuroscientist becomes entangled in his own experiment, pitting ten fragments of his consciousness against each other.','/c4H5aH4PxVomNxa5UIHa32bzrCO.jpg','2020-12-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Minor Premise',661137,1.9478,5.2,'yeYkJ59T07k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25812,_binary '\0','/dTvGUMFc5WCziTzXZKZ2EfW2bEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12680684',7.3,55139,'it','È stata la mano di Dio','In 1980s Naples, an awkward teen struggling to find his place experiences heartbreak and liberation after he\'s inadvertently saved from a freak accident by football legend Diego Maradona.','/kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg','2021-11-24',130,'Released',NULL,'The Hand of God',722778,4.3367,7.5,'i_1VW_0i6vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25813,_binary '\0','/trPmeJW25TFrejTNSXnLVpu64Fa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268204',7.8,9107,'en','Waste Land','An uplifting feature documentary highlighting the transformative power of art and the beauty of the human spirit. Top-selling contemporary artist Vik Muniz takes us on an emotional journey from Jardim Gramacho, the world\'s largest landfill on the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro, to the heights of international art stardom. Vik collaborates with the brilliant catadores, pickers of recyclable materials, true Shakespearean characters who live and work in the garbage quoting Machiavelli and showing us how to recycle ourselves.','/tJf0LR1nxvtePFnKtp4TKXnryRl.jpg','2010-01-24',90,'Released','What happens in the world\'s largest trash city will transform you.','Waste Land',46689,1.6879,7.6,'sNlwh8vT2NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25814,_binary '\0','/6gUYTnR0E0sQWPaFVtgR7zmZHfm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268208',3.4,1262,'en','Gnaw','In this dark, tongue in cheek, British Horror, six friends take a holiday in the heart of the English countryside which turns into a culinary nightmare when they discover that their hosts are a sadistic family of cannibals, set on turning their guests into their next meal! It\'s nice to have your friends for dinner','/x8HkuoWDV8zijuL9L1Unc5yJKD8.jpg','2008-10-31',90,'Released','Nice to have your friends for dinner...','Gnaw',17910,1.1957,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25815,_binary '\0','/jI52Uk6pdLJpqJBiis42RRQpMtq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12683198',6.6,1988,'de','Beyto','Talented swimmer, motivated apprentice, cool buddy: Beyto is in the midst of life. But when the only son of a Turkish migrant family falls in love with his coach Mike, an ideal world falls to pieces. His parents only see one way out: They lure him to their home village and plan his wedding with Seher, his childhood friend. Suddenly, Beyto finds himself in a disruptive love triangle.','/nmgizVNfdfFBmeW01rdHeZYvjOL.jpg','2021-07-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Beyto',745931,2.3316,5.9,'X7Zu5V2kOuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25816,_binary '\0','/tDHRhZGEVVth1EmiRS05STQJp5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12683756',6.2,13057,'es','Jaula','After a couple finds a traumatized child of unknown origins, wife Paula must decipher the girl\'s strange behaviors to unlock her identity and dark past.','/ifxAT8LVbSCxAi290VplTwbEQNh.jpg','2022-09-09',106,'Released',NULL,'The Chalk Line',960875,4.4275,6.4,'h0xhvgztUGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25817,_binary '\0','/fNWKUaOZbw3F3UfzFQ8FjZhUHGw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12687276',6.7,4245,'ml','കള','The life of Shaji, a laid-back youngster, turns upside down when someone from his past pays him a visit.','/mLmnhWJDAmI6j2cxH7uvBiyi9Jb.jpg','2021-03-25',127,'Released','The Unwanted','Kala',810190,1.1932,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25818,_binary '\0','/A5VmqOiOXHUqX8QMnXuYJdIOXeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268799',6.2,75636,'en','A Very Harold & Kumar Christmas','Six years have elapsed since Guantanamo Bay, leaving Harold and Kumar estranged from one another with very different families, friends and lives. But when Kumar arrives on Harold\'s doorstep during the holiday season with a mysterious package in hand, he inadvertently burns down Harold\'s father-in-law\'s beloved Christmas tree. To fix the problem, Harold and Kumar embark on a mission through New York City to find the perfect Christmas tree, once again stumbling into trouble at every single turn.','/cncxLilRHKayn8VKhzjAMHkbN4f.jpg','2011-11-04',90,'Released','Christmas comes prematurely.','A Very Harold & Kumar Christmas',55465,6.3794,6,'rILHv9oFq38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25819,_binary '\0','/ol2FlTsW52tBqIGLBlFH3R0O1sg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268809',4.7,9124,'en','Night of the Demons','Angela is throwing a decadent Halloween party at New Orleans\' infamous Broussard Mansion. But after the police break up the festivities, Maddie and a few friends stay behind. Trapped inside the locked mansion gates, the remaining guests uncover a horrifying secret and soon fall victim to seven vicious, blood-thirsty demons.','/3OlNfFL0tNUh2SbXI6Qn6Mhbc2M.jpg','2009-08-30',93,'Released','All Hell Is Going To Break Loose','Night of the Demons',27646,3.3265,5.1,'9FCKZ0yBnfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25820,_binary '\0','/pnZ9NMxRqbcJ2dPNROIoregruv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12689248',3.4,1979,'en','The Commando','An elite DEA agent returns home after a failed mission when his family makes an unexpected discovery in their house – a stash of money worth $3 million. They soon face the danger and threat of a newly released criminal and his crew, who will do whatever it takes to retrieve the money, including kidnap the agent’s daughters. Stakes are high and lives are at risk in this head-to-head battle as the agent stops at nothing to protect his family against the money-hungry criminals.','/mn1GYIQ1tvFuuu0YBNZBvrHyrkO.jpg','2022-01-07',93,'Released','Only one will survive.','The Commando',753232,4.6377,5.7,'_EoLNs5m-7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25821,_binary '\0','/1pX2IloFPEp1Pqrvru94LLzDLut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268987',4.9,11310,'en','Operation: Endgame','A battle ensues among two government spy teams in an underground facility after their boss is assassinated.','/ugbGBbzoPQXSgolQVVqRC3NGpIw.jpg','2010-07-20',82,'Released','Two rival teams of assassins. One killer day at the office.','Operation: Endgame',41135,3.1907,4.951,'4JXIe34PwKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25822,_binary '\0','/rq3fVu4LBLCiuFSKUEDcrWvYhWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1268989',6.8,1383,'en','The Unloved','Lucy is eleven years old. Having been neglected by her estranged mother and father, she is placed in a children\'s home. Through her eyes, we follow her struggle to cope with the system; her only saving being her self-belief and certainty that she is being watched over and protected by the holy spirit.','/h8IJpERlvkOyIM6qpycvb0EsibI.jpg','2009-05-17',106,'Released',NULL,'The Unloved',53445,4.7938,6.8,'MtOWMORQTrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25823,_binary '\0','/j7ynqTmnEZuqNXc0WqKvL7YNOSp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12691830',6.7,2713,'en','A Love Song','Two childhood sweethearts, now both widowed, share a night by a lake in the mountains.','/qnAWBl1nQgNk3wvy0rcIWOiv9pU.jpg','2022-07-29',81,'Released',NULL,'A Love Song',913851,3.6023,6.6,'NysYn89m5y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25824,_binary '\0','/e2Rao2UGrWO4skA8MT1HZlo9g07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1269560',6.7,1642,'en','Love Takes Wing','Belinda Simpson is now a doctor in a small Missouri town where an unknown plague is spreading fear and resentment amoung the townspeople. One local resident thinks the illness was spread from the town orphanage and wants to see it shut down. Belinda struggles to make sense of the disease and God\'s plan for the beleaguered town.','/b6bM8dmSbEHDv9hHIJCZjbgIkbV.jpg','2009-04-04',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Takes Wing',21636,2.3516,6.956,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25825,_binary '\0','/AhUoJtHvvcwd4u8IoWS921feITz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1269734',4.9,2516,'en','Angel of Death','A career assassin becomes haunted by one of her victims following a near fatal injury to her brain. Becoming a rogue assassin settling the score with her former mob employers, chaos and power struggles ensue.','/xbNgVKUVOhe4x3ZChhX8hHTzvgY.jpg','2009-07-07',77,'Released','People die... Get over it.','Angel of Death',20781,1.8913,4.7,'RyzhdE6AJes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25826,_binary '\0','/bH1SwaZ6ArKh2zPfdcG41zyoFKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270114',5.3,2869,'en','Saints and Soldiers: The Void','Germany, May 1945, deep in the Harz Mountains a U.S. tank crew discovers a platoon of Germans preparing to ambush U.S. supply trucks.','/9kXpca09Ajdfs5v12A0Uqme14xK.jpg','2014-08-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Saints and Soldiers: The Void',294690,2.457,5.3,'0hsKRqjZoD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25827,_binary '\0','/oInNEEn2qzAAWQkFhfDEKbXv9RR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270262',7,65650,'en','The Devil\'s Double','A chilling vision of the House of Saddam Hussein comes to life through the eyes of the man who was forced to become the double of Hussein\'s sadistic son.','/sDnnV0QbfvXthf8K4cYod4HVlug.jpg','2011-02-11',109,'Released','The 80\'s were brilliant, if you were in charge.','The Devil\'s Double',62630,5.1511,6.7,'qhlQOg9abRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25828,_binary '\0','/tvZfj9IGDGczQfXOYfLlu064BRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270277',5.6,2130,'en','Sympathy for Delicious','A newly paralyzed DJ gets more than he bargained for when he seeks out the world of faith healing.','/26kKZWAm6FaDXKFi30qUdv8oxpv.jpg','2010-04-09',96,'Released','You get what you need.','Sympathy for Delicious',58884,1.9857,5.7,'VwYY-tkrJHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25829,_binary '\0','/kdnuPzXT8h27S1rDu5TTpA7mKdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270286',6.8,6028,'en','To Save a Life','Jake Taylor has everything. He has a beautiful girl, he\'s the champion in basketball and beer pong, and everyone loves him. Then, an old childhood friend of his commits suicide. Jake wonders what he could\'ve done to save his friend\'s life. A youth minister tells him that Jake needs God. So Jake becomes a Christian. However, things begin to spin out of control. Jake is going to realize just what it means to be a Christian and how, to save a life.','/xtJrFdGB5QyatbNgLGXy1BogYtP.jpg','2009-11-05',120,'Released','Some people are just dying to be heard.','To Save a Life',41144,2.1334,6.3,'1o56pazEh-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25830,_binary '\0','/mwppSJeBFmEX4o8cc1NREjTZORO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270291',5.8,6398,'en','Hunter Prey','The Prometheus has dropped out of orbit. Communications and life support systems are down. Situation Critical: Status of Crew and Prisoner unknown. With orders to catch their Alien Prisoner alive the surviving crew of the spaceship Prometheus pursue a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse with their escaped prisoner on a deserted and barren planet. But, who is the hunter and who is its prey?','/5kv2w3ZjXQx5MEMdn3cBfRuLAca.jpg','2010-05-01',90,'Released','One man. One alien. One choice.','Hunter Prey',41360,1.9855,5.8,'Vp4DzRFSeq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25831,_binary '\0','/jPwmkSfpVFfMiDDvJ1aWRXGQ341.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270296',5.8,3286,'en','The Killing Jar','A stranger armed with a shotgun takes seven patrons hostage in a remote roadside diner. But as the body count increases, the desperate survivors discover that one of the hostages may be even more dangerous than their captor.','/oLVr18muLwkSyrq4YL2M9WG6tHu.jpg','2010-02-14',92,'Released','Eeny, meeny, miny, murder.','The Killing Jar',43754,2.1827,5.51,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25832,_binary '\0','/4tsZ4rWTUyFROVaFXMMBPQIJ940.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12703292',6.4,3961,'es','Un hombre de acción','Loosely inspired by the life of Lucio Urtubia, explore the figure of the so-called anarchist \'Robin Hood,\' who ran a legendary counterfeiting operation in Paris that put him in the crosshairs of America\'s largest bank, when he managed to obtain a huge amount of money by forging traveler\'s checks to invest in causes he believed in.','/50bEzUzctV12Zgzu0xPUEnxLEla.jpg','2022-11-30',111,'Released',NULL,'A Man of Action',945897,3.3179,6.406,'mY08z4osNYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25833,_binary '\0','/yGH7ke2rbeSI4IZx90UzIrMlWLq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12706836',4.9,4832,'en','Shell','Desperate to reclaim her career, once-beloved actress Samantha Lake is drawn into the glamorous world of wellness mogul Zoe Shannon - only to uncover a monstrous truth beneath its flawless surface.','/2XBNS8DxMFP7qOoTOY7cc8OYFwI.jpg','2025-10-01',102,'Released','Be the best version of yourself.','Shell',787747,3.0357,5.031,'R6W6YzhRuTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25834,_binary '\0','/wJgVvjUOo8NCPoH6oDQ17mL1RhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270761',5.5,52635,'en','Don\'t Be Afraid of the Dark','A young girl sent to live with her father and his new girlfriend discovers creatures in her new home who want to claim her as one of their own.','/jMBMm1jwqvILV8p1K44brBnmwLK.jpg','2010-11-06',99,'Released','Fear is never just make believe.','Don\'t Be Afraid of the Dark',46261,5.5607,5.844,'3kLU13UN7Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25835,_binary '\0','/inksCrNjfVAnp0zcG7S1I7guZGn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270766',5.8,1425,'fr','Henri 4','A wide-ranging, energetic period piece tracing the rise of the Protestant Henry of Navarre as he goes from battlefield warrior to France\'s beloved King Henri IV. Director Jo Baier\'s epic is a classically entertaining adventure, albeit one with more than a little bloodshed and frequent bawdy sexual interludes. In late 16th-century France, Catholics and Protestant Huguenots were at war. Seemingly seeking peace, the French dowager queen, Catherine de Medici summons Henry to her court to have him marry her daughter, uniting the two warring factions. However, the Catholics slaughter the Protestant wedding guests in what became known as the St. Bartholomew\'s Day massacre and Henry-now married-must use all his guile to both stay alive and maneuver for the throne. [Written by Palm Springs International Film Festival]','/nhxQICfkmXYZPEjF0bWAdNFKyMP.jpg','2010-03-04',155,'Released',NULL,'Henri 4',58602,2.231,5.6,'JSWxhOJLkxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25836,_binary '\0','/VuukZLgaCrho2Ar8Scl9HtV3yD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270797',6.6,617243,'en','Venom','Investigative journalist Eddie Brock attempts a comeback following a scandal, but accidentally becomes the host of Venom, a violent, super powerful alien symbiote. Soon, he must rely on his newfound powers to protect the world from a shadowy organization looking for a symbiote of their own.','/2uNW4WbgBXL25BAbXGLnLqX71Sw.jpg','2018-09-28',112,'Released','The world has enough superheroes.','Venom',335983,19.747,6.824,'27ykcO79F-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25837,_binary '\0','/yhp5Pt4GugkCs5mz63qWz5khHXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270798',7.7,773558,'en','X-Men: First Class','Before Charles Xavier and Erik Lensherr took the names Professor X and Magneto, they were two young men discovering their powers for the first time. Before they were arch-enemies, they were closest of friends, working together with other mutants (some familiar, some new), to stop the greatest threat the world has ever known.','/hNEokmUke0dazoBhttFN0o3L7Xv.jpg','2011-06-01',132,'Released','Witness the moment that will change our world.','X-Men: First Class',49538,1.363,7.306,'2BAYQD_j6Xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25838,_binary '\0','/sh9aRWXveSCeY2TDgNv3UzXAUb9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270835',5.5,16714,'en','Hatchet II','Picking up right where the original ended, Marybeth escapes the clutches of the swamp-dwelling killer Victor Crowley. After learning the truth about her family’s connection to the hatchet-wielding madman, Marybeth returns to the Louisiana swamps along with an army of hunters to recover the bodies of her family and exact the bloodiest revenge against the bayou butcher.','/k1lzmRZUGDejyV11JnD79yrEHiE.jpg','2010-10-01',85,'Released','Victor Crowley lives.','Hatchet II',43919,3.9608,5.5,'-p7Asu0zaR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25839,_binary '\0','/nAomcxOYQlS0HfsMcFn2fkhV8kT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1270842',6.3,13079,'ja','ノルウェイの森','Toru recalls his life in the 1960s, when his friend Kizuki killed himself and he grew close to Naoko, Kizuki\'s girlfriend, and another woman, the outgoing, lively Midori.','/cnTbsvghYlN8B3vhhxPOezimOGQ.jpg','2010-09-30',134,'Released',NULL,'Norwegian Wood',57703,2.6351,6.395,'tqiYXmpb41I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25840,_binary '\0','/ouQPvA86SW1DXFTsc2qaRqz4tAg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12708658',7,12076,'fr','Les Olympiades','Émilie meets Camille who is attracted to Nora, who crosses paths with Amber. Three girls and a boy – They\'re friends, sometimes lovers and often both.','/kSXPsrausCYVsDnQaJfhzqR9fV7.jpg','2021-11-03',106,'Released',NULL,'Paris, 13th District',746131,4.4944,6.9,'CIhIhyphxc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25841,_binary '\0','/qIVnRXGlVEuxkrxocidnKxRGAZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12711968',4.9,1235,'en','Curse of Aurore','A “Dark Web” thumb drive reveals footage of three American filmmakers in rural Quebec researching a historic child murder case. After witnessing several disturbing paranormal occurrences, they attempt to communicate with the spirit of the child.','/aR4fzZkBvjDxJyvYD2oEl13uh70.jpg','2020-07-24',90,'Released','Don\'t Dig Too Deep','Curse of Aurore',727478,0.8613,5.2,'_koawiiqMwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25842,_binary '\0','/bWmMLl3codxRsykbkmXcmjrmy4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12712604',6.4,9141,'en','The Miracle Club','Three close friends who have never left the outskirts of Dublin (much less Ireland) get the journey of a lifetime — a visit to Lourdes, the picturesque French town and place of miracles.','/5MOOL38IZTylA7K04FvJ4PaklaI.jpg','2023-07-14',90,'Released','Four women went to Lourdes in search of a miracle.','The Miracle Club',830721,4.7365,6.3,'Gp3ZFdklPCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25843,_binary '\0','/pVcPMxZV3vzNpfV94rOa1WShMvf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12715472',6.1,1400,'fr','Inexorable','Desperately seeking inspiration for the follow-up novel to his bestseller \"Inexorable\", Marcel Bellmer moves in his wife\'s old family mansion with his family.','/dBccFlBYLXewO8x9ptuKM6lHCDI.jpg','2021-09-07',98,'Released',NULL,'Inexorable',781099,2.1029,6.1,'ryiglT6Ryws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25844,_binary '\0','/3xGfsAYAxVmYj1CbE5vAkmMJbHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12718300',6.4,27543,'en','Confess, Fletch','The roguishly charming and endlessly troublesome Fletch becomes the prime suspect in a murder case while searching for a stolen art collection. The only way to prove his innocence? Find out which of the long list of suspects is the culprit - from the eccentric art dealer and a missing playboy to a crazy neighbor and Fletch’s Italian girlfriend. Crime, in fact, has never been this disorganized.','/h2oyiPu7aql1s1mLDoKBNAH7p3B.jpg','2022-09-16',99,'Released','A dead body. A stolen Picasso. And this guy.','Confess, Fletch',724665,8.1985,6.204,'pb2Pu5EjC1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25845,_binary '\0','/i6nTaWRwYRm9EQlObo5vgPPowdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12719846',7.3,1881,'hu','Külön falka','Tibor and Niki, father and daughter. The young girl was only five years old when they last saw each other, before Tibor was sent to prison. He is released seven years later and tries not to think about the past. Yet he can’t erase his daughter from his life and so they are compelled to start over from the beginning. Both are irresistibly charismatic, headstrong and irascible, but also determined to find a way back to one another.','/dXusX2lsY0dvZWqGlfzjP1Ix5uX.jpg','2021-09-30',98,'Released',NULL,'Wild Roots',852470,3.0933,6.9,'PNSUbuWyoLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25846,_binary '\0','/ltIsT89LCtNpSkLZOCLLkTyS24J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12720014',6.4,1346,'hu','Szia, Életem!','A popular writer with lack of inspiration and his never-seen son meets unexpectedly. From there they have to deal with living with the other in joy, in emtions and with the imagination of the child, this tales goes beyond reality.','/uOpCDZLdHpzraS5U6ciaRGdvovl.jpg','2022-08-25',115,'Released','A full-hearted comedy','Hello, My Life!',925603,1.0433,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25847,_binary '\0','/1hifoTnZqvS7TrLbxZS1HK6ZZmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272011',7.2,1284,'it','Fortapàsc','The story of Giancarlo Siani, a journalist killed by the Neapolitan Mafia in 1985.','/8hB2cp65RF3Odu1h35JNh7wcQko.jpg','2009-03-27',105,'Released',NULL,'Fort Apache Napoli',50987,1.1738,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25848,_binary '\0','/Ab7Ko5u702WXZpoOPM7oSUbYOah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272012',6.5,2185,'da','Fri os fra det onde','In search of a new lifestyle, Johannes and his wife Pernille leave the city and move with their two children to Johannes’ childhood town in the country. When Johannes’ drunken brother Lars accidently runs over Anna, a local, and plants false evidence pointing at the emigrant Alain, Johannes stands up to defend Alain. But it comes with a price.','/5F0FBTs2OA7glSUuvpwzYPCMAnw.jpg','2009-04-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Deliver Us from Evil',16639,1.6665,5.64,'IiV3Q5_3N5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25849,_binary '\0','/jS870G9Nm0m5qTn5oZamqnWaa0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272013',4.8,2599,'es','Fuga de cerebros','Emilio, a shy, not too brilliant pupil at a humble local secondary school, has always harboured a secret love for Natalia, the cutest, brightest girl in the class. On the last day of the school year, when he finally decides to declare his love, Natalia is awarded a scholarship to study Medicine at Oxford. It would seem that all is lost for Emilio, but his drop-out school-pals are not ready to throw in the towel. After faking qualifications and scholarships, this band of brainless nuts land in Oxford, causing havoc in the normally peaceful campus existence.','/n7PmqkLlk9pUJaNeBLedvAdFUgQ.jpg','2009-04-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Brain Drain',18120,1.91,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25850,_binary '\0','/vnyNXC1IDnILdLVovh8RB8n3FS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272018',6.6,2306,'ru','Кандагар','A docudrama about the escape of Russian pilots after being taken hostage by the Taliban in 1996.','/u4sUgqAEElZo8j022M25Ovc9LxN.jpg','2010-02-04',103,'Released',NULL,'Kandahar',34586,1.2717,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25851,_binary '\0','/mxo3vQ9J8HMArAZqQLzgHIPD9w9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272025',3.8,1958,'en','Polar Storm','When a piece of the massive comet \"Copernicus\" collides with the Earth, it knocks the planet off of its axis and unleashes a disaster never before witnessed. Dr. James Mayfield and his highly trained research team are the only ones who can re-align the axis. With his wife and teenage son in mortal danger, Dr. James Mayfield calls on his crack research team to help realign the planet\'s axis before the effects of the catastrophe are irreversible.','/mD7nAZXnkIYJ6T4c1xOyK9qxRO8.jpg','2009-03-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Polar Storm',27391,1.7003,4.1,'FeSyn2cfBHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25852,_binary '\0','/gF12JJf9wU2y1j0bXL4y3m3ZqQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272034',5.4,1296,'ar','بوشكاش','An ex-goalkeeper starts working as a talent scout and travels all over the world in search of professional players to join Egyptian football clubs.','/nXgcGxqScIOTDXytjCGGzsdDWV9.jpg','2008-08-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Boshkash',182596,1.481,5.68,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25853,_binary '\0','/6B9sNhy0z61BFljLqmzF4zFkGSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272051',5,1664,'ru','Белка и Стрелка. Звёздные собаки','Belka, the amazing flying dog is unexpectedly hurdled into the streets of Moscow when the rocket she is in malfunctions during one of her circus routines. Fortunately the crash leads her to meet a streetwise dog named Strelka and her irredeemable rat friend Venya. Together with other amusing friends found along the way, the three find themselves in a space program-training center where they get sent away in a rocket, leaving planet Earth...','/zufutvJv0KjMmuw8ldWpPLzkomT.jpg','2010-03-18',85,'Released','An adventure that’s out of this world!','Space Dogs',36696,2.2374,5.2,'IDjTiYt4P6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25854,_binary '\0','/fsDs4nGpA1w28mglVMu5LPgaeAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12721188',5.8,1289,'es','Se busca papá','What does a thrill-seeker tween girl do when her mom forbids her to enter a BMX race? Cast an actor with nothing to lose to play her approving dad.','/eII9dyLFsGmpJnj2fAGAnYjzQMg.jpg','2020-09-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Dad Wanted',737802,2.0229,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25855,_binary '\0','/7kX5o5o3H7M5f5vBTYZu8PSitPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12723616',4.6,1723,'te','Bombhaat','Vicky is a man who’s brought up being told by his parents he’s the unluckiest fellow on earth. His girlfriend Chaitra goes against the world and even her own father to prove him wrong. Life goes for a toss, more than usual, when he rescues his mentor’s daughter Maya.','/jMsXPRbjltXy4Hu4H6Rt4rBBngs.jpg','2020-12-03',136,'Released',NULL,'Bombhaat',770391,0.75,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25856,_binary '\0','/up8mHTvnn92bqcq3paWbFdWWXXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12724306',5.7,8891,'en','Glorious','After a breakup, Wes ends up at a remote rest stop. He finds himself locked inside the bathroom with a mysterious figure speaking from an adjacent stall. Soon Wes realizes he is involved in a situation more terrible than he could imagine.','/gttZLC3yhLFx1EnfjEUaDb2YAwl.jpg','2022-07-21',79,'Released','The universe has a favor to ask.','Glorious',939914,2.6272,5.9,'esqxTzc3lgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25857,_binary '\0','/m7dFZdz6cS720lfTEKwe2Arkw3p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12724622',6.4,3796,'fr','Anelka : L\'Incompris','Bad boy or football genius? Famed French footballer Nicolas Anelka\'s controversial legacy is examined in an unflinching documentary.','/5a9RuQfEVaBW2hSjIILDAokMMr.jpg','2020-08-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Anelka: Misunderstood',726649,1.8711,6.5,'lnPxHu6Sx5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25858,_binary '\0','/v7hAAjqypw9otTERMkIzZCq0fjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12726428',6,1872,'nl','Stromboli','Haunted by memories of her broken marriage and a fight with her daughter, a woman joins an intense self-help retreat when her vacation goes awry.','/4rQcKxoJkm6CViK82UfZwVkW2ec.jpg','2022-11-03',86,'Released',NULL,'Stromboli',1034629,1.7398,5.2,'JyE0mqjIZKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25859,_binary '\0','/swyPgOP2lffHfMjeZKNnNFR9P88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272878',6.7,239295,'en','2 Guns','A DEA agent and an undercover Naval Intelligence officer who have been tasked with investigating one another find they have been set up by the mob -- the very organization the two men believe they have been stealing money from.','/ptURGAFktibhk7DEAbMazlmNqWa.jpg','2013-08-02',109,'Released','Never rob a bank across from a diner with the best donuts in three counties.','2 Guns',136400,9.6064,6.5,'AK6EbfdnTHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25860,_binary '\0','/AbPxK4IMO9eNUgJYeSOfOjHxfkz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1272886',6.1,8777,'en','Small Apartments','When a clumsy deadbeat accidentally kills his landlord, he must do everything in his power to hide the body, only to find that the distractions of lust, the death of his beloved brother, and a crew of misfit characters force him on a journey where a fortune awaits him.','/z7j98OiCC6v0gOXJ9VF5t2kV169.jpg','2012-03-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Small Apartments',95755,3.3925,5.9,'jqXdvbCb2a8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25861,_binary '\0','/1uCX0fpYOdvrTIYulFymWOP08HT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12731980',7.3,48970,'en','Old Henry','A widowed farmer and his son warily take in a mysterious, injured man with a satchel of cash. When a posse of men claiming to be the law come for the money, the farmer must decide who to trust. Defending a siege of his homestead, the farmer reveals a talent for gun-slinging that surprises everyone calling his true identity into question.','/eE1SL0QoDsvAMqQly56IkRtlN1W.jpg','2021-10-01',99,'Released','You can\'t bury the past.','Old Henry',785663,5.635,7.3,'5Eiuk4uBJfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25862,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273202',7.2,2020,'sr','Чекај ме, ја сигурно нећу доћи','Alek (Gordan Kicic) is desperate because Teodora (Milica Mihajlovic) has left him after a three years being together. He is suffering, he is apathetic and is mentioning suicide constantly, he simply doesn\'t want to accept that the relationship is over. He has self-pitying sessions with his friend Bane (Milos Samolov) everyday. Despite Bane\'s advice, Alek keeps calling Teodora who has fallen in love with Nemanja (Branislav Trifunovic) in the meantime. However decisive and tough Teodora is when she is with Alek, she is as indulgent and helpless when she is spending time with Nemanja. The problem is that Nemanja is not in love with her but with Marina (Vanja Ejdus), a girl by a few years younger. Unfortunately, Marina is not in love with him, she is very attracted to Alek\'s \"Slavic depression\". She doesn\'t know that reason for his \"charm of a desperate\" is his failure with Teodora, she thinks Alek was born like that.','/dF1oa5gwmPpqk2VkEqtKhtPydjp.jpg','2009-06-13',91,'Released',NULL,'Wait for Me and I Will Not Come',33579,0.8287,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25863,_binary '\0','/nKn5mUGugWunPptdXvrAh5GNo2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273204',6.6,2666,'it','Il compleanno','Two couples are enjoying their summer at the beach, but when the grown son of one couple arrives, it surprisingly stirs something in the husband of the other couple, will the forbidden feelings end badly?','/4PhnXpYe0BS2vE0AwpYUUVRsLG6.jpg','2009-09-08',106,'Released','Desire and Discovery on the Italian Riviera','David\'s Birthday',64631,2.293,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25864,_binary '\0','/vCXwQxeadQg5NV39p7loyLeGpV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273207',5.3,5718,'en','DeadHeads','Two inexplicably coherent zombies awake amidst a zombie attack and decide to take a road trip to find the one\'s lost love, unaware they are being chased by the agents of a ruthless company with its own agenda.','/uDhZDedBv9eRDkuJSTbM77EmHI1.jpg','2011-04-29',95,'Released','A Road Trip Movie to Die For.','DeadHeads',77067,1.2417,5.1,'HZK6gZn38yQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25865,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273218',5,1351,'ta','குசேலன்','Balakrishnan and Ashok are two childhood friends who lose touch with each other. One of them goes on to become a national figure and the other, a village barber.','/6Cp1L4hhPa83IF7bA3Ac2VDRN1F.jpg','2008-08-01',160,'Released',NULL,'Kuselan',12274,1.1915,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25866,_binary '\0','/wx1LgDuWHZGGWxS9Jbg7R4J2BrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273221',3.9,13107,'en','London Fields','Clairvoyant femme fatale Nicola Six has been living with a dark premonition of her impending death by murder. She begins a tangled love affair with three uniquely different men — one of whom she knows will be her murderer.','/7OfQVm5GexlAREp8FoR4ILxp35T.jpg','2018-09-20',118,'Released','All of them want her, one of them wants her... dead.','London Fields',220882,5.6693,5.1,'4K_pJIXC7MI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25867,_binary '\0','/puznYtHv2zsZfRKWZbdqb9GrbgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273222',7.6,1792,'en','These Amazing Shadows','Tells the history and importance of The National Film Registry, a roll call of American cinema treasures that reflects the diversity of film, and indeed the American experience itself.','/jiby8Ilxlmbhv6elIf0qRMuaDdd.jpg','2011-01-22',88,'Released','The Movies that Make America','These Amazing Shadows',80337,2.6693,7.353,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25868,_binary '\0','/wa0UGYppc6uWOdVow4Ko2CG4jk9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273235',4.9,81622,'sr','Srpski film','Retired porn star Milos leads a normal family life trying to make ends meet. Presented with the opportunity of a lifetime to financially support his family for the rest of their lives, Milos must participate in one last mysterious film. From then on, Milos is drawn into a maelstrom of unbelievable cruelty and mayhem.','/yIQqiw3Az5QYNHLCUoCTtxXH24G.jpg','2010-01-06',104,'Released','Not all films have a happy ending.','A Serbian Film',73861,20.6456,5.443,'RcHq2W1dXRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25869,_binary '\0','/3G1nnMfHcBmNY1T7r2qoSHuyhLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273241',6.3,4329,'en','Brotherhood','Adam Buckley finds himself in the middle of a convenience store robbery during his last night as a pledge for a college fraternity. When the initiation ritual goes horribly wrong, and every move proves disastrous, Adam is forced to confront a new challenge all together, and he has to take a stand.','/2302IU1ouScHrOHMEaVczXtamIc.jpg','2010-03-13',76,'Released','Every night was a party. One night went too far.','Brotherhood',51462,1.6235,5.9,'XEwIJITP1Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25870,_binary '\0','/dWIBWL7HOIWys5afMnazDvoTjez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12734800',5.4,4569,'en','The Plot Against the President','Based on Lee Smith\'s book of the same name, this documentary follows the story of the biggest political scandal in U.S. history.','/btgFkggVJpTw99vRY5Zck0k3Eb4.jpg','2020-10-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Plot Against the President',746605,2.6013,6.567,'mqTu_Btkr08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25871,_binary '\0','/d8NUIrJwpFL0tiGdUTtpJMTslSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12735282',4.2,6553,'en','The Reef: Stalked','After her sister\'s murder, Nic, her younger sister and two friends seek solace through a Pacific island kayaking adventure. Hours into the trip the women are stalked by a shark and must band together, face their fears and save each other.','/hmbRg1VkVigS4Se2WCpyT5OV9mo.jpg','2022-07-14',93,'Released','It will find you.','The Reef: Stalked',730167,3.5822,5.3,'o0nCxBQiQLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25872,_binary '\0','/4lGB2Iy7BruiRfvVc6MZ2UM0yNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12735338',6.8,7342,'ja','サイダーのように言葉が湧き上がる','After meeting one day, a shy boy who expresses himself through haiku and a bubbly but self-conscious girl share a brief, magical summer.','/ooISQS2rzVqgkt2aq5HNoz8n2sa.jpg','2021-07-22',88,'Released','One summer, youth runs free','Words Bubble Up Like Soda Pop',579741,4.3783,7.35,'EMPnetBr9OM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25873,_binary '\0','/o8XSR1SONnjcsv84NRu6Mwsl5io.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12735488',7,77697,'te','కల్కి 2898-ఎ.డి','In the year 2898 AD, around 6000 years after Kurukshetra war, Ashwatthama gears up for his final battle of redemption at the sign of hope in a dystopian world and Bhairava, a wisecracking and self-interested bounty hunter, tired of the perilous life becomes the hurdle in the process.','/rstcAnBeCkxNQjNp3YXrF6IP1tW.jpg','2024-06-26',176,'Released','For a better Tomorrow','Kalki 2898-AD',801688,6.3246,6.447,'rn7tdg6cpW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25874,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12735856',7.7,2019,'te','నేను C/O నువ్వు','Maruthi, a son of a shopkeeper falls in love with Deepika, the only sister of Prathap Reddy, a zamindar and has deep political connections and believes in the caste system. Things take a fatal turn when Deepika accepts Maruthi`s love. Will Maruthi and Deepika be able to fight all odds and live happily ever after?','/75L8CH2XM2g8QCUmrtU6iqEpDNB.jpg','2022-09-30',113,'Released',NULL,'Nenu C/o Nuvvu',1031948,0.8644,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25875,_binary '\0','/6EDS74YVVSsA3rUL9MeENYY7M9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12736014',6.2,7075,'hi','कन्ट्रोल','Nella and Joe are the perfect influencer couple. But when he cheats on her, she turns to an AI app to erase him from her life — until it takes control.','/eCaaJkJqRA6unsVe5hvtgJq301H.jpg','2024-10-04',99,'Released','You think you are in control of your life...Think again.','CTRL',1146577,1.7084,6.092,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25876,_binary '\0','/oW91Jg0PMSJVW1AjsWVSsgEeovK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273675',8.1,4666,'en','Rent: Filmed Live on Broadway','Set in New York City\'s gritty East Village, the revolutionary rock opera RENT tells the story of a group of bohemians struggling to live and pay their rent. \"Measuring their lives in love,\" these starving artists strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.','/pLe09oTqdBudQO3mpEFT93FWJzd.jpg','2008-11-21',165,'Released','Rent\'s final performance on Broadway.','Rent: Filmed Live on Broadway',15199,2.6727,7.898,'fRJ4udt3Vmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25877,_binary '\0','/w7TUrUUo9pKcgY7PCdm2LK6XbZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1273678',5.5,50196,'en','The Spy Next Door','Former CIA spy Bob Ho takes on his toughest assignment to date: looking after his girlfriend\'s three kids, who haven\'t exactly warmed to their mom\'s beau. And when one of the youngsters accidentally downloads a top-secret formula, Bob\'s longtime nemesis, a Russian terrorist, pays a visit to the family.','/nJJrceb2xHGIA0irADX0JvWSIHT.jpg','2010-01-15',94,'Released','Part spy. Part babysitter. All hero.','The Spy Next Door',23172,10.276,5.899,'fa2RZf0m39g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25878,_binary '\0','/10WPNTeDvaHbpPXqtFgRODNLj4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12738164',6.5,4849,'tr','Aykut Enişte 2','On the eve of his wedding, a young man must deal with the trouble caused by an unexpected guest — his bride\'s former brother-in-law.','/41c6pOhq8AQaMbUQD2SKtbR8ldl.jpg','2021-12-02',118,'Released',NULL,'Brother in Love 2',911306,1.2721,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25879,_binary '\0','/nhaeqHR86ZNztAuOJNMmjEg9eXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12739994',4.3,1641,'en','The 100 Candles Game','A group of friends must confront their fears in a terrifying game. They must sit by the other players in a circle made of a hundred candles, take one of them and tell a horror story. As stories are told and candles blown out, strange events will start to happen. They will feel strange presences around them, lurking in the shadows. But they MUST NOT leave the game or else a terrible curse will fall upon them...','/mVcKV76XSxxJCsqdxjMql7yVJq5.jpg','2020-11-13',100,'Released','Survive the game or suffer the curse.','The 100 Candles Game',751394,3.6291,5.6,'s3GarHUWMSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25880,_binary '\0','/q4BqSkKRBt5I6STOeGmTkMN98xr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12740760',5.2,11396,'hi','फोन भूत','Two crazy, jobless, horror-film addicts Major and Gullu, under immense family pressure to find work, hit upon the idea to float a unique ghost-capturing service when they meet a spirit, Ragini, who makes their business a success but in return asks them for a favour which they are compelled to honour.','/dM3uOjl6UMfy1UtpnhaKDlt1SIk.jpg','2022-11-04',137,'Released','A Terrifying Comedy','Phone Bhoot',726207,1.6462,5.324,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25881,_binary '\0','/tKWJUdyIlsRM3NncISjqNceI2Hn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274273',3.8,2176,'en','The Last Seven','Seven strangers wake up on the deserted streets of London with no knowledge of how they got there. Before long someone -or something - is picking them off, one by one....','/jt207aVFJdnOT8ctRrPNhuZ9yrH.jpg','2010-08-24',84,'Released','London Population: 7 Million. Until Today.','The Last Seven',44646,1.4867,4.2,'0LsDPRfDROk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25882,_binary '\0','/fpZWYU5HfU3YiFlhNiTBfEJrTDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274293',6.6,3631,'ko','전우치','Spanning four centuries in Korea, this epic action-adventure concerns a powerful pipe and a trio of wizards who will do anything to protect it.','/al1V9H2GEjMQNcAnUpWZvkXX0gt.jpg','2009-12-23',136,'Released','World beware. The wizard is coming.','Woochi: The Demon Slayer',40171,3.0605,6.8,'_XXtOvsuyuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25883,_binary '\0','/fIPznqfHROKTU2lNx6V6gIrD6EY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274295',7.4,19136,'hi','कमीने','Two brothers, as different as chalk and cheese, find their lives intertwined when one puts himself in danger via a `get rich quick\' scheme and the other finds there is a price on his head.','/woeEkDNTyaJbNLEZXMkvk4XLNTx.jpg','2009-08-14',135,'Released','Thif Monfoon. Difcover Your Mean Fide.','Kaminey',20688,1.3787,6.768,'ePS3msSp9aQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25884,_binary '\0','/7JKLha2wFF2PSeRAC3JiTt59JFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274296',6.9,4948,'en','Listen to Your Heart','Struggling New York City singer/songwriter Danny falls in love with Ariana, a wealthy girl from Connecticut who tragically cannot hear the music she inspires him to write. After falling in love against the wishes of her controlling mother Victoria, Ariana becomes torn between hanging onto the shelter that Victoria provides and fighting for a love that, if given the chance, might just change her life.','/c7QlW32lhbyFx0l5XQtgrYKgbDW.jpg','2010-08-14',102,'Released','One song can change your life.','Listen to Your Heart',48373,1.6165,7.1,'BB5ag2hswmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25885,_binary '\0','/9iyMoO8wLaML2adLqsKLisYAVD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274300',5.3,8569,'en','The Tempest','An adaptation of the play by William Shakespeare. Prospera (a female version of Shakespeare\'s Prospero) is the usurped ruler of Milan who has been banished to a mysterious island with her daughter. Using her magical powers, she draws her enemies to the island to exact her revenge.','/9xnDtCsEoaooYYwmqrB2PBFVPag.jpg','2010-09-11',111,'Released',NULL,'The Tempest',44638,3.4523,5.3,'opjhs1mgd1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25886,_binary '\0','/taO1S8cQ6Rf9eGb3VpRRWuNiF28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12744120',7,2027,'it','Ariaferma','A prison drama where an old mobster and a prison guard must find a way to coexist so that imprisonment can become less so, and perhaps reveal the paradox that is behind the very concept of captivity.','/fT8cjGXzdSUe8CV2tnfY4wVT6zX.jpg','2021-10-14',117,'Released',NULL,'The Inner Cage',768331,1.3305,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25887,_binary '\0','/8b7BpDvmPABFtrw9GeSesHFQBaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1274586',4.5,12254,'en','Dying of the Light','Evan Lake, a veteran CIA agent, has been ordered to retire. But when his protégé uncovers evidence that Lake\'s nemesis, the terrorist Banir, has resurfaced, Lake goes rogue, embarking on a perilous, intercontinental mission to eliminate his sworn enemy.','/gL6riNxQeyPXT5YsgqE2aWhl1zi.jpg','2014-12-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Dying of the Light',297596,4.0222,4.7,'PUCggOyEmDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25888,_binary '\0','/qAalWPZlNxb8VjMsnL3aZhOHJi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12747236',5.7,1334,'zh','可不可以，你也剛好喜歡我','Tien Xiao-Xiang is a fan of author Si-Yi and Tarot cards. But deep down, she has another love, childhood sweetheart Li Zhu-Hao. Just when she sees the perfect opportunity to reveal her love to him from fortunetelling, Li Zhu-Hao confesses his feelings to her best friend Song Yi-Jing! But Song Yi-Jing has a condition for Li Zhu-Hao, that is to help three couples to date. They are: aloof and misandric art professor Stone and lovesick gym owner Liu Zhi-Liang; the most unpopular weirdo in school, Ah-Yu, and the subject of her nonstop public displays of love, campus hunk Danny Lo; mob boss lady Yu and philosophy student Ah-Shan. To make it happen for these three unlikely couples is almost like mission impossible.','/dwG70hf85j6yOippFCJj1YpoPO9.jpg','2020-08-21',109,'Released',NULL,'Do You Love Me as I Love You',728669,1.1686,6.8,'0-JRIBYp3Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25889,_binary '\0','/xRCQMhdqzwbB9IG91BXfGjtHDv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12747570',7.2,2779,'ta','Diary','A sub-inspector trainee sets out on a journey to track an unsolved, 16-year-old case. But little does he know that fate and destiny will put him on an exhilarating ride.','/nTy3jzjMJAH8i1pwCHwClbPGNc0.jpg','2022-08-26',123,'Released',NULL,'Diary',807598,0.8427,6.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25890,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12747588',6.4,3644,'te','మేక సూరి','Meka Suri is a 2020 ZEE5 Original Telugu crime thriller movie, starring Abhinay and Sumaya in the lead. The story revolves around Meka Suri, a butcher, who gets married to his love, Rani. However, when Rani gets brutally murdered by a group of people, Meka Suri decides to avenge her death with the help of Naxalites.','/kzGNlXPH6mx90k5UjX5yFsn7lK6.jpg','2020-07-31',86,'Released',NULL,'Meka Suri',729054,0.6474,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25891,_binary '\0','/5cRw2QHQz5bp7W2KLdSpZoFoTTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12747748',6.4,247337,'en','Leave the World Behind','A family\'s getaway to a luxurious rental home takes an ominous turn when a cyberattack knocks out their devices—and two strangers appear at their door.','/29rhl1xopxA7JlGVVsf1UHfYPvN.jpg','2023-11-22',140,'Released','There\'s no going back to normal.','Leave the World Behind',726209,10.1856,6.373,'cMVBi_e8o-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25892,_binary '\0','/oMxI0VCdp26C14rf7rjGZsyKXGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12748300',5.6,1901,'nl','Forever Rich','This is the story of Richie and his journey to become the greatest rap-artist in the Netherlands. One evening he is violently mugged by a group of teenagers and loses his most prized possession: an expensive watch. When images of the humiliating robbery go viral, Richie\'s hard-earned reputation is damaged.','/vRbX9sTiZheczEtNfjAi0bhHPAn.jpg','2021-10-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Forever Rich',785527,1.4742,6.5,'W5T7AOBdgoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25893,_binary '\0','/buop8brXQ8gGiOPrVTxZZUqE8Oa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12749596',6.5,52583,'en','Host','Six friends hire a medium to hold a séance via Zoom during lockdown — but they get far more than they bargained for as things quickly go wrong. When an evil spirit starts invading their homes, they begin to realise they might not survive the night.','/h7dZpJDORYs5c56dydbrLFkEXpE.jpg','2020-09-10',57,'Released','Someone new has joined the meeting.','Host',723072,6.3901,6.565,'SNlKbqHqGcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25894,_binary '\0','/5cnWSYPahf5oUxi6qTWUYIfAvaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12751534',7.3,1416,'no','Ingenting å le av','Kasper Berntsen is a successful stand-up comedian, who has everything he could wish for. One day everything changes. He learns that he has a serious illness, and his girlfriend puts an end to it.','/81JlrLn2uNZN6iGmmN2e1BhERi1.jpg','2021-09-10',107,'Released',NULL,'Nothing to Laugh About',857783,1.9023,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25895,_binary '\0','/9JLl9UYkcWbkLWWHtzuVB6fc9Qr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12753120',6.3,9557,'no','Nordsjøen','An oil platform dramatically goes down on the Norwegian coast, and researchers try to find out what happened when they realize this is just the start of something even more serious.','/1bB7uV5ljDWKG2m5Z4cgWwDMAeY.jpg','2021-10-29',104,'Released','The biggest disaster lies ahead of us.','The Burning Sea',623511,6.7174,6.554,'yu-Pxb4xAmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25896,_binary '\0','/liFThzRGOqmaJ73a0PuyFj1vzhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12754776',5.3,1702,'fr','Menteur','Jerome, 35, is a yacht salesman in Nice. But if you listen to him, in his spare time Jerome is also an astronaut, a karate world champion and a close friend of Miss Universe. As a matter of fact Jerome is a compulsive liar: he lies to everyone about everything! No one believes him, but that doesn’t prevent him from accumulating more lies. But one day Jerome wakes up to find out that all his lies have come true... and it’s just the beginning of the troubles ...!','/6onhfIc1qxGGX5qOSKxJXkQqdnx.jpg','2022-07-13',93,'Released','What if all your lies became reality?','Natural Born Liar',829165,2.3934,5.1,'K-WX2SxNO8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25897,_binary '\0','/sD7hC5cohIgFU6rfT4Tg08z6aUf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1275590',5.5,2972,'fr','De l\'autre côté du lit','Ariane and Hugo decide to exchange the lives they lead to escape from their routine, which after ten years of marriage, gives them the feeling of being hamsters in a wheel. She suddenly finds herself at the head of a construction equipment rental company and he tries to take the role of a house calling jewelry salesman...But is life really better when you live it on the other side of the bed?','/yFWMa7JatOBYwbuDcokjVbTuYWK.jpg','2009-01-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Changing Sides',15709,2.7016,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25898,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12757372',2.8,3103,'en','Red',NULL,'/cUF9UXwPfK2jryDYlrFHcRDQEwu.jpg','2022-08-04',92,'Released',NULL,'Red',847802,2.0135,4.2,'knfxDiUJuuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25899,_binary '\0','/pVV9S183cYwYjL4cWkPLXZ0mEIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12757438',3.8,1712,'en','Smiley Face Killers','Handsome young soccer player Jake Graham believes he is going insane, unable to shake the feeling of being stalked by something, by someone.','/g6mX91NNNKdFrHxAA7WX7kM8m6T.jpg','2021-02-04',97,'Released','They only have eyes for you.','Smiley Face Killers',718416,2.3504,2.9,'UgM2HkdwBz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25900,_binary '\0','/luSwrvFbMx9mt2ItmRNj4SWFrJW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1275786',3.9,1258,'en','Rise of the Gargoyles','Workers involuntarily release a gargoyle that proceeds to behead those who took her eggs (and some who didn\'t!).','/36W2GCXwbJZJIkGig5TbmxGi3e.jpg','2009-06-21',94,'Released','Evil takes flight.','Rise of the Gargoyles',24921,2.1729,5,'6neBrZpKnYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25901,_binary '\0','/4avmIRBBOs9b4DKoenf8SWWJJP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12758060',7.4,110728,'en','Tetris','In 1988, American video game salesman Henk Rogers discovers the video game Tetris. When he sets out to bring the game to the world, he enters a dangerous web of lies and corruption behind the Iron Curtain.','/4F2QwCOYHJJjecSvdOjStuVLkpu.jpg','2023-03-15',118,'Released','The game you couldn\'t put down. The story you couldn\'t make up.','Tetris',726759,6.9195,7.8,'-BLM1naCfME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25902,_binary '\0','/olwNdhuypfQruJzrgC6qdvpZHfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12758486',6.5,8302,'en','Chevalier','The illegitimate son of an African slave and a French plantation owner, Joseph Bologne rises to improbable heights in French society as a celebrated violinist-composer and fencer, complete with an ill-fated love affair and a falling out with Marie Antoinette and her court.','/5uKvfGF12cFr2Jblj7wFYm7AFgG.jpg','2023-04-20',104,'Released','The true untold story.','Chevalier',812635,3.5315,6.4,'-LtCIImfSCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25903,_binary '\0','/aQs9W0Xd2Pzr6ybuWiuepFMVJh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12758600',7.2,3653,'hi','कॉमेडी कपल','A story of two stand-up comedians, Deep and Zoya, and how they try to navigate their way through their relationship while joking about it on stage!','/mY3UO6GFnxhyjV3Ogmij9ZWJGem.jpg','2020-10-21',117,'Released',NULL,'Comedy Couple',748027,0.8768,8.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25904,_binary '\0','/FoWoVdi2LpyrHiLDBMtjxX2AED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1275861',4.8,2322,'en','Under the Mountain','Teenage twins battle dark forces hidden beneath Auckland\'s volcanoes.','/94g3Mt3qJxh6CmQ3J38CHUiMnJe.jpg','2009-12-10',91,'Released','An epic journey to save the world...','Under the Mountain',32932,2.1161,4.5,'WhRR-Z168Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25905,_binary '\0','/mM4M6vNxyhhDwgMqF9OhO5fGGaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1275863',6.8,18584,'hi','लव आज कल','Two lovers break up after they realize that their career goals are pulling them in different directions.','/6Q3pZ7pcEzHqr7ajmVRsxl5YeJq.jpg','2009-07-31',128,'Released',NULL,'Love Aaj Kal',19663,1.9155,6.3,'M8pWvwzbDQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25906,_binary '\0','/4GPCnwvTbsDleH5QIOyDLMsK8a2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1276104',7.4,632842,'en','Looper','In the year 2044, time travel has not yet been invented but in 30 years it will have been. When the mob wants to get rid of someone, they will send their target into the past where a looper, a hired gun, like Joe is waiting to mop up. Joe is getting rich and life is good until the day the mob decides to close the loop, sending back Joe\'s future self for assassination.','/sNjL6SqErDBE8OUZlrDLkexfsCj.jpg','2012-09-26',118,'Released','Hunted by your future, haunted by your past.','Looper',59967,14.1758,6.918,'2iQuhsmtfHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25907,_binary '\0','/x78O0A1rrLswKWU2ulRw070aft3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1276105',5.6,3039,'en','Saint John of Las Vegas','Compulsive gambler John had finally beaten the habit, started a new life, and said farewell to Vegas for good... or so he thought. When his new boss sends him back to Sin City to investigate a shady insurance claim, all the chips are back on the table.','/fFW0KMESYWfI74UAZ5gc3Ct8MBI.jpg','2010-01-29',85,'Released',NULL,'Saint John of Las Vegas',27023,2.5355,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25908,_binary '\0','/oOWqqq8mQMgcotdPrcXtEAlcA1V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1276110',6.4,1764,'en','Charlie & Boots','After a family tragedy, Charlie and his estranged son, Boots, try to put their differences aside and head off on the road trip of a lifetime - from regional Victoria to the Cape York Peninsula - they overcome many challenges to reach their dream - to fish off the northernmost tip of Australia.','/sskyVJp4LfMFqbXQadCnM2unlNB.jpg','2009-09-03',101,'Released','They\'re on the road to somewhere','Charlie & Boots',27595,1.8362,6.1,'3Emo-v0lp64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25909,_binary '\0','/r1QQNqLESXZzPxRBEcEWwgKNxnk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12763474',7.3,2559,'en','Robin\'s Wish','The final word in the story of what really happened to Robin Williams at the end of his life, focusing on his fight against a deadly neurodegenerative disorder known as Lewy body dementia.','/eLmuW6tlMbTDnOOYJB94AOnf1GI.jpg','2020-09-01',76,'Released','The genius mind. The untold story.','Robin\'s Wish',729798,2.3133,6.987,'iNgVioW5IWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25910,_binary '\0','/au6YoYkzbcgZ4CTCwc57UdhD8FC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12763920',6.8,7711,'ko','다만 악에서 구하소서','A retired contract killer goes on a bloody rampage when a young girl finds herself at the mercy of gangland human traffickers and only one man can come to her rescue, with an arsenal of weapons and years of experience in the art of killing.','/hngKHgBHRD5nbTx92zatBC6eMSP.jpg','2020-08-05',108,'Released','Beginning of a dead end chase.','Deliver Us from Evil',581526,4.5481,6.862,'GGrKazlUfRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25911,_binary '\0','/mcoZV42CxmW07Ob8ynDuZ7wKZSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1276419',7.5,54479,'da','En kongelig affære','A young queen falls in love with her physician, and they start a revolution that changes their nation forever.','/AafVGIirBlCw8Whb4DSPSLX9nGW.jpg','2012-03-29',137,'Released','Their love affair would divide a nation.','A Royal Affair',88273,4.5494,7.3,'e8762G2Toeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25912,_binary '\0','/ArjhP5piSA4hFD77y0JucsMfJZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12764606',3.9,2604,'en','The Lockdown Hauntings','With the streets now empty, it isn’t just nature that is taking advantage of this unprecedented global disaster. Spirits are freer than ever before and the spirit of a notorious serial killer, AKA ‘The Locksmith’, is back from the dead and he has even more potential victims. Can self-isolating detective George Parker with the guidance of paranormal expert Jordan Myers, prevent more young women from becoming victims of The Lockdown Hauntings?','/nQ1BgDIQnPjUCJVozrnZftALeWT.jpg','2022-12-09',101,'Released','How do you stop a serial killer who\'s already dead?','The Lockdown Hauntings',732773,1.5071,4.2,'Q8m0oGSt9-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (25913,_binary '\0','/xHRabofjmMGoIV3mb6xgy4nwOcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12764628',4.5,2073,'en','The Jack in the Box: Awakening','When a vintage Jack-in-the-box is opened by a dying woman, she enters into a deal with the demon within that would see her illness cured in return for helping it claim six innocent victims.','/3Ib8vlWTrAKRrTWUrTrZPOMW4jp.jpg','2022-02-24',89,'Released','Once you open the box... you can\'t escape it.','The Jack in the Box: Awakening',801071,3.2016,6.2,'7InYvYQq8DU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25914,_binary '\0','/itnQ5bodu4ecKM8J6u3AkpdVgI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12766346',6.4,2175,'en','If I Only Had Christmas','At Christmas, a cheerful publicist teams up with a cynical business owner and his team to help a charity in need.','/oJ465N1mV9FgYrsuph7ZxNtCJLn.jpg','2020-11-29',84,'Released',NULL,'If I Only Had Christmas',737766,2.4388,6.6,'vU6h74gEAA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25915,_binary '\0','/aYhX26OyiMfrxMm8xlrdecZ6SFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12767996',6.7,1422,'ja','コンフィデンスマンJP プリンセス編','Set in Langkawi, Malaysia, professional scammers Dako (Masami Nagasawa), Boku-chan (Masahiro Higashide), and Richard (Fumiyo Kohinata) target the Fuu Family for their next heist. Raymond Fuu, who was the head of the Fuu Family, passed away and he left behind 10 trillion yen. Dako, Boku-chan and Richard scheme to gain the inordinate inheritance. --asianwiki','/48FXmddMqf7YN6nxw6Mc8TpRiw0.jpg','2020-07-23',124,'Released',NULL,'The Confidence Man JP – Episode of the Princess –',657350,1.7895,6.407,'Y5XVK1MWMwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25916,_binary '\0','/ip9P7VaNtnkAQdFttEnmSApxxmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1276962',7.6,6918,'en','How to Make Money Selling Drugs','Ten easy steps show you how to make money from drugs, featuring a series of interviews with drug dealers, prison employees, and lobbyists arguing for tougher drug laws.','/sssykN580AHcU2F1W4LBgo5DJvi.jpg','2012-09-07',96,'Released',NULL,'How to Make Money Selling Drugs',124071,2.2121,7.1,'AxRVhgbVN9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25917,_binary '\0','/zmuTRTpBgCen2igqgcsjvGlLtKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12769908',6.7,1977,'sr','Хероји Халијарда','A story inspired by the largest single rescue mission of downed Allied airmen behind enemy lines in aviation history of all time, codenamed “The Halyard Mission”. This action took place in the summer of 1944. It was led by the Yugoslav Army in the Fatherland that was headed by General Dragoljub “Draža” Mihailović. It was at great cost and sacrifice that the Serbian people saved 508 American and other Allied countries’ airmen from certain death, sending them off to safety from the improvised airfield in the Serbian village of Pranjani, at the foot of Mt Suvobor.','/20NRJyeBycwQUlhgCeH0QyDNgcZ.jpg','2023-10-10',114,'Released',NULL,'The Heroes of Halyard',1160627,1.266,7.5,'Y54feeD502I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25918,_binary '\0','/3V9lo0udv734iryHJezPHWjoQAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12773628',6.9,3048,'en','One Royal Holiday','When Anna offers a stranded mother and son shelter in a blizzard, she learns that they are the Royal Family of Galwick. Anna shows the Prince how they do Christmas in her hometown, encouraging him to open his heart and be true to himself.','/qZMQ6Xp57sXZXzzYUuj4tYkU1MB.jpg','2020-10-31',84,'Released',NULL,'One Royal Holiday',737762,3.3147,6.7,'o-_ljWC8EvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25919,_binary '\0','/9c0lHTXRqDBxeOToVzRu0GArSne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12774526',3.5,2653,'en','After the Pandemic','Set in a post-apocalyptic world where a global airborne pandemic has wiped out 90% of the Earth\'s population and only the young and immune have endured as scavengers. For Ellie and Quinn, the daily challenges to stay alive are compounded when they become hunted by the merciless Stalkers.','/p1LbrdJ53dGfEhRopG71akfzOVu.jpg','2022-03-01',84,'Released','Hunt or be hunted.','After the Pandemic',935271,1.6611,5,'UZCVv3SFNtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25920,_binary '\0','/5KCW4GAH9ABV2KftH3Ej395z2R9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1277728',6.9,4521,'it','Pranzo di ferragosto','Broke, and armed only with his sense of humor, middle-aged Gianni lives with his mother in their old apartment. The debts are mounting, but if Gianni looks after the building manager\'s mother during the Ferragosto, a mid-August holiday, all will be forgiven.','/qqvur0NR5NcdOjRVvHBgpjXjubm.jpg','2008-04-30',75,'Released',NULL,'Mid-August Lunch',17631,1.8395,6.8,'OEmkappTLEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25921,_binary '\0','/67ln5E2D32XFHegFwmFjxT3wvqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1277737',7.9,23377,'en','The Stoning of Soraya M.','In 1986 Iran, Sahebjam, whose car breaks down in a remote village, enters into a conversation with Zahra, who relays to him the story about her niece, Soraya, whose arranged marriage to an abusive tyrant ended in tragedy.','/m4CfYBh1ZnYqZbt7ziYjHf53P4.jpg','2009-06-26',114,'Released','When a deadly conspiracy became a shameful cover-up One witness refused to be silent','The Stoning of Soraya M.',33409,3.4995,7.684,'IWQ9phw1C9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25922,_binary '\0','/cNogdBHu9qY9DQDMlXhJiW5tnD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1277936',6.3,10131,'en','Cropsey','Realizing the urban legend of their youth has actually come true, two filmmakers delve into the mystery surrounding five missing children and the real-life boogeyman linked to their disappearances.','/7yemDtWalM9x2AD6dYSQSND6W8h.jpg','2010-06-04',84,'Released','The Truth is Terrifying.','Cropsey',56811,1.1579,6,'lDM-Ef2cZqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25923,_binary '\0','/uDR9UjSuykTL8g3N3bh3siZ4n3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1277953',6.8,221359,'en','Madagascar 3: Europe\'s Most Wanted','Animal pals Alex, Marty, Melman, and Gloria are still trying to make it back to New York\'s Central Park Zoo. They are forced to take a detour to Europe to find the penguins and chimps who broke the bank at a Monte Carlo casino. When French animal-control officer Capitaine Chantel DuBois picks up their scent, Alex and company are forced to hide out in a traveling circus.','/ekraj4ksvIKeuvQVEevEJkuybZd.jpg','2012-06-06',93,'Released','They have one shot to get back home.','Madagascar 3: Europe\'s Most Wanted',80321,23.9812,6.651,'PlkWVkpP59U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25924,_binary '\0','/qclXsqBnRHRDFCmdaw6cJyw15Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278027',5.7,1305,'en','The Sweeter Side of Life','Pampered Manhattan housewife Desiree Harper has it all. That is until her husband unexpectedly dumps her for his acupuncturist. Faced with an airtight prenup, Desiree reluctantly lands a job making cupcakes at her father\'s bakery in Flemington, NJ. She soon discovers there\'s more to life than 5th Avenue and true love can be even sweeter in small town America.','/sDJdffM8KR9eUtOp38JVGtix24x.jpg','2013-07-11',80,'Released',NULL,'The Sweeter Side of Life',210983,2.2389,5.8,'2EqJWyxLJ7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25925,_binary '\0','/dQmxPgx2ymhGNnF9YjGBeilYEw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278060',7.9,2539,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第五章 矛盾螺旋','Tomoe Enjou is attacked by bullies from his old school and saved by Shiki Ryougi. He asks her to hide him at her place and admits that he killed someone. Several days later, there are still no broadcasts about the murder as if it didn\'t happen... and when the victims are found, they\'re alive and unharmed.','/vScnbrMbDpuwbiRafOcuxHjDKsI.jpg','2008-08-16',114,'Released','\"This spiral called Life, accumulated over several miracles and opportunities.\"','The Garden of Sinners: Paradox Spiral',23155,2.4921,7.6,'o3nYOOkXRfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25926,_binary '\0','/n1AdDvHvWcbyo6LPr5U68ocg2mS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12780950',4.5,1511,'ml','മഹേഷും മാരുതിയും','A man\'s attachment to his car gets tested when he falls in love with his childhood friend.','/ngqptMflbgoWNRaoZdYryMC9loO.jpg','2023-03-10',134,'Released',NULL,'Maheshum Marutiyum',935278,0.8706,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25927,_binary '\0','/mYSmeIEHo9WKDBVdjY60flz5a8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278104',5.2,8031,'tr','Osmanlı Cumhuriyeti','The film depicts a world in which Atatürk never became leader, the War of Independence never took place, and the Ottoman Republic continues to exist in a form adapted to the present day. The continuation of the Ottoman Republic instead of the Republic of Turkey, Ankara not being the capital, signs and license plates being in both Turkish and Arabic, and the sultan wearing a suit under his caftan are some of the tragicomic situations that make up the film\'s story.','/hwbRfF7JDYYyNNh2GnZispMRSej.jpg','2008-11-21',100,'Released',NULL,'The Ottoman Republic',52139,1.5255,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25928,_binary '\0','/bnRlmCPCGfQp5Uow6W31KN5CsTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278124',5.2,1584,'no','Snarveien','Driving back to Norway, Lina and Martin reach a roadblock where a policeman tells them to take a detour deep into the Swedish forest. But soon one creepy incident after another leaves them stranded in the dark woods and everything seems much too bizarre to be accidental.','/uPH2kfWPTLGeRKJK2mDkDt9oMI.jpg','2009-07-31',77,'Released',NULL,'Detour',29923,1.3247,5.3,'dFB7hYCoyao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25929,_binary '\0','/sSHSBbtkS6x3J1RGssKNwH4F64E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278180',5.8,2134,'sv','Kenny Begins','Kenny Starfighter is probably the most hopeless student the Hero academics of the galaxy has ever had. But in his desperate attempt in graduating he accidentally crashes on earth and discovers Pontus, an earthling who accidentally stumbled upon an intergalactic crystal which gave him inhuman strength. Now Kenny must save Pontus from Rutger Oversmart who wants the powers from the crystal for himself and Pontus must save Kennys faith from failing school and ending up as a hairdresser.','/oQHJCQfM14xSk89xkRi3aryE1Vp.jpg','2009-03-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Kenny Begins',21013,1.3342,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25930,_binary '\0','/5GWX9A160cglkIOFDFliSOxgH4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12782448',5.6,2181,'ta','பிச்சைக்காரன் 2','A poor man with a painful past becomes a victim of illegal brain replacement surgery, leaving him to struggle in the shoes of a rich billionaire.','/sZ6b5VYTZRFI1Q66tsOQXKokre7.jpg','2023-05-19',148,'Released',NULL,'Pichaikkaran 2',748917,1.1149,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25931,_binary '\0','/5oRKJU5NxAtAirvR9eZCbbRcJzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278293',6.3,2284,'en','9to5: Days in Porn','9to5 - Days in Porn focuses on the people behind a controversial and multi-billion dollar industry \"The Adult Entertainment industry\". It depicts their stories, each one different, unadorned and authentic, without glorification or prejudice. It delivers deep insight into their personal lives - from glamorous to grotesque - strange, fascinating, offensive, absurd and sometimes funny moments all at once.','/vCcXRri6Rrb2nZ0eDXPU3JKrpaS.jpg','2008-08-24',113,'Released',NULL,'9to5: Days in Porn',19929,3.7437,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25932,_binary '\0','/hjycsXyJRwFkEtWMEyhWNZdJDLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278322',4.7,1724,'en','Colin','Our hero Colin is bitten by a zombie; he dies and returns from the dead. We follow him as he wanders through suburbia during the throes of a cadaverous apocalypse.','/o2n6IfxHoBSFmvKd7R04qFTF5eG.jpg','2008-11-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Colin',27231,2.3269,4.4,'yRtQGo5BlaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25933,_binary '\0','/vz8H0z12dWoN8pzwIh6IwcpolP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278340',6.3,73448,'no','Død snø','Eight medical students on a ski trip to Norway discover that Hitler\'s horrors live on when they come face to face with a battalion of zombie Nazi soldiers intent on devouring anyone unfortunate enough to wander into the remote mountains where they were once sent to die.','/sfwVo5cZJtO8VyDWTILDt4f69IT.jpg','2009-01-09',88,'Released','Eins, Zwei, Die!','Dead Snow',14451,4.6012,6,'2qUo2tS6t7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25934,_binary '\0','/oOZM1C3wZtsZtdidVgEazeas7U4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12783454',4.8,27943,'en','The Kissing Booth 3','It’s the summer before Elle heads to college, and she has a secret decision to make. Elle has been accepted into Harvard, where boyfriend Noah is matriculating, and also Berkeley, where her BFF Lee is headed and has to decide if she should stay or not.','/c7xcqnMDVQ5v1hJBm3AZ5YikNe6.jpg','2021-08-11',112,'Released','The end of an era. The beginning of everything else.','The Kissing Booth 3',727745,7.7803,6.9,'5fKn0Dhj64w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25935,_binary '\0','/qpEW55mfsAaPL9VIuAeNX6uDCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278379',6.3,9195,'en','Jack Goes Boating','A limo driver\'s blind date sparks a tale of love, betrayal, friendship and grace—centered on two working-class New York City couples.','/5Qd8IJYdzzZh4Ylc8raKA9alRyW.jpg','2010-09-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Jack Goes Boating',43943,2.3807,6,'KcQjq2D2zXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25936,_binary '\0','/d6IpPxxsDtKqc9b3QOjtkA40zQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278449',7.1,10224,'sv','Sound of Noise','A tone-deaf cop works to track down a group of guerilla percussionists whose anarchic public performances are terrorizing the city.','/fD4WnzQH0YrvqXXon9RDTnOVPUw.jpg','2010-12-25',102,'Released','The first musical cop movie','Sound of Noise',48392,2.3225,7.2,'lUOO54rpXP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25937,_binary '\0','/aCURY1tNUkvrNnjw5qYJXTUp7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1278469',8.2,37416,'en','Temple Grandin','A biopic of Temple Grandin, an autistic American who has become one of the leading scientists in humane livestock handling.','/gQhQ6yEkUkDDo1zugpq46PJN8xZ.jpg','2010-02-06',108,'Released','Autism gave her a vision. She gave it a voice.','Temple Grandin',33602,4.5131,7.9,'cpkN0JdXRpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25938,_binary '\0','/xQzJNxkWtbtCvLKkq7Hjyw38G8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12787842',6,1367,'en','The Santa Squad','Allie, an out of work art teacher, has to accept a job with the Santa Squad to help wealthy widower Gordon and his two precious daughters rediscover the magic of Christmas. As Allie is lifting the holiday spirits of the family with Christmas decorations, cookies and shopping, her kindness is rewarded with the most unexpected of gifts: love!','/tEl9MFJnZjwVn0MsZMpJ6xvk0h2.jpg','2020-12-07',80,'Released',NULL,'The Santa Squad',744949,1.9823,6.1,'AzhwkKzbK4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25939,_binary '\0','/ckP7tL0mkRWSnFXSb3FLZs75SEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12788368',6.4,1277,'es','El Planeta','Amidst the devastation of post-crisis Spain, mother and daughter bluff and grift to keep up the lifestyle they think they deserve, bonding over common tragedy and an impending eviction.','/fsjc9edVdY7kxuC3889h1XWxTsv.jpg','2021-09-24',82,'Released',NULL,'El Planeta',776536,1.2635,6.1,'2pydmVzW_6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25940,_binary '\0','/2NrIzba4wHUYXJurKAMFs70Qcok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12788488',6.4,24952,'en','Deadstream','A disgraced internet personality attempts to win back his followers by livestreaming one night alone in a haunted house. But when he accidentally unleashes a vengeful spirit, his big comeback event becomes a real-time fight for his life.','/dC38JMmb17geWFIjIBgNoKRMFnL.jpg','2022-10-20',88,'Released','He\'s dying for followers','Deadstream',886083,3.3885,6.3,'6NGnOyNhQ5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25941,_binary '\0','/lbmAcK9e3qec2wJXOZZG70kbjem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12789110',6.5,1749,'it','Le sorelle Macaluso','Maria, Pinuccia, Lia, Katia and Antonella are five sisters who live in an apartment in Palermo. They make a living by renting doves for ceremonies. On a normal day at the beach, tragedy strucks.','/bBpfslKNy6VCTMu48o0sslJZgKy.jpg','2020-09-10',89,'Released',NULL,'The Macaluso Sisters',606865,1.3283,7.071,'W-RClMQnl_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25942,_binary '\0','/czJ2mC7fMhh4rRJ5UPaKb7fkKqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12789212',7.3,1949,'de','Final Account','A depiction of the last living generation of German participants in Adolf Hitler’s Third Reich.','/b8LYTQnsppdRGxzkYmd94ZtWzfj.jpg','2021-05-21',94,'Released','Never-before-seen interviews with the last living generation from Hitler\'s Third Reich. This is the past speaking to the present.','Final Account',728125,2.0133,7.545,'qobRIgAyQiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25943,_binary '\0','/l1Z9PLy8AXiqlZmFEgiGWeSFdSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12789558',7.2,139425,'en','Belfast','Buddy is a young boy on the cusp of adolescence, whose life is filled with familial love, childhood hijinks, and a blossoming romance. Yet, with his beloved hometown caught up in increasing turmoil, his family faces a momentous choice: hope the conflict will pass or leave everything they know behind for a new life.','/3mInLZyPOVLsZRsBwNHi3UJXXnm.jpg','2021-11-12',98,'Released','No matter how far you go, you never forget where you came from.','Belfast',777270,5.4319,7.029,'C658p987SQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25944,_binary '\0','/dYrHQb15gYIcHtJ6bwe9fNtEjtu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1279083',7,1905,'en','Examined Life','Examined Life pulls philosophy out of academic journals and classrooms, and puts it back on the streets. Offering privileged moments with great thinkers from fields ranging from moral philosophy to cultural theory, Examined Life reveals philosophy\'s power to transform the way we see the world around us and imagine our place in it.','/safs2eMlCyHo0J9qtRKGNzXTRkw.jpg','2008-09-05',87,'Released',NULL,'Examined Life',24566,1.0661,6.5,'1zwmum5_ofU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25945,_binary '\0','/MocpW8Wrp8uireBg6bT6Y6TKWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12792418',6.8,11064,'ko','낙원의 밤','An assassin named Tae-goo is offered a chance to switch sides with his rival Bukseong gang, headed by Chairman Doh. Tae-goo rejects the offer that results in the murder of his sister and niece. In revenge, Tae-goo brutally kills Chairman Doh and his men and flees to Jeju Island where he meets Jae-yeon, a terminally ill woman. Though, the henchman of the Bukseong gang, Executive Ma is mercilessly hunting Tae-goo to take revenge.','/dYCWUAidqgakGETwZkfGxU7CWhL.jpg','2020-09-03',131,'Released','No Safe Haven.','Night in Paradise',606523,4.0111,6.9,'y9XGC6iwgwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25946,_binary '\0','/ciFpP7Gb4ZlH6qNCMGftU0weWIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12792598',5.6,1254,'es','Selva Trágica','Deep in the jungle, a group of Mexican gum workers crosses their path with Agnes, a mysterious Belizean woman. Her presence enlivens the fantasies and desires of those men, without knowing that they have woken up an ancient Mayan legend.','/2ZVuB2IhHTBo7LTGTPs0Pzfb6H8.jpg','2020-09-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Tragic Jungle',618746,2.1075,6.1,'JGWrqh6Uo2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25947,_binary '\0','/iYunZznr8qaxdaRI6Cvi6ryLe5f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12794338',4.1,2086,'ta','அச்சம் மடம் நாணம் பயிர்ப்பு','The story revolves around a teenager from a conservative family who struggles to strike a balance between societal expectations and personal desires. According to the popular adage, Achcham (Fear), Madam (Innocence), Naanam (Coyness), Payirppu (Chastity) are the four \"ideal\" qualities that every good Tamil girl must possess.','/yARPw34kZqX4L4nkvz3F0iJTQub.jpg','2022-03-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Achcham Madam Naanam Payirppu',952220,1.1695,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25948,_binary '\0','/hZm2bAT9fB4EL93flj1fnrYXHdp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1279935',6.3,180905,'en','Date Night','Phil and Claire Foster fear that their mild-mannered relationship may be falling into a stale rut. During their weekly date night, their dinner reservation leads to their being mistaken for a couple of thieves—and now a number of unsavoury characters want Phil and Claire killed.','/9ftaHHJW2IrtnGbazdn5SP8V7Cf.jpg','2010-04-08',88,'Released','One ordinary couple. One little white lie.','Date Night',35056,9.006,6.118,'aspBKFz2dBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25949,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1280011',6.6,1604,'en','No Impact Man','Follow the Manhattan-based Beavan family as they abandon their high consumption 5th Avenue lifestyle and try to live a year while making no net environmental impact.','/dYnXmhbViEOsZlMED0UvHhdJws.jpg','2009-09-04',93,'Released',NULL,'No Impact Man',30873,0.7347,6.2,'Z9Ctt7FGFBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25950,_binary '\0','/zlj0zHo67xXoj7hvwGtaKRkSdBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12800524',5.9,11754,'en','Encounter','A decorated Marine goes on a rescue mission to save his two young sons from an unhuman threat. As their journey takes them in increasingly dangerous directions, the boys will need to leave their childhoods behind.','/AjRUsn8m2znK4mQuYR5fUguBDQM.jpg','2021-12-03',108,'Released','When you stand by each other, you can get through anything.','Encounter',728526,3.406,6.3,'SB44bZVe-c4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25951,_binary '\0','/620hnMVLu6RSZW6a5rwO8gqpt0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12801262',7.4,227996,'en','Luca','Luca and his best friend Alberto experience an unforgettable summer on the Italian Riviera. But all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water’s surface.','/9x4i9uKGXt8IiiIF5Ey0DIoY738.jpg','2021-06-17',95,'Released','Prepare for an unforgettable trip.','Luca',508943,16.0717,7.772,'YdAIBlPVe9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25952,_binary '\0','/oBt0rVzfPUAYIu6TZj9U5YGZWR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12801326',7.1,1510,'en','76 Days','Raw and intimate, this documentary captures the struggles of patients and frontline medical professionals battling the COVID-19 pandemic in Wuhan.','/ebj4sLjGWfoCAWRSeKZUoef4bS1.jpg','2020-09-10',93,'Released',NULL,'76 Days',728928,0.7735,7.2,'KpYhePFx1qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25953,_binary '\0','/5fhTStFUZzR2dCiVYTQgSwzzmkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12801356',7,1907,'en','MLK/FBI','Based on newly declassified files, the film explores the US government’s surveillance and harassment of Martin Luther King, Jr.','/qYG0J3tKCTj8otQQ7buVs3YATBI.jpg','2020-09-15',104,'Released',NULL,'MLK/FBI',728868,1.1785,6.9,'Lvfxzht9KUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25954,_binary '\0','/k29768dIYqNGBw5yYgR8dUVxP6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12801374',7.2,2527,'ja','すばらしき世界','Mikami, an ex-yakuza of middle age with most of his life in prison, gets released after serving 13 years of sentence for murder. Hoping to find his long lost mother, from whom he was separated as a child, he applies for a TV show and meets a young TV director Tsunoda. Meanwhile, he struggles to get a proper job and fit into society. His impulsive, adamant nature and ingrained beliefs cause friction in his relationship with Tsunoda and those who want to help him.','/w6NjKEdi5kqRsVv05pYJ2uyeOCU.jpg','2021-02-11',126,'Released',NULL,'Under the Open Sky',728882,2.265,7.5,'z000q9qv3Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25955,_binary '\0','/ba1z6lodrv84EamrxWPKWEUyp1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12801814',5.3,5063,'en','Violation','A troubled woman on the edge of divorce returns home to her younger sister after years apart. But when her sister and brother-in-law betray her trust, she embarks on a vicious crusade of revenge.','/9W2UhhdQFFvWvuIyOgkG92Z6bFz.jpg','2020-09-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Violation',728874,1.6485,5.5,'Otu7hGMgmcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25956,_binary '\0','/qockJIX0NNDiny7q5BoLywOVZxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1280534',6.7,4166,'es','Un novio para mi mujer','El Tenso does not know how to face his ill-tempered wife, Tana, to tell her that he wants to separate. Carlos, a friend of Tenso, suggests him to invert the situation and cause Tana to leave him by hiring Cuervo Flores, an irresistible seducer, to try and charm his wife until she falls in love with him.','/ybMKaNMoBie2ebXf4TIz1Sh70Iq.jpg','2008-08-14',100,'Released',NULL,'A Boyfriend for My Wife',16916,1.5563,6.3,'03asob6xEYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25957,_binary '\0','/tmbwscy8OvNMkg4CFOi8eEO523b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1280558',8.1,86660,'hi','A Wednesday!','Prakash Rathod, a retired police commissioner recounts the most memorable case of his career wherein he was informed about a bomb scare in Mumbai by an ordinary commoner.','/gVUSxtJM3arL5VIUIRNYde20EF0.jpg','2008-09-05',103,'Released',NULL,'A Wednesday!',19703,1.3284,7.008,'LGfwASavWNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25958,_binary '\0','/xhK1B9ilRCvOKdEs6JofFQj5JDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1280567',7.1,5964,'pt','Última Parada 174','Sandro was a boy who loved to sing rap, to kiss, to stare the statue of Christ the Redeemer and dreamed to go visit Copacabana. Growing up on streets, the story culminates at the infamous episode of 12th June 2000, when Sandro hijacked bus 174.','/qvSZA7HIJMelYSaQ7ObBCylDnsX.jpg','2008-10-24',108,'Released','A ride you\'ll never forget...','Last Stop 174',20268,1.9736,7.216,'2IOFiuzFFqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25959,_binary '\0','/fZ4hrFacm5yow9gT64rS6YMNyHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12808182',5.3,10574,'fr','Le Dernier Mercenaire','A legendary secret service agent comes out of hiding and returns to France to help the son he\'s never met get out of trouble.','/ttpKJ7XQxDZV252KNEHXtykYT41.jpg','2021-07-30',110,'Released','The daddy of all secret agents.','The Last Mercenary',729720,3.7821,6.346,'G4_ULVw5L04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25960,_binary '\0','/2ICMZZVcwboF8Z9V7aaJY3CVh9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12810074',5.5,25827,'en','Nightbitch','A woman, thrown into the stay-at-home routine of raising a toddler in the suburbs, slowly embraces the feral power deeply rooted in motherhood, as she becomes increasingly aware of the bizarre and undeniable signs that she may be turning into a dog.','/h49Pie8gM2jK0UHGFRjfPB3YTd.jpg','2024-12-06',98,'Released','Motherhood is a bitch.','Nightbitch',728949,6.0581,5.693,'918prRymA-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25961,_binary '\0','/2EYZgQCo9MNty5Nc6swTgzFYJUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12810902',3.3,4195,'en','The Moderator','After the murder of her two Scandinavian friends in Morocco, a Russian blogger decides to do her own justice.','/aB6aJkoFhYUmWEQaoxv67ZEgZOF.jpg','2022-07-29',81,'Released',NULL,'The Moderator',877619,2.0258,4.4,'maXOqkvhVoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25962,_binary '\0','/1paN9XayTNig1lVkVEcPL7luKhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1281374',5.8,2532,'en','Don McKay','Everything appears off-kilter when a man returns to his hometown after 25 years to visit his former lover.','/pkziSZ6vmwFnhybgBAM96Q6xKMr.jpg','2009-04-24',87,'Released','Some secrets are better left buried.','Don McKay',35689,1.6037,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25963,_binary '\0','/2BZ7PC9aISswNXV2tugmjGiriaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12816348',7.2,1603,'fr','Miraculous World : New York, les héros unis','Marinette\'s class is headed to New York, the city of superheroes, for French-American Friendship Week. But the arrival of Hawk Moth will complicate everything.','/9YbyvcrHmY2SVbdfXpb8mC4Fy0g.jpg','2020-09-25',61,'Released','New city. Same duty.','Miraculous World: New York, United HeroeZ',755812,8.1739,8.08,'952fktHweJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25964,_binary '\0','/krN2V7leYVBp6dOLzP11sM44eNb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12818328',7.5,17867,'en','Hundreds of Beavers','In the 19th century, a drunken applejack salesman must go from zero to hero and become North America\'s greatest fur trapper by defeating hundreds of beavers.','/jBg64OA2QEWL0zaOFMoAGipeGjJ.jpg','2024-01-26',108,'Released','Possibly thousands.','Hundreds of Beavers',1019939,4.4084,7.3,'Dm5XHpQZvek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25965,_binary '\0','/2hMqrgSN10iwOZJyl1ZIt6b4Zdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282016',6.4,2578,'en','The 39 Steps','Richard Hannay, a mining engineer on holiday from the African colonies, finds London socialite life terribly dull. Yet it\'s more than he bargained for when a secret agent bursts into his room and entrusts him with a coded notebook, concerning the impending start of World War I. In no time both German agents and the British law are chasing him, ruthlessly coveting the Roman numerals code, which Hannay believes he must personally crack.','/8N537ufRENaGUEJR0JTrRoK93rR.jpg','2008-12-28',90,'Released',NULL,'The 39 Steps',16877,1.7412,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25966,_binary '\0','/fFgMO4cd0fGAjJvOIm2AyVJ7Iu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282052',6.9,3343,'en','His Name Was Jason: 30 Years of Friday the 13th','A retrospective documentary about the groundbreaking horror series, Friday the 13th, featuring interviews with cast and crew from the twelve films spanning 3 decades.','/1YyPmtz41mXO0A2ztsn3Ibe6ssF.jpg','2010-04-20',90,'Released',NULL,'His Name Was Jason: 30 Years of Friday the 13th',15004,2.7506,6.7,'5lFweKwTjWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25967,_binary '\0','/ctBY3BWhHn3GfNjAr6ZNmGjd3Qu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12821362',2.6,1484,'en','Harry and Meghan: Escaping the Palace','The Duke and Duchess of Sussex are taking on the British monarchy in the third installment in Lifetime’s movie trilogy about the royal couple. The film explores what really happened inside the palace that drove Harry and Meghan to leave everything behind in order to make a future for themselves and their son Archie.','/plfWQnlLaiPoayrj2a0EJOhPw97.jpg','2021-09-06',120,'Released',NULL,'Harry and Meghan: Escaping the Palace',858717,1.3645,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25968,_binary '\0','/ka3C7QYGdi9L31i1KZ28UVFVFNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282139',7.9,13513,'tr','Devrim Arabaları','In the years of military coup, Turkey was unable to produce its own cars. But Pasha believed that Turkish people can produce their own cars so he ordered 2 cars. Gunduz and engineers with him must produce 2 cars in only 130 days!','/1FUuUG7bY8QIfoWSVLV7pofVf7q.jpg','2008-10-24',115,'Released',NULL,'Cars of the Revolution',52668,1.5044,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25969,_binary '\0','/30rvmoEBqovm723agDJ3QddWXcY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282140',7,447872,'en','Easy A','Olive, an average high school student, sees her below-the-radar existence turn around overnight once she decides to use the school\'s gossip grapevine to advance her social standing. Now her classmates are turning against her and the school board is becoming concerned, including her favorite teacher and the distracted guidance counselor. With the support of her hilariously idiosyncratic parents and a little help from a long-time crush, Olive attempts to take on her notorious new identity and crush the rumor mill once and for all.','/v5f1qO6NJnxWgONgkYg21TW39DT.jpg','2010-09-16',93,'Released','Let\'s not and say we did.','Easy A',37735,10.657,6.8,'KNbPnqyvItk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25970,_binary '\0','/tzlD0z8BT1bvwdBIghG8RXldp1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282142',6.5,1624,'en','The Nanny Express','With their mother dead, Emily and Ben torment their nannies to quit as fast as their father hires them. Till a nanny named Kate shows up and slowly wins Ben over. That\'s bad enough, but when her father and Kate start to fall in love, Emily sets out to break them up and match him with her ballet teacher.','/jxzR92vsqUBcBaYKpxE397i0Da7.jpg','2009-01-02',120,'Released','Happiness is only one interview away','The Nanny Express',43735,2.3758,5.9,'lXC5sI-1K7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25971,_binary '\0','/jgOqHQS6kj3rlz2E3GJfDdoQTyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282147',5.9,1367,'en','Doc West','After bandits steal his poker winnings this American legend makes his way to the next town in search of them. Seeking out his revenge during a poker game gone bad Doc West finds himself in the local town jail. When his past is exposed and a battle amongst the town breaks out in gunfire he will have to choose sides, between the outlaws or the law-abiding citizens.','/pABR4uDBhMm6HsP2fK1jkHlcybc.jpg','2009-09-07',180,'Released',NULL,'Doc West',39807,1.8874,6.2,'bIFmsfJR4d8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25972,_binary '\0','/zWmb8EMZNCuVaLnWUlYUaohneUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282153',6.3,2317,'pt','O Estranho Caso de Angélica','A photographer, Isaac, is asked by hotel owners to take portraits of their recently deceased daughter Angélica. When he looks at her through the lens of his camera, she appears to come back to life just for him. He instantly falls in love with her. From that moment, he will be haunted by Angélica day and night.','/rFFtcZX8cu99RcOSB1IBTXQYjAF.jpg','2010-12-29',97,'Released',NULL,'The Strange Case of Angelica',53413,1.692,6.5,'GVwnpN8HRA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25973,_binary '\0','/yKS1FhezmyFsrAGe6g5wK1L7aSD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1282155',6.7,1533,'fr','L\'Homme de Chevet','Muriel is beautiful, free-spirited and bed-ridden since a horrific accident. Leo is a drunk middle-aged ex-boxer. Desperate for work and unqualified, he interviews for Muriel, who hires him to cook and care for her against her better judgment. Initially out of his depth, Leo slowly wins Muriel\'s trust. As Muriel teaches him to read, he forces her to confront the joys beyond her window.','/uhIH2G6u4zFB6jyr6Wh3dRexkB8.jpg','2009-11-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Cartagena',52628,2.4568,5.664,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25974,_binary '\0','/oKqFPM54ZalHtom1xwpmAPLjXGD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12822926',7.2,3155,'en','On the 12th Date of Christmas','Two seemingly incompatible game designers team up to create a romantic, city-wide scavenger hunt themed for the \"12 Days of Christmas.\"','/piAaEyM0d18GW1R4Fjnqj4wIqwK.jpg','2020-11-01',84,'Released',NULL,'On the 12th Date of Christmas',737778,2.056,7.1,'DOpaB_4yswA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25975,_binary '\0','/1phS20ufmCOtT8kPBm3izGo6omk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12823454',5.7,45288,'en','Your Place or Mine','When best friends and total opposites Debbie and Peter swap homes for a week, they get a peek into each other\'s lives that could open the door to love.','/3oFfY1HpzJDlRzKSCBF2sA5mb9U.jpg','2023-02-10',109,'Released','Two lives. Two cities. One last chance.','Your Place or Mine',703451,10.1748,6.251,'5JyfgkPMXk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25976,_binary '\0','/8ocnkM8n1VxgQ1wMVFnSZvpY