unhappy family. FBI at the door.No Wi-Fi. Could this day get any worse?','Asteroid',876502,1.0214,6,'AQQQI8Vuiy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25984,_binary '\0','/drulhSX7P5TQlEMQZ3JoXKSDEfz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12838766',6.5,31513,'ko','승리호','When the crew of a space junk collector ship called The Victory discovers a humanoid robot named Dorothy that\'s known to be a weapon of mass destruction, they get involved in a risky business deal which puts their lives at stake.','/bmemsraCG1kIthY74NjDnnLRT2Q.jpg','2021-02-05',136,'Released','2092, the space sweep begins!','Space Sweepers',581389,5.6361,7,'H1WYnJF1Pwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25985,_binary '\0','/mYcZSyIj260YbvTuRSJSVF0GVpT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1283887',5.4,3258,'en','Burning Palms','A subversive tale that interlaces five stories set in Los Angeles, where no taboo is left unexplored as each character careens toward a dark and often comic fate','/6uNS6wOGGUgaUNtXMz32usyAmhH.jpg','2010-04-23',112,'Released','Five Tales That Will F#%! You Up For Life','Burning Palms',45013,2.665,5.234,'g8lrhLgI1dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25986,_binary '\0','/obVRoRquYuVUf4WqmCAvPmSJaSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1283889',6.3,2001,'fa','کنعان','Mina has decided to leave her older husband Morteza after ten years of marriage. Next Monday will be her divorce date, which means her first step towards her goal; immigration. However, the arrival of her older sister, Azar, together with the illness of her mother in law is causing her trouble. To her surprise, meanwhile, she finds out she is pregnant.','/kkp1VqoiOJXHk3S4YN3sLkxaKkL.jpg','2008-10-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Canaan',272270,1.3777,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25987,_binary '\0','/xWX5Do25HHAQq8atjDyO6NGioFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1283956',6.6,2475,'te','స్టూడెంట్ నెం.1','At his father\'s request, Aditya attends a law college in the coastal metropolis of Visakhapatnam, although he actually wanted to become an engineer. On the first day he meets the beautiful Anjali. Over time, the female student slowly begins to become interested in the strange newcomer, who acts nice and friendly but doesn\'t seem to be interested in anything else. The college is notorious for its disobediently and disorderly students. It\'s not the professors who are in charge on campus, but rather the student leader Satya. He is also in love with Anjali and sees Aditya as a competitor who needs to be put in his place. So Aditya faces multiple problems as he tries to reform the unruly students while dealing with his terrible past that everyone doesn\'t know about.','/5R3plOFdnoZyIVcXRKUcsHhI9RW.jpg','2001-09-27',155,'Released',NULL,'Student No. 1',82572,1.3186,5.214,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25988,_binary '\0','/3G1xFpoagVgdCg1uJs5z3eUAPm1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12839622',5.9,1833,'pa','Paani Ch Madhaani','A group of musicians travel to London after finding renewed success with a new singer. They end up winning the lottery, but misplace the winning ticket.','/6pv6nTPKvbN9UvKXmTJEkaMNtVD.jpg','2021-11-05',127,'Released',NULL,'Paani Ch Madhaani',890453,0.9286,7,'wQgUvqBiAak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25989,_binary '\0','/lPcXlPXoaIWIdlDHKdqX2TipSYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12839816',3.6,4112,'te','Asalu Em Jarigindhante',NULL,'/of9bdAMx1FIIBVIMGMik43ahzYY.jpg','2020-08-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Asalu Em Jarigindhante',730275,0.5088,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25990,_binary '\0','/hyK9WXnwBu7kbpewdTrp8vBSX4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1284028',7.4,2219,'en','Love the Beast','What if you were a Hollywood movie star with an obsession for cars and racing? Eric Bana is such a star!','/6YqNCBRErIcyyy2fSZQ5GFQxcpV.jpg','2009-03-12',92,'Released','25 Years of Love can\'t be Wrong','Love the Beast',20311,1.7731,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25991,_binary '\0','/9uwfH758mhTx6C0TEVmzbcQHuMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12844586',5.9,5891,'en','Sanctioning Evil','After being dishonorably discharged from the military, a Staff Sergeant finds his way back into society through a charismatic politician with a covert military operation to eliminate an underground criminal entity on U.S soil.','/ik6bMQ1Ar4Uch8owW2HWtQkPXWK.jpg','2022-10-07',110,'Released','Honor, betrayal, redemption.','Sanctioning Evil',1026377,2.8091,6,'AhwQ5IxpWjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25992,_binary '\0','/9wRAIQeOv2qzcgpfvA4dYZKeezl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12844910',5.8,167268,'hi','पठान','A soldier caught by enemies and presumed dead comes back to complete his mission, accompanied by old companions and foes.','/arf00BkwvXo0CFKbaD9OpqdE4Nu.jpg','2023-01-25',146,'Released','There is a storm coming. Fasten your seatbelt.','Pathaan',864692,5.9429,6.388,'yswBxKPFSvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25993,_binary '\0','/3Iuh238jb7QH9wh38uqSNCVfyaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1284526',6.9,1562,'cs','Venkovský učitel','A gifted and well-qualified young teacher takes a job teaching natural sciences at a grammar school in the country. Here he makes the acquaintance of a woman and her troubled 17-year old son. The teacher has no romantic interest in the woman but they quickly form a strong friendship, each recognizing the other\'s uncertainties, hopes and longing for love.','/f0QMtYSN1SDo93IrUcuIWZ06HLo.jpg','2008-03-20',117,'Released',NULL,'The Country Teacher',16439,1.1567,5.8,'Wh1Bff_i5Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25994,_binary '\0','/tSir1KH6WgQNAEDzf50tcrPiPzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1284575',5.7,224736,'en','Bad Teacher','A lazy, incompetent middle school teacher who hates her job and her students is forced to return to her job to make enough money for a boob job after her rich fiancé dumps her.','/zpIY4qUSX91J9XpPgr0hFrk1eKr.jpg','2011-05-16',92,'Released','She doesn\'t give an \"F.\"','Bad Teacher',52449,11.1918,5.614,'GahC5cVsU6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25995,_binary '\0','/fq5eURcFJTuTTuXkPr1BL6ua3aT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1284587',6.6,3044,'fa','شیرین','A hundred and fourteen famous Iranian theater and cinema actresses and a French star: mute spectators at a theatrical representation of Khosrow and Shirin, a Persian poem from the twelfth century, put on stage by Kiarostami. The development of the text -- long a favorite in Persia and the Middle East -- remains invisible to the viewer of the film, the whole story is told by the faces of the women watching the show.','/4Ekc4MJOdAq9yh0mqi1IttHgIdK.jpg','2009-04-18',92,'Released','You are the screen, they are the audience.','Shirin',87308,1.609,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25996,_binary '\0','/f2EShrwrmIdaDXuVnAlKoJymPTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1284591',6.6,3560,'tr','Süt','A high school graduate, Yusuf could not pass the university entrance exam. Writing poetry is his greatest passion and some of his poems are being printed in various obscure literary journals. But neither these poems, nor the rapidly falling price of the milk they sell, are being of any benefit to Yusuf and Zehra\'s lives. When Yusuf finds out about Zehra\'s secret affair with the town\'s stationmaster he gets disconcerted. Will he find the way to cope with his anxiety for the unknown future, the rapid change that he is going through and the pain of taking a step into adulthood and leaving his youth behind','/ojeiS9uaD2E76LLWiPr8oOHeWLZ.jpg','2009-01-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Milk',12471,1.6119,5.9,'DryB7s48dbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25997,_binary '\0','/n3mBbzyrMyZ2g7ppQhiQ1h9S8wR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12847168',6.2,1702,'hu','Nagykarácsony','A firefighter develops a fear of heights and has strange visions after his wedding proposal goes up in smoke. Will a teacher he meets later cure his vertigo and mend his broken heart?','/uZl6wPGpCQ7XbXdSrklHyoZnjaM.jpg','2021-11-25',109,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Flame',898691,0.8979,6.6,'EiPvZxr14TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25998,_binary '\0','/4Rn7vg25O6mXLYmNXYwttp1GQL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12847680',5.9,1776,'fr','Maison de retraite','A story of friendship between a young convict who is forced to work in a retirement home and a group of crazy old people. Together they organize their escape.','/lLrCA0MaLFZS518fkaeMUavJOGG.jpg','2022-02-16',97,'Released',NULL,'Retirement Home',736500,2.2732,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(25999,_binary '\0','/haOixpc26lheuIuO2WIi1M8nDO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12847812',6.8,3494,'fr','Tout s’est bien passé','When her elderly father has a stroke, Emmanuelle rushes to his bedside. Sick and half-paralysed in his hospital bed, he asks Emmanuelle to help him end his life.','/hyNNufs7Ds8TuT2kv4Z1mEfPx0r.jpg','2021-07-18',113,'Released',NULL,'Everything Went Fine',735726,4.2057,6.6,'YimoGA5_Kvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26000,_binary '\0','/aUtLuEvTI1Z0vItORUYho4UiU6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285009',5.3,40904,'en','The Strangers: Prey at Night','A family\'s road trip takes a dangerous turn when they arrive at a secluded mobile home park to stay with some relatives and find it mysteriously deserted. Under the cover of darkness, three masked killers pay them a visit to test the family\'s every limit as they struggle to survive.','/vdxLpPsZkPZdFrREp7eSeSzcimj.jpg','2018-03-07',86,'Released','Let us prey.','The Strangers: Prey at Night',371608,7.3296,5.7,'rNQrKls7k-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26001,_binary '\0','/9GDDzQ52GuGOuDeNRTuPz8NpCCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285010',4.4,3479,'en','Summer\'s Blood','A demented handyman comes to the rescue of a young woman, then imprisons her in his basement.','/pEDtMNONPumVCyhJQjeqVZyvVD.jpg','2009-11-02',91,'Released','In this house, within these walls, one family has a deadly secret.','Summer\'s Blood',26588,2.5463,5.4,'3eIMff1ZC4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26002,_binary '\0','/1PXwh3nJzgRkkYnqfWInJNypeL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285016',7.8,829070,'en','The Social Network','In 2003, Harvard undergrad and computer programmer Mark Zuckerberg begins work on a new concept that eventually turns into the global social network known as Facebook. Six years later, Mark is one of the youngest billionaires ever, but his unprecedented success leads to both personal and legal complications when he ends up on the receiving end of two lawsuits, one involving his former friend.','/n0ybibhJtQ5icDqTp8eRytcIHJx.jpg','2010-10-01',121,'Released','You don\'t get to 500 million friends without making a few enemies.','The Social Network',37799,20.281,7.377,'lB95KLmpLR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26003,_binary '\0','/8vDzqxZvrp7IdyAI5F8NePWGyEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12850582',8.2,2623,'ko','브레이크 더 사일런스: 더 무비','K-pop sensation BTS embark on their 2019 \'Love Yourself: Speak Yourself\' Tour, as the seven members begin to candidly tell personal stories they have never voiced before.','/k1VK2L971GmEevIjFbjcimxSeMx.jpg','2020-09-10',90,'Released','Borahae.','Break the Silence: The Movie',730647,1.969,9.1,'hz9_jkrrptU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26004,_binary '\0','/7i9wwdnpxEFOcV9p8md6zwb0OW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12851130',5.1,1563,'fi','Koputus','Three adult siblings return to their childhood home, where their parents were allegedly murdered many years ago. Their plan is to get the house and estate ready to be sold but an evil force tries to prevent them from doing so.','/ivZiw8oKNIH9mmVIwrft7pxA4Q2.jpg','2023-02-22',87,'Released',NULL,'The Knocking',869523,1.4849,5.5,'qr4_YWem18c','YouTube','Trailer'