-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26009,_binary '\0','/r4crDJeIpT2ZDLmptpA27Q67NZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285241',7.1,62440,'hi','Don 2','Having conquered the Asian underworld, crime boss Don sets in motion a plan that will give him dominion over Europe.','/2gBM8c36HIwn4vc2UuMeliqiCKY.jpg','2011-12-23',139,'Released','The Chase Continues','Don 2',41109,2.6752,7,'_X5w-6PqoZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26010,_binary '\0','/gtqBgw3i1WIMdZ4cJrOUYfnMhM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285246',6.9,3233,'fr','Mademoiselle Chambon','Véronique Chambon (Sandrine Kiberlain), a single schoolteacher and Jean (Vincent Lindon), discover an unexpected bond that causes them to question the direction of their lives. They move in different social circles but their relationship develops and their lives begin gradually to unravel.','/1tYs9sjWm33lTO0zUtPmCXPDQmx.jpg','2009-10-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Mademoiselle Chambon',34013,1.4335,6.4,'gJPvP3RS4Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26011,_binary '\0','/sUx0SuDAVYhx2cJr0qqYRsnBNNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285309',6.4,43123,'en','The Joneses','A seemingly perfect family moves into a suburban neighborhood, but when it comes to the truth as to why they\'re living there, they don\'t exactly come clean with their neighbors.','/5YINGouZK9pmPdMPAHv158eQf3o.jpg','2010-04-16',96,'Released','They\'re not just living the American dream, they\'re selling it.','The Joneses',41479,4.6677,6.2,'n2Y3GoN2PGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26012,_binary '\0','/me8J6liwKAiabtJteO2qmPlKMrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1285311',4.5,1376,'it','Natale a Rio','Fabio is in love with his colleague Linda, but she has never even seen him until he\'s mistaken for her boyfriend. Paolo and Mario leave for a luxurious vacation in Rio de Janeiro for Christmas, without knowing that their sons have booked a trip for the same low-cost destination and, for a problem of homonymy between fathers and sons, the two holidays are exchanged.','/b77Mv9O2Nw1ZAxm2uX0LeAPogmX.jpg','2008-12-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Natale a Rio',42437,1.3487,5.097,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26013,_binary '\0','/z1gOfb2IpoLN2wZY9hxVNs98HfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12856788',6.6,4524,'hi','Dangerous','Two women, who have some had bad experiences with men, passionately fall in love with each other.','/u746OGpGEeDezSELiCVTLqWxuK7.jpg','2022-04-08',99,'Released','A Killer Affair','Dangerous',877655,1.3717,2.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26014,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12857614',5.4,3172,'en','Love, Life & Pakodi','The film narrates the journey of a couple who face the complications and their confusion honestly, meanwhile rediscovering themselves at every step.','/zwvkx8lU4ohVf1jWBLtpzPrVWNd.jpg','2021-03-12',114,'Released',NULL,'Love, Life & Pakodi',819569,0.6695,0,'Fr1_iU90SJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26015,_binary '\0','/lQmjP6z2qJFQzjGuCDzyvBecM69.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12861212',6.7,7391,'hi','छोरी','Sakshi is eight months pregnant with her first child when she and Hemant are forced out of their home. They escape from the city and seek refuge in a house located deep inside sugarcane fields. The house is ridden with dark secrets that start unravelling as the story unfolds, posing a threat to Sakshi and her unborn child. Even as Sakshi tries to save herself and her unborn baby, scary sightings of three mysterious kids and a charred monster coupled with an eerie lullaby, emanating from an old transistor, wreak havoc with her sanity.','/sXMwQnF7yEgCY0AwjG49vK1t4dz.jpg','2021-11-26',129,'Released',NULL,'Chhorii',711643,1.2836,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26016,_binary '\0','/x2mwLto34QqB4nMlJgfFP6Wf43e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286124',6.3,4806,'en','iCarly: iGo to Japan','Carly, Sam and Freddie kick off their adventure in Japan on a tin can of a plane packed with caged possums and piloted by Spencer\'s odd acquaintance.','/i0TxUi4osHGcgORmpjHmzcff2AF.jpg','2008-11-08',99,'Released',NULL,'iCarly: iGo to Japan',62459,2.7309,6.8,'PEOZ-Xi5crk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26017,_binary '\0','/4KY72eR8E4VveOZ97hO7GyYuXD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286126',7.4,49676,'tr','A.R.O.G','Commander Logar escapes from the planet G.O.R.A. to Earth and finds Arif. Arif gets tricked by the evil Commander Logar into thinking that his intentions have changed but Commander Logar sends Arif 1.000.000 years into the past. After finding himself in the stone age, Arif begins to help the local tribe to defend themselves against a different, much more violent tribe and tries to find a way back to his time.','/5v3xYyHyJJKIyraRyR64szqCTkO.jpg','2008-12-05',127,'Released',NULL,'A.R.O.G',24426,1.9514,6.974,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26018,_binary '\0','/mZrnI76xbvq2dldhBHQKNz3P7Oo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286129',5.5,3176,'tr','Aşk Tutulması','Uğur, a fanatical Fenerbahçe fan, is a pharmaceutical representative. While he has a very calm personality in his daily life, he becomes a completely different person when it comes to football. His desire to win and his totems are what set him apart from other fanatics. Uğur, who lives with his mother and sister, is tired of his mother\'s pressure to get married. When it comes to marriage, Pınar also faces the same pressure from her mother. Uğur and Pınar meet by chance after a traffic accident. This encounter will bring about profound changes in both Uğur\'s and Pınar\'s lives.','/cz3urmK63RGRWWAId4x4lFQhq6f.jpg','2008-10-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Aşk Tutulması',52284,1.8901,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26019,_binary '\0','/jfBXIzOB0Flhm6YQ9QzftZy1TIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286142',2.7,2241,'tr','Destere','The story of a serial killer from Thrace. The film begins with two Trakyan farmers named Hayrettin and Hayati waking up one day in the basement of a village house. A voice recording from a serial killer who tells his victims, \"You don\'t play the game this way, you play it that way,\" begins to subject our heroes to various games. Inspired by the Saw series and serving as a parody of it, the film is a blend of comedy and horror.','/yiBNHic68dAMRdLBuZCFdKxP5i3.jpg','2008-07-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Destere',52129,1.5265,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26020,_binary '\0','/rliw4tb3MgL4BU9NrTTCOdwO3PV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286146',7.3,2261,'en','Full Love','Military veteran and former mercenary, FRENCHY works as a taxi driver, and hiding in Bangkok, picks up a beautiful female passenger who will change his life forever. When he embarks on a journey to save her he has the fight of his life.','/j9H8Pm5C8GzoYn3eNjprfexl3XW.jpg','2010-05-13',108,'Released','Haunted by the past, his vengeance knows no limits.','Full Love',51488,1.4939,7.4,'faOS-D_tbrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26021,_binary '\0','/t2punOrY26suWEOcd58CPBMFLxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286147',4.7,1955,'en','Ghost Machine','Two technicians battle a vengeful spirit that has infected their stolen military software.','/xfKMTNAuBQzAKnZPNc8m6YEL2VC.jpg','2009-02-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Machine',26656,1.4494,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26022,_binary '\0','/zPCWnlk5d0XAwgurFfw4BKdVXeQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12861508',3,5914,'en','Survive the Game','When cop David is injured in a drug bust gone wrong, his partner Cal chases the two criminals who shot him. They all land at a remote farm owned by troubled vet Eric, and as Cal and Eric plot their defense, more of the gang arrives - along with a wounded David. Outnumbered, the three heroes must use stealth, smarts, and good shooting to take down the drug-dealing mob.','/xF1uc2pEf34X2G41wvZaF5H0V7C.jpg','2021-10-08',97,'Released','Your land. Your rules. Your fight.','Survive the Game',787310,3.9609,5.3,'AqmOsnSElnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26023,_binary '\0','/beWFto6m5lDWhJaaLZAin02aDg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286151',6.2,2019,'sv','I taket lyser stjärnorna','Young adolescent girl Jenna\'s mother is dying, while at the same time Jenna is turning from a young girl into a young woman. So it is difficult for her to admit that she is afraid to lose her mother; instead she behaves contrary to how one would expect.','/hmNsXlLDOnxUc2LeykNJX9zzbs7.jpg','2009-01-30',90,'Released',NULL,'I taket lyser stjärnorna',18815,1.5393,5.7,'BvgWL4wUTyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26024,_binary '\0','/ySFjw1cB0PSa1wODU8IBU2SPwpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286154',3.2,1864,'tr','Kadri\'nin Götürdüğü Yere Git','Kadri and Cem are such good friends that they would do anything for each other. Cem has experienced a major disappointment in his love life and is in a state of depression. To help him get back to his old self, Kadir takes Cem to the Dionysos Hotel, the most beautiful hotel in Antalya. However, the hotel has another surprise in store: Cem\'s ex-girlfriend Betül and her new boyfriend Hakan. This situation drags Kadir and Cem into a series of comical events. USTA (International Cinema Television Workshop), of which Cem Özer is a partner, brings together master actors in the same cast for its first comedy film.','/96g0Vb0FE08ufH4wchtrrXwxsxF.jpg','2009-02-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Kadri\'nin Götürdüğü Yere Git',52136,1.0191,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26025,_binary '\0','/8QWtmdx22Ka135ynIz7wR9GTBRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286159',7.2,2257,'fr','1981','Filmmaker Ricardo Trogi recalls the events surrounding his family moving to a new neighborhood when he was 11 years old.','/aMQg4QThJsA7HjwkhNL8LMtRQNN.jpg','2009-09-04',102,'Released',NULL,'1981',30174,1.0182,6.8,'8MdqVhj2Cbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26026,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286163',3.9,3448,'tr','Muro: Nalet Olsun İçimdeki İnsan Sevgisine','Muro spent years in prison for \"organizing crime\". After getting out of prison, Muro and Ceto return to their hometown to start the revolution from the village. Their first plan is get married, build a home, to be a model revolutionary…','/yb8i9Lx95ucog82JS5Nk4RK1Tz0.jpg','2008-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Muro: Nalet Olsun İçimdeki İnsan Sevgisine',52138,1.0101,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26027,_binary '\0','/3KgkGsgokZBPdQvzgAFwS3m4IKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286165',6.8,1305,'tr','Pazar: Bir Ticaret Masalı','A Turkish small time black marketeer wants to enter the cell phone business. To get enough money, he promises the local doctor to get medicine for sick children.','/hNYP7mUnkD8hC1ukbUtz8qbPe6y.jpg','2008-11-27',93,'Released',NULL,'The Market: A Tale of Trade',12420,1.4867,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26028,_binary '\0','/u1TsfBfbgvyu29QbjEpCGttVIo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12861850',6.7,16076,'hi','चंडीगढ़ करे आशिकी','Manu, a bodybuilder from Chandigarh, India, falls in love with Maanvi, a Zumba teacher. All seems well until a revelation causes turmoil in their love story.','/owZYxR8y78tkkEd6mSH2olPsakJ.jpg','2021-12-10',117,'Released','A mind-bending love story','Chandigarh Kare Aashiqui',755836,1.5828,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26029,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12862042',6.4,3269,'hi','जोगीरा सारा रा रा','Jogi the match maker and Dimple who seeks help to him to get rid of her marriage, both face the consequences as it is eventually decided that Jogi will marry her to save face.','/ptyh51YwqaD2R6nUQKxyj57pPBD.jpg','2023-05-26',121,'Released',NULL,'Jogira Sara Ra Ra',801049,1.2914,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26030,_binary '\0','/1xMMkeXynf8w11eXqEC3HCLhzt5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286537',7.8,52976,'en','Food, Inc.','Documentary filmmaker Robert Kenner examines how mammoth corporations have taken over all aspects of the food chain in the United States, from the farms where our food is grown to the chain restaurants and supermarkets where it\'s sold. Narrated by author and activist Eric Schlosser, the film features interviews with average Americans about their dietary habits, commentary from food experts like Michael Pollan and unsettling footage shot inside large-scale animal processing plants.','/zdwN4o7OGAZGJw9T64lRAGTEP8b.jpg','2008-09-07',94,'Released','You\'ll never look at dinner the same way again.','Food, Inc.',18570,2.5773,7.361,'IJDGUxqEdYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26031,_binary '\0','/dafSAhag1mycrenyf3tZ26NmfjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12865416',8.4,2741,'ro','30 de ani și 15 minute','Romania is on the last place in Europe in terms of highway kilometers, but on the first place in the number of deaths in road accidents. Entrepreneur Stefan Mandachi builds 1 meter of highway on his private property.','/t7mVp3gGXH0K7aUx2lCgktMlxfH.jpg','2020-10-02',95,'Released',NULL,'30 Years and 15 Minutes',757018,1.109,8.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26032,_binary '\0','/ukpDMQzoICJfWspDSmJolsyheMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12867504',3,1960,'en','SARS-29','Set in the year 2029 after a decade long pandemic kills over four billion people worldwide, SARS-29 is a fictional documentary that explores how the world has changed through the stories of thirty survivors.','/4SK1egqjgXNJPiUJsDCa0hBi0Nq.jpg','2020-08-21',116,'Released',NULL,'SARS-29',782808,0.9643,3.8,'I0PD91AI4kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26033,_binary '\0','/mWoZxqkT0591uTBFKADgjWkNnZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286765',4.5,1999,'en','Necromentia','A off-world look at the superstitious repercussions of tattooing an Ouija Board on your body. Hagen, who has a dead wife believes that he can revive her from the dead. Travis, a man who lost his brother and wants to join him in the after life. Morbius, a bartender who is betrayed by those he loves comes back from the dead to take revenge.','/4kTEqDXomDKYqNBjcsoQKIElepD.jpg','2009-10-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Necromentia',24505,1.0062,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26034,_binary '\0','/4wHmsElQVJTCFVC7BA1MWFsPcWW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286784',6.7,3082,'nl','Dossier K.','Vincke and Verstuyft are detectives of the Antwerp police department. This time they have to deal with the Albanian mob and some problems in their own police division.','/aYpr0Hxrw3Rn6gAeyqLD3fhJi1p.jpg','2009-12-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Dossier K.',44751,1.3426,6.3,'fHRYENTvUGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26035,_binary '\0','/nph9Wz1nn0mtOlVp1IVQmzjxmmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286809',6.9,2860,'fr','La Journée de la jupe','A teacher, driven to exasperation from insults and insubordination, takes her class hostage.','/inFE2hhwEO1tmFxY7myZ2dl8sxV.jpg','2008-11-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Skirt Day',16277,2.4052,7.046,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26036,_binary '\0','/n39eDdSDiPlgr51qkQByRTX9ZN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1286821',7.6,5848,'en','More than a Game','This documentary follows NBA superstar LeBron James and four of his talented teammates through the trials and tribulations of high school basketball in Ohio and James\' journey to fame.','/sihrAH4uHhpjWwvmGbQVZnUHZaW.jpg','2008-09-06',105,'Released','The incredible true story of LeBron James and the Akron Fab Five','More than a Game',33295,2.3931,7.3,'_MPhFFiu7PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26037,_binary '\0','/th8htaAShAeJcIUtgphoMIdgu8g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12869276',6.7,1805,'pl','Weseלe','The story of a WWII tragedy in a Polish village mixed with the story of a wedding taking place in the same place 80 years later. A bitter look at a xenophobic community that forgets its own history.','/yFE7H7OC995kmYjM62esRrKiG6d.jpg','2021-10-08',134,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding Day',720318,1.6267,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26038,_binary '\0','/fRUL9ksl11qCIC2JsoaPTvXArdT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12870980',3.8,2083,'en','Help','A painful break up prompts Grace to visit her friend Liv who is living in the idyllic English countryside with her boyfriend Edward and his dog Polly. The trio start the weekend in high spirits but it soon turns into chaos, as well-kept secrets are exposed and the friends come to see each other in a whole new light.','/AcvPAoA3ng61bFvbrsuJ8gHMS9q.jpg','2021-03-20',96,'Released','Everyone has a secret.','Help',851438,0.8445,4,'qgSXweKXQLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26039,_binary '\0','/l33t6mBBipYlZCdthRyeAQmhQ46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12873300',6.6,2039,'en','Sight','Ming Wang is an impoverished Chinese prodigy who flees Communist China to become a pioneering eye surgeon in America. When tasked with restoring the sight of an orphan in India, who was blinded by her stepmother, Wang must confront the trauma of living through the violent uprising in his youth, the Cultural Revolution.','/u8LEeWVe0enckZjFOOnSGPQyGCk.jpg','2023-10-05',103,'Released','The present is made possible by the past.','Sight',1057006,3.5645,6.4,'BEhZACXXPP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26040,_binary '\0','/wqlwSAATTZTYA60OSeTKsj4ChZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12873562',5.3,41051,'en','The Invitation','After the death of her mother, Evie is approached by an unknown cousin who invites her to a lavish wedding in the English countryside. Soon, she realizes a gothic conspiracy is afoot and must fight for survival as she uncovers twisted secrets in her family’s history.','/jcTq6gIskCsHlKDvCKKouEfiU66.jpg','2022-08-24',105,'Released','You are cordially invited to a nightmare generations in the making.','The Invitation',8307