:21:07.000000','tt12908110',6,45057,'en','Mr. Harrigan\'s Phone','Craig, a young boy living in a small town befriends an older, reclusive billionaire, Mr. Harrigan. The two form a bond over books and an iPhone, but when the man passes away the boy discovers that not everything dead is gone.','/gPn9e8eP7TeKQU4IeWAMzOajR40.jpg','2022-09-28',105,'Released','Some connections never die.','Mr. Harrigan\'s Phone',723419,6.9247,6.4,'4Un_ker71dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26082,_binary '\0','/1SgD8XMa6dDSBKbPU4TDe2cmfGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12908150',7.3,78697,'en','The Life of Chuck','In this extraordinary story of an ordinary man, Charles \'Chuck\' Krantz experiences the wonder of love, the heartbreak of loss, and the multitudes contained in all of us.','/oumprkO9bThExP8NwxBIBnvBu2v.jpg','2025-06-02',111,'Released','Every life is a universe all its own.','The Life of Chuck',842924,12.5954,7.3,'dOyXdwXt8d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26083,_binary '\0','/rOGPAlScIzuhNV56E8nISm2UlyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12908508',6.8,3623,'ml','ജോൺ ലൂഥർ','Devikulam Police Station SI John Luther is a committed police officer, who even risks his life for policing. During an interrogation, he suffers ruptured eardrums and hearing loss. Will he be able to complete an investigation which he had to leave halfway?','/cJoQGHkdimCfYizm4e4onSAKa4U.jpg','2022-05-27',128,'Released',NULL,'John Luther',865464,1.2477,6.393,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26084,_binary '\0','/jJLyEAkdYLhxX9eV0tjtmn8FMNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291125',6.5,1511,'zh','一頁台北','Kai (Jack Yao), who works at his parent\'s noodle shop by day and spends his nights in a bookstore to learn French, decides to go to Paris after his girlfriend, who recently left for Paris, dumps him by phone. Then the local neighborhood mafia boss offers Kai a free plane ticket to Paris if he takes a mysterious package with him.','/odQHzqbg9ibrSluvYC67IWn5Pgl.jpg','2010-04-02',85,'Released',NULL,'Au Revoir Taipei',41416,1.185,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26085,_binary '\0','/eezsbzYPbYKjjh6E1XHDBNlLynh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291150',5.8,232012,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles','When a kingpin threatens New York City, a group of mutated turtle warriors must emerge from the shadows to protect their home.','/azL2ThbJMIkts3ZMt3j1YgBUeDB.jpg','2014-08-07',101,'Released','Mysterious. Dangerous. Reptilious. You\'ve never seen heroes like this.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles',98566,18.4963,5.93,'dwXFsrp6WBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26086,_binary '\0','/gYR3PkACV8BDCnDQeLK2nkLWzF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291465',7.1,20397,'hi','Raajneeti','It is the story of a fiercely fought election campaign, where money power and corruption are the accepted norms, and where treachery and manipulation are routinely used weapons. As the personal drama of these conflict-ridden characters unfolds against this gritty backdrop, love and friendship become mere baits, and relationships get sacrificed at the altar of political alignments. The darkness that rises from their souls threatens to envelope all that they hold precious. Until eventually, in the crescendo of increasing violence, the line between good and evil blurs, making it impossible to distinguish heroes from villains. Raajneeti is the story of Indian democracy. And its ugly underside. It is about politics. And beyond.','/69jBOHcylcjZ4yH8SeSqguvIXHn.jpg','2010-06-04',167,'Released','Politics ... and Beyond','Raajneeti',37951,1.6423,6.3,'e8pV8VmiHkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26087,_binary '\0','/rD5VHAfOYdcCYCXyyiFIeS8PSHj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291545',4.9,1235,'pl','Kochaj i tańcz','Hania is a young journalist who suddenly discovers that she is more connected with dancing than she could ever imagine ...','/1HoTgtkOLTK3tJ7drtRk5Z2bQZy.jpg','2009-03-06',118,'Released','To find happiness you have to follow your hearth and dance can be the most beautiful way to express love.','Love and Dance',36781,1.0719,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26088,_binary '\0','/fG5U8sQ2GHK4axzuLgH0bq8mddE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291547',5.7,8321,'en','After Porn Ends','Documentary examining what happens to some of the biggest names in the history of the adult entertainment industry after they leave the business and try and live \"normal\" lives.','/aPerSjt4viv7Ik8OEHL83AbrH6R.jpg','2012-05-21',90,'Released','Can they really live a normal life after porn?','After Porn Ends',109520,2.5959,5.6,'NV5lSmDWk24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26089,_binary '\0','/1maTRipBLZT1mJFCwST0e3MJQ0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291549',5.8,2720,'en','Meet Monica Velour','For Tobe, a nerdy, horny, frizzy-haired cineaste who doesn\'t quite fit in with the average contemporary teen, the pinnacle of womanhood is Monica Velour, a soft-core actress who reached the zenith of her career in the 1980s. When Tobe learns that his love idol is headlining hundreds of miles away at the Gentlemen\'s Petting Zoo in Indiana, he drives off with carefree glory, filled with the hope of meeting her.','/wfvv8XuQfdoFp5OxRa6pSoN4Qox.jpg','2010-06-04',98,'Released','Fantasy meets reality','Meet Monica Velour',56928,2.6254,5.8,'yADIyh0VlKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26090,_binary '\0','/tFtqdDndzsQyymIR4fGbC77HVXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291566',6.8,13592,'en','The Vanishing of Sidney Hall','Over the course of 12 years, and three stages of life, Sidney Hall falls in love, writes the book of a generation and then disappears without a trace.','/e8SJJEliAK9g0EG5agPsbxWoWoI.jpg','2018-03-02',120,'Released','It\'s all about beginnings.','The Vanishing of Sidney Hall',353066,4.6079,6.7,'jmSciysEDoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26091,_binary '\0','/mLg1I7Nn47CYOdG1tOXegOhca