026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12915842',6.6,1737,'mr','झोंबिवली','In the suburban neighborhood of Mumbai, a wall separates the haves and the have-nots. Sudhir and Seema, a newly married middle class couple, live a life without hardship while Vishwas, a slum dweller, dreams of dignity for his people. Their lives collide as post nightfall the town fills up with ominous cries and moans that don\'t belong to people - they belong to zombies.','/g6cOvmJvOg5cZr6YgkMTxgw14ve.jpg','2022-01-26',134,'Released',NULL,'Zombivli',814609,1.5845,6.6,'CHJocqYD41g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26096,_binary '\0','/vjdKZJ5F9lZmSRrgXERcnDuCAgx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1291652',6.7,20929,'sv','Snabba cash','When JW becomes a drug runner in order to maintain his double life, his fate becomes tied to two other men: Jorge, a fugitive on the run from both the Serbian mafia and the police, and mafia enforcer Mrado, who is on the hunt for Jorge.','/ezx8LhhpZd6U4sd0lXyCEUhIBUc.jpg','2010-01-15',124,'Released',NULL,'Easy Money',29920,3.8807,6.431,'IVCdV9TqiqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26097,_binary '\0','/gRpnYEI4L4uSXSHrFgf42jDeD89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12917050',5.2,6639,'en','The List','After her fiance sleeps with a celebrity on his free pass list, Abby Meyers, with nothing but five names and a fantasy shared by millions, sets out for Los Angeles to sleep with someone from hers.','/i0MdxxoNAzuANVnZkZcD15W1d5d.jpg','2023-08-12',97,'Released','Don\'t get mad, get laid.','The List',1151344,3.5244,6,'bfNdWg5mpdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26098,_binary '\0','/d7zDEW6AkRCvEOT2Cela4h0F3Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12921446',4.8,51331,'en','The Exorcist: Believer','Since his wife\'s death, Victor has raised his daughter Angela alone. After she and her friend return from a three-day disappearance with missing memories, they begin displaying frightening behavior reminiscent of the MacNeil possession fifty years prior.','/fFXkAlMH2iQrNknv4eq7LGTkcti.jpg','2023-10-04',111,'Released','Body and the blood.','The Exorcist: Believer',807172,9.271,5.811,'hvpEy6nJu7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26099,_binary '\0','/9FFz0ZYuNmBmKQBaZ5ibSqGvnI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12923028',6.3,1381,'es','Live is life: la gran aventura','Summer 1985. As every year, Rodri travels from Catalonia to Galicia and is reunited with his four friends. As real-world problems begin to undermine their friendship, the five of them embark on a nighttime adventure in search of a mythical object.','/8mxHAHepyXaV9rAhYIbimv11Pqy.jpg','2022-06-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Live Is Life',800855,1.8609,6.729,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26100,_binary '\0','/bCakS265nbi6fYB3bwuzVLAsjsv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1292566',6.1,100247,'en','How to Be Single','New York City is full of lonely hearts seeking the right match, and what Alice, Robin, Lucy, Meg, Tom and David all have in common is the need to learn how to be single in a world filled with ever-evolving definitions of love.','/a4Ce3qHqIyHM3QfGsiVTAu3YADJ.jpg','2016-02-08',110,'Released','Welcome to the party.','How to Be Single',259694,15.1866,6.3,'akwGjUeU6YA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26101,_binary '\0','/6mtgRaSZJ8qaI7X8OIBqwZg1c1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1292569',6.3,2909,'en','A Muppets Christmas: Letters to Santa','When Gonzo forgets to mail three letters to Santa, he convinces Kermit and the gang to help him deliver the notes to the North Pole. Along the way, they discover that Christmas is the time to be with those you care about most, as they dash home to make a friends Christmas wish come true.','/zDxpOQi7kkokDLxZkVQhejp2VHu.jpg','2008-12-17',43,'Released',NULL,'A Muppets Christmas: Letters to Santa',27190,3.231,6,'UCsdnewPSZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26102,_binary '\0','/9syZBfM2JW6sV95OittooG2WWoy.jpg','2026-