rate enough to try it. Not counting on the muscular response of Viagra\'s makers, the boys panic and hide the lorry load of Viagra down the town\'s Holy Well.','/5EMPHNVAyP14gkeDZ0gebhrbHvD.jpg','2009-07-01',93,'Released','Time for a stiff drink','Holy Water',38932,1.9101,5.7,'iEL0EThHmFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26106,_binary '\0','/6fBDH7IRAQ95lupqZxjYA3nifiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1292703',7.7,19959,'hi','Oye Lucky! Lucky Oye!','Lovinder Singh, a thief now in custody and facing trial, reflects on his life of crime while the press reflect on how he managed to get away with so much before being arrested.','/rtuw7H9ACOfs9BtRGF9okrr8yJH.jpg','2008-11-28',126,'Released','Kamao Toh Zero! Churao Toh Hero!','Oye Lucky! Lucky Oye!',15975,2.1549,7,'Siq5wdFuOt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26107,_binary '\0','/xyWgUmrQyo29PRVcsmAFIIxAeWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12929738',5.9,4124,'hi','London Confidential','A spy-thriller set amidst a series of brutal killings of Indian agents in London, and how Uma, a RAW officer, must expose a mole within the ranks.','/mtJbSbMUqwIJBJvFBRD7oYRknua.jpg','2020-09-18',78,'Released','The Chinese Conspiracy','London Confidential',734819,1.0806,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26108,_binary '\0','/TB88CYene7rzMs32FzFTLs0eU4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12929990',5.7,7521,'en','Resort to Love','Aspiring pop star Erica ends up as the entertainment at her ex-fiancé’s wedding after reluctantly taking a gig at a luxurious island resort while in the wake of a music career meltdown.','/7w4gX4zRlONqThjhmjdxw93FAXt.jpg','2021-07-29',101,'Released','Paradise is about to get complicated.','Resort to Love',785539,3.9037,7.1,'6fcnG6-L4Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26109,_binary '\0','/kutrMwSVEcGFn5F0fUJYYRPzuxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12930350',5.7,13005,'en','My Spy The Eternal City','JJ, a veteran CIA agent, reunites 