, and a threat of extortion, Li Mi’s dream may be on the cusp of becoming a reality.','/xrue2NK4puLbppDVURmoKu4aPDF.jpg','2008-09-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Equation of Love and Death',75677,1.369,7.212,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26161,_binary '\0','/zBG5Mg29NH9xxpWMMG7BIvKwYhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12996154',2.7,28956,'pl','365 dni: Ten dzień','Laura and Massimo are back and hotter than ever. But the reunited couple\'s new beginning is complicated by Massimo’s family ties and a mysterious man who enters Laura’s life to win her heart and trust, at any cost.','/7qU0SOVcQ8BTJLodcAlulUAG16C.jpg','2022-04-26',110,'Released','Oh Yes.','365 Days: This Day',829557,21.9352,5.9,'pyM3z73oMAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26162,_binary '\0','/sbr49JL9xSkM9u8hKXqDxvh70FY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt12997976',5.9,1704,'en','Dear Christmas','Natalie Morgan is an author and host of a popular podcast, Holiday Love, which shares true stories of holiday romance with its listeners. While to the outside world and her listeners everywhere see Natalie is an expert on romance, she\'s never truly experienced a romance of her own. As Natalie prepares to embark on a promotional tour for her new book, she stops back home to spend Christmas with her family and to celebrate her parent\'s 50th anniversary where she unexpectedly begins to experience her own holiday romance as sparks ignite with local firefighter, Jack.','/5Izo5eJ9aOCd6Ikf0M5sxCzZnNc.jpg','2020-11-27',80,'Released',NULL,'Dear Christmas',744941,2.3962,6.5,'I89wdfitRbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26163,_binary '\0','/7wTtxseIgLc5veHuocCzni4n65s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13000980',5.5,1305,'zh','金刚川','In 1953 the Korean War is entering the final stage. The People\'s Volunteer Army of China has launched its last major battle in Kumsong. In order to arrive on time and deliver enough ammo to the Kumsong front line, the soldiers have to defend themselves against the never ending bombardments of enemy bombers and race against time to repair the last bridge, all while facing supply shortages and with inferior equipment.','/nYP6pF7p71zcNpT5vJcMmOBEW8G.jpg','2020-10-23',122,'Released',NULL,'The Sacrifice',748685,2.2547,5.793,'6To6ZIDV46c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26164,_binary '\0','/e5CdXZDGKdPITqmxMfOX69IpjXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1300155',6.5,1898,'en','Alabama Moon','After the unexpected death of his survivalist father, an eleven year old boy raised in the Alabama wilderness must learn how to make a home in the modern world.','/zTExJLGaHxGnEtbo2n0vCgvxx7k.jpg','2009-10-25',99,'Released','An adventure for the boy in all of us.','Alabama Moon',51249,2.0576,6.603,'FcNp23Uxnos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26165,_binary '\0','/e1t2rwRugZviWTLwmQYZEPxcRQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1300159',4.4,3667,'en','Growth','In 1989, a breakthrough in \"advanced parasitic research\" on Cuttyhunk Island gave scientists a jump in human evolution. Initial tests proved promising, as subjects experienced heightened physical and mental strength and awareness. But - something in the experiment went horribly wrong, and the island mysteriously lost three quarters of its population.','/6iI5OYyjCI6Hmy7Uz1W3t1Uhz78.jpg','2010-01-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Growth',31196,1.6725,5.3,'SvGcGjIc16I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26166,_binary '\0','/pWWxxkMP7DquHtD8c6I0ZTh0XUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13003996',6.1,1318,'it','Mio fratello, mia sorella','When their father\'s will forces them to live together, siblings Nik and Tesla — and Tesla\'s kids — try to overcome their differences to become a family.','/hzeHk2Cmszec4fscgPEGVLVg8O6.jpg','2021-10-08',110,'Released',NULL,'My Brother, My Sister',770742,2.2814,6.4,'lIhlwbDz510','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26167,_binary '\0','/2ErTBuobMI61q7keuv6yhnn3UeN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13004760',4.2,1956,'ml','ഗ്ർർർ..','Heartbroken and intoxicated, Rejimon stumbles into a lion\'s den at the zoo. Haridas, a guard, has to forcefully dive in to rescue him, earning media attention for the blunder.','/f4GpEsQAc9LslfEmBlOwlChxpyx.jpg','2024-06-13',119,'Released','All Rise, The King is Here.','Grrr..',1090566,0.9481,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26168,_binary '\0','/y3K2w4GgJ27oyseSO1OJpKDeYx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13004806',4.9,2714,'ml','A Ranjith Cinema','The movie takes you on a roller coaster ride of events that happen in Ranjith`s life and how it affects the people around him, forcing him to resolve the matter before he looses control.','/zSx7nwhbRfQ68JL982uBICGob6Y.jpg','2023-12-08',147,'Released',NULL,'A Ranjith Cinema',911289,0.7602,5.2,'zDk2zF70lkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26169,_binary '\0','/e7OxR74RDkYM705egExklt8S8pF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1300563',7,4835,'en','The Age of Stupid','Pete Postlethwaite stars as a man living alone in the devastated future world of 2055, looking at old footage from 2008 and asking: why didn’t we stop climate change when we had the chance?','/niaE9vnTER9eyklYiLVWpdrqcsi.jpg','2009-09-21',92,'Released',NULL,'The Age of Stupid',24458,1.977,6.6,'9iFd8DzrR6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26170,_binary '\0','/kP5k4gA6yJiQCeN5FNcGwRtGDuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13007592',6.2,22486,'en','The Noel Diary','Cleaning out his childhood home at Christmas, a novelist meets a woman searching for her birth mother. Will an old diary unlock their pasts — and hearts?','/f6mMqxJfAD2Ao4sto7kOq6a7tWg.jpg','2022-11-24',99,'Released',NULL,'The Noel Diary',736918,4.8372,6.297,'asH6ny4ILzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26171,_binary '\0','/tEtkqU4k7i3axhWRTn48q1pEo5o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1300851',6.2,69193,'en','The Boondock Saints II: All Saints Day','Skillfully framed by an unknown enemy for the murder of a priest, wanted vigilante MacManus brothers Murphy and Connor must come out of hiding on a sheep farm in Ireland to fight for justice in Boston.','/jFHtFInp3tYIBxkwWMfNJf1RBZW.jpg','2009-11-24',118,'Released','The Saints Are Calling','The Boondock Saints II: All Saints Day',22821,6.4568,6,'h93ezXUz_iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26172,_binary '\0','/iVped1djsF0tvGkvnHbzsE3ZPTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1300854',7.1,984095,'en','Iron Man 3','When Tony Stark\'s world is torn apart by a formidable terrorist called the Mandarin, he starts an odyssey of rebuilding and retribution.','/qhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg','2013-04-18',130,'Released','Unleash the power behind the armor.','Iron Man 3',68721,30.2663,6.933,'YLorLVa95Xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26173,_binary '\0','/nzR9JTTgdX3E0hJCmv7crsyPq67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1301178',6.8,1284,'ja','PASSION','A young couple\'s announcement of their engagement to their friends is followed by a series of interactions and conflicts that forces everyone to reflect on their lives.','/em1O57xmPso5qpz8FLe64atAPGq.jpg','2008-11-23',117,'Released',NULL,'Passion',348869,1.7372,6.3,'KvBzIUF_dUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26174,_binary '\0','/2IRvEfq33ytOOpavtnblEQHI9Yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1301264',7.9,2881,'id','Laskar Pelangi','A group of 10 students struggles with poverty and develop hopes for the future in Gantong Village on the farming and tin mining island of Belitung.','/qoiVrVK09K7GQfrTnRUcAclu3L.jpg','2008-09-25',120,'Released','Ten students, two teachers, and a thousand dreams','The Rainbow Troops',22421,1.117,7.6,'8ZYOqARRTng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26175,_binary '\0','/5UYwUFt3PDKib9qmH2XATsKbxzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1301308',6.3,1357,'tr','Mixed Kebab','Ibrahim chooses to fall for young and handsome Kevin over marrying his cute but expensive cousin Elif while kid brother Furkan converts to Islamic fundamentalism.','/yLplc6DBaeE49yAi6iJ7a5iNTAZ.jpg','2012-02-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Mixed Kebab',132561,1.836,5.8,'RWooRL_4mEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26176,_binary '\0','/c61whqxzO2RsZCOsOaf6Ao4eYVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13014746',7,2336,'es','Mantícora','Julián is a successful video-game designer whose life is plagued by a dark secret. But when Diana pops up in his life, the man will feel as though a chance at happiness is within his grasp.','/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg','2022-12-09',116,'Released',NULL,'Manticore',760158,1.7439,6.8,'BXxoQTubLrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26177,_binary '\0','/16376kNV8E6ZUsDlUGdIEEk2Uea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1301698',6.5,4914,'hi','1920','1920, India. After forsaking his family and religion, a husband finds his wife is possessed by a spirit.','/i9rva37n3B27xHmcur8oxW8Ludi.jpg','2008-09-12',138,'Released','A Love Made In Heaven... A Revenge Born In Hell...','1920',19951,1.458,5.627,'5Mgj2nMoKN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26178,_binary '\0','/bexhsojXy8OalK3ITVxAbGQLxe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13017204',6.8,2921,'ja','ザ・ファブル 殺さない殺し屋','Akira is the legendary killer known as the Fable. Following the order of his boss and due to being overworked, he lives peacefully with his partner, Yoko, as ordinary siblings. Akira still works part-time at design company Octopus with CEO Takoda and employee Misaki. CEO Takoda and Misaki are unaware of Akira\'s background as an assassin. Meanwhile, Utsubo is a representative for an NPO. But, Utsubo works with contract killer Suzuki to set people up for extortion purposes. They target someone at design company Octopus.','/1ZgnxaT3BKkKU3RIJnR024ZjP9S.jpg','2021-02-05',132,'Released',NULL,'The Fable: The Killer Who Doesn\'t Kill',734519,2.2903,7,'Y24pIsqROzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26179,_binary '\0','/eNmoAIVeAIlFVR4OqYuSsLiZpW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1301990',5.7,3714,'en','Every Day','Ned is in the throes of a mid-life crisis. His work as a writer on an outrageous, semi-pornographic TV show is less than satisfying. His fifteen year old son has just told him he is gay and his eleven year old is afraid of, well pretty much everything. When his wife, Jeannie, moves her sick and embittered father from Detroit into their home in NY, it puts added stress on an already strained marriage. And when a sexy female co-worker puts the moves on Ned, the temptation sends him spiraling.','/dl7Lq2lbajfl83plwdMfs5Omn3n.jpg','2010-01-14',93,'Released','Not quite the party you signed up for...','Every Day',45077,2.2026,5.1,'b4nbltfmWeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26180,_binary '\0','/1RDto0tLo8Fhq7OcwgDaM7nECb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1302006',7.8,479673,'en','The Irishman','Pennsylvania, 1956. Frank Sheeran, a war veteran of Irish origin who works as a truck driver, accidentally meets mobster Russell Bufalino. Once Frank becomes his trusted man, Bufalino sends him to Chicago with the task of helping Jimmy Hoffa, a powerful union leader related to organized crime, with whom Frank will maintain a close friendship for nearly twenty years.','/mbm8k3GFhXS0ROd9AD1gqYbIFbM.jpg','2019-11-01',209,'Released','His story changed history.','The Irishman',398978,18.1135,7.57,'RS3aHkkfuEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26181,_binary '\0','/iBUIS2duNa9aDfLgRr8thsUPRs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1302011',7.3,363826,'en','Kung Fu Panda 2','Po is finally living the dream as the Dragon Warrior—until a shadow from his past comes roaring back. When the ruthless peacock Lord Shen unleashes a devastating new weapon used to wipe out kung fu masters across the land, Po and the Furious Five race across China to put an end to his plans. But if Po is to have any hope of stopping him, he must first confront the truth of his origins—and find inner peace before his past tears him apart.','/mtqqD00vB4PGRt20gWtGqFhrkd0.jpg','2011-05-25',91,'Released','The future of Kung Fu hangs in balance.','Kung Fu Panda 2',49444,25.269,7.1,'FQ63rqSRrEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26182,_binary '\0','/sXpyWx44iMv1spCd3QfnXKYDd7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13020386',6.1,1660,'en','Four Letters of Love','Nicholas and Isabel were made for each other but how will they ever know it? As ghosts, fate and the sheer power of true love pull them together, so too does life threaten to tear them apart.','/xUOAJF4uankgkcCBtvvQJX1VjuH.jpg','2025-07-18',110,'Released','The greatest miracle is love.','Four Letters of Love',1293244,3.6167,6,'Jg7lWUovA2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26183,_binary '\0','/olt6xjI8QvrTmm1GTH6VtX6ROCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1302067',4.6,24960,'en','Yogi Bear','A documentary filmmaker travels to Jellystone Park to shoot a project and soon crosses paths with Yogi Bear, his sidekick Boo-Boo, and Ranger Smith.','/5u6kGhqKVorNwcvz6zETWUPRmus.jpg','2010-12-17',80,'Released','Life\'s a pic-a-nic.','Yogi Bear',41515,9.425,5.579,'9iyYTz0Bh0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26184,_binary '\0','/v6Zd3eUxAzK4FmDvJNbDk6TuFHN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13022120',5.1,2594,'es','Invitación a un Asesinato','Eccentric millionaire Olivia sends her half sister Agatha, and a group of old acquaintances, a mysterious invitation for a weekend on her yacht, where they will discover the true motive behind this invitation: the celebration of… a murder?','/1IFdWd7ykl0yHqKid9Mm7TTIDSK.jpg','2023-10-06',93,'Released',NULL,'A Deadly Invitation',1179664,2.8511,5.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26185,_binary '\0','/evekFb5xYhSJXoG6AbM3r9SSHg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13022984',7.4,15492,'hi','खुदा हाफिज़ २: अग्निपरीक्षा','Following a traumatic chapter in their lives, Sameer and Nargis try to lead a happy life by adopting Nandini, a friend\'s orphaned niece. But fate soon strikes back hard when Nandini goes missing.','/dWYGHG6yIG8Fh8LwhbGnnaYNYyX.jpg','2022-07-08',146,'Released',NULL,'Khuda Haafiz Chapter 2: Agni Pariksha',965653,1.3947,6.879,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26186,_binary '\0','/bo4evsmoKb16AD1OhHgVOlgJtBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13024674',6.4,99165,'en','Army of Thieves','A mysterious woman recruits bank teller Ludwig Dieter to lead a group of aspiring thieves on a top-secret heist during the early stages of the zombie apocalypse.','/j04Oepj3LGTWSb1ltXm0pcy50Xq.jpg','2021-10-27',128,'Released','While the zombies took over, one team took advantage.','Army of Thieves',796499,8.271,6.796,'Ith2WetKXlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26187,_binary '\0','/mmFnng8ujZEL0e1OUdXqKpxwl89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1302559',6.6,2362,'ar','Le fil','Malik has a lot on his plate when he returns home to Tunisia after living in France. He\'s processing his father\'s death, he can\'t come out to his mother, and his childhood anxieties have resurfaced. But all of Malik\'s problems seem to fade away when he falls for Bilal, the dreamy houseboy at his mother\'s bourgeois estate.','/rp4eB4dLlScp1lRoR3BA2IBmzky.jpg','2009-05-12',93,'Released',NULL,'The String',69746,1.324,6.7,'HY8N9NY-uXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26188,_binary '\0','/eLBK45mIbaT1qn40841MoS0doLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13026738',4.9,2874,'en','Boon','Mercenary Nick Boon is trying to atone for his life as an enforcer for a ruthless syndicate. Running from his past, Boon moves to a remote area in the pacific northwest where he meets a struggling widow and her son. When he finds the pair living in fear of a criminal kingpin, Boon realizes the only way to protect them is to do what he does best: kill.','/5e4JWceLc71uPh47l6VT8NifqlK.jpg','2022-04-01',95,'Released','Vengeance was his past. Justice is his fate.','Boon',944865,3.9696,5.1,'-S5BAq7UDRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26189,_binary '\0','/qpiqVZdWjWEUsm17VLZg18jErNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13028258',7.6,27504,'hi','A Thursday','When a kindergarten teacher takes her 16 students hostage and makes a set of demands, it not only rattles the Mumbai police and the city but also sends shockwaves through the country and its leaders as the motive behind the hostage situation is unearthed.','/xnoyG3rPuKAHeRbNlwuyiC08Sya.jpg','2022-02-17',129,'Released',NULL,'A Thursday',897525,1.5808,6.673,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26190,_binary '\0','/bty8QfyiEc5hCyZbSmfsvc9ITJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13029044',5,23160,'en','Mother/Android','Georgia and her boyfriend Sam go on a treacherous journey to escape their country, which is caught in an unexpected war with artificial intelligence. Days away from the arrival of their first child, the couple must face No Man’s Land—a stronghold of the android uprising—in hopes of reaching safety before giving birth.','/rO3nV9d1wzHEWsC7xgwxotjZQpM.jpg','2021-12-17',111,'Released','We are all programmed to survive.','Mother/Android',739413,4.857,5.8,'JRl214mDZ-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26191,_binary '\0','/75iMCbiw9IQZC3UT2C4eF83QxHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13032716',5.8,2420,'sv','Dancing Queens','The story of Dylan Pettersson, a 23-year-old girl from a small island in the Swedish archipelago with big dancing aspirations.','/xq2pkQZV5Yt1METvy5S0QjmCpsn.jpg','2021-06-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Dancing Queens',761270,1.1683,5.9,'RV_ikl5tEU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26192,_binary '\0','/fDFAg5q9OUmlsHuQapIHo2dRMpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13033424',7.4,1527,'en','Buried: The 1982 Alpine Meadows Avalanche','In 1982, a massive avalanche descended on Alpine Meadows Ski Resort in Lake Tahoe, California, that triggered a desperate five-day search for eight missing people.','/y1QD3mYDwLHquVGmS6yOOG196Yp.jpg','2022-09-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Buried: The 1982 Alpine Meadows Avalanche',911988,0.7962,8,'8z1Mo3Iiq4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26193,_binary '\0','/gTkvNskvhYQckggJ8n1z8GesjJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1303685',7,1608,'fa','به همین سادگی','A mother and wife is on the brink of an attack. Hengameh Tahareh Ghaziani lives with her husband, her son and daughter in a middle class neighborhood, and spends his days taking care of their needs.','/lCigaFIFkKe9SgRVQvUwKlUL9H5.jpg','2008-03-19',97,'Released',NULL,'As Simple as That',186138,0.9614,6.9,'bjcZk08gmi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26194,_binary '\0','/hbUsU7HZyrDPzT8CwjLvQXWYAkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1303828',6.7,38321,'en','Defendor','A crooked cop, a mob boss and the young girl they abuse are the denizens of a city\'s criminal underworld. It\'s a world that ordinary Arthur Poppington doesn\'t understand and doesn\'t belong in, but is committed to fighting when he changes into a vigilante super-hero of his own making, Defendor. With no power other than courage Defendor takes to the streets to protect the city\'s innocents.','/a1ce5xYYkwSCqIHh0nGKnh7Zs7Q.jpg','2009-09-12',101,'Released','An unexpected hero will rise.','Defendor',34769,3.5191,6.415,'pXl64kQAvv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26195,_binary '\0','/hlXqNn2nJiERgX69LAPQVUAkXqE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1303833',5.9,1505,'zh','非常完美','Dumped by her fiance just two months before their wedding, comic strip writer Sophie hatches an elaborate plan to get her Jeff back and punish the movie star, Joanna, who seduced him away. She finds herself a partner, Gordon, an ex-lover of Joanna\'s. The two start on a comic adventure full of laughs and tears, aided by Sophie\'s two best friends, Lucy and Lily. At the eve of her success, Sophie suddenly faced of having to chose between a repentant Jeff and Gordon who has fallen for her.','/3EwvZJpDdRDc5hnhgvVtbbqZ0oh.jpg','2009-08-14',107,'Released','It is madness or it is love?','Sophie\'s Revenge',24986,1.3348,5.6,'Z81K3mRzb9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26196,_binary '\0','/gTydwZInr9ncMVFdYUzTcXtiTiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13039008',3.3,2291,'en','Kill Shot','Posing as hunters, a group of terrorists are in search of $100 million that was stolen and lost in a plane crash en route from Afghanistan.','/5kCEHZnUeAZFJvE3l8K5OYjIwjj.jpg','2023-08-15',93,'Released','When $100 million dollars goes missing, the hunter becomes the hunted.','Kill Shot',1134055,5.4482,8,'KloxZEb6X9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26197,_binary '\0','/uKGvqTeW5dSxHPjyFhChnDJWd2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1303902',4,1751,'en','Someone\'s Knocking at the Door','Returning to the same medical school where they were test subjects years before, two twisted serial killers use brutal sex acts to kill off a group of med students.','/8PEfUf3Bhukxq4nngChhhzGptX2.jpg','2009-08-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Someone\'s Knocking at the Door',74016,1.8276,4.3,'W8Ltdi0Bnu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26198,_binary '\0','/mKV5bggK8jOfAEmxePlmvYbqn16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13040330',6.6,2368,'en','Cross Country Christmas','Former classmates Lina and Max are traveling home for the holidays, until a storm hits and they have to work together to make it home in time, no matter the mode of transportation.','/lF5Bmfx8TZmDnNn8i7pSKA6zlEZ.jpg','2020-12-20',83,'Released',NULL,'Cross Country Christmas',737780,2.0572,6.8,'tOAOd4uxt58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26199,_binary '\0','/qMRJdqHCkBmWsM89BWxge24WvkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13043436',5,1805,'ar','الإنس والنمس','The story follows a poor government employee who lands in a lot of trouble because of his father\'s profession, while he falls for a girl who tries to help him solve his problems.','/jMxavCWPFEGXRoXGFwEuTUfLIsm.jpg','2021-08-04',120,'Released',NULL,'The Humans and the Mongoose',769271,1.0462,4.7,'5gV1b_C3-Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26200,_binary '\0','/ctckqAvz9aTZDtfXLmDUdMflesU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13045890',6.6,15253,'tr','Kağıttan Hayatlar','In the streets of Istanbul, ailing waste warehouse worker Mehmet takes a small boy under his wing and must soon confront his own traumatic childhood.','/cmru6N6Hnw2pJwuo1ctH1CxKqKZ.jpg','2021-03-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Paper Lives',785534,3.1664,8,'lXdSaVK-vzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26201,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13049516',6,2572,'en','Rose Blood','Takes place 13 months after Friday The 13th Part VII. We follow Tina Shepard as she is held and studied at the infamous Camp Crystal Lake Research Facility. Tina realizes that she is not alone. There in fact is another New Blood. Rose.','/61Ztzp65p0BtDpPufjmZle4SsPM.jpg','2021-11-29',92,'Released',NULL,'Rose Blood',1620724,1.9358,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26202,_binary '\0','/AjubB3hV3VroFVuPNFPywft1BP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13049760',5.8,2946,'es','Al morir la matinée','In 1993, spectators at the last screening of a horror film at a downtown cinema fall one by one into the hands of a sadistic and ruthless killer.','/6KCBYIII8SlUcTuvD6JSHwQSfQL.jpg','2020-09-03',88,'Released','No talking. No texting. No breathing.','The Last Matinee',739291,2.0439,6,'fqKYjeiKq7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26203,_binary '\0','/9ItJHmdnqiXrZBPN4KR4j9MYgVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13051364',4.8,1906,'bn','বাজি','Aditya, the son of a terminally ill businessman, discovers that his father has lost all his wealth to a swindler. Seeking revenge for this crime, he travels to London.','/50GMrb9PA0qDYeQ1wRsWcQAp4ra.jpg','2021-10-10',128,'Released',NULL,'Baazi',911960,0.9296,2,'1NCoTAIrsgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26204,_binary '\0','/rjw4AXWCJ3AYmmM2CkNOD6LcGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13051724',6.4,4027,'it','L\'immensità','Clara and Felice struggle to raise their three children in 1970s Rome. The eldest, Andrea, is transgender and yearns for another life where he gets to live as the boy he knows himself to be. Clara instinctively strives to protect her son by escaping into their imaginations to defuse family tensions.','/8zVoxTnEXEbCAv4BCJRvb54sJKl.jpg','2022-09-15',98,'Released',NULL,'L\'immensità',770724,4.3072,6.3,'XFSeAuG2oxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26205,_binary '\0','/d0YSRmp819pMRnKLfGMgAQchpnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13051810',5.2,9152,'no','Vikingulven','After witnessing a grotesque murder at a party in her new town, a teenager starts having strange visions and bizarre desires.','/2sJgljCEHQxuHbCJK6p15zM9vVM.jpg','2022-11-18',97,'Released','All werewolves have a story. This is the Norwegian one.','Viking Wolf',788752,3.9091,5.8,'6sxnOLRGkhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26206,_binary '\0','/cwWPWhdnqOBvGz3zRzD9zbhQQLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13055780',5.9,12527,'en','A California Christmas','With his carefree lifestyle on the line, a wealthy charmer poses as a ranch hand to get a hardworking farmer to sell her family’s land before Christmas.','/caCbdsdGHDJNMjSiA5X4mgIfe61.jpg','2020-12-14',106,'Released',NULL,'A California Christmas',768520,2.1123,6.4,'z9VAeDLNSMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26207,_binary '\0','/qu5NgAV3VWCptStuoXP3ggoP4s1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305583',5.1,7736,'en','Our Family Wedding','The weeks leading up to a young couple\'s wedding is comic and stressful, especially as their respective fathers try to lay to rest their feud.','/zvRn8aM9lmuBbbJVJgxZl41zarB.jpg','2010-03-12',103,'Released','To have and to hold... \'Til dads do us part.','Our Family Wedding',34563,3.1326,5.619,'wKfmsOfYNh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26208,_binary '\0','/sU9wVEAgWPXPULYQMctd0T5MCdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305591',5.4,25671,'en','Mars Needs Moms','When Martians suddenly abduct his mom, mischievous Milo rushes to the rescue and discovers why all moms are so special.','/yZBrpe4bxwDIDKBxPeJYrlyDK5R.jpg','2011-03-09',88,'Released','Mom needs a little space.','Mars Needs Moms',50321,9.711,5.999,'JWYVQzG0rYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26209,_binary '\0','/rodjjIJ8oh9nuBp86PhojcYHTEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13055982',4.8,4204,'en','Savage Salvation','Newly engaged Shelby John and Ruby Red want a fresh start after their struggles with addiction, but when Shelby discovers his beloved Ruby dead on their porch, he embarks on a vengeful killing spree of the dealers who supplied her. Armed with nothing but adrenaline and a nail gun, Shelby begins to unleash chaos on the town’s criminal underbelly, as he hunt’s down crime lord Coyote. Sheriff Church must race against the clock to put an end to Shelby\'s vigilante justice before the entire town descends into a bloodbath.','/fJRt3mmZEvf8gQzoNLzjPtWpc9o.jpg','2022-12-02',101,'Released','Payback is dirty.','Savage Salvation',740952,4.9164,6.133,'SUqQKvTvhdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26210,_binary '\0','/yO2LFaO62SoM1ZuOq26hWLF1TQ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13056008',5.4,25523,'en','No One Gets Out Alive','An immigrant in search of the American dream is forced to take a room in a boarding house and soon finds herself in a nightmare from which she can\'t escape.','/bZUostLcCZYgcuBuAjmuSkBggiQ.jpg','2021-09-29',85,'Released','Don’t try to leave. It’ll only make things worse.','No One Gets Out Alive',740925,5.6481,5.8,'sY2TLiK27g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26211,_binary '\0','/dom8lzl2iU46nDu6s4lBolBNjQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13056052',7.1,21089,'ko','브로커','When a young mother reconsiders abandoning her baby, she discovers a scheme selling foundlings for adoption.','/x86xaUnxU31JYiwlO35corDEV1i.jpg','2022-06-08',129,'Released','Some leave. Some retrieve.','Broker',736732,6.69,7.156,'NoWryyuj4Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26212,_binary '\0','/tq2NLdey0CwfW2tmOjFwIkmBE0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305678',7,1269,'ja','Genius Party Beyond','Five stories, five maestros, five styles and one common denominator: maximum creativity. Studio 4°C, the coolest label on the planet, invites us for the second time to an exclusive reunion of a talents with a group film, full of freedom and ingenuity, that goes from Mahiro Maeda\'s classic anime, to Kazuto Nakazawa\'s intricate urban sketches, Shinya Ohira\'s bedlam of color and Tatsuyuki Tanaka\'s animated cyberpunk. And as if that wasn\'t enough, Koji Morimoto, the studio big boss, is charge of putting the icing on the cake with fantafabulous piece of abstract poetry that would make a VJ die of ecstasy. The party of the year.','/uGZbRSafiU6A2Ek5idLWS7yGR4U.jpg','2008-10-11',81,'Released',NULL,'Genius Party Beyond',77248,2.3529,6.4,'qPYnzVdY2Q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26213,_binary '\0','/mAYZ5psezE9IlIfiPLk5udA4JkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305714',6.5,3992,'en','Make the Yuletide Gay','The holidays get overly festive as Olaf \"Gunn\" Gunnunderson, an out-and-proud gay college student, crawls back into the closet to survive the holidays with his parents. But when his boyfriend, Nathan, shows up at their doorstep unannounced, Gunn must put on a charade to keep the relationship a secret. With pressure mounting from all sides, will Gunn come out before the truth does?','/ziljiSKOvpYxuBbVsf5UDfh3uCk.jpg','2009-11-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Make the Yuletide Gay',26032,2.2534,6.3,'mNGfqy6wrL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26214,_binary '\0','/3fBKPYxzCwN0kv1TiEUFWC0gAje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13057170',6.4,1840,'en','Sweet Autumn','Maggie, a successful entrepreneur, returns home for a will reading and discovers she’s inherited half of her aunt’s famed maple candy business. What she doesn’t understand is why Aunt Dee’s maple supplier, Dex, inherited the other half. Her return also coincides with the town’s Sweet Autumn Fest, and through a series of letters Aunt Dee left, Maggie and Dex search for the reason behind her aunt’s final wishes. As she and Dex grow closer, Maggie must decide if the life she built is the one she wants.','/pNiwExRiyf2Kd6B7ButFiQUQ6p2.jpg','2020-10-17',80,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Autumn',737684,2.1457,7.051,'GY9pHwdwbVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26215,_binary '\0','/lr79OVNnJp1Jwys77zEjnJnQ1pc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13057626',5.9,1680,'ja','神在月のこども','A year after losing her mother, a young girl learns that she must journey across Japan to the annual gathering of gods in the sacred land of Izumo.','/zbajcTeE9NIOS5IzHqGDj0ZmW8b.jpg','2021-10-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Child of Kamiari Month',628964,3.6907,6.5,'ZsTS1tsD2NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26216,_binary '\0','/fvsSPqeVq4yhp7oZTGXA99uDQ1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305797',7.2,34069,'ta','எந்திரன்','Dr. Vaseegaran creates Chitti, a powerful robot in his own image, but it is rejected by the scientific body AIRD due to its lack of human behaviour and emotions. After a lightning strike triggers emotions in Chitti, he begins to develop human-like feelings. However, Chitti falls in love with Dr. Vaseegaran\'s fiancée, Sana, and turns against his creator, leading to dangerous consequences.','/hai6CSCLxULO1RThjDP3lWAqOtQ.jpg','2010-10-01',176,'Released',NULL,'Enthiran',148284,3.1553,6.6,'fYKLIjpfuwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26217,_binary '\0','/vfA9CvDECVYD5RwBDDOeZ6Lt8MP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305803',6.6,1701,'te','కింగ్','After Coimbatore-based Ravichandra Verma passes away, his young son, Raja, assumes the responsibility of running the family business as well as ensuring that his brother, Ajay, gets a good education - much to the chagrin of three of his uncles. Years later, while on a trip to Uttaranchal, despite of warnings from a Pandit, he gets killed by a female assassin, but his family is informed that he is missing. Shortly thereafter, Gyaneshwar Kale and his sister, Sravani/Shivani, will inform the family that Raja is still alive but is handicapped and suffers from memory loss. The family is overjoyed but are not aware that Raja is actually a hoodlum/extortionist known as Bottu Seenu/Raghu Rokda.','/u84c4qumExsXiV1PPS2ljpC6MSB.jpg','2008-12-25',173,'Released','A hoodlum look-alike assumes the identity of a noble man.','King',71918,1.1095,5.36,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26218,_binary '\0','/zaANf06OtqDJr5saqp5ymEkDPsi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305806',8.2,245360,'es','El secreto de sus ojos','Hoping to put to rest years of unease concerning a past case, retired criminal investigator Benjamín begins writing a novel based on the unsolved mystery of a newlywed’s rape and murder. With the help of a former colleague, judge Irene, he attempts to make sense of the past.','/dkeAwfZzwL3WvToydE3CXiY80E0.jpg','2009-08-13',130,'Released','An unsolved crime. A love story. An unwritten ending.','The Secret in Their Eyes',25376,8.2992,7.97,'ZhEuUDO0YUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26219,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305816',6.4,4652,'en','The Hide','On the windswept Suffolk mudflats creaks a bird-hide, inside which hovers Roy Tunt, a prematurely aged, mildly obsessive-compulsive birder. With one more sighting - the elusive sociable plover - he will have \'twitched\' the entire British List. Tunt has his shortwave radio, packed-lunch and a portrait of his ex-wife Sandra for company. Suddenly, in the midst of a conversation with Sandra\'s portrait, the hide door blows open and a bedraggled stranger - unshaven, edgy and bloodied introduces himself as Dave John, a fugitive from the storm. After a tense introduction, the two men discover that they have a good deal in common, sharing sandwiches, tea and personal exchanges which are frank, poignant and often funny. As the two men begin to form a close bond news of a police manhunt sets them both on edge driving their fragile relationship to a tragic conclusion.','/eGqL71P8Rjdh8jv3SppJqi4BFn2.jpg','2008-01-01',82,'Released',NULL,'The Hide',15282,1.9068,6.3,'_SdsXVyDT6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26220,_binary '\0','/gmNX2bJuS7jLocgWPazIqaGMfwE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13058290',7.3,7953,'ko','블랙핑크: 세상을 밝혀라','Record-shattering Korean girl band BLACKPINK tell their story — and detail the hard fought journey of the dreams and trials behind their meteoric rise.','/wwrvjmcgkDyB2RbCbIVLXZf82pl.jpg','2020-10-14',79,'Released','The rise of a global phenomena.','BLACKPINK: Light Up the Sky',740996,2.4619,8.167,'7jx_vdvxWu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26221,_binary '\0','/wVwbyzlURQ4qXXbRxhGpkVh8ChI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305869',5.4,3663,'sv','Sommaren med Göran','The Swedish summer is on and Göran, recently dumped by his girlfriend, is searching for the woman of his dreams. Göran is not altogether in harmony with himself or his work situation and is trying a bit too hard to please everyone around him. Unlike his best friend, he is not prepared to compromise with love and settle for the less-than-perfect girl. In pursuit of love, he sails out to a Midsummer party in the seductive Swedish archipelago.','/3sS7fsaHjCJ6htpnMTn2yvKeZ5g.jpg','2009-07-31',97,'Released',NULL,'A Midsummer of Love',30252,1.2337,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26222,_binary '\0','/86XAOhMI1hq9cNz3ZivGJ9BlJHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1305871',8,3694,'en','Padomju stāsts','“The Soviet Story” is a story of an Allied power, which helped the Nazis to fight Jews and which slaughtered its own people on an industrial scale. Assisted by the West, this power triumphed on May 9th, 1945. Its crimes were made taboo, and the complete story of Europe’s most murderous regime has never been told. Until now...','/r7OyvtTQo710tNLNhX6io5al3ul.jpg','2008-04-09',86,'Released',NULL,'The Soviet Story',31688,2.7009,7.274,'EYuRKy0HKK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26223,_binary '\0','/4qu4kO5HVTKMK2hvmCXeviZ233l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13061914',5.3,14298,'en','Locked Down','During a COVID-19 lockdown, sparring couple Linda and Paxton call a truce to attempt a high-risk jewellery heist at one of the world\'s most exclusive department stores, Harrods.','/svHelD0Hb3TXPAQoPsoBwdDMTvf.jpg','2021-02-25',118,'Released','Some people unravel faster than others','Locked Down',741228,4.5576,5.199,'mepeWor5JPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26224,_binary '\0','/x1USUTrTuWqlSgV7268oYj7pJDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13063384',5,2407,'en','Burial','Set in the last days of World War II, a small band of Russian soldiers led by intelligence officer Brana Vasilyeva, who is tasked with trafficking the remains of Hitler back to Stalin in Russia. En route, the unit is attacked by German ‘Werewolf’ partisans and picked off one-by-one. Brana leads her surviving comrades in a last stand to ensure their ‘cargo’ doesn’t fall into the hands of those who would see it buried in order to hide the truth forever.','/c4D22vnat4DUm9a9TFPZ0abDEsc.jpg','2022-09-02',95,'Released','Some secrets should stay buried.','Burial',715370,1.7828,5.3,'DyEa_zpLNsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26225,_binary '\0','/2hkyfxdJkBRR75msNs6V7Y9hd8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13064272',7,1412,'ja','アイの歌声を聴かせて','Satomi is fine being alone until an AI named Shion joins her class with a song and a promise to make her happy. While Shion’s musical numbers and princess gowns don’t quite pass as human, her antics bring Satomi closer to four other classmates. Together, they make memories worth saving, but even our most precious data can be erased.','/fKUsPOcpFQpdZYsmro4bVAonp93.jpg','2021-10-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Sing a Bit of Harmony',741335,2.5902,7.4,'PbfHnIW391Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26226,_binary '\0','/kXBMT1UpZkb6uktMF6yuLQP4jUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13065386',7.6,3516,'en','Totally Under Control','This documentary puts a spotlight on the White House’s failed response to the global pandemic and how it could have been prevented. Featuring damning testimony from public health officials and hard investigative reporting, director Alex Gibney reveals a system-wide collapse caused by a profound dereliction of presidential leadership.','/rGrJvECwCuzaxZNdDSReQJ74tT7.jpg','2021-05-05',123,'Released','What if the federal government had done its job?','Totally Under Control',741528,1.5751,6.659,'F7ktU4WRfzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26227,_binary '\0','/zrwx2GY2mObQl1PvORZttrefwAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13066182',7.1,16868,'es','El buen patrón','Julio Blanco is the proprietor of Básculas Blanco, a Spanish company producing industrial scales in a provincial Spanish town, which awaits the imminent visit from a committee that will decide if they merit a local Business Excellence award: everything has to be perfect when the time comes. Working against the clock, Blanco pulls out all the stops to address and resolve issues with his employees, crossing every imaginable line in the process.','/x1OgeRKB8AoOYKt3DzxJelLLpLA.jpg','2021-10-15',120,'Released',NULL,'The Good Boss',820722,4.6722,6.9,'JdZf8s0vuT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26228,_binary '\0','/e0lVsZrD6CPX8pt0QIDK7HDoRpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13067004',6.2,4366,'tr','Geçen Yaz','During summer vacation in a beachside town, 16-year-old Deniz seeks the affection of his childhood crush and navigates a love triangle.','/AvWrbe0FxXKjytWaOzMGXaFzoz4.jpg','2021-07-09',101,'Released',NULL,'Last Summer',785537,1.6624,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26229,_binary '\0','/uZDE9VnKFnIPmWriMjnp82bH9S8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13067292',3.5,3233,'en','Rogue Hostage','A former Marine races against time to save a group of hostages -- including his young daughter and a congressman — when armed militants take over his stepfather\'s store.','/zedUsN2fxRYhrp8k4uHVZuoEPaj.jpg','2021-06-11',94,'Released','Free the hostages. Or everyone dies.','Rogue Hostage',825997,3.3696,5.56,'sv-EkV3TuWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26230,_binary '\0','/yq9g4RGM1mEMBoSL5HKVBy9MOPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1306980',7.6,356542,'en','50/50','Inspired by a true story, a comedy centered on a 27-year-old guy who learns of his cancer diagnosis and his subsequent struggle to beat the disease.','/8f9tM9JVB4ETBhxlQcXIjLckArl.jpg','2011-09-30',100,'Released','It takes a pair to beat the odds.','50/50',40807,6.6568,7.202,'3MK0mHbdZd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26231,_binary '\0','/mxdiaM2tsx8M6W3zLgiPwAkhQfq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13069986',4.8,25552,'en','After We Fell','Just as Tessa\'s life begins to become unglued, nothing is what she thought it would be. Not her friends nor her family. The only person that she should be able to rely on is Hardin, who is furious when he discovers the massive secret that she\'s been keeping. Before Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes because of revelations about her family.','/dU4HfnTEJDf9KvxGS9hgO7BVeju.jpg','2021-09-01',99,'Released',NULL,'After We Fell',744275,17.918,6.998,'NYdNN6C9hfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26232,_binary '\0','/rwgmDkIEv8VjAsWx25ottJrFvpO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13070038',4.8,15922,'en','After Ever Happy','As a shocking truth about a couple\'s families emerges, the two lovers discover they are not so different from each other. Tessa is no longer the sweet, simple, good girl she was when she met Hardin — any more than he is the cruel, moody boy she fell so hard for.','/moogpu8rNkEjTgFyLXwhPghft5w.jpg','2022-08-24',95,'Released',NULL,'After Ever Happy',744276,12.3413,6.788,'K7AL2OARpTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26233,_binary '\0','/ltOpDGJQKum8qVSN2y6wfxiq8jS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307057',6,3567,'th','โปรแกรมหน้า วิญญาณอาฆาต','Two projectionists discover a disturbing film featuring the lynching of a woman. Not only are they troubled by the content of the movie, but strange events befall them following the viewing.','/ogavoWVR5ESW5vrHqBIPtsSK5A5.jpg','2008-10-30',83,'Released','When the movie ends. it\'s not really the end.','Coming Soon',16313,2.7978,6.2,'JAR3WAyIJ0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26234,_binary '\0','/7O6yp5DoR6uQlJVqfxkI4Vt8Wan.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13070602',5.6,17369,'en','A Castle for Christmas','To escape a scandal, a bestselling author journeys to Scotland, where she falls in love with a castle -- and faces off with the grumpy duke who owns it.','/xhRbfdGRcEv6RUiAfWnER2pOCcU.jpg','2021-11-26',98,'Released','Come home to where your dreams began.','A Castle for Christmas',758879,3.6993,6,'T_JbFba2i6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26235,_binary '\0','/gUNHPgkXllta2GYifmIucULUKnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307064',6.8,1297,'en','Love Finds A Home','In this sequel, Lillian has been adopted and it\'s several years later. Annie, married and pregnant, visits her fellow doctor friend, Dr. Owen. Dr Owen desperately wants a baby, but seems unable to become pregnant. Lillian finds a love interest, an assistant to her adoptive dad, the latter has become quite overprotective.','/zgFi7OtOeMmvH3stWJSpazJGaSJ.jpg','2009-04-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Finds A Home',25182,2.5938,6.641,'kIlhZFRkl7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26236,_binary '\0','/jj2jdmaK2Xy4PSlu4u3nsCg0v98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307065',5.5,3319,'en','Love at First Hiccup','Victor, a bumbling and gullible high school freshman, has caught a serious case of Anya-itis—an acute, incurable crush on hot senior Anya. Too bad she dates the most popular guy in school and doesn\'t have a clue that Victor exists. After a string of awkward run-ins, his chances of scoring a date with Anya seem to go from hardly any to, well, zero. But his shy and goofy charm—and an elaborate scheme to win the girl of his dreams—just might do the trick.','/mdYxRQKpFQhqFBo3k87vw18m7Ov.jpg','2009-02-02',85,'Released','There is a first time for everything','Love at First Hiccup',42306,2.278,5.3,'kDufcgzt4Q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26237,_binary '\0','/tEJ3nvnp520AvNPbhCegHMo1EfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307068',6.7,123820,'en','Seeking a Friend for the End of the World','As an asteroid nears Earth, a man finds himself alone after his wife leaves in a panic. He decides to take a road trip to reunite with his high school sweetheart. Accompanying him is a neighbor who inadvertently puts a wrench in his plan.','/rBbCwFLyt7Q25yaw2bEOQh7RMG1.jpg','2012-06-22',101,'Released','Nice knowing you.','Seeking a Friend for the End of the World',88005,7.5879,6.569,'EmXWcXKXWBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26238,_binary '\0','/mQWZ1IgBqv3bcQtc6OwlcvtvYmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13073252',7.2,1705,'pt','O Sequestro do Voo 375','Brazil, 1988. An unemployed tractor driver hijacks VASP flight 375 and orders commander Murilo to crash the plane on the Planalto Palace to kill the president - whom he considers guilty for the country\'s devastating economic crisis.','/xhZXZRMXzJlMpMuibmJx4By1iIb.jpg','2023-12-07',107,'Released',NULL,'The Hijacking of Flight 375',1032795,2.0687,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26239,_binary '\0','/1kHz8BDGA9mznEDImGSwk8wOrps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13074150',6.7,2347,'ru','Казнь','When the police finally catch an elusive serial killer, no one can prove his guilt, resulting in the lead detective making it personal.','/3kNxylSXErpu5ovkl7RgYYQ3r2g.jpg','2022-04-21',130,'Released','Be careful who you trust.','The Execution',650030,2.0435,6.2,'LnQmTFURyyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26240,_binary '\0','/qgW1bWixlO0IbhczYUwqsH8Pq28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13074322',4.5,1518,'en','The Gulf of Silence','Since 1945, only a select few in the US government have known the truth about UFOs. In 2020, one of them is finally speaking out. Join Dr. Laura Gale PhD on a guided tour through over half a century of disinformation, counterespionage—and mankind\'s attempts to make first contact.','/t8ovFzAYyX9X4ouzXMTxrVA7Lp3.jpg','2020-12-04',85,'Released',NULL,'The Gulf of Silence',707975,1.0825,6,'St9_435UPqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26241,_binary '\0','/vmDa8HijINCAFYKqsMz0YM3sVyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13075730',4.2,2222,'en','One Way','On the run with a bag full of cash after a robbing his former crime boss—and a potentially fatal wound—Freddy slips onto a bus headed into a rainy night in Georgia. With his life slipping through his fingers, Freddy is left with very few choices to survive.','/uQCxOziq79P3wDsRwQhhkhQyDsJ.jpg','2022-09-02',96,'Released','No wrong turn goes unpunished.','One Way',747803,2.5856,5.7,'ExEl3sjAz8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26242,_binary '\0','/kVKyKQNn0zGv5MswJ8noCrucEtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307858',6.1,2180,'en','All About Evil','A mousy librarian inherits her father\'s beloved but failing old movie house. In order to save the family business, she discovers her inner serial killer — and a legion of rabid gore fans — when she starts turning out a series of grisly shorts. What her fans don\'t realize yet is that the murders in the movies are all too real…','/wagAu4QicH7BqYUg1olO3k0p8O3.jpg','2010-05-01',98,'Released','People are DYING to get into this movie!','All About Evil',70448,2.5994,5.9,'FzKZ-KXLtak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26243,_binary '\0','/bcYq1U5mCMTZqVnHu3Rh2D6NzHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307859',6.2,1952,'nl','All Stars 2: Old Stars','In All Stars 2 Old Stars, the unexpected wedding of one of the boys means they treat themselves to an ‘old-fashioned training camp’ in the form of a long weekend in Barcelona. The match between Barcelona and Real Madrid is meant to be the high point of the trip. But of course not everything goes according to plan for the Swift Boys.','/uw4gKQiU49mkEUPGWqllGASHD2m.jpg','2011-10-10',123,'Released','All Stars 2 Old Stars II','All Stars 2: Old Stars',76784,1.574,6,'d2PinQfGYag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26244,_binary '\0','/nYNnaLrIZIbtiV45Xz8GUAijuWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307861',7.1,2833,'en','American Grindhouse','This documentary explores the hidden history of the American Exploitation Film. The movie digs deep into this often overlooked category of U.S. cinema and unearths the shameless and occasionally shocking origins of this popular entertainment.','/1vysYoEj5XFrfcSBrJyWQ4YeHks.jpg','2011-02-04',82,'Released','Giving ‘Em What They Want Since the Dawn of Motion Pictures.','American Grindhouse',70862,1.8705,6.7,'AndtsMdk2fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26245,_binary '\0','/cTEin0cexPJVpuCpybdbZYrYnD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307873',5.4,7668,'en','The Big Bang','A private detective is hired to find a missing stripper but the job turns complicated when everyone he questions ends up dead. From the mean streets of Los Angeles to the desolate desert of New Mexico, Cruz must contend with a brutal Russian Boxer, three brash LAPD detectives, an aged billionaire looking for the Big Bang, and the billionaire\'s stunningly gorgeous wife. The solution to the mystery will cost ten lives, net $30 million and just might explain - well - everything.','/hDBDk1wWOQ7PYSaGKbv8dEsFVYB.jpg','2011-02-03',101,'Released','The search for the ultimate missing person ends... at the beginning of time.','The Big Bang',54271,3.7264,5.354,'HwntbsRIYNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26246,_binary '\0','/dlYnr4ZXZ8Dgj2mKqwzRbrAoulc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13079150',6.1,9255,'fr','Pourris gâtés','The billionaire is tired of the whims of his own children and decides to teach them a lesson. He announces to them that he has become bankrupt. Now spoiled teenagers will have to do what they have never done: go to work, learn to love and value life.','/nW5LHayHlbavYD6XRM9SjKi55uu.jpg','2021-09-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Spoiled Brats',671043,3.5482,6,'Pi9fYbM8A0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26247,_binary '\0','/nQmIxKN6OoCqRMPXrqoiKvd8GfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307926',3.7,1270,'en','Go for It!','A Mexican-American teen in Chicago struggles with her family\'s expectations for her, and her desire to become a dancer.','/otMNSW5NH26XGVR7Y4Ok6YlsReR.jpg','2011-05-13',105,'Released',NULL,'Go for It!',61038,1.5546,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26248,_binary '\0','/w8pFYGWD3zhdfPZgbIOJDGrg31o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307963',7.4,1768,'en','Let\'s Make Money','Let’s Make Money is an Austrian documentary by Erwin Wagenhofer released in the year 2008. It is about aspects of the development of the world wide financial system.','/9UdFLgX4Mqx8NJtvjdUkOF5cuDe.jpg','2008-10-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Make Money',23368,1.1279,7.4,'Iuokg7TFgeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26249,_binary '\0','/pZWdW44OtyGD1r8gO3m6g7AsO7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1307989',2.6,1928,'en','Never Surrender','From the cage to the big screen, the world\'s greatest Mixed Martial Arts Champions come together for the first time in a major motion picture. When an MMA world champion is lured into the illegal world of underground cage fighting by an elusive promoter, he quickly realizes that the only way out is to kill or to be killed.','/3EMaDo7LSbn4kle5hFw4DRIFAK6.jpg','2009-04-28',87,'Released','One arena. No rules. All pain.','Never Surrender',20184,1.712,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26250,_binary '\0','/73DFJgv8bQd7KZYgNQNeikwnXMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308015',7.1,1652,'ta','சரோஜா','Jaga, Ganesh, Ajay and Vishwas are motoring to a cricket game. An accident leads them to divert on a side road, where they encounter a criminal gang that has kidnapped a young girl and shot a policeman - in front of them....','/A0337hxuF2MzwREwgBi6AFysERA.jpg','2008-09-05',190,'Released','An Ordinary Day Four Ordinary Men One Extra Ordinary Situation','Saroja',54389,1.288,6.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26251,_binary '\0','/rBhSUf8CHwZ442maEvF0tF4CoMd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308138',6.6,7230,'zh','花木兰','When barbarian hordes threaten her homeland, the brave and cunning Mulan disguises herself as a male soldier to swell the ranks in her aging father\'s stead. The warrior\'s remarkable courage drives her through powerful battle scenes and brutal wartime strategy. Mulan loses dear friends to the enemy\'s blade as she rises to become one of her country\'s most valuable leaders — but can she win the war before her secret is exposed?','/cnaoBXyHN1RCXbQ2TVA7U1dt2TG.jpg','2009-11-26',115,'Released','Warrior. Princess. Legend.','Mulan: Rise of a Warrior',32909,3.163,7.485,'M4OSxjVARC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26252,_binary '\0','/xNkHcO9OamYRhb9znPudtkFjePb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13086130',7.5,3457,'ko','소울메이트','When Mi-so and Ha-eun first meet in childhood, their lives become instantly intertwined, forming a bond surrounded by happiness and naivety. But as adulthood arrives, alone and together, they are forced to deal with sadness, anger, grief, growth, and most of all, love.','/iL0jvWpSVW1uFn9aAoUh3UwzdYA.jpg','2023-03-15',124,'Released','You were always beside me.','Soulmate',617882,3.4126,7.981,'39lFxCkXDYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26253,_binary '\0','/57Nn5HRpMiDY2ODKSI4VAOiuyJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13086266',6.6,9513,'ko','콘크리트 유토피아','The world has been reduced to rubble by a massive earthquake. While no one knows for sure how far the ruins stretch, or what the cause of the earthquake may be, in the heart of Seoul there is only one apartment building left standing. It is called Hwang Gung Apartments. As time passes, outsiders start coming in to Hwang Gung Apartments trying to escape the extreme cold. Before long, the apartment residents are unable to cope with the increasing numbers. Feeling a threat to their very survival, the residents enact a special measure.','/bHH5jiumG6QXpvKfUEN2QsaBVV.jpg','2023-08-09',130,'Released','We believe we are chosen.','Concrete Utopia',729854,5.4861,6.9,'nF58qINmxiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26254,_binary '\0','/nMEGEPQIyS30KIJpZETGpluFquJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308728',5.5,32473,'en','The Happytime Murders','In a world where humans coexist with puppets—who are seen as lesser citizens—cast members of a beloved 1990s children\'s television series begin getting murdered one by one. Puppet Phil Philips, an ex-LAPD detective-turned-private eye, takes on the case at the request of his old boss in order to assist his former partner, Detective Connie Edwards.','/rWxkur51srfVnMn2QOFjE7mbq6h.jpg','2018-08-22',91,'Released','No sesame. All street.','The Happytime Murders',412988,6.1985,5.826,'-eks8LG72uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26255,_binary '\0','/bXO410CYaMaoIGecgS7bcAlr5T9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308729',5.7,54670,'en','Bullet to the Head','After watching their respective partners die, a cop and a hitman form an alliance in order to bring down their common enemy.','/arJfxShfuZPhqfBZZU6DkPZfnjn.jpg','2012-11-14',92,'Released','Revenge Never Gets Old.','Bullet to the Head',70074,8.6143,5.6,'maXSTzmY86g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26256,_binary '\0','/gxwxIZpiCfTCkWkqM7EPx3ljpfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308736',6.5,1768,'fr','Le Missionnaire','Following his release from a seven-year stretch in prison, Mario Diccara discovers that his affairs with the underworld aren\'t completely settled. His brother Patrick, a priest, suggests that he stays with elderly Father Etienne in a small village in Ardeche until the conflict blows over. But their plan takes an unexpected turn when Father Etienne dies.','/eGZyAHnGgGTUfABgAd0ZQYH1TKD.jpg','2009-04-29',91,'Released',NULL,'Hallelujah!',17417,1.353,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26257,_binary '\0','/65Ro0B7P1Ge6RXkbNhP300nTLWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1308748',3,1532,'en','Bunnyman','Bunnyman is the story of a group of friends on their way back from a spontaneous weekend trip to Las Vegas, and while driving through the remote regions of southern California they suddenly find themselves in a sickening game of cat and mouse with a five ton dumptruck and, when looking for help, stumble upon a nightmarish family who takes pleasure in dismembering and eating as many of the kids as possible.','/qiRhMkZggipHrEU4xLpg6r5uOV5.jpg','2011-06-20',90,'Released','Pretty girls die young','Bunnyman',71326,1.4441,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26258,_binary '\0','/5AlTT97P209obOB9zRoyYDrzLkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13087796',7.1,15657,'de','Ich bin dein Mensch','Alma is a scientist coerced into participating in an extraordinary study in order to obtain research funds for her work. For three weeks, she has to live with a humanoid robot tailored to her character and needs, whose artificial intelligence is designed to be the perfect life partner for her. Enter Tom, a machine in human form in a class of its own, created solely to make her happy.','/v13p6KlgD7Y1Tas6X8GLJzv5zRe.jpg','2021-07-01',108,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Your Man',795813,4.4829,6.7,'ARxpqS9DQyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26259,_binary '\0','/jO2okhXvVhu9VUVOT6sZrImVHv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13087958',6.8,1913,'ta','புத்தம் புதுக் காலை','Putham Pudhu Kaalai brings together 5 of the most celebrated directors in Tamil cinema - Sudha Kongara, Gautham Menon, Suhasini Mani Ratman, Rajiv Menon, and Karthik Subbaraj to create Amazon Prime Video\'s first Indian anthology film.','/xNKFqFMos6VDvsJCzURAyalnmvD.jpg','2020-10-16',129,'Released',NULL,'Putham Pudhu Kaalai',749032,1.4969,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26260,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1309000',1.3,10117,'hu','Álom.net','Regina, the once popular girl has to make new friends at her new, conservative school. Problems arrive when she becomes enemies with Lívia, the school\'s queen bee, and falls in love with Márk, a musician. If these wouldn\'t be enough, she decides to organize a cheerleader team.','/zp9jVNAgidshnvv7Zco2BEyW19R.jpg','2009-04-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Dream.net',60242,1.5048,1.9,'SQg2xHp0uuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26261,_binary '\0','/9lRz2tlBicwe9PU0kr1FMy1GSau.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1309178',6.7,4285,'tr','Bizim Büyük Çaresizliğimiz','The peaceful cohabitation of two 30-something bachelors is disrupted when they both fall in love with the charming young woman who moves in with them.','/liDt6NQPKgYNvJnDAiwIFY0KrAR.jpg','2011-04-15',102,'Released',NULL,'Our Grand Despair',69352,1.1658,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26262,_binary '\0','/qneJNYO4nli9Y2U8KTfHjkvqI1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13093506',7.3,1443,'en','Bruce Springsteen\'s Letter to You','A tribute to The E Street Band, rock \'n\' roll, and the way music has shaped Bruce Springsteen\'s life, this documentary captures Bruce reflecting on love and loss while recording with his full band for the first time since Born in the U.S.A.','/eSvs9mobDPPVT3gCHc3KakCzNB0.jpg','2020-10-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Bruce Springsteen\'s Letter to You',750160,3.0952,6.9,'LuVRWA7r_dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26263,_binary '\0','/zLNb7g7uNOjxhITXkvxwiWb4o7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1309379',5.3,1331,'en','Sam','The journey of young, handsome New York City playboy Sam Wellman - man’s man and professional woman hater – and his relationship with Doc, his best (and only!) friend. One strange, drunken night Sam stumbles into an Old Curiosity Shop, where the elderly proprietor offers him tea along with sage advice on treasuring “the female of the species”. Sam awakens the next morning to find himself transformed into a woman.','/yhi43UFo5DjksahZ8N5TUYDavPj.jpg','2015-04-21',100,'Released','How do you get even with a womanizer? Make him a woman!','Sam',414977,2.6216,5.3,'n1GJsjENg9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26264,_binary '\0','/7QteV3RzbeieiGYQzalHFhrypVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1309409',6.7,2471,'el','Αυστηρώς Κατάλληλο','Two young Greek filmmakers in need of funding for their film titled \"The End of Passion\" end up seeking the financial aid of an almost forgotten old-time porn-king producer. He agrees to help them while concealing his own secret plan.','/4QRjeYAwge7apWocbxsJYjfkVE3.jpg','2008-10-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Strictly Non-Graphic',47110,1.6575,5.1,'cwQp3PpXmvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26265,_binary '\0','/jrqmkM0e0F0rRFAw0F0TNEfeyKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1309449',6.4,2347,'ja','カイジ 人生逆転ゲーム','Kaiji Ito moves to Japan after graduating from high school. Unable to find a job and frustrated with society at large, Kaiji spends his days gambling, vandalizing cars, and drinking booze. Two years later and his life is no better. A debt collector named Endo arrives to collect money owed. The debt collector offers two choices to Kaiji: spend 10 years paying off his loan or board a gambling boat for one night to repay his debt & possibly make a boat load of money. Could the debt collector Endo actually be setting up Kaiji? One way or another, for Kaiji it\'s going to be the night of his life.','/8C7ga0p7Ae2l38TsP82OpWgAMno.jpg','2009-10-10',130,'Released',NULL,'Kaiji: The Ultimate Gambler',37961,2.7993,6.759,'ZAnoykUQ01c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26266,_binary '\0','/67QL7qecW7uapA5VWyfje0Ji4xj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13095604',7.4,5155,'en','The Phenomenon','This documentary examines unidentified aerial phenomenon. With testimony from high-ranking government officials and NASA Astronauts, Senator Harry Reid says it \"makes the incredible credible.\"','/v2WWRtyYKrmLjtXhm53GMsGQQ2T.jpg','2020-10-06',100,'Released','Makes the incredible, credible.','The Phenomenon',745272,1.6155,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26267,_binary '\0','/t75eqfUkTRdCXgjfFVXeFM2WUSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13097336',5.7,15122,'en','The Lady of Heaven','Two stories separated by 1400 years. After losing his mother in the midst of a war-torn country, an Iraqi child learns the importance and power of patience by discovering the historical story of Lady Fatima and her suffering.','/j7pZEzOKDGalpH5fTWZnVO9yKLV.jpg','2021-12-10',141,'Released','The untold story.','The Lady of Heaven',748618,2.3567,6.3,'1MaDAW0jRYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26268,_binary '\0','/nV0LSOcrdjPtTc4NmR1x33Wc64U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13097434',8.1,8261,'te','కలర్ ఫోటో','Jayakrishna is a dark-skinned guy who falls head over heels on Deepu but keeps his feelings to himself. As time passes by, a gang in his college beats him up and this issue brings Deepu closer to him. Slowly the friendship turns into love and this does not go well with Deepu’s brother Rama Raju. The rest of the story is as to how the couple reunites after facing several problems.','/c6P4zWRUbyoknRSBr1LUR3rzJX9.jpg','2020-10-23',141,'Released',NULL,'Colour Photo',690565,1.5554,7.481,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26269,_binary '\0','/snWw3PIFQsmjQuCuVRjyGr1TWWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13097858',5.9,1484,'en','Christmas She Wrote','When Kayleigh, a romance writer, has her column cancelled right before Christmas, she heads home to reconnect with her family. Kayleigh gets an unexpected visit from the man who cancelled her column who fights not only to bring her back to the publisher but also for her heart.','/gxzNvCMMXCyb9u6eQZ9l8sUodjU.jpg','2020-12-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas She Wrote',746048,2.8055,6.1,'f2QRLyZT1s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26270,_binary '\0','/7kgDHoXEk0EySTczcmaYpPDBFQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13097932',7.5,41511,'en','One Life','British stockbroker Nicholas Winton visits Czechoslovakia in the 1930s and forms plans to assist in the rescue of Jewish children before the onset of World War II, in an operation that came to be known as the Kindertransport.','/yvnIWt2j8VnDgwKJE2VMiFMa2Qo.jpg','2023-12-21',109,'Released','Save one life, save the world.','One Life',760774,8.8706,7.776,'6ethollg-PI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26271,_binary '\0','/hr3yzjzfsiNxWqlDgRTSHgYB7fz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13098590',5.1,2681,'en','Fear Below','A rag-tag team of divers attempting to salvage a sunken car from a river are thwarted by a highly aggressive bull shark.','/f90xO280gGQArVP2GU4IshAClt.jpg','2025-05-02',85,'Released','You won\'t see it coming','Fear Below',1232933,4.1405,6.1,'-OnUk2ITg_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26272,_binary '\0','/fHWJrJxwK83RKIkz5GxQQRXaXCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13101714',5.4,1718,'en','All Eyes','A disgraced podcast host interviews an eccentric farmer who claims to have a monster living in the woods near his house.','/mKnD8g1id6Z7EDshDEgfK9BoCbL.jpg','2022-09-02',87,'Released',NULL,'All Eyes',974926,0.9583,5.7,'XgbNHszgm50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26273,_binary '\0','/5vADpL5lN9eVwHTC1J61RvFSsIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13102440',7.6,1937,'te','ప్లే బ్యాక్','Karthik is an investigative crime reporter from 2019, while Sujatha is from 1993 . An accidental cross time phone talk connects them. When Karthik knows about her difficulties, he tries to change her future by changing the incidents from her past.','/x0bUMvmCg8OuGdylKXWFwoNpfM1.jpg','2021-03-05',121,'Released',NULL,'Play Back',803309,0.9752,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26274,_binary '\0','/3FHaE8ngmEJVsd0jWiT8P0LrEhR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13103212',5.8,4273,'ml','ഇരുൾ','A dark rainy night, an empty house, a stranded couple and an unknown man. A sleek game of the cat and the mouse starts playing on, as the three of them find a dead body in the basement.','/cePtRJSY9UCOrgBI2K6SeThOxz5.jpg','2021-04-02',91,'Released',NULL,'Irul',807158,1.4235,5.657,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26275,_binary '\0','/h3RUnNeAsH0gYlEDhH5bVvwoJNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13103340',4.6,8283,'en','Father Christmas Is Back','Four sisters – Caroline, Joanna, Paulina, and Vicky – reunite for the Christmas Holiday in a Yorkshire mansion. However, their estranged father, James, joins in for the first time since he left the family behind decades prior. The group attempts to get through the holiday despite comedic misunderstandings, while also uncovering the long-buried secret that tore their family apart, so many years ago.','/mI6mFCO3lrJ4ovzwfmoLs58uhlK.jpg','2021-11-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Father Christmas Is Back',762469,3.1581,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26276,_binary '\0','/jDkmlTz9xBmhsIIyORb68VqRlL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13103732',5.3,9045,'en','The Offering','In the wake of a young Jewish girl’s disappearance, the son of a Hasidic funeral director returns home with his pregnant wife in hopes of reconciling with his father. Little do they know that directly beneath them in the family morgue, an ancient evil with sinister plans for the unborn child lurks inside a mysterious corpse.','/tbaTFgGIaTL1Uhd0SMob6Dhi5cK.jpg','2022-09-23',93,'Released','No soul is safe.','The Offering',955991,5.2744,5.95,'oMc-iybcRdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26277,_binary '\0','/h4O5b44rCwSQpdEazekNKkdrPTZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13105824',7.1,2102,'zh','消失的情人節','Xiao Chi, a driven girl who\'s been looking for love, gets asked out by a hot guy on the eve of Valentine\'s Day. As she anticipates her first date, she wakes up the next morning and finds that the Valentine\'s Day has mysteriously passed.','/5BLrHWfQ3Tz39GpyBRL2qM53dEl.jpg','2020-09-18',119,'Released',NULL,'My Missing Valentine',733573,1.3509,6.9,'-5K62YeU6ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26278,_binary '\0','/4C57cSkO7ty3lKXdBG43xGVFKYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13109730',6.9,2199,'en','Good Morning Christmas!','Two competing TV hosts are sent to a festive small town over Christmas. While pretending to get along for the sake of appearances, they discover that there’s more to each other than they thought.','/bbdAuRd893TvCiX4PGOLJLNMuhn.jpg','2020-11-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Good Morning Christmas!',746043,1.9843,6.3,'QEMsIyWechQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26279,_binary '\0','/zbhs099mZdsQheqnpgSpANfFDFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13109862',6.4,1600,'en','Matt and Mara','Mara is a young creative writing professor struggling with problems in her marriage to an experimental musician. One day, she runs into Matt, a charismatic, free-spirited author from her past, when he wanders onto her university campus. Bonded by their shared interests, the two gradually become closer. When Mara’s husband unexpectedly cancels plans to drive her to an out-of-town conference, Matt accompanies Mara on the trip instead. Along the way, the tension surrounding their undefined relationship slowly grows.','/qeyNyRSCwgXgRAg9cwoYr4qN1EY.jpg','2024-09-13',80,'Released',NULL,'Matt and Mara',887180,1.9343,6.4,'60woZc0tDkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26280,_binary '\0','/miWYR5GcGlJ2E4tYO4Um9NT2tcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13109952',6.9,32170,'no','I onde dager','A dysfunctional couple head to a remote lakeside cabin under the guise of reconnecting, but each has secret designs to kill the other. Before they can carry out their respective plans, unexpected visitors arrive and the couple is faced with a greater danger than anything they could have plotted.','/ebG8W3shUDBqhOz3VmB4m02HkFf.jpg','2021-07-30',113,'Released',NULL,'The Trip',760747,3.6828,6.7,'LC5MwTuEeeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26281,_binary '\0','/1vPZKYagNQEFP2lk0dDkjHmvLfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13110420',6.6,1631,'en','Chasing Waterfalls','Photographer Amy travels to a remote lodge to find mythical waterfalls and falls for handsome guide, Mark. They adventure to find the mystic waterfall and discover their true feelings.','/eJxHoF3xqXIqamM0j9WlKxGKZ6a.jpg','2021-03-20',84,'Released',NULL,'Chasing Waterfalls',793430,1.7591,7.2,'T12wgfk747Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26282,_binary '\0','/dOXYCfbKfHKRaQ3XU72vibXw3Ai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1311060',5.7,14292,'en','A.C.O.D.','A grown man is still caught in the crossfire of his parents\' 15 year divorce. He discovers he was unknowingly part of a study on divorced children and is enlisted in a follow-up years later, which wreaks new havoc on his family.','/iU5DZVXV8br0dnYl0ngu1Ih5WaS.jpg','2013-10-03',88,'Released','He\'s About To Ruin A Perfectly Good Divorce','A.C.O.D.',115283,4.1963,5.5,'SgG8lDHsqU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.00