',7.2,63887,'en','Animal Kingdom','Joshua “J” is taken in by his extended family after his mother dies of an overdose. The clan, ruled by J’s scheming grandmother, is heavily involved in criminal activities, and J is soon indoctrinated into their way of life. But J is given a chance to take another path when a cop seeks to help him.','/zhj8YPQKuRev5N3KoHacsPnF4mB.jpg','2010-06-03',113,'Released','A crime story','Animal Kingdom',44629,3.8492,6.791,'YNszOl14AWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26308,_binary '\0','/7XSw1gDV7uJvexJfoKGUIWadVRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13130948',4.4,32281,'hi','शहज़ादा','After realizing he was switched at birth by a conniving father, a rakish Bantu\'s life is upended when he becomes the heir to a billionaire.','/zyAHBSGEhiQMtE822NFkNKapMYi.jpg','2023-02-16',142,'Released',NULL,'Shehzada',884434,3.2163,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26309,_binary '\0','/pWXaHX2CdAebf2f4JyVewnIzl7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1313104',8.4,52863,'en','The Cove','The Cove tells the amazing true story of how an elite team of individuals, films makers and free divers embarked on a covert mission to penetrate the hidden cove in Japan, shining light on a dark and deadly secret. The shocking discoveries were only the tip of the iceberg.','/miodcVtQv2YxpKjjHJWcV0EDfSP.jpg','2009-07-31',92,'Released','Shallow Water. Deep Secret.','The Cove',23128,3.781,8,'FBWd-1vUNHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26310,_binary '\0','/u8bLVtr2yBFYK5lyFrQpdv57y7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1313113',5.8,7000,'en','The Firm','Set in the 1980s, Dom is a teenager who finds himself drawn into the charismatic world of football \'casuals,influenced by the firm\'s top boy, Bex. Accepted by the gang for his fast mouth and sense of humor, Dom soon becomes one the boys. But as Bex and his gang clash with rival firms across the country and the violence spirals out of control, Dom realizes he wants out - until he learns it\'s not that easy to simply walk away.','/1fuJJrud26pZ5zoNvkTbV4DOgpQ.jpg','2009-09-18',90,'Released',NULL,'The Firm',31218,2.452,5.7,'SW_3vg4vdr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26311,_binary '\0','/zXR8VkWcMerjcX1ft9d7oPNXliG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13131186',6.1,5379,'ta','எனிமி','Two childhood friends end up on opposite extremes of morality, and face each other in a good vs evil war.','/38CrzUHlPk7QHsBcZigi5MiQLoD.jpg','2021-11-04',159,'Released',NULL,'Enemy',798803,1.4457,5.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26312,_binary '\0','/9XSux1N1t5jqIR96U4EZlo7QZZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13131232',6.9,45737,'hi','मिशन मजनू','Set in the 1970s, an undercover Indian spy takes on a deadly mission to expose a covert nuclear weapons program in the heart of Pakistan.','/jHQitiHK4M561W1O7WwfJ0dJ8S1.jpg','2023-01-20',129,'Released',NULL,'Mission Majnu',778946,2.3384,6.858,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26313,_binary '\0','/iOWXSdxNDCCTrJh2Pyst3SgRsfG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13131350',7.1,27646,'hi','विक्रम वेधा','Vikram, an honest officer with the Lucknow police, is on a mission to find and eliminate gangster Vedha. However, when Vedha surrenders himself to the police and starts narrating stories to Vikram, it blurs the lines between good and evil. Vedha questions Vikram\'s righteousness while the latter believes he is fair and just. But is he?','/8L4vvIQvO8viLw8wyi2slQmU2sW.jpg','2022-09-29',160,'Released','Between Good & Evil, what you choose, defines you.','Vikram Vedha',851783,1.6716,6.745,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26314,_binary '\0','/6v1UV0FRWAkcqQc8w4hcfO5gVl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1313139',5.8,14339,'en','The Oranges','A man\'s affair with his friend\'s much-younger daughter throws two neighboring families into turmoil.','/3HDjhip7qzvEAb5A0AiJfcUBo22.jpg','2011-09-09',90,'Released','It\'s about to get juicy.','The Oranges',89008,4.1306,5.517,'Rk83dEZi29E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26315,_binary '\0','/aIZDssvWpzniJNSWOZfgkikM7Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13131610',3.3,2424,'te','భోళా శంకర్','A reformed gangster now taxi driver unwittingly draws the vengeance of a crime syndicate after aiding the police in busting a smuggling operation. Fueled by a burning desire for justice and to protect his adopted sister, he embarks on a relentless quest to hunt down the mobsters responsible.','/hgip2gbwu19ITJw1KvzLjKHIInt.jpg','2023-08-10',158,'Released',NULL,'Bhola Shankar',864221,1.6045,3.143,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26316,_binary '\0','/km0LBezbgNFYwHKm2k4yK5t7aQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13131636',5.6,4834,'hi','वेल्ले','Rishi is a writer/director who is narrating a script close to his heart to Rohini - possibly the lead protagonist of his film. As he begins his narration, we step into the world of Rahul, Riya, Rambo and Raju - four friends living their best days amusing people with childish shenanigans in school. These four \"Vellas\" are complete and content with each other\'s company and couldn\'t care less about the world around them until life hits them in the face. An enthralling script narration on one end, and four immature kids trying to correct a plan gone wrong on the other - Velle is about laughter, friendships, frenzy and the unpredictability of life.','/6V1WeFwf6h5KAhQKOP9tXngFgZ1.jpg','2021-12-10',125,'Released',NULL,'Velle',899439,0.8749,6.6,'6P67jUS62Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26317,_binary '\0','/exWgY1vaHMgtqkbab7RbwIzWfGW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1313230',5.9,1902,'fa','به نام پدر','This is about a father and his daughter who has been injured from the mines from Iran-Iraq war.','/2kLrXQAgtKsyORYiwlbK9wOFfqQ.jpg','2006-07-08',96,'Released',NULL,'In the Name of the Father',472078,0.7981,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26318,_binary '\0','/72j560vGCSJchF7rsZJoJJAqjgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1313244',4,2014,'en','Hypothermia','Two families\' idyllic ice-fishing vacation turns deadly when they awaken a creature beneath the frozen lake, forcing them to rely on each other if they want to make it safely back to land.','/91MuHkAOHLZfz9X5GJr2n3D9k82.jpg','2012-10-02',73,'Released','Fear What Lurks Beneath...','Hypothermia',132250,1.014,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26319,_binary '\0','/qp8qKiP7Q7zK4z3LItwWMHfV9kJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13133936',5,9215,'en','The Desperate Hour','A woman desperately races to save her child after police place her hometown on lockdown due to an active shooter incident.','/u6Pg9eTklhg6Aa7kXaxrfdE1Chi.jpg','2022-02-17',84,'Released','Time is running out.','The Desperate Hour',764835,4.8472,5.974,'1MWECKYcyJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26320,_binary '\0','/mzW2lOPQ75lwbDQ9Vnq5dJnKPGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13137576',6.7,2521,'fr','Serre moi fort','At dawn, Clarisse takes a last look at her husband and two sleeping children, hesitates to leave a note, and hits the road. A desperate escape that gradually reveals its layers as Clarisse — who seems to have an extra-sensory connection to the family she has left behind — loses herself in the world.','/dVEeFE3s5r6hGQfhuMFlZQZgpMx.jpg','2021-09-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Hold Me Tight',756651,2.3036,6.4,'A2zdNa7HzUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26321,_binary '\0','/s5MLcxbdFqvIzTLNLU5yQFFYALR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13139228',6.6,26164,'en','My Policeman','In the late 1990s, the arrival of elderly invalid Patrick into Marion and Tom’s home triggers the exploration of seismic events from 40 years previous: the passionate relationship between Tom and Patrick at a time when homosexuality was illegal.','/wdbiMjXd4CxPfCx4r4Jfy8cGec0.jpg','2022-10-20',113,'Released','Let it take hold of you.','My Policeman',744114,4.7886,7.5,'xAEgWXOH1mY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26322,_binary '\0','/int6tqvL97k6S9JCSPAVnwebg0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13141250',4.3,9461,'en','The Ritual Killer','Unable to process the death of his daughter, Detective Boyd embarks on a hunt for a serial killer who murders according to a brutal tribal ritual: Muti. The only person who can help Boyd is Professor Mackles, an anthropologist who hides an unspeakable secret. The line between sanity and madness thins as Boyd goes deeper into the killer’s world.','/1VtHaELqLMovl8EueBWHDtihhzF.jpg','2023-03-09',92,'Released',NULL,'The Ritual Killer',862552,7.5825,5.8,'DIa__DpZX9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26323,_binary '\0','/pz1BggF8DJHV9z0LwdCW4HrrwLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314177',5.7,8053,'en','Damage','An ex-con battles it out in the cage to pay for the operation that would save the daughter of his victim. Along the way he finds fatherly love, and friendship, in the most unlikely of places.','/2qH5K0RDwcTRvXnIkzuO2X7QQwA.jpg','2009-10-05',102,'Released','Bring the pain.','Damage',24832,3.0602,6.598,'3COT5lCkvL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26324,_binary '\0','/dg476doHgjMPIvWSYKPjhhttSgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13142240',6.4,2575,'fr','Les Amours d’Anaïs','A young woman struggling to stay on top of everything in her life meets a married publisher and begins an affair with him.','/jfxWrUtZVvjFQRhaIB6ibBxLMbo.jpg','2021-09-15',98,'Released','Lose yourself in love.','Anaïs in Love',781453,2.9292,6.2,'4j3NJN7-81c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26325,_binary '\0','/4ctxEEXIDLRawB4To5ntzhbVqln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314228',5,45262,'en','Did You Hear About the Morgans?','New Yorkers Paul and Meryl Morgan seem to have it all -- except that their marriage is crumbling around them. But their romantic woes are small compared to the trouble they find themselves in after witnessing a murder. To protect them from an assassin, federal agents whisk away Paul and Meryl to a small town in Wyoming, where their marriage will crash and burn, or their passion will reignite.','/zNRLfwUGKaSQEDvOKlIOLGn8qRk.jpg','2009-12-17',103,'Released','We\'re not in Manhattan anymore.','Did You Hear About the Morgans?',24438,6.4499,5.391,'i4E05P-Hwt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26326,_binary '\0','/8RPYpsJXwjJXmPywV5euNDubezk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314237',6.4,4700,'fr','Les Beaux Gosses','An awkward adolescent boy and his angst-ridden friends try their best to fit in amongst a cast of varied characters.','/ozs5DufKj2Rdj2MUYeGK7QcUL52.jpg','2009-06-10',90,'Released','They might speak the language, but they haven\'t got a clue.','The French Kissers',18896,1.8222,5.8,'yeGU9q82ytk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26327,_binary '\0','/t0GEyPe1hwabsCEdKe1KW5GoIZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314248',4.2,2050,'en','Sea Beast','In the fishing village of Cedar Bay, terror lies within the water. And now it has surfaced in search of something more substantial to devour than marine life: human flesh. A captain and a sea biologist must wage a terrifying battle against the deadly creatures in order to save mankind from total extinction.','/ta56QLWqHo5G3u9tQw2cS5NEMsF.jpg','2008-06-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Sea Beast',21922,2.3718,4.386,'O47ME43lzC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26328,_binary '\0','/Adehm187pA5lU5coIfIIdVOkyte.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314280',7.5,7844,'fr','Welcome','Bilal is 17 years old, a Kurdish boy from Iraq. He sets off on an adventure-filled journey across Europe. He wants to get to England to see his love who lives there. Bilal finally reaches Calais, but how do you cover 32 kilometers of the English Channel when you can\'t swim? The boy soon discovers that his trip won\'t be as easy as he imagined... The community of struggling illegal aliens in Calais','/iC6LqtvuVO3Cecsn5PD2KeJ9Dvs.jpg','2009-03-11',110,'Released','Friendship has no borders. True love has no limits.','Welcome',15712,2.092,7.2,'TQIGBxjJE_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26329,_binary '\0','/hbrXbVoE0NuA1ORoSGGYNASagrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13143964',6.6,166913,'en','Borat Subsequent Moviefilm: Delivery of Prodigious Bribe to American Regime for Make Benefit Once Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan','14 years after making a film about his journey across the USA, Borat risks life and limb when he returns to the United States with his young daughter, and reveals more about the culture, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the political elections.','/3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg','2020-10-23',96,'Released','Wear mask. Save live.','Borat Subsequent Moviefilm: Delivery of Prodigious Bribe to American Regime for Make Benefit Once Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan',740985,10.0357,6.431,'0Rsa4U8mqkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26330,_binary '\0','/osOvyg2ccbjFiQsmiZK2vw8f7zs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13143988',7.2,6108,'hi','Nail Polish','A high profile defence lawyer is promised a Rajya Sabha seat if he wins a case of an accused with charges of killing two migrant children. However, there\'s much more than what meets the eye in this courtroom drama that explores the uncertainty of human mind and the journey of criminal discovery.','/gcruMXQ2l8Gp69onHp2T3UtgMgW.jpg','2021-01-01',128,'Released',NULL,'Nail Polish',774098,1.2381,6.632,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26331,_binary '\0','/2WU8IouJegA4MerKPPerXLphwPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13145186',6.8,1370,'uk','Olga','2013. Exiled in Switzerland, Olga, a talented and passionate 15-year-old Ukrainian gymnast, is trying to secure a place in the National Sports Centre. But the Euromaidan revolt erupts in Kyiv, and suddenly her loved ones are involved. While the girl is adapting to her new country and preparing for the European Championships, the Ukrainian revolution makes its way into her life, and nothing will ever be the same again.','/weLIf43ZUoGj1SuI3PLLlYSZW6L.jpg','2021-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Olga',749142,2.1461,6.9,'S6xf-JxQTUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26332,_binary '\0','/1bBq4sVRqqdVIlg1rTF76rgOYU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13145534',6.4,5854,'fr','Incroyable mais vrai','Alain and Marie moved to the suburb house of their dreams. But the real estate agent warned them: what is in the basement may well change their lives forever.','/yBLlwTXweDzBKgEbYz5ZVTRQaZX.jpg','2022-06-15',74,'Released',NULL,'Incredible But True',735697,2.6211,6,'X4R78LAd8Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26333,_binary '\0','/3300h1Q2YjIkxsvZ65H9zVo8QNR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314652',6.3,15195,'ko','하녀','Eun-yi is hired as a maid in a mansion owned by a wealthy businessman. He quickly starts seducing his employee who seemingly has little choice but to comply with his sexual advances. Soon the women of the family plot against Eun-yi who must fight an equally devious battle to protect herself.','/acrlZuaS7ypiEUb3oZRA28Ox7TV.jpg','2010-05-13',107,'Released','When Opportunity Knocks, Answer at Your Own Risk.','The Housemaid',45202,4.0003,6.31,'r62pj3gRc9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26334,_binary '\0','/ixdki635IBcNserCl7GHbqiQOJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1314655',6.3,167566,'en','Devil','A group of people are trapped in an elevator high above Philadelphia, and one of them is the Devil.','/aivXPSi53H95BoUa5njEYso389s.jpg','2010-09-16',80,'Released','Bad things happen for a reason.','Devil',44040,9.7169,6.101,'wYy7igKD21A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26335,_binary '\0','/JiWdosr3iCo64KmqzUqxUo5aCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13147656',6.7,3418,'en','The Christmas Setup','Follows the story of New York lawyer Hugo who heads to Milwaukee with his best friend Madelyn to spend the holidays with his brother Aiden and his mom Kate, who is also in charge of the local Christmas celebrations. Ever the matchmaker, Kate arranges for Hugo to run into Patrick, Hugo’s high school friend and secret crush, who has recently returned after a successful stint in Silicon Valley. As they enjoy the local holiday festivities together, Hugo and Patrick’s attraction to each other is undeniable and it looks as though Kate’s Santa-style matchmaking is a success. But as Hugo receives word of a big promotion requiring a move to London, he must decide what is most important to him.','/e7QD0hOSQuvsZFRyu9LsvNkiYmF.jpg','2020-12-12',88,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Setup',744952,2.3667,6.2,'VDAqYCOsITc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26336,_binary '\0','/9tywiX5sG55QvsBODVdcDN7FO9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13149356',4.7,3107,'de','99 Moons','Everything is under control, she thinks. Everything is lost, he thinks. And then they meet. And fall.','/yNMhAnQcfcZNicMvhtYZrRpJq7E.jpg','2023-04-27',110,'Released',NULL,'99 Moons',964819,4.5801,4.8,'9lukKEbsDdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26337,_binary '\0','/mA9PrseviOSHkM2lZja9FAUoarN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13150080',5.3,1559,'es','A todo tren: destino Asturias','When Ricardo, a responsible father, decides to personally take his son to a camp in Asturias, other parents propose that he should also take care of their children. When the train is about to leave, Felipe, a flamboyant individual and grandfather of two of the children, shows up at the station.','/xxK9GyYqEN8224PxSdkOKYbLPZX.jpg','2021-07-08',89,'Released','A hilarious adventure (as long as it doesn\'t happen to you)','The Kids Are Alright: Destination Asturias',800823,2.0987,5.6,'BUKJTtOT2TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26338,_binary '\0','/grSMLUNcNBbRf8b4sQTGLMAe6wZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13150630',7.2,7646,'en','Secrets of the Saqqara Tomb','This documentary follows a team of local archaeologists excavating never before explored passageways, shafts, and tombs, piecing together the secrets of Egypt’s most significant find in almost 50 years in Saqqara.','/za9ANBaT0JAamJl0JjGXz5P1Gkq.jpg','2020-10-28',113,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of the Saqqara Tomb',753583,2.2456,7.3,'77_UeHKMB-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26339,_binary '\0','/2aNdcH8Izr4r9D8B2qkvMtPzmAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315216',7.2,5040,'en','Jesse Stone: No Remorse','Police Chief Jesse Stone, who was suspended by the Paradise, Mass. Town Council, begins moonlighting for his friend, State Homicide Commander Healy, by investigating a series of murders in Boston, leaving Rose and Suitcase to handle a crime spree in Paradise on their own. Jesse pours his energy into his work in an effort to push away his twin demons: booze and women. When his investigation leads to notorious mob boss Gino Fish, Jesse\'s pursuit becomes hazardous.','/tcqnCLdPigSFlZzsug3Mwmx8qLC.jpg','2010-05-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Jesse Stone: No Remorse',43263,2.5423,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26340,_binary '\0','/86NbNQpgUct9BVF6NgNKc97lqac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13153494',6.3,2094,'en','Punch','Seventeen-year old Jim is a small-town boxing hero who carries the hopes and dreams of his father Stan on his shoulders. His growing relationship with local takatāpui Māori boy, Whetu, forces him to confront the truth about his sexuality, and choose his own future.','/9KvyFkSsjKC5FjSOYcgFQ0xGdor.jpg','2022-11-22',99,'Released','Love is worth the fight.','Punch',942802,2.2329,5.6,'dc4nFczQ7MM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26341,_binary '\0','/csdiZhmXyurNpuZcZGkZr4i1UkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315350',6.6,5557,'en','Cherry','Ivy League Freshman, Aaron Milton (17) gets a different kind of education when he falls for Linda (34) a vivacious former wild-child who has returned to college to straighten out her life. The curriculum gets more challenging when Aaron meets Linda\'s sarcastic 14 year-old daughter, Beth - who quickly develops a crush on him. The math doesn\'t work in either direction but the dysfunctional triangle becomes a learning experience for all involved.','/sTlOUvhrsiGdtwVKbdlB5pAdE2U.jpg','2010-10-08',99,'Released','Too young? Too old? You do the math.','Cherry',47320,1.659,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26342,_binary '\0','/wtSCUR08t8vFW9glBz2yeTMbFlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315419',4.7,1313,'de','The Truth','When a couple is taken hostage in their home by an intruder, a simple home invasion robbery turns into something much more complicated...','/khVDEHy9gVwN8eKupDiYKLWJwBy.jpg','2010-05-20',98,'Released','The truth... Is always complicated.','The Truth',39240,1.5458,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26343,_binary '\0','/hQ6LuV2wMUg6PRb019bvxJ9ARAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13157970',2.9,2300,'en','Incarnation','Brad and Jess move to Los Angeles in search of a better life. When they stumble upon a hidden real estate gem, managed by the laid-back landlord Peter, they are elated by their turn of fortune. But their ideal home is hiding a secret far more sinister than they could have ever imagined, for the very walls are alive with an ancient evil, and they soon learn that greed comes with a hefty price.','/A7nzmQgmKz4Tmsxp2vvDGhcF9MG.jpg','2022-02-18',88,'Released',NULL,'Incarnation',926255,1.0521,3.9,'TPIeWdmuhYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26344,_binary '\0','/2Zn2IQmVW7MWO4oXJTu2oQzM2kT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315883',5.8,1238,'fr','Incognito','Lucas is an up-and-coming singer ready to do anything to be on top of the French pop scene.','/ggLqpRUaGt8SXnsv22y4CS6x42f.jpg','2009-04-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Incognito',17413,2.0913,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26345,_binary '\0','/9gZq0bWAiZUTyhCTFEjo7iCW3Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315962',6.3,4687,'fr','Partir','A bourgeois housewife, planning to go back to work as a physiotherapist after having devoted 20 years to her husband and two children, has her comfortable, elegant life turned upside down when she falls for a Spanish builder and begins a runaway affair.','/fJuIGigEH7YqIkHqHgJTxUs21Nq.jpg','2009-08-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Leaving',43619,3.4922,6,'rhJ9VozH-xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26346,_binary '\0','/4rHZyoFxGxvkMNiLFEqwm19HCtc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1315981',7.5,122725,'en','A Single Man','Set in Los Angeles in 1962, at the height of the Cuban missile crisis, is the story of a British college professor who dwells on the past and cannot see his future. We follow him through a single day, where a series of events and encounters ultimately lead him to decide if there is a meaning to life after the death of his long time partner, Jim.','/oN20MLvoLv14whAss05V3ETBu0p.jpg','2009-12-11',100,'Released',NULL,'A Single Man',34653,6.4821,7.3,'KTQT6hGp96g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26347,_binary '\0','/wDrs28ZYYnXVIeb87H0dCYlWiFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316037',1.7,27304,'en','Birdemic: Shock and Terror','A platoon of eagles and vultures attacks the residents of a small town. Many people die. It\'s not known what caused the flying menace to attack. Two people manage to fight back, but will they survive Birdemic?','/gqmcAVNNUosB55RliecFYnkWT4M.jpg','2010-02-27',93,'Released','Why did the eagles and vultures attack?','Birdemic: Shock and Terror',40016,2.139,2.2,'jE5dJDgZ644','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26348,_binary '\0','/kvLTvkS7Ddphl6RNCFRekRKNTjI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316078',5.3,5323,'en','The Sky Has Fallen','Within a couple of hours, a new disease wipes out almost all of mankind. Trying to avoid infection, people flee to remote locations, but they start seeing mysterious black figures, carrying away the dead and experimenting on them. Now, Lance and Rachel, two survivors determined to fight back, must kill the leader of these creatures before the rest of humanity disappears','/rK7LN2GlHFiha1bOKnYzp9pVdyf.jpg','2009-05-06',73,'Released',NULL,'The Sky Has Fallen',119175,1.2619,3.2,'c9M2Cw8OoDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26349,_binary '\0','/2Xd8DERh3y4FxEO5fzlmB6PAG0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13161356',7,3675,'tr','Beni Çok Sev','Accompanied by a ward, a prisoner travels to his hometown to reconnect with his daughter and make amends, but a tragic truth mars his journey.','/41eH50AJ6D4olMC0oErSMwDD9WY.jpg','2021-11-19',124,'Released',NULL,'Love Me Instead',889300,1.3842,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26350,_binary '\0','/iyGl6Fs0pL9HWctwh1BS9nItvel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13162144',7.5,3798,'ml','കാണെക്കാണെ','Paul’s daughter Sherin is no more and her husband Allen has remarried. When he visits the new couple, who is also taking care of his grandson, a few doubts pop up in his mind, regarding his daughter’s death.','/ydDJXheYFhCMFfQGnnicj3QJ8Yw.jpg','2021-09-17',120,'Released','...As You Watch...','Kaanekkaane',866434,1.0479,7.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26351,_binary '\0','/brze8bta1uZAlvGiQVbSQFhm5bQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13162334',4.4,1525,'sv','Glaciär','Two people are stuck in a quarantine hotel during a deadly pandemic. Physical contact equals death, total isolation is required. Yet, it is human nature to seek togetherness. But what happens when you have to choose between love and life?','/vxJrNkMZhfXdHQKEdoFq3tsGLhx.jpg','2021-04-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Glacier',821975,1.9479,5,'jEfh5YypvA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26352,_binary '\0','/wu2oDlbB8I2UMZIumWfbDi6oiYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316536',6.6,47961,'en','The Loved Ones','When Brent turns down his classmate Lola\'s invitation to the prom, she concocts a wildly violent plan for revenge.','/ydsLYdSiPSIL1LOWWYu7VCvDTT8.jpg','2010-11-04',84,'Released','Don\'t break her heart','The Loved Ones',46420,3.6149,6.7,'1jkPj0Nso30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26353,_binary '\0','/eMgNa5dbU34qyF0KA9DMA4TrEzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316540',7.7,21736,'hu','A torinói ló','A look at the monotonous daily struggle of a father and daughter in a windswept, desolate landscape. Over six days, their routine of eating boiled potatoes and tending a failing horse crumbles, symbolizing a slow descent into darkness, emptiness, and the end of existence.','/2kSElneXSKmMsGL55k0CbPGqLbu.jpg','2011-03-31',155,'Released',NULL,'The Turin Horse',81401,3.6365,7.6,'KYBCNTzQ31c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26354,_binary '\0','/hC11CgiCUdpCwG1I6dSY18nJXrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13165898',4.5,1272,'en','Ballistic','When a soldier\'s mother discovers the bullet that killed her son in Afghanistan was made at the factory where she works, she sets out on a path of revenge against those responsible.','/mTcXNQHnabavseapSfcAKhTnC3V.jpg','2026-04-17',91,'Released','A mother\'s pain, a bullet\'s purpose.','Ballistic',1243741,4.2785,5.776,'bxvgiEFR774','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26355,_binary '\0','/lCjCPWK1gPouYo92WL21fHBOtCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316616',5.7,5330,'en','There Be Dragons','Arising out of the horror of the Spanish Civil War, a candidate for canonization is investigated by a journalist who discovers his own estranged father had a deep, dark and devastating connection to the saint\'s life.While researching the life of Josemaria Escriva, the controversial founder of Opus Dei, the young journalist Robert uncovers hidden stories of his estranged father Manolo, and is taken on a journey through the dark, terrible secrets of his family’s past.','/7y6ehxTLB1ZJl3xFVFbhcnoJx1m.jpg','2011-03-25',112,'Released','Even saints have a past.','There Be Dragons',45054,3.1907,5.1,'kWVy91GzfsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26356,_binary '\0','/ystiVAkqldGAJzk7suY24jWxPl2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1316622',5.3,17509,'en','Wrecked','A man awakens in a car wreck at the bottom of a steep cliff. He can\'t remember who he is or how he got there, but a report over the radio fills in some of the blanks, as it describes a violent bank robbery and names a perpetrator who happens to be sitting dead in the back seat.','/vlMaBNaC7FATlWq5lq9LmWijBOe.jpg','2010-04-01',86,'Released','When your mind is a mystery. You can survive the wilderness. But can you escape your past?','Wrecked',50838,2.4644,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26357,_binary '\0','/98rqc2XO0M1NJVhNnej502LIr8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13169850',7,2299,'en','Time for Us to Come Home for Christmas','Five guests are mysteriously invited to an inn to celebrate Christmas. With the help of the owner Ben, Sarah discovers that an event from the past may connect them and change their lives forever.','/he6XKUtiiaUE58BZ4DswlcgHwth.jpg','2020-12-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Time for Us to Come Home for Christmas',746049,2.162,7,'YFXA5vpvWqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26358,_binary '\0','/122WPSRKHjMScqESFYmaYDIYmTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13172796',6.7,5520,'en','Plan B','After a regrettable first sexual encounter, a straight-laced high school student and her slacker best friend have 24 hours to hunt down a Plan B pill in America\'s heartland.','/fYWWORzYJrs6qXUO4JeRll2zdAZ.jpg','2021-06-18',108,'Released','The morning after is just the beginning.','Plan B',743599,2.6817,6.2,'u4-oQ1LEXO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26359,_binary '\0','/uRFUI3i6uySylNAKUPnO49UIpSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13176330',5.2,1516,'en','Hitpig!','A porcine bounty hunter accepts his next hit: Pickles, a naive, ebullient elephant. Though he initially sets out to capture the perky pachyderm, the unlikely pair find themselves crisscrossing the globe on an adventure that brings out the best in both of them.','/bYa20LYAZ3Q7lKXtLYybo0yWWTN.jpg','2024-11-01',85,'Released','When you’re on the lam, they call the ham.','Hitpig!',756397,5.1994,6.7,'I_MrnmtXCMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26360,_binary '\0','/lkEA5vnGbV8ZxLGqbxRlcHCvRYT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13177004',7.8,1468,'en','Sacred Cow: The Nutritional, Environmental and Ethical Case for Better Meat','A film about the current debate on eating and raising cattle for food, showing that animal-sourced foods are nutritious for humans, and can be raised in a way that is beneficial for the environment.','/nMPtWp73xwQ8hC4sHv2YLGWT6a.jpg','2020-09-28',80,'Released',NULL,'Sacred Cow: The Nutritional, Environmental and Ethical Case for Better Meat',768517,1.03,0,'eedW-RcCnDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26361,_binary '\0','/23QNbNnQKFZ4FSm8qSeOzFZIUYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318001',6.2,2249,'en','Handsome Harry','An ex-Navy man carrying out the last wish of a dying shipmate renews contact with old friends to break the code of silence around a mysterious, long-buried crime.','/bkM7PavmHTUrX5DWKFICZUYVJ32.jpg','2009-04-25',94,'Released','Can we ever change the past?','Handsome Harry',51933,1.1352,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26362,_binary '\0','/AvbFf89YNJiNvOb7tpdccA3jbHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318025',5.7,3479,'es','Hierro','Traveling on a ferry heading to the island of Hierro where they will spend their holidays, Mary loses her son Diego, and no one can explain what happened. Six months later, Maria struggles to overcome the pain of loss and continue his life. Then, you receive an unexpected phone call: they found the body of a child, so it must return to the island. There, in the suggestive and disturbing landscape, surrounded by disturbing and sinister characters, Mary is forced to confront their worst nightmares. And as he travels this road, he discovers that some mysteries should not be disclosed ...','/dJz6mLj4F8pHrFXo0F9lCIh6VWN.jpg','2009-09-26',94,'Released','A travel. A search. A mystery','Hierro',38256,1.4136,5.586,'vd1JiaBS3tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26363,_binary '\0','/LjAUvZTY55WIcsRwrLVT6EyG4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318044',4.3,8509,'en','American Virgin','A Freshman College Girl on a scholarship from an abstinence group that advocates saving sex until marriage discovers that her antics on a night of debauchery, when she reluctantly got drunk for the first time in her life, were captured on camera by a sleazy video producer. Now she and her friends must travel across country to recover the incriminating footage.','/qvWZ4j8aM9s8tuc6JH2OWdkDFP5.jpg','2009-10-03',82,'Released',NULL,'American Virgin',23568,2.7853,5.047,'cIdTOTj3-ZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26364,_binary '\0','/yIqKZfm5DqP5cEyWfYpnvK41CS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13182756',7.2,1730,'en','The Most Reluctant Convert: The Untold Story of C.S. Lewis','An elder C.S. Lewis looks back on his remarkable journey from hard-boiled atheist to the most renowned Christian writer of the past century.','/lrYRdwa78Ww1q7oEGbGSep97W16.jpg','2021-11-03',87,'Released',NULL,'The Most Reluctant Convert: The Untold Story of C.S. Lewis',804827,1.8635,5.9,'AWEjo6pr2Qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26365,_binary '\0','/ynx5rhctJ9L2yYZzI0G60ADAmt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13182834',6.6,1407,'ko','자백','Min-ho\'s adulterous lover Se-hee is murdered in a hotel where only the two of them were present, and Min-ho is immediately singles out as the prime suspect. Insisting on his innocence, Min-ho hires the talented lawyer Shin-ae to defend him, and confesses to her that a car accident on the day before may be connected to Se-hee\'s murder.','/lmU2Pg2skqGjjBu3OzT9S7y2jCy.jpg','2022-10-26',105,'Released','Solving the manipulations of the case.','Confession',634595,2.6948,7.245,'HNnZQuOPUdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26366,_binary '\0','/6cCF0KMUO2QmrVsQFujkQduREXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318514',7.6,610083,'en','Rise of the Planet of the Apes','A highly intelligent chimpanzee named Caesar has been living a peaceful suburban life ever since he was born. But when he gets taken to a cruel primate facility, Caesar decides to revolt against those who have harmed him.','/oqA45qMyyo1TtrnVEBKxqmTPhbN.jpg','2011-08-03',105,'Released','Evolution becomes revolution.','Rise of the Planet of the Apes',61791,24.0608,7.4,'P1yKN0llkrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26367,_binary '\0','/osf2ja2t7gWKXKzYJlA5N9fzV2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318517',6.3,24073,'en','The Man Who Killed Don Quixote','Toby, a cynical film director finds himself trapped in the outrageous delusions of an old Spanish shoe-maker who believes himself to be Don Quixote. In the course of their comic and increasingly surreal adventures, Toby is forced to confront the tragic repercussions of a film he made in his idealistic youth.','/4o4zw2c9sfHvszIb5xpuFagnouR.jpg','2018-05-19',133,'Released','Today\'s a marvelous day for adventures!','The Man Who Killed Don Quixote',297725,5.6452,6.7,'CmscmzjFLdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26368,_binary '\0','/AhSdAmPyVGxBUs560hNVstbTX3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318522',6,1405,'en','Before You Say \'I Do\'','George Murray\'s fiancée Jane Gardner gets cold feet after accepting his ring, terrorized by her first wedding with Doug, who cheated that very day with their wedding coordinator. George wishes he could have met her before she married her ex. After a car crash, George finds himself 10 years in the past, just a few days before the wedding. George has a chance to rewrite history, and stop her from making a terrible mistake. Hopefully, he\'ll save his future marriage and not ruin the rest of his life.','/9fOpao3RE7bHNcuZG9MjBSRSs02.jpg','2009-02-14',87,'Released','To have a future, he must undo her past...','Before You Say \'I Do\'',48281,2.4661,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26369,_binary '\0','/rzchR1ZQQlj5bCfEUdrTZsC5CF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1318523',5.3,4166,'en','The Unhealer','A botched faith healing bestows supernatural Shaman powers on a bullied teenager. When his lifelong tormentors pull a prank that kills someone he loves, he uses his powers for revenge and goes on a bloody rampage to settle the score.','/jEuKhYfeS4dz0uQj1yTZ2Gl8yNH.jpg','2021-12-02',94,'Released','With great power comes great pain','The Unhealer',740903,5.7231,5.8,'nh3zPbpr_kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26370,_binary '\0','/iZLqwEwUViJdSkGVjePGhxYzbDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13186306',2.5,34717,'en','War of the Worlds','Will Radford is a top analyst for Homeland Security who tracks potential threats through a mass surveillance program, until one day an attack by an unknown entity leads him to question whether the government is hiding something from him... and from the rest of the world.','/yvirUYrva23IudARHn3mMGVxWqM.jpg','2025-07-29',91,'Released','Your data is deadly.','War of the Worlds',755898,99.5664,4,'d9erkpdh5o0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26371,_binary '\0','/1w8kutrRucTd3wlYyu5QlUDMiG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13186482',6.6,84765,'en','Mufasa: The Lion King','Mufasa, a cub lost and alone, meets a sympathetic lion named Taka, the heir to a royal bloodline. The chance meeting sets in motion an expansive journey of a group of misfits searching for their destiny.','/jbOSUAWMGzGL1L4EaUF8K6zYFo7.jpg','2024-12-18',118,'Released','The story of an orphan who would be king.','Mufasa: The Lion King',762509,29.8206,7.284,'MjQG-a7d41Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26372,_binary '\0','/w9vIb69U3rCNrpktTL8a89Meomf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13186528',5.3,1240,'en','Ben 10 vs. the Universe: The Movie','A blast from Ben\'s past returns to do double the damage on Team Tennyson and planet Earth itself, forcing Ben to go interstellar to save the day. Based on the 2016 reboot.','/34KSOJVowmkeh6G0HZJMxqdHq6s.jpg','2020-10-02',70,'Released','Ben 10 is ready to take on the universe in his most epic adventure yet','Ben 10 vs. the Universe: The Movie',724475,4.6032,7.44,'opR_2-IBw8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26373,_binary '\0','/y4NzXdvpJdwRmsnOT7HdkmHh6Yn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13186604',4.7,38083,'en','Uglies','In a futuristic dystopia with enforced beauty standards, a teen awaiting mandatory cosmetic surgery embarks on a journey to find her missing friend.','/jaUu9zHtbcFwrB5Y1DNYE09HMex.jpg','2024-09-12',100,'Released','In a world of extreme beauty, anyone normal is ugly.','Uglies',748167,5.2288,5.693,'OhcOHkgTrQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26374,_binary '\0','/3tuXATLo1LMouHwQPBKS7siUuQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13188064',5.5,1618,'en','Let the Wrong One In','16 year old Matt is a little too nice for his own good, and when he discovers that his older, estranged brother Deco has turned into a vampire, he\'s faced with a dilemma: will he risk his own life to help his sibling, with blood being thicker than water; or will he stake him before he spreads the infection further?','/dnUcP1IzJmtjB0O64hnqniB3q6O.jpg','2021-10-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Let the Wrong One In',757916,2.0754,5.6,'_XFO2Wk9DxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26375,_binary '\0','/cJb04VJ0dmb49UKRfvmTEZMh7Gj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13192538',6.7,2639,'en','Never Kiss a Man in a Christmas Sweater','Single mom Maggie is facing Christmas alone until Lucas crashes into her life and becomes an unexpected house guest. Together they overcome Christmas while finding comfort in their growing bond.','/7VyM9eU0MoP4KA81meqt7UJoZAP.jpg','2020-11-07',84,'Released',NULL,'Never Kiss a Man in a Christmas Sweater',746034,2.5078,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26376,_binary '\0','/rx7UXy0OcWZuZwn9NI20wClwLbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319569',6.9,5301,'fr','Home','Along with her husband and three children, Marthe lives in an eden of her own creation, nearly isolated from the rest of the world. The arrival of a construction vehicle, however, pierces their tranquil, hermetic existence—before long a disused highway has been re-opened, and the family finds their home situated in the midst of rush-hour traffic. While the privileges of clean air, quietude and privacy are thus denied them, Marthe remains determined to stay no matter the cost.','/4Jq1IA3Z9NqlikWqBy7pgHiZyeJ.jpg','2008-10-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Home',61222,3.0506,6.855,'dRYzINrg6B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26377,_binary '\0','/gL6OWNNUIBJvknyonhnyHmQdAq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319694',6.4,6010,'en','Glorious 39','A mysterious tale set around a traditional British family on the eve of World War Two. Oblivious to the looming shadow of World War II, the wealthy Keyes maintain a confident façade in the British countryside until daughter Anne becomes an unexpected pawn. Her accidental discovery of secret recordings creates a rift in the family.','/kYXMRksWR7R2G7LEuEeVWhWgEY4.jpg','2009-11-20',129,'Released',NULL,'Glorious 39',35939,2.7109,6.005,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26378,_binary '\0','/rsH3eLp3lsey8ItHST2sAy1DTJW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319704',5.4,10042,'en','Chatroom','When strangers Jim, Eva, Emily and Mo meet William online in his new \'Chelsea Teens!\' chatroom, they\'re completely seduced by his fast-talking, charismatic character. But beneath the surface lies a much darker truth. William is a dangerous loner, channeling all his energies into cyberspace. He\'s become an analyser, a calculating manipulator who finds it almost impossible to interact normally with others in the real world, instead turning his hand to manipulating people online.','/71wg5xa3ASAdM3PCLNrDlqD9sTl.jpg','2010-08-11',97,'Released','Control. Alter. Delete.','Chatroom',48946,3.2521,5.808,'R5J90AjJc0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26379,_binary '\0','/mkpOFz93P5kxwSYoIl5jxgOrres.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319716',5.4,1752,'en','It\'s a Wonderful Afterlife','Indian mother Mrs Sethi\'s obsession with marrying off her daughter turns murderous. With jokes that routinely miss the mark and cringeworthy slapstick, this black comedy farce shouldn\'t work. Somehow, though, it does.','/uHXO6Fu4rWKmD2LLudXOeURWKDe.jpg','2010-05-07',100,'Released','Finding the right man can be murder','It\'s a Wonderful Afterlife',42057,2.2175,4.8,'5Hs8g6knp7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26380,_binary '\0','/kn0DkkCG459NTwUMzP6qbDWBNcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319718',6.8,16764,'zh','大兵小将','The story of a farmer forced into conscription, who has been looking to get out of the army ever since. His great chance arrives when he stumbles upon a wounded general from an enemy state, and he kidnaps him, intending to claim credit for the capture, which includes five acres of land, and most importantly, honorable discharge from the army.','/uCSQnopQPIw58RKTfzoRYxq9It5.jpg','2010-02-14',96,'Released',NULL,'Little Big Soldier',35138,3.6095,6.9,'OuqpelCg6kA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26381,_binary '\0','/20p0bMWormdEYqMeC0cyJgtS5Br.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319722',5.6,3662,'en','A Little Help','It\'s a movie for everyone whose life has been thrown off-course, out of whack, or simply not turned out the way they planned it. In other words, it\'s a movie for everyone, period. Set in suburban Long Island in the summer of 2002, with the psychic wounds of 9/11 still fresh, A Little Help is a story that takes a comic, searching and profoundly empathetic look at a few pivotal months in the life of dental hygienist Laura Pehlke (Jenna Fischer)-an ordinary woman whose life suddenly flies off the rails-and her heroic efforts to re-establish a sense of security and normalcy for herself and her son.','/dz5Dtx02nATmBskqAp1m8YJgSVR.jpg','2010-05-21',109,'Released',NULL,'A Little Help',65056,2.2244,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26382,_binary '\0','/yiVyfbUVi9GcRXOk2TfnKh28kqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319726',7.7,2523,'en','The Most Dangerous Man in America','\"The Most Dangerous Man in America\" is the story of what happens when a former Pentagon insider, armed only with his conscience, steadfast determination, and a file cabinet full of classified documents, decides to challenge an \"imperial\" presidency – answerable to neither Congress, the press, nor the people – in order to help end the Vietnam War.','/br3NZWHBAETFmfIBk4o9rvhByKZ.jpg','2009-10-16',92,'Released','Daniel Ellsberg and the Pentagon Papers','The Most Dangerous Man in America',34576,1.9194,7.4,'XwXylIaJ_Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26383,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319727',6.7,2928,'tr','Mustafa','The biography of Mustafa Kemal Atatürk, who not only grew himself up from a poor lonely child to a country\'s most loved person, but also rose a new country from the ashes of an empire. A story of a soldier, an eminent statesman and a great reformist.','/3vWP9zCOvWF2Q1LouU0vb9JuplF.jpg','2008-10-29',130,'Released',NULL,'Mustafa',52110,1.4261,5.174,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26384,_binary '\0','/cbY2iYRD1SRd7dvEKDMqywI6Cr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319736',3.9,1349,'en','Sand Serpents','Jason Gedrick and a small group of Marines are stranded in the remote Afghan desert. But it ain\'t the Taliban that\'s worrying them, it\'s these giant refugees from Tremors. In fact the big worms prove to be an ally of sorts by doing better against the Taliban than themselves but battling these enemies is something not covered in their training.','/vansdh0dohqSzKvFvzZz49lfhac.jpg','2009-07-11',90,'Released','Terror lies beneath.','Sand Serpents',49266,1.3742,3.9,'gtnKXM19kAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26385,_binary '\0','/4HU9GkpeA7ghltK3oYATQnNOA8y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319744',7.5,3680,'en','The Interrupters','The Interrupters tells the moving and surprising stories of three Violence Interrupters — former gang members who try to protect their Chicago communities from the violence they once caused.','/p9CKFs1NhIUUcqUziBhcvkkUjwO.jpg','2011-07-29',129,'Released','Every City Needs Its Heroes','The Interrupters',72711,1.6711,6.8,'sXmm0MZLGxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26386,_binary '\0','/cEyk0Kqp2gYjlfFXc4ogiKO6rcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1319746',6.3,7628,'en','My Fake Fiance','Jennifer and Vince, virtual strangers, find themselves strapped for cash and decide to stage a fake engagement and wedding just for the gifts','/5DgZNoDd4rRyGo3sle0DBR0NEcO.jpg','2012-08-16',95,'Released','Need money? Get a Fiance...','My Fake Fiance',37269,1.9565,6.6,'IxgWn0gzgmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26387,_binary '\0','/pBY3XBGT1WplO30yzrhSGBSvbaQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13197624',6.6,2161,'en','A Glenbrooke Christmas','As Christmas nears, heiress Jessica Morgan seizes what seems like her last chance to experience a relaxed Christmas and heads off to the small town of Glenbrooke, where she meets a handsome fireman.','/i2Q7WtmhXlDp8rDwTdmKBxiIMTZ.jpg','2020-12-12',85,'Released',NULL,'A Glenbrooke Christmas',746056,1.7005,6.5,'Ur1azuEePfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26388,_binary '\0','/b2iPSYQkypfiRCWZZeTBiebWLgJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13197812',5.4,1625,'en','Goodbye, Petrushka','Claire moves impulsively from NYC to Paris, where she nannies for the family from hell, battles wacky French bureaucrats, embarrasses herself in front of her Parisian crush, and navigates a toxic relationship—among other faux pas.','/6gk3v50w3SaGgRmHNVSWaSdjfnm.jpg','2022-06-12',97,'Released','A comedy about growing up and screwing up... in two countries.','Goodbye, Petrushka',924341,1.4104,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26389,_binary '\0','/xwrQazFIlIyZcP5oryK9mmVnhFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13198946',7.9,2098,'en','In Search of Darkness: Part II','The ultimate ‘80s Horror retrospective just got BIGGER. In Search of Darkness: Part II is a four-hour-plus sequel to the Rondo Hatton-nominated In Search of Darkness, adding 15 new interviewees and 40+ returning favorites for the biggest and most comprehensive ‘80s Horror documentary cast ever assembled.','/yJw53gLMUCEfNKyKf645XLpyy2w.jpg','2020-10-06',263,'Released','The Journey Into \'80s Horror Continues','In Search of Darkness: Part II',749240,1.6185,7.7,'l6gueCqmjM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26390,_binary '\0','/vaH71k2qZWTX2v3T3jrXa9boBTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13199716',6.3,2708,'te','చెక్','Aditya is a death row prisoner facing charges of terrorism. His only hope for living lies in the game of chess.','/7uWWCPFDE1ZqfzZuqEr5aRq18bn.jpg','2021-02-20',140,'Released',NULL,'Check',789358,1.191,5.357,'glgN50DmvYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26391,_binary '\0','/mx3YyWpm7lTUxGQcHQC42s3xuVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13200006',6.6,1406,'fa','Shayda','Shayda, a young Iranian woman living in Australia, finds refuge in a women’s shelter with her 6-year-old daughter, Mona. Having fled her husband, Hossein, and filed for divorce, Shayda struggles to maintain normalcy for Mona. Buoyed by the approach of Nowruz, she tries to forge a fresh start with new and unfettered freedoms. But when a judge grants Hossein visitation rights, he reenters their life, stoking Shayda’s fear that he’ll attempt to take Mona back to Iran.','/fKLSMZ7EfIGRNRXntdJ157PcHmo.jpg','2023-09-28',118,'Released','A love letter to mothers and daughters everywhere','Shayda',978586,1.7689,6.8,'npwKunbjZNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26392,_binary '\0','/Ng3bVep7dL8qQiWhWQlSo2OvpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320082',7.5,19242,'fr','Le Concert','A former world-famous conductor of the Bolshoï orchestra, known as \"The Maëstro\", Andreï Filipov had seen his career publicly broken by Leonid Brezhnev for hiring Jewish musicians and now works cleaning the concert hall where he once directed. One day, he intercepts an official invitation from the prestigious Théâtre du Châtelet. Through a series of mad antics, he reunites his old orchestra, now composed of old alcoholic musicians, and flies to perform in Paris and complete the Tchaikovsky concerto interrupted 30 years earlier. For the concerto, he engages a young violin soloist with whom he has an unexpected connection.','/nMIDVIq7p2mcvolG93FH4Ku3aYJ.jpg','2009-11-04',119,'Released','The grand deception that became the performance of a lifetime.','The Concert',25205,3.4267,7.2,'3aait4aOxP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26393,_binary '\0','/3KiWJd24didCM2yhXYq95AJaJtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320236',5.4,1240,'en','A Closed Book','Jane appears to be ideal: attractive, intelligent, unruffled by her employer\'s abrupt eccentricities. But, gradually, we come aware that Jane has another agenda. Incrementally, Sir Paul\'s familiar surroundings are altered. His housekeeper is diverted away, strange things happen around the house and he becomes increasingly dependent on his new assistant.','/ngcMZU6nV7XnX2jgPt0ueZgISSj.jpg','2012-07-13',88,'Released','She has a secret he can’t see.','A Closed Book',34211,1.4649,5.5,'3LwThz73rxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26394,_binary '\0','/lmglBJjuzAqdvmvVomX69AXHYNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320239',6.1,22257,'en','Burke & Hare','Two 19th-century opportunists become serial killers so that they can maintain their profitable business supplying cadavers to an anatomist.','/3VY3gKHPc9dRq8FshSXWbXtgD9B.jpg','2010-10-29',91,'Released','No Job Too Small. No Body Too Big. No Questions Asked.','Burke & Hare',50204,4.0769,6.1,'TH65zyrzmfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26395,_binary '\0','/fyNEA2BZ5Yixu6Wub9OtIqlmJBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320244',5.7,54715,'en','The Last Exorcism','After years of performing “exorcisms” and taking believers’ money, Reverend Marcus travels to rural Louisiana with a film crew so he can dispel what he believes is the myth of demonic possession. The dynamic reverend is certain that this will be another routine “exorcism” on a disturbed religious fanatic but instead comes upon the blood-soaked farm of the Sweetzer family and a true evil he would have never thought imaginable.','/eOo9tgGjxdsQEgqc6g7E1NL8460.jpg','2010-08-27',87,'Released','Believe In Him.','The Last Exorcism',38358,6.7767,5.675,'J7gCUvf38jE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26396,_binary '\0','/yBv9RxlWPXRCvjMFsrmB1pxwWo6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320253',6.4,383012,'en','The Expendables','Barney Ross leads a band of highly skilled mercenaries including knife enthusiast Lee Christmas, a martial arts expert Yin Yang, heavy weapons specialist Hale Caesar, demolitionist Toll Road, and a loose-cannon sniper Gunner Jensen. When the group is commissioned by the mysterious Mr. Church to assassinate the dictator of a small South American island, Barney and Lee visit the remote locale to scout out their opposition and discover the true nature of the conflict engulfing the city.','/j09ZkH6R4JWVylBcDai1laCmGw7.jpg','2010-08-07',103,'Released','Choose your weapon.','The Expendables',27578,19.8637,6.251,'8KtYRALe-xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26397,_binary '\0','/pcTlqvywOrFIc6esZAze12fKlaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320254',8.1,1449,'es','Presunto Culpable','Two young Mexican attorneys attempt to exonerate a wrongly convicted man by making a documentary. In the process, they expose the contradictions of a judicial system that presumes suspects guilty until proven innocent.','/xh4hOfgHQOTGWUmt9fcfmtBjHen.jpg','2008-11-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Presumed Guilty',58376,1.2168,6.4,'7mUs2fGLZ08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26398,_binary '\0','/1EnX8qIJUYv6mG0Asub6Om8158z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320261',4.9,78663,'en','Gulliver\'s Travels','Travel writer Lemuel Gulliver takes an assignment in Bermuda, but ends up on the island of Liliput, where he towers over its tiny citizens.','/6NoEtuTwZ04luk5H2DpT5ivW7Mg.jpg','2010-12-23',85,'Released','Black is the new big.','Gulliver\'s Travels',38745,8.3503,5.2,'5rKgly8grRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26399,_binary '\0','/x4bo1wEOcgmvrFftalSKeeFsGoL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320291',5.8,22809,'en','The Reef','A great white shark hunts the crew of a capsized sailboat along the Great Barrier Reef.','/s5JGAqmdv1cHlDjMqsmQUkVo2lW.jpg','2010-05-15',88,'Released','Pray that you drown first.','The Reef',49787,2.8827,5.643,'Q7Sy8KEyUms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26400,_binary '\0','/d4SnuHyfQPP6a856SIgsWZENMQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320296',3.9,4350,'en','Shank','SHANK delivers a ruthless vision of forthcoming urban life, where guns have been superseded by knives and are fiercely wielded by aimless youths. Amidst the chaos is the Paper Chazers gang, a rare morally conscious group who trade scavenged food for money. After Chazers gang member, Junior, witnesses his brothers murder, he must decide whether to get revenge or stick to the gangs moral code.','/jUqEb54raDC2SnAznfkQYC08H2s.jpg','2010-08-21',90,'Released','If you\'re not one of us, you\'re a victim.','Shank',41345,1.3853,4.9,'kfapOIPCRik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26401,_binary '\0','/hgiuAQDZeCZS4LWf0ODyqSBUU8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320297',7.5,1914,'it','Si può fare','The film follows Nello, the recently hired director of a newly developed work cooperative of former mental patients. After the closure of state psychiatric hospitals and asylums in Italy under the Basaglia Law many former patients were left with few resources and little hope of reintegrating into society. With the intention of actually improving the lives of his pupils, rather than just sedating them, Nello encourages them to expand their individual abilities and explore the wider world around them although, regardless of intention, there is sometimes a price to pushing boundaries too quickly.','/vRgjbl788t9w2DnhFCX8NSy73gM.jpg','2008-10-31',111,'Released','From a close range nobody is normal','We Can Do That',23619,1.6898,7.248,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26402,_binary '\0','/iXgrdOIQ6MOT4kULYmLLmeI3r19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320346',3.7,1216,'en','Merlin and the Book of Beasts','In the twenty years since the fall of Camelot, Merlin has become a recluse known as \"the wild man of the woods.\" He is now summoned by a charge of young knights as they quest to destroy an evil wizard who rules the land from a throne of a \"New Camelot.\"','/rVu79cadmLkmOwdS76mfL7QVsW2.jpg','2009-08-29',92,'Released',NULL,'Merlin and the Book of Beasts',21358,2.3446,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26403,_binary '\0','/1EWQAfGLYv2y4icU9NKAuiJCMJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320347',5.7,1567,'en','Nora Roberts\' Midnight Bayou','The new owner of a supposedly haunted New Orleans plantation manor uncovers a shocking secret that has been hidden for over 100 years.','/zmocKnQyAcupnZZjUBILuuYYied.jpg','2009-03-28',120,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Midnight Bayou',33314,2.5407,5.3,'JPoQlsTldSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26404,_binary '\0','/2BDZ2ubSUU9AmGTTRS3OP6Wfe4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1320352',6.9,5690,'en','Nothing Personal','Alone in her empty flat, from her window Anne observes the people passing by who nervously snatch up the personal belongings and pieces of furniture she has put out on the pavement. Her final gesture of taking a ring off her finger signals she is leaving her previous life in Holland behind. She goes to Ireland, where she chooses to lead a solitary, wandering existence, striding through the austere landscapes of Connemara. During her travels, she discovers a house that is home to a hermit, Martin.','/4GavXEdItxmP51soWRPPMVRQweV.jpg','2009-08-14',85,'Released',NULL,'Nothing Personal',45806,1.9877,6.5,'PuNxINUR-R0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26405,_binary '\0','/yuXZXuS4RCTnCYScrRWBCNz2ywB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13204490',7.3,21258,'fr','Petite Maman','After the death of her beloved grandmother, eight-year-old Nelly meets a strangely familiar girl her own age in the woods. Instantly forming a connection with this mysterious new friend, Nelly embarks on a fantastical journey of discovery which helps her come to terms with this newfound loss.','/fMghdAE1eRk8PdpDftsA574zs0S.jpg','2021-06-02',72,'Released','Experience a fairytale of wonder and innocence.','Petite Maman',749004,5.1194,7.1,'AZx_-qk_Wzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26406,_binary '\0','/omHLKG9Q51tS0TlsiuJgw28D1uN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13205458',5.4,2735,'en','Float','Waverly thought she had her future figured out: she’d start her medical residency in Toronto after a summer visit to her parents in Taipei. When her plans suddenly change, she makes an impulsive detour to a small Canadian town where she meets local lifeguard Blake. After he saves her from nearly drowning at a beach party, Blake offers to teach Waverly to swim, and as the lessons continue, the two unexpectedly find themselves falling in love.','/nkTggTHd2N85aNU0fbHMlORCwkn.jpg','2024-02-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Float',895959,4.8428,6.7,'eCWnEaz1Oeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26407,_binary '\0','/sDKzptKHICLuoeP62AmdXztHmpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13206476',7.2,2915,'en','Christmas by Starlight','Annie, a lawyer, must help her loved ones this holiday season. Her family’s restaurant, The Starlight Café, is slated for demolition. The heir to the development firm responsible, William, makes her an unlikely proposition: he’ll spare the café if Annie spends the week “appearing” as the legal counsel his father is demanding he hire in the wake of some costly mistakes.','/zYIfYIz0FRSZKrgz7cuw0NKX0NC.jpg','2020-11-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas by Starlight',746045,1.8727,6.8,'eMmcptXvmNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26408,_binary '\0','/vrx9KIwXm7nxz49Fs9iTjPgxq7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13206564',8.1,2279,'es','Las tres muertes de Marisela Escobedo','After the death of her daughter at the hand of her boyfriend, Marisela Escobedo began to fight for justice not only against the murderer but also against the corrupt Mexican judicial system.','/4E7nNHIchHWzpETfwAERxFuviO6.jpg','2020-10-14',109,'Released',NULL,'The Three Deaths of Marisela Escobedo',753230,1.5062,8.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26409,_binary '\0','/lVp8amNsbz0rNOTcjeA3Z4Q8Vhd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13206926',7.7,13023,'ml','ജോജി','Joji, an engineering dropout and the youngest son of a rich family lives with his aspirations of becoming super wealthy. Driven by greed and blind ambition, he decides to execute his plans following an unexpected event in the family.','/iXAUPTb8XNSf5B4zyUAEajz2vFu.jpg','2021-04-07',113,'Released',NULL,'Joji',791779,1.3515,7.449,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26410,_binary '\0','/4iMURVQCxjyMH8Vr1Wd3GCsxE06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13207508',6.8,20209,'en','Swan Song','In the near future, Cameron Turner is diagnosed with a terminal illness. Presented with an experimental solution to shield his wife and son from grief, he grapples with altering their fate in this thought-provoking exploration of love, loss, and sacrifice.','/zzCdikGD9Qa5NT8lZtUv9dXNgsm.jpg','2021-12-17',112,'Released','A thought-provoking exploration of love, loss, and sacrifice.','Swan Song',765245,11.4234,7.112,'LxftqrrlSqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26411,_binary '\0','/zBIwWJUCSFlbFym7XF7TkKO3Tc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13209832',3.4,3920,'te','G-Zombie','Sara is a research student who wants to make an immunity booster to save humanity. Her experiment however turns people into zombies and in comes Dhruva to save the day.','/wkugO5QrnKB3sJsl41Gg913BCsD.jpg','2021-02-05',116,'Released',NULL,'G-Zombie',794362,0.8915,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26412,_binary '\0','/qSGq2RfFOp0skUt1keXJGNPRI9Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13210188',6.2,1296,'sr','Златни дечко','This is a story about Denis Marković, a young talented football player with a problematic temperament, who from an early age, due to his talent, became a target of various interests.','/eBMnecVpfzkTSAEgeLkcgyf3vq5.jpg','2022-01-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Golden Boy',855844,1.378,7.3,'CpSS_ZKU9xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26413,_binary '\0','/auBT5JgJEQjECGfC96JMmYQLpjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321509',5.7,57536,'en','Death at a Funeral','Aaron\'s father\'s funeral is today at the family home, and everything goes wrong: the funeral home delivers the wrong body, his cousin accidentally drugs her fiancé, and Aaron\'s successful younger brother, Ryan, flies in from New York, broke but arrogant. To top it all off, a mysterious stranger wants a word with Aaron.','/oBCQYMJTqV3qLjrvZ5sTZUCBky7.jpg','2010-04-15',92,'Released','This is one sad family.','Death at a Funeral',34803,7.9328,5.883,'LkbR3nQqcrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26414,_binary '\0','/uEJuqp08dH6IQwZJGASlPZOXqKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321510',7.2,56363,'en','In the Heights','The story of Usnavi, a bodega owner who has mixed feelings about closing his store and retiring to the Dominican Republic or staying in Washington Heights.','/lbf7wmrYRieR8fNFLnGiypMoPm1.jpg','2021-06-10',143,'Released','The time has come.','In the Heights',467909,8.4963,7.111,'FlY-HzJ0kno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26415,_binary '\0','/yl9waUJoMTp1NnraBn4KWHuUSsx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321511',5.8,85764,'en','Oldboy','A man has only three and a half days and limited resources to discover why he was imprisoned in a nondescript room for 20 years without any explanation.','/iX93YdBrZA1EpGbphmjf4ARj1Za.jpg','2013-11-14',104,'Released','Ask not why you were imprisoned. Ask why you were set free.','Oldboy',87516,12.2766,5.9,'jfJDAlMgRK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26416,_binary '\0','/vZ8sy9K4oT2Kmp5xNSmgCMRYC8g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13217988',6.6,1465,'fr','Couleurs de l\'incendie','February 1927. The funeral of Marcel Péricourt, the most powerful banker in Paris. His daughter Madeleine must take the helm of the financial empire of which she is the heiress. But she has a son, Paul, who with an unexpected and tragic gesture will place her on the path to ruin.','/fiAymbgADFKnJMu1NSJhLOvb4SM.jpg','2022-11-09',135,'Released',NULL,'The Colors of Fire',785980,3.0617,6.749,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26417,_binary '\0','/sCjTJ3R8UKmyd9dvMPLQ61nZIfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321860',6.6,52435,'en','The Beaver','Suffering from a severe case of depression, toy company CEO Walter Black begins using a beaver hand puppet to help him open up to his family. With his father seemingly going insane, adolescent son Porter pushes for his parents to get a divorce.','/nlaWgS7iIb6MG3t0FitV1xdPqIV.jpg','2011-05-05',91,'Released','He\'s here to save Walter\'s life.','The Beaver',50780,5.305,6.4,'DOSOWNS3jts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26418,_binary '\0','/oaQeKZDAUCao3Vf633pbxxQKZ01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321861',5,4650,'en','Carjacked','A single mom and her child are carjacked by a bank robber who has no intention of letting them go.','/bPwccod1wNQrC0aqq6nxr9qC3Sm.jpg','2011-11-22',89,'Released','It\'s her car. Don\'t tell her what to do with it.','Carjacked',72912,2.5312,5.1,'VOQqmHzVOPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26419,_binary '\0','/pjvnL6gwb1m6noRIipRDjrgn4gC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321862',4.8,1825,'en','Dino Time','Young daredevil Ernie, his sister Julia, and his best friend Max accidentally trip a time-machine into operation and find themselves transported back in time 65 million years, where they meet a T-rex named Tyra and her rambunctious son Dodger.','/pzOkddFfLexWtTozMMvPDUNe0AK.jpg','2012-12-07',85,'Released','3 kids accidentally travel 65 million years into the past, are taken in by a dinosaur and must receive a missing piece of their time machine to get home.','Dino Time',136793,4.723,6,'cnZ3y24qqks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26420,_binary '\0','/bHDQPPXx5hxkrg7oE9TJXrFHUSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321869',4.6,3611,'en','The Lovers','The Lovers is an epic romance time travel adventure film. Helmed by Roland Joffé from a story by Ajey Jhankar, the film is a sweeping tale of an impossible love set against the backdrop of the first Anglo-Maratha war across two time periods and continents and centred around four characters — a British officer in 18th century colonial India, the Indian woman he falls deeply in love with, an American present-day marine biologist and his wife.','/6esL8UH2sXXqbfbaV6bFEUBCDOr.jpg','2015-03-13',109,'Released','Love is longer than life.','The Lovers',79698,2.8258,4.8,'0sgAgzTmq0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26421,_binary '\0','/9LalKDfdttu9z8Ag1UKTTO66FzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1321870',6.7,230162,'en','Gangster Squad','Los Angeles, 1949. Ruthless, Brooklyn-born mob king Mickey Cohen runs the show in this town, reaping the ill-gotten gains from the drugs, the guns, the prostitutes and — if he has his way — every wire bet placed west of Chicago. And he does it all with the protection of not only his own paid goons, but also the police and the politicians who are under his control. It’s enough to intimidate even the bravest, street-hardened cop… except, perhaps, for the small, secret crew of LAPD outsiders led by Sgt. John O’Mara and Jerry Wooters who come together to try to tear Cohen’s world apart.','/wAuQNTBFBu2yXZsX6yLhUPiwTlW.jpg','2013-01-09',113,'Released','No names. No badges. No mercy.','Gangster Squad',82682,9.863,6.4,'LlbN5cQKZik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26422,_binary '\0','/nuVRH9RSiYorgo37PQKeFnF4Ac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322257',6.2,2175,'hi','Jhootha Hi Sahi','A suicidal woman\'s \"final\" call mistakenly connects her to a man who gives her something to live for.','/d3j20TIls5bKHgzc7d0XOGbx1QR.jpg','2010-10-22',142,'Released',NULL,'Jhootha Hi Sahi',48826,1.1137,4.773,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26423,_binary '\0','/svxDWCRGn4AWbOePNE5Fmdsjf6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322269',7.2,100518,'en','August: Osage County','An intense look at the lives of the strong-willed daughters of the Weston family, whose paths have diverged until a family crisis brings them back to the Midwest house they grew up in, and to the dysfunctional mother who raised them.','/fvjxr77dfxdIOY3lvj0bHP4B5xT.jpg','2013-12-26',121,'Released','Misery loves family','August: Osage County',152737,7.4539,6.9,'xd0qcN7sexI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26424,_binary '\0','/vBxyAfGXC5k05vMSJwwMTfW6iU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322277',6,1954,'pt','Besouro','Based on the life of a legendary capoeira fighter from Bahia, \"Besouro\" spins a fantastic tale of a young Brazilian man of African descent in search of his mission.','/Gx36iu3gOhNFx2nxzEv1ffncmx.jpg','2009-10-30',94,'Released',NULL,'The Assailant',23854,1.412,6,'ghmo7_5A8U8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26425,_binary '\0','/fJOQ4kKnOef2ZonFmj3ittMms9H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322302',6.7,1311,'es','La hora cero','The Zero Hour tells the story of the La Parca (Zapata 666), a fearsome assassin who is forced to kidnap a private clinic to save the love of his life, Ladydi (Amanda Key). They soonreached the police and a media circus with them, who make our character into a national hero.La Parca finds that saving the life of Ladydi be difficult, but escaped with his followers will be an almost impossible task. Time starts to run out, and what seemed like a perfect plan will end in a frantic ending where La Parca is forced to confront past mistakes, and discover that their worst enemies are closer than he imagined.','/5YTFACNWVGaJSevR5mPU2UyEwnQ.jpg','2010-10-08',102,'Released',NULL,'The Zero Hour',89495,1.279,7.8,'7XLYi0eKToY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26426,_binary '\0','/cDD8be3mZkungkbDfHHR94UGYJX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322306',4.9,3893,'en','Exorcismus','Fifteen-year-old Emma Evans is like any other teenage girl; she thinks that her parents don\'t understand her. She longs for independence and a life free of family ties and responsibilities and she is prepared to do anything to achieve it. But one day she will be forced to face up to the consequences of her actions.Life seems to be carrying on as normal, until one day Emma starts experiencing frightening fits. Her parents are convinced that her problems are either medical or psychological, but when doctors\' tests are unable to draw any conclusions, the family is forced to look elsewhere for answers.It all started off as a bit of fun, Emma never really believed it, but the truth is there is something dark and sinister within her, and it won\'t take long to surface.','/9mNSRW05Y80iS9HdwvP5SIq4oL5.jpg','2010-12-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Exorcismus',63727,1.6621,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26427,_binary '\0','/yIG329hXOMJq1O1O2ubd9xoweHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322312',6.3,61758,'en','Going the Distance','Erin and Garrett are very much in love. When Erin moves to San Francisco to finish her journalism degree and Garrett stays behind in New York to work in the music industry, they gamely keep the romance alive with webcams and frequent-flyer miles. But just when it seems the lovers will soon be reunited, they each score a big break that could separate them for good.','/tTllmSew3nsizpzWNWKUkOuANhm.jpg','2010-08-27',102,'Released','A comedy about meeting each other halfway.','Going the Distance',38073,7.868,6.1,'1PHW-pyURHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26428,_binary '\0','/vGO6RbAPmArIY6FyAOGS8sPJQJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322313',6.9,1519,'en','Sunshine Superman','Documentary portrait of Carl Boenish, the father of the BASE jumping movement, whose early passion for skydiving led him to ever more spectacular -and dangerous- feats of foot-launched human flight.','/hCfe6xbM3dcV5AYTL5KQn8AUKRD.jpg','2015-05-22',100,'Released','If there are mountains let\'s climb them. If there are buildings let\'s jump off them.','Sunshine Superman',292081,1.8028,6.5,'3CsJW3_NqJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26429,_binary '\0','/lEXW3KduZdWTIPx8ExVPxCMX51M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322315',6.6,2459,'da','Headhunter','Martin Vinge, former notorious journalist, now successful headhunter with a complicated personal life, is in all confidentiality contacted by 85 year-old N.F. Sieger, S.E.O. of Denmark\'s largest shipping company and oil empire. Sieger hires Martin to find an alternative heir to the firm instead of his son, Daniel Sieger, who for a long time has been destined to take the company into the next era. Martin starts coming up with suitable names for the position, but discovers that he has actually been entangled in a larger impenetrable power game aimed at deciding what is really going to happen to the company; a brutal power struggle that puts an intense pressure on Martin and his private life and relationships.','/lRNSpYo7CVeJS8NravoByjJqFxy.jpg','2009-08-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Headhunter',20458,2.0722,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26430,_binary '\0','/lCGCJAcmjkaF7uw5UHFwHAOzMVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13223248',4.8,4927,'en','Az Amazonas Királynője - Queen of the Amazon','A dream vacation of a lifetime quickly turns into a hijacking, endangering passengers and crew, on a boat journey down the Amazon River and into the Brazilian rainforest. Desperate criminals storm aboard, pursuing a lost fortune in the jungle. Now under threat, and with food and fuel running low, the once idealistic tourists - now hostages - must use all their ingenuity as their Amazon cruise becomes a descent into a desperate struggle for survival.','/mxv5a2hv5g9WlflAgy5ObqxSve1.jpg','2021-05-06',88,'Released',NULL,'Amazon Queen',855594,1.3754,4.4,'yVFECNGg34A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26431,_binary '\0','/cb1EgHUV2OW988cEunXm7Px4OhT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322333',6.1,8851,'fr','Largo Winch II','Propelled to the head of the W Group after the death of his adoptive father, Largo Winch decides, to everyone\'s surprise, to sell it, and use the proceeds to create an ambitious humanitarian foundation. But on the very same day, he finds himself accused of crimes against humanity by a mysterious witness. To prove his innocence, Largo will have to retrace the steps of his past life, in the heart of the Burmese jungle.','/cS7v9W2OeOQFkTWA9PbeTrXoCEy.jpg','2011-02-16',119,'Released','The Burma Conspiracy','Largo Winch II',57331,3.9802,5.821,'xjJLhYYGhAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26432,_binary '\0','/pz7bGOUNJXyPKJ2GcJN6nhwBnCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13223398',5.6,49278,'en','Beast','A recently widowed man and his two teenage daughters travel to a game reserve in South Africa. However, their journey of healing soon turns into a fight for survival when a bloodthirsty lion starts to stalk them.','/f18rGcLlawKjNC5KRh36S0mvRlY.jpg','2022-08-11',93,'Released','Fight for family.','Beast',760741,7.8832,6.531,'oQMc7Sq36mI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26433,_binary '\0','/wotYdr0wMwPvh4c3n3rmcA4y0gh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322355',4.4,1306,'sv','Psalm 21','Henrik is a young father who lives in Stockholm, constantly plagued by nightmares with his deceased mother. One day, he receives the news that his father, father, who lives in a remote village, it is drowned and died. The circumstances of drowning are mysterious. Henrik travels to the village to investigate the cause of his death. To find out more about the drowning and on his father, the door to the unknown and open. Shadows of the past emerge, returning to this world for one reason only: revenge.','/EdeBWIPqu2mDCNU28KHoAluswN.jpg','2009-09-22',114,'Released',NULL,'Psalm 21',56685,0.9998,3.8,'h3Me0CE_TUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26434,_binary '\0','/5N0TkirfreQ5PM5rpSVOTq0OO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322385',7.5,12615,'da','Submarino','As children, Nick and his little brother take care of their baby brother while their mother drinks herself senseless. But the baby dies, and both brothers blame themselves. Many years later, Nick is out of prison after serving time for an assault. He drinks, lives in a shelter and tries to help an old friend. When their mother dies, Nick meets his brother at the funeral. The brother, who remains nameless, is a single father to a young boy, but also supports a drug habit that is spiraling out of control. When an opportunity presents itself, he becomes a drug dealer to secure his son\'s future. Eventually, the two brothers meet again.','/kzkQqjphmXSMoJjxOGcDitPhjAs.jpg','2010-03-25',115,'Released','Two brothers meet at their mother\'s funeral, each in his way on a path of self-destruction, both haunted by a tragedy in their youth.','Submarino',46789,1.5966,7.082,'RXQsSStHI5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26435,_binary '\0','/o5oQ0y2jBoXYjFGeQcjKwo8UkN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1322930',6.8,26255,'tr','Issız Adam','Alper is a renowned chef in his 30s at his own luxury restaurant. He lives an isolated life and spends his nights with one-night stands and paid intercourses. One day, his life changes utterly when his path crosses with Ada and gets enamored by her casual and modest outlook at life. As they start to get romantically involved, Alper must also overcome his chronic feeling of desolateness.','/pXnyp80KoNa9iW2v6HHCAk0bWCd.jpg','2008-11-07',113,'Released','You lay down on my knee, I told you a story and you grew up.','Alone',27952,2.3891,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26436,_binary '\0','/dtXcuwF1uUi9m0VVfEGEa7GpDzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13229894',7.1,30745,'es','Los renglones torcidos de Dios','Alice Gould, a private investigator, pretends to be mentally ill in order to enter a psychiatric hospital and gather evidence for the case she is working on: the death of a patient in unclear circumstances.','/n3X9tWYFYfE96BoNgtVffuwzQo.jpg','2022-10-06',155,'Released',NULL,'God\'s Crooked Lines',890980,5.2291,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26437,_binary '\0','/oVSZkUVVeOca7A1bkChQuZiF3AM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323044',4.4,1798,'en','Freeloaders','Slackers who live for free in a rock star\'s mansion find that their ride on the gravy train is coming to an end with the sale of their pal\'s residence.','/weO3PVaswSjXKtkHFCswC0D6tEl.jpg','2012-12-18',77,'Released','Living on easy street just got a little harder.','Freeloaders',121147,1.5657,4.6,'CaQeV9BtOes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26438,_binary '\0','/vD1yKObsRS2cvpmtuaCaMhr4zxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323045',6.2,88219,'en','Frozen','When three skiers find themselves stranded on a chair lift at a New England ski resort that has closed for the next week, they are forced to make life or death choices that prove to be more perilous than staying put and freezing to death.','/2J3URUnDrIpNvh0uVqINQvr4HhW.jpg','2010-02-05',94,'Released','No one knows you\'re up there.','Frozen',44363,6.7999,6.017,'5cZPZ7dwvZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26439,_binary '\0','/y2fxmO7IUV9YXvoUhFppwGcUTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13231544',7.7,20181,'tr','Kuru Otlar Üstüne','A young art teacher hopes to be transferred to Istanbul after completing his mandatory duty in a remote village school in Anatolia. After accusations of inappropriate contact with a student surface, his hopes of escape fade and he descends further into an existential crisis.','/mUFpdQSFAch1fMUb9MqHoESpmLS.jpg','2023-07-12',197,'Released',NULL,'About Dry Grasses',665733,3.6149,7.7,'WI1QH2R6c6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26440,_binary '\0','/cFFY6G19LeotX0SuUhvzja3CQZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13232552',5.4,3035,'en','The Man in the White Van','In early 1970s Florida, an ominous white van stalks young women. A teenage girl is the latest victim, but this one won\'t stay a victim.','/A98LHlo4wvgV3d79IovLhL0KSL5.jpg','2024-12-13',105,'Released','The horror a nation learned to fear.','The Man in the White Van',877087,3.1663,6.2,'ztQZYF0E0AY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26441,_binary '\0','/ndF2AJD3toBpZHM6CufJjZfwZkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13234058',6,18781,'en','My Son','When a man\'s only son goes missing, he travels to the town where his ex-wife lives in search of answers. [To play a man whose life is clouded by mystery, McAvoy will not be given a script of dialogue.]','/jrnCkZnktMTNYOEN5uo63nKKKHN.jpg','2021-09-23',95,'Released','A groundbreaking achievement in filmmaking where both actor and audience uncover a mystery at the same time.','My Son',750253,4.8028,6.1,'dJepaS1VqIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26442,_binary '\0','/8DHvtmF15wGwkMOW3nqZmpEzEaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13235822',4.7,11779,'en','Umma','Amanda and her daughter live a quiet life on an American farm, but when the remains of her estranged mother arrive from Korea, Amanda becomes haunted by the fear of turning into her own mother.','/moLnqJmZ00i2opS0bzCVcaGC0iI.jpg','2022-03-18',83,'Released','A mother\'s love never dies','Umma',751237,3.6485,5.273,'QQdXvvtu-iI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26443,_binary '\0','/2XSeKDmIa2KxaiJy4J9e8FrIZhk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323594',7.6,640915,'en','Despicable Me','Determined to prove he\'s the world\'s greatest supervillain, Gru hatches an audacious plan to steal the Moon. To pull it off, he adopts three orphaned girls—Margo, Edith, and Agnes—intending to use them as pawns in his scheme. But the unexpected bond they form forces him to question the criminal life he\'s always known.','/b1BT309QWjtFUlJPLmXmrcHOWEL.jpg','2010-07-08',95,'Released','Superbad. Superdad.','Despicable Me',20352,60.5365,7.3,'DsiayV5LuD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26444,_binary '\0','/pmkvTr5haxf77zzkMpHQJnzhQg2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323605',6,5543,'en','Suck','The film follows a petty rock band called the Winners, consisting of vocalist Joey Winner, bassist Jennifer, guitarist Tyler, drummer Sam, and French-Canadian roadie Hugo, along with their sleazy manager Jeff, as they tour across Canada and the USA after Jennifer is turned into a vampire by Queeny. Meanwhile, a vampire hunter who is afraid of the dark named Eddie Van Helsing quickly chases them down.','/23cE4h55B8fgtt0XiQZZNWE3RfH.jpg','2009-09-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Suck',44028,2.8254,6.1,'GHvA86OUsxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26445,_binary '\0','/q9ZLjqti3UTt5ZC3qQMZhRNueGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13236566',5.9,14119,'en','Operation Christmas Drop','While gathering evidence to support closing a tropical U.S. Air Force base, a congressional aide warms to its generous captain.','/1fUcKFDy58DhWYd5Y7Nu5DgpxaE.jpg','2020-11-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Operation Christmas Drop',738646,3.1562,6.4,'JTHWAQG6Gxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26446,_binary '\0','/twN87vhUMr0cf6psAcSTokHA4K3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13238110',7.1,2514,'tr','Çatlak','Migrant workers working in the UK as Fatih Ayhan still running mate in the UK, has received large amounts of debt to send to his family in Turkey. The payment of this debt even after Fatih\'s return to Turkey will be requested during a visit to the family by Ayhan from Turkey. Claiming this debt ignites a wick within the family that lives in the same building and with intertwined economic interests. All clashes between family members come to the fore.','/jQjkRO7iy4AAUXrDiCZfYNamkyF.jpg','2020-10-09',82,'Released',NULL,'Fractured',745518,0.8632,6.895,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26447,_binary '\0','/7HR38hMBl23lf38MAN63y4pKsHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13238346',7.8,177980,'en','Past Lives','After decades apart, childhood friends Nora and Hae Sung are reunited in New York for one fateful weekend as they confront notions of destiny, love, and the choices that make a life.','/k3waqVXSnvCZWfJYNtdamTgTtTA.jpg','2023-06-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Past Lives',666277,18.8291,7.698,'kA244xewjcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26448,_binary '\0','/nlfWocRL1KUVNOK7vH7Ld1vW9sn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323946',3.6,2306,'en','Pulse 3','Seven years after the last attack by the \"soulless ghosts\" who haunted the human race twice before, the world is left void of all deadly electronics that almost destroyed it... or so we thought. Living a primitive existence on the outskirts of the city, human survivors are surviving without any trace of technology. That is until 16 year old Justine enters the city and, letting her curiosity get the best of her, opens a working laptop and unknowingly unleashes the most terrifying attack the survivors have ever faced. In a world already torn and without hope, can humanity make it through the toughest struggle of all time?','/mBETskWqWuaqniogjdBqTMDNZ2z.jpg','2008-12-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Pulse 3',14255,1.9944,4.6,'40rqOSTse1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26449,_binary '\0','/3G8dPy3q6qfEW2o4CCB3gDk2qJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1323973',6.3,7632,'en','The Trials of Cate McCall','In order to be reinstated to the bar and recover custody of her daughter, a hotshot lawyer, now in recovery and on probation, must take on the appeal of a woman wrongfully convicted of murder.','/2u9raM4MWJTtGVQ7MeYwfgGouRl.jpg','2013-11-28',89,'Released','They had the power. She had the truth.','The Trials of Cate McCall',253279,4.4385,6.4,'YcZ2ANo2ICI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26450,_binary '\0','/d7sOZ1nP1Ac1cgwAiqzBl0s9gjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1324027',7.8,4281,'en','Trailer Park Boys: Say Goodnight to the Bad Guys','\"Say goodnight to the bad guys\" picks up where \"A Sh*t river runs through it\" left off. it\'s a year after the events of A.S.R.R.T.I and Ricky, Julian, and bubbles are rich with cash, but Julian sits on the money for a year claiming \"movies like casino prove that waving money around right away is a bad idea.\" and then hides it in his newly purchased Delorean (AKA car from back to the future)','/nznQFidJnm9SBMs5MMaQ1APG9Fl.jpg','2008-12-07',60,'Released',NULL,'Trailer Park Boys: Say Goodnight to the Bad Guys',26461,1.8239,7,'cFwp5_MZhGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26451,_binary '\0','/osjuwnDnIGW0MpHJgcSRBUjPsZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1324055',6.9,4656,'pl','Młyn i krzyż','What would it be like to step inside a great work of art, have it come alive around you, and even observe the artist as he sketches the very reality you are experiencing? From Lech Majewski, one of Poland\'s most acclaimed filmmakers, The Mill and the Cross is a cinematic re-staging of Pieter Bruegel\'s masterpiece \"Procession to Calvary,\" presented alongside the story of its creation.','/3IKLkxxXf38C2hY9ONi6Lvlz1qM.jpg','2011-03-18',96,'Released','Behind every great painting lies an even greater story','The Mill and the Cross',57829,1.506,6.4,'qzbbYinuTWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26452,_binary '\0','/bYlQaqn0eZGtYjzPyKHDn2QXDVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1324059',7.6,37897,'hi','Wake Up Sid','Wake Up Sid! is the story of a lazy Mumbai college student who does absolutely nothing, with a turn of events will Sid realize his potential in this world and become a success in the fast-paced life of Mumbai.','/1UpgW67W6Do0xizTuE26bMQFLdL.jpg','2009-10-02',138,'Released',NULL,'Wake Up Sid',21297,1.7541,7.2,'uB599LrV6AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26453,_binary '\0','/lIep6EZBihZouFiMcoAcNJj5OcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1324061',6.8,1701,'sr','Žena sa slomljenim nosem','The act of a woman with a broken nose, who suddenly jumps out of a taxi and throws herself off the bridge in Belgrade, connects the lives of three witnesses.','/ayw8nUC7KCRN2KFdnbFKSbufxqu.jpg','2010-09-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Woman with a Broken Nose',70745,2.1278,5,'UmLleN2LV7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26454,_binary '\0','/342kJg1LOL76vRp62GUQ5FLAZUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13240610',4.6,2448,'en','Night of the Tommyknockers','When miners blast for gold in the 1870\'s, they accidentally release ancient creatures known as Tommyknockers. The Town of Deer Creek, Nevada is soon under siege with only a handful of survivors held up in the local saloon.','/tsjkYkj9SJPD5iE8AYIBROYpzrE.jpg','2022-11-25',86,'Released','When the sun goes down, they come out.','Night of the Tommyknockers',926682,1.6998,4,'MCIdUR4N7iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26455,_binary '\0','/i93kbAebUkD6rxJZ3WAbgmylnbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13242960',7.5,4324,'te','మిడిల్ క్లాస్ మెలోడీస్','Raghava, who runs a breakfast center in his village, dreams of starting a small hotel in the city. Against his father\'s wishes, he plans to buy an old shop with his friend Gopal. The shop happens to be owned by Nageswara Rao, father of his love interest Sandhya. How will Raghava\'s love life and his dream to establish his own hotel clash?','/6pMz4FDeoIbomupYYLFAsAy2D4q.jpg','2020-11-20',135,'Released',NULL,'Middle Class Melodies',765718,1.5495,6.9,'P2_890jLOyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26456,_binary '\0','/gLjEkJ2rJQUbvogE4bBXak4kZXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13243610',6.4,1330,'en','Meet Me at Christmas','When Joan’s son’s wedding planner unexpectedly quits, she must coordinate his Christmas Eve wedding with the help of Beau, the bride’s uncle. As they work alongside each other they discover their fates and pasts are intertwined.','/wNFUuf9y9nOUFeRIcepAoLluQdX.jpg','2020-11-14',84,'Released',NULL,'Meet Me at Christmas',746459,1.7649,5.9,'8UDDSuvY3VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26457,_binary '\0','/lrUIf0OvOQpARAiLAQg1WVkcrUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13243898',8.2,6364,'en','The Mole: Undercover in North Korea','A real-life undercover thriller about two ordinary men who embark on an outrageously dangerous ten-year mission to penetrate the world\'s most secretive and brutal dictatorship: North Korea.','/mA76drf6b9UdtbIJDBU5hci8QPu.jpg','2020-10-11',123,'Released',NULL,'The Mole: Undercover in North Korea',751490,1.9736,7.1,'X9lb7LOym7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26458,_binary '\0','/qsNMA46KZVzcJnT89bfedOJcpik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13245502',7.2,4309,'te','DJ టిల్లు','When a local DJ and his affair with a young woman put him square in the middle of a crime, he must do his best to get out of the predicament he’s in.','/u2PY7lj58h9JngHgoVgSuqswgPH.jpg','2022-02-11',124,'Released','Atluntadhi Manathoni','DJ Tillu',937036,1.5538,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26459,_binary '\0','/ief30zvjRpZkVof0Mpz0TVvKURv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13246926',6.4,1774,'en','Unlocking Christmas','When a mysterious key and a holiday riddle arrive on their doorsteps, Kate and Kevin embark on a Christmas romance adventure they’ll never forget.','/gFhoJx9JJBea5ADYqCAC1WkMBlD.jpg','2020-12-13',84,'Released',NULL,'Unlocking Christmas',746476,1.9013,6.9,'6OJO6Xhrrhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26460,_binary '\0','/cidPXLFO3M2B7XqS1NSEQWmEFBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13247118',8,1708,'te','Missing','Newly married couple Gowtham and Sruthi meet with an accident one night and Sruthi goes missing. Gowtham with the help of his friends and Meena, decides to track down the four men he believes are responsible. .','/qaUA4IrgBVWtsiz0IR1uMJ5HYLl.jpg','2021-11-19',133,'Released','Search Vs Revenge','Missing',899331,1.5111,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26461,_binary '\0','/5qmj7Nbbr6OoxmFuq7lMhX3i02t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13249198',7.4,2211,'te','రాజ రాజ చోర','Bhaskar\'s wife thinks he is a stationery store worker, his girlfriend thinks he is a software engineer but no one knows he is also a burglar. His royal pains start when his tangled web of lies involving a hopeful girlfriend, a blackmailing wife, and a cheating cop all collide. Bhaskar\'s one last heist might just land him in a gilded cage of his own making.','/3gCWjvOPjDImjyU2cbW8L9eDbCW.jpg','2021-08-19',149,'Released',NULL,'Raja Raja Chora',802735,0.7395,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26462,_binary '\0','/oQMqMLIJXZAVMplga9RhDyZInAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13249596',5.9,15211,'en','Father of the Bride','A father comes to grips with his daughter’s upcoming wedding through the prism of multiple relationships within a big, sprawling Cuban-American family.','/chKMG9tzFqSkj24ejXTio156Qo0.jpg','2022-07-21',118,'Released','Love is simple. Family is not.','Father of the Bride',746419,6.7125,6.3,'Iwm0IO-NFRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26463,_binary '\0','/iPqoeXEfByDN399PQQ42IJHV2kN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1324999',5,276920,'en','The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 1','Bella Swan and Edward Cullen\'s honeymoon phase is abruptly disrupted by betrayals and unforeseen tragedies that endanger their world.','/qs8LsHKYlVRmJbFUiSUhhRAygwj.jpg','2011-11-16',117,'Released','Forever is just the beginning.','The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 1',50619,20.4788,6.185,'PQNLfo-SOR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26464,_binary '\0','/yiWfT2Bl1Nul3Xie39Ahs3FqSjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1325004',5.1,285764,'en','The Twilight Saga: Eclipse','Bella once again finds herself surrounded by danger as Seattle is ravaged by a string of mysterious killings and a malicious vampire continues her quest for revenge. In the midst of it all, she is forced to choose between her love for Edward and her friendship with Jacob, knowing that her decision has the potential to ignite the ageless struggle between vampire and werewolf. With her graduation quickly approaching, Bella is confronted with the most important decision of her life.','/dK4Gi1UdMiHzHc7r7CZQG4IQ9Sr.jpg','2010-06-23',124,'Released','It all begins... with a choice.','The Twilight Saga: Eclipse',24021,15.7693,6.186,'hZxJzhIPTTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26465,_binary '\0','/ef2jb3B7I8MVHFjHo3BnjAcSncr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1325014',6.5,5034,'en','The People vs. George Lucas','The passion the original Star Wars trilogy inspires in its fans is unparalleled; but when it comes to George Lucas himself, many have found their ardor has cooled into a complicated love-hate relationship. This hilarious, heartfelt documentary delves deep into Lucas’s cultural legacy, asking all the tough questions. Has Lucas betrayed his masterwork? Should he just have left the original trilogy alone? Is The Phantom Menace so bad it should carry a health warning? Utilizing interviews taken from over 600 hours of footage, and peppered with extraordinary Star Wars and Indiana Jones recreations lovingly immortalized in song, needlepoint, Lego, claymation, puppets and paper-mâché, above all this film asks the question: who truly owns that galaxy far, far away—the man who created it, or the fans who worship it?','/4vv7roShhYsFSp8xoCtzJYk8zD0.jpg','2010-03-14',93,'Released','They gave him their love, their money and their online parodies. He gave them... the prequels.','The People vs. George Lucas',75311,2.3753,6.4,'onhNEGVGHFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26466,_binary '\0','/5d6Gnj2u26RRE0H4mnyhU8Ckrxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13256400',5.8,2149,'ml','കനകം കാമിനി കലഹം','As Pavithran and Haripriya\'s marriage withers away, he plans a trip to bring things back on track. But his marital bliss is threatened by a bunch of nutjobs.','/iZJfmpm8NuTN631npCv0cIPyvlR.jpg','2021-11-12',121,'Released',NULL,'Kanakam Kaamini Kalaham',851743,0.8461,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26467,_binary '\0','/jcaja6PTsXtHIhf94I7CW5rDIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1325723',4.7,4822,'en','Choose','Fiona Wagner, a journalism student, tracks a cold-blooded killer with the help of her detective father and a therapist.','/4W4plHfj4GN40HOdZPplPLSEiUi.jpg','2011-01-17',83,'Released','Who Lives? Who Dies? Are You Ready to Choose?','Choose',54075,2.3493,4.5,'BhuwGbLz30U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26468,_binary '\0','/4VxzOyioe4VDEKjDIwhgml0JkWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13259610',3.8,5583,'en','The Outwaters','Deep in the Mojave desert, under a scorching blood-red sun, four travelers have set up camp to make art. One fateful night, the group is thrust into a feverish tornado of flayed flesh and mind-boggling monstrosities, the likes of which mere humans simply cannot fathom.','/81SNcKfobpYtPzbPEKIqutRMU6i.jpg','2023-02-09',110,'Released','Close your eyes. We dare you.','The Outwaters',752867,1.6796,4.4,'v6Du7TvNqvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26469,_binary '\0','/eo6pahstCYRUm0Lk4MORmfCs2SH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13260836',7.1,2121,'en','Angela\'s Christmas Wish','A determined Angela makes a wish to reunite her family in time for Christmas, then launches a plan to find her way from Ireland to Australia.','/8ftutOnMM5JHl69mvkNbs8f1AUR.jpg','2020-12-01',48,'Released',NULL,'Angela\'s Christmas Wish',752455,3.1538,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26470,_binary '\0','/4Yo4DW50ZNymxMUAwlASZwr1Ia5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1326194',6.8,1241,'en','Beer Wars','In America, size matters. The bigger you are, the more power you have, especially in the business world. Anat Baron takes you on a no holds barred exploration of the U.S. beer industry that ultimately reveals the truth behind the label of your favorite beer. Told from an insider’s perspective, the film goes behind the scenes of the daily battles and all out wars that dominate the industry.','/qNVZotUv3o6sG2dTQZT52K2NqOo.jpg','2009-04-16',89,'Released',NULL,'Beer Wars',19837,1.8952,6.4,'uY-Bg5Odi0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26471,_binary '\0','/6BOfQURcGKJHkCpC8kiMygMlQTJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1326238',6,2440,'en','Backlight','Several characters who are each at critical stages of their lives are strangely impelled towards an uncharted lake in the middle of the desert where they all have the opportunity to save each other.','/d0u8ecPEgfMuDDmZRu1uo9lpBAI.jpg','2010-07-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Backlight',59392,2.4864,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26472,_binary '\0','/h1UW6daoKBn86mMXG1E0ejc6Xoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13265204',5.1,1509,'fr','Metamorphosis','Seeking refuge on an island in Upstate New York, a married couple\'s final attempt to salvage their failing relationship takes a turn for the worse when the husband begins to regress emotionally, mentally, and physically.','/zxdFoFQA710sxYzwucbvjQGFmI4.jpg','2022-05-09',82,'Released',NULL,'Metamorphosis',980478,1.9,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26473,_binary '\0','/4gKxQIW91hOTELjY5lzjMbLoGxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13265876',3,7300,'en','Apex','Ex-cop Thomas Malone is serving a life sentence for a crime he didn’t commit. He is offered a chance at freedom if he can survive a deadly game of Apex, in which six hunters pay for the pleasure of hunting another human on a remote island. He accepts, and once he arrives, all hell breaks loose.','/chTkFGToW5bsyw3hgLAe4S5Gt3.jpg','2021-11-12',93,'Released','The hunters will be hunted.','Apex',763164,5,5.117,'Pompk1znaIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26474,_binary '\0','/MMuVHuGhDpxkX6SjYsHKdco0Wi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13266998',6.5,11271,'en','Bull','Ten years after he was last seen, a vicious mob enforcer returns home to find his son and methodically track down the gang that double-crossed him. His quest for revenge soon leads to a savage showdown between his wife and her mob boss father.','/oapxWncDc5ztrge3ycpvaZIMcf3.jpg','2021-11-05',87,'Released',NULL,'Bull',821792,2.9489,6.5,'IlQ4owX-jgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26475,_binary '\0','/vaOSSxnkr6ecBFAqwHKBrrk6BIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13267034',6.4,1465,'en','The Christmas Ring','A reporter searches for the love story behind an antique engagement ring. With the help of the ring’s owner’s grandson, they learn the legacy his grandparent’s left behind.','/qG6kfgzZyekumMjM9oxRNNIeYoL.jpg','2020-11-07',90,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Ring',746035,1.3735,6.6,'wKat2iMHRz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26476,_binary '\0','/a24TgwUmerOq55PgMpYcYlXQw8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1326733',7.5,2581,'en','The Art of the Steal','A gripping tale of intrigue and mystery in the art world, this film traces the history of a collection of Post-Impressionist paintings - worth billions - which became the subject of a power struggle after the death of its owner. Dr. Albert Barnes.','/1zK8dAd8cP92AMAHXoIvewwX7BI.jpg','2010-02-26',101,'Released','The true story of a multi-billion dollar art heist and how they got away with it.','The Art of the Steal',41999,1.1513,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26477,_binary '\0','/vDR2h5uQNgWyx3fsEVnEOcNFibZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13269536',6.3,19602,'en','Girl in the Basement','Sara is a teen girl who is looking forward to her 18th birthday to move away from her controlling father Don. But before she could even blow out the candles, Don imprisons her in the basement of their home.','/tPP9n6r5QrIKPnshnJqE7klptj2.jpg','2021-02-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Girl in the Basement',801335,16.6409,7.6,'a7VGn_0Vsx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26478,_binary '\0','/gr2KgfjOfCA4lxCH7yk5bgPIMkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13269580',7.4,7532,'fr','À plein temps','Julie finally gets an interview for a job where she can raise her children better only to run into a national transit strike.','/nH6MyOu4wdHnI3Im7PtpaqVRGQB.jpg','2022-03-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Full Time',833417,2.7196,7.019,'ax65fImmTyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26479,_binary '\0','/4PKfa0zltSrp1BJoLl8zfvYXaac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13269670',6.8,4916,'zh','新神榜：哪吒重生','While living as an ordinary deliveryman and motor racing fan, Nezha encounters old nemeses and must rediscover his powers to protect his loved ones.','/np4ScPY04HESKBbpexwstKsipKe.jpg','2021-02-06',117,'Released','Rebirth of a hero','New Gods: Nezha Reborn',663558,5.3065,8,'G0qiLpWdm5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26480,_binary '\0','/taC4SMRB4UUbXL9R4680aJ4ejQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1326972',7.5,26654,'zh','赤壁：決戰天下','The battle of Red Cliff continues and the alliance between Xu and East Wu is fracturing. With Cao Cao\'s massive forces on their doorstep, will the kingdoms of Xu and East Wu survive?','/4sZc0Fx5ECBDwDswKA0zsmh7o1n.jpg','2009-01-07',141,'Released','Destiny Lies In The Wind.','Red Cliff II',15384,5.673,7.282,'pd0bqLQrtdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26481,_binary '\0','/cPEH4ZvpYIy4oGN4L44T2Lk92DC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327035',7.9,34749,'hi','देव .डी','Dev, after spurning his childhood love Paro due to a misunderstanding, turns to drugs and alcohol for solace. Paro moves on but Dev remains in remorse. He then meets Chanda, an escort navigating her own past trauma, but Dev’s chauvinistic attitude and penchant for self-destruction stands in the way of their developing bond.','/krqfEEpvK31en2s7GpyGPmYt8r3.jpg','2009-02-06',144,'Released','Get Ready for Emotional Atyachar','Dev.D',15977,1.4506,7,'ATZB8mwU3M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26482,_binary '\0','/sT0c22syDUXXz85Gg0E7dzZzCaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13270424',6.7,10465,'en','Brian and Charles','An endearing outlier, Brian lives alone in a Welsh valley, inventing oddball contraptions that seldom work. After finding a discarded mannequin head, Brian gets an idea. Three days, a washing machine, and sundry spare parts later, he’s invented Charles, an artificially intelligent robot who learns English from a dictionary and proves a charming, cheeky companion. Before long, however, Charles also develops autonomy. Intrigued by the wider world — or whatever lies beyond the cottage where Brian has hidden him away — Charles craves adventure.','/pzP3N9qRo3S91QjfBFWNI0ph0AY.jpg','2022-06-17',91,'Released','Some friendships are built to last.','Brian and Charles',913814,2.387,6.3,'_JfWZd4CtIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26483,_binary '\0','/zGZpy2u5yRczyRMOlNTEm8vJMCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327194',6.4,119131,'en','The Lucky One','A Marine travels to Louisiana after serving three tours in Iraq and searches for the unknown woman he believes was his good luck charm during the war.','/vF1ZuIkF9Z71VzVvG265xJUawb0.jpg','2012-04-19',101,'Released',NULL,'The Lucky One',77877,10.4722,7.2,'gJAMYJkA2Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26484,_binary '\0','/z2Gg2BYtSRIus2a1RUkmKTQz6Gs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327200',4.6,2843,'en','The Reeds','A weekend boating party turns into a nightmare for a group of young Londoners when they stumble upon a terrifying secret hidden in the reeds.','/sxw59MhBv0p6WXkm9Iz8VYyeG28.jpg','2010-01-29',90,'Released','Sometimes they play tricks on you','The Reeds',35197,1.1229,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26485,_binary '\0','/n9gE9CmUIKBIB4fKbQV1ulX4nV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13273172',7.7,2389,'ko','담보','A debt collector who looks intimidating, but actually has a warm heart, ends up becoming the guardian of a child, who has been left behind as collateral by her illegal immigrant mother.','/nNgeb1Jy18azKKDcUUdh1Hhkjbr.jpg','2020-09-29',113,'Released','The money or your kid!','Pawn',589174,3.5547,8.338,'ylq5mKnv07Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26486,_binary '\0','/k7rxfxdroEsfzHx3P3ADYx2xm6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13273702',5.7,3261,'en','Too Close for Christmas','When Hayley accepts an invitation to spend Christmas with her sister’s new in-laws, her seemingly perfect holiday takes a turn when Paul, Hayley\'s brother-in-law\'s brother, unexpectedly shows up. Still harboring a grudge against Paul for ending her last relationship, Hayley reluctantly spends time with Paul and slowly realizes she may have been too quick a judge on Paul','/2UhfvaHjccA9BfBJfAt6OBDf8zl.jpg','2020-11-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Too Close for Christmas',764104,2.7344,5.9,'H1wARdDfJGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26487,_binary '\0','/65m6t44CM85668zjy8pCsdc0Ow5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13273728',5.6,3510,'en','An Autumn Romance','When librarian Taylor Harris suddenly loses her job, she decides to visit her brother in a small town in Montana. There, she gets involved in the fight to help save her brother\'s hotel from tycoon Joel Sheenan, who wants to renovate it.','/wvJzRrdivLX3QYoG0UHQhA5QOyV.jpg','2021-05-07',88,'Released',NULL,'An Autumn Romance',810223,5.6999,7.088,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26488,_binary '\0','/y91SQ471zKci9vhRZqExO7NnYS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13273744',6.1,1453,'en','A Christmas Carousel','When Lila is hired by the Royal Family of Ancadia to repair a carousel, she must work with the Prince to complete it by Christmas.','/1oqqPncrRREzk5D63YUL9CLbqVf.jpg','2020-12-19',84,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Carousel',746061,1.5954,6.8,'CoVyn2hr-8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26489,_binary '\0','/8I6RTwSmpt31I6bTIyxCgrcdXGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13273800',7.3,7075,'de','Sonne und Beton','The four friends Lukas, Julius, Gino and Sanchez are trying to survive the everyday life in Neukölln, Berlin between drugs, gangs, rap, violence and boredom. Until they are one day making a serious decision with serious consequences because of a dead certain plan.','/w2S0hvmEMv0lsyp8q4eDiTdXmQX.jpg','2023-03-02',119,'Released',NULL,'Sun and Concrete',915980,1.46,7,'YseO5USMSLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26490,_binary '\0','/nrp2khEM6JWFqqNLeub1J6Qafe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13274016',6.8,112074,'en','Reptile','Following the brutal murder of a young real estate agent, a hardened detective attempts to uncover the truth in a case where nothing is as it seems, and by doing so dismantles the illusions in his own life.','/bk4WUvoXSqPQGrhOAtt3AR0sUZf.jpg','2023-09-29',136,'Released','Shed the lies.','Reptile',866463,7.2827,6.667,'KS1cNkZ9o1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26491,_binary '\0','/sZ6DbL3e7NsAPwVig3nJ7GdLCxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13274576',6.4,1439,'fr','Oranges sanguines','Simultaneously, a retired couple overwhelmed by debt tries to win a dance contest, as the minister of economy is suspected of tax evasion, and a teenage girl encounters a sexual maniac, while a young lawyer attempts to climb the social ladder. When the shoe drops, the winner won’t necessarily be the one we expected.','/qLaYBkXhqPEsJIR4kipMCWt6Of3.jpg','2021-11-17',112,'Released','Warning: Naughty Comedy!','Bloody Oranges',833404,1.7541,6.1,'M8XdzpbYDYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26492,_binary '\0','/eb8X0y2k5sPZOIfc7Z12B6x27FH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13275406',6.4,1514,'tr','9,75','During his military service in 1990\'s Southeast Turkey, Ahmet experiences something that will haunt him for the rest of his life. In 2013, when the chaotic days of Gezi Park protests in Istanbul start, Ahmet learns he has a brain tumor. Just as the lines between truth and fiction, the dream and the reality start to get blurred for him, he meets Serap; the love of his life. But time is ticking and his painful past weighs down on him every day, suffocating him with the same question: Who is the child that plays hide and seek with him?','/1EDXENkqAKJyBDgqbWqkYzN1IS7.jpg','2020-10-22',117,'Released',NULL,'9,75',752603,1.0958,6,'6SnWShTa6o4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26493,_binary '\0','/L8ONMKI6PblIJpvE30dkrS6m3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13275740',6.3,3438,'ml','കൊത്ത്','Set in the rural socio-political environment of North Malabar, Kotthu follows two party workers Shanu and Sumesh and how certain party workers are honour-bound to their `acquired` political ideology of revenge killing.','/21PqmChUENnm0S02ItQ6kISlQR1.jpg','2022-09-16',155,'Released',NULL,'Kotthu',860394,1.2586,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26494,_binary '\0','/dICcoTGsQa9dAaIueoN5DTlf8hL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327601',4.6,1693,'en','Something Wicked','A young couple embark upon their honeymoon against the chilling landscapes of the Pacific Northwest. But when tragedy strikes, gruesome secrets from their past collide with sinister forces of the present...','/fmKcL3irtCGs1ZWcpx2tKcebp3i.jpg','2014-04-04',95,'Released','Love is a tragedy waiting to happen.','Something Wicked',260947,2.4742,4.8,'K-02W1AXhyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26495,_binary '\0','/haIoJKNVq4aRASaIQbMWgSUrMc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327628',7.2,5524,'de','Whores\' Glory','In Bangkok, Thailand, women punch a clock and wait for clients in a brightly lit glass box; in the red-light district of Faridpur, Bangladesh, a madam haggles over the price of a teenage girl; and in the border town of Reynosa, Mexico, crack-addicted women pray to a deity named Lady Death.','/5MToUaJwsqxcS3JgDa3afL2P0io.jpg','2011-09-09',110,'Released',NULL,'Whores\' Glory',85533,1.5279,6.8,'NhgpTrgLYt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26496,_binary '\0','/6OVV95xVpj8ZcNGVcj40AXdiltM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13276352',5.7,11995,'da','Toscana','When a Danish chef travels to Tuscany to sell his father\'s business, he meets a local woman who inspires him to rethink his approach to life and love.','/k9JHEiBkMsqCR5vKREjdOvz91u6.jpg','2022-05-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Toscana',859585,2.2077,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26497,_binary '\0','/iuvwEtn4Ic3nZURLCqFcLe9SELV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13276386',6.5,2328,'en','Shawn Mendes: In Wonder','A portrait of singer-songwriter Shawn Mendes\' life, chronicling the past few years of his rise and journey.','/aSs7V3ryvxCSpcXcxf9NY8YBtGC.jpg','2020-11-23',83,'Released',NULL,'Shawn Mendes: In Wonder',752939,2.0113,8.144,'n6b2il1O55U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26498,_binary '\0','/oK190JudMVb0C5773Vab0TKcBbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327701',4.6,6826,'en','Ben 10: Alien Swarm','Ben and a mysterious girl from his past must prevent an alien threat from destroying the world.','/4emrSFOwIlx35OawRcqlwH66TZD.jpg','2009-11-15',69,'Released','Go hero one more time!','Ben 10: Alien Swarm',25642,7.314,6.209,'bUzdFOkb_6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26499,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327763',5.3,1220,'en','Solitary','Sara (Amber Jaeger) suffers from agoraphobia, an obsessive fear of open spaces that renders her a virtual captive of her own home. When her husband, Mark (Kieron Elliott), disappears unexpectedly, Sara unravels emotionally and begins to panic. Turning to her estranged sister (Kristine Sullivan) and a psychiatrist (Andrew Qamar) for support, Sara soon begins to wonder whether the doctor is trying to help her or is plotting her demise.','/fVihcDivL3pIbP6wNNMIOnPDkRj.jpg','2009-03-29',91,'Released','Some Mysteries Must Be Solved Alone','Solitary',72642,0.8024,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26500,_binary '\0','/g0nLh5eQjTcffJUavvatBNkaSpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327773',7.2,124453,'en','The Butler','Cecil Gaines was a sharecropper\'s son who grew up in the 1920s as a domestic servant for the white family who casually destroyed his. Eventually striking out on his own, Cecil becomes a hotel valet of such efficiency and discreteness in the 1950s that he becomes a butler in the White House itself. There, Cecil would serve numerous US Presidents over the decades as a passive witness of history with the American Civil Rights Movement gaining momentum even as his family has troubles of its own. As his wife, Gloria, struggles with alcoholism and his defiant eldest son, Louis, strives for a just world, Cecil must decide whether he should take action in his own way.','/pAi8Bl3ZKX6pANPVhNwbhbQANop.jpg','2013-08-16',132,'Released','One quiet voice can ignite a revolution.','The Butler',132363,7.6779,7.3,'eZ4xDTz8Avc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26501,_binary '\0','/efrMu7NNO9a50WpJyIe3Ju6Suab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327788',7.3,5602,'en','The Most Wonderful Time of the Year','Five-time Emmy nominee and Golden Globe winner Henry Winkler stars in The Most Wonderful Time of the Year, the story of what happens when you open your heart to the power of Christmas. Disenchanted single mom Jennifer Cullen (Brooke Burns) is a Scroogette when it comes to anything Christmas. In fact, even her six-year-old son, Brian, is having trouble believing in Santa Claus. But when her Uncle Ralph (Henry Winkler) visits and brings a fellow passenger from his flight named Morgan Derby (Warren Christie), Jennifer s dubious heart awakens to the possibility that perhaps Christmas really does hold miracles. It s uplifting and laugh-packed and a story that will inspire the whole family to believe.','/dVDLByvtadEiUJZqjEfIqyXs68l.jpg','2008-12-13',88,'Released',NULL,'The Most Wonderful Time of the Year',35830,2.9082,6.4,'ZB97CnVDGvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26502,_binary '\0','/chgjaCrkcsl0CQQXlBTjPzkF2X7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327819',7.7,2547,'en','Boy Interrupted','On the night of Oct. 2, 2005, Hart and Dana Perry\'s 15-year-old son Evan jumped to his death from his New York City bedroom window. This moving film is the story, told by his filmmaker parents and others who knew him, of Evan’s life and death, and his life-long struggle with bipolar disorder. It delves into the complexity of Evan\'s disease, sharing his family\'s journey through the maze of mental illness. In showing how one family deals with generations of loss and grief, the film defies the stigma related to mental illness and suicide and tells a human story that touches everyone.','/pYjSsZ96L8RTMIqCgiuOlGUU2Cq.jpg','2009-09-05',92,'Released','Once there was a little boy who wanted to die…','Boy Interrupted',36738,0.9705,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26503,_binary '\0','/qjLY1UFBwBW2FyloXeC9I5OkgeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1327820',7,3554,'da','Broderskab','Former Danish servicemen Lars and Jimmy are thrown together while training in a neo-Nazi group. Moving from hostility through grudging admiration to friendship and finally passion, events take a darker turn when their illicit relationship is uncovered.','/mzVg3nYnPJTbDOdihNS9nuoaCKh.jpg','2009-10-21',90,'Released','Love conquers all.','Brotherhood',25541,1.5664,6.9,'UbyFZ9g_RXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26504,_binary '\0','/tOkKdmnT0NeiEJbHK0ZuL3GqUtZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13279528',5.9,2212,'de','Was wir wollten','Alice and Niklas are a young couple who\'s biggest wish is to have a child of their own. After several failed attempts they decide to go on a holiday in Sardinia to clear their minds. There they meet a family from Austria that seems to have everything they ever wished for. But appearances can be deceiving...','/A9hKgVKo4wU0sZk5XLv323PtU0a.jpg','2020-11-11',94,'Released',NULL,'What We Wanted',754800,2.3516,5.832,'MJb-eUFqzP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26505,_binary '\0','/tNWZ1fyKYl2zWRWsyXTTH7OwuQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13280054',5.5,6217,'en','Blood','Jess, a newly separated mother and nurse, moves into her old family farmhouse with Tyler, her teenage daughter, and Owen, her eight-year-old son. One night, the family dog senses something in the woods and runs off to find it. He returns a couple of days later and attacks Owen, savagely biting him before Jess is able to intervene. Owen is rushed to the hospital. His condition worsens, and no one can figure out why... until Jess discovers a disturbing cure...','/gCUFtTvjK4gbmjVxhx8bhyOhAeW.jpg','2023-01-12',108,'Released','How far would you go to save your child?','Blood',746524,4.3039,6.3,'TZX6E0M47Q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26506,_binary '\0','/xmfikA0HYgOzKKHLguTxZG9ZWrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13281312',3,1963,'en','Wrong Place, Wrong Time','An elite team of thieves takes refuge with a family after a heist goes horribly wrong. They soon find themselves in a fight for their lives when one of their hosts turns into a mysterious creature.','/4WGas7DgM54ZfokeO87N3kj2bbW.jpg','2021-05-04',84,'Released','Hell is about to be unleashed.','Wrong Place, Wrong Time',818972,1.4304,4.8,'BZL7-TscazE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26507,_binary '\0','/xtErsvnl1DD8123cBUChCmr6zCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13285394',7,2408,'fr','Les Choses humaines','The Farels are a power couple: Jean is a prominent French pundit and his wife Claire an essayist known for her radical feminism. Together they have a model son, Alexandre, who is a student at a prestigious American university. During a brief visit to Paris, Alexandre meets Mila, the daughter of his mother’s new partner, and invites her to a party. The next day, Mila files a complaint against Alexandre for rape, destroying family harmony and setting in motion an inextricable media-judicial machine that posits opposing truths.','/pOaSz0pWIMgNBDXTtTdfAeu9Le1.jpg','2021-12-01',138,'Released',NULL,'The Accusation',756603,2.8554,7.059,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26508,_binary '\0','/xUYIdye5PLXR1CKaVeIHxTNRVgx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1328634',6.8,13215,'hi','New York','The plot follows three friends in New York City whose lives are upended by the 9/11 attacks leading to suspicion, FBI involvement, and a story about friendship, identity, and the aftermath of terrorism.','/rjG0zZN6cRq4SJZRonI3HhvZtrg.jpg','2009-06-26',153,'Released','Three friends ready to face the world... and then the world changed.','New York',19616,1.878,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26509,_binary '\0','/6HEwXKpci1B1cEPQdG3CBNAUNHt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1328642',4.5,1425,'fr','Safari','Richard Dacier owns a tour agency specialized on organizing safaris for European tourists eager to confront the African wild life. Actually, he took the job after his father and never went into the savanna by himself. As he owes big money to some mobster, he is compelled to convey a fake tourist, with a suspicious suitcase, toward Mozambic. To avoid suspicion from the authorities, he is supposed to tour a group of tourists as usual. The only problem - he is completely unexperienced as a guide!','/k3YyJ8SCHjYiVtL8dXn0sQzcEzU.jpg','2009-04-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Safari',15587,1.246,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26510,_binary '\0','/phMbsc8EvcW6nuQ3K0WBwno1MYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13286622',6.3,1345,'en','Heart of the Holidays','After her life in New York unexpectedly falls apart, powerhouse stockbroker Sam Wallace returns to her small town for the holidays and reconnects with her high school sweetheart who helps reignite her humanitarian spirit just in time to help their community on Christmas.','/c6gsHd757ghfcZHpR9RjzYz2vBp.jpg','2020-11-23',85,'Released',NULL,'Heart of the Holidays',756727,1.956,6.4,'mOZkipEWiPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26511,_binary '\0','/33pMXav77ICRnceEBLhL8lXTywv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13287846',6.3,190735,'en','Napoleon','An epic that details the checkered rise and fall of French Emperor Napoleon Bonaparte and his relentless journey to power through the prism of his addictive, volatile relationship with his wife, Josephine.','/ytFOXyghxLzAM4KZyazDdEkM66q.jpg','2023-11-22',158,'Released','He came from nothing. He conquered everything.','Napoleon',753342,14.6043,6.3,'1DJYiG6wh0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26512,_binary '\0','/tdidYPYIH2MzafaMw1B1bLkexoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1328865',3.8,1288,'zh','刺陵','In the northwest desert where countless prosperous dynasties have flourished and fallen, there is rumor of a treasure of unbelievable riches buried among it. A group of mysterious guardians have been guarding the map to the location of the treasure until a fierce rivalry erupted. A notorious international crime group, The Company hunted down the map keeper and before they managed to secure the map, the keeper passed the map to a young chivalrous man Ciao Fei. Ciao Fei was forced to give up the map to save the live of his mentor’s daughter Lan Ting. Teaming up with Hua Ding Bang and Lan Ting they embark on a dangerous journey to recover the map and fight to protect the ancient treasure.','/hHF1pLZLHSs5Yf72LgADx00I0j5.jpg','2009-12-09',105,'Released',NULL,'The Treasure Hunter',37848,1.911,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26513,_binary '\0','/lkQ3p3zLVY9mfLPEJ1mdIbfSLmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13288678',6.6,2809,'ja','機動戦士ガンダム 閃光のハサウェイ','Twelve years after Char\'s rebellion, Hathaway Noa leads an insurgency against Earth Federation, but meeting an enemy officer and a mysterious woman alters his fate.','/6gw8onh4FKsruBA7Oouv01EFxzn.jpg','2021-06-11',96,'Released','Char\'s ideals and Amuro\'s passion... the heir of their wills...','Mobile Suit Gundam Hathaway',685274,6.7781,7.169,'MzxnPP5TLeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26514,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1329177',5.1,1867,'en','K-11','Raymond Saxx Jr., a powerful record producer, wakes from a drug-induced blackout to find himself locked up and classified \"K-11.\" Plunged into a nightmarish world ruled by a transsexual diva named Mousey, Raymond is truly a fish out of water. Complicating matters are a troubled young transgender named Butterfly, a predatory child molester and the ruthless Sheriff\'s Deputy, Lt. Johnson. Ray\'s struggle to contact the outside world and regain his freedom seems impossible, but he must learn to navigate this new power structure if he is ever going survive and be in control of his life again.','/ucQn8bEqCRstAHscjH4ryV08QgZ.jpg','2013-03-15',88,'Released',NULL,'K-11',170178,1.5617,5.4,'kOiI3x-VVIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26515,_binary '\0','/ggIKrUzKjOGJ2SNlMwaj4xhqrp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1329232',5.2,2268,'en','St George\'s Day','Infamous London gangster cousins, Micky Mannock and Ray Collishaw, are at the top of the food chain, when their world is turned upside down as they lose a shipment of the Russian Mafia\'s cocaine in rough seas. Set in London, Amsterdam and Berlin, the story races across Europe at breakneck speed as Micky and Ray attempt to stay one step ahead of the Police. Can they pull off a daring diamond heist in time to put things right and retire to a \"legitimate\" way of life.','/w5VU0eilunJ3UDKRDgeODQ8sDLs.jpg','2012-09-07',109,'Released','A match, a firm, a heist, and the mother of all battles.','St George\'s Day',131737,2.5854,4.661,'pdvseSAVznI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26516,_binary '\0','/v9mMKfzDdH6MeUUrrykaGg4jBMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1329404',3.8,1425,'en','Abandoned Mine','Five school friends seek adventure on Halloween night in an abandoned, haunted mine, only to find to their horror that the ghostly rumors may be true as they fight for survival.','/ucZi0XcIW3DhOuYd0oUQgDYOeFp.jpg','2013-08-15',95,'Released','It\'s Alive','Abandoned Mine',203186,1.4402,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26517,_binary '\0','/fMtmvjlZCz1gRHZvAAsVq63qxEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1329454',6.6,7321,'cn','復仇','A French chef swears revenge after a violent attack on his daughter\'s family in Macau, during which her husband and her two children are murdered. To help him find the killers, he hires three local hit-men working for the mafia.','/iEi7kOABrTvhwBi3np9wTwNKWNn.jpg','2009-05-20',108,'Released','There is no other law.','Vengeance',18899,4.0796,6.6,'beD4E_uVpOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26518,_binary '\0','/aFGFVXvqOzrK07jnRaSrzIJYp95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1329457',6.9,10686,'fr','Gainsbourg (vie héroïque)','A glimpse at the life of French singer Serge Gainsbourg, from growing up in 1940s Nazi-occupied Paris through his successful song-writing years in the 1960s to his death in 1991 at the age of 62.','/e1zGOGjIVxzRudOq0SQteQQKfmr.jpg','2010-01-20',130,'Released',NULL,'Gainsbourg: A Heroic Life',31900,1.9465,6.87,'zojRyGQP4x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26519,_binary '\0','/iF4GIfMX3EwsyapDZnHwKqGgSQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13298992',6.3,3170,'ml','നിഴൽ','A First class judicial Magistrate comes across an 8 year old boy-Nithin & his murder stories. Do they have real life connection?','/uGKbgLN4dc8BoxDGsM6kU9RglSV.jpg','2021-04-09',118,'Released',NULL,'Nizhal',795729,1.4116,5.729,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26520,_binary '\0','/rqJRmGFuXJMMc1iMzUC6hWiJANO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13299052',5.2,4091,'te','ఖిలాడి','Mohan Gandhi is a wanted criminal who’s serving time for a crime he might or might not have committed. With large sums of money, lies and deceit involved, who is he really?','/y0xP2OupckdMyiL0bCk8i2ENXqH.jpg','2022-02-11',154,'Released','Play Smart','Khiladi',794417,1.425,5.107,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26521,_binary '\0','/pyYcByKY5HyRsYdhTyIwFOnO6jT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13299890',8,11366,'ml','മഹത്തായ ഭാരതീയ അടുക്കള','After marriage, a woman struggles to be the submissive wife that her husband and his family expect her to be.','/4jgiaVOGD8sTjWlwBdx8q5JMJM3.jpg','2021-01-15',100,'Released',NULL,'The Great Indian Kitchen',786064,1.5655,7.571,'k_E6ctiFn6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26522,_binary '\0','/nhSlg3xCaolEWLS0IGKGba6Xbko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1330018',6,5109,'en','The Book of Love','After tragedy strikes Henry and Penny, he befriends a tenacious young girl and discovers she is constructing a raft to sail across the Atlantic to find her lost father. Together, along with some unlikely friends, they set forth to construct the vessel and subsequently rebuild their lives.','/TnGRaxeNPA82FGOEwunZTUivu0.jpg','2017-01-13',107,'Released','How far would you go for a lost love?','The Book of Love',352885,3.8064,6.5,'C270AmHANmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26523,_binary '\0','/rDaAgSzMgSYaSI7wvKYLbbtlwrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1330206',6.3,1291,'ko','미인도','Yun-jeong, a skilled painter, disguises herself as a man in court to continue her family\'s legacy. Circumstances become difficult when her relationship with Kang-mu draws jealousy from the others.','/xYfGHlsCbOiCCaGeiTPjlVu96bz.jpg','2008-11-13',108,'Released','Sensational secret from the history gets revealed.','Portrait of a Beauty',60192,3.6988,6.2,'AxZPlhT9b4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26524,_binary '\0','/8liHMI4t6VZsovqyHxgrwaFpipf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13302660',4.7,1586,'en','Double Threat','With ruthless mobsters on her tail, a young woman with a split personality becomes entangled with a man on a pilgrimage across the country to scatter his brother\'s ashes.','/5Z9KqbOA8WbInbmB0TsO62L7QIy.jpg','2023-03-15',91,'Released','Those who chase her will pay the price.','Double Threat',981848,2.6787,6.491,'Ie_QknawC9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26525,_binary '\0','/lxC0TPqCq5FBiUeTfG9Fph2lB5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13304286',6.5,8280,'tr','Eflâtun','Eflatun, a blind woman since childhood, has been able to get a hold of her life with the help of her father’s various shadow and sound plays. Eflatun inherits her father’s profession of clock repair. She waits for a man with who she had fallen in love with his voice. One day a man whose voice is identical to the man she’s searching for comes into the shop.','/xExjJp5aU7Sdh81TeGR8fbKxEiv.jpg','2023-01-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Eflatun',1036487,1.1671,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26526,_binary '\0','/kw8ivekqieGyNCqb5YtyYI3X7GL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13304584',6.1,2069,'te','బొమ్మ బ్లాక్‌బస్టర్','Pothuraju is a fisherman, film freak & ardent fan of Director Puri Jagannath. His life ambition is to conjure up the dramatic moments in his life & persuade his idol Puri Jagannath to make a film based on him. As time passes, he discovers life-altering secrets about his own family and life. Thus, Pothuraju will get forced to confront the deep pain behind his ludicrous antics and a simplistic worldview.','/4bYCtlGKQS8mngbNUPa0zslcRzY.jpg','2022-11-04',123,'Released','Mass Arachakam','Bomma Blockbuster',1036785,0.8946,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26527,_binary '\0','/hEF7N1fFu7S1rEjHBVUwnYn53Zu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1330525',6.8,2512,'cn','証人','Sergeant Tong is wracked with guilt after he unwittingly kills a young girl whilst capuring a criminal named Cheung. When the girl\'s sister is later kidnapped in a ploy to get Cheung released, Sergeant Tong vows to find and rescue her before she comes to harm.','/hlaIVAyQc2Wo5AIpprYIkpbirAT.jpg','2008-11-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Beast Stalker',18060,2.5602,6.753,'CayVm-cgmfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26528,_binary '\0','/sYZ8Csc9OjfNsFPcPnH8he7oZNo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1330591',7.6,7815,'tr','Sonbahar','Arrested while a student in university, Yusuf is released from prison after ten years. He returns home and is welcomed by his sick and elderly mother. Soon he will meet Eka, a beautiful Georgian girl who is a sex worker, and love becomes a final desperate attempt to grasp life and elude loneliness.','/cGE5larTDRaoWcFfbNfc5bvx39n.jpg','2008-08-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Autumn',12417,1.8816,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26529,_binary '\0','/sKGUTAtvGYT5e5fjIAI0egrjOZs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1330607',6.8,4037,'zh','非诚勿扰','Qin Fen, a funny, honest, single inventor, met a girl called Smiley, who was in agony of her boyfriend\'s betrayal. They traveled to Hokkaido, tried to help Smiley cure her pain in heart, and both of them gradually found their true love and life redemption during the journey.','/6Q3l0P80QimQpzYVydNeIeEmLUL.jpg','2008-12-18',124,'Released',NULL,'If You Are the One',18232,2.264,6.8,'_JXBDUj69SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26530,_binary '\0','/jQhPZ06ffOpsnwK1PsYOkVYu23T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13308316',6.1,1903,'fr','Babysitter','After a sexist joke goes viral, Cédric loses his job and embarks on a therapeutic journey to free himself from sexism and misogyny. He and his girlfriend hire a mysterious and liberated babysitter to help shake things up.','/sEdR0lapigrin4S4EMLICiTKDTO.jpg','2022-04-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Babysitter',764837,1.7167,5.8,'H4Z8lN5AIQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26531,_binary '\0','/ABuIGbnT6uQtHULIst9DiR7pyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13309170',6.2,23018,'en','Influencer','While struggling on a solo backpacking trip in Thailand, social media influencer Madison meets CW, who travels with ease and shows her a more uninhibited way of living. But CW\'s interest in her takes a darker turn.','/mtXV301BF7pqwvRjsWhQo6sD10F.jpg','2023-05-18',92,'Released','Be careful who you follow.','Influencer',1020910,3.5755,6.2,'max4YbL3idk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26532,_binary '\0','/kYS5oHeMjmgwHZQ1voxMbsqXpqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13309978',5.5,5718,'en','Superhost','Two travel vloggers check into a vacation rental with a host that will do anything for a good review.','/3YBdvIrYlWGXAp2jJGNMbwXp7tZ.jpg','2021-08-14',83,'Released','Don’t forget to like and survive.','Superhost',849369,3.1734,5.85,'k5wK0Z1ocpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26533,_binary '\0','/6KD5irvXdKWcPR2hXf80TrWEeCE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331025',7,8258,'en','The September Issue','A documentary chronicling Vogue editor-in-chief Anna Wintour\'s preparations for the 2007 fall-fashion issue.','/gcsx9hJdVmfkrcC6a0qcxF01jqQ.jpg','2009-08-28',90,'Released','Fashion is a religion. This is the bible.','The September Issue',23044,2.1839,6.6,'Tq4wo4JYy2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26534,_binary '\0','/1QTC1iOmFox4Zkc61aICdSQ1iMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331064',6,8816,'en','Paper Heart','Paper Heart follows Nick and Charlyne on a cross-country journey to document what exactly \"love\" is. Interviewing ministers, happily married couples, chemists, romance novelists, divorce lawyers, a group of children and more, the determined young girl attempts to find definition and perhaps even experience the mysterious emotion.','/rfOYFZ15ZhxKBXgazh2JHaZnoDc.jpg','2009-08-07',88,'Released','A story about love that\'s taking on a life on its own.','Paper Heart',25183,2.1219,5.8,'ewisKyyuF78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26535,_binary '\0','/tZINXLOJqVGg3Fv241xMXFzmV4G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13310936',7.1,1835,'te','తిమ్మరుసు: Assignment వాలి','After a cab driver is found dead, a young pub employee is framed for the murder and is sent to jail for 8 years. When he comes out on parole, a young lawyer takes up the case to prove his innocence.','/9dieUbTLijMnE9gKV8qt4Byc6Cx.jpg','2021-07-30',127,'Released',NULL,'Thimmarusu: Assignment Vali',805014,0.8019,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26536,_binary '\0','/mzP5hP0sfxilO3rVW3niqHUkcRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331291',6.5,3849,'fr','5150, rue des Ormes','Yannick moves to a small, quiet town to study cinema. One day when he fell off his bike, he knocked at the door of the Beaulieu residence so he could clean the blood off his hands. But Jacques Beaulieu and his family had other plans for Yannick. Beaulieu is a righteous psychopath and fanatic chess player who wants to rid the world of evil. And even though Ian has done nothing wrong, he is beaten, tortured and tormented before Beaulieu makes him an offer: win at chess and he is free to go. And so Ian is now a pawn in Beaulieu \'s game. A game in which he will either lose his mind or his life.','/mQc5h2k9YluczI6JRMwZkCInxp4.jpg','2009-10-09',110,'Released',NULL,'5150 Elm\'s Way',38988,1.8941,6.5,'610rSpUUF34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26537,_binary '\0','/t02XOer9nzMTQwUU62iHDWRbTeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331307',5.6,13744,'en','Dread','Three college students set out to document what other people dread the most. However, one of the three turns out to secretly be a sadistic psychopath who uses this knowledge to gruesomely torture the subjects.','/zJvKJ2SKATSRL7cdR2qW2LbaTaS.jpg','2009-07-14',108,'Released','Your Time Will Come.','Dread',26587,3.1496,5.5,'NyTFKDjE3Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26538,_binary '\0','/2Db87ALP6ScBoMvaC110we11bnC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331323',4.4,1577,'en','Beyond Sherwood Forest','King Richard is away fighting the Crusade, his brother Prince John has been left in charge. In order to further international diplomatic relations with Norway, the beautiful young Maid Marian is to be married off to a prince. A cursed girl who can change into a ferocious dragon is used to find and pacify Robin Hood.','/789U5EUoGTAEkxr2ST5tUm7PXz4.jpg','2009-11-28',93,'Released',NULL,'Beyond Sherwood Forest',37746,1.6102,5.2,'WIgsSRvI5fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26539,_binary '\0','/9UmI7GyekhovpTnMJOIMjPxw7V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1331335',4.8,2541,'en','Wyvern','The residents of a small Alaskan town find themselves under attack by a flying reptile known in medieval mythology as a Wyvern. It has thawed from its ancient slumber by melting icecaps caused by global warming.','/fw84TWlyimwbUwyJixZXyXR0fSG.jpg','2009-01-31',89,'Released','Ancient evil has come to feed.','Wyvern',21864,1.4955,5,'K60VHDDUYhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26540,_binary '\0','/zOVxbbt8BrrjWBJ0eO21S2adUvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13313408',6.6,2088,'it','Marilyn ha gli occhi neri','Clara and Diego, under the guidance of the psychiatrist of a day rehabilitation center for disturbed people who attend, decide to transform the treatment center into a restaurant, involving all their other companions.','/u4jiAnEDzDVhpVdBk9jtRrLzc9S.jpg','2021-10-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Marilyn\'s Eyes',776328,2.2121,6.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26541,_binary '\0','/yjZM4QrgA7PqX18Es6DxvJQH3ba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13314558',6.1,100556,'en','Day Shift','An LA vampire hunter has a week to come up with the cash to pay for his kid\'s tuition and braces. Trying to make a living these days just might kill him.','/tkl7n5r542S40hnYDI27lGNCACu.jpg','2022-08-05',114,'Released','Some jobs really go for the throat.','Day Shift',755566,13.1283,6.734,'GN_IwBptKi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26542,_binary '\0','/wmILpOmMEkIgsgvVdfXNTSS71Ck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13315432',4.5,1870,'en','Bless Me Father','A man confesses his sins and unveils the ugly truth of his life; he is killing for the same mobster that killed his father. Will Vinny Dapello follow his father\'s footsteps in the organized crime family? Or sacrifice his soul to save his life?','/2lik9yR6zIqcEKtSlYnK1rNjEgl.jpg','2023-05-16',91,'Released','His life or his soul?','Bless Me Father',987622,0.782,9.2,'3lqQ7inRER8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26543,_binary '\0','/j6Er72CMHKiZgFr0HBMbuyj7Ssa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13316062',3.5,1290,'en','Toys of Terror','A big family moves into a dusty old house in the snowy woods of Washington with hopes of it being a nice holiday escape. But the kids soon discover a stash of old toys that just so happen to belong to a creepy ghost boy. As stranger and stranger things start to happen, some of the kids begin to sense that something in the house is not quite right…','/gd5zv9V6MOaLOOVSN5RoZmF8a5Q.jpg','2021-12-02',89,'Released',NULL,'Toys of Terror',753926,2.2424,6.3,'VwxIsArT5c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26544,_binary '\0','/yC4DRg5aGgNpkHpUDpLtBqzownS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13316722',6.1,4825,'ko','서복','Ex intelligence agent Ki-heon is tasked with safely transporting Seo Bok, the first ever human clone, who holds the secret of eternal life. Several forces try to take control of Seo Bok to serve their own agendas.','/dHOuFBQ4Vtr7aCDebC0dvpR27ww.jpg','2021-04-12',114,'Released','Live the Moment.','Seobok',586047,4.4968,7.16,'GbU7onyLWJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26545,_binary '\0','/atB1iXpnvjI3suhVT2DTvRXqhzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13316770',3.2,1390,'en','Gods of the Deep','When a daring mission leads a deep sea submarine team into a mysterious opening on the ocean floor, they uncover a lost underwater world and awaken its ancient race of otherworldly beings.','/ea8609DKrceNJocKEUpDom6mHzx.jpg','2023-12-04',80,'Released','A new depth of fear.','Gods of the Deep',854887,2.0183,4.7,'UShRUzUpDt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26546,_binary '\0','/8gtogcxiWiODHR4BMscTsHplbH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13316790',6.2,3132,'sv','Ur spår','A mid-age hipster in Stockholm is a training freak and trains for the 90 km ski race Vasaloppet. His sister is the opposite, no job, drinks but has a daughter. Suddenly secrets reveals and promises are made.','/4yV6DjHg9ALJaopXlktvXphh9xR.jpg','2022-01-28',109,'Released',NULL,'Off Track',913129,3.1038,6.045,'KAD8V2Uxwd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26547,_binary '\0','/zTRdaRpxjcib6lHYSfHg4FnsiCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13317320',6.2,1667,'zh','狙击手','The story of sharpshooter Zhang Taofang, a young army recruit who at age 22 sets a record during the Korean War by reportedly killing or wounding 214 American soldiers with 435 shots in just 32 days.','/2m3NvM7Skz3rcNmhJ8lU33SRJEg.jpg','2022-02-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Snipers',799288,1.7243,6.9,'RGRYqu9GsRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26548,_binary '\0','/lVhSW3OcQ6Z6M4f4yMhrlHgPzc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13317694',6.2,6090,'tr','Sen Hiç Ateş Böceği Gördün mü?','Rebellious, irreverent wunderkind Gülseren navigates loneliness, love and loss against the current of political turmoil and social change.','/lZucbxHPkb5Xla5ivOcKim7A1NO.jpg','2021-04-09',113,'Released',NULL,'Have You Ever Seen Fireflies?',809236,1.5836,6.3,'WTbSahFObkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26549,_binary '\0','/cIGPPTfxKvoezGB4yxmIqa33ROn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13318052',5.8,6465,'en','Midnight at the Magnolia','Longtime friends and local radio hosts Maggie and Jack fake it as a couple for their families and listeners in hopes of getting their show syndicated.','/gOfLcgmRYQ04ihwkNKzM6Vn4CnV.jpg','2020-11-05',87,'Released','This New Year\'s Eve, the countdown to love is on.','Midnight at the Magnolia',734280,2.6779,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26550,_binary '\0','/wpdiBaOot1q3RORdsGPHUieZZaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13318942',4.6,2323,'en','Dark Windows','A group of teenagers grieving the death of their friend takes a trip to an isolated summerhouse in the countryside. What starts as a peaceful getaway turns into a horrific nightmare when a masked man begins to terrorize them in the most gruesome ways.','/hANd38mgGlOzA3lt12vfXMZbj90.jpg','2023-08-10',80,'Released',NULL,'Dark Windows',1089228,1.7786,5.1,'OrYjHkKv0NA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26551,_binary '\0','/x4rwSuhiY5TbkTyZbNTLy3qyQAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1332026',6.1,1565,'en','A Miser Brothers\' Christmas','Santa Claus and the mischievous brothers Heat Miser and Snow Miser are the targets of yuletide treachery when the North Wind tries to take Santa\'s place.','/buaDjwed0PAJyte7detsLUuLdI5.jpg','2008-12-13',48,'Released',NULL,'A Miser Brothers\' Christmas',305355,1.8342,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26552,_binary '\0','/1Ds7xy7ILo8u2WWxdnkJth1jQVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13320622',6.1,179430,'en','The Lost City','Reclusive author Loretta Sage writes about exotic places in her popular adventure novels that feature a handsome cover model named Alan. While on tour promoting her new book with Alan, Loretta gets kidnapped by an eccentric billionaire who hopes she can lead him to the ancient city\'s lost treasure that featured in her latest story. Alan, determined to prove he can be a hero in real life and not just on the pages of her books, sets off to rescue her.','/rnheO8cFvCYcmZsDrBoabJbKLFE.jpg','2022-03-23',112,'Released','The adventure is real. The heroes are not.','The Lost City',752623,16.5631,6.435,'5f9VcZqxFO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26553,_binary '\0','/6tAYyCxF0T5oUIH95zMBC3X3W5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13320662',6.7,36454,'en','Slumberland','A young girl discovers a secret map to the dreamworld of Slumberland, and with the help of an eccentric outlaw, she traverses dreams and flees nightmares, with the hope that she will be able to see her late father again.','/tfae1vtjzlE73DPJGlHq88sZKX3.jpg','2022-11-18',117,'Released','Every adventure begins with a dream.','Slumberland',668461,6.5751,7.3,'D7WhLZj5-LY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26554,_binary '\0','/84ObTe22XWcDgNBFEodziAyLfYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13320784',6.9,3203,'en','Five Star Christmas','After moving back to her hometown, Lisa (Lenz) plots with her siblings and grandparents to help her father\'s bed and breakfast get a five-star review from an incognito travel critic (Webster), but ends up falling for him, not knowing he is the real critic.','/2YE5vNC4ClIXRWBvWEahul6jPOy.jpg','2020-11-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Five Star Christmas',746060,2.1569,6.9,'-qbxFT8-gt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26555,_binary '\0','/xAvbFwRteyRyswg4EfsH28LzbKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1332100',6.4,1913,'en','The Big Gay Musical','Paul and Eddie have just begun previews for the new Off-Broadway musical \"Adam and Steve - Just the Way God Made \'Em.\" Their lives strangely mirror the characters they are playing. Paul is looking for the perfect man and Eddie is dealing with how his sexuality and faith can mix.','/55gPwA9tzQyxpXH04FcUl4nxbFP.jpg','2009-07-20',91,'Released','Just the way God made ‘em!','The Big Gay Musical',36041,1.9002,6.5,'Y8eaMGuJ7jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26556,_binary '\0','/j7JCJsoJ64Ra3YOKePyHcMeyr48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13321244',7.2,8439,'en','Origin','While investigating the global phenomenon of caste and its dark influence on society, a journalist faces unfathomable personal loss and uncovers the beauty of human resilience.','/dY0m1fypdNPp61kcmLdsk7KIR7C.jpg','2023-12-08',141,'Released',NULL,'Origin',753336,3.5365,6.1,'pAweg5PaMuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26557,_binary '\0','/mN2tymzT2Mc9ysLQhNIn3Yhqkjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1332125',7.3,4555,'el','Στρέλλα','Yiorgos is released from prison after 14 years of incarceration for a murder he committed in his small Greek village. He spends his first night out in a cheap downtown hotel in Athens. There he meets Strella, a young trans sex worker. They spend the night together and soon they fall in love.','/b0KvrOzDdmd845nrElq4zddzCas.jpg','2009-02-10',111,'Released',NULL,'Strella',50535,1.5786,6.2,'bNP6IeO8cDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26558,_binary '\0','/pKeCuOheX2KQtD2W2dqMtMsRF1Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1332134',7.4,20849,'no','Kongen av Bastøy','Norwegian winter, 1915. On the island Bastøy, outside Oslo, a group of young boys aged 11 to 18, are held in an institution for delinquent youth, notorious for its sadistic regime. One day a new boy, Erling, arrives, determined to escape from the island. After a tragic incident, he ends up leading the boys in a violent uprising. When the boys manage to take over the island, 150 soldiers are sent in to restore order.','/6jlkzkNqJkzgINeDqYfUDbxpcK8.jpg','2010-12-16',117,'Released',NULL,'King of Devil\'s Island',73211,4.4409,7.1,'4cRiT5VFSNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26559,_binary '\0','/9bAwRoTEjXf7nnSnFr79jBtMhKw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13321730',6.5,1793,'fr','La Fracture','Raf and Julie, a couple on the verge of breaking up, find themselves in an emergency ward bordering on collapse on the evening of a Parisian Yellow Vest protest. Their encounter with Yann, an angry and injured demonstrator, will shatter each person\'s certainties and prejudices. Outside, the tension escalates.','/ymHLBkyX7TpYyJLSIyHswrMjQgc.jpg','2021-10-27',98,'Released',NULL,'The Divide',764686,2.3179,6.6,'ageLqzbZOsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26560,_binary '\0','/ab5O0zmq6YoNffceL7mjfd8tTBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13322120',4.2,11046,'en','American Sicario','The story of the rise and fall of the first American-born drug lord in Mexico, this tale of power, money, greed and betrayal amongst rival members of the drug cartels finds American gangster Erik Vasquez scheming to become the top dog in the Mexican underworld, only to find himself making enemies out of both the powerful cartels and his own allies.','/nQRPSUmHGLrFRPK6v3BI1frAM1O.jpg','2021-12-10',90,'Released','The story of America\'s most dangerous drug trafficker.','American Sicario',893297,2.8801,5.88,'5EugiAQoLnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26561,_binary '\0','/b2BuIEIEjcvc6QN6Pum8XZsufrY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13322726',7.3,3563,'ru','Капитан Волконогов бежал','Captain Fedor Volkonogov works in law enforcement. He is on the good books of the management, and his colleagues respect him. But one day, his life abruptly changes: he is declared a criminal. The Captain manages to run away before he is arrested. Suddenly he turns into an outcast, whom his former colleagues search across the whole city. At night Volkonogov is visited by a messenger from the other world, who warns him that after death he will go hell and be tormented forever. But he has an opportunity to change his fate and get to paradise if he repents, and at least one person forgives him. The Captain embarks on his way to find forgiveness. But he cannot even fathom what tests are awaiting him on this way.','/lM09TKEl1bYcETEKtXB93QJUc4o.jpg','2023-01-05',125,'Released',NULL,'Captain Volkonogov Escaped',818621,2.9069,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26562,_binary '\0','/xVfNU7lGZQxZp8zRPNV5IY05klo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13323092',6.5,2791,'es','El caso Wanninkhof - Carabantes','In 1999, teen Rocío Wanninkhof is murdered. Her mother\'s ex-partner, Dolores Vázquez, is suspected. Did she do it? A second victim reveals the truth.','/5P9aiu9zOIC8YAx9Tj3YKZbwtmT.jpg','2021-06-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Murder by the Coast',830645,0.9086,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26563,_binary '\0','/mhIPm0FhVX60n9sSlcWL436TFae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13323118',4.6,5263,'es','El páramo','Lucía and her son live isolated from society in a flat place where there’s practically no life. The small family unit formed by mother and son hardly ever receives visitors, and their goal is to lead a quiet existence. At first they succeed, but the appearance of a mysterious, violent creature that starts stalking their small house will put the relationship that unites them to the test.','/lchjXJm2oqEVkpuXVX8YglbgKUZ.jpg','2021-10-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Wasteland',800410,2.5542,5.2,'7yfiMfe5jqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26564,_binary '\0','/ehFFFseTwny5xRrsti6YON86a3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13323330',6.1,2033,'nl','Luizenmoeder - De Film','The eccentric Miss Ank tries to pick up the pieces at her primary after the loss of their principal. Faced with a shortage of teachers, and increasingly demanding parents, the board hires an interim head to get things in order. Pretty soon e-teaching takes over, with an actual robot replacing the teachers, and CCTV enabling over-involved parents to keep a constant eye on what’s happening. Finding themselves up against this heartless new regime, pupils and teachers decide to join forces and rebel.','/8cOA7E80cLDU0aiXk8E7UxW5HIU.jpg','2021-07-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Rebels @School',830426,0.7196,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26565,_binary '\0','/zq8NTyMCvLmQAHLCgzCX3uGkLMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1332486',5.9,2077,'it','Baciami ancora','A look at the lives of Carlo, Giulia, and their friends some 10 years after the events of L\'Ultimo bacio.','/7rU1NwjibQvYl48H3Z1rLHyAckY.jpg','2010-01-29',139,'Released',NULL,'Kiss Me Again',40817,1.707,5.8,'A7vhf-S1CJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26566,_binary '\0','/yWRvAfZmbzk61REYod4WQACDhRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13327038',6.3,58051,'en','Do Revenge','A dethroned queen bee at a posh private high school strikes a secret deal with an unassuming new student to enact revenge on one another’s enemies.','/akIjKJDHcVN4bzifcEarKVPNpoa.jpg','2022-09-14',118,'Released','I\'ll do yours if you do mine.','Do Revenge',762968,7.9384,6.375,'rK-JQU_bShc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26567,_binary '\0','/senh3AVEpOmNfxOtEjwZFRUFR2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13328800',6.9,3709,'fi','Tytöt tytöt tytöt','Best friends Mimmi and Rönkkö support each other unconditionally. They want to live adventurous lives, loaded with experiences and passion. Emma on the contrary has given her whole life to figure skating. Nothing gets between her and success. But when the girls meet, life opens whole new paths, and they all rocket in new directions. While Mimmi and Emma experience the earth moving effects of first love, Rönkkö is on a quest to find pleasure. Three Fridays is all it takes to turn their worlds upside down.','/kNRhvWoVDWP9kr2E7GBB3G0ZQVI.jpg','2022-04-14',100,'Released','It takes a good fall to know where you stand.','Girl Picture',683363,2.077,6.6,'5mWXO3nehA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26568,_binary '\0','/2ZCq1wZ7avejS9Lkl0LmVpbiPec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13328824',7.4,2253,'fi','Sokea mies joka ei halunnut nähdä Titanicia','Jaakko and Sirpa have never met face to face, but talk on the phone every day. When Jaakko hears news about Sirpa\'s declining health, he decides to go meet her in another city. It\'s not the easiest decision, because he\'s blind and paralyzed from the chest down - and he has to make the journey alone. To get there, Jaakko must rely on the help of five strangers. What could go wrong?','/lYuZ8yvVuUJsISKY75yt6FIzJFb.jpg','2021-09-10',82,'Released',NULL,'The Blind Man Who Did Not Want to See Titanic',716855,2.6731,7.1,'Z8KrFWXQOUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26569,_binary '\0','/9bOjEovR9cdiFUYwZY7fyfNGWyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333125',4.4,121556,'en','Movie 43','A series of interconnected short films are the backdrop for a maniac screenwriter who pitches insane storylines featuring some of Hollywood\'s biggest and brightest. In some countries, like the United Kingdom and the Netherlands, the structure differs. Instead of a pitch, the films are connected by a group of three teenagers searching for the most banned film in the world, Movie 43, which will ultimately lead to the destruction of civilization.','/uYa06GxHsCsELx9vOQ11vsT0Aa6.jpg','2013-01-24',98,'Released','The biggest cast ever assembled for the most outrageous comedy ever made.','Movie 43',87818,10.072,4.662,'RrvFBjsglA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26570,_binary '\0','/igBexKJgzTaCH0IrRMJsB3nKEIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13332610',2.9,4220,'en','Kill Plan','A weathered CIA agent is thrown into a web of deception when he uncovers a rogue government plot to unleash a deadly drug on humanity.','/bxGucvOXiVK70uhMN9OkntvyGJY.jpg','2021-02-05',71,'Released',NULL,'Kill Plan',790786,1.2683,5.8,'KqW7p9ieSX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26571,_binary '\0','/ryPqzG3e2BNZ7JzjCMaFlxTNfln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13334578',2.6,10823,'hi','गणपत','In a dystopian future, Ganapath, a relentless and skilled vigilante, embarks on a mission to dismantle a powerful criminal empire that has gripped the city in fear. Ganapath becomes a symbol of hope for the oppressed in which leads dark.','/z5kngie7G0bR9CL3tcWhZLwIpIc.jpg','2023-10-20',135,'Released','A Hero Is Born','Ganapath',763118,1.6416,2.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26572,_binary '\0','/fclwrQ3gDsubiJoA5Ev8c8ppWiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13334870',6,2393,'ml','നാരദൻ','Chandraprakash, a well-known TV news anchor, comes under undue pressure from his higher-ups to bring competitive exclusives, which urges him to leave the job. When a rival media group offers him a new job, he rebrands himself into a loud, tyrannical journalist, catering to those looking for news theatrics.','/pZ4fVh4NG18D4mbf0lJGoAzfT0E.jpg','2022-03-03',150,'Released',NULL,'Naradan',757276,0.997,6.136,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26573,_binary '\0','/tzcWfZVfgA8qWm49pqICvdYNsak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333631',6.8,1879,'en','Art & Copy','The personal odysseys of some of the most influential advertising visionaries of all time and the stories behind their campaigns.','/yWWrGxHkJv8zzpLAdS33oXh4Ubk.jpg','2009-08-21',89,'Released','Creativity can solve anything','Art & Copy',36432,1.0814,7,'hLfvmiB4edI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26574,_binary '\0','/lI93UeaSKml4lLKmGNUh65NvoBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333634',7.8,2574,'en','Burma VJ: Reporter i et lukket land','Going beyond the occasional news clip from Burma, the acclaimed filmmaker, Anders Østergaard, brings us close to the video journalists who deliver the footage. Though risking torture and life in jail, courageous young citizens of Burma live the essence of journalism as they insist on keeping up the flow of news from their closed country.','/cAld4WLIUOP2rxt79UlDqhS9HlM.jpg','2008-11-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Burma VJ: Reporting from a Closed Country',26763,1.8534,7.3,'V08EBWQLzyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26575,_binary '\0','/tJJ737CJujLXw1GlUYd7K4AH3eB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333644',4.9,4575,'en','In the Hand of Dante','A Vatican priest discovers Dante\'s original Divine Comedy manuscript. When asked to authenticate it, writer Nick Tosches steals it, while a parallel story follows Dante\'s quest to create his masterpiece.','/nPPIufTBnzEg0d7NoR5RLL1oPra.jpg','2026-06-12',153,'Released',NULL,'In the Hand of Dante',1020047,7.5765,5.216,'cXA3Zgsky18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26576,_binary '\0','/vP7V2cb4xNovVxblCWTychWtBN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333667',7.6,10754,'en','When You\'re Strange','The creative chemistry of four brilliant artists —drummer John Densmore, guitarist Robby Kreiger, keyboardist Ray Manzarek and singer Jim Morrison— made The Doors one of America\'s most iconic and influential rock bands. Using footage shot between their formation in 1965 and Morrison\'s death in 1971, it follows the band from the corridors of UCLA\'s film school, where Manzarek and Morrison met, to the stages of sold-out arenas.','/yd5X8f1mt13ETAWLI7dp0MEEZLL.jpg','2010-04-09',86,'Released','A film about The Doors','When You\'re Strange',37659,3.3379,7.3,'6nvfWfr2jUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26577,_binary '\0','/cM6jO368k2FsnOHTjug0TlaCzdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1333994',7,2187,'en','Fat Head','A comedian replies to the \"Super Size Me\" crowd by losing weight on a fast-food diet while demonstrating that almost everything you think you know about the obesity \"epidemic\" and healthy eating is wrong.','/wIEEV2bqJfZXQcB79DzY1Okb9wD.jpg','2009-02-03',104,'Released',NULL,'Fat Head',36944,1.2839,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26578,_binary '\0','/6opP1ChcxCXb9FS7yEn1xyxIIJC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334102',5.3,30759,'en','The Resident','Juliet, a beautiful doctor, has found the perfect New York apartment to start a new life after separating from her husband. It\'s got spacious rooms, a spectacular view, and a handy, handsome landlord. But there are secrets behind every wall and terror in every room as Juliet gets the unnerving feeling that she is not alone.','/hoZiRe5EK4vIUjvjRf1aUk5RVg4.jpg','2011-02-10',91,'Released','She thought she was living alone','The Resident',50671,5.8904,5.76,'SaRDsYnYGeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26579,_binary '\0','/zDGHVU8OdQVOkXTGaxhv8rBafPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334104',5.4,1253,'ml','സാഗർ എലിയാസ് ജാക്കി റീലോഡഡ്','Sagar, known as Jackie, among the criminal underworld, is called by his friend Indu to rescue her husband Manu from the Rozario gang, who kidnapped him. Jackie rescues Manu with ease, but it ensues a gang war.','/lz0zdJPSf4cbp44LXmYjJZVY06L.jpg','2009-03-26',140,'Released','In a world of villains we need a Hero.','Sagar Alias Jacky Reloaded',79650,1.2945,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26580,_binary '\0','/4jeW9IKxiDD0SJYYpaoSSOULqqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13341400',6.4,2057,'en','Christmas in Vienna','Jess, a concert violinist whose heart just isn’t in it anymore, goes to Vienna for a performance. While there, she finds the inspiration she has been missing, and a new love.','/cRKI2spqkQ90X67IVW9SpoU8vqw.jpg','2020-11-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in Vienna',726523,1.4233,6.4,'1oYUA