 15:21:07.000000'),(26585,_binary '\0','/swmNeUPUqLZRxx2R1yYeeeopX59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13342190',6.8,1328,'en','Love, Lights, Hanukkah!','As Christina prepares her restaurant for its busiest time of year, she gets back a DNA test revealing that she’s Jewish. The discovery leads her to a new family and an unlikely romance over eight nights.','/fPwBjXBgT8tOmtLuIIrBveYaa7f.jpg','2020-12-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Love, Lights, Hanukkah!',746062,2.0335,6.8,'RBY_DSb-FJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26586,_binary '\0','/vYYO6ssz07fXSU9FEcixZavGWQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13342238',6.8,1923,'en','Project Christmas Wish','For years Lucy has played Santa to her small town’s community by making their holiday wishes come true. But when Lucy grants a little girl’s wish for a Christmas like she used to have with her mom, she unexpectedly finds her own wishes coming true in life and love.','/3rrVRvULO7Hx4bHIinhfcbRYhzW.jpg','2020-12-20',84,'Released',NULL,'Project Christmas Wish',746480,1.5025,6.5,'ky8P_wavHHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26587,_binary '\0','/pv6HPDS9rSM1bXGQFfDE9gg9iqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13342406',6.9,1797,'ml','ആർക്കറിയാം','Shirley and Roy in the middle of an impending Covid lock-down and a personal financial crisis, leave their Mumbai home for Shirley\'s home in Pala where her father Ittyavira stays. Roy soon finds that her home is not what he thought it is.','/dDZlfPMOkC4rNFHbcTNlgRjagvL.jpg','2021-04-01',126,'Released',NULL,'Aarkkariyam',811554,1.1332,7.3,'EkeS429PUvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26588,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334254',7,1347,'hi','Maharathi','After his boss, Jai Singh, commits suicide, Subhash, a chauffeur, hatches a plan to win his insurance money. He teams up with Jai\'s wife, Mallika, to make the suicide look like a well-planned murder.','/uaJhmaUQFzQgQ7zoKDB4PUsHGur.jpg','2008-12-04',119,'Released',NULL,'Maharathi',16383,1.3919,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26589,_binary '\0','/ppf18IfACeWmkObqyjrhmNiL6G4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334260',7.1,161272,'en','Never Let Me Go','As children, Kathy, Ruth, and Tommy spend their childhood at an idyllic and secluded English boarding school. As they grow into adults, they must come to terms with the complexity and strength of their love for one another while also preparing for the haunting reality awaiting them.','/8F0r5ng9Fp60OhzQfR5v33fppq.jpg','2010-03-18',104,'Released','These students have everything they need. Except time.','Never Let Me Go',42188,8.3668,6.8,'sXiRZhDEo8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26590,_binary '\0','/zmezb1RtB8e0HbWekAV9WsMLfec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334278',6.1,1265,'en','Snow 2: Brain Freeze','When Nick gets amnesia, it\'s up to Sandy and Buddy the reindeer to save him and Christmas.','/Rnn2bXZZmUOyD80alueT0KoBWs.jpg','2008-12-14',86,'Released',NULL,'Snow 2: Brain Freeze',51836,2.6517,5.6,'V6TcloS25XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26591,_binary '\0','/xS1AhYocBWKhnqj8PzfQzyKyrjN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334313',6.6,1474,'el','Ακαδημία Πλάτωνος','A Greek shopkeeper discovers something about his family\'s past when his mother embraces an Albanian worker.','/A79zd0zY9N6Wqx5WkteBJTBGSW1.jpg','2009-07-22',103,'Released',NULL,'Plato\'s Academy',37590,0.7721,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26592,_binary '\0','/ykErCezxPXT2yL7vFEM5pqaxMAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334328',7.1,2713,'el','Ψυχή Βαθιά','Two brothers are fighting on opposite sides during the Greek Civil War.','/u1NNoUIhJdmI9vlcLtW9T4pDrYl.jpg','2009-10-22',124,'Released',NULL,'With Heart & Soul',53128,0.9734,6.4,'Bje8YuNh4g8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26593,_binary '\0','/6eIXpbZc8WlLeT3bTUVpjRRqgin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334456',4.1,2101,'en','Ice Twisters','Charlie Price, a former scientist turned science fiction author, starts living one of his novels when the Federal Science Foundation\'s weather experiments escape control and turn disastrous.','/yaKcjBXIOnzOki4438QIsjxt3oD.jpg','2009-11-14',90,'Released','Hell has frozen over','Ice Twisters',34559,2.1604,5.9,'4wK5vmUSRGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26594,_binary '\0','/A8PZ4V2NjyGxlbedhlufqcbduHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334470',5.4,5086,'hi','रावण','A bandit leader kidnaps the wife of the policeman who killed his sister, but later falls in love with her.','/9fhM402gmREa5W9kvmCI8gojG1t.jpg','2010-06-18',138,'Released','Not just a story, a world.','Raavan',37460,1.3171,4.845,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26595,_binary '\0','/jhf7VPr85M2FeqCs7zlIs9JPxHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13344860',6.4,1743,'en','Christmas Tree Lane','Music store owner Meg spearheads the community effort to save the Christmas Tree Lane shopping district from demolition. As she finds herself falling for Nate, a recent acquaintance, she’s thrown when she learns his surprising tie to the developer.','/vs5yakgP0dmgi5WjbyfgkegF0V6.jpg','2020-10-24',80,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Tree Lane',737791,1.665,6.7,'2Vy4h7xaxNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26596,_binary '\0','/p2h886S7r4znUYvp1ELOTq7jqUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334512',5.7,54022,'en','Arthur','A drunken playboy stands to lose a wealthy inheritance when he falls for a woman that his family doesn\'t like.','/foUTAJurvnbUoIUbnuUk5dyHx7M.jpg','2011-04-08',110,'Released','Meet the world\'s only loveable billionaire.','Arthur',49012,4.6123,5.559,'IJpSdJJh278','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26597,_binary '\0','/o1MKuRXsPLHYjuMODP0J0XSLtkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334536',4.3,2178,'en','House of Bones','Psychic Heather Burton and a team of TV ghost hunters travel to investigate a haunted house surrounded by rumors of paranormal activity.','/hQhYefeuo645iFUeusHmvRhVpvi.jpg','2010-01-16',90,'Released','No One Here Gets Out Alive','House of Bones',50288,1.6479,4.3,'ll_Jrv9wIGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26598,_binary '\0','/R5wTkQNtYuPED9D4fFXtSGFZBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334537',6,6621,'en','Humpday','Imagine your life is somewhat complete with a house, job, and wife but then your best friend from college comes knocking at your door at 2 AM. During a pot-induced hedonistic party, a plan is hatched between the two friends to create an Art Film of “two really straight men having sex.” If they only knew how much this would affect all of their lives.','/y0Fkgopbb3OfslHYkAEiaDONmGl.jpg','2009-01-16',94,'Released','Some loves are meant to be. This one, not so much.','Humpday',23720,1.6357,5.3,'_1sQedSS5iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26599,_binary '\0','/3ubIRrPOmLg74gjgSUwXEXdHhSR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334553',6.7,31123,'en','The Perfect Host','Warwick Wilson is the consummate host. He carefully prepares for a dinner party, the table impeccably set and the duck perfectly timed for 8:30 p.m. John Taylor is a career criminal. He’s just robbed a bank and needs to get off the streets. He finds himself on Warwick’s doorstep posing as a friend of a friend, new to Los Angeles, who’s been mugged and lost his luggage.','/tYqk1u5d3eARg5gV8cF4RZFZKKQ.jpg','2010-07-01',93,'Released','Dinner parties are a dying art.','The Perfect Host',66195,3.3924,6.4,'MVe62FZMYAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26600,_binary '\0','/7bWxAsNPv9CXHOhZbJVlj2KxgfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13345606',6.5,177553,'en','Evil Dead Rise','A reunion between two estranged sisters gets cut short by the rise of flesh-possessing demons, thrusting them into a primal battle for survival as they face the most nightmarish version of family imaginable.','/5ik4ATKmNtmJU6AYD0bLm56BCVM.jpg','2023-04-12',96,'Released','Mommy loves you to death.','Evil Dead Rise',713704,24.9491,6.964,'BqQNO7BzN08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26601,_binary '\0','/jh5WBgOBsQB6BSd6JZUIOuae0eE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1334617',4.5,2597,'ar','طول عمري','For Rami, all is for the best in this best of all possible worlds, as long as he keeps to himself. But when his longtime lover leaves him to marry a woman and his best friends drift away, he comes face to face with the harsh realities of life as a gay man in Egypt. Against the backdrop of the choreographed crackdown on gay men and the notorious Queen Boat arrests of 2001, he plunges into a world of loveless friendships and spirals downwards to his ultimate downfall.','/9jDoSawjgmMhiugnVlMXTWpmXKW.jpg','2008-06-21',119,'Released',NULL,'All My Life',173539,1.2038,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26602,_binary '\0','/xEkNqpxZihxwUTl7YPvJ0swR2kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13349280',6,3994,'te','ఆడవాళ్లు మీకు జోహార్లు','Chiranjeevi is a bachelor seeking his perfect match. His family rejects a lot of alliances and search for a bride continues, until Aadhya enters the scene. However, Aadhya’s mother resists her daughter’s marriage to Chiru because it goes against what she believes as marriage to be – male dominance over females.','/bF8wcDaHNGkgTlCLvCsaC3quiRf.jpg','2022-03-04',139,'Released',NULL,'Aadavaallu Meeku Johaarlu',888299,1.4736,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26603,_binary '\0','/cDLN53hPa4dTufgqfcxXsrODuBq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13349716',7.6,17217,'te','శ్యామ్ సింగ రాయ్','A young filmmaker is in a soup right when he’s about to find his footing in the film industry. When he sets out to find an answer, turns out it’s in the past.','/5C2wGMdwTQDUMIltYnn9qGrOs8w.jpg','2021-12-24',157,'Released',NULL,'Shyam Singha Roy',799676,1.6715,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26604,_binary '\0','/xp6ZNacNFf9GmJe648fUqfbdyph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13349892',6.4,3822,'fr','Kompromat','Mathieu, a member of the French institute in Irkutsk, is arrested overnight by the Russian authorities. Imprisoned and accused of sexual abuse on his own daughter, he realises he is a victim of a Kompromat. With the help of the FSB, someone has built up a case to frame him. Isolated, he has no one to turn to. Proving his innocence is impossible: the only solution is to escape.','/6OimOLolZ94sy0KVmimRxqfxy8.jpg','2022-09-07',127,'Released','An ordinary frenchman trapped by the Russian state','Kompromat',852427,3.0004,6.314,'ktlAmBOmcEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26605,_binary '\0','/a6FYWepW86BDuqcU0bWRPzE6hcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13350066',6,1595,'te','థ్యాంక్యూ','Abhiram aka Abhi is a successful entrepreneur who calls himself ‘self-made’ and doesn’t believe anyone but himself is the reason for his success. But when he’s forced to look back on life, what does he realise?','/8wrpCfKmeyFLSE3pOYdY5TR4kw2.jpg','2022-07-21',127,'Released',NULL,'Thank You',902552,0.9974,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26606,_binary '\0','/6vOH2yvvzpPoL6PlIoogF7pioBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13350412',4.3,2489,'ta','ஈஸ்வரன்','A close-knit family begins to come apart at the seams due to an astrologer\'s predictions of an imminent tragedy.','/8JPPP8SPYihm8nsvI7RVlngm6ZK.jpg','2021-01-15',125,'Released',NULL,'Eeswaran',764179,0.997,4.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26607,_binary '\0','/ojsxr2OXLmmMDNK0dYhcJbEynII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13350688',6.4,2267,'en','Chateau Christmas','Margot, a world-renowned pianist, returns to Chateau Newhaus to spend the holidays with her family and is reunited with an ex who helps her rediscover her passion for music.','/6ZgaL0HewMSMlvV6FHXG7VwtTMe.jpg','2020-10-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Chateau Christmas',737779,2.3098,6.2,'q99-EcFKboU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26608,_binary '\0','/A47ST56xzw6zuHhHZiylLgfNRIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13352376',5.7,1558,'en','Lyvia\'s House','When a young journalist suspects the disappearance of a beautiful artist is connected to murders that took place 20 years earlier, she uncovers a reality she never could have imagined. Inspired by true events.','/j5kOuFOQ84DPH94RJ6U1MWT9UJX.jpg','2024-01-13',117,'Released','Blood tells.','Lyvia\'s House',1072805,1.287,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26609,_binary '\0','/43phzieCEWNm4A69ABYMcTr5Bl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13352838',6.8,2161,'en','Break Every Chain','Drowning in the depths of depression and sadness, burning with anger, and chained down by alcoholism, Jonathan couldn’t do it anymore. After the loss of his father as a young boy, facing countless horrific death scenes in the line of duty, and the death of his son, Jonathan turned to the world for answers — finding only darkness. Faced with the threat of losing all that is left to him, Jonathan turns to faith and finds hope and redemption.','/7CBhCjBlT92Hivvke3laZn3rNkn.jpg','2021-03-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Break Every Chain',841575,1.343,6.9,'FPe9yKN6jS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26610,_binary '\0','/fILWktCfh0ZiKWjWwyXalWzSvKX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13352968',7.2,45352,'en','Good Luck to You, Leo Grande','Nancy Stokes, a retired schoolteacher, is pretty sure she has never had good sex. Now that her husband has died, she is determined to take a tour of sexual vistas that until now she has only imagined. She even has a plan; it involves an anonymous hotel room, and a sex worker who calls himself Leo Grande.','/dxxOmTq4LgQxiyU4rW53qdj9FoN.jpg','2022-06-16',97,'Released','It\'s never too late to try something new.','Good Luck to You, Leo Grande',758330,9.8242,7,'TJcbZoJFLTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26611,_binary '\0','/36xTkr5CxVGKqe55q6lxVa8LyK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13354204',6.7,6465,'pt','Tudo Bem no Natal Que Vem','After taking a very nasty fall on Christmas Eve, grinchy Jorge blacks out and wakes up one year later, with no memory of the year that has passed. He soon realizes that he’s doomed to keep waking up on Christmas Eve after Christmas Eve, having to deal with the aftermath of what his other self has done the other 364 days of the year.','/pv4e8yKGMJAaZihYPFUjYHsG8Ob.jpg','2020-12-03',101,'Released','Imagine waking up and everyday is Christmas day.','Just Another Christmas',755339,2.4201,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26612,_binary '\0','/zfZEpY4rQs3tFg8sBXXVsKjrXdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13356044',6.5,1380,'en','Cranberry Christmas','A separated couple feign marital bliss on national television to help their town’s Christmas festival – and their business. But what will the future hold for them when rekindled love is complicated by new opportunities?','/dUCDnRJAThDXofa7CCrQX1SPo0Q.jpg','2020-10-31',80,'Released',NULL,'Cranberry Christmas',737795,2.269,6.7,'Uu-4dNwAAHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26613,_binary '\0','/itLnzp64tAr6beI5LDo3mdkExZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13356246',7.1,1802,'en','Holly & Ivy','When Melody’s neighbor, Nina, learns that her illness has returned, Melody promises to keep Nina’s kids, Holly & Ivy, together. To adopt the children, she must renovate her new fixer-upper, which she does with the help of contractor, Adam.','/2L5CqrFgHgt9RYtpkGT0Baz0Jp2.jpg','2020-11-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Holly & Ivy',737793,1.4488,7.2,'ZZ6-VOXHWiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26614,_binary '\0','/qFTCDd3LYMgjcUNQnkhAtk2XHql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13356580',7.4,1351,'bn','Mainkar Chipay','Three men are caught in a situation inside a car. One of them is a rich man who regularly sources cocaine from a fixed peddler at a fixed spot, another is a drug dealer who comes late and the third one is a cop. What happens next?','/e6RTnLXcvA4TkvYW5rpy9pLUa12.jpg','2020-11-09',50,'Released',NULL,'Mainkar Chipay',762338,1.934,7.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26615,_binary '\0','/56pQfNPTgGELk0LtvMbSo9AbO2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13356884',7.1,3807,'ja','ヤクザと家族 The Family','Taken in by the yakuza at a young age, Kenji swears allegiance to his old-school boss, pledging to adhere to the family code amid ever-changing times.','/tglfGYH372S7Pft0hUyYLsO8M2B.jpg','2021-01-29',136,'Released','I didn\'t have a father or a mother, but I had a family.','A Family',736146,3.4776,7.313,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26616,_binary '\0','/ykvcmLLLsKSMfWCfo2mXPEbOSTC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13357258',6.7,1501,'en','The Christmas Bow','When an accident puts her music dreams on hold, a gifted violinist reconnects with an old family friend, who helps her heal and find love during the holidays.','/aYhWFeMdknJlrV7AZY70rk7XStw.jpg','2020-11-08',84,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Bow',737794,1.2231,6.9,'GzF7TCGaitM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26617,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13357492',8.3,2064,'te','Rallalo Neeru','Neela cannot explain her past actions easily, but her blackmailer has his own demands. Her marriage gets into trouble, but there are bigger questions about love and identity.','/eWG4L7DUma7VWuAWWDfKyce5MDl.jpg',NULL,105,'Released','Hidden Waters','Hidden Waters',1719571,1.5673,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26618,_binary '\0','/vJbEUMeI2AxBUZKjP6ZVeVNNTLh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13357520',6.4,72381,'en','Heads of State','The UK Prime Minister and US President have a public rivalry that risks their countries\' alliance. But when they become targets of a powerful enemy, they\'re forced to rely on each other as they go on a wild, multinational run. Allied with Noel, a brilliant MI6 agent, they must find a way to thwart a conspiracy that threatens the free world.','/lVgE5oLzf7ABmzyASEVcjYyHI41.jpg','2025-06-24',117,'Released','Two heads are better than one.','Heads of State',749170,21.423,6.8,'8J646zM7UM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26619,_binary '\0','/3G3IhTlSiCfaFqdY1xv6Xa0MCTK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13358022',5.3,2269,'en','The Reading','After a deadly home invasion, Emma (Mo\'Nique Hicks) copes by writing a book, but when a young psychic and her team perform a reading in her home, a new terror is unleashed.','/vqeTY6g1ZTT7mkrvlSCiVgft8Wr.jpg','2023-02-02',96,'Released',NULL,'The Reading',1081694,1.9284,7.5,'QudfA-FDocA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26620,_binary '\0','/xm3VRqZFeWNEBpT5aVMGGfWxgAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13358054',6,1455,'tr','Dilberay','Born into a poor family with eight children in Kahramanmaraş, Dilber Ay endured many sorrows and hardships in the life she began in a tent. At the age of 13, she was sold to an older man for money, they married, and had children. She was beaten and tortured for singing, but despite all the pain she endured, she rose to the top of the stage with the strength she drew from her God-given voice, and she also experienced prison. She never gave up, always singing her way out of the bottomless pits she fell into.','/oC7SP4iYOTxdXKgagM8hXN45FtF.jpg','2022-02-04',130,'Released',NULL,'Dilberay',931653,1.4555,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26621,_binary '\0','/nyt0jlofZyjhRqiQkEp0cdoKaS3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1335975',6.3,181095,'en','47 Ronin','Kai—an outcast—joins Oishi, the leader of 47 outcast samurai. Together they seek vengeance upon the treacherous overlord who killed their master and banished their kind. To restore honour to their homeland, the warriors embark upon a quest that challenges them with a series of trials that would destroy ordinary warriors.','/xDHnmcroujCRG0ysYQaiswjbyHd.jpg','2013-12-06',119,'Released','For courage. For loyalty. For honor.','47 Ronin',64686,11.4958,6.212,'DEoDulGTElE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26622,_binary '\0','/xxAZYZU9IfVazeyTooB6m5XJoew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1336006',6.3,11824,'en','The Revenant','A horror movie/buddy comedy about Joey and his undead friend Bart who comes back from the dead as a revenant: an articulate zombie that needs to drink blood to arrest the decomposition of his body.','/bECzzYkRFlCZZAjQ9wboMGyWFcL.jpg','2009-08-16',117,'Released','What could be worse than having your best friend die?','The Revenant',79896,2.869,6.17,'bN1ZV-aYooY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26623,_binary '\0','/diO9O2aKKHijX8Xxh8eJqjHd7VU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13361648',6,1857,'fr','Le Nouveau Jouet','Samy lives happily with his wife, Alice, in a poor urban housing project amongst friends and neighbours. For his son’s birthday, the richest man in France throws open his grand department store, offering the boy whatever he wants. Alexandre chooses Samy, the night watchman, as his new toy…','/rCSxzI0Y0pX6pqD69CusJhvQtIC.jpg','2022-10-19',111,'Released',NULL,'The New Toy',865498,3.0691,5.9,'t3O4E5rIkFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26624,_binary '\0','/bN8IsRxmRbltneliMi7UuYAdHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13362890',4.1,2721,'en','The Surprise Visit','When a young couple makes a surprise visit to Mom, they get an even bigger surprise themselves from an old family friend who plans to steal Mom’s valuable jewelry while she is out of town. But when the “easy peasy” robbery goes wrong, resulting in the accidental death of the daughter’s husband, it forces the two young drug addicts to make a difficult decision: to abandon ship, or do the unthinkable.','/a3J0t376OE1Vk3jKN67viY31s5.jpg','2022-01-14',86,'Released',NULL,'The Surprise Visit',917300,1.5564,4.5,'Bq69rGCjos4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26625,_binary '\0','/aEuqobdECu21h7Wy0wkCbjXMWZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13363828',4.5,4356,'en','We Need to Do Something','Seeking shelter from a storm, a family finds themselves trapped in a bathroom for days with no sign of rescue and untold evils lurking just beyond the walls.','/g0qiyVdMRaEdXfdR10TVveDProY.jpg','2021-09-03',97,'Released','It’s not just a storm. It’s something far more sinister.','We Need to Do Something',769364,2.5456,5.2,'TcmfY_ApDxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26626,_binary '\0','/9H8wGFwKKt2ADRhg2odywTg1NCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13364334',6.2,3242,'ja','キングコング対ゴジラ','The advertising director of Pacific Pharmaceuticals, frustrated with the low ratings of their sponsored TV program, seeks a more sensationalist approach. He orders his staff to Faro Island to capture King Kong for exploitation. As Godzilla re-emerges, a media frenzy generates with Pacific looking to capitalize off of the ultimate battle.','/dmCfyzUl0Ylk8Rpi6dYyWuBrnNr.jpg','1962-08-11',97,'Released','Will you win, Godzilla? Will you win, Kong? The battle of the century!','King Kong vs. Godzilla',1680,4.2079,6.9,'ljLQZXOUNjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26627,_binary '\0','/qwCUf2jbmrK7BbWprlfLvkzd0XM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13364468',5.6,11654,'hi','Love Hostel','Set against the pulsating backdrop of rustic North India, Love Hostel traces the volatile journey of star-crossed lovers, being hunted by a ruthless mercenary on the orders of the area\'s MLA, who also happens to be the girl\'s grandmother.','/gjp2tU35OCLErpIG5pKqgBc9Ch7.jpg','2022-02-25',101,'Released','Love against all odds!','Love Hostel',828901,1.3156,5.45,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26628,_binary '\0','/3UIAPRd4uu1IuYy8I3VfE55mdTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13364790',6.9,3784,'zh','你好，李焕英','Devastated after her mom\'s serious accident and grief-stricken because she hasn\'t become the daughter she wanted to be for her mother, a Chinese woman finds herself transported back in time to the year 1981, where she meets her younger mother before she was her mom.','/31W7qLEMqQKgdCeCtV9EbVi3bwG.jpg','2021-02-12',128,'Released',NULL,'Hi, Mom',758891,2.4035,7,'S_qZTk9109Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26629,_binary '\0','/zNockOWGS1bjbgiT4D2CEZi9mj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13365482',7.2,1621,'en','Frybread Face and Me','Two adolescent Navajo cousins from different worlds bond during a summer herding sheep on their grandmother\'s ranch in Arizona while learning more about their family\'s past and themselves.','/fp0tp7gblkTI3t7rKYvTOtS1uIx.jpg','2023-11-24',82,'Released',NULL,'Frybread Face and Me',844026,1.596,5.9,'WUgwL9B8L_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26630,_binary '\0','/iDTcJtM7MTRxkOpy1h7FuoS4t7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13365876',7,5523,'en','Pinball: The Man Who Saved the Game','The dramatic comedy is based on the true story of writer and pinball wizard Roger Sharpe, chronicling his journey to overturn New York City’s 35-year ban on pinball.','/gjGphbx4ZDwAYYWImpY427KGw7B.jpg','2023-03-17',92,'Released','Find what you want and take the shot.','Pinball: The Man Who Saved the Game',855262,2.7709,7.1,'yBLpGUu6HCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26631,_binary '\0','/vR21OepmSu0sx2qHh8Lcpgx9IKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1336601',4.8,2385,'fr','La Meute','In the middle of a snowy no man\'s land, Charlotte picks up Max, a hitchhiker; they stop in a truck-stop restaurant, and when Max doesn\'t come back from the bathroom, Charlotte starts looking for him in vain. She decides to return during the night but gets kidnapped by the bartender, La Spack, who turns out to be Max\'s mother and needs to feed her kids, \'The pack\', a bunch of blood lusting ghouls. Charlotte now faces a terrifying reality: these ghouls are already dead... and hungry. Alone and in the middle of nowhere, she quickly realizes... she\'s next on the menu!','/vC2tiHgSKGWFDDBkvGu883JwBdU.jpg','2010-09-29',85,'Released',NULL,'The Pack',52369,1.3177,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26632,_binary '\0','/9b1KGgzmZsUl7g3p1bjjpMRxANe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1336608',5.9,85105,'en','Rock of Ages','A small town girl and a city boy meet on the Sunset Strip, while pursuing their Hollywood dreams.','/oVeE2QTUb14jPU2lYEGPE3s8T9j.jpg','2012-06-13',123,'Released','Nothin\' but a good time.','Rock of Ages',80585,7.5736,6.2,'jFiDeufhxSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26633,_binary '\0','/tZP2xJaUgCFByVMDYHyEOJiCSX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1336617',6.3,37615,'en','Cyrus','With John\'s social life at a standstill and his ex-wife about to get remarried, a down on his luck divorcée finally meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover she has another man in her life - her son. Before long, the two are locked in a battle of wits for the woman they both love-and it appears only one man can be left standing when it\'s over.','/qkJ0rB1qf62TJ6thxEVRT7Eccqn.jpg','2010-06-18',91,'Released','John met the woman of his dreams. Then he met her son...','Cyrus',39053,3.8103,5.926,'lMw0kLmuHOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26634,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13369990',6.5,2098,'te','Gully Gang','A film about a boy who doesn\'t know how to love and the difficulties he faces when he begins to fall in love with the support of his friends. Based on real events, this is a story of innocent love in a small town.','/faxF6tJc5NdRrLS1baO7Uzv83dh.jpg','2022-02-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Gully Gang',1433325,0.8173,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26635,_binary '\0','/2ynwipRzCLZo4WQFUCoKnXdGoj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337032',7.3,8344,'en','Trailer Park Boys: Countdown to Liquor Day','Ricky, Julian and Bubbles are about to get out of jail, and this time, Julian vows to go straight, even open a legit business. Soon the Boys will all be rich. At least that\'s what they\'ve told the parole board. But when they arrive back at the park, they find it\'s not the same old Sunnyvale - and it\'s not the same old Jim Lahey, Trailer Park Supervisor.','/8Lah6OK2sOPuJc5NsUc443PrHE4.jpg','2009-09-25',101,'Released','The only difference between you and them is a coupla drinks.','Trailer Park Boys: Countdown to Liquor Day',27561,1.6583,6.6,'Mrfqn7QsILE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26636,_binary '\0','/bzUJzGxmQdD3I7gFFLSalEN9ikx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337051',7,5566,'ro','Polițist, adjectiv','A cop named Cristi must go undercover to trail teen Victor who is suspected of selling pot in the north-eastern city of Vaslui.','/yiimBQLll8l6SXyNjder7ToilDi.jpg','2009-07-03',110,'Released','In a world where crime has no meaning','Police, Adjective',32511,1.4585,6.5,'UxHIY7yP2Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26637,_binary '\0','/vRf517K6cVc9XbN0qlt2owTVMmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337057',6.2,21519,'en','Rampage','The boredom of small town life is eating Bill Williamson alive. Feeling constrained and claustrophobic in the meaningless drudgery of everyday life and helpless against overwhelming global dissolution, Bill begins a descent into madness. His shockingly violent plan will shake the very foundations of society by painting the streets red with blood.','/xZZlA5obgTrQMyAF16yqCiVxHlO.jpg','2009-09-27',84,'Released','Vengeance is ruthless.','Rampage',38780,3.5326,6,'RTvjjxWguNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26638,_binary '\0','/wwal3W3nbVMv3A7NiF2OpLomZLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337117',7.1,3011,'en','Nightmares in Red, White and Blue','An exploration of the appeal of horror films, with interviews of many legendary directors in the genre.','/lI1MdPIr8zghXVGvOX7J2k3YJt5.jpg','2009-08-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Nightmares in Red, White and Blue',43065,1.6656,6.5,'4NYDc31loA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26639,_binary '\0','/xsIUIFmc7lVmuzOHSm4TKHqpiFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337137',7,3207,'en','South of the Border','A road trip across five countries to explore the social and political movements as well as the mainstream media\'s misperception of South America while interviewing seven of its elected presidents.','/8JwbicUe7NsPk6azviHzUGpXT41.jpg','2009-09-07',102,'Released',NULL,'South of the Border',47426,2.6232,6.1,'qoRjmYm6ry4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26640,_binary '\0','/icRf4BAaM33WbycD8IiOybm050.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337193',6,2127,'en','Guy and Madeline on a Park Bench','After connecting with the shy Madeline, a jazz trumpeter embarks on a quest for a more gregarious paramour, but through a series of twists and turns punctuated by an original score, the two lovers seem destined to be together.','/7bu5XiVNVSlJkdihAv7Bnkdah3i.jpg','2010-03-28',83,'Released',NULL,'Guy and Madeline on a Park Bench',46504,1.4124,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26641,_binary '\0','/7k7U0XWjo5LRAu9UxF9iGE3pCrF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13372794',5.3,8812,'en','The Manor','After suffering a stroke, Judith moves into a historic nursing home, where she begins to suspect something supernatural is preying on the residents. With no one willing to believe her, Judith must either escape the confines of the manor, or fall victim to the evil that dwells within it.','/eNf7Dp1m6eTKDY7p56iZdterZkL.jpg','2021-10-08',81,'Released','Enjoy your stay.','The Manor',767499,3.4442,5.484,'kKIhdhesFTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26642,_binary '\0','/8y556k6ihZeYv2OXcFHTdMJKp1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13372884',4.5,2631,'en','Black as Night','A teenage girl with self-esteem issues finds confidence in the most unlikely way, by spending her summer battling vampires that prey on New Orleans\' disenfranchised with the help of her best friend, the boy she\'s always pined for, and a peculiar rich girl.','/mx6cgtUiEOVGSI3sb3SNQxAXqRa.jpg','2021-10-01',87,'Released','Find your own way to slay.','Black as Night',767504,2.4409,5.5,'iuXnGbxTxDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26643,_binary '\0','/sG4zvv1Ahl2jHxyVnwuMHOP2Clx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13372944',4.9,2060,'en','Madres','A Mexican-American couple expecting their first child relocate to a migrant farming community in 1970\'s California. When the wife begins to experience strange symptoms and terrifying visions, she tries to determine if it\'s related to a legendary curse or something more nefarious.','/19pHi0qrUKvnUtwx6EoVbFNxg1E.jpg','2021-10-08',83,'Released','Fear grows inside.','Madres',796428,2.5899,5.6,'GNusqV6dUfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26644,_binary '\0','/4lmDTjpZNf5S1DlFzIbuQ7dus7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13372992',4.3,3192,'en','Bingo Hell','In the barrio of Oak Springs lives a strong and stubborn group of elderly friends who refuse to be gentrified. Their leader, Lupita, keeps them together as a community, a family. But little did they know, their beloved bingo hall is about to be sold to a much more powerful force than money itself.','/86VKuiaox9eVJTETel0ld7XZtiO.jpg','2021-10-01',85,'Released','Are you feeling lucky?','Bingo Hell',802226,1.8151,4.6,'m1DQx4Z-QPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26645,_binary '\0','/bv6MRtlmuFJQXAK6IiGJc4uBE7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337366',6.4,5090,'no','NOKAS','On the 5th of April 2004, the greatest bank robbery in Norwegian history was carried out in Stavanger. The events are seen through the eyes of those who were directly involved – the bank robbers, police officers and employees of the firm. The film is based on testimonies of eye-witnesses and unfolds in the places where the attack took place.','/eijeX7rgZgUieYVEIUoLsH0rrEX.jpg','2010-10-01',87,'Released',NULL,'NOKAS',48161,1.9947,6.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26646,_binary '\0','/3oqmk6mNWPatBKcjOOJLp5WW9zN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13375076',6.1,103859,'en','The Pope\'s Exorcist','Father Gabriele Amorth, Chief Exorcist of the Vatican, investigates a young boy\'s terrifying possession and ends up uncovering a centuries-old conspiracy the Vatican has desperately tried to keep hidden.','/jFC4LS5qTAT3PinzdEzINfu1CV9.jpg','2023-04-05',103,'Released','Inspired by the actual files of Father Gabriele Amorth, Chief Exorcist of the Vatican.','The Pope\'s Exorcist',758323,13.3196,6.903,'YJXqvnT_rsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26647,_binary '\0','/rsrlU3IywvRTTcdXHq0Z0GG6X4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1337672',7.1,1239,'ja','のだめカンタービレ 最終楽章 前編','Chiaki is an aspiring conductor who faces the challenge of leading an orchestra which is made up of substitutes. Nodame gives her support to her beloved as she works hard towards achieving her dream to pass a promotion exam at their music conservatory. Will Chiaki be able to revive a broken down orchestra and launch his musical career? What will become of Nodame and Chiaki\'s relationship?','/tY6nbHxXiu95zNjUfrQmZhi6VVf.jpg','2009-12-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Nodame Cantabile: The Movie I',37555,1.8604,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26648,_binary '\0','/wJrvNljE4lZDd5D7cIxi6xAVVZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13377488',5.5,3056,'pl','W jak morderstwo','A stay-at-home mom and avid reader of crime stories discovers the deepest secrets of a small town\'s residents while investigating a woman\'s murder.','/i4CLIpT1lEOtVvOsF3dajDTXxuc.jpg','2021-06-18',104,'Released',NULL,'In for a Murder',846167,2.1569,6.148,'tesvZRRAH-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26649,_binary '\0','/eADnOVYMUVMh6QIynBEowqSdrCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13380288',5.2,1912,'en','32 Weeks','After a car accident leaves a young woman with amnesia, she is torn between the new man in her life that she can\'t remember and her ex who she can\'t forget.','/sKXAnLdy32IPilze5pFNdDeeulx.jpg','2020-11-12',82,'Released',NULL,'32 Weeks',772918,2.152,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26650,_binary '\0','/hZiVR0mn81iyYnRQNw7gGRaHkw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13380324',5.5,4514,'en','Night Shift','A young woman working her first night shift at a remote motel begins to suspect that she is being followed by a dangerous character from her past. As the night progresses and increasingly supernatural events occur, she quickly finds out that nothing is what it appears to be.','/shsdw00R6RwkGsUmT7O5cKhmLqv.jpg','2023-03-03',83,'Released','Fear never sleeps.','Night Shift',829038,2.7003,6.204,'As0fOZt59bI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26651,_binary '\0','/vH5ANgDUXDbf4QZLjHA60h74Ujv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13381368',7.1,2152,'en','Christmas with the Darlings','Just before the holidays Jessica Lew is ending her tenure as the assistant to her wealthy boss to use her recently earned law degree within his company, but offers to help his charming, younger brother as he looks after his orphaned nieces and nephew over Christmas.','/wp9CZP0rs134nfvAK5fsMq8kz9e.jpg','2020-11-08',83,'Released',NULL,'Christmas with the Darlings',746032,2.36,7,'Pn9rNfPe7pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26652,_binary '\0','/jWMWZ2ttg8B8YtVzG04UfhlcL67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13382698',5.1,3589,'en','Trigger Point','Nicolas Shaw is a retired U.S. special operative who becomes part of an elite \'invisible\' team that quietly takes out the worst villains around the world.','/qlXenN6jjgbsIyEJxBjkfkEU0q8.jpg','2021-04-23',82,'Released','Everyone breaks.','Trigger Point',809314,4.0922,6.2,'AiRRoArpkqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26653,_binary '\0','/b8TIc5E7Gg2avJ3nF3gdmdgF84z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13387604',6.8,3300,'da','Ternet Ninja 2','After Phillip Eppermint manages to evade a prison sentence in Thailand, Checkered Ninja comes alive and seeks out Alex. Together, with Alex and his entire family, they now have to go to Thailand to bust Eppermint.','/fjWiVF2vFwd3mhs1dNoS0SOHxqt.jpg','2021-08-19',86,'Released',NULL,'Checkered Ninja 2',778819,2.6026,6.9,'RubZfeopTKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26654,_binary '\0','/p30hhjHTRFA08f3Bo3GENQCu6ST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13389730',6.8,1894,'fr','Simone, le voyage du siècle','Simone Veil\'s life story through the pivotal events of Twentieth Century. Her childhood, her political battles, her tragedies. An intimate and epic portrait of an extraordinary woman who eminently challenged and transformed her era defending a humanist message still keenly relevant today.','/yyN4d1pz2kd5TNSOKjdTU7aSn2e.jpg','2022-10-12',140,'Released','We are responsible for what will unite us tomorrow','Simone: Woman of the Century',740937,2.7751,7.9,'cRbr8nDHr00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26655,_binary '\0','/1fEYjnbvtEPI3BH7Zy3dlUSSNBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1339122',5.9,2304,'de','Maria, ihm schmeckt\'s nicht!','When Jan decides to marry his girl-friend Sara, he is not aware of his opponent: her father, who is an Italian.','/vypsnoxI3ACS5CMAuP76QNAJIU3.jpg','2009-08-05',92,'Released',NULL,'Wedding Fever in Campobello',24631,1.6184,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26656,_binary '\0','/i7lCp1lXWpRro13cJNIWiR1fsMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13391444',7.1,1239,'en','The First Wave','When Covid-19 hit New York City in 2020, filmmaker Matthew Heineman gained unique access to one of New York’s hardest-hit hospital systems. The resulting film focuses on the doctors, nurses, and patients on the frontlines during the “first wave” from March to June 2020. Their distinct storylines each serve as a microcosm to understand how the city persevered through the worst pandemic in a century','/xLUeiYTLwLiwY0wreEeoU4qaU89.jpg','2021-11-19',94,'Released','Four months, New York City, 2020.','The First Wave',811769,1.3961,6.7,'vZR2VltfBSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26657,_binary '\0','/6vRV8t5yrfKNSJcmEzrNO1fWEFJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1339161',6.7,4732,'de','Der Räuber','A champion marathoner leads a double life as a serial bank robber, sprinting between fixes (and away from police cavalcades) as many as three times a day.','/wxJ579nYUXzy9WeI13hIPld8tDs.jpg','2010-02-26',96,'Released',NULL,'The Robber',54524,1.386,6.4,'f6MtEIKTlUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26658,_binary '\0','/bu4y8d1qn9eYlJJqMZLFwlpLB4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13391696',6.1,5177,'ml','കോൾഡ് കേസ്','Sathyajith, Assistant Commissioner of Police, along with his team is assigned to handle controversial and complicated cases. One day, while fishing on a lake side, a man finds a garbage bag trapped inside his net.','/6lodKsWEcNNlEPbE461pD2c2SuG.jpg','2021-06-30',139,'Released',NULL,'Cold Case',838609,1.1351,5.317,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26659,_binary '\0','/iEqs3MI7YmjMPJPMbrdFLYzgp5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13391708',6.7,6274,'fr','Les Cinq Diables','8-year-old Vicky has a mysterious gift: she can recreate any scent she comes across, even that of her beloved mother Joanne. When her estranged aunt Julia suddenly returns to town, the invocation of her fragrance plunges the young girl back in time to unravel a past replete with family secrets.','/eGk3tFSCdF48eEEFsEgV0UwCHqh.jpg','2022-08-31',96,'Released',NULL,'The Five Devils',820697,3.365,6.7,'GEKJSpHXuRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26660,_binary '\0','/qo4WSjKvtw6KztqhgK1tXsLuVP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13391710',8.3,22383,'ml','ജന ഗണ മന','After the mysterious death of a college professor triggers nationwide protests, a police officer’s pursuit of justice unravels layers of political manipulation and moral conflict, exposing how truth and power collide in the pursuit of justice.','/1bSPVn6HlkGYTQ4tJYJ0UGWnQM9.jpg','2022-04-28',162,'Released',NULL,'Jana Gana Mana',792358,1.6847,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26661,_binary '\0','/tFBVXnqmsmoSFR3rbltTfdGIMgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13392012',4.3,6852,'en','Demonic','A young woman unleashes terrifying demons when supernatural forces at the root of a decades-old rift between mother and daughter are ruthlessly revealed.','/tcKtX4XWZq6vhGwhmmB8thdaabV.jpg','2021-07-29',104,'Released','It\'s not a dream, it\'s not reality.','Demonic',774021,2.9407,4.827,'dUUtdDnxRuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26662,_binary '\0','/c1ZypCKxui6Il3vuD6FdC7Lu12I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1339248',8.2,1451,'kn','ಆಪ್ತಮಿತ್ರ','Apthamitra movie is based on Nagavalli (Dancer). Ramesh, an engineer buys the palace. Everyone believes that the spirit of Nagavalli, a dancer is captivated in a room of that palace. Ganga she opens the locked room with the help of Soumya. Then start the troubles. Vijay who came to ramesh house for holidays.','/utDXUezKnPoQ1yNJRg09MQkb14f.jpg','2004-08-27',146,'Released',NULL,'Apthamitra',282554,1.2995,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26663,_binary '\0','/4RnhZgXAwvPR1P3MYj3rLfW3kts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1339302',7.1,3645,'ja','劇場版 BLEACH Fade to Black 君の名を呼ぶ','A strange disturbance in the World of the Living sends Ichigo and Kon to the Soul Society, where the Seireitei has been devastated by an explosion of reishi and Rukia is missing. Stranger still, none of the Soul Reapers remember Ichigo, and they think he’s the one responsible for the destruction. Now on the run, Ichigo is forced into a lonely battle in order to find Rukia and stop the real culprits!','/IfR2DrWLb26AAdQFwGkhvPTflX.jpg','2008-12-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Bleach the Movie: Fade to Black',17165,5.0999,7.1,'TnO5S9pQzzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26664,_binary '\0','/4wvMg3cg4xwQ5vS3O5fuaBrKqwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13393128',7.3,1698,'en','The Princess','Decades after her untimely death, Princess Diana continues to evoke mystery, glamour, and the quintessential modern fairy tale gone wrong. As a symbol of both the widening fissures weakening the British monarchy and the destructive machinery of the press, the Princess of Wales navigated an unparalleled rise to fame and the corrosive challenges that came alongside it. Crafted entirely from immersive archival footage and free from the distraction of retrospective voices, this hypnotic and audaciously revealing documentary takes a distinctive formal approach, allowing the story of the People’s Princess to unfold before us like never before.','/kNU8gzCuoYuZr1hl36xAlCAxFwF.jpg','2022-05-30',104,'Released','Her life. Our obsession.','The Princess',913868,2.3751,6.4,'PisHN6iFq-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26665,_binary '\0','/6SZg4LRCQxyqVZ3TgRKJfhCjCYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13393728',7.1,2408,'th','อ้าย..คนหล่อลวง','Ina, whose ex-boyfriend runs off, leaving her in debt, manages to catch on a cunning con artist who tries to con her. But instead of turning him to the police, she hires this con artist to swindle her ex-boyfriend to get revenge.','/GFHtWpnMfxjZ1HCTkyXoyQWI6V.jpg','2020-12-03',128,'Released','A heartfelt comedy about the art of stealing your heart away.','The Con-Heartist',771257,3.2073,7.1,'md3CmFLGK6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26666,_binary '\0','/2ak94bJfXxHR5vBxwrpkycwOKv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13397574',6.3,25876,'en','Mothers\' Instinct','Housewives Alice and Celine are best friends and neighbours who seem to have it all. However, when a tragic accident shatters the harmony of their lives, guilt, suspicion and paranoia begin to unravel their sisterly bond.','/6EtPToJlGpjyuIxkIoztnBXYFgJ.jpg','2024-01-11',94,'Released','Sometimes it\'s the only thing you can trust.','Mothers\' Instinct',758679,8.1056,6.8,'4ltU9ooQ8x0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26667,_binary '\0','/hHwWcz2tcZXbGekTjAEd5xKbHd4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13399946',6.8,2737,'fr','Goliath','Patrick is a tenacious lawyer specializing in environmental law. France is a schoolteacher who becomes an activist after her husband develops cancer from exposure to a pesticide. Mathias is an ambitious lobbyist working for an international chemical corporation. The paths of these characters collide as the lives of thousands are affected by a tragic act that sparks a powerful movement while the corporation fights to prevent the truth from being revealed.','/qjoOtXctgy2TeonJ66STfukizTN.jpg','2022-03-09',121,'Released','The truth can’t be silenced forever','Goliath',884971,1.8389,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26668,_binary '\0','/cS6zJA973HDSQ7yqCAdBEDbQCqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13400142',7.1,1464,'hu','A játszma','During the Cold War, the secret service of Kádár began a more dangerous state security game than ever before.','/iikGOkF5pIMhJW0TdQHgiePry79.jpg','2022-06-09',112,'Released',NULL,'The Game',925471,2.2292,6.333,'Z0fXM7c6yZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26669,_binary '\0','/wIb43RlPf5iYeoBAYIfxfhpE8NI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13400336',3.9,1691,'en','The Best Man','Mercenaries seize control of a remote resort hotel during a wedding and it\'s up to the best man, the groom and their drunken best friend to stop the terrorists and save the hostages.','/c9f6mFZqkyz4AD0sxGmynE1pe0v.jpg','2023-04-21',93,'Released',NULL,'The Best Man',1094319,4.3117,6,'fFrk7YkpAus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26670,_binary '\0','/503LUrI9juBk1rktOPzxyMUTDEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340094',4.7,42939,'en','The Crow','Soulmates Eric and Shelly are brutally murdered when the demons of her dark past catch up with them. Given the chance to save his true love by sacrificing himself, Eric sets out to seek merciless revenge on their killers, traversing the worlds of the living and the dead to put the wrong things right.','/g8TbOXrNMuqq7AaKqdvqS2oG4ob.jpg','2024-08-21',111,'Released','True love never dies.','The Crow',957452,11.7001,5.8,'4CLE3pWAAr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26671,_binary '\0','/jso7QKHWwkdlEHFef68kFWHsltx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340107',7.6,43258,'da','Hævnen','The lives of two Danish families cross each other, and an extraordinary but risky friendship comes into bud. But loneliness, frailty and sorrow lie in wait.','/dJpPpgf2z5lNw6xVxvfWm0lexNH.jpg','2010-08-26',118,'Released',NULL,'In a Better World',44716,3.2506,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26672,_binary '\0','/gVgpNGHkgK8iPfKnc89jL8kmKsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340108',6.6,5430,'en','Killer Bean Forever','When things go bad in Beantown, top assassin Killer Bean is called to clean-up the mess. Detective Cromwell finds himself in the middle between Killer Bean and mob boss Cappuccino.','/qZTCweihd6H8IM2W1Bgk7M3HKrf.jpg','2008-09-05',85,'Released','If you want to take him down, you better bring backup.','Killer Bean Forever',24528,2.6077,7.179,'Og7-2JjjZ1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26673,_binary '\0','/xj1uRzJqwnP4jhBg8CZ4WbjWH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340123',7,3937,'en','Samson and Delilah','Samson, a cheeky 15-year-old boy, and Delilah, live in an isolated Aboriginal community in the Central Australian desert. The two teenagers soon discover that life outside the community can be cruel. Lost, unwanted and alone they discover that life isn’t always fair, but love never judges.','/w5BD4rNvGthCZSoJzJsIO8bQJhA.jpg','2009-05-07',101,'Released','True love.','Samson and Delilah',47075,1.5461,6.3,'VRDli5ZKMeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26674,_binary '\0','/wvlIoof1FnKPLv9jAYanuP31V0C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340138',6.3,309971,'en','Terminator Genisys','The year is 2029. John Connor, leader of the resistance continues the war against the machines. At the Los Angeles offensive, John\'s fears of the unknown future begin to emerge when TECOM spies reveal a new plot by SkyNet that will attack him from both fronts; past and future, and will ultimately change warfare forever.','/oZRVDpNtmHk8M1VYy1aeOWUXgbC.jpg','2015-06-23',126,'Released','Reset the future.','Terminator Genisys',87101,28.9358,5.961,'Dx3ShEjUId0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26675,_binary '\0','/gIpDAN7mLGzaKEWA6WVd2hphk6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340161',4.7,1530,'en','The Prince & Me 4: The Elephant Adventure','One year after their royal wedding, King Edvard and Queen Paige of Denmark receive an invitation to attend the wedding of Princess Myra of Sangyoon. Upon their arrival, Paige finds Myra is unhappy with her arranged marriage to the brooding and sinister Kah and is secretly in love with a young elephant handler named Alu.','/fEKnwl4m8DRn7MkAqWIt6RN2y67.jpg','2010-03-23',90,'Released',NULL,'The Prince & Me 4: The Elephant Adventure',36515,3.1882,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26676,_binary '\0','/oVv5l6L5Wi5j3gd4P2vt0YvVMOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13403046',6.7,95384,'en','Fresh','Frustrated by scrolling dating apps only to end up on lame, tedious dates, Noa takes a chance by giving her number to the awkwardly charming Steve after a produce-section meet-cute at the grocery store.','/tlu71AgaL3EQBBCNGsAwZLPbV5D.jpg','2022-03-03',114,'Released','It\'s not for everyone.','Fresh',787752,6.5295,6.943,'wKk5VAK1GZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26677,_binary '\0','/4hSBnr2CC62j5eTVo6tje3VX8WU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340425',7.1,4965,'en','DMT: The Spirit Molecule','THE SPIRIT MOLECULE weaves an account of Dr. Rick Strassman\'s groundbreaking DMT research through a multifaceted approach to this intriguing hallucinogen found in the human brain and hundreds of plants, including the sacred Amazonian brew, ayahuasca. Utilizing interviews with a variety of experts to explain their thoughts and experiences with DMT, and ayahuasca, within their respective fields, and discussions with Strassman’s research volunteers, brings to life the awesome effects of this compound, and introduces us to far-reaching theories regarding its role in human consciousness.','/8OwP5TRrnYSPPWDHzIuNFM5sH7B.jpg','2010-10-15',75,'Released','Within us all…','DMT: The Spirit Molecule',53778,1.8307,6.1,'PXKX5efoW5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26678,_binary '\0','/i2GVEvltEu3BXn5crBSxgKuTaca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13405778',5.5,66587,'en','Insidious: The Red Door','To put their demons to rest once and for all, Josh Lambert and a college-aged Dalton Lambert must go deeper into The Further than ever before, facing their family\'s dark past and a host of new and more horrifying terrors that lurk behind the red door.','/d07phJqCx6z5wILDYqkyraorDPi.jpg','2023-07-05',107,'Released','It ends where it all began.','Insidious: The Red Door',614479,23.5057,6.528,'ZuQuOnYnr3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26679,_binary '\0','/1jKBfRyeyJvBkJSKvNQ4nhIzTSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13405810',6.7,25698,'en','Quiz Lady','A brilliant but tightly wound, gameshow-obsessed young woman, Anne, and her estranged, train-wreck of a sister, Jenny, must work together to help cover their mother\'s gambling debts. When Anne\'s beloved dog is kidnapped, they set out on a wild, cross-country trek to get the cash the only way they know how: by turning Anne into a bona-fide gameshow champion.','/tqKiprkTUfXWi8bOjCl0lHtCwod.jpg','2023-09-09',100,'Released','Two sisters. One destiny.','Quiz Lady',787781,7.9637,6.702,'4OzaexEqDa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26680,_binary '\0','/5PnypKiSj2efSPqThNjTXz8jwOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13406136',5.7,17345,'en','The Princess','A beautiful, strong-willed young royal refuses to wed the cruel sociopath to whom she is betrothed and is kidnapped and locked in a remote tower of her father’s castle. With her scorned, vindictive suitor intent on taking her father’s throne, the princess must protect her family and save the kingdom.','/9pCoqX24a6rE981fY1O3PmhiwrB.jpg','2022-06-16',94,'Released','Bow to no one.','The Princess',759175,9.7297,6.8,'6kFCkfdOfMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26681,_binary '\0','/viwOsqPOSBS519lT9zGqXH8kpbC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340773',5,8048,'en','Elektra Luxx','A favor for a woman from her past throws the life of a pregnant, retired porn star into chaos.','/eLv57AjGugpx2shfaq9crEBVioL.jpg','2011-03-11',98,'Released','From adult film star to functioning adult.','Elektra Luxx',56272,2.9294,4.8,'wicRCAGNcpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26682,_binary '\0','/3T4arcGFPQaA88X54IQOGnCClWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340778',6.1,1282,'hi','I M 24','Saying the truth was always difficult, and lying, they say, is much simpler. Shubendu lives by the tougher option. But when this honest, 42 year old balding writer falls in love with a 22 year old beauty queen, he is tempted to lie. What\'s more, his jerk of a roommate, Gagan, who swears by the magic of lies, helps him cook up stories. What follows is a hilarious ride of lies, cover-ups, goof-ups and contradicting tales. Shubendu begins enjoying this ride. Why didn\'t he know that lying was so much fun?! But at some point, the madness has got to stop. The question is: When? This Saurabh Shukla directed romantic comedy will touch all hearts, both young and old.','/tEL8llpeGNyoxXgtvojTCyKp0cj.jpg','2010-10-30',114,'Released','The perks of lying.','I M 24',150914,0.6733,3.5,'1HVJtPfPAuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26683,_binary '\0','/6ZwscHN0bSIueTVTo6mlTGUUP90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340800',7,228166,'en','Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy','George Smiley, the aging master spy of the Cold War and once heir apparent to Control, is brought back out of retirement to flush out a top level mole within the Circus. Smiley must travel back through his life and murky workings of the Circus to unravel the net spun by his nemesis Karla \'The Sandman\' of the KGB and reveal the identity of the mole before he disappears.','/e0dZ7TapGY9HtJ9xk1TUHPEOccl.jpg','2011-09-16',127,'Released','How do you find an enemy who is hidden right before your eyes?','Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy',49517,9.4247,6.618,'VW-F1H-Nonk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26684,_binary '\0','/e7eVM6mAEVZ7XZOGKrNTboTK38b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1340838',5.7,4874,'hi','राज़ : दि मिस्ट्री कन्टिन्युज','An artist comes to realize that the woman he has been been painting is real and is being haunted by a ghost.','/muXsgB3xdW68OEQrKr1MzyPuzBS.jpg','2009-01-23',137,'Released',NULL,'Raaz: The Mystery Continues...',15980,1.5612,5.521,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26685,_binary '\0','/nBbn7tMrt3ECxEkt7QgzhA8x79f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13411298',6.5,1221,'ko','조제','A university student\'s life transforms when he meets a unique, imaginative woman who challenges his rigid worldview and opens his heart to new possibilities.','/grmn5qw3b0vYQCAM74OEdG6QHjb.jpg','2020-12-10',117,'Released','Our Most Beautiful Time.','Josée',602301,2.5091,7.2,'Db1mQuMBmP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26686,_binary '\0','/bVmDpF2VzVivzH8GVFXfVJeRPd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341167',7.3,91965,'en','Four Lions','Four Lions tells the story of a group of British jihadists who push their abstract dreams of glory to the breaking point. As the wheels fly off, and their competing ideologies clash, what emerges is an emotionally engaging (and entirely plausible) farce.','/x4JzaRPXBs9wiHCe3e3ymXWuwfd.jpg','2010-05-07',97,'Released','We are four Lions.','Four Lions',37495,4.362,6.9,'o_yOtVBR0CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26687,_binary '\0','/y874crIlrWV1QFSSQ8m9kSceARX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341188',5.4,58071,'en','How Do You Know','After being cut from the USA softball team and feeling a bit past her prime, Lisa finds herself evaluating her life and in the middle of a love triangle, as a corporate guy in crisis competes with her current, baseball-playing beau.','/jbOnp79eUZxQHgcdnTIRlxel1dE.jpg','2010-12-17',121,'Released','How do you know it\'s love?','How Do You Know',42888,6.6144,5.3,'bS7CmZdhwmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26688,_binary '\0','/pfcj8IYB5bK8RTWiHwOCGfIzVw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13412252',6.9,16075,'ko','킹덤: 아신전','Tragedy, betrayal and a mysterious discovery fuel a woman\'s vengeance for the loss of her tribe and family.','/piGZDwFW4urLYDWGiYJMrt6hdCS.jpg','2021-07-23',92,'Released','And so it begins.','Kingdom: Ashin of the North',845222,6.3872,7.102,'YTqz2QYsSeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26689,_binary '\0','/drRxbu2OHG0DEENptZ8wI5f0uEU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341338',7,77928,'en','Good Luck, Have Fun, Don\'t Die','A \'Man from the Future\' arrives at an LA diner where he must recruit the precise combination of disgruntled patrons to join him on a one-night quest to save the world from the terminal threat of a rogue artificial intelligence.','/rWcfOdY7TU6lTdazWj0ebDZnAfO.jpg','2026-02-13',134,'Released','Time is running out. Are you ready to join the revolution?','Good Luck, Have Fun, Don\'t Die',1119449,19.3712,7.1,'CaSxNAZUKsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26690,_binary '\0','/6CVu24jTAbSDnTQ68MLNOztOleB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341340',5.2,2597,'en','A Warrior\'s Heart','Unable to cope with his military father\'s sudden death in combat, quick-tempered teen, Conor, starts getting into serious trouble. During an intense lacrosse camp, his father\'s old friend challenges Conor to get his life on track and become a man.','/rZsmMHmSZGj2hcYGNsHFLomw37E.jpg','2011-12-02',86,'Released','In the twilight of their youth... her love gave him the courage to win.','A Warrior\'s Heart',79699,3.1498,5.4,'Hepw_8fLhMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26691,_binary '\0','/wwSEfqyDrCfuJOmQsNxo3e2cBK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341341',5.4,4636,'en','Ceremony','Sam Davis convinces his former best friend to spend a weekend with him to rekindle their friendship at an elegant beachside estate owned by a famous documentary filmmaker. However, it soon becomes clear that Sam is secretly infatuated with his ex, Zoe, who is now the filmmaker’s fiancée, and that his true intention is to thwart their impending nuptials. As Sam’s plan begins to unravel, he is forced to realize how complicated love and friendship can be.','/7o2JhrMOYmGoZTeghXqYW9sEQzz.jpg','2010-10-08',89,'Released','He\'s the love of her life. She just doesn\'t know it yet.','Ceremony',55246,1.797,5,'FKw0NTnXAMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26692,_binary '\0','/gVBXL3je3fxQBFwAoTPWTXGXQXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1341710',5.5,14911,'en','The Shrine','A group of young journalists investigate a cult said to practice human sacrifice, but their ambitious ways may lead them to becoming the cult\'s next victims.','/sfiHjYGnDUnJK7ag7xrzL8jiAX4.jpg','2010-10-14',85,'Released','Once you find it, they won\'t let you leave.','The Shrine',47763,2.454,5.51,'lqZ4P4aB92I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26693,_binary '\0','/95CF2gUtU0v0bwPtgkXAvVZZPNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13419036',7.5,2335,'lt','Piktųjų karta','On the verge of retirement, Commissioner Gintas must undertake the investigation of a series of heinous murders, a dangerous task that could expose the many dirty secrets of several prominent members of the social elite of a small Lithuanian town.','/9PZZHbpvzChfuFwzHXYGodpHfyc.jpg','2022-10-14',115,'Released',NULL,'The Generation of Evil',782044,1.6526,6.4,'TJrKIRO0yyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(2669