A brother and sister are split up after their mother dies, their father remarries, and their new stepmother rejects them.','/gaODc23oPdXpOPAWeqkWPrYcW9T.jpg','2009-04-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Mommo: Kız Kardeşim',85409,1.2029,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26700,_binary '\0','/qKVOTKPPtvoXd75L1HOSBPLtKWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13424422',7.2,2725,'ja','劇場版 ソードアート・オンライン-プログレッシブ- 星なき夜のアリア','Asuna Yuuki had never played online games until accidentally putting on the NerveGear for Sword Art Online, the world’s first VRMMORPG. She soon finds herself and other players trapped inside a game, where if a player dies in the game, they die in the real world. As she continues to live on in this world where death is always a step away, a solitary swordsman named Kirito appears before her.','/yD9RhgIVydQNBK7OLEbCWYcWMUd.jpg','2021-10-30',97,'Released','This might be a game, but it\'s not something you play!','Sword Art Online the Movie - Progressive - Aria of a Starless Night',761898,5.3437,7.8,'J3-lSaS2rlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26701,_binary '\0','/fStC0dSCRQslE9NzXa36EyOom81.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13428402',7.5,6304,'ja','STAND BY ME ドラえもん2','Nobita travels to the future to show his beloved grandma his bride, but adult Nobita has fled his own wedding.','/vBv8iOFPLnXmtELUjcFc7OKHsR4.jpg','2020-11-20',96,'Released','Can he ever be a good husband to Shizuka?','Stand by Me Doraemon 2',728754,6.1357,7.85,'rHieKpfmTOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26702,_binary '\0','/iQHLdyee3hiLBpliRliGp7ZpjRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13428686',6.3,1297,'ko','도굴','To acquire ancient artifacts for a private collector, a cunning grave robber and his band of ingenious thieves carry out a series of risky heists.','/76wWHYvG7EnIXWkrLfABBeLebsA.jpg','2020-11-04',114,'Released','We make money by digging.','Collectors',605680,1.8522,7.2,'0vl9-M7FFsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26703,_binary '\0','/fjRlDPqo2qqMBoUItMtTDZe9kvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13429362',5.1,13296,'en','In the Earth','As a deadly virus ravages the world, Dr. Martin Lowery embarks on a mission to reach test site ATU327A, a research hub deep in the Arboreal Forest. The arduous journey, guided by park scout Alma, is set back by a nighttime attack that leaves the two bruised and shoeless. When they run into Zach, a man living off the grid, they gratefully accept his help. Zach’s intentions aren’t exactly what they seem, however, and a path out of the forest and into safety quickly fades as the line between myth and science blurs.','/a2e9GLb14xX1DFv80nsioci5Zld.jpg','2021-04-16',107,'Released','Nature is a force of evil.','In the Earth',748853,3.9448,5.574,'3Lqkfo7IymU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26704,_binary '\0','/hIeEpk2w1dnC9ly9ZJwwbunH2Cx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13429870',7.6,25893,'es','Robot Dreams','A lonely dog\'s friendship with his robot companion takes a sad turn when an unexpected malfunction forces him to abandon Robot at the beach. Will Dog ever meet Robot again?','/ds402Qq09ybgBcXKiQNTZfzsP5o.jpg','2023-12-06',102,'Released','Experience a once-in-a-lifetime friendship beyond your wildest dreams','Robot Dreams',838240,9.8059,8,'0CHV_ZDlhrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26705,_binary '\0','/6fYTLy4QE55BgMiHF3Co7bErjry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13429928',3.5,1258,'en','Operation Seawolf','During the last days of World War II, Germany, desperate for any last grasp to defeat the allied powers, looked to their last remaining weapons and soldiers. The German Navy and the last remaining U-Boats were formed together for one desperate last mission – a mission to attack the United States Homeland, known as Operation Seawolf. Captain Hans Kessler, a grizzled submarine commander from both World Wars, is called into service to make one mission a success and help turn the tide of the war.','/eqm5EAyC9hJCN5qutuW4Ka1xYbU.jpg','2022-10-07',86,'Released','Last mission to win this war.','Operation Seawolf',1018494,4.0008,5.6,'d0EWwDcbtoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26706,_binary '\0','/81gRNBrqINV6lOtcaQbTtGe7tmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343046',7.2,2752,'ja','名探偵コナン 漆黒の追跡者（チェイサー）','A new member from the Black Organization that shrunk Shinichi\'s body manages to find out about Shinichi\'s transformation into Conan. This discovery starts to put those around him in danger as Gin and the other Black Organization members start to take action.','/1rqrypnOq4cuwzobGW9gQgarkSr.jpg','2009-04-18',111,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: The Raven Chaser',28764,4.6661,7.3,'8CstN3E8xac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26707,_binary '\0','/edht8pZUJ0QUkDQdsZXXZTzUsYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13430782',7.8,3715,'ml','ജാൻ-എ-മൻ','The hilarious comic twists that awaits when Joymon, desperate to escape his lonely, mundane and routine life in remote freezing Canada, decides to travel to his hometown in Kerala only to celebrate his 30th birthday, forms the base of the story.','/l7F5fx3wJBCOCfBjti5Ftq14kwe.jpg','2021-11-19',147,'Released',NULL,'Jan-e-Man',868882,1.0801,7.737,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26708,_binary '\0','/6CTHr1V5pi7PyZEyOyqmElsiHAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13430858',6.3,12706,'en','What\'s Love Got to Do with It?','Two childhood friends now in their thirties must decide whether to follow their heads or their hearts once the man decides to follow his parents\' advice and enter into an arranged marriage in Pakistan.','/uJJYCo87r6qtsaTRENatoYuE9pI.jpg','2023-01-26',109,'Released',NULL,'What\'s Love Got to Do with It?',800301,4.9207,6.1,'0LqOp2MNwao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26709,_binary '\0','/h5gSLRhquJEkXz7qmu8HhBN2x4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343089',6.6,1869,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第六章 忘却録音','January 1999: Apprentice mage Azaka Kokutou, Mikiya\'s younger sister, has been ordered by her mentor, Touko Aozaki, to investigate a certain incident in which fairies steal the memories of students at Azaka\'s school, Reien Academy. Azaka launches an investigation with the help of Shiki.','/xbjuKoI5pNLpFAhtGSne9mgpW5k.jpg','2008-12-20',59,'Released','\"No one can recover lost memories from oblivion.\"','The Garden of Sinners: Oblivion Recording',23166,2.3235,6.7,'XVAJ1o_fsbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26710,_binary '\0','/cf4YmtSnNhdG7s9ERmXyaDEznEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343092',7.2,649791,'en','The Great Gatsby','Nick Carraway arrives in New York in 1922, an era of loose morals, glittering jazz and bootleg kings. Chasing his own American Dream, Nick encounters the mysterious millionaire Gatsby and his bewitching cousin Daisy. Soon, Nick is drawn into the captivating world of the super-rich, their illusions, loves and deceits. Bearing witness to this new world, Nick pens a tale of impossible love, incorruptible dreams and unforgettable tragedy -- mirroring our own times and struggles.​','/nimh1rrDDLhgpG8XAYoUZXHYwb6.jpg','2013-05-09',143,'Released','Dream dangerously.','The Great Gatsby',64682,16.6064,7.3,'4w8lohkQtbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26711,_binary '\0','/qhohCrCs4sv1M4H9NIRlhgl0lcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343097',7.3,78209,'sv','Luftslottet som sprängdes','After taking a bullet to the head, Salander is under close supervision in a hospital and is set to face trial for attempted murder on her eventual release. With the help of journalist Mikael Blomkvist and his researchers at Millennium magazine, Salander must prove her innocence. In doing this she plays against powerful enemies and her own past.','/92byRQBuuiLcfKnBi5NOuipSgV8.jpg','2009-11-27',147,'Released','There\'s A Storm Coming','The Girl Who Kicked the Hornet\'s Nest',33613,6.0227,7.1,'vVGbPFdU96A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26712,_binary '\0','/rqWVnmGufBEyi9XeZMRZBjc3jsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343115',5.4,1687,'en','Nora Roberts\' Tribute','A former child star buys her grandmother\'s house to rescue it from ruin but her hope for serenity is soon eclipsed by haunting dreams of her famous grandmother, who died of a supposed overdose in the house more than 30 years ago.','/g5od91BiXm2AyS1EzSnRfiNSQYl.jpg','2009-04-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Nora Roberts\' Tribute',43303,1.8777,5.7,'3XZY3qbhAnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26713,_binary '\0','/wnn2Zf1ZuCgcCVaoNdp20OI2uTs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13432484',3.3,3462,'en','Zeros and Ones','Called to Rome to stop an imminent terrorist bombing, a soldier desperately seeks news of his imprisoned brother — a rebel with knowledge that could thwart the attack. Navigating the capital\'s darkened streets, he races to a series of ominous encounters to keep the Vatican from being blown to bits.','/a6balsDWCFMHPaPT6rFoBpNjR6z.jpg','2021-11-18',85,'Released','It\'s always deadliest before the dawn.','Zeros and Ones',762433,3.0608,4.7,'RHje2IaqZGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26714,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343362',3.8,1478,'hi','Do Knot Disturb','A rich businessman wants to hide his extra marital affair with a supermodel. He bribes a waiter into pretending to be the model\'s boyfriend. Mistaken identities and misunderstandings follow which are sure to take the viewers on a hilarious ride.','/vzj663OM9mE2vG4PlydpCwcE0LU.jpg','2009-10-02',126,'Released',NULL,'Do Knot Disturb',23275,1.3496,3.289,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26715,_binary '\0','/6XjMwQTvnICBz6TguiDKkDVHvgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13433802',6.2,182819,'en','A Quiet Place: Day One','As New York City is invaded by alien creatures who hunt by sound, a woman named Sam fights to survive with her cat.','/hU42CRk14JuPEdqZG3AWmagiPAP.jpg','2024-06-26',100,'Released','Hear how it all began.','A Quiet Place: Day One',762441,14.3237,6.629,'E-WIb4ATfT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26716,_binary '\0','/sTOBeWipCzZvdXYaZjWdtJ6Kmvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13434562',5.4,4412,'en','A Wounded Fawn','A local museum curator who is dipping her toe back into the dating pool is targeted by a charming serial killer. When a fateful romantic getaway between the two becomes a tense game of cat and mouse, both must confront the madness within him.','/4hbYw6ImWaDAja74tue3d7Yi3yX.jpg','2022-06-11',91,'Released',NULL,'A Wounded Fawn',964873,1.8422,5.4,'Ddx78lV-fps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26717,_binary '\0','/ilK1JRbMjo4sMJtNKLOKnqRf1RH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13434866',3,1751,'en','Spitfire Over Berlin','August 1944. With the American Eighth Air Force poised to strike over Nazi Germany, British Intelligence learns that they could be flying into a deadly trap. With only hours to spare, Flight Lieutenant Edward Barnes must fly a life and death mission over Berlin in his unarmed Spitfire to obtain photographic evidence and save the lives of 1200 men.','/xtPPOPTad1qopK6uDe3VlYUa22o.jpg','2022-05-13',80,'Released','One pilot\'s heroic mission to hell and back.','Spitfire Over Berlin',976906,1.7165,5.5,'ffieX5zZerA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26718,_binary '\0','/fszKktAJqDnWsp2iOhpa4gk2cfm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343703',7.4,11318,'ru','Брестская крепость','The film covers the heroic defence of the Brest Fortress, which was attacked during the first strike of German invaders on June 22 1941. The story describes the events of the first days of the defence, including the three main resistance zones, headed by the regiment commander, Pyotr Mikhailovich Gavrilov, the commissar Efim Moiseevich Fomin and the head of the 9th frontier outpost, Andrey Mitrofanovich Kizhevatov. Many years later veteran Alexander Akimov again recalls the memories of the time, when he, then a 15 year old Sasha Akimov was deeply in love with the beautiful Anya and suddenly found himself in the middle of the bloody events of war.','/iHXo74DonjdP8AoY2iChSEm9HjG.jpg','2010-11-04',138,'Released','Surrender was not an option','Fortress of War',50618,2.8264,7.083,'XvWbUj_jlMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26719,_binary '\0','/cxbD9HzwCwTZG7ZzX11I4KMHLUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343704',3.2,5888,'de','Zeiten ändern Dich','After the bestselling book comes the film about Germany\'s most successful rapper: authentic, provocative and radical. Despite all his successes, Bushido has to face the demons of his past again and again.','/iQg5KvJl7D44m7Vq1X4lsOnwteu.jpg','2010-02-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Times Change You',32679,1.5788,4.1,'iGtHpklZ3h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26720,_binary '\0','/3k1PKmzNEosWFaOR1yC9ZKIYqmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343712',5.6,1976,'ru','Первый отряд','Set during the opening days of World War II on the Eastern Front. Its main cast are a group of Soviet teenagers with extraordinary abilities; the teenagers have been drafted to form a special unit to fight the invading German army. They are opposed by a Schutzstaffel officer who is attempting to raise from the dead a supernatural army of crusaders from the 12th-century Order of the Sacred Cross.','/hBj1aTnGf4564Klv9yIbSuB7Y8w.jpg','2009-05-13',73,'Released',NULL,'First Squad: The Moment of Truth',23527,2.4038,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26721,_binary '\0','/jUqDBi02CDjqrroC3Zl8hroBbSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343727',7.1,314927,'en','Dredd','In the future, America is a dystopian wasteland. The latest scourge is Ma-Ma, a prostitute-turned-drug pusher with a dangerous new drug and aims to take over the city. The only possibility of stopping her is an elite group of urban police called Judges, who combine the duties of judge, jury and executioner to deliver a brutal brand of swift justice. But even the top-ranking Judge, Dredd, discovers that taking down Ma-Ma isn’t as easy as it seems in this explosive adaptation of the hugely popular comic series.','/wLx65gtGVnUFCxceHWGszcruCZj.jpg','2012-09-07',96,'Released','Judgement is coming.','Dredd',49049,11.9289,6.863,'3Sp-2FvUNv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26722,_binary '\0','/slXaQ221FgSOsmAOqB7GQpHHjod.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1343755',5.6,9004,'de','Zweiohrküken','Two years have passed. There is a normal life, but handsome Ludo meets his old love, and Anna is very jealous...','/vULrURaizz6FNHVmObbPPzFlA3R.jpg','2009-11-24',124,'Released',NULL,'Rabbit Without Ears 2',9511,3.6252,5.768,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26723,_binary '\0','/esGtYJE3uoRuwA7o4ST2kGDhmeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13438734',4.3,4444,'en','Time Is Up','Vivien, an accomplished student with a passion for physics, and Roy, a troubled young man, are involved in an accident that forces them to reclaim their lives one minute at the time.','/dxWHyMY4HoXH8LiEhYlga2OtK5B.jpg','2021-09-09',108,'Released','Falling in love is a state of change.','Time Is Up',763148,4.5189,6.5,'VJgP-2MR7Dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26724,_binary '\0','/x4KoxiTXkNgeG5V3xtZvcbXcel7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13439744',2.6,4437,'te','Son of India','Kadiyam Babji is an ageing man angry with the way society functions. He decides the best payback is to kidnap some high-profile people. But NIA officer Ira is hot on his heels.','/6TcFX80eei50v56U5yeATINJA5x.jpg','2022-02-18',84,'Released',NULL,'Son of India',799397,1.0184,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26725,_binary '\0','/cMqkEaKXAxsfN57T3ihPOZwrVCj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13440294',8.2,2733,'en','Jayanti','Santya is an aggressive young chap, who is a matter of worry and fear for his family. When an Adivasi woman from Santya\'s neighborhood is raped and murdered by an upper caste man, Santya must make the journey towards becoming an Ambedkarite, in order to emancipate himself and help his community get justice and prosper.','/vjcPYU8QN7cdWIcdjBLMhyaZ0Nz.jpg','2021-11-26',144,'Released','Festival of People\'s Rights','Jayanti',920223,1.758,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26726,_binary '\0','/bsNpFjRWgFdZVeXGhdIwXbrgNRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1344355',7.3,5255,'tr','Vali','The suspicious deaths began with the information obtained by MTA engineer Ömer Uçar, who has been a friend of Governor Faruk Yazıcı since childhood, and his colleagues regarding the rich uranium deposit in the region. And the hidden and overt powers behind capital that want this system to continue…','/8H1gtrvLuIp7FlJvc6Llosy0yHo.jpg','2009-01-09',110,'Released',NULL,'Vali',37429,1.5571,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26727,_binary '\0','/tKQBdl1wf8rhurIr6QnvuDl7e3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13445076',6.1,2923,'ar','الكمينAl Kameen','It is the winter of 2018, the men and women of the UAE military are deployed to provide aid. At the Mocha Base, spirits are high as three Emirati soldiers anticipate an imminent return home. While on their final routine patrol, the three soldiers, Ali, Bilal and Hindasi are ambushed by heavily armed militants on their route, through a narrow canyon. Trapped, wounded, and out of communication range, the three soldiers realize the gravity of their situation. They are running out of options, munitions - and time. Back at the base, their commander receives word and realizes that the assault on the UAE army patrol was premeditated. A rescue mission is quickly put into action, but will air and land support reach the men in time, and will they survive?','/dEZJgTWjq5ex8lEvI6XcYMxnTSn.jpg','2021-11-25',110,'Released','They will bring their brothers home by any means necessary.','The Ambush',884452,3.9662,6.038,'CIhLYvhHllU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26728,_binary '\0','/ok5OH3S28TWsk764AS1KPe8ICin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13446126',5.2,1881,'th','โกสต์แล็บ..ฉีกกฎทดลองผี','After witnessing a haunting in their hospital, two doctors become dangerously obsessed with obtaining scientific proof that ghosts exist.','/A09Dqy91W40Q2iiD7IOJteDpJAa.jpg','2021-05-26',117,'Released','A shocking experiment crossing the line of the living.','Ghost Lab',710871,1.891,6.489,'RN9G-g5PhJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26729,_binary '\0','/iwCti1LGupsMjCzuhaccUA4OZfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13446168',6.5,19207,'th','ร่างทรง','A shaman\'s family learn that their goddess is supposedly controlling one of them. However, their lives take a frightening turn when they realise the goddess has nothing to do with the possession.','/wOJbWVMqdKIerkvOegeHfORxWqV.jpg','2021-07-14',131,'Released','Every faith will be challenged.','The Medium',745881,9.2759,7,'JySzXSlwNNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26730,_binary '\0','/zMcEalkxEiRjvmijliLBk0sYern.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13446424',4.8,1760,'de','Wir Können Nicht Anders','A man foils an attempted murder, then flees the crew of would-be killers along with their intended target as a woman he\'s just met tries to find him.','/ajKpYK7XdzIYjy9Uy8nkgRboKyv.jpg','2020-12-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Crossfire',765123,2.0675,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26731,_binary '\0','/jWdAGowjvKTEveFHteaMYJi0L8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1344726',5.9,1285,'pl','Ile waży koń trojański?','At 40, Zosia has a happy second marriage, a well-adjusted daughter, a good career, and a comfortable home in Warsaw. But as she and her family usher in the year 2000, she wishes some things in her youth had happened differently, and she\'s magically transported back to 1987, when she was still married to her womanizing first husband, Darek and lived in the People\'s Republic of Poland.','/pW13PFxuWVYmVheOpy76VhbeVb0.jpg','2008-12-26',117,'Released',NULL,'How Much Does the Trojan Horse Weigh?',38941,1.2629,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26732,_binary '\0','/qQVhuyjSyoM9lw7oYxouiuFmTp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1344784',7.2,1373,'en','Tapped','Is access to clean drinking water a basic human right, or a commodity that should be bought and sold like any other article of commerce? Stephanie Soechtig\'s debut feature is an unflinching examination of the big business of bottled water. From the producers of Who Killed the Electric Car and I.O.U.S.A., this timely documentary is a behind-the-scenes look into the unregulated and unseen world of an industry that aims to privatize and sell back the one resource that ought never to become a commodity: our water. From the plastic production to the ocean in which so many of these bottles end up, this inspiring documentary trails the path of the bottled water industry and the communities which were the unwitting chips on the table. A powerful portrait of the lives affected by the bottled water industry, this revelatory film features those caught at the intersection of big business and the public\'s right to water.','/izCGrNOWzqym7d4iPHv3JlOQrVM.jpg','2009-07-31',76,'Released',NULL,'Tapped',41339,1.2755,6.3,'72MCumz5lq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26733,_binary '\0','/1pfQIj7b2jVdNZcdXL9XcOiP5wx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13449624',6.1,43571,'hi','जुगजुग जियो','A marriage. A re-marriage. A pending divorce. It\'s been five years since Kukoo and Nainaa got married after knowing each other practically all their lives, and now they need to break it to their family that they want a divorce. Kukoo\'s parents, Bheem and Geeta, a couple that everyone looks up to, have no plans of making Kukoo and Naina\'s lives easier. They have their own plans and set of surprises in store for the young couple; all this in the middle of Kukoo\'s sister\'s wedding.','/ovyWtXhPRKKpSyMUIVYBWiurggY.jpg','2022-06-24',148,'Released','A family reunion, full of surprises','JugJugg Jeeyo',765019,1.3893,6.4,'z6ZedPiTEv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26734,_binary '\0','/hpUGKEgxPmzFdOi6IYCyXuMjOFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13450470',6.2,1989,'de','Hinterland','Vienna, 1920. The Austro-Hungarian Empire has collapsed. Peter Perg returns home from the Great War, after years of captivity. But the Vienna he comes home to is nothing like the place he once knew. The new Austrian Republic thrives on social and artistic freedom, but anti-democratic movements and unemployment loom overhead. A stranger in his hometown, his life takes a turn for the worse when one of his former comrades is murdered. Suddenly the mysterious killings of veterans are mounting. Personally connected to the victims, Perg decides to bring the killer to justice. He finds an ally in the cool-headed forensic doctor Theresa Körner, with whom he has a deeper, shared history. Their investigation leads them into the darkest corners of the city, as they confront a brutal and systematic killer and intrigues from within the police force. But when the killer’s net closes around Perg himself, he faces the moral dilemma of his life.','/zaA5ql3oI0ZImO57QP1I1sqbqaV.jpg','2021-10-07',98,'Released',NULL,'Hinterland',843338,1.7713,6.2,'Bpcdg3zRHlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26735,_binary '\0','/ttr8xexffJYGj71QArp9FOjlip0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13450702',4.8,3736,'en','American Warrior','A man with a troubled past decides to turn his life around after a heroic act by training for a mixed martial arts tournament.','/jULSJhWyDEj9nPPkmE4qDGLutr0.jpg','2025-09-16',89,'Released',NULL,'American Warrior',1121373,1.3383,5.5,'EMoZl7TGTok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26736,_binary '\0','/vlIKJkxvI47uLrlL3V6sNSZQjak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13451112',4.3,1262,'en','Lexi','“Laughing Lexi” has gone missing. As the tale unfolds, the story of what really happened becomes stranger than fiction.','/6lQRonLaFVKJSlWCt29vIPyKUyO.jpg','2022-06-24',80,'Released',NULL,'Lexi',930791,2.0498,3.4,'ElWYGIWhJNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26737,_binary '\0','/t2lCQMpEIpXKRAFksNEQzAPIF4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13451410',6.7,20678,'hi','धड़क २','When Neelesh, an idealistic law student from a marginalised section of society, steps into a prestigious institution, he is thrust into a world that doesn\'t reflect his own. His friendship with Vidhi offers hope-until a wave of tragedy exposes the deep-rooted hierarchies he tried to outrun. He must confront the invisible forces that shape who we are allowed to become and who we are allowed to love.','/1XoyvBhNNdDlN5HKxWEAzhIOYSU.jpg','2025-08-01',146,'Released','When injustice becomes law, resistance becomes duty','Dhadak 2',1213777,2.3135,6.976,'2MFMwvJd12k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26738,_binary '\0','/Ajme0WddNnEZWJg921BIhwai1mE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13451738',6.7,2393,'ta','கோடியில் ஒருவன்','An IAS aspirant, who lands in Chennai to fulfill his mother\'s wish, gets into trouble with a local councillor and his men, leading to a power struggle.','/4ref2SvT2e9PeJ6Jqfd3MovE3JT.jpg','2021-09-17',149,'Released','One in a million','Kodiyil Oruvan',873696,1.1074,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26739,_binary '\0','/z3TKgmqmIqrSAy35YOkyZK64uo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13451792',4.2,1267,'hi','क्या मेरी सोनम गुप्ता बेवफा है?','Sintoo, a dejected lover, pens down his feelings on a currency note which goes viral and triggers a chain of hilarious events. Will he overcome the heartbreak and find closure?','/moiZeBf4M74b2GrMAqn3QymJB63.jpg','2021-09-10',136,'Released',NULL,'Kya Meri Sonam Gupta Bewafa Hai?',868642,0.8681,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26740,_binary '\0','/deLWkOLZmBNkm8p16igfapQyqeq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13452446',6.1,122402,'en','Damsel','A young woman\'s marriage to a charming prince turns into a fierce fight for survival when she\'s offered up as a sacrifice to a fire-breathing dragon.','/AgHbB9DCE9aE57zkHjSmseszh6e.jpg','2024-03-07',107,'Released','This is not a fairytale.','Damsel',763215,15.6563,7,'iM150ZWovZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26741,_binary '\0','/4OWjaj13K6gRFMuE9SnjfQp00Eg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13452944',6.4,1526,'te','వరుడు కావలెను','Bhoomi’s mother wants her to get married soon but she’s particular about what she wants. Akash returns to India after a successful stint abroad and while these opposite poles attract, will they make it work?','/4J7zfkZBUDADKQdehSwFync1BR0.jpg','2021-10-29',133,'Released',NULL,'Varudu Kaavalenu',801505,1.0017,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26742,_binary '\0','/nRfJFQQ6OUVW4NV7wFzNDu57J3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13453006',7.1,43907,'en','Red Rocket','After hitting rock bottom in Los Angeles, former porn star Mikey Saber returns to his hometown in Texas to stay with his estranged wife and mother-in-law. Just as tensions begin to ease, he becomes infatuated with a young doughnut shop worker named Strawberry.','/345gLhiNpItU1ICx8OxJQwjgPmH.jpg','2021-12-10',130,'Released','Everything\'s bigger in Texas.','Red Rocket',763329,5.726,6.8,'Wfndmy-6e28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26743,_binary '\0','/hNCGEGCg65c1qI0kWs1eVsvP0Y0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13454122',6.4,1378,'en','Arlo the Alligator Boy','Upon learning that he is from New York City, a wide-eyed boy, who is half human and half alligator, decides to leave his sheltered life in the swamp and search for his long lost father. A musical adventure.','/oOQMJM7G2W8v2AEK722k8welIJY.jpg','2021-04-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Arlo the Alligator Boy',763568,3.47,6.805,'DAGdOI-ORxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26744,_binary '\0','/nrWm1FkHJImRPbagDZZOjplGB2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13454228',3.6,1543,'en','Every Last One of Them','Desperate to find his missing daughter, a man tracks her last known whereabouts to a small desert town only to discover that the head of a deeply funded security firm and his vicious younger sister are protecting a family secret that could potentially derail a billion dollar water deal between his boss and the US government.','/1nE7aQNpSDTNSLXJc3eRT36Bk7O.jpg','2021-10-22',82,'Released',NULL,'Every Last One of Them',848519,2.7278,5.2,'MKMo-1PJTNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26745,_binary '\0','/gigfdvfjKHn2Hw7DM1sbnvbyn0G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13454498',6.3,1831,'en','Dashing in December','When Wyatt returns home for the holidays to try to convince his mom to sell their family ranch, an unexpected romance with handsome ranch hand Heath may throw off his plans.','/dexLJ6rvku5YE9j8Wb5ljRDPNVW.jpg','2020-12-13',85,'Released','This holiday, let love in.','Dashing in December',764316,1.0816,6.3,'gWeCkrg8VUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26746,_binary '\0','/qrwMqyzQL8SQTumjprd7rK6mabR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345507',5,1392,'fr','RTT','When Florence, his companion of five years, shocks him with the news that she\'s leaving him, moving to Miami and marrying another man, Arthur loses it. He follows Florence to all the way to Florida with plans to stop the wedding, which is set to take place in just a few days. Along the way, he crosses paths with Emilie, who is also heading to Miami, but unlike Arthur, is wanted by the police. As a result, Arthur gets stuck on an adventure he definitely never expected.','/qB5yqRLiLvcspXVZ88l7QYpJeOZ.jpg','2009-12-09',88,'Released',NULL,'RTT',26629,1.1311,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26747,_binary '\0','/f751LTCXob7HZ2PPKHAgQc2K7SS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13456318',5.8,41052,'en','Persuasion','Living with her snobby family on the brink of bankruptcy, Anne Elliot is an unconforming woman with modern sensibilities. When Frederick Wentworth - the dashing one she once sent away - crashes back into her life, Anne must choose between putting the past behind her or listening to her heart when it comes to second chances.','/s99WrKSEVR4RVvwm5Zn2cqrHTMM.jpg','2022-07-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Persuasion',820912,4.0384,6.1,'Fz7HmgPJQak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26748,_binary '\0','/2fckvNvcgAQiD5IbkVdfh3i6cR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13456340',7.6,2507,'en','Riceboy Sleeps','In the 1990s, an immigrant single mother raises her teenage son in the Canadian suburbs, determined to provide a better life for him than the one she left behind in South Korea.','/344oy01RDIpTQd6Pw43iOYP3bjT.jpg','2023-03-17',117,'Released',NULL,'Riceboy Sleeps',1008038,2.8201,7.2,'UcwwHKLY8Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26749,_binary '\0','/oBxslht0UsJURwFfpPN1arURnJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13456976',4.9,3899,'en','Old Man','Deep in the woods, a lost hiker stumbles upon the cabin of an erratic and reclusive old man. What starts off as cordial conversation soon turns dangerous as it becomes clear that one or both of them might be hiding a terrifying secret.','/hBkTcM3xhNCDaSn08RxvcFAejUJ.jpg','2022-10-14',98,'Released','Beware the enemy within.','Old Man',766220,3.0263,5.706,'bdhxdt6scTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26750,_binary '\0','/gXcXHBqutlmuwwJ0LDp5wepjOZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345728',7,1694,'ja','南極料理人','When eight men are assigned to live 14,000 kilometers from home in inhumanly cold conditions, food becomes their new existence.','/amffI3ElNujOxhBN5b1vKVJLCE0.jpg','2009-08-08',125,'Released',NULL,'The Chef of South Polar',106378,1.9727,7.1,'7xxDNa29fvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26751,_binary '\0','/7ilfZ5YcBf2IZe2280PqsxudaQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345734',7,3188,'ko','영화는 영화다','Gang-pae is #2 gangster in his organization who longs to become an actor. Su-ta is a superstar actor who takes on the role of a gangster in an action movie called Rough Cut. When another actor leaves the set due to Su-tas violent ways, the production is on the verge of shutting down. Su-ta asks Gang-pae, whom he met by chance, to play alongside him in the movie in order to save the production.','/iv1hGQjD390UeH2unAoR6wAchBF.jpg','2008-09-11',111,'Released','Only one lead character, The one who wins takes the spot.','Rough Cut',17593,1.8148,6.9,'fNwszJu4AFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26752,_binary '\0','/r5ec8FpxaWv31v6tQ3q6ZnxzTYT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345772',5.3,6948,'en','The Clinic','While traveling across country with her fiancé, Beth wakes alone in an isolated clinic to a mother\'s worst nightmare. Just how far will she go to save her child?','/wWWjKwaWJ8pidrCxWeUsvXl00pl.jpg','2010-10-10',94,'Released','The truth lies within','The Clinic',57749,2.2326,5.6,'10FFQyN4I9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26753,_binary '\0','/qZkwpsYaCsC2uli38mUXCYbkmjh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345776',7.5,2004,'ja','劇場版「空の境界」第七章 殺人考察（後）','In February 1999, a string of murders has Shiki Ryougi and Mikiya Kokutou on edge. These crimes share a disturbing resemblance to a similar set of homicides from 1995, when Shiki and Mikiya first met, and awaken a dark, murderous desire that has laid dormant within Shiki\'s soul ever since then.','/kiOc87AV2sDlZomxKQtJrvHETiZ.jpg','2009-08-08',120,'Released','\"I\'ve accepted who I am and who I was, and now I will live my life.\"','The Garden of Sinners: A Study in Murder - Part 2',23167,2.6298,7.2,'cgbjyA458m0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26754,_binary '\0','/npWGRtZC8h5Pju3xX8ytwNfw8EO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345777',7.3,11503,'hi','इश्क़िया','While on the run from goons, a man and his nephew fall for a kidnapper\'s seductive widow.','/1iEv7Nv2n8qtlb6AThU4aqJuDR4.jpg','2010-01-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Ishqiya',33556,1.1659,6.512,'qLE2zJv68pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26755,_binary '\0','/t07GHagzBuqJiMDFocMKWEraHYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13457790',6,6733,'en','The Critic','Jimmy Erskine is the most feared theatre critic of the age. He lives as flamboyantly as he writes and takes pleasure in savagely taking down any actor who fails to meet his standards. When the owner of the Daily Chronicle dies, and his son takes over, Jimmy quickly finds himself at odds with his new boss and his position under threat. In an attempt to preserve the power and influence he holds so sacred, Jimmy strikes a Faustian pact with a struggling actress, entangling them and the boss in a thrilling but deadly web of desire, blackmail, and betrayal.','/kVdN99IPZgQSUKVkAPWb9ZnCkhz.jpg','2024-09-13',101,'Released','Ambition seduces. Power corrupts.','The Critic',992940,3.4941,5.788,'WsYz70rnWVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26756,_binary '\0','/c3OHQncTAnKFhdOTX7D3LTW6son.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1345836',8.4,2027399,'en','The Dark Knight Rises','Following the death of District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman assumes responsibility for Dent\'s crimes to protect the late attorney\'s reputation and is subsequently hunted by the Gotham City Police Department. Eight years later, Batman encounters the mysterious Selina Kyle and the villainous Bane, a new terrorist leader who overwhelms Gotham\'s finest. The Dark Knight resurfaces to protect a city that has branded him an enemy.','/hr0L2aueqlP2BYUblTTjmtn0hw4.jpg','2012-07-17',165,'Released','The legend ends.','The Dark Knight Rises',49026,37.8948,7.797,'7gFwvozMHR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26757,_binary '\0','/y9Xa7GOcQZ00sOozjRgD6pMN2pq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13458600',8.5,1738,'pt','Emicida: AmarElo - É Tudo Pra Ontem','Between scenes from his concert in São Paulo\'s oft-inaccessible Theatro Municipal, rapper and activist Emicida celebrates the rich legacy of Black Brazilian culture.','/afVApltOyuDj5Dgq8OB99SqJ6v9.jpg','2020-12-08',89,'Released',NULL,'Emicida: AmarElo - It\'s All for Yesterday',765613,1.4951,8.608,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26758,_binary '\0','/yITSh3nwDb9tut3TNbmUYeFgGlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13460190',6.2,1716,'fr','Les Vedettes','Daniel and Stéphane, two salesmen working in the same store but who cannot stand each other, decide despite everything to team up to participate in television games so they can pay their debts.','/7MdTly7XxHhSgnlHuJcqzrj7Uso.jpg','2022-02-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The Wannabes',740460,1.3028,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26759,_binary '\0','/1s8Catsbd9n6KrfxQagF3a3jh5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13462472',6.4,1305,'fr','Les Jeunes Amants','Elegant, retired architect Shauna (70) crosses paths with Pierre, a happily married doctor in his 40s, who first made an impression on her in a brief meeting 15 years previously. Both are quite troubled to meet again and begin an affair. While Pierre’s family life is soon turned upside down, Shauna struggles with feelings she thought belonged to the past.','/tE0vxFfdhO4d67uYpaesVHZrajs.jpg','2022-02-02',112,'Released','Love has no age, but it does have the power to change a life.','The Young Lovers',811211,2.9238,6.4,'an62yZ-Oub0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26760,_binary '\0','/dwNeWkccTWJCgfc6yqpkuH93nSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13462900',5.5,4931,'zh','长津湖','Korean War, winter 1950. In the frozen and snowy area of Changjin Lake, a bloody battle is about to begin between the elite troops of the United States and China.','/iXvAlIo4DPLBiraC2KLu4977Wo2.jpg','2021-09-30',178,'Released','Do they fall out of the goddamn sky?','The Battle at Lake Changjin',779029,3.8013,6.3,'7MlTVsKHoC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26761,_binary '\0','/ycqMcQ1t1RPxR4aN46SM2Z1P7qd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13464350',4.9,1608,'en','Under Wraps','Three friends try to save their mummified friend, Harold, from greedy criminals by returning him to his resting place before midnight on Halloween.','/7RbSSHD0MqQ4SmopPQBRBO0xuix.jpg','2021-10-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Under Wraps',763873,6.8218,6.8,'Ktf31p4Z-Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26762,_binary '\0','/mFDUO48v1Cik3MToFgBsF2Milvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13465140',5.3,1601,'en','Christmas...Again?!','Rowena \"Ro\" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.','/tCE4EHfSfGJHKSBIvbSCtplElLE.jpg','2021-12-03',94,'Released','Ho Ho Oh No.','Christmas...Again?!',762879,4.4277,6.508,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26763,_binary '\0','/qJUaZXqSw3eXBqW6GGql7YYrZgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13466166',7.4,4131,'ta','சாணிக் காயிதம்','A police constable from an oppressed caste and her half-brother go after the dominant caste men who raped her and burned her husband and kid alive.','/5HCd5AwTFcy14RV6R8U3CeeoF0U.jpg','2022-05-06',138,'Released',NULL,'Saani Kaayidham',755393,1.4368,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26764,_binary '\0','/gDNdlwryOUrnFzTSaRWkoWRqBMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13468436',6.8,2180,'en','The Colour Room','A pioneering ceramic artist Clarice Cliff rises to prominence in the 1920s while working in Britain’s Stoke-on-Trent pottery industry.','/yo9XO3yUCqvu1XF7hm72s3JWzZR.jpg','2021-11-12',108,'Released','Her pottery made history, her story broke every rule.','The Colour Room',807351,1.9316,6.1,'gQPFloejuCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26765,_binary '\0','/cBNLVp6sDn9xoK8gZYBw1ycAjaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13468602',4.6,7008,'en','The Lair','Royal Air Force pilot Lt. Kate Sinclair is on her final flight mission when her jet is shot down over one of the most dangerous rebel strongholds in Afghanistan. She finds refuge in an abandoned underground bunker where deadly man-made creatures known as Ravagers — half-human, half-alien, and hungry for human flesh — are awakened.','/ifRFLx83Xk1DcwAS3OScgI6HmWO.jpg','2022-10-28',93,'Released','Unlocked. Unleashed.','The Lair',760204,4.9195,5.6,'ebjFxaZfrQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26766,_binary '\0','/dim8Z0mqh8z4MfHJlGbp2hKShT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13468976',3.7,10620,'ml','ആറാട്ട്','Goparajan / Gopan, a native of Neyyattinkara and a real estate tycoon buys a large piece of land in Chittur for a construction purpose, but on his arrival, he learns that the residents are forcefully and unlawfully evicted from their properties by an Andhra based real estate mafia using illegal land acquisition rules with support from the local authorities and government officials.','/qt5zIVjW1ThRhJkSetOFlnySsoW.jpg','2022-02-18',168,'Released',NULL,'Aaraattu',784647,1.4196,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26767,_binary '\0','/keMfCmqrkSfnjyqCEvhc7mGzWX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1346961',6.1,3304,'en','The Eclipse','Michael is a widower who is struggling to adjust to his new role as the sole caretaker of his two children. Still reeling from the death of his wife, he has been plagued by terrifying apparitions. When he volunteers at a local literary festival, he finds himself drawn to Lena, an empathetic author of supernatural fiction. While Lena tries to help Michael with the mystery of his nightmarish visions, she must contend with problems of her own, as she’s being jealously pursued by self-obsessed novelist Nicholas, her one-time lover. As the festival progresses, the three adults’ lives converge and collide.','/96ma6Hn8aW3FbHoaDzHiRflCHls.jpg','2009-04-24',88,'Released','If there is life after death - love lives on','The Eclipse',39563,1.4362,6,'96CiqDqzmz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26768,_binary '\0','/whFn52IATIAvHtrXC3WGaywJj5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1346983',7.1,4053,'en','Loving Leah','When Leah\'s husband Benjamin dies suddenly, Benjamin\'s brother Jake is stunned to learn he is expected to marry the childless Leah to carry on his brother\'s name. Jake suggests to Leah that they get married and maintain a secretly platonic relationship. The harder they try to disguise their \"pretend\" marriage, the more their appreciation for each other\'s worlds grow, and out of understanding, a real love develops.','/1s0WPhi7isv6LaG0UF13ettmTyj.jpg','2009-01-25',97,'Released','A love story that defies tradition.','Loving Leah',52221,2.4566,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26769,_binary '\0','/9LM4UlmGTv85mOHBx8TMhpLXJMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1347007',5.6,3232,'no','Skjult','Painful memories arise when Kai Koss inherits his dead mother\'s house and goes back to his childhood home after 19 years.','/hbTIimvkPBmZovd3bu7HAKunmMQ.jpg','2009-03-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Hidden',24821,2.1481,5.6,'0GSoKL3n_6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26770,_binary '\0','/jKjJOyWwGeDqMeEFnvNNSPllrx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13470278',6.7,1331,'te','సెహరి','Varun who leads a joyful life with his girlfriend, until he breaks up with her. In anger, he takes a senseless decision to enter next phase of life by entering wedlock. But he realizes that she is not the right choice after becoming close with his fiancée’s elder sister.','/e6oQ0L7LTh2xJ7Ag94XVmJduWDv.jpg','2022-02-11',128,'Released',NULL,'Sehari',918004,1.213,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26771,_binary '\0','/reHX1X7D2kjGqNVDAGXyzezEAp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13471738',6.8,1698,'de','Rabiye Kurnaz gegen George W. Bush','Desperate to help her son, Rabiye Kurnaz, a housewife and loving mother from Bremen, goes to the police, notifies authorities and almost despairs at their impotence and in the end, against all the odds, something truly remarkable happens.','/3BmgTsU9EPhnQKz4doNifwcV0Fz.jpg','2022-04-28',119,'Released',NULL,'Rabiye Kurnaz vs. George W. Bush',915960,2.1371,6.2,'WB-PXGGUCE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26772,_binary '\0','/twHsTWlh6U38BZRRA4Aue2P2iEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13473548',7.1,2405,'pl','Żeby nie było śladów','In 1983, communist Poland is shaken by the case of high school student Grzegorz Przemyk, who is beaten to death by police. The only witness of the beating becomes the number one enemy of the state.','/hc7hhghhS7cbhEm00oo2DkdwtyR.jpg','2021-09-24',160,'Released',NULL,'Leave No Traces',788931,2.5475,6.8,'QNzhs5f4Osg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26773,_binary '\0','/g98yShUC2TCfAqpzk3SwQPIvp4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1347512',7.9,1930,'en','Blackadder Rides Again','This documentary marks the 25th anniversary since the first transmission of The Black Adder in 1983 and reunites the iconic cast to give their opinions on all series and specials. Narrated by John Sergeant, this in-depth guide includes interviews from the cast and crew, a clip from the pilot episode, clips from all four series and the specials, opinions about certain moments in the show, and much more. With interviews by Rowan Atkinson, writers Richard Curtis and Ben Elton, Stephen Fry, Hugh Laurie, producer John Lloyd, Miriam Margolyes, Rik Mayall, Tim McInnerny, Miranda Richardson, Tony Robinson and editor Chris Wadsworth.','/qAmQMxVBNx3vuAcyiDPej4qvWwd.jpg','2008-12-25',60,'Released',NULL,'Blackadder Rides Again',279803,1.359,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26774,_binary '\0','/aL1nc6Ps6eTNyLYP0y16WMMcLRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1347521',6.6,11914,'tr','Güneşi Gördüm','In the southeast region of Turkey, the Kurdish family of Altun lives in a small mountainside village plagued by a 25-year war that makes their daily lives a hellish struggle. As the war intensifies, the family is forced to migrate west to the city of Istanbul.','/12f1B21UGEcXiwrY0Iiw2O9OlSk.jpg','2009-03-13',115,'Released','Children here don\'t shape their own destiny.','I Saw the Sun',27960,1.7925,6.5,'acwoxq0NL14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26775,_binary '\0','/v7hdWmLh6VLgZQgkbHDxAa17M47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13479592',5.4,1756,'es','Centauro','Rafa\'s hooked on the pure, fiery feelings he gets from speed racing, but when his kid\'s mom gets mixed up with drug dealers, he burns rubber to save her.','/uMYROfsn2lm1P8wzOsq3c6TuRxF.jpg','2022-06-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Centauro',852592,2.8211,6.092,'jOxE45KWh3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26776,_binary '\0','/v3zHKRxNH3G3oop2GmSbgOzxza8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13482806',6.4,6390,'fr','Rien à foutre','Cassandre, 26, is a flight attendant for a low-cost airline. Based in Lanzarote, she’s always willing to take on extra hours and carries out her duties with robotic efficiency. On the side, she just goes with the flow and floats between Tinder, parties and lazy days. When she suddenly gets dismissed, she is forced to return home.','/yhd12Kew7wG7Kttap2X1JjgRooa.jpg','2022-03-02',115,'Released',NULL,'Zero Fucks Given',833326,4.2184,6.3,'a2dfJhaNdCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26777,_binary '\0','/bRNPaeb5il43EkOnTfYrUpvnbUn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13482828',6.9,9261,'fr','Un beau matin','With a father suffering from neurodegenerative disease, a young woman lives with her eight-year-old daughter. While struggling to secure a decent nursing home, she runs into an unavailable friend with whom she embarks on an affair.','/ekqrjI2w1xl7Q3OdexkFLz38BG8.jpg','2022-10-05',112,'Released',NULL,'One Fine Morning',747779,4.9262,6.4,'36aObn0Iges','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26778,_binary '\0','/9hyNKELRDv9phiF77amIlj6RfVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13483866',6.5,4552,'en','Linoleum','When the host of a failing children’s science show tries to fulfill his childhood dream of becoming an astronaut by building a rocket ship in his garage, a series of bizarre events occur that cause him to question his own reality.','/lAdPsBMnP5ctvKavQY9y8JazygK.jpg','2023-03-17',101,'Released',NULL,'Linoleum',765904,2.5084,6.246,'4scXHM7TiOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26779,_binary '\0','/wOjkbUL4tPioHwAIzDZaJsWkO8V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13484872',7.3,3837,'id','Mencuri Raden Saleh','To get his father out of prison, a master forger assembles a diverse team of specialists to steal a priceless painting.','/66yOibmlqxASFoNyEZIORELJqBC.jpg','2022-08-25',154,'Released','The ultimate heist. The ultimate masterpiece','Stealing Raden Saleh',832544,1.8382,7.6,'8kJsncH6t-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26780,_binary '\0','/riep7NVfRwIBloALcbqNPjE8bZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13485172',6.4,3401,'te','గాలి సంపత్','A partially mute man dreams of performing on stage in dramas but often keeps falling in trouble with the villagers due to his eccentric ways. By contrast, his son is a responsible man who dreams of climbing up the ladder and making something of his life. The film explores how the clash of personalities results in problems down the road for this father-son duo.','/eO6uVzyCXy7jPcUVv2HQ2hfJX03.jpg','2021-03-11',130,'Released',NULL,'Gaali Sampath',796758,1.1984,5.071,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26781,_binary '\0','/jSkOXVOcKNyh4p3gVmBYdV3g1y8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13486236',1.7,1566,'ru','Непосредственно Каха','Kakha fell for the beautiful Sophia, but in order to get to her heart, he needed to overtake the brand new BMW Ruslan on his “penny” and score a friendship with Sergo. What will Kakh choose - love or friendship?','/3HN50rKZvPkHeUmjLi2fmbjcGz2.jpg','2020-11-12',110,'Released',NULL,'Smack Dab Kakha',679694,0.8912,3.963,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26782,_binary '\0','/hhZZrmm4eXVtLOyk03yuKYmss08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13487922',3.6,1940,'en','1UP','After Valerie Lee quits her college esports team, she quickly realizes that her decision comes at the cost of her scholarship. Valerie soon discovers a loophole to save her collegiate future, if she can find a coach and assemble a whole new varsity-caliber team capable of reaching the State Finals.','/kqhLjoz3FGywYXUNTCPItfDY2N8.jpg','2022-07-15',100,'Released',NULL,'1UP',767401,2.0328,4.6,'O-wvn1D3N4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26783,_binary '\0','/6TmnNjAoqtGFKeeb5XeyXsCBSDj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13491110',6,43507,'hi','अंतिम: एक आखिरी सच','A farmer\'s son is forced to leave the village and move to the city, where he soon becomes a dreaded gangster and crosses paths with a fearless cop determined to eliminate criminals.','/tiGTU46VBHPJ8b0pGneIII1tAkj.jpg','2021-11-26',140,'Released',NULL,'Antim: The Final Truth',774607,1.869,6.536,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26784,_binary '\0','/yCt0HxNy9GJZO7xLL1pDHFSgpL3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13491620',7,2772,'hi','Unpaused','An anthology that brings five unique creators and filmmakers to tell stories about love, happiness, friendship, new beginnings, second chances and a glimmer of hope - set and filmed in the times of the COVID-19 lockdown.','/xhdsM0erWCo6DGMIQnp1lDtGp8N.jpg','2020-12-18',113,'Released',NULL,'Unpaused',772879,1.1334,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26785,_binary '\0','/vXDvQCLX59lZFg5yMQQDYlzEMSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13491678',6.9,16490,'hi','Bahattar Hoorain','‘Bahattar Hoorain’ is a dark comedy that examines the real consequences of violent extremism and urges that every human life should be treated with dignity and respect.','/856PQFVWTTDMelYPxjNJnqVgrqJ.jpg','2023-07-07',120,'Released',NULL,'72 Hoorain',767663,1.5603,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26786,_binary '\0','/3b7SPOd4JppF39Nri6MuvqjmMPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13491834',5.9,4368,'en','Sacramento','When free-spirited Rickey suddenly reappears in father-to-be Glenn’s life, the two former best friends embark on a spontaneous road trip from LA to Sacramento.','/9tAHcIb9hys2rO6eDcKatjVOLR8.jpg','2025-04-11',89,'Released','They\'re heading for a breakdown.','Sacramento',842931,1.8642,6.3,'jZRbFs_WhX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26787,_binary '\0','/ezc6SYtwErbIpBqJUOc5JuPS9N4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1349451',6.2,23329,'en','Butter','An adopted girl discovers her talent for butter carving and finds herself pitted against an ambitious local woman in their Iowa town\'s annual contest.','/30sLoIcLHjZwjMiTjyTUrTNawB4.jpg','2012-10-05',91,'Released','A comedy about sex, power and spreading the wealth.','Butter',79697,3.7501,5.9,'9OTM8RpMmtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26788,_binary '\0','/lLaeFLQNsZ11zG3LTSczD3YNLad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13495458',6.7,6320,'en','The Inspection','Ellis French is a young, gay Black man, rejected by his mother and with few options for his future, decides to join the Marines, doing whatever it takes to succeed in a system that would cast him aside. But even as he battles deep-seated prejudice and the grueling routines of basic training, he finds unexpected camaraderie, strength, and support in this new community, giving him a hard-earned sense of belonging that will shape his identity and forever change his life.','/w7m962Crc1p4C4gM6ZJBArAikM9.jpg','2022-11-18',95,'Released',NULL,'The Inspection',837938,3.546,6.1,'wSeprzQM6gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26789,_binary '\0','/p3ajeXwrCczDh8eYsT8ryTvvfwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13496236',3.4,2906,'en','American Siege','An ex-NYPD officer-turned-sheriff of a small rural Georgia town has to contend with a gang of thieves who have taken a wealthy doctor hostage.','/daeVrgyj0ue8qb3AHyU3UeCwoZz.jpg','2022-01-07',91,'Released','No one walks away.','American Siege',766907,4.5464,5.3,'AdI6ea_0T0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26790,_binary '\0','/mgYrvtsUosqKHwFyqQjMKU7w12D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13497984',5,2748,'en','From Black','A young mother who\'s crushed by guilt and shame after the disappearance of her young son five years previously, is offered a bizarre opportunity to learn the truth and set things right. Is she willing to pay the terrifying price for a chance to hold her boy again?','/9DG2g1Gl1ENAxFONIxxb5FMH99f.jpg','2023-03-15',110,'Released','Darkness is coming home.','From Black',943788,2.1024,5.2,'aOljiTJl4ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26791,_binary '\0','/k4lDIh6CnAUR76bCoND65IftUCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1349853',7.1,3740,'cn','竊聽風雲','The story revolves around three members of a police surveillance squad conducting an investigation into a financial investment group involved in criminal fraud. The focus of the plot, however, is actually on the three officers themselves who stumble upon an opportunity to capitalize on information they gathered during their surveillance.','/cmr7KbbsVrPdF9avbAtLhiJnvxP.jpg','2009-07-23',100,'Released',NULL,'Overheard',24889,2.3783,6.93,'r-uU-uCyZ0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26792,_binary '\0','/mQ9IeeNVAQUNz1mCmUUYpLJKZuY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1349856',5.6,2811,'fr','Neuilly sa Mère !','Samy moves from the underdeveloped crime-ridden French suburb to the riches of Neuilly.','/XLNEeGnPhazwU0GuEuJMShGUvS.jpg','2009-08-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Neuilly Yo Mama!',26691,2.4988,6.013,'FRZAneD28AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26793,_binary '\0','/tVCg0HYPLFVYljiQXJCWTY43LJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13498824',6.8,2787,'ko','승부','When a legendary Go master loses his title to a one-time friend and protégé, he sets out to reclaim it in a high-stakes battle of wits and skill.','/epI43M0kT1FNr2qPXOoke4ux8U1.jpg','2025-03-26',115,'Released',NULL,'The Match',760497,3.7641,7.261,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26794,_binary '\0','/6JAZlXuuWOuC5I5MMxx3c3z3Cak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13502736',5.9,6760,'sv','Suedi','What would you do if you found 30 million that no one was missing? Mahmut decides to do what he has always dreamt of: to be seen as a Swede. He changes his name to Sebastian, rents a nice house, buys a Volvo and starts wearing socks with patterns. But there\'s a problem, all of the money is in notes that become invalid in two weeks. His new life is threatened and he needs to find a way to launder 30 million in two weeks.','/kHDaXBYTRJSB0eQkBQ6Q18utUpu.jpg','2021-10-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Suedi',872586,0.7434,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26795,_binary '\0','/g6SsWJWuGUyr5BY29D4BnwHEc9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13502758',5.5,1260,'fr','Les Fantasmes','Faced with their fantasies, six couples try to explore the hidden sides of their intimate life. Six questions on access to pleasure. From role play to abstinence, via exhibition, six separate stories with the same questioning of desire today in the center.','/fTAuejHywUWi3jrT3FPUT38nOnx.jpg','2021-08-18',102,'Released','Tell us about yours...','Fantasies',768127,3.4527,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26796,_binary '\0','/7vdgvjjXPDtwtQ6aGE6f2PAmavA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1350484',5.6,1676,'en','Curious George 2: Follow That Monkey!','The film chronicles George\'s adventures as he befriends Kayla, a baby elephant, at a magic circus show and helps her travel across the country to be reunited with her family.Accompanied by his friend, the Man with the Yellow Hat, George travels by foot, train, and truck to reach Kayla\'s brother and sister in California, only to be accused of elephant-napping and brought all the way back to New York.','/40FelVlshxnsbmNhjqEubWkqgim.jpg','2009-08-07',81,'Released','Show me the Monkey!','Curious George 2: Follow That Monkey!',23903,5.1967,6.5,'Iimsy1O3jxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26797,_binary '\0','/cRAvKRY5S84T4cO08I05QeVGBBk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13507778',6.4,10575,'en','No Man of God','The complicated relationship that formed between the FBI analyst Bill Hagmaier and serial killer Ted Bundy during Bundy\'s final years on death row.','/jJzmSlNorOu6yvHSjXoF0bBcx17.jpg','2021-08-19',100,'Released',NULL,'No Man of God',716594,7.5779,6.56,'2vxm_IbS-6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26798,_binary '\0','/qE3OXSJHl405uV1tSmXoU0UX7PK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1350909',6.6,1678,'tr','Başka Semtin Çocukları','Semih, who was discharged from the army a month early for his \"heroism\" in operations in the southeast, encounters his brother\'s funeral on the day he returns from the army. When he sets out to find his brother\'s killer, Semih is drawn into another battle filled with difficult questions. As he searches for the truth, he will realize that what was lost was not just his brother\'s life, but also the harsh reality of lives doomed to be lost in \"The Other Istanbul,\" fueled by anger and helplessness.','/gqT5cQCvaPWUZSAvoauafEkItjU.jpg','2008-10-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Children of the Otherside',52189,0.8448,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26799,_binary '\0','/lNnnhBxQESk0WbUXNeh24Dx8XA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13510660',6.7,44134,'hi','धमाका','When a cynical ex-TV news anchor gets an alarming call on his radio show, he sees a chance for a career comeback — but it may cost his conscience.','/vQxw5OYyMRJVjSvDnNFQv38qlg0.jpg','2021-11-19',104,'Released','To win something, will you lose everything?','Dhamaka',767377,1.7189,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26800,_binary '\0','/jU31MF7RG4UBWcpKWhoELBEeJ4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1351177',4.7,1871,'en','Last of the Living','A contagious virus is turning everyone into zombies, and the only hope for survival lies in the hands of three couch potatoes.','/ojAA53oMBDLtXw70dSPwQ0Uaes4.jpg','2009-05-03',93,'Released','Those Damned Dead Just Won\'t Die','Last of the Living',22573,0.8305,4.2,'wPq5DgZ1t7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26801,_binary '\0','/siON8gxGnX8O8YAlGvPljTUV1RE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1351224',4.9,3646,'hi','प्यार इंपॉसिबल!','Be-spectacled geek, Abhay falls in love with college hottie, Alisha and silently slinks away into the shadows when he realises she\'s unattainable. Seven years later, he re-enters her life as the nanny and hopes to woo the single mom, this time at least. Does he succeed?','/k8aqtzrGYLVZQTKgi7wU8Qg0Ikg.jpg','2010-01-08',140,'Released','1 Beauty + 1 Geek = PI','Pyaar Impossible!',29538,1.3584,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26802,_binary '\0','/flcDFJ7GILJtyzEEaSi3frdj1C5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13514636',7.3,1831,'en','Rock Hudson: All That Heaven Allowed','This timely exploration of Hollywood and LGBTQ+ identity examines the life of legendary actor Rock Hudson, from his public \"ladies\' man\" persona to his private life as a gay man.','/2sgWVNX4oAyFnGnCDFMvWTsst4B.jpg','2023-06-20',105,'Released','Behind the screen. Beyond the secrets.','Rock Hudson: All That Heaven Allowed',1115091,2.4904,5.7,'zzWm5kIfE8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26803,_binary '\0','/qQfpXqKR6dewogmh3D6T0hFy3CE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13515090',6.2,3806,'en','Joyride','12-year-old Mully has lost his mother and discovers his debt-ridden father stealing the charity money they\'ve raised in her name. Grabbing the cash, Mully steals a taxi and is shocked to find a woman, Joy, in the back seat with a baby. A straight-talking solicitor who didn\'t expect to get pregnant, Joy is struggling with motherhood and planning to give her baby to a friend who will raise the child as her own. She joins Mully on a wild journey across Ireland, stealing cars, hitch-hiking, catching ferries and breaking police barricades.','/r0zaMNacZdm5CAU484hb8fmJs6j.jpg','2022-07-29',94,'Released','When we feel lost, finding our way home takes a little help.','Joyride',762361,2.2922,5.9,'e1INFVrVKPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26804,_binary '\0','/bqBY8uFoRMNRPhE39KTPIK1Dhim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13515258',4.8,1644,'en','Oracle','A young woman accepts a job on a property with a traumatic history. Upon her arrival, she soon realizes that the nightmares of her childhood are connected to the evil in the house.','/laOpPREcTlDukttovlUGJ3Wmtb6.jpg','2023-10-01',85,'Released','The past is a presence','Oracle',787761,1.5883,6.3,'HQcbTI8KRQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26805,_binary '\0','/7u7qx9dxVbeDggiSAAOo5as3AZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1351672',7.4,1879,'it','L\'uomo che verrà','A group of Italian villagers struggle to survive during a tumultuous time in 1943, debating how much assistance to give the partisans with the impending arrival of the Germans. Based on True Events.','/uyECMT8vSpUpaCRHPNPSBlaVV09.jpg','2009-10-16',115,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Will Come',42808,1.5685,7.4,'YEsFlxacD-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26806,_binary '\0','/djSAd6HUm66eVNC3PiZbYwOpD5A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1351685',6.3,156795,'en','Jack the Giant Slayer','The story of an ancient war that is reignited when a young farmhand unwittingly opens a gateway between our world and a fearsome race of giants. Unleashed on the Earth for the first time in centuries, the giants strive to reclaim the land they once lost, forcing the young man, Jack into the battle of his life to stop them. Fighting for a kingdom, its people, and the love of a brave princess, he comes face to face with the unstoppable warriors he thought only existed in legend–and gets the chance to become a legend himself.','/9jSI7saUX9Qz0JLh19jX2ulEwL7.jpg','2013-02-27',114,'Released','Prepare for a giant adventure','Jack the Giant Slayer',81005,14.3807,5.914,'SBBONir09z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26807,_binary '\0','/4LU9fOFHiSd1fJk5remPkakwLTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1351784',3.6,2135,'en','Psychosis','A serial killer unleashes his blood lust at a remote environmental-camp. Years later a horror novelist relocates to rural England and is plagued to the point of madness by horrific hauntings of a massacre.','/gfUwfviPHAiqJ98XMJnmadBAOH0.jpg','2010-07-19',89,'Released',NULL,'Psychosis',41445,1.2052,3.6,'mvUpvIs7A-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26808,_binary '\0','/atvEgnjjXN5QvFDThXVz4nyU9yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13521006',6.6,80324,'en','Beau Is Afraid','Following the sudden death of his mother, a mild-mannered but anxiety-ridden man confronts his darkest fears as he embarks on an epic odyssey back home.','/wgVkkjigF31r1nZV80uV0xNIoun.jpg','2023-04-14',179,'Released','From his darkest fears comes the greatest adventure.','Beau Is Afraid',798286,12.3345,6.7,'PuiWDn976Ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26809,_binary '\0','/2zEOvjgzaUbVkWu2cwEJSyrtvOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352369',4.8,8766,'ja','グロテスク','An unnamed doctor has always had everything he\'s ever wanted, but that has only made him develop more extreme and depraved needs. He kidnaps a young couple in the prime of their life together and forces them into a game of torment that slowly extinguishes their hopes for survival.','/A8PJ82bBBLItWjZOC4owC8eukD7.jpg','2009-01-17',73,'Released','King of Japanese Grotesque Movie','Grotesque',27297,3.0476,5.7,'HnUDsuQL1Fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26810,_binary '\0','/cAjf1lh5roaig8WzgzgkgtOALIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13523782',7.1,1669,'ar','برا المنهج','Nour is a 13-year-old orphan living in the countryside in the early 1980s. He is smart, but is also a compulsive liar with vision problems and wears eyeglasses that don\'t quite remedy his weakened eyesight. To gain the respect of his fellow classmates, he ventures inside a haunted house right in front of the school, one that all the kids are afraid to enter. Inside, he finds a solitary old man who\'s hiding from the world. A friendship and apprenticeship are born between the boy and the old man, initiating a journey of self-discovery that lies at the very heart of this light-hearted drama.','/mp6PDqcdVFNxDbODQ9CJeM0lf8A.jpg','2021-12-09',101,'Released',NULL,'Bara El Manhag',892306,0.7922,7.9,'yCgqex7tiCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26811,_binary '\0','/1GHfUGs8vatMrSZzs1T2I9FTrvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352388',3.9,6539,'en','Nude Nuns with Big Guns','Upon taking her vows to become a nun, Sister Sarah is abused, brainwashed and also drugged into submission by the corrupt clergy. On the verge of her own death from a lethal dose of drugs, Sister Sarah receives a message from God telling her to take vengeance on all those who did wrong to her. Armed with God\'s will and an arsenal of big guns, she dispenses Judgment Day on her former tormentors. When the church hires the merciless motorcycle gang \"Los Muertos\" to track down and to kill her they soon realize that this sister is one bad mother.','/jJwUJpHJ8FPyulcnSajSJdKgCMr.jpg','2010-09-24',90,'Released','This sister is one bad mother!','Nude Nuns with Big Guns',52208,3.2964,4.3,'jKYVtU7G0IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26812,_binary '\0','/yi4HL2Sw5XrCGvc5YJuHEOzMF37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352393',6.7,1824,'pt','Pequeno Segredo','Little Secret is a film with three interlocked stories all connected by a single secret that converge to reveal the tragic yet beautiful lives of three families and how hope, dreams and destiny can unite people from very different parts of the world.','/1MKSHAQKYuCwVyceWHZXHpW9hMA.jpg','2016-11-10',107,'Released','A love bigger than life','Little Secret',366517,1.2885,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26813,_binary '\0','/xndolqiw6jMhDDkkw1UPuD1xfrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13524234',8.5,5886,'en','Folklore: The Long Pond Studio Sessions','An intimate concert film, in which Taylor Swift performs each song from her album \'folklore\' in order, as she reveals the meaning and the stories behind all 17 tracks for the very first time.','/4iroJUn8YuQBekDwGy7r61YHXiu.jpg','2020-11-25',106,'Released','Our coming of age has come and gone.','Folklore: The Long Pond Studio Sessions',768141,2.7766,8.5,'jgdFUoZzCI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26814,_binary '\0','/uPTMnetNKoDk66GNwvI4aIOyeri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352765',7.2,1581,'cs','Přežít svůj život','Eugene, an aging man, leads a double life - one real, the other in his dreams. He goes to see a psychoanalyst, who tries to interpret the meaning of his dreams. Eugene finds a way of entering his dream-world at will and finds out about his childhood and what really happened to his parents.','/u6HEVymg2R6om7nAhLYgYLtlnom.jpg','2010-09-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Surviving Life (Theory and Practice)',76638,1.1467,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26815,_binary '\0','/yo7rPvwjHHYDM1bw4OgTZJY6QYP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352824',6.2,83985,'en','Chloe','Catherine and David Stewart are a well-to-do couple living in a posh area of Toronto, but all is not well in paradise. Catherine suspects that David is cheating on her, so she hires an escort named Chloe to meet David and see if he gives in to temptation — but events spin out of control when Chloe spills the details of her torrid encounters.','/b1SQETW5XglZb8eGnmb648lVANw.jpg','2010-02-25',96,'Released','If the one you love was lying to you, how far would you go to find out the truth?','Chloe',28211,6.0859,6.1,'eSLOkU2Vj2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26816,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1352852',7.5,5247,'en','The Yes Men Fix the World','THE YES MEN FIX THE WORLD is a screwball true story about two gonzo political activists who, posing as top executives of giant corporations, lie their way into big business conferences and pull off the world\'s most outrageous pranks.','/6eVleb6nkqjxUfLPRS5GwSKlA9J.jpg','2009-01-18',87,'Released','Sometimes it takes a lie to expose the truth','The Yes Men Fix the World',18489,1.4718,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26817,_binary '\0','/uSc90wmMJUINrfdjirv1mQWqpMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13528562',7.1,2082,'ja','浅草キッド','Before he hit it big, Takeshi Kitano got his start apprenticing with comedy legend Fukami of Asakusa. But as his star rises, his mentor\'s declines.','/iG0gHSFsQzxh57UJdCHXoQXFjB3.jpg','2021-12-09',123,'Released','I\'m a comedian, you fool!','Asakusa Kid',768147,2.7882,7.013,'KhzBFfkvn44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26818,_binary '\0','/arhGNrtkEHS9JX5PBf4xeljBVZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13528564',7.6,9932,'te','అంటే... సుందరానికీ!','A man from a Brahmin family falls in love with a Christian girl. In order to convince their parents, they say contrasting lies which complicates the situation and leads to a comedy of errors.','/yzMsEhiW8ip3hweLCnu48t4RdWD.jpg','2022-06-10',173,'Released',NULL,'Ante... Sundaraniki!',834654,2.6531,7.1,'kg3Xd260qIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26819,_binary '\0','/a6NAH3x0oFd6jxBLFDNkNqEo8cm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13529034',6.6,19133,'hi','मीनाक्षी सुंदरेश्वर','Forced to live apart due to a unique job prospect, two newlyweds face the hassles, hiccups — and hilarity — that arise from their long-distance marriage.','/3GfAdYIbjAGsjvWaumEOyD2w3pZ.jpg','2021-11-05',141,'Released',NULL,'Meenakshi Sundareshwar',828871,1.2852,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26820,_binary '\0','/amI3V0oERYoYADFqO5DlmrQ5eqm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13531020',6.4,2605,'ml','കുമാരി','Kumari is married off to Dhruvan of Kanjirangattu Tharavadu, a cursed land beyond Illmayi, in the west. As Kumari finds her comfort zone in her new family which is heavy with mystery, myths and superstitions, she also realizes that the people over there are blinded by faith and sorcery, ready to sacrifice their lives to preserve tradition, prosperity and peace.','/9nRd2JAPOngLX5PTyf8Bv4SCN70.jpg','2022-10-28',137,'Released',NULL,'Kumari',851731,1.2528,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26821,_binary '\0','/BevYc51yFcr4zppO8RI3Au8wXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13531468',7,4074,'fr','En corps','Elise thought she had the perfect life: an ideal boyfriend and a promising career as a ballet dancer. It all falls apart the day she catches him cheating on her with her stage backup; and after she suffers an injury on stage, it seems like she might not be able to dance ever again.','/A7ITMZ73NZBFbk0QHdo0gKoQ0mu.jpg','2022-03-30',117,'Released',NULL,'Rise',771077,2.7961,7.4,'K1oOdxxDK6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26822,_binary '\0','/xO6JSHH9fAPwgbCILl4qSICfNCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13533944',4.7,1375,'en','Mandrake','A probation officer, Cathy Madden, is tasked with rehabilitating a notorious killer named \'Bloody\' Mary Laidlaw back into society following a two-decade sentence.','/lZiXgVXQG5YJBy5ReWcy875g7Un.jpg','2022-03-12',85,'Released','Evil takes root.','Mandrake',898798,1.1956,5,'ovVsjMkJk6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26823,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13534806',5.9,1308,'fa','تی تی','Cinematic magical realism meets hard-edged drama in Ida Panahandeh’s stunning look at the life of Titi, an Iranian Roma Gypsy who earns pennies cleaning hospitals, becomes a surrogate mother… and saves the world from a rogue black hole.','/5kd9cVF8jZF4h8d8b5Twob92AKK.jpg','2020-11-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Titi',828349,1.1663,5.7,'bitYE5JPxrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26824,_binary '\0','/av4Ny4jfgTPrFoeylkAmLPsPvGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13534808',6.8,8315,'hi','जनहित में जारी','A small-town girl from MP, Manokamna, gets a decent-paying job. But the work requires her to sell condoms. Will she be able to voice her beliefs while balancing her responsibilities and society?','/A2bUJ6CBqimqcofBr4X0j0Ph89U.jpg','2022-06-10',146,'Released',NULL,'Janhit Mein Jaari',768466,1.3627,6.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26825,_binary '\0','/jtAI6OJIWLWiRItNSZoWjrsUtmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13535454',6.3,1844,'en','Gabriel\'s Inferno: Part II','Professor Gabriel Emerson finally learns the truth about Julia Mitchell\'s identity, but his realization comes a moment too late. Julia is done waiting for the well-respected Dante specialist to remember her and wants nothing more to do with him. Can Gabriel win back her heart before she finds love in another\'s arms?','/x5o8cLZfEXMoZczTYWLrUo1P7UJ.jpg','2020-07-31',106,'Released',NULL,'Gabriel\'s Inferno: Part II',724089,2.7633,8.343,'5g02v1oz5Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26826,_binary '\0','/cY9X3gHcu4zK9vAy3s77xyorm0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13535456',6.4,1778,'en','Gabriel\'s Inferno: Part III','The final part of the film adaption of the erotic romance novel Gabriel\'s Inferno written by an anonymous Canadian author under the pen name Sylvain Reynard.','/fYtHxTxlhzD4QWfEbrC1rypysSD.jpg','2020-11-19',102,'Released',NULL,'Gabriel\'s Inferno: Part III',761053,5.2831,8.3,'mjPUGem9SaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26827,_binary '\0','/4g5kaH8gfujIS93gTzFLMeDN99R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13535920',6.1,4117,'fr','Avec amour et acharnement','Jean and Sara have been living together for 10 years. When they first met, Sara was living with François, Jean’s best friend and an admirer from back when he played rugby. Jean and Sara love each other. One day, Sara sees François in the street. He does not notice her, but she is overtaken by the sensation that her life could suddenly change. François gets back in touch with Jean. For the first time in years. He suggests they start working together again. From here on, things spiral out of control.','/w0jUcrS42AyPNgb1RwjDm0BLaZz.jpg','2022-07-08',117,'Released',NULL,'Both Sides of the Blade',768757,3.1125,5.7,'OBTJTtOiuzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26828,_binary '\0','/94cS0mzODEoNIXFT7nhPcI8V4IJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13539646',6.7,16713,'zh','流浪地球2','Humans built huge engines on the surface of the earth to find a new home. But the road to the universe is perilous. In order to save earth, young people once again have to step forward to start a race against time for life and death.','/hEA7bpWw5IRKOW2MVjvx46SWevU.jpg','2023-01-22',174,'Released',NULL,'The Wandering Earth II',842675,10.8513,7.3,'23XQsJMYG84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26829,_binary '\0','/g3pIN5kRvmtcdtzjsJomZ1sw2QO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13544716',7,8097,'ja','僕のヒーローアカデミア THE MOVIE ワールド ヒーローズ ミッション','A mysterious group called Humarize strongly believes in the Quirk Singularity Doomsday theory which states that when quirks get mixed further in with future generations, that power will bring forth the end of humanity. In order to save everyone, the Pro-Heroes around the world ask UA Academy heroes-in-training to assist them and form a world-class selected hero team. It’s up to the heroes to save the world and the future of heroes in what is the most dangerous crisis to take place yet in My Hero Academia.','/jzP5rPwwNqUGERlrUzKKljfyulf.jpg','2021-08-06',105,'Released','Their fight is our future.','My Hero Academia: World Heroes\' Mission',768744,7.4941,7.6,'0r4OB67me6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26830,_binary '\0','/dd5iAgXvZjFQxs6wpqgJmDEI68S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13545522',4,3716,'hi','छत्रपति','When Shivaji and his family and the entire community of his village are one day forced to leave Pakistan, he is separated from his beloved mother, who once adopted him, while fleeing to India. Having grown into a respectable and feared man a few years later, Shivaji now sets out in search of his next of kin. But he also stands up for the rights of his people who are forced into forced labor by an exploiter and devotes his whole life to this task, which is why he is henceforth referred to as \'Chatrapathi\'.','/1Z5CyVeEjVq8mMaJR2brNpgw7cX.jpg','2023-05-12',124,'Released','For The People','Chatrapathi',1125221,2.1807,3.667,'6Q0P8KBOt4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26831,_binary '\0','/1rJTuRzWWqSB953Iqo4BrxgZe77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13551614',7.5,6954,'ml','കുരുതി','Ibrahim, a widower, grieves the loss of his wife and child and lives in a secluded area. However, his life turns upside down after a policeman comes knocking at his door with a criminal.','/ArCY77ZQOrzW44OzPmYP99piiFW.jpg','2021-08-11',122,'Released',NULL,'Kuruthi',813808,0.9726,7.2,'04fky-PdK3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26832,_binary '\0','/dwHBovIrNyypDUkprkXkklqDTpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13553662',7.1,2101,'fr','Presque','Two men, with vastly different life stories and personalities, embark on a hearse heading to the South of France. During their journey they realize that, however unlikely, they\'re not so different in the end.','/azEU5AyET4CaH6JX9wUziQYUTxR.jpg','2022-01-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Beautiful Minds',757999,3.3241,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26833,_binary '\0','/j6QRBOCh2hc1XUQ16E5hwF0xIOI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355546',7.7,12866,'ta','அயன்','Deva works for Arumugam, a smuggler, who has taken care of him for many years. However, when his best friend gets killed, Deva decides to help the police to nab a dangerous drug lord.','/49UwEe5U1GuRC6W7difviwCgde2.jpg','2009-04-03',162,'Released',NULL,'Ayan',20049,1.637,7,'jqQGEQnYyyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26834,_binary '\0','/ijiKTBq83oSWg1FpouegVqlut65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355623',6.3,1689,'fr','Barbe Bleue','Anne reads her younger sister, Marie-Catherine, the story of Bluebeard. In 17th-century France, another set of sisters — also named Anne and Marie-Catherine — are left impoverished by their father\'s death. Marie-Catherine dreams of marrying into money, and soon falls for wealthy divorcé Bluebeard. Grateful for the chance at a life of comfort, Marie-Catherine marries Bluebeard — in spite of rumors that he has made a hobby of murdering his wives.','/d2AvtBdNGXvKvDKlix9dTMKi4M5.jpg','2010-03-26',80,'Released',NULL,'Bluebeard',41499,2.679,5.6,'YLCWRyhdCQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26835,_binary '\0','/vAnHNACJvZjIRf4BdvMkav2Zbo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355627',4.3,1350,'en','Charles Band\'s Evil Bong 2: King Bong','Larnell and Luanne travel to South America in search of an antidote to the deranged effects caused by taking hits off of the malevolent Evil Bong.','/8ATSJrEaWaAi5NmRoxYB1If6lQP.jpg','2009-07-07',80,'Released','In 3D if you\'re stoned!','Charles Band\'s Evil Bong 2: King Bong',20029,2.571,3.9,'F0WJwn8dDgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26836,_binary '\0','/gz3rCM34UicmOxRY1T2SgiQZJoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355630',6.7,131880,'en','If I Stay','Mia Hall, a talented young cellist, thought the most difficult decision she would ever have to make would be whether to pursue her musical dreams at prestigious Juilliard or follow her heart to be with the love of her life, Adam, a rock singer/guitarist. However, a car wreck changes everything in an instant, and now Mia\'s life hangs in the balance. Suspended between life and death, Mia faces a choice that will decide her future.','/7Twh8h3Wh7GC9npTAEUThgkxkWL.jpg','2014-08-21',106,'Released','Live for Love.','If I Stay',249164,6.0341,7.341,'m9hZ40TJ0zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26837,_binary '\0','/2Ei2CsAerKG1mWdWeog5k2DbcRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355631',7,85729,'en','The Infiltrator','A U.S Customs official uncovers a massive money laundering scheme involving Pablo Escobar.','/758F57DxVRLe38S1Je4O1Bjx2u6.jpg','2016-07-13',127,'Released','The true story of one man against the biggest drug cartel in history.','The Infiltrator',325789,6.9001,6.684,'7cnUI_ryp2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26838,_binary '\0','/obtBUwnhRO8qcjCSB9iGvN9CCWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355638',7.1,4009,'fr','Le Chat du rabbin','The story of a rabbi and his talking cat, a sharp-tongued feline philosopher brimming with scathing humor and a less than pure love for the rabbi\'s teenage daughter.','/pcjwhq6hF3z2Wir0ZcKHTxmtRsH.jpg','2011-05-31',100,'Released',NULL,'The Rabbi\'s Cat',75491,2.7467,7,'0EQAeLo3MC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26839,_binary '\0','/jQPrZn9Qd6jGfPbfCm8OhOQkson.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355640',7.6,3244,'en','The Shock Doctrine','An investigation of \"disaster capitalism\", based on Naomi Klein\'s proposition that neo-liberal capitalism feeds on natural disasters, war and terror to establish its dominance.','/54CE1sVtX7vRYGGnDIBE9fHCkZO.jpg','2009-09-01',82,'Released',NULL,'The Shock Doctrine',41116,2.1606,7.1,'RCQj-z86qUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26840,_binary '\0','/gHz4ZQytRs8YGrqFMwB3Vrr8pig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355644',7,505520,'en','Passengers','A spacecraft traveling to a distant colony planet and transporting thousands of people has a malfunction in its sleep chambers. As a result, two passengers are awakened 90 years early.','/jK9S6HANSf2no64v1x1HxfcpmcA.jpg','2016-12-21',116,'Released','There is a reason they woke up.','Passengers',274870,13.8869,7,'7BWWWQzTpNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26841,_binary '\0','/mK4J2Qk4S4UQGOeMqsgei9DyPwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1355683',6.8,203930,'en','Black Mass','The true story of Whitey Bulger, the brother of a state senator and the most infamous violent criminal in the history of South Boston, who became an FBI informant to take down a Mafia family invading his turf.','/zfwciv4LIJkNQsfuhYGv0Nkiweg.jpg','2015-09-17',123,'Released','Keep your enemies close.','Black Mass',261023,13.0645,6.523,'R_F-lVhSfx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26842,_binary '\0','/1ij0pi6ybvUWsyRq9h2lmXRz7hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13557082',6,2712,'ml','മഹാവീര്യർ','An 18th-century king suffers from an illness of persistent hiccups. Meanwhile, a godman accused of stealing a temple statue in the present day defends himself in a contemporary court, where the two tales meet to unravel a satirical take on society.','/hbGaL2rnXkL7BnNyU2CxRcnYG3G.jpg','2022-07-21',126,'Released',NULL,'Mahaveeryar',820854,1.2028,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26843,_binary '\0','/pPd5Br8JkuGgYv3X7Jl8OPeVWDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13557090',6.1,1669,'ml','ഈശോ','While working the night at an ATM, a security guard, who is the prime witness in the case against a powerful industrialist, happens across a mysterious man named Eesho. They engage in a conversation and the guard pours his heart out to the stranger before realising that Eesho may not be a friend. Who is Eesho and what does he want?','/d32p3MUaItOPiRUlYiGyE8I1cSh.jpg','2022-10-04',107,'Released','Not from the Bible','Eesho',829675,0.8853,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26844,_binary '\0','/c5FumXxPjfohJyZdP4kfIghbm4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13559026',6.3,1676,'en','Jockey','An aging jockey is determined to win one last championship, but his dream is complicated when a young rookie shows up claiming to be his son.','/eMgskfX9BfG6i872hawQC17dPzr.jpg','2021-12-29',94,'Released',NULL,'Jockey',776511,2.1969,5.839,'YWI6Q-yKFbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26845,_binary '\0','/o375tDNib7tihlkWdtLW1fQhNL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13560574',6.5,228783,'en','X','In 1979, a group of young filmmakers set out to make an adult film in rural Texas, but when their reclusive, elderly hosts catch them in the act, the cast find themselves fighting for their lives.','/lopZSVtXzhFY603E9OqF7O1YKsh.jpg','2022-03-17',106,'Released','Dying to show you a good time.','X',760104,22.8332,6.703,'Awg3cWuHfoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26846,_binary '\0','/hEI5Se7PzgofyLoDr4qZASEzXOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13562940',5.9,4028,'hi','Dial 100','The Police emergency control room receives a call from a woman, who sounds troubled and wants to commit suicide. As officer Nikhil tries to calm her down, he discovers that the hysterical woman has bought a gun. When asked, she tells him to stay tuned to find out about her real intentions. But as time progresses, Nikhil figures out that the woman has sinister intentions and his family is in danger.','/t9ncR9DFRfa6XW0uh28B36CBh4U.jpg','2021-08-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Dial 100',770578,1.0453,5.962,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26847,_binary '\0','/gknIloEJve4FgAzlKdOUZu1K9HT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13566172',5.6,6585,'en','The Dive','Two sisters go diving at a beautiful, remote location. One of the sisters is struck by a rock, leaving her trapped 28 meters below. With dangerously low levels of oxygen and cold temperatures, it is up to her sister to fight for her life.','/1aLFglfGkTFG5p6KQg9o07EN3rl.jpg','2023-08-24',91,'Released','The calmer you are, the less air you lose.','The Dive',1109534,4.1636,6.268,'Sw3Yr54jCsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26848,_binary '\0','/jhoXSOgbqpgErGdYq2kWhbfkDFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1356763',6.9,2040,'en','Exporting Raymond','A documentary on Phil Rosenthal\'s experiences during the making of \"Voroniny,\" the Russian-language version of \"Everybody Loves Raymond\".','/9Y6DG9HiwWDhDpAFMyTzwEjgWsO.jpg','2011-04-29',86,'Released','A REAL comedy','Exporting Raymond',64836,1.1972,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26849,_binary '\0','/g5iO5dCQPG9DOqgdnnl5KUcgOPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1356790',7.5,3334,'en','I Am Divine','Harris Glenn Milstead, aka Divine (1945-1988) was the ultimate outsider turned underground hero. Spitting in the face of the status quos of body image, gender identity, sexuality, and preconceived notions of beauty, Divine succeeded in becoming an internationally recognized icon, recording artist, and character actor of stage and screen. Glenn went from the often-mocked, schoolyard fat kid to underdog royalty, standing up for millions of gay men and women, drag queens and punk rockers, and countless other socially ostracized misfits and freaks. With a completely committed in-your-face style, he blurred the line between performer and personality, and revolutionized pop culture.','/dVu4I4UPVJOY8LuW6fPojgSQUpL.jpg','2014-03-26',90,'Released','The true story of the most beautiful woman in the world','I Am Divine',171910,1.883,7.3,'WUF3w0M_e7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26850,_binary '\0','/yZq3kFveiDtfJpwQTgZwXBxs4aE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1356864',6.1,25081,'en','I\'m Still Here','I\'m Still Here is a portrayal of a tumultuous year in the life of actor Joaquin Phoenix. With remarkable access, the film follows the Oscar-nominee as he announces his retirement from a successful film career in the fall of 2008 and sets off to reinvent himself as a hip-hop musician. The film is a portrait of an artist at a crossroads and explores notions of courage and creative reinvention, as well as the ramifications of a life spent in the public eye.','/h8c53OPv2miF6vzpVXQZX8jw1pJ.jpg','2010-09-10',107,'Released','He\'s done with Hollywood.','I\'m Still Here',43939,6.1934,5.948,'N4-oww1rA28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26851,_binary '\0','/fCSqV63JvWzyDM6NaD3p0en1gDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1356928',6.8,3024,'fr','Le Père de mes enfants','Grégoire Canvel has everything a man could want. A wife he loves, three delightful children, and a stimulating job. He\'s a film producer. Discovering talented filmmakers and developing films that fit his conception of the cinema-free and true to life-is precisely his reason for living. Yet his prestigious production company, Moon Films, is on its last legs.','/f9kRv5aPeRAXWqvjn4HSAmT6DvH.jpg','2009-12-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Father of My Children',43614,1.7777,6.7,'E6hAmtnwAvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26852,_binary '\0','/ohlNSR8MsHk5e6fcAxqAJmcz4Sm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13570066',4.1,12838,'en','Desert Warrior','In 7th-century Arabia, Princess Hind becomes a warrior to defy the ruthless Emperor Kisra. Forged into a warrior and aided by legendary bandit Hanzala, Hind unites warring tribes for a last stand—the historic Battle of Dhi Qar—that will change history.','/waxnw1NpzTPY5JkqWvu0muSopRJ.jpg','2026-04-23',127,'Released','One warrior must unite them all.','Desert Warrior',898704,11.258,6.1,'fraAGOuT3sA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26853,_binary '\0','/5B22eed7ErxFiYAG4Ksb4eLwKNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13575806',6.5,13008,'en','Back to the Outback','Tired of being locked in a reptile house where humans gawk at them like they are monsters, a ragtag group of Australia’s deadliest creatures plot an escape from their zoo to the Outback, a place where they’ll fit in without being judged.','/jbAUTO7qFN8XFG2LM3bz30vzGFJ.jpg','2021-12-03',92,'Released','Dangerously cute and on the loose.','Back to the Outback',770254,10.3317,7.573,'dDNhtB7L8Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26854,_binary '\0','/19A41pDxtCfGoVKJuKbXAVy8yqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13577982',8.9,2264,'hi','Secrets of Sinauli','The excavations of Sinauli have uncovered secrets that were buried for 4000 years.','/ngiTDQRmhzE7xCQoRszSkkLjegB.jpg','2021-02-09',56,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of Sinauli',858993,0.7722,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26855,_binary '\0','/aFO0uKhvbImJ1n4XeVHnbjAhKSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13580484',5.2,1844,'en','The Piper','Liz and her daughter Amy move to Hamelin where a dark secret in Liz\'s past is uncovered by the restless spirit of the Pied Piper, who seeks out those who have gotten away with a crime, and punishes them by taking away their children.','/8lrevAFLg3Sdn6E76cMSeBg3NJh.jpg','2023-10-27',105,'Released','The last tune you\'ll ever hear.','The Piper',1045563,2.615,4.8,'n1Flaxe2WrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26856,_binary '\0','/sb6YO8QwlJYJZCYroVWV0psNmXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13580840',7.5,1968,'en','Simón','Simón, a Venezuelan freedom fighter exiled in Miami, copes not only with trauma, but also deep guilt over a choice he must make: stay in Miami and start a new life, or return home to the losing fight against a tyrannical regime.','/9ltmI5Mef0NHWm4Nxcpm6hT8VhY.jpg','2023-04-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Simón',1105832,1.4322,8.3,'-6AFAeu33E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26857,_binary '\0','/8Ls4lbIQZTupoYw9ORE6TXNNmWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13582682',8.6,1260,'gu','Raado','Some powerful people, with strong political influence, leaders of the crowd and determined law enforcement collide with one another and the society implodes.','/gAILFHdcSbgCE9mQX2j6Jn9pzgP.jpg','2022-07-22',142,'Released',NULL,'Raado',1001263,1.3815,8.667,'ee77lfNAAhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26858,_binary '\0','/f9gf70WfMM8wmDu86ivaTqPkyoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13583144',5.9,5713,'en','The Minimalists: Less Is Now','They\'ve built a movement out of minimalism. Longtime friends Joshua Fields Millburn and Ryan Nicodemus share how our lives can be better with less.','/1foXpKnMMAL1OzBrCS3CcwnHO7S.jpg','2021-01-01',53,'Released',NULL,'The Minimalists: Less Is Now',774054,0.9688,6.111,'jn-xbOCZOiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26859,_binary '\0','/n3ClIKIbZ408M4LFkSR9vtlDi8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13585362',7.2,1839,'uk','Я, Побєда і Берлін','The story of the novice musician Kuzma. Three days before the planned concert he goes with his friend Bard to Berlin for the old car \"Pobeda\". It is said that there is a collector ready to exchange the yellow beast for the Mercedes-Benz W140 (called as \"Mers\"). Kuzma promises his girlfriend Barbara to return home in a new car, and the guys from the band - to have time to perform. From the first minutes of the trip, of course, everything goes wrong. However, one thing is certain: the adventure will help the heroes find their true purpose.','/ryVAEk4W69suya0zLjI2U3rCChC.jpg','2024-03-14',100,'Released',NULL,'Rocky Road to Berlin',851479,1.5251,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26860,_binary '\0','/imexOndpcMnuf4H9t3o2SiaMxfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13586204',5.2,24774,'en','MobKing','Coming off a lengthy prison sentence, Mike White is coming home to a world changed drastically by technology and a mindset of just trying to live a normal life running his Gentlemen\'s club and taking care of his family.','/syA9xYFwUtZ3LWU1q3ORMwugwtt.jpg','2023-05-26',89,'Released',NULL,'MobKing',1132121,1.8232,5,'CtHREc7voGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26861,_binary '\0','/a94DIhurJk2QAhU9yBobvNsxBvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13588944',8,2124,'tr','Aşk, Mark ve Ölüm – Liebe, D-Mark und Tod','Cem Kaya’s dense documentary essay celebrates 60 years of Turkish music in Germany. An alternative post-war history that is at the same time a musical Who’s Who – from Yüksel Özkasap to Derdiyoklar and Muhabbet.','/lDhJTlhRo3GcaKmR0aDAosVmNiH.jpg','2022-10-06',98,'Released','A Music Film in German and Turkish','Love, Deutschmarks and Death',928350,0.9744,8,'mUW9FzsvEGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26862,_binary '\0','/11bG4JLUetKABGjf02g4YCI4G8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13592970',5.8,2598,'en','Loop Track','A four-day journey turns into a fight for survival. This is a psychological thriller about Ian, who wants to get as far away from humanity as possible, into the New Zealand bush. Some other individuals get attached to him. And he has the feeling that they are being followed. Is that real though?','/7cCztHZK3VKCECAV9YRDq1yAOP8.jpg','2023-07-28',94,'Released','Trust your fear.','Loop Track',1147236,1.5409,5.565,'PvJ9pzxJjFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26863,_binary '\0','/ckcyHqSPT9eCfo6Lbn7JbkcFYNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1359421',6,4551,'sv','Bröllopsfotografen','When the factory in Molkom shuts down, Robin leaves his beloved hometown to try his luck in Stockholm as a wedding photographer. This experience changes not merely his outlook on life but also his hairstyle.','/vvgJIUt4X0H2oyXpo6Ae52hCAZw.jpg','2009-10-16',108,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding Photographer',33494,1.6089,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26864,_binary '\0','/2CbwkYIGAdVsg50kULBMFHJyweG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1359552',7.9,1964,'bn','অন্তহীন','Antaheen follows the lives of three couples in tumultous relationships, who lead different lives but are connected by the infinite struggles and pain each of them goes through.','/oEOkpURjBN3i6iB17JNsNgC5cV2.jpg','2009-01-23',113,'Released',NULL,'Antaheen',115888,1.0753,6.091,'BqlNcVMZfn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26865,_binary '\0','/rAMwvUZZfbowJm5ai7eMAs26lqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1359553',5.5,2065,'en','The Chameleon','The amazing true story of Frédéric Bourdin, who after having plundered all the centers for runaway minors and deliquents in Europe, even thought he has come of age, now passes himself off as Nicholas Barclay, a 13-year-old American who had vanished three years ago. To his astonishment, Nicholas\'s family welcomes him like their son, leaving Interpol and the FBI aghast. It is the beginning of a race against time for the investigators, family and Bourdin. But who is manipulating whom? And who is Frederic Bourdin in reality?','/lmT69QsDZzEjg9BWoiLXTVlRAqo.jpg','2010-06-23',106,'Released','How do you know what you see is really the truth?','The Chameleon',58258,2.3552,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26866,_binary '\0','/hVD7KzuZQMzvrE0zlbUnyJuP7wg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1359554',5.8,1583,'en','High Noon','Baltimore\'s top hostage negotiator embarks on a relationship with a man who could be her soulmate while racing to resolve a case that threatens her job and her life','/asAuYaSmJnPXgERnsucgrsgM9MM.jpg','2009-04-04',90,'Released',NULL,'High Noon',35059,2.2051,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26867,_binary '\0','/upesCDlcWdcctY4LGanfpzHiOur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13598976',6.6,3793,'zh','緝魂','The founder of a corporation developing a futuristic cancer treatment is brutally murdered, and a prosecutor sidelined by the illness asks to lead the case, assisted by his newly pregnant detective wife.','/hrLX0HY408IFiVdSFytOtqcfLAs.jpg','2021-01-08',130,'Released',NULL,'The Soul',773569,2.4424,6.909,'bgf4wWrM8Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26868,_binary '\0','/xHJLzRy1YjC4GNc1XDnbRexwmK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13599178',6.8,1730,'bn','হাবজী গাবজী','Ambitious parents Ahana and Aditya, grappling with their erratic working hours, introduce their son Tipu to mobile gaming. Over time, the situation takes a turn as the boy\'s harmless pastime spirals into a relentless addiction.','/u6thtKjTiUl0Kyl09yu2a22Bnes.jpg','2022-06-03',124,'Released',NULL,'Habji Gabji',718569,1.1855,5,'16dIyByf_uQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26869,_binary '\0','/nhb9KwpI2O76t6YFjYaW7BSJOls.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13603190',5.5,1279,'en','The Integrity of Joseph Chambers','Fearing the apocalypse, an insurance salesman sets off into the woods on a solo hunting experiment.','/iKqEz4g6mPgm93NICaSSSGHHbjn.jpg','2023-02-17',96,'Released',NULL,'The Integrity of Joseph Chambers',950161,2.2887,5.1,'5SMbYwVEmko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26870,_binary '\0','/quo7dRc6HQqtZKcRoKuegkegFp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13603778',5.4,2526,'en','American Murderer','The True story of how charismatic con man Jason Derek Brown bankrolls his extravagant lifestyle through a series of scams. On Brown’s trail: Lance Leising, a dogged FBI special agent determined to put Brown behind bars. When Brown’s funds run low and his past catches up with him, he plots his most elaborate scheme yet, pitting himself against Leising in a deadly game of cat and mouse — and becoming the most unlikely and elusive fugitive on the FBI’s most-wanted list.','/sfCmTkVVtwoW4yNu1Cs4ZDtCTa5.jpg','2022-10-21',101,'Released','Based on the incredible true crime story.','American Murderer',774301,3.2531,5.9,'K14rwyu9HWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26871,_binary '\0','/m1k24MwmoqAdKMPJDaBLwdB5Tps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13603966',5.7,69537,'en','Heart of Stone','An intelligence operative for a shadowy global peacekeeping agency races to stop a hacker from stealing its most valuable — and dangerous — weapon.','/vB8o2p4ETnrfiWEgVxHmHWP9yRl.jpg','2023-08-09',122,'Released','Defy the odds','Heart of Stone',724209,12.3158,6.7,'LOHrNvFH3F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26872,_binary '\0','/kgfGezhJ663gXnAZOg5PfAL8fFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13605284',5.8,1757,'en','A Mistake','In the midst of a new scheme to publicly report surgeons’ performance, a gifted surgeon’s life is thrown into disarray as her colleagues begin to close ranks, and even her partner, a nurse at the hospital, turns her back on her.','/j6bpNu94Nah75ED2WQVxt2iOX.jpg','2