c comedy.','Borderline',1013482,4.3055,5.7,'ORHBgSvX_24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26945,_binary '\0','/u4JsyMpp6mtAYbg0t3GIaCgPrRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13651462',6.7,7152,'en','Lurker','When a twenty-something retail clerk encounters a rising pop star, he takes the opportunity to edge his way into the in-crowd. But as the line between friend and fan blurs beyond recognition, access and proximity become a matter of life and death.','/3rbY3fjXQpt4sQLQvKD7CT6oJsS.jpg','2025-08-22',100,'Released','Keep your friends close.','Lurker',1264573,2.6539,6.431,'876d5ZnyzzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26946,_binary '\0','/7aiVtavsu145yo6n4ZpazwMDLXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13651628',7,20943,'ja','竜とそばかすの姫','Suzu is a 17-year-old high-school student living in a rural town with her father. Wounded by the loss of her mother at a young age, Suzu one day discovers the massive online world \"U\" and dives into this alternate reality as her avatar, Belle. Before long, all of U\'s eyes are fixed on Belle, when, suddenly, a mysterious, dragon-like figure appears before her.','/fYHOD4pxZQk4rsP2tQrZI5uBlZV.jpg','2021-07-16',121,'Released','You are no longer alone.','Belle',776305,8.0488,7.6,'7iiDjDmywIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26947,_binary '\0','/97MOhHIgU6ZdLcB9DrAhx3WAqrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13651794',6.7,74054,'en','May December','Twenty years after their notorious tabloid romance gripped the nation, a married couple buckles under the pressure when an actress arrives to do research for a film about their past.','/zhV7B610l7hjlri4ywikJ18ONuq.jpg','2023-11-16',117,'Released','Some roles are transformative.','May December',839369,9.415,6.567,'4VdAParM4h8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26948,_binary '\0','/mkYYFZhjdExNNexOpCfxu9hbERp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13651858',3.8,4134,'en','Safer at Home','Two years into the pandemic, a group of friends throw an online party with a night of games, drinking and drugs. After taking an ecstasy pill, things go terribly wrong and the safety of their home becomes more terrifying than the raging chaos outside.','/2mfnSVdDartB6TJ3k7Qyn0zMzKu.jpg','2021-02-26',82,'Released','Isolation is a killer.','Safer at Home',792657,2.3473,5.3,'1oiySDPje3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26949,_binary '\0','/bgfqWW9mLs24hXuqiIcxU1j7Fgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13652142',7,8501,'en','Magazine Dreams','Aspiring bodybuilder Killian Maddox struggles to find human connection in an exploration of celebrity and violence. Nothing deters him from his fiercely protected dream of superstardom, not even the doctors who warn him of the permanent damage he causes to himself with his quest.','/vSidx9NHKuQIPEQ4yI9b9zkTeh3.jpg','2025-03-21',123,'Released','Never stop dreaming.','Magazine Dreams',784524,3.8922,7,'imqmeRe46iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26950,_binary '\0','/jDyNnLyJUOsVgseQgkHPRxpyo4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13652286',6.4,28654,'en','Fight or Flight','A mercenary takes on the job of tracking down a target on a plane but must protect that target when they\'re surrounded by people trying to kill both of them.','/dNyzZaMDS5hmOzWHFgNlgRRPDB0.jpg','2025-04-03',102,'Released','This flight goes nonstop to hell.','Fight or Flight',1212855,8.5523,6.273,'Cd-4wfnn8bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26951,_binary '\0','/3ctUvC1k206JjoUxGPdJqhBfa63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13654122',6,3783,'ta','யானை','A brash young man tries to prevent his wealthy, large family from being split up by their arch-nemesis, who wants to avenge his brother\'s death, which he blames on the family.','/gfK7CTnhoFcxRVNk04bUHQjq3AJ.jpg','2022-07-01',156,'Released',NULL,'Yaanai',882416,1.1889,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26952,_binary '\0','/9nhjGaFLKtddDPtPaX5EmKqsWdH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13654226',6.7,180522,'en','The Gorge','Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.','/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg','2025-02-13',128,'Released','The world\'s most dangerous secret lies between them.','The Gorge',950396,31.5703,7.7,'rUSdnuOLebE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26953,_binary '\0','/kYLTMpw4LTrHPF1fSzdE4kIqVT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1365471',3.8,1685,'da','Julefrokosten','When Anders Bo begins his new job as a car salesman, he is given the special task of infiltrating the small competing car shop, Holger\'s Auto during their annual Christmas party and steal their customer file. As Anders Bo romps through the commotion and antics of the celebration, he realizes that his assignment in fact relates to an old family feud and that the odd and funny characters working there might have more to offer than meets the eye - especially Amalie, the beautiful daughter of the owner, Holger. In the middle of Christmas pudding and Christmas cheer Anders Bo suddenly learns to listen to his heart.','/bBGVivV0G1dpPY03sOLrAjCOjFu.jpg','2009-11-13',86,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Party',48746,1.8758,4.5,'WqRRwODwAgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26954,_binary '\0','/wZKGZCL1dhVUljVXMyx5kk1LO6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1365474',6.8,5716,'nl','Komt een vrouw bij de dokter','Handsome Dutchman Stijn is the star of an advertising agency with his buddy Frenk and a hot womanizer. The boys start their own agency and Stijn marries colleague Carmen, who accepts his incurable greed for truly meaningless one-night-stands. Even fatherhood and a move to the boring country go well, until Carmen gets breast cancer. Now their lives are turned upside-down, maybe wrecked','/qmPhy9Y5sUAHnk8TfIZMCTKnX9N.jpg','2009-11-26',105,'Released','Would you cheat on you