e spins out of control as he finds himself on the run from a maniacal drug lord.','/jlGzZ8McDp73PAaWMeYCHWeHiM4.jpg','2011-12-09',81,'Released','Worst. Babysitter. Ever.','The Sitter',57431,6.1795,5.571,'kTmF4UnkkbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26967,_binary '\0','/tkj4i4TQP6TijYxqUq6duPZUW2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1366365',4.9,41483,'en','The Cold Light of Day','After his family is kidnapped during their sailing trip in Spain, a young Wall Street trader is confronted by the people responsible: intelligence agents looking to recover a mysterious briefcase.','/jLmKMhibZjHUYtsHQLIa5UBwqcc.jpg','2012-04-04',93,'Released','Instinct is his greatest weapon.','The Cold Light of Day',77948,5.2124,5.4,'qxJpe8d2dBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26968,_binary '\0','/l3jOmmiB4USBatikr5qBcWOJ3SN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1366409',6.2,3696,'en','Miral','A drama centered on an orphaned Palestinian girl growing up in the wake of the first Arab-Israeli war who finds herself drawn into the conflict.','/s58tUfisFwVj7E43ihBYPWJXYmg.jpg','2010-09-15',112,'Released','Is this the face of a terrorist?','Miral',45595,1.8611,5.8,'kRyFbrjo7_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26969,_binary '\0','/ej1bwcXrRdJNUG843KIosu8srCg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13664684',7.8,65331,'te','కార్తికేయ 2','Before the Kalyug begins, Lord Krishna hands over an anklet that holds the answer to all of world’s miseries. Years later a doctor finds himself in the thick of things when the pursuit for the anklet carries on. A doctor with a curious mind, Karthikeya, aka Karthik, believes in pursuing the truth. The quest leads Karthik to discover the power of the ancient Indian belief system and the essence of Krishna.','/fKKoQndNfbDOLfYM1Zogt7miGF1.jpg','2022-08-13',145,'Released','Krishna Is Truth','Karthikeya 2',894762,1.5702,6.317,'UIYS4iyeXj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26970,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1366687',5.7,2011,'ru','Любовь в большом городе','Three Russian friends work in New York, party hard and chase women. It\'s great times until they get cursed by a drunken Russian night club owner, who turns out to be Saint Valentine. St. Valentine\'s curse is simple - the guys lose all their manly powers until they find their true love. It turns out to be harder than it sounds - our boys have a lot of growing up to do. Fast.','/lHy4EMorlJKhawStHPQYcxd9qO7.jpg','2009-03-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Love and the City',24686,0.8831,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26971,_binary '\0','/edH2sKM63YiSEOWoaJPN87a71dZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13669038',6.9,85956,'en','Women Talking','A group of women in an isolated religious colony struggle to reconcile their faith with a series of sexual assaults committed by the colony\'s men.','/wcTc9GveMMjAdHSlzdE0FaRCtqi.jpg','2022-12-23',104,'Released','Do nothing. Stay and fight. Leave.','Women Talking',777245,7.7624,6.811,'dH7Sl2h_aHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26972,_binary '\0','/adzCWbEdMYDI7c3rqBw65IEVG8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1366981',7,2856,'tr','Uzak İhtimal','Muezzin Musa falls for his neighbor, the Catholic nurse Clara. The story gets even more exceptional when Musa meets Yakup, who turns out to be connected with Clara.','/nG2rQYfUpZj4VJdB4I6Bb6SzBHB.jpg','2009-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Wrong Rosary',34420,1.6019,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26973,_binary '\0','/x4oXUo4DutqU8rlFcU7IGpOfjuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13671922',7.6,3081,'ml','മധുരം','\"Love is sweet when it\'s new, it\'s sweeter when it\'s true\".The movie mainly focuses on Sabu and Kevin, the two bystanders in the hospital. Sabu waits for his wife\"s recovery, and Kevin, for his mother\'s surgery. Both of them become friends as Sabu\'s love story helps Kevin realize his mistakes in his marriage life.The movie revolves around the journey of Sabu\'s love life 10 years back and the journey of Kevin\'s realization. The movie also highlights other bystanders life story which can be related to','/vJLFF6XDHuOYeFrm4503fdmIG42.jpg','2021-12-24',122,'Released',NULL,'Madhuram',829830,1.366,6.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26974,_binary '\0','/bS4EmS7z2wiWal3eutYI5mUUhWk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13671954',6.5,2091,'ml','മ്യാവൂ','Follows Dasthakeer and Sulekha, a married couple that moves to Dubai with their three children for a better living.','/mZCp9z5LCrMCTSnjmHuyBQ8k8aW.jpg','2021-12-24',145,'Released',NULL,'Meow',894095,1.2735,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26975,_binary '\0','/o31kGDH9GbAZjVLwPYno8XvQGV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13680520',4.2,3071,'en','9 Bullets','A former burlesque dancer turned author discovers a second chance at life and redemption when she risks everything to rescue her young neighbor after he witnesses his parents’ murder. Now on the run from the local crime boss, who happens to be her longtime ex, she makes a desperate attempt to get the boy to safety.','/8h8R2D6AVTZCCA6NIvioObkhXsb.jpg','2022-04-14',96,'Released','One shot will change everything.','9 Bullets',777831,3.9021,5.3,'FyZcUWLvyos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26976,_binary '\0','/5RyXjT8DNS5VnJqarrSZQJ7XJYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368068',7.5,2167,'tr','Deli Deli Olma','The story of an exile man who came from Russia. He is the last descended of his family.','/ngNbNq2C5gAMMyJogTdUXAwQwDH.jpg','2009-04-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Piano Girl',37572,1.3225,7.313,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26977,_binary '\0','/sHy9qPITQcD8PGHUHRWseguyfiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368116',6.7,12120,'id','Merantau','In Minangkabau, West Sumatera, Yuda a skilled practitioner of Silat Harimau is in the final preparations to begin his \"Merantau\" a century\'s old rites-of-passage to be carried out by the community\'s young men that will see him leave the comforts of his idyllic farming village and make a name for himself in the bustling city of Jakarta.','/60Vd3zovl6XeRH8GQOsM9fwMHRO.jpg','2009-08-06',134,'Released','Every journey must begin with one small step.','Merantau',34626,3.1835,6.486,'2-DFFNUE1-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26978,_binary '\0','/3OqxS0TSFmwmk2H30Xo4dGycN93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368439',7.7,1440,'ka','გაღმა ნაპირი','Life creates many obstacles for 12 years old boy - Tedo. Tedo belongs to the generation, which was forced to mass displacement because of the civil war in Abkhazia, one of the most beatiful places in Georgia. The civil war took away everything Tedo had, even hope. The film tells about an extraordinary internal drama of a little boy, his thoughts, feelings, pasions, sorrows and efforts to take arms against the difficulties.','/yroZgC9rrGI1HGjwUTz5fkJUkVI.jpg','2009-05-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Other Bank',76459,0.9695,5.9,'348jxROE0XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26979,_binary '\0','/deWsq58zna9vzVDpP9kCv8XXVvI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368440',4.6,9502,'ru','Branded','In a dystopian future, where corporate brands have created a disillusioned population, one man\'s effort to unlock the truth behind the conspiracy leads to an epic battle with hidden forces that control the world.','/8YE4OfV1sHketYGy78AOCMI7j7T.jpg','2012-09-06',106,'Released','Crack the code. Take back your mind.','Branded',112090,2.4011,4.7,'rQ5p7l1hNuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26980,_binary '\0','/o69yilqOI0QMNMMktSLTo1XP5Y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368443',6.7,2100,'de','Same Same But Different','Based on the true story of Benjamin Prufer and Sreykeo Solvan. The unexpected and uncertain love story of Sreykeo, a 21 year old bar girl in Phnom Penh and Ben, a young German student traveling to Cambodia on a post graduation summer trip. When Ben returns home to Germany