o express herself artistically. At an underground rave, she meets Iranian born Saman, now an Australian citizen, who offers her a way out of her country and the possibility of living without fear.','/cADUJLOR3RI9VvBO1aKdN2cZ5Fh.jpg','2009-11-19',96,'Released','A generation searching for freedom...','My Tehran for Sale',77574,0.5548,4.8,'47sEhwrq73E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26985,_binary '\0','/uT7HW48P9PKm2LYLqs9gJqP8skd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1368870',4.8,1322,'en','Ticket Out','A desperate mother is forced to break the law in order to protect her children from her abusive ex-husband, and rely on the kindness of strangers who help battered spouses to escape their tyrannical mates via an elaborate \"underground railway\" system.','/zNFx2bQQP4jLbpaNYwQKaVN5XJn.jpg','2012-09-28',90,'Released','When the law is wrong, he is your only way out','Ticket Out',81010,1.7868,5.7,'TTIC2nAqstc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26986,_binary '\0','/izC8D4Bc9ebeupZB020cWUOgDez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13691036',5.6,1335,'nl','Meskina','A thirty-something aspiring children\'s author, labeled \"meskina\" (pity case) by her Moroccan-Dutch community for still being career-less and single, sets out to once and for all find professional success and true love.','/1qP4A0ivvWzGJjeOkQ7tBHW1eOE.jpg','2021-07-15',94,'Released','Write your own fairytale.','Meskina',841764,1.4133,5.9,'mn68KA5iMl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26987,_binary '\0','/9ugGl7jpiIvKj3UTY331MKl4Bz4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13694628',7.1,13312,'en','Nitram','Based on true events, \"Nitram\" lives with his parents in suburban Australia in the mid-90s. He lives a life of isolation and frustration at never fitting in. As his anger grows, he begins a slow descent into a nightmare that culminates in the most heinous of acts.','/j9dGkbHpSM254QhoLNxetvszcHa.jpg','2021-09-30',112,'Released','April 28, 1996, an event upsets Australia','Nitram',797457,3.6103,6.9,'8DK9RUl1BV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26988,_binary '\0','/2P7pGVJ5dGixxdmUyUvQBdkJNKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13694706',3.5,2438,'en','The Survivalist','A year and a half after the fall of civilization from a virus outbreak, a former FBI agent is forced to protect a young woman, who is immune to the disease, from a dangerous gang hunting her led by a psychopath who believes he’s going to use her to save the world.','/fLwKD0nJukoaAJv9pbPrphHs4Uq.jpg','2021-12-02',91,'Released','Ordinary guy, extraordinary arsenal.','The Survivalist',779057,3.4025,4.4,'69cl5QtYLzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26989,_binary '\0','/7OKubhoYyGsiiuCoZUJV37piDK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13696296',4.8,1376,'zh','中国医生','Based on real-life events, the film recounts the efforts of the Wuhan medical staff as they attempt to deal with the rising cases of Covid-19.','/8fhiqls7ucXalfqE3JaIL2MC6Oo.jpg','2021-07-09',129,'Released',NULL,'Chinese Doctors',848880,1.5264,5.8,'NncdLxzFCPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26990,_binary '\0','/lwZik54oIF4qKoSYZzkvGzmHTTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13696668',6.8,1696,'en','Tony Parker: The Final Shot','The background and career of Tony Parker, whose determination led him to become arguably the greatest French basketball player.','/8zrgid8f6c2ODn2T94jKfopOF4C.jpg','2021-01-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Tony Parker: The Final Shot',782973,2.0951,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26991,_binary '\0','/llZ5ulQCN9jykjCgqUUshZI046w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1369667',6.6,1620,'de','Ich und Kaminski','Young journalist Sebastian Zöllner is writing an article on artist Manuel Kaminski. Zöllner hopes that Kaminski dies soon, so that he can cash in on his article.','/jr5E9HuBdttsF9t7ceiAyEeTXZl.jpg','2015-09-17',124,'Released',NULL,'Me and Kaminski',277968,2.0294,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26992,_binary '\0','/qrcS0uQYNZrMdf0sOSN7Wt454fm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1369706',5.5,47804,'en','The Ward','Kristen, a troubled young woman, is captured by the police after burning down a farmhouse and is locked in the North Bend Psychiatric Hospital. Soon, she begins to suspect that the place has a dark secret at its core and she\'s determined to find out what it is.','/x2dqoY5cYop46SKebNXRNL5EXEM.jpg','2010-09-13',89,'Released','Only sanity can keep you alive!','The Ward',45657,4.2533,5.7,'HfrKb0fbtNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26993,_binary '\0','/9Qvc6fzE3PzodgJ9no11GlLYZJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1369845',6.2,23465,'en','Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie','During a family vacation, Alex, a young witch, accidentally casts a curse on her loved ones. To reverse this, she tries to find a magical stone while her brother tries to keep their parents together.','/vrjLcGBLurVem5lXN8237qz4tyE.jpg','2009-08-28',94,'Released','Family vacations can be tricky.','Wizards of Waverly Place: The Movie',26736,8.4317,7.3,'GRizB__8zHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26994,_binary '\0','/uuZLdQDybPZKQg8td1jwVOAZEBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13698928',6.6,6087,'hi','Silence... Can You Hear It?','When Pooja, the daughter of retired Justice Chaudhary, is found murdered under mysterious circumstances, ACP Verma is roped in to investigate this high-profile case. When everyone is hiding the truth, justice will thrive despite the silence.','/9lxPuirAgtqHYG3JtIdfg7TucKn.jpg','2021-03-26',136,'Released',NULL,'Silence... Can You Hear It?',804005,1.5301,6.13,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26995,_binary '\0','/oInRFA3YNf5hqgbiYwc0ZNJbybl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13698942',5.1,7582,'en','The Immaculate Room','Mike and Kate, a young couple, get the once-in-a lifetime chance to win a cool five million dollars. The challenge: Live for 50 days in a blank space. Sticking it out for thirty days, and the five million are theirs. How difficult can it be?','/pGtgOx5YAPWLl9K4Hdqrs5Qblbj.jpg','2022-08-19',92,'Released','1 room. 2 people. $5 million. If you leave, you lose.','The Immaculate Room',806929,3.7164,5.2,'st7gTecMRMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26996,_binary '\0','/b18Vz2Y1lDyxoHK8EzY3InZQ04p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13699132',6.5,1755,'en','The Supremes at Earl\'s All-You-Can-Eat','Three lifelong best friends known as “The Supremes” share the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood from decades of weathering life’s storms. Through the joys and sorrows of life, marriage and children, happiness and blues, love and loss, new shades of heartbreak and illness threaten to stir up the past when the trio sees their bond put to the test as they face their most challenging times yet.','/b6gnKDl7iMbW0LqrruhrzVArgVB.jpg','2024-08-07',124,'Released','Sisterhood reigns supreme.','The Supremes at Earl\'s All-You-Can-Eat',1002626,4.3352,6.7,'cnQhulR2doU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26997,_binary '\0','/5I27oM8XBdGePryOtTJUpnmkl7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13701962',5.6,4025,'en','A California Christmas: City Lights','Follows Callie and Joseph one year after they fell in love, now running a dairy farm and winery, but their romance is threatened when business and family obligations call Joseph back to the city.','/rI1ikNMmbeMDZiDDVATYaOeFEHL.jpg','2021-12-16',105,'Released',NULL,'A California Christmas: City Lights',882096,2.8537,6.6,'G6-vUOyr8GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26998,_binary '\0','/7ZPXQIh2TJ7F6ID4Ll9vN5mKtK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1370212',7.2,3710,'tr','Hayat Var','Hayat, her father and bedridden grandfather live in a riverside shack near the dangerously dark but breathtakingly beautiful waters of the Bosphorus. Hayat\'s father owns a small boat that secures the family\'s survival through a miscellany of not always lawful ventures. Beyond the motion and romance of the water, Hayat\'s life is harsh and unrelenting. But Hayat has an instinct for survival. Her capacity for courage, endurance and hope in the face of these trials suggest that there is Life despite the manifold injustices of an unjust world.','/gYp4yvLEKH59OhGZGektlubUgZ4.jpg','2009-03-05',121,'Released','Portrait of a lost childhood.','My Only Sunshine',37573,0.7991,6.9,'0_zwGdGSNAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(26999,_binary '\0','/ccE09Tf0W38uPV1GoQJKvopg0R0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13702796',6.3,4279,'fr','Pacifiction - Tourment sur les îles','Island of Tahiti. French government official De Roller is a calculating man with impeccable manners, capable of dealing with both high society and the locals he frequents in shady joints.','/kElJcT1oteDCyRzw0XNqrTZcCvA.jpg','2022-09-02',166,'Released',NULL,'Pacifiction',691214,3.2668,6.2,'CMrPRG3pTwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27000,_binary '\0','/2v9zlSKPrVLyhW8ywQoi3e6mzxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1370429',7.3,3619,'hi','99','Two unlucky delinquents stumble into a series of random misadventures when they attempt to collect a debt for their boss.','/2MtjgwcijLshodM5cNkCJFUW7tK.jpg','2009-05-15',141,'Released','Part fact. Part fiction. Pure fun.','99',19980,1.2057,6.759,'ZXXSWxg-D4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27001,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1370889',6.8,2973,'en','Talhotblond','This is the true story of a love triangle that takes place entirely online. Lies lead to murder in real life, as a teenage vixen (screen name \'talhotblond\') lures men into her web. Revealing a shocking true crime story that shows the Internet\'s power to unleash our most dangerous fantasies.','/bB9zl6vFxqR5Ebz9UR9pFEufNGL.jpg','2009-02-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Talhotblond',39246,1.9208,6.598,'CYOIL7tsxqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27002,_binary '\0','/sFDntG0Z0Wjrsz26TVptfs5OSLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371111',7.3,388444,'en','Cloud Atlas','A set of six nested stories spanning time between the 19th century and a distant post-apocalyptic future. Cloud Atlas explores how the actions and consequences of individual lives impact one another throughout the past, the present and the future. Action, mystery and romance weave through the story as one soul is shaped from a killer into a hero and a single act of kindness ripples across centuries to inspire a revolution in the distant future. Based on the award winning novel by David Mitchell. Directed by Tom Tykwer and the Wachowskis.','/8naVv2Xu3rWI5JKHz0vCujx6GaJ.jpg','2012-10-26',172,'Released','Everything is connected.','Cloud Atlas',83542,14.1216,6.899,'ByehYal_cCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27003,_binary '\0','/1EF6NoEynyNYODN8qePllCmK9z7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371117',6.4,3994,'en','Dear Mr. Gacy','A chronicle of the interaction between college student Jason Moss and the object of his obsession, serial killer John Wayne Gacy.','/zftYdcc60ixcsQu6a5ndWCUJIQ4.jpg','2010-05-10',103,'Released','The shocking true story of one of America’s most notorious serial killers.','Dear Mr. Gacy',51512,2.6572,5.8,'wZ_ERGZdqn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27004,_binary '\0','/njK3bfEYuqwjs8YTkpaDtkoTmVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371150',6.7,96257,'en','This Is Where I Leave You','When their father passes away, four grown, world-weary siblings return to their childhood home and are requested -- with an admonition -- to stay there together for a week, along with their free-speaking mother and a collection of spouses, exes and might-have-beens. As the brothers and sisters re-examine their shared history and the status of each tattered relationship among those who know and love them best, they reconnect in hysterically funny and emotionally significant ways.','/rVUI2267FdetVWz9UBQbqTmRVhQ.jpg','2014-09-10',103,'Released','Welcome home. Get uncomfortable.','This Is Where I Leave You',239678,9.261,6.656,'fH0cEP0mvlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27005,_binary '\0','/tEZ7LpbILQAbabjqJXvRzB9mF2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371155',7.1,16728,'en','Made in Dagenham','A dramatization of the 1968 strike at the Ford Dagenham car plant, where female workers walked out in protest against sexual discrimination.','/lcQGPxuk0fclp9UrFevI2lhDi1l.jpg','2010-10-01',113,'Released','In the fight for equal rights, an ordinary woman achieves something extraordinary.','Made in Dagenham',46138,3.4304,6.7,'OD-MuEKbOAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27006,_binary '\0','/2emtDkbxtAgtzEZOPVYVH9MBbUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371160',6.8,1475,'en','The Kid','Based on the real life story of Kevin Lewis, the film follows his childhood of abuse, his descent into a life of crime and the way he put his life together again afterwards.','/nKuquL5Xs0yCvBuPQnAw6zC89Wy.jpg','2010-04-22',107,'Released','When you have nothing to lose, you have everything to fight for.','The Kid',28987,1.6408,6.5,'ElezxolBAOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27007,_binary '\0','/vcEDGbbAMauqCbdZjL00GLJdLvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371574',7,5449,'tr','Kosmos','Kosmos is a thief and a miracle-worker. He appears one morning in a tiny, snowbound border village where he is welcomed with open arms – on account of arriving just in time to resuscitate a small boy who would otherwise have drowned.','/3vVT3FvGZ9l97cUUrDoQnqzdI9p.jpg','2009-10-14',117,'Released','A mysterious stranger with healing powers arrives in a small village.','Kosmos',43908,1.5318,6.547,'rHKW97aOUl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27008,_binary '\0','/pvbKbuIFVQdKmG0HNHhhcaO4CYP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371585',6.9,3064,'cn','奪命金','A criminal, a bank clerk and a police officer find their destinies entwined when a loan shark gets assaulted after having withdrawn $10 million from the bank in the midst of the world financial crisis.','/daQarDx1ags9E5K6zqwGYbkSQWW.jpg','2011-10-20',107,'Released','FOR FIVE MILLION DOLLARS, HOW FAR WOULD YOU GO?','Life Without Principle',90147,2.0617,6.7,'2M7jj-SgyaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27009,_binary '\0','/jKSW2xryZoR2yVYbHubkd1z5wgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371630',6.9,9232,'ja','空気人形','A life-size, inflatable sex doll suddenly comes to life one day. Without her owner knowing, she goes for a walk around town and falls in love with Junichi. She starts to date Junichi and gets a job at the same store where he works. Everything seems to be going perfectly for her until something unexpected happens.','/kLTNYdKFkH5kANF8QnVvLZNeWeN.jpg','2009-09-26',116,'Released','A very \"human\" story.','Air Doll',25053,3.0538,6.9,'R2T3YkiazkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27010,_binary '\0','/kZ694f33g9qwitN0KmrS7HUTBAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371631',6.3,1574,'el','Μαχαιροβγάλτης','After his father death, Nikos moves from Ptolemaida to Athens. His uncle offers him food and shelter while he starts taking care of his dogs. Alone in an isolated suburb, he\'s wearing down into his misery routine, till the moment his relationship with his aunt changes everything.','/eZGgyIRRuvCD0WkUozPDw2io9ev.jpg','2010-10-20',104,'Released','Let\'s create something beautiful!','Knifer',132390,0.922,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27011,_binary '\0','/dxD5xMhXBrbtGU0KmkNjirHOle3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1371711',8.4,2308,'en','Charles Darwin and the Tree of Life','Darwin\'s great insight – that life has evolved over millions of years by natural selection – has been the cornerstone of all David Attenborough’s natural history series. In this documentary, he takes us on a deeply personal journey which reflects his own life and the way he came to understand Darwin’s theory.','/plmI9ryqGc8zn3l8c4cVXdgycgR.jpg','2009-02-01',60,'Released',NULL,'Charles Darwin and the Tree of Life',20784,1.6101,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27012,_binary '\0','/9l2jCHbCxaySvMMuETfprVi8WJv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13717596',6.3,2065,'ml','ഭീമൻ്റെ വഴി','Bheeman realizes the inconvenience caused by an old pathway when he had to take his mother to the hospital. His life takes an interesting turn when he decides to broaden the pathway.','/e1HCqkTmo7Wa8jRcBFhzv7RYlJr.jpg','2021-12-03',115,'Released',NULL,'Bheemante Vazhi',860776,1.1783,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27013,_binary '\0','/ux6gkGSKNFtp2NFYxwYFxVWdnGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13717980',5.5,5276,'tr','Kin','Ahead of a promotion, a police chief becomes entangled in a deadly incident and uncovers an intrigue fueled by grudge that threatens his colleagues.','/6fhqb5JegWJGMuomR3Jqmo0Skqn.jpg','2021-10-08',104,'Released',NULL,'Grudge',874948,2.7686,6.061,'LM2sdqqk5Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27014,_binary '\0','/iryef4LKiPQkvhNJS1EtLlay3br.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13721828',6.3,9945,'ko','마녀 2','A girl wakes up in a huge secret laboratory, then accidentally meets another girl who is trying to protect her house from a gang. The mystery girl overthrows the gang with her unexpected powers, and laboratory staff set out to find her.','/9YTuscJXmr9Iua62amCgGSU8PDW.jpg','2022-06-15',137,'Released','The beginning of everything.','The Witch: Part 2. The Other One',615173,12.1941,7.431,'EgOiCWTR_JU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27015,_binary '\0','/a7pGifLdzNvkzFxSyrvte3PQoZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13722764',6.6,2302,'en','Downfalls High','When reserved and lonely teenager Fenix meets popular high school girl Scarlett, the two form a bond that shapes the rest of his life.','/sm9SqRIKHgIvj4YZn84ybvlfco1.jpg','2021-01-15',50,'Released','A first of its kind musical experience.','Downfalls High',750459,2.371,6.1,'gBfoWP5SCuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27016,_binary '\0','/8j5STUd71N5ZnRfCBSmxFOcPbK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1372301',7.3,3609,'sr','Technotise - Edit i ja','Belgrade, 2074. Edit Stefanović, a psychology student, after failing the same university exam for the sixth time, decides to visit a dealer on the black market who installs a stolen military chip in her body that will record everything she sees to help her pass the exam. Edit also has a job at a scientific and social research company, in taking care of Abel Mustafov, an autistic math genius who discovered a formula that connects all forces in the world, but no computer was able to calculate it fully without becoming self-aware and shutting down immediately after that. After Edit sees the formula graph, the chip calculates the formula, and becomes able to \"survive\" thanks to its connection to Edit. It develops a parallel personality and affords her abilities greater than she ever imagined.','/wSGbVkWZEl3556M1bia8rk5jWnn.jpg','2009-04-08',90,'Released','Meet your new hero. She\'s about to blow your mind...','Technotise: Edit and I',38248,1.3783,6.9,'dBzeAOAbEaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27017,_binary '\0','/cGJUnIquDE7SZpCS7YDG29roLwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13723064',5.9,8377,'pl','Wszyscy moi przyjaciele nie żyją','A group of friends at a New Year’s Eve party go through a whirlwind of events that exposes secrets, breaks hearts — and leads to a shocking outcome.','/4GGF9oW3b8qqjvig3n8Qftl4P1Q.jpg','2020-12-28',95,'Released',NULL,'All My Friends Are Dead',780154,2.5452,5.847,'3YGw7N-6rFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27018,_binary '\0','/wJj4sG7R84Nhm88BtGM9BdMjvDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13723562',6.6,1634,'hi','420 IPC','CA Keswani is arrested for bank fraud and forgery. Keswani hires Birbal, a lawyer, to fight his case. But Birbal realises that there\'s more to it than what meets the eye.','/63JxHmYhVGENCtq5tFYLsnZKHGx.jpg','2021-12-17',99,'Released','Law is a sport. The better player wins.','420 IPC',911360,1.4162,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27019,_binary '\0','/jl4AOwQ6nxt8yXfVJvjHsKSaV7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1372686',6.1,35077,'en','Coriolanus','Caius Martius, aka Coriolanus, is an arrogant and fearsome general who has built a career on protecting Rome from its enemies. Pushed by his ambitious mother to seek the position of consul, Coriolanus is at odds with the masses and unpopular with certain colleagues. When a riot results in his expulsion from Rome, Coriolanus seeks out his sworn enemy, Tullus Aufidius. Together, the pair vow to destroy the great city.','/6W6In8IUJMkxB8aBipulho6QLDd.jpg','2011-02-14',123,'Released','Nature teaches beasts to know their friends.','Coriolanus',101173,3.2397,5.838,'bsYrGIQnmxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27020,_binary '\0','/sQZ3VkcKoFpuvY2hbu6mIKPwv5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1372747',4.9,1231,'ru','Юленька','A university professor, who wants to slow down a little, moves with his wife and daughter, from the big city to a small town and starts a new job as a teacher in a girls\' gymnasium. Something weird is happening with the class, they seem to hide a secret. As it turns out, these girls don\'t play with dolls...','/oGgoCkw7IC6bF7hhGu0oldbrmIW.jpg','2009-02-19',102,'Released',NULL,'Yulenka',44839,1.4542,5.7,'qUWpzUv9RKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27021,_binary '\0','/sOUbKrT7tY33nouezzYNCJJXIHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13729220',6.8,4508,'id','Penyalin Cahaya','When photos of her at a party cause her to lose a scholarship, a student investigates whether something devastating happened to her that night.','/wjNNm0eZKNZ40Fqlc9QewDxy0by.jpg','2021-10-08',130,'Released',NULL,'Photocopier',858815,2.0671,6.924,'VbsTA-inEkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27022,_binary '\0','/nieiBCavrAfGuAOvuWg1ZZSrR77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13729232',6.6,2374,'fr','L\'Origine du mal','In a luxurious seaside villa, a modest young woman finds herself in the company of a strange family: an unknown and wealthy father, his extravagant wife, his daughter, an ambitious woman, a rebellious teenager, and their creepy maid.','/4gZBTU8atWdtF5vC3WDlXx8qQ67.jpg','2022-10-05',123,'Released','Someone is lying.','The Origin of Evil',786977,2.8548,6.4,'-81pAPmPQUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27023,_binary '\0','/nMxucwkm4dAT7kfxV98dXqs6P0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1373120',7.5,5907,'ko','똥파리','Sang-hoon is a lowlife gangster, a debt collector exercising thuggish ways to collect his money. The recipient of nothing but anger since his childhood, he expresses himself through violence. When he finally encounters someone who can stand up to him, feisty school-girl Yoon-hee they become unlikely friends.','/9ZPPjSoPWN4BPea2h8sd6L7skSI.jpg','2009-04-16',130,'Released','The world is like shit and blood hurt so bad. but here is the man who touches your heart.','Breathless',31850,3.2596,7.2,'9zzcGQkuTs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27024,_binary '\0','/zI4OrjoqyTiqycoN00OugzJD4Iv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1373156',7.2,17017,'hi','Karthik Calling Karthik','A much abused loner achieves success, and even wins the heart of his gorgeous co-worker, after getting early morning mysterious phone calls from someone.','/sJotaiNW28dj439ghTuKxFJijP4.jpg','2010-02-26',135,'Released','a call will change everything.','Karthik Calling Karthik',34764,1.7333,6.4,'dIZ2OwW7HJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27025,_binary '\0','/uVQ18GO8IjzHwWZlsDeGRB1v71o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1373215',4.6,25306,'tr','Recep İvedik 2','When his grandmother takes ill, foolish brute Recep tries to satisfy her wishes by getting a job and attempting to find a suitable wife.','/wuokr2itBRbbaLT0bjTykC252KJ.jpg','2009-02-13',110,'Released','A folk hero','Recep Ivedik 2',31061,2.0026,4.637,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27026,_binary '\0','/aLh6cCfYOTm32sYrCcPoWdPvohR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13733780',5.9,1374,'en','Susie Searches','Susie is an awkward college student who seizes the opportunity to bolster her popularity and her under-the-radar true-crime podcast by attempting to solve the disappearance of a classmate.','/m0KTbnNonhPVAEBxM3y5HvITuwT.jpg','2023-07-28',105,'Released','Susie has a secret. Can she keep it?','Susie Searches',842948,1.9839,5.5,'lGR-REniT-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27027,_binary '\0','/80bEh4CSZLnPM51T6l6QysACiwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13737848',6.3,1283,'en','Mix Up in the Mediterranean','A small-town cook impersonates his big city chef twin to compete in a culinary contest and falls for the woman in charge of the event, who thinks he is the brother who is married.','/670nNzefrz80DAtKDxaDF1HbQu6.jpg','2021-02-20',84,'Released','Twin brothers. One competition. Endless complications.','Mix Up in the Mediterranean',784389,1.9205,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27028,_binary '\0','/7U0cE2wrZjVHTPyltetj6KukOPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13743656',4.4,2120,'en','Rub','Meet Neal. He\'s lonely, gets bullied at work, and is unlucky in love. At the suggestion of a co-worker he decides to go to a massage parlor and in the process his life changes in ways he never would have imagined.','/o5Q80lg854e72Il9LXpqWNQqV0V.jpg','2023-05-23',105,'Released','Not all endings are happy.','Rub',1148708,1.7373,4.5,'5oEAvAvhvOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27029,_binary '\0','/wq09HGlCcIX5kwBe2SvTPwhENZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1374985',6.6,1684,'cs','Alois Nebel','A train dispatcher encounters a mute stranger who appears out of nowhere, and finds himself mysteriously involved with a murder in Poland. The end of the eighties in the twentieth century. Alois Nebel works as a dis­patcher at the small railway station in Bílý Potok, a remote village on the Czech–Polish border. He\'s a loner, who prefers old timetables to people, and he finds the loneliness of the station tranquil – except when the fog rolls in. Then he hallucinates, sees trains from the last hundred years pass through the station. They bring ghosts and shadows from the dark past of Central Eu­rope. Alois can’t get rid of these nightmares and eventually ends up in sanatorium. In the sanatorium, he gets to know The Mute, a man carrying an old photograph who was arrested by the police after crossing the border. No one knows why he came to Bílý Potok or who he’s looking for, but it is his past that propels Alois on his journey…','/G2WxodRC1RrK411bWOt5Q7tYqq.jpg','2011-09-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Alois Nebel',86819,1.9347,7.2,'gha5l5qyD_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27030,_binary '\0','/ld9gXxcJoc1JF0SriRiHvIdK6yh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1374989',5.8,65084,'en','Pride and Prejudice and Zombies','A zombie outbreak has fallen upon the land in this reimagining of Jane Austen\'s classic tale of the tangled relationships between lovers from different social classes in 19th century England. Feisty heroine Elizabeth Bennet is a master of martial arts and weaponry and the handsome Mr. Darcy is a fierce zombie killer, yet the epitome of upper class prejudice. As the zombie outbreak intensifies, they must swallow their pride and join forces on the blood-soaked battlefield in order to conquer the undead once and for all.','/jsJlOhVHiz1xXr36616EI8tJ4b2.jpg','2016-02-04',108,'Released','Bloody lovely.','Pride and Prejudice and Zombies',58431,8.9208,6.169,'syjfmdvLu9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27031,_binary '\0','/rRQFRnBA1PCvCCgc3E1cHy37lvm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1374990',5.9,1777,'fr','The Prodigies','Five teenage prodigies brutally beaten in New York’s Central Park plot an apocalyptic revenge against the world. Only master prodigy Jimbo Farrar knows their formidable power. But can he alone hold their rage at bay?','/6Xbayov6CSIt3BvrnthNP6btNQs.jpg','2011-06-07',87,'Released',NULL,'The Prodigies',61901,1.2541,6,'bjr2Vkn5F84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27032,_binary '\0','/sKWh9hF0ekVhHHyGuJwdA3fnMGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1374992',6.3,76143,'en','Upside Down','In an alternate universe where twinned worlds have opposite gravities, a young man battles interplanetary prejudice and the laws of physics in his quest to reunite with the long-lost girl of his dreams in this visually stunning romantic adventure that poses the question: what if love was stronger than gravity?','/wImo0dC72HRoI5QO85dGavmxW6q.jpg','2012-09-27',104,'Released','Two worlds. One future.','Upside Down',58244,7.0122,6.28,'6HUx8n91huU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27033,_binary '\0','/lprsAHkwMxk2iC6VZxNmV0H7g1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13751694',6.2,118135,'hi','Animal','The hardened son of a powerful industrialist returns home after years abroad and vows to take bloody revenge on those threatening his father\'s life.','/hr9rjR3J0xBBKmlJ4n3gHId9ccx.jpg','2023-12-01',201,'Released','A father-son bond carved in blood.','Animal',781732,5.3099,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27034,_binary '\0','/8ZTVqvKDQ8emSGUEMjsS4yHAwrp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1375666',8.8,2868289,'en','Inception','Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: \"inception\", the implantation of another person\'s idea into a target\'s subconscious.','/xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg','2010-07-15',148,'Released','Your mind is the scene of the crime.','Inception',27205,57.4822,8.374,'JE9z-gy4De4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27035,_binary '\0','/vuZmuuc4bML37kLCyX95sgPRhD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1375669',6.5,3182,'sv','Simon och ekarna','Epic story about two families and their friendship and common destiny in Sweden\'s Gothenburg in the 1940s and 1950s. Told from the perspective of young Simon Larsson, who learns that he\'s an adopted child who has a Jewish father from Germany. After WWII Simon travels to explore his roots - a journey that leads to the basic mysteries of the human life. After the bestselling novel by Marianne Fredriksson.','/bBkvsfDMXntHITI2VzhRYxXPGJs.jpg','2011-12-09',122,'Released','Every family has a secret.','Simon & the Oaks',82448,1.8888,6.377,'80_L_LsOexE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27036,_binary '\0','/kARonxQpuSZdFraTKlCThWOBCtu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1375670',6,319195,'en','Grown Ups','After their high school basketball coach passes away, five good friends and former teammates reunite for a Fourth of July holiday weekend.','/cQGM5k1NtU85n4TUlrOrwijSCcm.jpg','2010-06-24',102,'Released','Boys will be boys. . . some longer than others.','Grown Ups',38365,28.799,6.438,'1m-NrYetgOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27037,_binary '\0','/6EZjh8GQr19NcZQ5N9DWMbNLvLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13757540',6.4,1461,'ja','夏への扉 ―キミのいる未来へ―','A pioneering roboticist awakens in 2025 after decades in cryosleep. To change the past and reunite with his adopted sister, he seeks a way back to 1995.','/n82h2wqgV5VjviHHWShBoOSBy.jpg','2021-06-25',118,'Released','An adventure spanning 30 years starts now.','The Door into Summer',722798,2.4294,6.425,'MuTZDzNsy-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27038,_binary '\0','/yi9FwtjLkY8MUObaiEThf3LJO9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1375789',5.4,18639,'hi','रेस 2','Ranvir Singh encounters the Indian mafia in Turkey as he carries out a mission to avenge his lover\'s death.','/tUe3rzMvVsbi63z3EKA8egjFBv8.jpg','2013-01-25',150,'Released','Betrayal is survival.','Race 2',44749,2.6018,5.454,'9CwQ9PClSWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27039,_binary '\0','/7P8ffqqg5DwJf19jH0ilLdnfTya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13758250',3.4,1434,'ml','സ്റ്റാർ','When Ardra suddenly starts acting distant and cold with her family members, her husband Roy and others around her are puzzled and scared. Nobody in the family bothers to take her to a doctor and when they finally do, they learn the truth.','/hlVn1K8fdCLOux8nxwQa0yI2mTg.jpg','2021-10-29',120,'Released','Burst of myths','Star',814030,0.7747,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27040,_binary '\0','/yfUTW2pYUGU3vK682TZmV95Q6vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13758684',6.8,1220,'ja','漁港の肉子ちゃん','Brash single mother Nikuko is well-known for her bold spirit, much to the embarrassment of Kikuko, her pensive yet imaginative daughter. In contrast to her mother, Kikuko wants nothing more than to fit in as she navigates the everyday social dramas of middle school. Life in the harbor is peaceful until a shocking revelation from the past threatens to uproot the pair\'s tender relationship.','/ceine994qh3wc5KpQoEp3LAGHOS.jpg','2021-06-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Fortune Favors Lady Nikuko',781816,3.1963,7,'OqeN_j_She8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27041,_binary '\0','/w0OT65o1soARwceOyXfU2omZokJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13758760',7.1,3830,'ar','وقفة رجالة','A comedy about a group of friends as they get reunited to help one of their own find his way out of major trouble. As the situation gets more complicated, they are forced to take a trip to a coastal town.','/9gpAHWaPR6soH7Y3YtSNaKjEIAm.jpg','2021-01-13',112,'Released',NULL,'A Stand Worthy of Men',785861,1.2985,6.769,'D7WJDm64T3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27042,_binary '\0','/1BbH0YCNOub05ZNw1m8B5hQmO5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13760814',6.8,1621,'te','Point Blank','Point Blank','/gJLUfB8KZR8CbMNnOtMQayQKvvy.jpg','2021-10-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Point Blank',785582,0.4568,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27043,_binary '\0','/e8zHTUwi3as9ItvdtxhgNyaXklv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13761148',7.3,1887,'tr','Kesişme: İyi ki Varsın Eren','A true intersection story of a teenage boy lives in Black Sea hills whose life is full of struggle, a heroic soldier Ferhat and an uninvited visitor from back of beyond.','/7mNq8uQmbTvDMnVrhTz3pKMShU9.jpg','2022-01-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Intersection: Glad to Have You Eren',782482,1.493,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27044,_binary '\0','/4fwiqPtT0v7U3kQphhIcAo8L7Xc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13761284',4.3,1942,'te','శాకుంతలం','Shakuntala, daughter of Meneka and Rishi Vishwamitra lives in forest with her teacher, Rishi Kanva. In the forest she meets King Dushyant, falls in love with him and the two get married. After she has their baby (Prince Bharata), Dushyant leaves her in the forest with a promise to come back for her soon. However, due to a sage\'s curse, Dushyant forgets all about Shakuntala, until destiny brings them together again.','/6YKaTWjZckGH5lb3cRFHWWIjVk2.jpg','2023-04-14',149,'Released','Shaakuntalam','Shaakuntalam',913046,1.4964,4.1,'sEKOV6z305s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27045,_binary '\0','/1vmnZTqVmuUF55yb2Nd8T2pZmOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376168',4.6,1739,'en','Comedown','Six friends, who\'ve known each other from childhood, break into the tower block they lived in as kids, now deserted and condemned, to rig-up a pirate radio station, get high and party. When one of the group goes missing, her friends begin to search the dark interior of the tower and soon realize that they are not alone: a resident psychopath lurks in the shadows and is hunting them down, taking them out, one-by-one.','/zYAjYMFq41Cqg6vGoKWHJoZMuiw.jpg','2012-08-23',90,'Released','It\'s Fun Getting High... But The Comedown Is A Killer.','Comedown',121597,1.2083,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27046,_binary '\0','/od2WMBk2DftLXa9AtLWEOF2DhQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376195',6.4,4539,'en','Gunless','American gunslinger Sean Rafferty—aka The Montana Kid—is unable to find someone to duel in a Canadian town where no one understands the brutal code of the American Wild West.','/8Y4pBlpDZzzDYCJlsrhgwmFNYM8.jpg','2010-04-19',89,'Released','Fastest draw in the North... kinda.','Gunless',43090,2.6453,6.4,'DeYzK3F_iIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27047,_binary '\0','/fWmm5X31wPqt5fC5fxf1W17DvAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376213',5.5,7627,'en','The Adventurer: The Curse of the Midas Box','Seventeen-year-old Mariah Mundi\'s life is turned upside down when his parents vanish and his younger brother is kidnapped. Following a trail of clues to the darkly majestic Prince Regent Hotel, Mariah discovers a hidden realm of child-stealing monsters, deadly secrets and a long-lost artefact that grants limitless wealth—but also devastating supernatural power. With the fate of his world, and his family at stake, Mariah will risk everything to unravel the Curse of the Midas Box.','/31ykUoOS2RNdARk3B8z3y25gD8b.jpg','2013-12-05',99,'Released','The new name for adventure.','The Adventurer: The Curse of the Midas Box',227707,4.2028,5.7,'oW8pxkUpXIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27048,_binary '\0','/sarGZnE5MzXwLrcyacsc8900TRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376699',5.3,2426,'en','Den Brother','Alex Pearson has a lot to learn about teamwork. As the star of the Lemon Oaks hockey team, Alex almost always has his way on and off the ice. That is until he pulls a stunt so outrageous not even his own coach can give him a pass. His punishment? Suspension from the team, a never-ending list of chores and a job watching his little sister Emily after school.','/5oWZJChuObK0STDK3FiPNgxzFfr.jpg','2010-08-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Den Brother',46064,3.0239,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27049,_binary '\0','/aZLiQIQZ9EqXQGTMIfxbFI9u4qs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376709',6,2153,'en','I Love You Too','Written by comedian Peter Helliar, I LOVE YOU TOO stars Brendan Cowell as Jim, a 30-something emotionally stunted man whose inability to declare his love to his girlfriend, Alice, threatens to cost him the best thing he ever had but leads him to befriend a talented dwarf who helps him find the words to get her back.','/yhtLSMANn5GZqnzHjYYBkn8dEs9.jpg','2010-05-06',107,'Released',NULL,'I Love You Too',46660,2.459,5.6,'Bix9NDyF35U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27050,_binary '\0','/9siWvMpWYaJoFDSoVal0Q4EJv1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1376717',7.1,7096,'sv','Play','In central Gothenburg, Sweden, a group of boys, aged 12-14, robbed other children on about 40 occasions between 2006 and 2008. The thieves used an elaborate scheme called the \'little brother number\' or \'brother trick\', involving advanced role-play and gang rhetoric rather than physical violence.','/bJWi0taJmU9WyPdIUVhShxISCFA.jpg','2011-11-11',118,'Released','Just a game?','Play',85743,1.5539,6.8,'fz1UaRUgVjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27051,_binary '\0','/wvW0wYcjL1G2hcwWQb4TR0QEnst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1377278',7.4,1509,'en','⁧הַשְׁמָצָה⁩','Intent on shaking up the ultimate \'sacred cow\' for Jews, Israeli director Yoav Shamir embarks on a provocative - and at times irreverent - quest to answer the question, \"What is anti-Semitism today?\"','/5oLuAaqcy6kgyv3IE9RPp5iMP6a.jpg','2009-05-01',91,'Released','Anti-Semitism: The Movie','Defamation',56895,0.8607,7,'pJo7LhSPJaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27052,_binary '\0','/i3x9qtpW87R85d9xkaH2CUCzSX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13773882',4.9,1998,'hi','मैडम चीफ मिनिस्टर','A political-drama where a young woman from a small village rises to power into the world of politics by breaking barriers of caste and patriarchy and overcomes the obstacles placed by her opponents to become the chief minister and work for the upliftment of backward classes.','/jk8KZ4SqFR9Uz48m1KAEzc41vlX.jpg','2021-01-22',123,'Released','Untouchable, unstoppable.','Madam Chief Minister',782848,0.828,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27053,_binary '\0','/oIxLAeuMiIST6OQfnoAftIVtf4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13774454',6.3,4932,'fr','Super-héros malgré lui','A struggling actor seems doomed to live life as a loser. When he finally snatches a lead role as a superhero named “Badman,” he feels like everything is possible, but fate strikes again.','/Aie2kiYOUgZeakpshM2N64PKof1.jpg','2022-02-02',82,'Released','He Saves the World... by Accident','Superwho?',746333,5.0391,6.329,'i0YxNp-Moc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27054,_binary '\0','/uBVE7KJ7ivEmYil3R32fB4PGVPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13775584',6.9,2265,'en','As Luck Would Have It','When Lindsey travels to Ireland to acquire land that is perfect for a resort, she decides to enter the town\'s matchmaking festival to prove her investment—and win over a handsome local.','/50dVUPdEI1qWhiTnIWN3NIZqftn.jpg','2021-04-10',84,'Released','It takes more than luck of the Irish to fall in love.','As Luck Would Have It',795980,3.2986,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27055,_binary '\0','/84h6avqHvW2TgLfERuqYkQwzjp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13778486',4.7,2425,'en','Succubus','A new father going through a marital separation joins a dating app and matches with a beautiful but mysterious young woman... whose powers of seduction and manipulation entangle him in a mystery more horrifying than he could have ever imagined.','/7AfBMebJS8mEtSV5ymdxEPpgvXb.jpg','2024-10-06',103,'Released',NULL,'Succubus',1130276,6.7303,8.38,'kzZP33WEPZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27056,_binary '\0','/9nysqCWd0XpkadYMxxLsTVe07Ni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13781128',7.3,4951,'ml','പാച്ചുവും അത്ഭുതവിളക്കും','In return for getting ownership 