6 15:21:07.000000'),(27066,_binary '\0','/mwIMH6LN8BZK7oi7TFlt0YaW0Lz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1379228',7.7,2488,'ta','நான் கடவுள்','This surreal Tamil entry tells the story of Rudran, who is abandoned as a child in Kasi and grows up to be a mystic who indulges in strange rituals and believes that he has power over life, death and rebirth.','/he18aYmVT6gLGgbV6QDhcy55Lc2.jpg','2009-02-06',150,'Released','Aham Brahmasmi','Naan Kadavul',69499,1.3166,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27067,_binary '\0','/psT4PAYJl2uQgdq8HLSmH9JOTPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13793230',6.8,12369,'hi','जादूगर','A small-time magician with zero interest in football must lead his local team to the finals of a tournament if he wishes to marry the love of his life.','/wEfhAPR6VNzrt1tkTuzCamRMB3.jpg','2022-07-15',167,'Released',NULL,'Jaadugar',821119,2.97,6.539,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27068,_binary '\0','/4Pc60AP16Rcoai28DiLC7794KmT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13793498',7.2,1305,'bn','Nabab LLB','A girl named Shuvra becomes a victim of raping and fights for justice. A so called lawyer named Nabab comes to help her and give her justice.','/wYEHEOR1dZ1rFmBaS3yokXGs66f.jpg','2020-12-16',195,'Released','Back For Justice','Nabab LLB',901253,1.5849,5,'6nQ-4MtqeRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27069,_binary '\0','/vA5tZeY30S8GPsRz5CeS4VPNYWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13795296',5.6,13163,'hi','थैंक गॉड','An egoistic real estate broker in huge debts, meets with an accident. As he gains consciousness, he realizes that he is in heaven. God appears before him and informs him that he must play a \'Game of Life\'. If he manages to win, he will be sent back to earth; if he loses, he will be sent to hell.','/dxKtwP2Q4n3jfqMIqxoShX08UkH.jpg','2022-10-25',121,'Released','The Game of Life','Thank God',783723,1.6187,6.3,'4iOm5QBHTis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27070,_binary '\0','/35yyHzlMK