ether, but not only good times','/mlAQCSqGR7Xrqeu5zwlWGNvqYWm.jpg','2010-08-13',112,'Released',NULL,'Run Sister Run!',51190,1.1226,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27074,_binary '\0','/iKFpeM9xS5N0Yj5EGPqM6QFOnB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13802376',5.4,2298,'hi','द पावर','It is a hair-raising journey into the world of two lovers as both their families are ripped apart for the sake of revenge and power, and an entertaining look at how they rise out of that pit of blood lust and despair, together.','/fkzTQZHgURaPSjEhCxgUJGmAvjN.jpg','2021-01-14',154,'Released',NULL,'The Power',784167,1.0554,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27075,_binary '\0','/8LHSDyRizQ4kQz5rEHPKyXPvMG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13804084',6.4,10590,'en','Justice Society: World War II','When the Flash finds himself dropped into the middle of World War II, he joins forces with Wonder Woman and her top-secret team known as the Justice Society of America.','/tOUJvmdjppmPYZOoykWmerSspMT.jpg','2021-04-27',84,'Released','The fight for justice is the greatest battle of all time.','Justice Society: World War II',736069,4.8402,7.4,'s4xXbGFhEFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27076,_binary '\0','/YN9QF1ktsd0Wjia3Hn2ylXMuWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13806164',6.2,2519,'it','Siccità','In Rome it hasn’t rained for three years and the lack of water is overturning rules and habits. Through the city dying of thirst and prohibitions moves a chorus of people, young and old, marginalised and successful, victims and profiteers. Their lives are linked in a single design, while each seeks his or her deliverance.','/2pl2qRaUvJ9iKiNROyKi5a9l31E.jpg','2022-09-29',124,'Released',NULL,'Dry',797840,1.6555,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27077,_binary '\0','/bwMftdmUde6ydi8lKLuhWl27xep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1380799',7,1445,'cs','Habermannův mlýn','A story set in a small village in Sudetenland between 1937 and 1945. \"Habermann\" is based on true events.','/3b1qy0VW4VkWLV2R3KtNl10qgAG.jpg','2010-10-07',104,'Released',NULL,'Habermann',48487,1.6858,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27078,_binary '\0','/bG1FUzeF5GxtAuHLwzoqOO848Rl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381404',6.4,37670,'en','The Company You Keep','A former Weather Underground activist goes on the run from a journalist who discovers his identity.','/AvAyJbl7d0Gm0GRJlPPW8n4XrdT.jpg','2012-12-20',121,'Released','The greatest manhunt in history.','The Company You Keep',87496,6.1867,6.17,'FZ4CTyDwoPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27079,_binary '\0','/dfW3wDt56MkAUycMFqB8BuyfkHn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381413',5.1,1535,'en','Pete Smalls Is Dead','Two old pals attend an old friends funeral and find there is more to his death than him being dead.','/b9w3GcW84IKMYEeK2dfwNhKs9La.jpg','2010-09-17',95,'Released','In Hollywood, DEAD is the next big thing.','Pete Smalls Is Dead',72843,1.8886,4.6,'roz8qZdCmnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27080,_binary '\0','/cJUZ0IFOydTkRRmbfNnADmrdgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381418',5.4,8242,'en','You May Not Kiss the Bride','Bryan, an unassuming pet photographer has action and adventure thrust upon him when he is forced to wed Masha, a Croatian crime lord\'s daughter, and she is subsequently kidnapped while on their honeymoon in a tropical paradise.','/hTmZjfNuGUko6N8zTSN1rsVBFsV.jpg','2011-04-03',97,'Released','Till honeymoon do us part','You May Not Kiss the Bride',73500,3.3102,5.645,'PCmDKIiomC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27081,_binary '\0','/yJ1ZS0RuPFDpR3U4KwJIA1SZVoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381505',5.7,9371,'en','Father of Invention','Nearly a decade after a faulty product landed him in prison, an arrogant inventor is determined to restore his reputation and rebuild his fortune. But first, he has to convince his estranged daughter that he\'s worthy of a second chance.','/7ZPJQpl6dRgTYQ1krbSBptZQjMI.jpg','2010-02-14',93,'Released','Sometimes the best ideas are homegrown.','Father of Invention',35221,3.1088,5.4,'znE5tTpHTM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27082,_binary '\0','/k3t6zy7Oz0b8IFWD7qMMRfigKkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381508',4.1,1251,'en','Jack Falls','Former undercover police officer Jack Adleth returns to London seeking those who tried to have him killed in Amsterdam.','/aSdfaCqJlH2iZtt1st8NXYDeYos.jpg','2011-03-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Jack Falls',59951,1.2482,4.7,'sMr5K5WqaUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27083,_binary '\0','/uXiQPTZQbagTgHJUdJSNgxKPxeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1381512',5.3,2822,'ja','ロボゲイシャ','Sisters Yoshie and Kikue are two Geisha who are abducted by a mysterious organization to be transformed into murderous cyborg assassins.','/7fN1ZDG7sumIgndF8KfzEAvzkL8.jpg','2009-10-03',102,'Released',NULL,'RoboGeisha',39260,2.2204,5.388,'ZrbYRfDu3is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27084,_binary '\0','/vcc6NDwsMwNrwHgVuI9lGdWJLB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13818368',6.1,54618,'hi','फाइटर','As India faces a militant attack in Kashmir, the country’s best combat aviators join forces under a reckless yet brilliant squadron leader to form \'Air Dragons\', faces mortal dangers and their inner demons.','/zqFuriKJ6pYDvf72kXNLONnuE8k.jpg','2024-01-24',166,'Released',NULL,'Fighter',784651,4.2735,6.2,'lAVYll_wBeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27085,_binary '\0','/1kuz2NzNAPHSTUkwcy5Zvn1xbye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13821562',7.3,4726,'no','Ninjababy','When Rakel finds out she\'s six months pregnant after a one-night stand, her world changes. She is absolutely not ready to be a mother, but since abortion is no longer an option, adoption is the only answer. That\'s when Ninjababy, an animated character who makes Rakel\'s life a living hell, turns up.','/2KVHtTIWFmUqzT6HtPGLOMPQQen.jpg','2021-02-21',104,'Released','It\'s not love, it\'s semen.','Ninjababy',654074,1.4293,7.1,'aM06XKfPJeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27086,_binary '\0','/wtbRUVxQVvU6QIJH1oGLDThJLib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13822738',5.8,9795,'fr','Loin du périph','Ousmane Diakité and François Monge are two cops with very different styles, backgrounds and careers. The unlikely pair are reunited once again for a new investigation that takes them across France. What seemed to be a simple drug deal turns out to be a much bigger criminal case wrapped in danger and unexpected comedy.','/eGIxXsf3DXYejb0C62bfJVSPSM8.jpg','2022-05-06',119,'Released','Two cops. One case. No clue.','The Takedown',785985,3.8424,6.065,'iReeddMo_ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27087,_binary '\0','/ojiFyABgYbXVuuYQn0i3QRR37Vd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1382339',7.6,2493,'ta','சந்தோஷ் சுப்ரமணியம்','Santosh\'s life is dictated by his father, who decides everything for him. However, when Santosh falls in love with a girl, he struggles to convince his father to let him marry his girlfriend. Remake of Bommarillu (2006) Telugu film.','/op0ojhYFdF78oEJSVVe0exjJQvX.jpg','2008-04-11',177,'Released',NULL,'Santosh Subramaniam',63813,1.1473,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27088,_binary '\0','/gAaitR8Sm6Y227XdBUWu3sD2yRV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13825336',5.5,6118,'hi','गुड लक जैरी','In dire need of money, Jerry gets drawn into the dangerous world of drug trafficking. Things go awry when she decides to quit.','/abcG0hQJVwCdloTTTwrY0jfJ1Em.jpg','2022-07-29',118,'Released',NULL,'Good Luck Jerry',784940,1.4066,5.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27089,_binary '\0','/oPMLLBTkuuaXslNDGXbIOEeOixy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1382695',5.9,2178,'tr','Kirpi','Kirpi, the vengeful practical joker finally finds a match for his habit: Tahir Yaman. Prank and revenge loop of the duo will drag them to very complicated situations.','/aAZtiO7EQm8bkhR4nqHaVS0jxQy.jpg','2009-01-30',100,'Released','This is a revenge story','Kirpi',21190,1.6248,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27090,_binary '\0','/b1yxcZAjoU9ArgxWDjVrVgpupv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1382725',7.1,10020,'fr','La Rafle','A faithful retelling of the 1942 \"Vel\' d\'Hiv Roundup\" and the events surrounding it.','/9osPoGTddZZfMUzFDs82n57y2wQ.jpg','2010-03-10',115,'Released','An incredible real story of courage and survival.','The Round Up',41411,4.2872,7.5,'I-2-vRmUatY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27091,_binary '\0','/bq5U9148k5yZXmO0yfa5vfNJl2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13827606',7.2,1588,'es','La Civil','Cielo is a mother whose teenage daughter is kidnapped in Northern Mexico. When the authorities offer no support in the search, Cielo takes matters into her own hands and transforms from housewife into a vengeful militant.','/mP9EMrwJRxj7O4P4v2xsNyWWA1f.jpg','2021-07-08',140,'Released','Never underestimate a mother\'s wrath.','La Civil',833393,4.8285,7.83,'QMWv6Ve7McY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27092,_binary '\0','/4IJemTO3UP7vuYjqhhfVLQ9yl3w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13829262',5,5194,'de','Rubikon','The company soldier Hannah and the scientists Gavin and Dimitri are researching an algae project on board the Rubikon space station, which is supposed to permanently supply humanity with oxygen and food. But suddenly the earth disappears below them in a brown, toxic fog and all contact is broken off - are they the last survivors of humanity? Should they initiate the safe station, dare the return flight and thereby risk their lives?','/n5Ynx568yHn1hKG2ND7ctoL9jEl.jpg','2022-07-01',110,'Released','Take a deep breath. It is your last.','Rubikon',793961,2.3705,5.336,'S4rB8KsnbAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27093,_binary '\0','/kOy5RhoaAJt64L5naI4Oxfpbib0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13830148',6.7,1270,'it','Re Granchio','Small town in Italy, end of the 19th century. Luciano, a drunk, doesn\'t fit in the town. Rebelion against authority and a forbidden love makes him to commit a crime accidentally. To pay for his crime, he is forced into exile on the most remote island in the world, Argentina’s Tierra del Fuego. The hunt for the shipwreck treasure hidden on the island becomes his opportunity for redemption.','/92TK8iqJCRe6kLAF7zmRVXyQ5JI.jpg','2021-12-02',106,'Released',NULL,'The Tale of King Crab',833408,1.4036,7.1,'A060_b-pO-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27094,_binary '\0','/xfqo6NGsNk0A9Pvwu8orBLPC95O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13831504',7.1,2950,'en','It Was Always You','Elizabeth\'s engagement plans are thrown into disarray when her fiancée\'s free-spirited brother David returns home. David\'s unexpected influence prompts Elizabeth to question her life decisions.','/y3EoplS3g78FuFz8qzOptGinM3Y.jpg','2021-02-27',84,'Released',NULL,'It Was Always You',784391,2.3986,7.3,'9U-3FGXQsXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27095,_binary '\0','/46FRuCeAn6TrS4F1P4F9zhyCpyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13833688',7.6,310366,'en','The Whale','A reclusive English teacher suffering from severe obesity attempts to reconnect with his estranged teenage daughter for one last chance at redemption.','/jQ0gylJMxWSL490sy0RrPj1Lj7e.jpg','2022-12-09',117,'Released',NULL,'The Whale',785084,18.0324,7.754,'D30r0CwtIKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27096,_binary '\0','/zpqAzcQSbFaCscSjSpz2Fv8qSXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13834006',6.3,8563,'fr','8 Rue de l\'Humanité','Seven families live in the Parisian apartment building at 8, Rue de l’Humanite - and they didn’t escape to the countryside at the arrival of the coronavirus. Three months of life under lockdown will reveal the best and worst of these neighbours.','/bvK9AMUvh0TzjSmWwv74CgBEfg2.jpg','2021-10-20',126,'Released',NULL,'Stuck Together',785516,2.9882,5.912,'H5psDW5PG4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27097,_binary '\0','/x78cvxbmpBNcHON7x3Iv8vih5Sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13834480',5.1,5305,'en','Diary of a Wimpy Kid','Greg Heffley is a scrawny but ambitious kid with an active imagination and big plans to be rich and famous – he just has to survive middle school first.','/obg6lWuNaZkoSlwrVG4VVk4SmT.jpg','2021-12-02',58,'Released','New school. Old cheese.','Diary of a Wimpy Kid',774741,8.9201,6.238,'a_DhEoPJHes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27098,_binary '\0','/piHeZRpfTTwvJvWCmAhKX1rcdNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13834788',7.3,1776,'id','Yuni','In her last year of secondary school, a bright Indonesian student is determined to pursue her education and resist getting married, despite the expectations of her community.','/2NY6jrjneH6qgGCVPdcqcH9NpyN.jpg','2021-12-09',95,'Released','She dreams of the stars, but society wants her to tie the knot','Yuni',796158,1.3595,6.8,'G75HH3lscxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27099,_binary '\0','/yZAbie7fets0MWNPJwzEdlYUjtq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13835046',2.9,1477,'en','Aquarium of the Dead','A scientific mishap causes the species of an aquarium to become zombies.','/z12KUOHYDjNTBwb4BY5MQaIQkU0.jpg','2021-05-21',86,'Released','We\'ve fallen to the bottom of the food chain','Aquarium of the Dead',809929,3.1969,5.1,'c1tfzg7Iabc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27100,_binary '\0','/suLh9o4AZmp0oVpSYuwBftUByww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1383607',6.5,2653,'ar','رمضان مبروك أبو العلمين حمودة','Professor Ramadan is a feared and well respected teacher in a village, forced to take a job in the city teaching at a private school. He soon realizes that most of his students are infatuated with a famous singer whom he tries to ban all mention of within the school, only to fall in love with her himself.','/9JQEbyxjB9r35Wh3tPnyfZFJSOD.jpg','2008-12-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Ramadan Mabrouk Abou El Allamen Hamouda',60204,1.1782,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27101,_binary '\0','/23Pru6TuD4QcitNfXbRI8T7ZRpU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13840536',8.2,1654,'en','It Ain\'t Over','The life and times of New York Yankee catcher Yogi Berra, a 10 time World Series champion whose unique personality and unforgettable Yogi-isms sometimes got in the way of his being recognized as one of baseball’s greatest players.','/fr2ALrikCc1OkdpWw3XZj7LNlJ7.jpg','2023-05-12',98,'Released','When it comes to Yogi, you don\'t know nothin\'.','It Ain\'t Over',965397,1.5509,7.1,'XGvXOjD6zQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27102,_binary '\0','/4N2FuCTuqH3h4dw9XPFtsnDPSz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13841850',6,80657,'en','Men','In the aftermath of a personal tragedy, Harper retreats alone to the beautiful English countryside, hoping to find a place to heal. But someone — or something — from the surrounding woods appears to be stalking her, and what begins as simmering dread becomes a fully-formed nightmare, inhabited by her darkest memories and fears.','/jo1Kv3P3UgDVk7JnUFr2Cl8WWUM.jpg','2022-05-20',100,'Released','What haunts you will find you.','Men',780609,8.4112,6.1,'HKJ4Thgk1Js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27103,_binary '\0','/9pOV61KfWLXs264IrdRu0DGCZfC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13841874',6.5,1341,'es','Espíritu sagrado','José Manuel and the other members of the ufology association Ovni-Levante meet weekly to exchange information about extraterrestrial messages and abductions. Julio, their leader, dies unexpectedly, leaving José Manuel as the only person who knows about the cosmic secret that could alter the human future.','/eJa3nYAaL9hzTG94jXNLUXKJgJH.jpg','2021-11-16',97,'Released',NULL,'The Sacred Spirit',846779,1.2489,6.5,'a84RBPwymWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27104,_binary '\0','/scWLG4K7ogWbOpHMhE6dwedeUh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13842562',7,6312,'pt','Pelé','Against the backdrop of a turbulent era in Brazil, this documentary captures Pelé\'s extraordinary path from breakthrough talent to national hero. Mixing rare archival footage and exclusive interviews, this documentary celebrates the legendary Brazilian footballer who personified football as art.','/tX2gco2U4MlKEWwM4UkiIf1C74e.jpg','2021-02-23',108,'Released',NULL,'Pelé',785976,3.0357,7.3,'KMyUnyxVB9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27105,_binary '\0','/A6ay0usZcUk7Eooc2uJH8x7tq6p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13845438',6.1,5947,'ta','நானே வருவேன்','A father finds out that his teenager daughter is possessed, and the only way he can save her is by doing the ghost\'s bidding, which will mean an encounter with his long-separated twin - who happens to be a psycho killer.','/pfiAftin05Rw8XhIdxG9wkAwJIU.jpg','2022-09-29',122,'Released','Duo: An epic journey','Naane Varuvean',785664,1.3535,5.796,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27106,_binary '\0','/tlaVzavuphwLHEgHCxzc1Fn3Z5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13845652',7.5,3115,'da','Rose','Over the course of a week, sisters Inger and Ellen find their relationship challenged on a highly anticipated coach trip to Paris. Inger reveals her struggles with schizophrenia to the group, receiving both pity and discrimination. On arrival, it soon becomes clear that Inger has a hidden agenda concerning a figure from her past, ultimately involving the entire group in her hunt for answers.','/ewzE98Ajsk92rZQIxAOUHFLIJku.jpg','2022-02-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Rose',901251,1.6571,7.7,'QGC6Kgchxbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27107,_binary '\0','/5GEgpoQPNgxi8fvMNALTwskf3cM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13845660',7.3,3140,'is','Berdreymi','A teenage boy, raised by a mother who considers herself psychic, takes a bullied kid into his group of violent misfits. As the group’s troubles escalate toward life-threatening situations, an inner voice awakens in the boy and, with the help of his mother and his new friend, he manages to find his own path.','/oOqZz9rXGcNhuDBpjfLWxOO2T5W.jpg','2022-04-22',123,'Released','Friends. Family. Sacrifice.','Beautiful Beings',879901,3.4055,6.986,'A8MjQ9uVk4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27108,_binary '\0','/mQhdLGa5CFxhIrBUglmQE3F6spr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13845664',7.7,1514,'bn','জানোয়ার','Based on a true story- A group of robbers broke into a house at night with the intention of committing robbery. The house was inhabited by two young girls and a disabled child and their mother. Not getting the desired money, the robbers started torturing them. And they were raped them more than once and after the rape everyone was killed by cutting their throats.','/oArB3BeMKMuL6vHYFLMKzBwIzBK.jpg','2021-01-14',77,'Released',NULL,'Janowar',786029,1.3463,8,'dNyMDfSMdWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27109,_binary '\0','/4F33fcmDrtwFhCwaE4qbgloRcq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13846402',6.9,3731,'fr','Les Passagers de la nuit','On election night in 1981, celebrations spill out onto the street and there is an air of hope and change throughout Paris. But for Elisabeth, her marriage is coming to an end and she will now have to support herself and her two teenage children. She finds work at a late-night radio show and encounters a troubled teenager named Talulah whom she invites into her home.','/t5UGtAsH24q3t9GQpj0A7t9HXY9.jpg','2022-05-04',111,'Released',NULL,'The Passengers of the Night',895659,3.7798,6.9,'Wa8QSTuTug8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27110,_binary '\0','/kQTPNUtXSowT14cY0FnV3CaBDli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13846414',7.1,2747,'de','Fabian oder der Gang vor die Hunde','In 1930s Berlin, Dr. Jakob Fabian, who works by day in advertising for a cigarette company and by night wanders the streets of the city, falls in love with an actress. As her career begins to blossom, prospects for his future begin to wane.','/kfrHq2hg24ZMpesf8xfXUt3wAKb.jpg','2021-08-05',176,'Released',NULL,'Fabian: Going to the Dogs',620498,3.0981,6.5,'Qkf3mBKP8lM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27111,_binary '\0','/wHJzsRb5POQUBGeYUN64LJ2ZcZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13846472',6.4,1264,'fr','Les Promesses','Clémence, the fearless mayor of a town near Paris, is completing the final term of her political career. With her faithful right-hand man Yazid, she has long fought for this town plagued by inequality, unemployment and slumlords. However, when Clémence is approached to become Minister, her ambition arises, questioning her devotion and commitment to her citizens. Will her political integrity and election promises survive her newly found ambition?','/kO9muUDMi40FpnrqRvkMqCwc5Ac.jpg','2022-01-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Promises',786918,2.2335,6.3,'U8t43Ox3jN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27112,_binary '\0','/82cTBG4ly5fltYI7aA0YMzLMbjy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13846542',5.2,4134,'pl','Miłość do kwadratu','A celebrity journalist and renowned womanizer starts to rethink his life choices after he falls for a mysterious model who leads a double life.','/qeRCXsOitUdtDXc5sSVgwYGTZyg.jpg','2021-02-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Squared Love',787298,2.6148,6.064,'zF9YIYc0d7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27113,_binary '\0','/89AXcAOeR3I0QH9wMFkxAQyBaid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13846546',6.8,1530,'fr','Lingui : les liens sacrés','On the outskirts of the capital of Chad, determined single mother Amina works tirelessly to provide for herself and her 15-year old daughter Maria. When Amina discovers Maria is pregnant and does not want a child, the two women begin to seek out an abortion, condemned by both religion and law. In the process, mother and daughter forge a connection stronger than any they’ve ever known.','/5Cg39mHfs9u8UiqZJZy5uYANWgG.jpg','2021-12-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Lingui, the Sacred Bonds',820693,2.0438,6.6,'2DFew16WifY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27114,_binary '\0','/qJlbMCpBZTvS5QZ7z2bFCYyRjSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13848804',6.5,4004,'en','Journey to Bethlehem','A young woman carrying an unimaginable responsibility. A young man torn between love and honor. A jealous king who will stop at nothing to keep his crown.','/cJgF1vjiNoRAh5UePmiPfjrw6Iv.jpg','2023-11-09',99,'Released','The greatest story ever comes alive!','Journey to Bethlehem',1092329,3.5887,7.7,'97fogYVPT-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27115,_binary '\0','/p6mTSihi3IfROqqkaKEwslNqg3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13848958',5.5,1554,'ta','வசந்த முல்லை','Rudhra, who works tirelessly for a successful career and money, and suffering from blackout disorders, goes on a romantic journey to a hill station with his girlfriend Nita, trying to spend some quality time . On the way, he stays at the Vasantha Mullai Motel. The events that unfold in a single night drive Rudhra insane and take him on a roller coaster ride.','/85qkXShLwTYZHYFOzaA6MbWqnjG.jpg','2023-02-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Vasantha Mullai',1084871,0.7843,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27116,_binary '\0','/n6xGWFhNFiGySxcraV69MWPY9uI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1384927',7,3841,'en','Death of a Superhero','A dying 15-year-old boy draws stories of an invincible superhero as he struggles with his mortality.','/AmOfWnvFeH2Gn3qeQI8yBjKNqi6.jpg','2011-05-04',97,'Released','When time is precious living can\'t wait','Death of a Superhero',91551,2.7336,6.9,'xgbvfm3Gflg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27117,_binary '\0','/5SBgIj4PejTBe3gGMb2zTTCMkXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13849558',6.1,7622,'en','Corner Office','In this office satire, Orson, a straight-laced employee, retreats to a blissfully empty corner office to get away from his lackluster colleagues. But why does this seem to upset them so much?','/2JOPMnpaaTBvhy0HCby9uSBkt11.jpg','2023-08-04',102,'Released','Uncover the corners of reality.','Corner Office',800279,3.8878,6.518,'iEbvLxU8vMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27118,_binary '\0','/47CZWW68fQGAC4mMyQchPla4pc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385543',4.7,2943,'en','Dark House','A young man sets out on a trip that takes him to an abandoned mansion that holds the origins of his dark family legacy.','/higcYAgkTyfc9lSx9xfBYxB3iio.jpg','2014-03-14',102,'Released','And so the beast created one.','Dark House',257093,2.0475,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27119,_binary '\0','/obBe7n3FVvHfwK3wP182MrsBbCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13857556',5.3,5028,'en','Candy Land','Remy, a seemingly naive and devout young woman, finds herself cast out from her religious cult. With no place to turn, she immerses herself into the underground world of truck stop sex workers. Under the watchful eye of their matriarch and an enigmatic local lawman, Remy navigates between her strained belief system and the code to find her true calling in life.','/3upBKM4ZFZ1fEEnWrnTZMuyPrzI.jpg','2023-01-06',93,'Released','We\'ll take care of you.','Candy Land',826753,2.4386,6.2,'s9iIE9EU4PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27120,_binary '\0','/zQVYeNyKrdGUU58hZwoFHq7Rn7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385824',7.4,11317,'ta','யாவரும் நலம்','Manohar and his family move into a new apartment on the 13th floor. However, their peace is disturbed by a spirit that uses the television set as a medium to communicate with them.','/AvecQgxUwMuc1VTlkFm5RpAibZe.jpg','2009-03-06',137,'Released','Fear has a new address.','Yavarum Nalam',19950,2.9,6.4,'VSrhCiHFiGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27121,_binary '\0','/jE3deh9kkOKgl3MISqmpWpqLUjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385826',7,284985,'en','The Adjustment Bureau','A man glimpses the future Fate has planned for him – and chooses to fight for his own destiny. Battling the powerful Adjustment Bureau across, under and through the streets of New York, he risks his destined greatness to be with the only woman he\'s ever loved.','/5ZzeR8iz1nEFLp94OBnbakLZawo.jpg','2011-03-03',106,'Released','Your future has been adjusted.','The Adjustment Bureau',38050,10.9827,6.792,'fSeWHl1PaKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27122,_binary '\0','/p8ah01N83pfwrSmlJsUufEx5pGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385867',5.5,92910,'en','Cop Out','Detectives Jimmy and Paul, despite nine years as partners, can still sometimes seem like polar opposites—especially when Paul\'s unpredictable antics get them suspended without pay. Already strapped for cash and trying to pay for his daughter\'s wedding, Jimmy decides to sell a rare baseball card that\'s worth tens of thousands. Unfortunately, when the collector\'s shop is robbed and the card vanishes with the crook, Paul and Jimmy end up going rogue, tracking down the card and the drug ring behind its theft, all on their own time and without any backup—except for each other.','/qA31i7FPVDHezuoevx3497CvZd4.jpg','2010-02-26',107,'Released','Rock out with your Glock out','Cop Out',23742,5.7576,5.553,'NAH8qgVY9jE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27123,_binary '\0','/nJjTb3PwG1s7DxMhFoW5BtrXgnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385912',4.8,11276,'en','I Can Do Bad All By Myself','When Madea catches teenage Jennifer and her two younger brothers looting her home, she decides to take matters into her own hands and delivers the young delinquents to the only relative they have: their aunt April. A heavy-drinking nightclub singer who lives off of her married boyfriend, April wants nothing to do with the kids.','/kl8RNyG7jokw2pTLJNwkPhsBAL9.jpg','2009-09-11',113,'Released','Hope is closer than you think.','I Can Do Bad All By Myself',26367,2.7156,6.3,'nkUvBCW-tS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27124,_binary '\0','/pTKLth5bgOmOvipPLBP2th2dV05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13859494',7.5,1686,'hi','गुठली लड्डु','Guthlee, son of a poor sweeper, has a dream - to go to school. But the obstacle is his caste. A headmaster is sympathetic to him but powerless against caste discrimination. When they develop an unspoken bond, Guthlee\'s dream sees hope.','/6fXh8g5YRPoCbYjqcSaKkorf03m.jpg','2022-07-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Guthlee Ladoo',920026,0.8926,7,'6HrCQSFXD7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27125,_binary '\0','/dcaLGCuECUGRIj9IwM2VClg9fYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1385956',7.4,7739,'en','Particle Fever','As the Large Hadron Collider is about to be launched for the first time, physicists are on the cusp of the greatest scientific discovery of all time - or perhaps their greatest failure.','/3MHs9BrHt6ZjlPvaL4CP1ULYV2Z.jpg','2013-06-14',99,'Released','With one switch, everything changes.','Particle Fever',202141,1.4721,7.1,'Rikc7foqvRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27126,_binary '\0','/A0xW7GgeFQoQmPOn7HcHkBQ5nlb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13863334',4.7,3197,'en','Endangered Species','Jack Halsey takes his wife, their adult kids, and a friend for a dream vacation in Kenya. But as they venture off alone into a wilderness park, their safari van is flipped over by an angry rhino, leaving them injured and desperate. Then, as two of them go in search of rescue, a bloody, vicious encounter with a leopard and a clan of hyenas incites a desperate fight for survival.','/ccsSqbpEqr2KK9eMvoeF8ERFCd5.jpg','2021-05-27',101,'Released','Far from home. Far from safety. Far from over.','Endangered Species',817451,4.6172,5.689,'kLw87Kc46kU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27127,_binary '\0','/Psi0eWatl6FZHhzHkxxRRM6E1V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13863968',8,1927,'en','The Wisdom of Trauma','One in five Americans are diagnosed with mental illness every year. Suicide is the second most common cause of death in the US for youth aged 15-24, and kills over 800,000 people globally per year. Drug overdose kills 81,000 in the US annually. The autoimmune disorder epidemic affects 24 million people in the US alone. What is going on? The interconnected epidemics of anxiety, chronic illness and substance abuse are, according to Dr. Gabor Maté, normal - but not in the way you might think.','/mVrWEqqampxVe6PhJ1MjDoQqpx5.jpg','2021-06-08',87,'Released','Can our deepest pain be a doorway to healing?','The Wisdom of Trauma',838617,1.7351,7.1,'70HNmSsJvVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27128,_binary '\0','/nHyri67CN6juBR6hmOefCn9oGf8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386588',6.7,313361,'en','The Other Guys','Unlike their heroic counterparts on the force, desk-bound NYPD detectives Gamble and Hoitz garner no headlines as they work day to day. When a seemingly minor case turns out to be a big deal, the two cops get the opportunity to finally prove to their comrades that they have the right stuff.','/wNEHNqo3MgHmj3BUiPSqqq5czcm.jpg','2010-08-06',107,'Released','NY\'s finest were busy.','The Other Guys',27581,16.0295,6.341,'D6WOoUG1eNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27129,_binary '\0','/eczzFRSBe9pqo38LIvfeGqw90u0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13866142',6.4,1420,'ko','위시유','Singing and dreaming together, a talented singer-songwriter and a same-aged keyboardist add harmony and love to each other\'s lives.','/lvYrAUfx9DkhLVC07vD8wJQK3iA.jpg','2021-01-15',102,'Released',NULL,'Wish You',783753,1.9392,7.3,'lIHdTZA1J4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27130,_binary '\0','/AeAWTsG5iPfbonBtdSfiJAnfq6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386683',6.9,7874,'no','En ganske snill mann','After serving a 12-year sentence for killing the man that slept with his wife, a man ponders whether he should try and reconcile with his family, or take revenge on those who turned him in.','/l3I58PdeJHTPTzLa1QWtKS97hyW.jpg','2010-03-19',103,'Released','Sometimes gangsters need hugs too.','A Somewhat Gentle Man',31035,2.72,6.5,'OqPnwCQi0VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27131,_binary '\0','/1TJgdDUWfeeyHqagLY77A88Y3Cq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13866866',6.5,2016,'es','Puan','When Marcelo Pena finally is about to be appointed Head of the Philosophy Department, the famous and seductive Professor Sujarchuk returns from Europe to claim the kingdom for himself.','/5Ufiq3lA0QXnC1aIztBIFXovY7r.jpg','2023-10-05',107,'Released','A philosophical comedy of existential proportions','Puan',764442,2.7121,6.4,'cnz-6h60tkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27132,_binary '\0','/sj78u6ym80gdHf230MXY5BjhH1V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386691',6.3,18028,'en','Shimmer Lake','Shot in reverse day-by-day through a week—a local sheriff embarks on a quest to unlock the mystery of three small-town criminals and a bank heist gone wrong.','/bQHhpTHiys0CZRrdDRKvXBmM5KL.jpg','2017-06-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Shimmer Lake',457962,3.3119,5.936,'sm_hwxNTAa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27133,_binary '\0','/wAk0yKrhAmvsoMvlKs4QImhvK5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386697',5.9,766731,'en','Suicide Squad','From DC Comics comes the Suicide Squad, an antihero team of incarcerated supervillains who act as deniable assets for the United States government, undertaking high-risk black ops missions in exchange for commuted prison sentences.','/sk3FZgh3sRrmr8vyhaitNobMcfh.jpg','2016-08-03',122,'Released','Worst. Heroes. Ever.','Suicide Squad',297761,18.4604,5.9,'5AwUdTIbA8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27134,_binary '\0','/uBHeAB2Ug9ELBzkMyls8CUjzn4i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386703',6.2,277699,'en','Total Recall','Factory worker Doug Quaid takes a virtual mind-trip vacation with the Rekall company, opting for implanted memories of being a spy. When the procedure goes wrong, Quaid becomes a wanted man by the police and joins forces with a rebel fighter to stop the evil Chancellor Cohaagen.','/hVUxVVzZ0WvvPIpKwsMPMDOQyqi.jpg','2012-08-02',118,'Released','What is real?','Total Recall',64635,18.5581,6.036,'GljhR5rk5eY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27135,_binary '\0','/ilnVSwyxDOxvNBopcssOThaE9az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386741',6,1317,'es','Las viudas de los jueves','The closed community of a private neighborhood of high-priced houses, is moved by the discovery of three corpses that appear floating in a pool and rushes to frame it as an accident.','/cmxCVgA1Qlgx2sOVTJVdyDbo6l0.jpg','2009-09-10',122,'Released','The dark side of a perfect life','The Widows of Thursdays',38238,1.7121,5.529,'lG0F-h5IKVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27136,_binary '\0','/vy3CTp0UnH3cR5HvMXzSF0lFOx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386925',5.7,10052,'en','The Dead','When the last evacuation flight out of war-torn Africa crashes off the coast, American Air Force Engineer Lieutenant Brian Murphy emerges as the sole survivor in a land where the dead are returning to life and attacking the living.','/oJAbF41N7ZvoTAhZTaQ85AYpLJG.jpg','2010-08-30',105,'Released','The Feeding Begins','The Dead',74471,2.0362,5.528,'OJVdqZww9aE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27137,_binary '\0','/lFhTEHBphkHw5hDsuRLYAXZB3u4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1386932',7.5,117806,'cn','葉問2','Having defeated the best fighters of the Imperial Japanese army in occupied Shanghai, Ip Man and his family settle in post-war Hong Kong. Struggling to make a living, Master Ip opens a kung fu school to bring his celebrated art of Wing Chun to the troubled youth of Hong Kong. His growing reputation soon brings challenges from powerful enemies, including pre-eminent Hung Gar master, Hung Quan.','/wMcyFfKcJneVgcHxWYiQNUNHUsq.jpg','2010-04-29',108,'Released','Behind every great martial artist lies a teacher.','Ip Man 2',37472,1.2024,7.5,'4ynwOQX1A7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27138,_binary '\0','/cTxmFYOpvg0eNwc0xnEkoqcTMep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13871094',6.7,1553,'en','Stamped from the Beginning','Using innovative animation and expert insights, this documentary based on Ibram X. Kendi\'s bestseller explores the history of racist ideas in America.','/dksKQ0jEpKCG31tfyh7Pag7ALiA.jpg','2023-11-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Stamped from the Beginning',1132535,2.4483,6.6,'HMYLFQbyIu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27139,_binary '\0','/1McO40rFBnUSz0EB2EwYQlUv9LV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13872248',6.5,27836,'zh','哭悲','A young couple is pushed to the limits of sanity as they attempt to be reunited amid the chaos of a pandemic outbreak. The streets erupt into violence and depravity, as those infected are driven to enact the most cruel and ghastly things imaginable.','/a7VHvhROWorsWrtNKQnLZTxpxuG.jpg','2021-01-22',100,'Released','It feels...wonderful...','The Sadness',776797,7.7858,6.842,'DNgR1WXjUg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27140,_binary '\0','/bnMKMhGJuvELSjRp8KpkuDsBDw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13873302',6.5,32258,'en','Against the Ice','In 1909, two explorers fight to survive after they\'re left behind while on a Danish expedition in ice-covered Greenland.','/6FSGYvPEhIx3ThOikGqHmKxeyNN.jpg','2022-02-10',101,'Released','Survive the search. Survive each other.','Against the Ice',836009,5.3557,6.775,'bEyyKwVORvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27141,_binary '\0','/eEPR1HjWQEPzvrqGtSCxmzlsmin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13874422',5.9,7832,'en','The Eternal Daughter','An artist and her elderly mother confront long-buried secrets when they return to a former family home, now a hotel haunted by its mysterious past.','/kyv8tPXx3mKchYzVmA3VckKoJDi.jpg','2022-12-02',96,'Released','An exquisite ghost story.','The Eternal Daughter',790867,4.7811,5.9,'5hJR8hEsLZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27142,_binary '\0