the pressure to close the case as soon as possible proves too much for him.','/jnWyZsaCl3Ke6u6ReSmBRO8S1rX.jpg','2022-05-23',100,'Released','To solve this crime, they\'ll need to break all the rules','Cop Secret',792775,2.5713,6,'63OdtSiAt-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27146,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388359',2.9,2910,'en','Warning!!! Pedophile Released','A pedophile is released out of prison from a 6-year sentence after allegedly molesting a 12-year old girl. The victim, now 18, reunites with her assailant whom she calls her \"soul mate\" only to spark outrage in the community. Not only do they attack the Pedophile, but soon cause more harm and chaos to the girl that they supposedly were protecting.','/hPUInvVajb0Z3eLoC6e75GLNQbP.jpg','2009-10-16',115,'Released',NULL,'Warning!!! Pedophile Released',51750,0.9329,1.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27147,_binary '\0','/27qng7VwkW45T0X6vteYpD9Q62E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388402',6.9,1321,'en','Mal día para pescar','Jacob van Oppen, the former strongest man on earth, and his manager Orsini, who calls himself \"the Prince\", make a good living by traveling around small South American towns and organizing wrestling exhibitions. Arriving in Santa Maria, they are met with uncommon enthusiasm, the local newspaper wants to sponsor the fight, helping hands placard the town with posters, and an open call is made for a worthy adversary. Ever so resourceful, Orsini knows how to find the right combatant, but fishing in Santa Maria could lead to a bigger catch than he\'d hoped for.','/lQJCrr6ypVgHdCQYI9BBPq2GHvN.jpg','2009-07-31',110,'Released',NULL,'Bad Day to Go Fishing',61718,1.2585,6.6,'5_dYDNnXiew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27148,_binary '\0','/ppbLSfQFyrjXBgvwzdr0vb1Y7MW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388411',6.3,1678,'en','Terug naar de kust','A woman tries to escape a stalker by moving with her children to her sister\'s isolated beach house','/qbb2PzO8RcgFmr4jJV1bp2FwnWC.jpg','2009-10-29',110,'Released',NULL,'The Dark House',32860,1.2955,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27149,_binary '\0','/vkjsoMF86dJIv6Sgtd4CcuR8kzh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13884144',6.4,2001,'ja','劇場版 七つの大罪 光に呪われし者たち','With the help of the \"Dragon Sin of Wrath\" Meliodas and the worst rebels in history, the Seven Deadly Sins, the \"Holy War\", in which four races, including Humans, Goddesses, Fairies and Giants fought against the Demons, is finally over. At the cost of the \"Lion Sin of Pride\" Escanor\'s life, the Demon King was defeated and the world regained peace. After that, each of the Sins take their own path.','/k0ThmZQl5nHe4JefC2bXjqtgYp0.jpg','2021-07-02',79,'Released',NULL,'The Seven Deadly Sins: Cursed by Light',843241,4.2167,7.7,'s4U5ipjy6Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27150,_binary '\0','/9dp7P3Sih72mjmLlAmdLPhuXvmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388418',5.1,10657,'fa','اخراجی ها','The movie is the story of a gang of men who decide to participate in Iran-Iraq war, also known as First Gulf War, which lasted from September 1980 to August 1988. the main character, Suzuki, who is there to satisfy his beloved\'s father that he is worthy of marrying his daughter, goes through some moving experiences in the war and his character changes to a level that he even tries to sacrifice himself to save the others in the war. the Movie ends by his martyrdom.','/yEK3xnYt7k4oamNOfiB0taWPpuR.jpg','2007-03-20',104,'Released',NULL,'Deportees',384583,0.6242,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27151,_binary '\0','/2uTmgmz0Tds9lPiD84S0prqMfSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388427',6,2577,'sr','Život i smrt porno bande','Marko, an aspiring filmmaker, is unable to pursue a career in horror films. He ventures into the porn industry, but his unorthodox style fails to impress producers. Frustrated, he assembles a crew of junkies, homosexuals and transvestites and starts a traveling live porn show. Soon a shady producer appears, he will pay them real money if they are willing to start making snuff films for him.','/bUB1VodHERLZHuqqlaukuHX4OeF.jpg','2009-09-16',112,'Released',NULL,'The Life and Death of a Porno Gang',56531,2.0482,6.281,'R3cc6N2Mbyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27152,_binary '\0','/jNcO6bfg2XcexpHCParqiZIatgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388432',4.5,1430,'en','High Plains Invaders','In the lawless heart of the Old West, notorious outlaw Sam Phoenix stands at the gallows, moments from justice—or so it seems. But when an unearthly terror descends on the town without warning, everything changes. As chaos erupts and survival becomes the only law, Phoenix finds himself facing a threat far deadlier than any posse. Something not of this world has arrived… and it’s just getting started.','/mwN2d3ELKVLxn3vHH4c5PyVboiW.jpg','2009-08-30',87,'Released',NULL,'High Plains Invaders',36139,1.1753,4.5,'XOrWkZZc34M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27153,_binary '\0','/6eDkEBj8c1F75EUT4REMk9CWcRW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388441',7.3,1738,'ta','முகவரி','Sridhar, an aspiring music director, has been struggling to get a foothold in the music industry for many years. He falls in love but is willing to put his relationship on a backburner for success.','/yy8wGIhuVaDDBrJHc9m1VkjsT7H.jpg','2000-02-02',156,'Released',NULL,'Mugavari',69404,1.0944,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27154,_binary '\0','/oulDXgeHUhbv17n8vhnGXWUFtm2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1388444',7.4,3084,'ta','யாரடி நீ மோகினி','Vasu falls in love with Keerthi, but when he expresses his feelings to her, she turns him down and says that her marriage has already been arranged. He later learns that she is set to marry his close friend Cheenu.','/cUxzchnYYoeFJy7s4sD9bRdIGwx.jpg','2008-04-04',165,'Released',NULL,'Yaaradi Nee Mohini',69515,1.5601,7,'OpXjgqI2xFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27155,_binary '\0','/aqOKuH8zLYxM9uDLb9makn7x6LI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13884444',6,3175,'en','American Dreamer','In this winsome comedy, an entitled Economics professor pursues a tactic to buy an ailing widow’s mansion for nothing, but he quickly realizes that his seemingly foolproof strategy won’t be as easy as he thought.','/9bUsa318eCnztKZlcG86s8xk9Rk.jpg','2022-11-04',106,'Released','Hope isn\'t for everyone.','American Dreamer',931461,4.0707,5.9,'ip1M_fjL2Bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27156,_binary '\0','/5UK0y96yY3UERw2OHy14qnB2HuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13885320',7.1,10408,'hi','इंडिया लॉकडाउन','The Indian government announces a country-wide lockdown for 21 days due to the pandemic. India Lockdown encapsulates the story of four out of lakhs of individuals whose lives came to a standstill.','/rR8lTcL81n5oHtxmGHMWxag0XOc.jpg','2022-12-02',117,'Released','The tragic truth of irreversible loss','India Lockdown',788348,0.9824,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27157,_binary '\0','/82sMBMHziUTGczj1D4YtlJjoX5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13885428',7.4,12773,'ml','അന്വേഷിപ്പിൻ കണ്ടെത്തും','A team of four expert policemen go through extreme trials and tribulations to find the killer of a young woman.','/i32ooxvEsy5V6hDucB7hsELT9Vo.jpg','2024-02-09',143,'Released',NULL,'Anweshippin Kandethum',834664,1.5753,6.936,'FQZ5_AtbO2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27158,_binary '\0','/712eF5TMRNaOss5vtXojaJftYxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13885492',7.4,2025,'en','Little Richard: I Am Everything','The story of the black, gay origins of rock n\' roll. It explodes the whitewashed canon of American pop music to reveal the innovator – the originator – Richard Penniman. Through a wealth of archive and performance that brings us into Richard\'s complicated inner world, the film unspools the icon\'s life story with all its switchbacks and contradictions.','/5u5kkH6ux1wHHJHLePAR1xMgSv5.jpg','2023-04-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Little Richard: I Am Everything',1053718,2.2661,6.6,'3yJL0AJLexU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27159,_binary '\0','/6p9Nun8NyRaPU1lPRm01MlKMCor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13885592',6.7,1490,'de','Die Heimsuchung','Ben wakes up from an artificial coma after a failed mission. The personal protector has to deal with the fact that he could not prevent the death of a little girl. In order to recover, the BKA officer takes a break from the police service and drives to the Baltic Sea with his girlfriend Marion. He spent happy days there as a child. The first visit to his parents in years is at the same time the return to the place of painful memories, because back then his best friend Timmi was killed in a mysterious accident. To his astonishment, he now learns that Timmi, now an adult, is alive and lying in a hospital as a coma patient. Together with Marion, a doctor who specializes in this diseases, Ben wants to reach Timmi with the help of MRI technology. Perhaps the trauma can be resolved if the cause can be brought to light. Unlike Ben, however, neither Timmi\'s father nor the village cop Nolting seem interested in it. A web of guilt, lies and deception has to be unraveled to clue to the puzzle.','/sJ52OvRzeprYHwyuesSyCVK41CC.jpg','2021-09-24',87,'Released',NULL,'Die Heimsuchung',878057,0.8078,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27160,_binary '\0','/vuQDBNFnl8RHckp5zhTvxFqJ3ok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13885642',5.7,2727,'ta','சபாபதி','A young man who has a speech disorder ends up with a suitcase filled with money that belongs to a corrupt politician.','/hGimsV6wpwBygmmP1mN23gqfoiV.jpg','2021-11-19',123,'Released','Follow Sabhaapathy','Sabhaapathy',895077,0.6827,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27161,_binary '\0','/zSCiACrKR2XMjsN79pvH6gWrPG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13886392',5.8,1568,'ml','നീലവെളിച്ചം','A young, enthusiastic and free-spirited writer arrives to stay in a desolate mansion, rumored to be haunted by the apparition of a young woman named Bharghavi who committed suicide when she was betrayed in love. The writer, who begins to pen her story, soon realizes that there is more to her tragic tale.','/ytVFd3Q991GIsMvU6rMcaUbUDLw.jpg','2023-04-20',134,'Released',NULL,'Neelavelicham',834660,0.9165,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27162,_binary '\0','/D2ppnImxdDinPEYJzmW2dZmnjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13887082',4.6,1550,'de','Grand Jeté','Dance teacher and mother Nadja left her son Mario with her own mother when he was little. Now she has reappeared on his doorstep, seeking a closeness that knows fewer and fewer boundaries. An uncompromising film about family relationships.','/awpPWrE5kqIURHotysiR2yBg9Ty.jpg','2022-09-20',105,'Released','This could be their...','Grand Jete',928358,11.5032,4.9,'xz7SwtnM0KY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27163,_binary '\0','/kXjAi3cboSCXSFZJpWLAgWYa2ec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13889602',5,3252,'en','Last Survivors','The pic is set in the aftermath of an apocalyptic event that forces people into extreme isolation. A father and son, who have been living off grid for 20 years, encounter an outsider who threatens to destroy the utopia they’ve built.','/7LcUUUVsbCtNeTmf4dVG2kAcgcV.jpg','2021-10-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Last Survivors',789171,3.9715,5.2,'vqjV4_UFh1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27164,_binary '\0','/c3ALYF5zG3ZRydRSCYh7t8m4a11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13890392',6.6,2345,'en','Fake Famous','Explores the meaning of fame and influence in the digital age through an innovative social experiment. Following three Los Angeles-based people with relatively small followings, the film explores the attempts made to turn them into famous influencers by purchasing fake followers and bots to “engage” with their social media accounts.','/eWNK3XH1W8cVDVLeysQ5snCMqxW.jpg','2021-02-02',86,'Released','An unreal social experiment.','Fake Famous',788610,2.4362,7,'2B7m-ARHz0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27165,_binary '\0','/rtr0l61RxLPkmZHbZj0WFlGx5G5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389072',5.8,139042,'en','Downsizing','A kindly occupational therapist undergoes a new procedure to be shrunken to four inches tall so that he and his wife can help save the planet and afford a nice lifestyle at the same time.','/5bNzInSSAXfr0MFlHfb4IoQePVx.jpg','2017-12-22',135,'Released','We are meant for something bigger.','Downsizing',301337,9.2225,5.4,'UCrBICYM0yM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27166,_binary '\0','/1izLoqNuHTECe25rMcgAcYnMjsr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389096',6.4,59993,'en','Stand Up Guys','After serving 28 years in prison for accidentally killing the son of a crime boss, newly paroled gangster Val reunites with his former partners in crime, Doc and Hirsch, for a night on the town. As the three men revisit old haunts, reflect on their glory days and try to make up for lost time, one wrestles with a terrible quandary: Doc has orders to kill Val, and time is running out for him to figure out a way out of his dilemma.','/pOXmX1rldFQv3rFkWwe4uqbPWPJ.jpg','2012-12-14',95,'Released','They don\'t make \'em like they used to.','Stand Up Guys',121824,7.2651,6.035,'kK0wWvROGAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27167,_binary '\0','/tKONjlLiKBhEuIEOWmhULdZ15bv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389098',6.2,2246,'en','Mapplethorpe','A look at the life of photographer Robert Mapplethorpe from his rise to fame in the 1970s to his untimely death in 1989.','/ztRHEGTaQht07AuT8V1QVEpHXgx.jpg','2019-03-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Mapplethorpe',434072,2.1271,6.2,'TvXLMpjyqpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27168,_binary '\0','/wOodHfAuJZNHmgYCal0PicNtCWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389127',5.7,24006,'en','Texas Killing Fields','In the Texas bayous, a local homicide detective teams up with a cop from New York City to investigate a series of unsolved murders.','/oWGCz9txia8hJsQDNe6Lj91qr7K.jpg','2011-10-14',105,'Released','No one is safe.','Texas Killing Fields',72477,4.489,5.781,'7woppidfvtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27169,_binary '\0','/3epmRoQFyUpLATk1JKgnKKQp0kM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389137',7,162305,'en','We Bought a Zoo','Benjamin has lost his wife and, in a bid to start his life over, purchases a large house that has a zoo – welcome news for his daughter, but his son is not happy about it. The zoo is in need of renovation and Benjamin sets about the work with the head keeper and the rest of the staff, but, the zoo soon runs into financial trouble.','/dcOvIqdsojUdAtWt1nPT9xS76Su.jpg','2011-11-26',124,'Released','A true zoo story.','We Bought a Zoo',74465,12.8533,6.838,'Fopeq7wx4sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27170,_binary '\0','/vjGYFfG8Amm019QoSB9csEZC4X2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1389139',5.2,8869,'en','When the Bough Breaks','A surrogate mother harbors a deadly secret desire for a family of her own with the husband who is expecting to raise her child.','/4QqhN9jZkY33yMvknGI4YpM3TYv.jpg','2016-09-09',97,'Released','She\'s carrying more than just a secret.','When the Bough Breaks',335791,5.759,5.9,'Ws74Ie4fMc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27171,_binary '\0','/thGsyfOzd0lFhNESkUlUvvHkpNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13892718',6.2,2027,'hi','अतिथि भूतो भव','Srikant\'s life turns upside down when he bumps into a middle-aged ghost who claims to be his grandson from his previous birth. Things take an even more comical turn when the ghost seeks Srikant\'s help to meet his long-lost love.','/7hdFezTGLhBCmhuM34lbXRwegy4.jpg','2022-09-23',113,'Released','Love will travel, beyond life and death','Atithi Bhooto Bhava',788944,1.0663,9,'LzIKi4d7QSg','YouTube','Trailer','202