on a bike trip in a remote part of Argentina split up and one of them goes missing, the other must find her before her worst fears are realized.','/8k7BV9YRKTNXdj7wKiRGncNfwAh.jpg','2010-02-25',91,'Released','Alone. Stranded. No one to trust.','And Soon the Darkness',33107,4.6343,5.254,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27183,_binary '\0','/dcUVeAJapke6J2I1pJMBcqIU1WP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1391092',7.5,3807,'en','Marwencol','After a vicious attack leaves him brain-damaged and broke, Mark Hogancamp seeks recovery in \"Marwencol\", a 1/6th scale World War II-era town he creates in his backyard.','/bdlOAvKrHe4jLO9LUCxjqOqST4X.jpg','2010-03-12',83,'Released','When his world was stolen, Mark Hogancamp made a world of his own.','Marwencol',52013,0.8755,7.3,'vNKPEp6aEqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27184,_binary '\0','/fDoqpyyAg4LjwdvXJwW6hYSTZRm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1391116',4.9,2035,'en','Resistance','It is 1944 and the D-Day invasion has failed, Germany\'s army have successfully invaded England and the Nazi war-machine is now heading west towards Wales. A group of women in an isolated Welsh village near the English border wake up to discover all of the their husbands have mysteriously vanished. They have headed into the mountains to join the Resistance.','/jFoE1pCFuN1hBgcSwW9z44pH7R5.jpg','2011-11-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Resistance',96944,1.4317,4.8,'64qXowINUFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27185,_binary '\0','/m6yveMsilptiQgFlpnprybTmo25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1391137',4.8,11058,'en','Why Did I Get Married Too?','Four couples reunite for their annual vacation in order to socialize and to spend time analyzing their marriages. Their intimate week in the Bahamas is disrupted by the arrival of an ex-husband determined to win back his recently remarried wife.','/ctWuunKnm8bcG8cz40wndtdvV0W.jpg','2010-04-02',121,'Released','Marriage is an institution they\'re committed to.',