a, an undercover agent tasked with peace negotiations crosses paths with a tenacious boxer fighting for her dreams.','/y7DOaApwC0CO5EEV7Knqju3rLFa.jpg','2022-05-27',146,'Released','Who will win? India','Anek',888268,2.0767,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27194,_binary '\0','/crR4gCBnZ3uznllG5h8eWyOXmge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13920920',6.5,2865,'fa','تفریق','After a confusing interaction in downtown Tehran, a married couple seems to have found their doppelgängers.','/iGsBOd9aXPcRAkSODEZBMX5lMTU.jpg','2022-11-05',107,'Released',NULL,'Subtraction',1008043,1.3286,6.6,'_S-0mjg4ygI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27195,_binary '\0','/bQdktzKj99fPDZTUDr65VZUEk5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13920988',7,2248,'fa','شب، داخلی، دیوار','Ali, a blind man, is attempting to commit suicide when he is interrupted by the concierge of his building. He is informed that the police is in search of a woman who has escaped and hidden somewhere in the building. Little by little, Ali finds out that the fugitive woman, Leila, is inside his apartment. After participating in a workers’ protest that led to chaos, she is distraught about her four-year-old son who was lost when she was taken in a police van. Gradually, Ali becomes emotionally attached to her. Wishing to flee reality, helping Leila becomes a refuge in his own world of imagination.','/1kboERE2tFHuxwvmqE4e8n82ETq.jpg','2023-04-20',126,'Released',NULL,'Beyond The Wall',1004664,0.8745,6.7,'WkBuaS-Xlgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27196,_binary '\0','/hhikWeaatJSlzXusizbxktEquYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13921156',5.4,1276,'te','ఇదే మా కథ','Four strangers from different age groups connect at a Royal Enfield motorcycle meet and start a journey together, making discoveries about life, people and love.','/B8nwErmpQl6XWFxchxdwharSGS.jpg','2021-10-01',143,'Released',NULL,'Idhe Maa Katha',882420,1.0523,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(