ey want it or not. Quan – Ba Sang’s son is a modern young Youtuber.','/ucXxqYqNLjZ3auyLTzU9NsClsms.jpg','2021-03-12',128,'Released',NULL,'Dad, I\'m Sorry',787459,1.878,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27208,_binary '\0','/54OIv0X7tP3DCCy4eMPS5jiWFlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13926298',6.2,6961,'ta','நண்பன் ஒருவன் வந்த பிறகு','Anand, in the travel back to his home to reunite with his friends , looks back at his life in 8 chapters, trying to find an answer to the question of “What’s happiness / Am I happy?','/yszVzY7sK08XFvTfrx4AIgdB910.jpg','2024-08-02',135,'Released',NULL,'Nanban Oruvan Vantha Piragu',1190904,0.6238,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27209,_binary '\0','/eaBHMLcrhOc0iT7jRZoYho4IhsH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1392744',4.8,3312,'hi','चांस पे डांस','Sameer is the archetypal struggler who leaves his dad in Delhi and comes to Mumbai, chasing dreams of becoming a star in Bollywood. Does he manage to survive the bleak and grueling rounds of endless auditions, broken promises and missed chances?','/ypnLRUuBiu6VxQAiYeBvmLrR4fL.jpg','2010-01-15',121,'Released',NULL,'Chance Pe Dance',30695,1.3221,5.242,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27210,_binary '\0','/xtOCTmGemASooRkAxRorYODig1p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13927994',6.7,79927,'te','సలార్: పార్ట్‌ 1 – సీజ్‌ఫైర్‌','Set in the fictional dystopian city-state of Khansaar, the film follows the friendship between Deva, a tribesman, and Varadha, the prince of Khansaar. When a coup d\'état is planned by his father\'s ministers and his relatives, Varadha enlists Deva\'s help to become Khansaar\'s undisputed ruler.','/nlu9WbcetNFRGXXPWITr30ob7W6.jpg','2023-12-21',175,'Released',NULL,'Salaar: Part 1 - Ceasefire',770906,3.8908,6.8,'4GPvYMKtrtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27211,_binary '\0','/xlEwMw3GB7NWmk75v1uwOwmAY4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1392888',6.1,2382,'es','Daniel & Ana','Being kidnapped shatters a brother and sister\'s harmony, forcing them to confront their desires.','/9qdUuckSL6OAwp6aUpbMY6513YB.jpg','2009-10-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Daniel & Ana',112631,3.2663,6.7,'FOolpaxZPsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27212,_binary '\0','/ndrZYPNv0jKMCO9Ne98vfNxTzkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13929998',5.5,6566,'en','On a Wing and a Prayer','After their pilot dies unexpectedly mid-flight, passenger Doug White must safely land a plane and save his entire family from insurmountable danger.','/8GTJwaC2CeNa0Zg6QrPLwrfurpZ.jpg','2023-03-28',102,'Released','Based on the incredible true story.','On a Wing and a Prayer',878375,5.2215,5.904,'C4UKU7W3PKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27213,_binary '\0','/jjtFp052pwhphXbgOQlVKhonkjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1393000',6,4843,'en','Wrong Turn at Tahoe','A small-time crime boss kills a drug dealer without realizing that the drug dealer works for the biggest crime boss in the country.','/h0n2vU0Apv4xpDJMVVDbmADl5Lh.jpg','2009-11-16',91,'Released',NULL,'Wrong Turn at Tahoe',25594,3.3604,5.695,'XfvOCJO72wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27214,_binary '\0','/x5cFIXZMRnqtyPyeRrSEF5cuIK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1393020',6.5,4596,'en','Sex & Drugs & Rock & Roll','A biography of Ian Dury, who was stricken with polio at a young age and defied expectations by becoming one of the founders of the punk-rock scene in Britain in the 1970s.','/A8iKHHVRyJPL7Gq58eiTkSI53vJ.jpg','2010-01-08',115,'Released','There are a couple of ways to avoid death....one is to be magnificent','Sex & Drugs & Rock & Roll',37234,2.4609,6.2,'3tUR7EisSl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27215,_binary '\0','/tzJZaglq1hR7RS35BKG68Xz7KY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13932162',6.2,5371,'ru','Ганзель, Гретель и Агентство Магии','The Secret Magic Control Agency sends its two best agents, Hansel and Gretel, to fight against the witch of the Gingerbread House.','/4ZSzEDVdxWVMVO4oZDvoodQOEfr.jpg','2021-03-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Secret Magic Control Agency',797394,3.5186,7,'OESJJ2vZn9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27216,_binary '\0','/8qoYV0otdn0xE9yAGK7IeT6y0UG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13932304',5.9,2261,'it','America Latina','Massimo Sisti is a reputable professional with a nice house, a happy marriage, and two loving daughters, whose life is turned upside down when one day he finds a little girl tied up in his basement.','/r8J97YLCaf6GBbRbBxxdAYme8Rh.jpg','2022-01-13',90,'Released',NULL,'America Latina',807185,2.0561,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27217,_binary '\0','/v8Rg963ryBoP3ECo8g8OK8QQ1CE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13932410',6,2387,'es','El cuarto pasajero','Julián, a divorced man with financial problems, uses a cell phone application to share his car with strangers.','/deOu3LDIbWtipp8vjCaszKz22LZ.jpg','2022-10-28',96,'Released','Careful who you let in your car','Four\'s a Crowd',791333,2.9334,6.3,'WQBuj-2ZR4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27218,_binary '\0','/rbb2TqNnvVxJOpa2f106UW1AsIA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13934264',6,1741,'en','When It Rains in LA','Following the story of an Eastern European girl who escapes the horror of losing her boyfriend in her own country for an LA vacation with friends, she faces the reckoning of the trauma she left behind... and the rain she unearthed coming here.','/8CIaFZE017CwRfLaIRKzANVGVsN.jpg','2025-01-03',80,'Released','It rarely rains in LA, but when it does, strange things happen.','When It Rains in LA',1403322,1.2498,8,'bEXOgn8TTjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27219,_binary '\0','/byg8TpLY3rocdazIHsYMlVECR3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1393742',6.4,6402,'en','Jesus Henry Christ','At the age of ten, Henry James Hermin, a boy who was conceived in a petri-dish and raised by his feminist mother, follows a string of Post-It notes in hopes of finding his biological father.','/cdK3OU14K8zjWjDlhXY2rNRjKUQ.jpg','2012-05-04',92,'Released',NULL,'Jesus Henry Christ',96973,2.0202,6.2,'jFWFjaOhziA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27220,_binary '\0','/1IxJGZoUbLopBI8ag2t94aAXJFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1393746',7.5,10324,'zh','唐山大地震','Tangshan, 1976. Two seven-year-old twins are buried under the rubble of the deadliest earthquake of the 20th century. The rescue team explains to their mother that freeing either child will almost certainly result in the death of the other. Forced to make the most difficult decision of her life, she finally chooses to save her son. Though left behind as dead, the little girl miraculously survives, unbeknownst to her brother and mother.','/3NOlToQwBfecoTXtYzQmxwM4ID7.jpg','2010-07-22',135,'Released','23 seconds, 32 years.','Aftershock',44560,2.9672,7.16,'6_QML6RdN0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27221,_binary '\0','/6a8j99krgLPq7z01rKzFgYRYxht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13937754',6.6,1238,'en','Christmas at the Golden Dragon','When Romy and Rick’s parents surprise them with the news that they will be closing the Chinese restaurant they have owned and operated for decades, the siblings each find themselves reevaluating their futures. Also impacted by the news are the landmark restaurant’s loyal patrons and staff, who have all come to depend on the restaurant over the holidays.','/yOARNu1KqgU6CathaT4PK1qYWGX.jpg','2022-11-13',84,'Released','Family, love, and Chinese fusion.','Christmas at the Golden Dragon',1028186,1.8388,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27222,_binary '\0','/tEyWHYvNh60MsQbPIuZf46rsWo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13938338',7.6,2257,'en','Woodlands Dark and Days Bewitched: A History of Folk Horror','An exploration of the cinematic history of the folk horror, from its beginnings in the UK in the late sixties; through its proliferation on British television in the seventies and its many manifestations, culturally specific, in other countries; to its resurgence in the last decade.','/hW1TFe8Q6W4p6hxFbWOTWvwoySg.jpg','2021-09-09',193,'Released',NULL,'Woodlands Dark and Days Bewitched: A History of Folk Horror',614637,2.4529,7.6,'IT3S-bJ_dOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27223,_binary '\0','/hH2IvdorIVeRDMs0ZDkefTiIKfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13940818',7.2,4151,'en','The Contestant','The incredible true story of a man who lived for 15 months trapped inside a small room, naked, starving and alone... and completely unaware that his life was being broadcast on national TV in Japan, to over 15 million viewers a week.','/p6jHYpie6VEW68mnxfHVRZo0Xm6.jpg','2023-09-08',91,'Released','The naked truth about the world\'s first reality star.','The Contestant',1156638,2.3097,6.937,'UG2Tdw6BEro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27224,_binary '\0','/jNfiuAib5YkHIyfdfqX9zolk8jQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13943546',7.2,1407,'en','If These Walls Could Sing','The untold story of the Abbey Road studio, all-star interviews and intimate access to the premises.','/pvyDU4uekUMtWlNXB5yugBtVjNH.jpg','2022-09-03',86,'Released','Some places are as incredible as they sound.','If These Walls Could Sing',926392,2.8096,6.5,'fnn9zEQbqI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27225,_binary '\0','/7iYxvYBF2lrN9zm89sHHmRBzSpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1394383',7,1287,'en','Blood Into Wine','Music fans know Maynard James Keenan as the frontman of such bands as Tool, A Perfect Circle, and Puscifer, but in this documentary filmmakers Christopher Pomerenke and Ryan Page offer a closer look at one of the prolific rocker\'s more unexpected hobbies -- winemaking. Along with his business partner Eric Glomski, Keenan has managed to transform an arid stretch of Arizona desert into a lush vineyard that yields some particularly tasty grapes. Through unguarded conversations with Keenan and Glomski, Pomerenke and Page discover just what got the pair interested in winemaking, and why they chose such a hostile natural environment to serve as the site of their winery.','/frbuHxu3vkoykAJvwDbjAuOSBZY.jpg','2010-02-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Blood Into Wine',37259,1.4669,7.1,'ZKkkWpj-mR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27226,_binary '\0','/jsKlrx3EfTYjbaxmJYWF2mSZIfK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13944546',5.7,1266,'te','Amma Deevena','The protagonist Lakshmamma (Aamani) is a villager. She is married to an irresponsible man, who indulges in drinking and lives life at his will. The couple has five children together. Lakshmamma\'s husband (Posani Krishnamurali) doesn\'t help her raise the children. A single lady like her takes the responsibility of the home and starts earning. She works as a daily wage laborer in a quarry, as a worker at a flour mill, and starts supporting the family. The family gets into deep financial stress as the head of the family doesn\'t provide for them. She still manages to pull the family together with her earnings.','/hPmBZufncQfeo7u8z6h3Ms36DBP.jpg','2021-07-30',129,'Released',NULL,'Amma Deevena',1045219,0.6759,0,'XCT6FAsMAQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27227,_binary '\0','/k56AppUZYXGcwX9q6f8qeinn6fV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1395025',5.3,8528,'hi','एजेंट विनोद','Agent Vinod sets out on a secret mission to find the reason behind the death of Rajan, his colleague. Terror strikes when he unfolds an even bigger conspiracy.','/2XGxhpxUPknapgYlVQ0cxH42R1B.jpg','2012-03-23',157,'Released',NULL,'Agent Vinod',85050,1.7062,5.493,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27228,_binary '\0','/nhJcQKY7wmvbdE3NmBpEoa4eblk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1395054',7.4,21617,'hi','Once Upon a Time in Mumbaai','A tale of two gangsters from the eras of past and present, whose lives enter parallel paths as they struggle to survive within Bombay\'s criminal underworld.','/qkPmQx9GMuwTDEuIUMoeN6DEqVA.jpg','2010-07-30',132,'Released','Where it all began...','Once Upon a Time in Mumbaai',42966,2.3099,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27229,_binary '\0','/906MJ0zgOOvkMyxwQvuFQODNm2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1395135',6.5,2543,'ja','オカルト','Koji Shiraishi interviews the survivors of an indiscriminate attack at a sightseeing resort and starts investigating the strange events that have been happening to them.','/2HW5dqv4Uo77trZ0jg9UqUI5hMi.jpg','2009-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Occult',118315,1.9751,6.7,'32W93wQOlHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27230,_binary '\0','/dTOQaHP4PjDXU2JwDF6UYqGqRT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13957560',6.8,64276,'en','Dumb Money','Vlogger Keith Gill sinks his life savings into GameStop stock and posts about it. When social media starts blowing up, so do his life and the lives of everyone following him. As a stock tip becomes a movement, everyone gets rich—until the billionaires fight back, and both sides find their worlds turned upside down.','/e9u7luSxFKOZgPTB9XHFnPArGdP.jpg','2023-09-15',105,'Released','When Wall Street rigged the game, he changed it.','Dumb Money',792293,14.9023,6.683,'_VxRoOZNaR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27231,_binary '\0','/7UjQ5bYDQMZzprL5fUuFZUgZQxc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396208',4.5,8155,'hi','Action Replayy','A young man tries to revive his parents\' wilting marriage by traveling to the 1970s when their romance was budding to help make it bloom: something more complex than he expects.','/8YzWja1cgzIaaKys6Ajk95kJxQY.jpg','2010-11-05',129,'Released','Rewind Your Life','Action Replayy',49679,2.3686,5.189,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27232,_binary '\0','/gtkROcxhItcEvGoRr0a12PWBLpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396218',6,113947,'en','Mr. Popper\'s Penguins','Tom Popper is a successful businessman who’s clueless when it comes to the really important things in life...until he inherits six “adorable” penguins, each with its own unique personality. Soon Tom’s rambunctious roommates turn his swank New York apartment into a snowy winter wonderland — and the rest of his world upside-down.','/jGwZ1QI5DaL7mHQ2ZsMV1p8xvPS.jpg','2011-06-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Popper\'s Penguins',58224,11.1196,5.977,'7Js0ADU4owQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27233,_binary '\0','/hVcctLJeBJzXsFJOkj1ePJs7789.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396219',5.3,2917,'en','Outcast','When Mary and her teenage son, Fergal, move to yet another new home, it soon becomes clear they live their lives on the run, hiding from someone or something, terrified of being found. Their hunter, Cathal, soon picks up the trail. Intent on tracking Mary and Fergal, he will go to any lengths to succeed in his quest, often using dark arts to aid him. Mary’s only defence is to use an ancient form of her own magic to protect her only son. When local residents begin to be brutally murdered by an unknown life force, the sense of fear escalates. Is Cathal the beast responsible for the killing? Or is it the beast that he is trying to destroy?','/8k58xQGJRoFa2FBIoF5l6vXF5pB.jpg','2010-12-10',98,'Released','Evil runs in the blood','Outcast',42917,1.9217,5,'IH5bbbn3vZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27234,_binary '\0','/dNGIPREgcOCj9ucPmOHV3d1lAg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396221',4.5,9158,'en','Passion Play','An angel under the thumb of a ruthless gangster is saved by a trumpet player down on his luck.','/wx0W9Iak86peVoZnH8bBGA98chA.jpg','2011-01-10',94,'Released','Love Is Stronger Than Death.','Passion Play',38753,3.4518,4.69,'T5pYbPytAKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27235,_binary '\0','/uzr5OCSv6DnRWRDwq9btxdUNMNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396226',7.3,18109,'it','Venuto al mondo','Full-throttle melodrama about an ill-starred romance set against the backdrop of the siege of Sarajevo. A mother brings her teenage son to Sarajevo, where his father died in the Bosnian conflict years ago.','/uQ0ERG8dy3kHVP8aVlDFv448Gc7.jpg','2012-09-13',127,'Released','A story of love. A story of war. A story of life.','Twice Born',121642,3.9038,7.3,'igih-qD76B0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27236,_binary '\0','/2S0Kk3cMPE2CX0vEJ6Fp5OjPZgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396227',7.1,5624,'en','The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia','Produced by Johnny Knoxville and Jeff Tremaine for MTV and Dickhouse Productions, The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia is a documentary about the renowned West Virginia outlaw Jesco White and his eccentric backwoods family. In addition to getting in trouble with the law, the Whites, who live deep within Appalachia, uphold a time-honored dancing style, even as they contend with poverty, drugs and other issues. Alternately humorous and sad, the movie is an unflinching look at life on the criminal margins of rural mountain culture.','/7EQQsuK1Hk1zcoBlNBKfU41aS39.jpg','2009-04-01',86,'Released',NULL,'The Wild and Wonderful Whites of West Virginia',49637,1.3782,6.7,'AQBiXDNVeSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27237,_binary '\0','/iwkWvcXcP8M4r9HLglhVEhgGyVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13964390',5.2,40646,'fr','Sous la Seine','In order to save Paris from an international bloodbath, a grieving scientist is forced to face her tragic past when a giant shark appears in the Seine.','/qZPLK5ktRKa3CL4sKRZtj8UlPYc.jpg','2024-06-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Under Paris',1001311,8.8419,5.921,'jnCefPQIH98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27238,_binary '\0','/uBgSDdFwHo3wrWtSTaLK5ehNV34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13964404',5.4,6377,'en','Horror in the High Desert','In July 2017, an experienced outdoor enthusiast vanished in Northern Nevada while on an outdoor excursion. After an extensive search, he was never located. On the three-year anniversary of his disappearance, friends and loved ones recall the events leading up to his vanishing, and for the first time, speak about the horrifying conclusion of his fate.','/s1D5ZGgbxVgQHw70CDwYZQbvaBT.jpg','2021-03-27',80,'Released','No one just disappears.','Horror in the High Desert',805682,1.8803,5.7,'D9hjeRE7b4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27239,_binary '\0','/3C01kAcKGR6FwsUUSOvJ8N82pqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13964560',4.8,12066,'en','The Astronaut','After returning from her first space mission, astronaut Sam Walker is placed under NASA’s care at a high security house for rehabilitation and medical testing. However, when disturbing occurrences begin happening around the property, she fears that something extraterrestrial has followed her back to Earth','/souvvkJHYhztC1UqZ8lEVUiJa3J.jpg','2025-09-26',90,'Released','She didn\'t come back to Earth alone.','The Astronaut',1086260,7.9085,6.125,'cF3gdVOT6gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27240,_binary '\0','/qVGpxnjrGlHaSTCqTQI6viBDSfp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396484',7.3,709763,'en','It','In a small town in Maine, seven children known as The Losers Club come face to face with life problems, bullies and a monster that takes the shape of a clown called Pennywise.','/9E2y5Q7WlCVNEhP5GiVTjhEhx1o.jpg','2017-09-06',135,'Released','You\'ll float too.','It',346364,19.5696,7.241,'FnCdOQsX5kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27241,_binary '\0','/oXoww4LqozTF2MOJNyZnc9ioIP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396523',5.3,4573,'en','Revenge of the Green Dragons','A true immigrant story set against the vibrant backdrop of Flushing, N.Y. in the 1980s and 1990s.','/vnM4uANJz8cDLvBZUVFFqfLsIty.jpg','2014-10-31',95,'Released','The American Dream Isn\'t Free','Revenge of the Green Dragons',286709,3.0395,5.2,'3c-YiIC5Bz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27242,_binary '\0','/xMYwaQar9bJCeUinEugNEHgqMrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1396557',7.2,5278,'en','Winnebago Man','Jack Rebney is the most famous man you\'ve never heard of - after cursing his way through a Winnebago sales video, Rebney\'s outrageously funny outtakes became an underground sensation and made him an internet superstar. Filmmaker Ben Steinbauer journeys to the top of a mountain to find the recluse who unwittingly became the \"Winnebago Man\".','/q9XEQk8KY7cBxzC5xE2NCGMBhsv.jpg','2010-07-09',85,'Released','Will you do me a kindness?','Winnebago Man',42918,1.7632,6.7,'v1O9frM947U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27243,_binary '\0','/wsMuEaqX5Sks209lnjWEChCdv3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13968674',5.8,10870,'en','Fingernails','Anna and Ryan have found true love together. It\'s been proven by a controversial test. There\'s just one problem: Anna still isn\'t sure. Then she meets Amir.','/q04g3un61aeBoheQEso7enM28AF.jpg','2023-10-27',113,'Released','Love is a test. Results may vary.','Fingernails',790459,4.837,5.956,'mY-by4qPQpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27244,_binary '\0','/aFFfD8crUD7YIT2IWCYLggmrpW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13971916',7.2,1537,'fa','بی همه چیز','A remote village has not had a previous boom for years. Residents have either been forced to migrate or are in poverty and misery, but the village has a new guest. But the village has a new...','/tQ4AwiMazKzNRhQHMh3hlyk7G7P.jpg','2021-02-02',119,'Released',NULL,'Majority',799894,0.9032,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27245,_binary '\0','/ynhivSPoG1Wh3zqT76YZ1R3VHz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397219',6.7,1267,'ja','ルパン三世VS名探偵コナン','When a wealthy woman and her son die in a hunting accident, it\'s up to Conan Edogawa to solve the case. Meanwhile, Lupin the Third is after the Queen Crown, owned by the Vesparand royal family. When these two legendary characters meet, who will win the day?! Followed by “Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan: The Movie” (2013).','/fPYveL8hkrymMzrUgTt9uIm652Q.jpg','2009-03-27',104,'Released','Is yet another case closed or will there be a deadly cliffhanger?','Lupin the Third vs. Detective Conan',46033,4.0666,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27246,_binary '\0','/13yzNdCAbGxbENVc4sUEmJzi19p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397265',6.6,1849,'en','Enid','A poignant biography of one of the most successful and wildly-read writers of the 20th century. Her stories enthralled children everywhere but her personal struggles often proved too much.','/lDlgMqpWrZ6w3MAFi3I1JPubuu9.jpg','2009-11-16',82,'Released','The revealing untold story of Enid Blyton.','Enid',43711,1.4397,6.4,'QLrwyLVMvDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27247,_binary '\0','/5M92Rtz6r01HLrN0TMrU8jCbyVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397280',6.2,339265,'en','Taken 2','In Istanbul, retired CIA operative Bryan Mills and his wife are taken hostage by the father of a kidnapper Mills killed while rescuing his daughter.','/yzAlcuJhpnxRPjaj7AHBRbNPQCJ.jpg','2012-09-27',91,'Released','First they took his daughter. Now they\'re coming for him.','Taken 2',82675,16.1883,6.372,'otHUjWVgIig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27248,_binary '\0','/y2ixhIz6zXaxsBg8jPK62AZ8KQM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397492',7.2,2110,'hi','वैल डन अब्बा','Armaan tells his employer why he was away for three months looking for a husband for his daughter.','/21bMe3DvLiVRJ1Y3uCl2St2Z59B.jpg','2010-09-16',144,'Released',NULL,'Well Done Abba',38302,0.9488,6.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27249,_binary '\0','/3DnR786TXSqt3Zzt5XIrcBj4jOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397497',4.2,1386,'en','Carny','When a traveling carnival comes to a rural Nebraska town, the caged attraction everyone is talking about is the alleged Jersey Devil. When the beast escapes, tearing the citizens to shreds, local sheriff Sam Atlas steps up to form a tracking team. But the carnivorous fugitive is only one of Sam’s problems. The local pastor, enraged by the death of his son at the hands of the beast, has plans for igniting his own brand of hellfire and revenge.','/nviPsOALdIw49zafBLxODoqeQIy.jpg','2009-04-24',88,'Released','The carnival is anything but fun.','Carny',36737,1.3483,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27250,_binary '\0','/c53R0h6c4Rwb30tGbX2gNUpeJkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397498',6.1,4147,'zh','孔子','In 500 B.C., during Chinas famed \'Spring and Autumn Period\', Kong Ze (Confucius), a commoner reverred for his outstanding wisdom, is made Minister of Law in the ancient Kingdom of Lu. Under his inspired leadership, Lu ascends to new heights but becomes a target of conquest for the warlike nation of Qi. Threatened with annihilation by their powerful neighbour, a desperate people turn to their greatest teacher to lead their most powerful army. When Confucius delivers a stunning victory against all odds, a jealous aristocracy sets out to destroy him, but they should never under-estimate a remarkable man whose wisdom is more powerful than the sword.','/rCRMOp9LvgSdpvJm1xvjFGKGfNY.jpg','2010-02-11',125,'Released',NULL,'Confucius',34182,3.1388,5.957,'1BWVLwsC71o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27251,_binary '\0','/pbt6hLb5HYG8RnSMVDCWzxKz9wW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397511',7.5,1312,'en','RiP!: A Remix Manifesto','RiP!: A Remix Manifesto is a 2008 open source documentary film about the \"the changing concept of copyright\" directed by Brett Gaylor.','/sxADk5N2jbCKiUStUCZleTyrOD5.jpg','2008-11-20',86,'Released','Use your illusion...','RiP!: A Remix Manifesto',23996,1.3066,7.1,'jzuwKquulAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27252,_binary '\0','/fZvAroq9Vb5hhyKT6TxsjxJW7nm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1397514',5.7,122612,'en','Journey 2: The Mysterious Island','Sean Anderson partners with his mom\'s boyfriend on a mission to find his grandfather, who is thought to be missing on a mythical island.','/uFm2vnp9LhHx5MNo1Ego6O3vUhl.jpg','2012-01-19',94,'Released','Believe the impossible. Discover the incredible.','Journey 2: The Mysterious Island',72545,13.2595,6.156,'IVX7OidrkXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27253,_binary '\0','/wgbch1xH2OezrMKnol8Ze9UghPT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13975458',4.5,3321,'ja','CUBE 一度入ったら、最後','Six complete strangers with widely varying personalities are involuntarily placed in an endless maze of interlocking cube-shaped rooms containing deadly traps.','/3uTnw1XahydeVkwFzY5xq5aFUh7.jpg','2021-10-22',108,'Released','Once you\'re in, It\'s over.','Cube',792678,3.0745,5.4,'XumXdNoZKlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27254,_binary '\0','/2Jp2RIwJ3Dt7vamkTt7llVJ7uY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13978306',4.2,14948,'en','Brazen','Mystery writer Grace Miller has killer instincts when it comes to motive - and she\'ll need every bit of expertise to help solve her sister\'s murder.','/7e4n1GfC9iky9VQzH3cDQz9wYpO.jpg','2022-01-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Brazen',916740,3.2675,4.8,'WJPSSL2lSjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27255,_binary '\0','/6fKEw0I2FTD5FLOQ5q7L1tqf876.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13978520',4.3,4738,'en','Spy Kids: Armageddon','When the children of the world’s greatest secret agents unwittingly help a powerful game developer unleash a computer virus that gives him control of all technology, they must become spies themselves to save their parents and the world.','/vd8YdaH7dzeIMGTNwQinlSiA1gV.jpg','2023-09-22',94,'Released','Meet the next generation.','Spy Kids: Armageddon',790493,9.9925,5.9,'TuiRw0v3bAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27256,_binary '\0','/7at7nFWi1FDS2wGDZberXunAfZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13978658',7,6866,'ml','സല്യൂട്ട്','Committed and fiery, Sub Inspector Aravind Karunakaran is obliged to be part of an investigation where an innocent man Murali is deliberately being set up for the murder of a middle-aged couple. Fearing the consequences of revealing that they had deliberately framed Murali, the team refuses to investigate it further and let go of the man that they had arrested. Will they find the one responsible?','/1rTESlmFExGj4YViSVo9QYIqr9x.jpg','2022-03-17',145,'Released','LIES - TRUTH - JUSTICE','Salute',803666,1.0928,7.152,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27257,_binary '\0','/8r9RoGfwGmn1pn0G3sbvHHemSWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1398426',7.8,236177,'en','Straight Outta Compton','In 1987, five young men, using brutally honest rhymes and hardcore beats, put their frustration and anger about life in the most dangerous place in America into the most powerful weapon they had: their music. Taking us back to where it all began, Straight Outta Compton tells the true story of how these cultural rebels—armed only with their lyrics, swagger, bravado and raw talent—stood up to the authorities that meant to keep them down and formed the world’s most dangerous group, N.W.A. And as they spoke the truth that no one had before and exposed life in the hood, their voice ignited a social revolution that is still reverberating today.','/1CiLJx8Xtv3TbbFj6k7BboSmKgC.jpg','2015-08-11',147,'Released','The world\'s most dangerous times created the world\'s most dangerous group.','Straight Outta Compton',277216,10.3278,7.771,'-F5WcFPDzko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27258,_binary '\0','/4JiVd7xqClEKTKM9NKm2HkqfUBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1398428',4.7,8089,'en','YellowBrickRoad','In the Fall of 1940, the entire population of Friar, New Hampshire walked together up a winding mountain trail and into the wilderness. Without warning, they left behind everything: their homes, their clothes, and their money. The only clue where they went was a single word etched into stone near the forest’s edge: YELLOWBRICKROAD.','/oZRnAPskc9fhVetTm7XaVrUxs7p.jpg','2010-01-23',100,'Released','They went looking for evil in the forest but the forest found evil in them','YellowBrickRoad',47386,2.7449,4.7,'yzJgKbk50JQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27259,_binary '\0','/9x7YIgH4eKOxn5BbLmwdQA7X7ZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13984924',6.5,12940,'en','Fauci','Exclusive access into the career and life of the public servant who has advised seven U.S. presidents beginning with the AIDS pandemic in the 1980s and through SARS, Ebola and COVID-19.','/vxBNDSHsDGIdfI8IRaKUg5woeRd.jpg','2021-09-10',104,'Released','From the frontlines of one pandemic to the headlines of another.','Fauci',825422,1.3096,3.2,'SwAF6sYb94s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27260,_binary '\0','/on1p1AdcfxmlyHhVXoycWt75D8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13989030',5.3,12973,'en','The Royal Treatment','Isabella runs her own salon and isn’t afraid to speak her mind, while Prince Thomas runs his own country and is about to marry for duty rather than love. When Izzy and her fellow stylists get the opportunity of a lifetime to do the hair for the royal wedding, she and Prince Thomas learn that taking control of their own destiny requires following their hearts.','/mYAv0YUoXJzLxIdEirOken8Quwf.jpg','2022-01-20',96,'Released',NULL,'The Royal Treatment',790142,3.6516,6.7,'KWxJXZ3S3-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27261,_binary '\0','/ysKT1QImEotgoLx9pmaNSuCiwoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13989310',3.6,1280,'hi','कोई जाने ना','A heartbroken writer struggling with writer`s block goes to a quiet hill station where he finds love again but uncovers a copycat serial killer who has mysteriously come alive and is killing everyone around him.','/eDf9CzhjMf0xh8Z4ZNM7tMiVsgQ.jpg','2021-04-02',141,'Released',NULL,'Koi Jaane Na',794008,1.3131,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27262,_binary '\0','/znWvzSIsJN2YVquhpKfd8y9ctsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt13990280',5.7,1787,'ml','ഭ്രമം','A pianist pretends to be blind for inspiration, witnesses a murder. He suddenly finds himself in a blind spot with the victim\'s wife, the murderer. During this ordeal, he loses his eyesight for real. Will his girlfriend believe him?','/isdPM4fgP10qv1VzF0HBo6Zv0I3.jpg','2021-10-07',152,'Released',NULL,'Bhramam',803391,0.9416,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27263,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1399053',4.9,1874,'en','Monster: The Josef Fritzl Story','Interviews with family members, doctors, and victims of 73-year-old Josef Fritzl, who held his daughter captive in a basement for 24 years and fathered seven children with her.','/nHduqxMjZrfZ2wJofh9u4SZXANC.jpg','2010-08-16',48,'Released',NULL,'Monster: The Josef Fritzl Story',354870,1.4737,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27264,_binary '\0','/h3js4rulxzKMOokM2oO5Kr0mBZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1399103',6.2,460465,'en','Transformers: Dark of the Moon','The Autobots continue to work for NEST, now no longer in secret. But after discovering a strange artifact during a mission in Chernobyl, it becomes apparent to Optimus Prime that the United States government has been less than forthright with them.','/28YlCLrFhONteYSs9hKjD1Km0Cj.jpg','2011-06-28',154,'Released','Be afraid of the dark.','Transformers: Dark of the Moon',38356,5.4873,6.243,'XeUtb5L9iNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27265,_binary '\0','/A2xq61UUzcPeXw8NNQHco1P17a1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1399655',6.1,1243,'de','Jud Süß - Film ohne Gewissen','This intricate historical drama tells the story of actor Ferdinand Marian (Tobias Moretti), who is ordered by Nazi propagandist Joseph Goebbels to star in the 1940 anti-Semitic film Jew Suss. Despite his cooperation, Ferdinand\'s actions have unexpected costs. Ferdinand\'s Jewish wife, Anna (Martina Gedeck), is sent to a concentration camp, and as World War II intensifies, he rebels against the Nazis, leading to the destruction of his career.','/t0BFriqdnKoHga3TM9LofydEzKA.jpg','2010-09-23',114,'Released',NULL,'Jew Suss: Rise and Fall',61623,1.5122,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27266,_binary '\0','/wW4dZWEfUIXWVKhKsPFBokndJbI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1399683',7.1,158879,'en','Winter\'s Bone','After discovering her father put their house up for his bail bond and then disappeared, 17-year-old Ree Dolly must confront the local criminal underworld and the harsh Ozark wilderness in order to to track down her father and save her family.','/a0qhPkNlxLfsf5B2jFyI1Pp04XV.jpg','2010-06-11',101,'Released','Talking just causes witnesses.','Winter\'s Bone',39013,9.7082,6.771,'bE_X2pDRXyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27267,_binary '\0','/reb1sPedHAYcgLvNZ9VzvtpUfs8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1399952',5,2999,'ru','Обитаемый остров: Схватка','Maxim Kammerer fights for his love and freedom. He leads a rebel movement challenging the five greedy rulers. One of the rulers, Strannik, knows how dangerous Maxim can be. He makes up his mind to stop the young man at any cost. The last close fight will decide everything.','/mZuRkOM3t714W1MTJ4K6uqSIqvA.jpg','2009-04-23',99,'Released',NULL,'The Inhabited Island 2: Rebellion',18122,1.8685,5.2,'I7ozIcDqRxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27268,_binary '\0','/aIkG2V4UXrfkxMdJZmq30xO0QQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14001894',5.3,9027,'en','Secret Headquarters','While hanging out after school, Charlie and his friends discover the headquarters of the world’s most powerful superhero hidden beneath his home. When villains attack, they must team up to defend the headquarters and save the world.','/v6mvk0YC4o0PUdq82IbNRjIEEv3.jpg','2022-08-12',104,'Released','When the secret is out, the adventure begins.','Secret Headquarters',791155,6.7831,6.31,'OjIz3knndzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27269,_binary '\0','/6JOfXifVv1FGhnI30otCTIGvgln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14002046',7.5,15830,'ml','ഭീഷ്‍മ പര്‍വ്വം','Set in the backdrop of 1980s, Micheal helms his influential family in Kochi, inspiring fear and respect through his unnerving past. When a few younger members in the household feel his power over their lives too are aggravating, they join hands with foes to clamp down on him. And the story follows what’s in store for them.','/7vtSFcwagN0O5psdS69xPRaLYkS.jpg','2022-03-03',144,'Released',NULL,'Bheeshma Parvam',804309,1.5337,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27270,_binary '\0','/mm9IWTUAN7euXzIf3V1NUSwRAoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1400508',7.4,2225,'ar','فيلم ثقافى','Three sexually-frustrated friends are determined to watch a porno video but have no private place, no VCR, and no TV, so they go on a misadventure in which their group constantly increases, taking on more and more sexually-frustrated people and falling into one mishap after another, all because of the restrictions of society.','/17pQ1n3cPA1xXkEJHoRDkPjVvDY.jpg','2000-10-04',120,'Released',NULL,'A Cultural Film',193457,0.9243,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27271,_binary '\0','/u1g8nX8ewksMEqIfHp1h5eEhuVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1400515',3.5,1940,'en','Don\'t Let Him In','Two couples spend a weekend in the country, only to cross paths with a brutal serial killer. As the body count rises, suspicion spirals into paranoia, climaxing in a terrifying battle for survival.','/qMmComAwVq1h7aeOPscfPSVEIqB.jpg','2011-06-12',76,'Released','What if you invited a serial killer on holiday?','Don\'t Let Him In',71626,1.8422,4.023,'PjEkD8W-F1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27272,_binary '\0','/l5Q3LcVlac6TpGsM0Zdvu9dhhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14005338',6.1,2967,'de','Der Nachname','The Berger and Böttcher families come to Dorothea\'s finca on Lanzarote for a weekend trip. The mood is tense and escalates as various mysteries are revealed.','/lY64iy8nzuUq8O8PPN2x5sm5QLD.jpg','2022-10-20',87,'Released','Family holidays aren\'t holidays.','Family Affairs',899792,1.744,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27273,_binary '\0','/abXyMAzeL3aBoAuVcqIChuwq3DR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401113',6.5,11330,'en','Dante\'s Inferno: An Animated Epic','Dante journeys through the nine circles of Hell -- limbo, lust, gluttony, greed, anger, heresy, violence, fraud and treachery -- in search of his true love, Beatrice. An animated version of the video game of the same name.','/nAEGEYTjbli3JoFgyrLn3blxDqi.jpg','2010-02-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Dante\'s Inferno: An Animated Epic',31967,3.7932,6.993,'2A9Jwjl29Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27274,_binary '\0','/igFwEFRiEr0CzkQUNTcGYLxTpOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401143',6.6,35686,'fi','Rare Exports','Young Pietari lives with his reindeer-herding father in arctic Finland. On the eve of Christmas, a nearby excavation makes a frightening discovery and an evil Santa Claus is unleashed…','/jzaweEESl54ejxo3EE5uNL8lgTn.jpg','2010-12-03',83,'Released','This Christmas everyone will believe in Santa Claus','Rare Exports: A Christmas Tale',48395,4.4009,6.212,'9RQlikX4vvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27275,_binary '\0','/f2d419xzKDbtVpToJorTxlKMvgQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401152',6.8,277570,'en','Unknown','A man awakens from a coma, only to discover that someone has taken on his identity and that no one, (not even his wife), believes him. With the help of a young woman, he sets out to prove who he is.','/aXBQD515okXQZmYA89ntXMvSJSd.jpg','2011-02-16',113,'Released','Take back your life.','Unknown',48138,9.0819,6.698,'vSXUgkCjdBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27276,_binary '\0','/9zogGSFH5hFvLa07TXQfyO2zXdE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401236',4.3,2046,'en','The Fields','Tells the story of a young boy and his family who are terrorized by an unseen presence.','/u3qgZb6qYtIvABWCQG4GpZ0rEPJ.jpg','2011-09-23',100,'Released','Be More Afraid Of The Living, Than The Dead...','The Fields',88537,1.4108,4.2,'1eMonk1dq0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27277,_binary '\0','/73WRlXDUkpFtrB3rFWKnUqxHHDq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14013772',4.2,5482,'en','Elevator Game','Socially awkward teenager Ryan discovers that the night his sister disappeared, she had played \'The Elevator Game\' — a ritual conducted in an elevator in which players attempt to travel to another dimension using a set of rules found online. Ignoring warnings, he resolves to follow and find her.','/a4Zb13jow8RqJkYFgCUSdmzJCWq.jpg','2023-07-12',94,'Released','Some doors should never be opened.','Elevator Game',1015303,6.0635,4.9,'aABUVWzH8YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27278,_binary '\0','/cJ0rlqYZNW2HaUoEWcFRMqr7XER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14014068',5.6,4574,'en','Book of Love','Henry, an English writer who has written a new book that has become a failure in the U.K, gets notified that the dull book has been highly trending over in Mexico. Little does he know that Maria, a Spanish translator, turned the book into an erotic novel. Henry and Maria then swerve around Mexico to do a book tour and go through a wind of events.','/aU4cUkmn8CqnBYlYgE2sHlZ2AGy.jpg','2022-01-06',106,'Released','Some things can get lust in translation!','Book of Love',892835,3.9753,5.6,'7pJ394c64UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27279,_binary '\0','/2XcFwmVh4WPpcdbOJRc2GuFMskJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401607',4.8,1461,'en','The Con Artist','An ex-con finds his plan to go straight foiled by a loan shark who manipulates his target into taking on one last heist.','/chb9BGRb8Uegw2xJng8BDghXM0P.jpg','2010-11-25',83,'Released','His every crime is a work of art.','The Con Artist',61107,2.0354,4.4,'M9NdnqYsTaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27280,_binary '\0','/90qROu6vfd22iPuvb9gw8vSqRzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401621',6.4,1872,'en','A Boy Called Po','A recently widowed, now single father struggles to raise his sixth-grade son with autism. The pressure of his job and coping with the loss of his wife proves to push him nearly to the breaking point.','/ticaJamKmSTf1roAD1IFznVJRa6.jpg','2016-04-23',95,'Released','Don\'t be afraid, daddy.','A Boy Called Po',418272,2.1962,6.9,'CMF8LepeXSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27281,_binary '\0','/VYWo22N9BV49LqPdDEl9ZVoDzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401636',6.3,3613,'fr','Switch','In Montreal, the unemployed fashion designer Sophie Malaterre is shown a website, switch.com, where it is possible to switch houses with a stranger for vacation. Sophie seeks an apartment in Paris nearby the Eiffel Tower that belongs to Bénédicte Serteaux and they change apartments. Sophie arrives in Paris on Saturday morning. The next morning, policemen break in the apartment and arrest Sophie while she is having a bath. Detective Damien Forgeat interrogates Sophie believing that she is Bénédicte and she learns that a beheaded body was found in her room and all evidence of her life has been deleted.','/nOroxNJftPkGLjordf8IcYkjjZb.jpg','2011-06-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Switch',69225,1.6849,5.9,'xSUPlekMvfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27282,_binary '\0','/4F8sjrFTIpGdHrjugjAYaeU74e5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401643',6.8,3187,'fr','Vénus noire','The true story of Saartje Baartman, a black South African worker who moves to London with her master in the early 19th century. Although she dreams of being an artist, once in Europe she is exploited as a sideshow attraction due to her large buttocks and genitalia.','/rPyysXgqFwqsju9KrBWCI9skQSC.jpg','2010-10-27',159,'Released',NULL,'Black Venus',56405,2.1547,6.543,'mmDAx3e7KyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27283,_binary '\0','/bE70yUDG8qYiouOiJchl0JNz0FB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1401656',7.1,3004,'ja','僕の初恋をキミに捧ぐ','Takuma knows that his life is shorter than the others and he feels that his demise is getting near. He chose to stay away from the girl that he loves so that she can easily move on. What he didn\'t know is that he is under-estimating her.','/pI0qz8FTWvQ3NhgfrvblrXIOQeD.jpg','2009-10-24',122,'Released',NULL,'I Give My First Love to You',40700,1.9772,7.4,'w_7fP3T8Xbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27284,_binary '\0','/g0C5FVNPFjus0yMfACgBDK9O9tZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14016830',4.1,1726,'en','Rite of the Shaman','A high school boy must follow in his shaman grandfather\'s footsteps to become the beacon of light he was meant to be.','/a6fLpNp7Ahi6WWlhf8wkVnxAoIK.jpg','2022-05-27',69,'Released',NULL,'Rite of the Shaman',980271,0.9258,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27285,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14022026',6.9,1376,'hi','आ भी जा ओ पिया','When a city-educated Kaushal owns his own nursery in a picturesque Jharkhand village meets Kalpana, a city girl belonging to an army family is on a research tour with her mother and driver. Feelings develop between the youngsters but practical circumstances force them to rethink if they are actually made for each other.','/maxUWRJCBXYOGkPMf8sxvKd1mRt.jpg','2022-09-07',140,'Released',NULL,'Aa Bhi Ja O Piya',892529,1.1503,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27286,_binary '\0','/icAAqHhVXuSQlKNvUfL257AFTwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1402488',5.8,51493,'en','Happy Feet Two','Mumble the penguin has a problem: his son Erik, who is reluctant to dance, encounters the Mighty Sven — a penguin who can fly! Things get worse for Mumble when the world is shaken by powerful forces, causing him to bring together the penguin nations and their allies to set things right.','/2gWiQ4mn85jcXtREVePlVViupeV.jpg','2011-11-17',99,'Released','Every step counts.','Happy Feet Two',65759,10.5805,6.205,'ZjJnKjkwEKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27287,_binary '\0','/uNxgZ4IlBi1N1cj2sODAxeB0w8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14025788',6.1,5778,'it','Il Divin Codino','A chronicle biopic of the 22-year career of soccer star Roberto Baggio, including depictions of his difficult debut as a player, his deep rifts with some of his coaches, his triumph over injuries and personal discovery of Buddism.','/i0NOqrnE4FhXrk9cHm6DQeRo1Zm.jpg','2021-05-26',91,'Released',NULL,'Baggio: The Divine Ponytail',694254,1.901,6.4,'5pZ9k64LG1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27288,_binary '\0','/goLnRyCODNDzDzidfZfLQdfAnoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14028056',6.4,1256,'hu','Együtt kezdtük','A coming of age story, in flashback, of a group of high school students graduating in 2011. Each will take a different path from here on.','/ys988r4YOkGowjtiJmmMvH3zZK4.jpg','2022-08-04',101,'Released','Wine. Balaton. Love.','We Started Together',999110,1.0153,4.2,'mSQq_lf7-aQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27289,_binary '\0','/go6qbLUfddglCpDMGKnVDzPrxKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14028890',7.2,1997,'uk','Стоп-Земля','Hanging out with friends, smoking a lot, spinning bottles and kissing, making mistakes, playing, refusing to accept, dreaming with open eyes - life as a teenager can be overwhelmingly beautiful and difficult at the same time. In her debut, the Ukrainian director composes a deeply emotional and multi-layered portrait of a generation whilst seamlessly flowing between the fictional and the documental.','/dpYeho6AOQw45OnAgtvj3ppvurp.jpg','2022-01-20',122,'Released','If you don\'t dare, you\'ll never know.','Stop-Zemlia',794785,2.0072,6.2,'7V5WWypPl38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27290,_binary '\0','/6zrHO8VCbeVPP0qu8q1JHHAxtxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403047',6.5,2210,'ro','Aurora','A taciturn Romanian divorcee acquires a hunting rifle and initiates a killing spree.','/edmR325BbyaP0uMURbDYXejGvnr.jpg','2011-03-11',186,'Released',NULL,'Aurora',81527,1.7457,5.7,'LyYcJgUZ7bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27291,_binary '\0','/sy5VlRQt45boZanpB4NVLteXsi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14030682',7.7,1312,'en','Who We Are: A Chronicle of Racism in America','Jeffery Robinson\'s talk on the history of U.S. anti-Black racism, with archival footage and interviews.','/6c1jaEvORhMGTHpKSLik60yyrgu.jpg','2022-01-14',117,'Released','The enemy is us.','Who We Are: A Chronicle of Racism in America',803737,1.7915,7.5,'IGsGRSgZbXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27292,_binary '\0','/lVJVLe4EZ1hOKPUWgsZVebCnr0C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14030816',5.4,16017,'en','Baghead','Following the death of her estranged father, Iris learns she has inherited a run-down, centuries-old pub. She travels to Berlin to identify her father’s body and meet with The Solicitor to discuss the estate. Little does she know, when the deed is signed she will become inextricably tied to an unspeakable entity that resides in the pub’s basement – Baghead – a shape-shifting creature that can transform into the dead.','/lbOyeiiRYAE6Nm2e7xiNAAaRwZB.jpg','2023-12-28',95,'Released','Talk to the dead. Pay the price.','Baghead',845783,5.5762,6.5,'QhQGPKPNMfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27293,_binary '\0','/prut5bJSKTFDVMIsCfcV4iDe2pp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403085',7,1652,'ru','Похороните меня за плинтусом','A small child is trapped in a tug-of-war battle between his frivolous, but loving mother and an emotionally abusive neurotic grandmother, who wants to \"shelter\" her beloved grandson at all cost.','/4hNzmZVlh5a8bUH4kpVXAVRkzQO.jpg','2009-03-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Bury Me Behind the Baseboard',19875,1.0829,6.4,'CbkOAqcQJWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27294,_binary '\0','/sclEvlduoGf5io1oLj5UsQLOdKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403130',6.8,8970,'cn','十月圍城','In 1905, revolutionist Sun Yat-sen came to Hong Kong to meet revolutionary comrades. The Qing government sent a group of killers to murder him. Ordinary citizens from all walks of life joined together, blocking the streets and fighting off the assassins to keep Sun Yat-sen safe.','/hEqqA5pSm62IcJ4YJAuMByme3zr.jpg','2009-12-18',139,'Released','To save a nations future, they must protect one man from its past.','Bodyguards and Assassins',30596,3.6025,6.797,'Kf1l4KapO6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27295,_binary '\0','/lhkCyU9C9DbVGwiEmI61CeSVVrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14031338',7.1,3374,'en','Language Lessons','For his 45th birthday, wealthy Californian Adam receives a surprise gift from his choreographer partner: 100 weekly Spanish lessons with Cariño, a vivacious expat who teaches virtually from her home in Costa Rica. Adam\'s unconvinced at first; a self-described “creature-of-habit”, he’s unsure about where or how this new element will fit into his carefully-structured routine.','/DLHXdi6B1JeYQ9YElNfdSIYO35.jpg','2021-09-10',91,'Released','Get lost in translation.','Language Lessons',795530,2.3937,6.8,'rL-U20BUK4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27296,_binary '\0','/wn7wEntUjbh1abZNDsXT8bA1ioF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403144',5.9,3675,'it','Cosa voglio di più','Anna is an accountant for an important insurance firm and lives with her longterm lover Alessio - a man who longs for a stable longterm relationship with children, home, etc. Anna, feeling as though the fire has fizzled in that relationship takes up with co-worker Domenico and the two begin a passionate affair.','/7yxCUZBxIVOG8CEZ8O9zW4u9Fju.jpg','2010-04-30',121,'Released',NULL,'Come Undone',36956,3.3333,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27297,_binary '\0','/1naAvovOZDe21QOvdJ4e6GnFqcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403177',6.9,55892,'en','Hesher','A young boy has lost his mother and is losing touch with his father and the world around him. Then he meets Hesher who manages to make his life even more chaotic.','/dD03azf3h1hUHVzVkkqJs96Kkay.jpg','2010-01-22',106,'Released','Sometimes life gives you the finger and sometimes it gives you...','Hesher',44835,4.865,6.798,'jkKjafEIebw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27298,_binary '\0','/9jmlny93dxtXn4KnjGlj8sUsL20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403214',7,10962,'de','Paradies: Liebe','On the beaches of Kenya they’re known as \"Sugar Mamas\" —European women who seek out African boys selling love to earn a living. Teresa, a 50-year-old Austrian and mother of a daughter entering puberty, travels to this vacation paradise, moving from beach to beach.','/nah6G8dNvjL6L8k3wumcR3DH3KC.jpg','2012-04-27',121,'Released',NULL,'Paradise: Love',103686,4.4957,6.691,'Hc8nSACPuSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27299,_binary '\0','/2gomCP8CWsiwz0p4jw8nvDGvBVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14032336',5.9,1976,'ta','சிவகுமாரின் சபதம்','A young man from a weaving family vows to restore it to its past glory by taking on a textile magnate.','/e9Kqo1eZnkdW3LQHVDJhTDRYdF.jpg','2021-09-30',139,'Released',NULL,'Sivakumarin Sabadham',868535,0.9243,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27300,_binary '\0','/qzn6zDqClBZbP8Y89O6mkg1p91P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403241',5.3,11180,'en','Wolves','The coming-of-age story of Cayden Richards. Forced to hit the road after the murder of his parents, Cayden wanders lost without purpose... Until he meets a certifiable lunatic named Wild Joe who sets him on a path to the ominous town of Lupine Ridge to hunt down the truths of his history. But in the end, who\'s really hunting whom?','/2Q5sTH90MSvguFlb9UfcpeA2P5a.jpg','2014-08-28',90,'Released','Unleash the beast','Wolves',290555,3.8993,5.9,'-5-SAvUljlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27301,_binary '\0','/cPq0qrpFFbhYPGXBuVGH0DFk9sb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14032696',7.1,4406,'cn','智齒','Veteran detective Cham works with rookie cop Will to hunt down the city\'s serial killer. The investigation leads them to a lair littered with dismembered female limbs, and an ex-con who killed Cham\'s wife and child years ago...','/7Hh2w1ei26DTJ3JWmW8qcGQUI1n.jpg','2021-11-18',118,'Released',NULL,'Limbo',591222,2.1921,7.21,'8a4HCl12cNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27302,_binary '\0','/wQ60FXOHnVimJo6Bpdk6VU0qaP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14033342',4.7,3024,'en','The Quest for Tom Sawyer\'s Gold','Agatha Armstrong and her trusty sidekick Mrs. Mac were once the world’s most daring adventurers. But when her son Ant came along, everything quickly changed and her devil-may-care ways took a backseat to being over-protective and terrified of anything that posed a risk to her family.','/zceLrHeYOgJHw1tw6MUi15N2NUz.jpg','2023-06-22',88,'Released','The enigma of the lost treasure.','The Quest for Tom Sawyer\'s Gold',966576,2.5755,5.4,'EqjWKr8c-Bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27303,_binary '\0','/wP28rWRjcD1994uSLXAg0MZmUK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14033502',6.5,12110,'ro','Babardeala cu bucluc sau porno balamuc','Emi, a school teacher, finds her career and reputation under threat after a personal sex tape is leaked on the Internet. Forced to meet the parents demanding her dismissal, Emi refuses to surrender to their pressure.','/zUTkjET8VUwvbvSHtn0Lou7xwyZ.jpg','2021-04-29',106,'Released','Sketch for a Popular Film','Bad Luck Banging or Loony Porn',790496,0.5584,6.4,'RNKKwXbqkjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27304,_binary '\0','/c8KlUfYC5442nkG1Zyaygfui5Q9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14034294',5.3,5364,'it','Svaniti nella notte','A father, immersed in a difficult divorce process, embarks on a dangerous mission when his children disappear from their isolated country house.','/f83MF5KVFRs5zuFCPlb6UQV1Yo9.jpg','2024-07-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Vanished into the Night',1039868,3.5395,5.557,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27305,_binary '\0','/bUXt2gb9fMH6U1JYapZjLFvrIZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14034614',6.7,4352,'it','Nostalgia','Felice returns to his native Rione Sanità in Naples to look after his dying mother, having lived abroad for the last forty years. Here he discovers that his old friend Oreste has become a notorious crimeboss.','/t0xCqVcXlq1rPpsF6M4kzpzKypR.jpg','2022-05-25',117,'Released',NULL,'Nostalgia',541724,3.1288,6.8,'9WkA62wrmpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27306,_binary '\0','/mTOUk5M0LXIATbJDZkeH4xzA2hV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14034966',7.5,11532,'ja','偶然と想像','An unexpected love triangle, a seduction trap, and a random encounter are the three episodes, told in three movements to depict three female characters and trace the trajectories between their choices and regrets.','/z3xqVWOsetW6pSEgx1uiqXfzRet.jpg','2021-04-11',121,'Released',NULL,'Wheel of Fortune and Fantasy',795811,5.1341,7.197,'KySaA2EUgKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27307,_binary '\0','/z51wokzgouCkd4ri8YidruThw7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14035108',6.2,1334,'ko','인트로덕션','Youngho is summoned by his father, who is a doctor. Finding him busy with his patients, one of whom is a famous actor, Youngho has to wait. When his girlfriend Juwon moves to Berlin for her studies, Youngho shows up in the city to surprise her. Through her mother, Juwon has found accommodation at the home of an artist whose beauty intimidates her. Some time later, Youngho goes to lunch with his mother who wants to introduce him to a colleague – it is the same man Youngho met at his father’s clinic. Youngho asks his friend Jeongsoo to accompany him, and after lunch they go to the beach. Youngho falls asleep, and dreams of Juwon. When he wakes up, he braves the considerable cold and goes swimming, while Jeongsoo watches.','/a9aTkREV7ZbwMzgHaknjqWZUtUG.jpg','2021-05-27',66,'Released',NULL,'Introduction',795797,1.5058,6.4,'LuRFqrGzCWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27308,_binary '\0','/iVls8472HFJNBLAek0afJmDI1ve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14035154',6.8,2506,'ka','რას ვხედავთ, როდესაც ცას ვუყურებთ?','In the Georgian riverside town of Kutaisi, summertime romance and World Cup fever are in the air. After a pair of chance encounters, pharmacist Lisa and soccer player Giorgi find their plans for a date undone when they both awaken magically transformed with no way to recognize each other.','/dQlQWIejF1NKbRDYzFDqGAb6wN5.jpg','2021-11-12',150,'Released',NULL,'What Do We See When We Look at the Sky?',795815,1.7899,6.686,'5b0Kul0092U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27309,_binary '\0','/9JGOHuIy5MBpda2qZkjR6vOQAJV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14035242',7,2457,'es','Una película de policías','This documentary walks the line between fact and fiction, delving into corruption in the Mexican police through the experiences of two officers.','/hlq6tv7sFAA7LtNu7Rk8Fw6Kfu1.jpg','2021-10-28',107,'Released',NULL,'A Cop Movie',701524,1.9472,7.215,'b_m3jC4hGn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27310,_binary '\0','/dtnVDcsXzpkFeij8J6IkNEQI2hY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14035292',6.9,3870,'en','kid 90','As a teenager in the \'90s, Soleil Moon Frye carried a video camera everywhere she went. She documented hundreds of hours of footage and then locked it away for over 20 years.','/5yK7ySo3E3w1JDjqq9WNk9oIwsw.jpg','2021-03-12',71,'Released','The celebrities you thought you knew. The videos you\'ve never seen.','kid 90',795859,2.5197,6.948,'0kbgWzN0OWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27311,_binary '\0','/mkAIX4Jzax9mNWMafZfUjNmanbA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14036276',4.3,1247,'en','Control','A young mother awakens in a mysterious cell and is forced to harness her telekinetic abilities in order to escape and save her daughter.','/oxi29Eg7JymhqV5QkSrMviUb3e9.jpg','2022-09-23',89,'Released','Comply to survive.','Control',986088,2.3936,5.725,'GvUYfZ4RY0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27312,_binary '\0','/iVytJHJmbAQ5wnPCbYYAt4xZqR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14037272',4.4,1982,'en','The System','When a young soldier, newly returned from war, gets caught up in a drug bust, he is recruited by the authorities to go undercover in a notoriously dangerous prison in order to figure out what is really going on.','/uj6BjK7OXSCDhg0AjC2duL34vwQ.jpg','2022-10-28',97,'Released','Behind bars there is no mercy.','The System',1024627,4.395,7.356,'eiwOVqVFoXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27313,_binary '\0','/dPnqwG0gjibFfiHe01dvNlEcczH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403862',3.4,3205,'en','Sinbad: The Fifth Voyage','When the Sultan\'s first born is taken by an evil sorcerer, Sinbad is tasked with traveling to a desert of magic and creatures to save her.','/pJyu3IXK8eljAlbEpExJ7PQWioX.jpg','2014-02-07',89,'Released','Discover the Legend','Sinbad: The Fifth Voyage',54415,1.8499,3.9,'BH-Ok3y76Cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27314,_binary '\0','/5dwlH8Krm2bsuc2Pubw2cBb03g5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403865',7.6,379331,'en','True Grit','Following the murder of her father by a hired hand, a 14-year-old farm girl sets out to capture the killer. To aid her, she hires the toughest U.S. Marshal she can find—a man with \'true grit\'—Reuben J. \'Rooster\' Cogburn.','/tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg','2010-12-22',110,'Released','Punishment comes one way or another.','True Grit',44264,11.0374,7.304,'Q5fEgKj9QNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27315,_binary '\0','/kVRL80QbvvTUVfU6IN0oymgkWwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14039046',6.6,1494,'en','Don\'t Go Breaking My Heart','Miranda runs a boot camp for the recently broken hearted. She begins to form a connection with new client Ben who is also a reporter, investigating whether her boot camp is a fad or a phenomenon.','/gUf9RT7QPSbOFEupPzBxpv5knz6.jpg','2021-03-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Go Breaking My Heart',793436,2.0279,7.2,'hcJ8jViyiA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27316,_binary '\0','/7GZh9ORj1V3IzQkWK8zfHluNolP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14039078',6.6,1447,'en','Right in Front of Me','Carly gets a second chance at romance with her college crush but isn’t sure how to impress him until her new friend Nick starts giving her advice. Soon she learns who the right man for her really is.','/vzn6d9w3PqHLiTYXsfqlB4KQtsB.jpg','2021-04-17',84,'Released','Say yes... to your detiny.','Right in Front of Me',796000,1.9999,6.7,'hNs6UNG1frA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27317,_binary '\0','/1FTw6A7FF45b40uzk0cPVlNbKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14039086',5.1,2786,'en','Run & Gun','After leaving a life of crime and violence, Ray is a reformed good guy, enjoying a quiet family life in the ‘burbs. But when his past is discovered, Ray is blackmailed into one last job to collect a mysterious package. After a deadly double-cross, he finds himself wounded and on the run from ruthless assassins who will stop at nothing to get what he has. Now, with the lives of his loved ones hanging in the balance and danger at every turn, Ray’s only hope is to draw upon his violent past to survive.','/h0AKLEk4XCajdav1hSHIR71cU66.jpg','2022-01-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Run & Gun',910596,3.793,5.52,'b_3-oXMePZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27318,_binary '\0','/r6aqhlmJmu8Dv5E7QYEruaEXKYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14039582',7.5,78030,'ja','ドライブ・マイ・カー','Yusuke Kafuku, a stage actor and director, still unable, after two years, to cope with the loss of his beloved wife, accepts to direct Uncle Vanya at a theater festival in Hiroshima. There he meets Misaki, an introverted young woman, appointed to drive his car. In between rides, secrets from the past and heartfelt confessions will be unveiled.','/znXps7wPyYq8UDCfeyO2vfEIeRS.jpg','2021-08-18',179,'Released','Go on living.','Drive My Car',758866,8.0304,7.4,'6BPKPb_RTwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27319,_binary '\0','/D3i5IJlEpmoZdwnM828b5y9STz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14039678',6.6,1340,'te','నాట్యం','In the ancient dance village Natyam, Sitara attempts to resurrect her Guru\'s forgotten masterpiece choreography and discovers the true power and purpose of Indian Classical Dance. To dance is to tell a story that can change our world.','/eWXh5VQOMflOJI5uz5DJlJHr4Po.jpg','2021-10-22',136,'Released',NULL,'Natyam',887021,1.0504,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27320,_binary '\0','/kbxk09QgBJfJjnp66ey3JCEshKf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403981',7.1,166201,'en','Remember Me','Still reeling from a heartbreaking family event and his parents\' subsequent divorce, Tyler Hawkins discovers a fresh lease on life when he meets Ally Craig, a gregarious beauty who witnessed her mother\'s death. But as the couple draws closer, the fallout from their separate tragedies jeopardizes their love.','/j7umuMiLCHvWT7wYhFKJOTFSokF.jpg','2010-03-11',113,'Released','Live in the moments.','Remember Me',23169,11.5201,7.096,'iFFas72-dTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27321,_binary '\0','/o2nqs7C2azKRMgM14gCX8BqIXEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1403988',5,12889,'en','The Romantics','Alliances are tested when seven college pals reunite to watch two of their own say “I do” at a seaside wedding. But the maid of honor and the groom share a passionate history, and the bride isn’t the only one who’s wondering if it’s all in the past.','/pKXGDEgtqbXZBvwcZiZeWydqIEH.jpg','2010-09-10',97,'Released',NULL,'The Romantics',41556,2.7158,4.9,'0bQakUseu4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27322,_binary '\0','/rXQwZuQe8GZhSSuAPFVVKZsyPvh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14040054',6.4,1341,'de','Sisi & Ich','After an elaborate application process, Empress Elisabeth of Austria hires Countess Irma as her new lady-in-waiting and takes her to her summer residence on Corfu. As the two women become closer there, this soon leads to tensions back in Vienna.','/6J61mawQOGhYXXuKGuZrsiqC7fV.jpg','2023-03-30',132,'Released',NULL,'Sisi & I',913521,3.2344,6.2,'aU-PCCbTPo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27323,_binary '\0','/w955RLvmXvUtsc4KhBmGtuEmHWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1404082',6.4,1902,'fr','Tellement proches',NULL,'/2mR6ItN0WEGnpPmM3xFcgHkTypQ.jpg','2009-06-17',102,'Released',NULL,'So Happy Together',19268,1.2702,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27324,_binary '\0','/h4peDpoepEmErFwBeoIE4yZ1pvJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14041896',5.7,9434,'en','The Parenting','Boyfriends Josh and Rohan plan a weekend getaway to introduce their parents, only to discover that their rental is home to an ancient demon.','/5lMu14IMuHo0hKYCwCIogt7IioX.jpg','2025-03-12',94,'Released','Meeting the parents... it\'s a necessary evil.','The Parenting',850920,7.2078,6.1,'fn-hc0yf3MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27325,_binary '\0','/vA9N4eI19uBGE5HOhHxl9kJr5Ph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14042066',4.9,21583,'hi','दोबारा','In the 1990s, during a wild thunderstorm night, 12-year-old Anay dies in a road accident shortly after he sees his next-door neighbor committing a crime. Twenty-five years later, in a strange turn of events, on an identical stormy night, Antara finds herself in front of a TV set through which she attempts to save Anay’s life but her good deed causes a disturbing chain of unexpected consequences.','/l0Ayozn8O69UEjDvXnT5noIgUJp.jpg','2022-08-19',135,'Released','25 years. One unsolved mystery. And countless unanswered questions.','Dobaaraa',796207,1.4144,5.2,'AeTsMFbmK14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27326,_binary '\0','/3boseSuFfjTazSrPAe9G6pSDvnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14043966',5.2,8073,'en','Terror on the Prairie','A pioneering family fights back against a gang of vicious outlaws that is terrorizing them on their newly-built farm on the plains of Montana.','/xfwHIY865AYJoFgBAYoAJLvPLO9.jpg','2022-09-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Terror on the Prairie',884315,4.4913,6.1,'AcKVWp9mK7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27327,_binary '\0','/imAihjOnerraFPxAeKOlugUu1YE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14044924',6.5,1937,'ko','하이파이브','In the dead of night, a body donated for organ transplants mysteriously disintegrates into ashes. Soon after, five recipients, given a heart, corneas, lungs, liver, and kidneys, begin to develop supernatural powers. A teenage girl gains immense strength, a hipster manipulates electromagnetic waves, a novelist summons powerful gusts, a factory manager can heal others, and a woman discovers a strange, still-unidentified ability. Together, they form a reluctant but heroic team known as \"HI-FIVE.\" But they aren\'t the only ones transformed. A cult leader who received the donor’s pancreas gains the terrifying power to drain life energy and sets his sights on stealing the abilities of HI-FIVE to achieve godlike domination.','/xhSn3NkcBpqzUx9NOYa6CdSwwXZ.jpg','2025-05-30',119,'Released','Superpowers transplanted.','Hi-Five',793058,3.8313,7.134,'QLv_ARaBAH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27328,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14045080',6.5,2219,'kn','ಕೆ.ಟಿ.ಎಮ್','Karthik seeks love through several attempts. Will he find his destined partner or face continued failure?','/vtmcypgpEgkFeWyH51zwpCbpg6W.jpg','2024-02-16',149,'Released','Rise in love...','KTM',1243194,0.8638,0,'CoJpYFQ1o4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27329,_binary '\0','/iaZqpmhYs4KxNx6M89CesZiMdCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14045614',2.6,1780,'en','Croc!','Deep in the English countryside, Lisa and Charlie prepare for their wedding at a Tudor mansion. But an angry crocodile lies in wait, determined to ruin their big day.','/u4Xq3M0NMAimB95tgGLblTeVThn.jpg','2022-08-25',84,'Released','It\'s not safe to swim anywhere.','Croc!',901418,1.3466,2.8,'qzjiXeBV_6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27330,_binary '\0','/j6dwzbuxdV96SB6EUY592xDlRlJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14050808',6.7,1690,'ro','Întregalde','The suspense story follows three humanitarians whose mission in a remote village called Întregalde, in the Apuseni Mountains, in a remote area of Transylvania to offer the inhabitants various goods. Apart from a few quarrels and conflicts between the group members, everything seems to be going well for Maria and Dan. But soon after they stumble upon a disoriented local and try to help him, things go wrong.','/eCzi76IWzvoxpieTT8QSuHfzJid.jpg','2021-08-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Întregalde',838150,1.4071,6.2,'9icB1lfkAFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27331,_binary '\0','/rPTpNBAAf8IXS1bfOmPKKI4cl9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14051976',4.3,1220,'en','Camp Hideout','Noah is a troubled teen who nearly gets caught stealing a top-secret gadget from some big city thugs. After barely escaping, he decides to hide out at a summer camp that\'s run by the eccentric Falco and counselors Jake and Selena. As Noah tries to blend in with the rest of the rowdy campers, his crooked partners show up to steal the classified item, now in his possession.','/iRqstvN60G1JytNcqerdvOvEA21.jpg','2023-09-15',100,'Released','You can\'t hide when you\'re in plain sight','Camp Hideout',917594,4.2399,5.5,'q6zrGu9f48U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27332,_binary '\0','/fKyKSmvxwMpT0qe6B0m2vbyzAOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1405365',6.6,35311,'en','Celeste & Jesse Forever','Celeste and Jesse met in high school and got married young. They laugh at the same jokes and finish each other’s sentences. They are forever linked in their friends’ minds as the perfect couple – she, a high-powered businesswoman and budding novelist; he, a free spirit who keeps things from getting boring. Their only problem is that they have decided to get divorced. Can their perfect relationship withstand this minor setback?','/5Cr8kW7DjZEORU8jI32bqyHSGKW.jpg','2012-08-03',91,'Released','A loved story.','Celeste & Jesse Forever',84184,4.2607,6.383,'Faru8Lv-t8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27333,_binary '\0','/49HBB4LzWYwfMFMTkralkfJ5niz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1405412',4.7,4668,'en','Hardwired','After a tragic accident Luke Gibson is left with critical injuries and complete amnesia. A new technological breakthrough from the Hexx Corporation - a Psi-Comp Implant that\'s hardwired into Luke\'s brain - saves his life, but Luke soon finds out that this new technology comes with a price and that the Hexx Corporation harbors sinister plans for the new device.','/q93fo24fFxruqiHG2VybLengsmb.jpg','2009-11-03',94,'Released','They stole his past, now he\'s taking back his future.','Hardwired',24051,2.5446,5.129,'oCYumJVUsMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27334,_binary '\0','/y2TaBwQAdNmEd9aIecpbKayyMj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1405500',6.3,8617,'en','For Colored Girls','A film about existence from the perspective of 20 nameless black females. Each of the women portray one of the characters represented in the collection of twenty poems, revealing different issues that impact women in general and women of color in particular.','/iEGTE4dRhckbfX8KVGZFxystznL.jpg','2010-11-05',134,'Released','Many voices. One poem.','For Colored Girls',44944,2.9692,6.762,'SCAKyNDogBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27335,_binary '\0','/ccNJlQRL1n2MEGdffzNkTPmvaSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14056466',4.9,13964,'hi','युध्रा','Yudhra, who is struggling with anger issues, is assigned an undercover mission to bring down a powerful drug syndicate headed by Firoz and his son Shafiq. Yudhra accepts the responsibility as he wants to exact revenge against Firoz for his parents\'s death.','/cwmVHD41mGDQyPyCAsR8x6aMGc2.jpg','2024-09-20',142,'Released',NULL,'Yudhra',797223,1.2628,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27336,_binary '\0','/hCh81a298NGDzffXM2MP02Ypg16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14056670',6.7,2735,'ml','പാപ്പൻ','Abraham Mathew Mathan aka Paappan, a voluntarily retired S.P. from the Crime Branch who is unwillingly reinstated to the force for investigating a long-standing murder case.','/dVJEzunN825WhZLCSJfNA09SOKf.jpg','2022-07-29',162,'Released',NULL,'Paappan',845343,1.2819,5.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27337,_binary '\0','/cOF7XiobQU4TC2tKDPXJ8d2nULP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14057604',4.5,2087,'en','King of Killers','Garan is a part of a group of international hitmen who are contracted to take out the most dangerous killer in the world, only to find out that they\'re the ones being hunted.','/x5AreOAgkTBzUSL58o4jsYortw2.jpg','2023-09-01',91,'Released','In a game of life and death, murder is king.','King of Killers',1024127,4.5618,6.3,'_JXRDQw7EMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27338,_binary '\0','/f1xIzW2v2uK07JfONdNObTlMu5f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1405809',6.9,3941,'fr','Lourdes','In order to escape her isolation, wheelchair-bound Christine makes a life changing journey to Lourdes, the iconic site of pilgrimage in the Pyrenees Mountains.','/6HhppIyMPutZyOFTdFVdXdwCXde.jpg','2009-09-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Lourdes',41123,1.643,6.6,'4Dw0blEi9YA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27339,_binary '\0','/mApegAM7DCZvsKVfWAtavubycMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1405810',7.2,14165,'it','Mine vaganti','Tommaso is the youngest son of the Cantones, a large, traditional southern Italian family operating a pasta-making business since the 1960s. On a trip home from Rome, where he studies literature and lives with his boyfriend, Tommaso decides to tell his parents the truth about himself. But when he is finally ready to come out in front of the entire family, his older brother Antonio ruins his plans.','/gYSXvD0sB2MRXF5YreSWtdcW4Jv.jpg','2010-03-12',108,'Released','The only thing more complicated than love is family.','Loose Cannons',40794,3.1425,7.3,'XoHtIKBZUbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27340,_binary '\0','/sidmL6DT8j0TewIh4fzyrp1pa8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14058484',6.8,5930,'en','Biggie: I Got a Story to Tell','Christopher Wallace, AKA The Notorious B.I.G., remains one of Hip-Hop’s icons, renowned for his distinctive flow and autobiographical lyrics. This documentary celebrates his life via rare behind-the-scenes footage and the testimonies of his closest friends and family.','/wwMZiuoucmdVxZmj4HjYSLwAFJh.jpg','2021-03-01',97,'Released','Every legend has an origin story.','Biggie: I Got a Story to Tell',797309,2.2625,7.1,'fRj2NxkM84U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27341,_binary '\0','/95qIAVoUphzzJoitD6l3rjuO1Wz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14058850',6.5,1357,'en','A Tail of Love','When Bella discovers that funding for her dog rescue centre is discontinued, she turns to JR, a soldier who quickly becomes attached to one of her rescues, a German Shepard named, Indie.','/eoJX65JIFNOx6O1ZUKgzFJHJI95.jpg','2022-04-23',84,'Released',NULL,'A Tail of Love',877826,2.2837,6.674,'CH16kP0Bam4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27342,_binary '\0','/tULzz524DuvMxnAuQJpo8dk0EvJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14060094',4.9,29196,'en','Blacklight','Travis Block is a shadowy Government agent who specializes in removing operatives whose covers have been exposed. He then has to uncover a deadly conspiracy within his own ranks that reaches the highest echelons of power.','/bv9dy8mnwftdY2j6gG39gCfSFpV.jpg','2022-02-10',104,'Released','They\'re gonna need more men.','Blacklight',823625,8.2973,6.1,'d4K9Rzy2_DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27343,_binary '\0','/o0JpLYCadyUCR4KwxN7hrzFE968.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14060232',5.3,12957,'en','Infinite Storm','One woman\'s journey for self-discovery and turns into a harrowing tale of survival.','/4B34NKfHCFVHriYfKhbsunHYl4x.jpg','2022-03-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Infinite Storm',811631,8.6796,5.7,'zRaUIPMq-u0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27344,_binary '\0','/gZy0wniMXz7yRQwFxu1oJNlNs2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14061002',4.4,1751,'en','City Rush 3','Special Agent Ace teams up with Scarlett to take down the clown.','/iN4PCRAXehnA2q1I8KSuMxkx2ub.jpg','2023-01-09',55,'Released','Fight to the end.','City Rush 3',1144051,1.3343,5.8,'Zo-tQ1XYLLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27345,_binary '\0','/hqwib4EiffClOxXb5EwhTHYkS8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14061008',6,3756,'en','Last Train to Christmas','When successful 80s nightclub manager Tony Towers boards a magical train at Christmas, he discovers that each carriage harbours a different stage of his life and the actions he takes in one carriage directly affect his life in the next. Can Tony change his life – and the lives of the people he loves – for the better, or will he just make things worse?','/xkVUORoeRbRnAq5IkN4Pwq45R07.jpg','2021-12-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Last Train to Christmas',887609,1.9358,5.563,'_FRoPUn5tOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27346,_binary '\0','/bbeFONuIPTCHhdgkz3qnG4A0r8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14064760',8.4,3779,'lt','Pietinia Kronikas','Rimants is more interested in playing rugby, listening to music and dealing on the black market than studying for school, but when he falls in love with Monika, his faith in love and the future is tested.','/2peyJP4L5SdvDslCWwKP4KLUiGZ.jpg','2025-01-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Southern Chronicles',1252855,1.9485,7.077,'-thCZuQHOyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27347,_binary '\0','/uYeO6MkVSTG2K8g4yXskTf3unLC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407049',4.8,11006,'en','Altitude','After a mysterious malfunction sends their small plane climbing out of control, a rookie pilot and her four teenage friends find themselves trapped in a deadly showdown with a supernatural force.','/1MhCLk4TzLAQmj7SfUWO7X2iWQP.jpg','2010-10-10',90,'Released','Fear is in the air.','Altitude',44678,2.3612,4.7,'663uUyZ9U6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27348,_binary '\0','/1act330tE1QFQ5Dv9RRCHJG31Be.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407052',7.6,4891,'es','Arrugas','At an elder-care facility, a geriatric con artist tries to prevent his new friend with early Alzheimer\'s symptoms from being transferred to the \'lost causes\' floor.','/9aamZ9pJpWnPjYvQz68dsX15YwZ.jpg','2011-09-19',89,'Released',NULL,'Wrinkles',85444,2.5773,7.609,'kNfNx_2aAEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27349,_binary '\0','/gvNBgLoVxEGZrzjyudnTY0tdDlz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407061',6,16860,'en','Just Wright','Physical therapist Leslie Wright lands the dream job of working with basketball superstar Scott McKnight, helping him recover from a career-threatening injury. All goes well and soon Leslie finds herself falling in love with him. Just as their friendship deepens, however, Scott focuses his attention back on his tenuous relationship with his ex-fiancé Morgan, Leslie\'s gorgeous godsister, who would love to be the basketball player\'s trophy wife.','/qx1SumoTQYtB9VyxQ7irlfE2e7L.jpg','2010-05-14',101,'Released','In this game every shot counts.','Just Wright',38093,4.589,6.6,'ZHYSeSAXQf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27350,_binary '\0','/v9H1i8oN2c9PPn51MTjdEEi9QSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407065',4.9,7212,'en','The Moth Diaries','Rebecca is a young girl who, haunted by her father’s suicide, enrolls in an elite boarding school for girls. Before long, her friendship with the popular Lucy is shattered by the arrival of a dark and mysterious new student named Ernessa, whom Rebecca suspects may be responsible for the rising body count at the school.','/oVoUBnhef1EPTcg7gIOoDUI3Rhu.jpg','2011-09-06',82,'Released','Every girl has her secrets.','The Moth Diaries',91549,2.5594,5.3,'Da6JTlaHock','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27351,_binary '\0','/fJJRx2J27xpMeeGoXlQbYuJoMiF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407084',5.6,12997,'en','Twelve','A young drug dealer watches as his high-rolling life is dismantled in the wake of his cousin\'s murder, which sees his best friend arrested for the crime.','/cGcoACE6AQQWekvHMr4TVd5KOpH.jpg','2010-07-30',93,'Released','No one needs anything here. It\'s all about want.','Twelve',40720,2.7842,5.7,'NcDW-eZOz1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27352,_binary '\0','/4OYj5KmMJcUfigADtnCpD2wLfOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14071150',5.4,1483,'hi','Flight','The movie follows the journey of Ranveer Malhotra, who against all the odds, has to face deadly obstacles on a plane in order to survive.','/cTidclJOxLIwqmV4zzMSs8goTu1.jpg','2021-04-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Flight',813360,1.2321,10,'i37xLxNM9pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27353,_binary '\0','/4dcx4odNyL7IQ8c6vb6oYkjk9rg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14077516',6.3,3777,'en','Shirley','Shirley Chisholm makes a trailblazing run for the 1972 Democratic presidential nomination after becoming the first Black woman elected to Congress.','/ooo4D4kyZyFee5aiNfwZ43oKOkc.jpg','2024-03-15',117,'Released','Fearless. Fierce. First.','Shirley',798612,2.3254,6.6,'hjBeKNHIdMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27354,_binary '\0','/7P8MrCJfAeKrzbfrv5AEU1tvJfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14077696',7.1,4139,'es','Maixabel','In the year 2000, Maixabel Lasa’s husband, Juan Maria Jauregi, was killed by ETA. Eleven years later, she receives an incredible request: one of the men who killed Juan wants to meet with her in the Nanclares de la Oca prison in Araba (Spain), where he is serving his sentence after breaking ties with the terrorist group. Despite her reservations and her immense pain, Maixabel Lasa agrees to meet face to face with those who ended the life of the person who had been her companion since she was 16 years old. ‘Everyone deserves a second chance’, she said, when asked why she was willing to confront the man who killed her husband.','/7lOcGma9G2yak5qB6ITwg3j0PDm.jpg','2021-09-24',115,'Released',NULL,'Maixabel',814312,1.5735,7,'GbLSbRIofbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27355,_binary '\0','/1l3MCpPtmLMuEG9sS8XB7TW1mrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14079218',7.6,1689,'en','Arsène Wenger: Invincible','Framed against the backdrop of Arsenal’s historic “Invincible” season of 2003-04, the first and only occasion a team has gone an entire Premier League campaign without defeat, the film sees Wenger reflect candidly on his revolutionary era at Arsenal and the emotional and personal turmoil that surrounded his controversial exit after 22 years.','/8cORB7DDbLC1x42tPpw66z9dMC7.jpg','2021-11-11',95,'Released','The definitive story in his own words.','Arsène Wenger: Invincible',885277,1.5441,7.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27356,_binary '\0','/l1C0dtWshyoIdEeUbNQyX2B9GUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407927',7.5,3361,'en','180° South','The film follows adventurer Jeff Johnson as he retraces the epic 1968 journey of his heroes Yvon Chouinard and Doug Tompkins to Patagonia.','/jLvxcvpEbQ1bRETJZ3NlKpjQuLC.jpg','2010-02-10',86,'Released','Conquerors of the Useless','180° South',39333,2.0243,7.2,'NK3TOHLFL50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27357,_binary '\0','/lRCAcwJeh93YHO3ghFBDf0Pj3w3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14079374',7.7,35099,'en','14 Peaks: Nothing Is Impossible','In 2019, Nepalese mountain climber Nirmal “Nims” Purja set out to do the unthinkable by climbing the world’s fourteen highest summits in less than seven months. (The previous record was eight years). He called the effort “Project Possible 14/7” and saw it as a way to inspire others to strive for greater heights in any pursuit. The film follows his team as they seek to defy naysayers and push the limits of human endurance.','/8YS9oRn9rcAyBhYELFbGKk1TpFs.jpg','2021-11-12',101,'Released',NULL,'14 Peaks: Nothing Is Impossible',890825,3.8939,7.3,'8QH5hBOoz08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27358,_binary '\0','/gPZESeurSjhN1wYQqSvDc5ZBtqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1407972',6.6,6431,'cn','維多利亞壹號','A woman will go to whatever lengths necessary to obtain her dream home with a view of the sea. This includes driving down the property value and decreasing the occupancy rate by killing her potential neighbors.','/edY2IRaCGEKuJstuLLJ9MQNAYKX.jpg','2010-04-25',96,'Released','In a cut-throat property market, she\'d kill for a harbour view.','Dream Home',49706,2.2713,6.4,'zNmWzGFRfH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27359,_binary '\0','/npDrIM6ZbuD7nUxI7ZzNBxs4IRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1408101',7.7,512598,'en','Star Trek Into Darkness','When the crew of the Enterprise is called back home, they find an unstoppable force of terror from within their own organization has detonated the fleet and everything it stands for, leaving our world in a state of crisis. With a personal score to settle, Captain Kirk leads a manhunt to a war-zone world to capture a one man weapon of mass destruction. As our heroes are propelled into an epic chess game of life and death, love will be challenged, friendships will be torn apart, and sacrifices must be made for the only family Kirk has left: his crew.','/Aim3kVNh1MPIxPEFeJrl9e9Uf1a.jpg','2013-05-05',132,'Released','Beyond the darkness, lies greatness.','Star Trek Into Darkness',54138,16.205,7.321,'4pFjsiN2SRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27360,_binary '\0','/b7FwWsTgJ1lDcwvjnqu4uNqFdCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1408253',6.2,130523,'en','Ride Along','For the past two years, high-school security guard Ben has been trying to show decorated APD detective James that he\'s more than just a video-game junkie who\'s unworthy of James\' sister, Angela. When Ben finally gets accepted into the academy, he thinks he\'s earned the seasoned policeman\'s respect and asks for his blessing to marry Angela. Knowing that a ride along will demonstrate if Ben has what it takes to take care of his sister, James invites him on a shift designed to scare the hell out of the trainee. But when the wild night leads them to the most notorious criminal in the city, James will find that his new partner\'s rapid-fire mouth is just as dangerous as the bullets speeding at it.','/qrt65VVaP5DEEBZgB5XYctA82Qv.jpg','2014-01-07',99,'Released','Propose to this cop\'s sister? Rookie mistake.','Ride Along',168530,9.5596,6.262,'SD4cQwr7n5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27361,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14087490',7.4,1252,'en','Super Heroes The Movie','After a bad breakup, Wonderful Woman and Superbman, must work together with the super crew to prevent world domination by an invincible super villain from the 5th dimension named Bob. Shot in 1998, this superhero parody stars Lisa Guerrero as Wonderful Woman, Ric Borelli as Superbman and Kevin Glikmann as Bob. Siskel and Ebert would have said, it\'s so campy the marshmallows cook themselves.','/homwymbPU1R4lde7iX8TtjiAIS4.jpg','2021-02-02',80,'Released','Before the Justice League their was the Super Crew','Super Heroes The Movie',801939,1.1612,9,'U5L7cBHcp8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27362,_binary '\0','/otfoeC96neoOdA4HqsX06OWuzE9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14088510',4.8,41175,'en','Tarot','When a group of friends recklessly violate the sacred rule of Tarot readings, they unknowingly unleash an unspeakable evil trapped within the cursed cards. One by one, they come face to face with fate and end up in a race against death.','/gAEUXC37vl1SnM7PXsHTF23I2vq.jpg','2024-05-01',92,'Released','Your fate is in the cards.','Tarot',719221,9.6866,6.3,'XNTEjJm4WXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27363,_binary '\0','/fX1yYFplwxXRJh76wW85adiXJ8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1408972',7,4844,'es','Plan B','After his girlfriend Laura leaves him for another man, Bruno plans to come between the new lovers. But his plan takes an unexpected turn, causing Bruno to question his own sexuality.','/jde6YzOow74aNq1VNIJ9z03TXxE.jpg','2010-01-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Plan B',44282,2.359,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27364,_binary '\0','/nrgvVmc9XrKfXFaXvXtbpjecyqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1409004',5.7,6897,'en','Bloomington','A former child actress attends college in search of independence and ends up becoming romantically involved with a female professor. Their relationship thrives until an opportunity to return to acting forces her to make life-altering decisions.','/vCHFXTpoDiQNwKB66ulnxOraQAt.jpg','2010-06-23',83,'Released',NULL,'Bloomington',51736,3.4477,6.534,'eBR4YwpzCQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27365,_binary '\0','/5AhpUb8CAP0jZ4Wrn7AsRUYjZxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1409024',6.8,415872,'en','Men in Black 3','Agents J and K are back...in time. J has seen some inexplicable things in his 15 years with the Men in Black, but nothing, not even aliens, perplexes him as much as his wry, reticent partner. But when K\'s life and the fate of the planet are put at stake, Agent J will have to travel back in time to put things right. J discovers that there are secrets to the universe that K never told him - secrets that will reveal themselves as he teams up with the young Agent K to save his partner, the agency, and the future of humankind.','/90DdoEStzeObs96fsYf4GG544iN.jpg','2012-05-23',106,'Released','Back in time.','Men in Black 3',41154,15.8897,6.548,'IyaFEBI_L24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27366,_binary '\0','/6NStPepJGzAzJH6bsA8ytbFY1K6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14090476',8.9,3145,'mr','सरसेनापती हंबीरराव','Based on the Maratha warrior Hansaji Mohite who was later given the title of Sarnobat Hambirrao, the film portrays his life as the Commander in Chief of Chatrapati Shivaji Maharaj\'s army.','/kFQP73QmjEojppYzywWreK6jEYb.jpg','2022-05-26',158,'Released',NULL,'Sarsenapati Hambirrao',980167,0.7323,5,'r2MjcRjnll0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27367,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14091152',7.4,2305,'kn','Dollu','Bhadra, a dollu kunitha artist, is faced with the challenge of keeping his artistic tradition alive in his village.','/iQ2RHv5pyPcxNsbaeZcaNg8xlse.jpg','2021-11-20',98,'Released',NULL,'Dollu',897677,2.3147,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27368,_binary '\0','/lrE4Oed7CEDfYL61twc4Pe7kPsB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14091818',6.7,7274,'hi','Ajeeb Daastaans','An anthology of four stories that explore the surprising ways in which unexpected catalysts inflame the uncomfortable emotions simmering under fractured relationships.','/5KHjF8H2bqvQdmvkmeAlFjKXkmB.jpg','2021-04-16',142,'Released',NULL,'Ajeeb Daastaans',802403,1.7429,6.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27369,_binary '\0','/upoaYa4aVhGE3ByouVV5WpdBwto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14097180',6.8,6640,'en','Somewhere in Queens','Leo and Angela Russo live a simple life in Queens, surrounded by their overbearing Italian-American family. When their son finds success on his high school basketball team, Leo tears the family apart trying to make it happen.','/zXr6AziPii0NFpbTANNpLrOPxRP.jpg','2023-04-21',106,'Released',NULL,'Somewhere in Queens',829774,3.5623,6.3,'T_YDDN66Q1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27370,_binary '\0','/pk5OlCei3eXKf6U5k8QNbFEb6Eo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14097206',6.9,8291,'en','The Unlikely Pilgrimage of Harold Fry','Harold Fry is an unremarkable man who has made mistakes with all the important things: being a husband, a father and a friend. And now, well into his 60s, he is content to fade quietly into the background of life. Until, one day – Harold learns his old friend Queenie is dying. Harold leaves home, walking to his post office to send her a letter. And out of the blue, Harold decides to keep walking, all the way to her hospice, 450 miles away.','/pmP1Z6qKYCTLZH2JKqxltwAZHSY.jpg','2023-04-27',108,'Released','Hope is a journey.','The Unlikely Pilgrimage of Harold Fry',844409,4.1066,6.641,'v8MO1asqdcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27371,_binary '\0','/htsppUWAyhZajRlT4iF5MRp6iJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14097376',7.1,2495,'te','క్లైమాక్స్','Vijay Modi, a flamboyant billionaire. He lives a luxurious lifestyle surrounded by beautiful women and enjoys every bit to the core. Despite having it all, he wants to fulfill his three desires in life - to earn popularity, make a movie and become a successful politician. Proceedings turn interesting towards the latter part of the promo where cops enter into the scene and what unfolds next forms the crux of the plot.','/l2xR8AHcGJc6kIhVoXquYE24f8F.jpg','2021-03-05',80,'Released',NULL,'Climax',803852,0.8503,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27372,_binary '\0','/A6wkxXOLteYJtWKW9cgEcDLFtbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1409836',6.4,1625,'it','La matassa','Two cousins haven\'t spoken for almost twenty years, thanks to the enmity that their fathers feel toward one another. But an accident suddenly brings the cousins back together and thrusts them deep into the heart of the mafia.','/9wdHZjeYSY4TUB0D8wbs5RT4k3O.jpg','2009-03-13',98,'Released',NULL,'La matassa',53957,1.7681,6.7,'ydfVpx9-V2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27373,_binary '\0','/4YJ28KoOb5ViUzhqurdcWIFa7M0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14099334',6.7,29424,'hi','भेड़िया','Inspired by legendary folklore rooted in Arunachal Pradesh, Bhediya tells the story of Bhaskar, a man who gets bitten by a mythical wolf and begins to transform into the creature himself. As Bhaskar and his ragtag buddies try to find answers, he is worried that the monster in him will wipe out human existence in the local town.','/iZtq44ZmxBW0E3tAeLG6UdJe9aj.jpg','2022-11-25',156,'Released','Jungle mein Kaand','Bhediya',799177,1.8742,6.9,'d_BPlvbw_ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27374,_binary '\0','/5oRxXoe9XAEv2PSfIv7FK4HXUpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14099796',6.2,1870,'cn','金手指','In 1970s Hong Kong, the Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC) was formed to bring down the corruption syndicate led by British government officials. One of its top investigators is Senior Investigator Lau Kai-Yuen, who brought down countless corrupted officials. Just as he thought stability and prosperity are within reach, a new era of greed and riches takes him into a new battlefield of corruption.','/cU5o3TJSs7Xv3FD20il5tQIB6Lm.jpg','2023-12-30',126,'Released',NULL,'The Goldfinger',823598,3.0996,6,'lH3ZVehb5Mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27375,_binary '\0','/e2lvtGkiLHR92pM4ZFMSHlLvWki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1410051',5.8,14608,'en','Retreat','Kate and Martin escape from personal tragedy to an Island Retreat. Cut off from the outside world, their attempts to recover are shattered when a man is washed ashore, with news of airborne killer disease that is sweeping through Europe.','/ttQYNoyqsntARma6EdIDWMSTBGR.jpg','2011-10-14',89,'Released','No neighbours. No help. No escape.','Retreat',73936,2.3948,5.6,'E7zNPE57IHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27376,_binary '\0','/ca0a79cbCGWJdan3SEBKkQBSwKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1410063',7.5,58769,'zh','金陵十三釵','A Westerner finds refuge with a group of women in a church during Japan\'s rape of Nanking in 1937. Posing as a priest, he attempts to lead the women to safety.','/7NVgVX663tdareijAiv0eLiLn6d.jpg','2011-12-15',146,'Released','Fighting for freedom.','The Flowers of War',76758,5.3456,7.4,'cj2uhyfVNmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(2