eL.jpg','2021-02-26',87,'Released','Life will never be the same.','Alien Conquest',800705,1.9653,2.9,'XPVYfydtUfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27413,_binary '\0','/8V4wYBpm1tb3WXwxd7RY456P99b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413489',3.7,1288,'en','Cougar Hunting','Tells the tale of three buddies in their 20\'s whose love-lives are in shambles. They go to Aspen to pursue the booming trend of dating cougars: hot older women who prey on hot young guys.','/lNsmhNKvuBEflPnuDD1sSl28KeP.jpg','2011-04-22',102,'Released','On the trail of Aspen tail.','Cougar Hunting',68184,2.3407,3.3,'2JKFIViDbrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27414,_binary '\0','/x5EUEv1N9g4BCX9GQXKvv3nqMVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413492',6.6,102047,'en','12 Strong','A team of special forces head into Afghanistan in the aftermath of the September 11th attacks in an attempt to dismantle the Taliban.','/37Qwani2g0jVPU7N4OkkTZ7aERz.jpg','2018-01-18',130,'Released','The declassified true story of the horse soldiers','12 Strong',429351,11.8934,6.4,'-Denciie5oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27415,_binary '\0','/ghgFSYXj2YKJd7YtXtSMJbL4hJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413495',5.6,40468,'en','Paranoia','An entry-level employee at a powerful corporation finds himself occupying a corner office, but at a dangerous price—he must spy on his boss\'s old mentor to secure for him a multi-billion dollar advantage.','/isbiljuGztxLlcOvrSw5FkQDGEd.jpg','2013-08-14',106,'Released','In a war between kings even a pawn can change the game.','Paranoia',115348,5.4189,5.7,'0bdZWrW6HnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27416,_binary '\0','/5BDojYA0pBBkWVgtWfyCoazP6va.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413496',7.1,1948,'en','Revenge of the Electric Car','A sequel to 2006\'s Who Killed the Electric Car?, director Chris Paine once again looks at electric vehicles. Where in the last film electric cars were dismissed as uneconomical and unreliable, and were under multiple attacks from government, the auto industry, and from energy companies who didn\'t want them to succeed, this film chronicles, in the light of new changes in technology, the world economy, and the auto industry itself, the race - from both major car companies like Ford and Nissan, and from new rising upstarts like Tesla - to bring a practical consumer EV to market.','/dcitAQzCUnk06gt0I3hlAAh3etq.jpg','2011-10-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Revenge of the Electric Car',67619,1.9457,7.3,'jkRIu5a6Sb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27417,_binary '\0','/llpUbyitPOFRBwhXjfsr3wv59tR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413527',4.2,2482,'en','Evil Things','On January 9, 2009, five college students left New York City for a weekend in the country. 48 hours later, all five students have simply vanished without a trace. There were no leads and no evidence - until now.','/t5J2PIAudfPaHMuAgs9tc29vbEo.jpg','2009-06-17',86,'Released','They Were Never Seen Again...Until Now.','Evil Things',74555,1.0374,4.5,'8FhPaCbVeBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27418,_binary '\0','/cJYIA5UojWNQx4HqzvF6zGnRx3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1413529',7,1503,'ja','ゴールデンスランバー','When easy-going Aoyagi meets an old friend for a fishing trip, he ends up drugged, framed for the Prime Minister\'s assassination, and on the run from corrupt cops. It\'s only the beginning of what quickly becomes the worst, weirdest day of his life. But he\'ll get by with a little help from his friends, who include a famous pop diva, a rockabilly deliveryman, a crippled old gangster, and the world\'s most cheerful serial killer.','/4I38BO1TnwiJhzPrJReDKa9cxCH.jpg','2010-01-30',139,'Released','Suspicious eyes everywhere the world is chasing after him.','Golden Slumber',46911,1.7139,7.1,'gwNVJHETGvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27419,_binary '\0','/mlJTBVqDvlHqBTbozHRT4MpSpRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14137346',6.9,2261,'ml','പ്രിയന്‍ ഓട്ടത്തിലാണ്','Dr. Priyadarshan, a middle class man, silently goes through the pangs of hyperactivity and ADHD that entangles him into a series of coincidental events. He then meets Priscilla, a feisty, constantly doubtful and depressed girl.','/2gOHHVU4TYV3eQgMp5UQRVcb4bb.jpg','2022-06-24',140,'Released',NULL,'Priyan Ottathilaanu',937323,1.0956,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27420,_binary '\0','/12GAm3EiHUUeCB5mk3NphURUh1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14137416',7,4841,'it','Rapito','The story of Edgardo Mortara, a young Jewish boy living in Bologna, Italy, who in 1858, after being secretly baptized, was forcibly taken from his family to be raised as a Christian. His parents’ struggle to free their son became part of a larger political battle that pitted the papacy against forces of democracy and Italian unification.','/3CJDRs0NxJXqG2jnlsJOwrADYQM.jpg','2023-05-25',134,'Released',NULL,'Kidnapped',801112,5.7767,7.3,'LCwiOmN28H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27421,_binary '\0','/b08BDQPq42AoLMfhi7DtTOoYqVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14138650',6.6,143494,'en','The Pale Blue Eye','West Point, New York, 1830. When a cadet at the burgeoning military academy is found hanged with his heart cut out, the top brass summons former New York City constable Augustus Landor to investigate. While attempting to solve this grisly mystery, the reluctant detective engages the help of one of the cadets: a strange but brilliant young fellow by the name of Edgar Allan Poe.','/9xkGlFRqrN8btTLU0KQvOfn2PHr.jpg','2022-12-22',128,'Released','Every heart tells a tale.','The Pale Blue Eye',800815,9.434,6.785,'ddbL9jvg77w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27422,_binary '\0','/1Btw3PPFMPbVxHeSuad72vqbYVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14140954',6.5,2389,'ko','미션 파서블','Chinese secret agent Da-hee receives intel that a large number of illegal firearms are being smuggled into Korea and is sent to investigate the case. She meets Su-han, who is supposed to help her with the case, but due to his lackluster skills they fight over trivial things. But as their witnesses are suddenly murdered, the two of them quickly become the prime suspects.','/l2VrjVMJvyYizizmTkro22GLLnt.jpg','2021-02-17',105,'Released','A rookie secret agent\'s first mission turns into a chaos!','Mission: Possible',629028,4.1855,7.434,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27423,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14141184',7.6,3197,'or','କାଲିର ଅତୀତ','After returning to his drowned village in search of his family, Gunu finds himself haunted by the past as another cyclone approaches, pulling him into a journey through grief, memory, and the eye of the storm.','/eVNraGPgkJULAgX1863uhiFYho6.jpg','2020-11-06',83,'Released','Climate change is real.','Yesterday\'s Past',767661,0.6812,9,'gTijL47CNfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27424,_binary '\0','/euoXeFAOt9o7yAWA9zGZk7DdZWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14142060',7.6,66392,'en','Rental Family','An American actor in Tokyo struggles to find purpose until he lands an unusual gig: working for a Japanese \'rental family\' agency, playing stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients\' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality.','/A5lswNlytTUrnMWsuD0NFfhZlf3.jpg','2025-11-20',110,'Released','Happiness tailored to you!','Rental Family',1208348,12.1232,7.7,'RP9QKdU0vvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27425,_binary '\0','/v2cASxMb6MV2siGsACvRE6y8WSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1414361',2.8,2006,'en','Frat Party','Duffy, the big man on campus, is marrying Adriana, a debutante heiress to a global wine fortune, right after they both graduate from the same prestigious university. Unfortunately, the final frat party of his college career is the night before his wedding, and there are many obstacles in his way, including a soon to be father-in-law who is less than happy with his daughter\'s choice.','/tBevHrPcJOlDVLsIpWU5N7Rskox.jpg','2009-12-01',85,'Released','One party... can change your life','Frat Party',26673,2.0021,2.8,'mJHNwdquFrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27426,_binary '\0','/2ldITdRfMmwklWFQioB1R8NhI1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1414378',6.5,4461,'en','Tracker','A guerilla fighter from the South African Boer war called Arjan (Winstone) takes on a manhunt in New Zealand for Maori seaman Kereama (Morrison), who is accused of murdering a British soldier. What follows is a cat and mouse pursuit through the varied landscape of New Zealand with both hunter and huntee testing their bushcraft and wits against that of the other. Gradually they grow to know and respect one another but a posse, led by the British Commanding officer is close behind and his sole intention is to see the Maori hang.','/lPPLs4SFP4Pk3SCJbQfhp9vtbL8.jpg','2010-05-20',102,'Released','Never Stop Running!','Tracker',62255,1.7708,6.5,'H8P7Uk_I7l4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27427,_binary '\0','/iiNSeAjAbglRJNsobusROn6y0pf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1414382',5.8,57171,'en','You Again','History -- make that high school -- may repeat itself when Marni learns that Joanna, the mean girl from her past, is set to be her sister-in-law. Before the wedding bells toll, Marni must show her brother that a tiger doesn\'t change its stripes. On Marni\'s side is her mother, while Joanna\'s backed by her wealthy aunt.','/9qI5JE6yjmtakTankuDOMZ1vgEx.jpg','2010-09-23',105,'Released','What doesn\'t kill you... is going to marry your brother.','You Again',38303,8.6634,6.28,'KbD_fXetQvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27428,_binary '\0','/35xpwiUhgdXofUZe9RCtk0jn6RW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14145426',7,14952,'en','Beavis and Butt-Head Do the Universe','In 1998, Beavis and Butt-Head are sentenced to Space Camp by a “creative” judge. Their obsession with a docking simulator (huh huh) leads to a trip on the Space Shuttle, with predictably disastrous results. After going through a black hole, they re-emerge in our time, where they look for love, misuse iPhones, and are hunted by the Deep State. Spoiler: They don’t score.','/rVKMA2j8m8hWgsDyXOllXp8DsWI.jpg','2022-06-23',86,'Released','The dumbest science fiction movie ever made.','Beavis and Butt-Head Do the Universe',828947,5.2863,6.9,'EaHbTnA3qSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27429,_binary '\0','/vsrYscw6M5g1OEPxll9QTy6C9IK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14145436',4.6,14375,'en','Pet Sematary: Bloodlines','In 1969, young Jud Crandall has dreams of leaving his hometown behind, but soon discovers sinister secrets buried within and is forced to confront a dark family history that forever binds him to Ludlow.','/oO7945lhCDTBQ8n5uuye2874tiS.jpg','2023-09-23',87,'Released','Death is different here.','Pet Sematary: Bloodlines',830764,5.7063,5.6,'1IgQpRyfwbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27430,_binary '\0','/BdT03vHH7tkUOrP1r2TspDkfUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1414581',3.9,1245,'ja','戦慄迷宮3D','The horror-thriller follows a group of teenagers dealing with the disappearance of one of them, Yuki, at an amusement park\'s haunted house. On a rainy day 10 years later, Yuki inexplicably returns. However, no sooner is she united with her former friends than she collapses, and the group rushes Yuki to a nearby hospital. But after checking in, they discover that things are not quite as they seem at the medical center. As the night wears on, the group sinks deeper and deeper into the events from a decade ago that led to Yuki\'s disappearance.','/2Ux84iiZ6NP4dzSibCeqYTQmew3.jpg','2009-10-15',89,'Released',NULL,'The Shock Labyrinth',54579,1.7717,4.3,'o-VKe0f8Ydw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27431,_binary '\0','/ekZUWo5XtSrfe10RKWrL0YKkq9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14147224',4.6,9694,'en','Mindcage','Detectives Jake Doyle and Mary Kelly seek the help of an incarcerated serial killer named The Artist when a copycat killer strikes. While Mary searches for clues in The Artist\'s brilliant but twisted psyche, she and Jake are lured into a diabolical game of cat and mouse, racing against time to stay one step ahead of The Artist and his copycat.','/fUi9vNYQaB8QtrbEyS9J6vbKJJt.jpg','2022-12-16',97,'Released','The art of the kill.','Mindcage',1043565,4.5476,5.851,'7d8XdU8cb18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27432,_binary '\0','/jKSCK59bJwAkNZzG9mfQzPCI2N9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14149544',6.2,2052,'es','Historias para no contar','Five tales of human vulnerability and the hilarious, painful, and awkward curveballs life throws us.','/yjkxgOovtGpt0lTgHkQ9ImWS6td.jpg','2022-11-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Stories Not to Be Told',801860,2.4491,5.8,'lfhKY9exxmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27433,_binary '\0','/uBDbyoufp7TGaDDVTHOCxl3dz8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14152140',6.7,23586,'hi','डार्लिंग्स','Badru hopes her volatile husband will reform if he stops drinking. But when his rage goes too far, she and her mom boldly, albeit clumsily, seek revenge.','/lyA7kXCIAG17hVuvFOxlMmmv31A.jpg','2022-08-05',134,'Released','Violence against women is injurious to health','Darlings',801526,2.2884,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27434,_binary '\0','/AcvxSLa140z7qgGQ8G2UjhcgVEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14152756',8.1,35899,'en','Seaspiracy','Passionate about ocean life, a filmmaker sets out to document the harm that humans do to marine species — and uncovers an alarming global conspiracy.','/iFNri0fwn1WfCoxf3H3v1z8dCm4.jpg','2021-03-24',89,'Released',NULL,'Seaspiracy',801058,2.7153,7.8,'1Q5CXN7soQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27435,_binary '\0','/cQW6UoDxwwfqIMTVfxdxHk4JLGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1415283',6.1,40563,'en','Nanny McPhee and the Big Bang','Nanny McPhee appears at the door of a harried young mother who is trying to run the family farm while her husband is away at war. But once she’s arrived, Nanny discovers that the children are fighting a war of their own against two spoiled city cousins who have just moved in. Relying on everything from a flying motorcycle and a statue that comes to life to a tree-climbing piglet and a baby elephant, Nanny uses her magic to teach her mischievous charges five new lessons.','/9cgHfgBXVZmVR63AhwJ82R1kAFS.jpg','2010-03-26',109,'Released','The magic\'s back, warts and all.','Nanny McPhee and the Big Bang',35019,12.5462,6.333,'54xMw6eouOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27436,_binary '\0','/ua93tXnMRleRk6vxJxfH1RRShbq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1415290',7.2,1626,'ar','ابن بابل','A willful young boy follows his just and obstinate grandmother on a journey across Iraq, determined to discover the fate of her missing son, Ahmed\'s father, who never returned from war.','/mix4tE0JZBT1v4l72PPlbAvQioM.jpg','2009-05-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Son of Babylon',56807,1.1516,7.263,'yLtWQYkz2IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27437,_binary '\0','/bLZ1WGb59JXFRYRFgknOwwiPJ0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14153080',7.1,29861,'en','A Good Person','Allison\'s life falls apart following her involvement in a fatal accident. The unlikely relationship she forms with her would-be father-in-law helps her live a life worth living.','/dhejMQdsqPtTTCKIkyoJ5FLfC3F.jpg','2023-03-23',128,'Released','Sometimes we find hope where we least expect it.','A Good Person',800787,5.9213,7,'i8zPpJlWzLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27438,_binary '\0','/5IwrHiXMeKxOLZnkmMa116xGya4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14156154',6.7,2091,'pa','ਚਲ ਮੇਰਾ ਪੁੱਤ ੩','Chal Mera Putt 3 revolves around the lives of illegal immigrants in UK, their friendship and their constant struggle of finding a home away from home.','/vhlwENeB4bDPl1YeSiPLNfDAJnz.jpg','2021-10-01',130,'Released',NULL,'Chal Mera Putt 3',878667,3.2928,6,'NR1ZGMFUAus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27439,_binary '\0','/vEstTfKlnnxIVQBcy8mU8WtQCz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14158346',4.9,3156,'en','Sharp Stick','Sarah Jo is a naive 26-year-old living on the fringes of Hollywood with her mother and sister. When she begins an affair with her older employer, she is thrust into an education on sexuality, loss and power.','/hqPILOj6IAcoCYPE6vqGDQJtlUf.jpg','2022-07-29',96,'Released',NULL,'Sharp Stick',801913,6.2745,4.9,'d-RAeC0yj8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27440,_binary '\0','/wMUPT99gw6IB9OVvC46rF8wHIRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14158554',4.5,8211,'en','Fistful of Vengeance','A revenge mission becomes a fight to save the world from an ancient threat when superpowered assassin Kai tracks a killer to Bangkok.','/3cccEF9QZgV9bLWyupJO41HSrOV.jpg','2022-02-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Fistful of Vengeance',890656,4.2983,5.577,'vC_n_L1KGbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27441,_binary '\0','/dFmp1KIGdSVDhIhy0yQNmCDTjav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14160834',6.5,14940,'en','Rustin','Activist Bayard Rustin faces racism and homophobia as he helps change the course of Civil Rights history by orchestrating the 1963 March on Washington.','/lCawCmTJhKT7c2ZOzLBTXDIR8JS.jpg','2023-11-03',108,'Released','Own your power.','Rustin',898713,4.6216,6.5,'4lBqMhZ3NBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27442,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1416336',4.5,1835,'en','Extinction: The G.M.O. Chronicles','A Retrovirus, which was conceived as a tool for industrial genetic engineering, has gotten out of control and is spreading rapidly. While it crosses all organisms within our ecological system completely indiscriminately (mixing plant with animal and humans) most plants prove more resistant because of their complex DNA. However, the simple genes of the plants lead humans to become grotesque mutations, in most cases even to death. Within one week, 90% of mankind are either extinct or no longer human. However, a small fraction of the earth?s population remains immune to the virus and must survive in this new and constantly changing ecological system. Tom cellar is one the survivors and on an old military base in the Eifel he has entrenched himself. Further survivors come together and succeed in carving out a life in this new world. But the GMOs - the ?genetically modified organisms? - constantly develop themselves further, and soon the fence of the base offers no more protection.','/2EMayUEOr9lOK2OXZk7NTJf0E6d.jpg','2011-11-17',114,'Released','At the dusk of man... Only the dead survive','Extinction: The G.M.O. Chronicles',79721,1.6073,4.9,'AYzvQDSitAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27443,_binary '\0','/l7JgcJW2YHaYhPuc0sE1TsgNzku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14163772',6.3,2340,'sv','Sagan om Karl-Bertil Jonssons julafton','A tale of a boy from a wealthy family who during his work at the post office steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm.','/105kVP54fB2mxIdtirFUML4I9xF.jpg','2021-11-12',104,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Tale',779775,2.0213,6.5,'vlhMyN9tRqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27444,_binary '\0','/dUbtr5cXaCyFByz41ch806Omyj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14164234',5.6,3114,'ja','彼女','Rei helps the woman she\'s been in love with for years escape her abusive husband. While on the run, their feelings for each other catch fire.','/c7JzcVK4OZY1u7HYiFBOASkKPP5.jpg','2021-04-15',142,'Released',NULL,'Ride or Die',796849,3.7819,6.652,'0ScXgq3k4lY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27445,_binary '\0','/cpZH1cytFcftuAgeaEOasL4xK3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14167424',4.3,1624,'hi','Searching for Sheela','Journalists and fans await Ma Anand Sheela as the infamous former Rajneesh commune\'s spokesperson returns to India after decades for an interview tour.','/4uUmXmS1BNXieflgr884NnjYRFK.jpg','2021-04-22',58,'Released',NULL,'Searching for Sheela',816836,0.779,5.7,'9LGrzIRR6Hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27446,_binary '\0','/7Cam3PU0nCNL0eD7HPxNhnvRggH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1416801',7,55031,'en','Kill the Irishman','Over the summer of 1976, thirty-six bombs detonate in the heart of Cleveland while a turf war raged between Irish mobster Danny Greene and the Italian mafia. Based on a true story, Kill the Irishman chronicles Greene\'s heroic rise from a tough Cleveland neighborhood to become an enforcer in the local mob.','/yjDvqAMyFlesBtWNUUZMgglo78y.jpg','2011-03-10',106,'Released','The man the mob couldn\'t kill.','Kill the Irishman',51209,4.9376,6.783,'S-RcDFu-LlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27447,_binary '\0','/iGXrJvq3EVAd7CAt5BicepJYr5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14168118',7.1,10575,'pt','7 Prisioneiros','An impoverished teen seeking to escape the clutches of a human trafficker must weigh living up to his moral code against his struggle to survive.','/5svMKCGnR6Yvj8wxldvDvgUi0Jk.jpg','2021-10-22',93,'Released','Survival is Power','7 Prisoners',785538,3.0633,7.083,'vupNkHJGBQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27448,_binary '\0','/c60LcJdWw9PVEUG1EhK2OEYSN4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14168394',4.1,3818,'en','Agent Game','Harris, a CIA interrogator at an Agency black site, finds himself the target of a rendition operation after being scapegoated for an interrogation gone horribly wrong. As the team tasked to bring Harris in begins to question their orders -- and each other --Olsen, a senior intelligence officer, and his subordinate, Visser, raise the stakes. Now, it\'s up to Harris and some newfound allies to uncover the truth and turn the tables.','/yG05YYiKHNtbsqFUfrmCxGQj5zc.jpg','2022-04-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Agent Game',872542,4.5685,4.964,'ZXgS5a2aqC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27449,_binary '\0','/erVZTFQxvdwcrlZk4NnESJ2iFG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417067',7.2,2746,'bs','Cirkus Columbia','Bosnia and Herzegovina, 1991. After the fall of the communists, Divko Buntić, who has lived in exile in Germany for the past twenty years, returns to the village where he grew up, intent on reclaiming ownership of his family home, driving a swanky Mercedes and accompanied by his young bride; by Bonny, his lucky black cat; and with pockets full of money.','/dzpv9bDfToQ2yzTErx0Iu3NYzY2.jpg','2010-07-23',107,'Released',NULL,'Cirkus Columbia',63834,1.261,6.5,'hqrOByIMLI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27450,_binary '\0','/nHEfc1ukpsYMmILr79QrClYNma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417075',7.3,11575,'pl','W ciemności','A dramatization of one man\'s rescue of Jewish refugees in the Nazi-occupied city of Lviv. In Darkness tells the true story of Leopold Soha who risks his own life to save a dozen people from certain death. Initially only interested in his own good, the thief and burglar hides Jewish refugees for 14 months in the sewers of the Nazi-occupied town of Lviv (formerly Poland).','/cRm30D0tBvMLXjtoKuaUteBZ4nv.jpg','2011-12-09',145,'Released',NULL,'In Darkness',73686,3.912,6.9,'nb2TyPfxaQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27451,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417101',6.1,2170,'fa','کتاب قانون','Rahman (Parviz Parastuyi) falls in love with a Christan woman from Lebanon. She was a Christan but she becomes Muslim before her second meeting with Rahman. So he decides to marry her.','/vBwDfPBUtfPVeNljWISe3EcEZT.jpg','2009-10-07',95,'Released',NULL,'The Book of Law',211675,0.738,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27452,_binary '\0','/kj18Fat0G06RYmk93GOhNV6iWPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417108',5.4,6307,'es','Torrente 4: Lethal crisis','The rude, lewd and crude Spanish ex-police officer Torrente finds himself facing jail time. Can he survive a twisted irony that places him where he has put so many others, both guilty and innocent?','/aEU0HGjWWdq6Vd9s2hPmax3209B.jpg','2011-03-11',93,'Released',NULL,'Torrente 4: Lethal crisis',59117,2.3498,5.5,'OP-S7ZBIIFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27453,_binary '\0','/6PeLpBvYAPGj9wyLcZYvnPjCyw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417299',7.9,6500,'ta','உன்னைப்போல் ஒருவன்','A common man tries to fight terrorism by making anonymous calls to cops. Will he succeed ?','/35GMJaA9VeW6gQY5jlruEu6WEF4.jpg','2009-09-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Unnaipol Oruvan',25121,1.4616,7.036,'2JPcx5GLcEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27454,_binary '\0','/lEwqBGNR65KZv6Ej5ufcmhZu2y2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14173636',7.5,67912,'en','The Invite','Joe and Angela\'s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?','/b7Dr8Chzse8VagexAporUu2RtLx.jpg','2026-06-25',107,'Released','It\'ll be fun.','The Invite',950028,40.1116,7.243,'OJ19I9q_hOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27455,_binary '\0','/3RQccmgJDybIdLivf4aNCJj5fVO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14174168',3.9,3844,'en','Gasoline Alley','A man implicated in the triple homicide of three Hollywood starlets begins his own investigation. Needing assistance, he enlists the two detectives on his tail in order to expose a conspiracy more explosive than any of them imagined.','/ews3l3v7JYLtBS5ansZrXsXLMzl.jpg','2022-02-25',97,'Released','Justice gets dirty.','Gasoline Alley',916821,5.67,4.851,'SbfLLP0vjpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27456,_binary '\0','/i2tcQ9nDJpdJELPA82eCd7Irasd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14174940',4.7,30109,'en','Interceptor','A U.S. Army Captain uses her years of tactical training to save humanity from sixteen nuclear missiles launched at the U.S. as a violent attack threatens her remote missile interceptor station.','/jBKNAfANo4e3rzJtb7aHfYNd7b3.jpg','2022-05-26',98,'Released','The world\'s last defense.','Interceptor',831946,5.4449,6,'OQSoII4Bj1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27457,_binary '\0','/e2Hi3SjI2OKGylQFRJcSGqwfR8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417582',6.7,1221,'es','Entrelobos','Entre lobos (Among Wolves) tells the remarkable story of a poor country boy named Marcos, who at the age of 7 is handed over to his father\'s employer, a rich landowner, who in turn delivers him to a life of labor with a hermetic goatherd in an isolated valley. The old man, who lives in a cave, is unused to human company and at first seems not very interested in having a live-in apprentice. The boy, who was abused by his parents, is frightened and equally aloof initially. Despite this, the shepherd begins teaching Marcos how to herd the goats, as well as how to care for himself and how to survive in the wilderness by trapping and fishing.','/aiW0ZyV08G7f9Z1tCnN3RnRzJhY.jpg','2010-11-26',116,'Released',NULL,'Among Wolves',59835,2.5557,6.2,'jDriL5CUmjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27458,_binary '\0','/mr4wCG5QgLEk03buTHlZxkFFIhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1417592',8.2,8491,'en','Pearl Jam Twenty','Carved from over 1,200 hours of footage spanning the band’s career, Pearl Jam: Twenty is the definitive portrait of Pearl Jam. Part concert film, part intimate insider-hang, and part testimonial to the power of music.','/d38PBlEsj5W9Od581GuWLeTuy4F.jpg','2011-09-20',119,'Released',NULL,'Pearl Jam Twenty',72744,1.6422,7.8,'GzI8OhR0IVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27459,_binary '\0','/wRMliYnfL9In0Oi9OsJW2nD1XfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14176094',8.1,2315,'te','దృశ్యం 2','7 years after the events of Drushyam, the family lives with the trauma from that fateful night. A gripping tale of an investigation and a family threatened by it. Will Rambabu be able to protect his family this time?','/mKHsiNOoOnFRBap5HSVO8kLhJGF.jpg','2021-11-25',155,'Released','The Resumption','Drushyam 2',847767,0.8947,7.107,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27460,_binary '\0','/8xCL0U7CaDltwYI9327BU401IMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14176542',6.7,16717,'es','Bardo, falsa crónica de unas cuantas verdades','A renowned Mexican journalist and documentary filmmaker living in Los Angeles, after being named the recipient of a prestigious international award, is compelled to return to his native country, unaware that this simple trip will push him to an existential limit.','/3e6RA0CzFDC0pz5TqiRlbHcsc2n.jpg','2022-10-27',159,'Released','Experience a state of mind.','BARDO, False Chronicle of a Handful of Truths',685691,4.6044,6.8,'8Q_RVOTqZlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27461,_binary '\0','/bfYDeFDmoweRdmTt0ifHPOMgNXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14179942',7.7,5583,'en','Good Night Oppy','The inspirational true story of Opportunity, a rover that was sent to Mars for a 90-day mission but ended up surviving for 15 years. Follow Opportunity’s groundbreaking journey on Mars and the remarkable bond forged between a robot and her humans millions of miles away.','/7DTWN79hsN5AZEhW8w4SOquSI4D.jpg','2022-11-04',105,'Released','A 90-day mission becomes a 15-year journey of opportunity.','Good Night Oppy',972545,2.97,7.668,'W4t58Yruhds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27462,_binary '\0','/rbFqLPKj6D2JyRh5mOfA7jqX0Qk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14181714',5.8,19693,'en','The Bluff','When her tranquil life on a remote island is shattered by the return of her vengeful former captain, a skilled ex-pirate must confront her bloody past and unleash her deadly talents to save her family from a ruthless siege.','/dl1cA7wdwePc9QU2Rc24EPqlcyJ.jpg','2026-02-17',103,'Released','Betrayal cuts deep.','The Bluff',799882,17.4022,6.7,'uUYMqRjNxhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27463,_binary '\0','/6BLRFPhAQc39KEWVC7cV749tMoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14181816',6.2,11151,'en','Maggie Moore(s)','Bizarre back-to-back murders in an otherwise quiet Arizona desert town has rattled local Police Chief Jordan Sanders. The two dead women have no connection to each other – except they’re both named Maggie Moore. While unravelling a web of small-town lies and mysteries, the investigation gets even more complicated when Sanders begins a romantic relationship with one of the murdered women\'s neighbor, Rita.','/3IY1n6UQnjNImEToEDTW924EUAo.jpg','2023-06-16',99,'Released','One murder is a crime. Two is a mystery.','Maggie Moore(s)',800089,4.1019,5.8,'QdteVAA9aRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27464,_binary '\0','/1L0BG4iYnVEpBvG5RjiiMkld2r5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14182646',7.3,8659,'ta','வெந்து தணிந்தது காடு','A youngster from Tamil Nadu goes to Bombay in search of a better life and gets sucked into the underworld. Will he be able to find a way out of the violence and bloodshed?','/7z2D25a4h4hs8PHrTia8pPkHijE.jpg','2022-09-15',172,'Released','Part 1 - The Kindling','Vendhu Thanindhathu Kaadu',800623,1.2975,6.474,'5QfSf2LDNW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27465,_binary '\0','/9ywnF6JCB7RqmZ5OPzoe67LfTv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1418377',5.1,86696,'en','I, Frankenstein','200 years after his shocking creation, Dr. Frankenstein\'s creature, Adam, still walks the earth. But when he finds himself in the middle of a war over the fate of humanity, Adam discovers he holds the key that could destroy humankind.','/a53tIl4k20zCZCNyq73kiXkwWkl.jpg','2014-01-22',92,'Released','In the battle between good and evil, an immortal holds the key','I, Frankenstein',100241,8.3207,5.4,'NXc5epxOH_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27466,_binary '\0','/fwNICuPTTExPBWTH8osYeEjTCbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1418646',7,9308,'en','Beneath Hill 60','The true story of Australia\'s cat-and-mouse underground mine warfare—one of the most misunderstood, misrepresented and mystifying conflicts of WW I. It was secret struggle BENEATH the Western Front that combined daring engineering, technology and science. Few on the surface knew of the brave, claustrophobic and sometimes barbaric work of these tunnellers.','/5eHtQC77fmILNRd7FG70SOdChs8.jpg','2010-04-15',122,'Released','After Gallipoli there was still a war to be won.','Beneath Hill 60',43418,4.0087,6.839,'uYOpCJCl5L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27467,_binary '\0','/om7apkYMeZMsZ60RsR9DGitTkPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14186876',6.4,6643,'en','Bring Them Down','When the ongoing rivalry between farmers Michael and Jack suddenly escalates, it triggers a chain of events that take increasingly violent and devastating turns, leaving both families permanently altered.','/2jskL5eOFTQknpRalJ4chVYyuFo.jpg','2025-02-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Bring Them Down',804862,4.2942,6.7,'7pIKR6UBogs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27468,_binary '\0','/ek1LnoYGUsGOm7MYriJq0jzVkYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1418712',4.9,6016,'en','Outpost: Black Sun','A pair of investigators team up with a Special Forces Unit to venture deep inside a war raging between the military and a massive army of Nazi Zombie Stormtroopers. Their mission is to fight their way behind enemy lines, locate the technology at the source of this growing threat and prevent the seemingly inevitable rise of the 4th Reich.','/verU1sFnGjB7NbpM6yStKEsWzyR.jpg','2012-04-25',101,'Released','War in Hell','Outpost: Black Sun',100183,2.4675,5,'MBBh7ClJ02U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27469,_binary '\0','/3ODrafKxQEZyPui6y9bcPAPnGmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1418754',6.5,8890,'en','John Doe: Vigilante','When John Doe is convicted of being a vigilante serial killer, a vigilante group named \'Speak for the Dead\' emerges in support of John\'s cause—elevating the debate about justice versus vengeance.','/6bsz5CNrgw84xsx0FTnrDt8Yuub.jpg','2014-03-21',93,'Released','Hero or Villain? Justice or Vengeance? You Decide.','John Doe: Vigilante',253849,1.8847,6.4,'tBqEysLcJ-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27470,_binary '\0','/mlig5IpJPeKY7dIclrPdme7AI33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1418760',6.3,1842,'nl','Tirza','Jörgen\'s world is crumbling. Forced into early retirement and harassed by his ex-wife, the only part of his life which makes sense - his beloved daughter Tirza - is shattered when she disappears on holiday in Namibia. After weeks of terrifying uncertainty, Jörgen goes searching for her, but the heat, his drinking and bad memories combine to unhinge him. His only ally is a child prostitute called Kaisa. Together they journey into the wilderness on Tirza\'s trail to discover her fate.','/zr3PDDXZE4lxDBr721TLOvyUhai.jpg','2010-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Tirza',59505,1.6155,5.1,'DgijR7y27gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27471,_binary '\0','/qjylAJO8BuEtqBwHOK4xuQN0QIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14188930',7.9,6588,'ml','ന്നാ താന്‍ കേസ് കൊട്','A reformed thief\'s fight for justice when an innocent act to defend himself places him in loggerheads with the high and mighty of society.','/qd4dZuYRmgJtBQUm1E8zclAZXE4.jpg','2022-08-11',139,'Released','Sue Me','Nna Thaan Case Kodu',864761,0.9759,7.342,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27472,_binary '\0','/88g2Yk5bl0i8OsNZR6iouzgJyt8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14189076',6.4,4678,'ml','അറിയിപ്പ്','A sensitive and manipulated video clip is circulated amongst the co-workers of the factory where the couple work, which unleashes unexpected emotional, social and marital imbalances in their relationship.','/1N1qt9iOKfoCyi0bAWhD1bLC00m.jpg','2022-08-03',107,'Released','Declaration','Ariyippu',864245,1.0026,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27473,_binary '\0','/bGY3ec44F0cuA8UUzhNrA7xxGJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1419318',7.9,3884,'en','Facing Ali','Ten of Muhammad Ali\'s former rivals pay tribute to the three-time world heavyweight champion.','/cvGflJpxYX4tK6WOTFGiwS5BXPD.jpg','2009-05-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Facing Ali',30966,1.6491,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27474,_binary '\0','/mGQokr8TSKW6WyUBSgm4p7hjyaU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14195192',6.2,3373,'ml','പുഴു','Kuttan, an annoyingly disciplined and a bigoted upper-caste retired police officer, is living with his son Kichu. After Bharati, Kuttan’s younger sister, falls in love with lower caste Kuttappan and elopes with him against her family’s wish, the attempts on Kuttan\'s life increases and his paranoia make the lives around him miserable.','/l0UhlFCS5NiQuToUk8DocmokWAz.jpg','2022-05-13',122,'Released',NULL,'Puzhu',803626,1.1882,6.294,'d64ck4nkE_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27475,_binary '\0','/4DTAYsk9ZzJPQJDHieRjYwHzU8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14197038',4.6,1771,'en','The Piper','When a composer must finish her late mentor\'s concerto, she discovers that playing its music summons deadly consequences.','/A92IidYEd25UHJGh4baSsTcJ650.jpg','2023-10-12',95,'Released',NULL,'The Piper',845643,2.5946,5.2,'g89l39yuEuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27476,_binary '\0','/3n4UrvOkPOvJqAMu5YtTLzgO9Mm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1419950',4.9,2499,'en','Riverworld','Welcome to Riverworld, a place of strange, watery beauty and the current abode of a fascinating cast of the recently (and not-so-recently) dead. It certainly isn\'t Heaven, but it just might be Hell.','/z5kSwrsgBCXh23s22OZAUStgjSY.jpg','2010-04-18',178,'Released','The afterlife begins here.','Riverworld',62878,1.3733,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27477,_binary '\0','/srJ7haOhfykoPOYPQrstOaFem08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14199590',5.7,8319,'en','One Shot','An elite squad of Navy SEALs, on a covert mission to transport a prisoner off a CIA black site island prison, are trapped when insurgents attack while trying to rescue the same prisoner.','/3OXiTjU30gWtqxmx4BU9RVp2OTv.jpg','2021-11-05',97,'Released','Escape is just the beginning.','One Shot',811592,6.5723,6.7,'8PmV8GFrZzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27478,_binary '\0','/l8wpvjk4SlGUNaOkuvCpsjK3pKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14201576',6,1691,'en','Blueback','Based on the best-selling novel by Tim Winton, Blueback is a timely tale about the ocean, a beautiful marine creature, and a young girl’s power to change the world.','/pYjcXSRUhvYFAs5lft4d2qDEiks.jpg','2022-12-29',102,'Released','He\'s their best kept secret.','Blueback',807132,2.6691,6.7,'Jwv5DuCgZcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27479,_binary '\0','/b13AuahXeffKtRYij0QYb9pBuEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14201728',4.5,1598,'en','Twisted','Two millennials make quick money by leasing incredible New York City apartments they don’t own to people who don’t know they are being scammed. The con works brilliantly until they run into an apartment owner with a dark secret who flips the game on them.','/rF6txsM6cgF9vg6Ra5sNbkvUwrw.jpg','2026-02-06',93,'Released','Do no harm.','Twisted',1373198,5.3551,4.508,'fAkM20N5YV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27480,_binary '\0','/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14205554',7.4,143081,'en','KPop Demon Hunters','When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren\'t selling out stadiums, they\'re using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.','/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg','2025-06-20',96,'Released','They sing. They dance. They battle demons.','KPop Demon Hunters',803796,41.2086,7.995,'AzCAwdp1uIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27481,_binary '\0','/4wOmXiWbouvffB3kssZKCLeTOFS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1420558',3.2,1922,'de','Melancholie der Engel','Upon learning that his days are numbered, a man and an old friend return to an old house that connects them by a dark secret. Along with three women and a mysterious old man, the group journeys into a horrifying abyss of debauchery and moral mayhem, leading to a fatal turn of events, during which the darkest human depths are revealed.','/f8mzBkwm8kBJCIOV9MjXxYN0Uga.jpg','2009-05-01',164,'Released','Poetic, Radical, Original, Unwieldy... Impossible To Forget.','Melancholie der Engel',158246,3.0995,3.9,'kF_khHTKhdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27482,_binary '\0','/xQyGkQ8ICa4lgifGr3oZjkm3AJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14208870',7.5,137059,'en','The Fabelmans','Growing up in post-World War II era Arizona, young Sammy Fabelman aspires to become a filmmaker as he reaches adolescence, but soon discovers a shattering family secret and explores how the power of films can help him see the truth.','/h7llKkqkkJtJrTOaDLuVeUYDQ7I.jpg','2022-11-11',151,'Released','Capture every moment.','The Fabelmans',804095,13.009,7.556,'9wAKUa487aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27483,_binary '\0','/ejzZej2F3BrZbiTmdIcuo4wTkKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14209560',6.2,10825,'te','భీమ్లా నాయక్‌','A sub-inspector and the egoistic son of an ex-MP get in an egotistical war when the former arrests the latter for bringing in liquor from Telangana to AP.','/14KeWSkgzTbfJmmD4bXT9mwkaYz.jpg','2022-02-25',145,'Released',NULL,'Bheemla Nayak',811942,1.54,5.674,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27484,_binary '\0','/aBw406SvghTKV6CTK9t84Bo9Xik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14209618',5,29179,'te','గేమ్‌ ఛేంజర్‌','Ram, a newly appointed district collector, takes charge in a city in Andhra Pradesh and immediately confronts the deeply entrenched corruption and inefficiency plaguing the government. Determined to bring reforms, he initiates sweeping changes, sparking a fierce conflict with a powerful state Minister.','/qtOGsZoLW7QceqKmsOy5nSM6Aik.jpg','2025-01-09',164,'Released','The game is about to change!','Game Changer',811944,2.3698,4.984,'QSu9-DBjMPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27485,_binary '\0','/a2tys4sD7xzVaogPntGsT1ypVoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14209916',5.9,128487,'en','Cocaine Bear','Inspired by a true story, an oddball group of cops, criminals, tourists and teens converge in a Georgia forest where a 500-pound black bear goes on a murderous rampage after unintentionally ingesting cocaine.','/gOnmaxHo0412UVr1QM5Nekv1xPi.jpg','2023-02-22',95,'Released','Get in line.','Cocaine Bear',804150,15.0445,5.988,'DuWEEKeJLMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27486,_binary '\0','/xp276bUoMCCTeJFe6dmJyK8EjxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1421036',6.6,1766,'ta','கோவா','Three young men, who always get into trouble in their village, dream of an effortless life. For this, they run away to Goa in the hope of finding and getting married to rich foreign women.','/tHU76m8pX0SGxZSBkxi9WPisHXB.jpg','2010-01-29',164,'Released',NULL,'Goa',50093,0.9564,6,'sXICP9R3OUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27487,_binary '\0','/1ygxEyNuciVw575RSgJn5uQ0HeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1421040',5.8,1485,'it','Io, loro e Lara','A priest, after spending years in humanitary missions in Africa, reunites with his family, which is in worse conditions than when he left, and above all meets a young lady who will make him doubt both himself and his faith.','/bu5KsogttEN2K5UlDeBiseD478W.jpg','2010-01-05',115,'Released',NULL,'Me, Them and Lara',36298,1.6418,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27488,_binary '\0','/7tcCCbMR2kF38teW1cC4upWR2KC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1421048',6.1,2128,'en','Bloodworth','E.F. Bloodworth has returned to his home - a forgotten corner of Tennessee - after forty years of roaming. The wife he walked out on has withered and faded, his three sons are grown and angry. Warren is a womanizing alcoholic, Boyd is driven by jealousy to hunt down his wife and her lover, and Brady puts hexes on his enemies from his mamma\'s porch. Only Fleming, the old man\'s grandson, treats him with the respect his age commands, and sees past all the hatred to realize the way it can poison a man\'s soul. It is ultimately the love of Raven Lee, a sloe-eyed beauty from another town, that gives Fleming the courage to reject this family curse.','/ccaB2iIxZBFiQn4b8AGSmHxPhxC.jpg','2010-02-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Bloodworth',67198,2.8095,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27489,_binary '\0','/bzCuOfoZ9ZC9AGLs8ZVZ5yo1X16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1421051',6.3,48968,'en','Somewhere','After withdrawing to the Chateau Marmont, a passionless Hollywood actor reexamines his life when his eleven-year-old daughter surprises him with a visit.','/zOf1sdfF4eH3CVRCpmRO5ugVGdo.jpg','2010-09-03',98,'Released',NULL,'Somewhere',39210,4.1362,6.081,'iEga7Hz9a3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27490,_binary '\0','/iP5yf2KsKe1IfUN47iVwFmt0zJk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14210720',4.5,1437,'es','HollyBlood','Javi is a teenage student so shy and clumsy that he does not know how to attract the attention of his classmate Sara, a geeky girl who is only interested in a literary saga about vampires.','/ts82TuL0Uz2P3YNbMzZWC9Kp16Q.jpg','2022-07-22',88,'Released',NULL,'HollyBlood',821133,1.7297,5.268,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27491,_binary '\0','/AiR95OFlkY00Z18uLl2eL2pZNeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14210958',6.4,1672,'de','Guglhupfgeschwader','Bavaria\'s most relaxed village policeman has to face an organized crime syndicate coming after his grandmother\'s cakes.','/r8vFoyiCNd1jUmok5o0dNLAx55X.jpg','2022-08-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Guglhupfgeschwader',851238,1.2972,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27492,_binary '\0','/kR4TuKHWhrDhEpEJ0bAvrGjjaWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14212090',6.6,1386,'fr','L\'Envol','A French widower and WWI veteran returns home after the war to raise his newborn daughter.','/s6kr3P8OuskO4g4yqSAhb1hR8Uk.jpg','2023-01-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Scarlet',840111,1.8559,6.7,'3WGgFXZSC10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27493,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1421361',6.3,1776,'en','Dawg Fight','In a crime-plagued neighborhood near Miami, brutal, bare-knuckled backyard fights give young men a chance to earn money -- and self-respect.','/thgvd0tjDLJvTVx4BaZjfQAC7yK.jpg','2015-03-13',109,'Released',NULL,'Dawg Fight',325365,1.8789,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27494,_binary '\0','/fejok33Ijc6SppiEU1cfwA9Mo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14217100',7,15355,'nl','Ferry','Before he built a drug empire, Ferry Bouman returns to his hometown on a revenge mission that finds his loyalty tested — and a love that alters his life.','/1sZlGoyGShlPhKj1AspcuHh4jfU.jpg','2021-05-13',106,'Released',NULL,'Ferry',717192,2.5271,6.8,'2Uug0zsK2CU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27495,_binary '\0','/febsGW62souCYk62PrUR9JlZ5Sn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt14219486',5.2,1344,'en','A Christmas Karen','A reworking of A Christmas Carol where the protagonist is a typical Karen.','/g24L8aeCgPiIqjLWVYDl7kMts1w.jpg','2022-11-18',98,'Released','\"God help us, every one.\"','A Christmas Karen',996806,1.2437,5.167,'hPaLAPFOtAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27496,_binary '\0','/7far1lb1wzsjtE9owzZji4YfqNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1422020',7,14628,'en','Dog Pound','Three juvenile delinquents arrive at a correctional center and are put under the care of an experienced guard.','/btkq5xE0GrHzdl8I49OGTUmCPYL.jpg','2010-04-24',91,'Released','Fighting back is the only way out.','Dog Pound',43920,3.2112,7.2,'H5p-Q1yuyJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27497,_binary '\0','/wIgN4qGIydCAkgeFfPomqLRqRbg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1422032',7.4,15600,'es','También la lluvia','As a director and his crew shoot a controversial film about Christopher Columbus in Cochabamba, Bolivia, local people rise up against plans to privatize the water supply.','/4jFjNgGtqc4W1yemAoMi4h32dxB.jpg','2011-01-05',103,'Released','Many want to change the world... Few want to change themselves','Even the Rain',53596,3.127,7,'lfjROoB2O-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27498,_binary '\0','/wAboktxL62w3OhkG92kkUAlSxtp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1422119',6.5,2043,'zh','春风沉醉的夜晚','Hired to spy on a philandering husband, Luo Haitao soon becomes entangled in a clandestine affair with the other man. Along with Luo\'s girlfriend, they succumb to the delirium of drunken nights, but how long can their tryst last?','/9OLJx4JHimNTsRIw7Y0ObzJouP9.jpg','2010-04-14',116,'Released','Drifting bodies… raging desires.','Spring Fever',117646,1.9188,6.2,'U0DTUErg9-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27499,_binary '\0','/s6KaChxxqdJBna0PZ50QBBwmwdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1422122',7.8,6522,'ro','Amintiri din epoca de aur','Composed of six unconventional vignettes, each one dealing with the late communist period in Romania, a narrative is told through its urban myths from the perspective of ordinary people. The title refers to the alluded \"Golden Age\" of the last 15 years of Ceaușescu\'s regime.','/nZN1CSj8xiSCdO6Tmg2d3YI78vi.jpg','2009-05-29',155,'Released',NULL,'Tales from the Golden Age',39376,1.9856,7,'Dq366VCmS2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27500,_binary '\0','/3MWKCgI8dQGcWS1VL1fACItfWP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000','tt1422136',6.2,32417,'en','A Lonely Place to Die','A group of five mountaineers are hiking and climbing in the Scottish Highlands when they discover a young Serbian girl buried in a small chamber in the wilderness. They become caught up in a terrifying game of cat and mouse with the kidnappers as they try to get the girl to safety.','/xVYY1U5nYfx2PfJMs6knO8VZRk0.jpg','2011-04-09',99,'Released','Out here, there\'s nowhere to hide.','A Lonely Place to Die',81390,4.2519,6.2,'MhfbdaQ_ub0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:07.000000'),(27501,_binary '\0','/zgtnaBVDNkV2HjL1FF9CoxPQCNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422184',7.2,3127,'tr','11\'e 10 Kala','Mithat passionately collects newspapers in his Istanbul flat. The other tenants ridicule him and he lives a lonely life. As the building is to be renovated, Mithat develops a friendship with concierge Ali, another loner, who helps him save his collection. They involuntarily change each other’s fate.','/zCsMTCilA6isEZd1cmxxA13OWrU.jpg','2009-09-25',125,'Released',NULL,'10 to 11',50129,1.3675,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27502,_binary '\0','/rniS6AOKTOr5PV7Xok6m7QSzlXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14225838',7.6,18422,'it','Io capitano','Longing for a brighter future, two Senegalese teenagers embark on a journey from West Africa to Italy. However, between their dreams and reality lies a labyrinth of checkpoints, the Sahara Desert, and the vast waters of the Mediterranean.','/kGlZFwUQI5gAUdySNFfqGIkAF9n.jpg','2023-09-07',121,'Released',NULL,'Io Capitano',937746,6.826,7.8,'5Mg_AiPGw-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27503,_binary '\0','/pdi38HgS48AZJ1d6aJJmkJ0y71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422651',8,1787,'ja','劇場版 天元突破グレンラガン 螺巌篇','Seven years have passed after the battle of Teppelin... Humans have since reclaimed the surface of the earth and enjoy an unprecedented period of peace and prosperity. However, humanity\'s increasing population growth triggers the sudden emergence of an unknown, powerful enemy. The fearsome, manipulative power of the mysterious Anti-Spiral proves too overwhelming for humans to even fight back. When everyone becomes desperate and loses hope, Team Dai-Gurren members reunite to stand up once again!','/fJ1NsL2A7dwY63mBkHdP1K4kD3T.jpg','2009-04-25',126,'Released',NULL,'Gurren Lagann the Movie: The Lights in the Sky Are Stars',23452,3.7489,7.9,'PpOcJL88AcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27504,_binary '\0','/azq7VxyVix8yFF7rjKwFVhiSkXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422674',5.2,2342,'ja','呪怨 黒い少女','The supernatural grudge manifests itself by way of a strange cyst growing in the body of a young woman, slowly draining all life from her in revenge for... what?','/4p92Qh9aXeeV1ZoB5gurETs2X3g.jpg','2009-06-27',61,'Released',NULL,'Ju-On: Black Ghost',36917,2.2192,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27505,_binary '\0','/4f1apTKL3cFrpUQQIMFdRxO9Ecb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422675',5.8,2859,'ja','呪怨 白い老女','An apparitions of a young schoolgirl in a yellow rain hat, a family massacre, and a law student\'s suicide after he fails his bar exam are linked by the ominous recordings discovered on an audio cassette.','/7rQTZ4BM5yDbOOYxYCtxZb2qkch.jpg','2009-06-27',61,'Released',NULL,'Ju-On: White Ghost',26693,2.2398,6.154,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27506,_binary '\0','/fc2pEZgr0ltmyzLl4cO9JInOg6l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14227048',5.7,33988,'en','Family Switch','When the Walker family members switch bodies with each other during a rare planetary alignment, their hilarious journey to find their way back to normal will bring them closer together than they ever thought possible.','/g8Gwitm4CtZBSYhLeSY4Z3Xwwcg.jpg','2023-11-30',106,'Released','The Walker family is about to change lives. Literally.','Family Switch',798021,7.6868,6.4,'SWh4c9EVqGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27507,_binary '\0','/r7ESeXAMywgQudo8TyfduJcju8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422800',5,2078,'en','Beneath the Dark','Driving to a wedding in Los Angeles through the Mojave Desert, Paul and Adrienne pull off the highway and into Roy\'s Motel and Cafe. This roadside artifact proves to be a strange and surreal place with an unsettling mix of travelers, who force our couple to discover the secret hidden between them and ultimately, the horrifying reality of their current situation.','/ibgJKgRuPwLJbHJhhQmVqVGILuk.jpg','2010-11-05',102,'Released','Bring out the truth.','Beneath the Dark',49004,1.6882,4.8,'AEs-IYwcq1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27508,_binary '\0','/2pwTNwqpyOmnWPfaUx1QfF0xXmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422811',6.2,1915,'tr','Ali\'nin Sekiz Günü','Ali is a young man whose life passes as a routine between his house and the little shop he owns. Everything changes when she meets Zeynep, a girl who\'s recently moved to the neighbourhood.','/4vaxBcwDkDueyvnE3b9fvppHjFR.jpg','2009-05-08',107,'Released',NULL,'Ali\'s Eight Days',52194,1.5316,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27509,_binary '\0','/4mCpxy546XLOMuw8sugT6ucp3sc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1422835',6.9,1352,'tr','Dilber\'in Sekiz Günü','Dilber lives with her family in a very poor eastern village, her only dream is to marry her childhood lover, Ali. But when she finds out that it won\'t happen because of a reason that she can\'t get away with, she gets crazy and lock herself up in her family\'s barn. Then she makes everybody knows that she\'ll marry the first guy who proposes and won\'t leave the barn till that happens. One day, a limping man comes to the village. He\'s alone and has heard that there\'s a girl in that village who\'s ready to marry him.','/n7y9t8wRpnK1xqDHz1KDWW81sNe.jpg','2009-04-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Dilber\'in Sekiz Günü',51152,1.5348,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27510,_binary '\0','/vdoYF00jMugy088Mql4MiKvk3bR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14229154',4.8,2097,'en','The Breach','John Hawkins is set to retire from his post as police chief of the small town of Lone Crow, that is tucked away in the deep woods of northern Ontario. But following the discovery of a gruesome body with uncanny injuries, he’s pulled into an investigation to solve the horrifying mystery, which evades explanation.','/lZkVZ79Sew7T2tEEEccpBw47k6r.jpg','2022-07-25',93,'Released',NULL,'The Breach',805473,2.0017,4.6,'JNd-kZKZgl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27511,_binary '\0','/iloUOSs3Rcq3aMr04CrGRWVVBkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14230388',6.4,147058,'en','Asteroid City','In an American desert town circa 1955, the itinerary of a Junior Stargazer/Space Cadet convention is spectacularly disrupted by world-changing events.','/hfo7pvL9Fys7rocfL4VOzw9qDEQ.jpg','2023-06-08',105,'Released','\"You can\'t wake up if you don\'t fall asleep\"','Asteroid City',747188,13.1737,6.5,'9FXCSXuGTF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27512,_binary '\0','/zh6IdheEYinU4TPtorWsjx6qPQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14230458',7.7,423101,'en','Poor Things','Brought back to life by an unorthodox scientist, a young woman runs off with a lawyer on a whirlwind adventure across the continents. Free from the prejudices of her times, she grows steadfast in her purpose to stand for equality and liberation.','/kCGlIMHnOm8JPXq3rXM6c5wMxcT.jpg','2023-12-07',141,'Released','She’s nothing like you’ve ever seen.','Poor Things',792307,22.4971,7.629,'-EfYJWRw2FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27513,_binary '\0','/gL7bOfeLCQm2b8sClY4mBy2fRoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14230846',6.3,2089,'pa','Saunkan Saunkne','A couple married for more than 7 years loses hope for a child. On insistence of his wife he marries her sister. Shortly small squabbles between the two wives lead to comic situation and fun begins.','/rMAreVJF8PxvKFSUNsTYyCuJdTi.jpg','2022-05-13',150,'Released',NULL,'Saunkan Saunkne',957997,0.7662,5.8,'EDWyME3ay_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27514,_binary '\0','/1b8QiVh9EYojUpdp7HO4ZGnPzJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423592',6.5,2043,'tl','Kinatay','A young man tries to make some money so he can marry his girlfriend. He takes a job for $2,000 and then soon realizes that this job involves killing a woman.','/5HisC856GsPrrC6DbgWEl1IjX7x.jpg','2009-09-23',105,'Released','Journey into darkness.','Butchered',64450,1.4986,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27515,_binary '\0','/y7PsnD6oe00OVpDesy0bo0lhQQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14236064',6.5,1233,'ja','ボクたちはみんな大人になれなかった','Prodded by a friend request, a feckless forty-something recalls his past relationships from the 90s onward, looking for his vanished hopes and dreams.','/z3ul9VzWk8Vk5ic7EKujLn8eDeP.jpg','2021-11-05',124,'Released',NULL,'We Couldn\'t Become Adults',785544,2.0734,6.355,'QudoMSz0e6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27516,_binary '\0','/j0yxlws8fOY4KdwrOyhc8ZTlOsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14237398',4.9,1590,'te','Tempt Raja','Tempt Raja is a Telugu movie starring Veernala Rama Krishna Rao, Divya Rao and Aasma in prominent roles. It is a comedy drama movie directed by Veernala Rama Krishna Rao with T. Shankar as a musician, forming part of the crew.','/ApbpMA0NT6RCIAmtevUZev8sYhe.jpg','2021-04-16',107,'Released',NULL,'Tempt Raja',869450,1.6045,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27517,_binary '\0','/p6LMRDs7yG2meMDW2WFwc7YKhuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423894',7.3,27504,'en','Barney\'s Version','The picaresque and touching story of the politically incorrect, fully lived life of the impulsive, irascible and fearlessly blunt Barney Panofsky.','/vdsSaFbBWl8N6RV2XJuPBFyKeV8.jpg','2010-10-26',134,'Released','First he got married. Then he got married again. Then he met the love of his life.','Barney\'s Version',46829,3.9774,7,'OtNlrEBrp8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27518,_binary '\0','/4lYR9hLiG6EBbrNPsZMgWV8lzH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423922',6.2,1250,'es','De tu ventana a la mía','Interwoven emotions and struggles of three women of different generations aiming to build the lives they desire, their own future, love and dreams. All of them lose the love of their lives and they will have to pursue their happiness and fight for their dignity in a dark and hostile word.','/80Z1XgeQoseTk6C4FaXM3o92lK0.jpg','2011-10-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Chrysalis',85452,1.3254,6.8,'xg7J8VfGPnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27519,_binary '\0','/mRNApJoPyMgbfSQ4SMvN7QqrbFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423927',6.4,1307,'ar','النوم في العسل','Officer Magdy investigates the suicide of a groom on his wedding night. He knows that the groom was impotent. Later he realizes that impotence is becoming an epidemic that spreads among all men. However, no one wants to declare that out of shame.','/hv1L4MfYQCKWXp8Bz1hBeiJZYN.jpg','1996-02-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Oblivion',86899,1.4084,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27520,_binary '\0','/qtgONggcOZpraax4VpF0hGE9R8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423939',6.9,4031,'ar','حسن و مرقص','A terrorist Muslim group calls for the execution of Sheikh Hassan for refusing to join their organisation. At the same time, a priest ,Marcos, is also facing death threats. Both men seek help from the government, who puts them under the witness protection program, giving each man the other\'s identity.','/1U4K5FYViv3PvPofin257UiAdch.jpg','2008-07-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Hassan and Marcus',57836,1.4642,6.533,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27521,_binary '\0','/hLlaTznCqzSFp3ysItlBaAinbXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423953',7,1480,'ja','ライアーゲーム ザ・ファイナルステージ','In Liar game: Final Stage, Players are encouraged to trust each other to win the tournament. However, a mysterious player named X is secretly plotting to sabotage everyone of their chances to win the LGT.','/lRFqPafC2HnRUwB7EK1935hNdke.jpg','2010-03-06',133,'Released',NULL,'Liar Game: The Final Stage',50461,2.0103,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27522,_binary '\0','/ayaq7zQUiBIzsQAYSvtjfZb0RK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423961',6.5,4030,'ar','مرجان أحمد مرجان','Morgan, who is an uneducated very rich man, is used to buy everything he wants. Now the one thing we wants is a college certificate which he seeks to buy.','/jO4SRCoTryFWneJxul71iFYR9Qg.jpg','2007-07-04',115,'Released',NULL,'Morgan Ahmed Morgan',406878,1.0361,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27523,_binary '\0','/vJFZLY3v9Ol8BGzVLNTZy2z3jvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1423995',5.4,44220,'en','Stone','Parole officer Jack Mabry has only a few weeks left before retirement and wishes to finish out the cases he\'s been assigned. One such case is that of Gerald \'Stone\' Creeson, a convicted arsonist who is up for parole. Jack is initially reluctant to indulge Stone in the coarse banter he wishes to pursue and feels little sympathy for the prisoner\'s pleads for an early release. Seeing little hope in convincing Jack himself, Stone arranges for his wife to seduce the officer, but motives and intentions steadily blur amidst the passions and buried secrets of the corrupted players in this deadly game of deception.','/mcdN6DntOAOtKNQKcRKnfFayFis.jpg','2010-10-07',105,'Released','Some People Tell Lies. Others Live Them.','Stone',44113,5.181,5.3,'evhh3NE3fyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27524,_binary '\0','/rFxAofKYV00AEuaXuuVJofRrPiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424003',6.3,7183,'en','The Infidel','Based in a London suburb Mahmud Nasir lives with his wife, Saamiya, and two children, Rashid and Nabi. His son plans to marry Uzma, the step-daughter of Egyptian-born Arshad Al-Masri, a so-called \'Hate Cleric\' from Waziristan, Pakistan. Mahmud, who is not exactly a devout Muslim, he drinks alcohol, and does not pray five times, but does agree that he will appease Arshad, without whose approval the marriage cannot take place. Shortly thereafter Mahmud, while going over his recently deceased mother\'s documents, will find out that he was adopted, his birth parents were Jewish, and his name is actually Solly Shimshillewitz.','/LxwGYJQUFcxzIFOVT4pmxCVjia.jpg','2010-02-18',105,'Released','A Comedy Of Ethnic Proportions','The Infidel',42171,2.686,6.128,'9D9OKhg_kDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27525,_binary '\0','/wKPRS8GmIxjV8obWbWC1WsNdUfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424310',6,26553,'cn','十二生肖','Asian Hawk leads a mercenary team to recover several lost artifacts from the Old Summer Palace, the bronze heads of the twelve Chinese Zodiac animals which were sacked by the French and British armies from the imperial Summer Palace in Beijing in 1860. Assisted by a Chinese student and a Parisian woman, Hawk stops at nothing to accomplish the mission.','/zlC6cN9dYIT6FjQVx026s9pFLIu.jpg','2012-12-20',123,'Released','Twelve heads. Five continents. One man.','Chinese Zodiac',98567,9.0933,6.2,'OPQogQKVeTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27526,_binary '\0','/hDbQF1h1ncMlbu5UUW8qAA8o3gN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424327',7.3,6791,'he','עיניים פקוחות','A middle-aged Orthodox Jew, Aaron, living and working in Jerusalem with his wife and children, meets a homeless 19-year-old student. Aaron offers to give Ezri work as his assistant at his family\'s butcher shop. The two men grow close and their attraction becomes sexual. Aaron must now confront his own sexuality, his feelings for Ezri, and his obligations to his family and faith.','/15AKmO30arWmZ4WuTaPdVugWZbr.jpg','2009-05-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Eyes Wide Open',37810,1.6231,6.5,'rwBaS6m3q5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27527,_binary '\0','/zlcY9lB8LImEh0qtqI2CwYkrRNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424361',6.4,1314,'pt','Morrer Como Um Homem','A transgender woman attempts to rehabilitate her younger, drug-addicted boyfriend while also dealing with her ne’er-do-well son, a soldier who’s gone AWOL.','/s2SdVFz3lamXDQADrdwEBJN7VI.jpg','2009-10-15',133,'Released','You were already here before entering, and you will remain after you have left','To Die Like a Man',95538,1.3612,5.6,'BdPHZajMtn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27528,_binary '\0','/yVSgw4UyXWg0Edl7KMehdhhgIwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424381',6.4,264750,'en','Predators','A group of cold-blooded killers find themselves trapped on an alien planet to be hunted by extraterrestrial Predators.','/wdniP8NDaJIydi1hMxhpbJMUfr6.jpg','2010-07-07',107,'Released','They are the most dangerous killers on the planet. But this is not our planet.','Predators',34851,14.0775,6.31,'N2jJOy8rzog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27529,_binary '\0','/pjLOR8a3iluOZjiMS6twuUSotEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424431',6.8,3426,'ru','Царь','In 16th-century Russia in the grip of chaos, Ivan the Terrible strongly believes he is vested with a holy mission. Believing he can understand and interpret the signs, he sees the Last Judgment approaching. He establishes absolute power, cruelly destroying anyone who gets in his way. During this reign of terror, Philip, the superior of the monastery on the Solovetsky Islands, a great scholar and Ivan\'s close friend, dares to oppose the sovereign\'s mystical tyranny. What follows is a clash between two completely opposite visions of the world, smashing morality and justice, God and men. A grand-scale film with excellent leading roles by Mamonov and Yankovsky. An allegory of Stalinist Russia','/fV9iAomcH9J8nuo2kjSVzo3SF8U.jpg','2009-11-04',119,'Released',NULL,'Tsar',41545,1.8073,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27530,_binary '\0','/sS3jaC2SXoeYmjAuqPeoeelPZqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424432',8.4,84302,'en','Senna','The remarkable story of Brazilian racing driver Ayrton Senna, charting his physical and spiritual achievements on the track and off, his quest for perfection, and the mythical status he has since attained, is the subject of Senna, a documentary feature that spans the racing legend\'s years as an F1 driver, from his opening season in 1984 to his untimely death a decade later.','/nZbLCbRoP6iJq5sr8daHQzjnzFh.jpg','2010-10-07',106,'Released','No fear. No limits. No equal.','Senna',58496,4.7528,8.1,'sfosF-ZAbR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27531,_binary '\0','/tMB8ABBIJ8w2qzuRaDPWTDorAMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14247286',6.3,4192,'it','4 metà','In this rom-com challenging the concept of soulmates, parallel storylines portray four single friends as they pair up in different couple combinations.','/oYCNbQH7QjilbVrcfIkBi1RxsrE.jpg','2022-01-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Four to Dinner',832277,1.7195,6.152,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27532,_binary '\0','/72G2cjD0sVmpkQqFkSmADUz0g5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1424797',7.4,32841,'fr','J\'ai tué ma mère','Hubert, a brash 17-year-old, is confused and torn by a love-hate relationship with his mother that consumes him more and more each day. After distressing ordeals and tragic episodes, Hubert will find his mother on the banks of Saint Lawrence river, where he grew up, and where a murder will be committed: the murder of childhood.','/nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg','2009-06-05',100,'Released','Sons forget their mothers can die.','I Killed My Mother',26280,4.1949,7.4,'iECgGlD9dK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27533,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425252',3.3,1288,'en','The Crypt','Six young criminals break into hidden catacombs underneath their town and attempt to steal jewelry buried from the \"Great Depression\" only to find inhabitants guarding the precious belongings. After being trapped in this dark maze of crypts the group tries to escape alive.','/a0FoO8rUdzUJ1tnUTvSyWxKWwB9.jpg','2009-07-15',84,'Released','Some things are better left buried','The Crypt',21562,0.5875,4.3,'aK6DMPYI3zw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27534,_binary '\0','/mt1wqDyoEwqAESSzl9ElbomTPYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425253',5.3,3274,'en','Shadow','A Young soldier returning from Iraq goes on a high mountain adventure in a desolate place in Europe to forget his past, he will lear truth in a mysterious local legend discovering that reality can be sicker than nightmares.','/6mGtMVwXrv8vGAoYKeS1889fruU.jpg','2009-12-12',77,'Released','Reality Can Be Sicker Than Nightmares','Shadow',37813,1.4334,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27535,_binary '\0','/A21DGQkh8io9CsBtyDCTbeSh0VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425257',6.4,9566,'zh','苏乞儿','Su Qi-Er, a wealthy man living during the Qing Dynasty who loses his fortune and reputation as a result of a conspiracy against him. After being forced out onto the streets, Su dedicates his life to martial arts and reemerges as a patriotic hero known as the \"King of Beggars.\"','/6UICxESwvJbvRHdgT0jenH1xPmW.jpg','2010-02-09',115,'Released',NULL,'True Legend',37034,5.4485,6.586,'gLgnZYNf84c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27536,_binary '\0','/13G8CxUld2HN0PcWHPWcwYODIh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14252742',7.1,3419,'te','एक Mini కధ','Santosh suffers from a psychological problem that causes him to be insecure about his size. Struggling to find a solution, he erases the idea of marriage altogether until he meets Amrutha, with whom he falls in love.','/wLwHCq5RADXcTth2TBF7eUd88wx.jpg','2021-05-27',136,'Released',NULL,'Ek Mini Katha',833414,1.0955,6.5,'ikY-tkRFTgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27537,_binary '\0','/lw4jl7sF6bNOb9GJVaB6UKRPcyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14253138',5.7,1784,'en','Mistletoe Mixup','Holly is a young workaholic with no time for romance, or the holidays. She ends up meeting two great guys on the same day, but unbeknownst to her, they turn out to be brothers. While on a holiday ski trip, a sibling rivalry ensues for her affection. Will she find true love this Christmas, or spend another holiday alone?','/rhiVfwztl8lQSJx2LHfnLDTyTQu.jpg','2021-12-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Mistletoe Mixup',911758,2.0525,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27538,_binary '\0','/lHhRU3jEnju4pKibOeYOgxaEw2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14253846',6.7,65667,'da','Speak No Evil','A Danish family visits a Dutch family they met on a holiday. What was supposed to be an idyllic weekend slowly starts unraveling as the Danes try to stay polite in the face of unpleasantness.','/ukYuuFzPTumN1QNpQyz863bcNvr.jpg','2022-03-17',98,'Released',NULL,'Speak No Evil',833339,9.2473,6.6,'UhWiiDhmBCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27539,_binary '\0','/nSVwus6Vcnw06zqKAa1ioacrpUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14257582',6.5,107814,'en','Wolfs','Hired to cover up a high-profile crime, a fixer soon finds his night spiralling out of control when he\'s forced to work with an unexpected counterpart.','/vOX1Zng472PC2KnS0B9nRfM8aaZ.jpg','2024-09-20',108,'Released','They\'re not partners. They\'re not friends. They\'re wolfs.','Wolfs',877817,11.5977,6.546,'5RSUcuGIiI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27540,_binary '\0','/91LTJhQdL9F61ShXSxoKjtLUrfp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14257662',6.7,3065,'en','MoviePass, MovieCrash','Exploring the company founding and the implosion of the business by outside investors who took over the company, left it bankrupt and under investigation.','/eWht9uFRrqmqnLDL5F9grwUiL62.jpg','2024-03-09',89,'Released','From show business to no business.','MoviePass, MovieCrash',1229898,3.7691,6.608,'3G75RASEmUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27541,_binary '\0','/62p194Ai0TzmDabuDsVT9McJdIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425922',4.8,2502,'en','Black Nativity','A street-wise teen from Baltimore who has been raised by a single mother travels to New York City to spend the Christmas holiday with his estranged relatives, where he embarks on a surprising and inspirational journey.','/dIOk8uCYZMP69D6WhiRCZAGX9kE.jpg','2013-11-27',93,'Released','The Musical Event of the Holiday Season','Black Nativity',175541,1.8006,5.2,'sOT5QY2bxxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27542,_binary '\0','/j42ffT1b2VabQnDnzfrvX8KqUVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425928',5.7,4098,'ja','吸血少女対少女フランケン','A reconstructed girl is created from the pieces of a vampire girl\'s mini-butchery. Slaughter abounds as both of them pursue the same boy.','/qPtvA9lFvR5TyMGeIcxpI3lueGL.jpg','2009-08-15',84,'Released','Two Classic Monsters. One F****ed Up Movie.','Vampire Girl vs. Frankenstein Girl',36577,1.6812,5.6,'aAGMzxhk3Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27543,_binary '\0','/bScN9Seer3zZe5QxeOkohO8wTa5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1425933',6.7,2108,'en','Skeletons','In writer-director Nick Whitfield\'s black indie comedy, a pair of \"exorcists\" (Ed Gaughan and Andrew Buckley) with the power to rid people of their secrets agree to help a woman (Paprika Steen) whose daughter (Tuppence Middleton) is mute -- and whose husband is missing. Jason Isaacs co-stars as the mysterious Colonel, who seems to be calling the shots from the sidelines of the duo\'s shadowy enterprise.','/4vLoiTYMIXTLcec4WjnTX0YEE4Y.jpg','2010-07-16',94,'Released','Two men. One secret. No problem.','Skeletons',46909,1.097,5.7,'3gHoqkznBTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27544,_binary '\0','/7sIU6DdydcWn7ovVPRXs1K0s6QW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14260080',5.3,4492,'hi','हैलो चार्ली','Charlie, a simpleton daydreamer, currently a pizza delivery boy is tasked with driving his uncle\'s truck , Girnaar Express, to deliver a gorilla from Mumbai to the jetty at Diu. However, Charlie is unaware that Gorilla is disguised business tycoon MD Makwana, who is on the run after committing a multi-crore scam.','/8dhYgQ0nsFRIIXOKBNHW0hUTDyN.jpg','2021-04-09',102,'Released',NULL,'Hello Charlie',807072,1.0521,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27545,_binary '\0','/Rsh1NIh9Xlwp6bTs4djjdDcZrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14260566',7.2,2663,'en','The Great Lillian Hall','Lillian Hall, a Broadway actress, has never missed a performance throughout her long, illustrious career. Yet in rehearsals for a new play her confidence is challenged. People and events conspire to take away her ability to do what she loves most.','/2ogNnNAmteEYlhf8iW4rPXgfYNW.jpg','2024-06-30',111,'Released','Art transcends life.','The Great Lillian Hall',800513,3.3078,7.1,'3EZyqr0kDtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27546,_binary '\0','/wP0NGOGf2PG4lHXHWEqFW0kBOye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14260836',7.5,47511,'en','Better Man','Follow Robbie Williams\' journey from childhood, to being the youngest member of chart-topping boyband Take That, through to his unparalleled achievements as a record-breaking solo artist – all the while confronting the challenges that stratospheric fame and success can bring.','/fbGCmMp0HlYnAPv28GOENPShezM.jpg','2024-12-06',135,'Released','Fame makes monkeys of us all.','Better Man',799766,10.9389,7.6,'KVeH5T4wxkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27547,_binary '\0','/2vZczXItuWuDhjv9SdnbRQvu90H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426320',5.9,1588,'en','BearCity','Set in New York\'s gay \"bear\" scene and taking a cue from the popular HBO franchise \"Sex and the City,\" BearCity follows a tight-knit pack of friends experiencing comical mishaps, emotionally sweet yet lusty romantic encounters and a cast of colorful, diverse characters as they gear up for a big party weekend','/tfYnt1caU4YhpHMyMvdxq6xW4jw.jpg','2010-06-08',103,'Released','Romance can be hairy','BearCity',51764,2.0344,5.6,'BtYI7pbRyNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27548,_binary '\0','/fRpJYkNkd6gKguUVVM8JpN6khbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426329',6.2,44940,'en','Lovelace','Story of Linda Lovelace, who is used and abused by the porn industry at the behest of her coercive husband, before taking control of her life.','/ibt7chnBsaDbE6ZVwyneuZwYfsC.jpg','2013-08-08',92,'Released','The truth goes deeper than you think.','Lovelace',77805,6.2501,6.016,'2gJrCfNNzA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27549,_binary '\0','/ujjXotKDnHG9pyUtr4JCSPuXGlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426352',6.1,7028,'fr','Amer','Ana is confronted with body and desire at three key moments of her life. As a young girl, she brings her dead grandpa back to life. In her puberty, she discovers the power of decay and sexuality. Finally, she wrestles with loss and loneliness when she returns to her parental home, now derelict.','/3O3F28FVnle4CgZM0i324wntxZU.jpg','2009-09-23',90,'Released','A nightmare vision of desire and fear.','Amer',43950,3.264,6.2,'FYcS09xisRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27550,_binary '\0','/b9i6Z6RD8UI4SCtWCzPY1eVdCSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426361',7.1,3266,'bg','Източни пиеси','Two estranged brothers are brought together when they have opposite roles in a racist beating: while Georgi who\'s recently joined a neo-nazi group participates in the violence, Hristo witnesses and rescues a Turkish family. Only by reuniting will the two brothers be able to assess what they really want from life.','/lmGgetgogDi9RPtlApf2zNYYxB9.jpg','2009-10-16',83,'Released',NULL,'Eastern Plays',43738,1.3575,6.4,'6-wfSmiwk-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27551,_binary '\0','/i3FQdpLOWKFvKVOBkQ3L0sGHvBG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426362',6.9,3501,'en','Daddy Longlegs','After months of living a solitary existence, Lenny, 34, picks up his kids from school. Every year he spends a couple of weeks with his sons Sage, 9, and Frey, 7. Lenny hosts his kids within a midtown studio apartment in New York. During these two weeks, he must figure out if he wants to act as their father or be their friend. Ultimately, their trip upstate results in complete lawlessness taking over their lives.','/lnHRAJ5ucoIXDRCVxfdABpK60OS.jpg','2010-04-28',100,'Released','Go Get Some Rosemary.','Daddy Longlegs',58251,2.3309,6.6,'NpQbnh8o810','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27552,_binary '\0','/auORL6gbhGIqN7SaiMw3wevFtZm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426363',5.4,2454,'en','Hairbrained','A fourteen-year-old genius gets rejected by Harvard and ends up at a much lower ranked school where he makes friends with a mature student.','/ifLjWZ40nf5urj5socB2OMOZglE.jpg','2013-11-25',97,'Released','This is Eli Pettifog. He\'s got a score to settle, and it\'s going to get hairy.','Hairbrained',239056,1.6685,5.4,'W2RKT8eimmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27553,_binary '\0','/bZKZV9ouna3ZGyRwkpUlhPY1kxx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426374',7.4,2684,'es','Los viajes del viento','After his wife\'s death, a vallenato singer from Majagual, Sucre, decides to quit music and return his allegedly cursed accordion to his master. He is joined by Fermín Morales, a teenage boy who admires him and wishes to follow his footsteps. Together, they start a journey throughout several towns in Northern Colombia to Taroa, in La Guajira desert, where the singer\'s master supposedly lives.','/mmdvtUbeNDyPIgytDepDcWpLlud.jpg','2009-04-30',117,'Released','A musician travels a great distance to return an instrument to his elderly teacher.','The Wind Journeys',39378,1.0484,6.9,'6M5bQ3CmWGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27554,_binary '\0','/8yGsGMSD5kP6lFuPO2xS6bM6muz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426378',7.1,7702,'fa','کسی از گربه‌های ایرانی خبر نداره','Iranian musicians Negar and Ashkan look for band members to play at a London concert ... and the visa that allows them to leave Tehran to do so.','/fhsZEUHpo6hRw4IKJE5qL2oRiUb.jpg','2009-12-23',106,'Released',NULL,'No One Knows About Persian Cats',51413,1.1735,6.8,'LJU9NSOloMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27555,_binary '\0','/7Uk5S4SeooD2F6nsAtkOrXxzfr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14263818',7.7,1451,'en','Surviving Ohio State','Delves into the sexual abuse scandal surrounding athletics doctor Richard Strauss, whose two-decade tenure at The Ohio State University saw the abuse of hundreds of students, and the ongoing quest for justice and accountability by his survivors.','/lIQzTlFigckFQpeqVqsKDFcc4uP.jpg','2025-06-09',111,'Released','A scandal in Buckeye Nation.','Surviving Ohio State',1465569,2.0578,7.5,'iSP3PUHmCvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27556,_binary '\0','/iEi7zXoVUVXYNeVxBzdt68jegqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14263856',4.7,11069,'en','Last the Night','During the pandemic, a burned-out teacher on the verge of a breakdown overhears his students making fun of him in a Zoom class and vows revenge.','/4ansctfgMbWWWUgVVJOFtAZYEJA.jpg','2022-07-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Last the Night',990982,1.7424,5.1,'QrZSkMeKNmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27557,_binary '\0','/gMItMzDOyrfQGZsMWRM9tdxq5cV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14264694',4.3,4702,'en','Worldbreaker','Five years ago, a tear in the fabric of reality brought creatures to our world from an alternate dimension bent on our destruction. A father hides his daughter on an island to keep her safe while he prepares her for survival and the battles to come. But when the world is about to break, no place is safe.','/ahj1JU8r0uJv7QII5Uj7tKzbEsC.jpg','2025-10-30',95,'Released','The future belongs to those who fight.','Worldbreaker',1196067,10.4235,5.983,'A1sfyF8YKOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27558,_binary '\0','/5xfyi92J0MRttID4vFTPK3OmhgH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14264844',7.8,2558,'en','P!nk: All I Know So Far','A behind-the-scenes look at P!NK as she balances family and life on the road, leading up to her first Wembley Stadium performance on 2019\'s \"Beautiful Trauma\" world tour.','/vtoEBoGvrSJuDPfQ3rPELqIcG5e.jpg','2021-05-21',99,'Released',NULL,'P!nk: All I Know So Far',807597,2.1941,7.7,'EWcuGM8zjh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27559,_binary '\0','/yajv4It3IG4aUfWKXCv4D2bhGjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14265992',3.9,2456,'en','Aileen Wuornos: American Boogeywoman','Based on Aileen Wuornos’s early life, this is the true story of America’s most notorious female serial killer, who went on a killing spree in Florida in 1989 and 1990. What few people know, is that back in 1976 a young and beautiful Aileen Wuornos arrived in Florida searching for a new life that would help her escape her tragic past, married a wealthy Yacht Club President and had the chance to start again as part of Florida’s high society... or did she?','/9g1ZUcVDEOTsS9U1ifRMCgSVoH6.jpg','2021-09-20',86,'Released','America\'s most notorious female serial killer.','Aileen Wuornos: American Boogeywoman',806804,3.0508,5.1,'8m4TZTtUjDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27560,_binary '\0','/bNnNlUjf16ahEw0uv39NUeQ35YR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14267154',4.1,2481,'en','Ripper Untold','A detective and a medical examiner join forces to solve a series of horrific murders in Victorian London - but one of them harbors a deadly secret.','/eJ0q6GIac00TvanshEDREQ79mpz.jpg','2021-06-28',85,'Released','No one is safe.','Ripper Untold',820511,3.5241,6.1,'wxJYPy8AVro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27561,_binary '\0','/rnMAZ2sBiZI05HPvcOS6bBJMfgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1426937',7,1224,'te','నేనింతే','Ravi is an assistant director who dreams of making his own film, but producers are hesitant. Meanwhile, he falls in love with dancer Sandhya, an aspiring heroine with struggles of her own.','/x2HnxPPoyNnSDi9p3ZaTC9ejlOn.jpg','2008-12-18',145,'Released',NULL,'Neninthe',137452,2.1535,7.091,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27562,_binary '\0','/hjyqNFHx5wIO8dqaRi0v2ix1wiR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14270702',5.8,9553,'en','God Is a Bullet','Vice detective Bob Hightower finds his ex-wife murdered and daughter kidnapped by a cult. Frustrated by the botched official investigations, he quits the force and infiltrates the cult to hunt down the leader with the help of the cult’s only female victim escapee, Case Hardin.','/5kiLS9nsSJxDdlYUyYGiSUt8Fi8.jpg','2023-06-22',155,'Released','Say your prayers.','God Is a Bullet',808396,6.1265,6.258,'7VBB5ZcfI28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27563,_binary '\0','/jvulRWEbRnDpUx0UUBB42IuTe87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14270848',5.5,3105,'it','Rapiniamo il Duce','Near the end of WWII, a young bootlegger and his nightclub-singing girlfriend assemble a ragtag team for an dangerous heist: to steal Mussolini\'s treasure right from his headquarters.','/cbdHqb0kZTgF7jQbUw41KEYVInb.jpg','2022-10-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Robbing Mussolini',873125,2.663,5.6,'bKaj4gXor2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27564,_binary '\0','/8bJSeOlW0mPYIzlGiyK8T22sa2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1427298',4.9,11264,'en','The Human Race','A cancer survivor, an amputee, several immigrants, and many others are snatched from a Los Angeles street and forced to take part in a deadly race.','/fndNxZPL4XXN0e9n9SauYlwt25H.jpg','2013-04-10',87,'Released','Race or die!','The Human Race',185267,1.07,4.9,'YhdIy0dQCx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27565,_binary '\0','/rYhfAah0o7ZNklrTsKW3lStKUaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14275050',6.7,2069,'fr','Plus que jamais','Hélène, a 33-year-old woman from Bordeaux, France, lives happily as a couple with Mathieu, her husband of many years. Her life turns upside down the day she learns she has a rare lung disease. Thanks to a blog, she discovers Norway and decides to follow her instinct. Despite all the love she has for her life partner Mathieu, who is very supportive through her illness, she leaves him behind in France and will cross all Europe to Norway alone in search of a new path and to meet a blogger named Mister that she found on the internet.','/d900vS2Xz9XOhYCTE50jwLFZDlo.jpg','2022-11-16',123,'Released',NULL,'More Than Ever',843093,2.8181,6.441,'kOYr8yEFPRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27566,_binary '\0','/aHtZFBjUCSpghKWl2rU7zP6FhRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14279982',7.2,12098,'te','హిట్: ది సెకండ్ కేస్','Krishna Dev aka KD, a laidback cop working in Andhra Pradesh State HIT, takes on a gruesome murder case. As KD unravels the layers of the crime, the stakes rise unbelievably high and the threat comes unusually close.','/tidXGOilCSa5sch1KGiEXrWeYCf.jpg','2022-12-01',124,'Released',NULL,'HIT: The 2nd Case',811945,2.2529,6.849,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27567,_binary '\0','/30ATrJ3bkwMxVpV5S4AC68SE84D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14280066',6.6,3953,'ko','더 박스','A drama about a young man aspiring to become a singer and a washed-up former hit producer. The two men head off on a road trip filled with music and jamming sessions.','/4fQy5OmhJjxWHvuWs731qyydOZ.jpg','2021-03-24',93,'Released','A miracle music buster that will satisfy your five senses.','The Box',728814,1.9282,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27568,_binary '\0','/qPnvAndkTNZJzrulq9ra5zi7Mix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14280366',6.3,1525,'fr','La Brigade','Cathy is a sous-chef wanting to open a restaurant. With financial difficulties, Cathy accepts a job at a shelter for young migrants. At first she hates the job then her passion for cuisine starts to change children\'s lives.','/pymhSBJJWMmzONak9rGcwUcGOH3.jpg','2022-01-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Kitchen Brigade',845140,2.8439,6.4,'kCV5tZVKppM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27569,_binary '\0','/wWdrMUUwLl4gfd28uH1edzERjLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1428453',6.2,1218,'fi','Prinsessa','Princess tells the true story of former cabaret dancer Anna Lappalainen\'s redemptive struggle with insanity, who checked in to Finland\'s Kellokoski Psychiatric Hospital in 1945.','/dcn8Fzr4QXXr32hf7MPIdJDv3AE.jpg','2010-09-10',104,'Released','Happier than the rest of us?','Princess',60678,0.9395,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27570,_binary '\0','/hAuMdJGaBrjT9shwS0w5jQowiyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1428459',5.7,4348,'hi','वी आर फैमिली','Maya is the perfect mother. Her life revolves around her three children, Aleya, Ankush, and Anjali. Who thinks nothing much then the world of her. Despite being divorced from her husband, Aman. Maya has ensured that everything runs smoothly in her house, under her watch, and that they continue to remain a happy family unit. However, when Aman introduces his girlfriend, Shreya a career oriented woman, who has a lot to learn about children\'s, to the family, the situation immediately takes an unexpected turn. When an incident changes their lives drastically, bringing the two women under the same roof, they find themselves putting to test an unusual situation; can two mothers make a home?','/dy2qAtTqe83zCCB55sqVK2g7i1m.jpg','2010-09-03',115,'Released','A family... in an unusual situation.','We Are Family',44972,1.6439,5.7,'OmlnWf6lm8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27571,_binary '\0','/mJSe5dxKu8Sq0GfdjdWVqdGvzfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1428538',6.1,228276,'en','Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters','After getting a taste for blood as children, Hansel and Gretel have become the ultimate vigilantes, hell-bent on retribution. Now, unbeknownst to them, Hansel and Gretel have become the hunted, and must face an evil far greater than witches... their past.','/j343Rpj3WeNvP0SV80zveve70io.jpg','2013-01-17',88,'Released','Revenge is sweeter than candy.','Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters',60304,13.9263,6.11,'ErGy23X0B9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27572,_binary '\0','/6ZaQLu3cXlGREXLooynWH9aMm9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1428556',5.6,3632,'zh','三枪拍案惊奇','Wang is a gloomy, cunning and avaricious noodle shop owner in a desert town in China. His neglected, sharp-tongued wife is involved in a secret affair with Li, one of Wang’s employees. A timid man, Li reluctantly keeps the gun his lover has bought to kill her husband. But Wang is watching their every move. He bribes patrol officer Zhang to murder the illicit couple. It seems like a perfect plan: the affair will come to a cruel, bloody but satisfying end or so he thinks. The equally wicked Zhang has an agenda of his own. As the plot twists, more blood will flow, and ever greater violence will erupt.','/zqIjReP7BAx3OqKayy7vwIQ1Kqv.jpg','2009-12-11',95,'Released',NULL,'A Woman, a Gun and a Noodle Shop',44555,1.7965,4.9,'LMGBQDpfLnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27573,_binary '\0','/eWYJJComSRrnThuN4HlMmtnP1Nt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14292086',3.7,3443,'en','Nix','When a mysterious entity manifests itself, a family finds themselves on a scary and dark journey into their own self-created madness.','/pmAFOmkhsTXJlRptAgoKn77Odue.jpg','2022-09-30',94,'Released','Don\'t be afraid... It\'s nothing.','Nix',844380,1.4295,5.3,'sZyHP_Nf3wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27574,_binary '\0','/y8rsbapuHK2HqSDpedmNScTguRR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1429313',6.5,1581,'en','Africa United','The extraordinary story of three Rwandan children who attempt to realize the dream of their life: to attend the opening ceremony of the FIFA World Cup 2010 at Johannesburg.','/6KyW0erjBuZOGzIwvUMaj0U0K7b.jpg','2010-10-22',88,'Released','Anything is possible','Africa United',57393,1.3608,6.2,'vUfPmg5INwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27575,_binary '\0','/bNrMlFoMEHTLHAr5no8Ldc81bRX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1429392',5.9,3180,'en','Small Town Murder Songs','A modern, gothic tale of crime and redemption about an aging police officer from a small Ontario Mennonite town who hides a violent past until a local murder upsets the calm of his newly reformed life.','/lGXjm0ikB4cZXiEU47UKxDfbNFI.jpg','2010-09-14',75,'Released',NULL,'Small Town Murder Songs',69794,2.1303,5.3,'VB22oo_f8g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27576,_binary '\0','/dokhedWh0Vxww04leHjJPiaGUZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1429429',5.8,1897,'fr','Coursier','From multicultural Paris to designer Paris, Montmartre to the Champs-Elysées, sleazy sidewalks to high-end galleries... Watch out! Sam the courier is a man on a mission! On his scooter, Sam breaks every rule of the road to make good on the \"express delivery\" promise of the courier service he works for. But however hard he tries, Sam never gets a bonus from his boss, never beats his slicker colleagues and never gets past his Dad, a cop who books him every time. All Sam has up is Nadia, and she will turn on him if he doesn\'t show up for her sister\'s wedding. Trouble is, Sam has one more delivery to make and his day has just gone from bad to worse...','/xhse79Bx2nkapzzIrPrPanrY0rU.jpg','2010-02-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Paris Express',40194,2.5291,5.099,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27577,_binary '\0','/2pv723BfhVMCAwH9onNLX0JpVEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14295590',7.3,11371,'hi','मिसिज़ चैटर्जी वर्सेज़ नॉर्वे','An immigrant Indian mother fights the Norwegian foster care system and legal machinery to win back custody of her children.','/7hh1cvrrryYd3IHQFX8HnslWOkZ.jpg','2023-03-16',135,'Released','A mother\'s fight against a nation.','Mrs. Chatterjee Vs Norway',986594,2.5362,5.872,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27578,_binary '\0','/y2XkiVv21eIpRbYE5ML2yUt4mg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14296268',6.6,2510,'th','เพราะเราคู่กัน THE MOVIE','To avoid unwanted attention, Tine, a college student asks the most popular guy on campus, Sarawat, to pretend to date him — but their fake feelings become real love.','/iXsURq06m7NRzsvShjVHfWDmdAs.jpg','2021-04-22',111,'Released',NULL,'2gether: The Movie',810406,1.5222,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27579,_binary '\0','/q8NOU6y1E5m72n7Rpi4Vcrmk3Vh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14298328',6.3,27676,'en','Look Both Ways','On the night of her college graduation, Natalie\'s life splits into parallel realities after she takes a pregnancy test. What will life and love bring?','/jq8IGJgg16mJ95a5OPyS7eGJaam.jpg','2022-08-16',110,'Released','Wherever life takes you, let love guide you.','Look Both Ways',805327,7.4639,6.827,'8LOx5sD1okU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27580,_binary '\0','/3wpeQ4VaSgaptlisAmX2YR5kdDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430077',3.3,1627,'en','Dark Feed','When a film crew moves into an abandoned psychiatric hospital with a shadowy past to shoot a low budget horror film, they get more than they bargained for. The late nights and lack of sleep begin to take a toll, and the longer this crew works, the more the leaky, wet building seems to be coming back to life, feeding off its new inhabitants. As the shoot wears on, members of the crew exhibit increasingly strange behavior leaving those still sane realizing they need to get out of this place before they too succumb to the building\'s infectious hold, the only problem, the old hospital is not ready to let them go.','/4mTH9110RjPVc5asxgsVKAK7TU5.jpg','2013-03-18',86,'Released','Insanity can be contagious','Dark Feed',178408,0.7643,4.8,'zqvNtZ_4TW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27581,_binary '\0','/mFebVehvN5FvhRR9QUFzorG0R4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14300912',7.1,1498,'en','Procession','Six men who were sexually abused by Catholic clergy as boys become a makeshift family and find empowerment by creating films inspired by their trauma.','/cVhtXaXqCjy8Gdu3TspYPRq4zeP.jpg','2021-11-12',118,'Released',NULL,'Procession',869623,1.1499,6.6,'A0gsjrcAi9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27582,_binary '\0','/h9pnp7eF8NRKEpzqZlWLTvfn8y0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430110',6.7,2280,'fr','Rapt','A rich industrialist is brutally kidnapped. While he physically and mentally degenerates in imprisonment, the kidnappers, police and the board of the company of which he is director negotiate about the ransom of 50 million euro.','/if6eszZDwGpQnPOKNYRL2uWZ8Ad.jpg','2009-11-18',125,'Released','Paying his ransom won\'t bury his secrets.','Rapt',35008,1.3076,6.2,'qP7deUeQ1y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27583,_binary '\0','/xBHq2c25I776tO1VYrDNQaT5xzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14301252',5.4,5626,'en','Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 3','Zed and Addison are beginning their final year at Seabrook High in the town that’s become a safe haven for monsters and humans alike. Zed is anticipating an athletic scholarship that will make him the first Zombie to attend college, while Addison is gearing up for Seabrook’s first international cheer-off competition. Then suddenly, extraterrestrial beings appear around Seabrook, provoking something other than friendly competition.','/vqzdv4nArhuZxd7il0boKaVxQMF.jpg','2022-07-09',88,'Released','They beam down. We rise up.','Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 3',809107,7.9848,7.3,'EGsoC0bWakU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27584,_binary '\0','/bEAQfLTykGg232kJogBlxRYaRqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430132',6.7,530390,'en','The Wolverine','Wolverine faces his ultimate nemesis - and tests of his physical, emotional, and mortal limits - in a life-changing voyage to modern-day Japan.','/t2wVAcoRlKvEIVSbiYDb8d0QqqS.jpg','2013-07-24',126,'Released','When he\'s most vulnerable, he\'s most dangerous.','The Wolverine',76170,3.9966,6.435,'DwG56k6VGOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27585,_binary '\0','/2cU7gM3fkhFUNvahYfC5SmUxApD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14303882',6.3,2244,'ru','Лётчик','December of 1941, Northwestern Front. A German tank column is moving towards Moscow. During a mission to stop the enemy advance, Nikolai Komlev\'s IL-2 is shot down. Komlev manages to crash-land his plane in a remote forest clearing. He\'s alive, but far from friendly territory. Ahead of him is a relentless trial of severe physical and mental endurance. After battling hunger and extreme cold, evading packs of wolves and detachments of Nazi soldiers, the wounded Komlev finally makes it back to safety. But there he faces another challenge, the most life-changing of them all.','/msKnqw1OMiJnQQ7rOFh8Syglxfm.jpg','2021-12-02',105,'Released','A battle for survival.','The Pilot: A Battle for Survival',597859,3.4427,6.484,'n6PK_3Z8IqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27586,_binary '\0','/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430607',7.1,74182,'en','Arthur Christmas','For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title \"Santa\" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.','/brELZkSbkLrcCXJ0xt5hQUMXhut.jpg','2011-11-10',97,'Released','Ever wonder how 2 Billion presents get delivered all in 1 night?','Arthur Christmas',51052,11.2424,6.8,'7tk-WZSqIGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27587,_binary '\0','/eT990B07JBhgomU5nLI2WS1WLTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430612',5.6,46044,'en','Brick Mansions','In a dystopian Detroit, grand houses that once housed the wealthy are now homes of the city\'s most-dangerous criminals. Surrounding the area is a giant wall to keep the rest of Detroit safe. For undercover cop Damien Collier, every day is a battle against corruption as he struggles to bring his father\'s killer, Tremaine, to justice. Meanwhile, Damien and an ex-con named Lino work together to save the city from a plot to destroy it.','/6OopiNRk7lWP0hPsY0eYqq2kQTi.jpg','2014-04-22',90,'Released','Their streets. Their rules.','Brick Mansions',254473,7.1611,5.909,'4CzcsN4k9FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27588,_binary '\0','/9iMCwIdz2ZXAuKurdPiVrJy05Kb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430615',6.5,21373,'en','Big Miracle','A small-town news reporter and a Greenpeace volunteer enlist the help of rival superpowers to save three majestic gray whales trapped under the ice of the Arctic Circle.','/hqdrgC5oHK06DDaAlulReUC7Nog.jpg','2012-02-02',107,'Released','A family of whales trapped beneath the ice. One unforgettable rescue.','Big Miracle',78698,6.6948,6.7,'sghLvB201Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27589,_binary '\0','/9UZnCIeUVHzZQLDXN7lht2T4ndB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1430626',6.7,54819,'en','The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists!','The enthusiastic Pirate Captain, along with his rag-tag crew, sets out to beat his bitter rivals. The chaotic adventure takes them from exotic shores to Victorian London, and from a haplessly smitten scientist to a diabolical queen.','/bkLeXPDP6sramrTiF5W7TzUl4t0.jpg','2012-03-12',88,'Released','It\'s a plunderful life.','The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists!',72197,11.8545,6.5,'7qNuS8KauZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27590,_binary '\0','/7Z6Ey7hMdK42RIDdR0Ogpr364Ze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14307536',6.8,5025,'en','A Jazzman\'s Blues','A tale of forbidden love and family drama unravels 40 years of secrets and lies against a soundtrack of juke joint blues in the Deep South.','/3a6p9PnqD5ksDWiHkwWbkl6Jz7G.jpg','2022-09-16',127,'Released','Never stop loving.','A Jazzman\'s Blues',921643,3.4049,7.444,'PCggYIdUpyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27591,_binary '\0','/wcka0WH6otb1xueWk62Rpxqh3nm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14308636',7.1,17289,'en','Bank of Dave','The true story of how Dave Fishwick, a working class man and self-made millionaire, fought to set up a community bank so that he could help the local businesses of Burnley not only survive, but thrive. In his bid to help his beloved community, he has to take on the elitist financial institutions of London and fight to receive the first, new banking license to be issued in over 100 years.','/pKZ8nURAqNmuSpKVTYGko7SD1GP.jpg','2023-03-10',107,'Released','He\'s taking on the big boys.','Bank of Dave',937220,3.8906,6.851,'N-JQX4aeRfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27592,_binary '\0','/5FFpcmPzD5mhLom7bymZq7Py8eT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14309446',5.1,46434,'en','Me Time','With his family away, a devoted stay-at-home dad enjoys his first me time in years by joining his hard-partying old friend on a wild birthday adventure.','/bkjPoisqAavXUvtoirxTEcLLQyI.jpg','2022-08-26',105,'Released','This is not what he had in mind.','Me Time',862551,5.7916,5.839,'Mmq_NVwLN_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27593,_binary '\0','/rFj9IKlL75B2pXhZA60jkNWvxeW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1431045',8,1271906,'en','Deadpool','The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.','/3E53WEZJqP6aM84D8CckXx4pIHw.jpg','2016-02-09',108,'Released','Feel the love.','Deadpool',293660,30.6883,7.626,'9vN6DHB6bJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27594,_binary '\0','/nmfYF9OSDNBSsX4ROtITlA4bWvJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1431065',6.6,2150,'en','Forget Me Not','The film follows Will Fletcher, a musician, and Eve Fisher, who works in a pub where he is performing, during one night in London. After Will has saved Eve from a drunken customer at closing time, they stay up all night together, meandering through the streets of London and forging a relationship. Next morning, Eve takes him to see her Alzheimer\'s-suffering grandmother. The film is often compared to Richard Linklater\'s films \"Before Sunrise\" and \"Before Sunset\", as the style is very similar.','/4LZbg0CYTjofu03ZvAPecUvhBpI.jpg','2011-05-06',93,'Released','Love happens. When you least expect it....','Forget Me Not',65186,1.2439,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27595,_binary '\0','/fMCkkqpAVfFmbf009flydh7gQY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1431115',6.7,3610,'en','Mrs. Miracle','Overwhelmed widower Seth Webster is searching for a housekeeper to help him with his unruly six year old twin sons. \"Mrs. Miracle\" mysteriously appears and quickly becomes an irreplaceable nanny, chef, friend... and matchmaker.','/x4bgbJqRaiDC8wSPQNzVtn4iEsq.jpg','2009-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Mrs. Miracle',50506,1.8659,6,'nulPPmIpb9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27596,_binary '\0','/ArubxRDVVcZ8YF4F9Ckg9v9ofZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1431122',4.7,3598,'hi','No Problem','Two friends, who are crooks, rob a bank and the bank manager is accused of being an accomplice. The manager sets out to prove his innocence and bust the duo.','/tkTuqXDzTDd1OhYZ7EKsvdt7OVK.jpg','2010-12-10',143,'Released','Some Crimes Are Just Funny!','No Problem',53804,1.6697,4.26,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27597,_binary '\0','/8VPwE9Owon0lOUi1FdTfakEPVZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1431181',7.4,32360,'en','Another Year','During a year, a very content couple approaching retirement are visited by friends and family less happy with their lives.','/zrkQcAatfBox5x9KZjaYGnKoqu6.jpg','2010-11-05',129,'Released',NULL,'Another Year',44009,4.0926,7.004,'GpdXccL_laU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27598,_binary '\0','/et6vRjuPwF6Jurq3KKoKhprJQGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000',