.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14315500',3.8,6254,'pl','W lesie dziś nie zaśnie nikt II','When something horrible happens to the only survivor of a bloody massacre, an insecure rookie cop must overcome his fears to stop further carnage.','/6QvepemlDGIiiYsVs0Y1ieFuG7N.jpg','2021-10-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Sleeps in the Woods Tonight 2',871964,3.1557,4.6,'R_wIaGkiUBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27604,_binary '\0','/6tPOZmNQ1tbzlhcMmyhYN1a1dEh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14315566',5.1,1581,'pl','Bartkowiak','After his brother dies in a car crash, a disgraced MMA fighter takes over the family nightclub — and soon learns his sibling\'s death wasn’t an accident.','/9jUF9fuNRaJv0uYEJ1J3srNAnX7.jpg','2021-07-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Bartkowiak',809968,1.8147,6.025,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27605,_binary '\0','/r2HDWSKdG2gVFg4shNJpjLIYgEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14315584',6.8,5187,'pl','Hiacynt','Not satisfied with the result of a murder investigation in Warsaw\'s gay community, an officer in 1980s communist Poland resolves to uncover the truth.','/rUX2fGa7OV85c6rtjOC351RVeyD.jpg','2021-08-18',106,'Released','Lose everything, except yourself.','Operation Hyacinth',809970,2.7702,6.8,'J30EGyQVIlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27606,_binary '\0','/2r0O6rOOSfsZ3bIpWTOt0Xabxkf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14315756',6.2,22013,'en','Single All the Way','Desperate to avoid his family’s judgment about his perpetual single status, Peter convinces his best friend Nick to join him for the holidays and pretend that they’re now in a relationship. But when Peter’s mother sets him up on a blind date with her handsome trainer James, the plan goes awry.','/bfZPNzAwUQZ6FZQi1d136KLr3wl.jpg','2021-12-02',99,'Released','Peter and Nick are just friends. Peter\'s family knows better.','Single All the Way',810873,5.2087,6.4,'kCQxxqdowOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27607,_binary '\0','/oDT3OLAKXSBicI32FuOTZeEdWlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14317880',6.3,5771,'fr','Coupez !','Things go badly for a small film crew shooting a low-budget zombie movie when they are attacked by real zombies.','/hBUdnylt2a84PwGIPQcZDkCVB5M.jpg','2022-05-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Final Cut',852438,3.4905,6.69,'EvTLEws8SYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27608,_binary '\0','/zcUi0knDw1AYWFNkUCCyzBK6lXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14318430',5.6,5253,'en','Why Did You Kill Me?','The line between justice and revenge blurs when a devastated family uses social media to track down the people who killed 24-year-old Crystal Theobald.','/7LDUzYcqmch380p725onQ5BhV9Y.jpg','2021-04-07',83,'Released',NULL,'Why Did You Kill Me?',810731,1.5801,5.9,'QEXV8Rif8Vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27609,_binary '\0','/z6vbHSMK5otioU7BxkImituCM6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1432078',6.3,2603,'ko','7급 공무원','Ahn Soo-ji and Lee Jae-joon, who are oblivious to each other\'s real profession as secret agents, are in an ill-fated relationship. Three years later, they accidentally meet targeting the same enemy.','/7Z9hqDYhOL0uY3cFi9zGLo9WIrS.jpg','2009-04-04',113,'Released','To save the country, Love come next.','My Girlfriend Is an Agent',18374,2.5309,6.3,'3qC1fNrTBEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27610,_binary '\0','/c2uZuqjdt2KjkoRz1AgNCwZ7ung.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14321668',7.2,5776,'de','Die Wannseekonferenz','On January 20, 1942, the Wannsee Conference takes place in Berlin, a meeting that had only one item on the agenda: The Final Solution, the organization of the systematic mass murder of eleven million European Jews.','/8uOdIP7GowDMroxy1zSmBBaRCJw.jpg','2022-05-06',107,'Released','When Humanity Lost The War','The Conference',910365,3.1003,6.7,'52fRAzmjJoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27611,_binary '\0','/fBeWu9fWcCfHlyyPwQnuODSljae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14324296',6.8,2708,'it','A Chiara','The Guerrasio family and friends gather to celebrate Claudio and Carmela’s oldest daughter’s 18th birthday. There is a healthy rivalry between the birthday girl and her 15-year-old sister Chiara as they compete on the dancefloor. It is a happy occasion, and the close-knit family are on top form. However, everything changes the next day when the father disappears. Chiara, unconvinced by the cover story, starts to investigate. As she gets closer to the truth, she is forced to decide what kind of future she wants for herself.','/Ak0AM4lpmmkUkT0kXmRdjjxfa7h.jpg','2021-10-07',121,'Released',NULL,'To Chiara',833420,2.7612,6.781,'O7enm2b0BcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27612,_binary '\0','/uS9apevOgs2fuYghf9szOoK1u63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14324650',7.3,23355,'en','Batman: The Long Halloween, Part One','Following a brutal series of murders taking place on Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas, Gotham City\'s young vigilante known as the Batman sets out to pursue the mysterious serial killer alongside police officer James Gordon and district attorney Harvey Dent.','/sR7gppb0YGjwLvE6Vnj6wYv5MnW.jpg','2021-06-21',85,'Released','Naughty or nice. Trick or treat. Hero or villain.','Batman: The Long Halloween, Part One',736073,7.279,7.4,'8qodAY3S7Dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27613,_binary '\0','/tOYzR1aGWEqlrgUV4K5SdbEq2RY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14325028',3.1,1892,'en','Box: Metaphor','Box Metaphor is a compelling dystopian journey where unjust imprisonment unveils societal conformity and defiance’s profound impact. It’s about breaking free from metaphorical boxes and the resilience of the human spirit.','/91YJFHdTTF24Vab33XbToAh3TOo.jpg','2023-06-27',79,'Released',NULL,'Box: Metaphor',1237329,2.9159,5.3,'LC9HXehkbFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27614,_binary '\0','/ajMohH9DUCBHnMuMtoqQbz9xSpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14325118',3.9,1342,'te','వర్జిన్ స్టోరి','In the present world of less attention span and instant gratification, can the time consuming emotion of love survive or fade away.','/lFmjAAKZAbU5oRmORRqfUfeAfrW.jpg','2022-02-18',141,'Released',NULL,'Virgin Story',895973,0.8671,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27615,_binary '\0','/wVxXFz8VLmUts2dpJ0rK38Mi4Qv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14330236',4.8,2719,'en','Mack & Rita','A 30-year-old spends a wild weekend in Palm Springs and wakes up to find she has magically transformed into her 70-year-old self.','/rhJDDzGZitrGpW3ELmFhdCEFx9g.jpg','2022-08-12',95,'Released','Old soul. New age.','Mack & Rita',808087,3.4196,5.5,'c8LD5hvE8vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27616,_binary '\0','/cfB7VJF9LXrZRkMZLaa6Yhxo1Fb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14330672',7.7,1796,'ar','وداعًا جوليا','A retired singer from northern Sudan, Mona, burdened by guilt for covering up a man\'s death, hires his southern widow, Julia, as her maid. Unable to confess her role in the tragedy, she hopes to move forward, but the country\'s growing unrest threatens to reveal her secret.','/yQv7V4gTf6mI7OPUS7jWCDStPcr.jpg','2023-11-08',120,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye Julia',1111750,2.1368,7.3,'Xh8sauNG4AE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27617,_binary '\0','/jItFLAs2urRwwQ5rmc61LTd1les.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433108',6.4,117797,'en','Faster','After 10 years in prison, Driver is now a free man with a single focus - hunting down the people responsible for brutally murdering his brother.','/AsUeaXrhw4oscCSjUZ6heh1pVvd.jpg','2010-11-23',98,'Released','Slow justice is no justice','Faster',41283,8.7751,6.356,'SbJ3Itb4vsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27618,_binary '\0','/rcEDPOOOUTLFxLLQJggfLffbofe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14331144',7.8,66978,'ja','劇場版 呪術廻戦 0','Yuta Okkotsu is a nervous high school student who is suffering from a serious problem—his childhood friend Rika has turned into a curse and won\'t leave him alone. Since Rika is no ordinary curse, his plight is noticed by Satoru Gojo, a teacher at Jujutsu High, a school where fledgling exorcists learn how to combat curses. Gojo convinces Yuta to enroll, but can he learn enough in time to confront the curse that haunts him?','/23oJaeBh0FDk2mQ2P240PU9Xxfh.jpg','2021-12-24',105,'Released','Love is a twisted curse.','Jujutsu Kaisen 0',810693,13.511,8.102,'2docezZl574','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27619,_binary '\0','/49VrNua8keSq2FWsPuUyVQVgHZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433207',6.1,10355,'en','The Details','When a family of raccoons discover worms living underneath the sod in Jeff and Nealy\'s backyard, this pest problem begins a darkly comic and wild chain reaction of domestic tension, infidelity and murder.','/ejpsft6Utt4sHS68IcHTOgUjKhZ.jpg','2012-11-02',101,'Released','Doing the right thing has never gone so wrong.','The Details',135647,2.5992,6,'KszmY8rhMGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27620,_binary '\0','/afRaD8owvk00wm5n22P7YiHuboW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433528',7.4,2122,'fr','L\'Enfer d\'Henri-Georges Clouzot','In 1964, Henri-Georges Clouzot\'s production of L\'Enfer came to a halt. Despite huge expectations, major studio backing and an unlimited budget, after three weeks the production collapsed. This documentary presents Inferno\'s incredible expressionistic original rushes, screen tests, and on-location footage, whilst also reconstructing Clouzot\'s original vision, and shedding light on the ill-fated endeavor through interviews, dramatizations of unfilmed scenes, and Clouzot\'s own notes.','/m2r4RgTTDotGozJcxEOXxjTcmRs.jpg','2009-10-01',102,'Released','A master filmmaker\'s unfinished dream','Henri-Georges Clouzot\'s Inferno',41504,2.2933,7.253,'Y5xUefM2gt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27621,_binary '\0','/xK7GbENFsJqqMUs6orrGAqEpO29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433540',7.4,9322,'fr','Panique au village','Cowboy and Indian\'s only wish was to come up with a brilliant idea for Mr Horse\'s birthday, but when their plan ends up in utter disaster, they\'ll need to travel the world and back to make things right again.','/9Q1jtFU1zutKsAR9lwAl6YMkgZM.jpg','2009-06-17',77,'Released','They came… They saw… They panicked…','A Town Called Panic',40623,1.6148,7.5,'w3uG8LLuVPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27622,_binary '\0','/4lajnEr8oZFAGhwkHKuGsnvXA14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433562',5.6,8928,'fr','Vertige','A group of friends on a climbing vacation ignore warnings that the mountains are closed and start their ascent anyway. Collapsing bridges, bear traps and other dangers threaten to splinter the group… when the real hell begins and an unseen villain begins picking them off one by one.','/tIWnU0R5jK2PGlQU9MajL9nm0wH.jpg','2009-06-24',90,'Released',NULL,'High Lane',30974,2.8493,6.049,'YpmqKYFVYeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27623,_binary '\0','/iozxwgTMgaqljPfZ5fE7913mLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14336174',6.3,3019,'fr','Peter von Kant','Peter von Kant, a successful, famous director, lives with his assistant Karl, whom he likes to mistreat and humiliate. Through the great actress Sidonie, he meets and falls in love with Amir, a handsome young man of modest means. He offers to share his apartment and help Amir break into the world of cinema. Several months later, Amir becomes a star. But as soon as he acquires fame, he breaks up with Peter, leaving him alone to face himself.','/5ZTjS0XmJHCAcp0jWj6tR64hAeJ.jpg','2022-07-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Peter von Kant',807862,3.6257,5.8,'-H9LU1mSJ94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27624,_binary '\0','/wGk3QhflKUXft8eN1sAHBnkzm3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433775',5.3,1241,'ko','가루지기','A monk gives an impaired man the secret to a strong arousal. The man had been teased and tortured until the travelling man decides to help him out.','/3smywiLIJVJPLY4QoVD41FMgP87.jpg','2008-04-30',120,'Released','What is the object used for?','A Tale of Legendary Libido',42384,8.4215,5.7,'5gscAT6LALk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27625,_binary '\0','/vs4kj5fFi2UaOAglZZstvbyETvp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433810',7,14384,'hi','धोबी घाट','Arun is a reclusive and lonely modern art painter. Shai is an American banker who is on a visit to Mumbai. Munna is a washerboy also living near Arun and Yasmin. The movie is about these four characters from different class of society and how the lives of four characters are intertwined.','/hSNbvyrRbfAxz29yJSz7bJ1Ujuu.jpg','2010-01-21',102,'Released','Mumbai Dairies','Dhobi Ghat',54890,1.911,6.4,'erIzry9cHpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27626,_binary '\0','/e47cvCgbZogOyKXSenT9aqCDhe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433811',7.5,80579,'en','Disconnect','A hard-working lawyer, attached to his cell phone, can\'t find the time to communicate with his family. An estranged couple uses the internet as a means to escape from their lifeless marriage. A widowed ex-cop struggles to raise a mischievous son who cyber-bullies a classmate. An ambitious journalist sees a career-making story in a teen that performs on an adult-only site. They are strangers, neighbors and colleagues and their stories collide as ordinary people struggling to connect in today\'s wired world.','/mAStXq4ncbLBnujd3LG4KDd7Z3a.jpg','2013-04-12',116,'Released','Look up.','Disconnect',127517,7.3942,7.077,'EtTSyOlG3rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27627,_binary '\0','/qKbYJHQecf5QPLr57702msopoSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433813',7.6,4705,'en','IMAX Hubble','An IMAX 3D camera chronicles the effort of 7 astronauts aboard the Space Shuttle Atlantis to repair the Hubble Space Telescope.','/csUuK3fOCUanzjSNZGvFRZ8JdH4.jpg','2010-03-19',44,'Released','Change your view of our universe.','IMAX Hubble',44992,2.56,7.083,'WIgdxNo8n0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27628,_binary '\0','/5vOqihwb5qOkvnRefyw5ClbQUi0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433816',7.8,4991,'hr','Metastaze','Eliciting images of cancer, this drama explores the illnesses that plague modern Croatia. Four young junkies in Zagreb maturing in the wake of war reflect the petty hatreds, violence, prejudices and mood hanging over the country like a disease that spreads with no cure in sight.','/8ZzQW2wEGJolC0fMnbzKviUps8e.jpg','2009-03-30',82,'Released',NULL,'Metastases',45341,0.9206,7.3,'-CZ80qF39tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27629,_binary '\0','/sie33RpTUQJxJq2XXjrOBXJpASL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433822',4.1,21270,'en','The Apparition','Plagued by frightening occurrences in their home, Kelly and Ben learn that a university\'s parapsychology experiment produced an entity that is now haunting them. The malevolent spirit feeds on fear and torments the couple no matter where they run. Desperate, Kelly and Ben turn to a paranormal researcher, but even with his aid, it may already be too late to save themselves from the terrifying presence.','/bIcImUb7J5ta9IAZ9ENCZIMtDuw.jpg','2012-08-23',82,'Released','Once you believe, you die.','The Apparition',79694,4.3026,4.485,'WYELiw9nvnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27630,_binary '\0','/xVUY7fJum48tTUqiqeamousRBUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14338246',4.1,2403,'te','ఉస్తాద్ భగత్ సింగ్','A tribal boy is shaped by the values of his teacher, who gives him the name \'Bhagat Singh\'. He grows up deeply rooted in strong morals, which guide his actions throughout his life.He stands firm against injustice and takes on powerful evil forces, even when facing overwhelming odds.','/8n4ypYQWztEXlR8JxD0fctdKwfC.jpg','2026-03-18',151,'Released','This time it\'s not just entertainment.','Ustaad Bhagat Singh',868668,2.4332,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27631,_binary '\0','/n1wD5DEk8UmbL8tOSiH9vDNgcKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433852',7.3,2434,'en','Louis Theroux: A Place for Paedophiles','Louis has gained access to Coalinga Mental Hospital in California, which houses more than 500 of the most disturbed criminals in America, convicted paedophiles. Most have already served lengthy prison sentences, but have been deemed unsafe for release. Instead, they have been sent here for an indefinite time. Spending time with those undergoing treatment, Louis wrestles with whether he can ever allow himself to believe men whose whole history is defined by deception and deceit.','/fUWG7azWzr3ZfWvxUx5fS09U33F.jpg','2009-04-19',59,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: A Place for Paedophiles',68208,0.9986,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27632,_binary '\0','/7WcqlUrVetkMj1HOLBkHKqLHwmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1433905',6.3,7852,'hi','आल थे बेस्ट: फन बेगिंस','In order to increase his monthly allowance, Veer lies to his stepbrother Dharm about being married. When Dharm unexpectedly arrives in Goa, he mistakes Prem\'s wife for Veer\'s. This case of mistaken identities leads to chaotic and hilarious situations.','/wS4HXoaijxIbI8lv6H9MFNKAcQa.jpg','2009-10-16',144,'Released',NULL,'All the Best: Fun Begins',24603,1.4348,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27633,_binary '\0','/6WtF3uB695dm9gksqveDK3RlbDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14339846',5.6,10073,'hi','Mrs. Undercover','An ace undercover agent living as a middle-class housewife is assigned a task after a decade. How will she take down a serial killer targeting ambitious women with her rusty skills?','/wEKwOfgo3IMGNNGkDF0WJQtrmIx.jpg','2023-04-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Mrs. Undercover',915865,1.1957,5.267,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27634,_binary '\0','/A1RAuivOBC9S85u8z8ij7DPzoIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1434423',7.4,4557,'zh','风声','After a series of assassinations in Nanking, a Japanese spy master gathers a group of suspects in a mansion, then a tense cat-and-mouse game erupts as the Chinese agent tries to keep his or her identity a secret.','/9uR3iuxLEsSk5QEfkpclk67s9wT.jpg','2009-09-22',118,'Released',NULL,'The Message',32582,2.5764,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27635,_binary '\0','/yiTNRdUZ5CTUcojwdjITKfBfjRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1434435',6.2,19608,'en','Mother\'s Day','Crazed members of a sadistic family return to their childhood home to terrorize the new owners.','/9tFAISreDP3Eepwsu7DtcnrCvsB.jpg','2010-09-23',112,'Released','Don\'t Misbehave.','Mother\'s Day',101669,3.7865,6.5,'TcdfNJx68VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27636,_binary '\0','/gd4JXEnL3SAff3qth6Qx3ZNh3NO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1434443',7.1,5653,'da','R','Imprisoned for violent assault, Rune is placed in the hardcore ward, where his survival depends on quickly learning the prison\'s parallel world of rules, honor, and obligations.','/jxMgFBcEkBPhoikocUBqXS3i6TP.jpg','2010-04-22',99,'Released',NULL,'R',49207,1.5399,6.828,'kRDQaGiEz1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27637,_binary '\0','/bQk9Z0cj9OXB56sESStXVQgGKHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1434447',7.5,25385,'hi','रॉकेट सिंह','Rocket Singh: Salesman of the Year is the sometimes thoughtless, sometimes thoughtful story of a fresh graduate trying to find a balance between the maddening demands of the \'professional\' way, and the way of his heart - and stumbling upon a crazy way which turned his world upside down, and his career right side up. Welcome to the world of sales boss!','/3Z8lLFzPOBfOO4w3CykRaCeh9h.jpg','2009-12-10',156,'Released','Welcome to the world of sales boss!','Rocket Singh: Salesman of the Year',26815,1.4009,6.895,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27638,_binary '\0','/AnmfRV7X0kwEn96pg0lAVopV8YK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14349032',6,16901,'en','The Good Neighbor','A nightmarish evening unfolds for neighbors David and Robert when they accidentally hit a woman on her bike and flee the scene. While David is increasingly plagued by feelings of guilt, Robert shows no remorse and becomes overbearing and possessive.','/mXJ2xI7B0Z9WxDjyv18anPsOxeE.jpg','2022-06-17',97,'Released','Fear what\'s next door.','The Good Neighbor',893086,4.3551,6.6,'8PlcazoFgaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27639,_binary '\0','/jwmswCW3U8Uh0wEo46psJpgXejD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14351082',7.3,10333,'en','Cabrini','Italian immigrant Francesca Cabrini arrives in 1889 New York City and is greeted by disease, crime, and impoverished children. Cabrini sets off on a daring mission to convince the hostile mayor to secure housing and healthcare for society\'s most vulnerable. With broken English and poor health, Cabrini uses her entrepreneurial mind to build an empire of hope unlike anything the world had ever seen.','/uR7iQKPynetIxnbbWalF6OXbNcf.jpg','2024-03-07',142,'Released','Remember her name.','Cabrini',975056,3.1121,7.7,'9-aA70YJmcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27640,_binary '\0','/8DPxvLQGXXd96q59rd5mllgOqVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1435513',6.7,34267,'en','Hysteria','Two doctors in Victorian England use manual stimulation of female genitalia to cure their patients\' ills, leading to the invention of the vibrator.','/ziWnXi2VyNDD9qPi5wmOuolOCIu.jpg','2011-06-06',100,'Released','A comedy about the birth of the vibrator in Victorian England.','Hysteria',75802,3.6247,6.707,'pKgdLjDZ6ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27641,_binary '\0','/5nVujXcKNkmEfqxjnrcGV0KUuoy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14355860',6.6,1296,'ro','Miracol','A young novice sneaks out of her convent to deal with a matter that cannot be delayed.','/lldfzQ9cWsmVYSbBKVelNLeJscU.jpg','2022-02-04',119,'Released',NULL,'Miracle',854323,1.4781,6.5,'5qb131E-qjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27642,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436034',5,1429,'en','Legacy','Taking refuge in a shabby Brooklyn motel after narrowly surviving a failed mission in Eastern Europe, Black Ops soldier Malcolm Gray begins to disintegrate mentally as he broods over the legacy of his actions in this taut psychological thriller. Haunted by his demons while holed up in his room, Malcolm ponders the ascent of his brother, an ambitious senator with designs on the presidency.','/4FviXkOo3udmM3QTW26i0VYNMla.jpg','2010-10-15',93,'Released','“LEGACY”','Legacy',45568,1.5187,4.7,'F0g2m6KWzi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27643,_binary '\0','/bz95FrtRKCJ2ZKXJU7ZAXxvl4Xb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436045',7.5,72277,'ja','十三人の刺客','A bravado period action film set at the end of Japan\'s feudal era in which a group of unemployed samurai are enlisted to bring down a sadistic lord and prevent him from ascending to the throne and plunging the country into a war-torn future.','/yUsVsiVXUwClk4vSCx80vrdO6MV.jpg','2010-09-25',141,'Released','Take up your sword.','13 Assassins',58857,6.6283,7.303,'Xpm007vne54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27644,_binary '\0','/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14362112',6,20522,'en','Trolls Band Together','When Branch\'s brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.','/3ySgD2xwasTHOK6R9bNZiEwKgYo.jpg','2023-10-12',91,'Released','There are some new trolls on the block.','Trolls Band Together',901362,13.7391,7.2,'ftUpFjGKuY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27645,_binary '\0','/drmzRk9wjyuuohKapc3Lp514K09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436372',4,1685,'en','Elle: A Modern Cinderella Tale','Elle wants to be a singer/songwriter, but her dreams are cut short by the sudden death of her parents. She moves in with her adoptive uncle, who runs a small independent record label whose biggest act, Sensation, is also Elle\'s biggest pain.','/dnExa5ZHZ8xSWR2J6E4muzqvMc5.jpg','2010-04-26',90,'Released','Happily ever after is just a song away...','Elle: A Modern Cinderella Tale',56929,1.6569,5,'Zzw0zUQoPB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27646,_binary '\0','/8vuUwoOV1yGesQEm2p3fnmp7nzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436432',3.1,2592,'en','MegaFault','When miner Charley \'Boomer\' Baxter sets off a series of massive mining detonations in West Virginia, a gigantic earthquake is soon rocking the North Atlantic, exposing a deep seismic fault that runs the length of the North American continent. Joining forces with government seismology expert Dr Amy Lane, Boomer must now race against time to stop the chasm that is threatening to tear America - and the entire world - in half.','/wa3v5osMnFaEUImfMiWOTIjv2lQ.jpg','2009-10-10',90,'Released','A crack in the world has started... we have 24 hours to stop it.','MegaFault',30289,2.3815,5.375,'O5B-YDH4yKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27647,_binary '\0','/fiRDzpcJe7qz3yIR43hdXIE3NHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14364480',7.3,259942,'en','Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery','When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.','/iV9LM8aUb83BjCCx2RUnKE5sSQg.jpg','2025-11-26',145,'Released','He works in mysterious ways.','Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery',812583,19.6568,7.207,'0hc8yz5-d5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27648,_binary '\0','/dnAOVUpEcSUGzOO1bP2WFJLqxqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436481',6.3,2652,'ta','வேல்','Two sons that are separated as children grow up in drastically different environments.','/6mUp9lW0qYzySB5znUxZA2oYVbe.jpg','2007-11-08',160,'Released',NULL,'Vel',69634,1.178,6.21,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27649,_binary '\0','/hnEwn31kRg8hFct0Irwq4zze0pt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436559',4.8,9765,'en','Love, Wedding, Marriage','A happy newlywed marriage counselor\'s views on wedded bliss get thrown for a loop when she finds out her parents are getting divorced.','/1NrzuMavrCTh0j2CNs44BEWGg4C.jpg','2011-06-03',90,'Released','Here comes the ride.','Love, Wedding, Marriage',59296,3.0158,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27650,_binary '\0','/3vxlXdwBKztOJdgiZ2Qwasl9FY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436562',6.9,277736,'en','Rio','Captured by smugglers when he was just a hatchling, a macaw named Blu never learned to fly and lives a happily domesticated life in Minnesota with his human friend, Linda. Blu is thought to be the last of his kind, but when word comes that Jewel, a lone female, lives in Rio de Janeiro, Blu and Linda go to meet her. Animal smugglers kidnap Blu and Jewel, but the pair soon escape and begin a perilous adventure back to freedom -- and Linda.','/4nJxhUknKV8Gqdhov8pU1YWDYfb.jpg','2011-04-03',96,'Released','1 out of every 8 Americans is afraid of flying. Most of them don\'t have feathers.','Rio',46195,15.3714,6.771,'Bf6zeRwk5LE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27651,_binary '\0','/6Yv1L8F373buOO8UGGtwSkpgJdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436568',6.1,19283,'en','Assassination Games','Brazil is a contract killer, willing to take any job if the price is right. Flint left the assassin game when a ruthless drug dealer’s brutal attack left his wife in a coma. When a contract is put out on the same coldblooded drug dealer, both Brazil and Flint want him dead – one for the money, the other for revenge. With crooked Interpol agents and vicious members of the criminal underworld hot on their trail, these two assassins reluctantly join forces to quickly take out their target before they themselves are terminated.','/quJ0kXiQmP7rOg1m6WGmallQiJQ.jpg','2011-07-28',101,'Released','Twice the fire... double the power!','Assassination Games',71677,4.6484,6.3,'SCKVVZZiWTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27652,_binary '\0','/sLkc0zd6xJndbs2gfsfUJIft9c5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1436572',5.4,2827,'en','Café','When tragedy strikes the community surrounding a cafe in West Philadelphia, the cafe\'s regulars come to realize how intertwined their lives truly are.','/yxZSxSZxGDP5CuRrhOAZlLhSFQs.jpg','2011-08-19',103,'Released','What if the world you lived in weren\'t real?','Café',70005,2.1743,5.4,'d0t1VQ3PAOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27653,_binary '\0','/eGVcCqVtFNzkLntvrLEG604L7SR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14365790',4,1471,'es','Lo inevitable','A family takes refuge in an old country house the last hours before the announced final judgment. But the unexpected appearance of an intruder, who claims to be a savior, puts their faith and destiny at risk.','/mA20job57iS7BVChpC0c1gsMCFT.jpg','2021-10-28',97,'Released',NULL,'The Inevitable',679915,2.0532,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27654,_binary '\0','/ljJaDl3RdcNdSuQVa2ScdNZOF1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14369276',6.5,4509,'tr','Babamın Kemanı','Through their shared grief and connection to music, an orphaned girl bonds with her emotionally aloof, successful violinist uncle.','/bwvoSRyXRRqtpvoHYhySQk2U4EM.jpg','2022-01-21',112,'Released',NULL,'My Father\'s Violin',920394,2.5004,7.895,'ZyhWDaS8YYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27655,_binary '\0','/5HnVrSMsSxeR3RisIpBCUzVgrgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14369286',5.3,3007,'tr','UFO','When aspiring musician and student Deniz falls for a rough-hewn motorbike racer, tragedy and family opposition obstruct their path to love.','/dMtKov3q8stWGcy7UFuRzpMliUy.jpg','2022-02-23',109,'Released',NULL,'UFO',933357,1.5248,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27656,_binary '\0','/zgmbWPzRcq5vwqBmONzvkdNDtnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14369296',4.9,2871,'tr','Aşkın Kıyameti','After his ad agency goes bankrupt, an indebted Fırat falls for a singer at a yoga retreat and joins her on a journey of self-realization.','/zkOZJDTxy2BmhDLicQ7YzpeNG8a.jpg','2022-06-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Doom of Love',817889,1.556,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27657,_binary '\0','/tPKmDydEzqJPj5yol2zFCrraUcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14369780',6.6,28522,'en','Lady Chatterley\'s Lover','After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband\'s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.','/aSgl2DxPG3DuQXoaHr500KeULmT.jpg','2022-11-22',126,'Released',NULL,'Lady Chatterley\'s Lover',814338,7.4618,6.7,'ZOkXE3B0pDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27658,_binary '\0','/bGwBlxl9Ht2zljBHfNQD0YCEtrk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14371860',5.9,21247,'en','Apartment 7A','A struggling young dancer finds herself drawn in by dark forces when a peculiar, well-connected older couple promise her a shot at fame.','/uipHKJHY1nNEQyprXjfNzH0GIOF.jpg','2024-09-20',104,'Released','Rosemary was not the first.','Apartment 7A',807339,6.6499,6.1,'Kj2GqMvhbNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27659,_binary '\0','/AaModY6YpQmEFzG56ALP1PFLPUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14371878',5.6,53716,'en','Lift','An international heist crew, led by Cyrus Whitaker, race to lift $500 million in gold from a passenger plane at 40,000 feet.','/h7wJI6mctrDJ9wMbFfgrBUTn1LT.jpg','2024-01-10',107,'Released','The heist begins at 40,000 ft.','Lift',955916,9.8507,6.44,'QfFasuouxQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27660,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437212',6.6,1494,'tr','Gölgesizler','A barber working in Istanbul longs to be ‘both here and far, far away’. One day, he takes the day off and disappears abruptly without warning anyone. He then settles in a far-flung village. Some mysterious events start happening in the village as people disappear one by one.','/tpTOxX1tbnRJNNeQ1MYqIbtGkq6.jpg','2009-02-27',94,'Released',NULL,'The Shadowless',52180,1.6261,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27661,_binary '\0','/2P7mnMJGMP5mNRujxki0di8lSmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14372240',8.2,5779,'en','The Year Earth Changed','Never-before-seen footage shows how our living in lockdown opened the door for nature to bounce back and thrive. Across the seas, skies, and lands, Earth found its rhythm when we came to a stop.','/cLwQRXfzPjmpU6I78TCkoHazO0A.jpg','2021-04-15',48,'Released','Mother Nature is making a comeback.','The Year Earth Changed',811703,7.4243,7.862,'XswV_yqPq28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27662,_binary '\0','/aoJpJTwSGs6web4KGh3nLA5An8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437357',6.5,6070,'de','Faust','A doctor in early 19th-century Germany becomes infatuated with the sister of a man he unintentionally killed and bargains with the Devil incarnate to conjure their union in exchange for his soul.','/8jH8wVLNZ24QVxm5IEByWpsmHXJ.jpg','2011-10-26',140,'Released',NULL,'Faust',77560,3.1028,6.591,'en41_BCdAmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27663,_binary '\0','/nMJlSiRA0ct2vuX5O9ltq192IxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437358',7.2,50443,'es','Mientras duermes','César, an unhappy concierge, maintains a peculiar relationship with the very diverse inhabitants of the upper-class apartment building where he works in Barcelona.','/i44Mr6t3reXt7z28OMCPZTllRfr.jpg','2011-10-14',101,'Released','Someone is watching over you','Sleep Tight',77495,5.0864,7.1,'1sMBbvc2o_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27664,_binary '\0','/5yhXOc685Pybx7M5CiEetJhEgbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437361',6,3075,'fr','Le Mac','A mild-mannered banker is forced to masquerade as a notorious gangster and pimp.','/qsai3CTU0VENHY2LuKJ7Xe06LGr.jpg','2010-02-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Pimp',35025,1.9055,5.802,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27665,_binary '\0','/tBsms8rJtjb3olWG4D9i4lkmBCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437366',7,4600,'sv','Svinalängorna','One morning just before Christmas, Leena receives a phone call from a hospital in her childhood hometown telling her that her mother is dying. This news takes her on a journey to face her mother for the first time in her adult life. Leena has fought all her life to let go of her grief over her lost and dark childhood. She is now forced to deal with her past to be able to move on.','/5lgzIR9egyu9xNuGVWctxWVFfy8.jpg','2010-12-10',99,'Released',NULL,'Beyond',51423,1.4912,6.5,'j_Y0hgcHqwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27666,_binary '\0','/cJcRWA4HaA6UP4fG2gbBUNFneoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14375666',3.8,1392,'en','Lola','19-year-old Lola James is trying to work to save enough money to get her beloved little brother, Arlo, out of their toxic home. Until one tragic night, when her whole world gets uprooted. From that moment on, nothing will ever be the same.','/mCc3u1NXeHIgT8NyIOoZuoPUIxg.jpg','2024-02-09',83,'Released',NULL,'Lola',818861,1.7765,5.2,'pYtgiuOVH3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27667,_binary '\0','/1LMGpNSUekWg3XCPweN33knQPW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14376344',7.3,32069,'en','Cha Cha Real Smooth','Fresh out of college and stuck at his New Jersey home without a clear path forward, 22-year-old Andrew begins working as a party starter for bar/bat mitzvahs—where he strikes up a unique friendship with a young mom and her teenage daughter.','/iUvoVhvwTlP8DofoqeIu7QAGLAe.jpg','2022-06-17',108,'Released','Falling in love is easy. Growing up is hard.','Cha Cha Real Smooth',814340,6.6511,7.1,'QRyyagJ9GPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27668,_binary '\0','/aWK8SGc594kJwUa7vBcCes96Ylf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1437849',6.3,2089,'en','Le Donk & Scor-zay-zee','An improvised comedy, shot over five days by Shane Meadows, devised with and starring Paddy Considine. Rock roadie and failed musician, Le Donk has lived, loved and learned. Along the way he\'s lost a girlfriend but he has found a new sidekick in up-and-coming rap prodigy Scor-zay-zee. With Meadows\' fly-on-the-wall crew in tow, Donk sets out to make Scor-zay-zee a star...','/fUrQEbGcxGMR2aMdA2PNGJKzRFM.jpg','2009-10-09',71,'Released','One roady. One rapper. One dream.','Le Donk & Scor-zay-zee',25048,1.8457,6,'QGIo7AzBrRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27669,_binary '\0','/ccFavvHGfhA5yI32K0bzDjlyKSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14379088',6.1,3998,'ja','シン・仮面ライダー','A man forced to bear power and stripped of humanity. A woman skeptical of happiness. Takeshi Hongo, an Augmentation made by SHOCKER, and Ruriko Midorikawa, a rebel of the organization, escape while fighting off assassins. What’s justice? What’s evil? Will this violence end? Despite his power, Hongo tries to remain human. Along with freedom, Ruriko has regained a heart. What paths will they choose?','/9dTO2RygcDT0cQkawABw4QkDegN.jpg','2023-03-17',121,'Released','Those which change. Those which never change. And those that don\'t want to change.','Shin Kamen Rider',813477,3.9807,6.948,'Eu5RihzuPeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27670,_binary '\0','/r8xotdjJLzZpdbj3Iz636bUi3oR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438173',5.2,21408,'en','Bait','A freak tsunami traps shoppers at a coastal Australian supermarket inside the building ... along with a 12-foot great white shark.','/f9Ln9y5QRd7vHUWzxSv2Eizs80l.jpg','2012-09-05',93,'Released','A Tsunami Just Flipped The Foodchain.','Bait',118957,5.3851,5.7,'e5jD0q0dhYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27671,_binary '\0','/hTfAhmwSqr79bQAAf5n68q2lw0v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438176',6.4,120518,'en','Fright Night','A teenager suspects his new neighbour is a vampire. Unable to convince anyone, he tries to enlist the help of a self-proclaimed vampire hunter and magician.','/ySQ3v4Fzpy3fePs86eoLiDzwLYM.jpg','2011-07-26',106,'Released','You can\'t run from evil when it lives next door.','Fright Night',58151,9.1683,6.2,'txgGhyjPZGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27672,_binary '\0','/dkx8j5Orh3e46DIU6atEAfj7j2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438216',7.1,6237,'en','Oranges and Sunshine','The story of Margaret Humphreys, a social worker from Nottingham, who uncovers one of the most significant social scandals in recent times – the forced migration of children from the United Kingdom to Australia and other Commonwealth countries. Almost singlehandedly, Margaret reunited thousands of families, brought authorities to account and worldwide attention to an extraordinary miscarriage of justice.','/tMOAXwYuXCCmj7DvJW1e3Wafeib.jpg','2010-10-08',104,'Released',NULL,'Oranges and Sunshine',70925,2.2948,6.9,'wCeGcUGcR44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27673,_binary '\0','/2lPL9sQc2h8tJasyvoNiCdSxEjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438251',4.8,1488,'en','The Best and the Brightest','Set in the world of New York City\'s elite private kindergartens, The Best and the Brightest centers on a fresh-faced young couple, Samantha and Jeff, who have only recently moved into town. The comedy centers on their dawning realization of the lengths they must go to in order to get their five-year-old daughter into school.','/ltitgEWfTRFnnae38JtFEeFqH0P.jpg','2010-10-16',93,'Released',NULL,'The Best and the Brightest',59419,2.1727,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27674,_binary '\0','/dzx5vStQX4bHA1JBq8n5yLUqQx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438254',6.4,66792,'en','Charlie St. Cloud','Accomplished sailor Charlie St. Cloud has the adoration of his mother Claire and his little brother Sam, as well as a college scholarship that will lead him far from his sleepy Pacific Northwest hometown. But his bright future is cut short when tragedy strikes and takes his dreams with it. After high school classmate Tess returns home unexpectedly, Charlie grows torn between honoring a promise he made four years earlier and moving forward with newfound love. As he finds the courage to let go of the past for good, Charlie discovers the soul most worth saving is his own.','/r4XSrs6N086EU8CNm339dHRPhZg.jpg','2010-07-30',99,'Released','Life is for living.','Charlie St. Cloud',37950,6.2074,7,'M8iVf7ilhr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27675,_binary '\0','/ne9l7T6whDCfdwehphf6Z35GKMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438298',7.4,21042,'hi','गुज़ारिश','Ethan, a magician rendered paralyzed in an accident, sets off a furor when he makes a petition to the court to end his own life.','/uQgjtBBZ9se2Kcir9xQ9xY2kzyl.jpg','2010-11-16',126,'Released','Magic is an illusion... and so is life...','Guzaarish',41518,1.9145,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27676,_binary '\0','/wT0ZL7khRSfLnm2GuiRre3ytmz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14383680',7.8,2541,'ro','Complet necunoscuți','One evening, a glass of wine, 7 friends enter a dangerous game: they put their phones on the table and decide that everything they receive that evening, calls, messages, emails, will be answered by a speaker or read aloud.','/hJ1nrC4Qie8y6Prn3CAIiXB9o12.jpg','2021-09-24',94,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Strangers',885087,0.9307,6.3,'f6MEyO5j6xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27677,_binary '\0','/3ZiZxmhQqxzPir29zf3JvKYlWDS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14384176',5.6,1253,'nl','De Familie Claus 2','Jules Claus has embraced Christmas again and is getting ready for the busiest time of the year together with grandpa Noël. Everything seems to go according to plan, until Jules receives a very special letter with an intriguing question...','/k1m0SgH91AtSVcAY9p7dtqh0Pgr.jpg','2021-12-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The Claus Family 2',881180,2.0859,6.4,'wrhL2V1gOZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27678,_binary '\0','/A1gDvcNGFkXg57nLuh5Hk2E8B5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438461',4.9,4079,'zh','建国大业','The tale of one man who fought against the tyranny of a ruler and led his people in battle in the ultimate sacrifice for his country.','/97DSzO3TL5MjEJ7jg08ahdXrOTD.jpg','2009-09-17',138,'Released','When an empire falls a nation is born.','The Founding of a Republic',25626,3.5587,5.3,'Bweod7Gfjew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27679,_binary '\0','/uB81A4gWzVXYbjXMp18WqQQelhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438463',6.2,3788,'ru','Каникулы строгого режима','Two escaped convicts pose as children\'s summer camp staff in order to evade capture and learn about caring for others in the process. Sumrak has been in prison since he was 16 years old but is pushing thirty now, is well acquainted with prison gang culture and covered with tattoos. Evgeni Koltsov is a former police officer unjustly imprisoned and destined for a death sentence from the other inmates if he stays in prison.','/dqT6II2Ya26oVDNpafkmiqBq8aW.jpg','2009-08-25',115,'Released',NULL,'High Security Vacation',41978,1.1658,5.991,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27680,_binary '\0','/2u72uTiSpdJg6YvF38tKvvAdm85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438522',5.5,3504,'ko','고사: 피의 중간고사','In a prep-class for year-end exams, a sadistic killer puts the students through mind-games in order to save each other.','/bsbA0UeJNmmhcBwTRRfcCH23fEt.jpg','2008-08-06',90,'Released','One will die for every incorrect answer.','Death Bell',32272,2.1005,6.2,'ycKjbRXMIQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27681,_binary '\0','/yOrrfx66JkfSGKnEqA4e9gKmz5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438534',4.8,6702,'en','Primal','Anja and five friends join anthroplogy student, Dace, on a journey to study a remote, ancient rock painting. Their excitement vanishes when Mel becomes delirious after skinny-dipping in the waterhole. Feverish, bleeding, confused, she physically and mentally regresses to a vicious predatory state. Mel has gone primal. Mel’s lover and friends realise they are the prey as she savagely hunts them down. Before they can escape another one of them starts to regress, posing a hideous choice; kill their friends or be killed by them. Their only hope of survival is through a cave, where Anja learns too late the meaning of the ancient rock art they came to study.','/mXq7G9GcemHVDpxDmwWDoVULdnQ.jpg','2010-09-22',80,'Released','Evil Lies Within','Primal',49958,2.2612,5.2,'pah2u9AXsHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27682,_binary '\0','/5k97spwjkM5bR0n6MJcyM6mD33R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1438535',5.7,3094,'fr','Film Socialisme','A symphony in three movements. Things such as a Mediterranean cruise, numerous conversations, in numerous languages, between the passengers, almost all of whom are on holiday... Our Europe. At night, a sister and her younger brother have summoned their parents to appear before the court of their childhood. The children demand serious explanations of the themes of Liberty, Equality and Fraternity. Our humanities. Visits to six sites of true or false myths: Egypt, Palestine, Odessa, Hellas, Naples and Barcelona.','/uokQX94huM68TWyGa0Vm3HlLolR.jpg','2010-05-19',102,'Released','Freedom is costly','Film Socialisme',54083,2.2057,5.9,'oLuWoz9OpqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27683,_binary '\0','/paZcZF8RbQHPNq3gb3IeSNITjtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14388612',4,2727,'en','Gunfight at Rio Bravo','When mysterious Russian gunslinger Ivan Turchin rides into a small Texas town, he runs afoul of a bloodthirsty outlaw gang known as The Hellhounds. Outmanned and outgunned, the town must put their trust in Turchin to protect them from annihilation at the hands of the bandits. The gunslinger finds allies in the form of Marshal Austin Carter and Sheriff Vernon Kelly, and together the three must make a desperate stand against impossible and violent odds.','/92hYmHw1XpMEF7yZUzjOzcO4zmC.jpg','2023-01-13',80,'Released','Justice will be served.','Gunfight at Rio Bravo',835767,2.3026,6.494,'9hA-PyfOZ4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27684,_binary '\0','/g9Td0LOUxHz9AzoOBObVjpYp2DW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14391226',5.1,1479,'ta','பபூன்','Two Koothu artistes become pawns in a political power game and are falsely implicated in a drug smuggling case. For how long can they evade a determined police hunt?','/f46akXMSZyQE1CuSBBs6DhT710k.jpg','2022-09-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Buffoon',826448,0.8755,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27685,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1439456',5.2,1397,'ja','淫乱なる一族 第一章 痴人たちの戯れ','Office worker Takashi shares a drink one night with two women: Ryoko and Sakura. Fate intervenes and he subsequently ends up marrying Sakura. The newlywed couple move into Takashi’s family home (shared with his sister, father and grandfather), but Sakura’s nymphomaniac sex drive soon starts to cause tensions.','/oBuo2H8scmxdBl0On977QvvR36E.jpg','2004-04-23',60,'Released',NULL,'The Japanese Wife Next Door',81452,0.8535,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27686,_binary '\0','/60UN7vvcWWggLe0Uz9EFZJx718P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14394620',4.7,3098,'en','Crawlspace','After witnessing a brutal murder in a cabin, a man hides in a crawlspace while the killers scour the property for a hidden fortune. As they draw nearer, he must decide if the crawlspace will be his tomb or the battleground in his fight for survival.','/yZVByCjWvKdSWcYLacoFmnOoSpm.jpg','2022-03-31',90,'Released',NULL,'Crawlspace',879538,3.0978,5.771,'uuuyucG4pkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27687,_binary '\0','/f7DP8jCaoNmzAE341peN91vtAkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1439572',7,67734,'en','Perfect Sense','In Glasgow, Scotland, while a mysterious pandemic begins to spread around the world, Susan, a brilliant epidemiologist, falls in love with Michael, a skillful cook.','/2UuuO6MX1AzD61zX6NHiHQODoI1.jpg','2011-09-29',93,'Released','Without love there is nothing','Perfect Sense',51999,6.4149,6.9,'A18GfVdNP1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27688,_binary '\0','/tqw3TdWNb6pvI4P4ysoejt84A7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14397058',6.6,1321,'en','Aisha','Aisha lives at a centre for asylum-seekers in Ireland in a state of ongoing uncertainty. Having fled Nigeria after a violent gang murdered members of her family, she is desperately trying to find some degree of permanency, where she and her mother can be reunited and live without fear. As she navigates the complex legal system to seek settlement in Ireland, she sparks an unlikely friendship with Conor, a new guard at the centre. A former prisoner, Conor’s life experience and calming presence resonate with Aisha, allowing for a tentative romance to begin. But the bond between the pair comes under strain as the threat of deportation looms ever larger.','/5tazlFOBWLxsFLdJbpZkRMwrMNz.jpg','2022-11-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Aisha',820880,1.5041,6,'ArxJWsGNamg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27689,_binary '\0','/dmhNtB9HvZq4IPNuw7bRF2G4GX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14398312',3.7,2864,'hi','एलएसडी 2: लव, सेक्स और धोखा 2','In a high-tech world, three intertwined stories discuss identity, online intimacy and the allure of social networks.','/ywUtbLJngSqykpxiIHIqJNA06EX.jpg','2024-04-19',119,'Released','Go dirty in love digitally','LSD 2: Love, Sex aur Dhokha 2',1086726,1.0552,5.9,'4A10SL637p8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27690,_binary '\0','/DDKS13sbVxNRimLrQzXhd9lhRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14398454',5.9,3039,'hi','तारा वर्सेज बिलाल','Sparks fly when vivacious yet sensitive Tara collides with a reclusive charmer Bilal in this slice of life story set in vibrant and diverse London.','/nIf8Ya8gL15uO1A2VBdfIArsjct.jpg','2022-10-28',126,'Released',NULL,'Tara vs Bilal',1033878,0.8049,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27691,_binary '\0','/7tu0bQi8Tw2BrOB5vFyUjVtWma0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14400246',5.3,29918,'es','Bird Box Barcelona','After a mysterious force decimates the world’s population, Sebastian must navigate his own survival journey through the desolate streets of Barcelona. As he forms uneasy alliances with other survivors and they try to escape the city, an unexpected and even more sinister threat grows.','/iTGBHdL12QEpLyRVlykDuiYxzAG.jpg','2023-07-14',112,'Released','Fear the ones who see.','Bird Box Barcelona',805320,8.5216,5.915,'zdDN_mflfSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27692,_binary '\0','/85PMh0cKywekAJYDnRXfezYAmEc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440129',5.8,271788,'en','Battleship','When mankind beams a radio signal into space, a reply comes from ‘Planet G’, in the form of several alien crafts that splash down in the waters off Hawaii. Lieutenant Alex Hopper is a weapons officer assigned to the USS John Paul Jones, part of an international naval coalition which becomes the world\'s last hope for survival as they engage the hostile alien force of unimaginable strength. While taking on the invaders, Hopper must also try to live up to the potential that his brother, and his fiancée\'s father—an Admiral—expect of him.','/9b0Im7SfedHiajTwzSL9zGyBI7M.jpg','2012-04-11',131,'Released','The battle for Earth begins at sea.','Battleship',44833,17.5273,5.941,'JpoabtbEJOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27693,_binary '\0','/hSl0AZ2A2BCBy9eaCnF6f6kt0jF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440161',6.3,30900,'en','A Little Bit of Heaven','A guarded woman finds out she\'s dying of cancer but, when she meets her match, the threat of falling in love is scarier than death.','/l6PPyobgVN4eVlD9pJZg2SIPJMT.jpg','2011-02-03',106,'Released','Life starts now.','A Little Bit of Heaven',45156,4.1927,6.347,'7EAMAZhA6ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27694,_binary '\0','/zmYsI8P1yAEroRHyQe2uOWOK9D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440180',6.6,3206,'de','Goethe!','After aspiring poet Johann Wolfgang von Goethe fails his law exams, he\'s sent to a sleepy provincial court to reform. Instead, he falls for Lotte, a young woman who is promised to another man.','/5oyq7zDxGjq5qUdxY9KL7RLSpXL.jpg','2010-10-14',102,'Released',NULL,'Young Goethe in Love',52475,1.6492,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27695,_binary '\0','/3t07y8PFQO4rx5Z2QiHxuRqIBYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14402042',6.4,1777,'en','Bad Shabbos','An engaged interfaith couple are about to have their parents meet for the first time over a Shabbat dinner when an accidental manslaughter gets in the way.','/ga27jnuAsBCdtApoiVEMqxkNL1d.jpg','2025-05-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Bad Shabbos',1065342,2.3439,6.7,'90VptqEUi4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27696,_binary '\0','/bFAozpBc5s0cJcolKABpa5THusM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14402146',6.7,27687,'en','Empire of Light','The duty manager of a seaside cinema, who is struggling with her mental health, forms a relationship with a new employee on the south coast of England in the 1980s.','/h84SnIQF91Gz2Fv1OpMJ3245t4i.jpg','2022-12-09',115,'Released',NULL,'Empire of Light',814757,8.5685,6.6,'3JA3bD5xs-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27697,_binary '\0','/t9qK31W6i2iEuwTaStctjzcEr27.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14402316',6.2,3050,'en','Onyx the Fortuitous and the Talisman of Souls','Onyx joins a group of fellow occultists to attend a dark ritual at the mansion of their idol, Bartok. Suspecting Bartok’s nefarious intentions, Onyx is suddenly immersed in a world of monsters, mystery, and mayhem.','/devICaLkwCklaehPpajjSd47QLP.jpg','2023-10-19',110,'Released','Demons. Ghouls. Tiny wines. Onyx is in for one hell of a weekend.','Onyx the Fortuitous and the Talisman of Souls',929230,2.0069,6,'vKpkjcspfiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27698,_binary '\0','/aDKuDfEAYa2VENKd155D4ZoAl7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440232',7.1,28564,'fr','Les Petits Mouchoirs','Despite a traumatic event, a group of friends decide to go ahead with their annual beach vacation. Their relationships, convictions, sense of guilt and friendship are sorely tested. They are finally forced to own up to the little white lies they\'ve been telling each other.','/djypJtQfUxeEMh6kc0aRzIoN9UR.jpg','2010-10-20',154,'Released','The one thing friends can\'t escape is a few home truths.','Little White Lies',48034,3.6342,7.097,'WyCtRXWz4Cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27699,_binary '\0','/p6GI3J6CfxhxwYmvHpBtYRVi7iq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440266',7.6,16785,'de','Pina','Pina is a feature-length dance film in 3D with the ensemble of the Tanztheater Wuppertal Pina Bausch, featuring the unique and inspiring art of the great German choreographer, who died in the summer of 2009.','/mKKtIJYtaGwcgpMfnVR2byYhfz9.jpg','2011-02-24',106,'Released','Dance, dance, otherwise we are lost.','Pina',57276,2.4535,7.4,'F-cV74Mq7KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27700,_binary '\0','/k0Xr1jjwYO5p1un1S615g8FJ46Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440292',7.3,101742,'en','Submarine','15-year-old deep-thinking Welsh schoolboy Oliver Tate struggles to initiate and maintain a relationship with Jordana, his devilish, dark-haired classmate at their Swansea high school. As his parents\' marriage begins to fall apart, similar problems arise in his relationship with Jordana.','/nbzXX3CYtKUBrPeMcG7PVoLQHXB.jpg','2011-03-18',98,'Released','A comedy that doesn\'t let principles stand in the way of progress.','Submarine',49020,4.8784,7.355,'6CAntLzsQ74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27701,_binary '\0','/j14Z0pP7tpuHZlVBSuUL7tq2SGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14402926',7.2,19885,'en','Batman: The Long Halloween, Part Two','As Gotham City\'s young vigilante, the Batman, struggles to pursue a brutal serial killer, district attorney Harvey Dent gets caught in a feud involving the criminal family of the Falcones.','/5X1n5q08mZ7NpNpxehMFODxfNYq.jpg','2021-07-26',87,'Released','The clock is ticking. The days are numbered. The end has just begun.','Batman: The Long Halloween, Part Two',736074,6.5446,7.4,'u0jEvGBwK44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27702,_binary '\0','/hq4MeMZeWWOvsLyOp9kCG687Ds3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440345',6.7,39088,'en','This Must Be the Place','A bored, retired rock star living in Ireland sets out to find his dead father\'s tormentor, an ex-Nazi war criminal who is a refugee in the U.S.','/7WSD4SAMGVP6BHSOzDGL9Acunxd.jpg','2011-08-24',118,'Released','A former rockstar is hunting down a Nazi criminal. This could be his greatest hit.','This Must Be the Place',53487,4.4718,6.97,'qhfYPrsVpVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27703,_binary '\0','/661n67NhaW12hC2ux7Tm2KgR1u1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14403504',6.6,39156,'en','Last Breath','Seasoned deep-sea divers battle the raging elements to rescue their crewmate trapped hundreds of feet below the ocean\'s surface.','/uB8yTnF6YLIIVKuRJAK8LNk8C6w.jpg','2025-02-24',93,'Released','Make every breath count.','Last Breath',972533,12.9836,6.864,'sNMyooXZZTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27704,_binary '\0','/bhcC8JhHy5A2I6jsCvbXNb4uLCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14403632',3.5,4454,'en','Hoodman','An urban legend haunts a small town as a troubled young woman seeks to find her missing child. A relentless detective pieces together clues that lead them both to a suspected killer. As the mystery unfolds so does the frightening realization that the urban legend is real.','/kyUq8rB4iGFZAFbygbXC52ORaH0.jpg','2021-05-01',96,'Released','Be careful what you believe in','Hoodman',824806,1.7238,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (27705,_binary '\0','/qrRvoObynnktaK4MZIkV5rblGOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440379',5.4,2542,'en','Virginia','A sheriff sees his state senate bid slide out onto the ice when his daughter begins to date the son of a charming but psychologically disturbed woman with whom the sheriff has engaged in a two-decade-long affair.','/rdZbFkToPsvobzbw0khjs9yeKKY.jpg','2010-05-18',111,'Released','The simple life... is rarely simple.','Virginia',102639,2.0426,5.2,'eLPwPuje5E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27706,_binary '\0','/1eTfD2dnT5FbVZwgdJJISjzh2Fm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14404280',5.5,4397,'ja','ホムンクルス','A homeless man meets a medical school student who pays him to volunteer for a surgical procedure known as trepanation, drilling a hole in his skull, which ends up giving him the ability to communicate with the dark side of people’s subconscious minds.','/fnqmGW6N9fxEyPEylC2qT4bbUmd.jpg','2021-04-02',119,'Released',NULL,'Homunculus',741434,2.6633,6,'4WgLrW0Qg5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27707,_binary '\0','/pIlIXdRiMzWMnjcPMyV5IBEvMwC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14404596',5.8,3933,'es','Hasta que nos volvamos a encontrar','The opposite lives of a workaholic architect and a fiery artist are upended when their chance encounter in breathtaking Peru shifts their views on life.','/11SOeFmUEHahuyMOxxT1wdJ3iJs.jpg','2022-03-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Without Saying Goodbye',944664,2.6404,7.134,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27708,_binary '\0','/8SzqooIekWPwYRQYd0YVv9qj4al.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14405338',5.6,8284,'en','A House on the Bayou','In an effort to reconnect and mend their relationship, a troubled couple and their preteen daughter seek an idyllic getaway to a remote mansion in rural Louisiana. But when unexpected visitors arrive, their facade of family unity starts to unravel, as terrifying secrets come to light.','/ovxIJmAsQ4bz60IzVRXroNJ4BbX.jpg','2021-11-19',89,'Released',NULL,'A House on the Bayou',808090,4.9656,5.7,'8lqWoF3YrvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27709,_binary '\0','/tjdjDn10yDK5R7b6HdwtTASqwmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440728',6.3,107302,'en','The American','Dispatched to a small Italian town to await further orders, assassin Jack embarks on a double life that may be more relaxing than is good for him.','/5OEOsRaBsSxD0qBtAhus0iKDzr.jpg','2010-08-31',104,'Released',NULL,'The American',27579,8.1227,6,'ChQB0vpCQWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27710,_binary '\0','/uSqul7QkHCRvElhWtqO5ZkcnoqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440732',5.4,19981,'en','Bel Ami','Georges Duroy travels through 1890s Paris, from cockroach ridden garrets to opulent salons, using his wits and powers of seduction to rise from poverty to wealth, from a prostitute’s embrace to passionate trysts with wealthy beauties, in a world where politics and media jostle for influence, where sex is power and celebrity an obsession.','/59bgVtpX6MPy2d5zberJiRNkDDx.jpg','2012-03-09',102,'Released','Temptation. Seduction. Obsession.','Bel Ami',86467,4.698,5.3,'i-vuCO_jmGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27711,_binary '\0','/e4GdyAtLXbaTW1RmZIc8Atf3EFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14407336',6.4,12752,'fr','La Bête','In the near future where emotions have become a threat, Gabrielle finally decides to purify her DNA in a machine that will immerse her in her past lives and rid her of any strong feelings. She then meets Louis and feels a powerful connection, as if she had known him forever.','/96Jb7yjDkzluBqQZ21j54CJdYeM.jpg','2024-02-07',146,'Released','You remember, don\'t you? That we have already met?','The Beast',914206,4.5532,6.304,'Z5KsjVf8YdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27712,_binary '\0','/1XhN75Ka1xpNj2zeJcTWXT1pvZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1440741',6.6,9148,'pt','Do Começo ao Fim','Two brothers develop a very close relationship as they are growing up in an idyllic and happy family. When they are young adults their relationship becomes very intimate, romantic, and sexual.','/onweiIAA6n7FqL4ryVnDsTIdSPn.jpg','2009-11-12',96,'Released',NULL,'From Beginning to End',44125,3.2061,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27713,_binary '\0','/uRizG2pUwHNjmTLrUvqdi3pWK1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14407884',4.4,6289,'bn','মুজিব: একটি জাতির রূপকার','Biopic on the father of the nation of Bangladesh, Sheikh Mujibur Rahman. The film will showcase his growing up as a child to his standing up against all injustice in his youth to fighting for the independence of his country. How he led a country to it\'s independence with his inspirational presence and fight for the justice.','/71CE8chmoFjNtZIcGOSnD6dDn7O.jpg','2023-10-13',176,'Released',NULL,'Mujib: The Making of a Nation',680133,1.7979,6.5,'givLtqsybMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27714,_binary '\0','/dUg2WN7CPE5noL3mbFXWcC6IAIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14411774',3.5,2172,'te','ఏజెంట్','Ramakrishna aka Ricky\'s only one goal in life is to be a RAW recruitee and undertake some Planet-saving mission. Mahadev, RAW head, ropes him in for the most important mission ever known and unknown to even the Prime Minister of India. Ricky must tame The God, the megalomaniacal lynchpin of a giant-sized crime syndicate.','/ezFe7IZ6xbNdaq4VQglpOIip8qd.jpg','2023-04-27',155,'Released','The Wild One','Agent',886436,1.5981,4.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27715,_binary '\0','/hcNM0HjfPonIzOVy6LVTDBXSfMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14412366',3.5,5656,'en','A Day to Die','A disgraced parole officer is indebted to a local gang leader and forced to pull off a series of dangerous drug heists within twelve hours in order to pay the $2 million dollars he owes, rescue his kidnapped pregnant wife, and settle a score with the city\'s corrupt police chief, who is working with the gang leader and double-crossed him years ago.','/8Kce1utfytAG5m1PbtVoDzmDZJH.jpg','2022-03-04',101,'Released','Only the savage survive.','A Day to Die',864116,5.2682,5.7,'kPSCoh_vJbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27716,_binary '\0','/or5e8vxfd9Nc0rrLHKjD3YFhhmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14412446',6,8610,'nl','Moloch','Betriek lives at the edge of a peat bog in the North of the Netherlands. When she and her family are attacked by a random stranger one night, Betriek sets out to find an explanation. The more she digs, the more she becomes convinced that she is being hunted by something ancient.','/3jVzYOnylmvo7ZnGerjfoRj2wFz.jpg','2022-05-19',99,'Released','Family history may haunt you forever.','Moloch',959558,2.1191,6,'thCNuuI_YkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27717,_binary '\0','/eN60BXsEWxFfgatPpYbGMVO5qdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441326',6.8,59007,'en','Martha Marcy May Marlene','After several years of living with a cult, Martha finally escapes and calls her estranged sister, Lucy, for help. Martha finds herself at the quiet Connecticut home Lucy shares with her new husband, Ted, but the memories of what she experienced in the cult make peace hard to find. As flashbacks continue to torment her, Martha fails to shake a terrible sense of dread, especially in regard to the cult\'s manipulative leader.','/bgB4sa9UfCyGdamfKAZXyEWuAwR.jpg','2011-10-21',101,'Released','You can get away, but you can never escape.','Martha Marcy May Marlene',50837,4.8714,6.6,'ERREgOobLOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27718,_binary '\0','/4WRlyxjZnShSxoPgIxVa4fWx98f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441373',6.3,3916,'it','La solitudine dei numeri primi','Prime numbers are divisible only by one and themselves. These numbers are solitary and incomprehensible to others. Alice and Mattia are both \"prime\", both haunted by the tragedies that have marked them in childhood: a skiing accident for Alice which has caused a defect in her leg, and the loss of his twin sister for Matthew.','/m0gus7fk5eAZHS0OOAHa70Rqu9F.jpg','2010-09-10',118,'Released',NULL,'The Solitude of Prime Numbers',53399,2.5372,5.919,'ybsKbnkjMH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27719,_binary '\0','/eS5OdKN3kRZXQbWRSSCJ4Gh0z26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441395',6.3,173396,'en','Under the Skin','A seductive stranger prowls the streets of Glasgow in search of prey: unsuspecting men who fall under her spell.','/55wmcXJIDYITr7JDijJTdvwSaAv.jpg','2014-03-14',108,'Released',NULL,'Under the Skin',97370,9.4373,6.139,'J7bAZCOk0Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27720,_binary '\0','/l8OyAXEp5FKZWmDhqJMbiwAEvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14415204',5.4,20244,'en','Never Let Go','As an evil takes over the world beyond their front doorstep, the only protection for a mother and her twin sons is their house and their family’s protective bond.','/3EpZ2ksjijmdr8BhISP03PYzNFW.jpg','2024-09-18',101,'Released','One touch is all it takes.','Never Let Go',814889,12.3314,6.1,'-H3yhfkJBnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27721,_binary '\0','/xYyPLClpJiA5pq687pGjRel5qgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14416430',5.8,11983,'en','Paradox Effect','An innocent woman is forced to confront a dangerous kingpin who has kidnapped her young daughter and is holding her for ransom. She teams up with a corrupt Interpol agent, whose son is also being held hostage, to rip off various criminals to raise the ransom to save their offspring. Together they have one hour to save their families from the wrath of bigwig.','/koJFEW997sLjpu4e7wmFioA2mhL.jpg','2024-06-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Paradox Effect',1064375,4.1605,5.472,'vDHccD_L6Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27722,_binary '\0','/uBz7ji0Zw3vX99WH31rHFG5X0Az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14418234',7.5,10563,'hi','अक्षरधाम: ऑपरेशन वज्र शक्ति','NSG commando Hanut Singh, scarred by a past mission, defies orders during a temple siege in Gujarat. He leads a risky operation against terrorists demanding a militant\'s release, while confronting personal demons.','/ckghAN8FuYY2icUyJjVkKXiBrek.jpg','2025-07-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Akshardham: Operation Vajra Shakti',845861,2.4496,9.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27723,_binary '\0','/xqOcH6cKhGEbzgypAHU6UlUUDrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441912',7.3,38718,'en','The Way','When his son dies while hiking the famed Camino de Santiago pilgrimage route in the Pyrenees, Tom flies to France to claim the remains. Looking for insights into his estranged child’s life, he decides to complete the 500-mile mountain trek to Spain. Tom soon joins up with other travelers and realizes they’re all searching for something.','/uaRfG7n92IiuYcKLl7LJo2gr6qO.jpg','2010-09-10',128,'Released','You don\'t choose a life. You live one.','The Way',59468,4.6078,7.1,'0hy54CpKeqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27724,_binary '\0','/gG5ZlQNnJs2NsO9JdeCf1jgNzn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441940',7.2,15893,'en','Broken','Three suburban English families\' lives intertwine with tragic consequences.','/cNeDPyJdeV4Gzs3TcVthM8AJYHW.jpg','2012-08-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Broken',109584,3.3802,6.9,'cfQlRks4fuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27725,_binary '\0','/rsGYoSu8MNGabCMAnZIzzEHzIFd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441951',6.8,22350,'en','Quartet','Cissy, Reggie, and Wilf are in a home for retired musicians. Every year, there is a concert to celebrate Composer Giuseppe Verdi\'s birthday and they take part. Jean, who used to be married to Reggie, arrives at the home and disrupts their equilibrium. She still acts like a diva, but she refuses to sing. Still, the show must go on, and it does.','/lDg2DfB5MuEoUeRFQqzBFVoWGep.jpg','2012-12-26',98,'Released','Four Friends Looking For A Little Harmony','Quartet',121826,3.666,6.496,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27726,_binary '\0','/b1EbaZI1EnHZZP9p9XIKPm0MJew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441952',6.8,69306,'en','Salmon Fishing in the Yemen','A fisheries expert is approached by a consultant to help realize a sheik\'s vision of bringing the sport of fly-fishing to the desert and embarks on an upstream journey of faith and fish to prove the impossible possible.','/tSmZAKh1H80AGERgMOvXAWTwbVQ.jpg','2012-03-09',107,'Released','Make the Improbable Possible','Salmon Fishing in the Yemen',81025,4.4824,6.4,'LqzwMX3ftLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27727,_binary '\0','/jD0mmfqPRpvJUaPdpLl1vMj38CA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441953',7.2,32116,'en','Testament of Youth','Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.','/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg','2015-01-16',129,'Released','Divided by war. United by love.','Testament of Youth',284689,4.026,7.2,'e3e2nNNJ7-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27728,_binary '\0','/1tv5UC54Km9nRikglithpM8GrQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1441956',6.4,3428,'en','West Is West','Salford, North of England, 1976. The now much diminished, but still dysfunctional, Khan family continues to struggle for survival. Sajid, the youngest Khan is deep in pubescent crisis under heavy assault both from his father\'s tyrannical insistence on Pakistani tradition, and from the fierce bullies in the schoolyard. So, in a last, desperate attempt to \'sort him out\', his father decides to pack him off to Mrs Khan No 1 and family in the Punjab, the wife and daughters he had abandoned 35 years earlier.','/aW11kwzXmrr60bZpiAZ64HJodDx.jpg','2010-10-19',103,'Released','Same family. Different country. A lot more baggage.','West Is West',63943,1.6014,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27729,_binary '\0','/brOMTLeCIz0LBt4jxMp1658aT45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1442519',7.3,10266,'fr','Le Hérisson','Paloma is a serious and highly articulate but deeply bored 11-year-old who has decided to kill herself on her 12th birthday. Fascinated by art and philosophy, she questions and documents her life and immediate circle, drawing trenchant and often hilarious observations on the world around her. But as her appointment with death approaches, Paloma finally meets some kindred spirits in her building\'s grumpy janitor and an enigmatic, elegant neighbor, both of whom inspire Paloma to question her rather pessimistic outlook on life.','/dGV6PP3m871ur8pUFWR3NUysTi2.jpg','2009-07-01',100,'Released','Let Life In.','The Hedgehog',19597,2.8056,7.2,'oQFTEv_41HY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27730,_binary '\0','/rf3XJjHoG7gvkiyHNWvPTf0vpNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1442571',6.3,8820,'zh','錦衣衛','Commander Qinglong is the loyal leader of the assassin group that serves the emperor. But when his allies plan a rebellion against the ruler, he finds himself in danger.','/y1VWOEN0UXFiSgCNvWO3lQuzLx.jpg','2010-02-04',114,'Released','Live by your own laws.','14 Blades',34179,4.9972,6.322,'VZgWO9MflMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27731,_binary '\0','/1HosReoyDPOEbBdQVlnboFdcbQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1442576',4.5,3310,'pt','Lula, o Filho do Brasil','The true story of a working class boy who moves to the nation\'s financial capital at a young age and becomes one the most influential politicians in Brazilian history.','/eBMfXW9J9iH81Ni34fplljW03eX.jpg','2010-01-01',130,'Released','Family man. Militant. Hero. Convict. Savior. Romantic. Legend.','Lula, the Son of Brazil',43615,1.8253,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27732,_binary '\0','/sKj3SfJwDcaf10KdsNenL7zHBPK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1442578',7.2,1431,'pt','Reflexões de um Liquidificador','After receiving a new blade, a blender suddenly gains consciousness. As it grapples with existential questions, it becomes the sole companion to the grieving wife of a missing man.','/wVIbeWPhyGJE5rGRbUWeLyNJ6JX.jpg','2010-08-19',80,'Released',NULL,'Reflections of a Blender',158921,1.7637,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27733,_binary '\0','/pczYggeQUyuLy9Z3eZFyl0ts32m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1442584',6.8,1962,'pl','Wszystko, co kocham','Follows four friends in their quest to form a punk band. As workers protests sweep across the country, Janek and Staszek, the sons of a navy man, the rebellious Kazik, and the affluent Diabel gel as a band, but their disparate lives are touched by social turmoil and outside perceptions.','/7oxNnR7jrKMQ64crLiJyFcXZURM.jpg','2009-09-18',95,'Released',NULL,'All That I Love',39936,1.1432,6.6,'QS2NC8nW3eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27734,_binary '\0','/iwRZjIftnFy2vjSAQEKU3JUgv3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14428598',7.2,8712,'hi','क़ला','Haunted by her past, a talented singer with a rising career copes with the pressure of success, a mother\'s disdain and the voices of doubt within her.','/4d2xoBGXMpfeQ6QgpVI4qm34bKP.jpg','2022-11-24',119,'Released',NULL,'Qala',934419,1.3549,6.709,'2g2sXGixh3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27735,_binary '\0','/nKNAWa7ATTHUP90lEMA00h7L26P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14428606',7.1,4686,'zh','當男人戀愛時','A debt collector strikes a deal with a debt-ridden woman struggling to care for her ailing father: he will take care of her bills if she agrees to date him.','/sGFS01I30wgAtsWF2HXFPVmRAmd.jpg','2021-04-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Man in Love',797787,2.8574,7.207,'udr78TOy-Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27736,_binary '\0','/tFjXPjuTLaV51d0P3dSqHizbgtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14430410',6.9,1560,'te','Shukra','A couple enters a city ruled by cruel thugs but an unsettling affair reopens unexpected twists and creates new tensions for them. Will they stick together through it all?','/fkqwXMuIO7OEoYrZG0G9IydCb9.jpg','2021-04-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Shukra',826694,1.3913,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27737,_binary '\0','/j4F0911ZXLm1ONjVUjzgwA7c3MI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14438348',4.4,1818,'en','The Possessed','A man with the ability to exorcise demons fights to protect his loved ones after a sudden surge in demonic possessions. After discovering his nephew\'s girlfriend has the same supernatural gift, they join forces for the ultimate confrontation. Inspired by actual events.','/tDmWqD80zzxQZhgSzDEOW2llS0L.jpg','2021-10-29',97,'Released','When he asks whose body this is... you better pray you tell him it\'s yours!','The Possessed',739901,2.1567,6.3,'oltaw3akmoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27738,_binary '\0','/s6lbpJ0nan6RjTiiF4BPuYo9GST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14438964',6.8,12730,'hi','गुडबाय','After a mother\'s sudden death, chaos and grief collide when four adult siblings return to their traditional father\'s home for the funeral.','/gOCuUqmC96mXVyJ5QtjIpCMt2b8.jpg','2022-10-07',145,'Released','Some strings tune better together...','Goodbye',817866,1.584,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27739,_binary '\0','/kR3GJvjOG6yNwTJ0dyFCuITB4yV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14439178',7.1,1697,'de','Der Fuchs','At the dawn of World War II, a young motorcycle courier in the Austrian army encounters a wounded fox cub and takes it with him to occupied France. The soldier and the fox develop an unlikely bond. Based on the true story of Franz Streitberger, director Adrian Goiginger’s great-grandfather.','/fWbQ7lijtFNvE23VShJCl4PUZmd.jpg','2023-04-13',118,'Released','The true story of a young soldier and his extraordinary comradeship.','The Fox',936117,3.591,7.1,'mz7ErwZnvPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27740,_binary '\0','/rmhMB6KBxdSYatfiFoas60uF6Fc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14439896',6.5,36770,'en','Father Stu','The true-life story of boxer-turned-priest. When an injury ends his amateur boxing career, Stuart Long moves to Los Angeles to find money and fame. While scraping by as a supermarket clerk, he meets Carmen, a Sunday school teacher who seems immune to his bad-boy charm. Determined to win her over, the longtime agnostic starts going to church to impress her. However, a motorcycle accident leaves him wondering if he can use his second chance to help others, leading to the surprising realization that he\'s meant to be a Catholic priest.','/pLAeWgqXbTeJ2gQtNvRmdIncYsk.jpg','2022-04-13',124,'Released','God wanted a fighter… and He found one.','Father Stu',809140,11.3104,7.1,'DHREzAdyCPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27741,_binary '\0','/lIitoSriIAUanELQlMJaJQtJfxL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1444252',3.7,1345,'en','Terror Trap','While driving, an estranged couple\'s car is hit twice. A sheriff takes them to a motel where they hear disturbing noises from a room, realizing they\'re part of a deadly game.','/gab9aBrD8fxP2NveitSzOEP4rfV.jpg','2010-09-22',86,'Released','Once you check in, there\'s no escape...','Terror Trap',48669,3.0199,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27742,_binary '\0','/xzm5lEk9HnzK4WzjYffkdjhDkWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14443888',5.4,4422,'en','Summoning Sylvia','A gay bachelor party turned spooky when sinister spirits are suddenly summoned.','/f73jLLuwof34BqmoScqYMBeVqsY.jpg','2023-04-07',74,'Released','She\'s here, they\'re queer, get used to it','Summoning Sylvia',1060839,1.3488,4.2,'T0lU5juydjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27743,_binary '\0','/84XcRwKHAw4VXdKOYTSW5ARxFEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14444726',7.4,111071,'en','TÁR','As celebrated conductor Lydia Tár starts rehearsals for a career-defining symphony, the consequences of her past choices begin to echo in the present.','/dRVAlaU0vbG6hMf2K45NSiIyoUe.jpg','2022-10-07',158,'Released',NULL,'TÁR',817758,9.6873,7.1,'Na6gA1RehsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27744,_binary '\0','/1QVydsA1cMLJZP9gcKgXQDnRoIi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14445134',5.5,1289,'en','A Cinderella Story: Starstruck','Finley Tremaine, a small-town farm girl, longs to spread her wings and soar as an aspiring performer. When a Hollywood film crew arrives in her sleepy town, she is determined to land a role in the production and capture the attention of handsome lead actor Jackson Stone. Unfortunately, a botched audition forces her to change course. Now, disguised as cowboy “Huck,” Finley finally gets her big break. But can she keep the charade a secret from everyone, including her evil stepmother and devious step-siblings?','/vXIqSUpO84PMNt9JclXzCbPBslT.jpg','2021-06-29',100,'Released',NULL,'A Cinderella Story: Starstruck',818809,3.4513,6.8,'ZNO3ibABY50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27745,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14445892',6.7,1241,'en','Otru','The hero, Indran (Mathivanan Sakthivel) is a writer who meets a blind girl, Pramila (Mahashri). Indran uses the issues that Pramila have as a plot for his novel. In this journey he explores some thrilling events.','/syVI6lz32Y1yiBbrk6Cv0uBjCk8.jpg',NULL,122,'Released',NULL,'Otru',1559627,0.0571,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27746,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14446588',1.2,1696,'hi','Nyay: The Justice','The film revolves around a boy called Mahinder who comes to tinsel town with the youthful innocence and exuberance associated with small towns. His sheer perseverance, dexterity and histrionics makes him earn the admiration of both critics and fans.','/1wUk02QqEtU3X0wk2wgWS6uNdg6.jpg',NULL,150,'Released',NULL,'Nyay: The Justice',1353304,0.7247,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27747,_binary '\0','/aukoS4wGTAYHqnrWe66OLTCyw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14449392',5.1,4005,'en','Slumber Party Massacre','Dana, daughter of the only survivor of a massacre in 1993, is going on a weekend trip with her friends. After their car breaks down in the very same town where her mother once fought the Driller Killer, Dana and her friends must come face-to-face with the man who has haunted her mother’s life for the past 30 years.','/mrYjjxrniqVGg8Nes243siAeBMa.jpg','2021-09-27',86,'Released','You know the drill!','Slumber Party Massacre',818543,2.2049,5.151,'IprWIacOxI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27748,_binary '\0','/jJGNnLBgCgp5jlSJnbo2Z0PVEx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14450630',7.3,1237,'en','What Drives Us','The stories of some of the biggest artists in music, recalling the romance and adventure, as well as the idiocy and chaos, of their time on the road. While the world has changed, the custom has not changed. There is no other way to know whether you can make it in this business. You have to get in the van.','/blnGO5tz1J3sQtj7995vC8kmyDl.jpg','2021-04-30',88,'Released',NULL,'What Drives Us',817775,1.1041,6.8,'fVbgQ5bHLok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27749,_binary '\0','/gSbViBD4ExIOukjUCBWgtAKm7xW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1445203',7.5,4113,'en','Hot Coffee','Most people think they know the \"McDonald\'s coffee case,\" but what they don\'t know is that corporations have spent millions distorting the case to promote tort reform. HOT COFFEE reveals how big business, aided by the media, brewed a dangerous concoction of manipulation and lies to protect corporate interests. By following four people whose lives were devastated by the attacks on our courts, the film challenges the assumptions Americans hold about \"jackpot justice.\"','/o6xUakTHVZgTCc6lBza20r38iMv.jpg','2011-06-27',85,'Released','Is Justice Being Served?','Hot Coffee',68200,1.0461,7.2,'bBKRjxeQnT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27750,_binary '\0','/9i28azixHCQO9qCCJpMfcsuKpWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14452152',5.6,1339,'ta','மிரள்','A family with a past and trauma, encounters a series of strange incidences, in a car journey on their way home and runs into trouble in a windmills farm.','/3UaA5QZ6QQ8So85Yqjz049Bvt0h.jpg','2022-11-11',115,'Released',NULL,'Miral',983025,0.9429,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27751,_binary '\0','/fUlzONyAzageVzf2ruxkw3RWEiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14452174',7.8,4207,'fr','Soundtrack to a Coup d\'Etat','Jazz and decolonization are intertwined in a powerful narrative that recounts one of the tensest episodes of the Cold War.','/eZOB9UurVQjpdIp72L49pyd3anw.jpg','2024-09-11',150,'Released',NULL,'Soundtrack to a Coup d\'Etat',1214539,2.7534,7.7,'_RwLdIiZk_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27752,_binary '\0','/3SJGifNzU4m5LxS3IaddK5q85Hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14452368',7.6,1842,'ta','ரைட்டர்','A writer at a police station gets trapped in an illegal custody case involving an innocent PHD student. With his guilt and regret looming large, can he save the young man?','/oVqgR4mSnKmRKxvLWEGFo8P1Zeo.jpg','2021-12-24',150,'Released',NULL,'Writer',874207,0.8263,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27753,_binary '\0','/ixyUvoBMD4Qz9KYlXSGmXpn3GiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14454876',6,15626,'en','Golda','Set during the tense 19 days of the Yom Kippur War in 1973, Israeli Prime Minister Golda Meir is faced with the potential of Israel’s complete destruction. She must navigate overwhelming odds, a skeptical cabinet and a complex relationship with US Secretary of State Henry Kissinger, with millions of lives in the balance. Her tough leadership and compassion would ultimately decide the fate of her nation and leave her with a controversial legacy around the world.','/fqOOLq12rOMCTcWzxaJ5VUROxp3.jpg','2023-08-23',101,'Released','Israel, 1973... One woman stood between victory and defeat.','Golda',899524,3.4801,6.335,'unW5w6JCEb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27754,_binary '\0','/tqczE9Ci9dWvkPceEaUBXcQCMoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1445520',7.1,6600,'he','הערת שוליים','Jerusalem, Israel. Professors Eliezer and Uriel Shkolnik, father and son, have dedicated their lives to the study of the Jewish scriptures. Eliezer is a stubborn and methodical scholar who has never been recognized for his work; Uriel is a rising star, someone admired and praised by his colleagues. The fragile balance that has kept their personal relationship almost intact is broken in an unexpected way by a simple phone call.','/qy0W1KssDhGbtisBGKZHlcuuYqn.jpg','2011-05-25',102,'Released','Pride, envy, vanity… How far would you go for recognition?','Footnote',72551,1.4473,7,'8dwe7GR9kO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27755,_binary '\0','/30COvn7g7PP58wBkrnnh7Ws9bJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14456350',6.4,15738,'en','About Fate','Two strangers believe in love but never seem to be able to find its true meaning. In a wild twist of events, fate puts each in the other\'s path on one stormy New Year\'s Eve.','/fabZkaVHYJ67KbZx7oFoitauX34.jpg','2022-09-08',99,'Released','Love appears where you least expect it.','About Fate',828613,5.9021,7.5,'BVtN9rwoGpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27756,_binary '\0','/5iMLD2KE0JQcPchegqSpKstU4CT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14458442',6.5,21514,'en','The Son','A successful lawyer, with a new wife and infant, agrees to care for his teenage son from a previous marriage after his ex-wife becomes concerned about the boy\'s wayward behavior.','/hYR2doH3arnX0Y6WULuBPbtaLjN.jpg','2022-11-10',123,'Released',NULL,'The Son',806368,7.0571,6.769,'SJWRY4DzoAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27757,_binary '\0','/py6AS1PyKzGwOqJ3xjuViGltB7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14459724',6.5,1286,'en','The Perfect Pairing','A food and wine critic who hits her head and loses memory while accidentally visiting a winery she panned in the past, owned and operated by single dad Michael.','/fEEJzb0Vtb9xI6Q17ob7uHrDiZK.jpg','2022-01-15',84,'Released','Sip back and fall in love.','The Perfect Pairing',874136,1.9391,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27758,_binary '\0','/vM6ruczYNUkCZ7Xy20LzHJYli2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446072',4.7,7352,'en','Game of Death','CIA agent Marcus is sent undercover to Detroit to take out an arms dealer and the head of the hedge fund that is financing him. His CIA backup has other plans and turns on him, and it\'s a fight to survive in a hospital and into the hedge fund vault.','/iaF3ln0xzbam2QfeFQTKpTVCPHy.jpg','2010-11-27',98,'Released','Winning is everything.','Game of Death',46541,3.5483,4.877,'973jeNA7SFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27759,_binary '\0','/tXcAw0ce4WBX57hloHeL5hk0k2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446089',7.1,1447,'ja','拳銃残酷物語','Businessmen arrange the early release from prison of Togawa, serving time for taking revenge on the truck driver whose carelessness confined Togawa\'s sister, Rie, to a wheelchair. They want Togawa to hijack an armored truck loaded with 120 million yen; their leverage is to promise him money for surgery for Rie. Togawa consents and plans the heist with three others. The plan is solid, but it doesn\'t go smoothly. Togawa must improvise, there are traitors somewhere, and double-crosses mount. Can Togawa escape with enough money to help his sister and ensure a passage out of Japan?','/wobDzcGe4i2WzF4HBAPif3kACrg.jpg','1964-02-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Cruel Gun Story',71722,1.3369,6.7,'dglzcezis94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27760,_binary '\0','/zDtD5gL4JKS6lga9tip7MxpnPIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446147',5.5,5935,'en','Cat Run','When a sexy, high-end escort holds the key evidence to a scandalous government cover-up, two bumbling young detectives become her unlikely protectors from a ruthless assassin hired to silence her.','/2QnqQn7W2IjVEgK6mmUIkfQWY19.jpg','2011-04-01',106,'Released','CATch her if you can...','Cat Run',57353,2.891,5.2,'1JbTsW3QqP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27761,_binary '\0','/u66Dq5aAcKpVIDZ6RFkxr0e6LOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14461690',4.6,2925,'ta','என்ன சொல்ல போகிறாய்','Three individuals with clear notions of what romance discover the indefinable magic that is love when they end up in a triangular romantic relationship.','/UvLa8bM7E9AFnXBWGUc01Tzkp5.jpg','2022-01-13',146,'Released',NULL,'Enna Solla Pogirai',920758,1.2379,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27762,_binary '\0','/3dLjNqylxtfgKelBJse5OWqhggf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446192',7.2,211569,'en','Rise of the Guardians','When an evil spirit known as Pitch lays down the gauntlet to take over the world, the immortal Guardians must join forces for the first time to protect the hopes, beliefs and imagination of children all over the world.','/yfzmfWGjcmyugH6FZ13WcsUGiNj.jpg','2012-11-21',97,'Released','You better believe.','Rise of the Guardians',81188,19.4489,7.379,'aPLiBxhoug0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27763,_binary '\0','/yPiPn8Ywt84lfkzkksDuVmdpTgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446201',5.5,2691,'en','12 Men of Christmas','A high-powered New York publicist finds herself in Montana promoting a charity calendar after being betrayed by her boss and fiancé. Unfortunately, matters of the heart are just as complicated in the wilds as they are in the big city.','/4GIDNspYuIE8P9DycaYTrvDzhaw.jpg','2009-12-05',95,'Released','Calendar Girls meets The Full Monty','12 Men of Christmas',42556,3.4536,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27764,_binary '\0','/eTOUR2CD1Ljv7wityQc9GG5EYVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446206',7,1426,'ru','Волчок','There are two of them: a mother and a girl. They have no names. And they are in a constant run. The mother runs away from the daughter in an attempt to start new life, and the girl runs after her mother as she has no idea how to live without her. This endless run is full with repeated mistakes and resembles a barrel-organ sorrowful song or a spinning-top rotation. This small ridiculous toy \"volchok\" was the first toy in the girl\'s life, the only thing that tied her with the mother.','/zC2vwbgqMDEEg3jbIZZRuNSKF0X.jpg','2009-08-06',88,'Released',NULL,'Wolfy',51272,1.2701,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27765,_binary '\0','/otJxEwWcH12IiAngZiAHJDL0HvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446208',6.9,1239,'en','Ways to Live Forever','Sam loves facts. He wants to know about UFOs and horror movies and airships and ghosts and scientists, and how it feels to kiss a girl. And because he has leukemia he wants to know the facts about dying. Sam needs answers to the questions nobody will answer.','/rxS9OJxUzAsF001Chs7bYhdlOD9.jpg','2010-10-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Ways to Live Forever',69717,2.4594,7,'IdkFaDxwOAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27766,_binary '\0','/s7JEziJOgV7HsQimPGXSrkwMVas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14462452',4.8,3066,'en','Deliver Us','When a nun in a remote convent claims immaculate conception, the Vatican sends a team of priests to investigate, concerned about an ancient prophecy that a woman will give birth to twin boys: one the Messiah, the other the Antichrist.','/qOWZJgeEvH9ETqCFqxc6803l00H.jpg','2023-08-30',102,'Released','A virgin will give birth to heaven and hell.','Deliver Us',1097150,3.4319,5.5,'hlEo8c68cQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27767,_binary '\0','/4rsomWxlqnHt3muGYK06auhOib6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14463484',5.5,26364,'es','A través de mi ventana','Raquel\'s longtime crush on her next-door neighbor turns into something more when he starts developing feelings for her, despite his family\'s objections.','/jmkpZvMVIRrMFevxzOubSBfG0s0.jpg','2022-02-04',112,'Released','It all started with the Wi-Fi password...','Through My Window',818647,10.9426,7.348,'_zxhK3Z-R0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27768,_binary '\0','/a1LBO2XQ9q2VI8r0jtfFBFkVH8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14463514',5.7,3575,'es','Eres tú','The story of Javier who, at the age of 16, while kissing a girl for the first time, realized that he had a gift of romantic clairvoyance. Javier can see the future... and he finally knows who the love of his life is.','/A5buE7Bepg2rJhPaNCSzFc5kQ0T.jpg','2023-03-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Love at First Kiss',818648,3.5886,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27769,_binary '\0','/8EcO2cZ0SGtsp7PjS7TtwU6wNBk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14464962',3.3,1573,'en','Dark Web: Descent Into Hell','The Dark Web is the large part of the Internet that is inaccessible to conventional search engines. Experts estimate that search engines crawl and index less than 1% of all the content that can be accessed over the Internet. A young YouTuber, \"Ludovico 122\", will try to reach the eighth level of the Dark Web, penetrating the deepest and unknown part of the internet while he films the experience for his audience. But he is not prepared for a horrible surprise that will change his life.','/jAaaDI1sYR4jjQcd8esDrLoThKj.jpg','2021-09-17',79,'Released',NULL,'Dark Web: Descent Into Hell',875314,1.106,2.7,'Xe7q6PNzsrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27770,_binary '\0','/707thQazLJiYLBhCrZlRoV05NNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14465706',6.3,7343,'fr','Balle perdue 2','Having cleared his name, genius mechanic Lino has only one goal in mind: getting revenge on the corrupt cops who killed his brother and his mentor.','/uAeZI1JJbLPq7Bu5dziH7emHeu7.jpg','2022-11-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Lost Bullet 2',948276,4.6924,6.5,'_Vw3Nur4YDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27771,_binary '\0','/7CamWBejQ9JQOO5vAghZfrFpMXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14465894',5.9,6189,'fr','Sans répit','After going to extremes to cover up an accident, a corrupt cop\'s life spirals out of control when he starts receiving threats from a mysterious witness.','/aw4GGsRwhQtyLsjzC7dsAahfCDY.jpg','2022-02-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Restless',928381,6.1075,6.09,'L8tCoWmooRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27772,_binary '\0','/iNA964wOcIfJzOHeQRw1iZdc56z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14466284',6.9,5279,'hu','Futni mentem','After the death of her husband, a mother decides to fulfill his last wish and runs the marathon in relays with her daughters. A small problem is that none of them are physically and mentally prepared for running. Furthermore, the relatives and friends are also unexpectedly affected by the women\'s seemingly impossible challenge.','/cyL6gH4JuYvZRNtxePNq10HpFyt.jpg','2024-11-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Gone Running',1283819,2.0593,7,'0emsIMqpdKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27773,_binary '\0','/qDG5SlGkWNsjSJWiGTBMFI8DpzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1446714',7,707291,'en','Prometheus','A team of explorers discover a clue to the origins of mankind on Earth, leading them on a journey to the darkest corners of the universe. There, they must fight a terrifying battle to save the future of the human race.','/qsYQflQhOuhDpQ0W2aOcwqgDAeI.jpg','2012-05-30',124,'Released','The search for our beginning could lead to our end.','Prometheus',70981,17.7208,6.61,'cJMIzdf1eo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27774,_binary '\0','/x3jQdV5GLs1HqyfhJMi8MQanyG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14472156',5,6562,'en','Paint','Carl Nargle, Vermont’s #1 public television painter, is convinced he has it all: a signature perm, custom van, and fans hanging on his every stroke… until a younger, better artist steals everything (and everyone) Carl loves.','/5ELRsmAhDj3FKYYFIrOcOLXyVSM.jpg','2023-04-06',96,'Released','Go to a special place.','Paint',821890,3.3095,5.3,'8ObPQyc6Qsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27775,_binary '\0','/w5XeGpBB2t4sPL5n6lGIDCcnSsL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14474588',6.5,2338,'tr','Sen Ben Lenin','One day waves bring a wooden statue of Lenin to a small town by the Black Sea. The statue is erected in the town square by the Municipality with the hope that it would attract tourists to the town. As an official opening ceremony is planned with the participation of the Prime Minister and a Russian delegation, the statue gets stolen. Two police investigators from Ankara are assigned to find Lenin in twelve hours. Townspeople give an unexpected answer to the question «Where is Lenin?».','/hzSbdn6S295ghGc2gxh4UHpL31F.jpg','2021-11-26',86,'Released',NULL,'You Me Lenin',819223,0.936,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27776,_binary '\0','/7JB0b7resMMDlsGIy6XS4Wc70OZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1447479',6,2536,'en','A Marine Story','Marine officer Alexandra is tough enough to kick any guy\'s ass in a bar fight, but there\'s one opponent she can\'t beat: military policy. When she returns to her conservative hometown from Iraq with a mysterious personal life, she finds herself charged with preparing a tempestuous teenage girl to boot camp.','/pntBMDfGgPgIEeNBhT3JR7E3h5s.jpg','2010-11-05',98,'Released','Every fight is personal','A Marine Story',46564,1.2018,6,'L6u2hhwIUYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27777,_binary '\0','/p2SvjtejMgiBDCLL3ugOmCxk3sY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1447500',7.7,28634,'te','మగధీర','A street-bike racer chances upon a woman and is struck by visions of a past life where they were both star-crossed lovers in a war-ridden kingdom 400 years ago, while the reincarnation of his romantic rival emerges with murderous intent.','/xK7MEV56GF291VG0U5XnVJuvNv3.jpg','2009-07-31',164,'Released',NULL,'Magadheera',23790,2.3676,7.3,'_LaejRruLKI','YouTube','Trailer','