ction becomes increasingly blurred.','/gIJlvYYQsZbABQQwzIItzv06sOU.jpg','2010-04-22',84,'Released','The story of a girl who meets her one true love... Twice','My Girlfriend\'s Boyfriend',46198,2.7101,5.8,'OC8g9EVe68s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27782,_binary '\0','/9c8uXCaljHjRcHabsUmnXaH6tv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1447972',5.8,11988,'en','StreetDance 3D','In order to win the Street Dance Championships, a dance crew is forced to work with ballet dancers from the Royal Dance School in exchange for rehearsal space.','/oqWSenAtDQsWjMLVTMEDvcCtafU.jpg','2010-05-19',98,'Released','Two Worlds. One Dream.','StreetDance 3D',41592,4.145,6.5,'-CgJyzhI7Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27783,_binary '\0','/oX39pOojh66V5fCmakGVYAHVkwM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14479746',6.1,8398,'hi','Thar','A mysterious stranger arrives in a village situated in the Thar desert and crosses paths with a veteran cop investigating a case of brutal killings.','/2PK1WRr8dOF7FG5G4VCal4GcnPT.jpg','2022-05-06',108,'Released',NULL,'Thar',941596,1.3943,5.898,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27784,_binary '\0','/99wklPc31J1jVsPUUxpAQRQHx5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1447981',5.1,4187,'en','Monster High: The Movie','Clawdeen Wolf, half human and half werewolf, has recently started attending Monster High, a school for monsters in all forms. After quickly befriending her classmates Frankie Stein and Draculaura, Clawdeen feels like she has finally found a place where she can truly be herself, or so she thinks. Soon, a devious plan to destroy Monster High threatens to reveal her real identity and Clawdeen must learn to embrace her true monster heart before it\'s too late.','/768OBP28OA4mjavOUAIRlVo14Xu.jpg','2022-10-06',92,'Released','Skull\'s in session.','Monster High: The Movie',335795,5.417,6.7,'Ghz0V5LegzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27785,_binary '\0','/1pb3IZ3id9ayCwzY58yROhEUXwW.jpg','20