er as COVID-19’s reach intensifies. Hopefully for their sake, opposites do indeed attract.','/fyryw1EQxm5FNuLfo7Q8ytfey3I.jpg','2021-10-14',86,'Released','The date they couldn\'t wait to finish turns into an unexpected beginning','7 Days',821046,1.8202,6,'cGdmJMLu-Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27797,_binary '\0','/f9bFYAzSxu5EFZDuGjJW1yphboN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14500264',6.1,1448,'en','To Catch a Spy','When the newly renovated Hotel Optima in Malta has a grand reopening, Chloe and her team from Destination Traveler Magazine, head over to cover the travel scene in Malta and sees someone fall to their death, right past her hotel window.','/pnpIHLdsDzIfU3KvFJDK6hxX47J.jpg','2021-06-20',84,'Released',NULL,'To Catch a Spy',821807,1.8607,7.4,'09Tja_4vFzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27798,_binary '\0','/1ytf7rzkZ7RLlMnBdGggQ0ENe6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14500286',3.7,1584,'en','The Yeti','When an oil tycoon and a famous adventurer vanish into the harsh winter of remote northern Alaska, a hand-picked rescue team endeavors to bring them home. What they don’t know is that they are trespassing on The Yeti’s territory, and the elements are the least of their worries.','/zaqEfoKcWkVni2eONhJ7DRhMO8Q.jpg','2026-04-04',93,'Released','Fear is primal.','The Yeti',1418657,4.8476,5.9,'7rXJdyv5cRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27799,_binary '\0','/hiZLoo6joFeqkPZRlvG1zEw5q0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14500584',7.2,11387,'ja','ドロステのはてで僕ら','A cafe owner discovers that the TV in his cafe suddenly shows images from the future, but only two minutes into the future.','/kIKcksbl6dbmxTMS1wq15iFkBnB.jpg','2020-06-05',70,'Released','A one-take time travel Sci-fi comedy!','Beyond the Infinite Two Minutes',805627,3.218,7.254,'iaLqKLf2f7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27800,_binary '\0','/5spmzlcl3GmtMwQfptTVgMwdM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14502344',4,1398