eguard the country.','/4uyI0nOaIvKw1EN7EbtVpUzod3s.jpg','2022-10-21',167,'Released','Classified File','Sardar',858080,3.5503,6.767,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27820,_binary '\0','/uMdaDcSBJYXNroallLEuFMklimm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14527836',6.7,6082,'ko','내일의 기억','Soo-jin, who lost her memories due to a horrible incident, starts suspecting her husband. She is confused between reality and illusion, truth and lies.','/kTXwu4Ux8QJ1iwBprwVRbEtPa90.jpg','2021-04-21',99,'Released','Distorted illusions, blurred memories and inevitable truth.','Recalled',602302,3.0051,6.932,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27821,_binary '\0','/pPW6HWgfAuxhiYGr00zD7Oll29h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1453245',5.1,5372,'en','Devil\'s Playground','As the world succumbs to a zombie apocalypse, Cole - a hardened mercenary - is chasing the one person who can provide a cure. Not only to the plague but to Cole\'s own incumbent destiny.','/wkrou3Vc89suFBAfypsL2AL8Chw.jpg','2010-08-21',93,'Released','The fight for survival has begun..','Devil\'s Playground',47177,2.2694,5.252,'R-OYltrLxfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27822,_binary '\0','/mIpCxBWNz6SHCQBe2K2PFr5MB7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1453405',7.2,431108,'en','Monsters University','A look at the relationship between Mike and Sulley during their days at Monsters University — when they weren\'t necessarily the best of friends.','/y7thwJ7z5Bplv6vwl6RI0yteaDD.jpg','2013-06-19',104,'Released','Before they were incorporated, they had to be educated.','Monsters University',62211,17.8047,7.058,'E5Zbz6kRFzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27823,_binary '\0','/A7luKytaUQ2Vz7ARMdotUA0JNQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1453409',3.2,2411,'en','Dinocroc vs. Supergator','On a lush tropical island, working under a secret government charter, Martin Drake has not only grown sprawling acres of giant vegetables, but inadvertently spawned two mammoth reptiles as well. Now they\'ve broken free of their enclosures, and Drake has only one option: kill the creatures before word gets back to Washington and they close him down. When Drake\'s first team of well-armed mercenaries gets wiped out within hours of setting down in the jungle, he turns to one lone hunter, The Cajun, to go in single-handedly. But will The Cajun be cunning enough to find the creatures and destroy them before they turn the blue waters red with the blood of tourists. The only hope is to bring the monsters together and make them fight. When one emerges victorious, that will be the time to strike and kill the other. It\'s a risky plan, but ultimately the only one that may work. One of David Carradine\'s last movies.','/nlHG4VW1Du00ySCZKy4KuLPR7nV.jpg','2010-06-26',80,'Released','See The Awesome Battle Of The Beasts','Dinocroc vs. Supergator',44809,2.8152,4.4,'4pVuB6-po94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27824,_binary '\0','/3K1KUm2Q6tZm7VQopHWnx4EdL41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14534796',6.4,4333,'fr','Mascarade','Adrien, an attractive dancer whose career was shattered by a motorcycle accident, squanders his youth in idleness. His life changes when he meets Margot, who lives off scams and amorous manipulations.','/31KgCTaOuLJsUm2cGN2OffripeD.jpg','2022-11-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Masquerade',892515,2.845,6.8,'5g40qe8ABtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27825,_binary '\0','/els3qltvcOnflTlU48iyfMPIctU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14536120',7.1,7329,'ru','Мастер и Маргарита','A struggling writer in 1930s Soviet Moscow finds his life transformed when a mysterious professor arrives with his bizarre entourage, including a wisecracking trickster, a deadly assassin, a vampire maid, and a giant talking black cat, turning the city upside down while exposing the hypocrisy of those in power.','/jw172VAlwfYtWNWvhVrXZPW3jGT.jpg','2024-01-25',157,'Released',NULL,'The Master and Margarita',586353,19.6374,6.8,