hin line between love and hate turns deadly when a wife discovers her husband’s affair — and they both take extreme measures to get what they want.','/hSNHg7qReDtBk1u2PaSSzTTQ8ax.jpg','2022-08-26',106,'Released',NULL,'Loving Adults',990691,5.6275,6.3,'o1VV1DEITI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27897,_binary '\0','/A2WRSXXo5c8ojPhARzN5aczv86H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14592998',5.6,1831,'en','The Railway Children Return','Follow a group of children who are evacuated to a Yorkshire village during the Second World War, where they encounter a young soldier who, like them, is far away from home.','/sbps2oKs5ixtNSQqEae3r4mBq7x.jpg','2022-07-15',95,'Released','A new adventure begins.','The Railway Children Return',826680,2.9574,6.5,'dO3bG18PyzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27898,_binary '\0','/3FbzwKUJyEIfYjpObF3RFmjCIcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14596320',5.2,6939,'en','Spin Me Round','When the manager of an Italian restaurant chain wins the opportunity to attend the franchise’s educational immersion program in Italy, what she thought would be a romantic getaway devolves into chaos and catastrophe.','/55yyTk2PeKeFyyjwNJN70iZZu9n.jpg','2022-08-19',104,'Released','Unbridled romance with a side of soup or salad.','Spin Me Round',826942,4.9081,4.895,'ZrfmRnCs5SQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27899,_binary '\0','/gBJEZDWT00aye1b3mQXlrJ2gWNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14598598',6.9,3535,'ko','혼자 사는 사람들','Jina is the top employee at a credit card company call center. She avoids building close relationships, choosing instead to live and work alone – until she is suddenly tasked with training a new recruit.','/1JJOsHjuILBuD9XyD9InbtERqxu.jpg','2021-05-19',91,'Released','Living alone is fine, but being alone is hard.','Aloners',805058,2.1882,6.833,'6bp7NwAkN84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27900,_binary '\0','/AgmC4zYWDxAwH8u1N1LUEd8XmNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.