rhees (Jason Brooks) that involve bringing an end to the Jarvis family once and for all.',NULL,NULL,1,'Released','Friday the 13th','Friday the 13th Vengeance 2: Bloodlines',1771429,0.4298,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27905,_binary '\0','/5ssdM8ZGvvBCjFuzHtmyCdvMh3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14605426',6.7,1953,'en','Her Pen Pal','Event planner Victoria can’t wait to attend –- and plan –- her best friend’s wedding in Paris. But when she finds out her ex is bringing a date, Victoria reconnects with her French childhood pen pal.','/oz71mRn4UeiE7wr7KV5mUwsncA3.jpg','2021-06-19',84,'Released','Say \"oui\" to love.','Her Pen Pal',809340,2.2851,6.8,'PCsRj4w5Pic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27906,_binary '\0','/gTmpDN9GU2Oq1Ix5L870v717Bsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14606120',6.4,1347,'gu','Swagatam','It is a story about a madhouse which has some weird secrets and trail of insanity which runs in the blood. Manav’s innocent looking family has a secret habit of killing the over-aged lonely men who have nothing to look forward in life. One day, Manav gives his family the good news of his marriage and he discovers all dark secrets of the house. How will he get his life and his family’s life on track.','/3kxEEpTUvqnNtW9wPbflIKwpfkV.jpg','2021-05-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Swagatam',831199,1.5009,7,'jgdX2STfK-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27907,_binary '\0','/flT2E6NwMYv8Rt9ekQo5Skc31fs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14606600',6.1,1346,'en','Baby, It\'s Cold Inside','When a travel agent up for a promotion is directed to forgo her tropical vacation to instead visit the world-famous Ice Hotel, she discovers her sacrifices are more than compensated.','/hTv0Jol2nXFFO7UqbstrXdck2Pz.jpg','2021-05-08',84,'Released','Things are heating up at The Ice Hotel.','Baby, It\'s Cold Inside',819700,2.4171,6.7,'8uC0RTe5Nm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27908,_binary '\0','/rlq4xbuFfBh0oytjOUFOmdjgsr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1460738',6.8,1775,'ja','東のエデン 劇場版I The King of Eden','Takizawa prevented Japan\'s destruction - and then he vanished. Six months later, clues lead Saki to the Big Apple in search of her missing friend. Meanwhile, the remaining Selecao are plotting their final move. Some of them would prefer Takizawa dead and out of the way. Some might even be willing to help him achieve his goals. Unfortunately, some are prepared to destroy everything if it means claiming checkmate in Mr. Outside\'s puzzling game.','/sxCScvnhm0BmEWmye4Z81wopfBo.jpg','2009-11-28',82,'Released',NULL,'Eden of the East Movie I: The King of Eden',35435,3.4364,6.8,'0Q4cc46wym4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27909,_binary '\0','/dJXQ840kmEGefoJ0EQGlpZfsoic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1460743',6.8,9649,'zh','剑雨','Set in ancient China, Zeng Jing is a skilled assassin who finds herself in possession of a mystical Buddhist monk\'s remains. She begins a quest to return the remains to its rightful resting place, and thus places herself in mortal danger because a team of assassins is in a deadly pursuit to possess the remains which holds an ancient power-wielding secret.','/jIQAm7YlBoZqllu4gbnagRlO9NY.jpg','2010-09-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Reign of Assassins',44092,4.4867,6.869,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27910,_binary '\0','/agcdajWVvha6JCDfcDCgAjJUJmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1461238',7.9,1611,'en','Kurt Vonnegut: Unstuck in Time','A documentary 33 years in the making. A director and friend of Kurt Vonnegut seeks through his archives to create the first film featuring the revolutionary late writer.','/9bhe233DhxetlmCxb85264nxnFw.jpg','2021-11-19',127,'Released','The story of a lifetime, or two.','Kurt Vonnegut: Unstuck in Time',485432,1.4562,6.8,'PbunvLdbWxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27911,_binary '\0','/l6FePfGOQiAufW6FyNhKjvsbhDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1461249',5.3,1228,'en','Meskada','Small-town detective Noah Cordin is called to solve a juvenile homicide that occurred during a home burglary in his affluent town of Hilliard. The dead boy\'s mother, Allison Connor, is a member of the Meskada County Board of Commissioners, and a powerful woman in Hilliard; and the entire township rallies together in solidarity - to support her and Detective Cordin\'s efforts to find the killers.','/oNmq7mBaj0HkFBb8CsHz0diFnBY.jpg','2010-10-03',98,'Released','Some crimes find their criminals.','Meskada',47902,1.7515,4.6,'iEQWoIn_bPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27912,_binary '\0','/mw8DgCvmTiLyC47HAhdbXg2qxto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1461307',4.8,1352,'sv','Änglagård - Tredje gången gillt','A lot happens in a small village in 15 years. People fall in love, get married, have kids and divorces. Some move, some die - in Yxared just like in other places. Zac, Fanny and her daughter Alice travels back to to the small village in Ostergotland. Alice makes them return - where does she come from, what are her roots? The question about who Fanny\'s dad is, arises once more. And Alice, who\'s her dad?','/tOqDasd6AhpwGrorkSZcsKilJhg.jpg','2010-12-25',117,'Released','Some move, some die - in Yxared just like in other places.','House of Angels - Third Time Lucky',58557,1.3939,4.4,'k3_zRpRe1xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27913,_binary '\0','/tNtZdMP0OmxXvzA9lpZc9l5V2NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1461418',7.5,8656,'en','The Gruffalo','The magical tale of a mouse who sets foot on a woodland adventure in search of a nut. Encountering predators who all wish to eat him - Fox, Owl and Snake - the brave mouse creates a terrifying, imaginary monster to frighten them away. But what will the mouse do when he meets this frightful monster for real?','/154eUuLvPnI0mwVDGpMgUyniFEy.jpg','2009-12-25',27,'Released',NULL,'The Gruffalo',28118,6.9755,7.353,'cVkj4McR1Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27914,_binary '\0','/uR0FopHrAjDlG5q6PZB07a1JOva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14614892',7.1,19389,'ja','ドラゴンボール超 スーパーヒーロー','The Red Ribbon Army, an evil organization that was once destroyed by Goku in the past, has been reformed by a group of people who have created new and mightier Androids, Gamma 1 and Gamma 2, and seek vengeance against Goku and his family.','/pi0iZOEHeA3ih4p1IwAG4x2DZNH.jpg','2022-06-11',100,'Released','A super awakening and calamity is born.','Dragon Ball Super: Super Hero',610150,8.3529,7.888,'6_fXQSobiHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27915,_binary '\0','/8e2jdxansk1hV1qMk3KwK1jYBSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14617098',6.9,1332,'en','Sweet Revenge: A Hannah Swensen Mystery','As Hannah and Mike experience engaged life while balancing their busy careers, a murder at a 24-hour gym complicates their wedding planning.','/26QfVdLQ6hYEwvrnhdJChQUgJJ8.jpg','2021-08-08',84,'Released','A whole recipe for murder.','Sweet Revenge: A Hannah Swensen Mystery',840382,2.5223,6.9,'xIzm6PLSBx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27916,_binary '\0','/dAcWx9pcEVxDwC90VPxgzXJC7AO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14617254',4.2,2035,'en','The Accursed','Elly is asked by a family friend to spend a few days looking after an elderly woman living in a remote cabin. She readily agrees thinking a short trip to the woods will be a nice escape. The cabin turns out to be anything but relaxing as Elly begins hallucinating in ways that blur reality with her dreams. As the visions take over, Elly realizes that she was lured there by a demonic presence hiding inside of the woman just waiting to break free.','/27IgOiz7Vp19ei13pnRdOir7SD8.jpg','2022-10-14',96,'Released','Are you ready to gaze into hell?','The Accursed',852252,3.0107,5.3,'_29_wx6LjtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27917,_binary '\0','/qdyeQg2gWj1L8cDlwU3tI4s0Hub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14619456',5.8,10594,'en','Faces of Death','A moderator on an internet video-sharing platform stumbles across a potential snuff film ring hidden in the depths of the site\'s content.','/vPVY3S57lEooBLJCg6KGdMHkUxm.jpg','2026-04-10',97,'Released','You can\'t unsee it.','Faces of Death',855435,8.8914,5.694,'D6ScdXrsTMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27918,_binary '\0','/d6YusIEmX2PuL2wiWZKfg4aOlm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462014',7.4,1979,'en','Surviving Progress','Humanity’s ascent is often measured by the speed of progress. But what if progress is actually spiraling us downwards, towards collapse? Ronald Wright, whose best-seller, “A Short History Of Progress” inspired “Surviving Progress”, shows how past civilizations were destroyed by “progress traps”—alluring technologies and belief systems that serve immediate needs, but ransom the future. As pressure on the world’s resources accelerates and financial elites bankrupt nations, can our globally-entwined civilization escape a final, catastrophic progress trap? With potent images and illuminating insights from thinkers who have probed our genes, our brains, and our social behaviour, this requiem to progress-as-usual also poses a challenge: to prove that making apes smarter isn’t an evolutionary dead-end.','/zzyhiTDQIACufSYlETKpP1CMi7O.jpg','2011-11-04',86,'Released','Every time history repeats itself, the price goes up.','Surviving Progress',79172,1.4536,7.4,'sDdhA_qCfYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27919,_binary '\0','/eQvKX69XMRNNgQuwwBL4Wy1qC8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14620236',6,1318,'en','Hilma','Hilma af Klint (1862-1944) is an important part of art history and one of the first ever painters of abstract art. However, unlike the work of many of her peers at the time hers was misunderstood and neglected until long after her death. This is a story about Hilma and the circumstances which made her paintings possible. The film picks up during her early life and ends today; when her art connects with people of all religions and cultures. Just as she intended.','/1DG8gAw3ghKy1QhM7O55wbD7XDI.jpg','2022-10-19',120,'Released',NULL,'Hilma',827991,1.8232,5.2,'VIkT3LtrUQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27920,_binary '\0','/6eFU4wRgnL4YEvDagEianumeGpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462041',6,71254,'en','Dream House','Publisher Will Atenton quits a lucrative job in New York to relocate his wife, Libby, and their daughters to a quaint town in New England. However, as they settle into their home the Atentons discover that a woman and her children were murdered there, and the surviving husband is the town\'s prime suspect. With help from a neighbor who was close to the murdered family, Will pieces together a horrifying chain of events.','/uQFbnBEYguc6EWYKG0Hgq4LVdc2.jpg','2011-09-29',84,'Released','Once upon a time, there were two little girls who lived in a house.','Dream House',69668,5.9183,6.208,'XFxIYqcmRxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27921,_binary '\0','/vrXM77bpRNPJ9VBWRRTGUGigBpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462050',4.8,1512,'de','Horst Schlämmer - Isch kandidiere!','So far he has earned his living as deputy editor-in-chief at the Grevenbroicher Tagblatt, but actually Horst Schlämmer had always guessed: he was destined for something bigger - too much bigger. Without further ado, he therefore quits his old job, founds his very own party and thus starts his rush to the chancellor\'s office. While the election machinery is quickly started and soon picks up speed, only two questions remain unanswered: Is Horst Schlämmer ready for Germany? And is Germany ready for him?','/5rHIjPFK8iG8mabnguMJCWAS3ao.jpg','2009-08-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Horst Schlämmer - Isch kandidiere!',27637,1.8475,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27922,_binary '\0','/afmdDeou88W4OOJXr1Tepu2tLjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462054',6.2,5657,'en','Letters to God','A young boy fighting cancer writes letters to God, touching lives in his neighborhood and inspiring hope among everyone he comes in contact. An unsuspecting substitute postman, with a troubled life of his own, becomes entangled in the boy\'s journey and his family by reading the letters. They inspire him to seek a better life for himself and his own son he\'s lost through his alcohol addiction.','/vkOXEUy9J0GNtrqXY9Z9rl9pDHf.jpg','2010-04-09',110,'Released','Given the right address, anything is possible.','Letters to God',35691,2.8253,6.8,'9bYaYvcqFk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27923,_binary '\0','/cXvp5Bz9AzpKyW9wIYHDuuP3tGw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14622802',5.5,1659,'fr','Frère et Sœur','Alice and Louis are brother and sister. She is an actress; he was a teacher and poet. For more than 20 years, Alice has hated her brother. In all this time they haven’t seen one another. The death of their parents brings the siblings face to face.','/8UJfMqQSNjO33F19EhBIxngeOQU.jpg','2022-05-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Brother and Sister',836202,3.4808,4.9,'al47GwVwyLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27924,_binary '\0','/6v4JNim6vJQ7JljMxxCANqHDe1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14623762',4.1,2195,'en','Death Valley','Mercenaries with nothing to lose are hired to rescue a bioengineer imprisoned in a cold war bunker. Upon entering the ominous facility, they find themselves in a fight for their lives when they come under attack from an unknown and deadly creature.','/lVVBypE10jInpy2lYurWT8lyOXs.jpg','2021-11-18',93,'Released','The Mission has gone to Hell','Death Valley',892113,1.6767,4.8,'tfDL5KnYsTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27925,_binary '\0','/oNg8dOrAXyxv3mJr6vShmTHlfA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462411',5.7,2223,'en','Big Sur','Big Sur is a film adaptation of the Jack Kerouac autobiographical novel of the same name.','/kflrKGGliVnIURJG3W1DcEXyTHH.jpg','2013-11-01',100,'Released','Some souls never stop searching.','Big Sur',156277,1.8846,4.9,'i3lNAIwbpbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27926,_binary '\0','/xjdH7I5QSqCArZEIVjPMJcXvYh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14625190',6.8,1487,'ja','サマーフィルムにのって','Barefoot and her friends decide to make a samurai movie, gather a unique cast and staff for the production, and try to screen it at their school festival.','/zAEI0nAXkWp5tOsceWDirF8bNIC.jpg','2021-08-06',98,'Released','Our summer masterpiece.','It\'s a Summer Film!',747983,2.1105,7.2,'MbW5XY0Uw1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27927,_binary '\0','/tNr8lv3OeLD0OCJPUuazBN3DnTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462667',6.8,15761,'ja','アウトレイジ','When a tough yakuza gangster is betrayed by his bosses, it means all out war. Bodies pile up as he takes out everyone in his way to the top in a brutal quest for revenge.','/s6VVl5WKuGIDlSAm8hgvTsrzODK.jpg','2010-06-12',109,'Released','One wrong move and it\'s all out war.','Outrage',45284,3.874,6.868,'3Fj3htxRRHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27928,_binary '\0','/k4Cw6NeWhOArl4Zv3LP6HC6m2tp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462757',4.9,2492,'en','The Ghostmaker','A group of college friends discover a 15th century coffin that allows them to experience the world as ghosts. While their first adventures in the spirit world are playful and innocent, the \"Box of Shadows\" soon brings out the group\'s most dangerous impulses and desires. The friends find themselves pulled into a world of evil where they learn the line between life and death is there for a reason.','/lWDX11KWm3Sq2FGs7XUBXeW5fgm.jpg','2011-08-01',91,'Released','Life is Good When You\'re Dead','The Ghostmaker',122372,1.6055,5.2,'7y-a0RlEfcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27929,_binary '\0','/ju2i7Is6T4d6u4abdgXsHYkcg2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462758',6.9,177521,'en','Buried','As an American civilian truck driver working in Iraq, Paul Conroy\'s convoy is attacked by a group of Iraqi insurgents. Some time later, Paul awakes in a coffin with only a lighter, a cell phone, and his ever-growing anxiety. Faced with a dwindling oxygen supply and a dying battery, he must fight panic, despair, and delirium as he races against time to escape the claustrophobic death trap.','/lQP2sZngXzjh3NDIWzo9OVK5YVh.jpg','2010-09-24',95,'Released','170,000 sq miles of desert. 90 minutes of oxygen. No way out.','Buried',26388,7.2687,6.6,'d8KBYAvYpO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27930,_binary '\0','/3SxySECq5l4TnBObihnnzItn3AC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462759',5.6,7789,'en','Butcher\'s Crossing','In the 1870s, a young Harvard dropout seeks his destiny out West by tying his fate to a team of buffalo hunters led by a man named Miller. Together, they embark on a harrowing journey risking life and sanity.','/2KdkRsYuzYPlJMLrV39gdjY3WkS.jpg','2023-02-03',105,'Released','Nature judges like a god all men that come to her.','Butcher\'s Crossing',843846,5.3988,5.9,'yJEOJbSuOvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27931,_binary '\0','/57JocxmicOoAMhkUSmdKBlpZWMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462764',6.5,236852,'en','Indiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny','Finding himself in a new era, and approaching retirement, Indy wrestles with fitting into a world that seems to have outgrown him. But as the tentacles of an all-too-familiar evil return in the form of an old rival, Indy must don his hat and pick up his whip once more to make sure an ancient and powerful artifact doesn\'t fall into the wrong hands.','/Af4bXE63pVsb2FtbW8uYIyPBadD.jpg','2023-06-25',155,'Released','A legend will face his destiny.','Indiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny',335977,18.9162,6.5,'ZfVYgWYaHmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27932,_binary '\0','/2ExC9bBiPYPsA1EP5nvsy0GfG44.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462769',6.6,50553,'en','The Odd Life of Timothy Green','A childless couple bury a box in their backyard, containing all of their wishes for an infant. Soon, a child is born, though Timothy Green is not all that he appears.','/24HWf4QBnEbNYDJfNFR1CmwtST5.jpg','2012-08-15',105,'Released','He\'s a force of nature.','The Odd Life of Timothy Green',71864,7.7734,7,'QhaPxj1EIhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27933,_binary '\0','/iFi9fo2iiDOo1kn5GIOqmq6giAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14628220',6.1,1938,'en','Forty Winks','Forty Winks follows Fabio Berker, struggling Hypnotist in New York City, as he is blackmailed into being the world\'s first hypnotist hit man by a mysterious woman who finds out his degree is fake.','/gzOHsSvlz9iTq3T31DTMhVFBSq1.jpg','2022-03-19',80,'Released','The Life of a Hypnotist','Forty Winks',951436,1.3416,5.7,'B8tjMhyHk08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27934,_binary '\0','/hhT61DEebn8IicJbImFXw29GvRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462900',6.6,39031,'zh','一代宗師','The fall of China\'s last dynasty, a time of chaos, division and war, is the golden age of Chinese martial arts. Legendary kung fu master Ip Man, who will eventually train Bruce Lee, finds his peaceful life interrupted by vengeance.','/ydBVVIscL6TsX5hYztA5YpBCwJ3.jpg','2013-01-10',130,'Released','In Martial Arts there is no right or wrong, only the last man standing.','The Grandmaster',44865,7.1613,6.6,'EfbLJh7-hQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27935,_binary '\0','/9DFivmTofVBDZPcX2KJ6TuDIgnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1462901',5.6,7771,'en','All Is Bright','Two ne’er-do-wells from Quebec travel to New York City with a scheme to get rich quick selling Christmas trees.','/spCLVHZnOCcjrGwCEaVi8ADKRsn.jpg','2013-09-10',107,'Released','All is busted. All is broke. All is bitter. All is BRIGHT.','All Is Bright',174311,2.1956,5.4,'omz9Ih_p7GU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27936,_binary '\0','/btk09Axh7woJBK9diBLqNc0KFXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14632158',6.7,1810,'en','The 27-