t sidekick, Elmer.','/dzMfgDxEOfFdw6WIaoC94CayYWL.jpg','2022-10-06',76,'Released',NULL,'Aqua Teen Forever: Plantasm',828900,2.8535,6.4,'F59B9xfWQb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27942,_binary '\0','/us8T8e2bSkyORss8xanwCDZCZxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14636214',5.5,5065,'en','Sweethearts','Two college freshmen who decided to stick with their high school sweethearts have to pull a \'Turkey Dump\' and break up with them over \'Drunksgiving\' the one chaotic night before Thanksgiving in their hometown that puts their codependent friendship to the test.','/890UDXYal6i8A9NbMV5TAxZpOzH.jpg','2024-10-31',98,'Released','First comes love, then comes college','Sweethearts',999890,2.0068,5.8,'jIyJ-1-wThY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27943,_binary '\0','/tN5Ws9NXR6N3LR2S39rHfCXrFkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14637290',4.7,7060,'de','Das Privileg - Die Auserwählten','A wealthy teen and his friends attending an elite private school uncover a dark conspiracy while looking into a series of strange supernatural events.','/qBLi3Nd5JMQGMiOmmfuPgLw5SzD.jpg','2022-02-09',107,'Released',NULL,'The Privilege',926980,2.6628,5.2,'y31nj9uHvJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27944,_binary '\0','/zky1xbkgDwCMiNOLFoPRyjHMo2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14637386',5.4,2486,'en','Parallel','Grief-stricken after the loss of her child, Vanessa takes refuge at a lake house only to be met with an aberration of herself from a parallel universe and realizes the multiverse gates hold the key to releasing her grief or trapping her forever.','/4RQ2xOgRjw00ge7f2srg3bBAwZp.jpg','2024-02-23',88,'Released','Question your reality.','Parallel',876911,2.0721,6.3,'AYBIC1YN-5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27945,_binary '\0','/suLCAaSqpmvyXKdwiFBv6pYMTPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14637756',6.8,2855,'en','Rooney','A documentary covering the life and career of Manchester United and England l