 her family\'s lake house during the pandemic, Parker and her best friend are threatened by an unexpected visitor.','/bshCGAHZRldAfdxXDX3637PW9cR.jpg','2022-09-11',83,'Released','You\'re not safe inside.','Sick',829410,3.9179,6.099,'IlS90jL1EHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27954,_binary '\0','/fwrqW8Lp5VQuppFrODd4iJ8LySE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464335',6.3,307895,'en','Uncharted','A young street-smart, Nathan Drake and his wisecracking partner Victor “Sully” Sullivan embark on a dangerous pursuit of “the greatest treasure never found” while also tracking clues that may lead to Nathan’s long-lost brother.','/rJHC1RUORuUhtfNb4Npclx0xnOf.jpg','2022-02-10',116,'Released','Fortune favors the bold.','Uncharted',335787,23.6687,6.87,'4wCH1K-ckZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27955,_binary '\0','/eiywbFIH6rAiE3yuDoombKeL4xd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464535',5.1,5141,'no','Fritt vilt III','In 1988, a group of teenagers go to visit an abandoned hotel, only to find themselves hunted by a psychotic killer through the Norwegian woods.','/ugGa77nQvRT1REmz3L9mEVVZRUO.jpg','2010-10-15',95,'Released','The beginning is aproaching.','Cold Prey III',56937,2.0286,5.837,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27956,_binary '\0','/qa6E8alhOdOfJusrkSbriFO53G2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464539',4.8,3568,'en','House of Last Things','A mind-bending thriller set in Portland, Oregon about an unspoken tragedy and its effects on a house, its temporary caretakers and the owners, a classical music critic and his wife on a recuperative trip to Italy.','/fd4SUdFRYBdGvbfGaweYSyE6Ihx.jpg','2013-01-30',110,'Released','Pick Up the Key. Unlock the Past.','House of Last Things',204904,1.5182,5,'BNI8KCMBRUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27957,_binary '\0','/lR8eHumEoL8FkszpDvbEUZRXVt5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464540',6.1,254098,'en','I Am Number Four','A teenage fugitive with an incredible secret races to stay one step ahead of the mysterious forces seeking destroy him. With three dead and one on the run, the race to find the elusive Number Four begins. Outwardly normal teen John Smith never gets too comfortable in the same identity, and along with his guardian, Henri, he is constantly moving from town to town. With each passing day, John gains a stronger grasp on his extraordinary new powers, and his bond to the beings that share his fantastic fate grows stronger.','/tPxc7Bb5ZTSFMlCjYxzVWOVy8gD.jpg','2011-02-18',109,'Released','There were nine of us. Three are dead...','I Am Number Four',46529,13.1028,6.2,'XR2QSlHpKg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27958,_binary '\0','/1CF9VduPpELjzPpX1ELKk2tiaXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464580',6.4,46055,'en','Stake Land','Martin was a normal teenage boy before the country collapsed in an empty pit of economic and political disaster. A vampire epidemic has swept across what is left of the nation\'s abandoned towns and cities, and it\'s up to Mister, a death dealing, rogue vampire hunter, to get Martin safely north to Canada, the continent\'s New Eden.','/q5Cq3svR0XPEb9VkVBHPowT1Bxf.jpg','2010-09-30',98,'Released','The Most Dangerous Thing Is To Be Alive.','Stake Land',52015,3.2548,6.2,'atjH_jEr1Io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27959,_binary '\0','/fJGjHVvlaUecsRJ4nnDr6SPyt3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14647404',6,8602,'en','Cat Person','When Margot, a college sophomore, goes on a date with the older Robert, she finds that IRL Robert doesn’t live up to the Robert she has been flirting with over texts.','/atrfmVWmw9NPrpFSfgUE2XG7eF9.jpg','2023-10-06',118,'Released','Based on the sensational New Yorker short story.','Cat Person',843394,4.2338,5.8,'J2VukOLSxoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27960,_binary '\0','/tHTmBF6nhRYmfBR3yRrmrCLy3Oi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1464763',5.5,39835,'en','Mute','A mute man with a violent past is forced to take on the teeming underworld of a near-future Berlin as he searches for his missing girlfriend.','/ihGg1xndLl3MW34Km332pNkyLH7.jpg','2018-02-23',126,'Released','He doesn’t need words.','Mute',401371,4.8666,5.6,'ma8te7ywEio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27961,_binary '\0','/tXQckUIMZMBA2aId7Rhcacan9iP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465478',4.9,2788,'en','Die','Six people, each of them is on the road to self-destruction. They wake up in cells in a surreal facility, without knowing how they got there or why.','/heUAAtPWJVVV5QOMiynJztLcwC1.jpg','2010-01-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Die',53861,1.5249,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27962,_binary '\0','/9Kqw0EjGSLTg9tNhvosUIdbmgRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465485',2.7,1371,'sv','Göta Kanal 3 - kanalkungens hemlighet','Years after winning a race down the Göta Canal, life for a family of shipbuilders gets complicated when they get entangled with the mafia.','/uwrxLIzuspVHAdXlFbvhp55lode.jpg','2009-12-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Who Pulled the Plug? 3',29373,1.2229,2.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27963,_binary '\0','/2e0Ditkl7h4vbsICiZt6c2GCAms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465487',6.7,28672,'fr','L\'Arnacœur','Alex and his sister run a business designed to break up relationships. They are hired by a rich man to break up the wedding of his daughter. The only problem is that they only have one week to do so.','/sw7Sc4u2A9Y0dZ1543MoGVaQdmI.jpg','2010-03-17',105,'Released','He\'s broken every heart except his own… until now.','Heartbreaker',41211,3.6747,6.6,'1WCVzEAa38c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27964,_binary '\0','/vUTbKfyTkP35T06hNffU7F9CC6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465505',6.3,6506,'en','Red White & Blue','A woman attracts the attention of a psychotic former Army interrogator and an emotionally fragile young man caring for his ailing mother.','/fFGoaLCD089W8eT4Qmi9eSmqDim.jpg','2010-10-08',102,'Released','Three lives... bound together in blood','Red White & Blue',41827,1.4878,6.2,'tgOrzg76OUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27965,_binary '\0','/fN6E5gfRuxR2QbYinLWEcNh5gCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465518',6.1,1250,'ko','불꽃처럼 나비처럼','Mu Myeong is a Joseon dynasty headhunter who meets and falls in love with lady Ja Yeong who will become the future Empress Myseongseong. A few years later, Ja Yeong enters the royal palace to marry King Gojong. Mu Myeong still having feelings for Ja Yeong and in an attempt to get closer to her becomes her personal body guard.','/gzC2wata6kthYyni1gb6jjVTcSP.jpg','2009-09-24',124,'Released','An eternal flame of love behind the history.','The Sword with No Name',41441,2.1473,6.1,'Z5l2m5Ka9gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27966,_binary '\0','/t8FomdD4JYlaXOX0l5bp3KZx41z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465519',4.5,1815,'en','The Wrath of Cain','A former kingpin of the streets, Miles “Cain” Skinner is doing life in prison. He is feared and respected among the inmates. When Cain learns that his sentence will be shortened only by brain cancer, his urgency to change his ways goes into overdrive.','/n7PEY1KJUW2Pe21pUnkNKSqWuWO.jpg','2010-11-16',84,'Released',NULL,'The Wrath of Cain',44752,0.6794,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27967,_binary '\0','/Aa1Z4BYYwnxT2lqFnUIGPycSDoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465522',7.5,211197,'en','Tucker and Dale vs. Evil','Two hillbillies are suspected of being killers by a group of paranoid college kids camping near the duo\'s West Virginian cabin. As the body count climbs, so does the fear and confusion as the college kids try to seek revenge against the pair.','/8shwLEDzajJGSfLgbpac8x8xn1U.jpg','2010-01-22',89,'Released','Evil just messed with the wrong hillbillies.','Tucker and Dale vs. Evil',46838,8.6409,7.4,'NdNpFoWrBDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27968,_binary '\0','/vwHwnOwnnFsRdNSi1Zl5QOMY7z4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1465533',5.9,11187,'en','Columbus Circle','An heiress who\'s been shut inside her apartment building for nearly two decades is forced to confront her fears after one of her neighbors is killed and a detective arrives to begin the investigation.','/78vEPvktr8AvRfovH9yWzWD7aje.jpg','2012-03-05',82,'Released','An apartment to die for.','Columbus Circle',92000,2.5341,5.762,'g8E8jKDM5zM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27969,_binary '\0','/tm1kAqfiElwOgXLI8goHBqhIWIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14656632',3.7,5176,'en','Paradise City','Renegade bounty hunter Ryan Swan must carve his way through the Hawaiian crime world to wreak vengeance on the kingpin who murdered his father.','/xdmmd437QdjcCls8yCQxrH5YYM4.jpg','2022-11-11',93,'Released',NULL,'Paradise City',829799,6.2021,5.421,'YBBzvgBDgxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27970,_binary '\0','/84IssWiysuAt1tImKZpBB0zyT9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1466054',7.2,2659,'en','Cloudburst','When Dot\'s granddaughter puts her into a nursing home, Stella stages a breakout, and takes Dot to Canada so they can get married. They pick up a hitchhiker along the way.','/x4vlDX1xc0ZPRYnzyiGMpUOBSPv.jpg','2011-09-23',93,'Released',NULL,'Cloudburst',117098,1.4359,6.4,'U89Xb9j6beo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27971,_binary '\0','/cLzXRwUPP4ZQkMEEuhAbA0yF8MB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1466072',7.1,1303,'en','William S. Burroughs: A Man Within','A riveting and emotional journey into the world of writer William S. Burroughs, a man considered as cold as an iceberg on a winter night.','/2ibZjkVG0E43Pkxb4Vk0vySUSn9.jpg','2010-11-05',88,'Released',NULL,'William S. Burroughs: A Man Within',47753,1.6677,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27972,_binary '\0','/rWHgkCGMpGMXbbGxQIhyngeO7wC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14666592',7.5,3661,'en','Milli Vanilli','The story of Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan, who became fast friends during their youth in Germany. With Rob coming from a broken home and Fabrice having left an abusive household, they shared a similar upbringing, as well as a future goal: to become famous superstars. In a few short years, their dreams came true. Rob and Fab, better known as Milli Vanilli, became the world\'s most popular pop duo in 1990 and won the GRAMMY for Best New Artist. However, their ascension to success came with a devastating price that ultimately led to their infamous undoing.','/fVC6z68GbLHqf4LCgJUGfArlzXb.jpg','2023-06-10',106,'Released','10 million albums. 1 epic lie.','Milli Vanilli',1123287,1.9607,7,'_ygUUbEaUZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27973,_binary '\0','/fQejyaLj0AaEryHGEszJHt2kQ9A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14668224',3,2251,'bn','দিন - The Day','After an eight-year hiatus, Ananta Jalil\'s new film \'Din - The Day\' will officially herald his return to the big screen in July 2022. Long time co-star and wife Barsha stars opposite him as co-lead on the film that has the distinction of being a joint collaboration with the country of Iran. Principal photography took place in Iran, Turkey, Afghanistan and Bangladesh.','/vqYSMazKfGPmPU3OrlrjUDnWT6R.jpg','2022-07-07',179,'Released',NULL,'Din - The Day',997936,1.6501,3,'U-2SUokmPlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27974,_binary '\0','/zE97tcQOx7Ax6g1xKdKeCjTgpNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14668630',6.1,18426,'en','Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile','When the Primm family moves to New York City, their young son Josh struggles to adapt to his new school and new friends. All of that changes when he discovers Lyle — a singing crocodile who loves baths, caviar and great music — living in the attic of his new home. But when Lyle’s existence is threatened by evil neighbor Mr. Grumps, the Primms must band together to show the world that family can come from the most unexpected places.','/dN6XnCEP3AO7N4XFOFyZ8V8kZF5.jpg','2022-10-07',106,'Released','He knows every scale.','Lyle, Lyle, Crocodile',830784,10.0007,7,'kSHecHtkXAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27975,_binary '\0','/kSdIVZu7Cv60o9hTbKBzcTrbMX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14670094',5.2,3365,'en','Ruthless','A high school coach, whose teenage daughter was murdered, takes matters into his own hands by going after the men who kidnap his students for their sex trafficking operation.','/4ndp1pnHWRuiZLNpFJvO4Kh6Tav.jpg','2023-12-14',93,'Released','Break bones first. Ask questions later.','Ruthless',984249,4.5608,6.403,'iCM060OOWSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27976,_binary '\0','/4hLtzIcRe2q4oY8pv63XssDna2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14670198',6.9,1893,'te','పెళ్ళికూతురు పార్టీ','A seductive younger sister who tries to sabotage the marriage of her conservative older sister by going on a bachelorette road trip while being chaperoned by their reluctant grandmother.','/eP88j9SHXbZhJg4n9UvLZ4M0VE2.jpg','2022-06-24',132,'Released',NULL,'Pellikuturu Party',961624,1.0611,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27977,_binary '\0','/y8y0n2XxPYtW9IZhZe495Of7ZqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14670276',7.7,2137,'pa','ਲੇਖ਼','During their teen years, Rajvir and Ronak are attracted to one another but never act on their feelings. As years go on and they drift apart, they are reunited by fate and rediscover their attraction.','/xUQK8J7RrDRxdd00oGOM55KjJzg.jpg','2022-04-01',130,'Released',NULL,'Lekh',955575,1.6093,8.6,'tOlsYCsXJdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27978,_binary '\0','/bqmwgymX1G4J4zweheaPai8rbv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467088',5.1,2314,'en','Sweet Karma','A mute Russian girl infiltrates Toronto\'s underground sex trade to avenge the death of her sister.','/4eICrJCzM4M5nBCgtWpTe3l4lhP.jpg','2009-08-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Karma',46534,1.2066,4.8,'NBs4YZoZDeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27979,_binary '\0','/1HiZLxlZdLNviwXdBGe6L77fIWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467273',7,5681,'it','La prima cosa bella','The film tells the story of the Michelucci family, from the nineteen-seventies to the present day: the central character is the stunningly beautiful Anna, the lively, frivolous and sometimes embarrassing mother of Bruno and Valeria. Everything begins in the Summer of 1971, at the annual Summer beauty pageant held at Livorno’s most popular bathing establishment. Anna is unexpectedly crowned “Most Beautiful Mother”, unwittingly stirring the violent jealousy of her husband. From then on, chaos strikes the family and for Anna, Bruno and his sister Valeria, it is the start of an adventure that will only end thirty years later.','/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg','2010-01-15',122,'Released',NULL,'The First Beautiful Thing',36940,2.2196,7.235,'PFJpbtWLHww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27980,_binary '\0','/uQCEU5TInMRFjL6buecKj30n0lq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14672882',4.5,1448,'en','The Tomorrow Job','A team of thieves use a time travel drug to trade places with their future selves to execute the ultimate heist. When interrupted on a job the team must fix their past mistakes to prevent disastrous consequences.','/Ah3pJ3iuX28PKHjGLyIrEsFVq5q.jpg','2023-01-13',105,'Released','Time changes everything.','The Tomorrow Job',1064912,1.3562,4.672,'VIiXdwADCpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27981,_binary '\0','/wubUakLEAAnKeXmuTks5insTKQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467304',4.4,98483,'en','The Human Centipede (First Sequence)','During a stopover in Germany in the middle of a carefree road trip through Europe, two American girls find themselves alone at night when their car breaks down in the woods. Searching for help at a nearby villa, they are wooed into the clutches of a deranged retired surgeon, who has a very disturbed vision.','/gMtjxIkEi0hnTV5lPHbgeZ4ZpUZ.jpg','2009-10-31',92,'Released','Their flesh is his fantasy.','The Human Centipede (First Sequence)',37169,18.5204,5.2,'glfBurdSUS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27982,_binary '\0','/i9cxl3W6N2lpQE3EBVpBW6iKYHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467306',6.7,1910,'it','Viola di Mare','Nothing - not her father, not the church - can stop unruly Angela from being with her childhood best friend turned great love, Sara. Based on a true story, Viola di Mare, presents a uniquely engaging portrait of family, community and gender roles in a 19th century Italian village.','/rU5fHzO1WqjZlJp6A5CWJDF96Rg.jpg','2009-10-15',105,'Released',NULL,'The Purple Sea',34220,1.4096,6.6,'q483zFA2GjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27983,_binary '\0','/56okeNiTIIo0VR1xaZRfUj0Twkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14673560',6.3,4809,'en','Ride the Eagle','When Leif’s estranged mother, Honey dies she leaves him a ‘conditional inheritance’. He has to complete her elaborate to-do list before he gets her cabin in Yosemite. Leif steps into Honey’s wild world as the mother he never really knew tries to make amends from beyond the grave.','/iLQk1rKQ6dZOle3ElEFIIche6O4.jpg','2021-07-30',89,'Released','Change is in the air.','Ride the Eagle',830991,3.3455,6.2,'2UzyQ8QdpAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27984,_binary '\0','/cmRirdFMcrwMqH1h51rwYCp7waH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467388',6.5,4199,'pt','Nosso Lar','The selfish Dr. André Luiz dies and awakes in the limbo called \"Umbral\". After a painful period in the gruesome swamp, he is rescued and brought in a white light to \"Nosso Lar\" (meaning \"Our Home\"). He finds a place of harmony, where people live in peace awaiting','/rBOvHjIdNokh7GqTEZykm2Mo9Ce.jpg','2010-09-03',103,'Released',NULL,'Astral City: A Spiritual Journey',52333,3.1177,7.2,'xgCFZlAouc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27985,_binary '\0','/cmz40N9zZWsmCJ2vSlDaCKWeqlt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1467391',4.3,3661,'es','Spanish Movie','Large doses of humor, ingenious nods to Spain\'s most recent national cinema, an artistic cast highly linked to comedy and a high reserve of surprises constitute the ingredients of this crazy comedy: Spanish Movie.','/uUW7KgUKBi83kU0tlBJLYwdY4ZR.jpg','2009-12-03',83,'Released','How Paranormal It All Is!','Spanish Movie',35640,2.7754,5,'AjdwN1CzmlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27986,_binary '\0','/2PpnYuHupX4qmFteKIRS42ClTDj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14680834',6.3,1298,'ar','ماء العين','Aicha, a Tunisian mother gifted with prophetic dreams, lives in the isolated north of Tunisia with her husband Brahim and young son Adam. The family lives in anguish after the departure of the eldest sons Mehdi and Amine to the violent embrace of war. Months later, Mehdi unexpectedly returns home with a pregnant wife in tow. Mehdi\'s arrival triggers old wounds and a darkness that threatens to consume the entire village.','/hqHRWmT8hKiC2ua9F5r4qnWaMEI.jpg','2024-11-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Who Do I Belong To',794090,1.4087,7.4,'4ScJJEjfDXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27987,_binary '\0','/ebmY8j6bfTsxUdhVtTaoNITch6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14682800',6.3,5230,'en','Tuesday','A mother and her teenage daughter must confront Death when it arrives in the form of an astonishing talking bird.','/zrd6blans3SqghHSxPAl7tqnaOf.jpg','2024-04-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Tuesday',831395,4.1612,6.8,'qvqyBWCN39o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27988,_binary '\0','/a3WRRPhj8YvoxmkGLB5gJUjZEPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468321',6.8,1432,'ja','東のエデン 劇場版II Paradise Lost','Accused of terrorism and feeling the heat, Saki\'s high-tech crew is in the crosshairs. Meanwhile, the shroud of mystery covering Takizawa is lifted as he and his fellow Selecao make their final moves. Every game must come to an end. For those playing Mr. Outside\'s twisted game of conspiracy thrills, the end comes now.','/aH7cEbHQTsosx6H5bgpueQHOB8I.jpg','2010-03-13',93,'Released',NULL,'Eden of the East Movie II: Paradise Lost',44734,3.0704,6.7,'E6JnUZJ7qvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27989,_binary '\0','/3CgF7M11BZvVl9LDlDnQ2GPo8qB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468381',5.8,1525,'en','Undocumented','A documentary film crew runs afoul of sadistic radicals when they follow illegal immigrants sneaking over the U.S. border.','/cWdVZIBS7KobYvPuq2isygG6SMg.jpg','2010-09-14',96,'Released','I Want You To Go Home','Undocumented',74008,1.5963,6,'YkgRZt3rztM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27990,_binary '\0','/5inZvu1ATfH7ZXfr1fT9Th6fwfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468387',6.4,3422,'en','What if...','Fifteen years ago, Ben Walker made a decision to leave his college sweetheart and ultimately his faith, in order to pursue a lucrative business opportunity. Now with a high-paying career and a trophy fiancé, he is visited by an angel, who gives him a glimpse into what his life would look like had he followed his calling.','/pqwZH7DzDdQuJhPuBrasC3e6GR.jpg','2010-08-20',111,'Released','What if God gave you a second chance?','What if...',42950,2.3759,6.9,'MWNT69KJ9vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27991,_binary '\0','/avI5OoTqJF9gmYFBoil0OVBPdfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14686544',4.5,5635,'en','White Elephant','An ex-marine enforcer must battle his conscience and code of honor when he is forced to do things for the mob.','/lG56H40Y1BuHSPoWtEgDJsSgDBZ.jpg','2022-06-03',93,'Released','Live by a code. Die by a bullet.','White Elephant',843633,4.9548,5.8,'5zEPU7Ekz00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27992,_binary '\0','/9vgNmLi03Asn6Xj1XESB62QhBjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468700',6.5,2062,'tr','40','A bag full of money lands in front of you. Is it luck? The answer to your prayers? Part of a predetermined plan? Or all of the above? Set in the chaotic streets of Istanbul, 40 is a story of three strangers making their way in a city of 12 million, all searching...for one bag. Shot entirely on location, \'40\' combines intense story telling with documentary style cinematography embarking on a synchronistic journey dealing with faith, love, luck, destiny, human trafficking...and a bag of cash that falls from the sky.','/oPCaMQEHM5PlVrnFYyEIhLLSZJp.jpg','2009-09-01',89,'Released','One bag will change everything','40',71698,1.2115,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27993,_binary '\0','/pDyqbp5RymJoDRmx68cXLFty3LE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468703',2.9,1426,'en','Bear','Two young couples are driving through a remote forest when their car breaks down. When a run-in with a curious grizzly bear ends up with the bear being shot to death, the bear\'s mate arrives on the scene and vengefully attacks their van. The couples are trapped inside the disabled car and must come up with clever ways to survive. As they battle the surprisingly intelligent creature, and contemplate their uncertain fate, secrets begin to emerge that threaten to tear the group apart before the bear does.','/8xJjU8rQx2M2alAyGSRIxGzy3gx.jpg','2010-06-04',93,'Released','Play dead.','Bear',44224,1.4404,4.6,'7vXollIFnqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27994,_binary '\0','/33zjdLdGC28kad8Htn8Mo6wEYjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14687418',4.6,5419,'en','The Tank','In 1978 Oregon, Ben and Jules inherit an abandoned coastal property from Ben\'s late mother, who\'s never mentioned it. The untouched house has been kept a secret for 40 years and comes with a beautiful private cove and beach. Jules searches for answers while Ben unwittingly awakens a fiercely protective creature.','/2VxEtwgzOUukatl2IKGn4borpgE.jpg','2023-04-21',100,'Released','Some families have secrets.','The Tank',1098160,2.8452,5.1,'ugp6mE_0Rf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27995,_binary '\0','/30aGIUb1eHNeB5ZKeztL3gatnJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468829',4.9,3019,'en','Cherry Tree Lane','Prosperous professional couple Mike and Christine are settling in for a standard evening of wine, TV and low-level marital hostility when a ring on their doorbell changes everything. Turns out their son Sebastian is in a little trouble with some local boys, who are quite prepared to camp out and wait for him to get home ... the resulting culture-clash chamber drama is raw, revealing and nerve-splittingly tense.','/nx15pr00KmnWqOdGUltMrdaMCev.jpg','2010-07-10',77,'Released','No warning. No mercy. No escape.','Cherry Tree Lane',47259,1.1162,4.6,'wJw3uLrNwso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27996,_binary '\0','/1WygXLVPO4wNYm6WUgUi7PNAvkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468843',6.3,3583,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ダイヤモンド&パール アルセウス 超克の時空へ','When the creator of the world, Arceus, comes to pass judgement on humanity for the theft of the legendary Jewel of Life, Ash and his friends are sent back in time to possibly reverse the events that led to Arceus\' vendetta.','/tpqguVMKyPbINe0GYmMwduoaUar.jpg','2009-07-18',95,'Released','A tale untold. A legend unleashed.','Pokémon: Arceus and the Jewel of Life',39057,5.4713,7.1,'YWqh0EL6fqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27997,_binary '\0','/simmMpmHLWsDYRRzQbCWcqMHrxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1468846',5.3,27866,'en','Get a Job','Life after college graduation is not exactly going as planned for Will and Jillian who find themselves lost in a sea of increasingly strange jobs. But with help from their family, friends and coworkers they soon discover that the most important (and hilarious) adventures are the ones that we don\'t see coming.','/eElBXTTBBy9xgnJh6rMQcXm17En.jpg','2016-03-17',83,'Released','Graduating was the easy part.','Get a Job',186759,4.6899,5.3,'VOhRKseKN2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27998,_binary '\0','/6QmX2BDVr1hIOIPHqnxvp1C1ZZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1469304',5.5,221573,'en','Baywatch','Devoted lifeguard Mitch Buchannon butts heads with a brash new recruit. Together, they uncover a local criminal plot that threatens the future of the Bay.','/6HE4xd8zloDqmjMZuhUCCw2UcY1.jpg','2017-05-25',116,'Released','Don\'t worry, summer is coming.','Baywatch',339846,17.6956,6.078,'eyKOgnaf0BU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(27999,_binary '\0','/r4NUCpiBIpuvUB70jbbNEq0KLDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14695276',6.4,1314,'en','You Had Me at Aloha','When the host of a popular travel show resigns, the network enlists Paige, to step in for the next season set in Hawaii. Unbeknownst to her, they have also hired Ben, who likes to push everything to the extreme. As these two new co-hosts clash over their opposing ideas for production, they grapple with the fact that not only do they need each other to further their careers, but they also balance each other on and off the screen.','/5VdBJhCB6w1X05o2C6pPO7eMzjm.jpg','2021-06-05',84,'Released','She planned for everything... except for romance','You Had Me at Aloha',809336,2.373,6.8,'btfaOEVikac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28000,_binary '\0','/aOaMvd3a5GUOZiHJRF5qgDttijp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14696284',6.4,3269,'en','Better Nate Than Ever','13-year-old Nate Foster has big Broadway dreams but there’s only one problem — he can’t even land a part in the school play. When his parents leave town, Nate and his best friend Libby sneak off to the Big Apple for a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to prove everyone wrong. A chance encounter with Nate’s long-lost Aunt Heidi turns his journey upside-down, and together they must learn that life’s greatest adventures are only as big as your dreams.','/gXyv8pAHhJGhTS1MkQf96VHUAVO.jpg','2022-03-15',92,'Released','Every adventure begins with a dream.','Better Nate Than Ever',826953,3.8553,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28001,_binary '\0','/sWApVoELxEgdUArLWpki6cQMqoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1470023',5.6,50631,'en','MacGruber','Ex-special operative MacGruber is called back into action to take down his archenemy, Dieter Von Cunth, who\'s in possession of a nuclear warhead and bent on destroying Washington, DC.','/9cO8JD7aaQzI4q8lBS8MYXH8LrJ.jpg','2010-05-21',90,'Released','He\'s the ultimate tool.','MacGruber',37931,4.1856,5.423,'PKYrghKwu2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28002,_binary '\0','/vy8tAIeprwZdq8zVvyd3w4H9YBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1470024',6.9,5221,'ro','Marți, după Crăciun','Paul Hanganu loves two women. Adriana his wife and the mother of their daughter, the woman with whom he\'s shared the thrills of the past ten years, and Raluca the woman who has made him redefine himself. He has to leave one of them before Christmas.','/jkNGrNqhbnkEiXktK00TAtaAFkW.jpg','2010-09-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Tuesday, After Christmas',55151,1.5504,6.34,'uAmLtStWZoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28003,_binary '\0','/8Df8Wsstu76Wr8cTPfNHrSveVe6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14700948',5.9,5086,'fr','Friendzone','Hopeful romantic Thibault believes his luck could change when sparks fly between him and Rose. But can he go from bestie to boyfriend?','/xgQ55Koxnq6rwLoPDIfaIjm16bA.jpg','2021-09-29',88,'Released',NULL,'Friendzone',869617,2.2693,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28004,_binary '\0','/imiBIsvNU3TbMB3sbqKanKODS33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1470827',6.3,102423,'en','Monsters','Six years ago NASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched to collect samples, but crashed upon re-entry over Central America. Soon after, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as an infected zone. Today, the American and Mexican military still struggle to contain \"the creatures,\" while a journalist agrees to escort a shaken tourist through the infected zone in Mexico to the safety of the U.S. border.','/cARETxTELl8kQCIcpbRhEcMjkPD.jpg','2010-06-18',94,'Released','After six years, they\'re no longer aliens. They\'re residents.','Monsters',43933,4.9484,6.2,'X-z-fsKf_cU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28005,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1470860',7.2,1303,'nl','Adem','Two young man share an incurable illness. Is their love for the women in their lives strong enough to conquer their fear of dying?','/q9MhINPVJ2yv8mOZRCG0oWApVQY.jpg','2010-09-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Oxygen',60775,0.8238,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28006,_binary '\0','/4vkJmo7wqtEzJ2aCsHVJH16jOss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14714980',5.2,16384,'en','Poker Face','A yearly high-stakes poker game between childhood friends turns into chaos when the tech billionaire host unveils an elaborate scheme to seek revenge for the ways they\'ve betrayed him over the years. But as his plans unfold, a group of thieves hatch plans of their own breaking into the mansion thinking it is empty. The old friends quickly band together and the years of playing the game help them win their way through a night of terror.','/8a2MIBV9LuPYbF5rOEAohjjMz9P.jpg','2022-11-16',94,'Released','Everyone has a limit.','Poker Face',842934,6.3166,5.6,'JAZV5DxV3Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28007,_binary '\0','/iVtpnbPE91vmi3LmcOXycEblwPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14715170',5.3,34125,'en','Falling for Christmas','An engaged, spoiled hotel heiress finds herself in the care of a handsome, blue-collar lodge owner and his precocious daughter after getting amnesia in a skiing accident.','/zgtkXLJagDMlW4iXTCojL5guDeu.jpg','2022-11-10',95,'Released','This holiday season, fall for the unexpected.','Falling for Christmas',833097,4.2709,6.2,'bsNIJd45jYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28008,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14715848',6.5,1558,'te','Dream Boy','A 2022 Indian Telugu movie.','/hszBtBmDsbjtmoVRLtdKpI5HEfP.jpg','2022-07-08',138,'Released',NULL,'Dream Boy',1228121,0.6679,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28009,_binary '\0','/6DJ8GGp5w4e1j2lYJwvKX3jGV8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1472059',5.9,3479,'en','Eating Out: All You Can Eat','Tiffani attempts to help her geeky but very cute friend Casey find true love - or at least a sexy hunk. Taken under Tiffani’s wing, Casey pretends to be Ryan, Tiffani\'s hot, straight, stripper ex-boyfriend, in order to seduce the smoldering Zack online, which works, until the real Ryan shows up!','/lBCK26YxhePOiFjHpfFeycFIGzB.jpg','2009-10-09',80,'Released','Bring a big appetite.','Eating Out: All You Can Eat',25833,2.0395,5.7,'4jXybIot8Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28010,_binary '\0','/aWEBiudzkXoA5W8tp3UQYNanGlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1472195',4.7,1988,'en','The Violent Kind','One night at a secluded farmhouse deep in the Northern California woods, a small group of hardened young bikers and their girlfriends are tormented when one of the girls becomes savagely possessed and a gang of \"Rockabillies\" seemingly from the 1950\'s descends upon them to collect what is growing inside her.','/jA9pNLTXHrYcXF8bzpCBHXHqt1z.jpg','2010-01-25',89,'Released',NULL,'The Violent Kind',56529,1.4475,4.73,'Qtwf5YUiD1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28011,_binary '\0','/h0buW4Y9yqDcl28FzI7kJunfaiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14722598',4.7,1230,'es','Rainbow','In search of her mother, a teenager and her eccentric group of companions set off on a journey, trying to avoid the clutches of a wicked woman.','/7RVajiBhqJVwKIhUqSnRWBWhZA5.jpg','2022-09-18',117,'Released','This is not a movie, it’s a trip!','Rainbow',960170,1.6875,5.5,'66etEocjp3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28012,_binary '\0','/thYZcMfoGCGQBoNFJ7zPIOHpT8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14723224',1.5,40936,'hu','Elk*rtuk','When a young, ambitious market researcher finds out her boss is involved in the leaking of a scandalous Prime Minister speech, she decides to investigate the case to gain a position among the big-shots. Based on actual events.','/x0Fxbt9GMRbGqumV5LGQFyGbrAe.jpg','2021-10-21',125,'Released',NULL,'The Cost of Deception',876671,1.1304,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28013,_binary '\0','/dHM5EMGTcGizcBAb1zzVEuDDUYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1472584',4.6,21747,'en','Max Steel','The adventures of teenager Max McGrath and alien companion Steel, who must harness and combine their tremendous new powers to evolve into the turbo-charged superhero Max Steel.','/AuEzNLF8yvzd169guYEFisqvy5z.jpg','2016-10-14',92,'Released','Unleash your power.','Max Steel',286567,6.4457,5.551,'FSfWGcD78v4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28014,_binary '\0','/3PIF0u6ulHX9Se0DED4TCGXG4U2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14726510',4.8,2253,'en','First Love','A young man’s difficult entry into adulthood, who experiences the highs and lows of his first love, while dealing with the familial fallout spurred by the financial crisis of 2008.','/hqwSUWQcnd1cxpc6Gdx1X3t5v2O.jpg','2022-06-17',95,'Released',NULL,'First Love',834742,3.0976,5.691,'43Zphau9b20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28015,_binary '\0','/pcjWAV4Iw7sl3dpV1dfIoxbbTuu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14729020',5.6,7624,'en','Double Blind','After an experimental drug trial goes awry, the test subjects face a terrifying side effect: if you fall asleep you die. Trapped in an isolated facility, panic ensues as they try to escape and somehow stay awake.','/7JG4otyEyfTSECOq8VkFRdAA01M.jpg','2024-02-09',90,'Released','If you fall asleep you die.','Double Blind',1140648,3.0577,6.175,'mpUROlK2hjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28016,_binary '\0','/mzxbSuPn5a25sH8f77JnSVl1PRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473063',7,4490,'fr','La Fille du puisatier','It\'s the beginning of the WWII. South of France. Patricia, 18, is the oldest daughter of a well-digger, Pascal, who considers her a princess because of her moral qualities. She\'s kind, devoted. One day, she briefly meets a young man, Jacques, the son of Mazel, owner of the shop where her father buy his material. He\'s handsome and teasing. Her father\'s friend, Felipe, would love to marry her, and he invites her to an aviation show. She accepts his invitation only because she knows Jacques is a pilot and will be there. Soon, she\'ll carry his child, and he\'ll be gone, and the family will have to deal with this out-of-wedlock pregnancy...','/o0MGH7xXcbGao6uNJOyRAQj5l1R.jpg','2011-04-20',107,'Released',NULL,'The Well Digger\'s Daughter',62580,2.5502,6.8,'_5Z2zG6xMA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28017,_binary '\0','/t4IKPM6Kd1hWG4MxSxoqMU3xszD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473074',6.1,3945,'fr','Mammuth','Serge Pilardosse has just turned 60. He has worked since the age of 16, never unemployed, never sick. But the hour of retirement has come, and it is disillusionment: he is missing points, some employers having forgotten to declare it! Pushed by Catherine, his wife, he gets on his old motorcycle from the 70s, a \"Mammut\" which earned him his nickname, and sets off in search of his pay slips. During his journey, he rediscovers his past and his quest for administrative documents soon becomes incidental...','/f19wwAy4q1oAmGRBLvxRIq3bvd1.jpg','2010-04-21',92,'Released','A retiree battles to obtain his rightfully due pension.','Mammuth',37832,1.869,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28018,_binary '\0','/dvd330SU63LGyLf7WMKTMgJIl53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14731142',5.6,9142,'en','The Princess Switch 3: Romancing the Star','A priceless relic is stolen from identical royals Queen Margaret and Princess Stacy, who enlist the help of their sketchy look-alike cousin Fiona Pembroke to retrieve it.','/d42eVP0SdHEKUoUnaFpF2eMz4hZ.jpg','2021-11-18',106,'Released','Merry Switchmas.','The Princess Switch 3: Romancing the Star',785533,3.7697,6.7,'CfXzd8fgy6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28019,_binary '\0','/gV2wSIlNMIUxEArKYrTF2NX4tjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14731254',7.6,16440,'en','Val','For over 40 years Val Kilmer, one of Hollywood\'s most mercurial and/or misunderstood actors, has been documenting his own life and craft through film and video. He has amassed thousands of hours of footage, from 16mm home movies made with his brothers, to time spent in iconic roles for blockbuster movies like Top Gun, The Doors, Tombstone, and Batman Forever. This raw, wildly original and unflinching documentary reveals a life lived to extremes and a heart-filled, sometimes hilarious look at what it means to be an artist and a complex man.','/vWJKmfmjpkFeTbUGep6t7w5TexA.jpg','2021-07-23',109,'Released','The life you live is the story you tell.','Val',834027,5.1576,7.2,'YqNnhgEyQCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28020,_binary '\0','/hT9bSswKaiV2Ny3zoCJYn1YS5re.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473149',6.7,1633,'ar','احكي يا شهرزاد','Heba is a TV presenter interested in broadcasting stories that touch on the everyday secret lives of women and the social injustices they face. Her frank style in broadcasting puts her husband\'s job and consequently her marriage in jeopardy.','/8ZvdtedtXy3JxfNIuPUJnHU9LMt.jpg','2009-06-24',134,'Released',NULL,'Scheherazade, Tell Me a Story',44096,1.1724,6.348,'CDxyS7GT7Yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28021,_binary '\0','/4bnTKD6Mp0toKLdisdz4X8BOUsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473357',5.9,2983,'fr','Fatal','Fatal... short for Fatal Bazooka, a hardcore bling-bling rapper. A huge music star. Millions of fans, tons of hits, 4 Artist Of The Year Music Awards of Music, a fashion line, a magazine, and soon his own amusement park: Fataland. He is the undisputed number one, until...','/36bGGHNevGu8R7uq0dFxSdbSlqb.jpg','2010-06-16',95,'Released',NULL,'Fatal',45535,1.4701,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28022,_binary '\0','/5MEFtpfqOtV6PPxmImCySDiwJHA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473397',5.3,3777,'en','Lucky','A wannabe serial killer wins the lottery and pursues his lifelong crush.','/ve8jNuvrzayJe0WSdPUtHf9OPO0.jpg','2011-07-15',103,'Released','Even a serial killer can win the lottery.','Lucky',70585,2.3555,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28023,_binary '\0','/AaLhO6UsPMVT8TpYYGZj899NJOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14735160',5.4,1327,'ar','ماما حامل','When their sixty-something mother announces she’s pregnant, Esam and Basem find themselves in hilarious situations as they try to get her to have an abortion.','/avhiL9jbVwku0KvFL5uf8jNYsnJ.jpg','2021-06-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Mom Is Pregnant',831201,1.2546,4.8,'GQ3DzXcHmts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28024,_binary '\0','/w8Mzsl7hUjUr6gzHHrvneVM8XuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14736734',5.2,1474,'en','Brightwood','A couple find themselves trapped while on a run around a pond.','/359JRjSSr3t1l6ObcmZFbJwvKI8.jpg','2022-12-05',84,'Released','Love Comes Full Circle','Brightwood',1012706,1.6772,5.25,'6uiLq7urlxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28025,_binary '\0','/hTReEn9kCeZLxgQmC46hQszLKSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1473832',6.4,92085,'en','Bridget Jones\'s Baby','After breaking up, Bridget Jones\' happily-ever-after hasn\'t quite gone according to plan. Fortysomething and single again, she decides to focus on her job and surround herself with old friends and new. For once, Bridget has everything completely under control. Then her love life takes a turn when she meets Jack. A week later, she runs into Mark before she finds herself pregnant, but with one hitch - she\'s not sure of the identity of her baby\'s father - Mark or Jack.','/5hHomngoPZrNoXOPlyaHV6eXaQW.jpg','2016-09-14',123,'Released','Relationship status: beyond complicated','Bridget Jones\'s Baby',95610,10.3251,6.4,'5aaWY7rQS3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28026,_binary '\0','/wSFAoevZuVBo4L9f8NgYSD1o9cQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1474276',7.4,34523,'ja','サマーウォーズ','Teenage math whiz Kenji Koiso agrees to take a summer job at the Nagano hometown of his crush, Natsuki. When he arrives, he finds that her family have reunited to celebrate the 90th birthday of their matriarch. His job: pretend to be Natsuki\'s fiancé. Meanwhile, his attempt to solve a mathematical equation causes a parallel world\'s collision with Earth.','/fIFzH5mZOeh9G3UqDd6WdaN72UV.jpg','2009-08-01',114,'Released','Always protect your network.','Summer Wars',28874,6.381,7.5,'HQ7q7eHzs-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28027,_binary '\0','/vOQuHnEDwok0wowjuUaJOSrGwO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14748152',6.4,1223,'ta','மீண்டும்',NULL,'/mNZ06fKlUHwMpaUSSgGSn7Nv8Qa.jpg','2021-12-31',130,'Released',NULL,'Meendum',915932,0.6502,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28028,_binary '\0','/fS0y0xkdSRN28fDUeFJ3RwNXIII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1474889',5.1,1810,'en','The Freebie','Annie and Darren have been married for seven years, and they love each other as much as the day they were wed; they\'re affectionate, have fun together, and enjoy games such as crossword puzzle races. They would seem to have a perfect relationship, except for one thing -- they haven\'t had sex in ages, and seem to have lost all interest in making love with one another, no matter how they try to put each other in the mood. Hoping to put some adventure back into their lives, Annie and Darren come up with an unusual idea -- they each get one night in which they\'re free to find someone and have sex with them, scot-free. But is this going to help their relationship, or is it just going to turn a small problem into a big problem?','/2HywCkYCUJ6U3DdvPhllJsVCgZ6.jpg','2010-09-17',78,'Released','A one night experiment in infidelity','The Freebie',44966,1.6552,5,'0Th-kJMGby4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28029,_binary '\0','/wTRsE4A9zt4xJkmVxH098XDU49L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14753612',7.7,18351,'hi','स्वतंत्र वीर सावरकर','From his years as a student in England to his return to India and his involvement in the Indian independence struggle, the journey of freedom fighter and reformer Vinayak Damodar Savarkar, better known as Veer Savarkar.','/3MRZg94TNfdim6bnigrvUhqqoaM.jpg','2024-03-22',176,'Released','Who Killed His Story?','Swatantrya Veer Savarkar',957328,1.0315,6.4,'LQpxMRwS_bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28030,_binary '\0','/cQM9cgNCMRS2wseuUdGy1dgkt46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1475400',5.8,2038,'es','Que se mueran los feos','Eliseo is ugly, lame and single. He hasn\'t met the woman of his life and has never known love. Nati is ugly, missing a breast and separated. She found the man of her life but, even so, has never experienced true love. Eliseo thinks that the worst of his life is still to come. Nati thinks that the best of her life is still to come. The death of Eliseo\'s mother reunites them twenty years on in a last chance to find happiness and love. But what happens when the woman of your life is married to your brother','/pyPhqYYnmCkd56LKOG99r1TMbqT.jpg','2010-04-23',105,'Released',NULL,'To Hell With The Ugly',45332,1.9783,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28031,_binary '\0','/7ewBir8AIg2b0r4gOceCWUOyKNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14755038',7.1,4445,'es','Cinco lobitos','Amaia has just become a mother, and the challenge is even more significant than she imagined. So when her partner has to leave for several weeks because of his job, she decides to spend time with her parents in a lovely coastal village in the Basque Country and hopefully share the responsibility of looking after her baby. However, she forgot that even when one becomes a parent, one never stops being a daughter.','/4Zt8sVMHNq83C80OsABQIcW3fK5.jpg','2022-05-17',104,'Released',NULL,'Lullaby',835504,1.4953,7.179,'oolcO5mJbWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28032,_binary '\0','/AomVQ9WbrdN1vudNp2z0eLAqnsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14757296',6.2,1705,'en','The Baker\'s Son','Matt’s passion transforms his bread from bland to brilliant. But when his bread loses its magic, the island locals panic and turn to Annie - Matt’s childhood friend and true love - for help.','/wrtQw23W4lzVh2ltcFbJYD3J8CF.jpg','2021-06-12',84,'Released','Who kneads love?','The Baker\'s Son',809338,2.2222,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28033,_binary '\0','/sOR6e2JhxhHQmcvawhfi6gAntgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14757872',6.5,10909,'ko','미드나이트','A serial killer ruthlessly hunts down a deaf woman through the streets of South Korea after she witnesses his brutal crime.','/gXaS8OuavUsEjoW7P8qKrHTGPi1.jpg','2021-06-30',103,'Released','Silence kills.','Midnight',628704,5.2845,7.142,'E7hLubfftiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28034,_binary '\0','/nvkwCDF9vHzc0AdaSFxWqTxZj4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1476425',6.9,17090,'en','Turnabout','A troubled man survives a suicide attempt. He calls an old friend to rescue him in the middle of the night. Their journey is just beginning, and by daybreak, a tragedy will surface.','/Py0NyP2ncyeOshUUGAk1mW2SwV.jpg','2016-01-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Turnabout',433562,1.1675,4.636,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28035,_binary '\0','/ekRp1sEA8pnuzVHQkUESTgNSKdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14764464',5.8,17572,'en','Code 8 Part II','In a world where superpowered people are heavily policed by robots, an ex-con teams up with a drug lord he despises to protect a teen from a corrupt cop.','/h89INyaoH16CdlT7q7BtKikIFRy.jpg','2024-02-27',101,'Released','Power corrupts.','Code 8 Part II',932420,11.308,6.4,'omBi2KxEcRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28036,_binary '\0','/qJu5OXe8toQq4cjZ7h6zkDXRtRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14766956',6.5,3784,'tr','Yolun Açık Olsun','An ex-army captain travels to Dalyan to stop his friend\'s beloved from marrying another man, but grief and trauma from a combat tragedy mar his journey.','/jfDxr9uDIOK5QZDsO76Y7ATs0kF.jpg','2022-05-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Godspeed',971647,1.4153,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28037,_binary '\0','/vorhs2vcFkUfiFRaaSNzV6kQTVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1477014',4.5,2891,'ru','ЛОпуХИ: Эпизод первый','Three friends actors, tired of wasting their time in a small city, decided to try their luck in Moscow. After a show, a mafia leader dies of laughing. Now, they have to run to save their lives.','/yF6ere1MI5pCwoadk2Hc82C5deA.jpg','2009-08-13',85,'Released',NULL,'Stooges',84775,1.1442,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28038,_binary '\0','/omkxkjj0IEhzOc9CBOwK2lrmHSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14770620',5.5,3566,'en','One True Loves','Emma and Jesse are living the perfect life together, until Jesse disappears in a tragic helicopter crash on their first wedding anniversary. Four years later, Emma has found happiness again and is about to marry her best friend when Jesse resurfaces, turning her world upside down and leaving her torn between two great loves.','/6MF3JvIZkluUijw9rvDKNqPT8kC.jpg','2023-04-07',100,'Released','First love meets new love.','One True Loves',846961,4.0529,6.147,'Ai4zkFmoNEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28039,_binary '\0','/qXTSZkk8mQHnZjuRjW9fc2Ax5vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1477076',5.5,119982,'en','Saw 3D','As a deadly battle rages over Jigsaw\'s brutal legacy, a group of Jigsaw survivors gathers to seek the support of self-help guru and fellow survivor Bobby Dagen, a man whose own dark secrets unleash a new wave of terror.','/qHCZ6LjtmqWDfXXN28TlIC9OppK.jpg','2010-10-22',90,'Released','The traps come alive.','Saw 3D',41439,9.5498,6,'A1PxwwdEXao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28040,_binary '\0','/xaQhFVDeWf78FzZw214yU42w0YZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1477109',6,6826,'ja','SPACE BATTLESHIP ヤマト','In 2199, five years after the Gamilons began an invasion of Earth, the planet has been ravaged by the aliens\' bombs. The remnants of humanity have fled underground to escape the irradiated surface. One day, former pilot Susumu Kodai discovers a capsule sent from the planet Iscandar that tells of a device that can remove the radiation from the Earth\'s surface. The Earth Defense Force rebuilds the battleship Yamato with a new type of propulsion system to make the 148,000 light year trip to Iscandar in hopes of saving the Earth. Within one year, the radiation will drive the rest of humanity to extinction.','/qlRJcIFiVwA6X58LOGNuMP1io2H.jpg','2010-12-01',131,'Released','The legendary sci-fi animation, a live-action film at last.','Space Battleship Yamato',61984,4.7214,6.434,'NofVaIpUxHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28041,_binary '\0','/iENuTaWvI2e7KEuKnTxxBhZwF3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14772014',5.1,2502,'en','He Went That Way','Set in 1964, a three-day journey along Route 66 begins when Bobby Falls, a 19-year-old serial killer, hitches a ride with Jim Goodwin, a celebrity animal handler travelling with his precious cargo: his TV chimpanzee, Spanky.','/ii1DVzyj9uJOF9qBrnHCT6nAxUw.jpg','2024-01-05',96,'Released',NULL,'He Went That Way',836972,2.9865,5.6,'cCHH-Ey10HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28042,_binary '\0','/2Yy6GdTEJAmVeXf1GApD70nrZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14773478',6.1,2578,'en','Medusa Deluxe','Talented and cutthroat hairstylists at a competition find one of their own murdered before judging can begin. Winding through neon-lit halls, competitors unspool long-simmering resentments and lies as they search for the killer among them.','/hcuNu3dXNHjWOtcy0WtKU1rSW3Y.jpg','2023-06-08',101,'Released','Murder. Obsession. Hairdressing.','Medusa Deluxe',