ardships or fall victims to the abusive system?','/mkRp4QOvwLw6jI50Wi9eZvOhtU7.jpg','2022-04-08',142,'Released',NULL,'Taanakkaran',851634,1.1006,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28258,_binary '\0','/8PfpwiEMDWyHtOp0yZyxfsiD4Ej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1498858',7.5,2916,'zh','海洋天堂','The story of a father\'s tireless love for his autistic son. A terminally ill father\'s attempt to teach his autistic son the necessary life skills to survive on his own before he passes away. It is also a poignant tribute to the infinite love that parents have for their children and their unending desire to take care and look after them to their best abilities, no matter the struggle, no matter the effort.','/9DKcwFG0tIx1ZpcqkpJ0gBEmIcs.jpg','2010-06-24',96,'Released','Explore true love and affections from the angle of ordinary people.','Ocean Heaven',54328,2.2041,7.652,'hJWzyi0le7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28259,_binary '\0','/ueLHgBgPkFuwYMRoEgSTdUdV38U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1498878',6.5,4147,'en','The Whisperer in Darkness','Folklore professor Albert Wilmarth investigates legends of strange creatures in the most remote hills of Vermont. His enquiry reveals a terrifying glimpse of the truth that lurks behind the legends.','/fOulUsrnMvrzstbu1NEz13zzxY3.jpg','2011-03-12',104,'Released','In the deepest woods of the most remote hills... a dark mystery BEYOND BELIEF!','The Whisperer in Darkness',87178,2.0375,6.348,'A_ee9K9hXtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28260,_binary '\0','/mFjePzH3V23znOOpgY59DwllDQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1498887',6.2,2944,'fa','زنان بدون مردان','Against the tumultuous backdrop of Iran\'s 1953 CIA-backed coup d\'état, the destinies of four women converge in a beautiful orchard garden, where they find independence, solace and companionship.','/zCcboYYdiHwd8PFu3XaVlJVOzxO.jpg','2009-07-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Women Without Men',44159,1.6986,6.3,'UlG1wnCpdxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28261,_binary '\0','/zUkwDQnv5E0kxARmGYqjW7CpOlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14988886',6.2,3652,'hi','U-Turn','Radhika, a journalism intern is investigating bike riders violating traffic on a city flyover, turns sinister when she becomes prime suspect in the mysterious death of one of the motorists, she is forced to prove her innocence and find the real culprit.','/3nyMIlmfknVJRlxETTnuFSuVkGz.jpg','2023-04-28',101,'Released',NULL,'U-Turn',847732,0.9201,5.3,'ckxsrwdF9sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28262,_binary '\0','/aatZYYVD8ViFRuIaI8pWyc6Upi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14989778',7.8,3534,'ta','கணம்','A struggling young musician, along with his two friends, with the help of a quantum physicist goes back in time to prevent the death of his mother. What happens next?','/hzorfVrtVuRoAQbMPzsvQkf3kQM.jpg','2022-09-09',154,'Released',NULL,'Kanam',888319,1.6405,7.357,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28263,_binary '\0','/dolrFsj3RV7JBxMluQWW9pmkrM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14989988',6.4,3482,'te','డెవిల్','A British secret agent takes up the job of solving a dark mystery. He is led into a web of love, deceit and betrayal. His success and failure can change the course of history.','/sF3CTnQlVypKJnXbdL0CurjZmym.jpg','2023-12-29',144,'Released','The British Secret Agent','Devil',894200,1.0606,6.714,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28264,_binary '\0','/uQlQ2pf4x68bReJa0KN3gvBQYOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1499201',5.8,8182,'hi','Anjaana Anjaani','Akash and Kiara are trying to find luck in their life after several failed attempts to be successful in their careers and in love. Fed up, they both decide to commit suicide by jumping off a bridge. However, both land up on the same bridge at the same time.','/me3GHLnVREOlRdJPGmBPqsZBJTT.jpg','2010-09-30',151,'Released','All the greatest love stories... are between strangers.','Anjaana Anjaani',44566,1.7611,5.939,'xvgo6N89I80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28265,_binary '\0','/wBuf3cPIvpU4PvaPRlVYHgsbIex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1499228',5.4,2722,'pl','Galerianki','Shopping malls - today\'s place of creating desires. Best jewelry, clothes, shoes. Unaffordable by young girls, but they \"work\" to get themselves sponsors for new items.','/bti0UE5AXzApcKzXADVvoIK5Eie.jpg','2009-09-25',77,'Released',NULL,'Mall Girls',32559,1.8571,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28266,_binary '\0','/tgdAaxybWhs81dsur1elR62k7PR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1499249',3.3,5980,'en','Lake Placid 3','A game warden moves his family to Lake Placid, once the site of deadly crocodile attacks. Locals assure him the crocs are gone, but his mischievous young son finds a few baby crocs and begins feeding them. They quickly grow into very big adults and start attacking the game warden\'s family and nearby town.','/aHH3fy5ZVs4nrzNLZYIe1p2PJSc.jpg','2010-10-06',93,'Released','Don\'t forget you\'re lunch.','Lake Placid 3',44037,4.0568,5,'l9BCyDDm7sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28267,_binary '\0','/iiq2cWUYblgfvaVn0h3xZMZK65j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14992922',7.1,78411,'en','The Tinder Swindler','Posing as a wealthy, jet-setting diamond mogul, an Israeli conman wooed women online then conned them out of millions of dollars. Now, some victims plan for payback.','/iLUSFjdavIf0SrP7ldoQ1xomQVC.jpg','2022-02-02',114,'Released','Modern love is a dangerous game.','The Tinder Swindler',923632,5.4231,7,'2-Sp692UNqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28268,_binary '\0','/bPrIYmPFFf7iOnbroy3bpN8iiK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14993250',6.5,51410,'hi','रॉकी और रानी की प्रेम कहानी','Gym-freak brat Rocky falls in love with Rani, who comes from a well-educated Bengali family. Being from polar opposite worlds, the two decide to switch their families to adjust to each other\'s cultures and backgrounds and to know if their marriage will survive. Rocky and Rani are trapped in a world where they are united by love but divided by families and the ultimate question is will they fit in?','/vTQIqlxUkOuyf2UKhlM2OUaFGKz.jpg','2023-07-08',178,'Released','The power of family will decide the fate of love','Rocky Aur Rani Kii Prem Kahaani',848116,3.7516,6.18,'Ah_AMkoaLWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28269,_binary '\0','/sRfX2XPjyL7nRKVRKXVG6D0bVQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14993352',5.2,5128,'en','Consecration','After the alleged suicide of her priest brother, Grace travels to the remote Scottish convent where he fell to his death. Distrusting the Church\'s account, she uncovers murder, sacrilege and a disturbing truth about herself.','/yQTRmPzKAdLodknnPVtImm6FWPZ.jpg','2023-02-09',91,'Released','Blessed be the curse.','Consecration',884184,3.501,5.6,'HRjG65M6L2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28270,_binary '\0','/3xvSUNNWdAgzPaKkShNULwET94b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14994064',7.5,1923,'te','అద్భుతం','A boy and a girl ending up using the same phone number without each other\'s knowledge. What will be the consequences of this situation? will they be pleasant?','/mDaBilIfuY6v6V2xMvAdFkozoza.jpg','2021-11-19',142,'Released',NULL,'Adbhutham',891479,0.9935,6.773,'Z7lKq6sDtQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28271,_binary '\0','/fY6n7AeEUnQuSKbfAF2Ftd3Z6sG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14995258',5.8,4620,'fr','Sous emprise','Roxana Aubrey decides to drop her studies and escape her life in Paris for a free diving course in the south of France. She is quickly pulled into a life that reaches new depths brought by the weight of an ocean\'s descent.','/96ZYNAVN5RhBJqkijYkgFjQA630.jpg','2022-09-09',119,'Released',NULL,'No Limit',911129,4.8664,6.008,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28272,_binary '\0','/418RhkXyjuHaQnQZjRin1GWlPkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14996254',3.7,1517,'en','Werewolf Castle','When a pack of werewolves attack a medieval village, Thorfinn, whose lover perished in the attack, joins knights Thomas, Osmund, Hamelin, and Hal Skullsplitter as they lead the fight back against the vicious lycanthropes.','/tjMjnbS3pEdlGU1I2ahb3kXCGRt.jpg','2022-01-31',92,'Released','Swords vs claws.','Werewolf Castle',854867,1.6272,5,'K2yLn0PmxQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28273,_binary '\0','/6vL6V9tcHt2X9hfUC1EcCVqqwwk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14996298',2.6,2120,'te','Veyi Subhamulu Kalugu Neeku','To fulfill an oath to his father, Chaithu, a successful TV show director saves each penny to buy his dream house. After buying the house, he faces unexpected problems that keep his girlfriend at bay. What will he do?','/qD1v9KE6RIUrS7ZFzUmeEILpKQe.jpg','2022-01-07',140,'Released',NULL,'Veyi Subhamulu Kalugu Neeku',1098250,1.0475,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28274,_binary '\0','/9fkYHcOtaz4cKmlDWw7tqUr5TUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1499658',6.9,491663,'en','Horrible Bosses','For Nick, Kurt and Dale, the only thing that would make the daily grind more tolerable would be to grind their intolerable bosses into dust. Quitting is not an option, so, with the benefit of a few-too-many drinks and some dubious advice from a hustling ex-con, the three friends devise a convoluted and seemingly foolproof plan to rid themselves of their respective employers... permanently.','/uQkUwgyFHAm0jGQERPG6Z9o9Zbj.jpg','2011-07-08',98,'Released','Ever wish your boss was dead?','Horrible Bosses',51540,15.5815,6.573,'VpUeQV8sdOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28275,_binary '\0','/t9T6jKk2TqDqzpWTCMSeMNjYcX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1499666',7.9,21262,'ko','김씨 표류기','Mr. Kim is jobless, lost in debt and has been dumped by his girlfriend. He decides to end it all by jumping into the Han River – only to find himself washed up on a small, mid-river island. He soon abandons thoughts of suicide or rescue and begins a new life as a castaway. His antics catch the attention of a young woman whose apartment overlooks the river. Her discovery changes both their lives.','/gGzovvmOEyNVUu4WEHtw9wfDsqI.jpg','2009-05-14',119,'Released','Once in a life time, There comes a moment that you live in HOPE.','Castaway on the Moon',18438,3.5735,7.9,'061ZyqHhdCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28276,_binary '\0','/w4d1jESRZK12oTMMgmh0IWqlHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14998742',5.6,142402,'en','Rebel Moon - Part One: A Child of Fire','When the ruthless forces of the Motherworld threaten a quiet farming village on a distant moon, a mysterious outsider becomes its best hope for survival.','/ui4DrH1cKk2vkHshcUcGt2lKxCm.jpg','2023-12-15',134,'Released','There are no heroes. Only rebels.','Rebel Moon - Part One: A Child of Fire',848326,14.737,6.215,'_rHLOXbFZtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28277,_binary '\0','/jOuu4mEBOuJVb6CkkmRDpjnrZed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt14999684',5.3,16011,'en','Shelby Oaks','A woman\'s obsessive search for her missing sister leads her into a terrifying mystery at the hands of an unknown evil.','/i3omY4P6QUzFQlEeclWY92RuXCH.jpg','2025-10-02',91,'Released','Who took Riley Brennan?','Shelby Oaks',937941,9.7836,5.756,'B-m1TGIY6Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28278,_binary '\0','/fGJ3XKgnmA8xvl1VUjYAUWNhTRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15000156',6.3,7053,'en','Firebrand','Katherine Parr, the sixth wife of King Henry VIII, is named regent while the tyrant battles abroad. When the king returns, increasingly ill and paranoid, Katherine finds herself fighting for her own survival.','/kXAc1LaxL64udWr9SOAHQwOBEG0.jpg','2024-03-27',120,'Released','Henry VIII had six wives. One survived.','Firebrand',848439,4.3091,6.3,'oyAK_isFwbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28279,_binary '\0','/rhJgHS28BVc5o2rBWVwZa3aMJCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15000314',6.8,4541,'zh','白蛇2：青蛇劫起','While trying to free her sister from Fahai\'s clutches, Xiao Qing winds up in a dystopian city and meets a mysterious man who can\'t recall his past life.','/g9SQCIGHDqol11QcymtDqMI7SCp.jpg','2021-07-23',132,'Released','Dependence arises from the previous life.','Green Snake',795607,4.866,8.1,'atyZQvSJLYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28280,_binary '\0','/wuwLMGFlgcdzW0y9JIHhWFemVIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15004156',7.1,8630,'en','Woodstock 99: Peace, Love, and Rage','Explore Woodstock 99, a three-day music festival promoted to echo unity and counterculture idealism of the original 1969 concert but instead devolved into riots, looting and sexual assaults.','/5EKvQJgLg0wX4uYq9WhBlq3pxD5.jpg','2021-07-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Woodstock 99: Peace, Love, and Rage',848562,2.6788,6.5,'h62RmIsx6MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28281,_binary '\0','/iwGMl3AC0MGudaPv3B44ibJ4usJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1500512',5.9,2534,'en','Private Romeo','When eight male cadets are left behind at an isolated military high school, the greatest romantic drama ever written seeps out of the classroom and permeates their lives.','/aRNYy3aoVkM0x257LEqT0lLoVXt.jpg','2011-06-20',97,'Released','Love goes toward love as schoolboys from their books.','Private Romeo',103516,1.7529,5.5,'ajExqERK0p8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28282,_binary '\0','/7pRwTeGZomdcpLAVGRLdq3jzhvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1500516',6.5,1976,'it','Videocracy','In a country where bella figura is a national pastime, Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi is the maestro of media manipulation. Having risen to political primacy with the aid of his Mediaset empire, he now controls 90% of the bel paese’s television channels including the state-run RAI network. Quantity, it seems, does not equal quality. Fed on a diet of semi-naked dancing girls, inane competitions and rickety reality shows built around the most ridiculous of premises, is it any wonder that Italians are becoming a nation of fame-hungry wannabes?','/5osEufK4eDePSuFIhHr0ez5Bv3n.jpg','2009-08-28',85,'Released','The Shame of Europe','Videocracy',23451,1.4428,6.5,'rAFVjNhdlhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28283,_binary '\0','/cVHd71dNH5xPtquY8KxFyLzKnlC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15005606',3.3,1319,'en','Peter Five Eight','Sam, a seemingly poised and glamorous real estate agent in a small mountain community, is revealed to be an unhinged and troubled alcoholic with a dark secret, when a charismatic man named Peter shows up in town one day. As she tries to keep her life from unravelling, an older co-worker named Brenda is targeted by Peter for information at the behest of his powerful and shadowy boss, Mr. Lock.','/62Y7gQ1AT6zibx7BbaFUXMqxGlH.jpg','2024-03-22',100,'Released','The guilty always pay the price.','Peter Five Eight',974878,1.9742,4.4,'Gre6rd9O83Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28284,_binary '\0','/vlhzpgLDoiiMCNa3Jxj2VcuRAoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15006566',7.5,26502,'fr','As bestas','Antoine and Olga, a French couple, have been living in a small village in Galicia for a long time. They practice eco-responsible agriculture and restore abandoned houses to facilitate repopulation. Everything should be idyllic except for their opposition to a wind turbine project that creates a serious conflict with their neighbors. The tension will rise to the point of irreparability.','/ytWMRYLlusyzMFFjyuFRY1liteR.jpg','2022-07-20',138,'Released',NULL,'The Beasts',848685,4.2725,7.5,'GmgdYXYQYac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28285,_binary '\0','/4pWQoCHCprGEGQjaF1QKxTdPdm5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15006754',4.8,2355,'es','La jefa','When a fashion employee thinks she will have to end her promising career after getting pregnant, her boss offers to adopt the child.','/6AuWxKhfxDltvKMpXG4TblyBGNy.jpg','2022-04-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Under Her Control',946703,3.081,5.266,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28286,_binary '\0','/ouN6tUnlwhN0IgtnEI4ADIE6V3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15007046',3.7,1303,'en','The Haunting of the Tower of London','The Two Princes, imprisoned and allegedly murdered in the Bloody Tower within the Tower Of London by Richard III. The story tells how they allegedly came back to haunt the Tower and with guards and inmates starting to die in horrible circumstances, it becomes clear the Two Princes are out for revenge. A chilling ghost story based on the famous mystery.','/3syWckCgiAcsJUjDoC4Skj3Qg2F.jpg','2022-06-27',89,'Released','One of the most infamous murders in history of the Tower of London.','The Haunting of the Tower of London',854881,1.9185,5.8,'naF_YknHAJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28287,_binary '\0','/bCFo3bFiEzNdrWYS1ipaYpyvnXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1500761',7.2,1313,'pt','Viajo Porque Preciso, Volto Porque Te Amo','José Renato, a 35-year-old geologist, is sent out on a solitary expedition to the hinterlands of northeastern Brazil. The purpose of the trip is to assess possible routes for a canal that will connect the area with the only major river in the region. As the field trip progresses, it becomes clear that Renato shares with those places the same emptiness, sense of abandonment and isolation.','/kNw8FmmZ2scmlA1uY6SeudnFpLe.jpg','2010-05-07',75,'Released',NULL,'I Travel Because I Have to, I Come Back Because I Love You',87199,1.3003,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28288,_binary '\0','/mY3CRicUMaX3Btxv8yspud75UJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15009428',5.6,102305,'en','Argylle','When the plots of reclusive author Elly Conway\'s fictional espionage novels begin to mirror the covert actions of a real-life spy organization, quiet evenings at home become a thing of the past. Accompanied by her cat Alfie and Aidan, a cat-allergic spy, Elly races across the world to stay one step ahead of the killers as the line between Conway\'s fictional world and her real one begins to blur.','/siduVKgOnABO4WH4lOwPQwaGwJp.jpg','2024-01-31',139,'Released','The greater the spy, the bigger the lie.','Argylle',848538,15.157,6,'Sy6eNs3EW3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28289,_binary '\0','/5nsS8KmpSLGiPvjGlBkOAhvDIPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15010292',5.8,3770,'en','Flux Gourmet','At an institute devoted to culinary and alimentary performance, a collective finds themselves embroiled in power struggles, artistic vendettas and gastrointestinal disorders.','/gg9jup8MM9HjT7nvQ0h2gKDpi5W.jpg','2022-06-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Flux Gourmet',848818,1.6421,5.6,'oHraElR_v60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28290,_binary '\0','/hCdJ6jb0E80JJUCKmHnya9PsR5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15010478',7.5,4585,'en','9/11: Inside the President\'s War Room','Experience the events of September 11, 2001 through the eyes of President Bush and his closest advisors as they personally detail the crucial hours and key decisions from that historic day.','/t9otj0gqMwum9AzWslKNWhnQ5Mn.jpg','2021-08-31',89,'Released','See the crisis unfold through the eyes of the president and his closest advisors.','9/11: Inside the President\'s War Room',848981,5.3009,6.9,'4BcKbOCYOpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28291,_binary '\0','/e54WNY28sdscjLShpRQIV3vFmzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15010590',7,1397,'cn','梅艷芳','This long-awaited biopic provides a vivid account of the remarkable life of Anita Mui in and behind the limelight, chronicling her journey from a child performer to becoming one of world\'s most recognized music icons.','/8u049Y7PDVTysi6KLryhOE7ocdm.jpg','2021-11-12',136,'Released',NULL,'Anita',848788,1.9664,7.9,'g3S-2XTn-kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28292,_binary '\0','/zGT6zikFjC5wRROXbPIipKahZn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15010692',5.7,9901,'en','The Damned','A 19th-century widow has to make an impossible choice when, during an especially cruel winter, a foreign ship sinks off the coast of her Icelandic fishing village.','/fAXDQny8kEquc1BImiQHhYMGSsW.jpg','2025-01-03',89,'Released',NULL,'The Damned',850439,5.1266,5.9,'1itnHQHgxUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28293,_binary '\0','/6yFsjf2keenOf52kY2k1STZ7ZRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1501298',8.5,3888,'ta','கற்றது தமிழ்','A young Tamil-postgraduate, frustrated with the circumstances and futility of his job, slowly loses his mental balance and becomes a sociopath.','/gFbTox7xmHrBM7LvM1ALmUvcbpk.jpg','2007-10-06',147,'Released','Tamil M.A.','Kattradhu Thamizh',69550,1.2633,7.364,'vPfVWb2Cl4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28294,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15014000',6.8,2098,'te','Poster','Without problems no human being is on earth it can be love, study, career or anything else. Suicide is not the solution to any problem. We can make our future bright and beautiful, if we can give some space to move ahead, Our film is based on a person story, to whom, first avoided and neglected by everyone. But later the same people welcomed him.','/yZJ2IJb9VA8rzig4L7fmaE67rty.jpg','2021-11-19',143,'Released',NULL,'Poster',1119071,1.1134,0,'wSjGGPnKv5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28295,_binary '\0','/jfLgRFjtUncVTMSVzWQVPBZz5zI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1501652',4.5,1586,'en','Dead Awake','Dylan, a young man working at a funeral parlor, is trying to unravel a mystery that shattered his life ten years earlier. After faking his own funeral to see who will show up, he befriends a mysterious street junkie and is reunited with an old love from his past. The lives of these three characters are transformed by supernatural forces as Dylan discovers that no one is who they seem to be.','/w6bwGkV6Dc2kqwlsceNJbUoOvni.jpg','2010-12-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Dead Awake',50023,2.0312,4.6,'PhCB1PQdW7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28296,_binary '\0','/aGcnpdseBIevhLip0Q0CaCcZYBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15019036',4.6,3387,'pl','Gdzie diabeł nie może, tam baby pośle','Poland in the 80’s was a country ruled by crisis and a sense of hopelessness. Only few knew how to turn crisis into a business. It was a golden time for them. How did they know what would bring them money? How did they operate in a country where almost everything was forbidden?','/jFH0Lc0FbzHS51XYhrnRijVaK3r.jpg','2022-10-14',106,'Released','Real stories of Polish fortunes.','Where the Devil Can\'t Go, He Sends a Woman',1027197,1.6107,4.4,'3_ZQna76M3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28297,_binary '\0','/qYvn3fHGxPV9rkyqcznAqIegcsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15020080',5.7,1244,'te','సుందరి','A village girl is married to a software employee who is head over heels with her beauty. Life takes an unexpected turn when her husband loses his job and she is forced to take a few steps that she has to go through an emotional turmoil.','/uvqdZhmHyR5MtXTEpMX00HcSFG1.jpg','2021-08-13',112,'Released','The ultimate decision of an innocent lady','Sundari',872408,2.21,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28298,_binary '\0','/cs9Ecpu9om27rY2PjPQ5I71fdVv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15021154',6.8,3905,'sv','Exodus','A professional smuggler tries to save a 12-year-old girl whose family has gone missing in the Syrian war.','/AefA4xKoZMdn13wacMrRolVYgjA.jpg','2023-03-10',102,'Released',NULL,'Exodus',1063249,1.8417,6.923,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28299,_binary '\0','/3tH9dFvqBF9HQZOtpn2RRxZVyqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15022184',5.3,3318,'no','Royalteen: Arvingen','A teenager struggles to keep her scandal-ridden past and a big secret from getting out when she strikes up an unlikely romance with the crown prince.','/oK6I9Wa5RIqxpNbJ4NWemsotcYJ.jpg','2022-08-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Royalteen',996518,1.9867,5.819,'cRu4yK8Zczs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28300,_binary '\0','/webN6O1scfrvGjkVX8FuXpH5gl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15023916',5.8,9804,'hi','Jumper','A cable operator with an unusual talent for \'invisibility\' is forced into an investigation when an MLA goes missing. What he uncovers is bigger than kidnapping.','/vD6Q8CPglohe3KFj2DJRUHyp6Ql.jpg','2026-08-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Jumper',1748247,2.6451,0,'neWIzDJhFcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28301,_binary '\0','/yg4DNTCX1Z8onZxNOAyX95gJB5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502396',7.2,2774,'es','Alamar','Before leaving for Rome with his mother, five year old Natan is taken by his father, Jorge, on an epic journey to the pristine Chinchorro reef off the coast of Mexico. As they fish, swim, and sail the turquoise waters of the open sea, Natan discovers the beauty of his Mayan heritage and learns to live in harmony with life above and below the surface, as the bond between father and son grows stronger before their inevitable farewell.','/kakeJZOFUONyDFTLaSxfFJuAib1.jpg','2010-12-01',73,'Released','Filmed in the second-largest coral reef system on the planet!','To the Sea',48414,2.1364,6.8,'7cRKgk4_4bQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28302,_binary '\0','/eAIHqfS3kXm7kZl4j7ZBfdegyEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502397',6.5,199614,'en','Bad Boys for Life','Marcus and Mike are forced to confront new threats, career changes, and midlife crises as they join the newly created elite team AMMO of the Miami police department to take down the ruthless Armando Armas, the vicious leader of a Miami drug cartel.','/y95lQLnuNKdPAzw9F9Ab8kJ80c3.jpg','2020-01-15',124,'Released','Ride together. Die together.','Bad Boys for Life',38700,20.6012,7.104,'R228yPrwqTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28303,_binary '\0','/63QcB4IQpvoyROk9dLgcbHo9LYT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502404',5.4,107444,'en','Drive Angry','Milton is a hardened felon who has broken out of Hell, intent on finding the vicious cult who brutally murdered his daughter and kidnapped her baby. He joins forces with a sexy, tough-as-nails waitress, who\'s also seeking redemption of her own. Caught in a deadly race against time, Milton has three days to avoid capture, avenge his daughter\'s death, and save her baby before she\'s mercilessly sacrificed by the cult.','/nx2pChi41Xv4dsXsfSG3gnKcWaY.jpg','2011-02-24',104,'Released','One hell of a ride.','Drive Angry',47327,11.0147,5.551,'jouaan70m4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28304,_binary '\0','/8VjIXC2x8SHwAO52rfFpejKL4wc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502407',6.5,188790,'en','Halloween','Laurie Strode comes to her final confrontation with Michael Myers, the masked figure who has haunted her since she narrowly escaped his killing spree on Halloween night four decades ago.','/f7JAX5EGk4GgsEnus6OxyzwpFp7.jpg','2018-10-18',106,'Released','You don\'t believe in the Boogeyman? You should.','Halloween',424139,13.4832,6.6,'ek1ePFp-nBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28305,_binary '\0','/7f38eBUlqILSMjxRd4Py0IFbIim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502417',4.2,1724,'en','Assassins Run','Maya becomes the target of the Russian mafia after her husband, a successful American businessman, is killed.','/6FceOv1z6BYtxWVRuwa2xKygWIF.jpg','2013-04-22',88,'Released','Everything you trust. Everything you know. May be a lie...','Assassins Run',185497,1.9899,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28306,_binary '\0','/AduPjnaPm7lu6jZ40DtkozfXz63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502420',4.6,3331,'en','Swinging with the Finkels','A suburban couple decide to spice up their lives by swinging with another couple.','/pff0aaPS1GgDI95lVnm7gegIx0.jpg','2011-06-01',85,'Released','What do you do to spice up your marriage?','Swinging with the Finkels',65762,3.4917,4.5,'6tKycPLM0po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28307,_binary '\0','/or5kDR8Ve3TtuPSdEf1X5NdQHyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1502712',4.3,195602,'en','Fantastic Four','Four young outsiders teleport to a dangerous universe, which alters their physical form in shocking ways. Their lives irrevocably upended, the team must learn to harness their daunting new abilities and work together to save Earth from a former friend turned enemy.','/cDroz5qSlP8xZ6tOpeYoPkBvKyL.jpg','2015-08-05',100,'Released','Change is coming.','Fantastic Four',166424,18.2942,4.432,'AAgnQdiZFsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28308,_binary '\0','/zVkfZ8Wa7u9zKHsKujv95Kjlpez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15028452',6.4,2564,'ja','ベイビーわるきゅーれ','Two high school girls who are about to graduate also happen to be highly-skilled assassins. When the organization they work for orders them to share a room, their relationship quickly sours. But when they become targets of the yakuza, the girls realize they\'ll have to work together to survive.','/4A3hk4sT4EETeu7XqbLKFDFtFFu.jpg','2021-07-30',95,'Released','They\'re too young for this s#!t.','Baby Assassins',847143,2.2524,6.7,'M8OP0LM0lEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28309,_binary '\0','/jGspqU8fvG35zyeQnOjFytfkuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15028848',5,1902,'te','రామారావు On Duty','Ramarao, a mandal revenue officer who was formerly removed from the position of deputy collector, is posted in Chittoor in the year 1995 and he decides to find out about a few unsolved murders in his area. He learns from his own investigation that an illegal smuggling ring is responsible for the deaths. Can Ramarao stop the smugglers?','/snChpyepTGL6BUDeXNuRwDGZOmM.jpg','2022-07-29',150,'Released',NULL,'Ramarao On Duty',850161,1.1127,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28310,_binary '\0','/oCcmzztzS1SeFTopYoVq6NxgXIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1503096',4.5,1758,'fr','Camping 2','Jean-Pierre Savelli is a forty-something employee of an insurance company in Clermont-Ferrand who finds himself facing a mid-life crisis. When his fiancée Valérie decides to put their relationship on hold, he changes his holiday plans and heads for the Flots Bleus camping site near Arcachon. Jean-Pierre had been hoping for peace and calm. Instead he meets Patrick Chirac and his entourage of inveterate holidaymakers...','/vlJdgFdRNVJ37RpTrl97zBT7P7Q.jpg','2010-04-21',99,'Released',NULL,'Camping 2',38277,1.2915,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28311,_binary '\0','/cc7Nmid20lcfNh1eucWdLKidi7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15033192',5.7,29261,'en','Windfall','In an opulent vacation home, a mysterious intruder is forced to kidnap the property owners -- a wealthy CEO and his wife -- when they arrive unexpectedly.','/njBc0nNdl9QbsfMwyRqJkmW4NQO.jpg','2022-03-11',93,'Released','Every kidnap is a compromise.','Windfall',850018,2.754,5.5,'BaPdGDBcY5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28312,_binary '\0','/z1UxwFCSCepPRosjOBVllfrs0PB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15036416',7.3,6537,'de','Shiny_Flakes: The Teenage Drug Lord','Max S. reveals how he built a drug empire from his childhood bedroom in this story that inspired the series \"How to Sell Drugs Online.\"','/l3MsAxSnHo94ZAPT8zftsXO8y9X.jpg','2021-08-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Shiny_Flakes: The Teenage Drug Lord',850329,1.9599,7.5,'LMl93KgG72Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28313,_binary '\0','/66BCOOznR9x4kNRDcEefRSwPc11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1503769',7.7,6925,'en','Collapse','From the acclaimed director of American Movie, the documentary follows former Los Angeles police officer turned independent reporter Michael Ruppert. He recounts his career as a radical thinker and spells out his apocalyptic vision of the future, spanning the crises in economics, energy, environment and more.','/gM3uukXhkDkfK5qNqg4IM8UWlvp.jpg','2009-09-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Collapse',28227,1.7831,7.2,'XXIRwd1LNVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28314,_binary '\0','/u7GOJgNYK1AqNN89kAn7P4LfHFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504019',5.8,1244,'es','Memoria de mis putas tristes','To celebrate his 90th birthday, an old single journalist, Sabio, wants something special from Rosa Cabarcas’s brothel: an intense night of love with a virgin teenager. The madam finds him the ideal young woman, Delgadina, a factory worker, who is selling her virginity to support her family. When he sees Delgadina sleeping angelically, he loses interest in pure pleasure and falls in love with her. That love was not meant to be true, but fate changes, and that hope is born of an opportunity for unbridled love.','/vNVNPoP0vgL3RbnMStOBDQORtNR.jpg','2011-10-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Memories of My Melancholy Whores',114286,2.2407,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28315,_binary '\0','/cA88pwGnHa64BBcU3R1oCcJH9Qc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15041836',4.4,10376,'en','Werewolves','A year after a supermoon’s light activated a dormant gene, transforming humans into bloodthirsty werewolves and causing nearly a billion deaths, the nightmare resurfaces as the supermoon rises again. Two scientists attempt to stop the mutation but fail and must now struggle to reach one of their family homes.','/otXBlMPbFBRs6o2Xt6KX59Qw6dL.jpg','2024-12-04',93,'Released','They will hunt you.','Werewolves',970450,6.8371,5.741,'HSM0IAuU7Ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28316,_binary '\0','/u9354xPTWnWdOUXEMuXIpGQB2BJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15041866',5.6,1254,'he','השחיין','Erez, a rising star in the Israeli swimming scene, arrives at a godforsaken training camp held in a boarding school. The winner of the competition held there wins one ticket to the Olympics. There he meets Nevo, beautiful, gifted, who awakens subconscious desires in him. However, their swimming coach does not believe in friendships between competitors. Warned to stay away from Nevo, Erez is still too attracted to him. In between practices, he attempts to act upon his feelings…','/4DBb2XUpunS6LufF1ap8GBC3h9I.jpg','2021-08-30',84,'Released',NULL,'The Swimmer',739323,2.0553,5.533,'8OtZ_H2u3U4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28317,_binary '\0','/jKMbP0rwEkJYxkNRFQXFkVIIzGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15042300',6,7062,'en','On Swift Horses','Returning from the Korean War, Lee wants to begin a new life with his wife Muriel in California. But when his charismatic brother Julius arrives, their lives begin to change. Julius’s rebellious streak rubs off on Muriel, who secretly steps into the world of race horse gambling. Here she meets a new lover, a fellow woman looking to break free from her restrictive life. Meanwhile, Julius travels to Las Vegas, where he falls in love with a young man he meets at the card tables.','/5DNMeesJKMh7LLCzvsXGPDciTAJ.jpg','2025-04-21',119,'Released','How much would you gamble for love?','On Swift Horses',1092506,6.1527,6.2,'2MW146Iezoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28318,_binary '\0','/bGl7BFsHSQ7Lo2zkDgz4plDhXph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504300',7,2090,'en','The Parking Lot Movie','The Parking Lot Movie is a documentary about a singular parking lot in Charlottesville, Virginia. The film follows a select group of parking lot attendants and their strange rite of passage.','/23PNyVAeRaRTdz1ETH22MbdbeAS.jpg','2010-08-06',71,'Released','It\'s Not Just a Parking Lot. It\'s a Battle With Humanity.','The Parking Lot Movie',56113,0.9115,6.5,'LSvZXidLJ3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28319,_binary '\0','/jBF50CCmbYaTtoBMhum6fphvZRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504319',5.4,1929,'en','Road to Nowhere','A passionate filmmaker creating a film based upon a true crime casts an unknown mysterious young woman bearing a disturbing resemblance to the femme fatale in the story. Unsuspectingly, he finds himself drawn into a complex web of haunting intrigue: he becomes obsessed with the woman, the crime, her possibly notorious past, and the disturbing complexity between art and truth. From the Smoky Mountains of North Carolina to Verona, Rome, and London, new truths are revealed and clues to other crimes and passions, darker and even more complex, are uncovered.','/27j8SxY7Nk1yMTj2U40apKHFV5R.jpg','2010-09-11',121,'Released','Illusion is the first of all pleasures.','Road to Nowhere',42707,1.6925,5.8,'f5hyFPC96Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28320,_binary '\0','/m4MGxxEgAMqIX9x8MCg5pYeyYjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504320',8,736949,'en','The King\'s Speech','The King\'s Speech tells the story of the man who became King George VI, the father of Queen Elizabeth II. After his brother abdicates, George (\'Bertie\') reluctantly assumes the throne. Plagued by a dreaded stutter and considered unfit to be king, Bertie engages the help of an unorthodox speech therapist named Lionel Logue. Through a set of unexpected techniques, and as a result of an unlikely friendship, Bertie is able to find his voice and boldly lead the country into war.','/pVNKXVQFukBaCz6ML7GH3kiPlQP.jpg','2010-11-26',118,'Released','Find your voice.','The King\'s Speech',45269,23.6358,7.731,'HXMqX9s67kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28321,_binary '\0','/ypuM62IIP6P3RQsg8e3VN2md9iU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15043686',6.4,1502,'ml','ഒരു തെക്കൻ തല്ല് കേസ്','Things take a turn as dramatic events unfold after a crime was committed in a village and as the culprit is sought after.','/1RL8vEhnkQOYiE0f1SzsMZ2d6VQ.jpg','2022-09-08',150,'Released',NULL,'Oru Thekkan Thallu Case',851737,0.8384,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28322,_binary '\0','/pf6z6YRZRHwIILiEmFkVtciMRwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504403',5.2,11544,'en','Husk','A group of friends stranded near a desolate cornfield find shelter in an old farmhouse, though they soon discover the dwelling is the center of a supernatural ritual.','/UEPf0BcMkicqn7y20MzXKWj75c.jpg','2011-01-28',83,'Released','Join the harvest.','Husk',56906,3.2876,5.8,'C6Hs2p1M5f0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28323,_binary '\0','/pShmtD3EcduhBuxrsJkpOYxHoBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504429',6.4,3101,'fr','Le Refuge','Mousse and Louis are young, beautiful, rich and in love. But drugs have invaded their lives. One day, they overdose and Louis dies. Mousse survives, but soon learns she\'s pregnant. Feeling lost, Mousse runs away to a house far from Paris. Several months later, Louis\' brother joins her in her refuge.','/kjpwk9ruPZXIPDcRhwuT458eFYH.jpg','2009-12-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Hideaway (Le refuge)',51971,1.5906,6.1,'DFuCzWsP7Uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28324,_binary '\0','/ttwMXy37hEHMsRiyjXSypaCDeJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504443',3.4,2027,'en','Mongolian Death Worm','When an American oil company sets up an experimental drilling plant out in the vast deserts of Mongolia, they awaken a nest. The deadly creatures begin to breed and spread, devouring everyone in their path. The only person who can stop them is treasure hunter and adventure seeker who spent his life searching for a legendary tomb, fabled to be protected by the Death Worms. He knows he must do what he can to kill the creatures, but stopping these monsters may mean destroying his life\'s work forever!','/mNMNmwfNsbEdBvJtE7UWfO5DsxV.jpg','2010-05-08',90,'Released','Death Rises From Deep Below','Mongolian Death Worm',44811,2.4433,4.8,'D_VkkiEeEIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28325,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504489',5.1,6245,'en','Somebody\'s Hero','With the goal of impressing a fatherless boy, an average accountant foils a robbery while wearing a superhero costume. After the incident makes headlines, the man finds himself in the center of a media frenzy with people asking “who is this hero?” And “when will he be back?”','/ydVBGFHLxZKQvvQp1xXyNAgLzfh.jpg','2012-05-01',81,'Released','Everybody can be Somebody\'s Hero','Somebody\'s Hero',62196,1.2222,5.4,'9xt2Aj31CHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28326,_binary '\0','/gGKzHdKtd715ssXOePOSp81wiO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1504688',5.8,1373,'pt','Os Normais 2 - A Noite Mais Maluca de Todas','After thirteen years of engagement, the boring sex life of Rui and Vani is limited to one intercourse every other week. They decide to seek excitement with a threesome and they decide to invite Vani\'s cousin Silvinha to participate late night, but an accident interrupts their game. Rui and Vani unsuccessfully spend the night searching for for companion of a bisexual woman.','/5nLdwZTklH9aFYpPw819MPZ5M49.jpg','2009-08-28',75,'Released','The craziest night ever.','So Normal 2: The Craziest Night Ever',34277,1.294,6.6,'uIP8xHsV-1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28327,_binary '\0','/flxau5Iu7bChQHsESqvGZ3FQRaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15047880',6.4,154742,'en','Disclosure Day','A cybersecurity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there\'s life beyond our understanding.','/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg','2026-06-10',146,'Released','We deserve to know.','Disclosure Day',1275779,84.1578,7.469,'SCYT8vb2siQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28328,_binary '\0','/9dX0XlhmarggjFzr32NCp2alBW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15048606',5.7,6339,'hi','लॉस्ट','Crime reporter Vidhi investigates the sudden disappearance of a college student. While society associates different theories for his disappearance, what really is the true story?','/yRQkH26GZ7Qp9xkAMfmVNnkb1Ez.jpg','2023-02-16',124,'Released','Love. Courage. Politics. Betrayal.','Lost',850180,1.7836,5.5,'k5jfRCNVF1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28329,_binary '\0','/yV7DN5rCEzIbH7aCen6FIgdHbGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15048614',5.8,6082,'hi','Blurr','With progressive blindness setting in, Gayatri has to find answers to her twin sister\'s unlikely death. As the lines of reality keep getting blurred, is she ready to look the truth in the eye?','/yGKE9MVoxeLNR18VLYKDszE7jye.jpg','2022-12-09',126,'Released',NULL,'Blurr',850837,1.0531,4.542,'KNjBhoxNpvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28330,_binary '\0','/2fmUqn5BjWFzXvG2ytjUMc88CYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15049118',8.5,1555,'cn','時代革命','Throughout Hong Kong’s history, Hongkongers have fought for freedom and democracy but have yet to succeed. In 2019, a controversial extradition bill was introduced that would allow Hongkongers to be tried in mainland China. This decision spurred massive protests, riots, and resistance against heavy-handed Chinese rule over the City-State. Award-winning director Kiwi Chow documents the events to tell the story of the movement, with both a macro view of its historical context and footage and interviews from protestors on the front lines.','/aalqZbr1yAAoDU9996Qyaw4U63k.jpg','2021-11-22',152,'Released','The Times Didn\'t Choose Us, We Chose to Change the Times','Revolution of Our Times',850884,1.4701,8.3,'WbBU1AZS8HA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28331,_binary '\0','/fz8ftODxzRqVOWpVlh1wa1dktT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15053518',5.3,2263,'en','Torn Hearts','A promising up-and-coming country duo seek out the secluded mansion of their idol Harper Dutch, a former country music star and Nashville royalty turned recluse. What starts out as a friendly visit devolves into a twisted series of horrors forcing the friends to confront the lengths they will go to in pursuit of their dreams.','/w8dSAuMHUgx0lYSB6wAAURStcGM.jpg','2022-05-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Torn Hearts',852830,4.2373,5.7,'XbG7Yexn-nA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28332,_binary '\0','/13yVuhVKCiN2vUa4PdKSsBFF4nh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15056920',6.8,2415,'kn','ಭೈರತಿ ರಣಗಲ್‌','The story revolves around the life of Bhairathi Ranagal\'s journey from being a law-abiding responsible lawyer to the benevolent crime boss of Karnataka.','/ghA56IEkZ1FwJVDWWEihtVnRYvZ.jpg','2024-11-14',132,'Released',NULL,'Bhairathi Ranagal',1088410,2.2525,8.3,'Toq88y-7x1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28333,_binary '\0','/1kuxpJOxKSxpCSLaOjrqLi6KpmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15060662',7.2,1296,'pt','Nosso Sonho','The life story of Claudinho e Buchecha, greatest icons and most successful duo of the Brazilian funk melody in all time, showing how the rhythm and poetry of the periphery conquered Brazil.','/oRBUJX9a0gZzZ8KQIJ41CzJeErW.jpg','2023-09-21',121,'Released',NULL,'Nosso Sonho',947457,1.6191,7.548,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28334,_binary '\0','/89pMKwUjzqF7Eo99HpyrKzcWNVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15062890',5.4,1314,'te','Ja','Arjun an ad filmmaker falls in love with Vaishnavi, a teacher. They decide to get but his mother doesn\'t approve. When they find out Vaishnavi is pregnant with a baby girl, Arjun\'s mother forces Vaishnavi to get an abortion. Will they do it?','/v9K2lBrcsZALP3uTZRquzJg1X5G.jpg','2021-07-30',105,'Released',NULL,'Ja',869865,0.7556,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28335,_binary '\0','/tWXrVk5iUqnOLPCQ1f26jWaWwpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1506452',7.1,1410,'ru','Поп','Father Alexander is trying to maintain peaceful life for his church amidst the Nazi occupation during WWII.','/dtTO72wEu2RVSEBjM8ceEJT4njX.jpg','2009-04-04',129,'Released',NULL,'The Priest',51275,0.818,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28336,_binary '\0','/q2WWQyarMIHsjj7U7dusSXOd6FD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1506458',3.8,1793,'en','Witchville','When Prince Malachy returns to his father’s kingdom after the Crusades his first impression is that a bad harvest is the reason that the villagers are sick and hungry. But all is not as it seems and a stranger to the village, warns the new king that a dark force is the cause of their ills.','/q4cRqdKAPRxGdk6r150hQZv5EU2.jpg','2010-05-22',87,'Released','Let the hunt begin.','Witchville',42053,1.6791,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28337,_binary '\0','/r5bLJXXwUMp2MO5hkn4KYXIR4eO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1506999',5.8,93547,'en','Haywire','A black ops soldier seeks payback after she is betrayed and left for dead.','/c9fJ0dYC30NnE9k2p61c0dqlZqW.jpg','2011-11-01',93,'Released','They gave her no choice','Haywire',70435,8.373,5.706,'KFV0Uvzpz0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28338,_binary '\0','/r7HFL82L3NZOMWpxxyewEdoXPuP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1507002',5.8,1221,'en','Stano','Bobby Stano had everything going for him. Fresh out of high school, he was signed to the majors, had a beautiful girlfriend, everything was looking up. That is, until he and his friends get into a fight with a neighboring gang. The confrontation results in an accidental fatality and quickly changes Bobby\'s life forever. He\'s found guilty of murder and locked in prison for the next thirteen years. When Bobby is released, he\'s faced with a vilified reputation, a relationship to rekindle and a new life to find.','/ha8eYfbDVP6quENGGkEpwzHaFL5.jpg','2019-07-19',111,'Released','Every player has a past.','Bottom of the 9th',365958,1.4521,6.2,'dEUEUc0GDTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28339,_binary '\0','/bfKydQVfDbFAj4T8y979TY3y2K7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1507005',7.2,3122,'ta','நான் மகான் அல்ல','A playful young man leads a very happy life, but everything changes when his father witnesses a heinous crime.','/aCuaY59YaCDcO1FhtU2EWNRgVf1.jpg','2010-08-20',126,'Released',NULL,'Naan Mahaan Alla',50939,1.2586,6.372,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28340,_binary '\0','/A8v