-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15106860',2.8,1383,'en','Pursuit','Detective Breslin crosses paths with Calloway, a ruthless hacker desperate to find his wife, who has been kidnapped by a drug cartel. When Calloway escapes police custody, Breslin joins forces with a no-nonsense female cop to reclaim his prisoner. But is Calloway’s crime-boss father somehow involved in this explosive situation?','/oUU6blOmIu155vfIgzML3ZSsDrB.jpg','2022-02-18',92,'Released','They\'ll never be friends. But they\'re no longer enemies.','Pursuit',871799,2.2264,5,'7YEicjmt2KY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28378,_binary '\0','/zPwBdZVPIsS0HUuEjAjp5PofFck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15108954',6.2,2444,'ko','유체이탈자','Unable to remember anything about his life, a man begins regaining consciousness in a new body every 12 hours. Now, he must piece together his identity, all while evading attacks from pursuing agents and dangerous criminals alike.','/pufGxcWEyADFcoqeDcJlAAVX0Fl.jpg','2021-10-17',108,'Released','No memory. No allies. Nowhere left to run.','Spiritwalker',602295,2.4595,6.411,'JE-QgYanl-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28379,_binary '\0','/hTOENaCxntBphInVPxbxVgABK5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1510906',7.2,7817,'en','Third Star','James and his three closest lifelong friends go on an ill-advised trip to the stunning coastal area of Barafundle Bay in West Wales. What follows is a touching and comical adventure dealing with friendship, heroism and love.','/yNYtDMqT74sizQkpHtg1heyzFCl.jpg','2010-06-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Third Star',75170,2.1806,7,'KMz7Z5bYs8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28380,_binary '\0','/23jok5sYloPEBwKd6Bp4V8Y1O9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15109082',7.7,29891,'ga','An Cailín Ciúin','A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.','/6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg','2022-05-12',95,'Released',NULL,'The Quiet Girl',916405,5.975,7.5,'6Xjy5dtlRik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28381,_binary '\0','/xhQLKQeCVHEweQ08esBLkGI1kOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1510918',6.6,4907,'sv','Himlen är oskyldigt blå','It\'s 1975, and Martin is a teenager looking to break out of a stifling home environment ruled by his alcoholic father and long-suffering mother. When Martin\'s pal Micke suggests they get jobs together as waiters at a resort off the Swedish coast, Martin is all for it, but before long Micke finds better things to do and Martin is left on his own. The presence of pretty fellow server Jenny is a major consolation, but to his surprise, guileless Martin is soon chosen as the protégé of Gösta, the resort\'s short-tempered manager. Gösta clearly likes Martin and makes him his right hand man, which gives Martin a crash course in the seedy side of life when he discovers Gösta has a number of other business interests, not all of which are legal or ethical.','/zx4RUtGC2OHWEphKYsx16ALJ0gs.jpg','2010-09-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Behind Blue Skies',46953,2.9834,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28382,_binary '\0','/iraunnwrss2DJy4xayyntWHaAZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1510938',7.3,34049,'en','The Sunset Limited','A deeply religious black ex-con thwarts the suicide attempt of an asocial white college professor who tries to throw himself in front of an oncoming subway train, \'The Sunset Limited.\' As the one attempts to connect on a rational, spiritual and emotional level, the other remains steadfast in his hard-earned despair. Locked in a philosophical debate, both passionately defend their personal credos and try to convert the other.','/8cwqylJVbCfMflcjXQ71CwsXdpf.jpg','2011-02-12',91,'Released','Nothing is ever black or white.','The Sunset Limited',56831,4.5761,7.218,'l0MSitTAYyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28383,_binary '\0','/bRzglV0qhgXsZvdPhdC5ihBqISV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15112934',6.4,1336,'en','Taking the Reins','A writer goes back to the family ranch to write an article about her passion for horses and discovers what ended her marriage and why she stopped riding horses.','/wQA4Snh9ZPB2Rhzcu9ojVMR71Bd.jpg','2021-09-25',84,'Released','Love is a leap of faith.','Taking the Reins',858910,2.4773,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28384,_binary '\0','/phtEqyoXimImrqdD1Yp7upCNql1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1511329',6.1,1409,'nl','Bo','Fifteen year old Deborah meets Jennifer who steers her into a career as an escort. Under the alias Bo she begins a new life that she cannot handle and starts a downward spiral that only she can end.','/ojA8O7KMIGeC1VPu34DxBecY17L.jpg','2010-02-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Bo',42748,1.2514,5,'4g8L0eCCIyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28385,_binary '\0','/xEHcm3LgMWpXxtFuO9DkZnDSk2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15115102',7,2872,'fr','Un autre monde','An executive manager, his wife and his family, at the point when his professional choices are about to overturn all their lives. Philippe Lemesle and his wife are separating, their love irretrievably damaged by pressures of work. A successful executive in industrial conglomerate, Philippe no longer knows how to respond to the contradictory demands of his bosses. Yesterday they wanted a manager, today an enforcer. Now he must decide what his life really means.','/xhzf8sgqmDnluRsZv6ZHOPzms3q.jpg','2022-02-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Another World',664506,2.3537,6.798,'HeHOKBv-l7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28386,_binary '\0','/nNL94WoDkgOnFiMvzG8sMkqY66T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15115280',6.5,9191,'en','Sundown','When a distant emergency disrupts a vacation in Acapulco, simmering tensions rise to the fore between scions of a wealthy British family.','/fSlqFLbL7E1nqOcNBj9Db9edhl8.jpg','2022-01-28',82,'Relea