er his wife falls under the influence of a drug dealer, an everyday guy transforms himself into Crimson Bolt, a superhero with the best intentions, though he lacks for heroic skills.','/jZrRMGSajZQehg8mz74A5A00L3.jpg','2010-11-26',96,'Released','Shut up, crime!','Super',45132,5.2072,6.5,'tLj_Bzw8n90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28396,_binary '\0','/rbHjuU8zk7uTDVlxAFuxrTHEdds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1512240',6.2,5652,'en','Thin Ice','A dishonest insurance salesman\'s life quickly disintegrates during a Wisconsin winter when he teams up with a psychopath to steal a rare violin at the home of a reclusive farmer.','/15KTuJlR8GclVrgX0g58oACqiqv.jpg','2012-02-17',93,'Released','Greetings from Kenosha, WI! Where Ordinary Folks Can Make a Killing','Thin Ice',51996,3.3884,6.5,'tTnQzbD-VwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28397,_binary '\0','/rnnJXf1bAKZDU7lVsSWzAXMqJh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1512310',4,1563,'en','Goblin','Every Halloween, a small hamlet in the deep woods is visited by a fierce goblin, intent on capturing infants and brutally murdering anyone in its path.','/6JRPirTvGBr8WDXmvRV2Z00A2zt.jpg','2010-07-13',92,'Released','He Wants You Badly','Goblin',70740,1.6372,5.2,'F_k7ZBl9LRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28398,_binary '\0','/18xaRN1i08zqDJWsVPpSYHLIvGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1512685',6.7,39465,'es','Los ojos de Julia','Julia, a woman suffering from a degenerative sight disease, finds her blind sister Sara hung in a basement. Despite all signs pointing to suicide, Julia decides to investigate what she intuitively feels is a murder case.','/p9HqHVdW9oedgRMyZkBov8hDQiW.jpg','2010-08-16',118,'Released','You can\'t hide in the dark.','Julia\'s Eyes',52274,4.1642,6.7,'YSnRWQJPvhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28399,_binary '\0','/szov0Tr05mP7rKHlG2VYyWh33wx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15128068',7.4,24433,'hi','मोनिका, ओ माय डार्लिंग','A slick robotics expert joins a murderous plot after a passionate affair takes a sudden turn, but nothing — not even death — is what it seems to be.','/3iX8wpLgkx83jCLNR03nW4lpaP2.jpg','2022-11-11',129,'Released',NULL,'Monica, O My Darling',915831,2.2345,7.1,'R6HWTqbPR0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28400,_binary '\0','/pZkhtaqZzcTSz2e5GxUj3CM6jz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15128358',6.9,4982,'es','Modelo 77','Modelo Prison. Barcelona, 1977. A young accountant, awaiting trial for embezzlement with a possible 20 years sentence, joins a group of prisoners demanding amnesty.','/8NmaPNP3NS0Ok6sL1fT6ZSnw5OF.jpg','2022-09-23',125,'Released','Inspired by a true story.','Prison 77',913991,4.1083,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28401,_binary '\0','/wWZKPPBgj3sLnRD5xCiX8fBFjIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1512888',8.1,8649,'ta','ஆயிரத்தில் ஒருவன்','An expedition sets out to uncover the long-lost traces of the Chola dynasty, venturing into uncharted lands filled with ancient traps, hostile forces, and forgotten secrets. What begins as a search for history soon becomes a perilous struggle for survival, where myths and reality collide and the fate of an entire legacy hangs in the balance.','/9lrbtKE8vKIpYXxjj0hSwhnC81o.jpg','2010-01-14',181,'Released',NULL,'Aayirathil Oruvan',69597,2.1098,6.606,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28402,_binary '\0','/6PJSE1B6jFk5uVPxcc2DueCBD26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1512894',6.5,4188,'tr','Kıskanmak','Seniha lives with her brother Halit and his wife Mükerrem. When Nüzhet, the handsome son of the richest family in town, sets his eyes on the married Mükerrem, she is at first disgusted with Nüzhet’s overt sexual innuendo. However, it isn’t long before Mükerrem yields to her lust and thus they embark on an affair. When Seniha finally reveals her sister-in-law’s un-virtuousness to her brother, Seniha has no idea what the consequences will be and how cruelly her destiny will change.','/ajOsceipC0Cw2Wwo3253wsNfSHz.jpg','2009-08-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Envy',37523,1.6227,5.6,'84ejMnOpoOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28403,_binary '\0','/tNXUm64eyLiPZG8pM7Tt2fS8LJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15130204',6.5,2954,'kn','Seetharam Benoy','Seetharam, a cop, gets transferred to a remote village in Shimoga Dist Aanegadde finds himself in middle of a bunch of smart yet cruel thieves. The day he takes charge his house gets robbed. Matter of dignity and personal revenge, intense investigation then begins.','/yjGSCbPyzyz1uOD6pJGK99e5Rml.jpg','2021-08-16',125,'Released','Case no. 18','Seetharam Benoy',861772,1.9502,6,'HJwBIQLo1Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28404,_binary '\0','/or8y8JFF0vR3N9ap0Vdhf9tfTxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15131266',5.5,1614,'en','As Good as Dead','An ex-cop in self-imposed witness protection in Mexico becomes a target when a fight video of his apprentice goes viral.','/qqQPxxRQqfLrq0ubfDQCwhJHZ91.jpg','2022-12-16',88,'Released','A violent past. A man on the edge.','As Good as Dead',1028248,5.1458,6.1,'sx3r-9NF538','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28405,_binary '\0','/Zb9QjtGmmnqiRPFVhJZ2IIppQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15132028',7,2210,'pt','Deserto Particular','40-year-old Daniel has been suspended from active police work and is under internal investigation for violence. When Sara, his internet love affair, stops answering his texts he decides to drive north in search of her, starting on what is apparently a fool\'s errand. He shows Sara\'s picture around, but nobody seems to recognize the woman. Until eventually one guy pops up, saying he can put the two in touch under very specific conditions.','/ymVBbH4PRVdjjTXpD6zwOB8XKZn.jpg','2021-11-25',121,'Released',NULL,'Private Desert',856321,3.1618,6.7,'TOsfXrtgzno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28406,_binary '\0','/vy2oPrxGndZ14kXgyShPZaPzDQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15134398',6.1,9396,'ml','King of കൊത്ത','Kannan is a gangster who rules the crime-infested town of Kotha. After getting humiliated by Kannan and his men, CI Shahul Haasan tactfully plots the return of former gangster named Kotha Rajendran alias \"Raju\", thus leading to a transformative turn of events.','/wjeEQfZCgoPaAZ1wRFMEsjNZ1Zk.jpg','2023-08-24',174,'Released',NULL,'King of Kotha',855117,1.7915,5.689,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28407,_binary '\0','/edQRA97HrmoXKLUM76JfACuYIss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15135162',7.3,1682,'te','బ్యాక్ డోర్','Anjali meets Arun at a marriage and there is instant attraction between them. Will she choose to be a loyal wife or satisfy her desires by crossing the confines of the marriage?','/wcZ5gphJLN0H2Va85ouS4xYbs0m.jpg','2021-12-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Back Door',892664,0.9278,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28408,_binary '\0','/aBYuG7Dp8vmlLkGvBLiDWq8wjAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1513713',7.2,7320,'tr','Başka Dilde Aşk','Onur, who has been deaf since birth, works as a librarian. His father had left him and his mother when he was seven, and Onur has always blamed himself for this. Although being able to speak, he has chosen to stay silent because of the pitying looks of the people around him. At his friend Vedat\'s engagement party, he meets Zeynep, who later finds out about Onur\'s hearing disability, but is not bothered by it. She is forced by her overbearing father to leave home and gets a job at a call-center. Having to speak on the phone all day to people she doesn\'t know, Zeynep finds peace with Onur, who she communicates with perfectly without speaking...','/svwQqtjS5VFVJza0mAXXaGoWzUL.jpg','2009-12-18',98,'Released',NULL,'Love in Another Language',37570,1.261,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28409,_binary '\0','/rYPprJCfNkdzAFqTxxK0ejDupBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1513723',4.2,1679,'ar','بوبوس','A wealthy businessman and a businesswoman face financial ruin during an economic crisis. As they try to recover, a comedic romance develops between them.','/k1qoNNAajzzUsZHXZDghO5r1Tpv.jpg','2009-06-17',114,'Released',NULL,'Bobbos',44094,0.9294,4.65,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28410,_binary '\0','/rigPh3kJZfV1fGb7zaEzUI2fL0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15137342',6.2,1744,'kn','ಕಾಡುಮಲೆ','A woman\'s suicide attempt lands her in a mysterious realm where she meets a man haunted by a supernatural force. Together, they face the dark secrets of their forest prison as time runs out and malevolent powers close in.','/rHjvsoAu1QSBCsLcnBMTUrQ9iVN.jpg','2025-01-31',109,'Released','It\'s a brainscamming place.','Kaadumale',1435062,0.6533,2,'JEHCbL3JmRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28411,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15137416',3.7,1628,'kn','Lanke','Ram, a convict, steps out of jail to fall in love with the do-gooder Paavani.','/eejQaIM37uL0KN3mg4KSE4TbIcJ.jpg','2021-08-13',132,'Released',NULL,'Lanke',1000095,0.9166,0,'99oMuDL_eNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28412,_binary '\0','/kN8M7YPimH2D5Ysn6OjYUGWVV64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15137580',8.2,1479,'kn','Wheel Chair Romeo','The protagonist of the story, Ullas, has been disabled since his birth. Ullas walks in a wheelchair over a giant. Ullas feels to have a female companion and informs same to his father. The father begins to search for the girl to marry him, but no girl comes forward to marry him. He then enlists the help of Jack Mama to find a girl in prostitution to satisfy his sexual desire. Ullas draws on a blind girl Dimple in the same vein. He starts to like her, spends time with her. He proposes Dimple to marry him. At first Ullas’s Father refuses his son’s decision. Dimple, meanwhile, leaves the town since Ullas father’s rejection. However beacuse of Dimple’s good behavior Ullas\' father agrees to marry her. Meanwhile Ullas begins to find Dimple. He gets the help of his father, Jack Mama and friend Giri, to find Dimple.','/uLzZEYEKZJo2cEzmrFQ6VV8AvzZ.jpg','2022-05-27',147,'Released',NULL,'Wheel Chair Romeo',944058,0.4468,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28413,_binary '\0','/o6P8sXCaLb0VGTc5nrXVM1JUprU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1513835',4.9,2013,'en','Nightbeasts','A father and son on a weekend hunting trip encounter supernatural horror in the woods.','/15fwGBvhrxmtwctYb6yMnWdyNAm.jpg','2010-09-24',80,'Released','They come out at night. . .','Nightbeasts',248670,1.4407,4.3,'GJWI4mTBbDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28414,_binary '\0','/51dQaI3KrgtSACthFPF8wjCDTw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1513892',5.4,2245,'it','Scusa ma ti voglio sposare','Second part of the film \"Sorry if I love you\". Alex (Raoul Bova) and Niki (Michela Quattrociocche) are more in love than ever. They have just returned from the lighthouse on the island Blu where they have lived unforgettable days. Niki returns to see his friends, but a number of important changes in their lives will test the friendship of the girls. Alex also resume life with his old friends. All of them, Flavio, Enrico and Pietro, are no longer serene and safe husbands due to certain difficulties that have compromised their marriages.','/756xiX5OZRTHSfRzbR9YouKi2C.jpg','2010-02-12',106,'Released',NULL,'Sorry if I Want to Marry You',41413,2.4136,5.255,'6IWi0j2H4AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28415,_binary '\0','/xSIJy4vPKpo2uw6q7HNBhIvQaj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15140278',6.4,12254,'fr','Coup de chance','Fanny and Jean have everything of an ideal couple: fulfilled professionally, they live in a magnificent apartment in the beautiful districts of Paris, and seem to be in love as on the first day. But when Fanny crosses, by chance, former classmate Alain, she\'s immediately capsized. They see each other again very quickly and grow closer.','/cvejKWAstLqgUmC4N8P81CyhJdI.jpg','2023-09-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Coup de chance',859235,5.0065,6.196,'Ohcoh0KRvxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28416,_binary '\0','/kJtEJ5eLueljlnLEzl2O3A4UlZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1514041',5.8,11290,'en','4.3.2.1','Jo is chained down in a dead end supermarket job while all her friends are all out on their own separate adventures. But a chance encounter with some diamond thieves sends their separate worlds on a collision course with not only each other, but fate itself.','/rEarMWLtn185KElEuZw04pz0wIN.jpg','2010-06-02',117,'Released','4 Girls, 3 Days, 2 Cities, 1 Chance.....','4.3.2.1',44877,3.6254,5.5,'pXG7TJ6aPnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28417,_binary '\0','/9xIEYnviEoHcmHSI5ySvJhdI7oO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15141288',6.5,2101,'en','If I Can\'t Have Love, I Want Power','Featuring music from her fourth studio album produced by Trent Reznor and Atticus Ross, this evocative film experience stars Halsey as the young and pregnant Queen Lila, who wrestles with the manipulative chokehold of love.','/fLe08drzgDhSFGwU9ip4bAMJXJr.jpg','2021-08-20',53,'Released','All of this is temporary.','If I Can\'t Have Love, I Want Power',850337,1.9154,6.1,'90eBBlt5-rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28418,_binary '\0','/fgmq045Ds3srAWmBoRsD8NUM5RO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15141632',4.8,2549,'en','Hell Hath No Fury','Branded a traitor by her countrymen, French national Marie DuJardin is rescued by American soldiers on one condition: to survive, she must lead them to a cache of gold - before the Nazis return to claim it for themselves.','/wltdRZfeKDux9yKThlGKwjWhUil.jpg','2021-11-05',94,'Released','Vengeance is overdue.','Hell Hath No Fury',877013,3.2851,6.358,'ztgpqImviOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28419,_binary '\0','/yFR9O5I1r1lenDZd2bEtZYTNiN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15143042',6.7,1367,'en','Green and Gold','With American farms disappearing, a fourth-generation dairy farmer and his granddaughter fight to preserve their way of life. Facing foreclosure, they wager everything on their beloved Green Bay Packers in a Hail-Mary effort to save their little chunk of dirt.','/3eJYovkDRO2jdLHsc1pWV3JpOSW.jpg','2025-01-31',95,'Released','Sometimes, you gotta bet the farm.','Green and Gold',1361952,1.8492,6.9,'KWFqKGhcdgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28420,_binary '\0','/uavswX03M2T8RxoaAtOAdJEVIgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15143222',5.3,3456,'en','My Fake Boyfriend','A young man in a tricky situation follows the advice of his unconventional best friend and uses social media to create a fake boyfriend to keep his awful ex-lover out of his life. But everything backfires when he meets the real love of his life, and breaking up with his fake boyfriend proves hard to do.','/7l9qEWdSzki33Q3SKD1d5uvJBEo.jpg','2022-06-10',100,'Released','Real love is hard to find.','My Fake Boyfriend',908762,2.8633,5.9,'sGqRPJqqkJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28421,_binary '\0','/hQLz6CxQif3LGDXqMxtidKYcxRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1514425',3.5,1572,'en','Mothman','A group of friends band together to hide the truth about a mutual friend\'s tragic death. They soon discover that an evil entity is in pursuit of them.','/uG4jMDgRF0UqRCF2QxdeMDrniQ.jpg','2010-04-24',86,'Released','The hunter knows his prey','Mothman',43099,1.6443,3.9,'HEC90PEuXyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28422,_binary '\0','/8GVKgaBeSzL8YB6tePBtPq1QDYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1514446',7.1,3039,'bn','থার্ড পারসন সিঙ্গুলার নাম্বার','A woman breaks with traditional Muslim culture by living with her boyfriend before getting married, but when the relationship ends, she must face the harsh consequences of being an outcast in her community.','/6COGHlFCf8YwADcS8DYFwtev4Bh.jpg','2009-12-11',124,'Released','Her strength was her weakness. Her weakness was her strength.','Third Person Singular Number',78310,1.2336,5.944,'Q5N2ZuEppf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28423,_binary '\0','/CuBCTDsdAEsVbZPrI16kzUlTIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15145764',7.3,36892,'hi','Freddy','Introverted and awkward Dr. Freddy Ginwala desperately searches for a soulmate. When he finally finds her, the relationship becomes as painful as a root canal.','/av8OONk9vmm0OmGWNYzZpAbOJP3.jpg','2022-12-02',124,'Released','Love, marriage, betrayal.','Freddy',1041054,1.5301,6.9,'dx1mga5gFbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28424,_binary '\0','/4hYyhkueZmSCES8LZRJlonNy6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15145772',7.4,2000,'hi','200: Halla Ho','Inspired by true events, the film narrates the story of women terrorised by a mobster who gang-raped, robbed, terrorised and murdered 300 families for 15 years until he met his nemesis in a young Dalit girl.','/t6Py6jXrJ1SuHU29DdwxYxEwNtf.jpg','2021-08-20',115,'Released',NULL,'200: Halla Ho',858288,0.9097,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28425,_binary '\0','/jeXBKVsRYuhAprjhziwH3lQD3rP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1514831',5,4075,'tr','Kanal-i-zasyon','Imdat is a poor, uneducated, working class window cleaner who has migrated to the big city. As he cleans the windows of the private TV channel Kanal I, the president of the channel, Berk, discovers that Imdat has an uncanny ability to sense what program will yield the best ratings and what is likely to be panned by audiences, thus Berk begins milking Imdat\'s unique ability to score ratings. Soon Imdat finds himself replacing the president and leading the TV channel. He goes on to produce some truly tasteless and exploitative programs that enjoy massive ratings, eventually becoming part of the dirty media games himself.','/ljaqj5VRmIGYtmZc51RMw7l44u4.jpg','2009-11-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Sewage',52175,1.0276,5,'y6QT6ljBBYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28426,_binary '\0','/bKokMgTPVNqU4YZUUydzY6kCf5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1514837',7,2385,'pl','Rewers','A story about women, set in the present and in 1950s Warsaw. Sabina, a quiet, shy woman who has just turned thirty lacks a man in her life. Her mother knows all about it and tries at all costs to find her daughter a good candidate for a husband. The whole situation is controlled by the grandmother, an eccentric lady with a sharp tongue from whom no secrets can be kept.','/t3dWyZ5HAhdXp3p6P1ZDRqbQxp1.jpg','2009-11-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Reverse',36405,1.2631,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28427,_binary '\0','/euR3ibk2HS06mcQSanbe3CGEiEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15150190',4.7,1509,'en','Witch','Small town, England, 1575. William embarks on a journey to prove the innocence of his wife, Twyla, falsely accused of being a witch and will be put to death if found guilty. William must hunt down the real witch, to save Twyla from death.','/dsjyA06mUIPJfYeQs4WpUqquFGD.jpg','2024-04-29',80,'Released',NULL,'Witch',978040,0.9106,4.6,'8AwhAVp6xgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28428,_binary '\0','/lWNASscWXn32Asr9vkB1wq6cKvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1515091',7.4,505523,'en','Sherlock Holmes: A Game of Shadows','There is a new criminal mastermind at large (Professor Moriarty) and not only is he Holmes’ intellectual equal, but his capacity for evil and lack of conscience may give him an advantage over the detective.','/2HsHurlnTOyU6yUS14gY6BQCyRs.jpg','2011-11-22',129,'Released','The game is afoot.','Sherlock Holmes: A Game of Shadows',58574,14.9299,7.146,'9FozQnaEZl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28429,_binary '\0','/gnf6Y7nA0sfPUYxSdoZNrbThIvx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1515199',4.5,3328,'en','Fertile Ground','Emily and Nate Weaver leave the city for the rural comfort of Nate’s ancestral home in the country. Once there, Emily is plagued by horrifying visions and haunted by the ghosts inhabiting their isolated new home. When Nate’s behavior undergoes a strange and fearful metamorphosis, Emily fears she might be the latest target in a murderous tradition.','/dLSdXiveFrrUjCedujTl5NBxqDl.jpg','2011-01-28',95,'Released','From Cradle To Grave.','Fertile Ground',64853,1.8426,4.3,'fyvwHp-7TRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28430,_binary '\0','/s5i9CpdrQ7QeBYPgZtPZ3nEqU3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1515208',6.5,2953,'en','Walking with the Enemy','Regent Horthy is the leader of Hungary and a German ally, but his favorable standing with Hitler changes as the war comes to an end. Forced to cede Hungary’s power or else witness the execution of his son, Regent Horthy gives up control of his country to the Nazis, who quickly move Hungarians to ghettos and death camps, with no hope in sight. But the despair changes when a young man named Elek emerges. Separated from his family during the relocations and aided by the woman he loves , Elek defies the enemy by becoming one of them. In a race against time, disguised as a Nazi Officer he embarks on a mission to save his family and thousands of his countrymen.','/csYgiUFoZ82OO9CfeqJd8g7e56K.jpg','2014-04-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Walking with the Enemy',256476,3.3396,6.3,'aty51VTXz4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28431,_binary '\0','/zRXJARKQZk6NleofIEyWcBt1fGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15152316',4.7,1228,'fr','La Tour','In the heart of a city, the inhabitants of a tower wake up one morning to find that their building is shrouded in an opaque fog, obstructing doors and windows - a strange dark matter that devours anything that tries to pass through it. Trapped, the residents try to organize themselves, but to ensure their survival they gradually succumb to their most primitive instincts, until they sink into horror...','/9wcvKsdNs5eImAYFD4b12d0fSs9.jpg','2023-02-08',90,'Released','Which side will you choose?','The Tower',852432,1.6836,4.8,'dOTgNLRrsq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28432,_binary '\0','/1HzL603WOer58xtnrRYdSIL5K04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15153532',6.3,38546,'en','Strays','When Reggie is abandoned on the mean city streets by his lowlife owner, Doug, Reggie is certain that his beloved owner would never leave him on purpose. But once Reggie falls in with Bug, a fast-talking, foul-mouthed stray who loves his freedom and believes that owners are for suckers, Reggie finally realizes he was in a toxic relationship and begins to see Doug for the heartless sleazeball that he is.','/n1hqbSCtyBAxaXEl1Dj3ipXJAJG.jpg','2023-08-17',93,'Released','Go fetch yourself.','Strays',912908,11.6458,7.2,'26Xq6_g2r6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28433,_binary '\0','/dCPqbbRAE5aTS3KF0qeKjmcFdpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1516002',6.3,2029,'en','A Beginner\'s Guide to Endings','The film centers on three brothers who, upon learning they only have a few days left to live, set off to reverse a lifetime of mistakes. Hopper and Simmons are playing the brothers\' father and uncle, respectively, while Caan is one of the brothers. Helfer is Caan\'s girlfriend, a woman with a dangerous past.','/lRDn3rLSYPiLPurOOWYy3iCMFet.jpg','2010-09-17',92,'Released','A Comedy About Tragedy','A Beginner\'s Guide to Endings',88057,2.5424,6,'KxzOeE3TMUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28434,_binary '\0','/pZbVyOdEqs6T11yMFyt9nT2lLef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15163636',7.2,3292,'ta','வீரன்','Kumaran has had a troubled childhood after getting hit by lightning, comes back to his village to fight evil elements and provide hope through indigenous deities.','/9iRNyiT0dlRyaMWOBO1Hc6kaOcc.jpg','2023-06-02',150,'Released',NULL,'Veeran',979801,1.0391,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28435,_binary '\0','/oeqw3D9a8qyrSNtkZIK1QaCxBMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15163652',6.1,30879,'ta','துணிவு','A gang goes to rob a bank only to find that there\'s already a criminal mastermind holding it for ransom, but his identities and motives behind the heist remains mysterious. As they plan to collect the bounty and disappear without a trace, their crimes and their past slowly catches up with them.','/5Cdi9MFxEGsfphvDxV4TyY4znP6.jpg','2023-01-10',146,'Released','No Guts No Glory','Thunivu',904557,1.8888,5.7,'nI9TBoMlmv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28436,_binary '\0','/v3O6mtGeuXIyaADB3H2ytCcss0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15164298',4.8,2494,'fa','دینامیت','The story of some neighbors with different life styles..','/KQwj2kQrrlDJ4eYKVASgdRqQAL.jpg','2021-07-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Dynamite',848050,0.7104,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28437,_binary '\0','/r4pDYHM7BQto4UEDmypytQ7IvSa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15165236',7.3,1690,'zh','手','Hong Kong, 1960s. Zhang, a shy tailor\'s assistant, is riveted by his imperious client Miss Hua. Upon meeting her, she seduces him to make sure he will truly remember her when designing her garments. After this intimate first encounter, a rapport develops between the two. Entry is for the theatrically released extended version, not the segment from the Eros anthology.','/3yoe71wLvLaPzBD4iAIQtdljh0W.jpg','2021-05-20',56,'Released',NULL,'The Hand',846716,2.0423,7.213,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28438,_binary '\0','/rdTqe7zpT8zuldEIfSCUURj6cOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15167994',3.9,2103,'en','Private Property','Kathryn, a struggling actress and unfulfilled housewife, becomes friendly with her new gardener, Ben. He gives her the attention and sensitivity she craves; however, he is not who he seems.','/60rP1PaT21gnDbGMZlL6oC1weev.jpg','2022-05-13',87,'Released','Somebody\'s always watching.','Private Property',860860,2.8758,4.602,'hH1X_epP_f4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28439,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15169774',7.8,1292,'bn','Doctor Bakshi','After serving a jail sentence, Doctor Bakshi resumes his methods of seeking justice.','/vUvybeq2TZthXD6w8oRDwJ0sWln.jpg','2023-01-27',108,'Released',NULL,'Doctor Bakshi',881935,1.8714,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28440,_binary '\0','/7KzhgodLSMjgZD0IcQrevNMovhz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517177',6.7,5569,'de','Drei','Hanna and Simon are in a 20 year marriage with an unexciting relationship. By chance, they both meet and start separate affairs with Adam. Adam has no idea that his two lovers are married, until they are all found out when Hanna becomes pregnant, with the natural doubts stemming from their situation.','/t21QP3eQGLmPsaCLyxiMyxpFfYn.jpg','2010-12-23',119,'Released','Imagine the possibilities.','Three',53256,2.0883,6.1,'45C5lFxD6mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28441,_binary '\0','/kbyuph2mK7q7SNYpO7DBTLWxCig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517214',6.2,2774,'fr','Le Bruit des glaçons','An alcoholic writer is visited by an incarnation of his cancer.','/tG0x1kQqtCeo2eQ6fr2GCenhY1m.jpg','2010-08-25',87,'Released',NULL,'The Clink of Ice',50845,1.8217,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28442,_binary '\0','/v1v5I41QF00EKzGE5GElegIdadj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517216',6.9,1326,'ja','マイマイ新子と千年の魔法','Inspired by her grandfather\'s stories, young Shinko embarks on wild flights of fancy about the history of the little town she lives in. But dreams can\'t fend off the realities of growing up.','/9E1muIHzVoml9wwuVc6KJmO7MSw.jpg','2009-11-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Mai Mai Miracle',64809,2.2808,7.1,'4X0rBfBzDec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28443,_binary '\0','/88p24aG4NJNRH0r3ReyqGzuKpYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517225',7.3,3014,'sr','Neprijatelj','The story begins a couple days after the war has ended. A group of Serbian soldiers in charge of clearing the fields from mines discovers a man sealed inside a factory\'s basement. A mysterious man says he is \'ours\', he doesn\'t feel cold, isn\'t hungry and only asks for cigarettes. As soon as he is brought along, people start disappearing, and the infighting begins. Who is the mystery man?','/84XirBSxj5hZMFefHsgXzJfDbNO.jpg','2011-03-22',108,'Released',NULL,'The Enemy',110608,1.0123,6.6,'10R3vQsa5cM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28444,_binary '\0','/2OyHRnW3TW174fIrGkIWk6bWFvk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517249',5.6,3507,'en','Sunlight Jr.','Quickie-mart employee Melissa and paraplegic Richie are very much in love. Supported only by Melissa’s small hourly wage, they are nevertheless thrilled to learn that Melissa is pregnant. Then their situation deteriorates, and their tenuous financial situation threatens to bring their happy life crashing down.','/qqJGPF7cL0FJYvUhdr8sETLnPfs.jpg','2013-04-20',94,'Released',NULL,'Sunlight Jr.',173908,2.3448,5.256,'4rMeQACVWiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28445,_binary '\0','/1bDa2d9VqqBQlk42Gduu37Rz1ob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517260',5.8,122437,'en','The Host','A parasitic alien soul is injected into the body of Melanie Stryder. Instead of carrying out her race\'s mission of taking over the Earth, \"Wanda\" (as she comes to be called) forms a bond with her host and sets out to aid other free humans.','/1mfIZw6WgkCX310eoe0Ys14c3Fi.jpg','2013-03-22',126,'Released','Choose to believe. Choose to fight. Choose to love.','The Host',72710,8.2469,6.296,'SRKjf8b4f2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28446,_binary '\0','/1esAE8sLJRWWFsLLeh5r3g2WanI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517268',6.8,705681,'en','Barbie','Barbie and Ken are having the time of their lives in the colorful and seemingly perfect world of Barbie Land. However, when they get a chance to go to the real world, they soon discover the joys and perils of living among humans.','/iuFNMS8U5cb6xfzi51Dbkovj7vM.jpg','2023-07-19',114,'Released','She\'s everything. He\'s just Ken.','Barbie',346698,33.0367,6.