ung Muslim apprentice accidentally drops cannabis in the dough and sends sales sky high.','/7ke8MS7oa97ScXMFHbsvWmAI5Ln.jpg','2015-04-14',97,'Released','It\'s not just the bread that\'s getting baked.','Dough',299780,1.4846,5.8,'WPAcqo7ZzlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28451,_binary '\0','/3COCz2DMRNefY4a3lfUHrNj4tl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517489',3.6,31088,'en','Spy Kids: All the Time in the World','Eight years after the third film, the OSS has become the world\'s top spy agency, while the Spy Kids department has since become defunct. Retired spy Marissa is called back into action, and to bond with her new stepchildren Rebecca and Cecil, she invites them along to stop the evil Timekeeper from taking over the world.','/9pUVarhiXfCu8amjmyadzJJJITi.jpg','2011-08-18',89,'Released',NULL,'Spy Kids: All the Time in the World',56288,10.28,4.7,'yWWOrCE1MR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28452,_binary '\0','/4hewrs16Gam6RHnrUM0aDZBs4WW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15175188',5,2097,'hi','Faraaz','A terrifying hostage crisis unfolds over one fateful night in 2016 when heavily armed militants attack a popular cafe in Dhaka.','/5Dn3X97sTB15sBIdX8gkkhqCOyD.jpg','2023-02-03',112,'Released','In the darkest hours, he stood tall.','Faraaz',1019638,0.9913,4.65,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28453,_binary '\0','/gPngCIiDs7AIRh5wKBljtyqUlIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1517561',8.3,7325,'ta','துள்ளாத மனமும் துள்ளும்','A struggling singer feels guilty about a girl losing her eyesight; to meet the cost of her eye transplant surgery, he offers his kidney to a rich man.','/oTCPdMsrntsDDezIBVcB6pNQMwJ.jpg','1999-01-29',170,'Released',NULL,'Thulladha Manamum Thullum',78644,1.0867,7.406,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28454,_binary '\0','/eHBJKttEXUkxQMv2eiAgyt9AZw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15176374',9.1,10037,'ta','உன் பார்வையில்','When tragedy strikes twice, Bhavya refuses to remain a victim. Visually impaired, she is drawn into a perilous hunt for the truth behind the mysterious deaths of her husband & twin sister - uncovering a dark world where nothing is as it seems.','/3eMbzqxiq4P0KrdQSov2G9x6wyc.jpg','2025-12-19',117,'Released',NULL,'UnPaarvayil',985354,1.1152,7,'M_q4oP4BUj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28455,_binary '\0','/55A6U9ywDkoV2GxezvbaMwBpeGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15180952',7.5,1415,'pl','Film balkonowy','Composed from the conversations that the director holds with people passing by in the street under his Warsaw apartment, each story in \'The Balcony Movie\' is unique and deals with the way we try to cope with life as individuals. All together, they create a self-portrait of contemporary human life, and the passers-by present a composite picture of today\'s world.','/yB6iLGeXCkt8lQc1IPIOY6uuEHw.jpg','2021-08-07',100,'Released','Everyone\'s story is unique and life surpasses imagination','The Balcony Movie',846892,1.9949,7.4,'AC_yQ6DviZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28456,_binary '\0','/inoAjEKfuDxNzWGjhnIsTnTzDuF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15181064',5.3,6552,'hi','ककूड़ा','When her husband Sunny gets cursed by the terrifying ghost, Kakuda, Indira joins hands with a ghost hunter to find a solution.','/kc16Hwkst3GOfjqdfglSO1b3UjN.jpg','2024-07-12',117,'Released',NULL,'Kakuda',1229078,1.5309,5.714,'5V8Z3h9oVMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28457,_binary '\0','/ulw8SrKbDeDrsSVNKPb5211AseI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15181326',6.4,14205,'en','Dead Man\'s Wire','In 1977, former real estate developer Tony Kiritsis puts a dead man\'s switch on himself and the mortgage banker who did him wrong, demanding $5 million and a personal apology.','/dgSoeebklY0IGKWbp36r9FwRXlv.jpg','2026-01-09',106,'Released','His revolution was televised.','Dead Man\'s Wire',1263012,9.1473,6.527,'aHAwgnJL78Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28458,_binary '\0','/gPok6BQpPvPHqcvga60Lq40UwGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15181360',6.4,3121,'en','Rez Ball','After losing their star player, a high school basketball team rooted in Native American culture must unite to keep their state championship dreams alive.','/5MKpjuiCTk8nYnsUf5QegiPKEDh.jpg','2024-09-08',113,'Released','Play fast. Shoot fast. Take your shot.','Rez Ball',858414,2.0887,6.4,'plUsLi3elDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28459,_binary '\0','/uVflhRHoW3ttVs6KxI7BFVZLBBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15186426',4.8,2229,'en','Christmas Is Canceled','A father begins dating his 29-year-old daughter Emma\'s high school frenemy soon after his wife passes away. His daughter embarks on a mission to break up the happy couple.','/2Vivy2G7Kx8duhN35eUG74B8JXK.jpg','2021-12-23',95,'Released','Just say noel.','Christmas Is Canceled',899382,2.7138,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28460,_binary '\0','/hhD6lRCScoPd0k9VWTq4kYP8ToX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1518812',6.5,16555,'en','Meek\'s Cutoff','A group of settlers traveling through the Oregon High Desert in 1845 find themselves stranded in harsh conditions.','/oc28NmVqLx0x8epu3Ih3LvX4zE9.jpg','2011-04-08',103,'Released','The Road to Civilisation is Not Always Civilised.','Meek\'s Cutoff',57120,3.8577,6.5,'iR5o8omffT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28461,_binary '\0','/cpcDNWL2OgtCCcH7DDRjY8oxUsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15189534',5.8,5876,'es','La ira de Dios','Convinced the tragic deaths of her loved ones were orchestrated by a famous novelist she worked for, Luciana turns to a journalist to expose her truth.','/xXTybIXrytekB4TeN4xrqeI1f8G.jpg','2022-06-15',97,'Released',NULL,'The Wrath of God',880313,3.3798,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28462,_binary '\0','/1f3X1ucyVHKDn393kkAQ4Y5D39l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1519245',5.4,1567,'es','Agnosia','The protagonist is a young woman, Joan Prats suffering from agnosia, a strange, primary visual disease that is one of the neuropsychological disorders of perception. Although her eyes and ears are in perfect condition, her brain is not able to correctly interpret the stimuli it receives. Joan is the only person to know an industrial secret left behind by her late father and becomes the victim of a sinister plan to extract this information. Her captors plan to use her sensory condition to help extract the information that they so desperately want.','/anc5PqOs3wEJJYGsdOLnZ9YdDNq.jpg','2010-09-26',105,'Released',NULL,'Agnosia',62103,1.365,4.8,'urlGwg-NswU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28463,_binary '\0','/nNSSOb97fBS3bnCceH0wIQB7zxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15193040',5.5,2095,'tr','Kim Bu Aile?','Adem Haberdar\'s life takes a completely different turn when he has to leave the police after failing an important operation. Pursuing the gang that caused him to quit his job, Adem has to take over a chicken restaurant in order to follow the gang.','/nvNqP5Z0mpwgqI0ciRkT32Uf36m.jpg','2022-10-06',124,'Released',NULL,'Kim Bu Aile?',1031869,0.676,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28464,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15193162',8.1,6353,'hi','The Conversion','A Movie that explores the sensitive topic of religious conversion, this movie is a captivating drama depicting girl\'s dilemma of what happens in an inter-faith marriage that results in religious conversion.','/drWRlEAYzp4jkw4QOxb6K4w06Fp.jpg','2022-05-06',134,'Released',NULL,'The Conversion',972116,0.8217,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28465,_binary '\0','/3SzAsdYAleY3HM3qyAHftcAlYOs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1519461',4.3,16431,'en','Area 51','Three young conspiracy theorists attempt to uncover the mysteries of Area 51, the government\'s secret location rumored to have hosted encounters with alien beings. What they find at this hidden facility exposes unimaginable 