academic life sets on a tour to Cox\'s Bazaar. Expecting to live their life at the fullest. But some unexpected events that take place on the tour make their worlds go upside down.','/s0ZT1JyokLTV9vcvARzAaJNtRVQ.jpg','2021-08-19',89,'Released',NULL,'Networker Baire',860039,1.6164,6.75,'xYn-mApSCSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28501,_binary '\0','/if1129DRB6gR0Xcxanb1NPYwgVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523411',5.1,1941,'tr','Aşk Geliyorum Demez','With his dad’s shop threatened by commercial development, Ali decides to change the building contractor’s mind by making his daughter fall for him.','/iJitICtBL7hVXtLPogU0fwSwiK0.jpg','2009-11-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Game of Love',32345,1.0785,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28502,_binary '\0','/xMktkf9TTYvJkEMyk2y73hnxlgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523415',6.9,2688,'tr','Beş Şehir','Aydın is a policeman recently appointed to a new post in Istanbul. While trying to get used to life in the big city, Aydın stumbles upon Mehtap, a young woman who works at a candy shop in Beyoğlu, and he falls for her. But there is no way that Aydın can make Mehtap realize that he even exists, just as Şevket, a young man who has dropped out of law school before starting to sell toy trains on the streets to make a living, cannot make Dilek, another girl who works at the same store, realize his feelings for her. When Dilek and Aydın meet, Aydın diverts his uncontrollable feelings toward Dilek.','/5uQNaElLbuHXZ1qHZq1y6uHozAZ.jpg','2009-10-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Five Cities',51334,1.7592,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28503,_binary '\0','/kPsmN62vFuJD3FjFIRZXO84tKQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523483',5.7,14553,'en','Kaboom','Smith, a typical young college student who likes partying and engaging in acts of random sex and debauchery, has been having some interesting dreams revolving around two gorgeous women -- and is shocked when he meets the dream girls in real life. Lorelei looks just like his fantasy brunette, while a mysterious red-haired girl being chased by assassins draws him into an international conspiracy. Or is it all just a drug-induced hallucination?','/vIbX9X6lMdbdqYfuxxsHvi9n01v.jpg','2010-10-06',86,'Released','Blow your mind.','Kaboom',46837,3.2995,5.6,'DUMKPzQsas8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28504,_binary '\0','/pLxcQaLfY7gf7Qsi3jAUozexb2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523485',4.2,1357,'en','Kill Katie Malone','College students and best friends Ginger Matheson, Jim Duncan, and Kyle \"Dixie\" Canning, pool their cash to buy a \"ghost\" in an online auction. The three think it\'s all a goof, but once they open up the antique box to examine their \"treasure,\" they unleash the vengeful spirit of an Irish servant girl who has been wreaking havoc on her owners throughout the generations','/3EMyIIXjmqbxtLgsjXZ92tPhnbM.jpg','2010-10-10',88,'Released','you can\'t choose your family, but she can','Kill Katie Malone',48836,1.7451,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28505,_binary '\0','/wCAii5ptawbqYKRi3rt0bkmC6k9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523486',6.6,16166,'tr','Kolpaçino','Lives of several low-level gangsters get intertwined after a game of craps in their underground casino ends in a bloody shootout.','/nM2gv65hZbPWnnFp8q3AJiBuV3X.jpg','2009-10-29',98,'Released','An Urban Legend','Kolpaçino',50025,1.7767,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28506,_binary '\0','/zXT0KKVfuEurxfSgZm1FyUCVJBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523491',6.3,6556,'tr','Kurtlar Vadisi: Gladio','Retired security intelligence agent Iskender Buyuk has kept his government\'s secrets for years but when the men he has sworn to protect suddenly desert him, Iskender finds himself in the defendant\'s chair with only young and inexperienced lawyer Ayse to represent his interests. Understandably angered by this turn of events, Iskender decides to strike back against his one-time employers by revealing all he knows about covert op missions.','/hpqRSrnRt29PbHyetWlpHjQ8aVr.jpg','2009-06-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Valley of the Wolves Gladio',35747,1.4194,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28507,_binary '\0','/buDNWvy0f72phyy8arDVzy6IMlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523515',6.2,8009,'tr','Neşeli Hayat','Burdened by troubles and caught between cultures, Riza takes a job as a mall Santa and finds that real life may not be so different from make believe.','/rw9ZF58yRHPsSZXTboJBLrsZXvW.jpg','2009-11-27',107,'Released',NULL,'Jolly Life',52667,2.1371,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28508,_binary '\0','/jCSTuEOP6VeWBYMgLMTkue4Iu3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15235708',7.2,1931,'en','A Dickens of a Holiday!','To make the 100th anniversary of her hometown\'s Victorian festival a success, Cassie invites action movie star and former high school classmate Jake to play Scrooge in A Christmas Carol.','/rqm52nuyi19lxFEHz4DCVsCmA6v.jpg','2021-12-10',84,'Released','Life is what happens behind the scenes.','A Dickens of a Holiday!',877828,2.0803,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28509,_binary '\0','/wY5OLEEVEt9rw1U0gDHy0KsS8V4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523583',6.3,6275,'tr','7 Kocalı Hürmüz','Remake of a well-known Turkish musical comedy loved by generations, the film is about the adventures of flirtatious Hurmuz in late 1800\'s Istanbul. Hurmuz who lives in Taskasap, Istanbul has six husbands in a plot to solve her economic problems. She arranges to meet each of her husbands one day of the week. However, suddenly, she falls in love with the town\'s doctor whom she meets at her husband\'s barber shop. The doctor falls in love with her too... But, one night all six husbands come home at the same time, and Hurmuz and Safinaz - Hurmuz\'s \"go-between/accomplice/friend\" - find themselves in a series of very awkward yet funny situations.','/fLgQO8D6oPfZCnQSs6kmHVmIkBw.jpg','2009-11-20',120,'Released',NULL,'7 Husbands for Hurmuz',38547,1.1467,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28510,_binary '\0','/3q7LHMFl4ZZOyLn70MVHCJ6rgxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15238986',4.7,3649,'hi','प्लान ए प्लान बी','When an earnest matchmaker moves into an office next to a cynical divorce attorney, their bitter conflict is complicated by a growing attraction.','/qVZ7aCYKsoP3vca55znw37LQXUl.jpg','2022-09-30',106,'Released',NULL,'Plan A Plan B',1018220,1.4233,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28511,_binary '\0','/eZ239CUp1d6OryZEBPnO2n87gMG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15239678',8.4,792955,'en','Dune: Part Two','Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a path of revenge against the conspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the fate of the known universe, Paul endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.','/6izwz7rsy95ARzTR3poZ8H6c5pp.jpg','2024-02-27',167,'Released','Long live the fighters.','Dune: Part Two',693134,54.2098,8.137,'U2Qp5pL3ovA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28512,_binary '\0','/qIVlsUYHNoqBKrx68kXACkF63UY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1523980',7.2,1813,'es','Pecados de mi padre','Nicolas Entel\'s searing documentary tells the story of Pablo Escobar -- Colombian drug kingpin, murderer and family man -- through the eyes of his son Sebastian as well as the sons of two of Escobar\'s most prominent victims. Sebastian shares stories of living in luxury and on the lam, but more significantly, he attempts to end the cycle of bloody retribution and make peace with two of the men his father so deeply wronged.','/5j7IHhwwUjnfnPxwZjiGAgllnLe.jpg','2009-12-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Sins of My Father',46558,1.2521,6.5,'NL6L2XwEJ1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28513,_binary '\0','/Inki9MBsWyBEzrHKR49jVr4cMX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524131',5.1,2786,'en','Knucklehead','A fight promoter deeply in debt to his crooked rival and desperate for a new fighter catches a break when a 450 pound church handyman who has spent his entire life in an orphanage agrees to wrestle on behalf of his fellow orphans.','/lr8ea5YtZHafTkxHWb2OE5ZSEK.jpg','2010-10-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Knucklehead',44946,2.1921,5.6,'VrJt_8BZ2o0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28514,_binary '\0','/oY7mslp1RiSVRq2P93hn2Z7sgi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524134',3.7,1706,'en','Orcs!','Faced with extinction, two park rangers are forced to defend the national park against hordes of rampaging orcs. Ancient and long forgotten, these orcs are unleashed from the depths of the mountains, and they won\'t stop until we\'re all dead.','/30kBeVYvenPMEyE6uZkQijPFeKb.jpg','2011-07-11',80,'Released','They Will Eat Your Face Off','Orcs!',66470,1.3822,3.7,'Vs1_OyRwwpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28515,_binary '\0','/3se6YngJYOQ8rpbp7ZeNcnSKmmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524137',6.4,129867,'en','Contraband','When his brother-in-law runs afoul of a drug lord, family man Chris Farraday turns to a skill he abandoned long ago—smuggling—to repay the debt. But the job goes wrong, and Farraday finds himself wanted by cops, crooks and killers alike.','/c9NQDANheSz887myHeMocUKQ5Je.jpg','2012-01-12',109,'Released','What would you hide to protect your family?','Contraband',77866,6.8276,6.343,'Rp0b5ZXIUvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28516,_binary '\0','/BgBXBqAukHxt6WKb7Iw49LW0DW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15241758',5.1,2169,'en','Hounded','A stately home robbery takes an evil turn one night when a gang of young thieves are caught by the owners of the house and then hunted across the estate for the proprietor\'s entertainment.','/cdVz9dUv2YvNQil4svLAiUTuY28.jpg','2022-10-21',94,'Released','Old tradition. New blood.','Hounded',935999,2.567,5.2,'pCopX_oL1wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:2