:21:08.000000','tt15245268',7.9,9557,'nl','Young Hearts','14-year-old Elias increasingly feels like an outsider in his village. When he meets his new neighbour of the same age, Alexander, Elias is confronted with his burgeoning sexuality.','/iGCtYxfuvXfy0BD5m6p7vKuPOxS.jpg','2024-10-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Young Hearts',1232449,15.4684,8.6,'1aCTG9HplF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28521,_binary '\0','/xKsE9Z3AiGxo6gCc8FqAZlYrC0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524539',8.4,5195,'mr','हरिश्चंद्राची फॅक्टरी','In 1913 India\'s cinema industry is born from Dadasaheb Phalke\'s efforts to make Raja Harishchandra (1913), India\'s first feature-length B&W silent film.','/uRC3yCRlsETdnCvZiyXilLtMrdE.jpg','2009-01-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Harishchandrachi Factory',35572,1.0569,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28522,_binary '\0','/cBsuqkXl13ubY8xqUlzpusMojra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15245390',5.3,2259,'en','Raven\'s Hollow','West Point cadet Edgar Allan Poe and four other cadets on a training exercise in upstate New York are drawn by a gruesome discovery into a forgotten community where they find a township guarding a frightening secret.','/woYqEqtro2AMWHmwBy9429zB17x.jpg','2022-09-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Raven\'s Hollow',996581,2.5173,5.4,'3JmIj29VYqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28523,_binary '\0','/iLGYlfDpRmiXhqsujkonxUHwad3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15245738',6.4,1348,'en','The Holiday Fix Up','When Sam, the designer behind a popular home renovation show, returns to her hometown during the holidays to help renovate the Bell Harbor Inn, she gets paired with Coop as her lead contractor. The only problem — he\'s the guy who broke her heart and she\'s the one who got away. Sparks fly as they work closely to get the renovations done in time for the inn\'s annual Christmas Eve Harborfest.','/gErljGRKSUeedJw8mJPndGdIGi7.jpg','2021-12-11',85,'Released',NULL,'The Holiday Fix Up',881245,1.9573,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28524,_binary '\0','/vxcUvt5V3qsDddh0ivgdeSLUMyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524575',4.7,19493,'en','The Vatican Tapes','In a highly secured vault deep within the walls of Vatican City, the Catholic Church holds thousands of old films and video footage documenting exorcisms/supposed exorcisms and other unexplained religious phenomena they feel the world is not ready to see. This is the first tape - Case 83-G - stolen from these archives and exposed to the public by an anonymous source.','/eXN0zdTpm772ZCfnCeLAONguqxe.jpg','2015-07-23',91,'Released','For 2,000 years the Vatican has recorded evidence of evil. May God have mercy on their souls.','The Vatican Tapes',157544,5.8443,5.4,'jy-Bv3j9Aq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28525,_binary '\0','/35CkOX4O7TXT97qYiwspaEw5tld.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15248702',5.6,4092,'en','Catwoman: Hunted','Catwoman\'s attempt to steal a priceless jewel puts her squarely in the crosshairs of both a powerful consortium of villains and the ever-resourceful Interpol, not to mention Batwoman.','/iu01cvxs3eLQzra3YNF1pbpXIZa.jpg','2022-02-07',78,'Released','Predator becomes prey.','Catwoman: Hunted',862491,5.6547,5.8,'PYPqTLS_g9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28526,_binary '\0','/6y5ALiAai1JbLRb7ZlydNwEPu5a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1524930',6.2,136141,'en','Vacation','Hoping to bring his family closer together and to recreate his childhood vacation for his own kids, a grown up Rusty Griswold takes his wife and their two sons on a cross-country road trip to the coolest theme park in America, Walley World. Needless to say, things don\'t go quite as planned.','/fYDALvoCt3DBlSWN6pSAnGQ9ld7.jpg','2015-07-28',99,'Released','What could go wrong?','Vacation',296099,10.1238,6.3,'YU-42pvbBdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28527,_binary '\0','/6WGvlubnkAGq37o5prF37W7FcQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15251536',5.8,6681,'ml','കാപ്പ','When Anand learns that his wife Binu Trivikraman\'s name ended up in Kerala Anti-Social Activities Prevention Act (KAAPA) list by mistake, he embarks on a journey to prove her innocence, but finds himself caught in the crosshairs of a hardened gangster and a merciless war.','/hllm5duftEJDHQAPjK94DHisaE.jpg','2022-12-22',133,'Released','LAW…NOT JUSTICE...','Kaapa',862618,1.4842,4.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28528,_binary '\0','/aPM0xaWvCW26XmPFZMwlBDrAGBI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525323',6.2,3677,'te','బిల్లా','A police inspector sends a gangster-lookalike to uncover the gang\'s secrets.','/dJlJskiQFVDcWdb2f9FGl23x84m.jpg','2009-04-03',149,'Released',NULL,'Billa',23766,1.378,5.357,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28529,_binary '\0','/hWeYv8YG1aWA3OJG2Hpa0dIqPuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525366',6.3,20883,'en','Grabbers','Something sinister has come to the shores of Erin Island, unbeknownst to the quaint population of this sleepy fishing village resting somewhere off Ireland’s coast. First, some fishermen go missing. Then there is the rash of whale carcasses suddenly washing up on the beach. When the murders start, it’s up to two mismatched cops – an irresponsible alcoholic and his new partner, a by-the-book woman from the mainland – to protect the townsfolk from the giant, bloodsucking, tentacled aliens that prey upon them. Their only weapon, they discover, is booze. If they want to survive the creatures’ onslaught, everyone will have to get very, very drunk!','/n1CkFfuDCh4NDZgaXmyna3V0Hxc.jpg','2012-08-10',94,'Released','For the locals on Erin Island, it\'s last orders.','Grabbers',84204,3.1067,6.089,'4e3izWdh9WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28530,_binary '\0','/AwB7HGeDTrBGkP2WEnNwg8Wa0E4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15255288',5.7,86171,'en','Murder Mystery 2','After starting their own detective agency, Nick and Audrey Spitz land a career-making case when their billionaire pal is kidnapped from his wedding.','/s1VzVhXlqsevi8zeCMG9A16nEUf.jpg','2023-03-28',91,'Released','This mystery is deux or die.','Murder Mystery 2',638974,11.1874,6.356,'LM2F56uK0fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28531,_binary '\0','/rIgVB9OyryTxFnqjPU9ULMbQvR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15255876',6.7,68121,'en','Emily the Criminal','Desperate for income, Emily takes a shady gig buying goods with stolen credit cards supplied by a charismatic middleman named Youcef. Seduced by the quick cash and illicit thrills, they hatch a plan to take their business to the next level.','/iZvzMpREGiqDQ5eYbx8z70qPgst.jpg','2022-08-12',97,'Released','High risks come with even higher rewards.','Emily the Criminal',862965,7.4729,6.6,'ON6IwdTqQkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28532,_binary '\0','/qc2a2q2IB981Ly0sL22aI0PxUjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15257116',6.5,3844,'en','Palm Trees and Power Lines','A disconnected teenage girl enters a relationship with a man twice her age. She sees him as the solution to all her problems, but his intentions are not what they seem.','/jWiSF5VbFeeWZmx7rGgQCsFsLdW.jpg','2023-03-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Palm Trees and Power Lines',872516,3.0366,6.3,'cjZBbEkpaGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28533,_binary '\0','/bMRofddQE58ToKM7GtdJy6MuKoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15257160',6.6,56379,'en','Pain Hustlers','After losing her job, a single mom falls into a lucrative but ultimately dangerous scheme selling prescription drugs.','/m0gM9jE1KmCkXZRqkeNYEQZdVsZ.jpg','2023-10-20',122,'Released','An American excess story.','Pain Hustlers',862968,9.8215,6.638,'HbPeXsdamT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28534,_binary '\0','/jgOwUgUEVPSu8jDjQzeFTCFHVDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15257644',6.7,11822,'hi','मिली','Mili Naudiyal, a nursing graduate is planning to move to Canada. She takes up a job at a food outlet for the time being but her sudden disappearance without a clue leaves her loved ones in a desperate search for her in this survival drama.','/eJ36QCd5SPRpivJkVgZMqKyfgCz.jpg','2022-11-04',129,'Released','Dying to Survive','Mili',908397,1.5625,6.522,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28535,_binary '\0','/2aq4NmCedLUf8HasstMYOAo9L6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15258032',6.5,1727,'en','Lonesome','Casey, a country lad running from a small-town scandal, finds himself down and out in big city Sydney. When he meets city lad Tib both men find something they have been missing but neither of them knows quite how to negotiate it.','/3mrcgrdwsJqesvMTAAmE0YTX4LB.jpg','2023-01-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Lonesome',933170,1.299,6.2,'Nn9HffCh980','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28536,_binary '\0','/jNsK2a8A1DYpaCX5HGElp3t4x6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525835',6.4,8821,'ja','Gantz','After trying to rescue a man on the subway tracks, two teens wake up in a room dominated by a mysterious black sphere that sends them to hunt down and kill aliens hiding on Earth.','/vScJdcqXHyupdeO3wkTqT92ew85.jpg','2010-11-29',130,'Released','The only way to resurrect is to kill.','Gantz',56832,4.537,6.541,'6M7X1pTM6H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28537,_binary '\0','/m4ejd7i9jyX9bJgEggHKEAFXMdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525836',6.2,5000,'ja','Gantz: Perfect Answer','Summoned by the black sphere, Kei and Masaru fight against extraterrestrials until Masaru grows tired of fighting and refuses to continue.','/ir6QhKXU3zDYaOnJ0ISpu3nkE7O.jpg','2011-04-23',141,'Released','To continue life, play the game of death…','Gantz: Perfect Answer',74135,3.8747,6.6,'bcSThPonFgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28538,_binary '\0','/1pMDoMqLyaH75DluGCxhOHaKnmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525838',6.5,1331,'en','Gun Hill Road','An ex-con returns home to the Bronx after three year in prison to discover his wife estranged and his teenage son exploring a sexual transformation that will put the fragile bonds of their family to the test.','/ezAw8t0yRYqjjtf7jpcrEGOQbqi.jpg','2011-08-05',86,'Released','You can\'t escape who you are.','Gun Hill Road',65953,1.4755,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28539,_binary '\0','/9HmoXn6YLOk9uZt4tb2XmccZiKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525890',6,12886,'en','The Caller','Troubled divorcee Mary Kee is tormented by a series of sinister phone calls from a mysterious woman. When the stranger reveals she\'s calling from the past, Mary tries to break off contact. But the caller doesn\'t like being ignored, and looks for revenge in a unique and terrifying way...','/4xhuufxE28PhQrUUoUe1TYg6oeU.jpg','2011-08-26',92,'Released','Some calls are best left unanswered.','The Caller',73588,3.4033,6.195,'GBO-H9EZW5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28540,_binary '\0','/tzbZDomzmh5kxU49PRJDv07iGYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1525915',6.2,1276,'es','El gran Vázquez','Is it possible to live aside of the system, thinking only about the present and oneself? A feature film about Manuel Vázquez, the best comic book author in Barcelona during the sixties, but, mainly, a man with a very particular way of living his life.','/rs6AetmLIgI7Nmv6sdgnyjcIARr.jpg','2010-09-24',106,'Released',NULL,'The Great Vazquez',57413,1.3205,5.9,'2uQRApcLIFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28541,_binary '\0','/y4eA7NRzNkQssbhdRH0WxTFQ9y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15260176',4.4,5189,'hi','Despatch','Determined to break the next big story and refashion his complicated personal life, Joy embarks on a relentless odyssey through the heart and gut of Mumbai.','/chn341XKezmUfGO2hdin5grCZU5.jpg','2024-10-19',151,'Released',NULL,'Despatch',1069910,1.0874,4.429,'BHPMcOqa3H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28542,_binary '\0','/jHKNqz0LjM2dOUv5XDPmcSoYPEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15262370'