by He Loves You','Aarya 2',34763,1.5172,6.544,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28546,_binary '\0','/e5nsTMUFtg97mR8bU8eXevt4BIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15264532',8.2,4511,'kn','ರತ್ನನ್ ಪ್ರಪಂಚ','Rathnakara is an insurance agent living a mundane life with his unapologetically loud mother Saroja. An uncomfortable truth about his life leads him to go on a trail to find his world. What does he learn eventually?','/dH7q0wASf3Wn9nHQL8HDbUSrjg7.jpg','2021-10-22',146,'Released','The Journey of Rathnakara','Rathnan Prapancha',729030,0.94,4.5,'kT819h_6a8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28547,_binary '\0','/l7bm9w7ujgBeWAbKjpyJa8Psilg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1526578',6.3,2050,'fr','Ao, le dernier néandertal','When his clan, including his wife and baby girl Néa, are massacred, Ao, a desperate Neandertal man, decides to leave the North country where he has been living for the South where he was born. His aim is to join his twin brother, from whom he was separated when he was nine. On his long and adventurous way home, he meets Aki, a Homo Sapiens woman...','/k4nKlmubLYBzdJAMPkEfFk8WdCp.jpg','2010-01-29',84,'Released',NULL,'Ao: The Last Hunter',56623,2.5887,5.8,'rgUjnJ7qs8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28548,_binary '\0','/fAZaNMj7FyQaL20vnD5XR35KAUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1526741',6.5,7356,'it','Cado dalle nubi','An aspiring singer from southern Italy who\'s just been dumped moves north to Milan, where he falls in love and enters a TV singing competition show.','/sKPtM6uyuTcBPuspPjgdG3g6dmn.jpg','2009-11-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Cado dalle nubi',35554,1.7652,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28549,_binary '\0','/fIQfdZ6fqf9mIbqBaexbgIEIk5K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15268244',6.4,31692,'en','Joy Ride','When Audrey\'s business trip to Asia goes sideways, she enlists the aid of Lolo, her irreverent, childhood best friend who also happens to be a hot mess; Kat, her college friend turned Chinese soap star; and Deadeye, Lolo\'s eccentric cousin. Their no-holds-barred, epic experience becomes a journey of bonding, friendship, belonging, and wild debauchery that reveals the universal truth of what it means to know and love who you are.','/lTZ3r9NBdbrR6NA90v3hFYqd6TC.jpg','2023-06-22',94,'Released','Four friends. One trip. No luck.','Joy Ride',864168,7.1703,6.512,'Nn28aZkrFn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28550,_binary '\0','/cc3B8hCzBma7TFEdr44RNphn6cf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1526875',7.7,1867,'ta','அபியும் நானும்','Raghuraman, father of a grown daughter meets Sudhakar, father of a toddler at a playground. Raghuraman recounts the story of his own relationship with his daughter through the years, including his difficulties with accepting her marriage.','/5shSpO2q7FmO5FJLmWsveQP3XHc.jpg','2008-12-19',147,'Released','Children grow up. Sometimes parents must too.','Abhiyum Naanum',40617,1.3317,7.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28551,_binary '\0','/g99Zq9Cdr6yGjOHrVYUizzhjoZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1527057',6.8,1576,'ar','اللعب مع الكبار','When Hassan Bahlal, a young unemployed man, calls the National Security Agency to report a fire that is to break out in a factory the next day, a new chapter in Hassan\'s life begins as he tells the officer he has foreseen the incident in a dream.','/kFrI68Md1InTADwKmlVEtGF4gIW.jpg','1991-06-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Playing with Giants',372048,1.2518,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28552,_binary '\0','/k2cXzMrDAhbO8b2DwJehu2veXha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1527118',5.9,1233,'ar','حنفي الأبهة','Hanafi al\'abiha steals a jewelry shop with his partners and hides the bag with his brother Ahmad before they were arrested. His three accomplices escape and kidnap Ahmed\'s wife Duaa until they recover the bag. Hanafi is temporarily released to lead the Police to the place of his colleagues, and the events follow.'