tion and mental torment he encounters leads to an emotional roller-coaster ride full of fear and danger, where things are not always as clear as they seem to be, and where past deeds can have dire consequences.','/bSqpOGzaKBdGkBLmcm1JJIVryYy.jpg','2022-09-23',107,'Released','What he created will destroy him.','The Infernal Machine',916605,6.1616,6.252,'q0vrecpxXZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28557,_binary '\0','/uEqrGVBELVFaNVMOE4ExjLCMV3j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1527788',7.7,81557,'ko','아저씨','A reclusive pawnshop owner goes on a brutal rampage to rescue a young girl kidnapped by a criminal organization.','/9QJ3cPpYgoPfhRnRPxpQUfx790r.jpg','2010-08-04',119,'Released','Nothing to lose, nothing to compromise.','The Man from Nowhere',51608,7.7959,7.7,'38rPoGSr19U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28558,_binary '\0','/1eM6Ey1FzpgJigrxRiSYtntSWq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1527793',7.5,74933,'ko','어쩔수가없다','After being laid off and humiliated by a ruthless job market, a veteran paper mill manager descends into violence in a desperate bid to reclaim his dignity.','/vc2S0dvgpsM0XfSiXZDMVkRCSSU.jpg','2025-09-24',139,'Released','Would you kill for a job?','No Other Choice',639988,15.2921,7.5,'SK_DEabMNVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28559,_binary '\0','/9fbrF2kOLMVESTcz1Ifj4YAuA3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1527835',6.4,3369,'en','Archipelago','Deep fractures within a family dynamic begin to surface during a getaway to the Isles of Scilly.','/6Y53rzeunARUG2yiADsaHOJW0Rf.jpg','2011-03-04',114,'Released',NULL,'Archipelago',64655,1.8551,5.7,'4yyBmAohj_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28560,_binary '\0','/mORSowyx92dlvx9zYOKXZx0NpAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528071',6.4,92486,'en','Horns','In the aftermath of his girlfriend\'s mysterious death, a young man awakens to strange horns sprouting from his temples.','/tjTy6W05mPXXw87IqpjeGNhIcM4.jpg','2013-0