SP5w2QVHXG54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15281704',5.4,11527,'hi','कुत्ते','A van carrying crores of cash. One rainy night in the outskirts of Mumbai. Unaware of each other, three stray gangs cross paths on the hunt. Unfortunately, all of them have the same plan. Bullets... Blood... Betrayal... It’s every man for himself... All the dogs after one bone. Will these dogs bite the bone, or will they lose to greed?','/bwJHR0qzAvJLKy7EioiSRu0QivY.jpg','2023-01-13',112,'Released','Jungle has one rule, either you get killed or you kill...','Kuttey',864573,1.3517,5.886,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28565,_binary '\0','/fMa4phfB4pgDYgJBdFQ0hSHRlQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15282128',6,1444,'sv','En dag kommer allt det här bli ditt','Successful cartoonist Lisa and her siblings gather at their parents\' farm for the first time in over ten years. The parents want only one of them to inherit the forest, which has been in the family\'s possessions for generations.','/eVqXm2NuOcbfuk1619jY4yDej5K.jpg','2023-02-03',105,'Released',NULL,'One Day All This Will Be Yours',1035833,1.8655,6.1,'GmxuhefHsY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28566,_binary '\0','/6BI1XjPNT5VYEJ4vXkdyuiKLMYt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15282148',6.4,9689,'da','A Beautiful Life','When a young fisherman with a hidden talent gets discovered by a music producer, he must decide if he\'s ready to open himself up to stardom — and love.','/x6PvT4HAkK7phdj54Zao8rY5oBT.jpg','2023-06-01',99,'Released',NULL,'A Beautiful Life',1119173,3.4779,6.845,'8Yt1D8rj_RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28567,_binary '\0','/qOx5N4xzzJ7hr1VouVEJf5hASrp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15282172',6,1305,'kn','ಹೆಡ್ ಬುಷ್: Vol 1','Head Bush revolves around Jayaraj, his friends, foes, police officers, and the politicians who changed the course of the political scenario of Bengaluru in the 1970s. The film focuses on the rise and rise of Jayaraj - from a teenager to a rowdy to a mass hero.','/k87QaS5L4BGUPRrFVoiaegcqbOQ.jpg','2022-10-21',138,'Released','The Rise & Rise of Bengaluru Underworld','Head Bush: Vol 1',735855,0.7456,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28568,_binary '\0','/88TVBlVebgmaLFIGGIcQmBVcjNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528227',4.8,2417,'en','The Pregnancy Pact','Inspired by the true story of teenagers at Gloucester High School who agreed to get pregnant at the same time.','/dgjiRqWJXK26gjwcMC2OY3pvJYV.jpg','2010-01-23',87,'Released','Teen pregnancy isn\'t always unplanned.','The Pregnancy Pact',56968,1.8505,5.1,'ce0ES19thzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28569,_binary '\0','/nf9zjNFEUq41IZdvYkuvsIWLao3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528312',6.4,4999,'en','Route Irish','A private security contractor in Iraq rejects the official explanation of his friend\'s death and sets out to uncover the truth.','/u82X81dSc7d0hcDf34RBv568eFm.jpg','2011-03-16',109,'Released','The most dangerous road in the world conceals an even deadlier secret.','Route Irish',59065,1.8928,6,'FqtAwJs0uAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28570,_binary '\0','/qMASP9d57fyagDhnNUNGVr1nGqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528313',6.4,16335,'fr','Rien à déclarer','During the elimination of the Belgian/French border in the 90s, a Belgian customs officer is forced to team up with one of his French counterparts.','/vqJmmfVavVX9F9De3LQLDlGPc6D.jpg','2010-12-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Nothing to Declare',52077,4.1129,5.889,'U8LI0wvuz4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28571,_binary '\0','/c4w0cHapoKndfq4fXnDoUyW90Xd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15284556',6,1797,'en','Mārama','1859. When a young Māori woman is summoned from New Zealand to North Yorkshire, she uncovers her horrific colonial heritage and is compelled to confront and destroy the titled Englishman who devastated her family.','/a2grH0utOOUIVA6YydwvAZdHvru.jpg','2026-04-17',89,'Released','A Māori gothic story of retribution.','Mārama',1364953,7.4755,6.256,'qRQrXmHW8p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28572,_binary '\0','/f5zhq3zRjZugZCygV63l9LrxpsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528718',4.3,5081,'en','Born to Raise Hell','A hard core Interpol Agent is assigned to an Eastern European task force to target gun trafficking and dope running throughout the Balkans. While investigating a Russian gun dealer, his team is caught in a bloody street war between a Gypsy gang and the Russians, leaving one task force member dead. Fueled with vengeance, he leads us on an action packed thrill ride while avenging his friend\'s death.','/arH52UwfIEKuzUR0qZrm2E1r0Rh.jpg','2010-10-19',98,'Released','A duty to protect. A heart for vengeance.','Born to Raise Hell',46103,3.4733,4.547,'OEwgnEX26qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28573,_binary '\0','/4AamoNGo7rOAo1y8q12XH1QP8Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528734',7.6,4827,'en','Food Matters','With nutritionally-depleted foods, chemical additives and our tendency to rely upon pharmaceutical drugs to treat what\'s wrong with our malnourished bodies, it\'s no wonder that modern society is getting sicker. Food Matters sets about uncovering the trillion dollar worldwide sickness industry and gives people some scientifically verifiable solutions for curing disease naturally.','/g1u0Mf4VKKklC8fKsvAh5n5pk8T.jpg','2010-10-08',74,'Released','Prevent illness, reverse disease & maintain optimal health... naturally.','Food Matters',26018,1.353,6.8,'r4DOQ6Xhqss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28574,_binary '\0','/riVwkxmcW3WsWNg0al9EItHzCEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528750',5.5,2269,'fr','Happy Few','Mutual attraction leads two married couples to swap bedtime partners.','/n8ZDAs5lJ8hN3MSPBThLbxMnE5z.jpg','2010-09-15',103,'Released',NULL,'Four Lovers',59507,4.1746,5.9,'98j-2YGAyy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28575,_binary '\0','/sY9DFBGMqTSVOHe7ueVg6D9y5Oc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528769',5,1226,'en','Kommandør Treholt & ninjatroppen','Norwegian Ninja is the true story of how Commander Arne Treholt and his Ninja Force saved Norway during the Cold War. In 1983 the Ninja Force discovers that the sinister NATO force Stay Behind, who take charge in times of war and emergency, are planning a coup-d\'état in peacetime. Treholt and the Ninjas see only one solution: a full can of whoop-ass.','/t0inau3zDEFi5I6hBRKP5aGYx4o.jpg','2010-08-13',77,'Released',NULL,'Norwegian Ninja',52009,1.4043,4.7,'4wNVjI9bJIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28576,_binary '\0','/p6xIsQWUjlYDhugV9tYdfSil5cw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528813',5.7,5472,'en','The Penitent Man','The Penitent Man tells the story of psychologist Dr. Jason Pyatt, a man devoted to his work - a man torn from his family. With his struggling marriage and mounting bills, Jason is at a crossroads with the life he has chosen and the life he could have. When one of his clients - the mysterious Mr. Darnell - walks into his office and paints him a repentant tale of future economic and moral collapse, Jason\'s eyes are forever opened. With the help of his best friend Ovid, he embarks on a personal mission to change the course of his future, and possibly the world, forever.','/kHalOdvyHg1DEmKdTw6hgXCDHV5.jpg','2010-03-29',92,'Released','He knlows the secret.','The Penitent Man',145932,1.2593,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28577,_binary '\0','/4kui3QA55M2ZOmBgoRlrYj5MSlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1528854',6.2,140723,'en','Daddy\'s Home','The story of a mild-mannered radio executive who strives to become the best stepdad ever to his wife\'s two children, but complications ensue when their freewheeling, freeloading real father arrives, forcing stepdad to compete for the affection of the kids.','/fB9lALk9zKsMYWvf0bJSkJN219Z.jpg','2015-12-25',96,'Released','Choose your Daddy','Daddy\'s Home',274167,12.8991,6.3,'arhMMJx7tCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28578,_binary '\0','/gkAozXk0UXhsKWLP3Umyi9UOXGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15289090',5.2,1263,'en','Christmas on the Farm','Emmy\'s book about living on an Australian farm is about to be a publishing sensation – and the CEO publisher and her handsome son are coming to see her country life firsthand. Only problem is, it\'s not her life!','/c8FgK92umNLI4KU2WcXoyt8oyrH.jpg','2021-12-01',85,'Released','Family is what you fake it!','Christmas on the Farm',899235,1.8167,5.7,'r_oEqfyLpMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28579,_binary '\0','/pZv3qb5wK3h0kOUL2HOloYioAT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15289240',5.6,14301,'en','The Curse of Bridge Hollow','A Halloween-hating dad reluctantly teams up with his teenage daughter when an evil spirit wreaks havoc by making their town\'s decorations come to life.','/t6P9l6tcVnWLS1ADUAfkUCGQhm0.jpg','2022-10-14',90,'Released','Halloween comes to life.','The Curse of Bridge Hollow',864959,4.606,6.5,'Y-eYqE_X9N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28580,_binary '\0','/rJ9fsSZy006YB8Ahk4CKkdea5EK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15289510',7,2729,'lt','Tu man nieko neprimeni','Dancer Elena and sign language interpreter Dovydas meet and form a beautiful bond. As they dive into a new relationship, they must navigate how to build their own kind of intimacy.','/ebw1ZX5agO9dVf3OGY2nrwHm4pc.jpg','2023-09-22',103,'Released',NULL,'Slow',1058642,3.3644,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28581,_binary '\0','/plIjhnya8m85Js6j8KqtoRc2sni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15290106',2.5,2281,'te','One Not Five Minuttess','On a rainy night, Jaanu returns home after shopping, only to encounter strange and eerie happenings, questioning if there\'s an evil presence, presenting challenges that she must navigate to overcome the hurdles thrown her way.','/c4U7GfLmLtVxnZbweoSVza9VxBn.jpg','2024-01-26',109,'Released','What You Can\'t See Can Hurt You','One Not Five Minuttess',922636,0.9832,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28582,_binary '\0','/38W3ELhUprf0aTWyviRggCs1Jmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529233',6.6,2403,'it','Basilicata Coast To Coast','A musical comedy, a journey filled with unexpected twists and unexpected encounters, leading a group of musicians to set out to the rhythm of their musical verses to participate in the Scanzano Jonico Song-Theatre Festival, walking across Basilicata, from the Tyrrhenian to the Ionian Sea, along the route that gives the project its name. The journey will have a therapeutic effect.','/1jFrV9DPPS38jgYgyUFJXukMsAt.jpg','2010-04-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Basilicata Coast To Coast',43200,1.6071,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28583,_binary '\0','/o4f4gGWLFCYNLJhl2W5mXKHKnqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529235',6.6,11536,'it','Benvenuti al sud','Alberto, post office manager of a small town in Brianza, under pressure of his wife Sylvia, is willing to do anything to get the transfer to Milan. Even pretending to be disabled to climb in the ranking. But the trick does not work and as punishment, he is transferred in a small town in Campania, which to an inhabitant of the north is equivalent to a nightmare ...','/cyLKnz3q0Qz8RDZMbqt38l8nq68.jpg','2010-10-01',102,'Released','When you come to the South you cry twice: when you arrive and when you leave.','Welcome to the South',48415,2.9489,6.7,'AaN4Qo-Ocnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28584,_binary '\0','/o9oIYAREijFjp1IJ6BDFoXSbGC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529240',4.7,1708,'en','Brownian Movement','A psychiatrist\'s adulterous past continues to haunt her and her husband after they move to India.','/iImlVuS4iHLRx4Tl0OqvFeg1fkP.jpg','2010-11-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Brownian Movement',70761,1.8587,5.683,'s_JS3OGIYNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28585,_binary '\0','/fz1RkGqg2dd8W578ipSiDtlxkfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15292474',5.5,3308,'ta','ருத்ர தாண்டவம்','Rudran, a fearless cop who battles against drug mafia, gets trapped in a PCR (Protection of Civil Rights) case, unfortunately. Will he prove himself innocent?','/laGleOgbZxESGGzbWD70xnDgRul.jpg','2021-10-01',168,'Released',NULL,'Rudra Thandavam',875524,1.1293,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28586,_binary '\0','/7IhRGeVHTSAQmagWd8TUI1SEj6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529252',7.1,4130,'es','El hombre de al lado','When two neighbours clash, their argument becomes less about proposed building alterations and more about the wider battle between class and social status. The hugely impressive building in question is the only example of a Le Corbusier residential home in all of Latin America, adding to the poignancy of their argument.','/wMx6TUb9pltfRkj3YboYLxUL2Hp.jpg','2009-11-13',103,'Released',NULL,'The Man Next Door',47383,1.5325,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28587,_binary '\0','/o3yvz85NSGWkE9lontF9yYl27nJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15293256',6.9,2145,'en','The River Runner','Legendary kayaker Scott Lindgren attempts to complete an extreme, unprecedented whitewater expedition 20-years-in-the-making. When a brain tumor derails his goals, he sinks into the darkness of his own trauma only to discover that healing, like any expedition, is not a destination but a journey.','/qbc7Xq8vNdaYE0pacobmxBdxz6T.jpg','2021-08-25',86,'Released',NULL,'The River Runner',858054,4.5049,6.2,'CdLovewceng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28588,_binary '\0','/AdZjNz7jFhQt4BtaN8X1oo7jFBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529326',6.7,2246,'ar','سلام يا صاحبي','Two friends Marzouk and Barakat, work with street vendor Batta on her cart in the melon trade. Al-Gayiar who works in the trade of stolen cars admires them, they work with him till they become his competitors. He decides to get rid of them after they\'ve become a treat.','/qf9IAfUVnksSVLLIzsvPPuXWTH3.jpg','1986-06-07',129,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye My Friend',320997,1.1722,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28589,_binary '\0','/cNvaYDnGSfmOFi2yGnOmRIM5pce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15295368',6.1,4078,'kn','ಕೆಡಿ - ದಿ ಡೆವಿಲ್','In the early 1970s, a petty criminal Kaali unwittingly involves himself with underworld thugs, catalyzing events beyond his control.','/nEuEMJrnLBneE9tJlmzbhCFLu95.jpg','2026-04-30',141,'Released',NULL,'KD – The Devil',1103473,3.3659,5.3,'yQLKrS5N4KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28590,_binary '\0','/jI2gwnMCRMzkN6iBeDdQh2PH44E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529559',6,1276,'de','Hotel Lux','In 1938 Hans Zeisig, an apolitical comedian, impersonator and cabaret actor, flees with a Russian passport (instead of American, which he would have preferred) from Nazi-Berlin, and finds himself in the legendary Hotel Lux, the \'lost paradise\' of the Comintern, in Moscow. Everyone believes that Zeisig is a man named Hansen, Hitler\'s personal astrologer. But Zeisig quickly realizes that he\'s gone from the frying pan into the fire. In the Hotel Lux he meets his friends Frida and later Meyer again, still passionate communists. For the three idealists an adventure between love and death begins to run his course.','/pOrN7RADnZ9COqMQX9Cd9LMJVJ3.jpg','2011-10-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Hotel Lux',76175,0.9775,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28591,_binary '\0','/d187LYnwu7KzyPKgaQRnSWKrIbq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529569',6.4,7770,'fr','De vrais mensonges','A hairdresser forwards a passionate love letter to her widowed mother.','/s59yijelLaTRB17L9WTwY0UOn6l.jpg','2010-12-08',105,'Released','Love. Hard to find. Easy to fake.','Beautiful Lies',51072,2.1024,6.1,'ZHPr7uIO_uQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28592,_binary '\0','/iqrjewqeGYVrjxkVmmlL6DcgBT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1529572',6.8,46429,'en','Trust','A suburban family is torn apart when fourteen-year-old Annie meets her first boyfriend online. After months of communicating via online chat and phone, Annie discovers her friend is not who he originally claimed to be. Shocked into disbelief, her parents are shattered by their daughter\'s actions and struggle to support her as she comes to terms with what has happened to her once innocent life.','/rXoZYWd2G7pBh8N8Cp5ZO5Sjzbl.jpg','2010-09-10',104,'Released','What took her family years to build, a stranger stole in an instant.','Trust',44945,5.6291,6.556,'dIi3pOUY6xE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28593,_binary '\0','/y4eT4VDavpwuqEP7w1A2iOJUPah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15296186',5.8,3937,'ru','Мира','Near future. Lera Arabova is a 15-year-old girl who lives with her family in Vladivostok. Lera\'s father has been working at the orbiting space station \"Mira\" for many years and has long lost contact with his daughter, turning only into a voice on the phone. After a meteor shower hits the city, Lera has only one chance to save her loved ones and the city from a new disaster. Her father helps her in this - through satellite surveillance systems and the telephone, he uses every opportunity to send a message to his daughter, watching from above from the station her every step.','/mv2DFhsaLeNgFzNe2G5CJhzbrkt.jpg','2022-12-22',110,'Released','For a family, space is not a distance.','Mira',864101,5.2168,7.565,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28594,_binary '\0','/a3rp24lu7GiLIyBmoV5e4Crm9aI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15299406',4.6,1973,'hu','Hadik','During the Seven Years War, Austrian Queen Maria Theresa sends her best general, András Hadik and his Hussars to raid Berlin and humiliate the Prussian King, Frederick the Great.','/jTIz5dzgoCkYQW1Ty0WtsIi3nQN.jpg','2023-03-17',108,'Released','The most cavalryman of them all','Hadik',925615,2.0634,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28595,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 