bble gum factory uncover a secret alien mind control plot. Against all odds, the two are determined to save their town (and the world!)...that is if they don\'t drive each other crazy in the process.','/s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg','2024-08-01',91,'Released','To save the world, they\'ll have to stick together.','The Day the Earth Blew Up: A Looney Tunes Movie',870360,8.0109,7.5,'BtHUWHXfDyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28676,_binary '\0','/6oM1Im24YnH6RTmziatTIcxRRG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15353574',6.4,1616,'en','Hard Miles','A strong-willed social worker at a youth prison assembles a cycling team of teenage convicts and takes them on a transformative 1000-mile ride. Inspired by the life of Greg Townsend and the Ridgeview Academy Cycling Team. This is the story of how these troubled young men found another gear.','/pU50LpVZ7doTyJeC9JaqcbeH4ef.jpg','2024-04-19',109,'Released','Push to the limit.','Hard Miles',1009679,3.009,6.902,'VxwcSaXXAZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28677,_binary '\0','/dR78i8aMsa8wIuBiHGfU8K5gNL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15353964',5.7,19795,'en','Significant Other','Ruth and Harry decide to take a romantic backpacking trip through the Pacific Northwest, but amongst the beautiful scenery, Ruth makes an unexpected discovery that sets her off on a strange, frightening new path. The couple aren\'t alone in the woods, and they might not be the same when they come out...if they come out.','/liGvBdUsyOfiTJjNCD55JJfISzb.jpg','2022-10-06',85,'Released','Do you really know the one you love?','Significant Other',901385,4.3482,6.082,'A2ArvtpGtKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28678,_binary '\0','/lLw8BzClxm9ZIvHdxibGlmHUdcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535432',5.2,1258,'en','Crave','Aiden craves a better life. A life away from his gruesome job as a crime scene photographer, working alongside his detective friend Pete. A meaningful life where he can escape the hard streets of Detroit, fall in love with the perfect woman and save the world from evil. As Aiden\'s dark imagination starts to leak into reality, he meets Virginia, a younger woman with her own dilemmas and desires.','/wl17xkZK2ZDgr48wxam9BUp7I5M.jpg','2013-12-06',113,'Released','His imagination is a dangerous place to be.','Crave',91101,1.4178,4.4,'JiPFR7VoEoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28679,_binary '\0','/ivNDj0LuziOuz0ZivgA7sxHIi3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535438',6.3,46253,'en','Hope Springs','After thirty years of marriage, a middle-aged couple attends an intense, week-long counseling session to work on their relationship.','/mHEca5NntVHtUPfBiQ3ZVFBRixe.jpg','2012-08-07',100,'Released','Sometimes to keep the magic, you need to learn a few tricks.','Hope Springs',82696,6.0111,6.3,'tjymM95UWlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28680,_binary '\0','/bWgfjwdiU95YozlDHZyIEx1xA6Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535467',5.7,10182,'hi','Patiala House','Parghat Singh \'Gattu\' Kahlon is a middle aged shopkeeper who secretly practices bowling at night in order to keep his dream of playing for England alive. Even though his family members despise him for giving up his dreams only due to his father\'s wish, they find a ray of hope and convince him to play for England while they plan to hide the truth from his father.','/16Q863XEtms2HH8LaCZQmp3tRoz.jpg','2011-01-28',140,'Released',NULL,'Patiala House',53299,1.3159,6.022,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28681,_binary '\0','/r6K1nvEyBIwqfht1EAc9rpthyFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535491',6.9,4645,'ko','의형제','Two spies share a secret bond, despite their loyalties. A North Korean assassin is sent to Seoul to kill a dissident, but instead he teams up with a South Korean agent in search for revenge.','/uLU1Gwq8xLUjBax2JI4G2JC85ML.jpg','2010-02-04',117,'Released','North korean spy vs south korean intelligence officer.','Secret Reunion',50090,2.952,6.44,'WKKx5rG5mSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28682,_binary '\0','/5LtSjMNw6j3LkG29Oa4O0iY5U8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15354916',6.9,112783,'hi','जवान','An emotional journey of a prison warden, driven by a personal vendetta while keeping up to a promise made years ago, recruits inmates to commit outrageous crimes that shed light on corruption and injustice, in an attempt to get even with his past, and that leads him to an unexpected reunion.','/jFt1gS4BGHlK8xt76Y81Alp4dbt.jpg','2023-09-07',169,'Released',NULL,'Jawan',872906,8.137,7.04,'MWOlnZSnXJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28683,_binary '\0','/sufFmNogYfm6Kj7sdvlfLSRFEWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535492',6.7,2292,'cn','綫人','Policeman Don often works with informants but numerous too-close calls and failed missions cause him to see the world as one betrayal after another. Then, he meets Ghost, Jr, and is given a new chance to change his views.','/yWZJOHIOy3osra6fwX8RpzFKFtu.jpg','2010-08-26',113,'Released',NULL,'The Stool Pigeon',48417,2.3166,5.9,'OdfNQ3375T4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28684,_binary '\0','/6TnfTPOjZTY0fqzCUvpolVZCCYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535495',6.2,1685,'cn','鎗王之王','Champion competitive marksman Ken comes across an armored van robbery. He sees a policeman held hostage and shoots and kills four of the robbers. One of the robbers escapes and the policeman survives. The case is handled by Jerry Chang, whom Ken knows from having recently beaten him in a shooting match. Ken is found not guilty in court. Soon after, Ken is attacked by the escaped robber Pang Tao. Their confrontation reveals a very different background story and brings about a myriad of lies and traps and changes in relationships as Jerry and Ken try to outsmart each other.','/lbadh24XaGEdqmxNVqIsyuRbqd0.jpg','2010-06-30',117,'Released','A cop makes it his mission to bring down a media hero who has masterminded his own fate.','Triple Tap',44245,2.4772,6.474,'ee7EBuGgJ6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28685,_binary '\0','/5WhLV7bYhn8TaukEtIK6WL39ict.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535565',5.8,2621,'en','Lying to Be Perfect','Nola Devlin is an unassuming, frumpy magazine editor who is overlooked and teased by her coworkers. Though, when she is behind the glow and anonymity of her computer screen, she becomes the famous advice columnist Belinda Apple. Nola’s friends, tired of being overworked and overweight, band together to create the Cinderella Pact, vowing to lose pounds by following the advice of Belinda Apple. When her secret identity is threatened, Nola is forced to take her own alter ego’s advice. But, as the group of friends drops dress sizes, their real issues are exposed, and better-than-expected life changes begin to blossom.','/bS8rba4By9UqGQ5EtiO7VWhBM7M.jpg','2010-06-07',89,'Released',NULL,'Lying to Be Perfect',70076,2.9955,6.1,'XRxf8gB2i-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28686,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535566',5.1,1839,'en','The Bleeding House','The Smiths -- a family with a secret past -- are visited by a sweet-talking southern gentleman who is looking for small town humanity. But they\'ll soon find out that kindness towards strangers is not always rewarded, and the secretive stranger will find redemption does not always come easy.','/vGjZZ3yiSwdRhrNUjFGWnjNM2uu.jpg','2011-04-20',85,'Released','Grace Will Come To You','The Bleeding House',45347,1.213,5.1,'G0uLJtXxFOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28687,_binary '\0','/veltKlTm4Aj4PXve6lNmY6mRvG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535608',3.6,1251,'en','Monsterwolf','A creature of ancient legend manifests, bound to protect the ecological balance of the land and killing anyone that threatens it. This elusive guardian is initially both feared and celebrated by the locals, but when a deadly curse affects them all, they must unite and recapture the monster wolf’s spirit or face their ultimate doom.','/kJuGPV337ojSvJDmfI33358GcYO.jpg','2010-10-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Monsterwolf',57173,1.5394,3.7,'guhR6NuHHbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28688,_binary '\0','/vJ1MWvrJmupJFDrXHlbxRYJg2ZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535612',5.1,18735,'en','The Son of No One','A rookie cop is assigned to the 118 Precinct in the same district where he grew up. The Precinct Captain starts receiving letters about two unsolved murders that happened many years ago in the housing projects when the rookie cop was just a kid. These letters bring back bad memories and old secrets that begin to threaten his career and break up his family.','/koxJAJTPTKzMxKu3vVhPvoZc4w6.jpg','2011-11-04',90,'Released','Serve. Protect. Lie.','The Son of No One',74536,5.2495,5.1,'7U9OslXVjdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28689,_binary '\0','/f1IVSld55kUXJjXUUhMYOiMAOJX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535615',5.7,2519,'en','Best Player','After his parents decide to move to a retirement home in Florida, professional gamer Quincy “Q” Johnson (Jerry Trainor) must find a way to raise 175,000 dollars to buy his family home. After hearing about a tournament for the game “Black Hole” with a grand prize of 175,500 dollars, Quincy enters the tournament, only to be faced with a new challenge. An equally skilled gamer, named Chris Saunders “Prodigy” (Jeanette McCurdy), has become the one block in Quincy’s plan, defeating him at every turn. Quincy then teams-up with his friend Wendell (Amir Talai), to try and find ways to stop Chris from entering the tournament.','/hIVXQM0X4rawgKa6VFPb84NBqKX.jpg','2011-03-12',89,'Released','Do you have what it takes to be the best?','Best Player',60089,2.5996,6.617,'wLd_6RE7O58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28690,_binary '\0','/sFtBsQVPZdR13MQh36Npfx9m9Lw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535616',5.7,40646,'en','The Divide','Survivors of a nuclear attack are grouped together for days in the basement of their apartment building, where fear and dwindling supplies wear away at their dynamic.','/hnwX5cUuzBDM0OWJB2UtnjkrHDm.jpg','2012-01-13',122,'Released','The lucky ones died in the blast','The Divide',38541,4.3573,5.888,'YlMT5Js8Fa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28691,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535617',4.5,1447,'en','The Possession of David O\'Reilly','A supernatural shockumentary about a demonic presence in a young couple\'s home in London.','/nQyDW6TbCIXZsNIHfbSiINI25cN.jpg','2010-05-10',87,'Released',NULL,'The Possession of David O\'Reilly',49847,1.1087,4.7,'zF3XrzI9ROA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28692,_binary '\0','/9IbNkKwPo0lC2tZQMs8WwwY3izv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15358226',5.4,2128,'en','New York Ninja','A sound technician\'s pregnant wife is brutally murdered while witnessing a kidnapping in broad daylight. Dressing as a white ninja, he takes to the streets as a sword-wielding vigilante hell bent on cleaning up the streets of New York City.','/1oXECgPkTPx98EZWcaCpHH3Rdhv.jpg','2021-10-02',93,'Released',NULL,'New York Ninja',870219,1.7625,4.9,'X1wMt3fgOyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28693,_binary '\0','/fWOfr0L1ISpP3KF8qY2qG1qrxMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1535970',6.5,21240,'en','The Ledge','A thriller in which a battle of philosophies between a fundamentalist Christian and an atheist who shares an apartment with a gay friend escalates into a lethal battle of wills.','/cTaDS6CTIfZ5MH189ub6oE1FATk.jpg','2011-05-06',101,'Released','One life. One chance. One step.','The Ledge',63493,5.8317,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28694,_binary '\0','/1Re7Q0qUgTWLBGP547yc8zKK5Sd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15360384',4.2,1458,'en','Girl at the Window','A troubled teenage girl who’s struggling to cope with the accidental death of her father suspects that the mysterious killer stalking her hometown is not only her neighbour but her mother’s new romantic interest.','/5k5E5NMhoMOv0QY5PsvixOm0maU.jpg','2022-08-18',84,'Released','Danger is closer than you think.','Girl at the Window',985335,3.6283,5.7,'X8RJH1ELHBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28695,_binary '\0','/lcw9r76AzazaUxRWVgC7YSPA4ua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1536044',5.7,116662,'en','Paranormal Activity 2','Just as Daniel and Kristi welcome a newborn baby into their home, a demonic presence begins terrorizing them, tearing apart their perfect world and turning it into an inescapable nightmare.','/gfdrkBZAyUUXJJ2iLQe03SAYRD3.jpg','2010-10-20',91,'Released','In 2009 you demanded it. Nothing can prepare you for what\'s next.','Paranormal Activity 2',41436,5.3764,5.8,'ftD6rIAR-Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28696,_binary '\0','/8R82TxhOmIOtkxl4SXeRyylpvJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1536048',6.2,14213,'en','W.E.','In 1998, an auction of the estate of the Duke and Duchess of Windsor causes great excitement. For one woman, Wally Winthrop, it has much more meaning. Wally becomes obsessed by their historic love story. As she learns more about the sacrifices involved, Wally gains her own courage to find happiness.','/natLuO7NcStRln1vFWLqIYUKGwX.jpg','2011-09-01',119,'Released','Their affair ignited a scandal. Their passion brought down an empire.','W.E.',80591,3.4524,6.3,'ql8AtTM7blg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28697,_binary '\0','/347pJmCLkuFwA0NqTrNVwBL9wNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15360916',5.4,1740,'de','Du Sie Er & Wir','After their partner swap experiment takes a turn, four friends arrive at a remote beach hut to face the fallout and purge themselves of deeper truths.','/yAlmGXeAtc7ejp2G1V3qT4mATlb.jpg','2021-10-15',88,'Released',NULL,'The Four of Us',874965,2.2112,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28698,_binary '\0','/xkv7oPAlCZAkrorPLqKtDGjaIYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15361028',6.6,7922,'hi','जलसा','A hit and run of an 18-year-old girl becomes the hub of a wheel that sets into motion many a spoke - a journalist, a raging mother, a cop and a system all caught in an ethical dilemma. Questions are raised only to realize that the truth is rarely pure and never simple.','/h7lazOfbemCtX7ZZYnqmZx4IHxD.jpg','2022-03-18',127,'Released','If we tell you the truth, you\'d want to hear a lie','Jalsa',944410,1.1974,6.258,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28699,_binary '\0','/6eW2CUeKQvEhyJQL8zaotCjTvwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15361954',8.3,3031,'bn','পুনর্জন্ম','Rafsan Haq is a famous chef of Bangladesh. After disappearing for three years, one day his wife Neela suddenly shows up in a local police station. Everyone around Rafsan including the police became skeptical of this miraculous event and started doubting Neela\'s identity. What will Rafsan do now? Accept the love of his life or doubt her?','/mnPEFDN6hb41I536OY8DHdFJ5lN.jpg','2021-07-25',60,'Released','A mysterious disappearance, a mysterious replacement. And ?','Punorjonmo',1007938,1.2215,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28700,_binary '\0','/eL05IPWMWl4EzFMwej2vd5vwV9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1536410',5.7,21089,'en','Faces in the Crowd','Anna is living with \"face-blindness\" after surviving a serial killer\'s attack. As she lives with her condition, one in which facial features change each time she loses sight of them, the killer closes in.','/A3EtPBwTZe1Dfx1xvjCtReUxDsD.jpg','2011-10-25',102,'Released','She saw the killer\'s face, but it keeps changing...','Faces in the Crowd',70577,5.4415,6.1,'xNf5ja-p_ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28701,_binary '\0','/cjWXBvA7DnaYjQHCG6yaL1ZTkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1536437',5.6,3325,'en','Rushlights','Young lovers Billy and Sarah journey from L.A. to Texas with plans to make a false claim to the valuable assets left behind by a dead friend. But when their voyage brings them to Tremo, Texas, they find a bizarre and sinister world awaiting them.','/AcnDFEeeNfP7pZSp11xQLoHsrNY.jpg','2013-06-21',96,'Released','All is fair in love and murder.','Rushlights',191824,2.1247,4.8,'VuaIND_zJkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28702,_binary '\0','/uq20mJoPPSzpOYQCxX51DsQLL85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15364972',6.2,13483,'en','Sanctuary','Confined to a claustrophobic hotel room, the heir to a hotel empire and the dominatrix who has primed him for success become locked in a battle of wits and wills as he tries to end his relationship with her.','/yGQAZupyZgT2ESbBSMZ9R0OBToo.jpg','2023-03-02',96,'Released','His game. Her rules.','Sanctuary',870518,3.6696,6.099,'EaMahhnZMog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28703,_binary '\0','/j7ij93mtHXAF8D3PjRSEaKPHpIE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1536537',6.8,146277,'en','What Happened to Monday','In a world where families are limited to one child due to overpopulation, a set of identical septuplets must avoid being put to a long sleep by the government and dangerous infighting while investigating the disappearance of one of their own.','/atOgZMJpMrTdpqvPiHVPfBhR61l.jpg','2017-08-18',123,'Released','Seven sisters. One identity.','What Happened to Monday',406990,8.9924,7.1,'idZPTuwcMJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28704,_binary '\0','/xsObcvHvomdBVEbxCiq1cG1e5OV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15367558',4.7,1231,'en','Daddy Daughter Trip','A 2nd grader dreams of a fun-filled spring break vacation—but her family can’t afford it. Against the better judgement of her mother, and with only coins in their pockets, her dreamer father decides to take her on a spring break trip anyway.','/pehdaRuVzeN3TwSI1ssvEl80LM3.jpg','2022-09-30',100,'Released','He\'ll give her the spring break of a lifetime...even if it kills him.','Daddy Daughter Trip',848367,2.1297,6.9,'x-R5kUYPJEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28705,_binary '\0','/8M0TMmC7AGrulTZPcT6GXD3ps5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1537032',5.2,2301,'ta','கந்தசாமி','A CBI officer moonlights as a modern day Robin Hood in the guise of the masked Kanthaswamy, as he helps fight corruption and aid impoverished people.','/sH1X4a8B6LDeXtchcKnd51F2HcR.jpg','2009-08-21',190,'Released',NULL,'Kanthaswamy',25120,1.971,4.816,'WaREfo5-aBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28706,_binary '\0','/11cylDjePKAAGX0AxjBqeUAIaA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15373558',5.9,1289,'ml','ഡിയർ ഫ്രണ്ട്','Vinod, Shyam, Arjun, Sajith and Jannath are friends residing in Bengaluru. They live, eat and party together and share a beautiful bond. At times, they pull brutal pranks on their besties like that of making one wear a funny superhero costume on their birthday night and taking him to the pub. Will these pranks become serious or will it remain laugh it out loud?','/sdAUrGwJQwlUVAI4eXDwQZd40h8.jpg','2022-06-10',117,'Released',NULL,'Dear Friend',870832,0.8672,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28707,_binary '\0','/9wML6jkfn9dK0ZERPQIzRanE9vx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15373594',7.4,2004,'te','అశోక వనంలో అర్జున కళ్యాణం','Arjun, a small time money lender, is potbellied, thirty-plus guy under pressure to get married. After a lot of struggle, He finally finds a match in Madhavi and is all set to get married. When Arjun is forced to stay with Madhavi’s family due to the lock-down, and Just as he starts dreaming about a happy marital life with her, he discovers that Madhavi may not be interested in him.','/x4aHU1Xi3TtlKhnwXEsACBD42Ns.jpg','2022-05-06',149,'Released',NULL,'Ashoka Vanamlo Arjuna Kalyanam',967796,1.1633,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28708,_binary '\0','/fUTaU53LRWuxiCju6z0ndYzVpkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15373762',6.9,1261,'te','Case 30','A murder case has been assigned to Crime Branch Officer Arjun Bharadwaj. How Arjun investigates and unthreads the case is the rest of the story.','/osX3IDO2ezLLzJCBZY3xpp4eivC.jpg','2023-10-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Case 30',1194954,0.9802,0,'K8uD-nPBfp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28709,_binary '\0','/srVCG7w7JFcoqLlJe2NLgWN1MJr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15373868',5,10789,'kn','ಕ್ರಾಂತಿ','Kranti Rayanna, a business tycoon in Europe is invited by his favorite teacher to attend the Centenary celebrations of the school. Kranti begins a revolution and takes the fight on with Salatri Group trying to takeover 12,000 government schools and privatize them.','/sQSUpdPwzby0c6hG5ViN3iQnchx.jpg','2023-01-26',163,'Released','Learn to Fight Alone','Kranti',1030157,1.1254,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28710,_binary '\0','/agfI8NZQGf13WD0ZaOwozjvWwDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1537401',5.8,3115,'es','Año bisiesto','Journalist Laura works at home, isolating herself from others. While she lies to her mother and brother, Raul, on the phone about having an active social life, Laura\'s days consist of gazing at her neighbors, eating canned food and going to clubs to bring home strangers. As the anniversary of her father\'s death draws near, Laura develops a relationship with Arturo, a charismatic actor who shares her taste for rough sex.','/mpqI90MK7aI5RP5uvDr7gKHyCJ4.jpg','2010-05-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Leap Year',63555,1.6745,6.4,'ElQjvJcUIuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28711,_binary '\0','/ppNyhrKHCeEgASliV4QN03bp6QR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15374070',5.6,17188,'en','Studio 666','Legendary rock band Foo Fighters move into an Encino mansion steeped in grisly rock and roll history to record their much anticipated 10th album. Once in the house, Dave Grohl finds himself grappling with supernatural forces that threaten both the completion of the album and the lives of the band.','/zD2XyaV6eGEEgEzVnjg0hQVR5yz.jpg','2022-02-24',106,'Released','He gives new meaning to a killer track.','Studio 666',895744,6.4623,5.8,'UEDkqOBhPis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28712,_binary '\0','/aX1VH6SowCM3IezI09VqZjIuWiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15376894',6.7,6463,'fr','Saint Omer','A novelist attends the trial of a woman accused of killing her 15-month-old daughter by abandoning her to the rising tide on a beach in northern France. But as the trial continues, her own family history, doubts, and fears about motherhood are steadily dislodged as the life story of the accused is gradually revealed.','/43YbWCYPKcSmZ1L9NiVv19np2mT.jpg','2022-11-23',123,'Released',NULL,'Saint Omer',925943,2.8998,6.147,'9U2qIKH3cYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28713,_binary '\0','/3WPo7p2xIy2yvjT29S7CpnQwROE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1537715',5.9,2644,'tr','Abimm','Çetin is greedy. Years later upon his father\'s death he returns home. He begins a new friendship with his mentally disabled brother Arif.','/cfpMIQtczioH74CnyTL4Nx0J17u.jpg','2009-12-04',108,'Released',NULL,'Abimm',52089,0.6984,5.7,'WS9w9c0t3Rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28714,_binary '\0','/2MG1NLxWaA3IDWJMhCf1W25QR6j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1537717',5.2,2200,'tr','Acı Aşk','Orhan, who works as a literature professor at a university in Eskisehir, unexpectedly ends his relationship with Ayse whom he was planning to marry, and comes to Istanbul where he meets Oya. After living possibly the happiest days of his life with Oya, who is a photographer, Orhan finds himself in the midst of a challenging love triangle as a result of the horrible things they encounter the first days of their marriage.','/jFOsxJ6cQ8H4LvnOhhGl4IGct9m.jpg','2009-12-18',92,'Released',NULL,'Love, Bitter',35173,1.4752,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28715,_binary '\0','/aJYvtozh2KilTiTGVMSq6RoKQxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1537772',4.7,1895,'tr','Gecenin Kanatları','After losing her parents during a police raid at an early age, Grace is pledged to become a suicide bomber, but she falls in love.','/kK4U3tZMe26UJsASPeWoUfOqBhS.jpg','2009-12-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Wings of the Night',52183,1.6814,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28716,_binary '\0','/dqHMO9idekVfwFGCpMBcAzq5gjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15380500',5.5,5977,'ta','வாஸ்கோடகாமா','In a dystopian world where good is bad and bad is good, an honest man is sent to a bizarre prison.','/qYOdDztFRDumlUObHyv4csKytXT.jpg','2024-08-02',125,'Released',NULL,'Vasco Da Gama',926027,0.6754,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28717,_binary '\0','/vu6XHwIR3pIsXzB3vcZ3epxTFmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15380516',7,1558,'ta','மின்மினி','When Praveenah arrives at a boarding school in Ooty, she discovers that her classmate Sabari is haunted by the crushing weight of survivor\'s guilt. Years later, their paths converge again on a thrilling Himalayan biking adventure, where Praveenah sets out to help Sabari confront his demons and find redemption from the suffocating grip of guilt.','/haY7lrwLHN3Nai2BdUy0JLsknvX.jpg','2024-08-09',143,'Released',NULL,'Minmini',1321874,0.8055,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28718,_binary '\0','/r9GXAvybRDx613LzNRnZAPJyjrI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15380608',6.7,8794,'kn','ಬಘೀರ','Dismayed by corruption and violence, a virtuous police officer becomes a masked vigilante to dliver lethal justice to criminals and crooked cops alike.','/oW3iHFiXpfRXXQJiSXScNFEBf7h.jpg','2024-10-31',158,'Released',NULL,'Bagheera',777292,1.4425,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28719,_binary '\0','/iPTB7IFqxC1qG1rU5hQDxbzLQAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15380630',5.4,8895,'te','ఖుషి','Worlds and families collide when the son of a prominent atheist falls head over heels for the daughter of his father’s nemesis, a revered Hindu leader.','/tiEnkpOarH20cCSikeLiWlvY1We.jpg','2023-08-31',163,'Released',NULL,'Kushi',965489,2.0634,4.8,'bk_5n4mS-lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28720,_binary '\0','/8byxFCldQ2PEXKP9eF41X2Lgcjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1538401',6.8,2639,'ja','天使の恋','A cold and calculating high school student falls in love for the first time with a professor, but he\'s dying of brain cancer.','/z6ZIjEs81jJp2CleidgPsfLq1eA.jpg','2009-11-07',119,'Released',NULL,'My Rainy Days',43635,2.5999,7.406,'VM5f3NLep5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28721,_binary '\0','/z4nKeZpPCrTifS6pzzK8vNleADl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1538403',5.8,144602,'en','The Mortal Instruments: City of Bones','In New York City, Clary Fray, a seemingly ordinary teenager, learns that she is descended from a line of Shadowhunters — half-angel warriors who protect humanity from evil forces. After her mother disappears, Clary joins forces with a group of Shadowhunters and enters Downworld, an alternate realm filled with demons, vampires, and a host of other creatures. Clary and her companions must find and protect an ancient cup that holds the key to her mother\'s future.','/fspW2P3ggzBjdIw5HpJOw8HKtQK.jpg','2013-08-21',130,'Released','There is a world hidden within our own.','The Mortal Instruments: City of Bones',123553,13.2267,6.421,'RbA0ufF5A8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28722,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15387160',6,1278,'te','డేగల బాబ్జి','Babji is a murder suspect who also is an emotionally unstable man. He describes the modes operandi behind the crime he committed that eventually helps the cops disclose unfolded facts.','/5BCyQgz2n1LKdp6f4015CUjooC6.jpg','2022-05-20',119,'Released',NULL,'Degala Babji',1020480,1.0579,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28723,_binary '\0','/805aMQucnpLkSmQ35Pql35fq3Gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15387182',5.3,4963,'te','అఖండ 2: తాండవం','When all hope died, Akhanda arrived. He saved his family, protected his people, killed the wrongdoers, and retreated into isolation. But years later, new threats emerge putting the world in danger. And as the world burns, Akhanda returns.','/jo9efbQSGDZNQ6xMocyD1prFjdF.jpg','2025-12-12',164,'Released',NULL,'Akhanda 2: Thaandavam',1372588,2.5878,5.824,'2mt6f8rIEi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28724,_binary '\0','/7rNebkik5O2YLluU6xS2YJqXTAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15387190',4.8,6769,'te','వీరసింహారెడ్డి','Jai Simha Reddy, a businessman in Turkey and doting son of Meenakshi falls in love with Eesha. On the verge of his marriage, Jai comes to know the secret about his father Veera Simha Reddy who comes to Turkey to settle the marriage, which is when Jai meets his father for the first time. Things take a drastic turn around when Veera\'s past follows him to Turkey.','/4xBFmIiIqbzEes6Nnh27Q1jOKBa.jpg','2023-01-12',172,'Released','God of Masses','Veera Simha Reddy',896669,1.2712,4.32,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28725,_binary '\0','/qfKW6LUZVI49i4lDiA4HNBLeP01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1538819',6.5,5918,'tr','Ejder Kapanı','When a serial killer goes after former convicted pedophiles, it is up to Police Commissioner Abbas and his Chief Celal to stop the killings.','/8Vc2NOLXo08T3VvrafLP4QLu28d.jpg','2010-01-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Trap',35963,0.9637,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28726,_binary '\0','/3dfqQHaM2zfuX3bfqgp4aF4c6Xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15388610',7.1,3252,'en','Zoey\'s Extraordinary Christmas','On her first holiday without her father, Zoey attempts to create a magical Christmas for her family just like the ones Mitch used to do.','/wDuQ4pX2FZe3tYdR4urm1HgGyXy.jpg','2021-12-01',99,'Released','Start the holidays on a high note.','Zoey\'s Extraordinary Christmas',872130,2.8714,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28727,_binary '\0','/sg2iCpfERyX4xyqZipfvNqSAHbx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15389042',6.7,1275,'fr','La Nouvelle Femme','Set in 1900, Lili d’Alengy, a Parisian cocotte at the height of her fame, flees Paris to hide her “idiot” daughter. There she meets Maria Montessori, who is pioneering a teaching method that may help the child.','/zonDvNfq4UPqHMB7NlnHnpYcj0B.jpg','2023-11-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Maria Montessori',959395,3.0418,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28728,_binary '\0','/zXfvBmeLjifVSOLOtFCK72N65KT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15391274',4.8,1586,'en','Dr. Jason','Invited by a desperate woman the psychiatrist and ex military Nik Jason tries to help her demonic possessed sister and gets into a deadly hell trip of a parallel world.','/vTm0xKP1OC4enLGueMLddAeFsEN.jpg','2022-01-27',48,'Released','Save one soul to save the world','Dr. Jason',1503002,1.8674,5,'2oxJvw5VDOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28729,_binary '\0','/i6u0xPuFLAxdELBxUit75fyBqlq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15391770',4.3,5814,'en','Corrective Measures','Set in San Tiburon, the world\'s most dangerous maximum-security penitentiary and home to the world\'s most treacherous superpowered criminals, where tensions among the inmates and staff heighten, leading to anarchy that engulfs the prison and order is turned upside down.','/aHFq9NMhavOL0jtQvmHQ1c5e0ya.jpg','2022-04-29',106,'Released','Anarchy in the world\'s most dangerous prison.','Corrective Measures',872177,4.2862,5,'UTgjyRGwTRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28730,_binary '\0','/2NoZ64w4bxzzbu2uGqI9aMpy0z6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15392282',6.9,30768,'hi','मेरी क्रिसमस','A Christmas Eve encounter between two enigmatic strangers sparks a poignant connection - but a dark turn of events threatens to expose their murky past.','/xzzny20uTtIit2VnxSdAFKcOFmU.jpg','2024-01-12',143,'Released','Raat jitni sangeen hogi, subah utni rangeen hogi','Merry Christmas',890116,1.532,6.825,'EK4o81P5Lrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28731,_binary '\0','/h6aHPd0cZ3H8s9ET7G4DRP0FuKO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1539325',6.6,1532,'da','Sandheden om mænd','Mads moves into a house with his lovely girlfriend Marie when a sudden pang of doubt strikes him. Is this the meaning of life? Has he lived out all his dreams? He drops everything, moves away from his girlfriend and throws himself into a desperate quest to live out his greatest dreams; a quest to find the meaning of life and the one and only.','/8uPhVLwLwA4nyAQPr2KHdRo52Ub.jpg','2010-10-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Truth About Men',61624,1.4959,6,'rcEh1zCnwQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28732,_binary '\0','/mUH59Wlch6uRtiuv3YAi81XAMqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15393650',6.3,3757,'fi','Sorjonen: Muraalimurhat','A mural painted with blood is found on the wall of Pasila train station, which depicts Finland\'s best-known serial killer Lasse Maasalo. The text in the mural, “Making the world a better place”, is linked to a voting circulating in social media, where people can vote for persons that world would be a better place without. Soon the first body is found and Sorjonen must find the person who has named himself as The Judge.','/g24OiKp3k9b3VzrhCNcaQzHhZ60.jpg','2021-10-27',107,'Released',NULL,'Bordertown: The Mural Murders',716810,1.9906,6.63,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28733,_binary '\0','/yF3LqCRad6OWexlFhwxu9Vm1SZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15393652',7,3167,'de','Eismayer','Vice Lieutenant Eismayer is the most feared trainer and model macho in the Austrian Military and lives as a gay man in secret. When he falls in love with a young, openly gay soldier, his world gets turned upside down.','/ev4BO0x9ZWredBp4xqPiKxkHmB4.jpg','2022-10-28',87,'Released',NULL,'Eismayer',936362,1.8276,7,'0YJRj9jREu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28734,_binary '\0','/2RmFdep76gJKPQFcbPgfkcobdQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15397918',3.3,2349,'en','Game of Love','Follows Vivien and Roy as their love story continues and leads them to Roy’s childhood home in Sicily to prepare for the sale of the family estate. During the visit, a mysterious woman arrives and befriends Vivien, much to Roy’s displeasure. Tensions build and lines are crossed as secrets from Roy’s past force the couple to face aspects of their relationship they did not know existed.','/slLGOl6rTiMVySAYesYUFnJaaTf.jpg','2022-10-14',91,'Released',NULL,'Game of Love',888479,2.8946,6.128,'lWtiIeQMZ_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28735,_binary '\0','/qHPd5T4huGl8FZqBNq7Ljk7lE0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15397946',6.9,1630,'en','One December Night','Two music managers must put their history aside to oversee the televised reunion performance of their rock star fathers with a fractured past.','/jtzju1ZyZOEC6Vr29zqYaxfJAhr.jpg','2021-11-13',84,'Released','Families rocks.','One December Night',876444,2.4752,6.4,'VmA4Ny3yjy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28736,_binary '\0','/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15398776',8.2,1097537,'en','Oppenheimer','The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer\'s role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.','/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg','2023-07-19',181,'Released','The world forever changes.','Oppenheimer',872585,44.7034,8.023,'bK6ldnjE3Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28737,_binary '\0','/hoDsLazRKfUbzGpQFlHMlO4mAQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15399286',6.9,1881,'en','Lynch/Oz','Victor Fleming’s 1939 film The Wizard of Oz is one of David Lynch’s most enduring obsessions. This documentary goes over the rainbow to explore this Technicolor through-line in Lynch’s work.','/utMuIiigJPVQZXvpkyGL1mPw9Ib.jpg','2023-05-15',108,'Released',NULL,'Lynch/Oz',965400,1.8234,6.9,'ktEzqafTCds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28738,_binary '\0','/rkUAAoBXsqlegp8bLTLZSIsRZbg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15399372',7,2839,'es','Los reyes del mundo','Rá, Culebro, Sere, Winny and Nano. Five boys who live on the streets of Medellín. Five kings with no kingdom, no law, no family, set out on a journey in search of the promised land. A subversive tale told through a wild and endearing clan, somewhere between reality and delirium. A journey to nowhere, where everything happens.','/iK46b6jYIKvaakp7qKt0BKexN53.jpg','2022-10-13',111,'Released',NULL,'The Kings of the World',848112,2.0284,7.561,'9Rff5RbkHRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28739,_binary '\0','/7Vu0N2sLPfUWRjZau4XWs6PYovC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15399616',5.9,2424,'ml','ആയിഷ','Ayisha, migrates to the gulf as a domestic worker to an elite Arab family. slowly learns all the palace etiquettes. Interesting courses of events lead to the bloom of a beautiful bond between mama and ayisha','/3LQ8HwPAl3JpaqKSnVFgtbTxzhj.jpg','2023-01-20',153,'Released',NULL,'Ayisha',872659,0.7731,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28740,_binary '\0','/gXT8qeEr9xg3eRsYXwyrYtWyeLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1539997',7.4,1261,'ml','കേരള കഫെ','Ten interconnected short stories unfolding around a roadside railway café in Kerala, where travelers from diverse backgrounds pass through, their lives briefly intersecting amid themes of migration, relationships and modern struggles.','/iHocGERTmGi1eLfmKyow8PTtvLe.jpg','2009-10-12',140,'Released',NULL,'Kerala Cafe',85089,1.5174,6.729,'pBz_NLo2nf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28741,_binary '\0','/nxV0sjZYkIi8ywcfXn2RAreUAfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540005',4.4,1767,'en','CLONED: The Recreator Chronicles','When a group of teenagers stumble upon a secret lab, they become part of a deadly experiment - The Recreator - evil human clones. Craig, Tracy and Derek come face to face with exact copies of themselves that have only one purpose; to find and kill their originals. With time running out it\'s up to the original group to destroy the lab and save themselves before they are replaced. Gregory Orr\'s exciting thriller brings science fiction to life with a sexy edge.','/tDMjcYqsLtUVoBnTNozRrBI2sna.jpg','2012-02-16',91,'Released','You Will Be Replaced','CLONED: The Recreator Chronicles',127594,2.0854,4.8,'mqWGEkyr0RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28742,_binary '\0','/vFktlnv1cEKeyCuSLd02DVNUoRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540011',5,54175,'en','Blair Witch','Students on a camping trip discover something sinister is lurking beyond the trees.','/Ai73frMEz68bibFGRlPKdWBaIaq.jpg','2016-09-15',89,'Released','There\'s something evil hiding in the woods.','Blair Witch',351211,6.0951,5.25,'girSv9UH_V8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28743,_binary '\0','/n1hONNc8eGBti9N7YhSwBwPkujl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540128',5.7,32461,'en','Playing for Keeps','A former sports star who\'s fallen on hard times starts coaching his son\'s soccer team in an attempt to get his life together.','/jYv6MqOoAIpxZd6ydJ4S5S2QHDZ.jpg','2012-11-29',106,'Released','This holiday season, what do you really want?','Playing for Keeps',77875,5.2209,5.6,'musnXxhyxik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28744,_binary '\0','/aCSsQrr6QoSFFNlBElLWzR3Z51c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540133',7.3,102433,'en','The Guard','When a small-town Irish cop with a crass personality is partnered with a straight-laced FBI agent to bust an international drug-trafficking ring, they must settle their differences in order to take down a dangerous gang.','/dtQiStID0le2EMTmJXupPRybARB.jpg','2011-07-07',96,'Released','The FBI are about to discover that things work a little differently around here.','The Guard',67913,4.9793,6.973,'ey9GJC53VQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28745,_binary '\0','/3csHLy1FZ3WlMTGnD6OTbGxiaWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15403362',6.3,1747,'de','Der Passfälscher','Jewish aesthete Cioma, 21, does not let anyone take away his joy of life, especially not the Nazis. In 1942, he has to find new ways to make his living in Berlin and escape deportation. In the process he discovers his talent for forgery: not only with passports, but also his own identity.','/iJmVqG9y156lRObOEIAOnAEnAnz.jpg','2022-10-13',116,'Released',NULL,'The Forger',916386,2.223,6.2,'ggRS4sAkIz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28746,_binary '\0','/9eIzy76swY4DnVWfmOsA689sjgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15403712',6.8,3700,'fr','Les Enfants des autres','Rachel loves her life, her students, her friends, her ex, her guitar lessons. When she falls in love with Ali, she grows close to his 4-year-old daughter, Leila. She tucks her in, looks after her, and loves her like a mother... which she isn’t. Not yet. Rachel is 40. The desire for a family of her own is growing stronger, and the clock is ticking. Is it too late?','/5oDu0n0vc7D3t3RhxHDrT0Ezcoa.jpg','2022-09-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Other People\'s Children',803694,3.8328,6.7,'qT4So01MJL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28747,_binary '\0','/v1Tgmy58GLW5ChAp93kbu3CtprO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15403980',6.6,2225,'en','A Very Merry Bridesmaid','Leah\'s 30th birthday is on Christmas Eve, the same day as her brother\'s wedding. Her childhood crush is back in town for the wedding and he is determined to make sure her birthday does not go by the wayside.','/yGQIre0Q9TVf9sjMNUZ1FNzfkNI.jpg','2021-12-04',84,'Released','There are all kinds of ways to make a perfect day.','A Very Merry Bridesmaid',876104,2.1943,6.3,'62YRiWKLBa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28748,_binary '\0','/6Z1bNoYLvHo9odEgTb0GWhhWSED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540400',5.5,2867,'en','Bonded by Blood','In 1995, drug suppliers and career criminals Tony Tucker, Patrick Tate and Craig Rolfe were blasted to death by a shot gun whilst waiting in a Range Rover in Rettendon, Essex. The film charts their rise to become the most prolific dealers and feared criminals in the south of England, maintaining the hold on their empire with fear and violence until their untimely death.','/wReZq3BNZ7kDguL2ULvb1EOI5EG.jpg','2010-09-02',100,'Released','The Truth, The Whole Truth and Nothing but the F**king Truth!','Bonded by Blood',43944,1.7147,5.1,'bmx_TFQVqnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28749,_binary '\0','/sDepk0YIXeQrxais4Xv4UtZhhsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15404268',5.8,1548,'ro','Zăpadă, Ceai și Dragoste','The story of three friends who, through a less happy situation, end up in prison. There they plan their escape and with the help of a local mobster they manage to escape only to prepare for the next robbery. Too a strange potion with really strange consequences will fall into their hands.','/saJfcU0g2uRQ1bS4VNI8vYOf13p.jpg','2021-09-10',115,'Released',NULL,'Snow, Tea and Love',872666,1.2122,6.3,'pCMo0pZnA7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28750,_binary '\0','/bXRGmHspCCn8uCYnuuaoL5JwQCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540741',5.7,12479,'en','A Single Shot','The tragic death of a beautiful young girl starts a tense and atmospheric game of cat and mouse between hunter John Moon and the hardened backwater criminals out for his blood.','/zRGBGjdeGf12Pmalr1adT9IpoId.jpg','2013-09-19',116,'Released','One Chance. One Secret. One Mistake','A Single Shot',159932,3.3,5.683,'iVmYiPBctmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28751,_binary '\0','/hDf4kRRplfrMYMvEUdgj97VVKb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540761',3.4,1279,'en','Amphibious 3D','Marine biologist Skylar Shane hires an expat charter boat captain, Jack Bowman, to help her find prehistoric life form samples in the north Sumatran Sea. During the expedition, they run into some of Jack\'s \'friends\', a gang of smugglers headquartered on a fishing platform in the middle of the sea. Tamal, an orphan sold into servitude on the fishing platform by his uncle, a \'Dukun\' (sorcerer and master of black magic) shaman, begs Skylar to take him away. She empathizes with the boy, who reminds her of her lost daughter, Rebecca, and is determined to help him, not knowing what lurks beneath the dark inky water, waiting to surface. Ever since Tamal arrived, mysterious things begin to happen, until one by one the smugglers will be killed by the terrifying creature from the deep. In the middle of an eerie, violent storm, the animus inside Tamal grows stronger, calling for the ancient creature of his nightmares...','/aeblzxCdoPAOWhHjLd8dUiQJAqE.jpg','2010-10-12',83,'Released','Terror Is About To Surface','Amphibious Creature of the Deep',83877,1.1593,3.7,'PEPMWrk8tUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28752,_binary '\0','/53Gmnw4IEcsLiYEw7GXh8wi1xyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540767',2.5,6364,'en','Apartment 1303 3D','A woman uncovers sinister secrets while investigating the apparent suicide of her sister.','/zTANZaCUwG6prdRygximOdWKV6U.jpg','2012-12-06',101,'Released','Some rentals are too good to be true.','Apartment 1303 3D',160070,2.6481,3.6,'1ruBY0VhY1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28753,_binary '\0','/tartDaapthbPy4AFOK1P4LbpfTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1540814',7.1,1790,'en','Casino Jack and the United States of Money','A probing investigation into the lies, greed and corruption surrounding D.C. super-lobbyist Jack Abramoff and his cronies.','/3Ntq2UiCY4PwTDUTIqgeHghMCvD.jpg','2010-05-09',118,'Released','Come See Where Your Democracy Went','Casino Jack and the United States of Money',44999,1.6535,7.1,'QX6UiFOr8uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28754,_binary '\0','/1IPEh9U51W0ygb0U7XotU64JDAh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15411160',5.2,4431,'sv','Året jag slutade prestera och började onanera','Ambitious overachiever Hanna just needs one more kid before her life is perfect. Instead, her baby daddy unexpectedly dumps her. Suddenly, she finds herself without a place to live, job or family. With every fiber of her being set for victory, Hanna refuses to give up and decides to win him back. But to get there means having to win something much more important, love and desire for herself and who she is.','/ckbnMAgX8PxShIYmK1LFByKNhEL.jpg','2022-10-21',98,'Released',NULL,'The Year I Started Masturbating',983105,3.788,5.9,'W23QVeshjDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28755,_binary '\0','/heTzkS0WYIcUvVJ9TxIuRZC5cvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1541123',5.3,1946,'en','Astronaut: The Last Push','When a tragic accident cuts short the first manned mission to explore life on the moons of Jupiter, Michael Forrest must make the 3 year journey home to Earth in pure solitude','/auysnhVJ3ztKSLsyfCgJc2NbOxT.jpg','2012-06-01',90,'Released','How far will man go to discover life?','Astronaut: The Last Push',110122,2.3895,5.277,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28756,_binary '\0','/atPa3FCFIyJtJNeQUU12xGyP9Sz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1541149',6.3,5808,'en','Albatross','Beth, a bookish teenager, befriends Emilia, an aspiring novelist who has just arrived in town. Emilia soon begins an affair with Beth\'s father that threatens to have devastating consequences.','/5t8UtFxxdf0QtwUZZ5vF3ei91mO.jpg','2011-10-14',90,'Released','Beautiful. smart. talented. trouble.','Albatross',72842,1.514,6,'Eaq03LQ-KMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28757,_binary '\0','/i5RVI7UeGXB0DsuQndwogr6Gzu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1541160',6.3,35156,'en','Flypaper','A man caught in the middle of two simultaneous robberies at a bank desperately tries to protect the teller with whom he\'s secretly in love.','/uJcxUKIy2GXDODT2pDl0q9XvByq.jpg','2011-08-19',87,'Released','Two sets of bank robbers. One very sticky heist.','Flypaper',62046,5.193,6.373,'2wi0weAVUwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28758,_binary '\0','/lr5xdYRe1twD04KsjHsazZfPQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15412176',7,3605,'en','Next Stop, Christmas','Angie wonders what her life would be like if she had married a former boyfriend who became a famous sportscaster. She takes the train home to spend Christmas with her family and inexplicably finds herself 10 years in the past. With the advice of the train\'s enigmatic conductor, Angie has the chance to revisit that Christmas and learn what — and who — is truly important to her.','/f4Y8hRSAfGiSkGoKvS5sruW40me.jpg','2021-11-06',84,'Released','All aboard for Holiday romance.','Next Stop, Christmas',877004,2.7839,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28759,_binary '\0','/ttlL7zA48RxTLdum9k9bGxxQwVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15412828',4.5,4938,'en','Holes in the Sky: The Sean Miller Story','In July of 2013 Sean Miller disappeared for four days. Seven years later a documentary film crew found out why.','/5qlRniMvguednZs9nNlGLiTna5n.jpg','2021-10-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Holes in the Sky: The Sean Miller Story',903040,0.6241,5,'9yK7dq4_raA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28760,_binary '\0','/2azH3Kzm1GmdKLVdhks6mcYRmTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15413054',5.4,1312,'zh','峰爆','The opening of the new tunnel, which took ten years to build, coincided with a series of serious cataclysms. The lives of 160,000 people depend on the actions of two people, a father and a son.','/f3ryFcfGgBuLZMeEx6TMDinwiUy.jpg','2021-09-11',114,'Released','When a catastrophe comes, no one should be left behind.','Cloudy Mountain',862855,3.4689,7.1,'hM2T08cDy6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28761,_binary '\0','/wKRgxlxPQZtvU4sa28AiWphLRtr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15415976',4.5,1633,'te','మాచర్ల నియోజకవర్గం','Siddhu is an IAS officer who is waiting for his posting in AP. In the meantime, he falls in love with Swathi, who hails from Macherla and has issues with Rajappa. Things get heated up when Siddhu gets posted in Macherla.','/xADPZyP9ThxUacrrQi0nqGLzmUT.jpg','2022-08-12',159,'Released',NULL,'Macherla Niyojakavargam',891010,1.5617,4.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28762,_binary '\0','/frtGCaJ8wRHAbLHx6eR6gFIsJ9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15416100',5.7,1301,'hi','विस्फोट','When the paths of two families from vastly different worlds—a Mumbai slum and a luxury high-rise—unexpectedly collide, a tragic explosion leaves one man falsely accused, forcing him to fight for his innocence against a deep-seated web of corruption.','/2ObcZd32LJwfnOiWVTo1V3uTtSP.jpg','2024-09-06',131,'Released',NULL,'Visfot',1171133,1.5467,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28763,_binary '\0','/ncvfuh7OZG46Ohiw73RQfKVNecO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15416342',6.9,12630,'hi','The Bengal Files','A criminal investigator uncovers a web of corruption during a missing person investigation, while a figure connected to the case reflects on the communal violence which broke out ahead of India\'s partition.','/3gbZh1S735CLz7NwFRb7bycUWkP.jpg','2025-09-05',205,'Released','Boldest film ever','The Bengal Files',900838,1.9731,5.9,'3MfsZFAeNO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28764,_binary '\0','/kfkRLww2ISWd8Gnn3FYO39AH0Dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15416668',6.3,1881,'te','గూడుపుఠాణి','Upon eloping and seeking refuge in a secluded temple in the forest, Giri and Siri get trapped inside. Their troubles worsen when a group of armed thieves break in to steal the Goddess\' gold.','/unQLDBa61HXYUWNkvBXuFzlyhuf.jpg','2021-09-17',112,'Released',NULL,'Guduputani',893487,0.5832,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28765,_binary '\0','/17yZ1T3lNc8ud80723vFyXwI1Iy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1541874',5.4,9159,'en','Love','After losing contact with Earth, Astronaut Lee Miller becomes stranded in orbit alone aboard the International Space Station. As time passes and life support systems dwindle, Lee battles to maintain his sanity - and simply stay alive. His world is a claustrophobic and lonely existence, until he makes a strange discovery aboard the ship.','/ghKqC61MuwJIY8Wh61258fxpcRV.jpg','2011-02-02',84,'Released','Have you ever felt alone?...What if you truly were?','Love',54320,1.9404,5.5,'PEzZybrlk_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28766,_binary '\0','/zNi0Ugu2AhdTWRJXaMWz3MfRc38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15419420',6.5,8241,'ro','Teambuilding','A frothy comedy about life in the corporation, about the challenges of building a career and those of consolidating and motivating a team. The film, a satire of corporate life, reveals the events of a team building in which the robotic corporativism unleash themselves and unleash themselves by showing their human side.','/1kCztLCB5pFUp2pjeTmAGU02G6G.jpg','2022-09-30',91,'Released','Kind reminder, everybody','Teambuilding',1021331,2.0485,6.1,'8bc966ORJn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28767,_binary '\0','/cwfMFC2PpQPCSRa5nRDFEqeLbUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1541995',6.1,4191,'en','Snow Flower and the Secret Fan','A story set in 19th century China and centered on the lifelong friendship between two girls who develop their own secret code as a way to contend with the rigid cultural norms imposed on women.','/lhhlq19I9BjcfmGLZc7SzHQULo0.jpg','2011-07-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Snow Flower and the Secret Fan',58882,3.1944,6.1,'Aa93drpm30E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28768,_binary '\0','/d2saptrOrNX7HBqjfADRnfbKo4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15420598',6.2,2429,'nl','Anne+','Just before Anne is moving from Amsterdam to live with her great love Sara in Montreal, her publisher criticizes the manuscript for her first novel. What exactly is the story she\'s trying to tell? Does she even have something to say at all? Anne is forced to search for what she wants in life, because it is not only the main character in her novel who seems to be a little lost.','/8Pcz7SOPerJ0OjJnTVFb4YozpEi.jpg','2021-10-14',94,'Released',NULL,'Anne+: The Film',808579,1.5874,6.1,'Nne2blorXnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28769,_binary '\0','/s64fCVdgjiTM2Bu5nJKbRk0tMSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15420960',6.5,1489,'en','A Christmas Together With You','During the Christmas season, Megan and her father-figure Frank head out on a road trip to find his long-lost love. Along the way, Megan finds the love of her own life.','/bDlKgyTZtd5T7sZidwndSxUAjgY.jpg','2021-11-20',84,'Released','Where there\'s love, there\'s friendship.','A Christmas Together With You',876103,1.7688,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28770,_binary '\0','/eEfkeIs7YX53JW3i5OjoZbpNoEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15422224',4.5,5786,'en','Slotherhouse','Emily Young, a senior, wants to be elected as her sorority\'s president. She adopts a cute sloth, thinking it can become the new mascot and help her win, until a string of fatalities implicate the sloth as the main suspect in the murders.','/h5sfciSmuCYet8xOv0IWSUYp6Ap.jpg','2023-08-30',93,'Released','Don\'t rush, die slow.','Slotherhouse',1040892,3.5266,4.567,'JZYAD_TOvNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28771,_binary '\0','/j9lyBEiLLAvLIpwk9ehl3OG8wcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15422240',4.6,2952,'en','Eraser: Reborn','U.S. Marshal Mason Pollard specializes in “erasing” people – faking the deaths of high-risk witnesses. With the technological advances of the last 25 years, the game has upgraded, and it’s just another day at the office when he’s assigned to Rina Kimura, a crime boss’ wife who’s decided to turn state’s evidence. As the two flee to Cape Town, South Africa, Pollard discovers he’s been set up and will need to be at the top of his game, or he’ll be the one who’s erased.','/lWE48knKsaPGqVoANXoWraiub2d.jpg','2022-03-31',102,'Released','He will protect your future by erasing your past.','Eraser: Reborn',923597,4.4932,6.176,'u2_IiOM0vkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28772,_binary '\0','/fbNi8ygJ2w3AljcSWFDKrfWuGxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15422244',8,2991,'ml','സൗദി വെള്ളക്ക','Abhilash Sasidharan receives a summons warrant to appear in court for a case from his childhood. Desperate to learn the truth, he finds a small conflict snowballed into a larger one that changed the lives of everyone involved','/8weODzUVpgcjS3QeFkNRqzg37Bt.jpg','2022-12-02',146,'Released',NULL,'Saudi Vellakka',873992,1.0785,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28773,_binary '\0','/viBWzktrBmhzRw4ehmUIrrN4C0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1542344',7.5,428029,'en','127 Hours','The true story of mountain climber Aron Ralston\'s remarkable adventure to save himself after a fallen boulder crashes on his arm and traps him in an isolated canyon in Utah.','/h0RMdn0rfl9l5hWXz3tUh6QVkhi.jpg','2010-11-12',94,'Released','Every second counts.','127 Hours',44115,14.5902,7.1,'OlhLOWTnVoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28774,_binary '\0','/qFChVlWuERqGVXuvjfoZcbj2t0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1542482',6.8,2400,'ko','만추','Anna learns in prison that her mother has passed away in Seattle. Prison officials grants Anna a three day furlough to attend her mother\'s funeral. Anna embarks on a long trip to Seattle. Hoon is a Korean immigrant who works as a gigolo. Hoon is now on the run from a wealthy client\'s furious husband. These two seemingly lost souls are about to share three memorable days together.','/4SNjM2dUrq21TPK2faONOQ8riav.jpg','2011-02-17',113,'Released','True love knows no stranger.','Late Autumn',91073,2.2147,6.73,'fG11unGWCs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28775,_binary '\0','/1179VQ6ckccWzgyS2PHxWMFDGKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15426294',4.9,7841,'en','Gone in the Night','Upon arriving at a remote cabin in the redwoods, Kath and her boyfriend find a mysterious younger couple already there — the rental has apparently been double-booked. They decide to share the cabin with these strangers until the next morning, but her boyfriend disappears with the young woman, which sends Kath in a spiral to find an explanation for their sudden breakup — but the truth is far stranger than she could have imagined.','/A1F9RpyLNbYyE9nE4INrVQh0b7T.jpg','2022-07-15',90,'Released','Some secrets are better left buried.','Gone in the Night',874355,4.2776,5.5,'bnb_yOzLleg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28776,_binary '\0','/bc7NbL4rF3NYNkVVPYtntm35OPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15426740',7,1840,'en','KSI: In Real Life','An access-all-areas look at the life of global megastar KSI as he goes through the most momentous year of his life. At the height of his fame, spurred on by a break-up, the multi-millionaire YouTuber, boxer and rapper starts to re-evaluate his priorities. How did JJ Olatunji, a nerdy kid from Watford become so successful and at what cost?','/nUCiGWCcvcIVthb9cAW1PMz6vUR.jpg','2023-01-25',93,'Released',NULL,'KSI: In Real Life',1032505,1.4287,6.3,'D2jZCFFcva4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28777,_binary '\0','/zDTpqo53AlYsc0mBCqcTDMhhI86.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1542768',5.9,26142,'en','True Memoirs of an International Assassin','After a publisher changes a writer\'s debut novel about a deadly assassin from fiction to nonfiction, the author finds himself thrust into the world of his lead character, and must take on the role of his character for his own survival.','/hPoSSqDqkKSIP2l3t6pyre9u5Ze.jpg','2016-11-11',98,'Released','The man. The myth. The memoirs.','True Memoirs of an International Assassin',339396,5.4287,5.768,'E6l4xrEjFY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28778,_binary '\0','/6BsBDNhwNigNovi6RrHrrVR2nze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15427934',6.6,8528,'kn','O2','A brilliant doctor battles her childhood trauma, to revive the dead with an illegal intravenous oxygen drug. Her quest challenges the boundaries of science, spirituality, and love. Will she succeed or lose everything!','/n9rH9of4930TAHgpQXl