via telephone dating services and going on random encounters with girls looking for spending cash. His world is shattered one day when he is involved in the murder of one of his former encounters, the sweet-faced Ishibashi Yoshino who, after being jilted by playboy Masuo Keijo, berates and mocks the troubled loner.','/4tCpSellyteA45C7ijwZI1AZan0.jpg','2010-09-11',139,'Released',NULL,'Villain',61888,1.7632,6.8,'yGUeUi3_rc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28783,_binary '\0','/vzhb18e8CVKhs3KAwhOb64XOM63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1542852',6.8,9545,'es','Carancho','Sosa is a lawyer who haunts hospital waiting rooms hoping to represent the victims of traffic accidents in insurance claims. When he falls in love with ambulance medic Luján, he tries to leave this dark business but the shady law firm that he works for won’t let him off that easily.','/gtj5lQwQiV3x6nAdRERQRm39ovm.jpg','2010-05-06',107,'Released',NULL,'Carancho',47261,1.4048,6.724,'E9Ccjpbvg0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28784,_binary '\0','/xCXMHUMQJess3GACbR2PQI7sjeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15428940',6.8,19822,'en','Jules','A flying saucer lands in the backyard of an elderly suburbanite with memory problems, who forms a bond with the scared alien inside.','/yMOWu8rpZPiBI0j8MInBTtNO0vU.jpg','2023-08-10',87,'Released','You won\'t believe what just crashed into Milton\'s azaleas.','Jules',1072371,4.367,7.1,'0nrYm9Shbcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28785,_binary '\0','/7vLjt0NthBRvNDv9PVie8KpBWOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15430628',6.3,7888,'zh','龙马精神','A washed-up stuntman and his stunt horse become an overnight social media sensation when their real-life fight with debt collectors goes viral.','/7cVHSVDEltw7dO9t9ixClpQqekm.jpg','2023-04-07',126,'Released','The legend is back!','Ride On',931102,5.1816,7.158,'0KOjNWq1Bmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28786,_binary '\0','/hfrWfc7wLeex6vPuhaDR4lweZx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15431864',6.4,1518,'en','The Senior','At 59, Mike Flynt may be too old to be on a college football field, but not too old to feel the weight of unfinished business. After nearly four decades, he returns to his alma mater to take the hit that changed everything. Bruised, doubted, and nearly broken, he pushes for one more game, not for glory, but for the teammates he lost, the family he fractured, and the ending he still believes is possible.','/sv3kE86knrukjpGTtLLfg246JFx.jpg','2025-09-18',99,'Released','True story, ultimate comeback.','The Senior',1135303,3.0837,6.7,'BqufdXirirU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28787,_binary '\0','/pxjbTuHDgDz7CodjTeMIRIvDtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15432804',3.9,1543,'nl','F*ck De Liefde 2','In this romantic comedy, several friends, each dealing with unhappy love lives, turn to each other for help - but not always with the best results.','/bN6d0Xy4r3TBvZnrSUYWIGSqzJ4.jpg','2022-05-20',92,'Released',NULL,'F*ck Love Too',970308,2.284,5.3,'UAA6VUtPNzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28788,_binary '\0','/9Ijxw19fKxMr6bKEyfK3gQ9lVU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15433600',6.1,9038,'hi','ख़ुफ़िया','When a mole in an intelligence unit leads to the murder of an undercover spy, a hardened agent relentlessly pursues him to avenge the death.','/bbHUuTEo2DsYLoXCjkL8kB0oPhy.jpg','2023-10-05',158,'Released',NULL,'Khufiya',878926,2.2744,6.284,'ByojhBwG_-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28789,_binary '\0','/vTJOcTEUVjtVGXr4LAthhb8Ad5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15433754',6.7,1983,'bn','কিশমিশ','Krishanu ‘Tintin’ Chatterjee (Dev), an aspiring graphic novelist, meets Rohini Sen (Rukmini Maitra), a rich, progressive girl, at a college in the hills and the duo fall in love. They are all set to get married when their parents’ past returns to mess things up.','/k05Xg8ib12GfxF29EYToakG4Sgc.jpg','2022-04-29',141,'Released','As sweet as raisins','Kishmish',718099,1.1725,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28790,_binary '\0','/evUpfs4dw7AuZ5k8dkePVMFSg0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15433956',7.7,30811,'te','హను-మాన్','In a small village, Hanumanthu, a petty thief, finds a mysterious gem, that gives him god-like powers. Will he succeed in keeping these powers from falling into the wrong hands and save his village?','/m1zq48rWSXxplzoJR8YtbXWnnHM.jpg','2024-01-11',159,'Released','The Most Powerful Superhero In The Universe','Hanu-Man',869760,2.0328,6.5,'2IXNyRSXQuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28791,_binary '\0','/5GAoSh08vIgEPFd5HhIeRLOREAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15434074',7.3,31886,'hi','खो गए हम कहाँ','Three best friends juggle life as 20-somethings in Mumbai, where romance, ambition and heartbreak collide with the addictive draw of social media.','/WUptEusy1sMh3s46Ik7QbfoKts.jpg','2023-12-26',135,'Released','The coming of digital age.','Kho Gaye Hum Kahan',875188,1.7382,6.6,'DgbruQFwYBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28792,_binary '\0','/hxBG72OjlAtJxXkniz0y0hTbmPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1543459',4.5,1460,'it','War Games: At the End of the Day','A game of paintball turns deadly when three unhinged and deranged ex-soldiers play a twisted mind game of catch and release with their unsuspecting victims. This quickly leads to a bloody man hunt where everyone is a target and no one is safe.','/8MvtZfCrVUY0yCMokEs8F85CnxF.jpg','2011-07-21',93,'Released',NULL,'War Games: At the End of the Day',78352,1.6641,5,'UDpzoSCAZ8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28793,_binary '\0','/1IEVQC6u5N5yYOvNtnbpjutbxuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1543701',7.7,1322,'ka','ქუჩის დღეები','A middle-aged, unemployed heroin-addict, Checkie, loiters on the Tbilisi street outside his son’s school, where he himself was once a promising student. His wife, meanwhile, struggles to pay the tuition and understand her husband’s lack of interest in the family’s survival—even as the bank repossesses their furniture. But when a group of policemen blackmails Checkie into entrapping the son of his wealthy friend, husband and wife are unified by the uncertainty of their deepening moral dilemma, and a series of worsening foul-ups, in Levan Koguashvili’s lightly humorous yet realistic drama about the fate of a generation left behind in Georgia’s post-Soviet era.','/pGQyhI4ldYnW8FBUp8CjlRObskT.jpg','2010-01-20',89,'Released',NULL,'Street Days',110555,1.1623,6.571,'wO1XiAcia5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28794,_binary '\0','/7CVWvqO0huXURgVnuhgNQA1s8P2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15437820',6.9,1290,'ml','ഗഗനചാരി','A dystopian comedy that takes place in the 2040\'s, where an apartment inhabited by three problematic bachelors soon becomes a haven for an extra-terrestrial female fugitive.','/qTrGkS3Khx2Vj7Z3IplpiDqBkwv.jpg','2024-06-21',114,'Released',NULL,'Gaganachari',874763,0.812,7.4,'bQcb0Jh8KCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28795,_binary '\0','/ttkibtcAjoilW1PbTIFy9U9YOdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15438542',3.8,2698,'en','Code Name Banshee','Caleb, a former government assassin in hiding, who resurfaces when his protégé, the equally deadly killer known as Banshee, discovers a bounty has been placed on Caleb\'s head.','/YLv9S84WyPZ5uxty989Duhzi5u.jpg','2022-07-01',93,'Released','Two assassins. One secret. No turning back.','Code Name Banshee',916719,4.7636,5.8,'Cj876ciYN0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28796,_binary '\0','/vhCCnLWMTQSRpmmjdP6lIBywjT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1543920',7.6,5036,'en','Turtles Forever','Whoa, dude! Worlds collide when the Turtles from one dimension meet the Turtles from another dimension! What the shell is going on? The two Turtle teams must work together to find the Technodrome and undo this multi-dimensional mess!','/7PRI4GFIbuLHaYvw1AZEt19riIO.jpg','2009-11-21',73,'Released','Sometimes four ninjas just aren\'t enough!','Turtles Forever',34003,2.7957,7.3,'YixMJJzOCoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28797,_binary '\0','/dqTOcdf1ILtakesKUhBOutaIee3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15439344',7,1515,'ja','僕が愛したすべての君へ','While struggling to make friends after his parents’ divorce, Koyomi Takasaki meets Kazune Takigawa, but apparently, they already have. Kazune reveals that she’s from World Line 85, an alternate universe in which she and Koyomi are lovers. But in a reality where moving between dimensions is natural, could Koyomi be the one from another world?','/yl4WOrXTVFihtd6wcxpwkKD7xoP.jpg','2022-10-07',102,'Released',NULL,'To Every You I\'ve Loved Before',874743,3.1618,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28798,_binary '\0','/hcqY0Er8AhU3UiSAxB5tT6sBiZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15440322',6.6,12547,'te','దసరా','In 1990s, Set in small village Veerlapally, Dharani, Vennela, and Suri are childhood friends. Dharani loves Vennela, but she has Suri in her mind. Knowing Suri’s interest in Vennela, Dharani sacrifices his love and helps get them married. But Local politics between Rajanna, Shivanna and the latter\'s son Chinna Nambi threaten to disrupt their lives.','/8O4V2PHkI8mDvxAW3aeZDvRsYZd.jpg','2023-03-30',159,'Released',NULL,'Dasara',885184,2.238,6.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28799,_binary '\0','/rPJzSvaOcssRPegJkKS7UVa8Ib3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15440460',6.9,1676,'ta','ப்ளூ ஸ்டார்','The captains of two rival village cricket teams must put their longstanding grudge aside in order to take on the bullies threatening their right to play.','/8agxJ2Wv8EitO1xwF2HgxnyloCI.jpg','2024-01-25',166,'Released',NULL,'Blue Star',1230097,1.1255,7.8,'5_4ibmR7fj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28800,_binary '\0','/51jVHbIvlRhX6BaMq4YTZKN5DXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15441054',5.1,25698,'hi','गदर २','When Tara Singh goes missing during a skirmish and is believed to be captured in Pakistan, his son Jeete sets out to rescue him and enters a labyrinth from which they both must escape at all costs.','/brCBYKGQaxZZcwmFF6OIxZLdKVU.jpg','2023-08-10',168,'Released','Courage knows no borders','Gadar 2',885331,1.6695,5.9,'mljj92tRwlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28801,_binary '\0','/f9PSbuMeBS5CuHEOVyymg5lcq8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15441472',4.9,4939,'en','The Price We Pay','After a pawn shop robbery goes askew, two criminals take refuge at a remote farmhouse to try to let the heat die down, but find something much more menacing.','/8fwJt0qZieQ7dKaiiqehObWpXYT.jpg','2023-01-13',85,'Released','Reap what you sow.','The Price We Pay',996727,4.0783,5.8,'9IETOHDSl3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28802,_binary '\0','/b2yi8TtAPU15Ispvfzt1eTCsOEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15441522',6.6,1834,'fr','Sur les chemins noirs','Pierre, a famous explorer and writer, travels regularly through the world. Someday, climbing a hotel frontage while drunk, he falls from high and into a deep coma. When he awakes, he has difficulties walking but, against everyone\'s advices, he decides to walk through France, following forgotten pathways...','/mwwY0kU2GdS6Gsaxh8rqi3LU52u.jpg','2023-03-22',92,'Released',NULL,'On the Wandering Paths',888082,2.5032,6.334,'nPLOSNIKEc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28803,_binary '\0','/iu5RMfBVlU4v0drskl7sx3Gai0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15444046',5.2,1568,'en','Divinity','Two brothers crash into the decaying Earth to stop a capitalist from manufacturing an immortality serum, which is synthesized utilizing heinous methods and leaving an increasingly dire infertility rate in its wake.','/3Ri4XxXNCUKwlZWXgoVNftF7GIY.jpg','2023-10-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Divinity',1058619,2.6367,5.1,'I0TGRJicqa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28804,_binary '\0','/k9dHAAkqKmECsKV3zuv8fiw2BxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15444704',6.8,1594,'en','Love Gets a Room','January 1942, in Nazi-occupied Poland during World War II. Thousands of Jews have been confined to the Warsaw ghetto for more than a year. Outside, life goes on; inside, they struggle to survive another day. Still, on a cold winter night, a group of Jewish actors manage to stage a lively musical comedy.','/bfzXouYUfnIfEK9l7neFV3nFrjz.jpg','2021-11-26',103,'Released','The ghetto is no place for love stories.','Love Gets a Room',875419,1.8604,7,'NyQxqrBufXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28805,_binary '\0','/gV31rejG3kVpwH5T7HG8G99eLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15445056',6.8,26142,'fr','Athena','Hours after the tragic death of their youngest brother in unexplained circumstances, three siblings have their lives thrown into chaos.','/s8B0GsFEebd0DW2spykLMxnc1Kn.jpg','2022-09-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Athena',852046,4.2687,6.6,'vRunUkdkK8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28806,_binary '\0','/i43bTASEtzvx02UFMmZ8IGJcfKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1544578',5.4,1352,'en','Chop','Lance Reed is forced by a psychotic stranger to confront his duplicitous past. Seeking retribution for a crime, the man forces Lance to reveal his inner most secrets by systematically removing his limbs.','/sFPRfascZAGUuWqcZIKeTrwU79S.jpg','2011-05-07',98,'Released','An Eye For An Eye ... And Then Some','Chop',82466,0.903,5.2,'P96_WN21TXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28807,_binary '\0','/7oJePkds4pouWdkpQn5hYyfAcHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1544600',6.3,3386,'en','The Grace Card','Everything can change in an instant ... and take a lifetime to unravel. When Mac McDonald loses his son in an accident, the ensuing 17 years of bitterness and pain erodes his love for his family and leaves him angry with God ... and just about everyone else. Mac\'s rage stonewalls his career in the police department and makes for a combustible situation when he\'s partnered with Sam Wright, a rising star on the force who happens to be a part-time pastor and a loving family man. Can they somehow join forces to help one another when it\'s impossible for either of them to look past their differences-especially the most obvious one? Every day, we have the opportunity to rebuild relationships and heal deep wounds by extending and receiving God\'s grace. Offer THE GRACE CARD ... and never underestimate the power of God\'s love.','/bbWsYKtWTNtECusWJs3tvpTGlwO.jpg','2011-02-25',101,'Released','Never Underestimate The Power Of Grace ...','The Grace Card',54897,1.6754,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28808,_binary '\0','/3vuPHwoIZBajv8YKJQZcJihiC3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1544608',5.2,12803,'en','Voice from the Stone','Verena is a nurse who arrives at an old mansion in Italy to help a young boy who has fallen silent since the sudden passing of his mother.','/6pJseCfsd90nA26Jz1HTSuyRzGz.jpg','2017-04-28',91,'Released','Silence is calling','Voice from the Stone',301372,5.4754,5.621,'QZ3JYLriWaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28809,_binary '\0','/jEfkR3aj7ZtJxkGOclTtPoK7guw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15446834',5.2,3989,'hi','असेक','Plagued by unsettling supernatural phenomena, a man becomes increasingly paranoid that his ex is stalking him with black magic.','/dNJrK1uvoBPoYEVTAqI8ZSyrpdI.jpg','2024-06-22',107,'Released',NULL,'Aseq',1143431,0.6843,0,'VjP7msJ7xQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28810,_binary '\0','/drWXGph8OpT4K702iYYUOQWNEgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545022',4,1334,'de','Bedways','A huge, run-down apartment in Berlin Mitte. Two women and a man, rehearsals for a movie about love and sex, that will never be shot. Acting and reality mingle into a dangerous mélange.','/Dyn152ce3Jp4zwqlVLIi5rw5AK.jpg','2010-10-07',76,'Released','Berlin is the shelter, love is impossible, flesh is the law.','Bedways',62489,3.9029,4.6,'CVnMxagoCQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28811,_binary '\0','/yswml0UPEVFCVc3GJ1PF2BNyaNs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15450826',7,1497,'ja','君を愛したひとりの僕へ','Koyomi Hidaka and Shiori Sato meet at his father’s research center and begin to fall in love, but so do their parents, who eventually marry. To avoid becoming stepsiblings, they decide to run away to a parallel universe. Traveling between dimensions is common in their world, but not without repercussions. Does a universe exist for the young couple, and what will it cost them to find it?','/gt7kD8MjObtgQYH130pZiLTN0qx.jpg','2022-10-07',98,'Released',NULL,'To Me, the One Who Loved You',874745,3.1061,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28812,_binary '\0','/eFALDFMBn2C9ywQT8szDPQTh57p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545097',4.5,2028,'en','Harriet the Spy: Blog Wars','Young spy Harriet Welsch crosses paths with popular student Marion Hawthorne as the two girls vie to become the official blogger of their high school class.','/zEQp6YCUdadJJmF3PE38N6a52wd.jpg','2010-03-26',87,'Released','Fame is Fleeting. The Internet is Forever...','Harriet the Spy: Blog Wars',49350,2.5501,5.1,'SBxDRh3AgOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28813,_binary '\0','/eUZHhgwv0zwR3LPadxeBNfh7VCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545103',8.4,5180,'en','Rush: Beyond the Lighted Stage','An in-depth look at the Canadian rock band Rush, chronicling the band\'s musical evolution from their progressive rock sound of the \'70s to their current heavy rock style.','/5su3xR3k0doJmUYIVk8O5QnXnxn.jpg','2010-06-29',107,'Released','The band you know. The story you don\'t.','Rush: Beyond the Lighted Stage',41120,2.0566,7.5,'gsbJIfVh-dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28814,_binary '\0','/jRfYRzwE4eX1qcnMSTagL1xlxGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545106',5.4,12885,'en','Vamps','The modern-day story focuses on two beautiful young vampires who are living the good nightlife in New York until love enters the picture and each has to make a choice that will jeopardize their immortality.','/43nUqYJMyqS9HbgD9XoKDvaz6AC.jpg','2012-08-25',93,'Released','Nice girls suck.','Vamps',73935,3.6627,5.316,'I22Lqr9IRKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28815,_binary '\0','/xgotqsHt0x23gs6pC6wM0IGQjYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15451150',4.5,5120,'en','You Can\'t Run Forever','A teenage girl suffering from anxiety due to a tragic event from her past finds herself hunted through the woods by a sociopath on a murderous rampage.','/mkQEa3W4UbkAaL8kwv7pj7AiM0u.jpg','2024-05-17',102,'Released','Don\'t look back.','You Can\'t Run Forever',879412,4.4289,5.527,'IFDundIyznQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28816,_binary '\0','/5pUJhaYpDdmOiyMvCh3G1R6G1wi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15452062',6.9,9838,'fr','La Conspiration du Caire','A fisherman\'s son is offered the ultimate privilege to study at the Al-Azhar University in Cairo, the epicenter of power of Sunni Islam. Shortly after his arrival, the university’s highest ranking religious leader, the Grand Imam, dies and the young student becomes a pawn in a ruthless power struggle between Egypt\'s religious and political elite.','/zDRAA4UJWgQnSFxhJuefnwO74v5.jpg','2022-10-26',121,'Released',NULL,'Cairo Conspiracy',788977,4.0553,6.8,'EG8C70oQYd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28817,_binary '\0','/k8H6Qp4uJ9WHArPQwDqCaW9g3Sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545304',5.2,11726,'en','Desperados','A panicked young woman and her two best friends fly to Mexico to delete a ranting email she sent to her new boyfriend. On arrival, they run into her former beau, who soon gets caught up in their frantic scheme.','/hoUzSMxGu4Bm73EvH6B3iceFwW8.jpg','2020-07-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Desperados',706510,2.7607,6,'8AWqOBj_BqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28818,_binary '\0','/mduXCaZ1QaevkyJsvKcuXDTpv4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545315',4.8,3298,'en','Needle','College student Ben inherits a curious old mechanical box that churns out voodoo dolls. When a shadowy figure starts using the box to murder Ben\'s friends, he must find the killer.','/gxVJLWNMGyOXPG5P8KULdoWHHPg.jpg','2010-06-04',90,'Released','Ten Suspects. Six Clues. One Killer.','Needle',49347,2.1267,5,'TqLkrnyoKMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28819,_binary '\0','/deBohvE1fMV2L21Kg12nGlWQSaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545328',5.5,2461,'en','Whole Lotta Sole','In a misguided attempt to protect his family and pay back gambling debts to the local Mobster, Jimbo robs a fish market, which is coincidentally owned by the same Mobster. On the run, Jimbo is cornered in a local curio shop, where he takes hostage an assortment of colourful characters, including a man who may be his illegitimate father. Surrounded by the Police, the SAS and the Mobster\'s crew, the young man must find a way out of his precarious predicament with the help of his oddball captives.','/5YhkPG9R14UenoJMh4y37CLYqdm.jpg','2011-04-21',94,'Released','Small time robbery. Big time mess.','Whole Lotta Sole',165477,2.284,5.4,'ay8BK_tg-eI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28820,_binary '\0','/4BXLVLRwHxtydcUIhxphPVirJX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545660',5.6,22671,'en','Knights of Badassdom','Three best friends and dedicated roleplayers take to the woods to reenact a dungeons and dragons-like scenario as a live action role-playing game. Trouble arises when a prop spellbook purchased from the internet ends up being a genuine grimoire and they unwittingly conjure up a blood-lusting succubus from hell.','/7hxpi2Y7JNGHmETL2VAPONhvHGZ.jpg','2014-01-21',85,'Released','\'Tis about to get medieval up in here.','Knights of Badassdom',74461,3.5171,5.6,'zyougFDZ7zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28821,_binary '\0','/AgWnDRoGbbE6oXJWZpQVQWWzaUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545754',5.3,17463,'en','Are You Here','When Steve Dallas, a womanizing local weatherman, hears that his off-the-grid best friend Ben Baker has lost his estranged father, the two return to Ben\'s childhood home. Once there, they discover Ben has inherited the family fortune, and the ill-equipped duo must battle Ben\'s formidable sister and deal with his father\'s gorgeous 25-year old widow.','/v83MAkGH8jF8uNhJhKgADqw3Xup.jpg','2013-09-07',114,'Released','Friendship... there\'s nothing in it for anybody.','Are You Here',209244,6.8846,5.149,'uMtNpu6xBvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28822,_binary '\0','/8z3rvlweelKK1HDwLFxUDC9Vv8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545759',6.8,15219,'fr','À bout portant','Samuel Pierret is a nurse who saves the wrong guy – a thief whose henchmen take Samuel\'s pregnant wife hostage to force him to spring their boss from the hospital. A race through the subways and streets of Paris ensues, and the body count rises. Can Samuel evade the cops and the criminal underground and deliver his beloved to safety?','/tt2UlArx3joZWBYctJehCGmHGZZ.jpg','2010-11-08',84,'Released','A Desperate Man Is A Dangerous Thing','Point Blank',61404,3.4108,6.6,'Ha2O-LdNoqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28823,_binary '\0','/ahzZaRdrgDX6HMXj2AfbFCkBiq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15457802',5.6,1846,'te','ఊరు పేరు భైరవకోన','A man goes in search of some urgently required answers to the world of Bhairavakona, from which there\'s seemingly no way out.','/bPqtaVDJI2E8SheBhCgtktyBw6a.jpg','2024-02-16',133,'Released',NULL,'Ooru Peru Bhairavakona',1030109,1.2197,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28824,_binary '\0','/22XynAA6jKuMKMCoKVJFQzN5RGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15458036',6.7,1334,'te','Savitri W/O Satyamurthy','Satyamurthy is a young man who doesn\'t age, lives with his old-aged wife Savitri and three sons. His elder son is mighty embarrassed about his father\'s never-growing age.','/zaXN8G9d4PDiWmDzxuXOBDp0xr9.jpg','2021-11-19',NULL,'Released',NULL,'Savitri W/O Satyamurthy',898920,0.7369,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28825,_binary '\0','/cEFRKo7bORLPaVufN45YBLoAp2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15458936',7.4,2039,'hi','Dukaan','A girl who becomes a surrogate mother, becoming the relief for couples with issues.','/mbeJh5s3q19JqQSiqquYo4fZIgh.jpg','2024-04-05',122,'Released',NULL,'Dukaan',1251968,0.9567,5,'GMJLzvJJLOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28826,_binary '\0','/5N3w3cC5d8fDMLuuDMn8io4StUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15459206',6.6,2197,'fr','Le Dossier Maldoror','When two girls go missing, Paul Chartier, an impulsive young police recruit, is assigned to “Maldoror”. This secret unit has been set up to monitor a dangerous sex offender. When the operation fails, fed up with the limits of the legal system, Chartier embarks on a solitary hunt to bring down the culprits.','/kdOeeJOZySlQ5pDFijMIUuwLIPG.jpg','2024-09-08',155,'Released','When justice falters, obsession becomes the only weapon.','Maldoror',959596,3.2351,6.4,'0MXDo5By35o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28827,_binary '\0','/fQCGnq3OY8tyZa4jBPAGq9LSddw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545985',6.4,1344,'de','Die kommenden Tage','Welcome to 2020: The European Union has collapsed following the fourth Gulf War and massive barricades keep illegal immigrants out of cities that are barely functioning. In the middle of this highly volatile environment is the family of Walter Kuper, an energy conglomerate executive. Walter’s daughter, Cecilia, has joined the Black Storm terrorist group. Her sister Laura must choose between motherhood and the man she loves; their brother Philip has been called up to fight for Germany in a hopeless war to secure the last remaining oil fields. Starring leading actors Daniel Brühl, Johanna Wokalek and Jürgen Vogel, \"The Days to Come\" asks provocative questions about the current state of things as it depicts personal and political realities in a scarily believable near–future.','/3m3IsSCCo5FpaGTQvGmbNP0Up3G.jpg','2010-11-04',130,'Released',NULL,'The Coming Days',63077,1.4682,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28828,_binary '\0','/qfeyOcI7fr7456qBcxzxmwJT5sG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1545986',3.2,3155,'en','Dinoshark','A baby dinoshark evolves into a ferocious predatory adult, terrorising tourists and locals offshore from Puerto Vallarta, Mexico.','/qMZQhzde1nrMTDj6ImwcGEPQnKR.jpg','2010-03-13',92,'Released','Fear what\'s below the surface.','Dinoshark',35074,2.0309,4.2,'9ILns1Y8kOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28829,_binary '\0','/bL3zF1MzeqFI4Jnd3avwflzzlor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15460036',6.2,1802,'es','La virgen de la tosquera','On the eve of the 2001 outbreak, Natalia falls madly in love with her lifelong friend Diego. The romance is interrupted when he meets the more experienced Silvia. With the help of her grandma Rita, Natalia decides to call on incantations and curses to jinx Diego and Silvia\'s blossoming relationship.','/xqbUNS0uvqWEgvTWFuxba7Qs4yi.jpg','2026-01-15',95,'Released',NULL,'The Virgin of the Quarry Lake',862739,3.0301,5.8,'YtmkwXtz-oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28830,_binary '\0','/eDHOYmzdV2AdXXIz0XjQbNJiTSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1546036',6.1,4945,'en','The Drawn Together Movie: The Movie!','When the mystery-solving musician Foxxy Love notices she and her fellow housemates can curse without being bleeped—something they\'ve never been able to do before—she realizes their show has been canceled. Determined to get back on the air, the gang travels to Make-A-Point-Land in order to get a point (and get back on the air).','/vNrQpBgnwytWZwDhBQEMJLy13N1.jpg','2010-03-18',71,'Released','TV\'s most f\'ed up series... is about to eff up the movies.','The Drawn Together Movie: The Movie!',36736,3.7299,6.43,'akr5JXpT-28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28831,_binary '\0','/nDA3a2iQLYJs53kgcKHO5ZzQdnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15460742',6.9,2985,'pl','Filip','During World War II, a Polish food server at a luxury German hotel tempts fate as he romances local women while hiding his Jewish identity.','/tu8XMqMlAmNnBCo1xQ0IVj34wxz.jpg','2023-03-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Filip',999125,3.4288,6.88,'MS89cSYf8PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28832,_binary '\0','/orV7mt3Gu4h2WEE2ki2CfeIkMuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15463032',5.5,15571,'en','Love in the Villa','A young woman takes a trip to romantic Verona, Italy, after a breakup, only to find that the villa she reserved was double-booked, and she\'ll have to share her vacation with a cynical British man.','/t92CXfEP5aWBATeOomcF0wF9NsM.jpg','2022-09-01',114,'Released',NULL,'Love in the Villa',934756,4.8438,6,'_kRab62q54M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28833,_binary '\0','/wbhoYwvqgadchfMgUOfOp87QZDS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15464188',6.1,26874,'hi','इक्कीस','Second Lieutenant and India\'s youngest Param Vir Chakra recipient, Arun Khetarpal, gave his life fighting for his battalion and the country during the 1971 Battle of Basantar. Ikkis also takes a reflective look at the futility of war through the eyes of Khetarpal\'s father, who visits his ancestral home in Sargodha and Alma Mater for reunion, which now happens to be in post-partition Pakistan, 30 years later.','/dtdZ6QhcPyxGhpwamo8W8Yeiguh.jpg','2026-01-01',148,'Released','He was 21, will remain as that.','Ikkis',1196946,2.7742,6.66,'QfnyH8odcus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28834,_binary '\0','/xWQlaHuPcllRp9wqPsJqPjCTQcX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15464390',7.5,5871,'pa','ਮਸਤਾਨੇ','Set in 1739, Nader Shah\'s undefeated army is attacked by Sikh rebellions. Nadar demands their arrest to no avail. Five civilians are hired to play Sikh rebels but over time, they learn the Sikh way.','/8vrlTSiMcNlnCQn6oNcgbbKbSn3.jpg','2023-08-24',145,'Released',NULL,'Mastaney',1161406,0.9776,10,'YMDfraipmA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28835,_binary '\0','/ifYrZIl76ly3WjNyk6BByl1Cfe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15464742',7.4,1817,'pa','ਕਾਲੀ ਜੋੱਟਾ','Kali Jotta is a heartfelt story of life, love and loss. It is a social issue drama that explores a wide range of incidents and emotions of the characters. It is also a beautiful portrait of love and Reminisces about the times of pure and selfless love beyond time and age.','/aJlvuwsWLlPtqPW5127tJmemhLF.jpg','2023-02-03',130,'Released',NULL,'Kali Jotta',1071819,1.0132,7,'1y9tUcXFbqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28836,_binary '\0','/dJz5luVAulgXpyVTpReRmUJD5uI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15465098',7.6,2196,'ta','செம்பி','Ten-year-old Sembi and her grandmother Veerayi, an apiarist, live peacefully amidst nature in the hilly regions of Kodaikanal. They lead a beautiful life until three influential miscreants shatter all their dreams. After a tragedy the two escape and board a bus, whose Passengers from different walks of life try to help bringing justice to the duo.','/waqlWEPyebrXzD5N0g9YN1p0LHN.jpg','2022-12-30',124,'Released','The Moments','Sembi',1054334,1.0729,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28837,_binary '\0','/l1J1hanBmG5Xxy4pxpaKxu4kl5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15465194',6.7,2513,'kn','Dr. 56','Arjun is a theater artist who is suffering from an illness and has to take a pill every 56 minutes. Parallel to his misery is a murder investigation of three neurosurgeons lead by CBI officer Priya Krishna. Priya meets Dr Ashwath and the two go on an exposition about the medical mafia and its consequences.','/xQPGHTSylif4HHuzFgrBVYbMMKy.jpg','2022-12-09',105,'Released','1956 TO 2019','Dr. 56',1036788,0.9595,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28838,_binary '\0','/4hdgeJeuL2BnV5vd0BZ5SkqEc62.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15466426',6.8,2457,'no','Alle hater Johan','Johan, a loner with horses and explosives, is never accepted by the local community. We follow his struggle for belonging in the village and the lifelong, unrequited love for the girl next door, which he accidentally blew up in his youth.','/4UgamuOMuYdi7F5N7JWAwsgYGLB.jpg','2022-03-25',93,'Released','An explosive comedy','Everybody Hates Johan',750498,2.5854,5.9,'q-M5B0Q685M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28839,_binary '\0','/qZXxPEViI3FXehrTFFOUObhANAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1546653',7.1,2286,'da','Det røde kapel','Two Danish comedians join the director on a trip to North Korea, where they have been allowed access under the pretext of wanting to perform a vaudeville act.','/57pO0BCwRWivqLuPqUFIsXhFlyd.jpg','2010-12-29',88,'Released','Looking for laughs in North Korea?','The Red Chapel',52249,1.1613,7.2,'1aQRC_4LheY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28840,_binary '\0','/g03h9TULzJZOoXA34Abp5LE7lvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15467380',6.9,3642,'ja','劇場版 転生したらスライムだった件 紅蓮の絆編','A long-running conspiracy is swirling over a mysterious power wielded by the Queen in Raja, a small country west of Tempest. When a slime who evolved into a Demon Lord named Rimuru Tempest crosses paths with Hiiro, a survivor of the Ogre race, an incredible adventure packed with new characters begins. The power of bonds will be put to the test!','/xITip9n9uMAUA0TU6niMXU2tbh0.jpg','2022-11-25',108,'Released','The power of bonds will be put to the test!','That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime the Movie: Scarlet Bond',876792,7.238,7.4,'M4EPHOfgOdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28841,_binary '\0','/oBrHna3SHYVJrvGR4k6qG058vS2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15469820',6.4,8677,'en','Britney vs. Spears','Journalist Jenny Eliscu and filmmaker Erin Lee Carr investigate Britney Spears\' fight for freedom by way of exclusive interviews and confidential evidence.','/sd43f1ZDz8H8TDhcIbyKuUuJmIa.jpg','2021-09-27',93,'Released','No more secrets. No more silence.','Britney vs. Spears',797594,1.3342,6.998,'SgFDWK_sf9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28842,_binary '\0','/u87pbzV3oVdB33k1pybXieXrkdX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1547035',6.6,1426,'en','When Love Is Not Enough: The Lois Wilson Story','Based on the true story of the enduring but troubled love between Lois Wilson, co-founder of Al-Anon, and her alcoholic husband Bill Wilson, co-founder of Alcoholics Anonymous.','/jlBlWguLtgywmi4FTpkrRQPyLIW.jpg','2010-04-25',96,'Released','The epic story of devotion, recovery and hope','When Love Is Not Enough: The Lois Wilson Story',71184,2.3115,6,'xZgg3y7lJng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28843,_binary '\0','/8Rn63b4cDDwDkJjBYW54mF9wZrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1547084',5.3,1817,'es','El páramo','A special commando unit made up of 9 soldiers is sent to a military base in a moorland region after contact was lost and it was believed to have been the target of an attack. Upon arrival, they find a single mysterious survivor: a woman in chains.','/dshRGSHMsUxGeh1TPtkcJHkfOfs.jpg','2011-10-07',100,'Released','Something is out there','The Squad',83705,1.2254,6.107,'lT-xUGzcPB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28844,_binary '\0','/aMmjSIWIycKbwgQ3zSrk6w13zH0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1547090',3.3,1877,'en','Without Men','In a small and remote Latin American mountain village, all the men are recruited to fight in the country\'s civil war. Left to fend for themselves, the women of the town, led by Rosalba, slowly emerge from their supporting roles as wives and daughters to become unwitting founders of a remarkable new society: an all female utopia. When the men, led by an American reporter, return to try to reclaim their power, a clash of sexes ensues with unsuspected consequences.','/1EzXn6ZkhGBBlNizXQiGOeDvwwp.jpg','2011-06-29',83,'Released','There\'s a new boss in town','Without Men',68202,1.8758,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28845,_binary '\0','/89Kubf8TqJqdJBeePY0vmHzXJFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15471560',6.4,6640,'fr','Fumer fait tousser','After a devastating battle against a diabolical turtle, a team of five avengers — known as the \"Tobacco Force\" — is sent on a mandatory retreat to strengthen their decaying group cohesion, where they share scary stories the film depicts. Their storytelling sojourn goes wonderfully well until Lézardin, Emperor of Evil, decides to annihilate planet Earth.','/7aYwL5VEzGkBvww9YFYKBPGBbRt.jpg','2022-11-30',77,'Released',NULL,'Smoking Causes Coughing',872709,2.7333,6.042,'Q0X8LXlE9pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28846,_binary '\0','/zWBHtD07EKGVSR6jwrVulMJSjhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15471642',4.8,1672,'te','The Rose Villa','Ravi and Sweta meet a lonely elderly couple when their car breaks down in the forest. Invited to their home, strange behaviour sets off alarm bells and Ravi and Sweta attempt to escape.','/zybJ5VEgM7HNvMjbsSrpTc36sgA.jpg','2021-10-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The Rose Villa',897077,0.7159,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28847,_binary '\0','/rKlaHTeDR8R0ELsSHhbtedniGxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1547230',4.4,3680,'en','Judy Moody and the Not Bummer Summer','Third-grader Judy Moody sets out to have the most thrilling summer of her life.','/h2KtoDrmUvxW6S2RDr2BIqra7jA.jpg','2011-06-10',91,'Released','Supermegatotally thrilladelic.','Judy Moody and the Not Bummer Summer',60062,3.1802,5.9,'j7yoiXFUCcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28848,_binary '\0','/5I1VkAjzeo0arQQ7pFVymQsNrqN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1547234',6.5,123072,'en','Premium Rush','In Manhattan, a bike messenger picks up an envelope that attracts the interest of a dirty cop, who pursues the cyclist throughout the city.','/gHnGhJmE0LByOd4RS2mOASmUqQu.jpg','201