leased','THE HUNTED BECOME THE HUNTERS','Night Drive',876828,1.1611,7.545,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28853,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15477202',5.7,1463,'ml','Voice of സത്യനാഥൻ','A man is mistakenly suspected of being a threat to the President of India.','/rVGr7tD7j866GtZfV6IxTDxqzIe.jpg','2023-07-14',135,'Released',NULL,'Voice of Sathyanathan',877250,1.0429,6.409,'mapUuNZQ4iI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28854,_binary '\0','/yPu9JixqlAWAYQdZPvtUvjZNvAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15477504',7.4,5819,'ml','നന്‍പകല്‍ നേരത്ത് മയക്കം','A group of Malayali travellers, returning to Kerala by bus after their visit to Velankanni, all doze off in a lazy nap after lunch. One of the travelers, James, stops the bus in a village in Tamil Nadu. He starts behaving like a native of the place and speaking in Tamil, confusing his fellow passengers and the villagers alike. He walks amidst faith, delusion, dream and trance, followed by others.','/29lETTae7slJPteKkLt6Rdu5g7y.jpg','2023-01-19',107,'Released',NULL,'Nanpakal Nerathu Mayakkam',876845,1.4455,7.086,'mh9mvqmAYs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28855,_binary '\0','/vAgE5zZR3ySF6jqzLwelgpOY8XS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15479438',4.8,2149,'en','Somewhere Quiet','Meg is trying to readjust to normalcy after surviving a traumatic kidnapping — but her grounded sense of reality soon starts to deteriorate when she travels with her husband to his wealthy family’s isolated compound.','/evExphB7F7PpCHx06dMCwePArfH.jpg','2024-02-02',98,'Released','Escape has its limits.','Somewhere Quiet',1114922,1.5864,4.8,'UynOoH11-Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28856,_binary '\0','/poL87RE9mtvfiAKas8DHtdqA6nG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15479902',6.3,6591,'en','Trust No One: The Hunt for the Crypto King','When the young founder of a collapsing cryptocurrency exchange dies unexpectedly, irate investors suspect there\'s