d',NULL,'Meeting Point',877787,0.8172,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28861,_binary '\0','/f0Jmk9yx8BLFfnzUz2V5QDkaYf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15484422',6.3,1637,'en','You, Me and the Christmas Trees','An arborist helps a fourth generation Christmas tree farmer whose evergreens are dying just before the holiday. As she tries to get to the root of the problem before the town tree lighting, they begin to fall in love.','/ezgKTTz3ZT6wksXREympqR7G2eM.jpg','2021-10-22',84,'Released','Keeping tradition alive.','You, Me and the Christmas Trees',877692,2.3004,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28862,_binary '\0','/oTAbBVd48ngNEfXrZhGAtNbRbto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15485390',6,4449,'is','Napóleonsskjölin','A modern-day lawyer is sucked into an international conspiracy after being accused of a murder she didn\'t commit. Her only chance of freedom lies in uncovering the secret of an old German WWII aeroplane, long buried deep beneath the ice, before the CIA.','/l5VLVINzfiltL1fqNLt8oMTWnr0.jpg','2023-01-26',102,'Released','A dark secret hides beneath the ice.','Operation Napoleon',1002338,3.8417,6.158,'DvLfCSFtcBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28863,_binary '\0','/mY8c92w88UUQM0KWobvLZKwGJpi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1548542',7,2298,'tr','Bornova Bornova','A story from Bornova, a neighborhood in Izmir. Two good friends Salih and Hakan spend their days in front of a grocery store waiting for a chance to do something with their lives.','/sBblQd2skYTjY7pjtrb4vMJOZJB.jpg','2009-11-13',92,'Released',NULL,'Bornova Bornova',61845,1.7558,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28864,_binary '\0','/uzywNBnacW0nvmeSu48jEbI99ab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1548628',3.8,2609,'en','Scream of the Banshee','An archeology professor unearths a dangerous artifact, unwittingly releasing a creature that is able to kill with the power of its bone-splitting scream.','/hTqL9dG6DnKR6AljTLh27gyE9Rt.jpg','2011-03-26',90,'Released','She hasn\'t been out for a thousand years.','Scream of the Banshee',60950,2.8317,4.8,'0Fp0jy8XncQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28865,_binary '\0','/dK4L363dRxekkGJT7Pe2REjKW4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1548629',6.5,1432,'sv','Sebbe','Duct tape, electrical cables, trigger, explosives. Sebbe never planned to build a bomb. It just happened. Sebbe is 15 years old and lives with his mother in an apartment that is too narrow. He does his best. He never strikes back. Sebbe loves his mother because he knows nothing else. In the junkyard the dream is alive, and in the hands of Sebbe, dead objects come to life. Here he has the power to create. Here he is free - but alone. His isolation grows as his world shrinks, until one day he is completely isolated with no other than his mother. And when she falls, everything falls.','/8bvftuuoNvni8mdz4GjynRJeRVE.jpg','2010-03-12',83,'Released','Sebbe never planned to build a bomb. It just happened...','Sebbe',45133,0.8434,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28866,_binary '\0','/zHtf12JPaY514VwPv4FGCp4O8Py.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1548635',3.6,2077,'en','Siren','A group of friends escaping the city for a weekend away have a simple plan, to tour the coast for a relaxing weekend. Things hit a snag when one of the friends spots a seductive, sultry young woman waving for help off the shore of one of many secluded islands along the coast. Reaching out to rescue her turns deadly and they risk everything to get off the island alive.','/r7gfNhxv1XDnRCahmTo4dbxtYQ5.jpg','2010-11-11',86,'Released','Seduction is murder...','Siren',58718,1.9549,4.2,'p7S1cbul-Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28867,_binary '\0','/96SADhPnkXnVN3KaRKsDeBovLcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15486810',5.6,17774,'en','Teen Wolf: The Movie','The wolves are howling once again, as a terrifying ancient evil emerges in Beacon Hills. Scott McCall, no longer a teenager yet still an Alpha, must gather new allies and reunite trusted friends to fight back against this powerful and deadly enemy.','/wAkpPm3wcHRqZl8XjUI3Y2chYq2.jpg','2023-01-18',140,'Released','The pack is back.','Teen Wolf: The Movie',877703,12.2478,7.4,'3NbHKvuvI5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28868,_binary '\0','/1PnifX2JyvzmrUO5CCd0GXHjkyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15488088',6,5451,'en','Moving On','Two old friends reconnect at their friend\'s funeral, and decide to exact revenge on the widower who wronged all three of them decades earlier.','/pUZxbnF2i4gHf55tjuKIURDi8vR.jpg','2023-03-17',85,'Released','It\'s never too late to get even.','Moving On',953365,3.7583,5.9,'RCSKI5nO9V0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28869,_binary '\0','/eklBCVRWzpjUnvCjBH6c5spbWkK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15491744',7,1288,'te','Gem','Gem is a Telugu movie directed by Susheela Subhramanyam starring Vijay Raja and Rashi Singh in lead roles.','/yKZ2vSI2nYjJQhVoVksV4tQyoOT.jpg',NULL,124,'Released',NULL,'Gem',1276595,0.5331,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28870,_binary '\0','/7id7oE3gqZuO0piWN20Ev7V90wl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15494038',6.4,6206,'ja','雨を告げる漂流団地','One fateful summer, a group of elementary school kids set adrift on an abandoned apartment building must look within themselves to find a way back home.','/iNf1wC8cK6e8zgNyuMUqWFT7Din.jpg','2022-09-09',121,'Released','What is the secret hidden in the apartment complex?','Drifting Home',877957,4.6738,7.358,'BSE2KGU5png','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28871,_binary '\0','/1YL8ksfwm3p2Tgt1yaNVYYOvOKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15495150',6.1,11650,'en','The Witcher: Sirens of the Deep','When human sailors are attacked by mysterious creatures of the deep, only one person can stop the war between land and sea: the Witcher, Geralt of Rivia.','/y0pR5aBVvPn5uncaZjl94ZEnuEF.jpg','2025-02-10',92,'Released',NUL