to Vijay Salgaonkar and his family was closed, a series of unexpected events bring truth to light that threatens to change everything for the Salgaonkars. Can Vijay save his family this time?','/wk8Vu0DI0MiNLaXXiVqAwjLRKL5.jpg','2022-11-18',140,'Released',NULL,'Drishyam 2',1029827,2.4757,8,'cxA2y9Tgl7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28876,_binary '\0','/iFIv3Sz0dpasmzdSpO5qBK9hkmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15502006',7.3,1218,'en','Debbie Macomber\'s A Mrs. Miracle Christmas','When a family faces loneliness and loss of faith, Mrs. Miracle swoops in to renew their Christmas Spirit, and they experience a holiday of heavenly proportions.','/rUrCxAs3byx0jnjcfWxjtGTQ0U.jpg','2021-11-06',84,'Released',NULL,'Debbie Macomber\'s A Mrs. Miracle Christmas',877690,2.6536,6.738,'6D1_R63VA4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28877,_binary '\0','/56Iad99hgAlspgesCfC62bZpG5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15502162',4.7,3554,'hi','Hindutva','The depths of Hinduism is seen through its principal characters.Friendship, love and student politics are put in place.','/8TG91EMIYwXkSuE1aAfY9UnPKsx.jpg','2022-10-07',144,'Released',NULL,'Hindutva',1052680,0.657,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28878,_binary '\0','/5XiW5vZzxOAGUKqI2loJDFE76ms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15502356',5.7,1828,'de','Family Dinner','Overweight and insecure, Simi spends Easter weekend with her famous nutritionist aunt. The hope is that it’ll help her get on a healthier track, but as the aunt’s family’s icy dynamics and an increasingly malevolent atmosphere leave Simi feeling uneasy, weight isn’t the only thing she’s about to lose.','/5UTo2GqSwN2xUPM56xblerPlPaO.jpg','2023-01-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Family Dinner',964825,3.1453,5.8,'rPDqha73reA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28879,_binary '\0','/QdwnUl8CUmFfuQiVdFpPkOzndo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15502648',5.9,1304,'es','El test','What would you choose: be a little rich now, or wait ten years and be filthy rich? Could you wait this long? Why? And most importantly, could you come to terms with your life partner? The protagonists will have to choose between the possibility of opting for 100,000 euros at the present time or obtaining a million euros after ten years...','/r5DbPQNmPJYYJC0nv6di13Y2dB3.jpg','2022-09-02',110,'Released',NULL,'The Te$t',901944,1.14,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28880,_binary '\0','/obth7fsujmy1e9YG3WUA9JIJPbO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15502716',7.2,2970,'te','రిచి గాడి పెళ్లి','After dating for two years, Richie and Shree are set to get married in Ooty. A group of Richie\'s college buddies reunite at wedding and a tricky game over their dinner party, where a friend challenges his counterparts to attend their calls on \'speaker\', alters the course of their lives.','/7ZtAopowsr2IXsyxKkcaTcE4vf0.jpg','2023-03-03',114,'Released',NULL,'Richie Gadi Pelli',1095850,0.8992,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28881,_binary '\0','/cNMRwJ6UHfclZKn4Sevp97zL00P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1550312',7.3,17457,'fr','Café de Flore','Jacqueline is a young mother living in 1960s Paris with her disabled son Laurent. Abandoned by her husband, Jacqueline sacrifices everything to care for her son and vows to give Laurent a “normal” life full of happiness. Antoine, is a successful DJ in present day Montreal who seems to have it all: a thriving career, two beautiful daughters, partner Rose, with whom he is passionately in love. However, nothing is perfect and Antoine’s ex-wife Carole remains devastated by their recent separation.','/7RHazwQMBk4zkBM4U6CF4LfxGwZ.jpg','2011-11-17',121,'Released','Healing a broken heart isn\'t easy. Sometimes it takes a lifetime...or two.','Café de Flore',85033,2.7872,6.9,'Y3HAgq7aQOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28882,_binary '\0','/rAA1U5NI5poJextnlIGgewIZiLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1550524',6.7,2007,'en','White Irish Drinkers','A coming of age story set in 1975 working-class Brooklyn, in which two teenage brothers living with their abusive father and their well-meaning but ineffective mother are caught up in a life of petty crime. Older brother Danny concocts a daring scheme to steal enough money for the two to escape, timed around the chaos of an upcoming Rolling Stones concert. The sensitive younger brother, Brian, ultimately has a choice: remain loyal to the brother with whom he shares a powerful love-hate bond, or use his hidden talent as an artist as his own ticket out of their dead-end existence.','/2PhS5FoPvF0SWSVWqWEUv5B85FB.jpg','2011-03-25',109,'Released',NULL,'White Irish Drinkers',58194,1.5087,5.8,'e3o7S5wsa0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28883,_binary '\0','/wL3fIvKMa1Ui7rWaJByutlBMryo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15507128',5.8,2063,'en','The Trouble with Jessica','Sarah and Tom are in terrible financial trouble. On the brink of losing everything, they’ve managed to find a buyer for their stylish London home. When their best friends Richard and Beth come round for a final dinner, an uninvited old friend, Jessica, tags along.','/9wCT73zvdbX8gkvocS5nU68T1IG.jpg','2024-04-05',90,'Released','They were already in trouble... then she turned up.','The Trouble with Jessica',1056746,3.2304,5.981,'LvQfAq3ox_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28884,_binary '\0','/ytorq8y3v9g1P4sXDFv2tbNg7Ms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15507512',6.1,5789,'en','The Piano Lesson','A brother and sister\'s battle over a prized heirloom piano unleashes haunting truths about how the past is perceived — and who defines a family legacy.','/cgampq63AqCrza6bnvmWqCcvCzY.jpg','2024-11-07',127,'Released','Blood is a chord that resonates through time.','The Piano Lesson',804406,5.121,5.9,'FEpRbF9W3IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28885,_binary '\0','/lm96cKoFkmwZUSZnfDLtya05POr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15508150',7.5,3116,'en','My Christmas Family Tree','When Vanessa receives the results from her Family Tree DNA test, she discovers a family she didn\'t know existed and travels to their home for Christmas.','/nXnDMbSCKWQfH8WDkEc5kTbXZX8.jpg','2021-11-13',84,'Released','There\'s always room for more family.','My Christmas Family Tree',874194,2.6621,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28886,_binary '\0','/mFf5Hzz9A58o5clXHgvUYQ4PkmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509164',5.7,1496,'te','గాడ్సే','Vyshali, the assistant superintendent of police, is forcefully tasked to deal with unknown kidnapper Godse, who holds some high-profile personalities as hostages. Why did he kidnap them, what are his demands, and what does he want to achieve?','/cR9NesoY99WGQtQPViwbbthAWnt.jpg','2022-06-17',142,'Released',NULL,'Godse',804277,1.0251,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28887,_binary '\0','/5iXZJyEY2sDQMs7dHo9gH3qijmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509244',6.1,22943,'en','Happiness for Beginners','At a crossroads after her divorce, a schoolteacher ventures toward a fresh start in life — and love — when she signs up for a grueling group hiking trip.','/rK4jb2t3J98IXjY9O3nc8bX9yqt.jpg','2023-07-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Happiness for Beginners',881209,3.701,6.1,'45Iuy6YmMBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28888,_binary '\0','/ztAkPdxBulEpvAmU0aqqYFXwgf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509266',4.7,4428,'te','స్పై','A RAW agent is in search of his brother’s killer, unravels the connection between a notorious arms dealer and the hidden secrets of Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose, risking everything to protect India from impending chaos.','/dQstfiK8eMqRHwrgkzx4pk9td1l.jpg','2023-06-29',135,'Released',NULL,'Spy',964132,1.312,4.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28889,_binary '\0','/eD9lB3v3AYJ23b02pSSjMuIzx4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509506',6.7,5860,'te','ది 100','When a young woman\'s suicide and a spate of robberies and murders rattle the city, IPS officer Vikrant is drawn into a web of secrets, grief, and betrayal. As he digs deeper, he\'s not just cracking a case-he\'s standing up for dignity, justice, and the courage for women to rise again.','/vY7OxwSmJdrdcNWVyimkly12ufe.jpg','2025-07-11',136,'Released','It\'s not just a Number, It\'s a Weapon!','The 100',1503551,1.0044,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28890,_binary '\0','/vusj9GKxNNKR0ImecgUCJFJ9Whz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509564',5.5,1270,'te','రంగ రంగ వైభవంగా','Two childhood sweethearts love to hate each other due to their egos. What happens when they reconcile but their families begin warring each other instead?','/4FiERyPvvgla3ebsDsxsOmet7FO.jpg','2022-09-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Ranga Ranga Vaibhavanga',934772,1.0356,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28891,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15509662',7.4,1478,'en','Nallamala','A Beast - Like Human Has Entered into the Nallamala Forests at a time, when the people of India have got ridden of slavery and are rejoicing the long-awaited freedom, what happened in the Nallamala forest after savage human being entered the forest constitutes the Nallamala Story.','/vmu7doixdiiJpeXt99wkY7scj5M.jpg',NULL,133,'Released',NULL,'Nallamala',1003051,0.4181,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28892,_binary '\0','/xk0ck8qmYmevisTmphWIDm1g43p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15514498',5.9,14092,'en','Eenie Meanie','A former teenage getaway driver gets dragged back into her unsavory past when a former employer offers her a chance to save the life of her chronically unreliable ex-boyfriend.','/12Va3oO3oYUdOd75zM57Nx1976a.jpg','2025-08-21',106,'Released','He\'s her biggest blind spot.','Eenie Meanie',1151334,8.7318,6.28,'qH6SqkWS9WA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28893,_binary '\0','/17ZBSR65xyPtvZOvinaXiLfgI7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15515882',5.8,1226,'en','Under the Christmas Tree','Marketing whiz Alma Beltran and Christmas tree whisperer Charlie Freemont cross paths when Charlie finds the perfect tree for the Maine Governor\'s Holiday Celebration — right in Alma\'s back yard. While they initially spar, romantic sparks soon begin to fly between the two women as the enchanting tree and some Christmas fairy dust from the town\'s pâtissière extraordinaire bring out the best in them and spark each other to take leaps of faith and fight for love and Christmas magic.','/fMCZT3MmF3S993SuNAvMBbchQON.jpg','2021-12-19',84,'Released',NULL,'Under the Christmas Tree',883936,2.3035,6,'17lgndN4Zvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28894,_binary '\0','/8t9pNKhcGFnum8nuLWvKdmZccum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1551621',6,2559,'th','จีจ้า ดื้อ สวย ดุ','A young girl joins hands with a group of kung-fu masters to stop a notorious gang from abducting young women. However, the mission is compromised after they fail to locate the gang\'s hideout.','/56XtvAUgRzd2rfF8Jt02qBHFdBF.jpg','2009-08-12',113,'Released','She\'s back... with a vengeance.','Raging Phoenix',25855,1.9856,6.4,'ejM7ZCEzs5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28895,_binary '\0','/hcUm9SbLletMbrtu9059pi9oU2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15516226',6.6,11282,'hi','Chhatriwali','Sanya is an unemployed chemistry genius looking for a job. However, she also wants to use her knowledge of chemistry to help young minds move beyond the taboos of sex with the right education.','/yj6QBEx3QMMxfz5AqDtFEgvlfSb.jpg','2023-01-20',117,'Released',NULL,'Chhatriwali',897515,3.239,6.385,'T71-r8GFrbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28896,_binary '\0','/h45wM5ClEmKly26cK8QirQa8wpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1551630',5.7,7761,'en','Pawn','A petty robbery spirals into a tense hostage situation after three gunmen hold up a diner that\'s a front for the mob.','/x1xjvT12cF6CABsa8ji5Lj7GNyh.jpg','2013-04-23',88,'Released','Every move is a game changer','Pawn',165739,3.2871,5.5,'uADqhdOpDu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28897,_binary '\0','/u8XdZoM8SLjO9sO9uGQf6XF5rrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15516546',7.3,3557,'ml','ഇലവീഴാപൂഞ്ചിറ','Sudhi and Madhu are police officers at a small wireless police station on the hilltop. Amidst the heavy monsoon, they receive word that a woman`s body parts have been scattered all over Elaveezhapoonchira. Will they solve the mystery?','/v3SQFIQ1D0s0YAdc88xrIEQbFm9.jpg','2022-07-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Ela Veezha Poonchira',879128,1.5341,7.022,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28898,_binary '\0','/y5VNn9jt5wHGNEEAcS6T7y4XSLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15516726',5.7,14988,'hi','सेल्फी','RTO officer Om Prakash strikes a golden opportunity to meet his icon, Vijay Kumar. Bhut when his love gets spurned by the superstar, a clash of egos ensues.','/1QU1MCj0gFEZzIKl6pbfLsfClbJ.jpg','2023-02-24',143,'Released',NULL,'Selfiee',926130,1.371,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28899,_binary '\0','/wb6nDMtOojLN2I5cEHJFVDP0GQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15520020',7.5,4270,'en','Four Hours at the Capitol','The documentary is an immersive chronicle of the insurrection at the U.S. Capitol on January 6, 2021, when thousands of American citizens from across the country gathered in Washington D.C. to protest the results of the 2020 presidential election, many with the intent of disrupting the certification of Joe Biden\'s presidency.','/2PZIEIAUdpsAorGyrbESnxoL0yA.jpg','2021-10-20',92,'Released',NULL,'Four Hours at the Capitol',879535,2.8837,7.3,'qlcdaAx5hu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28900,_binary '\0','/x71agtfuKEm7B5eJg5K8Ey9G9GM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15521050',5.2,7547,'en','Love & Gelato','Lina is about to graduate high school and has her sights set on her future at MIT. But when her mom gets sick, she encourages Lina to follow in her footsteps and have