.2,2074,'te','Kapata Nataka Sutradhari','A Group Of Five Friends Lives In Pochamma Basthi Area. Being Poor They Always Dream To Lead A Happy And Luxurious Life. Suddenly Police Involve Them In Crores Of Rupees Gold Scam And Put Them In Jail. Did They Really Involve In The Scam? If Not, How They Came Out Of That?','/7sd898YvUh6aU0qEl6YDVmVJ6xT.jpg','2021-11-12',113,'Released',NULL,'Kapata Nataka Sutradhari',1037918,0.8673,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28917,_binary '\0','/cANnGY4fPkDd9URIU8L3INaiLrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1554414',5.7,1498,'en','The Dish & the Spoon','Two wounded souls commiserate through drinking and aimless wandering while acting out the roles of the happy relationships that elude them in reality.','/qx3hlKJIsd0Im2Iulak49FgVwE9.jpg','2011-03-12',90,'Released',NULL,'The Dish & the Spoon',81626,1.4974,5.4,'Pk7Imxy4xYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28918,_binary '\0','/hulaJrQbyYfxoNA4jfKgtVBPEsb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1554523',7.2,4306,'zh','山楂树之恋','The daughter of a right-winger, schoolgirl Jing Qiu is sent to the countryside for reeducation, and tasked to help write a textbook. There she meets Lao San, a young soldier with a bright future ahead. Despite the class divide and parental disapproval, romance blooms against turbulent times.','/xWMGWlhRVVKd666QaBR7D7Hd7og.jpg','2010-09-16',113,'Released',NULL,'Under the Hawthorn Tree',50542,2.7624,7.8,'88nn6fn5c04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28919,_binary '\0','/uAvtEybweIYBWo59JQetsaznE20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15546822',7.9,7740,'ml','മുകുന്ദന്‍ ഉണ്ണി അസോസിയേറ്റ്സ്™','Advocate Mukundan Unni wants to be successful and leaves no stone unturned to achieve growth, prosperity, and respect. But this steadfast nature aided with an ample dose of greed comes with a cost.','/7aEuV7eLbc0KXVBbtRZr1avWjSL.jpg','2022-11-11',127,'Released',NULL,'Mukundan Unni Associates™',880018,1.4284,7.744,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28920,_binary '\0','/bW62WOLYzax1WSG6tDTuJ5dBdT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15548032',4.2,2792,'fr','Les liaisons dangereuses','The innocent Célène might be falling in love with popular surfer Tristan at her new school. But she has no idea that, in actuality, she’s the object of a cruel bet between Tristan and Instagram influencer Vanessa.','/opTwqTgREzvP67ERVrqt0ApXbeV.jpg','2022-07-08',109,'Released',NULL,'Dangerous Liaisons',968739,3.2458,5.854,'gUHOSIe922E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28921,_binary '\0','/p2mKw6duxrpvqLY7dJHLaS4oLbg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15548074',5.1,2253,'en','The Sixth Secret','At a late-night seance, attended by twelve people, the medium announces that five secrets will be revealed before midnight. There might, however, be one more - the darkest of them all.','/rF7b0jjaqRfzAaIKpcdUBiMhJX7.jpg','2022-04-30',90,'Released','One secret too many','The Sixth Secret',964237,1.1431,5.5,'4D6fprH0sEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28922,_binary '\0','/xrXqpJqjGTNrLAtYUomcHwCvlHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555024',5.9,1344,'ko','아이리스 더 무비','Hyunjun and Sawoo, close friends and rivals from the South Korean special forces, are recruited by the secret agency NSS. They both fall for Seunghee, the beautiful but lethal profiling specialist at NSS. When they are faced against each other in a nuclear terrorist attack, they are forced to make their final decision and Seunghee\'s formidable secret is revealed.','/rL254xvbJdqQURG4MQrAGx9dkqz.jpg','2010-03-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Iris: The Movie',53656,1.9848,6.4,'lS0sRpuxMsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28923,_binary '\0','/hJgamYy7QSELC3UZSW9a3f0mjfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555064',6.3,19705,'en','Country Strong','Soon after the rising young singer-songwriter Beau Williams gets involved with a fallen, emotionally unstable country star Kelly Canter, the pair embark on a career resurrection tour helmed by her husband/manager James and featuring a beauty queen-turned-singer Chiles Stanton. Between concerts, romantic entanglements and old demons threaten to derail them all.','/6C95tD92E9xm5poyyzs37bYemM0.jpg','2010-12-22',117,'Released','It doesn\'t matter where you\'ve been as long as you come back strong.','Country Strong',45272,2.9339,6.1,'UhHRlpLuU7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28924,_binary '\0','/Ao2KeJ8GzLL4ibartNJlv5Inzw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555093',6.1,12765,'en','The Seasoning House','The Seasoning House - where young girls are prostituted to the military. An orphaned deaf mute is enslaved to care for them. She moves between the walls and crawlspaces, planning her escape. Planning her ingenious and brutal revenge.','/6AJQlfKsaNuWM1uCpXwLzYk6vx4.jpg','2012-08-21',89,'Released','Innocence isn\'t lost... it\'s taken.','The Seasoning House',127651,2.5419,6.3,'rnmt2IJtbYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28925,_binary '\0','/mROSB3VxDoum3kUOgov1Vtk8Acs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555126',7,2398,'en','The Secret Diaries of Miss Anne Lister','A lesbian in the 1800s who keeps a detailed account of her life written in coded diaries attempts to live independently while juggling an affair with a married woman.','/fpJHzNNRkLFdY41JwOdZYuAmZ23.jpg','2010-03-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Diaries of Miss Anne Lister',42548,1.7648,6.5,'HpF3bIvu3Dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28926,_binary '\0','/fnuftuStugg1sbEOeefQKQu7EE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15551346',5.3,3500,'en','The End','Twenty-five years after environmental collapse left the Earth uninhabitable, Mother, Father and Son are confined to their palatial bunker, where they struggle to maintain hope and a sense of normalcy by clinging to the rituals of daily life—until the arrival of a stranger, Girl, upends their happy routine. As tensions rise, their seemingly idyllic existence