r hurt so good for two co-workers who enter a contractual relationship as partners in consensual play, pleasure and pain.','/yQgGYiHUoDYeA4TbYlghpA5lmKH.jpg','2022-02-11',118,'Released','Will you dominate me?','Love and Leashes',760517,5.0473,6.734,'UEW3JpGCa5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28931,_binary '\0','/9YcZzSNIuPkzfr5GMLLHkUEVsIt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555440',6.3,1577,'en','Girltrash: All Night Long','The story of five girls and one epic night. The girls will find love, lust, girl-fights, rock and roll, and a whole lot of stoned sorority girls.','/xJTrdoiowuVfij1QyzdeMicf5QP.jpg','2014-02-10',85,'Released','By 2 a.m., I hope I\'m naked with her!','Girltrash: All Night Long',254936,1.9344,5.9,'aR4zXRdh73I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28932,_binary '\0','/5oNVSY9x548QIwpf7B2iHGOR5uA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15554410',7.1,1856,'pa','Aaja Mexico Challiye','Pamma is an ambitious youngster from Punjab who wants to go abroad. But this one dream turns his life around as he becomes caught in dangerous situations. Will Pamma be able to make it out of the jungles of Mexico?','/khH1DWBlGZydimNyaz2ENj57PLl.jpg','2022-02-25',125,'Released',NULL,'Aaja Mexico Challiye',940270,1.6649,8.5,'kyadkLznN-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28933,_binary '\0','/xiu4OXSCfrjWQ8MFKS7ln5gtfmr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15554616',5.3,1487,'ml','മകൾ','Juliet and her daughter Aparna live in Kerala, while Juliet’s husband Nandan works abroad. Nandan decides to move back to Kerala, and it changes the lives of the mom-daughter duo.','/uGeJE6AjzDhVDRpi3RYiPFHAa1o.jpg','2022-04-29',142,'Released',NULL,'Makal',865428,1.2435,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28934,_binary '\0','/vVNaQvEpDugLUxV6NBdJdivTT2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15554778',6,1803,'ml','മധുരം ജീവാമൃത ബിന്ദു','Explores Different Shades Of Human Desire Through Jessie, Ilyas, Samuel, And Bhaskaran - Each Chasing Passion, Longing, Or Curiosity In Their Own Way, Revealing How Desires Shape Life And Lead To Self-Realisation.','/pFf4WFC8lcmdEcaQXMeUDTbdok3.jpg','2025-10-31',115,'Released','‘Finding Happiness’','Madhuram Jeevamruthabindu',885206,1.6874,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28935,_binary '\0','/aXtcfxFp4RVO3chBblBODYYlrQT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15554886',6.6,5851,'en','Tales of Babylon','Two siblings, looking to escape their abusive mobster grandfather, join forces with a pair of hitmen with a knack for the theatrical in their search for a new life in this tale of crime, violence, and redemption.','/cX2A6fCQqOT44BKBCR2YGkwuZMF.jpg','2023-06-11',125,'Released','Everyone\'s in on the hit.','Tales of Babylon',997380,1.5738,6.2,'PBsnnf4vuZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28936,_binary '\0','/oCzNyVvxIaAUk41gBw86IOF3qq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1555747',6.6,1855,'en','Fubar II','Terry and Dean head north to make sweet cash in the oil patch.','/ry7PWiuAWZcBAlYPIgk7XWfOalk.jpg','2010-10-01',85,'Released','Give\'r Again','Fubar II',53358,1.7175,5.8,'WYn3TUmpKO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28937,_binary '\0','/3QNWdytOKgq630iT4axgFzcHzIi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15558152',4.3,3469,'en','The Visitor','After a series of tragedies including the death of his father-in-law, Robert and his wife Maia leave their home in London to move back to her childhood home. But when Robert discovers an old portrait in the attic of a man who is his spitting image, he goes down a rabbit hole to discover the identity of this mysterious doppelganger known only as the visitor. It isn’t long until he realizes – where the visitor goes, death follows.','/1FchVTEnjQw6m5NnQBa8QwjUv6T.jpg','2022-10-07',86,'Released','Where he goes, death follows.','The Visitor',881487,2.832,5.1,'QuNAnj3x4f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28938,_binary '\0','/m5I7dZYkM0SZP3tWeRRYph5LEuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15558182',2.4,2665,'en','Connie Lynn','Connie Lynn suffering post traumatic stress and depression navigates her way through life with Benny Lynn, she enters in to a whole new world she does not even know she is in without help to figure out where and who she is.','/qFhMqylxdzTn7swIMwXdtjamIvG.jpg','2022-08-19',75,'Released',NULL,'Connie Lynn',1016167,1.7962,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28939,_binary '\0','/7NVG8IJBCKkmHhqvdEVqi9vFe4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15559582',4.4,3112,'en','Bezos','Bezos chronicles the true-life story of Jeff Bezos-a humble yet awkward entrepreneur on his mission to create Amazon, the world\'s largest e-commerce company, and turning himself into the richest man in the world.','/9C6uwthu07qDfTyyYuhwvMS4dDI.jpg','2023-04-27',94,'Released',NULL,'Bezos',982104,2.25,6,'kCI-wOgrrFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28940,_binary '\0','/59oZSqxeBVwRgye5gWjGjAHHM7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15560132',4.9,3246,'en','Lovely, Dark, and Deep','Lennon, a new back-country ranger, travels alone through the dangerous wilderness, hoping to uncover the origins of a tragedy that has haunted her since she was a child.','/d4maZqH6a4vOUKuFzUrARZAiNc3.jpg','2023-07-23',87,'Released','She owes this land a body.','Lovely, Dark, and Deep',1062528,1.7642,5.1,'l78Serj793I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28941,_binary '\0','/bM3uB05kO12okK2PTKHp0m823fe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15560314',7.1,4699,'dz','The Monk and the Gun','An American travels to Bhutan searching for a valuable antique rifle and crosses paths with a young monk who wanders through the serene mountains, instructed by his teacher to make things right again.','/nhGaCXeBvFo7495aIZr261l6kb0.jpg','2023-10-17',107,'Released','Once upon a time in Bhutan...','The Monk and the Gun',1109237,2.8891,7.2,'OesAEwWIJlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(28942,_binary '\0','/qaRAlt903g3S