g for \"Superman\"','Gripping, heartbreaking, and ultimately hopeful, Waiting for Superman is an impassioned indictment of the American school system from An Inconvenient Truth director Davis Guggenheim.','/l7mRlEi4VCEH7sfgaXX1b6LzsXn.jpg','2010-09-24',111,'Released','The fate of our country won\'t be decided on a battlefield, it will be determined in a classroom.','Waiting for \"Superman\"',39440,1.5484,6.9,'h9FLXNiGtQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29035,_binary '\0','/fAOt0YV6xRyGDfnIIpo18YZd5QP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15670222',3.2,2684,'en','The Flood','A horde of giant hungry alligators is unleashed on a group of in-transit prisoners and their guards after a massive hurricane floods Louisiana.','/mvjqqklMpHwOxc40rn7dMhGT0Fc.jpg','2023-07-14',93,'Released','Danger is rising.','The Flood',1006462,4.8069,6.091,'xx5sYS0pHJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29036,_binary '\0','/rRcNmiH55Tz0ugUsDUGmj8Bsa4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15671028',6.3,222037,'en','No Hard Feelings','On the brink of losing her childhood home, Maddie discovers an intriguing job listing: wealthy helicopter parents looking for someone to “date” their introverted 19-year-old son, Percy, before he leaves for college. To her surprise, Maddie soon discovers the awkward Percy is no sure thing.','/gD72DhJ7NbfxvtxGiAzLaa0xaoj.jpg','2023-06-15',103,'Released','Pretty. Awkward.','No Hard Feelings',884605,18.3796,6.67,'7psP7xBEa28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29037,_binary '\0','/okL1DAWIi4fuAKq9q0xdk9Ylp0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15671624',6.9,2394,'hi','मायासभा: द हॉल ऑफ इल्यूजन','In a Mumbai theater, a producer, his son, and two intruders clash during one night over hidden treasure. As they search for gold, deception grows, secrets emerge, and past wounds resurface.','/hIC4knJmcAO02JPjF840FJBI4ib.jpg','2026-01-30',104,'Released','The Hall of Illusion.','Mayasabha: The Hall of Illusion',1094314,1.6317,0,'NR5zwpCZ6Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29038,_binary '\0','/ltABzS3q8Vowc85lEIuOi0gEoiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1567233',7.7,13019,'en','Forks Over Knives','Examines the profound claim that most; if not all; of the degenerative diseases that afflict us can be controlled; or even reversed; by rejecting our present menu of animal-based and processed foods. The idea of food as medicine is put to the test. Cameras follow \"reality patients\" who have chronic conditions from heart disease to diabetes. Doctors teach these patients how to adopt a whole-foods, plant-based diet as the primary approach to treat their ailments - while the challenges and triumphs of their journeys are revealed.','/v3SC1ztIEpo41AvF5frURCdvLOx.jpg','2011-05-06',90,'Released','Warning - This movie could save your life!','Forks Over Knives',64288,1.4306,7.131,'DZb-35oV_7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29039,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1567312',5,1229,'tr','Gelecekten Bir Gün',NULL,'/iyC3WM2FrZ6KO7e5ZpesMdZImIW.jpg','2010-01-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Gelecekten Bir Gün',52076,1.2583,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29040,_binary '\0','/d5tcsjdLw3uxBd318EIcTn9e35X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1567437',6.3,67365,'en','The Voices','A mentally unhinged factory worker must decide whether to listen to his talking cat and become a killer, or follow his dog\'s advice to keep striving for normalcy.','/weY5OVSFmxvA3D4lfyhgvugklEh.jpg','2014-01-19',104,'Released','Hearing voices can be murder.','The Voices',244458,5.5838,6.265,'aKp-lDM5fus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29041,_binary '\0','/ytEM935ESHPFuOQ30R2uMiSUYiB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1567448',7.4,41764,'tr','Yahşi Batı','Aziz and Lemi must recover a diamond gifted by the Sultan of the Ottoman Empire to the U.S. President which has been stolen by bandits in the American wild west.','/mk1HYwHQnHWeiRQ2UqY7Frjub05.jpg','2009-12-31',112,'Released',NULL,'Yahşi Batı',30691,1.5642,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29042,_binary '\0','/5QVM3Uf1bgTcRyfwFlEKrUxNE6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1567609',6.9,115245,'en','Get the Gringo','A career criminal nabbed by Mexican authorities is placed in a tough prison where he learns to survive with the help of a 9-year-old boy.','/sLzL1xG6JgVEEQ4DqSJpnJw3D2A.jpg','2012-03-15',96,'Released','The odds are against him. So is everyone else.','Get the Gringo',80389,8.7635,6.6,'ETppILg_CYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29043,_binary '\0','/hyR5Lfzf2ZvCtIJGMcMYOK5KcLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15676664',5.5,5435,'es','Venus','Lucía, a club dancer on the run, takes refuge in a sinister building on the outskirts of Madrid where her sister Rocío lives with her daughter Alba.','/bh1sVFEvlcmDbyUN6W4f7NC6Ay8.jpg','2022-12-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Venus',931954,2.9187,6.161,'WflBCCVdDkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29044,_binary '\0','/mZ6J2g6HCV2gj3iuCdSxcyBXq9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15678738',6.8,7307,'en','David','From the songs of his mother’s heart to the whispers of a faithful God, David’s story begins in quiet devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation, a young shepherd armed with only a sling, a few stones, and unshakable faith steps forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose, his journey tests the limits of loyalty, love, and courage—culminating in a battle not just for a crown, but for the soul of a kingdom.','/bESlrLOrsQ9gKzaGQGHXKOyIUtX.jpg','2025-12-14',109,'Released','A giant musical event.','David',1167307,14.7193,8,'gWgyI6_lR0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29045,_binary '\0','/AlLUCXfvxs1jVC2VEcBt7U7YY7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15678810',5.7,1237,'en','Bleeding Love','In an effort to reunite with his daughter after a period of absence, a father takes her on a road trip to Santa Fe, New Mexico. Along the way they encounter some interesting characters and obstacles while sorting out their relationship.','/i3s6n7XtZqepNA1Mv32cvwSfGX8.jpg','2024-02-16',96,'Released','The hardest journeys take you home.','Bleeding Love',1000780,3.0726,6.3,'U5piU4rmc0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29046,_binary '\0','/sANUefL2v8VI6fSfK3gWAG3XBt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15679400',6.1,143317,'en','Knock at the Cabin','While vacationing at a remote cabin, a young girl and her two fathers are taken hostage by four armed strangers who demand that the family make an unthinkable choice to avert the apocalypse. With limited access to the outside world, the family must decide what they believe before all is lost.','/dm06L9pxDOL9jNSK4Cb6y139rrG.jpg','2023-02-01',100,'Released','Save your family or save humanity. Make the choice.','Knock at the Cabin',631842,11.4582,6.241,'0wiBHEACNHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29047,_binary '\0','/hxqc4x1Ifxf3DSzqtuEUDMIkSqN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15680228',6.5,12856,'hi','भीड़','8 hours, complete lockdown in the whole of India, movement shut and state borders sealed. Thousands of migrants without food, water and mode of transport were forced to return to their homes. A crisis that shook the whole nation, a time when borders of disparity divided the people and one man stood for humanity.','/sJ3uHEY9LLP0BpdPy0KlJzYnmkv.jpg','2023-03-24',112,'Released','In the darkest of times, one man stood for humanity','Bheed',1081726,1.4095,6.125,'lGAKZ6L9IVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29048,_binary '\0','/vavw5MAIDtOpugBp4ei0FKbozyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568139',4.3,2049,'en','Beat the World','Three dance crews – one Latin American, one European and one Canadian – prepare to battle at the International Beat the World competition in Detroit. Along the way, they struggle with gambling debt, bad break-ups and their own egos. In the final showdown to become world champions they find that their lifelong hopes, dreams and even lives, are at stake.','/nZCPl2Du2PRkky4Mzb4YiXk9C1Q.jpg','2011-06-10',91,'Released','Feel the beat, live the dream.','Beat the World',66767,1.7028,5.2,'tz3e6iq9iOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29049,_binary '\0','/YIADHDdyLYMupOATE9Yn0UKueV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568150',7.4,3911,'en','Joan Rivers: A Piece of Work','A documentary on the life and career of Joan Rivers, made as the comedienne turns 75 years old.','/5BB0mplCUR1hHgQqR08FZgHBBdO.jpg','2010-01-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Joan Rivers: A Piece of Work',41397,1.8277,6.9,'eM4zqYR_lKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29050,_binary '\0','/rRIz3KweJDjnJ4GtCZJT3JPEYgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15682498',6.4,1265,'en','The Last Stand of Ellen Cole','When an evil contractor goes to extreme measures to evict a testy tenant who is standing in the way of his new project, he fails to take into account that this seemingly harmless old woman is a trained killer and will do anything to protect her beloved home.','/oq1pGVQ2t3Cy4v7sA4LRhNjtZuJ.jpg','2024-10-18',92,'Released',NULL,'The Last Stand of Ellen Cole',1411773,8.3018,8.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29051,_binary '\0','/zSAxVPc6OG9iPG9JGYimSdE1WEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568323',4.5,1271,'en','Beatdown','Brandon, a respected street fighter, is forced to flee the city after his brother is murdered and the money that was supposed to be paid back to a local gangster is stolen. While lying low at his father\'s house in a small Southern town, Brandon soon gets involved in the local underground cage-fighting circuit. With the help of Drake Colby, a former MMA champion, Brandon devises a scheme to bring a massive payday, if they are able to survive.','/6OfVPybktlixESHrHQ5ZdN68prO.jpg','2010-08-31',89,'Released','To fight another day...you must survive.','Beatdown',44745,1.7233,4.3,'bfl58LzsAXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29052,_binary '\0','/crFhLNVDCpW6NkU0CmBm3eLq2HT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568334',7.7,5104,'en','The Tillman Story','Pat Tillman never thought of himself as a hero. His choice to leave a multimillion-dollar football contract and join the military wasn\'t done for any reason other than he felt it was the right thing to do. The fact that the military manipulated his tragic death in the line of duty into a propaganda tool is unfathomable and thoroughly explored in Amir Bar-Lev\'s riveting and enraging documentary.','/aIHiKAWoGmleP6ODNfQOOCaMeix.jpg','2010-08-22',94,'Released','A mystery. A cover-up. A crime. One family will risk everything for the truth.','The Tillman Story',43924,2.051,7.1,'lg2FOSqRvxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29053,_binary '\0','/pj5hxCxAgFCmNeyC3S4hSt286Z1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568335',7.7,2635,'en','Jean-Michel Basquiat: The Radiant Child','A thoughtful portrait of a renowned artist, this documentary shines the spotlight on New York City painter Jean-Michel Basquiat. Featuring extensive interviews conducted by Basquiat\'s friend, filmmaker Tamra Davis, the production reveals how he dealt with being a black artist in a predominantly white field. The film also explores Basquiat\'s rise in the art world, which led to a close relationship with Andy Warhol, and looks at how the young painter coped with acclaim, scrutiny and fame.','/zJzYFGNwEXO7uzf5cNi8QnS6nXf.jpg','2010-01-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Jean-Michel Basquiat: The Radiant Child',51486,1.7282,7.2,'eXjR-y0WH-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29054,_binary '\0','/mThjtfdi5aZi2Ctoj4ysaEYM7J9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568337',6.1,6403,'en','Loosies','A young pickpocket in the New York subways – living a fast, free lifestyle – is confronted by a woman who he had a one night affair with. She informs him that she is pregnant with his child. He must now choose between continuing with his lifestyle and taking responsibility for his actions.','/qjQHb11UOj0ms0d6EYk4Qm48yeB.jpg','2012-02-01',89,'Released','Love is not a crime.','Loosies',79465,2.2094,5.7,'L5RMmaLayUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29055,_binary '\0','/z7dLToPL37g8AbaFkMTwgxWh2GT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568338',6.6,162879,'en','Man on a Ledge','An ex-cop turned con threatens to jump to his death from a Manhattan hotel rooftop. The NYPD dispatch a female police psychologist to talk him down. However, unbeknownst to the police on the scene, the suicide attempt is a cover for the biggest diamond heist ever pulled.','/pziTpiYy5dtVdvXctYIZv09r5Nk.jpg','2012-01-13',102,'Released','You can only push an innocent man so far','Man on a Ledge',49527,13.2912,6.4,'sBJSfqdhyTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29056,_binary '\0','/fPhFYHXxOC32SpLaHGKZZcbYzfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568341',6.3,6371,'en','Some Guy Who Kills People','A former mental patient\'s repressed anger reaches the boiling point, leading him to embark on a mission of revenge against the thugs who once subjected him to severe physical and mental trauma.','/m6sqWQDcg7er0dg7LomMQGeVBMO.jpg','2011-04-14',97,'Released','Your number is up.','Some Guy Who Kills People',80468,2.0543,6.1,'hNae-InUJ74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29057,_binary '\0','/fcT6oAirY3L1I2ysKbJulmz8fTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568343',5.5,7642,'en','The Humbling','Following a breakdown and suicide attempt, an aging actor becomes involved with a much younger woman but soon finds that it\'s difficult to keep pace with her.','/8x8NUmtcuNqlIH1JDAoxUjoDX7P.jpg','2014-12-31',112,'Released','Older but not wiser.','The Humbling',254023,4.8572,5.111,'qu6SCUXeYl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29058,_binary '\0','/dNFbrnF0mIBm0rClbfEFWTtsgMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568346',7.8,533617,'en','The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo','Disgraced journalist Mikael Blomkvist investigates the disappearance of a weary patriarch\'s niece from 40 years ago. He is aided by the pierced, tattooed, punk computer hacker named Lisbeth Salander. As they work together in the investigation, Blomkvist and Salander uncover immense corruption beyond anything they have ever imagined.','/8bokS83zGdhaXgN9tjidUKmAftW.jpg','2011-12-14',158,'Released','What is hidden in snow, comes forth in the thaw.','The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo',65754,13.9138,7.385,'DqQe3OrsMKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29059,_binary '\0','/dp0rdbGSbZTyWumnbWspXQp87hA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15683734',5.2,9286,'en','It Lives Inside','Desperate to fit in at school, Sam rejects her Indian culture and family to be like everyone else. However, when a mythological demonic spirit latches onto her former best friend, she must come to terms with her heritage to defeat it.','/73gIfV8gDwkVgUrFDzt4TfZC9Zc.jpg','2023-09-06',99,'Released','You can\'t contain evil.','It Lives Inside',1024773,4.3208,5.7,'FrPYOf5RmYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29060,_binary '\0','/nXAX76qmDwMPa5Gsxubb3NI2ANx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15684550',4.6,1509,'de','Die Geschichte der Menschheit - leicht gekürzt','In order to leave a lasting impression in space, Dr. Georg Friedle and his team of researchers include a condensed version of world history with the 1977 Voyager mission. However, their attempt to present themselves as an intelligent and empathic race backfires unchecked: their version presents a completely insane species whose development is apparently based on pure luck rather than solid reason. A planet where Greek philosophers are celebrated as rap stars, religion is touted as a clever marketing concept, stag parties serve as a secret weapon in the First World War and the construction of the Great Wall of China is a misunderstanding of honest Berlin craftsmanship. Even the revelation of the alleged true background to the assassination attempt on Hitler is likely to make experienced historians see the end of humanity as a mere matter of time.','/l6VGhaR0KkysQqk1QUTB6r6M78R.jpg','2022-06-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Die Geschichte der Menschheit - leicht gekürzt',915646,1.6729,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29061,_binary '\0','/2zjLxtdr1xInAxH06ZIrE9HVe4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15685360',5.9,1998,'en','You Gotta Believe','After dedicating the season to a teammate’s ailing father, a group of underestimated Ft. Worth youth baseball players takes its Cinderella run all the way to the 2002 Little League World Series—culminating in a record-breaking showdown that became an instant ESPN classic.','/l4X9SeMFCv414BCt97IBgzYX7JC.jpg','2024-08-30',104,'Released','A team of underdogs, with the spirit of champions.','You Gotta Believe',1143508,3.5725,7.3,'0r_nbHSOyDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29062,_binary '\0','/9WqDA9gCvCKCofSr1nyRwrD1Z2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15685876',6.1,5664,'te','ధమకా','Swamy and Anand Chakravarthy are lookalikes. Swamy is a jobless guy, while Anand is the son of Nanda Gopal Chakravarthy, running a company called People Mart. Under dicey circumstances Pranavi, a pretty young girl falls in love with both of them. When JP, a monstrous corporate honcho seeks to acquire People Mart through unethical means, Anand and Swamy’s lives get intertwined.','/h2NL8TIoQAkaMr5c5sKx2MryviU.jpg','2022-12-23',138,'Released','Double Impact','Dhamaka',888234,1.5297,4.217,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29063,_binary '\0','/g5sUt0l6m6dcfSxuBmrxJhBbFzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568815',6.6,1379,'da','En familie','Ditte owns a gallery, has a loving boyfriend and her dream job in New York is within reach. But Ditte is also the youngest generation of the famous bakery dynasty, Rheinwald, and when her beloved, but dominating father comes down with a serious illness, Ditte is faced with the grueling decision: To pursue her own dreams, or to continue the legacy of her family.','/u9oXCU4rzZWZpHqZ5zjFoYB57WE.jpg','2011-02-24',102,'Released',NULL,'A Family',58483,1.405,6.1,'ufj9GM3qZZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29064,_binary '\0','/rWRjiJFZ7uBsEGsgZkXC3HMyWsr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568816',5.9,3477,'es','Fase 7','A man protects his pregnant wife from their neighbors after the apartment is quarantined.','/eatj8zYMIaEYkMbB2h1nGcnJeJk.jpg','2010-07-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Phase 7',69278,1.3382,5.7,'c0OURCVRGYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29065,_binary '\0','/tcx15vswrQJCGET5lGxESQ4J5LG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568911',7.2,174677,'en','War Horse','On the brink of the First World War, Albert\'s beloved horse Joey is sold to the Cavalry by his father. Against the backdrop of the Great War, Joey begins an odyssey full of danger, joy, and sorrow, and he transforms everyone he meets along the way. Meanwhile, Albert, unable to forget his equine friend, searches the battlefields of France to find Joey and bring him home.','/3aRHhvvngFPJFy5uAjo7GVr3PhL.jpg','2011-12-25',146,'Released','Separated by war. Tested by battle. Bound by friendship.','War Horse',57212,9.943,7.3,'MFD_UlEvzUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29066,_binary '\0','/7Z7WVzJsSReG8B0CaPk0bvWD7tK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568921',7.6,119117,'ja','借りぐらしのアリエッティ','14-year-old Arrietty and the rest of the Clock family live in peaceful anonymity as they make their own home from items \"borrowed\" from the house\'s human inhabitants. However, life changes for the Clocks when a human boy discovers Arrietty.','/3lSRaSjDp2nkXMQkzzjpRi3035O.jpg','2010-07-16',95,'Released','Discover a secret world within our own.','Arrietty',51739,12.0697,7.7,'DskjJGeaRQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29067,_binary '\0','/h3afDLFbPJLX6sSgX13CYDzdFqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1568923',7.4,1976,'he','שתיקת הארכיון','Yael Hersonski\'s powerful documentary achieves a remarkable feat through its penetrating look at another film-the now-infamous Nazi-produced film about the Warsaw Ghetto. Discovered after the war, the unfinished work, with no soundtrack, quickly became a resource for historians seeking an authentic record, despite its elaborate propagandistic construction. The later discovery of a long-missing reel complicated earlier readings, showing the manipulations of camera crews in these \"everyday\" scenes. Well-heeled Jews attending elegant dinners and theatricals (while callously stepping over the dead bodies of compatriots) now appeared as unwilling, but complicit, actors, alternately fearful and in denial of their looming fate.','/kWYVUSgbuPYNbFg5Fh3RXx67R1.jpg','2010-08-18',89,'Released',NULL,'A Film Unfinished',58772,1.2264,6.5,'5Z7egcyAdbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29068,_binary '\0','/wO46AY2nLQoLdRYD64FS5AsUCbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15690300',4.3,4639,'en','Hot Seat','An ex-hacker is forced to break into high-level banking institutions, another man must try to penetrate the booby-trapped building to get the young man off the hot seat.','/6zoA2yEfKs8hNFlk4AV28VpoT3I.jpg','2022-07-01',99,'Released','No time to think. Nowhere to run. One chance to live.','Hot Seat',888195,4.1602,5.1,'4LkSJv66OFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29069,_binary '\0','/wVTDmUbmpHMRxPHwrWixobJjktY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15691228',6,1318,'en','Nantucket Noel','During the Seaside Noel celebrations, Christin learns of a developer who is planning to tear down the wharf that is home to her toy store. Tensions rise as she falls for the developer\'s son, Andy.','/oBpmDCdW1UehU1EfjGReth7F6tZ.jpg','2021-11-19',84,'Released','Let love light your way.','Nantucket Noel',874122,1.598,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29070,_binary '\0','/SpcCpHfaiWoBef6McRyl2UGlDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15691922',5.7,1329,'en','Christmas CEO','A small toy company CEO gets a once in a lifetime offer to merge with a mega toy company but will need her estranged ex-business partner\'s signature to seal the deal. What he helps her rediscover will change both of their lives.','/sEr64YRNev9EW7YIyUqpcxK8Z9T.jpg','2021-11-26',84,'Released','Playing with toys is serious business.','Christmas CEO',874193,1.4185,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29071,_binary '\0','/jEnjpMAhpDfvjZjH8onONF5tY8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15692408',7.2,2057,'hu','Zanox - Kockázatok és mellékhatások','As a result of a medical drug experiment, Misi will be able to travel through time, but only if he drinks from a special homemade spirit.','/db1ni4k6iW9DMSYonSYy7Ki1wMe.jpg','2022-05-26',89,'Released',NULL,'Zanox',957466,1.7198,7.2,'G_l_xf6HJrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29072,_binary '\0','/pVoHdy9DMyOVRnfcKmSMPJvq633.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1569364',5.6,5859,'ru','Чёрная Молния','A Moscow University student discovers that his otherwise unremarkable car can fly. After his father is attacked, he decides to use the car to fight crime and becomes the city\'s defender against an evil millionaire.','/7jR8cXfPw0bXx4vc2YUlBxPbg0q.jpg','2009-12-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Black Lightning',31162,3.5134,6.264,'jzhQnJo-D-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29073,_binary '\0','/kKLpMldF5EVxO3z3VfueGc5tr0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1569465',4.7,2793,'ru','Наша Russia: Яйца Судьбы','Rafshan and Dzhumzhud, migrant workers from Nubarashen, illegally come to Moscow, where the team leader Leonid received an order for super-expensive repairs from one oligarch. Having lost in the capital the “nationalist”, Rafshan and Dzhumzhud are trying to find and save him, wreaking havoc and destruction everywhere. But in the most hopeless situation, fate turns to guest workers - Rafshan and Dzhumzhud learn a terrible secret that will change everything ...','/yVzKZwVAYfz9ls1XtTdAm6cRFoQ.jpg','2010-01-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Our Russia: Eggs of Destiny',31059,1.0675,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29074,_binary '\0','/gBMnep0wWtTmka9WhJWoC6NT5H0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15699148',6.9,3094,'ml','പ്യാലി','Story of two young siblings compassion for each other and how they overcome obstacles in life.','/xX6bEkUSuuFusTEvH4KdQ90iTV.jpg','2022-07-08',116,'Released',NULL,'Pyali',990804,0.9595,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29075,_binary '\0','/mz8VQqcHsDpbIYa3hQP9m75LXcI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570538',5.4,1909,'tr','Ada: Zombilerin Düğünü','Five people who knew each other for a long time a group of friends, to attend the wedding of a mutual friend goes to Buyukada. Erhan, weddings, and long intervals, the team can come together to be able to record their happy moments brought a camera, and is continuous. All throughout the film viewed, it is reflected from the camera. Later a group of wedding guests attacking zombie, turns into a mess of blood.','/lAjJIjryeJbPNHdScs7plCBEurD.jpg','2010-01-29',76,'Released',NULL,'Island: Wedding of the Zombies',52092,0.9253,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29076,_binary '\0','/na7GJo2NLgoKod1gNi4vuPsXeo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570559',6.4,4201,'en','Burning Man','Tom is a British chef in a Bondi restaurant who seems to have decided there are no longer any rules he needs to obey. Whatever Tom is up to, his actions seem to be tolerated by those around him. As Tom descends into darkness, fragments of a different story begin to emerge. All the women in his world are trying in their own, very different ways to help put him back together.','/uqRG3Tl5zdzLPGPQjZsrJr8Eq4A.jpg','2011-09-10',111,'Released','Don\'t go so far out that you can\'t find your way back.','Burning Man',73565,2.2426,6,'9EMOW1auvZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29077,_binary '\0','/wCnBxGgvFSXgRBBkx0uO18DcxA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570583',6,2413,'en','For Ellen','After an overnight long-distance drive, Joby has a special meeting—with lawyers and his ex-wife. A struggling musician with the prerequisite tattoos, slimy hair, goatee, and his head firmly floating in the clouds, Joby hasn’t been around to be a dad. Now is his last chance to fight for shared custody of his daughter, Ellen.','/w3qMjOVOzwheOh9PbLEnZfNKNmh.jpg','2012-02-12',93,'Released',NULL,'For Ellen',84201,1.8532,5.4,'uxTghjN_3EI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29078,_binary '\0','/7dEizrcjurHpIFyGX0YRHqlNsxx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15706104',6,1630,'en','Boyfriends of Christmas Past','Leading up to Christmas, marketing executive, Lauren, is visited by the ghosts of four ex-boyfriends. She must learn to open her heart or risk losing her best friend, Nate.','/1AtCO9ZLk0yOolkabEj3TFfBpSB.jpg','2021-10-23',84,'Released','A comedy of break-ups, make-ups, and wake-ups.','Boyfriends of Christmas Past',874162,2.1983,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29079,_binary '\0','/7mtumZLFnSY68qWKtrHZjgjcoDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570619',3.2,6355,'tr','Kutsal Damacana 2: İtmen','Fikret returns to Istanbul to tangle with Somali pirates and sojourns in a Budhist monastery to battle a werewolf.','/zFvPejZN5HVIt7Zl5m1EA5yUGEy.jpg','2010-02-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Kutsal Damacana 2: İtmen',52161,1.3986,2.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29080,_binary '\0','/vyrCniZsrXZAW08eECKIp1BMLPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570728',7.4,629413,'en','Crazy, Stupid, Love.','Cal Weaver is living the American dream. He has a good job, a beautiful house, great children and a beautiful wife, named Emily. Cal\'s seemingly perfect life unravels, however, when he learns that Emily has been unfaithful and wants a divorce. Over 40 and suddenly single, Cal is adrift in the fickle world of dating. Enter, Jacob Palmer, a self-styled player who takes Cal under his wing and teaches him how to be a hit with the ladies.','/p4RafgAPk558muOjnBMHhMArjS2.jpg','2011-07-29',118,'Released','This is crazy. This is stupid. This is love.','Crazy, Stupid, Love.',50646,17.7982,7.278,'W7U03cW7k-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29081,_binary '\0','/6Ri679LLogY38LdtuazN9GukiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570732',5.3,6196,'ta','வேட்டைக்காரன்','Police-Ravi is a student aspiring to become a police officer,becomes hunted when he helps his friend out of trouble.The hunted becomes the Hunter to secure his future.','/Izeu2M0T0EMqtJWziKraltXvAU.jpg','2009-12-18',166,'Released',NULL,'Vettaikaaran',63635,1.5557,4.775,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29082,_binary '\0','/u6PcBlZIx56tgjWVEm0s46QHeaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570966',5.7,3721,'sv','Farsan','A heartwarming tale about a beloved father who is trying to cope with cultural clashes, loss and the search for love in average Swedish society.','/5N21xFLmk6MDXpQbGtgzyEfCcWj.jpg','2010-02-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Balls',32497,1.2691,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29083,_binary '\0','/kL1V6LpdI1nozZaqGbt8FvDzdTC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570970',6,3974,'fr','Mes chères études','Nineteen-year-old Laura is stressed by her first year at college when money worries distract her from her studies and so, desperate for cash, she answers an online advertisement for intimate companionship that leads her down a dangerous path.','/vSpMWP1iX2KeRyIcHV3nINeBxlQ.jpg','2010-01-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Student Services',65496,7.4776,5.3,'9RZTWgCBxlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29084,_binary '\0','/pyXuLJm0IfkvqQS8F2mJpqEGX0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1570989',6.2,15559,'en','Tiny Furniture','After graduating from film school, Aura returns to New York to live with her photographer mother, Siri, and her sister, Nadine, who has just finished high school. Aura is directionless and wonders where to go next in her career and her life. She takes a job in a restaurant and tries unsuccessfully to develop relationships with men, including Keith, a chef where she works, and cult Internet star Jed.','/5T81WvUlc1Our3UwmluXBBc3L0k.jpg','2010-11-12',99,'Released','Aura would like you to know that she is having a very, very hard time.','Tiny Furniture',47607,2.4124,5.6,'m_UVdNH0gJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29085,_binary '\0','/hmmO043egTRuKyWUmdq7jvezMBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15710136',6.5,12537,'te','యశోద','Looking to save her sister, Yashoda, a desperate woman agrees to be a surrogate and move in to a plush facility - but nothing is as it seems. In the world outside Eva, a Hollywood starlet dies under mysterious circumstances, so do a tycoon and a super model. An unknown drug seem to hold the key to the whole mystery.','/gSYkMzVRBeYwBgvQ155oORPJzmW.jpg','2022-11-11',135,'Released',NULL,'Yashoda',900222,2.1382,6.054,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29086,_binary '\0','/hE6Ifb6EZRkYk6yn3atC0ayDZgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15711350',3.3,1484,'en','The Fourth Musketeer','At the behest of his father, young d\'Artagnan travels from rural Gascony to Paris, where he becomes embroiled in a devious plot between the King\'s Musketeers and the Guardsmen of Cardinal Richelieu.','/zDgvlxVCq5doyAaQHOPuMScokoe.jpg','2022-03-07',85,'Released','One for all, all for one.','The Fourth Musketeer',919348,1.3049,4.6,'8INWiLf0-Q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29087,_binary '\0','/l0yU6sBGmV0B37oSWAX2Wesqk6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15711610',5.5,1241,'lt','Rūpintojėlis','A group of classmates celebrate their graduation in an isolated place about which a sinister story is told.','/7uviS1XZZoLjn30thrJYWOBhw8N.jpg','2022-11-04',85,'Released','Beware of what you do to others','We Might Hurt Each Other',994773,1.0289,5.6,'2I9uH99Gkx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29088,_binary '\0','/iGMz1vJEVZNdBafpE7vrHIj1Quo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571222',6.4,112613,'en','A Dangerous Method','Seduced by the challenge of an impossible case, the driven Dr. Carl Jung takes the unbalanced yet beautiful Sabina Spielrein as his patient. Jung’s weapon is the method of his master, the renowned Sigmund Freud. Both men fall under Sabina’s spell.','/7TPYtzq9ABkfED1JB0tRASamL4z.jpg','2011-09-30',99,'Released','Why deny what you desire the most.','A Dangerous Method',48231,6.0477,6.3,'ZhunuJRo8jA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29089,_binary '\0','/rm2oMykm5nX6SzXFr7TGHkO6r8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571234',6.1,154896,'en','Mortal Engines','Many thousands of years in the future, Earth’s cities roam the globe on huge wheels, devouring each other in a struggle for ever diminishing resources. On one of these massive traction cities, the old London, Tom Natsworthy has an unexpected encounter with a mysterious young woman from the wastelands who will change the course of his life forever.','/gLhYg9NIvIPKVRTtvzCWnp1qJWG.jpg','2018-11-27',128,'Released','Some scars never heal','Mortal Engines',428078,18.0669,6.254,'IRsFc2gguEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29090,_binary '\0','/vHZcuvAZbmNeS34pUHB98svwIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571249',6.8,47152,'en','The Skeleton Twins','Estranged twins Maggie and Milo coincidentally cheat death on the same day, prompting them to reunite and confront the reasons their lives went so wrong. As the twins\' reunion reinvigorates them, they realize the key to fixing their lives may just lie in repairing their relationship.','/lDygTdg1KlrVJVzqsFL515uGzSe.jpg','2014-06-05',92,'Released','Family is a cruel joke.','The Skeleton Twins',244772,3.4723,6.643,'nhULZJDXLaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29091,_binary '\0','/y4XBYLldCLuNLVeObTndfAaUrc3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15713012',5.8,2553,'fr','Overdose','Captain Sara Bellaiche, from Toulouse Judiciary Police branch, is investigating a go-fast linked to the murder of two teenagers, an investigation led by Richard Cross, from the Paris Criminal Brigade. Forced to collaborate in order to find the murderer and stop the bloody go-fast, Sara and Richard are both thrown in a breathless race against the clock on the roads of Spain and France.','/gZRUmFMTAduMyMdjdETd8zn9RFK.jpg','2022-11-04',119,'Released','Two cops, one killer, and a race against time across France and Spain.','Overdose',896485,2.8703,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29092,_binary '\0','/8fxG2HK1CxfB4DfPwbzUeMwutCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571401',5.7,3418,'de','Die Vermessung der Welt','Germany in the early 19th century. \"Die Vermessung der Welt\" follows the two brilliant and eccentric scientists Alexander von Humboldt and Carl Friedrich Gauss on their life paths.','/cEzYumB3zmDN5VobhKHVV3jK60y.jpg','2012-10-24',127,'Released',NULL,'Measuring the World',115023,3.6391,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29093,_binary '\0','/ogVQgSTF6E4hjNJuvzk5Zi1rDcv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571402',6.8,3621,'it','Vallanzasca - Gli angeli del male','Set in Italy in the 1970s, VALLANZASCA is the true story of the Italian underworld’s most infamous outlaw. A criminal by age 9, Renato Vallanzasca grew up to become the country’s most notorious mobster before the age of 27. Vallanzasca and his gang wrested control of the Milan underworld with a string of high profile robberies, kidnappings and murders. In the process, he captivated the public and earned the nickname ‘il bel Renè’ – for his devilish charm and handsome face. Arrested multiple times, his daring escapes from prison enraged the government, angered his rivals and fed his legend.','/gy3999DHePSXUR64OSz67PrW07s.jpg','2010-09-06',102,'Released','The incredible true story of Italy\'s most notorious gangster.','Angel of Evil',54441,2.337,6.756,'Wt3iY26bY0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29094,_binary '\0','/y2rBbw8XvHi68OCz6Z3ba8e44vk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571409',6.7,2843,'en','Parked','Fred Daly returns to Ireland with nowhere to live but his car. Then dope-smoking 21-year-old Cathal parks beside him, and brightens up his lonely world. Encouraged by Cathal, Fred meets attractive music teacher Jules. Growing closer, these three outsiders are set on a course that will change their lives forever.','/uYT3ERLIRpvkrpum2MnKpPMGWX6.jpg','2010-09-01',94,'Released','Sometimes the person you least expect can help you find your way home.','Parked',59110,1.288,6.509,'BlSdEuZidVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29095,_binary '\0','/aWoinUH9xn78YTiPp8NFubBtBvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15715122',5.1,3298,'hi','Dybbuk','Mahi, a newly married woman, brings an antique Jewish box into her home. When Mahi and her husband Sam begin to have paranormal experiences, they soon learn that the box is a dybbuk containing an evil spirit. The couple then seeks the help of a rabbi to unravel its mystery. Will they survive this ordeal before their child is born?','/sy0u4UEzMxrj7G79LMQWcuO15kt.jpg','2021-10-29',118,'Released','The Curse Is Real','Dybbuk',886440,1.2202,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29096,_binary '\0','/33Aymd6PReoLuJXOzcXrj7tSVj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571565',5.9,1263,'vi','Bẫy Rồng','Trinh, a mercenary, must complete a series of organized crime jobs for her boss in order to win the release of her kidnapped daughter. She hires several mercenaries to help, including Quan, who she becomes attracted to. Trinh and Quan\'s relationship becomes complicated as it becomes evident that their motivations are not the same.','/LwAmk0IFyZYxfmD0TH8GKZyzGZ.jpg','2009-12-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Clash',55208,2.1753,5,'K_XzuDju_E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29097,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15716552',7.3,3874,'kn','Tatsama Tadbhava',NULL,'/gfaAIh48t9E7qTYxItZSKpt1R6u.jpg','2023-09-15',122,'Released',NULL,'Tatsama Tadbhava',1388350,0.9126,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29098,_binary '\0','/rqUj70pNdivzKknRAgqurydLvJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1571724',7.1,7837,'tr','Bal','In the remote and undeveloped eastern Black Sea region, a six-year-old boy (Yusuf) wanders through the woods searching for his lost father, trying to make sense of his life.His father is a beekeeper whose bees have disappeared unexpectedly, threatening his livelihood. A bizarre accident kills the father.There is little dialogue or music in the film. The three main characters (Yusuf and his parents) are all fairly taciturn, and the soundtrack is filled out with the sounds of the forest and the creatures that live there.The environment is a recurring theme.','/1zeG8HGIJI4ae9SI7SGHhHc7pzG.jpg','2010-04-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Honey',44160,1.5093,6.736,'P_hVZwkw000','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29099,_binary '\0','/tK6rVybRWoJTqGUYb9BeBKnG3Y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15717242',6.6,9228,'hi','कंजूस मक्खीचूस','Jamnaprasad, a renowned miser, secretly saves all his money to fulfill his father\'s wish to go on the Char Dham Yatra. Hell breaks loose when his parents go missing during the tour due to heavy floods.','/sT02AqTJjztmM6gYe5O0IL0CnqT.jpg','2023-03-24',116,'Released','Jab footega ghada... ghapla hoga bada','Kanjoos Makhichoos',1099677,1.0481,5.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29100,_binary '\0','/95IgQM9w6YO4GwViI4imR2PqopR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572008',5.3,1994,'en','A Nanny for Christmas','Ally is a smart young career woman who needs a new job. Samantha is a busy Beverly Hills advertising executive/mom whose too-well-mannered kids need some fun in their lives. And Danny Donner is the tough-guy owner of a chocolate company who wants a major ad campaign immediately. Could it all somehow lead to the Christmas that changes everyone\'s lives forever?','/zlE665CgN922AUNosZEjgMv56HC.jpg','2010-11-23',88,'Released','Sometimes great gifts come in unexpected packages','A Nanny for Christmas',50652,2.6869,5.6,'YCauh8o9m24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29101,_binary '\0','/62rHT70dT1A57Zp8GIeGcSZm7jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15721088',4.9,3569,'en','High Heat','When the local mafia shows up to burn down her restaurant, Ana, a chef with a meticulous past, defends her turf and proves her knife skills both in and out of the kitchen.','/mmD0NVdhiRiCu64YKem5GK5PSfy.jpg','2022-12-16',84,'Released',NULL,'High Heat',1015963,4.9289,5.6,'XZoDwdLJUK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29102,_binary '\0','/gcgKSyE2iqwfKWMDZ8TJPxeIu0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15721650',7.5,4347,'ja','映画 五等分の花嫁','When five lovely young girls who hate studying hire part-time tutor Futaro, he guides not only their education but also their hearts. Time spent has brought them all closer, with feelings growing within the girls and Futaro. As they finish their third year of high school and their last school festival approaches, they set their sights on what’s next. Is there a future with one of them and Futaro?','/sg7klpt1xwK1IJirBI9EHaqQwJ5.jpg','2022-05-20',136,'Released',NULL,'The Quintessential Quintuplets Movie',820067,7.7058,8.287,'maS5nHFa1o8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29103,_binary '\0','/vTM2VGFFdgsaP8PEgogmVPoIAlg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15721828',7.6,2117,'en','This Much I Know to Be True','Like all musicians in 2021, Nick Cave was unable to connect with his audience in person. He uses this concert film to break the vocal and instrumental silence, talk about himself and perform songs from “Ghosteen” and “Carnage”, with help from Warren Ellis.','/amYrP5cL5Q2uKJP5RM027ZUzFyQ.jpg','2022-05-11',105,'Released',NULL,'This Much I Know to Be True',927025,1.7383,7.2,'LkXunmnWtGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29104,_binary '\0','/2IIy1acnCRbgiY4k4wiPc4GKZ7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572194',3.7,1925,'en','The Hike','Kate returns from war and goes on a camping trip with her friends. They come across strange people living off the land and befriend a group of rock climbers. After their friend goes missing, the women team up with the climbers to survive their hike.','/saqj6ykli0hjSjrOBB0QFmfRYan.jpg','2011-09-30',83,'Released','It\'s All About Survival','The Hike',77812,1.9087,4,'pGMVkhrDVxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29105,_binary '\0','/zhct3EwONRw0WGgQZI1wbDchVLV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572306',4.9,7834,'en','Don\'t Blink','Ten people arrive at a secluded mountain resort to find it completely deserted. With no gas for the return trip, the visitors are forced to stay and investigate the mystery surrounding the abandoned lodge.','/aDqmVV2XzHcqGNC3p7atbeaZrqn.jpg','2014-09-18',92,'Released','Life can be erased','Don\'t Blink',294308,2.4707,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29106,_binary '\0','/s8l7HK396cXmCoxYf84VJBxxaOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572311',3.1,17493,'hi','तीस मार खान','A con artist poses as a film director in a village with the intention of executing a caper with the unwitting help of the villagers.','/xhbaxPSFA78hQpsSekPLdBoyGIK.jpg','2010-12-24',137,'Released','A STylish International Conman With Loads Of Attitude.','Tees Maar Khan',46040,1.4742,3.8,'PYmpVwrmKT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29107,_binary '\0','/vTQ6fbyampB4lPwqIWRrsdBBxO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572315',4.8,61337,'en','Texas Chainsaw 3D','A young woman learns that she has inherited a Texas estate from her deceased grandmother. After embarking on a road trip with friends to uncover her roots, she finds she is the sole owner of a lavish, isolated Victorian mansion. But her newfound wealth comes at a price as she stumbles upon a horror that awaits her in the mansion’s dank cellars.','/dwIQ7WDCSiIcNdbferTcU7uI0KV.jpg','2013-01-03',92,'Released','Evil wears many faces.','Texas Chainsaw 3D',76617,10.3756,5.5,'Z0xYPG-gX0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29108,_binary '\0','/otJG0ohrujK1ZQoD7Xuv1uQrpxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572491',6.5,16055,'es','Balada triste de trompeta','A trapeze artist must decide between her lust for Sergio, the Happy Clown, or her affection for Javier, the Sad Clown, both of whom are deeply disturbed.','/rbpp2G4cpGG8jqCqhEBwvjQ0Y6C.jpg','2010-12-17',106,'Released','It\'s showtime','The Last Circus',56812,4.3553,6.7,'C8sEZAB13_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29109,_binary '\0','/aRd95psLUVBQcnBAu65qeBKcquq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15727212',3.8,1459,'en','Night Train','Mother Holly McCord is driven to extremes to save the life of her young son. Even if it means hauling black market drugs in her souped-up truck, with the Feds in hot pursuit. With two bounties on her head and her son’s life on the line, Holly climbs behind the wheel of “Night Train,” ready to outrun, out gun, and outlast them all.','/gZFSc3BqUyAvuakHSs7qaWJZnGN.jpg','2023-01-13',96,'Released','She will do whatever it takes.','Night Train',1007427,3.3979,5.8,'Eu31HgM5g6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29110,_binary '\0','/1CBYIBcan9AujVwng9ERELnCnKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572769',6.9,2358,'en','Countdown to Zero','Although the Cold War is behind us, the threat of nuclear disaster remains very real. Director Lucy Walker discusses the invention of the atomic bomb and brings the story into the present day, examining the possibility of nuclear calamity under the categories of \"Madness,\" \"Accident\" and \"Miscalculation.\" With narration by Gary Oldman, the film includes a hypothetical sequence of a nuclear explosion in New York City\'s Times Square, timed to coincide with the New Year\'s Eve countdown.','/lJ8EQ4D0x4iPlBxrKGXGtHTwvt6.jpg','2010-01-25',91,'Released','Demand Zero.','Countdown to Zero',50420,1.864,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29111,_binary '\0','/fJmeyANTcpTRWUHPi5cGj5rpBJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572781',8,9050,'ja','涼宮ハルヒの消失','A week before Christmas, Kyon wakes up in a world where the SOS Brigade doesn\'t exist. Mikuru and Yuki don\'t recognize him, and Haruhi and Itsuki seem to have vanished.','/x52WmUnfpB2AB0YUNGWJZaRzcBx.jpg','2010-02-05',162,'Released','Am I happier in the world that had Haruhi in it, or the one where she disappeared?','The Disappearance of Haruhi Suzumiya',36865,3.4109,7.9,'eHKyNQopYXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29112,_binary '\0','/3pCwzGhmxBBiuu7FwG7bw3QH52f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1572783',6.2,1442,'no','Varg Veum - Skriften på veggen','Varg Veum is no longer working as a private investigator. He\'s got a permanent job as a teacher, and has calmed down his life, enjoying the domestic bliss with his new girlfriend Karin, but the idyll doesn\'t last long. Veum gets a brutal meeting with the past, when \"The Knife\" is released from prison, determined to take revenge on those who got him convicted for the murder of a teenage girl.','/lhSvEJ5hpH6mDxhgmtfsgbDae69.jpg','2010-08-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Varg Veum - The Writing on the Wall',49818,2.2326,6.3,'smkSveJqY5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29113,_binary '\0','/8ODibBEc0ETUGfJFkqEg7BXCM8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1573072',5.7,18484,'hi','हाउसफुल','Believing himself to be a jinx and bringing bad luck upon himself and others, a man attempts to find true love, but ends up in very complicated relationships.','/koPiIQ7evC5rer6modUDxoZjYV.jpg','2010-04-30',135,'Released',NULL,'Housefull',58051,1.9083,5.737,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29114,_binary '\0','/9wmSV9Nk3j7GIEBQghJIGI0U2Nk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15732324',7.5,48018,'hi','ओएमजी २','Life is bliss until one day Kanti Sharan Mudgal’s son Vivek is blamed for immoral conduct and expelled from school. Overwhelmed, Kanti plans to leave town until a divine intervention leads him to seek justice by taking those responsible to court.','/kApiO3oL6t100aCtkcwEhk2kqgK.jpg','2023-08-11',155,'Released',NULL,'OMG 2',888710,1.7711,7.353,'Y6ZKXqM7HNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29115,_binary '\0','/ftlFPDcdhyPd1YDf9AcwYtE7gDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15732890',6.1,3109,'fr','Le Livre des solutions','Marc, a bipolar and paranoid filmmaker, cannot tolerate seeing his current project picked apart by his producers. The clips he’s been able to sneak a look at lead him to fear the worst. With his editor as an accomplice, he manages to spirit away the rushes to his aunt’s place in the Cévennes, to finish the film as he envisions it. Instead, its completion is constantly postponed, as he creates endless diversions and impasses, which alternate between the comic and the downright disturbing.','/1ljGxJuIB7PVnvtEFiNSVRnfXch.jpg','2023-06-07',102,'Released',NULL,'The Book of Solutions',888003,3.3248,5.917,'_Fy99yGTIYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29116,_binary '\0','/2UsNQV74s3lvw8XdI13KTxExZ2K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15734582',6.2,2056,'eu','Irati','Western Pyrenees, year 778. When his land is threatened by the ruthless armies of the Frankish emperor, a Basque warlord asks for help from his ancestral gods.','/jVUpT8PIWU9mpUWQqEyYDqmFN2y.jpg','2023-02-24',112,'Released','Everything that has a name is','Irati',726274,1.7602,6.6,'08KfGzGS6fM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29117,_binary '\0','/raNG392FkGf6ChMrwTA0wRcWIz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1573478',7.6,2188,'ml','പാലേരി മാണിക്യം: ഒരു പാതിരാക്കൊലപാതകത്തിന്‍റെ കഥ','In 1950, a young woman named Manikyam was found dead in the village of Paleri. Around 52 years later, Haridas, a private investigator, tries to unravel the truth about her death.','/x7mByLwbgoQDqHS7DYyFEzE94tw.jpg','2009-12-05',155,'Released','A midnight murder story','Paleri Manikyam: Oru Pathirakolapathakathinte Katha',40571,1.1294,7.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29118,_binary '\0','/9z0lv4NBV3ocfl5Q5SEa21apM5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15737510',6.5,1600,'en','The Santa Stakeout','Tanya is a police detective who is reluctantly partnered with fellow detective Ryan to solve a recent string of heists taking place during high-profile holiday parties around town.','/g7H4cvUmGC4dQ60ViOrELatrrFW.jpg','2021-10-24',84,'Released','Christmas goes undercover.','The Santa Stakeout',874238,2.0623,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29119,_binary '\0','/pRfBBi7q8cvM4NiKCh9cGmQdocV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15737898',7.8,3736,'ja','BLUE GIANT','High school student Dai Miyamoto has his life is turned upside down the day he discovers jazz. Picking up a saxophone and leaving his sleepy hometown for the bustling nightclubs of Tokyo, Dai will find that the life of a professional musician isn’t for the faint of heart, as he must confront what it truly means to be great.','/7LxbzvDvdeU7lBzB92JShURa0cM.jpg','2023-02-17',120,'Released','Witness the origin of the next great jazz legend.','Blue Giant',887870,5.9829,7.8,'gUf5R-MzITU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29120,_binary '\0','/6cNeUaoNNFsNhtHiUpxfVp5tDZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15739494',6.3,1527,'en','Christmas in Tahoe','To save her family hotel\'s Christmas show, talent booker Claire must ask for help from her ex-boyfriend Ryan, the lead guitarist of a now-famous band that fired her as their manager years ago.','/oTqpT4yqo2uXr7CSYDWHTiIOe6c.jpg','2021-11-28',84,'Released','Shake up Christmas with some romance.','Christmas in Tahoe',874226,1.8523,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29121,_binary '\0','/yH7THBF03htfvX1USFJOEXPNsBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15739902',6.8,2252,'en','\'Tis the Season to be Merry','Looking for a fresh angle to her book on relationships, Merry heads to snow-covered Vermont. She finds a new perspective and Christmas cheer with charismatic aid worker Chris.','/539aWeHrqkbaUz2Dw4m07zBARhU.jpg','2021-12-19',84,'Released','The book of love gets a rewrite.','\'Tis the Season to be Merry',888500,2.5736,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29122,_binary '\0','/ceEx9V0sUiyL2rPc6G7rZXnVtd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15740596',7,2555,'de','Wochenendrebellen','Mirco von Juterczenka\'s novel \"Wir Wochenendrebellen\" is the story of a father and his ten-year-old son, who is Asperger\'s autistic. The boy has set his mind on finally finding his favourite football club. But his selection criteria are very specific and besides, he wants to experience all the clubs (no matter in which league they play) live in the stadium.','/3H7rdXsFmoAA5coTaLOR7OTHyu4.jpg','2023-09-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Weekend Rebels',888768,3.5071,7.043,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29123,_binary '\0','/7IW5xt241RUAufYiFBoAPx5n52V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15740736',6.6,2366,'fr','Ténor','While working part-time as a food deliveryman, Antoine, an aspiring young rapper from the suburbs of Paris, meets Mrs. Loiseau, an eminent teacher at the Paris Opéra. Stunned by the young man\'s raw talent, she introduces him to the world of opera. As Antoine becomes one of Mrs. Loiseau\'s students, he hides his new dream from his friends and family, fearing that they won’t understand – this double life burdens him... Somewhere in between the gilded and uptight Parisian upper-class, and the harsh yet free-spirited and familiar suburbs he grew up in, Antoine will have to find his own voice.','/14195Sv9rUHXJAuWbjFDtRQMUCf.jpg','2022-05-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Tenor',936074,2.1088,6.999,'Nx1Q-vGmPh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29124,_binary '\0','/mhzA12GWiQra3bFCjwRtT4MBsYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15742294',5.2,1581,'sv','Länge leve bonusfamiljen','Lisa and Patrik have patched up their marriage after Patrik\'s infidelity, but everything turns upside down when they receive a letter from the district court about their divorce papers, which Lisa had forgotten she had filed.','/onrVCImi6V2zXiVrCZKihJhbgiu.jpg','2022-12-02',107,'Released',NULL,'Long Live the Bonus Family',1033755,1.2042,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29125,_binary '\0','/zIYROrkHJPYB3VTiW1L9QVgaQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15744298',5.6,30183,'en','Freelance','An ex-special forces operative takes a job to provide security for a journalist as she interviews a dictator, but a military coup breaks out in the middle of the interview, they are forced to escape into the jungle where they must survive.','/7Bd4EUOqQDKZXA6Od5gkfzRNb0.jpg','2023-10-05',108,'Released','Retirement didn\'t suit him.','Freelance',897087,7.7988,6.395,'6ura9bYCDJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29126,_binary '\0','/jL7ZJIn1cbE7sYg4LMppU3CW8kq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15745084',4.2,2027,'en','V for Vengeance','After learning that their younger sibling escaped an earlier kidnapping attempt that also killed their parents, two estranged sisters must join forces to rescue her from a group of bloodthirsty vampires. Out for revenge and control of a vampirism vaccine, Thorn and his band of the undead soon learn that they messed with the wrong family.','/eor4CPp7YHYh3J01NgNkQwGW4IC.jpg','2022-06-07',85,'Released',NULL,'V for Vengeance',982543,4.5868,5.446,'37A5tyJuZls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29127,_binary '\0','/7XdV5Iyh40QMIdJdMggMC4NSqDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15745226',5.7,1770,'en','Darby and the Dead','After Darby Harper suffered a near-death experience as a child, she gained the ability to see ghosts. To combat the existential boredom of high school, she runs a side business counseling local spirits in her spare time. When an unexpected occurrence happens between Darby and Capri, the most popular girl at her high school, Darby reluctantly agrees to help her and in the process learns how to fit in with the living world again.','/v1mtYW0qShlS3YFy10D8GqTk6LI.jpg','2022-12-02',100,'Released','Ghosted but not gone.','Darby and the Dead',898308,7.2365,5.9,'B34KREZ-r0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29128,_binary '\0','/gmFWvMH4iCqQL6LDf16tztMq38a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15747042',6.7,2207,'el','Μαγνητικά Πεδία','Having met by chance on the way to an island, a woman and a man decide to wander around together in search of a good place to bury a metallic box.','/mCd3nyuYv0hAviKJi6nuI7vFkaX.jpg','2022-05-19',78,'Released',NULL,'Magnetic Fields',891024,0.8541,6.7,'ZSGoJ-xcByM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29129,_binary '\0','/eF8XLbbBd5cIfvS00tzl0jWAcOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15748830',7,17084,'hi','जाने जां','When a single mother her teenage daughter becomes ensnared in a deadly crime, find an unexpected ally in their neighbor, a simple, doting but genius teacher math teacher comes to aid, while a tenacious cop digs into the case.','/oaUOV9VCNM5MjrmonqgH4o3XNwQ.jpg','2023-09-21',139,'Released','Love blurs the line between innocence and guilt','Jaane Jaan',950071,2.6809,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29130,_binary '\0','/oQR4TXfmbOBdHGyOAaN3vXjeygJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15753666',7.2,1362,'en','Puff: Wonders of the Reef','A baby pufferfish travels through a wondrous microworld full of fantastical creatures as he searches for a home on the Great Barrier Reef.','/3jW7VXaI955lIfegDlB0F5OShbP.jpg','2021-10-01',59,'Released',NULL,'Puff: Wonders of the Reef',890601,2.3605,7.65,'g-MdiE7gfmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29131,_binary '\0','/fQExn029sEcpXvpKJQIQdEwKv5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1575539',6.1,7404,'en','Elena Undone','The wife of a pastor who preaches against homosexuality embarks on an affair with a female writer.','/m4SDHYqLbYHnq5Lb6XPZPHgBbID.jpg','2010-06-25',111,'Released',NULL,'Elena Undone',56743,2.6677,6.862,'QKixl0vHSWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29132,_binary '\0','/dv4uPIXzgQM5LJ8MFyy1TG877nY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1575694',5.4,12304,'en','The Hit List','A disgruntled man creates a hit list with a stranger during a drunken night out and must then race to try to save those he marked for extermination as the bodies begin to pile up and all fingers point to him.','/tR88diuLaMMdxl9rBVdAKERzIjo.jpg','2011-04-02',90,'Released','Who\'s on your list?','The Hit List',58626,4.3599,6.012,'O3MsVkfYwJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29133,_binary '\0','/cHslW7gCvJXuo4DGnobVAbxrezp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15758364',6.2,1421,'en','Christmas Sail','When Liz returns home to take care of her estranged father, she is determined to give her daughter a perfect Christmas and reconnects with her best friend.','/l1hEbHfFI4UCW3X5MBtommRcOcQ.jpg','2021-10-31',84,'Released','Your greatest adventure is waiting in port.','Christmas Sail',874228,1.8064,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29134,_binary '\0','/eE3wZ9Lbp6hpBPnwiUW8msNcFfh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15758400',6.8,1874,'en','Open by Christmas','When Nicky finds an unopened Christmas card from a high school secret admirer, she and her best friend Simone search to find and thank the anonymous author.','/iAGrDr0EWqu8ZjCsIYSfuMH32SR.jpg','2021-11-12',84,'Released','True love is closer than you think.','Open by Christmas',874161,1.4083,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29135,_binary '\0','/tK6zJqW1MZ3ASoHnuX6gH1tRFtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15760296',6.5,2367,'bn','রাবণ','Is Ram Mukherjee Raavan in disguise?','/pvetSN4WvqsFjjIlmyFkD9KkHak.jpg','2022-04-28',130,'Released',NULL,'Raavan',920059,1.6466,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29136,_binary '\0','/3OODjz1SnzEXuJIVNkVU3MixaWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15761584',7,1307,'it','Grazie ragazzi','An actor past his prime gives drama lessons to prisoners in an attempt to stage \"Waiting for Godot.\"','/7vykcxsJeVVEcrrmFORF519Di1A.jpg','2023-01-12',117,'Released',NULL,'Thank You Guys',919950,1.5823,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29137,_binary '\0','/4KK8e8BvUWCWqmQk7iqBBN77p7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1576440',5.8,6405,'en','Good Neighbours','Neighbors Spencer and Louise have bonded over their fascination with a recent string of murders terrorizing their community. When a new tenant named Victor moves into the building, all three quickly hit it off. However, they soon discover each has his or her own dark secret. As the violence outside mounts, the city retreats indoors for safety. But the more time these three neighbors spend together in their apartment building, the clearer it becomes that what they once thought of as a safe haven is as dangerous as any outside terrors they could imagine.','/1i2YBTnZyC71TuJXq4RQWPGSbvv.jpg','2011-06-03',99,'Released','Everyone needs a place to lie.','Good Neighbours',64320,2.0803,5.6,'sohRd39sS84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29138,_binary '\0','/lB0Khj63L8fEyRQANmW06RxQ5i2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1576450',6.1,1494,'fr','Pieds nus sur les limaces','After the death of her mother, a woman returns home to care for her sister.','/hnerG1oMGliTnin71S9NIzqbuCe.jpg','2010-12-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Lily Sometimes',67509,2.1414,5.6,'O5XFa97y0K0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29139,_binary '\0','/kYD3ykZjiqFzJPhPLEAQ1QUj90x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15764854',7.6,4007,'it','Stranizza d\'amuri','The troubled relationship between Gianni and Nino, set in the narrow-minded and prejudicial Sicily of 1982.','/7nCjnXsLsN44rUIm4eEH9HEhuTk.jpg','2023-03-23',134,'Released','Sicily 1982, the dream of loving each other without fear','Fireworks',891636,3.0465,7.4,'m7xCsMnpbXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29140,_binary '\0','/m68kG3WTX5eIx2wSnWueqni9ASh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15765412',6,2220,'en','Allelujah','When news of the closure of a small hospital\'s geriatric ward begins to reach the community, the hospital invites a local news crew to document their planning of a concert in honor of the hospital\'s most celebrated nurse. But there might be something more threatening to the hospital itself, more deadly than the politicians ready to shut down the place at a moment\'s notice.','/7IK1XesJuUL04K5tda5ddj2MuDS.jpg','2023-03-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Allelujah',894201,1.7093,5.3,'KGektpTIYqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29141,_binary '\0','/l5whLwKedPHIxziuh8ZmdVKPrff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15766576',7.7,1864,'en','A Man Named Scott','In 2009, Scott Mescudi aka Kid Cudi released his debut LP, Man on the Moon: The End of Day. A genre-bending album that broke barriers by featuring songs dealing with depression, anxiety and loneliness, it resonated deeply with young listeners and launched Cudi as a musical star and cultural hero. A Man Named Scott explores Cudi’s journey over a decade of creative choices, struggles and breakthroughs, making music that continues to move and empower his millions of fans around the world.','/sihn5PoMqS4EvVOqO5zRtPKJjns.jpg','2021-11-05',95,'Released','Before he was The Man on the Moon, he was a man named Scott.','A Man Named Scott',890228,2.7979,7.3,'kqWT5zfhmLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29142,_binary '\0','/xHsc5OzhylbxDzJUTIDXckwcF2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15766640',6.9,3552,'en','An Unexpected Christmas','Jamie hasn’t told his family that he and his now ex-girlfriend Emily broke up. After an inopportune run-in with Emily at the train station in his hometown, Jamie convinces her to pretend they’re still a couple to avoid ruining Christmas for his family.','/xX3396RcIQynrulZHFlE1DqAOfy.jpg','2021-11-26',84,'Released','What\'s a little romance between exes?','An Unexpected Christmas',874124,2.0357,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29143,_binary '\0','/p6FKy7z2Cqnn8GEatu7GYVFhk95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15766876',4.7,2003,'ko','거룩한 밤: 데몬 헌터스','When a devil-worshipping criminal network plunges Seoul into chaos, the police turn to Holy Night—a trio of supernatural demon hunters—to restore order and defeat the rising evil.','/v3Mo77Qjp6pctpD4eJaNT6kFRSB.jpg','2025-04-30',92,'Released','Beat up to the salvation.','Holy Night: Demon Hunters',793387,7.5188,6.954,'0l35oxLd1UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29144,_binary '\0','/tZ9g5GGEWh7Y0uGMFDIwNvr6cxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15767324',3.9,1541,'ml','എരിഡ','A femme fatale and her much older husband have a windfall at a game of poker. But the gambling doesn\'t end at the cards table.','/j8RnVhsZ8utb1tIjGSLi0JZljVA.jpg','2021-10-28',124,'Released','A Tale of a Goddess in Love','Erida',889567,1.2352,1.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29145,_binary '\0','/4ZwdFna9Q620U1eZrUKdOgW0mD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15767726',3.9,2863,'te','రామ్ అసుర్','Ram tries to make a synthetic diamond but fails most of the time, leading to scars in his relationship with Priya. Through a friend, Ram meets priest called Ramachari, who in turn asks Ram to meet Suri. Ram’s life changes after meeting Suri.','/c8mvznqYPz5XztVHiiYcoF0bphX.jpg','2021-11-19',132,'Released','For the Peanut Diamond','Ram Asur',898842,0.8625,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29146,_binary '\0','/kEhCztSTP4ixu7R0AIWg8vvcvbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15767808',6.9,44835,'en','The Last Kingdom: Seven Kings Must Die','In the wake of King Edward\'s death, Uhtred of Bebbanburg and his comrades adventure across a fractured kingdom in the hopes of uniting England at last.','/qcNDxDzd5OW9wE3c8nWxCBQoBrM.jpg','2023-04-14',111,'Released',NULL,'The Last Kingdom: Seven Kings Must Die',948713,7.7191,7.2,'eqCYw_o5lng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29147,_binary '\0','/c3RgA6wQXKoPJNuYVpmPSYnocNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15768294',6.2,3257,'kn','ಬನಾರಸ್','An astronaut from an indefinite future fall in love with a girl in present time each other. When his i love is threatened by an existential element, responsibility falls on him to save her, using his future knowledge as an edge ahead.','/t07fraPQpolW7smcwBptQglTnsW.jpg','2022-11-04',150,'Released',NULL,'Banaras',899425,1.1724,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29148,_binary '\0','/3Ed9375VaD20Ko9Asf58wvP4PgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15768848',5.6,7618,'en','The Pod Generation','In a not-so-distant future, couples can share pregnancy on a more equal footing via detachable artificial wombs. While botanist Alvy has doubts about this new way of birthing babies, his love for Rachel prompts him to take a leap of faith.','/8A1gNoYBjmwcShNtxYCfkZkMKIj.jpg','2023-08-11',110,'Released','Discover the new natural.','The Pod Generation',889675,8.148,6.025,'rGMx_7oAeUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29149,_binary '\0','/wj7XhEOlSeTO6Yh2m2Rpz08Nc5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577038',6.6,2328,'en','A Christmas Wish','A broke single mother lands a job at a small town diner where the kindly patrons and staff help her family to have a happy holiday.','/vr6j28yj9kfl7TOO3J0BWoaUSEX.jpg','2011-11-20',93,'Released','When all is lost... miracles can happen','A Christmas Wish',80544,2.2007,5.9,'hf37mVQtg-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29150,_binary '\0','/gWfv4i7xqgLoAE7eefyn6WDnml9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577052',5.8,5540,'en','Goats','Having a self-absorbed New Age mother and an estranged father has meant 15-year-old Ellis Whitman has grown up relying on an unconventional guardian: a goat-trekking, marijuana-growing sage called \'Goat Man\'. When Ellis decides to leave the alternative ways of his desert homestead for a stuffy East Coast prep school, major changes are in store.','/sguv1tnaQjFWsbcpN0b08cWmsFJ.jpg','2012-08-10',92,'Released','You can\'t choose your family...or can you?','Goats',84203,2.3256,5.5,'iJiz3SsY9fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29151,_binary '\0','/69kyWC9Rtsd8uFUCLQ162c49nwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577055',4.7,2132,'en','Mask Maker','A lucky couple hits the jackpot when they purchase a 19th century plantation home for pennies on the dollar. Determined to get rich quick, they invite their friends up for the weekend to celebrate their good fortune. It’s quickly apparent that the plantation home’s former residents have not left and the unlucky youths suddenly find themselves running for their lives!','/f0XHiacPoei1GIsDZqlh9k2rlW8.jpg','2011-04-12',90,'Released','Meet Your Maker','Mask Maker',62904,1.5608,4.9,'krUxKLK_TrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29152,_binary '\0','/7p3tPblSkyCSgc1h4rLdFVoEdJv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577061',4.4,23639,'tr','Recep İvedik 3','Recep Ivedik has been depressed since the death of his grandmother. Everyone who tries to help him fails. A young girl named Zeynep, who can\'t find an apartment, stays with Recep. Initially, the two can\'t stand each others but after a while, they grow close. Despite many adventures together, Recep\'s depression won\'t go away. That is until he experiences something he had never experienced before.','/2tT4gR2KesVdY6KaFDZ0BUOBsEi.jpg','2010-02-12',95,'Released','A folk hero','Recep Ivedik 3',32926,5.1229,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29153,_binary '\0','/sPmonTGBsVDNgZD3TC5JbxE6ghx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577065',3.2,1280,'en','Sinbad and the Minotaur','Sinbad, armed with rumors of ancient gold, finds himself sneaking into the desert camp of the evil sorcerer Al-Jibar. Hidden among the many relics is an ivory scroll case containing the logs of the pirate Captain Minos, which will lead Sinbad to the golden head of the Colossus of Rhodes.','/t4fCnP7WMdLre8YcxESb7PbfcCI.jpg','2011-05-07',89,'Released','A Mythical Beast, A Legendary Warrior, A Titanic Battle.','Sinbad and the Minotaur',56652,1.8103,3.738,'d1ERAFPf7iA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29154,_binary '\0','/9cnUiMidzgt2tsxUc2qhhlxU1bk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15771916',6.5,17760,'en','You Hurt My Feelings','A novelist\'s longstanding marriage is suddenly upended when she overhears her husband giving his honest reaction to her latest book.','/do9UvkcDJeYbhYVoQPS00yOCYdc.jpg','2023-05-26',93,'Released',NULL,'You Hurt My Feelings',890215,5.4205,6.3,'20GWk5cWPBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29155,_binary '\0','/892rHLop6XobpTmdJ05UfkWMZpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15777864',7.7,4906,'en','Hilda and the Mountain King','When Hilda wakes up in the body of a troll, she must use her wits and courage to get back home, become human again — and save the city of Trolberg.','/3vm7LOe7DhkiA7umBhslQy9MdkY.jpg','2021-12-30',83,'Released','Such is the life of an adventurer.','Hilda and the Mountain King',789708,3.2017,7.529,'4MnjzxvsBNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29156,_binary '\0','/hGDhlnat9Ti4eTmQeLvDuw8Wu4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1577883',5.5,1936,'en','The Turn of the Screw','In a mid-19th century Essex country house, a young governess for two children becomes convinced that the house and grounds are haunted by ghosts and that the children are being possessed.','/gU6VIBiClt3YwElPd0YEV5fqPmW.jpg','2009-12-30',89,'Released','The dead are not at rest.','The Turn of the Screw',63517,1.9136,4.7,'WuRkT897cX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29157,_binary '\0','/5V9ljea8oH5BS1udHOTmbK8C82B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1578116',6.5,8031,'hi','अतिथि तुम कब जाओगे?','The story of a happily married couple living in Mumbai whose lives take an interesting turn when a distant relative turns up unannounced at their doorstep from a far off village.','/cia1gaHHjO626oSSH5Pf9hwbXN0.jpg','2010-02-26',155,'Released',NULL,'Atithi Tum Kab Jaoge?',34144,1.5217,6.237,'560FtBaW9Ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29158,_binary '\0','/kcNWiRdqqonajepaUim0VmE0Rex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1578128',4.7,1538,'de','Otto\'s Eleven','Otto is a man from a little German island, where he lives together with his friends. He gets his treasure, an expensive painting, stolen by a casino owner and his female assistent, so Otto starts travelling to the main land with his friends. Will he get it back?','/g2IXELil9YXgR9Vt7b9p0dteONv.jpg','2010-12-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Otto\'s Eleven',49998,1.397,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29159,_binary '\0','/sClvKM8C6a1DSPzMwkKjk8pNFDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15782570',6.8,4887,'en','You Can Live Forever','When Jaime, a gay teenager, is sent to live in a community of Jehovah\'s Witnesses in small-town Quebec, she falls madly in love with a devout Witness girl. The two embark on an intense affair with consequences that will reshape the rest of their lives.','/6JllNMDqHasBeqM5vFVxp1rB9Fk.jpg','2023-03-24',97,'Released',NULL,'You Can Live Forever',887580,2.7491,7,'MY8XPcO9FhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29160,_binary '\0','/7SzN9tvZjH9OcpyJAlL6R3Yv3u5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1578261',5.2,4914,'hi','ब्रेक के बाद','Aaliya is not ready for commitment even after a decade-long friendship with Abhay. She remains indifferent when he follows her to Australia, but is finally shaken when he announces his marriage.','/iTSyb8FrwaJlJVnxz2q15Un1StI.jpg','2010-11-25',120,'Released',NULL,'Break Ke Baad',50099,1.1766,5.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29161,_binary '\0','/4kmNLwmVeT3xMciSRefE6SCi2hX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15782690',6.4,32975,'en','In the Land of Saints and Sinners','In a remote Irish village, a damaged Finbar is forced to fight for redemption after a lifetime of sins, but what price is he willing to pay? In the land of saints and sinners, some sins can\'t be buried.','/443c0xNTLackGkFOKfbPClKMpIk.jpg','2023-10-06',106,'Released','Can you bury your past?','In the Land of Saints and Sinners',1027073,7.7852,6.434,'lWwhYRxhngc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29162,_binary '\0','/fgA9yAUvGBiuCQDOvGUbhMIofad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1578275',5.3,59543,'en','The Dilemma','Longtime friends Ronny and Nick are partners in an auto-design firm. They are hard at work on a presentation for a dream project that would really launch their company. Then Ronny spots Nick\'s wife out with another man, and in the process of investigating the possible affair, he learns that Nick has a few secrets of his own. As the presentation nears, Ronny agonizes over what might happen if the truth gets out.','/a7EVBTqeh6NoCFDW24qIp11kyi9.jpg','2011-01-13',111,'Released','Two best friends. Nothing could come between them... or could it?','The Dilemma',44564,6.1319,5.357,'0WK6cYefv2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29163,_binary '\0','/vc0sr2g7geu063cBcUQKl3kVDtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15782954',6.1,1657,'en','Fresh Kills','Rose Larusso, an inquisitive young girl in 1980s Staten Island, discovers her father is an emerging mafia kingpin. Rose\'s growing desire to break free from the path set before her soon threatens her existence and alienates her from her closest allies: her mother Francine, her sister Connie, and her aunt Christine.','/iDdDnFvxAVTHQLgzWos03lcFDvd.jpg','2024-06-14',120,'Released','You do what’s best for the family.','Fresh Kills',1062198,1.8799,6.2,'WNnR-2DROAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29164,_binary '\0','/ahjfjrRiWVK8ErZBd5o4AVs6mp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15783426',5.2,2606,'en','One Day as a Lion','Jackie Powers will stop at nothing to prevent his son from following him into a life of crime. With his mob employer in pursuit, a chance encounter at a roadside diner charts a new path.','/cxSKca4dNlk7O7PMiEYT203vlIw.jpg','2023-04-04',87,'Released','Every hitman deserves a second shot.','One Day as a Lion',1070777,4.3163,5.8,'29L6A8IBZfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29165,_binary '\0','/jQHk7plj9crd9Un8eXWwL35N5Tp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15783462',6.7,1635,'zh','奇迹·笨小孩','Desperate to pay for his little sister\'s surgery, a young man takes part in a risky business venture - only to encounter some serious setbacks.','/nAc8jgeqW0OQMfmPSuBcvxjOz70.jpg','2022-02-01',106,'Released',NULL,'Nice View',803266,2.3462,6.4,'pHvE06Emyd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29166,_binary '\0','/6OmzzuGWAa7YgvkbxP6XnvF5VAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15783464',5.1,1263,'en','Barber','Val Barber, a private investigator, is hired by a wealthy widow to find her missing granddaughter. Set in Dublin against the background of a global pandemic, Barber’s initial investigation into Sara’s disappearance quickly darkens. Secrets start surfacing in unexpected ways. Before too long, Barber finds himself entangled with powerful men of shady morals determined to thwart his investigation. Has he bitten off more than he can chew?','/w8rzw8XgGKkHdnWWLQTtbrS7qMP.jpg','2023-09-22',90,'Released','Everybody has a secret.','Barber',1089765,1.3448,4.7,'63FMPWRkcjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29167,_binary '\0','/lh2nbC8qRBJxyH0iqkPmXlNqhcK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15783520',5.2,2077,'en','On Fire','Inspired by true and harrowing events, an ordinary man finds his world suddenly torn apart as devastating wildfires rip through the surrounding countryside. With precious moments ticking by, he must flee with his son and pregnant wife if they have any hope of surviving the rapid forces of mother nature.','/1ms0zRAMtbVq5XoIfrlcSj84g6G.jpg','2023-09-29',80,'Released','Sometimes survival is the only thing that matters.','On Fire',900409,2.5015,6.2,'TbmM9Rugu4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29168,_binary '\0','/3UddZry7Pl5bTNatD008pxOJhrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1578882',5,11406,'en','Elephant White','An assassin is hired by a businessman to avenge the murder of his daughter by white slave traders in Thailand.','/hqriJWWisRhm5XapyuB40D1jqqA.jpg','2011-05-17',91,'Released','Set your sights on revenge','Elephant White',57585,3.2965,4.977,'t2nrrnPkPy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29169,_binary '\0','/4fLZUr1e65hKPPVw0R3PmKFKxj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15789038',7,169408,'en','Elemental','In a city where fire, water, land and air residents live together, a fiery young woman and a go-with-the-flow guy will discover something elemental: how much they have in common.','/4Y1WNkd88JXmGfhtWR7dmDAo1T2.jpg','2023-06-14',102,'Released','Opposites react.','Elemental',976573,20.0377,7.593,'-cT495xKvvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29170,_binary '\0','/lUIAlOzNVKunMHo7lFDqH8eGsWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15789472',6.3,50538,'es','Nowhere','A young pregnant woman named Mia escapes from a country at war by hiding in a maritime container aboard a cargo ship. After a violent storm, Mia gives birth to the child while lost at sea, where she must fight to survive.','/lncg31XDBdfYxrOnhrzVAUw8geT.jpg','2023-09-29',108,'Released','Attempting to survive in the middle of nowhere is her only option.','Nowhere',1151534,7.5167,7.312,'KDUtdcU10YA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29171,_binary '\0','/7TelXvAFWfIGppmnplhfJpzqfd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15789492',5.6,5780,'es','Infiesto','As the coronavirus upends their lives, two detectives doggedly pursue those responsible for an abduction they realize is part of a sinister pattern.','/4ZINmjqs326uS9tzihiLQu6LMO2.jpg','2023-02-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Infiesto',1072567,3.1217,5.862,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29172,_binary '\0','/23sJzwaYazdzqnp2gm6GAQk4sCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15790974',3.9,1695,'en','Deinfluencer','An influential cheerleader finds herself held captive by a masked psychopath with a God complex. She must complete a series of sadistic social media challenges to save her life and the lives of her fellow captives. However, the masked kidnapper has a secret agenda for his most recent victim.','/tLA4839HtC5GelEsUTFFtAL2ar5.jpg','2022-12-06',91,'Released','Trend or die trying.','Deinfluencer',969160,1.6298,5.7,'7_-47I8ywQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29173,_binary '\0','/kSeU4uk19t82k6Cao7hc6ktDYhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15791034',7,270763,'en','Barbarian','In town for a job interview, a young woman arrives at her Airbnb late at night only to find that it has been mistakenly double-booked and a strange man is already staying there. Against her better judgement, she decides to stay the night anyway.','/idT5mnqPcJgSkvpDX7pJffBzdVH.jpg','2022-08-29',103,'Released','Some stay for a night. Some stay for a week. Some never leave.','Barbarian',913290,23.0174,6.88,'Dr89pmKrqkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29174,_binary '\0','/ahYDVW0ReOTKI6sbI6du9SoXdX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15791574',4.9,3197,'en','Wanted Man','Follows a police officer who must retrieve an eyewitness and escort her after a cartel shooting leaves several DEA agents dead, but then he must decide who to trust when they discover that the attack was executed by American forces.','/pmdgdb8biQLLzTjySZLPdK13KwM.jpg','2024-04-01',85,'Released','Some borders are better not crossed.','Wanted Man',666035,5.2512,6.495,'FVHTquAjKdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29175,_binary '\0','/mF1VMcO0pSjPVVfpHs4hLFmLYTV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579223',5.9,2649,'pt','Assalto ao Banco Central','\"The Baron\" wanted to commit the perfect heist involving 3 tons of money and no violence. For this he would need the right people willing to get 1 million dollars to take part in this job. Based on true events, in 2005, 168,000,000 Brazilian Real (almost 80,000,000 US dollars) were stolen from a Brazilian Central Bank (Federal Reserve), making it the biggest peace-time robbery in history. It was perhaps the most audacious bank heist ever.','/sbUymWDX82csyNaTj3AmKGKqzrG.jpg','2011-07-22',101,'Released',NULL,'Federal Bank Heist',72560,2.189,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29176,_binary '\0','/eeTyUaM62zaYCYr0iyfzc4Qf6pu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579232',3.5,5387,'en','Freerunner','With a ticking bomb locked to his neck, a young freerunner races against the clock and all types of baddies to get from one end of the city to the other to save himself and his girlfriend.','/uy1FNiDvSqUkAKkQ7Nvb42ntdfr.jpg','2011-09-14',87,'Released','Run for your life','Freerunner',76101,1.555,4.475,'u4K4xbyRMIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29177,_binary '\0','/nsWgxQrDcTVhSGzAu5kVlw64XB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579247',6.1,19689,'en','Starstruck','Pop star Christopher Wilde has fame, fortune and a big-budget Hollywood movie awaiting him. But after meeting Jessica Olson, a down-to-earth girl from the Midwest, he is faced with following his heart or doing what\'s best for his career.','/kuyJuNiiZvu5iNr8Dgv5y75v1uc.jpg','2010-02-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Starstruck',35558,5.1162,7,'PmqQyrycpmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29178,_binary '\0','/tLD0ldW30ZMaMnh0quyKwRjHpan.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579306',6.8,1435,'en','A Soldier\'s Love Story','Ten year old Jared Marshall\'s life crumbled down after his parents\' divorce a year ago. Not only does his dad put his job first since, mother uproots him from Iowa by moving in with her ma so she can take a job in California. When Jared\'s class writes letters to US troops in Bosnia from the nearest base, kindhearted Sergeant First Class Vince Carerra, who grew up fatherless and got divorced because his wife wasn\'t faithful while he was on tour of duty, takes to the kid and starts a correspondence with \'fatherly\' advice. Once his unit returns to Fort Sebastian, Vince calls on Jared\'s home, warmly welcomed. Vince becomes Jared\'s personal baseball coach and after some Cupid encouragement, his mother\'s boyfriend, but on an understanding not to commit because he\'s likely to be redeployed.','/iqttzl9f5eXiD3qMAOM4ylVbqTv.jpg','2010-05-08',88,'Released',NULL,'A Soldier\'s Love Story',52635,1.857,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29179,_binary '\0','/pTzzoMS3OQ2iM1RImLITf9w0ov7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579361',7.7,9042,'en','Chasing Ice','When National Geographic photographer James Balog asked, “How can one take a picture of climate change?” his attention was immediately drawn to ice. Soon he was asked to do a cover story on glaciers that became the most popular and well-read piece in the magazine during the last five years. But for Balog, that story marked the beginning of a much larger and longer-term project that would reach epic proportions.','/q4T6Wqh7ZXzf30odR2Yo2dLWdZ.jpg','2012-10-01',74,'Released','Art meets science.','Chasing Ice',84185,1.6745,7.466,'eIZTMVNBjc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29180,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579540',5.4,1683,'te','ఏక్ నిరంజన్','A bounty hunter searches for the family he was separated from as a child, and falls in love with the sister of a gang member.','/tT0ElSp7p8d8Wsgv6Z1xFmLL8lY.jpg','2009-10-29',150,'Released',NULL,'Ek Niranjan',38220,1.0246,5.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29181,_binary '\0','/o7eaXe7otZbCnxdkmJ74Z2XRwxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1579592',7.9,6688,'te','కిక్','Kalyan is a kind of guy who prefers a life full of thrills than leading a regular life style. He seeks kick in whatever he does. He finds liking in Naina. They separate due to differences. Krishna is a young cop who is in lookout for a big ticket thief who happens to be Kalyan. Meanwhile, Naina agrees for an engagement with Krishna. The rest of the story is all about how Kalyan wins back his lady love and the real intent behind the robberies of Kalyan.','/lei28oUtPXyzGjkf6YKaIlAscAV.jpg','2009-05-08',155,'Released',NULL,'Kick',60807,1.4867,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29182,_binary '\0','/e13Io18jl6p5UiS5Cxhug9ptTPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15799524',6.9,9231,'en','The History of Sound','In 1917, two young music students attending the Boston Conservatory bond over a mutual love of folk music. They reconnect a few years later, embarking on a song-collecting trip in the backwaters of Maine.','/55of0Vy7m32hSRZKsCyyDjZn4AC.jpg','2025-09-12',128,'Released',NULL,'The History of Sound',891584,6.9309,7,'E2PSkw8BI7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29183,_binary '\0','/9OUohsezE4kZr74oy9DA8Dt4jXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15799550',7.7,1242,'ja','フルーツバスケット－prelude－','Kyoko, who couldn\'t believe anything in the world and lived a desolate life, meets Katsuya Honda, who has been assigned as an educational trainee. She is at the mercy of Katsuya, who is rude and has a strong habit, and she is gradually attracted to her. However, she is disowned by her parents in the wake of an incident with her bad fellow. It\'s a punishment that I\'ve been doing as much as I like. Katsuya appears in front of Kyoko who thinks so...','/gt7radvJj8UI8C8mvmtWX5uiqQB.jpg','2022-02-18',88,'Released',NULL,'Fruits Basket -prelude-',896499,3.0606,7,'ASHoe3ve14A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29184,_binary '\0','/gg4zZoTggZmpAQ32qIrP5dtnkEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15799866',5.3,28611,'en','Silent Night','A tormented father witnesses his young son die when caught in a gang\'s crossfire on Christmas Eve. While recovering from a wound that costs him his voice, he makes vengeance his life\'s mission and embarks on a punishing training regimen in order to avenge his son\'s death.','/tlcuhdNMKNGEVpGqBZrAaOOf1A6.jpg','2023-11-30',104,'Released','Action speaks louder than words.','Silent Night',891699,8.6349,6.1,'eKmEdwQLzoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29185,_binary '\0','/jDJ8iCLMBLhoznsXh9SEjpnQCdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15801594',7.5,2782,'zh','人生大事','Having been released after serving his sentence, a funeral director accidentally crosses paths with a girl which brings about an unexpected change in his attitude towards life.','/xHTGLYpZKfwGJ0lM2NEAmb6DdYi.jpg','2022-06-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Lighting Up the Stars',945664,2.4348,7.4,'Oo1aTWn-EqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29186,_binary '\0','/5HMmzpWnH6b9gV3WQ3LscPRoCJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1580426',5.7,7338,'en','Repeaters','A gritty mind-bending thriller about three twenty-somethings who find themselves in an impossible time labyrinth, where each day they awaken to the same terrifying day as the preceding one.','/9nQuL87o5AcUayeZM3cOXw1VbIv.jpg','2011-04-22',89,'Released',NULL,'Repeaters',71700,2.2541,5.8,'WA4TT6A-4IU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29187,_binary '\0','/nBpGom2LNszdhuicnlF4Xk6v3BI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1580704',6.6,4326,'hi','That Girl in Yellow Boots','An Anglo-Indian woman works in a seedy Mumbai massage parlor while trying to find her long-lost father.','/3Kgg5SU0mW77ZmQf58knmadzWvf.jpg','2011-09-02',103,'Released',NULL,'That Girl in Yellow Boots',77864,1.5617,5.837,'FRDRfQ_mZnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29188,_binary '\0','/mN0iadY7U4mUvXuoLBwwjtGAD32.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15807910',6.6,12854,'en','I Used to Be Famous','A former boy band star unexpectedly gets a second shot at success when he forms a bond with a gifted young drummer.','/hJMnsf6vzgoNx0bv3uh3PTCjmks.jpg','2022-09-09',104,'Releas