,'Released',NULL,'The Jewel',58060,1.2165,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29197,_binary '\0','/eF8xdU1zbaCpD7W19bK6zl76Krn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1582244',7.3,2160,'fr','Présumé coupable','Investigates the corrupt judicial system under which Alain Mar\'caux and his wife Edith were arrested on accusations of pedophilia horrific acts they never committed- and the years he spent fighting to get out of prison, clear his name and keep his family.','/9OnoipN90KiaMGCUuYZjZv8o0rC.jpg','2011-09-07',102,'Released','For justice, there were no innocents.','Guilty',83801,1.4099,7.153,'MckK5rnpo-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29198,_binary '\0','/4ANhs0bjHHu7wy2HOEaGrxgGp0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1582248',6.8,25753,'en','Puncture','Based on a true story. Mike Weiss (Chris Evans) is a brilliant but self-destructive Houston attorney whose drug addiction threatens to destroy his career. When he and his law partner Paul Danziger (Mark Kassen) take on a case involving a nurse injured by a contaminated needle, they uncover a $130 billion medical supply monopoly that has been blocking a life-saving safety','/sQD8NLW8ZsKHZMx9n7dLHSDgseH.jpg','2011-09-23',100,'Released','Madman. Genius. Playboy. Friend. Fool. Lawyer.','Puncture',72432,4.0845,6.7,'LVxH9UXEoMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29199,_binary '\0','/jPlyFmmh9rHQqIuRtEv0gCsOVPK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1582271',5.5,7744,'en','The Good Doctor','Dr. Martin Blake, who has spent his life looking for respect, meets an 18-year-old patient named Diane, suffering from a kidney infection, and gets a much-needed boost of self-esteem. However, when her health starts improving, Martin fears losing her, so he begins tampering with her treatment, keeping Diane sick and in the hospital right next to him.','/fJSdqHzpMeCkXMrILYt1SdGN2sL.jpg','2011-04-23',93,'Released','Do no harm.','The Good Doctor',65650,4.5255,6.181,'7NwPdz5iU6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29200,_binary '\0','/u8sfmvTrmaVC7r2QOarw7z555NY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15822830',7.2,1360,'en','North to Home','Suzanne McBride is excited to spend her birthday with her family. It will be the first time that her three adopted daughters will be together in years. This seems like a great time for a family reunion, but the sisters are each wrestling with unique challenges that threaten to derail this special occasion.','/5iKw3VjDs5TvuM5T2x6kSvb4fTT.jpg','2022-01-09',84,'Released','When life takes a turn, sisters take your hand.','North to Home',910772,1.6115,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29201,_binary '\0','/iJ27WaIy8xyrwAyHCYiJJNFq3Hy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15823728',6.5,7549,'en','BRATS','In the 1980s, Andrew McCarthy was part of a young generation of actors who were set to take over Hollywood after a string of successful teen movies. However, when the New York magazine cover story in 1985 dubs them the Brat Pack, stars in the making suddenly find themselves losing control over the trajectory of their careers. Now, almost forty years later, McCarthy looks to reconnect with peers and co-stars so that together they can reflect on their respective legacies.','/8kXKxkFo1KC0pwvjbaKg4ruXG6J.jpg','2024-06-07',92,'Released','Everybody wanted to be in the Brat Pack. Except them.','BRATS',999621,2.4657,6.1,'MxVNQkRM5Qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29202,_binary '\0','/1ZnbzMbxgSqKuCh9aOQCvv1mAyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt15824322',5.6,8699,'en','Christmas with You','Feeling career burnout, pop star Angelina escapes to grant a young fan\'s wish in small-town New York, where she not only finds the inspiration to revitalize her career but also a shot at true love.','/26RZloFHUyc0GTsybmnUPpSCPHb.jpg','2022-11-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Christmas with You',936960,3.5594,5.841,'BYti8tb3rmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29203,_binary '\0','/wGCGL