e du Vème','An American writer moves to Paris to be closer to his daughter and finds himself falling immediately on hard times.','/1wjGtEhg1bRATf5EKe5wplNJR98.jpg','2011-09-11',84,'Released','What you can not resist, you may not survive','The Woman in the Fifth',82501,2.9337,5.222,'YkaxVp5otdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29393,_binary '\0','/kylqe795oZYdUpa5WLFPYdjzqjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1605782',7,2923,'en','Comic-Con Episode IV: A Fan\'s Hope','A behind-the-scenes look at San Diego Comic-Con, the world\'s largest comic book convention, and the fans who attend every year.','/zcYCcVxJWulOMNrQJZxzMRuBmm7.jpg','2011-09-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Comic-Con Episode IV: A Fan\'s Hope',91356,3.2418,6.9,'9iyg5gB3nT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29394,_binary '\0','/b5bcKhvN6VP82U5ztNdPfOLiolD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1605783',7.6,474172,'en','Midnight in Paris','While on a trip to Paris with his fiancée\'s family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.','/4wBG5kbfagTQclETblPRRGihk0I.jpg','2011-05-11',94,'Released','Anything can happen in the city of light.','Midnight in Paris',59436,13.4256,7.508,'FAfR8omt-CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29395,_binary '\0','/me1O35voxm9rnyNvoVAVZdMA5Ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1605798',6,7449,'en','Effie Gray','A look at the mysterious relationship between Victorian art critic John Ruskin and his teenage bride Effie Gray.','/eEeuxFscc6NLdyhpvqBGsHgpqV3.jpg','2014-03-08',104,'Released','The Celebrity Scandal of the Victorian era.','Effie Gray',114155,3.6676,6,'iQPcqsBC288','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29396,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16058566',3.8,1995,'te','Ooriki Uttharana','In the 1980s, people who fall in love are tied up and killed. After 30 years, Raju falls in love with Shailu. What will happen to between Current Raju and Shailu?','/oM6yivfyNCL2pLyyzBPJHVrmvHh.jpg','2021-11-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Ooriki Uttharana',1121994,1.1594,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29397,_binary '\0','/nazhtLZUpFo2WYpR7G5fXV8vQFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606180',7,11329,'en','That\'s What I Am','A coming-of-age story that follows 12-year-old Andy Nichol, a bright student who, like most kids his age, will do anything to avoid conflict for fear of suffering overwhelming ridicule and punishment from his junior high school peers.','/wEVN6PW7cBW4JytulTtQNtRV1T8.jpg','2011-04-29',101,'Released','I\'m a teacher. I\'m a singer. I\'m a writer.','That\'s What I Am',57118,3.3101,6.8,'k6R9EFc2mvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29398,_binary '\0','/i3SmJIAp2XkO1RTdATFqFQYzJTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606183',7.3,3308,'ta','பாஸ் என்கிற பாஸ்கரன்','Bhaskaran is in love with a young and beautiful professor, Chandrika. In order to catch her attention and start a successful career, he along with his friend, Nallathambi, get up to various antics leading to hilarious consequences.','/47IzljgWEI4AkFfh89MJR4W7Bsg.jpg','2010-09-10',160,'Released',NULL,'Boss Engira Baskaran',51867,1.038,6.382,'VYuHcjcCxrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29399,_binary '\0','/xXMLr75S7mdmx7b6KA14VtCpoEg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606259',6.8,3294,'en','Knuckle','An epic 12-year journey into the brutal and secretive world of Irish Traveler bare-knuckle fighting. This film follows a history of violent feuding between rival clans.','/b93xbrz5kVYn5LUgHOznkaf5BvH.jpg','2011-12-09',97,'Released','Twelve years. Three clans. One war.','Knuckle',71771,0.7972,5.7,'XKYAgpW64Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29400,_binary '\0','/syEBH7EfneUnl19CLZHWCiQMwur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606267',5.2,2437,'hi','लफंगे परिंदे','The path of a street fighter and a dancer on skates, who are in love, is paved by friendship, grit and hope.','/kJurtDFPuOaSYUJQvmvwGxL2ntP.jpg','2010-08-20',126,'Released','Born wild. Born blind. Born to fight. Born to fly.','Lafangey Parindey',44613,1.199,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29401,_binary '\0','/yKwNdtid7BlZuTb4lqBcoQXC5fB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606339',6,5620,'en','Sushi Girl','Fish has spent six years in jail. Six years alone. Six years keeping his mouth shut about the robbery, about the other men involved. The night he is released, the four men he protected with silence celebrate his freedom with a congratulatory dinner. The meal is a lavish array of sushi, served off the naked body of a beautiful young woman. The sushi girl seems catatonic, trained to ignore everything in the room, even if things become dangerous. Sure enough, the four unwieldy thieves can\'t help but open old wounds in an attempt to find their missing loot.','/v4zrt4usen1Cd4kg0on67B4GjTT.jpg','2012-12-07',98,'Released','REVENGE IS A DISH BEST SERVED RAW.','Sushi Girl',60540,3.2362,5.5,'cb8F1F_DlpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29402,_binary '\0','/te4Jw00uYaDNfsa5sEPffMjSqpE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606376',6.4,1431,'ta','அவன் இவன்','A landlord takes a liking to two half-brothers who con people and adopts them. But his adopted family\'s harmony is disrupted when a smuggler enters their lives.','/jVxsUgXOcpcHgtbH5ubxIfo36eB.jpg','2011-06-17',130,'Released',NULL,'Avan Ivan',65518,1.2385,5.848,'JMmpvvfR0X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29403,_binary '\0','/wFUkS5cnMf3I8ysIPWzIXpTsuR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606378',5.2,224444,'en','A Good Day to Die Hard','Iconoclastic, take-no-prisoners cop John McClane, finds himself for the first time on foreign soil after traveling to Moscow to help his wayward son Jack - unaware that Jack is really a highly-trained CIA operative out to stop a nuclear weapons heist. With the Russian underworld in pursuit, and battling a countdown to war, the two McClanes discover that their opposing methods make them unstoppable heroes.','/qJ0csDXAVFMsNn0cRcjy6W6PxAK.jpg','2013-02-06',98,'Released','Yippee ki-yay Mother Russia.','A Good Day to Die Hard',47964,9.331,5.3,'5SQ0IzY0YrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29404,_binary '\0','/4QHF7kAYjIpZ5U8A0amvhRkHlZ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606384',7.6,13574,'ko','마이웨이','During the invasion of Normandy the photograph of a slim Korean man in German uniform was found. It transpired that the man had served as a soldier in the Japanese, Russian and German armies. His incredible story inspired director Kang Je-Gyu to create this epic war drama.','/3moPqIC1EBFilLI3YJNa5Nfel3e.jpg','2011-12-21',137,'Released','They met as enemies, but fate brought them together.','My Way',94047,5.5778,7.913,'GSSx0ICfEVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29405,_binary '\0','/a8IFeO1BMn4QEfLsf41Ml7LodyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606389',6.8,215641,'en','The Vow','Happy young married couple Paige and Leo are, well, happy. Then a car accident puts Paige into a life-threatening coma. Upon awakening she has lost the previous five years of memories, including those of her beloved Leo, her wedding, a confusing relationship with her parents, or the ending of her relationship with her ex-fiance. Despite these complications, Leo endeavors to win her heart again and rebuild their marriage.','/y5GUXzTvt7kSQbdQrSvbYNoa8HB.jpg','2012-02-05',104,'Released',NULL,'The Vow',72570,8.4146,7.2,'PcL24s-S6ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29406,_binary '\0','/xUTmr4QaB3XFU3TOWRGmZjnQFWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606390',5.4,2899,'en','All Things Fall Apart','50 Cent stars as gifted college running back Deon in this touching drama. Deon\'s world turns upside down when an unexpected crisis jeopardizes his professional ambitions -- and causes him to look at himself and his life in a new way.','/ktla2qVgVmPLCHBSYHt7oY5B2mo.jpg','2011-03-05',106,'Released','He won the game. Now he must fight the battle.','All Things Fall Apart',63139,2.5767,5.8,'qxR3xpp2TIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29407,_binary '\0','/k3v0axkDebnAq4L0v06YikelD98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606392',7.1,56440,'en','Win Win','When down-on-his-luck part-time high school wrestling coach Mike agrees to become legal guardian to an elderly man, his ward\'s troubled grandson turns out to be a star grappler, sparking dreams of a big win -- until the boy\'s mother retrieves him.','/xX0Ryq5J2weFF5BPYb80giKUL02.jpg','2011-03-18',106,'Released','In the game of life, you can\'t lose \'em all.','Win Win',55725,2.6085,6.825,'_TfeGeg6Erg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29408,_binary '\0','/3iBCtzohLGC87fEji5AzUwCKmVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606595',6.5,1411,'ja','あしたのジョー','For about as long as he can remember, Joe has always had to roll with the punches-living each day in the slums as if it may be his last. But when a wild brawl sends the kid to the slammer, the appearance of a fierce rival sparks a new passion for boxing within him. Spurred on by an unlikely mentor who believes he could go the distance, Joe leaps into the ring. But as he rises through the ranks, Joe realizes that he\'s no longer fighting for himself-he\'s fighting for tomorrow.','/1lUy2sq5O2XrtYq3vX9DgCLfsDK.jpg','2011-02-11',129,'Released',NULL,'Tomorrow\'s Joe: The Live Action Movie',72505,1.6529,7.031,'W6qNIsZBH7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29409,_binary '\0','/2vdzBRU95r92aTHgFXfnPODBUag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606652',6.4,1806,'ru','ПираМММида','Russia, early 90s. A fictional story inspired by financier Sergey Mavrodi, his securities company \"MMM\", and the pyramid scheme he ran that left upwards of fifteen million investors with nothing when it crashed.','/ilG5ZlBgsficgGuomuth45QhwxS.jpg','2011-04-07',105,'Released',NULL,'The PyraMMMid',61998,1.1919,5.82,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29410,_binary '\0','/4EzNgqecWKybssxauZDFObR3Dso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606657',5.4,1456,'fi','Pussikaljaelokuva','Sixpack is a positive story on the outskirts of society. The story takes place in Helsinki on rock and following the advent of exclusion of the story regarding one of summer days. The film\'s protagonist, Marshal, is stuck in a shabby home. Lihi and Henninen attract the Marshal out and tired of opposition after the Marshal finds them to spend a hot summer day in the park in the world with amazement. The trio crash -day pass to the young, rutjakkeisiin sense of humor to the police. Day lasts from early morning until the evening the rain to bring sorrow alhoon. Eventually, however, the sun began to rise again it\'s time to become sensitized and look deep into the eyes of friendship.','/ymejckdcT2l3b3bPkxDP9d2kzG1.jpg','2011-09-02',80,'Released',NULL,'Sixpack',85988,0.714,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29411,_binary '\0','/eZ1qsU4WBUeokmskklKTai5i1yN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606789',6.8,6970,'nl','Loft','Five best friends, all married, decide to share a loft apartment. In this loft they meet their mistresses and conquests. Everything seems perfect, until one morning the body of an unknown young woman is found in the loft. The group of friends begin to suspect each other and it soon becomes clear that they know far less about each other than they had initially thought.','/w4zK9iEIvJF8iAsFgveQZ9qXM0b.jpg','2010-12-16',110,'Released','Love. Lies. Lust.','Loft',57059,2.5825,6.248,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29412,_binary '\0','/5OQEUn0hjUFG2iV2kB09nZnoPU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1606829',8.2,3760,'lt','Kita svajonių komanda','The incredible story of the 1992 Lithuanian basketball team, whose athletes struggled under Soviet rule, became symbols of Lithuania\'s independence movement, and – with help from the Grateful Dead – triumphed at the Barcelona Olympics.','/kAGqVFdtRSccMfTUpKuRcQtXsCc.jpg','2012-09-28',89,'Released',NULL,'The Other Dream Team',84318,1.2558,7.2,'VlEYzY_haD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29413,_binary '\0','/3QI1svaflS6kBjXyCou3TkjoRU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16073638',6,1890,'en','Nyctophobia','As Liz struggles with nyctophobia (fear of the dark), a form of anxiety disorder that causes sleeping issues, she desperately tries to fall asleep by entering her “inner world” where she can access her happy childhood memories. However, she ultimately becomes trapped in a time loop of sorts in her “lucid dream” world and encounters her nightmare, Dark Figure, who appears in various forms and shapes as a clown. The time loop pushes her deeper into her lucid dream world, forcing her to reach her subconscious world where she meets her worst nightmare, the original form of Dark Figure.','/sBulkIdsfX0tR8eX9sCiMUGrX8g.jpg','2024-05-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Nyctophobia',1295064,0.7353,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29414,_binary '\0','/s7NbHqBc0bFWo0XHZrsrtMoMx2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16077654',6.4,1616,'ml','പത്മിനി','Rameshan, a lecturer and part-time poet, becomes the laughing stock of the village after his wife runs away on the wedding night. When he tries to overcome these taunts and win a second chance at love, he faces an uphill legal battle and toxicity of the society.','/dH5T9iztaJZ0NZDWiOOJfwzxUXI.jpg','2023-07-07',120,'Released',NULL,'Padmini',896828,1.0946,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29415,_binary '\0','/colFxzt6jfOqHvStz0uQKY9cgKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16077702',6.5,11249,'hi','गोविंदा नाम मेरा','An abusive wife, a hot girlfriend and a court case, Govinda Waghmare is just not able to catch a break. The icing on top of that horrible cake - a murder.','/c93pb87QTyMIdzV6ufUZSQfVMFi.jpg','2022-12-16',131,'Released','One murder, one suspect, but many secrets','Govinda Naam Mera',663457,1.1121,5.903,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29416,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16077750',7,1990,'te','Ikshu','Ikshva, a 16-year-old boy seeks help from a police officer to find his missing parents. An uninvited guest and local goons turn his fate around. Will he find his parents?','/3lPc8ppzbIzB8CREmv7w1BlnCsi.jpg','2022-09-23',124,'Released',NULL,'Ikshu',1179742,0.4571,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29417,_binary '\0','/t2Qtn9Vzm4a1pnu5LpKjfKUVQGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16078152',6.3,2211,'te','ఐరావతం','A mysterious white camera turns a beautician\'s life into a waking nightmare, especially when she watches herself dying in the videos shoots with it.','/2OCZWu1rnhonkW142xmSIwzXaFs.jpg','2022-05-06',122,'Released',NULL,'Iravatham',899661,0.7723,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29418,_binary '\0','/4ANhwN1jr5EGwHS0M13AH5Fs3NH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1608290',4.7,82592,'en','Zoolander 2','Derek and Hansel are modelling again when an opposing company attempts to take them out from the business.','/n8AJzALlTPBwe9Tkv3tdxbiAr9i.jpg','2016-02-06',100,'Released','Long time no Z.','Zoolander 2',329833,8.3526,4.9,'4CL4LNWHegk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29419,_binary '\0','/noxDwlQ2s2rZDqt8tqpEAhgAs7g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1608368',5.1,3141,'en','House Hunting','Two families go to an open house and can\'t leave','/zPMDRYwlnP6oDcOravyc0U2X6oB.jpg','2013-03-05',102,'Released','Family is hell','House Hunting',158967,3.0036,5.2,'eJ5wS4MZY6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29420,_binary '\0','/5UjRTKgaspuhynCHsxSgFKvC7Kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1608516',7.2,3110,'de','Lauf Junge lauf','A true story of Jurek, an eight-year-old boy, who escapes from the Warsaw ghetto, then manages to survive in the woods and working as a farmhand, disguising himself as a Polish orphan.','/nmrLlmQbuPNlqurK5T7UXDLStkU.jpg','2014-01-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Run Boy Run',239103,2.7213,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29421,_binary '\0','/7mGSBKuIGrFc9HNfp85bppQcFhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16085592',4.8,8026,'en','Tall Girl 2','After Jodi Kreyman gains popularity, her miscommunications start causing rifts with those around her and now she really needs to \"stand tall\".','/eyKkLdst2vFRjCC89C3NqGCLpNE.jpg','2022-02-10',97,'Released','Growing up is a tall order.','Tall Girl 2',772272,4.778,5.737,'2-1qlHIhWXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29422,_binary '\0','/avCJaZVDLnJuLvSmwIWmZczmqk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1608776',5.8,1366,'no','Kurt Josef Wagle og legenden om Fjordheksa','Is The Fjord Witch superstition, or is it true that Satan\'s bride lives across Melkelva in the forest by Grytefjord? Does Tordenskjold find himself or someone else entirely? Who would win in a magic battle between Jesus and Harry Potter? These and other questions are answered in Kurt Josef Wagle\'s lost video footage.','/yfKPz7EwZYIUdLqVSYZvXmm0hfQ.jpg','2010-03-05',82,'Released',NULL,'Kurt Josef Wagle and the Legend of the Fjord Witch',50324,1.2134,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29423,_binary '\0','/ibNLyuef3pdV3T8n3FKB3FQ9Qs7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1608777',7.1,6598,'hi','लव सेक्स और धोखा','A video camcorder, a store security camera, and concealed cameras candidly expose lives in three loosely linked tales.','/cGB0TZ27GXUTaBIxhf7IBPiHXzr.jpg','2010-03-19',108,'Released','You\'re being watched','LSD: Love, Sex aur Dhokha',35687,1.5451,6.039,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29424,_binary '\0','/AjfboLPgxFmUBHJzXBl2S5KS53L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16088568',5.8,2909,'es','Anónima','After an accidental text message turns into a digital friendship, Vale and Alex start crushing on each other without realizing they\'ve met in real life.','/kQu9rNkiB0nSSRGQX0B6u9sxwfw.jpg','2021-12-10',101,'Released',NULL,'Anonymously Yours',899405,2.3689,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29425,_binary '\0','/6HrSHokojPDUS4acsGBfrhx5Whm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609159',6.9,2816,'nl','Süskind','In Nazi-occupied Amsterdam, Walter Süskind is a member of the Dutch Jewish Council who rescues hundreds of children from the concentration camps.','/gUTHRtIkXpRbQb6dCVCGnd81I5g.jpg','2012-01-19',117,'Released',NULL,'Süskind',84057,1.7346,7,'guuJetChM4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29426,_binary '\0','/hGBleDZsJGo0epp50ekddIz9cvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609168',8.1,7771,'ta','விண்ணைத்தாண்டி வருவாயா','A young, aspiring filmmaker falls in love with a girl who moves into the house above his, but her sophisticated nature does more harm than good to him.','/AldNCoRJlhkzkBzKPmUalBdRCts.jpg','2010-02-26',157,'Released','Will you cross the skies for me?','Vinnaithaandi Varuvaayaa',37941,1.2195,7.379,'xK383VB7DuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29427,_binary '\0','/A254tk9Digrjx6e9ePlWvoKiD9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16092020',6.3,1438,'fi','Lapua 1976','On April 13th 1976, a devastating munitions factory accident shook the town of Lapua, Finland. Hundreds of kilograms of gunpowder ignited, causing an explosion that took the lives of 40 workers. Lapua 1976 tells a story of love, life, perseverance, grief and hope in the face of unbelievable calamity.','/1xSS5jLQNnpG5L9CafPJwFDw02a.jpg','2023-09-01',114,'Released',NULL,'Lapua 1976',1068427,1.5346,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29428,_binary '\0','/qnx8XZfvCNhRZCWThq2UW2BV5Gb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609479',6.2,16146,'en','Better Living Through Chemistry','A straight-laced pharmacist\'s uneventful life spirals out of control when he starts an affair with a trophy wife customer who takes him on a joyride involving sex, drugs and possibly murder.','/9PpwTNDsXnuGHcwBdpgybVSwsFN.jpg','2014-03-14',91,'Released','Happiness has no formula','Better Living Through Chemistry',157099,5.0646,5.9,'F3MeyUawSsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29429,_binary '\0','/biMJPdS7bGW7HQTQrHvXxMqOqdC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609486',5.8,10915,'en','Harold and the Purple Crayon','Inside of his book, adventurous Harold can make anything come to life simply by drawing it. After he grows up and draws himself off the book\'s pages and into the physical world, Harold finds he has a lot to learn about real life.','/qtW6bWUEqfPLaD6KnetIlSG4adf.jpg','2024-07-31',90,'Released','Everything he draws is about to get real.','Harold and the Purple Crayon',826510,7.7819,6.5,'-itXhXgatsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29430,_binary '\0','/ooeqJjQljGUt005iLZvdx3SZQRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609492',6.3,2693,'da','Superclásico','Christian is a Copenhagen wine seller on the brink of bankruptcy. Equally unsuccessful in just about every other aspect of life, it has been 17months since his wife Anna left him. Anna works as a soccer agent in Buenos Aires and now lives a life of luxury with Argentina\'s top player Juan Diaz. Then one day Christian and their 16-year-old son Oscar get on a plane to Buenos Aires. Christian arrives under the pretense of wanting to sign the divorce papers, but in truth, he wants to try to win Anna back.','/cBpnavIdRd8yxjux6vr2Rd6XK6W.jpg','2011-03-17',99,'Released',NULL,'Superclasico',74674,1.9624,6.2,'swOCtS3CbGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29431,_binary '\0','/d5IQaD0Nj9gjXtpUFq0oWRZaAuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609497',5.3,3613,'en','Quasi','A hapless hunchback who only yearns for love, finds himself in the middle of a murderous feud between the Pope and the King of France when each orders the hunchback to kill the other.','/g6uFA7r4VqqQeW4u9YtktheRXUt.jpg','2023-04-20',99,'Released','Every day is hump day.','Quasi',893752,3.2697,5.161,'PLUjuJpaTOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29432,_binary '\0','/dA8FBVYzcU2nWtM1y1tGKMidju6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609790',6.3,2917,'sv','Cornelis','”Cornelis” is the unique chronicle about one of Sweden’s greatest music legends - Cornelis Vreeswijk. An honest and gripping account of an exceptionally talented, but self-destructive artist’s intense life both on and behind the stage. A man who during his whole life was searching for love and confirmation.','/jR2cnZfeiBDGUNbpqlts5mM1omv.jpg','2010-11-12',101,'Released','A man. A voice. A legend.','Cornelis',50021,1.6516,6.1,'s-VkNVRj14w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29433,_binary '\0','/hiDAPAJ5m1yg0A2Pb6LOtaVfLXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1609808',3.5,1322,'sv','Åsa-Nisse - Wälkom to Knohult','In Knohult things havn\'t changed much. Eulalia is tired of Nisse who\'s engaged in all sorts of inventions in his workshop or poaching in the forest rather than to repair the water pump. When Eulalia in protest begins swimming in soft drinks and water the plants with spirit Åsa-Nisse sees nothing else to do but to repair the pump. As with all his inventions he adds a few extra features ... When he starts the machine the ground rumbles and up comes oil instead of water! Now, not only Åsa-Nisse, but the whole Knohult sees their chance to become wealthy! But \"Dunderpumpen\", as he calles the invention, turns out to be stronger than anyone had imagined, and when shady Scanian oil magnates with support of the Swedish government wants their share of the pie Knohult declares themselves a republic...','/krAuSKxCWC7ppCLzxHe3t8Fxc2j.jpg','2011-02-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Asa-Nisse - Welcome to Knohult',56991,1.5743,3.2,'knxZ4bco9XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29434,_binary '\0','/u5sRhOL7AyB68AQ0tpBkYpEkAIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16103578',5,2935,'en','Mother, May I?','Emmett enters into a nightmarish game of therapy with his wife Anya, who has inexplicably taken on the persona of his estranged and recently-deceased mother.','/iBYEX7IxR9wocuhgzco7D3SG90F.jpg','2023-07-21',99,'Released','You only get one mother.','Mother, May I?',1019961,2.0711,5.3,'1vmDCpuBj_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29435,_binary '\0','/pni27Qk251zHWwtZwcxxFPE5ErI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16103606',8.1,3698,'ta','இறுகப்பற்று','Three couples from different economic backgrounds find ways to fix their relationships.','/bnxW2Pb0k2n7G7atvBs7wnwaCdE.jpg','2023-10-06',153,'Released','Unfold Yourself','Irugapatru',1074673,1.1584,7.281,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29436,_binary '\0','/lmOFoZBxTEwc75N1TN91kqdAzxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1610452',7.2,19999,'hi','Band Baaja Baaraat','Shruti and Bittoo decide to start a wedding planning company together after they graduate from university, but romance gets in the way of business.','/n9Yd0otyugR9ArGxRwbEYxUXjTH.jpg','2010-12-10',139,'Released',NULL,'Band Baaja Baaraat',52696,1.8933,6.7,'k67ErU7SeIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29437,_binary '\0','/z8Hk7JSqXc2c86vAg17f73XSed1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1610525',6.5,7635,'en','Chuck','A drama inspired by the life of heavyweight boxer Chuck Wepner.','/xRowWuf8Q5bazuPRIqYLaKRxxs.jpg','2017-05-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Chuck',373546,3.2758,6.3,'0AQXwOOqNNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29438,_binary '\0','/mpxTLzAs7Os3SnjtnjqZ6PzOgae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16106000',5.1,2032,'lv','Upurga','A local guide is asked to lead a group of influencers along the river of a remote valley. As they get deeper into the wilderness, their venture takes a frightening turn.','/8Q0sJtvbhkPJ1jXzvYW7qzgcupk.jpg','2022-04-21',90,'Released','A mythological thriller in the wild','River of Fear',888001,1.6987,5.6,'4Az4zpFx6xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29439,_binary '\0','/hY0BJllNWKQP9BvJu6gCVbUEXVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1610996',5.8,21994,'en','Absentia','Tricia\'s husband has been missing for seven years. Her younger sister Callie comes to live with her as the pressure mounts to finally declare him \'dead in absentia\'. Tricia is reluctant, always holding out hope, but Callie is practical and wants her to move on. As Tricia sifts through the wreckage and tries to move on with her life, Callie finds herself drawn to an ominous tunnel near the house.','/imUIPWoe0Yma5UhZVl6bqX5lF.jpg','2011-03-03',91,'Released','There are fates worse than death.','Absentia',74777,4.3585,5.821,'aa1UJLqYeBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29440,_binary '\0','/bKNQQU1df6CpzTICYbxG5tBOHFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1611004',7.4,2739,'bn','অটোগ্রাফ','Arun, a famous Bengali actor, approves Shuvobrata\'s proposal of remaking Satyajit Ray\'s famous film \'Nayak\'. Problems arise when Shuvobrata requests his live-in girlfriend Shrin to act opposite Arun.','/zSf33ViXQsfsSCTz8QzSwcQIp2E.jpg','2010-10-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Autograph',167558,1.2178,8.1,'nWubjFn4ci4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29441,_binary '\0','/bcX3U1VTbreXzpOblmK0KhEbC8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1611211',6.9,6183,'de','Vincent will Meer','Vincent, a young man who suffers from Tourette\'s syndrome, has just lost his mother. His father, a successful politician, does not want to take care of him and therefore places him into a mental institution. He is put into a room with Alexander, a guy with a compulsive disorder, and is shown around by Marie, an anorectic girl.','/lGJUOYiOLrhk4p9SmQNT6qIX155.jpg','2010-04-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Vincent Wants to Sea',47979,1.8264,6.7,'KE_yskjXBOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29442,_binary '\0','/ei4bXNp4hBrfUEvWkp7usnQeGQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1611224',5.9,169352,'en','Abraham Lincoln: Vampire Hunter','President Lincoln\'s mother is killed by a supernatural creature, which fuels his passion to crush vampires and their slave-owning helpers.','/qv8deK0ZmutAuEpejruQKApIy6r.jpg','2012-06-20',105,'Released','Are you a patriot or a vampire?','Abraham Lincoln: Vampire Hunter',72331,10.4332,5.773,'2ilUeTRuDpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29443,_binary '\0','/w49XUahDiIFcx0U7DUOpIpX60gx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16118524',7,8998,'te','బేబీ','A pair of high school sweethearts face challenges in their relationship when they take different directions in life.','/cr74IPXOmqEgJMZ0yRppIuQvyqU.jpg','2023-07-14',175,'Released',NULL,'Baby',894730,1.6005,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29444,_binary '\0','/bbosLXMWiM6FBvByi5rZ3SvSA5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16118722',8,5489,'en','Tony Hawk: Until the Wheels Fall Off','A wide-ranging, definitive look at Hawk’s life and iconic career, and his relationship with the sport with which he’s been synonymous for decades, featuring unprecedented access, never-before-seen footage, and interviews with Hawk and prominent figures in the sport including Stacy Peralta, Rodney Mullen, Mike McGill, Lance Mountain, Steve Caballero, Neil Blender, Andy MacDonald, Duane Peters, Sean Mortimer, and Christian Hosoi.','/namFh1FM7BkCkiljALtgMXOoANI.jpg','2022-03-12',129,'Released',NULL,'Tony Hawk: Until the Wheels Fall Off',881198,2.5646,7.7,'iqhmW_etP38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29445,_binary '\0','/1kQGVh547uKRQwyEsnmYEsVVhiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1612319',4.9,2916,'en','Re-Kill','Five years after a zombie outbreak, the men and women of R-Division hunt down and destroy the undead. When they see signs of a second outbreak, they fear humanity may not survive.','/iPunx6eRmwxCDuDGB0N0o1jqADP.jpg','2015-10-16',87,'Released','We are the endangered species.','Re-Kill',106845,3.3594,6,'qsmQG8mEU1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29446,_binary '\0','/uoGc2A2XhYKcyfN4O2MOOixP24g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16124480',5.6,2360,'en','Reno 911!: The Hunt for QAnon','The Reno Sheriff’s Department find themselves in their stickiest situation yet, hunting down “Q,\" the person supposedly behind all of the conspiracy theories concocted by the QAnon movement. In their valiant efforts, the officers find themselves stuck at the QAnon convention at sea, and ultimately end up in more trouble when they escape only to discover that they’ve landed on Jeffrey Epstein’s infamous island.','/u8Mgy1UKexJfXjsTsglD83HkL5Z.jpg','2021-12-23',85,'Released','They\'re coming for Q.','Reno 911!: The Hunt for QAnon',899599,2.4281,5.763,'ExPt6yPfN_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29447,_binary '\0','/zLdjY4sdpIjto8AAqVtrTwDgnAt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1612608',5.8,1675,'fr','L\'Italien','Dino Fabrizzi is the number one seller of the Maserati dealership in Nice. At 42, he arrives at a turning point in his life, the position of director is openly proposed and his companion for a year, Helen, has the firm intention to marry her. For Dino, life is great, except that this perfect life was built on a lie. Dino is actually called Mourad Ben Saoud. Neither his boss nor Helen and even less his parents are aware of this false identity. In ten days begins Ramadan and Mourad who passes every year will this time assume the promise made to his sick father. Taking part in Ramadan, For Dino - the Italian - it will not be easy.','/plzFowK4MWA4ml4d9ptXlo7zLBI.jpg','2010-07-07',102,'Released',NULL,'The Italian',44155,1.4487,5.2,'c04NDJyECXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29448,_binary '\0','/hjYwsQQiOZJ3VO5ybqjaxafpbRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16127696',5,8473,'en','There\'s Something Wrong with the Children','Margaret and Ben take a weekend trip with longtime friends Ellie and Thomas and their two young children. Eventually, Ben begins to suspect something supernatural is occurring when the kids behave strangely after disappearing into the woods overnight.','/v8bSJhypBS39d9z4XZLAfHMquKA.jpg','2023-01-17',92,'Released',NULL,'There\'s Something Wrong with the Children',899579,4.1207,5.681,'OtYQB4r8Jew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29449,_binary '\0','/cqfaq9uczoHBBug74eORBH4Jcpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1612774',5.7,43307,'fr','Rubber','In the California desert, the adventures of a telepathic killer-tire, mysteriously attracted by a very pretty girl, as witnessed by incredulous onlookers.','/mWgCORI5IC5vOvB2cDVQe0YNtXZ.jpg','2010-11-09',82,'Released','Are you TIRED of the expected?','Rubber',45649,4.1956,5.9,'6s2uiPubmoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29450,_binary '\0','/md382aIRYpTu68TTksbXFSjFayW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1612782',5.4,2687,'en','The Butterfly Room','A reclusive and butterfly-obsessed elderly lady suffering from bipolar disorder develops a disturbing relationship with a mysterious but seemingly innocent youngster.','/s3qWNikZnuyzaVcZ5w9ClTROnhv.jpg','2012-08-04',87,'Released','Kids should never grow up','The Butterfly Room',101176,2.0045,5.7,'qh0qpffHw2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29451,_binary '\0','/aXGZ2xLKNHw7CXxX3GPDz4r1jK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1613023',7.6,4206,'en','Beats Rhymes & Life: The Travels of A Tribe Called Quest','Having forged a 20-year run as one of the most innovative and influential hip hop bands of all time, the Queens NY collective known as \'A Tribe Called Quest\' have kept a generation hungry for more of their groundbreaking music since their much publicized breakup in 1998. Michael Rapaport documents the inner workings and behind the scenes drama that follows the band to this day. He explores what\'s next for, what many claim, are the pioneers of alternative rap.','/kiE1jlShHK4HuBQJyLJ4c8lqMn8.jpg','2011-07-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Beats Rhymes & Life: The Travels of A Tribe Called Quest',70342,2.1411,7.1,'izT2Xmw1X3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29452,_binary '\0','/l8NDCwm1wUyo9DCBZlfMQy8NomO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1613040',8,6182,'te','లీడర్','Upon the death of his father, Arjun Prasad campaigns to become the CM of Andhra. He hopes to eradicate corruption from Indian Politics.','/kh4YPMvpyore0jFPyQ2eV5JSihv.jpg','2010-02-19',172,'Released','The Campaign Begins','Leader',55283,1.2342,6.712,'ddAAjFJBeZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29453,_binary '\0','/aIA3CacNlk7HTE7Sa4zb2nbUtJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1613062',7.5,9149,'en','The Music Never Stopped','Henry struggles to bond with his estranged son, Gabriel, who suffers from a brain tumor that prevents him from forming new memories. With Gabriel unable to shed the beliefs and interests that caused their physical and emotional distance, Henry must learn to embrace his son\'s choices and try to connect with him through music.','/hbKqNh3bi2Do4cpefIbBNUdQJg6.jpg','2011-03-18',105,'Released','No matter how lost you are, music can bring you home.','The Music Never Stopped',56401,2.6559,7.2,'7rXv9qlA91M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29454,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1613092',7.2,3455,'en','Happy','Happy is a 2011 feature documentary film directed, written, and co-produced by Roko Belic. It explores human happiness through interviews with people from all walks of life in 14 different countries, weaving in the newest findings of positive psychology. Director Roko Belic was originally inspired to create the film after producer/director Tom Shadyac (Liar, Liar, Patch Adams, Bruce Almighty) showed him an article in the New York Times entitled \"A New Measure of Well Being From a Happy Little Kingdom\". The article ranks the United States as the 23rd happiest country in the world. Shadyac then suggested that Belic make a documentary about happiness. Belic spent several years interviewing over 20 people, ranging from leading happiness researchers to a rickshaw driver in Kolkatta, a family living in a \"co-housing community\" in Denmark, a woman who was run over by a truck, a Cajun fisherman, and more.','/wAz3VHk0nyeottwGc3lOFHi3Hky.jpg','2012-02-11',75,'Released',NULL,'Happy',86577,1.035,7.1,'JcMQmuvzPmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29455,_binary '\0','/4KJSPoZwJ1TAIaTueDxtkmo5wE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1613750',7.1,54919,'no','Kon-Tiki','The true story about legendary explorer Thor Heyerdahl and his epic crossing of the Pacific on a balsa wood raft in 1947, in an effort to prove it was possible for South Americans to settle in Polynesia in pre-Columbian times.','/tphF7lJZys5ij9BHivbxsqmPiOo.jpg','2012-08-24',118,'Released',NULL,'Kon-Tiki',70667,3.9043,6.9,'e4DZ7svBw7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29456,_binary '\0','/pnoOhdjceFu62dns1B1pfbdZOEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16139258',5.7,9471,'hi','योद्धा','When terrorists hijack a passenger plane, a suspended commando onboard under mysterious circumstances, crafts a plan to thwart the hijackers and safeguard the passengers\' survival despite the engine\'s failure.','/rkCRwuWgrkGTya4vLqwFugwSqeh.jpg','2024-03-15',131,'Released','One commando. One hijack. Countless secrets.','Yodha',899718,2.0699,6.561,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29457,_binary '\0','/42ByqU555QR05IQnjRNDXtrjQu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1614408',6.5,1836,'ja','時をかける少女','Akari Yoshiyama is graduating high school soon and is expected to lead new life after she passes the university entrance exam, while her mother is working as a pharmacologist. However, her mother has a car accident and the situation is totally changed. She decides to go to 1972 to fulfill her mother\'s wish.','/hios2NxpDTkSFvdZV7CkgNkeNUC.jpg','2010-03-13',122,'Released',NULL,'Time Traveller: The Girl Who Leapt Through Time',54770,1.9581,6.3,'RFfSvCywEG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29458,_binary '\0','/1WjzTC7IegfvwUSRRQ4UI8BTTEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1614456',4.6,3558,'en','Little Deaths','Composed of three disturbingly sensual and terrifying short narratives, unified by the twin themes of sex and death.','/1g6JR23PMVPiInXkKwy3GxXkjOY.jpg','2011-02-25',90,'Released','Experimentation...Revenge...All Part of Life\'s Twisted Games...','Little Deaths',66164,1.7219,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29459,_binary '\0','/ikKKneDr1eLh3OzAahjeru227nO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16148552',6.7,2372,'fr','Le Paradis','In a youth correctional facility, Joe is preparing his return to society. But William’s arrival turns his desire for freedom into desire of another kind. Behind fences and cell walls, passions begin to play havoc with the need for liberty.','/5iLvMitjAswoh33VeAP2jCBAILE.jpg','2023-05-03',83,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Boys',1000563,2.9542,7,'L8fvn0KWq0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29460,_binary '\0','/xPvWJwjbnnKsLWg8LMkS4P2ONUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16148654',4.4,1335,'ta','கேப்டன்','A team of soldiers, led by a brave army captain, takes up a dangerous mission to go into a restricted forest area and uncover the mystery behind the unexplainable deaths of previous teams that had visited the site.','/dXtU4HbgvJTisY43gyYlbqqXizd.jpg','2022-09-08',116,'Released',NULL,'Captain',899705,1.1375,4.6,'513QYp8zYoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29461,_binary '\0','/agnO4yvC1H05nEbqonBZ5TH7EcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1614950',5.7,7183,'en','Avalon High','Elaine \"Ellie\" Harrison has just moved from Minnesota to Annapolis, Maryland while her parents take a year-long sabbatical to continue their medieval studies in nearby Washington D.C. Her new high school, Avalon High, seems like a typical high school with the stereotypical students: Lance the jock, Jennifer the cheerleader, Marco, the bad boy/desperado, and Will, the senior class president, quarterback, and all around good guy. But not everyone at Avalon High is who they appear to be, not even Ellie herself. Eventually, it becomes apparent that Avalon High is a situation where the ancient Arthurian legend is repeating itself.','/A0VRhkL3l7YWHH4FTWMCki55rfx.jpg','2011-01-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Avalon High',50479,4.9088,6.16,'RQQqNyXQXgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29462,_binary '\0','/cuodmX7wuVDciUH8LdSFEqoTzIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1614989',7.5,112336,'no','Hodejegerne','An accomplished headhunter risks everything to obtain a valuable painting owned by a former mercenary.','/k5DQqsb9T8djkTAOdwNCBBBHrtK.jpg','2011-08-26',100,'Released','The hunt is on.','Headhunters',70670,5.1618,7.2,'I7F6vru1n6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29463,_binary '\0','/aCk4WrOEsD4WgWzyc3XBg4zJANg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16150082',7.7,1836,'ar','هوبال','The Saudi family is following strict instructions from their grandfather to remain confined in the desert during the early 1990s. A series of events shakes the family\'s foundation and they find them in a struggle between life and death.','/z0YPcVdWvxG5dmBL0QRQeB2B6Th.jpg','2025-01-02',116,'Released','Every soul faces doomsday.','Hobal',1173720,1.006,8.7,'8DbWL7YCF5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29464,_binary '\0','/39FIOhhLT8mxvFRD6MaFzXCVgHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615065',6.4,139357,'en','Savages','Pot growers Ben and Chon face off against the Mexican drug cartel that kidnapped their shared girlfriend.','/joyiyBwYY5QCpldqT1FzrTqsTJK.jpg','2012-07-06',131,'Released','Young. Beautiful. Deadly.','Savages',82525,7.7663,6.359,'8imzQaoEwsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29465,_binary '\0','/sjGYwWuyXcmEkjddUTeGWpTgFxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615075',4.1,4470,'en','Suing The Devil','Luke O\'Brien, a washed-up salesman turned night law student, decides to sue Satan for $8 trillion. On the last day before Luke files a default judgment, Satan appears to defend himself. On Satan\'s legal team are 10 of the country\'s best trial lawyers. The entire world watches on Legal TV to see who will win the Trial of the Century','/3TKChf9CY05c7aZJukSNXgGYhC4.jpg','2011-08-26',104,'Released','Let the spiritual battle begin....','Suing The Devil',81694,1.3953,4,'vmCuvph6bs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29466,_binary '\0','/ikmSwv6DLBHlEJ3LmPvk7UGEJMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16150832',6.2,1246,'en','The Winter Palace','A novelist with a severe case of writer’s block is given the chance to finish her book at an empty winter chateau. She\'s surprised when the property\'s owner, a prince, decides to come stay as well.','/14iIpUh848qIxhIJ1V1tu2iobKe.jpg','2022-01-08',85,'Released',NULL,'The Winter Palace',890233,1.6162,6.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29467,_binary '\0','/3IwM2clHD1nGpBSFgo9fRtXP1dQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16150870',6.3,1479,'en','A Lot Like Christmas','Jessica Roberts owns the most popular Christmas Tree lot in the picturesque New England town of Hudson Springs. But when big-city marketing executive, Clay Moore moves a \"Big Box\" store into the area and starts selling trees, Jasmine finds her business in jeopardy. As their professional competition escalates, Jasmine and Clay run into another complication - they start falling for each other.','/nEiDoD653v8afwWsEkSG2r1TeAK.jpg','2021-12-05',84,'Released',NULL,'A Lot Like Christmas',877819,2.3719,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29468,_binary '\0','/fA11VdaJsy6jneGuZZfMDApyTmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615091',4.9,5874,'en','The Lost Future','A group of post-apocalyptic survivors, struggle to survive in a world where jungles and forests and primeval wetlands and deserts have obliterated civilization. They staunchly face genetically mutating beasts and mysterious diseases in an attempt to re-establish the human race as masters of Earth.','/rwP3xGH78aaNbGVFisFxx4LLuay.jpg','2010-11-13',90,'Released','Welcome to the apocalypse.','The Lost Future',50674,3.9972,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29469,_binary '\0','/fIriCG54pJZoMGvoHHLCPn5y7Cx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615147',7.1,164883,'en','Margin Call','Set in the high-stakes world of the financial industry, involving the key players at an investment firm during one perilous 24-hour period in the early stages of the 2008 financial crisis. An entry-level analyst unlocks information that could prove to be the downfall of the firm.','/xNXYXJ3XNC9o5wxDF2ImZ9b2es.jpg','2011-09-28',107,'Released','Be first. Be smarter. Or cheat.','Margin Call',50839,10.7759,6.855,'5RIU83i-WMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29470,_binary '\0','/sDiGcjWhSu42dCw0jQmBInAkDZ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615160',7,133748,'en','The Foreigner','Quan is a humble London businessman whose long-buried past erupts in a revenge-fueled vendetta when the only person left for him to love – his teenage daughter – dies in an Irish Republican Army car bombing. His relentless search to find the terrorists leads to a cat-and-mouse conflict with a British government official whose own past may hold the clues to the identities of the elusive killers.','/rwM4hzrmc5HiWfQD9ls9DL4QgGl.jpg','2017-09-28',114,'Released','Never push a good man too far.','The Foreigner',379149,14.4472,6.982,'r_rSAbYyIq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29471,_binary '\0','/vml21gWkiM2BXADaINTbOqrJ14X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16154506',4.6,2713,'en','Breakout','Having taken control of a maximum security prison, a criminal mastermind faces off against a retired Black Ops agent who had been visiting his incarcerated son.','/if4ri8tSSLPoqCWW2XypnYRO0Dy.jpg','2023-04-11',85,'Released','Breaking out is an inside job.','Breakout',926680,2.2161,5.3,'EjgLJ59a8cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29472,_binary '\0','/xHhDA63HYklr4FMdxAd05FqhhhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16156616',5.2,4441,'en','How to Date Billy Walsh','Archie has been in love with his best friend Amelia for as long as he can remember. Just when he builds up the courage to declare his feelings, she falls head over heels for Billy Walsh, a new American transfer student.','/5qcHcoJL3otMwJPKnbV5M3a1jQd.jpg','2024-04-04',101,'Released',NULL,'How to Date Billy Walsh',1017633,5.8227,6.4,'dQHx9ems_I4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29473,_binary '\0','/t8iv2Z3zZ30p2YTfxfMtwFkN6GX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615916',6.7,1997,'en','You Should Meet My Son!','A comedy about a conservative Southern mom who discovers that her only son is gay. Determined that he won’t go through life alone and miserable, she sets out to find him the perfect husband!','/lVT7S1nOVXOlwBE8LuUt4BUoX2t.jpg','2010-10-31',84,'Released','\"...He\'s a catch!\"','You Should Meet My Son!',73541,1.283,6.3,'ADPibwdmO_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29474,_binary '\0','/j8M9FjI1seC6OmUluDGkOZIwZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1615918',4.5,45687,'en','Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked','Playing around while aboard a cruise ship, the Chipmunks and Chipettes accidentally go overboard and end up marooned in a tropical paradise. They discover their new turf is not as deserted as it seems.','/npOXWVoZyl8UrF2wtByHtfmsWSX.jpg','2011-12-14',87,'Released','Sun, sea and squeaks.','Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked',55301,12.1567,5.7,'-dOc_fqmcZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29475,_binary '\0','/6cpzcoVpAifoZPyJ02Kfs0wnA5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16160622',6.9,3658,'fr','Le procès Goldman','A second trial begins in November 1975 against French left-wing revolutionary Pierre Goldman, accused of several armed robberies and the death of two chemists.','/fYbjXgBQUPgj1mtcmH0GafbJlXV.jpg','2023-06-07',118,'Released','I am innocent because I am innocent.','The Goldman Case',972118,2.5389,6.877,'U7XhGhN9QKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29476,_binary '\0','/sl7VRkF2bMGUBShAHgkWzTeOFlW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1616195',6.5,139055,'en','J. Edgar','As the face of law enforcement in the United States for almost 50 years, J. Edgar Hoover was feared and admired, reviled and revered. But behind closed doors, he held secrets that would have destroyed his image, his career, and his life.','/gltciP2dIaEQmm4JeYfB088k40n.jpg','2011-11-09',137,'Released','The most powerful man in the world.','J. Edgar',88794,5.705,6.2,'87UeEHrQpDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29477,_binary '\0','/7rLSEhUjCCnbg27lrCDVHQA0Ymu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1616543',7.1,1457,'en','Not the Messiah (He\'s a Very Naughty Boy)','Not The Messiah (He\'s a Very Naughty Boy) is a comic oratorio based on Monty Python\'s Life of Brian, which retells the tragic tale of Mandy, impregnated by a Roman soldier, giving birth to Brian, a reluctant revolutionary of the People\'s Front of Judea who falls in love with Judith, gets mistaken for a Messiah and is arrested by the Romans and sentenced to be crucified. It ranges in reference from Handel, through a naughty Mozart duet, to the Festival of Nine Carols, Bob Dylan, and the classic finale \"Always Look on the Bright Side of Life\".','/buZOjBBVkwi3nWvAHvxguQjRbm7.jpg','2010-03-25',92,'Released','Like Handel only funnier.','Not the Messiah (He\'s a Very Naughty Boy)',38877,2.0108,7,'l3aUBLMH_II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29478,_binary '\0','/wYzjlg2maQEvLS0rRIOT4pAR9Jx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1617145',4.6,2237,'no','Mørke sjeler','A young girl, Johanna, is attacked and seemingly murdered. Her father receives a phone call from the police pronouncing her dead as he sees her walk in the front door of their house. Strange things begin to happen to Johanna; she is disorientated and becomes pale and unresponsive. Similar attacks begin to happen, and Johanna’s father takes it on himself to find out the truth. He embarks on a dark thrill ride of lost memories, conspiracy, and zombie-like symptoms. Finding the mysterious darkness within is the source of the bizarre world he has uncovered.','/dr3sW9glUpdVHSWLO2cwYjAHdxg.jpg','2010-06-18',95,'Released','The darkness within has come out to play','Dark Souls',70669,1.4799,4.2,'mORr6ZRJM3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29479,_binary '\0','/oqUcfxHiNw4cglQqEs2ImItZr1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1617178',7,1986,'pl','Różyczka','Pressured by his superiors to disgrace public intellectual Warczewski, a professor and respected writer whom they believe to be a \"camouflaged Zionist,\" rough security-services colonel Rozek enlists his sexy but naive girlfriend, Kamila, to insinuate herself into the distinguished older man\'s life and report on his every move. Not particularly interested in serving communism but eager to please her domineering lover, Kamila accepts the mission, reporting under the code name \"Little Rose.\" As quick scenes contrast Kamila\'s crude pleasures with Rozek and her more refined experiences with Warczewski, it becomes clear that the more time the unschooled young woman spends with the professor, the more she comes to have true feelings for him.','/dS5iYRI8zYbaqpuj72Z3zP8gCyu.jpg','2010-03-12',118,'Released',NULL,'Little Rose',45822,1.8936,6.9,'CcwZCg7CWwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29480,_binary '\0','/llyawOKTKa1VBzISaQ5EMRNSbbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16174384',7,1320,'en','Target List','After announcing a ground-breaking cancer cure, five members of the research team are targeted by an assassin hired by the big pharma. When two researchers escape the attack, they soon find themselves framed for the crime and on the killer\'s target list.','/2tblYW8Pimb65Chis5cIvD55wIG.jpg','2023-09-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Target List',1167681,1.2203,6.8,'xoN-6upSUI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29481,_binary '\0','/62r3J8GJrtyMCPFdiCoT6ZXJx0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16174868',4.5,2636,'en','Left Behind: Rise of the Antichrist','After millions of people vanish and the world falls into chaos, a charismatic leader rises to lead the UN. However, his intentions are more sinister than they appear.','/7Yn4lvksfagrwH5FARlRXkeJWR0.jpg','2023-01-26',115,'Released','Based on a true story... that hasn\'t happened yet.','Left Behind: Rise of the Antichrist',1008903,3.2886,4.557,'YBNvXCrgOU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29482,_binary '\0','/n4InsAgML3c62ydEnEvj7IzinSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1617620',5.2,4043,'en','A Horrible Way to Die','An escaped murderer is in pursuit of his ex-girlfriend, who has fled to start a new life in a small town.','/dzAMpGbcIhPtJLD057BCkjYc022.jpg','2010-09-14',87,'Released',NULL,'A Horrible Way to Die',44950,2.2208,5.1,'f-j5tosPhAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29483,_binary '\0','/w4hk4QG05nDuSgimpa7XAM6OyPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1617661',5.3,202981,'en','Jupiter Ascending','In a universe where human genetic material is the most precious commodity, an impoverished young Earth woman becomes the key to strategic maneuvers and internal strife within a powerful dynasty…','/2NCcAZ3M3F0FxENYmammBknwpVn.jpg','2015-02-04',127,'Released','Expand your universe.','Jupiter Ascending',76757,19.8818,5.474,'THVFkk-sEus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29484,_binary '\0','/wghKvEjM7UzQzQcKnGbDjOyQO13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16183464',6.7,27171,'ja','ONE PIECE FILM RED','A new adventure begins for Luffy and his crew when mysterious pop superstar Uta unveils her identity — and launches a misguided plan for world peace.','/8ibfhe4P7rhmn3lrPhOZzIJHA2B.jpg','2022-08-06',115,'Released','An almighty voice. With fiery red locks.','One Piece Film Red',900667,11.0909,7.2,'89JWRYEIG-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29485,_binary '\0','/hGESSx1boaqsYeDRVfcxifCPCok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618372',2.6,2043,'en','Camel Spiders','Based on actual creatures that for years have tormented our armed forces in the Middle East, these creatures have now invaded the southwestern deserts of the United States. The Camel Spiders now freely hunt for prey, unafraid of any predator - including man. No place is safe no one is beyond their paralyzing sting. In the end, a small band of hearty fighters are forced to make one last stand against the creatures.','/d4kEoQoBrJkVa6MAeB6Lkrttuhn.jpg','2011-03-04',80,'Released','They Really Get Under your Skin','Camel Spiders',83188,2.4897,4.3,'g36mtYaGTC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29486,_binary '\0','/yZeQ1UWS9mxzUvilNg3nitNs3Gi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618430',6.2,4305,'hi','दम मारो दम','ACP Vishnu is sent on a mission to investigate and clean the underbelly of Goa. During his investigation, he uncovers a huge racket and discovers the involvement of various politicians.','/uzqKhhSA6ypWwqsnZSwCs7C42sb.jpg','2011-04-22',130,'Released','Every Paradise Has a Few Snakes','Dum Maaro Dum',63006,1.632,5.632,'OvRBeWDh5dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29487,_binary '\0','/yRJs2vAsm4g8ZFkNY90EpV2O9qB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618432',4.2,2108,'en','I\'m in Love with a Church Girl','Miles Montego has it all - cars, boats, good looks, mansion, money, women, but more importantly, he has a past.','/jgXsK9s2Nmy7T2A7Y4l7D0IMkz3.jpg','2013-10-18',118,'Released','Sometimes God needs to use Extreme Measures to deal with Extreme Circumstances','I\'m in Love with a Church Girl',207883,2.4498,5.9,'bnULsIsuwDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29488,_binary '\0','/wL8KA3zIJQPbbU5hJlyIdmmLZit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618434',6.1,193359,'en','Murder Mystery','On a long-awaited trip to Europe, a New York City cop and his hairdresser wife scramble to solve a baffling murder aboard a billionaire\'s yacht.','/bSMSO9xupd4R4vwTPqigHn2quLN.jpg','2019-05-25',98,'Released','First class problems. Second class detectives.','Murder Mystery',514999,11.3768,6.249,'5YEVQDr2f3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29489,_binary '\0','/s2zzIS4UmrkrCWU8dT603KaEAFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618435',4.8,6368,'en','Scooby-Doo! Curse of the Lake Monster','Scooby-Doo and the gang are on the case when a mysterious lake monster starts scaring the guests at a summer resort in Erie Point, where Fred, Daphne, Velma and Shaggy have taken on seasonal jobs to pay for a barn they accidentally burned down. But in addition to sneaking suspicions, there\'s some romance in the air.','/4fvCOntbgzZ9crbduTHRhgN8bgq.jpg','2010-10-16',80,'Released','Ruh-Roh! They\'re in too deep and way over their heads!','Scooby-Doo! Curse of the Lake Monster',47533,6.2459,6.2,'cOxeq6Z_0gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29490,_binary '\0','/mXmvN6drkdU1PWFF92AGklEVIa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618442',5.9,117710,'en','The Last Witch Hunter','The modern world holds many secrets, but by far the most astounding is that witches still live among us; vicious supernatural creatures intent on unleashing the Black Death upon the world and putting an end to the human race once and for all. Armies of witch hunters have battled this unnatural enemy for centuries, including Kaulder, a valiant warrior who many years ago slayed the all-powerful Witch Queen, decimating her followers in the process. In the moments right before her death, the Queen cursed Kaulder with immortality, forever separating him from his beloved wife and daughter. Today, Kaulder is the last living hunter who has spent his immortal life tracking down rogue witches, all the while yearning for his long-lost family.','/dS9YdnJkxtKE2PKCSsxTaO7Jpf5.jpg','2015-10-21',106,'Released','Live forever. Hunt forever.','The Last Witch Hunter',274854,12.8504,6,'QJDRdGxGw8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29491,_binary '\0','/vuRvXTB653e6418W10EVhMlEslq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618445',6.1,2253,'en','The We and the I','The We and the I is the heartfelt and comical story of the final bus ride home for a group of young high school students and graduates.','/djoIALNKsNFHfr9Ln0GGxI3if2M.jpg','2012-09-12',103,'Released',NULL,'The We and the I',109391,1.3723,5.3,'SzprxX6yf8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29492,_binary '\0','/146hnoa8ugfUtPgjPfl658vuTna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618447',6.7,5997,'fr','Un amour de jeunesse','A 15-year-old discovers the joys and heartaches of first love with an older teen, but in the ensuing years, cannot seem to move past their breakup.','/qj1P2hZJxMO3bXiC39JxbTWTNa5.jpg','2011-07-06',108,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye First Love',82327,2.3113,6.244,'7ZAH7bvJNRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29493,_binary '\0','/9MTbSRF0NYPxNSXdnrAbzZpvA2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618448',8.1,8458,'en','Racing Extinction','An unlikely team of activists and innovators hatches a bold mission to save endangered species.','/gydw7e4QCWrp5qExSJSvzyPJ42E.jpg','2015-01-24',90,'Released','It\'s better to light one candle than curse the darkness.','Racing Extinction',300792,1.654,7.8,'MwxyrLUdcss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29494,_binary '\0','/wwPz0aBv5ZMU4Nzl8E9zfjPHfus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1618450',6.3,1251,'it','Winx Club - Magica avventura','Reunited with her birth parents, Oritel and Marion, Bloom discovers what it is like to live as a princess of Domino. Adding to her joy at being with her parents is the upcoming Princess Ball, which Sky has asked Bloom to attend with him. But Bloom\'s happiness is short lived when Sky is forbidden by his own father to escort her. Meanwhile, the evil Ancestral Witches who had once destroyed Domino join forces with the Trix - Icy, Darcy, and Stormy - to erase all positive magic from the Magic Dimension. To reverse the effects of the Witches\' devastating reign of darkness, the Winx and the Specialists must travel to the cursed city of Avram and come face to face with the Trix and the Ancestral Witches. Only by defeating the witches can the Winx restore the positive magic in the entire dimension and regain their own powers.','/6P1Z0voZehYFDRNHigG2XAelKVa.jpg','2010-10-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Winx Club - Magic Adventure',74658,2.6662,7.2,'Kx5rd_VC2Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29495,_binary '\0','/lF41LYBSLVpZ61rZci471pqi6UW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1619029',6.6,87543,'en','Jackie','An account of the days of First Lady, Jacqueline Kennedy, in the immediate aftermath of John F. Kennedy\'s assassination in 1963.','/nF9N33PfhizMEzbfxHoxXBo2vx9.jpg','2016-12-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Jackie',376866,4.4281,6.449,'g9pW3B8Ycc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29496,_binary '\0','/t9mPOabcRZGNGXF6FG7UP8nFNDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1619037',6.2,1936,'en','Nice Guy Johnny','Johnny Rizzo, is about to trade his dream job in talk radio for some snooze-ville gig that\'ll pay enough to please his fiance. Enter Uncle Terry, a rascally womanizer set on turning a weekend in the Hamptons into an eye-opening fling for his nephew. Nice guy Johnny\'s not interested, of course, but then he meets the lovely Brooke, who challenges Johnny to make the toughest decision of is life.','/7gWPxxMfZgDE2ucUCO20utcO8Th.jpg','2010-11-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Nice Guy Johnny',43938,1.1355,4.7,'zBT00dP43_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29497,_binary '\0','/xKFPOVFRe6DHthFqVhZEuJeTKI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1619277',5.3,1464,'en','Conception','Conception is a clever, romantic comedy that proves it takes more than sex to make a baby. From a couple fighting the odds of fertility to young teenagers losing their virginity, the film follows nine very different couples on the night they conceive, showing that sex can sometimes be more neurotic than erotic. The hilarious ensemble cast includes Emmy-winner Julie Bowen and Sarah Hyland (“Modern Family”), Connie Britton (“Friday Night Lights”), David Arquette (Never Been Kissed), Jason Mantzoukas (“The League”), and Alan Tudyk (Dodgeball).','/jUBEmGU3f3ItMInVkCfdWE4NMJJ.jpg','2011-04-28',77,'Released','It takes more than sex to make a baby','Conception',83403,2.0009,4.6,'Tb6erLy9yjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29498,_binary '\0','/93BFLgHE0G10hXiDOUDHnRmQzZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16194408',5.6,1775,'zh','长津湖之水门桥','Commander Wu Qianli leads the 7th Infantry Company soldiers to Funchilin Pass where they are tasked to destroy a bridge to stop enemy troops from retreating.','/4W58wirZhbzcw2lNzRS2ErKnOGS.jpg','2022-02-01',149,'Released',NULL,'The Battle at Lake Changjin II: Water Gate Bridge',928123,2.7411,6.3,'4db8wd76RmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29499,_binary '\0','/8HMXlHNjMhuVt8X7WiFl9hWHAn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1619880',3.3,14791,'en','Sharktopus','The U.S. Navy\'s special group \"Blue Water\" builds a half-shark, half-octopus for combat. But the sharktopus escapes and terrorizes the beaches of Puerto Vallarta.','/2l1W3yZWkWfPKMU768DaiD6UZmf.jpg','2010-09-25',89,'Released','Half-shark... Half-octopus... All killer.','Sharktopus',46020,3.5199,4.1,'-hHeYj58ZzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29500,_binary '\0','/9bKg2Tft4P3AovKHzb7RTflcX3X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620449',4.9,7406,'de','Konferenz der Tiere','A group of animals waiting for the annual flood they rely on for food and water discover that the humans, who have been destroying their habitats have built a dam for a leisure resort. The animals endeavour to save the delta and send a message to the humans not to interfere with nature.','/gUCLetZNa3rZknSmLc2gGUdxWH7.jpg','2010-10-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Animals United',50135,7.4927,5.597,'M-Do5xwAG70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29501,_binary '\0','/iO85eX1oEnsoJHzCnyk8jdYQDSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620466',6.5,2447,'de','Groupies bleiben nicht zum Frühstück','A love connection clicks for Lila when she moves back to Berlin and meets Christopher -- never realizing that she\'s fallen for a rock star who\'s signed a contract to remain single for life.','/tqYqUtuEpBcY6NAEhRSrNHBnQDw.jpg','2010-09-15',103,'Released',NULL,'Single By Contract',60809,1.9095,6.9,'VvkQF6ggZtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (29502,_binary '\0','/bsUMIAeMVQ50g7PFofV1AMZbWNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620604',5.7,5352,'es','Somos lo que hay','After the death of a patriarch, a family must try to continue on with a disturbing, ritualistic tradition.','/35M8uaZaNdOYPF8YFEeVfAFCn1e.jpg','2010-11-12',90,'Released','Young. Wild. Hungry.','We Are What We Are',50272,2.1326,6,'MlhGKtys-nI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29503,_binary '\0','/vGrxXz7wU62rvIIOFhLz0vcRubw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620620',7.6,2745,'bn','The Japanese Wife','Snehmoy and Miyage are pen friends who exchange wedding vows through letters. Fifteen years pass but they never meet. Yet the bond of marriage is strong between them. This unusual relationship comes under a cloud when a young widow, Sandhya, comes to stay with Snehmoy along with her eight-year-old son Poltu. Snehmoy and the little boy bond and the arithmetic teacher discovers the joy of palpable bonds and fatherhood. There develops an inexplicable thread of understanding with Sandhya too. But Snehmoy remained loyal to his unseen Japanese wife.','/cf9VYWeZi009WX2X2ePPn5CwANB.jpg','2010-04-09',105,'Released',NULL,'The Japanese Wife',38301,5.3369,6.646,'n27r4C5IosY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29504,_binary '\0','/mx6zzr2H34fXMsBmL2it8NsmKF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620680',4.3,50256,'en','A Wrinkle in Time','After the disappearance of her scientist father, three peculiar beings send Meg, her brother, and her friend to space in order to find him.','/yAcb58vipewa1BfNit2RjE6boXA.jpg','2018-03-08',109,'Released','Be a warrior','A Wrinkle in Time',407451,10.9983,5,'b9Ezoiqt2HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29505,_binary '\0','/ycIVa39dhbA55B4tbHgqN4urSBs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620719',6.3,37675,'hi','दबंग्ग','A troubled relationship with his younger half-brother and stepfather compels Chulbul Pandey to become a corrupt but fearless cop whose life changes when he locks horns with a corrupt political leader.','/bi2J6IrRK7oFK63EMbzORIos8KP.jpg','2010-09-10',130,'Released','Robinhood Pandey... Cop.. Lover.. Rebel...','Dabangg',44425,2.2207,5.9,'BLV4t3VIBh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29506,_binary '\0','/53XAIKtBlit8PpNAPaADazADCR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620933',8.2,40508,'hi','पान सिंह तोमर','Paan Singh Tomar goes from celebrated runner to star brigand and rebel when life after sports fails to unfold as planned.','/ii2KMVvGmcmJrqwYcT5nKn92bD5.jpg','2012-03-02',135,'Released',NULL,'Paan Singh Tomar',96398,1.2566,7.4,'A0cT7ukL4GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29507,_binary '\0','/bxhpsZZuho6C07Cijx5xHywz2U2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620935',6.8,33904,'en','Bleed for This','The inspirational story of World Champion Boxer Vinny Pazienza, who after a near fatal car crash, which left him not knowing if he\'d ever walk again, made one of sports most incredible comebacks.','/cMM9frT6sFEvz7PwHniIDUKcLDo.jpg','2016-11-04',116,'Released','This is what the greatest comeback in sports history looks like','Bleed for This',332979,6.6007,6.795,'0yfWnRKXRac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29508,_binary '\0','/grY5sfuT9YeXWlp4JYCmRZVqjk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1620981',5.9,50381,'en','The Addams Family','The Addams family\'s lives begin to unravel when they face-off against a treacherous, greedy crafty reality-TV host while also preparing for their extended family to arrive for a major celebration.','/q1epO0eO8DWu8Vo8tPfvVlzW48T.jpg','2019-10-10',87,'Released','Think your family is weird?','The Addams Family',481084,15.3382,6.604,'xFCrR3Uw6Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29509,_binary '\0','/bYCYL5mVX4unStJy34wWuofVq2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621039',5.8,28773,'en','Free Birds','Two turkeys from opposite sides of the tracks must put aside their differences and team up to travel back in time to change the course of history—and get turkey off the holiday menu for good.','/gnSU2wUBq2gTkBEkxY8C1d1fXAQ.jpg','2013-10-30',91,'Released','The greatest turkey movie of all time.','Free Birds',175574,11.058,5.896,'r-RnGP63rpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29510,_binary '\0','/c8kjrMDDKrlpikQTgvNGLBZh5V8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621045',6.5,53190,'en','Think Like a Man','The balance of power in four couples’ relationships is upset when the women start using the advice in Steve Harvey’s book, Act Like A Lady, Think Like A Man, to get more of what they want from their men. When the men realize that the women have gotten a hold of their relationship “playbook,” they decide that the best defense is a good offense and come up with a plan to use this information to their advantage.','/kfIrKVPDzXJDBzPnFEuoatlaZPW.jpg','2012-04-20',122,'Released','Let the mind games begin.','Think Like a Man',67660,6.4313,6.808,'vxTN4eX4Vss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29511,_binary '\0','/gSv2qXt3OlTTFaYvKJVrFPtzsFL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621046',6.4,3855,'en','Cesar Chavez','A biography of the civil-rights activist and labor organizer Cesar Chavez. Chronicling the birth of a modern American labour movement, Cesar Chavez tells the story of the famed civil rights leader and labour organiser torn between his duties as a husband and father and his commitment to securing a living wage for farm workers. Passionate but soft-spoken, Chavez embraced non-violence as he battled greed and prejudice in his struggle to bring dignity to working people.','/cyEpCV8nLfhloAkwNxel4OjIhAA.jpg','2014-03-28',102,'Released','History is made one step at a time.','Cesar Chavez',230779,3.046,6.2,'q81a7KBEMVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29512,_binary '\0','/3HRRCk0YSD2dgYJvuff8crY7zBb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16211122',8.2,4201,'ta','அயோத்தி','A four member family from Ayodhya, headed by conservative, religious patriarch, Balram, his wife Janaki, daughter Shivani and son Sonu goes on a spiritual trip to Rameswaram. Things get complicated when Janki dies in an accident and the two kids endures at the hands of their fervently devout father. A Rameswaram localite, friend of the cab driver involved, with his other friend decides to help the family in returning their mother\'s remains to their homeland, despite all odds.','/em8sXeAUjNyWHEK2eG5rpYdoQfn.jpg','2023-03-03',121,'Released',NULL,'Ayothi',901489,0.8749,6.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29513,_binary '\0','/hYd9LfjlPPqhRqSfQmlNmEwDWcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16212056',5.8,1309,'ta','தெய்வ மச்சான்','A youngster from a small town believes that his only responsibility in life is to find a suitable groom for his sister. However, when things fall into place, he is faced with an issue that he would have never expected in life.','/kjnuXurwCmwuiKeN6kKVr3sSzPl.jpg','2023-04-21',131,'Released',NULL,'Deiva Machan',981729,1.0348,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29514,_binary '\0','/hQ5FJ00oBAInAXOauAYpHysZIXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621424',8,1725,'ta','Jayamkondaan','The film revolves around an Information technology professional, who returns to Chennai from London, to set up his own business. Follows the sibling relationship and the threat from the rowdy.','/6OCxTBXRTOmQKR3bHFfICwUK0pC.jpg','2008-08-29',145,'Released',NULL,'Jayam Kondaan',79334,0.7318,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29515,_binary '\0','/zMGBzikCJJ5tiqyabgYZ0DyUFkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621426',6.4,1507,'en','Natural Selection','When a dutiful, albeit barren Christian housewife discovers that her devout husband has suffered a stroke at a sperm bank where he\'s been secretly donating his seed for the past 25 years, she leaves her sheltered world and starts off on a journey to find his eldest biological son - a mullet-headed, foul-mouthed ex-con with whom she develops an odd but meaningful relationship.','/x5dCdyCYzx8j28S6fMO41YgYLnk.jpg','2011-03-13',90,'Released','Linda White Has Found Her Son. God Help Her.','Natural Selection',59439,1.3299,6.1,'soALrVRSNFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29516,_binary '\0','/4HF5VEbnPlc4AdqDxebQmwYsbBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621444',7.9,5864,'en','Bill Cunningham New York','Doubling as a cartography of the ever-changing city, Bill Cunningham New York portrays the secluded pioneer of street fashion with grace and heart.','/ex1m4lIAcdxJLBojN90fD3HoxlU.jpg','2011-03-16',85,'Released','He who seeks beauty, will find it.','Bill Cunningham New York',55244,1.7736,7.6,'M8kINiFhplc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29517,_binary '\0','/z3TFj6QdA5lqmMfliE01fUJN10Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621446',4.2,3915,'en','The Task','Something diabolical is taking place on the set of \"The Task\" a new reality show in which players complete terrifying missions within the confines of an abandoned prison hoping to win a hefty cash prize. As six young students explore their new environment, malicious spirits make their presence known in the most gruesome ways imaginable, Unable to escape the labyrinthine prison, the contestants become unwitting pawns caught at the centre of a blood-soaked night of terror.','/5duIlyVH1EiIncrGm8YPVEJ5PgZ.jpg','2011-01-28',90,'Released','The Audience Isn\'t The Only One Watching.','The Task',55861,1.6432,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29518,_binary '\0','/cWmmxqnsHctCqpltYMTxbME8EpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621642',7.1,2204,'th','รถไฟฟ้า มาหานะเธอ','In the center of Bangkok, 30-year-old Mei Li struggles to find true love. When she accidentally meets a handsome BTS engineer whom she considers the right man, she plans her first move. Though too many obstacles keep arising, Mei Li will never give up.','/3EUo3JyLrBMk6v3oJyHvg1UsRXR.jpg','2009-10-15',126,'Released','Next station i will say \"i love you.\"','Bangkok Traffic (Love) Story',72733,1.9169,7.281,'kHAtiE7sAas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29519,_binary '\0','/m7VLZBkj2FK9SZK0kqlYmi6fRUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1621830',8.7,10057,'bn','মনপুরা','A heartbreaking tale of a poor yet honest young man as lies, conspiracies and a horrible betrayal by his rich and influential employer leads his life towards uncertainty.','/b4brqc4JBjXYy8thlKAoP5jFVH0.jpg','2009-02-13',136,'Released',NULL,'Monpura',91777,1.9236,7.845,'nFBIJYEiUO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29520,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16219768',7.1,1971,'te','Grey: The Spy Who Loved Me','Officer Nayak investigates the death of Professor Sudarshan Reddy and meets Arushi Reddy, the professor\'s wife. Nayak discovers that Dr. Raghu, the professor\'s psychiatrist, is also involved in the murder. The drama opens up the gray shadows of intelligence agencies, their procedures, betrays, scandals, and cover-ups.',NULL,'2023-05-26',121,'Released',NULL,'Grey: The Spy Who Loved Me',1187840,0.6003,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29521,_binary '\0','/jms0K8EDkLYVVYOm7R0IyeJQ6VM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1622547',6,111916,'en','30 Minutes or Less','Two fledgling criminals kidnap a pizza delivery guy, strap a bomb to his chest, and advise him that he has mere hours to rob a bank or else...','/12VgS5G6OG7ANKrSbhtUD2POHb8.jpg','2011-08-11',83,'Released','A lot can happen in 30 minutes.','30 Minutes or Less',62206,6.6965,5.8,'_o8u4pIf3Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29522,_binary '\0','/vXMsZC4mi4fueBQLVWigcP7NUOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16227002',6.8,3097,'en','War Pony','The interlocking stories of two Lakota boys growing up on Pine Ridge Reservation. At 23, Bill just wants to make something of himself. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Matho can’t wait to become a man. Bound by their shared search for belonging, each of the boys grapple with identity, family, and loss, as they navigate their unique paths to manhood.','/oN2NCnVq0FTHvvIxKBEEJy8dhrr.jpg','2023-05-10',114,'Released',NULL,'War Pony',962566,2.0557,6.4,'j8GEkr6akyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29523,_binary '\0','/3oRwn7WIMt4Vtw65mnydDQHthwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16227014',7.6,16940,'en','Fire of Love','A doomed love triangle between intrepid French scientists Katia and Maurice Krafft, and their beloved volcanoes.','/9smEX8UP84yb2GisLwyAyQKvCWS.jpg','2022-07-06',94,'Released','The greatest lava-fueled love story ever told.','Fire of Love',913823,5.0682,7.5,'-_7XADmKVL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29524,_binary '\0','/zI7tra3btsx84GMNkXpbEzDc8FH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16227044',7.2,4675,'en','Martha','Told in her own words, this candid documentary charts the unstoppable rise, sudden fall and hard-won comeback of lifestyle icon Martha Stewart.','/4WN19oCTXlK8jXC0QZgNkBpcJcw.jpg','2024-08-31',116,'Released',NULL,'Martha',1330409,1.4545,7.3,'6blC6bsgZmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29525,_binary '\0','/efq4fpiyO31vGDHijeMNHGMkBYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16227342',5.9,16346,'hi','मिस्टर एंड मिसेज माही','Poles apart, Mahima and Mahendra find a unifying force in the form of cricket. While one Mahi (Mahendra) is grappling to come to terms with his dream of playing for India getting shattered, he wants to live it through the other Mahi (Mahima.) Mahima is a doctor but Mahendra hasn\'t seen anyone play like her. Will the clash of dreams unite Mr. and Mrs. Mahi or create boundaries for life?','/jnbcyRxzQbYOLSzz7OvU4pNwq42.jpg','2024-05-31',139,'Released','An imperfectly perfect partnership','Mr. & Mrs. Mahi',901315,1.4622,5.9,'vB7OiVfmEDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29526,_binary '\0','/ohQuOgjSpE07rf4JbeIAm3N6ZPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16227830',6.5,1268,'it','Confidenza','Pietro is a revered teacher, Teresa his brilliant and precocious student. Their affair is both illicit and tempestuous. After one fight, Teresa suggests that each tell the other a secret, one so shameful or shocking that were it to be made public, it would destroy that person’s life. Time passes, Pietro’s stature as a writer grows and his family settles into the comfort of a bourgeois life. But he is haunted by the possibility that Teresa may one day reappear and tear apart his world with the secret she knows.','/rySdSFkVfYa3zL7jhU42PcaxIgn.jpg','2024-04-24',136,'Released',NULL,'Trust',1037051,1.3736,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29527,_binary '\0','/8xAWBFB8o7d2xxkPwVv4ocFfA9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16228146',2.4,4502,'ml','ഒരു കനേഡിയൻ ഡയറി','Sara migrates to Canada and keeps in touch with Surya. However, a few days later, the calls stop. Once Surya reaches Toronto, he begins his search to locate Sara.','/uAk9UtGWiYveFWFMS2yrZDN3JFn.jpg','2021-12-10',128,'Released',NULL,'Oru Canadian Diary',976981,0.9116,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29528,_binary '\0','/5cG2XcylxUIclQsGPBKTtfoqcBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1622979',5.9,153976,'en','Final Destination 5','Death is just as omnipresent as ever, and is unleashed after one man’s premonition saves a group of coworkers from a terrifying suspension bridge collapse. But this group of unsuspecting souls was never supposed to survive, and, in a terrifying race against time, the ill-fated group frantically tries to discover a way to escape Death’s sinister agenda.','/Akx1Po4ZLetOWfYJhQf75tbhTtK.jpg','2011-08-12',91,'Released','Death has never been closer.','Final Destination 5',55779,12.7176,6.157,'24abND3yDq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29529,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1622991',2.8,1259,'en','Infected','A blood virus infects a small group of hunters turning a father & son trip into a fight for survival.','/f8wPeIHyY0OARlRIhcvT0CyEcxI.jpg','2013-04-09',95,'Released','Prepare for a Zombie Evolution','Infected',126962,1.9497,3.3,'HM5dexgcTw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29530,_binary '\0','/nnc0BEAEGaZvzPN3fLKTFZkVKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623008',7.3,2289,'en','The Arbor','The lives of the late Bradford playwright Andrea Dunbar and Lorraine, one of her daughters, and the community of Bradford, in the 30 years since the 18-year-old Andrea penned a play about growing up in the community titled \"The Arbor\".','/1ILtGNSUTyrZi8LAco4zkMWXM3q.jpg','2010-10-22',91,'Released','A Documentary Re-Invented','The Arbor',59266,1.7579,7.3,'TyNqRdM0Y4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29531,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16230388',7.8,1732,'en','Fighting the Fire','Brian Cook has been firefighter for over 15 years, but he is now facing the biggest battle of his life - not the fire in the field, but the fire burning inside.','/kzgaQBJOjtDMGeUNeD8OA2N9XiO.jpg','2024-07-02',115,'Released',NULL,'Fighting the Fire',1313958,0.9477,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29532,_binary '\0','/o6TYNmB1CT85j7lmyvSedoybyc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623205',6.3,222277,'en','Oz the Great and Powerful','Oscar Diggs, a small-time circus illusionist and con-artist, is whisked from Kansas to the Land of Oz where the inhabitants assume he\'s the great wizard of prophecy, there to save Oz from the clutches of evil.','/tkzfAUEKoUp4YFNbZV9hfpZOz0z.jpg','2013-03-07',130,'Released','In Oz, nothing is what it seems.','Oz the Great and Powerful',68728,10.4491,5.94,'DylgNj4YQVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29533,_binary '\0','/fRhpdmaA1wTAboeiKW2ZHvDezIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623288',7,118777,'en','ParaNorman','In the town of Blithe Hollow, Norman Babcock can speak to the dead, but no one other than his eccentric new friend believes his ability is real. One day, Norman\'s eccentric uncle tells him of a ritual he must perform to protect the town from a curse cast by a witch centuries ago.','/9DZPtuYTKYxt6vzHvZ5FLThG4fl.jpg','2012-08-03',93,'Released','It\'s all fun and games until someone raises the dead.','ParaNorman',77174,11.5703,7.052,'BG1XNzPy9FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29534,_binary '\0','/wug15qrt09vllipUKXr6SNf74QT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16233952',6.3,13900,'en','Something from Tiffany\'s','One woman\'s life is forever changed by an engagement ring meant for someone else.','/hzQV66zQHqWKRjLVphISNOqadIp.jpg','2022-12-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Something from Tiffany\'s',916053,8.0995,6.7,'G5u8oySXNTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29535,_binary '\0','/8XdXSbjYaXlhUuqbWdnmLGc0bvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16235342',4.3,1670,'en','Space Wars: Quest for the Deepstar','A father and daughter team of space scavengers race against a band of evil mercenaries to reach a legendary lost freighter called the Deepstar. Along their trek through the universe, they encounter monsters, aliens, robots, and something even worse.','/r4BLXXsaavI3tgSNDd4upxsxc5O.jpg','2023-04-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Space Wars: Quest for the Deepstar',986210,2.3766,4.4,'RpKCRek0P2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29536,_binary '\0','/9gNZs9bC5yZBqz6PHdA7CMXliQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623742',6.5,4264,'en','Cinema Verite','In 1973, the Loud family became a television sensation of a new kind. It was long before a metal rock star showed his eccentric family on the small screen and decades before housewives had screaming matches with each other on camera in public. CINEMA VERITE tells the behind-the-scenes story of the groundbreaking documentary \"An American Family,\" which chronicled the lives of the Louds in the early 1970s and catapulted the Santa Barbara family to notoriety while creating a new television genre: the reality TV series.','/yyXW04JEfVHBoK6ijeHiBle0odo.jpg','2011-04-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Cinema Verite',64566,2.0732,5.7,'Sc9Tfjxf53M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29537,_binary '\0','/ncSQZHHe1fzNl6rephMsmpRweBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623745',6.1,5466,'en','Little Birds','Lily and Alison face a life-changing event after they leave their Salton Sea home and follow the boys they meet back to Los Angeles.','/ZHGIfi8RZEPrKwHU5Ecbpx9J18.jpg','2011-01-23',94,'Released','How far would you go?','Little Birds',75595,1.9742,5.7,'KSm3DsOAmMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29538,_binary '\0','/zvNRf4KfomU4xJC9no1C6NjaqFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623753',6,1601,'pl','Kołysanka','A weird family named Makarewicz moves into a house recently abandoned by its owner, set in an idyllic but isolated Masurian village. Very soon a number of local residents and a few visitors mysteriously disappear. Nobody suspects that their new neighbors are a perfectly camouflaged vampire family...','/25R0tv7AlhyfVtqJLNsH0uZYtpE.jpg','2010-02-12',95,'Released',NULL,'The Lullaby',55429,0.8931,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29539,_binary '\0','/qr6GMGTN2Z46wGSLtsxVJo39NsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623757',7.3,1872,'en','Machete Maidens Unleashed!','In the final decades of the 20th century, the Philippines was a country where low-budget exploitation-film producers were free to make nearly any kind of movie they wanted, any way they pleased. It was a country with extremely lax labor regulations and a very permissive attitude towards cultural expression. As a result, it became a hotbed for the production of cheapie movies. Their history and the genre itself are detailed in this breezy, nostalgic documentary.','/GbANwz67TyuOQc5GFY4hBaqTQ0.jpg','2010-10-15',85,'Released','The Filipino revolution that even Marcos couldn\'t crush!','Machete Maidens Unleashed!',70115,1.5618,6.6,'y0VBjLNT2Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29540,_binary '\0','/bp2t3uY6tdCq25G4FtHsZnWRd6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623765',3.7,1461,'en','Snow Beast','Jim and his research team study the Canadian Lynx every year. This year, he has to take his rebelling 16 year-old daughter, Emmy, with him. But the lynx are missing. As Jim and his team try to find why, something stalks them--a predator no prey can escape.','/4IpuIeaXE0ZsjCvJBhVCfsI9BxG.jpg','2011-10-04',90,'Released','Survival Is Everything','Snow Beast',78362,1.9093,4.4,'hcZi_-w4_Z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29541,_binary '\0','/oTR3KI1kVQ6ULrR2X6TobDlYVzO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1623780',1.4,3776,'it','La leggenda del Titanic','Old Grandpa mouse tells to his grandchildren the \"real\" story of the Titanic disaster, including evil sharks, a giant octopus, and an evil whaling scheme.','/72ITKkdanAMTeXczHPSPTT2lvf6.jpg','1999-04-17',84,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of the Titanic',44310,1.9563,3.4,'CrHG4em_Jf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29542,_binary '\0','/UGriNSQ2pytO8wdtXauslV5FKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16246218',5.7,2999,'en','Bluff','A London police officer goes undercover as a heroin addict in a small English town and manipulates an unsuspecting local junkie into working with him for a dangerous drug dealer.','/jZuuzwYO6id1hxFLQ1WdQqOZZ70.jpg','2022-04-28',115,'Released','The truth will get you killed.','Bluff',955302,0.6614,7.3,'H9kfVB_MQYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29543,_binary '\0','/lX3IZmvMj4lVSBDk1efwLqgKd1N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16248294',3.9,2243,'en','Hitmen','Michael Hero, a powerful CEO, seeks vengeance for the murder of his grandson by offering a one-million-dollar bounty for the assassination of his grandson\'s accidental killers, attracting the world\'s leading assassins to the task at hand.','/cdbNHV7Rjy72WgZyIuh3QwxgVS2.jpg','2023-11-23',108,'Released','With a bounty on your head, you\'re better off dead.','Hitmen',1094481,2.1808,4,'GhSUhbsSetY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29544,_binary '\0','/f2M8xdzzsfgOaq8EcKsNJyMa9Jk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1624996',5.2,1973,'en','Vampire','An outwardly normal schoolteacher preys on suicidal women to slake his overwhelming thirst for human blood.','/4xFzHEJUFVEdqjlXGx4c329cV2Z.jpg','2011-10-09',120,'Released','They\'re dying to keep him alive.','Vampire',116248,2.3569,6,'AS0O_q2jJXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29545,_binary '\0','/gFfLAlVZyUZ6Cq4OtGxOmxSDvMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625134',5.1,1986,'nl','De Eetclub','Karen (32) and Michel (36) move with their daughter to an exclusive residential area. She soon finds a new close circle of friends: the women of the Dinner Club, and their husbands. But when two of the Club members commit suicide under suspicious circumstances, Karen starts to have second thoughts about her new friends. She has to choose: will she reveal the truth and dish the dirt, or will she protect the interests of the Dinner Club?','/bSFkacLRb16fyyOHEdfCCnb3J5N.jpg','2010-11-25',94,'Released',NULL,'The Dinner Club',62339,1.6641,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29546,_binary '\0','/61QRbP2qVRXLXK2NZBtNhHqeo2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625150',7.1,11096,'nl','Noordzee, Texas','A teen boy living in a small town on the Belgian coast finds his ordinary life take an unexpected turn when a handsome traveler blows through town.','/jLmcMgjW8sM9vVqXopZa97RICWb.jpg','2011-03-16',96,'Released','The exquisite agony of first love.','North Sea Texas',100898,2.0681,7.165,'NijFwKLxP4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29547,_binary '\0','/4ml4USbqddEVnRRVr3Wdwh2wOW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625155',7.3,2171,'pt','Sangue do Meu Sangue','A regular family living in the outskirts of Lisbon sees the serenity of their lives shaken beyond any remedy within a week.','/vLmegmielKMoURFK52L4V8NbRln.jpg','2011-09-27',131,'Released',NULL,'Blood of My Blood',82968,1.5938,7.1,'nK95hC54hEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29548,_binary '\0','/mBtZhh2MCOoY5Jwniuny6bKNL79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16252698',6.6,14982,'fr','Passages','Tomas and Martin are a gay couple living in Paris whose marriage is thrown into crisis when Tomas impulsively begins a passionate affair with young schoolteacher Agathe. But when Martin begins an affair of his own, Tomas must confront life decisions he may be unprepared—or unwilling—to deal with.','/1tgyAchzwQwtJ4EpBDlpBQ1E0AI.jpg','2023-06-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Passages',898673,3.5886,6.329,'BEry0hQ5J-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29549,_binary '\0','/qX9pse0WbFoviJMZSvd7YfH4FmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625340',5.6,9142,'en','The Client List','After she and her husband lose their jobs, a former Texas homecoming queen inadvertently finds herself in the middle of a prostitution ring after she unknowingly accepts a position at a massage parlor.','/ucbfvXdzZFSpuybuNv3jThrr2Ow.jpg','2010-07-19',88,'Released','A mother will do anything for her family.','The Client List',41180,5.013,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29550,_binary '\0','/4woSOUD0equAYzvwhWBHIJDCM88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16253418',4.6,13022,'en','No Way Up','Characters from different backgrounds are thrown together when the plane they\'re travelling on crashes into the Pacific Ocean. A nightmare fight for survival ensues with the air supply running out and dangers creeping in from all sides.','/hu40Uxp9WtpL34jv3zyWLb5zEVY.jpg','2024-01-18',90,'Released','Brace yourself.','No Way Up',1096197,7.8676,6.219,'e1k1PC0TtmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29551,_binary '\0','/wwcsaGDLBoYbPk5mBCaTIljLiCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625346',6.3,90552,'en','Young Adult','A divorced writer from the Midwest returns to her hometown to reconnect with an old flame, who\'s now married with a family.','/4tGMz5xUs9sk8X9B28G6UalHK1d.jpg','2011-11-11',94,'Released','Everyone gets old. Not everyone grows up.','Young Adult',57157,7.3586,5.805,'okfAW8OztkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29552,_binary '\0','/vxBMAluWjrAdETuuE0CQJm2nUgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1625856',4.5,3188,'te','బద్రీనాధ్','Trained by a religious martial arts guru, Badri becomes the protector of Badrinath temple and tries to revive Alakananda\'s faith in God, unaware of the fact that she has fallen for him.','/lrhPSR8ok9u6OzciZ7aCXSdg4Mt.jpg','2011-06-10',140,'Released',NULL,'Badrinath',77715,1.9464,3.797,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29553,_binary '\0','/zxC3Sdv5P7sKJtf2ijJpDziwWy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1626139',4.5,2475,'en','Donner Pass','Donner Pass has a well-known and macabre history - the place where George Donner and his party got stuck in the winter of 1846 and were forced to resort to cannibalism to keep from starving. But what if it wasn\'t just history?','/uX1sdwUuLy6eTHsx0ghQM9wh339.jpg','2012-11-15',90,'Released','You can\'t escape history.','Donner Pass',84742,1.567,4.3,'DWlZ0M79cIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29554,_binary '\0','/vujKrqkydYxLuFvdGjA5bDicupV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1626146',6.9,53143,'en','Hector and the Search for Happiness','Hector is a quirky psychiatrist who has become increasingly tired of his humdrum life. As he tells his girlfriend, Clara, he feels like a fraud: he hasn’t really tasted life, and yet he’s offering advice to patients who are just not getting any happier. So Hector decides to break out of his deluded and routine driven life. Armed with buckets of courage and child-like curiosity, he embarks on a global quest in hopes of uncovering the elusive secret formula for true happiness. And so begins a larger than life adventure with riotously funny results.','/lymRg46xAt6s9ApWa9MBcgnzXAS.jpg','2014-08-14',114,'Released','Sometimes to find yourself you need to get a little lost.','Hector and the Search for Happiness',254375,3.9042,6.681,'iWFVAIbIkS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29555,_binary '\0','/uhQCTYpxT8h5OyXRlAEvW0v8tzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1626175',6.9,1337,'en','One Night in Turin','Before the Premier League and multi-million pound salaries, in England \'football\' was a dirty word. The game was in disgrace, the fans, hooligans, the nation, it seemed, were all played out. Then there was Italia \'90 - The World Cup - a shot at redemption. But this was no ordinary World Cup and no ordinary time. The manager, Sir Bobby Robson, was under intense media scrutiny, and his team described as \'donkeys\'. Yet over six short weeks, through their heroic exploits they united a nation, coming within a heart beat of reaching the World Cup Final. Narrated by Gary Oldman, featuring match action - from Platt\'s last-gasp winner against Belgium to the silky skills of Gazza and the cool finishing of Lineker - and previously unseen footage, this is the definitive story of England\'s greatest footballing adventure on foreign soil... so far.','/hB4185ZvLLwGKzPEsJfjUm0uq69.jpg','2010-05-11',90,'Released','The Definitive Story of Italia \'90','One Night in Turin',45374,1.7043,6.2,'G7yMqM4zElw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29556,_binary '\0','/vrDcp5AGtoNSyO5oDn0zOMdU1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1626201',4.4,2332,'en','Red: Werewolf Hunter','The modern-day descendant of Little Red Riding Hood brings her fiancé home to meet her family and reveal their occupation as werewolf hunters, but after he is bitten by a werewolf, she must protect him from her own family.','/ldCKvSF1iNmNPRC7PurYwcX7CuG.jpg','2010-10-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Red: Werewolf Hunter',48871,1.8448,4.2,'qENMRbKYNmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29557,_binary '\0','/rpapaQOTDwsDquLlV7KIpIDfNTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16266336',7.9,2930,'id','Ngeri-Ngeri Sedap','A married couple stages their divorce in order to encourage their estranged adult children to return to their hometown.','/kfHpOKcFLBny8p2iE6fAgUuGe48.jpg','2022-06-02',114,'Released','Fake divorce. Real family. A whole lot of drama','Missing Home',904689,1.3987,7.938,'3tE7f6mCL5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29558,_binary '\0','/umvsEWznAHwgl1T55D1jWFjkQc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1626811',7.6,1400,'en','Cameraman: The Life and Work of Jack Cardiff','In 2001 Jack Cardiff (1914-2009) became the first director of photography in the history of the Academy Awards to win an Honorary Oscar. But the first time he clasped the famous statuette in his hand was a half-century earlier when his Technicolor camerawork was awarded for Powell and Pressburger\'s Black Narcissus. Beyond John Huston\'s The African Queen and King Vidor\'s War and Peace, the films of the British-Hungarian creative duo (The Red Shoes and A Matter of Life and Death too) guaranteed immortality for the renowned cameraman whose career spanned seventy years.','/cE8tzoDLqRNmUkWevomebGcXi3m.jpg','2010-05-05',86,'Released',NULL,'Cameraman: The Life and Work of Jack Cardiff',76142,2.3179,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29559,_binary '\0','/b7waMfqh9jpxs2E480XomKVSCSm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16270280',6.1,1475,'en','A \'90s Christmas','Workaholic lawyer Lucy Clark is celebrating her promotion alone on Christmas Eve when a mysterious rideshare experience transports her back to 1999. Reliving the holiday with her mom, sister and best friend - not to mention her high school crush - Lucy gets a second chance to understand where her relationships went wrong. Will this magical journey help her rewrite her future or leave her destined to be alone?','/eUX70TC2xgEMz8uCoYVZeukxtZA.jpg','2024-11-29',84,'Released','Rewind to the one that got away','A \'90s Christmas',1361210,1.9953,6.571,'qVDB0U9HP1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29560,_binary '\0','/xwzNxuKqYKJ8fCqErn40x3YAs9T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16275882',5.9,3506,'en','A Christmas Miracle for Daisy','Whitney Alder owns interior design firm Marietta Designs, which she runs with her friend Andi in the small town of Marietta, Montana. Whitney is designing Santa’s float for the annual Marietta Christmas Parade when a potential job opportunity comes her way: the full redesign of a landmark home by Christmas Eve.','/iatxP43TMVqSFpCFM4JybepGg0I.jpg','2021-12-11',85,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Miracle for Daisy',881500,2.408,5.9,'dfW6blOccco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29561,_binary '\0','/md848EEPm3dHZOqwGxxTVwH2vu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16277242',7.8,177823,'es','La sociedad de la nieve','On October 13, 1972, Uruguayan Air Force Flight 571, chartered to take a rugby team to Chile, crashes into a glacier in the heart of the Andes.','/2e853FDVSIso600RqAMunPxiZjq.jpg','2023-12-15',143,'Released','Based on a remarkable true story.','Society of the Snow',906126,13.1887,8,'pDak4qLyF4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29562,_binary '\0','/s6VIrsUr4Am6VpwJ15QUCiramsU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16277412',7.8,1470,'en','Freddie Mercury: The Final Act','The story of the extraordinary final chapter of Freddie Mercury’s life and how, after his death from AIDS, Queen staged one of the biggest concerts in history, the Freddie Mercury Tribute Concert at Wembley Stadium, to celebrate his life and challenge the prejudices around HIV/AIDS. For the first time, Freddie\'s story is told alongside the experiences of those who tested positive for HIV and lost loved ones during the same period. Medical practitioners, survivors, and human rights campaigners recount the intensity of living through the AIDS pandemic and the moral panic it brought about.','/tctFh2aNKCG7C1l5oPQGxK8qvHn.jpg','2022-04-20',89,'Released',NULL,'Freddie Mercury: The Final Act',897561,2.7981,6.679,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29563,_binary '\0','/jrujt84igaD0m1rVjIytdl1Neo6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1627924',4.9,5875,'hi','मौसम','A war, religious conflicts, and misunderstandings create obstacles for a couple of different faiths.','/dxk7w6CDQLc1yjkZZCiGdusU0n1.jpg','2011-09-23',161,'Released',NULL,'Mausam',75157,1.4954,5.588,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29564,_binary '\0','/wVxlmhk4OS2eCr0wTQcM4zJ20ml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16280138',5.2,20318,'en','Magic Mike\'s Last Dance','Mike Lane takes to the stage again after a lengthy hiatus, following a business deal that went bust, leaving him broke and taking bartender gigs in Florida. For what he hopes will be one last hurrah, Mike heads to London with a wealthy socialite who lures him with an offer he can’t refuse… and an agenda all her own. With everything on the line, once Mike discovers what she truly has in mind, will he—and the roster of hot new dancers he’ll have to whip into shape—be able to pull it off?','/9a9pyJZRhUWUSBT8BQqWihtqbI8.jpg','2023-02-09',112,'Released','The final tease.','Magic Mike\'s Last Dance',906221,9.9436,6.4,'pBIGdw-BRxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29565,_binary '\0','/zGW4Fauf0qWFyCdoo4301dUEHbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1628055',6.6,5121,'en','Touchback','A former high-school football star loses his shot at a college scholarship due to a devastating gridiron injury, but gets a second chance at living his dream.','/6tc4S4UJzAUtZJPHFpq2Weaa1bA.jpg','2011-04-13',118,'Released',NULL,'Touchback',75074,2.5075,6.6,'J0rAWFJ3KFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29566,_binary '\0','/mwI1OarF7BVWwn5O1Ng73UhyctP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16280912',5.5,9710,'en','Humane','In the wake of an environmental collapse that has forced humanity to shed 20% of its population, a family dinner erupts into chaos when a father\'s plan to enlist in the government\'s new euthanasia program goes horribly awry.','/ecOvKaoM1hwQbp0uTnULGrSV32e.jpg','2024-04-26',93,'Released','Dying makes all the difference in the world.','Humane',914215,4.9131,5.392,'V4b-OMLNWE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29567,_binary '\0','/gy3GxETZWtlEdWgOxhtq1Bv6XJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16282114',6.9,1359,'en','Eight Gifts of Hanukkah','An anonymous suitor sends optometrist Sara a gift for each night of Hanukkah. On her journey to find her secret admirer, she learns her one true love might be someone she never expected.','/zyrviRUaxVMN2rOmmUwMzCFbHG7.jpg','2021-12-03',84,'Released','Life is full of surprises.','Eight Gifts of Hanukkah',888488,1.8804,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29568,_binary '\0','/yUJHUuzrUXlmGcJoVXTwJhRcxVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16282866',4.9,2142,'pt','Lulli','After getting electrocuted by an MRI machine, an ambitious young medical student begins to hear the thoughts of others.','/ztJHKv6KSSgCTWAI2STrX2BeuJZ.jpg','2021-12-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Lulli',700127,1.1036,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29569,_binary '\0','/A6Mh2Y3Chk8qvaYvirQRQDT5icx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16287754',7.3,2816,'en','The Wedding Veil','Three longtime college friends who discover a mysterious, antique veil fabled to unite its bearer with her true love. After discovering a long-lost painting, museum curator Avery and successful, new board member Peter investigate the artwork\'s origins as they plan a charity fundraiser to unveil its restoration.','/zOaYiZyNZQotd1ye5Zw3WctDhy5.jpg','2022-01-08',84,'Released','A veil of a tale.','The Wedding Veil',910759,2.2936,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29570,_binary '\0','/auT0H5fFUnPKjHNj0OkQMkxdbl2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1628841',5.2,201845,'en','Independence Day: Resurgence','We always knew they were coming back. Using recovered alien technology, the nations of Earth have collaborated on an immense defense program to protect the planet. But nothing can prepare us for the aliens’ advanced and unprecedented force. Only the ingenuity of a few brave men and women can bring our world back from the brink of extinction.','/9S50foUIYGwiNPWOxi1WJF6IPwI.jpg','2016-06-22',120,'Released','We had twenty years to prepare. So did they.','Independence Day: Resurgence',47933,11.1167,5.368,'FrS7PThzR8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29571,_binary '\0','/kyx15eUlLQy7HHm8HRuvi9QagO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629242',5.6,9419,'en','Careful What You Wish For','A guy gets more than he bargained for after entering into an affair with the wife of an investment banker. Soon, a suspicious death and substantial life insurance policy embroil him in a scandal.','/alRvln4lzGjdSExC37vr1spSTF7.jpg','2015-05-06',91,'Released','Wanting her was his first mistake.','Careful What You Wish For',317744,4.5821,6.1,'3ibgWtcvj5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29572,_binary '\0','/qwJdnLDse1YZUFNnpQe7IqJFJDF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629284',6.8,1379,'ja','ハナミズキ','A young girl tries to maintain a long-distance relationship with an aspiring fisherman.','/3SdAQqiUNqmty61SIhcss6j3YnR.jpg','2010-08-21',128,'Released',NULL,'Dogwood Tree',60604,1.7054,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29573,_binary '\0','/f3xcA9b0Hl02PNLu9DRPe6S1A7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629374',6.5,14874,'da','Ronal Barbaren','Ronal is a young barbarian with low self-esteem, the polar opposite of all the muscular barbarians in his village. He\'s a real wuss. However, as fate would have it, responsibility for the tribe\'s survival falls on Ronal\'s scrawny shoulders, when the evil Lord Volcazar raids the village and abducts every living barbarian with the exception of Ronal, who is forced to go on a perilous quest to save his enslaved clan and thwart Volcazar’s plot to rule the world.','/vT8m9Ji4mrUExpuIX0LGjMPHEHX.jpg','2011-09-27',89,'Released','Babes, balls and muscles in 3D for the whole family','Ronal the Barbarian',79433,4.3546,6.102,'4N26u0cPdk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29574,_binary '\0','/pJR7nbSjBMu7Yeb24QEPWVXTOii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629376',6.3,7135,'hi','७ खून माफ़','Susanna is hungry for love and will go to any extent to find it in its purest form. In her quest for the perfect man, she gets married a number of times as each of her husband\'s die mysteriously.','/id4dnrhJmdExByFJ3WdkQNrvY1i.jpg','2011-02-18',148,'Released','A Story Of A Woman Who Kills All Seven Husbands','7 Khoon Maaf',56338,1.918,6.156,'p5Imb62RS8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29575,_binary '\0','/88VtVz4jnwdvPIuWOmVNXyVR3d1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629377',6.4,9194,'es','Secuestrados','Three hooded Eastern-European criminals burst into a home in a Madrid gated community, holding the family hostage in its own home, and forcing the father to empty his credit cards. But the family fights back - brutally.','/26H9sh943M4ZYbyvTRfKdm7mzNr.jpg','2010-06-17',85,'Released','Home isn\'t always so sweet.','Kidnapped',48393,2.6321,6.159,'gHw9R9bhC-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29576,_binary '\0','/aKVOSRcWqRKv1Jn9dyF1b1N6BMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629391',7.2,11201,'hi','Tere Bin Laden','Ali Hassan (Ali Zafar), a reporter with a downmarket TV channel in Karachi, is keen to go to USA for a better life, but his visa has been refused six times in seven years. In desperation, he gets hold of an Osama Bin Laden look alike and makes a fake Osama tape which he sells to the owner of his channel to raise money for a false identity, a new passport and better luck with US visa. As one can expect, it is far from smooth sailing for him and his friends, as they get into a series of comic situations.','/9L1SPbw0UCvEQ36qYote2lVfTm5.jpg','2010-07-16',104,'Released','A million dollar fake','Tere Bin Laden',42323,1.157,6.508,'-sJ_hCZMukQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29577,_binary '\0','/toG4f7W9EEsBrHrbRJaYADnfoqm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629439',3.5,3506,'en','51','Due to political pressure from the American public, the Air Force has decided to allow two well-known reporters limited access to the most secretive base on the planet. But when one of the base’s “long-term visitors” exploits this unprecedented visit as a chance to liberate himself and his fellow alien captives, Area 51 turns from a secure government base to a horrifying destination of terror.','/p6NvaDusl8urJUlglYgPVSnJjFN.jpg','2011-02-26',87,'Released','Welcome to the Future','51',57812,1.3975,4.2,'-fcBumibn8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29578,_binary '\0','/rIs9QmiMyqizwQzuz2Fo91QfSlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629443',6.8,3457,'en','Foster','Looking to adopt a child and unable to conceive a child of their own, the Morrisons\' lives are turned upside down when a seven-year-old boy unexpectedly shows up on their doorstep.','/tO5FI5th4mxvokU8qsPbu9l4ucE.jpg','2011-02-10',90,'Released','A feel good family fairy-tale','Foster',81232,2.3146,6.729,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29579,_binary '\0','/xY6smX9kNLNqODRjT7pWwTHpRiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16294738',6.4,3560,'en','Buried in Barstow','Hazel King is a single mother determined to shield her daughter from the life she once had as a hit woman while defending and protecting those who can\'t protect themselves. Her dark past comes back to haunt her, despite her desire for a quiet life in Barstow.','/jROLolTGKmAAeiPndRO0DpiUWNy.jpg','2022-06-04',85,'Released','You can\'t bury your past.','Buried in Barstow',942576,3.4133,7,'ab2rg2XVdMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29580,_binary '\0','/qvuJpcFl1P2LPOFtcUks6G44aSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16296308',5.4,1758,'en','Godless: The Eastfield Exorcism','Lara is a woman tormented, torn between science and faith. Pushed by her husband to seek treatment from a congregation of zealots, a ruthless exorcist will try to save her soul by putting an innocent woman through hell.','/nfSrMW6ooScsf3PRa0ZSjbch8ed.jpg','2023-03-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Godless: The Eastfield Exorcism',1088157,2.5979,6.5,'vc5nSNEpjDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29581,_binary '\0','/xmdmLndfx6eibdyp7kDWyFCrhmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629705',6.5,11333,'en','Blackthorn','In Bolivia, Butch Cassidy (now calling himself James Blackthorn) pines for one last sight of home, an adventure that aligns him with a young robber and makes the duo a target for gangs and lawmen alike.','/3QtOCerjSPkS9fo8IBwDr7qAwoj.jpg','2011-07-01',98,'Released','No destiny','Blackthorn',68818,2.7158,6.6,'eWltDO4nKyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29582,_binary '\0','/tZ2rcrjliD9Fv5UAQJtoW7Q46D2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629715',7.3,19775,'hi','Miss Lovely','A Hindi feature film set in the lower depths of Bombay\'s \"C\" grade film industry. Miss Lovely follows the devastating story of two brothers who produce sleazy horror films in the mid-1980s.','/jjEvChpGn5Ylsesd84aiVc6okUW.jpg','2014-01-17',113,'Released','Daring, Desirable, Dangerous','Miss Lovely',126318,1.1158,6.3,'ZnAVCEdySjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29583,_binary '\0','/lzfDcppvRnsf9LJFwjLWQkuB4GC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1629757',7.1,36430,'en','Chasing Mavericks','Surfer Jay Moriarity sets out to ride the Northern California break known as Mavericks.','/7wxJmFqTMcdE05sfWedB6458US1.jpg','2012-10-25',116,'Released','Legends start somewhere.','Chasing Mavericks',82684,5.0909,7,'6pwnwnzk8L8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29584,_binary '\0','/uwO7TpXZYTW0aBYUbcneTS4jocg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16300138',6.5,5080,'en','I Used to Be Funny','Sam, an aspiring stand-up comedian and au pair struggling with PTSD, weighs whether to join the search for Brooke, a missing teenage girl she used to nanny. As she fights to recover from her trauma and return to the stage, memories of her deep bond with Brooke rush back—making it impossible to ignore her disappearance.','/vL9osUSzKYdDphezKibmCjCH0xD.jpg','2024-06-07',106,'Released',NULL,'I Used to Be Funny',918287,3.1916,6.7,'wtVSWnofryc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29585,_binary '\0','/n4Y09nKZFzlQi4G35tKt6eXanev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630027',7.1,7507,'de','Almanya - Willkommen in Deutschland','After living 45 years in Germany, the Turkish Hüseyin Yilmaz, seventy, announces to his family that he has bought a house in Turkey and they should return to make the necessary reforms. The idea is unwelcome and causes very heated discussions. In addition, Canan, a granddaughter of Hüseyin, announces she is pregnant and the father is her English boyfriend, and no one knew anything.','/uuEWm1r3cfxrnX4NxAXuJhtOmp4.jpg','2011-05-13',101,'Released',NULL,'Almanya: Welcome to Germany',63849,2.2686,6.6,'MzWWObywANQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29586,_binary '\0','/kJsPVzdyBrYHLomuNv5SJDXUQ2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630029',7.5,647853,'en','Avatar: The Way of Water','Set more than a decade after the events of the first film, learn the story of the Sully family (Jake, Neytiri, and their kids), the trouble that follows them, the lengths they go to keep each other safe, the battles they fight to stay alive, and the tragedies they endure.','/t6HIqrRAclMCA60NsSmeqe9RmNV.jpg','2022-12-14',192,'Released','Return to Pandora.','Avatar: The Way of Water',76600,42.1558,7.583,'a8Gx8wiNbs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29587,_binary '\0','/mTufDWFNNtm4hJzRQi5cxsO5Ar4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630036',6.9,22976,'en','Courageous','Law enforcement officers Adam Mitchell, Nathan Hayes, and their partners stand up to the worst the streets have to offer with confidence and focus. Yet at the end of the day, they face a challenge that none of them are truly prepared to tackle: fatherhood. They know that God desires to turn the hearts of fathers to their children, but their children are beginning to drift further and further away from them. When tragedy hits home, these men are left wrestling with their hopes, their fears, their faith, and their fathering. Can a newfound urgency help these dads draw closer to God... and to their children?','/hVRkbZRCoHtnfi0V9GFZ3uXjCNp.jpg','2011-09-30',129,'Released','Honor Begins at Home','Courageous',72213,5.3628,7.6,'i9VT_NBIVfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29588,_binary '\0','/92LX2nflnkxHtmV2WRb4I4lSXsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16300962',6.9,64280,'es','Cuando acecha la maldad','When brothers Pedro and Jimi discover that a demonic infection has been festering in a nearby farmhouse, they attempt to evict the victim from their land. Failing to adhere to the proper rites of exorcism, their reckless actions inadvertently trigger an epidemic of possessions across their rural community.','/iQ7G9LhP7NRRIUM4Vlai3eOxBAc.jpg','2023-10-05',100,'Released','There\'s no point in praying.','When Evil Lurks',744857,8.2914,7.2,'YbJEiOOvBxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29589,_binary '\0','/2TaEkr096jxQrzryviiB3izYLEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16301164',5.7,3513,'en','This Time Next Year','Minnie and Quinn were both born in London on New Year’s Day, in the same hospital, one minute apart. Thirty years later — and very different people — they find themselves thrown together again in the same city on New Year’s Eve.','/ckLPzRl9ZDHzNt4tDjkTGUyCYg7.jpg','2024-06-03',116,'Released','It\'s a love-fate relationship.','This Time Next Year',1122418,3.1127,6.1,'-KiYX2AvuKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29590,_binary '\0','/2Lx15Nv0fCmbsPJeJ8RAzIWxRda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16302202',5.3,6647,'en','The Estate','Down-on-her-luck divorcee Macey and her fickle sister Savanna attempt to win over their terminally ill, difficult-to-please Aunt Hilda in hopes of becoming the beneficiaries of her wealthy estate, only to find the rest of their greedy family members have the same idea.','/mYgS4djsVj61kzEpX43LklGUfgK.jpg','2022-11-04',96,'Released','Where there\'s a will there\'s a war.','The Estate',910858,4.4355,5.4,'DqTEVmed0Bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29591,_binary '\0','/50Wq7fY21obXVRICuljdlSigWvH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16304446',6.4,47637,'en','Fair Play','An unexpected promotion at a cutthroat hedge fund pushes a young couple\'s relationship to the brink, threatening to unravel not only their recent engagement but their lives.','/btExhxzdUZoQagLaYyXgT4KgT2e.jpg','2023-09-28',113,'Released','Competition is close.','Fair Play',910571,7.819,6.4,'Vw9fgeNoTDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29592,_binary '\0','/7OSCCLhtbqD7p9vzcIUFDA8rvzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630564',4.3,2705,'en','Sacrifice','A tough undercover cop inadvertently gets involved in a dangerous heroin ring when a young defector of the drug trade leaves his five year-old sister in his care.','/fMXYwKqR82b9qDiCq8A6fVgekhw.jpg','2011-04-26',100,'Released','Drug Ring, Kidnapping, Violence, Police, One Word Title, Female Nudity, Drug Dealer, Hockey Arena','Sacrifice',56913,2.565,4.6,'QM6Jr2XYFMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29593,_binary '\0','/vbGGJX1iHvvdHtGSOpcbXb11anq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630603',7.2,1369,'cs','Kuky se vrací','Young Ondra has asthma and so his parents throw away his favourite toy: a musty old stuffed bear named Kooky. That night Ondra dreams that Kooky is determined to find his way back home from the dump. In the boy\'s fantasy, the bear gets lost in a forest occupied by strange animals and remarkable beings that he never heard of while living on the toy shelf in Ondra\'s room. And of course even in this small imaginary world, true good exists as does real evil, which Kooky must face up to in order to become a real hero.','/l1p0IJnpT98DZweNscQnxJobUwW.jpg','2010-05-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Kooky',50294,1.585,6.7,'MBQbkbnj780','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29594,_binary '\0','/tIxeyVkZIWdIcxc7eZwm5XSfh99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1630637',6.1,3874,'it','Immaturi','Six high school friends in their 40s who haven\'t seen each other in nearly 20 years rekindle their younger selves after a court cancels their diploma, forcing them to repeat the final high school exam.','/n97HpLLs6flPoxK1VVPMKN2Bc32.jpg','2011-01-21',108,'Released',NULL,'The Immature',56909,1.3525,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29595,_binary '\0','/48lIqWnrm1vG5YfPwXTLLpaKbUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16310718',5.7,1274,'en','Nobody\'s Home','When Theodora\'s boyfriend Luca is set to be released from the institution where they are both admitted, she escapes with him and tries to re-traumatize him so he remains under her control. They end up at his childhood home where a knock on the door sends them spiraling into a confusing night of games and manipulation rooted in lies, insecurity, and fear.','/tOtT4BKQtuTOkXO4ZjvBWdNaqwk.jpg','2024-09-17',83,'Released',NULL,'Nobody\'s Home',1170595,1.3944,6.1,'WLoXzUzRALk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29596,_binary '\0','/9nbr4LkLzT8GXYDnMCA90RtS5mT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16311444',6.3,1329,'sv','Motståndaren','In the aftermath of a devastating rumor, Iman and his family have been forced to flee Iran. As refugees, they end up in a run-down hotel in northern Sweden. Despite feeling powerless, Iman tries to maintain his role as the family patriarch. To increase their chances of asylum, he breaks a promise to his wife and joins the local wrestling club. As the rumors start to resurface, Iman’s fear and desperation begin to take a hold.','/fa1p2UyCrVVhQwg5Lmq45ipAo3N.jpg','2023-10-26',119,'Released',NULL,'Opponent',936370,1.7011,6.6,'07R2q7EyAps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29597,_binary '\0','/yNsliyE3OthPtxO71jFehzRfLYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16311464',6,1271,'en','Silver Haze','23-year-old Franky is a nurse who lives with her large family in an East London borough. Obsessed with a thirst for revenge and a need to assign guilt for a traumatic event that happened 15 years before, she is unable to build any meaningful relationship until she falls in love with one of her patients – Florence. They escape to the coast where Florence lives with her more open-minded patchwork family. There, Franky finds the emotional shelter to deal with the grudges of the past.','/3mSdBEUjmkCytuEmCuTCvkZIF0d.jpg','2023-03-02',103,'Released',NULL,'Silver Haze',936385,1.7262,5.7,'C4RFX2jzvBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29598,_binary '\0','/lkDYN0whyE82mcM20rwtwjbniKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16311594',7.6,392206,'en','F1','Racing legend Sonny Hayes is coaxed out of retirement to lead a struggling Formula 1 team—and mentor a young hotshot driver—while chasing one more chance at glory.','/9PXZIUsSDh4alB80jheWX4fhZmy.jpg','2025-06-25',156,'Released','Let\'s ride.','F1',911430,41.6551,7.829,'8yh9BPUBbbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29599,_binary '\0','/sXafgXIwHVbtUplBPcUYQvmbkM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16315948',6.8,2194,'uk','Клондайк','The story of a Ukrainian family living on the border of Russia and Ukraine during the start of the war. Irka refuses to leave her house even as the village gets captured by armed forces. Shortly after they find themselves at the center of an international air crash catastrophe on July 17, 2014.','/3IJOzk5dYZJXCQwbk9mmveCgTXQ.jpg','2022-05-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Klondike',913760,1.6149,6.7,'epmfMMHq6mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29600,_binary '\0','/2OYkD6dVs45IpmpGtz9fAqFbHJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1631707',6.4,15433,'en','Enter Nowhere','Three strangers arrive one by one to a mysterious cabin in the middle of nowhere after enduring separate life-altering predicaments. Searching for a way out of the woods, frustrated, hungry and battling to stay warm they discover their mysterious connection and realize what they have to do in order to get out of the woods alive.','/eBWZmjzehYXmVTCsFan9RnzmZ7Z.jpg','2015-02-02',90,'Released','Welcome to our nightmare!','Enter Nowhere',98568,2.9833,6.4,'GHqLD0AgfsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29601,_binary '\0','/4V1yIoAKPMRQwGBaSses8Bp2nsi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1631867',7.9,815804,'en','Edge of Tomorrow','Major Bill Cage is an officer who has never seen a day of combat when he is unceremoniously demoted and dropped into combat. Cage is killed within minutes, managing to take an alpha alien down with him. He awakens back at the beginning of the same day and is forced to fight and die again... and again - as physical contact with the alien has thrown him into a time loop.','/nBM9MMa2WCwvMG4IJ3eiGUdbPe6.jpg','2014-05-27',114,'Released','Live. Die. Repeat.','Edge of Tomorrow',137113,23.4846,7.643,'eb8wTIcGLgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29602,_binary '\0','/vQc3i8dFIEKx36FEpeApg7MXQD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1632544',6.9,3225,'ja','君に届け','Sawako Kuronuma looks miserable on the outside, but is actually a positive-minded girl, who looks up to Shota Kazehaya, a sociable and friendly boy. Perceiving Sawako\'s good intentions, he secretly has feelings for her. Sawako meets Kazehaya and makes her first friends, Chizuru and Ayane but in comes Kurumi proclaiming her love for him... Will Sawako and Kazehaya ever find out about each other\'s feelings?','/ttyBsRKi5yJdSoepIPciDmqwYXn.jpg','2010-09-25',128,'Released',NULL,'From Me to You',59944,1.8816,7.2,'8DNPhwwdfKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29603,_binary '\0','/lCR2wcqu6BBF7vFF3TqqDartccO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1632547',7.1,16357,'ja','冷たい熱帯魚','When fish shop owner Shamoto\'s teenage daughter Mitsuko is caught stealing, a generous middle-aged man named Murata helps resolve the situation. The man and his wife offer to have Mitsuko work at their opposing fish store. Shamoto soon discovers that something far more sinister lives behind Murata\'s friendly demeanor.','/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg','2011-01-29',146,'Released','He\'ll make you pick up the pieces.','Cold Fish',68341,3.9739,6.9,'ieTAZUXrBD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29604,_binary '\0','/TJ2gXxBYtLvbfs4XY0P3HEzuCS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1632679',7.8,2896,'en','Van Gogh: Painted with Words','A drama-documentary presented by Alan Yentob, with Benedict Cumberbatch in the lead role. Every word spoken by the actors in this film is sourced from the letters that Van Gogh sent to his younger brother Theo, and of those around him. What emerges is a complex portrait of a sophisticated, civilised and yet tormented man.','/soGsCeYNpq2OcdUrB4th1h1wwd.jpg','2010-04-05',80,'Released',NULL,'Van Gogh: Painted with Words',258514,2.3803,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29605,_binary '\0','/wD0TCyFkRkol7JkLmO7gp7oZkib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1632708',6.5,423750,'en','Friends with Benefits','Dylan is done with relationships. Jamie decides to stop buying into the Hollywood clichés of true love. When the two become friends they decide to try something new and take advantage of their mutual attraction - but without any emotional attachment.','/nKhhDFCdzxeJ3GUunQ570LDpUkz.jpg','2011-07-21',109,'Released','Some friends come with a happy ending.','Friends with Benefits',50544,13.4347,6.64,'MxfaGMuiniI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29606,_binary '\0','/z4GYTErSyFAZvGJjTLS4LRODY66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1633356',4.1,28517,'en','Shark Night 3D','A weekend at a lake house in the Louisiana Gulf turns into a nightmare for seven vacationers as they are subjected to fresh-water shark attacks.','/cjfRqUXtNc2iJHfP60HTq9nFs0.jpg','2011-09-02',91,'Released','Terror runs deep.','Shark Night 3D',65055,6.3187,5.064,'nDmLLGTQlXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29607,_binary '\0','/qo7WRoSXkpgvmc9TgaklzrsukLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1633359',5.8,20100,'en','The Toxic Avenger Unrated','When a downtrodden janitor, Winston Gooze, is exposed to a catastrophic toxic accident, he’s transformed into a new kind of hero: The Toxic Avenger. Now, Toxie must rise from outcast to savior, taking on ruthless corporate overlords and corrupt forces who threaten his son, his friends, and his community.','/cCWojb6N9UcTzNVtS4bOM3vQ30x.jpg','2025-08-28',102,'Released','The hero we need now.','The Toxic Avenger Unrated',338969,10.5215,5.9,'BO3tPsmx8_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29608,_binary '\0','/b6usdEMEOX5pcVpXrS32z0NOwGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634003',6.4,11569,'es','Metegol','All seems well for Amadeo, a shy but talented foosball player who\'s in love with the free-spirited Laura. Trouble strikes when Grosso, the world\'s best soccer player, returns home with plans to destroy the village and turn it into a new sports stadium. When Grosso kidnaps Laura, Amadeo receives the ultimate surprise when the figurines from his foosball table spring to life to help him save his beloved and reclaim the town.','/tJL0oyVmrwSpULCAGaTqs9VMTdM.jpg','2013-07-18',107,'Released','There\'s only one team this summer.','Underdogs',153158,5.1673,7.068,'aymhLsyy3TY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29609,_binary '\0','/jbUTtapd0bQcdf6xz7fGJK14rC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634013',8.1,13823,'sr','Монтевидео, Бог те видео!','A story about one team that decides to follow a dream that takes them on a journey to the First World Football Championship in Montevideo, Uruguay in 1930. A dream that allows them to become true stars and living legends.','/odJAlLJFfsGZcxracqeeqk1O7Hj.jpg','2010-12-19',140,'Released','When a dream becomes a legend.','Montevideo, God Bless You!',57419,1.4684,6.8,'TZOrgK0cp6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29610,_binary '\0','/zlqMASc3vEtdym2OvXgE7fC6onT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634106',5.7,92136,'en','Bloodshot','After he and his wife are murdered, marine Ray Garrison is resurrected by a team of scientists. Enhanced with nanotechnology, he becomes a superhuman, biotech killing machine—\'Bloodshot\'. As Ray first trains with fellow super-soldiers, he cannot recall anything from his former life. But when his memories flood back and he remembers the man that killed both him and his wife, he breaks out of the facility to get revenge, only to discover that there\'s more to the conspiracy than he thought.','/8WUVHemHFH2ZIP6NWkwlHWsyrEL.jpg','2020-03-05',110,'Released','Being a superhero is in his blood.','Bloodshot',338762,7.8513,6.668,'0R-qIOGyEcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29611,_binary '\0','/5xkUNp36OqJLm7ERfVIEinZrxQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634121',5.4,21968,'en','Intruders','Though no one can see him, Hollow Face lurks in the corners, desperately desiring love but only knowing how to spread fear and hate. He creeps into the life of John Farrow after Farrow’s beloved 12-year-old daughter Mia is assaulted in their home. The line between the real and the imaginary blurs as fissures start to open within the family unit. It seems that no security measure can keep Hollow Face out.','/erGjRCwzKOGHxJ32fR5ObGYtBBK.jpg','2011-09-12',100,'Released','The Nightmare is Real.','Intruders',63207,2.8414,5.482,'9FE616lUkuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29612,_binary '\0','/croOmkPszzl9p8ASq4NTYunFJ5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634122',6.3,150632,'en','Johnny English Reborn','The most prominent heads of state in the world begin gathering for a conference that could have a major impact on global politics. When MI-7 receives word that the Chinese premier has become the target of some high-powered killers, it falls on Johnny English to save the day. Armed with the latest high-tech weaponry and gadgets that would make even James Bond jealous, the once-disgraced agent uncovers evidence of a massive conspiracy involving some of the world\'s most powerful organisations, and vows to redeem his tarnished reputation by stopping the killers before they can strike.','/zDbrU0eSnRGh5gHc1iqTACTNNyT.jpg','2011-09-15',101,'Released','A little intelligence goes a long way.','Johnny English Reborn',58233,11.3549,6.253,'wCsSzZU-sQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29613,_binary '\0','/eIBn2eDoKUZHjuoU7IxbtQUPPjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634136',6,13809,'en','Violet & Daisy','Two teenage assassins accept what they think will be a quick-and-easy job, until an unexpected target throws them off their plan.','/aQawgKvHovftR0Ues1tlYrxLEWh.jpg','2013-06-06',88,'Released','Too much sugar can kill you.','Violet & Daisy',91550,3.4896,6.1,'C7CdL8xXmxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29614,_binary '\0','/xSNUTfKM8Ig3HsPFuK47gHF3KO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634300',5.2,1294,'en','Role/Play','A recently outed soap opera actor crosses paths with a recently divorced gay marriage activist, forcing them to confront the price of fame and the fickle nature of celebrity within the gay community.','/zEjGb0WvYbgu9hmjQZYnfWBbTyo.jpg','2010-06-03',85,'Released','Who are you pretending to be?','Role/Play',76421,1.1386,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29615,_binary '\0','/eudXxm6dNPcpSoGaUmUtczvVBwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16343836',6.4,1623,'en','Jingle Bell Princess','An actual princess has some mechanical issues and is temporarily grounded. Does she have time for a lobster roll? It is Christmas time in Maine which means snow, quaint scenery, and lots of Christmas lights near the ocean. With the crew distracted attending to the repair, Princess Amelia deplanes to walk through a magical Christmas tree lot near the airport perimeter.','/jqxh21dySEujfIvxQaIV3ti6oj5.jpg','2021-12-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Jingle Bell Princess',874257,1.8329,6.5,'adDQ77N7QaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29616,_binary '\0','/ziyOt3cXwt9bnLMEh9D8A2479Hp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1634524',6.7,1731,'is','Órói','An unexpected first kiss causes Gabriel to feel the electrifying \"jitters\" of love and lust with the free-spirited Marcus; a perfect way to end a Summer studying abroad. Realizing he is gay, Gabriel returns home and is immediately scrutinized by his family and friends who notice he’s different. But as the school year launches with Gabriel distracted with parties and his friends’ own dramas, Marcus returns, reigniting the hot, thrilling emotions of one’s first crush. Jitters fires head-first into the topsy-turvy world of first love with an attractive cast and pulsating soundtrack, making it a smartly refreshing journey into the queer, teen experience.','/jmGb7bzhvHlRSjbxlwn6KQx6pQ5.jpg','2010-08-27',93,'Released','Life is happening right here, right now.','Jitters',78441,1.1738,5.9,'3_APq2LGmvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29617,_binary '\0','/9O5XXzZiXuuog4KLHhBefzJ70HO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16345484',7.5,2295,'zh','雄狮少年','By a fortunate coincidence, Gyun is inspired and encouraged by a girl with the same name. Therefore, he decides to form a lion dance troupe with his friends, Kat and Doggie, to break the constraints of reality and fight for themselves for once.','/901NqAyWFcMoY7o1IJzl8QLbxxU.jpg','2021-12-11',104,'Released','The sick cats rise. Rotten, we are glowing.','I Am What I Am',839803,3.7452,7.315,'yWPx15h6Y6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29618,_binary '\0','/pmygxuqpZQmDAzGAba6wbDsHbR0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16347374',5.5,1995,'es','Mañana es hoy','A family is on holiday in 1991 when their teenage daughter decides to elope with her boyfriend. Their parents travel forward in time to 2022 and see how much Spain has changed in three decades.','/1rgf4MomMFjOdkskY6NYoHSy6uz.jpg','2022-11-29',108,'Released',NULL,'Tomorrow Is Today',1029528,1.979,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29619,_binary '\0','/a8Q2g0g7XzAF6gcB8qgn37ccb9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16360006',6.4,10091,'ja','バブル','In an abandoned Tokyo overrun by bubbles and gravitational abnormalities, one gifted young man has a fateful meeting with a mysterious girl.','/wjgwIZyEgtgy9nIdz6C5uJNel2X.jpg','2022-02-14',101,'Released','Is she a calamity or a blessing?','Bubble',912598,4.8566,7.3,'8pbWblLkHHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29620,_binary '\0','/8fNorb1m1Dw5KAFcoOGoAEds5Ye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636539',6.1,2298,'en','Love Birds','Sometimes the best things in life happen on the fly. From the moment an injured duck crash-lands on Doug\'s roof, everything changes. Recently dumped and wallowing in self pity, Doug decides to nurse Pierre back to health with the assistance of an eccentric vet and bird specialist, Holly.','/hybHtrMWPfz0zUZekAVbCO6X7hB.jpg','2011-02-24',103,'Released','When it comes to love, sometimes all you need is a little duck.','Love Birds',69792,1.4686,5.9,'IvQh5MvMpFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29621,_binary '\0','/xz3hZViv1AwAZDlwhu9dE8yVCmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16365840',6.4,1488,'en','The Christmas House 2: Deck Those Halls','The Mitchell brothers compete to see who can create the best Christmas House.','/cWccc2GZL0w4IUiW2d4o81c8A28.jpg','2021-12-18',84,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas House 2: Deck Those Halls',874196,2.0926,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29622,_binary '\0','/3V4kLQg0kSqPLctI5ziYWabAZYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16366836',6,164726,'en','Venom: The Last Dance','Eddie and Venom are on the run. Hunted by both of their worlds and with the net closing in, the duo are forced into a devastating decision that will bring the curtains down on Venom and Eddie\'s last dance.','/vGXptEdgZIhPg3cGlc7e8sNPC2e.jpg','2024-10-22',109,'Released','\'Til death do they part.','Venom: The Last Dance',912649,36.9944,6.671,'FKBN1qAzW3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29623,_binary '\0','/rY6w3b5Mn0LRIkD9lhhCei849NF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636780',7.7,2765,'ja','劇場版 銀魂 新訳紅桜篇','Odd Jobs Gin has taken on a lot of odd work in the past, and when you\'re a Jack of All Trades agency based in a feudal Japan that\'s been conquered and colonized by aliens, the term \"Odd Jobs\" means REALLY ODD jobs. But when some more than slightly suspicious secrets from the shadows of Gintoki Sakata\'s somewhat shady former samurai past and a new pair of odd jobs collide, the action is bound to get so wild and demented that only a feature film will do it justice!','/E3RT3f8oOuPS2pMhgH47TKBPgu.jpg','2010-04-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Gintama: The Movie',71172,3.3382,7.5,'VU_-I1Bup-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29624,_binary '\0','/2FhAnt7MO0dFTZYYCX2sB7mH6ef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16368004',7.1,1776,'en','The Presence of Love','The film follows adjunct professor Joss, who travels to England to visit the farm where her late mother grew up and bonds with single father Daniel, whose family now runs it.','/66IDuc0inPYJ4E8XpvIDtK12eAK.jpg','2022-03-13',84,'Released','Falling in love in the English countryside.','The Presence of Love',933331,2.3276,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29625,_binary '\0','/njX1bnN5Xq7Uagz6QvzKv0Js3FP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636815',6.9,2540,'ja','名探偵コナン 天空の難破船（ロスト・シップ）','A terrorist group invades a laboratory containing a deadly bacteria and destroys the lab with an explosion. They later announce via the internet they have gained possession of the bacteria and declare themselves to be the Red Siamese Cats, a terrorist group that was eradicated a decade ago.','/kthV4ZwXO37pfCFTbX1cHOYie4r.jpg','2010-04-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: The Lost Ship in the Sky',97375,4.5846,7.1,'y3O4XSygXPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29626,_binary '\0','/cUqXHZtnptgvyAE1hN47Wsf3ami.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636826',6.7,261865,'en','Project X','Three high school seniors throw a party to make a name for themselves. As the night progresses, things spiral out of control as word of the party spreads.','/lUPDGT3lyRrq8SvWuNWG2DP64bR.jpg','2012-03-01',88,'Released','The party you\'ve only dreamed about.','Project X',57214,11.722,6.927,'X28d7fbRGSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29627,_binary '\0','/oaXnvLEVLuenkTOyCV6KNA8MImQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636833',6.1,1694,'tr','Siyah Beyaz','A painter with a turbulent history, fiercely committed to his ideals and still averse to settling down despite his 70 years; a lawyer who packed in his job after suffering a heart attack and now pursues a quiet life looking after his pet snail; a doctor already disenchanted with his profession and now discarded by his wife; a career woman braving life on her own, who has made loneliness a life style. These characters are all patrons of Black & White, an Ankara bar that has been around for 25 years, and in a sense the bar is their last haven. The owner, meanwhile, is the irritable, easily offended but utterly lovable Faruk... Black & White is a film about the awareness of growing old, friendship, sensitivity and the finer details of life.','/1mk6Ak7PkMxi0tjaxL2AgmmV33R.jpg','2010-04-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Black and White',64138,0.6298,5.6,'Vxb9oaWfWCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29628,_binary '\0','/2DnAcx5tBx5tUGzwgECgq8C7AsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1636844',6.8,3606,'en','Will','Brennan is Liverpool\'s number one fan, able to recite facts ad infinitum about the club and at a public school in the south of England since his father Gareth is emotionally unable to care for him following the death of Will\'s mother. Gareth appears one day out of the blue with tickets for Liverpool\'s trip to the 2005 Champions League Final in Istanbul.','/9aEpPFYcOQyqtAinGIqlRws6oaq.jpg','2011-11-04',102,'Released','Always Follow Your Dream','Will',91979,1.6548,6.5,'Q1bbYfdgKh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29629,_binary '\0','/cIHFTyIf0LjRzjSnwtCAGzwTOKK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16368898',4.9,2149,'en','Lights Out','A drifting ex-soldier turns underground fighter with the help of a just-released ex-con, pitting him against corrupt cops and hired killers now gunning for him and all those he cares about.','/gCOSDDyN0qA8rGoVwsZc72v3RuZ.jpg','2024-02-16',90,'Released','They started the wrong fight.','Lights Out',931642,5.7101,7,'NGo00SVyeso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29630,_binary '\0','/q72PB4UfXK3RH7aoxp4X5l85wD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16369708',6.8,2520,'ja','屋根裏のラジャー','Amanda and her imaginary friend Rudger go on thrilling make-believe adventures. But when Rudger finds himself alone, he faces a mysterious threat.','/j2a9eQaoI91EuKnhGbE8yvPfmyV.jpg','2023-12-15',108,'Released','A boy no one can see, and the Imaginaries.','The Imaginary',913001,4.3202,7.598,'-nW6LLojcUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29631,_binary '\0','/A3iBjMelJFdLJ9xs68t56qfOjW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16369822',7,1232,'tr','Bandırma Füze Kulübü','When the calendars showed the 1950s, curiosity and interest in space had reached new heights, and many countries from Europe to Asia, led by the United States and the Soviet Union, had launched space programs and entered into fierce competition to reach beyond the unknowns of the sky. By 1957, the Soviet Union had become the first country to launch a rocket into space with Sputnik, followed by the United States as the second to make history. During these years, high school students and their friends living in Bandırma were inspired by Sputnik to pursue their dreams of space exploration. Despite lacking a space program, government support, or financial resources, they established the \"Bandırma Rocket Club\" with the aim of launching a rocket into space.','/FtQVAeVOvAtwoAQ3q2JgqWOVzf.jpg','2022-10-21',111,'Released',NULL,'Bandırma Füze Kulübü',1037406,1.0226,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29632,_binary '\0','/nxN4p3eITPgvk3dhZ6aNe3NCVX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16374352',6.3,3072,'en','The Blind','Long before Duck Dynasty\'s Phil Robertson became a reality TV star, he fell in love with Miss Kay and started a family, but his demons threatened to tear their lives apart. Set in the backwoods swamps of 1960s Louisiana, \'The Blind\' shares never-before-revealed moments in Phil\'s life as he seeks to conquer the shame of his past, ultimately finding redemption in an unlikely place. This stunning cinematic journey chronicles the love story that launched a dynasty, the turmoil that nearly brought it crashing down, and the hope that rose from the ashes to create a foundation for generations to come.','/bRYMdgIft5H8dOdDLkjoKOcS8Zg.jpg','2023-09-28',110,'Released','The true story of the Robertson family.','The Blind',1032194,3.2556,6.045,'dE2wUVknVj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29633,_binary '\0','/qobm3A9oXZAqVyKapoANeBgsG0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16375952',4.5,3247,'en','Dangerous Game: The Legacy Murders','A family reunion at a remote mansion takes a lethal turn when they are trapped inside and forced to play a deadly survival game where only one will make it out alive.','/xkRhMw0tBpDtg28bytxN2hrhyri.jpg','2022-10-21',96,'Released','Are you ready to play?','Dangerous Game: The Legacy Murders',1027385,3.3877,6.1,'6303iTtM-mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29634,_binary '\0','/bKhUoItzMH5Rj4ECw2nGV1ZABth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16376470',5.3,2439,'en','Horror in the High Desert 2: Minerva','In 2018 a string of tragedies unfold in the high desert of North Eastern Nevada. A woman was found dead and another would vanish along the same stretch of remote highway. Could these events be linked to the infamous 2017 disappearance of outdoorsman Gary Hinge?','/mVRFdp2oddZL2j0szJdTqsCVzAm.jpg','2023-03-01',76,'Released','No one just disappears.','Horror in the High Desert 2: Minerva',1092324,1.1038,5.4,'F5DwNoSXUcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29635,_binary '\0','/bd1ppZC3g3ctHwP2pCwbHDMr1Op.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16376494',7.1,1603,'en','Descendant','History exists beyond what is written. The Africatown residents in Mobile, Alabama, have shared stories about their origins for generations. Their community was founded by enslaved ancestors who were transported in 1860 aboard the last known and illegal slave ship, Clotilda. Though the ship was intentionally destroyed upon arrival, its memory and legacy weren’t. Now, the long-awaited discovery of the Clotilda’s remains offers this community a tangible link to their ancestors and validation of a history so many tried to bury.','/sHd1OBpWLxSN5UPSJrjwYeT4PPZ.jpg','2022-10-21',111,'Released','The past is always present.','Descendant',913822,1.5898,6.3,'2M8ESS9hSAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29636,_binary '\0','/pxL08w7Eq0vKrQ3mJzYp0VHGaKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637688',6.7,488723,'en','In Time','In the not-too-distant future, the aging gene has been switched off. To avoid overpopulation, time has become the currency and the way people pay for luxuries and necessities. The rich can live forever, while the rest struggle to negotiate for their immortality. A poor young man who suddenly comes into a fortune of time finds himself on the run from a corrupt police force known as the \"time keepers\".','/3Mwj2sIONQckOZP3YwsUXF7U5I4.jpg','2011-10-27',109,'Released','Live forever or die trying.','In Time',49530,18.2286,6.971,'xhYUaR5QiUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29637,_binary '\0','/a9ph8vuE5eudGsKuA1VSXpYWEoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637691',5.8,1480,'hi','खेलें हम जी जान से','1930, British India: In the province of undivided Bengal lies the sleepy, peaceful port of Chittagong. In this unassuming little town a revolution is about to begin; a revolution which will forever wake all of Chittagong and inspire the entire nation.','/dd4S6SmgSCAjx48AYunHoFlnwhn.jpg','2010-12-03',183,'Released',NULL,'Khelein Hum Jee Jaan Sey',50777,1.2172,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29638,_binary '\0','/dBaQ9zPkh4yi5Oe1Qm3apXs1WgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637706',6.4,92811,'en','Our Idiot Brother','Everybody has one—the sibling who is always just a little bit behind the curve when it comes to getting his life together. For sisters Liz, Miranda and Natalie, that person is their perennially upbeat brother, Ned. But as each of their lives begins to unravel, Ned\'s family comes to realise that Ned isn\'t such an idiot after all.','/2HahJCcUEduvMUTQhsqRwutpFw1.jpg','2011-08-26',90,'Released','Everybody has one','Our Idiot Brother',59968,4.9264,6.129,'1yvn8a16B9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29639,_binary '\0','/F04DzuM2R72foaCUBnK7H8eYfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637713',3.8,1310,'en','Roadkill','Six young friends on a road trip in Ireland run afoul of gypsies who curse them for accidentally running down an old woman. The curse takes the form of a terrifying flying beast that tries killing them all.','/6ZQUotw157KJDRLRKuxa42UYSqz.jpg','2011-04-23',88,'Released','Teenage snack!','Roadkill',71628,1.485,5.825,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29640,_binary '\0','/hkAVgWvAMmM8tj9CDEvGqMdNQBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637725',6.9,718855,'en','Ted','John Bennett, a man whose childhood wish of bringing his teddy bear to life came true, now must decide between keeping the relationship with the bear or his girlfriend, Lori.','/1QVZXQQHCEIj8lyUhdBYd2qOYtq.jpg','2012-06-29',107,'Released','Ted is coming.','Ted',72105,24.9928,6.455,'tJs8-Ytu0oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29641,_binary '\0','/f7YapECNdCwWOmHWaZOukGjJlLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1637728',3.8,2230,'en','Ferocious Planet','A groundbreaking device is designed to glimpse alternate universes. But when the machine malfunctions and transports a group of observers into a nightmarish dimension of alien terrors, the travelers must use ingenuity to survive.','/uwWF8T3c8aB7lASHzWJINeNdU8T.jpg','2011-04-09',89,'Released','They\'re Not on Earth Anymore.','Ferocious Planet',61341,2.1116,4.4,'8n4C8cfTYWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29642,_binary '\0','/nQAfnJSH9kDxLi1pD9YxjeeG2rr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16377356',7.6,1657,'en','The Janes','Defying the state legislature that outlawed abortion, the Catholic Church that condemned it, and the Chicago Mob that was profiting from it, the members of “Jane” risked their personal and professional lives to support women with unwanted pregnancies. In the pre-Roe v. Wade era — a time when abortion was a crime in most states and even circulating information about abortion was a felony in Illinois — the Janes provided low-cost and free abortions to an estimated 11,000 women.','/hKWJ0hw1tWOONaQliyrp2wC6Rcm.jpg','2022-05-03',101,'Released','They didn\'t have a choice.','The Janes',913829,2.3986,5.6,'pRbquE2BAkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29643,_binary '\0','/mYA6m2kruLxmqAApVcX8uMc0jNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16377816',7.4,2676,'pt','Marte Um','A middle-class Black family in Brazil copes with the election of a far-right extremist president. The mother believes that she\'s cursed after an unexpected encounter, while her husband puts all of his hopes into their son\'s soccer career.','/mrEHCuGyXpkBpQW5Xqt5kaHOyap.jpg','2022-08-25',115,'Released',NULL,'Mars One',913816,3.948,7.3,'Z7QE0uKnpDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29644,_binary '\0','/j2V5P9I56CMrhB7KRGk6J1bPvly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16377862',7,5507,'en','All That Breathes','Against the darkening backdrop of New Delhi\'s apocalyptic air and escalating violence, two brothers devote their lives to protecting one casualty of the turbulent times: the bird known as the black kite.','/xgTyGlmOYnDwUugITwd8MY5AQ5F.jpg','2022-10-21',97,'Released',NULL,'All That Breathes',913838,1.9006,6.926,'DdjH0tfjbkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29645,_binary '\0','/qNa2UgCl0lJebvBy91ViUte9uXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16377920',7.2,2310,'en','Будинок зі скалок','A temporary house for abandoned children near the front line in eastern Ukraine is run by a small group of social workers determined to provide comfort and safety. It may be humble and somewhat run-down, but this house is filled with love and offers up to nine months of refuge to kids whose fate will be determined by the system. During this short time, the caretakers try to nurture within them a sense of stability and normalcy.','/eFYeFvco3Cgcrny99RCTFIaXMla.jpg','2023-03-09',87,'Released',NULL,'A House Made of Splinters',913743,1.8684,6.9,'NQVr8stsecM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29646,_binary '\0','/2aaKTUEh44pDzMRdVxIpX7T40QK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16378034',8.5,2535,'he','Tantura','When, in the late 1990s, Israeli student Teddy Katz exposed the massacre of Palestinian civilians by Israeli forces in the village of Tantura, in May 1948, during the first Arab-Israeli war, he was initially praised for his pioneering work; but he was soon infamous and branded a traitor. Decades later, incendiary new evidence emerges that corroborates Teddy\'s findings.','/qWGy9Ag7hEtxK5eLqCDOpk7ujqN.jpg','2022-01-20',95,'Released','The untold story of Israel\'s foundation','Tantura',913847,0.974,7.7,'HNtrUjUNkJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29647,_binary '\0','/5auogVIPsyc6WZ3dxzXyA5w5aPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16378064',3.3,1677,'en','To the End','The world is in crisis as it misses target after target to stop climate change. The Green New Deal has captured the imagination of millions with its visionary promise for systemic economic and environmental change that will build a better and more just world. In this moment of political upheaval with clashes in the streets and the halls of Congress, climate policy is taking center stage for the first time in American history, and the fight is on.','/lICewYMs24nwFNJnEJnbksmIEHP.jpg','2022-12-08',103,'Released','This fight has just begun.','To the End',913869,0.8984,2.2,'Cv2jtKboDi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29648,_binary '\0','/w9UPGJ1pFIw7pJMAgj9BpFAwdGe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16378164',7.5,1544,'pt','The Territory','The Indigenous Uru-eu-wau-wau people have seen their population dwindle and their culture threatened since coming into contact with non-Native Brazilians. Though promised dominion over their own rainforest territory, they have faced illegal incursions from environmentally destructive logging and mining, and, most recently, land-grabbing invasions spurred on by right-wing politicians like President Jair Bolsonaro. With deforestation escalating as a result, the stakes have become global.','/jtN984vGSVGKBVY03tdL0KHWpuJ.jpg','2022-08-19',85,'Released','The battle for home.','The Territory',913849,2.2987,6.7,'wL9wvdbk7A4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29649,_binary '\0','/hNMds0oT22bK3HcVahhiXV9yjxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16378298',6.7,1931,'en','Meet Me in the Bathroom','Set against the backdrop of 9/11, the story of how a new generation kickstarted a musical rebirth for New York City that reverberated around the world.','/3XNYt5zo3B8urZLiSXNavuHgmVC.jpg','2022-11-04',108,'Released','An immersive journey through the New York music scene of the early 2000s.','Meet Me in the Bathroom',913792,1.8805,5.4,'UgHN-YE7IPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29650,_binary '\0','/pwveCZhMhXm7nGPFCtBTYcT6MyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16379224',6.5,1349,'en','137 Shots','In this documentary, law enforcement faces scrutiny as Americans demand justice after police violence claims multiple Black lives in Cleveland.','/c62odansbfa1zQ01lnyN4tIu6Dc.jpg','2021-12-15',104,'Released',NULL,'137 Shots',913179,1.0731,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29651,_binary '\0','/rpsHpJj7FgnNBXhaO2KFthPwqH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638002',7.1,170638,'en','Love, Rosie','Since the moment they met at age 5, Rosie and Alex have been best friends, facing the highs and lows of growing up side by side. A fleeting shared moment, one missed opportunity, and the decisions that follow send their lives in completely different directions. As each navigates the complexities of life, love, and everything in between, they always find their way back to each other - but is it just friendship, or something more?','/2HOd431LX9ggqSpBIJ7qyYhATyo.jpg','2014-10-16',102,'Released','Right love. Wrong time.','Love, Rosie',200727,11.5272,7.812,'AnMNYz7bxpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29652,_binary '\0','/hmmWBSDWEuHnglPHm470MqDJ9Yq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638328',6.1,5219,'fr','L\'amour dure trois ans','A heartbroken literary critic turns his despair into creativity following a bitter divorce, only to encounter an enchanting beauty who poses a major challenge to his newfound cynicism. Marc Marronnier thought his marriage was going well until his wife deemed him immature, and left him for a high-profile writer. Devastated, he began filtering all of his heartache into a misanthropic manuscript decrying the virtues of true love. But later, when Marc falls hard for his cousin\'s radiant and gorgeous wife, his entire life is turned upside down. Louise Bourgoin and Gaspard Proust star in a film by actor and author-turned-director Frederic Beigbeder.','/eO8O5SwT1bQMHtW6kqEPteMVeiX.jpg','2011-12-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Love Lasts Three Years',85735,3.0383,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29653,_binary '\0','/9IVFO8FT3yxVyu0RA3WoMrEbnnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638350',6.4,2173,'fr','Le Skylab','It is 1979 and Albertine, 10, and all her family members have gathered in Brittany to celebrate the birthday of her grandmother. Everyone thinks that the Skylab space station from NASA will fall on their heads this summer. The meeting turns into a crazy weekend full of revelations, love and song.','/lsJOlJ1vljO8UyFbAXbLd6cXwb.jpg','2011-09-19',113,'Released',NULL,'Skylab',85449,1.5223,6,'JdbhvYBdNr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29654,_binary '\0','/eUBljjyOlY3Tlq1DBU2TFbela0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638353',7.1,5922,'fr','Syngué Sabour - Pierre de patience','In a war-ridden country, a woman watches over her husband, comatose from a bullet in the neck and abandoned by Jihad companions and brothers. One day, the woman decides to say things to him she could never have done before.','/1Ed2STYKoR8zLQGBdPZsmf65xsb.jpg','2013-02-20',102,'Released','She achieved her independence by telling stories filled with forbidden secrets','The Patience Stone',128158,3.008,7,'PnBh7bO3caI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29655,_binary '\0','/nMgELJEb9ly9HIamnX4ZZ1Z2pH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638355',7.2,360505,'en','The Man from U.N.C.L.E.','At the height of the Cold War, a mysterious criminal organization plans to use nuclear weapons and technology to upset the fragile balance of power between the United States and Soviet Union. CIA agent Napoleon Solo and KGB agent Illya Kuryakin are forced to put aside their hostilities and work together to stop the evildoers in their tracks. The duo\'s only lead is the daughter of a missing German scientist, whom they must find soon to prevent a global catastrophe.','/y5yZaForGSJbPD66Cvq9AT5WMAD.jpg','2015-08-13',116,'Released','Saving the world never goes out of style.','The Man from U.N.C.L.E.',203801,12.947,7.078,'4K4Iv_N9Nno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29656,_binary '\0','/1p5Ihtk4Rh633uTAO1dBiGucSBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638362',7.3,2653,'en','Client 9: The Rise and Fall of Eliot Spitzer','An in-depth look at the rapid rise and dramatic fall of New York Governor Eliot Spitzer.','/4wK6M1vgGYBLKTVpI5kb6CkMq6I.jpg','2010-11-05',117,'Released','Money. Sex. Power. Betrayal.','Client 9: The Rise and Fall of Eliot Spitzer',45274,1.7879,6.2,'0ieJ_8HMV_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29657,_binary '\0','/uNLSPLDqdOprTfyJJUp806bSv0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1638364',7.2,8375,'en','The Armstrong Lie','In 2009, Alex Gibney was hired to make a film about Lance Armstrong\'s comeback to cycling. The project was shelved when the doping scandal erupted, and re-opened after Armstrong\'s confession. The Armstrong Lie picks up in 2013 and presents a riveting, insider\'s view of the unraveling of one of the most extraordinary stories in the history of sports. As Lance Armstrong says himself, \"I didn\'t live a lot of lies, but I lived one big one.\"','/i90vU3XY68o27nxJexDqT7S4cGN.jpg','2013-09-08',124,'Released','The world wanted to believe him. So did the camera.','The Armstrong Lie',214083,2.4957,7,'ocyRpcTAwyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29658,_binary '\0','/96FR1jqgp8v4DW0F0Fe4d87GNFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1639084',6.7,22548,'en','Tallulah','Desperate to be rid of her toddler, a dissatisfied Beverly Hills housewife hires a stranger to babysit and ends up getting much more than she bargained for.','/9kG86fYSa8Ug0o8RoT96Kce4URt.jpg','2016-06-02',111,'Released','Life can be a real mother.','Tallulah',353571,2.9272,6.706,'8WSz2s-Gemc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29659,_binary '\0','/g2kCzCm1nJy0pO4Ku5kSQDVYSVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1639093',5.5,1847,'de','Russendisko','Three young Russian friends, who move from Moscow to Berlin in a lucky wave of emigration right after the fall of the Berlin wall. They take their chance looking for a better life and find themselves involved in the tales of everyday lunacy on the streets of Berlin and its spirit of the early nineties.','/34vwgjaGT0ILmKQaWo31PumjoLY.jpg','2012-03-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Russendisko',114438,1.2134,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29660,_binary '\0','/ddkcwMd6H7kGfgqntkt2Af52mgl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1639426',8.1,50431,'hi','उड़ान','Upon returning to his industrial hometown, a young man must decide whether to follow his own dreams or acquiesce to his father\'s plans for his future.','/8dQmrGk0WRPiCwiiGdIxnY5s8Pc.jpg','2010-06-17',138,'Released',NULL,'Udaan',45316,1.6533,7.3,'wEJxe2bE-cE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29661,_binary '\0','/nJU9mcwhp3NyrEVawziufARy64B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1639826',6,6768,'en','Justin and the Knights of Valour','A heart-warming tale about friendship, honor & courage, which sees a young boy become a man as he embarks on a quest to become a knight.','/z6GrOTKOazrLnHQWVrN1pA082qi.jpg','2013-08-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Justin and the Knights of Valour',146381,7.4903,5.9,'c9R9x9RfyGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29662,_binary '\0','/5hv5VSNlt9maW6KewGq5qNSs24E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1639901',6.7,1938,'fr','Un homme qui crie','Adam Ousmane is a pool attendant at a local resort. When the new managers decide to downsize, Adam loses his job to his own son, Abdel. Shattered by the turn of events, Adam is pressured into contributing to the Chadian war effort. With no money to speak of, the only asset he can donate is his son.','/q90ysGM6CQmHnUTGGU4x5TBv4hn.jpg','2010-09-29',92,'Released',NULL,'A Screaming Man',57602,1.7389,6.1,'8_rvfk5psbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29663,_binary '\0','/d5efTvS3dENL2dAWxZSJSx9tBZg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640202',4.6,5694,'tr','Çok Filim Hareketler Bunlar','Everyone has different expectations of summer. And Comedy Kitchen: Holiday Recipes has a place for them all.','/zbOJD4N5kK6TkKRbghFvkG5e4xX.jpg','2010-03-26',134,'Released',NULL,'Çok Filim Hareketler Bunlar',46733,1.519,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29664,_binary '\0','/dMfOF7qcJ3ZO1SHIaEQnPNq2lel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640218',5,5833,'en','Evidence','Ryan is making a documentary on his friend, Brett, about camping for the first time. However, once they begin camping, they discover that there is a mysterious figure that is hunting them.','/4bloj9VOXaZwoDqkdse5aq5pVZn.jpg','2011-02-28',78,'Released',NULL,'Evidence',92395,1.9443,5,'OE5M_CLkCn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29665,_binary '\0','/nPwdXxCnsG12TB3dyC0ly7rJaDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16404416',7.2,1246,'te','మా ఊరి పొలిమేర‌','In a village plagued by black magic, a policeman sets off to seek justice for his brother\'s meaningless murder but discovers something unexpected.','/zwavTmcoZ8wim3uUz5hZvH9hCH6.jpg','2021-12-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Maa Oori Polimera',913761,1.0966,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29666,_binary '\0','/7ugJdVksDA4oYCxZY6tHhsG2NyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640459',6.1,50879,'en','Hobo with a Shotgun','A vigilante homeless man pulls into a new city and finds himself trapped in urban chaos, a city where crime rules and where the city\'s crime boss reigns. Seeing an urban landscape filled with armed robbers, corrupt cops, abused prostitutes and even a pedophile Santa, the Hobo goes about bringing justice to the city the best way he knows how - with a 20-gauge shotgun. Mayhem ensues when he tries to make things better for the future generation. Street justice will indeed prevail.','/xxMaO7VoN2BnZit79PedVHnTjcO.jpg','2011-05-06',86,'Released','Delivering justice, one shell at a time...','Hobo with a Shotgun',49010,4.1909,5.9,'ssHEAOrAdCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29667,_binary '\0','/zOgzt8tLL2qhvIztiNP92S7YD0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640484',5.7,12228,'en','Jumping the Broom','Two very different families converge on Martha\'s Vineyard one weekend for a wedding.','/60OXQUsWfAdSimqwAAJ5EvBxTre.jpg','2011-05-06',112,'Released','Sometimes the only way to get past family drama... is to jump right over it.','Jumping the Broom',57119,3.9535,5.9,'QsfB725SZuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29668,_binary '\0','/67wmtCS5Zhfv8rW8ypjQcGs8Bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640486',4.5,1995,'en','Inside Out','For the last thirteen years AJ has been behind bars, convicted of manslaughter for killing a man who intended to kill his best friend, Jack. Now released, AJ wants nothing more than to start a small business and live a crime-free life. Unfortunately, within hours of leaving prison, his oldest and best friend, Jack involves AJ in an accidental shooting in which a man is killed, forcing Jack to skip town.','/gVcMbZjXFGi1R3HL8efpkRgz7Zb.jpg','2011-09-27',93,'Released','Sometimes your best friend is your worst enemy.','Inside Out',70877,1.9391,4.6,'meum6sJL0GE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29669,_binary '\0','/beEjNV725OEZ7JZQxNN1eZ0Wyt3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640548',5.8,26254,'en','Rampart','The story follows veteran police officer Dave Brown, the last of the renegade cops, as he struggles to take care of his family, and fights for his own survival.','/wUlYwDmkytszsDvyIPn66pdqgZe.jpg','2011-11-23',108,'Released','The most corrupt cop you\'ve ever seen on screen','Rampart',75622,4.1064,5.494,'mO-Tvjk97Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29670,_binary '\0','/eje6RaOBEPlPuiuX4TDwug8XXDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640680',7.4,10490,'da','Armadillo','Danish soldiers are sent to Afghanistan in 2009 for 6 months, to help stabilize the country against the Taliban. They\'re stationed on Armadillo military base in Helman province. Unlike other war movies, this is the real deal – no actors.','/aezjTpjt0sdQV9X8XiSH2oHWEt7.jpg','2010-05-27',105,'Released','For you it\'s a movie. For them it\'s reality.','Armadillo',37828,2.0353,7,'0DDuRraJbOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29671,_binary '\0','/udq3vR6jqIT8U6lw4zmEMnfFSyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640711',5.7,13987,'en','A Few Best Men','A groom and his three best men travel to the Australian outback for a wedding.','/4GUeDoAykxWNOLe5yah7AQQa6c9.jpg','2012-01-05',96,'Released','You are cordially invited to absolute mayhem','A Few Best Men',85435,4.2118,5.7,'xSzCVYD7C4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29672,_binary '\0','/w5kcKQi7tfIk9r6sSt8njc9CFoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1640718',7.1,5382,'en','Kahlil Gibran\'s The Prophet','Exiled artist and poet Mustafa embarks on a journey home with his housekeeper and her daughter; together the trio must evade the authorities who fear that the truth in Mustafa\'s words will incite rebellion.','/rkg2thsR4r4H02FVVW1M1FyqhpL.jpg','2014-09-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Kahlil Gibran\'s The Prophet',283161,3.6106,7.4,'lwQbMxDcRGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29673,_binary '\0','/8eKVi3AXZVlipE5uJiT2zXgm2G9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16409868',6.4,1530,'en','High Tide','Lourenço decides to leave his homophobic family and country behind to get lost in the queer mecca of Provincetown, until the intense and unexpected romance with Maurice, who also feels lost in today\'s America, changes his life forever.','/3MuCGghA4mZVSN3zfKAKaWQFcPw.jpg','2024-10-18',105,'Released',NULL,'High Tide',1036641,2.849,6.1,'pGC8hwKMmwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29674,_binary '\0','/xTLSA6areOJIf4dDNdhjOjiz68V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16410984',5.9,1258,'ru','Одна','On August 24, 1981, the newlyweds Larisa and Vladimir Savitsky stepped on board the plane following the flight Komsomolsk-on-Amur - Blagoveshchensk. 30 minutes before landing, the civilian aircraft AN-24 collided with another aircraft and broke into pieces at an altitude of more than 5 kilometers above the ground. No one was supposed to survive ... but a miracle happened. Larisa Savitskaya woke up in the middle of the wreckage of the plane in the impenetrable taiga. Now she herself had to create a real miracle, which only a strong-minded person is capable of.','/2jtHkKhkA4kioi4km8uPql5G7WH.jpg','2022-06-09',108,'Released',NULL,'The One',610363,2.9361,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29675,_binary '\0','/uiW42lmewHmbtgnjVmMyABNdoAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641385',5.7,3458,'en','96 Minutes','The story of 4 lives slammed together in a shocking moment. Intercutting between a carjacking and the separate stories of the 4 kids, we watch as they hurtle toward a life-changing end.','/39FwN8IVp8y46KJ6VjA8oFY8e1o.jpg','2011-10-14',93,'Released','Out of options. Out of control. Out of time.','96 Minutes',89326,1.9333,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29676,_binary '\0','/wRsvZIZkrsPV7Whpxi4YdiShARh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641401',6,1234,'en','Louder Than Words','After the unexpected death of their daughter, a couple work to build a state of the art children\'s hospital where families are welcomed into the healing process.','/4QnhE9ltWLYnAEdb3o3z00SH16T.jpg','2013-10-11',95,'Released','Love will build what\'s ahead.','Louder Than Words',254918,2.1446,5.7,'IhOnMVQ4-Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29677,_binary '\0','/kSb1jLf8LI6BXUC3McZxPgXxyvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641410',6.7,3307,'it','Terraferma','A Sicilian family deals with the arrival of a group of immigrants on their island.','/z1J6pfxzkxhyQSHdtHWS4WgIPj.jpg','2011-09-07',88,'Released',NULL,'Terraferma',73872,1.2889,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29678,_binary '\0','/1pz3SskOp7i1JHGosUBmrrB57LN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641624',5.8,2491,'fr','Ma part du gâteau','France, a factory worker, lives with her three daughters in Dunkirk. The factory where she worked has been closed, leaving France and all of her workmates without a job. She decides to go to Paris to look for work. There she finds a cleaning job at the home of a rich man, Steve, whose world is radically different from her own. As their paths keep crossing, she discovers that her employer played a part in closing the factory in Dunkirk...','/xWaG5iXaYpl8MmSvMVYhuiAinMt.jpg','2011-03-16',109,'Released',NULL,'My Piece of the Pie',58043,2.0154,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29679,_binary '\0','/4jCHr55RGHQlXzcDYwJ70b0mYj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641638',7,33350,'cn','葉問前傳','The remarkable true story of the early life of Ip Man, the formidable kung fu genius who would become Bruce Lee\'s mentor; beginning at the start of his journey from his initial training through to the ultimate battle to become supreme master of the art of Wing Chun.','/ekJxJ037GWBrqIR8FX7Kh7daaR9.jpg','2010-06-24',100,'Released',NULL,'The Legend Is Born: Ip Man',44249,0.6881,6.9,'2-sb3jqVrpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29680,_binary '\0','/glDAEXQK9gcCncMlDTlHjbyODud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641831',4,1870,'en','Doomsday Prophecy','With the government agents on their trail, journalist Eric Fox and archaeologist Brook Calvin race against time to save the world after they find an artefact that predicts an impending doomsday.','/cJ0q94RFbj0l1odJidX4FDW6RPT.jpg','2011-08-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Doomsday Prophecy',72174,2.6196,4.1,'5kz_ud9ZW3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29681,_binary '\0','/y6C5I2qSvkwTmgBgSEIzpw4BtFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641841',5.6,9037,'en','Skin Trade','After his family is killed by a Serbian gangster with international interests. NYC detective Nick goes to S.E. Asia and teams up with a Thai detective to get revenge and destroy the syndicates human trafficking network.','/dfXB4ZKQRINdrY3xXMyLUJrXQai.jpg','2014-11-07',96,'Released','Two Cops. One Mission. No Mercy.','Skin Trade',327833,3.088,6.1,'mFJOfTk_gAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29682,_binary '\0','/aT3sRVqgpkyCo23fp9myVfKPWbA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16419074',7.4,198901,'en','Air','Discover the game-changing partnership between a then undiscovered Michael Jordan and Nike\'s fledgling basketball division which revolutionized the world of sports and culture with the Air Jordan brand.','/76AKQPdH3M8cvsFR9K8JsOzVlY5.jpg','2023-04-05',112,'Released','Some icons are meant to fly.','Air',964980,10.6853,7.3,'Euy4Yu6B3nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29683,_binary '\0','/qzpjvSQ1qADIf9mIICHNKt2W00D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1641975',5.5,7580,'en','Citadel','Chronically agoraphobic since the day his wife was murdered, Tommy Cowley finds himself terrorized by a gang of syringe-wielding feral children, who are intent on taking his baby daughter. Upon discovering the nightmarish truth surrounding these hooded children, he learns that to be free of his fears, he must finally face the demons of his past and enter the one place he fears the most - the abandoned tower block, known as the Citadel.','/2NBxSwARcPi4wwpLH1wyFWKXeJo.jpg','2012-03-11',85,'Released','They see your fear!','Citadel',52001,1.9522,5.4,'GVXT_D2nGpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29684,_binary '\0','/nze990j4KZAeeF5xp6QR5I7Idz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1642252',4.4,1551,'ja','巨乳ドラゴン 温泉ゾンビVSストリッパー5','A medieval Book of the Dead is discovered in the catacombs that run under a small town strip club. When one of the desperate strippers raises an army of the undead, the rest of the strippers must kick some zombie ass to save the world.','/vH7wcATCXFTO6OgE6oKZ9rc4SWg.jpg','2010-05-15',73,'Released','A bloody Armageddon has begun!','Big Tits Zombie',47519,2.3762,5.1,'RhKQHFIxZ2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29685,_binary '\0','/rkmjKERkVIqG3DhwY4mcRYH1RFf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16424988',5.9,4493,'en','Your Lucky Day','After a dispute over a winning lottery ticket turns into a deadly hostage situation, the witnesses must decide exactly how far they’ll go—and how much blood they’re willing to spill—for a cut of the $156 million.','/id7CoASydYb7MCRLAsOT29CLJik.jpg','2023-11-10',89,'Released','Cashing in will cost you.','Your Lucky Day',923993,3.4279,6,'2xMsdJvY0gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29686,_binary '\0','/jxhjb4TnIXtXHLgD9fg7erNXPCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16425284',7.1,6821,'it','Mixed by Erry','The rise and fall of the pirate mixtape empire of three brothers from Naples, Italy, during the \'80s.','/tCTqW2YLxx6gqrPFTlMswvDunuQ.jpg','2023-03-02',113,'Released',NULL,'Mixed by Erry',921785,1.8713,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29687,_binary '\0','/ipYOu4n0tg2ORrM621eJ80lkR3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16426066',4.8,1478,'en','Scare Package II: Rad Chad’s Revenge','Following the events of the original with the survivors attending the funeral of “Rad Chad” Buckley, which quickly devolves into an elaborate series of death traps centered around Chad’s favorite films, forcing the guests to band together and use the rules of horror to survive the bloody game.','/aQLCI3GOvb55Th7rzes38nXoBdb.jpg','2022-12-22',99,'Released','The call is coming from inside the movie.','Scare Package II: Rad Chad’s Revenge',915968,1.903,5.7,'7vl8-gXjGdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29688,_binary '\0','/sQgir8HSA3m7ku6xVlvd6mcRcKv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1642627',7.3,1578,'en','Louis Theroux: America\'s Medicated Kids','Faced with the challenging behaviour of their kids, more and more parents in America are turning to psychoactive medication to help them cope, even though the drugs, and sometimes the diagnoses, remain controversial. Louis travels to one of America\'s leading children\'s psychiatric treatment centres, in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, to get to know the diagnosed children and hoping to understand what drives parents to put their kids on drugs.','/ym9ZthTSfmYoqc3nav0sBAuR4sI.jpg','2010-04-18',59,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: America\'s Medicated Kids',68213,1.2259,6.9,'WKJ09Akn0os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29689,_binary '\0','/tq8COKsI99Bivjd4CZIYVGoKcIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16426418',7,184513,'en','Challengers','Tennis player turned coach Tashi has taken her husband, Art, and transformed him into a world-famous Major champion. To jolt him out of his recent losing streak, she signs him up for a \"Challenger\" event — close to the lowest level of pro tournament — where he finds himself standing across the net from his former best friend and Tashi\'s former boyfriend.','/H6vke7zGiuLsz4v4RPeReb9rsv.jpg','2024-04-18',132,'Released','Her game. Her rules.','Challengers',937287,20.015,6.913,'-2N3hmRmwHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29690,_binary '\0','/i91YI9y3GS68rLNy6eKrH2NEzln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16426570',6.1,2519,'en','Barron\'s Cove','When his young son is viciously murdered by a classmate, a grieving father with a history of violence kidnaps the child responsible, igniting a frenzied manhunt fueled by a powerful politician -- the father of the kidnapped boy.','/wo8qFjc2FLJdGg8FmnZeTxVBf7D.jpg','2025-06-06',116,'Released','Revenge is a deadly place.','Barron\'s Cove',1128546,4.2001,7.243,'_CJ-f5GW9Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29691,_binary '\0','/c5mE8GRrT2qs2uwKgLvAx77AvBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1642665',5.2,3262,'en','Urban Explorer','Anxious to explore the mysterious hidden world under metropolitan Berlin, an international group of four urban explorers hires a local guide, Kris, who leads them into the maze of escape tunnels and subterranean fortifications under the city. When their guide has a bad fall, two of the girls in the group frantically set off to seek help while Denis, the young American, stays behind. Armin, a former East German border guard suddenly appears from nowhere. Out of sheer desperation, Denis allows Armin to lead them and their unconscious guide to safety and it is at this moment that Denis realizes he has just made the biggest mistake of his life!','/mywIDBRM7nsd34IdYTPU9siwEB9.jpg','2011-09-08',94,'Released',NULL,'Urban Explorer',73290,1.767,5.1,'y6OPe_rUdgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29692,_binary '\0','/yQ47vUuYiVOWsrwI3XaA2QHUhBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16427398',4.4,1569,'en','Dark Nature','While recovering from an abusive relationship, Joy joins her friend\'s therapy group on an isolated mountainous retreat. Led by a doctor with experimental methods, the group is soon forced to confront a monstrous entity.','/n77eq3pzs8sVzWUFgcreggohNZ5.jpg','2023-05-19',85,'Released',NULL,'Dark Nature',994138,2.6078,5.4,'0k3vQenlXG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29693,_binary '\0','/1yetepKgJ0HZvrjDzd0nQWFQCWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16427718',5.6,4571,'es','Granizo','A famous TV weatherman, Miguel Flores, becomes public enemy number one when he fails to predict a terrible hailstorm. He is forced out of the big city, Buenos Aires, fleeing the capital for his birthplace of Córdoba. The result will be a voyage of rediscovery that is as absurd as it is human.','/9zVyqx5WKb0iCkk46wDUxuwAiMR.jpg','2022-03-30',118,'Released',NULL,'All Hail',682344,2.0535,6.413,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29694,_binary '\0','/k9X79JC2dDTcSpxuKJ3p2Teq3oZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16427902',4.3,1902,'pt','Biônicos','When the progress of robotics makes Paralympic athletes the new sports stars, Maria dreams of competing against her sister. For that, she will have to enter a world of crime and violence.','/xVCYzdBE6lo3sUFK1OMZnXvpGtT.jpg','2024-05-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Bionic',1025463,3.0424,5.9,'RTeuhVG7LXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29695,_binary '\0','/4tdV5AeojEdbvn6VpeQrbuDlmzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16428256',7.6,65886,'ja','すずめの戸締まり','Suzume, 17, lost her mother as a little girl. On her way to school, she meets a mysterious young man. But her curiosity unleashes a calamity that endangers the entire population of Japan, and so Suzume embarks on a journey to set things right.','/yStW1TXF5s7Tbtu9KjIZEaWl6HL.jpg','2022-11-11',122,'Released','On the other side of the door, was time in its entirety.','Suzume',916224,13.9217,7.9,'9UuwS0mTBNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29696,_binary '\0','/riLVTzlpOAYhMF9nOMANL6BiEN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16431330',7.3,8793,'en','A Nice Indian Boy','When Naveen brings his fiancé Jay home to meet his traditional Indian family, they must contend with accepting his white-orphan-artist boyfriend and helping them plan the Indian wedding of their dreams.','/xfY2FZlnm5uaQbaWR9IYW41J1xG.jpg','2025-04-04',96,'Released','First comes love. Then comes chaos.','A Nice Indian Boy',1128614,4.8051,7.273,'wkbyxebDrjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29697,_binary '\0','/9nzfyiYbmTUXWC4B2kwjl4NAlqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16431404',6.1,109451,'en','Apex','A grieving woman pushing her limits on a solo adventure in the Australian wild is ensnared in a twisted game with a cunning killer who thinks she\'s prey.','/eTp7gSPkSF3Aw79mNx1NkBP1PZT.jpg','2026-04-24',96,'Released','Hunt. Survive.','Apex',1318447,30.76,6.896,'kgv8jf_8dm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29698,_binary '\0','/arNhhBd88bP3Bjoe4HT8MFE1JQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16431870',6.3,66454,'en','The Family Plan','Dan Morgan is many things: a devoted husband, a loving father, a celebrated car salesman. He\'s also a former assassin. And when his past catches up to his present, he\'s forced to take his unsuspecting family on a road trip unlike any other.','/jLLtx3nTRSLGPAKl4RoIv1FbEBr.jpg','2023-12-14',118,'Released','A thrilling road trip comedy.','The Family Plan',1029575,17.5252,7.2,'ns8weNznn1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29699,_binary '\0','/frs3Xvh6T0wQhtbrvCKyfIJ50Kl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16431882',5.8,2920,'en','Brooklyn 45','Five military veterans, best friends since childhood, gather together in a Brooklyn brownstone several months after the end of World War II, and the metaphoric ghosts of their past become all-too-literal.','/dN8IIAvzIW3XX8aOvA9aQubK4hd.jpg','2023-03-12',93,'Released','The ghosts of your past would like to have a word with you.','Brooklyn 45',916433,1.946,5.9,'iSKuOQV1AEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29700,_binary '\0','/9umudqXenMm3kfX7hCTekIH0XWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16431966',6.6,8394,'en','Sometimes I Think About Dying','Fran likes to think about dying. It brings sensation to her quiet life. When she makes the new guy at work laugh, it leads to more: a date, a slice of pie, a conversation, a spark. The only thing standing in their way is Fran herself.','/lp0dtmNtOW88A13GZjGoKZko7S8.jpg','2024-01-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Sometimes I Think About Dying',891933,4.0493,6.8,'idtCErzXixE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29701,_binary '\0','/hYJOPAcO60cSNaWqzE815PgdsTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1643222',5.8,12779,'de','Hell','In 2016 the sun has turned the entire world into a scorched and barren wasteland. The humans who have survived are either resourceful or violent, and sometimes both. Marie, her little sister Leonie, and best friend Phillip, are in a car headed to the mountains - rumor has it there is water there. Along the way they meet Tom, a first-rate mechanic. But can they trust him? Fraught with deep distrust, the group is lured into an ambush where their real battle for survival begins.','/rJulOgsQxehjHhAdhIi9SgLLFHC.jpg','2011-09-20',89,'Released','What gave us our beginning, will lead to our end.','Hell',73262,2.2555,5.756,'3l91z_C7RhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29702,_binary '\0','/mjwt3MkRBz2dkISyeUBp8n4KFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16433236',7.4,2651,'en','The Sound of 007','Pull back the curtain on the remarkable history of six decades of James Bond music, from Sean Connery’s Dr No through to Daniel Craig’s final outing in No Time to Die.','/wHsfL0ub95Xr6GK6tJUpmVnrT1J.jpg','2022-10-04',88,'Released',NULL,'The Sound of 007',1028506,3.3985,7.3,'Tcs5icPCTnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29703,_binary '\0','/dJXpid2Nh5KbaPNaAP8ZDEt2Chs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16433744',6.5,1253,'en','Beanie Mania','An eye-opening deep-dive into the world of Beanie Babies, charting the origins of a frenzy that helped make Ty Warner’s plush toys the biggest fad of the 1990s.','/rCJq1GMW1UVk7HYu03Vbv2hY89y.jpg','2021-12-23',80,'Released','What is the price of obsession?','Beanie Mania',916613,0.9607,6.6,'e5ckOjR814s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29704,_binary '\0','/v3Vk2hIvQ6jYnFp0H4WbGKWKA3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16436848',4.6,1659,'hi','छोरी 2','Sakshi must rescue her seven year old daughter from being sacrificed by an evil cult to satisfy their resident leader, while fighting societal superstitions and the horror that continues to haunt her and young women around her.','/mCgKANxZJW645pXdmJdBb4ysRPk.jpg','2025-04-11',133,'Released',NULL,'Chhorii 2',1084031,1.2362,4.929,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29705,_binary '\0','/cKqk1m6n2lPHZMHNSVYhrnRCiux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16437278',4.9,13690,'en','The Strays','A Black woman\'s meticulously crafted life of privilege starts to unravel when two strangers show up in her quaint suburban town.','/3OKBFYRVSKkBVJ7WpKogTVQfUqC.jpg','2023-02-17',100,'Released',NULL,'The Strays',1063422,4.686,5.5,'o9_UteTT9wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29706,_binary '\0','/ljXjWZJBiJSIkPDC1JSzc60TLsM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16442822',6.6,1477,'en','Love to Love You, Donna Summer','The extraordinary story of disco queen Donna Summer through a rich archive of unpublished film excerpts, home video, photographs, artwork, writings, personal audio and other recordings that span the life of one of the most iconic performers ever to shake a room to its timbers. From her early career with Giorgio Moroder in Germany, to later years more focused on spirituality and family life as a shelter from troubles associated with both notoriety and intimate wounds, her story is all the more special for being told in the first person – both singular and plural.','/9vEx3khgj8I2saMfny2hlFXw6uD.jpg','2023-02-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Love to Love You, Donna Summer',1055378,1.9918,7.095,'xQXInltKe8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29707,_binary '\0','/4uij4drUitClyXihCyQJSklXvvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16444750',7.1,2626,'ja','余命10年','Twenty-year-old Matsuri Takabayashi learns that she only has ten years to live due to an incurable disease. She decides to not dwell on her life and not to fall in love—until she meets a man named Kazuto Manabe at a school reunion.','/3TTSYnXJyDXEadiG1BMangdq3XV.jpg','2022-03-04',124,'Released','Inspired by her true story.','The Last 10 Years',876797,5.7416,7.217,'GyMXxOdHF7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29708,_binary '\0','/yT49Yx7YpzzIlAYp4QpKDNR504Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16446556',3.9,3032,'te','నేనెవరు','Krish and Chitra are in love. After Chitra goes missing, Krish starts killing people. But one day Akshara befriends him and get to know more about his life. What will happen when Akshara is revealed to be an undercover cop?','/naHuG2imzNF7LPaocb6EBrazB6S.jpg','2022-12-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Nenevaru',1046100,0.715,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29709,_binary '\0','/aOBIon675l54MET558A3m6xj6yY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645080',6.5,62475,'en','The Art of Getting By','George, a lonely and fatalistic teen who\'s made it all the way to his senior year without ever having done a real day of work, is befriended by Sally, a popular but complicated girl who recognizes in him a kindred spirit.','/3ahdKyzHbYhvqJdtpsEWipEai98.jpg','2011-06-17',83,'Released','The toughest lesson is love.','The Art of Getting By',64678,5.4846,6.6,'oJZeU7PuytA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29710,_binary '\0','/1yFmxvVYgVrFKL2ksFzgX0MrWOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645089',8.2,82895,'en','Inside Job','A film that exposes the shocking truth behind the economic crisis of 2008. The global financial meltdown, at a cost of over $20 trillion, resulted in millions of people losing their homes and jobs. Through extensive research and interviews with major financial insiders, politicians and journalists, Inside Job traces the rise of a rogue industry and unveils the corrosive relationships which have corrupted politics, regulation and academia.','/7yXXIWec24htucjsZS1sDuPLqw8.jpg','2010-10-08',109,'Released','The film that cost over $20,000,000,000,000 to make.','Inside Job',44639,5.3465,7.7,'FzrBurlJUNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29711,_binary '\0','/k8fNdW9NwNPlAdwYDMlufGwQzna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645131',5.8,13419,'en','Romeo & Juliet','In Verona, bad blood between the Montague and Capulet families leads to much bitterness. Despite the hostility, Romeo Montague manages an invitation to a masked ball at the estate of the Capulets and meets Juliet, their daughter. The two are instantly smitten but dismayed to learn that their families are enemies. Romeo and Juliet figure out a way to pursue their romance, but Romeo is banished for his part in the slaying of Juliet\'s cousin, Tybalt.','/9FZ3wTjY9rUvIoobJFv8ozoTwTT.jpg','2013-09-12',118,'Released','The most dangerous love story ever told.','Romeo & Juliet',91745,5.1501,6.7,'Y_mdm6SafPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29712,_binary '\0','/cOEd8b4lBqVIriNTMuhEi3nelZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645155',6,34565,'en','Erased','A former agent of the CIA and his estranged daughter go on the run after his employers target them for assassination.','/42OvgvP795xTfVINk48PAYWEFt7.jpg','2012-08-23',100,'Released','Far from home. Far from safe. Far from over.','Erased',106021,4.6251,6.1,'vknG01yvT9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29713,_binary '\0','/jWq20KNbg5txb28tLxJl0yLYuxp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645170',6.5,372882,'en','The Dictator','The heroic story of a dictator who risks his life to ensure that democracy would never come to the country he so lovingly oppressed.','/n0W7kajF4GFMRk2c0wWwMQqTaDM.jpg','2012-05-15',83,'Released','Make way for Aladeen.','The Dictator',76493,20.4997,6.247,'cYplvwBvGA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29714,_binary '\0','/i9BtOklh2txI78wNSTNjoAZ6Fvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16452664',5.3,1503,'es','Padre no hay más que uno 3','Christmas is coming. The children accidentally break a Nativity scene figurine from their father\'s collection and must by all means get an equal one, the problem is that it is a unique antique piece. Sara, the eldest daughter breaks up with her boyfriend, Ocho, who will try to recover her favors with the help of her father-in-law, Javier. Precisely Javier\'s father-in-law, Marisa\'s father, will be welcomed into the family home to spend the holidays after her recent separation, which will not leave Javier\'s mother, Milagros, indifferent. Rocío, the folklore of the family, who has been playing the Virgin for several Christmases, is relegated this year to playing the shepherdess, something that her father, Javier, is not willing to assume.','/k2v9xSPtiyxCNxaRGtj7COwdgG3.jpg','2022-07-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Padre no hay más que uno 3',975120,1.9626,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29715,_binary '\0','/xJq12neztP7mfDNorwkJGSMbIB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16453244',6.1,3313,'pl','Jak pokochałam gangstera','A mysterious woman recounts the rise and fall of Nikodem \"Nikoś\" Skotarczak, one of the biggest gangsters in Poland\'s history. Inspired by a true story.','/9RnGB9eX6zEF4GDfYTvWHznyBUZ.jpg','2022-01-05',185,'Released',NULL,'How I Fell in Love with a Gangster',809972,3.0482,6.639,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29716,_binary '\0','/A3sUt0LwEZYW15Xc75wqFtBiXda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1645916',5.8,1737,'en','Standby','Twenty-something Alan (Gleeson) is down on his luck. Stood up at the altar and recently fired from his banking job, he finds himself working with his mother as a part-time tourist advisor at Dublin Airport. It\'s there he comes face to face with first love Alice (Paré), stuck on standby for a flight home to New York. Their summer romance ended eight years previously with Alan promising to return to the US one day. He never did, and they haven\'t spoken since. Seizing his chance, Alan convinces a reluctant Alice to stay one more night in Dublin. Over the course of an unforgettable evening, they may just realise that they are more compatible than ever. But time is running out on this brief encounter. When does an unexpected second chance, become the one you\'ve always been looking for? - Written by Wildcard Distribution','/sCtH2uita7BGP9ohGt7yNmbAz8r.jpg','2014-11-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Standby',301225,1.3334,6.1,'VzwVJ-t4ZkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29717,_binary '\0','/oTqN90fv92jSfvQIxTnAvPgcd19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646111',7.1,1563,'en','Life, Above All','A touching mother-daughter relationship that reflects the modern South Africa.','/tFnlS2xevN5uY171wYuCvjJBKMA.jpg','2010-12-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Life, Above All',45244,1.1338,6.5,'mTWZrLK2TME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29718,_binary '\0','/ql0WYYO9zpxVAd6OzLzCOMlfnVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646114',6.8,2769,'ru','Счастье моё','Georgy is driving a load of freight into Russia when, after an unpleasant encounter with the police at a border crossing, he finds himself giving a lift to a strange old man with disturbing stories about his younger days in the Army. After next picking up a young woman who works as a prostitute and is wary of the territory, Georgy finds himself lost, and despite asking some homeless men for help, he’s less sure than he was before of how to make his way back where he belongs. As brutal images of violence and alienation cross the screen, Georgy’s odyssey becomes darker and more desperate until it reaches an unexpected conclusion.','/ek1lclrmb1qH3xcL7kC8ue8mncu.jpg','2010-09-30',128,'Released',NULL,'My Joy',60981,1.219,6.288,'C45v9ffd3OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29719,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646127',6.4,1225,'fr','Simon Werner a disparu','March 1992, in a small town in the suburbs of Paris. During an alcohol fueled party, teenagers discover a body hidden in the bushes of a forest. A body that seems lifeless. Two weeks earlier. Simon, a 16 year-old teenager, has not shown up for class. Blood stains are found in a class-room. Run-away, kidnap, suicide, murder? A few days later, Laetitia, a student from the same class goes missing without her parents knowing where she has gone. A young girl with no dark background or connection to Simon. The next day, Jean-Baptiste, a third student, also disappears. Rumors start to spread. The psychosis begins...','/nUZGt8VAtYzGxsIveM43uQQsZNs.jpg','2010-10-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Lights Out',59015,1.4452,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29720,_binary '\0','/r7Ph2dFHq0UZhorYJ1DYYimVBlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16464084',6.7,1781,'en','Stay the Night','A failed work opportunity prompts chronically single Grace to pursue a one night stand with a stranger. Turns out he\'s an on-the-outs professional athlete in town with a problem of his own. Maybe they can help each other.','/8z9cGlYlbn7ASsHJJMRx8hh6Sv2.jpg','2022-10-07',94,'Released',NULL,'Stay the Night',934198,1.5308,6.9,'mcRl8Ws7QcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29721,_binary '\0','/53gLUhvVffVXSXOPAuXPeHkqEe9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646876',5.5,18290,'en','16 Wishes','The story about Abby Jensen, a girl who\'s been eager to reach her 16th birthday and has kept a secret wish list since she was a little girl. When the Big Day actually arrives, utter disaster strikes, leaving Abby to think her birthday is ruined. But when a mysterious box of magical birthday candles arrives to turn things around, Abby\'s 16 Wishes start to come true. Her day gets better and better...until she makes one wish that threatens to change everything.','/tO8TZvH83uHtrLnec6f684xfzOB.jpg','2010-10-02',90,'Released','Everyone\'s sweet 16 is special, Abby\'s is magical.','16 Wishes',40205,5.1307,6.3,'sYB7zfkOd7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29722,_binary '\0','/jDO0O3mowmz5tl7S2MGGxJGn71R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646926',5,15275,'en','Open Season 3','Boog, Elliot, and their forest friends return with an all-new adventure, this time in a Big Top Circus! The comedy begins when Boog\'s pals choose their family obligations over the annual guy\'s trip, and a disappointed Boog decides to take a trip of his own, which leads him right into the middle of a circus ring...literally. When he switches places with a devious look-a-like circus grizzly and falls for an alluring Russian troupe member, he\'ll come to realize that maybe you don\'t have to choose between family and friendship after all.','/qEr9fkGLQUWcAnVfDV46L79bdFs.jpg','2010-10-21',75,'Released','Boog and Elliot are Back and the Fur is Going to Fly!','Open Season 3',51170,7.8599,5.7,'2-ELvMF_-ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29723,_binary '\0','/bMj2VvmClzNswmwr7M7t7Ejz48I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646958',7.5,1723,'ro','Autobiografia lui Nicolae Ceaușescu','The three-hour-long documentary covers 25 years in the life of Nicolae Ceaușescu and was made using 1,000 hours of original footage from the National Archives of Romania.','/fhBcXMx346RpsDdkoH3i7m3NpLe.jpg','2010-10-29',180,'Released',NULL,'The Autobiography of Nicolae Ceausescu',67404,1.2946,7.7,'grdV_2l7R2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29724,_binary '\0','/5cnEvJ7W0lfR8auMXoSLxZOnEX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646959',7.2,19845,'ko','김복남 살인사건의 전말','A disillusioned Seoul woman visits a remote island to reconnect with a childhood friend, only to find her trapped in an oppressive cycle of physical, mental, and sexual abuse. As tensions escalate, the situation spirals into a harrowing tale of survival and retribution.','/uqvG28xhk34ExPZYu2wRGmKB34h.jpg','2010-08-19',117,'Released','Nothing is more deadly than a woman seeking revenge.','Bedevilled',59421,4.3284,7.219,'Bj6SCYSYwcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29725,_binary '\0','/29pZOJSY5KXwDOeQxHkR4dQXIyB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646967',8.2,8273,'en','The Art of Flight','Iconic snowboarder Travis Rice and friends redefine what is possible in the mountains. Experience the highs, as new tricks are landed and new zones opened, alongside the lows, where avalanches, accidents, and wrong-turns strike.','/q5k4edlPT6TeBnYzicIQSbprQIC.jpg','2011-09-08',80,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Flight',68450,1.7301,7.8,'kh29_SERH0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29726,_binary '\0','/8AAuJtCzaibYkbE0QVHc8EBsELB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646971',7.8,407209,'en','How to Train Your Dragon 2','Five years after uniting the dragons and Vikings of Berk, Hiccup and Toothless soar beyond their homeland, charting the vast unknown. During one of their adventures, the pair discover a secret cave that houses hundreds of wild dragons—and a mysterious dragon rider with a startling connection to Hiccup. And as the ruthless conqueror Drago Bludvist rises to seize control of both dragons and people alike, Hiccup must step into his role as a true leader and, alongside his friends and Toothless, protect Berk from a devastating war.','/d13Uj86LdbDLrfDoHR5aDOFYyJC.jpg','2014-06-05',102,'Released','Training is over. The adventure begins.','How to Train Your Dragon 2',82702,24.7699,7.685,'1Y0erVF9cLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29727,_binary '\0','/qRYiSL8Awc06m8DMCLVmRETfdu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646973',5.3,8245,'es','La casa muda','Laura and her father Wilson arrive at a cottage off the beaten path in order to repair it since its owner will soon put the house on sale. They will spend the night there in order to start the repairs the following morning. Everything seems to go on smoothly until Laura hears a sound that comes from outside and gets louder and louder in the upper floor of the house. Wilson goes up to see what is going on while she remains downstairs on her own waiting for her father to come down. The plot is based on a true story that occurred in the 1940s in a small village in Uruguay. La casa muda focuses on the last seventy eight minutes, second by second, as Laura tries to leave the house unharmed and discovers the dark secret it hides.','/lVl4kAIVswaPR2mmgUMQ1seYoj9.jpg','2010-08-25',79,'Released','Real Fear In Real Time','The Silent House',56180,1.3685,5.4,'Rc8WnSu2w9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29728,_binary '\0','/xZdIykZigrLEwD7ILa4mvII4VcD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646974',7.1,8519,'fr','Le Nom des gens','Bahia Benmahmoud, a free-spirited young woman, has a particular way of seeing political engagement, as she doesn\'t hesitate to sleep with those who don\'t agree with her to convert them to her cause - which is a lot of people, as all right-leaning people are concerned. Generally, it works pretty well. Until the day she meets Arthur Martin, a discreet forty-something who doesn\'t like taking risks. She imagines that with a name like that, he\'s got to be slightly fascist. But names are deceitful and appearances deceiving.','/qnUyni6Cc5bQbgyvvof6yNwoIUd.jpg','2010-11-24',100,'Released','Make love, not war','The Names of Love',50848,2.3154,7.2,'wFWyEzKDEu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29729,_binary '\0','/rCUI25z0DwcMVBMfZ5MOmMWazkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646975',7.2,4520,'it','Le quattro volte','An old shepherd lives his last days in a quiet medieval village perched high on the hills of Calabria, at the southernmost tip of Italy. He herds goats under skies that most villagers have deserted long ago. He is sick, and believes to find his medicine in the dust he collects on the church floor, which he drinks in his water every day.','/hCgtAYG53uRdvET4O482paUGMuK.jpg','2010-05-28',88,'Released','Human. Animal. Vegetable. Mineral.','The Four Times',57389,1.5398,7.467,'9UoYNZzC2ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29730,_binary '\0','/yBtoIr2ov4nzXJN5tuKEfyEgfdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646980',5.9,32757,'en','The Double','The mysterious murder of a US senator bearing the distinctive trademark of the legendary Soviet assassin \'Cassius\', forces retired CIA operative, Paul Shepherson to team with rookie FBI agent, Ben Geary to solve the crime. Having spent his career chasing Cassius, Shepherdson is convinced his nemesis is long dead, but is pushed to take on the case by his former supervisor, Tom Highland. Geary, who wrote his Master\'s thesis on Shepherdson\'s pursuit of the Soviet killer, is certain that Cassius has resurfaced.','/t4W10sjJSDAWRUDn2Kb8DQKxiZv.jpg','2011-10-27',98,'Released','Keep your enemies close','The Double',73499,4.7048,5.8,'pKRKoZIjiFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29731,_binary '\0','/g6Bppew6A1PxpHfraNroo0mRBcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1646987',5.7,205052,'en','Wrath of the Titans','Perseus tries to live a quieter life as a village fisherman while – dangerously weakened by humanity\'s lack of devotion – the gods are losing control of the long-imprisoned Titans and their ferocious leader, Kronos.','/b9n2R3xZWQ8MVZgndQoV34stS0h.jpg','2012-03-28',99,'Released','Feel the Wrath.','Wrath of the Titans',57165,14.9367,5.774,'8jEWLCZA7R8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29732,_binary '\0','/u5dPVeTY7s69VbM9nxyg20H2fYV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1647483',5.8,2640,'en','Wasted on the Young','When a high school party goes dangerously off the rails, one teenager finds that revenge is just a computer click away.','/zC5OvpztrEWiRc3XyGgcdDGvc4a.jpg','2010-06-13',97,'Released','Youth is innocent. Youth is beautiful. Youth is dangerous.','Wasted on the Young',70418,1.7988,5.5,'5SyCNE7PY4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29733,_binary '\0','/7I5uDeJfST5EgU3yQHpO3ExyBQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1647668',7,49634,'en','Million Dollar Arm','In a last-ditch effort to save his career, sports agent JB Bernstein dreams up a wild game plan to find Major League Baseball’s next great pitcher from a pool of cricket players in India. He soon discovers two young men who can throw a fastball but know nothing about the game of baseball. Or America. It’s an incredible and touching journey that will change them all — especially JB, who learns valuable lessons about teamwork, commitment and family.','/6OgA9x6jvwBIj8e7x8LANTbVvR2.jpg','2014-05-09',124,'Released','Sometimes to win, you have to change the game.','Million Dollar Arm',198185,4.7064,6.722,'lEtNIoPxcq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29734,_binary '\0','/go2JaeHIxzZJiXPLibcdsUdpwTN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648093',6,4730,'zh','关云长','During the warring period of the three kingdoms, ancient China is in turmoil. To unify the country, general Cao Cao, the real power behind the Emperor, enlists the aid of the greatest warrior in the land, Guan Yu. However, Guan Yu is a loyal friend of Cao Cao\'s enemy Liu Bei so to persuade the peerless warrior to fight, Cao Cao takes his beloved Qi Lan hostage. After leading Cao Cao\'s forces to victory Guan Yu sets out with Qi Lan to rejoin Liu Bei. Now Cao Cao has deemed him too great a threat to live, and on the journey he must face all the forces at the Emperor\'s command sent to destroy him.','/7JfgKo0Ipvu9AWO9y5Y56OGxPn0.jpg','2011-04-28',107,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Bladesman',62977,2.7783,6.3,'DY82e1bNFWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29735,_binary '\0','/fkZFA9SHDijvl2tPxZRWogAJeWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648112',6.4,19386,'nl','New Kids Turbo','Five friends from \'Maaskantje\' are getting fired because of the economic crisis. They decide that they won\'t pay for anything anymore.','/5nD9368gG2b0uGLHC2vWRTN8PQu.jpg','2010-12-09',84,'Released','Kick some kut','New Kids Turbo',46523,2.3896,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29736,_binary '\0','/5WhsVxBqjy4eg6QkmVcnl11bhv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648179',6.4,100077,'en','Here Comes the Boom','A high school biology teacher moonlights as a mixed-martial arts fighter in an effort to raise money to save the school\'s music program.','/g3ZjNkQP4M7Cs0clPD9q7EO2P1g.jpg','2012-10-10',105,'Released','No one will fight for his students like Mr. Voss.','Here Comes the Boom',87826,7.5335,6.228,'M4L6ruTF5qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29737,_binary '\0','/xxjFyF0onOaH1MvTrOsuA47v74R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648186',7,13151,'en','Fisherman\'s Friends','Ten fishermen from Cornwall are signed by Universal Records and achieve a top ten hit with their debut album of Sea Shanties. Based on the true-life story of Cornish folk band, Fisherman\'s Friends.','/4faFbkPf8aH5nrY4YcNvn40PXLL.jpg','2019-03-15',112,'Released','Some Bands Can\'t Be Managed','Fisherman\'s Friends',559713,4.231,6.8,'dTFFBynGtUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29738,_binary '\0','/pVVobDO8cezhVPvwD6EBUN0g3mt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648190',5.6,157264,'en','The Dark Tower','A boy haunted by visions of a parallel world aids its disillusioned guardian in preventing the destruction of the nexus of universes known as the Dark Tower.','/i9GUSgddIqrroubiLsvvMRYyRy0.jpg','2017-08-03',95,'Released','There are other worlds than these.','The Dark Tower',353491,13.4646,5.81,'GjwfqXTebIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29739,_binary '\0','/tDJC35YmhaEJFydDYrJBTXg0ZIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648201',6.9,1698,'en','For Lovers Only','An American photographer runs into an old flame while on assignment in Paris.','/dFmgAV7jor6pVRtvdDlzFfw2Gf0.jpg','2011-07-12',88,'Released',NULL,'For Lovers Only',77910,1.1332,6.4,'v3SdjaycY-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29740,_binary '\0','/lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648204',6.9,23615,'en','Lemonade Mouth','When five ragtag freshman first meet in detention, it seems they have nothing in common. But, through music, they form an unbreakable bond and discover they have the makings of the greatest high school garage band in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.','/5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg','2011-04-15',113,'Released',NULL,'Lemonade Mouth',65218,5.4857,7.4,'Ecn8dvDK7LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29741,_binary '\0','/iMY6L1aKXJjBk05IjCkEDWw2Fj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648208',4.1,2205,'en','Riddle','Holly &amp; Nathan Teller live in a small town in Pennsylvania. Holly is on the cheerleading team and has a close relationship with her younger brother Nathan, who is subjected to bullying at school. Nathan is taken for a car ride one day by the bullies, whose intent about what they are going to do with Nathan is not clear. He gives them the slip, but disappears and is still missing after three years.','/umS2K9OvTLT7Encz4DCPeIlkVmi.jpg','2013-01-10',100,'Released','A mysterious town. A deadly secret.','Riddle',170194,1.6357,4.6,'XfanUq7K_BI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29742,_binary '\0','/2Mq10FWFbxoYgsZysWlw7T9wSNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1648216',6.7,31600,'es','Tres metros sobre el cielo','Babi, a sheltered upper-class girl, and Hache, a reckless rebel obsessed with illegal motorcycle races, fall into a forbidden love that pulls them deeper into passion and risk.','/xeWyY2s13dRlKOLk4E3TkXgM4sS.jpg','2010-12-03',122,'Released','One step to you.','Three Steps Above Heaven',61979,13.6465,7.7,'pfp-OyS9Djc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29743,_binary '\0','/7RE3dqDcafLRPj3W2q7EJ3ybIm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16491324',6.5,12347,'en','Honor Society','Honor is an ambitious high school senior whose sole focus is getting into Harvard, assuming she can first score the coveted recommendation from her guidance counselor, Mr. Calvin. Willing to do whatever it takes, Honor concocts a Machiavellian-like plan to take down her top three student competitors, until things take a turn when she unexpectedly falls for her biggest competition, Michael.','/mMCd9gWqot9MZn8Ypz95crfhkSx.jpg','2022-07-23',98,'Released','Getting to the top means taking down the competition.','Honor Society',929170,4.2799,7.381,'L4z67u7TNFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29744,_binary '\0','/gOJJjBB1aj6vqzuJLspERcwZuPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16491414',5.4,2734,'en','The Naughty Nine','Fifth-grader Andy finds himself without a present from Santa on Christmas morning. Realizing he must have landed on the “naughty list” and feeling unfairly maligned, Andy pulls together a team of eight other naughty-listers to help him execute an elaborate heist on Santa’s Village at the North Pole to get the presents they feel they deserve.','/5JoTI5Nrh2U639WfwUk0Akum7fQ.jpg','2023-11-09',83,'Released','Rebels with a claus.','The Naughty Nine',936059,5.6658,6.3,'LE4M6xQhBFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29745,_binary '\0','/ch0kqAxTI6VMgDNPWCiN0ZFCwfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16491560',5,8023,'en','A Sacrifice','American social psychologist Ben Monroe investigates a local cult connected to a disturbing event. While he immerses himself into his work, his rebellious teenage daughter, Mazzy, gets involved with a mysterious local boy, who introduces her to the city’s underground party scene. As these two worlds head towards an intersection, Mazzy finds herself in great danger and Ben will need to race against the clock to save her.','/iLDCfFMY1ZXEGHWhJzIhmWbjF74.jpg','2024-06-28',94,'Released','Purify and start again.','A Sacrifice',931628,5.5545,5.5,'I_okcXmUx2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29746,_binary '\0','/6EUCHkb3rmqy08EP07oMPZbjpZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16492636',8.4,5714,'ja','鬼滅の刃 浅草編','Tanjiro ventures to Asakusa for his second mission with the Demon Slayer Corps. A recap of Kimetsu no Yaiba episodes 6–10, with new footage and special end credits.','/t2w332ARBJxy1G65abj8C7VNjeW.jpg','2022-08-25',103,'Released',NULL,'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba - Asakusa Arc',895003,2.9124,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29747,_binary '\0','/zarxsF8exAYk58HjS1ZNxY8KkXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16492678',8.4,36913,'ja','鬼滅の刃 鼓屋敷編','Tanjiro ventures to the south-southeast where he encounters a cowardly young man named Zenitsu Agatsuma, a fellow survivor from Final Selection. His sparrow asks Tanjiro to help keep him in line. A recap o