e sister.','/rqAhYRbOjgPSVzxKYXV9t6gm5fi.jpg','2022-11-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Dear Zoe',646473,2.9657,6.5,'7Qc9odvRMZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29825,_binary '\0','/4WixdIabyjYJy8Tyw4AUPOLxAo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16578828',5.4,1405,'cs','Hranice lásky','After years together, Petr and Hana, partners in work and in life, share their unspoken erotic fantasies. What begins as an innocent conversation gradually turns into curious experimentation with a non-monogamous approach to their relationship. But sexual freedom tastes differently for each of them.','/zdwRsbVA3lVDZEHrwHstNdlKoIq.jpg','2022-11-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Borders of Love',993234,2.1669,5.7,'upoY8ku6Xew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29826,_binary '\0','/dkShjpfNMPUM91pLRCA0VGx9uke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16578868',7,1378,'en','Love\'s Portrait','Lily is a museum curator who finds a painting that looks just like her. Lily’s search for the artist leads her to Ireland, where she meets William, a charming man who helps her on her quest and may also know more about the portrait’s origins than he’s letting on.','/kbz3Opu6wVRFKt4xXBwBnjGqapE.jpg','2022-09-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Love\'s Portrait',1006307,1.149,6.7,'4Myd6-cuRQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29827,_binary '\0','/oyF8bQ40wIlwRe1Hado4GsufIlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1658797',5.4,5592,'en','Anuvahood','Kenneth (who likes to call himself Kay) begins to realise he\'s just another wannabe bad boy... even less than a loser in fact. After quitting his job at Laimsbury\'s, Kay vows to become a respected gangster... or cry trying. A pulls-no-punches, coming-of-age story, centering on one directionless hopeless \"shotter\", who finds his true worth in the face of urban adversity.','/e1u4r4pwJuba6Vasp4pMjFDBr4U.jpg','2011-03-18',88,'Released','There\'s a wasteman on every street!','Anuvahood',68419,1.5925,6.3,'PPsQBNxt-Y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29828,_binary '\0','/8FgzQadEF68NYvmTVyuY4pCtred.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1658801',6.6,13838,'en','Freeheld','New Jersey car mechanic Stacie Andree and her police detective girlfriend Laurel Hester both battle to secure Hester\'s pension benefits after she was diagnosed with a terminal illness.','/794PfYjTz3yxMRdTRmdFYt6w6ff.jpg','2015-10-02',103,'Released','A true story of love and injustice.','Freeheld',306745,5.5346,7.2,'-N-NTx46K_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29829,_binary '\0','/l0rHUQ38yZ4bhuUmi9t4MArsOkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1658820',4.8,1674,'en','Sket','When a young woman is cruelly and indiscriminately attacked by a notorious gang led by the violent Trey, her little 16 year old sister Kayla wants revenge and will stop at nothing to get it, even if it means joining a rival girl gang led by the volatile and damaged man-hating Danielle.','/kJ6kIgPbcA6rUM0mduZZu49MYbd.jpg','2011-10-28',83,'Released','Man\'s World. Sister\'s Hood.','Sket',92391,1.2655,5.1,'IA7DXYsAMTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29830,_binary '\0','/FRNnuA1XJoRi0Dk5yc5JtnLhKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1658837',5.9,45160,'en','The Tall Man','When her child goes missing, a mother looks to unravel the legend of the Tall Man, an entity who allegedly abducts children.','/iZGQsDlYcNaJf2MVopAZHs69FI4.jpg','2012-03-19',106,'Released','Fear takes a new shape','The Tall Man',86597,5.9495,6.1,'bQiZ-llvYwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29831,_binary '\0','/bCdDu23bLVzUTCykxDKEhhpj5c9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1658851',6.5,11439,'en','Toast','Young Nigel Slater has big culinary aspirations, even though all his mother knows how to make is toast. When his mother dies, relations grow strained between Nigel and his father, especially when he remarries a woman who wins his heart with a lemon meringue pie. Nigel enters culinary school, starts working in a pub, and finds himself competing with his stepmother - both in the kitchen and for his father\'s attention.','/2TSqAghgHeXA7nHXNDp0wuovj3X.jpg','2010-12-30',96,'Released','The Story of a Boy\'s Hunger','Toast',52850,3.4488,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29832,_binary '\0','/xx59OnVBIhIJY0WytusBj1ec9MS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16591746',4.2,2565,'te','గార్డ్','Sushanth, a security guard on night duty in Melbourne’s ominous Building M, falls for Sam, a compassionate doctor. Their blossoming romance turns nightmarish when Sam becomes possessed by a malevolent spirit tied to the building’s dark past. To save her and survive, Sushanth must uncover ancient secrets and confront the vengeful force.','/3oWqfB5JEcLxr2ERqamoebbMzQ7.jpg','2025-02-28',118,'Released','Revenge for Love','Guard',1520844,0.6729,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29833,_binary '\0','/9RFXPgdcWLQyBnfd7rPBsGXhUYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659216',3.4,5129,'en','Spiders','After a Soviet space station crashes into a New York City subway tunnel, a species of venomous spiders is discovered, and soon they mutate to gigantic proportions and wreak havoc on the city.','/vuF1EopyrrtRvVPsAsFBAThcWIT.jpg','2013-02-08',89,'Released','The City is Crawling','Spiders',164331,2.645,4.4,'oOZ2OtNDscA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29834,_binary '\0','/xVLbRglz8yOPT1m32rycJQNAI2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659324',4.3,1596,'en','Depravity','A group of residents begins to suspect that their strange neighbor might be hiding something dark.','/FdVaHyz80vatz25boNLneTNCrR.jpg','2024-10-11',112,'Released',NULL,'Depravity',1123282,3.1333,5.6,'ZUgNSIx9isg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29835,_binary '\0','/aM6E4DBP6588q3tEr9hz41ls80q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659337',7.9,605975,'en','The Perks of Being a Wallflower','Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, 1991. High school freshman Charlie is a wallflower, always watching life from the sidelines, until two senior students, Sam and her stepbrother Patrick, become his mentors, helping him discover the joys of friendship, music and love.','/aKCvdFFF5n80P2VdS7d8YBwbCjh.jpg','2012-09-20',103,'Released','We are infinite.','The Perks of Being a Wallflower',84892,15.4686,7.806,'QE7CGX1d6LU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29836,_binary '\0','/qUideAPA9J1LWbA6nejFZxW5yJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659338',5.6,21555,'en','The Numbers Station','When the moral values of a longtime wetwork black ops agent is tested during his last operation, he receives an unfavorable psych evaluation. Now he is given a break and a seemingly uncomplicated assignment of simply protecting the security of a young female code announcer, code resources and remote station they are assigned to. After an ambush and one phone call later, it becomes a complicated fight for their survival.','/bcpaJ2JYM2WKzzuRUAB869uMWnK.jpg','2013-04-18',90,'Released','The code has never been compromised. Until now.','The Numbers Station',77234,5.8587,5.5,'4bigClSQWNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29837,_binary '\0','/5wxjd6D6jX8XlhQRw3rUiwl4HwK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659343',5.1,22489,'en','Universal Soldier: Day of Reckoning','After his wife and daughter are murdered in a home invasion, a widower named John now finds himself up against an army of Universal Soldiers in relentless pursuit, led by a mysterious leader who promises to set UniSols free from their conditioning.','/4fMTRrkCwACBTunF3L36Rao365u.jpg','2012-10-04',114,'Released','Under their own command','Universal Soldier: Day of Reckoning',122857,7.2668,5.582,'hHp5n5jhAqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29838,_binary '\0','/bGJOjom2bvsYn0fIQu9ChKT3sB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659611',5.2,1287,'fr','Le grand partage','An unusually cold winter forces the french government to push the best housed people to accommodate some poor fellow citizens. The decree called \"Le Grand Partage\" creates some trouble among the residents of a Paris upscale apartment block.','/lSHOcTFsDHJInyweF7LcilPprp7.jpg','2015-12-23',102,'Released',NULL,'The Roommates Party',366566,1.579,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29839,_binary '\0','/fvzLL73L2WeQZ7n20sOtk3Mjv5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1659619',6.6,6611,'fr','L\'Odyssée','The aquatic adventure of the highly influential and fearlessly ambitious pioneer, innovator, filmmaker, researcher, and conservationist, Jacques-Yves Cousteau, covers roughly thirty years of an inarguably rich in achievements life.','/myZ39CT2bMX40lqkh1D64qn3fJE.jpg','2016-10-12',122,'Released',NULL,'The Odyssey',332794,3.9877,6.6,'unCIKO7-PSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29840,_binary '\0','/yvxJdoYSVIYDNMgPyDVGDmqMnTr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1660302',6.8,3316,'fr','À perdre la raison','Young and full of life, Murielle has a promising future ahead of her when she meets and falls head over heels for Mounir. A wedding soon follows, and the happy couple quickly set about preparing to make a family. However, with family come ties, and none come as tight as that between Mounir and his adoptive father. As Murielle continues to bring new life into the family, frictions between Mounir and Doctor Pinget reach boiling point. Helpless to extract her husband and children from the wealthy nest that Doctor Pinget has provided for them, Murielle is drawn into an unhealthy family dynamic. There is only one way out of this nightmare, and for Murielle all sense of reasoning begins to abandon her.','/vzIyf1V3Jjc3u5SWzTqLJr0yTKL.jpg','2012-05-30',111,'Released',NULL,'Our Children',121210,1.8031,6.8,'vukNkMtApJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29841,_binary '\0','/rVbpucPpRyFXYV73AiCOrKknNJw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1660379',6.7,8747,'fr','L\'Apollonide, souvenirs de la maison close','The dawn of the 20th century: L’Apollonide, a luxurious and traditional brothel in Paris, is living its last days. In this closed world, where some men fall in love and others become viciously harmful, the women share their secrets, their fears, their joys and their pains.','/adkiqkEOKW8nMlfF8hVcaPWTAwB.jpg','2011-09-21',126,'Released',NULL,'House of Pleasures',84427,4.5503,6.476,'xAjHNnQNVEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29842,_binary '\0','/iF9fu3kbk1DWZGwRUTDa0exWsAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16606348',7.4,2207,'zh','爱情神话','A divorced, retired painting teacher from Shanghai falls in love with a woman who is also divorced. The involvement of his ex-wife and a student of his makes the whole thing complicated.','/iqimtbcRb89faYfqify3cxs1a7y.jpg','2021-12-24',112,'Released',NULL,'B for Busy',902478,1.985,7.7,'yYBZf6YZ0yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29843,_binary '\0','/wfdHCilp8cNPK7tK4jLgdUT7703.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1660648',6.2,63686,'en','Ricky Stanicky','When three childhood best friends pull a prank gone wrong, they invent the imaginary Ricky Stanicky to get them out of trouble. Twenty years later, the trio still uses the nonexistent Ricky as a handy alibi for their immature behavior. But when their spouses and partners get suspicious and demand to finally meet the fabled Mr. Stanicky, the guilty trio decide to hire a washed-up actor and raunchy celebrity impersonator to bring him to life.','/oJQdLfrpl4CQsHAKIxd3DJqYTVq.jpg','2024-03-07',114,'Released','He\'s the best friend they never had.','Ricky Stanicky',1022690,10.3711,6.516,'WXpBN_31-Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29844,_binary '\0','/tDKtGjdfTF0c0T95ZhtveVjnRZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16606580',3.8,2052,'te','Half Stories','Lakshmi, Chinna, and Shiva are friends who work together in organized crime but when something goes wrong they turn on each other.','/Mp1nesTXG9Ie4w6E8XmxFg1kw.jpg','2022-01-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Half Stories',1234808,0.4224,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29845,_binary '\0','/H41DJiw7Q8xn6bWC75eyaavp9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16606592',6.7,12341,'fr','Le Règne animal','In a world hit by a wave of mutations transforming humans into animals, François does everything he can to save his wife. As some of the creatures disappear into a nearby forest, he and their son Émile embark on a quest that will change their lives forever.','/39AiQnXlXOjoqBSkiUpTG80rXLw.jpg','2023-10-04',127,'Released','All creatures crave freedom.','The Animal Kingdom',943134,6.9408,6.938,'nWAJXTcEEOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29846,_binary '\0','/kwePBi7uV5INLsbQGEJCAySTwxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661031',7.1,5381,'te','బృందావనం','Indu makes her boyfriend Krishna act like her friend Bhoomi\'s lover so that her family will stop searching for a groom. However, their lives takes a turn when Bhoomi falls in love with Krishna.','/8l2z3abBgXvIpQUEHLVt9sLMcCp.jpg','2010-10-14',170,'Released',NULL,'Brindavanam',56981,1.3001,6.405,'J9ZhAtJClsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29847,_binary '\0','/AlqDoPCHBqrqRNpAWkAmltIFTR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661099',5.5,7680,'en','X','A veteran call girl and a runaway prostitute witness a murder which sends them on an out-of-control roller coaster ride through the twilight zone of sex-for-sale.','/nvU6uTwSpMpitM6mnuYXb1LgxxX.jpg','2011-11-23',90,'Released','A jaded call-girl… a fledgling hooker… the night from hell.','X',73454,8.7259,6.4,'yA22XOFhRR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29848,_binary '\0','/q7vmCCmyiHnuKGMzHZlr0fD44b9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661199',6.9,206939,'en','Cinderella','When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella\'s fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.','/j91LJmcWo16CArFOoapsz84bwxb.jpg','2015-03-06',105,'Released','Midnight is just the beginning.','Cinderella',150689,18.5892,6.8,'cVwCxYiKCO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29849,_binary '\0','/wxTm7Fppm0XnpzuAmCtT0XvLpuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661236',6.6,1322,'es','La contadora de películas','María Margarita is the youngest of four siblings in a family living in a mining town in the Atacama Desert (Chile). The most special time of the week for this family is Sunday, when they all go to the movies to enjoy stories that let them escape their everyday lives by transporting them to other worlds. The girl’s parents soon realise that the little girl has a very special gift: an almost uncanny ability to recount movies. The girl’s extraordinary talent will spread throughout the village, changing the fortunes of her family as the country is transformed forever.','/w1TGEhGbcvIp0MnUGdzDdTji9E9.jpg','2023-10-27',116,'Released','Everyone has a story to tell','The Movie Teller',928118,3.1538,6.5,'8RMiJmDHTT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29850,_binary '\0','/vZbAwP1LthxHzRnodvVwXKwUk4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661275',6.8,22439,'en','Their Finest','During the Blitz of World War II, a female screenwriter works on a film celebrating England\'s resilience as a way to buoy a weary populace\'s spirits. Her efforts to dramatise the true story of two sisters who undertook their own maritime mission to rescue wounded soldiers are met with mixed feelings by a dismissive all-male staff.','/tF0dhJfxzOjvkybJVfNPuuj5ClH.jpg','2017-02-19',117,'Released','In the fight for freedom everyone played a part.','Their Finest',340101,5.6301,6.6,'mMh1EvAQOQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29851,_binary '\0','/iniZ0x168fb6fHdpio4DJmf0nDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661382',6.4,65482,'en','Grudge Match','A pair of aging boxing rivals are coaxed out of retirement to fight one final bout -- 30 years after their last match.','/jTq9jYTKKo6EhQPso4xTMpPYYXW.jpg','2013-12-25',113,'Released','Stallone vs DeNiro','Grudge Match',64807,6.9694,6.106,'1bQSOBJCPQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29852,_binary '\0','/1nR9mCsJD02j13wet0yAnVhEG6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661420',7.3,16439,'fr','Polisse','Paris, France. Fred and his colleagues, members of the BPM, the Police Child Protection Unit, dedicated to pursuing all sorts of offenses committed against the weakest, must endure the scrutiny of Melissa, a photographer commissioned to graphically document the daily routine of the team.','/cKs3XSFVbFeZcH3g9geAvr6ApOl.jpg','2011-10-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Polisse',71157,2.8417,7.756,'rJ60lcoouvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29853,_binary '\0','/8e8tXJCDoPoNNW4K6ojTHdAo7pZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661461',5.5,4097,'de','What a Man','What a man is a comedy that tells the story of a young professor, Alex (Matthias Schweighofer), who after being left by his girlfriend Caroline (Mavie Hörbiger), begins a journey to know himself. But how do you overcome the difficulties of a man today? Or rather what is it that makes a man a man?','/km1hztI9jzypOaQSz0YHh1e5SYY.jpg','2011-08-25',95,'Released',NULL,'What a Man',73770,1.8833,5.3,'TdXytJSRrtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29854,_binary '\0','/lGoyDkKafXvKmZ2oQYdVMOzuhSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661820',6.1,14814,'en','Cut Bank','25-year-old Dwayne McLaren, a former athlete turned auto mechanic, dreams of getting out of tiny Cut Bank, Montana the coldest town in America. But his effort to do so sets in motion a deadly series of events that change his life and the life of the town forever...','/hP5N3R8qqe7JT4N3esgh23GOpCN.jpg','2014-10-04',94,'Released','Good Folks. Bad Deeds.','Cut Bank',276902,3.894,5.785,'35c8ttEJ6fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29855,_binary '\0','/hvE9ZNH1tTOe2QpTogFhqk8MwD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1661862',6.4,5877,'es','No habrá paz para los malvados','Madrid, the beginning of the century. One day, the police inspector Santos Trinidad coming home very drunk, is involved in a triple murder. But there is a witness who managed to escape and that could incriminate him. Santos undertakes an investigation to locate and eliminate the witness. Meanwhile, Chacón a judge in charge of investigating the triple murder, meticulously advances in the search for the murderer. Santos and Chacon soon discover that what seemed a simple case of drug trafficking is actually something far more dangerous.','/d3DI1iu6IYuw3fpOQ83ijKG9e3A.jpg','2011-09-16',114,'Released',NULL,'No Rest for the Wicked',76013,2.8378,5.964,'EB7uBJfHyIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29856,_binary '\0','/t0bsKqnnmuiOrzU8QLy0dHgHTja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1662293',4.4,5466,'en','Nothing Left to Fear','Wendy, her husband Dan and their kids have just moved to the small town of Stull, Kansas, where Dan is the new pastor. But in this sleepy community of friendly neighbors, a horrific series of occurrences awaits them: Their teenage daughter is being tormented by grisly visions. Her younger sister has been marked for a depraved ritual. And deep within the heartland darkness, one of The Seven Gates of Hell demands the blood of the innocent to unleash the creatures of the damned.','/65aDPoEpgFvnAK1bgZysjxgSgyG.jpg','2013-09-26',100,'Released','Let Us Prey.','Nothing Left to Fear',209901,2.5682,5.201,'V3W55f0eTks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29857,_binary '\0','/mxs6p3GGAOtlcZEAHutSynt6H3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1662500',5,2705,'en','Everlasting','\"Everlasting\" is an award-winning thriller about a High School student who travels from Colorado to L.A. to find the truth behind the murder of his girlfriend.','/aWCugQP7865KVLf8RwTcbZsTd1U.jpg','2016-02-13',87,'Released','Dark and Beautiful Forever','Everlasting',354864,1.2157,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.00000