-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663207',5.8,21248,'en','Life of Crime','Two common criminals get more than they bargained for after kidnapping the wife of a corrupt real-estate developer who shows no interest in paying the $1 million dollar ransom for her safe return.','/apO5xGmcEHpdIBc3Zreax7MXl2m.jpg','2013-09-14',100,'Released','Right target. Wrong woman.','Life of Crime',209189,6.6836,5.7,'Fpq8v0ItU0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29863,_binary '\0','/6mYkt6TLIONY4T4GoAeCrCD7EpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663222',2.3,1622,'en','Dead Sea','A Marine Biologist is assigned to investigate the mysterious deaths of some marine life in an inland salt water lake that has been attributed to a creature thought to have been the stuff of a legend.','/bc7zTttPdDMLjOWmpnUGab0ZyNs.jpg','2014-04-15',90,'Released','It\'s Feeding Time.','Dead Sea',263416,1.2657,3.7,'X5g_Y1MeLLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29864,_binary '\0','/gF3ZLqfGgEXof1gpjvi6e3GkHoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663321',7,10450,'fr','Poulet aux Prunes','Since his beloved violin was broken, Nasser-Ali Khan, one of the most renowned musicians of his day, has lost all taste for life. Finding no instrument worthy of replacing it, he decides to confine himself to bed to await death.','/2wPrGdPG2Zn6vFSAMfWsrcTrQTr.jpg','2011-10-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Chicken with Plums',78206,2.9551,7,'bQ9OA4pNiKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29865,_binary '\0','/mhYpcwafQ1X1xVClRjZnGceJj6N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663625',4.5,1408,'en','Bloody Bloody Bible Camp','In 1977 a group of young, horny, out of control Christians are spending a fun filled weekend at the mountain lakeside Happy Day Bible Camp. One by one these youthful sinners pay a BLOODY penance for their misdeeds. Flash forward 7 years, when another youth group of Bible toters return, lead by \"Father Richard Cummings\" (Reggie Bannister), \"Sister Mary Chopper,\" (Tim Sullivan) goes bloody murder after the camp - emphasis on CAMP - with stand out performances by folks like Gigi Bannister, Jessica Sonneborn, Troy Guthrie, Deborah Venegas, Jay Fields, and Jeff Dylan Graham. In the end, Bannister and Troup must face down the a transvestite serial killing nun in a fight to the death, and call upon the higher graces of the infamous Ron Jeremy as \"Jesus\" guide them through! A hilarious campy equal opportunity offensive film that will have you DIE laughing!','/qcVo4S9twvG4kLKv6SZysbpdNtV.jpg','2012-05-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Bloody Bloody Bible Camp',120771,1.5332,4.5,'jZuOR8GIq0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29866,_binary '\0','/cSDUAkc3PwZ8qjrdfOhbQNP8Opv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663628',5.2,2196,'en','Christmas Mail','In this holiday romantic comedy, a mysterious woman who works at the post office answering Santa\'s mail captures the heart of a disillusioned postal carrier.','/dumR7pD3PxK200RzJNycAZlMmIC.jpg','2010-12-04',89,'Released','An unexpected delivery that changed their lives...','Christmas Mail',76706,2.2061,5.2,'qd0PpCqWZeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29867,_binary '\0','/aMAIOGMVAtwNRtlMvGPDIkGchk9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663655',4,8065,'en','Martyrs','A woman and her childhood friend seek out revenge on those who victimized and abused them.','/pkBWgdlFClVrr39iLpUTdzqvgz8.jpg','2015-10-09',86,'Released','To see God you must experience true evil.','Martyrs',362057,3.2693,5.094,'RPwvx9Qff9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29868,_binary '\0','/9X7Im1YuBhyHYVD8r7CAONPJR5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663662',6.9,564208,'en','Pacific Rim','Using massive piloted robots to combat the alien threat, Earth\'s survivors take the fight to the invading alien force lurking in the depths of the Pacific Ocean. Nearly defenseless in the face of the relentless enemy, the forces of mankind have no choice but to turn to two unlikely heroes who now stand as Earth\'s final hope against the mounting apocalypse.','/8wo4eN8dWKaKlxhSvBz19uvj8gA.jpg','2013-07-11',131,'Released','To fight monsters, we created monsters.','Pacific Rim',68726,27.663,6.95,'5guMumPFBag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29869,_binary '\0','/ezOTaeW6Rat1Nl9CH5gEClD17o7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663673',5.6,1815,'en','16-love','When the number one junior player in the country is injured, she begins to discover the teenage life she never got to live... and find the love she never thought she\'d have.','/tIk1eU6t9J3bU5z7h2xPSmdr79X.jpg','2012-01-20',89,'Released','Game...Set...the Perfect Match!','16-love',82626,1.1805,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29870,_binary '\0','/A3k532lVyccaSJ15drIluqAawM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663680',6.7,4035,'en','The Encounter','When five strangers with nothing in common come together at a remote roadside eatery, they place their orders with the diner\'s omniscient owner, who seems to know everything about them ... and is eerily reminiscent of Jesus Christ.','/o40841LWnE4xhldkjqUaznZFIYx.jpg','2010-05-03',85,'Released',NULL,'The Encounter',63348,2.2709,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29871,_binary '\0','/6QCzbj6En7yyZUV4hFnD1TrZEB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1663689',5.1,1745,'en','The Perfect Teacher','A spoiled, selfish teenager becomes infatuated with her teacher. She befriends his daughter as a way of worming her way into the family, and sets about manipulating every aspect of his life.','/beSsbJ77KIc8j9X0gf3O8FlL4OW.jpg','2010-09-12',90,'Released','You can\'t choose your family but she can.','The Perfect Teacher',68193,2.2393,5.8,'Y24amVXnw4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29872,_binary '\0','/43U82uXEsPd0fchBT49nSUSXHMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1664664',3.3,1923,'en','Hidden 3D','Following the death of celebrated scientist Susan Carter, her son Brian is surprised to inherit her controversial experimental addiction treatment center. When he and some friends visit the property, they uncover a terrifying and deadly secret.','/mVJuiBgeHygy6JLh6KVtJTdPeAH.jpg','2011-04-21',82,'Released',NULL,'Hidden 3D',64622,1.3595,3.4,'ZbFiUinIpPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29873,_binary '\0','/mjjAj7QTaiJQcwihX2stBAaTi6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1664806',7,5179,'ta','ராவணன்','After inspector Dev stirs the reign of Veeraiya, a tribal outlaw, the latter responds by kidnapping his wife, Ragini. While she tries to escape from him, Dev fights many resistances to find her.','/4mVJLb1lnLvlFlgvx4QPrlkoldw.jpg','2010-06-18',134,'Released','Ten Heads, Ten Minds, A Hundred Voices, One Man','Raavanan',54456,1.7469,7,'1L6b5JJShrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29874,_binary '\0','/wniroOh9ZfNOrcdbS9pCHOTt5a6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1664809',7.6,5230,'hi','रखता चरित्र','Based on the life of Paritala Ravindra, the film follows his life from just a college student to being a politician in the state of Andhra Pradesh.','/cPFW3LMUKUNfj5jaPJVPXZP5U06.jpg','2010-10-21',123,'Released',NULL,'Rakht Charitra',49028,1.5377,6.983,'HWTTagvrJBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29875,_binary '\0','/fTmAqNWKg6qT5azE6Iwladat76Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1664814',7.4,2096,'ar','رسائل البحر','A man witnesses the drastic changes in society as he goes back to the Alexandria of his youth.','/vVtRpl4L8Yni7sKC96D93pJ3MUa.jpg','2010-02-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Messages from the Sea',103416,0.9959,7.674,'T4GNeP0KyKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29876,_binary '\0','/KJca8XALbnedKsdhLe5sndQfu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1664892',6.4,3385,'no','Sykt lykkelig','A perfect housewife, who just happens to be sex-starved, struggles to keep her emotions in check when an attractive family moves in next door.','/4S1NmY1m7IqWi3IvwPjbfpZHMoK.jpg','2010-11-05',80,'Released','A comedy 