Movie',66923,4.8098,5.2,'6EoDyB3D7Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29990,_binary '\0','/2rjI2uXmjitMAaXVO21r9ao7v2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684562',6.8,274428,'en','The Fall Guy','Fresh off an almost career-ending accident, stuntman Colt Seavers has to track down a missing movie star, solve a conspiracy and try to win back the love of his life while still doing his day job.','/e7olqFmzcIX5c23kX4zSmLPJi8c.jpg','2024-04-24',127,'Released','Fall hard.','The Fall Guy',746036,24.2247,6.948,'EySdVK0NK1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29991,_binary '\0','/9znKRRPsj3ZlXTIFDVEyMWp2pFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684564',4.3,2362,'en','The Victim','Annie\'s life is in jeopardy after she\'s witnessed the horrific rape and murder of her closest friend. Fleeing from two attackers she stumbles across Kyle, a recluse living in the middle of the woods. Kyle finds the stillness of the woods comforting. The ruggedly handsome loner stays far from civilization - that is - until a single knock on his door throws his solitary life into chaos.','/rMWGCTARl355jcUTylJoduVtQFA.jpg','2011-06-06',84,'Released','Who is the victim?','The Victim',44008,1.5408,4.7,'X1MXHfXI_-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29992,_binary '\0','/t3Jsn2XPjEz0yknWmNSJwEjIwdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684628',5.9,8306,'fa','Circumstance','A wealthy Iranian family struggles to contain a teenager\'s growing sexual rebellion and her brother\'s newfound conservatism.','/fs4Qi07K9htZzI73YaukSQFqmHk.jpg','2011-08-26',107,'Released','Let no love fall victim to...','Circumstance',60421,2.8478,6.6,'aD7wieh-m-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29993,_binary '\0','/aT7HV3yKvnXbp4o126pf5gAU0Na.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684907',6.9,1481,'en','Love Begins','Clark Davis adventurous dreams of seeing the world are put into jeopardy after he and a friend start a fight which damages a local cafe. Through a plea deal with the Sheriff and café owner Millie, Clark works off his sentence as a farmhand for the Barlow sisters, Ellen and Cassie. Older sister Ellen doesnt understand Cassies friendly nature with Clark; she agreed to the Sheriffs offer only because the farm has become too much to maintain alone. Clark is slowing winning Ellen over, but suddenly suffers a traumatic head injury in a fall. After Ellen nurses him back to health, her former fiancé returns to win her back. Will Clark travel on or stay behind where love begins?','/b0JiPlWEZ8cnhhgVOWo0rnbGuvh.jpg','2011-09-17',120,'Released',NULL,'Love Begins',81450,1.9077,7.806,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29994,_binary '\0','/ciYJLdCqjTodNpzfIPclznaqI9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684913',7.3,1959,'ar','ميكروفون','Upon his return to Alexandria, Khaled becomes intrigued with a graffiti mural opposite his apartment. As he pursues this further, a larger underground arts scene slowly reveals itself, composed of musicians, filmmakers, and graffiti artists. As they struggle to get their voices heard, Khaled is compelled to help them acquire some much deserved visibility.','/mWuwv2tWNg98aLmDho4HQXWF0hX.jpg','2010-01-26',116,'Released','It starts underground…','Microphone',81435,0.8815,7.6,'xiwsNGWfRc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29995,_binary '\0','/uqtKnIGgxku0GELQbQWuEiFac6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684925',5.9,6497,'en','Wish You Were Here','Four friends lose themselves in a carefree South-East Asian holiday. Only three come back. Dave and Alice return home to their young family desperate for answers about Jeremy\'s mysterious disappearance. When Alice\'s sister Steph returns not long after, a nasty secret is revealed about the night her boyfriend went missing. But it is only the first of many. Who amongst them knows what happened on that fateful night when they were dancing under a full moon in Cambodia?','/5yNsRnjgvfOkCr6fGrwqf93pbhx.jpg','2012-04-26',93,'Released','Four went. Three came back. Only one of them knows what happened.','Wish You Were Here',60270,2.6066,5.5,'WVw1f43xF2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29996,_binary '\0','/iH6KzJajyhjU35jUtfCVlY8UF5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1684927',3.8,3345,'en','Swamp Shark','Open on gorgeous swamplands of the Atchafalaya Basin in the summer. Lots of beautiful teens are at the beach the weekend before Gator Fest. That night an animal smuggling deal goes wrong and a large sea creature escapes into a swampy backwoods river. At the McDaniel\'s \"Gator Shack\" restaurant, a local, Jackson is drunk, and gets mangled to bits. The town sheriff blames the carnage on the McDaniel\'s \"escaped\" pack of gators and tries hauling them off to jail. Rachel McDaniel, head of the family, claims to have seen the fin of a shark! Rachel and her family, along with the help of a mysterious stranger, Charlie, take on the Swampshark and the law to clear their names, save Rachel\'s kid sister Krystal and prevent the unwitting folks at the upcoming Gator Fest from being torn to shreds by a beast the likes of which no one has ever seen!','/gNk8Ji4mDZCwlNro0czoosJ6d1l.jpg','2011-06-25',85,'Released','Fresh water. Fresh meat.','Swamp Shark',63749,2.4352,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29997,_binary '\0','/jJPJTvq9aqmIlJUqOInmE4pSTiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686018',3.7,3188,'en','Creature','An ex-Navy seal, his girlfriend and their friends head out on a road trip to New Orleans. The group decides to stop at a roadside convenience store owned by Chopper, who tells them the tale of Lockjaw, a fabled god-like creature who is half-man, half-alligator.','/SrKrYh4Qmhpfcn9PsW2jpLROul.jpg','2011-09-09',93,'Released','Terror has teeth.','Creature',73963,2.3332,5.185,'0wFLRbkzWxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29998,_binary '\0','/lN6FYCiZbvXo4sLID3ioiNFlQ8y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686039',5.6,16089,'en','Five Minarets in New York','Two Turkish anti-terrorist agents are sent to New York City on a mission to find and bring back the dangerous Islamic leader codenamed \"Dajjal\", believed to be hiding in there. Working with the FBI and NYPD, the agents orchestrate the arrest of Hadji Gumus, a well-respected Muslim scholar and family man who years before fled to the United States after being released from a Turkish prison, where he served time for murder. This tale love, friendship, peace and prejudices, takes us on a journey seeking to answer the question of whether innocence or guilt even matters to one who lusts for vengeance.','/hqcRs578GT1kwqjOEcqbDQDf8Z4.jpg','2010-03-09',119,'Released','The past will impact the future.','Five Minarets in New York',51794,3.5077,5.5,'fQTUcCIU_yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(29999,_binary '\0','/tnfvAIxUUizw7H97IFoYv9cFMqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686042',6.2,2502,'en','Girl on a Bicycle','Paolo, an Italian tour bus driver living in Paris, has just summoned up the courage to propose marriage to his German girlfriend Greta. However, a chance encounter with a French woman on a bicycle the very next day turns Paolo\'s life upside down.','/nxzQEltbVbhJbVhWK9RtMRiXEM9.jpg','2013-03-04',101,'Released','Some distractions are better than others.','Girl on a Bicycle',199341,2.7078,5.871,'Ln7DJHq_wA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30000,_binary '\0','/jJ3PxDV7qVrbl4ywVFfeOu4rfzE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686067',7.2,4375,'fr','La Source des femmes','A comedy/drama set in a village and centered on a battle of the sexes, where women threaten to withhold sexual favours as long as the men refuse to install a water pipe.','/s6aeswUubPwVtWFnVcaClS6980q.jpg','2011-11-02',135,'Released',NULL,'The Source',56418,2.9207,6.559,'1Ka0pnbkvig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30001,_binary '\0','/79VMK5MI4TDbt3LvfHsdNuHlYuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686313',7,10952,'sv','I rymden finns inga känslor','Simon has Asperger\'s syndrome and doesn\'t like changes in his life. He lives with his big brother Sam and Sam\'s girlfriend Frida. When Frida can\'t stand having to adapt to Simon\'s peculiarities anymore she takes off, leaving Simon with having to find a new, perfect, girlfriend for his brother.','/mVVWBgQtLy9gIZE4PXe2rt7ShNQ.jpg','2010-09-03',85,'Released','There are no feelings in outer space.','Simple Simon',55165,2.4881,7.21,'T-5sNIb912A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30002,_binary '\0','/830lKrltDrfZgtjVC1Ya8PD4IbO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686768',6.8,2794,'de','Der ganz große Traum','An English teacher brings soccer to a German school in the 19th Century.','/kvm2cmbnYerVUsYSomv5H2iYthn.jpg','2011-02-24',113,'Released','Hip hip hooray boys!','Lessons of a Dream',58166,2.3343,7,'tSIbHII-N44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30003,_binary '\0','/iN63QN9aHNQC8vAEtVWtXTGkfVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686784',5.9,8986,'zh','龍門飛甲','Three years after the infamous Dragon Inn was burnt down in the desert when its innkeeper Jade vanished. A new gang of marauders had taken over - innkeepers by day and treasure hunters by night. The inn is the rumoured location of a lost city buried under the desert, and its hidden treasure would only be revealed by a gigantic storm every 60 years. The gang used the inn as a front to locate the lost treasure.','/1i5kkGZne5tKfSlTtaYnfJQNN6c.jpg','2011-12-15',125,'Released','Jet Li and Tsui Hark are back together.','Flying Swords of Dragon Gate',81870,4.8069,6.23,'veI3veD-JrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30004,_binary '\0','/ibqZTadDksuqhSKUGPk6ULuNTQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686812',7.3,2841,'en','The Song of Lunch','A dramatisation of Christopher Reid\'s narrative poem that tells the story of an unnamed book editor who, fifteen years after their break-up, is meeting his former love for a nostalgic lunch at Zanzotti\'s, the Soho restaurant they used to frequent.','/xzobrJkNLYdHBjv8ts7Iwe9MVCS.jpg','2010-10-08',48,'Released',NULL,'The Song of Lunch',53314,2.1474,6.6,'rfS4C2LSVsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30005,_binary '\0','/hA9o7Tps0OBLvrZ6KkIVS8bmQSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686821',5.4,58939,'en','Vampire Academy','Rose, a rebellious half-vampire/half-human guardian-in-training and her best friend, Lissa -- a mortal, royal vampire Princess - have been on the run when they are captured and returned to St. Vladamirs Academy, the very place where they believe their lives may be in most jeopardy. Rose will sacrifice everything to protect Lissa from those who intend to exploit her from within the Academy walls and the Strigoi (immortal, evil vampires) who hunt her kind from outside its sanctuary.','/cJZpKgiFfjDZ6L5aOJvbmDhsGqY.jpg','2014-02-07',104,'Released','They suck at school.','Vampire Academy',203739,7.5958,6.3,'Gr9cSq0K2vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30006,_binary '\0','/dv2qaHpKAsqq5B4zi4F08qCHvWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686897',2.5,1334,'en','The Bunker','A fictional war-torn valor story of heroism, set in the uncharted lands of \"The Ho Bo Woods\" in southern Vietnam in 1965. Following a bogus ghost hunt for a missing Special Forces unit led by a man they call Ranger, Private Johannes Schenke (Han) attempts to save an alleged nVa (North Vietnamese Army) operative, along with his comrades who have been captured by Ranger and his renegade Special Forces squad while operating out of an abandoned nVa bunker.','/rQix2G2puR7SNlhd9Y5jENE2yU0.jpg','2014-04-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Bunker',261492,1.6106,4,'sJ7hdZW2-cY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30007,_binary '\0','/cl0DXDRKAq1FrmyNqAH8WMKnXoF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1686902',2.6,1522,'en','Monsters in the Woods','A micro-budget movie crew treks into the wilderness to shoot horror scenes for their unsellable indie-drama. They soon find themselves in the midst of their own real horror movie, as they are hunted by a large group of creatures.','/fZMNWHCD7xZYRg4rcwGSPnOMe1z.jpg','2012-02-11',83,'Released',NULL,'Monsters in the Woods',93513,1.4222,2.1,'kOWMScKLCsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30008,_binary '\0','/bA3Zc9GXeLT4NBSfFOnheqghzoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1687247',7.6,15795,'en','Life in a Day','A documentary shot by filmmakers all over the world that serves as a time capsule to show future generations what it was like to be alive on the 24th of July, 2010.','/g4Kze731McN2WkcN0OLwi1CMa8u.jpg','2011-01-27',95,'Released','The story of one day on Earth.','Life in a Day',66150,3.1407,7.2,'8Xfl_1QjxRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30009,_binary '\0','/ukQakOCdAXHaI4X11NBCVfbctPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1687277',4.8,1267,'en','InSight','While tending to a stabbing victim, Kaitlyn is electrocuted and awakens to find that she is experiencing the memories of the now-deceased woman.','/yXbwFWn9lD79aD2UxAAkkVXrrEC.jpg','2011-09-02',92,'Released','Fear what you see.','InSight',77874,2.0241,4.6,'aU3DwqwpIk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30010,_binary '\0','/fAyndOp66NLBNEIeRpobiZDysnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1687281',6.5,10734,'en','Terri','Terri, a pajama-clad, disaffected high school student learns how to engage the world with the help of Mr. Fitzgerald, his assistant principal.','/ng3K9EeuBFn82kN4XgpOKQgx6Fd.jpg','2011-07-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Terri',51993,1.8781,6.3,'zN4l05LMReA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30011,_binary '\0','/djFH0wVIGgtJ9wKP7SGsUO8FU10.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1687889',4.1,2018,'en','Madison County','A group of college kids travel to a small, mountain town called Madison County to interview the author of a tell-all book on the accounts of several grisly murders that happened there. But when the kids get to Madison County, the author is no where to be found and the towns people act like they haven\'t seen him in years. They also say that the killer never existed and the murders never happened. However, when the kids start digging around to get their own answers, they find out that the stories maybe more real than the townspeople are letting on!','/2zCC4BBXyxb9rsSfv1edBgfWXsO.jpg','2011-10-11',81,'Released',NULL,'Madison County',77785,1.044,4,'1QVH5klkpUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30012,_binary '\0','/1Rw3KOjmKY4QrJ9MKugIo3F5FjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1687901',6.5,72655,'en','The Awakening','In post–War England, a writer and sometime-ghost hunter investigates a reported haunting at a boys boarding school.','/txmiJkl8su0jkEABLIHZBqVHrTj.jpg','2011-08-17',107,'Released','Sometimes dead does not mean gone.','The Awakening',77949,6.4481,6.4,'3yneMKpmA8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30013,_binary '\0','/3Sa0aM3gTStFkjkhNaqk2E9KLCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1688649',7.2,2806,'es','La voz dormida','Finished the Spanish Civil War in April 1939, in November 1940, while Spain is being crushed by the ruthless boot of dictator Franco, Pepita travels from rural Córdoba to Madrid to be near her sister Hortensia, who is seven months pregnant and imprisoned, haunted by the shadow of a death sentence.','/8lZkChW71KsJlhypnsbKwaYP05d.jpg','2011-10-21',119,'Released',NULL,'The Sleeping Voice',79745,1.9343,6.7,'2p_WSRLPtMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30014,_binary '\0','/eILtCPqMZzJFsdcsJtsbhXuyby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1688653',3.3,1791,'en','Metal Tornado','The HELIOS PROJECT is a high tech facility tasked with storing and converting solar rays into an endless supply of renewable energy. After years of research and millions of dollars, it is now time to test the system out.','/qUVqBWAVUeyonfJOYytJH2RJEsd.jpg','2011-07-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Metal Tornado',76340,2.5338,4.7,'0ePs8PRq8xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30015,_binary '\0','/ySP2yLUKnayXmJ0JNlQohT0Hxjo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16899584',8.9,2053,'en','The Beatles: Get Back - The Rooftop Concert','On the 30th of January, 1969, the Beatles performed an unannounced concert from the rooftop of their Apple Corps headquarters at Savile Row, within central London\'s office and fashion district. Experience the final and unforgettable iconic performance of The Beatles in a special 60-minute presentation, digitally remastered into the image and sound quality of IMAX DMR technology.','/4MPsj31FTnfXg1NO93lzr3PqNuE.jpg','2022-01-30',65,'Released','Experience their iconic final performance only in IMAX.','The Beatles: Get Back - The Rooftop Concert',923403,2.1237,8,'JpqfAxuFJm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30016,_binary '\0','/mGwzJbtX6zU0SdtxeHn1sNNK8JW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16900880',6.6,16887,'ko','길복순','At work, she\'s a renowned assassin. At home, she\'s a single mom to a teenage daughter. Killing? That\'s easy. It\'s parenting that\'s the hard part.','/taYgn3RRpCGlTGdaGQvnSIOzXFy.jpg','2023-02-18',137,'Released','A life of lies can kill.','Kill Boksoon',849869,5.4152,6.889,'6w2vM69JxpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30017,_binary '\0','/rUTpCdySAr2GLjjyqRbYRh0Tt5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690368',5.7,3323,'da','Alle for én','Four rogues, who were best friends as kids, have one big problem: they\'re sitting on both sides of the law. Martin is a policeman, while Nikolai, Ralf, and Timo can\'t distinguish between personal possessions and the possessions of others! When all four find themselves in a fix, they\'re forced to return to their former tricks against a common foe, Mr Niemeyer. Martin is not as successful, however, either at his job or marriage, and thinks he deserves a better life. Now he sees an opportunity to save his career by \"playing\" with his old friends on a mission that is so crazy that even the two foolish brothers can do some good.','/cKikIufxCbwfm3hURGQGQaoIZLT.jpg','2011-02-10',82,'Released',NULL,'All for One',72054,1.3192,5.9,'ZU8xZB01J08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30018,_binary '\0','/8NI5t1Ps7ODeJnNSMXqwW2ASicj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690389',6.5,1780,'fr','Vous n\'avez encore rien vu','From beyond the grave, celebrated playwright Antoine d\'Anthac gathers all his friends who have appeared over the years in his play \'Eurydice\'. These actors watch a recording performed by a young acting company, La Compagnie de la Colombe. Do love, life, death and love after death still have any place on a theater stage? It\'s up to them to decide. And the surprises have only just begun...','/qXWGsizU1BQEbwn2mIlvHesBUtA.jpg','2012-09-01',115,'Released',NULL,'You Ain\'t Seen Nothin\' Yet',103717,1.9052,6.6,'Jw0eKOUJKwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30019,_binary '\0','/zg14tM7fKXoFM8uyuiC4aoNfxo0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690455',5.9,6772,'en','Dark Horse','Abe is a man who is in his thirties and who lives with his parents. He works regretfully for his father while pursuing his hobby of collecting toys. Aware that his family doesn\'t think highly of him, he tries to spark a relationship with Miranda, who recently moved back home after a failed literary/academic career. Miranda agrees to marry Abe out of desperation, but things go awry.','/47nbkrQQSdFKJY9BwR6rfeTOvWk.jpg','2012-06-08',86,'Released',NULL,'Dark Horse',83384,2.1808,5.7,'wc8rG7cMrBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30020,_binary '\0','/7fC65V10NQ2lhHHQ0KA1KNA1PvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690470',6.1,2923,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ダイヤモンド&パール 幻影の覇者 ゾロアーク','Ash and his friends must stop a greedy media mogul from using the shape-shifting Zoroark to capture the time-travelling Celebi.','/tWgH64RZmm2rIHtO2DNnfN3DZa8.jpg','2010-07-10',96,'Released','The fury of Zoroark has been unleashed!','Pokémon: Zoroark - Master of Illusions',50087,5.1999,6.8,'3Iy3UlYdF9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30021,_binary '\0','/y2E2lNUE2VQbHchKpvGV3rVXS8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690483',6.3,3175,'ja','いばらの王 -King of Thorn-','A mysterious virus, nicknamed Medusa, is spreading around Japan, turning its victims into stone. Given the impossibility of finding an immediate cure, the government opts for cryopreserving a select group of patients until they come up with a solution. Kasumi, one of the chosen ones, has been asleep for years and her awakening, more than a bed of roses, is a bed of thorns, and happens in the midst of total chaos where monstrous creatures lie in wait all around.','/wH9SSbsNWKLtZjA4LBQ7P2GwbLZ.jpg','2010-05-01',109,'Released',NULL,'King of Thorn',50388,5.1461,6.5,'occKebcmWcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30022,_binary '\0','/uD267eSiACfWLxp47t3gYymOQRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690953',7.3,465597,'en','Despicable Me 2','Gru is recruited by the Anti-Villain League to help deal with a powerful new super criminal.','/5Fh4NdoEnCjCK9wLjdJ9DJNFl2b.jpg','2013-06-26',98,'Released','More minions. More despicable.','Despicable Me 2',93456,24.5675,6.9,'EK3j98PHaGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30023,_binary '\0','/6EMqJu1wAKWtgO364odfkS3nzIP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1690967',6,2771,'en','Come Sunday','Evangelist Carlton Pearson is ostracized by his church for preaching that there is no Hell.','/oucoXiLsc07YryywgjddmU3YoDV.jpg','2018-01-21',106,'Released','Believer. Preacher. Heretic.','Come Sunday',430446,1.8764,5.8,'gQJHvVoqi1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30024,_binary '\0','/9qMP1aquRST8XfJ58EqTMAZ9kA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691152',7.2,7816,'en','David Lynch: The Art Life','An intimate journey through the formative years of David Lynch\'s life. From his idyllic upbringing in small town America to the dark streets of Philadelphia, we follow Lynch as he traces the events that have helped to shape one of cinema\'s most enigmatic directors.','/pgtQceTZKylB2B237t18h2pOXpE.jpg','2017-02-15',89,'Released','Experience a unique documentary event: exploring the life and the mind of the creative genius behind David Lynch.','David Lynch: The Art Life',413765,2.4317,7,'g_NYNSMxOro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30025,_binary '\0','/h9vfNig5MMf2QvMV8JOi0hHD1RJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691154',5.4,4027,'en','The Pill','Worried that he has gotten the free-spirited Mindy pregnant after an unprotected one-night stand, Fred feigns romantic interest and sticks by her side for twelve hours to make sure she takes both doses of the morning-after pill.','/xGQOL6qS8EvouYcsIGJYbPe3WGK.jpg','2011-12-16',83,'Released','Some relationships are hard to swallow.','The Pill',87587,1.67,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30026,_binary '\0','/nvg8oPS5JfU2GDMubSc7OuAcglT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691323',6.2,8537,'el','Attenberg','Marina, 23, is growing up with her architect father in a prototype factory town by the sea. Finding the human species strange and repellent, she keeps her distance...that is until a stranger comes to town and challenges her to a foosball duel, on her own table. Her father, meanwhile, ritualistically prepares for his exit from the 20th century, which he considers to be \"overrated.\"','/ry03y6yIwgEZwG5zuCHmOxj8Thk.jpg','2010-12-09',97,'Released','Sexy, strange and beautifully deranged.','Attenberg',62321,2.3311,6.09,'3jPWSrvyIzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30027,_binary '\0','/rrQJwg3jFQasEilhmq8TMpGocb1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691338',8,5077,'en','Robot Chicken: Star Wars Episode III','Millions of years from now, after Socrates, Shakespeare and the bible are long forgotten, only two great works will remain: the sci-fi cinema epic Star Wars and Adult Swim\'s stop-motion animated, cheap gag extravanganza Robot Chicken. And now, for the first time, they come together for the third time, in this all new special. That\'s right, all your mot beloved Star Wars characters are going back through the comedy meat grinder.','/htL6wH77hfO1N97n6MOwt9AD1oB.jpg','2010-12-19',45,'Released',NULL,'Robot Chicken: Star Wars Episode III',51888,2.7758,7.5,'rmT6RX-YWzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30028,_binary '\0','/2K7fSaGnhxVQwWxfthbKRBY7gKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691452',3.7,2067,'en','You Can\'t Kill Stephen King','Siblings Monroe (Monroe Mann) and Hilary (Crystal Arnette) have discovered that they have inherited a lake house and to make things even better, the famous horror author Stephen King is rumoured to live somewhere nearby. They decide to take their friends down to the lake house to check things out, only to find immediate resistance from all of the locals, who insist that King doesn\'t live in the area. Despite being completely unwelcome, they decide to stay and soon find that people are being killed one by one in a manner similar to several deaths in various Stephen King stories.','/o65cbWl3dtvJK0pa6iBiw5SMemS.jpg','2012-04-14',83,'Released','It Was a Mistake to Visit His Lake','You Can\'t Kill Stephen King',137528,1.3717,4.5,'qW8Zz-dSAWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30029,_binary '\0','/fV7WI8KICW1cA9jLclyM4mRAL6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691453',4.9,2748,'en','Knockout','Outsider and new kid Matthew desperately wants to join his high school\'s boxing team, but resident bully and boxing champion Hector stands in his way. Facing constant torment, Matthew finds an unlikely ally in Dan, the school\'s janitor and one-time amateur boxer. Together, they train for the biggest boxing match of Matthew\'s life and discover what it truly means to be a winner.','/r0YX2BRhyGlwgs7xPNYJUbtJvVc.jpg','2011-03-05',95,'Released','Inside every kid is the heart of a champion.','Knockout',58448,2.6897,5.4,'4dYQB0I7QqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30030,_binary '\0','/6hbCQdwuzJsLeZ09YSuBcNXjSPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16914952',5.3,2196,'te','బ్లాక్','Aditya is a Police Constable who\'s life takes a turn when a murder and robbery that take place while he is on duty. Can Aditya manage it all?','/q6go3JKo822ctqirgQG3R8og6Of.jpg','2022-05-28',138,'Released',NULL,'Black',890119,0.8626,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30031,_binary '\0','/jZXI5WdFkYDfDNBZsy8PFqp03vP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16915972',6.7,5446,'id','Pengabdi Setan 2: Communion','After moving from their home to an apartment building, a new terror awaits Rini’s family.','/xQNMM3u6srkhM8bdTCKVTFzyCF1.jpg','2022-07-30',119,'Released','A mother\'s terror is forever.','Satan\'s Slaves 2: Communion',925786,3.5565,7,'uBL3Ci6lbBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30032,_binary '\0','/q0X5l5GfbqxKuof0XHEIuh94RKb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691916',6.4,61465,'en','Before I Fall','Samantha Kingston has everything. Then, everything changes. After one fateful night, she wakes up with no future at all. Trapped into reliving the same day over and over, she begins to question just how perfect her life really was.','/eowzonDJMCuNXoJGVkP9Z7oCmiM.jpg','2017-03-02',98,'Released','What if today was the only day of the rest of your life?','Before I Fall',397837,7.3589,6.968,'ADj35gDqM90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30033,_binary '\0','/vxgnRbELXgcTSdby7bHR30XEE4f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691917',5.7,53514,'en','Planes','Dusty is a cropdusting plane who dreams of competing in a famous aerial race. The problem? He is hopelessly afraid of heights. With the support of his mentor Skipper and a host of new friends, Dusty sets off to make his dreams come true.','/i2xgU0y0p77WTrB0oIkbpdaWq8R.jpg','2013-08-09',91,'Released','From above the world of Cars','Planes',151960,9.8592,5.9,'3KumjBXHdzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30034,_binary '\0','/jqXCrMZDta1qT3pXTeYArAfolAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1691920',5.9,6683,'en','I Melt with You','Former college friends meet up for a reunion that leads them to face the apparent disillusionment that defines their lives. After a week of excessive drug and alcohol abuse, events lead them to contemplate fulfilling a self destructive pact they made when they were young.','/6Xq0cwrXOgmyKCTtH3KlOJFS8uu.jpg','2011-12-09',129,'Released','When life hammers you, get smashed','I Melt with You',75345,2.3586,5.3,'CGjCceYNhuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30035,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692084',5.1,1843,'en','High Road','Directed by Matt Walsh, a co-founding member of world-renowned comedy troupe Upright Citizens Brigade, High Road showcases a totally improvised script about Glenn “Fitz” Fitzgerald (James Pumphrey), a young man whose loyalties are split among his band, his girlfriend Monica(Abby Elliottt) and selling drugs. After his band breaks up, Fitz finds himself dealing drugs out of his garage and bonding with 16-year-old neighborhood kid Jimmy (Dylan O’Brien). As his former band mates (Zach Woods, Matt L. Jones, Lizzy Caplan) begin finding success and one of his drug deals goes awry, Fitz hits the road with Jimmy. Amid car chases, guns, broken bones, sassy cabbies and a suspicious doctor (Horatio Sanz), Fitz has to navigate their way to safe harbor--and he doesn’t even know about the surprise Monica has in store for him back home!','/qQRZwequtuXOcYVHvdyAD5A5L2X.jpg','2012-03-06',87,'Released','The road less traveled is filled with pot holes.','High Road',89857,1.2007,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30036,_binary '\0','/h8UaRBkF3oJaXq3pv0dtzLt8EOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692098',6.1,2931,'en','Hideaways','The elder one of each generation in the Furlong family is equipped with an extraordinary capacity. James discovers the nature of his at the time of an accident which causes the death of his father and his grandmother. Haunted by this mysterious evil he hides in a forest not to harm anybody. A few years later, Mae also takes refuge it in the forest and meets James.','/oC9ZK2SqxZq2Zae6ouZZ3C2VxPk.jpg','2011-11-23',90,'Released','Can Love Overcome a Curse','Hideaways',99494,2.1745,6.1,'1uRFW3mQulo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30037,_binary '\0','/uUD3l9juYOGNfw2GyTNCLH285dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692189',6,1288,'te','డాన్ శీను','This story is all about a ambitious boy named Seenu (Ravi Teja) who dreams of becoming a don. He always likes to be called as ‘Don’ Seenu since childhood due to the strong influence of the Amitabh Bachchan starrer ‘Don’. He grows up with just one passion - that of becoming the World\'s No: 1 Don. Thanks to his enterprising nature, he gains access to the cream of the city\'s dons, and uses his cleverness to play off the top two - Machiraju (Sayaji Shinde) and Narsing (Sri Hari), fierce rivals - against each other.','/xzG4qy5yqq5LJWV8FqIAENTeM8X.jpg','2010-08-06',166,'Released',NULL,'Don Seenu',52944,1.0158,5.295,'5PKnVDho_vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30038,_binary '\0','/bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692190',7.7,14158,'es','El Infierno','After being deported back to Mexico, a man has no choice but to join the vicious drug cartel that has corrupted his hometown in order to survive.','/ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg','2010-09-03',148,'Released','Mexico 2010, Hell... nothing to celebrate','El Infierno',52629,8.9485,7.962,'n4jQnRkj-gU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30039,_binary '\0','/mntBeW6TRgm7GkYJwRDy3oJnKtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692486',7.1,139346,'en','Carnage','Two pairs of parents hold a cordial meeting after their sons are involved in a fight, though as their time together progresses, increasingly childish behavior throws the discussion into chaos.','/3Imx53XV3T02ADlMxYazYXVNysZ.jpg','2011-09-16',80,'Released','A new comedy of no manners.','Carnage',72113,5.5962,7.162,'Zvg_wK6smK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30040,_binary '\0','/6LkKZ43zyz7SAqWGTYM75uKLwKU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692504',6.2,9316,'de','Wir sind die Nacht','One night, 18 year old Lena is bitten by Louise, leader of a female vampire trio that are as deadly as they are beautiful. Her newfound vampiric lifestyle is a blessing and a curse at the same time. At first, she enjoys the limitless freedom, the luxury, the parties. But soon the murderous blood lust of her comrades in arms proves too much for her, and she falls dangerously in love with Tom, a young undercover cop.','/zNESCcM2PbynPPdzlEPUUHMaxqI.jpg','2010-10-28',100,'Released','Immortal. Insatiable.','We Are the Night',52587,3.6997,6,'8pSLgO1oeDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30041,_binary '\0','/wfTHcv3ZDTzy5pplUup1JWAwa1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1692928',8.2,4520,'en','The Last Lions','In Botswana\'s Okavango Delta, an ostracized lioness and her two cubs must fight alone to survive - overcoming all manner of hazards. Their only defense is to escape to Duba Island -- and with that, an unknown future. The setting for this epic tale is one of the last regions where lions can live in the wild. Faced with dwindling land and increasing pressure from hunting, lions - like our lone lioness and her cubs - are approaching the brink of extinction.','/xNxqoeTfHReYbHbhigir85J21Nh.jpg','2011-02-11',88,'Released','The Most Powerful Force In Nature Is A Mother\'s Love','The Last Lions',53505,1.3866,7.2,'PoAcNdeEf_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30042,_binary '\0','/4UxTRmFEZO6iLdRnSUR5bXqMwvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1693679',3.3,2079,'en','Hirokin: The Last Samurai','In a planet where humans must scavenge the post-apocalyptic barren wasteland, Hirokin – a reluctant warrior with a dark past – sets off on mission to fulfill his destiny. Having fought to the death to save his wife and son from the planets evil dictator – Griffin – and his elite army of hunters, the lone warrior is left for dead in the vast desert. Armed with his samurai blade, Hirokin is forced to choose between avenging the murder of his family and fighting for the freedom his people. In a twist of fate and with a small rebellion by his side Hirokin s vision finally becomes clear.','/2N6NDtxSPSKM4q1KRqNILNf8ZvH.jpg','2012-04-23',105,'Released',NULL,'Hirokin: The Last Samurai',103551,2.7951,3.7,'dUtc7UEGDsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30043,_binary '\0','/4HssFhEDz82Mjk7ZvU0rQ0iYXNs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1693830',6.6,2565,'ru','Овсянки','Miron Alekseevich, director of a paper and pulp mill, goes to bury his wife Tanya in the place where they once spent their honeymoon. He goes not alone, but with a photographer named Stork, to whom he tells touching details of his life with Tanya. The narrative weaves together the memories of the characters, as well as the rituals and beliefs of the Meri people, a small Finnish tribe that once lived in the Northern Volga region and dissolved among the Russians.','/lQ29b3lxfXSPyR3P48yNWfD6tTD.jpg','2010-10-28',77,'Released',NULL,'Silent Souls',51276,1.3413,6.303,'zajWwRNxFSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30044,_binary '\0','/xKtkFgefgheTZgTlmMeZrOP84UY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1693843',4.5,2481,'en','Poolboy: Drowning Out the Fury','In this unearthed lost movie from 1990 that the studio deemed too terrible to release, a Vietnam Veteran Sal Bando(Sorbo), tortured by his past as a Poolboy returns home to Van Nuys, California, and a country he doesn\'t recognize, in which it seems only Mexicans run pool-cleaning companies. Bando sets off on a brutal mission to reclaim his \"rightful\" vocation and enact revenge on the man(Trejo) who killed his wife and son.','/110wCwfzRRiGVdXtpAptgTPK3JJ.jpg','2011-07-22',90,'Released','No Lifeguard on Duty','Poolboy: Drowning Out the Fury',70863,2.2449,4.9,'9OkkfDdoCm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30045,_binary '\0','/ywnuGxNTS1d6eUqLykJdqffSEx5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1693872',5.1,3944,'en','Red Faction: Origins','In the year 2125, Alec Mason led the Martian Colonies to freedom in the hit action game Red Faction: Guerrilla. Now, Syfy and THQ are teaming up to continue the saga of conflict on Mars 25 years later in an all-new Original Movie, Red Faction: Origins. Stargate Universe\'s Brian J. Smith stars as Jake Mason, son of revolutionary hero Alec Mason (Terminator 2\'s Robert Patrick) and a Red Faction ranger. Fighting to preserve Martian freedom, Jake encounters a powerful new enemy in a dangerous and mysterious group led by the charismatic Adam Hale (Torchwood\'s Gareth David-Lloyd) and holding secrets that will rock the Mason clan. Jake must now battle the relentless regime and somehow reunite a family torn apart by war. Red Faction: Origins also stars Battlestar Galactica\'s Kate Vernon and The Tudors\' Tamzin Merchant, and will feature music from Bear McCreary (Battlestar Galactica).','/r16e0nXP2DmCZxH7WGeXbeSsudR.jpg','2011-06-04',91,'Released','Can Alec save everyone?','Red Faction: Origins',65945,2.4211,5.194,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30046,_binary '\0','/qRyuVUaENDPGGJBbPHOycnT0JdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1693989',6.3,1834,'ja','パラダイス・キス','Hyasaka Yukari only wants one thing: to enter the college that her mom wants. One day, she meets an extravagant group that loves fashion. They were searching for a model and Yukari fits their ideal model. From now Yukari will know the world of fashion and modeling, and what she really wants.','/eyNH5XUHTStR7IhpBeOJoK7jqpl.jpg','2011-06-04',124,'Released',NULL,'Paradise Kiss',78214,1.8267,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30047,_binary '\0','/6lQwPjxE7O3oOX5xxB3wKJZU2MR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1694019',6.7,2665,'ko','이끼','A city boy visits a remote village to find out the reason behind his father\'s strange death. The locals are watching his every move and are eager to see him leave. As he starts to investigate, the village\'s sinister secrets begin to unravel.','/tOqJWvNV4RagBNB0AM6IPXBNPy6.jpg','2010-07-14',162,'Released','A secret buried underneath.','Moss',49087,2.067,6.9,'TJc8u9xv3LU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30048,_binary '\0','/wlZ29Zkryj8exANbj3Wr52kiILx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1694020',5.8,41868,'en','The Guilt Trip','An inventor and his mom hit the road together so he can sell his latest invention.','/55JqWqocsMNx5uanELDRDFqu40J.jpg','2012-12-19',95,'Released','Get ready for one mother of a road trip.','The Guilt Trip',82687,10.4019,5.6,'UAwiiGUCeLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30049,_binary '\0','/k5T3sHUGsjZa4qVsf2BAECdrOOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1694021',5.3,11710,'en','Into the Grizzly Maze','Two estranged brothers reunite at their childhood home in the Alaskan wild. They set out on a two-day hike and are stalked by an unrelenting grizzly bear.','/i5GbFCeZ0fG5xb2ta6B3yNgzIM7.jpg','2015-02-27',94,'Released','Hunt or be hunted.','Into the Grizzly Maze',244316,4.326,5.4,'T7hIqnKsuQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30050,_binary '\0','/2XHojuZ86dDyXdECqHFi0VSr8v0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1694118',6.1,2899,'en','Memorial Day','Memorial Day, 1993. When 13-year-old Kyle Vogel discovers the World War II footlocker belonging to his grandfather, Bud, everyone tells Kyle to put it back. Luckily, he ignores them. Although Bud has never talked about the war, he finds himself striking a deal with his grandson: Kyle can pick any three souvenirs, and Bud will tell him the stories behind each one. Memorial Day not only takes us on a journey into Bud\'s complicated wartime past, but also into Kyle\'s wartime future. As the two men share parallel experiences in combat, they come to realize how that magical day on the porch shaped both of their lives.','/mBp63rPK3pNhWRrsUXrqSPCOXo5.jpg','2011-06-06',108,'Released','Two Generations. Two Wars. One Story','Memorial Day',105945,1.8059,6.15,'-7IZoj0xfGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30051,_binary '\0','/wMEIoMjmn50NvpW1D56m7xE9U0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1694542',6.8,18170,'hi','तनु वेड्स मनु','Manu comes to India to find a bride for himself and falls for Tanu at first sight but she is a free spirited girl has no plans of marrying him.','/jSp16ilrwEyeBorFcBdFtYjhMUr.jpg','2011-02-25',119,'Released','Celebrate a perfect mismatch.','Tanu Weds Manu',58333,1.2782,6.737,'AdEFqon_dmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30052,_binary '\0','/nIXBaPRix53sq4W2KK8FazrGzc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16951452',6.4,3934,'en','Anna Nicole Smith: You Don\'t Know Me','From the heights of her modeling fame to her tragic death, this documentary reveals Anna Nicole Smith through the eyes of the people closest to her.','/mybL2Hd3PvsY7Qyjf7W6BKsoECu.jpg','2023-05-16',116,'Released',NULL,'Anna Nicole Smith: You Don\'t Know Me',1114590,3.183,6.063,'5p-0WRVZ-Pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30053,_binary '\0','/gCOe0ZSGgfsHob7gdg2xQANwTAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16953666',7,13597,'fr','La Nuit du 12','Young and ambitious Captain Vivés has just been appointed group leader at the Grenoble Criminal Squad when Clara\'s murder case lands on his desk. Vivés and his team investigate Clara\'s complex life and relations, but what starts as a professional and methodical immersion into the victim\'s life soon turns into a haunting obsession.','/9IHnpje2aZ6TI6B385BqGfhcMuB.jpg','2022-07-13',114,'Released','Some crimes will haunt you.','The Night of the 12th',925102,4.7853,6.9,'58s-pXvTQss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30054,_binary '\0','/sDK2DMOHfqIeS5EFFAt9stFcTWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1695405',5.6,4820,'en','The Loneliest Planet','Backpacking in the Caucasus Mountains, walking for hours, an engaged couple and their tour guide trade anecdotes and play games to pass the time, until a momentary misstep, that takes only two or three seconds, changes everything.','/9ZWKbwa9eZvqJJhh5BJQRZRMGTs.jpg','2012-05-25',113,'Released',NULL,'The Loneliest Planet',82321,1.3093,5.7,'W_0cZnM0l8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30055,_binary '\0','/mekK9e3Qh3cvEuosDtUjkMm5z6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1695800',8.2,6751,'ml','പ്രാഞ്ചിയേട്ടൻ & The Saint','While Pranchiyettan, a devotee of St. Francis of Assissi, attains the best of riches, he is unsatisfied with his reputation and sets off to popularise himself as a celebrity in society.','/lUuvRncu2qopplvguE7IdXVbU9R.jpg','2010-09-10',147,'Released',NULL,'Pranchiyettan & The Saint',79897,1.2046,7.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30056,_binary '\0','/nnIV7gR1QhgPcytfOayMqOldKXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1695831',7.2,1582,'is','Eldfjall','Hannes is an old man who has grown apart from his children. Recently retired when his wife gets ill he tries to reconcile with them and to atone for his cold demeanor in the past.','/zQ6EzF5s4zEeoUHFVZVCg18bsC3.jpg','2011-09-30',95,'Released',NULL,'Volcano',91913,0.9631,6.9,'0QYgHfSk22o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30057,_binary '\0','/Als2QyqbLgT5G3rwTGJta8QQfqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1695843',6,50870,'en','Haunted Mansion','A woman and her son enlist a motley crew of so-called spiritual experts to help rid their home of supernatural squatters.','/8Im6DknDVxRiGXc5t8rVOJyzuNx.jpg','2023-07-26',123,'Released','Home is where the haunt is.','Haunted Mansion',616747,12.811,6.434,'AjLKTz81bj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30058,_binary '\0','/1Ub6KssTM5gOCtxtikoeNLsibDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1695994',4.5,4063,'en','The Virginity Hit','Four guys, one camera, and their experience chronicling the exhilarating and terrifying rite of passage: losing your virginity. As these guys help their buddy get laid, they\'ll have to survive friends with benefits, Internet hookups, even porn stars during an adventure that proves why you will always remember your first time.','/krUYZAjEZ5n5GL7tuLoQGfxja0S.jpg','2010-09-24',120,'Released',NULL,'The Virginity Hit',42889,2.5982,4.4,'dA8BUZWpVkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30059,_binary '\0','/yC8xzyCEGHEn20qrhIaMLKJPWDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1696190',7,3117,'lt','Tadas Blinda. Pradžia','A romance blooms between a noblewoman and a common man amid a peasant revolt against the brutal Russian army','/301GtjRNJet4k1Wtqayju2Q3R34.jpg','2011-01-01',111,'Released','It takes a burning soul to spark the flame of freedom','Fireheart: The Legend of Tadas Blinda',82331,0.8234,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30060,_binary '\0','/fLBMZVAV75my1nFg4JR0fKOu4ho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1696192',3.8,4113,'en','A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!','The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series\' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy\'s fairies\' magic in order to promote his oil business.','/h94rbv7xBNJUgweD5pMK7cpqwMO.jpg','2011-07-09',57,'Released',NULL,'A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!',70338,4.2515,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30061,_binary '\0','/wJjloWiEQ3HJcUFU8gpwK0kdRkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16968790',6.5,1776,'en','Curious Caterer: Dying for Chocolate','Goldy is a spirited single mom who’s thrust into the role of town sleuth to help solve a friend’s mysterious death. With the clock ticking to find the culprit, Goldy strikes up an unlikely partnership with Detective Tom Schultz, who leans into Goldy’s local knowledge. As their relationship shows signs of becoming something more, the suspect list rises. Will Goldy narrow in on the killer before the killer narrows in on her?','/7quPRcCVUmMBxKO58QwPuIADtYG.jpg','2022-04-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Curious Caterer: Dying for Chocolate',936897,4.3184,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30062,_binary '\0','/dnl5cnGrCojp8WqXO4lQwDsJGBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1697064',6.3,8458,'en','Educazione siberiana','The story of a gang of children growing up in a community of banished criminals, in a forgotten corner of the former Soviet Union. This community rejects the world outside. The only law it obeys… is its own. Against this backdrop two best friends, Kolyma and Gagarin, gradually become fierce enemies as they find themselves on opposite sides of the strict code of honour of the ‘honest criminal’ brotherhood.','/pSXguX0FmIvRr7r85uSZW96tLut.jpg','2013-02-27',110,'Released','In the mid-1980s, a Siberian gang leader is exiled to a small town on the Ukrainian border where he teaches his grandson the “honest criminal” code.','Siberian Education',171337,3.6778,6.795,'Mg4r4c49PIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30063,_binary '\0','/qe0oK0A5ovrlgH39Ga13dxxw9MU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16970906',3.3,1865,'en','Sheroes','When four thick-as-thieves friends arrive in Thailand, they quickly find themselves in over their heads. Fighting to stay alive, they employ their unique set of skills and unleash their fierce loyalty in a heart-pumping battle for survival.','/itUAkQmihFmRxMYTa3AkvIzMCV4.jpg','2023-06-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Sheroes',1130818,3.3564,5.8,'wGaiW4xRHEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30064,_binary '\0','/AmwVIWnm7fljI9kwgE7hut8InfW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16970976',5.8,3512,'en','Battleground Melbourne','The story of the Fall of the World\'s Most Liveable City, through the eyes of those who risked everything to save it.','/vsFyNmsqBIQbEdP6XZfHH27DMTM.jpg','2022-01-13',102,'Released','The fall of the World’s Most Liveable City, through the eyes of those who tried to save it.','Battleground Melbourne',926531,1.0144,9.5,'i-p_nE9spqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30065,_binary '\0','/orEVSaVSRNElwjB7GZI3vsOKMS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16977750',7.8,1534,'en','Sidney','This revealing documentary honors the legendary Sidney Poitier—iconic actor, filmmaker, and civil rights activist. Featuring interviews with Denzel Washington, Spike Lee, Halle Berry, and more.','/cVdkjqmIipF2DCvDwt16BRv7e9o.jpg','2022-09-10',112,'Released','The life and legacy.','Sidney',961722,4.607,6.941,'ZIt0bGwe1rY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30066,_binary '\0','/zJIyrAt24I48Kz26ffu8dFpB6UQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1697800',4.6,6526,'en','Die in a Gunfight','Mary and Ben are the star-crossed black sheep of two powerful families engaged in a centuries-long feud. When the pair reignite a romance after many years apart, their forbidden love draws a motley assortment of schemers and killers into their orbit, and as fists and bullets fly, it becomes clear that violent delights will have violent ends.','/byXLJZq5vfveYdAWaC4uMtojsWj.jpg','2021-07-01',92,'Released','Love is messy.','Die in a Gunfight',481879,4.4266,5.2,'1kw7Nv1mIF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30067,_binary '\0','/lpYER5hPpg1NHki8EVmcDeWi1vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1697851',7.1,7572,'en','Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe','Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we\'ve come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam\'s last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the \"Espada Ardiente\" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he\'d imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic\'s doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.','/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg','2011-04-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe',61537,2.0067,6.374,'dWXxgpyIm2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30068,_binary '\0','/tMjbe5NoKkuMuaX6RR1C5XFwPdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698008',2.6,2643,'en','Super Shark','An offshore drilling accident triggers the release of a giant prehistoric shark. When marine biologist Kat Carmichael arrives, she runs up against corporate front man Roger Wade, who plots with Stewart to disrupt her investigation. With the help of Skipper Chuck and disc jockey Dynamite Stevens, Kat tries to find a way to defeat the monster which has evolved to a state where it can walk on dry land and fly...it\'s the SUPER SHARK!','/5hLiYCnO00t7Q0dWjtZKUvGh5pJ.jpg','2011-12-08',87,'Released','Bikinis, bullets & big bites.','Super Shark',83880,2.3785,4,'g1AN3FEpkT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30069,_binary '\0','/7wqvISZl4TYey6CQ4iwZu0k2kA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698010',7.9,6832,'en','TT3D: Closer to the Edge','By vividly recounting the TT\'s legendary rivalries and the Isle of Man\'s unique road racing history, this 3D feature documentary discovers why modern TT riders still risk their lives to win the world\'s most dangerous race. The Isle of Man Tourist Trophy is the greatest motorcycle road race in the world, the ultimate challenge for rider and machine. It has always called for a commitment far beyond any other racing event, and many have made the ultimate sacrifice in their quest for victory. A story about freedom of choice, the strength of human spirit and the will to win. It\'s also an examination of what motivates those rare few, this elite band of brothers who risk everything to win.','/xTpacyxa9ly5UPfgogsmf83g2zt.jpg','2011-04-22',104,'Released','Just because you\'re breathing doesn\'t mean you\'re alive.','TT3D: Closer to the Edge',79628,1.8671,7.6,'5SzffK8nxxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30070,_binary '\0','/v5gfib323vzrROVbJ1fKKMWvqhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16982622',6.4,1479,'en','Norwegian Dream','Robert moves from the Polish countryside to work on a fish processing factory on the coast of Norway. There he falls in love with Ivar who is openly gay and a member of the workers union. Robert is hiding his sexual orientation from the other Polish immigrant workers. When Ivar helps the Polish to start a strike for better working conditions at the factory, Robert has to choose between money or love.','/pGz461zc5RfLcuSrDYY5YM9RTCo.jpg','2023-03-06',98,'Released','When the world is against you, choose hope','Norwegian Dream',1071715,1.4749,5.9,'FX2-RE5n7kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30071,_binary '\0','/aaEpmSJTR9BpPjCg8YqLkJ3AEnp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698641',6.2,49338,'en','Alexander and the Terrible, Horrible, No Good, Very Bad Day','Alexander\'s day begins with gum stuck in his hair, followed by more calamities. Though he finds little sympathy from his family and begins to wonder if bad things only happen to him, his mom, dad, brother, and sister all find themselves living through their own terrible, horrible, no good, very bad day.','/pxbAepXQjsGFDHaR3dPndFSxDU0.jpg','2014-10-08',81,'Released','One day can change everything.','Alexander and the Terrible, Horrible, No Good, Very Bad Day',218778,5.02,6.2,'bQ4C-RoKDQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30072,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698647',6.5,2058,'en','Delirium','Set in a world where love is deemed illegal and can be eradicated with a special procedure. With 95 days to go until her scheduled treatment, Lena Holoway does the unthinkable, she falls in love.','/mJXHsvyg1SlxtIFg5yO38ODjdwx.jpg','2014-06-20',52,'Released','A brave new world without love','Delirium',279828,1.5173,6.2,'mBv7OhUCOeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30073,_binary '\0','/nDPfwJChKbTi6m8mUinl8aV0St4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698648',5.7,16540,'en','Girl Most Likely','A failed New York playwright stages a suicide in an attempt to win back her ex, only to wind up in the custody of her gambling-addict mother.','/6chqhaNb2TwyaMeknbThUzziPWq.jpg','2012-09-07',103,'Released','She has a lot to live up to. And a few things to live down.','Girl Most Likely',72890,3.4722,5.6,'CavL9yoWxPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30074,_binary '\0','/h2NUhJzdIZF8IWxiTMNU6PSYerL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1698652',7.2,2018,'en','Champs','A documentary about the sport of boxing, as seen through the eyes of champions Mike Tyson, Evander Holyfield and Bernard Hopkins.','/tFN3IDKbPPyVOrEAkN4bLqBHb7W.jpg','2015-03-13',86,'Released',NULL,'Champs',262436,1.221,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30075,_binary '\0','/3MlOdGahzlASqDWCRl6x474Fphk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16986596',3.6,2563,'en','Sons of Summer','To mark the anniversary of his father\'s death, Sean takes his friends on a road trip to his surfer dad\'s favorite beach. But Sean\'s drug-dealing friend forces him to do one last favor – steal a heroin shipment from a local mobster.','/d69N1b1bPBBUwo9YQ6M2WKotLpm.jpg','2023-07-28',87,'Released','He\'s in for the ride of his life.','Sons of Summer',1152238,2.0825,6.3,'CR53TmQVakM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30076,_binary '\0','/lbdrPA3KezeiNN09cPpjsFHitWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt16987062',6.6,2165,'fr','La Syndicaliste','The true story of the Irish national Maureen Kearney- head tradeunion representative-turned-whistleblower of a French multinational nuclear powerhouse. After denouncing top-secret deals that shook the sector, Kearney’s life is suddenly turned upside-down when she is violently assaulted in her own house.','/ppx4Njse3xKDDAylXH5EryaJfa.jpg','2023-03-01',122,'Released',NULL,'La Syndicaliste',925714,2.7083,6.6,'2em_31HEBA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30077,_binary '\0','/zH8SawqKdafKcVmJzyVvhCvuhkT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699135',5.8,3627,'da','Klassefesten','\'The Renion\' is a new Danish comedy starring Troels Lyby, Nicolaj Copernicus and Anders W. Berthelsen. The three highschool friends Niels (Nicolaj Copernicus), Andreas (Anders W. Berthelsen) and Thomas (Troels Lyby) are invited to their 25 years anniversary. While Niels and Andrew struggles with not feeling like participating, Thomas is of a different opinion. Having arranged an all-time weekend of drinks, ladies and blowing off steam! The big question is: Will they actually survive the Copenhagen nightlife ... and will they even get to the reunion?. \'The Reunion\' is a Danish comedy about old friends, that realises, at some point they are going to grow up and have to behave as adults... AS IF!','/gNBbyQ9kCw8rs6wkLxGy3degC3Y.jpg','2011-10-13',91,'Released','Why was everything more fun back then?','The Reunion',89877,1.1212,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30078,_binary '\0','/tHkiNBnEmjvC1tnzk9p3c5frQBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699147',6.2,4789,'en','Seven Days in Utopia','Talent can only get you so far. For golfer Luke Chisholm, that turns out to be Utopia, Texas -- where he\'s left stranded after blowing his pro debut.','/2KB7YLO7UXALmWUZLPFnR7bUE7f.jpg','2011-09-02',98,'Released','Life is never the same once you\'ve been to Utopia.','Seven Days in Utopia',70876,2.3259,5.7,'C0oUpqz2FJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30079,_binary '\0','/4aefYwXWvip0ZqDHZ8D3jAVHXBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699163',6.2,1297,'no','Varg Veum - Dødens drabanter','Varg Veum investigates the murder of a married couple; prime suspect is the stepson, but Veum does not think he is guilty. Not even when he confesses.','/cp7lSi7PRrx9kro9AiXHPTVLRaX.jpg','2011-04-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Varg Veum - The Consorts of Death',55614,1.5885,6.2,'V8gFdzSM0_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30080,_binary '\0','/sla76Gd6EPxiXR96kCCjs32IBOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699164',6.1,1358,'no','Varg Veum - Svarte får','Varg Veum promises his girlfriend that he will find her sister who has vanished.','/6lmW3VcRChr2dS6EcSwXgrf9mQ9.jpg','2011-01-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Varg Veum - Black Sheep',55612,2.5118,5.7,'1tvd2eH6uNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30081,_binary '\0','/5sbDYEDOdYymf7LESKiceAmPlQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699185',6.6,1519,'fr','Les hommes libres','In Paris during WWII, an Algerian immigrant is inspired to join the resistance by his unexpected friendship with a Jewish man. Based on not very known facts about the Muslim community in Paris during WWII, when the Paris Mosque and its dynamic leader played a pivotal role in supporting the resistance and rescuing Jews.','/wIxYcEJUrv75MmQ5RTColWcH7TW.jpg','2011-09-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Free Men',85741,1.6423,5.7,'dq1V4vXgiYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30082,_binary '\0','/xVk88jDcOhKl318vkcVrkPmHoG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699195',7.3,4875,'ar','طير أنت','Baheeg is a shy veterinarian who secretly loves Laila, the owner of a sick puppy in his clinic. On his birthday, Baheeg finds a genie who grants him many wishes in order to graduate from genie school. Baheeg tries through his wishes to attract Laila\'s attention by becoming many different characters in hopes that she will fall for love him.','/pWm1ZCvEgMjHuJn1kathmtjAdYO.jpg','2009-07-15',117,'Released',NULL,'Fly Out',60179,0.9862,7,'-eROEcDMpog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30083,_binary '\0','/xWELQ7vmBBtEZxy74rYLa6vQw8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699225',7.6,3162,'en','Beyond the Blackboard','Inspired by a true story, “Beyond the Blackboard” is about a 24-year-old first-time teacher who makes a difference in the lives of the homeless children she teaches in a shelter’s makeshift classroom. Set in 1987 in Albuquerque, New Mexico, this movie tells the story a brand-new teacher and Mom who is given a tougher than expected teaching job and winds up teaching homeless children in a school that is housed in a room and called, literally, The School with No Name. She has some personal prejudicial hurdles to cross before she is able to be a true teacher for these children and of course there are hurdles like the lack of books and supplies.','/alz6CH9i5EmQJhlT5qLKGOq8YdL.jpg','2011-04-24',100,'Released','A first-time teacher makes a difference in the lives of homeless children','Beyond the Blackboard',60895,2.8781,7.5,'YNpaHnTt4eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30084,_binary '\0','/mHMwoMPLkWHsMeNtFZSNSUOOJ1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699231',5.2,23711,'en','Quarantine 2: Terminal','A plane is taken over by a mysterious virus. When the plane lands it is placed under quarantine. Now a group of survivors must band together to survive the quarantine.','/ouQOquRqqaO8sPAziD4BFoNO1Pb.jpg','2011-06-16',86,'Released','The most deadly mutant virus just went airborne... and escape is not an option.','Quarantine 2: Terminal',59115,3.8873,5.705,'9o4f2QAU_4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30085,_binary '\0','/2ADD5cncyDmVaRUOem22jZy1Bdh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699491',6.1,2549,'sv','Hur många lingon finns det i världen','Alex\'s high opinion of himself isn\'t backed up by reality as he is unemployed and having trouble with his girlfriend. When he finally gets a job with the local council/municipality of Hudiksvall his life is about to change. Suddenly Alex finds himself the leader of a local theatre group of people with learning difficulties. Through their work together, Alex comes to appreciate that we all have our own talents which can grow if given the opportunity and support. \"The Importance of Tying Your Own Shoes\" is based on the work of the Glada Hudik Theatre whose performances have met with success in Sweden and internationally since it was formed in 1996.','/e0L1jRNsOx701koCy6ie4Qj0icd.jpg','2011-03-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Importance of Tying Your Own Shoes',60592,1.6206,6.4,'8WCavWZIUic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30086,_binary '\0','/qLZNVqSIU7S3FDL6a8nBNb739eJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699513',3.1,6513,'zh','建党伟业','A chronicle of the events that led to the founding of the Chinese Communist Party.','/dw4lcKrxY5JwEzh09g7Vyt7Xc4q.jpg','2011-06-23',124,'Released',NULL,'Beginning of the Great Revival',69310,4.3605,4.7,'i1-yuI2DOQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30087,_binary '\0','/uJSuJ4eocpofYc6LjEJ7G3vgbfS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699518',6.6,7942,'fr','Le Jeune Karl Marx','26 year-old Karl Marx embarks with his wife, Jenny, on the road to exile. In 1844 in Paris, he meets Friedrich Engels, an industrialist’s son, who has been investigating the sordid birth of the British working class. Engels, the dandy, provides the last piece of the puzzle to the young Karl Marx’s new vision of the world. Together, between censorship and the police’s repression, riots and political upheavals, they will lead the labor movement during its development into a modern era.','/4VwBXiCzXKJyHfRdVBb843m23dx.jpg','2017-03-02',118,'Released',NULL,'The Young Karl Marx',400020,2.8019,6.833,'qssSV56-wO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30088,_binary '\0','/5xN3McEMUVJredTSr9Jc8pXKJO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699746',5.4,4336,'en','Christmas Cupid','Sloan is beautiful, stylish, and on the fast track to success at her public relations firm. After her client Caitlin ends up in a coma and becomes her own personal ghost of Christmas past, present, and future; she finds out first hand that her unethical ways needs to change and reuniting with a past jilted lover may be the answer.','/ldW5GWiktjjakPa8yZWnCK8Z0Dz.jpg','2010-12-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Cupid',52060,2.4941,5.8,'2qtPpH-CRHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30089,_binary '\0','/lw0C0wuJoOB3yy4RXrdzL42dnhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1699755',5.4,5259,'en','Peeples','Hoping to propose to his upper-crust girlfriend, Wade Walker crashes her family\'s annual reunion and lands in a face-off with her dad.','/6ZBSsBfxKK5GdTzz1BOKGl4BnzJ.jpg','2013-05-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Peeples',72359,2.3052,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30090,_binary '\0','/oIFtnPkM3jqbq4kGlEjhARvhIxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700258',6.2,10902,'de','Kokowääh','Henry is a playboy who has no idea that he is the father of a beautiful, cute girl out of a One-night-Stand. Her mother left the daughter in front of Henry door after her husband realized after 8 years of marriage that he is not the father so their relationship now is breaking up... By the way: Kokowääh, is how a German (in this case an 8 Year old child) that has never heard the dish before - would pronounce \"Coq Au Vin\" (chicken in a wine sauce).','/s1xlGUJhPlqRa1FF6Uw73UXuEUS.jpg','2011-02-03',115,'Released',NULL,'Kokowääh',53174,3.1563,6.2,'uaYN8rtxEAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30091,_binary '\0','/oNtyzgl0Y2wTCGy87aViKqi5MBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700423',6.2,3217,'nl','Gooische Vrouwen','Gooische Vrouwen (Vipers Nest) is based on a very popular Dutch TV series and can be described as a Dutch variation of Sex and the City and Desperate Housewives. The film tells the story of four girlfriends who live in the bourgeois area ‘t Gooi, where life always seems to run smoothly, but dark clouds are gathering on the horizon. A flight seems the only way out…','/d0RFSjjcvoMHhRBZBcGLLBHvNAL.jpg','2011-03-10',105,'Released',NULL,'Gooische Vrouwen',63996,1.8972,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30092,_binary '\0','/7W7bUPJGEyg3ey9ZIdthXGTaUQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700467',6.1,2041,'fr','L\'Art d\'aimer','Several interconnected chapters follow a variety of Parisian couples navigating love, desire, and relationships. Isabelle, frustrated by a year of celibacy, rejects her friend Zoé’s offer to \"borrow\" her husband and instead impersonates their mutual friend Amélie, who cannot bring herself to sleep with her close friend Boris. Meanwhile, the lonely Achille is stunned when his alluring new neighbor appears at his door in a negligee, proposing an affair. Elsewhere, middle-aged Emmanuelle struggles with an overwhelming attraction to every handsome man she encounters, threatening her marriage, while a young couple wrestles with jealousy. Each chapter delves into the unpredictability of love with humor and poignancy.','/cBDqfxQpRCMSRvmj4uPVhO8ykMI.jpg','2011-11-23',85,'Released',NULL,'The Art of Love',92424,2.3397,5.9,'Yz1Vt8KQfEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30093,_binary '\0','/gvyQBlNTO5DTIabdlAo6yBZH36U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700494',3.1,1568,'tr','Türkler Çıldırmış Olmalı','The famous businessman Fahri and his family are kidnapped by Somali pirates. The pirates demand a large ransom from Turkey for the release of the businessman and his family. The Turkish government decides to form an illegal team for this task. Colonel Mehmet, who has been imprisoned for a long time, is offered this mission in exchange for his release. Mehmet, along with six people selected from the prisoners, will try to rescue Fahri and his family.','/XSvRXJdfJffcIWxVvg36LixvMv.jpg','2009-11-27',100,'Released',NULL,'The Turks Must Be Crazy',37575,0.9802,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30094,_binary '\0','/zzbEAP5d1Ci0QKitpaA8PykHIj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17007120',6.3,10834,'en','The Beanie Bubble','Ty was a frustrated toy salesman until his collaboration with three women turned his stuffed animals into a defining \'90s trend. This behind-the-scenes look at history\'s biggest toy craze is a wild story about what—and who—is valued in this world.','/9YDW8dCrQyRpppK5985hKY1Mc8X.jpg','2023-07-21',110,'Released','The crazy behind the craze.','The Beanie Bubble',926008,7.2323,6.4,'KV32siOI9mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30095,_binary '\0','/1WoPau7XK17cWQGAOxmyisud0Iq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700808',6.2,4058,'en','Fast Girls','A street smart runner develops an intense rivalry with an equally ambitious wealthy young athlete.','/wrsIUs4esWv3oncNpRI4ERon4bF.jpg','2012-06-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Fast Girls',113294,3.4018,6,'qau_N4wYx-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30096,_binary '\0','/hsb8nNBt3emvWqBs7Xv5IKlz6Im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700841',6.1,229213,'en','Sausage Party','Hot dog Frank leads a group of supermarket products on a quest to discover the truth about their existence and what really happens when they\'re chosen to leave the grocery store.','/vNgdPJQ5CI60oEiiHLKRNrsDhMy.jpg','2016-07-11',89,'Released','Get your fill.','Sausage Party',223702,13.1621,5.749,'GAJrBPUVDJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30097,_binary '\0','/iAyzpvldbIxLdDIjRMOJoBORola.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700844',6.2,17594,'en','The Deep Blue Sea','The wife of a British Judge is caught in a self-destructive love affair with a Royal Air Force pilot.','/tZAXsFxxYWWSpEy5XQtdBaETYoc.jpg','2011-11-25',98,'Released','Beware of passion...','The Deep Blue Sea',51994,4.065,5.9,'MIQR_99II3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30098,_binary '\0','/3CXIH1cc3Da9Ubk5Xgzqh5a88QS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1700845',6.1,11007,'en','The Invisible Woman','In 1857, at the height of his fame and fortune, novelist and social critic Charles Dickens meets and falls in love with teenage stage actress Nelly Ternan. As she becomes the focus of his heart and mind, as well as his muse, painful secrecy is the price both must pay.','/1qurTmuj36prAz4BG71hC9r2n02.jpg','2013-12-25',111,'Released','His greatest story was the one he could never tell.','The Invisible Woman',111473,3.6924,5.914,'OV77JsmAAAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30099,_binary '\0','/nvW0QfRJ7ga9TK8DKwBfAPA8ywP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17009348',6.8,23488,'fr','Dogman','A boy, bruised by life, finds his salvation through the love of his dogs.','/5RuUD7J4vO0El7TRL9guZIik0I0.jpg','2023-09-27',115,'Released','Wherever there is an unfortunate, God sends a dog.','Dogman',944401,8.7288,7.8,'8-IceYBT584','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30100,_binary '\0','/lDVl2jf6VB8ODl1olZ6FLvOV1gX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17009710',7.6,237691,'fr','Anatomie d\'une chute','A woman is suspected of her husband\'s murder, and their blind son faces a moral dilemma as the sole witness.','/kQs6keheMwCxJxrzV83VUwFtHkB.jpg','2023-08-23',151,'Released','Did she do it?','Anatomy of a Fall',915935,18.1878,7.512,'FUXawkH-ONM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30101,_binary '\0','/242MiRZ2x6N0OyeStFiIzwyBnw3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17009856',6.8,2224,'fr','Le Lycéen','Lucas is a 17-year-old gay teenager coping with the sudden and unexpected death of his father in an accident that may or may not have been suicide. He views his life as a wild animal in need of taming. Between a brother settled in Paris and a mother with whom he now lives alone, Lucas will have to fight to rediscover hope and love.','/qHRlWadU9QFZNP5TZcyEJVwYP2B.jpg','2022-11-30',123,'Released',NULL,'Winter Boy',918044,2.7165,6.621,'3iCIxtmpdug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30102,_binary '\0','/krkiarKAcnw9dSFpxf9qfJWSuu3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1701210',6.6,13267,'en','Black Gold','On the Arabian Peninsula in the 1930s, two warring leaders come face to face. The victorious Nesib, Emir of Hobeika, lays down his peace terms to rival Amar, Sultan of Salmaah. The two men agree that neither can lay claim to the area of no man’s land between them called The Yellow Belt. In return, Nesib adopts Amar’s two boys Saleeh and Auda as a guarantee against invasion. Twelve years later, Saleeh and Auda have grown into young men. Saleeh, the warrior, itches to escape his gilded cage and return to his father’s land. Auda cares only for books and the pursuit of knowledge. One day, their adopted father Nesib is visited by an American from Texas. He tells the Emir that his land is blessed with oil and promises him riches beyond his wildest imagination. Nesib imagines a realm of infinite possibility, a kingdom with roads, schools and hospitals all paid for by the black gold beneath the barren sand. There is only one problem. The precious oil is located in the Yellow Belt.','/9ikn974ObBFOnIre7JE4tDwQnGd.jpg','2011-12-21',130,'Released',NULL,'Black Gold',77221,4.1791,6.5,'4oDVE5nSVsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30103,_binary '\0','/gG6TwnmnEqkyrIEb2SNGwVTqDE2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1701224',4.8,3311,'en','My Name Is \'A\' by Anonymous','Directed and created by Shane Ryan, the movie was shot shortly after the events which inspired it (15 year old Alyssa Bustamante was convicted of killing her 9 year old neighbor, Elizabeth Olten). Compared to the likes of David Lynch, Larry Clark, Harmony Korine and John Cassavetes, the film dares the audience to watch it, confronting issues with kids and teenagers often sugar-coated by Hollywood. The movie tackles hard-hitting subjects like self mutilation by teen girls, bullying, rape, bulimia (showcasing the actual damage it does to a girl\'s body) and, of course, the murder.','/f7AOHMQ8kdr31T5VHhH7FhHjL2p.jpg','2012-10-19',90,'Released',NULL,'My Name Is \'A\' by Anonymous',228080,1.6176,1.5,'a1GyyoiXVew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30104,_binary '\0','/oAS8TTaS8IwwoZZ2hqO6mF2zbER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1701976',7.3,2385,'en','Urbanized','A documentary about the design of cities, which looks at the issues and strategies behind urban design and features some of the world\'s foremost architects, planners, policymakers, builders, and thinkers.','/AlgE2Xj02j2Bb75eYfgDuPCzev2.jpg','2011-09-09',85,'Released','A documentary film by Gary Hustwit','Urbanized',77269,1.0951,7.3,'qHWwxBEfikw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30105,_binary '\0','/dIejmkCP46vN5a17u44phOGyAVR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1701990',5.6,17496,'en','Detention','As a killer named Cinderhella stalks the student body at the high school in Grizzly Lake, a group of co-eds band together to survive while they\'re all serving detention.','/wLuMoe16Z27DH96B2vg4FQNiAjj.jpg','2012-04-06',93,'Released','Cancel Your Future','Detention',68684,2.8134,5.6,'CXAGH-Q3e_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30106,_binary '\0','/n1d72dX1ZC00MabxftWnqqhPQEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702009',3.1,2549,'en','Strippers vs. Werewolves','Mickey, who happens to be a werewolf and a crime boss, gets all worked up and hairy during a private dance at a strip club. Justice, the dancer, grabs the nearest weapon and lands a fatal blow: her silver fountain pen right through Mickey\'s wolfed-out eye. This ignites a small-scale war between Mickey\'s group of werewolf mobsters and the sultry strippers of Vixens.','/OscWRpUcnqhgqxMJQCxVCwa5ss.jpg','2012-04-27',93,'Released',NULL,'Strippers vs. Werewolves',94603,2.0961,3.9,'ZT2Sw-iqfuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30107,_binary '\0','/wMDg5cm1xIieCTINQo6drZWIy8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702014',7.9,29917,'pt','Hoje Eu Quero Voltar Sozinho','Leonardo is a blind teenager dealing with an overprotective mother while trying to live a more independent life. To the disappointment of his best friend, Giovana, he plans to go on an exchange program abroad. When Gabriel, a new student in town, arrives at their classroom, new feelings blossom in Leonardo making him question his plans.','/2BhhlAYwKvONGW7tr16ZhnD0sym.jpg','2014-04-10',96,'Released','Not every love happens at first sight.','The Way He Looks',237791,3.9638,7.912,'rcb0VnB2vnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30108,_binary '\0','/Lu57GTE24Ja5O61jieY2aIBk8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17023012',5.5,11134,'en','The Home','A troubled man starts working at a retirement home and realizes its residents and caretakers harbor sinister secrets. As he investigates the building and its forbidden fourth floor, he starts to uncover connections to his own past and upbringing as a foster child.','/qyGY1k5GqAORsVhfZA3gFKirZWD.jpg','2025-07-24',95,'Released','Evil never gets old.','The Home',926606,5.3943,6.855,'EVjvYF_geAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30109,_binary '\0','/tuOGlHRCgBAnMwHgcwUyq9htqXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702425',5.5,22193,'en','Casa de Mi Padre','Scheming of a way to save their father\'s ranch, the Alvarez brothers find themselves in a war with Mexico\'s most feared drug lord.','/kVCc7xwTAlckBofazrwIz8x1TXC.jpg','2012-03-15',84,'Released','Funniest movie you\'ll ever read.','Casa de Mi Padre',80304,4.087,5.3,'01IYDy2Gdk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30110,_binary '\0','/4CEVoTSP3R0NMWUYbbOtfM3bwsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702429',6.3,3280,'en','Eisenstein in Guanajuato','In 1931, following the success of the film Battleship Potemkin, Soviet filmmaker Sergei Eisenstein travels to the city of Guanajuato, Mexico, to shoot a new film. Freshly rejected by Hollywood, Eisenstein soon falls under Mexico’s spell. Chaperoned by his guide Palomino Cañedo, the director opens up to his suppressed fears as he embraces a new world of sensual pleasures and possibilities that will shape the future of his art.','/gpNz2BmVeeJU82QIpWfLArhgBUH.jpg','2015-02-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Eisenstein in Guanajuato',121869,1.7697,6.132,'fb364B6u1XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30111,_binary '\0','/kUDzb7V5XuDHpY17lk8NQykiW5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702439',6.7,122358,'en','Safe Haven','A young woman with a mysterious past lands in Southport, North Carolina where her bond with a widower forces her to confront the dark secret that haunts her.','/2CbJ3HTb6SFbMeguYH52UQSHOwY.jpg','2013-02-07',115,'Released','You know it when you find it.','Safe Haven',112949,7.9956,7.2,'SCCdqVFA-88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30112,_binary '\0','/wsuO9N3t89buTgtzJ5vUMBCHBB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1702443',1.7,76078,'en','Justin Bieber: Never Say Never','Tells the story of Justin Bieber, the kid from Canada with the hair, the smile and the voice: It chronicles his unprecedented rise to fame, all the way from busking in the streets of Stratford, Canada to putting videos on YouTube to selling out Madison Square Garden in New York as the headline act during the My World Tour from 2010. It features Usher, Scooter Braun, Ludacris, Sean Kingston, Antonio \"L.A.\" Reid, Boyz II Men, Miley Cyrus, Jaden Smith, Justin\'s family members and parts of his crew and huge fanbase in a mix of interviews and guest performances.','/dGNMD5XTBQN3teIth21ohKOCJcR.jpg','2011-02-11',105,'Released','Find out what\'s possible if you never give up.','Justin Bieber: Never Say Never',54518,3.9194,5.173,'trpxwhiatLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30113,_binary '\0','/gystuaqp5AkVqqu3Nf0564zeOv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17024450',6.8,165822,'en','The Equalizer 3','Robert McCall finds himself at home in Southern Italy but he discovers his friends are under the control of local crime bosses. As events turn deadly, McCall knows what he has to do: become his friends\' protector by taking on the mafia.','/b0Ej6fnXAP8fK75hlyi2jKqdhHz.jpg','2023-08-30',109,'Released','Justice knows no borders','The Equalizer 3',926393,26.2725,7.294,'19ikl8vy4zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30114,_binary '\0','/pfmmfFu2bLEwcbWuXNPainWPOkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703048',6.8,5360,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO -ナルト- 疾風伝 ザ・ロストタワー','Assigned on a mission to capture Mukade, a missing-nin, Naruto Uzumaki sets out for the once glorious historic ruins of \"Ouran\", where he pursues and corners the rouge ninja. Mukade\'s goal is revealed to be a dormant leyline within the ruins; he unleashes the power of the leyline, causing a light to envelop Naruto, sending him into the past, 20 years before the series began. When Naruto awakens, he comes into contact with the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze.','/6e2YvN1tQK4xQHlmy7GJTuXOt2u.jpg','2010-07-31',85,'Released',NULL,'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Lost Tower',50723,6.8396,7.162,'hPerisY9Ppg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30115,_binary '\0','/1MWwdzZAdEac2VRkvNWRAWx340s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703049',7.4,6411,'ja','トライガン バッドランド ランブル','In a quicksand surrounded town called Makka, rumors spread of a legendary robber named Gasback is after the town. To protect it, Mayor Kepler has hired bounty hunters. These hunters have been following Gasback from town to town in hopes of getting the bounty. Vash the Stampede is in town, along with Meryl and Milly, along with the female bounty hunter Amelia and Nicholas D. Wolfwood.','/7JYK0FBs2nX6ikqeT6rDzEZRM.jpg','2010-04-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Trigun: Badlands Rumble',51859,3.0357,7.5,'bjIUbn-4FRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30116,_binary '\0','/eFe03Aht63Y2ZBOXhxajvD3Svvh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703125',5.7,2874,'en','Someday This Pain Will Be Useful to You','Precocious yet sensitive teenager James has a deep perception of the world but no idea how to live in it. Finding no help from his divorced parents nor his older memoir-writing sister, he decides to reject the beliefs adults try to push on him, starting with the college career that is looming over his last summer in New York, and embarks instead on a search for wisdom through nontraditional means...','/ibNxEHRsxZBBT82vu7iD3gsl67k.jpg','2012-02-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Someday This Pain Will Be Useful to You',93676,2.3793,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30117,_binary '\0','/fAsuiSAYRg0iadijOdEqK9CO6kY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703148',6.7,42988,'en','The Hunter','Martin, a mercenary, is sent from Europe by an anonymous biotech company to the Tasmanian wilderness on a hunt for the last Tasmanian tiger.','/KgFYNh3GE36FrXjo9udZbnV1z6.jpg','2011-10-06',102,'Released','Some mysteries should never be solved.','The Hunter',70954,3.9259,6.651,'KgfB9kebFNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30118,_binary '\0','/mZdvVaC59aYRKKcl96hiia2nQp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703199',6.1,72287,'en','Grave Encounters','A crew from a paranormal reality television show lock themselves in a haunted psychiatric hospital. They search for evidence of paranormal activity as they shoot what ends up becoming their final episode.','/8vnsB3Rg9Gb91UOaecXRb7dYB37.jpg','2011-09-09',93,'Released','They were searching for proof... they found it.','Grave Encounters',50698,5.7517,6.3,'Qn3fDvUXFps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30119,_binary '\0','/xSC3PiNopaTnTbJWgcJOhzDzQE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703824',6.2,2605,'no','Kong Curling','Once a great curling star, Truls Paulsen is diagnosed with obsessive-compulsive disorder and banned from competition. But when he learns that his old friend and coach Gordon is on his deathbed, Truls, heavily-medicated decides to compete again, in the hopes of winning money for Gordon to have an operation in the US. Truls stops taking the meds and tries to convince his old team mates that he is mentally stable enough to lead them to victory in the Norwegian Curling Championship. But, is it a good sign that he obsessively insists his teammates pull their zippers all the way up before they can play?','/6jud1vtsG2J6BLMhX4LpH7JJE3B.jpg','2011-09-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Curling King',75227,1.0763,6,'t8NH77CS2V4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30120,_binary '\0','/CSm8M4uj9ba5jVVhbeBbg9hCyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703957',6.5,22911,'en','Genius','New York in the 1920s. Max Perkins, a literary editor is the first to sign such subsequent literary greats as Ernest Hemingway and F. Scott Fitzgerald. When a sprawling, chaotic 1,000-page manuscript by an unknown writer falls into his hands, Perkins is convinced he has discovered a literary genius.','/f3KG63zvQGvakfwOTUb8ODgHEnP.jpg','2016-06-10',104,'Released','Max Perkins discovered Ernest Hemingway and F. Scott Fitzgerald. But he never met anyone like Thomas Wolfe.','Genius',267192,5.0841,6.5,'xZ_IsVxIPTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30121,_binary '\0','/1sD7xpM6KQJUYbr7YHyR1gMGrfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1703958',5.8,7644,'hi','एक मैं और एक तू','Rahul and Riana meet each other for the first time, get drunk, and awake the next morning to find that they have gotten legally married to each other.','/yei87xHRcmf4OhritS6GAju8fdq.jpg','2012-02-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Ek Main Aur Ekk Tu',84533,1.3463,5.629,'P5ZeKcwtIKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30122,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1704137',7.4,1328,'te','అష్ట చమ్మ','In this adaptation of The Importance of Being Earnest, Lavanya is in love with the actor Mahesh Babu and decides to marry a man with the same name. But things take an unexpected turn when she finds out that her boyfriend\'s real name is not Mahesh.','/fxIOKsfPqFL7CBEwln0otGjCgUQ.jpg','2008-09-05',126,'Released',NULL,'Ashta Chamma',80889,0.9347,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30123,_binary '\0','/hpHcRM1SeznBd1WrzR3DZyMIgch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1704144',7.1,1317,'te','గగనం','When terrorists hijack a plane from Chennai, a struggle with the pilots damages the engine forcing them to make an emergency landing in Tirupati. NSG commando Ravi is entrusted with rescue operations.','/2wqp4IygJls3tSr3t5E6oh62RAT.jpg','2011-02-11',131,'Released',NULL,'Gaganam',59900,1.0992,6.471,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30124,_binary '\0','/aZQR5Np9fZjck0HM3qYs1wUgwYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17041964',7.8,69683,'en','Navalny','Follows the man who survived an assassination attempt by poisoning with a lethal nerve agent in August 2020. During his months-long recovery, he makes shocking discoveries about the attempt on his life and decides to return home.','/9FXHNsqB4Wk9p42Yh0UtDflRY1f.jpg','2022-04-08',98,'Released','Poison always leaves a trail.','Navalny',926676,2.6173,7.3,'cPRuvKqZty0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30125,_binary '\0','/n9R9QqshUPVVHacPQyqe3Pt40ta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1704292',6.9,19248,'en','Battlestar Galactica: Blood & Chrome','The first Cylon war has been raging for 10 years and a young Ensign William Adama joins the fleet. Disappointed not to be assigned to a fighter but to a freighter, his co-pilot also isn\'t too keen on having a rookie flying his aircraft as he has only a short time before he again becomes a civilian. Their cargo is a civilian scientist, but they no sooner leave than she has new orders for them and a new destination. Although she’s less than forthcoming about the details, Adama is keen—particularly as it involves going into Cylon controlled space. However, nothing is as it seems.','/fuHuvxnfcPXZauX1Pm7qwmc9k5L.jpg','2012-12-09',91,'Released',NULL,'Battlestar Galactica: Blood & Chrome',257368,4.1272,6.8,'IxL8g1_H-KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30126,_binary '\0','/9YUOSQevLpvWOiZYcrDyyHcvNqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17044594',5.3,1412,'pl','Pod wiatr','She graduated from a prestigious high school in Warsaw and entered medicine in London. He works as a kitesurfing instructor at the seaside, thanks to which he combines earning money and passion. They will meet in Hel. The unusual charm of the boy makes the girl exceed her limits and enter a completely unknown world of kitesurfing, music and fun. The feeling that arises between them does not please her family or his friends. Is Ania and Michal\'s relationship strong enough to overcome adversities and become more than just a holiday love?','/867QI9NTJIhe0kQJ0bcnutXjpK5.jpg','2022-02-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Into the Wind',933547,2.0554,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30127,_binary '\0','/gLr8DBGveOCJAS469GnWTRSXsP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1704573',6.8,67658,'en','Bernie','In small-town Texas, affable and popular mortician Bernie Tiede strikes up a friendship with Marjorie Nugent, a wealthy widow well known for her sour attitude. When she becomes controlling and abusive, Bernie goes to great lengths to remove himself from her grasp.','/rW5CetooG545jpkPNpD4FjFAXfe.jpg','2012-04-27',99,'Released','A story so unbelievable it must be true.','Bernie',92591,2.9475,6.6,'_cVC5k561GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30128,_binary '\0','/tepskbohQYG94DhjbWfifKQXEQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1704619',7,7647,'en','Tabloid','One of America\'s top documentary filmmakers turns his attention to the outrageous and nearly unbelievable story of Joyce McKinney, a former Miss Wyoming beauty queen who gained a great deal of notoriety after being accused of kidnapping a young Mormon missionary, restraining him in chains and raping him in 1977 England. The unbalanced McKinney is extensively interviewed, particularly about her ambition to write a memoir telling her side of the tale.','/eTjP19ezcIb2fMLOgjWheBVcGV.jpg','2011-07-15',87,'Released','An Errol Morris love story','Tabloid',69480,1.6953,6.4,'yP771tgYxoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30129,_binary '\0','/lDHukrDiNiNZM7GUCaQnFBrKKNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17048366',6.9,1503,'en','Explorer: The Last Tepui','This documentary starring climber Alex Honnold and famous biologist Bruce Means document their expedition to the South American sky islands in search of new species and discoveries. Follows elite climber Alex Honnold and a world-class climbing team led by National Geographic Explorer and climber Mark Synnott on a grueling mission deep in the Amazon jungle as they attempt a first-ascent climb up a 1000 foot sheer cliff.','/u3csCMawDUyB6DZKI4q3j8m6vjG.jpg','2022-04-06',55,'Released','Climb into the unknown.','Explorer: The Last Tepui',927081,3.0318,7.5,'vmPredMTXpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30130,_binary '\0','/rUuwxNhoJNRWOMbJk7Y50gKE101.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705118',5.4,1762,'nl','LelleBelle','19-year old Belle practices playing the violin diligently, but is unable to impart her music with a sensitive undertone. Her life changes when she discovers that sexual desire stimulates passion in her music.','/osDWrq7tQzj1zD5AsAyFejFUHWd.jpg','2010-10-08',90,'Released',NULL,'LelleBelle',52371,1.1714,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30131,_binary '\0','/i0yh9yh4SJzntYDf4zzIN9SDoHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705120',7.2,4054,'bg','Love.net','Follows the parallel stories of a number of characters who are trying to change their lives via the Internet or are simply having fun online.','/v5dfWFqn0hxURhNiPNtHwQr1bHv.jpg','2011-04-01',109,'Released','Love at first virtual sight','Love.net',70713,1.8941,6.2,'MD-foUiZnjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30132,_binary '\0','/yroy35hen9ct4vX1CQlCJNPwfL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705125',3.5,1386,'en','Mysterious Island','During the American Civil War, five northern POWs make the decision to escape the war by hijacking a hot air balloon. Drifting through the night, they wake to find themselves marooned on a desert island, but they aren\'t alone.','/kaaFdsDxCKQXtikIhuD0dWvIUuz.jpg','2012-02-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Mysterious Island',90363,3.0408,4.5,'DX6CT0H8BuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30133,_binary '\0','/7LBqlW288n1xSoipCGHZSpkn2vd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705134',5.2,3381,'pt','State of Emergency','Chaos consumes a small town when a chemical facility explodes releasing a deadly toxin. Moments after the leak, the town\'s residents show signs of mutation, causing the military to quarantine the area leaving any survivors helpless and trapped inside. The story follows Jim, a young man isolated within the red zone, as he eludes flesh eating zombies in an attempt to win back his freedom.','/m7qQoj6x58VLeN4WoQQVIosacjb.jpg','2012-09-17',90,'Released','The end is near.','State of Emergency',136476,1.5303,5.4,'JwnFC75v46k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30134,_binary '\0','/ptzhZVIQ9wKV2kdAJB9ts7CIlLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17052842',6.5,1571,'zh','燃冬','In cold wintry Yanji, a city on China\'s northern border, young urbanite Haofeng, visiting from Shanghai, feels lost and adrift. By chance, he goes on a tour led by Nana, a charming tour guide who instantly fascinates him. She introduces him to Xiao, a personable but frustrated restaurant worker. The three bond quickly over a drunken weekend. Confronting their individual traumas, their frozen desires slowly thaw as they seek to liberate themselves from an icy world.','/nBGYXCiXhHBNmgvFY7aKrmbXCdv.jpg','2023-08-22',100,'Released',NULL,'The Breaking Ice',923150,2.9263,6.4,'kRO24Rup-3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30135,_binary '\0','/67XMeY5MIfPd74eYjkXEGxwuPHG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705772',7.7,17828,'ta','மங்காத்தா','Vinayak, a suspended cop, helps a group of four men rob cricket betting money amounting to 500 crores INR. When it comes to splitting the amount, betrayal hits the team hard and a chase ensues.','/tZnDKJyUYfZKKPfBgVheU9vKlUo.jpg','2011-08-31',161,'Released','A game of chase and get chased','Mankatha',76788,1.8891,6.8,'vHESM8iR1JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30136,_binary '\0','/fqRJLbbakXAT88XTBVz0no4xavg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705786',7.3,20935,'es','Un cuento chino','A comedy that chronicles a chance encounter between Robert and a Chinese named Jun who wanders lost through the city of Buenos Aires in search of his uncle after being assaulted by a taxi driver and his henchmen.','/wSrMT1YrcMH4NdzH7IdJaQzgzJc.jpg','2011-03-24',93,'Released','An Argentine and a Chinese united by a cow that fell from the sky','Chinese Take-Away',67884,2.596,7.263,'oyFzB104QaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30137,_binary '\0','/gaCVydMmgZ4PnY1KmccM7LxtPol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705952',4.8,13416,'en','Tarzan','One of the most classic and revered stories of all time, Edgar Rice Burroughs\' Tarzan returns to the big screen for a new generation. Tarzan and Jane face a mercenary army dispatched by the evil CEO of Greystoke Energies, a man who took over the company from Tarzan\'s parents, after they died in a plane crash in the African jungle.','/wIg7TclH6PUcvTWFh0QdtU5Wcvt.jpg','2013-10-17',94,'Released','The legend starts here','Tarzan',230222,5.1915,5.7,'eah80eMZMgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30138,_binary '\0','/1nHeGjnG5g3JMRx5Wp1pwkylfAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1705977',7.5,2501,'en','Carrie Fisher: Wishful Drinking','\"Wishful Drinking\" is based on Fisher\'s memoirs of the same title. The stage adaptation had its world premiere in 2006 at the Geffen Playhouse in L.A. It later played at Berkeley Repertory before opening on Broadway in October at Studio 54. The show takes audiences on a comic tour of Fisher\'s messy personal life and career. The actress-writer recounts stories about her work on the \"Star Wars\" series as well as her relationship with her parents Eddie Fisher and Debbie Reynolds. She also discusses her much-publicized problems with alcohol and drugs.','/dA9y6kaqSTLkFiSJNqd6mnSKome.jpg','2010-12-10',75,'Released','A show where one woman reconciles herself to being Carrie Fisher.','Carrie Fisher: Wishful Drinking',52461,3.4543,7.344,'xcTvmIEG4Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30139,_binary '\0','/uFX825QmtaiEWI0WYQ3j6ekeoGD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706317',4.1,2823,'hi','तेज़','To avenge his past, Aakash Rana plants bomb in a train endangering lives of 500 passengers.','/iokEa7lggQqReHkj9rs27m07Jt1.jpg','2012-04-27',121,'Released',NULL,'Tezz',85992,1.9142,4.093,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30140,_binary '\0','/ydAjRQXNlEu3sTaSFtUvb3uZFZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706414',6.5,3370,'ru','Край','The action takes place shortly after the end of the Second World War in the Siberian hinterland, among Russians and Germans with damaged personal stories and a strange transformation: the victors seem to be crawling into the skins of the defeated, and vice versa. Ignat, is the embodiment of the larger-than-life image of the Soviet victorious warrior who, in fact, proves to be shell-shocked, sick and broken, although not completely destroyed. Trains become fetish for the heroes of the film, and speed becomes a mania; they virtually become one with their steam engines, while the machines take on human names. The heroes set up an almost fatal race in the Siberian forest, risking their own lives and those of others.','/wiu1eyrjXWql0Lll9rZf64Eeg9A.jpg','2010-09-23',115,'Released',NULL,'The Edge',47557,1.903,5.8,'xfmrRNS1kKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30141,_binary '\0','/tsX1feqGEix5VvbkkqG0slHJOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706433',7,2635,'ru','Жить','Early autumn, godforsaken Russian countryside. A local hunter Michail witnesses a skirmish in the middle of the forest - three men want to kill the forth, Andrey. Kind-hearted Michail helps Andrey escape and together they run from the villains who chase them. Thus, two totally different men start a long and dangerous journey together, constantly arguing with each other regarding their ideology, morals and opinions about life. But life will put everything on its place and make the men understand who they really are.','/fCcyRdv7QXOAyaV3ZsGq8di6xjC.jpg','2010-11-11',74,'Released',NULL,'To Live',59426,1.115,6.5,'qL1SpPN_sic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30142,_binary '\0','/x21hZjoqMCDC0DqGibINQAzIrEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706450',6.1,5394,'fa','ملک سلیمان','Solomon, Prophet and the King, has asked God to give him an ideal kingdom which has never been given to anybody before. He is told to prepare himself and his subjects with evil and unearthly creatures that haunt the men.','/j24feOqc1BINnVeT8yMPLosHJAJ.jpg','2010-10-08',110,'Released',NULL,'The Kingdom of Solomon',153779,1.7827,6.3,'pOBwmC5XaGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30143,_binary '\0','/kAfg4C0uKF2z8TQWX5IoItyAZK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706470',5.5,2084,'en','Weekender','The exploits of two friends who make the move from partying at illegal warehouse raves to becoming successful promoters at the peak of the Manchester, Amsterdam, and Ibiza rave scene in the early 90s.','/oHbqUpTvDKK8SbbftRlvhmhSFVs.jpg','2011-09-01',90,'Released','Epic high. Killer Come Down.','Weekender',74608,1.2416,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30144,_binary '\0','/rgNzvSagnlc32TuMEBa529QFIig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706593',7,280083,'en','Chronicle','Three high school students make an incredible discovery, leading to their developing uncanny powers beyond their understanding. As they learn to control their abilities and use them to their advantage, their lives start to spin out of control, and their darker sides begin to take over.','/kdyrdFIt29FUmLIKvedAc2j4rpo.jpg','2012-02-01',84,'Released','What are you capable of?','Chronicle',76726,11.4278,6.87,'AQ9XG-j4kvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30145,_binary '\0','/xYlTXk9aYoL7U0lVjzf3fUGmJMC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706596',6.8,3218,'da','Dirch','Opening in the seductive style of the sixties, »A Funny Man« uncovers the perennial loneliness that comedian Dirch Passer (Nikolaj Lie Kaas) has found himself in after a fast-tracked rise to fame. He struggles between his own desire to gain critical respect and servicing the audience¿s needs. Costing his kindred friendship to on-stage partner Kjeld Petersen (Lars Ranthe) Dirch takes on Steinbeck\'s classic »Of Mice and Men«, only for the audience to break out in laughter at his first line. Dirch\'s Lennie becomes a running joke, and so has, Dirch believes, his own life.','/m8qpq78icrD5BKjylb2iYwoydKb.jpg','2011-08-25',116,'Released','A biography of the Danish actor and comedian, Dirch Passer','A Funny Man',73448,1.6843,7.3,'PUGhCBxwdb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30146,_binary '\0','/f1mkwzPX23sDQ1rFiBoJgfbbMj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706598',6.1,10391,'en','Every Secret Thing','One clear summer day in a Baltimore suburb, a baby goes missing from her front porch. Two young girls serve seven years for the crime and are released into a town that hasn\'t fully forgiven or forgotten. Soon, another child is missing, and two detectives are called in to investigate the mystery in a community where everyone seems to have a secret.','/jR3rrAtFhK6MufgJIlNYoo0Iyfd.jpg','2014-04-20',93,'Released','Don\'t look away for even a second.','Every Secret Thing',258284,3.8985,6.2,'6QT0zKjvRfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30147,_binary '\0','/vz45GHSnBNYRcyoZe3UCQ4HD4D4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1706620',7.1,425504,'ko','설국열차','In a future where a failed global-warming experiment kills off most life on the planet, a class system evolves aboard the Snowpiercer; a train that travels around the globe via a perpetual-motion engine.','/kw6YQudA0TMcNmGUGy5XIw7zbnV.jpg','2013-08-01',127,'Released','Fight your way to the front.','Snowpiercer',110415,16.2099,6.909,'3Np3v7xnNJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30148,_binary '\0','/h1An6CRfuzwlUAKtnmGpKuHCW37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17067574',5.3,3425,'en','Cold Meat','David Petersen is passing through the Colorado Rockies. After saving a young diner waitress from her violent ex-husband during a break from driving, he hits the road again alone through a dangerous snow blizzard. One false move behind the wheel has him waking up inside a ravine, in the eye of the storm. But the cold is the least of his worries when a beast starts prowling outside. How will he survive?','/7XIIFcDxSk6XqG9Rek6h9q6KU58.jpg','2024-02-23',89,'Released','Outside is dangerous. Inside is deadly.','Cold Meat',1032372,3.2041,6.413,'Q_NaGIkfxQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30149,_binary '\0','/7T3QKVE01BYCTfeoYft2KZQfy1B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17069062',4.3,3370,'en','Craving','After a drug deal goes south, four heroin addicts barricade themselves in a country bar as the cops close in. Withdrawal sets in, further complicating their hostage situation, while a secret one of them is hiding could destroy them all.','/oEWi555lKs4cplwt7Vu0yXnhUk8.jpg','2023-03-01',85,'Released','Flee or Face the Monster Inside','Craving',941256,1.1713,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30150,_binary '\0','/nXqRGRhFxa3v5rJsJUApYdKdiKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17070412',6.2,1983,'cs','Franz','Conceived as a kaleidoscopic mosaic, the film follows the imprint Franz Kafka left on the world from his birth in 19th-century Prague to his death in post-WW1 Vienna.','/cCRBkb1U9eKz1DYa4UMGZBSkcjC.jpg','2025-09-25',127,'Released',NULL,'Franz',1157322,2.9766,6.25,'WFPrlEa294Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30151,_binary '\0','/3QF0JAVaDBT9dJXYD9R8fT9Z0Sq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1707380',5.5,6724,'en','Every Thing Will Be Fine','One day, driving aimlessly around the outskirts of town after a trivial domestic quarrel, a writer named Tomas accidentally hits and kills a child. Will he be able to move on?','/qTQC2MVoxYl0Qi336fB7iOBBuEN.jpg','2015-04-02',118,'Released','A moment. A tragic accident. And nothing will ever be the same again.','Every Thing Will Be Fine',246127,7.0716,5.435,'WRZdyzJo_So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30152,_binary '\0','/bsG8LkZx1ijrcf3fP6AvBlGTxkX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1707386',7.5,364973,'en','Les Misérables','An adaptation of the successful stage musical based on Victor Hugo\'s classic novel set in 19th-century France. Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg','2012-12-18',158,'Released','Fight. Dream. Hope. Love.','Les Misérables',82695,12.3521,7.293,'28sHoKcpugw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30153,_binary '\0','/7TiPld4fBYY20aOquQJpOVuntgg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1707391',4.7,6075,'en','4:44 Last Day on Earth','A look at how a painter and a successful actor spend their last day together before the world comes to an end.','/vSeQ7eXy1tmig0jkX63wACDiLM4.jpg','2012-03-23',82,'Released',NULL,'4:44 Last Day on Earth',86820,3.0277,4.786,'b0Nqx8ZK1ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30154,_binary '\0','/yDpIzQaBwFti63qWqQWf0mgNC1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1707392',5.3,10640,'en','Lovely Molly','A supernatural presence menaces a newlywed couple after they move into the wife\'s long-abandoned childhood home.','/1o2Ruw1LpWhkTqdzqOuwBk2liIq.jpg','2011-09-14',100,'Released',NULL,'Lovely Molly',74505,3.0825,5.087,'gFOuKIJkgU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30155,_binary '\0','/2JaOoN0AM5ZbG8yecvew7ziwRMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17074358',7.1,2157,'te','నీతో','Varun, an insurance agent, meets Meghna, the daughter of a wealthy businessman, over a marriage policy. Their interaction leads to sharing some details about their respective relationships. Circumstances that follow and their failed relationships make them meet more often, and it opens a door for the Cupid to strike. But can love happen more than once, or is it just a rebound?','/3fjnBHVB2DAwEL2cwjYOFUWcwJE.jpg','2022-10-14',123,'Released',NULL,'Neetho',1034852,0.6692,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30156,_binary '\0','/8hSx5b4YfD2dzvGtrE6mdXF0xrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17076046',6.8,50230,'en','Weird: The Al Yankovic Story','Exploring every facet of ‘Weird Al’ Yankovic’s life, from his meteoric rise to fame with early hits like ‘Eat It’ and ‘Like a Surgeon’ to his torrid celebrity love affairs and famously depraved lifestyle, this biopic takes audiences on a truly unbelievable journey through Yankovic’s life and career, from gifted child prodigy to the greatest musical legend of all time.','/qcj2z13G0KjaIgc01ifiUKu7W07.jpg','2022-09-08',108,'Released','The world belongs to the weird.','Weird: The Al Yankovic Story',928344,6.1967,6.725,'oCPMK8FUVCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30157,_binary '\0','/aI0cRhsqcClmgN4jhy4KNhPeH33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1707818',7.4,1283,'en','Ethos','Hosted by twice Oscar nominated actor and activist Woody Harrelson, Ethos lifts the lid on a Pandora\'s box of systemic issues that guarantee failure in almost every aspect of our lives; from the environment to democracy and our own personal liberty: From terrifying conflicts of interests in politics to unregulated corporate power, to a media in the hands of massive conglomerates, and a military industrial complex that virtually owns our representatives. With interviews from some of todays leading thinkers and source material from the finest documentary film makers of our times Ethos examines and unravels these complex relationships, and offers a solution, a simple but powerful way for you to change this system!','/q9103y3olGV23NknJHFXQOSXqUL.jpg','2011-02-10',72,'Released','You are the solution','Ethos',57510,1.0589,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30158,_binary '\0','/sDIiEwrgp63eAE2d63J5giIKtZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17079358',4.3,3710,'en','I Can\'t Breathe (God Forgive Them)','What lies beyond Death? Does Justice indeed Prevail? The testing of your faith is more precious than gold. So, keep on believing.','/fO7qfCAWCLZ3qEW6sRDeLER9MIu.jpg','2022-07-05',65,'Released',NULL,'I Can\'t Breathe (God Forgive Them)',987927,1.1344,2,'uGllR8Kz8P0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30159,_binary '\0','/rGnf32URcZAqdTxtkoC6aUD1GBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17079606',6.9,4203,'zh','鬼才之道','When ghosts must compete to survive in the underworld by haunting the living, one unassuming young woman needs help creating a lasting performance while under the tutelage of a passionate agent and a washed-up diva.','/yDcc3OWNEtzjDtJly1OyZShtTMV.jpg','2024-08-07',110,'Released','Do you know what the best thing about being dead is?','Dead Talents Society',1006724,2.854,6.9,'YEMc4m4vYZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30160,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17081088',3.2,3491,'en','Spaghetti','Nurse Lena Simon seems to have found the perfect man in savvy businessman Scotty Sharpe, but when she suspects him of seeing someone else she takes the unusual advice of her best friend Toni and does a voodoo spell on him.','/kGmy63TQ3XNXvP8zMYR5i7TVYea.jpg','2023-09-11',81,'Released','THE SECRETS IN THE SAUCE','Spaghetti',1192618,0.9451,3.5,'DLE_p_6QUfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30161,_binary '\0','/zpFFDwv7RsWwQIRBHzUW7WGmycC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1708135',7,10681,'de','Elser – Er hätte die Welt verändert','The breathtaking story of a man who nearly would have changed the world. In 1939, when Hitler tricked millions of people at the height of his power, radical Georg Elser — disparaged as an assassin — is one of the greatest resistance fighters.','/dSaDHmmDWLdoJnCnwJQToFkXJp5.jpg','2015-04-09',114,'Released','This man could have changed history','13 Minutes',319337,3.8769,6.834,'8SsIsCWXtV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30162,_binary '\0','/7PIJNQf49O48aGaGAnYBZ4vziQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1708453',7,4596,'hi','Aakrosh','The Central Bureau of Investigation deputes two officers to investigate the disappearance of three medical students, which they believe to be an incident of \'honour killing\' in a small, closed community.','/ya8x3bI2MkvVfu4ZKzkgKSTsDaU.jpg','2010-10-01',145,'Released','There is no honour in honour killing','Aakrosh',54081,1.7126,6.929,'yyhOjaJMWUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30163,_binary '\0','/7YrFahshvnqYbWLhIxkWsBMg3e9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1708459',6.8,2722,'en','Call Me Mrs. Miracle','Mrs Merkle (or Mrs. Miracle as she is know by some) finds herself in a toy department of a department store that is having all kinds of financial problems, but leave it to this kind lady as she will get the Christmas spirit flowing very freely at this store.','/qwVwpK2xIUzRfgrlSHiwIfIdHie.jpg','2010-11-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Call Me Mrs. Miracle',78059,2.338,5.9,'9Pu55fZZahQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30164,_binary '\0','/gh9mRGlL41HPnyoakF6WZtCAhe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1708532',5,22490,'hi','Ready','Prem believes Sanjana is the girl chosen by his dad and falls in love with her. However, she is a runaway bride escaping from a marriage set up by her mafia uncles against her wishes. On learning the truth, he devises a plan to win her over from her uncles who intend to usurp her huge inheritance.','/umfKMUkXXPfMUoOq60nXjDbQOCL.jpg','2011-06-03',140,'Released',NULL,'Ready',65946,1.4487,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30165,_binary '\0','/2Qp9Ms9YYJd1NlKesksIMVriiUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1708658',7.6,2374,'en','November Christmas','A young father asks for pumpkins at the local farm stand. \"In August? No.\" the farmer replies. The farmer ruminates on the odd request and gets involved with strangers for the first time since his son\'s death long ago.','/5pyVraJsoQpSVFHSDYI3ners0qI.jpg','2010-11-28',96,'Released',NULL,'November Christmas',52688,2.1288,7.5,'WEf00ziLSBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30166,_binary '\0','/rVYHQl3siFZEpG3qhqsxVfzvpzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709122',6.1,2510,'de','Die vierte Macht','A journalist gets caught up in a terrorist plot in Moscow while investigating the Russian secret service.','/cHns6BrDBnxQAHZTmr8rtiDXQEU.jpg','2012-03-08',115,'Released',NULL,'The Fourth State',92484,2.1213,5.974,'lTFfa4a84k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30167,_binary '\0','/zZUuNeCzA5W6YJweyFLxBN6xTHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709143',5.5,40970,'en','The Last Days on Mars','On the last day of the first manned mission to Mars, a crew member of Tantalus Base believes he has made an astounding discovery – fossilized evidence of bacterial life. Unwilling to let the relief crew claim all the glory, he disobeys orders to pack up and goes out on an unauthorized expedition to collect further samples. But a routine excavation turns to disaster when the porous ground collapses and he falls into a deep crevice. His devastated colleagues attempt to recover his body. However, when another vanishes, they start to suspect that the life-form they have discovered is not without danger.','/kxcQkAhpn8cvJTsU8PXblI5Qq8F.jpg','2013-08-11',98,'Released','The search for life is about to end.','The Last Days on Mars',190847,4.7876,5.5,'u9GqPNcDjBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30168,_binary '\0','/ut884L9bjXoc9C8P1dIa9oW28BY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709157',7.5,7017,'en','The Lost Valentine','A young and cynical female journalist learns love may transcend trials and time as she discovers a story that will change her life forever. When war separates lovers on their wedding anniversary Feb. 14, 1944 at LA Union Train Station, Navy pilot Neil Thomas makes a promise he isn\'t sure he can keep - to return to the train station safe by their next anniversary. For sixty years Caroline Thomas keeps her promise by waiting at the train station until her missing in action husband can finally keep his with the \"lost valentine.\" The message and meaning shows romance and love can be real; worth fighting, and maybe even dying for.','/yLil9ucsqiMgannyyJJrsXPMUQH.jpg','2011-01-30',100,'Released','Love can stand the test of time.','The Lost Valentine',61348,3.2068,6.9,'273b92KQFOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30169,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709173',4.4,1269,'en','Unaware','In July 2010, a vacationing couple discovered something disturbing on a ranch in rural Texas. Armed with a home camcorder, they captured their experience on video.','/1SGGTo7ZdS5sbYcCWotRyswsz5o.jpg','2013-03-12',81,'Released','The uncensored, controversial footage from July 2010.','Unaware',202244,0.6264,4,'5zzjuOhyAYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30170,_binary '\0','/iiEAEgrNS11aaYJwIi5GZc9ETBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709652',5.7,3212,'en','Dragon Age: Dawn of the Seeker','In the land of Orlais, a brash young Seeker—Cassandra—fights to stop a blood-soaked conspiracy. Hidden hands seek to tear apart the realm\'s most powerful religious order, and as the sinister plot unfolds, Cassandra is accused of treason and murder. Hunted by friend and foe alike, the impulsive beauty must clear her name while clashing with corrupt templars and rogue blood mages. Should she fail, the executioner’s blade awaits. Should she overcome her rage and expose the unseen forces threatening the rule of the Divine, Cassandra will take her place in legend.','/6R4gnQZp8MSaljsR8dl9R4ARByo.jpg','2012-02-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Age: Dawn of the Seeker',103173,2.2754,5.5,'O9FWaWqUyRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30171,_binary '\0','/7TOJVCvqHq0xaazcCDFIF6GBSI6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1709654',6.1,4753,'en','Edwin Boyd: Citizen Gangster','Based on a real WWII vet and family man turned bank robber. Disillusioned by his post war circumstances, Eddie Boyd is torn between the need to provide for his young family and an unfulfilled dream to head to Hollywood to become a star. He discovers a way to do both, robbing banks Hollywood style, but his dream leads him down a path of danger and tragedy.','/hTY0Wst8Gwm8tfVjw4J24i0L28q.jpg','2011-09-10',105,'Released','Gangster. Media darling. Model citizen.','Edwin Boyd: Citizen Gangster',92493,3.4892,5.571,'cKPu7I2nMFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30172,_binary '\0','/e1Z4TfgRYdwen5Hzj5kVUZQEOeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17097088',7.6,3140,'zh','隐入尘烟','Humble, unassuming Ma and timid Cao have been cast off by their families and forced into an arranged marriage. They have to combine their strength and build a home to survive. In the face of much adversity, an unexpected bond begins to blossom, as both Ma and Cao, uniting with Earth\'s cycles, create a haven for themselves in which they can thrive.','/wUf7BWSN16KOdO70P3UOy5FRWRg.jpg','2022-07-08',133,'Released','An unlikely love story.','Return to Dust',928720,3.0081,7.301,'OxCrPuP5Dx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30173,_binary '\0','/6hssitVStllb62WlOpub0WsCdBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1710393',6.3,1240,'es','Ismael','An aging couple follows after Ismael Tchou, an 8-year-old, who is trying to find his way to his estranged biological father all by himself.','/rSBDObfZLedaoxpJy8LYuCroD6F.jpg','2013-12-26',106,'Released','Three strangers: a mother, a son, a grandson... And a trip that will change their lives forever.','Ismael',220620,0.9532,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30174,_binary '\0','/xNf9R2tw75AzU5DGaQR37wGppJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1710396',5.8,9386,'en','Joyful Noise','G.G. Sparrow faces off with her choir\'s newly appointed director, Vi Rose Hill, over the group\'s direction as they head into a national competition.','/pIgrIGFMZ7CslGPCWI7JHV3R96H.jpg','2012-01-13',117,'Released','Dream a whole lot louder!','Joyful Noise',63574,4.2608,6.4,'FiNEwLKmSq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30175,_binary '\0','/2iIYLstTPdr9tiukF6WevBJXeJh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1710417',5.5,9253,'en','Lola Versus','Just three weeks before her wedding, Lola\'s longtime fiance, Luke, dumps her. With her 30th birthday looming and being forced to re-enter the New York City dating scene, she feels adrift in a cold world. She leans on her friends for support but, after a series of romantic humiliations, professional blunders and boozy antics, Lola realizes that she alone is in charge of her fate.','/vAmofQjo2lECavOLlK72O3kFNc0.jpg','2012-04-24',87,'Released','Lola vs. Sex, Love, Lola, The World.','Lola Versus',100529,3.9114,5.02,'Ktxy1fDR8