be','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30518,_binary '\0','/o4Cv7kBEHZMTgl4Gy5yL0h88JyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17595094',3,4742,'en','In the Fire','A doctor from New York travels to a remote plantation in the 1890s to care for a disturbed boy who seems to have inexplicable abilities. She begins treating the child, but in doing so, ignites a war between science and religion as the local priest believes the boy is possessed by the devil and the cause of the village\'s woes.','/rS6GBWRgKkvmcPvtKNuhGkQggjz.jpg','2023-09-14',87,'Released',NULL,'In the Fire',946215,2.0604,4.6,'aDrXKWafFdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30519,_binary '\0','/7GmQKKAB3q3xkpxt1VFt2DrfviW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17595262',6.4,3103,'da','Klienten','Renowned psychologist Susanne is caught in a living nightmare when her new client turns out to be a wanted serial killer.','/oUhZzMpHAMgdRgLbsvBIqhY7fKe.jpg','2022-06-20',95,'Released',NULL,'The Last Client',934287,2.9268,7.212,'R021h9xKh24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30520,_binary '\0','/5JW57lFk52e25D1rncAyBTj8G7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1759744',5.9,5993,'en','Charlie Says','Three young women were sentenced to death in the infamous Manson murder case, but when the death penalty was lifted, their sentence became life imprisonment. One young graduate student was sent in to teach them – and through her we witness their transformations as they face the reality of their horrific crimes.','/cgc4tSc8Q65aYpRroFz3jPNad5j.jpg','2019-05-10',110,'Released','Dreamers. Victims. Murderers.','Charlie Says',471859,3.5916,5.9,'KPSKkxTQFEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30521,_binary '\0','/v27Hfi65ly1gVbb2KJZvGbzUzNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17597510',6.8,1596,'nl','De vuurlinie','The story of Dutch commando Marco Kroon, who, after becoming the first recipient of his country\'s highest military award in over five decades, finds himself in the crosshairs of the law for alleged drugs and weapons violations.','/gj7hKzCS73CZFysAOrfWalMKB2a.jpg','2023-09-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Line of Fire',1143984,0.9088,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30522,_binary '\0','/nWJPW8Z2fZr9vmBzqlLh2o5vOac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1760967',7.1,11680,'en','Ill Manors','Ensemble film revolving around characters living in Forest Gate, London. Over the course of a few days, six inter-linking stories explore issues of drug use, prostitution and urban poverty.','/qhN0X6sDUalPxoNRfuUIBR6QmSO.jpg','2012-06-06',121,'Released','We are all products of our environment ...some environments are just harder to survive in','Ill Manors',109843,2.109,6.318,'1hfxWjUcbzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30523,_binary '\0','/w4Vv9hrgzO2RvekPVND6rmNG0ae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1760980',6.2,2647,'es','Madrid, 1987','In 1987 Madrid, the unexpected encounter between a seasoned journalist and a young student leads to a profound exploration of love, desire, politics, power, and discovery of each other.','/aCfIPBTn9xX6kZ6miyObL03fMeg.jpg','2012-04-13',104,'Released',NULL,'Madrid, 1987',84308,4.2458,6.6,'9SlxD4ZOXxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30524,_binary '\0','/t5nuwTiu0LDRQbWiozsgLSL8uYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1761005',3.5,1704,'en','Persecuted','Nationally acclaimed evangelist John Luther is the last obstacle in the way of sweeping religious reform in the States. When a U.S. Senator and Luther\'s own supporters abduct and frame him in the murder of an innocent teenage girl, an unprecedented era of persecution is unleashed. Out on personal recognizance, Luther escapes police surveillance in search of the truth. And suddenly, a once-normal life is targeted by a team of ex-military operatives who wage a relentless campaign to eliminate the incriminating evidence. As evangelist turned fugitive, Luther vows to expose anyone involved with or profiting from the girl\'s murder; a mission that brings him face-to-face with the coming storm of persecution that will threaten the entire Christian community in America.','/2txiRHanktEUaZF39iL7MxsdfZs.jpg','2014-05-09',93,'Released','And you shall suffer as Christ.','Persecuted',257521,1.5664,4.2,'z4FslottUKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30525,_binary '\0','/cDUHziVoMwim4PY0vXgZPbVkw2Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1762300',7.9,2825,'en','One Life','One Life captures unprecedented and beautiful sequences of animal behaviour guaranteed to bring you closer to nature than ever before, as well as a second disc packed full of never before seen extras including an exclusive making of featurette narrated by Daniel Craig.','/zorlrbxahQjtIy6rHovTBTK8FcC.jpg','2011-07-19',85,'Released','The journey of life continues','One Life',75720,1.6361,7.5,'9Y4jnNU0Azs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30526,_binary '\0','/AdqdU9nexxg8obiEWQoIQQqsr4Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1762399',5.2,12589,'en','Walking with Dinosaurs','In a time when dinosaurs rule the Earth, the smallest dinosaur of the herd, a playful Pachyrhinosaurus named Patchi, embarks on the biggest adventure of his life. As he tries to find his place in a spectacular world filled with fun-loving friends and a few dangerous foes, Patchi will discover the courage he needs to become the leader of the herd and a hero for the ages.','/lkElT9HpOUIjIL20Hwy3LZqgXWc.jpg','2013-12-18',87,'Released','The Greatest Adventure in 70 Million Years','Walking with Dinosaurs',77951,6.1826,6.2,'f4K8ZtJaQ-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30527,_binary '\0','/hoZHoGRC44auu2rc0smBtMMxsR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1763264',6,27362,'en','No One Lives','A gang of ruthless highway killers kidnap a wealthy couple traveling cross country only to shockingly discover that things are not what they seem.','/d9wDmRcQngl9Jo7Go3EU7f2W15m.jpg','2013-03-09',87,'Released','No one runs. No one escapes.','No One Lives',123109,4.9568,6,'Z4HxhzBG0ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30528,_binary '\0','/y0EpsN8VU5SH31Q5PMpk93UjyK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17632818',7.3,5356,'ml','കൂമൻ','The story takes place in a hilly village on the Kerala-Tamil Nadu border. The story is about a strict police officer who relocates there and the subsequent events that turn his and many other\'s lives upside down associated with that police station. Few normal incidents happen in the village, and some from the past suddenly appear to be abnormal. The secrets slowly start unfolding.','/nhKiu5zi5rUjPwzEQCaLKfbDHrL.jpg','2022-11-04',151,'Released','The Night Rider','Kooman',933833,1.5296,6.625,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30529,_binary '\0','/eovymlyVhwU6MtbzopaVlA3ptUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1763288',3.3,1457,'en','Stripped','Four friends head to Vegas for a 21st birthday in hopes of finding adventure, debauchery and memories that will last them a lifetime.','/sEIXLQCzDKBu7m3DYo4jR6hOJRD.jpg','2013-05-14',80,'Released','Your donation is accepted.','Stripped',264227,1.1821,3.7,'Frxpjk_CApQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30530,_binary '\0','/dE0NoGwzU81sYTLY9gUGEzLjozG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1763303',6.8,76021,'en','The First Time','A spark of attraction smolders, then ignites, between two teens from different high schools who meet by chance at a party.','/tG6jUndWd9FRuvI4j5Z2bhTuq0V.jpg','2012-10-19',95,'Released','Nervous is normal.','The First Time',84199,5.1193,6.989,'Pa5963ftpDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30531,_binary '\0','/fYXK4EqnIZDbriiQ1wyUddVLq6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1763316',5.2,4708,'en','The Theatre Bizarre','Down a seedy city street in her neighborhood, young Enola Penny is obsessed with what appears to be a long abandoned theatre. One night, she sees that the front door is slightly ajar and impulsively decides to sneak inside. But there in the dark, decrepit auditorium, a show unlike any other unfolds before her eyes. Its host is an eerie human puppet named Peg Poett who will introduce Penny to six tales of the bizarre: A couple traveling in a remote part of the French Pyrenees cross paths with a lustful witch; A paranoid lover faces the wrath of a partner who has been pushed to her limit; The Freudian dreams of an unfaithful husband blur the lines between fantasy and reality; The horrors of the real world are interpreted through the mind of a child; A woman addicted to other people\'s memories gets her fix through the vitreous fluid of her victims\' eyeballs; And a perverse obsession with sweets turns sour for a couple in too deep.','/qtj2RjVq9YK9oEau5tAWDTurOW0.jpg','2011-07-15',114,'Released','Welcome to the Theatre of the Absurd.','The Theatre Bizarre',83727,1.8817,5.3,'nS1PvIqBetM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30532,_binary '\0','/hZcYs6uvZGMBL30kHAt9ALNJHpu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17633184',7.3,4574,'no','Krigsseileren','War Sailor is a magnificent drama that tells the story of the more than 30,000 Norwegian war sailors and their families\' fate during and after the Second World War.','/dcPepf0zLwAB10aW7BlU7YwZCWa.jpg','2022-09-23',150,'Released',NULL,'War Sailor',924154,1.0993,6.6,'7d8XrBtTRE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30533,_binary '\0','/hHw7qug8ka3eppjwTm2aDpOKAUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17633634',5.4,4109,'en','Bosco','Based on the true story of Quawntay “Bosco” Adams. Sentenced to 35 years for attempted possession of marijuana, Adams miraculously escaped from a Federal maximum-security prison while under 24-hour surveillance in solitary confinement with the help of an older woman he met through a lonely-hearts ad.','/dXjSeS3w97setnrNv4m6tlqqXzn.jpg','2024-02-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Bosco',1175351,2.5333,6.8,'Pz7s3YPS7nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30534,_binary '\0','/hJPotpDw4p6vFgnyuQnQGMlRWp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17634642',6.4,1236,'fr','Les Petites Victoires','Between her roles as mayor and teacher in the small village of Kerguen, Alice\'s days are very full. When an unexpected new student, 60-year-old Emile, finally decides to learn to read and write, her daily life threatens to become unmanageable. Especially since Alice will also have to save her village and her school...','/7abkBKQ65ktmLus53D8d9BVEDvp.jpg','2023-03-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Small Victories',1000603,1.951,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30535,_binary '\0','/cuLN0p5JQXytPjUbByKVaxUsi1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764141',7.4,5083,'ar','٦٧٨','Three women seek justice due to the difficult daily situation which sexual harassment causes in the streets of Cairo, Egypt.','/5V3Lgw0BJ8bTL750GSRj4ILDYj8.jpg','2010-12-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Cairo 6,7,8',85441,1.4975,7.3,'COesFcvkXaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30536,_binary '\0','/1LyjrU4vhre18GbjW52hshAiumJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764183',6.6,58181,'en','Arbitrage','A troubled hedge fund magnate, desperate to complete the sale of his trading empire, makes an error that forces him to turn to an unlikely person for help.','/oVJF2KTmNB8ZFkp0aUSay7d0Opf.jpg','2012-09-14',107,'Released','Power is the best alibi.','Arbitrage',60599,6.1984,6.3,'J9qdfY02LuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30537,_binary '\0','/ySiuaXE9Dp0z9xKmFEeQJ7C1Ns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764198',6.3,1664,'en','Best Laid Plans','David Blair directs this powerful British Drama, loosely inspired by John Steinbeck\'s novel \'Of Mice and Men\'. Set in Nottingham, the film revolves around the relationship between the thuggish Danny (Stephen Graham) and Joseph (Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje), a giant of a man with a mental age of seven. When Danny finds himself in debt to a local crime boss, he feels he is left with no choice but to manipulate Joseph into participating in a series of underground cage fights from which Danny can pay his debts.','/j4mUlFZhsspONZDlxgy9bqpz3RY.jpg','2012-02-03',108,'Released','Some Friendships are worth fighting for','Best Laid Plans',90953,1.2111,5.5,'6yCcxhVFQdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30538,_binary '\0','/4xGuNyCX46pwEpdQISRYiaBXEN7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764234',6.2,161739,'en','Killing Them Softly','Jackie Cogan is an enforcer hired to restore order after three dumb guys rob a Mob protected card game, causing the local criminal economy to collapse.','/heaz45kpFa4Oa7iLis0OBas68ls.jpg','2012-07-30',97,'Released','In America you\'re on your own.','Killing Them Softly',64689,7.5969,6.023,'UNNhfFqXBgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30539,_binary '\0','/jR5SwS9tnNdU9F6jvO1OsiG54dP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764275',6.6,6135,'is','Djúpið','Based on an astonishing true incident that took place on the frigid seas off Iceland in 1984, The Deep fashions a modern-day everyman myth about the sole survivor of a shipwreck, whose superhuman will to survive made him both an inexplicable scientific phenomenon and a genuine national hero.','/7fJZbHl3P9oaDhLEoJOaaOiX5EF.jpg','2012-09-07',95,'Released',NULL,'The Deep',127913,2.3667,6.3,'ryhljb_2Cjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30540,_binary '\0','/1VU99ChCmUFJP9BoNPKKBhUiowz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764366',3.2,4124,'en','Hollywood Sex Wars','Max, Aaron and Glen have a track record littered with strike-outs and misfit hook-ups. The boys embark on a mission to up their hot babe batting average. They meet Hollywood Casanova Johnny Eyelash who teaches these boys the game of scoring A-list arm candy. But there is one problem, the girls are organized, cunning and have an agenda of their own. Its not long before the girls, led by Big Wendy and Little Wendy pick up on Johnny\'s tactics and Hollywood becomes one big booby trap.','/pMfSIrbZCvkUjNZAAPEiDkHHJna.jpg','2011-10-03',98,'Released','Get laid or get played','Hollywood Sex Wars',82510,2.613,3,'aaf2VUO-lJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30541,_binary '\0','/gOcgmSwbCFW7h1rmEqMvYPzvjh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764551',4.7,7068,'en','Psycho Killer','Following the brutal murder of her husband, a Kansas highway patrol officer sets out on a journey to track down the perpetrator. As the hunt progresses, she comes to realize the man responsible is a sadistic serial killer, and the depth of his mental depravity and his sinister agenda is more twisted than anyone could have imagined.','/5xgxxmLivJXL8aF0HdZfpx8aAIo.jpg','2026-02-20',91,'Released','He’s coming for you.','Psycho Killer',1107166,9.1391,6.65,'pwq8gwdVxts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30542,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764600',4.8,4002,'ru','Служебный роман. Наше время','Anatoli Novoseltsev works in a ratings company, whose director is an unattractive and bossy woman. An old friend of his, Yuri Samokhvalov, who gets appointed assistant director, wants to make Novoseltsev the manager but encounters objections from Ludmila Kalugina, the director. Samokhvalov then advises Novoseltsev to lightly hit on the boss. Ironically, Novoseltsev and Kalugina fall in love with each other.','/9t3e7ZGgTW7aN5s5k0mhrXlFLGp.jpg','2011-03-17',88,'Released','Based on a real masterpiece','Office Romance. Our time',61293,1.1489,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30543,_binary '\0','/6lLvKnRQDx0MibdyXsQl9EizdpC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764614',4.8,3614,'en','The Curse of Styria','In 1989, Lara Hill, accompanies her art historian father to an abandoned castle across the Iron Curtain. From a car crash outside of the castle, emerges the beautiful and mysterious Carmilla. Lara secrets Carmilla into the castle and the two are drawn into an intoxicating relationship. But when Carmilla mysteriously disappears, and women of the town begin committing suicide, Lara’s psychic wounds erupt into a living nightmare that consumes the entire town of Styria.','/8NXdv4wDYRlkxSMg0VdfdcQC2lB.jpg','2014-08-21',99,'Released','Love requires sacrifice.','The Curse of Styria',229154,1.9805,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30544,_binary '\0','/rg10dfOmhP42jTmVs0jRTPQ0WUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764625',6,10007,'es','Las aventuras de Tadeo Jones','Tad is a celebrity archaeologist and adventurer just like his hero Max Mordon... in his dreams! In reality, Tad is a Chicago construction worker. One day, however, he is mistaken for a real professor and takes his place on a flight to Peru in search of the lost city of Paititi.','/vmysxjUJkYmp6CmjNOKOeHMOzFA.jpg','2012-08-10',92,'Released','No whip, no gun... All fun!','Tad, the Lost Explorer',121734,7.6782,6.3,'AeegNmbFR3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30545,_binary '\0','/1levD3OghlNvnkY2OB9CFmbeRfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764647',5.3,3548,'en','Shadow People','A radio talk show host unravels a conspiracy about encounters with mysterious beings known as The Shadow People and their role in the unexplained deaths of several hundred victims in the 1980s.','/1exiURM0lihHWoEEeLrHux5sxEI.jpg','2013-03-17',89,'Released',NULL,'Shadow People',176570,1.5236,5,'RszVo4me9qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30546,_binary '\0','/ihKsZZYMbyHXC1L7s90WDLITdC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764651',6.6,336522,'en','The Expendables 2','Mr. Church reunites the Expendables for what should be an easy paycheck, but when one of their men is murdered on the job, their quest for revenge puts them deep in enemy territory and up against an unexpected threat.','/74rTIGyGoIu5KSxDVMdr8H3MtMo.jpg','2012-08-15',103,'Released','Back for War.','The Expendables 2',76163,18.7595,6.356,'ip_CYHdyUBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30547,_binary '\0','/xcaoQG4vzXVqfGjgTVpmle7Cxko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1764657',7.9,2118,'en','The Great White Silence','Herbert Ponting travelled to Antarctica with Captain Scott’s ill-fated South Pole expedition and filmed the stunning images that make up this extraordinary documentary. (Originally released in 1912 as With Captain Scott in the Antarctic, the material was re-edited and re-issued by Ponting in 1924 as The Great White Silence.)','/zygS2mwsnnE6ILFg0Iekuy2zW2X.jpg','1924-05-01',108,'Released',NULL,'The Great White Silence',84880,1.6262,7.8,'qoe7noZkLlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30548,_binary '\0','/qDz1KJoraOsF0PGzNGk63PARNps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1765729',2.5,1317,'ru','Бригада: Наследник','Ivan is a typical modern young man of 18. His father disappeared 10 years ago. Trying to shake off the pursuing enemies of their father, Belov\'s wife and daughter changed their names and settled in the United States. But Alexander Belov\'s blood still runs in Ivan\'s veins. He wants to prove his financial independence to his mother and gets involved in a dubious stock market speculation. The operation fails and Ivan and his friends are faced with a huge debt. To solve this problem Ivan heads to Russia in order to try selling a small part of his father\'s multi-million heritage, but keeps this venture a secret from his mother. His friends Phil, Sydney and Kelly join him in this undertaking. The new rescue plan turned out to be even more dangerous than the prior speculative venture. The main characters get into areal maelstrom of betrayals, pursuits, family secrets and their disclosures and showdowns with both the mob and the Russian secret services...','/jAJPWJ6dRox5q1u4NWZutnWXsnj.jpg','2012-11-29',102,'Released',NULL,'Legatee',149798,0.9432,2.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30549,_binary '\0','/jghb0ivR2irMvBG3yHuqc1vVjOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17660740',6.9,3315,'en','The Pez Outlaw','Steve Glew, a small-town Michigan farmer, boards a plane for Eastern Europe soon after the fall of the Berlin Wall. His mission is to locate a secret factory that holds the key to the most desired and valuable pez dispensers. If he succeeds, he will pull his family out of poverty and finally find a purpose in his mundane life.','/aCZlHJe8gbfecigjGFHO8FJQwdy.jpg','2022-10-21',85,'Released','Some hobbies are more dangerous than others.','The Pez Outlaw',934222,1.1684,6.9,'DvawI3djAoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30550,_binary '\0','/ra5QwDYHUf1kUb0HDfqfAfZpwCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1766085',6.6,1475,'en','Shut Up Little Man! An Audio Misadventure','In 1987, Eddie Lee Sausage and Mitch Deprey recorded the nightly squabbles of their over-the-top neighbors, homophobic Raymond Huffman and proudly gay Peter Haskett, and the chronicle of the pair\'s bizarre existence soon took on a life of its own. This darkly funny documentary checks in with former punks Eddie and Mitch, who detail their late-\'80s Lower Haight surroundings, and surveys the tapes\' influence on an array of underground artists.','/gFOu1szsOIgxdYPzYIBMZscFqcG.jpg','2011-08-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Shut Up Little Man! An Audio Misadventure',73669,1.4234,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30551,_binary '\0','/dFGbu1lJZFmiiGI5J9sQHAvhG5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1766094',5,22335,'en','So Undercover','When the FBI hires her to go undercover at a college sorority, Molly Morris must transform herself from a tough, streetwise private investigator to a refined, sophisticated university girl to help protect the daughter of a one-time Mobster. With several suspects on her list, Molly unexpectedly discovers that not everyone is who they appear to be, including herself.','/abR6e0FaWwwcEJEM4PY5VvjwBr1.jpg','2012-12-06',94,'Released','Meet the FBI\'s new secret weapon','So Undercover',93837,5.2341,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30552,_binary '\0','/kH8fqDAbRLk93HQeDXs2GLjY1yZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1766175',5.6,1769,'en','Trap for Cinderella','A young girl, suffering from amnesia after surviving a house fire that takes her childhood friend\'s life, begins a tormented road to recovery.','/46F0gInnHI4oCPd0iH9KNIs60vd.jpg','2013-07-12',100,'Released','The trap is set.','Trap for Cinderella',199723,1.8784,5.207,'3DIU5dgYkp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30553,_binary '\0','/n90D0WoWScoLALfolbt47FZ1Qyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1766190',6.6,3501,'da','Hvidsten gruppen','The true story of the Fiils: a family of innkeepers who, during Nazi-Germany\'s occupation of Denmark, took up arms against the German occupiers. But in the fight for freedom, some must die so that others may live.','/3e6X32YaSkGa28KVhnfMmdoBF8T.jpg','2012-03-01',122,'Released','Some must die so others can live','This Life',103839,1.6261,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30554,_binary '\0','/su7FqHdZez0oOvpZAbV7P6BGq0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17663876',5.6,5830,'en','Muzzle','LAPD K-9 officer Jake Rosser has just witnessed the shocking murder of his dedicated partner by a mysterious assailant. As he investigates the shooter’s identity, he uncovers a vast conspiracy that has a choke-hold on the city in this thrilling journey through the tangled streets of Los Angeles and the corrupt bureaucracy of the LAPD.','/1zwYPOYtcGBma92dkMSsqTI0Qfx.jpg','2023-09-29',100,'Released','Vengeance is off the leash.','Muzzle',939335,7.1429,6.5,'rYY5QdEGEZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30555,_binary '\0','/k6ANeyxAfMRi5xhxIXv1Scn9vc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17663992',6.4,155770,'en','Scream VI','Following the latest Ghostface killings, the four survivors leave Woodsboro behind and start a fresh chapter.','/wDWwtvkRRlgTiUr6TyLSMX8FCuZ.jpg','2023-03-08',123,'Released','New York. New rules.','Scream VI',934433,20.6394,6.9,'1Ie2qmAOc6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30556,_binary '\0','/dDGKfYF90ZJFiqrcAOhNIBmxUeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1767272',4.8,2383,'en','388 Arletta Avenue','A young couple find themselves in an unnerving situation with a mysterious stalker.','/aK1ACo13ZHEJFO8fLxOMexhGxXW.jpg','2011-09-11',87,'Released',NULL,'388 Arletta Avenue',73943,2.0487,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30557,_binary '\0','/zoz4vZPe95m0RiUZtMyGeto5L02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1767354',6.8,62941,'en','Odd Thomas','In a California desert town, a short-order cook with clairvoyant abilities encounters a mysterious man with a link to dark, threatening forces.','/skBMhQjHLTU1rp4gutxHp0JuY1C.jpg','2013-01-29',97,'Released','I might see dead people... But then, by God, I do something about it.','Odd Thomas',179826,6.2959,6.948,'ZEnvutQ0UI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30558,_binary '\0','/ocQbjedQkWNaUj8queTgPGlVRlx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1767372',6.2,30961,'en','She\'s Funny That Way','On the set of a playwright\'s new project, a love triangle forms between his wife, her ex-lover, and the call girl-turned-actress cast in the production.','/2FiZVfwz27bvMROkud3dlFyE8uA.jpg','2015-04-22',93,'Released','Show biz has always been a little screwball.','She\'s Funny That Way',245906,5.9782,5.9,'tjQqJwpYwN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30559,_binary '\0','/imk3oXgLZJg5lcm93jPUukP73fl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1767382',5.2,25910,'en','Silent House','Sarah returns with her father and uncle to fix up the family\'s longtime summerhouse after it was violated by squatters in the off-season. As they work in the dark, Sarah begins to hear sounds from within the walls of the boarded-up building. Although she barely remembers the place, Sarah senses the past may still haunt the home.','/mbkvYlx1scovMi80rOOkNBvgU11.jpg','2011-01-21',86,'Released','Experience 88 minutes of real fear, captured In real time','Silent House',92182,2.9056,5.4,'6yLD4km_d1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30560,_binary '\0','/ice3dNrgJZmyFXs4InhjAJMIGMS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17676734',6,9957,'en','Americana','After a rare Native American artifact falls onto the black market, a shy waitress with big dreams teams up with a lovelorn military veteran to gain possession of it, putting them in the crosshairs of a ruthless criminal working on behalf of a Western antiquities dealer.','/83Gis9pOKCvAdaKXCNChey4IZyL.jpg','2025-08-15',107,'Released','Welcome to the new west.','Americana',934456,5.3355,6.207,'ulZoLec80fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30561,_binary '\0','/8RqZ57dpz3SiqfZq0gvV9Bzju6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17677178',5.5,4727,'en','Who Invited Them','Adam and Margo\'s housewarming party goes well enough except there\'s this one mysterious couple lingering after the other guests have left.','/2aY7M59bGPRqPHtUz6qGArN7bed.jpg','2022-06-05',80,'Released','Sit down. Have a drink. Get uncomfortable.','Who Invited Them',931346,2.8649,5.5,'Tgavhhzfsg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30562,_binary '\0','/xFPtZRyFBU8oxeImTEh2rexzPXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17677434',4.9,8267,'es','La fiebre de los ricos','A strange disease kills off some of the richest and most influential people on the planet. First it was the billionaires, then the multi-millionaires and so on progressively... Then it threatens to strike anyone with any sort of fortune. With the whole world panicking, people try to flood the market with assets the world no longer wants.','/fKmn4SrS41loy8gMzyxups69Xof.jpg','2024-12-12',116,'Released','The richer you are, the faster you die.','Rich Flu',934584,4.4337,5.3,'kJ_4XQiC4lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30563,_binary '\0','/24fe6ou97ammOg3O6ShCgaiolp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17677744',5.6,1262,'ja','七つの大罪 怨嗟のエジンバラ 前編','Tristan, the son of Meliodas and Elizabeth, inherits the power of the Goddess Clan and can heal people’s wounds and injuries, but he often ends up hurting others due to his inability to control his Demon Clan power. To protect his family, Tristan heads to Edinburgh Castle and meets a host of new friends along the way.','/g1CSJZwI51YPGATc5iiExxfwvyg.jpg','2022-12-20',52,'Released','Are you ready to revisit the Kingdom of Leones?','The Seven Deadly Sins: Grudge of Edinburgh Part 1',989937,3.3056,7.692,'hskfrLEkrxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30564,_binary '\0','/uVeWvMvaTy3zj8Z8oOJ04XGYhW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17679584',7.5,7799,'ar','أزرق القفطان','A middle-aged tailor and his wife find their relationship challenged by the arrival of a handsome new apprentice.','/a4ipoP8RnMsISuAkzupbZj4mTKI.jpg','2023-02-10',122,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Caftan',958279,2.858,7.231,'CRAHt9PFv0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30565,_binary '\0','/9qEUwCulckZeSU3M7uPCzWi3wND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17686944',3.3,1627,'en','The Highwayman','Famed highway robber Dick Turpin finds himself on the run in the English countryside having accidentally kidnapped the Earl of Pembroke\'s feisty daughter, Elizabeth. As her fiance Winthroppe attempts to track them down, Elizabeth begins to fall for the dashing highwayman, leaving Turpin with no choice but to face off against Winthroppe in a fight for Elizabeth\'s heart - and her fortune.','/eVEyBmldMAfKBOIjuuLnXxFThiI.jpg','2022-05-07',85,'Released',NULL,'The Highwayman',973509,1.3654,6,'VGwbAUAX7xE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30566,_binary '\0','/9H0KFczIXen0AbDKRdKxZ1QhRmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1769363',6.7,11287,'en','The Giant Mechanical Man','An offbeat romantic comedy about a silver-painted street performer and the soft spoken zoo worker who falls for him.','/yfecPCTuP8vNAijpjewznbKuzIu.jpg','2012-04-27',94,'Released',NULL,'The Giant Mechanical Man',100046,3.6713,6.449,'NY2CT0dNf1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30567,_binary '\0','/ocgfe17YJhIMk5991yTMydTxxXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1770650',5.4,1730,'th','โคตรสู้ โคตรโส','A group of martial arts students are enjoying a reunion party when a bomb goes off in the building. When they wake up, some of their friends have been kidnapped and they soon find a group of assassins coming after them. The only way to survive is to fight their way out.','/GcXOHBEHqfaT3bYTb56Vd4zbEP.jpg','2010-12-16',106,'Released','In the ultimate fight of their lives only the strongest will survive.','BKO: Bangkok Knockout',64205,1.9326,5.7,'xjuxIbxV8Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30568,_binary '\0','/98G6Z7SZt9NtQ0UhrRFm20AVyE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1770672',4.4,2264,'en','Djinn','Desperate to put the traumatic loss of their infant child behind them, newlywed couple Khalid and Salama return to their home in the United Arab Emirates. Unknown to the couple, their new luxury apartment block, Al Hamra, was built on the site of an old abandoned fishing village of the same name. Legend has it the village was abandoned after malevolent beings haunted its inhabitants. Unsettled by her new surroundings and the eerie hallways of Al Hamra, Khalid worries his wife is failing to battle her personal demons – but could it be something far more sinister?','/woW3UhIRYb6xJjv0sbS2dKtDo8Y.jpg','2013-10-31',85,'Released','Evil wants an heir.','Djinn',229138,1.3994,4.4,'wO-PdQECgww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30569,_binary '\0','/pi6H83hc192nBTEDJbpNkm8TCZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1770734',6.2,13416,'en','Shadow Dancer','In 1990s Belfast, a woman is forced to betray all she believes in for the sake of her son.','/ihkceEMJK4XtHXgw97ggsrE3ExP.jpg','2012-02-12',101,'Released',NULL,'Shadow Dancer',84336,3.6252,5.946,'-jdSpJ0EtMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30570,_binary '\0','/xAGRv8tyai7iXfvJhCTtpJpXFvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17717416',6.3,3799,'en','Bad Genius','A highly-gifted student sees an opportunity to escape her roots by helping wealthy classmates cheat on key exams, but at great risk to her future.','/h5hONXZ4hPgniv1DXMB1IZohhpO.jpg','2024-09-12',96,'Released','Risking it all for one big score.','Bad Genius',934866,3.8697,6.8,'bSTgvx3eP_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30571,_binary '\0','/2RgsodpRG1kbSjv9q2g7flIShOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772230',5.7,6876,'zh','辛亥革命','China\'s first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.','/k93DWz849jCsHW7rIbeUAIxewpr.jpg','2011-09-23',99,'Released','The fall of the last empire.','1911',76349,3.4452,5.732,'46HzyYbXXRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30572,_binary '\0','/4HAF3vOCHnCwLD2jLS6MN57HQ2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772240',5.2,60591,'en','Apollo 18','Officially, Apollo 17 was the last manned mission to the moon. But a year later in 1973, three American astronauts were sent on a secret mission to the moon funded by the US Department of Defense. What you are about to see is the actual footage which the astronauts captured on that mission. While NASA denies its authenticity, others say it\'s the real reason we\'ve never gone back to the moon.','/4bLqU6YncqvKETzvPZPPoVrLUYM.jpg','2011-07-20',86,'Released','There\'s a reason we\'ve never gone back to the moon.','Apollo 18',50357,4.8859,5.3,'-82qd_rCzOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30573,_binary '\0','/ez0zntkwczsv1d1n8WFhMe5rtq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772250',7.3,50036,'es','La cara oculta','A Spanish orchestra conductor deals with the mysterious disappearance of his girlfriend.','/sk6D07ntxMgzqArCq1ufHSvxZvt.jpg','2011-09-16',92,'Released','There are doors that should never be opened.','The Hidden Face',80184,5.2955,7.302,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30574,_binary '\0','/xpkreMLtHfudy6aNr7ZfIFsXduu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772261',4.4,2221,'en','The Curse of Downers Grove','The town of Downers Grove looks like your average suburban neighborhood -- but Downers Grove has a disturbing secret.... For the past eight years, one senior from every high school graduating class has met a bizarre death right before graduation day. And this year, Chrissie Swanson has a terrible feeling that she is going to be the one to die. Can Chrissie survive the curse of Downers Grove or will she, like those seniors before her, fall prey to the town\'s deadly secret?','/fTpYTV0a23Diw344tE199bIHo7l.jpg','2015-08-21',89,'Released','High school can be murder.','The Curse of Downers Grove',309919,1.9484,4.6,'wiCLImVvWmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30575,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772262',3.9,1293,'en','Dragon Day','When Duke Evans, an out of work NSA analyst, is evicted from his home he moves his family to his grandfather\'s old cabin. However here they are also threatened when a hellish cyber-attack is unleashed on the US rendering anything with a computer chip useless. He must now keep his family alive, fight off would-be thieves and a newly corrupted government, and ultimately make the hardest decision of his life- to survive.','/6ELuPDideRREpbGaGxyTyFyGdHq.jpg','2013-01-10',96,'Released','The hack is the attack.','Dragon Day',219288,1.8044,4.2,'l70t-dLIrS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30576,_binary '\0','/988AG01BZZe62P33jemkFIacxF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772264',6.8,65455,'en','Stonehearst Asylum','An Oxford Medical School graduate takes a position at a mental institution and soon becomes obsessed with a female mental patient, but he has no idea of a recent and horrifying staffing change.','/fZxGCCQ0NAtraevqULJ84wSSjo0.jpg','2014-10-23',112,'Released','No one is what they seem.','Stonehearst Asylum',207933,10.0016,6.9,'3fw6fDIgNcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30577,_binary '\0','/l6oRHECKy8lChTA82O2jMlAJUBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772270',6.1,2454,'en','Foxfire','Set in the 1950s, a a group of young girls in upstate New York form their own gang.','/gUQRVV9wbM8XRbx9JabGZGOVX88.jpg','2013-01-02',123,'Released',NULL,'Foxfire',101998,1.7939,5.7,'cq5olSh_tbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30578,_binary '\0','/gfSxzy13Jrzu9CseVE6js5TIox3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772271',5.9,5301,'en','3, 2, 1... Frankie Go Boom','Frank Bartlett has been tortured, embarrassed, and humiliated by his brother Bruce — usually on film — his entire life. Now that Bruce is finally off drugs and has turned his life around, things should be different. They are not.','/5JOlPMiErxebf0nBDW8dK64zF3n.jpg','2012-10-12',89,'Released','A comedy about two brothers, a girl with a broken heart, a sex tape, an angel and a pig...','3, 2, 1... Frankie Go Boom',94104,1.8323,5.7,'WNBu7zzmnyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30579,_binary '\0','/6ZzMkCCDX7TbLQySUqW8meYqVPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772288',7,35206,'en','Danny Collins','An ageing hard-living 1970s rock star decides to change his life when he discovers a 40-year-old undelivered letter written to him by John Lennon.','/sf9ndc9l6alP9DhJF1ZpKz1PaXK.jpg','2015-03-19',107,'Released','A letter from John Lennon changed his life','Danny Collins',256924,6.7438,6.7,'d2U-MnSv8aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30580,_binary '\0','/9OuKGYvM6VGovrPQ5SBD4Gm0xaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772339',6.7,2368,'tr','Prensesin Uykusu','Çağan Irmak\'s delightful new film is a fairy tale for the waking hour. Aziz works as a clerk in a library and lives in his own quiet and peaceful little world. Then one day he discovers that he has new neighbours: Seçil, the owner of the new opened local beauty shop and her 10 year-old daughter Gizem. Life for Aziz becomes much brighter and livelier but then something unexpected happens and darkness descends once again. A whole new set of events is set in motion as a bunch of memorable characters join together to try to change the course of fate. From the Diary of Aziz: There are those who say that fate cannot be changed, for if it could, it would not be fate. So be it. How hopeless we would feel if we had to live in a world where nothing could change. Don\'t you think so? It might just be that there will come a day when you will realize that something bad that happened to you happened for a reason and caused something better to come about. You never know.','/1R6CJluB8qJitRogMMck8lkk7xX.jpg','2010-11-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Sleeping Princess',50423,1.4336,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30581,_binary '\0','/3IFRjBDwtk0DlIsDfJ2zEzLjUBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772341',7.7,505607,'en','Wreck-It Ralph','Wreck-It Ralph is the 9-foot-tall, 643-pound villain of an arcade video game named Fix-It Felix Jr., in which the game\'s titular hero fixes buildings that Ralph destroys. Wanting to prove he can be a good guy and not just a villain, Ralph escapes his game and lands in Hero\'s Duty, a first-person shooter where he helps the game\'s hero battle against alien invaders. He later enters Sugar Rush, a kart racing game set on tracks made of candies, cookies and other sweets. There, Ralph meets Vanellope von Schweetz who has learned that her game is faced with a dire threat that could affect the entire arcade, and one that Ralph may have inadvertently started.','/nrEupcBwf4O1zihCM34NoXusZDq.jpg','2012-11-01',101,'Released','When the game is over, the fun begins.','Wreck-It Ralph',82690,23.9761,7.362,'87E6N7ToCxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30582,_binary '\0','/d6oeM3zgzAXgZRbfxL4kRhn9ktK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772373',5,6928,'en','The Craigslist Killer','Based on a true story, seemingly flawless Philip Markoff, a charismatic and popular medical student at Boston University, leads a double life and starts to descend into a twisted world of gambling, crime, battery, and eventually murder, all while meeting his victims via Craigslist.','/6kv8tLMxL3OkotgmESuTVM0ihb5.jpg','2011-01-03',95,'Released','Be careful what you search for.','The Craigslist Killer',55680,2.8245,5.2,'t-zMX7Lk0tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30583,_binary '\0','/eXYRjRUb78nSuLVQhwsBqIwxWPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772416',6.2,2839,'tr','Vay Arkadaş','One of the three friends living in the slums of Istanbul Manik, Tik and Dildo\'s, many ordinary overflow out of the neighborhood, but the excitement continued in a lively way in themselves, the stories of adventure full of life and laughter.','/3JsOoJTlRgrMPSsxf4PRvj5iP1e.jpg','2010-11-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Vay Arkadaş',51243,1.4242,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30584,_binary '\0','/dnWowXHGJ0AmeD5CLdJQHRVxTSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772424',7.4,14200,'ar','وهلأ لوين؟‎','In a remote, isolated Lebanese village surrounded by land mines, Muslims and Christians live together in peace. As civil strife starts to engulf the country around them, the women in the village try, by various means and to varying success, to keep their men in the dark by sabotaging the village radio, and then destroying the village TV.','/crYsh9vt7ujWoI4o91bfclYp7WM.jpg','2011-09-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Where Do We Go Now?',77461,2.4797,7.37,'QBGuk2lfZdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30585,_binary '\0','/tJ4U9bRdnyR2qUPWyh85oAJEgpT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772872',5.3,2679,'hi','Game','Four strangers are invited by the reclusive Kabir Malhotra, to his private island of Samos, Greece. They don\'t know each other and they don\'t know him ... and by the next morning they will wish they had never come.','/nB8jtWGzFuYGRY1Dkbtf23dxbap.jpg','2011-04-01',135,'Released','It\'s Not Over Till Its Over','Game',60740,1.0822,5.8,'P4jvR6MiFFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30586,_binary '\0','/1h815ydN8AvrRmNU48eXu4EanO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1772925',7.8,40052,'en','Jiro Dreams of Sushi','Revered sushi chef Jiro Ono strives for perfection in his work, while his eldest son, Yoshikazu, has trouble living up to his father\'s legacy.','/iVrkM4jSJw1IsOpW5jTtY5QxVqj.jpg','2011-06-11',82,'Released','Fall in love with your work','Jiro Dreams of Sushi',80767,2.3264,7.719,'0VB_DrsHDQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30587,_binary '\0','/lQAVFfrqxhTzUzpKwV5G1elrc5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773000',7.6,1385,'cs','Občanský průkaz','Bittersweet comedy about four teenage boys, their friends, parents, lovers - from the moment when they are 15 to moment when they are 18. Story is set in 1970s, when is Czechoslovakia occupied by Russians.','/erOqslWV5Q8aTiiYMD6FP6prckV.jpg','2010-10-21',129,'Released',NULL,'Identity Card',55637,0.8958,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30588,_binary '\0','/567fcHNucXnunbib6Cc8nHX1DPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773015',7.5,6493,'hi','Phas Gaye Re Obama','Om, a debt-ridden NRI, wants to sell his ancestral property to pay his debts, but things turn awry when he is kidnapped by gangsters who believe him to be a rich target.','/wdRVfwsdXpN7H4p8Ydnr90Ym5d3.jpg','2010-11-01',111,'Released','Join the Gang','Phas Gaye Re Obama',56897,1.5882,7.073,'WJzhBCPa0O8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30589,_binary '\0','/6GGtqNc3N5iTW5jBHjio1GzTmcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773109',5.8,4982,'hi','Yamla Pagla Deewana','An NRI visits India to look for his estranged father and brother. He soon learns that both are expert conmen. He is forced to join them and go to Punjab to fix his younger brother\'s love life.','/1Po2YSBz2vloFxjYbs3CNO7I1vf.jpg','2011-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Yamla Pagla Deewana',54639,1.3896,5.322,'ImJvBQWkaOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30590,_binary '\0','/ivFeRNnlt0UQmniHGe83XFEFzcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773389',5.2,2838,'en','Einstein\'s God Model','For thousands of years, evidence of life after death has eluded mankind. Science is about to change that. With the help of a physicist, a blind medium, and Thomas Edison’s final experiment, Brayden Taylor embarks on a quest to contact his deceased fiancee. For his love to transcend dimensions, he must defy the laws of quantum physics. He must defy the balance nature demands. He must defy ... Einstein’s God Model.','/wNvRtIL4dNV6BCfkLFHOYrwJ0V8.jpg','2016-08-19',89,'Released','It\'s very beautiful over there ...','Einstein\'s God Model',420478,1.8452,5.5,'D_leEuAAu9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30591,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773441',8.3,1611,'kn','ಗಾಳಿಪಟ','Three friends, Ganesh (Ganesh), Diganth (Diganth) and Kitty (Rajesh Krishnan) come to Mugilupete. Ganesh falls in love with Sowmya (Daisy Bopanna), a widow, staying with her in-laws Kodandaram (Anant Nag) and Padma (Padmaja Rao) while Diganth and Kitty fall for Kodandaram\'s daughters Radha (Neethoo) and Pavani (Bhavana Rao) respectively. While Diganth-Radha and Kitty-Pavani get the green signal for marriage, Sowmya is hesitant to accept Ganesh as her life partner. The director shows how Ganesh wins her heart in a unique way.','/j0g7LQV2k2ZcO3ivnuUr7TVAaSR.jpg','2008-01-30',146,'Released','Manada Mugilalli Mohabbath','Gaalipata',224568,1.0498,7.714,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30592,_binary '\0','/5v60mZhF7nLgmPS3qZ9JUwDr33l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773753',5.1,9835,'en','Mara','Criminal psychologist Kate Fuller is assigned to the murder of a man who has seemingly been strangled in his sleep by his wife and the only witness is their eight-year-old daughter, Sophie. As Kate digs into the mystery of an ancient demon which kills people in their sleep, she experiences the same petrifying symptoms as all previous victims and spirals through a chilling nightmare to save herself and Sophie before she dares fall asleep again.','/gQDmXAef1Oc1SXci5mui2x5DJwt.jpg','2018-08-22',100,'Released','If you see her, you\'re already dead.','Mara',514277,2.6975,5.7,'9LuwGUFQf04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30593,_binary '\0','/442KB0zDUd69ecKTqaQulnZsKst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1773764',8,8432,'hi','Ship of Theseus','Three stories about persons forced to think about the ethics and moral issues raised by medical advances.','/t75n1cm3uZXl4WQj8U9UcfBRmWC.jpg','2012-09-06',143,'Released','How do you know where you end and where your environment begins?','Ship of Theseus',128207,1.5694,6.9,'-CWFqkcx9CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30594,_binary '\0','/jA1vle7V5wCc0HTOErkakX8hqkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1774358',6.3,1416,'es','El cártel de los sapos','The real life story of Andres Lopez Lopez aka \"Frecita\" during his years involved with the Colombian Cartel aka \"Cartel Norte del Valle\"','/8GOf6nwrnaGu6mNv8VdVkD42lzL.jpg','2011-11-11',106,'Released','Based on the real life story of a cartel kingpin.','The Snitch Cartel',136735,2.4723,7.2,'vYZSxXcwJmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30595,_binary '\0','/pA4ziTciiu15jVWJguKZpvIPz7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1774438',7.8,1671,'fi','Kovasikajuttu','The Punk Syndrome is a film about Finland’s most kick-ass punk rock band, Pertti Kurikan Nimipäivät. The band members, Pertti, Kari, Toni and Sami, are mentally handicapped and they play their music with a lot of attitude and pride. We follow these professional musicians on their journey from obscurity to popularity. We watch them fight, fall in love and experience strong emotions. We witness long days in the recording studio and on tour. They laugh, cry, drink and fight over who gets to sit in the front on the tour bus. Then it’s time to make up and go talk to people in the audience and tell them how great their band is.','/oBi2Il78DUxg0QEPAztlMToRMyA.jpg','2012-05-04',85,'Released',NULL,'The Punk Syndrome',122492,1.208,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30596,_binary '\0','/qmKvkjlzQ9LapKRCECCl8GBYLdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1774591',5.8,5569,'en','Teenage Cocktail','Feeling confined by their small town and overbearing parents, Annie and Jules hatch a scheme of running away. The only issue is, they need the money to get there. Jules suggests the couple try webcam modeling. Although she’s nervous at first, Annie can’t argue when the money starts rolling in. But as the girls soon find out, consequences can blindside you. Sometimes violently.','/24Hbcq4KnvvWPPz8WYZuAIG5S6K.jpg','2016-03-12',88,'Released','How Annie and Jules fell in love and how it all got weird.','Teenage Cocktail',381075,2.0086,5.406,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30597,_binary '\0','/jvtz543v2y21otwWqaw4bjm14qx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1776086',7,1755,'en','Bettie Page Reveals All','The world\'s greatest pin-up model and cult icon, Bettie Page, recounts the true story of how her free expression overcame government witch-hunts to help launch America\'s sexual revolution. When she saw the film The Notorious Bettie Page, produced by HBO in 2006, the main person concerned reacted unequivocally: “Lies! Lies!” In a long interview recorded shortly before her death, the woman who entered the collective unconscious as the ultimate pin-up gave her version of events to director Mark Mori. In a gravelly voice, Bettie Page tells her own story and lifts the veil on areas often hidden by images that have made so many men and women fantasize since the 1950s: her abused childhood, an eclipse that lasted forty years, her mental illness. Through testimonies and unpublished archives, this documentary brings back to life a body and a face endlessly declined before our eyes, just as Bettie wanted: “I would like people to remember me as I was in the photos.”','/2h3dJpOKM3dVmIXKZtk1LWHMuwp.jpg','2013-11-22',101,'Released',NULL,'Bettie Page Reveals All',220494,2.739,6.8,'V8ZJsDgIM7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30598,_binary '\0','/f06wctFI1PSBlxBOqQYQ3vkJbua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1776143',6.5,2123,'cn','單身男女','A typical story of the classic romantic triangle, where one person ends up having to choose between two others. This time, it is set against a backdrop of offices in Hong Kong, with a focus on architecture and its designers.','/l3wF8nHu1v2R1iI5ZIQ0zgyIeW.jpg','2011-03-31',115,'Released','Torn between two lovers, feeling like a fool.','Don\'t Go Breaking My Heart',67793,2.3862,6.4,'4OlRFeTw_pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30599,_binary '\0','/jW5YmMRjSCQRPZJ9r5Hf62bX604.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1776196',6.8,6013,'ja','鋼の錬金術師 嘆きの丘（ミロス）の聖なる星','A fugitive alchemist with mysterious abilities leads the Elric brothers to a distant valley of slums inhabited by the Milos, a proud people struggling against bureaucratic exploitation. Ed and Al quickly find themselves in the middle of a rising rebellion, as the exiled Milos lash out against their oppressors. At the heart of the conflict is Julia, a young alchemist befriended by Alphonse. She\'ll stop at nothing to restore the Milos to their former glory – even if that means harnessing the awful power of the mythical Philosopher\'s Stone.','/7RvBQOTZGhCoPvLiF3Ugp2Q94Ux.jpg','2011-07-02',110,'Released','Finally tell the story of forbidden bonds','Fullmetal Alchemist: The Sacred Star of Milos',80518,4.6346,6.8,'37Iofk7wNjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30600,_binary '\0','/hBVqQXjyOyDYpnhmAL9HlspnMtX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1776222',7.1,2557,'nl','Kauwboy','A lively young boy befriends and attempts to raise an abandoned baby jackdaw unbeknownst to his choleric and disapproving father.','/7H2QE3PzZlK4ATvGeZda0HbjyRh.jpg','2012-04-18',81,'Released',NULL,'Kauwboy',114718,1.4182,6.305,'x2arjDF3hmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30601,_binary '\0','/36VhNCIOHTFD1sCLpyUnXqDk7f3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1777034',7.3,14050,'en','United','United is based on the true story of Manchester United\'s legendary \"Busby Babes\", the youngest side ever to win the Football League and the 1958 Munich Air Crash that claimed eight of the their number. The film draws on first-hand interviews with the survivors and their families to tell the inspirational story of a team and community overcoming terrible tragedy.','/kWWa20kIjk4B6OtRHqWj41HHmiN.jpg','2011-01-02',91,'Released','The true story of how the world\'s most popular team rose from the ashes','United',62441,2.7484,6.9,'myNAceLxHI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30602,_binary '\0','/isSO9bWaaPQFGNuDQThcM6aDHTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1777551',7.4,7635,'en','Bobby Fischer Against the World','The first documentary feature to explore the tragic and bizarre life of the late chess master Bobby Fischer.','/nWuo6jWdvqLX0zZ9zmOdQObDCHD.jpg','2011-06-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Bobby Fischer Against the World',67885,1.6386,6.8,'5sWuhpsG2aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30603,_binary '\0','/3t6rSXaycM6LHsEMYvoWoBboJfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1777595',6.4,2525,'en','50 to 1','A misfit group of New Mexico cowboys find themselves on the journey of a lifetime when they learn their crooked-footed racehorse qualifies to run in the Kentucky Derby. Based on the true story of Mine That Bird, the cowboys must overcome impossible odds even before they reach Churchill Downs and the land of Kentucky\'s blue bloods.','/uIbniwxSlHyvGECiBMkTeWI0pib.jpg','2014-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'50 to 1',197583,1.8175,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30604,_binary '\0','/s4ZEtO5Lo444WJ5lBVyYARAq08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1777606',6.5,12106,'en','Rosaline','Left heartbroken after Romeo begins to pursue her cousin Juliet, Rosaline schemes to foil the famous romance and win back her guy in this comedic twist of Shakespeare\'s Romeo and Juliet.','/jQHrbzVy6ptopxqUohV6PcmmVcY.jpg','2022-10-11',97,'Released','The love story you know, the ex you don’t.','Rosaline',826769,3.3797,7.1,'DVMc3rUXW-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30605,_binary '\0','/fTXj3Edo1Ml3U8aHiNduslEPem7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1777612',4.2,1831,'en','Demons Never Die','When a young girl takes her own life, Archie and the other Suicide Kids decide to follow her lead and form a pact. But as the group begin to die on by one, Archie realizes that they have all become the target of a masked killer and that his commitment to death has become a terrifying fight for survival and a battle to protect the girl he loves. But who\'s the killer?','/gfdFSg5SuiBB5fTDX0QtM07DFUS.jpg','2011-10-27',93,'Released','For some people the scariest thing... is finding a reason to live.','Demons Never Die',54094,1.5006,4.5,'G_FuDM59JdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30606,_binary '\0','/l8CVEHGV53lrptHpHiiBMFGg9kk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1778258',6.7,1864,'cn','復仇者之死','A serial murderer has brutally killed several policemen and their pregnant wives. After a quick investigation, the murderer is revealed to be Kit, whom the case\'s detective-in-charge knows from a previous case. Once upon a time, Kit was an innocent boy in a rural village who also has a crush on naïve high school student Wing. After the death of Wing\'s grandmother, Kit rescues Wing from a foster care facility, and the two quickly fall in love. However, their romance ends prematurely when a local policeman arrests them. The events that follow lay the seeds for Kit\'s terrifying path to vengeance.','/mqeO5gCR0NtipojZ9QydW88kPsN.jpg','2010-12-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Revenge: A Love Story',63415,2.3544,6.5,'yYxIG_vzY14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30607,_binary '\0','/6NBgG4LvjP4TkH1FDSfoJqVoQ7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1778304',5.8,105488,'en','Paranormal Activity 3','In 1988, young sisters Katie and Kristi befriend an invisible entity who resides in their home.','/9nYranPiWdNmbD5PRPPSL7VUFTS.jpg','2011-10-19',83,'Released','Discover how the activity began.','Paranormal Activity 3',72571,6.236,5.9,'raF9HO4OTcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30608,_binary '\0','/7VACUKaPSsLKrEZIptduWLEjPTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1778338',8.2,3811,'en','The Culture High','The Culture High tears into the very fibre of the modern day marijuana debate to reveal the truth behind the arguments and motives governing both those who support and oppose the existing pot laws.','/h2rtO45j5BehkqeXwfJ434ZCmDh.jpg','2014-09-18',120,'Released',NULL,'The Culture High',295538,0.9868,7.4,'GRvo9QabEIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30609,_binary '\0','/kc7EqzuZVtwxCgmqjj1Lv5ISTsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1778924',6.1,2035,'en','The Ultimate Life','Despite his best intentions, billionaire Jason Stevens can’t find enough time to keep his beloved Alexia a priority. But when he discovers his late grandfather’s journal, he is transported back to Red Stevens’ incredible world. With everything he loves hanging in the balance, Jason Stevens hopes the past will prepare him well for the future.','/lRjea5SWCiKzDIpgNDzyvyOSTp.jpg','2013-09-06',105,'Released','Some things are worth more than money.','The Ultimate Life',195757,4.0502,7,'7C_ghciPnco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30610,_binary '\0','/lJjuN6YOHIKfXdQE3WOPz4lWA4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1778931',7.1,2432,'en','Manny','From abject poverty to becoming a ten-time boxing world champion, congressman, and international icon, Manny Pacquiao is the true definition of a Cinderella story. In the Philippines, he first entered the ring as a sixteen-year-old weighing ninety-eight pounds with the goal of earning money to feed his family. Now, almost twenty years later, when he fights, the country of 100 million people comes to a complete standstill to watch. Regarded for his ability to bring people together, Pacquiao entered the political arena in 2010. As history’s first boxing congressman, Pacquiao now fights for his people both inside and outside of the ring. Now at the height of his career, he is faced with maneuvering an unscrupulous sport while maintaining his political duties. The question now is, what bridge is too far for Manny Pacquiao to cross?','/mYnQXI0Dm4Tp9prSa6ZqX1NpXAk.jpg','2014-12-31',87,'Released',NULL,'Manny',253295,1.6744,6.4,'Qqi_DVcSMPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30611,_binary '\0','/yvpKHS9JLaDvPVuMpGyhqtZ9tH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1779076',6.3,2207,'en','The Jeffrey Dahmer Files','An experimental documentary film that uses archival footage, interviews, and fictionalised scenarios to tell the story of the people around Jeffrey Dahmer during the summer of his arrest in 1991.','/bLSI26TOpRx0tMyjlRQzTO2aUWF.jpg','2013-02-15',76,'Released','He lived next door.','The Jeffrey Dahmer Files',97686,1.2911,5.5,'Wc5ufsgrtW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30612,_binary '\0','/5r1gKY9mJNXLABbhoJJmyeVG9EJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1780762',4.8,13021,'es','Aftershock','Mayhem and death follow when an earthquake traps a group of tourists in a Chilean town.','/jbPqPMbJbhFttJy2joNVsO7a7Po.jpg','2012-09-12',89,'Released','The only thing more terrifying than Mother Nature is human nature.','Aftershock',123103,3.4893,5.1,'xi-ufQs3Dis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30613,_binary '\0','/wCCvyjGuLpA67UsR3VtdTFNvCuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1780798',5.7,29859,'en','Clown','A loving father finds a clown suit for his son\'s birthday party, only to realize the suit is part of an evil curse that turns its wearer into a killer.','/gp5QyaU49utfWVVL698BzlN2vMh.jpg','2014-11-13',99,'Released','The kids aren\'t alright.','Clown',112454,4.6364,5.8,'PNtZu-3di38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30614,_binary '\0','/yOs8pRIj5G9Bn8OEWfZzI4k0z5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1780856',7.6,1798,'de','Halt auf freier Strecke','Frank and Simone have fulfilled a dream and live with their two children in a row house in the suburbs. They are a happy couple, until the day Frank is diagnosed with an inoperable brain tumor. The family is suddenly confronted with death.','/jfIakkpNeHFVqaYA4TPiDxLGXNi.jpg','2011-12-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Stopped on Track',78313,1.9185,6.8,'DnepOnl910s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30615,_binary '\0','/cdMfn0Jr9RGqKkaX9HyR5l1kiYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1780967',6,11346,'en','Seberg','An ambitious young FBI agent is assigned to investigate iconic actress Jean Seberg when she becomes embroiled in the tumultuous civil rights movement in late 1960s Los Angeles.','/kv78WJ2YvWyk3c32sbOGFh64xcs.jpg','2019-12-13',103,'Released','Actress. Activist. Adversary.','Seberg',510298,3.1469,5.909,'Tck5EBUTeoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30616,_binary '\0','/s6dL0a10qrcqcnsHn1o21LC0Wo9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1780983',3.6,3600,'en','Assassin\'s Bullet','In Assassin\'s Bullet, Slater plays Robert Diggs, a black ops agent who comes to work for Ambassador Ashdown (Hunger Games star Donald Sutherland), tracking down a vigilante assassin in Eastern Europe. The maverick hit(wo)man has been taking out high-profile targets on the U.S. hit list, and Diggs must uncover the killer\'s identity before there\'s an international incident. The usual game of cat and mouse ensues.','/x8MsZDOsM3SFw7ihvZPYQBMPle.jpg','2012-08-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Assassin\'s Bullet',117923,3.0483,3.907,'G0m6kazVfTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30617,_binary '\0','/cZr5milmwj3hLbcMxZc4yszwn0O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781058',5.9,11497,'en','Wilson','Middle-aged and divorced, Wilson finds himself lonely, smug, and obsessed with his past.','/m63h5MxevYrKn3720hVgKZAx86S.jpg','2017-03-24',94,'Released','Positively Negative.','Wilson',346681,3.3863,6,'jjPxlzjuLww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30618,_binary '\0','/4hklKFnoKpsmDE58S1wQiPjaS88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781069',8.1,18515,'en','Zeitgeist: Moving Forward','A presentation of a case for a needed transition out of the current socioeconomic monetary paradigm which governs the entire world society. This subject matter will transcend the issues of cultural relativism and traditional ideology and move to relate the core, empirical \'life ground\' attributes of human and social survival, extrapolating those immutable natural laws into a new sustainable social paradigm called a \'Resource-Based Economy\'.','/i4zMQlaVc4NCTj5RQTR4AhppPoC.jpg','2011-01-15',161,'Released','This Shit\'s Got to Go!','Zeitgeist: Moving Forward',54293,1.6985,7,'QYLLFpNn4lM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30619,_binary '\0','/wpl3g17Ucjh30hUBv4Ng57ERWA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781769',6.6,113084,'en','Anna Karenina','In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she\'s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.','/b9mvt1kKqDuveD1AJuGSkBEuagU.jpg','2012-09-06',129,'Released','An epic story of love.','Anna Karenina',96724,7.5439,6.7,'RxtsC_LZ9eI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30620,_binary '\0','/yi0jwjo1gSlU1GcW4bPvWb4K2H2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781775',4.5,6603,'en','Beneath the Darkness','After watching their best friend get murdered, a group of teens struggle to expose a local hero as the vicious killer and keep from becoming his next victims.','/vzNQqXgIMxAAKQqnDziFtgksLbo.jpg','2012-01-06',96,'Released','Now I lay you down to sleep.','Beneath the Darkness',78461,1.7409,4.7,'oOwOkm1B62o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30621,_binary '\0','/jqeuR2sLKzFfiQHIiQAKK54rEoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781812',5.2,4826,'en','Exit Humanity','A decade after the American Civil War, Edward Young returns home from a hunting trip to find a horrific reanimation of his wife and that their son Adam has disappeared. He must battle his way through an unexplainable outbreak of the walking dead.','/9qdu0lDpQLKOqkTcyhO8Hv0gjYQ.jpg','2011-10-16',114,'Released','History has a violent way of repeating itself.','Exit Humanity',86305,1.7625,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30622,_binary '\0','/lVDDXGuuu2WiqQCyXMsLe513FNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781827',6.6,18832,'en','Hands of Stone','The legendary Roberto Duran and his equally legendary trainer Ray Arcel change each other\'s lives.','/rpAYkkc7ltnxnMXOZLPuI9A6cuB.jpg','2016-08-26',111,'Released','No más. No surrender.','Hands of Stone',184341,5.523,6.6,'KeP5YVVkQV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30623,_binary '\0','/lCt1HJfRuMskVCuBMuqv9D9L66J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781840',6.3,4148,'en','Jayne Mansfield\'s Car','Alabama; 1969: The death of a clan\'s estranged wife and mother brings together two very different families. The scars of the past hide differences that will either tear them apart or expose truths that could lead to unexpected collisions.','/52B13wFJFd4DhM9txFbmsiuVomE.jpg','2013-07-25',122,'Released','Torn Apart. Driven Together.','Jayne Mansfield\'s Car',94671,2.962,5.7,'hniT8wE9W1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30624,_binary '\0','/8dzhOaD3C3oadvpos1goB3UvLt8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781843',6.7,3146,'fr','L\'Exercice de l\'État','Transport Minister Bertrand Saint-Jean is awoken in the middle of the night by his head of staff. A bus has gone off the road into a gully. He has no choice but to go to the scene of the accident. Thus begins the odyssey of a politician in a world that is increasingly more complex and hostile.','/asri7RwmdY5OMqlLED8CF92Hdc0.jpg','2011-10-26',115,'Released',NULL,'The Minister',95448,2.728,6.4,'1vqbPSle7yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30625,_binary '\0','/3c6eDo7kX9aU2ullnfvaBOosYNO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781866',5.3,1269,'pt','Muita Calma Nessa Hora','Three young friends, Tita, Mari and Aninha decide to change their situations and travel to a beach place for a weekend. On the road, they meet Estrella, a hippie that wants a hide to try to find her unknown father. Together, they will live hilarious, absurd and moving situations. More than a change the air, they change themselves.','/gpyl7xI1SEb8WgC5PeRUQcw19cx.jpg','2010-11-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Muita Calma Nessa Hora',56840,1.5303,6,'fZSn1cA3Jis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30626,_binary '\0','/e3xcYVsoR5dfVM0kq1l0BTkSgzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1781922',6.8,99621,'en','No Escape','In their new overseas home, an American family soon finds themselves caught in the middle of a coup, and they frantically look for a safe escape in an environment where foreigners are being immediately executed.','/6WLnzTG4Hz3lFvfZGSsyB8NFGgM.jpg','2015-08-26',103,'Released','Survive together or die together','No Escape',192141,10.1571,7,'DOjj07EuO50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30627,_binary '\0','/lYasFduyooJu9Ebi9w8TpLaJT8y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1782440',6.1,2313,'en','Firebreather','It\'s not easy being a teen like Duncan. His mom wants him to pay more attention to his homework, while his dad - a 120-foot-tall monster known as a Kaiju - wants him to become the next King of All Monsters. When these worlds collide, Duncan must use his human wits and his Kaiju powers - including super strength, agility and the ability to breathe fire - to protect his family and friends from a giant monster rampage.','/mTPC0ysx6pa91BK6dnnKvoynjb3.jpg','2010-11-24',69,'Released','Forged in Darkness, Born in Flames','Firebreather',50337,5.2753,7.4,'Tdx1j80G0WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30628,_binary '\0','/iTV9vaIehH1XHsxit1AmBWFWOTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1782568',6.2,4168,'ru','Ёлки','A collection of several interlinked stories that happen on the New Year\'s eve...','/5rhCyyt2FXF7fk5PUGR7KKs73En.jpg','2010-12-12',89,'Released','You are just six steps away from a miracle','Six Degrees of Celebration',57809,1.5576,6.4,'xJ16Fsh7GBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30629,_binary '\0','/4bGESzRlJ0hnZRD0uK2LbhlyfQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt17827194',5.8,1480,'ar','أغنية الغراب','Nasser, an unexceptional washout, is diagnosed with a brain tumor when he meets an enigmatic and peculiar young woman. Infatuated by her and sick of being a failure, he must quickly figure out what he wants to do in life before he goes through a risky surgery, and reach out to the young woman with the most seductive way there is .. a song.','/mr4T2539fogjPxdIO8cXpeZlsjk.jpg','2022-10-30',109,'Released',NULL,'Raven Song',1042075,1.1074,8.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30630,_binary '\0','/eEtBGMENh3UBax2wz0ZvBzCzxPu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783232',6.4,60060,'tr','Fetih 1453','After the death of his father Murat II, young Mehmet II ascends to the Ottoman throne. After braving internal and external enemies, he decides to complete what he was destined to do: Conquer Constantinople.','/xzTAM0yaOKkdD4C2tVbdHilcNAc.jpg','2012-02-10',160,'Released','The fall of an empire will be the rise of another.','Conquest 1453',89584,2.9389,6.126,'nSmEMqC6kUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30631,_binary '\0','/eJyjS1ARKy3bYpXGDAIs5zABqlx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783244',4.4,2216,'pl','1920 Bitwa Warszawska','Poland\'s winning battle against Soviet Russia as seen through the eyes of two young protagonists, Ola and Jan. She is a Warsaw cabaret dancer, while he is a cavalry officer and poet who believes in socialist ideals','/2tFCUlnyXB9uNrfoN5pu3V0DVQ.jpg','2011-09-30',115,'Released',NULL,'Battle of Warsaw 1920',87077,1.8238,4.5,'c3YdyOXXVZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30632,_binary '\0','/7U3oOMuhJJ5esr45ERgohAynNiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783298',4.7,3667,'tr','Hür Adam: Bediüzzaman Said Nursi','“Hür Adam” or “Free Man” in English is the real-life story of a very influential Kurdish scholar in Turkey that had lived between 1877-1960, \'Said Nursi\'. A writer, philosopher, and philanthropist, he compiled many books on Islam covering various themes of faith, brotherhood, and philanthropy and exploring the reasons behind societal weakness, poverty, ignorance, and divisions.','/84i0tdNwrGgpGCvuKIVaeND3D3L.jpg','2011-01-07',163,'Released',NULL,'Free Man',65725,1.8104,4.1,'mew8JYLAmMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30633,_binary '\0','/874gQae8zVRbSJw5OYRdyZnKTRe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783377',6.6,1238,'te','Sri Rama Rajyam','Lord Sri Rama retains his wife Sita comes back to their kingdom Ayodhya, after killing Ravana. And Sri Rama will continue his charisma in ruling the kingdom after his Pattabhishekam. On one day he will hear the sweet news that Sita is pregnant. Everything looks fine, but on one day Sri Rama came to know that people in his kingdom are having discussions about Sita’s character, as she spent some time in Ravana’s place. So, Rama decides himself to leave Sita and she is sent to the forest. There she was protected by Valmiki and was given shelter in his Ashram. Later she gives birth at Ashram to twins; Lava and Kusa. Later she gives birth at Ashram to twins; Lava and Kusa. What are the incidents that happens next forms the Sri Rama Rajyam Story.','/gc2sbV8xhxvhGBbKLgT42SWBj7S.jpg','2011-11-17',150,'Released',NULL,'Sri Rama Rajyam',94987,2.3958,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30634,_binary '\0','/pMWVUlJkVWf3OOCYptiXMVUb96J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783413',5.7,2479,'en','Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy','Based on the events surrounding the murder of British student Meredith Kercher. Hayden Panettiere (Heroes) and Marcia Gay Harden (Academy Award winner for Pollock) star in the Lifetime Original Movie Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy based on the international headline-grabbing story of the now infamous American exchange student accused by Italian authorities of brutally killing her roommate. Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy poses the question of whether Knox (Panettiere), the Seattle honors student accused of murdering her college roommate Meredith Kercher (Amanda Fernando Stevens) in 2007 with her boyfriend Raffaele Sollecito (Paolo Romio) and acquaintance Rudy Guede (Djirbi Kebe), actually committed the crime or was herself a victim.','/n9dqpOjKNt7V3wlGaFiJuYPsfF7.jpg','2011-02-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy',58105,1.954,6.078,'ZsZTz9CcQPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30635,_binary '\0','/6RddnxbRCoNr5c7A31ELsNGmEvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783422',7.1,3422,'de','Zwei Leben','Europe 1990, the Berlin wall has just crumbled: Katrine, raised in East Germany, but now living in Norway for the last 20 years, is a “war child”; the result of a love relationship between a Norwegian woman and a German occupation soldier during World War II. She enjoys a happy family life with her mother, her husband, daughter and granddaughter. But when a lawyer asks her and her mother to witness in a trial against the Norwegian state on behalf of the war children, she resists. Gradually, a web of concealments and secrets is unveiled, until Katrine is finally stripped of everything, and her loved ones are forced to take a stand: What carries more weight, the life they have lived together, or the lie it is based on?','/AqEuWjcYhjpJnNp9FB52resPqCu.jpg','2012-10-19',97,'Released','She built one life on love, the other on deceit','Two Lives',149893,1.9619,6.578,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30636,_binary '\0','/5O8761Rd6WBqq48NfpFvmCiDSnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783423',5.6,8062,'tr','Çakallarla Dans','Servet the accountant makes a plan to steal money from a client. He decides to get his brother-in-law Gökhan involved to use his account for the money transfer. When two more friends Meatball Necmi and Del Piero are added to the plan, things start going bad.','/jGAZY7OTQH6hToMzj4PZwpmVFIF.jpg','2010-12-17',102,'Released',NULL,'Dance with the Jackals',59811,2.0626,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30637,_binary '\0','/iAmTmSUzpxrxz1KJwhrXsdMFRfi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1783732',6.3,42075,'en','John Dies at the End','A new drug promises out-of-body experiences, but users are coming back changed forever, and an otherworldly invasion of Earth is underway.','/i90UfpJLNRa0yEfpvvuE4XKxZDc.jpg','2013-01-25',99,'Released','Just so you know... they\'re sorry for anything that\'s about to happen.','John Dies at the End',75761,4.0014,6.269,'_rvkyNABa78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30638,_binary '\0','/VOZpbuwDIahLiOygGqmJkwx5Lg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1784458',7,1249,'nl','Groenten uit Balen','The story of the laborer family Debruycker during the turbulent strike by Vieille Montagne in 1971.','/1gQtSRTP0X0UclTAQUw8XaxoNMX.jpg','2011-12-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Groenten uit Balen',80469,0.7903,5.9,'57YAebZKwIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30639,_binary '\0','/gqZn8GSMM1otS4WIQLBesZgZs1l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1784499',6.1,10429,'tr','Kurtlar Vadisi: Filistin','After the Freedom Flotilla attempts to bring humanitarian assistance to Gaza refuses to turn back, it is attacked by the Israeli military. In a dramatic battle scene, activists resist and are killed by the Israeli soldiers. A Turkish commando team led by Polat Alemdar (Necati Şaşmaz) travels to West Bank in Palestine, where they launch a campaign against Israeli military personnel in an attempt to track down and eliminate an Israeli general, leader Moşe Ben Eliyezer (Erdal Beşikçioğlu), who is the responsible for the flotilla raid.','/5B9mXAFQoE6n25z6GXO3qKoHHLG.jpg','2011-01-27',105,'Released','The first casualty of war is truth','Valley of the Wolves: Palestine',58637,1.6738,5.5,'2drg4FbCpnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30640,_binary '\0','/1u4VTwPzi8XAwdqZdv2QmUj1Rou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1784538',7.5,3947,'en','Miss Representation','The film MISS REPRESENTATION exposes how American youth are being sold the concept that women and girls’ value lies in their youth, beauty and sexuality. Explores the under-representation of women in positions of power and influence in America, and challenges the media\'s limited portrayal of what it means to be a powerful woman. It’s time to break that cycle of mistruths.','/98owJxMsoARozljBXpQXH93v2fF.jpg','2011-01-20',85,'Released','You can\'t be what you can\'t see.','Miss Representation',77801,1.6388,6.9,'W2UZZV3xU6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30641,_binary '\0','/Fwv4Ae1OfXwGaGfftwchlkpXe6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1784575',7.3,13850,'sr','Parada','The Parade, in a tragicomic way, tells the story about ongoing battle between two worlds in contemporary post-war Serbian society - the traditional, oppressive, homophobic majority and a liberal, modern and open-minded minority... The film, which deals with gay rights issues in Serbia, features footage of the 2010 Belgrade gay pride parade. The film introduces a group of gay activists, trying to organize a pride parade in Belgrade.','/xdqyKH35zociRb17kJ2YVCQW64y.jpg','2011-10-31',115,'Released',NULL,'The Parade',81534,2.2649,6.714,'dhon4O02xwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30642,_binary '\0','/8YSsjDjxRMzpPkMKDpXg4y6AMhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1784589',4.4,5591,'hi','Players','Two professional robbers, an illusionist, an expert make-up artist, a gadget expert and a hacker come together to steal Romanian gold ingots while it is in transit.','/v1EhvuG6PohOoW3qWbBD1rudYGN.jpg','2012-01-06',163,'Released',NULL,'Players',83382,1.7406,5.043,'WgPQ7_xsm3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30643,_binary '\0','/b48yqgYlaA9EZdCjh1EAtPe12fY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785288',5.7,3770,'en','An Ordinary Man','A war criminal in hiding forms a relationship with his only connection to the outside world - his maid.','/qc2mu3aYUDhdDCcrgvQWiQ4rMp1.jpg','2017-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'An Ordinary Man',405965,2.7275,6.2,'znGOUeToqiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30644,_binary '\0','/hzm5ryfoBEvh7pNCWOvijDoUZA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785333',7.3,1959,'hi','चिट्टागोंग','Jhunku, a 14-year-old youth in 1930s British Bangladesh, embarks on a journey to determine where he belongs.','/2YUIg8P4rJnoXoZMF30mmteoIdf.jpg','2012-10-12',105,'Released','Ordinary Boys, Extraordinary Triumph','Chittagong',109221,1.3026,6.825,'8C7sOtAgpns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30645,_binary '\0','/w6XPF2XMnLtaoWaqPII6Fh9p0pX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785389',7.4,2404,'en','God Bless Ozzy Osbourne','Featuring never before seen footage uncovered from the archives and interviews with Paul McCartney, Tommy Lee and others, God Bless Ozzy Osbourne is the first documentary to take viewers inside the complex mind of rock\'s great icon.','/vIIrzyd2RI5uXwVtvJm28gU34kK.jpg','2011-04-24',94,'Released',NULL,'God Bless Ozzy Osbourne',79201,2.167,7.9,'jU0xRi-4Wug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30646,_binary '\0','/nuQSpGRKJkxnLOMWzZD8UZ6E92B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785394',7.3,4527,'ja','劇場版 BLEACH 地獄篇','Hell – A place where beings that have committed mortal sins during their lifetime are sent. It is a realm where even Soul Reapers are forbidden to interfere. When a group of vicious Sinners plot to escape from this eternal prison, they discover that Substitute Soul Reaper Ichigo Kurosaki is the key to their freedom.','/pd7V5iCB19VBPJkihxFXFwSRW2M.jpg','2010-12-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Bleach the Movie: Hell Verse',73245,4.2087,7.605,'7wwHPzRX-6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30647,_binary '\0','/5oQXOe2v2NjnsO2Cx5OtpA4zFIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785612',7.4,3313,'en','The Punk Singer','A look at the life of activist, musician, and cultural icon Kathleen Hanna, who formed the punk band Bikini Kill and pioneered the \"riot grrrl\" movement of the 1990s.','/d8k0rBZKAh15dGw6NQVMO25zhuw.jpg','2013-11-29',80,'Released',NULL,'The Punk Singer',178290,1.1744,7.1,'fwrXC5OXqgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30648,_binary '\0','/zyh9pUlokoBdkE54UsMIxRx54fl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785635',4.9,14491,'en','The Vault','Two estranged sisters are forced to rob a bank in order to save their brother. But this is no ordinary bank.','/eMXA8Mbl9P9kNVGhMKqwr5Xni8C.jpg','2017-09-01',91,'Released','No one is safe.','The Vault',416160,4.3697,4.9,'BJW07Khwx6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30649,_binary '\0','/7lK2cM9zotTi3pqX5LHe2u9IY1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1785669',3.3,3757,'en','Vikingdom','A warrior fleeing the violence of his past must take up the sword and risk everything to face a god of incalculable power.','/mllJZUdy0LVD7MabX1bHlDDIqI6.jpg','2013-09-11',114,'Released','Live by the Sword.','Vikingdom',100542,2.0061,4.2,'kfBW6xZNVB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30650,_binary '\0','/zL81haaTPijExkTH8S4nWrZCiBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1786668',6.5,1588,'ko','시라노; 연애조작단','The successful Cyrano Agency helps people, who can\'t find a date, to get a love life — until they are hired to help Sang-yong.','/twx3c3SYYvpkuKOpZ57yfodNr0f.jpg','2010-09-16',118,'Released','Outsource your romance. leave it to the professionals.','Cyrano Agency',53514,2.1683,6.823,'7Fj8iL45eCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30651,_binary '\0','/tQbRiVWlznLEr7P6DIFrSvqgYE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1786751',6.6,12104,'en','CBGB','A look at New York\'s dynamic punk rock scene through the lens of the ground-breaking Lower East Side club started by eccentric Hilly Kristal in 1973 which launched thousands of bands.','/9xHdRPamTjLG4bosURJju6UYCHp.jpg','2013-10-11',101,'Released','50,000 bands and 1 disgusting bathroom.','CBGB',111479,3.1265,6.4,'scW0Dqims9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30652,_binary '\0','/uNiGFF0bHYzOZR24q4KviYQAiUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787127',6.8,2123,'en','The Forgiveness of Blood','A seventeen-year-old boy and his younger sister’s dreams and aspirations are put on hold when their father is accused of murder.','/z7710f2bWJgAqtM3Ck7UtL7Ex17.jpg','2011-02-18',109,'Released',NULL,'The Forgiveness of Blood',82624,1.9954,6.543,'h15A2xFgLiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30653,_binary '\0','/tgi9tnSIAZRMMA3Gryj4a2JpYbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787660',7.6,7325,'en','Being Elmo: A Puppeteer\'s Journey','Beloved by children of all ages around the world, Elmo is an international icon. Few people know his creator, Kevin Clash, who dreamed of working with his idol, master puppeteer Jim Henson. Displaying his creativity and talent at a young age, Kevin ultimately found a home on Sesame Street. Narrated by Whoopi Goldberg, this documentary includes rare archival footage, interviews with Frank Oz, Rosie O’Donnell, Cheryl Henson, Joan Ganz Cooney and others and offers a behind-the-scenes look at Sesame Street and the Jim Henson Workshop.','/7W2jIcJoWyMaYNiSkCxhZQX3OQF.jpg','2011-10-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Being Elmo: A Puppeteer\'s Journey',75301,2.3621,7.2,'dlNZo10pCts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30654,_binary '\0','/1tcHHrn0QCsCxIW7eVlFPE4Y3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787725',7.1,3398,'en','If a Tree Falls: A Story of the Earth Liberation Front','Filmmaker Marshall Curry explores the inner workings of the Earth Liberation Front, a revolutionary movement devoted to crippling facilities involved in deforestation, while simultaneously offering a profile of Oregon ELF member Daniel McGowan, who was brought up on terrorism charges for his involvement with the radical group.','/tXswjlTtMtbL0imkrngn1UY2b8x.jpg','2011-06-22',85,'Released',NULL,'If a Tree Falls: A Story of the Earth Liberation Front',79042,1.4434,6.5,'QAGxy85R380','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30655,_binary '\0','/fDVFfShvogB52g86V2plsmF3BWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787759',4.9,9214,'en','Madea\'s Big Happy Family','When Shirley, Madea\'s niece, receives distressing news about her health, the only thing she wants is her family gathered around her. However, Shirley\'s three adult children are too preoccupied with their own troubled lives to pay attention to their mother. It is up to Madea, with the help of rowdy Aunt Bam, to bring the clan together and help Shirley deal with her crisis.','/6qWcpqRfUEFrbKdDvB7tg7h1oXz.jpg','2011-04-22',106,'Released','Peace. Love. Harmony. Or else.','Madea\'s Big Happy Family',51017,2.7455,6.8,'bExi5_p28Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30656,_binary '\0','/xJ5D7ZkReMGfOtrwFhwHdjFDIfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787767',6.4,2926,'fi','Vuosaari','In a multicultural suburb of Helsinki, a bullied Russian immigrant decides to fight back, a young woman dreams of superstardom at any cost, and a junkie couple schemes their way out of debt.','/pie7NVsNdjZlDxLCcyjwFlM13Bl.jpg','2012-02-03',123,'Released','Everybody wants to be touched','Naked Harbour',114172,2.7474,5.81,'rssewuLs3dQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30657,_binary '\0','/tfnJAQMHkunBYKcJwGkagIqyjOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787777',6.9,3500,'en','Page One: Inside the New York Times','Unprecedented access to the New York Times newsroom yields a complex view of the transformation of a media landscape fraught with both peril and opportunity.','/rFob85bcxUb31YwTWBOYF6Gol8m.jpg','2011-04-29',88,'Released','This year, the biggest story is their own.','Page One: Inside the New York Times',63144,1.4686,6.9,'JLct9jNrFuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30658,_binary '\0','/vsd8wo394NgyO9jY9xqxe4waHIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787791',7.3,2384,'en','Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles','An urban mystery unfurls as one man pieces together the surreal meaning of hundreds of cryptic tiled messages that have been appearing in city streets across the U.S. and South America.','/hEY9BVAEDXWZHrq1C1LlfDngteS.jpg','2011-08-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles',54358,0.5864,6.6,'aXHpnTzx3ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30659,_binary '\0','/5g38B5dvD5ys4UWSwwun45NxQx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787837',7.9,2441,'en','We Were Here','A reflective look at the arrival and impact of AIDS in San Francisco and how individuals rose to the occasion during the first years of the crisis.','/64HVJ79MxUlaqr6THC9DGbwf9dR.jpg','2011-09-09',90,'Released',NULL,'We Were Here',81716,1.184,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30660,_binary '\0','/aJIojufZhl5JG42rJ0H3LsMxId6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1787988',7.3,49085,'hi','तलाश','A cop, investigating the mysterious death of a filmstar, meets a sex-worker, while he faces some personal problems psychologically. The mystery connects these people in a way, that ultimately changes their lives.','/oCxyN7HmJ7zWp8jtJeMRHABnutF.jpg','2012-11-30',149,'Released','The Answer Lies Within','Talaash',86004,2.1509,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30661,_binary '\0','/fEEC9qDWBdlaVLfXWNDlmeyGQ9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1788383',4.4,3953,'en','House of the Rising Sun','Ray, an ex-cop, is starting a new life looking to stay out of trouble. One evening, on Ray\'s watch, the nightclub he works for is robbed and the owner\'s son is shot dead. As his criminal past is exposed Ray hunts for the person responsible for this crime in an effort to clear his own name. Ray must get to the bottom of this as both the mob and cops start to close in on him as their target suspect.','/cZLgk8f51582QUHOQpSH72sotoL.jpg','2011-07-19',90,'Released','They took his badge. He kept the gun.','House of the Rising Sun',68472,2.77,4.4,'knx2NAnye1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30662,_binary '\0','/ptZypdOBofmADX9JCtgi5E38cnC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1788391',6.3,50621,'en','Kill List','Nearly a year after a botched job, a hitman takes a new assignment with the promise of a big payoff for three killings. What starts off as an easy task soon unravels, sending the killer into the heart of darkness.','/qwT2I3ons0oD58jIppKmd4qLtvB.jpg','2011-09-02',95,'Released','Who’s next?','Kill List',74725,4.0615,6.2,'aqkqF--v1tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30663,_binary '\0','/ggWV74vWCNjyBaa4dd8SBPMnxzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1789074',6.4,1358,'en','The Night Watch','Four Londoners are inseparably linked by their wartime experiences. In a time when the barriers of sexuality and social convention have been broken down, they enjoy a freedom never experienced before.','/ioEzgZFFZZGnrhI2rsIy7R0a4WI.jpg','2011-04-04',90,'Released','Love and liberation in wartime','The Night Watch',70214,1.7286,5.807,'DeWMFKomkzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30664,_binary '\0','/nF3b4QGe4OsAFJHlEYwZf25IAbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1789083',8.1,4642,'en','The Weight of Chains','The Weight of Chains is a Canadian documentary film that takes a critical look at the role that the US, NATO and the EU played in the tragic breakup of a once peaceful and prosperous European state - Yugoslavia. The film, bursting with rare stock footage never before seen by Western audiences, is a creative first-hand look at why the West intervened in the Yugoslav conflict, with an impressive roster of interviews with academics, diplomats, media personalities and ordinary citizens of the former Yugoslav republics. This film also presents positive stories from the Yugoslav wars - people helping each other regardless of their ethnic background, stories of bravery and self-sacrifice.','/4QvHRS1P38JkOTH2pwuQGlF54ul.jpg','2010-12-17',125,'Released',NULL,'The Weight of Chains',64924,1.1491,7.3,'6Qi50Mun4RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30665,_binary '\0','/1w2lTdUXgWolvdB65s9bcWm3suZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1789810',8.2,2582,'pt','José e Pilar','A deeply moving story about love, loss and literature, this documentary follows the days of José Saramago, the Nobel-laureate Portuguese novelist, and his wife, Pilar del Río. The film shows their whirlwind life of international travel, his passion for completing his masterpiece \"The Elephant\'s Journey\", and how their love quietly sustains them throughout.','/ifK7pLn4d683YBc6mwkgs2DOvxy.jpg','2010-10-18',117,'Released','The universe won\'t remember us. It won\'t remember Homer wrote The Odyssey.','José & Pilar',94639,1.0615,7.3,'TkxyTc9BbkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30666,_binary '\0','/frmY45LSk48dehy2F6s5Y1UmKcX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790621',6.2,5269,'en','A Christmas Kiss','Wendy Walton is the best designer in Boston... but no one knows it yet. Hoping to kick-start her career, Wendy has left work with the local theatre to take a job as an assistant to Priscilla Hall, the most prestigious designer in the city. Ms. Hall works Wendy around the clock, which is how Wendy finds herself trapped in an elevator late one night with an incredibly handsome stranger. Wendy and the mystery man share an impulsive, romantic, life changing kiss before the doors open and Wendy runs out, leaving him behind. The next day at work, Wendy answers the door to find the handsome gentleman standing in front of her.','/ecgrk0VsqzMMTUg5VsfqJADgaeM.jpg','2011-11-12',96,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Kiss',81332,2.996,6.1,'nbJ-SuOau9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30667,_binary '\0','/7C921eWK06n12c1miRXnYoEu5Yv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790809',6.5,391711,'en','Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Men Tell No Tales','Thrust into an all-new adventure, a down-on-his-luck Capt. Jack Sparrow feels the winds of ill-fortune blowing even more strongly when deadly ghost sailors led by his old nemesis, the evil Capt. Salazar, escape from the Devil\'s Triangle. Jack\'s only hope of survival lies in seeking out the legendary Trident of Poseidon, but to find it, he must forge an uneasy alliance with a brilliant and beautiful astronomer and a headstrong young man in the British navy.','/6lAPOAFYFWIO3SQRemEY2wInQMC.jpg','2017-05-23',129,'Released','All pirates must die.','Pirates of the Caribbean: Dead Men Tell No Tales',166426,24.3432,6.665,'jnVk2C2YrSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30668,_binary '\0','/iOmVY1v6wHE61VSf1BNoLjtihk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790825',6.4,1490,'en','MURPH: The Protector','A documentary based on the honor, courage and commitment of Navy SEAL LT Michael P. Murphy, who gave his life for his men in 2005 and was posthumously awarded the Medal of Honor in 2007.','/AmpbA20rqkKrDtb6yIeS6pwdyRA.jpg','2013-03-22',79,'Released',NULL,'MURPH: The Protector',179822,1.0173,5.7,'1Ps8z2-40YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30669,_binary '\0','/1MX8edKn2QP71bL2uv03JN3AIxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790834',6.3,5409,'en','Simon Killer','A recent college graduate flees to Paris after a break-up, where his involvement with a prostitute begins to reveal a potentially dark recent past.','/32SUAJ7JP9Jvb251J8tf9U2Si6m.jpg','2012-04-12',106,'Released','It takes a muscle to fall in love.','Simon Killer',84338,2.3809,5.864,'VJICFO4lbtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30670,_binary '\0','/eTlcNXGv32zkVI7ZDHhfeaKHXKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790864',6.8,572272,'en','The Maze Runner','A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.','/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg','2014-09-10',113,'Released','Get ready to run.','The Maze Runner',198663,36.9684,7.19,'3b946aGm0zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30671,_binary '\0','/4AjoilnnuC6GbhaNBbCw0sDid84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790867',7.2,2157,'en','The Other F Word','What happens when a generation\'s ultimate anti-authoritarians — punk rockers — become society\'s ultimate authorities — dads? With a large chorus of punk rock\'s leading men — Blink-182\'s Mark Hoppus, Red Hot Chili Peppers\' Flea, Rise Against\'s Tim McIlrath — The Other F Word follows Jim Lindberg, 20-year veteran of skate punk band, Pennywise, on his hysterical and moving journey from belting his band\'s anthem, \"Fuck Authority\", to embracing his ultimately pivotal authoritarian role in mid-life, fatherhood.','/5aXOrCNV9Hlvftw8qzZpvA1lpjJ.jpg','2011-11-02',98,'Released','Sometimes a little anarchy can be a life-changing experience.','The Other F Word',75785,1.6718,6.5,'zZkWHZ3hJtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30672,_binary '\0','/r80Lt5e8goXNCW36MV63IazYWxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790869',5.3,6039,'en','In Their Skin','A couple and their young son retreat to their woodland vacation home, only to face sinister neighbors who intend to kill them and steal their identities.','/e9Hi3zFRr5RibddE1L7TLJQgbGK.jpg','2012-11-09',96,'Released','Yours is the life they\'ve chosen.','In Their Skin',117978,2.0885,5.3,'KRAW6jKKC8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30673,_binary '\0','/evPzxMacNWsjkUKQO4NXKe5Rl6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790885',7.4,344466,'en','Zero Dark Thirty','A chronicle of the decade-long hunt for al-Qaeda terrorist leader Osama bin Laden after the September 2001 attacks, and his death at the hands of the Navy S.E.A.L. Team 6 in May, 2011.','/wNSdSSxowM3WIqmPJNg3RagYbwP.jpg','2012-12-19',157,'Released','The greatest manhunt in history.','Zero Dark Thirty',97630,12.1782,6.992,'EYFhFYoDAo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30674,_binary '\0','/oRTDhJ42ObvZS2QMz7woLWbojXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1790886',6.1,143567,'en','The Campaign','Two rival politicians compete to win an election to represent their small North Carolina congressional district in the United States House of Representatives.','/jMWjJ13sFTT07DwjNlqh8VY4sK6.jpg','2012-08-09',85,'Released','May the best loser win.','The Campaign',77953,7.8958,5.8,'Bmp6UDzIUes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30675,_binary '\0','/cwytQHRHSrMnsSEowcY4Z6jIEeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1791528',6.6,120652,'en','Inherent Vice','In Los Angeles at the turn of the 1970s, drug-fueled detective Larry \"Doc\" Sportello investigates the disappearance of an ex-girlfriend.','/pfVua7TzzttOh3RTOuBqT7xN0oY.jpg','2014-12-12',149,'Released','Love usually leads to trouble.','Inherent Vice',171274,12.265,6.542,'BTRMkQzFYHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30676,_binary '\0','/7LM4nm9QSmIUWvIVYGiEXwqMfO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1791614',6.2,15341,'en','Struck by Lightning','After being struck and killed by lightning, a young man recounts the way he blackmailed his fellow classmates into contributing to his literary magazine.','/iceZkHBrLTgeXZF7Z3gANJgiNQM.jpg','2013-06-19',90,'Released','What are the odds of surviving high school?','Struck by Lightning',87440,3.2358,6.2,'OZNArjGeW2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30677,_binary '\0','/wb33jbebU3KsiyaEixc9HMGQATV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1791681',3.8,2724,'en','Treehouse','A teenage boy discovers the perpetrators of several brutal kidnappings in his home town.','/6kOvkJDDi9qghFrQEkYlv2MDksq.jpg','2015-06-25',96,'Released','No kids allowed','Treehouse',286372,1.9604,4.5,'wkX-Jj4nOBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30678,_binary '\0','/9JJJOq1YuhUpC3wRgeEYn85UPbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1791682',6.3,56328,'en','While We\'re Young','An uptight documentary filmmaker and his wife find their lives loosened up a bit after befriending a free-spirited younger couple.','/rdYXGeK3OZjBrd2R8A1sSS0Kxcq.jpg','2015-03-27',97,'Released','Life never gets old.','While We\'re Young',252512,6.1058,6.007,'LfFGwbr0AKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30679,_binary '\0','/Ap3qM0ULq2u8L9fEvMHzoYska3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1792543',5.2,4617,'en','The Reunion','The Cleary brothers, Sam, Leo and Douglas took dysfunctional families to a new level: Sam and Leo have grown up hating each other and neither likes their juvenile delinquent kid brother, Douglas, to whom they\'ve only recently been introduced. The sons share the same father, a womanizing drunk, but all have different mothers. Their father died a rich man and when they\'re brought together by their sister Nina to learn which of them will inherit the old man\'s fortune, they are handed an unpleasant surprise.','/bsaQsYf58wY8wdYy1zxbZHXwxCt.jpg','2011-10-21',96,'Released','Last Chance. Long Odds.','The Reunion',77879,2.352,5,'Vxd8urxKviQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30680,_binary '\0','/5cutp5vtikuY7n5YfyhirAs9NbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1792621',6.4,1814,'en','Superheroes','A journey inside the world of real life caped crusaders. From all over America, these self-proclaimed crime fighters, don masks, homemade costumes and elaborate utility belts in an attempt to bring justice to evildoers everywhere.','/utZVTxNMFsGi5oHDJYu73Q367CZ.jpg','2011-08-08',81,'Released','For real.','Superheroes',71905,0.7842,6.5,'5zxCLbPncGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30681,_binary '\0','/jZsTNDun2GCILLnN8y9x9KKnHXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1792647',6.8,8392,'en','Cirque du Soleil: Worlds Away','An original story featuring performances by Cirque du Soleil. A young woman is entranced by an Aerialist. When they fall into the dreamlike world of Cirque du Soleil and are separated, they travel through the different tent worlds trying to find each other.','/jAt4ugebhXKmAnirHAWe5P6gnMi.jpg','2012-11-09',91,'Released','Experience a Journey Like Never Before','Cirque du Soleil: Worlds Away',94352,2.9441,7,'tG_WlSwwb3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30682,_binary '\0','/bOmOKlujruO0fudftYCqxNR6Xd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1792794',1.7,3206,'en','Almighty Thor','Loki destroys the fortress of Valhalla and steals the Hammer of Invincibility, only the young hero Thor can protect Earth from Armageddon.','/tU61BDSUdYIG33BO65vbCCqZYr7.jpg','2011-05-07',88,'Released','The Legend Is Born','Almighty Thor',63736,2.1642,2.8,'WfUb_yUZiUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30683,_binary '\0','/zTstjQnXAbA0gHUIqSWQKDoEK6N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1792799',5,4599,'en','ChromeSkull: Laid to Rest 2','After his gruesome encounter with a girl, and being outmatched by his own assistant, ChromeSkull resurges with a horrifying massacre of his own.','/vZSoi9OyOXKoHRevs2T28tZ1Lfz.jpg','2011-09-20',93,'Released','Death Polished.','ChromeSkull: Laid to Rest 2',55723,3.1557,4.986,'ZEh_xNzfBDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30684,_binary '\0','/78NLasXAO6fhkQ55SrlS4Ul0oPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1793223',5.6,2508,'en','Free Samples','A Stanford law-school dropout named Jillian escapes to the anonymity of Los Angeles to figure out what she wants to do with her life, and on the day of her college boyfriend\'s birthday, she finds herself stuck running an ice cream truck fending off locals and oddball friends alike. This one day spent in a truck on the streets of Los Angeles will wake Jillian from her aimless daze and make her see that life doesn\'t stop just because you want it to.','/cr0obllVMQSjOO8jciw1LkBABOI.jpg','2013-05-31',80,'Released','Ever have one of those years?','Free Samples',106337,2.3348,5.6,'nEfIndKDGtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30685,_binary '\0','/bvhW6zii1f9fsUaPFyRjCky4INM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1793239',6.1,4383,'fr','L\'Assaut','December 1994. On Saturday 24th, four GIA terrorists hijack an Air France A300 Airbus, bound for Paris, with 227 passengers on board, at the Algiers airport.','/nYGQJGsGWmmq8L0EOSDJGdHiz1i.jpg','2011-01-17',88,'Released','Monday 26th December 1994. Marignane Airport.','The Assault',59145,3.3936,6,'o2aqaHt9Z5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30686,_binary '\0','/odKJ6zy27UmGE398U2K9PlLqnZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1793931',5.5,4805,'fr','Les Tuche','Everyone in the village of Bouzolles knows the Tuche family, who live by the philosophy \"Man is not made to work.\" Despite their lack of money, they strive to be happy... that is, until their hand-to-mouth existence is turned on its head. After winning the lottery, the Tuches get rich beyond their wildest dreams and move to Monaco. And while attempting to fit in in their swanky new homeland, they struggle to stay true to the same principles by which they\'ve always lived.','/uG8o2RST9yx0N7IInzUNMAIGbxY.jpg','2011-06-30',95,'Released',NULL,'The Tuche Family',66129,2.2616,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30687,_binary '\0','/mNINSJHjxQ7D1dDsV7gZg1exVST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1794850',5.3,2086,'fr','La Vérité si je mens ! 3','Eddie, Dov, Yvan and the others ... Our warm friends have migrated from the moribund Sentier to the flourishing suburb of Aubervilliers ... Where the old Jewish entrepreneurs left the ground to young courageous and dynamic Chinese wholesalers ... The little band is as close to each other as in previous episodes, and life goes on at the mercy of small family events and business. Dov still seems frivolous, enterprising Eddie, chilled Yvan, casual Karine, resolute Sandra, naive Chochana, irresponsible Serge and mythomaniac. As for Patrick, he is in love and the happy elected is far from easy to access. Everything would be fine until a bad wind brings its share of adversity seriously compromising the cohesion of the group. Will they succumb under the storm to the turmoil, or, once again, by mutual aid, cunning and skill, will they triumph over the crisis with panache?','/i2U9VV2WWBXeA3Zc0jQFfYqnqB0.jpg','2012-01-31',120,'Released','Truth, we missed you!','Would I Lie to You? 3',86868,2.1895,5.5,'jxdHFbkznKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30688,_binary '\0','/ldH34eD3aprr1weK3sKXPxe3pMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1794886',5.9,2984,'sv','Nobels testamente','While covering the annual Nobel Banquet for tabloid Kvällspressen, crime reporter Annika Bengtzon witnesses a spectacular murder right in front of her. Two people are shot, one of them the controversial Laureate in Medicine, Aaron Wiesel. Annika is the key witness and is bound by the police not to disclose anything she has seen. A terrorist group with connections to the Middle East quickly admits responsibility for the murder. International press is all over the story, as are the police.','/cXaniIYdPXKjGf94r3ld9P0UbQG.jpg','2012-03-02',90,'Released','The truth can be deadly.','Nobel\'s Last Will',93230,1.7992,5.99,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30689,_binary '\0','/1W6zwX287HJU7jVoUQIMpoSnwWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1795369',8.5,4723,'en','National Theatre Live: Frankenstein','Childlike in his innocence but grotesque in form, Frankenstein’s bewildered creature is cast out into a hostile universe by his horror-struck maker. Meeting with cruelty wherever he goes, the friendless Creature, increasingly desperate and vengeful, determines to track down his creator and strike a terrifying deal. Urgent concerns of scientific responsibility, parental neglect, cognitive development and the nature of good and evil are embedded within this thrilling and deeply disturbing tale.','/8xyvEc5knCDuO8jEgdwBqeMvaau.jpg','2011-03-17',130,'Released',NULL,'National Theatre Live: Frankenstein',203912,2.456,7.7,'DmkQHV8e4Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30690,_binary '\0','/iAZIuf6lIrT38HcbnlTDDsWBh3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1795702',7.2,15287,'en','Wild Bill','Out on parole after 8 years inside Bill Hayward returns home to find his now 11 and 15 year old sons abandoned by their mother and fending for themselves. Unwilling to play Dad, an uncaring Bill is determined to move on.','/6KKZ8NNVVXfURBeXXw2BrZhHjb4.jpg','2011-10-21',98,'Released','Wanted... just not round here.','Wild Bill',86593,2.5165,6.8,'OBJvEHwb2KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30691,_binary '\0','/dN0vNAvTibACw31rLR1D9pA0NL3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1796395',6.5,3488,'ar','زهايمر','Mahmoud Shuaib, a wealthy man diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s, begins making unusual financial decisions. Fearing for their inheritance, his two sons take legal action to gain control of his estate.','/3ZKdd8boPgd919IFLhBNdCPa9Ld.jpg','2010-10-09',106,'Released',NULL,'Alzheimer\'s',62972,1.1847,6.116,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30692,_binary '\0','/dXVPPPBeSkfLGA5ANCeqoCcnz9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1796406',6.3,2903,'es','Ausente','Martín, a young student, gets injured during a swimming class. Sebastián, the PE teacher, takes him to the hospital. When they leave, he offers to drive him home, but Martín is planning to spend the night at a classmate\'s house, since there is no one at his own home.','/8ZXP5iuLRJtLz4Vd30EER46wwCh.jpg','2011-07-27',87,'Released',NULL,'Absent',87380,2.0452,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30693,_binary '\0','/3hjagIOblSI1PYLDqXChy40qwJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1796603',2.8,1333,'ru','Самый лучший фильм 3-ДЭ','Hijinks ensue when an amateur filmmaker, financially reliant on video piracy, must reshoot all the movies from a film festival before time runs out.','/zxSdHbLuLrrCSdFZjXKiaoxMPkP.jpg','2011-01-19',102,'Released',NULL,'The Best Movie 3-DE',57889,1.1256,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30694,_binary '\0','/mciaieoKQ1nSugRFxdVetkSRqCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1796652',7.5,2394,'ja','東京家族','An elderly couple journey to Tokyo to visit their grown children, only to find them preoccupied and self-involved.','/1AoAAyO4LuIu89WCJF6SzNpw8bI.jpg','2013-01-18',146,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Family',187662,1.8288,7.3,'CjXnSjqcKUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30695,_binary '\0','/iGFBNpWOq2kI8wVRRvI6CfmxAKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1796657',6.3,2744,'ru','Три богатыря и Шамаханская царица','A bogatyr is an epic warrior from ancient Kievan Rus. Most are directed in the traditional bylinas, traditional Russian epic poems, as being endowed with enormous strength and cunning, although often not completely immune to human weaknesses. Here, our three heroes gather together once more to rescue the ruler of the land from the attempts of an evil foreign queen. She plans to make him fall in love with her so her youth and beauty can be renewed, but in exchange will destroy his kingdom.','/nc8d2RZ08H2Oo0E6pguo2ob9uns.jpg','2010-12-29',75,'Released',NULL,'Three Heroes and the Shamakhan Queen',52939,1.3988,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30696,_binary '\0','/bJsWJi70nBTXtaerD9jY0lxlN2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1797348',6,4466,'es','7 días en La Habana','A lesbian, an aspiring actor, an aspiring singer, a low-class marriage, a neighborhood community and 2 renowned directors have memorable less-than-24-hour-long experiences while living in/visiting the capital of Cuba.','/s5ljh9Oaxjd3nqJVW8IcppoVW9U.jpg','2012-04-05',129,'Released',NULL,'7 Days in Havana',94904,4.3562,5.6,'iGFE0ZQEX2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30697,_binary '\0','/11RECq7xCbqerwagIQ9t7pnk4Nl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1797396',6.2,1837,'sv','Gränsen','December 1942. Two young soldiers leave their posts at checkpoint 83 in North Värmland, Sweden and make their way through the ice cold winter night towards the Nazi-occupied Norwegian border. Sweden stands on the brink of invasion and they want to see the enemy everybody\'s talking about. But the adventure ends in disaster and soon thereafter Lieutenant Aron Stenström finds out that his brother Sven is one of the missing soldiers. With the odds stacked against him he is forced to go behind enemy lines on a secret rescue mission. Deep inside the Norwegian forests Aron realizes that a completely different kind of line must be crossed if they\'re to come out alive.','/jQQ0XC0OllDX1Ichqcmk7xhMPXV.jpg','2011-01-28',122,'Released','The Mission is a Man','Beyond the Border',56481,1.4081,6,'fXchSJA2wkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30698,_binary '\0','/vH6TWGAgQaLSibGU7tz26JLb0Cp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1797469',6.8,22745,'en','Page Eight','Johnny is a long-serving MI5 officer. His boss dies suddenly, leaving behind an inexplicable file which threatens the stability of the organisation.','/69q0ZufQqPCjFbyuTxXRtqQtDd6.jpg','2011-08-28',99,'Released','New Century. New Rules.','Page Eight',73358,4.1636,6.6,'C1hGHdPVXlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30699,_binary '\0','/bAD0lCJLpascMlnchCoePRsAC0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1797487',5.8,1879,'en','Savannah','Savannah is the true story of Ward Allen, a romantic and bombastic character who rejects his plantation heritage for the freedom of life on a river. Ward navigates the change of early 20th century America on the wrong side of the law and society, his long-time friend, a freed slave named Christmas Moultrie, at his side. Master of Shakespeare, and the shotgun that provides Savannah\'s markets with fowl, Ward fights for his rights as a hunter. His charisma and eloquent rhetoric win the heart of a society woman who defies her father to marry him. An elderly Moultrie tells the story of life on the river with his friend to a little boy, who passes the legendary Ward Allen down to the next generation.','/6MAuG6SU0yTIvCweElDNBXcofwQ.jpg','2013-04-25',101,'Released',NULL,'Savannah',207871,2.0425,6.028,'6ICikhYN1NA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30700,_binary '\0','/e74H6yfw9qh8uEJP3yVUfWlMvxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1797504',6.7,17912,'es','Tengo ganas de ti','After two years away, Hache returns to Barcelona seeking a fresh start. Falling for Gin while facing unresolved feelings for Babi, he must confront love, loss, and who he\'s becoming.','/m7JUNQu5zRsmFeUWZrGoV0fTp0B.jpg','2012-06-22',123,'Released',NULL,'I Want You',109689,8.7532,7.5,'4j41P9CvXfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30701,_binary '\0','/mazqYfDUreT2KE6ZsaWT59JARHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798188',7.4,60432,'ja','コクリコ坂から','Yokohama, 1963. Japan is picking itself up from the devastation of World War II and preparing to host the 1964 Olympics—and the mood is one of both optimism and conflict as the young generation struggles to throw off the shackles of a troubled past. Against this backdrop of hope and change, a friendship begins to blossom between high school students Umi and Shun—but a buried secret from their past emerges to cast a shadow on the future and pull them apart.','/rRLYX4RZIyloHSJwvZKAhphAjiB.jpg','2011-07-16',91,'Released',NULL,'From Up on Poppy Hill',83389,7.7969,7.5,'9nzpk_Br6yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30702,_binary '\0','/aSrP7Xmk4EDL1iqWX2cbtnXqmT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798243',7.4,20268,'en','Rudderless','A grieving father in a downward spiral stumbles across a box of his recently deceased son\'s demo tapes and lyrics. Shocked by the discovery of this unknown talent, he forms a band in the hope of finding some catharsis.','/ka3gEmHph5FTJouSdOOK02Ck6bx.jpg','2014-10-17',105,'Released','The way back begins with a single chord.','Rudderless',244403,3.0202,7.2,'Xq6XgPSgzmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30703,_binary '\0','/lj7enxOyRXazcCIFJyCn9dLuF2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798603',5.6,32006,'en','Bad Santa 2','Fueled by cheap whiskey, greed and hatred, Willie Soke teams up with his angry little sidekick, Marcus, to knock off a Chicago charity on Christmas Eve. Along for the ride is chubby and cheery Thurman Merman, a 250-pound ray of sunshine who brings out Willie\'s sliver of humanity. Issues arise when the pair are joined by Willie\'s horror story of a mother, who raises the bar for the gang\'s ambitions, while somehow lowering the standards of criminal behavior.','/xmsEwpA2fSq6IO3sfKrLuIPLHSc.jpg','2016-11-23',92,'Released','Giving the holidays another shot.','Bad Santa 2',338964,6.0204,5.4,'8anWq67nXhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30704,_binary '\0','/lwFKeONjTUSbqaaGdJL8vJq2LK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798632',4.6,25843,'en','Firestarter','For more than a decade, parents Andy and Vicky have been on the run, desperate to hide their daughter Charlie from a shadowy federal agency that wants to harness her unprecedented gift for creating fire into a weapon of mass destruction. Andy has taught Charlie how to defuse her power, which is triggered by anger or pain. But as Charlie turns 11, the fire becomes harder and harder to control. After an incident reveals the family\'s location, a mysterious operative is deployed to hunt down the family and seize Charlie once and for all. Charlie has other plans.','/jjBdPcQ0bplBnv2XgElKLoeFDuM.jpg','2022-05-12',94,'Released','Never play with fire.','Firestarter',532710,7.1447,5.433,'59MJfJPP5eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30705,_binary '\0','/zT9iYKMtmU82Jo44WbiuMOW7jRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798684',7.3,282412,'en','Southpaw','Billy \"The Great\" Hope, the reigning junior middleweight boxing champion, has an impressive career, a loving wife and daughter, and a lavish lifestyle. However, when tragedy strikes, Billy hits rock bottom, losing his family, his house and his manager. He soon finds an unlikely savior in Tick Willis, a former fighter who trains the city\'s toughest amateur boxers. With his future on the line, Hope fights to reclaim the trust of those he loves the most.','/kSQ49Fi3NVTqGGXILmxV2T2pdkG.jpg','2015-07-22',123,'Released','Believe in hope.','Southpaw',307081,15.6611,7.361,'Mh2ebPxhoLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30706,_binary '\0','/1YnZchmaGc8dchgRPDpR1KGrixA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1798709',7.9,733979,'en','Her','In the not so distant future, Theodore, a lonely writer, purchases a newly developed operating system designed to meet the user\'s every need. To Theodore\'s surprise, a romantic relationship develops between him and his operating system. This unconventional love story blends science fiction and romance in a sweet tale that explores the nature of love and the ways that technology isolates and connects us all.','/eCOtqtfvn7mxGl6nfmq4b1exJRc.jpg','2013-12-18',126,'Released','A Spike Jonze love story.','Her',152601,17.528,7.835,'XsQqMwacZQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30707,_binary '\0','/EJIstDMBj70my4IZVMX7uJlJ85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1799508',5.4,6729,'en','After','When two bus crash survivors awake to discover that they are the only people left in their small town, they must form an unlikely alliance in a race to unravel the truth behind their isolation. As strange events begin to unfold, they start to question whether the town they know so well is really what it seems.','/5AKcsJYztbcX2KsyCXtKucyUUMA.jpg','2012-08-27',90,'Released',NULL,'After',118612,1.7682,5.5,'RCFI8lZCA0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30708,_binary '\0','/eOkbeZ658RHVt7ULoFBqmesxEYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1799516',6.4,6283,'en','Benji','Two school kids strike up a friendship with an orphaned puppy named Benji. When danger befalls them and they end up kidnapped by robbers who are in over their heads, Benji and his scruffy sidekick come to the rescue.','/79pacM3h5FoETnfuRC6O2qPfzn4.jpg','2018-03-16',87,'Released','A hero comes home.','Benji',495193,3.4578,6.903,'UqtFvSKhKmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30709,_binary '\0','/3r2G1vSDf4S3Pl5lJ9BDm9FTxe6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800241',7.2,521900,'en','American Hustle','A conman and his seductive partner are forced to work for a wild FBI agent, who pushes them into a world of Jersey power-brokers and the Mafia.','/z6O1KDhfWDTm5ZBr6Ovr0eg8LqO.jpg','2013-12-12',138,'Released','Everyone hustles to survive.','American Hustle',168672,13.3123,6.852,'h5Cb4SFt7gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30710,_binary '\0','/2FfNbWD2ss7BrI1jYVbkWT3CunU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800246',6.1,110894,'en','That Awkward Moment','Best pals Jason and Daniel indulge in casual flings and revel in their carefree, unattached lives. After learning that the marriage of their friend Mikey is over, they gladly welcome him back into their circle. The three young men make a pact to have fun and avoid commitment. However, when all three find themselves involved in serious relationships, they must keep their romances secret from one another.','/tjDAdesZNYFyRNnZvLT0osc7S2t.jpg','2014-01-29',94,'Released','When you realize getting some means wanting more.','That Awkward Moment',225565,5.0574,6.1,'Mvr-NQrqF6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30711,_binary '\0','/mDzzAQypU9CaolRyMiDVwlwffBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800302',6.7,75018,'en','Gold','Kenny Wells, a modern-day prospector, hustler, and dreamer, is desperate for a lucky break. Left with few options, Wells teams up with an equally luckless geologist to execute a grandiose, last-ditch effort: to find gold deep in the uncharted jungle of Indonesia.','/ukMXAdr325Tn1mLGkxdG8Lab16l.jpg','2016-02-03',120,'Released','Prove \'em all wrong','Gold',334524,7.7215,6.629,'VXSrDNFG8Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30712,_binary '\0','/j8wiDInTSDbPwnV9xisVqEADHT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800338',7,4498,'nl','Lucia de B.','An assistant prosecutor zealously pursues a conviction in the case of a pediatric nurse accused of murdering her patients, but doubt arises when her evidence shows that the infants may have died of natural causes.','/tw32mBOY7zSPgvewNNF2Wfqe622.jpg','2014-04-03',97,'Released','Guilty until proven innocent','Accused',242065,2.1509,6.873,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30713,_binary '\0','/UdBPChrpIpVXYxId6DfiuqqqYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800351',5.1,1420,'en','One Night in Istanbul','Two down on their luck Liverpool cabbies, Tommy and Gerry, strike an unusual deal with a local gangster to take their sons on a trip of a lifetime, to watch their beloved football team play in the European Cup Final in Istanbul. Hoping to use the trip as a chance to bond with their sons, big trouble awaits them in the form of a sexy hotel chambermaid, two ruthless crooks on a mission and a bag of counterfeit cash. It is 3-0 down at half time and things could not be more desperate both on and off the pitch. Stevie G and the boys in red are trying to launch the most amazing football comeback in history, and Tommy is in deep water, being held hostage. With the clock ticking and time running out, a miracle is needed fast. In the end a bit of faith, and Gerry’s lucky underpants may be the only thing that can get them and the cup back home in one piece.','/6HLo27SX1qpTZpPYjYOlFzgOcgC.jpg','2014-09-10',93,'Released','Four fanatical fans. One cup final... Only one outcome!','One Night in Istanbul',287915,1.7327,4.2,'F8dKDs3xNSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30714,_binary '\0','/f0rEqxtjwBhQDOkOdk2t5UQmrFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800372',7.4,4579,'nl','Achtste Groepers Huilen Niet','Tough prime school girl Akkie loves soccer and can be a real bully. Love is the only thing she\'s scared of. When Akkie is diagnosed with leukemia, she has to fight for her life. On the verge of going to high school, Akkie has to allow love to enter her life, and thus gain courage to accept the inevitable.','/oKcS00H2ItgXmSvmY6e4O0PZaQP.jpg','2012-02-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Cool Kids Don\'t Cry',115929,3.2912,7.922,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30715,_binary '\0','/6p4yHucexKDgsZmHw6TQXkMIEiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800393',4.9,2473,'en','The Last Son','Isaac LeMay, a murderous outlaw, learns he is cursed by a prophecy: one of his children will kill him. To prevent this, he hunts down each of his estranged children, including long-lost son Cal. With bounty hunters and Sheriff Solomon on his tail, LeMay must find a way to stop his children and end the curse.','/8RRzcE0uZo7gObuoEiJJnKqvspl.jpg','2021-12-10',96,'Released','A prophecy written in blood.','The Last Son',729577,3.2106,5.6,'6OnQWJPgSrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30716,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800671',4.8,1463,'en','Beyond','A detective teams with a tabloid psychic to track down a missing child.','/kibpCAsb6PWspawPDY3FNlbPGeG.jpg','2012-03-29',90,'Released','The unexplainable becomes something unimaginable','Beyond',87293,1.1923,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30717,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800734',4.3,1304,'en','Shiver','Wendy Alden, a young secretary in Portland lacking in self- confidence becomes victim of a savage killer who has claimed the lives of a number of other women. Somehow Wendy finds the resources of courage to fight back and escape.','/hsi8ZhgUICETzeml16GpWRVWr4T.jpg','2012-04-21',92,'Released','The perfect killer has met his match','Shiver',140343,2.6694,4.2,'KYfKac5OTWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30718,_binary '\0','/9qM08KBrvuzENc0G9RzlzyVjkSm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1800741',6.4,60318,'en','Step Up Revolution','Emily arrives in Miami with aspirations to become a professional dancer. She sparks with Sean, the leader of a dance crew whose neighborhood is threatened by Emily\'s father\'s development plans.','/jMpwxmk3r7Aq36GcqMbCuP9DJYQ.jpg','2012-07-26',99,'Released','One step can change your world.','Step Up Revolution',85446,9.5906,6.907,'UhDJJNgc1EA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30719,_binary '\0','/aHLCEVmuPWqDyLzcKZqX9GuYPdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1801051',6.6,16581,'tr','Eyyvah Eyvah 2','A clarinetist from a village in Turkey\'s Thracian region tries to reach his fiancé, who works as a nurse in a village near Çanakkale, to give her a ring to win back her heart.','/yGHZcn8tquj3efEN2uC5fEWmdxl.jpg','2011-01-07',109,'Released',NULL,'Oh Dear 2',53325,1.1791,6,'hLRZaVEuDGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30720,_binary '\0','/dZAHldgqnm1f5n9q4jxsINphEgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1801061',6.5,6138,'it','Io e te','An introverted teenager tells his parents he is going on a ski trip, but instead spends his time alone in his mom\'s basement. But things didn\'t go as planned after his half sister joins him.','/bvwPVIo33VT192KRx4aBiWTQ5Fc.jpg','2012-10-24',96,'Released',NULL,'Me & You',119360,2.0971,6.199,'_e1RmjWqX1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30721,_binary '\0','/npxDOs4yEphzsuUETvnsNW466Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1801071',8.1,8286,'sr','Монтевидео, видимо се!','A football team from Belgrade, former Republic of Yugoslavia gets a chance to go to the First World Football Championship, but things get complicated along the way.','/8ZD5R4WZSLephLFLQpWOuSIyNGC.jpg','2014-01-15',141,'Released',NULL,'See You in Montevideo',255647,1.1747,7.2,'cARFBihsR6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30722,_binary '\0','/krnWJfiL4WKMitmiKt0AUpdS0QI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1801123',5.8,1412,'en','Travelling Salesman','Four mathematicians are gathered and meet with a top official of the United States Department of Defense. After some discussion, the group agrees that they must be wary with whom to trust and control their solution. The official offers them a reward of $10 million in exchange for their portion of the algorithm, swaying them by attempting to address their concerns. Only one of the four speaks out against the sale, and in doing so is forced to reveal a dark truth about his portion of the solution. Before they sign a license to the government, however, they wrestle with the ethical consequences of their discovery. -- Wikipedia','/1OqGXOwYDQ5VrZyJNCuBivyioP1.jpg','2012-06-16',80,'Released','A cerebral thriller','Travelling Salesman',126749,0.7611,5.5,'6ybd5rbQ5rU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30723,_binary '\0','/2ONQC1jV5ucuNmbJjd4JtGx5NFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1801552',4.8,18663,'en','Gotti','John Gotti rises to the top of the New York underworld to become the boss of the Gambino crime family. His life takes a tumultuous turn as he faces tragedy, multiple trials and a prison sentence.','/6vdCoMp68u6JbnlqeXEvxrTNPSm.jpg','2018-06-14',106,'Released','He showed the world who\'s boss.','Gotti',339103,4.9239,5.3,'m290GmN-Q7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30724,_binary '\0','/wrxA079U3x0JZoqr68wC4DcyF2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1802197',7,11722,'en','The Lady','The story of Aung San Suu Kyi as she becomes the core of Burma\'s democracy movement, and her relationship with her husband, writer Michael Aris.','/nAtFlDKS7VP1EQ3nGs8Rv2GUuTP.jpg','2011-11-30',132,'Released','From House Arrest to Parliament','The Lady',77878,3.7018,6.8,'_C10uGA6btQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30725,_binary '\0','/kfvjuMG6RxR1XNfbnbkKWNz54FK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1802810',5.7,3739,'de','Rubbeldiekatz','An actor\'s career takes a \"Tootsie\"-like turn when he lets himself be cast as a woman in a movie.','/9SmlwvWXuGU0OdrN78Cp9Tg2PTd.jpg','2011-12-15',108,'Released',NULL,'Woman in Love',80125,1.0891,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30726,_binary '\0','/mGLNCMu1x8b7zzsriQG7uvTn2YF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18039808',6.4,1429,'ar','La Dernière Reine','1516, Legend has it that the king of Algiers had a wife named Zaphira. When the pirate Aroudj Barbarossa arrives to liberate the city from the Spaniards, he is determined to conquer Zaphira as well as the kingdom itself. But is Zaphira willing to let him, or is she plotting for herself?','/8Q8vDgmohdmHCmxRJz4OgUPRl6S.jpg','2023-04-19',110,'Released',NULL,'The Last Queen',958161,1.7363,6.5,'8VvMTkWeKEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30727,_binary '\0','/AhoK85QcuNHriwRUZgIMBTlRC3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1804508',6.6,1719,'da','Fortidens skygge','Detective Katrine Ries Jensen and legal psychiatrist Thomas Schaeffer form a special unit at the Copenhagen Police investigating serial killings. A case from Schaeffer’s past crops up. As a young psychologist, he held back from sending a patient, who was manically drawing the details of a traffic accident, to a secure hospital. Now these bloody scenes resurface, enacted as real killings.','/eislDZnTtfxy1JgDT6tjnGObXcY.jpg','2012-03-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Those Who Kill - Shadow of the Past',118946,2.1933,6.4,'pkp-zt-7ULg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30728,_binary '\0','/A7hwNu6AG1LvyHvbjEF9LYxuNDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1804623',7.7,1332,'ta','பசங்க','Two boys who instantly dislike each other learn to forgive after an accident.','/gDGN0txfJTC8O72jUvSlKG2fp30.jpg','2009-05-01',158,'Released',NULL,'Pasanga',114904,1.0761,7.409,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30729,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1804642',7.1,4082,'fa','طلا و مس','A Tehran mullah-in-training struggles to take care of his ailing wife and their children in this profoundly moving melodrama. A film of near-universal appeal, it puts a human face on Iran\'s Muslim clergy with its unusual tale of a man forced by hardship to become a better husband and father. Seyed Reza has just moved with his family to Tehran so he can study the Koran, and he relies on his lovely wife Zahra to look after their two young children and weave the intricate rugs that earn them a living. But one evening Zahra collapses and is taken to the hospital, where she\'s diagnosed with multiple sclerosis. Scarcely able to process the tragedy, Seyed is left to cook, change diapers, walk his daughter to school and take his toddler son with him to his classes, where peers and elders treat him with scorn. But Seyed eventually learns to cope, his prayers and devotional studies taking on deeper meaning as he attends to the hard nightly work of rug weaving, getting through with a heavy ...','/ilC3E3g7nA4Q0nHZtp5daEOCFJx.jpg','2011-01-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Gold and Copper',266588,0.7743,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30730,_binary '\0','/x9u1DZh2z2MiLvAKlVu5UPrbwEg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1805263',7.9,5257,'hi','I Am Kalam','The film celebrates the survival of the human spirit against overwhelming odds and highlights the need for underprivileged children\'s education. Its a film based on former indian president A.P.J. Abdul Kalam and is aimed at inspiring the poor to educate their children. Written by DaGambit Chhotu\'s peasant village is ruined by drought, so his ma drops the boy with uncle Bhati, who runs a tea stand at the city outskirts. Clever Chottu, who calls himself Kalam after the self-made Indian president, soon outsmarts uncle\'s adult assistant and makes friends with the loneliest boy in the palace, now a hotel, a prince his age.','/zCl7XBbx8MfPFngcREwGH35J4yo.jpg','2010-10-15',89,'Released',NULL,'I Am Kalam',71562,1.2472,7.188,'ieOfXPzRfTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30731,_binary '\0','/4yXwLVlpzVWMkVZuYxhLXC2luo6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1805297',7.1,11018,'fr','Les Femmes du 6e étage','Paris, in the early 1960s. Jean-Louis Joubert is a serious but uptight stockbroker, married to Suzanne, a starchy class-conscious woman and father of two arrogant teenage boys, currently in a boarding school. The affluent man lives a steady yet boring life. At least until, due to fortuitous circumstances, Maria, the charming new maid at the service of Jean-Louis\' family, makes him discover the servants\' quarter on the sixth floor of the luxury building he owns and lives in. There live a crowd of lively Spanish maids who will help Jean-Louis to open to a new civilization and a new approach of life. In their company - and more precisely in the company of beautiful Maria - Jean-Louis will gradually become another man, a better man.','/88875SqNHpwslXXa5WtDA3VnOvn.jpg','2011-02-16',106,'Released','Help is on the way.','The Women on the 6th Floor',57243,2.6883,6.758,'ppH4MBsVTKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30732,_binary '\0','/9kntGSkiu4vfvJelZxnm10FlsXK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1806911',6.5,2338,'en','Girl Model','A documentary on the modeling industry\'s \'supply chain\' between Siberia, Japan, and the U.S., told through the experiences of the scouts, agencies, and a 13-year-old model.','/bhv8Pa7UrwomiBbjRYpjM9sXGjQ.jpg','2011-09-08',78,'Released',NULL,'Girl Model',83443,2.1542,6.466,'7_NfoEawuRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30733,_binary '\0','/2JTqYozAkCUga9LSq64gI9CJ8Bm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1806913',5,13720,'hi','गोलमाल अगेन','Gopal and his best friends are back again, and this time they move back to their old neighborhood in a new palatial house where they learn that it is being haunted by a ghost.','/kGx26PL1v658T8XbOk5MfmNpHU3.jpg','2017-10-19',151,'Released','No Logic, Only Magic','Golmaal Again',472123,1.7923,5.4,'VgQUwsUHdqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30734,_binary '\0','/9whEVuKte4Qi0LI4TzPf7glinJW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18069420',4.3,7727,'en','Smurfs','When Papa Smurf is mysteriously taken by evil wizards, Razamel and Gargamel, Smurfette leads the Smurfs on a mission into the real world to save him. With the help of new friends, the Smurfs must discover what defines their destiny to save the universe.','/8o6lkhL32xQJeB52IIG1us5BVey.jpg','2025-06-30',89,'Released','Adventure comes out of the blue.','Smurfs',936108,13.0575,5.7,'108UjvIzE64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30735,_binary '\0','/jwVTVcclaqL7madhRvQJ32Khn9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1806954',7,1643,'en','Lost Christmas','An Urban Fairy Tale set in Manchester. A story of how a series of tragic events, that blight a young boy\'s life on Christmas Eve, take him on a journey where a chance meeting with a mysterious stranger may have the key to help and give him a perfect Christmas.','/6yc6GsJpaad5MRZ8155giAXcwwK.jpg','2011-12-11',88,'Released','Nothing is truly lost, we just need to know where to look.','Lost Christmas',81182,1.5297,6.8,'BeYnjcydwMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30736,_binary '\0','/8GPrrsAwGK6tIT74L8RZvagQbEh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1806959',5.7,1497,'ta','மன்மதன் அம்பு','Madhan is convinced that Ambu is unfaithful and refuses to pay detective Mannar when he reports otherwise. Wanting to make money to help a friend, Mannar cooks up stories about Ambu\'s infidelity.','/qK752uiBVcMNzj97335SvVIUdus.jpg','2010-12-23',168,'Released',NULL,'Manmadhan Ambu',52645,1.2386,5.4,'WoMb3vrtPog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30737,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1806975',4.8,1646,'en','Never Open the Door','Three happy couples enjoy the holidays in a cozy secluded cabin in the woods when they are suddenly interrupted by an unprecedented event that will forever change their lives.','/32KZmBwnPDIKWGzcpv3cHXFZB30.jpg','2014-12-01',64,'Released',NULL,'Never Open the Door',428282,1.0323,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30738,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1807022',8,2934,'kn','ಸೂಪರ್','Super (Kannada: ಸೂಪರ್) (originally known only by Vitarka Mudrā hand symbol) is a 2010 Indian multilingual film written and directed by Upendra. This utopian film garnered extraordinary reception from critics and the general public for its revolutionary concept of a contrasting futuristic India set in the year 2030, and the contemporary image of India. With the title of the film depicted only by a symbol, it features Upendra and Nayantara in lead roles and is produced by Rockline Venkatesh, while V. Harikrishna has scored the music. Raking in more than Rs 100 million through satellite television and audio rights even before release, it was declared a superhit in Kannada where it grossed a record Rs 25 million in first three days of the opening weekend. The film grossed over 50 crore (US$9.05 million) and has been declared one of the biggest blockbusters of Kannada cinema.','/77MjvImWCQ2uEs4Cq8X0RMiN6ts.jpg','2010-12-03',146,'Released',NULL,'Super',123196,1.0388,6.409,'gxHzzSbM28w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30739,_binary '\0','/vVX3rJ9GKlAaWrxZeloPnKpKbIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18071320',5.6,2214,'en','Inside Man','Based on true events. A disgraced police detective seeking redemption goes undercover to expose a violent crime syndicate. But as he sinks deeper into the mob, the price for absolution may be higher than he can afford.','/hIJ5QNIjQ2oILCNLBtbnS0Cmw9z.jpg','2023-08-11',87,'Released',NULL,'Inside Man',1020662,4.1892,6.1,'EvqJ7slnbxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30740,_binary '\0','/dE1SUD70ptplI0bKbdQCbbS8RZ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18071972',5.1,2210,'en','Organ Trail','A young Abigale Archer is left friendless and alone in a brutal Montana winter during the 1870s—fighting for survival and to retrieve her one earthly possession, her family’s horse, from a gang of bloodthirsty bandits.','/s9nwiVMOVvnS2Jt6hdy7UHoFSD0.jpg','2023-04-14',112,'Released',NULL,'Organ Trail',950141,2.4123,6.1,'dfo2Dr7X_s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30741,_binary '\0','/b795kAB6Vbw0P92tyQwQyr4YzGf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18072316',3.7,40899,'hi','बड़े मियाँ छोटे मियाँ','Two elite soldiers with troubled pasts are enlisted for a daring mission when a deadly masked madman threatens India\'s defenses.','/ote8HmQOgmoAfqFaqVKsEdgD2q4.jpg','2024-04-11',164,'Released','The world is about to end and...our heroes will rise','Bade Miyan Chote Miyan',936622,2.7848,6.1,'IGzLHNPO4QI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30742,_binary '\0','/8xH4qa8g4u26bqcpiZ5FO7sGn9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18072376',6.7,1317,'az','موقعیت مهدی','Mehdi Bakeri asks his younger brother Hamid to return to the war zone and be by his side despite the problems and issues that have happened to him. Hamid accepts his request and goes with his brother. After the Operation Kheibar.','/tMNfBWImAwqsdUVf9FMgcIUoK4.jpg','2022-02-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Situation of Mehdi',933232,0.5173,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30743,_binary '\0','/zFi8k4xbWHwjHmFoWFTK4Dy7mMC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18072540',5.2,2013,'es','La niña de la comunión','May, 1987. While returning from a nightclub and after having taken drugs, new girl in town Sara and her friend Rebe find a doll wearing a communion dress. From that moment, their lives will become a living hell.','/n7h5qQErebTkp5YfbDxcu9sPxc8.jpg','2023-02-09',103,'Released',NULL,'The Communion Girl',1008005,3.634,6,'YdVEYsePink','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30744,_binary '\0','/5gz7WdWWEDigSFxcWsYz1pxlI2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18072882',5.4,2392,'is','Northern Comfort','A special forces veteran, an uptight property developer, an influencer with half a million followers and an incompetent instructor are thrown together on a high-end fear of flying course. The course\'s final challenge is an experience flight from London to Iceland, which ends up being a horrendous ordeal. Lost in Iceland, freezing and terrified, they must find a way of facing their fears and working together to spread their wings... and fly.','/ugGhGBjM77ctVB2VSmQP0RJOnMe.jpg','2023-08-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Northern Comfort',986843,3.8185,5.4,'C548FAynojU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30745,_binary '\0','/elH2ZWRHOKpjUNHROvpTCZIvuO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18073066',4.9,2376,'no','Leave','A young woman tries to find her origins after having been abandoned as an infant at a cemetery wrapped in a cloth with satanic symbols, but as she gets closer to answers a malevolent spirit is telling her to leave.','/aiw8k5wXSCkueUD7eavmnNtaQFO.jpg','2022-10-28',106,'Released','Her heritage is haunting her.','Leave',983526,1.8312,5.6,'cKQxHfug6BU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30746,_binary '\0','/rY1gLGeZkpXUp0A5IJqNR5n9acD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18073134',6.7,1839,'fa','ملاقات خصوصی','Parvaneh\'s father is in prison for theft. Farhad, a young teacher who is her father\'s ally, is in touch with Parvaneh from time to time to do some of Iraj\'s work. One day, Farhad expresses interest in Parvaneh and invites her to visit him in prison.','/ot5P9Y21U2zfCsNhQ6BugIYvOKL.jpg','2023-01-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Conjugal Visit',933233,0.8682,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30747,_binary '\0','/aCqsz1Wol8QImZPa3AjecpZPCpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18073328',6.5,20602,'de','Blood & Gold','At the end of World War II, a German soldier is looking for his daughter while an SS troop is looking for a Jewish treasure.','/oLRQP5cEjiT1DxeIHUYEV96Ijum.jpg','2023-04-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Blood & Gold',1098110,4.5155,6.651,'eDsrUYd2VbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30748,_binary '\0','/iG58Wk7WHnaFvSAgkeBMrPyPTPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18077672',6.6,2217,'en','Jolly Good Christmas','David is an American architect who relocates across the pond to take up a job at a prestigious London firm. As the clock counts down to Christmas Day, David is running out of time to buy his girlfriend – who also happens to be his boss’s daughter – a thoughtful present so he resorts to buying her a somewhat uninspired gift card.','/26YADsX1ub5IhnYHIMoSAZBeRDR.jpg','2022-10-29',84,'Released','One day is all it takes to change your life.','Jolly Good Christmas',974213,2.5434,6.8,'mnsK7Wb2jDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30749,_binary '\0','/81mBCIvDLNzIxTNWg1nG1OXufJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18077924',4,3414,'en','Poolman','Darren Barrenman, an unwavering optimist and native Angeleno, spends his days looking after the pool of the Tahitian Tiki apartment block and fighting to make his hometown a better place to live.','/vVz4Rh4j6FQTq9eva3xEvCMumAh.jpg','2024-05-09',100,'Released','Los Angeles has a new hero.','Poolman',834562,2.4353,4.26,'V_Uavq0FNSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30750,_binary '\0','/9SHqgPwJr2A0ReRQqzPfKq05dSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1807892',6,4681,'en','Holiday Engagement','Thirty-something Hillary Burns has spent her life trying to get the approval of her parents, in the shadow of her more successfully-attached siblings. So when Hillary\'s fiance, workaholic lawyer Jason King, dumps her because she isn\'t willing to relocate for his potential promotion, she panics because she had been promising to bring him home to meet her expectant family, whom she does not want to let down! As a last-minute idea, her best friend Sophie convinces her to actually hire someone to \"play the role\" of Jason for her return home on Thanksgiving.. leading to an interesting combination of sparks & revelations for all involved.','/4yM1krPnjkWhIOmrY33mVQgSwXJ.jpg','2011-11-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Holiday Engagement',82099,1.9295,5.9,'jwEjqiFrjvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30751,_binary '\0','/aeksAhU6dZl0Fclm3dBRt6cKBmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18079362',5.9,14197,'en','80 for Brady','Four lifelong friends set out on an unforgettable journey to see their hero Tom Brady play in Super Bowl LI and witness one of the greatest comebacks in sports history, discovering that it\'s never too late to live life to the fullest. Inspired by a true story.','/qhSFHOS9CeXTqGgmbCi5pteIc6k.jpg','2023-02-03',98,'Released','Best friends get into the best kind of trouble.','80 for Brady',942922,8.1619,6.2,'-UeGXB2NjR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30752,_binary '\0','/k77YtPLuDVK1U3BZLjvem7ZDy73.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1807944',5.3,4339,'en','As I Lay Dying','Strife and disaster befall a poor Mississippi family during a two-day trip by horse and wagon to bury their deceased matriarch.','/9blwnvKBmFDwNTmFeSt7Z26XgMt.jpg','2013-10-09',110,'Released','From the classic novel by William Faulkner','As I Lay Dying',152745,3.6962,5.2,'T-kHDmfEnPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30753,_binary '\0','/lcG1w9Lsmfa5XzWeC6vRRUWrfzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1807950',7.2,20740,'tr','Aşk Tesadüfleri Sever','Year 1977, a September morning in Ankara... Yilmaz tries to rush his pregnant wife Neriman to the hospital and he crushes into Omer\'s car. This accident causes Omer\'s pregnant wife Inci, who was in the back seat, to have a pre-term labor. The babies are born on the same day. They see each other for the first time... This accident is the threshold of the coincidences that bring Ozgur and Deniz together.','/yGGAVANrwyRILduyEl6godYCgqX.jpg','2011-02-04',118,'Released',NULL,'Love Likes Coincidences',56919,1.7201,6.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30754,_binary '\0','/qovAAvPpKJybuL95hjw1vCvx9gp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1807958',5.8,1342,'pl','Baby są jakieś inne','Two middle-aged male friends are travelling together by car and expressing their thoughts and emotions connected with women.','/qoTNksNuj245qVoJaZYpk69FpPZ.jpg','2011-10-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Man, Chicks Are Just Different',92108,1.3559,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30755,_binary '\0','/2sX6RIuyGugJqJo6XSoVzEJzPkX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808015',6.3,7288,'it','Che bella giornata','Checco, an uneducated but self-satisfied fellow from Milan, who has always dreamed of becoming a police officer, fails his entrance exam for the third time. It must be said that at the oral examination Checco said that the reason why he wanted to join the police was benefits in kind and cronyism! But the young man has connections and he soon finds himself a security agent at the Milan Cathedral. Of course the bumbling idiot proves a living catastrophe! Spotted by Sufien, an Arab terrorist who is preparing an attack against the cathedral, Checco appears as the perfect sucker. To manipulate him, he sends his charming sister Farah to him, with the mission to seduce him...','/mGNakJZRSxFsXXJCoy38zW5Kp0.jpg','2011-01-05',92,'Released',NULL,'What a Beautiful Day',53319,2.0567,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30756,_binary '\0','/4no1zB9wvTQj7YK1V1xK8FGMeeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808045',6.6,1370,'pl','Czarny Czwartek. Janek Wiśniewski padł','Antoni Krauze reminds one of the darkest history of the cards with PRL. Spectacular reconstruction of the dramatic events in Gdynia, ended a brutal pacification of demonstrators by troops and militia in 1970.','/hTwcsv1DsFgfpKaPlqyxe2AVfui.jpg','2011-02-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Black Thursday',78326,1.2781,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30757,_binary '\0','/vybZHtJjaM8Xa1u8kRo5exgF1eS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808197',6.5,15713,'tr','İncir Reçeli','On a night of despair after being turned down continuously for the scripts he writes, Metin ends up in a bar where he meets a girl named Duygu. After spending the night together, she walks out in the morning before he wakes up and leaves only a short note. The next time they meet, Metin becomes curious about her secret and decides to follow her. What he finds out will be the beginning of an everlasting love.','/hkF7HQOxUlVmKz9UQHjUevBVZf7.jpg','2011-02-11',94,'Released',NULL,'Fig Jam',64335,3.177,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30758,_binary '\0','/ktGl5QUiQUiWjlccUuqvkZWDWGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808223',7.4,27226,'tr','Kaybedenler Kulübü','Kaan and Mete, co-hosts of a mid 1990s radio show called Kaybedenler Kulübü (Losers\' Club), struggle to deal with their daily lives after their show becomes an instant hit. Kaan meets Zeynep, the girl of his dreams, but their relationship comes under pressure as the show continues to stir controversy and attract fans from every segment of Istanbul society.','/kTffzdbvp8EXZ602qZGlB6yWfWt.jpg','2011-03-25',105,'Released',NULL,'Losers\' Club',60228,2.4056,6.507,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30759,_binary '\0','/Qy6WqN8J3D9cCl3qsp8Oq0c7fY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808240',6.1,3003,'es','La chispa de la vida','Roberto is an unemployed publicist who achieved success when he thought of a famous slogan: \"Coca-Cola, the spark of life.\" Now he is a desperate man, trying to remember the happy days, back to the hotel where he spent the honeymoon with his wife. However, instead of the hotel, he finds a museum built around the Roman theater in the city. While walking through the ruins, he has an accident, an iron rod sticks into his head and leaves him completely paralyzed. If he tries to move he would die. Roberto becomes the focus of the media, which will change his life ...','/mUrp6iLFKxij6bLH1yIeFC6KGMg.jpg','2011-11-30',98,'Released',NULL,'As Luck Would Have It',84797,2.4068,6,'aks200zBM_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30760,_binary '\0','/cvOHMfZTxIiNI9yyjYgYfCpT48p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18082758',5.3,5920,'nl','The Takeover','Self-proclaimed ethical hacker Mel Bandison\'s life is turned upside down when she stops a data breach on a high-tech self-driving bus that also happens to shut down an international criminal network. She then becomes a target and is framed with a deepfake video that “shows” that she murders someone.','/g7rdcofib7HqdlDP1LT7Hmf1f2o.jpg','2022-11-01',87,'Released',NULL,'The Takeover',944864,3.2355,5.7,'KutXTcm-s3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30761,_binary '\0','/pSu4HvshUuE6X87KIT4P50bhoPT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808339',6.1,5390,'en','Not Another Happy Ending','When a struggling publisher discovers his only successful author is blocked, he knows he has to unblock her or he\'s finished. With her newfound success, she\'s become too happy and she can\'t write when she\'s happy. The only trouble is, the worse he makes her feel, the more he realizes he\'s in love with her.','/bsJTUA3zVFva5I8Zo1pygKvTt6D.jpg','2013-10-11',102,'Released','Sometimes love needs a re-write.','Not Another Happy Ending',203321,2.4697,5.8,'1xmweTUqjkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30762,_binary '\0','/wcEGMvOzCPjPABa4jbTDF2UOx53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18083578',5.4,14575,'en','57 Seconds','When a tech blogger lands an interview with a tech guru and stops an attack on him, he finds a mysterious ring that takes him back 57 seconds into the past.','/dfS5qHWFuXyZQnwYREwb7N4qU5p.jpg','2023-09-29',99,'Released','Rewind the past. Avenge the future.','57 Seconds',937249,8.1561,6.2,'O3MdV7YJWEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30763,_binary '\0','/zGNLkZYzFrBvROL2g6UNJsfnA8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808454',6.6,12704,'pl','Sala samobójców','Moody, dark, and handsome Dominik is terrorized at school, after video footage of his drunken kiss with classmate Aleksandr goes viral. Grappling with public humiliation, Dominik seeks solace in an avatar based \"suicide room,\" where the pink-haired rebel Sylwia consoles him.','/7mQyn9zDgrHfPtj37BLT1DK3mId.jpg','2011-03-04',116,'Released','Where fantasy and reality meet.','Suicide Room',72478,3.9329,7.23,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30764,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808477',4.3,2261,'en','Skew','When Simon, Rich, and Eva head out on an eagerly anticipated road trip, they bring along a video camera to record their journey. What starts out as a carefree adventure slowly becomes a descent into the ominous as unexplained events threaten to disrupt the balance between the three close friends. Each one of them must struggle with personal demons and paranoia as friendships are tested and gruesome realities are revealed...and recorded.','/zevrFgRl2rZ4wAwjz4HSlTjaLaC.jpg','2011-04-19',83,'Released','On July 19, 2005 three friends went on a road trip. They never came back.','Skew',82115,1.6244,4.1,'IjwBwuKD8mI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30765,_binary '\0','/tJIcDPBMSmCP13VltYzclgttSaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808587',4.6,2136,'sv','The Stig-Helmer Story','The Stig-Helmer Story is a 2011 Swedish comedy film directed by Lasse Åberg. The film is the sixth in the series about Stig-Helmer Olsson.','/sM3A3qBAXcyGUwq29kdij0nxgbN.jpg','2011-12-25',100,'Released','A shamelessly nostalgic comedy.','The Stig-Helmer Story',82447,1.3323,4.5,'2OJ_E1iD2yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30766,_binary '\0','/frZEtZHLV391cCWlyhZVf2kqab4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1808691',5.2,2638,'tr','Ya Sonra?','Onların da aşkı masallar gibiydi ve evlendiler. Yani masallara göre sona geldiler… Adem\'le Didem birbirlerini hala sevmektedirler. Ama evlilik, Adem\'in sevgisini ve ilgisini açığa çıkartma reflekslerini köreltmiştir. Didem ise özgüveni ve özgür iradesi elinden alınmış mutsuz bir kadına dönüşmüştür. Tek tutunduğu onu yeniden hayata döndürecek işidir. Adem\'i hala çok seviyordur. Kocasının peşinden ailesini, dostlarını, kariyerini bırakarak daha önce sadece haritalarda gördüğü şehirlere bile yerleşmekte tereddüt etmeyen Didem, şimdi aynı fedakarlığı Adem\'den bekler. İşte tam bu sırada başka bir masalın prensi hikayemize girer. Artık uyanma vakti gelmiştir…','/gugsJjZjZ6JtNNVbXlt0lXbiQH.jpg','2011-02-24',105,'Released','Külkedisi prens ile evlenir ve masal biter. Peki ya sonra?','Ya Sonra?',57739,0.7529,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30767,_binary '\0','/omu6l0VfWlOKFPyBDgzOheXFEtc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1809231',6.6,3577,'no','Arme Riddere','Terrified and bloody, Oscar Svendsen awakes clinched to a shotgun in a strippers joint. Around him 8 dead men, and police aiming at him. To Oscar it\'s clear that he is innocent. It all started when four chaps won 1,7 million on the pools.','/44IvrRM7US4rjMeNx2bvu9IyXRo.jpg','2011-12-02',86,'Released','Every man for himself','Jackpot',86987,1.4311,5.957,'douOFKgjSuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30768,_binary '\0','/m7xifwtBHlKuEVqBNFafJHwF6RQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18092672',6.6,4185,'no','Gulltransporten','Fredrik isn’t the bravest of men, but now he is faced with a great responsibility and an enormous task - to get the entire Norwegian gold reserve away from the Nazis during the invasion of Norway.','/6E4LopmCMUXcMLIv7o3jw1xQrgJ.jpg','2022-12-15',117,'Released','A true robber story about the time Norway had to steal its own gold.','Gold Run',964426,3.2565,6.5,'iZphQUljiqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30769,_binary '\0','/zIvwweHc0mx8d5r01x7J2moFGpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1809287',5.1,1982,'en','Ecstasy','A small-time drug smuggler from Scotland, is trying to figure out his way through life until he meets a beautiful girl from Canada, who seeks a change after a bad relationship she just got out of.','/sjWrxGy3Q8oj4ij5jJY414BddIS.jpg','2011-09-10',99,'Released','Never be afraid of love, everyone is looking for','Ecstasy',91902,1.6593,4.9,'xmFD3iSEto4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30770,_binary '\0','/As2uMTs7L4EyBFnm3sQxPKIEeHu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1809387',8.3,1656,'en','The War You Don\'t See','This film investigates how the media has reported war, from the First World War to the present day.','/bto5NXOYG6CXyohWuprOLv9opBe.jpg','2010-12-14',97,'Released',NULL,'The War You Don\'t See',51795,1.3326,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30771,_binary '\0','/wxdtjlapI0d1vsXhNN0LhLMsaGw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1809398',7.2,200434,'en','Unbroken','A chronicle of the life of Louis Zamperini, an Olympic runner who was taken prisoner by Japanese forces during World War II.','/vAlHUjHwLWMV5mg4epGR9WSIfiy.jpg','2014-12-25',137,'Released','Survival Resilience Redemption','Unbroken',227306,9.1091,7.415,'kk1M_HwmFMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30772,_binary '\0','/3V3YhLX6XOayRGTi5k2Mwea8NZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1810522',3,1286,'ta','ஆழ்வார்','Aalwar is a traditional priest. He is devoted to his mother and sister. But the villainous elements Lal, Vincent Asokan, kill the sister and mother. Aalwar, with revenge ringing in his mind, ends up as Shiva the killer, even while working as a ward boy in a hospital. Shiva is out to make a statement against the venal forces. He sees himself as some kind of avatar — in fact, he bumps off the baddies under the get-up\'s of Lord Rama and Lord Krishna. In climax, Shiva turns up as Lord Narasimha and bumps off the last villain by placing him on his thighs and ripping apart his bowels and chest with his sharp claws.','/qDmedvAT4oYXSMMt8qab5Ku3AqC.jpg','2007-01-12',157,'Released',NULL,'Aalwar',69409,1.1103,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30773,_binary '\0','/wIJKNIZfdfJuV4HgDU6uk0arcnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1810602',5.9,1798,'zh','非诚勿扰2','The odd-couple courtship saga continues of wealthy, middle-aged retiree Qin Fen and serious-minded young air hostess Xiaoxiao. After an amusing prelude in which Qin presides over a lavish divorce ceremony for an amicably splitting married couple, he and Xiaoxiao decide to address their own relationship barriers - her youth and beauty, his cynical, childish sense of humor — by entering into a trial marriage while on a trip to the country\'s tropical southeast.','/3FjlLKcay0hV6BcizAIMVlhCoWe.jpg','2010-12-22',123,'Released',NULL,'If You Are the One 2',56540,1.4805,5.9,'5c7PyRNgvJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30774,_binary '\0','/xKtWcQD2yugIKz49LvZNHdLM09T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1810683',7.3,25120,'en','Little Boy','An eight-year-old boy is willing to do whatever it takes to end World War II so he can bring his father home. The story reveals the indescribable love a father has for his little boy and the love a son has for his father.','/lAU9pgq3niI6sFemcKm4FGGmrnW.jpg','2015-04-23',106,'Released','Believe the impossible.','Little Boy',256962,6.2812,7.3,'b_BdzqsIX6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30775,_binary '\0','/jF8ZA0UwXPsNis3kmZUN5gtFedF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1810697',5.3,13035,'en','Meeting Evil','Follows disillusioned young family man John as a mysterious stranger, Richie takes him on a murder-fueled ride that transforms the weak-willed John into a desperate hero willing to go to any length to protect his family.','/aGbgCFTN7zUFF6NddoQC8L883HP.jpg','2012-01-31',89,'Released','Evil comes knocking','Meeting Evil',94204,4.7108,5.3,'gaj0Uj40CEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30776,_binary '\0','/impZCV9HiZ3bIrKK5bD1TKRsfVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18107136',5,1346,'en','The Death That Awaits','A drifter searching for answers to a mystery from her past takes on a job looking after a sick teen who is undergoing a mysterious transformation her family will do anything to stop.','/7hloUkIXB1Jc0xjSFlO4dcVfzdt.jpg','2025-02-06',102,'Released',NULL,'The Death That Awaits',1297454,3.4927,6.3,'PGm21GCVei0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30777,_binary '\0','/obP94bLjEXGFWQumzkKlBb9Fmzi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1810864',4.7,1324,'fr','L\'Élève Ducobu','Ducoboo is a very inventive dunce and joker, he is very resourceful at finding new ways to copy from his neighbor, to cheat or to defy the teacher\'s authority.','/piVjl9Xhd6xeYxJnm7ifJaURjHd.jpg','2011-06-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Ducoboo',68637,1.6229,5,'oOf38Xb4NuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30778,_binary '\0','/ctepmnTOnVKRLQXX4VdD2AsJFnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18108824',6.4,8036,'en','The Friend','New York City writer Iris finds her comfortable, solitary life thrown into disarray after her closest friend and mentor bequeaths her a Great Dane named Apollo. The huge dog immediately creates practical problems for Iris, from furniture destruction to eviction notices, as well as more existential ones. Yet as Iris finds herself unexpectedly bonding with Apollo, she begins to come to terms with her past, and her own creative inner life.','/xPAcaKFWvbB9fXAmhIr3leBCRVJ.jpg','2025-03-28',119,'Released',NULL,'The Friend',1186563,5.9901,6.709,'K2Df2g0Gl6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30779,_binary '\0','/kNcbJs4jJWcrEeAPQRnED3FTNFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18110702',5.3,2131,'en','Bark','Charismatic Nolan Bentley wakes up in the middle of a remote forest, tied to a tree with no recollection of how he got there. With his time relentlessly running out, a mysterious stranger appears and he must finally reckon with the demons of his past and fight to survive to find a way out of his nightmare.','/oOfPCEijTMEAwrGkK6Y8IkpKm7r.jpg','2024-10-24',90,'Released','Some secrets don\'t stay buried.','Bark',1146892,1.3246,5.3,'RbrguazafBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30780,_binary '\0','/ofG7o8n6EYw92pNc1OaJ95mEKs6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1811307',6.2,3145,'en','Burning Blue','Two Navy fighter pilots find themselves in the midst of a forbidden relationship throwing their lives and careers into disarray.','/uUpBD2EHyDpCLPATj8LFghiDCTy.jpg','2014-06-06',100,'Released','Deny nothing.','Burning Blue',256196,2.0762,6.2,'2QzIo3_wKHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30781,_binary '\0','/rUONctvx2KhEKSPz1ybzkwu0rP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18113118',5.2,1416,'fr','Chien et Chat','While about to take off, Monica, the owner of a famous influencer cat named Diva, and Jack, an international thief whose dog Chichi swallowed a stolen ruby, dis- cover that their pets have gotten lost on the tarmac. The owners – and their pets – must team up to find their loved ones. But they don’t know that Brandt, a cop hot on their heels, will do anything to get his hands on the ruby!','/3SYqAvxQIddxY5Bd6sWV9Q9kMTw.jpg','2024-02-14',86,'Released',NULL,'Cat and Dog',977331,3.8789,5.704,'u22-tVHqfXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30782,_binary '\0','/ylW6aw2jtKIrlSUha50fxuRhoLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1811315',5.3,2201,'en','FDR: American Badass!','Chronicles the adventures of Franklin Delano Roosevelt, as he rides a \"wheelchair of death\" to stop the world from being taking over by polio-carrying werewolves during WWII. A deadly menace that are led by Werewolf Hitler, Mussolini and Emperor Hirohito.','/kNTmjJ09POWy8peL6c9ZL5Rt3Dj.jpg','2012-09-24',93,'Released',NULL,'FDR: American Badass!',99223,1.2504,5.1,'rs2m2DJybD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30783,_binary '\0','/3Ne79oXHxnPeHgeKPK3A68GAL4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1811371',3.8,1872,'es','Underground','A group of friends fight for their lives against bloodthirsty creatures lurking in an underground military base.','/9dCCM0kTNpipDzSHdYfsRBlvwH.jpg','2011-12-29',83,'Released','You can run, you can hide, but they will always find you.','Underground',80195,1.6291,4.5,'GvHTrD1a8vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30784,_binary '\0','/x34sh46sRoU7XucJwbkw04zNi0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1813327',6.3,1900,'it','Gianni e le donne','Gianni is sixty. He is retired but has not become lazy for all that. In fact he is a helpful fellow who gives a hand to all those who need one: shopping for his wife, walking the pretty neighbor\'s dog, and so on. Everybody likes Gianni, but is it for the right reasons? Doesn\'t his wife profit by the situation (she still works so it is only logical that Gianni do all the chores)? Isn\'t he subject to the excruciating whims of his rich mother?... Sure, everybody LIKES Gianni, but who LOVES him? Agreed, being kind to them, he is the ladies pet, but he does not attract them anymore. That is why, when his macho lawyer friend Alfonso blames him for not having young mistresses \"like every other senior Italian male\", Gianni, who is beginning to ask himself questions about what it is like to become old, starts chasing dames.','/uwaW8GlkydCtNDNfiNDXWsXmSZH.jpg','2011-02-11',90,'Released','Gianni is back and looking for love ...','The Salt of Life',56959,2.2495,6,'1K4SmpYxuNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30785,_binary '\0','/4r1KmStJneT8txlUQAWy8l58ilX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1813609',4.8,3045,'en','A Haunting at Silver Falls','A small town is haunted by the twin daughters of a wrongfully convicted man. Young Jordan is sent down the path to who the real killer is only to find the killer is very close to her.','/vD2PGnUZ9LkzfTbT8cpbcRWlUpO.jpg','2013-05-28',96,'Released','Twin girls haunt a new girl in town to steer her down the path to the right killer.','A Haunting at Silver Falls',197919,2.1202,4.731,'NnIQiWyPadU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30786,_binary '\0','/dezFPyUmRguvXr8ot6HSXGaCGrV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1813757',7.7,12065,'lg','Who Killed Captain Alex?','War erupts between a mafia group and soldiers.','/2GYBwJJMOrWsEmJRvRl48mQDyTI.jpg','2010-03-01',68,'Released','EXPECT THE UNEXPECTABLE!','Who Killed Captain Alex?',316776,1.6639,6.516,'BymeLkZ7GqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30787,_binary '\0','/xcPdPDl8ihjIDQW6XxnQvABEvyp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814621',5.7,37278,'en','Admission','Straitlaced Princeton University admissions officer Portia Nathan is caught off-guard when she makes a recruiting visit to an alternative high school overseen by her former classmate, the freewheeling John Pressman. Pressman has surmised that Jeremiah, his gifted yet very unconventional student, might well be the son that Portia secretly gave up for adoption many years ago.','/f3HoCikJxypRtLJptBwvs7L7etE.jpg','2013-03-21',107,'Released','Let someone in.','Admission',144340,4.1422,5.6,'YsGY3hk-OkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30788,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814631',2.1,1710,'en','American Nudist','A young woman invites a filmmaker to follow her through the modern world of nudism.','/puLHC96soFDmOFUFHXli8Qw0zXX.jpg','2011-11-15',98,'Released',NULL,'American Nudist',105478,2.3262,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30789,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814642',8.2,2072,'en','Bad Hero','Jason known as the boss of the drug dealer\'s playground catches a man kidnapping TV star Linda Murphy.',NULL,NULL,73,'Released',NULL,'Bad Hero',260607,0.4265,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30790,_binary '\0','/2L1LMfwqBeR6owgphgtfUtJXhQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814797',6.3,1453,'te','Mirapakay','Rishi (Ravi Teja) is an inspector in the Intelligence Bureau. His colleagues fondly call him \'Mirapakaay\'. The chief of the IB, Narayana Murthy (Nagababu) gets information that Kittu Bhai (Prakash Raj), a mafia don, is trying to spread his tentacles in India and is targeting Delhi first. During the course of the investigation, ACP (Sanjay Swaroop) is killed by Shankar (Kota Srinivasa Rao), a local goon with the help of his son (Supreet). Murthy sends Rishi to Hyderabad and gets him admitted to a college as a Hindi lecturer as part of an undercover operation. Rishi meets Vinamra (Richa Gangopadhyay) at a temple & falls in love at first sight. Incidentally, she studies in the same college and in the same class to which Rishi teaches Hindi. Their love blossoms. At this juncture, Vaishali (Deeksha Seth), daughter of Kittu Bhai, joins the same college. Grabbing the opportunity, the IB chief asks Rishi to extract information about Kittu from Vaishali.','/xb4ePZdBvazvqrETSTbjCtQMWj0.jpg','2011-01-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Mirapakay',57736,1.989,5.65,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30791,_binary '\0','/jsKRghidoIF2uOFeGUGFSDuPIsQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814836',7.4,8759,'en','Project Nim','From the team behind Man on Wire comes the story of Nim, the chimpanzee who in the 1970s became the focus of a landmark experiment which aimed to show that an ape could learn to communicate with language if raised and nurtured like a human child. Following Nim\'s extraordinary journey through human society, and the enduring impact he makes on the people he meets along the way, the film is an unflinching and unsentimental biography of an animal we tried to make human. What we learn about his true nature - and indeed our own - is comic, revealing and profoundly unsettling.','/bKvxfhFK4hSgY19ObJ30bQYtyli.jpg','2011-07-08',93,'Released','The world will be a different place once you\'ve seen it through his eyes.','Project Nim',63579,1.4912,6.9,'gy4LahNY2zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30792,_binary '\0','/eUH8sdeY6v8qKrx20cvxrx5h8XG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814905',3.9,1430,'en','The Crying Dead','The cast and crew of a paranormal reality show spend their first night at a haunted location; it starts with vague apparitions that quickly turn into violent hauntings and, one-by-one, people begin dying.','/cGyq2x7WSxMW3JjAPxk6ZgsWayN.jpg','2011-10-31',77,'Released','The Past Can Kill You','The Crying Dead',129798,0.8653,4,'2voamcLmyRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30793,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1814930',7.1,3106,'en','Vegucated','Explores the challenges of converting to a vegan diet. It \"follows three meat-and-cheese-loving New Yorkers who agree to adopt a vegan diet for six weeks.','/jKXD994yp5b95lXK7aGhGSGPysF.jpg','2011-01-09',76,'Released','Three people. Six weeks. One challenge.','Vegucated',76127,1.006,6.8,'GKzng1_byMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30794,_binary '\0','/1pgiezGVzht05L2Z96Ex83zDCGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815708',4.7,11257,'en','Freelancers','The son of a slain NYPD officer joins the force, where he falls in with his father\'s former partner and a team of rogue cops. His new boss, Sarcone, will see if he has what it takes to be rogue through many trials and tribulations of loyalty, trust and respect. When the truth about his father\'s death is revealed revenge takes him over and he won\'t stop until justice has been truly served.','/qCvA4Cw7lsYGR5fatVcoPEIYolU.jpg','2012-08-10',96,'Released','To serve, protect... and steal.','Freelancers',122800,3.0017,5.104,'Y-rJeEB8wWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30795,_binary '\0','/mSUnNIjJEkqkWxbklDjWCD2RUdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815717',6.2,2973,'en','Gerontophilia','Lake is in a straight relationship with Desiree but finds himself becoming attracted to men at the pool. When he cannot control his desires any longer, he starts working at an adult home and begins a relationship with a much, much older man.','/mHtqroqrwpyFhR2j7uerQ7AZ3JZ.jpg','2013-08-28',90,'Released','Gerontophilia [jə-ˌrän-tō-ˈfil-ē-ə] noun - the love or sexual preference for the elderly.','Gerontophilia',212721,1.8628,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30796,_binary '\0','/fIXmzzKUzLP239GG4BR4OHnQMT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815746',3.8,1524,'en','Humans vs Zombies','Students on summer break are exposed to a deadly virus that is spread rapidly through direct human contact. The infected become enslaved by the invading \"swarm\" intelligence and driven by an insatiable appetite to consume human flesh. Returning home, the students spread the infection to their fellow classmates and other unsuspecting townspeople.','/ytQ2S5UlBrnclSDqioKfjbEShij.jpg','2011-11-11',105,'Released','The infection has begun.','Humans vs Zombies',90232,1.1439,4.5,'CZze9aRHoYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30797,_binary '\0','/gNb5FsAIqAHtIn9cI2OvTE9OZHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815753',6.2,1456,'it','Il giorno in più','Giacomo is a 40-year-old man who works for a big company in Milan. To avoid working on weekends, he lies about having a girlfriend whose character he creates based upon a girl he sees every morning.','/9Q2jNCr38n4T09Wdr87v77hw6pa.jpg','2011-12-02',111,'Released',NULL,'One Day More',79836,2.4892,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30798,_binary '\0','/g9UJ5gkz4ruAPDQJSy0jsgh5mZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815782',5.9,3079,'sv','Kronjuvelerna','Fragancia is arrested for the attempted murder of Richard Persson, the son of a powerful factory owner. During the interrogation her amazing and remarkable life story is revealed. We follow her through her impoverished childhood, her adolescence where she meets the great love of her life, ice hockey star Petterson-Jonsson and the lead up to the fatal night where the story begins.','/jCYaqpASLsCsP0vNO869BnsQ624.jpg','2011-06-29',120,'Released','An incredible biographical story of murder, betrayal and love.','The Crown Jewels',72993,1.6426,5.4,'CeYCfuCDwcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30799,_binary '\0','/16Omt4mwRf771EWEiNrwfuNJX4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815799',6.1,2686,'fr','Les bien-aimés','From Paris in the 1960s to London in the first decade of the third millennium, Madeleine and her daughter Véra flit from one amorous adventure to the next, living for the moment and taking all the opportunities that life offers. But not every love affair is without its consequences, its upsets and its disappointments. As time goes by and gnaws away at one’s deepest feelings, love becomes a harder game to play.','/1T77id5LO02Ym3ml6oL87KBZvN5.jpg','2011-08-17',139,'Released','Be hard be brave','Beloved',93188,3.6762,6.1,'1_rR0n1gR1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30800,_binary '\0','/sf8SQHhh0bu0KOnZZtIhhWoX0MF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815837',7.9,1556,'bn','মনের মানুষ','The movie is about a poet and singer Lalon Fakir who belongs to a cult called baul and who believes and inculcates that the value of a human being is above the narrow belief of religions.','/wvILsBmyRxJAGb8y5HK85O3pbHM.jpg','2010-12-03',150,'Released',NULL,'Moner Manush',54323,0.9365,7.5,'ZmfLM-fdCRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30801,_binary '\0','/5D4XFQLHXvYIaMSuKYjxPqY6q4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815852',6.6,6493,'en','Nitro Circus: The Movie','You will see Travis Pastrana and the whole Nitro Circus crew perform some of the most ridiculous, awe-inspiring, and simply insane stunts ever caught on camera. Coming to you in three dimensional glory, it will feel like you are there sitting shotgun with the crew.','/ofDDFfZ40dnGUPyjaDSPwqCQ12K.jpg','2012-08-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Nitro Circus: The Movie',110112,2.3498,6.4,'gxTuEC8RMzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30802,_binary '\0','/e3posvSzYf9PjrQg27W64Kyc8qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1815862',4.8,217884,'en','After Earth','One thousand years after cataclysmic events forced humanity\'s escape from Earth, Nova Prime has become mankind\'s new home. Legendary General Cypher Raige returns from an extended tour of duty to his estranged family, ready to be a father to his 13-year-old son, Kitai. When an asteroid storm damages Cypher and Kitai\'s craft, they crash-land on a now unfamiliar and dangerous Earth. As his father lies dying in the cockpit, Kitai must trek across the hostile terrain to recover their rescue beacon. His whole life, Kitai has wanted nothing more than to be a soldier like his father. Today, he gets his chance.','/iXMvYIlzzJBs352CfeiQcBvovZt.jpg','2013-05-30',100,'Released','Danger is real, fear is a choice.','After Earth',82700,10.9262,5.179,'-r9IXze_tPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30803,_binary '\0','/sBiobcx5DaKlLs6wK6jlAEVmQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18161082',5.7,1263,'en','Turn Me On','In a world where the inconvenience of human emotion has been eradicated by a single daily vitamin, one young couple skips their dose and discovers love, joy, sex, and all the baggage that comes with it.','/tp8iokHkDfFSXwxTJ1sdhlFROsS.jpg','2024-11-06',99,'Released','Feel something. Change everything.','Turn Me On',937086,2.3852,5.8,'POq-N8Vqy6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30804,_binary '\0','/9j7bPqtsbIzhMwVYD6deKsGhzys.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18162096',7.3,6452,'ro','Nu Aștepta Prea Mult de la Sfârșitul Lumii','On behalf of a multinational company, a production assistant drives around the Romanian city of Bucharest, interviewing various citizens who have been injured due to work accidents to cast one of them in a “safety at work” video.','/y2H7SMzSO0f8KHjCqavUhVfRX0Z.jpg','2023-09-27',164,'Released',NULL,'Do Not Expect Too Much from the End of the World',937085,2.7111,6.869,'107BDD11YcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30805,_binary '\0','/6nCy4OrV7gxhDc3lBSUxkNALPej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18163814',4.8,1803,'en','Stockholm Bloodbath','In 1520, the notorious and power-hungry Danish King Christian II is determined to seize the Swedish crown from Sten Sture, no matter what it takes. Meanwhile, sisters Freja and Anne make a solemn promise to seek revenge on the men who brutally murdered their family. Everything comes to a head in the heart of Stockholm, where the sisters are drawn into a ruthless political struggle between Sweden and Denmark that culminates in a mass execution, presided over by the mad King \"Christian the Tyrant,\" known as the Stockholm Bloodbath.','/tzXOB8nxO70SfSbOhrYcY94x6MI.jpg','2024-01-19',145,'Released','Old grudges never die.','Stockholm Bloodbath',1051486,3.4841,6.292,'UzUx3idEx-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30806,_binary '\0','/1yQpY4UCaGEirYq9EqTrDvZ24KQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1816518',7.8,24651,'fr','Ernest et Célestine','Celestine is a little mouse trying to avoid a dental career while Ernest is a big bear craving an artistic outlet. When Celestine meets Ernest, they overcome their natural enmity by forging a life of crime together.','/iJPbRASktYW0I009Ktc2zUE6Fvg.jpg','2012-12-12',80,'Released','Bonnie and Clyde, Sid and Nancy...','Ernest & Celestine',126319,4.4145,7.8,'UJ1rmOYLr2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30807,_binary '\0','/zwXUPj4D1xVQMVX3Zi7qvbpb2cv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1816585',4.7,1798,'en','Mermaids: The Body Found','A story that imagines how these real-world phenomena may be related. In this story, startling amateur video and photographic evidence, as well as additional audio recordings, suggests whales weren’t the only creatures affected by the Navy’s sonar. The film follows the two scientists who tracked the whale beachings for years and delivers first-hand, on-camera accounts of what they claim to have discovered in the aftermath of one particular beaching. Their story is nothing less than fantastical: they claim to have found the remains of a mermaid.','/xFGoPjzRXSDWUcnpFacrLOo7KF1.jpg','2011-03-19',82,'Released',NULL,'Mermaids: The Body Found',117124,1.5897,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30808,_binary '\0','/qmrrK8on0pfR9C53ZF3tABswS3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1816597',5.8,3697,'en','The Aggression Scale','When out-on-bail mob boss Bellavance discovers that $500,000 of his money is missing, he sends four hardcore hit men to send a \"loud and messy\" message to the suspected thieves\' families. But when the killers invade the Rutledge home, they\'ll meet the household\'s emotionally disturbed young son Owen. Owen has a history of violent behavior, knows how to make lethal booby-traps and is about to teach these thugs some deadly lessons in extreme vengeance.','/24IWHU3vVqHWAvwkjBpp2ybz2vb.jpg','2012-03-10',85,'Released',NULL,'The Aggression Scale',94818,2.5903,5.6,'ElXVL8-up8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30809,_binary '\0','/p30zjdch82XjnUjNdTgbcxt60gG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1816608',4.6,6249,'en','Another Me','A teenager finds her perfect life upended when she\'s stalked by a mysterious doppelganger who has her eyes set on assuming her identity.','/ryGdE6W9oMSKSRE0CSaHActo4oh.jpg','2013-11-15',86,'Released','She’s watching. She’s waiting. She wants your life.','Another Me',252529,2.8804,5.446,'hg37MLNj16Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30810,_binary '\0','/oX29bzX5KNNPGg2bUZnZB7oOpUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817081',5.6,12647,'en','A Case of You','Young writer Sam has a crush on Birdie, the cute and quirky barista at his local coffee shop. When his conventional attempts to woo her crash and burn, he takes his efforts online, creating an Internet profile embellished with all of the details that would make him Birdie’s dream guy. When the harebrained scheme is a surprise success and Birdie falls for his exaggerated alter ego, Sam must keep up the act or lose his dream girl forever.','/qP6X7K5BWtQv28leIpxJNmq1deB.jpg','2013-11-06',91,'Released','He\'ll be everything she likes but himself.','A Case of You',174316,4.3931,5.547,'_Zmd_23Tsyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30811,_binary '\0','/v1qPNKoFvNGweo3CnmLgkYbagR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817191',6.3,2583,'fr','La Vie d\'une autre','When the fun loving Marie sets her eyes on brooding comic book artist Paul, it sets off the kind of romantic sparks that quickly culminate in the bedroom. But the next morning brings its share of surprises as Marie crawls out of bed to discover her life flash-forwarded fifteen years down the road: Not only has she been married to Paul all this time, but she’s now the mother of a little boy the head of a powerful multinational investment firm and the proprietor of a fabulous apartment overlooking the Eiffel Tower. Quickly Marie discovers that all her achievements have not brought happiness.','/71pWxKKnBErzNHF1hS4j3ZXJXW.jpg','2012-02-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Another Woman\'s Life',116231,2.0073,6.2,'2vqoo5Za4HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30812,_binary '\0','/hXz0u1wEYU7LogAPspwd1o4xBfj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817232',7,6380,'en','Phineas and Ferb the Movie: Candace Against the Universe','Phineas and Ferb travel across the galaxy to rescue their older sister Candace, who has been abducted by aliens and taken to a utopia in a far-off planet, free of her pesky little brothers.','/m5ZGqyTN8BMRO3OApuSWHBfyySg.jpg','2020-06-14',86,'Released','Get ready for a mission that\'s out of this world!','Phineas and Ferb the Movie: Candace Against the Universe',594328,7.4747,7.245,'w7FySIfypLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30813,_binary '\0','/qCsaZ2GoaCn5vmOUD9kCsyabr9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817273',7.3,312929,'en','The Place Beyond the Pines','A motorcycle stunt rider considers committing a crime in order to provide for his wife and child, an act that puts him on a collision course with a cop-turned-politician.','/vY5j2xQzMGWmxBuhQo0HfA4Lxqb.jpg','2013-03-20',140,'Released','One moment can change your life.','The Place Beyond the Pines',97367,9.5685,6.982,'KepnbJT5nBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30814,_binary '\0','/5i08YwdQHxkSbz6YWvsX4KFUHaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817276',3.9,1805,'en','A Resurrection','A down to earth school psychologist tries to help a mentally ill student who actually believes his brother is coming back from the grave for revenge on the students who killed him.','/o5Z1675pij30NIF0JVr5p4ZQh1M.jpg','2013-03-21',98,'Released',NULL,'A Resurrection',177552,1.625,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30815,_binary '\0','/oVizwvM1ulKdJc7A2UanGYjny35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817286',6.2,1489,'fr','38 témoins','In the harbor city of Le Havre, France, a woman is stabbed during the night, just below the windows of her neighborhood. Pierre (Yvan Attal) has witnessed the murder, and heard the wails of the women crying for help. So have the neighbors, certainly. But at the end, nobody called the police. Nevertheless, sorrows are too heavy for Pierre, which feel the needs to tell everything to his wife (Sophie Quinton), and to the police. During the investigation, it appears that 38 people witnessed the murdering, and none reacted...','/dtMWw10XHdRce57jAdpH2YAv55x.jpg','2012-03-14',104,'Released',NULL,'One Night',95191,1.1908,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30816,_binary '\0','/tMHHtJ1ISUKR5xDASpadO8Cmorg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817287',7.1,3811,'en','Is the Man Who Is Tall Happy?','A series of interviews featuring linguist, philosopher and activist Noam Chomsky done in hand-drawn animation.','/y9yAjpCQRqtzcR5GdSVHuLdxuV0.jpg','2013-11-22',88,'Released','An Animated Conversation with Noam Chomsky','Is the Man Who Is Tall Happy?',167502,1.3015,6.9,'mBaEjIzDhgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30817,_binary '\0','/lTNQ8jEtmuuRrFJ1ZzfWd5xIem4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817676',5.6,7212,'en','Girl in Progress','As single mom Grace juggles work, bills, and her affair with a married doctor, her daughter, Ansiedad, plots a shortcut to adulthood after finding inspiration in the coming-of-age stories she\'s reading for school.','/tTzjlbcHotG8DEH9vFDf2IheFfn.jpg','2012-05-11',93,'Released','A tale of acting up, acting out, and acting your age.','Girl in Progress',82618,2.6225,5.6,'mfhlBjUIPss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30818,_binary '\0','/frTXhzfhoVPVwPJKJx40svhmPeW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1817771',5.9,14844,'en','Freaks of Nature','In the town of Dillford, humans, vampires and zombies were all living in peace - until the alien apocalypse arrived. Now three teenagers-one human, one vampire, and one zombie-have to team up to figure out how to get rid of the visitors.','/uOfXM61tr3sDoyyAaNTDyfxxyaE.jpg','2015-10-30',92,'Released','Get out undead or alive.','Freaks of Nature',218784,5.4092,6.1,'eNXH63gCOG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30819,_binary '\0','/4x2dOp6K4oG8Lwufd9qCFss0Yup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18180926',5.7,1934,'en','The New Boy','In a remote monastery in 1940s Australia, a mission for Aboriginal children is run by a renegade nun, Sister Eileen. A new charge is delivered in the dead of night – a boy who appears to have special powers. When the monastery takes possession of a precious relic, a large carving of Christ on the cross, the new boy encounters Jesus for the first time and is transfixed. However, the boy’s Indigenous spiritual life does not gel with the mission’s Christianity and his mysterious power becomes a threat. Sister Eileen is faced with a choice between the traditions of her faith and the truth embodied in the boy, in this story of spiritual struggle and the cost of survival.','/r0hNRXZtGaON1wBPqPI4oe1V4CU.jpg','2023-07-06',116,'Released','A mysterious new arrival disturbs a delicately balanced world in this story of spiritual struggle and the cost of survival.','The New Boy',937161,2.8696,6.1,'BNT-jpoo9KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30820,_binary '\0','/lhSpqpI7fOpDUM4mTQZ5FINa4Wd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18181656',6.8,1672,'en','Always Amore','The movie centers around Elizabeth who, with the support of her mother-in-law Nonna, is doing everything she can to keep her late husband’s once acclaimed — but now struggling — Italian restaurant afloat. With business going downhill, she is forced to work with a professional restaurant consultant, Ben, to see if they can turn things around. At first, Elizabeth resists the changes Ben believes will save the restaurant, but as they get closer, Elizabeth realizes that not all change is bad. She rediscovers her passion for baking and might even open her heart to new love.','/dPJMl05qBhE98cwQz4TCfhPaQ2m.jpg','2022-04-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Always Amore',937110,1.9548,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30821,_binary '\0','/pcjG9s2dgibavpl4N7b9aVfXWpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18184012',8.1,5848,'kn','ಲವ್ Mocktail 2','A sequel to Love Mocktail. Revolves around Aadi after the demise of his wife Nidhi. How does he move on from such a loss?','/u2U7XpEzlFq3x3C0bjRzOo3rhg.jpg','2022-02-11',140,'Released','Story to be Continued...','Love Mocktail 2',723567,2.0654,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30822,_binary '\0','/4flCm7WbiZYIaHawPmvaiHrzkno.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18184122',8.1,3077,'bn','Redrum','Famous musician Sohel is found dead in his bedroom. His wife Neela was sleeping peacefully when the body is discovered. Sohel\'s childhood friend detective Rashed took charge of the investigation. Although Neela seems to be the prime suspect, everyone around Shohel is not telling the truth. When the present is not serving Rashed anything fruitful, he dives into the past. Unsetting events start to unveil and we learn that lie is nothing but a badly expressed truth. How Sohel was killed?','/eZdk4K2CeqMwlm19UDwCB6wYzph.jpg','2022-02-17',132,'Released','When A truth is badly expressed, it becomes a lie!','Redrum',936267,1.6482,8,'MM-TQeS-P-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30823,_binary '\0','/crd7JeAFtMnHKlNLd84SN4YOmcr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1819513',6.8,3610,'en','Dreams of a Life','A filmmaker sets out to discover the life of Joyce Vincent, who died in her bedsit in North London in 2003. Her body wasn\'t discovered for three years, and newspaper reports offered few details of her life - not even a photograph.','/o5vQtRWFjpBLRPXgpGzoggCMEjQ.jpg','2011-08-16',95,'Released','Would anyone miss you?','Dreams of a Life',83540,1.7243,6.5,'jSfXh8IJEg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30824,_binary '\0','/6QxeUFTR78TmHyYO0Q2DssdB2JF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1820462',3.9,3668,'ru','Беременный','To cure a man of his tendency to disbelieve people bringing him any kind of good news, God fulfils the man\'s wish to have a baby, but, instead of his wife, God makes him pregnant.','/uU9t8o8DnoGbzlQNjcQY3ZSkjZ.jpg','2011-09-08',81,'Released',NULL,'Beremennyy',75438,1.0659,2.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30825,_binary '\0','/hnkdrpKqANChFKvwTRYlw2Y6xZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1820488',7,7771,'fr','Rebelle','Somewhere in Sub-Saharan Africa, Komona a 14-year-old girl tells her unborn child growing inside her the story of her life since she has been at war. Everything started when she was abducted by the rebel army at the age of 12.','/78Yi8mzd1S04ANbdlxI1FkMl4Vx.jpg','2012-02-17',90,'Released',NULL,'War Witch',98205,2.6305,6.6,'Z8hM9-OGnws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30826,_binary '\0','/zyqAhNJqwiop5yUOJ8SHV27labY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18212138',4.4,3813,'en','Kill Code','North America has been divided into four main quadrants. A power-hungry corporation has taken over the conventional prison system and made criminals the new law enforcers. The owner of that corporation, nanoscientist Eion Prescott, created a nano-virus called Onyx. Which is distributed through deadly watches to criminals. First, infecting them. Then, forcing them into eliminating each other for freedom. Who can topple the corporation\'s entire system from within?','/bXvSKLCillha6wxY0yxoRCM2WQl.jpg','2026-04-16',87,'Released','Judge. Executioner. Freedom.','Kill Code',949536,14.9609,4.875,'HlIKFktkF_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30827,_binary '\0','/6IhmwXgHKmYZoIV9PZxKWQtXAet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821317',8.1,8024,'ta','ஆடுகளம்','Pettaikaaran is famous in his town for an impeccable track record of successes in rooster fights. When one of his aides, Karuppu, goes against his word in a fight, it leads to an enmity between them.','/osU8Egxu2xhS6RwkxDbfOMYjZZ2.jpg','2011-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Aadukalam',68016,1.4132,7.705,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30828,_binary '\0','/trTMVPx2xYWl6yI2oGHEETkaXLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821362',5.9,3987,'fr','Case départ','Two contempo Frenchmen of Antillean descent visit their ancestor\'s time as well as their land in the slavery-themed French era.','/eGNpK9qDsSK4hgEoLSQTraxOUsE.jpg','2011-07-06',94,'Released',NULL,'Case départ',66118,1.9702,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30829,_binary '\0','/mMjRFMOuFxsL2elALlm5v8CA7ud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821426',6.2,7326,'en','Family Weekend','A 16-year-old girl takes her parents hostage after they miss her big jump-roping competition.','/RiUNV96HPP14OfB7ILEOe2Vj26.jpg','2013-03-28',105,'Released','If a family doesn\'t stick together, sometimes you have to use a little tape.','Family Weekend',172631,4.3092,6.3,'1nJA2Mq9B6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30830,_binary '\0','/aeNhkhY8ial2VgudAoqkmFCN2BW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821427',6,5238,'en','Offender','Justice needs to be served at Britain\'s most notorious young offenders institute.','/gYzE8XlHGMH1nmlwlPksBzj8kZH.jpg','2012-08-08',102,'Released','This summer ... justice will be served','Offender',122044,2.3774,6.7,'AmP8EtUqThQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30831,_binary '\0','/uoYFSeun3XgtANmyaUH3DTySodf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821478',7,8653,'ta','காவலன்','Bhoominathan aka Bhoomi is introduced to us as a person who gets into many local fights. Worried about his future, his family sends him to Muthuramalingam , a much respected personality in his place Semmanur, to put Bhoomi\'s life on the right track. But things don\'t go as planned. Muthuramalingam\'s adversary threatens to kill his daughter Meera as a revenge against his own daughter\'s fate. So Bhoomi is given the job of Meera\'s bodyguard at college. Meera goes to college with her friend Madhu but is irritated by Bhoomi\'s presence everywhere. So she devises a plan.','/9LmnnPxfkVZC3b2J0rrOTsessjG.jpg','2011-01-15',152,'Released',NULL,'Kaavalan',58723,1.3437,5.745,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30832,_binary '\0','/ycRsscsENS6hTTRPlSv3YyBAkHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821480',8.1,70552,'hi','कहानी','Pregnant and alone in the city of Kolkata, a woman begins a relentless search for her missing husband, only to find that nothing is what it seems.','/e2eQVOrdQ8k7yYjjHKHP2nlwbTu.jpg','2012-03-08',122,'Released','A mother of a story.','Kahaani',82825,2.1071,7.2,'CUj73MLqZoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30833,_binary '\0','/yePsFcldyZ6VnxaBr8ZbVEaOt4W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821549',7.7,129432,'en','Nebraska','An aging, booze-addled father takes a trip from Montana to Nebraska with his estranged son in order to claim what he believes to be a million-dollar sweepstakes prize.','/o1t2Mw18EEBnl8v4Nby3PFjxnM1.jpg','2013-09-21',115,'Released','Life\'s not about winning or losing. It\'s about how you get there in the end.','Nebraska',129670,5.1262,7.4,'YvW_DmfKfSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30834,_binary '\0','/q0arvx5ai3x3vMJICHiCfAfQJzh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821593',7.3,25261,'nl','Rundskop','A young cattle farmer is approached by an unscrupulous veterinarian to make a shady deal with a notorious beef trader.','/j9XzaLtFAJIozDH4MQwxaR2aDvJ.jpg','2011-02-02',129,'Released','My whole life I’ve known nothing but animals.','Bullhead',63310,1.8796,7.1,'1GDdNg0HidI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30835,_binary '\0','/pmRZc2gCrUI11AVWWjlfIxdBgeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821597',6.6,1826,'it','Scialla! (Stai sereno)','The life of a melancholy professor is turned upside down when he discovers that a rebellious teenager he is tutoring is actually his son.','/RwyeBE6i44VVmr3QXR9zwL1G9b.jpg','2011-11-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Easy!',78854,1.1242,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30836,_binary '\0','/AaxHl7yR9kyh9eSNWexS2tqkH84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821607',6.3,2250,'ta','சிறுத்தை','A thief comes across a little girl who says that he\'s her father. When he learns the truth about his lookalike, who\'s an honest cop, he decides to turn a new leaf and help get rid of the local baddie.','/wqXmZXcBKXNPp67KhTHo2FHB1q0.jpg','2011-01-14',161,'Released',NULL,'Siruthai',63448,1.4969,5.903,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30837,_binary '\0','/c1nCz7PEip3YeqT7R4I8Toc3FOw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821641',6.4,20948,'en','The Congress','An aging, out-of-work actress accepts one last job, though the consequences of her decision affect her in ways she didn\'t consider.','/oeT9rwfCBayxgVoUn1yZGmkZlUq.jpg','2013-07-03',123,'Released',NULL,'The Congress',152795,4.2136,6.398,'QHBl43lMJY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30838,_binary '\0','/hDyGD9UQn6CDky3jcGXGVnPOGUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821658',5.7,32841,'en','The Nut Job','Surly, a curmudgeon, independent squirrel is banished from his park and forced to survive in the city. Lucky for him, he stumbles on the one thing that may be able to save his life, and the rest of park community, as they gear up for winter - Maury\'s Nut Store.','/4iHnGlmOjAj2k5zUftYDIzSITCf.jpg','2014-01-17',85,'Released','No nuts, no glory.','The Nut Job',227783,9.3186,5.9,'Euf_u3caHmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30839,_binary '\0','/iTWfYuqu315DOZgcH9wwKwcGeI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821680',4.7,2074,'es','Don Gato y su pandilla','There\'s a new police chief in the neighbourhood who is disappointed with Officer Dibble\'s performance. The chief and his army of robots declare war on Top Cat and his gang of feisty felines.','/9RQDenX73T35lNbW3dBEqTqjsXp.jpg','2011-09-16',90,'Released','The Cat is back!','Top Cat: The Movie',78570,2.7138,6.1,'7FAnUtCwo8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30840,_binary '\0','/legXlaonlFs8WSC5M7Kl7Us3uJx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821682',8.1,5790,'ml','ട്രാഫിക്','An emotional thriller based on a road trip from Kochi to Palakkad. Inspired from the real events that happened in Chennai.','/3ficNeBPB03vUZ9N7okWftKpyr9.jpg','2011-01-07',122,'Released',NULL,'Traffic',142948,1.6659,6.915,'NpMP-YxFJrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30841,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821692',7.3,1770,'en','United Six','Six women decide to break into a bank, withdraw at the 11th hour - but must go on the run after the bank gets robbed by unknown person(s).','/fFLU33nP3eThl9MyfRgQzc5v0Ae.jpg','2011-09-20',NULL,'Released',NULL,'United Six',83320,0.4702,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30842,_binary '\0','/gd2vQT8uMf1FAsiC0OdewL7XUFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821694',6.6,190013,'en','RED 2','Retired C.I.A. agent Frank Moses reunites his unlikely team of elite operatives for a global quest to track down a missing portable nuclear device.','/tbksijr6g340yFWRgI4JfwrtM9h.jpg','2013-07-18',116,'Released','The best never rest.','RED 2',146216,10.9334,6.531,'56vPzBENK9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30843,_binary '\0','/4TlLr7ZKo5c5sIgxEMXC0GTE3wi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1821700',7.4,30033,'ur','وار','The efforts of the Pakistani security forces in their fight against terrorism and how the lives of security officials are affected. A retired security officer returns to save Pakistan from a major terrorist attack.','/sjRwsdao3kRDhZz9nWx5SZwGJnk.jpg','2013-10-16',130,'Released',NULL,'Waar',228101,0.956,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30844,_binary '\0','/wHXWGru6aACOGMr5jgCcC9WWyL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1822255',6.8,1561,'de','Mein bester Feind','Poland 1943: An unlikely pair - a concentration camp prisoner and a captain in Hitler\'s notorious SS - free themselves from the wreckage of a crashed SS airplane. The two appear to be strangely familiar with each other and the extent of their extraordinary relationship is thrillingly revealed.','/w4pa1tVAC17uUsD5pQzW1CCv4kj.jpg','2011-02-16',109,'Released',NULL,'My Best Enemy',78463,1.9668,5.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30845,_binary '\0','/nhz7FjT8zqrlNgVJsyao65MEpT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1822266',8,2373,'mr','मुंबई पुणे मुंबई','A girl from Mumbai who comes to Pune to meet a prospective groom, with the idea of rejecting him, ends up spending the day with a complete stranger.','/ibkKHgcx1iT0fi8eIJ6LIp1HNFU.jpg','2010-06-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Mumbai Pune Mumbai',313646,1.2727,7.7,'kwM366wTYn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30846,_binary '\0','/3FriKnwW3U0XbA3GIijfHYpudmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1822275',4.9,1292,'ar','عمر و سلمي ٢','Now parents, Omar and Salma hit some obstacles while raising their two children and staying in love after the honeymoon ends.','/w3T9m6IdrcepbBIwWnCKxqtdvT8.jpg','2009-05-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Omar & Salma 2',57407,3.8907,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30847,_binary '\0','/k7AaqwQLNX7dZNYNeIeBHFRf9aB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1822302',6.1,1852,'en','Sassy Pants','Desperate to get out from under her overprotective mother, a home-schooled teen runs off to live with her dad, and forms a bond with his much-younger boyfriend.','/tvsrerkWadhBqQ9Gm0kXNuXkX6x.jpg','2012-10-26',87,'Released','In a family like this, someone has to wear them.','Sassy Pants',138907,1.7983,5.6,'qCa6aUZCi28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30848,_binary '\0','/rLgFk1j0QQVGqH2QjggdVJsFchJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1822395',4.2,2521,'en','Dropa','The hunt is on as a government assassin comes out of retirement to track down a killer extraterrestrial murdering the former members of his team in this science fiction thriller set in an alternate future America.','/day7ZzHVA4fVWkFp9LDGLqOUSD4.jpg','2019-12-06',101,'Released','They came in peace. They found us.','Dropa',652618,1.5449,5.2,'QJiszUQ2pUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30849,_binary '\0','/88J3AZ8R5U4JZqE9luHyR8bhsyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18224610',4.7,6145,'en','House of Darkness','Driving home to her secluded estate after meeting at a local bar, a player out to score thinks his beautiful, mysterious date will be another casual hook-up. While getting acquainted, their flirtation turns playful, sexy and sinister. Hoping to get lucky, his luck may have just run out.','/1udlXpDFZ4Rc52cX4jmYlOzQecH.jpg','2022-09-09',88,'Released','\"Once upon a time...\"','House of Darkness',942890,2.9884,5.014,'8mnuvcWZglY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30850,_binary '\0','/bAAOUDcLDV93cASAXtAxqOj8tO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18224682',6.1,1911,'en','Biggest Heist Ever','Their crimes earned them the nickname Bitcoin Bonnie and Clyde — and the story only gets weirder in this documentary about the most lucrative heist ever.','/wIS7g0i09afNbHQ9VHRnP8PErTs.jpg','2024-12-05',87,'Released',NULL,'Biggest Heist Ever',1391409,1.5936,6.1,'4yzcg2rtMnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30851,_binary '\0','/ru8H1c0vzYG4AwP9kEsW0yZ58jc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18224752',6.3,2250,'fr','Complètement Cramé !','Since his wife\'s death, Andrew Blake is depressed. In an ultimate impetus, he leaves London to go back to France, in the house he met her. This journey through happy days memories won\'t go as planned.','/hpszN3PHW9ubsKcrCia1g6y8mAr.jpg','2023-11-01',100,'Released','A tale of second chances, served with elegance','Mr. Blake at Your Service!',792614,4.3879,6.453,'CDEy129O6wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30852,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18226208',6.5,2191,'fa','علفزار','The truth carries a heavy burden, whether it is said that it sets off a storm, or it remains in the heart that disturbs man. Between telling the truth and revealing a secret or being silent and expedient, one is preferable to the other.','/t10lcx0IqUeW0cFtWkwvFOa0hIe.jpg','2022-02-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Dustland',933206,0.8284,5.6,'LqaXjDuJovc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30853,_binary '\0','/vGjUCw8pKjYi1dq2hwC5kdqkLhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1823059',5.6,5547,'en','A Perfect Ending','This intimate drama follows Rebecca, a woman who has kept her sexuality a secret from her friends but chooses to reveal it to a stranger. While Rebecca\'s revelations may not yield the results she expects, a perfect ending is still in reach.','/mjwWEwE1xdbtFGCOgeXi5jvQnOU.jpg','2012-06-01',110,'Released','It’s not always what you expect…','A Perfect Ending',107257,4.1318,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30854,_binary '\0','/vp8IUA3ZhnkeggkQUTQsffjj1SN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1823125',6,1859,'en','Greetings from Tim Buckley','A chronicle of the days leading up to Jeff Buckley\'s performance at his father\'s tribute concert in 1991.','/8fhvtgf2FVIfb2GBV0bekWKr973.jpg','2013-05-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Greetings from Tim Buckley',128073,0.1221,5.2,'pyPoTI-59HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30855,_binary '\0','/oQ2nVRKSes9N9cmlnfAT66OdecN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1823202',7.6,2465,'ru','Сибирь. Монамур','Siberia. Late autumn. In taiga, in the deserted village there lives an old man Ivan &amp; his seven-year-old grandson Leshia. A pack of feral dogs devours everything alive in the neighborhood. One of these dogs is Leshia\'s best friend. Sometimes their relative uncle Yuri brings food to them. Once on his way back from Ivan\'s village uncle Yuri is attacked by dogs &amp; perishes. Ivan &amp; Leshia stay without supply. Once Leshia witnesses Ivan shooting at \'his\' dog &amp; runs away. The old Man finds him in a dry well, but he fails to get him out on his own. Ivan sets out through taiga in search of help. Now the dogs are hunting him... And the boy is waiting for his father...','/xX2RW3TgUooYsQ5Cl704i9pQ2rO.jpg','2011-04-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Siberia, Monamour',80670,1.2955,6.9,'AcscUgVbdyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30856,_binary '\0','/4wc8Aw29TwGHpRnKCndw1ZiiH7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18233116',6.8,2457,'ml','1921: പുഴ മുതൽ പുഴ വരെ','Malabar Rebellion of 1921 and the anti-colonial uprising led by resistance leader Variyamkunnath Kunjahammed Haji.','/wJYrYyMCuGPe7BvbYEkjhpDmZhn.jpg','2022-08-13',192,'Released',NULL,'1921: Puzha Muthal Puzha Vare',1098424,0.9249,3.5,'eM3JCLwNhWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30857,_binary '\0','/z0cYoSjZ1sH9oKBDhJeQxlxIYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18235146',5.8,3949,'fr','Club Zero','Miss Novak joins the staff of an international boarding school to teach a conscious eating class and forms a strong bond with five students that eventually takes a dangerous turn.','/9BPVGkU51kUWk54YJl2BXDEdl9y.jpg','2023-09-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Club Zero',938250,2.7747,5.9,'Wrt2CjWWMnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30858,_binary '\0','/8FgFpyqpm5XZ8JpYXv6iHyQ7lKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18235306',6.9,2108,'ja','LOVE LIFE','Taeko and her husband, Jirō, are living a peaceful existence with her young son, Keita, when a tragic accident brings the boy\'s long-lost father, Park, back into her life. To cope with the pain and guilt, Taeko throws herself into helping this deaf and homeless man.','/5OSTURpAJCFsUydL6w4JPx48SSQ.jpg','2022-09-09',123,'Released',NULL,'Love Life',927594,2.7719,7.2,'F43IxG6xSsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30859,_binary '\0','/j3snmrxqxT60FrH1Z8i54fGnHZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1823664',5.4,43993,'en','Annie','Annie is a young, happy foster kid who\'s also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they\'d be back for her someday, it\'s been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything\'s about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he\'s her guardian angel, but Annie\'s self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it\'s the other way around.','/aKAM9V0izx4VhsdyAdBvAB26UCZ.jpg','2014-12-18',118,'Released','It\'s a hard knock life.','Annie',196867,8.7595,6.2,'nasLuiP-1E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30860,_binary '\0','/qX5T5GVAcq2UKaaiAx5SZp1AtlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1823672',6.8,285915,'en','Chappie','Every child comes into the world full of promise, and none more so than Chappie: he is gifted, special, a prodigy. Like any child, Chappie will come under the influence of his surroundings—some good, some bad—and he will rely on his heart and soul to find his way in the world and become his own man. But there\'s one thing that makes Chappie different from any one else: he is a robot.','/uuDUpzlMFomdSfNWlpEPS9nVZWV.jpg','2015-03-04',120,'Released','I am consciousness. I am alive. I am Chappie.','Chappie',198184,22.7136,6.792,'HhNshgSYF_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30861,_binary '\0','/AhFBR5fYeDhOKGriOBB54buraU2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1824254',6.9,8351,'en','We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks','Julian Assange. Bradley Manning. Collateral murder. Cablegate. WikiLeaks. These people and terms have exploded into public consciousness by fundamentally changing the way democratic societies deal with privacy, secrecy, and the right to information, perhaps for generations to come. We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks is an extensive examination of all things related to WikiLeaks and the larger global debate over access to information.','/tJHQbEtZSUry2QDbQcv8ziMt7Ib.jpg','2013-05-24',127,'Released','The truth has consequences.','We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks',159154,1.9239,6.5,'WUjA_hcYzzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30862,_binary '\0','/cE7ETf9dvVioIKY0rr5XgB7PEeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18246324',5.9,1835,'te','Kaalamega Karigindhi..?','A Light, Heartwarming, and conflict-less film on School Nostalgia with a poetic touch in its narration.','/87EOhP9TnaTlw1YyYjSYTiqpJsG.jpg','2025-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Kaalamega Karigindhi..?',1477943,0.8888,9.5,'F8nYD0C3hqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30863,_binary '\0','/aIUcjJ16VMCElh4sUARhT5fKosi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1824932',7,1277,'es','Canción sin nombre','Peru, at the height of the political crisis of the 1980s. Georgina is a young woman from the Andes whose newborn daughter is stolen at a fake health clinic. Her desperate search for the child leads her to the headquarters of a major newspaper, where she meets Pedro Campos, a lonely journalist who takes on the investigation. Based on a true story.','/dw7Gqz7ABdvFJUuNKICZCum2vEN.jpg','2020-01-23',97,'Released',NULL,'Song Without a Name',582925,1.3554,6.4,'Rrw0YmZDhic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30864,_binary '\0','/yYKglcHssuu5OmBn9SYIxxZZ9if.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18250130',6.5,2389,'ml','നെയ്മർ','Neymar tells the story of two friends who buy a Dog named Neymar.','/6fY7flm2T5jLnw19e1MiRvv60FH.jpg','2023-05-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Neymar',937053,1.819,5.385,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30865,_binary '\0','/19B3vwsPwLzHvSAo9uxC70QEkqW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1825157',6.4,55969,'en','The Double','An awkward office drone becomes increasingly unhinged after a charismatic and confident look-alike takes a job at his workplace and seduces the woman he desires.','/7kNcpmP1Pe9fWLKEbEOX5GEWueC.jpg','2014-04-03',93,'Released',NULL,'The Double',146015,5.0279,6.5,'_klCoDTHKGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30866,_binary '\0','/A3TdBjiLGWF5akBgQgG4LD8OGkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1825163',8,2414,'fr','Prêt-à-jeter','Once upon a time... consumer goods were built to last. Then, in the 1920’s, a group of businessmen realized that the longer their product lasted, the less money they made, thus Planned Obsolescence was born, and manufacturers have been engineering products to fail ever since. Combining investigative research and rare archive footage with analysis by those working on ways to save both the economy and the environment, this documentary charts the creation of ‘engineering to fail’, its rise to prominence and its recent fall from grace.','/fWBjMhFao7aT6c6q3opk0xAWose.jpg','2010-11-30',75,'Released','The untold story of Planned Obsolescence','The Light Bulb Conspiracy',61933,0.981,7.6,'251qoGOqpdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30867,_binary '\0','/tcPDv78HCW1BG8Inm1MCNsrcpRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18252340',4.8,1471,'en','Carnifex','An aspiring documentarian and two conservationists who venture into the Outback to record the animals displaced by bushfires where they discover a terrifying new species.','/wUiN09IRVhbDrffXbMuwmq9e4Tq.jpg','2022-12-01',93,'Released','Some species should remain extinct.','Carnifex',1024532,1.3806,5.4,'SFOQ98Vuuqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30868,_binary '\0','/b6ZJZHUdMEFECvGiDpJjlfUWela.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1825683',7.3,926267,'en','Black Panther','King T\'Challa returns home to the reclusive, technologically advanced African nation of Wakanda to serve as his country\'s new leader. However, T\'Challa soon finds that he is challenged for the throne by factions within his own country as well as without. Using powers reserved to Wakandan kings, T\'Challa assumes the Black Panther mantle to join with ex-girlfriend Nakia, the queen-mother, his princess-kid sister, members of the Dora Milaje (the Wakandan \'special forces\') and an American secret agent, to prevent Wakanda from being dragged into a world war.','/uxzzxijgPIY7slzFvMotPv8wjKA.jpg','2018-02-13',135,'Released','Long live the king.','Black Panther',284054,30.4405,7.362,'dxWvtMOGAhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30869,_binary '\0','/aPvIX46VtxZDwu5bB2UcJ7xdpxs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18257464',6.6,13217,'en','Polite Society','Martial artist-in-training Ria Khan believes she must save her older sister Lena from her impending marriage. After enlisting the help of her friends, Ria attempts to pull off the most ambitious of all wedding heists in the name of independence and sisterhood.','/Af1izSvHbGu6JiFTVzgfKxWQOfs.jpg','2023-04-27',104,'Released','Big trouble. Little sister.','Polite Society',977223,5.5243,6.3,'Bmx88shjiVo',