vcg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30901,_binary '\0','/3SXATaC4JZA8qxLyAUFjcq17BBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1828976',6.4,8298,'en','Good Luck Charlie, It\'s Christmas!','Teddy Duncan\'s middle-class family embarks on a road trip from their home in Denver to visit Mrs. Duncans Parents, the Blankenhoopers, in Palm Springs. When they find themselves stranded between Denver and Utah, they try to hitch a ride to Las Vegas with a seemingly normal older couple in a station wagon from Roswell, New Mexico. It turns out that the couple believes they are the victims of alien abduction. The Duncan\'s must resort to purchasing a clunker Yugo to get to Utah, have their luggage stolen in Las Vegas, and survive a zany Christmas with Grandpa and Grandma Blankenhooper.','/ecuJMYZM3HQ96mnWtmyXoHb7s7T.jpg','2011-12-02',80,'Released','For the Duncan family, Christmas is about to take a major detour.','Good Luck Charlie, It\'s Christmas!',81440,3.6759,6.7,'XcIEsTubRJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30902,_binary '\0','/xFADrLaDM7Lc9eJx9wI5pLqQVMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1828995',6.6,14447,'fr','La Délicatesse','A French woman mourning over the death of her husband three years prior is courted by a Swedish co-worker.','/1pc9cMMt7Hs4z8fOOzsOLe3MjNX.jpg','2011-12-20',108,'Released','Love can surprise you.','Delicacy',81342,5.0637,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30903,_binary '\0','/sL5D4VGH63JoTSgABiQZgsQvQ1V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1829012',5.3,25541,'en','Passion','The rivalry between the manipulative boss of an advertising agency and her talented protégée escalates from stealing credit to public humiliation to murder.','/o9DoB4Rsuc8wdkSZCJWB6fq9QPP.jpg','2013-02-13',101,'Released','No backstabbing. Just business.','Passion',109099,4.6064,5.206,'iV6BzEAZTUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30904,_binary '\0','/kC5d3MDJUvD6XrfPiOmcARLipDW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000',