television channel. He is nursing a heart break after his girlfriend dumped him for another guy. He attends the wedding of his girlfriend where he meets the another girl Nitya dumped by the groom (her boy friend). They hit off well and become instant friends. Nitya stays in Bangalore and Gowtam stays in Hyderabad. They keep bumping in to each other over a period of years. Though both these people like each other, the fate intervenes to separate them at crucial moments. The rest of the story is all about how this couple finally realises that they are made for each other after few years of courtship.','/cKX4ySefAsNhMDb2TbjLyLBCsi3.jpg','2011-01-21',136,'Released','A Crazy Story','Ala Modalaindi',57010,1.4157,6.706,'sl9ScX6kHRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30909,_binary '\0','/r1xx1HzUxlSozLFjlewPmMirgNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18305194',6.9,2555,'ta','தி ஸ்மைல் மேன்','A police officer who is diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s disease must solve one last case before he loses all his memories. He must run against time to catch the notorious serial killer who he believes has a mysterious role in his own personal life.','/p8J4IroY8tzRrtEckuetnMKLc42.jpg','2024-12-27',121,'Released',NULL,'The Smile Man',942386,1.28,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30910,_binary '\0','/3GTSbc85Xangv8JkBSsQZMXGyhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1830643',4.5,8138,'en','Death of Me','A couple on holiday on a remote South Pacific island awaken one morning with a hang over and no recollection of what transpired. When playing back a video of the previous night, they see they participated in a local ritual that somehow ends with him murdering her.','/8F9xUvb1JMWUMkFV2Yq3aiueAbq.jpg','2020-10-02',95,'Released','True love takes sacrifice.','Death of Me',595149,3.511,4.986,'mxKoOGstEmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30911,_binary '\0','/7BOTTnRZ5kT0UV5FECrxfqbaW1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1830713',5.3,8262,'en','Big Ass Spider!','When a giant alien spider escapes from a military lab and rampages across the city of Los Angeles, it is up to one clever exterminator and his security guard sidekick to kill the creature before the entire city is destroyed.','/uW4ayPN4B1mjrwb3OURRy0m9Hh7.jpg','2013-10-17',81,'Released',NULL,'Big Ass Spider!',166822,3.7757,5.58,'TSlNiSEWqwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30912,_binary '\0','/oSDq3SOC5nzma3UzBW4gM47r0v1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1830786',3.1,4098,'hi','रास्कल्स','Two rival con-men attempt to outdo each other to woo a wealthy woman.','/qmxNVBW0Yl4pVeo6jjVFlMS7RJC.jpg','2011-10-06',128,'Released',NULL,'Rascals',75896,1.2219,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30913,_binary '\0','/mO8UMrxwVEodMPGhYfgSiTxqjsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1830792',7,3650,'de','Romeos','Lukas, 20, is a prisoner in his own body. As a pre-op transgender person, he is constantly finding himself trapped in uncomfortable, compromising positions. His best friend, Ine introduces him to the gay scene in Cologne where he meets the confident and gorgeous, Fabio. The two develop a romantic relationship that tests the boundaries of love. ROMEOS forgoes stereotypes and conventions to offer an honest and humorous examination of the most basic of human conditions: friendship, sex, and love.','/4ZT0P15q4pbVafS8aAeAnweu6uo.jpg','2011-12-08',94,'Released','How do you love someone, if you don\'t show who you are?','Romeos',81704,1.9136,6.8,'ZHFjDJzrjGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30914,_binary '\0','/l9LYfu2KzA62wwRlCB5VqADoGmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1830802',8.3,2099,'mr','Shala','Set in the 70\'s in rural India, four 9th grade kids were writing their destiny. Joshi (14) is madly in love with Shirodkar (14) a beautiful Indian looking girl. Both study in the same class. The age old question \"What is love anyway?\"','/5OeDB3LhNuFPmxewBMphNd9EoIZ.jpg','2011-01-20',108,'Released','“I miss you so much at home”','Shala',90532,1.5245,7.5,'6IFxDCci564','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30915,_binary '\0','/bWF5ImUscXXYia8owpm8coadR4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18312380',5.3,11588,'en','Primitive War','During the Vietnam War, a recon unit ventures to an isolated jungle valley to uncover the fate of a missing platoon. They soon find themselves in a fight for their lives against an unexpected enemy — prehistoric dinosaurs.','/noujgznyJIaurEinZhcSVzTmkLo.jpg','2025-08-21',135,'Released','This ain\'t no walk in the park.','Primitive War',1257009,12.5919,6.565,'NfMKBKKzIXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30916,_binary '\0','/h6COxpZ6M69UNfdfcXMD0Mcj3kR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18313356',6,1755,'en','Jericho Ridge','North Washington county sheriff Tabby finds herself alone in the sheriff’s office one night while her colleagues are out on patrol, but she soon finds out they’ve been set up by a murderous drug cartel while she herself comes under siege at the office, where she must battle desperately to save herself and her son.','/lWd3qpJAVcDNQEpphqDzjTwRgH2.jpg','2024-04-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Jericho Ridge',969926,1.5844,6.2,'RJVmW7oYhAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30917,_binary '\0','/ifoZ1yHUS0InDRwhe5LT2TLUmsQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18313970',6.3,1450,'en','Feeling Butterflies','When you need butterflies for your wedding or birthday, there’s only one woman to call: Emily Mariposa. It’s what her business ‘Feeling Butterflies Inc.\' is all about – and right now, business is good! In fact it’s so good, Emily and her business partner Adam are struggling to keep up with demand.','/eSduohMZEVQHmYQKFFTkDi2ko6C.jpg','2022-03-01',85,'Released','Emily\'s butterfly business is taking off – and so\'s her love life!','Feeling Butterflies',927755,1.2872,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30918,_binary '\0','/qE3QIUTvoAeZZlCv0xlxFhsVMPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.0