y workout video. After being ridiculed by her co-stars, Phoebe befriends a mafia princess wild child, who teaches her how to murder her way to the top.','/r2gIabMJ5CFAP086ss4YwjvASf0.jpg','2023-07-08',84,'Released','The deadliest aerobics video ever made.','Murdercise',1005004,1.4483,3.7,'XimU55yGJ6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30936,_binary '\0','/xEn2SqJQ2uBAxSBfrcAqgiFDQCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18353064',5.7,5184,'tr','Boğa Boğa','Evading a scandal, a couple from Istanbul starts over in a town on the Aegean coast — but quickly discover the locals are determined to get rid of them.','/s0VMKl4eB0KdQr2jPavPum5tVNP.jpg','2023-04-21',112,'Released',NULL,'Chokehold',944152,2.18,5.561,'D3A9wFAIhac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30937,_binary '\0','/oO3cPfvjiKwxdjguOPlhgZnslA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18357588',6.8,1643,'th','เร็วโหด..เหมือนโกรธเธอ','When a world champion of sport stacking is dumped by his long-time girlfriend, he has to learn basic adulting skills in order to live alone and take care of himself.','/lwkrv2C1CH0OICYDkvTAsXXh8uG.jpg','2022-04-06',132,'Released','An action movie about daily life. Feel the speed. Feel the love.','Fast & Feel Love',889741,2.0557,6.757,'pg_Ij-3YySM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30938,_binary '\0','/ankMobVAIpizlNagjfRiaNaZ7lR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1835955',5.2,2487,'en','Errors of the Human Body','Canadian scientist, Dr Geoff Burton takes up a position at a new institute in wintry Dresden in order to contribute to their most important project—a human regeneration gene—that also has the potential to make something miraculous out of a personal tragedy that has haunted him for years.','/yDQpXQqmce6vSi43bHR0Wx3EJW2.jpg','2012-09-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Errors of the Human Body',121565,1.8243,5.2,'jFGjlZ0f16U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30939,_binary '\0','/5btPLADkUW3gxzIs25VdqRAOMtB.jpg','2026-10-0