gOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839482',5.6,2620,'en','Free Ride','A single mom in the 1970s raises her two daughters and becomes involved in illegal drug trade to make a better life.','/9vuDdLXgyjhiuqi0MiE66XvnbEg.jpg','2013-10-10',86,'Released','Crime pays... or it costs you everything.','Free Ride',240881,1.596,5.3,'DDXwY8yGr1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30973,_binary '\0','/4EqTcyWfO807ihMzGHequR7x1Co.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839492',7.2,109832,'en','Ruby Sparks','Calvin is a young novelist who achieved phenomenal success early in his career but is now struggling with his writing – as well as his romantic life. Finally, he makes a breakthrough and creates a character named Ruby who inspires him. When Calvin finds Ruby, in the flesh, sitting on his couch about a week later, he is completely flabbergasted that his words have turned into a living, breathing person.','/zELurt0GVRkR5X5ymuk7KXUxhC8.jpg','2012-07-25',104,'Released','She\'s Out Of His Mind.','Ruby Sparks',103332,7.5245,7.11,'xb3_AE-UinY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30974,_binary '\0','/gB8eFFUw6UA97A7TzrNVrc3D08o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839494',7.1,18782,'ja','星を追う子ども','The film centers on Asuna, a young girl who spends her solitary days listening to the mysterious music emanating from the crystal radio she received from her late father as a memento. One day while walking home she is attacked by a fearsome monster and saved by a mysterious boy named Shun. However, Shun disappears and Asuna embarks on a journey of adventure to the land of Agartha with her teacher Mr. Morisaki to meet a Shun again. Through her journey she comes to know the cruelty and beauty of the world, as well as loss.','/8RE7Zz9oTzOeMcahqm74AWkOVpV.jpg','2011-05-07',116,'Released','A journey to say goodbye.','Children Who Chase Lost Voices',79707,5.452,7.239,'tmHo_0mgos0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30975,_binary '\0','/8HXhqBkETYijmTs2zHoGdFyUqr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839522',7.7,5380,'sr','Кругови','Circles (Serbian: Krugovi) is a Serbian movie based on the true story of a Serbian soldier who risked his life to protect a Muslim civilian during the war in Bosnia. During the war in Bosnia in 1993, a Serbian soldier pays for his life after protecting a Muslim civilian from being attacked by three other soldiers. 12 years later, the consequences of this act of heroism are still having their repercussions.','/sT4BErYqu2SjwsHGoE99KtpxsOM.jpg','2013-02-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Circles',110919,1.3699,7.066,'TgaE7y8QjT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30976,_binary '\0','/woX12iknroma60mvrYj6aLID84z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839590',7.5,1408,'en','Ray Harryhausen: Special Effects Titan','There’s only one person who so accurately personifies movie magic in the history of film, and that man is special effects maestro Ray Harryhausen. Focusing on the man behind the landmark effects on films like Clash Of The Titans, One Million Years B.C., Jason And The Argonauts and many more, this in-depth film features interviews with the great man himself, and with an array of animators and directors influenced by his work including Guillermo del Toro, Peter Jackson, Nick Park, Terry Gilliam, James Cameron and Steven Spielberg. The film also features unseen footage of tests and experiments recently uncovered.','/7feAu14viNcTACirNdmqtlQ4DFH.jpg','2012-09-29',90,'Released','The world\'s biggest directors, the best special effects artists, pay tribute to...','Ray Harryhausen: Special Effects Titan',146490,2.1228,7.4,'EUu1uyeG6rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30977,_binary '\0','/o24QvDPvSuCxNJjgbs6ulR9nGXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839591',5.2,6279,'en','Recoil','A cop turns vigilante after his family is murdered, exacting vengeance on the killers - and then on all criminals who have slipped through the system.','/5K0EDKAP4OvmCujhwdc8gVxbPT0.jpg','2012-04-16',94,'Released','They each have a score to settle.','Recoil',91333,3.112,5.7,'njmF5r4rSxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30978,_binary '\0','/3UseBwzKsUmMN37XcahJSVYRWkf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839596',7.8,56297,'hi','Rockstar','College student Janardhan is a simpleton who desperately seeks inspiration for the musician inside him. Although heartbreak helps him reach his goal, it also leads him to self-destruction.','/cJZC9riwrdATBUonkZJZD6y9g40.jpg','2011-11-11',159,'Released','Beyond the limits of right and wrong.','Rockstar',79464,2.3835,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30979,_binary '\0','/47iDObIEsSVomrtmO9ju9dPfJ4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839642',6.2,6266,'en','The Face of Love','A widow falls for a guy who bears a striking resemblance to her late husband.','/fpCHgbltugwZpoTfXsyKxL6Ersa.jpg','2013-10-25',92,'Released','She lost her perfect love... until she found his perfect double.','The Face of Love',214086,2.9579,6.101,'6cA3RAUs8LY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30980,_binary '\0','/fM4TVNg27IBCYAz8FUiLefWck1p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1839654',7,22578,'en','The Magic of Belle Isle','In an effort to tap into his original talent, a wheelchair-bound author moves to a rural town, where he befriends a single mother and her three kids, who help reignite his passion for writing.','/imoZLjmCnfG4f69Dq0f2Zsr9XOR.jpg','2012-07-06',109,'Released','A re-coming of age story.','The Magic of Belle Isle',101731,5.4263,6.962,'R54gkgDk_M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30981,_binary '\0','/bgkFOoXEQMRjKkCvgoj7smdGbuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1840309',6.6,522901,'en','Divergent','In a world divided into factions based on personality types, Tris learns that she\'s been classified as Divergent and won\'t fit in. When she discovers a plot to destroy Divergents, Tris and the mysterious Four must find out what makes Divergents dangerous before it\'s too late.','/aNh4Q3iuPKDMPi2SL7GgOpiLukX.jpg','2014-03-14',140,'Released','What makes you different makes you dangerous.','Divergent',157350,17.6381,6.899,'WI1Jqx47Uw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30982,_binary '\0','/eIDU9RFFapzrfV0fjYtr5lzf04J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1840372',6.6,2505,'ja','名探偵コナン 沈黙の15分（クォーター）','The explosion of a new Tokyo Subway line leads Conan and his friends in a snow-clad village. Here, after eight years, the little detective sheds light on the dynamics behind the shocking event that caused the death of a woman and the coma of a 15-year-old boy. Under the beautiful snow, Conan gets involved in something bigger than him.','/9bNsqXpPKSdcqPeBgWg9HsrwYJe.jpg','2011-04-16',109,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Quarter of Silence',77617,8.2652,7.1,'JiM5Yi7xqe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30983,_binary '\0','/rjHCwgSKOcmqk8EJeEOc7e44dPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1840388',4.6,4049,'en','Rosewood Lane','Radio talk show therapist Sonny Blake moves back to her childhood home on seemingly idyllic Rosewood Lane after her alcoholic father dies. But upon arrival in the old neighborhood, Sonny discovers her neighbors are terrified of the local paperboy. She thinks this is ridiculous, until she encounters the boy himself. It turns out that he is a cunning and dangerous sociopath, one who may have gruesomely killed her father - and others.','/7iv2Akvi4kO0taSUL0ujewgLJ0l.jpg','2011-10-15',97,'Released','Evil dwells in the most unlikely places','Rosewood Lane',86759,2.0914,4.7,'JjLrWn2VZqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30984,_binary '\0','/b0GGZbLB7P9r4klx1wUcz77WzE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1840417',7,85158,'en','The Words','The Words follows young writer Rory Jansen who finally achieves long sought after literary success after publishing the next great American novel. There\'s only one catch - he didn\'t write it. As the past comes back to haunt him and his literary star continues to rise, Jansen is forced to confront the steep price that must be paid for stealing another man\'s work, and for placing ambition and success above life\'s most fundamental three words.','/aJtPLZS7tlpiQl6pEr8H42K565x.jpg','2012-09-07',102,'Released','There\'s more than one way to take a life.','The Words',83686,5.0093,6.7,'lTlh70mx-eM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30985,_binary '\0','/lBeROrAwwPUXEiALmg7mMapNAll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1840911',6.4,5562,'es','El sexo de los ángeles','Carla and Bruno believe they have answers for everything until Rai appears in their lives, an attractive and mysterious young who lives outsidethe rules. In this story about love and friendship, boundaries dissolve by the rhythm of funkyand break to offer a provocative, exciting and deeply touching vision about romantic relationships.','/syUzYJh4GaqoY6lRKBtlnFUqoYa.jpg','2012-05-04',105,'Released','All beautiful and all in love, but this not heaven...','Angels of Sex',104634,3.2031,6.3,'D7yi0RjOX2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30986,_binary '\0','/kqSxCsGIT4rqrZTTMpYP8RIzojv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18411490',5.6,56942,'hi','टाइगर 3','Spy couple Tiger and Zoya face a ruthless enemy with a personal vendetta.','/7wgED7Yx9VLcNWSO91VgwicHmMD.jpg','2023-11-11',150,'Released','This time, it\'s personal.','Tiger 3',720557,4.8267,5.64,'9Xmfb5hmlfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30987,_binary '\0','/zXyLGVReHhoBfLjhkq6oteyJGH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18411838',3.5,1644,'en','Woman in the Maze','A young woman rents a cursed house, forcing her to solve the mystery to find a way out.','/pwTrBeqYyzTdj59fbferFWUIdLx.jpg','2023-10-06',101,'Released','She can get in, but can she get out?','Woman in the Maze',1145028,1.3735,3.9,'_oDu7glocZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(30988,_binary '\0','/iYqSQaWDttQIQzsxg9xHyg0bttG.jpg','2026-10