story of the Foo Fighters: from the band\'s very first songs created as cassette demos Dave Grohl recorded during his tenure as Nirvana\'s drummer, through its ascent to their Grammy-winning, multi-platinum, arena and stadium headlining status as one of the biggest rock bands on the planet.','/9t11iPy8Mo5O4yHorqcKXXDLwtt.jpg','2011-04-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Foo Fighters: Back and Forth',61488,1.7528,7.6,'zBArTIXhUcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31051,_binary '\0','/2vc5hXc4pMXcKOOsOuyI2MQ1AdK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1853614',7.2,8898,'ja','ももへの手紙','A shy 11-year-old\'s life takes a strange turn when she discovers three hungry goblins living in the attic of her new house. She misses her old life. She misses her father so very much. Until she makes some new ghoulish friends.','/uH4c5t3Wzzv41Wq9ws2Q47N1Dzo.jpg','2012-04-21',120,'Released','A letter that ties the bond between them.','A Letter to Momo',100271,4.4346,7.4,'p93ArHyvzLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31052,_binary '\0','/tJfBEBVygt5eJN1EFRdOfi7LqCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1853643',5.5,7771,'en','Why Stop Now?','When a college piano prodigy tries to check his mother into rehab, he is taken hostage by her drug dealer and swept along on a wild adventure.','/xEaVD2RJADGWUhlBkhGV0vQoHrP.jpg','2012-08-17',88,'Released','A Funny Thing Happened on the Way to Rehab.','Why Stop Now?',118677,2.4186,5.4,'RsmcVU4HdKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31053,_binary '\0','/2oZklIzUbvZXXzIFzv7Hi68d6xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1853728',8.5,1913381,'en','Django Unchained','With the help of a German bounty hunter, a freed slave sets out to rescue his wife from a brutal Mississippi plantation owner.','/7oWY8VDWW7thTzWh3OKYRkWUlD5.jpg','2012-12-25',165,'Released','Life, liberty, and the pursuit of vengeance.','Django Unchained',68718,41.2318,8.2,'_iH0UBYDI4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31054,_binary '\0','/okjEw4GrEqn4seWkvUHIUXogQZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1853739',6.6,120659,'en','You\'re Next','When the Davison family comes under attack during their wedding anniversary getaway, the gang of mysterious killers soon learns that one of their victims harbors a secret talent for fighting back.','/l163jakfKvchUTVTtBi0KA7ZhIc.jpg','2013-08-22',94,'Released','Did you remember to lock your door?','You\'re Next',83899,8.2878,6.595,'3ZKQU0YYkNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31055,_binary '\0','/wlNvuEelOmUZpAbCuAn7kEADpps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854236',6.5,15515,'da','Den skaldede frisør','Ida, a Danish hairdresser who has lost her hair to cancer, returns home from the hospital one day to find her husband is cheating on her. She decides to travel to Italy on her own for her daughter\'s wedding, but discovers on arriving that the wedding gathering will present its own challenges.','/nKeCYHHG8LCv2RuOpgS8jkRyihT.jpg','2012-09-06',116,'Released','It started when everything was over.','Love Is All You Need',126250,3.6411,6,'afvT_XOlpro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31056,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854506',1.5,1790,'en','Aliens vs Avatars','Six college friends blowing off steam on a camping trip, find themselves caught up in a cat and mouse hunt with an Alien monster. Not knowing what to do or who to trust, they struggle to protect themselves. Reluctantly, they join forces with another, seemingly friendly, alien, Ava, who orbits the Earth and appears to them in the form of an avatar. Having only one chance at stopping the monster, they must race to locate and repair the Ava’s earth sent robot, before it slaughters them one by one.','/bgwYgUeAMvy6PZXLSDrWy9dlUEQ.jpg','2011-09-20',80,'Released',NULL,'Aliens vs Avatars',79582,1.2927,3,'p_EIrbGgprw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31057,_binary '\0','/t0nhS1KT2peBPQWRY6mcsxhmWJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854513',7.5,12217,'es','Blancanieves','A black and white silent movie, based on the Snow White fairy tale, that is set in a romantic version of 1920s Seville and centered on a female bullfighter.','/yJzYcX23DdwR6S4XBEy1SDdiApe.jpg','2012-09-28',104,'Released','Never take your eyes off the bull','Blancanieves',127864,2.0296,7.2,'yNlG0nAxX9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31058,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854524',8,1389,'tr','Ekümenopolis: Ucu Olmayan Şehir','Ecumenopolis: City Without Limits\" tells the story of Istanbul and other Mega-Cities on a neo-liberal course to destruction. It follows the story of a migrant family from the demolition of their neighborhood to their on-going struggle for housing rights. The film takes a look at the city on a macro level and through the eyes of experts, going from the tops of mushrooming skyscrapers to the depths of the railway tunnel under the Bosphorous strait; from the historic neighborhoods in the south to the forests in the north; from isolated islands of poverty to the villas of the rich. It\'s an Istanbul going from 15 million to 30 million. It\'s an Istanbul going from 2 million cars to 8 million. It\'s the Istanbul of the future that will soon engulf the entire region. It\'s an Istanbul nobody has ever seen before.','/9dbicT9xVs73XZbq7mFE1i9jX0N.jpg','2011-04-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Ecumenopolis: City Without Limits',168339,1.1294,7.6,'XEzqu_z9fRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31059,_binary '\0','/fvrGb6zfQaQ8RD9pC8o9vv1b7W2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854564',5.7,135858,'en','Percy Jackson: Sea of Monsters','In their quest to confront the ultimate evil, Percy and his friends battle swarms of mythical creatures to find the mythical Golden Fleece and to stop an ancient evil from rising.','/tAu90qEpLqwqiZLsMqpaMVr55oN.jpg','2013-08-07',106,'Released','Where There Are Gods, There Are Monsters.','Percy Jackson: Sea of Monsters',76285,7.5336,6.03,'M4MNNw9ZhrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31060,_binary '\0','/kbKA4XRfKQkvjVPmC9U5tAQuAEg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854568',6.1,1630,'fr','Notre paradis','Vassili is an aged prostitute with killer instincts. He finds an unconscious young man in the Forest of Boulogne and takes him home. Now lovers and accomplices, the two men become a couple in prostitution and steal from their clients. And yet, menaces of retaliation leave the couple with no choice but to escape from Paris. The runaway begins...','/gTzG5MMIkupuluwhppFcgVz5ohp.jpg','2011-09-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Our Paradise',99119,2.3623,5.9,'3g_di0DVb4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31061,_binary '\0','/mHtc3uRWWEtri6unqCogHHBJRAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1854582',4.2,2559,'en','The Helpers','Seven friends from Sacramento, California head out on a documented road trip to Las Vegas. Their trip takes a very unexpected turn for the worse when their back tires mysteriously blow out. A couple miles down the road, they find a little gas station Diner/Motel, run by the most friendly, polite and \"helpful\" people. It appears that their problems are solved, but boy are they wrong! When convinced by \"The Helpers\" to stay overnight, the friends all wake up in their rooms to a new kind of gruesome and bloody terror!','/5YEzcIGM4TFSdG9fllCLx4ZMDK5.jpg','2012-10-27',81,'Released','Can we help you?','The Helpers',114635,1.2487,4,'HjG4ijJ75Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31062,_binary '\0','/fx6c2UuNnXPwuRvu4tGaJJJITT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18550140',7.3,32558,'fa','عنکبوت مقدس','A journalist descends into the dark underbelly of the Iranian holy city of Mashhad as she investigates the serial killings of sex workers by the so called \"Spider Killer\", who believes he is cleansing the streets of sinners.','/6ObJ4x7m1F5QRY06WzOxNJQHwGb.jpg','2022-07-13',118,'Released',NULL,'Holy Spider',889699,4.0491,7.252,'27wZZ6O1IBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31063,_binary '\0','/bGfbeZ52aqTvxde9pjyC62jaSUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18550182',7.2,6953,'ro','R.M.N.','A few days before Christmas, having quit his job in Germany, Matthias returns to his Transylvanian village. He wishes to involve himself more in the education of his son, Rudi, left for too long in the care of his mother, Ana, and to rid him of the unresolved fears that have gripped him. He’s also eager to see his ex-lover Csilla and preoccupied about his old father, Otto. When a few new workers are hired at the small factory that Csilla manages, the peace of the community is disturbed, underlying fears grip the adults, and frustrations, conflicts and passions erupt through the thin sliver of apparent understanding and calm.','/7zGDc1sWKlfYb6bKs2s2JaU4jLl.jpg','2022-06-03',125,'Released',NULL,'R.M.N.',919570,2.6425,7,'0fROZfFTpD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31064,_binary '\0','/cZo3IX1j2ABMzBUpobjWEtNuyVa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18550220',7,3663,'fr','Chien de la casse','Childhood pals Dog and Mirales live in a little village in the south of France and spend their days just hanging out. To kill time, Mirales has got into the habit of teasing Dog mercilessly. But this summer is different: Dog meets Elsa and romance blossoms.','/gxXAW8rqZQLNDcyzZD0vp3Wmgc8.jpg','2023-04-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Junkyard Dog',957608,2.6232,6.9,'tCv83D3CQOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31065,_binary '\0','/wK2D1OAodmCWtaPxybcBFCLRskF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1855199',7.6,296185,'en','End of Watch','Two young officers are marked for death after confiscating a small cache of money and firearms from the members of a notorious cartel during a routine traffic stop.','/pDeVKQICkcdwwjHxGj0MeS14YJ6.jpg','2012-09-20',109,'Released','Every moment of your life they stand watch.','End of Watch',77016,11.1148,7.362,'9HTSDmf0BI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31066,_binary '\0','/aP4N50cMgY2tzTciwHj13rKu6H6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1855236',5.5,3060,'en','Just Like a Woman','Two women get on the highway heading to Santa Fe. Marilyn dreams of winning a contest held by a famous belly dancing company, while her friend, Mona, has a darker secret.','/pk394wl8XZyc41fbo6Kc1gVfWG.jpg','2013-03-07',105,'Released','two friends - one journey - no limits','Just Like a Woman',150093,1.8757,5.5,'-pFPQNUyZAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31067,_binary '\0','/mLgFebdy051NX1vfFrpuUPRQHgg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1855325',5.3,160678,'en','Resident Evil: Retribution','The Umbrella Corporation’s deadly T-virus continues to ravage the Earth, transforming the global population into legions of the flesh eating Undead. The human race’s last and only hope, Alice, awakens in the heart of Umbrella’s most clandestine operations facility and unveils more of her mysterious past as she delves further into the complex. Without a safe haven, Alice continues to hunt those responsible for the outbreak; a chase that takes her from Tokyo to New York, Washington, D.C. and Moscow, culminating in a mind-blowing revelation that will force her to rethink everything that she once thought to be true. Aided by new found allies and familiar friends, Alice must fight to survive long enough to escape a hostile world on the brink of oblivion. The countdown has begun.','/ohdUDWVlcbuWphaLu6wS91xdJ73.jpg','2012-09-12',95,'Released','Evil goes global.','Resident Evil: Retribution',71679,2.8001,5.83,'hoyMT-7wEqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31068,_binary '\0','/qylFMbocdDIiC0uE2Fnw1nL7mWT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1855401',5.4,11096,'en','Tim and Eric\'s Billion Dollar Movie','Two guys get a billion dollars to make a movie, only to watch their dream run off course.','/bcipzEhr7xh9bfvqLq3iqJjnFdk.jpg','2012-03-02',94,'Released','It\'s got shrim!','Tim and Eric\'s Billion Dollar Movie',79