44,'EDDj_0A_4Ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31073,_binary '\0','/xwMI3XD4EvQtLcBCGUoGx0TBWwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18558306',6.7,4984,'es','Los delincuentes','Morán works as a clerk in a bank in Buenos Aires. He is as good as invisible to his colleagues. Over dinner with his colleague Román, Morán tells him that he stole exactly $650,000, which is exactly double what he would have made until his retirement. He plans to turn himself in, but not before offering Román to split the money if agrees to hide it for the duration of his incarceration.','/3AWh0IKlyjIdG8IX5N8a9eE7Yey.jpg','2023-10-16',190,'Released','Steal back your life.','The Delinquents',714889,1.8763,6.4,'KacoBtvgcT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31074,_binary '\0','/iPHsjvbFyGbeCEDC7u8Ib8U1zS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18559464',6.9,48800,'en','My Old Ass','An 18th birthday mushroom trip brings free-spirited Elliott face-to-face with her wisecracking 39-year-old self. But when Elliott’s \"old ass\" starts handing out warnings about what her younger self should and shouldn\'t do, Elliott realizes she has to rethink everything about family, love, and what\'s becoming a transformative summer.','/yUs4Sw9AyTg2sA1qWBkNpD2mGSj.jpg','2024-09-13',89,'Released','What would you ask your older self?','My Old Ass',947891,6.918,6.79,'Yvks3SeCDOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31075,_binary '\0','/uFvYlyWN24gxkDIaWEmMuQMYbqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18559720',3.3,1268,'en','The OctoGames','Eight contestants compete in eight deadly, classic children\'s games. They seek fame beyond their wildest dreams, competing for the chance to take over the YouTube channel of the famous yet elusive masked content creator known only as \"JaxPro\".','/qGz5rffXhegQH5PGUDiObqoOt06.jpg','2022-10-07',88,'Released','8 Games. 8 Players. 1 Winner.','The OctoGames',1028703,1.736,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31076,_binary '\0','/xm8CxKBa2DHonoVjhRu6pTLgRUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18559904',6.3,8092,'te','మిస్టర్ ప్రెగ్నెంట్','Gautham, a renowned tattoo artist marries his love Mahi,under the condition that they won\'t have children. When Mahi becomes pregnant, Gautham, who strongly dislikes kids, struggles with this situation and surprisingly decides to carry the baby himself.','/sIBUiSfRDQj8YkkpHcEieXDpayD.jpg','2023-08-18',142,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Pregnant',1166642,0.7559,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31077,_binary '\0','/iH0g7qR4qxy9Wmft8TOBfTdE8Ux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856014',6.3,9132,'sv','Hamilton - I nationens intresse','Carl Hamilton manages to infiltrate an international gang that has stolen advanced Swedish GPS-guided missiles. But the league is subjected to a sudden deadly attack by a well drilled group of mercenaries of unknown clients. Hamilton escapes the massacre, but the rockets have disappeared without a trace.','/nlV09Qmr7NKnObi6COPXn13T1Og.jpg','2012-03-02',109,'Released',NULL,'Hamilton: In the Interest of the Nation',82450,3.1045,6.1,'2y-br2NyKO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31078,_binary '\0','/8wapci0gWZ5U6zyKthhLQa2cALr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18560202',7.3,1282,'pt','Mussum, o Filmis','The trajectory of Antônio Carlos Bernardes Gomes, known as Mussum, from Trapalhões. His poor childhood, his military career, his relationship with Mangueira and his success with the group Originais do Samba, as well as behind the scenes as a member of Trapalhões.','/olETegpIsLwrApT1ldOKIwFE8lY.jpg','2023-11-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Mussum, o Filmis',937949,1.383,7.735,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31079,_binary '\0','/aLyFETNQARNuelOYSJKS7IdRlvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856047',5.6,3900,'sv','Hamilton 2 - Men inte om det gäller din dotter','Swedish intelligence officer Carl Hamilton\'s 7-year-old goddaughter Nathalie is kidnapped. When the kidnapping\'s underlying motive becomes known, the Swedish authorities assume a passive role, forcing Hamilton to action. With the help of international contacts, Hamilton manages to get them on track. Hamilton, along with some military colleagues, plans a daring rescue mission.','/scJMZBuy8dGBukYDbPLVVzS66X7.jpg','2012-09-07',86,'Released',NULL,'Hamilton 2: But Not If It Concerns Your Daughter',147655,2.219,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31080,_binary '\0','/awmmXbzrjoROdgDekXPEM5eS1A4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856053',5.7,1570,'fi','Niko 2: Lentäjäveljekset','Set right before Christmas, young reindeer Niko must deal with his mother\'s remarriage and his being tasked with looking after his little stepbrother.','/2PV2XJG8ZD8E6iVlV9mRBh3Gb0t.jpg','2012-10-12',79,'Released','Small things come in big packages','Niko 2: Little Brother, Big Trouble',141614,3.207,5.9,'FBETLCp2KjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31081,_binary '\0','/laQAm6xswJQBb5KAfS7H3rPh1Bk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856057',6.6,1830,'fr','Phantom Boy','At a hospital in New York, Alex, a police officer, meets Leo, a boy who has the ability to get out of his body and pass through the walls like a ghost. Both team up with Mary, an intrepid journalist, to capture a disfigured villain who terrorizes the city.','/AlCyvatuIXehWMFrhqR4QE1ZIt.jpg','2015-10-14',82,'Released','My name is Leo and I have a secret','Phantom Boy',356161,2.1274,6.993,'n3Q1PvD3twY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31082,_binary '\0','/gub9e0qRZWmmzTV77A6T95HELIF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856080',7,30848,'en','The Boys in the Boat','The triumphant underdog story of the University of Washington men\'s rowing team, who stunned the world by competing at the 1936 Berlin Olympics.','/ncJMztHprw3gLRAnDjNnnT23CIt.jpg','2023-12-25',123,'Released','Believe in the impossible. Believe in each other.','The Boys in the Boat',823452,6.7524,7.238,'dfEA-udzjjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31083,_binary '\0','/gNdLJU9TxrpGx4dkZidjys3fyy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1856101',8,768756,'en','Blade Runner 2049','Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what\'s left of society into chaos. K\'s discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years.','/gajva2L0rPYkEWjzgFlBXCAVBE5.jpg','2017-10-04',164,'Released','The key to the future is finally unearthed.','Blade Runner 2049',335984,85.983,7.607,'dZOaI_Fn5o4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31084,_binary '\0','/qM8l22fZGX4jXAg9tbJKNWyjICM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18561380',1.2,9949,'tr','Müjde','After losing her home and all that she\'s known, a widowed Turkish woman finds herself in an unexpected love affair with a young Syrian refugee in Istanbul.','/ayBYXpNf2c2csJIy7WLdL0fG3tV.jpg','2022-03-16',48,'Released',NULL,'Miracle',950029,0.7411,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31085,_binary '\0','/8DJefIN5uIiJ4k9xr6kGPfa68l3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18561446',6.1,1617,'en','Moon Garden','A comatose five-year-old girl journeys through a dark industrial dreamscape, following her mother\'s voice on a transistor radio to find her way back to consciousness.','/jEwxATA59b3StO8WiNdX9YfRwwg.jpg','2023-05-19',96,'Released','Journey beyond the dark.','Moon Garden',977000,1.2827,6.2,'ZY2z3kasg0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31086,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18561466',6.6,1395,'gu','ગજબ થઇ ગયો!','Sheth Kapurchand Mangaldas Vidyalaya is one of the last existing Gujarati medium schools. Principal of the school wants to preserve his heritage and is struggling with changing world. Enter Bhagirath, who is a post graduate from Princeton University and offers to teach the students for free. Vishwa, principal\'s daughter and a teacher herself doesn\'t trust Bhagirath as his teaching methods are unconventional. Bhaga, Vishwa and students- Anant, Paheli, Virat travel to nearby village and their journey begins to achieve the goal.','/brTxylT2EfAfTcxxBTLHhu5msjY.jpg','2022-04-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Gajab Thai Gayo!',961808,0.6268,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31087,_binary '\0','/oy9HT8GThmtHYzGT9abRBkZuGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18561736',5.6,7184,'hi','द ग्रेट इंडियन फैमिली','The film is set in the fictional town of Balrampur where Vedvyas Tripathi better known as Bhajan Kumar lives with his family headed by his father Pandit Siyaram Tripathi. Bhajan Kumar’s life with his family was going well till a question on his identity arises that throws the city in a flurry of rumour and apprehension. Will he survive or fall prey to this onslaught?','/9Gxe853oX3URrNj8PKGfvoBF3tx.jpg','2023-09-22',112,'Released','The biggest confusion of the year','The Great Indian Family',984092,1.329,4.846,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31088,_binary '\0','/dc1UUrJi7eAyxsfQYdL3Xh5m2vu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18563148',6.3,4896,'en','Silverton Siege','After a failed sabotage mission, a trio of anti-apartheid freedom fighters ends up in a tense bank hostage situation. Based on a true story.','/5HruMN0vvl84AqD7sCDXFNO4RhP.jpg','2022-04-27',100,'Released','Freedom is a fight.','Silverton Siege',951470,2.8136,6.278,'L23I_XopoA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31089,_binary '\0','/m1QWWfHbK3vNaqW8XfQWZ87CaBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18566574',6.5,1508,'en','Dark Feathers: Dance of the Geisha','A young woman must choose loyalty to a historical Asian clan, and her non-traditional love, amidst the deaths of her dance partners being investigated by her new lover.','/xCQMn8LZZ6CIIHF6Ruky6DBsFy4.jpg','2024-08-02',93,'Released','Love And Death Are Eternal Dancing Partners','Dark Feathers: Dance of the Geisha',1260944,1.4293,5.2,'iY7VI3BqWEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31090,_binary '\0','/xuAsdWOc9RkNJwslUV64dk09Tjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18568902',8.3,11856,'hi','कौन प्रवीण तांबे?','Mumbai-born leg-spinner Pravin Tambe made his debut in professional cricket at the age of 41 in the IPL for Rajasthan Royals in 2013 not having played any international or even first-class cricket before that. The story traces the extraordinary journey of Tambe as he became the oldest debutant - at an age when most cricketers have retired or are on the verge of retirement - a modern-day fable of an underdog who fought against his destiny.','/w6t4nzjbmlGDAYnNvUeo6zxMySC.jpg','2022-04-01',133,'Released',NULL,'Kaun Pravin Tambe?',946652,1.1084,7.543,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31091,_binary '\0','/45mbpJFLxSFLdBT5PEM9HISrLEv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18573650',7.3,3162,'en','The Blue Angels','Follow the veterans and newest class of Navy and Marine Corps flight squadron as they go through intense training and into a season of heart-stopping aerial artistry.','/7WpeYv3rEhHtsqymb1JQJEM1nrs.jpg','2024-05-16',93,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Angels',1120821,2.3492,6.7,'f36UTLWPL6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31092,_binary '\0','/hliplWWIXu1JaRrYR58fkvimYvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857596',7.4,2084,'en','iParty with Victorious','Scorned girlfriends Carly and Tori hatch a plot against the boy that they are both dating.','/au5IiL3OUjir4CJYsg2lyJb61C6.jpg','2011-06-11',70,'Released','Leave it all to Shine.','iParty with Victorious',627394,2.6304,7.3,'2M97X8HVm5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31093,_binary '\0','/ofxq93dSF85goDtNfQoquo8LTWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857670',8.3,7564,'ta','தெய்வத்திருமகள்','An intellectually disabled man fights for custody of his 7-year-old daughter, and in the process teaches his opponent lawyer the value of love and family.','/ovfLSxsgLFYm2ISjfH1Te0lNyEr.jpg','2011-06-03',162,'Released',NULL,'Deiva Thirumagal',63964,2.3193,7.412,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31094,_binary '\0','/a7srWmQU9WjqHvr8tE9x5pYWJuF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857772',7.3,1533,'en','Louis Theroux: The Ultra Zionists','Louis Theroux spends time with a small and very committed subculture of ultra-nationalist Jewish settlers. He discovers a group of people who consider it their religious and political obligation to populate some of the most sensitive areas of the West Bank, especially those with a spiritual significance dating back to the Bible. Throughout his journey, Louis gets close to the people most involved with driving the extreme end of the Jewish settler movement - finding them warm, friendly, humorous, and deeply troubling.','/eAGqQfo35YrLueDO8onF1D89i9n.jpg','2011-02-03',60,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: The Ultra Zionists',86522,1.9246,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31095,_binary '\0','/b7qyTKrkFDAVyAzBgVpqjvAHneH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857824',5.6,1460,'es','Perras','Something terrible is happening in class 3A at Calmecatl Junior High. No one can leave the classroom until the guilty party is found. This is the device that gives us a glimpse of the ethics, games, esthetics and eroticism of these girl-women. It is not easy to say what the subject is, there are so many: the discovery of sexuality, discrimination, chance, drugs, maternity, traditions, betrayals, power, love. A mural of a complex reality from the point of view of twenty-something women in the skin of 14 to 15 year old girls.','/jrJrgwFjAyzkZLiaU5dA8o1hcUA.jpg','2011-03-04',100,'Released','Do your parents know?','Perras',114168,5.6821,7.3,'ftwEQPI04cE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31096,_binary '\0','/89K9xyHDif0fojc0Q2cDm0L08Af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857842',5.9,3083,'en','Redd Inc.','Six captive office workers are literally chained to their desks by a demented, escaped serial killer; former regional manager Thomas Reddmann. He assigns his \'human resources\' the impossible task of proving his innocence or suffering gruesome consequences.','/k0sJHCm3vRqGioWywLsLnR6ujUf.jpg','2012-11-03',93,'Released','Heads Will Roll','Redd Inc.',133463,1.2764,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31097,_binary '\0','/oIXnmpQXADWUF8JXSjKNlSw78qk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1857913',5.8,9339,'zh','白蛇传说','The Sorcerer and the White Snake is an ancient Chinese fable about a woman demon who falls in love with a mortal is brought to life through the latest advances in CGI and action techniques.','/5Jfv3CtMULd41C5jpLR8PGAMgE3.jpg','2011-09-27',100,'Released',NULL,'The Sorcerer and the White Snake',75948,5.075,6.538,'E5KR-SDeQII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31098,_binary '\0','/w53XDs2lFYzSolKjTFu8Cep0CDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1858481',5.7,7821,'en','Last Passenger','Independent British thriller starring Dougray Scott and Kara Tointon. Lewis (Scott), an overworked doctor, is on his way home from London with his young son Max (Joshua Kaynama). Clearly exhausted from his work, Lewis decides to take a nap on the train while an attractive young woman (Tointon) watches over his son. When he wakes, all but a few passengers have alighted and he realises that the train is not stopping to let anyone else off. Determined to get to the bottom of the mystery, Lewis goes to investigate and finds that the train has been taken over by an unstable driver who is hellbent on destroying the vehicle along with all the remaining passengers on board.','/ntIHy3C3Xgd5bl0c85pFX6joTFq.jpg','2013-10-18',96,'Released','A small group of everyday passengers on a speeding London commuter train battle their warped driver who has a dark plan for everyone on board.','Last Passenger',104329,2.4007,5.6,'grI0gJyxhw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31099,_binary '\0','/qQRpC4S36cyqZPwDGnbc9pMgVo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859438',7.6,6823,'th','สิ่งเล็กเล็กที่เรียกว่า...รัก','An introverted young girl falls in love with a popular senior. However, as she begins to come out of her shell, she faces several new problems.','/mdm2vTbBuUo8lWcizGW48FzIelb.jpg','2010-08-12',118,'Released','There is nothing like your first love.','A Little Thing Called Love',57627,2.8918,7.813,'LLaLWehxJFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31100,_binary '\0','/yfTo3luM4pcfb8KYXJsbyLLs39i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859446',6.3,15996,'el','Άλπεις','A nurse, a paramedic, a gymnast and her coach offer a service for hire wherein they stand in for dead people by appointment, hired by relatives, friends or colleagues of the deceased, to assist with the grieving process.','/nF5A64lC0MuuEK6qNmOfQpY6mRv.jpg','2011-10-27',94,'Released','When the end is here the Alps are near.','Alps',81857,2.2928,6.215,'zl0ovVe0Ou4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31101,_binary '\0','/q1UjftzFqSOSMxhrqAXtoTLjQpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859522',6.8,12902,'sv','Kyss mig','After they meet at their parent\'s engagement party, Mia and Frida are intrigued by and attracted to one another, despite Mia\'s own upcoming engagement to Tim. Mia must decide whether to continue her life with Tim or to follow her heart with Frida.','/3Y3JMMYYvwZmMWHQRehztndToFR.jpg','2011-07-29',107,'Released','Kiss Me','With Every Heartbeat',71325,2.6814,7.141,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31102,_binary '\0','/qUcJ0cQNcx7H61kZhWZ2jIvd0d2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859603',3.6,1708,'en','The Guest House','Before leaving for college, a recently dumped goth girl\'s life changes forever when she falls in love with a smart and professional college grad who is staying in the family\'s guest house.','/9lgQZZTJJ2MwXynLdf7dIEj38ol.jpg','2012-06-18',82,'Released','Love has its own place','The Guest House',117618,0.9188,4.5,'mqr_2U7gaOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31103,_binary '\0','/6ereyJmv6OenRhayTcWqH3ciEQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859607',5.4,1744,'en','Kath & Kimderella','Kath & Kim turn more than just heads when they go on an overseas trip and end up being the centre of their very own fairytale.','/64aAV5Iit9LTsivV37f6nbTCwrW.jpg','2012-09-06',86,'Released','A ritzy tale of fashion, pashin\' and revolution.','Kath & Kimderella',130953,1.8723,5.4,'Jh5UHA1gPq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31104,_binary '\0','/p4Ol9H1FUaPISjx5U3C5KVRnUTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1859650',6.3,93608,'en','To Rome with Love','Four tales unfold in the Eternal City: While vacationing in Rome, architect John encounters a young man whose romantic woes remind him of a painful incident from his own youth; retired opera director Jerry discovers a mortician with an amazing voice, and he seizes the opportunity to rejuvenate his own flagging career; a young couple have separate romantic interludes; a spotlight shines on an ordinary man.','/sMmYRgvFRk5Ginhytx7ciU7UwVs.jpg','2012-04-20',111,'Released','Romance! Adventure! Hilarity! Italy!','To Rome with Love',81836,6.3849,5.794,'kV43JZ6yWS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31105,_binary '\0','/nc2zXyrhMGhopIUyd5uqST4PqdP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860152',6,3488,'fr','17 filles','When Camille accidentally becomes pregnant, she encourages her friends and fellow high school classmates to follow suit. It\'s only a matter of time, before seventeen girls in the high school are pregnant and the town is thrown into a world of chaos.','/sej5qgyMyDnYk0Wl1gzwLH48lS0.jpg','2011-06-13',87,'Released',NULL,'17 Girls',87368,1.7192,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31106,_binary '\0','/43rA20XmMR5jUklfpCAksc32LKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860181',6.7,4487,'is','Svartur á leik','In the mid to late \'90s, the Reykjavik crime and drug scene saw a drastic change from a relatively small and innocent world into a much more aggressive and violent one.. The film tells the story of this change through the fictional gang of pushers that took control of Iceland\'s underworld.','/iG3e6KeIvhbkryLolUGx8BNfCnj.jpg','2012-03-11',104,'Released',NULL,'Black\'s Game',97340,1.7647,5.974,'wotsscY95Qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31107,_binary '\0','/yUjc0QIKJe0kyzjQ7Ky6dKRasv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860213',5.9,143445,'en','Dirty Grandpa','Jason Kelly is one week away from marrying his boss\'s uber-controlling daughter, putting him on the fast track for a partnership at the law firm. However, when the straight-laced Jason is tricked into driving his foul-mouthed grandfather, Dick, to Daytona for spring break, his pending nuptials are suddenly in jeopardy. Between riotous frat parties, bar fights, and an epic night of karaoke, Dick is on a quest to live his life to the fullest and bring Jason along for the ride.','/k0Lz1TfSlbcQthQKYGwE7blDfwN.jpg','2016-01-20',102,'Released','Jason is ready for adulthood. His grandpa isn\'t.','Dirty Grandpa',291870,12.8343,5.9,'q1zlkaPpMsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31108,_binary '\0','/vtT1HFl4Mj3qF5YWLtsnidG70fZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860238',5.9,1560,'en','Goddess','Elspeth Dickens dreams of finding her \"voice\" despite being stuck in an isolated farmhouse with her twin toddlers. A web-cam becomes her pathway to fame and fortune, but at a price.','/q0mwF7KXkw4T5gJ1CGAuETuIusW.jpg','2013-03-12',105,'Released','There\'s one in all of us.','Goddess',179340,1.0579,5.7,'7eomODwlINQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31109,_binary '\0','/7SleH2eUSnAohTcn6zkYkGXJDVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860242',6.9,115089,'en','The Highwaymen','In 1934, Frank Hamer and Manny Gault, two former Texas Rangers, are commissioned to put an end to the wave of vicious crimes perpetrated by Bonnie Parker and Clyde Barrow, a notorious duo of infamous robbers and cold-blooded killers who nevertheless are worshiped by the public.','/4bRYg4l12yDuJvAfqvUOPnBrxno.jpg','2019-03-15',133,'Released','The legends who took down Bonnie & Clyde','The Highwaymen',500682,7.2589,6.775,'aH6vC-BBKOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31110,_binary '\0','/3qfiZd8ETMk9MQsmhbOB5QAAx0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860353',6.4,127812,'en','Turbo','The tale of an ordinary garden snail who dreams of winning the Indy 500.','/inTKQni4YW8syrfgnXHwzmNeSo4.jpg','2013-07-11',96,'Released','He\'s fast. They\'re furious.','Turbo',77950,12.1232,6.283,'HJVwEWEc7a4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31111,_binary '\0','/8EMkqHeD3SBH7im7OiaLJHLiunp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860355',7.7,7561,'en','Undefeated','Set against the backdrop of a high school football season, Dan Lindsay and T.J. Martin’s documentary UNDEFEATED is an intimate chronicle of three underprivileged student-athletes from inner-city Memphis and the volunteer coach trying to help them beat the odds on and off the field. For players and coaches alike, the season will be not only about winning games — it will be about how they grapple with the unforeseeable events that are part of football and part of life.','/8MF2TC6s9Q6onyWgVWJ9YC689oc.jpg','2011-12-12',113,'Released','Character will be revealed.','Undefeated',82620,1.5369,7.4,'JN-jxNMsTPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31112,_binary '\0','/fRT76SSQzAuZljogpsWyKphUxYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860357',7.1,202137,'en','Deepwater Horizon','A story set on the offshore drilling rig Deepwater Horizon, which exploded during April 2010 and created the worst oil spill in U.S. history.','/jgBIYCZACe3iaS9TL2XzVGkO5p5.jpg','2016-09-28',107,'Released','When faced with our darkest hour, hope is not a tactic.','Deepwater Horizon',296524,14.7375,6.9,'8yASbM8M2vg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31113,_binary '\0','/cxQxCUw2Ek996Hd9NFcgMkfCWK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1860359',7.1,2018,'cs','Ve stínu','In the former Czechoslovakia, 1950s, police captain Hakl investigates a jewelry robbery. An opened safe deposit leads to a known burglar. What seems an easy case soon starts to tangle. When he is called off the case, he continues on his own. The investigation leads him onto thin ice. Can he beat a stronger enemy and save his family and his own life?','/icXymjFZUpN8iyTu981VWbxM8Bx.jpg','2012-09-13',106,'Released',NULL,'In the Shadow',136190,1.5107,6.6,'T65fTy5SE54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31114,_binary '\0','/nvw0ZSOxut7UmmZV2WaKn6w8v8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861279',4.4,3150,'en','Barricade','A father\'s quiet retreat to the woods with his two children turns into a fight for survival.','/cJJWX8HdzovNdDPrjF604uvPRIe.jpg','2012-09-25',82,'Released','Lock. Your. Doors.','Barricade',134394,1.3453,4.5,'ekXNWWlp3N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31115,_binary '\0','/5Hu6Se9EjzRfxuTL8jvgHiYxfc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861334',4.6,1245,'es','Fuga de cerebros 2','Alfonso, pursues the girl of his life to Harvard, determined to conquer her under the same friends and outlandish plans that his brother used in Oxford. But when you least expect it appears Martha, the girl he fell in love while at school.','/qMjGY0PZwHMWUfUreNBhdP1Lp6Z.jpg','2011-12-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Brain Drain 2',80105,2.0148,5,'hda1bBEb6H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31116,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861340',4.9,2216,'tr','Günah Keçisi','Sahin K., who wants to leave his fame, wealth, but unhappy life in Germany behind and live a simple and normal life, decides to live in Bodrum. As he struggles to reunite with his son Caner, whom he lost because of his notoriety, he becomes a folk hero who will solve the town\'s problems. His unrelenting fame will drag him into different adventures.','/qsxD4Wq2YVpQCtJgPNHbQQQbSrQ.jpg','2011-01-21',83,'Released','He tried to change his life but he was the scapegoat.','Scapegoat',83559,1.2283,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31117,_binary '\0','/5li8dEJE67Ahe5j3gZPEY0ZRsgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861375',6.4,2428,'fr','La Guerre des boutons','A village in the South of France, 1960. A band of country boys aged 7 to 14, led by fearless young Lebrac, wages an uncompromising battle against their sworn rivals, the kids from the neighboring village. A war of honor and allegiance that\'s been kept alive for generations, in which humiliation is the most fearsome defeat and no tactic is too extreme, including attacking the enemy stark naked!','/c4xpTNxBIxUwaJsT2B47PVZ0oKC.jpg','2011-09-14',109,'Released',NULL,'War of the Buttons',74944,2.0698,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31118,_binary '\0','/8KnvbGYu8bDKlkyXWRWxWfGvioq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861421',5.7,1561,'cn','倩女幽魂','Government official Ling Choi Sin journeys to the parched Black Mountain Village, to help its inhabitants find water. As he leads a group of volunteers up the haunted mountain, he encounters a bevy of sexy demons as well as a lovely girl named Siu Sin. After wooing her with some candy, he falls for her... and then realises that he is caught in a deadly triangle; another guy, a demon-hunter named Yan Chek Ha is also in love with Siu Sin. However, before the two men can settle their differences, they have to contend with the evil Tree Demon as well as a one-armed demon hunter who is determined to kill all the supernatural beings.','/zKigVU0hX69Nzf2GyDF1O9tZpEJ.jpg','2011-04-21',100,'Released',NULL,'A Chinese Ghost Story',70530,2.7273,5.647,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31119,_binary '\0','/zO7Mshala7a22ZWj5N66CqZeCTo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861445',4.8,1669,'en','An Act of War','Battling insomnia and undiagnosed PTSD, a war veteran works nights as a projectionist at a decrepit theater. While struggling to adapt to civilian life, he soon finds himself tangled in an inescapable web of seduction, addiction, and violence.','/MV4oKAa9tGL3Et05TTsf75flug.jpg','2015-03-10',99,'Released',NULL,'An Act of War',289723,1.4392,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31120,_binary '\0','/PnSYdLMcdzZ2wEemUfclbKw9Vi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1861982',7.1,3250,'ko','아이들...','On March 26, 1991, five boys set off to the mountain to go frog hunting and never come back to their family. While a documentary producer, detective and professor try to solve the mystery of the incident, one of the boys\' parents is a suspect.','/1RRzcPFHgBUBMJWb2D5OsDQ7Rm7.jpg','2011-02-17',132,'Released','Five missing children, They never came back.','Children...',72066,2.5492,7.259,'lcmK9Qd2oJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31121,_binary '\0','/hOVZHM2ZEaWdytcptRhfzk0fJBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1862079',6.9,135851,'en','Safety Not Guaranteed','Three magazine employees head out on an assignment to interview a guy who placed a classified ad seeking a companion for time travel.','/vgP1ikT5tYv2pAlkpAN1SjGZmsh.jpg','2012-06-08',86,'Released','What would you go back for?','Safety Not Guaranteed',84332,5.2233,6.784,'xa8dz8w4YCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31122,_binary '\0','/rIpgYXtzfGr4sciIMFbKPSBnc8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1862472',5.8,9465,'tr','Kolpaçino: Bomba','Born into a wealthy family, Özgür is unhappy with his life. Neither he sees support from his stingy father, nor from his rich father-in-law. Özgür\'s love from the past, Sale, expects financial support for the album to be released.','/aLMYsy2QUXmiExXfujDSuJufJqw.jpg','2011-03-11',92,'Released',NULL,'Kolpacino: Bomb',75640,2.1298,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31123,_binary '\0','/r0Zhgr8KhJHnRB0tp8bvySHx40r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18626656',7.5,3635,'fr','Arrête avec tes mensonges','An author returns to his hometown of Cognac for the first time in 35 years to help promote a distillery. Once there, he meets his first love’s son, Lucas. Memories come rushing back to him: irrepressible attraction, bodies becoming one in the heat of desire, a passion that can never be revealed… His first love’s name was Thomas. They were 17.','/m2zbDIYtb0SJx7NDDEH1gP1dHrZ.jpg','2023-02-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Lie with Me',976293,3.258,7.3,'9JjOjkfH4TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31124,_binary '\0','/8DVtamxTBJVoXbU85QHRfU7tsuH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1863192',7.4,4891,'ka','სიმინდის კუნძული','The Inguri River forms a natural border dividing Georgia from Abkhazia. One of the spring floods has created a little island in the middle of the river, as if made for the cultivation of corn. At least, this is the belief of an old peasant, whose sunburned face resembles the landscape he has trodden for dozens of years.','/aXfqkcug2GewkSmpIVdmzMSzu3Q.jpg','2014-09-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Corn Island',282376,1.3313,7.2,'yBlKuudoAQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31125,_binary '\0','/eoNrwjxLjX6KuWE5YdUiJ3q6w5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1863201',5,4625,'en','Dark Circles','When new parents Alex and Penny retreat from the city and move into a place outside town, the stress and massive sleep-deprivation caused by their infant has both of them seeing things in the house that may or may not exist. Persistent sightings of a strange woman has each of them wondering if they are suffering from hallucinations, or if their new home holds a dark, supernatural presence. As their fragile grasp on reality spirals into delirium, Alex and Penny find themselves nearly helpless to deal with the horrific truth of what is really going in this house.','/qaFRm7Ixvu41eCx4wIXXNq8M8KR.jpg','2013-05-21',87,'Released','In This House No One Sleeps','Dark Circles',194121,1.846,5.1,'K0HVeqjqs9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31126,_binary '\0','/xFr7lB18nj2IKAwBTDWwhNjenLp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1863203',4.3,1511,'en','The Employer','Five highly qualified applicants interview for a coveted job with the Carcharias Corporation, a powerful conglomerate whose business practices are shrouded in mystery. On the night before the last round of interviews, they are all kidnapped and drugged. The next day, they wake up trapped together in a locked room without any hope of escape. Soon the true nature of their situation is revealed when they receive a phone call from the mysterious CEO of Carcharias, known only as The Employer. He informs them that they are about to experience the final interview, but it\'s not at all what they were expecting.','/hlh1T4CbcybebiTVFGPofBioPcC.jpg','2013-06-07',85,'Released','How far will they go to get the job?','The Employer',191094,1.3311,4.3,'2YwHM7f2Xs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31127,_binary '\0','/kR804hHqD1ODS7UKif7j0tbTgQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1863347',6.4,3571,'ru','О чём ещё говорят мужчины','A year later the men are still talking, but this time on the 31st of December and still about the women, football, children, and, of course, about the approaching New Year’s celebration. But what can they do, if their beloved wives and girls are waiting for them at Kamil’s, busy with New Year tree decoration and cooking, and the husbands are accidentally got stuck in the advertising agency office? Will they manage to get home in time to celebrate the New Year together?','/9T3bl4c3mM2MYM4BL8TefSQEOB2.jpg','2011-12-29',95,'Released',NULL,'What Men Still Talk About',83456,1.2379,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31128,_binary '\0','/9BTEwkw4XKujooFn5gXm0kQfsuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1864288',7,7089,'en','Conan O\'Brien Can\'t Stop','A documentary that follows the former Tonight Show host. Filmed during Conan’s ”Legally Prohibited From Being Funny on Television” comedy tour, after his departure from the Tonight Show, taking viewers on an intimate journey of O’Brien’s life.','/nRxb5WsKnOIdkjecBRSKksRL4ia.jpg','2011-06-24',89,'Released',NULL,'Conan O\'Brien Can\'t Stop',65058,2.4025,6.583,'zV-q-EiRSzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31129,_binary '\0','/scE3snaOqxvdMk2mrDOjeGtZh5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1864405',6.1,2356,'en','Low Down','The daughter of jazz pianist Joe Albany witnesses her beloved father\'s struggle -- and failure -- to kick his heroin habit.','/tCZ2ROr17jDwnMHUe0tjGpXLzkV.jpg','2014-01-19',119,'Released','Un Film de Jeff Preiss','Low Down',244580,2.2116,5.6,'lXFi2KoREW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31130,_binary '\0','/ypPG4dq8eAScb2E4qcNZBDEyXEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1864461',5.5,1555,'en','Certain Prey','Minneapolis Deputy Police Chief, Lucas Davenport, has to face off against a duo unlike any he\'s ever encountered; a lethal hit woman and a ferociously cunning killer determined to hunt him down.','/bfx11YnuVVOrkdE3H7ocYi5ISox.jpg','2011-11-06',89,'Released',NULL,'Certain Prey',78224,1.8267,4.9,'Tqv5BWN4US8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31131,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1864494',3.9,1311,'en','Stormhouse','The military have captured and imprisoned a supernatural entity. And now it wants to play.','/3aaf6TDLsXMt36LFUT0mAsHKVBR.jpg','2011-06-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Stormhouse',84558,0.8449,3.4,'9O_D7z4vQkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31132,_binary '\0','/8N0SUkGcTog5m9Bb3Pj7kt8Vv5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1864557',6.4,2398,'fi','Tie pohjoiseen','A father who was absent for 30 years of his son\'s life returns and wants to set on a journey through Finland, so they can learn to know each other again.','/nyuGf79xRhk3lgQ0v6lrAmRUywg.jpg','2012-08-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Road North',128203,2.0129,5.9,'U6H8CruHjEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31133,_binary '\0','/xXeJA5T6kizxi5Goimo6S1jjL5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865346',4.6,2916,'en','Detention of the Dead','A group of oddball high school students find themselves trapped in detention with their classmates having turned into a horde of Zombies.','/tf2baOEkFodZ5NYXMfb7gxcZgV.jpg','2012-04-27',87,'Released','When there\'s no more room in Hell, the dead will go to DETENTION!','Detention of the Dead',139715,2.0663,4.7,'wS66fv-BXAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31134,_binary '\0','/zuG12LAd7Dv1YqGL5tSzyQCDCQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865357',6.9,1293,'es','El estudiante','Roque starts University in Buenos Aires but he is not particularly interested in attending classes or working towards a degree. Instead, he dedicates his time to one of the many groups vying for control of the university, motivated less by grand political ideals than by a wish to get close to Paula, an attractive young teacher heavily involved in internal university politics.','/93BK54rXeMhrVbmwemAze6HPWFu.jpg','2011-09-01',111,'Released',NULL,'The Student',118204,1.083,6.3,'BvICsWskmrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31135,_binary '\0','/fsiMxZEe8tabMhM11HgGjQO57KV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865368',5,6321,'en','Frenemies','Three pairs of friends relationships go from good to bad and back again. Several couple fall out over girls, boys and work. Can all these couples settle their differences and be friends again?','/cfEUQG5Jv5SHVgq6pPfybS57ORO.jpg','2012-01-13',86,'Released','Geek vs Chic. Beauty vs Beast. Downtown vs Uptown. What happens when three sets of BFF\'s become enemies?','Frenemies',84105,3.2205,5.7,'zAaqR0ldWJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31136,_binary '\0','/nlTYJADA3YjqfIBIjTND2gMuryS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865393',4.9,1924,'en','Hellbenders','An exorcism comedy which follows the Order of Hellbound Saints (Brooklyn Parish), a highly secretive and profoundly blasphemous men of God, as they battle demonic forces too terrible to be cast out by traditional Vatican-approved methods.','/sWgCQPypdN9jFaUSjItPn9htW9p.jpg','2013-10-18',87,'Released','Deliver them to evil.','Hellbenders',123107,2.1931,5.4,'bhpyUTho3vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31137,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865425',7.5,5546,'en','Kumaré','A documentary about a man who impersonates a wise Indian Guru and builds a following in Arizona. At the height of his popularity, the Guru Kumaré must reveal his true identity to his disciples and unveil his greatest teaching of all.','/6XzJ4RAqNKI4V3K3UarK4MthJA8.jpg','2012-06-20',86,'Released','The true story of a false prophet','Kumaré',98886,2.4577,6.8,'OXUzG6YKuvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31138,_binary '\0','/mVLZvSe1Aa8CFKx0cInTamVZJrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865505',8,68992,'en','Song of the Sea','The story of the last Seal Child’s journey home. After their mother’s disappearance, Ben and Saoirse are sent to live with Granny in the city. When they resolve to return to their home by the sea, their journey becomes a race against time as they are drawn into a world Ben knows only from his mother’s folktales. But this is no bedtime story; these fairy folk have been in our world far too long. It soon becomes clear to Ben that Saoirse is the key to their survival.','/16LQC6zpqB0l74mVWb93a2oMFnX.jpg','2014-06-23',94,'Released','Let the song of the sea sway your heart...','Song of the Sea',110416,10.0759,8,'VrhoOzW8oF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31139,_binary '\0','/obWCiuAGP0dpyzisjCdjxiOJTZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865545',4.2,1350,'ru','Liars All','On New Year\'s eve in London, a provocative game spins out of control and ends in murder, the true killer elusive amidst conflicting testimony and hidden motives.','/eOkdwrIYLENBufZNsoWUhUD00le.jpg','2013-08-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Liars All',196305,1.7873,5,'3cFmw4L1Xg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31140,_binary '\0','/2j28fB2PDEolxDhDGGvV3OJ3obL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865569',7,14436,'tr','Çalgı Çengi','Salih and Gürkan, two cousins from Ankara, are struggling musicians that are trying to make a living by performing at private events such as bachelorette parties. Nihat, a low profile event manager, finds a gig for the duo which leads them to encounter with unexpected guests in their \"dressing room\".','/rVrhfoULPOvHbCHG01aWq7FBVe.jpg','2011-02-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Çalgı Çengi',64468,1.6486,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31141,_binary '\0','/3AxqQUNC6d3PpbDHQLYX2UKgzUD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1865573',4.5,4017,'en','Bad Kids Go to Hell','On a stormy Saturday afternoon, six students from Crestview Academy begin to meet horrible fates as they serve detention. Is a fellow student to blame, or perhaps Crestview\'s alleged ghosts are behind the terrible acts?','/dVzEumXyiQ13VJOrHxFolGmMyEq.jpg','2012-12-07',91,'Released','Daddy\'s money can\'t save them now.','Bad Kids Go to Hell',138372,2.4385,4.6,'Q1Dbxx6EpRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31142,_binary '\0','/dkUDFGxXTLALgQes1AmYDqV2I9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1866205',6.1,3716,'it','Nessuno mi può giudicare','35-year-old Alice has a husband and a son. Her life seems a beautiful dream, but it soon turns out to be a nightmare. Her husband dies in a car accident and her lawyer tells her that she is on her uppers. The only way she has to earn money in a short time is by resorting to the oldest job in history.','/626jMahE21C1M04EFDq3dQmSQvb.jpg','2011-03-18',95,'Released','Everyone has the right to live as they can.','Escort in Love',59570,3.1696,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31143,_binary '\0','/6P6YdvJsAZlUZKipA86rbfjfKzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1866249',7.2,45175,'en','The Sessions','Though a childhood bout with polio left him dependent on an iron lung, Mark O\'Brien maintains a career as a journalist and poet. A writing assignment dealing with sex and the disabled piques Mark\'s curiosity, and he decides to investigate the possibility of experiencing sex himself. When his overtures toward a caregiver scare her away, he books an appointment with sex surrogate Cheryl Cohen-Greene to lose his virginity.','/57o1DBc5DfJXVc8wArAblSbZ8sD.jpg','2012-05-02',95,'Released','The festival hit of the year!','The Sessions',113947,5.9444,6.9,'6T7vqxwuWEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31144,_binary '\0','/dq2ynRiiOgJN3kh9jpyWIKAmHUe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1866251',3.3,1231,'en','Coffin Baby','An attractive young woman is kidnapped, held captive and forced to endure the evils of one of the most violent homicidal maniacs in the city\'s history. \"The Toolbox Killer\" aka TBK. It is by her will, strength and her faith that she must survive, the ordeal. Her escape is almost hopeless. Unfortunately her situation only worsens when outside supernatural forces become more difficult to contend with than TBK.','/k4pBspIEC0lzVwKVW1vA3GCyVnj.jpg','2013-03-15',85,'Released','If you can\'t be something great...do something terrible.','Coffin Baby',71682,2.2219,4.8,'S6XhBUPTUb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31145,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1867091',5.4,1230,'en','The Reconstruction of William Zero','A geneticist wakes up from an accident with only fragments of his memory intact and is forced to relearn who he is via his twin brother. But as he digs deeper, he discovers he might not be who he thought at all.','/s60pOCpGtPHy4NeaLTyd96RH1eE.jpg','2015-04-11',98,'Released','You can\'t run from yourself','The Reconstruction of William Zero',282313,1.6432,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31146,_binary '\0','/pR12U3MPxq6aeHHd4sQOml72SSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1867093',5.6,10555,'en','The Samaritan','After twenty years in prison, Foley is finished with the grifter\'s life. When he meets an elusive young woman named Iris, the possibility of a new start looks real. But his past is proving to be a stubborn companion.','/oimc19nfcUTPveC85EhPyQUQ3CE.jpg','2012-03-02',90,'Released',NULL,'The Samaritan',98339,3.9073,5.457,'1xIAm1bsO64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31147,_binary '\0','/7UCl3dlJ5Fn0x4YMZa5zSjzKISR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1867101',6.4,2968,'ja','テルマエ・ロマエ','Lucius Modestus, ancient Roman bath architect, has lost his job. The one way he can win it back is by creating a bath that nobody has seen before, and, by pure chance, ends up slipping through time to Japan in 2012. There, he discovers the wonders of Japanese bath technology, incorporating it into his own designs, but must face the challenges of the succession of the emperor, his home life, and his new hot spring-based friends, including manga artist meet-cute Mami.','/82cRT6oMF6eukcn8Dukwvu6BCfD.jpg','2012-04-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Thermae Romae',105210,2.2987,6.3,'MOmFSflNiQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31148,_binary '\0','/zYThYpCSBEyEuPAgBLGJhFz58lS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18671246',6,1584,'fr','Les Cyclades','As teenagers, Blandine and Magalie were inseparable. Years passed and they lost sight of each other. As their paths cross again, they decide to take the trip together that they have always dreamed of. Direction Greece, its sun, its islands but also its galleys because the two former best friends now have a very different approach to holidays... and to life!','/t974TGJkpoWO8mQaB574pcZFL5i.jpg','2023-01-11',111,'Released',NULL,'Two Tickets to Greece',958335,2.5439,5.9,'VQD6FRFI8HI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31149,_binary '\0','/yaze6df9AMIA9oeDEbIZ4zOTRCJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18671386',5.4,2691,'ja','鋼の錬金術師 完結編 復讐者スカー','The Elric brothers meet their toughest opponent yet — a lone serial killer with a large scar on his forehead.','/c5OwwBNyJkwyroIOIJL9IiRjydR.jpg','2022-05-20',125,'Released','The promised day is coming soon','Fullmetal Alchemist: The Revenge of Scar',960700,3.9801,6.508,'cqj4u6eyDq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31150,_binary '\0','/5hoS3nEkGGXUfmnu39yw1k52JX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18671660',5.5,1764,'ja','鋼の錬金術師 完結編 最後の錬成','The Elric brothers’ long and winding journey comes to a close in this epic finale, where they must face off against an unworldly, nationwide threat.','/AeyiuQUUs78bPkz18FY3AzNFF8b.jpg','2022-06-24',142,'Released','Hope is Unbreakable','Fullmetal Alchemist: The Final Alchemy',960704,3.995,6.283,'cqj4u6eyDq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31151,_binary '\0','/ttsFffDoso5BIqNugMoQDBI9A34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18687124',7.9,17608,'ko','BTS: Permission to Dance on Stage - Seoul','Join us as BTS and ARMY become one once again with music and dance in this unmissable live concert experience broadcast from Seoul to cinemas around the world! \"BTS: Permission to Dance on Stage\" is the latest world tour series headlined by pop icons BTS, featuring powerful performances and the greatest hit songs from throughout their incredible career.','/d5Qg9sbntjqmuswpIuF7BltuUZq.jpg','2022-03-12',195,'Released',NULL,'BTS: Permission to Dance on Stage - Seoul',939984,3.8764,8.9,'z-2XxjBh-Ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31152,_binary '\0','/solQ9TRE0vrE22z3w04qPY8i4QP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18688184',5.5,2394,'es','Matrimillas','Tangled in a troubled marriage, a frustrated couple finds hope in a watch-based app that rewards good deeds — until unhealthy obsessiveness takes over.','/caMOaq9aBvLt4eUzP05JwLfQyKQ.jpg','2022-12-07',101,'Released',NULL,'The Marriage App',948037,1.8337,6,'pQL4OHfLhgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31153,_binary '\0','/yAFPkPUKPhV5INwsUykCBMfe7Xa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869226',7,3602,'te','100% Love','Balu and Mahalakshmi are both very competitive in college, which leads to ego clashes. When they meet again after a few years, they try to outdo each other until they realize that they are in love.','/xDuAT2K7kcN2kM9BP9lwwNqNWCD.jpg','2011-05-06',140,'Released',NULL,'100% Love',63378,1.5008,6.321,'Q0wjGBZ5yuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31154,_binary '\0','/tXGZ5Lu8aJh9TJotl3e79lGshL3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869296',5.6,3214,'hi','Bbuddah Hoga Terra Baap','After a series of bomb blasts in Mumbai, ACP Karan Malhotra announces that he will bring in the culprits responsible within a very short period of time as well attempts to convince his college sweetheart, Tanya P. Nath, to marry him. He then sets about interrogating several suspects so much so that an underworld gangster, Kabir, is compelled to hire an assassin to do away with him. The potential killer, Viju, is an uptight older ex-convict as well as a former gangster, who now runs a pub in Paris, and is willing to kill Karan. As he sets about this gruesome task, he comes across an old flame, Kamini, as well as his estranged wife, Sita - and it is these encounters that may well be the turning point in this life that may convince him to leave the bombs and Bandooks behind and spend the rest of his life praying and watching the Bhakti Channel.','/yatGTB5sPpVySH7LqAALljmeeR5.jpg','2011-07-01',118,'Released','Just don\'t call him ... Bbuddah','Bbuddah Hoga Terra Baap',69774,1.5728,4.949,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31155,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869345',7.7,1835,'es','Contratiempo','A race against time between a man whose son requires urgent treatment and a stockbroker who suddenly lost his investors\' money and ruined his own family.','/wQxlCKuLYVXP9cBwpFYdYn6uChy.jpg','2011-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Setback',268874,1.6248,8.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31156,_binary '\0','/4ETwtKZnMSWZJ3SFLfBLkpUXpOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869347',6.3,31363,'en','Crooked House','A private investigator helps a former flame solve the murder of her wealthy grandfather, who lived in a sprawling estate surrounded by his idiosyncratic family.','/AewyKG2cvgZQBG4XU6SVomfu1k5.jpg','2017-09-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Crooked House',419835,8.1141,6.374,'ERj3KafjfRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31157,_binary '\0','/ea5khkci4MoI5AovlZWoxDAsuSh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869416',6.6,3403,'pt','Faroeste Caboclo','When João goes to Brazil in search of a better life, he meets punk music enthusiast Maria and falls in love with her. But his involvement in the local drug trade makes him the target of a vicious drug lord.','/5XHb7KdI0qnTQhUzEubhmuvsYZx.jpg','2013-05-31',108,'Released','You lost your life','Brazilian Western',195423,1.2653,6.298,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31158,_binary '\0','/3zkkcYlzWThtyQApPLOLeRgo3EI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869425',5.6,1233,'en','Filly Brown','“Majo” Tonorio, a.k.a. Filly Brown, is a raw, young Los Angeles hip-hop artist who spits from the heart. When a sleazy record producer offers her a crack at rap stardom, Majo faces some daunting choices. With an incarcerated mother, a record contract could be the ticket out for her struggling family. But taking the deal means selling out her talent and the true friends who helped her to the cusp of success.','/5CdRIAll52h0s0cbFH0VKiCp7pg.jpg','2013-04-19',100,'Released','This is my life.','Filly Brown',84197,1.5694,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31159,_binary '\0','/xqSmpPJeHo0T5Q42x5Nq46SQyd5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869470',4.7,6939,'en','Hollow','An old monastery in a small, remote village in Suffolk, England has been haunted by a local legend for centuries. Left in ruin and shrouded by the mystery of a dark spirit that wills young couples to suicide, the place has been avoided for years, marked only by a twisted, ancient tree with an ominous hollow said to be the home of great evil. When four friends on holiday explore the local folklore, they realize that belief in a myth can quickly materialize into reality, bringing horror to life for the town.','/bXy8r2WysptFJMmTvYDErMg5X34.jpg','2011-07-31',91,'Released',NULL,'Hollow',127626,1.7237,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31160,_binary '\0','/kq99sRIMHlgIPHV8U4SHdWBZMRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869716',6.8,54313,'en','The East','An operative for an elite private intelligence firm finds her priorities irrevocably changed after she is tasked with infiltrating an anarchist group known for executing covert attacks upon major corporations.','/qTJPT1jFz94vSkmiHMUxQTfQsL7.jpg','2013-05-31',116,'Released','Spy on us, we\'ll spy on you.','The East',87499,5.332,6.6,'7z54r8jvGj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31161,_binary '\0','/jHN8hldnPvPR6a3G5YeaEov2nNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1869721',5.9,2127,'zh','大魔術師','In the years after the Revolution, China broken up into fiefdoms held by warlords, who are busy fighting each other. One warlord has imprisoned a girl and wants her to be his seventh wife, but he\'s too honorable to force her. The local revolutionaries wants to kill him and bring back the republic. But when a stranger returns from abroad with mastery of magic to recover the girl he loved, who is tricking whom and who will win at the end?','/96k1xo0HLv0uzwefbUoAafaXBJg.jpg','2011-12-22',128,'Released',NULL,'The Great Magician',83721,2.6148,5.986,'GEuDawf6PNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31162,_binary '\0','/26hIJYDMVtQsp7NHmXrBoYbre7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1870419',5.6,11846,'en','Hatchet III','A search and recovery team heads into Victor Crowley’s haunted swamp to pick up the pieces, and Marybeth learns the secret to ending the voodoo curse that has left Victor Crowley terrorizing Honey Island Swamp for decades.','/kbSuJBmPXn72SibvzXk6eGVo1D2.jpg','2013-06-14',81,'Released','Some legends never die.','Hatchet III',167575,3.9347,5.7,'1SSEm5vzNBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31163,_binary '\0','/hozr6lmxzdEAwADSINd4YQjmTg6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1870425',4.4,10135,'en','Mac & Devin Go to High School','A comedy that follows two high school students -- one overachiever struggling to write his valedictorian speech, the other a senior now going on his 15th year of school.','/x3G4ft7cAWsnXjFPC5D5ruvGaOg.jpg','2012-07-03',75,'Released','Snoop Dogg and Wiz Khalifa get their higher education on','Mac & Devin Go to High School',104859,3.5667,6.496,'g2No2gXyLt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31164,_binary '\0','/sTumBA3jMn1B5b8TIpELBO1xbrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1870527',4.2,2635,'en','Remains','The story centers on two lone survivors of a bizarre accident that reduced most of the world\'s population to zombies. They take refuge in a vacant casino and fight a losing battle against the undead.','/8IxvPu3zfPtZiGbXoQQ5NfkssJD.jpg','2011-12-06',88,'Released','This Town Will Eat You Alive.','Remains',84449,1.5029,4.9,'MJq2ddpm4RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31165,_binary '\0','/Advmbl9xeQ6s43Zee13bPFgMZkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1870529',6.4,7044,'en','Won\'t Back Down','Jamie Fitzpatrick and Nona Alberts are two women from opposites sides of the social and economic track, but they have one thing in common: a mission to fix their community\'s broken school and ensure a bright future for their children. The two women refuse to let any obstacles stand in their way as they battle a bureaucracy that\'s hopelessly mired in traditional thinking, and they seek to re-energize a faculty that has lost its passion for teaching.','/7Repugxu8BQXMYSGpzqRrBjFRna.jpg','2012-09-28',121,'Released','If you can\'t beat the system... change it','Won\'t Back Down',82631,3.4123,6.1,'lvYPxZpstkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31166,_binary '\0','/gCPE6VUryR7qU0Pvsc1qs8dpRu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1871236',6.1,2086,'de','Blutzbrüdaz','Otis and Eddie have been best friends since childhood and live in Berlin on a day-to-day basis. No prospects, only the big dream of music. When one day a record label becomes aware of them, nothing stands in the way of living out this dream. But the record label likes to interfere and the friendship is put to the test.','/hk5aw6nAwIbP08VjcRuFGlGWfFJ.jpg','2011-12-28',87,'Released','My city, my block, my film','Bloodbrotherz',83342,0.9591,5.9,'UtfGp8G0pNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31167,_binary '\0','/kwNoweXwy3olFcfdYW2uS34iCgE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872084',6.7,2536,'ar','ابن القنصل','After spending 30 years in prison, a man comes out to find out he has a son. Together with his son and a newly-acquired friend he resumes his criminal life.','/6215soMfqTTWqhIynWdL2VH7FGC.jpg','2010-11-12',119,'Released',NULL,'The Consul\'s Son',67099,0.9893,6.4,'S_DYx9qvo5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31168,_binary '\0','/yjlFv2kIQ6O7MSbNM6xGIHQIPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872101',6.8,1251,'fr','Fanny','\"Fanny\" is the second part of the \"Marseille trilogy\", made by Marcel Pagnol with the generic name of \"Marius, Fanny and César\". Fanny falls in love and is abandoned by Marius. Now she discovers she is pregnant. Her mother and Marius\'s father, César, persuade her to accept the romantic advances of a much older man. To save face, Fanny accepts to marry Honoré Panisse, a rich merchant of the Vieux Port, 30 years her senior who will recognize her son.','/mvb4hT4rEnAxMxo3zJj8X2fXROY.jpg','2013-07-10',102,'Released',NULL,'Fanny',201018,1.5736,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31169,_binary '\0','/mOq4TpTwvtF3FgDGbOAl1YGz4dA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872102',6.7,1262,'fr','Marius','\"Marius\" takes place in Marseilles\' Old Port, at the La Marine Bar, owned by César and his son Marius. Marius\' biggest dream is to embark on one of the boats passing by his dad\'s bar and to set off to a faraway land. Fanny, a young and pretty seafood peddler, has secretly been in love with Marius since her childhood; Marius, never admitting it, has always loved Fanny. One day, a sailor drops by La Marine and offers him a job on an exploratory ship. Trying to hold him off and to make him jealous, Fanny confesses his love to him and provokes a fight between Marius and one of César\'s old friends, Panisse, a boat merchant, who despite his old age, has been courting Fanny for a while. Torn between the call of the sea and his love for her, Marius abandons his dream to be with Fanny who gives herself to him. As César and Honorine, Fanny\'s mother, are getting ready for the wedding, Marius changes his mind, drawn back to the call of the sea.','/5SF1K2NNF4jTAwTj3ersomzjDzw.jpg','2013-07-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Marius',200645,1.0879,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31170,_binary '\0','/k0hlAzTryCYX1O1LyC6P8tAa8s0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872181',6.6,608541,'en','The Amazing Spider-Man 2','For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.','/bU7nTmvmy0h3VUP01v1T2imgH6N.jpg','2014-04-16',141,'Released','His greatest battle begins.','The Amazing Spider-Man 2',102382,26.9261,6.562,'DlM2CWNTQ84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31171,_binary '\0','/sPantp0oQ9idos7Jdwko2r6ZOIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872194',7.4,221047,'en','The Judge','A successful lawyer returns to his hometown for his mother\'s funeral only to discover that his estranged father, the town\'s judge, is suspected of murder.','/3K93GWotLXe4FqpErri0xkpLaD5.jpg','2014-10-08',141,'Released','Defend your Honor.','The Judge',205587,18.8692,7.3,'ZBvK6ni97W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31172,_binary '\0','/6NsUCdgCuTD3aFVZZIX8w5eD6bT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872818',6.7,42312,'en','Liberal Arts','Newly single, 35, and uninspired by his job, Jesse Fisher worries that his best days are behind him. But no matter how much he buries his head in a book, life keeps pulling Jesse back. When his favorite college professor invites him to campus to speak at his retirement dinner, Jesse jumps at the chance.','/yEEEQoJQ1fGT11faLPBfHXkds9E.jpg','2012-09-14',97,'Released','Sometimes students make the best teachers.','Liberal Arts',84306,4.2894,6.468,'yBUCyxJwHm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31173,_binary '\0','/5gHiDiHyiib1xbMUVol9VToUIW2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872819',6.9,1567,'pt','Like Water','Anderson Silva is the deadliest man on the planet - The longest-reigning UFC Champion, and the most feared fighter in mixed martial arts. Like Water offers a unique perspective of the living legend as he trains with fellow fighters Lyoto \"The Dragon\" Machida, Junior Dos Santos, and Antonio \"Minotauro\" Nogueira, in preparation for his career defining title defense against challenger, and arch villain Chael Sonnen. A man of few words, Anderson Silva walks the fine line between cockiness and confidence. A philosopher in spirit, and dedicated family man, Silva\'s personality contradicts that of Sonnen\'s, who uses trash talk and intimidation to get under his opponents\' skin. Balancing family and fighting; respect for the sport, and rage for his opponent; Silva\'s mind and body will be put to the test, as first-time filmmaker Pablo Croce peels back the layers of an ultimate fighter to reveal the heart of a champion.','/wn5S1nVaoEeGHo3UNwtuV9nySz8.jpg','2011-10-06',76,'Released',NULL,'Anderson Silva: Like Water',92117,1.1163,6.1,'Jh6DdqbyAK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31174,_binary '\0','/cRDXDysyWRh3b2UquaBykvoZRLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1872880',6.5,5878,'fr','Un bonheur n\'arrive jamais seul','Sacha is a real seducer, a man with no ties or emotional or professional. Charlotte is a modern and independent woman, but barely has time to care for their three children. While Sacha and Charlotte are, at first glance, two incompatible beings, when they meet soon discover that they are quite complementary and need each other.','/lBFwkGYizI2jZLRpfL1i1cBLZY3.jpg','2012-06-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Happiness Never Comes Alone',121936,3.3549,6.1,'OjicLKOJQic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31175,_binary '\0','/3cjFnCq39CYvuPvfCDNK2YZum2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1874513',7.4,1301,'en','God Loves Uganda','A powerful exploration of the evangelical campaign to infuse African culture with values imported from America\'s Christian Right. The film follows American and Ugandan religious leaders fighting sexual immorality and missionaries trying to convince Ugandans to follow biblical law.','/psoBX5RD77Sa2gvfE4M84UiC9Oh.jpg','2013-10-11',83,'Released','Have you heard the Good News?','God Loves Uganda',159006,1.014,6.6,'m3_hKv4pEM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31176,_binary '\0','/nekTKLIsanzVGWK75WZBRBccOhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1874522',7.7,4939,'fa','اینجا بدون من','The story is about the world of a small family with familiar dreams and not so remarkable problems. The mother is trying to lead everything to save her family, but small events disarrange all her plans.','/c6YTj92ytJqFH37u3dgX8rbg9tC.jpg','2011-03-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Here Without Me',253988,1.2039,7.227,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31177,_binary '\0','/pUptUgPYwdNVSzMNRcUUs7WZ2Ap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18747542',6.7,6961,'de','Faraway','Zeynap Altin is at the end of her tether: she works far too much and is not valued at all by her husband, daughter and father. To make matters worse, the funeral home dressed her beloved late mother in a man\'s suit instead of her favorite dress. Enough is enough: Zeynep flees from Munich to the previously unknown holiday home on a Croatian island that her mother secretly bought years ago - with the hope of finding quiet, peace and herself there. If only the previous owner Josip, a rough islander, didn\'t still live on the same property and annoy her with his views and wisdom.','/v4czyy4HQuOMQtGCCB9N6JcvJwT.jpg','2023-03-08',109,'Released',NULL,'Faraway',1081291,2.7041,6.544,'2stkk0yy0ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31178,_binary '\0','/1hup7l6zMVNHTToava3jMTgXLCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1874757',6.9,2270,'en','The Good Witch\'s Family','A young witch visits her cousin in a small town during a heated mayoral election race. Her kind-hearted cousin, the town’s beloved “good witch” and newlywed with two teenage step-kids, is running for office, but must keep her family from falling apart when their visitor uses her magic to put them—and the whole town—under her bitter spell.','/ywsP21sGXXzui0gk1sVMAZ751Sh.jpg','2011-10-29',85,'Released',NULL,'The Good Witch\'s Family',81033,2.2036,7.3,'G6B634nnooc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31179,_binary '\0','/xvwHM3h60LLIg8Ci1TwtU7be9dZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876261',2.5,2031,'en','Bigfoot','A rock concert awakens the legendary monster, who goes on a rampage. The event\'s organizer plans to kill the beast and create a tourist attraction around its stuffed body, but an environmentalist realizes the creature is the last of its species, and is determined to make sure it does not become extinct.','/j5ZuJTEzPxyifFTYs1BvGRQfLb3.jpg','2012-10-28',89,'Released','The legend is alive!','Bigfoot',117856,2.4574,3.1,'JyrJxlFNPgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31180,_binary '\0','/lLjWX6HuGGxuFJ9aJ9gBcSJzzDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876277',7.1,23592,'no','Into the White','During World War II, enemy fighter pilots find themselves face to face after shooting down one another\'s planes over a desolate landscape. In order to survive, they must set aside the rules of war.','/bk9RD0kH51GoDURk7xgWDoTcRl7.jpg','2012-03-09',104,'Released','Inspired by the true world war II story.','Into the White',78215,3.1642,6.9,'MpcFKka5MEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31181,_binary '\0','/mAhfIvCrLGRLsBQfKZCgIP9ICbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876330',5.5,1553,'en','Hello Herman','Set in the not so distant future, in Any Town USA, sixteen-years-old Herman Howards makes a fateful decision. He enters his suburban school and kills thirty nine students, two teachers, and a police officer. Just before his arrest, he emails his idol, famous journalist Lax Morales, sending him clips of the shootings captured with Herman\'s own digital camera. In the clips Herman tells Lax, \"I want to tell my story on your show\". Lax, haunted by his own past, is now face to face with Herman.','/nbG49b8cPgUBIC1k41o5LiUVDqq.jpg','2012-10-20',88,'Released','No one just becomes a murderer.','Hello Herman',138977,2.4697,5.8,'h7Lz_iS5cYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31182,_binary '\0','/zmSOXIgYhuZfTaSNespeJianIUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876349',3.1,2101,'en','Jersey Shore Shark Attack','Many years ago, hundreds of locals and tourists were massacred by giant man-eating sharks in the infamous 1916 Jersey Shore attacks. But that\'s just a legend... or is it? It\'s a holiday weekend on the Jersey Shore and, unbeknownst to anyone, underwater drills have attracted dozens of albino bull sharks to the pier. When a man goes missing, TC (The Complication), Nookie and friends fear the worst and plead with the police chief to close down the beach. It isn\'t until a famous singer is eaten alive during a performance on the pier that the shark hunt begins. Now, the Preppies must work together with the Guidos in order to save the Jersey Shore and its inhabitants from another vicious slaughter.','/iXICsou2NwPuIrcCyap0bpUxcSR.jpg','2012-06-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Jersey Shore Shark Attack',114003,2.2101,4.6,'8IHehF8BCuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31183,_binary '\0','/vSxv28xBdueSvzKcrtgVI8MARfC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876373',6.1,2031,'en','Lost & Found in Armenia','A US Senator\'s son who attempts to forget the break up of his fiancée is forced to vacation in Turkey by his best friends. A para-sailing trip mishap lands him in a small village in Armenia, where he is accused of being a spy. It is there he meets a young woman who helps him to escape from misfortune.','/ywQ4XnPydnmuGwT3QiV839VA1XC.jpg','2012-11-21',100,'Released','What happens in Armenia...','Lost & Found in Armenia',199656,3.3957,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31184,_binary '\0','/35CW8S5lnxZAebyBoqKASuMVw6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876446',3.9,1499,'en','Snowmageddon','An Alaskan town is in danger of destruction by a mystical snow globe that appears on a family\'s doorstep, wrapped like a Christmas gift, and causes deadly \"natural\" disasters in their own town, while simultaneously occurring in the snow globe.','/tCToeT0GjHCEEIGA8n4tJFavYx6.jpg','2011-12-10',86,'Released','Hell has frozen over.','Snowmageddon',81179,3.0169,5.6,'XTw2yw_9GWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31185,_binary '\0','/fnLxM63B6g9Q6VIhCTypLiz61Y7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876451',5.8,6918,'en','Sparkle','Musical prodigy, Sparkle struggles to become a star while overcoming issues that are tearing her family apart. From an affluent Detroit area and daughter to a single mother, she tries to balance a new romance with music manager Stix while dealing with the unexpected challenges her new life will bring as she and her two sisters strive to become a dynamic singing group during the Motown-era.','/6LqVIhz0xxoFjiGjftDW69DbvNi.jpg','2012-08-17',116,'Released','Celebrate the legend','Sparkle',88036,2.7202,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31186,_binary '\0','/vBsR4DOA0HKHOpFQ2ePq2QCKMSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1876547',4,6115,'en','Zombie Apocalypse','Months after a zombie plague has wiped out 90 percent of the American population, a small group of survivors fight their way cross-country to a rumored refuge on the island of Catalina.','/vaOFYHJns2S3aOMTGNeJs49QNBN.jpg','2011-10-29',90,'Released','Mankind Survived... But Not Alive.','Zombie Apocalypse',75735,3.181,5.2,'3qYI4BmdVAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31187,_binary '\0','/tIHNc6240dif2H8lzsuahPTCvxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1877543',4.8,7479,'en','247°F','Four friends travel to a lakeside cabin for a carefree weekend, but the fun turns into a nightmare when 3 of them end up locked in a hot sauna. Every minute counts and every degree matters as they fight for their lives in the heat up to 247°F.','/1lkaFSVU0tN3z21CJV98P9dseMe.jpg','2011-09-01',88,'Released','Every Degree Matters','247°F',137145,2.6134,5.5,'0X08so-BfFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31188,_binary '\0','/cxO9eE1rxKSSKb70drj4RgDOOlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1877740',6.9,1244,'en','Five','An anthology of five short films exploring the impact of breast cancer on people\'s lives.','/xK8mQE7RlZCfSpN2pZbVgpM7TjK.jpg','2011-10-10',87,'Released','Direct Your Power','Five',77261,2.2204,7.1,'J_ZBaLpNOUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31189,_binary '\0','/rvtdN5XkWAfGX6xDuPL6yYS2seK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1877830',7.8,949026,'en','The Batman','In his second year of fighting crime, Batman uncovers corruption in Gotham City that connects to his own family while facing a serial killer known as the Riddler.','/74xTEgt7R36Fpooo50r9T25onhq.jpg','2022-03-01',177,'Released'