10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31194,_binary '\0','/uCn0Pqa4D5RjXcbBzTneiUO2Sik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1879012',3.1,2243,'en','Night of the Living Dead: Re-Animation','After inheriting the family mortuary, a pyrophobic mortician accidentally exposes hundreds of un-cremated bodies to toxic medical waste. As the corpses re-animate, the mortician\'s inheritance-seeking younger brother unexpectantly shows up, stumbling upon a full zombie outbreak!','/oZwmgcATMp0CqiaMIWkIGXaFAnf.jpg','2012-10-16',88,'Released','The Beginning of the End','Night of the Living Dead: Re-Animation',95667,1.9305,6.1,'-TmIUIL5K-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31195,_binary '\0','/oZtoyj3rhOST8FUtIXUqblIYmCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1879016',6.6,44767,'en','Operation Mincemeat','In 1943, two British intelligence officers concoct Operation Mincemeat, wherein their plan to drop a corpse with false papers off the coast of Spain would fool Nazi spies into believing the Allied forces were planning to attack by way of Greece rather than Sicily.','/tfdfh1mK24VujxT5z11732asxdR.jpg','2022-04-01',128,'Released','Deception. The greatest weapon in war.','Operation Mincemeat',661231,6.7648,6.5,'YQ7ZXOXHZ20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31196,_binary '\0','/zbTaYrQzZaaEf1SZlv3RTZiUvZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1879030',5.4,10082,'fr','Q','In a social context deteriorated by a countrywide economic crisis, the life of several people will be turned upside down after they meet Cécile, a character who symbolizes desire.','/wxvvNXY3n0637cOcdeC61eyVAnC.jpg','2011-10-06',103,'Released','Love, desire and complications...','Desire',86331,9.0514,6.318,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31197,_binary '\0','/wQfBP2dSauy1S0YZQmYD4L30c4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1879032',5.2,13440,'en','Rapture-Palooza','Two teens battle their way through a religious apocalypse on a mission to defeat the Antichrist.','/9yc5UCe3i5mrHuIWsGgsKfI37rd.jpg','2013-06-07',85,'Released','A match made in hell','Rapture-Palooza',174188,3.594,5.1,'9oaS_N1zsqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31198,_binary '\0','/mRnceZhq19AoJf97ueVX7lhAUl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1880399',6.9,21907,'en','Kodachrome','Matt Ryder is convinced to drive his estranged and dying father Benjamin Ryder cross country to deliver four old rolls of Kodachrome film to the last lab in the world that can develop them before it shuts down for good. Along with Ben\'s nurse Zooey, the three navigate a world changing from analogue to digital while trying to put the past behind them.','/mseyc8v3UD1DhaZ3kSdXs4Dj9Xf.jpg','2017-09-08',105,'Released','Over time, everything develops','Kodachrome',419635,4.9042,6.8,'g3IvVejktJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31199,_binary '\0','/chGIywoxl6v4hx0jywFPAS5gTm9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1880415',5.7,1235,'en','Battlecreek','Henry is a loner and a night owl. His rare skin disease has kept him under the close watch of his fiery mother, who has sheltered him his entire life. One night, a young woman\'s car breaks down and Henry\'s life will change forever.','/H2BFmmx3M3RJNv7CiovUvvf27h.jpg','2017-11-03',97,'Released','Some scars never heal.','Battlecreek',346699,1.3726,5.9,'rMSP6i7KrHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31200,_binary '\0','/ek5Yac53PCliZVpIVRLRRSseRjr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1880418',6.3,1717,'en','Newlyweds','A newlywed couple\'s honeymoon is upended by the arrivals of their respective sisters.','/t09NlDBh0z1HEhPu6Xs5c4hRk64.jpg','2011-12-26',85,'Released',NULL,'Newlyweds',72766,1.9988,5.9,'xl1Q4TnAWiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31201,_binary '\0','/8LYxSH8ZJzKbS3kNIELsVc05RNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1881002',5.6,49137,'en','Maggie','There\'s a deadly zombie epidemic threatening humanity, but Wade, a small-town farmer and family man, refuses to accept defeat even when his daughter Maggie becomes infected. As Maggie\'s condition worsens and the authorities seek to eradicate those with the virus, Wade is pushed to the limits in an effort to protect her. Joely Richardson co-stars in this post-apocalyptic thriller.','/twa9gXjocLM629sJrQYVtmF306R.jpg','2015-05-08',95,'Released','Don\'t Get Bitten.','Maggie',287424,8.8837,5.4,'UgjrjR42Ado','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31202,_binary '\0','/eJnLlH11bFzTILVHZPCpRQmL6Nr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1881010',8.3,1562,'kn','ಮಿಲನ','Hero is in love with a girl who is forced to marry a police officer. Hero is later forced by his parents to marry a girl liked by them. Here starts the trouble again, even she wants a divorce from him. Will hero divorce her or they are happy with each other is the later part of the story','/gw6sfKGRG6vy9OcZDu5HgBUP81o.jpg','2007-09-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Milana',521400,2.3408,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (31203,_binary '\0','/4YubhOmbxTSdnMBhjQGngd7TSao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1881024',5.1,5220,'en','One in the Chamber','A seasoned assassin plays both sides in a Russian gang war and becomes the target of an unknown enemy.','/QQu9v0AwjO0fIj4pnpiBYhGk0T.jpg','2012-08-21',91,'Released','When killers collide, every bullet counts.','One in the Chamber',122924,4.7392,5.512,'U8nw8r0xRoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31204,_binary '\0','/bchA8NdPsP6UhJXrnixOmZOFDQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1881060',5.3,3832,'en','Static','A couple facing marital problems after losing their child finds their life together further complicated by a mysterious visitor.','/ecPbDVrirQgXcjOrwfyFBOQmq1S.jpg','2012-10-31',83,'Released','If you hear them coming, you\'re already dead.','Static',165567,2.2243,5.2,'iJpmoSBScsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31205,_binary '\0','/yvxHC0wZyuH1ZnxmjpVrEuggzv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1881109',4.6,3963,'en','Zeroville','A young actor arrives in Hollywood in 1969 during a transitional time in the Industry.','/6LrlFzEOW45jrG84kTrGqlYKQHZ.jpg','2019-09-19',96,'Released','Sex, cinema and punk rock. 1969','Zeroville',291867,3.3723,5,'0EAgfxPHvo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31206,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18815884',6.3,6251,'hi','Kaal Trighori','Three nights waited a hundred years… to give birth to the Trighori and Three lives are ensnared in this Vicious cycle. When Reality begins to blur one question remains: is this a perfectly crafted trap… or is something far more sinister at play?','/bFwWxy1e6FGIoEAh3z4Y7KKwMmT.jpg','2025-11-14',159,'Released',NULL,'Kaal Trighori',962851,1.9403,0,'MxYLzgyWxKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31207,_binary '\0','/lJXHuyY622HcA0RHJvkeJcvzamK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18816518',7.1,24509,'no','Syk pike','Increasingly overshadowed by her boyfriend\'s recent rise to fame as a contemporary artist creating sculptures from stolen furniture, Signe hatches a vicious plan to reclaim her rightfully deserved attention within the milieu of Oslo\'s cultural elite.','/ynePU5z7JFn2Gf82RmfZgV84H8X.jpg','2022-09-09',97,'Released','An unromantic comedy.','Sick of Myself',788734,4.1563,7.2,'B9YYTs2HBBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31208,_binary '\0','/zYTUdAeUwHZLFqZXvMLhd1oOszh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1883121',7.3,3823,'hi','404: Error Not Found','A brilliant student starts hallucinating after moving into a room that was occupied by another who committed suicide.','/1B1jyibEUknWeeoUc5OpsitQyAO.jpg','2011-05-20',121,'Released',NULL,'404: Error Not Found',71481,1.0035,6.404,'5TxnwlDn7w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31209,_binary '\0','/gNBrmb0zabXmRY1IKVgcBXSo2F0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1883180',6.9,20681,'sv','En duva satt på en gren och funderade på tillvaron','An absurdist, surrealistic and shocking pitch-black comedy, which moves freely from nightmare to fantasy to hilariously deadpan humour as it muses on man’s perpetual inhumanity to man.','/h2uRIr0fNpZbTGH5youi7MDRL2T.jpg','2014-10-24',101,'Released',NULL,'A Pigeon Sat on a Branch Reflecting on Existence',110390,5.5873,6.9,'iy8PWgf8lvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31210,_binary '\0','/yE6WGAjRd0G6fEcEp3nPQNTFGuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1883251',7.5,2895,'en','Louis Theroux: America\'s Most Hated Family in Crisis','Following up on his 2007 documentary, The Most Hated Family in America, Louis Theroux returns to Topeka, Kansas, for a week-long visit with the Westboro Baptist Church. He again joins the Phelps family on their controversial pickets where they try to antagonise communities with offensive slogans and anti-gay placards. But four years on from Louis\'s last visit, there are signs of disarray in the Phelps clan. A series of defections of family members has shaken up the church.','/xwhHpR1gEc0tcHOPEBPIZrpgh4K.jpg','2011-08-14',60,'Released','Return to the Most Hated Church in America','Louis Theroux: America\'s Most Hated Family in Crisis',206953,1.1825,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31211,_binary '\0','/b2AfxdTbNifN9cAH8KVqH51Y4VS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1883367',2.7,23493,'en','The Human Centipede 3 (Final Sequence)','Taking inspiration from The Human Centipede films, the warden of a notorious and troubled prison looks to create a 500-person human centipede as a solution to his problems.','/xUk5AGcGvybPBvvMqrDPbAFAknD.jpg','2015-05-22',103,'Released','100% politically incorrect.','The Human Centipede 3 (Final Sequence)',94365,8.1263,3.7,'Pijm_Cgc5g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31212,_binary '\0','/jU8W4GzmyYaW0vgLqv35kEG71O5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1884268',6.9,3967,'hi','Chalo Dilli','Mihika, an investment banker, misses her flight to Delhi and meets Manu Gupta, a very talkative man. In order to reach Delhi on time, she must tag along with him on a road trip and put up with his antics.','/xUyG3BBvc9xokTR5mNjSjuHakR8.jpg','2011-04-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Chalo Dilli',63468,1.798,6.173,'khRB85bwj-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31213,_binary '\0','/f3sRsJvwFV8VISy72L7iUDpdWOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1884318',3.5,2704,'en','Girls Gone Dead','A group of six ex-high school cheerleaders are stalked by a killer with a medieval war hammer and battle axe during their first Spring Break from college.','/h4fkp6KuY55vocpkInbFeXOSrgT.jpg','2012-03-28',104,'Released',NULL,'Girls Gone Dead',117942,2.3479,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31214,_binary '\0','/r8ZoopMHBVhIqIhvvxJRQjtkRr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1884369',4.7,2342,'en','Noobz','Four friends hit the road to LA to compete in the Cyberbowl Video Game Championship, but will they be able to compete with the worst hangovers of their lives?','/6MpGb2U26E4n9OYYicleucaNHbe.jpg','2013-01-25',100,'Released','Regular Guys, Virtual Heroes.','Noobz',120802,1.8939,5.8,'TB1zJU08IiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31215,_binary '\0','/mRcHE8RVBMoZIDWpBXrSmKWp4cE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1884457',5,4698,'en','The Package','A courier for a local crime lord must deliver a mysterious package while being chased by a horde of unusual gangsters.','/jBJ0IbG0zUdvbemRsHBAYvOtxH2.jpg','2013-02-09',95,'Released','Vengeance delivered.','The Package',146578,3.3301,5.2,'CCx5eJ6gNoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31216,_binary '\0','/qpblcOrASbFWNJnmdaZSC3fznXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885265',5.8,8706,'en','Good Deeds','For all his life, wealthy businessman Wesley Deeds has done what\'s expected of him and has settled into a predictable routine. His scripted life begins to change, however, when he meets Lindsey Wakefield, a struggling single mother who works as a night janitor for his corporation and has just been evicted. He offers to help Lindsey get back on her feet and, though he\'s already engaged, romantic sparks begin to fly. Suddenly, he finds himself torn between what is expected of him and what he really wants.','/vIiWJq4WPcTfaIH8VkVlU2irzXo.jpg','2012-02-23',129,'Released','Wesley Deeds is about to discover the person he was meant to be.','Good Deeds',62008,2.3244,6.3,'HaO8f_eA4aM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31217,_binary '\0','/vfpzVkHhKF2cvUHo9oU0RaJRirn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885281',7.6,2988,'de','Klitschko','Klitschko tells the captivating story of the boxing worlds most famous brothers: Vitali and Wladimir Klitschko. From the socialist drill of their childhood in the Ukraine, and their first successes as amateurs, to their move to Germany and subsequent rise as international stars on the verge of holding the championship titles of all five boxing federations (Wladimir secured this with his unanimous World Boxing Association win against David Haye on July 2nd, 2011). Along the way they experience defeats and setbacks, low points and triumphant comebacks as well as conflicts with each other. Exciting conversations with companions and opponents, including the very first with the Klitschkos parents, give insight into their personal lives, plus never-before-seen footage of the draining preparations for a fight, and the spectacular boxing matches. Director Sebastian Dehnhardt composes an intimate and fascinating portrait of two exceptional athletes who are, before all else, brothers.','/6kiCtOWdB73dLeTQMv6YbIeDaK4.jpg','2011-06-16',118,'Released',NULL,'Klitschko',70808,1.6956,6.8,'uoFoy3aa7dA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31218,_binary '\0','/1PgKayi51XgITYGp0J770AnqZAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885299',6.1,4390,'en','Lucky Them','More interested in partying and flirting with young musicians than work, veteran rock journalist Ellie Klug has one last chance to prove her value to her magazine’s editor: a no-stone-unturned search to discover what really happened to long lost rock god, Matt Smith, who also happens to be her ex-boyfriend. Teaming up with an eccentric amateur documentary filmmaker, Ellie hits the road in search of answers.','/5DxrA5t9synimM571W8G9c1YRTx.jpg','2013-09-06',96,'Released','Revisit your past. Rewrite your future.','Lucky Them',214096,2.9321,6,'oW8EBhjflL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31219,_binary '\0','/uNP27yOuXSEtiKxcobj3wcfSHd2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885300',6.4,10313,'en','Best Man Down','A newlywed couple cancels their honeymoon and returns to the snowy Midwest to make the funeral arrangements for their best man, who died unexpectedly after their ceremony.','/iJOjvFV0a5znaeMVD8v7Xp51g4c.jpg','2012-10-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Best Man Down',138222,2.6136,6.6,'bcf44Ws1JFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31220,_binary '\0','/2Fnp8bGCG2V6uB66C3uc7LDRS0f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885331',6.1,4123,'fr','Paris-Manhattan','Alice, an obsessed Woody Allen fan, meets Pierre in a night-club and falls in love with him. But when Pierre sees Alice\'s sister Hélène, things start to get complicated.','/7ojaHghrQL9POiX6lm8mmsirGrH.jpg','2012-07-18',79,'Released','Two cities. One hopeless romantic.','Paris-Manhattan',123235,2.6587,5.4,'XWnNkCInmow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31221,_binary '\0','/hKh0spHrLSrtCjfPrv6wE5UYauC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1885440',6.6,1378,'en','We\'ll Take Manhattan','We’ll Take Manhattan explores the explosive love affair between sixties supermodel Jean Shrimpton and photographer David Bailey. Focusing on a wild and unpredictable 1962 Vogue photo shoot in New York, the drama brings to life the story of two young people falling in love, misbehaving and inadvertently defining the style of the Sixties along the way.','/52NYXOykIJ4LKzM1PyvNLXw1gU2.jpg','2012-01-26',90,'Released',NULL,'We\'ll Take Manhattan',85696,2.4434,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31222,_binary '\0','/yl52nn4i81rNxtzcBIhgMSsYTaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1886493',4.6,18442,'en','Catch.44','The lives of three female assassins take a sudden turn when their charming boss lures them into one last job. They soon find themselves thrust into a bizarre situation involving a psychotic hit man, a grizzled trucker and a delusional line cook.','/mbDQA2a3H9CbEHr7bDkaqxAGDO1.jpg','2011-12-08',93,'Released','If you are going down, take everyone with you','Catch.44',75736,4.701,5,'GE2CV47Hc7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31223,_binary '\0','/jeyARHiVTAMLKfIx8BwEt7hhbqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1886502',6.8,2547,'it','Corpo celeste','After growing up in Switzerland, 13-year-old Marta returns to a city in southern Italy with her mother and older sister. Independent and inquisitive, she joins a catechism class at a local church. However, the games and religious pop songs she encounters there do not nearly satisfy her interest in faith. Struggling to find her place, Marta pushes the boundaries of the class, the priest, and the church.','/6I0bvojngNbc7qGlDcTsfrhWBcb.jpg','2011-05-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Corpo Celeste',64835,1.8536,6.9,'TS3SrQaRqmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31224,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1886531',6.5,3826,'tr','Entelköy Efeköy\'e Karşı',NULL,'/7GzHekgtXDlKaGtLxUt1SfYZz6N.jpg','2011-12-02',111,'Released',NULL,'Ecotopia',109146,1.3805,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31225,_binary '\0','/4zxojwUwMYHwAAzPGv2saJSs5Nq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1886644',2.9,4204,'en','Piranhaconda','A hybrid creature - half piranha and half anaconda -- attacks a low-budget horror movie crew on location near her nest when her egg is stolen. Now they must outrun and kill the deadly piranhaconda as well as stop the mad scientist who stole the egg - before they all become dinner.','/oqgQghwDwyv4PzyaoMUnhgtiCjt.jpg','2012-06-16',90,'Released','Part Snake! Part Fish! All Killer!','Piranhaconda',115084,3.4152,4.9,'fcDaxyLfrNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31226,_binary '\0','/mC763biJd67eykSXLeJlpGoEjaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1887703',3.5,1772,'en','Collision Earth','A huge solar flare blasts Mercury out of it\'s orbit and provides it with an intense magnetic field and it\'s on collision course for Earth.','/4bJgb47iOM6LvbkdQtkMBtb4fhr.jpg','2011-03-24',86,'Released','When Planets Collide','Collision Earth',85949,2.4883,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31227,_binary '\0','/5tMDTMU0kesMEecbI0tX1Zve8KQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1887748',4.5,1467,'en','Sawney: Flesh of Man','Religious psychopath Sawney stalks Scotland abducting unholy souls for his communion of sacrifices. With his insane family of inbred killers, Sawney tortures and eats their victims saving the best morsels for a chained-up figure in their cavernous Highlands lair. As the Missing Persons list rises investigative crime journalist Hamish MacDonald writes sensational and damming headlines against the police, due to their incompetence in handling the case. After his fiancée is kidnapped by the cannibal clan Hamish investigates the heinous crimes on his own with disastrous results. For there’s something he doesn’t know about the case that’s crucial to solving it…','/jjylZgPZuXq2fT5enAm8QA8aDph.jpg','2012-08-22',89,'Released',NULL,'Sawney: Flesh of Man',160128,1.9844,4.8,'L522EOtIJf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31228,_binary '\0','/vY5rcfEqV5kpMuw2pdY7BTbkGTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1887763',6.4,3253,'hi','हॉन्टेड','A real estate agent traveling to a haunted mansion in Himachal Pradesh time-travels to 1936 to save a young woman from a rapist spirit who has kept her soul trapped in the house for decades.','/enab9pHxda3bcaRpPDAnIJv1voa.jpg','2011-05-05',143,'Released','India\'s first Stereoscopic 3D film','Haunted',68758,1.077,5.8,'1g8a96rw-Jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31229,_binary '\0','/nOBF2SWJG7ODvIR7H6pBvIX7esU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1887785',6.6,1644,'it','La leggenda di Kaspar Hauser','Arriving on a deserted beach in the Mediterranean sea, in a time and a place unspecified, Kaspar Hauser is forced to confront the evil of a Grand Duchess who feels threatened by the power she exercises over the community.','/186Rl8qNhOHXWN6cMYs1sHFDUwi.jpg','2013-06-13',95,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Kaspar Hauser',124091,1.3996,5.8,'gGDhlqYbfik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31230,_binary '\0','/9LsZh2O1sidMvxKuMCI9RDzdZj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18884172',3.9,1741,'en','Crescent City','When a ruthless serial killer terrorizes a small Southern town, everyone becomes a suspect -- including local authorities. As the body count rises and the dark mystery deepens, the chief detective becomes haunted by the horrors of his past.','/kWwIkWextuqVUvAEM9DwJfEfkKe.jpg','2024-08-16',103,'Released','Some sins are unforgivable.','Crescent City',1245708,4.9998,6.1,'jrI-8ScanDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31231,_binary '\0','/gycBJ7rtVZyfR9ijkhAzNEunleI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18884832',6.1,1340,'en','Christmas Class Reunion','High school classmates, who once dubbed themselves the “cursed class,” reconnect at Christmas for their 15-year reunion. Over the course of their time reconnecting, the classmates challenge each other to remember who they were, who they are, and who they want to be.','/1sYxuse7fhYQ0Zej8Z0tGizD9uu.jpg','2022-12-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Class Reunion',1028537,1.8392,5.7,'uUey_4BcoXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31232,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1889440',5.5,1960,'te','Teen Maar','Michael Velayudham is a chef specialized in Italian cuisine in Cape Town. He falls in love with Meera Sasthri - another Indian staying in Cape Town. Meera is a restoration specialist and she is moving to India. Since it is not possible to continue the relationship across the seas, they bid good bye to each other. Michael finds a local white girl in Cape Town and Meera finds a local politician back in India. The rest of the story is all about how their true love unites them despite them being so casual about their relationship. There is also another story dealing with Arjun Palwai that runs parallel with a time difference of 30 years in Waranasi.','/kUnBF7h9PtJmOy9mxzFsjGoeVJz.jpg','2011-04-14',150,'Released','Celebration Of Love','Teen Maar',63377,0.897,4.115,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31233,_binary '\0','/ehiMVFVHtgoGwyJ0cIXP3mmHe0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890363',7.1,8216,'hi','Buddha in a Traffic Jam','Vikram is a happy-go-lucky management student from a top Business School of India. He becomes an overnight sensation after a successful internet campaign against the radical fundamentalism of moral policing in India. This prompts his university teacher - Professor Ranjan Batki, to throw him a challenge for yet another internet campaign that would help raise money via a non-profit Pottery Club for poor people living in Maoists areas of India. Little does Vikram know that he is about to become a part of a plot that would risk his life and the nation. He gets entangled between two corrupt facets of India - Socialism and Capitalism, both of which are deeply rooted in India. It\'s a story inspired from true life incidents of Underbelly India.','/bAia8POGJHaSLL9RCdo99ZNClKG.jpg','2016-05-13',114,'Released',NULL,'Buddha in a Traffic Jam',394034,1.254,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31234,_binary '\0','/4Ni6C84ai3hd4hIW6vgiViW0L1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890373',6.7,6076,'de','Kriegerin','Marisa, a 20-year-old German girl, hates foreigners, Jews, cops, and everyone she finds guilty for the decline of her country. She provokes, drinks, fights and her next tattoo will be a portrait of Adolf Hitler. But Marisa\'s convictions begin to crumble when she meets a young Afghan refugee, and she learns that the black and white principles of her gang are not the only way.','/nsMjsaBMkZgXaUzW3YmvIAHE2oC.jpg','2011-06-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Combat Girls',82529,2.2858,6.656,'fSQVf1KQxDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31235,_binary '\0','/3Yr5QWfsktABMZKz7vfq8YlQh3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890375',4.8,3308,'en','Crawlspace','A group of elite soldiers sent to infiltrate and extract the lead science team from Pine Gap, Australia\'s top secret underground military compound, after it comes under attack from unknown forces. The mission is compromised when they encounter a young woman with no memory of who she is or how she came to be there. As they try to escape, the group quickly discovers all is not as it seems and the facility has become a testing ground for something far more sinister.','/bO7buGzOASNZIhM994zChemLzml.jpg','2012-05-01',89,'Released','In this space everyone can hear you scream','Crawlspace',138496,2.2893,4.8,'kB68WJDhWbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31236,_binary '\0','/gsRrlhzABinh3QNFZZOm2Lz4uJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890377',5.5,2107,'fr','Bienvenue à bord','Isabelle, HR of a large cruise company, made the mistake of choosing her boss as a lover. Before embarking on the maiden voyage of the new flagship of the fleet, though, he decided to disembark from their relationship! Some women take their revenge by poison, firearm, or slander. Isabelle chooses Remy a flamboyant, unemployed ne\'er-do-well who flunked out in life on land, but after all is said and done, might have better luck at sea... She recruits him as leader of her plot and on this Palace of the Seas, Remy will first prove to be the worst nightmare of the CEO and Richard, the Cruise Director...then, little by little, he will change his life and that of all those who cross his path...','/k4gweAvrUR4H4hjJTPucPOO0mlw.jpg','2011-10-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Welcome Aboard',75198,2.1472,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31237,_binary '\0','/qXb05u6Kp87Ufc6w15laBjyvS42.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890493',6.5,4351,'te','ఊసరవెల్లి','A youngster, who does anything for money, avenges on those who killed the family of Niharika.','/5gOZm6zPdTig01iZVG4m6t14G5W.jpg','2011-10-06',161,'Released','Vengeance With A Difference','Oosaravelli',80281,1.8185,5.294,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31238,_binary '\0','/p3ORaHGOhqbu57hXi1OAOAEIysD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1890513',5.1,3046,'hi','Ragini MMS','Out to relax and have fun at a farmhouse, a couple experience horror at the hands of an unknown entity','/eABMkxPnI3Rfkv0qJw0XyuXQ2iC.jpg','2011-05-13',93,'Released','They don\'t know it yet. It\'s a threesome!','Ragini MMS',66841,1.7083,4.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31239,_binary '\0','/8QQeg0k1d50fITG9B4gGIRcMybN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891755',6.2,11811,'ta','Billa II','Small-time diamond smuggler David befriends Goa-based gangster Abbasi. But when David begins to build inroads with an international gangster, Abbasi is not happy, and soon the two turn into bitter rivals.','/gADzX6C4pGHneBoU148LXFMDyMr.jpg','2012-07-13',140,'Released','Every man has a past. Every Don, a history.','Billa II',116185,1.4012,5.75,'beOgcOu-vQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31240,_binary '\0','/lTrgEroxngegsWxvCbwCtIune8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891757',8.2,9473,'ur','Bol','The patriarch of a religious Muslim family refuses to accept his intersex child, tearing his family apart.','/6hx1ogX91dxe4SGJ1MRHX9dLjp7.jpg','2011-06-24',165,'Released','If taking a life is a crime, why is giving a life not a crime?','Bol',70067,0.8388,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31241,_binary '\0','/yUc1EuUJ4hEXKePiqlWIkudERSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891769',7.3,4826,'fr','Le Tableau','Three characters living in an unfinished painting venture out into the real world in search of their creator to convince him to finish his work.','/ol4cgUIyw3FXFmJOILBowuGTZgI.jpg','2011-10-12',80,'Released','Break on through to the other side.','The Painting',98162,1.5322,7,'G5NNf1lrj2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31242,_binary '\0','/qccjMQvkhbindJhX9FrCK3V7QFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891788',6.7,1415,'it','È stato il figlio','The Ciraulo family lives in the miserable district of Palermo called \"Zen\". When one of their children dies in a shootout between mafia gangsters they receive compensation and buy a luxury black Volvo. Things go wrong when Trancredi, another son, takes the car out and damages the car door.','/3KRKbDrCUZFIZl8VgACYS5ISkuv.jpg','2012-09-01',90,'Released',NULL,'It Was the Son',121998,1.4177,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31243,_binary '\0','/4EnbdtRAYxbMWbK8JGaxMAgSXiY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891845',7.2,1447,'fr','Le Jour des Corneilles','In a cabin of the deep of the forest, a child and his father lead a wild and hard life in utmost isolation. The child grows up fearing and admiring his father, with the ghosts haunting the forest as his only companions. Until the day he discovers the neighbouring village and meets a young girl there, Manon. At her side, he discovers that love exists. From then on he won\'t cease to search for the place where his father\'s love for him is hiding.','/bkPuLais3EWSKME5bxjJ1Bzh4Sd.jpg','2012-10-23',90,'Released',NULL,'The Day of the Crows',137193,3.307,6.6,'2BSYIRFk4Dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31244,_binary '\0','/feBTSiXQvrs7PCVXvwCkXvOvwUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891884',4.5,8109,'hi','वंस अपॉन अ टाइम इन मुंबई-दोबारा','Shoaib\'s life takes a precarious turn when he finds himself pitted against a younger contemporary - not just in \"business\", but in love...','/guXvxt6hvZyQqHXGYuvujtuxcCQ.jpg','2013-08-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in Mumbai Dobaara!',208540,1.5829,4.926,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31245,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891892',6,2001,'nl','Quiz','A famous game show host is being harassed in a restaurant by a strange man who claims to have kidnapped his wife and daughter. A morbid game ensues in which the game show host turns out to be the contestant.','/1GjSXB3GYiK5DZpywrG8f93OgyM.jpg','2012-03-22',85,'Released','Not every question has an answer','Quiz',96823,0.9121,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31246,_binary '\0','/25aZiKfWh3kwqgIoGJfdod7uY8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891905',4.3,1280,'th','SeeFood','Pup, a bamboo shark, discovers egg sacs while playing around the ocean with his friends. When he sees human poachers stealing the eggs from his reef, Pup makes it his mission to save his family. As he leaves the sea and enters the beautiful, yet dangerous, world of humans he\'ll prove he isn\'t too small to save his family.','/jwHk1rQ334cnpRMCdJZ9EXI3zBg.jpg','2011-09-08',93,'Released',NULL,'SeeFood',79842,3.6073,4.909,'RtS67OMZq2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31247,_binary '\0','/AaHteIdpc4n8JohDJ1LBDPoYtU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891923',4.6,3350,'en','The Hoarder','Ella discovers a terrifying secret when she becomes trapped in an underground storage facility. To survive she must join forces with a group of strangers, each with something to hide.','/1ezp9Cu7weyUbigGSqmTbUTEHdh.jpg','2015-05-21',86,'Released','Some things should never be locked away.','The Hoarder',207270,2.7562,4.4,'YE5_wRXz7Jo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31248,_binary '\0','/hi7V8oFLw8OreWskCUEAkZhXjme.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891942',6.9,1838,'fr','Nicostratos le pélican','After his wife died a man refuses to go out and doesn\'t want to talk to his only son. Life has no meaning for him. One day his son finds a baby pelican and decides to leave the bird at home. Pelican helps the boy find his father again and revive him back to life ...','/mKdz4SQt4zHuUgYkneo4oPlSBny.jpg','2011-06-29',95,'Released',NULL,'Nicostratos the Pelican',79728,1.5432,6.45,'RsR1EzBYmpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31249,_binary '\0','/fVNl1NS6wGHhb9xrU9DdHutBi9v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1891974',6.5,3213,'ja','逆転裁判','Based primarily on the first game in the series, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney, the film focuses on rookie defense attorney Phoenix Wright, as he strives to protect his clients in various murder trials, including the death of his mentor, Mia Fey, and the accusation of rival prosecutor, Miles Edgeworth. Phoenix\'s greatest ally is Mia\'s younger sister Maya, a spirit medium whose body is possessed by Mia to communicate with him.','/j2QcDHN7nScDSLsnuS3tCXOl2SN.jpg','2012-02-11',135,'Released','Objection!','Ace Attorney',91694,2.0721,6.1,'Qt2De8YVsGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31250,_binary '\0','/nKDxMlDSQfiFuJSwbwG5q1BLQmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18923048',6.4,1567,'hi','Operation Romeo','Aditya Sharma and Neha Kasliwal are in a relationship which finds itself challenged one night when they’re out on a date and get harassed in the dead of the night by two men posing as policemen. Will the night change the course of their relationship?','/qTyR9BDP4OCRMYUhHBYszRpFXE1.jpg','2022-04-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Operation Romeo',957136,1.0621,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31251,_binary '\0','/fUl6pTtudCMcCG0XQDvn9dDe24N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18924506',5,10684,'en','2000 Mules','Bestselling author and award-winning filmmaker, Dinesh D’Souza, exposes widespread coordinated voter fraud in the 2020 election sufficient to change the overall outcome. Drawing on research provided by the election integrity group, True the Vote, “2000 Mules” offers two types of evidence: geotracking and video. The geotracking evidence, based on a database of ten trillion cell phone pings, exposes an elaborate network of professional operatives, called mules, delivering fraudulent votes to mail-in boxes in the five key states where the election was decided. Video evidence obtained from official surveillance cameras corroborates the cellular positioning data. The film concludes by exploring ways to assist in the prevention of election fraud in future democratic elections.','/nTz0ZDc2PdHpn07O37Jmq2vaSPV.jpg','2022-05-20',86,'Released','They thought we’d never find out. They were wrong.','2000 Mules',933554,1.8206,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31252,_binary '\0','/fdzpbJ0xdyjMUY4DqN6cOpESA1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18925334',7,164413,'en','Pearl','Trapped on her family’s isolated farm, Pearl must tend to her ailing father under the bitter and overbearing watch of her devout mother. Lusting for a glamorous life like she’s seen in the movies, Pearl’s ambitions, temptations, and repressions collide.','/ulBLIBqvdnf4H6JBt0OpMCU1ECn.jpg','2022-09-16',102,'Released','An X-traordinary origin story.','Pearl',949423,12.6754,7.236,'L5PW5r3pEOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31253,_binary '\0','/k4cFld0vF83NSCWICwQpBKE0d34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18926098',6.2,23985,'ta','விடாமுயற்சி','While struggling with his broken marriage, Arjun is pulled into a desperate search for his wife, Kayal, when she goes missing during a road trip.','/yx7AYFLoupzBfdfEAlDFuOiei2A.jpg','2025-02-06',151,'Released','Perseverance triumphs.','Vidaamuyarchi',949716,2.8355,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31254,_binary '\0','/uW7Km2jzTu6kcdpTuKZjo7SXLwT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1893195',6.6,8762,'it','A.C.A.B. - All Cops Are Bastards','A look at the controversial riot cops unit, told through the stories of three veteran cops and a young recruit.','/kXNJVhfmiYSN3XRH8UP1mqq7PNB.jpg','2012-01-27',105,'Released',NULL,'A.C.A.B. - All Cops Are Bastards',85739,2.3942,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31255,_binary '\0','/mAbDuA5s5fTkc8JltJGWYFkj6ml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1893218',6.5,3369,'en','Dear Santa','Crystal, a rich party girl, finds a little girl\'s letter to Santa asking for a new mother, and she vows to win over the father and daughter before the holidays.','/1UDzXg6R7K26aBjMpxk9WbQTrpm.jpg','2011-08-11',90,'Released','Dear Santa. North Pole.','Dear Santa',145312,1.747,6.3,'GneiCLjmVJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31256,_binary '\0','/b4sEuxxATT62LUkhEzmbIFkP73i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1893256',6.2,82770,'en','Hummingbird','Homeless and on the run from a military court martial, a damaged ex-special forces soldier navigating London\'s criminal underworld seizes an opportunity to assume another man\'s identity, transforming into an avenging angel in the process.','/m1EVOMMeCD75bBUPTfejSPzGDrb.jpg','2013-05-07',100,'Released','All roads don\'t lead to salvation.','Hummingbird',136418,10.9474,6.178,'8c77ONP5QnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31257,_binary '\0','/jLvL23gZ4J9I09v6nlgY1EiZtYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1893269',7.3,1380,'en','Kusama: Infinity','Now one of the world’s most celebrated artists, Yayoi Kusama broke free of the rigid society in which she was raised, and overcame sexism, racism, and mental illness to bring her artistic vision to the world stage. At 88 she lives in a mental hospital and continues to create art.','/o1gZE9QqU9F9ogNaoFO0lsa3EUP.jpg','2018-09-07',80,'Released',NULL,'Kusama: Infinity',490794,1.4707,7.2,'x8mdIB1WxHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31258,_binary '\0','/AmzVV7kqds8BJBXwnQtx5YpqFdU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1893273',6.7,25673,'en','The Last Letter from Your Lover','A young journalist in London becomes obsessed with a series of letters she discovers that recounts an intense star-crossed love affair from the 1960s.','/fDKK51YdOfu9pTmSRw7sHUhGFxm.jpg','2021-07-23',110,'Released','Don\'t leave your love story unwritten.','The Last Letter from Your Lover',638449,9.2487,7.3,'TUq8DwtmFCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31259,_binary '\0','/oGYsuHkVbFb6VVKH3xYgmaM4KUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18934038',4.9,1421,'ta','கருங்காப்பியம்','Set during the lockdown, Umayal Karthika deciding to spend time at a 100-year-old unkempt library in a bid to divert and heal from a heartbreak. From the sea of books, she picks up Karungaapiyam and with her reading different chapters, and her imagination about the stories comes to life.','/6ssa2D45PoAdp9lqb5r9reOsREr.jpg','2023-05-19',134,'Released',NULL,'Karungaapiyam',1090518,0.9378,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31260,_binary '\0','/aTkGKWi78hEDlnLJr3ksxPo2r0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18938680',5.7,1721,'id','Sayap-Sayap Patah','In 2018, the headquarters of the Mobile Brigade Command Headquarters in Kelapa Dua, Depok was attacked by terrorists who tried to break into the detention center and killed 5 members of Densus 88.','/tgX0uTSuNnigHe6FmlGI45jCCzf.jpg','2022-08-18',110,'Released','Unforgettable Tragedy.','Broken Wings',950236,0.8458,6.4,'jiK1A3BhEBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31261,_binary '\0','/w4zq7R4OKc80vJReFC7eDq4VHgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18938922',5.1,1377,'en','Seize Them!','An arrogant queen becomes a fugitive in her own land after being overthrown by a charismatic revolutionary and must face hardship and danger as she embarks on a voyage to win back her throne.','/mh9jNSpTaFvOwYXyILvfOEEJHhm.jpg','2024-04-05',91,'Released','Sucks to be queen.','Seize Them!',954802,1.7139,5.7,'BBMib2Nfu8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31262,_binary '\0','/d7Z7M83ZbYYN8qb1zltztAT0Tq1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt18939362',5.4,33020,'hi','निकिता रॉय','A woman\'s scepticism about the supernatural is challenged when she looks into the mysterious death of her brother and its connection to a religious cult.','/aFJQSWies9Qw2NwBORneBCgFlG3.jpg','2025-07-18',112,'Released',NULL,'Nikita Roy',1005156,1.2641,4.8,'zqwywHHZ54c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31263,_binary '\0','/tCdypgid7Meg3qpmvquUA9qqLNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1894476',6.4,33908,'en','How I Live Now','An American girl, sent to the English countryside to stay with relatives, finds love and purpose while fighting for her survival as war envelops the world around her.','/4drLEdRSIzKZOKLsM79kBvsuq18.jpg','2013-09-10',101,'Released','Love will lead you home','How I Live Now',162215,5.8587,6.6,'0wDXdqnPtiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31264,_binary '\0','/quSMvDhlcxrKnhWV8rMIvfd3gTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1894561',6.1,1992,'en','Cowgirls n\' Angels','A group of rodeo trick-riders recruits a young girl to join them.','/eTOqYI7m