,'Released',NULL,'Arirang',104858,0.6707,6.4,'pMiOYp3RQuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31358,_binary '\0','/6KmUwyVzHTaq30Q3LWfNeFj2lcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922561',7,3035,'ko','북촌방향','A film director who no longer makes films arrives in Seoul to meet a close friend. When the friend doesn\'t show up, he wanders the city aimlessly for three days, grabbing drinks and meeting women, with each day playing out like a version of the last.','/nYgTNFSFKJMDQF4mq9vt3ieJ7eQ.jpg','2011-09-08',79,'Released',NULL,'The Day He Arrives',85525,1.8588,6.9,'_nuet1q58z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31359,_binary '\0','/bCmzUxV0YxRv22l2CXBZCjP2H5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922612',5.6,6253,'en','Glee: The Concert Movie','A concert documentary shot during the Glee Live! In Concert! summer 2011 tour, featuring song performances and fans\' life stories and how the show influenced them.','/y5NCu183zREb4XmHSB6QP3K7TH2.jpg','2011-08-11',84,'Released','The embodiment of popular culture.','Glee: The Concert Movie',67675,2.9019,7.3,'SOspGTrGOUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31360,_binary '\0','/l9JOqJT4I0Bcj8wplLQ2GUgFaxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922645',6.2,2649,'fr','La fée','A hotel clerk searches all over Le Havre for the fairy who made two of his three wishes come true before disappearing.','/8YhM5QAZLpcqDfFzWD42wWjTC4x.jpg','2011-09-14',93,'Released',NULL,'The Fairy',89287,1.219,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31361,_binary '\0','/8pu9akucB5NH1ZwKRBX9kLdLZLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922679',5.3,1864,'en','Open Road','Angie, a young Brazilian artist, abandons her old life and embarks on a journey around the country. Running from her past, and searching for her foundation in life, Angie finds not only herself but love in its many forms.','/y8Ecw1WdbgTacszNR1C0G4WK21r.jpg','2013-04-12',85,'Released','Where will the road take her?','Open Road',192210,1.6994,5,'YCHVPuynCvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31362,_binary '\0','/bpy9DzqhLN4oPxaHxFMQKG20v08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922685',5.9,15734,'en','Phantom','The haunted Captain of a Soviet submarine holds the fate of the world in his hands. Forced to leave his family behind, he is charged with leading a covert mission cloaked in mystery.','/lA1CRLLy3mA5bbut4g3u3CKBrZX.jpg','2013-01-03',99,'Released','You will never see it coming.','Phantom',152259,3.065,5.8,'fv0NlYLrRaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31363,_binary '\0','/nMV5Z10eko8pxLLJrTbrJi6hR9J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922689',6.4,1556,'nl','Plan C','Ronald Plasmeyer (Ruben Van Der Meer) is a small-time Amsterdam detective, struggling with financial problems because of his gambling habit. When the Chinese crime boss Hao threatens Ronald\'s ex-wife and son to get his money back, Ronald comes up with a plan that will solve all his problems. Ronald enlists two petty criminals (Ton Kas and René Van \'t Hof) to rob an illegal poker tournament he\'s taking part in, providing him with a perfect alibi. Quick, simple and non-violent; the plan is foolproof... until people start getting killed. Soon, Ronald\'s partners take off with the money, leaving him empty handed. To make matters worse Ronald\'s colleagues in the police force begin to suspect him of the robbery, setting the stage for a nerve-racking game of cat and mouse. Ronald is all-in... holding the worst hand of his life.','/5mMbL0g9iI5RV5GPH9SAFKPunJ4.jpg','2012-03-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Plan C',114929,0.9508,6,'64QmivaWEnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31364,_binary '\0','/pAUvwUPy4VDhxImkN7rYaOvmGZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922721',6.3,2141,'af','Skoonheid','François van Heerden, a mid-40s Afrikaans family man, has become devoid of any care or concern for his own measure of happiness, and so convinced of his ill-fated existence, that he is wholly unprepared when a chance encounter unravels his clean, controlled life.','/4f2KN9Vzq5cVM68WY26QCMdj1iK.jpg','2011-08-05',101,'Released','When desire becomes obsession.','Beauty',96551,1.4994,5.8,'1I-Zl2sBhuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31365,_binary '\0','/jovIEk4cAxWmA2dBcPrfhn3jzYN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1922777',6.8,322620,'en','Sinister','True-crime writer Ellison Oswalt is in a slump; he hasn\'t had a best seller in more than 10 years and is becoming increasingly desperate for a hit. So, when he discovers the existence of a snuff film showing the deaths of a family, he vows to solve the mystery. He moves his own family into the victims\' home and gets to work. However, when old film footage and other clues hint at the presence of a supernatural force, Ellison learns that living in the house may be fatal.','/nzx10sca3arCeYBAomHan4Q6wa1.jpg','2012-10-04',110,'Released','Once you see him, nothing can save you.','Sinister',82507,14.8411,6.873,'apghx7q9oeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31366,_binary '\0','/g6wufgtycJCP508tlC3crSYFCgC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924245',5.7,37051,'en','Cry Macho','A one-time rodeo star and washed-up horse breeder takes a job from an ex-boss to bring the man\'s young son home from Mexico.','/esrzqq7Ud8yoslFTu3J5HqTJVOQ.jpg','2021-09-16',104,'Released','A story of being lost... and found.','Cry Macho',749274,6.1765,5.9,'JVc8SI5CAKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31367,_binary '\0','/4NY2PBOcctr5ETj16zPrd0iiczU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924273',6.3,3996,'es','Promoción fantasma','A teacher with paranormal abilities helps a group of ghosts graduate high school.','/oduJ7jj5DsVuvIctPxHRcb88vfr.jpg','2012-02-03',88,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Graduation',86541,3.5622,6.562,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31368,_binary '\0','/c4wMkrDHYXtK0n9f79nkSNXSytR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924277',6.5,6690,'es','Grupo 7','Angel, a young intelligent and kind, aims to be a police inspector. Rafael instead is an expeditious, forceful and arrogant policeman. Meanwhile, Miguel and Mateo are part of Group 7, a group of rogue cops ready to do anything to achieve their goals.','/j6YLnLaX1jPCw62ICVI5GdkXDkB.jpg','2012-04-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Unit 7',98582,2.0235,6.123,'loxMhurgeT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31369,_binary '\0','/cBwvbNr6o3qaETtNG3pUoV0jGIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924394',7,28419,'en','The Angels\' Share','Robbie is a Glasgow boy locked in a family feud who just wants a way out. On community service, he meets Rhino, Albert and Mo. Little did Robbie imagine that turning to drink might change their lives, leading them to the distilleries of the Scottish Highlands and the biggest gamble of his life.','/bt9kJ8gwTMaDcmL0INlJYIZ887t.jpg','2012-06-01',101,'Released','Four Friends. One Mission. Lots of Spirit.','The Angels\' Share',103747,3.3128,6.9,'iELanfA565Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31370,_binary '\0','/4EdN5rIT43xcqi4IVRrhxiDOz6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924396',7.7,138616,'it','La migliore offerta','Virgil Oldman is a world renowned antiques expert and auctioneer. An eccentric genius, he leads a solitary life, going to extreme lengths to keep his distance from the messiness of human relationships. When appointed by the beautiful but emotionally damaged Claire to oversee the valuation and sale of her family’s priceless art collection, Virgil allows himself to form an attachment to her – and soon he is engulfed by a passion which will rock his bland existence to the core.','/ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg','2013-01-01',131,'Released','A master of possession. A crime of obsession.','The Best Offer',152742,5.8378,7.806,'zJGleGyahC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31371,_binary '\0','/1AZoKXDwfbuk6B7M0bjivcrWdmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19244260',5.5,7121,'en','Red Right Hand','Cash is trying to live a quiet, honest life in a small Appalachian town. When a vicious crime boss forces him back into her services, he soon learns he\'s capable of anything -- even killing -- to protect his family and his home.','/vfEG79SQIg3p6B8rBLVeIo2BBhb.jpg','2024-02-22',111,'Released','God. Family. Survival.','Red Right Hand',1227816,6.4392,6.582,'R7NNUnMIRAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31372,_binary '\0','/qqqnNDiQx62xZsVRZnxhP8GguJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924429',6.9,121486,'en','Trance','A violent gang enlists the help of a hypnotherapist in an attempt to locate a painting which somehow vanished in the middle of a heist.','/rR3F4fIn0JUJa1hlq2focd2W3zH.jpg','2013-03-27',101,'Released','Don\'t be a hero.','Trance',68727,5.0215,6.615,'976y9Xm6BkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31373,_binary '\0','/w7adEDKcOlp39Z35V5VRV1XFkHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1924435',6.4,145276,'en','Let\'s Be Cops','Best pals Ryan and Justin are stalled in their respective careers -- a fact that is painfully driven home when they go to a college reunion. Dressed as police in the mistaken belief that they were to attend a costume party, Ryan and Justin find that the uniforms earn them much respect and attention. Although Justin is uncomfortable with the idea, Ryan decides to continue with the charade, putting them both in increasingly dangerous situations. When these newly-minted “heroes” get tangled in a real life web of mobsters and dirty detectives, they must put their fake badges on the line.','/pf4FoUr2phn5WyZjU7rLXSiW1Ve.jpg','2014-08-13',104,'Released','Fake Cops. Real Trouble.','Let\'s Be Cops',193893,16.2025,6.469,'Mx03VkB-TPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31374,_binary '\0','/7P71nJego3BXineT4U48hkX3nqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19246408',6.8,8696,'tr','Bursa Bülbülü','Cengiz is the singer at a tea garden in Bursa and his greatest ambition is to release an album. Cengiz\'s life changes when he meets Taskin. Believing that the song composed by Taskin\'s father, Serafettin, would be a great start for his album, Cengiz buys the song using money he borrowed from his older brother. When Taskin spends all that money, Cengiz starts performing with Taskin and his sister Arzu.','/7Ar20IXj63Ac2MEcZOHt7EC4fsM.jpg','2023-01-13',121,'Released',NULL,'The Nightingale of Bursa',1056177,4.6693,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31375,_binary '\0','/bwfbcCPAcKDBG1xFQm8zf2AHeaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925421',7.3,16229,'ru','Елена','After suffering a heart attack, a wealthy elderly Russian man plans to will most of his estate to his estranged daughter. However, his wife has other plans.','/pdSxysKTeE6oTYhtVBF08Nwj2Ir.jpg','2011-06-06',110,'Released','Thy Will Be Done.','Elena',78182,2.1543,7.2,'drDu9Ta1JWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31376,_binary '\0','/6ZNqWfUXdxiNVqwgO2doLlkmgQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925431',5.6,28772,'en','Fire with Fire','A fireman takes an unexpected course of action when a man whom he\'s been ordered to testify against—after being held up at a local convenience store—threatens him.','/kziBJGQFo9f0Vkj9s37qI0G9I0I.jpg','2012-08-31',97,'Released','Revenge has its own set of rules.','Fire with Fire',139567,8.2239,5.7,'j9Auh9MI-Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31377,_binary '\0','/4N2Kg5G3xOkzbwKr2af8ATmK7Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925435',5.4,10133,'en','Frankenstein\'s Army','Toward the end of World War II, Russian soldiers pushing into eastern Germany stumble across a secret Nazi lab, one that has unearthed and begun experimenting with the journal of one Dr. Victor Frankenstein. The scientists have used the legendary Frankenstein\'s work to assemble an army of super-soldiers stitched together from the body parts of their fallen comrades -- a desperate Hitler\'s last ghastly ploy to escape defeat','/tBDuUfnAyN2OTHhyy4xyUrU8C2A.jpg','2013-01-24',84,'Released','What is dead may never die.','Frankenstein\'s Army',153738,2.3837,6.058,'PMUQ2IMuz8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31378,_binary '\0','/l79uCRoRVEXHtIMphmD61jcpkyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925446',6.1,1721,'fi','Härmä','19th century drama set on the plains of Ostrobothnia, western Finland, which are controlled by groups of knife-wielding thugs, the toughs. Traditionally, the first-born son inherits everything, so when Esko – a bum and a gang leader – learns that his father will leave the Välitalo estate to his younger and exemplary brother, all hell breaks loose.','/5qsTiEo1iJvLA9LrRLTs429ZBlI.jpg','2012-02-17',129,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in the North',105983,0.8903,5.7,'Q9sspmasDTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31379,_binary '\0','/fWBcH7PukPlv9Kyp0UgqLnNCKYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925466',4.9,1659,'en','Mall','Malcom\'s done with his life. Only the noise of Crystal Meth gives him a reason to keep going - everything else it has long regardless. Equipped with a bag full of weapons and self-made bombs, he makes his way to the nearby mall to really stir things up. On his personal war campaign, he not only changes his life radically, but also the fate of other people who are in the wrong place at the same time: a teenager whose favorite pastime is smoking pot in his dreary existence, a housewife, where their best days have been left behind, a greedy businessman whose only desire is to increase his wealth and a depressed pervert.','/um8IFziUkc0fstPICsqCNZyPh5F.jpg','2014-06-18',88,'Released','The American dream ain\'t what it used to be.','Mall',276901,1.3361,4.7,'-muemdqvERU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31380,_binary '\0','/lXV99D0vbh6h13sL5L18tKrpjLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925479',5.5,6200,'en','Officer Down','When a cop\'s crooked past comes back to get him, can he do the right thing, or will he succumb to the threats of his dangerous connections?','/ageNvAnhrwOrFjsB8mHqckee503.jpg','2013-01-22',98,'Released','Once a bad cop, always a bad cop.','Officer Down',100544,2.8886,5.3,'hvvusI6Sh64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31381,_binary '\0','/rs0CUiyCxUkecOCeatneeA7VhjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925493',5.2,3428,'en','Random Acts of Violence','A pair of comic book writers begin to notice scary similarities between the character they created and horrific real-life events.','/4eMWV14tUE10mnveNWhdwIsD4lg.jpg','2019-07-31',80,'Released','Death imitates art','Random Acts of Violence',582049,2.7023,5.3,'aYYMR9nRouQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31382,_binary '\0','/aqjiiYkvt9dNfvnyIx1IxUtBRrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1925518',5.3,8086,'th','ต้มยำกุ้ง 2','Kham finds himself in trouble when he is accused of killing a trader. While on the run from the trader\'s nieces who are martial artists, Kham meets a friend who warns him of a terrorist plot.','/hYTnLRJcIbYZEN9vfYN93fm8l5R.jpg','2013-10-23',104,'Released','This time the fight goes beyond.','The Protector 2',110552,4.1011,6.2,'VaRWXVtODxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31383,_binary '\0','/nY2s9QNE6E8iZ0WuHUlc4z97KYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1926313',7.6,23792,'hi','प्यार का पंचनामा','Nishant starts dating Charu while his roommates Rajat and Vikrant already have girlfriends in Neha and Rhea respectively. Trouble starts when the guys feel that their girlfriends are dominating them.','/vKCuXtM3hpsm9kLu1Jlg5E79owb.jpg','2011-05-20',149,'Released',NULL,'Pyaar Ka Punchnama',65521,1.5366,6.764,'DkWWklnZ-Tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31384,_binary '\0','/zcAp3HYUCUdjMhulJagyOuKF3pg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19264600',5.9,5523,'en','Catering Christmas','A fledgling caterer, Molly Frost, is hired by Jean Harrison, the perfectionistic director of the renowned Harrison Foundation, to cater this year’s annual Christmas Gala dinner. Things get complicated when Molly falls for Jean’s nephew, Carson, 30s, a travel photographer with no desire to take over the family’s foundation… until his aunt assigns him to the task of making sure the catered dinner goes perfectly.','/mmVZsiEYIN4AtRUCSJSIAZ8idjM.jpg','2022-10-29',85,'Released',NULL,'Catering Christmas',961769,2.8641,6.3,'Dt99KYkmFds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31385,_binary '\0','/3QtvKWJNPvUIQKtQzdtZVG62UkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19267924',5,3686,'en','Choose Love','The steady boyfriend. The one who got away. The charming rock star. Who will Cami choose? In this interactive rom-com, her love life is in your hands.','/eYOZMQY3tggQs6aQCXJdAMqey5z.jpg','2023-08-30',130,'Released',NULL,'Choose Love',956502,1.7515,4.8,'Tn6T_ZzBh0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31386,_binary '\0','/jKlawfQvVhS1UtaE5L0MHxPJykW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1927012',3.8,1295,'fr','Dead Shadows','Chris\' neighbors become increasingly violent as they mutate into something from beyond this world after a comet passes the Earth.','/iLy35VlOa3h5UGSTUR9umGImby2.jpg','2012-09-09',75,'Released',NULL,'Dead Shadows',176915,0.9253,4,'T6XFQLEsnYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31387,_binary '\0','/ojpMnxKVdCMxqnEOmAMExKb36Jl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1927035',6.9,1562,'uk','Той, хто пройшов крізь вогонь','The Hero of the Soviet Union becomes a GULAG prisoner and then an Indian Chief.','/yGvp9ADoe2BSehmQVnRVFXArjvD.jpg','2012-01-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Firecrosser',109045,1.3669,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31388,_binary '\0','/vdmjh9sCXQE1QcRHtjSds6vl0NO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1927068',5.2,1925,'pl','Shameless','In an incendiary story of love, desire, and betrayal between siblings, the rebellious young Tadek returns to his half-sister Anka’s home in search of solace and affection. Bound together by a painful shared family history, brother and sister must find a way to break free in order to survive. This formidable debut fearlessly yet tenderly explores one of society’s last taboos.','/x3Fkr2cGZa8PYIAjFskbHOPmdQr.jpg','2012-07-20',80,'Released',NULL,'Shameless',133521,9.0934,5.4,'YNJkTc1RojI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31389,_binary '\0','/vHYwaBOnQJxMcwEQz8wDoQkpKzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1927077',7.1,5238,'pl','Listy do M.','A romantic comedy set on Christmas Eve in Warsaw and centered around a series of characters.','/iay5DmaYQZrvmDm0hrNHl6JQYRI.jpg','2011-11-11',116,'Released',NULL,'Letters to Santa',79221,1.241,6.9,'vHNfk9FZs_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31390,_binary '\0','/9KM1CQhvA4pzf2LoUYw0KrKA70z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1927093',2.6,3267,'en','Fred 2: Night of the Living Fred','When Fred suspects that his new music teacher is a vampire, he and his friend Bertha set out to save the town from this garlic-hating fiend.','/rBl9FBizmfIVhFokwn3gJIACMpj.jpg','2011-10-22',84,'Released','Grab some garlic, Fred\'s going vampire hunting!','Fred 2: Night of the Living Fred',84564,2.3367,5.1,'SbL2FJx0REM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31391,_binary '\0','/mwI9GkEhhUHKLuUGcMu6VSw0K2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928200',6.3,1626,'es','Kamikaze','Slastan, a Karadjistan man, is willing to blow himself up aboard a Moscow plane bound for Madrid, but his plan is complicated when, due to a snowstorm, the flight is delayed. Staying in a hotel, the terrorist will have to live with the 332 people who he will kill until the storm ceases, which prevents him from continuing his mission. Slastan knows, speaks and relates to his future victims and begins to wonder if suicide and ending the lives of all these innocent people is really right.','/bLcZ9mtBiexjbZjlDbNCEYnS7v2.jpg','2014-03-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Kamikaze',229194,1.0714,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31392,_binary '\0','/f015qv2MjjgHyDqsnFLRC7VfjTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928329',6,1708,'pt','Linhas de Wellington','Passionate romance, brutal treachery, and selfless nobility are set against the background of Napoleon’s 1810 invasion of Portugal.','/la5B96U9G4CdZH92QIwBE0eV3sk.jpg','2012-10-04',151,'Released',NULL,'Lines of Wellington',122198,2.0427,5.7,'CIx-104PYYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31393,_binary '\0','/yWaUueQsfojYlA7NQowbcKlj2BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928330',5.5,20415,'en','Bad Ass','Decorated Vietnam hero, Frank Vega returns home only to get shunned by society leaving him without a job or his high school sweetheart. It\'s not until forty years later when an incident on a commuter bus makes him a local hero where he\'s suddenly celebrated once again. But his good fortune suddenly turns for the worse when his best friend is murdered and the police aren\'t doing anything about it.','/d3b6f3OBRKTN6sOULUCQGNlIfBp.jpg','2012-04-12',91,'Released','They messed with the wrong senior citizen.','Bad Ass',94380,4.5715,5.766,'_EZwovYWQI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31394,_binary '\0','/lv7FLZalKKVA7ECYIWLNB2KCqAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928335',4.5,1571,'en','Kill \'em All','Captured international assassins are locked up inside a high-tech bunker known as the Killing Chamber. To break out of this concrete hell they must duel each other, fight deadly ninjas and battle against gangs of masked maniacs. And... if they survive this, they will have to confront Snakehead: the lethal, deranged top dog who will stop at nothing to kill \'em all!','/bT0Zq14exMAn8OKrdqQUF0kPm8C.jpg','2012-12-11',86,'Released','I\'m going to hell when I die','Kill \'em All',150230,1.9404,5.2,'asKEqfuK8mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31395,_binary '\0','/9SCZHbKSgcIInFO2vsWrjj5TDRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928337',5.3,4825,'en','Mine Games','A group of young friends make an incomprehensible discovery in an abandoned mine, but the more they try to change the future, the more they seal their fate.','/4EumAjlw1pIpqoz8m0fJr1Tj2fm.jpg','2012-12-01',88,'Released','The Deeper You Go, The Darker It Gets','Mine Games',126323,1.7565,5.5,'ZNp1RRgmfM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31396,_binary '\0','/4BXGXTcfQ8n5PTX0YL0UDWQSdNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1928340',5.6,24796,'en','After the Dark','At an international school in Jakarta, a philosophy teacher challenges his class of twenty graduating seniors to choose which ten of them would take shelter underground and reboot the human race in the event of a nuclear apocalypse.','/mTSBjTriWuvYp27dsTWF9hs25HB.jpg','2013-07-06',107,'Released','Smart. Talented. Beautiful. Stranded.','After the Dark',198287,6.2495,6,'QQJge9ZNEWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31397,_binary '\0','/823bFEITN9k0d6LV1AtNlPtpDZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19287686',7,1497,'de','Ein ganzes Leben','When Andreas arrives in the remote valley in the Austrian Alps, he is only about four years old - nobody knows for sure. He grows up to become a skilled farmhand and, as a young man, joins a work crew that builds one of the first mountain railroads, bringing light and noise to the valley along with electricity. He also finds the love of his life in Marie, but their happiness is short-lived. Only many years later, when Andreas embarks on his final journey, she is with him once again. And in amazement Andreas looks back at all the years that lie behind him.','/podcOble2lPYMQoBIwBPYaHtGhy.jpg','2023-11-09',116,'Released',NULL,'A Whole Life',1161680,2.7789,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31398,_binary '\0','/xAgileyhdUi27CyDbuy4qptdnT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19289040',3,8449,'hi','जहां चार यार','Four dedicated housewives - Shivangi, Mansi, Neha, and Sakhina, whose lives revolve only around their husband and family, decide to escape the suffocating routine life by traveling to Goa for a few days to live life on their terms. They have no idea that their vacation will lead to a series of life-changing events.','/oo5KBgfp8EWzFQGnciNC0RJb2lZ.jpg','2022-09-16',126,'Released',NULL,'Jahaan Chaar Yaar',802793,0.7782,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31399,_binary '\0','/11eRKCIIkRnGseeIlWlAqkbiHKl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1929263',5.9,30481,'en','Heaven Is for Real','After their young son, Colton, undergoes emergency surgery, small-town parents Todd and Sonja Burpo are overjoyed at the child\'s miraculous recovery. However, the Burpos are unprepared for what happens next... Colton says that during his surgery he went to heaven and back, and tells his parents things that he couldn\'t possibly know. Can Todd find the courage and conviction to share his son\'s extraordinary, life-changing experience with the world?','/tsFovEJuZHVgpvFTHXb37l7ma4F.jpg','2014-04-16',99,'Released','Unlock the mystery','Heaven Is for Real',236751,7.4291,6.8,'N-ewaCVARtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31400,_binary '\0','/1uy9joA0YLhrTiNKo7m1rjEZ0ve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1929276',5.4,2961,'en','Estranged','Due to a near-fatal accident that has left her incapacitated and depleted of her long-term memory, a temporarily wheelchair-bound woman returns home after being abroad for six years accompanied by her bohemian boyfriend, the apparent cause of the accident. Unable to remember her family or her own childhood, she sets out, with the help of her boyfriend, to find the reason for her leaving all those years ago and quickly discovers her relatives may not be as loving as she’d thought','/rxzm5G9XDs3OJzXk3gadLJlpdGw.jpg','2015-08-28',92,'Released','There\'s no place like home.','Estranged',337085,2.1376,5.3,'TrnI07bl_7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31401,_binary '\0','/zFbhLim5PWLTmQgvMAlj48ExCsv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1929297',5.2,4049,'en','Last Moment of Clarity','After his girlfriend Georgia is murdered by European mobsters, Sam flees to Paris to hide out. Years later, he sees a woman in a Hollywood film who he\'s certain is Georgia. In L.A. to investigate, he encounters Kat who impulsively decides to help him on his quest. But when Sam meets the mystery actress face to face his life spins out of control.','/mHWbWIB2YntY9865pXfqoVf8vAy.jpg','2020-05-19',90,'Released','Chase your dreams, not your addictions.','Last Moment of Clarity',567608,4.3093,5.145,'Ritye-tf1-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31402,_binary '\0','/88PXOy1SjoReJqwwFniFZh8p6JL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1929308',5,10702,'en','Magic Magic','In remote Chile, a vacationing young woman begins to mentally unravel; meanwhile, her friends ignore her claim until it\'s too late.','/xgbECqu8xLVzmHT9p3SuB4HtSpL.jpg','2013-07-26',97,'Released','Beware of the Unseen','Magic Magic',139519,2.2979,5.1,'CjKTTYOlkGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31403,_binary '\0','/iUxriRQ6EjQXA0PEy40hUxTjhB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1930294',4.8,10343,'en','Black Rock','Three childhood friends set aside their personal issues and reunite for a girls’ weekend on a remote island off the coast of Maine. One wrong move turns their weekend getaway into a deadly fight for survival.','/dkUDpTgP634Mt7fl2rR5N7P9HRS.jpg','2012-01-21',79,'Released','Not every island is a paradise.','Black Rock',84178,2.1222,4.8,'I7LSFpTh6vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31404,_binary '\0','/4QFh4odwCHpD3b6zr1Q3XY2GBF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1930315',5.4,13711,'en','Cyberbully','A woman tries to help her teenage daughter when she becomes the victim of online bullying.','/wJIGiUaknsC6tLL2Om0dATZu90Z.jpg','2011-11-10',90,'Released','Words can hurt.','Cyberbully',70821,2.3983,5.994,'c1ilW2AreiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31405,_binary '\0','/1nq8ULcKtDzpbTPxUfIQnecFflr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1930458',4.9,1342,'en','Red Line','Terrified commuters are on the ride of their lives when terrorists send a subway train speeding out of control during rush hour. With the saboteur among them, a group of citizens are now trapped underground and in a race against time if they hope to see daylight again. Full of fast-paced action and suspense, Redline is a thriller that will have you holding on for safety.','/oQ8ghqM9MWGr1ct5W6SAzR3IQc3.jpg','2013-07-15',86,'Released','Next Stop: Terror','Red Line',206419,2.3329,4.9,'jq04GuFxHWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31406,_binary '\0','/iIsUxdkwTBbB157nZJ2voE8bImc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1930463',5.7,4552,'en','Ride','Overbearing mom, Jackie, travels cross-country to be with her son, Angelo, after he drops out of college to become a surfer. She meets a surf instructor who convinces her to try to accept her son\'s wishes and allow him to follow his dreams.','/vozQNEvIKWkQIIiaMPvTOArxGkH.jpg','2014-11-08',93,'Released','When her son dropped out, she dropped in.','Ride',330115,2.0179,5.7,'XVU2RIOgSJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31407,_binary '\0','/ygQOs1thAGr2798J12EEy6LLuAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1930546',5.6,8185,'en','Arthur Newman','A story of a man who fakes his own death and assumes a new identity in order to escape his life, who then moves in with a woman who is also trying to leave her past behind.','/ns4gt4qD5JA3QioVlKzWSEM56Dj.jpg','2012-09-07',93,'Released','If you don\'t have a life, get someone else\'s.','Arthur Newman',127374,3.6255,5.641,'DaAVy7m2Nug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31408,_binary '\0','/yfLAaxP3T0p08X0gxHm8zYdjnHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19308034',7.7,4453,'en','Jim Henson Idea Man','Featuring unprecedented access to Jim Henson\'s personal archives, filmmaker Ron Howard brings us a fascinating and insightful look at a complex man whose boundless imagination inspired the world.','/w1IYhFVW2XyKfkIyZ65jZ2Uyn6Y.jpg','2024-05-18',108,'Released','Never stop creating.','Jim Henson Idea Man',1273196,5.9401,7.788,'iyGFV6VIxkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31409,_binary '\0','/5p1MPUS4RLmdAFRH3DsTRrSYEbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931388',7.6,3783,'en','Beware of Mr. Baker','Ginger Baker is known for playing in Cream and Blind Faith, but the world\'s greatest drummer didn’t hit his stride until 1972, when he arrived in Nigeria and discovered Fela Kuti\'s Afrobeat. After leaving Nigeria, Ginger returned to his pattern of drug-induced self-destruction, and countless groundbreaking musical works, eventually settling in South Africa, where the 73-year-old lives with his young bride and 39 polo ponies. This documentary includes interviews with Eric Clapton, Steve Winwood, Carlos Santana and more. Beware of Mr. Baker! With every smash of the drum is a man smashing his way through life.','/z8U2FGiRoyCej0Mh8VU6iAZVRY9.jpg','2012-11-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Beware of Mr. Baker',97610,1.672,7.493,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31410,_binary '\0','/65XErolCI3Zg3EeNgzf6oJMAm0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931435',5.6,54022,'en','The Big Wedding','To the amusement of their adult children and friends, long-divorced couple Don and Ellie Griffin are forced to play the happy couple for the sake of their adopted son\'s wedding after his ultra conservative Catholic biological mother unexpectedly decides to fly halfway across the world to attend. With all of the wedding guests looking on, the Griffins are hilariously forced to confront their past, present and future - and hopefully avoid killing each other in the process.','/ooSGwWVJRp81ErEH7VmTmVwjoMc.jpg','2013-04-25',90,'Released','It\'s never too late to start acting like a family.','The Big Wedding',87567,6.0141,5.838,'nFQvqGtuAKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31411,_binary '\0','/An6oBoTRbPNdNDMuxTJ8GMuUujR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931466',5.3,1633,'en','Knife Fight','A political strategist juggling three clients questions whether or not to take the high road, as the ugly side of his work begins to haunt him.','/loiYGqP01wLjbYpLE7Pd6pUT0sX.jpg','2013-01-25',99,'Released','When it comes to getting elected, there\'s no such thing as going too far.','Knife Fight',157919,0.0993,5,'8TaEWe9fwfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31412,_binary '\0','/mnWAectkyVej1nKwnmhpqp1KWbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931470',7,5507,'fr','La guerre est déclarée','Roméo and Juliette are two young actors. They fall in love at first sight, move in together and make a baby. A love story and the founding of a home like millions of others. Except that their little boy, Adam, behaves abnormally. The young parents try hard to persuade themselves that everything is okay but, with the passing of time, they cannot delude themselves anymore: their son has a problem. From now on, war is declared. A war against illness. A war against Death. A war against despair.','/gVqIROaHxwwsxCSTEaEMqWyINmX.jpg','2011-08-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Declaration of War',73562,2.2785,7.037,'d0UN5DW6KB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31413,_binary '\0','/6KrodMTWn9hNZBhrwOYd8snqtVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931533',7.1,290635,'en','Seven Psychopaths','A struggling screenwriter inadvertently becomes entangled in the Los Angeles criminal underworld after his oddball friends kidnap a gangster\'s beloved Shih Tzu.','/4ukEYAxlSivFcDG6vLxJB6PjTjg.jpg','2012-10-12',110,'Released','They won\'t take any shih tzu.','Seven Psychopaths',86838,9.7619,6.819,'-hUJ1AxDsIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31414,_binary '\0','/kkTj3BQlDrM3YdN5caHhw5sz6bu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931551',3.3,1253,'en','The 25th Reich','In 1943, five US soldiers are recruited by the OSS for a time travel mission to save the world from the tyranny of Hitler\'s 25th Reich.','/13o2Visivhktf5KVk4Sf9NN7qcJ.jpg','2012-05-09',84,'Released','They came back from the past, to save the future!','The 25th Reich',111208,1.2029,4.3,'mI5Z1DCK2Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31415,_binary '\0','/wxPlEATyRNZ1nM8nofaoSs8nLWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19315924',6.5,4321,'en','Ranveer vs Wild with Bear Grylls','Click through this interactive special, helping superstar Ranveer Singh and adventurer Bear Grylls brave the Serbian wilderness to find a rare flower.','/9bNdVdSw6A16aSlSrA9iQX1jct.jpg','2022-07-08',70,'Released',NULL,'Ranveer vs Wild with Bear Grylls',992328,1.9782,5.071,'joH3je2HrxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31416,_binary '\0','/8NUTSNVeWDLZ97KBQM7IwK8HgTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1931602',5.9,16952,'en','Very Good Girls','Two New York City girls make a pact to lose their virginity during their first summer out of high school. When they both fall for the same street artist, the friends find their connection tested for the first time.','/4TmLzB5bEUUQbFqMgWQjkDC2mUN.jpg','2013-01-22',91,'Released','When we lose our innocence, we have to find ourselves.','Very Good Girls',70706,5.3541,5.788,'Axxy3gghEhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31417,_binary '\0','/6hChsVVd2Ttd8iKIDHLu7git3z9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19316094',6.1,3038,'en','An Egypt Affair','A rejected husband. A beautiful stranger in peril. A dangerous liaison. For two couples enjoying a spectacular Egyptian adventure, treachery and deception cruise the Nile along with them.','/m5rhR6A2fyDMo2g6ULFNjy61MD5.jpg','2023-04-27',82,'Released','A rejected husband. A beautiful stranger in peril. A dangerous liaison. For two couples enjoying a spectacular Egyptian adventure, treachery and deception cruise the Nile along with them.','An Egypt Affair',1081101,1.5595,7.5,'7a66fUIli24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31418,_binary '\0','/1NBPhXi3C2OFeWO5uZvEDJfi6fr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19316408',3.6,1616,'en','Stranger in the Woods','Olivia and her friends go on a vacation. After Olivia nearly drowns with a slit wrist in her bathtub after her fiancé\'s funeral, her friends suspect that she tried to kill herself, but she believes someone attacked her.','/qcrbiVMOkAaOyha8BqyVDQCTwh6.jpg','2024-02-14',82,'Released','Just when you think you\'re out of the woods.','Stranger in the Woods',1175038,2.1883,6,'XLypNESfj-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31419,_binary '\0','/dSbHiA9m62FhQxiSZoJmhzKlmZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19319352',6.3,3669,'fr','Farang','Sam is a professional boxer about to get released from prison. While on parole, his past catches up with him and he has no choice but to flee. Five years later, he has rebuilt a simple life on an exotic island in Thailand with his wife and her daughter, but when he gets blackmailed by a dangerous local godfather, he must embark on a dangerous drug smuggling mission which results in a tragedy. Now he has only one purpose: to seek merciless vengeance.','/u9035lysUz3ccloQt0SeIp1Mu8a.jpg','2023-06-28',99,'Released','This ends one way.','Mayhem!',959092,4.0179,6.7,'PmcqVmRPgvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31420,_binary '\0','/bxUqzGliFaTt3eovdsuWK9TwbPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1932695',6.7,1399,'ja','聯合艦隊司令長官 山本五十六 – 太平洋戦争70年目の真実','Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto (1884-1943) was the Japanese Naval commander who was given the order to attack Pearl Harbour, an order he was duty bound to obey which went against his own personal beliefs. While this infamous attack is a low point in Japanese and US history it wouldn’t have happened if the Japanese government had listened to Yamamoto in 1939 and searched for a more peaceful way to end their war campaign, proving his many ominous presages of the outcomes of the attack to come true.','/96va8I9758w2f2LmZ6sspELBUg8.jpg','2011-12-23',135,'Released',NULL,'Isoroku Yamamoto, the Commander-in-Chief of the Combined Fleet',131739,2.0665,6.4,'DrGE0DxDBuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31421,_binary '\0','/hn0uh4wv2jPAnMXZ0fULE1qjcjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1932718',6.4,30641,'en','Thanks for Sharing','A romantic comedy that brings together three disparate characters who are learning to face a challenging and often confusing world as they struggle together against a common demon—sex addiction.','/qSf3mmkjxohgnA8ZvhBQqTTBaWx.jpg','2013-09-19',112,'Released','Life is a journey you never have to take alone.','Thanks for Sharing',112200,4.066,5.963,'FP0aIPWCuDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31422,_binary '\0','/kk1MMdWF9Z4vBMM0ebBjD7G5zFf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1932767',7.4,29538,'en','What Maisie Knew','In New York City, a young girl is caught in the middle of her parents\' bitter custody battle.','/1unkWKdT68ba6NdiSsPqzJeylxc.jpg','2013-05-02',99,'Released','Hold on with all your heart.','What Maisie Knew',127373,3.8543,7.118,'UrGzb1nBBl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31423,_binary '\0','/ims0V4WEUYt6JgfvPIyH9G79q40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1933667',6.8,33372,'en','The Wizard of Lies','A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff\'s massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff\'s family.','/8k4lJ4e0hvDQtKpItXmmPdw69sO.jpg','2017-05-11',133,'Released','Only those you trust can truly betray you.','The Wizard of Lies',363992,10.3242,6.583,'h3Qm1ZhRQwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31424,_binary '\0','/ts5284n2iDF205O8dBGRz4T66YC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934205',7.8,4744,'fr','Ce que le jour doit à la nuit','Algeria, the 1930s. Younes is nine years old when he is put in his uncle\'s care in Oran. Rebaptized Jonas, he grows up among the Rio Salado youths, with whom he becomes friends. Emilie is one of the gang; everyone is in love with her. A great love story develops between Jonas and Emilie, which is soon unsettled by the conflicts troubling the country.','/lHhxXg9JxNXVP4BiCPA9nju6GZJ.jpg','2012-09-12',162,'Released',NULL,'What the Day Owes the Night',119193,3.5242,7.641,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31425,_binary '\0','/w2r6FIWHDRP3Eb1LQII1dGbHTrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934231',7.6,35325,'hi','देली बेली','Three unsuspecting, average guys find themselves on the hit list of one of India\'s most-powerful crime syndicates.','/hGmjlOFPaqwxAxR3XDvalExTlXd.jpg','2011-07-01',102,'Released','S#!t Happens','Delhi Belly',67109,2.5099,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31426,_binary '\0','/6VKQ2ynCyPcrVIkP5S3cP3kcC7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934234',7.3,4241,'it','Diaz - Non pulire questo sangue','On July 19–21, 2001, over 200,000 people took to the streets of Genoa to protest against the ongoing G8 summit. Anti-globalization activists clashed with the police, with 23-year-old protester Carlo Giuliani shot dead after confronting a police vehicle. In the aftermath, the police organized a night raid on the Diaz high school, where around a hundred people between unarmed protesters—mostly students—and independent reporters who documented the police brutality during the protests had took shelter. What happened next was called by Amnesty International \"the most serious breach of civil liberties in a democratic Western country since World War II.\"','/vcGFlMHToPdYLn3ZMUwHsA8FQr0.jpg','2012-04-13',127,'Released',NULL,'Diaz - Don\'t Clean Up This Blood',96714,5.4013,7.2,'YKsUBai-Rcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31427,_binary '\0','/kzqJ2FJnXweCzQuO5RYbF2PdgDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934269',7,3409,'he','הסיפור של יוסי','The sequel to \"Yossi and Jagger\" finds character Yossi (Ohad Knoller) leading a sad existence after losing his partner Jagger on the battlefield. A chance encounter with a middle-aged woman linked to his past shakes up his otherwise staid routine and sends him on a spontaneous pilgrimage to Tel Aviv. It is on the roads of southern Israel that he reignites the fire of his former self.','/dwFA7j1qeKuycXY8kLT3zO0kGv5.jpg','2012-05-16',84,'Released',NULL,'Yossi',117629,1.693,6.8,'KTyoVUBhjo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31428,_binary '\0','/xQo44JM52MfEX7tvajmzKvWhloL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934381',4.7,2974,'ko','7광구','In Sector 7, an underwater oil field located south of Jeju Island, Hae-jun is working as a marine equipment manager on an oil prospecting ship called Eclipse. Joining the crew later is Jeong-man, a former colleague of Hae-jun\'s father, assigned to Eclipse as captain. Though his job is to oversee the withdrawal of the ship, he suggests conducting some drilling one last time.','/41ZNHkEs7GYTI9994mW6BHCIP29.jpg','2011-08-04',101,'Released','Something awaits them 8,000 feet under the sea…','Sector 7',75821,1.8541,4.9,'JxYo_rgyHOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31429,_binary '\0','/6E0ng1l8EOSWDEUqkbcTeFFZUAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934452',3.6,1325,'en','Realms','After a high-speed police chase leads to an unexpected crash, two Americans bank robbers and their three local hostages take shelter in a mysterious manor in the woods. As the criminals plot their next move and the hostages try to escape, they begin to realize no one is safe from the evil lurking inside the house.','/m3CLStp0Prl8qIebBe6TJLmHZAR.jpg','2017-12-21',90,'Released','Not everyone wakes up from the nightmare.','Realms',548859,1.8604,4.3,'H7JfixV8WBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31430,_binary '\0','/gLYduOzQOtOzP873a81LXugWkIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934458',4.5,3133,'en','Under the Bed','Two brothers team up to battle a creature under the bed, in what is being described as a \"suburban nightmare\" tale.','/bgD3QUvhCIJAMem0LNQrvrYMo1H.jpg','2012-07-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Under the Bed',128311,1.8413,5,'1oTgs2Aelbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31431,_binary '\0','/sW3wobBRx1dIwp2dDpkOTWQ00OK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1934487',7.1,3048,'tr','Zenne','German photographer Daniel Bert, who comes to Istanbul to do photo shoots, meets Can, who is a zenne at a nightclub, and Ahmet, who comes from a conservative eastern family.','/14vy9LAXX2eJhjKi9bVgSgteVxg.jpg','2012-01-13',107,'Released','Honesty may kill you.','Zenne Dancer',84070,0.999,6,'rnvZiwF_cCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31432,_binary '\0','/fEluwtwTRa1WOJwVk59ZJgcbROg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935065',5.8,5442,'en','Not Suitable For Children','A young playboy who learns he has one month until he becomes infertile sets out to procreate as much as possible.','/wYxr14jTu02noGxXRqPDJgK37wC.jpg','2012-07-12',97,'Released','He never wanted to have kids until life kicked him where it counts','Not Suitable For Children',120292,2.3394,5.3,'nSSB3ZxaYvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31433,_binary '\0','/tMtXSrEeh2rueJQVWMom78ZBhG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935089',5.8,4775,'en','Blind','A novelist is blinded in a car crash that killed his wife and several years later rediscovers his passion for life and writing when he embarks on an affair with the neglected wife of an indicted businessman.','/cXyObe5aB63ueOndEXxXabgAvIi.jpg','2017-07-14',105,'Released','We see what we want to see','Blind',364733,3.3211,6.1,'3oMTkNDtvjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31434,_binary '\0','/lKbuydOGvGTqElmsRSr5rJNgdfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935094',5.7,1750,'ko','고양이: 죽음을 보는 두 개의 눈','So-yeon suffers from claustrophobia and inherits a Persian cat when its owner dies. She begins having nightmares and people around her begin dying as she searches for the truth.','/zHnkNOd0C9cu0rwbywll9maxnDQ.jpg','2011-07-07',106,'Released','How Many Lives Do YOU Have?','The Cat',75931,2.1366,6.7,'xmar5NdXOuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31435,_binary '\0','/Fg5foi9hsarfwGwi3nXz2gT14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935109',8.9,2815,'bn','দীপু নাম্বার টু','An adventure story for young boys, Dipu Number Two is the second film of a talented director from Bangladesh who is one of the few who concentrate on quality filmmaking in a country with a rich commercial film industry. The story is taken from a youth-oriented novel in which Dipu, a boy belonging to the educated class, is teased by the school bully but eventually forms a deep relationship with him. The rest is totally escapist in nature, including a scene in which the two youths manage to capture single-handedly an entire group of robbers.','/4Gz1HkpZhwWpyuual7eytb5CBj9.jpg','1996-12-16',154,'Released','An adventure story for young boys.','Dipu Number Two',93527,1.1091,9.364,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31436,_binary '\0','/xfC6hsmcsnf2MY1iXDs56gJNfQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935156',8,29511,'en','Jodorowsky\'s Dune','In 1974, Chilean-French director Alejandro Jodorowsky embarked on the quixotic project of adapting Frank Herbert\'s influential novel Dune (1969) for the big screen. After investing two years, and millions of dollars, the gigantic project ended in failure; but the artists Jodorowsky brought together to carry it out continued to work together, and ended up laying the foundations for modern science fiction cinema.','/zXBAjeOu3iRISnU73j4CwEiG0fj.jpg','2013-08-30',87,'Released','What is to give light must endure burning','Jodorowsky\'s Dune',191720,3.1592,7.8,'Q-oBEGF7uwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31437,_binary '\0','/otmqSaptLwYutON1oZEgBLZeBEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935179',7.3,201605,'en','Mud','Two teenage boys find a fugitive hiding out on an island in the Mississippi River and help him reunite with his lover and escape an avenging family and their armed posse.','/o2jT5jQdKh1HAF0fMKuGwBOwOYB.jpg','2013-04-26',130,'Released','Running from his past. Hiding from the law. Only one way out.','Mud',103731,6.5199,7.058,'DTEDfEhKwLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31438,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19351904',5.8,2294,'pa','ਲੈਂਬਰਗਿਨੀ','Fed up with Lehmber\'s deceiving behaviour, his father sends him to London. There his life takes a U-turn when he falls in love with Ginni.','/yLyb7wB3yCIdZfZMSen1vEaJW0o.jpg','2023-06-02',117,'Released',NULL,'Lehmberginni',1132448,0.8439,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31439,_binary '\0','/fcBqCqnAKiP8UEaXI1ZOVrV8Mpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935194',5.4,18282,'en','Overdrive','Master car thieves square off against French gangsters in the South of France with money, women and lives all on the line.','/a0hTRjis1cxwmjOuBaS7WdDG3dj.jpg','2017-06-16',93,'Released','Think fast. Drive faster.','Overdrive',404733,6.9897,6.1,'fXk9S9cwsEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31440,_binary '\0','/xORicGgrCluE8piP7jhH61uN1ij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19352286',5.4,1326,'de','Rumspringa','During a trip to Berlin, a young Amish in the middle of a rite of passage reconnects with his roots, explores other ways of life, falls in love — and faces a big decision.','/tPmr7R2Zq66SXhFcXZiFSJ0Afx8.jpg','2022-04-29',102,'Released',NULL,'Rumspringa',956862,1.1848,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31441,_binary '\0','/97tEx5wgsdukAzC32NkcAFRvTGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935302',4.3,11784,'en','Monsters: Dark Continent','Seven years on from the events of Monsters, and the ‘Infected Zones’ have spread worldwide. Humans have been knocked off the top of the food chain, with disparate communities struggling for survival. American soldiers are being sent abroad to protect US interests from the Monsters, but the war is far from being won.','/sQ3uSRb0wrgJf9sWc8LxYbnqltC.jpg','2014-10-09',119,'Released','Fear has evolved','Monsters: Dark Continent',145221,3.5128,4.7,'BAfYPog0pWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31442,_binary '\0','/thFSP3fBwqBYUZUyIAmaHuwNkvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19356262',5.4,29421,'en','Drive-Away Dolls','Jamie, an uninhibited free spirit bemoaning yet another breakup with a girlfriend, and her demure friend Marian desperately needs to loosen up. In search of a fresh start, the two embark on an impromptu road trip to Tallahassee, but things quickly go awry when they cross paths with a group of inept criminals along the way.','/6QPKmqntFgLm6sB47AtSelEGGPM.jpg','2024-02-22',84,'Released','A story of two ladies going south.','Drive-Away Dolls',957304,10.9222,5.5,'Oy0RYiQRWUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31443,_binary '\0','/tOWjPR2PO8ujUhQxK4JPU0D0KmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935749',5.2,1932,'en','The Bling Ring','At the center of one of Hollywood\'s most notorious burglary rings in 2009 was a group of average, middle-class teens from a quiet suburb. This is the behind-the-scenes story of how Nick, a shy, awkward boy, lured by the promise of popularity and acceptance, found himself following his glamorous, charismatic best friend Rachel into breaking into celebrities\' houses and robbing them of millions of dollars in clothes and jewelry.','/x3WmMVULbz2IZ75J3n5wWaatRml.jpg','2011-09-26',87,'Released',NULL,'The Bling Ring',116853,2.3568,4.9,'netHk1FAozQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31444,_binary '\0','/t1uSzpjK03WY53LntehNdnjyLxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19358036',2.3,1216,'en','Not Another Church Movie','Taylor Pherry is given a mission from God Himself: to tell his family\'s stories and inspire his community. What he doesn\'t know is that the Devil has plans of his own.','/hLEWhuLToCrSCs3viyM6E4ztOHj.jpg','2024-05-10',91,'Released','(This is NOT a Tyler Perry movie)','Not Another Church Movie',1045467,2.4501,3.3,'9HZuafmpwzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31445,_binary '\0','/ld7V9BjMk2xtiBNcR8savyyk5ca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935859',6.7,211026,'en','Miss Peregrine\'s Home for Peculiar Children','A teenager finds himself transported to an island where he must help protect a group of orphans with special powers from creatures intent on destroying them.','/CIlbMFOfYDj0MP23hsIYhFGrL6.jpg','2016-09-28',127,'Released','Stay peculiar.','Miss Peregrine\'s Home for Peculiar Children',283366,14.8853,6.8,'DN1uhnnKscY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31446,_binary '\0','/XhcwHFuSPj4TOvQgdARk4Fes2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935896',4.7,21469,'en','The ABCs of Death','An ambitious anthology film featuring segments directed by over two dozen of the world\'s leading talents in contemporary genre film. Inspired by children\'s educational ABC books, the film comprises 26 individual chapters, each helmed by a different director assigned a letter of the alphabet. The directors were then given free reign in choosing a word to create a story involving death.','/k3TcTGCgvvvhAiW9pkyWNz9CoNN.jpg','2013-03-08',129,'Released','26 directors, 26 ways to die.','The ABCs of Death',87436,5.4217,4.9,'NlqYnmMT0Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31447,_binary '\0','/lA8r57ye1Kg30RO8PesaajzAWAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935897',4.9,16982,'en','Amityville: The Awakening','Belle, her little sister, and her comatose twin brother move into a new house with their single mother in order to save money to help pay for her brother\'s expensive healthcare. But when strange phenomena begin to occur including the miraculous recovery of her brother, Belle begins to suspect her mother isn\'t telling her everything and soon learns they moved into the infamous Amityville house.','/c9Nyu8YZfLsWWbze4DEGPbnwCcT.jpg','2017-06-30',87,'Released','Every house has a history. This one has a legend.','Amityville: The Awakening',203835,6.466,5.3,'ZT-50hCYrk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31448,_binary '\0','/tnIr0EPYySwj4bzPhU3gLjEYlX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935902',6.3,18015,'en','The Brass Teapot','When a couple discovers that a brass teapot makes them money whenever they hurt themselves, they must come to terms with how far they are willing to go.','/6txTmb8OIimrQezgD8ERMmrrbnT.jpg','2012-09-08',100,'Released','Everyone Has A Price. What\'s Yours?','The Brass Teapot',127867,3.3364,6.1,'g30KBZ4m61Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31449,_binary '\0','/rCiiqocQyNWNlWW8pUNYAXS7a1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935914',6.1,9666,'es','Los últimos días','A mysterious epidemic spreads across the planet. Humanity develops an irrational fear of open spaces that causes instant death. Soon, the world population is trapped inside buildings. As Barcelona descends into chaos, Marc sets off on a quest to find Julia, his missing girlfriend, without ever going outside.','/iRKybTUmEy3ZHS2o2ZDUCGyRAAn.jpg','2013-03-27',103,'Released','When the world is over, there is still hope','The Last Days',168138,3.0089,6.018,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31450,_binary '\0','/51Rslb4Lg3Y3NjDUEoqWfwHljUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1935940',6.3,5410,'en','Get Santa','A father and son must team up to save Christmas when they discover Santa Claus sleeping in their garage, having crashed his sleigh and found himself on the run from the police.','/gW4FX4DFRnKlGINzB4UdZJnSdgE.jpg','2014-12-05',102,'Released','They have one chance to save Christmas...','Get Santa',250535,3.0446,6.1,'Vl_bpTu0M0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31451,_binary '\0','/7dPHEITlb0WnotuduNnOwgWj2G6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19364132',5.4,2489,'en','Drugstore June','After the pharmacy in her small town is robbed, a girl who still lives at home with her parents takes matters into her own hands to solve the crime, while at the same time trying to get over her ex-boyfriend and become more of an adult.','/zbWcd3e5ooHEmiJnEmRE8sE3bOP.jpg','2024-02-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Drugstore June',1058303,2.2395,5.7,'We1MkGPt3nA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31452,_binary '\0','/bP9h1qHuFQIDERuGXt43Q3TfBdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19369162',5.2,3508,'en','The Puppetman','The Puppetman, a convicted killer on death row, always maintained his innocence saying that it was an evil force controlling his body as he slaughtered his victims. Now Michal, the killer\'s daughter, begins to suspect that there may be some truth to her father\'s claim when those around her begin to die in brutal ways. She must try and break the curse of The Puppetman before all her loved ones are killed.','/wEnct8jeMHYzOfm5Y6QmxD3V61t.jpg','2023-10-10',96,'Released','You\'re not in control','The Puppetman',1146143,3.1294,5.5,'Owv4PGJ6V0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31453,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937092',4.3,1487,'hi','ऑलवेज कभी कभी','Four students come of age during a year at their school, St Marks with various encounters.','/JXS3QQMIZVWZGyjy6fXzcC520Z.jpg','2011-06-17',126,'Released',NULL,'Always Kabhi Kabhi',71900,1.1518,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31454,_binary '\0','/4TBugvWwlJUGgLAfzLq0CBJmeog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937118',6.9,15971,'fr','Casse-Tête Chinois','Xavier is a 40-year-old father of two who still finds life very complicated. When the mother of his children moves to New York, he can\'t bear them growing up far away from him and so he decides to move there as well.','/urOhy4mkGTcRHjXBotanF6zyBJw.jpg','2013-12-04',117,'Released',NULL,'Chinese Puzzle',206408,4.2151,6.579,'cwA3R71nGgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31455,_binary '\0','/EejQuj9zkVtQAXnTyZjPMAwGB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937133',5.8,6437,'fr','De l\'autre côté du périph','Two mismatched cops team up to investigate the murder of a business mogul\'s wife.','/lJSNu2WJ5PGuEnyD8mfSVp5yY0H.jpg','2012-12-15',96,'Released',NULL,'On the Other Side of the Tracks',146375,2.9154,5.644,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31456,_binary '\0','/z3gZRm7ZnWVyKpZHJ4vho7wRZW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937149',7.6,80595,'es','El cuerpo','A woman’s body disappears mysteriously from the morgue without a trace. Police inspector Jaime Peña investigates the strange occurrence with the help of Álex Ulloa, the widower of the missing woman.','/du9zczcShf4WIuljDR0Aib7AYtX.jpg','2012-12-21',107,'Released','Death is not always the end.','The Body',111083,7.2599,7.519,'rWiBztGfgO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31457,_binary '\0','/ra9surFrWYvIL0pWcm3MrxmPhTg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937264',7,35820,'en','Now Is Good','A girl dying of leukemia compiles a list of things she\'d like to do before passing away. Topping the list is her desire to lose her virginity.','/oOBHF6qWtMkzwpnrLDTKJPAb3zH.jpg','2012-09-19',103,'Released','Live every moment, love every minute','Now Is Good',90369,5.0698,7.3,'TZ6KV9Hg9f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31458,_binary '\0','/ltouKJGLUwKSHFbgrnPw3qlxIdE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937269',6.5,5732,'en','One Small Hitch','On a flight home to Chicago for a family wedding, childhood friends Josh and Molly innocently agree to fake a wedding engagement to make Josh\'s dying father happy. Things quickly get out of hand with their two boisterous families, and a series of events causes them to pretend to be a couple and start planning a phony wedding. When the playacting begins to foster real feelings, the two must make some serious decisions: Split up and return to their lives in LA, or make a life as a couple back in Chicago?','/quw2cNXialcL4PIirf38w98d7Si.jpg','2013-02-14',100,'Released','Love with strings attached.','One Small Hitch',166879,3.739,6.6,'Boqp_1dVWak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31459,_binary '\0','/eTmS7bpv7zaq5igfcxcKv64uydg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937339',7.7,7156,'ko','써니','Seven girls become good friends in high school, then events pull them apart for 25 years. When one of the friends lies dying in a hospital, she wishes to see each of them one last time.','/m21yedsv5rGNmvOU0X9ARvxC0XM.jpg','2011-05-04',136,'Released','The sunniest moment of our lives.','Sunny',77117,3.2163,7.793,'dPb717U_hf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31460,_binary '\0','/eUisrfjmEZqdWvImkLeUPXnKImH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937388',6.3,3006,'en','The Millionaire Tour','A mysterious cab passenger taken hostage must convince the hijackers that he is not the con man they set out to kill.','/t7dKu2jxjkraa2LwrNrMaYB4TTD.jpg','2012-07-31',80,'Released','Buckle up for the ride of your life.','The Millionaire Tour',101056,1.8178,6.218,'biFWb3gX7yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31461,_binary '\0','/zp49zf9Ox33BAXrWYKJ0oBQvDmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937449',5.6,8288,'en','At Any Price','Henry Whipple wants his rebellious son Dean to help expand his family’s farming empire. However, Dean has his sights set on becoming a professional race car driver. When a high-stakes investigation into their business is exposed, father and son are pushed into an unexpected situation that threatens the family\'s entire livelihood.','/eZB526cDGE8qxgycckTP7SaM1Pr.jpg','2012-08-30',105,'Released','How far will you go to chase a dream?','At Any Price',121789,2.8992,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31462,_binary '\0','/sx9AV4zhzAwS9XIcRh5f9GFzXS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1937506',5.6,2368,'en','The Philly Kid','A former NCAA champion wrestler is paroled after 10 years in prison. Now, to save a friend\'s life, in a series of cage fights he must agree to do the impossible - lose.','/pN0UFnqzkIFjmhH8ICKVAqxNBdo.jpg','2012-05-11',94,'Released',NULL,'The Philly Kid',102222,2.215,5.4,'fqZMKHUzbdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31463,_binary '\0','/r3mNrASQwRvFg9keHAhK2f5BKa5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19381382',5.9,4525,'fr','Cocorico','The Bouvier-Sauvages, a large aristocratic family, meet the much more modest Martin family when their children\'s wedding is announced. For the occasion, the future bride and groom offer their parents DNA tests, which will reveal their true origins. The results are totally unexpected and will make the effect of a bomb.','/b0blE2Rk7ZED24qQhif5hBGT6Px.jpg','2024-02-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Cocorico',973912,2.8984,5.602,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31464,_binary '\0','/jaB7VzHKoPm5U4ck0KsFJ75dqp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19383190',7.6,3073,'en','The Fire Within: A Requiem for Katia and Maurice Krafft','Filmmaker Werner Herzog combs through the film archives of volcanologists Katia and Maurice Krafft to create a film that celebrates their legacy.','/i1LgOPrUq40dvCVo5oWX0XNqoQa.jpg','2024-05-09',85,'Released',NULL,'The Fire Within: A Requiem for Katia and Maurice Krafft',977341,2.3404,7.8,'8SIUeLphLyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31465,_binary '\0','/e2q05a5g0hfvBDU9eqCTE0pDS10.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19394150',6,1337,'en','A Cozy Christmas Inn','Real estate exec, Erika, travels to Alaska during Christmastime to acquire a bed and breakfast, only to discover that it’s owned by her ex. While there, she finds herself falling in love with the town and quite possibly him.','/o39aC3rs6bGA35oN54OalZHbv04.jpg','2022-10-28',84,'Released',NULL,'A Cozy Christmas Inn',1012072,1.9371,5.7,'fdrqRXZ__q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31466,_binary '\0','/lIW5kU1jeuBqDKX2AFZY72idSjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1939654',4.8,1582,'hi','भेजा फ्राई 2','Good hearted but not worldly-wise, the rolly-polly tax inspector, Bharat Bhushan (Vinay Pathak) is back to fulfill his long cherished dream of becoming a singer. To further his media ambition he enters a game show hoping to win a cash prize with which he can make his own music album. Eventually Bhushan goes on to win the competition which also gifts him a free stay on a cruise ship.','/oczOWHlWBI12q45w0aylhCB1f3.jpg','2011-06-17',130,'Released',NULL,'Bheja Fry 2',67893,0.8963,4.048,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31467,_binary '\0','/zTwuMSZ8Tsf9k6r2lslemPs4m1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1939659',5.8,156950,'en','Carrie','An awkward, telekinetic teenage girl is the object of relentless bullying at school and an oppressively religious mother at home.','/kloXz9qwO23z9Kbt3z3MgnjF4xO.jpg','2013-10-16',101,'Released','You will know her name.','Carrie',133805,8.97,6.069,'LxwPUSWRaJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31468,_binary '\0','/t5jXjGPzKke3AD8P98QUqPuFJpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19396786',8.8,3399,'tr','Atatürk II 1881 – 1919','Mustafa Kemal had just begun his journey after proving himself in 1915 at the Gallipoli front. He would go on to face major battles on the eastern front against the Russians and later against the British in Syria, ultimately becoming the only Ottoman officer not to lose a battle during WW1. However, despite all his success, he would encounter an unexpected challenge upon his return to Istanbul.','/mmUxzWaQp1HrdySFl7cIjPkms0E.jpg','2024-01-04',142,'Released',NULL,'Atatürk II 1881 – 1919',1198904,1.5195,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31469,_binary '\0','/yPU89i5KvCrfPkbgsUqYjRycPaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19403516',6,14665,'en','Hallow Road','Two parents enter a race against time when they receive a distressing late-night phone call from their daughter after she caused a tragic car accident.','/dVsgV7ak6vR5xyXFggooJQinXBg.jpg','2025-04-16',80,'Released',NULL,'Hallow Road',1205656,6.4803,6.13,'DXGL49DpjJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31470,_binary '\0','/zDparHclByx1ulKw9YEpRfr02UV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19406606',5.6,6653,'en','The Shift','Following a tense encounter with a mysterious stranger with otherworldly powers, a man finds himself banished to a parallel, tyrannical Earth, where he fights to get back to the woman he loves.','/voLxg0emuu862JAgFwM4yTH3eGj.jpg','2023-11-30',113,'Released','Infinite worlds. Endless choices. One way out.','The Shift',1108658,6.0066,6.345,'5iSfZVtMoQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31471,_binary '\0','/9CxwriuI30YxGhKqLnr5A8FgP9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1941466',6.1,1607,'ja','Blood-C The Last Dark','Tokyo, Winter. Despite the use of the Youth Ordinance Bill to enforce curfews for minors and regulate the use of the Internet, young people continue to fight for their own freedom through underground methods. One such group calls themselves Surat. They have decided to take on Fumito Nanahara, a man who has great influence on the political world, and basically controls Tokyo with an iron fist. While using the Internet as a weapon to discover more information about Fumito, they learn about \"Tower\", the secret organization behind Fumito which engages in human experimentation.','/sUlxd7SRFr6ou8d5MfL0sj7XpSv.jpg','2012-06-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Blood-C: The Last Dark',171823,3.4567,7.1,'pOWUXcv6ick','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31472,_binary '\0','/kSqZvYhvsLvmeotgpwEG2zSshqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1941478',6.9,2166,'pt','Capitão Falcão','A satire on anti-communist paranoia in the days of fascist dictatorship in Portugal. The series follows the adventures of the \"Lusitanian superhero\", the ultra-patriotic Captain Falcão, a man who follows the direct orders of António de Oliveira Salazar in the fight against the \"red menace\".','/yuaYyJgZAS48neZKXfqDkue7DQ.jpg','2015-04-23',106,'Released','The first portuguese super-hero!','The Portuguese Falcon',188621,1.6783,6.8,'WFbeDw-Wwmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31473,_binary '\0','/AidXjiJl7NOJw0Ajgh8SNbmAGIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1941638',7,1501,'hi','Sadda Adda','\'The only thing that will stop you from fulfilling your dreams is you\" People have dreams, but not all of us have the guts to put faith in ourselves. Most of us lose focus and give up. We are most afraid to believe in our own dreams. Those who do are the true winners. This slice of life film is set in the backdrop of our capital city- Delhi.','/AaUYLkem4Vrcqgp7eXdPIb8FHaZ.jpg','2012-01-13',115,'Released',NULL,'Sadda Adda',96276,1.5359,7,'cE7oHZ3nDdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31474,_binary '\0','/gTUTc5fJA3uW0qykMcLbYtBqWUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942798',3.2,1318,'en','Alien Tornado','Aliens attack Earth with deadly electrical tornadoes, and it’s up to a farmer, his smart high-school daughter and a tornado blogger to thwart the horrific invasion.','/bCiOtKLJdYtjie64pO5925OC2vS.jpg','2012-04-21',85,'Released',NULL,'Alien Tornado',104185,2.1643,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31475,_binary '\0','/2j9rtueSUQZdz5rEzfeMSgrDpl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942831',7.7,1596,'en','Company','Set in modern upper-crust Manhattan, an exploration of love and commitment as seen through the eyes of a charming perpetual bachelor questioning his single state and his enthusiastically married, slightly envious friends.','/kpvvHmWTnVAl9oEiGouQ1GZKvmf.jpg','2011-06-15',146,'Released',NULL,'Company',140846,1.6613,7,'U_RJtM2PK7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31476,_binary '\0','/fPUbP2MpL1zGD1x8xkOtu1o6ZH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942884',7.6,21762,'en','Indie Game: The Movie','Follows the dramatic journeys of video game developers as they create and release their games to the world. It\'s about making video games, but at its core, it\'s about the creative process, and exposing yourself through your work.','/2B1IqPg97ZhpEov4Fg3si4hI1Kw.jpg','2012-05-18',103,'Released','Making fun and games is anything but fun and games.','Indie Game: The Movie',80215,1.7465,7.5,'GhaT78i1x2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31477,_binary '\0','/m8OMTJjfuaV9QOvQutgeubmaoFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942900',6,1435,'en','Kiss at Pine Lake','A boy and a girl fall in love during summer camp and promise to stay in touch, but they don\'t. Fifteen years later they meet again in the same camp under very different circumstances. What will happen to the camp and will they try again?','/sQR9DeD6XTwWGcKD90yUSnKn5Me.jpg','2012-05-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Kiss at Pine Lake',117878,2.0878,5.9,'S6mFUTEQqpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31478,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942971',6.7,1313,'en','Showrunners: The Art of Running a TV Show','“Showrunners” is the first ever feature length documentary film to explore the fascinating world of US television showrunners and the creative forces aligned around them. These are the people responsible for creating, writing and overseeing every element of production on one of the United State’s biggest exports – television drama and comedy series. Often described as the most complex job in the entertainment business, a showrunner is the chief writer / producer on a TV series and, in most instances, the show’s creator. Battling daily between art and commerce, showrunners manage every aspect of a TV show’s development and production: creative, financial and logistical.','/kWEPPZKsF3OFNZgyEoFc56I3VOr.jpg','2014-10-17',88,'Released','Their Vision Is Television','Showrunners: The Art of Running a TV Show',147778,2.5524,6.4,'_XVSHhNm6Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31479,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1942989',6.8,3418,'en','The Citizen','Yearning to leave behind his life of misfortune in the Middle East, Ibrahim Jarrah wins the U.S. Green Card Lottery for a chance to become an American citizen. Ibrahim lands in New York City the day before 9/11…and the events of the September terrorist attacks forever shape the struggles he faces on his journey to capture the American dream.','/HTAWH6ShCGsbAmzHVddkdched5.jpg','2012-09-19',99,'Released',NULL,'The Citizen',171698,2.4783,6.5,'fVHFNQlkggo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31480,_binary '\0','/5e1D0tx6B5ox5jjXWfgQH2Y1SG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1943014',4.2,1391,'en','The Wicked Within','After a year passes since the sudden death of a child, a family gathering takes place whilst unexplainable events occur. Tension over peculiar circumstances cracks the veneer of cordiality and dark secrets emerge.','/82lKQXWuPBaGA9048pHB9WsPAPO.jpg','2015-10-16',91,'Released','Every family has its demons. The truth will possess us all.','The Wicked Within',157422,1.9562,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31481,_binary '\0','/t1pw7UenmE8F6G30ZL38oHcV4p1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1943765',6.7,1734,'en','Morgan','Morgan is the inspiring story of Morgan Oliver, a gay young athlete determined that a bicycle accident that left him paralyzed will not change him. He takes a chance on love when he meets Dean Kagen on a basketball court. Dean helps Morgan train for the same race in which he had his accident. But when he sees that Morgan will risk everything to win, Dean walks out. Left alone to face the race and demons that caused his accident, Morgan teeters between what he needs and what he wants. Can he find the strength to pull himself back up again?','/1TKTOVnLKWmuzJ3lUnpzt03AqbZ.jpg','2012-01-07',89,'Released','Sometimes you have to dare to dream','Morgan',151693,1.7391,5.8,'1cnOM_GatwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31482,_binary '\0','/3e7KZWmgGRRg3BGKyJmQlJJE4r4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1943873',7.5,2365,'en','You\'ve Been Trumped','In this David and Goliath story for the 21st century, a group of proud Scottish homeowners take on celebrity tycoon Donald Trump as he buys up one of Scotland\'s last wilderness areas to build a golf resort.','/hF5CXLEgPrfS7Wv73RyoOslX5ps.jpg','2012-07-06',95,'Released','Because Money and Power Should Not Cost the Earth','You\'ve Been Trumped',118769,1.4406,6.5,'hjAIKgOOc8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31483,_binary '\0','/eNBsISJpxxfROy3MrTic0YCB2UA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19445266',5.1,1662,'en','Razzennest','South African enfant terrible filmmaker and artiste-cineaste Manus Oosthuizen meets with Rotten Tomatoes-approved indie film critic Babette Cruickshank in an Echo Park sound studio. With key members of Manus\'s crew joining, they record an audio commentary track for his new elegiac feature documentary Razzennest. But the session goes down a different path... cazzart! The ultimate elevation of arthouse horror, just not as you might expect.','/bGoZSMwlwp531sC7fEUy2jrKU90.jpg','2022-09-29',81,'Released','History is Written by the Dead','Razzennest',978938,1.5348,5.233,'sIuF40DRsXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31484,_binary '\0','/hZfRDnqqh7hlvMu7O5j4EvwIMNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945034',6.5,3507,'es','Una pistola en cada mano','J. is depressed. E. lives peacefully. S. tries to get back with his wife. G. resorts to anxiolytics. P. plays seduction games. María and Sara exchange their husbands. L. calls his lover in a peculiar way.','/yLQGaOWSgCZ0o5UCL1WWUjicUPw.jpg','2012-12-05',90,'Released','When love is a weapon, you need…','A Gun in Each Hand',139808,1.9582,5.9,'eNWQ-KEGUb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31485,_binary '\0','/gr0K6DBPwZfksSb8KVEcWsndP0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945039',7.8,1290,'ml','ആദാമിന്‍റെ മകൻ അബു','Abu, a poor perfume seller, lives with his wife. The couple strives hard to make an honest attempt to go for the Hajj pilgrimage.','/pHDJNc798sdonF78TanRxHfWneC.jpg','2011-06-24',104,'Released','The most misunderstood religion in the world is all about love','Adaminte Makan Abu',132189,1.1376,6.536,'0NwQ-IE4JMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31486,_binary '\0','/eKawmfSvrDkfGglKQF8MHSNIAYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945044',4.6,6585,'en','Exeter','During an all-night, drug-fueled party at an abandoned asylum known for the horrific treatment of its patients, a group of ordinary teens decide to experiment with the occult, mysteriously leading to a violent possession. In an effort to find help, the group rushes to escape, only to find themselves locked inside with no means of communication. Tempers flare, trusts are broken and in attempt to save one of their friends possessed by the demon, the amateurs try to perform an exorcism. Instead of solving the problem, and unbeknownst to them, they unleash an even more powerful and vengeful spirit, one with a distinct motive and which wants them all dead. The teen\'s only chance of survival is to uncover the asylum\'s deep mysteries and find a way out before it\'s too late.','/AwhFI88HW2BE62E6kEsTGPliZKB.jpg','2015-01-16',91,'Released','An excellent day for an exorcism','Exeter',226458,2.935,4.7,'SBoI-R4mhkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31487,_binary '\0','/2kaBbThrOp8ZXf8iSuGmiuI2Zwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945062',4.8,11402,'en','About Cherry','18-year-old Angelina shuffles between school, a dead-end job, her exploitative boyfriend, and home, where her life consists of cleaning up after her alcoholic mother and protecting her younger sister from their menacing stepfather. After arranging an escape to San Francisco with her best friend Andrew, she soon finds herself dating a coke-addicted attorney and becoming immersed in the local porn industry, mentored by lesbian director Margaret, who has more than just a professional interest in Angelina\'s talents.','/gl6Q7GwDnwHDNd1emmQBoyUKiwB.jpg','2012-02-14',102,'Released','There\'s No Such Thing As Going Too Far.','About Cherry',94901,5.1542,4.6,'Pm6RlqnxI-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31488,_binary '\0','/dWA4vVw6yyNdlHtSZhC1APlVDwT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945084',5.1,20593,'en','Everly','After she betrays a powerful mob boss, a woman matches wits and weaponry with a legion of killers who are out to collect the bounty on the heads of her and her family.','/xOJ7zR5N6GFMs6psJpSgbY9Qo5R.jpg','2015-02-26',93,'Released','Enter if you dare.','Everly',277355,4.0165,5.519,'jCWXWgg5H9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31489,_binary '\0','/iE0fIZNpKUOhdu56vu3uQHjtNM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1945228',6.5,5833,'en','Voyage of Time: Life\'s Journey','A celebration of the universe, displaying the whole of time, from its start to its final collapse. This film examines all that occurred to prepare the world that stands before us now: science and spirit, birth and death, the grand cosmos and the minute life systems of our planet.','/by2hTbppbkyhQ2ddALHzXlUq8LM.jpg','2017-03-10',90,'Released','From So Simple a Beginning.','Voyage of Time: Life\'s Journey',86822,2.8601,6.323,'YlWe_YcBWDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31490,_binary '\0','/u9jhRivrlpUk2WLuq4lXf3TuRPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946289',6,1521,'fr','L\'homme qui rit','During a winter storm, Ursus offers shelter to two orphans, Gwynplaine and Déa; some years later, they are still living together. Gwynplaine has become a famous star, but his success threatens his relationships with Déa and Ursus.','/fyZ6OW6750keTIftUWwFuPa4uCN.jpg','2012-12-26',93,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Laughs',151826,3.1054,6,'M0ajiIiHrts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31491,_binary '\0','/dsVgmBCPaTs4ugO0ctH6g2jaCWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946298',5.7,3025,'fr','Le Guetteur','When police is about to apprehend a famous gang of bank robbers, an elite sniper opens fire from a roof, thus facilitating the flee of his accomplices. However, one of them is seriously injured, which compromises the plans of the thieves.','/jLy3x4zEHrMeWtKzBcpsx4WLdH3.jpg','2012-09-05',86,'Released',NULL,'The Lookout',122192,2.1938,5.581,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31492,_binary '\0','/lY34oYh7u5BQrXcPEekKzoChIEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946310',5.8,2294,'en','Crazy Kind of Love','While re-evaluating her life, a mother relies on her stoner son and his awkward brother to keep life interesting. When an unlikely romance blossoms between the youngest son and the girl next door, she realizes the key to her happiness can be found where she least expects it.','/fFy97WBoUyGqlUVMh5A9YcJZsh7.jpg','2013-05-31',87,'Released','Family is a puzzle. It comes together one piece at a time.','Crazy Kind of Love',191566,2.1701,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31493,_binary '\0','/zjldO41BNz3v8bnHqDRLsI7Ehg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946347',5.2,1762,'it','Gladiatori di Roma','A new hero is born in this hilarious, animated adventure of epic proportions! Timo, a student at the Gladiators? Academy in Rome, has no desire to become a legendary gladiator like his stepfather. That is, until the mesmerizing Lucilla walks into his life. With the help of an unlikely band of sidekicks, Timo is determined to be the gladiator of her dreams and embarks on an action-packed journey to become the Colosseum?s first victor!','/9Qyx97TwsPQ1uR82wwQ2dzY0wOU.jpg','2012-10-18',94,'Released','Not Born to Be Gladiators','Gladiators of Rome',137548,2.9209,5.731,'PFF-N8kgYjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31494,_binary '\0','/2IVCxbB93bxMaovkNuLB4bG3dSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946381',4.1,1818,'en','Red Sky','Disgraced Top Gun fighter pilot Butch Masters leads a rogue squad in recovery of a WMD. Masters must navigate a fractured friendship, a love triangle, and must take to the skies to reclaim his military and personal honor.','/h5wrpVvjeq8kgClO0CtX2aNOcxU.jpg','2014-03-12',100,'Released','Go Rogue','Red Sky',242166,2.5091,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31495,_binary '\0','/ptoEJX75We768HAzQ96myFsJ94O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946421',6.8,3250,'en','The Captains','The Captains is a feature-length documentary film written and directed by William Shatner. The film follows Shatner as he interviews the other actors who have portrayed starship captains in the Star Trek franchise.','/ex8S1Xypc8NHb2jvI3hZskPyVhh.jpg','2011-07-22',97,'Released','The final frontier is only the beginning','The Captains',70703,3.4544,6.405,'nKOnV0wS6Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31496,_binary '\0','/93gOZuHazBWulk7b47MCXWVTiqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1946502',5.2,8668,'en','UglyDolls','In the adorably different town of Uglyville, weirdness is celebrated, strangeness is special and beauty is embraced as more than meets the eye. After traveling to the other side of a mountain, Moxy and her UglyDoll friends discover Perfection -- a town where more conventional dolls receive training before entering the real world to find the love of a child.','/p97LQ1TL95mptVL2AS8Rz1cJCQg.jpg','2019-05-01',88,'Released','A classic underdoll story.','UglyDolls',454458,7.3504,6.6,'7-VGKtQbS24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31497,_binary '\0','/oal5fDK90yX6b8yunj6JahBqX2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19465630',6.4,8569,'uk','Снайпер. Білий ворон','Mykola is an eccentric pacifist who wants to be useful to humanity. When the war begins in Donbas, Mykola’s naive world is collapsing as the militants kill his pregnant wife and burn his home to the ground. Recovered, he makes a cardinal decision and gets enlisted in a sniper company. Having met his wife’s killers, he emotionally breaks down and arranges “sniper terror” for the enemy.','/lZOODJzwuQo0etJJyBBZJOSdZcW.jpg','2022-05-03',120,'Released','On the battlefield, one bullet can change everything.','Sniper: The White Raven',966220,7.0514,7.719,'cZIhRHSXtyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31498,_binary '\0','/hGCO9lWeoCQc9IAUZqt7T9EimT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1947998',3.8,1882,'en','Dear God No!','A gang of outlaw bikers pull a home invasion on a disgraced Anthropologist hiding a secret locked in his cabin basement.','/r3nznxWCH0ihflOHmkcNEE5Msb6.jpg','2011-10-21',85,'Released','When the blood begins to flow.... who will be left to scream.','Dear God No!',89403,0.9495,3.5,'rHcAunRydZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31499,_binary '\0','/hEwPNUPLim6XxelWKkH4zGXdenx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1948150',6.8,22802,'hi','सिंघम','An honest, small town cop is transferred to a big city that is controlled by a crime boss that he had once humiliated. Remake of Tamil Singam (2010).','/pggLRaurdWwjqX2vkhKIVQSBjXV.jpg','2011-07-22',143,'Released',NULL,'Singham',70590,2.7116,6.5,'mp-XqCrCi6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31500,_binary '\0','/AlVn3M0sTLa0WuU9Cc8cpfnOsOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19488344',6.3,1373,'pa','Honeymoon','A newlywed couple\'s honeymoon in London turns into a hilariously chaotic trip when the pair\'s clueless family crashes the romantic getaway.','/zshh1Td7DA2vUAZppborLqVeoAH.jpg','2022-10-25',131,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoon',1033884,1.584,7,'Z0uAhXV9Wpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31501,_binary '\0','/oQVzkJvOeQo3PjL0JlDK152n0FP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1949548',5,4852,'hi','Heroine','A female superstar struggles through the trials and tribulations of being a Bollywood actress.','/v1QyMNUpbWJwrU0OlI3uLivrENZ.jpg','2012-09-21',140,'Released','Unlock Your Mind This summer','Heroine',134215,1.8719,4.967,'lonG_351xgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31502,_binary '\0','/qSv7KLlhDFFrBhXL6cN3EcmAhle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1949605',4.9,1720,'en','Who Gets the Dog?','Six years after saying \"I do,\" Olive and Clay call it quits. Although they split amicably, both want custody of their beloved dog Wesley and they end up in court. With everything at stake, can man\'s best friend find a way to reunite the couple?','/rLXPoZ2ApBD5pFMNTyxhyJvoxkG.jpg','2016-09-13',95,'Released','Breakups can be woof!','Who Gets the Dog?',415766,3.5753,5.1,'7oq_x3Vk0sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31503,_binary '\0','/sidvlo7V8VMyskNKGwua0Tarbol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19500164',7.5,63502,'en','Nimona','A knight framed for a tragic crime teams with a scrappy, shape-shifting teen to prove his innocence.','/2NQljeavtfl22207D1kxLpa4LS3.jpg','2023-06-23',99,'Released','A little anti. A little hero.','Nimona',961323,7.0767,7.853,'f_fuHRyQbOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31504,_binary '\0','/2vq5GTJOahE03mNYZGxIynlHcWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1950186',8.1,586714,'en','Ford v Ferrari','American car designer Carroll Shelby and the British-born driver Ken Miles work together to battle corporate interference, the laws of physics, and their own personal demons to build a revolutionary race car for Ford Motor Company and take on the dominating race cars of Enzo Ferrari at the 24 Hours of Le Mans in France in 1966.','/dR1Ju50iudrOh3YgfwkAU1g2HZe.jpg','2019-11-13',153,'Released','They took the American dream for a ride.','Ford v Ferrari',359724,22.8579,8,'I3h9Z89U9ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31505,_binary '\0','/zAWXavwU4pdTkOU3DSrgM3xGjBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1950235',5.9,27246,'en','Let It Snow','In a small town on Christmas Eve, a snowstorm brings together a group of young people. They soon find their friendships and love lives colliding, and come Christmas morning, nothing will be the same.','/rEVu3E1OhMPJeCAn9a6QLyVhZDj.jpg','2019-11-08',93,'Released','Let love take you by storm.','Let It Snow',295151,5.4068,6.1,'pitxxQYZcug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31506,_binary '\0','/w1YMpwptMmXZwBLXoDFp3ktuYwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1951095',5.4,4619,'en','Child of God','A dispossessed, violent man\'s life is a disastrous attempt to exist outside the social order. Successively deprived of parents and homes and with few other ties, he descends to the level of a cave dweller and falls deeper into crime and degradation.','/6HFUfOnpwHeuHJLs8o4w4QK20C2.jpg','2014-04-28',104,'Released','Murder is his salvation','Child of God',152736,2.2592,4.8,'uUZyAL-Tpws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31507,_binary '\0','/kKe5KtlJarhjk9KYQdKsVGe95JU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1951133',6.2,1252,'en','Funeral Kings','It\'s always a good day for a funeral at St. Mark\'s Middle School. Andy and Charlie, two altar servers, don\'t just get to miss class anytime a parishioner kicks the bucket, they cut out early and play hooky as soon as the service is over. Eventually their irreverent personalities will put them in a situation that is too big for them to handle.','/eC9Hxvkw8HI4GqFIKKX9uc4i1wm.jpg','2012-11-16',85,'Released',NULL,'Funeral Kings',96087,1.1869,6.1,'qvCobdWtavQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31508,_binary '\0','/3DrlQ3JtNgdutIpZQZPfUUjpZlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1951166',6.5,5865,'fr','Le Capital','The head of a giant European investment bank desperately clings to power when an American hedge fund company tries to buy them out.','/3vUOc5i1nDaP4gmTQ9rpEsUJOUi.jpg','2012-11-14',114,'Released',NULL,'Capital',121793,2.3262,6.177,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31509,_binary '\0','/mqIheOKqtRD7Z9l4kEmic7BDqEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1951181',6.6,35412,'en','The Immigrant','1921 New York. An immigrant woman is tricked into a life of burlesque and vaudeville until a dazzling magician tries to save her and reunite her with her sister who is being held in the confines of Ellis Island.','/ArWRRQYeXL3nG4jYpMOPoBvgmy9.jpg','2013-11-27',117,'Released',NULL,'The Immigrant',152599,5.923,6.329,'97PQtQ3B6rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31510,_binary '\0','/wzMQ6GVCtIiG4hQi2bAQFqVyW79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1951216',6,