ons girls for a living but finally meets his match is this fun-filled \"ROM-CON.\"','/3PxKzBv4hr7rKjofcCiMRnwx4AT.jpg','2011-12-08',140,'Released',NULL,'Ladies VS. Ricky Bahl',82698,1.9187,6.045,'6y4XYlHktsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31524,_binary '\0','/xL10TJ5dQluARc6Qq1dkHs2Xrk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1954701',7.3,18396,'de','Oh Boy','Niko, a twenty-something college dropout, lives for the moment as he drifts through the streets of Berlin, curiously observing everyone around him and oblivious to his growing status as an outsider. Then on one fateful day, through a series of absurdly amusing encounters, everything changes.','/gy58pmCztFrpxaRM9rGhv93LgCP.jpg','2012-11-01',88,'Released','No job. No girl. No coffee.','A Coffee in Berlin',130739,2.6915,7.204,'oMwUSipMzFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31525,_binary '\0','/2KVfDRUbEFBmtn3C6B5fQYZOPMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1954811',5.2,1477,'en','See Girl Run','What happens when a 30-something woman allows life\'s \"what if\"s to overwhelm her appreciation for what life actually is? Disregarding her current obligations, she digs into her romantic past in hopes of invigorating her present.','/b0l12kcEJ410qHJ9ET7pcMd7Xm8.jpg','2012-03-11',90,'Released','Sometimes going back is the only way forward.','See Girl Run',97732,1.6796,5.069,'_EPwgleiQlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31526,_binary '\0','/WHgowcHmy1lXITLOGyS0oJANMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1954843',5.6,2391,'en','Space Milkshake','Four low-ranking astronauts are stuck together on an orbital Sanitation Station after they bring a mysterious device aboard their ship and all life on Earth disappears. Little do they know they are about to come under attack by a mutating rubber duck named Gary, who wants to open a portal to his evil dimension and take over the Universe.','/6gzXQd8GUhqfwdHtE4hyTnPQ5t9.jpg','2012-10-26',85,'Released','We\'re ducked','Space Milkshak