fe’s path, experiences joy and pain, endures the wheel of fortune randomly turn his luck into disaster and his despair into unexpected bliss. But not even for a moment does he lose his innocence.','/1MK86Vr2nf1GSYOtRd8pFvA5RM8.jpg','2022-09-30',88,'Released','May all your dreams come true.','EO',785398,5.4673,6.5,'ii0gjj963ZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31562,_binary '\0','/ft0r9QV6Fh6NPZoi8bmvbt9y0Yz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1965308',5.7,10486,'en','InterReflections','In a quest for a new, more humane society, a counter-culture revolution takes the world by storm. In the first of the InterReflections Trilogy, we look back to the modern world and wonder how it was we managed to survive as long as we had.','/r7dA6ju7gPdHhVEr06wa3IY3VyJ.jpg','2020-01-26',165,'Released','Which side of history will you be on?','InterReflections',67326,1.8943,5.9,'_W5eOZev4CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31563,_binary '\0','/hqU7refTJZ8rqQsMpfnCsiJAy8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19653180',7.9,19517,'fa','برادران لیلا','At the age of 40, Leila has spent her entire life caring for her parents and four brothers. A family that is constantly arguing and under pressure from various debts in the face of sanctions against Iran. While her brothers are struggling to make ends meet, Leila makes a plan.','/onQUSikPNXVvoT3wCLzHgiOPrHT.jpg','2022-08-24',170,'Released',NULL,'Leila\'s Brothers',962558,3.05,7.6,'mlBuFgvYWDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31564,_binary '\0','/zDc9955Z37GV7pKkgKrp0JF3obF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1966359',5.6,24230,'en','Father Figures','Upon learning that their mother has been lying to them for years about their allegedly deceased father, two fraternal twin brothers hit the road in order to find him.','/avRiH6kbsw3Wxi1J7857alb9yyt.jpg','2017-12-21',113,'Released','Finding their father would be a family miracle.','Father Figures',354861,7.6355,5.777,'3GOjf9ZGnIQ','YouTube',