'/yMaHhVkyFL4U1jJkg9SZKo80T9w.jpg','2012-07-13',99,'Released','There are two sides to every lie.','The Imposter',84287,2.9609,7.3,'4ar3bGDLXmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31569,_binary '\0','/feO6v1UMaCDFsshStLpAv2FwARz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1967545',6.9,57628,'en','Labor Day','Two strangers are drawn together under incredible circumstances. What starts as an unforeseen encounter over a long holiday weekend soon becomes a second chance love story.','/iQdbCtk1Q3TdZRBKSLU1Vh870l7.jpg','2013-12-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Labor Day',130150,9.6294,7.064,'eDAm-qRpkHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31570,_binary '\0','/3iUXvjXJPBzbAajLzztETZebpuY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1967614',5.8,8665,'en','The Comedian','An aging comic icon, Jackie Burke, has seen better days. Despite his efforts to reinvent himself and his comic genius, the audience only wants to know him as the former television character he once played. Already a strain on his younger brother and his wife, Jackie is forced to serve out a sentence doing community service for accosting an audience member. While there, he meets Harmony, the daughter of a sleazy Florida real estate mogul, and the two find inspiration in one another, resulting in surprising consequences.','/jR7PZd7K0dFT6oL9qhbSsiJXDsR.jpg','2016-12-09',120,'Released','nobody\'s a bargain','The Comedian',369524,2.7214,5.7,'QJit_DU2XhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31571,_binary '\0','/aiGofBuScyARwucuhfwhatA6uJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1967688',5.9,1676,'en','Desperately Seeking Santa','Jennifer, a young, ambitious executive running promotions at a failing Boston mall comes up with a genius promotional gimmick to save her workplace and position herself for advancement: hold a \"Hunky Santa\" contest to replace the old Mall Santa. David, a local man trying to save his family\'s pizzeria, ultimately wins the contest and sparks fly between him and Jennifer. However, complications ensue when it comes to light that the company Jennifer works for is the same one trying to run David\'s family out of business.','/8TEdwCxgtPUq3VLvvjmaGlwaHL6.jpg','2012-11-07',87,'Released',NULL,'Desperately Seeking Santa',81330,1.7396,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31572,_binary '\0','/8FeC8e2LxArT0Nfr2opdObLZDel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1967697',6.8,2271,'en','White Frog','When Nick, who has Asperger\'s syndrome, struggles to carry on after the death of his brother Chaz, Chaz\'s best friend Randy takes Nick under his wing.','/9T3BQSIuw7OkvWndcr306tC2ybR.jpg','2013-05-10',93,'Released','Everyone is different...some more than others','White Frog',192623,2.7589,5.889,'ei3oedWt1Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31573,_binary '\0','/As0Mex8uhCGWnihqeEbbQ2xGwyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1969057',7.3,1310,'de','Homevideo','Shy, sensitive high school outsider Jakob Moormann is miserably lacking immaterial support at home, where his strict father, uniformed cop Claas, and selfish mother are too busy breaking up to be there for him. Jakob focuses on class dream-girl Hannah, without much luck. His secret recording of himself masturbating gets into class bullies Henry and Erik\'s hands through the mother\'s thoughtlessness. The rascals blackmail Jakob and post the video on the Internet. After a raging lecture phase, dad stands up for Jakob, but his life is already wrecked more than anyone realizes.','/4tbyRMlETn7RwobflixlZ1uz0f4.jpg','2011-08-18',89,'Released',NULL,'Homevideo',79016,1.0537,6.674,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31574,_binary '\0','/cgu22PGyj7Bi5sSGA5VuymI2Z7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1969062',6.9,17917,'en','Infinitely Polar Bear','A manic-depressive mess of a father tries to win back his wife by attempting to take full responsibility of their two young, spirited daughters, who don\'t make the overwhelming task any easier.','/knQuQkoqNLXKvdwcjgGpY1gzmJa.jpg','2014-01-18',87,'Released','Sometimes family is the best medicine.','Infinitely Polar Bear',244539,3.4391,6.6,'d1pCQS1H2Z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31575,_binary '\0','/3J56A5EaJno1qSDEYIFQxaiiqh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1969959',2,1451,'it','Box Office 3D - Il film dei film','An Italian parody of the biggest U.S. blockbusters such as \"Gladiator, \" \"Harry Potter\", \"Fast and Furious\" and \"The Da Vinci Code\".','/1GhEuQr18Jh3ZJQu98hpKDH63Zd.jpg','2011-09-09',102,'Released','At my signal, unleash Hell... or at least make a racket!','Box Office 3D: The Filmest of Films',76994,1.705,2.9,'KMqY-KIg_n4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31576,_binary '\0','/wbDkvShcrveXNFsgyujY4kdurVa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19704542',5.7,6921,'en','Sidelined: The QB and Me','Dallas, a burdened but headstrong dancer, is determined to get into the best dance school in the country—her late mother’s alma mater. However, that dream is suddenly derailed when the cheeky yet secretly grieving football star, Drayton, crashes into her life with a unique story of his own. Will the two of them be able to grow into their dreams together, or will their dreams be sidelined?','/mSL6truNrWP1Bn9ng1rN0SkMI4f.jpg','2025-02-06',99,'Released','Prepare to catch feelings.','Sidelined: The QB and Me',957119,10.3815,6.448,'KJm3CNtYQpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31577,_binary '\0','/rPSJAElGxOTko1zK6uIlYnTMFxN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19704612',5.8,2933,'en','Gangs of Lagos','A group of friends who each have to navigate their own destiny, growing up on the bustling streets and neighborhood of Isale Eko, Lagos.','/nGwFsB6EXUCr21wzPgtP5juZPSv.jpg','2023-04-07',124,'Released',NULL,'Gangs of Lagos',1104040,1.1144,6,'TBLNplnMVzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31578,_binary '\0','/iuGaTFUUNlkSAyyULZVKt9ZwBzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19704638',6.6,15976,'en','Our Father','After a woman\'s at-home DNA test reveals multiple half-siblings, she discovers a shocking scheme involving donor sperm and a popular fertility doctor.','/maG75HDZbOwywDFd1h195CA8I36.jpg','2022-05-11',97,'Released','Is he yours?','Our Father',962697,1.9732,6.5,'phQxK5u8IEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31579,_binary '\0','/lYlCKvcw7DeP8DwKY1VO0kJVT0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19705884',5.6,6761,'no','Good Boy','Christian, a millionaire heir, meets Sigrid, a young student, on a dating app. They hit it off quickly, but there\'s only one problem: Christian lives with Frank, a man who dresses up and constantly acts like a dog.','/pzluRg3Jnm2YPs7CQyCrFJ8JADl.jpg','2022-06-03',76,'Released','Simply put, he\'s a dog.','Good Boy',983507,4.0924,6.23,'5I8b9AOZJTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31580,_binary '\0','/fBBU7WEXeY3QbtowP98LBQNyLhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19712072',7.5,6137,'bn','চেঙ্গিজ','The movie revolves around Chengiz, an underworld mafia from the 1970s to the mid-90s that ruled the streets of Calcutta.','/mkEQiWvOp4MYElFfnFv8jqajVPR.jpg','2023-01-05',149,'Released',NULL,'Chengiz',956272,1.2173,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31581,_binary '\0','/6D2yFWcDhGPpNmfkATZwf845p9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19713090',6.7,6148,'ko','더 킬러: 죽어도 되는 아이','While his girlfriend is away on a trip, retired assassin Bang Ui-kang is tasked with looking after her friend\'s 17-year-old daughter. After a street attack, Bang Ui-kang becomes embroiled in a murder investigation and dangerous trafficking gang.','/5IQqdtTq1wH5YJynx86Ysi4sDVt.jpg','2022-07-13',95,'Released','Mission: save the girl.','The Killer',938008,5.77,7.617,'OPqG_zodLpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31582,_binary '\0','/kVChi7qHX9UMcpAh7J6fGBCCH2c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971325',6,62250,'en','Autómata','Jacq Vaucan, an insurance agent of ROC robotics corporation, routinely investigates the case of manipulating a robot. What he discovers will have profound consequences for the future of humanity.','/h7SEtIWOfLsuCWhQgflev7ppRPq.jpg','2014-10-09',110,'Released','Your time is coming to an end – Ours is now beginning','Automata',262543,9.218,5.9,'PDw_BVUVAQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31583,_binary '\0','/h8KYW3ptazhrDshynNABMgcfd8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971352',6.4,41339,'en','Compliance','On a particularly busy day at a suburban Ohio fast food restaurant, manager Sandra receives a phone call from a police officer saying that an employee has stolen money from a customer.','/bLdu28fr9txYlHLmEOyGplDT3nH.jpg','2012-08-23',90,'Released','How far would you go?','Compliance',84188,3.604,6.349,'9XGi3_uD0Ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31584,_binary '\0','/nsu4eCB9b5MXJKqVLhlQgAcCa2B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971466',7,1249,'ko','마당을 나온 암탉','Based on a bestselling preteen novel of the same title that has sold more than 1 million copies in Korea, “Leafie, A Hen into the Wild” is about a laying hen named Leafie who is destined to live the “same old” repetitive life confined on the chicken farm. Her fate changes when she escapes from the chicken farm and hatches a duck egg. With the duckling (who believes Leafie to be his mother), sets off on a journey into the wild with her new son to find her freedom.','/8EC4MNOe8TTx4JS8MncXPTj0eWC.jpg','2011-07-28',93,'Released','A story of love, sacrifice and courage','Leafie, a Hen Into the Wild',89623,3.1616,7.8,'wENxx-3jYnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31585,_binary '\0','/6WcKl6DZRHpFa0fneTTswkvTiIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971514',6.1,1423,'it','Salvo','Salvo, a ruthless Sicilian Mafia hit man, changes his priorities after being involved in a bloody ambush.','/pAd8TgB4KgiOuIf7PBY7dMFEF9j.jpg','2013-06-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Salvo',190901,2.1008,5.8,'2hFutsiH1pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31586,_binary '\0','/nSa6N6lCVoom9itqf33czyldQAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971558',3.9,1468,'en','The Sleeper','It\'s 1981 and the girls of Alpha Gamma Theta sorority are having a party. As the new pledges arrive, so does an uninvited guest. Little do the sisters know someone is watching them in the shadows. As the girls shower, study, eat and sleep the stalker studies the girls. One by one he finds the girls at their most vulnerable and murders them. The police hunt for the missing girls and their killer, but will they find them in time? Or will the girls be forced to fight for their lives..','/9yU7dIrHlVJfzxoX2kSnELruNs6.jpg','2012-01-31',90,'Released','If I Die Before I Wake...','The Sleeper',86101,0.8829,2.9,'q97uRGXEon8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31587,_binary '\0','/efKw78G11Hfst5fbmH6Yc56QgB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1971571',7,1602,'de','Fraktus: Das letzte Kapitel der Musikgeschichte','German mockumentary about the history of the techno band of the same name. Fraktus were once considered the pioneers of techno. Now, after 25 years, they are planning their big comeback. The band is supported by their manager Roger Dettner, who used a trick to get the band back together.','/2pThyBOA43DS9YUxHDDUcWiF7EU.jpg','2012-11-06',95,'Released','The last chapter of music history.','Fraktus',140554,1.8303,6.8,'iHDCE1BISYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31588,_binary '\0','/ngsAuG8JYOiuwgGejN7xljgETNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19719836',6.9,10870,'ko','Retour à Séoul','After an impulsive travel decision to visit friends, Freddie, 25, returns to South Korea for the first time, where she was born before being adopted and raised in France. Freddie suddenly finds herself embarking on an unexpected journey in a country she knows so little about, taking her life in new and unexpected directions.','/uEz1pAW2r1tECDI8ipttabaLHhW.jpg','2022-11-18',119,'Released',NULL,'Return to Seoul',952701,3