eir dad: Kolya considers him a hero, while Vasylii thinks he is a scoundrel.','/9GGORXI4WRusI7XWje8c4lBm9WS.jpg','2023-04-13',106,'Released',NULL,'Luxembourg, Luxembourg',1005141,1.5803,7.7,'keQEs4tL_FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31628,_binary '\0','/lCuRY9QF821VOOV8IJyeLfIuhTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19783734',7.7,6229,'uk','Ти – космос','After the explosion of the Earth, the Ukrainian space trucker Andriy becomes the only human in the Universe until French woman Catherine calls him from the faraway space station. Andriy decides to see her despite all the obstacles.','/hOinKSq03z7L6aXbsmmppgMeBJX.jpg','2025-04-24',101,'Released',NULL,'U Are the Universe',1013052,6.9496,7.5,'NKVB2VoNFYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31629,_binary '\0','/VA14bufR9toIesTGDRUkdMaxeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1978524',5.6,4035,'de','Schlussmacher','BREAK UP MAN is an odd couple road movie and tells the story of Henri, who works for a break up agency in Berlin and on behalf of those who want to separate themselves from their future “ex”-partners. To complete his most important mission he is confronted with an unwanted partner, Toto, who spoils more or less everything and makes Henri’s life a nightmare.','/3b9tQFCfnCGFcM7kRKWJAZcw2qA.jpg','2013-01-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Break Up Man',160085,1.3888,5.907,'ikVuR-zicfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31630,_binary '\0','/8zm0VqBOg0RUekZIx6xZzCo4gCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1978532',5.8,8736,'en','Someone Marry Barry','A trio of friends scheme to find a wife for their socially inappropriate friend Barry, and end up finding a girl just like him.','/4fwVknJ86F6pAXWGOKItWABb1yp.jpg','2014-02-07',86,'Released',NULL,'Someone Marry Barry',249923,2.3035,5.6,'tOCDrc8Min4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31631,_binary '\0','/kM0iQD2OpnUx6qLYKkr2wdN0DOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1978567',3.7,1248,'en','The Reef 2: High 