 about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that\'s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called \"Forky\", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.','/w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg','2019-06-19',100,'Released','The adventure of a lifetime.','Toy Story 4',301528,31.4625,7.464,'LDXYRzerjzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31639,_binary '\0','/cF3H9pyUF6dsvqlYUcH0TyBAMTG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1979388',6.7,142495,'en','The Good Dinosaur','An epic journey into the world of dinosaurs where an Apatosaurus named Arlo makes an unlikely human friend.','/8RSkxOO80btfKjyiC5ZiTaCHIT8.jpg','2015-11-14',93,'Released','A single kindness can change everything.','The Good Dinosaur',105864,32.323,6.755,'8lsIrASLD-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31640,_binary '\0','/3AxTgDxsKQniEyvYcU4KutrNn0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19798116',5.9,1420,'da','Bytte bytte baby','When two pregnant women learn that the fertility clinic mistakenly swapped their eggs, they must navigate the error — and their disdain for each other.','/kKG7t9pHxt8XNr3Ssnqg4Cv2WXU.jpg','2023-03-16',104,'Released','Two couples, one mix-up, and a whole lot of surprises.','Maybe Baby',1079201,1.6854,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31641,_binary '\0','/ccu1ib5IP133bMNn0g6zUeDmbdp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19800814',6.7,2003,'en','Rip in Time','Sarah is an organic farmer who meets a man named Rip Van Winkle Jr., who claims to be from 1787. Soon, she discovers old-fashioned romantic feelings that might be just as crazy as his story.','/fgFpbUPC4YH9TUT0Zbji8pNVYXd.jpg','2022-05-22',84,'Released','When you\'re in love, time stands still.','Rip in Time',958612,1.8387,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31642,_binary '\0','/xGDXI5E7h40mo54NvpzjpskmCcg.jpg','2026-10-