he only thing they have in common is how well they sing together. She takes the women of the group out of their comfort zone of traditional arrangements and into a world of amazing harmonic combinations in a fight to the top of college music competitions.','/gsFoJk9g8W3zgaipRrrURk7LbiF.jpg','2012-09-28',112,'Released','Get pitch slapped.','Pitch Perfect',114150,15.6134,7.3,'8dItOM6eYXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31661,_binary '\0','/7iRe4OiHBgD3FM55X2dZi4pWlGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19820538',7.2,2381,'ko','다음 소희','A female detective investigates the cause of a high school girl’s death and uncovers a disturbing truth.','/mNRgBLBc2inQX1Ba72hQjB4Lwk0.jpg','2022-11-21',138,'Released',NULL,'Next Sohee',923344,2.0788,7.259,'w3IIUdAMcAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31662,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1982759',6.8,1520,'en','Le Fear II: Le Sequel','After the disaster of Le Fear, director Carlos Revalos decides to make a sequel with a bigger budget. What could go wrong? Simply everything.','/4zpT9JrYndkeyhJajaknotfiJ7d.jpg','2016-11-11',90,'Released','I only wanted to make a Bloody Horror Film!','Le Fear II: Le Sequel',865629,1.128,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31663,_binary '\0','/eM4ojeuCZyYbif0NTwE1Ebiue2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1982848',7.4,1688,'ar','١٨ يوم','10 filmmakers provide 10 separate stories focusing on the 18 days of the 2011 Egyptian revolution. Ten stories they have experienced, heard, or imagined.','/kbj3euWVHplgcXoqT3Ry9exLl9f.jpg','2011-09-06',125,'Released',NULL,'18 Days',224486,1.0166,6.6,'pbQfnK7Gn3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31664,_binary '\0','/hu65CqUoGCxmrFk7XaQ2IRoTPd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1982882',4.1,1811,'en','True Bloodthirst','Vampires and humans live in a future world where they co-exist – barely. Now, both groups find themselves under attack by a new species of super vampire. The surviving humans and vampires join forces to obliterate the vicious man-sized bat vampires which threaten to shatter the uneasy peace between the two species.','/c3pSgFaG5yv4tbSb0kDmb0N1sjQ.jpg','2012-07-14',90,'Released',NULL,'True Bloodthirst',120092,1.7694,4.8,'Ebwz0-K6iZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31665,_binary '\0','/oV472EbPedkc5QzqolGc7sCgCnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19838566',4.9,6422,'no','Kraken','A marine biologist is doing research on a fish farm when she encounters several strange occurrences. Along with the brutal deaths of two teenagers, all signs point to the deep fjord; can there be more to the depths than the eye can see?','/snjASPpfqpkmA7lVXDo24rA8I0z.jpg','2026-02-06',94,'Released','Only 5% of the ocean has been explored for a reason…','Kraken',1110034,36.9403,6.238,'EUTatY1-oBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31666,_binary '\0','/2yCvBerA21XiF52be0IYknw5a7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19838608',6.5,9416,'hi','बबली बाउंसर','A first-of-its-kind for her village, Babli takes up a bouncer\'s job to win over her love, leading to a series of funny and heart-warming events.','/iX2vylrLdiiDBGaA3xhPobJp7dW.jpg','2022-09-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Babli Bouncer',1002082,1.458,5.708,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31667,_binary '\0','/bCBxtsw9ijVY0ETAtAyOANK3sKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19838620',5.5,3945,'en','Nandor Fodor and the Talking Mongoose','In 1935, Hungarian-American para-psychologist Nandor Fodor began his investigation of a strange occurrence on the Isle of Man. An average British family, the Irvings, claimed to have been contacted by a mysterious entity at their farm. A talking mongoose. Named Gef (Pronounced \"Jeff\".)','/pnvmMHuMrdWkSC3Y1PtIxOXILNQ.jpg','2023-09-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Nandor Fodor and the Talking Mongoose',979287,2.2842,5.4,'1x2AhTXRVKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31668,_binary '\0','/gOvb0MWKeg97AWr7Cpvi3aDnB0r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19838634',5.9,25671,'hi','Ulajh','The journey of a young IFS officer, belonging to a prominent family of patriots, who gets embroiled in a dangerous personal conspiracy while far from her home turf, at a career-defining post.','/tRTaE89m8As6G6aqgYjCBmm6MKN.jpg','2024-08-02',134,'Released','Every promise is a lie. Every friend is a suspect. Every clue is a trap.','Ulajh',1124876,1.8283,5.763,'Tk1EQD7vGiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31669,_binary '\0','/bTv8z95KN3pgVMirXAzpN84CHaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1984110',4.4,1926,'en','Among Friends','A twisted horror about a dinner party gone wrong. Set against an 80s backdrop, the good time takes a dark turn when one in the group hijacks the evening in an attempt to help the others come clean about their secret betrayals against one another–and is willing to cut through the bone in order to expose the truth.','/iy2golngZQWB424znah0qvhv93O.jpg','2012-07-08',80,'Released','This dinner party\'s gonna be KILLER.','Among Friends',125558,1.4332,4.3,'V_RBN-ozihk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31670,_binary '\0','/pFgJs2sVaFMNZDX9mvdkSbVSqeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1984153',6.1,27006,'en','Excision','Pauline, a disturbed, outcast teenager, has a fascination with surgery and experiences violent, psychosexual fantasies, all while aspiring to a career in medicine.','/3aLgB6FTQlNanER0RpckbKdwyh9.jpg','2012-09-12',81,'Released','Heal The Sickness','Excision',84194,3.461,6.219,'Zp0A4sQWjvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31671,_binary '\0','/w2KUMhuk3HZVsdGLCLiuFam7kEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19841734',6.6,4884,'fr','L\'Innocent','Sylvie, a nearly sixty-year-old woman, has fallen in love with Michel, a thug she marries in prison. The couple dream of starting again with a clean slate by opening a flower shop. But Sylvie’s son Abel, convinced that Michel will fall into a life of crime, disapproves of this