19',137,'Released','You will be changed.','Wicked: For Good',967941,30.2274,6.584,'R2Xubj7lazE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31676,_binary '\0','/2gmaQoioyg0nmYEMBlSjBovLcUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19848268',4.9,6159,'en','Fear the Night','During a bachelorette party in a secluded California farmhouse, masked intruders launch a brutal attack, forcing eight women to fight for survival. Led by Tess, a troubled military veteran, they unite to defend themselves throughout a harrowing night.','/oAWpvlroYbHbkaeKwlL3XlVRnyG.jpg','2023-07-21',92,'Released','Fight til dawn.','Fear the Night',1143190,5.0638,5.909,'fNkZjTXeaf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31677,_binary '\0','/18KD4JzKcPgPpZ6aqhz96b8aeRM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19848676',6.6,1998,'en','Riley','The life of a disciplined high school athlete begins to unravel when his queer identity competes against the idea of who he was supposed to be.','/1vW8CLfLfZ3KAG52G7a6ET3s61N.jpg','2025-12-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Riley',1177865,1.6533,5.7,'ECtc7a53hhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31678,_binary '\0','/gh7pgS9iskzlRMWfa8UEeGY6RgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985017',5.3,8054,'en','Atlas Shrugged: Part II','Railroad owner Dagny Taggart and steel mogul Henry Rearden search desperately for the inventor of a revolutionary motor as the U.S. government continues to spread its control over the national economy.','/9iwPz9zy1uCP73QMxhNs6gaTTom.jpg','2012-10-12',112,'Released','Who is John Galt?','Atlas Shrugged: Part II',134371,3.6469,5.2,'AF9QT43uDQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31679,_binary '\0','/c3eDS62fd2wuchzjbv5kJAIoIiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985019',6.3,25606,'en','Austenland','Obsessed with the BBC production of \"Pride and Prejudice\", a woman travels to a Jane Austen theme park in search for her perfect gentleman.','/8f9XX2rIOY5kmzivS5sZfnVuCxE.jpg','2013-08-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Austenland',156711,3.9798,6.349,'xQL8d5NTHlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31680,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985100',8.2,1272,'bn','হাজার বছর ধরে','The barren wife of a rich man allows him to marry a younger woman in order to have a child.','/49htOnktPSYor4Mej7GC3qhgJnN.jpg','2005-01-09',136,'Released','Symphony of Agony','Symphony of Agony',434006,1.3561,8.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31681,_binary '\0','/fGshLKUGUqRRolgWkyoEmr0mzJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985266',6.7,8667,'fa','ورود آقایان ممنوع','In order to prepare her best and brightest for the upcoming chemistry Olympiad, strict, conservative headmistress Ms. Darabi is forced to break her lifelong rule of not allowing male teachers in the school and reluctantly hires the bumbling Mr. Jebeli. Little does she know though that several of her students, led by the self-assured Paria, have a plan to get her to fall in love with him. \'No Men Allowed\' is a hilarious, rollicking romcom, chock-full of witty dialogue and zany antics that will have you coming back time and time again!','/qAmcSZTqXpBb26rCTHDIlwDE1XC.jpg','2011-06-15',102,'Released',NULL,'No Men Allowed',388204,0.9582,6.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31682,_binary '\0','/wQiXDEzfU8pydakr5yZ01bhlN30.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19853258',8.1,18270,'en','STILL: A Michael J. Fox Movie','A short kid from a Canadian army base becomes the international pop culture darling of the 1980s—only to find the course of his life altered by a stunning diagnosis. What happens when an incurable optimist confronts an incurable disease?','/fDO4gYZxvdsIrHKzsSAbc3N7Wfg.jpg','2023-01-20',95,'Released',NULL,'STILL: A Michael J. Fox Movie',1058699,8.2261,7.8,'yHgMSR4F1Ak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31683,_binary '\0','/9l3oDzswSC5rlCWAfGWerIvPxMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19853698',6.4,5557,'en','Música','A young man, plagued by the music in his head, has to come to terms with an uncertain future while balancing love, family and Brazilian culture in Newark, New Jersey.','/kUX5ourGUJDG0yvEeS3uooZS0dS.jpg','2024-03-13',91,'Released','Face the music.','Música',968441,2.6577,6.4,'VckVviJh8ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31684,_binary '\0','/mzpsWQSaehWLfKkLarITsB2iRJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19853810',6.6,1631,'en','Looking for Her','Taylor is headed home for the holidays and her family is finally ready to meet her girlfriend \"Jess\". The only problem is, Jess isn\'t really her girlfriend. Taylor holds open auditions for someone to play the part for the holidays.','/pPvVZYfNY0xZPCcrP4zR5b4vGDt.jpg','2022-12-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Looking for Her',1038157,1.189,7,'OUss-2_1nTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31685,_binary '\0','/fxHJCv78XO9baIjcRNK6ZEYfnYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19857862',2.3,17458,'hu','Most vagy soha!','On March 15, 1848, a young firebrand poet, Sándor Petöfi ignites the Hungarian Revolution with his passionate \'National Song\', prompting the Austrians to dispatch a ruthless secret agent to assassinate him and suppress the uprising.','/o1vuwWJIxCfORNO8LUqu1j0OSjI.jpg','2024-03-14',135,'Released','One spark is enough to set the world on fire.','Now or Never!',984195,1.4986,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31686,_binary '\0','/uqyjO3wzR7Kj2WL4bMiUljiEM29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19858164',6,14577,'en','Little Bone Lodge','During a stormy night in the Scottish Highlands, two criminal brothers on the run seek refuge in a desolate farmhouse. But after taking the resident family captive, they find the house holds even darker secrets of its own.','/2BwerQH4tZvHU6zUlC77aDw7pLt.jpg','2023-11-23',93,'Released','A mother always protects her family.','Little Bone Lodge',1075335,3.02,6.6,'Hux3uEsesEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31687,_binary '\0','/h7l5Kt46llTSNd77g7sEUB2ZtLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19858184',6.4,1697,'fr','Bernadette','When she arrived at the Elysée Palace, Bernadette Chirac expected to finally get the place she deserved, she who had always worked in the shadow of her husband to make him president. Put aside because she was considered too old-fashioned, Bernadette decided to take her revenge by becoming a major media figure.','/pS2X3RvvBRllM4lxtWW1m3MjbW9.jpg','2023-10-04',94,'Released','One Chirac can hide another','The President\'s Wife',961084,1.9266,6.3,'ZZet5WQlNd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31688,_binary '\0','/o4mhrLxv6I70kvYA42qANGUF7ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985949',6.3,121009,'en','The Angry Birds Movie','An island populated entirely by happy, flightless birds or almost entirely. In this paradise, Red, a bird with a temper problem, speedy Chuck, and the volatile Bomb have always been outsiders. But when the island is visited by mysterious green piggies, it’s up to these unlikely outcasts to figure out what the pigs are up to.','/iOH0fEFtV9z9rZp9zmBFGGeWicv.jpg','2016-05-11',97,'Released','They came in peace, they left in chaos.','The Angry Birds Movie',153518,16.5018,6.294,'0qJzWrq7les','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31689,_binary '\0','/vWriOBVlgW0XWdgbOiijhyLW7B8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985966',6.3,127593,'en','Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2','After the disastrous food storm in the first film, Flint and his friends are forced to leave the town. Flint accepts the invitation from his idol Chester V to join The Live Corp Company, which has been tasked to clean the island, and where the best inventors in the world create technologies for the betterment of mankind. When Flint discovers that his machine still operates and now creates mutant food beasts like living pickles, hungry tacodiles, shrimpanzees and apple pie-thons, he and his friends must return to save the world.','/ss5NcK2NWFg2YcKKYXLrk8q1myS.jpg','2013-09-26',95,'Released','Something big was leftover.','Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs 2',109451,16.8777,6.458,'3QCJTbHU60U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31690,_binary '\0','/cBgY9ippmGnfuPweHwi1MMfyCWb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1985981',5.7,16575,'hi','देसी बॉयज़','When two cash-strapped UK-based Indians become male escorts amid an economic downturn, money flows right in but everything else in their lives starts falling apart.','/8ARLxG5RbsHMxDYhUFEXq2jSSI1.jpg','2011-11-25',122,'Released',NULL,'Desi Boyz',79990,1.8332,6.2,'uWlorjdK8cI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31691,_binary '\0','/vgT0kAaWU88do5RrCfHhXRVPnXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19861162',6.3,18158,'en','The Return','After twenty years away, Odysseus washes up on the shores of Ithaca, haggard and unrecognizable. The king has finally returned home, but much has changed in his kingdom since he left to fight in the Trojan war.','/xSj6EbdwHs3MFT2tRj9L3I7TE5j.jpg','2024-11-28',116,'Released','Some legends are more than myths.','The Return',975511,9.5657,6.58,'aOQQ45ddYdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31692,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1986180',5,1250,'en','The Test','A guy puts his unwitting bride-to-be through a series of increasingly bizarre \"stress tests\" to see if she\'s worthy of marriage.','/lzKr2NhkkJ6pRXp2ta973pshKS3.jpg','2012-09-27',88,'Released','What if you could know before it was too late?','The Test',252629,1.996,3.9,'ruVfEZN8oK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31693,_binary '\0','/iuGwiCRSyyOuk2OO7LDbhpkKS3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1986202',4,8749,'en','Whispers','A young couple grieving the recent death of their daughter move to the countryside where they are haunted by their tragedy and a sinister darkness.','/2bKJAcZFrGUZWbWeqzke19OG3Nc.jpg','2015-10-30',90,'Released','Death isn\'t always the end.','Whispers',450070,0.7395,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31694,_binary '\0','/peE1ax04MnTQ9ChDryoDNF95r5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19862722',6.3,14125,'en','Find Me Falling','After a failed comeback album, a rock star retreats to a cliffside home on Cyprus, only to find his new life complicated by visitors — and an old flame.','/8BnahuMWBt9b3migk0as6Ojgr7F.jpg','2024-07-18',94,'Released','Fall in love with life again.','Find Me Falling',1255350,3.951,6.6,'56DuFZX9cuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31695,_binary '\0','/iKqItVltY6r0eJeIRdIZV8IrBpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864802',6.6,60732,'en','Land of Bad','When a Delta Force special ops mission goes terribly wrong, Air Force drone pilot Reaper has 48 hours to remedy what has devolved into a wild rescue operation. With no weapons and no communication other than the drone above, the ground mission suddenly becomes a full-scale battle when the team is discovered by the enemy.','/h3jYanWMEJq6JJsCopy1h7cT2Hs.jpg','2024-02-09',113,'Released','No man left behind.','Land of Bad',969492,14.7901,7.283,'dKcHOR-V1G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31696,_binary '\0','/zH2zbxYfYplU0m1k6wUXRCIsgMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864828',6.7,10788,'en','Memory','Sylvia is a social worker who leads a simple and structured life: her daughter, her job, her AA meetings. This is blown open when Saul follows her home from their high school reunion. Their surprise encounter will profoundly impact both of them as they open the door to the past.','/cZgTA5ZOKOIRGyYClJMu02VUNcE.jpg','2023-12-22',104,'Released',NULL,'Memory',979097,3.7192,7,'0JwDmI5onf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31697,_binary '\0','/2yvzBVtMGCtw1Em9a7W1fxuTzIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864832',7,5352,'es','La cocina','In the sweltering back kitchen of a Times Square restaurant, undocumented cook Pedro is caught between mounting pressures at work and a complicated romance with waitress Julia. When money goes missing, suspicion spreads, igniting tensions that threaten to upend the fragile hopes of the staff.','/5Hnlt0KY7OtYRLIDPaR4oDS3Ajo.jpg','2024-10-25',139,'Released','Get back to work.','La Cocina',966238,4.3899,6.9,'MXhtJ5sBYXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31698,_binary '\0','/bCXuMi55ejgp0KW693piosj6btZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864926',6.7,1461,'te','అమ్ము','Ammu\'s thought marriage was a fairy tale – full of love and magic, ends when her cop-husband Ravi hit her for the very first time. What Ammu thought was a one-off incident soon turned into a never-ending cycle of abuse, trapping her and breaking her soul and spirit. Pushed to her limits, Ammu teams up with an unlikely ally to break free.','/ckaM4pI0CzYHzGUG1bar9Q7LHbl.jpg','2022-10-19',136,'Released',NULL,'Ammu',968732,1.3319,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31699,_binary '\0','/iUtBxiYWJ0oebFUZzusl6Dm6aCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864942',4.7,1458,'hi','ऐ वतन मेरे वतन','In the midst of India\'s struggle for freedom in 1942, a brave young girl starts an underground radio station to spread the message of unity, setting off a thrilling chase with the British authorities during the Quit India movement.','/gOFBpQBRcPFZWEkzRWnQgQHku4T.jpg','2024-03-21',133,'Released','Her voice united a nation','Ae Watan Mere Watan',969173,1.0889,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31700,_binary '\0','/qHfBUCEAyreAL3btFKuPMuMWlSD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19864958',6.2,3042,'hi','मजा मा','A rumour about an unassuming housewife threatens to disrupt her middle-class family\'s life on the eve of her son\'s engagement.','/vfzBw0g0zKjyCpcTCEQEfq3gy0d.jpg','2022-10-06',135,'Released','All families have secrets.','Maja Ma',969797,1.4113,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31701,_binary '\0','/jMq2UM1GZdHpeCfGMc62Odic2Ws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1986843',6.3,10517,'fr','Un plan parfait','Successful woman in love tries to break her family curse of every first marriage ending in divorce, by dashing to the altar with a random stranger before marrying her boyfriend.','/iPFBW4KaLyCdXwEsa2TXRBW0Jxe.jpg','2012-10-29',104,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Plan',133698,6.3577,5.885,'3-ykIh-9mJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31702,_binary '\0','/6sej53nqSSZ23e7idAQW969uX7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1986857',3.8,3840,'en','Hijacked','A special agent\'s plans to reconcile with his ex-fiancé are ruined when she boards a private jet that is targeted by hijackers working for the same crime lord that he is chasing.','/s8YWXoXXmDkNkAEQSqGeF37VYlH.jpg','2012-07-31',91,'Released','Flying has never been so dangerous....','Hijacked',119117,1.7684,4,'NOxNtodX_-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31703,_binary '\0','/8QMWSEeotCy7dhB8EAZgCuNaQtb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19869024',4.7,1340,'es','Sayen','Sayen is hunting down the men who murdered her grandmother. Using her training and knowledge of nature, she is able to turn the tables on them, learning of a conspiracy from a corporation that threatens her people\'s ancestral lands.','/aCy61aU7BMG7SfhkaAaasS0KzUO.jpg','2023-03-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Sayen',850871,2.4444,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31704,_binary '\0','/ydraTo0yB2XLGaKJSxXquX3TE7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19869122',7,2114,'ja','わたしの幸せな結婚','An unhappy young woman from an abusive family is married off to a fearsome and chilly army commander. But the two learn more about each other, love may have a chance.','/zitTrEPtVRmGfObGvgiDqMQ4fjE.jpg','2023-03-17',115,'Released',NULL,'My Happy Marriage',1037348,3.1876,7.324,'NyoYskNaYRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31705,_binary '\0','/9lOKi7XDeANXxPLm7uaikJKy7Wv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1986953',4.5,7736,'en','Storage 24','Something nasty is lurking inside a secure storage unit. When a group of people get trapped inside, they need to find a way to get out of a building that\'s designed to keep things in...','/8o059PGrYLl28RM3TzHoY955SSH.jpg','2012-06-29',87,'Released','Will their first contact be their last?','Storage 24',114958,2.8913,4.3,'-ntq2jCCGMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31706,_binary '\0','/2NR3jzedZIcnfMvj9ii2CSbPMMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19869662',6.9,3763,'en','Irena\'s Vow','19 year old Irena Gut is promoted to housekeeper in the home of a highly respected Nazi officer in Poland when she finds out that the Jewish ghetto is about to be liquidated. Determined to help twelve Jewish workers, she decides to shelter them in the safest place she can think of – the basement of the German Major\'s house. Over the next eight months, Irena uses her wit, humour and immense courage to hide her friends as long as possible.','/lN6iCgTgpNlylelUctrA29wJx4W.jpg','2024-04-15',121,'Released','Change the world with your courage.','Irena\'s Vow',1026880,3.9244,7.7,'AjDOIiBpp2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31707,_binary '\0','/cOADBqxPLpYdmZZyFPuhjthdSoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1987018',6.5,4836,'fr','Un heureux événement','She drove me into a corner, then forced me to go beyond my limits. She made me confront the absolute: love, sacrifice, tenderness, abandonment. She dislocated me, transformed me. Why didn\'t anyone warn me? Why doesn\'t anyone ever talk about this?\" Un heureux événement, or an intimate view of motherhood, sincere and with no taboos.','/qVUl6ktomxxkPu02LhFtiBsoFv7.jpg','2011-09-27',107,'Released',NULL,'A Happy Event',77462,3.049,6,'Imq1qwQDxes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31708,_binary '\0','/iz6UMraYyIhoyWEDPv5Tcx7vcL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19874970',6.9,1809,'kn','ಬ್ಲಿಂಕ್','Apoorva, a 24-year-old in Bengaluru, conceals his failed MA from his mother. Juggling part-time jobs, he relies on his love interest, Swapna, for support. Apoorva\'s unique ability to control blinking becomes a curse when a mysterious old man reveals his father\'s survival.','/sv3gqXkQL5tMWRQiR9UVPblpEEI.jpg','2024-03-08',136,'Released',NULL,'Blink',1136463,1.4364,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31709,_binary '\0','/ct2I74zKDrK1Ts2jJa9WixJrigg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1987680',7.1,70960,'en','The Upside','Phillip is a wealthy quadriplegic who needs a caretaker to help him with his day-to-day routine in his New York penthouse. He decides to hire Dell, a struggling parolee who\'s trying to reconnect with his ex and his young son. Despite coming from two different worlds, an unlikely friendship starts to blossom.','/hPZ2caow1PCND6qnerfgn6RTXdm.jpg','2019-01-10',126,'Released','Based on a true story.','The Upside',440472,10.6604,7.1,'EWw7rCHcduQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31710,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1987681',6.2,1305,'en','Waking','Ben is about to turn 30 and on his way to what everyone else tells him is a great life. He’s been with his girlfriend Amy for 6 years and is about to propose, and looks to be in line to take over her father’s practice. But a chance meeting with a mysterious and beautiful woman named Nadia changes everything, as Ben and Nadia begin to connect when they fall asleep, going on journeys through their memories together. As they begin to realize they’ve been meeting in their dreams since they were children, Ben must choose between the perfect life on paper, or the girl of his dreams.','/4wCJ2J1R70c8rq8pDeYEbAkraTt.jpg','2013-04-19',95,'Released','What would you risk for the person of your dreams?','Waking',181756,0.0625,5.1,'mdoY31OA_Pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31711,_binary '\0','/o9QBMAKfRv0Erl38T6vaYlobiPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19879660',7.9,2314,'mr','धर्मवीर','A biopic on life of a Hindu nationalist leader Anand Dighe, through various incidents narrated by his close aides.','/x5kqbaZflZRJ7Jg8XZxzUAKyq9t.jpg','2022-05-13',178,'Released',NULL,'Dharmaveer',976783,0.9241,7.7,'jSOWLmB2Zqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31712,_binary '\0','/yjA8aw25U7XBmXlT3FhsPS1882F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19883220',5.9,1286,'da','Birthday Girl','On a cruise ship bound for the Caribbean, 42 year old Nanna has invited her daughter Cille and her best friend on a cruise to celebrate Cille\'s 18th birthday. The expectations are high, and they have big plans set for the three days aboard the cruise. But on the first evening, the dream vacation descends a nightmare, and Nanna realizes that in order to get justice, she must take matters into her own hands.','/tkUtWGKI7O4efZ2yEqDjIj7tGpq.jpg','2024-04-04',90,'Released','A night of celebration becomes a nightmare.','Birthday Girl',983524,2.2395,5.7,'jxszivKaTA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31713,_binary '\0','/H8YE8DDrnvr869RgCqLvhfcUFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19883634',7.1,15104,'en','The Old Oak','A pub landlord in a previously thriving mining community struggles to hold onto his pub. Meanwhile, tensions rise in the town when Syrian refugees are placed in the empty houses in the community.','/xN293BKB0MDqpILmLCtGGYxQXKW.jpg','2023-09-29',113,'Released','It\'s not where you\'re from, it\'s what you bring.','The Old Oak',970348,4.7892,7.2,'Fwb0c5zqsyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31714,_binary '\0','/tYuPkSBWpiLopOvH3KPXt1SvoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1988573',5.2,2165,'pt','Cilada.com','Exposed by his girlfriend through a video on the Internet, Bruno tries to revive his reputation, but all he can do is get into a series of traps (Cilada, in Portuguese). Cilada.com is a comedy about love and betrayal that shows the power of the Internet to transform small intimacies and slips in fame and constraints globalized.','/jCTh6jL9fd39Zu65Af5lnlHg0uw.jpg','2011-07-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Trap.com',69938,0.8702,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31715,_binary '\0','/m9xwvflfh4hpjmlSapeDx2h9RCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1988621',5.2,12449,'en','Exists','A group of friends venture into the remote Texas woods for a party weekend and find themselves stalked by Bigfoot.','/m3BteJOJcbEI3pDgrZ1Fguy0ndV.jpg','2014-03-17',81,'Released','The legend is real. So is the terror.','Exists',124470,2.3512,5.542,'rxc9PGsNPjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31716,_binary '\0','/2IwJkMqaTDBpKOVgeKnEp2KnAug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19886242',6.9,7850,'ml','റോഷാക്ക്','When Luke Antony\'s wife goes missing, he sets off to search for her and stumbles upon the Balan family. However, terrorising events start occurring as Luke grows closer to them.','/hKVeDdgpjR8CAEd73ioDe7wni4o.jpg','2022-10-07',150,'Released',NULL,'Rorschach',950284,1.7117,6.659,'1FmqSUwAirA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31717,_binary '\0','/1jOqG59qbiFC7bof8qB7aHcxe4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1988733',7.3,1498,'ta','நாளைய தீர்ப்பு','Mahalakshmi endures abuse from her husband, Arun Mehta, who is unfaithful to her with multiple women. Despite this, Mahalakshmi independently raises her son Vijay. As Vijay grows up, he seeks revenge for his father\'s wrongdoings.','/4k2p95mNHUrEV3uEll4WUp6Ql4c.jpg','1992-12-11',140,'Released','A violent movie without violence!','Naalaiya Theerpu',63648,0.9011,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31718,_binary '\0','/96S2aGGh6I7og1oNrAiRHxGz0PH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19887550',6.4,13265,'en','Good Grief','When his husband unexpectedly dies, Marc\'s world shatters, sending him and his two best friends on a soul-searching trip to Paris that reveals some hard truths they each needed to face.','/wJFHUglmh7xlY7g9Ql85QAJBZ6n.jpg','2023-12-29',101,'Released','Love lost is love found.','Good Grief',1036619,5.2524,6.168,'bR_MPXTaEZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31719,_binary '\0','/fy5rYYLOLczsX8VBhcfrJ6Qnum8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1988774',7.4,2283,'ml','സോൾട്ട് ആന്‍റെ പെപ്പർ','Kalidasan, a foodie, receives a phone call not intended for him. He finds that the person at the other end, Maya, is also fond of food and cooking. Soon they develop feelings for each other.','/4feN0SirBtgkXDv9OX4QGfaGwLe.jpg','2011-09-08',132,'Released','The story born out of a Dosa','Salt N\' Pepper',135212,1.1141,7.2,'hMZtNKedYEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31720,_binary '\0','/tRfQHwsFMQZV8pTmxUQywYn6UYf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1988781',3.1,4361,'en','7 Below','A group of strangers is trapped in a time warp house where a terrible event transpired exactly 100 years prior.','/qP7tRnSpuQngVD7MPnHH3yqewiO.jpg','2012-04-16',90,'Released','Evil has found a new home.','7 Below',84577,1.8819,3.6,'mpBkwCPmTx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31721,_binary '\0','/cteNJT0XmlXNWc30sIijOLMvgty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19890316',4.9,6083,'en','What Happens Later','Two ex-lovers get snowed in at a regional airport overnight. Indefinitely delayed, Willa, a magical thinker, and Bill, a catastrophic one, find themselves just as attracted to and annoyed by one another as they did decades earlier. But as they unpack the riddle of their mutual past and compare their lives to the dreams they once shared, they begin to wonder if their reunion is mere coincidence, or something more enchanted.','/oSAdS03j8zbjv35gKdjrIL5snw1.jpg','2023-11-02',104,'Released','They missed their connection.','What Happens Later',970948,7.3949,4.8,'zceSigCGWSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31722,_binary '\0','/jirdIf1Sq918dKitXM1TxAOOvAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19893706',5.8,2642,'te','కృష్ణ వ్రింద విహారి','Krishna falls for Vrinda and tells a white lie at home to ensure they’re married. But what happens when it leads to unnecessary misunderstandings?','/9R9YMJLhOtAEtK7SwNrI27GUUu7.jpg','2022-09-23',139,'Released',NULL,'Krishna Vrinda Vihari',930136,1.0545,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31723,_binary '\0','/6h9JbK80tj60VUEAKhNR1UT9Mpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1989475',6.4,23491,'en','Chained','A serial killer kidnaps a young boy after murdering his mother, then raises him to be his accomplice. After years in captivity, the boy must choose between escaping or following in his captor\'s bloody footprints.','/4A7t5QmUN0joSZMOSUtbFOrbsTU.jpg','2012-10-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Chained',116979,2.4236,6.9,'L2b05pECEpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31724,_binary '\0','/rjLH5lztozxEtLuWhXCMSFpnPt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19894774',7.2,2612,'en','La Tresse','India. Smita is an untouchable. She dreams of seeing her daughter escape her miserable condition and enter school. Italy. Giulia works in her father’s workshop. When he has an accident, she discovers that the family business is ruined. Canada. Sarah, a successful lawyer, is about to be promoted to the head of her firm when she learns that she is ill. Three lives, three women, three continents. Three battles to fight. Although they don’t know each other, Smita, Giulia and Sarah are unknowingly linked by their most intimate and singular bond.','/tJnYgLeefl3ebgB5mHwSstSRreF.jpg','2023-11-29',121,'Released',NULL,'The Braid',989596,3.1905,7.4,'8AsbS9KGk4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31725,_binary '\0','/v96cXndPy7D7M4aKuTTp43NUtAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1989485',4.6,4573,'en','Dead Before Dawn','A bunch of college kids accidentally unleash an evil curse that causes people to kill themselves and turn into Zombie Demons, aka ZEMONS!','/5eg33AUKUsnGuX5LCe1OMTSJdIC.jpg','2012-10-10',88,'Released','Half Zombie. Half Demon. All Zemon!','Dead Before Dawn',135579,2.4843,5.2,'rqN4AggoCAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31726,_binary '\0','/4Q3CG0clzmwZWnfdRZFuxs0oj9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19895822',7.9,1684,'en','Made in England: The Films of Powell and Pressburger','Martin Scorsese presents this very personal and insightful new feature-length documentary about British filmmakers Michael Powell and Emeric Pressburger.','/36oj0KFSY4j0GdQ1EicVPcN0ppb.jpg','2024-05-10',133,'Released',NULL,'Made in England: The Films of Powell and Pressburger',1139072,2.4003,7.7,'BcXCsE3KB7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31727,_binary '\0','/ziTYJXcrxgYOYcpsgbcS7xXWmQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1989593',5.3,2086,'en','Red Hook Summer','When his mom deposits him at the Red Hook housing project in Brooklyn to spend the summer with the grandfather he’s never met, young Flik may as well have landed on Mars. Fresh from his cushy life in Atlanta, he’s bored and friendless, and his strict grandfather, Enoch, a firebrand preacher, is bent on getting him to accept Jesus Christ as his personal savior. Only Chazz, the feisty girl from church, provides a diversion from the drudgery. As hot summer simmers and Sunday mornings brim with Enoch’s operatic sermons, things turn anything but dull as people’s conflicting agendas collide.','/qxAc0F0zzGj0YROOOr6OQIEOvq1.jpg','2012-08-17',125,'Released','This August Spike Takes You Back To Brooklyn','Red Hook Summer',84328,2.0732,5.4,'qWUaexrY2dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31728,_binary '\0','/kDzDaJS9f8UcFfsKx6rjDkUk9EC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19896150',5.3,2644,'en','The Angry Black Girl and Her Monster','Vicaria is a brilliant teenager who believes death is a disease that can be cured. After the brutal and sudden murder of her brother, she embarks on a dangerous journey to bring him back to life.','/4c3rU9R5oYexKFWaAHAc195B0RN.jpg','2023-06-09',92,'Released','Death can be cured.','The Angry Black Girl and Her Monster',1083858,2.3303,6.2,'yh7HWG7qn4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31729,_binary '\0','/qkyBAsIplXMJRwX4VWdd0wnYG2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1989674',4.6,1384,'en','The Man Inside','A thriller centered on a young boxer trying to distance himself from his father\'s gangster past and the relationship with his trainer.','/ccpSsaPRWMAvW4qpzFjDSsyekcI.jpg','2012-07-27',99,'Released',NULL,'The Man Inside',123329,1.0825,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31730,_binary '\0','/1LypzdyfUOxSfuJk5S5hiXORDn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1989712',6.4,3743,'ko','다른 나라에서','A young woman and her mother run away to the seaside town of Mohang to escape their mounting debt. The young woman begins writing a script for a short film in order to calm her nerves: There are three women named Anne, and each woman consecutively visits the seaside town of Mohang. A young woman tends to the small hotel by the Mohang foreshore owned by her parents. A certain lifeguard can be seen restlessly wandering up and down the beach that lies nearby. Each Anne stays at this small hotel, receives some assistance from the owner\'s daughter, and ventures onto the beach where they meet the lifeguard.','/k3yhKHTkMzmgHyN5uArZNqxNoq.jpg','2012-05-31',89,'Released',NULL,'In Another Country',103753,2.2649,6.1,'-l13iiXd2Bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31731,_binary '\0','/p3ng10hZIysyDgCyrqlFgMJCUpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19898828',5.8,2327,'en','A Merry Christmas Wish','Janie, a rising marketing executive living in The Big Apple, returns to her hometown of Woodland Falls when her Great-Uncle Randall passes away. Randall has even arranged for his farmhand, Dylan to help at the event, which is being held in the farm’s sprawling barn. Aware that her Manhattan boyfriend is anxious for her to return to the city so the pair can jet off to a previously planned holiday on the beach, Janie begins to feel an unexpected emotional tug about living life in a more authentic, meaningful way.','/9qBQDIED8O8ehWODVt3s304KQlt.jpg','2022-11-12',85,'Released',NULL,'A Merry Christmas Wish',971503,2.3687,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31732,_binary '\0','/6FoFRkXraYPvSNqlzobE4bgL8rJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1990181',6.1,12327,'en','Brake','A Secret Service Agent is held captive in the trunk of a car and endures high-speed mental and physical torture as terrorists attempt to extract needed information for their sinister plot.','/qKDoK8hUt8fGGXKpvAnt3AQVUvy.jpg','2012-03-22',92,'Released','The only way out is to give in.','Brake',85414,2.7204,5.791,'QPofHkR5K9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31733,_binary '\0','/t9HWln3vfHhPPT3GMUsvrFBZAyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1990216',5.4,7249,'en','El Gringo','A man crossing into Mexico with a satchel of $2,000,000—and a bloody past—finds himself under sudden attack in the sleepy town of El Fronteras.','/yM2bXInHW0CQdRDgM5GiJjAV1QQ.jpg','2012-05-10',99,'Released','He\'s Not in Acapulco Any More','El Gringo',102629,3.0355,6.338,'ikz-zq1QqOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31734,_binary '\0','/qKy85RbA1Ka7WZOwJQUenza68VL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1990217',6.6,2031,'es','El artista y la modelo','In occupied France in summer 1943, a world-weary famous sculptor finds the desire to work again with the arrival of a beautiful young Spanish refugee.','/wBqimTaw2X8ISMT8hYLT0gQ88r5.jpg','2012-09-28',104,'Released',NULL,'The Artist and the Model',115821,2.2523,6.1,'XlpdDGgT09k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31735,_binary '\0','/mV2UZZHYiWPKH0AwtMSil1T7DUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1990314',7,67519,'en','Robot & Frank','Curmudgeonly old Frank lives by himself. His routine involves daily visits to his local library, where he has a twinkle in his eye for the librarian. His grown children are concerned about their father’s well-being and buy him a caretaker robot. Initially resistant to the idea, Frank soon appreciates the benefits of robotic support – like nutritious meals and a clean house – and eventually begins to treat his robot like a true companion. With his robot’s assistance, Frank’s passion for his old, unlawful profession is reignited, for better or worse.','/602vUwe1GPmaRvcrT3OQWqH1Nm1.jpg','2012-08-24',89,'Released','Friendship doesn\'t have an off switch','Robot & Frank',84329,4.3609,6.9,'a_gAJk_CfPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31736,_binary '\0','/56gCD5eLWsMVUHXi7iyZiFBjTw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1990352',7.2,1271,'en','The Island President','Follows the globe-trotting journey of President Mohamed Nasheed of the Maldives, the lowest-lying country in the world, who, after bringing democracy to his country, takes up the fight to keep it from disappearing under the sea.','/3yN0Y28EEYUkIyPbEItYu9ss5EQ.jpg','2012-03-28',101,'Released','Can this man save the world?','The Island President',86850,0.8612,6.1,'sNBPVJgmGlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31737,_binary '\0','/3Xcdlmo5GjSSzVVHuyJdtpPSENC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1991031',5.8,6652,'en','Digging Up the Marrow','A documentary filmmaker turns his lens on an enigmatic conspiracy theorist who claims he\'s found the entrance to a vast underground city populated entirely by monsters.','/xCE04zhX6TSQF1VvViyVTBVqvkr.jpg','2015-02-20',88,'Released','Believing is seeing.','Digging Up the Marrow',279972,2.4014,5.4,'MCSYNT7Xrfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31738,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1991191',6.4,4387,'en','Surviving Family','Terry hasn\'t seen or spoken with her family in 2 years. When she shows up unannounced on her father\'s doorstep - with her fiancé and a plan to get married in 5 days - she learns that she\'s not the only one with secrets.','/gWNtD2Vz9giSAFrLObbIJTISQXF.jpg','2014-08-15',87,'Released','You can\'t escape the family tree.','Surviving Family',362609,1.4049,4.4,'o9VaMQiZ7Q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31739,_binary '\0','/1BgWRWjZtD6zyJfzlfDx3NHaECQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1991245',5.1,71078,'en','Chernobyl Diaries','A group of six tourists looking to go off the beaten path, hire an \'extreme tour guide\' who, ignoring warnings, takes them into the city of Pripyat, the former home to the workers of the Chernobyl nuclear reactor, but now a deserted town since the disaster more than 25 years earlier. After a brief exploration of the abandoned city, the group members find themselves stranded, only to discover that they are not alone.','/9AKhThGA8IATBy3gR7I4dw9SEc4.jpg','2012-05-24',88,'Released','Ten years ago, the Ukrainian government let tourists visit the area around Chernobyl. They said it was safe...it wasn\'t.','Chernobyl Diaries',93856,5.7085,5.323,'Uy1ay369Jiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31740,_binary '\0','/xI2PFG5zwlb4KWga7l9FcHGB4gr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1992138',6.5,9368,'hi','Force','A vengeful drug-dealer/gangster targets and terrorizes an entire police unit and their families.','/ozSxdP967hxbyMcnLVNSzRzwaPv.jpg','2011-09-30',137,'Released',NULL,'Force',75745,1.3836,6.594,'wYyH6ujINzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31741,_binary '\0','/tREGMC67rsPK9zFwJAd8nUnA3bE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1992156',5.9,1220,'it','Il futuro','When their parents die, Bianca starts to smoke and Tomas is still a virgin. The orphans explore the dangerous streets of adulthood until Bianca finds Maciste, a retired Mr. Universe, and enters his dark mansion in search of a future.','/zRHHZVNfOwYzFQMTt185I7fEyp8.jpg','2013-09-06',94,'Released',NULL,'The Future',153774,1.5316,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31742,_binary '\0','/6dTCJnmXxQW4sjTmMiXGmz6nRi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1992193',7.3,1978,'en','Pandora\'s Promise','The atomic bomb, the specter of a global nuclear holocaust, and disasters like Fukushima have made nuclear energy synonymous with the darkest nightmares of the modern world. But what if everyone has nuclear power wrong? What if people knew that there are reactors that are self-sustaining and fully controllable and ones that require no waste disposal? What if nuclear power is the only energy source that has the ability to stop climate change?','/1n6lvmXwmqrz3Jek6sJIO6eR2s4.jpg','2013-06-12',89,'Released','At the bottom of the box she found hope.','Pandora\'s Promise',159152,1.0001,6.9,'bDw3ET3zqxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31743,_binary '\0','/qSj5BPXLXEV06euTz4q6r04rDT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1992258',5.9,6012,'en','Tower Block','A year after witnessing a murder, residents of Tower Block 31 find themselves being picked off by a sniper, pitting those lucky enough to be alive into a battle for survival.','/ikUmaaOMbyeszWnyaIXye3f1GFe.jpg','2012-09-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Tower Block',128876,2.693,5.864,'K5Ysxp3MXek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31744,_binary '\0','/4EeHeVQLkotvpwwBmkMrFCZ8NnK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1993391',3.6,3139,'en','10 Rules for Sleeping Around','By following ten simple rules, 20-somethings Vince and Cameron spice up their relationship by sleeping around. But when their straitlaced friends get engaged, their relationship gets turned upside down. To put the rules to the test, they will go on the road to the Hamptons to crash the biggest party of the year where love triangles collide and off-the-wall mayhem ensues.','/dX8IMDXbVWJ7fq0AX0efog1SMX5.jpg','2013-08-23',94,'Released','Now it\'s our turn.','10 Rules for Sleeping Around',216138,2.4087,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31745,_binary '\0','/iOAYZpVEOy4lsLxE4cTqB3GTBWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1993396',2.7,1259,'en','Toxin','A pharmaceutical company recruits a well-known scientist to help develop a vaccine against a deadly virus.','/uTcskaIJip2y7zpvJbZDZLxF70S.jpg','2015-01-29',81,'Released','Fear is their greatest enemy','Toxin',322061,2.1703,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31746,_binary '\0','/d830bWWtKjL5j1ZHaFiBKvv3Gwt.jpg','202