r\'s apartment in New York City, the girls bicker with each other until one fateful night, when Katie\'s noisy bedroom activities make Lauren barge in and discover a dirty little secret. This revelation brings them closer together, and Lauren (the brains) and Katie (the talent) concoct a wildly successful business venture. As profits swell, the girls reevaluate their hopes and dreams and realize that just because someone pees in your hair in college doesn\'t mean she won\'t be your best friend 10 years later.','/9eIlVo8lvk9fmfP05JGFKlPha80.jpg','2012-08-31',87,'Released','Lose your hang-ups. Find your calling.','For a Good Time, Call...',84200,4.7508,5.8,'cMZhDdNfrE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31754,_binary '\0','/vjvrgGvCvS6crRg5bFcyoubQnZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1996310',7.1,16593,'de','Lore','After being abandoned by their Nazi parents at the end of World War II, five German siblings embark on a harrowing journey across their war-torn country. Led by the eldest, 14 year-old Lore, the children are forced to confront their parents’ actions and the reality of a new world.','/1yWoAyREEPDfyVnOgHUVfLVitmZ.jpg','2012-09-20',109,'Released','When your life is a lie who can you trust?','Lore',121835,2.634,6.7,'iSabgBt2k3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31755,_binary '\0','/nUd1WMUxLHbmRbytTrO6GnsedDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1997291',6.3,2841,'fa','بی پولی','A haughty acclaimed newly married fashion designer named Iraj is shown the door by his boss after the boss\'s son arrives at Iran to take over his father\'s company. Iraj reluctant to promulgate the loss of his job, starts using his savings, trying to conceal the truth from his naive wife. Having squandered all the money he had on trivial matters, he tells his wife about being axed &amp; that\'s when the tables turn on him.','/5jXIiEcZ1dxyLFdOH3WLpju5PqH.jpg','2009-01-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Poverty',270971,0.8209,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31756,_binary '\0','/wp9qoRXwz84DLuWw1QCiEJg4t5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1997455',7.7,1645,'ta','நாடோடிகள்','A group of friends fight tooth and nail to unite two lovers but are dejected by a later turn of events.','/leiEeREi2dLjykqfDsT5ZFWUveF.jpg','2009-06-26',145,'Released',NULL,'Naadodigal',25122,1.1509,7.538,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31757,_binary '\0','/1Y3pnuqQXEyYtLq9FP8tROOQBDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1998204',7.9,1639,'de','Die andere Heimat - Chronik einer Sehnsucht','Follow-up to the TV trilogy “Heimat”, this time for cinemas, set again in the fictional village Schabbach in the Hunsrück region of Rhineland-Palatinate.','/aIgtT1WQaLnFmhEZGtfotYv9YY0.jpg','2013-10-03',225,'Released',NULL,'Home from Home – Chronicle of a Vision',215740,1.9027,7.8,'762vlkikJ48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31758,_binary '\0','/dkPi08aPgRrOTB8OLrdSpt6zfa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt19984386',5.5,2992,'en','American Star','An assassin on a final assignment in Fuerteventura, to kill a man he has never met. When his target is delayed, he finds himself drawn to the island, people and a ghostly shipwreck. Instead of following protocol he stays. But when the target returns, the world has shifted. Before everything was simple, now nothing is.','/aFjxI9yMd142au1O74JlUttG4Ki.jpg','2024-01-26',107,'Released',NULL,'American Star',1170824,2.843,5.7,'hb47dUzNUm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31759,_binary '\0','/4Q1VPlFYD1zeGiJ5KbUiUcvvJYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1999130',7.3,1257,'ne','Death Zone: Cleaning Mount Everest','A team of 20 elite Nepali climbers venture into the Death Zone of Mount Everest to restore their sacred mountain and the contaminated water source of 1.3 billion people. They ascend the highest point on the planet to the 150 bodies of deceased climbers and 100,000 pounds of rubbish that remain on the high slopes of Everest. This is the self-documented story of their life-threatening journey.','/3utmtr73t6Gyi0eytWKPBLng94y.jpg','2018-04-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Death Zone: Cleaning Mount Everest',549536,1.4502,7.6,'BI2TlvNJxCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31760,_binary '\0','/tatvngHzToApquhiX0IHqJJqnOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1999141',2.7,1292,'en','Dragon Crusaders','In this sword-and-sorcery extravaganza, a group of marauding Knights Templar suffers a curse that transforms them into monsters, driving them to square off against an evil dragon obsessed with annihilating the entire world.','/ajJMNh2gvGZtqivvaMRoq0cAjz2.jpg','2011-09-27',90,'Released','Holy Warriors Must Battle an Army of Demons','Dragon Crusaders',75507,1.441,2.7,'lO-hPbMtRzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31761,_binary '\0','/yFPzrBaRqmX7yWs5xFCZFVgQReI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1999167',7.1,6875,'ja','劇場版 NARUTO -ナルト- ブラッド・プリズン','After his capture for attempted assassination of the Raikage, leader of Kumogakure, as well as killing Jōnin from Kirigakure and Iwagakure, Naruto is imprisoned in Hōzukijou: A criminal containment facility known as the Blood Prison. Mui, the castle master, uses the ultimate imprisonment technique to steal power from the prisoners, which is when Naruto notices his life has been targeted. Thus begins the battle to uncover the truth behind the mysterious murders and prove Naruto\'s innocence.','/4WT7zYFpe0fsbg6TitppiHddWAh.jpg','2011-07-30',108,'Released',NULL,'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: Blood Prison',75624,6.6384,7.249,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31762,_binary '\0','/yB6rrOZgkaQfmQPRf0w89qfJXDV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt1999192',7.3,6773,'en','Kevin Hart: Laugh at My Pain','Experience the show that quickly became a national phenomenon. Get an up-close and personal look at Kevin back in Philly where he began his journey to become one of the funniest comedians of all time.','/jk7C5sIDHSGiJjBQz6bmPNP1WOF.jpg','2011-09-09'