hop. Lisa is left feeling excluded, and tension develop. But soon an unexpected accident forces all of those involved to reassess the situation and adopt a different position in each other’s lives.','/4M20reNbCJCnaNSLCKMSDBuc7uX.jpg','2011-11-23',100,'Released',NULL,'The Adopted',76532,2.4266,6.8,'3k_qftN0-fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31774,_binary '\0','/gkp83BnUbnXoZpIW5e6u9P6wFzd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2004304',7.9,2275,'en','Mission Blue','This documentary follows oceanographer Sylvia Earle\'s campaign to save the world\'s oceans from threats such as overfishing and toxic waste.','/34sR023uQt7gNMFWNIWRHaacrVc.jpg','2014-01-30',94,'Released','A world without the ocean, is a world without us.','Mission Blue',286407,1.4942,7.4,'B1wp2MQCsfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31775,_binary '\0','/l4tkQijvUpycBHS3zMUkkV0KNDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2004419',4.9,1508,'en','Sanatorium','On a bitterly cold December night, a paranormal investigations team has set their sights on the bloody Hillcrest Sanatorium to answer the age old question: Is there life after death? With rumours of hauntings and local children gone missing, they may just get their answer the hard way when members of the team mysteriously disappear, leaving behind unnerving evidence.','/u5wE05STbRVDqoBUmqFOPK1QcJx.jpg','2013-10-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Sanatorium',248576,1.2838,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31776,_binary '\0','/3Oi74iL54He71BpVEexKj7KnT63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2004420',6.3,348721,'en','Neighbors','A couple with a newborn baby face unexpected difficulties after they are forced to live next to a fraternity house.','/sN1RU08CMi8xkRIibremh3AOdgw.jpg','2014-05-08',97,'Released','Family vs. Frat','Neighbors',195589,10.0041,6.178,'KrAf5ALLxGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31777,_binary '\0','/yadP27a0OsNINtPZxqgluxiuJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2004432',6.2,25669,'en','Wolf Creek 2','Lured by the promise of an Australian holiday, backpackers Rutger, Katarina and Paul visit the notorious Wolf Creek Crater. Their dream Outback adventure soon becomes a horrific reality when they encounter the site\'s most infamous local, the last man any traveller to the region ever wants to meet—Mick Taylor. As the backpackers flee, Mick pursues them on an epic white knuckled rampage across hostile wasteland.','/uELzdTzPOpZwSFqBbwpjuKE7UW3.jpg','2013-08-30',106,'Released','The outback can be crazy this time of year.','Wolf Creek 2',199534,4.4428,6.4,'s4bqeT5edbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31778,_binary '\0','/5IIFJxwRzmkhczQidIhpoaolpZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20048582',5.4,14456,'en','Canary Black','Top level CIA agent Avery Graves is blackmailed by terrorists into betraying her own country to save her kidnapped husband. Cut off from her team, she turns to her underworld contacts to survive and help locate the coveted intelligence that the kidnappers want.','/hhiR6uUbTYYvKoACkdAIQPS5c6f.jpg','2024-10-10',103,'Released','This mission is personal.','Canary Black',976734,9.9779,6.2,'tSaw2HTVSsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31779,_binary '\0','/oNoprEND25zXR6Fns8cIZUkuoMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2005151',7.1,308315,'en','War Dogs','Based on the true story of two young men, David Packouz and Efraim Diveroli, who won a $300 million contract from the Pentagon to arm America\'s allies in Afghanistan.','/mDcPRjZC1bb6LavFU3gwsWdVfCM.jpg','2016-08-18',114,'Released','An American dream','War Dogs',308266,17.0522,6.951,'KWs5qnZnhfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31780,_binary '\0','/kzjNkzcuhL2uElito95yoOaNkLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2005164',5.2,1949,'en','Breathless','Lorna is a strong-willed Texas woman who’s had enough of her untrustworthy husband Dale’s criminal acts and lack of husbandry. Fed up, she enlists the help of her old friend, Tiny, to help her figure out what to do with Dale after his latest double-cross involving the theft of $100,000 from a bank.','/eOo4VUHU1qwrAS7xf8PqaMSHj0x.jpg','2012-01-04',91,'Released','Even a good woman has her breaking point.','Breathless',122930,2.8571,5.9,'0Et0S7sBPOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31781,_binary '\0','/xWoQPSqJxB8P6Non8kyMSvtna9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2005363',5.8,6081,'ja','鉄拳 ブラッド・ベンジェンス','Set in the rich Tekken universe, Tekken: Blood Vengeance 3D follows Xiaoyu Ling, seasoned martial artist and high school student, tasked by the G Corporation to infiltrate an international school in Kyoto to gather information on the mysterious student Shin Kamiya. Before she can make any progress in the investigation, Shin is kidnapped by an unknown assailant. Digging deeper into Shin’s background in an attempt to rescue him, Xiaoyu learns about the frightening underbelly of the Mishima Zaibatsu. Jin Kazama, Kazuya Mishima… and the late Heihachi Mishima’s conspiracy that’s stained with blood.','/nYfa9yK6LlbE9K4U7Ved815RgMM.jpg','2011-07-26',100,'Released','The power to change everything. A fate they were not prepared for.','TEKKEN: Blood Vengeance',79516,2.8431,6.791,'IPT_qqJ12s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31782,_binary '\0','/xLW4UQ4zYf7fHrei9pqx4fJsfKy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2005374',6.4,73273,'en','The Frozen Ground','An Alaska State Trooper partners with a young woman who escaped the clutches of serial killer Robert Hansen to bring the murderer to justice. Based on actual events.','/hHDj1h3lJvYd9Cervoswz9crhWg.jpg','2013-07-11',105,'Released','The hunter becomes the hunted','The Frozen Ground',199373,8.1292,6.258,'PKKfUcGrLDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31783,_binary '\0','/mUWjBk12lY0om9iEFK8wdhxj7It.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006040',5.8,15864,'en','A Fantastic Fear of Everything','Jack is a children\'s author turned crime novelist whose detailed research into the lives of Victorian serial killers has turned him into a paranoid wreck, persecuted by the irrational fear of being murdered. When Jack is thrown a life-line by his long-suffering agent and a mysterious Hollywood executive takes a sudden and inexplicable interest in his script, what should be his big break rapidly turns into his big breakdown, as Jack is forced to confront his worst demons; among them his love life, his laundry and the origin of all fear.','/sMZyKSo8b47VW1h2zjjGUZIefV1.jpg','2012-06-07',100,'Released',NULL,'A Fantastic Fear of Everything',101519,3.5072,5.7,'LQ1CGSMoqfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31784,_binary '\0','/kyZUeUeDjOQO9t8KaPxHpWJCTsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006295',6.9,42101,'en','The 33','Based on the true story of the collapse of a mine in San Jose, Chile—that left 33 miners isolated underground for 69 days.','/hpXkIuAlIlcNYACRE2MssxnHvZQ.jpg','2015-08-06',120,'Released','Hope Runs Deep','The 33',293646,5.097,6.401,'hOoIBOYqHyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31785,_binary '\0','/w7ot5UbHVM6ANPCpzpodinJVxiR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006721',4.6,1654,'en','Divorce Invitation','\'Divorce Invitation\' centers on Mike Christian, a happily married man who runs into his high school sweetheart Alex, and after all these years, sparks still fly. When Mike is determined Alex is his true soul mate, he realizes he has a huge problem-he signed an iron-clad pre-nuptial agreement and his wife will not let him out of the marriage','/1Au4jGHUKvckHAbuZd9bgchFetY.jpg','2012-11-14',113,'Released',NULL,'Divorce Invitation',115446,1.8611,4.529,'cAyO9_OUSS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31786,_binary '\0','/gKcFbx4QsanSNyblcsnycCEgKdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006753',5.3,2324,'en','Heavenly Sword','The film\'s plot follows that of the game closely. Nariko, a member of an ancient tribe who have guarded an ancient magical sword for thousands of years, is charged with bringing the sword to its destined wielder, a deity reincarnated who will bring peace to the land. But on her quest, Nariko must wield the sword herself against the forces of King Bohan, who wishes to possess the weapon himself.','/wZzMbYDomCgj6LUN1b33ha7BiGh.jpg','2014-06-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Heavenly Sword',256766,2.3668,6.3,'HQAiBlnJ1DQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31787,_binary '\0','/pVc4XvRIdXxPfMVilvadqeUkkYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006801',2.4,1658,'en','Night of the Living Dead: Resurrection','The dead rise with a hunger for living flesh, and cities are soon overrun. A family flees from the carnage and takes refuge in an isolated farmhouse in western Wales.','/phjGLWZBsOgyp5CtcQ8X0A01TAb.jpg','2012-11-28',86,'Released','When the Sun Goes Down, the Terror Begins','Night of the Living Dead: Resurrection',190829,1.726,2.9,'Day-T_Dl8fM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31788,_binary '\0','/cQZHeK03AbBmaVZqK1eKvyCBdhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2006810',5.9,4308,'en','Papadopoulos & Sons','Following his ruin in the latest banking crisis, a self-made millionaire reluctantly re-unites with his estranged freewheeling brother to re-open the abandoned fish and chip shop they shared in their youth.','/att5nJlL49IoGMK1kW5cxQTyXfa.jpg','2012-12-20',109,'Released','Success is the joy you feel! Only when you lose everything, do you find it all.','Papadopoulos & Sons',173294,1.5086,6,'83J2uhKjOxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31789,_binary '\0','/aYPE1Srh7zqai4mAyQC5lYJHZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2007360',6.2,5051,'en','Computer Chess','At the American Computer Chess Convention, enthusiasts gather to pit their programs against other computer chess programs and human players in a tournament for a grand prize of $7500.','/sjmzVdWkgB46ZXrNCflC9aorzog.jpg','2013-07-17',91,'Released','An artificially intelligent comedy','Computer Chess',158743,2.