g','After raising an unnervingly talented spider in secret, 12-year-old Charlotte must face the truth about her pet and fight for her family\'s survival.','/97XZtLd461e5e0WBIBJREK1lzqC.jpg','2024-04-12',92,'Released','Your biggest fear just got bigger.','Sting',1087388,5.5574,6.2,'2cPHQxTVXMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31807,_binary '\0','/cfPiu2zcK6b4t7QM7dO1ihyPFfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2011276',5.4,12307,'en','Banshee Chapter','On the trail of a missing friend who had been experimenting with mind-altering drugs, a young journalist - aided by a rogue counter-culture writer, finds herself drawn into the dangerous world of top-secret government chemical research and the mystery of a disturbing radio signal of unknown origin.','/nyXKB77RrItfUsAcgoIlXmUfged.jpg','2013-11-06',87,'Released','The experiments are over, the terror has just begun...','Banshee Chapter',207769,2.9591,5.6,'2Wl5TRMn8qU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31808,_binary '\0','/kxkj4AlLyEVskeD0UfyTk7WvC4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2011300',5,1678,'en','The Kitchen','Jennifer\'s thirtieth birthday party is supposed to be a special day. But what starts out as a day of celebration quickly spirals into a most ill-fated day Jennifer wishes she could forget, in this ensemble comedy set entirely in a kitchen.','/5ocUCEGPpq5lxc7S26bCv1V9Jii.jpg','2012-08-13',79,'Released','It\'s Jennifer\'s party and she\'ll cry if she wants to','The Kitchen',137683,1.8514,4.8,'49yUBfaCT_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31809,_binary '\0','/nUQ1a2kZDOtvktJkhW2ot3iw0cS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2011311',6.3,31979,'en','The Outsider','A former American G.I. joins a yakuza family after his release from prison in post-World War II Osaka.','/m2riQcEzjVrkP8wKHDXwC5EQpHQ.jpg','2018-03-09',120,'Released',NULL,'The Outsider',199928,3.3582,6.145,'QNNcl2mEHzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31810,_binary '\0','/jVPc