t the police closing in on him as well as the ticking clock of his own rapidly deteriorating mind.','/w39qKYjltCix18BwtoZ1e45usdb.jpg','2024-03-15',115,'Released',NULL,'Knox Goes Away',972614,7.5027,7,'bZ8SeYVnc9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31818,_binary '\0','/wM7Q43bXytzDAvgsu0zNwNtBx1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20119468',5.8,8104,'nl','Faithfully Yours','Using each other as alibis, two friends sneak off to indulge in secret affairs — but their elaborate web of lies unravels when one of them goes missing.','/i64ot8tIL9XMSwiSQrvi6DuOBpM.jpg','2022-12-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Faithfully Yours',1030613,3.0739,5.935,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31819,_binary '\0','/dRTa5iJHxqPmhsdVgJnnrqlZEtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2011953',6.4,6564,'en','Keep the Lights On','In 1997 New York City, filmmaker Erik bonds with closeted lawyer Paul after a one-night fling. As their relationship evolves through dysfunctional patterns, Erik struggles to negotiate his own boundaries while being true to himself.','/xuY4WOU8PHEFjRpPxNQMVyLNfPs.jpg','2012-07-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Keep the Lights On',84290,2.7213,5.7,'M22BZp6ZKmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31820,_binary '\0','/bMdKv4K2QgAStm0PLQIHNsgMpND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2011971',7.5,21968,'fr','Monsieur Lazhar','During a harsh Montréal winter, an elementary-school class is left reeling after its teacher commits suicide. Bachir Lazhar, a charismatic Algerian immigrant, steps in as the substitute teacher for the classroom of traumatized children. All the while, he must keep his personal life tucked away: the fact that he is seeking political refuge in Québec – and that he, like the children, has suffered an appalling loss.','/qcSXbOP1iv859kgQgqZ4Ib9yqKG.jpg','2011-09-10',94,'Released','No matter where you go... there you are','Monsieur Lazhar',78480,2.6613,7.2,'gjNCkxnT-xE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31821,_binary '\0','/oVB3cM0KZmETsmvEZjMwSmsPVCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2012011',6.4,11997,'en','Scenic Route','Stranded on an isolated desert road, two life-long friends fight for survival as their already strained relationship spirals into knife-wielding madness.','/fLR1XII83u0zMPcW5sSR3XBxwYC.jpg','2013-08-23',85,'Released','There is no turning back','Scenic Route',172847,1.9823,6.247,'0JBVtWeS5Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31822,_binary '\0','/dHQBsnPOx7eX75cpiNezI7276Om.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20124778',5.5,1300,'ar','عمهم','The story follows Sultan, a boxer and trainer who works with his friend Saeed in a sports center. They find themselves in trouble when they stumble upon a printing press for counterfeit money.','/uM7cL5jnXvKMHtDploJu30Gfu27.jpg','2022-07-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Their Uncle',967937,1.1895,5.6,'nPUyNVW-DEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31823,_binary '\0','/l7asYmqOad01F2u0oCMM8nQjoEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2012616',5.8,9530,'en','Motor City','In 1970s Detroit, John Miller falls for a local gangster\'s girl and lands in prison for a crime he didn\'t commit. With his life ruined, Miller plots revenge against the man who took his girl away.','/rKws4iqKhrzWHVLHnwtMnCpEHhF.jpg','2026-07-23',104,'Released','Love will drive you mad.','Motor City',87513,27.9243,6.206,'JHMPxTWI4sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31824,_binary '\0','/z24SD1MG48VVIjT5IuAmtOasAPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2012665',4.9,2934,'en','Repentance','An earnest life-coach/author, Thomas Carter, is mysteriously abducted by a deranged client, Angel Sanchez, who delves into Thomas\' teachings and uses his spiritual messages of Karma - action and reaction (Vipaka), against him to terrorize him and his family for their past sins.','/aJYR6GeUbrEbrapDWZDxqYdLseS.jpg','2014-02-28',90,'Released','Karma is Action, Vipaka is Reaction','Repentance',80920,2.1722,4.7,'300JHUrEhN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31825,_binary '\0','/zZiflZpuaZerugtfdyXcg6dcylD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2013293',7.8,115250,'ja','風立ちぬ','A lifelong love of flight inspires Japanese aviation engineer Jiro Horikoshi, whose storied career includes the creation of the A-6M World War II fighter plane.','/jfwSexzlIzaOgxP9A8bTA6t8YYb.jpg','2013-07-20',126,'Released','We must live.','The Wind Rises',149870,9.6697,7.8,'H_aEaPWELqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31826,_binary '\0','/gZoYp9YgWoMQQfUdS4U7srXX9xT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2014202',4.9,2357,'en','Dawn Rider','A gripping story of vengeance and passion set in the American West. When the father of gunslinger John Mason is shot to death by masked bandits, Mason sets out with guns blazing to track down those who killed him. During his quest, he finds himself involved in a grim love triangle when he falls for Alice, the determined and beautiful woman also adored by John’s best friend. Based on the timeless John Wayne adventure, Dawn Rider is a riveting saga of retribution, duty and valor in the American West.','/fJMC2wBEifL4M6QP2OjSuEBVMyX.jpg','2012-05-29',94,'Released','Justice is a quick draw.','Dawn Rider',109500,2.7557,5.6,'pwECUslRwYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31827,_binary '\0','/keLyTsvCQ9PnVSfIdzrJU3tzQgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2014260',7.4,1234,'pa','Jihne Mera Dil Luteya','Life is carefree and filled with series of mischievous events for dashing and happy-go-lucky Yuvraj and rocking rebel Gurnoor at the Patiala University, until they are bedazzled by the charming and sexy Noor who sweeps them off their feet the moment she lands in their lives, as both vie for their lady love\'s attention and her heart.','/8X4OeRZURzbreAG0GT4vnv4Pp2g.jpg','2011-07-29',135,'Released',NULL,'Jihne Mera Dil Luteya',77024,1.5707,5.3,'Iz0yI85d5RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31828,_binary '\0','/AkuDVdvopWHr2Vw3IBmfhlPk8Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2014338',7.6,13905,'en','Side by Side','Since the invention of cinema, the standard format for recording moving images has been film. Over the past two decades, a new form of digital filmmaking has emerged, creating a groundbreaking evolution in the medium. Keanu Reeves explores the development of cinema and the impact of digital filmmaking via in-depth interviews with Hollywood masters, such as James Cameron, David Fincher, David Lynch, Christopher Nolan, Martin Scorsese, George Lucas, Steven Soderbergh, and many more.','/qeeQ7rfTAXNYh4EqqdolFLkNwKM.jpg','2012-08-19',99,'Released','Can film survive our digital future?','Side by Side',110354,3.5052,7.2,'aFGJY_NJwwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31829,_binary '\0','/ciOAfVGvMzrTtdcEPoZ8hyZEyn9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2014346',5.7,1726,'en','Somebody Up There Likes Me','Thirty-five years in the life of Max, his best friend Sal and a woman they both adore, Lyla. The trio stumble through mandatory but seemingly unfulfilling entanglements, at weddings, funerals, hospitals, eateries, divorce courts and the tool shed. A deadpan fable about time sneaking up on and swerving right around us.','/3LHkPNbe3okI6hG60u7PtWCUcOb.jpg','2013-01-22',76,'Released',NULL,'Somebody Up There Likes Me',97609,2.0026,5.2,'hptxBJLUWz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31830,_binary '\0','/5nE5XAkyH7bLQzgC4rcilQVOHvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2014392',7.1,2536,'es','Violeta se fue a los cielos','A portrait of famed Chilean singer and folklorist Violeta Parra filled with her musical work, her memories, her loves and her hopes.','/lE3N29dnqqiIcKKdvAZpVcQZ9b.jpg','2011-08-11',110,'Released','Creation is a bird without a flight plan','Violeta Went to Heaven',80717,0.1416,6.8,'SChk4lmDCJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31831,_binary '\0','/fuuyu5OxInQuJOD11HVHVeROv8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2015315',6.3,1650,'ko','푸른소금','A young assassin is sent to kill a retired mob boss. But things get complicated when she begins to like him.','/uzotD4t8W14mEsRZlcJ1X2x6fPb.jpg','2011-08-31',122,'Released','Someone came into my...','Hindsight',81460,2.1377,6.48,'c3ceUMbElg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31832,_binary '\0','/yIHbfIKg6udGn2amj3EJYupSjnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2015349',6.3,9338,'en','The Greatest Hits','Harriet finds art imitating life when she discovers certain songs can transport her back in time – literally. While she relives the past through romantic memories of her former boyfriend, her time travelling collides with a burgeoning new love interest in the present. As she takes her journey through the hypnotic connection between music and memory, she wonders – even if she could change the past, should she?','/cve12HkI9psBUfmkx7FeBciaQN7.jpg','2024-04-05',94,'Released','Find the right song, change your past. Find the right person, change your future.','The Greatest Hits',1011082,6.9086,6.5,'riDLqQ0Q15c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31833,_binary '\0','/uLtVbjvS1O7gXL8lUOwsFOH4man.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2015381',8,1384470,'en','Guardians of the Galaxy','Light years from Earth, 26 years after being abducted, Peter Quill finds himself the prime target of a manhunt after discovering an orb wanted by Ronan the Accuser.','/r7vmZjiyZw9rpJMQJdXpjgiCOk9.jpg','2014-07-30',121,'Released','You\'re Welcome','Guardians of the Galaxy',118340,19.1756,7.908,'2LIQ2-PZBC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31834,_binary '\0','/47SVqaO02doJ06tOmrjiWDkwU3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2016303',5.2,14738,'en','The Bricklayer','Someone is blackmailing the CIA by assassinating foreign journalists and making it look like the agency is responsible. As the world begins to unite against the U.S., the CIA must lure its most brilliant – and rebellious – operative out of retirement, forcing him to confront his checkered past while unraveling an international conspiracy.','/36pYugctLa70NmwMEgXTR1G31Kq.jpg','2023-12-14',110,'Released','Some secrets are deadly.','The Bricklayer',927107,11.4518,5.8,'G6YfPaucph8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31835,_binary '\0','/nvl7kBSFn5XfOIE2CoUmoxdDBDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2016335',5.4,2196,'en','Walter','A ticket-taker at the local cinema believes he is the son of God. He has agreed to decide the eternal fate of everyone he comes in to contact with.','/cwwL3zfVNpVsLrRr35U4QQVXmeG.jpg','2015-03-13',87,'Released','Heaven or hell. It\'s in his hands.','Walter',323967,2.6863,5.3,'iriKbvNKibM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31836,_binary '\0','/7ZP8HtgOIDaBs12krXgUIygqEsy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20168564',6.3,7855,'ko','외계+인 1부','Gurus in the late Goryeo dynasty try to obtain a fabled, holy sword, and humans in 2022 hunt down an alien prisoner that is locked in a human\'s body. The two parties cross paths when a time-traveling portal opens up.','/8QVDXDiOGHRcAD4oM6MXjE0osSj.jpg','2022-07-20',142,'Released','For ages, aliens have locked up their prisoners in humans bodies.','Alienoid',601796,6.7557,6.9,'-S6L1bSZMWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31837,_binary '\0','/jM8C4mURyEkQorqyGF5wPFp4M5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2016894',5.7,43250,'hi','एक था टाइगर','A top Indian agent is sent to observe the actions of a scientist but the mission complicates when he falls in love with the scientist\'s Pakistani caretaker.','/jGTyeAH5KZuCX6Qat1VcTBXnqth.jpg','2012-08-15',133,'Released','Once, there was a tiger.','Ek Tha Tiger',85985,3.6047,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31838,_binary '\0','/lk44IoTz31WJPKiMRZ5pFn9XdKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2016940',6,42591,'en','Man of Tai Chi','In Beijing, a young martial artist\'s skill places him in position to experience opportunities and sacrifices.','/wnuT1D0fsFu7chFLtcQqw