ers full of hilarious profanities, rowdy Irish migrant Rose is charged with the crime. Suspecting something amiss, the town\'s women band together to investigate.','/scAU7YudKNVeZlOfgSEWntAUSJ.jpg','2024-02-23',100,'Released','Be careful what you post.','Wicked Little Letters',975773,5.907,6.9,'7DRwCQRQ-LI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31879,_binary '\0','/cu3uaBqPORcfpKQWaIjA1GJbvEg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2023587',6.2,202268,'en','Mama','Guillermo del Toro presents Mama, a supernatural thriller that tells the haunting tale of two little girls who disappeared into the woods the day that their parents were killed. When they are rescued years later and begin a new life, they find that someone or something still wants to come tuck them in at night.','/eo8BhR8Q5STmWE9sMLsEPagxmy6.jpg','2013-01-17',100,'Released','A mother\'s love is forever.','Mama',132232,8.1924,6.293,'I7_CLVoGkgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31880,_binary '\0','/6u1d3n8FOG23wqroRa88alBITQT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20236042',6.8,1674,'tr','Yurt','Forced to leave the comfort of his middle class lifestyle at his father\'s behest, fourteen-year-old Ahmet is sent to an all-boys religious dormitory where he must navigate familial expectations, his religious obligations, and the childhood to which he so desperately clings.','/hBeJX2GOOczfDMaDT4jRRT0f0yR.jpg','2024-04-03',118,'Released',NULL,'Dormitory',1156208,2.2644,6.342,'e5TXifjg2JU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31881,_binary '\0','/wNw6IumUIONZcbGjKjnA77GVpfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2023690',6.5,31828,'en','Sightseers','Chris wants to show girlfriend Tina his world, but events soon conspire against the couple and their dream caravan holiday takes a very wrong turn.','/l52cpdZcVkEVTaLqga6xxSQoaKX.jpg','2012-11-30',88,'Released','Death has a ginger beard.','Sightseers',117974,3.1989,6.3,'OM4IFqV6RYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(3