 discovers exactly how the money was spent and where it did—and didn’t go.','/imT07ON4hfWtNvLgXryERZdbtC7.jpg','2022-10-12',79,'Released','George Floyd and the Rise of BLM','The Greatest Lie Ever Sold: George Floyd and the Rise of BLM',977367,2.0256,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31902,_binary '\0','/m7B3pDhzf3pfHrVE1aQ6gzOKXAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2025667',3.3,10341,'en','Smiley','After learning of an urban legend in which a demented serial killer named SMILEY can be summoned through the internet, mentally fragile Ashley must decide whether she is losing her mind or becoming Smiley\'s next victim.','/rO8jANmASmul1tWi53mudn1V9IA.jpg','2012-10-12',95,'Released','Evil wears a smile.','Smiley',119278,3.3473,4.3,'it0wFv0xzKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31903,_binary '\0','/soW3KH0OWzTooeXPm624mMfXI0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2025690',6.7,75270,'en','The Finest Hours','The Coast Guard makes a daring rescue attempt off the coast of Cape Cod after a pair of oil tankers are destroyed during a blizzard in 1952.','/6UG91TJ4DKI6FGdqXZfDBeRZHX8.jpg','2016-01-27',117,'Released','32 survivors, room for 12.','The Finest Hours',300673,6.0819,6.6,'v_j0gXEtKVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31904,_binary '\0','/1urraINhjp8NDGwVF6gWwza6gY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20257492',6.7,2833,'en','Lonesome Soldier','Based on a true American story, Lonesome Soldier immerses viewers in the captivating journey of Jackson Harlow, a young man hailing from the heart of Tennessee to the war-torn lands of Iraq. Haunted by the vivid memories of war, Jackson\'s homecoming proves to be a profound turning point in his life, as he discovers that the battle he faces is far from over—it’s just different. Lonesome Soldier vividly portrays the profound challenges and profound triumphs experienced by those who have bravely faced the crucible of war, only to return to a world that may never fully comprehend their struggles.','/vogNJaF8eCpfhemCgCZNRW7Zq2M.jpg','2023-11-03',109,'Released','The War isn\'t over, it\'s just different','Lonesome Soldier',1200251,1.7037,4.5,'Lfs5nFeFxCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31905,_binary '\0','/xVcffNU61CclEGgtiWP7KLIE2dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20258220',3.7,6741,'en','Angels Fallen: Warriors of Peace','When an Iraq War veteran receives a calling from a higher power, he embarks on a mission to stop a fallen angel from raising an army of the dead to take over the world.','/dKdKUSGQ9E0G73WPr9xIHrofpkT.jpg','2024-07-09',103,'Released','He is the world\'s only hope.','Angels Fallen: Warriors of Peace',1058537,4.5376,5.8,'hj0CtX8YevI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31906,_binary '\0','/5VY1i8ET5xUeg0zEEwNjFfWYJJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20258920',3.3,4457,'en','Tin Soldier','An ex-special forces operative seeks revenge against a cult leader who has corrupted his former comrades, the Shinjas. This leader, known as The Bokushi, promises veterans a purpose and protection, but is revealed to be a destructive influence. The ex-soldier, Nash Cavanaugh, joins forces with military operative Emmanuel Ashburn to infiltrate the Bokushi\'s fortress and expose his reign of terror.','/lFFDrFLXywFhy6khHes1LCFVMsL.jpg','2025-05-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Tin Soldier',977294,6.4827,4.9,'8FK-KONeCks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31907,_binary '\0','/to0MAYz8Y27B4gq8X4EzzsFjG2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20258974',7,3980,'tr','Hayat','Hicran runs away from home when she is forced into an engagement with Rıza by her father. Rıza, who thinks that Hicran doesn\'t want to be with him, doesn\'t care at first. But when it begins to bother him, he decides to confront the situation and embarks on a long search for her in Istanbul.','/ga6MOnxYa5e0bF30TJOsdqO1j18.jpg','2023-12-15',193,'Released',NULL,'Life',710277,1.8007,6.8,'4MPAbrvQxQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31908,_binary '\0','/qjXyAWVOYp8t6x22OtTTz6misK4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027064',5.9,6233,'en','Blue Caprice','A narrative feature film inspired by the events known as the Beltway sniper attacks.','/cb26MlJHJkgXXsBMYTURhrJ0vB2.jpg','2013-09-12',93,'Released','Some killers are born. Others are driven to it.','Blue Caprice',158739,1.7238,5.8,'btxEOr34nw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31909,_binary '\0','/e1gAy3E4bvOLnhNUB8LLCEC17kW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027136',5.9,10865,'en','Kristy','When a college girl who is alone on campus over the Thanksgiving break is targeted by a group of outcasts, she must conquer her deepest fears to outwit them and fight back.','/5sT3ZsWbX6VOlgqslJ1l7eWZJqq.jpg','2014-08-07',85,'Released','Run for your life.','Kristy',146229,2.88,6.064,'OZK6ZiiOUuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31910,_binary '\0','/huMnhc0c0VF7oYX2fi3KECJXpXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027138',5,4451,'hi','क्या सुपर कूल हैं हम','An aspiring actor and a struggling DJ team up to pursue the ladies they love and a diamond that rightfully belongs to their oversexed dog.','/lGxipu6pNdb3ywPlCm0nPaXb5tY.jpg','2012-06-05',137,'Released',NULL,'Kyaa Super Kool Hain Hum',120101,1.2471,4.77,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31911,_binary '\0','/rqPehvtSbAbMQfYCy2spmPUGUNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027140',6.5,17405,'fr','L\'Écume des jours','A woman suffers from an unusual illness caused by a flower growing in her lungs.','/y41mndWYov3oPSZdHUtyjEdALvF.jpg','2013-01-10',131,'Released',NULL,'Mood Indigo',157820,4.1882,6.1,'dh3V-dFlmyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31912,_binary '\0','/mydyu5sEQiFJSp4c70eq0CMUp8s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027154',4.6,1740,'en','Love Bite','Four teenaged lads set off to get laid in order to stay alive. However, the boys have to attract the girls first in order to complete their mission. Otherwise, they will be hunted and killed by a vicious Werewolf which only seems interested in Virgins.','/eoCoAUcpvuoPnbapCJCvlw1byqI.jpg','2012-11-09',91,'Released','For the virgins of Rainmouth, things are going to get hairy!','Love Bite',142591,1.6697,5.3,'3e459nhd0kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31913,_binary '\0','/hel4RhpqHWamrfCueE7TZMEWJ5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027178',7,8041,'pt','O Homem do Futuro','Zero is a brilliant scientist. However, 20 years ago, he was publicly humiliated when he lost Helena, the love of his life. One day, an accidental experience with one of his inventions causes him to travel back in time to 1991. Having taken the opportunity to change history, Zero returns to own time to find totally changed.','/cWfdBMbe3SodE14h3VptXy6sQZm.jpg','2011-09-02',106,'Released','Nothing will be like before.','The Man from the Future',73624,2.4476,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31914,_binary '\0','/xEpiDj1WZcMAFMGgjmrGIfAz74K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027231',5.6,7378,'en','Perfect Sisters','Tired of their mother\'s alcoholism and a string of her abusive boyfriends, two sisters plot to kill her.','/c7JoUa6DDoHkR5ubRdCgnpwGUE5.jpg','2014-04-08',100,'Released','Being a teenager can be murder.','Perfect Sisters',206192,2.9466,5.831,'rlmILXxZUYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31915,_binary '\0','/2yS8gTQdzy3eP9SakyAFX9yOLSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2027265',6.6,1888,'fr','Une vie meilleure','Yann, a cook, and Nadia, a waitress and mother of 9-year-old child, decide to risk everything on the purchase of a restaurant. With plenty of talent, energy, love and dreams, but no finance of their own, they find themselves forced into a jungle of financing and bank loans that quickly overwhelms them. To bail them out, Nadia has to take a job in Canada, while Yann is forced to stay behind to save the restaurant. Together, he and the child confront a relentless avalanche of creditors, an uncaring system and the daily grind from which there is no respite… Yann finally understands that his only chance of salvation lies in joining his lover – as well as reuniting mother and child – by following Nadia to Canada and a better life.','/rbakPCBP4lCbChOxwB9PuB6Aq4w.jpg','2011-11-18',110,'Released',NULL,'A Better Life',85546,1.7153,6.32,'KOXze-_lyBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31916,_binary '\0','/vhtrvMyM00flv5Nhr3uSw3QqLF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20274588',7.4,2097,'en','Albert Brooks: Defending My Life','Rob Reiner profiles Albert Brooks, comedic legend, acclaimed filmmaker, talented character actor and a lifelong friend, who Reiner first met in their high school drama club.','/slZsCmKcSW0vsUzGnaYNbox5PT5.jpg','2023-11-12',88,'Released','Comedian. Actor. Filmmaker.','Albert Brooks: Defending My Life',1184849,2.6678,7.2,'L5pRaWnClyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31917,_binary '\0','/lNfCPWJnFppNThDVZBcPgrsJBoS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2028530',8,11693,'en','Paradise Lost 3: Purgatory','A further investigation into the arrest of three teenagers convicted of killing three young boys in Arkansas who spent nearly 20 years in prison before being released after new DNA evidence indicated they may be innocent.','/5Ix8SvMu5MllsXLtD0dvZR0vDi2.jpg','2012-10-13',121,'Released','The complete inside story of the West Memphis Three','Paradise Lost 3: Purgatory',83660,1.9241,7.4,'B43Cj-JEJdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31918,_binary '\0','/iTtwta5u2IjyPtFcEGyGhyfMeAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20315818',6.5,5959,'en','Ezra','Stand-up comedian Max Bernal lives with his father Stan while struggling to co-parent his autistic son Ezra with his ex-wife. When forced to confront difficult decisions about their son\'s future, Max and Ezra embark on a cross-country road trip that has a transcendent impact on both their lives.','/uXSajviZLZhYUSNL41y1PJ9RisB.jpg','2024-0