imals?','/tgyHSVTw42PMHxnq0KOXbTVwu5C.jpg','2023-01-13',129,'Released',NULL,'Lakadbaggha',1069567,1.233,6.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31922,_binary '\0','/bLGsVMO8rSjJnV5JHpgtE7nrTAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2032557',6.8,15421,'en','The Reluctant Fundamentalist','In New York, a Pakistani native finds that his American Dream has collapsed in the wake of the 9/11 terrorist attacks.','/nbdiRDhStWuAPmrscejIlRCFrQt.jpg','2013-04-24',130,'Released','Terror has two faces.','The Reluctant Fundamentalist',121677,3.9929,6.6,'ouXWUenv5_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31923,_binary '\0','/7rVmPxSPm53SsVyUTmjrenOa8yH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2032572',5.3,15727,'en','USS Indianapolis: Men of Courage','The harrowing true story of the crew of the USS Indianapolis, who were stranded in the Philippine Sea for five days after delivering the atomic weapons that would eventually end WWII. As they awaited rescue, they endured extreme thirst, hunger, and relentless shark attacks.','/aREeJV7avhlLnCicVG3fBjXiaW1.jpg','2016-09-22',128,'Released','1196 men aboard, 5 days in water, 317 survived','USS Indianapolis: Men of Courage',340945,7.1092,5.9,'rlHPOAwGNyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31924,_binary '\0','/czVIuIXqDPgCBHI3vLYQcRtzAo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20330434',6.5,7585,'fr','Mon crime','In 1930s Paris, Madeleine, a pretty, young, penniless, and talentless actress, is accused of murdering a famous producer. Helped by her best friend, Pauline, a young, unemployed lawyer, she is acquitted on the grounds of self-defense. A new life of fame and success begins, until the truth comes out.','/hcvhE2JWsidOxHL7yXk3MXs4vyt.jpg','2023-02-24',103,'Released','Who benefits from the crime?','The Crime Is Mine',977506,5.3241,6.464,'cEI0IGFdxoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31925,_binary '\0','/4hQI7GjNi78PUKlWO1BLV5OQXFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2033981',6.8,2871,'en','Downloaded','A documentary that explores the downloading revolution; the kids that created it, the bands and the businesses that were affected by it, and its impact on the world at large.','/xxc7xbBOFqZEE57q375UZu0JsqZ.jpg','2013-06-20',106,'Released','Napster: The Music. The Battle. The Revolution.','Downloaded',173210,1.3439,6.5,'h7YnjPGIeKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31926,_binary '\0','/svjKczWWmHzpeETQGdwfVcwBdRI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2033997',6.6,1617,'tr','Gelecek Uzun Sürer','Sumru, a young ethnomusicologist in search of her lost lover, leaves Istanbul for a three-month research project in Diyarbakır. While crossing paths with locals and tracing the pains of others through a music project based on Anatolian mournings, she comes to confront the remnants of her own agony.','/n1FT2QzF8aUaZ5ZUuPhDaxLp4I3.jpg','2011-11-11',108,'Released',NULL,'Future Lasts Forever',79682,1.0054,5.5,'b-9ezwxBxwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31927,_binary '\0','/1lNPZohA9DSQX55IIW65Y3LkjZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034009',3.1,1693,'en','Haunted High','A group of students are trapped at a school after a time capsule from the 1950\'s is cracked open by an earthquake. The students soon realize that ghostly spirits escaped from the time capsule, and possessed the principal and three other teachers.','/vvBldMlCmq7WDI6eoWIHSAe1JfE.jpg','2012-08-25',85,'Released','Showing your school spirit can be deadly.','Haunted High',128655,1.7752,4.3,'CxwddMzy9xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31928,_binary '\0','/1Vx5e9s6X8dCCfghY4jIioe8hX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034026',6.7,2692,'ta','முனி 2: காஞ்சனா','When three spirits possess a timid young man and start making him act like a woman, his mother consults an exorcist who unearths a heartbreaking tale of societal injustice, murder and vengeance.','/imGP0yeKkK8u8LCboD3ufUvaFnT.jpg','2011-07-22',170,'Released',NULL,'Kanchana',75064,1.7512,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31929,_binary '\0','/qQOHMXOBE3MFHW1NYi4XkvqEZWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034031',6.4,47670,'en','Laggies','Overeducated and underemployed, 28 year old Megan is in the throes of a quarterlife crisis. Squarely into adulthood with no career prospects, no particular motivation to think about her future and no one to relate to, Megan is comfortable lagging a few steps behind - while her friends check off milestones and celebrate their new grown-up status. When her high-school sweetheart proposes, Megan panics and- given an unexpected opportunity to escape for a week - hides out in the home of her new friend, 16-year old Annika and Annika\'s world-weary single dad Craig.','/kL2ccASO8O6v92gGTaaY5gOCAI4.jpg','2014-09-25',100,'Released','Acting your age is so overrated.','Laggies',244264,3.6264,6.12,'4o8peGbqxeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31930,_binary '\0','/cQE2dSKpt31WNtiRipbYBlJz5YE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034139',4,17733,'en','The Last Exorcism Part II','As Nell Sweetzer tries to build a new life, the evil force that once possessed her returns with an even more horrific plan.','/260ztSWhGIYSLAjDC6smFWcdUSp.jpg','2013-02-28',88,'Released','The second coming','The Last Exorcism Part II',146203,6.3136,4.7,'BySJLmciR5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31931,_binary '\0','/palbhPOSYf2g1p18vWd91dDhZLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034176',3.8,3894,'en','Redcon-1','After a zombie apocalypse spreads from a London prison, the UK is brought to its knees. The spread of the virus is temporarily contained but, without a cure, it’s only a matter of time before it breaks its boundaries and the biggest problem of all… any zombies with combat skills are now enhanced. With the South East of England quarantined from the rest of the world using fortified borders, intelligence finds that the scientist responsible for the outbreak is alive and well in London. With his recovery being the only hope of a cure, a squad of eight Special Forces soldiers is sent on a suicide mission to the city, now ruled by the undead, with a single task: get him out alive within 72 hours by any means necessary. What emerges is an unlikely pairing on a course to save humanity against ever-rising odds.','/6t2zRldr64GZDuMxKhPzwhVxyjX.jpg','2018-09-07',117,'Released','War Has Just Evolved.','Redcon-1',485811,3.5581,5.7,'OqYyEJpa7xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31932,_binary '\0','/A2owp1CjaOzAxnPwzQoovtJFBcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034761',5.8,1944,'no','Reisen til julestjernen','13 year old kind-hearted Sonja arrives at a tiny village together with a company of bandits. But there is a curse on the village. A long time ago, the King’s only daughter Goldhair disappeared while searching for the Christmas Star. The Queen died of a broken heart, leaving the shattered King all on his own. From that day on, the King cursed the Christmas Star, thereby causing darkness and grief to descend upon the land. However, an old sage has revealed that Goldhair is still alive, and will return only if the King finds the way back to the Christmas Star. Ever since, the King has been searching for the Christmas Star every Christmas, but all in vain.','/ysqFnW2TrlD6W9H9dn1FLgVhpsq.jpg','2012-11-09',80,'Released',NULL,'Journey to the Christmas Star',149427,3.1527,6,'GhTEDA8_1Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31933,_binary '\0','/th26RNksfM9nn7DPH06OqiV6BA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2034800',5.9,161437,'en','The Great Wall','European mercenaries searching for black powder become embroiled in the defense of the Great Wall of China against a horde of monstrous creatures.','/p70dq1YxabemdZDm5K6Q8G10wSn.jpg','2016-12-16',103,'Released','1700 years to build. 5500 miles long. What were they trying to keep out?','The Great Wall',311324,15.5376,6,'6SKI9rgqFck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31934,_binary '\0','/A7ttaNyNFb0AcUTgZ11a72osdvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20355484',5.1,2296,'sv','Ett sista race','A street racing legend Dennis who neglected his marriage and 16 year old daughter Hanna. One day he finds out that his daughter will participate in a race with her new boyfriend. To stop Hanna, Dennis and his ex-wife Tove go on a trip.','/xlJjZOq3scU1CoMaAv0g3dViEb0.jpg','2023-12-25',113,'Released',NULL,'The Final Race',1135894,2.2426,5.9,'Ico5F4EWOp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31935,_binary '\0','/hIRyLinDrbwZ5Lzc5GvoedfR6e3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2035630',7,10992,'en','Starlet','An unlikely friendship forms between 21 year-old Jane and the elderly Sadie after Jane discovers a hidden stash of money inside an object at Sadie\'s yard sale.','/8mVU5KjD5b4Df3CRTnJqKFSwg5y.jpg','2012-11-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Starlet',91679,2.4583,6.809,'-JHszQynTPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31936,_binary '\0','/gh6JF8QSN4fXkICO6R2oXkaNhsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2035670',5.4,2567,'en','The Wedding Video','When the rogueish but loveable Raif is asked to be his brother Tim\'s best man at his wedding, he decides the best present for the happy newlyweds would be to catch the entire thing on video. He returns home from abroad to find his brother is no longer the bohemian vagabond that he used to be, and is in fact marrying into a very wealthy family, and the wedding they\'re about to be part of will be the most outlandish and bizarre that Cheshire has ever seen... Thank the lord Raif has caught it all on tape!','/uEi5c7eFy6S0fdD1MFighbvhvhN.jpg','2012-08-17',94,'Released','Love. Honour. Disarray.','The Wedding Video',122843,2.1887,5.5,'FfgofRLbZ64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31937,_binary '\0','/fgIjuWPLUVKEPg4qHUH2FznbGqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20358284',6.1,5044,'en','The Lesson','Liam, an aspiring and ambitious young writer, eagerly accepts a tutoring position at the family estate of his idol, renowned author J.M. Sinclair. But soon, Liam realizes that he is ensnared in a web of family secrets, resentment, and retribution. Sinclair, his wife Hélène, and their son Bertie all guard a dark past, one that threatens Liam’s future as well as their own.','/o4VDbFrzujtEBmCB8UVm4kfayMN.jpg','2023-07-07',103,'Released','Who is teaching whom?','The Lesson',977770,2.5059,5.7,'amO6BhGJ4so','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31938,_binary '\0','/lm5JZRVb2hnmY0oZN5rEi217xic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2036376',4.8,4102,'en','Girls Against Boys','After a series of bad experiences with men, Shae teams up with her co-worker, Lu, who has a simple, deadly way of dealing with the opposite sex.','/s15s3Ut9CRnkKKk9KIrp1ommFUz.jpg','2012-05-17',87,'Released','Bad girls don\'t cry. They get even.','Girls Against Boys',94887,2.6925,4.8,'jmReqVh39Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31939,_binary '\0','/ctxdYzIzshUvOHEdG80p3r6tYJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2036388',7.2,2043,'it','Io sono Li','A study of the friendship between a Chinese woman and a fisherman who came to Italy from Yugoslavia many years ago, who live in a small city-island in the Veneto lagoon.','/zj0qO36gzAWh9vhpbVjvQp3iQqv.jpg','2011-09-23',100,'Released',NULL,'Shun Li and the Poet',75562,1.5087,6.966,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31940,_binary '\0','/jJksQOsDRIjTZyH9QIurGujPYvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2036408',5.9,1404,'de','Mann tut was Mann kann','Confirmed bachelor Paul falls for Iris, who’s unfortunately as good as married. Although his friends have women problems of their own, and all end up moving into Paul’s apartment, they concoct a daring plan to help Paul save Iris from marrying the wrong man.','/moSJJT2eXBaTK8JIJw53ACnje2r.jpg','2012-10-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Men Do what Men Can',149763,1.54,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31941,_binary '\0','/iwGecI7d8rii2DQe3m3sLnBySQh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2036416',7.5,12519,'zh','那些年，我們一起追的女孩','A group of close friends who attend a private school all have a debilitating crush on the sunny star pupil, Shen Chia-yi. The only member of the group who claims not to is Ko Ching-teng, but he ends up loving her as well.','/mQ07Y4KlYZlJjVSEp2AFTYZA9i.jpg','2011-08-19',109,'Released','Do you still remember your high school days?','You Are the Apple of My Eye',84111,2.5696,7.4,'v5H6wE47FrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31942,_binary '\0','/ysUFXFv5pjtJXYVEZCh9LrUI7J4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20365920',7.9,4796,'sr','Čuvari formule','In 1958, during the Cold War, two scientists, two worlds, and two ideologies faced a race for survival at the Vinca Scientific Institute near Belgrade.','/yOANMJCxkjFoVULGp6QJZCF9div.jpg','2024-06-05',120,'Released','The death formula becomes the formula of life.','Guardians of the Formula',1147335,1.8631,7.1,'UkVEJvB4i_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31943,_binary '\0','/xa4CnNdPmVPeT1qFuQgiCgASKE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039338',5.2,54866,'en','Flatliners','Five medical students, hoping to understand the mystery of what lies beyond life, embark on a dangerous experiment. When their hearts are stopped for a short period of time, they have a near-death experience…','/e9NHATN0TJW6ZZPLLWFsKdilVl1.jpg','2017-09-28',111,'Released','You haven\'t lived until you\'ve died.','Flatliners',400710,7.7462,5.643,'6Ho29C0eths','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31944,_binary '\0','/m9dqpTKaWNtMY8yKqAS8WyoNV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039345',5.9,20467,'en','Grand Piano','Tom Selznick, the most talented pianist of his generation, stopped performing in public because of his stage fright. Years after a catastrophic performance, he reappears in public in a long awaited concert in Chicago. Just moments after starting his performance in the packed theater, in front of an expectant audience, Tom finds a threatening message written on the score: \'Play one wrong note and you die\'. Without leaving the piano, Tom must discover the anonymous sniper\'s motives and look for help without anyone realizing.','/srDej4diwXriw1127ccpUfXRyeO.jpg','2013-10-11',90,'Released','Play or die.','Grand Piano',220286,4.5482,5.957,'nEoM7bM7KVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31945,_binary '\0','/4BYjHUOPxZUHIu95XIKWzRrsvSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039366',5.6,1439,'en','Lucky Christmas','Lucky Christmas is the story of Holly Ceroni, a single mom trying to get back on her feet, but who is crushed to learn her winning lottery ticket is in the glove compartment of her recently stolen car. Mike Ronowski, the construction worker behind Holly\'s missing property, goes along with a master plan to befriend Holly and coerce her into giving him half of her winnings. Mike unexpectedly falls in love with Holly and learns there are more important things in life than quick money in time for the holidays.','/nPBjJgbGxcWAOEdHpvT4m52ISvI.jpg','2011-11-12',87,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Christmas',81421,1.2712,5.7,'lro50CAwG18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31946,_binary '\0','/3L4u4mkbDvflAhvgPmsYy4zdGz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039369',5.9,1266,'pt','Mato Sem Cachorro','The day a man almost runs-over a puppy, he meets the love of his life. The couple and their dog live the dream, until she wants out.','/n3smHWlrTpGSZKPj5BiAu11tZ1h.jpg','2013-10-04',101,'Released',NULL,'Mato Sem Cachorro',224233,1.2327,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31947,_binary '\0','/ni6AHnsPMdH8jaK2wT3MRXA7JCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039393',6,78519,'en','The Gambler','Literature professor Jim Bennett leads a secret life as a high-stakes gambler. Always a risk-taker, Bennett bets it all when he borrows from a gangster and offers his own life as collateral. Staying one step ahead, he pits his creditor against the operator of an illicit gambling ring while garnering the attention of Frank, a paternalistic loan shark. As his relationship with a student deepens, Bennett must risk everything for a second chance.','/hIgU3cxn7Y87joQGM3srofnXOm5.jpg','2014-12-25',111,'Released','The only way out is all in','The Gambler',284536,9.1721,6,'7CFBu0EommA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31948,_binary '\0','/ro4yf72eAePdsWZ82VTtOsH4dCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2039399',4.2,3606,'en','The Philadelphia Experiment','A secret government research project tries reviving the World War II \"Philadelphia Experiment,\" which was an attempt to create a cloaking device to render warships invisible. When the experiment succeeds, it brings back the original ship (the Eldridge) that disappeared during the first test in 1943 - which brings death and destruction to the 21st century. It\'s up to the sole survivor of the first experiment and his granddaughter to stop it.','/ufhU1dBr5xvDRfpDhbrzBelNRuX.jpg','2012-07-27',85,'Released','Past and present collide','The Philadelphia Experiment',122293,3.8197,4.8,'8r5AZU4-x9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31949,_binary '\0','/imvFJRsVoUxa2nu2cZtZL4W2ui4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2040281',7.5,1257,'en','Beauty Is Embarrassing','Raised in the Tennessee mountains, Wayne White started his career as a cartoonist in NYC. He quickly found success as one of the creators of the Pee-wee\'s Playhouse TV show which soon led to more work designing some of the most arresting and iconic images in pop culture. Recently his word paintings featuring pithy and and often sarcastic text statements finely crafted onto vintage landscape paintings have made him a darling of the fine art world. The movie chronicles the vaulted highs and crushing lows of an artist struggling to find peace and balance between his professional work and his personal art. This is especially complicated for a man who struggles with the virtues he most often mocks in his art...Vanity, ego and fame.','/fbZ8sg3QUcXJs98i7uKvmUDygQB.jpg','2012-09-07',88,'Released',NULL,'Beauty Is Embarrassing',90603,1.0593,7.3,'sIv4PHJqCnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31950,_binary '\0','/zCswi1CZhBZKmzV61Klt6kAluxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2040367',5.1,1468,'en','Gus','Lizzie\'s best friend, Andie, becomes pregnant and offers to give the baby to her. Lizzie\'s husband, Peter, reluctantly goes along with being the child\'s father, and Andie moves into the guest room for the remainder of the pregnancy.','/7WZLSWwEGyaVghoFNCNyq2n5xPS.jpg','2013-12-06',87,'Released',NULL,'Gus',172785,2.002,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31951,_binary '\0','/uBCVsnoBLBNSeCvhfcApsNzqQx1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2040560',5.7,26570,'en','The Pact','After their mother passes away, sisters Nicole and Annie reluctantly return to their childhood home to pay their last respects. While staying overnight in the house, the sisters sense a mysterious presence in their midst: noises startling them in the night, objects moving about, a fallen picture of an unknown woman posed next to their mother. Annie begins experiencing a series of intense and disturbing dreams - visions that lead her to uncover something terrible about her mother\'s past that is finally revealing itself.','/o0a4iSc5yKEiV15NCTI5GwrZudc.jpg','2012-05-25',89,'Released','Some doors should never be opened.','The Pact',111440,3.5957,5.7,'hTkcqutbS7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31952,_binary '\0','/kjMFnngbARSnaxqq1JFVxZnilJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2040578',3,3922,'en','U.F.O.','A group of friends awake one morning to find all electricity and power shut off and an immense alien aircraft hovering in the air above their heads. Suddenly this regular group of friends is battling to survive as the entire human race is threatened by the alien army hovering ominously above.','/u6YRCDCiauJFYltBklD1X8m6OQm.jpg','2012-12-15',101,'Released','Try to remain calm','U.F.O.',146631,2.2255,4.3,'YWKYKG2GUnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31953,_binary '\0','/jrtRZnxbk0a5dgGlhIk3YxTBtY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2040605',5.6,1315,'ko','너는 펫','A woman finds a man in a box in front of her home and takes him in. She jokingly says she wants to keep him as her pet since the man reminds her of her childhood dog. The man agrees. Later the woman discovers that the man is a dance prodigy. Complications arise when her old flame from college returns.','/v1a4ipJ8CkG4Id8JCJfFXvTzybG.jpg','2011-11-10',110,'Released','How does the master tame her pet…','You Are My Pet',83754,1.213,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31954,_binary '\0','/xxvk5fbX7ThkbJf3u7Gi5en1IjT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20413120',7,3167,'te','Suraapanam','Drinking \'Suraapanam\' let\'s Shiva turn into an old man, a young boy and a kid everyday. Will there be any consequences? How will he deal with them?','/aAezEnuAbHKCuTZEXQoSUsYDu6w.jpg','2022-06-10',145,'Released',NULL,'Suraapanam',1195333,1.3285,0,'HKlv2Uopyog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31955,_binary '\0','/sTcdSl3GGb9tsgfpZ2eIgVt982T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2041331',3.4,2326,'en','Sx_Tape','From the director of CANDYMAN and the producers of PARANORMAL ACTIVITY comes a found-footage nightmare of lust, possession, and destruction. Jill\'s an artist. Ian\'s a filmmaker. And their love life is off the chain. There\'s no experience too wild, no dare too dangerous—not even when Jill lets Ian strap her to a gurney in the abandoned hospital they\'re scoping out for their next art show. But he shouldn\'t have left her alone. Not even as a joke. Now, Jill\'s hookup with horror has awakened something in that place. Something with a lust for more than flesh.','/n484SE5u944nFRw4sJ9kr6IN1O3.jpg','2013-10-10',85,'Released','Some tapes shouldn\'t be made','Sx_Tape',228496,1.8635,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31956,_binary '\0','/ndSOCqFamuo3KbVs7o8SNCuFl1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20413650',4.7,1449,'en','The Donor Party','Follows Jaclyn who really wants a baby, and realizes she doesn\'t need a husband to be a mother after a messy divorce and wasted years of online dating, so she and her best friends create a plan to get her pregnant at a very special party.','/lIdA8Q5sdR2GaoeNfUgh0P3yzSh.jpg','2023-03-03',93,'Released',NULL,'The Donor Party',1081683,3.2649,5.4,'Eq3KcYtzBLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31957,_binary '\0','/tTowHrLbxXxtiJT65HJVWSp0EqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20414228',3.5,4744,'de','Manta Manta - Zwoter Teil','When a former racer faces the prospect of his car repair shop and go-kart track being foreclosed, he comes up with a daring plan: to win the prize for the big race on the Bilster Berg. He has one month to turn his old Opel into a rocket from the old days, but his ex-wife suddenly enters his life with a request to take care of their son.','/sYMPaNG3nl2tcYJfqXcMK5whUMt.jpg','2023-03-30',127,'Released',NULL,'Manta, Manta: Legacy',1058100,2.7539,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31958,_binary '\0','/90BfOJl7EVi6LyWbVyJfRFw5ixt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20414360',7.1,2206,'en','Köln 75','The true story of Vera Brandes, teenage patron saint of the 1970s Cologne music scene, who risked everything to organize the greatest solo concert in music history: Keith Jarrett’s legendary Köln Concert.','/oMeg1capgysYPHVOnZq7HfoIXzE.jpg','2025-03-13',116,'Released','In a man\'s world, make some noise.','Köln 75',1171153,2.6904,7.1,'j83Ps9SmpF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31959,_binary '\0','/oSSCA6Py4m6xfzud3UgR45KjfnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20414550',5.9,2275,'sv','Tillsammans 99','A group of very different individuals who in 1975 lived in a commune called \"Together\". Now it is 1999, and the collective has turned into the world\'s smallest. The commune consists of only two people - Göran and Klasse. Feeling a bit lonely, the idea occurs of a reunion with their old friends.','/9VBMAwJRQCdkqsv5e028RnK0Uo1.jpg','2023-10-13',115,'Released','We were amazing. We are amazing.','Together 99',977935,1.3066,6,'9oZAnK5tMRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31960,_binary '\0','/orYBqueGhVXKVuWECyxecujBAvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20414642',5.8,3636,'sv','En dag och en halv','In a desperate bid to reunite with his daughter, an armed man bursts into the medical center where his estranged wife works and kidnaps her.','/9xkkrxSY1t4FUtMKKFXalVo3cmt.jpg','2023-09-01',96,'Released',NULL,'A Day and a Half',978783,3.001,6.287,'eNxhpkdOTWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31961,_binary '\0','/8FSB22d8lFe7OIHNXVcw8t8OSri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20414834',3.1,2148,'en','Putin','A portrait of a formidable political figure, unraveling the contrasting facets of an iron-fisted tyrant and a man haunted by fear.','/j3Q2MrpmaOrKfN2pInNvRNhYa4G.jpg','2025-01-09',109,'Released','Absolute power is never enough.','Putin',1255795,2.5652,6.1,'k2qgYK1CrkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31962,_binary '\0','/jxeIgOEY5pbl9aMRExGawV6xkyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2041488',5.2,6481,'en','Thunderstruck','After NBA star Kevin Durant switches talent with 16 year old Brian, the teenager becomes the star of his high school team, but Durant starts struggling and eventually learns an important lesson.','/lR1ssqRzslQx9WtTOKnfgqbNB1y.jpg','2012-08-24',94,'Released','NBA superstar Kevin Durant has got game. His biggest fan has none. Things are about to switch!','Thunderstruck',119738,4.1696,6.2,'65qyPfZe9Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31963,_binary '\0','/gbKb9959quTMhYPP4T3w1YKXRYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2041510',4.8,5010,'en','The Maladjusted','Three friends struggle to maintain their hedonistic lifestyles as they approach 30. Delving into their story, we become subjected to their inane theories, absurd philosophies and warped sense of humor.','/mG7L0xOry42sOtS6aJZHl9eipzc.jpg','2013-07-11',103,'Released',NULL,'The Maladjusted',288215,0.9489,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31964,_binary '\0','/zUKTmHpiiZzRitoSnxmX6cWgQvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20415188',7.2,1376,'da','Bamse','A LUCKY MAN is a tribute to the popular Danish musician Flemming \"Bamse\" Duun Jørgensen, who has provided us with classics like “Vimmer Street”, “Why Does Louise Go Dancing” and “In A Boat That’s Itty-Bitty”. Behind the warm smile and the overalls is a powerful and moving story about a man’s lifelong pursuit of recognition and love. Flemming “Teddy” Jørgensen is the only child of 12 siblings to be given up for adoption. Flemming’s adoptive father wishes for Flemming to take over the family’s factory, but to the father’s dismay, Flemming chooses music and becomes the frontman of Teddy’s Friends. A fractured background that leaves deep marks in Flemming’s life. A LUCKY MAN is a warm and compassionate film that tells Teddy’s life story with his biggest hits as the soundscape.','/76UgoEzhz8AP5UqmeFYQgyCQsC4.jpg','2022-08-25',92,'Released',NULL,'A Lucky Man',995169,1.1238,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31965,_binary '\0','/ugdryGVwOCSE4ic2A3vud8dv8qy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20420316',7.5,3459,'de','Gladbeck: Das Geiseldrama','In August 1988, two armed bank robbers keep German police at bay for 54 hours during a hostage-taking drama that ends in a shootout and three deaths.','/3gQVzkLd8GxqNVG5t5CkQEvMDnD.jpg','2022-06-08',91,'Released',NULL,'Gladbeck: The Hostage Crisis',975923,1.8909,7.535,'61yP5BRLhUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31966,_binary '\0','/AvH5bT6g00Iy7cv31BTokIa2KRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20420538',5.8,2334,'es','Todos los nombres de Dios','After being implicated in a terrorist attack, Santi, a taxi driver, is taken hostage by one of the perpetrators.','/n15gfcgwV0LVPSobrayZcFHcwN6.jpg','2023-09-15',105,'Released',NULL,'All the Names of God',1053592,3.0415,6.565,'87w5CR91iHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31967,_binary '\0','/pg01mUOLX6bmkmQyQownrPDXbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20420628',6.1,8255,'en','Freud\'s Last Session','On the eve of the Second World War, two of the greatest minds of the twentieth century, C.S. Lewis and Sigmund Freud converge for their own personal battle over the existence of God. The film interweaves the lives of Freud and Lewis, past, present, and through fantasy, bursting from the confines of Freud’s study on a dynamic journey.','/mp7IBxFuvNZSVOOGESybvaPxd7y.jpg','2023-12-22',109,'Released','September 3, 1939. The world is on the brink. A monumental session with two of the greatest minds of the twentieth century over the future of mankind and the existence of God.','Freud\'s Last Session',1025491,4.6934,6.6,'-lM65Dm6Ytc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31968,_binary '\0','/zN7NIIH7UA17OyPXcBM7tpRvxI0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20420646',7,1685,'de','In Liebe, eure Hilde','In Berlin 1942, Hilde is a member of an anti-Nazi group. She falls in love with another member, Hans. The two spend a summer together until they get caught by the Gestapo and Hilde is imprisoned, eight months pregnant.','/hJ8y5VsbjbzDCoXJ6LDwn8JcFkP.jpg','2024-10-17',124,'Released',NULL,'From Hilde, with Love',1070319,2.6532,7,'vR2lh316l3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31969,_binary '\0','/3mrli3xsGrAieQks7KsBUm2LpCg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20424130',5.4,4385,'en','Mob Land','A sheriff tries to keep the peace when a desperate family man violently robs a pill mill with his brother-in-law, alerting an enforcer for the New Orleans mafia.','/mcz8oi9oCgq1wkA3Wz2kluE94pE.jpg','2023-08-04',111,'Released','Crime. Family.','Mob Land',979275,4.4367,5.525,'XbcFFw8YdEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31970,_binary '\0','/isihZ8cM9nr5JGNn8yU9l7yYxN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20424172',6.5,4206,'fr','Alibi.com 2','After closing his agency Alibi.com and promising Flo that he would never lie to her again, Greg\'s new life became quiet, too quiet... Not for long! When he decides to propose to Flo, Greg is up against the wall and has to introduce his family. But with his crooked father and his ex-charm actress mother, this could ruin his future union. He has no choice but to reopen his agency with his former accomplices for an ultimate Alibi and to find more presentable fake parents.','/u2IgcRl1q5iDoag5xBYR4q51gJW.jpg','2023-01-07',88,'Released',NULL,'Alibi.com 2',967585,3.5861,6.551,'4Ws_rUHEGQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31971,_binary '\0','/k4SrTlJFMIeUYItEFtrXGcqZw6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20424814',6.4,1228,'en','I\'m Beginning To See the Light','A tale of self-rediscovery seen through the eyes of a grief-stricken trumpeter, who finds salvation in a lighthouse and its two suicidal visitors.','/y6H0DS1MpWyAtfIAg1KyKbEDj0O.jpg','2024-09-29',104,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Beginning To See the Light',1109202,2.2214,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31972,_binary '\0','/kdkCTC6Cl20TJSf4B1eIJXAFeXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2042568',7.4,173243,'en','Inside Llewyn Davis','In Greenwich Village in the early 1960s, gifted but volatile folk musician Llewyn Davis struggles with money, relationships, and his uncertain future.','/nNxK3pC3DMpPpWKMvo2p3liREVT.jpg','2013-10-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Inside Llewyn Davis',86829,8.0138,7.2,'9JvHEDJEguY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31973,_binary '\0','/nurGOIIEQEJIfBerLXLpDhOr7yu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2042583',7.6,5411,'es','La jaula de oro','A group of Central-American teen-agers depart from the slums of Guatemala City escaping poverty and violence, towards the promised land of California.','/95RJFUkUzy9iskS8lhCMJpMbHYH.jpg','2013-10-25',110,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Dream',186976,2.6516,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31974,_binary '\0','/29fL6pG0Fi67Qflhrh5ZDY0eDsf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043757',2.5,7910,'en','2-Headed Shark Attack','A Semester at Sea ship is attacked and sunk by a mutated two-headed shark, and the survivors seek refuge on a deserted atoll. The coeds, however, are no longer safe when the atoll starts flooding.','/elKZZhpc6fVFgMFPZaVAC4l1JdM.jpg','2012-06-26',90,'Released','1 Body, 2 Heads and 6,000 Teeth','2-Headed Shark Attack',86703,3.9886,4.258,'lcH03mWg_sM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31975,_binary '\0','/zOkXYh6eA5YlURYHINlCFo2RAZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043865',5.7,2067,'es','Cásese quien pueda','Ana Paula catches her fiancé cheating. After a night of drinking, she wakes up far from home, not so certain she wants to go back.','/qShzlTIGJRDENDgvgVVvrIqpmIJ.jpg','2014-02-14',107,'Released','The wedding justifies the means','Get Married If You Can',252444,1.6512,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31976,_binary '\0','/zTDcmbU5dWVE3t0p4DkO01GIxA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043932',6,11365,'nl','New Kids Nitro','Gerrie, Richard, Rikkert, Robbie and Barry from Maaskantje are in a big fight with the village of Schijndel. When a zombie kills someone from Brabant, things get out of hand.','/2NyrICtZIlDvJjzcau2tUkqdhGw.jpg','2011-12-07',78,'Released',NULL,'New Kids Nitro',79723,1.7856,6.102,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31977,_binary '\0','/va6SObQdsJV4BmPKts4pTsKIk37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043933',6.1,17910,'en','Night Moves','The story about three radical environmentalists coming together to execute the most intense protest of their lives: the explosion of a hydroelectric dam.','/qQj7JKpUfrP7rVvr7kVrKuevGy7.jpg','2014-04-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Night Moves',157823,3.3877,5.9,'W2hHtZ16yng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31978,_binary '\0','/yOzv1fdOmJWzSITlVeWoT8sxq9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043979',7.6,4259,'pl','Róża','This harrowing tale of survival centers on Rose, a Masurian woman, whose German soldier husband was killed in the war, leaving her alone on their farm. A single woman had no defense against Russian soldiers who raped as a form of revenge, nor against plundering Poles who found themselves in desperate straits. Help arrives for Rose in the form of Tadeusz, a former officer in the Polish Home Army who deserted after he saw his wife raped and murdered by Russian troops and is attempting to hide his identity.','/keQEIvYOpjlTdz593vLvJjkbnYy.jpg','2012-02-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Rose',89156,1.1873,7.086,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31979,_binary '\0','/mEoQaQV5mWxvD7xuHHVeTFHsSk9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2043993',6.4,4403,'en','No Sleep \'Til Christmas','Lizzie, a high-end event planner, lies awake nightly while her devoted fiancé Josh rests peacefully. When a sleep-deprived incident causes her to run into Billy, a low-key bartender who is just as sleepless and frustrated as she is, they discover that they can only fall asleep while next to each other.','/iC3K1xIG5qZBOhjtxt11Oruvj1H.jpg','2018-12-10',85,'Released',NULL,'No Sleep \'Til Christmas',550097,2.8578,6.756,'bPfK-pzQKEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31980,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2044040',7.1,1792,'en','The Last Gladiators','In ice hockey, no one is tougher than the \"goon\". Those players have one mission: to protect the star players at any price. Exploring the violent world of hockey fights, Academy Award winner Alex Gibney (\"Taxi to the Dark Side\") looks at the world of the NHL enforcers and specifically the career of Chris \"Knuckles\" Nilan who helped the Montreal Canadiens win the Stanley Cup.','/6Z2itVB5BaA7LtcugfSFWXAWwqH.jpg','2012-10-26',94,'Released','Some fights never end','The Last Gladiators',93103,1.1938,6.9,'wv9UAmA0RJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31981,_binary '\0','/fcm21Y2a5XfnsNsHiP1qGRY4IBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2044729',4.6,6008,'en','A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III','Charles Swan III, a successful graphic designer, has it all: fame, money and devilish charm that have provided him with a seemingly perfect life. But when a perplexing beauty named Ivana suddenly ends their relationship, Charles is left heartbroken. With the support of his loyal intimates - Kirby, Saul, and his sister, Izzy – Charles begins a delirious journey of self-reflection to try and come to terms with a life without Ivana. \"A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III\" is an unconventional melodrama told in a bold and playful style.','/bFI9LR2Bw0R57aobRLiN08rWtpn.jpg','2013-02-08',86,'Released','Reality Is Overrated','A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III',124461,2.6441,4.1,'1Q9NWeZba1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31982,_binary '\0','/kZf9xrKmnrblkTCJW91KcvdWFXK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2044774',8.5,2968,'ar','الكيف','Gamal sings at local weddings. His brother Salah, a chemist, tries to convince him to quit drugs and gives him some weed that is made out of harmless substances. When a drug dealer grows impressed by Salah\'s formula, Salah succumbs to the temptation of money.','/5C6kNh21RGJkmZYlpWX7Tpttlim.jpg','1985-09-16',120,'Released',NULL,'El Keif',199634,0.7199,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31983,_binary '\0','/fy4T5mcj3c6uyRI7iKjInoC8vrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2044801',4.5,7325,'en','Kite','When Sawa\'s mother and policeman father are found victims of a grisly double homicide, she begins a ruthless pursuit for the man who murdered them. With the help of her father\'s ex-partner, Karl Aker, and a mysterious friend from her past, she becomes a merciless teen assassin, blasting her way through the dark world of human trafficking only to uncover a devastating truth','/twNC3WumNZvTk5TGvLY8okhXDaB.jpg','2014-06-13',90,'Released','Never underestimate a girl with nothing to lose.','Kite',192712,3.3582,4.3,'Lm4tyQw2LhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31984,_binary '\0','/aT2evpXB5F7ln2xxsJFYFEkraiz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20449626',6.2,1479,'da','Elsker dig for tiden','Anna and Thomas are missing something: love. They will follow their encounter through confusing crushes and lack of commitment, but can love survive when you don\'t want to compromise your own dreams for your partner?','/kh5Rd9RMMrNGUOkCe0fhmvXsP1T.jpg','2022-12-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Love You for Now',1019835,1.8599,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31985,_binary '\0','/yIhVPYJiTif4LAOcRRkpPD1F2Lz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20452218',5.7,3884,'fr','Gueules noires','1956, in the north of France. A group of underground miners is forced to take a professor to take samples a thousand meters underground. After a landslide that prevents them from going back up, they discover a crypt from another time, and unknowingly awaken a legendary bloodthirsty creature.','/x8hiMBkSpVaFQv35xUwNhPi07wK.jpg','2023-11-15',103,'Released','It should have stayed asleep.','The Deep Dark',976830,3.7176,5.8,'GLoziP_ujG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31986,_binary '\0','/g1wfg7MAXSURHE6a8iepZ7iZQqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20452454',7.4,5540,'hi','Binny and Family','Binny\'s life in London turns upside down when her grandparents visit her and try to insist living her life according to them. Binny and Family throws light on the widening generation gap and that neither generation are being able to understand the other one.','/lXmsRFM9Ih6yLu0jsxarTyAfWH3.jpg','2024-09-27',126,'Released','Every generation has its own story','Binny and Family',1341476,0.9706,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31987,_binary '\0','/bkMgiwBFnen4