 Still haunted by Betelgeuse, Lydia\'s life is turned upside down when her teenage daughter, Astrid, accidentally opens the portal to the Afterlife.','/kKgQzkUCnQmeTPkyIwHly2t6ZFI.jpg','2024-09-04',105,'Released','The ghost with the most is back.','Beetlejuice Beetlejuice',917496,20.9437,6.918,'As-vKW4ZboU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31996,_binary '\0','/w8JkEshUabXw6EPXtLgRtRrXQGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2049511',3.5,1929,'en','No Tell Motel','Dirty little secrets are exposed when five friends become stranded at an abandoned motel haunted by a dark secret of its own.','/nEsRMIZ2eIG26FTGFmlBQP7o3Rm.jpg','2012-10-09',83,'Released','Your Room Is Ready...','No Tell Motel',121071,1.9713,4.929,'8zJ9CJkBYfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31997,_binary '\0','/d3dDgrzE5DDR5vDe4qNbXmN57ey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2049543',5.4,11848,'en','Synchronicity','A daring physicist travels into the past to stop a mysterious woman from stealing his invention. But once there, he uncovers a surprising truth about the machine, the woman, and his own fractured reality.','/wGHoYDswvx96PVF43qFErVAnQHS.jpg','2015-07-22',101,'Released','To save his future he must alter his past.','Synchronicity',347945,2.3963,5.734,'E1el06Ic5Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31998,_binary '\0','/hNPqRhXKDjlzQG5zz4XDBigAlJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2049586',7.9,1823,'en','Glen Campbell: I\'ll Be Me','A documentary film detailing Glen Campbell\'s final tour and his struggle with Alzheimer\'s disease.','/fEyp8k5cIgochfpsD6tsYCkhhzS.jpg','2014-04-24',116,'Released','His music is legendary. His story is human.','Glen Campbell: I\'ll Be Me',285689,2.1991,7.6,'CC374jwyrkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(31999,_binary '\0','/6JYqLNj6Z8uCQyCvvtM3VhKzETy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2049630',4.9,2070,'en','Unfreedom','A Muslim fundamentalist in New York kidnaps a liberal Muslim scholar with intent to kill. A closeted lesbian in New Delhi kidnaps her activist bisexual lover with intent to marry. The resulting torture and violence evokes a brutal struggle of identities against unfreedom.','/4aVScKvEeY8i9Recn1LKTcOJZtq.jpg','2015-05-29',102,'Released',NULL,'Unfreedom',329864,1.7477,5.2,'varm8aIKiLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32000,_binary '\0','/8jujdLr4OAQoWGgfNmaE4RR0mqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20502488',5.7,9618,'en','Meet Me Next Christmas','On a quest to reconnect with the man of her dreams, Layla races across New York City to find a ticket to a sold-out Pentatonix Christmas Eve concert.','/tPRH0Rm00esNefnI1ZxQqTTIpzJ.jpg','2024-11-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Meet Me Next Christmas',1104171,3.7877,6.4,'QdGiO-zZC_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32001,_binary '\0','/1KWCgzjqu58fAudivh8qst7AY85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2050633',4.6,5071,'en','The Barrens','A man takes his family on a camping trip and becomes convinced they are being stalked by the legendary monster of the New Jersey Pine Barrens: the Jersey Devil.','/9dTbd20NEgsTDx5glF7dYYAKXKy.jpg','2012-09-28',97,'Released','The terrifying legend of the Jersey Devil is alive.','The Barrens',135368,2.7675,4.908,'bqMZl1p3mUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32002,_binary '\0','/nnGluGp4Bowcy7STdDAEScQcwzV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2051879',6.4,80103,'en','Europa Report','A crew travels to Europa, Jupiter’s icy moon, to investigate signs of life in its subsurface ocean, but disaster cuts them off from Earth, leading to a tense and dangerous exploration.','/tbsfaBjiAW5vfrV06R8KCOzVOYy.jpg','2013-06-27',90,'Released','Fear. Sacrifice. Contact.','Europa Report',174772,7.5401,6.3,'cbw9hlBnG74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32003,_binary '\0','/gVnjy4A3E5nJVKDhdw46VB5Pkz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2051894',5.9,3537,'en','Home Run','A pro ball player with a substance abuse problem is forced into rehab in his hometown, finding new hope when he gets honest about his checkered past, and takes on coaching duties for a misfit Little League team','/687pD1t23ptW7mxhA34ASLEaFrE.jpg','2013-04-19',114,'Released','Freedom is possible','Home Run',176124,2.5056,6.2,'Se3L51jHIos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32004,_binary '\0','/oqOfd2kd1DArXYHUhKxaGDTfyNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20519180',7.4,2188,'nl','De terugreis','Jaap and Maartje have been together almost 50 years. Grumpy old Jaap is no longer terribly interested in doing much, but Maartje, despite her occasional confusion, is still keen to embrace everything life has to offer. When the couple receive a letter from an old holiday friend, Maartje manages to convince her reluctant husband to visit him in Southern Europe. After many years, the pair get into their old car to embark once more on a journey through a completely changed Europe - bickering all the way, but also uncovering one memory after another. During their trip, Jaap reaches the painful conclusion that his wife is showing increasing signs of dementia. Realising that everything is about to change, they rediscover just what it is they love about each other.','/9VE2Z1fDFdx7vLh6RH0f5yidDVl.jpg','2024-03-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Memory Lane',1245874,0.9783,6.4,'pdvw2o5clk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32005,_binary '\0','/3NsjhcK8AW1MvNcpDDbPkaViUA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20519254',7,1537,'da','Når befrielsen kommer','When a folk high school is turned into an internment camp for German refugees, the headmaster couple Jakob and Lis and their children are thrust into an impossible situation. Should the family help the refugees — or stand firm in the Danish resistance against the Germans?','/hPnW1JMogaNrq84D9XOp1lU8fNg.jpg','2023-09-23',100,'Released','Humanity is a choice.','Before It Ends',1120543,2.1225,7,'pdF5L-IlPtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32006,_binary '\0','/eFWMlb1NR4hHu0RZAkhoTyBnl3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2051941',7,5050,'cs','Muži v naději','Charming bon vivant Rudolf is convinced that infidelity is the basis for a happy marriage, since, after all, a woman does not want to be bored with her partner.','/22rnwek6CG5FOwlR2ZJCgwojiAQ.jpg','2011-08-25',115,'Released',NULL,'Men in Hope',85621,3.4665,7.3,'Ds-vheDOqpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32007,_binary '\0','/9AC51QUyFL4XOEMeQjOYWGpy488.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2053352',7.5,1790,'en','Diana Vreeland: The Eye Has to Travel','This intimate and loving portrait of the legendary arbiter of fashion, art and culture illustrates the many stages of Vreeland\'s remarkable life. Born in Paris in 1903, she was to become New York\'s \"Empress of Fashion\" and a celebrated Vogue editor.','/6Dy44pmM7WER0TNMfR4jcPHNCKd.jpg','2012-09-21',86,'Released',NULL,'Diana Vreeland: The Eye Has to Travel',82639,1.6965,7,'f4Zxvsnwm_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32008,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2053378',4.2,1506,'fi','Juoppohullun päiväkirja','Juha Berg is a 30-year-old hopeless drunk in the Kallio neighborhood of Helsinki. Juha doesn\'t have the first intention of changing his way of life - just the opposite. He really enjoys sundry sexual relationships, adrenalin-inducing violence and, of course, alcohol for which he gets money even if by collecting bottles. But the hilarity in a drunken haze soon gets a run for its money as the passionate Juha falls in love with his AA group leader. The relationship with Tiina progresses quickly to dating and Juha has to make pivotal decisions. Juha has to begin balancing between maintaining a functional intimate relationship and his old lifestyle. Juha\'s best friend Kristian does his best to sabotage the relationship, and Juha\'s shaky decision to stay sober is further hindered by Mikael, an expert on German erotica. But how far can you go before there is only one solution left?','/nGUNVdinoN13SrIKpCd1S42rKR2.jpg','2012-12-28',84,'Released','a drop of booze wont kill you','Gloriously Wasted',149854,1.2896,4.3,'Tswotl4F06k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32009,_binary '\0','/diJhdx9Clpf68zs5TuxyOpHzNPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2053423',4.6,1726,'en','Revenge for Jolly!','Harry is having a very, very bad day. He returns home from an all-night drinking binge with his cousin Cecil, to discover that his little dog Jolly...Harry\'s one true love and the source of light in his dark, solitary life-has been murdered. Brokenhearted and beyond consolation, he vows to track down the dog\'s murderer at any cost. Armed with a stockpile of firepower in the trunk of his car, he and Cecil embark on a frenzied, alcohol-fueled wild-goose chase, leaving a bloody path of destruction in their wake.','/3LDh44NHhTa27TfO0ntWiilogKo.jpg','2012-07-17',85,'Released','Dog\'s best friend, man\'s worst enemy.','Revenge for Jolly!',192126,2.3706,4.6,'exPIwTobVhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32010,_binary '\0','/dmj6rictIMGfDbTv6pxeifyqs3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2053425',7.4,73312,'fr','De rouille et d\'os','Put in charge of his young son, Ali leaves Belgium for Antibes to live with his sister and her husband as a family. Ali\'s bond with Stephanie, a killer whale trainer, grows deeper after Stephanie suffers a horrible accident.','/6bcerd7CeQ5y5Dilym1O2C8c8Gl.jpg','2012-05-17',123,'Released',NULL,'Rust and Bone',97365,5.1103,7.2,'1u74RX6o-8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32011,_binary '\0','/gCTrUQMjcwUXiWUCAq4SGG6kUro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2053463',7,206878,'en','Side Effects','A woman turns to prescription medication as a way of handling her anxiety concerning her husband\'s upcoming release from prison.','/dk10bwGyj8aRdOTl3EkgATEefh2.jpg','2013-02-07',106,'Released','One pill can change your life.','Side Effects',109421,8.3731,6.615,'Qb7dv56xcM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32012,_binary '\0','/7OFw4NIC6RPQtKonm8kU6yR2VC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2054790',6.1,9943,'fr','Michael Kohlhaas','In the 16th century in the Cévennes, a horse dealer by the name of Michael Kohlhaas leads a happy and prosperous family life. When a lord treats him unjustly, this pious, upstanding man raises an army and puts the country to fire and sword in order to have his rights restored.','/hlLec0D9nq9TSv5OjbgqPqEDGKK.jpg','2013-08-14',122,'Released',NULL,'Age of Uprising: The Legend of Michael Kohlhaas',186971,2.5778,5.891,'uUQfZtiKu-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32013,_binary '\0','/5R8dNmfySR7OQKxeGcrg9hUj98O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2054808',7.3,2235,'sr','Шешир професора Косте Вујића','Professor Vujić\'s Hat (Serbian: Sesir profesora Koste Vujica) is a Serbian movie. The story was first presentet as a TV drama in 1972. The story of professor Kosta Vujić who in the mid-19th century taught an extraordinarily talented generation of gymnasium students, some of whom would go on to become prominent members of the Serbian society and eventually historically significant figures. They include Mihailo \"Mika Alas\" Petrović, Stevan Stojanović Mokranjac, Jovan Cvijić, and Jaša Prodanović.','/w5U33FkNS5exjaB4VznOxQz6WSi.jpg','2012-02-02',121,'Released',NULL,'Professor Kosta Vujic\'s Hat',110892,1.1507,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32014,_binary '\0','/m9D5TR0HdiyiG9njjpeJvxHmfZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2055709',5.6,6386,'en','Penthouse North','After losing her sight while working as a photojournalist in Afghanistan, Sara Frost, now reclusive, lives quietly in a New York penthouse with her boyfriend, until a smooth but sadistic criminal looking for a hidden fortune enters her life.','/kgRYyBsi8v1OOXkvTZQaDu3keIY.jpg','2013-04-17',85,'Released','Some secrets are better left unseen.','Penthouse North',199591,4.1798,5.798,'EUDM78fXvvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32015,_binary '\0','/rMrtoZfd0B0jDc1IW6r7MHELAtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2055765',5.8,13769,'en','The English Teacher','Small-town Pennsylvania schoolteacher Linda Sinclair balances her staid home life with an incredible passion for her subject. Then a former star pupil reenters her life after failing as a playwright in New York City. Seeing in his script the inspiration that she has always longed to instill in her students, this dyed-in-the-wool romantic enlists the help of long-suffering drama teacher Carl to mount the work as the high school’s next and riskiest production.','/mF14chZNzgDRZffs8Wk8lPwdNQA.jpg','2013-05-16',92,'Released','Refuse to live life by the book.','The English Teacher',174321,4.1207,5.6,'8fqAU3kYKWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32016,_binary '\0','/pgBUbWT8wA9CtTmnkLpaLnaczAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2055800',5.5,1517,'tr','Vücut','Leyla and her boyfriend Yilmaz are in the porn film sector for 25 years in Germany. A while ago, they moved to Istanbul and Yilmaz left her for another woman. Although they are separated, Yilmaz comes up with a last minute request: one last movie where Leyla meets 20 year old handsome but quite traumatic character Izzet. The age difference between Leyla and Izzet, unsolved problems of Izzet\'s chubby mother and sister, Yilmaz\'s passion to his work and its results all crash into each other in an unexpected way.','/jrDgv6lsfXZoGMMOcUX9giUuByf.jpg','2012-05-03',104,'Released',NULL,'Body',165071,2.3146,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32017,_binary '\0','/5cimjM66UN2ARoIkA0zKSkqKeXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20561114',4.5,2302,'en','Christmas on Mistletoe Farm','After inheriting a farm at Christmas time, a widowed father makes a bumpy adjustment to village life — while his kids hatch a plan to stay there forever.','/rGCwI76dylPViDF9VXFY0ORRhls.jpg','2022-11-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Christmas on Mistletoe Farm',1038627,3.4892,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32018,_binary '\0','/pERcOAR1Teg4sLDDqRXj1TBjVsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20561198',7.7,42288,'da','Bastarden','Denmark, 1755. Captain Ludvig Kahlen sets out to conquer a Danish heath reputed to be uncultivable, with an impossible goal: to establish a colony in the name of the king, in exchange for a royal title. A single-minded ambition that the ruthless lord of the region will relentlessly seek to put down. Kahlen\'s fate hangs in the balance: will his endevours bring him wealth and honour, or cost him his life...?','/okVwls2laPGOsLKKhXQCEiTBwpw.jpg','2023-10-05',127,'Released','A captain’s ambition, a ruthless rival, and a land that defies them both.','The Promised Land',980026,8.4942,7.7,'c9U1E9cC5is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32019,_binary '\0','/6ClN8j9O3EoSLh3cc5F3ZoWVoON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20562474',6.5,1601,'en','Groundswell','On the heels of a professional and personal setback, Atlanta chef Emma travels to Hawaii, where she meets Ben, a reclusive surf instructor.','/grTEghnEsv9NSWEDzcU3OrPINVk.jpg','2022-08-21',84,'Released','Find your heart on Hawaiian shores.','Groundswell',990009,2.3595,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32020,_binary '\0','/vqJEy4iCCqNK30zwNVwBweFm1UR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20567314',5.3,3958,'tr','Aaahh Belinda','A young actor\'s perfect life takes a madcap turn when she agrees to star in a commercial — and suddenly gets transported to her character\'s world.','/6MI2WO2ThKMz8LSdpxBvaIAt8FE.jpg','2023-04-07',96,'Released',NULL,'Oh Belinda',994751,2.5618,6.4,'IG51vmcDqns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32021,_binary '\0','/jXSu4omJTmGtyOJJzB0WFzEA08v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2056771',6.4,37025,'en','A Bigger Splash','An American couple, Paul and Marianne, spend their vacation in Italy and experience trouble when Marianne invites a former lover and his teenage daughter to visit, which leads to jealousy and dangerous sexual scenarios.','/hQ8vLJyws0tAYbBmzpTKbjdNHKI.jpg','2015-11-26',125,'Released','We\'re all obscene.','A Bigger Splash',324807,5.8797,6.1,'1mOVgI0-pb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32022,_binary '\0','/6HRo6TUVcb0x9Rzq3h8rURvZMzf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2057392',7.3,96795,'en','Eye in the Sky','A UK-based military officer in command of a top secret drone operation to capture terrorists in Kenya discovers the targets are planning a suicide bombing and the mission escalates from “capture” to “kill.” As American pilot Steve Watts is about to engage, a nine-year old girl enters the kill zone, triggering an international dispute reaching the highest levels of US and British government over the moral, political, and personal implications of modern warfare.','/faRGb9SuyGuZpsNRoIxoVSLLCId.jpg','2015-09-07',102,'Released','Welcome to the new front line','Eye in the Sky',333352,9.6298,6.997,'hOqeoj669xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32023,_binary '\0','/dyxKVcFzPPCM6kJxGfCU7oIUuzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2057441',6.9,4278,'hi','Mujhse Fraaandship Karoge','Two rival college students begin an unconventional online romance when they pretend to be each other\'s crushes on social media.','/oew8lhCSVVw44vttJ8vCFVdyfHn.jpg','2011-10-14',106,'Released',NULL,'Mujhse Fraaandship Karoge',78442,1.2045,6.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32024,_binary '\0','/vKFAsiwUwz5C7vgfHZXfpujVim4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2057920',3.7,1227,'en','It Watches','Andre, recovering from a recent accident, agrees to help his friend Robert by taking over a house sitting job at a creepy home nestled in the hills above Los Angeles. As night comes, the house reveals its insidious nature as Andre begins hearing ominous sounds and experiencing strange occurrences throughout the house that lead him to believe he is not alone, and that someone, or something is in the house with him.','/5TLHMLgCCkEszjpFzAwRjlgwS0E.jpg','2016-12-06',86,'Released','This House Can Kill','It Watches',425007,1.816,2.9,'DjqLwKVawLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32025,_binary '\0','/mtQQhtbrIPPqYFxH3lzBENHrvHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2057931',7.4,1568,'de','Der Verdingbub','Switzerland, 1955. The young orphan Max is sent as a foster child and contracted to work for the Bösiger family who lives on a farm. His foster parents treat him like a workhorse while their son seizes every opportunity to humiliate him. Playing the accordion is the one thing that is entirely his. But when the new teacher stands up for Max, it only makes a bad situation much worse. The only thing preserving his will to survive is his friendship with Berteli, who was also taken on to work at the farm. Max dreams of Argentina with her: a fantasy world, where allegedly even hayforks are made of silver.','/nuhHf1r5FgAVzdy6LnQoOVRn6Db.jpg','2011-11-03',103,'Released',NULL,'The Foster Boy',81556,1.1121,6.99,'E9Qv_XVJ-js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32026,_binary '\0','/qJNA7GOqwJj0pGeuHSWiMDdq3S9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2058107',7.1,44727,'en','The Railway Man','A victim from World War II\'s \"Death Railway\" sets out to find those responsible for his torture. A true story.','/yuADLCxGCA5rFWk2QDXvX5plBrD.jpg','2013-12-02',116,'Released','Revenge is never a straight line.','The Railway Man',127560,5.8265,6.8,'bbS_dYEwf2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32027,_binary '\0','/3zJnkABcx8xNsD22jYJXEShTjcg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2058673',5.3,69742,'en','Point Break','A young undercover FBI agent infiltrates a gang of thieves who share a common interest in extreme sports. A remake of the 1991 film, \"Point Break\".','/z7JOvw5Lqs9ezoFTJxmz3nx3av2.jpg','2015-12-03',114,'Released','Find your breaking point.','Point Break',257088,10.5142,5.955,'ncvFAm4kYCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32028,_binary '\0','/67WVW36tcLYnY2ONzbxh7gEfohh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2059171',6.3,42600,'en','13 Sins','Drowning in debt as he\'s about to get married, a bright but meek salesman receives a mysterious phone call informing him that he\'s on a hidden-camera game show where he must execute 13 tasks to receive a multi-million dollar cash prize.','/x4tC1s6oFG9nEyxVSM0FiIsLea1.jpg','2014-04-11',93,'Released','You don\'t play the game. It plays you.','13 Sins',155084,7.0278,6.3,'57DsUaFd9VU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32029,_binary '\0','/92MsvjpGoaiujgg6prkwmFvggoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2059255',7.4,27305,'es','No','In 1988, Chilean military dictator Augusto Pinochet, due to international pressure, is forced to call a plebiscite on his presidency. The country will vote ‘Yes’ or ‘No’ to Pinochet extending his rule for another eight years. Opposition leaders for the ‘No’ vote persuade a brash young advertising executive, René Saavedra, to spearhead their campaign. Against all odds, with scant resources and while under scrutiny by the despot’s minions, Saavedra and his team devise an audacious plan to win the election and set Chile free.','/Aqp4PH27zI4Uqqag41y2gXwmXma.jpg','2012-08-09',118,'Released','CHILE, HAPPINESS IS COMING!','No',110398,4.2087,7.2,'eMPNQzJF49E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32030,_binary '\0','/ryhPsBgcSE2IcsrYkEeF5plSb93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20597364',6.8,1305,'en','Suze','When her only daughter goes off to university, an empty nest mother gets stuck taking care of her daughter\'s heart-broken ex-boyfriend, who she can\'t stand.','/j1CBbkJGuWMjZw7jzxVa2wCDvSL.jpg','2025-02-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Suze',1039227,1.6065,7.5,'8cgc_te4qGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32031,_binary '\0','/A5IbRUILGjBjdWIkWBovGGtI1Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2060525',5.5,3188,'en','Manborg','The evil Count Draculon and his army of demons have conquered Earth, but a young soldier who lost his life in the first war against Hell has reawakened in the future as MANBORG! Together with a crew of post-apocalyptic rebels, the half-man half-machine hero will fight to defeat Draculon and take back the planet!','/IVoSzuN0JefEoTQRvEekKPCsbb.jpg','2011-10-25',70,'Released','Revenge is Back!','Manborg',53101,1.4104,4.9,'zhF6BLFBm9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32032,_binary '\0','/qknxyRgP6UTmwJ4B9tDAmzHMq7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2061702',7.8,25854,'ja','蛍火の杜へ','One hot summer day a little girl gets lost in an enchanted forest of the mountain god where spirits reside. A young boy appears before her, but she cannot touch him for fear of making him disappear. And so a wondrous adventure awaits...','/mDqzHV8UXWWNpZkoAbKmKX1ZxEE.jpg','2011-09-17',45,'Released',NULL,'Hotarubi no Mori e',92321,0.0066,8.3,'qXLSRH31Yao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32033,_binary '\0','/lDn2V2iFSvdG0dWPBGecm3yXQd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2061712',5.7,11027,'en','Interview with a Hitman','An elite hitman returns to erase his past only to find that somebody has messed with his future.','/5RitmzYivc4WTncMIlOsrgjKzcd.jpg','2012-07-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Interview with a Hitman',118737,3.01,5.2,'VtTTpUy6XiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32034,_binary '\0','/ysVQFb7FYNJ2ueQ9fyVGRfFTunb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2061756',6.7,2685,'en','Muhammad Ali\'s Greatest Fight','Muhammad Ali’s historic Supreme Court battle from behind closed doors. When Ali was drafted into the Vietnam War at the height of his boxing career, his claim to conscientious objector status led to a controversial legal battle that rattled the U.S. judicial system right up to the highest court in the land.','/w9Fbq2F6SysIV4N0woCqL65jwBN.jpg','2013-10-04',97,'Released','Some Fights Are Bigger Than The Ring','Muhammad Ali\'s Greatest Fight',196355,2.2782,6.4,'6Us7AQdPrcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32035,_binary '\0','/808Ibs0SLZBIgzpgdDrABxCI1qP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2061822',4.1,2503,'en','Devil Seed','Alexandra is a lively college student returning to live with her roommates Jessica and Breanne after the summer holidays. After a night of drinking, Alex agrees to a psychic reading to learn about her future with her boyfriend, Brian, but during the reading a dramatic turn of events causes SOMETHING to go drastically wrong. When Alex awakes the next day, she cant remember the events of the night before. She begins to hear creepy noises, hallucinate, black out and receive unidentifiable scratch marks all over her body. Afraid shes going crazy, she seeks help from her friends but Jessica, Breanne and Brian are incapable of comprehending the scope of the darkness descending UPON her. Instead, Alex receives help from a school professor and his father who have dealt with the supernatural before. But as Alexs condition worsens, it becomes apparent that it may already be too late to stop the entity from using Alexs body as a gateway into our world.','/zjrDE4agtUL3xGEVAlN0SkCjbuk.jpg','2012-05-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Devil Seed',119478,1.8246,4.6,'KBNdjbKamcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32036,_binary '\0','/y8heN9YdP7C5s099S7olky4hkOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2061869',4.7,2792,'ja','ゾンビアス','Wracked with guilt over her younger sister\'s suicide, pretty young karate student Megumi accompanies a group of older friends on a camping trip into the woods, where they\'re attacked by feces covered undead.','/sKJ1uRFB8eFUD40uVOqGl9MXAoY.jpg','2012-02-25',85,'Released','They Come in the Toilet','Zombie Ass: Toilet of the Dead',101733,4.1452,5.099,'BJImnJ-GD_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32037,_binary '\0','/I0RaCaMSKBOM4AlfkvTRyh6ZLG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062575',6.7,1226,'es','La vida precoz y breve de Sabina Rivas','In the Mexican-Guatemalan border, young teenage lovers, Sabina and Jovany, both Hondurans, accidentally meet again after some years without seeing each other. She plans to get to the United States and dreams about being a great singer; he commits all the required atrocities to be accepted by the gang: la Mara Salvatrucha. Sabina and Jovany crashed with the most adverse conditions at the border like white slavery, the Mexican and American migratory agents Burrona and Patrick, the brothel matron Doña Lita, Don Nico the Mexican Consul in Tecún Umán, the drug trafficking networks, the army and la Mara Salvatrucha.','/cxmJeBgPomHt43CNxcWk9UCDsB9.jpg','2012-11-09',115,'Released','To dream of the american dream is easy, but it is difficult to cross Mexico.','The Precocious and Brief Life of Sabina Rivas',142487,2.0052,7.2,'rq0u2h4bcgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32038,_binary '\0','/gHFkjsInQGhYkdvm9YUJveaDzzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062622',4.8,2165,'en','Postman Pat: The Movie','Like always, Postman Pat is happily going about his duty delivering letters and parcels around the fictional town of Greendale. One day, auditions for the TV talent show, \"You\'re the One\", are held in Greendale, which Pat manages to pass. With Pat required to be away from Greendale whilst participating in the contest, various Patbot 3000 robots are deployed to take Pat\'s postal duties. This soon turns out to be an evil plot to take over the world, which Pat must now stop.','/718nsLt48Pk6fvHG2huwKS9o2cn.jpg','2014-05-23',88,'Released','He’s about to deliver the goods.','Postman Pat: The Movie',245685,3.5414,5.1,'JpkXJF1u-RM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32039,_binary '\0','/nGOCNKg8IU76uXPPYnYbfB2YH1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062661',3.6,4225,'en','Tape 407','Survivors of an airplane crash find themselves within the borders of a government testing area and pursued by predators.','/spsy2Zn3F9ToDGXWQDHQnSWykFu.jpg','2012-04-27',90,'Released','The plane crash was just the beginning','Tape 407',92393,1.1421,3.8,'xBmDGVm-41U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32040,_binary '\0','/4fj9pWyIA3I2TxXXfXFRfIPbX0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062700',5.6,24479,'en','Song to Song','In this modern love story set against the Austin, Texas music scene, two entangled couples — struggling songwriters Faye and BV, and music mogul Cook and the waitress whom he ensnares — chase success through a rock ‘n’ roll landscape of seduction and betrayal.','/itmaNi14GyWguTOywZ0mMzyScW9.jpg','2017-03-17',129,'Released','Love. Obsession. Betrayal.','Song to Song',330947,5.6923,5.478,'O4SrVkj84zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32041,_binary '\0','/wbNU5HXNaDEZIOgxxO8Un4C1TkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062969',7,7623,'fr','L\'enfant d\'en haut','A drama set at a Swiss ski resort and centered on a boy who supports his sister by stealing from wealthy guests.','/lLxtv8TFBBGhDIZMVwziUJwrRZQ.jpg','2012-04-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Sister',102000,3.197,6.7,'QIw2ARdPGmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32042,_binary '\0','/eJIQeihNUsXb7ZY7NjAxZlp7wwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2062996',7.1,3717,'en','Something from Nothing: The Art of Rap','SOMETHING FROM NOTHING: THE ART OF RAP is a feature length performance documentary about the runaway juggernaut that is Rap music. At the wheel of this unstoppable beast is the film\'s director and interviewer Ice-T. Taking us on a deeply personal journey Ice-T uncovers how this music of the street has grown to dominate the world. Along the way Ice-T meets a whole spectrum of Hip-Hop talent, from founders, to new faces, to the global superstars like Eminem, Dr Dre, Snoop Dogg and Kanye West. He exposes the roots and history of Rap and then, through meeting many of its most famous protagonists, studies the living mechanism of the music to reveal \'The Art Of Rap\'. This extraordinary film features unique performances from the entire cast, without resorting to archive material, to build a fresh and surprising take on the phenomenon that is Rap.','/vXEZjHxxwaQqKnkE92paaXg5bV1.jpg','2012-06-15',106,'Released','Hip Hop didn\'t invent anything. Hip Hop reinvented everything','Something from Nothing: The Art of Rap',84342,1.9362,6.7,'2YqIp5PynOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32043,_binary '\0','/2xIdkizWSAQEpbCMR3VKfhgyx8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063008',5.6,1883,'tl','The Road','A 12 year old cold case is reopened when three teens are missing in an old abandoned road where a gruesome murder is left undiscovered for three decades.','/hOgRqrFBRguPaO6XdhGPB8ULD0a.jpg','2011-11-30',110,'Released','Nobody Leaves','The Road',97794,0.9968,5.3,'U4IVywGmjd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32044,_binary '\0','/cvN2G6PJ8R5r5G2pPYnsyiNXWMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063011',5.9,2831,'zh','逆戰','Agent Jon contemplates leaving the force until he learns his brother is working as a mercenary for a former colleague who betrayed their team.','/7J0SlFWcVFdErk5Vaax35xb19de.jpg','2012-01-19',122,'Released',NULL,'The Viral Factor',83706,2.0004,5.82,'aWzbWMt-l1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32045,_binary '\0','/kabcborEykobWskmLtN8XNRod8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063013',5.5,2223,'zh','铜雀台','In his old age, Cao Cao assesses his former military tactics, love, and relationship with his son.','/iflthXJoh1jDND6CWCrEAG9JgwT.jpg','2012-09-26',107,'Released',NULL,'The Assassins',136701,3.0407,5.762,'OW_7okST6iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32046,_binary '\0','/t7M5WfJVnjzUuhJkz54Izo2Yf8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063666',6.2,6767,'en','Hello I Must Be Going','An affair with a 19-year old actor helps reinvigorate life for thirty-something Amy after she moves home to her parents’ house following her divorce.','/p1LzTkVUB9nMPumPan2WchqtKKE.jpg','2012-09-07',95,'Released','*Meet Amy Minsky. She\'s just getting over her divorce.','Hello I Must Be Going',84281,2.5133,5.9,'NSgZ5ERvoCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32047,_binary '\0','/dJ8xrTmjRhCoPKJ5Z3qODsel6qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063745',7.3,1975,'hi','Kya Dilli Kya Lahore','In 1948, a cross-fire erupts at an isolated stretch of Indo-Pak border, leaving only two soldiers alive. One is an Indian soldier of Pakistani origin while the other happens to be a Pakistani soldier of Indian origin. An ironic story of pride and survival begins when - in an attempt to evade danger, they bump into each other. And amidst continuous exchange of bullets, altercations and murkier situations, it evolves into a journey of human connection with an unforeseeable end.','/4q9fNNQj9lKhTfbeaXegXybYbxx.jpg','2014-05-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Kya Dilli Kya Lahore',268534,1.2442,7.5,'Oy96lq-Nhx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32048,_binary '\0','/5rdtiEBC6znvGr5ep2TfeqI1JCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063781',6.7,18580,'en','Smashed','Kate and Charlie like to have a good time. Their marriage thrives on a shared fondness for music, laughter… and getting smashed. When Kate’s partying spirals into hard-core asocial behavior, compromising her job as an elementary schoolteacher, something’s got to give. But change isn’t exactly a cakewalk. Sobriety means she will have to confront the lies she’s been spinning at work, her troubling relationship with her mother, and the nature of her bond with Charlie.','/d4b2k3bB5C6AC9s3FFZhjZw7rB1.jpg','2012-01-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Smashed',84341,3.0871,6.463,'n1J1IKeqAoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32049,_binary '\0','/1nF5id9N7kaLzWtu6tnHzeD5f0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063782',6.3,2924,'th','ลัดดาแลนด์','A family moves into a neighborhood where they encounter a series of terrifying paranormal events that lead them to the edge of sanity.','/vt6WwZTgWoyr4dAFNuoK2NXhidK.jpg','2011-04-28',117,'Released','Would you stay or move out if your village had ghost?','Laddaland',64215,1.8433,6.4,'9a6aoRI2eO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32050,_binary '\0','/nZLnhGL3Zgus2LjvbBGiCNx6Py3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2063834',6.7,2964,'en','Thrive: What on Earth Will it Take?','An unconventional documentary that lifts the veil on what\'s really going on in our world by following the money upstream - uncovering the global consolidation of power in nearly every aspect of our lives. Weaving together breakthroughs in science, consciousness and activism, THRIVE offers real solutions, empowering us with unprecedented and bold strategies for reclaiming our lives and our future.','/A8TQcGsSg9BSAq2YGiYlFzBcSJ3.jpg','2011-11-11',132,'Released','The world is waking up.','Thrive: What on Earth Will it Take?',80169,1.2933,5.8,'OibqdwHyZxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32051,_binary '\0','/gbsFT8oASldg1irE95cNwhPLboq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2064713',7.5,4179,'en','A Band Called Death','Before Bad Brains, the Sex Pistols or even the Ramones, there was Death. Formed in the early \'70s by three teenage brothers from Detroit, Death is credited as being the first black punk band, and the Hackney brothers, David, Bobby, and Dannis, are now considered pioneers in their field. But it wasn’t until recently — when a dusty 1974 demo tape made its way out of Bobby’s attic nearly 30 years after Death’s heyday — that anyone outside a small group of punk enthusiasts had even heard of them.','/xYjNtz5JvUnkxRFDJ3rNAjzTt21.jpg','2013-06-27',96,'Released','This Band was Punk, before Punk was Punk','A Band Called Death',137563,1.892,7.2,'hAcLnf6Tx_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32052,_binary '\0','/f6ovBHZPmT2qi3oMwGOONuJeuqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2064816',4.7,2133,'hi','I, Me aur Main','As Ishaan, a music producer who takes advantage of the women in his life, feels a connection with Gauri, his new next-door neighbor, he begins to learn the importance of friendship - causing him to work to repair his relationships.','/c0L7Rke5Rm86CCiSkuR4sSOnCiX.jpg','2013-03-01',108,'Released',NULL,'I, Me aur Main',171767,1.4012,4.6,'lo9v0__LxLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32053,_binary '\0','/9wIiokFu12WgrEH44qWpmhFfmkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2064849',5.6,3900,'hi','London, Paris, New York','London Paris New York is a film that captures the angst of the twenties, the most dramatic period of one\'s life - when you have to find a career, you have your first significant relationship and most importantly form your identity in this world. This is story about Lalitha, a middle class south Indian girl from Chembur (an eastern suburb in Mumbai) who is on her way to New York to study politics with full scholarship, and Nikhil, a Punjabi, rich kid from Bandra (a posh western suburb of Mumbai) who is going to study Film Making in London on 100% dad\'s money. They decide to hangout together one evening in London and find that they are completely drawn to each other even as their future lies on separate continents. The film follows their personal journey and their love story as they meet in London, Paris and New York for a night each over eight years. The film is in three chapters and each chapter is shot in a manner that mirrors the mental state of Nikhil and Lalitha.','/n5wd8rEmSxlZpvfsu7vVblBHtdJ.jpg','2012-03-02',100,'Released','3 days... Infinite moments...','London, Paris, New York',85047,1.235,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32054,_binary '\0','/4YA27hPiubhlVIxVtfzbWXLqC7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2064968',5.4,14374,'en','The Longest Week','Left broke and homeless by his wealthy parents\' divorce, a young man moves in with an old friend and finally meets the woman of his dreams -- only to discover she\'s already dating his friend.','/nXWsjQefKVsJdQQsu5NZT1Zk1rv.jpg','2014-09-05',86,'Released','She had him at “I\'m your best friend\'s girlfriend”','The Longest Week',206821,3.7675,5.1,'Qwu51SYfQQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32055,_binary '\0','/1Q1UpxGl4UgjYntlkQG2Lq20mf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2065877',6.8,1328,'en','Apostle Peter and the Last Supper','The film portrays Saint Peter reflecting on his time with Jesus and his fellow Apostles during his final imprisonment in Rome. In particular, Peter attempts to convert one of his jailers, Martinian, by relating the life, teachings, and sacrifice of Jesus.','/2axHjxvFO67WNqBPkO3GE1GWYZt.jpg','2013-02-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Apostle Peter and the Last Supper',127770,1.7042,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32056,_binary '\0','/dYU9zV8sauJMVmAvefSw7Rn2wef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2065924',7.8,2479,'ta','எங்கேயும் எப்போதும்','Two buses collide, with tragic results. We see the past of four passengers: Amudha, a village girl visiting Chennai for the first time, falls in love with Gautham, a stranger, who shows her around the city. And then there\'s Kathiresan, a metal worker, who\'s infatuated by Manimegalai, a nurse.','/ybuL8UIIQ1SOTz3CILzCuCBeA5E.jpg','2011-09-16',138,'Released',NULL,'Engaeyum Eppothum',79354,1.1977,7.242,'rUQfYWxeQGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32057,_binary '\0','/isnJGDrfR9dIrHMsPTvHtJaGEpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2066051',7.3,212076,'en','Rocketman','The story of Elton John\'s life, from his years as a prodigy at the Royal Academy of Music through his influential and enduring musical partnership with Bernie Taupin.','/f4FF18ia7yTvHf2izNrHqBmgH8U.jpg','2019-05-17',121,'Released','Based on a true fantasy.','Rocketman',504608,8.0292,7.311,'S3vO8E2e6G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32058,_binary '\0','/AmPGmrldZEFMHdZ7BNm8r1IL09S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2066176',7.4,6843,'en','Any Day Now','In the late 1970s, when a mentally handicapped teenager is abandoned, a gay couple takes him in and becomes the family he\'s never had. But once the unconventional living arrangement is discovered by authorities, the men must fight the legal system to adopt the child.','/e5C1J8mKX4aHy6GOczK6iTwqodP.jpg','2012-12-14',97,'Released','They made him a promise. He made them a family.','Any Day Now',105526,2.5782,6.973,'i0rSiPU4Yqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32059,_binary '\0','/2tD6lbeSHx0sYDsu0BoS2d1qrbZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20672356',6.8,4255,'hu','Semmelweis','Set in 19th century Vienna, Ignac Semmelweis, a short-tempered but passionate doctor, delivers babies and carries out autopsies on a daily basis while looking for the cause of puerperal fever, the mysterious epidemic that decimates patients in the hospital.','/ol6lDiWvWIDZsElj2sfBwQF9IBJ.jpg','2023-11-30',127,'Released','He saw the invisible, he did the impossible','Semmelweis',1016683,1.4475,7.8,'2rQWibxbImQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32060,_binary '\0','/vYDWXhE5ppOmr6xcMwUEtWd1dm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20672490',5,6070,'en','American Carnage','After a governor issues an executive order to arrest the children of undocumented immigrants, the detained youth are offered an opportunity to have their charges dropped by volunteering to provide care to the elderly. Once inside the elder care facility, however, they discover more twisted secrets than they could have possibly imagined.','/zQmwQqtT2KEfg5IO5u8lexZoCAR.jpg','2022-07-15',101,'Released','No one escapes the daily grind.','American Carnage',982752,5.229,5.8,'6tkqLPCg7x0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32061,_binary '\0','/bD8ftQIovUjCAIA6OVVuquHtLWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20672534',5.5,8508,'ja','ゾン100～ゾンビになるまでにしたい100のこと～','Bullied by his boss, worked around the clock, he\'s nothing more than a corporate drone. All it takes is a zombie outbreak for him to finally feel alive!','/kD35dB3KOHrLo1Y3RU5xXJ1hI7.jpg','2023-08-03',129,'Released','When zombies flooded the town, a bright light shined into my dark life!','Zom 100: Bucket List of the Dead',1070514,4.7572,6.5,'yhbWaJaYDiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32062,_binary '\0','/aD9A7xpkemoJQCKTp6IFBysKb6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20674118',5.7,1243,'no','Munch','Edvard Munch was one of the most important artists in the period between the 19th and 20th centuries. His motif Skrik (The Scream), repeated in several techniques, became part of the 20th-century world subconsciousness – an image of fear and loneliness most people probably know, even if they have no idea who created it.','/f5yypQ94MDn4Y2LOqTvQxiC3Fqr.jpg','2023-01-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Munch',998845,1.3997,6.6,'C18B10A6OoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32063,_binary '\0','/CAHXqaYzjyf6F6cqgvUb7mw7Tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20674132',5.1,1533,'en','Birdeater','A bride-to-be is invited to her own fiancé\'s bachelor party, but when uncomfortable details about their relationship are exposed, the night takes a feral turn.','/yhfIkmknvFXD68RsSUmbs27Ia7V.jpg','2024-07-18',115,'Released','Just a quiet one.','Birdeater',1114137,1.7691,5.4,'8AnVKhZIZRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32064,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20674378',3.1,2137,'en','Clinic','A single mother decides to get a Brazilian Butt Lift against professional opinion.','/6kVkzh8t3Oc8hRkLXPifjji8gjL.jpg','2023-09-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Clinic',1202958,0.6897,2.2,'FSCdKCKnmrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32065,_binary '\0','/rSSkBESBW7HRDBtBKAW0dFOROvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2069100',7.4,8456,'mk','Трето полувреме','Spitz is the German-Jewish coach of the football team Macedonia during World War II. Under his leadership, the team fights to become the champion of Bulgaria\'s National Football League','/8duugici2uS3hl6mmzljvcv5i16.jpg','2012-09-27',113,'Released',NULL,'The Third Half',136743,1.6004,6.5,'UJbt4oIBP7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32066,_binary '\0','/l2mtlw6Te6HvfcQAogsBYyxDmA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2069715',6.2,5251,'tr','Anadolu Kartalları','Onur, Ayşe, Mustafa, Tunç ve Fatih. Onlar, gökyüzüne hakim birer pilot olma hayaliyle yaşayan genç havacılar. Hayalleri yükseklerde fakat hedefe giderken yaşadıkları bin türlü zorluk, aile, sevgili hasreti, dostlukları, havada olmak için yaptıkları fedakarlıklar ve birbirleriyle rekabetleri ne kadar çetin bir yola çıktıklarının da göstergesi olacak. Binbaşı Kemal Tanaçan\'ın deneyimi ve desteği sayesinde eğitimden geçen beş genç için Uluslararası Anadolu Kartalı Tatbikatı, hayatlarını tamamen değiştirecek çok büyük bir deneyim olacaktır..','/keovFHBEEJNOoBppsTvP5YvG6mO.jpg','2011-10-28',120,'Released','Vatan kanatlarımızın altında','Anatolian Eagles',77862,1.1781,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32067,_binary '\0','/gpWErHeuasppId2voOWkSDb4bzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2069797',5.7,12352,'en','Delirium','A man recently released from a mental institute inherits a mansion after his parents die. After a series of disturbing events, he comes to believe it is haunted.','/j2jIkjrASnjtwCmCNDwh9LDWvq9.jpg','2018-05-10',96,'Released','It\'s all in your head','Delirium',340601,4.0061,5.736,'hlzjZAHZ4H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32068,_binary '\0','/uC91Lq13znWNxg4Khwo6TQ6w6Bl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2069935',3.7,3365,'tr','Sümela\'nın Şifresi: Temel',NULL,'/3UKLquWYDv7kfWr7ZdgUjv25mkM.jpg','2011-12-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Sümela\'nın Şifresi: Temel',87328,1.5028,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32069,_binary '\0','/s5inFkaGhp5ceo0uTxTjAvFehlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2069955',4.2,2057,'en','Border Run','A female American reporter searches for her missing brother against the backdrop of violence and human smuggling across the US/Mexican border.','/anA1Musyha2EmgiW9m4FXOFMX3d.jpg','2012-10-12',96,'Released','Trust no one','Border Run',146955,2.6253,5.6,'HC4dvVNv6mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32070,_binary '\0','/y8CGiAYo2E6Ld82FvNvwRwr8937.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2070597',6.2,1855,'en','纽约客@上海','When ambitious New York attorney Sam is sent to Shanghai on assignment, he immediately stumbles into a legal mess that could end his career. With the help of a beautiful relocation specialist, a well-connected old-timer, a clever journalist, and a street-smart legal assistant, Sam might just save his job, find romance, and learn to appreciate the beauty and wonders of Shanghai.','/2a1q1RTxspKxGWbGKVpXFzl6MbV.jpg','2012-05-03',98,'Released','A New Yorker in Shanghai','Shanghai Calling',126186,2.0342,6.3,'xKjBRWh5RdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32071,_binary '\0','/aoUD4d5urXCSpziPqv2Mv0GrLZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2070604',4.9,1248,'en','April Apocalypse','Artie is pure bred trailer trash. He has zero ambition, is everyone\'s favorite punching back at school and bears the burden of his virginity in silence. And then April moves out of the state. She\'s his best friend and support since kindergarten and the love of his life. Three years later Artie finally has the courage to take to the road and go see April to tell her how he feels about her. One car-crash later Artie wakes up in the middle of the zombie apocalypse. But this time he\'s not going to hide. Artie\'s love for April doesn\'t give him wings, but does give him the courage to hack, slash, punch and kick himself a part towards the girl he loves. Time is of the essence, because that bite on his hand will make the difference between a French kiss and a bite out of April\'s brains.','/A9FB6gCQLpTKQFtI4SCSQbSeA0q.jpg','2013-10-12',84,'Released','Nothing\'s sicker than love, not even The Dead','April Apocalypse',270064,2.0153,6,'2iLk-icOeDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32072,_binary '\0','/3xTS1lDlbpwg63slWSMeHdamOS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2070649',8,28367,'ko','도가니','Based on actual events that took place at Gwangju Inhwa School for the hearing-impaired, where young deaf students were the victims of repeated sexual assaults by faculty members over a period of five years in the early 2000s.','/mbMp0oIFmYnw0i5gzRoKt8cH5ve.jpg','2011-09-22',125,'Released','The hideous truth, concealed far too long.','Silenced',81481,5.7191,8.2,'SSZh4qb8ybs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32073,_binary '\0','/cTEQbm8JCHm5Ro13CcE4xDt6nTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2070776',6.8,13253,'fr','Populaire','An insurance agent and his new secretary become locked in the grip of romance and competition as they train together for a speed-typing contest.','/4d4a0uDl8tI4EoIjYEyU54Xpkzu.jpg','2012-11-27',111,'Released','A comedy that strikes all the right keys.','Populaire',136403,3.486,6.601,'i6upoz9I7eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32074,_binary '\0','/hupSDY6YrkYu58NKrStQxXC2525.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2070862',5,12768,'en','Temptation: Confessions of a Marriage Counselor','Judith has known her husband Brice since they were children, but now their marriage is growing stale. Having just completed her graduate work in psychotherapy, she\'s eager to begin a career as a marriage counselor. She takes an internship at a matchmaking firm for millionaires and meets Harley, a charismatic billionaire investor who makes no effort to hide his attraction to Judith. Although quite resistant at first, eventually Judith succumbs to his charms, placing her marriage in jeopardy and forever altering the course of her life.','/22hclz5NzRKyWb81TjO1yx1Wn4w.jpg','2013-03-29',111,'Released','Betrayal burns forever.','Temptation: Confessions of a Marriage Counselor',97006,3.3263,6.7,'xJAyyNUIqcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32075,_binary '\0','/uLuy3yMcD4WFkzHZe1ugLbJWX9Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071441',6,2166,'zh','危險關係','Dangerous Liaisons is a Chinese film by Hur Jin-ho based on the novel with the same title by Pierre Choderlos de Laclos.','/zdwWWN5kJIXC0tnto4DkCOB3MAR.jpg','2012-09-27',110,'Released','some sin is beautiful.','Dangerous Liaisons',121602,2.4678,6,'mN4Ald5BfTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32076,_binary '\0','/b4tQEgWzRmrOCjJkG0RO0hgCQ16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071491',1.5,5295,'en','Jurassic Shark','When an oil company unwittingly unleashes a prehistoric shark from its icy prison, the Jurassic killer maroons a group of art thieves and a group of college students on an abandoned island','/kl0e1dthiBM3B3jADe50d29N043.jpg','2012-09-21',78,'Released','Dinosaur from the deep','Jurassic Shark',120846,1.2443,2.5,'oehW-BRnbNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32077,_binary '\0','/eWxbzr7FdvlNAXBhpAeLwUh05OS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071550',6.1,32986,'en','Open Grave','A man awakes -- without memory -- in a pit full of bodies and must figure out if the people who rescued him are the killers, or if he is the murderer.','/tgXcICQjS3aEbxCYgYMroBXyJGn.jpg','2013-08-13',102,'Released','The moment you wake up, the nightmare begins.','Open Grave',215830,3.3929,6,'WRhZJ4M9E5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32078,_binary '\0','/l2DWN9SKH5oVAJREcGcCRY4JfEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071571',4.1,2595,'en','Scarecrow','For generations, it was an urban legend that lived in the nightmares of children. Now, the season to rejuvenate the tale will revive a town\'s darkest fears. With the Scarecrow Festival on the horizon, school teacher Aaron Harris is doling out punishment for six students serving detention. Their task: help Aaron\'s girlfriend Amanda fix her family farm before it\'s sold. But the cornfields circling the farm come with a legend and Tyler takes macabre delight in recounting the tale: It never sleeps, it never dies, it can\'t be stopped, hear their cries.','/2FNlOE060DyeT3T5hcR133lYebv.jpg','2013-10-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Scarecrow',226948,2.09,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32079,_binary '\0','/iByv5K0Msg8iiBlVeR1RqCa04Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071590',5.9,2039,'en','Spinning Gold','A biopic of 1970s record producer Neil Bogart, co-founder of Casablanca Records.','/pbCxv1KcdJhpzxCFsfHA3Tq9jtm.jpg','2023-03-31',137,'Released','To make hit records, Casablanca Records broke every rule','Spinning Gold',326316,4.8016,5.5,'15dUFSz3-wc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32080,_binary '\0','/uCZgvuc1ONSoyMQ0AB5OWmprvv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071613',7.2,12646,'te','బిజినెస్ మాన్','Just as the cops have declared the end of Mafia in Mumbai, a man named Surya arrives in the city with the intentions of conquering it.','/hLF5o53irg0ZVV4ecLptkLgiTXq.jpg','2012-01-13',133,'Released','Guns Don\'t Need Agreements','Businessman',83889,1.7903,7.109,'xo_ZUn99wQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32081,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071620',6.9,1554,'he','The Flat','The flat on the third floor of a Bauhaus building in Tel Aviv was where my grandparents lived since they immigrated to Palestine in the 1930s. Were it not for the view from the windows, one might have thought that the flat was in Berlin. When my grandmother passed away at the age of 98 we were called to the flat to clear out what was left. Objects, pictures, letters and documents awaited us, revealing traces of a troubled and unknown past. The film begins with the emptying out of a flat and develops into a riveting adventure, involving unexpected national interests, a friendship that crosses enemy lines, and deeply repressed family emotions. And even reveals some secrets that should have probably remained untold...','/5OjMfOPDMzXWnJUzSK1UYRZg1RI.jpg','2011-07-11',97,'Released',NULL,'The Flat',116466,1.8166,6.4,'Z94u_5qLxXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32082,_binary '\0','/5uEuSlV8y9ThgBerewYsm5ZlwEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2071648',4.3,1338,'en','Vampire Dog','Ace, a 12-year-old boy is new in middle school. His grandfather from Transylvania passes away at the ripe age of 99, and sends him his dog, Fang, to look after. Ace soon discovers that Fang is a vampire dog. Professor Warhol, a mad scientist and her bumbling assistant Frank, try to capture Fang to steal his DNA, in order to look young.','/jXOEngAOBUOnCtWmjHB1rrGBsas.jpg','2012-09-25',91,'Released','All Bark... and No Bite!','Vampire Dog',134415,1.6863,5.1,'BV1fiNgq-D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32083,_binary '\0','/4gqr9cHhQaDsZsN7DQL9CLFzmZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072029',4,1354,'en','7 Nights Of Darkness','In 2010 six reality television show contestants spent seven nights in an abandoned and haunted asylum. The show never aired but an editor for the network was able to piece together some footage. The prize for staying all seven nights was a share of one million dollars that was to be split amongst any contestants that didn\'t leave. No prize money was ever awarded.','/waC7zI1fqjmZo9C0NvUQTUnYo4I.jpg','2011-11-08',90,'Released',NULL,'7 Nights Of Darkness',83473,1.2501,4,'uLQzePHe34k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32084,_binary '\0','/unC4BwtTTTetd03lmgMolGrBf1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072045',5.8,6704,'en','Are All Men Pedophiles?','We live in a society that both condemns pedophiles and sexualizes young girls. The film explores the many dangers children face and exposes the systematic violation of children rights by societies, presenting the testimony of both victims and perpetrators. It also looks at how the pedophilia hysteria that has led to the mass incarceration adults and children.','/cQ2ZQEv0nbiOSLJikc224JmCVRM.jpg','2013-03-01',70,'Released','There are two sides to every story.','Are All Men Pedophiles?',142573,1.9105,5.2,'oINFeGsyxBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32085,_binary '\0','/6e4aobelFez3PYtRa1q6OS9cR7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20721318',5.7,1322,'ru','Холоп 2','Grigory, the son of an oligarch, is fully rehabilitated after his humbling experience as a 19th-century serf. Moreover, he develops a strong sense of moral justice. When he meets a pampered young socialite named Katya, he is abhorred by her insolent escapades. Grigory transports Katya “back in time” to teach her a valuable lesson about humility.','/8wGPQIMhyB1hfGbURsbqezObvS1.jpg','2024-01-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Son of a Rich 2',1004096,1.696,6.323,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32086,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072145',6.1,1286,'fi','Kulman pojat','A buddy comedy about a fanatic small town football supporter who falls in love with a perfect girl, only to notice that his dream-girl supports the wrong football team. Now he has to befriend the enemy or forget the girl he loves.','/p0QSPBxDBpPsmFucKGA6krtC1nE.jpg','2012-02-24',84,'Released',NULL,'Fanatics',90645,1.4866,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32087,_binary '\0','/q18kiShd6TP529xlflUvvL284vJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072167',7.7,4744,'ta','மயக்கம் என்ன','Karthik is a freelance photographer with big dreams of becoming a famous wildlife photographer, but faces constant struggle in advancing his career. When Karthik’s close friend Sundar introduces his girlfriend Yamini to their group, they can\'t stand each other initially, but there lies the twist, when opposites attract.','/szikIRSbIApMeVbdcTKIEK5UpZb.jpg','2011-11-25',145,'Released','Follow your heart','Mayakkam Enna',76976,1.1164,6.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32088,_binary '\0','/wle8YjQAHKnxCkUi3imd06FUTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072220',6.3,3029,'zh','忠烈楊家將','When a rival nation sends troops to invade the Song Dynasty, the emperor sends general Yang Ye (Adam Cheng) to defend the nation. However, Yang\'s place in the court is shaky due to a feud with Pan Renmei caused by the accidental death of his son at the hands of one of Yang\'s sons. At the battle, Yang is abandoned by Pan\'s troops, leaving him trapped in the face of an attack by Yeli Yuan (Shao Bing), an enemy general who wants to kill Yang to avenge his father. After learning about their father\'s predicament, Yang Ye\'s seven sons set out to rescue their father at any cost.','/aOaXWW8ihwrSqYtSJdz77IeAVbk.jpg','2013-04-03',102,'Released',NULL,'Saving General Yang',181009,3.0859,6.36,'fbB0xOqY2V8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32089,_binary '\0','/hkkbP02FiHJRCv9UOhBz3r5lVHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072227',7.2,11366,'hi','शंघाई','Prime leader of a campaign against a big government project is killed in what appears to be a road accident. An IAS officer is ordered to probe the incident and the veils of falsehood begin to drop.','/i1SwP8KqOIKtu5V2i2IjXNm2dVy.jpg','2012-06-08',120,'Released',NULL,'Shanghai',100681,1.4577,6.771,'eGGPX8BsibM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32090,_binary '\0','/jJWNm6KaAQbwwKrOcmPDAZaIf21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072230',5,16686,'ja','進撃の巨人 ATTACK ON TITAN','100 years ago, titans suddenly appeared on Earth. Soon, human civilization veered on collapse due to the titans. Humans then built a giant wall to defend themselves. Within the giant walls, humans lived in peace, but, 100 years later, the giant wall is broken.','/ihK3jUDlcQBMEObbLwSswqpiy3Z.jpg','2015-08-01',98,'Released','The face of humanity\'s extinction.','Attack on Titan',295830,8.3012,6.14,'InF16sp7J0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32091,_binary '\0','/9VEOQvCnd8T8wILgyqjKgyhALw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072233',5.6,36741,'en','Sleepless','Undercover Las Vegas police officer Vincent Downs, who has a lot of enemies, is caught in a high stakes web of corrupt cops and the mob-controlled casino underground. When a heist goes wrong, a crew of homicidal gangsters kidnap Downs’ teenage son T. In one sleepless night, Downs will have to rescue his son, evade an internal affairs investigation, and bring the kidnappers to justice.','/9WkUSY33MDPGmz0vtzbsfaxTHVa.jpg','2017-01-12',95,'Released','They Got T.','Sleepless',324542,5.3918,5.939,'dA7JW9Zj2-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32092,_binary '\0','/nrgBPzYygw9f7FZR7j5rb4VKMEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072241',6.2,1318,'sv','Stockholm Östra','Stockholm East is the love story between two strangers, bound together by a tragedy that has taken its toll on both their lives and relationships. When Johan and Anna meet at the railway station connecting Stockholm with the idyllic suburbs where they both live, they embark on a dangerous journey of passion and lies.','/k9CqZrnAWWldvgKAmvzyew4ouZP.jpg','2011-10-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Stockholm East',86983,2.1933,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32093,_binary '\0','/4z6k3BuINspRCVEQT5vg2RBj29m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20724154',6.6,1553,'en','Hidden Gems','While prepping for her sister’s wedding, Addie loses her grandmother’s ring in the waters of Hawaii. She hires dive instructor Jack to search for her lost treasure. They immediately clash with each other when Addie insists she go on the pursuit with Jack. Once they come to an agreement, Jack ends up serving as Addie’s tour guide of the island’s hidden gems.','/vgcxiduPt1siWT5E2QnQDZGNExF.jpg','2022-06-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Hidden Gems',970895,1.4106,6.3,'ahbKa5_HKgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32094,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20724796',7.3,3482,'te','కిరోసిన్',NULL,'/cRBsjCexmjaulXs77BrscA0OcO4.jpg','2022-06-17',120,'Released','A Burnt Truth','Kerosene',982182,1.1871,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32095,_binary '\0','/c0tZsK1WouPqKIgREuTcjDuy5K0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20729172',6.4,2010,'en','Hoard','The story follows Maria – a teenager whose mother used to be a hoarder. Now (set in the 90s) she lives in a foster home where a previous resident, Michael, inspires her to revisit the childhood memories and passions that she has repressed.','/81VQOyGSnyMxE2SWf0bgnHAAKeT.jpg','2024-05-17',126,'Released',NULL,'Hoard',996087,1.9608,6.9,'5mYoshmw1uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32096,_binary '\0','/mGsVAfnZSTeAm2ny9FSjSrXx9xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072933',5.6,5755,'en','Cottage Country','When Todd takes his girlfriend Cammie up to the family cottage for a reclusive proposal, the last thing he expected to be doing was dealing with was his slacker brother and his hippie girlfriend. But in this comedy of errors, Todd and Cammie, have to deal with his accidentally murdered brother in order to live happily ever after.','/nbUTgFg6zJ1j47irmiivsDEI2rU.jpg','2013-03-13',91,'Released','They aren\'t going to let a little blood spoil their weekend','Cottage Country',141733,2.372,5.4,'AouydGmX_NQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32097,_binary '\0','/rNuVltH8EeUKrbVlQyxNDtAG5z1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2072962',6.8,2207,'ko','의뢰인','Kang Seong-hee, a famous lawyer, takes up a case wherein he has to defend a man who is the main suspect in his wife\'s death. However, a formidable public attorney tries to test his mettle in court.','/lAJ9csveLoNmgarN7lrz3ylETgH.jpg','2011-09-29',123,'Released','They find justice of their own.','The Client',81242,2.0301,6.882,'SPEBP0qdpSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32098,_binary '\0','/lgAyykepbeHrHHBzxdKHgR2qRA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073016',7.3,3920,'fr','Le Fils de l\'autre','Two young men, one Israeli and one Palestinian, discover they were accidentally switched at birth.','/sOKYfoBrDjysNdafStBwvlXTWCT.jpg','2012-04-04',105,'Released',NULL,'The Other Son',125623,2.0381,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32099,_binary '\0','/4a1vA2zntOk9gPq95KJpsYCifJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073029',7.8,6749,'en','Marina Abramović: The Artist Is Present','Performance artist Marina Abramovic prepares for a major retrospective of her work at the Museum of Modern Art in New York.','/6CbjWJpB4TowXNXykRoUzqvyfVH.jpg','2012-06-13',106,'Released','The hardest thing is to do something which is close to nothing.','Marina Abramović: The Artist Is Present',84309,3.0783,7.3,'HvcQ39OBzzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32100,_binary '\0','/5hUrYw1wgFi2kPwZtEmTTqln3KE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073070',7.1,4584,'hi','Saheb Biwi Aur Gangster','After the death of his first wife, wealthy Raja Aditya Pratap Singh, re-marries another woman, simply known as Chhoti Rani, who subsequently becomes mentally unstable. His father\'s former mistress, Badi Rani, controls the wealth, while he himself has a mistress. Unable to procure contracts through Mantri Prabhu Tiwari, he decides to stand for elections, while his rival, Ghenda Singh, recruits an assassin, Babalu, who is also the nephew of Sunder, Chhoti Rani\'s chauffeur, to kill Aditya. After Sunder is unable to drive due to an injury, he recommends Babalu, and Aditya hires him. Babalu settles down in his new job, attempts to get accepted by everyone, including Chhoti Rani, who he finds attractive. He soon finds out that she, too, has feelings for him, and then starts making plans of not only carrying out his assigned task but also becoming the next Saheb.','/wadMSZ16EMmJkMcVwKapF6XaYwb.jpg','2011-09-23',119,'Released',NULL,'Saheb Biwi Aur Gangster',75744,1.5087,7.1,'xFyQTtD6BzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32101,_binary '\0','/14AbFi7MsqqczVUIurmWFLpIGIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073086',7.4,5010,'en','Still Mine','Craig, a fiercely determined New Brunswick farmer, sets out to build a more suitable house for his ailing wife, Irene, despite their children\'s concerns. As he starts building, he is blindsided by the bureaucratic codes and officials. As Irene becomes increasingly ill, Craig fights back. Based on a true story.','/mbSCfkLnGrxMqOkny5SrLiqfCav.jpg','2012-09-10',102,'Released','Still Devoted. Still Determined.','Still Mine',128215,2.1329,6.9,'Mv_Rl0CBPNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32102,_binary '\0','/W0gP5SVQU7uPB39GSTCumYLtc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073121',5.7,1574,'en','The Suspect','Two African American social scientists pose as bank robbers in an effort to understand the racial dynamics of small-town law enforcement. However, their experiment takes an unplanned turn.','/ixZSs07C94Nv4Hal6Ou9JrTOfYL.jpg','2013-01-23',89,'Released',NULL,'The Suspect',228245,1.667,5.3,'vsE3QJf205w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32103,_binary '\0','/yNmaptv4mmGp6EHqmMWOI2CKSNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2073600',7.4,2576,'en','Lad: A Yorkshire Story','After the death of his father, a teenage boy forms a healing friendship with a park ranger in the Yorkshire Dales.','/b09ECRsoOGOToToe3x2eSCLlWTB.jpg','2012-05-01',96,'Released','From the heart of a boy comes the story of a man.','Lad: A Yorkshire Story',224204,1.379,6.9,'rCSlR0IKwt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32104,_binary '\0','/2UBfXho6hKnsXPUtsUB91ANGePD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2075108',8.1,6853,'bn','২২শে শ্রাবণ','A serial killer terrorises the city of Kolkata and leaves behind verses of Bengali poetry. The police seek the help of a retired officer to unravel the case and find the perpetrator.','/l01wF0ImU8I2Mr1lb5zODooqnht.jpg','2011-09-28',138,'Released',NULL,'Baishe Srabon',90843,1.3352,7.4,'o-Az9dxnQF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32105,_binary '\0','/zudpzoAvmfSWKPcMyXrbma5JyGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2075277',7.4,1368,'kn','Paramathma','The story of Paramathma focus on the philosophy that those who are very close to heart leave us quickly. A section of the society believes this and longevity is cut short by destiny as villain.','/m4yw6MtSDgJGFJY5NA8yeUz5Tx4.jpg','2011-10-05',132,'Released',NULL,'Paramathma',225179,1.1854,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32106,_binary '\0','/lh58E8HDePofGMYzHHT2MHJ5OUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2075318',5.6,1346,'en','#Stuck','A hot one-night stand turns into an awkward morning after when Guy and Holly get stuck in a dead-stopped traffic jam.','/4xeoHNWVgjD05gZE8ZtwbKCw4zy.jpg','2014-07-01',84,'Released','Wham. Bam. Traffic Jam.','#Stuck',295050,1.6109,5.8,'0TkG4eBfqQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32107,_binary '\0','/kxhXFGZllNqfErwTs86u8qX0qC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2075373',6.9,1310,'en','The American Scream','An original documentary which follows three families in a small seaside town in Massachusetts as they prepare for their annual home made haunted houses. This story highlights their long journey from planning to opening day and cleanup until next year and the obstacles which face them during the process.','/jWOcY71h0zx6Icpa35y6ySstNqV.jpg','2012-10-28',91,'Released',NULL,'The American Scream',134255,0.9094,6.7,'vQMkrdzD3xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32108,_binary '\0','/61lIwkMsVSunWP3Cz7ks5STzBuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20754156',7.6,2733,'hi','तुमसे न हो पाएगा','When the world starts regarding Gaurav as a loser, he sets off on a journey to prove everyone (and their mothers) wrong.','/ziz7A8NgRExxeCxmTYGE6VGuMKs.jpg','2023-09-29',132,'Released',NULL,'Tumse Na Ho Payega',1177634,1.5257,7.591,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32109,_binary '\0','/cY7YLBjPBydrQFrJTnE1BHDSAOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076176',6.9,3397,'fr','Cloclo','A biopic of French pop star Claude Francois, most famous for co-writing the song \'My Way\'. Tracing his life from his childhood in Egypt through his success in France to his untimely death in Paris in 1978.','/upwipxKFnuasyfcdLB4M32annwG.jpg','2012-03-14',148,'Released',NULL,'My Way',85870,1.7663,6.4,'EowdPk8UMCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32110,_binary '\0','/dCuwNZp2DLOWr8qV0GDBHINhVZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076220',7,51660,'fr','Holy Motors','We follow 24 hours in the life of a being moving from life to life like a cold and solitary assassin moving from hit to hit. In each of these interwoven lives, the being possesses an entirely distinct identity: sometimes a man, sometimes a woman, sometimes youthful, sometimes old. By turns murderer, beggar, company chairman, monstrous creature, worker, family man.','/4ZuTrrDQhCS9f6KzIX6HfsjjyMd.jpg','2012-07-02',116,'Released',NULL,'Holy Motors',103328,5.8199,6.983,'sVsAixfCL4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32111,_binary '\0','/qx0XH83qU14AWJ73j2wHKYeKpTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076251',5.7,1358,'it','La peggior settimana della mia vita','Seven days before his wedding, a man must contend with a series of never-ending disasters.','/l2Llp8yFjrY3ow9AlAWtByHGso0.jpg','2011-10-27',93,'Released',NULL,'The Worst Week of My Life',77944,1.3275,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32112,_binary '\0','/jZDudPPIV4lSxEVgzfK9Z6nHdhi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076298',7,41616,'cn','葉問4','Following the death of his wife, Ip Man travels to San Francisco to ease tensions between the local kung fu masters and his star student, Bruce Lee, while searching for a better future for his son.','/b5cz6BoyHrgBnhfDHOW5hXRWbln.jpg','2019-12-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Ip Man 4: The Finale',449924,3.3975,7.3,'f40JahDi1Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32113,_binary '\0','/5AEfMEdY0sXyYKuB0fOHkN5kqkr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076346',5.3,1547,'en','Teacher of the Year','Surrounded by the eccentric faculty of Truman High School, Mitch Carter wins the California Teacher of the Year award and immediately receives a tempting offer that may force him to leave his job.','/kf9hZ3Ol6GpFH0vE0yf1tLzXJMJ.jpg','2015-05-19',82,'Released',NULL,'Teacher of the Year',297362,2.0719,5.371,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32114,_binary '\0','/93J92SYSiJpl1XRRNXDwZ3p7Xps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076372',4.9,1715,'en','Toad Road','Stuck in a dead end town, young James kills time with his druggie friends, engaging in debauched chemical intake to the point of unconsciousness, until he meets Sara, a sweet new arrival to their group. However, Sara wants James to take her further into the world of narcotics experimentation (just as James was contemplating abandoning this lifestyle), and she also wants him to introduce her to the sinister local legend of Toad Road, a spot deep in the forest that is apparently home to the Seven Gates of Hell.','/71uFW8n72RuRjsrGfFgJDhutcV5.jpg','2013-10-25',76,'Released',NULL,'Toad Road',121572,1.3744,4.8,'Wsm4zuDoieI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32115,_binary '\0','/dQN62EG7uwX721Ry4XBF7De425v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20764956',8.3,1216,'en','River Beauty','Two Alligator Detectives Arrive in a strange small town to solve a murderous mystery of why the gators are making their way in to town.','/omkYRDRbGD0lEGmowE9qr6fTR5W.jpg','2023-09-09',90,'Released',NULL,'River Beauty',1353989,0.8246,0,'dOFICSYU4W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32116,_binary '\0','/qCPLtXrTB10UsgAFxsWOB44gDPu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076822',5.7,65166,'en','Chaos Walking','Two unlikely companions embark on a perilous adventure through the badlands of an unexplored planet as they try to escape a dangerous and disorienting reality, where all inner thoughts are seen and heard by everyone.','/xAYGdGBGptNkisXRpmhZSry6SPF.jpg','2021-02-24',109,'Released','No one escapes the noise.','Chaos Walking',412656,12.1648,6.545,'nRf4ZgzHoVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32117,_binary '\0','/xyYaeLTNsJTYL5JSCNRu3VCXAmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076850',6.1,5043,'no','Flukt','Ten years after the Black Death devastated the country, a poor family sets out on a journey to search for better living conditions. In a deserted mountain pass, they are attacked by a gang of ruthless killer thieves. The only one spared is 19 year old Signe. She is taken prisoner, and the gang brings her back to their camp. Here, she soon learns that they have a fate worse than death in store for her, and realises that her only hope is to escape.','/qhCUKKg9fz4i7FiVy95SzUB2KyM.jpg','2012-09-28',76,'Released',NULL,'Escape',136080,2.0223,5.9,'4ozf407ofbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32118,_binary '\0','/lRuGkOHrSimoguAlNkNEzlBJZII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076862',5.9,1583,'en','I Am a Ghost','Emily, a troubled spirit, haunts her own house every day, wondering why she can\'t leave. With the help of Sylvia, a clairvoyant hired to rid the house of spirits, Emily is forced into a \'patient/therapist\' relationship, uncovering disturbing mysteries about her past that may help her move on to \'the next place','/cUGrMLCOWruUw1szmhSFo9HcOGo.jpg','2012-10-14',74,'Released',NULL,'I Am a Ghost',120698,1.1332,5.2,'JmW1DZ_vmKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32119,_binary '\0','/xH1fADDlEQMXreGClUCxA0XrJPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20768712',5.6,10281,'en','Book Club: The Next Chapter','Four best friends take their book club to Italy for the fun girls\' trip they never had. When things go off the rails and secrets are revealed, their relaxing vacation turns into a once-in-a-lifetime cross-country adventure.','/lXoeOcWWhPpLH1wzTIhOx8jydBo.jpg','2023-05-11',108,'Released','Slightly scandalous. Totally fabulous.','Book Club: The Next Chapter',982271,6.5451,6.275,'U8aHKAeRJRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32120,_binary '\0','/g4hnzXhoH8kCh9Eu0mg06mQVcjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2076897',6.5,3459,'en','My Brother the Devil','Fourteen-year-old Mo is a lonely, sensitive boy whose hunger for the rant and banter of buddies makes him prone to tread dangerous territories. He idolizes his handsome older brother, Rashid, a charismatic, well-respected member of a local gang, whose drug dealing enables “Rash” to provide for his family. Aching to be seen as a tough guy himself, Mo takes a job that unlocks a fateful turn of events and forces the brothers to confront their inner demons. It turns out that hate is easy. It is love and understanding that take real courage.','/a5sqiJ1kPLKieVGBMaOrHLVFgrQ.jpg','2012-01-22',111,'Released',NULL,'My Brother the Devil',84316,2.2042,6.3,'hZjXLaDbU8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32121,_binary '\0','/b3Rh4OEVnQgA5vSw5IvvviD3FeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20771626',5.5,1417,'es','Los agitadores','It is Christmas break, and Andy leaves the city to spend some time at a luxury villa with his best friends. The days spent in male company amidst the timeless atmosphere of the holidays foster rest, relaxation, and occasional horseplay. However, their initial consensual fooling around reveals that each of them has different personal boundaries.','/ubsC73ldy60iTA0XK0slwLmKoD6.jpg','2023-06-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Horseplay',978415,2.5158,7.4,'dd3ppx1cDIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32122,_binary '\0','/qHG3AZHf9Doia3zChzCHV82MJLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077721',7,1839,'en','Blackbird','An unlikely friendship with a preppy classmate lands toubled teenager Sean Randall in serious hot water when he\'s falsely accused of planning a Columbine shooting scenario.','/aTjFb0TU4YiKKsGicyawrsP9Xz.jpg','2012-09-09',103,'Released','An alienated teenager\'s posturing online threat ignites a firestorm of fear in a small community.','Blackbird',127862,1.2462,6.657,'Wzi-DVjA4-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32123,_binary '\0','/nWdEBsHiQaMk62zsFwOJeMMS5XW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077747',7.2,2086,'en','Love, Marilyn','Using the book \'Fragments\', which collects Marilyn Monroe\'s poems, notes and letters, and with participation from the Arthur Miller and Truman Capote estates who have contributed more material, each of the actresses will embody the legend at various stages in her life.','/pWwZEW6kOpQ6CEw2n2y6kvVXYAK.jpg','2013-05-30',105,'Released','One icon, many voices','Love, Marilyn',121831,2.9335,6.5,'BtlncyqkbWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32124,_binary '\0','/eLInBavBIK0ssluoZYLvaNm9fXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077833',5.9,27352,'hi','राउडी राठौर','A small-time thug comes across a young girl who claims him to be her father, following which he realizes he has a lookalike who\'s being hunted by goons.','/ytdp64MDSpONpm932nQcMTD95IF.jpg','2012-06-01',143,'Released','Faulad ki Aulaad','Rowdy Rathore',102632,2.9621,6,'gCAcU3p9GNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32125,_binary '\0','/xkgoxCfvLJeaA7LT7ewL9T0rMvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077851',6.7,12442,'en','Sleepwalk with Me','A burgeoning stand-up comedian struggles with the stress of a stalled career, a stale relationship, and the wild spurts of severe sleepwalking he is desperate to ignore.','/vs2wxfMrV48VWKTGbsYstIWrwI1.jpg','2012-08-24',81,'Released','A comedy for anyone who\'s ever had a dream. And then jumped out a window.','Sleepwalk with Me',84340,1.8862,6.5,'u9tRN7bok4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32126,_binary '\0','/hjmKqTwOIwN52RBGM72bLSq9Gay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077886',8.8,10992,'en','The Phantom of the Opera at the Royal Albert Hall','A disfigured musical genius, hidden away in the Paris Opera House, terrorises the opera company for the unwitting benefit of a young protégée whom he trains and loves. The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera was celebrated with a grand performance at the Royal Albert Hall in London.','/xYqpJl7XWENDfIy3CqtO8klHOTX.jpg','2011-09-27',160,'Released','The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera.','The Phantom of the Opera at the Royal Albert Hall',76115,4.2415,8.347,'gd0h4nMkaIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32127,_binary '\0','/wu1ZfK910bxCUtyne1bL1s9lOLj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2077908',6.9,2032,'fr','Zarafa','Inspired by the true story of the first giraffe to visit France, Zarafa is a sumptuously animated and stirring adventure, and a throwback to a bygone era of hand-drawn animation and epic storytelling set among sweeping CinemaScope vistas of parched desert, wind-swept mountains and open skies. Under the cover of darkness a small boy, Maki, loosens the shackles that bind him and escapes into the desert night. Pursued by slavers across the moon-lit savannah, Maki meets Zarafa, a baby giraffe – and an orphan, just like him – as well as the nomad Hassan, Prince of the Desert. Hassan takes them to Alexandria for an audience with the Pasha of Egypt, who orders him to deliver the exotic animal as a gift to King Charles of France.','/4h8bXfUY81fim7Pq8prTOOlG3La.jpg','2012-01-25',78,'Released',NULL,'Zarafa',94196,2.9858,6.892,'d_ygyScwOWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32128,_binary '\0','/1omLO5cfU8sYjm9xs9EwkyZkZ8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20782072',4.8,8858,'sv','Feed','A group of social media experts are hired to help an old family business to strive. But they soon find themselves stuck on a tiny island in a lake in which an ancient Swedish witch is said to live.','/1Qr8bsfup4bNnXWhBo5PbynqlkE.jpg','2022-10-28',100,'Released','Like. Share. Die.','Feed',1015936,2.0703,5.8,'52V-IX6Js_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32129,_binary '\0','/jhmGJmPcuAhF2ccuKluYlLxnyeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20784210',5.6,2176,'en','LEGO Star Wars Summer Vacation','Looking for a much-needed break, Finn arranges a surprise vacation for his friends Rey, Poe, Rose, Chewie, BB-8, R2-D2, and C-3PO, aboard the luxurious Halcyon. However, Finn\'s plan to have one last hurrah together quickly goes awry.','/vUL5UXsL5DaYgGVd2GSeqIvMKfK.jpg','2022-08-05',49,'Released','They\'re going to need a bigger beach.','LEGO Star Wars Summer Vacation',980804,4.2891,6.3,'RZnXjJqJp8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32130,_binary '\0','/cvfVV8lEKnGO6oVktSo05oZauwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20784402',8.7,2222,'te','మది','Abhimanyu, aka Abhi and Madhu, two next-door youngsters, are deeply in love with each other. Madhu’s father gets her married to someone from their caste. In a salvaging effort, Madhu and Abhi decide to continue their love story even after her marriage.','/iHxOsBelhu83n9Be39Ih0DD05Ig.jpg','2022-11-11',139,'Released',NULL,'Madhi',1074677,0.8581,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32131,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20784426',7.3,2113,'te','Maro Prapancham','Venkat Kiran Koka, Suraiya Parvin, Yamin Raaz, Akshika Vidvat, Srinivas Sagar, PVR Raja','/qZPSj2rs6f28MyF7pGHgtGb3Kff.jpg',NULL,109,'Released',NULL,'Maro Prapancham',1100100,1.3658,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32132,_binary '\0','/iMIvLPrMbSeUSmIEs1YvbKize4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078552',6,4879,'en','Blood','When police discover a young girl brutally murdered, brothers Joe Fairburns and Chrissie Fairburns join their supervisor Robert to investigate main suspect Jason Buliegh, a local sex offender and social outcast. Forced to release Jason from police custody, the Fairburns take matters into their own hands in an attempt to coerce a confession.','/wtHDMP6VPNF2Vc8YNCHwz4sJtNo.jpg','2012-10-09',93,'Released','You can\'t bury the truth.','Blood',136278,2.4741,5.9,'j5fgSBoqE5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32133,_binary '\0','/5wnoob7GtS6jiplzK0fYo8g9KXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078586',7.2,2553,'ro','Despre oameni şi melci','One worker in a bankrupt factory finds an unusual solution to save his co-workers from unemployment. If it doesn\'t work the factory will be privatized and sold to a French company planning to convert the plant into a snail cannery. Only 300 of the 3000 workers will keep their jobs.','/qApYDHXv6s84Z5xutBPhQNCTJgl.jpg','2012-09-14',95,'Released',NULL,'Of Snails and Men',136727,1.6345,6.6,'5JkJeQEaZjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32134,_binary '\0','/rk1q1PA4iCOFPPvuHb0IuJCL8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078599',7.3,3151,'ja','鍵泥棒のメソッド','A failed actor switches identities with a stranger at a bath house thinking it is his way out of his life of misery but only to find himself filling the shoes of an elite assassin.','/eBCHchnYY5cR62ap3VZ4k7gxpu6.jpg','2012-09-16',128,'Released','If your life has you down… try out someone else\'s.','Key of Life',128113,1.8954,7.538,'In4BnAsQDQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32135,_binary '\0','/iNtSeZg5i8AOolSzmytx4E7rYgB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078644',7.6,2130,'ml','ഇന്ത്യൻ റുപ്പി','Jayaprakash, a real estate agent aspiring for success in his field, experiences a paradigm shift in his outlook on life and work upon meeting Achutha Menon.','/aXq4Cd7aHorMX3l0ZcPCbOZvFtf.jpg','2011-10-06',155,'Released',NULL,'Indian Rupee',124052,1.0395,7.367,'Bg-041JUva0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32136,_binary '\0','/5hmW7NJaWBpUS4GMmUsiqWGjDAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078718',5.3,5149,'en','Sacrifice','Sacrifice is the story of consultant surgeon, Tora Hamilton, who moves with her husband, Duncan, to the remote Shetland Islands, 100 miles off the north-east coast of Scotland. Deep in the peat soil around her new home, Tora discovers the body of a young woman with rune marks carved into her skin and a gaping hole where her heart once beat. Ignoring warnings to leave well alone, Tora uncovers terrifying links to a legend that might never have been confined to the pages of the story-books.','/eVrlNY7SbWmTslaRlJvo3sMsZm4.jpg','2016-04-29',91,'Released','Every life has a price','Sacrifice',394661,2.2243,5.4,'3vJXSuxmcJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32137,_binary '\0','/ge4ko1blLwuThYklulj0V4lwgs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078733',5.9,1627,'da','Sover Dolly på ryggen?','Anne has given up trying to find a man who will fit into her sensible and controlled life. Therefore she has chosen to become pregnant with an anonymous sperm donor who has been carefully chosen. But as her hormones get the better of her she realizes that the child may come to resemble the father and possibly get his less flattering characteristics. Anne feels compelled to find the sperm donor and ensure that he is as perfect as she imagines.','/gg7nzlKBsAucOpc1vXcKVxaxE4A.jpg','2012-10-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Almost Perfect',141011,1.636,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32138,_binary '\0','/obzWmvCrKUnrsbNYESgzhXZ8rnw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078763',8.2,1312,'ta','வாகை சூட வா','Veluthambi, who aspires for a government job, finds himself teaching poor children in a village. When he learns that they are appointed as bonded labourers, he decides to bring about a change.','/xYv0VsgkvHXcyorhQkcLFADTAAi.jpg','2011-09-30',123,'Released',NULL,'Vaagai Sooda Vaa',115271,0.983,7.25,'WgYVAvjZQF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32139,_binary '\0','/1nRRM7xkESqmHge8llznh36gnB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2078768',6.2,1858,'zh','听风者','An espionage thriller set in the 1950s and adapted from the novel \"Year Suan/Plot Against\" by May Jia. Tony Leung Chiu Wai plays a blind man who works for a piano tuner. He is recruited for a spy mission because of his exceptional hearing.','/A6vo0HbWsCNwQb4mQr3KMNlv6c0.jpg','2012-08-10',120,'Released',NULL,'The Silent War',129070,2.266,6,'EqiGtnWS7fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32140,_binary '\0','/624YqcgFriv3FQkdqbF9Ta7776o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20788760',4.2,2157,'ar','بحبك','Ali, a self-made middle-class businessman, finds himself torn between two loves: The woman he\'s about to marry and his old flame who barges back into his life. What will his heart dictate?','/kyIKLxluJQVUHKbyNUbkvgr3avd.jpg','2022-07-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Bahebek',969880,1.5101,4.885,'cMjFkYOJ5d0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32141,_binary '\0','/gWTRgPGyuMNhj7YJKOlf3TmPJDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2079571',7.1,1324,'en','Roman Polanski: A Film Memoir','An interview with film director Roman Polanski conducted during his period of house arrest, discussing his life and work.','/xNuOybVO3fFrGenvhJxrpfslF2i.jpg','2012-10-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Roman Polanski: A Film Memoir',119415,2.4178,6.488,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32142,_binary '\0','/xj49X22pmh61fWBsveCkHtVtOBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2080374',7.2,188450,'en','Steve Jobs','Set backstage at three iconic product launches and ending in 1998 with the unveiling of the iMac, Steve Jobs takes us behind the scenes of the digital revolution to paint an intimate portrait of the brilliant man at its epicenter.','/ljiRO29Y9khEERRqMluptUYunJ9.jpg','2015-10-09',123,'Released','Can a great man be a good man?','Steve Jobs',321697,9.9223,6.8,'9XEh7arNSms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32143,_binary '\0','/2z4n91LX9jtg9VUW8JSeMFLP8A0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2081194',4.4,4142,'en','Hansel and Gretel Get Baked','An intense new marijuana strain named “Black Forest” is taking Los Angeles by storm, and Gretel’s stoner boyfriend can’t get enough. But when the old woman growing the popular drug turns out to be an evil witch, cooking and eating her wasted patrons for their youth, Gretel and her brother Hansel must save him from a gruesome death — or face the last high of their lives.','/shYb3LezqJF4P90CGgp9zoD2MjF.jpg','2013-02-19',86,'Released','Prepare for the high of your life','Hansel and Gretel Get Baked',165864,3.1084,5.2,'gxX5KYygsBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32144,_binary '\0','/hqlw19nT1FK9CCyg8b8JyXRRony.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2081259',5.6,1708,'fa','دل شکسته','Heartbroken is the story of love between two youngsters who have two different perspectives and are from two different families.','/c30LXZGw6Z1jvrjSugoJtN5Egr1.jpg','2009-06-15',110,'Released','Heartbroken','Heartbroken',502847,0.9257,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32145,_binary '\0','/9qWT9XN6ei6edEIwmIZDGnqb7x4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2081437',5.9,9776,'en','The Liability','When 19-year-old Adam agrees to do a day\'s driving for his mum\'s gangster boyfriend Peter, it takes him on a 24-hour journey into a nightmarish world of murder, sex trafficking and revenge, in the company of aging hit man Roy.','/4TdsXzigS6xYYO9Qn8oOQrZqX1M.jpg','2012-11-24',86,'Released','They had their turn... now it\'s his','The Liability',162145,2.1363,5.637,'t_jk3MBoQ-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32146,_binary '\0','/zxa9J4EPYGItbSbasBZK39WDoaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2081438',2.4,2041,'en','Zombie Massacre','A bacteriological weapon developed by the US Government to create a super soldier - spreads an epidemic in a quiet little town in the middle of Eastern Europe. All citizens have been turned into infected zombies. The plan is to bring an atomic bomb into the city\'s nuclear plant to pretend a terrible accident occurred. No one has to know the truth. A team of mercenaries is hired to complete the mission. The battle is on. Hordes of monsters against the team. Who will survive?','/iVAuzh1gMuqjCuLBaGajY4lAsgL.jpg','2013-06-06',91,'Released','There is no hope.','Zombie Massacre',153509,1.2819,4.9,'DV6VJqXPWiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32147,_binary '\0','/5aj49OfiHroZ7WsHKGUviosR0d9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2082152',4.5,3463,'en','13 Eerie','Forensics students arriving on an isolated island \"body farm\" get to try out their CSI skills on a bunch of corpses under the watchful eye of their grumpy professor. The island used to house a state penitentiary, where the authorities were experimenting on death row inmates, and now the bodies won\'t stay still.','/3EU0EzOI9MH659vLjeUx6G2biGt.jpg','2013-03-29',87,'Released','We prey for you','13 Eerie',122369,2.2332,4.726,'Mr0NM0draJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32148,_binary '\0','/kcIvHVTswx1I7IqrmOcQ6DiqUHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2082180',7.7,12834,'ko','오직 그대만','A former boxer turned parking lot attendant finds hope in the love of the blind telemarketer who walks into his booth one day.','/7PaCGnjY87sc9088zxFf34Tamcz.jpg','2011-10-20',108,'Released','I see you. I hear you. I love you.','Always',86000,3.7846,7.814,'RhNR8iUF9Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32149,_binary '\0','/dVUBKQMehxVnEQMpcOPw3OQqNMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2082197',8.1,94906,'hi','बर्फी!','The heartwarming tale of Barfi, a charming deaf-mute young man from 1970s Darjeeling, and two unalike women who can\'t help but fall for him.','/5cJIx2zKjDoUtPSliou23xsReb1.jpg','2012-09-13',151,'Released',NULL,'Barfi!',127501,1.8862,7.649,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32150,_binary '\0','/rQv4rZfOtSmRsf7u9ZV5Ehrwbaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2082221',7,8042,'ko','범죄와의 전쟁','Ik-hyeon, a corrupt officer, joins forces with another crook, Hyung-bae, to continue his illegal activities before he loses his job. Eventually, he decides to escape and pin the blame on his partner.','/3ppxP6yFoKxkA3jQkDdv3E9u1tc.jpg','2012-02-02',133,'Released','Power can not be taken alone.','Nameless Gangster',89501,3.865,6.9,'zPRFKk3gYBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32151,_binary '\0','/iMCBgdgCGkziDhUL9d8uWVf5UZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2082262',5.7,4803,'sv','En gång i Phuket','Life coach Sven travels