,123,'Released','Times change. Friendship doesn\'t.','The Best Man Holiday',146304,4.7426,6.5,'k6iNiJivOOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32159,_binary '\0','/wwqQheFktKinTEiSaYkHSwNqiU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2083379',5.6,6506,'en','A Dark Truth','In the jungles of Ecuador, blood taints the waters. A multinational conglomerate\'s unholy alliance with a bloodthirsty military regime has resulted in a massacre. Only the rebel Francisco Franco and his determined wife Mia can prove the truth. To settle a personal debt, former CIA agent Jack Begosian takes on the freelance assignment to rescue Francisco and risks everything in a brutal battle to expose the cover-up.','/je93UwdBdhtHpp9YgaYGnJqnX8G.jpg','2012-11-29',106,'Released','Escape the jungle. Expose the truth.','A Dark Truth',138376,3.175,5.5,'54hZzO-QPkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32160,_binary '\0','/ivndXrpSYpCSuu2S5OrUvzAetCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2083383',6.8,72790,'en','Trouble with the Curve','Slowed by age and failing eyesight, crack baseball scout Gus Lobel takes his grown daughter along as he checks out the final prospect of his career. Along the way, the two renew their bond, and she catches the eye of a young player-turned-scout.','/zLZQVmxOj5kICbS5Pq7rB1cbPvP.jpg','2012-09-21',111,'Released','Whatever Life Throws at You.','Trouble with the Curve',87825,6.3894,7,'fTHSqutzOcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32161,_binary '\0','/qeir1DKwGicRVjhRsJhEPMl1GEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20838498',6.2,2135,'hi','Thai Massage','A typical middle-class 70-year-old widower, Atmaram Dubey, who has been celibate for decades, realises he will probably never have sex. This awakening catapults him into an outrageous journey of self-discovery defying societal norms.','/rYPis1a03mHIIUXDScAKLHvEfBO.jpg','2022-11-11',120,'Released','Good men go to heaven, great men go to Thailand.','Thai Massage',977673,1.3907,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32162,_binary '\0','/ow1w5xXA2bvkpgNgTUCjeKMerOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20840000',7.4,3908,'hi','Ardh','Shiva struggles to become a mainstream actor in Mumbai despite being a theatre actor. With the help of his wife Madhu, he disguises himself as a transgender and begs for money to survive.','/m4BcmjzAElnwWWmdKDR7sYs3q93.jpg','2022-06-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Ardh',945324,0.9637,4.667,'q-b8ywtjCl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32163,_binary '\0','/rnYHp1iDh95Wg7p7EqCPzBUEhgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084093',5.2,1276,'en','Ashley','A teenage girl, distraught from her vain attempt to connect with her estranged mother, resorts to cutting herself. When she develops an online relationship with an older woman, she learns to accept her sexuality and the endless solitude of sprawling suburbia.','/eowIAh7dgGZgNKsUeG0llCW2rCL.jpg','2013-08-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Ashley',212967,1.4733,4.7,'CIOnUnvVmQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32164,_binary '\0','/dgH4WGjsoTGDcKR50vEe5SjfnGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084098',6.9,1367,'zh','星空','May is worried about her mother and father, whose marriage is on the rocks, and she yearns to return to the woods where her grandfather lives. One day, May befriends a boy as lonely as she is. When reality catches up, they run away to a beautiful world that belongs only to them.','/9DEDG5QcktqifgQwO4rW9BLWdEO.jpg','2011-11-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Starry Starry Night',85878,1.4357,6.2,'I89GQVj1whw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32165,_binary '\0','/dir8OkZjZQF8fg2CGtxpqhdF4wD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084934',4.9,1707,'nl','Zombibi','The bizarre story takes place in Amsterdam-West, where a virus turns people into bloodthirsty zombies. Although much blood is flowing and many limbs chopped off, there is a lot to laugh at in this bizarre horror comedy.','/oRaDmZ0ktsx8y0CJ9mNs2HmkgAe.jpg','2012-02-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Kill Zombie!',90231,1.3667,4.7,'HGzazDoMEsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32166,_binary '\0','/9sfGWVz2D2EvfDzqhP22xwJh7tT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084953',7.3,6651,'en','Terms and Conditions May Apply','Have you ever read the Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policies connected to every website you visit, phone call you make, or app you use? Of course you haven’t. But those agreements allow corporations to do things with your personal information you could never even imagine. This film explores the intent hidden within these ridiculous agreements, and reveals what corporations and governments are legally taking from you and the outrageous consequences that result from clicking “I accept.”','/hiXXUS7LVqALDNugz5kRvS0Xkx1.jpg','2013-07-12',79,'Released','Find some privacy.','Terms and Conditions May Apply',159622,2.1258,7,'yzyafieRcWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32167,_binary '\0','/8FCHJ21JBQOgATY2WI8vwYAiXg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084970',8,885262,'en','The Imitation Game','Based on the real life story of legendary cryptanalyst Alan Turing, the film portrays the nail-biting race against time by Turing and his brilliant team of code-breakers at Britain\'s top-secret Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, during the darkest days of World War II.','/zSqJ1qFq8NXFfi7JeIYMlzyR0dx.jpg','2014-11-14',113,'Released','The true enigma was the man who cracked the code.','The Imitation Game',205596,60.9864,7.979,'Fg85ggZSHMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32168,_binary '\0','/7QslgwJBhPM1A6AYLcQKXDrblrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084977',7.2,5903,'en','The Scapegoat','In 1952, as England prepares for the coronation, two very different men have one thing in common—a face.','/qm7405EUohvZvGjINJkGYNsqU03.jpg','2012-09-09',100,'Released','Two men, one face.','The Scapegoat',139463,1.7514,6.371,'8AbfgNNrmss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32169,_binary '\0','/s1DqTGJ96V0Q8YxL9GZVkJi48jZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2084989',6.5,36324,'en','Upstream Color','A man and woman are drawn together, entangled in the lifecycle of an ageless organism. Identity becomes an illusion as they struggle to assemble the loose fragments of wrecked lives.','/tQ4IWxSYIgZVWnQwLCG8r6sUraU.jpg','2013-04-05',96,'Released','You can force your story\'s shape, but the color will always bloom upstream.','Upstream Color',145197,2.4989,6.339,'5U9KmAlrEXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32170,_binary '\0','/cHNfMabYAuDKuvjfuqJtl5sEx6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085002',6.4,2407,'sv','Äta sova dö','A young Eastern European immigrant working in Sweden is faced with a painful choice when she\'s laid off from her factory in the name of \"efficiencies.\"','/yrZkn6Y9ixan29jCGzorlJFR12Z.jpg','2012-10-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Eat Sleep Die',127901,1.1904,5.9,'tWoacp0nAnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32171,_binary '\0','/28EqsZDeEAy4VMZfrYbiyJZznKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20850406',8.5,85666,'te','సీతా రామం','Afreen, a rebellious Pakistani student sets ablaze the car of an Indian in London. Angered Afreen returns to Pakistan to ask for money from her grandfather that she has to pay in a month\'s time as damages. However, she gets to know that he is no more and the only thing he has left for her is a letter-delivering task, written by Ram to Sita. As Afreen sets out to find Ram, there begins her journey of discovering the secret behind the 20-year-old letter.','/t1O94ZBzsQXJihtVkrsStRLyUDR.jpg','2022-08-05',158,'Released',NULL,'Sita Ramam',894803,3.4495,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32172,_binary '\0','/4yzMGGkWgF5c6zLpIF0aIfHRjc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20851874',6.7,2545,'en','Fourth of July','A recovering alcoholic and jazz pianist in NYC confronts his acerbic family during their annual Fourth of July vacation.','/2taYmICrAP9YJTo6VmGtZCpQQXM.jpg','2022-07-01',90,'Released','An American Mess','Fourth of July',983406,1.4427,6.3,'_XiKCHS3Z_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32173,_binary '\0','/lzhoqccJ8b8qjRyT0fNbqKOCTLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20853816',4,3255,'en','The Mean One','In a sleepy mountain town, Cindy witnesses the murder of her parents by a blood-thirsty green figure in a red Santa suit. Twenty years later, the Christmas-hating monster begins to terrorize the town once more. Cindy finds new purpose in stopping the creature and saving the holiday.','/56yQqjnGo9Ky65bSSGxz5vDaNUo.jpg','2022-12-09',93,'Released','Slashing through the snow.','The Mean One',1033052,2.4184,6.2,'5aMRJAbn_kQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32174,_binary '\0','/nPBaJKudqdAMpTTcxDt0LtuIgua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20854842',7.2,5815,'mr','वेड','Satya lives in a railway colony who dreams of playing for the railway cricket team and eventually representing Team India. Soon he falls madly in love with Nisha. However, Satya`s life takes a drastic change when a local Politician Bhaskar creates havoc in his personal and professional life. 12 Years Later, Satya is a drunk miserable man hopelessly waiting for his love. He is married to Shravani who has been crazily in love with Satya since her childhood. Who`s love has more madness - Satya or Shravani?','/kNd1IkaAVOvrkDqvCsjEiSrWn29.jpg','2022-12-30',148,'Released',NULL,'Ved',913544,1.9146,7.154,'Al2Gtph9ytI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32175,_binary '\0','/bKTMM27PLdmGoMf8kjl2cPUV4vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20854856',5,8394,'hi','Ishq Vishk Rebound','When friendship turns into love for two newly singles, it threatens to destroy their wider friendship circle.','/bJ9fGn0t9XO2Mjz1P05OQh76AaI.jpg','2024-06-21',106,'Released',NULL,'Ishq Vishk Rebound',1080808,0.8837,3,'oip7nX8yKN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32176,_binary '\0','/fkAxLEPBm6hAZkbQAKXvuFgF9jo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085746',7.4,2884,'pa','ਅੰਨ੍ਹੇ ਘੋੜੇ ਦਾ ਦਾਨ','A family living in a Punjab village deals with social and labor inequities until a fight breaks out during a lunar eclipse.','/oGo1Wqtk15qUIKutkZyPQ0riBSW.jpg','2011-09-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Anhey Ghorhey Da Daan',127925,1.1173,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32177,_binary '\0','/wt3DHrwUHYq00duMBEcazcox70D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085752',5.3,2067,'en','Autumn Blood','Two young orphans in the Tirolian Mountains come under siege by a vicious band of hunters. Frightened of being separated by child services following the death of their mother, a self-sufficient 16-year-old girl and her 10-year-old brother - who hasn\'t spoken a word since seeing his father killed by the mayor - strive to live off the land in peace. Their innocence is shattered, however, when a group of hunters led by the mayor\'s son brutalizes and rapes the free-spirited girl. Later, when a well-meaning social services worker arrives too late to protect the terrorized siblings, the girl and her brother prepare to take a stand against their ruthless attackers.','/sZPCUqjULdmkjoJ2vqhf9ykktlL.jpg','2013-09-10',100,'Released','Season of vengeance.','Autumn Blood',237614,3.0131,4.9,'Js0G0jWNhfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32178,_binary '\0','/w2zsNG7WKBMH35QqcFYILEAdYDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20857676',4.5,2330,'pl','Akademia Pana Kleksa','A seemingly ordinary girl finds her way into the eponymous Academy to explore the world of fairy tales, imagination and creativity. With the help of a crazy, talented teacher, she develops her unique abilities and also stumbles upon a clue that will help her unravel the biggest secret of the family...','/ymbECZscR8BTkdvXziSinMIckAz.jpg','2024-01-05',130,'Released',NULL,'Kleks Academy',1026999,5.4201,5.869,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32179,_binary '\0','/gwBmjqsNc932AdnKCfq11kT7EUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085783',8.3,1924,'mr','देऊळ','Keshya, a simple villager believes that god has arrived in his village but everyone disbelieves him. Later when the politics plays its part things take a drastic change','/gR3gt5KUOmebsyrgqX6BPvXDswT.jpg','2011-11-04',139,'Released',NULL,'Deool',94935,1.2266,8.4,'lfzctPCpb2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32180,_binary '\0','/qOqpRqFulhrOox5GTuh29MtQ3pU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085795',7,2747,'ja','劇場版 FAIRY TAIL 鳳凰の巫女','The film revolves around a mysterious girl named Éclair who appears before Fairy Tail, the world\'s most notorious wizard\'s guild. She lost all of her memories, except for the imperative that she must deliver two Phoenix Stones somewhere. The stones may spell the collapse of the magical world, and Natsu, Lucy, and the rest of the Fairy Tail guild are caught up in the intrigue.','/aDuie7u8AL3J6ZH2LS5ySnPkX1W.jpg','2012-08-18',86,'Released',NULL,'Fairy Tail: Phoenix Priestess',135531,4.1951,7.3,'nPv741YW3tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32181,_binary '\0','/pYxLP0MWvhMG1Sx852N2PT8F3zf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085910',6.2,24024,'en','Room 237','A subjective documentary that explores various theories about hidden meanings in Stanley Kubrick\'s classic film The Shining. Five very different points of view are illuminated through voice over, film clips, animation and dramatic reenactments.','/wPXxJSz36VjAkxa4MZ0C28uOdwA.jpg','2012-10-26',103,'Released','Some movies stay with you forever... and ever... and ever.','Room 237',84330,3.0924,6.1,'hXgVb1E_zxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32182,_binary '\0','/sFfD1TvTUzmzWFpSm7GnYrKcWJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2085930',5.8,12862,'en','Starship Troopers: Invasion','The troopers of two starships have joined forces to terminate a massive bug attack at a Federation outpost. Before the mission can be completed and the survivors evacuated, one ship abruptly departs and goes inexplicably dark. The remaining battle-hardened troopers race to the rescue only to discover that the threat from the bugs is about to hit home.','/xJJY16XSazUgDvbWEXQ1ulLiz8q.jpg','2012-08-28',89,'Released','Everyone fights. No one quits.','Starship Troopers: Invasion',114478,5.6569,5.9,'tCfmKj5w7RI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32183,_binary '\0','/iUmJYNPuF5hMsTW3yy5FEo1miSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20859464',6.6,13594,'en','The Artifice Girl','A team of special agents discovers a revolutionary new computer program to bait and trap online predators. After teaming up with the program\'s troubled developer, they soon find that the AI is rapidly advancing beyond its original purpose.','/A3qrVjsBd4IZ3QWHMs2x1dwRxuX.jpg','2023-04-27',93,'Released','She\'s not real. She\'s more than that.','The Artifice Girl',983282,4.516,6.7,'uwur0W5PpXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32184,_binary '\0','/uvgqWe8wFRmZlHLoZ6iKW0eb4r2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20860736',5.5,1329,'en','Catching Dust','A criminal husband and his wife hide in a lone trailer. Exhausted by her husbands controlling ways, she decides to leave. But then a trailer arrives with a couple which creates dangerous consequences for them all.','/w7LTgu7kiwvBgoKLhtc9vP1IDgr.jpg','2024-08-23',96,'Released','Some secrets should stay buried.','Catching Dust',992638,1.5896,5.3,'8ldSnxr_-CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32185,_binary '\0','/rmV6gnPC9LqNWOKzwd8jQe8Ljcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20864606',3.2,2530,'en','Camp Pleasant Lake','A couple breathes life into a new camp on an old campsite, connecting them to a chilling past that unravels a 20-year-old mystery involving a missing young girl. As eerie events unfold, they must confront forces tied to a brutal crime.','/vO4ok0SkjbTfLCICxx0uMzOBoEJ.jpg','2024-02-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Camp Pleasant Lake',1196646,2.3081,5.212,'brCD7XPKfoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32186,_binary '\0','/wHPve0fc0MEpzI1tZY4cybL49Rn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20864704',6.2,1615,'en','Lifemark','David\'s comfortable world is turned upside down when his birth mother Melissa unexpectedly reaches out, longing to meet the eighteen year old son she\'s only held once.','/pGdXvXhbVO4a9ej3G8IE76wZK3m.jpg','2022-09-09',105,'Released','Hope is at the heart of every journey.','Lifemark',975407,1.949,7.5,'WLmAI7Rxl-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32187,_binary '\0','/ftE3DsMRVitLWqyMEJ88enllizO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20865078',6.7,3548,'zh','热烈','After getting recruited by a veteran street dancer, an aspiring breakdancer will do whatever it takes to prove he can make his way to the top.','/iSAYTpmdv4JVULVXKi0GBdsLZKy.jpg','2023-07-28',125,'Released',NULL,'One and Only',1006485,2.4124,5.9,'ujOkT2edZQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32188,_binary '\0','/qEKkA07NBx2FPpciIXZQrTkEvXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2086830',6.7,2015,'ko','돼지의 왕','Two friends, Jung Jong-suk and Hwang Kyung-min, meet after several years and talk about their time in school, which left them scarred.','/o93tMT3eyeOXBZ8F8TiGQWUq3Ta.jpg','2011-11-03',97,'Released','A broken youth won\'t rest alone. Memories are beyond your imagination.','The King of Pigs',91088,1.2811,6.1,'sfr4hnfBvVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32189,_binary '\0','/cIycZvjlU4ukPh5Bj4o4HDnZXiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20869180',6.6,1351,'en','Fourth Down and Love','Sparks are reignited when a single mom and a pro football player coincidentally meet again on her daughter’s flag football field after his career is derailed by a injury.','/nWtuQ1SeJM1f6zuEj2l3NpFOTsJ.jpg','2023-09-09',84,'Released',NULL,'Fourth Down and Love',1158690,2.207,6.6,'AAHZF8Z0e6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32190,_binary '\0','/r1V9AU5da9PiKwxxbK5HFuTTuxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20871388',6.1,2228,'it','Il grande giorno','In a large villa on Lake Como, everything is ready to celebrate Elio and Caterina\'s wedding. It will be the most beautiful day of their lives and also of their parents\' lives, especially their respective fathers, Giacomo and Giovanni. Too bad that together with Margherita, Giovanni\'s ex-wife and mother of the bride, Aldo, her new partner, also arrives at the wedding. Friendly, outgoing and above all a total troublemaker. Giacomo and Giovanni try to contain him in every way, but under Aldo\'s blows, cracks open up from which a hidden malaise emerges, destined to call into question the friendship between Giovanni and Giacomo, their marriages and more. And that will force everyone to deal with their own doubts and with the courage it takes to allow themselves happiness.','/2DyTIexH2TMfmy3jArpifBANRh6.jpg','2022-12-22',90,'Released',NULL,'The Great Day',919952,1.1556,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32191,_binary '\0','/94hfGX8TSFJdgN0Upq3xnQVAoNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20876910',5.9,1577,'en','We Wish You a Married Christmas','Becca and Robby are a married couple having a hard time connecting with each other as the holidays approach. Just before Christmas, they head to a cozy Vermont inn at the advice of their marriage coach so they can recharge. Their weekend away gets unexpectedly extended when a mishap puts their car out of commission and just may put them on the road to a very happily married Christmas.','/cZjDTEpZ0SPER7NuuIIjPlGwEP8.jpg','2022-10-22',84,'Released','It ain\'t over till the Alpaca sings Jingle Bells.','We Wish You a Married Christmas',1027338,1.8285,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32192,_binary '\0','/bMjSLynLefcVZ8vPsVHyQDdAvZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20877986',6.5,2157,'ar','ولاد رزق 3: القاضية','Years have passed since the brothers have separated in their different ways of life. But one day, a ghost from the past returns to cast a shadow over the sons of Rizk, forcing them to return to a life of crime and theft once again in order to save themselves, in a fateful operation that is the largest, most dangerous, and most important in the history of the sons of Rizk.','/oYwTsy5sNz3TvIeYBWyDRYnTzdu.jpg','2024-06-12',125,'Released',NULL,'Sons of Rizk 3: Knockout',629040,1.3601,6.368,'DD5SvLL3rso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32193,_binary '\0','/xjwVOqA6sIp7KN6YPdYvf4DJQLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2087820',6.8,3036,'en','Jack Irish: Bad Debts','Jack Irish is a man getting his life back together again. A former criminal lawyer whose world imploded, he now spends his days as a part-time investigator, debt collector, apprentice cabinet maker, punter and sometime lover - the complete man really. Jack is an expert in finding those who don\'t want to be found - dead or alive. He helps out his mates while avoiding the past. That is until the past finds him.','/xiRa3aqX0QbwQ8trpLktrTcvjnA.jpg','2012-10-14',90,'Released','...He\'s down but not out.','Jack Irish: Bad Debts',141095,2.4919,6.5,'IApMh9sEFi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32194,_binary '\0','/57eWYwrS7K9svhkxU5vhA0F8spU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2087850',5.3,9194,'fr','Les infidèles','Eight short films explore the subject of male infidelity. Serial cheaters, Fred and Greg, spend a night on the town doing what they do best, and with absolutely no regrets. The duo play various characters in assorted extracurricular situations, ranging from sexist to the darker sides of carnal desires.','/boHSJQ4ECBNjuEKTgct2jBOLqQd.jpg','2012-02-29',109,'Released',NULL,'The Players',89899,3.2993,4.8,'WetlFffGSFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32195,_binary '\0','/q3y13v1uVVOOKh2T7LBC9Ti2yZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2087878',7.1,1231,'en','Minecraft: The Story of Mojang','Minecraft: The Story of Mojang is a feature-length documentary that follows the young company over the course of its first year as their profile expanded across the world stage and into the homes of millions of gamers. Featuring insights from industry icons, journalists, tastemakers, and players profoundly impacted by the game, the film serves as a time capsule for one of this generation\'s most unorthodox success stories.','/2V3Tbq7xdRRw0G92Tx62IYDLz1g.jpg','2012-12-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Minecraft: The Story of Mojang',151870,1.5191,7.2,'SXEdspVDMxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32196,_binary '\0','/h1jF78eKPrqejbXe3OHQ2KxmTJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20879602',5,12024,'en','Maybe I Do','Michelle and Allen, who have reached the point in their relationship where they are considering next steps, decide to invite their parents to finally meet and to offer some understanding of why marriage works. Except the parents already know each other quite well, which leads to some very distinct opinions about the value of marriage.','/8AepEHAUDEbvxzuKV4ll0gKobdL.jpg','2023-01-27',95,'Released','Maybe you stay married for the kids.','Maybe I Do',972230,6.4986,5.447,'Z11QkNvMZpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32197,_binary '\0','/ymvzM5HbUUq1fO6OLvR44rwUCsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2087985',6.5,1381,'en','The Pregnancy Project','The Pregnancy project tells the real story of Gaby Rodriguez, a seventeen-year-old who attended a Washington state high-school and made her senior school project the treatment of pregnant teenagers by pretending to be pregnant.','/oqR3OPRJe2bUYDZoJ3Rhn19iENf.jpg','2012-01-28',86,'Released',NULL,'The Pregnancy Project',110496,1.9598,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32198,_binary '\0','/2gccYK4lqVeRzrXYZmiZhL0P7Ft.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088003',5.4,37330,'en','Big Game','Air Force One is shot down by terrorists, leaving the President of the United States stranded in the wilderness of Finland. 13-year-old Oskari is on a hunting mission to prove his maturity to his kinsfolk by tracking down a deer, but instead discovers the President in an escape pod. With the terrorists closing in to capture their prize, the unlikely duo team up to escape their hunters.','/eWFH7P8A9t8Bg6MkLPYmvS4t6di.jpg','2014-09-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Big Game',230179,6.8488,5.5,'-30Ib-la1TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32199,_binary '\0','/jsCc3f3PufBfrZfhCQ6rTkBmjDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088012',7.3,1391,'ko','완득이','A deadbeat teacher helps an angry, aimless teenager find direction in life during his final year of high school.','/tO5IOFRHOIECJEdYIjP5my2OZSg.jpg','2011-10-20',110,'Released','The colorful encounters of my turning point.','Punch',91078,1.8578,6.9,'2MkoXh8xE_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32200,_binary '\0','/9F2FlpYQ1flSklBADm7qqqB8x4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088745',7.1,4207,'en','Iverson','Iverson is the ultimate legacy of NBA legend Allen Iverson, who rose from a childhood of crushing poverty in Hampton, Virginia, to become an 11-time NBA All-Star and universally recognized icon of his sport. Off the court, his audacious rejection of conservative NBA convention and unapologetic embrace of hip hop culture sent shockwaves throughout the league and influenced an entire generation. Told largely in Iverson\'s own words, the film charts the career highs and lows of one of the most distinctive and accomplished figures the sport of basketball has ever seen.','/8JKFYFOzsW4ScokxzjlkyTgxVb1.jpg','2014-04-27',87,'Released','Others played the game. He changed it.','Iverson',266442,0.968,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32201,_binary '\0','/6Ib5nqkY1sn0bGjaICcpFY4Yvqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088847',6.5,1428,'te','ఓ మై ఫ్రెండ్','Two childhood friends, who believe they share a platonic bond. When complications arise in their romantic relationships due to their friendship, how will their relationship evolve?','/dRUrvQt8j9OGypi0LvbImKp6ZNp.jpg','2011-11-11',131,'Released',NULL,'Oh My Friend',86717,1.4731,6.386,'srvtcq-kDb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32202,_binary '\0','/dMNGf2gN9UXZFTlTvsTP4s50vOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088869',4.1,5814,'en','Percentage','After a drug deal gone wrong, two New York City hustlers relocate to Miami, where they set up a lucrative credit card fraud operation. Unfortunately, their new business not only attracts the police, but the city\'s top criminals -- and both want a percentage of the take.','/29XbWNchwireAfDJ7IKXF6ScnZY.jpg','2013-04-24',82,'Released',NULL,'Percentage',203264,1.5037,4.5,'yEJj0FQ3EFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32203,_binary '\0','/r6ywEjkxI7020Qmf3PF499Arku5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088893',6.4,1959,'en','Shell','Abandoned by her mother when she was a child, Shell has stayed to take care of her dying father but now feels trapped within the beautiful but desolate landscape that surrounds her. With only her routine of running the decaying petrol station, taking care of her father, and spending afternoons in her bedroom with a local mechanic, life is passing Shell by with every passing truck that rattles her walls. One day a salesman stops to re-fuel and offers Shell a taste of the outside world that takes her closer than ever to the edge of the road and her desire to escape.','/ccAlGG65s2Q5J0Roy6T2rmBQqhi.jpg','2013-03-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Shell',135990,1.4433,6.26,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32204,_binary '\0','/tHqpMjzUANHHMk5fUPofrqUbaI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088923',2.3,1989,'en','The Cloth','Action/horror story centered on a secret organization formed by the Catholic Church to counteract the rising number of cases of demonic possessions across the country. The story follows a young godless man who is being recruited into the cloth in order to prepare a new generation with the tools needed to stop the rise of the ultimate evil; Beelzebub.','/o1UMaleuGx3BaUJMtZtB0JsjuKV.jpg','2012-10-28',88,'Released','The battle for your soul, has begun!','The Cloth',86215,1.3552,2.5,'PEAhYE7ybcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32205,_binary '\0','/qxSy8xkhAxtqDM2ysSU41xjAlIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2088950',5.6,6119,'en','The Show','An unsettling look at reality television, where a disturbing game show has its contestants ending their lives for the public\'s enjoyment.','/oe0WzIcsCfwYLu5WhHKOjXO4aYx.jpg','2017-09-21',104,'Released','It\'s a matter of life and death.','The Show',375098,3.2664,5.7,'-mTMC1V5G4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32206,_binary '\0','/8ordwFmmfEEtzyXWFF1VtepDJgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2089750',5.4,5118,'en','Nativity 2: Danger in the Manger!','This sequel to the popular British comedy sees a new teacher (David Tennant) take over. When he enters his school in the National \'Song for Christmas\' Competition, he and his pregnant wife, and the schoolchildren, embark on an epic road trip that ends up with a birth and a donkey, where he must embrace his fears and become a hero.','/6FkBNdHWsRdt45HYMex7QYJOdN8.jpg','2012-11-23',105,'Released',NULL,'Nativity 2: Danger in the Manger!',139380,2.2311,5.5,'TozJszmbzvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32207,_binary '\0','/tQBJu83JWyP9tEQ4iGLdiErDwnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2090465',6.1,16110,'en','Black Butterfly','Paul is a down-on-his-luck screenwriter who picks up a drifter and offers him a place to stay. However, when the deranged stranger takes Paul hostage and forces him to write, their unhinged relationship brings buried secrets to light.','/toB9yjJssyJZSworX0KePbjSexP.jpg','2017-05-26',93,'Released',NULL,'Black Butterfly',76812,5.4451,6.206,'USR9JMDPpIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32208,_binary '\0','/iEoswpT189UFsp28bE0gOOiScB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2090537',6.9,2405,'en','Jack Irish: Black Tide','Jack Irish has no shortage of friends, but family members are few and far between. His wife was murdered by an ex-client and his father is a fading photo on the pubs football wall of fame. So when Des Connors, the last link to his dad, calls to ask for help in the matter of a missing son, Jack is more than happy to lend a hand. But sometimes prodigal sons go missing for a reason... As Jack begins to dig, he discovers that Gary Connors was a man with something to hide, and his friends are people with yet darker and even more deadly secrets.','/4v6UE8i5qNjOOjlCde7nn82InvE.jpg','2012-10-24',98,'Released','It can pull you under.','Jack Irish: Black Tide',141099,1.9503,6.6,'dfRnjS7Khp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32209,_binary '\0','/eFapRVR9ycSAKSBQpf2fO2VSXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2090629',3.5,1935,'en','The Culling','Five college pals head out of town for a fun weekend, but plans quickly change after they encounter a strange 7-year old girl at an abandoned roadside cafe and offer to drive her home - and come face to face with evil incarnate.','/cSuTZbBzBeyVMiI2qGn6f8hhEYd.jpg','2015-03-15',81,'Released','When the devil breeds...a new evil is born.','The Culling',309889,2.0369,3.9,'ZGZZvnvx7_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32210,_binary '\0','/jEX09yj69kQrZSKoKfnHKtPNQWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20911974',5.5,2567,'en','My Mother\'s Wedding','Three sisters return to their home for the third wedding of their twice-widowed mother. But the mother and daughters are forced to revisit the past and confront the future, with help from a colorful group of unexpected wedding guests.','/feHTwv3BplNlLW3o9LtW2kqZLJg.jpg','2025-08-08',96,'Released','Celebrate love all over again.','My Mother\'s Wedding',985602,5.734,6.144,'tdhh-2iW_n8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32211,_binary '\0','/badH8voj3PdUp1LlcfhII8F0FiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091235',7.3,2430,'es','Azul y no tan rosa','The story of Diego, a young and successful photographer that lives in the glamorous world of fashion, shallowness and excess. A tragic accident turns his world around; his partner is now in a coma. Unexpectedly, and right at this terrible time, Diego must take care of his son, Armando. Now, both of them have to adapt to each other; Armando to the unknown, homosexual world of his father, and Diego to the closed attitude of his teenage son.','/hlAtgCDpCea5s4X7JrV6TS88vsX.jpg','2012-11-27',114,'Released',NULL,'My Straight Son',168379,1.3205,7.7,'6EtUi0-inU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32212,_binary '\0','/5ceIqlRzWH4x1IPU9OfjXHO2Kz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091256',6.2,37428,'en','Captain Underpants: The First Epic Movie','Based on the bestselling book series, this outrageous comedy tells the story of George and Harold, two overly imaginative pranksters who hypnotize their principal into thinking he’s an enthusiastic, yet dimwitted, superhero named Captain Underpants.','/vKSmaPct5OEeMoD8ue30RisHlKD.jpg','2017-06-01',89,'Released','50% hero. 100% cotton.','Captain Underpants: The First Epic Movie',268531,10.6221,6.3,'zs2SrqLum1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32213,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091318',6.6,1644,'en','I Am Not a Hipster','Things are not looking good for Brook, a young, talented singer/songwriter who has become the clichéd tortured artist. Slow to come to terms with the death of his mother, Brook is self-absorbed, aggressive, and the major obstruction to his own career success. His isolation is lifted when his three sisters and estranged father come to spread his mother’s ashes. Brook’s loving sisters have a magical effect on his anger and apathy, suggesting there may be hope for the misanthropic musician after all.','/nvyEBK4vLIrdoPx5cek3Bavk22.jpg','2013-01-09',90,'Released',NULL,'I Am Not a Hipster',84283,1.4595,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32214,_binary '\0','/tOp0HxHsQBQiTkD7vmTSkgRVlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091325',4.5,5485,'en','Bad Johnson','With women practically throwing themselves at him, Rich can’t control himself. But he continually blames his penis, which seems to have a mind of its own. After ruining yet another promising relationship with Jamie, Rich has finally had enough and wishes his penis would just leave him alone. The next morning, Rich wakes up to find his wish has come true and his johnson is no longer on his body.','/j9w5V6N5RqzoYGeLDgrBpJ2iy6a.jpg','2014-05-02',87,'Released','Say hello to his little friend.','Bad Johnson',258805,2.199,4.6,'4X65idlOHp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32215,_binary '\0','/BjY9Sm4nAULcIchY6MTcX6oa72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091327',4.2,3067,'en','Pleasure or Pain','A young designer falls under a man\'s erotic spell and is drawn into a world of sexual abandon from which she may never return.','/hPsB2NZozctyxl9juWPZzdIpHxa.jpg','2013-09-05',102,'Released','How far would you go... as far as you dare.','Pleasure or Pain',251783,6.2679,4.8,'J6LMT2QYDVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32216,_binary '\0','/4uERmytN70Z1qptFk55dXSO1D7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091384',6.5,4505,'te','పంజా','Jai, an orphan, falls into bad company after Bhagwan, a gangster, gives him shelter and hope to live. However, Jai and Munna, Bhagwan\'s son, fight with each other after Munna kills an innocent woman.','/fW2dqMDDo6dz2GAAJgYIwfcuvik.jpg','2011-12-09',156,'Released',NULL,'Panjaa',80539,1.3635,5.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32217,_binary '\0','/pq0YbRUY7JMbuElDWIK6nRoFSdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091473',6.6,41205,'en','Promised Land','A salesman for a natural gas company experiences life-changing events after arriving in a small town, where his corporation wants to tap into the available resources.','/5C0b6Wu4Z0V4NuA1cD8SZU7FCkb.jpg','2012-09-23',106,'Released','What\'s your price?','Promised Land',133694,5.7342,6.296,'vzEcZJSdW-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32218,_binary '\0','/st3saCQAN1q72ws0gHoFLmQ0rL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091478',5.1,13077,'en','Air','In the near future, breathable air is nonexistent. Virtually all of humanity has disappeared, and those chosen to reestablish society reside in a controlled state of suspended animation. Two engineers tasked with guarding the last hope for mankind struggle to preserve their own sanity and lives while administering to the vital task at hand.','/vs7xGGYZltIZuLTcCgDp73tTJYn.jpg','2015-08-14',94,'Released','Two men. One Task: save humankind.','Air',284674,2.435,4.99,'L8tKXWulnu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32219,_binary '\0','/ymDCdsobG8P4S3epFvT0CLDvEhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20916568',6.2,21777,'en','The Wrath of Becky','Two years after she escaped a violent attack on her family, 16-year-old Becky attempts to rebuild her life in the care of an older woman -- a kindred spirit named Elena. However, when a violent group known as the Noble Men break into their home, attack them and take their beloved dog, Becky must return to her old ways to protect herself and her loved ones.','/k9NeWFZCC7XKDdh9HK8cZBqZmHD.jpg','2023-05-26',83,'Released','Hell hath no fury like a 16-year-old scorned.','The Wrath of Becky',986070,7.2241,6.4,'Q-RnvQACrH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32220,_binary '\0','/wMNY6tU9WOUeAMRfqbCYwceOl9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt20917338',6.2,9329,'en','Scrooge: A Christmas Carol','On a cold Christmas Eve, selfish miser Ebenezer Scrooge has one night left to face his past — and change the future — before time runs out.','/oyGb5JpEYMEqDDjfJKLEvPTVSjK.jpg','2022-11-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Scrooge: A Christmas Carol',1001865,5.3414,6.8,'tZylTiyaWV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32221,_binary '\0','/ugnGe88pG04SViHpbXbqenzKkOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2091935',6.3,66344,'en','Mr. Right','A girl falls for the \"perfect\" guy, who happens to have a very fatal flaw: he\'s a hitman on the run from the crime cartels who employ him.','/aSx5YUCLcSUAR4nt93aeIpZYHF6.jpg','2016-02-29',95,'Released','They make a killer couple.','Mr. Right',333385,6.1018,6.4,'5dSDOlC-MoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32222,_binary '\0','/t3aBB33j4NiJMWAh7LZefULfdLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2092011',6.2,5471,'en','What Richard Did','What Richard Did is a striking portrait of the fall of a Dublin golden-boy and high school rugby star whose world unravels one summer night.','/m9Cq5ueENbP16X7cJtOxGYbTUW8.jpg','2012-09-09',87,'Released',NULL,'What Richard Did',128248,1.9542,5.7,'xXTcSCp8R6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32223,_binary '\0','/koE0U8zlwdWNLE3oADZeUFFGBah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093100',7.4,1443,'ru','Дом','In a large house in the middle of the steppes, the Shamanovs meet for a family gathering. When suddenly the eldest brother Victor appears after a 25 year absence, unspoken family conflicts come to light. Nobody suspects that Victor is escaping his dark past and that killers are looking for his hiding place.','/iSnRfGxEeX9O2rTHcWn38qR5D1F.jpg','2011-11-03',127,'Released',NULL,'Home',79580,0.8853,6,'-Pi4BjfTURk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32224,_binary '\0','/oPfD5GVMDTWEzER8PwQY9k7eQZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093270',5.9,9069,'en','The Returned','In a post-zombie world, where the infected live normal lives, their retroviral drug is running out.','/gMdNeOFGmYXdan1ov835HOio1Qn.jpg','2013-11-15',98,'Released','Neither Zombies Nor Humans','The Returned',227094,2.2129,6.027,'B6h5vtY5qZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32225,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093944',4.4,3837,'en','Amber Alert','When a group of friends decides to follow a car they\'ve seen posted on an Amber Alert, things start to go very wrong.','/jP8nszewPaJvSPprobpItyRbsB5.jpg','2012-11-02',81,'Released','You are her last hope.','Amber Alert',135670,0.7352,5,'-GVEq7qBgcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32226,_binary '\0','/dPGn9ONgU9vYuViebCoBdHGDbHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093977',5.6,7212,'en','Crush','A secret admirer\'s crush on a high school athlete takes a fatal turn.','/ntQhvoStjTJhmj755UFx6TuC6yp.jpg','2013-03-13',94,'Released','Careful what you wish for','Crush',183662,2.8175,5.969,'uW150YnKkOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32227,_binary '\0','/wJt1THSshTQPedR6zC9a4WCzF26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093990',6.4,6891,'es','El Niño','Two youths, Niño and Compi, enter the world of drug smuggling in the Strait of Gibraltar; while two police officers, Jesús and Eva, try to eradicate the contraband.','/oqg4JAvb1Rv4kmYgLXFWwZLDDDn.jpg','2014-08-29',136,'Released',NULL,'The Kid',247182,2.2679,6.4,'VnuFKCohNLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32228,_binary '\0','/4qqX8rBDa4Dzqf6pSSumpFoEHMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093991',6.3,15657,'en','Elvis & Nixon','In 1970, a few days before Christmas, Elvis Presley showed up on the White House lawn seeking to be deputized into the Bureau of Narcotics and Dangerous Drugs by the President himself.','/pwUXhwUAOq3J7ixxwOIWpMAFbje.jpg','2016-03-22',86,'Released','On December 21st, 1970, two of America\'s greatest recording artists met for the first time.','Elvis & Nixon',301348,4.2664,6,'o9x3Z6b0Z1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32229,_binary '\0','/8prCWy4k9oFHBlth5jT33p0SoJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2093995',6.4,3781,'en','Fort Bliss','After returning home from an extended tour in Afghanistan, a decorated U.S. Army medic and single mother struggles to rebuild her relationship with her young son.','/bDCWv9myyBpkvrKfcQusosFRAg1.jpg','2014-09-05',116,'Released','Soldier. Mother. So many expectations.','Fort Bliss',