etween unconditional love and a new addiction.','/aGwFRwsqkCX1eMsMZCD0tgGA8Fr.jpg','2024-04-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Parachute',953713,3.2792,6.7,'4c9VmKpX77Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32292,_binary '\0','/zXwyVgBIUGUxAURd3uwizFqYV4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21058846',6.5,1605,'en','My Grown-Up Christmas List','Taylor, a journalist, and Luke, in the military, share a special bond that grows between them over the course of several Christmases that they spend together and apart.','/liXcawutrsGtQc8CmPYlQadWqGW.jpg','2022-07-09',84,'Released',NULL,'My Grown-Up Christmas List',983232,1.9819,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32293,_binary '\0','/dj2i9BbqoUEJMazscIsSI6D7pqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21059394',6.9,3251,'pa','Lover','Lally is madly in love with his school mate Heer. Things take an interesting turn when Heer and Lally are separated from each other.','/tQnVzRUaDYnzPGDM44XlpmHCbEk.jpg','2022-07-01',135,'Released','True love stories never end','Lover',993609,0.7113,6,'J8eU7bEs7_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32294,_binary '\0','/qg2ar8RD0V543u8T35SxTguGV2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21059520',7.3,26491,'en','Girl in the Picture','A young mother’s mysterious death and her son’s subsequent kidnapping blow open a decades-long mystery about the woman’s true identity, and the murderous federal fugitive at the center of it all.','/w6dnirDUhvWuHy91QECqGSYmOpa.jpg','2022-07-06',101,'Released','Her identity was a mystery to everyone. Even her.','Girl in the Picture',988046,3.0258,7.1,'jnJ4BGNpby8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32295,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106284',6.4,2205,'en','$50K and a Call Girl: A Love Story','When Ross is diagnosed with terminal brain cancer and given six weeks to live, his newly engaged older brother Seth offers to spend his $50,000 wedding fund on a final trip of a lifetime. Their plans are complicated when Ross invites a call girl to join the group and Seth’s uptight fiancée insists on tagging along. This raucous road trip comedy features hip-hop star Asher Roth.','/buer6JTPgKwNgtFZVfy6h33BCgR.jpg','2014-01-10',90,'Released',NULL,'$50K and a Call Girl: A Love Story',248268,1.0996,5.7,'UJChXXJiKwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32296,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106350',5.6,1268,'en','Borealis','Set in 2045, Vic, an ex-ultimate fighter, is the owner of the only airstrip, hotel and bar in the high Arctic frontier town of Borealis. He does his best to keep the peace amongst a vast array of clashing characters in this lawless international free zone that sits on top of the world’s last remaining oil.','/Aia25jQYPdpK9lRSW5RyNxotQFV.jpg','2013-01-11',88,'Released','Their Battle is to Survive','Survival Code',158106,1.4293,5.3,'17yQpuf3LRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32297,_binary '\0','/965wciBY5wAbQPd6AJyVgBZSk1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106361',5.8,75156,'en','Into the Storm','As a new day begins in the town of Silverton, its residents have little reason to believe it will be anything other than ordinary. Mother Nature, however has other plans. In the span of just a few hours, an unprecedented onslaught of powerful tornadoes ravages Silverton. Storm trackers predict that the worst is still to come, as terrified residents seek shelter, and professional storm-chasers run toward the danger, hoping to study the phenomenon close up and get a once-in-a-lifetime shot.','/kBgrhrES9kMKSPxawUYV61KjlnB.jpg','2014-08-06',89,'Released','There is no calm before the storm.','Into the Storm',216282,8.4596,6.074,'eierBlblwec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32298,_binary '\0','/k4oreWZCB8NW1c5eJGozi5YU7ca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21064272',6.4,1464,'en','Machine Gun Kelly\'s Life In Pink','An in-depth look at the dramatic highs and lows of an artist chasing music\'s top spot while tackling noise from the outside world, stardom, fatherhood and more. From creating his platinum-selling, Billboard No. 1 album “Tickets to My Downfall,” to his most recent No. 1 studio album, “Mainstream Sellout,” this is an all-access pass, that goes beyond the headlines, into the chaotic world of Machine Gun Kelly.','/eiJxvswZSc3dc3DfAUw2YvC254u.jpg','2022-06-27',102,'Released','Inside the world of this generation\'s most polarizing rock star.','Machine Gun Kelly\'s Life In Pink',988460,2.0945,7.7,'xK-wXyzhtp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32299,_binary '\0','/4l65BWqJBl7hBwdIwp2nQdwsOuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21064584',7.5,122028,'en','The Iron Claw','The true story of the inseparable Von Erich brothers, who made history in the intensely competitive world of professional wrestling in the early 1980s. Through tragedy and triumph, under the shadow of their domineering father and coach, the brothers seek larger-than-life immortality on the biggest stage in sports.','/s2VLjcykJfwplJNGT5iEeCA0mRx.jpg','2023-12-21',133,'Released','Sons. Brothers. Champions.','The Iron Claw',850165,16.4196,7.5,'8KVsaoveTbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32300,_binary '\0','/jmVWlCZ8hRtmrQGbKXXFHsrSohp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106476',8.3,418395,'da','Jagten','A teacher lives a lonely life, all the while struggling over his son’s custody. His life slowly gets better as he finds love and receives good news from his son, but his new luck is about to be brutally shattered by an innocent little lie.','/jkixsXzRh28q3PCqFoWcf7unghT.jpg','2012-10-25',116,'Released','The lie is spreading.','The Hunt',103663,12.8167,8.097,'0KwzEQPMppI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32301,_binary '\0','/zjPOZtbAZPjF70dLUN2NWT3Tl1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21065274',5.4,2124,'en','Black Diamond','Follows a young woman whose idyllic life with her hedge funder boyfriend turns it into a deadly triangle of lust, obsession and murder after meeting a local cowboy handyman.','/6Tzq8vYW5ji0WQnMkg8kBFx3tWJ.jpg','2025-01-10',89,'Released',NULL,'Black Diamond',1091862,3.0773,5.3,'VdPar752vpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32302,_binary '\0','/gmXiFZzZQvtOqdbpMepM8rw0oVO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106529',5.6,1663,'en','Lust for Love','Winning your childhood sweetheart can create more problems than it solves.','/5tx4eGgX0Ede9oiLJD8adM5Iv6O.jpg','2014-02-07',85,'Released',NULL,'Lust for Love',113091,1.5632,5.4,'eAlPSApVKOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32303,_binary '\0','/dqhG3R56QW1Kf0ddRBLAGXGvKgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106537',5.5,6535,'hi','मटरू की बिजली का मंडोला','Harry is an industrialist who loves his daughter Bijlee, and the bond they share with Harry\'s man friday, Matru. Bijlee\'s plan to wed the son of a politician, however, brings twists and turns in the lives of Matru, Bijlee and Mandola.','/bUc4nB4FgGFrwhhFlmUlvspa1RN.jpg','2013-01-10',151,'Released',NULL,'Matru Ki Bijlee Ka Mandola',139521,0.9294,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32304,_binary '\0','/QJ5MFYnHYCy6wLLeGo0xbngjEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106550',6.2,6137,'fr','Möbius','An FSB officer falls in love with his agent, an American woman who works as a trader in a Russian bank.','/8OA7xqy0mvq62DYVloqnRvmUkmM.jpg','2013-02-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Möbius',170689,2.6416,5.699,'lc_tBR4f3YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32305,_binary '\0','/cBrzOqgAJv1YG4Jww9dt1B54Sv8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106651',6.3,71589,'en','Spectral','A special-ops team is dispatched to fight supernatural beings that have taken over a European city.','/5yprxs7ZyBr58RsTQJrKCVmqk8X.jpg','2016-12-09',109,'Released','How do you stop an enemy you can\'t see coming?','Spectral',324670,7.5415,6.6,'rmC3ZhIHHi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32306,_binary '\0','/n8aPq7Hfcc4BZu3znLY1kFMqNpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106670',5.7,1822,'ko','돈의 맛','The assistant of a wealthy socialite reveals her husband\'s salacious affair. The fallout entangles him in a web of sex, love and deceit that could threaten his life and career.','/uMz28D5XxrdUddxfJpR3NJDAbVi.jpg','2012-05-17',115,'Released','Money, Where All Lusts Begin.','The Taste of Money',103750,5.7868,5.5,'Fns9FTUpQ2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32307,_binary '\0','/wcnMRuiLeGFJprzUy17BfxoxpqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106671',7.1,4337,'tr','Tepenin Ardı','In the quiet foothills of Turkey, Faik lives an isolated existence. When his second son brings his boys for a visit, Faik takes the opportunity to pontificate about the law of the land, as he sees it. He shares one unsolicited thought after the next, most particularly focusing on the elusive nomads whom he suspects have been trespassing on his property. The day and night wear on, and each member of the clan takes his turn entrusting the film\'s audience with his own dark secret.','/SN9t45t6hImAjr1AzB85gUICxZ.jpg','2012-12-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Hill',138574,0.75,6.779,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32308,_binary '\0','/zspVrc2CgJo4Q5IIYUpt6qOY035.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106675',2.7,1507,'en','ThanksKilling 3','A fowl-mouthed turkey and a cast of outrageous puppets embark on a surreal quest to find the lost sequel, ThanksKilling 2.','/idcDC9M0DOOYEzxRFFv4wUMNUHs.jpg','2012-11-01',99,'Released','Only one copy remains.','ThanksKilling 3',140750,1.3737,3.3,'I-u5baokRi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32309,_binary '\0','/rvWsU70sypCSSSWlK4TjyAxn1jX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2106741',6.5,2436,'zh','消失的子弹','One rainy night in an arms factory near Shanghai, a young female worker accused of stealing a box of bullets from the ruthless Boss Ding is violently killed in a game of Russian roulette. Half a month later, a series of inexplicable deaths takes place in the factory, where the victims are shot but no bullets are found. Rumors of a deadly curse begin to spread in the factory, terrorizing the workers there. So, eccentric police inspector Song Donglu and his hot-blooded, gunslinging partner Guo Zhui are sent in to investigate the mystery of the phantom bullets...','/8G5SjBSUuWYn4se8rIOxAZdsFxD.jpg','2012-08-14',108,'Released',NULL,'The Bullet Vanishes',129850,2.2737,6.404,'03NAGSuhXss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32310,_binary '\0','/5xWFdQjaupH6bEN0BB6rIsPWBca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21071620',7.3,5102,'ml','പൂക്കാലം','A couple in their late 90s, lead a happy life with a large family of four generations. On the day of their granddaughter\'s engagement an unexpected event sends them on a magical journey that will test their familial bonds.','/otS5iKajrP2HxZhXi9VgZ5O02Md.jpg','2023-04-08',136,'Released',NULL,'Pookkaalam',988546,1.0525,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32311,_binary '\0','/fkAHZ4Oh11JB7fueQgPeBg63cMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21076374',6.5,2011,'te','బలమెవ్వడు','Satyanarayana, an insurance agent falls in love with Parnika, a dance student. In the following events, he unintentionally rescues her from an assault, and after multiple meetings, they eventually fall in love. But their world is shaken when Parnika is diagnosed with cancer. Is she really suffering from cancer, or is there a cynical medical mafia behind it?','/uESegTpq5HorPGrbjrA4r1vtRqW.jpg','2022-10-01',130,'Released',NULL,'Balamevvadu',1031224,1.0876,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32312,_binary '\0','/nNSdn9EgNHg7kJRK5cR0M0F3CXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2107648',5.5,4688,'es','Ahí va el diablo','A married couple loses their children while on a family trip near some caves in Tijuana. The kids eventually reappear without explanation, but it becomes clear that they are not who they used to be, that something terrifying has changed them.','/xj5eqCfIxU5H99vCthrR2tkpG5N.jpg','2012-09-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Here Comes the Devil',123359,1.6334,5.5,'7SJH7KySdrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32313,_binary '\0','/8DKOGOxky0wOFawQiWSfRKL5weU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2107651',6.1,1562,'en','I Married Who?','Straight-laced Jordan (Martin) is about to marry Peter (Snedeker), a clean-cut ambitious attorney. Before she walks down the aisle, Jordan and her best friends, Claire (Adrienne Frantz) and Jessica (Daphnee Duplaix), head to Vegas for a bachelorette party, because what happens in Vegas stays in Vegas, right? But when Jordan wakes up the next morning unable to recall the night before, she panics when she finds she’s in movie star Matt\'s (Ethan Erickson) hotel suite with a gigantic diamond on her finger and a marriage certificate lying nearby. Before Jordan can have the marriage annulled and put this nightmare behind her, the impromptu wedding explodes into a publicity stunt fueled by Matt’s manager Eric (Bruce Nozick) to promote his latest movie. With her wedding day approaching, Jordan finds herself more confused than ever when she starts falling in love with the movie star she’s married to instead of the fiancé she thought was her perfect match.','/lLqUdTxPCxSPANKeNHl5wusH7Ze.jpg','2012-10-20',86,'Released',NULL,'I Married Who?',139251,1.6775,6,'GoBQR4Ycxpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32314,_binary '\0','/sQGHdkl0dnHRnA6EpFXlq1R0T78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2107814',5.7,4522,'de','Schutzengel','15-year-old Nina witnesses a terrible crime that puts her life in danger. Being an orphan, she has nobody she can trust. When corrupt businessman Thomas Backer sends five killers after Nina, witness protection officer, Max, a former special-forces soldier, is responsible for her safety. They soon overcome their initial distance to find common ground. While on the run from the ruthless Backer, Rudi, one of Max’s former comrades, comes to their rescue – and continues to help the two out of some precarious situations. Even Max’s ex-girlfriend Sara is not just there to help him as a federal prosecutor. Nevertheless, Nina and Max face ever-increasing danger, and soon the teenager is not the only one in need of a guardian angel – Max could use one too.','/yG98ZiFFR8ika8O30HydnMuS5mD.jpg','2012-09-18',133,'Released',NULL,'The Guardians',130747,2.3406,6.06,'-RAAn1SMsg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32315,_binary '\0','/4YC5MSjnODf2y57Dn7ZjpDOkRkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2107850',7.4,1217,'en','The Case Against 8','A behind-the-scenes look inside the case to overturn California\'s ban on same-sex marriage. Shot over five years, the film follows the unlikely team that took the first federal marriage equality lawsuit to the U.S. Supreme Court.','/nFvuHsg8F0e0r3SPcpcHehsPDO.jpg','2014-06-06',109,'Released','Battles Are Won Because We Fight Them','The Case Against 8',250651,1.4575,6.75,'0TKTVbUEV-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32316,_binary '\0','/yWhPEx0CyRAVXtAeQspbDIcxXPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2107861',5.4,6910,'en','Walking on Sunshine','Set to the music of popular hit 1980s songs. A beautiful coastal village, present day Italy. After a whirlwind romance, Maddie is preparing to marry gorgeous Italian Raf, and has invited her sister Taylor to the wedding. Unbeknownst to Maddie, however, Raf is Taylor\'s ex-holiday flame, and the love of her life...','/hgsvghc0V4xnYKD80f0eqsB5IFZ.jpg','2014-06-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Walking on Sunshine',267863,2.9604,6.2,'lTNMJh_mWR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32317,_binary '\0','/eaJohfG999BgezzDnoXnuyRGmzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21080296',3,1459,'en','Trinket Box','A newlywed interracial couple Mike and Ava move to a new home set on starting new beginnings, but an historical evil, locked away for years, is about to break free and wreak havoc on their relationship and their lives.','/wBPTRWIjnL1UAkn7AmnF19QABx.jpg','2023-03-31',104,'Released','Our love bleeds darkness.','Trinket Box',1096996,1.0918,4.2,'ID7BNimpy4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32318,_binary '\0','/tJmIjMjVVb2UiTnIvvcA7XU0BcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21084334',6.6,1426,'en','I Heard the Bells','Known as America’s Poet, Henry Wadsworth Longfellow leads an idyllic life – until the day his world is shattered by tragedy. With a nation divided by Civil War and his family torn apart, Henry puts down his pen, silenced by grief. But it’s the sound of Christmas morning that reignites the poet’s lost voice as he discovers the resounding hope of rekindled faith.','/rk2IyAZIYWx9WzznLkNj0rdEyhR.jpg','2022-12-01',106,'Released','The inspiring true story behind the beloved Christmas carol.','I Heard the Bells',1039571,1.9284,6.8,'e5G8zeg9bS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32319,_binary '\0','/dQ2JyETNGbnJ7THrK74FPuyODTi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2108546',6.8,2362,'nl','Jackie','Two Dutch twin sisters travel to the United States, looking for their long-lost mother.','/d2w5CCy7uOVHkbSqQoulxWLYFzQ.jpg','2012-05-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Jackie',107178,1.1307,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32320,_binary '\0','/8Shh5uunWUXml7yd5Q7HxBCqDKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21086802',6,1376,'fr','Augure','After spending years in Belgium, a young Congolese man returns to his birthplace of Kinshasa to confront the intricacies of his family and culture.','/2HgCEfROW5U3dyBwXgT3ztkOBWq.jpg','2023-11-15',90,'Released','A story about love, family, and the pursuit of happiness.','Omen',889818,1.3809,5.7,'BjL0NOETPV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32321,_binary '\0','/1ZZ492nBiFTInejsrPQKiyHgz1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21087084',5.4,2477,'nl','Happy Ending','A young woman quietly unsatisfied in the bedroom by her boyfriend puts their relationship to the test when she proposes to o