ood when a woman and a mysterious child move in.','/na5tAslm1kGNcft083AIXMTOsYR.jpg','2012-10-17',87,'Released','All the activity has led to this...','Paranormal Activity 4',82990,6.8267,5.4,'BSCyPfiTlkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32326,_binary '\0','/wxr4Z6E83h14CogsZOzDm1vuDX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2109248',5.6,353634,'en','Transformers: Age of Extinction','As humanity picks up the pieces after the battle of Chicago, a shadowy group reveals itself in an attempt to control the direction of history…while an ancient, powerful new menace sets Earth in its crosshairs. With help from Cade Yeager, Optimus Prime and the Autobots rise to meet their most fearsome challenge yet.','/jyzrfx2WaeY60kYZpPYepSjGz4S.jpg','2014-06-25',165,'Released','This is not war, it\'s extinction.','Transformers: Age of Extinction',91314,20.6102,5.974,'S30VkLn5a2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32327,_binary '\0','/BcKs9SKK76hxeprG8NcMTd4iZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21093976',9.1,3642,'en','National Theatre Live: Prima Facie','Tessa is a young, brilliant barrister. From working class origins, she has reached the top of her game. An unexpected event forces her to confront the lines where the patriarchal power of the law, burden of proof and morals diverge.','/mA154UHwvm9bFEt6kEfVdyWyuAk.jpg','2022-07-21',114,'Released','There are no truths, only legal truths.','National Theatre Live: Prima Facie',963568,2.1553,8.81,'tOQ7YsxkVUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32328,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21094076',5.3,1318,'ml','ടു മെൻ','This is the story of two men from opposite ends of the spectrum of life, who somehow get inexplicably intertwined. The story happens over 24 hours, from the dawn of the eve of Bakrid to the dawn of Bakrid','/jsz4cB1jXuhH3bxYUDPq18hJLV7.jpg','2022-08-05',110,'Released','A journey not by choice','Two Men',1008019,1.0601,5,'yGFNaZ3H0ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10