allery',616251,4.4583,7.1,'-5AdZ_8I7sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32593,_binary '\0','/tBcIJccCUPXfc2RlNASvwLeaqu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2140577',6.3,10726,'en','The Pretty One','When her idolized twin sister Audrey dies in a car accident, Laurel decides to take her place. But, as she eases into the life she has always wanted, she must decide between continuing the lie or revealing herself.','/rIYgspS4xulnonEUG2Xh3VXfDt0.jpg','2014-02-07',90,'Released',NULL,'The Pretty One',174337,3.1793,6.111,'WhTA9Ru68iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32594,_binary '\0','/dgZ5e1q6dGUYLUxepmZTmoGqwEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2140619',6.3,76852,'en','Two Night Stand','After an extremely regrettable one night stand, two strangers wake up to find themselves snowed in after sleeping through a blizzard that put all of Manhattan on ice. They\'re now trapped together in a tiny apartment, forced to get to know each other way more than any one night stand should.','/rz0YnlHieXP9SBuJU4ANBW8ttIw.jpg','2014-09-26',86,'Released','Before love. After sex.','Two Night Stand',286554,5.0801,6.412,'Kb7xAUHKhok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32595,_binary '\0','/xZJWIX09rE0YHohBekt8WwENdow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2140629',5.8,10369,'en','Arizona','Set in the midst of the 2009 housing crisis, the life of Cassie Fowler, a single mother and struggling realtor, goes off the rails when she witnesses a murder.','/AcqXQms8AzkrTL22FbT9VKcjt7.jpg','2018-08-24',85,'Released','The heat is on, but it’s a dry heat.','Arizona',490004,1.9991,5.4,'jIAH3h_rSUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32596,_binary '\0','/vx9iOv68dEsIyqRUVHyJJlXbhcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2140671',5,2648,'sv','Vittra','Ida and Albin are a happy couple. They set off to a cabin in the vast Swedish woodlands to have a fun holiday with their friends. But under the floorboards is an evil that waits to be unleashed.','/fJGXQyhekGgFEHUXQmuR9b3k6Iu.jpg','2013-05-04',96,'Released','Say Goodbye to Your Friends','Wither',134812,1.729,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32597,_binary '\0','/aWLkVSdeTpO3OXkP1qNCnqaV51L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21412402',6.8,1231,'it','Cento domeniche','Antonio, a former shipyard worker, leads a mild and peaceful life: he plays bowls with friends, takes care of his elderly mother, has an ex-wife with whom he is on excellent terms and Emilia, his only and beloved daughter When Emilia announces to him one day that she has decided to get married, Antonio is filled with joy, he can finally fulfill his dream by giving her the reception they have always dreamed of together being able to count on the savings of a lifetime.However, the bank of which he has always been a client seems to be hiding something, the employees are suddenly elusive and the director inexplicably changes constantly.The task of paying for his daughter\'s wedding will prove increasingly difficult and Antonio will discover, against his will, that those who keep our treasures don\'t always keep our dreams as well.','/yVYTR3TA8c3eoHPAg2lwt3UBWmK.jpg','2023-11-23',94,'Released',NULL,'100 Sundays',1013221,1.8738,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32598,_binary '\0','/lpwHaZ2zMtAOirsuLiyYQQbKmb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21417490',3.6,1281,'en','What Lurks Beneath','The crew of USS Titan find themselves on the brink of World War 3 with Russia, when a naked stowaway appears in one of their torpedo tubes. The captain banks fears she may be Russian, but she\'s something far more dangerous.','/6LFSdNB610uSUZ08Y6xN4V3p8OV.jpg','2024-06-25',102,'Released','Don\'t capture what you can\'t control.','What Lurks Beneath',1330167,1.4269,5.7,'ND3kILiJRC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32599,_binary '\0','/yMh8badxy3ekUavcBNW37hjWE1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2141751',6.4,9557,'en','God Help the Girl','Eve is a catastro