/ekdyrBffLhoFWkm5eUVAbIhDVh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21445686',7.5,4398,'en','Batman: The Long Halloween Deluxe Edition','Atrocious serial killings on holidays in Gotham City send The World\'s Greatest Detective into action - confronting both organized crime and a unified front of classic DC Super-Villains - while attempting to stop the mysterious murderer.','/15erh7z92WBiW6z8Xpb8WLaWhbD.jpg','2022-09-19',168,'Released',NULL,'Batman: The Long Halloween Deluxe Edition',1010830,2.6057,7.196,'PGc_YOV9-U8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32625,_binary '\0','/c4CMeW8B2l0tA3ar5xtjWhALecS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21448540',4.7,4082,'en','Baby Ruby','After welcoming her baby, Ruby, home, the tightly scripted world of lifestyle influencer Jo starts to unravel. As increasingly sinister happenings mount, Jo is plunged into a waking fever dream where everyone is a threat and nothing is what it seems.','/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg','2023-02-03',93,'Released','A mother\'s instincts never lie.','Baby Ruby',1008374,2.5432,5.1,'4dhrL0MpJhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32626,_binary '\0','/xBIC287534LHt75X0OSig31euHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21451014',7.3,1876,'en','Unicorns','When hard-working single father Luke stumbles across an underground nightclub, he meets Aysha, a beautiful, seductive woman. Their first kiss yields fireworks — which are immediately followed by Luke’s sobering realization that Aysha is not the cisgender woman he thought, but a remarkably femme drag queen. Unable to deny the spark between them the pair are forced down the unexpected path of transformation, where they must question their identities and confront their individual truths.','/lVhD18gCDUjJ9dpMEhPdD5XPdJk.jpg','2024-07-05',120,'Released',NULL,'Unicorns',1008416,1.4839,6.8,'Vvr8Nh5SdKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32627,_binary '\0','/kwGvFyRtGSSm8AFfnRNXoZTQmJj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21454134',6.6,79559,'en','The Bikeriders','After a chance encounter, headstrong Kathy is drawn to Benny, member of Midwestern motorcycle club the Vandals. As the club transforms into a dangerous underworld of violence, Benny must choose between Kathy and his loyalty to the club.','/ApMuukdDAOR2rgaFDZIcjfigi64.jpg','2024-06-19',116,'Released','Legacies don\'t come easy.','The Bikeriders',1008409,12.0238,6.688,'7W0ec8UMnfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32628,_binary '\0','/t0eapHW6Be3oH5uXVVDMfJ5aeqf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2145829',4.6,7942,'en','Robot Overlords','Earth has been conquered by robots from another galaxy and the human survivors must stay in their homes, or risk incineration.','/n9zyjUoTkcxWPC2osR2AdblPza1.jpg','2015-01-29',90,'Released','Mankind May Fall. Heroes Will Rise.','Robot Overlords',240483,4.3314,4.8,'zr_5U4y6EG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32629,_binary '\0','/ccf4bJpXDby21gpk886MEsON6OY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2146836',7.2,2269,'ml','ഡയമണ്ട് നെക്‌ലെയ്സ്','Arun is an oncologist based in Dubai who lives life king size without worrying about the future. But he is in trouble when creditors start pestering him and he is restricted within the country.','/iYfZMu4z7nROu3tYfwsNyj34wBY.jpg','2012-05-04',157,'Released',NULL,'Diamond Necklace',141938,1.0475,7.017,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32630,_binary '\0','/ilUW044uC9GDI4h3nRUkn1tSclX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2146960',8.2,2479,'ta','வழக்கு எண் 18/9','Venu works at a roadside shop and loves Jyothi, a maidservant in the nearby apartments. Before Venu gets a chance to express his love to her, she meets with an accident and he is arrested.','/nVqwQPARr6Ak8OVm1Gqc3pSDMIC.jpg','2012-05-04',115,'Released',NULL,'Vazhakku Enn 18/9',109835,0.8084,7.278,'h520tLpw_aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32631,_binary '\0','/c3tOvnxFp2uUfLs6U8ew52N3FhO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21469794',5,11129,'en','Space Cadet','Tiffany \"Rex\" Simpson has always dreamed of going to space, and her \"doctored\" application lands her in NASA\'s ultra-competitive astronaut training program. In over her head, can this Florida girl rely on her quick wits, moxie and determination to get through training and into the cosmos before she blows her cover?','/7QUOIldN6ShKj1LdLhO26a8QXND.jpg','2024-07-04',110,'Released','Houston has a new problem.','Space Cadet',1019411,5.2741,5.5,'6wL3evhiN5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32632,_binary '\0','/qBQ3yAmdbPQK6TeAZz0OUd10PAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2147134',7.9,2657,'en','56 Up','When a cross-section of seven-year-olds were interviewed for 7 Up in 1964 it was immediately evident that their social backgrounds influenced their attitudes towards life. While the upper class children were confident and self-assured, those from middle and working class backgrounds were resigned to a challenging life of hard work. This premise was put to the test every seven years when the same group were interviewed about the progression of their lives. 49 years in the making, the changes that occurred to the original 14 make for fascinating television and are in many ways the stories of all our lives. From success and disappointment, marriage and childbirth, to poverty and illness, nearly every facet of life has been captured on film. Now, at the age of 56, the group are once more brought together and, with the benefit of hindsight, assess whether their lives have been ruled by circumstance or self-determination.','/gG9tFcx7SRN9KuKIFM0PVPycRum.jpg','2012-05-14',144,'Released','In 1964 a group of seven year old children were interviewed for the documentary \"Seven Up\". They\'ve been filmed every seven years since. Now they are 56.','56 Up',116167,1.7975,7.2,'f-U6RfKVzCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32633,_binary '\0','/oe5zpoVher2uZSvkhrHKi9H7TtW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2147319',6.4,4843,'ja','ヘルタースケルター','Top model Lilico, having recently undergone multiple cosmetic surgeries, begins to experience troubling side effects. As she desperately tries to retain her perfect image, Lilico descends into a world of nightmares and makes those around her miserable.','/nrTHLNNjejHgoVVkJUowkTpndI0.jpg','2012-07-14',127,'Released','How far will you go for beauty?','Helter Skelter',104524,5.5047,6.746,'JFQLVsWWoEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32634,_binary '\0','/bnYvSTHnlxNwDY4DwzDDtdj1tj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2147365',2.6,4457,'en','Keith Lemon: The Film','With dreams of becoming a successful entrepreneur just like his beloved Richard Branson, Lemon bids farewell to his hometown of Leeds and heads for the capital. When he becomes an overnight billionaire, it seems everything is going his way, but it\'s not long before he discovers that life can be just as cruel as it is kind.','/x2qasSMjbblXa6SQ6yp0w7G3TSO.jpg','2012-08-24',85,'Released','BIGGERER, LONGERER, FUNNIERER','Keith Lemon: The Film',118690,2.5917,2.952,'bIemgNIFKEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32635,_binary '\0','/du3jOKkHYJMhZCSwQuJGeWYGNFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2147459',4.9,4406,'en','Patrick','Patrick lays comatose in a small private hospital, his only action being his involuntary spitting. When a pretty young nurse, just separated from her husband, begins work at the hospital, she senses that Patrick is communicating with her, and he seems to be using his psychic powers to manipulate events in her life.','/7qBKs8ziqHEYydJJnRyTo6IGpFC.jpg','2013-10-15',96,'Released','Cruel. Controlling. Comatose.','Patrick',199578,2.2545,4.9,'0N5iCcPGqoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32636,_binary '\0','/endVnEgUGjibpLaF0yjUX2CWhh4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21477618',6.7,5150,'en','Mortal Kombat Legends: Snow Blind','The vicious, power-mad Kano is determined to take over Earthrealm, one soul at a time. Assisted by a trio of cold Black Dragon mercenaries, he embarks on a brutal assault from town to defenseless town. The choice is simple: kneel or be annihilated. Kenshi, a rebel warrior, calls on Kuai Liang, the only one powerful enough to challenge the malevolent Kano. But Kuai Liang has given up the ways of the warrior, and Kenshi is too undisciplined to defeat Kano himself. If Kuai Liang cannot break through the glacier of doubt that holds him back, Earthrealm will fall.','/8wyOdQRVrpoUb2wMdGHykaD17GM.jpg','2022-10-09',82,'Released','Evil is unleashed!','Mortal Kombat Legends: Snow Blind',1007401,5.0996,7.671,'vvqx3-1G9Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32637,_binary '\0','/7TIoq6DRnMn2aDViSRfPooWZkga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21478426',6.4,3010,'en','Life After Fighting','Retired martial arts world champion Alex Faulkner has settled into a simple life, when the disappearance of two of his students leads to an unthinkable discovery close to home. Just when all hope of finding the children is lost, he locates the imprisoned girls and unsurfaces an international child trafficking operation, which draws him back into the fight of his life against those behind it.','/wcf965PrbcIjFO6n3IIrSv09thh.jpg','2024-06-07',126,'Released',NULL,'Life After Fighting',1289601,3.1034,7.049,'KMdiYlC_cA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32638,_binary '\0','/eZLsPz4piloV44VBWQIsLhoQKR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21482312',6.6,1946,'tr','Tereddüt Çizgisi','A criminal lawyer Canan, divides her time in the courthouse and mother\'s hospital bed at night. She has to make a moral choice that will affect lives of her mother, judge and murder suspect client.','/kiRDQQBMXYJwxBTQ95xuDqH2z6.jpg','2024-05-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Hesitation Wound',1025377,1.068,6.5,'VaFpOwt0w6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32639,_binary '\0','/aBVrQPoXP4T1TTgH38CcKuknMBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2149053',4.7,1429,'fa','نارنجی پوش','The story of a professional photographer Hamed Aban and the radical change in his life. The teacher of his son gives him a book about nature and the cleaning of it. This changes him radically. He goes and hires himself in the municipality, wearing the orange suit like them and cleaning the streets, collecting garbage. Meanwhile his wife who is in Europe back home and is very angry with him. She insists on him to get back to his former work but he refusing. Then she wants a divorce and to take the son with herself to Europe.','/1dIM9S3z8HMqbVoRjZPm2MlbpEu.jpg','2012-02-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Orange Suit',389122,0.7097,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32640,_binary '\0','/c2OclSIAMM1978UATjWFFG2a5Dy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2149360',5.7,6505,'en','Found','Marty is the ideal fifth grader—he gets good grades, listens to his teachers and doesn\'t start trouble in class. But a darkness is beginning to fall over Marty\'s life, the kids at school won\'t stop picking on him, his parents just don\'t seem to understand him, and now Marty must grapple with a terrible secret that threatens to destroy life as he knows it—his big brother is a serial killer.','/a6KyeVoJ3gyttg8hu32ytSNOYO5.jpg','2012-03-30',103,'Released','Marty loved horror movies... Until his life turned into one.','Found',138941,1.3664,6.3,'Eca1gMpVbys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32641,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2149814',4.5,1895,'ar','رغبة متوحشة','A widow living with her daughter and sister-in-law attempt to forget a scandal committed by her late husband.','/eAgyL3YOZdJKXZHzBYVX2OipL8z.jpg','1991-06-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Untamed Desire',433287,1.0592,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32642,_binary '\0','/1qT6elYFPpsi0bEoXSiwPb908L7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2150139',4.8,1340,'en','A Second Chance','A young girl and her coach overcome adversity to make their way into the National Australian 