the big one that marks a life forever.','/3mtfNuPiORYsgvNBxoZhBmkHTDI.jpg','2012-01-18',95,'Released',NULL,'My First Time',113160,2.7962,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32650,_binary '\0','/cBhoqYyBzLFhHVZhaQH7aD0CEfF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2152896',8.2,2727,'ta','சுப்ரமணியபுரம்','In 1980, five friends live a carefree life in Madurai until they commit a near-perfect crime but do not manage to get away with it.','/n6fX9TDrzNPEYBK6ia1FMz84g2j.jpg','2008-07-04',145,'Released',NULL,'Subramaniapuram',76850,1.1872,7.357,'Ni6bUUeK4q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32651,_binary '\0','/cnmQ86KEX7OeWJlsg38Cu7zNRF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2153963',7.3,8001,'pt','Tabu','Lisbon, Portugal, 2010. Pilar, a pious woman devoted to social causes, maintains a peculiar relationship with her neighbor Aurora, a temperamental old woman obsessed with gambling who lives tormented by a mysterious past.','/mtr1ztUkJs6jsYdzK3gBLsuffr4.jpg','2012-04-05',120,'Released','Aurora had a farm in Africa, at the foot of Mount Tabu…','Tabu',93858,2.7386,6.978,'HoelUhjVXas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32652,_binary '\0','/bqWv9lqVpXO9kOrAZcdKaZjdQ1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2155399',7.1,4179,'pt','Variações','Film biography dwelling on the hectic artistic life of António Variações, a famous Portuguese pop rock singer from the 80s, who died from AIDS-related complications in 1984.','/mK0kFykY6zHMIJvIQGIpC6mCabW.jpg','2019-08-22',109,'Released',NULL,'Variações: Guardian Angel',529459,1.2366,7,'OmT7NWv2jJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32653,_binary '\0','/aCwM4hSUsboYKelX8XuxAReNPBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2156807',7.3,4579,'ar','إكس لارج','Magdy is searching for true love, so when he finds his childhood friend Dina on Facebook he tries to get closer to her. He is afraid that she would refuse him as he is very obese. So on their first meeting he told her that he is Magdy\'s cousin','/dBK3YVsY27F7VYWXdSrXqot947K.jpg','2011-11-01',130,'Released',NULL,'X-Large',103376,1.617,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32654,_binary '\0','/lAbBvE3c7EeynhYVqA4xDOFWfzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21572042',5,4477,'en','Aftermath','After waking up in the middle of a forest with no memories, a young woman is targeted by mysterious strangers with a motive as unclear as her way back home.','/3jVwnnSD4YxkGZM1F6RdLAu8Ayy.jpg','2024-01-29',78,'Released','There\'s nowhere to hide.','Aftermath',1144047,1.7064,4.9,'9DsnVfaOv1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32655,_binary '\0','/q77fnUaHG486dGgAdW4yrZFnqka.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2157346',6.6,2773,'de','Rommel','The story of the final seven months in the life of German Field Marshal Erwin Rommel.','/d61Zqug5ka7Rn0RsTPyQgJA30vO.jpg','2012-11-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Rommel',139862,3.1173,6.046,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32656,_binary '\0','/eQVNZF8KC5C5qjetpnphCDAb6n1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2160105',5.8,13051,'en','I Still See You','Ten years after an apocalyptic event left the world haunted by ghosts, Veronica \'Ronnie\' Calder receives a threatening message from beyond the grave. Joining forces with a mysterious classmate, Kirk, Ronnie descends into a shadow world that blurs the bounds of the living and the dead—and begins a desperate race against time to stop a cunning killer.','/9fqzZs922V8OmwgO11Eqclof2mQ.jpg','2018-09-27',98,'Released','What if your whole world was haunted?','I Still See You',448095,7.3147,6.432,'HvPmJQiDr_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32657,_binary '\0','/9UJ1Y4epC0ZRlsC1OeCocMMt8BD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21603520',7.4,2751,'en','Time for Him to Come Home for Christmas','Four days before Christmas, Elizabeth Athens receives a voicemail from a number she doesn’t recognize. On the message, a man she doesn’t know makes one final plea to the love of his life for a 