ge Takei journeyed from a World War II internment camp to the helm of the Starship Enterprise, and then to the daily news feeds of five million Facebook fans. Join George and his husband, Brad, on a wacky and profound trek for life, liberty, and love.','/kN2ppWKG1b1bRMizK3JuZ0Yc28R.jpg','2014-08-22',94,'Released','A star’s trek for life, liberty, and love.','To Be Takei',250777,1.5076,7.2,'JyuYSaUp-2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32730,_binary '\0','/vEfBwIp8huLWJElhOP8krbTTK2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2175535',5.3,2421,'it','Adam Chaplin','After his wife Emily is murdered, widower Adam Chaplin calls upon supernatural forces to help enact his brutal revenge.','/nEUn35sNCZWkaROnKKZXCOrwsr2.jpg','2011-09-30',84,'Released','Nothing can prepare you for this extreme fight.','Adam Chaplin',99117,2.2187,6.027,'QuSL7JpyD-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32731,_binary '\0','/7TkjACu9mEggWa97LJLMxaRXHWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2175669',4.3,1647,'en','Get Lucky','Lucky is a small time criminal and he\'s happy just getting by until he agrees to look after some counterfeit money for a friend who is in a bit of trouble with the law Two months go by without a word from him so Lucky burns the \'funny money\' to avoid problems for himself.','/zQ2CQ1UJpqbQOGH2TtlCYNT2JU4.jpg','2013-08-08',86,'Released',NULL,'Get Lucky',211528,1.5791,5,'gNPgb46loJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32732,_binary '\0','/pLOcIdji9vw7xxUIdl3TH5avhyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2175672',7.5,2369,'ml','സ്പിരിറ്റ്','Raghunandan (Mohanlal) is a TV show host and a budding novelist. He is a loner and a compulsive alcoholic, the latter of which resulted in his divorce from Meera (Kaniha). Despite this Meera and her husband Alexy (Shankar Ramakrishnan) are his best friends. His alcoholism however starts taking a huge toll on his life and things take a turn for the worst. At this point he meets Maniyan (Nandu) a plumber who is a bigger alcoholic than he is which makes Raghu re-evaluate his relationship with alcohol.','/e7LfCfqFFzhSzffBRGGv0IrUpgz.jpg','2012-06-14',145,'Released',NULL,'Spirit',120149,1.0605,7.065,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32733,_binary '\0','/sgf60uAPn95lBAcSX9eQE8bKxTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2176013',6.7,63193,'hi','जब तक है जान','Samar Anand, a London-based struggling musician falls in love with Meera Thappar. After a severe accident, a panicked Meera promises God to leave Samar if he lives. Heartbroken, Samar leaves for India to become a fearless bomb disposal expert in the army.','/1TlzJZrzUlaC95Noqt3oMoxQxCu.jpg','2012-11-13',176,'Released',NULL,'Jab Tak Hai Jaan',132316,2.981,7.028,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32734,_binary '\0','/arUO6RTEyBQFDKPOL3E2e90E9z1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2176690',4.8,2121,'fr','The Smell of Us','Self-destructive teens go skateboarding, use drugs and turn tricks in Paris.','/vKP9PDKRP9x0sDQWHyHdEPJV7YM.jpg','2015-01-14',92,'Released',NULL,'The Smell of Us',157824,2.5169,4.873,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32735,_binary '\0','/Ao1qigOI0ekNYaxDwndivAhzLei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2176722',3.7,1547,'en','Ejecta','Two men witness an unexplainable event in the sky as a historic solar storm approaches, and they try to survive as a terrifying life form hunts them.','/wMF7hBnoUhVjjDZcTZqaO1iZ378.jpg','2014-09-24',82,'Released','We were never alone.','Ejecta',266433,1.3254,3.8,'lLclJ5jH9Do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32736,_binary '\0','/la6NrDLTKNxjYEz5J56hsXCD1FQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21767274',6.5,1291,'ta','ஆர் யூ ஓகே பேபி?','A heart-wrenching tale of adoption unfolds, pitting adoptive parents against the biological mother. Media intervention escalates the issue to legal consequences and emotional turmoil, finally leading to a gripping courtroom climax.','/3eLw2weWLeVyWw6s1CVWIlEVlj5.jpg','2023-09-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Are You Ok Baby?',1145622,0.8554,0,'SCiTgI2ZiJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32737,_binary '\0','/j6V2VwXyTLL69Rsf26bpduvC6LN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2177509',6.3,2511,'es','Carmina o revienta','Carmina, 58, runs a shop selling Iberian products in Seville. After several robberies and no help from her insurance company, she comes up with a way to recover the money she needs to keep her family. While she waits in her kitchen for her plan to kick in, she thinks back over her life, her work and her miracles.','/gS3e57zDuMrm8c1NJyP9oCoiVim.jpg','2012-07-05',71,'Released',NULL,'Carmina or Blow Up',107916,1.1326,6.2,'V-S-cFM6AM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32738,_binary '\0','/1PvPjvtsSwj5TI5YNRukUbpHz7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2177511',7.3,7055,'it','Cesare deve morire','Inmates at a prison in Rome rehearse for a performance of Shakespeare\'s Julius Caesar.','/jrtCezCf08Kuk1I9D14vy3ZmfA4.jpg','2012-03-02',76,'Released',NULL,'Caesar Must Die',96821,2.097,7.259,'rQXsLENIJvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32739,_binary '\0','/vsLrBh3MALRGRB1pMErDQQz3l3c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2177771',6.1,149472,'en','The Monuments Men','Based on the true story of the greatest treasure hunt in history, The Monuments Men is an action drama focusing on seven over-the-hill, out-of-shape museum directors, artists, architects, curators, and art historians who went to the front lines of WWII to rescue the world’s artistic masterpieces from Nazi thieves and return them to their rightful owners. With the art hidden behind enemy lines, how could these guys hope to succeed?','/wiWAg4mKV2S4vImPxsPRIdj2R2B.jpg','2014-01-24',118,'Released','It was the greatest art heist in history','The Monuments Men',152760,8.7988,6.064,'SziPDANik18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32740,_binary '\0','/dFbu2OmbvKj10ytpnIgtWwJhV09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2177827',6.8,3153,'fr','The Search','A woman who works for a non-governmental organization (NGO) forms a special relationship with a young boy in war-torn Chechnya.','/oKBssmqkeguXW3TxncwU980fuZB.jpg','2014-11-26',149,'Released',NULL,'The Search',245692,1.8878,6.8,'TeHf_c94tFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32741,_binary '\0','/tWcZTx3yyFuHruBf4p0w7lDGc7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2177843',7.2,10552,'en','We Are Legion: The Story of the Hacktivists','Takes us inside the world of Anonymous, the radical \"hacktivist\" collective that has redefined civil disobedience for the digital age. The film explores early hacktivist groups like Cult of the Dead Cow and Electronic Disturbance Theater, then moves to Anonymous\' raucous beginnings on the website 4chan. Through interviews with current members, people recently returned from prison or facing trial, writers, academics, activists and major players in various \"raids,\" the documentary traces Anonymous’ evolution from merry pranksters to a full-blown movement with a global reach, the most transformative civil disobedience of our time.','/6h3KVwIyPCh1pzS4mchjuUBgZ17.jpg','2012-01-20',93,'Released',NULL,'We Are Legion: The Story of the Hacktivists',97690,1.9133,7.1,'N0IDkzhBQMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32742,_binary '\0','/mcZO2pc3MKS6ijmt48MczMbWOks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2178256',7.3,3295,'lo','The Rocket','Laos. In a land ravaged by war and exploitation, a boy whose family believe he is cursed must redeem himself by taking part in a dangerous rocket competition.','/nFh4GRrEnrc3L29SueSP4DqFMqT.jpg','2013-02-10',96,'Released',NULL,'The Rocket',168742,1.1471,6.6,'l9dHw423U7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32743,_binary '\0','/hvaSiRRM93aCSzTmKlY4sHERL0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2178470',7.3,59031,'hi','ये जवानी है दीवानी','On a trekking trip, an introverted Naina falls for a charming ex-classmate, whose thirst for adventure drives them apart. Years later, their paths cross again.','/em39H81XLCDgXsI7V4IcBZseEO6.jpg','2013-05-31',160,'Released','One cannot be wise and old without being young and crazy.','Yeh Jawaani Hai Deewani',185008,2.4995,7.304,'9kFDQkNmA5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32744,_binary '\0','/ot2u2MYZekrN02nDOO986qudrkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2178508',4.4,12399,'hi','Son of Sardaar','A Punjabi man returning to India falls in love with a woman whose family welcomes him as a guest before realizing he is the man they need to kill in order to avenge their loved ones.','/rqFbCvKVPdqI1Yrm8Xn172XXiVC.jpg','2012-11-13',141,'Released',NULL,'Son of Sardaar',140896,1.7115,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32745,_binary '\0','/zQ6jbZKqfNMeqFjEzNhDV4EZinG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2178941',7.2,17371,'de','Barbara','In 1980s East Germany, Berlin doctor Barbara is banished to a country medical clinic for applying for an exit visa. Deeply unhappy with her reassignment and fearful of her co-workers as possible Stasi informants, Barbara stays aloof, especially from the good-natured clinic head, Andre.','/i7yjITqgz5zSW1jJWzxfwQsyDeo.jpg','2012-03-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Barbara',88284,3.0867,7.1,'FKTd5igNLq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32746,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179007',4.1,1624,'en','Cut!','Nothing is as it seems as an ex-con and aspirant filmmaker set out to manufacture a horror film by scaring real people; however, when it goes too far and someone actually dies, the pair decide that killing for real on film is the way to make a truly terrifying movie.','/fhiOhyus53Cpf9hLbSp0itMnNE9.jpg','2014-01-14',101,'Released','Taking lives, one scene at a time.','Cut!',256511,1.0939,4.2,'0oNSDhBsdNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32747,_binary '\0','/eHupgrjAhtvFCIyC0xpZyIXquiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179087',4.5,1464,'en','I Will Follow You Into the Dark','A woman reeling from the death of her parents becomes attached to an alluring man whose sudden disappearance sends her and her friends into a haunted high-rise to find him.','/gAMP75aFXQkZFDa6Zs28ruraLj7.jpg','2012-12-20',107,'Released','How far would you go to find the one you love?','I Will Follow You Into the Dark',216374,1.863,4.5,'Qreq4EXuNKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32748,_binary '\0','/1IL2nLny4P2njzO1MNZMrJV9EmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179116',7.1,88057,'en','The Kings of Summer','Three restless teenagers run away to the woods for the summer, determined to escape their parents and live by their own rules. In a hidden clearing, they build a makeshift house and attempt to create an independent life, testing their friendship, freedom, and the challenges of living off the land.','/6dcIbwJuxlEnzLe0EaGFvsh4ZdS.jpg','2013-01-19',95,'Released','Why live when you can rule.','The Kings of Summer',156700,5.163,7,'cLnAiVI4R2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32749,_binary '\0','/ll1d1AXoQganpzphgUVuWGo3Nmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179121',7.3,20403,'fr','Le Prénom','Vincent, a wealthy real estate agent, is invited to dinner by his sister Elizabeth and her husband Peter, both professors in Paris. Claude, a childhood friend and trombonist in a symphony orchestra, is also present. Vincent brings news from the prenatal examination of his and his wife Anna\'s unborn son. The name chosen by the soon-to-be parents strongly offends the others for many reasons. The dispute between the guests quickly escalates and before long the resurgence of old grudges and hidden secrets is unavoidable...','/5xKkDkv506CiSp99SxmHLsnaoFs.jpg','2012-04-25',110,'Released','A child is the beginning of happiness. A name is the beginning of despair.','What\'s in a Name',112198,2.7594,7.323,'DsET47haqs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32750,_binary '\0','/sdwzz7Pdnm6l6rqPgRwychnCGB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179133',8,1865,'ne','लुट','Loot is the story for five guys who find quick ways of success and accomplishment in life. It is a quest for quick money and better life. In a place where the crime rates are ascending day by day, Loot draws a reality check on the present security system of the city. Loot is about relationships: it\'s about friendship and betrayal. Loot is the real picture of Kathmandu; the city of crime and lawlessness like never explored before.','/xEirZWvKeVk8P73KAyYeb1FHivA.jpg','2012-01-01',121,'Released',NULL,'Loot',490783,1.3472,7.6,'QUsgST4Zj5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32751,_binary '\0','/rl95VDEP3nsUQmGzE0S1S7y6T0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179136',7.3,576099,'en','American Sniper','U.S. Navy SEAL Chris Kyle takes his sole mission—protect his comrades—to heart and becomes one of the most lethal snipers in American history. His pinpoint accuracy not only saves countless lives but also makes him a prime target of insurgents. Despite grave danger and his struggle to be a good husband and father to his family back in the States, Kyle serves four tours of duty in Iraq. However, when he finally returns home, he finds that he cannot leave the war behind.','/i1U46OwMc6vlm7OoSUKfqUH615e.jpg','2014-12-25',133,'Released','The most lethal sniper in U.S. history.','American Sniper',190859,17.0026,7.407,'5bP1f_1o-zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32752,_binary '\0','/recf4mXJ6b6L5kwOmSsLLfQBrBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179226',4.4,2290,'en','Absolute Deception','A widowed reporter recruits the help of a federal agent to investigate her late husband\'s secrets, but the two become the target of unknown attackers. When FBI Agent John Nelson’s key informant, Miles, is abducted and shot, all that’s left is a severed finger. In order to find a new lead, Nelson travels to New York City to inform widowed magazine reporter Rebecca Scott that her long dead husband, Miles, had only recently been murdered to see if she had heard from him in recent years. Perplexed, Scott joins Agent Nelson in the wealthy enclave of Australia’s Gold Coast to find out what really happened. The two soon discover Miles may have been part of an elaborate “Ponzi scheme” to bilk investors, and a vengeful billionaire, out of millions of dollars. As more layers of Miles’ secret life are exposed, can the two stay ahead of the mysterious attackers who will stop at nothing to halt their investigation?','/fSKWzXaWFTxzLLbF3wAJL2qxXeb.jpg','2013-06-10',92,'Released','She thought she had the perfect life','Absolute Deception',199556,2.5078,5.1,'cxWQkIYPKYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32753,_binary '\0','/55Q6ZLbN5n7IAJZJsDk6Q35ZZC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179231',6.2,3618,'en','The Bromley Boys','A boy, a girl, and the worst football team in Britain. You can\'t choose who you\'re going to fall in love with.','/AoISw2L3HnhNOxPhWUIr4SRFMgT.jpg','2018-06-01',97,'Released','It only takes 90 minutes to fall in love.','The Bromley Boys',512747,1.4769,5.9,'lbP8K6X7n-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32754,_binary '\0','/hKsr0EFO7eRXD7GzD0b6kKa2xRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179239',5.1,1782,'en','The Last Showing','A couple trapped in a cinema are manipulated into becoming unwilling actors in a film being captured by CCTV cameras.','/e0lN3D1Fv63CGpg6vMlEZGZ80Od.jpg','2014-08-22',89,'Released','He Gave His Life to the Movies. Tonight, He\'ll Take Theirs.','The Last Showing',222887,1.9701,5.2,'LaWnLvGWdzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32755,_binary '\0','/gILchMyz3VVX3J4mQuZbMZuv4nS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2179936',4.6,2222,'en','School Dance','High schooler Jason has found his dream girl—the gorgeous Anastacia. There’s just one problem: she doesn’t know he exists. If he can win a spot on the school’s hottest dance crew, Jason might have a shot. But before he does, he’ll have to overcome his battle-ax of a mother, survive Anastacia’s gangsta brother, and pass the crew’s initiation—in this fresh, sexy, and outrageously funny comedy.','/nplQTnjWiE4mGP1eeaDmNqaF0oR.jpg','2014-07-02',85,'Released',NULL,'School Dance',271467,3.7036,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32756,_binary '\0','/fNXUCk54vGcoKr34olN14ohUSFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21800162',7.7,18861,'it','C\'è ancora domani','In postwar Rome, a working-class woman dreams of a better future for herself and her daughter while facing abuse at the hands of her domineering husband. When a mysterious letter arrives, she discovers the courage to change the circumstances of her life.','/4Hi7yjiQjokEDStT1MOj5rPgRfW.jpg','2023-10-26',118,'Released','The Italian phenomenon.','There\'s Still Tomorrow',1026227,5.5161,8.066,'Z5hAvdF6xQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32757,_binary '\0','/eHK0Tagwl5kPhpIKstBeG045aLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21800888',7,2137,'ko','육사오（6/45）','A comical encounter between South and North Korean soldiers over the 5.7 billions won lottery that crossed the military demarcation line on the wind.','/AifHZptVzkzLLfk2tedIQixqrgV.jpg','2022-08-24',113,'Released','Joint lottery area','6/45',821153,2.778,6.824,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32758,_binary '\0','/diF927vBIYi1uQxVpdx7W7wUuIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180168',6.4,2186,'en','TalhotBlond','Thomas Montgomery, a married father of two young daughters, gets seduced by the world of online gambling and chat rooms where a virtual romance and sexual obsession ultimately leads to the murder of an innocent man.','/3FF9YFuVvh5t393NxfME47wxqrZ.jpg','2012-06-23',88,'Released','Fantasy kills','TalhotBlond',159389,3.1846,6.3,'42ImcufMB5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32759,_binary '\0','/yN3hQS9vw37Bzt66d7FxH7OZSv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21802440',6.8,2241,'te','Two Souls','Cheated on by his girlfriend, Akhil, a troubled young guy decides to end his life but instead, he ends up in a comatose state. Soon his soul detaches itself from the body and wanders off, only to find the company of another soul Priya. Together they\'d embark on a journey, that change their lives forever.','/xLYZdNKNCgJZTdiawujb2hBfZmF.jpg','2023-04-21',134,'Released',NULL,'Two Souls',1140530,0.5967,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32760,_binary '\0','/yucG1ibKT4LJfkkr2utZiJq1snw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180277',6.1,1447,'no','90 minutter','Director Eva Sørhaug (Cold Lunch) reveals the rage and violence lurking beneath seemingly tranquil domesticity in her bold and uncompromising sophomore feature.','/lEWuN1nEV0MlTnpRXVhhOOEuEYV.jpg','2012-09-21',92,'Released',NULL,'90 Minutes',123261,1.0943,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32761,_binary '\0','/agY1CR8xjk4GOFFnTe4BOGPYE1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180333',3.9,1901,'en','Crowsnest','In late summer of 2011, five young friends on a road trip went missing after being attacked by nomadic cannibals in a huge RV. Video was recorded by the victims & recovered by police as evidence in their still-unsolved murders.','/g2swX9YGaIq1dpGr7gva8DGnWe4.jpg','2012-09-07',84,'Released',NULL,'Crowsnest',137955,2.089,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32762,_binary '\0','/qpwbjQ3mWc59i2P3oewVFdAkSrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180335',6.4,1436,'hu','Csak a szél','Drawing inspiration from the death-squad murders of several Gypsy families in Hungary in 2008, director Bence Fliegauf\'s chilling and unforgettable real-life horror story follows a family whose dreams of emigration and escape are suddenly, horribly destroyed.','/nEw8Q4D55DbsJYwLUG1C53bWIX0.jpg','2012-02-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Just the Wind',110383,1.1422,6.3,'SbEIsireE2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32763,_binary '\0','/lcITbesmy0IBO6TXTAgQHJE6Asx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180339',5.5,73532,'en','Deep Water','A well-to-do husband who allows his wife to have affairs in order to avoid a divorce becomes a prime suspect in the disappearance of her lovers.','/6yRMyWwjuhKg6IU66uiZIGhaSc8.jpg','2022-03-17',116,'Released','The love story is never the whole story.','Deep Water',619979,12.7095,5.831,'90JsrQwE5CA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32764,_binary '\0','/zQG3cHYQTmArolURcoodp7WJrlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180351',7.4,1246,'en','Eating Animals','An examination of our dietary choices and the food we put in our bodies.','/tppzVmguu02QAjXM957XVqKrvgl.jpg','2018-06-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Eating Animals',503150,1.1347,6.6,'Y-z4Mpql6Ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32765,_binary '\0','/qF938YRj7RoYkjwOsXFDNYf907J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180411',5.9,154858,'en','Into the Woods','In a woods filled with magic and fairy tale characters, a baker and his wife set out to end the curse put on them by their neighbor, a spiteful witch.','/bINGDDuvUnZyde2sIcSx41IE5b6.jpg','2014-12-24',125,'Released','Be careful what you wish for...','Into the Woods',224141,9.4209,5.8,'dRgr7itwgak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32766,_binary '\0','/gTK2lEyMSFxKsA52uEYLQlmpAWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180477',7.8,18497,'ta','நண்பன்','The plot of the film illustrates the embankment of two friends on a quest for a lost buddy, who was once an optimistic and successful student. On their journey, they recount their college life and special moments that the three shared up until their lost friend secretly parted ways after convocation. During their quest, the two encounter a rival classmate who once made a long forgotten bet with them, a funeral that goes impossibly out of control, and a wedding they must crash.','/dmhPnvYQVtx4xS1dkA9trCpQXvY.jpg','2012-01-13',181,'Released',NULL,'Nanban',69537,1.578,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32767,_binary '\0','/kbZEGxqBiPmhB8brmaFDERv6RTS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180543',3.6,1332,'en','Tasmanian Devils','Tasmanian Devil Synopsis: Danica McKellar (“The Wonder Years,” “The West Wing”) and Olympic speed skating champion Apolo Ohno take on a deadly mythical beast in the new Syfy Saturday Original Movie “Tasmanian Devil.”','/h5iuPmkVg7V0VkPGX5lP0uHuIqC.jpg','2013-01-31',91,'Released','The hunt has begun...','Tasmanian Devils',160697,2.6145,4.8,'Q-9U7yWWGPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32768,_binary '\0','/uUJp5I4IbzuhdUiEx4R9OAoFpbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21807222',6.6,100269,'en','Saw X','Between the events of \'Saw\' and \'Saw II\', a sick and desperate John Kramer travels to Mexico for a risky and experimental medical procedure in hopes of a miracle cure for his cancer, only to discover the entire operation is a scam to defraud the most vulnerable. Armed with a newfound purpose, the infamous serial killer returns to his work, turning the tables on the con artists in his signature visceral way through devious, deranged, and ingenious traps.','/u7Lp1Hi8aBS73jv4KRMIv5aK4ax.jpg','2023-09-27',118,'Released','Witness the return of Jigsaw.','Saw X',951491,13.4575,7.148,'t3PzUo4P21c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32769,_binary '\0','/2mvMwjBeffSpZNoAKPi11ACbE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2180994',5.3,14312,'en','A Good Marriage','After 25 years of a good marriage, what will Darcy do once she discovers her husband\'s sinister secret?','/8odAiCOM9qwzzGRW69aKfAvK85q.jpg','2014-10-03',103,'Released','Two can keep a secret... if one of them is dead.','A Good Marriage',288281,3.8107,5.3,'CjOnIbXU--M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32770,_binary '\0','/aZAWi9EEfEhE2qswlcHvoeUQn7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21810074',3,1243,'kn','ವಾಮನ','Explores the emotions and lifestyles of ordinary people, with a compelling hero Guna pursuing vengeance against antagonists. His actions are driven by his past life, which influences his present and future.','/3MoMjkrhqJMKESO2L7SQPghx2uK.jpg','2025-05-05',134,'Released','Every Bad Man Has a Strong Reason','Vaamana',927224,0.7506,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32771,_binary '\0','/yIehWVVlvqdWB1NNFgI266CHuMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21810110',5.7,5632,'te','భగవంత్ కేసరి','Bhagavanth Kesari\'s life takes an unexpected turn when he becomes the guardian of Vijaya Lakshmi aka Vijji, daughter of his jailer. Kesari, with his unwavering sense of justice, embarks on a journey to nurture Vijji into a resilient young woman aspiring to join the Indian army. Intertwined in this narrative is the presence of Rahul Sanghvi, a power-hungry tycoon whose connection with Bhagavanth and Vijji, unravels hidden secrets.','/4jZMZQ9oYqEAYODAeWUNJL79aIe.jpg','2023-10-19',164,'Released','I Don\'t Care','Bhagavanth Kesari',979669,1.476,4.906,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32772,_binary '\0','/nmU3WgYuv7TyCrImrVtYG2VB6U6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21810682',5.8,9595,'en','The End We Start From','As London is submerged below floodwaters, a woman gives birth to her first child. Days later, she and her baby are forced to leave their home in search of safety. They head north through a newly dangerous country seeking refuge from place to place.','/S9U0axheNakD9LQusEpFijDgSe.jpg','2023-12-08',102,'Released',NULL,'The End We Start From',973778,4.1392,5.8,'AqkZvWkB5cI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32773,_binary '\0','/vvMM09norDnlN6lJopwJSx2NCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181282',6.5,2004,'en','A Patch of Fog','A university teacher gets caught shoplifting by a security guard, who won’t let him go. He becomes his new best friend and says ‘I won’t call the cops if you come and have a pint with me’. From there a twisted romance of sorts unfolds.','/3uCl1EoSwBeSqvnBrKsSPPvfI6B.jpg','2015-09-11',90,'Released',NULL,'A Patch of Fog',356187,2.4348,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32774,_binary '\0','/4YaoOPKs3RN0qet3K14X6eUFowt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181298',3.4,2412,'es','Don’t speak','A group of friends are having a party on a boat. In the distance, a small town watches them in silence. Suddenly, one of them is seriously injured and the group approach the village for help. No one attends, the few inhabitants they find order them to be quiet and disappear into the darkness. The group split for help and strange and terrifying things start to happen, some of them are killed in terrible circumstances. Those who still live, increasingly terrified, discover the reason for all these murders. If they want to leave the village alive and the house where they are locked, they will have to survive in absolute silence.','/6bUckj6vh1zbPoYWBIPolc3S0P2.jpg','2015-10-10',82,'Released','Can you keep a secret? I haven\'t heard anyone for a long time until they arrived. They came for help and they broke the rules. I tried to warn them but it was too late. Little did they know. The party is over. Who will survive?','Don\'t Speak',341741,1.2326,2.9,'4T-4XObf1d8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32775,_binary '\0','/2oTqxCe7EGMqMpJx5we2xcBT6Lx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21813994',6.6,4427,'en','Fancy Dance','Following her sister\'s disappearance, Jax and her niece Roki must stick together. Desperate to keep what\'s left of their family intact, Jax and Roki defy the law and hit the road on a journey to the Grand Nation Powwow in Oklahoma City.','/kMOqbt2cdWryPJIrxnwzplPNmF6.jpg','2024-06-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Fancy Dance',1058617,5.02,6.5,'AmPPiLaiN8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32776,_binary '\0','/pdbHsXieyLq1UjRfeWNpy9x68Eb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21814814',4.3,2195,'en','Bama Rush','Follow four young women as they prepare to rush at the University of Alabama in 2022. Against the viral backdrop of #BamaRush on TikTok, and the long-held tradition of sorority recruitment at the University of Alabama, the film explores the emotional complexities and high-stakes of belonging in this crucial window into womanhood.','/30q4SkivFioRpJTIxOdMDvcN5M5.jpg','2023-05-23',100,'Released','Acceptance is everything.','Bama Rush',1053722,1.0109,4.1,'QxxJRbiwgcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32777,_binary '\0','/iveeHEGtkq0dBJZtOcoK650sZ6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21815562',5.9,22516,'en','The Alto Knights','Two of New York\'s most notorious organized crime bosses, Frank Costello and Vito Genovese, vie for control of the city\'s streets. Once the best of friends, petty jealousies and a series of betrayals place them on a deadly collision course that will reshape the Mafia (and America) forever.','/epGF8vv3caKLm6X8PKbD5xirFLa.jpg','2025-03-19',122,'Released','The most dangerous enemy is an old friend.','The Alto Knights',1013601,7.8111,6.2,'1aayuOp0AnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32778,_binary '\0','/bb3kb40953xIrYNzAcKIrvVW7pi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21815772',5.4,2317,'en','Spoonful of Sugar','Millicent, working on her thesis about children with severe allergies, is hired to babysit little Johnny, a sickly, mute child who suffers from every allergy under the sun. As she discovers Johnny’s dark family secrets, things begin to become unhinged.','/q4cLHdAJCHqAWIIplCHEyG6JgrR.jpg','2022-09-24',94,'Released',NULL,'Spoonful of Sugar',1015081,1.615,5.2,'uzRL67TjKyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32779,_binary '\0','/4QslEwPvhSATtFQD1uVeJNvtusz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21816824',7.2,3947,'en','\"Sr.\"','A portrait of the life and career of Robert Downey Sr. (1936-2021), the visionary and fearless US filmmaker — father of actor Robert Downey Jr. — who in the sixties and seventies laid the foundations for countercultural comedy.','/2lyqE4OQaEvNvNQwngsZH9xzg4B.jpg','2022-09-02',90,'Released','Like father. Like son. Like no other.','\"Sr.\"',1013577,2.8648,6.881,'1qWUUGB7KUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32780,_binary '\0','/3kprJr9fAmaLR8jYN5bPDkOY2by.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21816918',4.9,1764,'en','The Painted','When Evelyn Elster inherits her estranged cousin\'s fortune she thinks her family has finally gotten the break they\'ve needed. Little do they know they\'ve not only inherited her cousin\'s riches, but also a family curse, and must do whatever they can to avoid becoming its latest victims.','/ybQ7ZTkn83lZCy4wD9naOPIWVU4.jpg','2024-12-19',85,'Released',NULL,'The Painted',1250846,2.3459,5.5,'B8UoHafIrlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32781,_binary '\0','/oKvjowyRtr8SDITScfKOXxJwP4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181831',8.2,21724,'hi','शाहिद','A story based on real-life human-rights and criminal lawyer, Shahid Azmi, who was slain while defending the wrongly accused by the law in terrorist activities.','/9AO8ciYnqjg9YavpR01n9sobE0.jpg','2013-10-18',129,'Released','Based On The Life Of One Of The Most Controversial Figures Of Our Time.','Shahid',128206,0.8723,7.325,'LhOqoeL0v3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32782,_binary '\0','/elxCYAlCQGtpBVsnRqcOy9I78FX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181853',5.8,1226,'en','It\'s Christmas, Carol!','The story of driven, heartless, publishing executive, Carol Huffman, who on Christmas Eve is visited by the ghost of her former boss, Eve. Eve tells Carol that she has lost sight of the things that are truly important in life and that she is there to show her the error of her ways. Eve explains that normally there would be three ghosts for the job but due to budget cutbacks, she is in charge of Carol\'s journey through her past, present and future.','/gpj8MSZD3NDfFtFUX4rUuCmix3j.jpg','2012-11-18',84,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Christmas, Carol!',151071,2.1939,5.5,'7wScyIvPiBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32783,_binary '\0','/4N6Rx5KVUvGqXomsRpeenBTTaEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181867',6.6,1681,'it','Come non detto','Mattia is about to move to Madrid by his boyfriend Eduard. When the day before leaving for Spain, Eduard announces his arrival in Rome to know the \"laws\", Mattia must choose whether to finally come clean with his companion, or confess to being a formidable liar.','/v4TFpkkfJMDOA5PuWDJ2vFjnS1q.jpg','2012-09-07',85,'Released','Mattia is about to leave and decided to travel light.','Tell No One',157123,1.3613,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32784,_binary '\0','/nrDyzITJljfb6As9qnLnH8rf4Is.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21818782',5.7,29318,'hi','तेहरान','On 13th February 2012, a magnetic bomb exploded, destroying an Israeli embassy vehicle in Delhi. ACP Rajeev Kumar, leading the investigation, suspects more than what meets the eye. Amid political pressure and suspicions of an Iranian connection, he embarks on a perilous journey to uncover the truth, facing formidable adversaries.','/gbz9Y1NwnlE2GxXmgWTKZC1fste.jpg','2025-08-14',116,'Released','Hunted by Iran. Abandoned by Israel. Deserted by India.','Tehran',942058,1.8457,6.1,'ffDvEdkFtJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32785,_binary '\0','/iSninPxyb8p9aEPn4bcnXlsCqPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21818816',8.5,2899,'hi','While We Watched','A turbulent newsroom drama that intimately chronicles the working days of broadcast journalist Ravish Kumar as he navigates a spiraling world of truth and disinformation.','/in1UJVqJRxBZ5obprRtvR8Mf3K9.jpg','2023-07-14',94,'Released',NULL,'While We Watched',1016217,1.4908,7.778,'yFoG42xk85U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32786,_binary '\0','/kfsbsb51hxB0WeMFuICL94rb1dE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21818968',2.6,1484,'ml','Saturday Night','The film centers around a group of four childhood friends, Stanley, Sunil, Babu, and Ravi. After a long separation, they reunite and embark on a journey to rekindle their bond.','/dQrNM5Vsr9CK8o6lmofav9Dueq9.jpg','2022-11-04',160,'Released',NULL,'Saturday Night',962194,0.9178,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32787,_binary '\0','/ubtLuy2SsC7q0BIewPPOGeQVtlN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21819228',7.7,19403,'en','Stutz','In candid conversations with actor Jonah Hill, leading psychiatrist Phil Stutz explores his early life experiences and unique, visual model of therapy.','/uOiJmotRM12wsgfwiEXsp3AErdU.jpg','2022-11-13',96,'Released','Meet a different kind of therapist.','Stutz',799375,2.66,7.464,'UKCmefQdplI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32788,_binary '\0','/u3MWQCdHyCK7IADtat4sVmBXd9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21819250',7.3,6855,'en','Selena Gomez: My Mind & Me','After years in the limelight, Selena Gomez achieves unimaginable stardom. But just as she reaches a new peak, an unexpected turn pulls her into darkness. This uniquely raw and intimate documentary spans her six-year journey into a new light.','/oMpsswJv8x4vnOnIKqs4xJs2Kn3.jpg','2022-11-04',95,'Released','Every breath, a breakthrough.','Selena Gomez: My Mind & Me',1022256,11.847,8.5,'of32sI9jw5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32789,_binary '\0','/c6CNXwTZItibqstbextiG5RGEDT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21819258',6.7,1413,'en','Bonus Track','George, a 16-year-old who believes he is a future star musician, can\'t believe his luck when the son of a famous duo takes an interest in his music. This new arrival helps him rehearse for a talent show and leads both boys to learn from each other and grow closer.','/547xnuQ5aZmSf6EYP4l7YNDD1N9.jpg','2024-10-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Bonus Track',1022824,1.6252,5.9,'IU06M-crkcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32790,_binary '\0','/5faqsJ8TMT0IhkZ1xgD6PEWm8xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2181931',7.8,45518,'hi','इंग्लिश विंग्लिश','In the United States for the first time, an Indian housewife with a limited command of English turns Manhattan into her personal language school.','/ccEVR8sf18psGH5dai