00'),(32795,_binary '\0','/x3b7tZLvLJMEfjbIND0jgwn8QJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2182121',6.9,5311,'hu','A csendesek','A young Hungarian woman (played by Hungarian actress Orsi Tóth) wakes up inside a crashed car in the middle of nowhere, not knowing where her brother Isti is. Upset and alone, she leaves aboard a cargo ship to keep a promise she made to him. Once at sea, she withdraws into a dream world and loses grip on her life completely.','/6GQYy44te7uy7PWS4WDAr497WPu.jpg','2013-01-22',97,'Released',NULL,'Silent Ones',158942,0.7223,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32796,_binary '\0','/qITMDD5ggmuUsShtJT1MAusnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2182256',5.7,11389,'en','Premature','On the most important day of his young life, a high school senior is forced to relive his failed attempt at losing his virginity over and over again, until he gets it right.','/iU7OQ2oG2HyIqmZjikXA4N86wpN.jpg','2014-07-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Premature',253310,4.1093,5.486,'vFncV2U5PHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32797,_binary '\0','/fViElUGfdoZjtnVxvSpJX8TwxY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21823606',7,166213,'en','A Real Pain','Mismatched cousins David and Benji reunite for a tour through Poland to honor their beloved grandmother. The adventure takes a turn when the pair\'s old tensions resurface against the backdrop of their family history.','/yaTFjMNh8D78dDHrglivOTv5YOx.jpg','2024-11-01',90,'Released','Join the family.','A Real Pain',1013850,12.5086,6.795,'E_sjoa8aHpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32798,_binary '\0','/98PhUeOMK33Oyekw53tSGsfPZ7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21825416',7.1,3938,'en','Truth & Treason','When loyalty to country becomes loyalty to a lie, one teen risks everything to expose the truth. With the Gestapo closing in, he must decide what it really means to be a good German.','/ArDLn658OjT3dMThIi4GDQJRuY3.jpg','2025-10-16',121,'Released','His defiance will never be silenced.','Truth & Treason',1443940,8.0917,8.005,'MoUnZcAd5uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32799,_binary '\0','/xOlEdqLMwf1OakIC1sokact3Piq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21825858',7,5010,'ja','ちひろさん','An unapologetic former sex worker starts working at a bento stand in a small seaside town, bringing comfort to the lonely souls who come her way.','/51PoruM9YZ4meE0SzDZaNjciKBW.jpg','2023-02-23',131,'Released','She\'s always lived on her own.','Call Me Chihiro',1024621,5.3068,7.171,'_X7xl1_C3c8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32800,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21827144',6.6,2052,'te','Akasha Veedullo','Siddhu, a simple guy, falls for Nisha and gets attached to her. A series of events leads to their separation and Siddhu becomes a Rockstar. Why did they separate? What went wrong between them?','/bIY17t5PhFqJ7j6FYCTQ251vCwd.jpg','2022-09-02',146,'Released',NULL,'Aakasha Veedhullo',1019949,1.0311,3,'jPd2jSB2-nQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32801,_binary '\0','/AckDhp2FYTD9AbhpDCk6HyrjNc8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2182972',5.8,10762,'en','Song One','Estranged from her family, Franny returns home when an accident leaves her brother comatose. Retracing his life as an aspiring musician, she tracks down his favorite musician, James Forester. Against the backdrop of Brooklyn’s music scene, Franny and James develop an unexpected relationship and face the realities of their lives.','/sY4CD3Wj4OIdiVCrU4qOJMxOzVg.jpg','2014-01-20',86,'Released','A moment can change everything.','Song One',244783,2.7781,5.727,'ihdJgH757A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32802,_binary '\0','/gz1Lr0WcKJ1eg7mfN0AfAPXbI7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2183014',6.8,44053,'en','Love at First Sight','Hadley and Oliver begin falling in love on a flight from New York to London, but when they lose each other at customs, can they defy all odds to reunite?','/vCMGlarDrcmhclBmnYoH7JUCDuA.jpg','2023-09-15',91,'Released','100,000 daily flights around the world. 6 million travelers. One connection.','Love at First Sight',353577,6.4316,7.234,'j0kro6SuwxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32803,_binary '\0','/xqCU96foxW8w2dhaEhP3vr1Sx4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2183034',5.7,20617,'en','Earth to Echo','After a construction project begins digging in their neighbourhood, best friends Tuck, Munch and Alex inexplicably begin to receive strange, encoded messages on their cell phones. Convinced something bigger is going on, they go to their parents and the authorities. The three embark on a secret adventure to crack the code and follow it to its source, and discover a mysterious being from another world who desperately needs their help. The journey that follows will change all their lives forever.','/yiNPza51nLvVTWTB9q4ifzfUlml.jpg','2014-06-14',91,'Released','An adventure as big as the universe.','Earth to Echo',238603,4.5925,5.896,'JMlcdEtAiBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32804,_binary '\0','/aKCxzcNr8bUiJCwrrc0y9rYFfbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21830836',5.1,4609,'en','House of Spoils','An ambitious chef opens a restaurant on a remote estate where she battles kitchen chaos, crushing self doubts… and a haunting presence who threatens to sabotage her at every turn.','/udfMAdiyKhgAS47dRXEnXo6tHt6.jpg','2024-09-21',101,'Released','Bring your appetite.','House of Spoils',1014661,4.6782,5.503,'qPtxADbsUzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32805,_binary '\0','/77Fqz6PFCSnWySDOmEL6ZPcaYIl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21830902',6.1,34584,'en','Upgraded','Ana is an ambitious intern dreaming of a career in the art world while trying to impress her demanding boss Claire. When she\'s upgraded to first class on a work trip, she meets handsome Will, and Ana pretends to be her boss– a white lie that sets off a glamorous chain of events, romance and opportunity, until her fib threatens to surface.','/uhOXS17gRpTwA85WsZLlYFK3rz0.jpg','2024-02-07',104,'Released',NULL,'Upgraded',1014590,8.6636,7.2,'P3_dj7BnHp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32806,_binary '\0','/43oduu4qhXLkpRk0SVRP0FcWvFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2183152',6.1,2821,'en','The Lady Vanishes','Young socialite Iris Carr befriends an older woman while traveling solo by train. When Iris wakes from a nap, the woman is gone and other passengers claim she never existed.','/AuLuO1pEy8yAYTIROv0uH6cuXa9.jpg','2013-03-17',86,'Released','Is anything what it seems?','The Lady Vanishes',178146,2.0997,6.3,'BmYTkfXGwPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32807,_binary '\0','/AqLFZK2nykm6oURXFRHjOaAssqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21833376',7.3,2823,'uk','Довбуш','In the early eighteenth century, foreign rule means dark times for the Hutsuls of the Carpathians. The two Dovbush brothers become opryshkos - mountain outlaws. But the two brothers become enemies - one cares only about money, the other - Oleksa - fights for his people. The Carpathians are convulsed with a wave of uprisings. The aristocracy uses its military might to try to kill Dovbush and destroy his legend. But Dovbush outwits them. The desperate lords devise a devious plan and attack the invincible outlaw\'s Achilles heel - his love for his childhood sweetheart, Marichka. Who will be the assassin to attack the Opryshko whose immense strength and bravery inspired folk tales? Will the lords\' treacherous plan destroy the hero before he can lead his people to freedom?','/85HSmdR9xW0PJdnPsn8KaUfZPGI.jpg','2023-08-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Dovbush',815029,1.9272,6.9,'Rvh36mLq_kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32808,_binary '\0','/yOolpgCdBtn7RH9JQQi8rI47HAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21833834',6.2,2651,'en','Limbo','Travis, a jaded detective, arrives in the remote outback town of Limbo to investigate the cold case murder of local Indigenous girl Charlotte Hayes 20 years ago. As truths about the murder begin to unfold, the detective gains a new insight into the unsolved case.','/g9I1TsGYWMOiFSMfyRTnjhP9hdN.jpg','2023-05-18',108,'Released',NULL,'Limbo',1077670,3.1282,6.1,'-UgQxOmBNSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32809,_binary '\0','/twnIpXYZXXVq0DsMxFdDUdG0YOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21835934',6.7,1274,'ta','August 16, 1947','An atrocious British general is in charge of a secluded fictional village in pre-Independence Madras. Spanning in three days, from 14 August to 16 August 1947 and follows the illiterate and oppressed villagers’ lives as they fail to receive the news of India’s Independence due to isolation. A local lout, Param, leads a revolt to free them all.','/75BAvjIU5yAnNAJRF7uVorBnNRd.jpg','2023-04-07',144,'Released',NULL,'August 16, 1947',980044,1.1397,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32810,_binary '\0','/5XIRL45dcc44GKkcKTzRXsRuxaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21836538',7.1,6813,'en','The Figo Affair: The Transfer That Changed Football','This documentary spotlights one of the most contentious deals in football history and the extraordinary player at the center of the storm: Luís Figo.','/cmUmwFRrgQguSPPut2SYzwNEQEY.jpg','2022-08-25',105,'Released',NULL,'The Figo Affair: The Transfer That Changed Football',1014779,2.295,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32811,_binary '\0','/vcpgqWoIxtmCGpUD2tOtAXbKPT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21836620',7.2,2665,'en','Skandal! Bringing Down Wirecard','Upstart payment firm Wirecard wowed the financial industry with its runaway success — until a tenacious team of journalists exposed massive fraud.','/ArXXUMwKZURyXMNyy0Q86cRLaIt.jpg','2022-09-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Skandal! Bringing Down Wirecard',1014550,1.6705,7.431,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32812,_binary '\0','/arA7AFtzpJdOmWMQNh5gXpfR7SD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21837726',7.4,12524,'en','The Redeem Team','Using unprecedented Olympic footage and behind-the-scenes material, The Redeem Team tells the story of the US Olympic Men\'s Basketball Team’s quest for gold at the 2008 Olympic Games in Beijing following the previous team’s shocking performance four years earlier in Athens.','/iXu5rPQYean8AktqZHmWb27rOEe.jpg','2022-10-07',98,'Released','Everything to lose. Everything to prove.','The Redeem Team',1018648,3.717,7.377,'UMmfRJdPPoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32813,_binary '\0','/qTHpxLjOadI2fcCoi5o1zUN9Ofo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21841642',6.2,1867,'en','A Maple Valley Christmas','Erica is a rancher who has spent her whole life working the family farm with her mother and sister. When Aaron arrives and disrupts her plans, she starts to question what it is she actually wants.','/mMpXU9tJOtOGdMkUTJzotJbNd1j.jpg','2022-11-05',84,'Released','Let love be your legacy.','A Maple Valley Christmas',1027442,1.8088,6.3,'g7e9DqQW_Ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32814,_binary '\0','/cWdttyAMaOl4cK85oCfZALpIKWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184227',6.3,1842,'it','Bella addormentata','A mosaic of several intertwined stories questioning the meaning of life, love and hope, set during the last six days in the life of Eluana Englaro, a young woman who spent 17 years in a vegetative state.','/basum4NDZlibx0Vbd3AKqIOFXYm.jpg','2012-09-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Dormant Beauty',110447,2.9176,6.3,'sdqtISQSMfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32815,_binary '\0','/fOIAJv6Nynqav4Aw56RZXmrhehp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184233',6.3,2985,'en','1 Mile To You','After a teenager\'s friends die in an accident, he finds running allows him to remember them perfectly. Running, however, also brings him notoriety. He is caught between keeping the past alive and making new memories in the present.','/by5sJxbg7HXdqSm05oYT54AsZTg.jpg','2017-04-07',104,'Released','Run with your heart.','1 Mile To You',342472,3.1151,6.5,'LFB0NqjfpBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32816,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184267',2.1,1262,'en','Saint Dracula','He is the vicious leech of the myths and, at present, the tragic lead of a love story.','/bn9vH8ukZQP0hLieJt8aylg3uzr.jpg','2012-11-11',120,'Released',NULL,'Saint Dracula',149233,1.1767,2.4,'LPfsINRyO_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32817,_binary '\0','/oPeJdQLq4p3dYb1dup7UgLd0ENc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184287',5.6,4480,'en','Summer in February','The Newlyn School of artists flourished at the beginning of the 20th Century and the film focuses on the wild and bohemian Lamorna Group, which included Alfred Munnings and Laura and Harold Knight. The incendiary anti-Modernist Munnings, now regarded as one of Britain\'s most sought-after artists, is at the centre of the complex love triangle, involving aspiring artist Florence Carter-Wood and Gilbert Evans, the land agent in charge of the Lamorna Valley estate. True - and deeply moving - the story is played out against the timeless beauty of the Cornish coast, in the approaching shadow of The Great War.','/78p1N5yne7VpEq7s7saaim1fuHB.jpg','2013-06-13',101,'Released','A true tale of love, liberty and scandal amongst the Edwardian artists\' colony in Cornwall','Summer in February',180951,3.0979,5.356,'hcow3GMWqfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32818,_binary '\0','/djCFJH5SHJFlhyMuWUsGTyyhiHH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184331',6.7,2036,'es','Una noche','In Havana, Raul dreams of escaping to Miami. Accused of assault, he appeals to Elio to help him reach the forbidden world 90 miles across the ocean. One night, full of hope, they face the biggest challenge of their lives.','/2iFWDgFgflcu8ORHuCVERYITjTX.jpg','2012-04-19',90,'Released','Three kids. One night. No return.','One Night',140447,2.2759,5.7,'RKLXDk4NFrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32819,_binary '\0','/9J3HHP3kQ5ZStyirJyWPWtvvrHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184339',5.8,263608,'en','The Purge','Given the country\'s overcrowded prisons, the U.S. government begins to allow 12-hour periods of time in which all illegal activity is legal. During one of these free-for-alls, a family must protect themselves from a home invasion.','/46X1ei9uf13nkkr0OhWldGyr5Uh.jpg','2013-05-31',85,'Released','One night a year, all crime is legal.','The Purge',158015,13.9121,6.244,'A2bVeqhzuSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32820,_binary '\0','/mk9LcqxSPVxvquFhQYg8vRhC1zM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2184390',4.3,1233,'en','So Cold the River','A documentary filmmaker\'s research on a town\'s mysterious benefactor unearths an unexplained evil while staying at a local resort.','/5cf2aIXdSCiM40Hae0g2W8Ox98h.jpg','2022-03-25',93,'Released','Some pasts won\'t let go.','So Cold the River',811061,2.3364,5.4,'LqNM1a6j6Jo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32821,_binary '\0','/f2YYd59EwNAMroWDds4MhRooFWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21848358',7.1,7625,'hi','जोगी','Amid tension in 1980s India, three friends of different faiths unite in a noble yet dangerous effort to save hundreds in their town.','/aQJ93gdI2htbZfOLX41PnkRxW3l.jpg','2022-09-16',116,'Released','The biggest human heist','Jogi',1014386,1.7593,6.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32822,_binary '\0','/mMyOE1X6ypJpyHIhpqfCmwOY1H6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2185022',7.5,7556,'en','Love on a Leash','A dog who strives to become a man seeks a woman who will love him enough for the transformation to take place.','/pNbvw5Ru8meiUawJSh4Rr1xyk5E.jpg','2011-07-21',86,'Released','Love at first bark.','Love on a Leash',307124,2.1838,6,'wE3oDEOwzFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32823,_binary '\0','/7Xcxujw8dN5a9rCMOWKEiHSvW01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21853596',4.6,2572,'en','The Island','When his brother is killed, LAPD officer Mark leaves the city to return to the island he grew up on. Seeking answers and ultimately vengeance, he soon finds himself in a bloody battle with the corrupt tycoon who\'s taken over the island paradise.','/ajb1rMiorchfRemYHZCkbV9DBg6.jpg','2023-07-21',93,'Released',NULL,'The Island',1138749,4.5382,6.3,'vInLr1OZ_0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32824,_binary '\0','/c8jqJ502BzvkCXy2enrao1PuQEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21860836',7.3,2488,'en','Obi-Wan Kenobi: A Jedi\'s Return','This special explores the return of Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker to the screen, as well as Ewan McGregor and Hayden Christensen to their classic roles. Director Deborah Chow leads the cast and crew as they create new heroes and villains that live alongside new incarnations of beloved Star Wars characters, and an epic story that dramatically bridges the saga films.','/vQGgvXjoMZf8x1m3BHsMxVXPyck.jpg','2022-09-07',60,'Released',NULL,'Obi-Wan Kenobi: A Jedi\'s Return',1015606,6.1103,6.8,'4WaC8k3WVl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32825,_binary '\0','/qkv9i6XvM5O7iYYsJHQff4ZN01J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21862626',5,1981,'en','Kids vs. Aliens','All Gary wants is to make awesome home movies with his best buds. All his older sister Samantha wants is to hang with the cool kids. When their parents head out of town one Halloween weekend, an all-time rager of a teen house party turns to terror when aliens attack, forcing the siblings to band together to survive the night.','/f87UCQzVwMlzGFePtCtZS4TgAFp.jpg','2023-01-20',75,'Released','F*ck space.','Kids vs. Aliens',1013870,2.2227,5.3,'3F_feNb4oYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32826,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186669',3.9,1835,'ar','٤٨ ساعة في إسرائيل','Amal raises her brother Nasr after the death of her father and husband in an Israeli raid on Suez in 1956. Nasr grows up and joins the Egyptian intelligence and travels to Greece to obtain an important microfilm, but he disappears after being kidnapped. However, he manages to hide the microfilm. Amal decides to travel to Greece to search for her brother. Both the Egyptian intelligence and the Israeli intelligence (Mossad) monitor Amal to obtain the microfilm, and the events of the film continue.','/ispr8OQ9QFo95FFZogvrmCaSoFd.jpg','1998-01-28',110,'Released',NULL,'48 hours in Israel',481574,0.663,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32827,_binary '\0','/ihwMvLqVch8ByUOieDTQcSLuV2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186715',6.6,5692,'cn','寒戰','After five specially trained officers and a van full of firearms fall off the grid, the Hong Kong police start receiving calls from the hijackers.','/zFiHdFJHppW43xmsnS8whzYnVQ8.jpg','2012-11-08',102,'Released','Asia\'s safest city is about to be tested.','Cold War',137409,2.9249,6.632,'eGMM9NYef6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32828,_binary '\0','/xov3ufX4ZRyw2pSF3XLNjtvZPw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21867370',6.6,2751,'ko','공조 2: 인터내셔날','Follows Rim Chul-ryung heading back to South Korea in pursuit of a brutal and secret criminal organization. He teams up again with Kang Jin-tae, who volunteers to work with the North Korean in order to get back on the investigation team after a mistake landed him in the cyber crime department.','/wvJOS9e9b0GXfNni98dYZujPLC8.jpg','2022-09-07',129,'Released','One team new mission.','Confidential Assignment 2: International',736820,4.6065,7,'ZYuNzKBtDhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32829,_binary '\0','/cUHxmWfkp6se0Rt10Kr86bMCYDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21867434',7.3,72779,'en','BlackBerry','Two mismatched entrepreneurs – egghead innovator Mike Lazaridis and cut-throat businessman Jim Balsillie – joined forces in an endeavour that was to become a worldwide hit in little more than a decade. The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic demise of the world\'s first smartphone.','/nQSvHZDuMlrZdm7ooMo8gb4CXhW.jpg','2023-02-13',120,'Released','Work hard. Fail hard.','BlackBerry',1016084,7.4139,7.184,'cXL_HDzBQsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32830,_binary '\0','/uRbzr3dYlWa6NK1ya8fEPqDOUyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21867590',7.2,1700,'cn','正義迴廊','Adapted from a sensational real-life case in 2013, the intricate story begins when a young man partners with his friend to murder and dismember his parents. Pleading not guilty, the defense attorneys soon turn on each other, as the defendants play the devil and idiot game. Meanwhile, heated debates emerge inside the jury room, where nine jurors grapple with the truth.','/2Jh0O3AwUK7zzzAvkGf9xRfmB76.jpg','2022-10-27',135,'Released','Based on the crime and trial that rocked Asia.','The Sparring Partner',1005251,2.37,7.061,'pwO8gNlAgzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32831,_binary '\0','/t9Ov67Xd7uyxddVzxkTrWOelJom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186766',5,1259,'en','All Stars','Two kids look to throw an ambitious dance show in order to save their struggling youth center.','/piZarTWIVogobaasi9XaexNilRj.jpg','2013-05-01',106,'Released','6 misfits. One show...No way!','All Stars',189680,2.9126,5.6,'p0ICgA86VN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32832,_binary '\0','/p5jnaIXiGWY2aRMYynGTGlSiQRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186781',7,2987,'en','Five Dances','A gifted young dancer arrives in New York City and joins the downtown contemporary dance world. With talent to burn, he soon must choose between his responsibility to his broken family in the Midwest, and forging a life and career for himself.','/nvaoz2MOT4GkqfhIQcjbTJ7sSZX.jpg','2013-06-19',83,'Released',NULL,'Five Dances',142115,1.9873,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32833,_binary '\0','/tnUv0HX7kpVNysU0TYu7NreXuJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186783',4.9,2212,'en','Forbidden Ground','Three British soldiers find themselves stranded in No Man\'s Land after a failed charge on the German Trenches. Set in France 1916.','/bbADqCeTMMhyUqXWXGlbQgY6oK1.jpg','2013-08-16',95,'Released','Survivors will become heroes.','Forbidden Ground',215814,1.5612,5.4,'9rfW8Eui4AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32834,_binary '\0','/uuAbE6pP6VF7LxeOTokMUeDPyPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186812',6.3,13571,'fr','20 Ans d\'écart','38-year-old Alice has everything to become the next editor-in-chief of Rebelle magazine except for her uptight image. But when the young and charming Balthazar, barely 20, crosses Alice\'s path, she realizes that he holds the key to her promotion.','/7PbiUzPjM6ZvD9sGppBtdLcDdwx.jpg','2013-03-06',92,'Released',NULL,'It Boy',173185,7.7848,6.54,'AZFP0oIUit4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32835,_binary '\0','/7tmlUctBhphnEpbTetZYvcy04ng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186819',6.1,2366,'ko','하울링','A beat cop and his rookie partner investigate a series of killings that seem to be carried out by a mysterious wolfdog.','/eVxXzYqOXblLVI7nVOAupxTme6D.jpg','2012-02-16',114,'Released','The Case With No Trials.','Howling',116227,1.6962,6,'7ialMPe1JAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32836,_binary '\0','/pBNTlK05egmrIIs14rTBcImhibN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2186848',5.8,7725,'en','Landmine Goes Click','After an American tourist steps on a landmine, he is forced to watch his girlfriend get assaulted.','/dRzCChRwhFXSjamEaj7wUWtTl7T.jpg','2015-03-03',110,'Released','Dare to step off.','Landmine Goes Click',329556,2.6456,5.589,'6xlmjV4hMIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32837,_binary '\0','/6GD0l6dTLHiULOAauHFxViCAD7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21869176',6.4,1500,'ca','Creatura','After moving in with her boyfriend, Mila becomes aware of her loss of desire.','/1HELwyz6NMKi16cc6VRbXsaZCsD.jpg','2023-06-07',110,'Released',NULL,'Creatura',1071846,2.1269,6.1,'BQM-RHhDTRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32838,_binary '\0','/ecOf