mbarks on a personal mission with his trusted comrades to eliminate the mastermind, ensuring the sleeper cells remain leaderless and trapped in silence, waiting for orders that will never come. Ready to sacrifice his own life, he sets out on his final mission—but does he succeed, and at what cost?','/18Hvx5MDIVnoexyehnGmMQE1lod.jpg','2012-11-13',170,'Released',NULL,'Thuppakki',143010,1.7509,7.3,'aW_j4pNvG98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32842,_binary '\0','/zbJlLFRtPv8mFdiNaJCbv2DYizi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2187248',7.9,1236,'ta','தங்க மீன்கள்','Kalyani, a poor labourer, strives hard to make a living and provide for Chellamma, his innocent eight-year-old daughter.','/bXLqVU2qnKViL3hwDOe45wJucah.jpg','2013-08-30',125,'Released',NULL,'Thanga Meenkal',218197,1.0873,7.458,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32843,_binary '\0','/hBPiwjiNCyI08gftr2IxOX3LYPg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21873280',7.4,1256,'es','Un actor malo','During the filming of a movie, actress Sandra Navarro denounces actor Daniel Zavala for sexual abuse on the set during the recording of a scene for the movie. Daniel pleads his innocence and the production tries to prevent the situation from leaking off the set and causing a scandal.','/lWcxVUhWPwAsck8gmZlilPONCJ6.jpg','2024-04-04',129,'Released','When reality surpasses fiction.','Bad Actor',1111869,1.3663,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32844,_binary '\0','/4AUSrS2IzntYdycY01OlnJNug1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2187444',3.9,2074,'en','Pernicious','It was supposed to be an adventure of a lifetime as three young girls spend the summer in Thailand. But their adventure quickly becomes a nightmare when the trio unleashes the spirit of a murdered child with only one thing on her mind – revenge.','/np86qoyuuiuF4uPGbVyzHdXju1b.jpg','2015-06-15',93,'Released','Evil Never Dies, It Waits','Pernicious',326441,1.1789,4.4,'Z6kNwJFYLJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000