55',5.8,2531,'da','Alle for to','This sequel to the box office hit All for One finds the previously tight-knit trio dispersed: Nikolai is on parole, while brothers Ralf and Timo are planning a heist involving the unlikely combination of unsalted butter, a strict diet and a helicopter. When their seemingly impossible heist succeeds, Nikolai asks to borrow some money to start over. The brothers reject him, but when all three of them are tricked by a fish-loving banking executive, they are forced to team up again.','/wbLVedzlKgNa6qKuLRozQpSs3b.jpg','2013-01-31',89,'Released','This is all for two, and you are out !','All for Two',168510,1.0978,5.5,'RqXGb4CxLP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32849,_binary '\0','/A3fWOEryWNdCfIkzl177ZJQoXr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2188717',4.5,2100,'en','Dead Souls','On his 18th birthday, Johnny finds out that he\'s come into an inheritance - and his family were a lot stranger than he ever knew...','/4HHl7IrFNDxFU4MEAHHfjKbfbbJ.jpg','2012-10-11',93,'Released','Don\'t go home','Dead Souls',183412,1.3965,4.7,'6YEhKm0kXQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32850,_binary '\0','/xJQsDKD6ZfQ9nJGtuKB4N878REq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2190367',7.1,9848,'pt','O Som ao Redor','An independent private security firm arrives at a middle-class neighborhood in Recife, Brazil.','/gX5bvUtJZaBjWwq8lSwGOIJN5jM.jpg','2012-11-19',131,'Released',NULL,'Neighboring Sounds',97989,1.8594,7.1,'yeDOSDOs2X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32851,_binary '\0','/d0w5Ch9jwuE6tkHeNVu7aniPvwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2190467',5.9,2212,'en','Safelight','A teenage boy and girl discover a renewed sense of possibility as they go on a road trip to photograph lighthouses along the California coast.','/3Fy3aBhBe9IWJdgL9HfCbYXpvpP.jpg','2015-07-17',84,'Released','To find their future, they had to escape their past...','Safelight',296025,2.9061,5.8,'O21zOIJU9cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32852,_binary '\0','/oq153wuHYMIyQ1FAkeJl2sZ6y3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2190483',7.2,1955,'ru','Жить','Fate brings ordeals to characters that find themselves immersed in deep crisis; they must seek the strength to cope with adversity. In a remote and cold region of Russia, Galya, a middle-aged woman with a drinking problem, has been separated from her twin daughters and she wants them back. On the other hand, Grishka and Anton are a young couple who decide to get married, but right after the wedding their relationship is put to the test in a brutal way. Artyom longs to see his missing father, but his mother objects. There is only one element that brings all of these characters together: misfortune.','/xzA7NMuR4MtlZUxp4yzdkRMaWEf.jpg','2012-08-30',119,'Released',NULL,'Living',144804,0.7002,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32853,_binary '\0','/86vpf0kTFk0epGRJpyemNNQbWmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21905744',4.6,7495,'en','The Front Room','Everything goes to hell for newly-pregnant Belinda after her mother-in-law moves in. As the diabolical guest tries to get her claws on the child, Belinda must draw the line somewhere.','/zjkU6mZH9dMbQK2B622MlsRT8uw.jpg','2024-09-05',95,'Released','All hell moves in.','The Front Room',1016848,6.139,5.111,'eMQt_V2eCRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32854,_binary '\0','/nLSxaIFn89TllahCKqyqOVhNJ1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21905940',6.8,1329,'es','El castigo','A child disappears from his parents sight in a mysterious but haunting forest after a punishment.','/8H80Pa3F03Fber6A1p5iW5xBuL5.jpg','2022-09-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Punishment',1019239,1.6847,6.6,'HlYN64259nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32855,_binary '\0','/gSkXPjdC4H8tenobA0msHIeSVZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21906206',5.2,1842,'en','Hotel for the Holidays','Georgia is an ambitious young woman and the manager of the high-end hotel, which attracts guests of all kinds—including heartbroken singles, an infamous pop star, and a European ex-prince who recently abdicated his throne — all looking to escape from their everyday lives and come to the hotel as a sanctuary during the holiday season. Georgia’s work and personal life become entangled when she is caught between the charming hotel chef Luke and the sophisticated ex-prince staying at the hotel, Prince Raymond. The storylines of Georgia and the hotel’s eclectic guests twist, turn, and come together, as they unexpectedly find friendship, love, and inspiration.','/1NOG8uPLzqLrpf5H5PZH658VjP1.jpg','2022-12-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Hotel for the Holidays',1017339,2.0546,5.9,'WP8vBw2SrTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32856,_binary '\0','/7YUB91f71QEBsccsQuIeqHvIrxy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2190838',5.2,5442,'en','Stage Fright','A high-end musical theater camp is terrorized by a bloodthirsty killer who hates musical theater.','/a92NoM9rikfHrLbWS2Isg0cYXw4.jpg','2014-04-03',89,'Released','Sing Your Heart Out!','Stage Fright',156597,2.0282,5.32,'nzTsNbQXwPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32857,_binary '\0','/m7TX7dhMxvxp7w7MS5vUprm9i7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21908676',5.3,4992,'hi','नीयत','When an exiled billionaire mysteriously dies at his birthday party at a Scottish castle, the prime suspects are his close family and friends, each with a motive to kill him.​ CBI officer Mira Rao must use all her skill to unravel the mystery where nothing is what it seems and everyone hides a secret or two.','/yHLEle6lz50GH97D7bAcingUlxG.jpg','2023-07-07',132,'Released','One Murder, Many Mysteries.','Neeyat',968748,1.2174,5.1,'ptiMDzLQnzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32858,_binary '\0','/48wrf9AAI6K2f7gsKVTh1UT81XW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21909366',5.6,2928,'da','Den grænseløse','In a moment of cowardice, Detective Carl Mørck sends Rose, his junior colleague in Department Q, to the remote Danish island of Bornholm to answer his old colleague Christian Habersaat\'s repeated requests. But during his forced retirement ceremony Christian kills himself sending Rose into a journey deep into her own traumatic past. Later, Department Q are embroiled into an old cold case of a girl found dead hanging in a tree.','/bdJaVU8f8OJbz4SqhXx9TiErdDS.jpg','2024-02-01',126,'Released',NULL,'Boundless',1078249,5.1412,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32859,_binary '\0','/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21909764',6.1,46802,'es','Culpa mía','Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister\'s mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.','/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg','2023-06-08',116,'Released','Love can only survive in the shadow of secrets.','My Fault',1010581,41.6824,7.7,'xY-qRGC6Yu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32860,_binary '\0','/2X5wFZj3tqP9A3gTVUTdhgx6eHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21909844',6.1,2235,'tr','Prestij Meselesi','The film, which deals with the birth and rise of the Prestige Music generation, tells the passions and life struggles of artists, including Özcan Deniz, Haluk Levent and Mahsun Kırmızıgül, from the 1990s to the present.','/5Fsr8mHyd0GxQYBl83357e23kCs.jpg','2023-02-02',121,'Released',NULL,'A Matter of Prestige',1024600,1.0414,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32861,_binary '\0','/a3XL3zY9Jx5Zea1IBA9Ag4LUBxg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191082',5.8,4786,'en','A Promise','A romantic drama set in Germany just before WWI and centered on a married woman who falls in love with her husband\'s teacher. Separated by the war, they pledge their devotion to one another.','/p6QfDLXrO2PX5xAl2x2koJmwlNa.jpg','2013-09-04',94,'Released',NULL,'A Promise',214081,3.9268,5.7,'ixI61YXEOFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32862,_binary '\0','/jx4lkFMfRbRZjB0FCqJlHryQNGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191332',7.1,3096,'tr','Gözetleme Kulesi','Haunted by his dark past, a man takes a job as a fire warden in a remote tower in the wilderness, and is inexorably drawn towards a young woman with a terrible secret of her own.','/aGr2VXyGezWtol9vnOoS7JYWFvK.jpg','2012-10-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Watchtower',128244,1.8043,7.235,'rULaaWl6-aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32863,_binary '\0','/uNMwASFJXcoJ0QYcEVMxnTcTYCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21913634',4.3,1569,'en','Natty Knocks','On Halloween Eve, Britt and the kids she is babysitting have to survive the horror of serial killer Abner Honeywell, who is himself the traumatized son of B-movie horror legend \"Natty Knocks\".','/ofs3b0oDJvZh8Pp74kakIPcUOu7.jpg','2023-07-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Natty Knocks',960469,1.653,5.2,'9nuTYwOlmpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32864,_binary '\0','/iHWmBFux6qFAed55IhkE3M6JwEC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191394',7.1,2828,'th','ATM เออรัก..เออเร่อ','Two enamoured employees in a bank with no fraternization policy must recover their company\'s lost money while trying to keep their relationship a secret.','/8DNNANlLkL2b8VxYB0cw8CB6GwZ.jpg','2012-01-19',123,'Released','The ultimate battle depends on this ATM.','ATM',104651,1.6835,7.3,'c-JXLx-ygvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32865,_binary '\0','/vSfqeerU4E3b8dI7TWbGSX4vrdn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191400',6.5,2493,'da','Spies og Glistrup','Maybe the best thing to come out of Scandinavia during the hippie years was, in fact, the story of a radical libertarian and a hedonist capitalist. Their friendship, forged by being outsiders in a conformist country, took them through years of adulation and success, with slight detours into the welcoming arms of vilification and imprisonment. A joyride through taxation, mass travel, hookers and politics. Not feeling too constrained by historical facts, director Christoffer Boe\'s story of Simon Spies and Mogens Glistrup covers just a few of their decades in a tale of warmth and humour, defiance and eccentricity.','/f1aHVJQKflibJQhjCN8jZCobLyW.jpg','2013-08-29',110,'Released',NULL,'Sex, Drugs & Taxation',211005,1.3972,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32866,_binary '\0','/raAnzfAAJ8nk21iTEker6SSY5kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21916206',3.6,2056,'de','Der Parfumeur','To regain her sense of smell and get back her lover, a detective joins forces with a perfume maker who uses deadly methods to create the perfect scent.','/ieivbB7SDenOGfqae0vZdJQfJA.jpg','2022-09-21',96,'Released',NULL,'The Perfumier',1016446,3.081,4.505,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32867,_binary '\0','/7JhsJxNmdW0y4IyNrHy10cECrAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191701',5.4,194808,'en','Grown Ups 2','Lenny has relocated his family back to the small town where he and his friends grew up. This time around, the grown ups are the ones learning lessons from their kids on a day notoriously full of surprises—the last day of school.','/hT6ijOtjtYrnyDhN7VA2QWyGFAm.jpg','2013-07-11',101,'Released','Just because they\'re a little older doesn\'t mean they\'ve grown up.','Grown Ups 2',109418,24.0445,6.193,'EClDbUb-bgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32868,_binary '\0','/jGfDFFkz8fGu5ITSZBOFeYHbkze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21917050',6.8,1774,'ta','நாட் ரீச்சபிள்','After getting a tip through an app, about a girl being kidnapped, the cops reach the crime scene, only to find out that another girl has been murdered there. How did this happen? Where is the girl who was kidnapped?','/5bEt0Yiapdk6SSoBiGQbDtuIWpR.jpg','2022-09-09',136,'Released','A Conflicting Crime Thriller','Not Reachable',1017749,0.7802,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32869,_binary '\0','/jz8hxdROUuWuiVgH3u8zIKIjm3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191721',3.7,1294,'hi','Jodi Breakers','Jodi Breakers is a Hindi film directed by Ashwini Chaudhary featurring R Madhavan and Bipasha Basu in the leading roles with Omi Vaidya and Dipannita Sharma in supporting roles.','/osbyqCxFZsxrdkmncuUhwlPvkZ8.jpg','2012-03-02',128,'Released',NULL,'Jodi Breakers',84877,1.8484,5.071,'czJk9mek-I0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32870,_binary '\0','/aMdJ3syKHN5d37ixAygWOX17Qx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191765',6.2,11633,'fr','Un moment d\'égarement','Antoine and Laurent, old friends, spend their vacation in Corsica with their respective daughters: seventeen-year-old Louna and eighteen-year-old Marie. One evening at the beach, Louna seduces Laurent. Louna is in love, but for Laurent it was nothing more than a momentary distraction. Without revealing her lover\'s name, Louna confides in her father, who tries by any means to discover who his daughter\'s lover is. How long will the secret be able to be kept hidden?','/o9NRdRKpaQyrpFpWVjLt6LTZijO.jpg','2015-06-24',106,'Released',NULL,'One Wild Moment',342878,5.526,5.8,'eVQuAw9jf5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32871,_binary '\0','/9uMZWLVrwaAx8l8nGReQTD6Aqa0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2191888',5.7,4611,'en','Proxy','While walking home from her latest OB appointment, a very pregnant Esther Woodhouse is brutally attacked and disfigured by a hooded assailant. This horrible event seems to be a blessing in disguise when Esther finds consolation in a support group. Her life of sadness and solitude is opened up to friendship, understanding, and even acceptance. However, friendship and understanding can be very dangerous things when accepted by the wrong people.','/oeVynprx6gjG9O2PItcb09FIZ7u.jpg','2014-04-18',122,'Released',NULL,'Proxy',211065,2.2624,5.5,'arRhnf213E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32872,_binary '\0','/h1FiTVcFyz4lKVxnT3MnfJeuJxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2192016',7.4,6899,'en','The Dark Horse','One-time Maori speed-chess champ, Genesis Potini, lives with a bi-polar disorder and must overcome prejudice and violence in the battle to save his struggling chess club, his family and ultimately, himself.','/qaYROTCUIYYfHLU6ClzXygychzu.jpg','2014-07-17',124,'Released','Bravery is contagious','The Dark Horse',276496,1.5902,6.3,'X3YopiaQ3k8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32873,_binary '\0','/xUZg3SoY7jYnvXrn6TbZOtDNMPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2192582',6.9,2071,'ru','Рассказы','A young writer brings a collection of short stories to a big Moscow publishing house. The manuscript stays at the office and mysteriously influences the lives of anyone who opens it and reads at least one page. There are four stories in the manuscript, and four readers whose lives are changed after reading them. The situations range from realistic to absurd to thrilling to create a rich portrait of life in contemporary Russia and showcase the thoughts, feelings and ambitions of people who live there.','/b95pDpdu8SslD7mGBwM0xBnH14Z.jpg','2012-11-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Short Stories',160833,1.0393,6.071,'TbLcvo8SXS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32874,_binary '\0','/sYDsiXb88fMuTazC6J72PG6VpVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21926684',6.2,1392,'ta','பகாசூரன்','A street performer is on a killing spree and a retired army man turned YouTuber tracks an online sex racket parallely. How do their lives connect and what is the street performer really seeking?','/mwEn3zXAvKiMEt3xmaEynKFCqP0.jpg','2023-02-17',155,'Released',NULL,'Bakasuran',981371,1.0242,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32875,_binary '\0','/muG1Inh2Eawg8MoAElROpwHGtur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21927594',7.1,4811,'de','Girl You Know It\'s True','The rise and fall of Milli Vanilli, a studio group assembled by German producer Frank Farian and fronted by nightclub dancers Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan. After a string of worldwide hit singles, awards and performances, it was revealed that the duo never sang a note of their songs, leading to one of the biggest scandals in music history.','/yKYSHULhVfFzibLmWyJfUiwsFkR.jpg','2023-12-06',124,'Released','The biggest scandal in music history.','Girl You Know It\'s True',1067950,3.1068,7.4,'5xXcn5tWwx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32876,_binary '\0','/5bmbMBoVJByokQpglOZGBHyNDh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2192888',4.4,2545,'sv','Sune i Grekland - all inclusive','A penny-pinching dad springs for an all-inclusive Greek vacation with his wife and three kids, who get up to plenty of antics of their own. What fun is a family vacation if you actually have to hang out with your parents the whole time?','/aym1nUcs16ti6sZlBs3cZVQgs7L.jpg','2012-12-25',85,'Released',NULL,'The Anderssons in Greece: All Inclusive',133459,1.9354,4.9,'wa-Y_Vd894o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32877,_binary '\0','/6Bgd7xihK37b98ERPTvLOqQO1eu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21929356',7,4823,'en','A Trip to Infinity','Does infinity exist? Can we experience the Infinite? In an animated film (created by artists from 10 countries) the world\'s most cutting-edge scientists and mathematicians go in search of the infinite and its mind-bending implications for the universe. Eminent mathematicians, particle physicists and cosmologists dive into infinity and its mind-bending implications for the universe.','/24EXccaDuDEMYp7eVvsCicj5K41.jpg','2022-09-26',79,'Released',NULL,'A Trip to Infinity',1005031,2.8735,7.1,'CNFm_DzHDaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32878,_binary '\0','/bnhSHdrmPBSY2F61aIQh1NlXKrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21929748',7.2,1696,'en','BS High','After a nationally televised high school football game between top-ranked IMG Academy and unknown Bishop Sycamore ended with an IMG blowout win, it\'s discovered that Bishop Sycamore isn\'t at all what it seems.','/j2nhRa8t6qV8AlUxHOeqmKSKm9O.jpg','2023-06-14',95,'Released','It was all a scheme.','BS High',1070807,1.9382,6.8,'aevincEID5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32879,_binary '\0','/d1lPdtkHZDKI6RxFNQLDY8MkdFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193185',5.9,1753,'en','Rewind','Revolves around a team of military field operatives and civilian scientists who must use untested technology to travel back in time to alter past events in order to change the future and avoid a devastating terrorist attack. Feature length pilot for failed tv series, released as a made for TV movie.','/yO653wd3BbJOzW3xALMDPFTZK95.jpg','2013-08-26',76,'Released',NULL,'Rewind',217341,1.3358,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32880,_binary '\0','/mJaIjahqXpWtDVMMLQr81yRNniG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193215',5.4,110812,'en','The Counselor','A lawyer finds himself in far over his head when he attempts to get involved in drug trafficking.','/aNiLkGnzVb5CorZHKk16w9S4COt.jpg','2013-10-25',117,'Released','Sin is a choice.','The Counselor',109091,12.6279,5.3,'6ML50I0mVHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32881,_binary '\0','/ucvAwCzaRuQAydXKP1BPErgZIzR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193265',4.9,14675,'en','Welcome to the Jungle','A company retreat on a tropical island goes terribly awry.','/xWXn2Pfrkbe7Xuwv2BZ2UL53Wdf.jpg','2013-04-27',95,'Released','Unleash your inner beast!','Welcome to the Jungle',205724,5.1144,5,'TBjKcuGI0kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32882,_binary '\0','/djPUo00dbry1frPzDLD5dgsmG7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21933110',5.1,8295,'de','Old People','A woman who\'s returned home with her two kids to attend her sister\'s wedding must suddenly defend their lives against older people on a killing spree.','/2JKKheLcrpXXYSUD3mkmdq8I9p3.jpg','2022-10-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Old People',999722,3.1145,5.643,'-EG8hNcRNwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32883,_binary '\0','/cHm2EMaqQY8QJsXPm4PXLK3T9Ol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193364',7.3,4633,'ur','Main Hoon Shahid Afridi','A boy who dreams of becoming the next Shahid Afridi finds himself down on his luck when the only club he ever knew goes bankrupt.','/4vYmrWN7OG8schYSTSkTE3YHUt4.jpg','2013-08-23',130,'Released','Jeet Ke Liye Kuch Bhi','Main Hoon Shahid Afridi',226393,1.5864,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32884,_binary '\0','/i8V32GInnjIKSkE3YHKHJQLeXWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193418',4.5,8441,'en','Hammer of the Gods','Action epic sees a passionate young man transform into a brutal warrior as he travels the unforgiving landscape in search of his long lost brother Hakan The Ferrocious, whose people are relying on him to restore order to their kingdom.','/i44bgKZ0Q84D462SU21ePNoPkDm.jpg','2013-07-05',99,'Released','Blood will Reign','Hammer of the Gods',192538,3.4971,4.407,'MUrL7GcgHO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32885,_binary '\0','/5BMC7wIcQMoPhQqiMETqHb1Mx6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2193456',5.7,1686,'en','Nearlyweds','Revolves around three friends who have dream weddings only to find out that the pastor who married them failed to complete the key paperwork required to make them official.','/jGv37RQEGJL2scwpOzT3pxMegGf.jpg','2013-01-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Nearlyweds',163814,1.7197,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32886,_binary '\0','/d6UCTzWPV3BJap5OB9kE45gdAVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21935200',6.4,3161,'ta','சைரன்','After being in jail for 14 years, Thilagavarman gets out of prison on parole. A cat-and-mouse chase unfolds as Nandhini, a tainted police officer zeroes in on him as suspect in a spate of murders','/gpHjWVPf8h8i40zOLBWKbkZGvW5.jpg','2024-02-16',154,'Released',NULL,'Siren',1019232,1.4195,6.188,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32887,_binary '\0','/nxqLO90i7cPqjNuS6NEwf608KSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21935486',6.2,1653,'te','సింధూరం','Set in Sriramagiri in 2003, Ravi is a college drop out who works as an informer to Singhanna, a Maoist leader who operates against the local politician. Sirisha, sister of the village head Eeshwar Reddy, becomes the new MRO to the village, decides to eradicate Naxalism in her village and hopes to bring a change. The continuous bloodshed between democracy and armed struggle reveals to us the darkest secrets behind every noble cause.','/jVlMypbIRectCSzpU4iV8T9hFNS.jpg','2023-01-24',133,'Released','The Reinterpretation of The Revolution','Sindhooram',1077101,1.2466,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32888,_binary '\0','/23HvwdsAQeL0MxN9fm3d8m1NaPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21940010',7.3,27017,'en','A Million Miles Away','The life of engineer and former NASA astronaut José M. Hernández, the first migrant farmworker to go to space.','/kMI3tgxLAZbzGOVlorUBva0kriS.jpg','2023-09-08',122,'Released','It takes more than a dream to reach the stars.','A Million Miles Away',1002185,6.9654,7.6,'J-HcUuiLzR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32889,_binary '\0','/elZZLzhDzjRIIkGcIK0FGmZSUaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21942598',6.2,19016,'en','Freaky Tales','In 1987 Oakland, a mysterious force guides The Town\'s underdogs in four interconnected tales: teen punks defend their turf against Nazi skinheads, a rap duo battles for hip-hop immortality, a weary henchman gets a shot at redemption, and an NBA All-Star settles the score.','/lo5mfglsGeMYmAkSRXs9DATNJxk.jpg','2025-04-04',107,'Released','In 1987, Oakland was hella freaky.','Freaky Tales',979660,7.0159,6.335,'-2e8SYmofZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32890,_binary '\0','/2WRe1y5S1jGWTKUcSPPmD1Ixq56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21942866',6.8,97230,'en','Dream Scenario','Hapless family man Paul Matthews finds his life turned upside down when millions of strangers suddenly start seeing him in their dreams. But when his nighttime appearances take a nightmarish turn, Paul is forced to navigate his newfound stardom.','/eMaAi8wTI5wON8pp33w3BDuGyZ8.jpg','2023-11-10',102,'Released','Meet the man of your dreams.','Dream Scenario',823482,11.9672,6.652,'q3x9iUL-74w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32891,_binary '\0','/einbto9qLXFx9QXxEHylaxDbKPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2194499',7.8,442270,'en','About Time','The night after another unsatisfactory New Year\'s party, Tim\'s father reveals to him that the men in their family have the ability to travel through time. They can\'t change history, but they can change what happens and has happened in their own lives. Thus begins the start of a lesson in learning to appreciate life itself as it is, as it comes, and most importantly, the people living alongside us.','/ls6zswrOZVhCXQBh96DlbnLBajM.jpg','2013-06-27',123,'Released','What if every moment in life came with a second chance?','About Time',122906,21.7643,7.901,'7OIFdWk83no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32892,_binary '\0','/vyT3ClK10TozZpYZ9FnjGObDUzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2194599',5.3,4473,'de','Kokowääh 2','Who said a patchwork family is without problems? Two years after the turbulence of Kokowääh, everyday life turns to everyday chaos…','/hwaouRPtEF5Vc5nLA9QvFkwbjhA.jpg','2013-01-27',120,'Released',NULL,'Kokowääh 2',170759,4.1248,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32893,_binary '\0','/eBa978z4R19VXT1JSB9g5kk8T4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21946058',5.3,2779,'te','Hunt','Arjun is the ACP of Hyderabad, who gets involved in an accident which leads him to suffer partial memory loss. He must tackle his inner demons and confront external enemies who are trying to keep him from solving his friend and colleague Aryan Dev’s murder case. Eventually, Arjun solves the murder case and learns that Aryan has been killed by a man, who is a closeted homosexual. To stop Aryan from outing that man publicly, that man killed him.','/6QnfT7zunSxKwbQmmT9FoxccwZe.jpg','2023-01-26',132,'Released','Guns Don\'t Lie','Hunt',938890,0.8273,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32894,_binary '\0','/5Wwi4rF7wmRXbU5mJD81nV6Pg4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2194724',7.9,2036,'ja','劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ[後編] 永遠の物語','As the young girls have discovered the truth about the cruel fate of a magical girl, one magical girl after another is destroyed. Throughout it all, there is one magical girl who continues to fight alone - Homura Akemi. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part II: Eternal is a retelling of the second half of the TV anime series.','/vPrVi40JAScg92zKEpOQPHmYrZs.jpg','2012-10-13',109,'Released',NULL,'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part II: Eternal',152044,3.9755,7.508,'ZknpyKkHIvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32895,_binary '\0','/sIpqSkjb7VxQLBnNDzbmKjWK1Iq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2194826',5.9,2674,'en','The Barber','Eugene is a small town barber, beloved by the local community, but hiding a deadly secret. John is hunting for a serial killer not to expose him but to learn the business! They form a twisted bond and turn the town upside down as Eugene teaches John to kill.','/oYODFbMfqsT5qvH440bN3wXL86n.jpg','2015-03-27',95,'Released',NULL,'The Barber',312797,2.5592,5.644,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32896,_binary '\0','/t0WFxaoKHptUN6MUagdR5xZqf0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21950462',5.3,1723,'fr','Visions','An experienced airline pilot, Estelle leads a perfect life between long-haul flights with her loving, protective husband Guillaume. One day, by chance, in an airport corridor, she crosses paths with Ana, a photographer with whom she had a passionate affair twenty years earlier. Little does Estelle know that this reunion will send her into a nightmarish spiral, turning her life upside down and irrational.','/hKflNpAkZsA5IydLqF4ExbalcYt.jpg','2023-09-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Visions',818721,3.7014,5.74,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32897,_binary '\0','/WqN2eD2R2GOGds5iiZDJcHh7JS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21950514',5.2,1793,'en','A Hollywood Christmas','Jessica, a young, up-and-coming filmmaker in Hollywood has made a name for herself directing Christmas movies. But when handsome network executive Christopher shows up threatening to halt production on her latest movie, Jessica’s assistant, Reena, points out the irony: Jessica isn’t just trying to save her Christmas movie, she’s actually living in one. Jessica must now juggle all the classic tropes—her actors falling in and out of love, a wayward elf dog, and her own stirring romantic feelings for her perceived nemesis—in order to get her movie and her life to their happy endings.','/f8D6dobydMiuabqRDQi0598ghc4.jpg','2022-12-01',91,'Released','She\'s directed every love story... but her own.','A Hollywood Christmas',1028938,2.7592,6.1,'OS6L1Umb-jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32898,_binary '\0','/893UjyF5QIOzNpXP94ZArpKmYHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2195490',6.5,2160,'ko','이웃사람','A serial killer murders a girl from his neighborhood. The residents begin to suspect him one by one, as he tries to cover his tracks and plans another kill before escape.','/jCjA4GFfpaeisAdNI1URXuEagAR.jpg','2012-08-22',110,'Released','Watch who lives next door.','The Neighbors',133601,2.8211,7.3,'1l-T9Z5XXow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32899,_binary '\0','/ptjodfJgt3CSdryZI4zP9HsAWGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21955196',5.8,2496,'sv','Stöld','A young woman struggles to defend her Sámi heritage in a world where xenophobia is on the rise, climate change is threatening reindeer herding, and young people choose suicide in the face of collective desperation.','/ovUBfip0EgyqHZYhVx4K0ZjFkgn.jpg','2024-04-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Stolen',1019317,3.1243,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32900,_binary '\0','/5vNn4LReE0p5AFDVpspYU2ZY8HV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2195548',6.3,21439,'en','Prince Avalanche','Two highway road workers spend the summer of 1988 away from their city lives. The isolated landscape becomes a place of misadventure as the men find themselves at odds with each other and the women they left behind.','/kCfs93bW6FdLIZoYN5pYILysyx4.jpg','2013-02-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Prince Avalanche',113148,2.6145,6.119,'I7Ny5FyHtmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32901,_binary '\0','/w3R8LTPU3ocl6oXuNkXmqw5bIFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21955520',4.8,5282,'en','Peter Pan\'s Neverland Nightmare','Wendy Darling strikes out in an attempt to rescue her brother Michael from the clutches of the evil Peter Pan who intends to send him to Neverland. Along the way she meets a twisted Tinkerbell, who is hooked on what she thinks is fairy dust.','/rhTG3gMlJa0nFlOS7WNKUJ2EDro.jpg','2025-01-13',89,'Released','He\'s every parent\'s worst nightmare.','Peter Pan\'s Neverland Nightmare',1020414,5.7533,5.698,'FtsthiWpcAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32902,_binary '\0','/3TBCV0z4sCor9b8S44wig4rG55P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2195566',7.6,1348,'en','Neurons to Nirvana','Through interviews with leading psychologists and scientists, Neurons to Nirvana explores the history of four powerful psychedelic substances (LSD, Psilocybin, MDMA and Ayahuasca) and their previously established medicinal potential. Strictly focusing on the science and medicinal properties of these drugs, Neurons to Nirvana looks into why our society has created such a social and political bias against even allowing research to continue the exploration of any possible positive effects they can present in treating some of today\'s most challenging afflictions.','/vyGDvVoG6lS33sCTzK1WTmbTqQz.jpg','2013-10-19',69,'Released',NULL,'Neurons to Nirvana',228813,0.9177,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32903,_binary '\0','/qz2QzkYzesbbL94rdUpZrFPhlRe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21957774',5.3,23697,'en','Irish Wish','Maddie\'s dream guy is days away from marrying her best friend when a wish for true love made on an ancient stone in Ireland magically alters her fate.','/v4Bb70dpIIQoEnZAHnm3nzCPauU.jpg','2024-03-14',94,'Released','Be careful who you wish for.','Irish Wish',1019420,5.9324,6.1,'_gKXowSyfjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32904,_binary '\0','/oz6BhMMSOsTfwQ8GTlCKVMKaKDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21958136',6.1,6474,'en','The Wasp','Heather bumps into Carla, having not spoken to her in years, and presents her with a very unexpected proposition that could change both of their lives forever.','/qgsjF2QmnCUi3GGsoAUyoOrvOgn.jpg','2024-08-29',96,'Released','Infatuation can sting.','The Wasp',1019404,3.0608,6.27,'zrw65D3H1r8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32905,_binary '\0','/6KntMDqrvzZJQnrO8ihQSyp8cmq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2196017',6.8,2679,'sv','Mig äger ingen','The story of a lone father\'s relationship with his daughter, of the destructive power of alcohol, of a child\'s vulnerability, but also of love, betrayal and socialist politics in 1970s Sweden.','/rXvzGJSrMxH0atWmaQ4NqGVDuja.jpg','2013-11-08',110,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Owns Me',199740,1.4195,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32906,_binary '\0','/bFBJYftWPdHbm0p1IFFu5vHaFgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2196053',6,1903,'en','Something Like Summer','Something Like Summer traces the tumultuous relationship of Ben and Tim, secret high school sweethearts who grow over the years into both adulthood enemies and complicated friends.','/shYMavWTiJoxMg1irMh9c2P1vpP.jpg','2017-02-25',115,'Released','Twelve years. One love.','Something Like Summer',460437,1.1817,5.722,'g0N8GE4sggw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32907,_binary '\0','/u927k3O6hvGCccmOnLUiqgYeF0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2196254',7.5,3153,'pa','ਜੱਟ ਐਂਡ ਜੂਲੀਅਟ','Jatt is a mischievous lovable sort of a guy whilst Juliet is the typical Punjabi modern day girl. Sparks fly when their paths cross on their way to Canada due to their different outlook on life. But as faith brings them together time and time again their hatred for each slowly turns into friendship only to realize its true meaning when they get separated. Will life give them one more chance to prove their love for each other or will they continue to be at loggerheads?','/sWheGtsztva6pVksRorg0mWC1M6.jpg','2012-06-29',140,'Released',NULL,'Jatt & Juliet',124380,1.372,7.423,'q8aq0WAZFlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32908,_binary '\0','/avl2fPDheCbGQCjO3DQYHOLjTnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21965874',6.7,4588,'en','Allen Sunshine','A former music industry mogul grieving the death of his wife at an isolated lake-side home finds subtle redemption in the youthful spirit of friendship cultivated with two young boys.','/mIz2zVOCRqfUj3QU3X64esg2Up7.jpg','2024-07-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Allen Sunshine',1027801,0.8867,7.1,'weseng2Pgx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32909,_binary '\0','/uwtjyf0EdhDMGqMrwdeoUY9n3ma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21967916',4.8,1289,'en','The Dead Thing','A young woman lost in a series of meaningless connections falls in love with a charismatic and sensitive man, who hides a dark secret that turns her affair into a dangerous obsession.','/mhg1zYmo0CwQITXEIs45lxR5EOE.jpg','2025-02-14',94,'Released',NULL,'The Dead Thing',1287842,1.2813,5.6,'6CwPbQyIeR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32910,_binary '\0','/uXAoawxHYrvx3dOmQ755qdsBsxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2197128',5.9,1788,'no','Pornopung','The story of Karl, Christian and Leo will forever change the way you view the relationship between men and women. In a world were women have the power and all the advantages, they\'ve learned that there is only room for one kind of man - the kind that shaves his balls. In a competition to beat Casanova, they fall victim to their own most charming and destructive in a game all men and women are doomed to lose. Pornopung is a dark and entertaining journey through the forefront of modern seduction and sexuality. It will make the most ardent feminist admit that they\'ve won the war of the sexes.','/q8Ksif8PFgZyhd56fuqYfmlOoLy.jpg','2013-07-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Crack, Back & Sack',126856,2.1327,5.7,'m2vspE5Uto0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32911,_binary '\0','/cOLGWmKOAOgN6ywFm3a0D9Qu5cn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21977546',4.2,1360,'tr','Bomboş','Forty-year-old Günel, whose only passion in life is to photograph inanimate objects, meets an energetic and sympathetic Şefik during the free Cyprus holiday that she won in the company lottery. The holiday, which starts with a beer in a luxury villa, by the pool, becomes unpleasant when Günel breaks his leg. Her only solace is meeting Nazli, who has the same name as her neighbor in Istanbul and is a nurse just like her. Watching Şefik in the neighboring villa out of distress, Günel witnesses an unexpected… murder? He can\'t be sure because of the hot weather and the drugs he takes.','/vabWySL4pStUgOxbVAXIKh8r1xd.jpg','2022-10-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Hollow',976512,0.7935,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32912,_binary '\0','/jrsB8tChsAFTQilhsS8fxNTuear.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2197936',6.6,4737,'en','Fatima','In 1917, outside the parish of Fátima, Portugal, a 10-year-old girl and her two younger cousins witness multiple visitations of the Virgin Mary, who tells them that only prayer and suffering will bring an end to World War I. As secularist government officials and Church leaders try to force the children to recant their story, word of the sighting spreads across the country, inspiring religious pilgrims to flock to the site in hopes of witnessing a miracle..','/lfA46pZbk4kxIaQvHyBPq0KH84Q.jpg','2020-08-13',113,'Released','In 1917, in the midst of a world war, people needed hope. They received a miracle.','Fatima',520318,3.8134,7.2,'m8u9MTfW2zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32913,_binary '\0','/tkNwAiWE9hbiJUUwz42jU2dbWfi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21979910',6.4,13874,'en','The Passenger','Randolph Bradley is perfectly content fading into the background, but when his coworker Benson snaps and goes on a violent killing spree, he’s forced to face his fears and confront his troubled past in order to find a way to survive.','/4elVCxpRBcqVLPEI2sDC4fIa0Mt.jpg','2023-08-04',98,'Released','Ride or die.','The Passenger',957314,4.5579,6.5,'rBUYCbf3r4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32914,_binary '\0','/poPjoZhOFwYMW0ri89JUUSjdP8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2198161',7.5,8485,'te','సీతమ్మ వాకిట్లో సిరిమల్లె చెట్టు','An exuberant and evocative family drama, that primarily revolves around the close bond between two brothers with radically different personalities, highlighting the complex process of choosing an ideal life partner for each of them.','/sP0U5uHuLdc0m8pDqHhofyCqvL4.jpg','2013-01-11',159,'Released','Simple but Beautiful','Seethamma Vakitlo Sirimalle Chettu',193197,1.9331,7.128,'8-fsOSq-_Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32915,_binary '\0','/98bRSb9ST2wwAhlINdf4qcnaoxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2198235',6.7,1645,'hi','Monsoon Shootout','A rookie cop joins the crime branch of the Mumbai police department, and on his first assignment is faced with the dilemma of whether he should shoot a murder suspect who is attempting to escape or not.','/mXyYxhkc8hkUImSeqkfkDx0J0OY.jpg','2017-12-15',88,'Released','The Truth Is Never Simple','Monsoon Shootout',194522,1.4656,6.619,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32916,_binary '\0','/nxWUUSYOTEAjARGUI9EcTBSMo2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2198241',4.7,3173,'en','The Outsider','Revolves around a British military contractor Lex Walker who is told his daughter has died. When he arrives in Los Angeles and discovers the body is not hers, he begins an investigation.','/iYRFAxQpB0VVVO17cPC8nEyZiLN.jpg','2015-06-21',94,'Released','Outgunned. Outnumbered. Out for blood.','The Outsider',241765,4.0553,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32917,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21983580',7.8,2114,'te','Rahasya',NULL,NULL,'2022-09-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Rahasya',1175524,0.8447,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32918,_binary '\0','/n8iboL3CJJNQVHOdeA1jX0nS3dE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21983758',6.2,14438,'ml','ദി ടീച്ചര്‍','PE teacher Devika and her husband have been trying to be pregnant for four years. Their equation changes after she becomes pregnant and when she reveals that she has been abused by four students during a sports meet.','/szlck49swaimG1UlITTiCa2F1Gy.jpg','2022-12-02',121,'Released','Never Forgive , Never Forget','The Teacher',939513,1.0451,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32919,_binary '\0','/muehoR18ntsIHKpHgkffAX9zdhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21987878',6.9,1485,'en','Day of the Fight','On the day of his first fight since his release from prison, a former boxing champion reconnects with his trainer, ex-wife, childhood friend, and abusive father in a quest for forgiveness and closure.','/dGiqb2SoM1WD3NQn3TM4CskkArC.jpg','2024-11-15',108,'Released','How far would you go for the ones you love?','Day of the Fight',1095435,2.8588,6.5,'UtpV_Mwk0ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32920,_binary '\0','/wsyZddVckvPCANlBOklKJaFQWMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21988182',5.5,4690,'en','T.I.M.','Prosthetics scientist Abi and her adulterous husband Paul adjust to life outside the city as Abi begins working for high-tech company Integrate, developing a humanoid AI - T.I.M.','/aGLElgUFzjhvHsbDQ1Ae0d5kaWu.jpg','2023-08-16',101,'Released','His intelligence is artificial_ The threat is real_','T.I.M.',1040229,2.7886,5.722,'X61ztmpSdGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32921,_binary '\0','/6dT9FaI4B4bHYCa5iZGZDhXovso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21989120',6.5,3813,'te','ఉగ్రం','CI Shivakumar,a brash police officer, handles a lot of missing cases which has caused great strain on his marriage life. After a serious accident,Shiva admits his wife Aparna and daughter Lucky in hospital, only to find them missing next day. Will Shiva solve the mystery despite suffering from a serious medical condition?','/cnsJnyCUefcHDQT1OnFgUOSR2nR.jpg','2023-05-05',148,'Released',NULL,'Ugram',1069937,1.2469,5.643,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32922,_binary '\0','/8d5npI4lCu771jYOnA5STkN201C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2198956',6.3,4555,'en','Coldwater','A teenage boy is sent to a juvenile reform facility in the wilderness. As we learn about the tragic events that sent him there, his struggle becomes one for survival with the inmates, counselors, and the retired war colonel in charge.','/txjUPHSFoTwO4IYtRkt997c9ABc.jpg','2013-06-12',104,'Released','We Will Re-Adjust You.','Coldwater',172520,1.4971,6.4,'UHbmYrmNE60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32923,_binary '\0','/g2EUWSPVSLyzIkrKdxuHSF2wGWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21991654',5.5,14609,'en','Sympathy for the Devil','After being forced to drive a mysterious passenger at gunpoint, a man finds himself in a high-stakes game of cat and mouse where it becomes clear that not everything is as it seems.','/afGdVMa80LMs6ibLP22CwM5uI4e.jpg','2023-07-20',90,'Released','Revenge takes the wheel.','Sympathy for the Devil',1030987,4.9718,5.9,'8IOwEPjQq9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32924,_binary '\0','/2NjW4xx7IqkoQaAHNq7aaVt9uKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2199251',3.8,2485,'en','The Wedding Pact','Two best friends in college Mitch and Elizabeth make a pact that if in ten years after graduation they are both not married they will marry each other. Ten years later Mitch (still single) finds out Elizabeth never got married so he decides to travel across the country, find her and follow through on their pact. What he soon realizes is it wont be a simple as he thought.','/hQ8kya0t6OiZovU0mvaPlnoa38E.jpg','2014-02-04',91,'Released','Who remembers those crazy promises you made in college? ...He did.','The Wedding Pact',254047,1.6461,5,'w8Ql1kfDFJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32925,_binary '\0','/pZxSWMjfjSSujRVj8xk8YlIZKoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21994906',6.4,11800,'en','Your Christmas or Mine?','Students Hayley and James are young and in love. After saying goodbye for Christmas at a London train station, they both make the same mad split-second decision to swap trains and surprise each other. Passing each other in the station, they are completely unaware that they have just swapped Christmases.','/A806wuTGJECDh9krhQAhnieQcLr.jpg','2022-12-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Your Christmas or Mine?',865559,3.8299,6.4,'ObRmLzY3ulA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32926,_binary '\0','/4XzjwbFe45SUTmxowDPkac5gUgb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21995004',7.7,1281,'en','The Fire That Took Her','Mother-of-two Judy Malinowski, then 31, was doused in gasoline and set on fire by her crazed boyfriend – and one of the first ever to testify from beyond the grave, at the trial for her own murder. A story that lives at the intersection of true crime and #MeToo, THE FIRE THAT TOOK HER goes deep inside a landmark case to ask a timely question: How much must women suffer in order to be believed?','/ze8zXR2iY0kCHN7qJhkCOv3dExF.jpg','2022-10-21',95,'Released',NULL,'The Fire That Took Her',1025896,1.7068,7.5,'paIqs0f3FAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32927,_binary '\0','/AuzyTuRHzmS78cP6pR9SgDQC6ys.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2199543',6.3,3721,'pt','Praia do Futuro','Donato fails in his attempt to save a drowning man, and meets one of the man\'s friends. He decides to start his life over, but pieces of his past keep coming after him.','/lologg70UiUMok8ijdSfDzBwR0N.jpg','2014-05-01',106,'Released','A hero split in half.','Futuro Beach',227975,1.7394,6.5,'GGkYG6yp7KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32928,_binary '\0','/dqTvzfXhUWPoBuIbQInOBmYvEL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2199571',6.6,120574,'en','Run All Night','Brooklyn mobster and prolific hit man Jimmy Conlon has seen better days. Longtime best friend of a mob boss, Jimmy is haunted by the sins of his past—as well as a dogged police detective who’s been one step behind Jimmy for 30 years. But when Jimmy’s estranged son becomes a target, Jimmy must make a choice between the crime family he chose and the real family he abandoned long ago. Now, with nowhere safe to turn, Jimmy has just one night to figure out exactly where his loyalties lie and to see if he can finally make things right.','/iGvSMoPbWZWDnIhh54yiq3sW7wH.jpg','2015-03-11',114,'Released','One night to live. To die. To run.','Run All Night',241554,13.2786,6.4,'plrh783KCqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32929,_binary '\0','/mxdBG6HTCdpssqk2kNZEXNHv3Ti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21996838',6.6,1596,'en','Mister Organ','Following reports of fraudulent car clamping in Auckland, journalist and filmmaker David Farrier opens an investigation that pushes him to the limits of his sanity in this incredible true story of psychological warfare.','/caBkWqXCtZkpZePfNzwxggCXMtJ.jpg','2022-11-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Mister Organ',1013602,1.87,6.524,'0woo8y3GGZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32930,_binary '\0','/5xXY3oPMnomX7dRalNuwO4Ab57v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2199711',7.9,43676,'ta','விஸ்வரூபம்','Vishwanathan, a Kathak dance teacher in New York, is happy in his marriage with Nirupama, a nuclear oncologist who married him to pursue higher studies in the USA. Deciding to cut ties with her husband, Nirupama hires a private detective to monitor his activities. To her utter shock, certain truths about her husband are subsequently revealed, setting off a chain of events that will change both of their lives irreversibly.','/6j0ie6qImOH0ndS7uaZb4879PwC.jpg','2013-01-25',147,'Released','God will save us. Which god?','Vishwaroopam',117319,1.7194,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32931,_binary '\0','/ffOxfVhSMcHiM26kWFQ9Lto4v6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21997328',5.7,1507,'cs','Její tělo','A Czech high diver\'s Olympic dreams are shattered when she suffers a devastating injury while training. Forced to leave the sport she loves, she follows a photographer friend into the world of nude modeling, ultimately reinventing herself as an adult film actress. Inspired by the true story of diving champion Andrea Absolonová.','/foNYeBzrTpz94Sg9yV6hGMsax8A.jpg','2023-11-16',106,'Released',NULL,'Her Body',1109402,3.4898,6,'tiucyDFhEFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32932,_binary '\0','/oklGdpmjhxbL0cKczHLBzmI4Lop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt21998526',6.6,11260,'hi','Zwigato','Manas, an ex-factory floor manager loses his job during the pandemic. He is then forced to work as a food delivery rider, grappling with the app and the world of ratings and incentives. Life is relentless for him, but not without shared moments of joy with his wife, Pratima. The film captures the life of invisible \'ordinary\' people, hidden in plain sight.','/cy5prmLqNUVOqfEqa0ArhqIRDB1.jpg','2023-03-17',106,'Released',NULL,'Zwigato',1014060,1.1552,6.467,'xtd1aB-iLe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32933,_binary '\0','/yLjDHhGr70Uw6Zm4Bzx6YhZJRtr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22000548',6.9,1247,'hu','Lefkovicsék gyászolnak','A generous and stubborn elderly boxing coach gets along with everyone except his own son. They\'re reunited after the death of the old man\'s wife and forced to face old grievances.','/qAzRyjD5Vld5ZnP1xAN0kEw2BIC.jpg','2024-02-22',85,'Released',NULL,'All About the Levkoviches',1016695,1.3569,7.7,'wTGMrzmaxJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32934,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22000754',7.1,2069,'te','Paga Paga Paga','A incident happend at pezzonipet area where the contract killers lived in 1980\"s . A person give a contract to a serial killer to kill his enemy and how the first person who gave the contract completely out and out comedy action thriller. A incident happend at pezzonipet area where the contract killers lived in 1980\"s . A person give a contract to a serial killer to kill his enemy and how the first person who gave the contract completely out and out comedy action thriller.','/xyBhiwazlaGxEQgo2rlXNeHxXX9.jpg','2022-09-30',129,'Released',NULL,'Paga Paga Paga',1026265,0.4371,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32935,_binary '\0','/p3ptZJtmzjpE9jvvi4NzJvuWALp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22001304',6.6,3491,'it','Adagio','Tangled up with blackmail and crooked cops, the son of a former gangster seeks out his father\'s old friends, who risk everything to save him.','/x9kLSGl1q6T4IKjXpJ8I6O8U873.jpg','2023-12-14',127,'Released',NULL,'Adagio',1021803,1.4048,6.6,'_5kR8naRimM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32936,_binary '\0','/bNH7K4yJtPqLd1VHvsjZHwx4BUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22001978',5.2,4185,'ml','ഓടും കുതിര ചാടും കുതിര','Jilted at his wedding, Aby encounters a reserved woman needing help. As they heal together, his ex returns with newfound insight into his dreams. A hidden truth leads Aby to find peace.','/zIEV0sb7RNcLB7ZKRqt2rx1ANbA.jpg','2025-08-28',153,'Released',NULL,'Odum Kuthira Chadum Kuthira',945836,1.1389,5.313,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32937,_binary '\0','/jiuAJSfQQ873upYtfRL3fTUaNc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22004186',7,1785,'en','A Little Prayer','A loving father grapples with how to protect his daughter-in-law when he discovers that his son is having an affair in a sensitive and searching portrait of a Southern family.','/7kP3bPM1xUhA4zl4ri4DhYoDRDM.jpg','2025-08-29',91,'Released',NULL,'A Little Prayer',1043766,1.8618,5.6,'_tsHp2PM2lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32938,_binary '\0','/UxPjfVl50OGlJ6Ww8DXEDFzx7g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22004344',7,18708,'en','Snack Shack','Inseparable best friends AJ and Moose decide to run the local pool\'s snack shack after their plan to sell home-brewed beer goes down the drain. Things take a turn when they meet Brooke, an effortlessly cool lifeguard who puts their big plans, and friendship, at risk.','/wCXd5tpUSc12LVPd2oN9OKU1EVQ.jpg','2024-03-15',112,'Released','One summer can change everything.','Snack Shack',1037113,7.6754,7.4,'BdXFIKFPWoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32939,_binary '\0','/doAsWvHiAqp700K2V4KELEcHZi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2200908',7.1,1585,'pt','Febre do Rato','Zizo, a radical and anarchist poet living in a marginal quarter of Recife in the north eastern state of Pernambuco, distributes his social angst-filled thoughts through a publication named Febre do Rato, and spews poetry to anyone who’d listen. Our character always revolves within the universe that he has created around himself. A very particular world, in which satisfying the unfortunate is a mixture of a kind of benefit with high dose of malice.','/iWhRVK8mlUZpNkt4Wo3Z3hHrzgV.jpg','2012-06-22',101,'Released','They can shut the artist up, but never his poetry','Rat Fever',133569,1.2537,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32940,_binary '\0','/4IMn2EqCBb4n4r6FODOP7fJQIdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22010428',8.5,6598,'ko','BTS: PERMISSION TO DANCE 온 스테이지 – LA','Purple colors the city of Los Angeles, as BTS brings their \"Permission to Dance\" concert to SoFi Stadium for the first time in two years. In a stadium radiating anticipation and cheer, splendid performances from \"On\" to \"Permission to Dance\" glorify the stage that now comes to life on screen. Be united once again by the power of music.','/9pNGRpOOQpZtqMLncEcQDv86OkW.jpg','2022-09-08',130,'Released',NULL,'BTS: Permission to Dance on Stage - LA',1022102,2.7823,8.804,'E0JxDffw9J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32941,_binary '\0','/buwTFD7YJY5FhbOcwtUhhouKzwg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22010586',6.4,4286,'en','Capturing the Killer Nurse','Charlie Cullen was an experienced registered nurse, trusted and beloved by his colleagues at Somerset Medical Center in New Jersey. He is also one of history’s most prolific serial killers, with a body count potentially numbering in the hundreds across multiple medical facilities in the Northeast.','/384EXJadmQGmNMfB9nrGSBhCupO.jpg','2022-11-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Capturing the Killer Nurse',1018647,2.0304,6.447,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32942,_binary '\0','/1pbzvBXcAToKg7bu6TXdCVwyDC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201211',6.7,1772,'en','A Boy Called Sailboat','A Hispanic family find hope in their extraordinary son named Sailboat when a personal gesture awakens a global desire. Armed with a \"little guitar\", Sailboat leads an offbeat cast into the miraculous story of the greatest secret never told.','/5h4EI91Y8RNQaVCetbk6nf1SbNr.jpg','2018-06-08',92,'Released','A boy with the most unlikely name, does the most unlikely thing...','A Boy Called Sailboat',416673,2.1767,6.6,'9R6BL9Dr4YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32943,_binary '\0','/1IO3kcmZxz34RIwl11qxsi9CT2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201221',4.5,4018,'en','Some Girl(s)','On the eve of his wedding, a successful writer travels around the country to meet up with ex-lovers in an attempt to make amends for his wrongdoings.','/ozz4epRp9QMxZx8Uj5BQl8rhveb.jpg','2013-06-28',90,'Released','It\'s not you. It\'s him...','Some Girl(s)',172897,1.5718,5.2,'RzpAzzZ0KnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32944,_binary '\0','/i85EPKS1V76LWdF1hoPGH8ffSHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201251',5.2,2289,'en','The Hot Flashes','An unlikely basketball team of unappreciated middle-aged Texas women, all former high school champs, challenge the current high school girls’ state champs to raise money for breast cancer prevention. Sparks fly as the women go to comic extremes to prove themselves on and off the court, become a national media sensation, and gain a new lease on life.','/snonsl2O76GjYWOeyMH5DvPLBcc.jpg','2013-07-12',99,'Released','Everyone thought their glory days were over. Everyone thought wrong.','The Hot Flashes',170752,2.2679,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32945,_binary '\0','/4V5EWfD7ydCF2sZlePaWar7zVOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201261',5.6,2264,'en','The Sky Is Everywhere','Lennie is a teen musical prodigy grieving the death of her sister when she finds herself caught between a new guy at school and her sister\'s devastated boyfriend. Through her vivid imagination and conflicted heart, Lennie navigates first love and first loss.','/qMVUlq6rdqFo1xZ5ozQcKFCDbgj.jpg','2022-02-11',103,'Released','Live fearlessly. Love endlessly.','The Sky Is Everywhere',640265,5.8412,5.7,'7R_5fSWvGs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32946,_binary '\0','/vZCEneYibMTcjxk4TEsNMmRn3Qb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201532',4.2,1256,'en','The Adventures of Beatle','Beatle is a quirky loner who refuses to live by society\'s rules. Her business cards read \"Towing/Assassination,\" and she even has a hit man infomercial to go along with it. Her only human contact is with her psychiatrist and the stripper/hooker she employs once a week. Everything changes the night she meets Athena Klendon, a suicidal blonde with a secret. With a demented killer on their tail, courtesy of Athena\'s crooked former employer, the two quickly strike a bargain. Athena will change her life insurance policy to reflect Beatle as the beneficiary in exchange for her own execution. And while they wait for the paperwork to come through, Beatle will provide room and board and get some extra help on her infomercial. The two have no idea that Detective Holt has been on their case reviewing their every move. Just when he thinks he\'s got Beatle pinned beyond a shadow of a doubt, this comedic mystery takes a wild and unexpected turn.','/umsPInK2ZLwba72VqyvKMQ3ctdZ.jpg','2015-10-20',83,'Released',NULL,'Guns for Hire',356366,2.5849,4.795,'E31JDKvb3S0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32947,_binary '\0','/xcVKEdew2rfkgL5xK312WOzOTv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2201548',4.8,5862,'en','A Teacher','Diana Watts, a high school teacher in Austin, Texas, is in the midst of an affair with one of her students, Eric Tull. As the reality of their situation forces itself upon them, Diana puts the relationship on hold. It’s only a matter of time before she gives in again to her desire; this time even more recklessly than before.','/kqARjEtNutJOTMnLhB4HtLYT4Vb.jpg','2013-09-06',76,'Released',NULL,'A Teacher',158884,2.9214,4.6,'LIM71MCFirE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32948,_binary '\0','/omRgNEWxU8wDbh5Qfdadf4l6V9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22016156',5.3,11608,'sv','Avgrunden','As the Swedish town of Kiruna sinks, Frigga finds herself torn between her family and her job as security chief at the world\'s largest underground mine.','/ta1B8QQ3pBRA0TG8wH0CfgG6vlp.jpg','2023-09-15',104,'Released','NOT IF. BUT WHEN.','The Abyss',1053544,3.6729,5.67,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32949,_binary '\0','/kXucfOA2HcwHnGU9uXx2ymkMqgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2202086',5.8,1614,'hi','Ab Tak Chhappan 2','Home Minister Janardhan Jagirdarand chief Minister Anna Saheb are much concerned over the criminal activities of underworld dons Rawal and Rauf Lala. Rawal is operating from Bangkok while Rauf supervises his gang from Mumbai. The famous Encounter Squad is activated to counter the gangsters and restore peace in the area. The formidable Sadhu Agashe (Nana Patekar) is requested to take charge of the peace-keeping mission. At first he is reluctant but after continuous insistence, he agrees to launch a counter attack against Rawal and Lala Rauf gangs and the action begins.','/acRIouyjmxO9UwKtFSHslUU192Z.jpg','2015-02-27',105,'Released',NULL,'Ab Tak Chhappan 2',328402,1.3703,5.5,'92gFw-QV07I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32950,_binary '\0','/p5ozvmdgsmbWe0H8Xk7Rc8SCwAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22022452',7.5,260481,'en','Inside Out 2','Teenager Riley\'s mind headquarters is undergoing a sudden demolition to make room for something entirely unexpected: new Emotions! Joy, Sadness, Anger, Fear and Disgust, who’ve long been running a successful operation by all accounts, aren’t sure how to feel when Anxiety shows up. And it looks like she’s not alone.','/vpnVM9B6NMmQpWeZvzLvDESb2QY.jpg','2024-06-11',97,'Released','Make room for new emotions.','Inside Out 2',1022789,40.8364,7.54,'L4DrolmDxmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32951,_binary '\0','/umx11EgTkJJNe8a5TrhLrNOgN9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22022784',6.4,4207,'en','My Dead Friend Zoe','Merit, a U.S. Army veteran suffering from PTSD, is repeatedly tortured by visions of her deceased friend and company buddy Zoe. After her Afghanistan service in 2016, she attends group therapy until Dale, her grandfather and former Lieutenant Colonel, is recently diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s. Merit steps up to his aide, and discovers more about herself and her family, while also gaining the courage to put her metaphorical demons to rest.','/bRoDBpwGU5UW03hQMExN2l92Q93.jpg','2024-03-09',103,'Released','Grief can be a funny thing.','My Dead Friend Zoe',1128505,4.5934,6.3,'Q4SbCaV1esg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32952,_binary '\0','/fXpkyFsWFaYW1KN2odqalxguTj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22023218',5.8,9646,'en','You\'ll Never Find Me','Patrick, a strange and lonely resident, lives in a mobile home at the back of an isolated caravan park. After a violent thunderstorm erupts, a mysterious young woman appears at his door, seeking shelter from the weather. The longer the night wears on and the more the young woman discovers about Patrick, the more difficult she finds it to leave. Soon she begins to question Patrick’s intentions, while Patrick begins to question his own grip on reality...','/dfaN69DMjxGmhuoYkWFmsAYwBT0.jpg','2024-03-14',100,'Released',NULL,'You\'ll Never Find Me',1117321,2.8964,6.1,'y1EHT838rrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32953,_binary '\0','/49CjA88b278yvTswsJs1jUJTAbx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22023622',7.2,1221,'el','Σε μια άγνωστη χώρα','Cousins Chatila and Reda are saving to pay for fake passports to get out of Athens. When Reda loses their hard-earned cash to his drug addiction, Chatila hatches an extreme plan to pose as smugglers in an attempt to get them out of their desperate situation before it is too late.','/wjr6q8kw1HkkpoeodvUOjQXFlom.jpg','2025-02-14',106,'Released',NULL,'To a Land Unknown',1214052,2.3883,7.5,'18hfoeEKVm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32954,_binary '\0','/7uz6adVRXIo8xYuyO8feFb73FiU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2202471',6.5,1696,'zh','愛','Eight people try to end their loneliness by searching for that one person to love, who can make their life complete.','/vDvYtfQYCw0BEVCzrd7yfOaLM4W.jpg','2012-02-14',120,'Released','Valentine\'s Day 2012','Love',95919,1.227,5.7,'E_tJOVDtqk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32955,_binary '\0','/9fH0DsfM7941NvvIoMq3x9cyIAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2202607',7.5,1974,'ro','Toată lumea din familia noastră','Marius is a divorced man in his late thirties. His five year-old daughter Sofia lives with her mother, which causes Marius a deep frustration. On the day Marius arrives to take his daughter on their annual holiday, he is told that she is ill but he doesn\'t believe it and insists to take her with him. The situation soon gets out of control with all the family taking part in a web of humor, violence, childish songs, police interventions and love statements.','/vazDs6SKZyprTomY4PYU8nI00Xb.jpg','2012-02-13',107,'Released',NULL,'Everybody in Our Family',126325,1.4806,6.878,'StNH7O2IYm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32956,_binary '\0','/lLdKuIp7ah6dD3BsOaeOAwok065.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22027654',7.7,7826,'ml','ജയ ജയ ജയ ജയ ഹേ','Jayabharathi who was denied every simple joy in life while growing up just because she is a girl/woman is married to Rajesh, a male chauvinist, short-tempered and selfish person. On suffering domestic violence, she doesn\'t get any support. She then decides to fight back!','/lAc6mHHJxmiAbkxrF0TipvRRZW7.jpg','2022-10-28',145,'Released',NULL,'Jaya Jaya Jaya Jaya Hey',931132,1.1967,6.987,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32957,_binary '\0','/kM7HkgCVmpf3ENFGoKLrYHeidbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2202798',3.5,1481,'en','Christmas Twister','During the holiday season, Ethan, a meteorologist, and his wife Addison, a TV news reporter, must put aside their differences and band together to help save others and rescue their missing children from a massive F6 twister that has unexpectedly descended upon their small Texas town.','/oAF5gTU1p8tjkz76d93wRnYd4oS.jpg','2012-12-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Twister',208466,1.7786,4.9,'qQTC0GYl9FE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32958,_binary '\0','/Aq5pvd4AFVtD9HMYtrRLz9Fb3oK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22028080',5.8,1993,'en','I\'m Glad It\'s Christmas','An aspiring Broadway singer is convinced to participate in a small-scale production for her local Christmas celebration. Along the way, she finds hope and unexpected mentorship towards her dream career. But will her professional success come at the cost of her chance at love?','/f06n8vO4sevRsWwwzlkfTa3eRXt.jpg','2022-11-26',85,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Glad It\'s Christmas',1022685,2.5981,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32959,_binary '\0','/xTRnlDvGPXKI81zAXpZDT1J8i4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22029194',3.7,1878,'en','Spin the Bottle','When a group of friends play spin the bottle in a house marked by a brutal massacre, they unknowingly unleash an evil spirit and start dying in terrifying ways. Now, the survivors must stick together to uncover the house\'s dark secrets and end the bloodshed.','/knZo3KnD7mT4aXwLDbYyQw7ZA8Z.jpg','2024-10-03',124,'Released',NULL,'Spin the Bottle',1030983,2.3823,4.9,'KkSk2xG82Zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32960,_binary '\0','/cpMszrx8BFVfmq3ZBrL6RVQvO2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2203308',7.1,39029,'hi','आशिकी २','A young woman meets a failing musician who launches her singing career, but their relationship is doomed when people assume he\'s with her for her fame and fortune.','/z18DWXBRxn3kz00sIVhC7ZK39Qm.jpg','2013-04-26',132,'Released','Love makes life live...','Aashiqui 2',192558,3.0674,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32961,_binary '\0','/cpK4ZqGZVJAIIKo8EgpSHif8yNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22036406',4.4,15987,'ta','கங்குவா','A bounty hunter in present day, learns about his previous life as a legendary warrior, when fate unites him with a mutant kid.','/lycbTFBXqFN1kMdPEsnAFutKEEy.jpg','2024-11-14',154,'Released','A Mighty Valiant Saga','Kanguva',622792,1.8099,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32962,_binary '\0','/kWYOO5KpdTXLlmGhBktutQsJtEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22036922',5,2842,'te','Mr. King','Shiva is an RJ who is doing his thesis on airplane mechanism while Seetharama is cunning and complex. Umadevi and Vennela both fell in love with Shiva. How will Shiva untangle the love triangle and manage Seetharama Raju\'s twisted game?','/8hcuXysMgXrfAGrod67s6hBL5eR.jpg','2023-02-24',145,'Released',NULL,'Mr. King',1105261,1.4058,7,'pN7st20Eo3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32963,_binary '\0','/3hMaW8jFKQe95K7CWMP7SHtYu6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22037066',7.4,6190,'ml','മാളികപ്പുറം','8 year old Kallu from Panchalimedu village is unhappy that her pilgrimage to Sabarimala is delayed and decides to go with her friend.','/3CFhiwbxJXu7YpOJG3vG1TRB0Zd.jpg','2022-12-30',121,'Released',NULL,'Malikappuram',1022973,1.5093,6.545,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32964,_binary '\0','/aUfAbn4WXkioO5FPKAyxnVGaVqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22037984',5.5,3166,'de','Silber und das Buch der Träume','When Liv moves to London, she meets the mysterious Henry and his group of friends, who pull her into the enthralling world of dream-travel. She and her newfound band of dream-wanderers conduct a ritual to make their biggest dream come true, but it demands the gravest sacrifice.','/ycpxvpNyrkzsydwvLTUNixRWrdQ.jpg','2023-11-06',92,'Released',NULL,'Silver and the Book of Dreams',1023845,3.2768,5.7,'l82zIibKF-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32965,_binary '\0','/fk9yvxzTYDBZRiBpoKgrwjSbigQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22039142',7.4,1745,'sr','За данас толико','By baking his favorite dessert – coconut cubes, the siblings manage to lure their eldest brother back home. Time seems to cease to exist, and a tale of happy people unfolds. Seemingly ordinary summer days turn extraordinary. In love with life, they elevate reality above the ground, dispersing any and all dark clouds with their joyous spirit.','/lwMviSok7mbx3msNbNPKqMuDEnm.jpg','2024-03-01',94,'Released',NULL,'That\'s It for Today',1160624,1.0027,8,'EFA08sM3EXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32966,_binary '\0','/vqL1DAd9FbU2CvnG6hLX82bQM0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2203939',6,161990,'en','The Other Woman','After discovering her boyfriend is married, Carly soon meets the wife he\'s been cheating on. And when yet another affair is discovered, all three women team up to plot mutual revenge on the three-timing SOB.','/yHnbb6z8REuFIyBLT2Nj3MX54dY.jpg','2014-04-16',109,'Released','The oddest friends are about to get even','The Other Woman',193610,10.7008,6.423,'BlHMHLuJWbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32967,_binary '\0','/i9c73fQXxchnJZxq9UFlme20oRM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2204080',6.6,5840,'en','Wildlike','Fourteen-year-old Mackenzie is sent to live with her uncle in Juneau when her mother can’t care for her anymore. The living situation quickly takes a turn for the worse, and she runs away to rejoin her mother in Seattle. While on her dangerous journey of sleeping in cars and breaking into hotel rooms, she’s drawn to Rene, a lonesome backpacker looking for tranquility in the wilderness.','/ePr0yezWy3DKsHDv3fUdxSJ6Mz7.jpg','2015-09-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Wildlike',300654,2.1757,6.2,'VnL_YcohpNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32968,_binary '\0','/zz219ZRGo0vVIzvKttjx5nXOc2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22041854',6.4,56609,'en','Priscilla','When teenage Priscilla Beaulieu meets Elvis Presley at a party, the man who is already a meteoric rock-and-roll superstar becomes someone entirely unexpected in private moments: a thrilling crush, an ally in loneliness, a vulnerable best friend.','/uDCeELWWpsNq7ErM61Yuq70WAE9.jpg','2023-10-27',113,'Released','Wife to the king. Icon to the world. Destined for more.','Priscilla',1020006,9.582,6.684,'BK8tT07cY-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32969,_binary '\0','/721p2lNSGp2iSlUUukZwCzEKrnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22042346',5.1,4986,'en','2073','Inspired by Chris Marker\'s iconic 1962 featurette La Jetée; the year is 2073—a not-so-distant dystopian future—and the setting is New San Francisco, the scorched-earth tech-dominant police state where democracy and personal freedom have been well and truly obliterated.','/l67ir3kU53FYd6Vjwhqrkih1H1P.jpg','2024-12-27',83,'Released','This is a warning','2073',1023915,3.1778,6.7,'YDE97KrYDuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32970,_binary '\0','/d89lImlbkjUmDQkeut9KyqUzLS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2204243',6.3,5457,'te','బాద్‍షా','Rama Rao fails to get a job with the police force due to his father\'s connections with a gangster. But when his brother is killed by the gangster, Rama Rao becomes Baadshah to oppose him.','/cGX4vRGRRwu42Z9nyQh1Dp2r7E6.jpg','2013-04-05',155,'Released',NULL,'Baadshah',181882,1.3786,5.5,'pdwZfMi_OQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32971,_binary '\0','/evxXVJtomJJbAXcDxF6wsCJzVDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22042742',5.1,7338,'en','Christmas Bloody Christmas','It\'s Christmas Eve and Tori just wants to get drunk and party, but when a robotic Santa Claus at a nearby toy store goes haywire and begins a rampant killing spree through her small town, she\'s forced into a battle for survival.','/60Dy8eA5QyUHKHBmojXUtZxWdo8.jpg','2022-12-09',87,'Released','You better not cry.','Christmas Bloody Christmas',1019836,2.3035,5.3,'XTacwYIYPJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32972,_binary '\0','/9bKA9eysktLqFOwrZV3myrRCiWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2204340',5.7,2551,'zh','四大名捕','An undercover agent is assigned by his corrupt chief to infiltrate a rival department and sabotage their investigation of counterfeit currency. What he discovers is the counterfeiter\'s real plan. To overthrow the capital. Not by flooding it with funny money, but with an army of undead.','/7FN7JBHUN0aIGls5nxlwDAiQpIi.jpg','2012-07-12',118,'Released',NULL,'The Four',120143,2.6485,6.4,'G82CrR0xHZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32973,_binary '\0','/wHED4nYFwpPOeAF0N9hhjuwdmEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2204371',7,5270,'en','Somm','Somm takes the viewer on a humorous, emotional and illuminating look into the mysterious world of the Court of Master Sommeliers and their massively intimidating Master Sommelier Exam.','/AusSOmDe3jMrXeTn0YosX1Ezai7.jpg','2013-06-21',93,'Released','How much do you know about wine?','Somm',184149,1.0807,7,'zGOUnT_OzoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32974,_binary '\0','/wBfiIbB5HVD8RENhuofL1WIoZu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2204379',5.9,4919,'en','The Devil\'s Carnival','Sinners are invited to a theme park where they endure the repetition of their transgressions. What chances do a conniving kleptomaniac, a gullible teenager, and an obsessed father stand when facing their own moral failings? Lucifer and his colorful cast of singing carnies invite you to grab a ticket to The Devil’s Carnival to find out!','/aXxwHBRvu5i2AieAPAgalgRnone.jpg','2012-04-05',55,'Released','You can\'t help but fall.','The Devil\'s Carnival',100493,2.3531,5.6,'v2hqUqsxe9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32975,_binary '\0','/viKEEaaCaZ0hZ2nGuvIEozlLooL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22048412',6.2,91346,'en','MaXXXine','In 1980s Hollywood, adult film star and aspiring actress Maxine Minx finally gets her big break. But as a mysterious killer stalks the starlets of Hollywood, a trail of blood threatens to reveal her sinister past.','/ArvoFK6nlouZRxYmtIOUzKIrg90.jpg','2024-07-04',103,'Released','Hollywood is a killer.','MaXXXine',1023922,11.4232,6.26,'adax3nfU6HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (32976,_binary '\0','/59AJ2w9tKRSbBpnxKfB5UyIg6Jf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22050754',4.7,31247,'en','The Strangers: Chapter 1','After their car breaks down in an eerie small town, a young couple are forced to spend the night in a remote cabin. Panic ensues as they are terrorized by three masked strangers who strike with no mercy and seemingly no motives.','/oYsCNpW4k7Pd7ac3uQfBhr2ihtW.jpg','2024-05-15',91,'Released','They don\'t need a reason.','The Strangers: Chapter 1',1010600,11.8889,5.667,'3pZUQmZdOi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32977,_binary '\0','/49Lg3ekPtlITIrjvyKVUbKN0ALg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22050856',5.8,1387,'en','A Christmas... Present','Maggie and Eric are busy parents of teenagers who embark on a trip to the home of Maggie’s widowed brother to celebrate Christmas. Everyone has different expectations of the perfect holiday. Through a series of transformative events, Maggie learns to embrace the season.','/cFeWa0Oy9ayM1ou73Xo8HrTAk4C.jpg','2022-11-27',85,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas... Present',1024038,1.4086,5.7,'3xUU79skD78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32978,_binary '\0','/aqqoDJs8vYp2EZ74aQ1UMY0sjM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2205401',5,13107,'en','Addicted','A gallerist risks her family and flourishing career when she enters into an affair with a talented painter and slowly loses control of her life.','/fAERrD6vvmznDoL99wlgjhSfPcH.jpg','2014-10-10',105,'Released','Every Woman Needs an Escape','Addicted',235271,8.0001,5.9,'ZdZ0lUxunbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32979,_binary '\0','/fy7XKiNg6w9cZlPeuNqcxbfnX9J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22054798',7.2,2061,'en','Sakalagunabhi Rama','Ram and Swathi face a lot of financial crisis as Ram\'s salary is low and as a result Swathi leaves him. He gets in touch with his old friend Deepika which leads to a sexual relationship. Will he ever get back with Swathi?','/qGrpnOF8axksPMyzLnluvampQpt.jpg','2022-09-16',123,'Released',NULL,'Sakalagunabhi Rama',1224502,0.9465,3,'HjGETuroxS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32980,_binary '\0','/so5jtbB00IiW3dKbeI5JTdGNmK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2205697',7.2,96182,'en','Stuck in Love','An acclaimed writer, his ex-wife, and their teenaged children come to terms with the complexities of love in all its forms over the course of one tumultuous year.','/byic4VFVrpPyjDWK54CcsxYWW85.jpg','2013-06-14',97,'Released','A story about first loves and second chances.','Stuck in Love',111969,7.355,7.4,'3Z8KrBnasIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32981,_binary '\0','/54iIQChulnjG0gM4X7kFihOY7Ey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22058628',5.8,4313,'zh','长空之王','A talented trainee pilot is given the opportunity to virtually test the latest fighter jet, which pushes him to his limits.','/dsbRnYqHm2OBLQK8E2bvgFafvpf.jpg','2023-04-28',127,'Released','Forge the sword to protect the vast sky.','Born to Fly',1012837,3.2932,6.7,'3pt3cpD8Pao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32982,_binary '\0','/zjI8UymCtOg78xj5HknDNBzyP8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2205904',7,8220,'en','Generation Iron','Generation Iron - examines the professional sport of bodybuilding today and gives the audience front row access to the lives of the top 7 bodybuilders in the sport as they train to compete in the world\'s most premiere bodybuilding stage - Mr. Olympia.','/b71ERNofHX9HXp2v61W3q2sef03.jpg','2013-09-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Generation Iron',207021,2.2626,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32983,_binary '\0','/4YbVJmtXjRL3tmbVHbhZoHqCOka.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2205948',7.6,2054,'ja','劇場版 魔法少女まどか☆マギカ [前編] 始まりの物語','Madoka Kaname, an ordinary middle-schooler, along with her best friend Sayaka Miki, are offered the chance to have any wish they want granted by the mysterious Kyubey, and become magical girls and fight witches. However, fellow magical girl Homura Akemi seems intent on stopping Madoka from becoming a magical girl at any cost. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part I: Beginnings is a retelling of the first half of the TV anime series.','/kJjtXLRR1mV7kEUuSnCKDEmN94G.jpg','2012-10-05',131,'Released',NULL,'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part I: Beginnings',152042,4.784,7.6,'ZknpyKkHIvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32984,_binary '\0','/ydl4dpOEz5NESGqPu1XpFwKxFRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22060496',6,2098,'tl','Pabuya','Gang leader, Pepe, is chased by his rival gangs and the police so he runs to his old flame, Bella, who he trust. But this trust is shaken when the police issues a reward for his capture.','/at6IW12IjSEzHw6im71Z67Ep07f.jpg','2023-09-21',81,'Released','Kunin natin ‘to!','Pabuya',1022921,2.416,5.4,'iU1HAfDjMVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32985,_binary '\0','/ygKvE0XGOZeu5F8rtHX7n2hzSuO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2207050',6.6,3287,'fr','Alceste à bicyclette','Serge Tanneur is at the pinnacle of his acting career when he decides to turn his back on show business and become a hermit living off of France’s Atlantic coast. Three years later, Gauthier Valence, a beloved TV actor, shows up on the island to offer Serge a role in his directorial debut – a rendition of Molière’s classic play, “The Misanthrope”. Serge refuses at first, but then suggests that they rehearse the first scene and after five days he’ll decide if he wants to dothe play or not. What ensues is a battle of brawn and wits and peculiar encounters with a hotel maid who longs to be a pornstar and an Italian divorcée.','/Ao4KVqDGpJvraAurV1mZXbPUKNd.jpg','2013-01-16',104,'Released',NULL,'Cycling with Molière',156236,1.8802,6.5,'lvjwuMylkgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32986,_binary '\0','/zE5j0lQ5dVqSbKLMi3JwrjcT055.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2207072',5.6,4716,'fr','Eyjafjallajökull','The eruption of the Icelandic volcano Eyjafjallajökull causes major disruptions to travelers\' plans around the world. For Alain and Valérie, it\'s a catastrophe. Because to make it to the small Greek village in time for their daughter\'s wedding, this divorced couple, whose mutual hatred knows no bounds, will be obliged to set out on the road together.','/zszXmplKgcZ6WILGxZ1Jax8Ck72.jpg','2013-10-02',92,'Released',NULL,'The Volcano',219318,3.0908,5.6,'ODgDfo6frOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32987,_binary '\0','/tLZlhfGH7riAgzSKo1lJXxAN7ZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22071864',5.8,1465,'it','Per lanciarsi dalle stelle','To honor her best friend\'s last wish, a young woman with severe anxiety confronts her greatest fears to try and reclaim her life — and perhaps find love.','/sPHpbnhFNGyYGzXMT5BQatdIYQN.jpg','2022-10-05',89,'Released',NULL,'Jumping from High Places',1024426,2.389,5.705,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32988,_binary '\0','/hRbREZuDVNZfe5Xpv7Tc3Ptc0eI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2207484',2.7,3290,'en','Muck','A group of friends emerge from the darkness, bloody and lucky to be alive. Having already lost two friends in the marsh, they break into an empty vacation house to take shelter. Whatever was in the marsh is still after them, but it\'s not the only thing that wants them dead. Something much worse and more savage lays in wait.','/bPYH46Qtc85jeeicjAg4hyL8uC2.jpg','2015-03-13',99,'Released','The lucky ones are already dead.','Muck',256030,2.6348,3.1,'g0nZ1Lj3UbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32989,_binary '\0','/jvy29LK18qexSuRDR2vkr1aUfRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22075376',6.6,6416,'en','Milk & Serial','A surprise birthday prank takes a turn for the worse when a popular social media duo must face the reality of the terrifying aftermath.','/7YFkZQEZNlHZewFiqBWeXHRVyGB.jpg','2024-08-09',62,'Released','When a surprise birthday prank goes terribly wrong, two social media influencers must face the devastating consequences that come after...','Milk & Serial',1778411,1.6509,5.667,'pbzGQ1lszv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32990,_binary '\0','/y1wd7YlAmYVnS45x2kK9ryydixM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2207658',7.2,1768,'en','Louis Theroux: Twilight of the Porn Stars','In 1997, Louis Theroux made a documentary about the world of male porn performers in Los Angeles. 15 years later, he returns to find a business struggling with the deluge of free porn on the internet. Louis revisits some of the original programme\'s contributors as well as meeting the latest crop of porn performers dreaming of porn stardom.','/n1piaZaulT4iV1YUouCox1Syzck.jpg','2012-06-10',60,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: Twilight of the Porn Stars',115189,1.9203,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32991,_binary '\0','/7OaLy1fxMKb37DZW6aG6BnGqiA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22078754',6.4,2278,'ml','കഠിന കഠോരമീ അണ്ഡകടാഹം','Bachu, a young man who wishes to become a businessman, is in a big crisis. His family forces him to go to Gulf but he is not ready to change his decision. When lockdown is imposed he rethink his actions.','/xeyVlSv6ouJkCYQ7Gg5n2qAftjq.jpg','2023-04-21',120,'Released',NULL,'Kadina Kadoramee Andakadaham',1016263,0.8586,5.444,'s7k_JTkIws0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32992,_binary '\0','/yFG0dsaG4LdKGouUXKlca35iQSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22080556',7,1221,'en','Missing 411: The U.F.O. Connection','In Missing 411: The UFO Connection, David Paulides continues the story of people who vanish in the wild without a trace. In his third documentary, David reveals the first evidence documenting a link between UFOs and missing people.','/wuw2SInmgIh14FGvSkqM31VHuQw.jpg','2023-09-10',93,'Released',NULL,'Missing 411: The U.F.O. Connection',1060000,1.0529,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32993,_binary '\0','/sL7oLmRQQGa7y8XpiXBp3Qn1mg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2208144',6.6,1416,'de','3 Zimmer/Küche/Bad','Eleven moving dates, eight friends: Philipp, Wiebke, Jessica, Maria, Swantje, Michael, Thomas, Dina – all in their twenties and mutually lonesome. And always searching: For a new city, a new job, an own apartment, a new, or even an old love. The search is never-ending, and so they repeatedly find themselves at a ritual gathering: someone moving. Boxes are shifted from one side of Berlin to the other, or the length and breadth of Germany, from one abode to the next as one life is exchanged for another. In 3 ZIMMER/KÜCHE/BAD, director Dietrich Brüggemann portrays existences in which relationships, social networks and backdrops are in a constant state of flux; where best friends are the only, and therefore the most valuable constant. Humorous sketches of the self-conception of a generation for whom moving has become the symbol of a life on the go.','/3uQNbpcK7AMaZif8wz6XEJamRU8.jpg','2012-10-03',118,'Released',NULL,'Move',130736,1.9729,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32994,_binary '\0','/eRZOgO9m7UVOCZx9tLal0bSlck5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2208216',5.9,2931,'lt','Aurora','Lucas is a scientist who works near the European experimental project that focus on advanced ‘human neuron research’. The project is to transfer neuron information from one human mind to another. Lukas is chosen to connect his mind with a comatose woman he named Aurora.','/2FDPjmAhKcVj0lLZRFjMRjQXV1D.jpg','2012-06-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Vanishing Waves',133764,1.9823,5.8,'-iED4L2Drcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32995,_binary '\0','/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22084616',8,299132,'en','Spider-Man: Brand New Day','Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn\'t remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.','/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg','2026-07-29',145,'Released','A brand new day starts now.','Spider-Man: Brand New Day',969681,658.2244,7.864,'62bIsvRcPv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32996,_binary '\0','/ncbT2hBlge60umfN904qkkVpm0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22085392',5.8,1852,'en','Satanic Hispanics','When police raid a house in El Paso, they find it full of dead Latinos, and only one survivor. He’s known as The Traveler, and when they take him to the station for questioning, he tells them those lands are full of magic and talks about the horrors he’s encountered in his long time on this earth, about portals to other worlds, mythical creatures, demons and the undead. Stories about Latin American legends.','/8oRsWDVKBiLE7laQLH6uwgmKioE.jpg','2022-11-25',113,'Released','5 Stories from 5 Latino AF Directors','Satanic Hispanics',1015080,1.9731,5.8,'o2FuIjP9miM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32997,_binary '\0','/oL7rpJoLzKhQYVK2zsJGcMcJfx5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2208568',5.5,1607,'en','Montana','In the mean streets of London\'s East End, a former Serbian commando and a fourteen-year old boy plot revenge against a powerful crime lord and his ruthless lieutenants. As our heroes prepare to take on their enemies, the boy is mentored in the dark arts of assassination and learns the true meaning of friendship, honor and respect.','/wpoaBvuSEudMzPdvrd9jRAlbCW.jpg','2014-10-05',108,'Released','Raised in the streets, trained by an assassin.','Montana',290336,1.3698,6.1,'rBjtBIrYYUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32998,_binary '\0','/uHvxzUCjRQHSRBdmyoLQY6ZrtJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22086334',5.2,13446,'hi','ड्रीम गर्ल 2','Karam, a small-town boy from Mathura, is struggling every day to pay his father\'s debt, who has borrowed money from nearly everyone on the planet. On the other hand, he is deeply in love with Pari, whose father has kept the conditions to marry her. To make ends meet, Karam dons as Pooja, which creates wild chaos and a comedy of errors.','/gvNeqDNwZ8isym8CeHZsZk1QiSJ.jpg','2023-08-25',134,'Released',NULL,'Dream Girl 2',1025067,1.9045,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(32999,_binary '\0','/yknasAMOThRi4J3WNJZztM3Wgm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22091698',5.7,2026,'pt','Esposa de Aluguel','To fulfill his mother’s dying wish and avoid being removed from her will, an inflexible bachelor hires an actress to play his fiancée.','/6l6qR3JGf1WLJAwwYgIQPR5rLKz.jpg','2022-10-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Someone Borrowed',1022206,2.8767,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33000,_binary '\0','/olX3IvsMtwTOSFwvwr5cDmWvNYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209266',6.4,1405,'pl','Obława','Marcin Krysztalowicz\'s film is both a partisan ballad, showing the real face of German occupation of Poland during WW2 and a startling war thriller. It tells a story of corporal \"Wydra\", struggling not only with Germans and Polish traitors but also with his own past...','/kxlApZWJF3g3o0vLFSkJM82p5F3.jpg','2012-10-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Manhunt',166045,0.9605,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33001,_binary '\0','/jmlATmv6IEIDfrX9vrxoT3epLa9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209300',7.3,4478,'pl','Pokłosie','Two brothers are trying to find out the truth from years ago. The whole town is against them.','/gdkPvFAs5C5RtQan18cvPQdsM0e.jpg','2012-11-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Aftermath',143800,2.0385,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33002,_binary '\0','/aqGDZrEN3wCpLHs4lPoN07BijdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209386',6.7,3633,'pl','Jesteś Bogiem','The story of the late 90s generation and the three friends behind the music: Magik, Fokus and Rahim. The fact-based film charts the relentless struggle for success of Paktofonika, against the backdrop of crumbling traditional values in dreary 90s Silesia.','/obzhVV6Pc51jjDrOy6ZHscLp1c8.jpg','2012-09-21',110,'Released',NULL,'You Are God',135161,1.0564,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33003,_binary '\0','/hM6L8ouknh9SLhFcNNWxqGSHfJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209400',5.7,2212,'pt','E Aí... Comeu?','Three male friends navigate different stages of romantic relationships: One is starting to date; another fears infidelity; the third is divorcing.','/Av3xRNFS0Zgvqp4nirocppD3Bjy.jpg','2012-06-22',105,'Released','The first true comedy about love','Hey, Did You Score?',117534,1.2797,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33004,_binary '\0','/aPSGg0ZGirS0sSxGlwTGTAo0ruV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209418',7.9,188299,'en','Before Midnight','It has been nine years since we last met Jesse and Celine, the French-American couple who once met on a train in Vienna. They now live in Paris with twin daughters but have spent a summer in Greece at the invitation of an author colleague of Jesse\'s. When the vacation is over and Jesse must send his teenage son off to the States, he begins to question his life decisions, and his relationship with Celine is at risk.','/qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg','2013-04-05',109,'Released','Everything\'s better with maturity.','Before Midnight',132344,7.7657,7.5,'NRVLVPWzeek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33005,_binary '\0','/ypuD6ZsupyVV1ElNSIPz2BooIlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209764',6.2,248655,'en','Transcendence','Two leading computer scientists work toward their goal of Technological Singularity, as a radical anti-technology organization fights to prevent them from creating a world where computers can transcend the abilities of the human brain.','/i3JqPtiJWnidaif3UA2K2Eng0hp.jpg','2014-04-16',119,'Released','Yesterday, Dr. Will Caster was only human...','Transcendence',157353,9.5126,6.082,'280qnrHpuc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33006,_binary '\0','/rViGvoM5eWaSnxOS1ycvD0hJkTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2209792',5.7,1276,'en','The Encounter 2: Paradise Lost','Seven years after the world\'s most devastating tsunami in Thailand six strangers find themselves trapped in a beach side resort on the brink of an oncoming hurricane. Each of their hearts are broken and silently cry out on the most desperate night of their lives. As the storm rages on and the six strangers fall deeper into the heart of darkness another guest arrives at the hotel. He says he is Jesus Christ, and he knows what each of them suffers from. Knowing their dire need, he came to bring them all a message of hope and rescue them from the darkest corners of their own hearts.','/fISfe7hl61Yyp7qJpQ1szBysc0J.jpg','2012-09-18',100,'Released',NULL,'The Encounter 2: Paradise Lost',128540,1.8929,4.9,'EpCK_idZKFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33007,_binary '\0','/5XzXnCsb3I0ZH8CQQnlDxd5rKK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22099068',3.5,4732,'hi','कोड नेम: तिरंगा','Tasked with capturing a wanted criminal, a fierce undercover agent wrestles with perilously high stakes when her heart is pulled into the mission.','/mAcdxgmbLvflTz9cASmsURO09N2.jpg','2022-10-14',137,'Released','Nation. Love. Sacrifice.','Code Name: Tiranga',1021166,0.9227,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33008,_binary '\0','/5Gp3dWngab6qlNUkSjChWC2gjTo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210425',7.4,6093,'ar','1000 مبروك','A man finds himself stuck in a mysterious time loop, reliving the same day again and again. As the cycle repeats, he is forced to confront his daily routines, question his relationships, and search for meaning in a world that refuses to change.','/7Dsxc1YpF95yca8aEKrSAq6y3wM.jpg','2009-06-26',115,'Released',NULL,'1000 Mabrouk',44090,1.2326,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33009,_binary '\0','/fiXkW2f7HzkjrelKnkqwtpeROVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210441',8,9283,'ar','عسل أسود','An Egyptian-American returns to his homeland after twenty years abroad, filled with nostalgia and high hopes. But as he reconnects with his roots, he finds himself caught between two worlds—and begins to experience the reality of a country he thought he knew.','/4VftuMgC4O9uDJZGA6XzNety5W1.jpg','2010-05-25',131,'Released',NULL,'Bittersweet',84250,2.1189,7.5,'I6ig5pQ-wGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33010,_binary '\0','/kvDJrJ9A7duUJL8oMrm8dNu7QSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210463',4.5,4364,'en','Battle of the Damned','Following a deadly viral outbreak, private military soldier Max Gatling leads a handful of survivors and a ragtag band of robots against an army of the infected.','/xmGJwTaQ8XTnW4EPNag6Eu2KaTL.jpg','2013-08-18',89,'Released','He didn\'t come here to be a hero, but things change.','Battle of the Damned',185471,2.6722,4.462,'gl18WpHOn3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33011,_binary '\0','/v7GQxa9ZmdMZjt4JwZF54mvAiTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210479',7.5,16259,'ja','ベルセルク 黄金時代篇I 覇王の卵','Guts, an immensely strong sword-for-hire, has little direction in his life, simply fighting one battle after the next. However, this all changes suddenly when he meets and is bested by Griffith, a beautiful and charismatic young man who leads the Band of the Hawk mercenary army. After Guts joins the Band and the relationship between the two men begins to blossom, Casca, the tough, lone swordswoman in the Band of the Hawk, struggles to accept Guts and the influence he has on the world around her. While the two men begin to fight together, Griffith continues to rise to power, all seemingly in order to reach his mysterious, prophesied goals. What lengths will Guts and Griffith go to in order to reach these goals, and where will fate take the two men?','/vES8WAzjowrMT8gwnoEaCioZXXk.jpg','2012-02-04',76,'Released','He trusts no one, only his sword.','Berserk: The Golden Age Arc I - The Egg of the King',113082,4.9007,7.3,'FnbwFiZf9vg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33012,_binary '\0','/oEVPuMiuWc9Z2zHU2XOgALAj1Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210509',6.4,3551,'ar','بلبل حيران','Bulbul meets a successful aristocratic girl named Yasmine, but she\'s not the romantic type he dreams of, at the same time he admires his cousin Hala for her calmness and kindness. In the middle of all this, the psychiatrist Amal shows up and he thinks of getting engaged to her.','/8BvqE3uBGJ0BBzAoUJkFzeq3d7M.jpg','2010-11-11',112,'Released',NULL,'Bewildered Bolbol',57773,1.3475,6.3,'CcGLWeuezEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33013,_binary '\0','/gF12JJf9wU2y1j0bXL4y3m3ZqQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210581',5.2,1551,'ar','اللمبي 8 جيجا','Lembi.. a poor lawyer who marries a school teacher and he causes her troubles due to his bad financial status, and then he meets with an accident which changes the way he was living....','/rkabkYawRYHx0lvUFdiXzx8TNcX.jpg','2010-07-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Lembi 8 Giga',57468,1.3389,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33014,_binary '\0','/bZcnfOdOohGSJ2NHDbpxXLI9No6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210725',5.3,1806,'ar','خمسة باب','Inside the prostitution district of Old Cairo, an honest policeman is appointed to fight corruption and bullying inside the neighborhood, until he falls in love with one of the women there. After a trap is set for him, he gets fired from his job.','/tvvuE4xzxeWVqdD0sHDDAFDYW9d.jpg','1983-08-08',140,'Released',NULL,'Khamsa Bab',64162,0.9132,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33015,_binary '\0','/3pNf4EyNet3WNHRpxtQrsUlZeEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210769',7.5,10093,'hu','Liza, a rókatündér','Liza is a naïve, lonely 30-year-old nurse who wants to fall in love. Her only company is a long-dead Japanese pop star, who turns her into a fox-fairy out of jealousy. Now, every man who desires Liza shall die horribly. Can she overcome the curse?','/h0nP7HDejKeuiJumJpR5S5GOnG1.jpg','2015-02-19',98,'Released','Dating can be fatal','Liza, the Fox-Fairy',326333,1.6127,7.3,'hWxLLyr9aOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33016,_binary '\0','/1xFjrbb12NoGvXkdNt6KTiePpXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210781',6.1,2961,'en','Lullaby','Estranged from his family, Jonathan (Hedlund) discovers his father has decided to take himself off life support in forty-eight hours’ time. During this intensely condensed period, a lifetime of drama plays out. Robert (Jenkins) fights a zero sum game to reclaim all that his illness stole from his family. A debate rages on patients’ rights and what it truly means to be free. Jonathan reconciles with his father, reconnects with his mother (Archer), sister (Brown-Findlay), and his love (Adams) and reclaims his voice through two unlikely catalysts – a young, wise-beyond-her-years patient (Barden) and a no-nonsense nurse (Hudson). Through this intensely life affirming prism, an unexpected and powerful journey of love, laughter, and forgiveness unfolds.','/ghKDvp24lXKo6b1TtILweFKy6yV.jpg','2014-06-13',117,'Released','What do you say when everything has been left unsaid?','Lullaby',261768,2.1642,6.2,'JyyjACPQgLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33017,_binary '\0','/1qM4tqW8EAlxUbWGHdqXnvOiU1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2210834',6.1,3260,'en','Jimmy P.','At the end of WWII, Jimmy Picard, a Native American Blackfoot who fought in France, suffers from unexplainable symptoms and is admitted to a military hospital. When doctors suspect schizophrenia, an eccentric psychoanalyst takes up the case and starts a conversation with the veteran.','/fjOBKLWWV8vqk68NLksUSa20LEo.jpg','2013-09-11',117,'Released',NULL,'Jimmy P.',160768,2.1631,6.1,'JpThmmshJ-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33018,_binary '\0','/7ebXR61ne2aot6BZMsn8JTtqpJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2211173',6,9739,'te','ఎవడు','Satya is given a different face after he suffers burn-related injuries. After being released from the hospital, he deals with the murderer of his lover Deepti. But his new face has given him new foes.','/euSAn9sVeS4Qnaj1ZWDw56gPi9W.jpg','2014-01-12',166,'Released',NULL,'Yevadu',215248,2.3421,6.006,'r6YZjpuEh4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33019,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2211174',6.5,1387,'hi','Ammaa Ki Boli','Ammaa Ki Boli is a comical genre movie directed by Narayan Chauhan and produced by Mukesh Chaudhary under the banner of Street Act Production. The story revolves around an old-aged husbandless mother, her 5 grown-up children’s and a second-rate two-seater scooter. The movie features Faruk Zafar as Ammaa in lead role, following with Priyal Patil, Govind Namdev, Sitaram Panchal, Sanjay Mishra, Hrishita Bhatt, Zakir Hussain Actor, Ishtiaq Khan, Shekhar Singh and others in their respective important roles','/wBLZ0ZPTYLnbSdJLPefJqr2WGfB.jpg','2019-08-30',118,'Released','Ammaa Ki Boli is hindi comedy movie starring Shekhar Singh, Sanjay Mishra, Hrishita Bhatt releases on December, 14, 2012.','Ammaa Ki Boli',146329,1.0126,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33020,_binary '\0','/fQUNZaqJTcG7ARwNfTMlwKS6Jgl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2212008',5.2,17969,'en','The Bag Man','A criminal waits in a seedy motel for his boss after killing several men to steal a bag.','/iWVuYsgZYhtDVroaxu6zCF5FA63.jpg','2014-02-28',108,'Released','The cat\'s in the bag.','The Bag Man',242076,4.2193,5.3,'FhxaFepjdLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33021,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2212658',6.6,1464,'en','Abducted: The Carlina White Story','A baby abducted at birth and raised by the woman who took her, eventually discovers she is a missing child, reconnects with her birth parents, and struggles with choosing between her two identities.','/rjHFRsAE4NUVZei1xanF1a0UdNE.jpg','2012-10-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Abducted: The Carlina White Story',139255,2.0306,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33022,_binary '\0','/uvtQQMCMR50e8Ahs6RRpOrAYk1Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2213054',7.8,40282,'hi','कई पो छे!','Three friends growing up in India at the turn of the millennium set out to open a training academy to produce the country\'s next cricket stars.','/cAlv5vmDXzpVmTCk4DmggUbW7cd.jpg','2013-02-13',126,'Released','Brothers...For Life.','Kai Po Che!',168245,1.4098,7.1,'a1s3YIagZOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33023,_binary '\0','/mXXpmfN6Z6bjY7qsCwYaDA5jiUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2214941',5.8,2156,'en','Daddy\'s Little Girl','After the police find Derek’s daughter brutally murdered on the beach, he vows to make the culprit suffer for his actions, even if that person is ‘part of the family.’ With careful research into the history of torture, Derek prepares himself and his basement for a week of brutal tactics that will make his daughter’s killer feel the pain that he has inflicted upon so many others. In a time when stranger danger is ever present, a single father learns that it’s the ones you trust most who have to be watched the closest.','/e2zef4gFoNsqfUIHVs9b3QrMxSu.jpg','2014-01-08',107,'Released','The Only Thing Stronger Than A Father\'s Love Is His Revenge','Daddy\'s Little Girl',138943,1.5323,6.1,'kLb7IQwxNcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33024,_binary '\0','/w8y0xfpIoPSRr51A05308vrkZCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215077',6.1,2304,'en','Half of a Yellow Sun','An epic love story: Olanna and Kainene are glamorous twins, living a privileged city life in newly independent 1960s Nigeria. The two women make very different choices of lovers, but rivalry and betrayal must be set aside as their lives are swept up in the turbulence of war.','/dMNg70yFZt1w7lXoHqCu4U43MVZ.jpg','2013-09-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Half of a Yellow Sun',209401,2.1927,5,'bq9jI1QnEXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33025,_binary '\0','/2X2jnuBmTa4q34Eutv50r9Uk1FK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215151',8,7209,'en','Inequality for All','Based on Reich\'s 2010 book Aftershock: The Next Economy and America\'s Future, the film examines widening income inequality in the United States. U.S. Labor Secretary Robert Reich tries to raise awareness of the country\'s widening economic gap. He publicly argued about the issue for decades, and producing a film of his viewpoints was a \"final frontier\" for him. In addition to being a social issue documentary, Inequality for All is also partially a biopic regarding Reich\'s early life and his time as Secretary of Labor under Bill Clinton\'s presidency. Warren Buffett and Nick Hanauer, two entrepreneurs and investors in the top 1%, are interviewed in the film, supporting Reich\'s belief in an economy that benefits all citizens, including those of the middle and lower classes.','/yGWDqQlRzIcvna4YoEYw1cZ7rmn.jpg','2013-01-19',88,'Released',NULL,'Inequality for All',159008,2.2844,7.5,'YCbAyk8aRxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33026,_binary '\0','/wuOZtOD2rWTW28uJx53hi3GEizt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22152120',5.3,2095,'te','ఆపరేషన్ వాలెంటైన్','Showcasing the indomitable spirits of the Indian Air Force heroes on the frontlines and the challenges they face during one of the biggest, fiercest aerial attacks that India has ever seen.','/fCZNIxEcpUDEnywcoShl4JZa1Y4.jpg','2024-03-01',132,'Released','Come what may...face it','Operation Valentine',1034158,1.1756,5.2,'nls7AradbRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33027,_binary '\0','/gq5ldqZmGuTMqp0QofuSB6PffrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215221',6.5,2138,'fr','La Religieuse','Suzanne Simonin describes her life of suffering in letters. As a young woman she is sent to a convent against her will. Since her parents cannot afford the dowry required for a marriage befitting her rank they decide she must instead become a nun. Although a kind and understanding Mother Superior helps her to learn the convent’s daily routine, Suzanne’s desire for freedom remains unabated. When the Mother Superior dies, Suzanne finds herself faced with reprisals, humiliation and harassment at the hands of the new Abbess and the other Sisters. For many years, Suzanne is subjected to bigotry and religious fanaticism. (Berlinale.de)','/yr1xovsr57JBdEEN9SrajE0ogxB.jpg','2013-03-20',106,'Released',NULL,'The Nun',159967,2.7471,6.2,'ItZ2KbWTdMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33028,_binary '\0','/cspozBIhoSTxHNhUg4X3ZT4WSFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215267',5.3,1303,'de','Little Thirteen','The everyday lives of teenagers, coming from various social backgrounds. For them, sexuality has become a substitute for love, resulting from emotional neglect.','/8soOp2XFbOyeFybl6pghZjXJXw0.jpg','2012-07-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Little Thirteen',138735,2.6033,5.3,'kze4s_gTtL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33029,_binary '\0','/lDdTFUonxMymKX2NYbUkJSfJWyj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215285',5,12101,'en','Madea\'s Witness Protection','For years, mild-mannered Wall Street banker George Needleman has meandered through life oblivious to his family\'s dysfunction and his company\'s malfeasance, but he\'s forced to wake up when he learns that he\'s been framed in a mob-backed Ponzi scheme. Placed under federal protection, George and his family are shipped down South to Madea\'s house, where the no-nonsense matriarch whips them all into shape using her special brand of tough love.','/4P6d7kVDB60Ydmk9WAhrPCWrARI.jpg','2012-06-29',114,'Released','Believe it or not, they know too much.','Madea\'s Witness Protection',103370,4.2109,6.1,'-yj_pkwFYlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33030,_binary '\0','/nS2QTnSyG0TTnyLAIrjud1aSk7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215395',6.6,8154,'fr','Paulette','Paulette lives alone in a housing project in the Paris suburbs. With her meager pension, she can no longer make ends meet.','/vrOmk9UVy5MW1fMpwVAMMlmCdWk.jpg','2012-10-04',87,'Released',NULL,'Paulette',159121,3.5243,6.453,'tSkLHvlOzvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33031,_binary '\0','/6dUkpGBZdFrwjT6MsLoXd7iSVFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215457',4.6,2004,'en','Run','A street smart, 17-year-old named Daniel practices Parkour and is both hero and thief.','/lcEOVoHUyfcMCjciOWikPLWPK0Z.jpg','2013-07-03',106,'Released',NULL,'Run',224087,1.1335,5.492,'tJqJlNkIkHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33032,_binary '\0','/rQIZtxfg8HIDkXM4EO73pw2kLwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215477',6.4,23939,'hi','गोलियों की रासलीला रामलीला','Ran and Leela are passionately in love with each other. The only problem is that their respective clans have been enemies for 500 years.','/qqR1WMElj2kV4FCUmXanGRdTCXs.jpg','2013-11-14',155,'Released','There are hundred reasons to die, but only one to live.','Goliyon Ki Raasleela Ram-Leela',235984,2.775,7,'StphRCLkx6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33033,_binary '\0','/x4F6EPnV4HnCpMPtTomS12QnHjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215537',6.5,2760,'pt','Somos Tão Jovens','The life of Renato Russo, from his first involvement with music, to his years in the punk rock band Aborto Alétrico, to the formation of Legião Urbana, in the Brasília rock scene of 1970s and 1980s.','/sakpWhGTY1ipnHDWAB4LvKawskp.jpg','2013-05-03',104,'Released','You know the myth. Now know the story.','We\'re So Young',191034,1.6846,6.787,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33034,_binary '\0','/k6OJmK0SamFbu0642JLMey4voNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215673',4.4,1599,'en','The Timber','In the wild west, two brothers embark on a journey to collect a bounty in a desperate attempt to save their home: but what they find along the way is more than they bargained for.','/kV0jEsELVEhqIU9MPyidKaHpvh9.jpg','2015-02-27',81,'Released','Fortunes will be made, lives will be lost.','The Timber',322443,1.9291,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33035,_binary '\0','/cZRcHeM3pwIPOomIkGlEUpIpWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2215719',6,14069,'en','Katy Perry: Part of Me','Giving fans unprecedented access to the real life of the music sensation, Katy Perry: Part of Me exposes the hard work, dedication and phenomenal talent of a girl who remained true to herself and her vision in order to achieve her dreams. Featuring rare behind-the-scenes interviews, personal moments between Katy and her friends, and all-access footage of rehearsals, choreography, Katy’s signature style and more, Katy Perry: Part of Me reveals the singer’s unwavering belief that if you can be yourself, then you can be anything.','/yPW5Lmptt7z8rCYtVYjkpyjI3SY.jpg','2012-06-28',93,'Released','Be yourself and you can be anything','Katy Perry: Part of Me',101267,4.4315,7.142,'Q1tDT852GGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33036,_binary '\0','/hVqcf5B92U0KnlLsbkynI7QJQRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2216240',7.1,18076,'da','Kapringen','Tensions are high after a Danish freighter is captured and held for ransom by Somali pirates, leading to weeks of high-stakes negotiations – and an escalating potential for explosive violence.','/wstbZDlyvmsgXRfK7O7HeDrjc0s.jpg','2012-02-29',103,'Released',NULL,'A Hijacking',127846,3.5916,6.8,'EQ5b5Jml7H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33037,_binary '\0','/6jWEJKQVYFkWD6o6hu5SlokSMyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2216856',6,2318,'sv','Fjällbackamorden 3 - Tyskungen','Erica\'s parents are killed in a traffic accident. She moves to Fjällbacka and discovers she has a brother.','/yz7kqnZ31NJamcBsm1w9SACa6Lg.jpg','2013-06-28',105,'Released',NULL,'The Hidden Child',389614,1.8109,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33038,_binary '\0','/ePoM1vuSq1u1dtkciJirJ9T2x68.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22170036',7.1,14470,'ta','கேப்டன் மில்லர்','In the 1930s, during the British Raj, Analeesan \"Eesa\", a former soldier of the British Indian Army called Captain Miller, is on a mission to protect the people from the British after witnessing an atrocity.','/6qKnVaE5BvA2fO1L6r4i1ScX34G.jpg','2024-01-11',158,'Released','I AM THE DEVIL.','Captain Miller',962074,1.9273,6.8,'4MqsUwyXrdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33039,_binary '\0','/np58LPJkwC3THsKBkBscDKSlQPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22173666',5.3,15325,'en','Azrael','In a world where no one speaks, a devout female hunts down a young woman who has escaped her imprisonment. Recaptured by its ruthless leaders, Azrael is due to be sacrificed to pacify an ancient evil deep within the surrounding wilderness.','/qpdFKDvJS7oLKTcBLXOaMwUESbs.jpg','2024-09-27',86,'Released','Many years after the rapture… Among the survivors, some are driven to renounce their sin of Speech.','Azrael',1029235,5.7179,5.8,'-kKSxFDcwKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33040,_binary '\0','/hmder4IIqLH59BON9EYgpjBgkNy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2217458',7,3867,'pt','Flores Raras','In 1951, New York poet Elizabeth Bishop travels to Rio de Janeiro to visit Mary, a college friend. The shy Elizabeth is overwhelmed by Brazilian sensuality. She is the antithesis to Mary’s dashing partner, architect Lota de Macedo Soares. Mary is jealous, but unconventional Lota is determined to have both women at all costs. This eternal triangle plays out against the backdrop of the military coup of 1964. Bishop’s moving poems are at the core of a film which lushly illustrates a crucial phase in the life of this influential Pulitzer prize-winning poet.','/qTatiV0yzfLFLbBsFARNFYnTidL.jpg','2013-02-09',118,'Released','Two iconic women. One passion.','Reaching for the Moon',167683,4.4668,6.6,'27YqB_UZ9u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33041,_binary '\0','/9tdXnZ2iM2KXrlID0RMSUnrynsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2217859',6.6,15492,'en','Louder Than Bombs','Three years after his wife, acclaimed photographer Isabelle Reed, dies in a car crash, Gene keeps everyday life going with his shy teenage son, Conrad. A planned exhibition of Isabelle’s photographs prompts Gene\'s elder son, Jonah, to return to the house he grew up in — and for the first time in a very long time, the father and the two brothers are living under the same roof.','/26hoecTKEAXswDwk4nUE4SEcPg2.jpg','2015-10-01',109,'Released','Break the silence.','Louder Than Bombs',157827,4.4285,6.459,'14BCXs8YIkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33042,_binary '\0','/rxesxBpjrVVApJ06YPLztp0cshj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2217895',6.2,3268,'en','4 Minute Mile','A teenager overcomes odds to run a 4-minute mile race.','/5VPGS72m2mcVWI6qyyZLM2jsJC5.jpg','2014-06-05',96,'Released','Teenage distance runner works hard to achieve a 4-minute mile.','4 Minute Mile',274820,1.9068,5.9,'CGHkKDGATP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33043,_binary '\0','/qSfeV3QAvBEuB4CnxhLaeblfaio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22179486',5.1,1811,'en','Cursed Friends','Four friends wake on Halloween and realize the predict-your-future game they played in 2002 is coming true in disturbing ways. They must band together to help each other escape the wild fates that have turned their lives upside down.','/zKxK1rZ0y3k6SQfRotq0jLMzz2Q.jpg','2022-10-08',87,'Released','Scariest. Movie. Ever.','Cursed Friends',1031206,2.3179,4.9,'gZU9Cbj4DhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33044,_binary '\0','/2QjZb6YHj5Ueldi5y7E7E5sWDZb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2218003',6.2,24292,'en','Closed Circuit','A high-profile terrorism case unexpectedly binds together two ex-lovers on the defense team - testing the limits of their loyalties and placing their lives in jeopardy.','/keW2sLB9yJbdkRy9yHQjqUjmzbB.jpg','2013-08-28',96,'Released','They see your every move.','Closed Circuit',146223,5.2039,5.9,'_dDiMp-gTHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33045,_binary '\0','/fGVLgcajve9IoLxvFlkn8aFFMVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22180518',6.3,2053,'fr','Disco Boy','After a painful journey through Europe, Aleksei, a Belarusian, joins the Foreign Legion in France and clings to a confused hope of a European identity. Jomo, a Nigerian, fights for the survival and durability of his people in the Niger Delta and is ready to die to defend his ideas. These two young people who are sacrificed and smashed together will, against all odds, meet and their destinies will merge to continue across borders, bodies, life and death...','/cYsAJeLh9LmesAnPjdTaZEdr1bP.jpg','2023-03-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Disco Boy',922830,1.8358,6.5,'dIFnEGhVMWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33046,_binary '\0','/ogumeypv8XwqmpuORMIdLpyRlkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22184520',5.4,1544,'en','Deer Camp \'86','In the fall of 1986, six knuckleheads from Detroit travel north to partake in the annual tradition of deer hunting. But something horrific has been awakened and the hunters become the hunted.','/41fJZ2Tjv3QBEDKRKHT3XrYIn0.jpg','2024-05-31',85,'Released','They should\'ve stayed in Detroit... where it was safe!','Deer Camp \'86',1041517,1.1126,5.5,'9ZTlqz6zc5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33047,_binary '\0','/v57iMzSzzM8NsyMqrSmKGToHoCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22184976',6.5,2787,'en','Minions & More Volume 1','This collection of 10 short films produced by Illumination includes: From the \"Despicable Me\" franchise: Puppy (2013); Minion Scouts (2019); Training Wheels (2013); The Secret Life of Kyle (2017); Santa\'s Little Helpers (2019). From the \"Grinch\" franchise: The Dog Days of Winter (2019). From the \"Secret Life of Pets\" franchise: Norman Television (2016); Weenie (2016). From the \"Sing\" franchise: Love at First Sight (2017). From the \"Lorax\" franchise: Forces of Nature (2012).','/hjVIpMS8gOEaLB87kpgEOqdDCrk.jpg','2022-09-27',44,'Released',NULL,'Minions & More Volume 1',1029119,5.1593,7,'lrykXYY6jks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33048,_binary '\0','/yRz2GuDYxUIkj1atbXpEETKYnV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22185848',5.6,2879,'es','¡Que viva México!','After his grandfather\'s death, a man travels with his wife and kids to his hometown, where chaos ensues with his relatives over the inheritance.','/ieyUpr5ES9QEz1cn4clCnBf9XJl.jpg','2023-03-23',192,'Released',NULL,'¡Que viva México!',868985,2.6042,7.329,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33049,_binary '\0','/wN8JKRHfNjJpD2BiOtFxShb1VDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22188452',5.5,5880,'hi','हड्डी','A transgender woman, Haddi, moves to Delhi to join a gang of transpeople and cross-dressers headed by an influential man. But is this move aspirational or driven by revenge?','/6GrbL3kAu9yhNcY0hK3qE3tuIf2.jpg','2023-09-07',134,'Released',NULL,'Haddi',1063633,1.7328,5.111,'BncbxpHc_ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33050,_binary '\0','/lZ8SesZuZVqJY3ZqXIsxFGubUew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22189742',5.5,2048,'en','Fall Into Winter','Keely is aghast when her brother sells his half of their family-owned, upscale candy shop to his best friend from high school orcing a sudden urgency to find connection and common ground. Keely has been hurt before; change is her new nemesis. Brooks’ past is a mirror of Keely’s. He, too, has a fortress around his heart. Fate brings the pair together. Might it also offer new beginnings?','/nKvBcgmhGNDEGPY4zZFnuGOK9KC.jpg','2023-01-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Fall Into Winter',1027330,2.1223,5.7,'fpIEwIKQgqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33051,_binary '\0','/u792SfQyGVFpAsIAm44sILx2eLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2218988',8.2,19141,'ml','ഉസ്‌താദ്‌ Hotel','When his father refuses to support his choice of a career, an aspiring chef tries to fulfil his dream by helping his grandfather run his small eatery.','/88QYspKRArRutF3t0Bzj0JYFlcI.jpg','2012-06-29',150,'Released',NULL,'Ustad Hotel',117751,1.6818,7.535,'Z1m3y4L1yzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33052,_binary '\0','/2uhgSLmXzT2y4Bed7JEFBZFdXEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2219210',4,1795,'en','Crawl or Die','Earth as we know it is gone. A virus has destroyed the planet and rendered all its women infertile, all but one. An elite team of soldiers are tasked with bringing the woman to safety on the newly habitable Earth Two. But when they are forced underground they find themselves fighting for survival from an bloodthirsty creature in a maze of ever shrinking tunnels. As the team\'s ranks start to dwindle, the tunnels shrink and the ammunition run out, the crawl for survival becomes more and more desperate.','/5KGwSbuyyAxnEEaPlmnBa9sIzSo.jpg','2014-08-13',90,'Released','If you can\'t run...','Crawl or Die',286657,1.0087,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33053,_binary '\0','/cR9Vrdajld5GvdIGMkYFCghYyhD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2219214',5.3,1597,'en','The Toy Soldiers','On one evening in a decade of sex, drugs and rock \'n\' roll, the innocence of youth and family unravels. Five parallel coming-of-age stories dramatize the stages of grief. A youthful mother in a custody battle over her children, finds tranquility with the bottle. The abuse of her ex-husband still haunts the children; a nineteen year old drug addict, and his younger brother, a bullied closet homosexual.There\'s the story of the dog; a teen who offers sexual favors to gain acceptance, the challenged classmate who would do anything for her love, and the redhead beauty, haunted by a secret, tragic past. These lives and others will change forever on this final evening before their hangout, The Toy Soldiers Roller Rink, closes its doors for the final time.','/iOtfK7gJd1FBbbzNZVvjqpNxGIn.jpg','2014-11-14',143,'Released',NULL,'The Toy Soldiers',269026,0.8955,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33054,_binary '\0','/5EQ72VsocH2zfl6qMujRycFUDIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2219514',6.7,4114,'he','למלא את החלל','Eighteen-year-old Shira is the youngest daughter of the Mendelman family. She is about to be married off to a promising young man of the same age and background. It is a dream come true, and Shira feels prepared and excited. On Purim, her twenty-eight-year-old sister, Esther, dies while giving birth to her first child, Mordechay. The pain and grief that overwhelm the family postpone Shira\'s promised match. Everything changes when a match is proposed to Yochay-Esther\'s late husband-to a widow from Belgium. Yochay feels it\'s too early, although he realizes that sooner or later he must seriously consider getting married again. When the girls\' mother finds out that Yochay may marry the widow and move to Belgium with her only grandchild, she proposes a match between Shira and the widower. Shira will have to choose between her heart\'s wish and her family duty. She will find out that the void which she must choose exists only within her heart.','/zE51xR2MFxloryI4WrIBenT5a9n.jpg','2012-07-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Fill the Void',122088,1.2801,6.3,'7hoxulGKQ7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33055,_binary '\0','/k9xtdT6TqMrXuPrf8qLw4RfZCX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2219650',7.5,1255,'en','Seymour: An Introduction','Ethan Hawke directs this intimate documentary portrait of classical pianist, composer, author, teacher and sage Seymour Bernstein.','/cCWyRe8FIzv65ZFTUMNUZyMeERB.jpg','2015-03-13',84,'Released','Play life more beautifully','Seymour: An Introduction',291817,1.5992,7.2,'oCOM3wMqoHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33056,_binary '\0','/cDiEVwx3VWNRny0ctFVVmCuCFSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22202450',5.6,1814,'he','אסקובנק','A ragtag group of misfits, veterans and ex-cons embark on a perilous journey in the jungles of Colombia to find the buried barrels of cash left behind by legendary drug kingpin Pablo Escobar before his downfall.','/5G0pPDxAKWgQy24NHBGl8LYPxIH.jpg','2025-11-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Escobank',1426083,2.419,5.955,'iQqUdSuALPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33057,_binary '\0','/cTE68uJ57CrhlWz0H0DQ3bABbFt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22203026',5.3,3439,'da','Englemageren','Laura is a detective on leave with postpartum depression. When a horrifying serial killer begins methodically murdering women in the most brutal ways, she decides it is time to return to the field. As the bodies pile up, it becomes increasingly clear that she too hides a dark secret that could derail the case and her career.','/cqqDvNVqAN3Z3VWtfcuDlAlRXeh.jpg','2023-06-08',94,'Released',NULL,'The Angel Maker',1115377,2.809,5.5,'aQ3ZhriZq8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33058,_binary '\0','/cobTwC4abDdXQsRsinNlG4fIUQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2220408',5.8,1526,'pt','Vai Que Dá Certo','5 friends have a plan to rob a transporter that can change their lives.','/q793L0YiI5kmGRpIYOYVCJWgiAE.jpg','2013-03-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Vai Que Dá Certo',180371,2.0331,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33059,_binary '\0','/3q2cUhf1aAwuF5eGFsijdJr5Ngz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2220642',7.9,2703,'en','Bad 25','Spike Lee pays tribute to Michael Jackson\'s Bad on the twenty-fifth anniversary of the epochal album, offering behind-the-scenes footage of Jackson recording the album and interviews with confidants, musicians, choreographers, and such music-world superstars as Kanye West, Sheryl Crow, Cee Lo Green and Mariah Carey.','/NexnTuyXokEYori4efMBZRE1Cg.jpg','2012-10-19',131,'Released',NULL,'Bad 25',127509,2.8348,7.3,'5hHtGItWgZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33060,_binary '\0','/fLDo1GXZWuBpMRkrzITYzBufath.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207152',6,1387,'en','A Christmas Mystery','When her best friend\'s father is falsely accused of stealing the town\'s prized jingle bells, a young amateur sleuth and her friends must find the real thief before Christmas.','/7ROhQeFIRCDadpIe4C7fVi5mV1Q.jpg','2022-11-24',87,'Released','Solve the crime. Save the season.','A Christmas Mystery',987919,3.6943,6.4,'dJtD-kTJCQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33061,_binary '\0','/x3hE7pJFc4iasyx6krKiTffEV4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207602',6.8,1946,'en','Noel Next Door','A hard-working, single mom gets into a war of words with a neighbor who she feels is ruining Christmas, only to find that this misunderstood grouch just may steal her heart.','/lwG3Avf6Vg19pX3zmm3GYOyo28Y.jpg','2022-10-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Noel Next Door',1027329,1.6879,6.987,'_oWtKTogrVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33062,_binary '\0','/u3GeTpM12Pddpt4G1Ns2xODiNbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207622',6.5,1414,'en','The Most Colorful Time of the Year','Ryan is an elementary school teacher, who learns that he is colorblind. Michelle, an optometrist, and mother of one of his students, helps bring color into his life in time for the holidays.','/qZq3hbnJ9ekOyauDmja3jhcAfxu.jpg','2022-12-09',84,'Released',NULL,'The Most Colorful Time of the Year',1028561,1.8032,5.7,'Wn7fc6BE9W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33063,_binary '\0','/jpqyoPovvTOxcKZLybKH8iNaR1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207772',6.2,1796,'te','గీతసాక్షిగా','In Hyderabad, Arjun,a DJ leads a happy life with his family and falls for Amulya. Suddenly his life turns upside down as the police arrest him for allegedly raping and killing an innocent girl. After 5 years, ACP Roopesh reopens the case to find out the truth behind the heinous crime.','/lAwTx3aTbtl4SwF2PsgHLJiuHhB.jpg','2023-03-22',136,'Released',NULL,'Geetasakshigaa',1097586,0.7805,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33064,_binary '\0','/83g3gkDw6oc2mxkyB8DSoXQZJHl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207786',7.1,24141,'fr','Les Chambres rouges','The high-profile case of serial killer Ludovic Chevalier has just gone to trial, and Kelly-Anne is obsessed. When reality blurs with her morbid fantasies, she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the case’s puzzle.','/uBJvbf0g9rcsYElcwZCMYU0Vrj8.jpg','2023-08-11',118,'Released','We see you, and you are obscene.','Red Rooms',912480,5.9113,7.1,'VGZOwN1uK34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33065,_binary '\0','/go05UcvVRJrj1AjEsYWPJCtojdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22207828',6.4,1423,'en','A Christmas Cookie Catastrophe','Annie Cooper has big shoes to fill when she takes over as CEO of her late grandmother’s small-town cookie company and is doing her best to help their struggling business get back on track. That task gets more daunting when her grandmother’s secret recipe is stolen during the Christmas party. As Annie tries to crack the case and uncover the culprit she works with Sam, the owner of a local bakery, to recreate the recipe in the hope of saving the company and her job. As Annie and Sam bake batch after batch in pursuit of the perfect one, they begin to learn that their lives go together like milk and cookies.','/uKow4E46OiKD70nyQLn0KgkGfxN.jpg','2022-11-27',84,'Released','Bake It Till You Make It','A Christmas Cookie Catastrophe',1028552,2.154,5.6,'WF11gfcQGE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33066,_binary '\0','/6romdRvqhONWwVpPHbNeh9v1Ivf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22208468',2.8,2302,'tr','Kutsal Damacana 4','Fikret accidentally becomes a priest, finding himself in an unpredictable position in the priesthood. Unexpectedly rising to the Vatican, Fikret decides to return home.','/gvFdPztBqJ0IaudQYFeR7q1LgRb.jpg','2023-01-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Kutsal Damacana 4',1027410,1.272,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33067,_binary '\0','/dlX3AMENxhIkDBKl7TJMbb9Banf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22208480',4.5,1628,'tr','Özür Dilerim','Erkin, who works as a watchman at the lighthouse, is a lonely man in his mid-thirties. Erkin, crushed under his credit debts, one day receives the news of his grandfather\'s death. A big surprise awaits Erkin, who immediately goes to his grandfather, who is staying in the nursing home. He asks his grandfather Erkin to apologize to his brother Koray and ex-fiancee Merve, whose heart he broke years ago. Having to fulfill his grandfather\'s wish in order to get rid of his loan debts, Erkin finds himself in a great adventure in this process.','/vjA8vqKnHHHbGOllVTcL2gwBvus.jpg','2023-04-14',110,'Released',NULL,'My Apologies',1101410,3.9821,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33068,_binary '\0','/auLEgC09Pvwkzul8lwEkcWnlSC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2221648',5,2121,'en','Return to Nim\'s Island','Fourteen year old Nim, more determined than ever to protect her island and all the wildlife that call it home, faces off against resort developers and animal poachers. Soon she realizes she can’t depend on her animal cohorts alone and must make her first human friend – Edmund, who’s run away to the island from the mainland – to save her home.','/9LPDKDZQyGlQQphTna5kRHe4nrE.jpg','2013-03-15',90,'Released','Adventure runs wild, again.','Return to Nim\'s Island',172386,2.9891,6.5,'Oe8SYuFkB9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33069,_binary '\0','/lA5fOBqTOQBQ1s9lEYYPmNXoYLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2222042',6.9,162124,'en','Love and Monsters','Seven years since the Monsterpocalypse began, Joel Dawson has been living underground in order to survive. But after reconnecting over radio with his high school girlfriend Aimee, Joel decides to venture out to reunite with her, despite all the dangerous monsters that stand in his way.','/718NnyxyQuBQcGWt9sdelA1Zc3h.jpg','2020-10-16',109,'Released','An apocalyptic love story.','Love and Monsters',590223,9.1764,7.265,'-19tBHrZwOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33070,_binary '\0','/s661ZCXwC3cVIPlrrvo4bKOL7k3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2222052',6.5,8185,'en','My Salinger Year','A college grad takes a clerical job working for the literary agent of the renowned, reclusive writer J.D. Salinger.','/pyebSSBGw84cY2wsXEkWlseED7G.jpg','2020-02-20',101,'Released','The true story of a literary education.','My Salinger Year',619594,4.4857,6.3,'05jdkAUwGPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33071,_binary '\0','/3ErIkAECU5wgMVYihoQzp0CMudm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2222206',6.3,2121,'en','Dear Mr. Watterson','20 years after Calvin and Hobbes stopped appearing in daily newspapers, filmmaker Joel Allen Schroeder has set out to explore the reasons behind the comic strip\'s loyal and devoted following.','/gg1JaYaeYZh4L75UMSWOEqFnaHy.jpg','2013-11-15',89,'Released','An Exploration of Calvin & Hobbes','Dear Mr. Watterson',184846,1.5009,6.4,'sRnnGfuS4vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33072,_binary '\0','/37x8deGuuEiMBEIoe28ulrFsoNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2222394',7.3,11566,'es','Nosotros los nobles','Tells the \"riches to rags\" story of the Nobles, three upper-class twenty-somethings that appear to have no limits to their checkbooks, and no direction in their lives. Until one day, their father tries to teach them a lesson by staging a financial scandal that forces the whole family to escape to an old house in the poor side of town, and leads the \"kids\" to do what they haven\'t done before: get jobs.','/40JLnLz5KEQeZnUCKD3zf8sQJFx.jpg','2013-03-28',108,'Released',NULL,'We Are the Nobles',180147,3.4745,7.993,'ynA5nXZyZxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33073,_binary '\0','/o55Q7lZ9oqHPIfnXRmXOWTnYLyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2222550',4.9,2643,'hi','1920: Evil Returns','This story revolves around a famous poet who meets a woman who is in trouble. In order to treat her, he takes her to Shimla in a big hospital, but soon that woman gets possessed by devil and goes out of control. Now the question remains that what is the relation that poet shares with her which compelled him to go to any extent to save her, why she was possessed by devil and who is the devil.','/mGxYnL1fjDdzSbIowzyQTc4QNjY.jpg','2012-11-02',130,'Released','Possession is Back','1920: Evil Returns',158519,1.509,5.664,'Hq-U6HWZjsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33074,_binary '\0','/5BPIbXCNKd7bV6AWtplMcutGrFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22227936',7.1,6712,'tr','Cici','A family migrates to the city after a tragic loss. When they reunite in their hometown 30 years later, buried emotions and painful secrets resurface.','/fxNW0JZdqy39IjYMJixn9vj7B1d.jpg','2022-10-27',151,'Released',NULL,'Cici',1026822,1.6258,6.3,'W0Zma6L9bfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33075,_binary '\0','/kAwN3UWRUWauNK1l4oh7TfdOsJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22237964',6.8,1772,'es','La misteriosa mirada del flamenco','As an unknown and deadly disease begins to spread, legend has it that it is transmitted between two men, through a simple glance, when they fall in love. While people are accusing her family, Lidia must find out whether this myth is real or not.','/xfPhni21LIEmuV8HiDfrLhcmTwr.jpg','2025-09-11',108,'Released',NULL,'The Mysterious Gaze of the Flamingo',896096,2.3651,6.4,'UscRzx6i53M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33076,_binary '\0','/s8gb0U9A96U1bl4Q8JB7JiqsyTa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2223824',6.4,1250,'en','An Officer and a Murderer','The true story of Colonel Russell Williams, one Canada’s most powerful and respected Air Force Officers, who committed numerous brutal crimes and was eventually brought down by a tenacious small town police detective.','/tYcIJT4FcE90TF2c7YbIQQ8ni4K.jpg','2012-07-21',85,'Released',NULL,'An Officer and a Murderer',121437,1.9961,5.5,'-hvzQLBES_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33077,_binary '\0','/6OmYtlqri24uwgPx1UQERaZIMmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2223990',6.8,73938,'en','Draft Day','At the NFL Draft, general manager Sonny Weaver has the opportunity to rebuild his team when he trades for the number one pick. He must decide what he\'s willing to sacrifice on a life-changing day for a few hundred young men with NFL dreams.','/bnl2ocjS1io4UCPhjoFuPKmJ9bf.jpg','2014-04-11',110,'Released','The greatest victories don\'t always happen on the field.','Draft Day',200505,7.1305,6.717,'K3SlVsdUuBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33078,_binary '\0','/nE7OAfjTo3PGA0n3fRZcl95pA3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2224004',6.2,6982,'en','Sweetwater','In the late 1800s, a fanatical religious leader, a renegade Sheriff, and a former prostitute collide in a blood triangle on the rugged plains of the New Mexico Territory.','/q69vCHmShdsiXixCIdwJuyJXEXY.jpg','2013-10-09',96,'Released','Revenge is Sweet.','Sweetwater',158916,3.3736,6.107,'J2VaYd08p-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33079,_binary '\0','/gnkBzJVH2zicIopP2fHf4kRElne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2224026',6.5,123022,'en','Home','When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet. But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh. The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.','/usFenYnk6mr8C62dB1MoAfSWMGR.jpg','2015-03-18',94,'Released','Earth just got a little stranger.','Home',228161,15.6282,6.791,'Du4jTG7-93k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33080,_binary '\0','/1PtOvY6oMl0gror7VyzWIbndVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2224167',7,3197,'ar','المصلحة','Police officer Hamza requests his transfer to the Anti-Narcotics Administration, following the killing of his brother by Suleiman Al-Muslimi. He monitors his brother Salem, the big drug dealer, who smuggled Suleiman and fabricated a charge for Hamza\'s wife.','/iCJQR6pxlR6FWhredNTp60AHeLe.jpg','2012-05-14',115,'Released',NULL,'The Deal',117416,1.0888,6.7,'HWbGg8cAgGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33081,_binary '\0','/j26vRsWuTCp6m7LXQZ6M4GOELR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2224317',7.4,18425,'hi','लूटेरा','In a village, a young archaeologist falls in love with a landlord\'s daughter. Their union seems doomed. But destiny brings them together a year later. Will they live happily ever after?','/qirqvVPQt1vrC2QZyCGLyeLuTO.jpg','2013-04-04',136,'Released',NULL,'Lootera',205017,1.5843,7,'KaNoRbUabzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33082,_binary '\0','/mixMcqFUkuqbAHxRVtZVCLjjVep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22246514',6.1,1513,'en','A Magical Christmas Village','When Summer’s mother Vivian moves in with her and her young daughter Chloe, her orderly existence is upended. Upon arrival, Vivian sets up an heirloom, miniature Christmas village resembling their town, and tells Chloe it grants Christmas wishes. As Chloe begins setting up the figurines, real-life events seem to mimic the scenes she creates. With a little help from the magic of the Christmas village, the family will be brought closer together and just maybe, Summer will learn to open her heart to love again.','/reNCBGdwXnjSUDLFWpHmQFkCOp.jpg','2022-11-13',84,'Released',NULL,'A Magical Christmas Village',1026605,1.9786,6.3,'JSd1hHuMQzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33083,_binary '\0','/3kmrbT2kguKWaz6UknbXyUf3chc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22246560',6.6,1499,'en','Lights, Camera, Christmas!','When a holiday rom-com movie shooting in her town needs a costume designer, Kerry, a local shop owner, steps into the role. While working on the movie, she rediscovers her passion for costume design and finds herself falling for Brad, the film’s famous leading man.','/xensL98L0bGnkkQsEFy3USC5n5Y.jpg','2022-11-05',84,'Released','Is this the onset of an on-set romance?','Lights, Camera, Christmas!',1027439,1.455,6.3,'aHpxw7a6okU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33084,_binary '\0','/7wLQWuvv1ehpoaDg9C8mzxXrVuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22247450',6.7,2568,'en','The Royal Nanny','Claire is an MI5 agent who goes undercover as the royal nanny. She must overcome the challenges of her assignment, like resisting the charms of Prince Colin, while keeping the family safe at Christmas.','/svpc5CdExIpsNkX091K70HY8gpm.jpg','2022-11-12',84,'Released','Protecting the crown. Minding the children.','The Royal Nanny',1028182,2.646,6.4,'W0Sw50RrnoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33085,_binary '\0','/iCltdG8lcYsL2tWAc0DZdFaVXBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22247482',7.5,4897,'en','Three Wise Men and a Baby','Three brothers get the surprise of their lives when they are forced to work together to care for a baby over the holidays. As they slowly get the hang of things, they find themselves on unexpected journeys of self-discovery and begin to rebuild their relationships as brothers, as well as the damaged romantic and professional relationships in their respective lives…all while rediscovering their love of Christmas.','/yR3hrMFIiczybGN7Y8wXMjmnPfz.jpg','2022-11-19',84,'Released',NULL,'Three Wise Men and a Baby',1028541,2.4661,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33086,_binary '\0','/fZSRQcr4AcNg0jlcUptY7JvQSFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22247540',7,1798,'en','My Southern Family Christmas','Under the guise of a journalist, Campbell has a chance to get to know her biological father for the first time – without him ever knowing who she really is. As she spends time with him and his family, as well as with the town’s record keeper, she realizes that families are messy, wonderful things. In the end, Campbell must decide if she’s going to keep her identity a secret or reveal the truth to her father – a decision that will change their family Christmas forever.','/c318CHh7DeyfORPhDUASRQIoSSA.jpg','2022-11-24',84,'Released','Put A Little Joyeux Into Your Noel','My Southern Family Christmas',1028558,2.019,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33087,_binary '\0','/7r4FDeSitadknxYPpUbdwbn8Yrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2224902',5.1,1605,'ta','சகுனி','Saguni is a Tamil political satire film directed by Shankar Dayal. The film features Karthi and Pranitha in the lead roles, while Santhanam, Roja, Prakash Raj, Raadhika Sarathkumar and Nassar appear in supporting roles. The film along with its dubbed Telugu Version Sakuni released on June 22, 2012, It received mixed reviews.','/5rzFSSlDZnfDWHSWnN3zyZpKLU5.jpg','2012-06-22',150,'Released',NULL,'Saguni',67635,1.2413,4.8,'GQAI2W42Qmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33088,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2225780',5.8,1266,'en','Still Life: A Three Pines Mystery','Chief Inspector Armand Gamache and his team arrive in Three Pines to solve the unusual murder of a much-loved woman and find dark secrets shadowing this usually peaceful village.','/vX5Cj9S616awyEG7ieQY8aYuSDg.jpg','2013-09-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Still Life: A Three Pines Mystery',223360,1.7755,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33089,_binary '\0','/8zv3y1rkwyYVHLrVgvCE7wmuNvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22257924',7.6,3268,'sv','Stormskärs Maja','Maja and Janne move to the barren and remote island of Stormskerry, where survival is a daily struggle. Growing up in a world of old values, Maja becomes aware of a new era: a woman can be an equal partner instead of a mere bystander. The couple have children, and life is good until trouble sets in: war arrives on the island, Janne is forced to flee from the English troops, and Maja and the children are imprisoned. The family also faces many financial difficulties and death. Years pass, but Maja remains strong and stays in Stormskerry despite all the hardships and difficulties.','/7oTBiJzG