Grave Encounters 2','Tortured by the ghosts of the demonized insane asylum that killed the crew of GRAVE ENCOUNTERS, film students fight to escape death as their own paranormal investigation goes terribly wrong in this horrifying sequel.','/uFnPfU54VlOc4Dxi0TYeSZaMxEI.jpg','2012-10-12',95,'Released','Fear is just a word. Reality is much worse.','Grave Encounters 2',134366,4.898,5.6,'HIOK1xlrXas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33126,_binary '\0','/qHDmgm7h0fL9VWANdfwXOYc6xP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2231630',6.2,2318,'fr','Avant l\'hiver','They are the perfect French haute bourgeois couple: Paul is a respected surgeon and Lucie cooks and gardens exquisitely. But now, in the autumn of his life, Paul can’t resist the lure of an ambiguous and dangerous relationship with a mysterious young woman. Might there be something sinister behind the roses delivered to his office and the “chance” meetings?','/11wMh1PgDuR2F200f7hgbr37N7p.jpg','2013-11-26',103,'Released',NULL,'Before the Winter Chill',218993,2.8864,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33127,_binary '\0','/yDmXYqPGooOwyc4idUHITOIoHa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2231874',5.4,8262,'en','Every Breath You Take','A psychiatrist, whose client commits suicide, finds his family life disrupted after introducing her surviving brother to his wife and daughter.','/nrgNXpH4x9NAkqOKhxEs3TspkHc.jpg','2021-04-02',105,'Released','Such things still happen','Every Breath You Take',803923,4.7426,5.8,'9dMHedhCYOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33128,_binary '\0','/g5KHHtOd2jSFh7j64C7S05hrvCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2233170',5.7,1282,'en','Sand Castles','In rural Indiana, Noah and his impoverished family wrestle with the mysterious return of his now mute sister, Lauren, who was kidnapped and held captive for over a decade.','/pe2vpFDaFCpew23DFuTg7eOAVSk.jpg','2016-02-16',93,'Released','Tragedy runs through our blood','Sand Castles',266425,1.1873,4.2,'Fh8DS6uL3no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33129,_binary '\0','/goPs7BcYBOrGMPjPwnqf3tMJI7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22333954',5.7,2883,'en','B&B Merry','Tracey Wise is a renowned luxury travel blogger who is invited by Graham Cooper to a Christmas getaway in exchange for her review of his family’s small bed & breakfast, Silver Peak. Unfortunately, the humble B&B is facing tough competition from an upscale hotel resort nearby that has been stealing guests and threatening the survival of the family business.','/7WSMNERoqgtOwV1Q5xDmAiLvMeE.jpg','2022-12-04',85,'Released',NULL,'B&B Merry',1029578,2.1175,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33130,_binary '\0','/mQiDYahIHLqhZxRuVK3wNdbi1ri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22334258',5.9,3081,'en','Someone Like You','Shocking news hits after young architect Dawson loses his best friend London. In his heartbreak, Dawson is compelled to launch an impossible search for London’s secret sister, twins separated as embryos. But along the way, Dawson never planned to fall in love.','/zsvD0BjEQIIoh2PpE5X7VXmSrQO.jpg','2024-04-02',118,'Released','Her whole life was built on a lie... but it was a lie that led her to him.','Someone Like You',1029330,5.4568,7.3,'oQ7iDaQAjgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33131,_binary '\0','/fh3ljsmWy2gzjXQkX2EZiMT29k1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2233953',7.2,1225,'ar','المشبوه','The film tells the story of an ex-burglar who is struggling to lead a normal life with his wife and little son. His elder brother pressures him to return to burglary.','/mqxAzryKJow3BoO1uIAKuLRJFu2.jpg','1981-08-20',125,'Released',NULL,'The Suspect',421346,0.7252,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33132,_binary '\0','/3JwLoQ98yofeGq8bu3Pjox5oI5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234003',7.4,68627,'en','Calvary','After being threatened during a confession, a good-natured priest must battle the dark forces closing in around him.','/jzgiam18I0gR20LB8BAE5u4dIdm.jpg','2014-04-11',101,'Released','Killing a priest on a Sunday. That’ll be a good one.','Calvary',157832,3.0808,7.105,'3iBJbcHq-oU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33133,_binary '\0','/v4cF26ERLs1XnHfdEQv0xs24Yd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234025',6.5,5466,'en','Coffee Town','Will is a 30-something website manager who uses local café, Coffee Town, as his office. When the owners of the shop discuss plans to convert Coffee Town into a bar, Will enlists the help of his two best friends Chad and Gino to save his freeloading existence. In order to thwart the plans of Coffee Town\'s owners, the trio stages a robbery to create the illusion of an unsafe neighborhood not suitable for the proposed venue. Also standing in their way is Sam, a disgruntled barista with delusions of grandeur and Will\'s heartache over unrequited love for Becca.','/475PTJRhikorye5BnTan5BPm85j.jpg','2013-07-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Coffee Town',198062,1.5628,6.432,'MagOLStZWvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33134,_binary '\0','/kms4PhWfP1Q2jidPLOf26qm0paJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234155',6.3,229107,'en','The Internship','Two recently laid-off men in their 40s try to make it as interns at a successful Internet company where their managers are in their 20s.','/hIh3ZgsZ31nbUAGn5SKIZGKiKCX.jpg','2013-06-07',119,'Released','Hiring them was a brilliant mistake.','The Internship',116741,0.4512,6.241,'G3W6IESxRKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33135,_binary '\0','/5YnUQ5oRXjQcxuqwn76NoIxwRV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234261',5.8,16882,'en','The Love Punch','Retirement at last! Middle-aged and divorced, company owner Richard Jones is looking forward to a worry-free existence as he arrives at his office on his last day of work. Much to his dismay, he discovers that the management buyout of his company was fraudulent. The company is now bankrupt and the employee pension fund — including his own — has been embezzled. Enlisting the help of his ex-wife Kate, Richard sets out to track down the shady businessman behind the fraud.','/iaJZm5z38RUi9czHxaiayN1OMAe.jpg','2014-01-13',94,'Released','You can\'t pinch a diamond without stealing a few hearts.','The Love Punch',209249,2.9704,6,'dVmdXE_iB8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33136,_binary '\0','/3AG8l871y3oT0fGHT94imryxXjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234429',4.7,5945,'en','Sparks','A masked vigilante who discovers the dark side to heroism. Going after the nation\'s most notorious super criminal leaves Sparks\' life and reputation in ruins.','/59X0So2x1HGEGXr91kqe4YaMhW0.jpg','2013-03-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Sparks',171776,2.1266,4.8,'evV1E45kbRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33137,_binary '\0','/fNh8yNnCBTbBbmyLw4E20KMOfTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234451',6.2,2651,'en','An Amish Murder','The Amish farming community of Painter’s Mill, Ohio, is shattered when a series of brutal murders leaves the town with a sense of frailty and loss of innocence. Among the most affected by the tragedy was Kate Burkholder, a young girl who survived the terror and, as a result, left the Amish life behind. Fifteen years later, Kate returns to Painter’s Mill as its Chief of Police. Certain she’s come to terms with her past, Kate’s renewed life in her hometown is shattered when a murder investigation triggers deep-seated emotions from her childhood and exposes a dark secret that could destroy her.','/w7J2VlkFU2xiuUfloW8byOijb8C.jpg','2013-01-06',84,'Released','Some secrets are too terrible to reveal. Some crimes are too unspeakable to solve.','An Amish Murder',159937,2.3338,5.8,'MfSbkjOKMOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33138,_binary '\0','/kS8n8osHNys8UlBZfXBVU4p4plP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2234543',5.7,1323,'fr','Un château en Italie','Louise meets Nathan, her dreams resurface. It\'s also the story of her ailing brother, their mother, and the destiny of a leading family of wealthy Italian industrialists. The story of a family falling apart, a world coming to an end and love beginning.','/xRfj3J1BEqYsPFMKB1p4nvtFCpD.jpg','2013-10-30',104,'Released',NULL,'A Castle in Italy',197089,1.8026,5.4,'gSW14H3-7e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33139,_binary '\0','/aZXtziEpZR1GpPwzIyr2s1dRWsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235108',6.1,27330,'en','Dear White People','A campus culture war between Blacks and whites at a predominantly white Ivy League college comes to a head when the staff of a satirical magazine stages an offensive Halloween party.','/jH3851P2DjjnBsrjphbR1CWRzm6.jpg','2014-10-17',108,'Released','A satire about being a Black face in a white place.','Dear White People',114750,2.9674,6.099,'JMgWMzbM2Pk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33140,_binary '\0','/55bCcCvDWLIGUhpK5XfYI6X4N2a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22352776',7.1,1263,'fr','Ernest et Célestine : Le Voyage en Charabie','Ernest and Celestine are travelling back to Ernest\'s country, Gibberitia, to fix his broken violin. This exotic land is home to the best musicians on earth and music constantly fills the air with joy. However, upon arriving, our two heroes discover that all forms of music have been banned for many years - and for them, a life without music is unthinkable. Along with their friends and a mysterious masked outlaw, Ernest and Celestine must try their best to bring music and happiness back to the land of bears.','/2E8SU5J6pk5BheYPJLjGyVPsrv7.jpg','2022-12-14',80,'Released','They’ll play a few strings to get what they want.','Ernest & Celestine: A Trip to Gibberitia',947219,3.112,7.222,'PdUXLHu-ui8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33141,_binary '\0','/qHdPNd1cUaSNYLLNgt1Pv3LVd0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22352848',5.5,12215,'ko','정이','On an uninhabitable 22nd-century Earth, the outcome of a civil war hinges on cloning the brain of an elite soldier to create a robot mercenary.','/z2nfRxZCGFgAnVhb9pZO87TyTX5.jpg','2023-01-12',98,'Released','AI Combat Warrior Will be Unleashed.','JUNG_E',843794,4.5213,6.079,'v_Jc1MYFv5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33142,_binary '\0','/6DLAey1QQa4wA2QQTB8GArJVNlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235348',7.1,2272,'en','Second Chances','Jenny McLean is a single mom working at a 911-call center struggling to make ends meet and raise her two kids, Elsie and Luke. Although still reeling from her divorce, Jenny can’t help but flirt when she gets emergency calls from Jeff, a local firefighter she nicknames “Cowboy” for his handsome voice. When Jeff is hurt in the line of duty, he finds himself unable to climb stairs and needing to rent a first floor room from Jenny. It isn\'t long before the sparks are flying but can Jenny allow herself to take the risk?','/qIEzkMMzDfkHt1Qj6jpReGY1d5C.jpg','2013-05-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Second Chances',212762,1.6091,6.2,'QtewKDkF4eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33143,_binary '\0','/s3tlKP2rFbFpLrviwWd7PIRpsfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235372',6.3,2869,'en','Son of the South','In civil rights era Montgomery, Alabama, Klansman\'s grandson Bob Zellner must choose which side of history to be on during the Movement. Defying his family and white Southern norms, he fought against social injustice, repression and violence to change the world around him','/3LExC6FEHKkHdeb7z3W0ncU2CKY.jpg','2021-02-05',104,'Released','Founding grandson without a father...','Son of the South',686548,3.5147,6.5,'x0IjvDWw0i4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33144,_binary '\0','/rVkptIl9QkhpB5xM6BnUAHOJ43b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235695',6.1,51045,'en','Rebecca','After a whirlwind romance with a wealthy widower, a naïve bride moves to his family estate but can\'t escape the haunting shadow of his late wife.','/kGhllBArW7ImDycSMIG5bj6GEPL.jpg','2020-10-16',123,'Released','All marriages have their secrets','Rebecca',505379,3.8517,6.3,'LFVhB54UqvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33145,_binary '\0','/fme0BJIU46w1aGfOYXcUTDnLTQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235779',5.1,22246,'en','The Quiet Ones','A professor and his students perform a dangerous experiment that causes a young woman to lose her sanity.','/wLULlJrFzhWhJhmjgBTUw0OYv3P.jpg','2014-04-25',98,'Released','A shocking experiment. An unspeakable evil.','The Quiet Ones',193612,5.1064,5.092,'1GNyQusclgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33146,_binary '\0','/z21LzuiF2seFbEhIkvBjUJ7NEiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235858',5,3785,'te','రెబెల్','After his parents are brutally murdered, a man goes on a quest to find his parents\' killers. He finds that his own uncle is involved in the killings.','/nwD0qvuk75C0a3uI7WT04BbZb2j.jpg','2012-09-28',176,'Released',NULL,'Rebel',135870,0.424,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33147,_binary '\0','/2h0MReVqyjteMkDx3WITOZd0Olt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2235902',6.5,6776,'en','Geography Club','A coming-of-age movie that tells a story unfolding in every high school around the country -- a story of kids hiding their true identities in plain sight, even as they feverishly pursue their hearts\' desires.','/oPwDoem41nOxe1tEI5p65tYTbpe.jpg','2013-04-27',84,'Released','They formed a club they thought nobody would join...','Geography Club',197033,2.9485,6.2,'Kyv91MU52CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33148,_binary '\0','/d7qDCDGIPKB3QMJ96hC1QFQnIZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2236054',6.7,9389,'en','Mystery Road','A murdered girl is found under a bridge on a remote road and indigenous detective Jay Swan gets the case. Jay finds that no-one is that interested in solving the murder of an indigenous teenager and he is forced to work alone.','/vmcfuVKkXLwQqW6E9mq9wdUWyaZ.jpg','2013-08-15',121,'Released','Some roads lead to murder','Mystery Road',199818,2.0828,6.233,'tqd_xbslmjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33149,_binary '\0','/6xgilZKNuBDX53niRUTF8AQfeyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2236160',4.4,2613,'en','Nightlight','Five friends play a game in a \"mysterious\" forest with a long history as a beacon for troubled young people contemplating suicide.','/mjkFH50ZXwwJAsOylLmsSu9Cu1C.jpg','2015-03-27',85,'Released','Five friends. One game. Zero chance of survival.','Nightlight',268725,1.6694,4.9,'AVFPuiRjzH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33150,_binary '\0','/f2DeK04CFdFCNHb9w4UwAH2UxYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2236182',3.6,3515,'en','Rise of the Zombies','When zombies overrun San Francisco, a desperate group survives by locking themselves inside Alcatraz Prison. When the undead breach the island, our heroes are forced to return to the mainland overrun with the undead.','/aGyeGL033oG4eVaf0CiXNqdUTbH.jpg','2012-10-27',90,'Released','You can\'t kill what isn\'t alive','Rise of the Zombies',140174,3.238,4.243,'qk1jS_cHDB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33151,_binary '\0','/utN8hZyjsrRJflxXT8TDNbQtkjh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2237324',5.2,7020,'en','Bent','On his latest private investigation, a shamed former cop connects a murder case to a government conspiracy involving rogue agents from a top spy agency.','/xUqimeu4KzFeqTvblNLvG8Y1DAo.jpg','2018-03-09',96,'Released','Corruption has it\'s own set of rules.','Bent',505579,3.8109,5.2,'K87nFzlw-M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33152,_binary '\0','/I4ofwq3XfmwXAETUs5pjubcMJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22375054',7,72254,'en','Strange Darling','Nothing is what it seems when a twisted one-night stand spirals into a serial killer’s vicious murder spree.','/kWNCRgt3ocv19bYO0sk7TRuZuFY.jpg','2024-08-22',97,'Released','Love hurts.','Strange Darling',1029281,9.7169,6.862,'F_F3f_Fqtrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33153,_binary '\0','/tAl5nVeZe7Glx0LN93SxQDphl7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2238032',5.6,24119,'en','Skiptrace','A detective from Hong Kong teams up with an American gambler to battle against a notorious Chinese criminal.','/jki396PIIGja0NoFjUq1AdBbMGc.jpg','2016-07-21',107,'Released','Ready. Set. Panic.','Skiptrace',270774,6.95,5.764,'z1iefFsPSaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33154,_binary '\0','/9N4moRdtePykeBBXaMaTLLBhpFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2238050',6.3,31387,'en','White Bird in a Blizzard','In 1988, a teenage girl\'s life is thrown into chaos when her mother disappears.','/aVGYxG8kFR5EOtQ8vwdSJgIyHLy.jpg','2014-10-15',92,'Released','I was 17 when my mother disappeared…','White Bird in a Blizzard',157825,5.3434,6.193,'CBHcT0hBmdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33155,_binary '\0','/plTx6iHNbLxNXKL4swZxl4RVT2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2238470',4.9,3234,'en','The Stranger','A supernatural thriller, laced by flashbacks, and set in Canada’s North-West, “The Stranger” turns on the mysterious titular figure of Martin, who comes to a small quiet town seeking to kill his wife Ana who suffers from a very dangerous decease that makes her addicted to human blood - just like himself-. However, when he arrives to the town, he discovers that Ana has been dead for a couple of years and decides to commit suicide to definitely eradicate this dangerous decease, but, before he can do it, Martin\'s brutally attacked by three local thugs led by Caleb, the son of a corrupt police lieutenant, and the incident suddenly starts a snowball that will plunge the community into a bloodbath.','/8YjSy1vG4yuuatgdAU1NbitA52F.jpg','2014-06-12',93,'Released','Blood will tear us apart.','The Stranger',291151,1.3326,4.7,'vIfujezyQ9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33156,_binary '\0','/gNMRGN44c47Tk034ApZ23tZQxos.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2238837',7.1,1657,'ta','காதலில் சொதப்புவது எப்படி','After Arun and Parvathi\'s stormy romance ends, he goes to Puducherry where he befriends Cathy, the girlfriend of his buddy John. But their friendship is mistaken for love by John.','/61oKNx1ojPwkF6KzSs3cRnKMwkb.jpg','2012-02-17',127,'Released','Come, Fail in Love','Kadhalil Sodhappuvadhu Yeppadi',101793,1.1131,5.761,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33157,_binary '\0','/g0a8z7hfr5QdhQMWst7hGFwqtcy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2238839',6.8,2054,'cn','春嬌與志明','When old flames reunite, will it be second time\'s the charm or a case of once bitten twice shy? Jimmy and Cherie, two ex-lovers from Hong Kong, cross paths in Beijing and can\'t seem to forget each other, despite being involved with someone else. Torn between fidelity towards their new partners or following their hearts, they explore the struggles, doubts and fears that exist among modern young couples.','/xTVqndmsHc3PzZ0nmVER5SsRqTs.jpg','2012-03-29',112,'Released',NULL,'Love in the Buff',105680,2.1326,6.649,'OoFNhcl-gXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33158,_binary '\0','/7W2z7wASYrXVX0EKt3hXwBmNzCL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22394694',4.1,2182,'en','Detective Knight: Redemption','In custody in New York, Detective James Knight finds himself in the middle of a jailbreak led by The Christmas Bomber, a brutal fanatic whose Santa Claus disciples are terrorizing the city. With the promised return of his badge in exchange for taking out the terrorists, the steely-eyed Knight doles out mercy for the just...and merciless justice for all the rest.','/acCIjyszhmit8k5eWVGNTustYRK.jpg','2022-12-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Detective Knight: Redemption',1035803,3.8636,5.314,'bXMbkKzvpHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33159,_binary '\0','/fTLMsF3IVLMcpNqIqJRweGvVwtX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22394702',3.4,2028,'en','Detective Knight: Independence','Detective James Knight \'s last-minute assignment to the Independence Day shift turns into a race to stop an unbalanced ambulance EMT from imperiling the city\'s festivities. The misguided vigilante, playing cop with a stolen gun and uniform, has a bank vault full of reasons to put on his own fireworks show... one that will strike dangerously close to Knight\'s home.','/jrPKVQGjc3YZXm07OYMriIB47HM.jpg','2023-01-20',92,'Released',NULL,'Detective Knight: Independence',1035806,3.5564,5.3,'zt-hyQE-sIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33160,_binary '\0','/6de4PnUGaa3Kijy9wjCENDRKLEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22394800',7.1,2628,'tr','Cem Karaca\'nın Gözyaşları','Against a backdrop of political unrest in Turkey, this biopic charts the life of Anatolian rock singer Cem Karaca, focusing on his revolutionary ideals. Heightened emotions and moments of threat reflect the country\'s rising tensions.','/yOdlIrWIeRX0eLQTxVGSGYyyhMn.jpg','2024-01-26',123,'Released',NULL,'Tears of Cem Karaca',1230527,1.5295,7.2,'yKRW8PUFz4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33161,_binary '\0','/1asV2KH7zlqDcZsmLJaa89eyzge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2239512',6.8,1287,'et','Seenelkäik','Politician Aadu Kägu goes to the mushroom forest with his wife Viivi to rest his nerves from the reputation campaign. They are joined by a voter, penniless rock star Zäk. In order to avoid common mushroom forests, they drive to some countryside at random. Soon the trio discovers that they are lost, at the same time a media scandal breaks out - the investigative press suspects that Kägu has misused state money. The fight for honor, life and death begins, both in the forest and in the city.','/gUGmhAOSaLi3MoOnXksYKTu3kEO.jpg','2012-09-21',93,'Released','Who is the fool now?','Mushrooming',128135,0.7596,5.8,'WuX6-eE-gH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33162,_binary '\0','/5rYnygKCkmqWuMv1O5yAnzGF8gV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2239822',6.4,211512,'en','Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets','In the 28th century, Valerian and Laureline are special operatives charged with keeping order throughout the human territories. On assignment from the Minister of Defense, the two undertake a mission to Alpha, an ever-expanding metropolis where species from across the universe have converged over centuries to share knowledge, intelligence, and cultures. At the center of Alpha is a mysterious dark force which threatens the peaceful existence of the City of a Thousand Planets, and Valerian and Laureline must race to identify the menace and safeguard not just Alpha, but the future of the universe.','/vlc95gl3PtrjxSEuM8RhTtSm2xU.jpg','2017-07-19',137,'Released','A universe without boundaries needs heroes without limits.','Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets',339964,13.3121,6.657,'_shrCoqWh9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33163,_binary '\0','/cMSfVBqshJTDfdwr00hxkpuwjRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2239832',5.7,24584,'en','Think Like a Man Too','All the couples are back for a wedding in Las Vegas, but plans for a romantic weekend go awry when their various misadventures get them into some compromising situations that threaten to derail the big event.','/yKI9Nof9MH3dNHM469hEfCjCbjJ.jpg','2014-06-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Think Like a Man Too',184098,5.7447,6.4,'N8b6kVSZNLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33164,_binary '\0','/xKJTWGvheOMMlTHgrjN18KaD9Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22398528',2.7,1858,'en','Alice in Terrorland','A recently bereaved teenage girl goes to live with her aunt in a secluded woodland house, unaware that sinister forces lurk within.','/5XJGvr8g9jkmN6KUIOQOj2iE6K4.jpg','2023-12-26',77,'Released',NULL,'Alice in Terrorland',1174618,3.0813,5.7,'vk3bFFCKWZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33165,_binary '\0','/miL1LsOOKGwG7621RPmVPitjW9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22399738',5.5,2133,'en','Sweet Dreams','Morris navigates his way through a mandatory stay at Sweet Dreams sober living. In an attempt to get his life back on track, he agrees to coach a misfit softball team of his fellow housemates.','/e1TyT5umEoAM2SXQIp7OwNBn7Hv.jpg','2024-04-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Dreams',1062421,2.7085,5.5,'Ey_sy6qhzAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33166,_binary '\0','/6WvPHqHFAeBP4hATMQ5F6mehhUm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2240312',3.3,2289,'en','Hold Your Breath','There is an old wives tale that you should hold your breath when passing by a cemetery because an evil spirit rejected by both heaven and hell can get inside of you when you inhale. Somewhere in a carload of college kids on holiday doesn\'t follow the rules when driving by a graveyard, allowing a spirit of a recently executed serial killer to get inside him/her to begin a killing spree of body-jumping carnage.','/w7PJWZOHCLzfnw57TRFTcrLk1Ni.jpg','2012-10-05',87,'Released','When you drive by a graveyard, don\'t ever forget...','Hold Your Breath',127548,2.0658,4.2,'ZiBZWC-SwOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33167,_binary '\0','/rBETwHpwads6QhSoTOzc0cgjp3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2240764',5.9,1230,'en','Bad Boy Street','Two men embark on an unconventional romance in Todd Verow\'s sexy Parisian-set drama. Claude finds a young man passed out in the street and, taking pity on him, decides to take him to his apartment to safely sleep. Awakening the next morning, the sexy stranger soon makes a play for his forty-something host, kick-starting a passionate romance. But will the chance meeting develop into more than just lust or will the pair\'s differences drive them apart? An accomplished, serious and very modern gay romance .','/dZy8hh9Vbv2R7TR1lvm4Tk16kKM.jpg','2012-10-22',80,'Released','What am I going to do with you? Whatever you want.','Bad Boy Street',140208,3.736,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33168,_binary '\0','/nWcKw1FeYKFTnGSosSBYjyFVRdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2240784',7.8,1676,'fr','Planète Océan','Dive into our planet\'s greatest mysteries with a team of international underwater cinematographers as they explore the breathtaking bond between humanity and the ocean.','/kukf6NNxQF1wLykdC2e0jlVELig.jpg','2012-06-18',94,'Released',NULL,'Planet Ocean',152113,2.3586,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33169,_binary '\0','/dNplOw9U5IzlY7nNiaMS0JSVobp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22408160',6.4,74235,'en','Kinds of Kindness','A triptych fable following a man without choice who tries to take control of his own life; a policeman who is alarmed that his wife who was missing-at-sea has returned and seems a different person; and a woman determined to find a specific someone with a special ability, who is destined to become a prodigious spiritual leader.','/50lPmjIpDs8gKfgK7fPIeKzpllh.jpg','2024-05-30',164,'Released','We might all be in danger.','Kinds of Kindness',1029955,13.893,6.481,'Kk6c7MNmTwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33170,_binary '\0','/xCIG9pPVmemiSsYZbLaFw5QxhLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241035',6.4,2008,'fa','به رنگ ارغوان','An undercover Iranian intelligence officer investigates the political status of a college student, whose parents were active members of the mujahedin khalgh radical group.','/7eoWq3OCjHv8wMEvUVlJe1fO2mJ.jpg','2010-02-17',97,'Released',NULL,'The Color Purple',414086,0.8177,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33171,_binary '\0','/acx2qYDXfkrSdSgWwr2kpA5F2BW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241116',5.9,1486,'en','White Rabbit','A bullied student sees visions of a rabbit he was forced to kill as a child, and those visions propel him into a state where his imagination causes him to carry out violent acts.','/n9iPAVxdqoYbmTeogiXwyQbLHQz.jpg','2013-09-20',90,'Released',NULL,'White Rabbit',300090,1.4257,6.1,'aYTbCK_CqrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33172,_binary '\0','/ct5kjqyBwzH6OSxuOIluChs3FFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241351',6.5,112849,'en','Money Monster','Financial TV host Lee Gates and his producer Patty are put in an extreme situation when an irate investor takes over their studio.','/DlgdAkAKirD01R1mBejhFjS6nQ.jpg','2016-05-12',99,'Released','Not every conspiracy is a theory.','Money Monster',303858,11.4385,6.43,'qr_nGAbFkmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33173,_binary '\0','/eFLblKezeUfNLq5PRr4JQcPDvNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241403',5,2688,'en','Outpost: Rise of the Spetsnaz','It explores the terrifying origins of the supernatural Nazi soldiers, and what leads to a brutal and relentless confrontation. In an epic battle between the shadowy forces of the Nazis and a fearsome adversary, the legendary Spetsnaz, the Russian military elite known for their courage and ferocity.','/cKIJXGI1wMzx63ewmYHrPbC8Yc2.jpg','2013-06-26',87,'Released',NULL,'Outpost: Rise of the Spetsnaz',164377,2.3655,4.935,'SL-ZOGhzFas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33174,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241471',4.3,1366,'en','An American Ghost Story','When Paul, an unemployed writer, decides to rent and live in a house that\'s rumored to be haunted, he puts his life and his relationships in grave danger as he obsessively attempts to get the story that will finally make his career.','/grDDnpEnul39P5w5rTDQNvU1h12.jpg','2012-10-01',95,'Released','Some things are better left alone.','An American Ghost Story',214990,1.1966,4.1,'8d-invSCT5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33175,_binary '\0','/tWYldjFEs3hmFxe2HKCVwV3InnO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241605',6.3,8829,'es','Tesis sobre un homicidio','Roberto is a Law professor whose life is thrown into chaos when he becomes convinced that one of his best students has committed a brutal murder. Determined to uncover the truth, he begins a personal investigation…','/qJr8TqZ1EhX5705U8SUPSfOqftJ.jpg','2013-01-17',106,'Released','Details. The key is hidden in the details.','Thesis on a Homicide',167963,1.9867,6.3,'p-_vI450t9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33176,_binary '\0','/u0YnDUKO9hMWjYeGvQ2czeUkcWW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241691',5.8,1521,'fr','Au bout du conte','Laura is still waiting for Prince Charming at the age of 24. So when Sandro appears at a party, exactly like her Prince would in her dreams, she thinks she\'s found the right one. But then again, when she meets Maxime, Laura starts to wonder if some Princes could be more charming than others? Of course Sandro has problems of his own : his father, Pierre, just bumped into Madam Irma at his father\'s funeral and this reminded him of the date of his own death which Madame Irma had predicted ages ago. Now Pierre is unable to make any plans, not with his new partner Eleonore, nor with Sandro. And Maxime has his own problems, and so does Eleonore, Marianne, Jacqueline and many others. But don\'t worry, in the end, they\'ll all live happily ever after.','/lB1kVizjYAT1x44JdDZMWCR9Kkb.jpg','2013-03-05',112,'Released',NULL,'Under the Rainbow',160564,1.9982,5.6,'hIevboMMZs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33177,_binary '\0','/ezkcwZIUoSziZ6fWHNHkMRioZet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2241750',5.6,1828,'en','Drown','Len is a Surf Lifesaving champion, a legend in the cloistered surf club just like his father. When the younger, faster, and fitter Phil arrives at the club, Len’s legendary status starts to crumble. Then Len sees Phil arriving in the company of another man. Phil is gay.','/fHqPEhRJjDI2Qo6EjPvtOtToyH5.jpg','2015-03-04',93,'Released','Get ready for a night out with the boys.','Drown',287855,1.8604,5.5,'kt7BcS8T-NI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33178,_binary '\0','/5v9YtGBrTmIpOP21FgsGWTpGgIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2242176',4.8,2030,'en','Horsehead','Since her childhood, Jessica has been haunted by recurrent nightmares whose meaning escapes her. This peculiarity has led her to study the psychophysiology of dreams and to follow a therapy with Sean, her mentor and boyfriend, to try and understand the origin of her nightmares. Following the death of her maternal grandmother she hardly knew, Jessica reluctantly returns to the family home. Jessica then begins to wander in a nightmarish world inhabited by twisted versions of her family members. She gradually improves her skills as a lucid dreamer and investigates to solve the mystery that gnaws her and haunts the family home...','/zbRQXLN90LOs7iTnJzNq15WFDn5.jpg','2014-09-07',89,'Released',NULL,'Horsehead',285549,1.5038,5.3,'-EH0QvEUvME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33179,_binary '\0','/jcli1SIkrjxs4UTbJi5slxRKgHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243260',4.7,1494,'en','Swung','David’s life is on the slide: he’s broke, in the middle of a divorce and ‘can’t get it up’. His girlfriend, Alice, is his rock, but the magazine she writes for is going down and the pressure is on to find a story. While job hunting online, David stumbles across the perfect antidote to his boredom: a ‘Swingers’ site. The resulting inbox of lewd invitations on the home-laptop justifiably upsets Alice, until she realises this could be just the ‘story’ she needs. The idea of uncovering the swinging scene causes quite a stir in Alice’s office and, much to David’s chagrin, she is urged to pursue the story. Their first reluctant foray is an hysterically low-rent initiation, however, an unexpected upturn for David’s manhood is all the extra encouragement they need. As events accelerate beyond their control the once adoring couple become lost and fundamental questions are asked of their relationship.','/wRjm5zztXRUYhXEl3FQKbIbgtMC.jpg','2015-06-19',87,'Released','What\'s your safe word?','Swung',287284,3.8698,5.4,'iIZs23Zu01E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33180,_binary '\0','/rTl1x2zvz6EqwlkEo8tZ7l1a8e0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243299',7.9,3074,'hu','Final Cut: Hölgyeim és uraim','A film where anything can happen - the hero and the heroine changes their faces, age, look, names, and so on. The only same thing: The love between man and woman... in an archetypical love story cut from 500 classics from all around the world.','/tcHQiTS7pQUbwKrmGeW4reZuTxg.jpg','2012-02-04',84,'Released','A Recycled Movie','Final Cut: Ladies and Gentlemen',126314,3.0737,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33181,_binary '\0','/gr09ANaHAIm9lpLOiYhB79rC4Tm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243361',5.3,1427,'sv','Kvarteret Skatan reser till Laholm','For a long time, a group of friends have been on a yearly summer trip to Laholm. This year, they want to go somewhere else, at least everyone except Ulf, who force the others to join the trip - by saying he has cancer.','/wJULIlPuj0efOXbiZ5Yl0Ru3OcZ.jpg','2012-03-16',83,'Released',NULL,'High Rise Life – The Movie',93222,1.5224,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33182,_binary '\0','/EccrWxeF28GeGLSSuDOU9suom5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243389',5.6,25701,'es','Los amantes pasajeros','Something has gone wrong with the landing gear of a plane en route from Madrid to Mexico City. The group of eccentric travelers on the flight, defenseless in the face of danger, indulge in colourful confessionals, while the outlandish crew attempts to find ways to entertain them.','/sQSHPwWlqW9AJEac6sakeIhrMZx.jpg','2013-03-08',90,'Released',NULL,'I\'m So Excited!',144789,3.3804,5.7,'DhH-A8pLCMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33183,_binary '\0','/vTpDpRm8v7v4a7MkHOYxsrIx30D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243393',6.6,3387,'en','Love Never Dies','Set ten years after the events at the Paris Opera House, the Phantom has fled to New York, where he lives amongst the joyrides and freak shows of Coney Island. He has finally found a place for his music to soar, all that is missing is his love Christine Daaé. In a bid to win back her love, the Phantom lures Christine, her husband Raoul, and their young son Gustave from Manhattan, to the glittering and glorious world of Coney Island... they have no idea what lies in store for them...','/66PKthTm3oi2lrsahRbaAPOnimT.jpg','2012-02-08',121,'Released','The Sequel to The Phantom of the Opera','Love Never Dies',88920,1.8512,7.009,'HkoMHsaVUY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33184,_binary '\0','/wq2xijPs2bFWLVuMh7LzBKkovC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243471',5.6,2021,'tr','Patlak Sokaklar: Gerzomat',NULL,'/4HZOwbuu0ONKrgcBUMXer6GzlGs.jpg','2012-03-16',95,'Released',NULL,'Patlak Sokaklar: Gerzomat',110986,0.6254,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33185,_binary '\0','/mgnMFeLCEaNTOiD7w2DOaqzddyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243537',5.1,55883,'en','A Haunted House','Malcolm and Kisha move into their dream home, but soon learn a demon also resides there. When Kisha becomes possessed, Malcolm - determined to keep his sex life on track - turns to a priest, a psychic, and a team of ghost-busters for help in this spoof of all the \"found-footage/documentary style\" films released in recent years.','/f3ajCdwH7H8JTMVUsCaN5lUsnhi.jpg','2013-01-11',86,'Released','This $*%! ain\'t paranormal.','A Haunted House',139038,8.5219,5.955,'daCqXHagaPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33186,_binary '\0','/dvBOmgWTW1eOBqlE84Gc2jVhInj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22436062',5.7,2110,'ml','ധൂമം','Avinash wants to quit his marketing job at a top cigarette company, but it comes with consequences','/zZ4qJFfv6UXqb6otLBW2qzOQu4C.jpg','2023-06-23',143,'Released',NULL,'Dhoomam',1030101,1.0371,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33187,_binary '\0','/gvCnzzk9QELPQNkR27p4W9uFFGV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243621',5.4,3189,'ru','Снежная королева','The Snow Queen creates a world of eternal winter, frosting human souls and emotions. When she turns Kai, the son of a wizard, into an ice statue, his sister embarks on a journey to save him and bring life back to the world.','/siQpJAT2IQjN218hxJXvrHePtNS.jpg','2012-10-11',76,'Released','Cold can freeze your heart, love can set you free','The Snow Queen',164372,4.3937,5.847,'HJrTHEDgHfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33188,_binary '\0','/wYxtUQNjVyQlXWG330fbCbrNLBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22437050',5.6,1893,'en','Wild Is the Wind','When two corrupt police officers investigate the brutal murder of a young girl, tensions come to a head in their small, racially-segregated town.','/cyn395RyxeP64T6jEgOGE4K7O46.jpg','2022-10-28',123,'Released',NULL,'Wild Is the Wind',1033107,1.9671,5.643,'4CjJsX90yAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33189,_binary '\0','/tNvpplzuQ3delUdHejzHJNcuSZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22437798',6,1544,'pl','Teściowie 2','Would-be bride and groom Weronika and Łukasz decide to give themselves a second chance and invite their family to the wedding and reception in a seaside town. Among the invited guests are Wanda and Tadeusz – with their dog, Mirelka, and also a divorcee, Małgorzata, accompanied by her much younger partner, Jan , and her mother. The sea, drinks, and nude sunbathers make the family members on both sides more open and ready to shed their masks.','/oXfk4IvOBwhmOulGhLLNhBHMLa9.jpg','2023-09-15',94,'Released','Will there be a wedding this time?','The In-Laws 2',1043912,0.8863,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33190,_binary '\0','/pPKAcvCYcQWx4slftwnAssvEuBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2243900',4.3,4631,'en','Trouble Is My Business','Private eye Roland Drake cracks cases and romances femme fatales in 1940\'s Los Angeles while corrupt cop Det Barry Tate rules the city. A tale told in the classic style of film noir. Drake has fallen on hard times in a harsh world. He has been evicted from his office and disgraced by a missing persons case. Ruined in the public eye and with the police. it seems like it\'s all over for Roland Drake. Then, redemption walks in - with curves. The owner of those curves is a sexy, dark haired beauty named Katherine Montemar. She wants his help. The chemistry is immediate and her concern for the disappearance of her family members pulls him into her case - and into bed.','/2o4z89Q6YsEniOboIvRDKVNnuPw.jpg','2018-04-03',116,'Released','Passion, Murder, and Betrayal. Just Another Day at the Office.','Trouble Is My Business',513285,2,4.7,'1YS11iK0-is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33191,_binary '\0','/6sldBftt9plrgf3dygltLccuWIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22440764',6.3,1360,'en','I Am Vanessa Guillen','Vanessa Guillen was 20 years old when she was found murdered at a US Army base. Rather than submit to silence, her family fought for justice and change.','/cUhmtPP9L8BBnuquyPE4zOU2RTg.jpg','2022-11-16',95,'Released',NULL,'I Am Vanessa Guillen',1030323,1.9093,7.5,'Wpii7t26aZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33192,_binary '\0','/dWwcwqAOkS6e4GCRJ5fC9iSVx9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22444570',7.2,20053,'ta','பொன்னியின் செல்வன்: பாகம் 2','968 AD. The Pandyan assassins gather once again to destroy the Chola dynasty. Now the mighty Chola princes must fight the Pandyas, the Rashtrakutas and other Chola enemies who have joined forces. Also, at play are the rumours of Ponniyin Selvan’s death at sea, the powerful Pazhuvettarayar’s betrayal, and the tragic destiny of Aditha Karikalan, whose heart was long lost to the vengeful Nandini.','/1fMM5yjLYJNfO3CSQBpfC1kqeIK.jpg','2023-04-28',164,'Released','The Cholas are Back','Ponniyin Selvan: Part II',858082,2.4142,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33193,_binary '\0','/ctzyA7JN6ZJ6FohK1itRoEBV4oV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2244877',8,2644,'bs','Halimin put','In order to recover the body of her son lost during the war in Bosnia, a grieving, but strong-willed Muslim woman, Halima, must track down her estranged niece, who we find carries a mysterious connection to him.','/zawq2lr9jo6ZJWA86zhwpCU22c5.jpg','2012-07-25',105,'Released',NULL,'Halima\'s Path',187864,0.9446,7.9,'VxhxteoJnC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33194,_binary '\0','/yvJxDpIN9QttKwalYR6YF6f559D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2244889',6.9,1594,'en','Heaven Adores You','Heaven Adores You is an intimate, meditative inquiry into the life and music of Elliott Smith. By threading the music of Elliott Smith through the dense, yet often isolating landscapes of the three major cities he lived in -- Portland, New York City, Los Angeles -- Heaven Adores You presents a visual journey and an earnest review of the singer\'s prolific songwriting and the impact it continues to have on fans, friends, and fellow musicians.','/5M4Owu4Z9GjToJhUUz1nqhRkpTC.jpg','2014-05-14',104,'Released',NULL,'Heaven Adores You',276729,1.2217,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33195,_binary '\0','/lsyeHaNblFjnCWIJhkfBRmxG7QP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2244901',5.7,41190,'en','I Give It a Year','After a quick courtship, two lovers hastily decide to tie the knot. As their first year of marriage unfolds, temptation and incompatibility put their relationship in jeopardy.','/hCSqxrM5Sw6AhDIRfxQ4BenPd9y.jpg','2013-02-08',97,'Released',NULL,'I Give It a Year',150117,7.356,5.508,'0HOpijEHeII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33196,_binary '\0','/qJyIO2Ies3icSZDg5YaZOLrxwNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2244947',7.5,5429,'ar','كده رضا','A comedy about triplet brothers with only one birth certificate.','/eNSxF2OgoT3UBp8FQK6EHkPQH4P.jpg','2007-07-31',113,'Released',NULL,'Can’t Complain',43405,1.0652,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33197,_binary '\0','/ygiO8LyMEcHa8dwg0aLCpybPlP0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245003',6.8,20778,'en','Miss You Already','The friendship between two life-long girlfriends is put to the test when one starts a family and the other falls ill.','/cvA686C7O8MwXhFIaql4ui6eR0p.jpg','2015-09-12',112,'Released','When life falls apart, friends keep it together.','Miss You Already',290762,4.5484,7.4,'kP6iAjcExfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33198,_binary '\0','/a9cGIGSP1FwP9EDy7OTvZ06ModC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245049',6.7,2308,'fa','پذیرایی ساده','An Iranian couple from the city drive around a remote mountainous region. They hand out bags of money to poor villagers in return for them carrying out unusual requests the couple make of them.','/tem0VXX19E2hKMxEjIkuoEqu7u0.jpg','2013-01-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Modest Reception',114962,1.1266,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33199,_binary '\0','/4s2d3xdyqotiVNHTlTlJjrr3q0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245084',7.8,561905,'en','Big Hero 6','A special bond develops between plus-sized inflatable robot Baymax, and prodigy Hiro Hamada, who team up with a group of friends to form a band of high-tech heroes.','/2mxS4wUimwlLmI1xp6QW6NSU361.jpg','2014-10-24',102,'Released','Drop everything. Save the world.','Big Hero 6',177572,36.6371,7.725,'8IdMPpKMdcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33200,_binary '\0','/qReOpdUuuxHGdDB7dMk1wGPE5wl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22450920',5.5,2359,'tr','Hazine','Mesut, a civil servant who returns his hometown to bury his mother, is dragged into by his younger brother Musa to a treasure hunt and finds himself tangled up with a murder.','/bKaHXUdOjea5K3DyrmLeifCoWcb.jpg','2022-11-04',108,'Released',NULL,'Treasure',1030328,1.8085,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33201,_binary '\0','/92emBazocuGHWg8qWEAYOfbvZE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245151',5.7,5012,'en','Supremacy','The story centers on paroled white supremacist who has just killed a cop, and takes a black family hostage. Within hours of being released from 14 years of solitary confinement in maximum-security Pelican Bay State Prison, Garrett Tully is on the run again. When he finds a house off a dirt road and takes a family hostage, he thinks the Aryan Brotherhood has his back–and his kidnap victims are black. The family’s patriarch, Mr. Walker, is a jaded ex-con who hates cops so much he disavowed his own son for becoming one. Seeing a familiar desperation in Tully, Walker refuses to call the authorities for help, causing familial tensions to escalate, and soon grave missteps are made.','/jyuFA9AYBLNJY4Zb2Q5ty8cSIbW.jpg','2014-06-12',110,'Released','No One Is Save','Supremacy',277702,3.4196,5.7,'VYCX9_F0G5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33202,_binary '\0','/nswukoPpvmWa8Jm3Yo0wYChJMTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245171',6.3,8388,'en','The Cut','In 1915, a man survives the Armenian genocide in the Ottoman Empire, but loses his family, speech and faith. One night, he learns that his twin daughters may be alive, and goes on a quest to find them.','/QGmH2wYtZWyrFZ2T9VFOJntsfR.jpg','2014-10-16',138,'Released',NULL,'The Cut',250230,2.5222,5.9,'J_uQT6WcOEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33203,_binary '\0','/yd2rbFZgptuEc7WwzD9cs5QzmSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245195',7.1,3774,'en','The History of Future Folk','An alien intending to claim Earth for his people before their homeworld is destroyed by a comet decides not to eliminate humanity when he hears their music. Instead, he lives among them until another alien is sent to find and kill him.','/cJHq7n8fl6p5tY0Jr6GQ2uoO0rR.jpg','2012-06-15',86,'Released',NULL,'The History of Future Folk',115199,1.968,6.6,'fZrDALCsKwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33204,_binary '\0','/g0fwXBuC0JBq6PPbobQYzvyezzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245223',6.8,1592,'en','The Source Family','A feature documentary film set in Hollywood, examining a radical experiment in \'70s utopian living. The Source Family were the darlings of the Sunset Strip until their communal living, outsider ideals and spiritual leader Father Yod\'s 13 wives became an issue with local authorities. They fled to Hawaii, leading to their dramatic demise.','/b39CESSCHbZsPhRyyMOGFJbhlUX.jpg','2013-05-01',98,'Released','God Has A Rock Band','The Source Family',98064,1.5788,6.1,'F3f4aleOAxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33205,_binary '\0','/aGMnsSAps1tSmbWrUbmVEijaJWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2245544',8.3,3993,'pa','Carry On Jatta','Jass falls in love with Mahie who is interested in marrying an orphan. While they both marry each other, Jass hides his marriage from his family.','/3KJ8UiNloo0Un2osnQOuyXfqNO2.jpg','2012-07-27',140,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Jatta',123463,1.3108,8.3,'7UoOy9PvJrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33206,_binary '\0','/s4CHQ8m27TPBji3ZQAzgEEg0X8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22457506',4.2,9681,'hi','मेरे हज़्बन्ड की बीवी','A Delhi professional faces a love triangle when his old flame returns as he falls for someone new. This leads to a series of comedic misunderstandings in his relationships.','/fQMBYG4JOD6WN8QzViPYqxuIsru.jpg','2025-02-21',142,'Released','Love Triangle Nahi, Circle Hai','Mere Husband Ki Biwi',1196942,1.6543,5.45,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33207,_binary '\0','/oOWloFmj1BdnxLozIxIDjeeeXYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22462104',7.7,3139,'bn','পুনর্জন্ম ৩','After discovering about Rafsan Haq\'s sinister side Rokeya is running away from him . On the other hand, Police is desperately trying to encircle Rafsan Haq. What will be his next move?','/ubhYjfhWFIwXhk6zY30sqKuwJer.jpg','2022-10-01',57,'Released','\"Everything will be Okay at the end. If it\'s not, then remember it\'s not the end. Just wait for that\"','Punorjonmo 3',1031001,1.2782,6.8,'Jn1mKN8SPfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33208,_binary '\0','/heQXuVyPcPzG98NdU3VtXzWhD4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246565',7.4,11204,'en','An Honest Liar','An Honest Liar tells the incredible story of the world-famous magician, escape artist, and world-renowned enemy of deception, James \'The Amazing\' Randi. The film brings to life Randi\'s intricate investigations that publicly exposed psychics, faith healers, and con-artists with quasi-religious fervor. A master deceiver who came out of the closet at the age of 81, Randi created fictional characters, fake psychics, and even turned his partner of 25 years, Jose Alvarez, into a sham guru named Carlos.','/sXgXPtynmZnLLISonrrc7XtrLKv.jpg','2014-04-18',90,'Released',NULL,'An Honest Liar',262481,2.3133,7.1,'KYaddaNQH5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33209,_binary '\0','/hsiQvctD83I6Xb3YpWSfYF1Ie6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246595',4.8,1344,'hi','Blood Money','In South Africa, a young man living with his wife becomes embroiled in an illegal diamond business and with time finds his life changing.','/hjWbVHzGYFFzozJIX7Em8EcfYst.jpg','2012-03-31',110,'Released','Success comes at a price.','Blood Money',105379,1.3505,6.1,'5-t2-NenlrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33210,_binary '\0','/cyxhtPxRMrudT3UpioNjdkDZX4G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246673',6.2,2693,'en','Lovestruck: The Musical','Harper was one of the best dancers to hit Broadway, but an injury caused her to leave the spotlight, become a choreographer, and raise her daughter Mirabella. When Mirabella decides to quit the show to get married, her mother is determined to put a stop to the wedding and show Mirabella that she cannot give up her career for love.','/2SYu78HqqrDw0Pph44Ikr1eNJbN.jpg','2013-04-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Lovestruck: The Musical',189204,1.9856,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33211,_binary '\0','/gmfR15AgaxeISYWqTWsIpVsEzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246724',5.9,5620,'hi','घनचक्कर','A safe cracker claims he has lost his memory when two criminals come calling for their cut of the bank heist loot.','/w1pwtL1XCrrQj2d4RaqKaZYRet6.jpg','2013-06-28',137,'Released','Remember Not To Forget','Ghanchakkar',192097,1.611,5,'ClncY3AQxeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33212,_binary '\0','/bbuTzs1Y0sT7qlRXnqPPB360Sza.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246837',6.3,7790,'ta','மாற்றான்','Akhilan and Vimalan are the conjoined twins of genetic scientist Ramachandran, whose company makes Energion, a dietary supplement that promises to make geniuses out of children. When Russian journalist Volga tells them that there is something fishy about Energion and is mysteriously found dead, their lives are turned topsy-turvy.','/q2RdAKjrGI1ibjetUff7wJtp0g7.jpg','2012-10-12',168,'Released','Sometimes the end is just the beginning','Maattrraan',139662,2.6496,5.755,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33213,_binary '\0','/bHZOC6xO4TmUqy1VwGhpC9DNotr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246887',5.1,2111,'en','Back in the Day','Sometimes in order to move forward, you have to go back. And in this raunchy comedy, Jim Owens does just that when he heads home for his high school reunion. In an attempt to relive the glory days with his boys and explore an old romance, he nearly destroys his hometown and friendships.','/ic42z1TNNQ8DdU9iN9juqKWhA18.jpg','2014-01-07',94,'Released','Sometimes in order to move forward...you have to go back','Back in the Day',228028,2.1668,4.7,'3cMwPaqcx4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33214,_binary '\0','/lR9wg1q3Eci2lrD41Jm2lAi5BIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246924',6,1554,'en','Tricked: The Documentary','This character-driven film considers the evolving sex trafficking landscape as seen by the main players: the exploited, the pimps, the johns that fuel the business, and the cops who fight to stop it.','/ejVgXkD61Slgd9SOAcpwy4T6UuD.jpg','2013-12-13',73,'Released','A shocking look inside America\'s sex trade','Tricked: The Documentary',241553,1.0446,6.1,'FDCpqRGxAz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33215,_binary '\0','/iTgF0Z5jRj93KCmzTVdPkOVAKBq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2246953',6.9,2441,'ja','レンタネコ','A young woman who rents out cats to lonely old folks finds her life turned upside down when a young man from her past shows back up in her life.','/9N1LLlSCze4M60a8JYvpfui62NP.jpg','2012-05-12',110,'Released','I don\'t want to stay lonely.','Rent-a-Cat',116303,1.8789,7.2,'ujAmNgVoKYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33216,_binary '\0','/9TkvQ73TGAFwUwMdx1dr9tQ6K9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2247119',5.7,1610,'ar','وش اجرام','Our man has about everything against him : he is short, weak, so simple, with an IQ far below the average. There is no wonder why he keeps on being teased by his friends, parents and even fiancee. But circumstances will turn him into a hero and then a vicious criminal feared by all. Half-educated and out-of-work, Taha, is kidnapped by a gang of thieves in his hometown Alexandria. Unbeknownst to them, neither Taha\'s mother nor his girlfriend has a fraction of the ransom','/5pCFfIrprmpVrgCuFWgcyhaoVez.jpg','2006-06-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Born to Be a Criminal',366230,1.0214,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33217,_binary '\0','/cOiXspoYrNbJqLTWAyPxfLo0d0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2247129',7.3,1329,'te','ఎటో వెళ్ళిపోయింది మనసు','The romantic lives of two people – Varun and Nithya, are chronicled in this film from their school days until their adult lives. They fall in love multiple times and keep breaking up over minor issues. But deep down, they are so madly in love with each other that they keep giving themselves another chance.','/oIwMIEsRK4sisfoaSHCdATMjiVg.jpg','2012-12-13',153,'Released','This could be your love story!','Yeto Vellipoyindhi Manasu',149262,1.7156,6.731,'KMCb4_Sfz6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33218,_binary '\0','/h2WyyRB2jKpketuZ0znyANyJGjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2247476',6.6,17794,'en','When the Game Stands Tall','A young coach turns a losing high school football program around to go undefeated for 12 consecutive seasons.','/ffVhh4sBLpJCu875v6hwLJN5VNR.jpg','2014-08-22',115,'Released','Inspired by the extraordinary true story.','When the Game Stands Tall',232679,5.2244,6.7,'qT0aE4iAnJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33219,_binary '\0','/fPSFcnG6onc8NGb246PWcASIlGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22475426',6.1,2708,'en','What We Hide','After their mother suffers a fatal overdose, two sisters fear being separated by the foster system and decide to hide her body. But when their lie risks being exposed, they must decide how far they’re willing to go to keep their secret.','/cQDHU06FsBqNv0r3n3Il3q8jPxY.jpg','2025-08-08',102,'Released','Not all secrets remain buried.','What We Hide',1031962,2.9452,6.4,'9Blus-SQ9NE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33220,_binary '\0','/qROrvjNOU4kqc5DbpUOGMZ0JCnw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2247566',7.7,2565,'ja','KANO','A Taiwanese high school baseball team travels to Japan in 1931 to compete in a national tournament.','/sHTi5Wzp44VprvTBUnMbmXEp4b8.jpg','2014-02-27',185,'Released',NULL,'KANO',256930,1.5957,7,'pmG6LuRxilw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33221,_binary '\0','/ledcZn5v3qvi7hqxjdti1r3LWMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2247692',4.8,11128,'en','2016: Obama\'s America','\"If Obama wins a second term, where will we be in 2016?\" Across the globe and in America, people in 2008 hungered for a leader who would unite and lift us from economic turmoil and war. True to Americas ideals, they invested their hope in a new kind of president, Barack Obama. What they didn\'t know is that Obama is a man with a past, and in powerful ways that past defines him--who he is, how he thinks, and where he intends to take America and the world.','/9Ht3rh0GVgh0rGqW99wCXWE4DP1.jpg','2012-07-13',88,'Released','Love Him, Hate Him, You Don\'t Know Him','2016: Obama\'s America',126509,1.8084,4.1,'vtv6XUT-hno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33222,_binary '\0','/y9nGps2pogC3e19pUHqOaf4pBHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22478818',5.7,8131,'en','William Tell','The narrative unfolds in the 14th Century, when the European nations vie for supremacy within the Holy Roman Empire. The ambitious Austrian Empire, desiring more land, invades neighbouring Switzerland, a serene and pastoral nation. Protagonist William Tell, a formerly peaceful hunter, finds himself forced to take action as his family and homeland come under threat from the oppressive Austrian King and his ruthless warlords.','/8SdaetXSTPyQVDb5pTEPRLBSx15.jpg','2025-01-17',133,'Released',NULL,'William Tell',1195631,10.2536,6.214,'6Q8Y-coIGhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33223,_binary '\0','/etuLD8q3Zyf1fkVMTx7e5sMDZV1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22480126',6.8,4444,'hi','Berlin','New Delhi, the winter of 1993. A deaf mute young man is arrested by \"Bureau\" and accused of being a spy. A sign language expert is brought in to act as an interpreter for the Government’s agent and the “spy”. The unravelling of the mystery is the journey that sucks the sign language expert into the dark vortex of rivalry between intelligence agencies, deceit, and corruption, where the horizon line between innocence and guilt gets hazy.','/nBCVdo3NO2UPHO2lnrfZa0NQZfB.jpg','2023-10-14',125,'Released',NULL,'Berlin',1184551,1.0358,6.222,'IVfHV8gTH0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33224,_binary '\0','/tjMZZqhcAaQScRetNdXuFNf3UtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2248028',7.5,4947,'ml','തട്ടത്തിൻ മറയത്ത്','Vinod is madly in love with a Muslim girl, Aisha. Aisha, who gradually falls in love with Vinod, is disappointed to see their difference in religion acting as a barrier in their marriage plans.','/pJnwpWxAFMexmQrasF5oEQir0c3.jpg','2012-07-06',126,'Released',NULL,'Thattathin Marayathu',120150,1.5498,7.317,'zITXHmHaaGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33225,_binary '\0','/pVyI0faJI6jYIlVxUqhZ1AgBOOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22482764',7.9,2025,'en','Thriller 40','Forty years after the release of Michael Jackson’s ‘Thriller,’ the best-selling album of all-time, director Nelson George takes fans back in time to the making of a pop masterpiece, featuring never-before-seen footage and candid interviews.','/5LOKk1Ca1YaCb3EjTEMDJdPbQxN.jpg','2023-12-02',89,'Released','The album that changed it all.','Thriller 40',1031774,2.6951,8.7,'xyJJnzHr96c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33226,_binary '\0','/n0NP7FPfAV3KZTQloZQCa1G7tRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22486094',7.1,1462,'te','ఓరి దేవుడా..!','Two childhood friends, Anu and Arjun, decide to get married. However, their marital life becomes complicated due to misunderstandings and miscommunication which leads to a divorce.','/3sdQDyUYDpSFIGd9UetguWV4yRY.jpg','2022-10-21',143,'Released',NULL,'Ori Devuda..!',896449,0.8669,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33227,_binary '\0','/qclL4zkea2cu7O0i6QE3X5b4nbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22487338',6.8,3970,'fr','Simple comme Sylvain','Sophia is a philosophy professor in Montreal and has lived as a couple with Xavier for 10 years. Sylvain is a carpenter in the Laurentians and must renovate their country house. When Sophia meets Sylvain for the first time, it’s love at first sight. Opposites attract, but can it last?','/u4IbLxbb1p9X9pMAUn4ddJztO60.jpg','2023-09-22',110,'Released',NULL,'The Nature of Love',912520,2.9801,7.017,'T_1yHVCPcno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33228,_binary '\0','/aazPb6z69o0cngsGvoh7kQhWBU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2248739',6.7,3170,'en','Departure','An English mother and her teenage son spend a week preparing the sale of their remote holiday house in the South of France. Fifteen-year-old Elliot struggles with his dawning sexuality and an increasing alienation from his mother, Beatrice. She in turn is confronted by the realisation that her marriage to his father, Philip, has grown loveless and the life she knows is coming to an end. When an enigmatic local teenager, Clément, quietly enters their lives, both mother and son are compelled to confront their desires and, finally, each other.','/6TZ4H3iOHcpWr9zmClps3jZGhQV.jpg','2016-05-20',109,'Released',NULL,'Departure',361475,2.0598,6.306,'z1nNaFyXby4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33229,_binary '\0','/e5H1SGeouEonsXHlQ6rEY8aAAWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22488024',5.7,2857,'cn','天龍八部之喬峰傳','Qiao Feng is the respected leader of a roving band of martial artists. After he is wrongfully accused of murder and subsequently exiled, Qiao Feng goes on the run in search of answers about his own mysterious origin story—and the unknown enemies working to destroy him from the shadows.','/jGKCpt3zzbGZbgoza6HCvecqElM.jpg','2023-01-16',130,'Released','When a warrior belongs nowhere, the enemy is everywhere.','Sakra',990140,7.1019,6.5,'aHP_pyGtFIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33230,_binary '\0','/tLYTWKiSHoR0yVz8ScrQDa1Youu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22488728',8,18819,'ta','லவ் டுடே','A young couple is made to exchange their phones for a day. What follows is a hilarious and emotional sequence of events that puts their lives in misery.','/iRfIti4RhDFZ11UyCmz5Mk5wtGI.jpg','2022-11-04',154,'Released',NULL,'Love Today',1032627,2.3992,7,'Xjw4ZbCIYS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33231,_binary '\0','/9IcqA79TMkcHu6IQs6kkkIAO0YY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2248944',6.2,2663,'es','Dos más dos','When the fun of double dating begins to grow old, Richard and Bettina share a dirty little secret with their friends Diego and Emilia: They live a double life as swingers, and would love to share this practice with them.','/2pM6DJtGUvRzgXFfxGBScMMafew.jpg','2012-08-16',103,'Released','We all have fantasies to fulfill. Which is yours?','2 + 2',134096,2.5655,6.711,'6oVAh7o7Rb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33232,_binary '\0','/sMWhhWQpNUKFv3hWZPtTkZkhOrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22489564',7.3,2394,'mr','हर हर महादेव','The young Shivaji Shahaji Bhosale is building the foundation of Hindavi Swarajya. This is the beginning of a memorable journey for the man who will go on to be known as Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj. But to turn this dream of Swarajya into reality, he must unite the Watandars.','/hnSPawPoBmtcd6vCTIncY3QAesD.jpg','2022-10-25',161,'Released',NULL,'Har Har Mahadev',1032616,1.0745,8,'ItalSITEr2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33233,_binary '\0','/irveLiOCi0R4v7Jro3yyA59pYad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22490428',6.9,1635,'it','Napoli - New York','In the immediate post-war period, amidst the rubble of a poverty-ridden Naples, two kids, Carmine and Celestina, try to survive as best they can by helping each other out. One night, they secretly board a ship bound for New York to reach Celestina’s sister, who emigrated to America several years earlier. The two children join the many Italian emigrants seeking a new life in America and arrive in an unknown metropolis, which, after several misadventures, they will learn to call home.','/1e4WBvQ2eM2S94SNpev0P5PG2Ge.jpg','2024-11-21',124,'Released',NULL,'Naples to New York',1112637,2.2023,7.117,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33234,_binary '\0','/tAszr4GuJcZWq10LpiHIuJNDQR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2249081',6,3258,'en','The Forgiven','After the end of Apartheid, Archbishop Desmond Tutu meets with a brutal murderer seeking redemption.','/mUQK6gWivZ7q2ehkh8D2YFCqMq9.jpg','2018-03-09',115,'Released','Racist. Prisoner. Murderer. Child of God.','The Forgiven',450766,3.4185,6.1,'_lpuc162YpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33235,_binary '\0','/883smeniIZTmucEQAMGctTMwCOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2249221',6.7,21038,'en','Zulu','As a child, Ali Neuman narrowly escaped being murdered by Inkhata, a militant political party at war with Nelson Mandela\'s African National Congress. Only he and his mother survived the carnage of those years. But as with many survivors, the psychological scars remain.','/h5OZD7pVkIKR5jf4lGFzQQrLmLc.jpg','2013-12-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Zulu',185567,3.4129,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33236,_binary '\0','/6JRVzEY5p9XZTnSQMnRZQHlUWUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22494914',5.2,3148,'en','The Apology','Twenty years after the disappearance of her daughter, a recovering alcoholic is preparing to host her family\'s Christmas celebration when her estranged ex-brother-in-law arrives unannounced, bearing nostalgic gifts and a heavy secret.','/gUFHThondPpmjqeh3XI1yXnCRDa.jpg','2022-12-16',91,'Released','Revenge is a mother.','The Apology',1035654,2.784,5.806,'Y7ki82vHj5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33237,_binary '\0','/zwTfvUl3JnqY1QjgsLTE8NKvHun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2249542',6.9,2569,'hr','Sonja i bik','Sonja, a city girl from Zagreb, a vegetarian and a hardcore animal-rights activist, strongly opposes bullfighting in Dalmatinska zagora (Dalmatian Hinterland). People find this irritating and they conclude that no matter how passionately Sonja loves animals, she would never dare to stand in front of a bull. Bets are raised and Sonja faces a challenge in the form of Ante, known far and wide for his powers of persuasion.','/tDAqtL2dCTrTmlBMOUhuRqpHFPc.jpg','2012-07-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Sonja and the Bull',170898,0.7985,5,'X0WoIuRxDzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33238,_binary '\0','/cutZV0cZOKZiGB9UYt1gEmORNeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22496012',4.6,1354,'en','Jagged Mind','When Billie finds herself reliving different versions of the same first date, she must break out of a series of loops created by her manipulative ex-girlfriend.','/llvoAqUBvnhuo6M4iQah1SGE6kZ.jpg','2023-06-14',88,'Released','Believe anything but your own memory','Jagged Mind',1115939,3.0778,5.4,'FL0y_1MM5Jo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33239,_binary '\0','/haDK5MfX0Pc2pBZGqb2w5QSppEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2249712',6.2,2183,'tr','Araf','Araf is the story of Zehra and Olgun whose lives are caught in a vacuum. The world in which they live and work is a place of throwaway culture and constant change. They too are waiting for a chance to change and escape from their empty, monotonous lives.','/uVH1mQ1hl2quBO13dGXJRsUWsyw.jpg','2012-09-21',124,'Released',NULL,'Araf/Somewhere in Between',129119,1.9506,4.8,'w2gqBdz6oGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33240,_binary '\0','/qTU2mExebq379PS8P5Qrm4ToVyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22497768',6.7,4452,'ar','الخلاط+','He who has a trick in their bag, they shall use it. An anthology of social deception and trickery in four unlikely places.','/znOml3I0JoZaYL47B7u7WuNzKHI.jpg','2022-12-04',116,'Released',NULL,'Alkhallat+',1064450,1.0552,6.9,'PdJuFT4aOdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33241,_binary '\0','/fydz7WxoS5VAcDCG867yjLgFSQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22497964',4.3,1246,'ta','குருமூர்த்தி','An honest cop tries to track down a suitcase filled with ₹5 crore worth of unaccounted cash that belongs to a businessman. With at least a dozen individuals after it, can he recover it before it falls into the wrong hands?','/9dk8KkPuYmt65mTjXPQVAfsQjLT.jpg','2022-12-09',122,'Released',NULL,'Gurumoorthi',1045830,0.92,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33242,_binary '\0','/ei3SkZWFlYiiHiRJPJrVoRZkbN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2249826',7.1,1315,'fr','Hard Skills','Paul Olivier has created a parallel universe with his rules and rituals allowing him to overcome the trauma suffered in his childhood. His fate will be sealed when his path crosses with Sasha.','/bMNsfyhUjVMIzSKwpL1ZQnpbf3Y.jpg','2023-01-07',82,'Released',NULL,'Hard Skills',976333,0.8295,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33243,_binary '\0','/yp9ws1rWcvpwYkV9jOHzX8H7qHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22499672',5.7,1945,'en','Christmas at the Drive-In','Sadie Walker is starting over in her hometown of Chesterfield, New York, following a series of major life disruptions that include leaving her law practice after losing her biggest case and no longer being engaged.','/oxA95knlryWfwtR52kb7sKGNSsy.jpg','2022-11-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at the Drive-In',1026941,2.3291,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33244,_binary '\0','/hdsdQADn3omGt33sG26LTieBkG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22500220',5.5,2416,'en','A Brush with Christmas','Over the week leading up to Christmas in the town of Bayside, Charlotte tries to capture her own unique style in the local art scene while also helping her mother, run the family restaurant. Disheartened and struggling to find time for her art, Charlotte throws out her latest painting, only to discover that it has been anonymously submitted to the Christmas art festival. It turns out that Wyatt, a visiting artist, stumbled upon her discarded work and is now using the festival’s exposure to find its mysterious creator.','/yAX42kvKyEpKHK1unTdWpPz3y9I.jpg','2022-12-18',84,'Released',NULL,'A Brush with Christmas',1032591,2.3797,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33245,_binary '\0','/6mFIzav6W0jQEyr1ljiCDwp9GyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2250234',4.9,3816,'en','SAGA - Curse of the Shadow','A secret cabal, The Shadow, works to bring about the return of Goth Azul - the Undead God - in the rich world of SAGA, populated by elves, orcs, dwarves and dragons. A ruthless elven bounty huntress (Nemyt) shoots down the dragon ridden by the fugitive orc shaman, Fangtor Bloodmoon. When Fangtor refuses to surrender quietly, the huntress must battle for her own life against the dangerous villain, and comes away with more than just his head.','/ypVg8jxAkdWxoRQ1jcObtAXLy2M.jpg','2014-04-02',100,'Released',NULL,'SAGA - Curse of the Shadow',198677,0.7185,5.523,'WcHTWu7qlp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33246,_binary '\0','/pKNgzF5IJHkluNG6rZgVbRXvAIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2250282',4.6,1710,'it','Tulpa','Lisa Boeri is at the top of her corporate career. At night she frequents the notorious Club Tulpa, owned by a mysterious Tibetan guru. Unshackled from repression and guilt, Lisa will do anything with any stranger to attain a higher consciousness. However, when her lovers start getting murdered in shocking ways, Lisa can’t go to the police because the scandal would impact her day job. Foolishly she tries to unmask the assassin herself, with truly nightmarish consequences.','/9C2toUczEoSYhdWIRBPYxEY714W.jpg','2012-08-25',84,'Released','Members Only','Tulpa - Demon of Desire',128452,1.8186,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33247,_binary '\0','/fJRrRn60YzI1hVt4X1BIo6hsM0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22505214',6.6,4162,'ko','용감한 시민','An expelled boxing champion, who now is a high-school teacher, witnesses intolerable violence and throws her first punch to build justice against it, while putting on a mask.','/ixQoOExnnvIxYvnqGgfhaWqXeXc.jpg','2023-10-25',112,'Released','Purring in the face of injustice.','Brave Citizen',897160,6.1912,7.608,'nLx7YXszBYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33248,_binary '\0','/oiiQVnnEY4M2pz6iZkq59ls9fP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22507216',7.2,4834,'de','Amrum','On Amrum Island in spring 1945, twelve-year-old Nanning hunts seals, fishes at night, and works the fields to help feed his family. When the war ends, his mother sinks into depression, and he must navigate new conflicts while struggling to find his own path.','/z87OLGYXojP3bJjp0EpbutpvGTy.jpg','2025-10-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Amrum',1269644,3.7205,7.2,'-izT0MKkvZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33249,_binary '\0','/zDn58IGLtNxDrEnEkO7JM814HiF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22507374',5.4,2523,'ko','보고타: 마지막 기회의 땅','After moving to Bogotá for a chance at a better life, a young Korean man rises through the Colombian black market — risking peril for a shot at success.','/p1WPGGPVHHVJwTjmUaCsbTNATgn.jpg','2024-12-31',109,'Released',NULL,'Bogotá: City of the Lost',636279,3.5184,6.975,'7UP25X3xRA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33250,_binary '\0','/mPSldLhM8Qwr034YkQOZHRdhsxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22507484',6.4,4025,'ko','타겟','Soo-hyun, who has recently moved into a new house, buys a used washing machine through a second-hand app but finds out it doesn’t work. Annoyed by the seller’s irresponsibility, she leaves a comment calling the seller a con man, and reports it to the police. Little does she know that the seller is a psychopathic serial killer who uses an online second-hand market to lure his victims. Her comment renders his hunt for a new victim all but impossible so she becomes his next target. She starts receiving obscene phone calls, countless unwanted food deliveries, and strange men knocking on her door looking for a good time. A trip to the sender’s address proves deadly serious when the police and Soo-hyun find a man’s dead body.','/kYmoJSypfpB9OnwvxebiV1nZUXi.jpg','2023-08-30',101,'Released','I bought an item online from a killer.','Don\'t Buy the Seller',813079,2.6189,6.8,'r7HIU9vx3KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33251,_binary '\0','/7S9LKhPn35NpfbT6668U0dMWOnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22507524',7.5,5188,'ko','서울의 봄','After the assassination of President Park, martial law has been declared. A coup d\'état bursts out by Defense Security Commander Chun Doo-gwang and a private band of officers following him. Capital Defense Commander Lee Tae-shin, an obstinate soldier who believes the military should not take political actions, fights against Chun Doo-gwang to stop him. The conflict between the two grows while military leaders are holding their decision and Defense Minister is gone. In the midst of chaos, the spring of Seoul that everyone longed for heads to unexpected direction.','/vy14tKxsbJYdDyFl6kQuVkK2s44.jpg','2023-11-22',142,'Released','The worst historical day in Korean democracy.','12.12: The Day',919207,5.9661,7.566,'22k35WtiAaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33252,_binary '\0','/8111id3VJF3nKZ5z3Rf1Pca3OvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2251281',5.6,12610,'en','Dark Was the Night','An evil is unleashed in a small town when a logging company sets up shop in the neighboring woods. Isolated and threatened, a mysterious force hidden within the trees outside the small town of Maiden Woods, strikes fear in the townspeople as Sheriff Paul Shields attempts to overcome the demons of his past while protecting those that he loves.','/xSC7sWXbafOCa24itOHTpKXwOAV.jpg','2014-10-17',97,'Released','Evil\'s Roots Run Deep','Dark Was the Night',300467,2.9351,5.6,'LeYJmGaMaSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33253,_binary '\0','/A3VQ3HJWuwGuD69IO9zlAobhnjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2251481',2.3,1694,'sv','Sean Banan inuti Seanfrika','Sean Banan travels to Africa and brings along pop diva Kikki Danielsson, also known as Kikki Dee, to shoot a music video. Something that should be very uncomplicated instead turns into a chaotic road trip.','/9q5VqEv0x6b2dOweOAxPwR5UKI2.jpg','2012-02-15',76,'Released','More fun than you can handle!','Sean Banan Inside Seanfrica',87072,1.4281,1,'Rv7pDaRxum0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33254,_binary '\0','/2TPh9687eCB5ZN3I8wx5MRWQvZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2251828',6.3,1281,'ru','Территория','It happened in the sixties, during the political thaw in the Soviet Union... but our story unfolds in the coldest terrain of the country. It was an unexplored and unbeaten terrain of boundless ice-field and forbidding rocks. This was the proper place for real men and real romantics. Our story is about the geologists prospecting gold in the Extreme North.','/2QYg5Uiyq6c6DSQxAtd8hRe5Sws.jpg','2015-04-16',170,'Released',NULL,'Territory',335724,1.1889,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33255,_binary '\0','/uIc0DZHBPNIGMcfQBmQro9vA6EM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2252552',3.6,2061,'en','Gutshot Straight','A professional poker player falls deep into underworld when he takes an unexpected wager from a mysterious high roller.','/lWtftwehOukt2YIrBqoUj0VplkW.jpg','2014-10-11',89,'Released','All debts will be paid.','Gutshot Straight',297702,3.2163,4.1,'BMdmhMtA08s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33256,_binary '\0','/eaT30NWuLZm1UirjuAtKQJeXqpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2252680',6.2,4788,'es','La gran familia española','Five siblings gather to celebrate a wedding at their family estate on the day Spain plays the final of the 2010 World Cup.','/zqAn7UYNLexx5EDxXoeV8CLpqtM.jpg','2013-09-13',101,'Released','Get ready for the match of your life.','Family United',215848,1.6602,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33257,_binary '\0','/vQrFlOLzuD0MeXiDfwsdO9GYhBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22527810',6.2,1664,'en','The 12 Days of Christmas Eve','When Brian Conway, a successful businessman whose family relationships have suffered, gets in a car accident on Christmas Eve, Santa gives him twelve chances to redo the day and repair the relationships in his life, including with his daughter Michelle.','/ozGEBpK6BtLoQhEM4WkGnqBmT0W.jpg','2022-11-26',88,'Released',NULL,'The 12 Days of Christmas Eve',1034168,2.2776,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33258,_binary '\0','/twrfK3Db0EW1WLpzT9pKjJGdHxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22528178',7.1,1645,'en','Kokomo City','Four Black transgender sex workers in Atlanta and New York City break down the walls of their profession.','/A6xJwNiO80OfA3YPwcJvtqWNgic.jpg','2023-07-28',73,'Released','Their bodies. Their business.','Kokomo City',1058678,1.4769,6.7,'JdM2voAE-ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33259,_binary '\0','/kYC6Z4XUvZ9JQKhrkvsif4bAJl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22528200',5.3,6253,'en','F Marry Kill','When true-crime junkie Eva Vaugh is shoved into the dating app world by her besties on her 30th birthday, she suddenly finds herself at the center of a real-life murder case. As new details about the murders are revealed on her favorite podcast, she realizes that one of the three men she’s dating could be the infamous \"Swipe Right Killer\" terrorizing the city.','/v7eHvzCoRFXhqt0XM2d8MQ1FBKa.jpg','2025-03-06',97,'Released','A dating movie with a killer twist.','F Marry Kill',1200801,4.7243,6.09,'9hxuNfoWNs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33260,_binary '\0','/6DXziVYOFVzARM182ywxnledL1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22530172',8,1505,'id','Budi Pekerti','A schoolteacher\'s reputation is at risk when a video of her speaking up against injustice goes viral on the internet and is misinterpreted.','/9nRxHuA966OxNszQIskZPOSDZU8.jpg','2023-11-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Andragogy',1057663,1.1939,8.4,'TLPEacYsEQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33261,_binary '\0','/5IfH9Itm2WAlfZTuXj5Q9lAS1jV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22530226',6.7,1807,'th','ผีใช้ได้ค่ะ','Worried about her husband being allergic to dust, Nat, a recently-dead woman, returns as a ghost possessing a vacuum cleaner to clean the house.','/ysCOASLn8SaiFYWZYqNLTdO97NQ.jpg','2025-08-27',130,'Released','Love sucks.','A Useful Ghost',1364904,3.1706,6.427,'IldRn0JAPUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33262,_binary '\0','/yoR3IxnS4C6YmTDQmCn9qs5Yy17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2253742',5.9,1848,'ko','R2B: 리턴 투 베이스','Tae-hun causes trouble for the his unit with his antics. He does not take much seriously until a dogfight leaves a pilot dead and another missing. Tae-hun and the other members of his unit launch a rescue mission to prevent a war from breaking out.','/wiKfRPoid8MJrrbH0VsrMxiMiSW.jpg','2012-08-15',113,'Released','Take the battle to the skies.','Soar Into the Sun',124294,2.2717,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33263,_binary '\0','/enC6nKHaL5LKniMCVm8Vdi34Q02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2253939',6.3,3099,'fr','Camille redouble','Camille was only sixteen and still in high school when she fell in love with Eric, another student. They later married and a child and were happy for a while. But now twenty-five years have passed and Eric leaves her for a younger woman. Bitter and desperate Camille drinks so much liquor at a New Year Eve\'s party that she falls into an ethylic coma and she finds herself... propelled into her own past! Camille is sixteen again when she wakes up this morning, her parents are not dead anymore and she must go to school, where she will meet her schoolmates and, of course, Eric. Is she going to fall for him again and... be miserable twenty-five years later? Or will she avoid him with the result never having her beloved daughter? Who ever said that time traveling was fun?','/fDYSELYsjhI7maKW3X71X3qB5BN.jpg','2012-09-12',115,'Released',NULL,'Camille Rewinds',135281,2.2517,6.144,'5BJoOGIY-U0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33264,_binary '\0','/eKoczeIloZZ0JACq8CqyfrdOKkb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22543124',5,4975,'hi','कुछ खट्टा हो जाए','Heer, a carefree and jovial guy is in love with Iraa, an aspiring IAS officer. Heer and Iraa\'s families are hell-bent on getting them married and start a family. To escape this familial pressure, Heer and Iraa decide to tie the knot as he promises her to support her aspirations. However, the chaos ensues when a misunderstanding leads both families to believe that the couple is expecting a child.','/t9R05SjYwdn2pzg3Pomm9SpqJFY.jpg','2024-02-16',125,'Released',NULL,'Kuch Khattaa Ho Jaay',1032706,1.0849,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33265,_binary '\0','/g9tiB40IJFsuiNsBMBybsbmPqDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22543326',7.4,11860,'ta','மாவீரன்','After a head injury, cowardly newspaper cartoonist Sathya hears a voice in his mind, foretells events and puts him in precarious situations and forces him to take on a corrupt politician.','/gl3AeCuuFDsjhN4rKKFQ9O8mzrC.jpg','2023-07-14',166,'Released',NULL,'Maaveeran',987895,1.7381,7.093,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33266,_binary '\0','/c1Sz6K8CKnKrwZV00EEId3EYg5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2255934',4.4,2246,'hi','अइय्या','Meenakshi, a Marathi gal with an ultra-sensitive sense of smell, lives her life in her dreams, dancing and enacting her favourite actresses Sridevi, Madhuri and Juhi. Not believing in arranged marriages, Meenakshi awaits her prince when she comes across Tamil artist Surya, to whom she is strangely attracted to.','/zXe9EPLUHbtoP8ItSpqd9jG7NlL.jpg','2012-10-12',146,'Released','Go Wakda','Aiyyaa',137180,1.663,4.688,'Hy6op7S1fCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33267,_binary '\0','/8TLYPA7CZ87Kfn5NoaYYhKWzl88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2256041',7.9,1648,'ar','إحنا بتوع الأتوبيس','Adel Imam and neighbour Abdel Moneim Madbouly are taken to a Police station after an altercation with a bus conductor. They are mistakenly arrested with a group of suspected terrorists and taken to a maximum security jail.','/1oPJ0rY7olDE92t6rEHSd2LWLNJ.jpg','1979-10-22',135,'Released',NULL,'We Are the Bus People',86601,1.0154,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33268,_binary '\0','/rRK2hnmxNdBpkJ9kFqWz0mu7qLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2256055',5.1,3733,'en','Witchboard','A cursed Witchboard awakens dark forces, dragging a young couple into a deadly game of possession, deception, and supernatural terror in New Orleans.','/8RcN5FHkJVNJdOaL6WtTePU7CyF.jpg','2025-08-14',113,'Released','Dare to play.','Witchboard',1107325,4.3128,5.547,'2_5wj2N0WUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33269,_binary '\0','/vzdRcDmn42ozv75udhZXlI0niBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2256677',5.9,1570,'nl','De verbouwing','Tessa opens her luxurious clinic with a big party. She is smart, beautiful, savvy, and happily married with an intelligent adolescent son. But appearances are deceptive. In reality, her marriage is falling apart, her house renovation is a disaster and the finances of her clinic are a mess. Desperate, she accepts the helping hand of a friend from the past who has turned up suddenly, but in doing so, opens herself up to an ordeal of terror and blackmail.','/cUI1MOuWhZVxhPQ4qBLFWXpMsjV.jpg','2012-09-06',106,'Released',NULL,'The Renovation',130293,1.4495,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33270,_binary '\0','/cDWX9YyCTZxAi6X2Wfok1pMqIqj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2256703',6.6,2557,'en','Hitched for the Holidays','A couple of single adults agree to pose as each others significant other throughout the holidays to keep their meddling families from harassing them, only to find that their feelings for each other are real.','/33r8ThAUjm8YurFIJDcWEpZHQcV.jpg','2012-11-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Hitched for the Holidays',145840,2.2631,6.4,'007kW0iURNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33271,_binary '\0','/cZto6nOS5aMWGoU3aVQLlKDqVuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2256749',4.7,2079,'sv','Mammas pojkar','Bröderna Hårdrock is a film about two brothers who are planning a heavy metal convention in their sleepy village. Their mother, the village priest, worries about them and wants them to settle down and have families. A young female teacher and line dance instructor in the village sets both their hearts beating faster and, unaware of each other\'s feelings, they enter a battle to win her affections.','/pmyy5z0X3IucMKHT86PCujv4OGd.jpg','2012-12-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Mammas pojkar',163590,1.2229,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33272,_binary '\0','/kb6eujZPrKxgwUaKYtqU4CjVtOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2257436',4,1363,'en','Hate Crime','A Jewish family, new to the neighborhood, are recording their youngest son\'s birthday celebrations on video when their home is suddenly invaded by a band of meth-head Neo-Nazis.','/6HBeLHp7FqGNyrGy5sZz1tLijGs.jpg','2012-10-15',72,'Released',NULL,'Hate Crime',172372,1.2264,3.6,'Kx2aKWLmU8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33273,_binary '\0','/rXqgPPqCTFAjvxHZg8PgJmqEUWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2257602',7.4,2404,'en','The Staircase II: The Last Chance','Explosive developments - implicating both the forensics laboratory of the police department of North Carolina, and Duane Deaver, its chief - shed new light on the case of murder suspect Michael Peterson.','/or255kBLL7GEa4525AW0wPuc9oW.jpg','2012-11-15',130,'Released',NULL,'The Staircase II: The Last Chance',156220,1.8648,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33274,_binary '\0','/A8HNdlZYm7hrdiD0Uufl6WpDnml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258239',6,1403,'ru','8 первых свиданий','Vera is a famous TV personality who wakes up with Nikita in bed after a hard day of partying. The next day, when she wakes up, the same thing happens.','/hbcy5IrykmZlZdtD0ZeCcloLjyA.jpg','2012-03-08',87,'Released',NULL,'8 First Dates',98581,1.231,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33275,_binary '\0','/kC7YmW69fEdM0cazeVIVdmj7644.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258281',7.5,14015,'ro','După dealuri','Alina returns to Romania from Germany, hoping to bring Voichita—the only person in the world she loves and was loved by—back with her. But Voichita has found God, and God is the hardest lover of all to best.','/zV2v5jFXlN2We3GS2IkGQ6e2Bmm.jpg','2012-10-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Hills',103740,2.3071,7.1,'R0X6wxxDAEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33276,_binary '\0','/6948QYLT3GVComQG4hbiNFF7VuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258285',5.7,2443,'en','La Voie de l‘ennemi','A convict is released from prison in a small town in New Mexico. 18 years ago he killed a deputy. The then-and-now sheriff seeks revenge.','/df8tTDXxd4wgDgaldnph2I0R2UB.jpg','2014-05-07',120,'Released',NULL,'Two Men in Town',254772,2.6741,5.5,'gex-6DMf8Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33277,_binary '\0','/fuCfQ0D2HtNa7kRLFDkPWl87Zs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258337',7.7,31040,'te','ఈగ','A passionate flower decorator, Nani, falls for his neighbor, Bindhu, but their budding romance takes an unexpected turn when he crosses paths with Sudeep, a ruthless and powerful businessman.','/pX7fn4EZrg2YFlV4GNMIfHDOQZ6.jpg','2012-07-05',145,'Released','The Ultimate Revenge Story.','Eega',148265,2.8922,7.1,'x-1ZoU1xB4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33278,_binary '\0','/cat9ansWgGKMpRJPgDWcoMbl0mx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258345',6.2,26361,'en','Fading Gigolo','Fioravante decides to become a professional Don Juan as a way of making money to help his cash-strapped friend, Murray. With Murray acting as his \"manager\", the duo quickly finds themselves caught up in the crosscurrents of love and money.','/bThnmRhh0d3oKcmte2w0aArm8Lq.jpg','2013-09-07',90,'Released',NULL,'Fading Gigolo',214030,4.5088,5.8,'DuKoub-Sy9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33279,_binary '\0','/wtReELsaSlFnWbJth4eTZkUcMVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2258465',6.6,2827,'ru','Мамы','Every year on the International Women’s Day telephone networks transfer millions of phone calls and SMS messages. The vast majority of phone calls are addressed to the most important women in lives of everyone - to our mothers. But what would it be if because of enormous number of calls telephone network breaks down? What would we do? Someone would wait until network is rebuilt and would congratulate his mom in the evening or even the next day. But others, like the heroes of our movie, would change their plans to congratulate their moms just today ... personally ... as a kid!..','/wvJ7gSX0lmfrMjmzh8p12a1b5ng.jpg','2012-03-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Mommies',99247,1.3202,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.00