ds his male cousin. Two former childhood friends reunite and start a relationship that gets complicated due to one of them’s fear of getting caught. A gay long lasting relationship is in jeopardy when a third man comes along. An old family man is obsessed with a young male prostitute and tries to raise the money to afford the experience.','/l5wf2Auk8ctiPQgtQ1PKZrd82Fr.jpg','2014-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'4 Moons',258034,2.233,7.3,'hcdfXVbGcXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33284,_binary '\0','/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261287',6.8,27208,'en','Ballerina','In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.','/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg','2016-12-14',89,'Released','Life\'s greatest adventures begin with a single leap.','Ballerina',342473,12.3583,7.211,'FsNJBRDbZBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33285,_binary '\0','/goccXjwwNyDhrwQiP77T71pfFb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261331',6.4,43350,'en','Black Sea','A rogue submarine captain pulls together a misfit crew to go after a sunken treasure rumored to be lost in the depths of the Black Sea. As greed and desperation take control on-board their claustrophobic vessel, the increasing uncertainty of the mission causes the men to turn on each other to fight for their own survival.','/oqOXFP35a2DjxjdpmEaOTIfI5TS.jpg','2014-12-05',115,'Released','Brave the deep. Find the gold. Trust no one.','Black Sea',246080,6.7633,6.268,'Urrve_J9F_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33286,_binary '\0','/qlLeTVyqdM1s7EWKEgYJ9jB455E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261434',6.3,2629,'it','Viaggio sola','Single and middle-aged, beautiful Irene is wholly devoted to her job as an inspector of luxury hotels. Constantly on the road, she indulges in expensive pleasures at impeccable resorts, but always incognito and alone, soon escaping to the next exotic destination with her checklist and laptop in tow. When her best friend and ex, Andrea, who has always been a source of emotional support, suddenly becomes unavailable, Irene is thrown into a deep existential crisis. \"Luxury is a form of deceit,\" she is told by a fellow traveller in the fog of a steam room, and thus begins Irene\'s quest to bring more meaning into her life.','/eh7igoV9Hf4KgH6Z1TfPeIX7FK4.jpg','2013-04-24',85,'Released','This is your journey. The path is up to you.','A Five Star Life',184992,1.4063,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33287,_binary '\0','/lwNbG531mocWm1kuluE8jd1Er6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261505',5.1,6443,'tr','Evim Sensin','After returning back to family, Leyla tries to fix everytihng while starting a new life wit Iskender. Everything goes smoothly until troubles find Leyla...','/iTcQK4nPROXM0S20WiBYV7OVu7y.jpg','2012-11-02',91,'Released',NULL,'You\'re My Home',141901,1.5257,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33288,_binary '\0','/xQeQmrRanxRLgjbXC9mMo33RmSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261719',5,1387,'ru','Джунгли','A comedy about funny adventures of the married couple on the remote island.','/gTDrZsWBnF75Z78wU5LnlaEY8BK.jpg','2012-11-29',80,'Released',NULL,'The Jungle',148347,3.1574,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33289,_binary '\0','/jmZqL9yJ9DYuwzUv5mQUK946sXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2261749',7.1,11005,'fr','La Cage Dorée','In the beautiful area of ​​Paris, Maria and José Ribeiro lived for almost thirty years on the ground floor of a Haussmann building, in their dear little lodge.','/rts29kBtuw1xAlNeWMFuZN4WZRe.jpg','2013-04-19',90,'Released',NULL,'The Gilded Cage',186161,2.3505,6.7,'2sxYb4jMrNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33290,_binary '\0','/uprETUBkI2seUT3nSxBDFfdcL9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262126',7.1,1933,'ta','கலகலப்பு','A man struggles to save his family-owned restaurant as it is running in loses. He soon falls for a health inspector keen on shutting down the place. When his brother enters the scene, things get worse.','/oTvh7AaE3YK7gVe07XrIlrGq7VI.jpg','2012-05-11',149,'Released','Masala Cafe','Kalakalappu',134702,1.0637,6.3,'QS0YgbeJ8E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33291,_binary '\0','/oMvovUVMe7HIvPsZxq23cBdLwZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262161',6.4,4280,'en','Sunset Song','The daughter of a Scottish farmer comes of age in the early 1900s.','/loBR4Qm16d0gtaCJ7T1gknMtK4f.jpg','2015-12-04',135,'Released',NULL,'Sunset Song',277713,1.8474,6.2,'sQqqkTdwv50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33292,_binary '\0','/6iIZqay1OnGXAeAvogitzWv3zkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262183',1.9,1235,'tr','SüperTürk','What makes a superhero? Of course, he flies and splits fruit or other objects in two with rays of light from his eyes. He cheats at gambling without anyone noticing, and his mother has lead poured and beads strung to protect him from the evil eye! Although his family manages to keep this super kid, SuperTurk, out of sight and hide his abilities for a long time, one day he is accidentally exposed. Now he has to shuttle between TV channels, doing monkey business for people...','/cAqzWi0jD4RNCl1pCPCZPKRylxb.jpg','2012-04-25',98,'Released',NULL,'SüperTürk',138725,1.4578,1.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33293,_binary '\0','/b0XkgWgCBurkCZdNXp7kEZdgxEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262227',7.2,85675,'en','The Book of Life','The journey of Manolo, a young man who is torn between fulfilling the expectations of his family and following his heart. Before choosing which path to follow, he embarks on an incredible adventure that spans fantastical worlds where he must face his greatest fears.','/aotTZos5KswgCryEzx2rlOjFsm1.jpg','2014-10-01',95,'Released','Two worlds. One love.','The Book of Life',228326,15.091,7.5,'_i69CJc1BgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33294,_binary '\0','/3CV0vEBSWPBjbgFCsz44HqDVx1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262270',6.1,1323,'en','Spud 2: The Madness Continues','The year is 1991, and Spud Milton\'s long walk to manhood is still creeping along at an unnervingly slow pace. Approaching the ripe old age of fifteen and still no signs of the much anticipated ball-drop, Spud is coming to terms with the fact that he may well be a freak of nature. With a mother hell-bent on emigrating, a father making a killing out of selling homemade moonshine, and a demented grandmother called Wombat, the new year seems to offer little except extreme embarrassment and more mortifying Milton madness. But Spud is returning to a boarding school where he is no longer the youngest or the smallest. His dormitory mates, known as the Crazy Eight, have an unusual new member and his house has a new clutch of first years (the Normal Seven). If Spud thinks his second year will be a breeze, however, he is seriously mistaken.','/5QGj83QNMD5SSP9OrmsdTOokSzw.jpg','2013-06-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Spud 2: The Madness Continues',200580,2.0894,6.9,'CkMirXFQf-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33295,_binary '\0','/9O34wbCIC84J23jo6jbNGPr4Ix9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262315',6.3,20297,'en','The Good Neighbor','Two high school filmmakers decide to create the illusion of a haunting on an unsuspecting neighbor.','/9FxUm0peyinMPv21uUmgGt92WOi.jpg','2016-09-16',98,'Released','You never know who\'s watching','The Good Neighbor',339994,3.8212,6.2,'wIXTB9wtqxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33296,_binary '\0','/5cJw0kJK6PxLLqsexTCbNL6B1R1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2262345',7.2,4405,'fr','Tout en haut du monde','In 1892 Saint Petersburg, when her explorer grandfather\'s failure to return from his latest expedition brings dishonour to her aristocratic family, a resilient teenager runs away to follow in his trail in search of 