pt to gain the trust of the Sheikh, Colin offers him a deal: if he manages to convince the owner to sell the champion pigeon, the sheikh will agree to do business with Colin\'s company. But when Colin meets Jos, the grumpy owner of the pigeon, and Isabella, his granddaughter, he realizes that this mission will not be as easy as he had hoped.','/sgzekfyPgfdNxNpFZVcXec9FzcY.jpg','2014-04-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Flying Home',261375,2.8048,5.9,'UE2bcads6SE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33332,_binary '\0','/qP5u5oUJZBr1isM6ro1D02cEGRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2273004',6.9,2131,'en','The Good Witch\'s Charm','Good Witch Cassie Nightingale is back to her bewitching ways, but this time she’s also juggling a newborn daughter and her job as town Mayor. With such a busy schedule she and her husband, town sheriff Jake Russell, aren’t getting much sleep. Hoping for a break, Cassie plans a much needed vacation with her new family. But things go awry when a crime wave sweeps through town and an investigative reporter tries to ruin Cassie’s image after a video of her magically disappearing turns up on the internet. To make matters worse, Cassie’s estranged foster mother appears in town and Cassie’s stepdaughter is suddenly accused of the recent robberies. Supported by her loyal family and friends, Cassie must rely on her signature charm to put a stop to the rumors before they completely destroy the town, and a Good Witch’s reputation!','/yXdG4mMNqUwurLgOfNzEdDsyyGO.jpg','2012-10-27',90,'Released','The Good Witch has her hands full juggling her new job as mayor while trying to spend quality time with her family.','The Good Witch\'s Charm',148656,1.8666,7.3,'DEWWEEiWnF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33333,_binary '\0','/x83yOAqnKBrlOfcDGkqGNUh6jfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2273024',6.9,1868,'en','The Good Witch\'s Destiny','As Cassie\'s birthday approaches, Lori discovers disturbing parallels between Cassie and her great aunt, who disappeared years before on her birthday. When signs of a curse appear, Cassie conjures up a little magic to make things right again.','/vLSvMMhVPhDDeFdugnWM7PvTV9x.jpg','2013-07-01',82,'Released',NULL,'The Good Witch\'s Destiny',638186,2.14,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33334,_binary '\0','/6Pq5k17JjKfBErKz42e7mkDlBZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2273657',6.3,76168,'en','True Story','A drama centered on the relationship between journalist Michael Finkel and Christian Longo, an FBI Most Wanted List murderer who for years lived outside the U.S. under Finkel\'s name.','/ncP8XQ0bXP0xSpJmMsRt8mUcEXd.jpg','2015-04-17',99,'Released','Some mysteries are beyond belief.','True Story',245706,5.8151,6.3,'MpaJIjlwgAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33335,_binary '\0','/qa3oDSDZSJKSdIdBgQgEAxO0N88.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22740896',6.6,53399,'en','People We Meet on Vacation','Poppy\'s a free spirit. Alex loves a plan. After years of summer vacations, these polar-opposite pals wonder if they could be a perfect romantic match.','/peG6482ALJQ9Tbvv2P38BquVk0f.jpg','2026-01-06',116,'Released','On vacation, you\'re free to follow your heart.','People We Meet on Vacation',1034716,10.0996,7,'m1C9DTOUH5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33336,_binary '\0','/uiEgyO6bFsNRt4CGd8VJwXcBnmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22741760',6.4,8730,'en','Your Monster','After her life falls apart, soft-spoken actress Laura Franco finds her voice again when she meets a terrifying, yet weirdly charming, monster living in her closet.','/nHlHRntqfDM0ORsfgPL28u4GiTT.jpg','2024-10-25',104,'Released','Love can be a beast.','Your Monster',1098378,3.6777,6.5,'PRbpP1i99YE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33337,_binary '\0','/7KJgU1ZN7k1YQtY14l6VsnODbeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22742070',6.2,2661,'zh','查無此心','When a mysterious corpse is found in a river, a distressed police officer delves into a string of grisly murders as danger quickly approaches.','/hsECYZeM4Vqm27GJoFC4Kzzy5jH.jpg','2023-09-08',104,'Released',NULL,'The Abandoned',1006763,2.3386,6.3,'GAJ9T7qBThc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33338,_binary '\0','/5QeF5B23hLWYZTChdzWayd5X5Ow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22742964',7,7927,'zh','關於我和鬼變成家人的那件事','After finding an odd envelope, Policeman Ming-han\'s life takes a spooky turn: He\'s now wed to a ghost husband, and they must solve a crime together.','/bmOaSOo5wB7cMDhhp6Msnd4IsLZ.jpg','2023-02-10',129,'Released','An unexpected marriage between two worlds.','Marry My Dead Body',983883,3.8847,7.1,'BCFyt7GkOmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33339,_binary '\0','/7FgUNLsVdOyiUlr4O8hCM5NDAeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22743064',4.9,13103,'hi','यारियाँ २','As three cousins embrace the warmth of a new city, they also face challenges that transform their lives.','/zcy8ZFwnzMhB32RaPArpj2XASP4.jpg','2023-10-20',150,'Released','Cousins by blood, friends by choice','Yaariyan 2',1001241,1.6225,4.4,'XRgVik3IsPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33340,_binary '\0','/xk7gyLrU2t7CRS1sFGR69QTzA9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2274570',5.7,8396,'en','Bad Milo!','A horror comedy centered on a guy who learns that his unusual stomach problems are being caused by a demon living in his intestines.','/1dmHunFILNXKzjOkl1A7IIsTI58.jpg','2013-08-28',84,'Released','Embrace your inner demon.','Bad Milo!',172828,3.51,5.7,'dknb76qw0Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33341,_binary '\0','/3J8mUvgQ8myBHZVlS5ZnXkTdh4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2274604',6.8,1488,'en','Eat With Me','When Emma moves in with her estranged, gay son, the pair must learn to reconnect through food where words fail, and face the foreclosure of the family’s Chinese restaurant and a stubborn fear of intimacy.','/nbG2sWh1RKcjhcTmC7OAfAVIIDp.jpg','2014-12-05',95,'Released','Live. Love. Eat.','Eat With Me',308418,1.4328,6.1,'io8SpIVzZys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33342,_binary '\0','/djiDKVB07xTy7tDFbWb9k7KLI3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2274648',5.3,108452,'en','Hellboy','Hellboy comes to England, where he must defeat Nimue, Merlin\'s consort and the Blood Queen. But their battle will bring about the end of the world, a fate he desperately tries to turn away.','/bk8LyaMqUtaQ9hUShuvFznQYQKR.jpg','2019-04-10',121,'Released','Demons have demons too.','Hellboy',456740,10.8533,5.578,'ZsBO4b3tyZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33343,_binary '\0','/oW6uu6QUEFtwgQqA1QL1XYKeCL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22751230',6.6,6545,'te','స్లమ్ డాగ్ హస్బెండ్','Lacchi, a happy-go-lucky mall-business man\'s proposed marriage with his lover Mounica gets into trouble when father of his first wife Baby, who happens to be a dog files a case in court against Lacchi demanding alimony.','/mmdZzRqg2vrlbc63sMJL5kz8HBk.jpg','2023-07-28',126,'Released',NULL,'Slum Dog Husband',1168772,0.9121,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33344,_binary '\0','/eur1aeBRVI8quipdANrcTwvSIDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275471',5.2,2277,'en','A Perfect Man','A philandering husband unknowingly falls back in love with his wife over the phone when she pretends to be another woman.','/ePbLUHHFIjm1qkne4ofesamoSLG.jpg','2013-11-01',95,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Man',228331,1.3105,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33345,_binary '\0','/gmqGmSx8sRi7XX9f39qF7FdDPUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275743',4.7,4335,'en','Berlin, I Love You','An anthology feature of 10 stories of romance set in the German capital.','/i9LdjJWgYIaOkvG7NtTcq5Ox4nO.jpg','2019-12-04',120,'Released','Love has a place.','Berlin, I Love You',401686,4.5786,4.8,'G-2Rmlx5BYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33346,_binary '\0','/ewI2f0gaavqHAVKNEXgvOUFW1yD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275794',4.9,4465,'hi','गोरी तेरे प्यार में','Sriram Venkat is the most shallow guy on earth who doesn\'t value relationships, family, friends, life or the country. Not necessarily in that order. Because he couldn\'t care less about the order. This makes him the clear \'black\' sheep of the family.','/icfBtvHEYI99OE8KYfLoEwMrm80.jpg','2013-11-22',150,'Released','Only love can bridge the gap...','Gori Tere Pyaar Mein',237305,1.6736,6.026,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33347,_binary '\0','/3WpyWUTp0kZxzmdQQTcQwSh3flO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275802',5.9,5605,'hi','सत्याग्रह','A corporate go-getter sees his priorities shift when a personal tragedy brings him face-to-face with political corruption.','/wJQh5a8KsnwajTqGzd4gt2akmQO.jpg','2013-08-30',152,'Released','The Revolution Has Begun!','Satyagraha',217446,1.4008,6.125,'1KXwGcZI13k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33348,_binary '\0','/7NoUjcNHgnehY4xtgiqWKiVUuAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275813',7.2,2851,'hr','Ljudožder vegetarijanac','Danko Babic is an ambitious and amoral gynaecologist at Croatia\'s leading fertility clinic. When his colleague Bantic is appointed as head of the clinic, Babic starts a secret war to overthrow his rival. Distracted by his ruthless campaign he makes series of fatal mistakes that result in the death of a patient. A crooked coroner and a corrupt police officer cover up his misdeeds, while Babic grows increasingly dependant on drugs and alcohol. He begins performing illegal abortions on prostitutes who work for Jedinko, a gangster who controls the local drug and sex trade.','/opq3sFgD6yCB31qsLznvGoSMq9C.jpg','2012-03-01',86,'Released',NULL,'The Vegetarian Cannibal',132551,1.4269,6.4,'0ChxPTlajCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33349,_binary '\0','/lsH3w02pstQiF2ayUhm8hJptnON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2275946',6.4,35056,'en','Redirected','Four friends become stranded in Eastern Europe and have to become hit men, prostitutes, corrupt cops, smugglers and more to make it home.','/kA6lnOcfyd5EnSqgv4dRwKYvvo4.jpg','2014-01-10',99,'Released','Right crime. Wrong country.','Redirected',190469,2.5971,5.843,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33350,_binary '\0','/gMivgcDVJmp8DTwMZ2YLhkJV09V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22767628',4.6,3428,'en','Blackwater Lane','An American school teacher in England drives past an abandoned car late one night, unaware that the driver was the victim of a murder. As she comes to terms with the realization, seemingly supernatural events start to affect the gothic manor she lives in with her husband.','/tdUFd56CFC0o6XoAkn4WRNHwqod.jpg','2024-06-21',108,'Released','There is a place where the supernatural is real.','Blackwater Lane',1215918,4.4677,6,'nwtUswJKRs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33351,_binary '\0','/38BmdeAQ1RVhZmc2a4JuejYa7pW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2276778',5.2,4766,'fr','Les Profs','With only 12 percent of its pupils obtaining their baccalaureate, Jules Ferry High School is the worst school in France. The Inspector of Schools has already exhausted all the conventional means to raise standards at the school and he has no choice but to take the advice of his deputy. It is a case of having to fight fire with fire: the worst pupils must be taught by the worst teachers...','/xAlhgy253GWiVbzUl2hdBV4e5qt.jpg','2013-04-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Serial Teachers',182219,0.1188,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33352,_binary '\0','/n9pwLwQ4ClAoGenTwkkunfK2onH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22769820',5.9,5859,'en','Legion of Super-Heroes','Kara, devastated by the loss of Krypton, struggles to adjust to her new life on Earth. Her cousin, Superman, mentors her and suggests she leave their space-time to attend the Legion Academy in the 31st century, where she makes new friends and a new enemy: Brainiac 5. Meanwhile, she must contend with a mysterious group called the Dark Circle as it searches for a