l Anthem','A 21-year old construction worker in rural New Mexico joins a community of queer ranchers and rodeo performers in search of their own version of the American dream.','/sUFTNOFBoJzCGu8c9XRJAy7G6xu.jpg','2024-07-12',99,'Released',NULL,'National Anthem',1082543,3.2823,6.6,'kFVhFkiQZVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33376,_binary '\0','/jyiS3eQFQzSNlY4TRIIkTSyI1ce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22804850',4.7,1958,'ar','من وراء الموج','Stranded on a deserted island, a family of four scavenges for survival as their past unravels, sending them into a downward spiral of painful events.','/paesE1W2WFqJEBNMFUszFVcuDsW.jpg','2024-12-07',98,'Released','This is my land. Our paradise. Hidden from everyone. It doesn\'t know we\'re here.','The Sand Castle',1185719,2.4426,5.673,'4D_mOyayGxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33377,_binary '\0','/dbtGinhWWKgQLQ0hjZHMFWxBJcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22805590',3,2374,'en','Black Noise','Members of an elite security team deployed to rescue a VIP on an exclusive island. The rescue mission becomes a desperate attempt to survive, escape the island and elude the sinister presence that seeks to harm them.','/snKpXexv5dtWqEKEmXrJtp8QGQC.jpg','2023-11-03',86,'Released','Within the light lies something dark.','Black Noise',1159518,2.3842,5.3,'eYdLTA6n8kA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33378,_binary '\0','/dUy9xPhGXE3aEEZR4nm0rMukNFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281002',5.4,1408,'ja','カルト','Three female idols appear on a television show to investigate an exorcism. An exorcist with psychic powers named Unsui claims that the show’s subjects, the Kaneda family, are cursed by a demon that’s too powerful for him to banish on his own, so he calls in a fellow exorcist to help. Soon, a reckless ghost hunter enters the fray as the three idols witness a series of terrifying events.','/j2acim7xoRErW4WmzFihmKE0pn8.jpg','2013-07-20',84,'Released',NULL,'Cult',225666,1.3348,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33379,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281065',6.2,2205,'fi','21 tapaa pilata avioliitto','The film follows Sanna, who sets out to document the countless ways there are to ruin a marriage for her doctoral thesis.','/xyqOob0l3b0P9EvjB6xeXjam94e.jpg','2013-02-08',93,'Released',NULL,'21 Ways to Ruin a Marriage',178806,1.5396,5.8,'rEqXhx8wEO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33380,_binary '\0','/3z0XnZwPoHqybzUchawX2JqTGyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281099',5.4,1984,'ar','امير البحار','A Naval Academy student falls hopelessly in love with a woman who only sees him as a friend until a risky voyage sets them on a different path.','/cnHZHFnRl4OYVwBK7xTcrieEYyD.jpg','2009-11-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Prince of the Seas',71309,1.3028,5.5,'mJwCH-9ptVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33381,_binary '\0','/8xvgP63h10tzaJLX6TAySKxfUk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281159',5.3,18002,'en','Contracted','A young woman contracts what she believes to be an STD—but it ends up being a far worse disease.','/3Be1XlwkmJ9CLBND35ww2Pg3Qs.jpg','2013-07-07',84,'Released','Not your average one night stand.','Contracted',204349,2.7576,5.3,'_t_uncP2XGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33382,_binary '\0','/94DsDDxQJ92zYsNSQDgob7xaRU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281309',6.8,1671,'ja','カノジョは嘘を愛しすぎてる','Set within music field, this film depicts a love story between a 25-year-old sound engineer and 16-year-old high school student Riko, who posessess a gifted voice. 25-year-old sound engineer Aki is a member of popular band \"Crude Play,\" but right after the band decides to make their major record debut Aki quits the band. But, Aki provides his music to Crude Play under the name of producer Soichiro. Aki begins to date Riko, whose father runs a fruit and vegetable shop. Riko doesn\'t know about Aki\'s background, but she likes to listen to him hum. Riko is in a band herself, with childhood friend Yuichi and Sota. One day she is scouted by producer Soichiro.','/fGzQtbiezYk7P6Lg7kYZIUpigkp.jpg','2013-12-14',117,'Released',NULL,'The Liar and His Lover',226208,2.2576,7.6,'YllBY-v-718','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33383,_binary '\0','/ksZTspehDCC4PCZN8ci31pFT6yp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22813112',6.3,1341,'ko','노량: 죽음의 바다','The Imjin War reaches its seventh year in December of 1598. Admiral Yi Sun-shin learns that the Wa invaders in Joseon are preparing for a swift withdrawal following the deathbed orders of their leader Toyotomi Hideyoshi. Determined to destroy the enemy once and for all, Admiral Yi leads an allied fleet of Joseon and Ming ships to mount a blockade and annihilate the Wa army. However, once Ming commander Chen Lin is bribed into lifting the blockade, Wa lord Shimazu Yoshihiro and his Satsuma army sail to the Wa army\'s rescue at Noryang Strait.','/sRvL19WMG883eFyfs3wBRxf6Vx0.jpg','2023-12-20',153,'Released','The long-awaited final clash.','Noryang: Deadly Sea',660360,2.9946,6.395,'HPRkiVU39I4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33384,_binary '\0','/uFdQiyy0kJyH4vUsYij0g2mi3nc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2281345',6.6,5746,'it','Magnifica presenza','An aspiring actor discovers that his spacious new apartment comes complete with eight friendly ghosts.','/jgkbT5b0TNGRoRdVAww7mVTlkOo.jpg','2012-03-16',105,'Released',NULL,'A Magnificent Haunting',97899,2.2974,6.433,'MUI3v9IfL1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33385,_binary '\0','/5Qtb47jSlBnzeOzIZqMmlRLV63Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22814692',6.2,1675,'en','Holiday Harmony','A likeable and talented underdog gets momentarily sidelined from chasing her musical dreams when her van breaks down in a welcoming small town just before Christmas.','/5lDOz2zlfiprRYKAWUJRkdSaWhl.jpg','2022-11-24',111,'Released','Let your voice lead you home.','Holiday Harmony',1028935,2