manager decides to enter local panchayat elections. Unexpectedly, his wife Omana, shocks everyone by filing for divorce, claiming that Mathew is gay.','/uPtqA6uwGqL19gXjzSlmQ31XFn.jpg','2023-11-23',112,'Released',NULL,'Kaathal - The Core',1029947,1.3425,7.109,'uc0kllY_Rgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33390,_binary '\0','/hP7snoME9lumckt7NpOMIZJDOmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2282016',5.7,14571,'en','The Possession of Michael King','Michael King asks occultists to summon all evil spirits to prove his point that they do not exist. But something goes wrong and he becomes a danger to everyone.','/r1LrvbUsQHn8ByJIOoeI76F6jR0.jpg','2014-08-14',83,'Released','If you invite it in, it will never let you go.','The Possession of Michael King',272692,4.4902,6.153,'dbUMYgKIvik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33391,_binary '\0','/ccOieCW1YkgOyBloPyAfJARDY0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2282719',5.7,1580,'en','Blue-Eyed Butcher','A woman appeared to have a fairy-tale life, but six years into her marriage, the fairytale crumbles when her husband is found buried in the backyard of their home with numerous stab wounds.','/sZqc88f6I7lLSEq7uRo8PbikW7G.jpg','2012-03-03',85,'Released','She did it 193 times.','Blue-Eyed Butcher',104593,2.392,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33392,_binary '\0','/5XaXMFgcecAzAtfOCu7WlHhQJRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22827888',5.7,1734,'en','Boot Camp','Unathletic Whitney Carmichael signs up for an intense summer boot camp to reinvent herself and falls for her personal trainer. She then finds the strength to embrace her true self and ignore the others\' expectations.','/nQ5q2QhlekcUFrU2fWXCGJMVHRO.jpg','2024-08-02',94,'Released','Love is worth the sweat','Boot Camp',1319504,5.7133,6.2,'ZtGFmDiNLiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33393,_binary '\0','/qjA0tZZ7LuxOsAQdahquVLUm6Ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2282829',1.5,1230,'pl','Kac Wawa','Andrew and Marta are about to get married. But on the stag night, Andrew finds himself drawn in to an evening of mischief. As the party kicks off, no one can anticipate the incredible and outrageous situations these guys are going to get into.','/hvAzDsCsFNHreuhgFEpNMJ4qfOz.jpg','2012-03-02',97,'Released','Poland\'s 3D answer to \'The Hangover\'!','Kac Wawa',97212,0.9766,2.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33394,_binary '\0','/uVulZOgJmNEqzdd1Q5I0OdNUkqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2282849',5.4,1878,'fr','Les Kaïra','3 childhood friends who have never left their hometown in the suburb try to get into porn as a way of earning easy money.','/cUW7NUzXJbvsZyM0LAAo5ftgov6.jpg','2012-07-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Porn in the Hood',123229,5.0642,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33395,_binary '\0','/pmhDcl2LhqtbO3nWLtNbIUqOFlo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2283017',6.6,1321,'ja','希望の国','An old couple, their only son, the son\'s wife, a young man and his lover live peacefully in a village. Then, a terrifying earthquake strikes that causes a nearby nuclear station to explode. The residents must evacuate, but the family lives on a farm, with only half of the area designated as an evacuation area.','/zL8FpQ1VpOPtfHg2Q174AIsDSVd.jpg','2012-10-20',133,'Released','What\'s life after a disaster?','The Land of Hope',110396,1.4425,6.1,'9Nnt6yFyPrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33396,_binary '\0','/2FYzxgLNuNVwncilzUeCGbOQzP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2283336',5.6,162732,'en','Men in Black: International','The Men in Black have always protected the Earth from the scum of the universe. In this new adventure, they tackle their biggest, most global threat to date: a mole in the Men in Black organization.','/dPrUPFcgLfNbmDL8V69vcrTyEfb.jpg','2019-06-12',115,'Released','The world\'s not going to save itself.','Men in Black: International',479455,13.7504,5.891,'40ghX7dNuKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33397,_binary '\0','/zZKmEmRDc7ZjFucPm2UGNgDRlDc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2283362',6.9,512067,'en','Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle','Four teenagers in detention discover an old video game console with a game they’ve never heard of. When they decide to play, they are immediately sucked into the jungle world of Jumanji in the bodies of their avatars. They’ll have to complete the adventure of their lives filled with fun, thrills and danger or be stuck in the game forever!','/pSgXKPU5h6U89ipF7HBYajvYt7j.jpg','2017-12-20',119,'Released','The game has evolved.','Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle',353486,16.8056,6.824,'10VphsyJhbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33398,_binary '\0','/kMUsTD4Dco26kkIUEhntbKZo0Ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2283748',8.1,72034,'hi','ओएमजी - ओ माय गॉड!','A shopkeeper takes God to court when his shop is destroyed by an earthquake.','/iTPzC3H2iG49xFIcMs01UfZeBXv.jpg','2012-09-28',125,'Released','A Divine Comedy.','OMG: Oh My God!',135718,2.2072,7.293,'eSfJ9NTE0OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33399,_binary '\0','/jw3TTogEmt9ydtaEERimwLttSIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2284766',6.8,3752,'en','Mary and Martha','Wealthy American housewife Mary Morgan takes her bullied son George out of school for home education,including a trip to Southern Africa. Whilst in Mozambique George is bitten by a mosquito which crawls through a hole in his net and dies of malaria. After his funeral at home Mary feels a compulsion to return to Africa where she meets English woman Martha O\'Connell,whose 24 year old son Ben, a teacher with voluntary service overseas,has also died of malaria. Ben gave his net to one of his pupils,believing adults cannot catch malaria. The two women are shocked to see the high death rate caused by the disease and,whilst Martha stays in Africa as a voluntary helper,Mary petitions the American government to change things. Martha turns up at Mary\'s house unannounced and,helped by Mary\'s ex-diplomat father,they address a senate committee on health spending,persuading them to do more to combat malaria. They meet with some success though a coda states that much more can be done.','/smDcAghsfl6mdMzRhy41MPikp0S.jpg','2013-03-01',90,'Released','Two mothers lose their sons to malaria.','Mary and Martha',176339,2.4131,6.3,'cLTqf1P2DjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33400,_binary '\0','/yjN54IGBAkQSr55ntraLdxBoJwr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22852560',6.9,2020,'de','Das Verschwinden des Josef Mengele','In the aftermath of the Second World War, Josef Mengele, the Nazi doctor at Auschwitz, escapes to South America to rebuild his life in hiding. Through the eyes of his son who finds him again, Mengele is confronted with a past he can no longer ignore. From Buenos Aires to Paraguay via Brazil, the man who became known as “The Angel of Death” will organize his methodical disappearance to avoid any form of trial.','/eFS1Aj5VjK6p7aVuqTcJIv4HSyU.jpg','2025-10-16',135,'Released',NULL,'The Disappearance of Josef Mengele',1037264,7.0345,6.643,'FFVFBwoyrZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33401,_binary '\0','/7eEVlWdYxh96ZV4PBeR1cOrzohe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22853444',8.2,1461,'en','Behind Closed Doors','Politically Exposed Persons (PEPs) are people who hold a public function and as a result, present higher risks of being involved in bribery or corruption. Offshore leaks have revealed repeatedly that PEPs use British finance and British offshore jurisdictions to launder their wealth, hide their wealth and re-invest it into the global financial system. London is the place where they buy property, where they take legal action against their critics and where they live when they fall from grace. But what happens when a developing country fights back and attempts to get Britain to return the money that it claims has been stolen? Watch Behind Closed Doors and find out.','/uXTZR5N4NWZJNsTfqoS7zyHpuFC.jpg','2023-05-22',64,'Released','A Film about corruption in high places and those that enable it','Behind Closed Doors',1130602,0.8843,9,'JUpgQZvrZKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33402,_binary '\0','/2XCmJWRZIQtHzikNsW29l9oy5Fb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22863968',4.1,6396,'en','Something in the Water','After lesbian couple Meg and Kayla split following a traumatic homophobic incident, their three friends are intent on mending the rift during the wedding of Lizzie at a paradise resort. But a pre-wedding boat excursion turns to disaster and the wedding breakfast is likely to be the five girls!','/tCA4O5CwZWLaryAGKQrbfvFbaWZ.jpg','2024-03-22',86,'Released','Fear finds new depths.','Something in the Water',804616,3.7127,5.566,'1G7f4M5o6W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33403,_binary '\0','/6e4M1qL4TN5mdP5LQVF6nIKdUJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22866358',5.7,8391,'en','The Book of Clarence','Streetwise but down-on-his-luck, Clarence is struggling to find a better life for his family, while fighting to free himself of debt. Captivated by the power and glory of the rising Messiah and His apostles, he risks everything to carve his own path to a divine life, and ultimately discovers that the redemptive power of belief may be his only way out.','/hZuq34U1dWuIIWgTa6wZNPeDinS.jpg','2024-01-11',129,'Released','How far would you go to prove you\'re not a nobody?','The Book of Clarence',976584,8.3702,5.849,'aTMqRPOqkGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33404,_binary '\0','/v0NEB75SZjxY8GS3ho8WeEvjIT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22868010',4,25420,'en','Return to Silent Hill','When James receives a mysterious letter from his lost love Mary, he is drawn to Silent Hill—a once-familiar town now consumed by darkness. As he searches for her, James faces monstrous creatures and unravels a terrifying truth that will push him to the edge of his sanity.','/mdw7bSnE11WpwWf3ViXtnavuqiT.jpg','2026-01-21',106,'Released','Guilt is a place you can never leave.','Return to Silent Hill',680493,22.8713,5.4,'WHz68ffYJ0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33405,_binary '\0','/sxgIHRBgmJgSt7jByEM1WUk2bJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22868842',7,1875,'ja','かがみの孤城','Shy outcast Kokoro has been avoiding school for weeks when she discovers a portal in her bedroom mirror. She reaches through and finds herself transported to an enchanting castle where she is joined by six other students. When a girl in a wolf mask explains that they have been invited to play a game, the teens must work together to uncover the mysterious connection that unites them. However, anyone who breaks the rules will be eaten by a wolf.','/cPV2etoFUkgQLWqKduWxXAeP4Oe.jpg','2022-12-23',116,'Released','You don\'t have to be alone anymore.','Lonely Castle in the Mirror',942881,3.8617,7.1,'J7TBaUBCCOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33406,_binary '\0','/rogeBJK44LtWynOqzMFmEF30T80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22868844',7.4,10262,'ja','映画 ブラッククローバー 魔法帝の剣','As a lionhearted boy who can\'t wield magic strives for the title of Wizard King, four banished Wizard Kings of yore return to crush the Clover Kingdom.','/9YEGawvjaRgnyW6QVcUhFJPFDco.jpg','2023-06-16',113,'Released','When the legend revives... The kingdom will fall.','Black Clover: Sword of the Wizard King',812225,16.7314,8.1,'M-JD8QqStBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33407,_binary '\0','/xzwNTmJzCxn4gBpAsV9o2Krkx0C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22869490',4.7,6662,'hi','जीतेगा: तो जिएगा!','It follows the journey of a man from the slums of Mumbai to the world of extreme underground sports.','/tmrjo8M4rm6NhkBKk20wDSj91go.jpg','2024-02-23',154,'Released','Win to live','Crakk: Jeetega... Toh Jiyegaa',1215938,1.7651,5.273,'eziuN4OCRCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33408,_binary '\0','/YIuw3ZjNbEGVKLXKSr6nM4yPYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2286990',6