 a fleshy growth on his forehead who helped save a village from a frightening army of steampunk soldiers bearing strange machines with the knowledge of Tai Chi that they entrusted him with.','/d9eIaUQY6NO3qP7wgTW8ORjaBMb.jpg','2012-10-25',100,'Released','The Throwdown Continues','Tai Chi Hero',149085,3.5284,6.068,'nhL9eJoogJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33464,_binary '\0','/t6empYIEGXHxuUtW1swUoPZLNlt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22964884',7,5072,'es','Upon Entry (La llegada)','Diego, a Venezuelan urbanist, and Elena, a contemporary dancer from Barcelona, move to the United States with their approved visas to start a new life. Their intention is to boost their professional careers and start a family in \'the land of opportunities\'. But upon entering New York airport\'s immigration area, they are taken to the secondary inspection room, where border officers will subject them to an unpleasant inspection process and a psychologically grueling interrogation.','/lpIoYLy0S3wIOKU8qbyYGa9Wg4h.jpg','2023-06-16',77,'Released','To enter the \"Land of Opportunities\" you must tell the truths...','Upon Entry',1051547,2.6597,6.7,'B9dFvX8_1eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33465,_binary '\0','/yrKCdBZWCJzif7PbxdpLr9fdfwC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2296697',5.6,6077,'en','Concussion','After a blow to the head, Abby decides she can\'t do it anymore. Her life just can\'t be only about the house, the kids and the wife. She needs more: she needs to be Eleanor.','/uib2Khi2wynz9BEAoUBIvEE64vB.jpg','2013-01-17',96,'Released','Wife. Mother. Escort.','Concussion',156965,2.9432,5.2,'Tme7d_YGS9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33466,_binary '\0','/kjTuxh0azwQEAsCmjFLsdRSs7wZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2296709',5.8,1528,'pt','De Pernas pro Ar 2','Alice owns a network of sex shops and workaholic who, in trying to reconcile the harsh routine of work and family life, suffers nervous breakdown, she is forced by her husband to go to spa. Precisely at this time, appears unique opportunity to expand its business in New York. Using fun gimmicks, risks his health, leaves spa party there with family to ride, but actually in order to facilitate their professional interests. In trying to reconcile the agendas, engage in hilarious situations and mistakes that culminate in the possible separation of the couple.','/9Qd8MSJLAtDHMiPrZ3kgHW63DIc.jpg','2012-12-28',98,'Released','Ela quer conquistar o mundo. E vai fazer isso com muito prazer.','Head Over Heels 2',161908,1.1741,6.3,'R_SIB4xLAzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33467,_binary '\0','/ucdkgxumpc0VgC66NUU9kysFvkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2296747',6.7,1365,'fr','En mai, fais ce qu\'il te plaît','In may 1940, the German troops enter France. Frightened by the progress of the enemy, the people of a small village of Pas-de-Calais decide on the recommendations of the prefecture, to give up everything to go on the road, fleeing to the coast.','/m6JB1I384GtMcD04z6Rpzt3fF9M.jpg','2015-11-04',114,'Released',NULL,'Come What May',351192,2.0675,6.3,'UqjPgUTyQhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33468,_binary '\0','/jVUR1W6cq8VuT4A6N4fd2yDNhji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2296777',5.3,15957,'en','Sherlock Gnomes','Garden gnomes Gnomeo & Juliet recruit renown detective Sherlock Gnomes to investigate the mysterious disappearance of other garden ornaments.','/wqnzpJR3PwS4doVkAkt9seSEpoX.jpg','2018-03-15',86,'Released','They\'re on a mission to bring every gnome home.','Sherlock Gnomes',370567,6.9591,5.7,'comz38kRsb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33469,_binary '\0','/j6KrMlP36bXxQteJGT61Aw5BZaM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2296909',7.9,2023,'en','Pink Floyd: The Story of Wish You Were Here','Wish You Were Here, released in September 1975, was the follow up album to the globally successful The Dark Side Of The Moon and is cited by many fans, as well as band members Richard Wright and David Gilmour, as their favorite Pink Floyd album. On release it went straight to Number One in both the UK and the US and topped the charts in many other countries around the world. This program tells the story of the making of this landmark release through new interviews with Roger Waters, David Gilmour and Nick Mason and archive interviews with the late Richard Wright. Also featured are sleeve designer Storm Thorgerson, guest vocalist Roy Harper, front cover burning man Ronnie Rondell and others involved in the creation of the album. In addition, original recording engineer Brian Humphries revisits the master tapes at Abbey Road Studios to illustrate aspects of the songs construction.','/yNoWIRIh3VQPMEEYpQnGSmyJk3F.jpg','2012-06-26',59,'Released',NULL,'Pink Floyd: The Story of Wish You Were Here',116835,1.4637,7.3,'6iQVeSMgCSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33470,_binary '\0','/jAFlUub0Ydw4M9q3QQYyB9ij7fi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2297031',7.6,1458,'en','TimeScapes','Stunning slow-motion and timelapse cinematography of the landscapes, people and wildlife of the American South West.','/oYrzAEzV5rBI9seDzI0INUrx8oz.jpg','2012-06-01',52,'Released','From the astronomy photographer of the year.','TimeScapes',112162,1.2895,7.2,'e-GYrbecb88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33471,_binary '\0','/vlLl83vy8ZFMbAqCOprt90Vv6SX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2297063',5.8,1860,'en','Whitewash','In the harsh, wintry woods of rural Quebec, Bruce (Thomas Haden Church), a down-on-his-luck snowplow operator, accidentally kills a man during a drunken night joyride. Stricken with panic, he hides the body and takes to the deep wilderness in hopes of outrunning both the authorities and his own conscience. But as both begin to close in, Bruce falls apart mentally and morally and mysteries unravel to reveal who he was before the accident, the truth behind his victim, and the circumstances that brought them together in a single moment.','/nvJbgIDbE5feJHFox9BVpaZMWgf.jpg','2013-04-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Whitewash',174344,1.2234,5.9,'Dp56QGUddDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33472,_binary '\0','/icF61XJqeJChGyHvFMs93q3Da6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2297108',3.8,1384,'en','100 Ghost Street: The Return of Richard Speck','A group of paranormal investigators sojourned to the Chicago walk-up where deranged drifter Richard Speck systematically slew eight student nurses back in ’66, looking for restless spirits. Their unfortunate success gets shockingly documented in this fear-filled found-footage foray featuring a bright young cast.','/7yplFwlgtpsi44sz4HHbn1CtcyH.jpg','2012-07-24',84,'Released','45 years after the massacre, paranormal investigators search for America\'s most notorious mass murderer.','100 Ghost Street: The Return of Richard Speck',122326,1.2686,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33473,_binary '\0','/2VbPypoIBkomTTs7tBsp4uMaxrp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2297164',5.8,3718,'ko','인류멸망보고서','In \'A Brave New World\', a virus brings the city to ruins and zombies flood the streets of Seoul. In \'The Heavenly Creature\', a robot reaches enlightenment while working at a temple, but its creators deem this phenomenon a threat to mankind. In the final segment, \'Happy Birthday\', a young girl logs onto a strange website and places an order for a new billiard ball for her father. Soon afterwards a meteor heads toward Earth and people flee to underground bomb shelters.','/1HQBqpGtsN8f65kzHoZhLKbMchr.jpg','2012-04-11',113,'Released',NULL,'Doomsday Book',118624,2.4689,6.165,'9GGfa0EybCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33474,_binary '\0','/mOzQklElA7ZBg3dSniCG7Npot7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2298384',6.3,5479,'fr','Amour & turbulences','Antoine is a lawyer living in New York. On his way back to France for the final round of a job interview, Antoine finds himself sitting right next to his ex-girlfriend Julie. With a seven-hour flight ahead of them, they are going to have to speak to each other.','/46jTvszYJJMRXWQV8YISrJVUUi8.jpg','2013-04-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Love Is in the Air',168055,3.0017,5.955,'5CpZHYl9kro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33475,_binary '\0','/jHkiI2z2AyyFuF4tLp8o9nIBbNz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2298394',4.1,1998,'en','Free the Nipple','An army of passionate women launch a revolution to \"Free the Nipple\" and decriminalize the female body. Based on a true story, this mass movement of topless women, armed with First Amendment lawyers, graffiti installations and national publicity stunts, invade New York City to protest the backwards censorship laws in the USA.','/3kcDr7Ku97xyZMg6QUo328r54UR.jpg','2014-12-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Free the Nipple',295698,2.249,4.5,'eX8czRjkaBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33476,_binary '\0','/eJWf8MTRmDVgUk6koy9Fg58yPNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2298416',6.7,1932,'fr','Suzanne','The story of a family and a love affair told through the journey of a young woman called Suzanne.','/ewDCuvoKKDrX0I8S4DkPDIULjb1.jpg','2013-12-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Suzanne',190853,1.2329,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33477,_binary '\0','/zMGOItxIcvWkJztncbQPdbtliUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22987820',6.6,3754,'te','(టిల్లు)²','Balagangadhar Tilak, also known as Tillu, is rebounding from the heartbreak inflicted by Radhika. He returns to what he excels at: being a DJ, embodying a flamboyant lifestyle, and managing the Tillu Events company with his family and friends. He becomes the center of attraction at every gathering. Just when life seems favorable, Lilly enters his life, captivating him completely. But who is Lilly? Is she akin to Radhika, or is there more to her than meets the eye?','/unRseguQgs9YQbzSHTZKIE3qXa7.jpg','2024-03-29',123,'Released',NULL,'(Tillu)²',1039482,1.0934,6.361,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33478,_binary '\0','/q4xFY1rQ5xea59ulQXGA9D0Q8CE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2298820',6.8,1527,'fr','La cinquième saison','Villagers find their situation growing increasingly desperate when their community becomes engulfed in an endless winter.','/rwFrOzPC43J8mDJ3RSzQ9bVz330.jpg','2012-09-03',93,'Released',NULL,'The Fifth Season',123366,1.214,5.962,'5_hj5-dIHDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33479,_binary '\0','/nTzvTiyS1rPOMLSwwMUTMefzp0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt22988228',8.2,1277,'pt','Racionais: Das Ruas de São Paulo Pro Mundo','Armed with music and a message, influential hip-hop group Racionais MC\'s turned their street poetry into a powerful movement in Brazil and beyond.','/wuAti3pkylfx0EyhfRUPpxK6Xkm.jpg','2022-10-20',116,'Released',NULL,'Racionais MC\'s: From the Streets of São Paulo',1033303,1.5355,8.331,'DqSdAgyF41k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33480,_binary '\0','/nsNn4mgNn8EO5g9YnS0FIwzaweI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2299206',5.4,4452,'de','Blutgletscher','At a climate research station in the Alps, the scientists are stunned as the nearby melting glacier is leaking a red liquid. It quickly turns to be very special juice — with unexpected genetic effects on the local wildlife.','/b3TD8k4Jd7ah1Hasre8LZR3FpUD.jpg','2013-09-27',98,'Released','Terror has Evolved!','Blood Glacier',210913,2.022,5.7,'5Rq8smYm268','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33481,_binary '\0','/8t2wI3IZVWucJaULiYLlWTrQ6bS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2299248',6.7,2481,'en','Killing Lincoln','April 14, 1865. One gunshot. One assassin hell-bent on killing a tyrant, as he charged the 16th President of the United States. And in one moment, our nation was forever changed. This is the most dramatic and resonant crime in American history—the true story of the killing of Abraham Lincoln.','/zqlOXMsJ0sSyForOe93BSfNW3Pi.jpg','2013-02-16',89,'Released',NULL,'Killing Lincoln',170039,2.3568,6,'QjBUP00iQ8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33482,_binary '\0','/pMECH54FSKApJJuwNYmwodtaFEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2299368',4.3,1277,'en','A Fairly Odd Christmas','After Timmy Turner causes Santa amnesia he must become the new Santa in order to save Christmas.','/a3ipMyRyXv5WKUXxYWNNqkeHTEO.jpg','2013-11-12',65,'Released',NULL,'A Fairly Odd Christmas',146712,2.8186,5.1,'mbpHTSETZ6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33483,_binary '\0','/iOmGHgU3qhCMTBcf73m528risb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2299842',7.1,16882,'ko','피에타','A loan shark is forced to reconsider his violent lifestyle after the arrival of a mysterious woman claiming to be his long-lost mother.','/cI9SXHxBsEF0cgUTZKDDaPC0ozT.jpg','2012-09-06',104,'Released','The truth of the heart is born only from sacrifice.','Pieta',123377,2.9241,7,'oIBZ1ACd0SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33484,_binary '\0','/o2iN9n2ShVqobqnYR0odM6yIlgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2300975',5.4,27463,'en','Jessabelle','A young woman recuperating at her father\'s run-down home after a tragic accident soon encounters a terrifying presence with a connection to her long-deceased mother.','/9WP1ADKCeDG0avA0WSo4mUemTqW.jpg','2014-11-07',90,'Released','The dead are back for life.','Jessabelle',203834,4.0473,5.4,'CoBCEdt_BC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33485,_binary '\0','/s0QGV8uJM0vX1GP8KjO8PCu5iNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2301147',5.5,1313,'en','Sex After Kids','A disparate variety of couples from all walks of life strive to maintain active sex lives despite the notable distraction of having kids.','/gkTQGJj0350QMwb58BzJnZAVP7u.jpg','2013-01-26',105,'Released','By Any Means Necessary','Sex After Kids',251266,1.9438,5.5,'6zYHImalNN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33486,_binary '\0','/zt7Ry3fEvcb24jpB3aojOPESK33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2301155',6.1,8696,'hi','शूटआऊट ऍट वडाला','The first-ever registered encounter by the Mumbai Police, which took place on November 1, 1982.','/qFcNJCXd2G18ngq4rFq601MbqbZ.jpg','2013-05-03',150,'Released',NULL,'Shootout at Wadala',188640,0.0782,5.478,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33487,_binary '\0','/vcZg3tjspOOIKlDQGfXZtxOqrBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2301592',7.4,10053,'es','La danza de la realidad','\'Having broken away from my illusory self, I was desperately seeking a path and a meaning to life.\' This phrase perfectly sums up Alejandro Jodorowsky’s biographical project: reconstituting the incredible adventure of his life. He was born in 1929 Tocopilla, a coastal town on edge of the Chilean desert, where he discovered the fundamentals of reality, as he underwent an unhappy and alienated childhood as part of an uprooted family.','/2qbsG9t943DciYTHITISzXQltqt.jpg','2013-06-19',130,'Released',NULL,'The Dance of Reality',137698,1.9596,7.2,'GMM5tZOsr3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33488,_binary '\0','/sNOWphqcNsq7aKw1LSKcP672gwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt23018924',6.5,7303,'ta','தங்கலான்','During the British rule, Thangalaan, a fierce tribal leader, and his tribe assist Lord Clement, a British General, to trace gold in their village. While searching for the gold, the villagers earn the wrath of Aarathi, an apparent sorceress, who Thangalaan sets out to stop with all his might.','/dAci50FwevkdWIUzQWpdz7kSKHe.jpg','2024-08-15',156,'Released','Son of Gold','Thangalaan',910784,1.893,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33489,_binary '\0','/gdTZxKZ0KspO5zLIi9LPxWB3DjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2301900',3.9,1693,'en','Puppet Master X: Axis Rising','After foiling a plan to blow up an American arms plant, Danny and Beth quickly find that one of Toulon\'s puppets has been kidnapped by the Nazis, and his life-giving serum has been synthesized to create a master race of unstoppable soldiers.','/aRKkCKwPCrXe3mZdCgLZnWy6wCn.jpg','2012-09-15',