the property. Can Bhupati Ray and Manohar succeed in selling it?','/84yy5xjv3sM8G2HbxUnKejKJgYz.jpg','2022-10-25',136,'Released',NULL,'Ballabhpurer Roopkotha',921935,0.8464,8.5,'NER2p1UmdAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33493,_binary '\0','/1CbExVP0bgrTshP7DvnDdwqryYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt23026954',5.5,1604,'en','Monster High 2','As they enter sophomore year at Monster High, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and Frankie Stein face new students, new powers, and an even bigger threat that could not only tear their friendship apart but could change the world forever.','/9RaCErx1ofEBiUsifGFaA6F6rKt.jpg','2023-10-05',94,'Released','Where being different is your greatest power.','Monster High 2',1039960,3.6767,6.7,'Mz_VxktIEaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33494,_binary '\0','/mjYU7EwVeOtM39ArdWHZk78VhYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2302755',6.5,308991,'en','Olympus Has Fallen','When the White House (Secret Service Code: \"Olympus\") is captured by a terrorist mastermind and the President is kidnapped, disgraced former Presidential guard Mike Banning finds himself trapped within the building. As the national security team scrambles to respond, they are forced to rely on Banning\'s inside knowledge to help retake the White House, save the President and avert an even bigger disaster.','/u3GTFGwesNBNd0t1hiLaEk1iqZU.jpg','2013-03-20',120,'Released','When our flag falls our nation will rise.','Olympus Has Fallen',117263,17.0094,6.418,'74F_pts7Uhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000'),(33495,_binary '\0','/t5TR3aeVPeCFq8VqykuHm0gl2Rs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:08.000000','tt2302966',7.4,25940,'ta','ஐ','A deformed hunchback kidnaps a bride and holds her hostage while his connection to her and his targets is revealed in a series of flashbacks that unfold as he starts seeking revenge.','/pZioBfNL0BHl8JZ6P9ddqBNnFuj.jpg','2015-01-04',170,'Released',NULL,'I',263471,2.1181,6.7,'8uPK9Ov6Zd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026