y, maybe he\'ll see his son again.','/myS41ZUmFvslkT8LeD2irAKxyrf.jpg','2024-07-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Largo Winch: The Price of Money',1000075,4.0262,5.8,'8bgZE7IJRM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33511,_binary '\0','/pXRAVmgcYnXGq6PAF7Hfe5P7QJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2304933',5.2,127696,'en','The 5th Wave','16-year-old Cassie Sullivan tries to survive in a world devastated by the waves of an alien invasion that has already decimated the population and knocked mankind back to the Stone Age.','/4Dd79cz5qxKNoKWg1xsfrpOchEr.jpg','2016-01-14',112,'Released','Protect your own.','The 5th Wave',299687,14.8803,5.9,'JDJj9X0ZAsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33512,_binary '\0','/xBAgzFMlbqvvhelo4lckeBdbCwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2304953',5.7,21663,'en','Reasonable Doubt','When up-and-coming District Attorney Mitch Brockden commits a fatal hit-and-run, he feels compelled to throw the case against the accused criminal who was found with the body and blamed for the crime. Following the trial, Mitch\'s worst fears come true when he realizes that he acquitted a guilty man, and he soon finds himself on the hunt for the killer before more victims pile up.','/n0BUpxa6E8PYoZWbx5g6CxbdalX.jpg','2014-01-17',91,'Released','Proof is the Burden','Reasonable Doubt',240916,5.6639,5.8,'TKweGDinS7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33513,_binary '\0','/wlP3Sjw5WVvjsi2CGFp84QwrZZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2305051',7.1,147472,'en','Wild','A woman with a tragic past decides to start her new life by hiking for one thousand miles on the Pacific Crest Trail.','/ohhWI4Xwf4m4HjbQiIkyAhLekUy.jpg','2014-12-05',115,'Released','Based on the inspirational best seller.','Wild',228970,8.8137,7,'xOPl8gKdmYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33514,_binary '\0','/q8cXWpngGo5rYz2lkGJc5GiKcmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23052532',6.6,6587,'ta','மார்க் ஆண்டனி','Set in 1995, Mark, a skilled mechanic and the son of a former gangster, stumbles upon a phone that has the ability to connect with the past, tries to save his estranged mother from a grim fate. While facing his own family\'s legacy, Mark must navigate through dangerous consequences of altering the past, as it causes unforeseen repercussions in the present.','/3xz1lfMrFlNtZ4H8DQKvYog8ilR.jpg','2023-09-15',151,'Released',NULL,'Mark Antony',922087,1.6543,5.941,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33515,_binary '\0','/kmLssINCNdXnIDjWkBsk6LUNSbe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23055660',6.9,24692,'en','Nickel Boys','Chronicles the powerful friendship between two young Black teenagers navigating the harrowing trials of reform school together in Florida.','/lu2vmmtStmTNMmSZl2LgrrQpLZo.jpg','2024-12-13',140,'Released',NULL,'Nickel Boys',1028196,8.9562,6.6,'-2qZ429rUZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33516,_binary '\0','/zrIE7qg61W2KEwDRCW83VtkhSeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23060698',5.6,28262,'en','Clown in a Cornfield','Quinn and her father have just moved to the quiet town of Kettle Springs hoping for a fresh start. Instead, she discovers a fractured community that has fallen on hard times after the treasured Baypen Corn Syrup Factory burned down. As the locals bicker amongst themselves and tensions boil over, a sinister, grinning figure emerges from the cornfields to cleanse the town of its burdens, one bloody victim at a time.','/6ep6gw90TJ8bYvJC6hEDo8SxjoJ.jpg','2025-05-02',96,'Released','Are you a friend of Frendo?','Clown in a Cornfield',713364,11.6876,6.1,'8tBSOKyyZT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33517,_binary '\0','/cA5ug5RlU5rcDJtwsrwjIyjqrQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23060796',5.5,7702,'en','There\'s Something in the Barn','An American family fulfills their dream of moving back to their roots after inheriting a remote cabin in the mountains of Norway. But there\'s a surprise waiting for them.','/4NdUPvCk8S4