0',5.8,63216,'en','Immaculate','An American nun embarks on a new journey when she joins a remote convent in the Italian countryside. However, her warm welcome quickly turns into a living nightmare when she discovers her new home harbours a sinister secret and unspeakable horrors.','/zyopv7D5j7cfswG0NYiA14qAdPC.jpg','2024-03-20',89,'Released','Not every intervention is divine.','Immaculate',1041613,12.341,6.201,'11gb7q1tosI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33549,_binary '\0','/9MXZo7uROqNbMBTrQG9tplfKFn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2313780',2,1797,'en','12/12/12','When baby Sebastian is born on 12/12/12 everyone around him starts to die. Soon, his mother realizes that her son is the spawn of Hell.','/oubHb1teqWP69qUJZbjHAEZvyJp.jpg','2012-12-04',85,'Released','The end of the world begins with it','12/12/12',147879,1.839,3.1,'PU8RuOlxA0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33550,_binary '\0','/FUnAVgaTs5xZWXcVzPJNxd9qGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23137904',5.4,65006,'en','Rebel Moon - Part Two: The Scargiver','The rebels gear up for battle against the ruthless forces of the Motherworld as unbreakable bonds are forged, heroes emerge — and legends are made.','/95gnJZIk2rEkMO0Ch46x5CVjnms.jpg','2024-04-19',121,'Released','Protect each other and show them no mercy!','Rebel Moon - Part Two: The Scargiver',934632,11.5589,6.045,'UEJuNHOd8Dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33551,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23144080',6.2,2392,'pa','Maujaan Hi Maujaan','Three brothers Guri, Inder and Jassi, live in London along with their sister Aman and run a cafe. Guri is deaf, Inder is blind and Jassi is mute. One day Guri falls for a girl, Reet. Will they overcome all the challenges and have a happy ending?','/1lHyLXC3EhgUVDAVUMrQDpoeZDS.jpg','2023-10-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Maujaan Hi Maujaan',1156129,1.0741,0,'kslt19LEJQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33552,_binary '\0','/9GzQ4bT6gdeq4fKMrzpJLwx40sI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23146644',4.2,3367,'en','Latency','When professional gamer Hana, who suffers from acute agoraphobia, receives new equipment that enhances her game, she begins to wonder if it is reading her mind – or controlling it.','/yNBDVUFmvgCgxzpEl5ZJ9TUSc8t.jpg','2024-06-14',94,'Released','Fear is reality','Latency',1042657,2.8246,5.6,'UloUAqsi96o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33553,_binary '\0','/ahyExEzUyhy5PZn1jqsHgXi0atx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23147592',5.7,1382,'en','Wait with Me','When romance novelist Kate Smith suddenly gets writer\'s block as she\'s beginning the final installment of her international bestselling steamy Bed \'n Breakfast series, she\'ll do pretty much anything to get her groove back. Like sneak into a Tire Depot waiting room because her words flow there just like complimentary coffee-smooth, sweet, and scorchingly hot. She manages to fly under the radar until the rugged and charming mechanic, Miles Hudson, notices the quirky redhead slinking in and out of the employees only entrance. But she\'s way too intriguing to blow the whistle on. Doing a test-drive of her new book idea sounds like a much better option.','/34cgjVoAIXVsZ2uZkTsdxWhv2Si.jpg','2023-03-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Wait with Me',1046043,1.6578,6.8,'QhAxLK4lz0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33554,_binary '\0','/odjVFoEy7Qyko2qooWDbT5OuLUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2314824',4.4,13037,'en','Behaving Badly','Teenager Rick Stevens is willing to do whatever it takes to win the heart of Nina Pennington. He\'ll have to deal with his best friend\'s horny mom, a drug abusing boss and even the mob if he ever hopes to land the girl of his dreams. Love is never easy!','/vHPRAvYa4AT2KfORbpTlhNGtGEI.jpg','2014-04-14',92,'Released','One good girl, several very bad choices','Behaving Badly',259018,4.5629,5.3,'oyVTKJugsiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33555,_binary '\0','/7MErybVeXk2pv9RH4PK1fC1zb27.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2314886',4.2,3166,'en','Breakout','A pair of criminals try to track down the kids who witnessed them commit a murder in the woods.','/1tFa4YTAiTfdnLhvTQP0awlE8N9.jpg','2013-09-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Breakout',218329,2.914,4.3,'BZdXNFFjfe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33556,_binary '\0','/4cC9aJUsQ7PL9qDLelevfUsOrvr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23149358',7.2,1280,'el','Black Stone','While shooting a documentary about “missing” civill servants a filmmaking duo stumble upon Charoula, a desperate, overprotective Greek mother searching for her missing civil servant son. But when his name is linked to government fraud with a foreign female accomplice, Charoula sets out her other, disabled son, Lefteris to clear his name. With the help of a Greek African taxi driver and a less than helpful antifa group of misfits, the documentary duo follow Charoula on her quest to find and bring him back home where he belongs, even if it means discovering who her son really is.','/vT3dXGh4VscaQLwDaBiCuuMUU9b.jpg','2023-06-08',87,'Released','How far is a Greek mother willing to go in order to bring her missing son back home?','Black Stone',1050977,2.0837,6.6,'gZxMdXlgpM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33557,_binary '\0','/rz8NcfTRczvn94vpnmMx42zt6EC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23149780',6.5,48345,'en','Eden','A group of disillusioned outsiders abandon modern society in search of a new beginning. Settling on a remote, uninhabited island, their utopian dream quickly unravels as they discover that the greatest threat isn’t the brutal climate or deadly wildlife, but each other.','/jbFEESMVbpJU8IjZBjiWGJdEsxR.jpg','2025-04-03',129,'Released','Inspired by the accounts of those who survived.','Eden',1042834,13.8685,6.7,'2HRB36E5N6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33558,_binary '\0','/8wKDBmmSoLRMtf42dhu7uUDKS1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315152',7.2,9864,'ko','늑대소년','An unexpected phone call brings an elderly woman to her childhood country cottage, and memories of an orphan boy she knew 47 years ago come flooding back to her.','/r8nLI2052swGQ53p5eVVPuEzlAf.jpg','2012-10-31',122,'Released','Love was the first human language he\'d ever learned.','A Werewolf Boy',128246,4.1198,7.655,'bGyLPT6pQs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33559,_binary '\0','/skYxo3bOe9JoNLbgfXKREZl5Z3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315200',6.6,8344,'fr','Les Garçons et Guillaume, à table !','How to become a man when your mother and your closed circle have decided otherwise? This is the challenge Guillaume took up. The film recounts Guillaume\'s tragicomic battle from the young age of eight, as he adopts the role of a girl then of a homosexual... until, aged 30, he meets the woman who, after his mother, will become the other woman in his life. Beyond this story of a heterosexual coming-out, the film tells the tale of an actor who never stopped loving women, maybe even a little too much.','/7FunclNlH3HjMXrSWMFUHWGy4Pp.jpg','2013-11-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Me, Myself and Mum',190880,3.3521,6.629,'LmdD-MgPp3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33560,_binary '\0','/odi6xBunyvnqdc7zCHUq9G2By6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315226',7.3,3013,'ja','舟を編む','Majime, an eccentric man in publishing company, who has unique ability of words, joins the team that will compile a new dictionary, The Great Passage. In the eclectic team, he becomes immersed in the world of dictionaries. But the team is overwhelmed with problems.','/nRCqjeDbTxHKWOXtcWAU8CDOFT8.jpg','2013-04-13',133,'Released','Will The Great Passage ever be completed?','The Great Passage',182827,1.8791,7.2,'c6GfoD9ReqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33561,_binary '\0','/kKM2AVhkuJgywH2GQPZJU9X4wTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315558',6.1,1646,'da','I lossens time','Helen, a priest, is approached by scientist Lisbeth with a desperate plea for help. A young man, who has been sent to a high security psychiatric ward after having killed an old couple, has attempted suicide while rambling about God. Having been part of an experiment attempting to humanize inmates by assigning them pets, the young man has suddenly gone ballistic. Fearing that he will attempt suicide again priest and scientist must now confront their mutual animosities while trying to grasp the truth. In a race against time the two women begin a shocking journey deeper and deeper into the sick mind of a young man\'s soul.','/kFN9T3XaMLJfMASf2LAyRUzQi0m.jpg','2013-09-26',93,'Released',NULL,'The Hour of the Lynx',177865,1.3297,5.8,'1pMBGL7w6qQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33562,_binary '\0','/rEnptPvvIyRg8dEmtCJIq89bxJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315582',6.2,12250,'en','Una','When a young woman unexpectedly arrives at an older man\'s workplace, looking for answers, the secrets of the past threaten to unravel his new life.','/xvEhxYOHf7eKzLWeorlyrg3Dpru.jpg','2017-01-05',94,'Released','Absence makes the hurt grow stronger.','Una',301334,2.6748,6.003,'RwaCvLuo5WI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33563,_binary '\0','/3liOPiruqLCqH8Ucsj3ImIeGaMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315596',6.2,17482,'en','Galveston','After a violent encounter, Roy finds Rocky and sees something in her eyes that prompts a fateful decision. He takes her with him as he flees to Galveston, an action as ill-advised as it is inescapable.','/u3hDPc70JEWbrLruk6sni1OcODe.jpg','2018-10-10',91,'Released','Hell is real','Galveston',283601,3.9634,6.11,'82UWW1bJdl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33564,_binary '\0','/zoA8ZK6gbdjRoiJKgW2e4iYy5jP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2315628',6.3,1337,'en','For Those in Peril','Aaron, a young misfit living in a remote Scottish fishing community, is the lone survivor of a strange fishing accident that claimed the lives of five men including his older brother. Spurred on by sea-going folklore and local superstition, the village blames Aaron for this tragedy, making him an outcast amongst his own people. Steadfastly refusing to believe that his brother has died, he sets out to recover him and the rest of men.','/eOhv6aTB2bbnrPRImQva8Hh1KQL.jpg','2013-05-18',93,'Released',NULL,'For Those in Peril',187927,1.773,6.1,'FTGM9CX_Ugs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33565,_binary '\0','/rVTeajiYbZJAuwqsPdpMA5TJFxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23157384',6,3690,'en','Sew Torn','A seamstress gets tangled in her own thread after stealing a briefcase from a drug deal gone bad. In an escalating game of cat and mouse, her different choices lead to drastically different outcomes along the way.','/6N3bJq0VInPhifYml7cZ0TjRrXb.jpg','2025-09-11',100,'Released','Choices. Choices. Choices.','Sew Torn',1046758,3.8597,6.4,'DRu8hLsgODo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33566,_binary '\0','/iXXPaQPfQowpQ5UvhsHLj9BgFhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316204',6.4,349166,'en','Alien: Covenant','The crew of the colony ship Covenant, bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy, discovers what they think is an uncharted paradise but is actually a dark, dangerous world.','/zecMELPbU5YMQpC81Z8ImaaXuf9.jpg','2017-05-09',122,'Released','The path to paradise begins in hell.','Alien: Covenant',126889,33.7151,6.2,'H0VW6sg50Pk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33567,_binary '\0','/deYWtXTc56YdXyIuuMuA8dvBY16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316411',6.8,244458,'en','Enemy','A mild-mannered college professor discovers a look-alike actor and delves into the other man\'s private affairs.','/vf40tyDRKZsBmaLsYeopzfFLzLx.jpg','2014-03-14',91,'Released','You can\'t escape yourself.','Enemy',181886,9.3114,6.8,'aVvgt3jIUsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33568,_binary '\0','/9s89RtBecBmzmXeqnDH8bzqiPKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316479',5.6,7496,'en','Blue Iguana','He\'s a low level criminal with no future and just out of prison. She\'s a low level lawyer never noticed by others, a lost soul without a life. Their anger and hostility makes them serious criminals. Love happens in the strangest of places.','/8ixLHMV9RoyBGJz2yRuggsr0vyX.jpg','2018-08-23',100,'Released','Mullets. Bullets. And one gem of a heist','Blue Iguana',471429,2.4547,5.7,'1ZIcL95jWSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33569,_binary '\0','/qOAH7SDZMjzNolkoLS0PPFPMm0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316548',5.4,18456,'en','Beautiful Disaster','College freshman Abby tries to distance herself from her dark past while resisting her attraction to bad boy Travis.','/bwdLflvCcOCRPqb1x13KPuYIzVx.jpg','2023-04-04',96,'Released',NULL,'Beautiful Disaster',1016121,9.0161,6.636,'nvaenzyXl4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33570,_binary '\0','/92Uceuy7HaiiHFgW48gNyxhx17d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316801',6.4,24644,'fr','La Belle et la Bête','Forced to face the cruel side of life, a devastated, bankrupt merchant chances upon the enchanted castle of a hideous creature, the mere sight of it chills the bone to the marrow. There, a fate worse than death awaits the poor father-of-six, who, after plucking a sweet-scented rose from the repulsive master\'s verdant garden, must do the impossible: permit his compassionate daughter, Belle, to take his place and pay for the sins of her parent. Now, an impenetrable mystery shrouds the haunted mansion, and, as repugnance gradually turns into affection, only true love could break the spell.','/8bErT2koHXAUSW5PdLQqgL5gEEe.jpg','2014-02-12',112,'Released','The legend is reborn...','Beauty and the Beast',197796,11.1624,6.3,'AFcrsNDYAms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33571,_binary '\0','/6RMTZkmgBaiiMeL0nHRQ6CZHaql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2316868',6,1539,'en','The Better Angels','At an isolated log cabin in the harsh wilderness of Indiana circa 1817, the rhythms of love, tragedy, and the daily hardships of life on the developing frontier shaped one of our nation’s greatest heroes: Abraham Lincoln. Abe is a thoughtful and quiet boy who spends his days at the side of his beloved mother while learning to work the land from his stern father. When illness takes his mother, Abe\'s new guardian angel comes in the form of his new stepmother, who sees the potential in the boy and pushes for his further education.','/k6qHQrKBNnUdTLnWfzQ4T1XnU4Z.jpg','2014-01-18',95,'Released',NULL,'The Better Angels',192142,3.1738,6.3,'KU4gKqz2Lb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33572,_binary '\0','/AecGG1XVCmkk7fT10ko3FC0dLIP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23172090',6.5,21403,'en','Dust Bunny','Ten-year-old Aurora asks her hitman neighbor to kill the monster under her bed that she claims ate her family. To protect her, he must battle an onslaught of assassins while accepting that some monsters are real.','/qa5aZpO8tQqhlDaE0flalS1TuIS.jpg','2025-12-11',106,'Released','Sometimes there really are monsters under your bed.','Dust Bunny',1043197,9.8832,6.683,'lQqmOjPDlWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33573,_binary '\0','/3CcZRO5UMQwIA2f3U6bEnpjpegf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2317225',6,33024,'en','The Machine','Already deep into a second Cold War, Britain’s Ministry of Defense seeks a game-changing weapon. Programmer Vincent McCarthy unwittingly provides an answer in The Machine, a super-strong human cyborg. When a programming bug causes the prototype to decimate his lab, McCarthy takes his obsessive efforts underground, far away from inquisitive eyes.','/nNHAZaTrFVOjwLhkMYm4syUjNw8.jpg','2013-04-25',92,'Released','They rise. We fall.','The Machine',174675,4.5997,5.889,'e9oa93BrNuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33574,_binary '\0','/gHDMBYpp5NZtkyFFPIRLJJUshFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2317337',7.7,48249,'hi','विक्की डोनर','A man is brought in by an infertility doctor to supply him with his sperm, where he becomes the biggest sperm donor for his clinic.','/u8AO7DgcVYkVSXeU7oQdlhMFwcN.jpg','2012-04-20',122,'Released',NULL,'Vicky Donor',103243,1.4734,6.8,'Jme-VkIzkoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33575,_binary '\0','/rSRA1p4e3laAAJflzdgtqNlx27Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23173980',4.7,3647,'en','Darkness of Man','Russell Hatch, an Interpol operative who takes on the role of father figure to Jayden, the son of an informant killed in a routine raid gone wrong. Years later, Hatch finds himself protecting Jayden and his grandfather from a group of merciless gangs in an all-out turf war, stopping at nothing to protect Jayden and fight anyone getting in his way.','/5zxsN56sUWKMSguTvKYoWps63jI.jpg','2025-12-18',108,'Released','Laws can be broken. Promises can\'t.','Darkness of Man',1049574,4.7289,5.325,'HRKegxOLrOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33576,_binary '\0','/uLFfEoBQGFYUUakNFHowddAArzV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2317524',5.3,6237,'en','12 Rounds 2: Reloaded','Nick Malloy portrays an Emergency Medical Technician (EMT) who finds himself caught in a deadly 12-round game of cat and mouse with a vigilante tied to the paramedic\'s past. With little time to spare and his wife\'s life hanging in the balance, the EMT must figure out why he\'s been chosen to be the pawn in this maniac\'s game before it\'s too late.','/btThjvVC4lOqE95F9iVK118kpj2.jpg','2013-06-01',95,'Released','Are you ready for another 12 Rounds?','12 Rounds 2: Reloaded',195269,4.0415,5.6,'-rJ8yYQsJxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33577,_binary '\0','/xVFpOIVdVn5ZUq1QIf0UJcZWjO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23177868',5.9,10499,'es','Momias','Through a series of unfortunate events, three mummies end up in present-day London and embark on a wacky and hilarious journey in search of an old ring belonging to the Royal Family, stolen by ambitious archaeologist Lord Carnaby.','/18nabcSr5luPtdycpTZItffddbP.jpg','2023-01-05',88,'Released','Discover a new world.','Mummies',816904,11.9672,6.935,'WRB8YIc4U68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33578,_binary '\0','/iMgyiuUfACYAHx9EkCVabJubBcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2318092',6.2,49530,'en','Endless Love','A privileged girl and a charismatic boy\'s instant desire sparks a love affair made only more reckless by parents trying to keep them apart.','/7WDqvNmy4p6IJx8JjvzOtaV2IRr.jpg','2014-02-12',104,'Released','Say goodbye to innocence','Endless Love',226857,7.676,6.939,'BLLIGfdq-3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33579,_binary '\0','/wAakbctcClnjOQv1rCr2vyOelqJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23183388',6.2,2560,'ml','ചാവേർ','It chronicles the tale of two competing gangs that are constantly at odds with one another in the Kerala area.','/jtKAARhtxOyAwqibPxfNexWkIWO.jpg','2023-09-22',128,'Released',NULL,'Chaaver',923035,0.9077,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33580,_binary '\0','/6V1HaqhKgkS2OjvdT7bvpRJezGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2318405',6.1,5463,'ru','Белый тигр','WWII, 1945. After barely surviving a battle with a mysterious, ghostly-white German Tiger tank, Red Army Sergeant Ivan Naydenov becomes obsessed with its destruction.','/8xEl4uwCjPr82CIpywV14fxiO8b.jpg','2012-05-03',105,'Released','Spring 1945. A legend is born','White Tiger',111237,2.6585,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33581,_binary '\0','/zJwbWH5azL3Wc7bXQ5d9QCpCbf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2318527',5,10665,'en','Hell Baby','After she and her husband move into a haunted house, a woman gives birth to a demonic infant that wreaks havoc.','/vQTBwT8T26fuIr0T9iV7PYTUHmC.jpg','2013-09-06',98,'Released','The Devil got a baby mama.','Hell Baby',159092,2.8023,5.092,'EOAQuBtfNlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33582,_binary '\0','/aBwbgdmsCZBZ7trw8fDznPWsCne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2318625',7.5,10029,'he','עלטה','Two young men — a Palestinian grad student and an Israeli lawyer — meet and fall in love amidst personal and political intrigue.','/1e4rasagdrAmqlRKOBZ52zy2rt6.jpg','2012-09-09',96,'Released','Love knows no borders.','Out in the Dark',128154,1.6397,6.8,'A0p-Jj7Djc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33583,_binary '\0','/dh2Wlqpw8ZiA8w87oyui2mLm8GG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2318701',6.5,1412,'en','The Final Member','Thirty miles from the Arctic Circle, in the northern Icelandic town of Husavik, stands the Icelandic Phallological Museum - the world\'s only Penis museum. Over 40 years, the founder and curator has collected every specimen from every mammal except for one elusive penis needed to complete his collection: The Human Specimen. The film follows the curator\'s incredible, sublimely comic, often shocking quest to complete his eccentric collection, and the two intrepid men who have raised their hands to be the first human','/2Ac0F76yfpkm3FwGt7e4wL2Hmph.jpg','2012-05-01',72,'Released','The world\'s only penis museum has every animal specimen except one','The Final Member',125414,0.8389,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33584,_binary '\0','/wUG2O57Rg0hrMtwsL6b9etPkKAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2319580',7,21300,'en','The Grand Seduction','A small fishing village must procure a local doctor to secure a lucrative business contract. When unlikely candidate and big city doctor Paul Lewis lands in their lap for a trial residence, the townsfolk rally together to charm him into staying. As the doctor’s time in the village winds to a close, acting mayor Murray French has no choice but to pull out all the stops and begin The Grand Seduction.','/jEmeM9BKYWaCxzX0nF6thqLl9zp.jpg','2014-05-30',112,'Released','The small town of Tickle Cove needed a doctor. What they got was a miracle.','The Grand Seduction',209185,3.1967,6.7,'01lMJa-bPQ4','YouTube','T