must make a life-changing decision and choose his true son or the boy he raised as his own.','/r0nejXOf6e4leWhnLuEQOmC5hrX.jpg','2013-09-24',120,'Released','At what point does a father truly become a father?','Like Father, Like Son',177945,5.42,7.7,'gLEPbl2TL8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33646,_binary '\0','/3mJvbOITjPSlqzDuSpbRAST91Rq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2331167',7.6,2128,'ta','நான்','An ex-convict forges signature of a deceased medical student to get enrolled in a medical college. He kills his roommate by accident in a dispute and fears that his identity will be revealed.','/5JOXVScmQ2UXMy27Q3t1UnGstNq.jpg','2012-08-15',135,'Released','No One Is Perfect','Naan',134508,0.7331,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33647,_binary '\0','/gckd5pU4NaML6LijOuxB1Kb0IF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2331880',6.3,1747,'en','The Fitzgerald Family Christmas','The siblings of the Fitzgerald family must decide if the dad who abandoned them 20 years ago can come home for Christmas. Can the big Irish clan get past their grievances to be a family again?','/oSKSougUd20bblwrKrxfy6I2wu0.jpg','2012-09-09',103,'Released','A time to share the spirit of the season.','The Fitzgerald Family Christmas',127916,1.5356,6,'gxVeEHlr7oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33648,_binary '\0','/9hLE7hMDyIhtSfR6L7DJrsUzY2K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23319892',5.5,3722,'en','French Girl','Sweet Gordon, an affable English teacher in Brooklyn, has beaten the odds; a French Girl has fallen in love with him and he’s fallen even harder back. But their future is thrown into limbo when she interviews for an executive chef position in her hometown of Quebec City. To Gordon’s dismay her future boss also happens to be her former lover, a celebrity Chef with oceanic eyes and a hit TV show. Good luck Gordon.','/Bu1cgfaLOqELu11qRdmzYX6o6K.jpg','2024-03-15',106,'Released','Menage-a-what?','French Girl',1024452,9.7453,6.2,'kzA_s24a