09.000000','tt2336846',6.2,1878,'en','She Made Them Do It','\"She Made Them Do It\" follows the twisted life of Sarah Pender, a charismatic, intelligent young woman who would become one of the country’s most sought after fugitives.','/zfiG5RguvKXBnouQUhFCc7bNXbi.jpg','2012-12-28',90,'Released',NULL,'She Made Them Do It',157449,1.998,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33675,_binary '\0','/2eFD9n7fP9dTcrjMQEVOKEv9L2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2336960',6.8,2762,'fr','Inch\'Allah','A Canadian doctor finds her sympathies sorely tested while working in the conflict ravaged Palestinian territories.','/vkmnQyx4JgifqOpiVHEZj4QYmm0.jpg','2012-09-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Inch\'Allah',128104,1.3453,6.4,'51dixEewdSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33676,_binary '\0','/AM0ZMglFUJknBXBUiPgEVEe0iQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2337841',5,5412,'en','Bottom of the World','On their road trip through the southwestern desert, Alex and his girlfriend Scarlett arrive in a town in the middle of nowhere and take a room in a mysterious hotel so that Scarlett, who is feeling increasingly ill, can get some rest.','/wUgO5MVsdFIqwvuako55rnfoM1Y.jpg','2017-03-31',85,'Released','Reality is not what it seems','Bottom of the World',393172,2.4234,5.2,'j9AyPrtxN1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33677,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23379618',7.3,2048,'en','Clue','Murder and blackmail are on the menu when six mysterious guests assemble for a dinner party at Boddy Manor. Was it Mrs. Peacock in the study with the knife? Or Colonel Mustard in the library with the wrench? Based on the cult 1985 Paramount movie and inspired by the classic Hasbro game, this farce-meets-murder-mystery is bloody good fun.','/o9oVfFGNiQeWpqF6PHSodirh97y.jpg','2022-02-09',75,'Released',NULL,'Clue',938442,2.0336,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33678,_binary '\0','/6hQqAMD9GnAELB7CgNZRtinbP8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2337981',7.2,4785,'ko','건축학개론','When Seung-min was on his first year at the Academy of Architecture, he met Seo-yeon. She was a musician student, and Seung-min totally fell in love with her. Years have passed, and now he meets Seo-yeon again - she asks him to rebuild her father\'s old house.','/349EO3Wrvc2d9F58nyTR1Y1hl6r.jpg','2012-03-22',118,'Released','Can he meet her again?','Architecture 101',107235,2.9252,7.277,'mUpJ18MRe8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33679,_binary '\0','/gxfvtq5eYiClS2X7hxAAPBNrbWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2338151',8.1,226162,'hi','पीके','A stranger in the city asks questions no one has asked before. Known only by his initials, the man\'s innocent questions and childlike curiosity take him on a journey of love, laughter and letting go.','/z2x2Y4tncefsIU7h82gmUM5vnBJ.jpg','2014-12-18',153,'Released',NULL,'PK',297222,8.7532,7.704,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33680,_binary '\0','/m0TSKryA9qRPzsEJxJ9CR4HHBuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23382644',6.4,1438,'en','Minions & More 2','This collection of 11 short films produced by Illumination includes: From the \"Despicable Me\" franchise: Mower Minions (2016); Yellow Is the New Black (2018); Competition (2015); Cro Minion (2015); Binky Nelson Unpacified (2015); Panic in the Mailroom (2013). From the \"Secret Life of Pets\" franchise: Super Gidget (2019). From the \"Sing\" franchise: Eddie\'s Life Coach (2017); Gunter Babysits (2017). From the \"Lorax\" franchise: Serenade (2012); Wagon Ho! (2012).','/j0w5tggQs0VVtXj5OF8kWqME2WG.jpg','2022-11-08',54,'Released',NULL,'Minions & More 2',1045644,6.551,7.408,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33681,_binary '\0','/xpRbqBKqZszYqIJBe547WY2I7t4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2338424',6.2,8836,'en','Tumbledown','A young woman struggles to move on with her life after the death of her husband, an acclaimed folk singer, when a brash New York writer forces her to confront her loss and the ambiguous circumstances of his death.','/6Dg1MqdqAaoia58KaXSNETn3Qya.jpg','2016-02-12',105,'Released','Turn the page. Start a new chapter.','Tumbledown',207936,2.6354,6.2,'haVs8nSq6ZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33682,_binary '\0','/1ltcMaCX5kPOEA4NFTSBnvBFNbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2338454',5.7,21648,'en','Unicorn Store','A woman named Kit moves back to her parent\'s house, where she receives a mysterious invitation that would fulfill her childhood dreams.','/rGe3eWy3F3qggDZMc86bASN4I7C.jpg','2017-09-11',91,'Released','Everyone needs a little magic. Even if they\'re all grown up.','Unicorn Store',423949,4.0398,5.9,'r_51UsTDBAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33683,_binary '\0','/xGACHBFPRum6kZzpYzHnSTPnqUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2338846',6.2,1430,'de','Gold','Canada, the summer of 1898. A group of German settlers travel towards the far north in covered wagons with packhorses and their few possessions in tow. The seven travellers set off from Ashcroft, the final railway station. Along with their leader, flamboyant businessman Wilhelm Laser, they are hoping to find their fortune in the recently discovered goldfields of Dawson, but they have no idea of the stresses and dangers which lie ahead on their 2,500 kilometre journey. Before long uncertainty, cold weather and exhaustion begin to take their toll and conflicts escalate. The journey leads these men and women deeper and deeper into a menacing wilderness. (Berlinale.de)','/p2hrjECXfZ29CZqQBcm1ze3VOMp.jpg','2013-02-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Gold',159344,1.77,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33684,_binary '\0','/fdjf0UyZCbiMPKppirXW1863D8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2338864',6.8,2156,'de','Finsterworld','The film tells different stories in a kind of parallel Germany about love, affection and hatred.','/yFz0SwkdTZdZ45yCXQFJ17XAjSZ.jpg','2013-10-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Finsterworld',204384,1.1393,6.4,'quokQw20VJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33685,_binary '\0','/hnK7PRGUqg6N1b6OgMsAjr0mDf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2339505',6.1,5622,'ta','கோச்சடையான்','A noble warrior seeks revenge against the ruler of his kingdom, who killed his father. At the same time, he also ends up upsetting the neighbouring enemy kingdom\'s ruler.','/imvahgJM2w1LQnSnZEgaycRbgx.jpg','2014-05-23',124,'Released','The Legend','Kochadaiiyaan',256968,1.1958,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33686,_binary '\0','/4qd3DjdLHetJMR7wKA9ufK6eG9j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2339741',4.8,30624,'en','The Woman in Black 2: Angel of Death','40 years after the first haunting at Eel Marsh House, a group of children evacuated from WWII London arrive, awakening the house\'s darkest inhabitant.','/2110gY8s9VClt064nFvsobk5MmC.jpg','2014-12-30',98,'Released','She Never Left...','The Woman in Black 2: Angel of Death',288158,6.7778,5.2,'5-a8bWi4LO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33687,_binary '\0','/oaliethcvyREtDbNBp94hi5IXeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23398348',6.6,1272,'en','Rule Breakers','In a nation where educating girls is seen as rebellion, a visionary woman dares to teach young minds to dream. When their innovation draws global attention, their success sparks hope—and opposition. As threats loom and sacrifices are made, their courage and unity ignite a movement that could forever transform the world.','/zJ6yH7e7XFsVTbF1gZnERCVeQJn.jpg','2025-03-06',122,'Released','Some rules are made to be broken.','Rule Breakers',1379520,3.0306,7.6,'CW_P4zT6i9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33688,_binary '\0','/xI3c07VIq7WIYswXLFshNRvkmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23398540',4.1,6974,'ta','தக் லைஃப்','In a world ruled by crime and betrayal, mafia kingpin Sakthivel and his brother Manikkam rescue a young boy, Amaran, during a violent police shootout and raise him as their own. Years later, when an assassination attempt shakes Sakthivel\'s empire, suspicion turns inward. Consumed by vengeance, Sakthivel sets out to destroy the very family he once built.','/jH2wFFESmlPgfqO5LgCMVFJymFY.jpg','2025-06-04',165,'Released',NULL,'Thug Life',1045021,2.903,4.964,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33689,_binary '\0','/zHf4EEJHkCHTBvLDo0gaAXzA93x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2340650',7.1,5132,'en','East Side Sushi','Years of working in the food industry have made Juana, a working-class Latina, a chef of speed and skill. Searching for financial stability, she stumbles into a high-energy, male-dominated Japanese cuisine kitchen. The new atmosphere re-ignites her passions for food and life and makes her hungry to get mixed up in the flavors of this new world.','/hyDJxhPooTZQ3F889qxHyAUzBfO.jpg','2014-03-08',100,'Released','The way to a woman’s heart is through...sushi!','East Side Sushi',257245,1.5684,6.7,'XaMo7qN-OMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33690,_binary '\0','/mYysBInoW3eeoBIAGvQ67ycPOpP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2341664',4.8,3539,'en','Come Out and Play','A couple take a vacation to a remote island - their last holiday together before they become parents. Soon after their arrival, they notice that no adults seem to be present - an observation that quickly presents a nightmarish reality.','/31KjWbcG9NEMLekF9TlzBJCaKeG.jpg','2012-10-09',87,'Released','Come out, come out, wherever you are.','Come Out and Play',127884,2.8964,5,'OCigbK1I0y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33691,_binary '\0','/bumbvWDKNNeuaRwMMoQwDD639ho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2341766',5.8,4623,'hi','नौटंकी साला','Ram, a successful theatre artist, saves Mandar from committing suicide. He then ends up developing a special bond with Mandar and even helps solve his problems.','/tXhlHif5waKYau71u89ALTNhrlX.jpg','2013-04-12',130,'Released',NULL,'Nautanki Saala!',184793,1.124,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33692,_binary '\0','/fWSEMMGywytp32P3VrTL9bXHOe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2342207',5.3,1618,'fr','Mais qui a re-tué Pamela Rose ?','French filmmaker Eric Lartigau directs the anarchic buddy comedy Bullit and Riper, originally released as Mais qui a tue Pamela Rose? French comedic television stars Kad Merad and Olivier Barroux are both the protagonists and the screenwriters. As a parody of Hollywood cop films, the story is set somewhere in the American Midwest as fabricated by the French. After losing his regular partner, FBI agent Richard Bullit (Merad) gets assigned to the book-learned cop Riper (Barroux) to investigate the death of a stripper. American movie stereotypes abound, such as shock jock Phil Canon (Gérard Darmon) and sheriff Steve Marley (Jean-Paul Rouve).','/556VNOb4FKYoPqqFtMun6mNaDwL.jpg','2012-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Mais qui a re-tué Pamela Rose ?',139374,2.0446,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33693,_binary '\0','/eHqBxRfCzFSy9Cc0hDLbhMHuEaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2342227',6.5,2176,'ta','நீதானே என் பொன்வசந்தம்','Childhood friends Varun and Nithya are in love with each other but due to different career choices, they break up with each other. Years later, Varun meets her and tries his best to win her back.','/w8iOOYjUioL4zSFmnQl9BuYGePC.jpg','2012-12-14',155,'Released','This could be your love story','Neethaane En Ponvasantham',116647,1.441,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33694,_binary '\0','/cajP2MOOFy8VvJr3d2H2vr1ZzVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2342810',6.9,1303,'pt','Cine Holliúdy','During the seventies, the massive arrival of television in the Brazilian countryside puts in jeopardy the business of running small movie theaters. Francisgleydisson is the owner of Cine Holliudy, and he must be extremely creative to keep his passion for cinema alive.','/rvTLvv9hxJEcdLfbhOWtZP7swkh.jpg','2013-08-09',91,'Released',NULL,'Cine Holliúdy',214355,1.9377,6.404,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33695,_binary '\0','/645pKgsVD1Q0OFjNJMnbmirtXh8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343140',6,1659,'en','The Seven Year Hitch','Jennifer and Kevin are childhood best friends who have lived together, platonically, as adults for many years. When Jennifer decides to marry her cheating, manipulative boyfriend, Bryce Kevin has to stop the wedding to protect her from making, what he believes is, a terrible mistake. With a little help from his brother and neighbor Kevin discovers that he and Jennifer are already legally married due to common law, having lived together for seven years and, as such, Jennifer can not marry Bryce.','/2wwRnQQ4KLgmc24Y7fr8FqP2IER.jpg','2012-10-13',86,'Released',NULL,'The Seven Year Hitch',173557,2.3495,6,'sSnykgkxn_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33696,_binary '\0','/bLp3Ev1KUjKnTmbtS58T861qloE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343158',6.2,1371,'en','Run & Jump','After a stroke leaves her husband disabled and fundamentally changed, a spirited Irish wife struggles to keep her family members together. All the while they are under the microscope of an American researcher documenting their recovery process.','/uHMxKoVxf2O0sXLjZh3FG0ZHS60.jpg','2014-01-24',102,'Released','Sometimes life is about making the leap','Run & Jump',174378,1.776,5.9,'H7dBkwWdqIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33697,_binary '\0','/zmr3L9su0GwOdy5w2bQdDkWq5Va.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343601',7.1,1845,'en','Knuckleball!','Follows the Boston Red Sox\' Tim Wakefield and the New York Mets\' R.A. Dickey - the only two major league pitchers who use the unpredictable knuckleball - during the 2011 season.','/tQEYv3sL3jN0H8r7y20CHT6lf5S.jpg','2012-09-18',93,'Released','To gain power you must first give up control.','Knuckleball!',111174,0.885,6.9,'jnX37Msqnlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33698,_binary '\0','/bUiv8siGkJOmlaRTH5L4QFuq2HS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343617',7,4512,'fi','Leijonasydän','Neo-Nazi falls in love with a woman who has a black son and finds himself fighting with conflicting feelings.','/vpeD9IyFZMlxtYQnTc7P8FUJomM.jpg','2013-10-18',99,'Released','Fatherhood or fatherland. Love or hate.','Heart of a Lion',214217,1.2888,6.6,'C3FXr17zwqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33699,_binary '\0','/ezUINIrvYgv802lCkmh5bUbAIoG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343621',6.7,1243,'hi','Liar\'s Dice','The film follows Kamala, a young woman from Chitkul village and her girl child Manya, who embarks on a journey leaving their native land in search for her missing husband. Along this journey she encounters Nawazudin, a free spirited army deserter who helps them to get to their destination with his own selfish motive.','/86uk08xgxgeSm2WwRWNCjrOMJ3v.jpg','2013-10-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Liar\'s Dice',248211,1.2271,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33700,_binary '\0','/sKnbKlgMDCTDTtKm91wJ4vSbyIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2343793',6.3,30431,'en','Third Person','An acclaimed novelist struggles to write an analysis of love in one of three stories, each set in a different city, that detail the beginning, middle and end of a relationship.','/8HfxGEbQnPvIzaYAHMvu947r8sQ.jpg','2014-06-20',137,'Released','Life can change at the turn of a page.','Third Person',192145,5.5155,5.9,'gvwnSPONBFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33701,_binary '\0','/enalQlvPv7KlFtz2OhXZvdXypG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2344672',5.5,1823,'ta','கடல்','A wrongdoer is caught red-handed and he is not going to forgive the man who exposed him.','/4iMBITapARh7R0xMh2hXewcm5Fm.jpg','2013-02-01',164,'Released',NULL,'Kadal',147815,1.3126,5.7,'8ddbF1PtUlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33702,_binary '\0','/3lrQMYkVciKOmuGgLJTpz5uj5cp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2344678',1.8,9777,'hi','हिम्मतवाला','When a temple priest commits suicide after being dishonored by an evil landlord, his son returns to his native village on a mission of vengeance.','/rWuzBNbsNc0DPFoWBb9FlKwWt7f.jpg','2013-03-28',150,'Released','The 80\'s Will Be Back!','Himmatwala',180680,0.1482,2.856,'neqBc-8f4tY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33703,_binary '\0','/c8sODXEgANa49CdcHc9NgNBexdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345112',6.4,18845,'en','Parkland','November 22nd, 1963 was a day that changed the world forever — when young American President John F. Kennedy was assassinated in Dallas, Texas. This film follows, almost in real time, a handful of individuals forced to make split-second decisions after an event that would change their lives and forever alter the world’s landscape.','/23jc1Hclf1FFxpyYs9A4SxfRbK3.jpg','2013-10-02',94,'Released','November 22, 1963, 12:38 pm - A trauma patient is rushed to Parkland Memorial Hospital in Dallas. His name is President John F. Kennedy.','Parkland',209262,5.9427,6.2,'--y0wwiVMEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33704,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23453382',7.9,2014,'en','The Final Contestant','When a middle-aged woman family business is robbed, she turns to her hometown for help, and plans for a city-wide talent show begin. Two young, performers both face the harsh reality of bullying.','/skqjddtkOmdckUGoJQs573OSczt.jpg','2023-11-03',75,'Released',NULL,'The Final Contestant',1463992,0.7057,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33705,_binary '\0','/60JWJnRHV8kIbcpDvT2ObLEkkXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345561',6.9,2500,'ml','ഗ്രാന്‍റ്മാസ്റ്റര്‍','Chandrashekhar lives alone in a dark and violent city. Even with crime occurring all around him, he withdraws from all responsibility and lives quietly. Soon, change is forced upon him in order to catch a serial killer. Like a grandmaster who anticipates his opponents moves well in advance, he proceeds forward. But only once, just once, he makes a fatal mistake.','/t2iZIpbwHB0NftIwXTfe4N1dDyb.jpg','2012-05-03',130,'Released','Anything can happen before the next move','Grandmaster',105506,1.0456,6.568,'GYCgqSpj5Pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33706,_binary '\0','/be1ePwAZVHgZmy8Jxs0WEzaWk5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345567',5.9,20176,'en','Haunter','A teenager is stuck in a time loop that is not quite the same each time. She must uncover the truth but her actions have consequences for herself and others.','/gBsO7Sp3g1oOaxQ44pomsJLm7m7.jpg','2013-10-17',97,'Released',NULL,'Haunter',166271,3.6402,6.1,'sClAdBHrZNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33707,_binary '\0','/5r52emjfcu5jqxDWgQrdAXN8FHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345613',3.2,7282,'en','Leprechaun: Origins','Two young couples backpacking through Ireland discover that one of Ireland\'s most famous legends is a terrifying reality.','/yyZ7folrZTqEJFD7wUuGf84CmPK.jpg','2014-08-22',90,'Released','A horror icon is reborn.','Leprechaun: Origins',126172,3.2614,4.4,'zYg51_PFeHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33708,_binary '\0','/wXI4ljoRVDBp2vHRoXKb2jPlmAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345737',6.4,55066,'en','The Rover','Ten years after a severe economic collapse in the western world, lawlessness reigns and life is cheap. Eric is a lone drifter, and his car is his only possession. When a gang steals it, Eric comes across the injured Rey, left behind by the car thieves. The pair form an unlikely and uneasy alliance.','/734OOkr69mt8lyPk8iw3TwgQ90R.jpg','2014-06-04',103,'Released','Fear the man with nothing left to lose.','The Rover',157845,6.5554,6.3,'ChM2icbWo9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33709,_binary '\0','/i4ZougHEyBAboDpi6jsaTUDTjUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2345759',5.4,224995,'en','The Mummy','Though safely entombed in a crypt deep beneath the unforgiving desert, an ancient queen whose destiny was unjustly taken from her is awakened in our current day, bringing with her malevolence grown over millennia, and terrors that defy human comprehension.','/zxkY8byBnCsXodEYpK8tmwEGXBI.jpg','2017-06-06',110,'Released','Welcome to a new world of gods and monsters.','The Mummy',282035,21.6355,5.521,'GzorZUuZqEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33710,_binary '\0','/fKscSOfO1X95gBIDbE9of6yx9EW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23458804',5.7,2905,'ml','ജെ‌എസ്‌കെ','Janaki, an IT professional from Bangalore, returns to her hometown in Kerala for a quiet vacation. But her peace is shattered when she becomes the victim of a horrific incident. As she begins her fight for justice, the case takes an unexpected turn with the entry of Advocate David Abel Donovan.','/s5aKJoOSv3D8snq3Y2N3APeK5vz.jpg','2025-07-17',156,'Released','Truth Shall Always Prevail','JSK - Janaki V vs State of Kerala',1044944,1.0489,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33711,_binary '\0','/giMMpWw75rOxZZnWJI3Guu6dnFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23461428',4.4,1642,'ta','லால் சலாம்','When a cricket game between two brothers goes wrong, a group of Indian villages are torn apart in the process. With tensions exacerbated by a scheming politician, the two brothers and their father must reconcile their differences to revitalize the locals’ Hindu and Muslim unity.','/65n64KT32r638HD8WS0mGL0vSGc.jpg','2024-02-09',162,'Released',NULL,'Lal Salaam',1044552,1.0601,2.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33712,_binary '\0','/6ToGkmqn0KG0UGGGUAC1Ww0e5CM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23468450',6.5,232684,'en','Longlegs','FBI Agent Lee Harker is a gifted new recruit assigned to the unsolved case of an elusive serial killer. As the case takes complex turns, unearthing evidence of the occult, Harker discovers a personal connection to the merciless killer and must race against time to stop him before he claims the lives of another innocent family.','/1EwNyiiNFd863H4e8nWEzutnZD7.jpg','2024-07-10',101,'Released','Say your prayers.','Longlegs',1226578,13.4676,6.522,'48wg-_VzD