 by terrorists, President Danielle Sutton must bring all her statecraft and military experience to defend her family and her fellow leaders.','/wv6oWAleCJZUk5htrGg413t3GCy.jpg','2025-04-10',108,'Released','Never underestimate a patriot.','G20',1045938,6.2822,6.3,'ZL7R8qyQXrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33725,_binary '\0','/AnqeDtbQNhKcc0VXpGf1laROHQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2348394',4.7,1975,'en','Home Sweet Home','A young married couple comes home from a date night to discover that they are imprisoned in their own house with a killer inside.','/7x9GFobhD2WKFjSc3kfpB0GWsYW.jpg','2013-05-14',81,'Released',NULL,'Home Sweet Home',195796,1.5599,5.4,'NKo9XjR17uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33726,_binary '\0','/otRH0PEMUuD5gCP9k6x82OpKvi5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23490532',5,1736,'te','నచ్చింది Girl Frienడూ','Raja Ram aka Raja, a confident youngster who has just completed his graduation, heads out with a friend to join a finance course. On the way, he falls in love with Sandhya aka Sandy, a software developer who heads an IT firm. From that instance, his life takes several mysterious turns in a few hours.','/kOyQqVenAMDjzXxOCYAVrMF4Cjh.jpg','2022-11-11',130,'Released',NULL,'Nachindi Girl Friendu',1032698,1.3009,0,'OvfehYPfXsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33727,_binary '\0','/gYRdSs0nC9ovtqUa99k3Oa5hD8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23490586',5.9,3213,'te','అమిగోస్','Siddharth, a youngman who runs a family business is astonished to find his doppelgängers Manjunath and Michael on getdopple.com. After meeting up in Goa, they come down to Hyderabad to help Siddarth win over Ishika, a girl looking for superman to be her husband. But things take a drastic turn when NIA swings into action to nab Michael, aka Bipin Roy.','/vVBOUGpDRQTq2m8uRTmiqJaYphS.jpg','2023-02-10',137,'Released','They say when you meet somebody that looks just like you, you die.','Amigos',1034587,1.3914,4.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33728,_binary '\0','/fXyhfO8wUzrP5FWihTta3JhwZ2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2349144',6.4,28526,'en','Mississippi Grind','Gerry is a talented but down-on-his-luck gambler whose fortunes begin to change when he meets Curtis, a younger, highly charismatic poker player. The two strike up an immediate friendship and Gerry quickly persuades his new friend to accompany him on a road trip to a legendary high stakes poker game in New Orleans. As they make their way down the Mississippi River, Gerry and Curtis manage to find themselves in just about every bar, racetrack, casino, and pool hall they can find, experiencing both incredible highs and dispiriting lows, but ultimately forging a deep and genuine bond that will stay with them long after their adventure is over.','/vS3Bc6BiuZtAbSQpKhhRzPa7c2d.jpg','2015-07-04',108,'Released','We can\'t lose.','Mississippi Grind',309242,5.0427,6.04,'7p1MNB6TNQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33729,_binary '\0','/5WyJYVBB2wzzzJn6VF6YEYHIpF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2349460',6.1,3763,'en','Grace Unplugged','A talented young singer and aspiring songwriter’s Christian faith and family ties are tested when she defies her worship-pastor father and pursues pop-music stardom in GRACE UNPLUGGED, a moving and inspiring new film that explores the true meaning of success.','/1woGP3DCEyfPuifRPSkrwDanOQm.jpg','2013-10-04',102,'Released','Would you give up what you need... to get everything you want?','Grace Unplugged',206284,2.7966,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33730,_binary '\0','/uwj3rzni98tEYqJae4Cy2k78Xmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2350496',7.8,69912,'hi','The Lunchbox','A mistaken delivery in Mumbai\'s famously efficient lunchbox delivery system (Mumbai\'s Dabbawallahs) connects a young housewife to a stranger in the dusk of his life. They build a fantasy world together through notes in the lunchbox. Gradually, this fantasy threatens to overwhelm their reality.','/jSOiz1h97i3qwjZJXY8SeLvjPsl.jpg','2013-09-20',104,'Released','Can you fall in love with someone you have never met?','The Lunchbox',191714,3.7714,7.393,'lJxLudSPxsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33731,_binary '\0','/7bhewNqPoDMneXO4z67vK7LekDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2350892',5.8,10464,'en','Bad Country','When Baton Rouge police detective Bud Carter busts contract killer Jesse Weiland, he convinces Jesse to become an informant and rat out the South\'s most powerful crime ring.','/557r9wTsHdf0ae3MJYihepIZWs3.jpg','2014-09-26',95,'Released',NULL,'Bad Country',256731,4.1586,5.532,'12eihkTBukU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33732,_binary '\0','/6ZMqLQvmlsxMH35EGSh9E4EvfC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2351177',8.1,4737,'bn','ভূতের ভবিষ্যৎ','A young director listens to a hilariously scary story narrated by a stranger, where a group of ghosts try to save the only place they can haunt in peace.','/wDlRYYrW091vaQakFwba9lcCmMI.jpg','2012-03-14',123,'Released',NULL,'Bhooter Bhabishyat',126063,1.145,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33733,_binary '\0','/tLxj077KKhBMjnwJkW322VAIbbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2351310',6.6,16001,'ko','감기','A case of the flu quickly morphs into a pandemic. As the death toll mounts and the living panic, the government plans extreme measures to contain it.','/729vIACE8bNm4Z0PUCUp7oQ2wnE.jpg','2013-08-14',122,'Released','Death goes viral.','The Flu',200085,6.1803,7.517,'1BvKZMg2LjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33734,_binary '\0','/5H9PwuhElfj4vPabFAy3LciqpPe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2352230',6,2676,'nl','Het Diner','Two brothers and their wives have dinner in a fancy restaurant to discuss their teenage children\'s misdeeds. An excoriating assessment of Europe’s contemporary social ills.','/aR2bhmFpAgTJfHLHDf49fZHtQbW.jpg','2013-11-07',88,'Released',NULL,'The Dinner',214139,1.0647,5.5,'z0Yq0_t2