 by Sacha, the owner of a local hairdressing salon, Kathir decides to become a hairdresser.','/21llDripC24N3UkfNT5wpsjyDBb.jpg','2024-01-25',135,'Released',NULL,'Singapore Saloon',1046924,1.1555,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33754,_binary '\0','/3kvSQ6TLiO4xTLqbSXdxfjeB7KU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2355823',6.3,7310,'tr','Sağ Salim','While delivering a deceased man\'s body for burial, a naive village courier encounters a host of eccentrics and implicates himself in dark crimes.','/coCanvmNLFhD07LrFPV8BMtRetS.jpg','2012-05-18',98,'Released',NULL,'All Good',140485,2.4923,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33755,_binary '\0','/au3o84ub27qTZiMiEc9UYzN74V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23558280',5.7,32372,'en','Elevation','Post-apocalyptic survivors find refuge in the Rocky Mountains to hide from giant, insect-like creatures that can\'t live above 8,000 feet. However, when one of them needs life-saving supplies, they risk it all to venture into the danger zone.','/tnfc0NJ3BzhJrGJhkkEd6MHBdq5.jpg','2024-11-07',91,'Released','Don\'t go down without a fight.','Elevation',1035048,10.1309,6.4,'N7pZthBBLOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33756,_binary '\0','/edt6m2eWC8ujHk161FLy5AbiR3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2355953',6.5,1267,'tr','Uyanık Kardeşler','Two brothers look for ways to prove their outlandish hypothetical speculations right to their cheeseparing father, in order to receive a great deal of allowance from him.','/bFNmcA8a62Hc2ugNw5XpyAaBS9n.jpg','1974-01-01',77,'Released',NULL,'The Cunning Brothers',473407,0.6568,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33757,_binary '\0','/3mpgltEMgPf8zFtPnAWdDVN8ZT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23561236',7.5,157118,'en','American Fiction','A novelist fed up with the establishment profiting from \"Black\" entertainment uses a pen name to write a book that propels him into the heart of hypocrisy and the madness he claims to disdain.'