. Together they go to investigate a murder planned by Bharatan Pillai.','/3n50OtsviGm5BzUt51kaUi34seI.jpg','2012-08-29',142,'Released',NULL,'Run Baby Run',130371,1.4225,5.6,'OpI5Wys70ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33762,_binary '\0','/pMxO1beNNFYMDM7RcDyKW5Wheuz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23572848',5.7,9621,'en','The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants','Desperate to be a big guy, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following The Flying Dutchman – a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate – on a seafaring adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep sea, where no Sponge has gone before.','/xJnOMMsFASxNiFnG7v3TNIQ3ife.jpg','2025-12-16',88,'Released','Ship\'s about to go down.','The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants',991494,15.9696,6.803,'XdPt8QWTypI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33763,_binary '\0','/eg2jxQ1FFi6ENDfyMIMC5odpcU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357291',6.3,113498,'en','Rio 2','It\'s a jungle out there for Blu, Jewel and their three kids after they\'re hurtled from Rio de Janeiro to the wilds of the Amazon. As Blu tries to fit in, he goes beak-to-beak with the vengeful Nigel, and meets the most fearsome adversary of all: his father-in-law.','/gVNTBrjxh2YRmQFjlaqrNbHVvrd.jpg','2014-03-19',101,'Released','It\'s on in the Amazon.','Rio 2',172385,13.0708,6.512,'J9L06tdcG8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33764,_binary '\0','/hiib86sJwcqFlCJAPK8yhk63QcY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357377',6.6,8098,'ko','베를린','When an illicit arms deal goes bad, North Korean spy Pyo Jong-seong finds himself targeted not just by the South Koreans but also his own bosses.','/bX8OXtPoxbJWcHszHmYQGhLtTmm.jpg','2013-01-30',120,'Released','Trust No One. Suspect Everyone.','The Berlin File',160704,2.732,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33765,_binary '\0','/ixomGplKX40BU5R7QxCdwPOL9CI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23573936',6.5,2202,'it','Comandante','One dark night during the early phases of WWII, the Italian Royal Navy submarine Cappellini sinks an armed merchant ship sailing with lights out. At that moment, its commander Salvatore Todaro makes a decision that was destined to go down in history: to save the 26 shipwrecked Belgians who otherwise would have drowned in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean and disembark them at the nearest safe harbor. To make room for them on board his submarine, he is forced to navigate on the surface of the water for three days, visible to the enemy forces and endangering his life and that of his men.','/yyTsyp5EwmLQTIU38nFKo4fEx46.jpg','2023-10-31',120,'Released',NULL,'The Commander',1047016,2.5094,6.887,'XzLALijpw18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33766,_binary '\0','/4tjas7KgZNWtG891WqV4QRvFRjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357453',6.7,2146,'en','Underground: The Julian Assange Story','In 1989, known as Mendax, Julian Assange and two friends formed a group called the International Subversives. Using early home computers and defining themselves as white hat hackers - those who look but don’t steal – they broke into some of the world’s most powerful and secretive organisations. In the eyes of the US Government, they were a major threat to national security.','/nphLCrlf0gWX2ixB4oR4LlphDOf.jpg','2012-10-07',89,'Released',NULL,'Underground: The Julian Assange Story',136698,1.6936,6.296,'xAoUZQP-CRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33767,_binary '\0','/rE62yFLg0ihbVmLE3eug1lDYJiv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357461',6.8,2069,'it','Miele','Irene, nicknamed \'Miele\', has devote herself to people looking for help, and tries to alleviate their suffering even when they make extreme decisions. One day she has to cope with Grimaldi and his invisible malaise.','/s7QhAAnHcwc9w45pGQLrBUJwdxh.jpg','2013-05-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Honey',186988,1.531,6.6,'Ph2dID8chxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(