d committed relationship — a relationship that was cut tragically short by a misstep off the side of a roof.','/lnv3D6895YxYet3NWMrHxXB5l3h.jpg','2013-04-23',80,'Released','A love story, unequaled.','Bridegroom',174366,1.8209,7.25,'gFEo4GcHh3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33773,_binary '\0','/xmjSdDmBPTuVMNCb1iTlpA0Ib7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357790',6.4,1851,'fa','برف روی کاج‌ها','Piano teacher Roya (Mahnaz Afshar) realizes that her marriage to Ali is in a deadlock when she discovers some of her husband\'s secrets. In the meantime she meets a young musician (Saber Abar) and has to make a painful choice.','/etxigqHdwyrQf51swUOqmIwVv29.jpg','2013-04-09',92,'Released',NULL,'The Snow on the Pines',228407,0.8642,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33774,_binary '\0','/yJA2V29uGOZ2yYhSIGWO7J1HDvX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357926',5.9,5807,'hi','रमैया वस्तावैया','A wealthy NRI falls hard for a country girl during a visit to his homeland.','/iSVYJE0Hz4g0SEAGKXA84yhcfPT.jpg','2013-07-19',148,'Released','Go Desi Cool ...','Ramaiya Vastavaiya',208036,2.1925,6.245,'fVAaYZQ31TE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33775,_binary '\0','/24Zu1tf5Dht8U32p8kBGUxzoUAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2357958',4.7,3508,'pt','Marighella','This communist and parliamentarian leader was arrested and tortured, and became famous for having written the \"Minimanual of the Urban Guerrilla\". Greatest name of the left-wing militancy in Brazil in the 1960s, Carlos Marighella acted in the main political events of Brazil between the 1930s and 1969 and was considered enemy number one of the Brazilian military dictatorship. His life was a great act of resistance and courage.','/cT1LDiWCt7ijRHZwUMyGXrCs6q7.jpg','2012-08-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Marighella',203593,1.4177,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33776,_binary '\0','/vEMCO6NgZr4cOBBHBmyUqsDEvjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358412',6.2,2960,'hi','David','The story is about three Davids living in different parts of India whose lives eventually come together in a twist of events, and who are about to take a step that is going to change their lives forever.','/8IxwMQCgL7kDfOF0cjOAqX5c7ki.jpg','2013-02-01',155,'Released','Three lives, three destinies, one name','David',161040,1.2781,5.886,'fmOBx6jS3Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33777,_binary '\0','/uFxRgQxeAhm8P4s7RbQ4niGT1G3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358456',7.5,1829,'en','I Am Big Bird: The Caroll Spinney Story','A documentary about Caroll Spinney who has been Sesame Street\'s Big Bird and Oscar the Grouch since 1969. At 78-years-old, he has no intention of stopping.','/h3s3DLKPOtbafzSb5OuebMKFKYY.jpg','2015-05-06',90,'Released','Big Bird guided you through childhood. Let Caroll take you the rest of the way.','I Am Big Bird: The Caroll Spinney Story',266619,1.7983,7.4,'uFTCUF853H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33778,_binary '\0','/dIyyXVDBSNQAqz9UEaio1DFaJEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358592',8.3,14006,'kn','ಲೂಸಿಯಾ','A man suffering from insomnia is tricked into buying a drug, Lucia, that makes his desires come true in his dreams, blurring the line between fantasy and reality.','/1b0pkG5fKRXbgxQrk3AVwXSNo7e.jpg','2013-10-19',136,'Released',NULL,'Lucia',219343,1.1093,7.2,'pgIL2H-OdcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33779,_binary '\0','/4T5d7KGrpx3BTDq9IKm6KpMeeNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358891',7.7,107260,'it','La grande bellezza','Jep Gambardella has seduced his way through the lavish nightlife of Rome for decades, but after his 65th birthday and a shock from the past, Jep looks past the nightclubs and parties to find a timeless landscape of absurd, exquisite beauty.','/7suf0vaQfv5E7X1GVh4HJwK90yo.jpg','2013-05-21',142,'Released',NULL,'The Great Beauty',179144,6.1843,7.5,'koxRDhAQOpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33780,_binary '\0','/A34inrFSAIQNatFGc8qP5kfwDmV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358911',7.7,13554,'ja','ベルセルク 黄金時代篇Ⅱ ドルドレイ攻略','The Band of the Hawk and their enigmatic leader Griffith continue winning battle after battle as their prestige throughout the kingdom of Midland grows. But their latest task is one that has seen failure from everyone who has attempted it: the subjugation of the impenetrable fortress of Doldrey.','/emotEtDYn6qA5O5C52yb5bS4TrN.jpg','2012-06-23',98,'Released','This sword is proof that i have lived.','Berserk: The Golden Age Arc II - The Battle for Doldrey',118412,4.3323,7.31,'0zEbyF6NuAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33781,_binary '\0','/mrVUkTJHY8MeZRvBDxxmnAhRcxa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358913',7.9,13549,'ja','ベルセルク 黄金時代篇Ⅲ 降臨','One year has passed since Guts left the Band of the Hawk and Griffith was imprisoned by the Kingdom of Midland for treason. In the dead of night, at a camping site where they hide, the Band of the Hawk is attacked by Bakiraka assassins led by Silat. When all seems lost, Guts returns from his journey. \"You destroyed everything.\" Crying that Griffith is nothing without Guts, Casca and Guts are joined together body and soul. Griffith is imprisoned in the oldest building in Wyndham Catle, the Tower of Rebirth.','/hZ7bjwg3x4uQHVmeeyoGgifWdyS.jpg','2013-02-01',110,'Released','I sacrifice.','Berserk: The Golden Age Arc III - The Advent',144288,4.8957,7.667,'BaVWv_9AANE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33782,_binary '\0','/fPIuhCBHyAqZp93spcTTcABz13g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2358925',5.4,38151,'en','Unfinished Business','A hard-working small business owner and his two associates travel to Europe to close the most important deal of their lives. But what began as a routine business trip goes off the rails in every imaginable – and unimaginable – way, including unplanned stops at a massive sex fetish event and a global economic summit.','/eVWVZf3fkx9eNqbHyn9xNlmC2h4.jpg','2015-03-05',91,'Released','Best business trip ever.','Unfinished Business',239573,5.0286,5.4,'8yb9Dn2mnMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33783,_binary '\0','/6lAsUu93qNgvjDu9E3jTSFRsJI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359002',7,4493,'nl','Daglicht','Young lawyer Iris discovers that she has an older, autistic half-brother Ray, who is in prison for the atrocious murder of his neighbour and her five-year-old daughter. When she meets Ray he reminds her a lot of her own son Aron, who also is autistic, and she starts to believe that he is innocent.','/ypkewcUUuYerNGmrogQg18hOYQA.jpg','2013-04-10',115,'Released','Some family secrets cannot bear the daylight','Daylight',184323,1.8929,6.7,'aq1-2OnbYe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33784,_binary '\0','/epIcUGDXIZVs1jNNFI5lWgWNUIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359024',7.1,87716,'en','Blue Ruin','When the quiet life of a beach bum is upended by dreadful news, he sets off for his childhood home to carry out an act of vengeance. However, he proves an inept assassin and finds himself in a brutal fight to protect his estranged family.','/q0itEsso2drJXqH9kfdidxIT5dF.jpg','2014-04-25',90,'Released','Revenge comes home.','Blue Ruin',188166,3.3249,6.796,'Qy4IoArzmn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33785,_binary '\0','/gtDzQON3mwcDobDLRQwkywf3nJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359085',7.4,1367,'en','Hitler\'s Children','Their family name alone evokes horror: Himmler, Frank, Goering, Hoess. This film looks at the descendants of the most powerful figures in the Nazi regime: men and women who were left a legacy that indelibly associates them with one of the greatest abominations in history. What is it like to have grown up with a name that immediately raises images of genocide? How do they live with the weight of their ancestors\' crimes? Is it possible to move on from the crimes of their ancestors?','/h4XWZa16wRTbrpM1oJIxTDbRmFP.jpg','2011-11-21',83,'Released','Thou shalt honor thy mother and thy father.','Hitler\'s Children',113362,0.8058,6.9,'7NDKyXWBLSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33786,_binary '\0','/smvj6bTir5VALYlVfus9CTLJ887.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359137',3.5,2169,'en','Last Ounce of Courage','Bob Revere is a small town Mayor and combat decorated veteran. He faces a root of bitterness from his past filled with heartbreaking loss. His grandson comes back into his life after many years to ask the most important question, “What are we doing with our life to make a difference?” Bob had grown apathetic along with an entire town. Now with the help of children, a group of people all band together to inspire hope, take back the freedoms that are being lost and take a stand for truth.','/ozzB0mH3DjdNCUO8LeKPI42qXwp.jpg','2012-09-14',99,'Released','A story of faith and freedom.','Last Ounce of Courage',130774,1.698,3.1,'A5iue0Wi3gY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33787,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359201',6.4,2187,'ta','ஒரு கல் ஒரு கண்ணாடி','Saravanan falls for Meera at first sight, but she eventually turns him down. When he learns about her upcoming marriage, he and his friend, Partha, set out to Pondicherry to stop the wedding.','/cy7D4RFuTM3dwZzrZdsjiDBrfZ3.jpg','2012-04-12',166,'Released',NULL,'Oru Kal Oru Kannadi',77089,0.9666,5.2,'C4x99GRM0P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33788,_binary '\0','/6hTcU96hEpFc4wpyhfYn4gMryTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359427',7.3,2185,'en','Linsanity','The life story of basketball sensation, Jeremy Lin.','/bpBn0oq6kRuf2o34EL3goyh2NKC.jpg','2013-10-04',88,'Released',NULL,'Linsanity',159142,1.777,6.7,'-e-nOQHawZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33789,_binary '\0','/9Ws6Ayncx7OhKuC9tLU786Va52U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359810',7.6,38553,'hi','रान्झाना','A small-town boy needs to break through the class divide to gain acceptance from his childhood sweetheart who is in love with big city ideals.','/wi1Qv5nPo0ddJgjA0baD9MR3NC0.jpg','2013-06-21',140,'Released',NULL,'Raanjhanaa',191121,1.8716,6.6,'ER9vmhxFucg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33790,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2359814',7.9,1360,'en','Speciesism: The Movie','Modern farms are struggling to keep a secret. Most of the animals used for food in the United States are raised in giant, bizarre factories, hidden deep in remote areas of the countryside. Speciesism: The Movie director Mark Devries set out to investigate. The documentary takes viewers on a sometimes funny, sometimes frightening adventure, crawling through the bushes that hide these factories, flying in airplanes above their toxic manure lagoons, and coming face-to-face with their owners.','/pbiR635xoHk8lHjmLpQjgq2D89R.jpg','2013-09-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Speciesism: The Movie',234555,0.7317,7.3,'tJYzia6KUbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33791,_binary '\0','/wTLdfZEPkVV5z7veNClYBGCgUaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2360446',4.8,2397,'en','The Hooligan Factory','Danny wants something more. Expelled from school and living in his grandfathers flat, he longs to live up to the image of his estranged father Danny Senior','/3KjrgwU3ylj71iokFo7YJ4qNXbn.jpg','2014-06-13',90,'Released','These boys will leave you in stitches!','The Hooligan Factory',281524,1.6316,5.4,'GqAQzTSg8Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33792,_binary '\0','/9Rhe1vlm6FMQvGCt3ak8dDQFiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2361184',5.3,2341,'en','Tapped Out','A disgruntled teenager, sent to do community service at a rundown Karate school, enters an MMA tournament to face the man who killed his parents.','/tLoelSHYPWB2sYk1q3bLdVujGtp.jpg','2014-05-27',105,'Released','He lost everything... except the will to fight','Tapped Out',257447,1.9899,5.6,'DDp-yVli75I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33793,_binary '\0','/8OCo2aJRWcdnzKkzqplP1V0sgYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2361317',6.4,62852,'en','Live by Night','A group of Boston-bred gangsters set up shop in balmy Florida during the Prohibition era, facing off against the competition and the Ku Klux Klan.','/bkd46T4RplawnDjpHoI8mhzTLks.jpg','2016-12-25',129,'Released','Joe was once a good man.','Live by Night',259695,9.6969,6.3,'ClcQUlXcCKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33794,_binary '\0','/i8Q2Ei2dPliMLgPWYhRTxIDzh7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2361509',7.1,314784,'en','The Intern','70-year-old widower Ben Whittaker has discovered that retirement isn\'t all it\'s cracked up to be. Seizing an opportunity to get back in the game, he becomes a senior intern at an online fashion site, founded and run by Jules Ostin.','/u7o3TwUgukRzTIyPwdMVdqmMRMD.jpg','2015-09-23',121,'Released','Experience never gets old.','The Intern',257211,18.3279,7.2,'ZU3Xban0Y6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33795,_binary '\0','/b3BgSELpDtSWK9OYCt2BTzkTqro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2361700',7.6,3904,'en','Antarctica: A Year on Ice','Filling the giant screen with stunning time-lapse vistas of Antarctica, and detailing year-round life at McMurdo and Scott Base, Anthony Powell’s documentary is a potent hymn to the icy continent and the heavens above.','/agXQuqqqvF0Th77y2nEZg7INOXl.jpg','2013-09-05',92,'Released','Step Outside The Box','Antarctica: A Year on Ice',201132,1.2794,7.288,'UOUYPnpJsK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33796,_binary '\0','/87t8uM4fExQhtAXpsj5WhO01zI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2361746',6.3,4799,'hi','हरामखोर','When a vulnerable new student finds comfort in her brash teacher, their academic relationship takes a manipulative and troubling turn.','/pZMrkB3Y2srTl4MwMOqQSnNBeVN.jpg','2015-11-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Haraamkhor',314690,1.1453,5.611,'bt7r3RaLbrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33797,_binary '\0','/tG5ZSx57zkijfK975aENinlOdIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23621682',4.8,6721,'en','Bambi: The Reckoning','After a mother and son get in a car wreck, they soon become hunted by Bambi, a mutated grief-stricken deer on a deadly rampage seeking revenge for the death of his mother and wife.','/8oBbWxWDJrrDtNkmd0OzZpPFFUR.jpg','2025-07-11',80,'Released','Welcome to his stomping grounds.','Bambi: The Reckoning',1049942,6.659,5.724,'9Y_pZ3uXreM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33798,_binary '\0','/gVkqA2pIJ3HHjFu0cCNLsD1FBe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2362778',6.7,4233,'hi','Saheb Biwi Aur Gangster Returns','The Royal Scandal, the war for power and fight for money continues with the return of Saheb Biwi Aur Gangster. Aditya Pratap Singh is crippled and is trying to recover from the physical disability and his wifes betrayal. The lover cum seductress Madhavi Devi is now an MLA, her relationship with Aditya may have broken to shambles but her relation with alcohol is deep, dark and daunting. Indarjeet Singh, a ragged prince who has lost everything but his pride, pledges to get back his familys respect which was once destroyed by Adityas ancestors. Ranjana is a modern ambitious girl who is madly in love with Indarjeet Singh. The story takes a new turn when Aditya falls in love with Ranjana and forces Birendra her father, for their marriage. In this game of live chess between Saheb, Biwi and Gangster, the winner, the survivor takes it all.','/cDMmAwGVYbKMF9GZVEceYeuvx47.jpg','2013-03-08',139,'Released',NULL,'Saheb Biwi Aur Gangster Returns',172817,1.5357,6.9,'xFyQTtD6BzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33799,_binary '\0','/pUdc9c0ocapiHcQ7wb5vTsDOai0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2362991',6.5,2571,'en','When Calls the Heart','Elizabeth Thatcher, a cultured young teacher in 1910, fears leaving her comfortable world in the city. But when she accepts a teaching position in a frontier town, she finds new purpose and love with a handsome Royal Canadian Mountie.','/jKQKlEwii03hzgsxHPpiG01vkiZ.jpg','2013-10-05',90,'Released',NULL,'When Calls the Heart',229749,2.4031,6.6,'8FjTnjUHX7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33800,_binary '\0','/biJctq3zk4Km3hYkRQWN91yt0rY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23630030',6.3,1983,'ko','하얼빈','In 1909, several years after Korea is forced into becoming a Japanese colony, freedom fighters plot the daring assassination of Japan\'s prime minister during their quest for independence.','/oNA9eRaFCLlFKRZlzYEldPZlFpg.jpg','2024-12-24',108,'Released','One goal. One mission. The old wolf must fall.','Harbin',610251,4.0129,7.3,'jQzdirYRBI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33801,_binary '\0','/rSnme75Yls7Utk5gLc8mRzO0x9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363047',7.4,2639,'ml','22 ഫീമെയിൽ കോട്ടയം','Tessa, a young nurse, is betrayed by her lover, Cyril, and sexually assaulted by his employer. After she is released from prison, she sets out to take revenge on her tormentors.','/96x0AzP90ea5ASSJIdxSytyvTqk.jpg','2012-04-13',122,'Released',NULL,'22 Female Kottayam',129088,1.1304,7.318,'338mpApboZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33802,_binary '\0','/xmeKdogPTOHMCLsUOzgXlehE9cz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363178',6.4,2687,'sv','Hotell','Erika is mentally bruised and starts group therapy with people seeking absolute anonymity.','/fL2tPGtU39de4MiXM2iinc6ZHtA.jpg','2013-09-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Hotel',193523,1.2221,5.9,'IkCRxbx_c9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33803,_binary '\0','/mW38QtEPcdlZYWuidk0hFfZggBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363181',4.7,1317,'en','Event 15','Three soldiers get trapped in an elevator when terrorists set off a dirty bomb. But when one escapes, her world turns upside down as she realizes nothing is what it seems.','/pojHKTn9RyFPC1AeCmp4mrkZbzq.jpg','2013-03-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Event 15',257912,1.8588,4.9,'mdpxhCVj36s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33804,_binary '\0','/eEgkXWZAMwp0v9nGFiZQgSFjCZ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363213',5.8,9263,'no','Gåten Ragnarok','Archaeologist Sigurd Svendsen discovers that the Oseberg ship hides a secret from the Viking Age. Along with his two children put Sigurd out on a quest to find the truth. The mystery leads them into \"No Man\'s Land\" between Norway and Russia where no man traveling in modern times. Old runes take on new meaning when the secret they uncover is more frightening than anyone could have imagined.','/7io1VfX1sRta46vb4aHBnHWgCGp.jpg','2013-10-04',93,'Released','All myths have an origin','Ragnarok',140818,3.9978,5.7,'TLOGU5qKPCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33805,_binary '\0','/d5pZknUhpqLDPdCBM9xB9KeCcut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363219',4.1,1871,'nl','Het Bombardement','A thrilling love story between the young boxer Vincent and the German Eva, who soon has to marry with the middle-aged Dirk to save her family. While the war starts in the Netherlands their impossible love inflames. May 14, 1940, the day that the centre of Rotterdam is bombed and the young lovers lose sight of each other.','/q0wlmX9tMW8hgASpIKFNmBjaehz.jpg','2012-12-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Het Bombardement',154972,1.8696,4.8,'lBwFht-1JzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33806,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363439',4.3,1812,'en','The Frozen','After a harrowing snowmobile accident, a young couple is stranded in the woods and must survive while waiting for help to arrive. Events take a turn for the worse after the disappearance of Emma\'s boyfriend, leaving her on her own not only to battle the elements, but also to elude a mysterious hunter who is tracking her through the forest.','/jbSBwAGNP4N4AcNX2Rxq4h5u5g3.jpg','2012-10-10',95,'Released',NULL,'The Frozen',150211,0.8527,4.2,'7mjRJSQ18-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33807,_binary '\0','/dsuzaxrCvH2WU04gdosEKslAozb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363471',6.8,5854,'en','The Summit','The Summit is a 2012 documentary film about the 2008 K2 disaster directed by Nick Ryan. It combines documentary footage with dramatized recreations of the events of the 2008 K2 disaster. On the way to and from the summit, eleven climbers died during a short time span creating one of the worst catastophes in climbing history. Much of the documentary footage was captured by Swedish mountaineer Fredrik Sträng. Sträng was planning to do a Documentary which was aborted due to the fact that he did not reach the summit. The footage was still valuable to help solving what really did happen since all the climbers had different stories about what happened.','/n7hRnGpAIT75xSyBnTBPfAZQ213.jpg','2013-10-04',95,'Released',NULL,'The Summit',133441,1.6572,6.8,'aY_h5LYc1jE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33808,_binary '\0','/2GfZHTXnje6HSYRTIwZbDpKuqJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23635174',6.1,2458,'te','My Name Is శృతి','Shruthi embarks on a career in an advertising agency in Hyderabad, sharing accommodations with a friend in the city. However, a routine return to her room during a commercial shoot unveils a series of startling events, thrusting her into the perilous realm of the feared medical mafia.','/8mJ83rDp2wbuUkLK2L6nHMc3McK.jpg','2023-11-17',130,'Released','When Intelligence injects with Crime.','My Name Is Shruthi',948990,0.8578,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33809,_binary '\0','/uO0RWPpZeqQzmAc9Gv5g4wYFdsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2363564',6.2,1547,'ca','Barcelona nit d\'estiu','In 2012 the comet Rose crossed the skies of the city of Barcelona and its magic that night caused 346 love stories flourish. An atmosphere of dreams, hopes and desire mixed to give a special connection between people. From these stories six are the stars of the film. A dinner among friends with a love of life is coupled with a first time for miles. An encounter that can change their lives and revive old ties that clash with the discovery of a baby on the way. In parallel, the struggle between friendship and love strikes the last story, a clandestine love between gay athletes who have to make a tough decision.','/tCWSCWdVjYy9pNytDoH0HB3ALpk.jpg','2013-03-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Barcelona Summer Night',215828,2.1081,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33810,_binary '\0','/pdKlsuRnaSG5kTo1rMhRlTCMNKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23638508',7.1,1239,'no','Fedrelandet','With Olin\'s 85-year-old father as guide, we experience Norway\'s most adventurous valley, Oldedalen in Nordfjord. He grew up here, and here generations before him have lived in balance with nature.','/h7mbw1HL6AQFkNIpC8BpQ1YASTJ.jpg','2023-09-01',99,'Released','A magnificent, existential journey with the filmmaker’s parents as its human yardstick, and with the primordial forces of the earth looming in the bedrock.','Songs of Earth',1091371,1.9582,7.3,'InpVP3fn7a8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33811,_binary '\0','/73X7Yj9JmAKynrkPyo4iOaDXlz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23638614',7,6277,'en','Unsung Hero','When David Smallbone\'s successful music company collapses, he moves his family from Australia to the United States in search of a brighter future. With nothing more than their six children, their suitcases, and their love of music, David and his pregnant wife Helen set out to rebuild their lives from the ground up. Based on a remarkable true story, a mum\'s faith stands against all odds; and inspires her husband and children to hold onto theirs.','/mtkAdP8l8Hx9bIF2JChLdpy3VQL.jpg','2024-04-26',113,'Released','One family\'s journey from Down Under to center stage.','Unsung Hero',1115009,5.4979,7.1,'UHyrHRNX9Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33812,_binary '\0','/nIQfkTPQPYne1r9oKGmCIMXSDV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23639696',4.6,1499,'en','Drive Back','A couple returning from their engagement party must escape from a seemingly endless forested backroad causing them to lose their grip on reality... and a killer hunting them from the surrounding woods.','/ayDUrLQkE2ZyozVDSR7GK0SAy3P.jpg','2024-11-08',94,'Released',NULL,'Drive Back',1022892,1.1539,5.3,'lceq8H6T36U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33813,_binary '\0','/aTZSKUTk76AixSdClXUb2qC8ZEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23640230',7.1,3034,'et','Savvusanna sõsarad','Women share their innermost secrets and intimate experiences inside an Estonian smoke sauna. Cleansing their bodies and baring their souls, they embrace the healing power of sisterhood.','/uUs4e9S0Z5VaVgZH25wnEzKC5ty.jpg','2023-03-21',89,'Released',NULL,'Smoke Sauna Sisterhood',1058688,3.524,7,'8Yq9Fej3xGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33814,_binary '\0','/kcNGOdOmVvuYl8jmzpl7H8uUKOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23642740',7.3,6081,'ar','مندوب الليل','In the heart of Riyadh, where desperation and opportunity collide, Mandoob brings forth the gripping tale of Fahad Algadaani, a mentally fragile man racing against time to save his ailing father. As his world crumbles under the weight of financial burden and societal indifference, Fahad\'s life takes an unexpected turn when he is forced to make ends meet as a humble delivery mandoob.','/5yJSI5ibGEn53vUEkng6jqX4WG5.jpg','2023-12-14',112,'Released','A casualty of change, ego and nocturnal behavior','Night Courier',1157577,1.5217,6.6,'LNA9Yl11-0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33815,_binary '\0','/7lWaPb80r6BsL9V436Cgs6SYklb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23642744',5.3,6071,'en','Night of the Hunted','When an unsuspecting woman stops at a remote gas station in the dead of night, she\'s made the plaything of a sociopath sniper with a secret vendetta. To survive, she must not only dodge his bullets and fight for her life, but also figure out who wants her dead and why.','/tfNFmBGBVF1biwOTBgFONAeCaDZ.jpg','2023-10-12'