7.1,11833,'sv','Vi är bäst!','Three girls in 1980s Stockholm decide to form a punk band—despite not having any instruments, and being told by everyone that punk is dead.','/8KzhURCHxpVtpMk4oMerB4vn48b.jpg','2013-03-28',102,'Released','THREE GIRLS VS. THE WORLD.','We Are the Best!',191294,2.0125,6.998,'TfPytPjV1xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33824,_binary '\0','/kCzGGhFJ4kNxZCS7lETAXp7MzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2365580',6.5,28044,'en','Where\'d You Go, Bernadette','When architect-turned-recluse Bernadette Fox goes missing prior to a family trip to Antarctica, her 15-year-old daughter, Bee, goes on a quest with Bernadette\'s husband to find her.','/BziuuZULnGmTRLthEty1QdKSEo.jpg','2019-08-16',109,'Released','Disappearances can be deceiving','Where\'d You Go, Bernadette',405177,5.9252,6.6,'Em1onUCArxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33825,_binary '\0','/b0F59HpqPll0vsDtXrE1ai5nDql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2365971',6.1,1604,'en','Sweetwater','In 1990 Chicago, a taxi driver recounts to his passenger, a sportswriter, his life story. He reveals himself to be Nat \"Sweetwater\" Clifton, one of the first African Americans to play in the NBA.','/18Jz0oJto5lwsZrQ11w3GKI6rtt.jpg','2023-04-14',119,'Released','The man who changed the game.','Sweetwater',987257,2.4614,6.9,'2JmyjKCKWYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33826,_binary '\0','/hAeZVtiKlNoqFD9JACtbal9fcIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2366308',7.5,2575,'en','Everything or Nothing','The story of three men with a shared dream: James Bond franchise producers Albert R. Broccoli and Harry Saltzman, and Bond creator and author Ian Fleming. It’s the thrilling and inspiring narrative behind the longest running film franchise in cinema history, which began in 1962.','/j7ibOc2uYDZbIr7T0aaFMdIi6Ud.jpg','2012-10-05',98,'Released','The untold story of 007!','Everything or Nothing',135921,2.4381,7.256,'A4nkPNWUlaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33827,_binary '\0','/fm0DYaSpo86VPxw2BU93w237WIl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2366450',7.5,14747,'en','Stories We Tell','Canadian actress and filmmaker Sarah Polley investigates certain secrets related to her mother, interviewing a group of family members and friends whose reliability varies depending on their implication in the events, which are remembered in different ways; so a trail of questions remains to be answered, because memory is always changing and the discovery of truth often depends on who is telling the tale.','/aVDtDW3qP0je1Cy87GDfijG9W4c.jpg','2012-10-12',109,'Released',NULL,'Stories We Tell',128216,2.9323,7.1,'eTFjYusJHH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33828,_binary '\0','/t8GikdzEZt3jdEfr47mGT5GUPPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23664710',7,6168,'gu','કચ્છ એક્સપ્રેસ','Your life is perfect with your family and husband. But when this perfect life is just an illusion, where else do you seek solace?','/fOBOwI9W4pFyX6VrB3pdSVld4mc.jpg','2023-01-06',134,'Released',NULL,'Kutch Express',1070917,0.7133,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33829,_binary '\0','/AsdzgRhMkJzxviUsdhCgU6EszvV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2366608',5.7,20146,'en','Lost River','Billy, a single mother of two, is led into a macabre underworld while her teenage son, Bones, discovers a secret road leading to an underwater town. Both Billy and Bones must dive deep into the mystery if their family is to survive.','/z00sPSV2Fue6tDPAhtn1mehOHc2.jpg','2015-04-08',95,'Released','Dive deep into the underwater town.','Lost River',167810,4.5731,5.7,'H8ngDiG9V8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33830,_binary '\0','/s1T8Cxe9CYfdui4B5mjDUrDCakB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23666832',6.1,1968,'nl','Ome Cor','A down-on-his-luck Rotterdam dock worker struggles to get his financials and family life back on track.','/sNcWeBaH0unRAgjp3PMjmm3bKNn.jpg','2022-12-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Ome Cor',1058922,1.0495,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33831,_binary '\0','/s4unvmFhZlPYNtmqaOfmIv9Gnqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2366806',2.3,1930,'en','Lazarus: Apocalypse','In 1957, insurance investigator George Lazarus is tasked with interviewing twelve employees of the Deadly Sin Cigarette Company when his firm receives a suspicious insurance claim. He learns that all twelve had been let go after contracting mysterious illnesses, but before he can report back, Lazarus goes missing without a trace. After his disappearance, his fiancée Bethany and his friend Chip set out to find him - but what they uncover may actually signal the end of the entire human race.','/8OIdlTc4kEpjdjE9Br3b8Zi8Kkf.jpg','2014-09-09',91,'Released','Hollywood 1957, Before the Apocalypse...','Lazarus: Apocalypse',290725,1.604,3.6,'2qHaflO29gI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33832,_binary '\0','/hicKiGaDavEBjtaUOtovDF3EDps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2367066',4.8,1647,'en','Lord of Tears','Lord of Tears tells the story of James Findlay, a school teacher plagued by recurring nightmares of a mysterious and unsettling entity. Suspecting that his visions are linked to a dark incident in his past, James returns to his childhood home, a notorious mansion in the Scottish Highlands, where he uncovers the disturbing truth behind his dreams, and must fight to survive the brutal consequences of his curiosity.','/9owSsTl4NjLXgGkgjsAyRS6LX6c.jpg','2013-10-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Lord of Tears',228915,0.9818,5.4,'0ZWxGrhhYT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33833,_binary '\0','/siN6ghWU6La1fYlslZGdgZwGJ5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2367996',5.2,1532,'ta','முகமூடி','A man can no longer tolerate injustice and corruption and he becomes a vigilante to fight for a better society.','/oSW1xrdNMPVRutxYzEOuxIn6gBH.jpg','2012-08-31',162,'Released','The Superhero Within','Mugamoodi',69536,1.238,4.646,'6Q_n-o19_rA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33834,_binary '\0','/xNgFmX4odJG6tJZY3tTLvq8tmQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368254',6.7,22801,'en','A Private War','One of the most celebrated war correspondents of our time, Marie Colvin is an utterly fearless and rebellious spirit, driven to the frontlines of conflicts across the globe to give voice to the voiceless.','/pAh6uDR9bBznybiJCVYZNJmjg63.jpg','2018-11-16',106,'Released','The most powerful weapon is the truth.','A Private War',475132,5.5088,6.757,'88w-xtEzibY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33835,_binary '\0','/xIxSYH5Oe37IujTVN8iXc2eodzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368525',5.7,1445,'es','15 años y un día','Jon is a troubled teenager who has been expelled from school. His mother decides to teach him a lesson by sending him away with his grandfather Max, a retired military man who lives in a village by the seaside. But the time they will spend together won’t be that simple, Jon likes to flirt with danger and bad companies, and the veteran has now settled down into a comfortable life.','/cidTFapHXtGXxVUUxtPI18V6Q0m.jpg','2013-09-21',96,'Released',NULL,'15 Years and One Day',180418,1.7119,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33836,_binary '\0','/5rWU2W2UvXE5eeNcH1L8AWUOdZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368606',4.5,1574,'en','The Lost Tree','After a serious traumatic accident, a man leaves his old life behind and moves to an isolated cabin to start over. He soon learns of the surroundings of the area and its dangerous past.','/1grC3NAoeeokMd5QtJbsauFE0wt.jpg','2015-09-01',88,'Released','Some things are better left unfound.','The Lost Tree',328784,1.3616,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33837,_binary '\0','/jC6xdsrOpgLiODlEeII2bSnOFxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368619',6.4,55816,'en','Bastille Day','Michael Mason is an American pickpocket living in Paris who finds himself hunted by the CIA when he steals a bag that contains more than just a wallet. Sean Briar, the field agent on the case, soon realises that Michael is just a pawn in a much bigger game and is also his best asset to uncover a large-scale conspiracy.','/lTby7l0zX7xG8Pt0eNrWBrNzdqX.jpg','2016-04-22',92,'Released','With law comes disorder','Bastille Day',333669,9.9646,6.3,'U5R0bI8EJCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33838,_binary '\0','/lp8nmsZ27vLTSyGD9ud9PF3iuUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368635',6.1,3407,'fr','Bird People','An overstressed American businessman and a French chambermaid make a connection at an airport hotel in Paris.','/moJ3ozCPhj7pSiCzH6x9JuWa4G6.jpg','2014-06-04',128,'Released',NULL,'Bird People',266040,2.8329,5.9,'Xuf2EE4O9kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33839,_binary '\0','/8MLUpbQFbApiH47LZGkVIYeCmVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368672',7.1,9750,'fr','Minuscule - La Vallée des fourmis perdues','In a peaceful little clearing, the remains of a hastily abandoned picnic sparks a battle between two tribes of ants. A bold young ladybug finds himself caught in the middle. He befriends the leader of the black ants, Mandible, and helps him save the anthill from the assault of the terrible red ant warriors, led by the fearful Butor. A fantastic journey at ground level.','/tk4kHoeXx0i7TROwiOrcSEtHOEl.jpg','2013-11-17',89,'Released','An Epic Adventure At Ground Level.','Minuscule: Valley of the Lost Ants',140870,4.3598,6.988,'94QlYiCmWvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33840,_binary '\0','/6MZmtfRKQuMIIUOq6niaLlyC7SY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2368749',7.1,7437,'es','Después de Lucía','Alejandra and her dad Roberto have just moved to town. She is new at school, he has a new job. Starting over is sometimes complicated when you have left so much behind.','/aL0R8E6pIehFCuVpo3Wj8ewAWi9.jpg','2012-10-03',103,'Released',NULL,'After Lucia',126315,2.2396,6.643,'5hAx8KwryrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33841,_binary '\0','/gLZ3gHpjA1oc2KbOSkRt2syY3pi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369041',3.8,2629,'en','Legendary: Tomb of the Dragon','Travis and his team travel to China in search of what isn\'t supposed to exist ... their mission to capture a Cryptid which is wreaking havoc in a remote village and they need to do this before it is killed by Harker, the legendary bounty hunter.','/9wmdfVx5RCSCFXDvitqIA5YRqe.jpg','2013-05-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Legendary: Tomb of the Dragon',226672,2.8334,4.1,'XpFaDQWcHgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33842,_binary '\0','/b9oaachhBJqHVN2lk1ThoMzfQ5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369047',7.3,2244,'fr','Les Chevaux de Dieu','The film follows two brothers over the course of a decade. While they begin as kids in search of thrills in the sprawling slums of Morocco’s Sidi Moumen, we witness their gradual, and ultimately shocking, radicalisation.','/xtCYy7sfWIPH2zMUAcHAxxI4Cun.jpg','2013-02-08',115,'Released','No one is born a martyr.','Horses of God',134908,2.2896,7.2,'k_rq6GBSdLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33843,_binary '\0','/p9PDOvhUHLUXrNcbURMwIg7OfMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369127',6.4,1521,'zh','浮城谜事','Lu Jie has no idea her husband is leading a double life, until the day she sees him entering a hotel with a young woman. Her world crumbles. A few hours later, the young woman dies beneath the wheels of a car. The police officer in charge of the case refuses to believe her death was accidental.','/62G6awdqmVWTLhPjVPP03W3k1yg.jpg','2012-10-19',98,'Released',NULL,'Mystery',103875,1.3812,6.5,'fFik4Rlh_Ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33844,_binary '\0','/syVAWAnY6fTBDDFntHsM8vFjKex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369135',6.4,188304,'en','Need for Speed','The film revolves around a local street-racer who partners with a rich and arrogant business associate, only to find himself framed by his colleague and sent to prison. After he gets out, he joins a New York-to-Los Angeles race to get revenge. But when the ex-partner learns of the scheme, he puts a massive bounty on the racer\'s head, forcing him to run a cross-country gauntlet of illegal racers in all manner of supercharged vehicles.','/4ktdbrhCnAoDGLW36afjB717Sa.jpg','2014-03-12',132,'Released','For honor. For love. For redemption.','Need for Speed',136797,13.4857,6.455,'X6qjouwpFho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33845,_binary '\0','/sa0gTT0zT83cMkxXp8I8vbibzex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369154',5.3,7797,'hi','आर... राजकुमार','Rajkumar, an aimless youth, works for a drug baron and is sent to kill a rival dealer. His life is changed forever when he meets Chanda, and has no idea she is the adopted daughter of the man he is supposed to kill.','/2wURYkClPhuWaZz936eUEWWVzUM.jpg','2013-12-06',146,'Released','Pyaar, Pyaar, Pyaar...Ya Maar, Maar, Maar','R... Rajkumar',240614,1.6244,6.083,'KsnHky4wv5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33846,_binary '\0','/2el9VEDz8R6NGlWRrsAwOpCQWMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369205',6,5491,'no','Pionér','Pioneer is set in the early \'80s, at the beginning of the Norwegian Oil Boom. Enormous oil and gas deposits are discovered in the North Sea and the authorities aim to bring the oil ashore through a pipeline from depths of 500 meters. A professional diver, Petter, obsessed with reaching the bottom of the Norwegian Sea has the discipline, strength and courage to take on the world\'s most dangerous mission. But a sudden, tragic accident changes everything. Petter is sent on a perilous journey where he loses sight of who\'s pulling the strings. Gradually he realizes that he is in way over his head and that his life is at stake.','/bpJyl76W6erraH08kf19nmpCwn3.jpg','2013-08-30',106,'Released',NULL,'Pioneer',168399,1.973,5.8,'zMTT8DN4CZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33847,_binary '\0','/2rPX1eSx02K5GUgrARwsuYjxBSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369317',4.9,8946,'en','Space Station 76','A comedic drama about a group of people (and several robots) living on a space station in a 1970s-version of the future. When a new Assistant Captain arrives, she inadvertently ignites tensions among the crew, prompting them to confront their darkest secrets. Barely contained lust, jealousy, and anger all bubble to the surface, becoming just as dangerous as the asteroid that’s heading right for them.','/cToUKM0dDUaLMW4Lgr3QXHlzqdM.jpg','2014-09-19',94,'Released','Welcome to the future of your past.','Space Station 76',253312,4.9894,4.857,'k520GiR362U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33848,_binary '\0','/deLGvoubdNQ5kKOHbXXmXNW1Hnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2369396',5.5,7820,'en','Bounty Killer','It’s been 20 years since the corporations took over the world’s governments. Their thirst for power and profits led to the Corporate Wars, a fierce global battle that laid waste to society as we know it. Born from the ash, the Council of Nine rose as a new law and order for this dark age. To avenge the corporations’ reckless destruction, the Council issues death warrants for all white collar criminals. Their hunters—the bounty killer. From amateur savage to graceful assassin, the bounty killers now compete for body count, fame and a fat stack of cash. They’re ending the plague of corporate greed and providing the survivors of the apocalypse with retribution. These are the new heroes. This is the age of the BOUNTY KILLER.','/bG7wdte8enWVc1uuLX6Ys7ckxwd.jpg','2013-09-05',93,'Released','In the year 2042, CEO\'s are making a killing. It\'s time to return the favor. If the suit fits, waste it.','Bounty Killer',209504,2.8961,5.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33849,_binary '\0','/aYjgRcI7eRxdmLqPhucxJV5VIm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370140',7.4,2838,'en','Crossfire Hurricane','This film is released as part of the ongoing 50th anniversary celebration of the Rolling Stones. It tells the story of the Stones\' unparalleled journey from blues obsessed teens in the early 60s to their undisputed status as rock royalty. All of the Stones have been newly interviewed and their words form the narrative arc that links together archive footage of performances, news coverage, and interviews, much of it previously unseen. Taking its title from a lyric in \"Jumpin\' Jack Flash,\" this film gives the viewer an intimate insight into exactly what it\'s like to be part of the Rolling Stones as they overcome denunciation, drugs, dissensions, and death to become the definitive survivors. Over a year in the making and produced with the full cooperation and involvement of the Stones, this film is and will remain the definitive story of the world\'s greatest rock \'n\' roll band','/7rGmjuPjtddvMcfrvaRuxIzCUew.jpg','2012-10-18',111,'Released','...The Rise Of The Stones...','Crossfire Hurricane',137285,1.3873,7.1,'jRodNxDEiYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33850,_binary '\0','/eB1hcjLMkQgv3xSmeGpk7XwdNTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370224',7.4,2282,'en','Milius','The life story of ‘Zen Anarchist’ filmmaker John Milius, one of the most influential storytellers of his generation.','/iCf2e0HvH2T42M4qxL25zu4dvU8.jpg','2013-03-09',103,'Released','Man. Myth. Legend.','Milius',173467,1.6203,7.093,'oLuPXfsCkWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33851,_binary '\0','/v6cPGGeZ7l4UO9xuHpQLTr75L7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370228',4.1,1462,'en','All I Need','The paths of a desperate man and an imprisoned young woman cross unexpectedly in the den of a mysterious killer.','/khAn5Y4pW4W2TAYwEKFmtusLs2k.jpg','2016-11-21',85,'Released',NULL,'All I Need',340197,1.5768,4.3,'fcXrkw1L25k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33852,_binary '\0','/4qo0v8Fiy42LqkRgMktVaffcnCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370230',6.1,3331,'en','All Summers End','A teenager tries to deal with his guilty conscience after his role in a prank that causes the death of his girlfriend\'s older brother.','/An55LrWu0q6Nvh09xjMNAwE9Pnk.jpg','2017-02-06',82,'Released','First love will never let you go.','All Summers End',322517,2.2843,6.5,'FHO6G5WLidQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33853,_binary '\0','/uTmwbGpjH9GVXz1kjyuKeW0jlI4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370248',7.9,96158,'en','Short Term 12','Grace, a compassionate young supervisor at a foster care facility, helps at-risk teens. But when a new charge dredges up memories of her own troubled past, Grace\'s tough exterior begins eroding.','/iRYip0xx8sxM1TvgDQdK2YKV5pw.jpg','2013-08-23',96,'Released','Support them. Take care of them. But don\'t become their friend.','Short Term 12',169813,5.2862,7.7,'Cook_OOKWlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33854,_binary '\0','/9x8TaV6fRMAMSgug27lvo5qYzSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370718',7.8,4760,'en','Artifact','Follow 30 Seconds to Mars as they record their latest album, This Is War, and their battle against record label EMI.','/9BzAO0DwaYPpbyMtyqpWVNLn8th.jpg','2012-09-14',105,'Released','Sometimes we must fight in order to be free.','Artifact',127853,1.3555,7.5,'5xgz-5vIo_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33855,_binary '\0','/xu7d0EZo6nqKUb41CC96YdTg2Jw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2370792',5.3,1394,'cn','一路向西','Set in contemporary Hong Kong, several young people are searching for romance and struggling to learn the difference between lust and love in an adventure that takes them to the mainland where pleasure is much more readily available.','/iHNfgw9bS5DBjsVxVAXL8Nm6Klm.jpg','2012-09-20',119,'Released','Happy Ending Massage, Love Or Lust, Erotic, Sauna Brothel','Due West: Our Sex Journey',134764,6.9616,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33856,_binary '\0','/hx1DW5oZuikUzVv7AQk9Ak5qRy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23709962',5.6,1513,'hi','पटना शुक्ला','When a helpless student has nowhere to turn to except a housewife who\'s also a small-time lawyer, what they uncover is a quagmire of an educational scam.','/A2rFSihwKXEp6kxdxHJPaLaCw39.jpg','2024-03-29',125,'Released','Common woman, uncommon fight','Patna Shuklla',1257074,1.0596,6.889,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33857,_binary '\0','/cNk2P65hINKhqDgGJUlhJCtuidZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2371158',7.1,2293,'nl','Oorlogsgeheimen','Tuur and Lambert are best friends. But the war is closing in and is about to change their lives forever. Tuurs dad joined the resistance and even his big brother seems so be part of it. Lamberts family on the other hand choose to obey the Germans. Then a new girls from the city shows up, befriending the boys but telling her secret to only one of them. A choice that separates the boys and ultimately gets her in trouble.','/lpkEDbomA3ZhcVJxpuiTiGFk3jt.jpg','2014-07-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of War',277190,2.4382,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33858,_binary '\0','/z80RWUg5fs0wxx43jDSkaJvln0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2371399',6,1639,'fi','Muumit Rivieralla','The Moomins along with Little My and Snorkmaiden had a sea journey that after storms and desert island dangers leads the family to Riviera, the place that takes their unity to the test.','/qwPeBYrEuLuNrYSZvp7vIpeBKEs.jpg','2014-10-10',80,'Released',NULL,'Moomins on the Riviera',293271,2.8373,5.8,'KXv8YdvgZ50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33859,_binary '\0','/eDa0A4tiPHKhCG618sS1nFHMGmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2371411',6.1,3846,'zh','画皮2','According to demon lore, it takes hundreds of years to attain human form. Even then, lacking a human heart, a demon cannot experience the true pains and passions of existence. However, there is a legend that if a pure human heart is freely offered to a demon, it can become a mortal and experience true life. Sequel of Painted Skin (2008).','/on45j7hbfj42U9J86bdbR8zg3cb.jpg','2012-06-28',131,'Released',NULL,'Painted Skin: Th