2,6.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33884,_binary '\0','/dPFAJ1YUSnvIUnKaIix67rzdzTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23752132',7.1,3580,'hi','Pune Highway','Three friends who have grown up together in the same building in Mumbai are affected, in different ways, by a dead body found 200 kms away in a lake. As they fight for their friendship, they can\'t escape the ugly truth racing towards them.','/1iaFmRUchHDN0Nfm4d1MxZFaacC.jpg','2024-11-23',128,'Released',NULL,'Pune Highway',1389626,1.3266,6,'v0pHu3-IVno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33885,_binary '\0','/f6I9d90HcTlOhjkAc7wBRhf9FC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375255',4,4517,'en','Liz & Dick','On the set of Cleopatra, Hollywood\'s most beautiful star, Elizabeth Taylor, fell into the arms of one of the world\'s greatest actors, Richard Burton - and she didn\'t leave. Their subsequent white-hot, scandalous love affair gave rise to the paparazzi and they became the most hunted and photographed couple on earth. Their rocky, passionate, relationship, born in front of the cameras, was subsequently captured in a series of films, including The V.I.P.s and Who\'s Afraid of Virginia Woolf? The last of the great, extravagant stars, flaunting diamonds, yachts and private planes, they continually seized the headlines. They even divorced and married again - only to divorce again - but remain in each other\'s hearts. This Elizabeth Taylor - Richard Burton story is a no-holds barred account of their undying, but impossible love.','/9zB6dpl7otnzzgJN5iXP5NNJAGN.jpg','2012-11-25',88,'Released','Glamorous, infamous, scandalous','Liz & Dick',130358,1.8613,3.6,'bCIwVhPscrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33886,_binary '\0','/cSogjKX3KRz5a3DaFrReahLaFkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23752842',6.8,2053,'hi','The Heist','Ex-FATF agent Ananya meets master con artist Neel through the Dark Web. They form an unlikely team to conduct a heist to loot a billionaire fugitive of his ill-gotten money and disrupt his smuggling network.','/AepCaxPrKEnvP30pwbp9LfDPXXJ.jpg','2024-07-19',130,'Released',NULL,'The Heist',1312769,2.3109,0,'-o3a-mSFErE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33887,_binary '\0','/cMXp028BZIdiA9OFfiK4gSYYtcr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375379',7.7,11969,'ja','ONE PIECE FILM Z','Zephyr, now known as Z, rides the seas with only one goal: Destroy all pirates and their dreams at becoming King of Pirates. When Luffy and his crew encounter him at sea, not only are they utterly defeated by the man with an arm made of Seastone, Nami, Robin, and Chopper are turned 10 years younger due to Z\'s minion Ain. Luffy is so determined to win against him that he does not even notice Z\'s master plan that could sacrifice thousands of lives.','/dd0HwfxstffjRgbBcQvtw3uqS6O.jpg','2012-12-15',108,'Released','The most wanted pirate in history... is about to save the world!','One Piece Film: Z',176983,7.3878,7.5,'1gGt1Mg_zSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33888,_binary '\0','/unYwfOMLGZcPw0HqYA3PggE7YAm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375417',4.6,1575,'en','Playdate','A new family moves into the house next door to the Valentine family. While they become fast friends, Emilie Valentine starts to notice bruises and odd behavior from the two sons in the new family. Are they victims of child abuse? Or are there twists and turns to finding out the real reason?','/fHCqVI5a3dyAngKc88kNuXeJrk9.jpg','2012-04-28',82,'Released','Do you know who your neighbors are?','Playdate',152130,1.356,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33889,_binary '\0','/dlq3GoejDFL1AfLeoOnarf6bGUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375559',7.9,47999,'te','1 - నేనొక్కడినే','A rock star must overcome his psychological inhibitions to seek revenge for his parents\' death.','/dYpqpA7BsDHeyAGs9AAEPhZmbck.jpg','2014-01-10',176,'Released',NULL,'1: Nenokkadine',249772,1.5377,6.7,'NKTUbFsN8WA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33890,_binary '\0','/euBvKWkvYD38O7dMMvw3GvrkZoa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375574',6.2,15218,'en','A Field in England','During the Civil War in 17th-Century England, a small group of deserters flee from a raging battle through an overgrown field. They are captured by an alchemist, who forces the group to aid him in his search to find a hidden treasure that he believes is buried in the field. Crossing a vast mushroom circle, which provides their first meal, the group quickly descend into a chaos of arguments, fighting and paranoia, and, as it becomes clear that the treasure might be something other than gold, they slowly become victim to the terrifying energies trapped inside the field.','/dKhMJr8yoHVyvxyUiAeIn2hKVdL.jpg','2013-07-05',90,'Released','Open Up And Let The Devil In','A Field in England',179111,2.656,6.2,'cRRvzjkzu2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33891,_binary '\0','/uSJadK097br8JJkdoluDlXsNykA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375589',6.4,1423,'en','Teenage Kicks','Miklós is at the age when everything feels high-stakes. He is coming to terms with his own sexuality, and when his best friend Dan reveals that he has a new girlfriend, this puts an end to their plans to run away together.','/hQ8C1KzVz7tCsjBWRZimif4dXbV.jpg','2016-06-11',98,'Released','The scars of our youth shape the adults we become.','Teenage Kicks',398541,1.5575,5.8,'Iu7iscd5jJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33892,_binary '\0','/1jLaJPdu7dMl0Nk3vLuafDx9PWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375605',8.2,44782,'da','The Act of Killing','In this chilling and groundbreaking documentary, former Indonesian death squad leaders reenact their real-life mass killings in the style of various film genres. As they recreate their past atrocities, the line between reality and performance blurs, exposing the lingering impact of Indonesia\'s 1965-66 anti-communist purge and the unsettling psychology of its perpetrators.','/sp5B7Tz5ttsgOLnIlCP5uEhtesI.jpg','2012-11-01',159,'Released','A story of killers who win and the society they build.','The Act of Killing',123678,4.9237,7.7,'cTozJLf-Px0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33893,_binary '\0','/jXAXOMrtB1rnGpSnNxdzkFJmHjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2375639',5.6,2172,'en','South of Hope Street','There is a strange event in the sky. Only a young woman, and some of her more alienated friends...notice. But they are voiceless, as it just gets stranger - even as below - on the ground, it gets more, what is ominously called, \'normal\'.','/cxhaxLO26mPYbppPwdUNHRZpwsX.jpg','2024-04-18',101,'Released','Look into the sky... and revolt.','South of Hope Street',910476,1.6169,5.2,'rfdmdrbudKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33894,_binary '\0','/slI1jHl1vNEs9eJviFbD9cbuNOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2376134',6.5,1392,'en','Tamla Rose','Three teen girls in a Motown band embark on an emotional ride to hell and back.','/9Kx05EaLzPvJV9K47wJWMUKdSO1.jpg','2013-12-13',112,'Released',NULL,'Tamla Rose',230506,1.1986,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33895,_binary '\0','/brb00GEHqtkDetey1nNSsOEvDq8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2376218',5.8,14164,'en','The Forger','A former child art prodigy and second generation petty thief arranges to buy his way out of prison to spend time with his ailing son, only to be forced to alter his plans and commit one more job for the man who financed his release.','/x6wsmaVgIhtOwbMyIzOyfmZZSqf.jpg','2014-09-10',95,'Released','Never too late for a final blow','The Forger',255157,4.7811,5.8,'6HIlyaGAkXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33896,_binary '\0','/2CtKnSi5SQ3aZc9Af25bsVv6Rcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23769946',6.4,1937,'it','Un mondo a parte','Elementary school teacher Michele Cortese is about to start a whole new life. After 40 years of teaching in the metropolitan Roman jungle, he had to move to a village in Central Italy, to teach in a tiny school with just a few children aged 7-10. Struggling to overcome his urban inadequacy, he finds a friendly face in vice-principal Agnese and gradually manages to fit in, thanks to her and their spirited pupils. As everything seems to be falling into place, unwelcome news comes through: the school has failed to meet its student quota for the next year and will soon be shut for good.','/9Laozh4nmOZkmf3meyjPb2IYAdL.jpg','2024-03-28',113,'Released',NULL,'A World Apart',1109306,1.6679,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33897,_binary '\0','/jl2YIADk391yc6Qjy9JhgCRkHJk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23770030',7.8,26692,'en','Memoir of a Snail','Forcibly separated from her twin brother when they are orphaned, a melancholic misfit learns how to find confidence within herself amid the clutter of misfortunes and everyday life.','/woaN8CbloH0akyX0E72ayxlJAB4.jpg','2024-10-17',94,'Released','Life can only be understood backwards, but we have to live it forwards.','Memoir of a Snail',1064486,10.152,8.064,'Ehc8cc7g31I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33898,_binary '\0','/bCzkRouaqLUSpSP5KHuObo8Fam5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23770418',8.5,4079,'ja','かぐや様は告らせたい-ファーストキッスは終わらない-','After pining for one another and plotting for so long, Kaguya Shinomiya and Miyuki Shirogane finally have their climactic first kiss. However, they struggle to define their relationship. After all, how much of their true selves have they really shown to one another?','/jY092qLqa7qTMelwRiNPpLUolEz.jpg','2022-12-17',96,'Released','Romance can be a little melancholy.','Kaguya-sama: Love Is War -The First Kiss That Never Ends-',997317,4.2569,7.957,'At-bu8dszQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33899,_binary '\0','/wQ7o2eJUvIeChQMGWlET4b9226t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23770924',7.2,2058,'kn','Hostel Hudugaru Bekagiddare','When the warden of their hostel takes his own life, a group of students conspire to make it look like an accident for fear that they will be blamed.','/qUOYHFerIeMGrQWREX3UDrr3AaC.jpg','2023-07-21',136,'Released',NULL,'Hostel Hudugaru Bekagiddare',1147777,1.0708,7.167,'Q0sHtYB0umM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33900,_binary '\0','/8r5fK186edYyNasf0UB4TMZehh0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2377132',5.8,3477,'en','The Makeover','This is an update of George Bernard Shaw\'s \"Pygmalion\" that changes the genders of the main characters. Hannah Higgins attempts to turn blue-collar Boston beer vendor Elliot Doolittle into a viable candidate and inadvertently learns something of Elliot\'s side of life.','/ywepu6TUxC3mRtzxa7CCKFYJbiC.jpg','2013-01-26',85,'Released','He\'s Her Work In Progress','The Makeover',164443,1.8184,5.6,'f6_pNzogwj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33901,_binary '\0','/npzbtnkAXPOV7dkKSdh616jiOnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23772282',6.8,1887,'ta','பி.டி சார்','The film follows a Physical Training teacher who inspires his students to realize their potential and pursue their aspirations. As he navigates various challenges within the school environment, his mentorship plays a crucial role in their journey of self-discovery and personal growth.','/1nTKDDzcU0M0I4PonmbjAHkIyQE.jpg','2024-05-24',129,'Released',NULL,'PT Sir',1073264,1.2047,8.1,'rlvJHsx6N60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33902,_binary '\0','/JFQJDXEHnZmfJC1sWNbIrz0WS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2377322',6.2,91845,'en','Deliver Us from Evil','When a frightening wave of violence sweeps through New York City, troubled cop Sarchie fails to find a rational explanation for the bizarre crimes. However, his eyes are opened to a frightening alternate reality when renegade Jesuit priest Mendoza convinces him that demonic possession may be to blame for the gruesome murders. Together, they wage a valiant supernatural struggle to rid the city of an otherworldly evil.','/Uz32ERsyCmGwV8Eg2wmT2ooWpo.jpg','2014-07-01',118,'Released','You haven\'t seen true evil.','Deliver Us from Evil',184346,8.4692,6.3,'2RR42oZX3-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33903,_binary '\0','/jmD17beMI8NaMHPJAOXVfn9QgM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23778430',5.3,1867,'en','Mother, Couch','The members of a dysfunctional family find themselves mysteriously trapped in an antiquated furniture store when their elderly matriarch suddenly refuses to get up from one of the display couches.','/mUJeMGImIFFmq5Ck7pxOC9D8dr6.jpg','2024-07-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Mother, Couch',1032642,3.7561,5.6,'Znu2_4vAD4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33904,_binary '\0','/wkPPRIducGfsbaUPsWfw0MCQdX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23778968',6.9,30065,'en','Thelma','When 93-year-old Thelma Post gets duped by a phone scammer pretending to be her grandson, she sets out on a treacherous quest across the city to reclaim what was taken from her.','/rUcuageYgv9SsJoWuc0seRWG6JC.jpg','2024-06-21',98,'Released','Revenge has never been sweeter.','Thelma',1051891,4.8545,6.8,'RFAFsDEM0j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33905,_binary '\0','/yQxYnMCIsjd0rXm5hyXZzmE549O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2377938',8,63001,'hi','स्पेशल 26','During the 1980s in India, a group of con artists rob businessmen and politicians by conducting fake raids, posing as officers of the CBI or Income Tax Department . They plan to execute their biggest con as a final job while a relentless cop is on their trail.','/cOo6lOiZXO0zldPKsih9asKPWDo.jpg','2013-02-07',144,'Released','Real power resides within the heart','Special 26',165904,2.0185,7.3,'PiyQb28geOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33906,_binary '\0','/sVVpovybLphcPqKAvQdy56xKEN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378079',5.8,1323,'es','Alacrán enamorado','Julian (Álex González) and his friend Luis (Miguel Angel Silvestre) are two neighborhood boys who are part of a gang of violent neo-Nazis, led by Solis (Javier Bardem). After start training in a gym, Julian is transformed gradually thanks to the discipline of boxing, the nobility of his coach (Carlos Bardem) and the love of a young latin girl (Judith Diakhate). All of this takes away from the group, but Luis is not ready to accept that leave the \"herd\".','/nA9YI2PEsiiJ4paaOg0LCkPEKnA.jpg','2013-04-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Scorpion in Love',166089,2.6881,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33907,_binary '\0','/Z4sxUWa0K0TwZpkwrHKsVVpX3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378171',6.4,1796,'es','El mundo es nuestro','El Culebra and El Cabesa, a pair of criminals, decide to take a bank at gunpoint, dressed as penitents. The plan is simple: Get in, get the money, take off all the loot quickly and catch the first flight to Brazil. But things get complicated when a man on his fifties, victim of the economic crisis goes into the bank loaded with explosives, threatening suicide. What would be the easiest shot in history, becomes a nightmare carnival.','/owKEGvWvR3aq2oNOtAOvo1gvm9.jpg','2012-06-22',86,'Released',NULL,'The World is Ours',115655,1.4894,6.2,'CfHdoZA_ezA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33908,_binary '\0','/2WtvKiCl7ncYJxc9oodEF9mPqmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378177',6.3,2100,'fi','8-pallo','8-Ball tells the story of single mother Pike who, having just been released from prison, is trying to start her life anew. When her former boyfriend Lalli comes back from abroad, it opens a window into a past that Pike wants to put behind her.','/5gQWtVYRrveoUw6ipyGmseXLnXb.jpg','2013-02-22',107,'Released','It\'s Never Too Late','8-Ball',161056,1.1438,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33909,_binary '\0','/uEWCi9fc89m9qS5SNshlvxkSsLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378191',4.6,4792,'en','The Haunting of Helena','After a divorce, Sophia moves to the south of Italy with her daughter, Helena. Their new home, an apartment within an austere building of the fascist age, is a chance for them to start a new life. But inside an old storage room hides a mysterious closet and a buried secret. After the loss of Helena’s first baby tooth, a chilling obsession begins and an apparition haunts her sleep...','/iB8rf8FYHGlrbmLybCo6Mpg8hNt.jpg','2013-01-14',87,'Released','She\'s coming for her.','The Haunting of Helena',159211,2.436,5.7,'_17ZEyoUMuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33910,_binary '\0','/mwfrFIbXKYDsqKAWE1ouUIoX7iA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23782140',7.7,5723,'ta','வாழை','A twelve-year-old bright schoolboy, Sivanandhan, his mother, sister, and with his friend Sekhar works during his school holidays carrying banana stalks, a task he dreads. As he navigates life\'s challenges, poverty, friendship, and the challenges of growing up, Sivanandhan’s determination is tested by the harsh realities of life.','/4AAd41LHVUxTmLwcPXRpPxpZW3v.jpg','2024-08-23',134,'Released',NULL,'Vaazhai',1051426,1.7079,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33911,_binary '\0','/cFpsxdJQoVLqMTSRACmnwNqe27w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23782248',5.7,5559,'te','కస్టడీ','Siva, a police officer, has to escort a witness to the court. He learns that all the police service wants to kill the witness. An escape begins.','/5E9TjPijGlsd1nkdzEhJkxDoPHR.jpg','2023-05-12',150,'Released','A Venkat Prabhu Hunt','Custody',965203,1.5632,5.115,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33912,_binary '\0','/8r4Fk4GZMPZGRBjxFJsZjJICj0O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23782584',7.5,21021,'no','Nr. 24','On the brink of the Second World War, a young Norwegian man\'s drive to resist the Nazis sets a new course for his future – and the future of his country.','/qv7crkk9fzMrvj3WqWU6PiFm12f.jpg','2024-10-30',112,'Released',NULL,'Number 24',1222248,5.5433,7.142,'zbMZU3saPw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33913,_binary '\0','/uZtYhcnk3WWvUzQkJLqnNywMQpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23782662',4.8,2514,'tr','Özel Ders','Posing as a private tutor, Azra secretly coaches students on achieving their goals in life and love — but not without a few bumps in the road.','/w9KBLiAcV00uMSEsxviI5kRogSs.jpg','2022-12-16',89,'Released',NULL,'Private Lesson',1054513,2.4036,6.7,'g33zQr0LUHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33914,_binary '\0','/eXcgXi3kTzkxLcHIvzaAaFj33NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378281',7.5,34781,'es','No se aceptan devoluciones','Valentin is Acapulco\'s resident playboy, until a former fling leaves a baby on his doorstep and him heading with her out of Mexico.','/x3Ygv0aZbZ3iUMeXyIlSu0Ugyp5.jpg','2013-07-20',122,'Released','Life doesn\'t care if you\'re ready.','Instructions Not Included',211954,4.0286,7.7,'IWBL3JfQls8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33915,_binary '\0','/9BEav1t3F0E7yLCPfBeV7BZko1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378298',7.1,1628,'ta','காதல் மன்னன்','Strict and authoritarian, Rudran disowns his elder daughter for eloping. His younger daughter, Thilothama, lives under his rigid rules until she falls for Shiva, a kind-hearted mechanic. Fearful of her father’s, she struggles to confess her love. As emotions and traditions clash, will Thilothama and Shiva defy the odds, or will Rudran’s unyielding stance on love tear them apart?','/pBRu82BSltCBLtN1JeIrnhVM0oI.jpg','1998-03-06',136,'Released',NULL,'Kadhal Mannan',69420,0.8348,5.9,'ncBgluKXfAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33916,_binary '\0','/gQVp9cbYZB36c7nTACsbtDIrfsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378401',7.1,3678,'en','Meet the Patels','Finding love is never easy. For Ravi Patel, a first generation Indian-American, the odds are slim. His ideal bride is beautiful, smart, funny, family-oriented, kind and—in keeping with tradition—Indian (though hopefully raised in the US). Oh, and her last name should be Patel because in India, Patels usually marry other Patels. And so at 30, Ravi decides to break up with his American girlfriend (the one who by all accounts is perfect for him except for her red hair and American name) and embark on a worldwide search for another Patel longing to be loved. He enlists the help of his matchmaker mother, attends a convention of Patels living in the US and travels to wedding season in India. Witty, honest and heartfelt, this comedy explores the questions with which we all struggle: What is love? What is happiness? And how in the world do we go about finding them?','/qPefACwGVov9QlJZI3GfxPzhaiZ.jpg','2014-06-14',88,'Released',NULL,'Meet the Patels',266764,1.4779,7,'UPLQ4sadJDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33917,_binary '\0','/b6DSXmqDufJj30TDUkw6WngZffd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378453',5.5,4831,'en','Savaged','After thugs brutalize a deaf-mute woman, the spirit of an Apache warrior takes over her lifeless body and sets out on a bloodthirsty quest for revenge.','/bsPV6pXVDTAGbl4Tg4xWkm3Kkl.jpg','2014-08-06',91,'Released','They took her life. She\'ll take her revenge.','Savaged',216580,2.9025,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33918,_binary '\0','/lBDOPBbmI0mKqBAakiLZ0BdgzET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378507',7.1,41592,'en','The Glass Castle','A young girl is raised in a dysfunctional family constantly on the run from the FBI. Living in poverty, she comes of age guided by her drunkard, ingenious father who distracts her with magical stories to keep her mind off the family\'s dire state, and her selfish, nonconformist mother who has no intention of raising a family, along with her younger brother and sister, and her other older sister. Together, they fend for each other as they mature in an unorthodox journey that is their family life.','/8NPP7mliHLlVMHce8SjApiRxgzm.jpg','2017-08-11',127,'Released','Find beauty in the struggle.','The Glass Castle',336000,6.9065,7.1,'VJFRjL8_Dvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33919,_binary '\0','/5g9wIe8Q8GFPdVLSmC372gvZfci.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23785128',4.4,2947,'en','Founders Day','A small town is shaken by a series of ominous killings in the days leading up to a heated mayoral election.','/ohzLPC9lHUWseBgB7HRcz0GBkFb.jpg','2024-01-19',107,'Released','Change is here.','Founders Day',1055451,3.2069,5,'ElnPVEYGCJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33920,_binary '\0','/hVZxw5rrqWX1dOxyKLnMYOhigZz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378830',6.8,5266,'da','Sommeren \'92','The 1992 Danish football team competes for the European Championship.','/yJG0iXaHJEdmt7k7XwiVYBY3mrN.jpg','2015-08-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Summer of \'92',353614,1.8661,6.6,'V0uDZxyhaJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33921,_binary '\0','/uu4bq17fYj3yPPH6ImLCzSgBvwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2378884',5.3,4620,'en','Cavemen','A Los Angeles playboy decides to give up his partying ways and find true love.','/zjHzJuERChMzXUvc05WmHkf0PKK.jpg','2013-10-26',88,'Released','Downtown L.A. is their playground.','Cavemen',192345,1.7247,4.8,'BoAi-SZccf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33922,_binary '\0','/g4g9LKtf9jUqqXMtKJduL26GcUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23789874',6,1516,'ru','Сто лет тому вперёд','Kolya is an ordinary guy: video games, rap and friends. The last thing he cares about is the future. Until one day, he gets into the future himself. And everything is not easy there. The Earth coalition won the intergalactic war and lives quite happily, only the leaders of the defeated pirate forces are secretly preparing a new offensive. To do so, they need to go back in time and change the course of history, and Kolya unwittingly becomes their tool. But most importantly, Kolya meets Alisa, a girl unlike anyone else.','/hQqA7Qbtg6kzJ5DuxuJX80ZU4A1.jpg','2024-04-18',144,'Released',NULL,'Guest from the Future',732698,2.2219,7.24,'EfUNm8Jumkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33923,_binary '\0','/j63Clh2P6PKQQNDSruu3z7NPeNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23790418',5.5,6770,'no','Så var det jul igjen','To celebrate their engagement, Thea takes Jashan home — but his Indian roots and her family\'s Norwegian traditions clash in a chaotic Christmas.','/suDjK0qIsPoBNrAhWUtIjkIWx1G.jpg','2023-12-06',89,'Released',NULL,'Christmas As Usual',1202584,2.8734,5.9,'rg2yZQGYTmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33924,_binary '\0','/4LQlyIkccYkCoLAu198EdFqkeY7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23790602',4.5,1330,'te','నా సామిరంగ','Three brothers brought together by chance navigate their love lives while jealousy from village elders brews.','/4xwNsmT0XPFF0Ssa7kB6FR1MZRz.jpg','2024-01-15',143,'Released',NULL,'Naa Saami Ranga',1171096,1.4066,6.125,'MbcPCSkIEb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33925,_binary '\0','/kCwmLYy9ZMto1eMH8BI9KcVVIH2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23790696',3.1,12101,'te','ది రాజాసాబ్','Seeking his lost grandfather, a young man enters a haunted mansion and awakens a family curse powerful enough to upend both his life and reality.','/nvK6gYa4diCnQkDVN42uoYXPrdT.jpg','2026-01-08',186,'Released',NULL,'The Rajasaab',1022453,4.6094,4.8,'YFZMBqyXkqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33926,_binary '\0','/pJEHHmz3pZqRBAXF5uv7rHcOMeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23790740',7.4,14782,'hi','श्रीकांत - आ रहा है सबकी आँखें खोलने','In a world with odds stacked against him in every step of the way, Srikanth defies norms, blazing a trail from rural India to becoming the first visually impaired student at MIT. As he builds Bollant Industries, his success brings challenges for which he would not only chase personal dreams but safeguard a shared future for the ones just like him. This is the tale of an entrepreneur\'s triumph and sacrifice, both which he welcomed with open arms and a smile.','/nkWF1jIMQqWZSShNTAdBUqrdFsZ.jpg','2024-05-10',134,'Released','Story of a man whose vision inspired the world','Srikanth',1093971,1.4139,7.6,'OMeuJP5iBWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33927,_binary '\0','/2LNjPXTq3oYwXcD084iHxERXrua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2379080',6.6,1835,'en','Cruel & Unusual','Wrongly condemned for killing his wife, a man finds himself in a mysterious institution where he is sentenced to relive her death for eternity.','/wfHsUrNvtRqmCpo6l3SmaZZZ46E.jpg','2014-04-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Cruel & Unusual',258075,1.5531,6.2,'MiR7R316N-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33928,_binary '\0','/fDuB3PR7LDsqEQXD5dRKTODaQR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2379082',6.7,3481,'en','Monster Pies','Mike has felt alienated and alone for as long as he can remember, until a new boy arrives at his school - awakening feelings and a world of possibilities he\'d never before dared to dream of.','/lF07V5QGGyOUSLOvibg8ESposXo.jpg','2013-04-10',85,'Released','Sometimes opposites don\'t attract.','Monster Pies',168022,2.1171,5.6,'M6HSwQ4XtOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33929,_binary '\0','/32E8LziFHOD1xEtVh5tXpUBR93R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23790924',6.4,4155,'fr','Vincent doit mourir','Vincent finds himself under attack for no apparent reason overnight. When the phenomenon intensifies, he must run and change his way of life completely.','/ztghAnb7nuhZ6q11cx1F9gBAJ6m.jpg','2023-11-15',109,'Released',NULL,'Vincent Must Die',965890,2.6825,6.2,'3RO2z9YNNJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33930,_binary '\0','/hoeooOsGEYsr5du9j1j12jGv0UL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23793170',6.1,3211,'en','Coup!','A mysterious grifter appears on an isolated seaside estate claiming to be a wealthy family\'s new chef. When the Spanish Flu pandemic of 1918 descends on the island, the mischievous cook rouses his fellow staff to rebel and take over the mansion.','/9a9Uo1YtkEeXPgAFvDyEGcMnYCX.jpg','2024-08-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Coup!',1054221,2.3706,6.5,'vJpPkX1FKPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33931,_binary '\0','/uwm3Qekq4vqPTbVvM74deRRmpWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2379318',6.3,1998,'fr','Les Beaux Jours','Bright days ahead? Caroline has retired, at last. A new life lies before her: time to take care of her children, her husband, and, most of all, herself. However, she soon comes to realize that this new freedom is synonymous with boredom and idleness. Especially when she receives a membership to her neighborhood’s senior club as a birthday present… Reluctant at first, she nevertheless decides to take the plunge. Oddly enough, she meets great people there, starting with the young computer science teacher, who is far from insensitive to her charms. Caroline gradually takes control of her life again and lives a second youth: taking a new lover, living new experiences, breaking the rules, not doing what’s expected of her… Who said that retirement was the beginning of the end and not a new beginning?','/4hW550N7m5Vr3U8dFj4LIIVigN2.jpg','2013-06-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Bright Days Ahead',197936,2.3275,5.975,'Wzx0oRXvVws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33932,_binary '\0','/tVlpRtfPizUPZtcMfDgxltskory.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23793436',6,2295,'en','Off the Record','Young singer-songwriter Astor Grey struggles to break free of a toxic relationship with a infamous bad-boy rock star who threatens to destroy her after promising her the world.','/b28otxhi38AlICfdLfLXw2HjoWZ.jpg','2025-05-02',95,'Released','In the glittering world of fame, betrayal is just a beat away.','Off the Record',1220002,2.6233,5.5,'Tm9YOujM0CA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33933,_binary '\0','/aP6Hzwi2hqPGvX9sF4GliCy55yA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2379713',6.8,501797,'en','Spectre','A cryptic message from Bond’s past sends him on a trail to uncover a sinister organization. While M battles political forces to keep the secret service alive, Bond peels back the layers of deceit to reveal the terrible truth behind SPECTRE.','/zj8ongFhtWNsVlfjOGo8pSr7PQg.jpg','2015-10-26',148,'Released','The Dead Are Alive.','Spectre',206647,13.98,6.572,'ujmoYyEyDP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33934,_binary '\0','/ijpvcY138IqXIYLadDEp8Pe186g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2380207',6.8,5558,'es','Stockholm','The story of the encounter between a boy and a girl. He confesses that he fell in love with her at first sight, but she does not believe him. However, as they walk through the night in Madrid, they share their desires, secrets, and maybe a few little lies. But soon the film brings us back to the harsh reality of power struggles, psychological games and conflicts between the sexes. Stockholm thus offers an incredible reading of the relations between young people today.','/72Kl7ve97Uwrgjnpia30VzfwtFM.jpg','2013-04-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Stockholm',185738,1.2374,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33935,_binary '\0','/f1YohZe2PDV5OgTPwNVvRhhV935.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2380247',7.7,8391,'en','The Central Park Five','In 1989, five black and Latino teenagers from Harlem were arrested and later convicted of raping a white woman in New York City\'s Central Park. They spent between 6 and 13 years in prison before a serial rapist confessed that he alone had committed the crime, leading to their convictions being overturned. Set against a backdrop of a decaying city beset by violence and racial tension, this is the story of that horrific crime, the rush to judgment by the police, a media clamoring for sensational stories and an outraged public, and the five lives upended by this miscarriage of justice.','/aKlQ8Sjr07OkCLuYkRYtpVSMm3e.jpg','2012-05-24',119,'Released',NULL,'The Central Park Five',124067,1.8673,7,'B7XX6GgI5SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33936,_binary '\0','/g7CHF8gTLGooTbP4GznIGwaqAGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2380307',8.4,726842,'en','Coco','Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel\'s family history.','/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg','2017-10-27',105,'Released','The celebration of a lifetime.','Coco',354912,42.7179,8.197,'Rvr68u6k5sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33937,_binary '\0','/4Y0RX8ByzDXeeDmVUKdh8rVx1m8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2380331',6.6,12069,'en','Words and Pictures','An art instructor and an English teacher form a rivalry that ends up with a competition at their school in which students decide whether words or pictures are more important.','/lm7kJm4mZ5NuFF3iMRXDaGzqItn.jpg','2014-05-22',111,'Released','Is a man worth more than his words, a woman worth more than her pictures?','Words and Pictures',214075,3.9084,6.378,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33938,_binary '\0','/bcaatLzghmqAvBSe52ZeSOdh3Jn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23804378',7.5,5663,'hi','Three of Us','Shailaja embarks on a confrontational journey with her husband and childhood-love as she finds herself at the cusp of her past, present and future. Stitched with a very delicate thread of emotions, this film is about love, loss, healing, awareness and liberation.','/5KQTxjyfhbSrsjkgG1oKFWIIaKN.jpg','2023-11-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Three of Us',1052873,1.5929,7.7,'B_uQGJAKPIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33939,_binary '\0','/xzpXvyetmrdR3NSRN9uy0xO3lR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23804696',6.9,14554,'te','హిట్: ది థర్డ్ కేస్','The Homicide Intervention Team (HIT) sends ruthless police officer Arjun Sarkaar to find a group of killers and stop their grisly murder spree.','/wT9tGyFol4RBwkjESXUWeBdnLJn.jpg','2025-04-30',157,'Released',NULL,'HIT: The Third Case',1060046,4.808,6.7,'VOScrKrY2fM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33940,_binary '\0','/dr6m5UDbTdIU3dH9Ls3ruHfjiUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2380564',6,3348,'en','Swearnet: The Movie','Fed up with being censored in their post-Trailer Park Boys lives, the out of work stars/world-renowned \'swearists\', Mike Smith, Robb Wells and John Paul Tremblay decide to start their own uncensored network on the internet.','/yxJGlfTUAEIy46M4T3EDks75P9S.jpg','2014-08-29',112,'Released','Because people f#@king swear.','Swearnet: The Movie',186610,1.7668,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33941,_binary '\0','/dXL1hXpFe3ZM3XQ4KnIAxBdrgHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23806182',4.5,1822,'ru','Непослушная','In order to prevent the construction of a skyscraper in an urban forest, Elya, a young environmental activist, accepts a challenge from the mega wealthy developer: If after spending seven days with him, she doesn\'t fall for him, he\'ll stop the project. During this time of luxury and passion, Elya becomes increasingly attracted to him.','/9vUEWR3LjQcPqaev2Rfm5uKvV9i.jpg','2023-02-14',109,'Released',NULL,'Naughty',1057491,5.1681,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33942,_binary '\0','/oTEnEJaqSLC70oZVWHEHdEr8bBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2381046',5.5,2924,'en','Jamie Marks Is Dead','No one seemed to care about Jamie Marks until after his death. Hoping to find the love and friendship he never had in life, Jamie’s ghost visits former classmate Adam McCormick, drawing him into the bleak world between the living and the dead.','/q2hTW172Q7CSC0A5Lp6HAJ41XQr.jpg','2014-07-28',101,'Released','How far would you go to be remembered?','Jamie Marks Is Dead',244562,2.1744,5.6,'RSh3Kc6LZH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33943,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23810972',6.7,2234,'en','Died Suddenly','5 billion vaccinated worldwide, and many are dying suddenly. Is this the greatest orchestrated die-off in the history of the world?','/2Db02J5xhkuLSRQW269DqS668Ki.jpg',NULL,69,'Released',NULL,'Died Suddenly',1752579,1.3345,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33944,_binary '\0','/2T4bqHgYfzXNQoALJsvhW40kDTg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2381111',7.5,159611,'en','Brooklyn','In 1950s Ireland and New York, young Eilis Lacey has to choose between two men and two countries.','/cs7W8j5lI7qzRW6tKSj9p1Q0Ze7.jpg','2015-10-20',111,'Released','Two countries, two loves, one heart','Brooklyn',167073,6.3025,7.3,'15syDwC000k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33945,_binary '\0','/p5AwpwkF6gcRJ04NEbtUQM7vJMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2381213',5.4,2609,'en','Sundown','High school seniors Logan and Blake prepare for an epic Spring Break as they travel to the beautiful and exotic Mexican beach resort of Puerto Vallarta hoping to hook up with their high school crushes. Surrounded by hot girls in teeny bikinis, the guys are truly in heaven. After meeting at a club, Logan falls for a mysterious local beauty named Gaby but then realizes the next morning, when his grandfather’s Rolex watch is missing, that she was after more than just his heart.','/kuqB9ejNH7w4n2067ZSMuwhNnwm.jpg','2016-05-16',103,'Released','Surrounded by hot girls in teeny bikinis, the guys are truly in heaven.','Sundown',267800,1.7311,5.8,'6oaKFWcqXDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33946,_binary '\0','/vYIUN5rrCncHFY8WvcuXQlM4hk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2381249',7.4,450023,'en','Mission: Impossible - Rogue Nation','Ethan and team take on their most impossible mission yet—eradicating \'The Syndicate\', an International and highly-skilled rogue organization committed to destroying the IMF.','/fRJLXQBHK2wyznK5yZbO7vmsuVK.jpg','2015-07-28',131,'Released','Desperate times. Desperate measures.','Mission: Impossible - Rogue Nation',177677,22.7908,7.227,'F-qBD17wwrQ','Yo