3p0wYOAVykXfo4iH61SVsqEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2382422',6.1,3005,'fr','Jacky au royaume des filles','In a country where women are in charge, a man goes to unusual lengths to make his dream of marrying the daughter of a military leader come true.','/nEXMIWgRIFDZVFl7fFHooQBBBdu.jpg','2014-01-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Jacky in the Kingdom of Women',223954,3.103,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33959,_binary '\0','/vNKlrvHiw32yrjnUoaTMGnH6soN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2383068',6.1,23453,'en','The Sacrament','Two journalists set out to document their friend\'s journey to reunite with his estranged sister. They track her to an undisclosed location where they are welcomed into the remote world of \"Eden Parish,\" a self-sustained rural utopia composed of nearly two hundred members and overseen by a mysterious leader known only as \"Father.\" It quickly becomes evident to the newcomers that this paradise may not be as it seems. Eden Parish harbors a twisted secret. What started as just another documentary shoot soon becomes a fight for survival.','/thdioQOYqqusDUfT6trgwMIoNaQ.jpg','2014-05-01',99,'Released','Live as one. Die as one.','The Sacrament',211067,4.0427,5.9,'pdROBLUzXS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33960,_binary '\0','/nbyTX77u3qELm9DYPgYfva7vAwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23846482',6.4,9598,'te','కుబేర','A ruthless billionaire, Neeraj, uses beggars as benamis to launder money, with the help of a disgraced civil submit servant, Deepak. One of the beggars, Deva, escapes with ₹10,000 crores and becomes the target of a deadly manhunt. He meets Sameera, who joins him in his mission to use the money to uplift society\'s poor. With Deepak\'s help, Deva fights back.','/xjLC5DeA4FQTBv4xe8r3wYqh8lu.jpg','2025-06-19',185,'Released',NULL,'Kuberaa',1171101,2.5439,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33961,_binary '\0','/1wWGBVCT9GQYDDRthxz2KmqrgIA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23846664',4.9,2567,'te','ఎక్స్‌ట్రా ఆర్డినరీ మ్యాన్','Abhi, from his childhood, revels in the art of playing other people. His mother recognizes his extraordinary talent, propelling him into the world of acting. As he matures, he becomes a sought-after junior artist, always relegated to the background. The lines between reel and real life blur as Abhi faces a complex situation at home, with a supportive mother and a nagging and concerned father. A chance encounter with Likitha , the MD of a company, leads to love, and Abhi finds himself playing the role of a CEO. However, a conniving director presents an intriguing script, introducing Abhi to Nero, a self-absorbed and evil character with conquest on his mind.','/bOym2XLkyDcYVvX5sZ6YYm19xXT.jpg','2023-12-07',155,'Released',NULL,'Extra Ordinary Man',1150622,1.5353,4.409,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33962,_binary '\0','/oTQpz1hwbtw11j3xb8rbNAeZs8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23846874',6.2,6230,'hi','सजनी शिंदे की वायरल वीडियो','While facing backlash after a video of her at a nightclub goes viral, a teacher disappears suddenly — and a tenacious cop begins a thorny investigation.','/xkDtXIlQBtkaHSjL6NyUsZREZTe.jpg','2023-10-27',114,'Released','Everyone is a suspect','Sajini Shinde Ka Viral Video',1187054,1.283,6.425,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33963,_binary '\0','/6RV2o8PBCEyw9ylOWViV1CtULIF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23849204',8.7,177285,'hi','12वीं फेल','Based on the true story of IPS officer Manoj Kumar Sharma, 12th Fail sheds limelight on fearlessly embracing the idea of restarting the academic journey despite the setbacks and challenges and reclaiming one\'s destiny at a place where millions of students attempt the world\'s toughest competitive exam: UPSC.','/eebUPRI4Z5e1Z7Hev4JZAwMIFkX.jpg','2023-08-11',146,'Released','#RESTART','12th Fail',1163258,5.3331,7.9,'KjbtuqENvVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33964,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23849582',6.4,2459,'ml','മധുര മനോഹര മോഹം','Town of Kumbazha, the lives of Manu and Meera\'s family are forever altered by an unexpected truth. As the unshakeable foundation crumbles, they embark on a tumultuous journey, challenging societal norms.','/ektyuao2iG6NXGCSRVxxNcQkXWZ.jpg','2023-06-16',119,'Released',NULL,'Madhura Manohara Moham',1022971,1.2121,5.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33965,_binary '\0','/jG5MLSLZoHlNAO4NDSqUVPB5UjD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385073',6.1,1298,'te','ఎందుకంటే ప్రేమంతా','Two young people are confused by their feelings for each other.','/gQHL3YuiABEjfujbTqKCRIqj16Z.jpg','2012-06-08',155,'Released',NULL,'Endukante Premanta',153860,1.6008,5.139,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33966,_binary '\0','/y3ZpZIBaXHRveQOdbrDMT1h7uSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385074',4.6,2596,'en','Thanatomorphose','Bruised from a night of rough sex, a young woman is shocked to find that her body, rather than healing itself, has inexplicably begun to rot. Swept up in the strange sensual experiences brought on by her slowly decaying form, she tries desperately to cling to her new existence — even as the putrid meat sack that was once her young body begins to literally fall off her bones...','/6EBH4OrpJrPWROoPqcURbtaUdRA.jpg','2012-10-04',100,'Released','Rotting from the inside out','Thanatomorphose',144204,2.8677,5.753,'z4Q2C_vg4Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33967,_binary '\0','/A8vjn3hsXsdIGtGRQicjqGWcli5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385104',7.2,10853,'hi','डी डे','Four Indian agents spend nine years under cover to track down India\'s most wanted criminal.','/q2pizfhonKPTWdB4OC49qJWbBqi.jpg','2013-07-19',153,'Released','We\'ve Bled Enough. It\'s Time To Bring Him Back.','D-Day',206851,1.5734,6.7,'6NlCkqBGnRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33968,_binary '\0','/n9i58TjgT3dXy9pdjAXifdRk3mi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385115',7.6,1324,'en','Jaco','The story of Jaco Pastorius, a self-taught, larger-than-life musician who single-handedly changed the course of modern music by redefining the sound and the role of the electric bass guitar. Never-before-seen 8mm film, photographs, and audio recordings unveil the true story behind the legend of Jaco’s life, his music, and his heartbreaking end.','/sKKmFdxwy7HEq5j98QOwlRratUo.jpg','2015-03-17',111,'Released',NULL,'Jaco',324277,1.8339,7.5,'xYE-tm8UBSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33969,_binary '\0','/z0hAhAyzXPqt5CC2vLwxRa4iGsH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385195',6.5,1578,'en','Rhymes for Young Ghouls','In 1976, a Mi\'gMaq teenager plots revenge against the sadistic Indian agent who imprisoned her in a residential school where rape and abuse are common.','/steITxOFJ4HnFRuxnYePDxDGK3r.jpg','2013-09-09',86,'Released','Growing up means getting even.','Rhymes for Young Ghouls',212748,1.8473,6.6,'feWS9simNFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33970,_binary '\0','/fuP4ZQt1hxbyLMwCWzu2rBrplmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23852952',5.8,1365,'en','Pelosi in the House','Documentarian Alexandra Pelosi offers a candid, behind-the-scenes chronicle of the life of her mother and Speaker of the United States House of Representatives, Nancy Pelosi, through her career milestones leading up to the inauguration of President Joseph Biden in January 2021.','/dqoyg81cnNRDhHPRK2EnDdh2jPN.jpg','2022-12-13',110,'Released','A home movie by Alexandra Pelosi.','Pelosi in the House',1054638,1.7321,5,'yH8YujtJo3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33971,_binary '\0','/fBUaeRfD2mu6T9vNZ1IR3yhccdP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23853982',6.5,21786,'it','Parthenope','Parthenope, born in the sea near Naples in 1950, is beautiful, enigmatic, and intelligent. She is shamelessly courted by many. However, beauty comes at a cost.','/k3BL39ca5pliALDTzUdC9ZIB9gk.jpg','2024-10-24',137,'Released','Is she a siren or a myth?','Parthenope',1109255,8.6258,6.7,'AQBB13EI7vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33972,_binary '\0','/AjlTyTNlMzAFvoF65uM7d97EwQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23856264',6.7,1245,'fr','Toni, en famille','Toni has spent her entire life putting other people’s needs before her own. When she was 20 years old, she was pushed by her mother to join a TV singing competition, becoming a national star. Twenty years and five children later, she is a full-time mom who spends all her time and effort on raising her teenage kids. As she helps her children plan their future after graduation, she begins to imagine what her life could be if - for once - she did what she really wanted. Will she be able to turn her life around and dare to be something other than a mother and a daughter?','/kLtdTVkjB5e9ynoUmDTz7W99P3V.jpg','2023-09-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Toni',989224,2.1745,6.635,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33973,_binary '\0','/qQhqjY7sdOGOrzKTcJWgXhoJ6GH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385882',6.3,1378,'fr','Vic + Flo ont vu un ours','Two recently released prisoners learn to live in a sugar shack deep in the forest.','/bBU3PPEAOsPa1Zk9qOJOZ5nILLP.jpg','2013-09-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Vic + Flo Saw a Bear',160160,1.7504,5.6,'TmX11-CUeR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33974,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2385952',4.9,1323,'en','Gang Money Run','A struggling musician falls for a charismatic burlesque dancer while getting entangled with hired guns and a border town gang bent on killing him.','/iujdlgbRWcCAGnglD9RtkqcmrZs.jpg','2014-04-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Gang Money Run',337206,0.8832,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33975,_binary '\0','/i2PQLKOun5HzRMuGEG6tzeBIcbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386237',4.9,20307,'en','Malevolent','A brother-sister team who fake paranormal encounters for cash get more than they bargained for when a job at a haunted estate turns very, very real.','/gbq5yQTQ1AfcBQb0y4ozUPTzd8Y.jpg','2018-12-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Malevolent',481375,3.044,5.01,'kJ3tMPVvE6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33976,_binary '\0','/i7pZrEkDs7LecD6KVFREniPkY6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23862640',5.1,1689,'tl','Pamasahe','A penniless mother, with her infant child, takes on a journey by land and sea to find her husband in Manila. But this trip won\'t be free for she has to use her body to get to her destination.','/9bm8wS2LnKKOuDyp3WSe5pgoLkp.jpg','2022-12-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Pamasahe',1041898,1.3189,6.3,'7QxwnPVejLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33977,_binary '\0','/21AC1SV8rVwYIA1J4NbWQNLCTJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386278',5.1,9064,'en','Haunt','An introverted teen sparks with his new neighbor, and together the couple begins to explore the haunted house that his family has unknowingly just purchased.','/8WusI9Anntdu3yMKir1zPM2Vhka.jpg','2014-06-27',86,'Released','The Feeding Never Ends','Haunt',146243,1.919,5.3,'b-iEIPCmfak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33978,_binary '\0','/5SAozzEWrGcrYmU0il2NO6PohjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386285',6,6001,'en','Road to Paloma','While Native American Wolf is being pursued by the FBI for having taken the law into his own hands, when his mother was raped and killed on their reservation he crosses paths with Cash, a down and out musician who is coping with the end of his marriage. An unlikely friendship develops, as they ride together towards the Teton mountain range, where Wolf will spread his mothers ashes.','/cM0IitlIIS5kzdUPqyGTvl79TOY.jpg','2014-04-12',91,'Released','On the road. On the run.','Road to Paloma',268060,3.8869,5.8,'xLcueCRRtjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33979,_binary '\0','/vawlXCVAF1ls0aOYKSUcZtP7V8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386327',6.2,1513,'en','The Institute','Thousands of participants in a San Francisco-based alternate reality game end up getting more than they bargained for. Told from the players’ perspectives, the film looks over the precipice at an emergent new art form where the real world and fictional narratives merge to create unforeseen and often unsettling consequences. Examining counter-culture, new religious movements and street art, this film takes the viewer on a journey into a secret underground world teeming just beneath the surface of everyday life.','/mrgeNjB4lVeQZDmhVOwnajBw5QZ.jpg','2013-10-11',92,'Released','Is it a cult? Is it a game? Or is it a life-changing adventure...','The Institute',159988,1.5954,6.1,'ZnJIA7oqqcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33980,_binary '\0','/9LnbH36b9L85azfbbaXmgJQBVsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386404',6.3,23651,'en','He Never Died','When Jack learns his long-lost daughter was taken by a crime syndicate, he confronts his demons and wages a brutal fight to save her.','/vzqwe4uuINJhbPqvlbVShBnCvHv.jpg','2015-12-18',99,'Released','Bullets. Blood. Bingo.','He Never Died',279690,3.8284,6.214,'7apn63fyu_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33981,_binary '\0','/46vzYSLeRxPwYU02Ojn4VHdeTOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23864864',6.5,2858,'hi','जोरम','A father is on the run with his little baby girl to escape the ghosts of his past and the forces that want him dead.','/r5QNn8wyKlVb4J5tRmhNFvqmT68.jpg','2023-12-07',117,'Released',NULL,'Joram',1063708,1.1516,7.5,'XOCbjto_DFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33982,_binary '\0','/h3KN24PrOheHVYs9ypuOIdFBEpX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2386490',7.4,183151,'en','How to Train Your Dragon: The Hidden World','As Hiccup fulfills his dream of creating a peaceful dragon utopia, Toothless’ discovery of an untamed, elusive mate draws the Night Fury away. When danger mounts at home and Hiccup’s reign as village chief is tested, both dragon and rider must make impossible decisions to save their kind.','/xvx4Yhf0DVH8G4LzNISpMfFBDy2.jpg','2019-01-03',104,'Released','Fly on your own. Find your way home.','How to Train Your Dragon: The Hidden World',166428,17.1275,7.8,'5DEdq57E5ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33983,_binary '\0','/fmNoWqkvGmdZqwKUAWtnFugk4WV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23865712',6.2,6177,'hi','कड़क सिंह','AK Shrivastav, a quirky patient suffering from retrograde amnesia, uncovers the reason behind his condition while trying to recollect his life accurately','/eB7VUbPWvbohPvmYn22XAtpmcvU.jpg','2023-11-24',136,'Released',NULL,'Kadak Singh',1072758,1.2977,5.938,'RryFB9nXC8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33984,_binary '\0','/oPsRr7AfNLw6XaPuMpvkWK0bIUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23865918',5.2,9268,'te','పెద్ది','In a village that doesn\'t officially exist, a laborer\'s unmatched athletic talent becomes his weapon to fight for his people\'s right to be recognized.','/kJAJNNBYlbqAcpTDxBNnaILSMTy.jpg','2026-06-03',189,'Released','Hurt. Bruised. But not beaten.','Peddi',1057265,8.3759,5.688,'AdEE5xFQelY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33985,_binary '\0','/swQaCEzhR0pZxyeIpi25MYYz2LB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23865942',3.9,1741,'hi','सरज़मीं','Set in Kashmir, the film follows an Indian Army officer who discovers that his estranged son has joined a militant group.','/xiO5hTN7X4764Bi0eqXSGUltSbA.jpg','2025-07-25',137,'Released',NULL,'Sarzameen',1218602,1.7444,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33986,_binary '\0','/aIKxC8mGq44EUDLPYw1ckCwciqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23871504',6.8,1518,'ko','올빼미','Korea, 1645 - Joseon Dynasty: a partially blind and gifted acupuncturist, Gyeong-su, is invited to work alongside the royal physician in the palace of King Injo, just before the crown prince Sohyeon returns after having been held captive by the Qing Dynasty. Prince Sohyeon and his father begin to differ in opinion on the future direction of their dynasty, leading King Injo to suffer from severe anxiety and paranoia. One night, Gyeong-su witnesses prince Sohyeon\'s death. Disbelieved as a witness on account of his blindness, Gyeong-su must struggle to reveal the truth while not falling prey to the power-hungry conspirators of the palace.','/cTePuecC5fJvo66yVaG1wKh9vwR.jpg','2022-11-23',118,'Released','The crown prince is dead. The only witness is a blind man.','The Night Owl',806128,2.6269,7.336,'z5rPprTas88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33987,_binary '\0','/2ombmAHOI5oTP6YtG0qPtg5Whna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23871574',5.6,1501,'en','Dr. Jason II: Lights & Shadows','A satanic alliance tries to pave the way for the birth of the Antichrist.','/32Sz2PyhZaA4Su2ANioMsmXYCqI.jpg','2024-05-15',62,'Released','Breathe in. Breathe out.','Dr. Jason II: Lights & Shadows',1436914,1.2059,7.4,'IeG2p7Vn6DY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33988,_binary '\0','/yBMGM7x8lPXUlmTNfCLZvHbpJmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23872640',4.6,7334,'en','Dirty Angels','During the United States\' 2021 withdrawal from Afghanistan, a group of female soldiers posing as medical relief are sent back in to rescue a group of kidnapped teenagers caught between ISIS and the Taliban.','/3O3qSGmjRGc10hMwFul8WDxKE5t.jpg','2024-12-11',104,'Released','Fight your way out.','Dirty Angels',1043905,8.8064,6.098,'YBwoSa3n8Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33989,_binary '\0','/2sza8BjMdHUBmmzMKc0XET7C25z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387408',5.2,7051,'en','The Damned','After suffering the recent loss of his wife, David Reynolds decides to take his family on a cathartic trip to her home village in Columbia. While en route, they get into a car accident and seek refuge in a secluded inn. While there they find a mysterious young girl, Ana Maria, locked up with cryptic symbols painted on the walls of her cell. Shocked by the treatment of her caretaker, the family sets Ana free only to realize that she is possessed by an evil spirit from centuries past. What’s worse, the spirit can jump from person to person, creating a deadly dynamic amongst the once loving family. Now, David must figure out a way to lock the spirit up for good before it destroys him and his family.','/jtTlnB7jOfEBiK5eVSLUMWR6aKg.jpg','2014-06-20',87,'Released','Heaven help us.','The Damned',258086,2.9544,5.5,'HcaVqCbsXro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33990,_binary '\0','/oLuAgHcYk9UrulfFJCmYfcnvmgB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387433',6.3,85774,'en','Dark Skies','From the producers of Paranormal Activity, Insidious, and Sinister comes Dark Skies: a supernatural thriller that follows a young family living in the suburbs. As husband and wife Daniel and Lacey Barret witness an escalating series of disturbing events involving their family, their safe and peaceful home quickly unravels. When it becomes clear that the Barret family is being targeted by an unimaginably terrifying and deadly force, Daniel and Lacey take matters in their own hands to solve the mystery of what is after their family.','/euLgEo2kvuLjYxbfOekWF3l82t6.jpg','2013-02-21',97,'Released','Once you have been chosen. You belong to them.','Dark Skies',145135,7.1735,6.377,'K8iLp1xQtPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33991,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387495',7.3,2275,'hi','Jalpari','Tomboy Shreya coaxes her widower father Dev to take her to their ancestral village in Haryana something he is not too keen about. Eventually she gets her way and along with her dad, her brother Sam and granny, she reaches her destination only to understand why her father had been putting off the trip for years.','/d4fYsWKlcATrjNgjrlRKKEnF64X.jpg','2012-08-31',95,'Released','The Desert Mermaid','Jalpari',149082,1.0099,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33992,_binary '\0','/vwIpLee6CEkx3kYSFANEUWVc3u1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387499',5.9,72760,'en','Keeping Up with the Joneses','An ordinary suburban couple finds it’s not easy keeping up with the Joneses – their impossibly gorgeous and ultra-sophisticated new neighbors – especially when they discover that Mr. and Mrs. “Jones” are covert operatives.','/yvWcTrRCzE4C2hkd2wV4erPuKCn.jpg','2016-10-20',105,'Released','They lived a normal life... Until the Joneses moved in.','Keeping Up with the Joneses',331313,8.0566,6.089,'nPfYXXg65qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33993,_binary '\0','/cxNQSKoSNazlrcIU1PSGc2EIK3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387513',6.7,5836,'es','Libertador','Bolívar was instrumental in Latin America’s struggle for independence from the Spanish Empire, and is today considered one of the most influential politicians and emancipators in American history. Libertador is told from the viewpoint of Bolívar, portrayed by Ramírez, about his quests and epic military campaigns, which covered twice the territory Alexander the Great conquered, and his vision to unify South America.','/7KpEs3jrHT5mRNCyTcJepzJh4z3.jpg','2013-09-09',119,'Released','His army never conquered. It liberated.','The Liberator',132342,2.0141,6.8,'4CkGqclYbeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33994,_binary '\0','/zoU4jiKH2UMgFmBHhbclxyVym9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23875342',6.3,2986,'te','ముఖచిత్రం','Dr. Rajkumar, a plastic surgeon marries Mahati, a shy & traditional village girl , leaving his his childhood love Maya Fernandez heartbroken. A tragedy strikes the couple, months after their marraige, which leads to a plastic surgery later, Maya \'becomes\' Mahati.','/j7WpuYoWoyZ0ZtGcCJTD424aKvj.jpg','2022-12-09',122,'Released',NULL,'Mukhachitram',1055772,1.403,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33995,_binary '\0','/3ZW8D196Ckh683dqKZMEH2Vnb8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt23875550',6.5,6077,'kn','ಉಪೇಂದ್ರ ಇಂಟೆಲಿಜೆನ್ಸ್','Set in a fictional world, the story is about the psychological conflict between a king in a town and an extraordinary man, and how that man, through his cunning and master minded plans takes over everything, takes control of the entire town, becomes a dictator.','/tWoeysV4ro6wn4TE0QgqMuo6Val.jpg','2024-12-20',132,'Released',NULL,'UI',984500,1.3663,5.7,'eGx2kFakx44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33996,_binary '\0','/sbFcNaLJUwMr4XlqwfJiZhy7c6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387559',6.3,86275,'en','Delivery Man','An affable underachiever finds out he\'s fathered 533 children through anonymous donations to a fertility clinic 20 years ago. Now he must decide whether or not to come forward when 142 of them file a lawsuit to reveal his identity.','/huXHYDclKT4RM1OvS3O7SXYRAU0.jpg','2013-10-10',105,'Released','You\'re never quite ready for what life delivers.','Delivery Man',146239,6.3087,6.255,'LoXphwjmb4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33997,_binary '\0','/5qzqlw0cpPgOy7xS9RQorCGhm7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387627',7.4,1476,'ur','زندہ بھاگ','Three young men try to escape the reality of their everyday lives and succeed in ways they had least expected.','/4bwobqHJyK93zRXyAaVQHVRkXsD.jpg','2013-09-20',115,'Released','There are many ways out... but no shortcuts.','Zinda Bhaag',220923,0.7451,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33998,_binary '\0','/bDgKTaTOcMoMWWL5Bh8PE9JaoP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387692',6,1231,'fr','Souvenir','A former European song contest singer, fading away in a pâté factory, falls in love with a young, aspiring boxer. Together, they decide she should attempt a comeback.','/v7CeTKALmIy0BmLalGNSPnpVxzY.jpg','2016-12-21',90,'Released',NULL,'Souvenir',408258,1.1617,5.6,'-ucI827QtoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(33999,_binary '\0','/tXsPURNrGxI54Lcs5ji4fCYGAKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2387806',6.8,1975,'de','Heute bin ich blond','The true story of a young woman whose lust for life means she is determined to be so very much more than just another cancer patient.','/3cVZAL8mL3fi7nbE2zZRKg2KogM.jpg','2013-03-27',117,'Released',NULL,'The Girl with Nine Wigs',170125,1.9295,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34000,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388621',6.8,1573,'en','1982','1982, a film inspired by true events at the onset of the crack epidemic in Philadelphia, tells the story of a father and his efforts to protect his gifted daughter from the insidious epidemic which has literally come home via her drug-addicted mother. As his wife becomes more distant and unreliable, he struggles to raise his daughter on his own, while still striving to help his wife become clean. In the process, he learns some hard truths about his marriage and his life, which will ultimately test him as a parent, a husband, and a man.','/suJnawPMpozKwbOhQn0qqHkJoIX.jpg','2013-12-31',90,'Released',NULL,'1982',215918,1.3585,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34001,_binary '\0','/jRxc6dVw7AxRUuOtFxmGop0IZ5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388637',6.4,23767,'en','Ain\'t Them Bodies Saints','Bob Muldoon and Ruth Guthrie, an impassioned young outlaw couple on an extended crime spree, are finally apprehended by lawmen after a shootout in the Texas hills. Although Ruth wounds a local officer, Bob takes the blame. But four years later, Bob escapes from prison and sets out to find Ruth and their daughter, born during his incarceration.','/xkGkVjeMcvEg7P3VxWy8wYBJ7Dv.jpg','2013-07-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Ain\'t Them Bodies Saints',152748,4.5194,6.1,'L6FhsOYXRAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34002,_binary '\0','/f7H0215XAgJqgdn6MyGOx6tMnB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388705',6.2,2391,'en','Molly Maxwell','At Phoenix Progressive School, students take notes lying on parlor couches and are encouraged to explore their gifts through electives like break-dancing and graphic-novel writing. In the midst of all this liberal pedagogy and budding talent, Molly Maxwell feels unexceptional, until she falls for her attractive English teacher, Ben.','/x0sIALqTCCN4cUT44H1vUwK2T6p.jpg','2013-01-06',91,'Released','Love doesn\'t act its age.','Molly Maxwell',159667,1.9385,6.5,'HKvTV8acLbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34003,_binary '\0','/o0EQmMhHA6Gpf7MS7KxPafWqTPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388715',6.6,151503,'en','Oculus','A woman tries to exonerate her brother\'s murder conviction by proving that the crime was committed by a supernatural phenomenon.','/yCzR1yKRLiJyTDLgY1ppazXEmdE.jpg','2014-04-03',104,'Released','You see what it wants you to see.','Oculus',157547,7.3923,6.5,'gA1dCfn8PBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34004,_binary '\0','/pApaVlxJCp2o4mrzCAD3AaLjq77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388771',6.5,70045,'en','Mowgli: Legend of the Jungle','A human child raised by wolves, must face off against a menacing tiger named Shere Khan, as well as his own origins.','/clRnzMsFoMIdC7I5JsG6dnnHH8l.jpg','2018-11-25',105,'Released','The greatest journey is finding where you belong.','Mowgli: Legend of the Jungle',407436,11.45,6.475,'OVBjPpUlQrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34005,_binary '\0','/gb5KKGJV428D72LfYYUd95bDrnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388805',4.8,2958,'nl','Verliefd op Ibiza','Kevin is a young footballer who recently made a multimillion deal by transferring to FC Barcelona. He hardly realizes what is happening to him. Too young, too rich, too beautiful. His girlfriend Elza knows how Kevin should spend his millions. She is eagerly anticipating her birthday where Kevin will ask her the most important question of all. Kevin\'s grandmother Karla observes it all from the sidelines with concern. Fortunately there is the down-to-earth event planner Lizzy who shows Kevin the meaning of true love.','/srfg90ModqcMNpfeVxEkn5fAxlp.jpg','2013-01-30',117,'Released',NULL,'Loving Ibiza',164130,1.4051,4.9,'9lHcgtH1bo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34006,_binary '\0','/jwRR9WUUIvRTkwBsVwtQ2snqCXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388819',6.7,3736,'tr','Yozgat Blues','Sabri, a barber in Yozgat - a very small city in the middle of Anatolia - has an emotional breakdown when he runs into Yavuz and Neşe, who come to the town to sing in a small music hall-bar. This will also affect Neşe and Yavuz. None of their desires will be how they want them to be.','/5epq58iq9Ql5GAyVskTpqg2tSyT.jpg','2013-12-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Yozgat Blues',215653,0.8663,6.4,'U6GzpYNwVi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34007,_binary '\0','/drf11R7VV9IPIrYdVWB85Pe5Y0A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2388986',6.5,8354,'en','Paterno','After becoming the winningest coach in college football history, Joe Paterno is embroiled in Penn State\'s Jerry Sandusky sexual abuse scandal, challenging his legacy and forcing him to face questions of institutional failure regarding the victims.','/Ad4y2Cc2FcY1wOk3DH7HVWlrgEM.jpg','2018-04-07',105,'Released','The greater the legend, the harder the fall.','Paterno',467867,2.5318,6.2,'scI7dYdlzuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34008,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2389120',5.5,4149,'fa','گشت ارشاد‎','Three urban working poor young men who impersonate crew of a Guidance Patrol to earn money.','/xOyQ5T4J7ePZ0mtUOCwKhZenph2.jpg','2012-03-15',96,'Released',NULL,'The Guidance Patrol',420743,1.1113,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34009,_binary '\0','/1jpP5hIgpEX1mZK4uGZEVkwscJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2389182',6.7,21652,'en','Cheap Thrills','Recently fired and facing eviction, a new dad has his life turned upside down when he meets a wealthy couple who offer a path to financial security... but at a price.','/cnGzB8L2Y4oEyAZ4VvLxAwTRA3N.jpg','2013-03-08',88,'Released','What doesn\'t kill you makes you richer.','Cheap Thrills',175291,4.3422,6.4,'CvnMBY7DVC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),