gilantes to avenge the death of their trainer.','/ggtC5K3FJF7wGmf3Tt5SMcTclkT.jpg','2014-11-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Ungli',303904,1.6071,5.683,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34021,_binary '\0','/dsqlBtXS5DJBrFYTIYJuSD5YatF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2392672',6.9,7740,'fr','Réalité','A wanna-be director is given 48 hours by a producer to find the best groan of pain, worthy of an Oscar, as the only condition to back his film.','/l6aty0lfqsTefZ5xduwT7D44N1q.jpg','2015-02-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Reality',179150,1.7049,7.055,'Qr6D6Z7IAAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34022,_binary '\0','/sO1rHbQgxHpwAznH00OxaHnqNUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2392748',4.5,4480,'en','Scorched Earth','In a post-apocalyptic future, bounty hunter Attica Gage pursues a ruthless outlaw at the head of a dangerous criminal gang.','/4IHyd8EPufdS4WrACaembE0wY9b.jpg','2018-02-02',93,'Released','Before the end of the world, Gage has some people to kill.','Scorched Earth',347111,3.476,5.2,'BjkX0ilJSXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34023,_binary '\0','/yGlO1l2hfWOGLiQk2oriI18WkYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2392810',6.2,2053,'en','Queen & Country','In this sequel to Hope and Glory (1987), Bill Rohan has grown up and is drafted into the army, where he and his eccentric best mate, Percy, battle their snooty superiors on the base and look for love in town.','/hgFgNutcHskZFwE3Cfu8McXWjGl.jpg','2015-01-07',114,'Released',NULL,'Queen & Country',266084,2.3486,6.1,'7S6TKqorNBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34024,_binary '\0','/vtqJ6ffqPTaE9HoABwOurVR2V9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2392830',6.4,6757,'en','A Quiet Passion','The story of American poet Emily Dickinson from her early days as a young schoolgirl to her later years as a reclusive, unrecognized artist.','/k2WWlrMbuINyzDCfBuD48eN22QY.jpg','2016-10-07',125,'Released',NULL,'A Quiet Passion',368942,2.5012,6,'13-5EpGlcZc','YouTube','Trail