2-10-18',107,'Released','You never walk alone','The Marathon',138686,1.2887,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34074,_binary '\0','/fIIU1ZDR1d3kb10SRiiF7YhzA8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2401715',6,4074,'en','The Devil\'s Violinist','The life story of Italian violinist and composer, Niccolò Paganini, who rose to fame as a virtuoso in the early 19th Century.','/ja0TH6VlH2s72OEZeHJtAN82Dy7.jpg','2013-01-30',122,'Released','Fame is desire, love is a curse.','The Devil\'s Violinist',191820,2.8931,6.583,'FTEb3RsN4jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34075,_binary '\0','/lVrii1oDEWb9kLWcabthvlVCUIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24017902',4.7,2044,'sv','Karusell','Park manager Fiona is tasked with taking care of some former friends who won an exclusive private sneak preview of Halloween at Liseberg – a whole night, all alone in the empty park. But cotton candy, lovely rides and lots of laughter soon turn into something completely different, as they realize they are not alone in the park. And the night of dreams quickly turns into a true nightmare.','/dhTFWMto4o6ATe6W58bFU8AGUje.jpg','2023-10-20',93,'Released','An exclusive private Halloween night at Liseberg quickly turns into a true nightmare.','Carousel',1058078,1.792,6.1,'F0XS83Js2yY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34076,_binary '\0','/sg2ABfteLaTvYKe3LPPmQlZMrvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2401807',5,26554,'en','Rage','When the Russian mob kidnaps the daughter of a reformed criminal, he rounds up his old crew and seeks his own brand of justice.','/1pC6xTd15iLIs5De7JKQfrDmKyd.jpg','2014-05-09',98,'Released','The past never stays dead','Rage',242310,5.3886,5.254,'KoREt4C6l3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34077,_binary '\0','/arULWjWheaUhyOyn6aNhsFZoMiz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2401825',6.4,1296,'zh','无问西东','From World War, to revolution and ultimately rebirth, Forever Young is the story of four generations spanning a hundred years of modern Chinese history. Each generation faces its own unique set of challenges. Up against corporate corruption, the trials and tribulations of the cultural revolution, and one\'s duty to nation in time of war, they are faced with choosing their individual paths through history. But as the challenges and turmoil of each generation may differ as time changes, what was learned in the past cannot help but effect the choices that are made in the future as it is passed down from generation to generation. And that is the universal message that being true to yourself is precious. It is the source of strength that empowers one to become the person they want to be, to march forward as far as their hearts desire, into the future.','/szMFnofjf6RZN596GVlDVmf1CSP.jpg','2018-01-12',138,'Released',NULL,'Forever Young',289930,1.9028,7,'9WqplNR9Rp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34078,_binary '\0','/xNykrL50OsygNTtFuHCw9U0D3eu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2401878',7.2,79179,'en','Anomalisa','An inspirational speaker becomes reinvigorated after meeting a lively woman who shakes up his mundane existence.','/4DJ1zNr4Y6q7zQ27goEYla46VdO.jpg','2015-12-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Anomalisa',291270,3.9479,7.1,'WQkHA3fHk_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34079,_binary '\0','/cgLiIJe1aW0J007EUUnWUpMX2Wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402085',5.7,7346,'en','Jimi: All Is by My Side','A drama based on Jimi Hendrix\'s life as he left New York City for London, where his career took off.','/dsNU5nwOy30WfTet32cLiOsFkkN.jpg','2013-09-07',118,'Released',NULL,'Jimi: All Is by My Side',192133,3.1487,5.6,'981Ql4R2xC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34080,_binary '\0','/yRlYnL6EuFuYOU2j0VR0GSUcSFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402091',6.8,5361,'sv','Återträffen','A film between fiction and reality, highlighting questions about group dynamics and established hierarchies. A group of people meet for their high school reunion 20 years later. One of them talks about her being bullied and outcast and soon the former classmates fall back to the roles they used to have back in school. But this is just half of the film.','/2m4ncyUtpBQbYZoSxwrR80Nkq6H.jpg','2013-11-15',88,'Released',NULL,'The Reunion',202573,1.1601,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34081,_binary '\0','/h0qweIIYMy6aI3loldAsOEmCuCS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402095',6.3,2342,'en','Harvest Love','A young widow and her nine year-old son spend a week at her family’s pear farm in Washington state, where they both fall in love with small town farm life, and she falls for the guy who has been managing the farm.','/y7feCJdtNmxERcLxWAddB84w9D0.jpg','2017-09-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Harvest Love',475375,2.2341,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34082,_binary '\0','/usWzZFCKNBhVzD96ESLFEzETwPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402101',6.2,50499,'en','Dark Places','A woman who survived the brutal killing of her family as a child is forced to confront the events of that day.','/acJXtT4ZX7nWIhOaCfSAGBxFw71.jpg','2015-04-08',113,'Released','In 1985, her entire family was murdered. 30 years later, the truth emerges.','Dark Places',182560,7.474,5.9,'pbQib4tE9Lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34083,_binary '\0','/kBenhxySFb2NhRJjCVLRCiTqYPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402105',6.1,28276,'en','Dom Hemingway','After spending 12 years in prison for keeping his mouth shut, notorious safe-cracker Dom Hemingway is back on the streets of London looking to collect what he\'s owed.','/hvrUPdZUDlSn1S4KCW5IdIMGS5D.jpg','2013-11-14',93,'Released','I want my money plus interest… and a present','Dom Hemingway',192134,4.0709,5.817,'Et0AWf5mjbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34084,_binary '\0','/qFVv6qw6LqotUQofdwKSvxJfLnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402157',6.3,73586,'en','The November Man','An ex-CIA operative is brought back in on a