uble-bass player originally from Albania. It\'s love at first sight. Confronted by Anka, Paulo finds himself out on the street. Despite Ilir\'s misgivings, Paulo moves in with him. One day, when Paulo promises that he will love Ilir for the rest of his life, Ilir leaves the city and doesn\'t return. A few days later, Paulo finds out that Ilir is in jail, and the two lovers embark on an heart-breaking relationship.','/ngNKNQjNDC1OeWLajeVULBLiKvT.jpg','2012-12-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Walls',136437,1.5787,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34091,_binary '\0','/2giW19Qb8Lmyd5XCyVU2avABvhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402927',7.3,155017,'en','Carol','In 1950s New York, a department-store clerk who dreams of a better life falls for an older, married woman.','/cJeled7EyPdur6TnCA5GYg0UVna.jpg','2015-11-20',118,'Released','Some people change your life forever.','Carol',258480,7.3863,7.5,'0FLIajZa_Y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34092,_binary '\0','/2Oq3s9XabKVgMzisEDtelthiDgC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2402985',5.4,3155,'en','Ping Pong Summer','In 1985 a summer vacation in Ocean City, Md., changes the life of a shy white teen who\'s obsessed with table tennis and hip-hop music.','/o2GYdbshaBeWZn0V4tFLyiyg0BS.jpg','2014-06-06',92,'Released','1985 - Wish You Were Here!','Ping Pong Summer',246011,1.5559,5.7,'LqE32n-K7Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34093,_binary '\0','/qJcUobr34c77YRQQ7zacTNrBdKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2403021',5.4,55713,'en','The Green Inferno','A group of student activists travel from New York City to the Amazon to save the rainforest. However, once they arrive in this vast green landscape, they soon discover that they are not alone… and that no good deed goes unpunished.','/nh2EAkJEWaOFdzK2DMaITrdmM2a.jpg','2014-09-04',100,'Released','Fear will eat you alive.','The Green Inferno',171424,6.5194,5.747,'aGGPTlrX_PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.0