ak free and get his revenge.','/3uwNlBJfgWCraGXwZAwnkwqMJMS.jpg','2014-10-10',98,'Released','The kidnapping was just the beginning.','Catch Hell',293633,2.1607,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34098,_binary '\0','/uW6Xctrs07bb8J0mZ65zWKg8Y5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2403883',5.5,1647,'en','Hotel Noir','Los Angeles, 1958: a detective holes up in a downtown hotel awaiting killers to come get him. During the course of one night he will meet various occupants of the hotel and the truth of how he came to be in his present situation will be revealed.','/mM7lFpYA2IEpXluO3XB7UU5aZ7i.jpg','2012-10-09',97,'Released','Check your reservations at the door.','Hotel Noir',135047,3.0867,5.7,'RZuN8YiCqbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34099,_binary '\0','/nFgQU011NrKHPKDxjow24lncMck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2403961',5.8,6855,'es','Séptimo','Buenos Aires, Argentina. Sebastián, a successful lawyer, leaves his ex-wife\'s condo, located on the seventh floor of an apartment building, to take his two children to school. While they run down the stairs, he uses the elevator. Once on the ground floor, Sebastián awaits the arrival of the children.','/dTSJHOcV8adoDYEx7IYdRwlV3D3.jpg','2013-09-05',84,'Released','Every second counts','7th Floor',214761,2.0201,5.8,'U2bgKiy9e40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34100,_binary '\0','/bldgj2IeKr7poONE7h2wHhomPBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404027',6.8,2309,'hi','Arjun: The Warrior Prince','Legend knows him as an archer of unwavering focus, the soldier who fought a battle in his own heart before taking up arms against his enemy. This is the untold story of Arjun, hero of the Mahabharata. A precocious talent plunged from boyhood and innocence into a murky world of deceit and betrayal, coming of age to become the most powerful warrior of his time. From the dusty plains of Hastinapur to the icy peaks of the Himalayas, Arjun: The Warrior Prince is the story of a man discovering what it takes to be a hero.','/bbyNAeBppsHUE0ki5BgikCdb6s.jpg','2012-05-25',96,'Released','The untold story of India’s greatest warrior.','Arjun: The Warrior Prince',117369,1.6386,6.163,'6K-R-Q0YRtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34101,_binary '\0','/xtW7sFSRHWnWQTDQLnvKqZsV9R0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404171',6.8,1561,'en','Altman','Robert Altman\'s life and career contained multitudes. This father of American independent cinema left an indelible mark, not merely on the evolution of his art form, but also on the western zeitgeist. With its use of rare interviews, representative film clips, archival images, and musings from his family and most recognizable collaborators, Altman is a dynamic and heartfelt mediation on an artist whose expression, passion and appetite knew few bounds.','/h83e01Qrjrnonwwm70c8qdgb6ww.jpg','2014-08-01',95,'Released','Maverick. Auteur. Rebel.','Altman',278086,2.2705,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34102,_binary '\0','/bwMxFhvGXUBWjWK64lnWJ9VUhCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404181',7.3,35155,'en','Belle','Dido Elizabeth Bell, the illegitimate, mixed-race daughter of a Royal Navy admiral, plays an important role in the campaign to abolish slavery in England.','/qCK00C3L0bM5jphoYU0gFpG3Hly.jpg','2013-05-01',105,'Released','Based on the inspiring true story','Belle',205601,4.3043,7.1,'bTz5VjBscGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34103,_binary '\0','/amLGmoZO78zXWD7pScbAC5U8RzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404217',7.3,3074,'ja','永遠の0','A brother and sister learn their biological grandfather was a kamikaze pilot who died during World War II. During their research into his life, they get conflicting accounts from his former comrades about his character and how he joined his squadron.','/jw4aoqckCNARJqtWyvRlH7cQkWE.jpg','2013-12-20',144,'Released','Find life in the sky.','The Eternal Zero',248087,8.3334,7,'123ihd2TcFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34104,_binary '\0','/pl2zr5efo9Dz1fi2gpsslGwEQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404233',5.4,137191,'en','Gods of Egypt','A common thief joins a mythical god on a quest through Egypt.','/hzH7fwaTyQNITLo40Hu3R7cVMqv.jpg','2016-02-25',127,'Released','The battle for eternity begins','Gods of Egypt',205584,15.8288,5.7,'cMVxECWC-vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34105,_binary '\0','/1V4coRGM1ENYR5xVUO4h11B6tCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404299',5.2,3177,'en','Lovesick','The story of Charlie Darby, who has everything going for him: a great job, friends, family, the whole package. The one thing Charlie doesn\'t have is love, because every time he gets close, he goes clinically insane. When he meets the perfect girl, Charlie must overcome his psychosis to claim his chance at true love.','/mxFjqVyBjzvjLrBQ5wKvxdC3OyL.jpg','2014-04-24',100,'Released','Love Hurts','Lovesick',319389,1.7886,5,'LNHihFE8Osw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34106,_binary '\0','/mt4cfjeFHNKda7KDSvvJlG50swc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404311',6.3,129027,'en','The Family','After ratting out his Mafia cohorts, Giovanni Manzoni and his family enter the Witness Protection Program and relocate to a sleepy town in France. Despite the best efforts of their handler to keep them in line, Giovanni (now called Fred Blake), his wife and children can\'t help but resort to doing things the \"family\" way. However, their dependence on such old habits places everyone in danger from vengeful mobsters.','/x2arN02JFsZcDKmBb0SIjG8Smc8.jpg','2013-09-13',111,'Released','Some call it organized crime. Others call it family.','The Family',112205,10.4558,6.363,'-SwDU04Oeak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34107,_binary '\0','/cKrWGcWHKcergHyDKxKGbgcUsMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404425',7.3,66461,'en','Woman in Gold','Maria Altmann, an octogenarian Jewish refugee, takes on the government to recover artwork she believes rightfully belongs to her family.','/6eoj6bozvgwNuDV3vOrqlvrCrX.jpg','2015-03-20',109,'Released','Justice is priceless.','Woman in Gold',304357,7.7679,7.3,'wu9JeTX6Sdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34108,_binary '\0','/4qxZJRYe4ezA5J1sidnV7vuaYaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404435',6.9,249195,'en','The Magnificent Seven','Looking to mine for gold, greedy industrialist Bartholomew Bogue seizes control of the Old West town of Rose Creek. With their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.','/ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg','2016-09-14',132,'Released','Justice has a number.','The Magnificent Seven',333484,15.0058,6.5,'q-RBA0xoaWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34109,_binary '\0','/8lnkl8KO096dI9iGvVqJ6wS2BVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404461',7.7,52696,'fr','Le passé','After four years apart, Ahmad returns to his wife Marie in Paris in order to progress their divorce. During his brief stay, he cannot help noticing the strained relationship between Marie and her daughter Lucie. As he attempts to improve matters between mother and daughter Ahmad unwittingly lifts the lid on a long buried secret...','/8nff89qjYN3Hck5G33xeRPsM8TZ.jpg','2013-05-17',130,'Released',NULL,'The Past',152780,3.2566,7.3,'Z2-_lt4kwXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34110,_binary '\0','/c0V8KAiuoWLXf7TfvwHK4yhIfb9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404463',6.6,190881,'en','The Heat','Uptight and straight-laced, FBI Special Agent Sarah Ashburn is a methodical investigator with a reputation for excellence--and hyper-arrogance. Shannon Mullins, one of Boston P.D.\'s \"finest,\" is foul-mouthed and has a very short fuse, and uses her gut instinct and street smarts to catch the most elusive criminals. Neither has ever had a partner, or a friend for that matter. When these two wildly incompatible law officers join forces to bring down a ruthless drug lord, they become the last thing anyone expected: buddies.','/yERBa1y5zNUOTRKQPiDCPIc2fuv.jpg','2013-06-27',117,'Released','They\'re just trying to stay alive long enough to kill each other.','The Heat',136795,10.5726,6.588,'1O3iRdiplB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34111,_binary '\0','/jfCfEhdFtotjSwP6bipQzk3eaoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404465',6.9,13183,'en','Troop Zero','In rural 1977 Georgia, a misfit girl dreams of life in outer space. When a national competition offers her a chance at her dream, to be recorded on NASA’s Golden Record, she recruits a makeshift troupe of Birdie Scouts, forging friendships that last a lifetime and beyond.','/yr1RzTrVIfS5n9zvClUfAtZDyUn.jpg','2019-02-01',94,'Released','Show the universe who you truly are.','Troop Zero',525946,3.3145,7,'Gi4C6GncmQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34112,_binary '\0','/cwksvHtgtfszBMEwc8x95IK0TMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404519',3.6,1299,'hi','3G','When Sam and Sheena are on vacation in the Fiji Islands, Sam buys a 3G enabled phone. Unforeseen events take place after he starts receiving unknown calls and finds his life at risk.','/9W0BufWYb6liaiAwIKGw4uwNgeY.jpg','2013-03-14',124,'Released','A Killer Connection','3G',178476,2.373,3.536,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34113,_binary '\0','/emx5mbzVkid36bjvKNteATRgE66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2404583',4.4,3266,'en','Ironclad 2: Battle for Blood','A survivor of the Great Siege of Rochester Castle fights to save his clan from from Celtic raiders. A sequel to the 2011 film, \"Ironclad.\"','/ms66USpYj5g5tjMZyvH6UMeYjK5.jpg','2014-03-14',108,'Released',NULL,'Ironclad 2: Battle for Blood',258251,1.2005,4.8,'KtTCcDpPJDU','Y