0','tt24059780',7.2,7433,'te','విరూపాక్ష','Set in a village named Rudravanam in 1990\'s, Surya along with his mother, visit there after a long time. Suddenly a series of mysterious deaths occur due to an unknown person\'s occult practice and whole village is scared. Will Surya find the person causing the deaths and save the village?','/fqMn4h9ctOyumII2nXDnm5mRTxQ.jpg','2023-04-20',146,'Released',NULL,'Virupaksha',1034590,2.3888,6.591,'UcOpgGt06FE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34119,_binary '\0','/w6hnBN92nY8sTCAS3iIzxe3uMF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24060354',5.8,2636,'ar','حوجن','When a human family moves into Hwjn and his family\'s house in a world where Jinn is compelled to live among humans, their lives are completely upended. Hwjn, who is forbidden by old regulations from mingling, unintentionally falls in love with the human daughter, Sawsan.','/rkrAsE5QGnmT9rJAjz3FAkRlikU.jpg','2024-01-04',126,'Released',NULL,'Hwjn',1073635,1.1767,5.4,'BU133GQzFB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34120,_binary '\0','/lBJR69jrQ8I84irRexFfO70v0EA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24060892',6,12148,'te','దె కాల్ హిమ్ ఓజి','Trained to fight in Japan, a man\'s peaceful life in exile abruptly ends when trouble pulls him back to Mumbai to help those he swore to protect.','/oWOJ4VMyF92IEcTmrQO0xFDqeyk.jpg','2025-09-24',155,'Released','Firestorm is coming.','They Call Him OG',1080365,2.3389,5.731,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34121,_binary '\0','/psJG4SMKuZ9ReaSEikxwOweH0kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2406252',7.1,22197,'fr','La Vénus à la fourrure','An enigmatic actress may have a hidden agenda when she auditions for a part in a misogynistic writer\'s play.','/b9pCYixO3ZO7tB303efB3O4nkqC.jpg','2013-05-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Venus in Fur',197082,4.4218,7.188,'Q1LZ6JoUkJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34122,_binary '\0','/g3hni0i9iAQ13jDGOFWavJFlojc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','