friendship and finding your voice when the stakes are as small (and as big) as a school desk.','/iwLSVYnGzM9MXg4KDORMbl1V52N.jpg','2024-11-29',135,'Released','CLASSROOM ELECTIONS, UNIVERSAL LESSONS.','Sthanarthi Sreekuttan',1012933,0.9401,6.833,'77iGcpEDZ_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34127,_binary '\0','/7CSILt4l54Kxsk0DzQTYPq9WojO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24068064',6.7,31225,'en','Reality','Augusta, Georgia, United States, June 3, 2017. After running some errands, Reality Winner returns home, where she is approached by two men.','/rTEYxSDo9aJTTbM0zuMMLgzJcUJ.jpg','2023-06-02',83,'Released','The truth cannot be redacted','Reality',985617,4.2368,6.4,'pZKeY3Tw6SI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34128,_binary '\0','/x1eYwWTT8KbT8MvZBioxJ4ctZ35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24070754',7.5,5445,'fr','Je verrai toujours vos visages','Since 2014, France\'s restorative justice programmes have offered a safe space for supervised dialogue between offenders and victims. Grégoire, Nawelle, and Sabine, victims of heists and violent robberies, agree to join one of these discussion groups alongside offenders Nassim, Issa, and Thomas, all convicted of violent robberies. Meanwhile Chloé, a victim of childhood sexual abuse, prepares for dialogue with her own agressor after learning he has moved back into town.','/ptJWIUOm3aA15rjz5SJJwS6WJU4.jpg','2023-03-29',115,'Released',NULL,'All Your Faces',1000492,3.7941,7.9,'h3XKroA-sTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34129,_binary '\0','/xAb8nHgo84sHZfuyfllg2b2VzsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24071398',5,1316,'en','Haunt Season','A masked maniac targets cast members at a suburban Halloween haunt attraction, turning their staged injuries into gruesome real-life horrors. As the terror escalates, the lines between performance and reality blur.','/9igACFphyrAPXwibMglCMMjVDe2.jpg','2024-10-04',81,'Released','Enter if you dare.','Haunt Season',1294496,1.5422,6.5,'YY5gzH-B-co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34130,_binary '\0','/xySCWwZVuU03xOsJfs1Qk8yG2DF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2407380',6.5,1832,'en','Test','San Francisco, 1985. Two opposites attract at a modern dance company. Together, their courage and resilience are tested as they navigate a world full of risks and promise, against the backdrop of a disease no one seems to know anything about.','/tTWRomgIMOoIB3CJLPlVbqSawEm.jpg','2013-06-29',89,'Released','Sometimes it\'s just a matter of chance','Test',226979,1.7642,6.7,'6T8Yqh73vXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34131,_binary '\0','/hWI96Kk02iDfO1fuTKU2rvwgzEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24074898',7.4,1466,'bn','প্রজাপতি','A retired 65-year-old widower lives alone as his wedding planner son runs a busy business, and he\'s determined to see his son get married.','/2lJ0skAUEoLmqOdWTAXhlj7hHLo.jpg','2022-12-23',142,'Released','Search for a friend','Projapati',922931,0.8531,7,'1SByTa7b8vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34132,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24075716',6.1,3084,'ml','ഇമ്പം','A young cartoonist forms unexpected connections at Shabdam Publishing House, where the elderly owner, Karunakaran, and proofreader Kathambari become integral parts of his creative journey.','/w8txX55lEELyDx9kSmqLApTvmay.jpg','2023-10-27',122,'Released',NULL,'Imbam',1044787,0.7547,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34133,_binary '\0','/lsfdEPDdBFNSPk4xKk3AG5tqfCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24076146',6.2,4708,'en','The Persian Version','When a large Iranian-American family gathers in New York City for the patriarch’s heart transplant, a family secret is uncovered and catapults the estranged mother and daughter into an exploration of the past.','/1nzBlZtebWJXY8ap0ibkgb3eMUr.jpg','2023-10-20',108,'Released','Based on a true story... sort of.','The Persian Version',1058620,2.1984,5.8,'PDrlpcv4vXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34134,_binary '\0','/1fCLekUeDF2NCgA3GEoLEmfvmYu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24079788',6.8,2755,'en','Victim/Suspect','Investigative journalist Rae de Leon travels nationwide to uncover and examine a shocking pattern: Young women tell the police they’ve been sexually assaulted, but instead of finding justice, they’re charged with the crime of making a false report, arrested, and even imprisoned by the system they believed would protect them.','/tGaFFNfqS6rH51LJS8a663OGwdO.jpg','2023-05-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Victim/Suspect',1058671,1.2365,6.989,'JoZaGvTpYTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34135,_binary '\0','/uTVejvgvXQHX03bO66mlJbSOC2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24079846',6.7,1853,'es','Heroico','Luis, an 18-year-old Mexican boy with indigenous roots, enters the Heroico Military College with the hope of securing a better future. There, he encounters a rigid and institutionally violent system designed to make him a perfect soldier.','/tRD18JW9iKqmwkQKvzPYDQetRoI.jpg','2023-09-21',88,'Released','There are no rights here, not even humans.','Heroic',958182,2.4832,7.2,'afXiHNTAXdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34136,_binary '\0','/dCZb9vMCNBL0eaNPtgexsjAxVVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2408040',6.3,4644,'hi','B.A. Pass','After losing his parents in a car accident, Mukesh stays at his Aunt\'s house in Delhi. Enrolled in a good for nothing course in college he finds peace by playing chess at the local cemetery, the rest of the times he worries over ways to make a living and taking care of his sisters. \'B.A.Pass\' is a story looking at the fatal promise of a new life. When Mukesh meets Sarika \'auntie\' at a kitty party, little does he know of the city and it\'s ways and means to survive. Sarika seduces Mukesh, shy and inexperienced he falls for her. What follows is a twist of destiny, a kind of story that appears in the tabloids as \'heinous acts of crime\'','/A9GhjUpw3bSJO9OLC1dDBfCgUHa.jpg','2012-08-30',95,'Released','Seduction Corruption Deception','B.A. Pass',222951,1.9482,5.436,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34137,_binary '\0','/986n9SAXsuxpPJzFAWK3azPknX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24082438',8.6,65630,'en','20 Days in Mariupol','As the Russian invasion begins, a team of Ukrainian journalists trapped in the besieged city of Mariupol struggle to continue their work documenting the war\'s atrocities.','/zIRp1IeuPh4GgqFCH3y0DQuY9xP.jpg','2023-07-14',94,'Released',NULL,'20 Days in Mariupol',1058616,4.488,8.088,'9H_Fg_5x4ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34138,_binary '\0','/3VjhZz7CrNSdKUIMYg4dVcyrRbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24082454',4.5,1757,'en','Perpetrator','Jonny Baptiste is a reckless teen sent to live with her estranged Aunt Hildie. On the event of her eighteenth birthday, she experiences a radical metamorphosis: a family spell that redefines her called Forevering. When several teen girls go missing at her new school, a mythically feral Jonny goes after the Perpetrator.','/fjTI6czy62GCsoI7G7fKghSrH2x.jpg','2023-09-01',101,'Released',NULL,'Perpetrator',1061656,2.0043,4.4,'EvkVyZPKhEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34139,_binary '\0','/d0WXOA6pQanoDBc60WtEaF5oM5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24082488',7.4,4153,'es','La memoria infinita','Augusto and Paulina have been together for 25 years. Eight years ago, he was diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s disease. Both fear the day he no longer recognizes her.','/dKIcHpK6EtKocvE2PHVfmkYtrdK.jpg','2023-08-11',85,'Released',NULL,'The Eternal Memory',1032760,2.2983,8,'v-hxO7_oEZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34140,_binary '\0','/zSR6cX7uJu9sXepVmSEc3FfugzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24082864',6.2,1232,'en','I\'ll Be Right There','Wanda wants to take care of everyone in her life. She barely has time for herself, not that she would know what to do with it anyway.','/jHbn6gQqEGFZXExp7oxuA84JsRe.jpg','2024-09-06',98,'Released','A mom’s work is never done.','I\'ll Be Right There',1109946,2.4763,6,'1K-LN9MzyLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34141,_binary '\0','/9WxqnP9c29wXd03sALSpxpTx8fk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24083908',5.3,1556,'en','The Black Book','After his son is wrongly accused of kidnapping, a deacon who has just lost his wife takes matters into his own hands and fights a crooked police gang to clear him.','/kn28W24slBLyGr8ZIZnxNE5YZrY.jpg','2023-09-22',124,'Released',NULL,'The Black Book',1172009,3.7419,6.721,'6PPH4SOm9gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34142,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2408912',7.1,1531,'bn','চোরাবালি','Sumon is compelled to grow up in the city\'s underworld as mafia lord Osman Ali\'s killer machine. After killing a pregnant woman, Sumon\'s conscience leads him to defy Ali\'s order.','/hAWZ1g1dACHltFe76z5Y3gRWfTg.jpg','2012-12-21',137,'Released',NULL,'Chorabali',541662,1.0506,5,'VMeWhWzD0D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34143,_binary '\0','/txY4kzq8o97pm8sb4I0EtmPVXmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2409300',6.4,5687,'ja','キラーズ','A psychotic executive triggers a journalist\'s dark side, and they begin to form a strange bond through the internet.','/vkTi1Y5js8exwZ8V6mbXNEQy2Om.jpg','2014-02-01',137,'Released','Inside Us Lives A Killer.','Killers',171846,1.7096,6.3,'km-U2csTy3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34144,_binary '\0','/2NB1wbvAbpmbv7lpXSz6KENxrNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2409302',7.2,9661,'ja','地獄でなぜ悪い','In Japan, gonzo filmmakers hatch a three-pronged plan to save an actress\'s career, end a yakuza war and make a hit movie.','/6jVK9vvUDp9eH0JSIUgcvlrqdGa.jpg','2013-09-14',130,'Released',NULL,'Why Don\'t You Play in Hell?',134350,2.8464,7.3,'wr03JVWdCks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34145,_binary '\0','/sNpKtb925bpFmfBUTRAfYlWr4Ue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2409642',7.5,2055,'bn','ঘেটুপুত্র কমলা','A teenage boy is hired along with the music group of his father by a Zamindar (landlord) for entertaining him until the annual flood is over in the Haor region of East Bengal. But the boy finds out that he has to do something more than the rest of the members of the group are required- he has to satisfy the landlord sensually as well. The wife of the landlord cannot stand this new \'rival\' of hers and conspires to kill the boy.','/i6RnlRpUuQYTSX21ycNmcFlM1kp.jpg','2012-09-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Pleasure Boy Komola',136732,1.23,5.813,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34146,_binary '\0','/6YZnVLBpXdIleygcyh75NKrV9I5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2409818',5.1,15836,'en','Open Windows','Nick is excited to discover he\'s won a dinner date with his favorite actress, Jill Goddard. But when Jill refuses to honor the contest, he receives an offer he can\'t refuse: the ability to view Jill secretly via computer. Nick begins watching the unknowing star on her webcam, not realizing that this decision will put himself and Jill at risk as they enter a terrifying world of cat-and-mouse.','/dHA9jV7xKWjOvv2lYWxDwAmZjhk.jpg','2014-07-04',101,'Released','The 21st Century REAR WINDOW.','Open Windows',151368,3.147,5.1,'_Qz7DDvTA-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34147,_binary '\0','/fuCRyREqcz2KoJdOfcDDgWR9VOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2411024',6.9,2696,'ko','용의자X','A brilliant math teacher formulates the perfect cover-up after his neighbor murders her abusive ex-husband.','/osnCFdOjqFIiI6fnR9yp5lPjQST.jpg','2012-10-18',120,'Released','To him the only unsolvable equation was love.','Perfect Number',138665,2.3837,6.682,'F4k1YgfC_wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34148,_binary '\0','/6qz5CrAGeNVJKJiTQDHFO63KFTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2411144',5.3,2430,'es','La reina de España','After her experiences in Nazi Germany, actress Macarena Granada traveled to Hollywood, where she became a star. In the 1950s, the diva returns to Francoist Spain to star a Hollywood blockbuster about Queen Isabella I of Castile. (A sequel to The Girl of Your Dreams, 1998.)','/5dPUXLTRn0B68CfXqniTeUdH9jF.jpg','2016-11-25',127,'Released','Lights. Camera. Distraction.','The Queen of Spain',401252,3.5518,5.2,'G1J4qxaatow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34149,_binary '\0','/b6B0rLiNig6zMsxMC1IGnXSqymI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2412556',6.7,1361,'ja','真夏の方程式','Masaharu Fukuyama reprises his role from 2008\'s \"Suspect X,\" playing the physicist-cum-detective Manabu Yukawa. The scientist-sleuth arrives in an oceanside town to speak on a panel. But when a man turns up dead outside the inn where he\'s staying, Yukawa begins to unravel the connections that tie the victim to the activist daughter of the innkeepers, and a precocious boy who first appears on a train—and keeps popping up. It\'s a Sherlock Holmes mystery with an environmental twist, and one that should please fans of a classic whodunnit.','/tpaA8VfyUrUSUbTAaSjloapTnqa.jpg','2013-06-28',129,'Released',NULL,'Midsummer\'s Equation',204702,1.8068,7,'aQ712A08PNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34150,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2412568',6.8,1345,'en','Ragamuffin','RAGAMUFFIN is based on the true story of Rich Mullins, a musical prodigy who rose to Christian music fame and fortune only to walk away and live on a Navajo reservation. An artistic genius raised on a tree farm in Indiana by a weathered, callous father, Rich wrestled all of his life with the brokenness and crippling insecurity born of his childhood. A lover of Jesus and a rebel in the church, Rich refused to let his struggles with alcoholism, addiction and women tear him away from a God he was determined to love. As he struggled with success in Nashville, depression in Wichita, and oblivion in the Four Corners, Rich became one of the first of his time to live honestly amidst a culture of religion and conformity.','/rEGqcU7bY6LlJ5t9jV6GfnIox92.jpg','2014-01-09',137,'Released','His life was a whirlwind. His music was honest. His faith was reckless.','Ragamuffin',268386,0.9673,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34151,_binary '\0','/tTEEPlXFL6hPEsMYy446vXjS8HI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2412746',4.6,2104,'en','Revelation Road: The Beginning of the End','Josh McManus, a traveling salesman with a cloudy past, finds himself in a dusty West Texas town at the wrong time. After a crippling series of earthquakes throws the entire world into chaos, a traveling salesman will have to fight his way through a vicious outlaw biker gang known as the Barbarians to get home to his family.','/bUeWsVnWByrKDenwto9JD1FYaCV.jpg','2013-03-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Revelation Road: The Beginning of the End',179269,2.1243,4.793,'osp-Z35eZrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34152,_binary '\0','/6VoxDupaW2VXfLtJyeOoGCgXSjD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24131288',4.8,4131,'en','Cash Out','Criminal mastermind Mason is about to execute the score of a lifetime when his lover and key member of his crew, Decker, takes the team down and reveals she’s an undercover Interpol agent. Heartbroken, Mason escapes and retires from the life of crime until his younger brother Shawn is out of his league taking on a big bank heist all on his own. Mason has no choice left but to come to the rescue, while Interpol brings Decker in hoping to unnerve him. Before the SWAT teams storm the bank, Mason must use every tool in his arsenal to not only escape with the prize, but also the love of his life.','/v3youHDLigrtIis1NqTjlY8Sk38.jpg','2024-04-26',90,'Released','Every heist has its price.','Cash Out',1116490,6.1679,6.2,'Vt7rHUkoM08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34153,_binary '\0','/ekZhOpdH2gAOECoSKhvEzrCNsPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24131660',5.3,3980,'en','Bring Him to Me','Under orders from a ruthless crime boss, a getaway driver must battle his conscience and drive an unsuspecting crew member to an ambush execution. There is a long drive ahead.','/9QGAUtP5YvEFRMdYl2iEhgHybDw.jpg','2023-11-02',96,'Released','When is it too late to turn back?','Bring Him to Me',1059126,3.5909,5.8,'E5AlSC7Fn-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34154,_binary '\0','/bRj18W8wPaqfurD9mUkLVF64JZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24132110',4,1218,'en','Desert Fiends','Follows six friends who break down in the middle of nowhere, on the way to a concert, and encounter the desert fiends -- a deranged family who lives in the desert, killing anyone they come across.','/qvzt6IoiXOp05eLDLxd5BbXXs2B.jpg','2024-12-13',106,'Released','Sun. Sand. Psychos.','Desert Fiends',1102231,2.1298,5.3,'M_ZofuBVmsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34155,_binary '\0','/e3QWy9vh0E2TLpt9sMDAVcJVEby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24132144',6.9,1232,'en','Kim\'s Video','Since 1987, and for almost three decades, New York cinephiles had access to a vast treasure trove of rare films thanks to Kim\'s Video, a small empire run by Yongman Kim, an enigmatic character who amassed more than fifty thousand VHS tapes.','/rqMNKFY5RpbavDAiPd3jgNzd6fP.jpg','2023-09-27',89,'Released','Cinema is a record of existence.','Kim\'s Video',1058673,1.7071,6.9,'RLbTNL2eKIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34156,_binary '\0','/8J0gmuwmq8z7TI4YuWDTclHoB75.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24132732',7.7,17640,'en','The Deepest Breath','Bonded by their love of freediving, a record-setting champion and a heroic safety diver try to make history with a remarkable feat, ready to risk it all.','/4gKAn4npGEBi0HZAbwFZ77reLBR.jpg','2023-01-21',108,'Released','One dive. One breath. One chance.','The Deepest Breath',1058647,2.7103,7.6,'MzH6BI6P4Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34157,_binary '\0','/zueazIISObJTRXlNbWfS1bIb6u6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414040',5.4,1678,'fr','Le Règne de la beauté','An architect and his wife see their relationship challenged.','/aToqnWuKIlqLHWbJXbaET0eo4OF.jpg','2014-05-15',102,'Released',NULL,'An Eye for Beauty',271826,2.4352,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34158,_binary '\0','/ygYat93GZrJzLocKyLg9H980QAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414046',7,2312,'es','Los insólitos peces gato','Young Claudia works in a supermarket where she promotes various types of products. One night, she ends up in the emergency room with severe appendicitis and meets Martha, a patient, laying in the bed next to hers.','/zZ9wdeh2jXZJYUxngOapEUsCVYh.jpg','2013-08-10',91,'Released',NULL,'The Amazing Catfish',215924,1.4174,6.7,'ujD9FAcy7YU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34159,_binary '\0','/72RrvtNKo2oytiXEU5fGkpn935q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414166',8.7,2891,'en','Led Zeppelin: Celebration Day','On 10th December 2007, Led Zeppelin took the stage at London\'s O2 Arena to headline a tribute concert for dear friend and Atlantic Records founder Ahmet Ertegun. Founding members John Paul Jones, Jimmy Page and Robert Plant were joined by Jason Bonham, the son of their late drummer John Bonham, to perform 16 songs from their celebrated catalog.','/K7PZu1bnTs1OE5yFS5BIpIqvCP.jpg','2012-10-17',124,'Released',NULL,'Led Zeppelin: Celebration Day',137366,1.7474,8.2,'VbusDxLekPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34160,_binary '\0','/mWBWDO63f2wVijFnpGxms8nhHhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414196',4.4,1382,'en','The Maid','An emotionally troubled teenager gets into a passionate relationship with the older French woman working in his father\'s house.','/eZerBkR2ChRnOrIO4MoolnjXb8w.jpg','2014-04-12',99,'Released','Fate brought them together. Love set them free.','The Maid',326947,2.3821,4.5,'LnRspRW6bew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34161,_binary '\0','/lHBMMXazNtFFl3tYVefg0u7vaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414212',4.7,1841,'en','Santa Paws 2: The Santa Pups','When Mrs. Claus travels to Pineville, the merriest place on the planet, a quartet of magical puppies stow away on her sled, granting joyful wishes to the town\'s boys and girls. However, something goes terribly wrong - the Christmas spirit begins to disappear. Now, the Santa Pups and Mrs. Claus must race to save Christmas magic from running out for all.','/sqbtTl02wRkmLu7dVpI90T039wW.jpg','2012-11-20',88,'Released','One Magical Wish Can Change Everything !','Santa Paws 2: The Santa Pups',142308,4.0774,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34162,_binary '\0','/gdtcqHZph2QZMIVYxjNGF43kPum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24146896',6.8,5106,'es','Rotting in the Sun','A filmmaker facing an existential crisis goes on a vacation to a Mexican gay nudist beach, where he meets a social media celebrity who convinces him to collaborate with him on his new TV show. But one disappears and another embarks on a wild journey through Mexico City to find him.','/n2UhXsV5W2IlVdCRSxtK7hNa83s.jpg','2023-09-08',111,'Released','A (almost) true mystery.','Rotting in the Sun',1058696,2.6805,6.4,'LVRKCAsFy9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34163,_binary '\0','/71TAboo7x1IQn45CmWWfRn6aDAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414766',6.7,15355,'en','Frequencies','The story of the forbidden relationship between a \'low born\' boy and a \'high born\' girl in an alternate reality where every person\'s relationships and life worth are determined by their innate \'frequencies\'.','/oAq4JsymeYtQHK5IqExvpBQEu4m.jpg','2013-07-24',109,'Released','It changes everything.','Frequencies',218425,2.5038,6.6,'22VVuQI4kgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34164,_binary '\0','/v0kXbzbfwS4QWHBc4AuQ52Z5b9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2414822',4.6,1359,'en','The Perfect Wave','The true story of Ian McCormack who grew up surfing the waters of New Zealand. Wanting to dive deeper, Ian sets out on a journey with his best friend that will change his life as they chase the perfect wave.','/sRbFTl2OkANyTm26IbwUZ3Vr3ay.jpg','2014-02-28',94,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Wave',251979,1.6269,4.9,'W8DOyx8OjUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34165,_binary '\0','/7btCSdbZ01URLMvahgZnsc78NEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415112',6.6,5137,'en','A Bride for Christmas','Bride-to-be Jessie Patterson calls off her third engagement - during the ceremony! She swears off serious relationships, until she meets and is pursued by Aiden MacTiernan. Aiden, on the other hand, has bet his friends he is marriage material, and can find a fiancé in the four weeks leading up to Christmas. When Jessie and Aiden begin to fall for each other, Jessie must decide if she is ready for serious love, and Aiden must decide if his bet is worth risking his relationship with Jessie.','/d5oFtJZI0PREMTft27lgW4nr7JV.jpg','2012-12-01',90,'Released',NULL,'A Bride for Christmas',147132,2.3593,6.3,'BVF-PJiyGo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34166,_binary '\0','/841kNhTuBg8iJcNTwQW7fTXEWiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415372',8.3,2611,'en','Inner Worlds, Outer Worlds','There is one vibratory field that connects all things. It has been called Akasha, Logos, the primordial OM, the music of the spheres, the Higgs field, dark energy, and a thousand other names throughout history. The vibratory field is at the root of all true spiritual experience and scientific investigation. It is the same field of energy that saints, Buddhas, yogis, mystics, priests, shamans and seers, have observed by looking within themselves. Many of history\'s monumental thinkers, such a Pythagoras, Kepler, Leonardo DaVinci, Tesla, and Einstein, have come to the threshold of this great mystery. It is the common link between all religions, all sciences, and the link between our inner worlds and our outer worlds.','/7160MQra0CrCivy9qYililLDf9s.jpg','2012-12-19',122,'Released',NULL,'Inner Worlds, Outer Worlds',178189,0.7694,7.7,'08CnDSQelNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34167,_binary '\0','/kvb4mFFEqABFFBLPqCmDIiLktQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415458',7,13936,'en','The Wolfpack','Locked away from society in an apartment on the Lower East Side of Manhattan, the Angulo brothers learn about the outside world through the films that they watch. Nicknamed ‘The Wolfpack’, the brothers spend their childhood reenacting their favorite films using elaborate home-made props and costumes. Their world is shaken up when one of the brothers escapes and everything changes.','/gr0hihtD5wxvsH8N4HB66XKfnAo.jpg','2015-06-12',89,'Released',NULL,'The Wolfpack',307931,2.2082,6.7,'5cPjBtGr4PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34168,_binary '\0','/1k0frMIYvTouGHy0rMwsUWFDCPD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415496',6.8,2438,'en','Love at the Thanksgiving Day Parade','As Chicago gears up for its annual Thanksgiving Day parade, Emily Jones, an eager parade coordinator is shocked when Henry Williams, a wealthy new development consultant, is brought in to analyze the parade\'s finances.','/gcLowhz4bXvibhcYJJewC1YzBmw.jpg','2012-11-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Love at the Thanksgiving Day Parade',142635,1.8269,6.4,'TAyY_mghtlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34169,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415946',2,2077,'tr','Oğlum Bak Git','He is someone who wears red down to his underwear. He wears red so that the blood of the people he kills does not stain his clothes, as he is allergic to blood. Our hero Orhan, who went to meet Figen to overcome his cowardice and create a new outlook on life for himself, finds himself in another predicament on the first day he meets her. Red Erol wants to marry Figen off to the son of Rüstem, a well-known figure in the mafia world. Figen is tired of her father’s pressure. She tells her father that she is engaged to Orhan and that she is madly in love with him. Our innocent Orhan, unable to say “no” to anyone, goes along with Figen’s lie.','/jTbJmFHytkNP930emijw67aDMjg.jpg','2012-10-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Oğlum Bak Git',331062,0.8611,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34170,_binary '\0','/33CTNXC6Ra2jTu95vFaxEHdy02v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2415964',6.2,2177,'tr','Çanakkale 1915','The story of the film is about the Gallipoli Campaign during World War I on the Gallipoli Peninsula in Turkey in 1915. The film covers the resurrection of Turkey following its defeat in the Balkan War, through depictions of Sergeant Mehmet Ali (Ali Ersan Duru) from Biga, Corporal Seyit and many others. To help Russia and threaten Constantinople, the Allies try to force through the Dardanelles Straight with a large fleet. Through a series of historical sketches, the film documents how they were defeated despite many difficulties and hardships.','/sbfbwU7QkrOrdbL7KsYVj5W1zwl.jpg','2012-10-17',128,'Released',NULL,'Çanakkale 1915',161805,0.8577,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34171,_binary '\0','/1f3h03wGvnXl6zWri8uW2N45ctZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2416424',5.6,1382,'de','00 Schneider - Im Wendekreis der Eidechse','A dangerous gangster called the Lizard escaped from prison. He steals chickens and spits on old ladies. There\'s only one man who can catch him: the commissioner Roy Schneider!','/quoBK0F6kOC7E3K4N9ZOj9tfP3u.jpg','2013-06-30',94,'Released',NULL,'00 Schneider - Im Wendekreis der Eidechse',138820,1.5354,5.2,'6cbGYVf0OFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34172,_binary '\0','/aA5B2OsN6rccwnhn8TEG4m4V3jI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24169886',6.2,45280,'en','The Instigators','Rory and Cobby are unlikely partners thrown together for a heist. But when it goes awry, they team up with an unusual accomplice — Rory\'s therapist — to outrun police, backward bureaucrats, and a vengeful crime boss.','/dnYWsIFDmygCjNg65rY3uBymx81.jpg','2024-08-02',102,'Released','Worst. Heist. Ever.','The Instigators',1059064,11.9879,6.139,'X5oqpxi3U7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34173,_binary '\0','/cjnY4oravR6PsDF50AGZLZo1ifR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417134',6.5,3359,'en','Naughty or Nice','Krissy Kringle receives a delivery intended for Santa Claus. A magical book that shows if a person has been naughty or nice. She uses the book\'s power to find out about those around her, which leads to some very unusual and unintended results. Krissy realizes that everyone has some good and some not so good in them.','/9NCi7SvwReCxQVbcppR7A0Cds4w.jpg','2012-12-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Naughty or Nice',145711,2.7066,6,'W9VgnoenO4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34174,_binary '\0','/pahSEjEt49pwRan1vLvSIOruCTV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417154',8.2,1435,'en','Filmage: The Story of Descendents/All','Long before Green Day and Blink 182 inflicted punk-rock\'s puncture wound on the map of mainstream music, the Descendents were at home concocting the perfect mix of pop, angst, love, and coffee. FILMAGE: The Story of DESCENDENTS/ALL follows drummer/square-peg Bill Stevenson and his \'caffeinated retardedness\' as he pushes his rotating door of bandmates to \'achieve ALL,\' his philosophy of going for greatness at all costs. Stevenson is a force to be reckoned with--not even grapefruit-sized brain tumors can keep him down.','/kxbUWtPSqEiJi9UTXygcTe1noNL.jpg','2013-10-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Filmage: The Story of Descendents/All',210274,1.8544,8,'yPb3dZ7Hqy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34175,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417560',7.3,3833,'hi','Filmistaan','Sunny is struggling to make a living in the Bollywood industry. He takes a job as assistant director (the operative word being assistant) for an American documentary filmmaking team, but during filming in the Indian Rajasthan province he is kidnapped by Pakistani terrorists – and detained in a small village in Pakistan. The situation is delicate, but the villagers share Sunny\'s passion for Bollywood film, and little by little the hostage and the guardians come to understand each other. Eventually, Sunny lays a plan to escape with the help of the villagers.','/2WpoYfif0kxQE9ibeXnLKIYCAn6.jpg','2014-06-06',117,'Released',NULL,'Filmistaan',161064,1.7178,6.737,'p-0LWnz8Ut0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34176,_binary '\0','/7bUYzlDz8eel1BVL1Y0YcF9NQmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24176060',6.3,31152,'en','Queer','In 1950s Mexico City, William Lee, an American ex-pat in his late forties, leads a solitary life amidst a small American community. However, the arrival in town of Eugene Allerton, a young student, stirs William into finally establishing a meaningful connection with someone.','/xe4b2TMciLKA1C0JlhWxb4ENLln.jpg','2024-11-27',138,'Released','I\'m not Queer, I\'m disembodied.','Queer',1059128,7.417,6.5,'-pVKnv4E-k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34177,_binary '\0','/dgnabUOINxe8S8QAI05W3UJBGQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417650',2.6,4115,'en','30 Nights of Paranormal Activity With the Devil Inside the Girl With the Dragon Tattoo','After a stint in a psychiatric hospital, a young woman returns to the house where her father killed the entire cast of The Artist during his exorcism.','/xng4MvtKEj8mV2aHgc51tGZzkdN.jpg','2013-01-14',80,'Released','Based on true events... that may not have happened','30 Nights of Paranormal Activity With the Devil Inside the Girl With the Dragon Tattoo',157058,2.6204,4,'HD7WEn389Nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34178,_binary '\0','/piJ8gpsbGdxlxdaYLQnw7SguVMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417712',5.8,16216,'en','Goon: Last of the Enforcers','During a pro lockout, Doug \"The Thug\" Glatt is injured and must choose whether to defend his team against a dangerous new enemy, or be there for his wife as she prepares to give birth to his daughter.','/mVpqXYZ3X1YYnVQ7aj8jEm88vHS.jpg','2017-03-17',101,'Released','Glatt\'s Back!','Goon: Last of the Enforcers',336890,4.6685,5.678,'eAdDciuOYqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34179,_binary '\0','/ygvtgSudLK7fawWOVNnU9RTxlBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2417854',4.4,1585,'en','Lucky Bastard','Lucky Bastard is a \"found footage\" thriller about a porn website run by Mike (Don McManus) that invites fans to have sex with porn stars. Jay Paulson plays Dave, an eager young fan given a chance to have sex with the fabulous Ashley Saint (Betsy Rue). But everyone gets more than they bargained for in the seemingly mild-mannered Dave... with gruesome results. The film is captured by the \"Lucky Bastard\" porn cameras for a fresh take on the \"found footage\" genre','/f7vOAna0WNV8DD4quj0Em73Cj0w.jpg','2014-02-14',94,'Released','This will not end well.','Lucky Bastard',180850,1.0751,4.1,'opAgX78rGCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34180,_binary '\0','/ui6H8KO3BIYkkxvlAeJn5PjrzXb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2418372',5.9,1453,'fr','Abus de faiblesse','A stroke-afflicted filmmaker is manipulated by a notorious con man.','/uiHvyVVtGAC4MPhkiZHXZ8UKBu7.jpg','2013-09-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Abuse of Weakness',179100,1.5248,5.3,'AD37uyXWeV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34181,_binary '\0','/ogKkr5YOyKB0gY5lNTB9Rx6ZI95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2418440',6.2,5988,'es','Tres bodas de más','Ruth, a young researcher at a college, is invited to the weddings of three of her exes. She enlists the help of her assistant to find a companion for each wedding; will one of them turn out to be her soulmate?','/gvNWifzv9rQC7NVsw3MJotrBdBu.jpg','2013-12-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Three Many Weddings',201765,2.6453,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34182,_binary '\0','/6NZMN7XRb0TDRloST3P8T9W2z0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2418558',6,9307,'de','Rubinrot','On her 16th birthday, Gwendolyn Shepherd finds out that instead of her cousin, she has inherited a rare gene that allows her to travel through time.','/lCfUO2be7jlskyTXRnf1bQtdIes.jpg','2013-03-14',122,'Released',NULL,'Ruby Red',175774,3.8822,6.928,'s3hr0sXT8qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34183,_binary '\0','/cO3jKUkJb2suHWWMFU4PfnI8QTG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2419284',6.6,1419,'en','Red Obsession','France’s Bordeaux region has long commanded respect for its coveted wine, but shifts in the global marketplace mean that a new, voracious consumer base in China is buying up this finite product. Bordeaux both struggles with and courts the spike in demand, sending prices skyrocketing. Narrated by Russell Crowe, Red Obsession is a fascinating look at our changing international economy and how an obsession in Shanghai affects the most illustrious vineyards in France.','/3345e6iaHJBx4mrIKoJ4f3gzHwH.jpg','2013-02-13',75,'Released',NULL,'Red Obsession',174358,1.3277,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34184,_binary '\0','/48eujRJTwft8788UHRJdEWqxwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2420006',6.5,1617,'en','12 O\'Clock Boys','Pug, a wisecracking 13 year old living on a dangerous Westside block, has one goal in mind: to join The Twelve O\'Clock Boys; the notorious urban dirt-bike gang of Baltimore. Converging from all parts of the inner city, they invade the streets and clash with police, who are forbidden to chase the bikes for fear of endangering the public. When Pug\'s older brother dies suddenly, he looks to the pack for mentorship, spurred by their dangerous lifestyle. Pug\'s story is coupled with unprecedented, action-packed coverage of the riders in their element. The film presents the pivotal years of change in a boy\'s life growing up in one of the most dangerous and economically depressed cities in the US.','/p7PKGce8BK7LHg4bHlQpFxPKn9s.jpg','2013-04-29',76,'Released',NULL,'12 O\'Clock Boys',169853,0.9863,6,'cpM54lf3BbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34185,_binary '\0','/jqOCty3utHRzDf8BNX5rP6p0UDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2420124',5.7,3997,'en','Wendy','A re-imagining of \"Peter Pan\" from the point of view of Wendy Darling, who finds herself lost on a mysterious island where aging and time have come unglued. She must fight to save her family, her freedom and the joyous spirit of youth.','/nphsStbtAuJ2IaXtCvDXDwMUF5N.jpg','2020-02-28',111,'Released','An ageless tale.','Wendy',399363,3.1142,5.7,'KKktQFFcXL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34186,_binary '\0','/1TPGPtvZCPTAYFpxqWbnX70nrV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2420166',5.5,2175,'en','The World Made Straight','In a rural Appalachian community haunted by the legacy of a Civil War massacre, a rebellious young man struggles to escape the violence that would bind him to the past.','/AwDOpMAHK69nUe6IYyHtmVjW9GR.jpg','2015-01-09',119,'Released','For blood. For money. For a way out.','The World Made Straight',289716,2.3781,5.6,'UAlh5UYXp4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34187,_binary '\0','/b4LHXb0CPCkXxM0F8yYkSKbXciM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2420756',6,9414,'en','Late Phases','When deadly attacks from a nearby forest beset a secluded retirement community, it is up to a blind army veteran to discover what the residents are hiding.','/7ulbyPajXTNZkki9AtcLI9YYhc2.jpg','2014-11-21',95,'Released','The hunt is on','Late Phases',254193,2.5277,6,'EJgXfzSYehk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34188,_binary '\0','/8wrhQaF6ZWviIiR7cGUOi2WCGyd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2420886',5.7,2274,'fr','Paris à tout prix','Maya is living the ultimate fashionistas dream: she is working as a stylist for one of the French trend setters, in the capital of haute-couture: Paris. One of the IT girls of fashion, shes following her dreams until one night, when her life takes a sudden turn: shes being deported back to Morocco, after being stopped for over speeding, because her Visa expired some time ago. So in no more than 24 hours, shes deported back to her family and original country. The strong cultural shock and the judgmental differences are pushing the woman to obtain back her place in the city of dreams and her dreams, no matter the costs. But that doesn\'t mean she will have to return alone, as she finds other things also among her way back to the city.','/l0TqmtksDVWgEO6J5XtW4yHFfGV.jpg','2013-07-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Paris or Perish',203665,3.0613,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34189,_binary '\0','/3qyGPgOz07rOjjeZyxmJhkRpAgG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2421416',6.1,3720,'en','Trust Me','In an attempt to sign a Hollywood starlet, struggling talent agent and former child star Howard Holloway must contend with her volatile father, a scheming long-time rival, and a producer and casting director who despise him.','/za40eaNet6AsJ8voY6AMNokhj4P.jpg','2013-04-20',90,'Released','He\'ll make you a star if it kills him.','Trust Me',174343,2.4277,5.8,'WFdAcG5ZTtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34190,_binary '\0','/tvzGlFkOHApPOckWN7PSNScGDbx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2421662',7.2,4777,'en','The Challenger Disaster','When the space shuttle Challenger blew up in 1986, it was the most shocking event in the history of American spaceflight. The deaths of seven astronauts, including the first teacher in space Christa McAuliffe, were watched live on television by millions of viewers. But what was more shocking was that the cause of the disaster might never be uncovered. The Challenger is the story of how Richard Feynman, one of America\'s most famous scientists, helped to discover the cause of a tragedy that stunned America.','/ltSiY7rORMGlSHGI7Lr0sgI8D6.jpg','2013-03-18',90,'Released',NULL,'The Challenger Disaster',177203,2.1701,7.3,'vXGnOROO0Yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34191,_binary '\0','/gbpy4mwYEodTutM9Z1HTEPK6i3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24216998',7,12754,'fr','Vampire humaniste cherche suicidaire consentant','Sasha is a young vampire with a serious problem: she\'s too sensitive to kill. When her exasperated parents cut off her blood supply, Sasha\'s life is in jeopardy. Luckily, she meets Paul, a lonely teenager with suicidal tendencies who is willing to give his life to save hers. But their friendly agreement soon becomes a nocturnal quest to fulfill Paul\'s last wishes before day breaks.','/m5OItLBY5T38ew1YI4VSIXjl5G2.jpg','2023-10-13',91,'Released',NULL,'Humanist Vampire Seeking Consenting Suicidal Person',988402,6.4078,7.447,'ksWqIui9jHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34192,_binary '\0','/1t3YfNmAZeWIFEctgh43pL10gdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24218194',5.3,1218,'ru','Волшебник Изумрудного города. Дорога из жёлтого кирпича','Ellie lives in a distant city. One day, the evil witch Gingema conjured a hurricane that took Ellie and her dog Totoshka to the country of the Munchkins. To return home, Ellie and her friends the Scarecrow, the Tin Woodman and the Cowardly Lion will set off along the yellow brick road to the Emerald City in search of the Wizard who will grant their cherished wishes.','/hJuJR6bpZghRDfgQJHUCL1Oh5GU.jpg','2025-01-01',104,'Released',NULL,'The Wizard of the Emerald City, Part I',658224,3.8115,7.2,'XtQTfJru9kM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34193,_binary '\0','/8LklTcuIn5cMRP3mD2Y3vAqnkpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24223026',5.4,1485,'en','The Dirty South','Sue Parker is thrust into a desperate struggle to rescue her family\'s failing business, teetering on the edge of ruin due to her father\'s negligence. With the arrival of a charming wanderer, she sees him as their sole hope to help prevent their bar from being seized by the merciless local tycoon.','/4MIiVSXsHx5q9l3HgTc07gn895r.jpg','2023-11-10',107,'Released','Out of patience, out of time, and now she\'s a criminal.','The Dirty South',1133232,2.9875,5.853,'hin7Q8ZBT7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34194,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24223982',6,4498,'kn','Gowri','good movie son of indra jit lankesh','/kDDbP4X6e3Zk3qq5BoAi69UxTjm.jpg','2024-08-15',130,'Released',NULL,'Gowri',1339528,0.4565,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34195,_binary '\0','/vHXMenEFXgfIkT8mxVT4nuR0Q8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24224996',6.5,1354,'en','Mumbai Mafia: Police vs the Underworld','In 1990s Mumbai, a crime boss and his network wield unchecked power over the city — until the rise of \"encounter cops,\" who brazenly kill their targets.','/x8KYZWt1nraPdRSkNfxdrxFdjim.jpg','2023-01-06',88,'Released',NULL,'Mumbai Mafia: Police vs the Underworld',1066719,1.7537,6.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34196,_binary '\0','/8ycWZizMNfYlQE5CdLSbOboNDko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24225606',6.5,23339,'hi','मेट्रो... इन दिनों','Follows interconnected stories of several different couples, each facing a crossroads at different stages in their lives and relationships.','/AlmzM8CNm2fRJQW2iA9Ittwv0ig.jpg','2025-07-04',159,'Released','Your Own Story.','Metro... In Dino',1065426,2.0939,6.4,'Wm2R3aJPY2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34197,_binary '\0','/q1z8Arah95QYhZ1uRI11ftmJAdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24225846',6.2,5426,'te','శబరి','A single mother battles her past demons to safeguard her child\'s future, facing daunting challenges to shield her daughter from imminent danger.','/lHZnBvrABc5cTLzu64dQfPcfnzL.jpg','2024-05-03',127,'Released','No One Can Seperate Us','Sabari',1030060,1.0136,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34198,_binary '\0','/rVrflERUtklZ3xpCERzNogBwAMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24226474',8,12117,'ta','ஜிகர்தண்டா டபுள்X','A notorious gangster is incited to transform into a film hero and opts for a filmmaker and their project descends into a scenario they had never anticipated.','/rlPTdgLfgsSv8WiQXRZ2AVIDwAi.jpg','2023-11-10',172,'Released','A Pandyaa Western Story','Jigarthanda DoubleX',1007074,2.0054,7.653,'ClpPFQZMzds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34199,_binary '\0','/vJp0Y4uymGfG3wnHsnGLWCowbJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24227018',4.4,3770,'ta','காதர்பாட்சா என்ற முத்துராமலிங்கம்','An arrogant yet righteous man decides to get married to a woman, who has been suffering at the hands of her relatives. Little does he realize that an enmity from his past is going to invite trouble in his personal life.','/72ZO0zs9NuEAEsLOMnoPcKnW6sm.jpg','2023-06-02',153,'Released',NULL,'Katharbasha Endra Muthuramalingam',1033880,0.7814,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34200,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24227752',6.2,1575,'te','రా రా... పెనిమిటి',NULL,'/ixaSMNUk2AOI5xgWlwu9v22oJtT.jpg','2023-04-28',91,'Released','Love is but a Game of Waiting','Raa Raa... Penimiti',1111206,0.854,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34201,_binary '\0','/h4NLl5w9hkqRUz55esKGG6d8q01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2423132',6.4,2427,'hi','Akaash Vani','Akaash and Vani leaving their house to go to college. Vani catches her train on the other hand Akaash travels by a truck as he misses his train. As they reach their the next day Vaani says \"I love you\" to Akaash. He replies to this in a filmy way and both of them become friends. Akaash and Vani fall in love with each other and continue a 4 year relationship.','/p6Bi6Xm3VhfkHkdyRqRRX76H2Jj.jpg','2013-01-24',149,'Released',NULL,'Akaash Vani',181462,1.0205,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34202,_binary '\0','/jLVzjSxJ5zUB25XPJP1SEzDbxbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2424028',5.4,1301,'es','Tráiganme la cabeza de la mujer metralleta','A powerful Argentine gangster uses everything in his power to stop the woman that wants to kill him, a sexy mercenary known as \"the machine gun woman\". The staggering sum of cash he offers for her head sets in motion an army of hitmen. And also, by accident, bursts in the life of naïve DJ Santiago, a common youth that will have to steel his guts against the underworld, and above all, survive the irresistible - and bloodthirsty - Machine Gun Woman.','/hRLfAug1FgrhNIP90ZZXq8gUp7K.jpg','2012-09-23',73,'Released','They came for her head, she cut them to pieces','Bring Me the Head of the Machine Gun Woman',232195,1.5347,5.5,'RHqozwN1ZYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34203,_binary '\0','/6gWXHCVptuSbvmsY2qwnhUnfMDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24244300',5.2,2509,'ta','டியர்','A newly married couple faces challenges when the wife\'s snoring interrupts the husband\'s sleep. Their struggles depict the compromises needed for a lasting marriage.','/nGrdWSoaPklsid9POrELW7Ll7dz.jpg','2024-04-11',134,'Released','The Snoring Begins','DeAr',1122356,1.2462,6.3,'nJOnyufuXwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34204,_binary '\0','/2ZnqZDIJcdADSfo0SxuGznGxLtF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24244436',6.9,1340,'mk','Домаќинство за почетници','Dita, who, despite never aspiring to be a mother, finds herself compelled to raise her girlfriend’s two daughters—Mia, a tiny troublemaker, and Vanesa, a rebellious teenager. As their individual wills clash, a heartwarming story unfolds about an unlikely family\'s struggle to stay together.','/fXg7Avh7eQzkeasMqwGiDxlQRqi.jpg','2024-04-05',107,'Released','Home is where you belong.','Housekeeping for Beginners',1081593,1.3073,6.9,'PeMlORxufuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34205,_binary '\0','/tvYP0sTbFoUalpMVTS6koawbnLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24245466',3.3,1302,'hi','रुसलान','The unstoppable force Ruslaan is coming to break free of the chains of conformity. With his gun and guitar, he\'s about to create a symphony of rebellion like no other.','/Wlxn5NCIcXeLrSn79wAtyFr2BD.jpg','2024-04-26',140,'Released',NULL,'Ruslaan',1196940,3.6813,4.333,'gqpFSY93qF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34206,_binary '\0','/2RMJreRdls4tbm4QXeQjNR1cRXI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24248198',6.3,1899,'en','Adult Swim Yule Log','Get in the holiday spirit with this cozy, crackling fire.','/faELFruDaoZQzOKLhrRDBheCSx3.jpg','2022-12-11',92,'Released',NULL,'Adult Swim Yule Log',1060421,1.8549,6.214,'Jkw_RB5U1ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34207,_binary '\0','/A6KaZEXI9NJ1nwjmzTQDkiDTDWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24249072',5.5,7700,'en','Last Straw','A rural roadside diner becomes the host of a maniacal killing spree – leaving a young waitress to clean up the mess. After hard-headed Nancy fires the staff at her dad’s diner, she decides to cover the last shift of the night by herself. Little does she know, she is far from alone. The day is coming back to haunt her and when things begin to spiral out of control, she must fight for her life over the course of one long night.','/hgpUvybRQzRK6UagoHNQRrO8sUg.jpg','2024-09-20',81,'Released',NULL,'Last Straw',1137205,3.3512,6.1,'YSouHifJFB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34208,_binary '\0','/swERS96YBRc3fLwbJiIZiop33xr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2424988',7,29884,'hi','Gabbar Is Back','A vigilante network taking out corrupt officials draws the notice of the authorities.','/dhIVF43jCqVzxuo11hYcHQxjzS6.jpg','2015-05-01',130,'Released',NULL,'Gabbar Is Back',337876,1.2654,6.8,'T95zFC4Z2pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34209,_binary '\0','/hzKOHLfHHdgRRcxpK6YuuXyyRgU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24249946',6.7,6380,'en','The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial','Barney Greenwald, a skeptical lawyer, reluctantly defends an officer of the navy who took control of the Caine from its captain, Lt. Philip Francis Queeg, while caught in a violent sea storm. As the court-martial proceeds, however, Greenwald increasingly questions if it was truly a mutiny or rather the courageous acts of a group of sailors who could not trust their unstable leader.','/jii0CWMcjFmCfrTXsRyMuwjlNY3.jpg','2023-09-03',109,'Released',NULL,'The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial',1018332,3.8162,6.694,'iUpMsZrZjrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34210,_binary '\0','/xqc5l6CCOBqni0gT9J2nvodhCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2425486',6.9,9935,'es','Gloria','Gloria is a 58-year-old divorcée. Her children have all left home but she has no desire to spend her days and nights alone. Determined to defy old age and loneliness, she rushes headlong into a whirl of singles’ parties on the hunt for instant gratification – which only leads to repeated disappointment and enduring emptiness. But when Gloria meets Rodolfo, an ex-naval officer seven years her senior, she begins to imagine the possibility of a permanent relationship.','/t1copJu3ecVx7zVCBA1o6z02WcZ.jpg','2013-05-08',105,'Released','Live every moment.','Gloria',160068,2.2035,6.559,'lrmuQBUO13Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34211,_binary '\0','/227dN0NhNrjZ1KNmci4gnaYsycA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2425886',4.9,1459,'en','Chilling Visions: 5 Senses of Fear','A horror anthology of shorts themed around the five senses.','/uxRtcHQWmd2Wv1BLxcI2DerncdI.jpg','2013-05-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Chilling Visions: 5 Senses of Fear',207273,1.6017,4.7,'-ViRHQV3AnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34212,_binary '\0','/nJqHWGxs6pi3qFF8cYVpMPXq8Se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24268454',6.7,80838,'hi','The Kerala Story','A converted Muslim woman narrates her ordeal of how she once wanted to become a nurse but was abducted from her home and manipulated by religious vanguards and turned into an ISIS terrorist and landed in Afghanistan jail.','/g70f3hwn5jPaNzqPssoa9unlawo.jpg','2023-05-05',138,'Released',NULL,'The Kerala Story',1117411,1.7264,4.528,'3Jk3vquJDGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34213,_binary '\0','/eWAyaR01f4TVui8vxLVFwUjx3hB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2427502',6.2,6615,'sv','Snabba cash - Livet deluxe','JW now lives in exile and is more than ever determined to find out what happened to his missing sister Camilla. Every trace leads him to the world of organized crime in Stockholm. Jorge is about to do his last score – the largest robbery in Swedish history. But during the complicated preparations he meets a woman from his past – Nadja. Martin Hägerström is chosen to go undercover into the Serbian mafia, in order to get its notorious boss Radovan Krajnic behind bars. When an assassination attempt is made on Radovan, his daughter Natalie is pulled into the power struggle within the Serbian mafia.','/oSTHRFOcC1l1qpW84n7RioCDRnY.jpg','2013-08-30',127,'Released',NULL,'Easy Money III: Life Deluxe',196032,2.8676,6.183,'kdZmcJ5QMKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34214,_binary '\0','/jv247hW6iebdNHwtt8fZdXjZwdV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2427892',6.9,20307,'fr','Tom à la ferme','A young man travels to an isolated farm for his lover\'s funeral where he\'s quickly drawn into a twisted, sexually charged game by his lover\'s aggressive brother.','/df7pp0jSs4wRxfWHtdgCaDPelmm.jpg','2014-03-28',105,'Released','What you don\'t know will hurt you.','Tom at the Farm',184352,3.9283,6.8,'rZNzJhTczZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34215,_binary '\0','/pNPYEC5hTUAQkzgDsnKu4ti4qaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2427968',6.4,1323,'it','Una famiglia perfetta','Leone is a rich and powerful man whose loneliness drives him to hire a cast of actors to play the family he never had. On Christmas Eve, reality and make-believe start to get blurred.','/tkmvXoqQnzqkF66315TrsjSDilG.jpg','2012-11-29',120,'Released','Money can\'t buy happiness... but it can rent it.','A Perfect Family',162282,1.3317,6.5,'nbHhXHiXio4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34216,_binary '\0','/AvrGwToWkP6fp13lzpxsyzoq9JH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2428170',6.3,87403,'en','Creep','Looking for work, Aaron comes across a cryptic online ad: “$1,000 for the day. Filming service. Discretion is appreciated.” Low on cash and full of naiveté, he decides to go for it. He drives to a cabin in a remote mountain town where he meets Josef, his cinematic subject for the day. Josef is sincere and the project seems heartfelt, so Aaron begins to film. But as the day goes on, it becomes clear that Josef is not who he says, and his intentions are not at all pure.','/qn53D574tT0YRyLgirEFHQwGUXw.jpg','2014-03-08',82,'Released',NULL,'Creep',250574,5.5848,6.4,'o2y8kKsxeII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34217,_binary '\0','/bCRDelikJKv73PBo47hbGec6yVF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2428246',6.6,1771,'en','Mr. Stink','Chloe recedes into herself due to her family\'s uncaring attitude towards her. When she meets Mr. Stink, a smelly man, she invites him to live in her garden shed.','/7Lergwt4FcSszwUks8QYzahOrsu.jpg','2012-12-23',60,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Stink',152347,1.443,6.4,'e2JRJqdG4RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34218,_binary '\0','/zPabya2Q4WKuhRalkgwacFWuWxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2429074',5.9,11808,'en','G.B.F.','The bitter fight for supremacy between the three most popular girls at North Gateway High takes an unexpected turn when their classmate, Tanner, is outed and becomes the school’s first openly gay student. The trio races to bag the big trend in fashion accessories, the Gay Best Friend, while Tanner must decide whether his skyrocketing popularity is more important than the friendships he is leaving behind.','/f4fR1WMgSv7K93ZPoJlPyvaApdE.jpg','2014-01-17',93,'Released','Being out has never been so in.','G.B.F.',174323,0.1213,5.9,'l7hSNYcA7pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34219,_binary '\0','/vSzvTeXqnhWtlUQRGMJfvERZtvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2429292',6.9,5983,'sv','Känn ingen sorg','Pål dreams about becoming successful with his music, but he has one major obstacle: himself. He\'s a diamond in the rough, and the only things greater than his musical talent are his obsessions, which constantly get him into trouble. We follow Pål on an emotional journey one summer in Gothenburg where he is thrown between passion and deceit; love, reconciliation and deliverance.','/pK5PdfuCp8c09P99PATuGYDArQV.jpg','2013-07-19',119,'Released','You\'ve got to die a few times before you can live.','Shed No Tears',187628,1.5419,6.8,'5FqkRSAbkFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34220,_binary '\0','/m7hESs33SwgkZupn9sftjPufEUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2429640',5.1,5431,'hi','मर्डर 3','A hot-shot fashion and wildlife photographer Vikram gets into a relationship with Nisha. She moves in with him in his palatial house outside of the city. The old world house, made decades ago is as beautiful as it is scary. It holds many secrets which Nisha is soon to unearth; of the life of the man who made it and of Vikram, who is dealing with the mysterious disappearance of his former girlfriend Roshni','/ls8RgPMuBW5aCYmAMH8gBXOC2Hc.jpg','2013-02-14',124,'Released','This Valentine... Love Will be Murdered','Murder 3',168114,1.098,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34221,_binary '\0','/pO8AFkpPRqrHpU9r3cQdgMgoUx1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2429870',4.3,1669,'en','Summoned','Follow three individuals who served on the jury for one of San Francisco\'s most high profile serial killer cases. Now someone, or something, is killing them off one by one.','/f7D6pzej5RYfbpqXXW7aGl8mzLU.jpg','2013-07-26',91,'Released','Some secrets won\'t stay buried','Summoned',181175,1.883,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34222,_binary '\0','/k9AUmz39HUiwrLcRrUQkq5a8tIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2430044',5.8,1617,'fr','Joséphine','Josephine doesn\'t like her job and keeps on having relationships without a future. Her sister and parents keep pushing her to find a good husband. To shut them up, she creates a handsome Brazilian millionaire but her little white lie has a flip side - she loses everything to find the love of her life.','/iXu2U7KUdMwahA0Wwuk83cbHZCs.jpg','2013-06-19',88,'Released',NULL,'Josephine',199661,1.4175,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34223,_binary '\0','/eyn0vuN4IZjImE5Dws0iPhZrCMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2431286',7.6,107757,'en','Philomena','A woman searches for her adult son, who was taken away from her decades ago when she was forced to live in a convent.','/eBUv2GmGdXmCk1AaSOmyiu70hN8.jpg','2013-11-01',98,'Released','These two unlikely companions are on a journey to find her long lost son.','Philomena',205220,4.578,7.339,'a8WyFLsdtNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34224,_binary '\0','/zyjXrdYoprdsPjjOKjzlgVbzdCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24326062',4.7,1571,'pt','Mamonas Assassinas: O Filme','The life and times of comedy rock band Mamonas Assassinas, from their beginning to their breakthrough in the late 1990s.','/nOYKZrePJaHQotqoF6M7azjBPzM.jpg','2023-12-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Mamonas Assassinas: The Movie',1169900,1.7392,5.378,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34225,_binary '\0','/xBORKTaQJTq3l7EdnTTnrZnYzYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24326458',5.7,4193,'en','One Mile: Chapter One','After being released from special forces, a father tries to reconnect with his daughter by taking her on a tour of college, but they soon find themselves fighting for more than their lost relationship when a murderous cult pursues them.','/1GZaoYe0mQy211DgDSAxAXr30ul.jpg','2026-02-20',90,'Released',NULL,'One Mile: Chapter One',1327688,11.3503,6.678,'868HlmpAhtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34226,_binary '\0','/jxQIjkJBTyZSxN3yyilpR0ns6HA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24326462',5,2863,'en','One Mile: Chapter Two','Former special forces operative Danny is forced back onto a remote island when a violent, secretive community takes revenge by abducting his daughter Alex, launching a relentless hunt against enemies prepared for his every move.','/3sjc9qXXmQoUWKQ3qIjS1nZaUJy.jpg','2026-02-27',84,'Released',NULL,'One Mile: Chapter Two',1327690,7.2046,6.652,'868HlmpAhtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34227,_binary '\0','/dmxAtfGZUbb95F1dKM0HD0FlCQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2433040',5.1,4080,'en','Beyond the Mask','A former assassin tries to redeem himself by becoming a masked highwayman in Colonial America.','/jp98MdkytPiYC21N25QeDU3Hinx.jpg','2015-04-06',103,'Released','A revolutionary family adventure of grace and liberty.','Beyond the Mask',318954,3.0472,5.5,'HlyWBhWjWfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34228,_binary '\0','/wqiCkkw9PeOoyivyuRCsNwyD8PL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2433190',6.3,1602,'es','Tensión sexual, Volumen 1: Volátil','A pulsating, thrill ride that weaves six scintillating experiences of men in various forms of male bonding, Sexual Tension: Volatile will leave you wanting more! A young man feels the adrenaline rush of his sexy tattooist’s needle in ‘Ari’ while in ‘The Cousin,’ a cute boy has a taboo attraction for a family member. Two ‘straight’ buddies literally show, each other, how to make love to a woman in ‘The Other One,’ while a man with ‘Broken Arms’ receives a sensual sponge bath from a male nurse. ‘Love’ is questionable when a broken shower brings a married man and an innkeeper together and in ‘Workout’ two muscular men begin to explore each other chiseled bodies. Voyeuristic pleasures await you as the camera penetrates and caresses the men’s bodies while exploring the mysterious and electrifying nature of male intimacy.','/oyT3EBVYhDxL2oLNvbzHkPw5m8g.jpg','2012-10-07',102,'Released',NULL,'Sexual Tension: Volatile',177656,2.1891,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34229,_binary '\0','/4IY2v8g0NM2eUn8hJn9BD3wByhD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt24342088',4.9,2627,'ml','ക്രിസ്റ്റി','Roy, a village boy who\'s a failure at studies, joins Christy\'s tuition. They become good friends, but later when Christy gets a job abroad, Roy\'s life changes','/vroJQMcR4hynkuFbqMhjA4NjOTK.jpg','2023-02-17',140,'Released',NULL,'Christy',1026114,0.9898,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34230,_binary '\0','/oT3MgdcZsWM66QuzZ0JUXAuA9lM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2435514',2.8,1305,'en','The Invoking','After inheriting a house from the family she never knew, Samantha Harris and three friends head to rural Sader Ridge to inspect the property. Soon after arriving, Sam begins to experience horrific visions of savage brutality and unspeakable evil. Plagued by the sinister forces closing in around her, Sam descends into a waking nightmare when the demons from her past refuse to stay buried any longer.','/vix4kqsAlEfLVXt31NKUMqjK0fN.jpg','2013-03-16',82,'Released','Bury the past...or it will bury you.','The Invoking',192023,0.9685,3.8,'3yksqMdBqog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34231,_binary '\0','/iPALrRYl93S3M1fTjufqXGKuMG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2436046',5.2,2691,'da','Antboy','12-year-old Pelle accidentally gets bitten by an ant and develops unimaginable superpowers. With help from his friend, comic book nerd Wilhelm, Pelle creates a secret identity as the superhero Antboy. Slowly things start to happen in the surburban community, and when a scary and crazy supervillain, Flea, enters the scene, Antboy must step up to the challenge. The first Danish superhero-movie. Based on the books by Kenneth Bøgh Andersen.','/kbYXm4j8S8AfLSnvA88uf7WpcWz.jpg','2013-09-07',77,'Released','Superheroes come in all sizes','Antboy',198436,2.4075,5.6,'Ktb2kHdOvgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34232,_binary '\0','/eyJk5LTMLIeAN2kVsP0yXrPZJfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2436386',6.4,89335,'en','Project Almanac','A group of teens discover secret plans of a time machine, and construct one. However, things start to get out of control.','/9u5Rb0e7mx8qOO7zj39KnIR