4mJ26K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2473682',5.1,48621,'en','Paranormal Activity: The Marked Ones','Seventeen-year-old Jesse has been hearing terrifying sounds coming from his neighbor’s apartment, but when he turns on his camera and sets out to uncover their source, he encounters an ancient evil that won’t rest until it’s claimed his very soul.','/2o4vBAnORr9UnLMvWHhULGDHfzH.jpg','2014-01-01',84,'Released','You\'re one of us now.','Paranormal Activity: The Marked Ones',227348,7.3316,5.4,'Q3MS1rRhJmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34333,_binary '\0','/cPK2h2K156k1vfRXgTbyJNyYAKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2473750',5.5,2737,'fr','Aux yeux des vivants','Three teenagers skip school in order to explore an abandoned film studio lot where they catch sight of a woman being dragged by a masked man.','/hnenGxU08EzNpjz7LYPj4pBEFYf.jpg','2014-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Among the Living',254186,2.7868,5.3,'cm8wZZgHtiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34334,_binary '\0','/74IaLYwgko2nTLj8Gz9ukQ4RIvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2473794',6.8,28856,'en','Mr. Turner','Eccentric British painter J.M.W. Turner lives his last 25 years with gusto and secretly becomes involved with a seaside landlady, while his faithful housekeeper bears an unrequited love for him.','/rnVhl1PFSOoW5c6UhZJZt5TV98p.jpg','2014-10-31',150,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Turner',245700,4.7811,6.543,'jWjKggucxIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34335,_binary '\0','/irxjcC0io2ibj703Wr0FQABeZdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474024',5.9,11372,'en','The Last Five Years','In New York, a struggling actress and a successful writer sing about their failed marriage from two perspectives.','/dxTLKSTyGb5IXB64iNgU9AWAsXT.jpg','2014-11-03',94,'Released','There are two sides to every love story.','The Last Five Years',206296,2.9561,5.8,'9FKjLJZdycI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34336,_binary '\0','/tz6gIe2k5ztFAfDYg4dHbDoAfl7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474310',6.8,5223,'hu','Viharsarok','Szabolcs plays in a German football team, as does Bernard. They are roommates, best friends, inseparable. A lost match makes him reconsider his life and he goes back to Hungary in hope for more simplicity. Yet his solitude does not last long. Soon after his arrival he meets Áron and a mutual attraction between the two boys develops when suddenly Szabolcs receives an unexpected phone call from Bernard: he has arrived to Hungary...','/oartojnh2YHIwyUFYj6mCLqOZt5.jpg','2014-02-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Land of Storms',254005,1.4843,6.317,'pumUHoRrAnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34337,_binary '\0','/eXYrO4nvvC0atKfAGCeRKzIS9Jn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474438',7,3513,'fr','Attila Marcel','Paul is a sweet man-child, raised — and smothered — by his two eccentric aunts in Paris since the death of his parents when he was a toddler. Now thirty-three, he still does not speak. Paul\'s aunts have only one dream for him: to win piano competitions. Although Paul practices dutifully, he remains unfulfilled until he submits to the interventions of his upstairs neighbour. Suitably named after the novelist, Madame Proust offers Paul a concoction that unlocks repressed memories from his childhood and awakens the most delightful of fantasies.','/eU61s3yRn7zFKof1sDrS018d2vs.jpg','2013-11-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Attila Marcel',186729,2.9457,6.904,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34338,_binary '\0','/x0BJYrY8LDDWumXpLT9m3WF44Mn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474932',5.8,3927,'en','Despite the Falling Snow','New York, 1961. Alexander Ivanov, a high-ranked Soviet bureaucrat, reluctantly defects to the West while is part of a diplomatic mission, feeling the grief of being unable to know the fate of his wife Katya, whom he has had to leave behind in Moscow. Only many years later, in 1991, he will finally find out the truth when his niece Lauren travels to Moscow to participate in a painting exhibition.','/uZ3o8weY8zcwmACdhqJXgkAe5zU.jpg','2016-01-29',94,'Released','You can betray your country but not your heart.','Despite the Falling Snow',366901,2.5776,5.7,'PkS1Q_Ik5BM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34339,_binary '\0','/wlTLDtE1I9V3wD2H4YfNb0MkZXO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474958',6,10776,'en','Kill Your Friends','A&R man Steven Stelfox is slashing and burning his way through the music business, a world where \'no one knows anything\' and where careers are made and broken by chance and the fickle tastes of the general public. Fuelled by greed, ambition and inhuman quantities of drugs, Stelfox lives the dream, as he searches for his next hit record.','/pMqa6G9iSDQZtuDIIl4Rw5NDGmQ.jpg','2015-11-06',104,'Released','Lies. Betrayal. Murder. Just another day in the music industry.','Kill Your Friends',318922,3.6995,6.038,'AhtAqjCsi18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34340,_binary '\0','/mXcoOFlpwNepO3TsWGuPb9Aurld.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474972',4.7,6727,'en','Alien Outpost','A documentary crew follows an elite unit of soldiers in the wake of an alien invasion.','/dXe0HXP66DyTv6mw5pxbGq89knr.jpg','2014-09-19',93,'Released','Mankind\'s Last Stand','Alien Outpost',312526,2.624,5.029,'TRMMxIRp0gI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34341,_binary '\0','/x3qfexS225RyoOUz807q5KVFQwp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2474976',5.7,20354,'en','The Hallow','Deep within the darkness of secluded forest land in rural Ireland dwells an ancient evil. Feared by the nearby superstitious villagers as cursed creatures who prey upon the lost, their secrets have been kept from civilization and remain on their hallowed ground. But when a conservationist from London moves in with his wife and infant child in order to survey the land for future construction, his actions unwittingly disturb the horde of demonic forces. Alone in a remote wilderness, he must now ensure his family\'s survival from their relentless attacks.','/sOT4KqFPlvxTeEwyHOcn8agJnsI.jpg','2015-11-06',97,'Released','Nature has a dark side.','The Hallow',312831,3.7669,5.737,'-Wox2Oh2EXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34342,_binary '\0','/rKDATXn8fe2b6TvDJMFjgoSwH0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2475154',7.5,2261,'pt','Elena','Petra heads to New York in search of her older sister after a long time of being separated. They are both movie actresses and heirs of the wounds of the Brazilian dictatorship. But Petra has only a few clues: home movies, newspaper clippings, a diary...','/tJ71RMba3A3zAUvxChgXhBOrLRp.jpg','2013-04-11',82,'Released',NULL,'Elena',160859,1.2692,7.3,'Hpg10V0v-7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34343,_binary '\0','/qxkejUxl8Hm5KKDKiRiHGMMYVcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2475544',6.7,1327,'en','Manhunt: The Inside Story of the Hunt for Bin Laden','An espionage tale from inside the CIA\'s long conflict against Al Qaeda, as revealed by the remarkable women and men whose secret war against Osama bin Laden started nearly a decade before most of us even knew his name.','/xCW8CaeqZmVy6pS2i1sZZgkR6bD.jpg','2013-01-20',100,'Released','The raid took 40 minutes. The search took two decades.','Manhunt: The Inside Story of the Hunt for Bin Laden',159011,0.794,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34344,_binary '\0','/9vgd9tMEGzteNRdd1UezWdYijKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2475846',4.5,1431,'en','Against the Wild','The action-packed feature film tells the dramatic tale of two siblings and their Alaskan Malamute, who must make an emergency landing when their small plane has engine problems. They find themselves in a beautiful but potentially dangerous natural environment that they must overcome together.','/cTs2mJEJMa6WxYt4ZJnlz2xK0VC.jpg','2013-12-29',90,'Released','Partners in survival. Friends for life.','Against the Wild',246449,1.9603,5.2,'uk7wYzoj0Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-1