g mother Nawal has to fight for her inheritance in order to save her daughter and home in a society where having a son would be a game changer.','/7nQgIXi8BQSFASb15fWVQBTthgW.jpg','2024-01-12',113,'Released','Nawal’s brave deception.','Inshallah a Boy',1069185,1.6538,7.1,'nmcfWNjjuDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34505,_binary '\0','/dJj3rT0OcSi5G713BezmqIDfd90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25406500',7.7,8806,'ml','ഇരട്ട','After a cop is found dead, a policeman\'s investigation sparks a chilling search for the truth connected to his estranged twin and their fraught past.','/4km0kB3EIZxrmWBybJzf6PtvZFn.jpg','2023-02-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Iratta',945167,2.3774,6.888,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34506,_binary '\0','/z9F50fEfdi4E1XzUINJBhPWgJGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2542368',6.6,3895,'nl','Soof','Soof is reaching 40 and has everything she ever wanted: three children, a small catering business, a sweet husband Kasper and a lovely home. Until she starts asking herself: \'is this all there is\'?','/jPh9PLlIlzmnp0jwzovBwuXiLeG.jpg','2013-12-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Soof',230217,1.0644,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34507,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2542406',8,2224,'ta','பரதேசி','Before independence during the 1940\'s depicts the lives of poor carefree villagers who are lured to work in tea plantation farms and how they are forced to live rest of their lives as slaves with no traces of hope and freedom.','/q7ILAFCPI1Xnou55R9ymJXwwvyO.jpg','2013-03-15',126,'Released',NULL,'Paradesi',146584,0.9426,7.667,'SV4oEP4QUY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34508,_binary '\0','/hL8S0xhLnOB6rEvEzXErjAW9d2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25425178',7.1,2069,'te','A Journey to Kasi','Jack Weber, a post-doctoral student on Hindu Vedantic Doctrine, meets a prostitute Swetha and eventually develops feelings for her. They set out on a journey to Kasi. In a parallel story, Sambaiah, an old man, requests his son Sivananda to take him on a pilgrimage to Kasi. What happens to the family of Sivananda? How is Swetha connected to Kasi?','/22JOWGiIwLsPKMQSeAql6yRjcrL.jpg','2023-01-06',127,'Released',NULL,'A Journey to Kasi',1320302,0.4447,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34509,_binary '\0','/nch2vrJhqSY7PbdZKUbVZzVZoBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2542852',5,4104,'en','Downtown Owl','In 1983 Owl, North Dakota, the lives of three residents – elderly Horace, who spends his afternoons reminiscing in the local coffee shop; teenage Mitch, depressed backup quarterback star player-power-horse; and newly appointed high school English teacher Julia – along with those of the town\'s other residents, are upended by a historic whiteout blizzard.','/jJc9FJehQALnKOAwCdLVbqgeycQ.jpg','2023-06-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Downtown Owl',960251,7.2529,5.4,'Q4HGKpcOKAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34510,_binary '\0','/8MUZz7oPXQftFTslZpRP3CVMOoq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2543164',7.9,879714,'en','Arrival','Taking place after alien crafts land around the world, an expert linguist is recruited by the military to determine whether they come in peace or are a threat.','/pEzNVQfdzYDzVK0XqxERIw2x2se.jpg','2016-11-10',116,'Released','Why are they here?','Arrival',329865,27.8924,7.634,'7W1m5ER3I1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34511,_binary '\0','/g2AVuSgZHuTntU8P4nXYqEYOSXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2543336',6.1,9051,'en','The Harvest','After becoming orphaned, a lonely girl moves in with her grandparents and tries to befriend a sick, bed-ridden boy next door, despite his mother’s strong objections. Her persistence leads to a friendship, but during secret visits, she uncovers dark secrets in the boy\'s home.','/he6abiplc1atXbN7OztQAiZoYU.jpg','2015-04-10',104,'Released','First the Fall, then The Harvest.','The Harvest',229182,2.0008,6,'XKxstu5m44s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34512,_binary '\0','/2vxKa3gMHc84O1iHRkslqeHSsxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25433734',8.3,27310,'te','హాయ్ నాన్న','Six-year-old Mahi, a spirited child with cystic fibrosis, shares a deep yet complex bond with her father, Viraj, a dedicated single parent and successful fashion photographer. Her curiosity about her absent mother leads to a journey of discovery when she runs away with her loyal dog, Pluto. A chance encounter with a kind woman named Yashna sparks unexpected revelations, intertwining their lives in ways they never anticipated. Set against a backdrop of love, sacrifice, and redemption, Mahi’s story is a heartfelt exploration of family, resilience, and the enduring power of connection.','/hhMLtq9m1aK0dpY9Wcq26XeDH2z.jpg','2023-12-07',155,'Released',NULL,'Hi Nanna',1068452,2.5021,8,'3Ld05Om2UWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34513,_binary '\0','/qDaX2hHX79BlkHNlENGryNi8L5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25434258',6.2,2760,'hi','अपूर्वा','In the merciless Chambal ravines, a regular girl must outwit hardcore dacoits to survive one night before any help comes her way.','/wpOTqABDilffZJttzW905FRIfNx.jpg','2023-11-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Apurva',1046688,1.0801,5.8,'YtVH3qz_XUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34514,_binary '\0','/b7xQ5fuyVO4c24igizCfPgF6n7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2543472',7.9,199342,'en','Wonder','The story of August Pullman – a boy with facial differences – who enters fifth grade, attending a mainstream elementary school for the first time.','/sONh3LYGFcVDTy8pm1tbSOB13Li.jpg','2017-11-13',113,'Released','Who gives you the courage to face the world?','Wonder',406997,17.5877,8.098,'ASAGdtAJPnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34515,_binary '\0','/223v5btruh9KfS0m4eVj9BnEWBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25434834',7.5,18385,'ta','விடுதலை: பாகம் II','Troubles worsen for Kumaresan after the capture of Perumal, and soon he is confronted with having to make a choice between performing his duties as a police constable, or taking a stand for what is right.','/l2LVYzhCuwfPfN80v6lic55DIAc.jpg','2024-12-20',172,'Released',NULL,'Viduthalai: Part II',1020354,1.4465,6.9,'HOxXrrwa_8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34516,_binary '\0','/71egHDJ8bl2K0t6oIJ9mGA7Xdhl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25434854',6.8,2898,'zh','深海','Shenxiu has felt a deep sadness since her mother left. A storm plunges her into a dreamlike world of swirling colour. Led by the Hyjinx, and joined by inventive underwater chef Nanhe, she embarks on a quest to find solace in the Eye of the Deep Sea.','/jKKHyRTXbcjcSJhUdtimhxuZke9.jpg','2023-01-22',112,'Released','Dive into the fantastical underwater world.','Deep Sea',667717,2.8514,7,'GlhWF_qDEUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34517,_binary '\0','/6y5MQBMMPvOMw7e5CLUjbRMrTl8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2543702',4.8,3113,'en','By the Gun','A rising Boston gangster endangers those around him when he starts to make moves without the knowledge of his boss.','/k5U1M1frRT1AnP89dYw4eBpoWfE.jpg','2014-09-28',105,'Released','Nick wanted to be a made man until he found a reason to get out.','By the Gun',270005,2.4415,4.2,'EzzHcrlWpig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34518,_binary '\0','/xHVaTY08gtfgcX8fDTqndHITEjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2544074',3.8,2046,'en','Brand New-U','Identicals is a highly unconventional romantic thriller: an obsessive love story stripped down and re-arranged into the looping logic of a nightmare.','/fQANKfPEUTvm2SdPZKDHRhO0N2g.jpg','2015-06-20',100,'Released','None of us are as unique as we hope','Identicals',343724,1.1888,4,'Q5Px4OpXdxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34519,_binary '\0','/zgx6bBaVLAsFO5ip7gwndOjhE7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2544120',6,3079,'ko','후궁: 제왕의 첩','Living a torturous life of poverty and barely able to survive, Hwa-yeon decides to offer herself as one of the king’s concubines. Once inside the royal palace, two men are immediately seized by the woman - the Grand Prince Seong-won, a megalomaniacal ruler drunk with power and lust, and Kwon-yoo, who has everything to lose if his desire for Hwa-yeon is exposed.','/cLT2eYXoDSXWkqJQcDqVinxIkf0.jpg','2012-06-06',122,'Released','The one the king couldn\'t have.','The Concubine',122126,8.87,5.8,'rZ1ZfTCoSeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34520,_binary '\0','/wTyyWTdwW9hdOlaqM2RVqrPj3tD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2544734',4.2,3889,'en','Bullet','Danny Trejo plays \'Bullet\' a tough cop who takes the law into his own hands when his grandson is kidnapped.','/oSYnKLSl11aoZqJQIK9zoV63l3D.jpg','2014-02-25',87,'Released','This time they messed with the wrong guy!','Bullet',169298,1.7892,4.254,'KucLA4_WW9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34521,_binary '\0','/1mOD7BGsHrj3SWvq8L2GyjqvbKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2544766',7,11145,'nl','Michiel de Ruyter','When the young republic of The Netherlands is attacked by England, France and Germany and faces its own civil war no less, only one man, Michael de Ruyter, can lead the county\'s strongest weapon, the Dutch fleet.','/li4FlbrBWWNk9VnyATNXVYIU7hl.jpg','2015-01-29',128,'Released','Wars are fought by many. History is made by few...','Admiral',277154,3.7778,6.432,'glwnk5x1scY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34522,_binary '\0','/tCW0uGWwfZzRkupNFdI0yUo4A0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2545118',8.1,77055,'en','Blackfish','Notorious killer whale Tilikum is responsible for the deaths of three individuals, including a top killer whale trainer. Blackfish shows the sometimes devastating consequences of keeping such intelligent and sentient creatures in captivity.','/kCk4mDFE96Mn1AYfEcbxkIiw7ND.jpg','2013-06-07',83,'Released','Never capture what you can\'t control.','Blackfish',158999,3.8396,7.9,'w2vG_Ifu4zg','YouTube','Trailer','202