reat personal risk, putting their own lives on the line in their quest to uncover the truth.','/oZJfw78ZyPmgNJ0YJ8070nKEF4Y.jpg','2023-03-16',113,'Released','Inspired by a true story','Boston Strangler',881164,8.8666,6.628,'N_yfmHCkSB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34565,_binary '\0','/gNOyIDGW8YY6AYbz6nMvrVSHSXs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2560092',6.6,6909,'en','The Magician\'s Elephant','Peter is searching for his long-lost sister when he crosses paths with a fortune teller in the market square. His only question is: is his sister still alive? The answer, that he must find a mysterious elephant and the magician who will conjure it, sets Peter off on a journey to complete three seemingly impossible tasks that will change the face of his town forever.','/cAoAgzOCxSytYBqqCQulhXNR3LB.jpg','2023-03-10',99,'Released','Dare to believe','The Magician\'s Elephant',776835,5.2533,6.784,'JvNuYOR7b4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34566,_binary '\0','/nUGgjaSQHIJwQOVJPyOury7BReU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2560102',7.2,6903,'en','Lilting','A young man of Chinese-Cambodian descent dies, leaving behind his isolated mother and his lover of four years. Though the two don\'t share a language, they grow close through their grief.','/4u0iIdNdaTtTg0xY3If9HRZfPYR.jpg','2014-08-08',91,'Released',NULL,'Lilting',248212,2.8241,7,'I8HhLd07fYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34567,_binary '\0','/7SkhcQYU8mxGGCbmRbqOf6UFIuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25602750',6.3,7041,'en','The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story','Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.','/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg','2023-02-11',88,'Released',NULL,'The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story',1075334,4.8341,7.141,'dtJKPeWube4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34568,_binary '\0','/rPWu6jHHfBjBcf4obpThi2wRwEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2560792',4,5531,'en','Skybound','Five friends on a small airplane mysteriously lose their radio connection on a trip from New York to LA. As they continue their flight, they\'re forced to assume that a major disaster happened on the ground. They discover a stowaway, Erik, who urges them not to land at any cost. Before they run out of fuel, they must find out the truth.','/s6Hhs4XnJfwPGrZ51klFw5XK2Xz.jpg','2017-11-07',82,'Released','What if suddenly the ground was gone?','Skybound',472921,2.0088,4.8,'kRouNwBr2uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34569,_binary '\0','/a6nyPzxYy0pK5BVNNfeZcNm9c3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2561140',4.6,1274,'tr','Bana Bir Soygun Yaz','When Onur’s girlfriend Leyla burns his belongings, including a mysterious box of pastries meant for Hacamat Hüso’s friend, she unwittingly destroys fifty thousand euros hidden inside. Homeless and confused, Onur turns to childhood pals Fiko and Süleyman, only to be grabbed by Hacamat’s men and beaten, prompting the three friends to scramble desperately to recover the lost money and save their lives.','/sr2lW3gXxHs8VzPjtcH3tnalm9J.jpg','2012-12-14',104,'Released',NULL,'Bana Bir Soygun Yaz',179737,0.949,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34570,_binary '\0','/y6xagsmCkb8IaQW6o7X4ipK1nEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2561546',5.6,19045,'en','The Town that Dreaded Sundown','A masked maniac terrorizes the same small community where a murderer known as the Phantom Killer struck decades earlier.','/dHXH9Gzk14am6KFFG7B3W60P5R4.jpg','2014-10-16',85,'Released','In 1946, a mysterious hooded killer terrorised Texarkana. In 1976, he was immortalised in the silver screen. Now, the maniac is back…','The Town that Dreaded Sundown',287084,6.1699,5.863,'ziRIF0kWOJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34571,_binary '\0','/b52Vpc5NZTdoj1mlcgc9xd14i3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2561572',6,157073,'en','Get Hard','When millionaire hedge fund manager James is convicted of fraud and sentenced to a stretch in San Quentin, the judge gives him one month to get his affairs in order. Knowing that he won\'t survive more than a few minutes in prison on his own, James desperately turns to Darnell-- a black businessman who\'s never even had a parking ticket -- for help. As Darnell puts James through the wringer, both learn that they were wrong about many things, including each other.','/rJPbS2cYOYhDCjT5NmW1Fm6gFl3.jpg','2015-03-26',100,'Released','An education in incarceration.','Get Hard',257091,8.2387,6.016,'aAn5NQO3GKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34572,_binary '\0','/s0OrExdg7i3RLR7oqzHRk4q2kL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2562232',7.7,703489,'en','Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance)','A fading actor best known for his portrayal of a popular superhero attempts to mount a comeback by appearing in a Broadway play. As opening night approaches, his attempts to become more altruistic, rebuild his career, and reconnect with friends and family prove more difficult than expected.','/rHUg2AuIuLSIYMYFgavVwqt1jtc.jpg','2014-10-17',120,'Released','How did we end up here?','Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance)',194662,18.3764,7.436,'egYzOALlYyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34573,_binary '\0','/tqBA1DeUvlKDpD7u2Z7Sqw2fbQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2564144',8.2,6891,'ta','நடுவுல கொஞ்சம் பக்கத்தை காணோம்','In an accident two days before his wedding, a young man forgets the last year of his life. His friends are determined to ensure that he gets married despite his condition.','/z8zfkQND0z7G5ACgKwv7jBKZNhh.jpg','2012-11-30',161,'Released',NULL,'Naduvula Konjam Pakkatha Kaanom',146582,1.645,7.364,'55XFbsWnvG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34574,_binary '\0','/zlJa0HIRT2g3Ld7l0f8GblgGpBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2564706',8.2,6168,'bn','Television','A devout village leader prohibits an array of modern devices, but when his strict measures go too far, the locals rise up in popular rebellion.','/wmIV5gTjiU9xOg5ZoyQqLmT73JD.jpg','2012-12-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Television',133479,1.8396,7.143,'6s1dRyQ8Zbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34575,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2564978',2.9,1218,'en','Lost Time','After leaving a doctor visit with the worst news, Valerie Dreyfuss and her sister Melissa come to a stop on a lonely stretch of road. Their car is engulfed by a blinding light....12 hours later Valerie wakes to the horror that her sister is gone, nowhere to be found.','/oT95MDcL9MHOobWsN1Pn5rbrms6.jpg','2014-09-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Lost Time',291347,1.4822,3.3,'jZwe4XHWH_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34576,_binary '\0','/gvjh0aE2JS4xaIaMimEghvE03lU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2565752',6.6,1310,'ja','凶悪','Death-row inmate Sudo sends a letter to magazine reporter Fujii. In his letter, he states that a man named Kimura, also known as \"teacher,\" committed numerous murders for insurance money. While checking out the story, based on Sudo\'s tip, Fuji becomes convinced that the letter is correct. But, a lot of time has passed from the incidents and Sudo\'s testimony isn\'t clear. Due to the persistance of Sudo, who is a former yakuza, and Fuji, the police begin to move.','/gvujj0BkV519ZK23dL6vmMllgww.jpg','2013-09-21',128,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Path',253775,1.6022,6.4,'JMsnO4UYWts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34577,_binary '\0','/gyc9bpaHW2GSc63OYpiT7sXUY4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2566644',6.9,1970,'en','Seoul Searching','In the 1980s a group of foreign-born Korean teenagers who meet at a Seoul summer camp to learn what it means to be Korean. The three boys, from the U.S., Mexico, and Germany, then meet three girls who rock their world.','/484oHzBz4ymDS5x1zvoH17DbECA.jpg','2015-01-30',105,'Released','They only met once but it changed their lives forever.','Seoul Searching',310001,1.487,7.006,'j6jGNtql0YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34578,_binary '\0','/A6d09KtZKdVGSg0gzsldjDwwvhD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2567026',6.2,137102,'en','Alice Through the Looking Glass','Alice Kingsleigh returns to Underland and faces a new adventure in saving the Mad Hatter.','/kbGamUkYfgKIYIrU8kW5oc0NatZ.jpg','2016-05-25',113,'Released','It\'s time for a little madness.','Alice Through the Looking Glass',241259,17.1878,6.568,'QtrOm-DBhIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34579,_binary '\0','/ipEGo7bzwQH5H5r10qko0yG9FoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2567038',6.5,4226,'en','The Frame','Two strangers find their lives colliding in an impossible way. Alex is a methodical cargo thief working for a dangerous cartel. Sam is a determined paramedic trying to save the world while running from her past.','/i1xuWy0sHQ1s5UfNcwN2VYnbGhg.jpg','2014-11-21',127,'Released',NULL,'The Frame',305127,1.1969,6.3,'QUm04OmjZMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34580,_binary '\0','/blHv4GsQr5zD9fP8mWph01RfzG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2567712',7.3,51909,'en','Starred Up','19-year-old Eric, arrogant and ultra-violent, is prematurely transferred to the same adult prison facility as his estranged father. As his explosive temper quickly finds him enemies in both prison authorities and fellow inmates — and his already volatile relationship with his father is pushed past breaking point — Eric is approached by a volunteer psychotherapist, who runs an anger management group for prisoners. Torn between gang politics, prison corruption, and a glimmer of something better, Eric finds himself in a fight for his own life, unsure if his own father is there to protect him or join in punishing him.','/cy0A9BUQoL7daCBVFRyyWecoeyu.jpg','2014-03-21',106,'Released','We\'re all different on the inside.','Starred Up',209276,5.3557,7.1,'zE4ziBfu0JA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34581,_binary '\0','/eu77hdChwNXIzEfLaw3ixrAbrLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2568760',6.4,1458,'ml','തീവ്രം','Harsha Vardhan is out to avenge his wife\'s murder. But it will be a tough job when Alexander, the police officer of the city, is very cautious of what is happening around.','/8wlcX2ZKomm2bfTZkl84WZ3T3pt.jpg','2012-11-16',135,'Released',NULL,'Theevram',165755,0.9299,6.339,'39T4fJGQys0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34582,_binary '\0','/uARnuPezr7eZkOsHj2ujFQz6EKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2568862',6.6,100563,'en','Going in Style','Desperate to pay the bills and come through for their loved ones, three lifelong pals risk it all by embarking on a daring bid to knock off the very bank that absconded with their money.','/4nfWsdsJfO5srRZgxiWC9xHub0W.jpg','2017-04-06',96,'Released','You\'re never too old to get even.','Going in Style',353070,8.8821,6.7,'hcdTN5soeQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34583,_binary '\0','/5yzpA7odHcs926hLptTwAZmFoVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2569088',4.9,7190,'en','The Saint','International master thief, Simon Templar, also known as The Saint, is asked by a desperate rich man to find his kidnapped daughter. However, in addition to evading the authorities, Simon must face a dangerous adversary from his past.','/n8tsrPLem70exhXHfSausV7FlPx.jpg','2017-07-11',92,'Released',NULL,'The Saint',463906,3.2918,5.412,'q3b_luiZ8bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34584,_binary '\0','/aVM3Gm3242eGTic389a4VT2QBx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2569792',6.6,2256,'en','Murder on the Home Front','At the height of the London blitz, Dr Lennox Collins, pioneer of the new forensic science, is enlisted by DI Wilkins after prostitute Mary Williams is strangled and a swastika carved on her tongue.','/w3OXk8dm4Rd3WZ0OTvH9qn2YHP9.jpg','2013-05-09',91,'Released',NULL,'Murder on the Home Front',201658,1.755,6.5,'TduVt7h4PTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34585,_binary '\0','/q8mOkQdVNHmgRmGtOXmexyqFzMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2570414',5.3,1245,'en','Blackwood','Having recovered from a shattering emotional breakdown, college professor Ben Marshall relocates to the countryside with his wife and young son, hoping for a fresh start. He has a teaching job lined up and a new home to move into; things finally look to be going Ben\'s way. Until, that is, he starts to feel that something isn\'t quite right in the house. Finding himself plagued by spectral visions, Ben becomes obsessed with uncovering the truth behind a local mystery that appears to be putting the lives of his family in danger','/uqQT68BJ2Skiuk5S2elmvAijmfJ.jpg','2014-08-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Blackwood',225285,2.0523,5.9,'mLziyGyn07A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34586,_binary '\0','/7StVyZiKacQxHfuwsvnSDt8XK8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2570738',5.7,1397,'en','White Reindeer','After an unexpected tragedy, Suzanne searches for the true meaning of Christmas during one sad, strange December in suburban Virginia.','/3uWOtVSd28oDwV1E7ZKTcfY3McV.jpg','2013-12-06',82,'Released',NULL,'White Reindeer',176085,1.0302,4.8,'60N-WM_DR4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34587,_binary '\0','/kr4V9a8BdXAVAd1WaEdV6nDrTlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2570858',6.5,15513,'en','The Duke of Burgundy','Day in and day out, lovers Cynthia and Evelyn enact an elaborate sadomasochistic fantasy as mistress and maid. But as their ritual of domination and submission begins to turn stale, Cynthia yearns for something more conventional, while Evelyn tries to push their taboos even further.','/72ctjjts0j8OFQkIFODT6RnYbBK.jpg','2015-02-20',104,'Released',NULL,'The Duke of Burgundy',250225,5.0646,6.318,'P-xIMBnclyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34588,_binary '\0','/1YtdSBAmdihSm6kpBQBztsarYVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2571140',5.1,13220,'hi','Boss','Disowned by his father as a boy, Surya is taken in by a crime boss. When his brother Shiv is wrongly imprisoned, his father pleads for Surya\'s help.','/kOsSC9X6aarcq0LlFAPTECIZ0jd.jpg','2013-10-16',143,'Released','The BOSS is here.','Boss',228355,1.8561,5.6,'zaoDtl0GL2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34589,_binary '\0','/tsLvEmqspGcD9SrsPId8GnQEgIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2571502',6.4,1614,'fr','Les yeux jaunes des crocodiles','Josephine and Iris, sisters with opposite personalities, have their relationship radically transformed while working on a book.','/rRhLaXepn0Bib67NLmHhvOnxQcw.jpg','2014-04-09',118,'Released',NULL,'The Yellow Eyes of Crocodiles',260312,1.554,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34590,_binary '\0','/fvsKY0EjwC3kMmP6tuuLkFqqLty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2572212',6.2,3112,'en','Surrounded','After her stagecoach is ambushed, a woman is tasked with holding a dangerous outlaw captive and must survive the day when the bandit’s gang tries to free him.','/iVVvlosgMU6aePXavihV3L3V3D6.jpg','2023-04-02',100,'Released','Never surrender.','Surrounded',759584,2.6961,6.2,'h1PcWQcsQuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34591,_binary '\0','/jTHtYidds3hy6fVl2ZPoAyNr2AR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2572632',5.8,4667,'en','Vendetta','Special ops interrogation officer Jimmy Vickers tracks down a gang who slaughtered his parents while at the same time avoiding being tracked down by his old unit and the cops. With police closing in and his old unit on his trail, he has to evade capture long enough to complete his gruesome crusade.','/Avmal6Ma8E4rluk2g3FxIlNVfMS.jpg','2013-11-08',102,'Released','Judge, jury, executioner.','Vendetta',225747,3.3047,5.8,'J9X0pEsJshU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34592,_binary '\0','/juhNBu3B3B4ijVimeiUlAHFlooA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25730490',3.7,1726,'sv','Canceled','Gone Ghosting is a popular ghost hunting team that earned millions from live broadcasts and selling merch. Lise, Catta, Sandro, and Polly join the group to live-stream a ghost hunt to prove that everything is real. They break into a place where legend says everyone has died and do the craziest broadcast ever live.','/kgtDMp1Qut4M92g2yTdX2YL9zh8.jpg','2023-08-25',97,'Released','THE WAY BACK GOES THROUGH HELL','Canceled',1070535,1.5752,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34593,_binary '\0','/jKGC5KoRza6IX5aKBnovBXH4Vey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2573198',6.6,2229,'ja','ハル','Kurumi’s heart was broken by the sudden death of her boyfriend in a tragic airplane accident. By melding futuristic technology with the binary equivalent of human emotion, a brilliant scientist created an ultra-lifelike robotic surrogate to take Hal’s place – and lure Kurumi from her shroud of solitude.','/xSiBXQGAXfEYjaxUySI53AAFH3.jpg','2013-06-08',60,'Released',NULL,'Hal',196761,2.3307,7,'OS43cCcWU0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34594,_binary '\0','/81MTnnn2ZJjpAUT26qZ4edyG3Bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2573372',4.8,1690,'en','Becoming','A couple on a road trip through America encounter a terrifying dark force older than the country itself. An evil that transforms loved ones into someone terrifying, the entity has left a trail of murdered families going back hundreds of years.','/9NZdljsmvWcAGyPqzKgmdLvn97t.jpg','2020-04-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Becoming',526052,2.1692,5.3,'OLpCqbkU07Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34595,_binary '\0','/eGdQOaHEEyTJDMyWYl8eUlQ7PZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2573438',5.4,6039,'tr','G.D.O. KaraKedi','Three brothers living in Balat, one of Istanbul\'s old neighborhoods, each struggling to make ends meet in their own way: Gürkan, who earns a living as a taxi driver; Orhan, who runs a rice shop; and Duran, who is hopelessly in love. While continuing their daily struggles like everyone else and trying to resolve their ordinary problems, the lives of these three brothers are turned upside down by a triangle of murder, mafia, and kidnapping triggered by an accident that befalls them one day.','/ij8LLpqc0yQCn5h3UBHnlgTSdAl.jpg','2013-01-24',97,'Released',NULL,'G.D.O. KaraKedi',211715,1.2948,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34596,_binary '\0','/opq1sp8B6r9ExY9Nbx9UUjPMDit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2573750',6,2313,'hi','Gulaab Gang','A fearless woman fights social injustice; creating a sanctuary for abused women and battling a crooked politician.','/iGfRhEbULFryeMdUFuRq8zApsr9.jpg','2014-03-07',139,'Released',NULL,'Gulaab Gang',254420,1.4037,6,'xAcN8RR3Ry4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34597,_binary '\0','/g33eIny2fc4JVLJcSoNMMLBUOJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2573858',6,4678,'en','The Stag','At his fiancée’s urging, a very modern Irish groom-to-be reluctantly agrees to a stag weekend with his friends, camping in the western wilderness of Ireland. Much to their chagrin, these modern men are joined by the brother of the bride, a crazy, unpredictable alpha male known as “The Machine”, and an explosive Id to their collective Ego. The Machine is a force of nature, and under his leadership, the men—stripped of modern comfort, convenience and, finally, clothing—must begin their journey into the wild.','/yKW97IU1Wijj6rc3EJr47xHTVVp.jpg','2013-09-10',94,'Released','They\'re about to get in touch with their masculine side!','The Stag',215962,1.474,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34598,_binary '\0','/uzt3lbbAc46LsSfmnmQ0i08jCVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2574576',6,1588,'en','Cut Snake','Set in Melbourne in the mid-1970s is the story of Sparra Farrell, a very private man in his twenties who is trying to make a life for himself in a new city. He has found honest work and becomes engaged to the beautiful Paula. But the prospect of his new life is challenged when the charismatic Pommie tracks him down. Sparra finds himself drawn back into a world that he thought he had left behind.','/pZPbV7sBzEN3LKr5P0OWlp6sX2M.jpg','2015-09-24',94,'Released','You can hide your past. You can never escape it.','Cut Snake',284875,1.7687,6.1,'1U0VuMAwOlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34599,_binary '\0','/qrnuMKgQKe8s1aHyZMaaz54gV6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2574698',2.8,61520,'hi','गुंडे','The lives of Calcutta\'s most powerful gangsters - Bikram and Bala, changes when Nandita enters it. Then a counter-force takes charge and a thriller unfolds.','/JMjQWxnVSI9BrMCFlzdEqC0y4o.jpg','2014-02-14',152,'Released',NULL,'Gunday',250551,1.9244,4.9,'lFI09rbuHQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34600,_binary '\0','/7G8rizluKUAZtNm5mharE8FiTcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2576450',3.6,6554,'hi','Besharam','Babli is a street smart car mechanic living in a Delhi orphanage. He is charming and lives life to the fullest. He also steals cars to support his orphanage. He has no sense of right or wrong till he unwittingly hurts the love of his life, Tara. Babli realizes that there is no right way of doing the wrong thing. Babli sets out to fix all the wrongs in his life and he continues to be shameless about it.','/79xt4XA6FBY9c9gBzEKrpKQ5Mz6.jpg','2013-10-02',143,'Released','No yearning for respect, no fear of humiliation','Besharam',218779,1.345,4.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34601,_binary '\0','/67czeepXFFGFB9IsjYJXGRxnRRe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2576522',6.8,1963,'ko','누구의 딸도 아닌 해원','Facing her mother’s departure and the weight of a secret affair with her professor, college student Haewon drifts through a series of encounters and dreams, blurring the lines between her desires and reality.','/5UirkMzr70C1hBBQNya8CgHPPa6.jpg','2013-02-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Nobody\'s Daughter Haewon',160075,2.2778,6.5,'KDrRqT-jMnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34602,_binary '\0','/lMaWlYThCSnsmW3usxWTpSuyZp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2576852',8,63135,'ja','かぐや姫の物語','Found inside a shining stalk of bamboo by an old bamboo cutter and his wife, a tiny girl grows rapidly into an exquisite young lady. The mysterious young princess enthrals all who encounter her. But, ultimately, she must confront her fate.','/cQidJuA546OSSXKWXoiCeINDxuj.jpg','2013-11-23',137,'Released',NULL,'The Tale of The Princess Kaguya',149871,9.5049,8.1,'ILVGna1QMkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34603,_binary '\0','/i4PxQyFAjuMzpYQgIUotJ7bOF5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2577150',7.3,5498,'pl','Drogówka','Seven policemen, seven deadly sins, a murder case, secrets and the filth of everyday police work: Traffic Department transports the viewer into the darkest Warsaw streets.','/eNULbWYSYVqAISvJJmcCbb7uQGn.jpg','2013-01-31',118,'Released','The ride is just starting','Traffic Department',167179,1.3657,6.6,'o9CCb24I0Jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34604,_binary '\0','/aoidrQ7c0Z170EvyoDSMDeq1mUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2577172',5.5,10825,'en','GirlHouse','In an attempt to make some extra cash while away at College, Kylie moves into a house that streams content to an X-rated website. After a deranged fan hacks in to determine the house\'s location, she finds herself in a terrifying fight for her life.','/4zR3QYWoeY2mTwVWnVxUQQptqdM.jpg','2014-10-16',100,'Released','Enjoy the show.','GirlHouse',312791,6.5812,6.034,'DVwu1qIQRgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34605,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2577622',6.9,2041,'ml','My ബോസ്','The film is set in the backdrop of IT Industry. Dileep appears as a young software engineer working in Mumbai and who aspires to migrate to a foreign country while Mamta plays the role of his boss.','/znXsebVJ9p7kxEW04lT4psHv3MB.jpg','2012-11-10',152,'Released',NULL,'My Boss',151036,0.9715,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34606,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2577990',7,2090,'en','Valentine Road','On February 12, 2008, in Oxnard, California, eighth-grade student Brandon McInerney shot his classmate Larry King twice in the back of the head during first period. When Larry died two days later, his murder shocked the nation. Was this a hate crime, one perpetrated by a budding neo-Nazi whose masculinity was threatened by an effeminate gay kid who may have had a crush on him? Or was there even more to it?','/A6FNr3gUvWFeZi5wg7KFfoG30ge.jpg','2013-01-19',89,'Released',NULL,'Valentine Road',159015,0.7865,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34607,_binary '\0','/j2OzvpNqiAK6Pbs6DvfQC0ApxLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2578608',1.6,2149,'en','Krampus: The Christmas Devil','Jeremy, a local police officer leads a life of a confusing past, spending his current time searching for his kidnapper as a child. After other children begin missing, Jeremy pieces together the truth and realizes that his childhood kidnapper could be a creature of ancient yuletide lore, Krampus, who is the brother of St. Nick, and punisher of children who perform acts of unspeakable evil without repercussion. Can Jeremy kill Krampus and prevent more missing children?','/lz1BFvFfvOXOAvdozk7Jshp2QDF.jpg','2013-08-17',83,'Released','Are you on the naughty list?','Krampus: The Christmas Devil',248561,1.3581,3.8,'wuPxfV2QKjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34608,_binary '\0','/9uNxv66tEPnzsKCDPzcIK0ZIgVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2580382',6.4,20567,'en','The Survivalist','In a time of starvation, a survivalist lives off a small plot of land hidden deep in forest. When two women seeking food and shelter discover his farm, he finds his existence threatened.','/hd491WgKPxeQus2LnvFbYmyUFmt.jpg','2015-04-15',104,'Released','Every Stranger Is The Enemy','The Survivalist',329004,2.8823,6.2,'aH66dngiW0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34609,_binary '\0','/cIBp7rip1kZLSD7BQrEE4UXs6aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25808194',5.4,4516,'ko','탈출: 프로젝트 사일런스','Due to sudden deteriorating weather conditions, visibility on the Airport Bridge is severely impaired, leaving people stranded and at risk of the bridge collapsing due to a series of chain collisions and explosions. Amidst the chaos, the canine subjects \"Echo\" from the military experiment \"Project Silence,\" who were being transported in secret, break free, and all human survivors become targets of relentless attacks.','/lZT5Cq4wkz7IeJEnz94U94xuEWD.jpg','2024-07-11',96,'Released','Every survivor is a target.','Project Silence',726139,5.818,6.8,'AJyBfN957qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34610,_binary '\0','/9CMWvZ3ZUhnAo0B9VXyrypJSi8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2581244',5.7,26409,'en','Life After Beth','Zach is devastated by the unexpected death of his girlfriend, Beth. When she mysteriously returns, he gets a second chance at love. Soon his whole world turns upside down...','/4ZQ8LoU9SwSxSrmc3aOtHmruk26.jpg','2014-08-15',89,'Released','Boy meets girl. Girl eats boy.','Life After Beth',244566,4.2962,5.51,'JjysgllBzHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34611,_binary '\0','/t6izyY62fQei8QTtSeDFaPG2haO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582426',4.6,1966,'en','Julia','After suffering a brutal trauma, Julia uses an unorthodox form of therapy to restore herself.','/56W0KP6xEpvAjVf3Ofc0yyhfuNk.jpg','2015-01-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Julia',278632,1.3878,4.8,'NQSyv92xZJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34612,_binary '\0','/4sOeeDX9uBteu81ty2bcdbzU933.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582496',7.7,145357,'en','Me and Earl and the Dying Girl','Greg is coasting through senior year of high school as anonymously as possible, avoiding social interactions like the plague while secretly making spirited, bizarre films with Earl, his only friend. But both his anonymity and friendship threaten to unravel when his mother forces him to befriend a classmate with leukemia.','/eLjS2bLMjln2n2I73Xu6TaANPDZ.jpg','2015-06-12',105,'Released','A little friendship never killed anyone.','Me and Earl and the Dying Girl',308369,6.3107,7.5,'2qfmAllbYC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34613,_binary '\0','/2gGug6mhhYn6sRrym91n3GAq88A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582498',6.2,12684,'en','Sweet Virginia','A former rodeo star, now a motel manager, meets a young man who is responsible for the violence that suddenly has seized his small town.','/oArWgsA0qwQyVRdUfgRSvwuQYAG.jpg','2017-11-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Virginia',413992,2.9295,5.855,'Jz3E_CCaAXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34614,_binary '\0','/4CmF4usDkX8EvJWbmMnKIS8o4qA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582500',4.8,15748,'en','Shut In','A widowed child psychologist lives in an isolated existence in rural New England. When caught in a deadly winter storm, she must find a way to rescue a young boy before he disappears forever.','/qXIGq6ddQhIYe4Z7A86nZ1qjUME.jpg','2016-11-11',91,'Released','Some fears can\'t be shut out.','Shut In',329981,4.5713,5.3,'BsA7vjg-Fko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34615,_binary '\0','/858cbEQUEwAceAZCtFXsFDcfwzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582502',7,31218,'en','Fathers and Daughters','A Pulitzer-winning writer grapples with being a widower and father after a mental breakdown, while, 27 years later, his grown daughter struggles to forge connections of her own.','/fgzp7gGea27hN5d26mgKtZJQgX7.jpg','2015-10-01',116,'Released','He wrote to her, about her, and for her.','Fathers and Daughters',254172,6.4984,7.2,'1WQEy6lHEkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34616,_binary '\0','/t0ov7AzlRkfuRnDXghcHTIgf4vA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582576',6.3,31374,'en','Sand Castle','Set during the occupation of Iraq, a squad of U.S. soldiers try to protect a small village.','/aw2K9mV3DE4ez3glmKmBxpzrDPQ.jpg','2017-04-21',113,'Released','Home is a war away.','Sand Castle',390054,6.0833,6.492,'8hq28cZ938E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34617,_binary '\0','/kQVdpIPCqfpa24I8SQRiwOAbkLG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582782',7.6,281787,'en','Hell or High Water','A divorced dad and his ex-con brother resort to a desperate scheme in order to save their family\'s farm in West Texas.','/ljRRxqy2aXIkIBXLmOVifcOR021.jpg','2016-08-11',102,'Released','Blood always follows money.','Hell or High Water',338766,13.2565,7.306,'JQoqsKoJVDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34618,_binary '\0','/lcgaDmokrKltbgwQu9Wf6X0qPTE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582784',6,11898,'en','Flower','Rebellious, quick-witted Erica Vandross is a 17-year-old firecracker living with her single mom, Laurie, and her mom\'s new boyfriend, Bob, in L.A.\'s San Fernando Valley. When Bob\'s mentally unbalanced son, Luke, arrives from rehab to live with the family, Erica finds her domestic and personal life overwhelmed. With Luke and her sidekicks Kala and Claudine in tow, Erica acts out by exposing a high school teacher\'s dark secret.','/xYTI11qFnmx39LRhDOsGEabfqtp.jpg','2017-03-16',94,'Released','Bad decisions. Good intentions.','Flower',421471,3.1948,6.3,'qmYcbgJBv7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34619,_binary '\0','/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582802',8.5,1181178,'en','Whiplash','Under the direction of a ruthless instructor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.','/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg','2014-10-10',107,'Released','Do your best, he said…','Whiplash',244786,37.7153,8.4,'Df1xkYYbYrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34620,_binary '\0','/oQaVV7p916HO5MDI820zzs1pin9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2582846',7.6,428055,'en','The Fault in Our Stars','Despite the tumor-shrinking medical miracle that has bought her a few years, Hazel has never been anything but terminal, her final chapter inscribed upon diagnosis. But when a patient named Augustus Waters suddenly appears at Cancer Kid Support Group, Hazel\'s story is about to be completely rewritten.','/kcVuktIlrn9SAN1uBmPDnocTQmF.jpg','2014-06-03',126,'Released','Life doesn\'t have to be perfect for love to be extraordinary.','The Fault in Our Stars',222935,13.9261,7.589,'3Ixw15DE-xY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34621,_binary '\0','/aoH62d081H5XOfB5PLaez6iLeVz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2584018',6.3,2627,'en','Freedom','Two men separated by 100 years are united in their search for freedom. In 1856 a slave, Samuel Woodward and his family, escape from the Monroe Plantation near Richmond, Virginia. A secret network of ordinary people known as the Underground Railroad guide the family on their journey north to Canada. They are relentlessly pursued by the notorious slave hunter Plimpton. Hunted like a dog and haunted by the unthinkable suffering he and his forbears have endured, Samuel is forced to decide between revenge or freedom. 100 years earlier in 1748, John Newton the Captain of a slave trader sails from Africa with a cargo of slaves, bound for America. On board is Samuel\'s great grandfather whose survival is tied to the fate of Captain Newton. The voyage changes Newton\'s life forever and he creates a legacy that will inspire Samuel and the lives of millions for generations to come.','/j94GeQu4CBSmvaxzmsRRGvRGvsT.jpg','2014-08-21',98,'Released','John Newton\'s Amazing Grace','Freedom',288980,1.6754,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34622,_binary '\0','/lTyikzfGgRX5ZqIfVeT26APYfRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2584384',7.9,494458,'en','Jojo Rabbit','Jojo, a lonely German boy during World War II has his world shaken when he learns that his single mother is hiding a Jewish girl in their home. Influenced by a buffoonish imaginary version of Adolf Hitler, he begins to question his beliefs and confront the conflict between propaganda and his own humanity.','/1mqL7VG4Ix8wmxwypmCA1HTHBky.jpg','2019-10-18',108,'Released','An anti-hate satire.','Jojo Rabbit',515001,16.3839,7.973,'tL4McUzXfFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34623,_binary '\0','/Adodw4lGLniSGEayPTMiklsU4Zu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25852740',6.3,1578,'te','Breakout','Maniratnam, an aspiring filmmaker with monophobia, visits Hyderabad for a narration but fails. Unable to reach his friend for accommodation, he\'s offered shelter by Raju, a local mechanic.','/pZtWmps7smPv7N7zbr1HtO02qHs.jpg','2023-04-11',84,'Released',NULL,'Breakout',1419723,0.4066,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34624,_binary '\0','/y7fySMqq4A8RkXSkeqsFx0wlLuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2585562',7.9,9853,'ta','பீட்சா','Michael, a pizza delivery boy, lives with Anu, an aspiring horror fiction writer. One day, on a delivery run, he goes to a bungalow, where mysterious events begin to unfold.','/mdcEraw1DFG3INWiRkuaOc0xV6o.jpg','2012-10-19',127,'Released','From today your moment is waiting…','Pizza',139357,1.6975,6.966,'1ORbkrHs5JU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34625,_binary '\0','/2UevkfEy29FKNqQarPuaMA1EdAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2585736',4.7,2066,'en','American Bistro','A heartfelt adventure about a milquetoast accountant, Medor, whose perfect life is ruined when he discovers his wife having an affair with his boss. Having lost everything, he finds refuge in his estranged, deadbeat nephew and together, they chase his old, forgotten dream: opening a restaurant.','/dYafBJeexgcWfxxpQsjAI0M9vyP.jpg','2019-08-13',94,'Released','Working with family is a recipe for disaster','American Bistro',622045,0.924,4.6,'xgSLevMxTro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34626,_binary '\0','/Tpihv0cSBwSHuO7vSjJDp2fiqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2586118',6.7,5947,'nl','D\'Ardennen','A brutal home-jacking goes hopelessly wrong. Dave, one of the two robbers, manages to run off, leaving his brother Kenneth behind. Four years later, Kenneth is released from prison and much has changed. Dave has his life back on track and is trying to help Kenneth however possible, but is witnessing how the highly strung Kenneth tries to win back his ex-girlfriend Sylvie.','/nVfABxAnahoU65o61cZ77tKNbD7.jpg','2015-10-14',93,'Released',NULL,'The Ardennes',351037,2.1261,6.6,'7ORsS7aVW-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34627,_binary '\0','/gtJlivrn5XG5x24m9biLIuJFNtw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2586120',6.3,6158,'fr','Le Fidèle','When Gino meets racing driver Bénédicte, it\'s love at first sight. But Gino has a secret. The kind of secret that can endanger their lives.','/7ruUT8L9MV0RS8nQM9sDRnboMya.jpg','2017-10-04',130,'Released',NULL,'Racer and the Jailbird',414063,4.5604,5.9,'Eb7NJtR9NS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34628,_binary '\0','/pCykOvGwmvI1Wu3mMysKbKgVcKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2586682',5.1,1700,'tr','Aşk Kırmızı','The film asks the question would have been triple love. Ferhat and Zeynep is a happily married couple. Karlıdağ outside of marriage appears happy couple, the first love of life remained in the years ahead will be turned upside down with the introduction of the Euphrates Nazlıgül again. Zeynep even a night encounter with the former love of her husband Nazlıgül powdery mildew that can not bear to be separated , and that is the love in his heart can not prevent the re-ignition.','/hGjWeHKU7zyZD9wLBJv4PqRl3r.jpg','2013-03-15',114,'Released',NULL,'Aşk Kırmızı',210408,1.9246,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34629,_binary '\0','/9gWrxuOJeArUbvnqrZALSjhPv9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25868520',5.7,1988,'en','Rise of the Conqueror','In the 14th-century, as the Silk Road crumbles and rival factions tear the land apart, fearless warrior Timur emerges from exile. Stripped of everything, he fights to unite the fractured kingdoms, using strategy and sheer will to carve an empire from chaos. Undefeated in battle and widely regarded as one of history’s greatest military leaders and tacticians, not to mention one of its most brutal, Timur would found the Timurid Empire, which ruled over modern-day Afghanistan, Iran and Central Asia.','/9cRE0DsM6CNIiY9Ah3cd8oc3n1Y.jpg','2026-04-09',119,'Released','His legacy will be written in fire and blood.','Rise of the Conqueror',1207162,10.8007,5.904,'a1xSbllpMDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34630,_binary '\0','/ee7nLU6c9JPzxRIqR5qxDXEo3uh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25869142',3.8,3239,'en','Disquiet','After a near-fatal car accident, Sam wakes to discover he is trapped in an abandoned hospital by mysterious and sinister forces that have no intention of letting him leave…','/rVFjtO9u58PMirVHUvyAXLYObYm.jpg','2023-02-10',85,'Released',NULL,'Disquiet',1072074,2.3595,5.3,'CQf2ylF5EnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34631,_binary '\0','/3g2GKCM0og3MPnffWSuEEFQsQfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25872924',5.8,1634,'id','Waktu Maghrib','A terror chases the souls of Adi and Saman. Ayu knows the reason as to why they are tormented - a sin committed at the most dangerous time of Maghrib Time. What sin have they committed and what will happen to Adi, Saman, Ayu and their village?','/tLkviJkau1cRMCoAa06R1gkH2Hn.jpg','2023-02-09',104,'Released',NULL,'The Wailing of the Maghrib',1064312,2.4176,6.04,'bgIlyb_g63s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34632,_binary '\0','/wsZQdtSTgodeJf8ygPbtHSVLjO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2587914',3.8,1867,'en','A Matter of Faith','Christian girl Rachel Whitaker goes off to college for her freshman year and begins to be influenced by her popular biology professor Marcus Kaman, who teaches that evolution is the answer to the origins of life. When Rachel’s father senses something amiss with his daughter, he begins to examine the situation and what he discovers catches him completely off-guard. Now very concerned about Rachel drifting away from her Christian faith, he sets out to do something about it.','/j4JwHpOjV6ZU1StNmpqtLMiRsND.jpg','2014-10-17',88,'Released',NULL,'A Matter of Faith',291348,1.8338,4.8,'QYmREjN0s1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34633,_binary '\0','/8AWRJJdzopEjrarOoygDoEFfkZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2589132',7.6,2550,'id','Habibie & Ainun','Habibie wanted to unite Indonesia by designing airplanes. He met his soulmate and underwent his struggle to become the 3rd president of Indonesia.','/eOdYhBFF7vE5v83KVVQfDEyLgEu.jpg','2012-12-12',125,'Released',NULL,'Habibie & Ainun',172705,1.4888,7.7,'DlU_FyHXS7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34634,_binary '\0','/zdSIDaA4MUdWj5fIMleiPwJbnRM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2591692',5.9,1251,'en','Boiling Pot','On a college campus in modern America, ideas that have long been neglected as \"issues of the past\" emerge as racial tensions and frictions grow between different student groups.','/ew4x73PxUxAuqg74SM2F7ygEFxC.jpg','2015-09-29',95,'Released','Everyone is guilty','Boiling Pot',361608,1.1583,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34635,_binary '\0','/qMNmdJG0WFNXcI6hfZMQH0geHc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2591814',7.4,61519,'ja','言の葉の庭','Takao, who is training to become a shoemaker, skipped school and is sketching shoes in a Japanese-style garden. He meets a mysterious woman, Yukino, who is older than him. Then, without arranging the times, the two start to see each other again and again, but only on rainy days. They deepen their relationship and open up to each other. But the end of the rainy season soon approaches.','/mXUCVq3HMtS4Y9IQ8vmEOPyN0vH.jpg','2013-05-31',46,'Released',NULL,'The Garden of Words',198375,6.7517,7.6,'FMabhvDoolc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34636,_binary '\0','/gcitkvOxToH