's final stand against the undead. Now, she must return to where the nightmare began - The Hive in Raccoon City, where the Umbrella Corporation is gathering its forces for a final strike against the only remaining survivors of the apocalypse.','/gytKL6fimeiTIjd9kl5bfjY2k4C.jpg','2016-12-23',107,'Released','Evil comes home.','Resident Evil: The Final Chapter',173897,1.5956,6.1,'74IwWmTaoNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34640,_binary '\0','/aneNwXogGkcchpRifCioURWhdbJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2592808',6.8,4090,'ko','반창꼬','A doctor tries to woo a grieving, widowed firefighter in her attempt to get him to testify on her behalf in a medical malpractice case.','/aB1zGc5BNHSaQlEhOSni4ts8DrL.jpg','2012-12-19',120,'Released','A day to heal, a day to love.','Love 911',146724,3.6367,7.388,'3MVgdmd8ri0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34641,_binary '\0','/7KwuFTnvGvWJuLi4BXs7Gf24T0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2593224',6.3,1548,'fr','Dans la cour','Antoine is a musician. The forties, he suddenly decides to end his career. After a few days of wandering, he gets a job as a janitor. Mathilde lives in the old building in the east of Paris where he takes office. This is a young retiree, generous and involved, who divides his time between his associational activities and the life of the condominium. One night, she discovers a disturbing crack on the wall of his living room. Gradually, his anxiety grew to turn into panic and if the building collapsed ... Slowly, Antoine befriends the woman he feared to see slip into madness. Between slips and concerns, both form an awkward tandem, humorous and solidarity which will, perhaps, through this bad patch.','/6mCfCONngJG0NPM6QpyBZxeCPuA.jpg','2014-04-23',97,'Released',NULL,'In the Courtyard',267804,1.237,5.8,'H5OG_bEWzDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34642,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2593392',8.2,3377,'en','Alive Inside','Five million Americans suffer from Alzheimer\'s disease and dementia—many of them alone in nursing homes. A man with a simple idea discovers that songs embedded deep in memory can ease pain and awaken these fading minds. Joy and life are resuscitated, and our cultural fears over aging are confronted.','/xuKGqgNAer0XfCSVotrBaP5bCTT.jpg','2014-01-18',74,'Released','Music is the strongest form of magic','Alive Inside',250643,1.137,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34643,_binary '\0','/8uONGrM7zmtIKhJBTbPAdKnm9nN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25947954',5,1446,'en','Gray Matter','All her life, Aurora has been taught by her mother that the superhuman abilities they possess, the abilities that make them unique, also make them dangerous. Now, on one fateful and deadly night, Aurora will find out if her mother was telling the truth and just what consequences the use of her powers might have.​','/zJn1nO2UuS4Oo5Sk49YUHHRcGyC.jpg','2023-07-13',87,'Released','Trust your power.','Gray Matter',1093796,2.2526,6.8,'w-JAJRcx5S0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34644,_binary '\0','/3bEYOnYaf9TgT6eDZHbspq1mJqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2594950',7.2,5366,'ru','Майор','On a cold winter’s day Sergey Sobolev, a major at the local police office, is driving to the hospital where his wife is about to give birth to their child. High from happiness, he’s driving too fast and runs down a boy on a passage walk, who dies. Now the major has only two options: go to prison or conceal the crime. Sobolev decides to compromise with his conscience and calls on a colleague to help him out. But the case turns out to be messy and when Sobolev finally changes his mind and tries to make up for his deed, it’s already too late…','/zc1NzhQ9bG2VI0OvcKiKxgwTHcc.jpg','2013-08-07',99,'Released',NULL,'The Major',191717,1.3333,6.767,'o9PbLbtH1G8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34645,_binary '\0','/zbjPdytgVezATUKHto58jzT5NWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25965930',2.9,1743,'ro','Romina, VTM','Romina begins to fall in love with Valentin, a tourist on holiday in Costinești with plans to become a musician. Romina helps Valentin to become an artist and, without realizing, he is starting to look a lot like someone from Romina\'s past.','/nXyHerwRTk2c9doh6GH09ZbMdjN.jpg','2023-01-02',83,'Released','Will she save her father\'s pub and at what cost?','Romina, VTM',1072568,1.7396,5.4,'IAjkhEwu1sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34646,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25966332',7.3,2081,'en','Error 500','A man\'s dream of winning an Olympic gold medal for India is crushed when the love of his life takes a detour to disaster.','/9CAKR4lmUkIFqbF5N3EA0N7hhKM.jpg','2023-01-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Error 500',1479854,0.4147,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34647,_binary '\0','/dyZb0VGLvN8Md8caGZ3fNko4zy2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt25971180',6.5,1429,'fr','Les Choses simples','Vincent is a famous successful entrepreneur. One day, a car breakdown on a mountain road temporarily interrupts his frantic lifestyle. Pierre, who lives apart from the modern world in the middle of sublime nature, comes to his aid and offers him his hospitality. The meeting between these two men, who are opposites will upset their respective beliefs and they will find themselves laughing. The question is...deep down, are they really each living the lives they want to live?','/70GmOX3yhKETP4KzXmeH3OQOQ0h.jpg','2023-02-22',95,'Released',NULL,'A Great Friend',1000572,1.7054,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34648,_binary '\0','/huTilrUWxEMWT5MzMVLbZ0uJorR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597126',7.8,3186,'bn','Bojhena Shey Bojhena','A horrible accident takes place between two buses on the highway in Behrampore which includes students returning after winning their kabadi match, a newly-wed couple, a lover taking his love of life to meet his parents and a girl traveling for the very first time to the city of Kolkata - later it\'s revealed how lives of two couples among those passengers were connected and things take a tragic turn after the accident.','/3P0fSbYRFnUOP5bZ9Huqa6Vxgax.jpg','2012-12-28',145,'Released',NULL,'Bojhena Shey Bojhena',244537,1.2542,7.105,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34649,_binary '\0','/u9okrvmPADlGSTtpRMGrkKd2Q63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597242',4.8,7833,'en','At the Devil\'s Door','When ambitious young real estate agent Leigh is asked to sell a house with a checkered past, she crosses paths with a disturbed girl whom she learns is the runaway daughter of the couple selling the property. When Leigh tries to intervene and help her, she becomes entangled with a supernatural force that soon pulls Leigh\'s artist sister Vera into its web - and has sinister plans for both of them.','/veJ20fCOlKN60zWcNygmLkdu6EJ.jpg','2014-03-09',91,'Released','It\'s looking for a home.','At the Devil\'s Door',254188,3.1199,4.7,'anZuooQ8J1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34650,_binary '\0','/pDQSxAtGcTt3XLUDMwX83xCKP8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597718',4.8,2333,'en','Three Night Stand','A man\'s plans for a romantic weekend go awry when he learns that his ex-girlfriend, whom he still secretly loves, manages the ski lodge where he and his wife are staying.','/5ME166MZiPlqOhN2N3CyKxfqUqD.jpg','2014-01-25',86,'Released','Meet Carl. His wife. & the Love of his Life.','Three Night Stand',245169,2.1628,4.9,'UV1I3Qa5Kz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34651,_binary '\0','/3uQh2dqjr0aNQg6dAKtdubJCkOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597760',5.4,5160,'en','The Outcasts','After falling victim to a humiliating prank by the high school Queen Bee, best friends and world-class geeks, Mindy and Jodi, decide to get their revenge by uniting the outcasts of the school against her and her circle of friends.','/44jotbmLRwHSIcd4wVAYCVmli8D.jpg','2017-04-14',95,'Released','Let the battle for high school begin.','The Outcasts',306943,3.2878,6.1,'QkEhyS6kfbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34652,_binary '\0','/qCfGkNG8czPgGZVsIy75TNB6N8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597768',5.7,10345,'en','Come and Find Me','When his girlfriend goes missing, David must track down her whereabouts after he realizes she\'s not who she was pretending to be.','/iU5HQB70sL5nsa4JJuPplgqsFjk.jpg','2016-11-11',112,'Released','Everything to find. Nothing to lose.','Come and Find Me',345918,4.446,5.6,'YImOJ96IiXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34653,_binary '\0','/8Rmrz5v9SOWCMhtHfLJcIPpG9Tx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597804',6.7,4150,'en','Don\'t Make Me Go','A terminally ill man and his teenage daughter embark on a road trip from California to New Orleans for his 20th college reunion. While there, he secretly hopes she can reunite with the mother who left them long ago.','/lUPrLn7g5x0jrPP5pZWMVGlQy2s.jpg','2022-06-13',110,'Released','Family is a trip.','Don\'t Make Me Go',861072,3.2656,6.9,'NYxOe7kOl7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34654,_binary '\0','/smxlrWGByIzvdraNHYSmG36w1G9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2597892',5.5,11384,'en','Viral','Following the outbreak of a virus that wipes out the majority of the human population, a young woman documents her family\'s new life in quarantine and tries to protect her infected sister.','/4XLUXRn0Du0xGPUitSuTTT9a8lF.jpg','2016-02-18',86,'Released','Fear what\'s inside.','Viral',336455,4.6212,5.8,'4XdRLd13a4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34655,_binary '\0','/fI9grCtscP4ICChFJWIuoR5tbBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2598466',7.8,1679,'ja','ワンピースエピソード・オブ・ナミ～航海士の涙と仲間の絆～','After Nami steals the Going Merry, Roronoa Zoro, Usopp, and later Monkey D. Luffy and Sanji (along with Johnny and Yosaku) set after her and wind up in Cocoyasi Village, Nami\'s hometown ruled by the tyrannical fishman Arlong. It is here that Nami\'s past and true motives come to light.','/uQRqA01wCnJGpxYu2KpZQ2W0osj.jpg','2012-08-25',105,'Released',NULL,'One Piece Episode of Nami: Tears of a Navigator and the Bonds of Friends',215180,2.8177,7,'ukkgQyBDGXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34656,_binary '\0','/7hJxwdm2OSE4Umsta7rYIxDaymU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2599716',5.9,11613,'zh','警察故事2013','A man looking for the release of a long-time prisoner takes a police officer, his daughter, and a group of strangers hostage.','/iYukEgKMbbWr05s4nIvGqYGt84z.jpg','2013-12-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Police Story: Lockdown',219572,4.484,6.218,'0c6zKI_-g2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34657,_binary '\0','/zgQzlK8BRAS6I1o5qhfUP3m1xon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2600742',3.3,3624,'en','Ghost Shark','A coastal town is plagued by a supernatural man-eating shark. A ghost hunter joins forces with a sea captain to uncover the secrets of the area\'s dark past and find a way to exorcise the spectral predator.','/erZ7mMudfRES9We5zmclUqQltoQ.jpg','2013-08-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Shark',216539,2.2795,5,'I04ojT74gG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34658,_binary '\0','/vWVk4y4iM3PopwbKPoZexXXZ9Sg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26008876',6.1,2210,'ml','ജാനകി ജാനേ','Struggling with panic disorder, Janaki is ecstatic when Unni Mukundan proposes to marry her. Things go south when Janaki\'s fears land her in serious trouble.','/2YrXfW28FDIfJr4AOooMVp61x4Y.jpg','2023-05-12',122,'Released',NULL,'Janaki Jaane',1046714,1.0379,4.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34659,_binary '\0','/84PoeXK0FVyGTEU2n6fQ0qWEULT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2602664',6,1541,'fr','Pop Redemption','A black metal band it is about to split up. In their way to one last gig at Hellfest festival an accidental death triggers numerous misadventures to four metalheads.','/2S0Su5mieHGXXLQ4EQYWr28uXBF.jpg','2013-06-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Pop Redemption',198130,1.9467,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34660,_binary '\0','/rggVtemmDMYn2MUofVtGxDeSTrq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2604346',5.6,1400,'es','¿Quién mató a Bambi?','The story of two young friends, a lawyer, a rich man and a group of kidnappers end up in a series of strange circumstances all to discover; Who Killed Bambi?','/8360beCE12SVM6ohyODcAjSjV3o.jpg','2013-11-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Who Killed Bambi?',217414,2.1796,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34661,_binary '\0','/j9eOeLlTGoHoM8BNUJVNyWmIvCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26047818',6.1,180022,'en','Anyone but You','After an amazing first date, Bea and Ben’s fiery attraction turns ice cold — until they find themselves unexpectedly reunited at a destination wedding in Australia. So they do what any two mature adults would do: pretend to be a couple.','/5qHoazZiaLe7oFBok7XlUhg96f2.jpg','2023-12-21',103,'Released','They only look like the perfect couple.','Anyone but You',1072790,19.3377,6.747,'UtjH6Sk7Gxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34662,_binary '\0','/fz2bre9VjdmCs2ns4qqTe8BCX4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2605454',6.2,1520,'ar','خارج على القانون','A guy whose father was an assisstant to a drug dealer who killed him . So when the guy when he grow up he worked with the same dealer . At the end he killed the dealer for his father .','/i1AmjimmZaAx5vwZBOptl8nJ12y.jpg','2007-11-11',113,'Released',NULL,'Convicted Outlaw',405889,0.6998,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34663,_binary '\0','/elqnjE1wMU34IkeMn6O5E3Zaapz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2605474',6.3,2745,'ar','في محطة مصر','Reda, a young salesperson meets Malak in the railway station who asks him to play the role of her husband before her rich parents who live in Upper Egypt.','/fjbdAIEDGPgu1Lod2I4G6hmvgcn.jpg','2006-08-14',103,'Released',NULL,'At Cairo\'s Railway Station',57408,0.8903,6.426,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34664,_binary '\0','/bNORSjWvhetPA0sXGktL3827avc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2605480',7.2,3932,'ar','واحد من الناس','Mahmoud is a man with simple dreams. His life turns into agony, when he witnesses a murder in the garage where he works as a security guard and he testifies against the murderer.','/aso7BXD0MWVz8XkRsNH2fnUvtRq.jpg','2006-12-19',134,'Released','Truth will always prevail! Or Does It??','One of the People',56082,0.8593,6.859,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34665,_binary '\0','/1SO3YnpeZB4kSBpv4IgT88dBiE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26060006',6.6,2586,'fr','Pas de vagues','Julien, a young teacher, is wrongfully accused of sexual misconduct by a teenage girl from his class. As he faces mounting pressures from the girl’s older brother and her classmates, the situation spirals out of control. Allegations spread, the entire school is thrown into turmoil, and the teacher has to fight to clear his name.','/haqfplSRnIwO8ha5tKOxwnG1sxP.jpg','2024-03-27',92,'Released',NULL,'The Good Teacher',1000862,2.7148,6.364,'5wa67QkhH1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34666,_binary '\0','/fmnKBkXyu5xuXU6CCL9n1876APO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2606314',5.1,3375,'en','Unthinkable','When he is tasked to take care of the former US ambassador in Syria, a med student comes to learn of the devastating impact a past attack left on the ambassador\'s family and the dark secrets connected to it. Soon, he finds himself embroiled in a conspiracy beyond his wildest imagination.','/nDkzuVlNsSVFBkkZQqw26fCKz4J.jpg','2020-04-29',88,'Released',NULL,'Unthinkable',552116,1.5641,3.8,'xustKhOX0_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34667,_binary '\0','/hycr8NAoZgCtLxiSNYZL9kCQcCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26067432',6.8,7819,'nl','WIL','Two young police officers find themselves torn between collaboration and resistance as they navigate Nazi-occupied Antwerp during World War II.','/qAhD2oipCFMUXcZ5YDtQg0pwbUY.jpg','2023-09-27',114,'Released',NULL,'WILL',973468,2.2745,6.528,'DbWlQAcq3Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34668,_binary '\0','/98xqekxcbskRqrSundbBn7H6GJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2608030',5.2,1380,'en','Loaded','Old friends reunite to accompany a friend on a road trip to rehab.','/cLcNaYxGDE2gWkIWjQKT5dHvfWj.jpg','2014-03-08',90,'Released','SOME BAGGAGE YOU CAN\'T LOSE.','Loaded',257214,1.2307,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34669,_binary '\0','/hSiKjVcXnUVfVQFC3Sq7KDFilJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2608224',7.6,26384,'tr','Kelebeğin Rüyası','In a small Turkish town, two young tuberculous poets try to survive while publishing their poems. As they both fall in love, their life would never be the same.','/y3tvOh6QmyQDSth9EKKNzpdaZ0y.jpg','2013-02-22',138,'Released',NULL,'The Butterfly\'s Dream',171160,1.918,7.193,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34670,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2608324',5.6,1448,'en','Manhattan Romance','Danny, a commercial editor and documentary filmmaker attempts to finish his film, a study on relationship while navigating the relationships in his own life. Will he continue to chase the unattainable Theresa a hippy new age dancer(Caitlin Fitzgerald) or will he finally admit he\'s in love with his best friend Carla (Katherine Waterston) who is in an unfulfilling relationship with a political strategist(Gaby Hoffman). Manhattan Romance is a funny insightful look at contemporary life in Manhattan. It explores new age ideas and open relationship as well as true friendship and connection.','/n792aEUTwqVHGTYT80Ry0JGMdmA.jpg','2015-10-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Manhattan Romance',302323,1.1884,4.9,'U5GM5yx7jOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34671,_binary '\0','/jsp420JTZ7EK5LhpwzunE1Pu43d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26084002',6,23626,'en','Self Reliance','When a man is offered a million dollars to play a game in which hunters try to kill him, he thinks he has found the perfect loophole: they can only attack when he’s alone. His only problem is that none of his friends or family believe the game is real. Forced to seek companionship in unexpected places, he navigates the bizarre challenge with humor, paranoia, and a surprising search for connection.','/hlSWmmuuLeV1p3YcIkU59khEHLY.jpg','2024-01-03',91,'Released','Surviving is all about the company you keep.','Self Reliance',1072876,6.5028,5.9,'Ocw_fVdr4_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34672,_binary '\0','/2oIydKGJE1OvuJUH3cROjB88qlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26084136',7.5,1337,'en','Being Mary Tyler Moore','With unprecedented access to the Mary Tyler Moore Estate, friends, family, and colleagues, Being Mary Tyler Moore constructs an intimate mosaic of Mary\'s sixty-year career in show business.','/2A6MSRDblLl7X4gVPVxigc7psqG.jpg','2023-03-13',119,'Released','The woman behind the smile.','Being Mary Tyler Moore',1072873,4.0513,6.7,'zU5p79a7IgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34673,_binary '\0','/vkB6HdWSlnbkD4TALfaqEsFv8yZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2608732',7.4,14231,'sv','TPB AFK: The Pirate Bay - Away from Keyboard','TPB AFK is a documentary about three computer addicts who redefined the world of media distribution with their hobby homepage The Pirate Bay. How did Tiamo, a beer crazy hardware fanatic, Brokep a tree hugging eco activist and Anakata – a paranoid hacker libertarian – get the White House to threaten the Swedish government with trade sanctions? TPB AFK explores what Hollywood’s most hated pirates go through on a personal level.','/tTgeYhe5V7tF3gV7ZPwgsTqVDfO.jpg','2013-02-08',82,'Released',NULL,'TPB AFK: The Pirate Bay - Away from Keyboard',50275,2.4831,7.2,'6X8MU4iZwJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34674,_binary '\0','/xV5BbehpSz0ZkHdsVMyoYJdLCDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2609218',3.9,3334,'hi','Ragini MMS 2','A sleazy film director\'s decision to shoot his latest erotic horror movie in a notorious haunted house angers the vengeful spirit of its past inhabitant.','/fGz97aWWA2SaEfh24T5tf3WJIdm.jpg','2014-03-21',120,'Released',NULL,'Ragini MMS 2',260266,1.4881,4.7,'L-JlgcPidTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34675,_binary '\0','/aqdU45qrak58686flWheHLXuq0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2609222',6.4,4227,'fr','Quai d’Orsay','Alexandre Taillard de Vorms is a force to be reckoned with. With his silver mane and tanned, athletic body, he stalks the world stage as Minister of Foreign Affairs for France, waging his own war backed up by the holy trinity of diplomatic concepts: legitimacy, lucidity, and efficacy. Enter Arthur Vlaminck. Hired to write the minister\'s speeches, Arthur must contend with the sensibilities of his boss and the dirty dealings within the Quai d\'Orsay, the ministry\'s home.','/7uXxAaZudlNEg1Lwu7GDEWbK3dV.jpg','2013-11-06',113,'Released',NULL,'The French Minister',209355,1.867,6,'NxF7US5YYUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34676,_binary '\0','/bBnVwaiLBXBkwq9zSZUzDNWUHW5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2609758',5.2,8142,'en','A Madea Christmas','Madea dispenses her unique form of holiday spirit on rural town when she\'s coaxed into helping a friend pay her daughter a surprise visit in the country for Christmas.','/tbwm8GptynNoxbkC5AhjYMYfnn7.jpg','2013-12-13',99,'Released','Jolly. Fat. Old. Who were you expecting?','A Madea Christmas',175555,1.9431,6.4,'-SLe_EIpeWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34677,_binary '\0','/aJa8LScLLkWvxznttGe8EzhJyam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2609778',6.2,1238,'en','The Last Straight Man','Lewis is a closeted gay man throwing a bachelor party for his straight best friend and secret crush, Cooper. After a night of drunken sex together, the two men decide to meet in the same hotel suite on the same night each year to hook up and catch up. Over the course of twelve years, we see four additional nights that depict how the two men grow and how their friendship changes.','/n3n7SJkmSzz4VMJM6B5RmCVjElX.jpg','2014-05-06',110,'Released','It was a one night stand...that lasted 12 years.','The Last Straight Man',319017,1.6691,5.2,'QwUigNVB7qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34678,_binary '\0','/y9CeLvlcDvbt6mIlh8GuyH17e8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2609912',6.7,9633,'en','Kevin Hart: Let Me Explain','Captures the laughter, energy and mayhem from Hart\'s 2012 \"Let Me Explain\" concert tour, which spanned 10 countries and 80 cities, and generated over $32 million in ticket sales.','/lzYQkVuEN0zw2JvJsMUsOU47nb4.jpg','2013-07-03',74,'Released','Witness the rise of a legend','Kevin Hart: Let Me Explain',181330,2.2186,6.713,'uX0N972soEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34679,_binary '\0','/u3WPcNllxCxbrgaKYdTlB6dwJ2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2610768',3.3,44910,'tr','Celal ile Ceren','Celal, who dreams of achieving happiness as a ladies\' man and charmer, soon gets into difficulties and suffers misfortune. Back when Celal was in a relationship, he was jealous of the life of a bachelor.','/sBgd9qbZDIx1BzvapdCminIgkSq.jpg','2013-01-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Celal and Ceren',161808,1.3875,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34680,_binary '\0','/e6eEMq26zKl6Eo6rkNV4yBbRXQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2611026',6.7,2986,'en','The Hornet\'s Nest','Armed only with their cameras, Peabody and Emmy Award-winning conflict Journalist Mike Boettcher, and his son, Carlos, provide unprecedented access into the longest war in U.S. history: they are embed with U.S. troops during nine days of intense combat in Afghanistan.','/sTE5D1Na9mfCDZoce0BllMfTo2b.jpg','2014-05-09',93,'Released','Real War, Real Heroes','The Hornet\'s Nest',263510,1.2215,6.2,'_9UpmtaC-3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34681,_binary '\0','/fYfvtPU3caCfEO3ILavBD1tBH6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2611390',6.9,1444,'am','Difret','Three hours outside of Addis Ababa, a bright 14-year-old girl is on her way home from school when men on horses swoop in and kidnap her. The brave Hirut grabs a rifle and tries to escape, but ends up shooting her would-be husband. In her village the practice of abduction into marriage is common and one of Ethiopia’s oldest traditions. Meaza Ashenafi, an empowered and tenacious young lawyer, arrives from the city to represent Hirut and argue that she acted in self defense. Meaza boldly embarks on a collision course between enforcing civil authority and abiding by customary law, risking the ongoing work of her women’s legal aid practice to save Hirut’s life.','/vcjdECnf9UFlSTynnll3Kyx5kKE.jpg','2014-08-10',96,'Released',NULL,'Difret',245855,1.451,6.298,'C2pO_uX4O5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34682,_binary '\0','/nEuLKnO5GaiefmDy3gOSdXlVas8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2611626',4.3,3926,'en','Force of Execution','Seagal stars as mob kingpin Mr. Alexander, an old-school boss who rules his criminal empire with both nobility and brutality. For a simple prison hit, he sends his best enforcer and protégé Roman Hurst (Foster). When the hit goes wrong, Hurst is forced to pay the price of his failure: banishment in the city that he almost once ruled. But a war is brewing for the soul of the city between Alexander, a cold-blooded gangster known as \'The Iceman\" (Rhames) and a merciless Mexican cartel. Hurst, with the help of an ex-con restaurant owner (Trejo) who has a few hidden moves of his own, will rediscover his own will to survive the coming conflict and to wreak vengeance on those who have wronged him.','/1KQlvJDp1X609PhMlr9aLx4Wc7L.jpg','2014-02-03',98,'Released','Don\'t Break The Code.','Force of Execution',227359,3.356,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34683,_binary '\0','/1zLteAskWWBom6W5AvAqeona9LP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2611652',7.4,10483,'is','Fúsi','Fúsi finds comfort in the familiarity of his routines, until an involuntary dance class forces him to encounter the real world.','/v0dQuDILXHbq89d0v9biRosqjoV.jpg','2015-03-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Virgin Mountain',320736,2.4099,7.261,'CcQcMUlT9cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34684,_binary '\0','/62gQM8q7Xl3rXbnFPRxWkMHqSEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2613012',7.4,1492,'ta','தமிழ்ப்படம்','A mockumentary comedy which parodies contemporary commercial films in Tamil cinema, mocking stereotypical scenes.','/uHxFRg8EwIft7KSfUUkIpW2F2sp.jpg','2010-01-20',160,'Released',NULL,'Tamizh Padam',107590,0.796,5.889,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34685,_binary '\0','/5PplTSjZrO41oWKgB0uMpZANDib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614032',3.1,1343,'ta','அலெக்ஸ் பாண்டியன்','Alex Pandian (Tamil: அலெக்ஸ் பாண்டியன்) is a Tamil action-masala film directed by Suraj that features Karthi and Anushka Shetty in the lead roles, while Santhanam plays a pivotal supporting role. Devi Sri Prasad composed the music. The film will also be dubbed and simultaneously released in Telugu as Bad Boy.','/pi5nekESuNU7wAf28IeOUyvj1ms.jpg','2013-01-12',162,'Released',NULL,'Alex Pandian',155491,1.093,3.7,'n1elLIveVC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34686,_binary '\0','/aTloiKdNs2c8vlstbx3wBWD6Thi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614684',7.2,65316,'en','\'71','A young British soldier must find his way back to safety after his unit accidentally abandons him during a riot in the streets of Belfast.','/2ZfUpDXEFQxEyXfzfxGFA9rcbP1.jpg','2014-10-10',99,'Released',NULL,'\'71',252178,4.4787,6.8,'kIYDNyEkJP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34687,_binary '\0','/wkIqUY4HCSgIOHgm2lhYtGPke4O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614700',6.5,1224,'en','Keeping Rosy','A woman becomes enraged after being passed over for a promotion at her job.','/caT4Cg1yeZZ9RgGV8RzmmQYgwNG.jpg','2014-06-08',89,'Released',NULL,'Keeping Rosy',274902,1.2839,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34688,_binary '\0','/rgAiSdsNCKhpdVUIi3xJIOmfG3Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614722',6.6,1632,'hi','Umrika','When a young village boy discovers that his brother, long believed to be in America, has actually gone missing, he begins to invent letters on his behalf to save their mother from heartbreak, all the while searching for him.','/zdn8Ya8XtmTMSQUUVwEqkGoi7Td.jpg','2015-07-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Umrika',310567,1.3481,6.064,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34689,_binary '\0','/2w4nhku8wqfUGAEEOHaXvoPj0FS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614776',7.2,1229,'en','City of Gold','As the unabashed cradle of Hollywood superficiality and smoggy urban sprawl, Los Angeles has long been condemned as a cultural wasteland. In the richly penetrating documentary odyssey City of Gold, Pulitzer Prize-winning food critic Jonathan Gold shows us another Los Angeles, where ethnic cooking is a kaleidoscopic portal to the mysteries of an unwieldy city and the soul of America.','/uu5dxoVi791363dRQeaPAqAyzrE.jpg','2016-03-11',96,'Released','Discover the world. One meal at a time.','City of Gold',317954,0.8651,6.3,'__2uT1cZWkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34690,_binary '\0','/6S8PK2JrPkWRtJ5O5f2XIOSadla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2614860',7.2,4084,'nl','Marina','Italy, 1948. Young Rocco is growing up in Calabria, until one day his father Salvatore decides to leave to Belgium, where he strives to earn a lot of money by working in coal mines. Very soon he sends for his family. Rocco becomes a migrant overnight, with all the consequences this entails. Rocco wants to be like other youngsters, become someone and have a purpose in life. Against his father’s wish and better judgment he seeks an escape through music and love.','/ccD3qO0TC3fQwtMXHsrp1j03qwb.jpg','2013-11-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Marina',229582,1.6503,6.8,'i2A87iNexUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34691,_binary '\0','/8PbSXZPqESnV6YhwLCPjqpJvg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2615584',4.9,6231,'hi','फटा पोस्टर निकला हीरो','Vishwas, the son of a widow, wants to be an actor despite his mother\'s wish that he become a police inspector. However, his life takes a turn when he is is mistaken for an inspector while dressed for a photo shoot and gets entangled with a criminal gang.','/rDcViuwRwb4wIlH2yHcUo3Hi0CR.jpg','2013-09-20',146,'Released',NULL,'Phata Poster Nikhla Hero',222430,1.2102,5.123,'yCrNoy5OeOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34692,_binary '\0','/mLnbZF4B2ZUYkrbGZL5RGkfe0n4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26160190',6.5,14667,'ko','스마트폰을 떨어뜨렸을 뿐인데','A woman\'s life is turned upside-down when a dangerous man gets a hold of her lost cell phone and uses it to track her every move.','/yW43JgoYPnSois2V0bIpFQFuDWl.jpg','2023-02-17',117,'Released','Why are you doing this to me?','Unlocked',740441,5.009,7.3,'k8qGElYoAoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34693,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2616620',8,1468,'kn','Kraanthiveera Sangolli Raayanna','Life saga of Indian brave freedom fighter Sangolli Rayanna against British...','/azlszzogh2ABTTnZNTWGj8HdRrg.jpg','2012-11-01',180,'Released',NULL,'Kraanthiveera Sangolli Raayanna',726319,0.7847,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34694,_binary '\0','/4wAvP0n2n28Tv5xYv3YRr5meZre.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2616810',6.8,9562,'no','Blind','Having recently lost her sight, Ingrid retreats to the safety of her home—a place where she can feel in control, alone with her husband and her thoughts. After a while, Ingrid starts to feel the presence of her husband in the flat when he is supposed to be at work. At the same time, her lonely neighbor who has grown tired of even the most extreme pornography shifts his attention to a woman across the street. Ingrid knows about this but her real problems lie within, not beyond the walls of her apartment, and her deepest fears and repressed fantasies soon take over.','/6ZFyh8OAxe9ePA8DAWzRps5LycY.jpg','2014-02-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Blind',245844,1.9375,6.277,'cX4Hhqjt6J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34695,_binary '\0','/hQ0XzOn6dYLtGKiddS9kRbkAIdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2617676',6.3,12957,'ta','தலைவா','A mafia don sends his son out of the country because he doesn\'t want even a shadow of his life falling on him. Destiny wills otherwise. The son makes an innocuous trip to Mumbai to visit his dad. And ends up filling his father\'s large shoes.','/5h2SfwKTbbp0T21kjrOPU3QMaHn.jpg','2013-08-20',182,'Released','Time To Lead','Thalaivaa',202616,2.0201,5.518,'4hYS1PoM4XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34696,_binary '\0','/aCNfKTJstRM5LjbLRy2s3cOnNkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2617828',7.5,24786,'de','Freier Fall','A promising career with the police, a baby on the way... Marc\'s life seems to be right on track. Then he meets fellow policeman Kay and during their regular jogs Marc experiences a never-before-felt sense of ease and effortlessness – and what it means to fall in love with another man.','/fNmiRDUoAPmfS6q6HW5OH7q4VYA.jpg','2013-05-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Free Fall',167581,3.7563,7.7,'RvmOWDARyrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34697,_binary '\0','/yXuJeoPkxYjWS9XyNzuR8VDZLLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2618368',6.7,2182,'es','Gloria','Gloria never imagined that an audition for the music producer Sergio Andrade was going to change her life so drastically. King Midas not only brought her to stardom, but also to a dramatic story of love, heartbreak and betrayal. Based on the life story of pop/rock singer Gloria Trevi.','/1yVRLamL1TixPSrWAJQ51AI6PZr.jpg','2014-10-20',120,'Released','Fame is very difficult to control','Gloria',264401,1.2586,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34698,_binary '\0','/92NMNpuiJQsKKQh7qbInKzGZCgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2619512',5.2,4858,'en','The Big Take','A reclusive movie star hires a private detective after he\'s anonymously blackmailed. Things turn violent when an aspiring writer is fingered for the crime in a dangerous case of mistaken identity.','/6fMk2KOraSkKejMBtkIagYTd4RR.jpg','2018-09-04',83,'Released','It\'s murder to make a movie','The Big Take',362676,1.8093,4.9,'bBsgpDs3aUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34699,_binary '\0','/fIOqJeHs4iHUCwSap7wIvgRCwDl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2620590',5,31809,'en','Leatherface','A young nurse is kidnapped by a group of violent teens who escape from a mental hospital and take her on the road trip from hell. Pursued by an equally deranged lawman out for revenge, one of the teens is destined for tragedy and horrors that will destroy his mind, moulding him into a monster named Leatherface.','/nV7LPlyhUxKn5y0nuItCr8D1OSu.jpg','2017-09-14',88,'Released','Witness the beginning of your end.','Leatherface',300665,6.2136,5.574,'wt8wybR4sfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34700,_binary '\0','/6wk73hNnSHqvIbxWHFb9WLRgvNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2620736',5.3,8575,'en','Jug Face','When a supernatural pit worshipped by a remote community in the woods demands a new blood sacrifice, a young woman struggles to find a way to survive as the pit lashes out in anger.','/tBNRzn69tdvQPiKNNu5RA3WcMx9.jpg','2013-08-09',81,'Released','The pit wants what it wants','Jug Face',157115,1.4556,5.26,'qX6nmhH9yk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34701,_binary '\0','/4Fn6K1uSuNkC84dNVO6Q3fdP7dq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2620952',4.7,1289,'da','Player','Player follows a righteous, self-controlled and rather boring lawyer, who is sent to Nice on a divorce case. As he arrives, everything starts go wrong – he is cheated out of $2 million company money and the future looks bleak, when he meets his old buddy, a gambler of easy virtue.','/hprLNXYma5UqdkKVxm66hce8PbY.jpg','2013-06-20',79,'Released',NULL,'Player',178255,1.5748,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34702,_binary '\0','/mAeorMD46ij2mgqQzs4iVtLQetz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2621000',7.5,25634,'hi','जॉली एलएलबी','Wanting to earn fame and fortune, a small time lawyer files a PIL for an infamous hit-and-run, and thus learns what it really is like to be a lawyer.','/zmh8eBq0MdwqHl7NMyVOnAhNu7I.jpg','2013-03-15',135,'Released','We Believe INJustice','Jolly LLB',177358,1.2916,7.1,'cIIExNPgXm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34703,_binary '\0','/tXkIqZL1GnDymT1M8WMXfLzC1qa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26217622',4.9,2659,'en','Zoey 102','Pacific Coast Academy alumni return to Malibu for an over-the-top wedding that turns into a high school reunion for the books.','/liVS0KJMviz4iOfbrZkLqdCzBIp.jpg','2023-07-27',101,'Released','Saving the date since 2008.','Zoey 102',1073170,2.2316,6.9,'2a3VKZyu_0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34704,_binary '\0','/rZ7LnEI4nhcuDafnVH5ADSf8mVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2622122',5.8,1857,'en','Holidaze','Melody, high powered corporate workaholic for a retail conglomerate, is happy to spend the holidays jet-setting with her girlfriends. However, she\'s in for an unpleasant surprise when her boss sends her to her sleepy hometown to convince the reluctant townspeople to allow them to build a new discount store. Now, forced to reconnect with her family and her childhood sweetheart Carter, her task is not so simple, as all are vehemently opposed to everything Melody\'s company stands for. Desperate to get out of town and back to her real life, Melody takes a spill and wakes up in an alternate universe where she never left home and is married to Carter! Once determined to leave her small town life behind, Melody must make sense of her new life and decide if you truly can go home again. - Written by ABC','/bwGmv9x9jSDah0kkNRp1PQIq3JF.jpg','2014-10-22',88,'Released',NULL,'Holidaze',242555,1.3184,5.3,'4cEH-KUjdOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34705,_binary '\0','/xKmIqPB1sP4LNd4ZnILBt6AtzDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2622130',5.4,1491,'hi','जयंताभाई की लव स्टोरी','A street thug with a soft heart and a young, hot-headed former company executive end up as neighbours.','/ywbYwfKoY8WZYHLJLHn2btlJoD.jpg','2013-02-15',130,'Released',NULL,'Jayantabhai Ki Luv Story',189542,1.1707,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34706,_binary '\0','/qWyNNd4uAr8tta2Hd5Toiz14fVl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26225118',5.8,7633,'hi','फिर आई हसीन दिलरुबा','While evading the cops in Agra, Rani and Rishu scheme to run away together. But when their plans go awry, Rani asks a mild-mannered admirer for help.','/lIBjLUAAw2bzeOHBJIKiZI4QDL0.jpg','2024-08-09',133,'Released',NULL,'Phir Aayi Hasseen Dillruba',1072693,1.9283,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34707,_binary '\0','/rZowlIsA2lZDnoS24UQs2bkYTkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2622826',2.4,2759,'en','Avalanche Sharks','A snow avalanche awakens humungous, prehistoric sharks that proceed to chomp on bikini clad co-eds.','/c8XL1mLik4IdRsEpcPUdcm8RxR9.jpg','2012-01-12',82,'Released','Beware Of Frost Bites','Avalanche Sharks',249260,1.6824,3.3,'sotQoOngYno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34708,_binary '\0','/eoLwcutwbn9DYqmWUSshAF5AMhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2622874',5.4,2312,'en','My Mistress','After the death of his father, a 16-year-old boy struggles with anger and instability, distancing himself from his mother. His search for escape leads him to a lonely dominatrix living nearby, a woman accustomed to giving and controlling pain. Drawn to her world, he seeks both solace and love, while she finds herself pulled into a bond that neither expected but both need.','/r5hLODk4cnYZ7OQGBhs1EpulZDT.jpg','2014-11-06',104,'Released','Love hurts.','My Mistress',282672,3.6303,5.125,'aezbEcwKyoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34709,_binary '\0','/3Z3JHhkyzuFYdzZ7uX7g7CXkPwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26229554',7.8,1255,'en','Bono & The Edge: A Sort of Homecoming with Dave Letterman','Filmmaker Morgan Neville captures Dave Letterman on his first visit to Dublin to hang out with Bono and The Edge in their hometown, experience Dublin, and join the two U2 musicians for a concert performance unlike any they’ve done before.','/cyUpftk8IzR6BAhEAR8GG79A4o5.jpg','2023-03-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Bono & The Edge: A Sort of Homecoming with Dave Letterman',1073704,3.2083,7.6,'BjAdRYM9iR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34710,_binary '\0','/2ZmbuDNbL6YUV2r8O5AAenKx01V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26229612',7,17144,'hi','राजनयिक','The Deputy High Commissioner, J.P. Singh, faces an unusual crisis when a mysterious woman rushes inside the Indian High Commission in Islamabad, claiming forced marriage in Pakistan and seeking a return to India.','/uwl9Y4px8TTIQK4N19k6gnW1RnX.jpg','2025-03-07',130,'Released','A true hero needs no weapon.','The Diplomat',1147546,2.8342,6.5,'CnEOLuCojY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34711,_binary '\0','/vReQkX60ojU6emh1bXh2ZEDV8Li.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26232890',7.6,1584,'te','Valentines Night','Realize that everything connects to everything else.','/iz9gkNtZW8FrAWMv6oYoH0XzNd.jpg','2023-01-26',104,'Released','telugu','Valentines Night',1245138,0.5637,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34712,_binary '\0','/1Us0a54s7aFDwDtIfRjlwvnLJQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26233598',6.5,14080,'ta','ராயன்','Raayan, a simpleton patriarch has to protect his family when they inadvertently get muddled in a violent world with whirlpool of murder, debauchery, feud, politics and power, a quagmire that he has repeatedly warned them not to get pulled into.','/dHMbqpG7vZk1iEJaEkCCyixFbos.jpg','2024-07-26',143,'Released','Blood is Thicker than Everything.','Raayan',1136418,1.7563,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34713,_binary '\0','/qPNIwdR3y965KMsiweyuXdjDRXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26234108',4.4,1327,'ta','வா வாத்தியார்','After being raised as the reincarnation of a famous actor, a man finds himself clashing with his grandfather\'s expectations of him.','/hb1YWskm1H2YwNj2KF2BGWgLA58.jpg','2026-01-14',129,'Released',NULL,'Vaa Vaathiyaar',1112564,2.1982,4.778,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34714,_binary '\0','/dWgJDuJof8AjGPRyH26QjSQzmH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26234970',5.4,4503,'te','గాంఢీవ‌ధారి అర్జున','Ex-special forces officer turned Private security bodyguard Arjun Varma, agrees to protect Central Environment Minister Adtiya Raj Bahadur while he’s in London for a Climate Change Conference at the UN. But a series of events force him to protect much more than his client.','/ysgb4NqiSoNrqIVCR4Z0LUhu5Qu.jpg','2023-08-24',138,'Released',NULL,'Gandeevadhari Arjuna',1034155,1.6611,6.063,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34715,_binary '\0','/3hCfSJkgIMr2MuN1p09WqZ2zyOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2623502',6.9,3290,'en','Getting Go: The Go Doc Project','Too shy to make a proper introduction, a recent college grad devises to shoot a documentary about the NYC nightlife scene in order to meet the go-go guy he’s cyber-obsessed with.','/u4BIt17CDcvgwSh7kVqpELSeW1z.jpg','2013-03-04',91,'Released',NULL,'Getting Go: The Go Doc Project',170750,1.541,6.3,'WpCFpEp2JVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34716,_binary '\0','/9ukAM3lAqx79HLs3Eqnb58IX6GW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26237514',6.2,4857,'en','Bonhoeffer: Pastor. Spy. Assassin','As the world teeters on the brink of annihilation, Dietrich Bonhoeffer joins a deadly plot to assassinate Hitler, risking his faith and fate to save millions of Jews from genocide.','/9WtImcI6k9XOcnPmSeN2Kzpf4ay.jpg','2024-11-20',132,'Released','In an impossible time, it takes impossible courage.','Bonhoeffer: Pastor. Spy. Assassin',1079244,4.0392,6.733,'WZM90izJ8sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34717,_binary '\0','/3htgvJ6d0GV633oHYueeISk8J7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26238710',6.6,6695,'en','Sketch','When a young girl’s sketchbook falls into a strange pond, her drawings come to life—chaotic, real, and on the loose. As the town descends into chaos, her family must reunite and stop the monsters they never meant to unleash.','/sxiDj3dTgZuCPkx30Jvyq8K9QUV.jpg','2025-07-28',93,'Released',NULL,'Sketch',1319969,5.4732,7,'G62s3J9LNkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34718,_binary '\0','/mlJ0Tuk0ITFLY0hpIKBDdbs6CwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26243612',6.2,9909,'te','ఓ సాథియా','A carefree engineering student, Arjun’s life takes an unexpected turn when Keerthy enters his world.Just as it appears their romance is beginning to blossom, Keerthy moves out of the town, leaving Arjun in great despair. Determined to find his lost love, he embarks on a journey filled with challenges and surprises.','/nrx02c6gASURJWkeiVzUk4oQQ4W.jpg','2023-07-07',137,'Released',NULL,'O Saathiya',1150097,1.1078,8,'CrpFwtYENpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34719,_binary '\0','/i6ylEEnaxIRAZEqmPgXuMVUIzGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2624412',5.8,9552,'en','Boulevard','Nolan Mack, a soft-spoken bank employee, undoubtedly loves his wife Joy, though their cavernous empty house only underscores how disconnected they’ve always been from each other. Nolan finds himself drifting from his familiar present-day life in pursuit of lost time after meeting a troubled young man named Leo on his drive home. What begins as an aimless drive down an unfamiliar street turns into a life-altering series of events.','/pURqIgBlaYpU0gJkxyCkhSF9pri.jpg','2014-04-20',88,'Released','It\'s never too late to make a U-turn','Boulevard',259963,2.2285,5.8,'xvl1lRFWCDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34720,_binary '\0','/eBNcp12gC6DQRERxutSoPIypkqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26245982',7.1,2140,'es','Tardes de soledad','The life of the bullfighter Andrés Roca Rey during a day of bullfighting, from the moment he dresses up to the moment he undresses.','/uxmv9ySlP0KKiGZcWsU0wzy9goL.jpg','2025-03-07',126,'Released',NULL,'Afternoons of Solitude',975324,2.7566,6.894,'3CXJjQh4JsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34721,_binary '\0','/5nj47ZPRTYry69hRMlwVPpjXJ8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2624704',7.5,1600,'ta','காவியத்தலைவன்','Two rival artists at Sivadas Swamigal\'s drama troupe compete in everything they do. While one of them goes on to become successful, the other fails in life.','/aIhoQ3UFnRAV4wcJZgEkTWBX1JQ.jpg','2014-11-07',150,'Released','Epic Hero','Kaaviya Thalaivan',280959,1.1319,7,'DE-CGPdk_TM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34722,_binary '\0','/gP5b71EcMSoIGzJkKikCZip14bm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2624866',4.1,1581,'de','Die Präsenz','Hoping to film paranormal activity, three friends break into an abandoned castle, where an evil presence soon hounds them into terror and madness.','/sdL6WPcHABejIgppLmddKN5ScKs.jpg','2014-10-31',82,'Released','Can a place be evil?','The Presence',303856,1.8089,4.5,'1KHY7K1_qaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34723,_binary '\0','/6UnVwCA6F29erZK29PKqRyHqFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2625030',7.5,29224,'ko','신세계','An undercover cop has his loyalties tested when the boss of the corporate gang he\'s spent years infiltrating dies.','/v6wvLIF2X9juSXsBb5Ch6tU2LOK.jpg','2013-02-21',134,'Released','Three Men. Three Ways. To A Different World.','New World',165213,6.6528,7.4,'YL5nlbIx84A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34724,_binary '\0','/5Dn52LUvWTcgZmjIATr5vqd6rmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26255020',6.5,1471,'fr','Le Consentement','In 2013, Vanessa Springora recounts how she found herself under the influence of a famous writer. In 1986, she was 13; him, almost 50. The victim of a triple predation: sexual, literary, and psychic, there\'s more beyond her individual story. She questions the excesses of an era, and the complacency of an environment blinded by talent and celebrity.','/8QTo3OgSqS09jFYPwQWXyx0fi2W.jpg','2023-10-11',119,'Released',NULL,'Consent',956964,3.0894,6.8,'6QT9m41vLL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34725,_binary '\0','/vLBhZrk1H6RejsBRwXX9Q9njd0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2625598',7.3,4950,'en','Living on One Dollar','How do 1.1 billion people around the world live on less than one dollar a day? Four young friends set out to research and live this reality. Armed with only a video camera and a desire to understand, they spend just 56 dollars each for 56 days in rural Pena Blanca, Guatemala. They battle E.Coli, financial stress, and the realization that there are no easy answers. Yet, the generosity and strength of their neighbors, Rosa, Anthony and Chino gives them resilient hope. They return home transformed and embark on a mission to share their new found understanding with other students, inspiring and challenging their generation to make a difference.','/1w9MQn2itNBaWPZdtsDHIYmo6l6.jpg','2013-04-22',56,'Released','56 DAYS | 56 DOLLARS | HOW DO YOU SURVIVE?','Living on One Dollar',229768,0.9367,6.5,'Ze72rpWp_Dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34726,_binary '\0','/6ue3tVfrmQRuh3Yq6ppiTXVNfpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2625810',5.8,23217,'en','Into the Forest','In the not too distant future, two young women who live in a remote ancient forest discover the world around them is on the brink of an apocalypse. Informed only by rumor, they fight intruders, disease, loneliness & starvation.','/3xBUU6pYZPe9tqVH2R430y6psEm.jpg','2016-06-03',101,'Released','Hope is power','Into the Forest',334538,3.8509,5.827,'_TRSvK-Omwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34727,_binary '\0','/kW75Wz92dGMcs8rcEUScDMUwvna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26258204',5.6,2338,'ko','독전 2','A determined detective continues his search for the truth behind Asia\'s largest drug organization and its elusive boss he has unfinished business with.','/g9aDZSqH5KmsHbMurhni5d2wq6q.jpg','2023-10-05',116,'Released','Some wars never end.','Believer 2',958263,3.9421,6.703,'BglW4ogv6ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34728,_binary '\0','/ercOLSzpTIswuvxcmumYcG5Aaou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26258488',3.6,4558,'tr','Bihter','Bihter, who is desperate for love, sees Adnan, a wealthy and respected older guy, as a way out of the stereotype that society and her materialistic mother have given her. But she soon discovers that she is not satisfied with his attention and has other needs.','/80LYrmrs3EcW0hj9aXAwglmXtJF.jpg','2023-11-16',113,'Released','A story of passion, infidelity, courage and a great catastrophe.','Bihter: A Forbidden Passion',1078642,2.4872,5.1,'0omLimuZLh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34729,_binary '\0','/pe1hZrWcNDo4pu4fJR287h8vXgU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26258634',5.5,7871,'te','7:11 PM','An incident that takes place at 7:11 PM changes the fate of a town called Hamsala Deevi and a planet called Proxima-EV12. Ravi, An IPS aspirant travels beyond imagination through time to stop a criminal mastermind, save his loved ones and his beloved town.','/3BNikHPFp2TCJvXRdXnBs8Tvcdv.jpg','2023-07-07',129,'Released','When Time gives you Second Chance','7:11 PM',1150089,0.7991,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34730,_binary '\0','/pHYVsFUjKnYpHmhvTILd3XqXwRM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26258714',6,1431,'ta','மிஸ்டர். எக்ஸ்','Centers on secret intelligence agency cases involving five major national threats that were thwarted through covert operations.','/7aqx7T9FNu1HPCyb0CBjJtjshoU.jpg','2026-04-17',153,'Released',NULL,'Mr. X',1126723,3.8273,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34731,_binary '\0','/3zuwmQ9ASsLlI2BHwy9PhP0wPGe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2626090',6.8,1989,'en','Noble','Christina Noble overcomes the harsh difficulties of her childhood in Ireland to discover her destiny on the streets of Saigon. A true story.','/svvPx59UJrUSrRHKd5wkvLB61ir.jpg','2014-09-19',100,'Released','A fearless life. A reckless love.','Noble',192767,1.714,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34732,_binary '\0','/ecR2BYIID0z7cnP3oCq7ZT3RWaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2626350',5.9,37772,'en','Step Up All In','All-stars from previous installments convene in glittering Las Vegas, battling for a victory that could define their dreams and their careers.','/hgAjyJyEvj5S9CeztXs39iEUJKS.jpg','2014-07-15',112,'Released','Every Step Has Led To This','Step Up All In',243683,11.8879,6.816,'-cBttI0W80U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34733,_binary '\0','/hdUxe1yxkU4QaYrX3MAnkGzSNmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2626460',5.1,1734,'en','Top Dog','Hooligan boss Billy Evans has it all - a successful business, a beautiful family and respect on the terraces. But when he clashes with gangster Mickey over a backstreet proetection racket, Billy soon finds himself out of his depth as they look to finally settle the question - who is Top Dog?','/Dt9gXltqfUReFqJ683ix5g80RU.jpg','2014-05-26',92,'Released','Show No Mercy','Top Dog',272636,1.3841,5,'g0svcsa4ZOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34734,_binary '\0','/hw01jSu6sicxYXfjjFRYQO2zYFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2626926',6.5,1584,'fa','پرده','In a secluded house by the sea with the curtains shut, a screenwriter hides from the world with only his dog as company. The tranquility is abruptly broken one night by the arrival of a young woman fleeing from the authorities. Refusing to leave, she takes refuge in the house. But come dawn, another unexpected presence will change everything.','/7GvlNdVGT6RWhQaffro6Bl3AkJy.jpg','2013-02-12',106,'Released',NULL,'Closed Curtain',160171,0.8464,6.8,'iij9UFuAnog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34735,_binary '\0','/e9xU1oJ2tZ7HZklHq23CoN5ra0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2626964',6.3,1592,'en','Catch Me Daddy','Laila, a girl on the run from her family, is hiding out in West Yorkshire with her drifter boyfriend Aaron. When her brother arrives in town with a gang of thugs in tow, she is forced to flee for her life and faces her darkest night.','/7ssQ2LJ5i7MzLixZbEhgn7iMDgg.jpg','2015-02-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Catch Me Daddy',269747,1.2319,5.9,'GNJUklY6NUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34736,_binary '\0','/bpKVsb5LcbWPsdx7PfFT6blGS1G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26270862',6.6,2870,'no','Sex','Two married, heterosexual chimney sweeps face experiences that unsettle their views on sexuality and identity. One has a same-sex encounter without considering it either as an expression of homosexuality or infidelity. The other finds himself in dreams where he is seen as a woman.','/lUTYYt81DXiPebkAitxoN78uujm.jpg','2024-03-01',118,'Released',NULL,'Sex',1228681,4.7361,6.5,'8pA-dnr8jUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34737,_binary '\0','/5HqoWjT7Omcd2dTLK44tQS5LRY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26280696',6.7,1221,'te','సాచి','Saachi is in high school when her father gets diagnosed with a brain tumor. Unfortunately, she doesn\'t get any help from the family or the community. She then decides to run her family-owned barbershop business. Can she manage it all? Will her father survive?','/3jVf4F72z9ZpkiJMpF0nRwQMGC6.jpg','2023-03-03',118,'Released',NULL,'Saachi',1228860,0.577,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34738,_binary '\0','/fpTjdag7KBAj5yubi37AYgtIb9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2630134',5.8,3170,'en','Barbie in the Pink Shoes','About a young girl who finds a pair of pink ballet shoes and is taken to a magical ballet land.There she learns how to help her friends and follow her instincts.','/4HSPgeq04YUghXbSO5tSPP0jZ4k.jpg','2013-02-14',75,'Released','Listen to the beat of your heart and keep on dancing.','Barbie in the Pink Shoes',168903,5.6668,6.9,'Ym9Pdjt-fBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34739,_binary '\0','/lbuF0PYFGrKnMh3GqwFnxNs3cHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2630336',6.1,1999,'ja','黒執事','Set in the year 2020, following her supposed death, a young woman returns as the son of her noble family to precede the family\'s prestigious company, with a demon at her side to avenge her parent\'s murder.','/vidfsb8UxcWIl0amKk7adYdKWVh.jpg','2014-01-18',119,'Released',NULL,'Black Butler',220447,2.3215,7,'fiy5WlSP98E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34740,_binary '\0','/7z2lSLmiJ5jNeYCoXmton86BapN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26304178',5,4337,'en','O\'Dessa','A farm girl is on an epic quest to recover a cherished family heirloom. Her journey leads her to a strange and dangerous city where she meets her one true love – but in order to save his soul, she must put the power of destiny and song to the ultimate test.','/l7EcAvzYaYfKv4JXKroJYfaTzSH.jpg','2025-03-08',106,'Released','Ain’t nothing more powerful than love.','O\'Dessa',1075456,4.0562,5.8,'-YDQR6NUNYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34741,_binary '\0','/z5zMl9oqrj1ZrgQyQa8mQVReE39.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2630898',7.4,2000,'en','(Dis)Honesty: The Truth About Lies','Documentary exploring the human tendency to be dishonest. Inspired by the work of social scientist, Dan Ariely, the film interweaves personal stories, expert opinions, behavioral experiments, and archival footage to reveal how and why people lie.','/kqn5YPQySbYgum0VJzOZza8gOsq.jpg','2015-05-22',89,'Released',NULL,'(Dis)Honesty: The Truth About Lies',329750,1.3288,7.3,'u-dWRVS-vVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34742,_binary '\0','/qxosbt73uW4Xp6RgxGOwSLb6n6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2630992',3.5,1309,'en','Darkest Day','Dan wakes up on a beach with no memory. He discovers an empty city ravaged by a deadly virus. After befriending a small group of survivors it soon becomes clear the army are hunting him down, and the group are forced on a dangerous journey to escape.','/nKbxDYIVKNHevdkIcbHuC3V1OTV.jpg','2015-05-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Darkest Day',340213,2.2591,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (34743,_binary '\0','/e9ZEuHGHZ06AToHlfN1L7nejJ7W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2631186',8,156652,'te','బాహుబలి:ద బిగినింగ్','The young Shivudu is left as a foundling in a small village by his mother. By the time he’s grown up, it has become apparent that he possesses exceptional gifts. He meets the beautiful warrior princess Avanthika and learns that her queen has been held captive for the last 25 years. Shividu sets off to rescue her, discovering his own origins in the process.','/9BAjt8nSSms62uOVYn1t3C3dVto.jpg','2015-07-10',159,'Released',NULL,'Bāhubali: The Beginning',256040,6.1926,7.6,'3NQRhE772b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34744,_binary '\0','/55ryL0YfqbuYDHaQJY6qlAb6M7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26315142',7,4260,'es','Tótem','In a bustling Mexican household, seven-year-old Sol is swept up in a whirlwind of preparations for the birthday party for her father, Tona, led by her mother, aunts, and other relatives. As the day goes on, building to an event both anticipated and dreaded, Sol begins to understand the gravity of the celebration this year and watches as her family does the same.','/gBIQrOpneWqOYA1ZBIvaClm8zuH.jpg','2023-09-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Tótem',958186,2.5849,6.8,'cEYx_vOof1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34745,_binary '\0','/oU64d2IVxXLyhCFgvwZjR6EQC7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26315566',6.3,2870,'en','The Final: Attack on Wembley','As England reach the final of the Euros at last, 6,000 ticketless football fans storm Wembley stadium, leaving destruction in their wake.','/6XQ1WAbqhBMrEB1UAEiB8Hpy5Ge.jpg','2024-05-07',82,'Released',NULL,'The Final: Attack on Wembley',1263766,2.5717,6.4,'sYH7gRgJ2Bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34746,_binary '\0','/lCKmwaiaEqph32GdrbGX6ASgqvE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26316907',4.7,2443,'ta','இறைவன்','Arjun, a tough cop along with his friend Andrew embark on a mission to track down a truly gruesome psychopathic killer called Bhramma a.k.a The Smiley Man. They eventually manage to apprehend Bhramma at the cost of losing Andrew makes Arjun resign from the police force. However, tragedy hits home when Bhramma escapes from prison and resumes his killing spree.','/zRusAvFszxi96hzBfAQWezqnUQl.jpg','2023-09-28',152,'Released',NULL,'Iraivan',990787,1.1671,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34747,_binary '\0','/nbV74XlKammNDGJM4SxShSupOgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26319590',5.7,1444,'ta','ரிவால்வர் ரீட்டா','A woman must use her intelligence and grit to protect her family after they are unexpectedly caught in the crossfire of gang violence.','/vhllGhZ2TBbyB0f5xjgj181PP5T.jpg','2025-11-28',140,'Released',NULL,'Revolver Rita',1074048,1.709,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34748,_binary '\0','/4aed10ZJDnncXWvc7V8ZaFdE37m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2633076',5.6,3450,'en','Dig Two Graves','A girl\'s obsession with her brother\'s disappearance leads her on a nightmarish journey through a small town\'s Gothic landscape where she is faced with a deadly proposition. How far will she go to save the people she loves?','/5Nyhc5JrWiRMuDm4iDIs1PDqzss.jpg','2014-10-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Dig Two Graves',326420,1.5106,5.6,'GsP2t2wUl4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34749,_binary '\0','/zedSgAiBlbpnbETIHZjyXsuO3ZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26331750',7.8,2999,'gu','વશ','Atharva, a family man, takes his family for a vacation and unfortunately gets trapped in black magic by a stranger named Pratap.','/u7M4LAaFVcwLr3sLsuORHPncTup.jpg','2023-02-10',117,'Released',NULL,'Vash',1085547,1.4262,8.091,'DuWOpHkG49s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34750,_binary '\0','/cT9ZfwoPDk8JbgkessmQgxAWiaM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26342662',6,56000,'en','M3GAN 2.0','After the underlying tech for M3GAN is stolen and misused by a powerful defense contractor to create a military-grade weapon known as Amelia, M3GAN\'s creator Gemma realizes that the only option is to resurrect M3GAN and give her a few upgrades, making her faster, stronger, and more lethal.','/oekamLQrwlJjRNmfaBE4llIvkir.jpg','2025-06-25',120,'Released','Miss me?','M3GAN 2.0',1071585,15.5369,7.147,'1FeiTZMtwLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34751,_binary '\0','/nEvqsqcZ7NZIFtkxKXJvD2cLwaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26342863',6.8,1372,'fr','Rosalie','France, 1870s. Rosalie is a young woman unlike any other. She hides a secret: she was born with a face and body covered in hair. She’s concealed her peculiarity all her life to stay safe, shaving to fit in. Until Abel, an indebted bar owner unaware of her secret, marries Rosalie for her dowry. Will Abel be able to love Rosalie and see her as the woman she is, once he finds out the truth?','/Ah8Fdk0K8yQzcYPe3uKulih8wFd.jpg','2024-04-10',115,'Released',NULL,'Rosalie',995746,2.7922,6.5,'QbVNY5unhhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34752,_binary '\0','/biTVTManu2sDupFKicsN2ThQJ92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2635006',6.6,2826,'en','The Retrieval','On the outskirts of the Civil War, a boy is sent north by a bounty hunter gang to retrieve a wanted man.','/ln8GrgP67up3y3S2sLWndsGMvE2.jpg','2013-03-11',92,'Released',NULL,'The Retrieval',169800,1.3002,6.455,'auTweQI0Z5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34753,_binary '\0','/dAXSflkUKRfpzK74kRaovfK09Kx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26350277',6.3,20010,'ko','발레리나','Grieving the loss of a best friend she couldn\'t protect, an ex-bodyguard sets out to fulfill her dear friend\'s last wish: sweet revenge.','/oE7xtGDqZnr7tFHfwb8oM9iRW6H.jpg','2023-10-06',93,'Released','Merciless and ruthless, to hell.','Ballerina',961268,6.7144,7.023,'IhXfUTGVEUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34754,_binary '\0','/kQPnktOc9LP6awJOZHcY1dfjiav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2635622',7,6060,'hi','दि अटैक्स ऑफ 26/11','Rakesh Maria, Mumbai\'s Joint Commissioner, recounts the events of 26/11, where ten Pakistani terrorists attacked the city','/peDKpbfsQ4YdWjUllEQrUbGJLQW.jpg','2013-03-01',116,'Released',NULL,'The Attacks Of 26/11',171879,1.0043,7.1,'20v_DINmWXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34755,_binary '\0','/j2ExXeaolTgJzWPgX1n3jfy3KBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2636124',7,4738,'ja','攻殻機動隊ARISE border:1 Ghost Pain','The story is set in 2027, one year after the end of the fourth non-nuclear war. New Port City is still reeling from the war\'s aftermath when it suffers a bombing caused by a self-propelled mine. Then, a military member implicated in arms-dealing bribes is gunned down. During the investigation, Public Security Section\'s Daisuke Aramaki encounters Motoko Kusanagi, the cyborg, wizard-level hacker assigned to the military\'s 501st Secret Unit. Batou, a man with the \"eye that does not sleep,\" suspects that Kusanagi is the one behind the bombing. The Niihama Prefectural Police detective Togusa is pursuing his own dual cases of the shooting death and a prostitute\'s murder. Motoko herself is being watched by the 501st Secret Unit\'s head Kurutsu and cyborg agents.','/p0kHK9nJoLzpqa6tqOzPgPkdxYN.jpg','2013-06-22',58,'Released',NULL,'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 1: Ghost Pain',196750,3.6482,7.012,'n4td6fF-wUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34756,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2636364',7,1478,'en','I\'m Still Here','Suffering from a terminal illness, a young loner decides to make big decisions for the little time that he has left while coping with the five stages of grief: denial, anger, bargaining, depression and acceptance.','/a9JnIUtBkMCiJ67udxhuv1He8vQ.jpg','2013-09-01',120,'Released','Make every second count','I\'m Still Here',980425,1.2657,2,'GiQX3dJlqRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34757,_binary '\0','/2cKkruj9Q6t0O3OYHaV0dlNFW89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2636522',6.9,6856,'en','The Unbelievers','Scientists Richard Dawkins and Lawrence Krauss travel the globe promoting a scientific worldview and the rational questioning of religious belief.','/e3rRgbUY2Fon26zwJMkei9b26hg.jpg','2013-12-13',77,'Released','What are you willing to believe?','The Unbelievers',191502,2.6546,6.5,'ZxDLkoK8vQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34758,_binary '\0','/xtHonIIIQXverDQM08TMQXjn9Fe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2637276',6.3,265400,'en','Ted 2','Newlywed couple Ted and Tami-Lynn want to have a baby, but in order to qualify to be a parent, Ted will have to prove he\'s a person in a court of law.','/38C91I7Xft0gyY7BITm8i4yvuRb.jpg','2015-06-25',115,'Released','Thunder buddies for life.','Ted 2',214756,29.6827,6.328,'S3AVcCggRnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34759,_binary '\0','/iz0gx0msnS2G2vUcmigSE7aN4CL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2637294',5,45580,'en','Hot Tub Time Machine 2','After their first adventure with the Hot Tub Time Machine, Lou and Nick are living very well off their ill-gotten gains, while Jacob still cannot rely on Lou to be a positive role model. When an unknown assailant breaks into Lou\'s mansion and shoots him, Nick and Jacob take him for another trip in the hot tub. They emerge in the year 2025, where they must figure out who shot Lou and prevent it from happening again.','/lBroHetSm8RMI8zp7ThpFJsw9E1.jpg','2015-02-20',93,'Released','The laws of space and time are about to be violated.','Hot Tub Time Machine 2',243938,5.8165,5.2,'KKBMtjXexI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34760,_binary '\0','/rlqMgjSsQCHsY3XGhvjt2brhrYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2637378',6.8,2777,'en','Match','A Seattle couple travel to New York to interview colorful former dancer Tobi for research on a dissertation about dance. But soon, common niceties and social graces erode when the questions turn personal and the true nature of the interview is called into question.','/4DpIWptBtqyeZD1mNS25N1XeZgI.jpg','2014-04-18',92,'Released',NULL,'Match',261036,2.0034,5.8,'Nis-CHC785Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34761,_binary '\0','/18oPBFI1RlrW0zjaDuJx5zMAgfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2637720',7.5,2161,'en','Ghost Adventures','In 2007, The Sci-Fi Channel premiered \"Ghost Adventures,\" a raw documentary in which 3 men go to Virginia City, NV and Goldfield, NV on a ghost hunting expedition. Virginia City is rife with macabre lore and reputed to be one of the most haunted cities in America. Ghost Adventures has won a Grand Jury Prize for Best Documentary that was given by the New York International Film &amp; Video Festival.','/3yN8gsBIk40fdthF7tCPrOonGug.jpg','2007-07-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Adventures',29721,0.7774,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34762,_binary '\0','/wBUmTf1Yu2Tn8eGD7UPaiSrzgBI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2637848',6.3,1896,'en','Sirius','Dr. Steven Greer—an Emergency room doctor turned UFO researcher—discloses top secret information about classified energy and propulsion techniques, investigates new technology and sheds light on criminal and murderous suppression. He does so by accumulating over 100 Government, military and Intelligence-community witnesses who testify on record about the cover-up.','/7pBPEjEVIGfIDNgq7505jN9NheR.jpg','2013-04-23',117,'Released','It\'s time for you to know','Sirius',186254,1.9897,6.2,'mrszolSEm4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34763,_binary '\0','/tlnn39MAkUfgCA3U3Kd9CFge0Tx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2638104',5.7,2024,'ta','பிரியாணி','The desire for biryani after drinks lands two friends in an endless frenzy as they get framed for a kidnapping and go on the run.','/3rQDyj9lAoHKRhJYhb0L2rt3Qun.jpg','2013-12-18',149,'Released','A Venkat Prabhu Diet','Biriyani',191741,1.1961,4.8,'sgZAjScgDak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34764,_binary '\0','/qcquSEEdkKeXDmyKvrAKWznk2Cs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2638144',5.7,50563,'en','Ben-Hur','A falsely accused nobleman survives years of slavery to take vengeance on his best friend who betrayed him.','/c9CoGrBA5yw8A7YBMz0hGzfzpNq.jpg','2016-08-17',125,'Released','Brother against brother. Slave against empire.','Ben-Hur',271969,7.8296,5.8,'gLJdzky63BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34765,_binary '\0','/aBnk0VLNKtd2JZKONb1jdC7R94H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2638662',5.1,4566,'en','Summer Camp','Four American counsellors at a European summer camp must deal with the outbreak of a rage-inducing plague that starts in the animals.','/qVwZaHB1IHpjst5EGaW0Ck3gVsV.jpg','2016-03-18',81,'Released','Ready for some fun?','Summer Camp',306966,1.9365,5.6,'HosXKWILvyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34766,_binary '\0','/4ANK5uSBMQxEdHSYqSqs4YMY0Ed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2639254',6.5,27097,'en','A Little Chaos','A landscape gardener is hired by famous architect Le Nôtre to construct the grand gardens at the palace of Versailles. As the two work on the palace, they find themselves drawn to each other and are thrown into rivalries within the court of King Louis XIV.','/xFtSpvgTqQJC2IMaoKd7WsLPknN.jpg','2015-03-26',117,'Released','From incredible passion grows incredible beauty.','A Little Chaos',283227,6.6191,6.316,'6ihzIGDITqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34767,_binary '\0','/n67gpLtNFXqpGkM2ZdQoPLjTnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2639336',6.1,42676,'en','Greta','A young woman returns a lonely widow’s lost purse, leading to an unlikely relationship between the two — until the young woman discovers the widow might not be all that she seems.','/9hBpFyJ3pGdupXbaC2L7nGvLMBn.jpg','2019-02-28',98,'Released','Everyone needs a friend.','Greta',471506,7.0058,6.6,'WAEoJkL_8zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34768,_binary '\0','/8Jcd5t7VBnor1INXpZox0CYZIpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2639344',6.7,13828,'en','Love Is Strange','After 39 years together, Ben and George finally tie the knot, but George loses his job as a result, and the newlyweds must sell their New York apartment and live apart, relying on friends and family to make ends meet.','/5nkM5aUSTMvXudUB3M0FgZ6voqD.jpg','2014-08-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Love Is Strange',244268,4.3519,6.289,'FY4fkcbSfKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34769,_binary '\0','/b4uAD5kqB3cJ9Wdka5qlod5BHwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26394837',7.2,21813,'en','Code 3','A burned-out paramedic tries to survive his last 24 hours on the job while training a new recruit.','/gIAYMDb5mIAeCAj76q1sRsKjkzo.jpg','2025-09-12',100,'Released','The best medical care minimum wage can provide.','Code 3',1161617,9.0194,7.1,'Np4MAXPz_PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34770,_binary '\0','/9hGZTY08GhbIxZli5x075Lh3f3Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2639664',6.1,3151,'ar','على جثتي','Raouf is an interior designer and an owner of a home furniture gallery. He is a very suspicious person when it comes to dealing with all people around him. It is only when he goes into a coma, he started to realise his mistakes and discover what all his friends and family think of him. Is it too late ?','/3XlSTDPYStmROqpF3qW4mjQmkoy.jpg','2013-01-13',106,'Released',NULL,'Over My Dead Body',171127,0.8768,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34771,_binary '\0','/cKR1w5l5m6HjhysaGHpZhoHtT8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2640460',6.5,3566,'ky','Kurmanjan Datka. Queen of the Mountains','At a time when most females in Asia possess little or no power over their lives, headstrong Kurmanjan Datka defies her family\'s authority -- and ultimately becomes the ruler of her native Kyrgyzstan region.','/9my4y17YNNIIx6A1aP8BvuO5WdG.jpg','2014-08-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Queen of the Mountains',295914,1.2815,7.1,'yIjhRQUsj_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34772,_binary '\0','/ZIwr7usYLrVodguqdosMiXzJc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2640474',6.7,8712,'es','La casa del fin de los tiempos','The story of Dulce, a mother who has encounters with apparitions inside her old house. She must decipher a mystery that could trigger a prophecy: the death of her family.','/88keS5TaMqlbuqCZIgwwusmv4tu.jpg','2013-06-21',101,'Released','There\'s no turning back.','The House at the End of Time',207686,1.9681,6.832,'clEBwkjs0sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34773,_binary '\0','/leUZ5slPO6wE738lUiavdGLy3zR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2640502',6.3,1249,'en','The Thanksgiving House','Boston lawyer Mary Ross inherits a house in Plymouth, Mass., from her great-aunt and plans to sell it. But soon has a change of heart, which is complicated by local historian, Everett Mather who\'s research indicates that the houses location might be the site of the original Thanksgiving.','/qT1dMKsIIaIsASsHzoLKFXIIYDI.jpg','2013-11-02',90,'Released',NULL,'The Thanksgiving House',234951,1.6513,6.1,'v5VEj2k0NrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34774,_binary '\0','/4Xxyir19sidaQlpS8HOFiipeVbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2641874',4.7,2397,'en','Dirty Teacher','When a high school senior discovers her teacher is seducing her boyfriend, events turn deadly after the teacher tries to cover it up.','/bhgfarQ9e72UFcfMJ517XiAjAm1.jpg','2013-03-30',88,'Released','Being teacher\'s pet can be murder.','Dirty Teacher',184724,2.2006,5.9,'clBRObihbIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34775,_binary '\0','/7jzCLnt5IDGDHhNAKTfbq1In4dM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26420234',8.2,6346,'en','Music by John Williams','His unforgettable scores are an essential part of some of the most beloved movies of our time, over a career that spans decades. See and hear maestro John Williams\' own story, with insights from filmmakers, musicians, and others he has inspired, complete with rare behind-the-scenes looks at the making of movie history.','/dIZ3SzuT3YuAWX1fjdxDevbwQBX.jpg','2024-11-01',106,'Released','The man behind the maestro.','Music by John Williams',1076708,4.9035,8.02,'YrTTTxiuER8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34776,_binary '\0','/hjn08za1KIk68aombOgpqieq9Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2642442',5.5,1529,'sv','Studentfesten','1994. Rasmus two best friends Frans and Ian talk him into crashing graduation parties in search of fun, booze and girls to get over Klara who just broke up with him. During the day his feelings for her is tested when he learns the truth about Klara\'s break-up. But is their love for real? And more importantly, can it survive the night?','/umaPoX3KZZFoFrri6BGan5UlD1f.jpg','2013-04-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Studentfesten',171427,0.0473,5.1,'G4MHVXOLFbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34777,_binary '\0','/47tZ5EDrUEePs5DzQ30YsXecmk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26424928',7.6,1688,'en','SLY LIVES! (aka The Burden of Black Genius)','An examination of the life and legacy of Sly & The Family Stone – the groundbreaking band led by the charismatic Sly Stone – that captures the band\'s reign while shedding light on the burden that comes with success for Black artists in America.','/5aRjJdgFRxy3gQ0l7zgGARMansx.jpg','2025-01-23',112,'Released','A Questlove Jawn','SLY LIVES! (aka The Burden of Black Genius)',847692,3.3667,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34778,_binary '\0','/wE1QFcyvR2uyW6N7LRDWT9vNfDj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26425683',8.4,2587,'ko','j-hope IN THE BOX','For 200 days, the daily life of artist j-hope is captured. From his production of solo album \"Jack in the Box\" and listening party, this documentary follows him all the way to his debut on the stage of \"Lollapalooza.\"','/6EzOqBScbCqoTKCM77LEPxgSNTi.jpg','2023-06-16',85,'Released','Let\'s jump. Let\'s burn. Let\'s hope.','j-hope IN THE BOX',1076443,2.7029,8.346,'rGESlN9wias','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34779,_binary '\0','/aUc9aTBwtQWZ0gNRDgOH8EMId8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26425693',5.3,1250,'zh','绿夜','Two lone female fighters who have learned to rely on no one but themselves venture into Seoul\'s underworld. In search of the big hit that could mean liberation from their useless husbands, these disparate women grow closer.','/7pb4jesQRCVCcOAiHJ4uqZtetDa.jpg','2023-11-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Green Night',1075813,2.3642,6.2,'ADOonnEcG2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34780,_binary '\0','/vxd7z21i77vLZpVNy0nMF5aepfF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2643308',6.4,2594,'ru','Околофутбола','This movie is about soccer hooligans, the most aggressive and violent soccer aficionados. They are an exclusive group, the elite of all soccer fans. Whoever they may be in their everyday lives—college students, bankers, musicians, or car mechanics—they are a “firm.” It’s easy to get into a firm, but once you’re in, it’s for life. There’s no going back. The movie is based on actual events','/vcTLIaPBRMxl3nbFqV7cuaBi23q.jpg','2013-09-24',100,'Released','We\'re Here To Stay!','Kicking Off',227199,1.2032,6.2,'F0DbQKdV3SQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34781,_binary '\0','/xRr7mnOJ39bZtCRmVefrm3sBxX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26434746',4.4,2560,'en','First Shift','NYPD veteran Mike and rookie Angela tackle a high-stakes day on New York\'s toughest streets, diving headfirst into a vortex of danger and action. Their adrenaline-fueled pursuits and unexpected threats unfold as they navigate perilous encounters. Amidst the chaos, intense challenges forge unbreakable bonds.','/ajsGI4JYaciPIe3gPgiJ3Vw5Vre.jpg','2024-08-30',89,'Released','Day one, duty calls','First Shift',1090007,2.6862,5.4,'j9NVJ8Cbm-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34782,_binary '\0','/lUlz0oE3zhAku7QvGoDJCeaFuiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26439204',4.5,2660,'en','Mercy','An ex-military doctor finds herself in a deadly battle for survival when the Irish mafia seize control of the hospital at which she works. When her son is taken hostage, she is forced to rely upon her battle-hardened past and lethal skills after realizing there’s no one left to save the day but her.','/8voINwqMlscROrjhN97fGkmhvEV.jpg','2023-05-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Mercy',1111966,2.5773,6.1,'Kz-fFw4ELuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34783,_binary '\0','/w57nxiBIODAYHLRs1xmrCY9zEFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26439764',8.1,59242,'kn','ಕಾಂತಾರ: ಅಧ್ಯಾಯ - ೧','During the Kadamba reign, King Vijayendra, the ruler of the fictional feudatory land of Bangra, meets his final fate while venturing into the mystical forest of Kantara. Witnessing this, his son Rajashekara seals the borders of their realm. Later, Prince Kulashekara reopens them through a brutal massacre. The protagonist, Berme, in search of prosperity, crosses the divide and ignites a conflict of faith, power, and destiny between the Kingdom and Nature.','/ehQPboTPaIMkMUOoNOh8e7pZ5Rp.jpg','2025-10-01',165,'Released',NULL,'Kantara - A Legend: Chapter 1',1083637,5.9316,7.273,'TMQUFhWm8C0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34784,_binary '\0','/zUCDf87awNIwV5N4NQdA807dGTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26439870',4.8,6204,'hi','आज़ाद','In 1920s India, a young stable boy bonds with a spirited horse. Amid rebellion and tyranny, his quest to ride the majestic animal becomes a journey of courage, awakening him to the country\'s fight for freedom.','/yWFpiJcUJfXRbm3om48kNJ0MU7A.jpg','2025-01-17',147,'Released',NULL,'Azaad',1379877,1.8988,6.154,'Lini8Tqyqmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34785,_binary '\0','/wbW4w4HvvzDavQCjUKtLMosyNn5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26440619',7,11616,'de','Roter Himmel','Self-important author Leon joins his best friend on a summer holiday near the Baltic Sea to complete his novel. When they arrive, they find their house is already occupied by a carefree woman who challenges Leon to open up. Meanwhile, forest wildfires rage around them and impending disaster looms.','/k8NYzD01zAUsdqocjhLXbO9BSS8.jpg','2023-04-20',103,'Released',NULL,'Afire',900379,7.2493,6.8,'KzdO_J10kEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34786,_binary '\0','/w5KvL8rwSh7u8IcKs4E93phKwBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26442053',5.3,6789,'en','Old Guy','Stuck at a dead end but vying for the love of spunky club manager Anata, aging contract killer Danny Dolinski is thrilled when The Company pulls him back in the field, but only to train Gen Z newcomer Wihlborg, a prodigy assassin with an attitude.','/mr46kEBqDreAeZyDxD1ZtJhLyON.jpg','2024-12-13',93,'Released','Competition is always a killer.','Old Guy',1077782,6.6852,5.6,'vAGp4TkTbAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34787,_binary '\0','/iWyBVGno1Rx7xpESfLn9Bt4W0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26442871',5.8,1765,'en','Wildcat','Can scandalous art still serve God? Does suffering precede all greatness? Can illness be a blessing? In 1950, writer Flannery O\'Connor visits her mother Regina in Georgia when she is diagnosed with lupus at twenty-four years old. Struggling with the same disease that took her father’s life when she was a child and desperate to make her mark as a great writer, this crisis pitches her imagination into a feverish exploration of belief.','/ig3XxhP2coWNZDnHLqyV3DxXWkR.jpg','2024-05-03',108,'Released',NULL,'Wildcat',1076101,3.3105,5.7,'FvYkEpDlqlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34788,_binary '\0','/nVP2UAvA9pH7h3pkkKryyMc3cGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26443107',5.7,3081,'en','The Adults','Eric returns home for a short visit and finds himself caught between reuniting with his sisters and chasing a victory with his old poker group. As the trip extends, Eric finds it increasingly difficult to avoid confrontations and revelations as his carefully constructed façade of his adulthood gives way to old childhood conflicts.','/i4vkr30zcBnVH2XCXUxyuFTX5JR.jpg','2023-08-18',91,'Released','Some adults need to grow up.','The Adults',1077661,3.1651,6.2,'NPMrL6XTBl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34789,_binary '\0','/lgotja3xMoJZbynwHfcQcJAEMWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26443597',7.3,154797,'en','Zootopia 2','After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia\'s history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De\'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.','/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg','2025-11-26',108,'Released','They\'re back with a twissst.','Zootopia 2',1084242,74.759,7.672,'5AwtptT8X8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34790,_binary '\0','/u53UYu5XG2hNgWGvs3xGhAVzypl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26443616',7.2,85302,'en','Hoppers','Scientists have discovered how to \'hop\' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.','/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg','2026-03-04',104,'Released','Act natural.','Hoppers',1327819,49.4406,8.148,'PypDSyIRRSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34791,_binary '\0','/xXrcPNEKf9FXb74NoNddiCkvIj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26445355',8,4636,'ta','வடக்குப்பட்டி ராமசாமி','Ramasamy profits from the superstitions of people in his village by exploiting their beliefs in regards to the village temple. However, his life takes an unexpected turn when the temple, his primary source of income, is temporarily closed.','/9gX8pe70Yb4j6QMHvz7KdjTv5zP.jpg','2024-02-02',144,'Released',NULL,'Vadakkupatti Ramasamy',1115680,1.0092,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34792,_binary '\0','/zNvSWIvca6aA0eq63JqzVvagqLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26445387',5.9,1483,'ml','I, നോബഡി','Rajeevan, an ordinary government employee, witnesses something he was never meant to see and is thrust into the centre of a serious crime. Branded a troublemaker and hunted by the system, he must protect his family while fighting to survive against forces far beyond his control.','/qFJl3w9KpVXpfZ3rpmv7p0UYZkP.jpg','2026-07-09',169,'Released',NULL,'I, Nobody',1339676,3.3885,5.5,'NA_7tmxv4_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34793,_binary '\0','/wmH8saYc8hLyObxjRx0fZR98Ire.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26445483',5.5,26056,'hi','फुकरे 3','In the third installment, the Fukras plan to take over Delhi, and run for city elections. However, they have no money and so they take on an international job to make a quick buck, which changes their lives forever. In the first two films, we saw them using dreams, then premonitions to make money but now they’ve been gifted with a new & unique talent which is going to make them millionaires.','/1E5qIvLBNrv4onx5SxnNz5Monac.jpg','2023-09-28',147,'Released','Ek naya chumatkar from Jamnapaar','Fukrey 3',805785,1.2062,5.6,'HeDdkMIyhoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34794,_binary '\0','/AVH6dYTp9wAD0KKC4uGgaGfNdo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26445683',6,2903,'ml','നടന്ന സംഭവം','A group of family and friends in a residential association experience a major shift upon the arrival of a peculiar new tenant.','/uqa0EEbqUCzOa0NkwWOfdIYkj6T.jpg','2024-06-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Nadanna Sambhavam',1077263,0.7886,4.8,'Gz-oL9oc9VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34795,_binary '\0','/bxT8jFcWNuWK5LmVo1oGhAm4dnZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26446278',7.6,50556,'fr','Le Comte de Monte-Cristo','Edmond Dantès becomes the target of a sinister plot and is arrested on his wedding day for a crime he did not commit. After 14 years in the island prison of Château d’If, he manages a daring escape. Now rich beyond his dreams, he assumes the identity of the Count of Monte-Cristo and exacts his revenge on the three men who betrayed him.','/sAT1P3FGhtJ68anUyJScnMu8t1l.jpg','2024-06-28',178,'Released','This is not vengeance, this is justice.','The Count of Monte Cristo',1084736,14.9994,7.9,'8Q6y1waxlTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34796,_binary '\0','/2rYrEe7ByNbM1K6UAegBbOhOiF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26446481',4.8,1689,'en','The Haunting of Julia Fields','A young woman from a small town moves out on her own for the first time only to realize something sinister lurking inside her new home.','/kfCYTf1Vy8YYyr5FhFVg8JExWtb.jpg','2023-01-05',71,'Released','Paranormal Activity meets Hush','The Haunting of Julia Fields',1080282,0.7164,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34797,_binary '\0','/3QnCrD4dOTaBXSgJOMc8Gefg3KD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2644714',4.5,3322,'zh','不二神探','When a series of eerie murders erupts across Hong Kong, grizzled veteran Huang and his reckless younger partner Wang, are assigned to track down the killer.','/z0hHegblrOHWpEGv0lhh1k9Ux9g.jpg','2013-06-18',98,'Released','Two Cops. One Killer. No Limits.','Badges of Fury',202220,3.84,5.399,'9NF7czH1m_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34798,_binary '\0','/iL4cVqkzt28ltvvSGgZodQjB3D3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26448005',6.9,1777,'te','Rebels of Thupakula Gudem',NULL,'/49GOfc2EDAS9Yx53wPYHIBt8U6v.jpg','2023-03-03',143,'Released',NULL,'Rebels of Thupakula Gudem',1080975,0.6327,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34799,_binary '\0','/fEw9lVTbDH92W9JFNx1l6XOw6Go.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26448954',6.8,1540,'fr','Here','In Brussels, a construction worker crosses paths with a bryologist.','/pIDQ7miG72FEVIiRgGPdxCGv3tW.jpg','2024-01-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Here',1058032,1.9249,5.9,'Tp6b9-YuMxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34800,_binary '\0','/9ASc8rgFNQ782CMBKXwynczE9cm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26448972',6.8,1220,'fi','Mummola','It’s Christmas time and the family has gathered. Everything goes on as it did the previous Christmases, with grandpa drinking too much and grandma trying to keep everyone in the mood. After the Christmas holidays, everyone returns to their own homes until it\'s time to gather again, this time for a funeral.','/onGT5eIQB3Y9gmdAE96WFGb9C83.jpg','2023-11-10',114,'Released',NULL,'Family Time',925920,1.8181,6.1,'RizyGnn-_lY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34801,_binary '\0','/ddiw4IcAtPIY7unuCZoDXYJDH2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26450742',4.4,2330,'en','The Engineer','As Israel is rocked by a series of terrorist bombings, a US senator\'s daughter is killed in one bloody explosion. Now, ex-Mossad agent Etan must lead an elite, covert team of agents and mercenaries to find the man responsible—the elusive “Engineer.” Can they find and destroy the madman before more innocent lives are lost?','/ozkZ8TeIRwzNH2zF5LFS39M3v5U.jpg','2023-08-18',93,'Released','The team that took down the mastermind behind the deadliest suicide bombings in history.','The Engineer',1156255,3.9464,5.906,'Wg6uB7ULaB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34802,_binary '\0','/zPfIEKhdjy2t8CSq256DNcWHp6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2645092',6.5,10627,'tr','Hükümet Kadın','Xate is an ordinary woman from Midyat with eight children in tow. The only thing that sets her apart is her husband\'s job as Mayor of Midyat. Until, that is, an extraordinary day changes her life - and the lives of everyone else in Midyat. For the illiterate, uneducated Xate becomes Mayor of Midyat! While she takes on her mayoral duties much as she does those in her house, the infantile rivalry between her children in municipal matters leads to adventures that have the Midyat folk howling with laughter.','/fOjnfISRtU9pJinlJxHX3YrPVQE.jpg','2013-02-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Government Woman',171158,2.0761,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34803,_binary '\0','/6pVNQKZEyQmqywucPZLkwcVPKrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2645104',5.2,3780,'tr','Romantik Komedi 2: Bekarlığa Veda','Didem tries everything to get actor Cem to propose to her, but he\'s got other things on his mind: a beautiful new co-star and a secret bachelor party.','/8BGr8oY94Trwagiddq2FtylYQN9.jpg','2013-02-13',105,'Released',NULL,'A Romantic Comedy 2',171179,1.8649,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34804,_binary '\0','/wWyptiuZkQBtEWjhTBae8STM6EM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26451068',5,3418,'en','Escape','Ten sex trafficked young women are taken from an island resort by a violent criminal gang for shipping to an overseas client. A young nurse and feisty dancer hatch an escape-plan, finding themselves in the desert fighting for survival against ruthless traffickers.','/75YBLsA38KAJfL4D4plgcmquAE1.jpg','2024-03-15',93,'Released','Fight back or die.','Escape',1164892,4.4343,5.6,'s7s2c4UDtQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34805,_binary '\0','/dXXkwPvt2ynYqTAmtwQqK26WXGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26451073',5.7,1551,'es','Escape','A young man becomes convinced that the solution to all his problems is to live in jail, and he will do whatever it takes to get it.','/9yTWVCapYo63Mc93CHxEyIdSEqo.jpg','2024-10-31',126,'Released','What does a law-abiding man have to do to get put in jail?!','Escape',1078744,1.4428,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34806,_binary '\0','/z4bMCwjppKNBmXq3FsMWif9k7te.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2645130',6,2250,'tr','Mutlu Aile Defteri','Children of a retired colonel come together after their father falls from the rooftop. This constrained togetherness reveals their lies day by day.','/91HDig30jW991XqLrGaxgvgsN4R.jpg','2013-03-08',92,'Released',NULL,'Happy Family Journal',173031,0.9983,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34807,_binary '\0','/zEDwCgqnZpwfxByYFhg35R4gKiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2645188',4.6,1892,'en','The Quiet Hour','In a remote part of rural, post-apocalyptic England, now occupied by unseen alien invaders, a feisty teenage girl sets out on a desperate attempt to fight back a group of bandits and defend her parents\' farm, their remaining livestock, and the solar panels that keep them safe from extraterrestrials. If she doesn\'t succeed, she will lose her only source of food and shelter; if she resists, she and her helpless blind sibling will be killed.','/9PCAqaRs6x9kIUhY9PptMhFsWE9.jpg','2016-06-24',85,'Released','Time is running out.','The Quiet Hour',293941,1.263,4.6,'5cYe5ChWzWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34808,_binary '\0','/53Ey8CIdc9jeS7fB4TCyxQTCjm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26452616',6.7,3614,'en','Giant','Follows Prince Naseem Hamed from his humble beginnings on the tough working-class streets of Sheffield and his discovery by Ingle, himself a steel industry worker turned boxing trainer. Their unlikely partnership, Naz’s unorthodox style, cocky persona, and sheer dominance in the ring propelled them to the top of boxing’s elite and unprecedented levels of global superstardom, all in the face of the rampant Islamophobia and racism of ’80s and 90’s Britain.','/RHgGB3VweOIWOvoheOl5OZykQO.jpg','2026-01-09',110,'Released',NULL,'Giant',1078581,5.3533,6.989,'cqg5PtgeNRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34809,_binary '\0','/9qYD7pAOEdYBoQblv5VAMMSVAC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26452781',5.2,4596,'en','Marked Men: Rule + Shaw','Shaw Landon has loved Rule Archer from the moment she laid eyes on him. Rule, a fiery-tempered rebel tattoo artist, doesn’t have time for a good girl pre-med student like Shaw — even if she’s the only one who can see the person he truly is. She lives by other people’s rules; he makes his own. But a short skirt, too many birthday cocktails, and spilled secrets lead to a night neither can forget. Now, Shaw and Rule must figure out how a girl like her and a guy like him are supposed to be together without destroying their love…or each other.','/gZQU8BtCH2IbMZq6QETiU4HXQSR.jpg','2025-01-22',93,'Released','Love always leaves a mark.','Marked Men: Rule + Shaw',1078600,6.6361,6.736,'1OBKb0kX57w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34810,_binary '\0','/3wuN2RnMh6k00VPya7R1806MccR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26453369',7.1,1719,'en','Marc Maron: From Bleak to Dark','Over the course of a hilarious and deeply personal hour, Maron explores such universal topics as getting older, antisemitism and faith, and the superiority of having cats over children – especially during the pandemic.','/dap1rGaaxLUW1K2kDKgkO7qu2nb.jpg','2023-02-11',65,'Released',NULL,'Marc Maron: From Bleak to Dark',1078615,1.3307,6.1,'zwYjFmP0boY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34811,_binary '\0','/bFGTEi5xBYLQtFiXKnYcAR88vbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26453759',3.7,1441,'en','Don\'t Look Away','After a gang of criminals unintentionally unleashes a supernatural force onto the world, a young woman named Frankie is convinced she\'s being stalked by a killer mannequin. Frankie soon realizes that her friends are in jeopardy too. She must find the man who holds the key to stopping the killings, but Frankie knows that once you see the mannequin, there may be no end in sight, except for your own.','/iiYx85daT0DzoU4XQGgaynvDtn8.jpg','2023-09-01',83,'Released','It doesn\'t breathe. It doesn\'t move. It just kills.','Don\'t Look Away',1102425,1.9644,4.5,'QjossJS4CTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34812,_binary '\0','/of1lXyqqqN6iPNI4vvaQF83qxBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2645670',3.5,1558,'en','Independence Daysaster','When Earth is attacked by a hostile alien force, a small town firefighter and a rogue SETI scientist team up to activate the only technology capable of defeating the invaders.','/6jor0EqECPgHqu89GrQIy9Wetkf.jpg','2013-06-27',86,'Released','The battle for Earth begins','Independence Daysaster',205126,2.1195,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34813,_binary '\0','/zGsHpuMN412VyzJZZnQeq4lMdjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26458038',8.2,35088,'ml','മഞ്ഞുമ്മല്‍ BOYS','A carefree vacation turns into a desperate race against time when a group of lifelong friends must unite to save one of their own from a notoriously perilous, uncharted abyss deep within the Guna Caves.','/bswrtewwthpsh6nABiqKevU4UBI.jpg','2024-02-22',135,'Released',NULL,'Manjummel Boys',1069945,2.6175,7.876,'9uzfrur9SDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34814,_binary '\0','/ngvYhqkJDAp46nAHVeAz0uzhtOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2646378',4.3,3584,'en','The Frankenstein Theory','When he is suspended from his university job for his outlandish ideas, Professor John Venkenheim leads a documentary film crew to the rim of the Arctic Circle in a desperate effort to vindicate his academic reputation. His theory: Mary Shelley\'s ghastly story, \"Frankenstein,\" is, in fact, a work of non-fiction disguised as fantasy. In the vast, frozen wilderness, Venkenheim and his team search for the legendary monster, a creature mired in mystery and drenched in blood. What they find is an unspeakable truth more terrifying than any fiction...a nightmare from which there is no waking.','/kC8J8grw6G9EZfXun041hrVTKH5.jpg','2013-03-01',87,'Released',NULL,'The Frankenstein Theory',169865,1.0196,4.4,'KK5WSD2PVHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34815,_binary '\0','/6GhU4BJnqLSaAuz0yQBq3RfdzsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26470109',6.7,62972,'en','Oddity','After the brutal murder of her twin sister, Darcy goes after those responsible by using haunted items as her tools for revenge.','/3Z9c1tbUhP0QruRjczPHnbx3U2D.jpg','2024-07-19',98,'Released','Every murder lives on.','Oddity',1216191,7.3549,6.687,'ktIqbb0TS7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34816,_binary '\0','/e9FagFmnHwREdVJpSky4te4Lru8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2647078',6.1,2469,'en','Leaving D.C.','After 20 years of living in Washington, D.C., Mark Klein seeks much-needed solace by moving to the remote wilds of West Virginia. To ease his loneliness, he sends regular video updates to members of his OCD-support group back in the city. But Mark gradually realizes that despite his new, isolated setting, he may not be alone. From the endless woods surrounding his home, something else is watching.','/vjd0xsCiNGaGB7JGIs3lVeuNSNe.jpg','2013-02-22',77,'Released',NULL,'Leaving D.C.',413469,0.8621,5.5,'YeFMLeH9ZAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34817,_binary '\0','/gCwqAuSehwSaGnuqkvFKu9PuyRa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26472958',6.7,1675,'ca','Molt lluny','Sergio, who has traveled to Utrecht with his family to attend a soccer match, suffers a panic attack just before taking the flight back to Barcelona.','/9hca7cAwBjw4ZlnQr6JqaC7f8e6.jpg','2025-04-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Away',1409925,1.3252,6.703,'eMw6_lQbIDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34818,_binary '\0','/hZqRxcFLeVfahDZcqCKOLftTxwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26474783',6,3723,'en','Dead Mail','An ominous help note finds its way to a 1980s post office, connecting a dead letter investigator to a kidnapped keyboard technician.','/mZultpdnzuCDAouwDs5ZYdkGGgT.jpg','2024-03-09',102,'Released',NULL,'Dead Mail',1229915,1.396,5.492,'KI3VcLtfusc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34819,_binary '\0','/t1kwxAXFwuDPTQdhFFyqks5j1b2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2648034',7.5,2990,'ml','അന്നയും റസൂലും','A taxi driver, Rasool and a salesgirl, Anna fall in love with each other. But soon their union is put to question when Anna persuades Rasool to convert to Christianity.','/cLsxjLL5TurnjMFTvuuKw469wRA.jpg','2013-01-04',167,'Released',NULL,'Annayum Rasoolum',155518,1.515,7.548,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34820,_binary '\0','/9KbFJLSX6KWSFLcgHCEoim6wRqX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26489351',7,2011,'te','Jagamerigina Satyam','In 1994, in the picturesque village of Dimda on the Telangana border, this is the gripping story of Satyam-a kind-hearted farmer\'s son. His love for Saritha, the village sarpanch\'s niece, sparks jealousy and rage, leading to betrayal.','/vkiq4ZonUTNq5LRxFZVPNLQm1Pe.jpg','2025-04-18',141,'Released',NULL,'Jagamerigina Satyam',1508081,2.1542,0,'sJ-pAJxarnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34821,_binary '\0','/q2B3bjLYcxGG11ThDr8gyzCIGAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2649128',6.4,8605,'ru','Метро','Terror strikes the underground train system in Moscow in the form of a flood from a collapsed tunnel. The film follows a diverse group of Moscow citizens who find themselves trapped in the city’s underground rail network, their train derailed and virtually crushed after an aging tunnel collapses. Amongst this band of survivors is softly spoken surgeon Andrey (Sergei Puskepalis), whose wife is having an affair with the conceited businessman Vlad (Anatoly Beliy). Fate brings these two men together on the same doomed train, but there is little time to resolve their differences, as the tunnel begins to quickly fill with water, forcing them to work together with the others and find a way back to the surface.','/b66g0ad7zYYpp1TVCbacsa5W9Id.jpg','2013-02-21',130,'Released',NULL,'Metro',174733,2.455,6.7,'m2v8R1X2sPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34822,_binary '\0','/7BGntp5Z62Ip99yqglS5WOxTfw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2649152',4.7,3606,'ru','Что творят мужчины!','Unapproachable women, half a million dollars and four guys are to take part in a very funny game “Sexlotto” which is organized by an extravagant millionaire. The essence of the game is to seduce as many women as possible in the seaside resort within five days. Having received the task, the magnificent four rush into the battle.','/zWLrXD0AbSLZdfcSzv0EAvJQfIW.jpg','2013-02-27',87,'Released',NULL,'What Men Do!',179690,1.129,3.1,'5gG05KVDm34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34823,_binary '\0','/8OquscTbTxII7j4aFOMkriEf8vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26491631',3.1,1704,'en','The Devil\'s Left Hand','A Demonic entity breaches a Medium at a young couple\'s housewarming party, wreaking havoc and terrifying the attendees. After the party, the entity begins stalking the guests. They attempt to fight back, but don\'t know who they can trust as the Demon can shape-shift and appear to be anyone. The stakes grow higher when the Demon begins killing them, one by one.','/b9eqnotTZSVc4a4KzpISHfSMUKC.jpg','2023-07-01',98,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Left Hand',1157981,1.137,3.4,'XfuG2VoE7M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34824,_binary '\0','/BqPHa5sz4wTzzRZkyLqXFi0E1x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26493971',5,2608,'ta','அரண்மனை 4','After his sister\'s suspicious death, a man decides to discover the hidden truth, setting off a chasm for chaos and terror.','/k4d4RmvBVtSF8SGgTGAqPZlsOg1.jpg','2024-04-11',148,'Released',NULL,'Aranmanai 4',1140905,1.7952,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34825,_binary '\0','/23COMNwqP8q4rWPtLGTBuCD3LnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2649554',6.6,87137,'en','Midnight Special','A father and son go on the run after the dad learns his child possesses special powers.','/hgDRq1l4ATxwufWjILKsYtglbI6.jpg','2016-02-18',112,'Released','He\'s not like us.','Midnight Special',245703,6.4832,6.3,'8UU_CC81aGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34826,_binary '\0','/zN1WZjLtP45C10IyMcXsDCUceIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2650642',6.6,3472,'pl','W imię...','The contemporary story of a priest who launches a centre for troubled youth in a small parish. He is a good priest and is well-liked by his congregation, which remains unaware of his complicated past.','/2tk89gkhWlntQMnBt125uRXwSSD.jpg','2013-09-06',102,'Released',NULL,'In the Name of...',160165,2.446,6.9,'Dti3xTI3L0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34827,_binary '\0','/1ydyBeyf3qI9zn6OWsIBAkufiEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2650718',7.1,2022,'en','Matterhorn','A lonely widower finds himself facing both his devout Calvinist village community and his own deepest regrets when he takes a deranged vagrant into his home.','/hCZrQoZIHBlTV4luqWwvJRSp8d9.jpg','2013-01-24',87,'Released',NULL,'Matterhorn',159514,1.0632,6.1,'UbEqW7t-D7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34828,_binary '\0','/3GExA1eGVd8lvZYOpkJCmgVrN5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26507543',6.8,1769,'id','Air Mata di Ujung Sajadah','In this heartfelt drama, a mother discovers that a son she thought died at birth is still alive.','/dKEOoh66hKXPUirgL5FGmAIpxiY.jpg','2023-09-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Tears at the Edge of a Prayer Rug',1082381,1.0932,6.1,'kxv7xyQ5bbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34829,_binary '\0','/fXHT6tTLVCchwrsFkpTyqtUcsCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2650978',7.1,15388,'de','Das finstere Tal','The Alps, late 19th century. Greider, a mysterious lone rider who claims to be a photographer, arrives at an isolated lumber village, despotically ruled by a family clan, asking for winter accommodation.','/8s59L4YCmDNyQAkSrlkvc3Vc3fp.jpg','2014-02-13',115,'Released',NULL,'The Dark Valley',248933,3.2265,7.027,'VsLnBQ4IyCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34830,_binary '\0','/xBrgF29v1pYLEtN2b8NYxVmwuCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2650986',6.8,4522,'da','Nordvest','Nordvest is a gangsterfilm set in the suburbs of Copenhagen. Casper (18), the oldest of 3 siblings, survives life on the streets by committing burglaries for the neighbourhood boss, Jamal. When Casper gets an offer to work for Jamal’s rival Björn, he jumps at the chance for a better life, making his way into a world of drugs and prostitution. As things escalate between Björn and Jamal, Casper finds himself and his family dead center of a conflict, that threatens to destroy them.','/4wYYMhv5S0yegXPXg8QttaElAQu.jpg','2013-04-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Northwest',161491,1.4392,6.39,'jqgyztUTZlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34831,_binary '\0','/dcyPj11c00lOhMESAVWtJKzlHt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2652092',7.4,36091,'en','The Good Lie','A young refugee of the Sudanese Civil War who wins a lottery for relocation to the United States with three other lost boys. Encountering the modern world for the first time, they develop an unlikely friendship with a brash American woman assigned to help them, but the young man struggles to adjust to this new life and his feelings of guilt about the brother he left behind.','/yAhoeIwwtPxJ7uf9HLIMHIqWFnL.jpg','2014-09-10',110,'Released','Miracles are made by people who refuse to stop believing.','The Good Lie',250538,6.8102,7.5,'XvvaesOIIVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34832,_binary '\0','/rT54o3GyVFvk5EQMXSLoSTnUo6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2652118',6.1,22045,'en','Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon: Sword of Destiny','A story of lost love, young love, a legendary sword and one last opportunity at redemption.','/te3aeAyhkfqgpa5BSTq3oNxGqQD.jpg','2016-02-18',100,'Released','The past returns with a vengeance.','Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon: Sword of Destiny',263341,6.5037,6.161,'P7ohxUUd5XQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34833,_binary '\0','/o0SBSckdRTD0gDnLEE5r4aYrStF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2652948',5.2,1604,'en','Hostage to the Devil','This documentary examines age-old questions about the existence of the Devil and good versus evil, through the life of controversial priest, Father Malachi Martin. It explores Martin\'s horrifying final case before his mysterious death.','/k7M6M813nZCuqMOiEoBOOtcKeej.jpg','2016-10-31',90,'Released','The true story of America\'s most notorious exorcist.','Hostage t