all it took.','A Picture of Her',1081439,2.8464,7,'spsH1LJnWlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34853,_binary '\0','/uWESOFs4paFT6sVnB9axGz9ILsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26594061',7,1217,'en','Joan Baez: I Am a Noise','Since her debut at the age of 18, musician, civil rights campaigner and activist Joan Baez has been on stage for over 60 years. For the now 82-year-old, the personal has always been political, and her friendship with Martin Luther King and her pacifism have shaped her commitment. In this biography that opens with her farewell tour, Baez takes stock in an unsparing fashion and confronts sometimes painful memories.','/9falaEXKXkanzldpAwTSEiOSbhy.jpg','2023-10-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Joan Baez: I Am a Noise',1075815,2.4233,6.8,'dhcV1gEat_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34854,_binary '\0','/6MZdEVe0COl9sB1sCIPOOFpngjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2659414',8.1,26477,'ko','7번방의 선물','A story about a mentally ill man wrongfully imprisoned for murder and his relationship with his 6 year old daughter.','/wHh4Or1RVzgX2GSYYfEN5HcO6xQ.jpg','2013-01-23',128,'Released','If caught, they\'re all doomed!','Miracle in Cell No. 7',158445,4.7723,7.9,'h9MGZFy-gog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34855,_binary '\0','/eVPMCjjZ3kDRIYrTooNKwjZnUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26594993',5.1,2720,'en','A Semente do Mal','When Edward’s search for his biological family leads him and his girlfriend Ryley to a magnificent villa high in the mountains of Northern Portugal, he is full of excitement at meeting his long-lost mother and twin brother. Finally, he will discover who he is and where he comes from. But nothing is as it seems, and Edward will soon learn that he is linked to them by a monstrous secret.','/ri9cazZeb7QKlmJpLZ7PpJelHb.jpg','2024-01-18',91,'Released','A mother\'s love never dies.','Amelia’s Children',1082063,3.0085,6,'IF6eUddnYtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000')