 on the chilling true story.','The Order',1082195,10.5357,6.6,'pPZaOB4ea-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34864,_binary '\0','/6GWkFSudUjR9GOod23IvJzaLK2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26626085',5.4,1607,'en','City Rush 4','Surging crime, a virus and android assassins led by a mysterious gangster boss force special agents Ace and Nea into action.','/wvEZYAhEmzHiqDUQzmIR54q0iMd.jpg','2024-12-06',45,'Released',NULL,'City Rush 4',1428293,1.1174,7.5,'UQEvre9-93M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34865,_binary '\0','/4IGsGmPZ0mRVxCDZLRUUDWMYcYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26626445',6,1653,'ml','അഡിയോസ് അമിഗോ','A man with financial troubles finds himself on a boozy road trip with a wealthy stranger.','/3h3aOAEcU8oxTTnWUoEBxec0oYR.jpg','2024-08-09',156,'Released',NULL,'Adios Amigo',1082411,0.8833,5.5,'oi-ABOheUpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34866,_binary '\0','/erD10BYPVLYtJ4QnNlGk932RgpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26629652',7.5,5250,'no','Elskling','Maria finds herself at a crossroads when her husband suddenly announces that he wants to end their relationship. She must either let her whole world come crashing down, or come to terms with the life she has and find a way forward.','/3g1ikwXdRC3PoVHSoH8JM97G0jx.jpg','2024-09-19',101,'Released',NULL,'Loveable',1082900,4.0347,7.043,'lbVugYlyAoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34867,_binary '\0','/9GoB8QJsKaP8RLJ9NPuDziQ1IVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26637593',6.2,2797,'te','దేవకీ నందన వాసుదేవ','Haunted by an astrological prophecy, Kamsaraja relentlessly torments his sister\'s family, believing her child will be his doom. Even in imprisonment, Krishna protects the family from Kamsaraja\'s evil plans.','/2mXXuHkXfZrMjdCzbo2fo8E3bkn.jpg','2024-11-22',112,'Released',NULL,'Devaki Nandana Vasudeva',1390695,0.7475,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34868,_binary '\0','/7MOM46t74L9oR9CiUp501R9u1c0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2663812',8.2,7914,'en','An Adventure in Space and Time','Actor William Hartnell felt trapped by a succession of hard-man roles while wannabe producer Verity Lambert was frustrated by the TV industry\'s glass ceiling. Both of them were to find unlikely hope and unexpected challenges in the form of a Saturday tea-time drama. Allied with a team of unusual but brilliant people, they went on to create the longest running science fiction series ever made.','/lRrmdPMvCPGcLF6FrvS66STXAyU.jpg','2013-11-21',83,'Released','The Story Begins Here...','An Adventure in Space and Time',210024,2.5267,7.7,'dEwikIhEZrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34869,_binary '\0','/dSUNxNdmp8uO2DLMRE6PfpLiLwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2664880',5,3385,'no','Villmark 2','An old sanatorium is deteriorating in an isolated forest in the mountains. Five contract workers have taken on the task of tracking the huge building for hazardous waste before it\'s demolished. They realize that the job is more than a search for asbestos and mercury when they encounter the building\'s frightening past. You can demolish a building, but never remove the past.','/tlFDrOk3Zpo9rDVhrBBbnfuFAJ4.jpg','2015-10-09',93,'Released','They can demolish a building, but never remove the past.','Dark Woods II',336884,2.3589,4.7,'YeooSEbDB5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34870,_binary '\0','/gcsMBralErimrFu7gZLEpgIrZi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2665200',6.3,2713,'en','Fir Crazy','When marketing executive Elise MacKenzie decides to help sell Christmas trees at her family’s Christmas tree lot, she discovers a newfound fondness for the holidays. But all could be lost when the store owner who hosts the tree lot on his block wants to shut it down, and it’s up to Elise to find a way to rekindle his Christmas Cheer.','/dzZQ3z0cjvyfLJi9Y9RESJs8l1F.jpg','2013-12-12',87,'Released','This Christmas, love is just around the corner.','Fir Crazy',213901,2.3818,5.9,'uQoIHXdW7SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34871,_binary '\0','/1EECShloaXfQpXLphUzpDKxSTeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26655108',5.4,6299,'te','ద ఫ్యామిలీ స్తార్','Govardhan, a devoted architect from Hyderabad, juggles supporting his extended family while seeking a partner who understands his commitments. When he discovers Indu thesis on his family, he challenges her, leading to unexpected twists as they navigate misunderstandings and eventually find love amidst sacrifice and understanding','/2mLyHeWwU0Ocv9Jvk72IDqZqT7G.jpg','2024-04-04',155,'Released',NULL,'The Family Star',1141320,1.8948,4.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34872,_binary '\0','/fP6hZm95w8AK6l8CRAAhLGkh5WV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26655359',5.6,5906,'ml','മലയാളി ഫ്രം ഇന്ത്യ','Aalparambil Gopi, an unemployed boy, is forced to travel away from home. Fortunately, the journey ends up transforming his life forever.','/mOqYSsuaDi9D6dh0GRF8gj2ilJQ.jpg','2024-05-01',158,'Released',NULL,'Malayalee from India',1101175,1.133,4.607,'U8AEj9DN1wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34873,_binary '\0','/r6sKI2rJt7mXbETyRIb0z47AZtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26655658',6.1,10928,'hi','कौशलजी वर्सेस कौशल','Yug Kaushal, a 27-year-old, leaves behind his small-town roots in Kannauj and moves to Delhi. Always cribbing about his parent not adapting to the modern lifestyle and more urban way of living their life, Yug gets the shock of his life when the senior Kaushals consider mutual separation as the situation spirals into chaos.','/ulr4CICHijcXZaeS4M7KupyCu0x.jpg','2025-02-21',132,'Released',NULL,'Kaushaljis vs Kaushal',1436133,1.0832,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34874,_binary '\0','/i068XM0ozhRGUw4mCZRezvzKbK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26656821',6.4,1284,'fr','Boléro','Boundary-pushing Russian dancer and actress Ida Rubinstein selects renowned French composer Maurice Ravel to compose the music for her next ballet. Ravel ends up creating his greatest success ever: Boléro.','/8H8kS9Q7unESbSrwCdTDgXVWRq7.jpg','2024-03-06',120,'Released','The Ravel Mystery','Boléro',1004348,2.6754,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34875,_binary '\0','/dqmMWNWfLnExDRpMtIMqI97GQFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26657236',6.8,198389,'en','Backrooms','A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.','/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg','2026-05-27',111,'Released','See how far it goes.','Backrooms',1083381,102.3316,7,'0HjdiohVOik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34876,_binary '\0','/7MEi8dOoQKz6no668dZDQgotOPD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26657977',5.5,3435,'en','Adulthood','The lives of two siblings are completely upended when they discover a dead body, long buried in their parent’s basement, sending them down a rabbit hole of crime and murder.','/a40Gi0Zq4Ecqu3obmOp6TSgEne1.jpg','2025-09-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Adulthood',1083420,2.309,6,'rutRDICG2oE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34877,_binary '\0','/TGsfNWkASegCfAn6ED1b08a9O6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26658104',4.8,20671,'en','Imaginary','When Jessica moves back into her childhood home with her family, her youngest stepdaughter Alice develops an eerie attachment to a stuffed bear named Chauncey she finds in the basement. Alice starts playing games with Chauncey that begin playful and become increasingly sinister. As Alice’s behavior becomes more and more concerning, Jessica intervenes only to realize Chauncey is much more than the stuffed toy bear she believed him to be.','/bPCxkrCEGJmaYfvdXj0x3mCLbGr.jpg','2024-03-06',104,'Released','Meet Chauncey. He\'s not imaginary. And he\'s not your friend.','Imaginary',1125311,8.1936,5.874,'Lj0HODMVSnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34878,_binary '\0','/qh7PWKRfy2K8rZZP7LzembGgWIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26658272',7.8,17966,'hi','अमर सिंह चमकीला','A humble singer\'s brash lyrics ignite fame and fury across Punjab as he grapples with soaring success and brutal criticism before his untimely death.','/t9wSGgaPfbGUBBlne7xw8GaArvu.jpg','2024-04-12',146,'Released','Tadkila. Bhadkila. Rangeela. Woh hai...','Amar Singh Chamkila',1086729,1.4678,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34879,_binary '\0','/fCStoeG7JXhjwk2ypA1gdrqEljK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26659737',7.5,2815,'te','Cheddi Gang Tamasha','Johnny, Siddhanti, Raddu, Lantar, and Goni are friends in spoken English class in Hyderabad city. All those who are in financial trouble find stealing an easy way out and decide to become thieves. This gang, which started going to steal without anyone recognizing them and wearing Cheddar\'s, has not been successful in committing thefts. Due to the strange incidents that occur everywhere they go, Situations gets away without committing any thefts. The main purpose of this Cheddi Gang Tamasha is to make every scene entertaining and to tell what kind of strange and strange experiences they will face wherever they go.','/fr8wxAuggRoCh13ZZfUtfMjbzh3.jpg','2023-02-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Cheddi Gang Tamasha',1458606,0.4204,0,'2zTqkA57bmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34880,_binary '\0','/aMnRuVks72sikr3bQ8ywoBHcpEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26659814',6.2,41301,'hi','औरों में कहां दम था','After 20 years in prison, a man reunites with his lost love and the truth behind his crimes is revealed.','/cKvom4C6fGIM1sOKINkBi7oCqok.jpg','2024-08-02',145,'Released','Epic. Intense. Unforgettable.','Auron Mein Kahan Dum Tha',1083590,1.7546,5.3,'2lr5h0IqArI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34881,_binary '\0','/oFh4iJa9DA9cEfhOD0rV55LwI7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26659974',6.2,1253,'ta','தண்டகாரண்யம்','After losing his forest ranger position, a Tamil villager pursues his dream of joining the Indian Army, only to face harsh realities that challenge his idealistic 