task of remounting her former mentor’s most famous work, the opera Salome. Haunted by dark and disturbing memories from her past, she allows her repressed trauma to color the present as she re-enters the opera world after so many years away.','/eX6WC02RFdm2Om6iPzV5YV3wFAv.jpg','2025-03-07',107,'Released',NULL,'Seven Veils',1083782,4.0608,5.5,'KBZpKmRsmFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34886,_binary '\0','/r4X2xRrWleVgx0kahP27xRmm3ia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26671996',5.7,27192,'en','Locked','When Eddie breaks into a luxury SUV, he steps into a deadly trap set by William, a self-proclaimed vigilante delivering his own brand of twisted justice. With no means of escape, Eddie must fight to survive in a ride where escape is an illusion, survival is a nightmare, and justice shifts into high gear.','/hhkiqXpfpufwxVrdSftzeKIANl3.jpg','2025-03-20',95,'Released','No escape. No mercy. Just survival.','Locked',1083968,9.0863,6.209,'KojA43FmHqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34887,_binary '\0','/vWVmlnQnTjqB2MpGD9CtRitep0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26672512',6.7,5049,'ko','로기완','After defecting from North Korea, Loh Kiwan struggles to obtain refugee status in Belgium, where he encounters a dejected woman who has lost all hope.','/x4BkphLO6abbGhceYEMhJERkvHo.jpg','2024-02-19',134,'Released','I have decided to survive in this land.','My Name Is Loh Kiwan',1039882,3.7724,7.248,'oxsR6jEoeBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34888,_binary '\0','/fP3VylFikGWYU0aWNkOxpi40r24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26673530',4.9,1809,'ro','Haita de acțiune','A police satire about Aurel, a gipsy police officer, on his first day of work. He really wants to prove what he is capable of, but his career is at risk when his friend, Denzel, recruits him in his not so secret operation.','/rDipe00vmNe0i2zifEh7RCAdJXK.jpg','2023-03-21',99,'Released',NULL,'The Action Pack',1084008,1.2258,6.4,'ikU_RnJlo8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34889,_binary '\0','/bJzWrOYHu1kF4eUiEa1DX4OrQvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2667380',5.7,16343,'en','Kill Command','Set in a near future, technology-reliant society that pits man against killing machines. Against this backdrop an elite army unit is helicoptered to a remote, off-the-grid island training facility. What starts out as a simple training exercise for Captain Bukes and his tight-knit unit, descends into a terrifying battle to the death, as the marines discover the island is overrun by an enemy that transcends the human concept of evil.','/4RRnDZppHjQEuKOu4M7IUPqBbDJ.jpg','2016-05-13',99,'Released','You can\'t fight the future.','Kill Command',384798,5.138,5.7,'4TlxF6S4uoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34890,_binary '\0','/7drO1kYgQ0PnnU87sAnBEphYrSM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26674627',5.7,12000,'ja','バイオハザード：デスアイランド','In San Francisco, Jill Valentine is dealing with a zombie outbreak and a new T-Virus, Leon Kennedy is on the trail of a kidnapped DARPA scientist, and Claire Redfield is investigating a monstrous fish that is killing whales in the bay. Joined by Chris Redfield and Rebecca Chambers, they discover the trail of clues from their separate cases all converge on the same location, Alcatraz Island, where a new evil has taken residence and awaits their arrival.','/qayga07ICNDswm0cMJ8P3VwklFZ.jpg','2023-06-22',91,'Released','Destinies intertwined. A world gone mad.','Resident Evil: Death Island',1083862,15.8486,7.262,'L-vkuA8oqMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34891,_binary '\0','/3nB9fYQycK4iWchvfbXhacD42XC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26674818',7.4,3372,'en','Tatami','Iranian female judokas Leila and her coach Maryam, travel to the Judo World Championship, intent on bringing home Iran’s first gold medal. Midway through the Judo World Championships, they receive an ultimatum from the Islamic Republic ordering Leila to fake an injury and lose, or she will be branded a traitor of the state. With her own and her family’s freedom at stake, Leila is faced with an impossible choice: comply with the Iranian regime as her coach Maryam implores her to do, or fight on, for the gold.','/A9SUL6wPDGfjX6cCBal0SmUcT47.jpg','2024-03-08',104,'Released','Gripping, in all senses of the term.','Tatami',1084066,2.992,7.741,'iXLa1gh6LWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34892,_binary '\0','/b5zs7mQ8d8aQZKyBCv8xTcj4joi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26675252',8.6,2124,'en','Louis Tomlinson: All of Those Voices','Ditching the typical glossy sheen of celebrity documentaries, this film gives audiences an intimate and unvarnished view of Louis Tomlinson\'s life and career. Through never-before-seen home movie footage and behind the scenes access to Louis’ sell-out 2022 World Tour, the documentary offers a unique perspective on what it\'s like to be a musician in today\'s fast-paced world.','/ctYglXhhUh0Nhd99GRbeKZlakGJ.jpg','2023-03-22',108,'Released',NULL,'Louis Tomlinson: All of Those Voices',1084072,1.9473,8.9,'K0UZuiqToow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34893,_binary '\0','/oMa31OjTXCqZoee4YhYv8enFFMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26675379',7.4,2950,'pt','Vitória','Nina is an elderly woman who lives alone and feels distressed by the increasing violence in her neighborhood. Amidst conflicts with her neighbors, she decides to film the movement of drug traffickers from her window, hoping to assist the police. After months of recording suspicious activities, her initiative attracts the attention of a journalist, who approaches Nina and offers to support her in her mission.','/pT1j9Y9bpyYKE3wFpARyNK4NdBe.jpg','2025-03-13',112,'Released','Based on a true story.','Vitória',1043808,3.549,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34894,_binary '\0','/cDau8XMNbURuVPOhqJo9AK1kUQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26675491',6,11080,'te','BRO','After being fatally injured in a car crash, a man is given three months back on earth to make amends.','/cCirdTe57qpOvb1NFKECbQRMmfQ.jpg','2023-07-27',133,'Released',NULL,'BRO',1090486,1.5626,5.895,'4UP0lI1awvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34895,_binary '\0','/qcbm9rcIIH1PvETjmermWIqvFoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2667550',7,5430,'tr','Çanakkale: Yolun Sonu','Corporal Muhsin is a sharp shooter who previously fought in the Balkan War. When mobilization is declared again, he joins the war alongside his brother Hasan. The two brothers support each other in the fight against the enemy.','/s1sFBRA5FlvevTqezTRv3ygCAje.jpg','2013-03-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Gallipoli: End of the Road',187962,1.2257,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34896,_binary '\0','/9o7H2h2tvYPNyD3Ni2PiwPTz0WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26676104',6.5,3796,'sv','Hammarskjöld','Set in Cold War in 1961, follows the story of diplomat and economist Dag Hammarskjöld, who boards a plane in a desperate attempt to negotiate a ceasefire from his enemies after he leads UN troops into their first wartime operation.','/948vMAdG66PHRs4PoclPDkixWsa.jpg','2023-12-25',114,'Released','The Swede who challenged world politics.','Hammarskjöld: Fight for Peace',1084145,4.102,6.3,'kW4A80058uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34897,_binary '\0','/bNTUgxHYaDmLo1SfRtahcM16XMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26677014',7.1,12436,'en','The Penguin Lessons','In 1976, as Argentina descends into violence and chaos, a world-weary English teacher regains his compassion for others thanks to an unlikely friendship with a penguin.','/pJUfkCcU5mCEMF8O0LKvlMnYAfD.jpg','2025-03-27',111,'Released',NULL,'The Penguin Lessons',1086497,4.2888,7.1,'0A_C3MT3uyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34898,_binary '\0','/z3bzhmC0CPikWeerUkLO73YvGrC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26678938',5.8,15993,'en','Pretty Lethal','A troupe of ballerinas find themselves fighting for survival as 