L,'Ravikula Raghurama',1393508,0.5283,0,'eFUqT6oZKG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34930,_binary '\0','/yLmDe5PZ02gxFFwXRzeMxO4nA65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26733635',6.4,1421,'ml','സുലൈഖ മന്‍സില്‍','Ameen and Haala’s marriage is arranged in a hurry. As Ameen tries to know Haala better before the wedding, she does not consider it important and this leads to a misunderstanding between the couple','/vk0TctYXqWMNzHSXWgljYK9nUVb.jpg','2023-04-21',120,'Released',NULL,'Sulaikha Manzil',1015676,1.5116,4.667,'Bz9-CfQZk3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34931,_binary '\0','/qE0FswzjACs2kvAycYVS2zcmgec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26735622',4.7,15667,'en','Balls Up','Two marketing executives go \"balls out\" and pitch a bold full‑coverage condom sponsorship with the World Cup. After their drunken celebration in Brazil sparks a global scandal, they must outrun furious fans, criminals, and power-hungry officials to salvage their careers and make it home alive.','/xwvJ3WzdJ1OCuDoY8LAxBUlQyig.jpg','2026-04-15',104,'Released','Their survival takes a big pair.','Balls Up',1084577,18.4544,5.858,'zgzxY4RtxBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34932,_binary '\0','/whnFKx0Y54Ktg6o2TiwbnQfXdZf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26736843',5.7,73417,'en','The Watchers','A young artist gets stranded in an extensive, immaculate forest in western Ireland, where, after finding shelter, she becomes trapped alongside three strangers, stalked by mysterious creatures each night.','/vZVEUPychdvZLrTNwWErr9xZFmu.jpg','2024-06-06',102,'Released','Let them see you.','The Watchers',1086747,13.3011,6.342,'CrhrNS0JFyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34933,_binary '\0','/elnU6h6Sns1KZ4NFheQ8EVithfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2673812',7,1930,'en','Into the Mind','From the makers of All.I.Can comes the new feature film Into the Mind. Blur the lines between dream state and reality, as you perceive the world through the minds of many. Into the Mind contemplates the experiences passed between mentors and peers to paint a philosophical portrait of human kind. What drives us to overcome challenge? How do we justify risk? What forces are at the core of a mountain addiction? Unique athlete segments over a multitude of mountain sport genres depict the connectivity of Earth, and window into never-seen-before moments. Explore how we begin our perception of self, construct the foundations of confidence, and are ultimately led up the path of self-actualization.','/mNBh4VrwIIw66n86WEobfhaE3Db.jpg','2013-09-25',83,'Released',NULL,'Into the Mind',163875,0.7297,6.9,'2WdBgqZ4ZbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34934,_binary '\0','/fRwDKL8kuBZZNOtXvNxag8bXMYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2673882',7.3,2430,'pa','ਜੱਟ ਐਂਡ ਜੂਲੀਅਟ 2','In order to get promoted, Fateh Singh, a constable, agrees to go to Canada and bring the commissioner\'s daughter back to her father. However, he ends up falling in love with her.','/yJmq1RjPOFmiyfHOjjta7qF73ph.jpg','2013-06-28',137,'Released',NULL,'Jatt & Juliet 2',203599,1.4543,7.4,'FtGrababuKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34935,_binary '\0','/sGE6N1vJjxZLkOJEXdIOqTslxuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26739529',5.4,5814,'en','Money Shot: The Pornhub Story','Featuring interviews with performers, activists and past employees, this documentary offers a deep dive into the successes and scandals of Pornhub.','/kpTqWqLYcf1uErnx5VXLah4EWJZ.jpg','2023-03-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Money Shot: The Pornhub Story',1087040,4.8915,5.7,'WTAay-4QUuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34936,_binary '\0','/ivP9PVz7YOhQRGoswdOvWoYsCw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26741429',6.5,1241,'en','A Cinderella Christmas Ball','Chelsea Jones, a Chicago-based dance instructor whose adoptive parents have long since passed, travels to the small European country of Havenshire over Christmas break in search of her heritage… and maybe even family. Discovering that the only way to get access to information she needs on her quest is via the royal family, she accepts an offer to teach a very reluctant Prince a special Waltz for the traditional Royal Christmas Ball.','/iS4MXjwNEhA5pqfQDz0cP43zRul.jpg','2024-11-29',86,'Released',NULL,'A Cinderella Christmas Ball',1087092,2.27,6.1,'Wt5Q-geVtMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34937,_binary '\0','/c5Ural3rnZ9VFfZ2knmVuv4I1OL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26742994',4,1692,'en','Sunrise','When an ex-cop named Fallon returns to the scene of a horrific crime, the residents of a rural town soon discover that this dark visitor is really a vampire who feeds on blood and fear. After he is befriended by a kind immigrant family, the instinctive killer is faced with a choice between revenge and redemption.','/4aRvg2ybz646gciX5M6qaclunC2.jpg','2024-01-19',93,'Released','The sun never sets on evil.','Sunrise',1216784,1.9239,5.5,'GWZbj5k0acQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34938,_binary '\0','/8J6UlIFcU7eZfq9iCLbgc8Auklg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26743210',7.7,141587,'en','How to Train Your Dragon','On the rugged isle of Berk, where Vikings and dragons have been bitter enemies for generations, Hiccup stands apart, defying centuries of tradition when he befriends Toothless, a feared Night Fury dragon. Their unlikely bond reveals the true nature of dragons, challenging the very foundations of Viking society.','/53dsJ3oEnBhTBVMigWJ9tkA5bzJ.jpg','2025-06-06',125,'Released','The legend is real.','How to Train Your Dragon',1087192,34.1486,7.934,'22w7z_lT6YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34939,_binary '\0','/jLvNVWqyfvaMaYrOwtuVmNaGGXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26743414',7.2,4830,'fr','Monsieur Aznavour','From his poor childhood to his rise to fame, from his triumphs to his failures, from Paris to New York, discover the exceptional journey of an artist. Intimate, intense, fragile and indestructible, devoted to his art until the very end, here is one of the most immortal singers of all time: MONSIEUR AZNAVOUR.','/23FkaTaAosaTcTgyuJdTf7TvcJu.jpg','2024-10-23',134,'Released',NULL,'Monsieur Aznavour',1002155,5.0268,7.2,'MB3OAsPPzl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34940,_binary '\0','/fevCa67iK0QuboWsIS3LnCcAlCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2674358',5.6,11263,'en','The Hunter\'s Prayer','An assassin forges an unlikely partnership with one of his targets: a woman seeking revenge for the murder of her family.','/d5MEdS2Q1HpZyqaRZ54VrzHfq4G.jpg','2017-06-08',91,'Released','It\'s just business','The Hunter\'s Prayer',302150,5.3526,5.645,'v_Icvb9lFms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34941,_binary '\0','/f4zJ9UPZYrL9mMIzJEhJneP4bM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26744208',7.2,3815,'kn','ಕಾಟೇರ','Set against the rustic backdrop of the 1970s, unfolds the tale of farmers confronting challenges that intricately shape the course of their lives.','/iP7pN1Y9OBE2D9unv2Bfwv8c3R1.jpg','2023-12-29',177,'Released',NULL,'Kaatera',1212788,0.962,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34942,_binary '\0','/3WK7p9EdZmmvB1IbB2Vw9Rf4lXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2674426',7.4,343704,'en','Me Before You','Lou Clark, a directionless 26-year-old from the English countryside, takes a job at the local castle as a caregiver and companion to a wealthy young banker, Will Traynor. Wheelchair-bound from an accident two years prior, the once adventurous Will has all but given up — that is until Lou determines to show him that life is worth living.','/Ia3dzj5LnCj1ZBdlVeJrbKJQxG.jpg','2016-06-01',110,'Released','Live boldly.','Me Before You',296096,22.971,7.932,'T0MmkG_nG1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34943,_binary '\0','/k0ucFBBgSDTXYU8fVHXJyjAuIIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26744289',6.2,15932,'fr','Vermines','Residents of a rundown French apartment building battle against an army of deadly, rapidly reproducing spiders.','/dY98PkUAbIGUUg0FhXEcOkbzHIZ.jpg','2023-12-27',106,'Released','Their bite is death.','Infested',1063879,5.0562,6.5,'LR-uiy20_zM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34944,_binary '\0','/5EYIaPWR8cg1fKAyH2KTFzTIaPT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2674430',4.9,9462,'en','Approaching the Unknown','Captain William Stanaforth is on a one-way solo mission to take the first steps in colonising Mars. Like all pioneers throughout history, Stanaforth will face insurmountable odds and life and death decisions as he rockets bravely through space.','/zubKPqGvXog7LWMyVVZChCo4E8L.jpg','2016-06-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Approaching the Unknown',328429,2.7332,5.2,'CQx2eosUlXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34945,_binary '\0','/5N2crkkMaPehMUDtzRhI0uxo86U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2674454',6,16435,'en','Churchill','A ticking-clock thriller following Winston Churchill in the 24 hours before D-Day.','/zdDthGLJxzEYOCb9IHHjLmSqoRx.jpg','2017-05-25',110,'Released','The untold story of D-Day.','Churchill',399790,3.5476,6.2,'RnCxa0Ea0CE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34946,_binary '\0','/aU8POCo7adWGBObJjV6wQUyyo60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26744818',6.5,1775,'es','Un amor','Upon settling in the countryside village of La Escapa, Nat accepts a disturbing sexual proposal by neighbour Andreas, paving the way for a self-consuming passion.','/34VeLVwFihUvhlqk8U7QiNlbbkU.jpg','2023-11-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Un amor',1087571,1.7826,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34947,_binary '\0','/dtWmtqe4fQpeOZ9W5dFb6PncLGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26744890',4.7,1441,'hi','Khichdi 2: Mission Paanthukistan','The Parekh family goes on an adventure to save the world with Praful serving as an emperor of a fictional country Paanthukistan. The absurdity, the gags and the silliness return as the Parekh family\'s adventure transcends various landscapes – cities, beaches, snow-clad mountains, deserts, and caves.','/tIbcDgeW7KoN1R9JME76pgyF5XI.jpg','2023-11-16',122,'Released','C-grade agents, unwanted - dead, alive or unconscious','Khichdi 2: Mission Paanthukistan',1171106,1.5107,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34948,_binary '\0','/wllC5QYKSm9Bgf92k3D5oi01H7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26745202',6.1,2335,'te','Vey Dharuvey','Vey Dharuvey narrates the story of Shankar (Sai Ram Shankar), a young man from Karimnagar who relocates to Hyderabad in search of employment after facing setbacks in his engineering exams. In Hyderabad, Shankar falls for Shruti (Yasha Ravi Kumar), but their budding romance takes an unexpected turn when Shankar stumbles upon a startling revelation. As Shankar delves deeper into the mystery, he unravels a scandal involving Fly Consultants CEO Satya Harishandra Prasad (Devraj Pothuru), his brother Banu (Sunil), and others. Determined to unveil the truth and seek justice, Shankar confronts various challenges, including personal struggles and opposition from influential figures. The film portrays Shankar\'s journey as he juggles love, justice, and self-improvement. Through his endeavours, Shankar not only seeks redemption for himself but also looks to make a positive impact on society.','/pdjz96sKi6420kjaUURDY1D5w1F.jpg','2024-03-15',127,'Released',NULL,'Vey Dharuvey',1262003,0.7153,5.5,'mhKwF3uelOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34949,_binary '\0','/yC26uOPaXcyAj44nXsw4jGIuHSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26745321',6.1,4922,'no','Armand','Armand, a 6-year-old boy, is accused of crossing boundaries against his best friend at elementary school. While no one knows what actually happened between the two boys, the incident triggers a series of events, forcing parents and school staff into a captivating battle of redemption where madness, desire and obsession arise.','/sC4H6dsiN8kpTzPowfL9S5kugg0.jpg','2024-09-27',116,'Released','I can understand this is not easy to hear.','Armand',1144681,2.7269,6.3,'0kqGkQ1qxN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34950,_binary '\0','/grHW40Lv8gzahOKHNr4oCuKHwaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26745657',7,43098,'hi','मडगांव एक्सप्रेस','Three childhood friends embark on a trip to Goa that goes completely off-track when they wake up in their hotel room to find a cache of cocaine belonging to a don.','/kS1s8FKLWFR6cn1rlVUyqURb5os.jpg','2024-03-22',145,'Released','bachpan ke sapne... lag gaye apne!!!','Madgaon Express',1201015,2.2478,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34951,_binary '\0','/eE8HdVSdg4QuQJEZvSPOw3ZV0fg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26748538',5.1,1505,'en','Mind Body Spirit','Anya, an aspiring yoga influencer, as she embarks on a ritual practice left behind by her estranged grandmother. What starts as a spiritual self-help guide quickly evolves into something much more sinister. As Anya becomes obsessed with the mysterious power of the practice, she unwittingly unleashes an otherworldly entity that begins to take control of her life -- and her videos. Now Anya must race to unlock the truth, before her descent into madness threatens to consume her mind, body and spirit.','/crkMD6xsMWMzKFK2xOE8tslR3AC.jpg','2023-03-24',88,'Released','Make space.','Mind Body Spirit',1034093,0.7398,5.2,'oA8cG45AZS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34952,_binary '\0','/jxvkfgYvAHn0ps874wgCirRfCyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26749648',6.3,1316,'en','Another End','In a future where consciousness can be transferred, Sal is urged by his sister to try a breakthrough technology that implants the memories and personality of the dead into the living. After the passing of his wife, Sal must decide how far he\'s willing to go to reconnect with the past.','/fuWWd7pQYGv21av3HonQg6oCkZL.jpg','2024-03-21',129,'Released','Death is not the end.','Another End',1087593,3.0515,6.7,'Thhz5SeT6Tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34953,_binary '\0','/xIuFVaQXkxXa1HpcpsfNGOJSxSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26750774',6,3360,'es','El llanto','Andrea, in search of her biological family, feels stalked by an invisible threat. Other women before them have suffered the same fate. Twenty years earlier, on the other side of the world, Camille, fascinated by Marie, tries to warn her of a threat hanging over her.','/wB5fVj1Se9TFt9q1CHAtoPiuMyZ.jpg','2024-10-25',107,'Released',NULL,'The Wailing',1299372,3.2971,5.921,'QAVhQtHvCX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34954,_binary '\0','/dCgrFY6uTqhEpyhe8MzP1oExyLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26753003',5.8,172308,'en','Trap','A father and teen daughter attend a pop concert, where they realize they\'re at the center of a dark and sinister event.','/jwoaKYVqPgYemFpaANL941EF94R.jpg','2024-07-31',105,'Released','30,000 fans. 300 cops. 1 serial killer. No escape.','Trap',1032823,18.1734,6.215,'hJiPAJKjUVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34955,_binary '\0','/8wvZ0eGSH4CxYRiybeOarKknPCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26753672',6.5,4060,'en','The Activated Man','After Ors Gabriel loses his beloved dog to cancer, the shock from the trauma produces strange vision projections that force Ors to wrestle with two possibilities: that his mind has fractured, or that it\'s actually real.','/5sSmHMzMrHXXFczppNlM3ix5dUm.jpg','2024-12-13',116,'Released','Protect yourself with light','The Activated Man',1206589,1.3356,6.5,'HhpX2F9JC_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34956,_binary '\0','/bml9iJaB6W3lAUXR2mIthlzl62o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26754354',5,3372,'en','The Well','A young restorer travels to a small village to restore a medieval painting to its former glory. She will put her life in danger due to a curse attached to the painting.','/dBC4AlWK7WgNd49wEpY9GnpZxrt.jpg','2024-08-01',91,'Released','Evil has new depths.','The Well',1091267,3.3208,5.7,'ECRaLzfqQhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34957,_binary '\0','/mohiVnDYwd9SWG8yIk4nOkiwO5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26757264',6.5,1402,'it','Gloria!','In late 18th century Venice, in a convent school for girls, Teresa, a student with prophetic gifts, joins forces with some amazing music-makers. They create a new kind of pop, bright and bold, and challenge the ancient and rigid system.','/Nm0umpaFx2FthwtdTqGdegohu6.jpg','2024-04-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Gloria!',1231035,1.9046,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34958,_binary '\0','/78CquSA0GN0m7NIYnNECx91KFkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26757462',4.5,18505,'en','Hellboy: The Crooked Man','Hellboy and a rookie BPRD agent get stranded in 1950s rural Appalachia. There, they discover a small community haunted by witches, led by a local devil with a troubling connection to Hellboy\'s past: the Crooked Man.','/iz2GabtToVB05gLTVSH7ZvFtsMM.jpg','2024-08-29',100,'Released','Something crooked this way comes.','Hellboy: The Crooked Man',1087822,8.7551,5.1,'nk6vellYsfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34959,_binary '\0','/9v5Q5OOR9e83KBlK6SPQEcbm6Iw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26758372',8.5,24032,'ta','மெய்யழகன்','Twenty-two years after losing his home, Arulmozhi Varman returns to his native Thanjavur to attend his cousin\'s wedding. Amidst the celebrations, Arul is reintroduced to an upbeat man whom he cannot recall. With the help of the unknown man, Arul reconnects with his past.','/ngDEH7YqVaMCAD4LpNxRl6ScJnw.jpg','2024-09-27',177,'Released',NULL,'Meiyazhagan',1136423,2.5491,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34960,_binary '\0','/exPxtvZYNxpt6xTCPYYkCVyquh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2675914',7.1,31171,'no','Kraftidioten','Upstanding community leader Nils has just won an award for \"Citizen of the Year\" when he learns the news that his son has died of a heroin overdose. Suspecting foul play, Nils begins to investigate, and soon finds himself at the center of an escalating underworld gang war between Serbian drug dealers and a sociopathic criminal mastermind known only as “The Count.”','/ujlJLvzWRh2hR0UoHypv9QLZ2os.jpg','2014-02-21',115,'Released',NULL,'In Order of Disappearance',252822,3.9079,6.9,'7cG-exgIwPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34961,_binary '\0','/9FHjaErnsIi6sGRgsj5EkBsnm6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2675978',7,7789,'hi','डेढ़ इश्किया','A team of con men fall for a Begum and her female confidante. Does their love fructify?','/r6KLehJgkGUBFBS1geBOZIlPozm.jpg','2014-01-10',152,'Released',NULL,'Dedh Ishqiya',248698,1.6037,6.622,'_J3fkfUDkx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34962,_binary '\0','/tawbUjOaCDNq1AjbbkH2dcNTVP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26763310',6.8,4396,'te','మంగళవారం','Fear engulfs a village as murders pile up mysteriously. Shailu, a young woman, is the heart of the story and the enigmatic tale unravels with a suspenseful cinematic journey.','/zZxBWGqdoQ3lX7oPjtI41Yby59j.jpg','2023-11-17',143,'Released',NULL,'Mangalavaaram',1093012,1.5047,5.118,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34963,_binary '\0','/tKmjZaPhkVbLAK3vjrdwE0eplM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26768685',7.2,1828,'pa','ਰੱਬ ਦਾ ਰੇਡੀਓ 3','A village\'s unity is tested by a new highway project that sparks greed and conflict.','/uXgnaogJMjzNs2pnZkcGM1EulOa.jpg','2026-04-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Rabb Da Radio 3',1211237,1.5617,8,'jW0uhCZTTpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34964,_binary '\0','/x0QV6OVD9JNJGtG3SiFSTA3QG3j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26770525',4.9,2191,'hi','ला वास्ते','A man who has done B.Tech, gets the job of lifting unclaimed dead bodies in the name of job.A unique tale depicting the untold tragedy of unclaimed dead bodies in our society.','/bTXJTmMn37imtkvSVO09t5UQ4mU.jpg','2023-05-26',116,'Released',NULL,'Lavaste',1132662,0.5595,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34965,_binary '\0','/fUKqrS9KFFa19urCsfhYkMJFOYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2677064',5.8,3134,'ta','விஸ்வரூபம் II','RAW agent Wisam Ahmad Kashmiri prevents an al-Qaida terrorist from executing a massive attack on New York. He must now wade through further traps and conspiracies to thwart a new plot against three democratic nations.','/ghBzFUq3naFwwInKnDL7QLbbkUA.jpg','2018-08-09',141,'Released',NULL,'Vishwaroopam II',278358,1.3293,5.422,'YFMotSEeU18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34966,_binary '\0','/cI9fRbR6mzj51QZJsiIzXZT81TX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2677722',6.5,23226,'en','City of Lies','Los Angeles Police Department detective Russell Poole has spent years trying to solve his biggest case -- the murders of The Notorious B.I.G. and Tupac Shakur -- but after two decades, the investigation remains open. Jack Jackson, a reporter desperate to save his reputation and career, is determined to find out why. In search of the truth, the two team up and unravel a growing web of institutional corruption and lies.','/pK7IYQdtdWtMDBJZfMqDxgMjXEt.jpg','2018-09-06',112,'Released','The only thing more notorious than the crime, was the cover up.','City of Lies',433501,6.7421,6.338,'6tGCaioscqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34967,_binary '\0','/168dp7vy3kwOehcMpFaLOfB52NV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26783625',5.6,15837,'en','Bone Lake','A couple’s romantic vacation at a secluded lakeside estate is upended when they are forced to share the mansion with a mysterious and attractive couple. In this darkly hilarious and seductive horror story, a dream getaway spirals into a nightmarish maze of sex, lies, and manipulation, bringing terrifying secrets to light and triggering a bloody battle for survival.','/sGo5ti82LlydAZrvcsaj31iPuEI.jpg','2025-10-02',94,'Released','What\'s your body count?','Bone Lake',1330421,9.9086,5.917,'SOVT2ServZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34968,_binary '\0','/a65WMR49PnWmSaCzaCyMNNHKQfn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26787296',4.2,5032,'pt','O Lado Bom de Ser Traída','Babi discovers a betrayal by her long-term partner and decides to embark on a new adventure in life. On this journey, she meets judge Marco and they begin to live a story permeated by a lot of sexual tension.','/3MxgXI3VO7QCNnP0mPBjxLIemNM.jpg','2023-10-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Burning Betrayal',1173558,8.3606,6.248,'2I9e8zKFdXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34969,_binary '\0','/n06GR0Jmd1gwglNVKdyJIphQG3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2678948',6.2,15398,'ta','ஜில்லா','A cop decides to take on his godfather, who raised him from childhood, and make him realize the error of his ways.','/kUBsvLoyzgxTqTvuiE0PmJHpsRU.jpg','2014-01-10',169,'Released',NULL,'Jilla',246087,1.5732,5.7,'b1_og1IF4wE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34970,_binary '\0','/yRtZmZa2bmDYaOKygG7IaroSXwg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2679042',5.7,102356,'en','Hitman: Agent 47','An assassin teams up with a woman to help her find her father and uncover the mysteries of her ancestry.','/cx9AOBOv9Qf5ufZYQMbfTV7w7VY.jpg','2015-08-20',96,'Released','Your Number is Up.','Hitman: Agent 47',249070,10.0967,5.913,'dv83tbUUySo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34971,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2679480',7,2702,'hi','Sulemani Keeda','A pair of ne\'er-do-wells with Bollywood dreams finally get a chance to write a screenplay, but romance might get in their way.','/ihQRKI6vhPJ8km95GgE92dyX8BK.jpg','2014-12-05',89,'Released',NULL,'Sulemani Keeda',264206,0.7427,7.182,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34972,_binary '\0','/7ANVSRoyytu28zGOSXafMk0WbZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2679552',5.5,17718,'en','I.T.','Mike Regan is a successful, self-made man who has it all: a gorgeous wife, a beautiful teenage daughter and a sleek, state-of-the-art “smart home”. But he soon finds himself in a deadly, high-stakes game of cat-and-mouse when his I.T. consultant, Ed, starts using his skills to stalk Mike’s daughter and endanger his family, his business, and his life. In a world where there is no privacy, and personal secrets can go viral by the click of a mouse, Mike needs to rely on his old connections to defeat a new kind of nemesis.','/A5VrX0pzM2pnPNXwKO3jKTt35ux.jpg','2016-09-09',96,'Released','Your life is not secure.','I.T.',340677,4.5851,5.399,'bTX03mFn814','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34973,_binary '\0','/ml9WFOTF3liDw3gfbCJ9c1c4DW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26843513',6.5,8909,'en','Sovereign','Struggling single father Jerry indoctrinates his son Joe into the sovereign citizen movement, teaching him that laws are mere illusions and freedom is something you take. But, as Jerry’s ideology consumes them, they are set on a collision course with a police chief who has spent his life upholding the rules that Jerry has spent his tearing down.','/cWXUMfnMj4ioReprwsDZgt8sghK.jpg','2025-07-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Sovereign',1130022,2.9128,6.642,'7Zqxvn4a0v0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34974,_binary '\0','/mXLqmRDY3HUokHSjdSCLenM5nfJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26861992',4.2,7698,'en','Mea Culpa','A criminal defense attorney must choose between family, duty and her own dangerous desires when she takes on the case of an artist accused of murder.','/roxD9VCTTXYfPjVj9HiSC5IMtc7.jpg','2024-02-22',120,'Released','Everyone\'s guilty of something.','Mea Culpa',1090874,4.8892,5.7,'-p0g9YfjJSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34975,_binary '\0','/bTKgTXvn75B4jarRM38dTfNHMzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26880702',5.9,2316,'en','Finding Michael','In 1999, Michael Matthews became the youngest Briton to summit Mount Everest. But three hours after he reached the top of the world, aged just 22, he disappeared into blinding snow and his body has never been found.','/2kQsTvmeNLacvVDlITX7HoYnLYm.jpg','2023-02-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Finding Michael',1044050,3.1736,5.6,'dvf5B-GoFD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34976,_binary '\0','/excuyZ6SazlOo4FozdX4xuaBk5U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26885613',7,1779,'hi','हमारे बारह','A woman takes her father to court to allow her mother, who is in the midst of a risky pregnancy, the right to terminate the pregnancy in order to save her life.','/ey2CKXPkTDMUv5VeltHCc4rrDeZ.jpg','2024-06-21',148,'Released',NULL,'Hamare Baarah',1301258,0.7845,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34977,_binary '\0','/6z9puKCNohQ3T535N9MxNcnbzoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26887171',3.4,1728,'ta','பெட்டா ராப்','A movie stuntman begins to lose hope of achieving his dream of becoming an action star.','/pt5Wv7YW6Lv4XbZJ7ZeVrswg2EZ.jpg','2024-09-27',133,'Released',NULL,'Petta Rap',1317591,0.7883,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34978,_binary '\0','/9l1qL7iXIELIqIxOojGfsHkW1sX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2689354',4.7,1293,'en','Call Girl of Cthulhu','When a virginal artist falls in love with a call girl, she turns out to be the chosen bride of the alien god Cthulhu. To save her, he must stop an ancient cult from summoning their god and destroying mankind.','/3wGr5pgOAv0jvUCMgPDhBbAKaAk.jpg','2014-05-08',92,'Released','She\'s turning wet dreams... into NIGHTMARES.','Call Girl of Cthulhu',285598,1.779,5.069,'bwqJ9IXn4WU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34979,_binary '\0','/jiW3TaZtpMQgMfVnMn5Nmciqhdv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26896414',5.4,2620,'en','All the Devils Are Here','After a heist, four criminals lay low in a remote safehouse, waiting for orders. As paranoia builds, one thing becomes clear — the real threat may not be outside, but among them.','/4GJTUSjbCGynQo4PpTTNzzxYfBM.jpg','2025-09-25',87,'Released',NULL,'All the Devils Are Here',1530875,4.3004,6.3,'FK_FYtYDOmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34980,_binary '\0','/2IOQb9cl99JHgyTLCdyRXniT4Ew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26899139',7.8,2152,'hi','Pyre','In the Himalayan Mountain range, a rural village loses its inhabitants to the city’s allure while an elderly couple, Padam Singh and Tulsi, live in desolate isolation. Their days are filled with routine and occasional humour as they mask their loneliness. Their son’s absence gnaws at them, and when a letter arrives promising his return, it reignites their hearts with joy and anticipation. However, the reunion does not unfold as expected, shattering their hopes. As the film climaxes, the spectator is confronted with a more rueful plight, deeply engaging the audience’s empathy.','/h8bmRYjBq5NnByC4kxgvaNfR7Fs.jpg','2024-11-19',111,'Released',NULL,'Pyre',1374689,1.1306,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34981,_binary '\0','/kvVuOva5Yok8j3kEbGzTOMb6RxN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2689958',4.4,1778,'en','Big Sky','Hazel suffers from a crippling case of agoraphobia - so much so that it causes a rift between her and her mother, Dee. They agree that Hazel will go to a treatment facility to help her deal with her fear, transported by a driver and specialty van from the facility. But when two masked gunmen attack them on the desert road, Hazel has to battle her fears so she and her mother can survive.','/BP8N07kYXAzEVpfPti0I8qR9oo.jpg','2015-08-14',95,'Released','The only way out is to face her own fears.','Big Sky',332839,2.2321,4.5,'Z-rT-Ygf_9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34982,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26900526',7.9,2432,'en','Emesis Blue',NULL,'/95PDcIE5G5xx1InpEFqmpoIKC75.jpg',NULL,108,'Released',NULL,'Emesis Blue',1772341,0.5718,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34983,_binary '\0','/nwhS2lSw5AmIRzMtKuSGdE75kIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2690138',5.1,12307,'en','The D Train','With his 20th reunion looming, Dan can’t shake his high school insecurities. In a misguided mission to prove he’s changed, Dan rekindles a friendship with the popular guy from his class and is left scrambling to protect more than just his reputation when a wild night takes an unexpected turn.','/34sJQxmJT42jioSiabF5QobG0NC.jpg','2015-05-08',101,'Released','Every reunion needs a hero.','The D Train',308638,3.9709,4.909,'3PzB1Feeocw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34984,_binary '\0','/yXiJZwuOCVZORPjjoNcDcySU5dY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2690160',2.8,1872,'en','Poseidon Rex','Jackson Slate, famous treasure hunter, is out to find the legendary Lost Gold Of Cortez in the open waters off a secluded island in the Caribbean Sea. Using dynamite to blast his way through centuries of silt, new chasms are created reaching miles below the ancient ocean floor. From here, an ancient evil is released, that quickly, savagely, and without warning, destroys Jackson s boat and kills his crew. The sole survivor of the carnage, Jackson teams up with marine biologist, Sarah, to venture back to the site and investigate the horrific events. They extract an egg from the darkest depths of the ocean and take it back to the lab to investigate. But when it hatches, they realise they have awaken a deadly prehistoric monster, the P-Rex, which will stop at nothing until the entire island is destroyed...','/1Ng6QwrflpHNPcZLxlrnwj0R3b7.jpg','2014-04-18',76,'Released','Half Dinosaur, Half Sea Monster, All Trouble','Poseidon Rex',244852,1.2686,4,'5Ay8VmG8qU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34985,_binary '\0','/y8MeWjHGDrYYSg97gH0r6WP3ody.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2690226',6.6,2160,'en','The Chaperone','In the early 1920s, a Kansas woman finds her life forever changed when she accompanies a young dancer on her fame-seeking journey to New York City.','/tu8VIrkJ8LTyrrT9wT9Nhix2VG7.jpg','2019-03-29',103,'Released','One trip can change everything','The Chaperone',476344,1.8411,6.2,'STwiLcUMibE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34986,_binary '\0','/5velHYsh09VNgwR1HMJXi4hYaFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26903085',8.2,2769,'id','Jatuh Cinta Seperti di Film-Film','Bagus, a screenwriter, reunites with his high school friend and crush, Hana, who is still grieving from the loss of her husband. He wants to convince her to fall in love once again, just like in the movies.','/nWslpGqZnSvpX2UxOkg7pespZOA.jpg','2023-11-30',118,'Released','Can love be scripted? Or is it a feeling you just have to live?','Falling in Love Like in Movies',1074313,2.2239,8.8,'FmsljtjpvpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34987,_binary '\0','/yxQACC8pPE5RpRU8nFVU830LL6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26903104',7.1,13895,'te','స‌రిపోదా శ‌నివారం','Set in Sokulapalem, bound by a promise to his mother, Surya, an LIC agent leads a normal life on six days, maintains a careful ledger of everyone made him angry,unleashing his anger only on Saturdays, solely for justifiable reasons. A tragic incident pits him on a collision course with the ruthless and borderline-manic cop Daya.','/e2yVhbMkpi4JvvdIhvRpS0Muge7.jpg','2024-08-29',172,'Released',NULL,'Saripodhaa Sanivaaram',1194915,2.2421,6.7,'0_f1LzYjFI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34988,_binary '\0','/b9im9QSS66Bk0JaIHkqUucAGmoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26903465',7.1,2341,'ta','சார்','The people of Mangollai village like Colochi Saami and Saamikannu opposed education for the poor while people like Annadurai and Sivangaanam fought against oppression.','/pt1jvwxgZMIVbaJaKUpq4N7MrzS.jpg','2024-10-18',132,'Released',NULL,'Sir',1372611,0.7367,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34989,_binary '\0','/dofkXOowagwqplYveqhE3sjyMcb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2691498',6.8,1752,'nl','Hoe Duur Was de Suiker','A story about two half-sisters life in the eighteenth century Suriname. There is Lynda, a white colonial and slave owner, and her slave Mini-Mini\'s. While Lynda is slowly embittered by the hard life in the colony, Mini-Mini gets a chance at her own happiness. The question is, if she dares to seize that chance, as this happiness is at the expense of her mistress and half sister?','/jKe0KmKJlMsxEMAMtLThwrj88fz.jpg','2013-09-26',120,'Released','Two half sister, bound by slavery, divided by love','The Price of Sugar',217011,1.6918,6.1,'IEhbgSiT-Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34990,_binary '\0','/yIOw17XdfsoCaydtrkzlZBCcHk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26915336',7.5,15645,'fr','Mars Express','In 2200, private detective Aline Ruby and her android partner Carlos Rivera are hired by a wealthy businessman to track down a notorious hacker. On Mars, they descend deep into the underbelly of the planet\'s capital city where they uncover a darker story of brain farms, political corruption, and a missing girl who holds a secret about the robots that threatens to change the face of the universe.','/g8rUn0khoYB3G4gPPGTF1Xv9Olu.jpg','2023-11-22',89,'Released','Built to serve. Programmed to live.','Mars Express',586810,5.0111,7.5,'oREaFu3VKmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34991,_binary '\0','/jwyOZRvTQ6wCnejTjvYOXbvuzYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2691722',7.1,3207,'nl','Het Vonnis','When his wife\'s murderer is released due to a procedural error, Luc will do everything in his power to stop it from happening... He is going to take justice into his own hands and will then compete with the constitutional state which let him down.','/9yEeUUkHOtasAHS77YF2jhoJrwu.jpg','2013-10-09',111,'Released',NULL,'The Verdict',225975,0.9813,6.828,'t64TepyO9uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34992,_binary '\0','/fVcliRV9650rR99u03jOIYN3W7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2691734',5.2,2636,'en','October Gale','A doctor takes in a mysterious man who washes ashore at her remote cottage with a gunshot wound. Quickly they both learn the killer has arrived to finish the job, while a storm has cut them off from the mainland.','/1S1jh8GNQftHIuFnVRxTNfoXG19.jpg','2014-09-11',91,'Released',NULL,'October Gale',285843,1.9798,5,'x5BoJJbbEjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34993,_binary '\0','/vg0n59EwKomMNJwlbt1CqlgFDI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2691804',5,8681,'te','హరి హర వీర మల్లు: భాగం 1 – Sword vs Spirit','Set in the 1650s Mughal Era, Veera Mallu, a Robin Hood-like outlaw with secret motives is hired to steal the Koh-i-Noor from Aurangzeb’s palace. He is joined by a crew of misfits, each talented in their own way, to complete the mission.','/mKM3yC7kepjfs8A723dqd9hOky8.jpg','2025-07-23',161,'Released','Battle for Dharma','Hari Hara Veera Mallu: Part 1 – Sword vs Spirit',727121,3.0536,5.667,'_oUFfxcgxfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34994,_binary '\0','/xNHiHSMBlUaiQeTO0H82D7bmPWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26919016',8.5,1533,'ja','Yuzuru Hanyu ICE STORY 2023 \"GIFT\" at Tokyo Dome','Produced and directed by Yuzuru Hanyu. The first-ever solo ice show at Tokyo Dome \"GIFT,” a story that self-portrays Yuzuru Hanyu\'s life and future on the ice. Featuring MIKIKO as the director. The show will finally open for one night only on February 26, 2023.','/vDmhiwlTJBxDvmFipqssnzv29p9.jpg','2023-02-26',162,'Released',NULL,'Yuzuru Hanyu ICE STORY 2023 \"GIFT\" at Tokyo Dome',1093472,1.0271,8.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34995,_binary '\0','/33ayowCajE7A3bdIcGUCEYDpe0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26920120',6.3,1700,'ja','ベイビーわるきゅーれ2ベイビー','Chisato and Mahiro must pay four years of overdue fees or lose their membership in their assassin guild. They take part-time jobs, but find themselves in the middle of an armed robbery and being hunted by other assassins.','/y7plbod3RgDntiJZ8Yesk4Wj6Na.jpg','2023-03-24',101,'Released','Killing is perfect. Life isn\'t.','Baby Assassins 2',1077600,2.9897,6.727,'rvMR90x3T3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34996,_binary '\0','/1ClgfKeczI0d0KKuBs5qSIqUReT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2692250',6.2,152246,'en','Night at the Museum: Secret of the Tomb','When the magic powers of The Tablet of Ahkmenrah begin to die out, Larry Daley spans the globe, uniting favorite and new characters while embarking on an epic quest to save the magic before it is gone forever.','/xwgy305K6qDs3D20xUO4OZu1HPY.jpg','2014-12-17',98,'Released','One final night to save the day.','Night at the Museum: Secret of the Tomb',181533,17.8297,6.228,'THxsWvtbMjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34997,_binary '\0','/5l6y6M6ryNdr4LPjCuIcHVl99jy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26923601',4.7,2354,'te','Game On','A loser enters into a real time game to win which leads him to explore challenges and brings out the hidden secrets from his past.','/bFD8MyNYCG4k4zf40nlCiDR6Wai.jpg','2024-02-02',140,'Released',NULL,'Game On',1251016,0.7241,10,'RA3Z5lrPags','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34998,_binary '\0','/821am1avpUGLXAfKavTRqxCmM8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26923797',7.3,2901,'es','Sorda','Angela\'s deafness raises concerns during her pregnancy regarding connecting with her daughter. Post-delivery, partner Héctor supports her as she learns to mother in a society lacking adequate accommodations for the hearing-impaired.','/ykB9bwUHT1AV04KjYPLhfgMwYdD.jpg','2025-04-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Deaf',1303613,3.7345,7.158,'YhYdF1oavYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(34999,_binary '\0','/m0XCtFisSD0O6P55G1pUHdFccuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26926267',4.9,18508,'en','Mother of the Bride','Lana\'s daughter Emma returns from abroad and drops a bombshell: she\'s getting married. In Thailand. In a month! Things only get worse when Lana learns that the man who captured Emma\'s heart is the son of the man who broke hers years ago.','/vdTvwykMWvVgdaViBVRh8IFTku5.jpg','2024-05-08',90,'Released','First love deserves a second chance.','Mother of the Bride',1093231,5.5187,5.8,'bUSoEQBHtSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35000,_binary '\0','/iqQSRP52a8q7CNViVyXz6nC5CJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26927452',4.2,12873,'en','Hurry Up Tomorrow','A musician plagued by insomnia is pulled into an odyssey with a stranger who begins to unravel the very core of his existence.','/9W44XSMYbjXdlXcQhD104zPhhhJ.jpg','2025-05-14',105,'Released','Reality lies deeper than you think.','Hurry Up Tomorrow',1093237,4.9219,5,'NsIOX5dQrbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35001,_binary '\0','/kpk6B4AJnkSd03UVLqX3qotOWLE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26928684',4.7,2448,'en','Summer Camp','Childhood best friends Nora, Ginny and Mary used to spend every summer at sleepaway camp together, and now, fifty years later, seize the opportunity to get back together for a reunion at the camp — full of food fights, river rafting and emotional revelations.','/9RrcqS0kT5weSqS853WGWFDEATZ.jpg','2024-05-31',96,'Released','Having the times of their lives. Again.','Summer Camp',1094009,5.6883,5.4,'P_na6hBhm18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35002,_binary '\0','/9LFk66Se0T3Uw2JPupYxAc6F2Gq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2692904',7.1,170736,'en','Locke','Ivan Locke has worked hard to craft a good life for himself. Tonight, that life will collapse around him. On the eve of the biggest challenge of his career, Ivan receives a phone call that sets in motion a series of events that will unravel his family, job, and soul.','/tTREq5tTyYwmSLDRMhybJ82zXcX.jpg','2014-04-10',85,'Released','No turning back.','Locke',210479,4.8624,6.9,'TsBDYAYnQb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35003,_binary '\0','/yeZefPtGWmhkK1G4tTd2Ae390Xl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26930838',6.8,1382,'en','Men Up','In Morriston Hospital in Swansea in 1994 a group of ordinary middle-aged Welsh men stepped into the unknown by taking part in the world\'s first medical trials for the drug that became Viagra.','/sX8JWqwRc4RPqGVjK39LzNAWJ3G.jpg','2024-10-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Men Up',1179231,2.784,6.2,'-1kBK6AR4LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35004,_binary '\0','/mA03GgESjKMCUAiCywyx6I7kSZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26931594',7.5,3644,'en','Man on the Run','After the breakup of The Beatles, Paul McCartney formed Wings with his wife Linda. Archival footage captures their life together, with Linda inspiring Paul\'s music in the 1970s, a decade in which Wings achieved numerous hits.','/6wHOJ6pAkj0RWCZx8U4dqsrlQpa.jpg','2026-02-19',115,'Released',NULL,'Man on the Run',1260643,3.4538,7.5,'pBcllNrY0u8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35005,_binary '\0','/t3mTQNXbsHCnqHImKHEoyflP5X6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26931915',7.1,1323,'en','Wanda Sykes: I\'m an Entertainer','The comedy icon sounds off on parenting with her French wife, the perils of public bathrooms and why she\'s tired of going high when others go low.','/tXglM0xLh0chzmbxRiglcQk6w8G.jpg','2023-05-22',60,'Released',NULL,'Wanda Sykes: I\'m an Entertainer',1118425,2.0864,6.6,'rJdIRMolhE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35006,_binary '\0','/1TdCtQaAqZhKRSOSbPi1EPToJxN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26932223',4.6,79341,'hi','भूल भुलैया 3','Rooh Baba ventures into a haunted mansion in the kingdom of Raktaghat in West Bengal, where he confronts two vengeful spirits, both asserting to be Manjulika.','/3AfHD1HoaQpQwKH8kxRdBKVmzeU.jpg','2024-11-01',158,'Released',NULL,'Bhool Bhulaiyaa 3',980599,2.5475,5.5,'6YMY62tMLUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35007,_binary '\0','/lWkb8EgpzzepKfufkA8Zr1sIxHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2693580',6.5,8411,'en','Miss Stevens','Stuck at a crossroads in her personal life, it falls on high school English teacher Miss Stevens to chaperone three of her students — Billy, Margot and Sam — on a weekend trip to a drama competition.','/7pWcZa8ANeRCIlddbBZu8QconsU.jpg','2016-09-16',86,'Released','Everybody needs a chaperone.','Miss Stevens',346134,4.9728,6.49,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35008,_binary '\0','/d5DAiBywENsRTqVMFSGSZrllEtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2693664',5.8,11037,'en','Young Ones','In a future where water is scarce, a farmer defends his land and hopes to rejuvenate his parched soil. However, his daughter\'s boyfriend schemes to steal the land for himself.','/6Vbhvo9d4Bv65rEzqFJR7TUD2ve.jpg','2014-06-28',100,'Released','In a future without water, vengeance will rain.','Young Ones',215379,3.6983,5.75,'mH9_tU5PbGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35009,_binary '\0','/b3AeMIsXPm6wvGp9E7mGmRZ6528.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26936666',6.8,41402,'ta','வேட்டையன்','A sought-after Supercop gets caught in a series of unexpected events when he encounters a suspect who is accused of being involved in a murder case.','/1q0dAC3OJZVKQcV2dG5sGvdUGqN.jpg','2024-10-10',161,'Released','The Hunter','Vettaiyan',1093966,1.441,6.2,'NQXE3iJCWNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35010,_binary '\0','/kx2Vmo1rqwgzO0lF6ZDAmUom3jq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26940053',6.5,1678,'en','The Summer Book','The story of the relationship between Sophia, an eight-year-old girl who is growing up fast, and her grandmother, who is nearing the end of her life. They are spending time together with Sophia’s father, at the family summer house on a tiny unspoiled island in the Gulf of Finland. All three are coming to terms with the recent death of Sophia’s mother in very different ways.','/nGF9oiUzyiHDsR6XmzKPgFh9ThE.jpg','2025-01-31',94,'Released',NULL,'The Summer Book',1073112,2.899,7.3,'tDYcCHgDdfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35011,_binary '\0','/7mQ13AV4qd6A43XxXfSoyYQMzhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26940324',5.8,35685,'en','Jackpot!','In the near future, a \'Grand Lottery\' has been established - the catch: kill the winner before sundown to legally claim their multi-billion dollar jackpot. When Katie Kim mistakenly finds herself with the winning ticket, she reluctantly joins forces with amateur lottery protection agent Noel Cassidy who must get her to sundown in exchange for a piece of her prize.','/7vv0NTaQGOO7M5ZMerp1vMFJsby.jpg','2024-08-13',107,'Released','Take the money and run.','Jackpot!',1094138,11.7631,6.347,'IW7pIYtpp50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35012,_binary '\0','/6SLyu9ygASsrOqkCpjAwtyG9PWW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26943420',5,2274,'en','The Thundermans Return','Twins Phoebe and Max are enjoying their superhero lifestyle, but when one \'save\' goes awry, the Thundermans are sent back to Hiddenville. While Hank and Barb enjoy their return, and Billy and Nora look forward to a normal high school life, Max and Phoebe are determined to regain their superhero status.','/2J5eeroLDY0d45mVjpuGhcLZs3W.jpg','2024-03-07',70,'Released',NULL,'The Thundermans Return',1094556,5.4188,6.907,'gYA5WOFhd-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35013,_binary '\0','/5DetBQfNtZy7eMWdA2jWczsArGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26958570',4.9,1717,'en','Summoning the Spirit','Carla and Dean decide to escape the hustle of the big city, purchasing a home in a remote forest. They have big plans for their new quiet life, only to find something much more sinister; they are on the land of a cult, and the leader claims a telepathic connection to a legendary beast that inhabits the woods surrounding them. Carla and Dean are forced to uncover the terrifying truth of the cult\'s prophecy.','/7Ez8G9wOiA45Huri4j02SLpqMpx.jpg','2023-03-06',96,'Released','Something has awakened.','Summoning the Spirit',1096443,1.1893,4.8,'6D118asy-14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35014,_binary '\0','/uqkFwYwFicbh9F5MbHNnp5kKmFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt26997803',5,1292,'te','భీమా','When mysterious occurrences plague a closed Shiva temple at Mahendragiri, a fearless and dynamic cop Bhimaa quests to unravel and confront the sinister truth hidden in the shadows and the revelations behind strange happenings in the village, supported by spirits.','/fdaob8wA5SkeGnKA0LrpWb14TFy.jpg','2024-03-08',141,'Released',NULL,'Bhimaa',1226886,1.3102,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35015,_binary '\0','/qRwSY7MQcMY099gwtCaBMTqvNlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27002406',5.1,2966,'en','Come Out in Jesus Name','Following a startling chain of events, the most controversial pastor in America, Greg Locke, took a 180-degree turn from his mainstream religious traditions and led his church to the brink of revival. He and a diverse group of unconventional preachers then began to spark the most important awakening in the history of the Christian Church — through the most unlikely means – by casting out demons. This fiery film documents the beginnings of their journey.','/u6quZ7rdcuew8qBuluyHFTBH0Q5.jpg','2023-03-13',100,'Released','The most important awakening in church history has begun','Come Out in Jesus Name',1081021,1.0775,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35016,_binary '\0','/9JzpVcqBlJouPyIvnQz0kdDnAPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2700330',8.1,2471,'en','The Two Escobars','Pablo Escobar was the richest, most powerful drug kingpin in the world, ruling the Medellin Cartel with an iron fist. Andres Escobar was the biggest soccer star in Colombia. The two were not related, but their fates were inextricably-and fatally-intertwined. Pablo\'s drug money had turned Andres\' national team into South American champions, favored to win the 1994 World Cup in Los Angeles. It was there, in a game against the U.S., that Andres committed one of the most shocking mistakes in soccer history, scoring an \"own goal\" that eliminated his team from the competition and ultimately cost him his life. The Two Escobars is a riveting examination of the intersection of sports, crime, and politics.','/qYnslGb1D0JgYLQYiwPqQ2ojQDv.jpg','2010-06-22',100,'Released','Sometimes it really is a matter of life and death','The Two Escobars',53190,1.127,7.4,'dKTpGn3BM64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35017,_binary '\0','/fTDCrqJ9uxXHP4F6gY9SUWN6Xsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27004148',6.1,3884,'id','Siksa Kubur','When a violent act kills her parents, Sita vows to debunk the idea of supernatural torment after death — a fixation that leads her on a dark quest.','/sDaiRx3OWvCOo1vLoEpdedLeVzY.jpg','2024-04-11',117,'Released','You Shall Believe.','Grave Torture',1119527,3.6987,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35018,_binary '\0','/7w3lsubWU6UTOBgNqzQ4SPuXm8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27004149',5.2,1509,'id','Kabut Berduri','A big-city detective investigates a series of gruesome murders along the Indonesia-Malaysia border — forcing her to confront ghosts from her past.','/z6uPuxzFJs7OyTPrl5V0XUITKj5.jpg','2024-07-31',112,'Released',NULL,'Borderless Fog',1126357,3.427,6.2,'wWVM1qK909E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35019,_binary '\0','/8BemLDPKS52ZKgqzwD21W5BEZAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27007466',8.1,8914,'ta','லப்பர் பந்து','Middle aged local cricketer Poomalai finds a new rival in the form of a younger sports person named Anbu. Their rivalry in cricket gets complicated when Anbu falls in love with Poomalai\'s daughter Durga.','/jNyLZjIgaYVkBli2JihHwABlAPY.jpg','2024-09-20',146,'Released',NULL,'Lubber Pandhu',1097000,1.4877,7.632,'oP88LHBukW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35020,_binary '\0','/4lSNlbUVRzjXyoL95n0GF3WrOTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27010338',7.1,1700,'en','The Wedding Cottage','A wedding guide creator must convince an uninspired artist and owner of a special wedding cottage to renovate the rundown cottage to host a contest-winning couple for their dream wedding.','/tCL19os5OXvEYU4GpMYUpgVMHeV.jpg','2023-04-15',84,'Released','Here comes the fixer upper.','The Wedding Cottage',1093764,1.9527,7.2,'xNCSxSvHHqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35021,_binary '\0','/gqPiSgE7byIolbKdzfo4B5ULpn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27012110',5.8,26486,'hi','गैसलाइट','Meesha, a young paraplegic woman confined to a wheelchair, returns to her family’s royal estate after 15 years at the behest of her estranged father, only to learn that he’s mysteriously missing and probably dead.','/8D3lObq5pv7lH0o5tny908SldKf.jpg','2023-03-31',111,'Released','One murder, many suspects; Deadly twists','Gaslight',1092654,1.077,5.545,'bA00GJQbS1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35022,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2701772',4.3,1471,'en','Kingdom Come','A group of strangers wake up in an abandoned hospital to find themselves stalked by a supernatural force with sinister intentions.','/17ZFwfA92kXR6wD9QlpLDfopvSF.jpg','2014-08-20',99,'Released','They are coming for your soul.','Kingdom Come',295723,0.9421,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35023,_binary '\0','/bJyNlaNe1Pex0cvYG6RC9qGnGIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2702724',5.4,51510,'en','The Boss','A titan of industry is sent to prison after she\'s caught for insider trading. When she emerges ready to rebrand herself as America\'s latest sweetheart, not everyone she screwed over is so quick to forgive and forget.','/f43EUrZvE9bV0EmuqgtPgWVXnUc.jpg','2016-04-07',99,'Released','Watch your assets','The Boss',323676,5.9085,5.813,'V8GAMZqJqjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35024,_binary '\0','/mw6ucZfre773Fb1BSSsvsvV8a9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27028399',5.8,51611,'hi','मर्डर मुबारक','When a gym trainer is murdered at an elite Delhi club, a wily investigator unravels the sordid secrets of its ultrarich members to find the killer.','/joU5VihgUvkhyPnhzxfjmWk32rd.jpg','2024-03-15',142,'Released','Secrets they all will kill for','Murder Mubarak',1051023,2.1231,6.557,'mquDaCVVeGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35025,_binary '\0','/usIfpM7Lr3r9fWTvMGZ8HoD1f8f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2702920',5.6,11232,'en','The Secret Garden','Mary Lennox is born in India to wealthy British parents who never wanted her. When her parents suddenly die, she is sent back to England to live with her uncle. She meets her sickly cousin, and the two children find a wondrous secret garden lost in the grounds of Misselthwaite Manor.','/5MSDwUcqnGodFTvtlLiLKK0XKS.jpg','2020-07-08',100,'Released','Unlock your imagination','The Secret Garden',521034,7.0585,6.335,'gHNOXDiD9Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35026,_binary '\0','/rIg8wChXrWKY2HWUcZcfDXO46a9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27032419',6.7,6278,'hi','मिसिज़','A newly wed finds herself in an overcooked and tasteless happily ever-after laced with patriarchal traditions.','/oua21BWpycKYHDFxOcMqJwsm9Rb.jpg','2023-11-17',111,'Released',NULL,'Mrs.',942411,1.5219,6.66,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35027,_binary '\0','/2xnLwNvea2TSH0M0oc9iEq2KEVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27032708',4.6,5602,'fr','Survivre','A couple celebrates their son’s birthday in the middle of the ocean on their boat. A violent storm hits and it brings up hungry creatures from the depths and they fight for their survival.','/7fR3KxswtY8OHHZuOUB9td58CRX.jpg','2024-06-19',90,'Released','The world has gone sideways.','Survive',1196470,7.9463,5.877,'fnMO7zSitto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35028,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2704212',7.1,1445,'fi','Sel8nne','Selänne is a documentary about Teemu Selänne—the best Finnish ice hockey player of all time. It\'s directed by JP Siili, whose previous films include such hits as Härmä and Ganes. We\'ve followed the heroic tales of Selänne for over two decades. His exploits are famous, but now we get to know Selänne the man. In this documentary Teemu lets the viewer get close and under his skin. The film follows Selänne\'s journey from childhood to the latest NHL season. We see the life story of an exceptional athlete inside and out, not only through Teemu\'s words, but through the views of his loved ones and colleagues. Selänne is charismatic, social, irritating, charming, happy and always late. Welcome to the life of Teemu Selänne!','/7ORgTa9u3qLhVRiphpOlpAg2Py3.jpg','2013-09-26',110,'Released',NULL,'The Finnish Flash - A Teemu Selänne Story',224659,1.5032,6.8,'nZbf__zq768','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35029,_binary '\0','/ffQAbMDcME2IFmdnzCrbDjEupM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27047448',3.8,7025,'en','Til Death Do Us Part','After bailing on her wedding, a former bride-to-be must fight off her ex-groom and seven angry killer groomsmen in order to survive the night.','/pdo2Wyq3BvME9gHxcrH5RN147hg.jpg','2023-08-03',109,'Released','For better or worse... much worse.','Til Death Do Us Part',1126577,4.0907,5.5,'81FJNFuzKRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35030,_binary '\0','/3eUyLEF5M0ky3h6KJsWiWzaakB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27047903',5.5,66858,'en','Scream 7','When a new Ghostface killer emerges in the quiet town where Sidney Prescott has built a new life, her darkest fears are realized as her daughter becomes the next target. Determined to protect her family, Sidney must face the horrors of her past to put an end to the bloodshed once and for all.','/jjyuk0edLiW8vOSnlfwWCCLpbh5.jpg','2026-02-25',114,'Released','Burn it all down.','Scream 7',1159559,31.5261,6.2,'4g8OciWNJn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35031,_binary '\0','/kPG8nx4ynnakEQtiBweMMS7kvrp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2704816',7.1,3458,'en','Who Took Johnny','An examination of the infamous thirty-year-old cold case of Iowa paperboy Johnny Gosch, the first missing child to appear on a milk carton. The film focuses on Johnny’s mother, Noreen Gosch, and her relentless quest to find the truth about what happened to her son. Along the way there have been mysterious sightings, bizarre revelations, and a confrontation with a person who claims to have helped abduct Johnny.','/93QgSxYD68F3jeICIB8mYaZzhPi.jpg','2014-01-17',80,'Released',NULL,'Who Took Johnny',251220,2.3018,6.8,'aSsk-LoO6WA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35032,_binary '\0','/aKPCZwkSZy2ASLo0QKeYmcoplfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2704998',6.9,284456,'en','Game Night','Max and Annie\'s weekly game night gets kicked up a notch when Max\'s brother Brooks arranges a murder mystery party -- complete with fake thugs and federal agents. So when Brooks gets kidnapped, it\'s all supposed to be part of the game. As the competitors set out to solve the case, they start to learn that neither the game nor Brooks are what they seem to be. The friends soon find themselves in over their heads as each twist leads to another unexpected turn over the course of one chaotic night.','/85R8LMyn9f2Lev2YPBF8Nughrkv.jpg','2018-02-15',100,'Released','This is not a game.','Game Night',445571,14.0724,6.848,'qmxMAdV6s4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35033,_binary '\0','/6SukPXIL4ipy2JptYaTgeYnRD0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27050277',6.1,5985,'es','El correo','After shrewdly seizing his chance to join a money-laundering scheme, a modest valet dives into a world of fast cash, fast cars — and an inevitable crash.','/1IRKYqQXXleihbzaFXeDU1TdxKP.jpg','2024-01-19',102,'Released',NULL,'The Courier',1148713,5.1945,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35034,_binary '\0','/iXWYGGvuPCRuvBAUils2YetytmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27051027',6.5,14856,'kn','Love...ಲಿ','An orphan grows up to become a gangster who finds love. However, he faces a critical situation where he risks losing everything.','/hSWOvggVbTpkYSzolnx2ns4Efoj.jpg','2024-06-14',168,'Released','An inspired story','Love Li',1305575,0.8833,6,'2WYQbp3rJLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35035,_binary '\0','/iVqXcSZs4ye2HTROwUYQgy3Dx7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27052428',6.9,2088,'en','Orwell: 2+2=5','George Orwell was one of the most visionary authors of the 20th century, whose novels 1984 and Animal Farm foretold a chilling, authoritarian future. Acclaimed director Raoul Peck interweaves clips, readings from Orwell\'s diary, cinematic references, and modern-day footage to craft not only a portrait of the writer, but a fresh take on how prophetic his work has become.','/qG1LjcK8ohi4mSJ9j8KHUs5svbe.jpg','2025-10-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Orwell: 2+2=5',1098534,3.4894,7.2,'acKIDBKyx9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35036,_binary '\0','/aQ5nvQGT6mM6TliOM5iSgrKVF4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27052633',6.3,25455,'en','Echo Valley','Kate lives a secluded life—until her troubled daughter shows up, frightened and covered in someone else\'s blood. As Kate unravels the shocking truth, she learns just how far a mother will go to try to save her child.','/AsqALJWqGRgnKEo3gt1TCOF4nCM.jpg','2025-06-13',105,'Released','A mother at peace. A daughter in crisis. A night that changes everything.','Echo Valley',1097311,9.9152,6.5,'KQiZ5zMhliw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35037,_binary '\0','/xtdfF8BICp0CZSvA3lnqqYx7eSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27056012',6.5,28697,'hi','खेल खेल में','What if for one night your mobile phone was a public property? 7 friends at a wedding after-party decide to play a seemingly harmless but as it turns out, a dangerous game which might have earth-shattering consequences with relationships, marriages and identities being at stake.','/32P0oQf41HXbENRGtu2h0rqBF2k.jpg','2024-08-15',135,'Released',NULL,'Khel Khel Mein',1241592,1.5673,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35038,_binary '\0','/pwfXx2O3eFXi5dtWCV5XJPQJgqN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27056066',6.8,14060,'hi','स्काई फ़ोर्स','In the 1965 Indo-Pak War, India faces a devastating surprise attack. Wing Commander Ahuja leads a retaliatory strike, but Squadron Leader Vijaya goes missing after a heroic solo engagement against a superior enemy jet. Ahuja spends 23 years seeking the truth and uncovering a cover-up.','/f1KLUpaW7rbXhUm5SxG1lpPFFCJ.jpg','2025-01-24',125,'Released','Some missions end. Others last a lifetime.','Sky Force',1143407,2.2035,6.6,'PKsVB1wPZ78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35039,_binary '\0','/6nPnDJwhVtc1trJE4ujyFIyLDlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27056116',6.2,1854,'nl','Het Geheugenspel','The body of Nathalie, who disappeared 25 years ago, is found on the Deridder family estate. The event reveals a long-hidden crime, and when secrets are brought forth, the present is overshadowed by the past.','/c59z3Hguyq2jpcEXNNsHDNBQb9Y.jpg','2023-05-18',107,'Released',NULL,'The Memory Game',1110820,1.1447,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35040,_binary '\0','/hE39tIC0VUt8tPMDGIbTeTrqklP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27075304',4.6,3225,'de','Chantal im Märchenland','Chantal, an influencer with no followers, and her best friend Zeynep end up in a fairytale world thanks to an antique magic mirror that they think is a social media gimmick. The marriage-mad princes didn\'t expect such a badass princess. Thanks to her ghetto skills, Chantal does away with reactionary fairytale clichés, fights against curses and tyrannical kings - and, above all, fights for her friendship with Zeynep.','/kL8vKVD7TqgGnRpKCpPXAwI4PnF.jpg','2024-03-28',118,'Released',NULL,'Chantal in Fairyland',1119774,3.3908,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35041,_binary '\0','/arGs8D4RfUfsk7vMiMjDi6Mtabv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27075958',5.7,55248,'en','Fountain of Youth','A treasure-hunting mastermind assembles a team for a life-changing adventure. But to outwit and outrun threats at every turn, he\'ll need someone even smarter than he is: his estranged sister.','/4iWjGghUj2uyHo2Hyw8NFBvsNGm.jpg','2025-05-19',126,'Released','The best secrets are the hardest to find.','Fountain of Youth',1098006,16.365,6.2,'-7S28bH8iDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35042,_binary '\0','/zH3GO60Czc16BuUTi2pL1iASgt5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2707810',5.7,1753,'en','Submission','A well-respected professor who is a celebrated novelist and loving husband loses himself when he becomes obsessed with an ambitious and talented student.','/ldqG5s9WENZdfHlwKB4r2AwCXa0.jpg','2018-03-02',106,'Released','He read her story. Then he became part of it.','Submission',414454,2.0632,5.9,'P11MroggtPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35043,_binary '\0','/6mkIV5UmI9CoWZROWDd69KrZuYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2707848',6.1,6910,'fr','Saint Laurent','1967-1976. As one of history\'s greatest fashion designers entered a decade of freedom, neither came out of it in one piece.','/3CjpieZ2qIcX43ZehKq2lv5wwOh.jpg','2014-09-23',150,'Released','The story that has never been told before','Saint Laurent',221667,2.8632,6.1,'kF7y2U0zW7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35044,_binary '\0','/pzsd4yHmasqvdnJwmqQboosiGwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2707858',6.2,13832,'fr','Yves Saint Laurent','A look at the life of French designer Yves Saint Laurent from the beginning of his career in 1958 when he met his lover and business partner, Pierre Berge.','/vEepuUvERKdHfUyys1XYbHoERE7.jpg','2014-01-08',106,'Released','Fashions fade. Style is forever.','Yves Saint Laurent',245775,2.4951,6.614,'bhoO_rBo7-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35045,_binary '\0','/jwkappl2YX1KKbBR5QK8yVMj5xp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27078772',7.3,3260,'en','Lewis Capaldi: How I\'m Feeling Now','An intimate, all-access documentary that will chronicle Lewis Capaldi\'s journey from a scrappy teen with a viral performance to a Grammy-nominated pop star.','/djaZtmMiKFp8zaclEaAyD8vHcvx.jpg','2023-04-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Lewis Capaldi: How I\'m Feeling Now',1098164,2.3631,7.548,'PSaOQKk710g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35046,_binary '\0','/m9trQEeSF27oRVxuHYG5bPkpyaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27080561',6.6,1640,'ta','கொட்டுக்காளி','A family decides to visit their clan God to cure their daughter, thought to be possessed because she is in love with a man from a different caste. The journey, accompanied by her betrothed, unveils tensions between tradition and personal freedom, exposing her silent rebellion.','/8zsfFnOFSn6fxedlf3dL4ESIsJL.jpg','2024-08-23',104,'Released','The Adamant Girl','The Adamant Girl',1098332,1.2106,7.722,'Aj5YUabHbCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35047,_binary '\0','/xUpoUFez8y5DCNT6CUVemEHsSPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2708254',6.9,9918,'en','Life of a King','The true story of one man\'s mission to give inner city kids of Washington DC something he never had - a future. After being incarcerated for eighteen years, Eugene Brown established the Big Chair Chess Club to get kids off the streets and working towards lives they never believed they were capable of. This is his inspirational story.','/b5dpHRk7Vuw54JocWGDTuRK22nU.jpg','2013-06-22',101,'Released','The endgame is the only thing that\'ll set you free.','Life of a King',201550,4.3185,7.2,'1_bma8mMO6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35048,_binary '\0','/o0cm4EExs6uEbCUlFZoJ74BkFPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2708764',5.8,3018,'ja','HK/変態仮面','High school student Kyosuke Shikijo is the most talented member of the school\'s martial arts of the fist club. His late father was detective and Kyosuke share his father\'s strong sense of justice. Kyosuke also has a secret. Kyosuke likes to wear female underwear and transforms himself into the alter ego \"Hentai Kamen,\" wearing female underwear and gaining superhuman powers. This unusual interest also comes from his parents, with his father a masochist and his mother a sadist. By chance, Kyosuke gets the underwear of female high school student Aiko Himeno. With her underwear, he gains various pervert techniques and attempts to protect Aiko from a dirty and heinous teacher.','/o5ENtNf4uNACilr90RNTIhd2CtU.jpg','2013-04-13',105,'Released','Panty Bless You.','HK: Forbidden Super Hero',204342,2.5912,6.215,'c0vF0CBKKEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35049,_binary '\0','/uvhenCX4hoS44htqyYyhQFKGd8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2708946',5.6,2748,'en','UnHung Hero','When Patrick Moote\'s girlfriend rejects his marriage proposal at a UCLA basketball game on the jumbotron, it unfortunately goes viral and hits TV networks worldwide. Days after the heartbreaking debacle, she privately reveals why she can’t be with him forever: Patrick’s small penis size. \"Unhung Hero\" follows the real life journey of Patrick as he boldly sets out to expose this extremely personal chapter of his life confronting ex-girlfriends, doctors, anthropologists and even adult film stars. From Witch-Doctors in Papua New Guinea to sex museums in Korea, Patrick has a lot of turf to cover on his globe trotting adventure to finally answer the age old question: Does size matter?','/et7jpooiP4K7eawUhmbYJmRyI7J.jpg','2013-12-06',84,'Released','A handful is all you need.','UnHung Hero',173495,1.1144,5.2,'ghPZ3KxAYSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35050,_binary '\0','/5lWIYxYEqWi8j3ZloxXntw3ImBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2709692',6.4,115538,'en','The Grinch','The Grinch hatches a scheme to ruin Christmas when the residents of Whoville plan their annual holiday celebration. But a certain little who might change things.','/Al7DMUp8bqUN4JwXVNxfJYyv5cH.jpg','2018-11-08',85,'Released','It was the heist before Christmas.','The Grinch',360920,19.3229,6.862,'L8LWUyUy7jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35051,_binary '\0','/q2VAZ4q3cB8BGgfAbVE8IIu8Bej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2709764',6.4,1345,'ko','사이코메트리','While investigating the kidnapping and murder of a little girl, a detective spots a piece of graffiti that depicts the crime scene perfectly—but the graffiti was drawn a month before the crime took place, and that the artist knows more than he is telling.','/9a5ajYpawjv5Ujz5Hf9QeZq3LZE.jpg','2013-03-06',107,'Released','The past is revealed with a touch of a hand.','The Gifted Hands',193717,1.8032,6.034,'G3wvIIcUfOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35052,_binary '\0','/c1Ywtvlqls6tPBZ3BqbPtBwHyng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2709768',6.5,239130,'en','The Secret Life of Pets','The quiet life of a terrier named Max is upended when his owner takes in Duke, a stray whom Max instantly dislikes.','/g3Hms6AE174doeGR1gz5zX5sVsv.jpg','2016-06-18',86,'Released','Ever wonder what your pets do when you\'re not home?','The Secret Life of Pets',328111,6.1867,6.326,'UZJVc_JTI_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35053,_binary '\0','/omClMgWIsLMnMd3NN4hbXSVDSzy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2709784',6.4,2761,'en','Burton and Taylor','Legendary acting duo and married couple Richard Burton and Elizabeth Taylor prepare for a 1983 theatrical production of the play \"Private Lives.\"','/cnzLsrmaM8GxSKCaNaJ9gfC0Vaf.jpg','2013-07-22',83,'Released',NULL,'Burton and Taylor',209091,2.2329,6.2,'hYU2mhxEDQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35054,_binary '\0','/cpnbat6ELFoO5vJ3xAi3RDn2Uom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2710368',5.6,1944,'en','Final: The Rapture','A gritty, international tale of four separate stories woven together by a common theme: the Rapture.','/3w2e1G7fibmrW8C79zT9HnOJkQG.jpg','2013-09-13',90,'Released','What if you woke up and it finally happened?','Final: The Rapture',224903,1.2703,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35055,_binary '\0','/wgoftpRkmDUwmM6elRYOThbdD7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2710826',4,2210,'en','AfterDeath','Five young people wake up dead. Washed up by the tide they scramble to an abandoned beach house, soon realizing that the perpetual night and blasts of pain suggest this is some version of hell. Between in-fighting and attacks by a demonic shadow creature, they recall the collapse of the nightclub that brought them here - and begin seeing hope of a second chance in the cabin\'s two mysterious paintings...','/3nfbBfC7lqOKMC8G5bx4e7kKB2C.jpg','2015-10-19',88,'Released','There is only hell...','AfterDeath',214256,1.3037,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35056,_binary '\0','/ay0PJQZizDXk0pzhoGX4v7K9h7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27110516',5.4,4548,'en','One More Shot','Following the attack on the black site in Poland, Navy SEAL Jake Harris is ordered to escort terrorist suspect Amin Mansur to Washington D.C. for interrogation. Before the prisoner transfer process is complete, though, the airport is attacked by a group of heavily armed, well-trained mercenaries.','/xiLFc19JANfAZHbecqoCFpmtiUV.jpg','2024-01-09',102,'Released',NULL,'One More Shot',1214314,8.5917,6.565,'QaxJFknK1WE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35057,_binary '\0','/wZC1a3V8xZqHBrmsuRJFtG25dkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27114092',6.2,2141,'ru','Майор Гром: Игра','Police Major Igor Grom is known throughout St. Petersburg for his punchy character and uncompromising attitude towards criminals of all stripes. Incredible strength, analytical mindset and integrity — all this makes Major Thunder a real superhero. His life is perfect: during the day he catches criminals with his partner Dima Dubin, and spends the evenings in the company of journalist Yulia Pchelkina. The complete idyll is interrupted by the appearance in the city of a mysterious villain calling himself a Ghost. He offers Thunder to play a dangerous game, the stake in which is the lives of ordinary people.','/8ssOkbkJ1SiF401jYhLej30NhOv.jpg','2024-05-23',166,'Released',NULL,'Major Grom: The Game',1080252,1.5906,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35058,_binary '\0','/34v4fklYEAhpkRNa8dG0OA3xbI2.jpg','2026-10-06 1