ancé dies in a bungee jumping accident.','/gj74sUGsPMg5qDQooh8GTs4MvbP.jpg','2023-12-08',97,'Released','It\'s a different world. He fits in perfectly.','Mr. Monk\'s Last Case: A Monk Movie',1100795,6.7088,6.8,'Krfd3OWb4hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35075,_binary '\0','/rsd09IM1NQuuBQOZr1MKm6FiBFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27146069',5.4,3218,'en','The Ruse','An in-home caregiver fears for her life after being assigned to a mysterious elderly patient in a remote seaside home.','/hyEtogFteyeNPYkFbJbjTjxC9Zc.jpg','2025-05-16',100,'Released',NULL,'The Ruse',1095700,1.7358,5,'id8fboXbxjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35076,_binary '\0','/jqB9jaE6TMY57ytJN8BTuoPKZm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2714622',5.9,4260,'te','ఇద్దరమ్మాయిలతో','A young woman becomes embroiled in a financial and political conspiracy while studying in Spain, as she meets a young musician with a somewhat dark past unfolded through the pages of his lover\'s diary.','/ch9MUo4wxU7rmoVZtwtVQsPFvHr.jpg','2013-05-31',138,'Released',NULL,'Iddarammayilatho',197999,1.4257,5.486,'11wKH4QXGac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35077,_binary '\0','/ajukqMGU1d5d1Csx0jUGPDsXpFC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2714900',7.7,15909,'en','Finding Vivian Maier','Vivian Maier\'s photos were seemingly destined for obscurity, lost among the clutter of the countless objects she\'d collected throughout her life. Instead these images have shaken the world of street photography and irrevocably changed the life of the man who brought them to the public eye. This film brings to life the interesting turns and travails of the improbable saga of John Maloof\'s discovery of Vivian Maier, unravelling this mysterious tale through her documentary films, photographs, odd collections and personal accounts from the people that knew her. What started as a blog to show her work quickly became a viral sensation in the photography world. Photos destined for the trash heap now line gallery exhibitions, a forthcoming book and this documentary film.','/yaj9mpHNpns5j4ODP4352PgDWJM.jpg','2014-03-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Finding Vivian Maier',169607,1.734,7.6,'2o2nBhQ67Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35078,_binary '\0','/r2u2MOaOLWSi6onaAo37Vf39xGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27155038',5.7,14709,'en','Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken','Ruby Gillman, a sweet and awkward high school student, discovers she\'s a direct descendant of the warrior kraken queens. The kraken are sworn to protect the oceans of the world against the vain, power-hungry mermaids. Destined to inherit the throne from her commanding grandmother, Ruby must use her newfound powers to protect those she loves most.','/8ChIb3WzYAcza1vrXR56v510MWk.jpg','2023-06-28',92,'Released','Discover the hero just beneath the surface.','Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken',1040148,15.4993,7.134,'iAMKwDsfUeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35079,_binary '\0','/yjLbhu654CZkrusJ3VMuzrGNZp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27156546',6.5,1507,'en','Child Star','Explore the highs and lows of growing up in the spotlight through the lens of some of the world’s most famous former child stars. Through celebrity interviews, verite scenes, and archival footage, this film deconstructs the stages of earlier stardom and looks at the entertainment system over the last century.','/qonoT25IHa7v2j82IkYQwyxZUb6.jpg','2024-09-17',97,'Released','Is the price of fame worth your childhood?','Child Star',1323753,1.9827,6.2,'0M6i1tDWJos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35080,_binary '\0','/6z6ZNNZT39hqnOq1e490wCttcUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27158093',4.9,1424,'en','Arthur\'s Whisky','When Joan’s husband dies, she is shocked to discover he had invented an elixir which makes the drinker look young again. Sharing it with her two friends, the three women paint the town red but soon discover that they are no longer equipped to be 