sire to be free of her feeds his obsession with Kimmel, a man suspected of brutally murdering his own wife. When Walter and Kimmel\'s lives become dangerously intertwined, a ruthless police detective becomes convinced he has found the murderer. But as the lines blur between innocence and intent, who, in fact, is the real killer?','/hEeuCjUnGFCPdHbHFUUGGsCIrNt.jpg','2016-12-16',96,'Released',NULL,'A Kind of Murder',305943,3.8997,5.374,'12zoi09mRoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35141,_binary '\0','/fLgQ6bf9RKywpZckiEtAPnY3DLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2726560',7.1,95569,'en','The Longest Ride','The lives of a young couple intertwine with a much older man as he reflects back on a lost love while he\'s trapped in an automobile crash.','/qdUVfvPBvT6cetDDM7rn8y2CNZE.jpg','2015-04-09',128,'Released','Two couples. Two love stories. One epic tale.','The Longest Ride',228205,8.9268,7.6,'FUS_Q7FsfqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35142,_binary '\0','/xMvELz6dZs2Hz0ZWZHl3GllxK6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2727028',5,3210,'hi','टोटल सियापा','Aman, a Pakistani man living in London, falls in love with Asha, an Indian woman. But he must convince her parents to let them get married, despite their different nationalities.','/m3xZxCa3Vn2ypE7jXLbLwWmom3U.jpg','2014-03-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Total Siyapaa',255580,1.3023,4.5,'2iCj4qDGNu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35143,_binary '\0','/AneA0sMIzPufIowXnmLTSkvxeJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2728784',3.8,1416,'en','After Darkness','As the Sun burns out, an American family gathers at the end of the world, their hopes for rescue slowly crumbling as they also confront long lasting divides amongst each other.','/yyiHuU6dHKIazMKZhcYabAfUyfo.jpg','2019-01-15',98,'Released','Hope begins at the end of the world','After Darkness',414777,1.6679,4,'vqBYLni44ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35144,_binary '\0','/75rb8oTFVzOHhlL6RX6c