s former colleagues for an important mission, setting him on a dangerous collision course with his own past.','/kk9SmNt6QcP5thvSYELWvO0NWuC.jpg','2024-09-05',183,'Released','A Venkat Prabhu Hero','The Greatest of All Time',1129608,2.0136,4.7,'B5GAjuSnNuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35212,_binary '\0','/2TPoqmatGDfBOiRxqNoL11ncCJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27489557',6.5,124009,'en','Abigail','A group of criminals kidnap a teenage ballet dancer, the daughter of a notorious gang leader, in order to obtain a ransom of $50 million, but over time, they discover that she is not just an ordinary girl. After the kidnappers begin to diminish, one by one, they discover, to their increasing horror, that they are locked inside with no normal little girl.','/5gKKSoD3iezjoL7YqZONjmyAiRA.jpg','2024-04-16',109,'Released','Children can be such monsters.','Abigail',1111873,15.7043,6.647,'3PsP8MFH8p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35213,_binary '\0','/sySusX3ST0L490E7GrHWb5Otyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27489745',6.3,1484,'en','Hannah Gadsby: Something Special','A panicky proposal. A novelty wedding cake. A fateful bunny encounter. Hannah Gadsby shares tales of love and marriage in this feel-good comedy special.','/yuL8xl9XA5RSqTx8RhmDeIin0U1.jpg','2023-05-09',74,'Released','It\'s a feel good show. Seriously.','Hannah Gadsby: Something Special',1112125,1.0697,6.6,'_Bs1F8PRP1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35214,_binary '\0','/lBcXozUeABairkTavz3X3ZAtOL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27490099',7,9156,'fr','L\'Amour ouf','Local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, but gang violence leads him to a darker destructive path. After years apart, the star-crossed lovers discover that every path they\'ve taken leads them back together.','/yu9dRyKcUHTfKcqsomUtpord4t3.jpg','2024-10-16',160,'Released',NULL,'Beating Hearts',959604,6.1938,7.2,'0dZZRNQl2wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35215,_binary '\0','/bB8av9j4BideDSLuDeAreqMJJil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27490380',6.5,2104,'id','13 Bom di Jakarta','An organization races against time to uncover the mastermind behind the placement of 13 bombs in Jakarta before the city falls into chaos.','/7vSfQ5nIjA5c2TB0EMTXCBRwvJG.jpg','2023-12-28',143,'Released','Indonesia\'s Biggest Action Film This Year.','13 Bombs',1126128,1.8324,7,'ijJG00FIfR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35216,_binary '\0','/kIswXWYAvgq3rrloYbRAXdTsgVl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27491225',5.2,3681,'en','Things Will Be Different','In order to escape the police after a robbery, two estranged siblings lay low in a metaphysical farmhouse that hides them away in a different time. There they reckon with a mysterious force that pushes their familial bonds to unnatural breaking points.','/8vpYPns2SjbmgqkE72e69knRMGY.jpg','2024-10-04',102,'Released','Time is not on their side.','Things Will Be Different',1226840,2.0832,5.554,'m4IkQCed2L0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35217,_binary '\0','/jRTscA0zTdpURzXw35aavHLEdaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2749282',6.3,1852,'en','Papa Hemingway in Cuba','In 1959, a young journalist ventures to Havana, Cuba to meet his idol, the legendary Ernest Hemingway who helped him find his literary voice, while the Cuban Revolution comes to a boil around them.','/sUxyoy9hIZWqeNUEEbFByWEHzjf.jpg','2015-11-19',109,'Released','Hemingway\'s Untold Story.','Papa Hemingway in Cuba',389323,1.8032,5.4,'EC130UBgtfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35218,_binary '\0','/guHEM3M773m83506NF6NpCxMEmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2749296',5.5,10699,'en','The Beautiful Risk','William, a respected artist who lost everything after his divorce, arrives in Montreal on a job prospect. When the job falls through he then is saved and forms an erotic friendship and exposes his soul with a young woman named Paulette.','/qRsRE3YQ7jkFSnyQBITGM6HZr8a.jpg','2014-10-23',91,'Released',NULL,'The Beautiful Risk',320538,0.8315,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35219,_binary '\0','/eDXviWshlrhrUskquIREBtFEm8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27496044',4.3,2272,'ml','Vrusshabha','What happens if two sworn enemies from a previous life are reborn as father-son in a new birth?','/hRKxGHeQBdwKswKgkmDrrMCDqoQ.jpg','2025-12-25',127,'Released','Reborn Love : A Love So Strong,It Defies Death','Vrusshabha',1151083,1.3727,0,'sxJ58fkQ8OQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35220,_binary '\0','/oek96LbnelwbyVcvyrRqCwkho8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27496114',6.3,1516,'en','Where Are You, Christmas?','After Addy wishes for a year without Christmas, she wakes up in a black and white world and works with the town mechanic to restore Christmas.','/6j3A3Rnm0SyMuGmROAsUaGb4Klx.jpg','2023-10-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Where Are You, Christmas?',1132390,2.0256,6.3,'Mdg_DdJd4l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35221,_binary '\0','/b5ei2QImsyKJlY63zGBEpQScTDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27496775',6.3,3335,'da','Vogter','Eva, an idealistic prison officer, is faced with the dilemma of her life when a young man from her past gets transferred to the prison where she works. Without revealing her secret, Eva asks to be moved to the young man’s ward – the toughest and most violent in the prison. Here begins an unsettling psychological thriller, where Eva’s sense of justice puts both her morality and future at stake.','/rbNoiXJS3PW1u3geU3VcttBqi6C.jpg','2024-07-10',100,'Released','Who is hiding the bigger monster?','Sons',1113120,3.9901,6.6,'PDVGhfkSn70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35222,_binary '\0','/9aJUVBiHkEa7a5qx3uU6r8g33ZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27497165',5.2,1474,'en','In Cold Light','Fresh out of prison, Ava\'s attempt to reclaim her drug operation collapses when she witnesses a brutal crime, forcing her to flee into a nightmarish underworld where allies are scarce and enemies multiply by the minute.','/rnrrZfFiUIpL00wUh15OBKStnDD.jpg','2026-01-23',96,'Released','Desperate people do dangerous things.','In Cold Light',1128377,4.3209,5.91,'S56o2SOFsIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35223,_binary '\0','/evAN2WIMQPok7XbI5y8j49OEx7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27501039',6.5,23662,'hi','Bloody Daddy','Sumair Azad, a dirty cop and his friend, Jaggi, steal Sikandar Chowdhary\'s cocaine bag. As a result, Sikandar kidnaps Sumair\'s son, but things take a turn when he loses the cocaine bag as he faces off Gurugram’s drug lords, a crime boss, murderous narcs and straight cops on one fateful night.','/gX8k6oKpIsWHpfWNz3Bu4wUuliA.jpg','2023-06-09',122,'Released','One man. One job. One hell of a night.','Bloody Daddy',1014390,1.6702,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35224,_binary '\0','/fz4wnEWbY3V137tlk9T1NbX1xkD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502227',7.6,2760,'pt','Retratos Fantasmas','Downtown Recife’s classic movie palaces from the 20th century are mostly gone. That city area is now an archaeological site of sorts that reveals aspects of life in society which have been lost. And that’s just part of the story.','/aFYGUmC7efpLkHUCbhIBppYiFd8.jpg','2023-08-24',93,'Released','Coming soon to a cinema near you','Pictures of Ghosts',1112548,2.1038,8,'6xjZsMj21Fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35225,_binary '\0','/uXkyaqoc8wgujotPCeUARrqVdOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502250',7.2,2491,'de','Anselm – Das Rauschen der Zeit','This unique cinematic experience dives deep into an artist’s work and reveals his life path, inspiration, and creative process. It explores his fascination with myth and history. Past and present are interwoven to diffuse the line between film and painting, allowing the audience to be completely immersed in the remarkable world of one of the greatest contemporary artists, Anselm Kiefer. Wim Wenders shot this unique portrait over the course of two years in stunning 3D.','/erEJByCPNjwpOk34XAZXQvKEJnJ.jpg','2023-10-12',93,'Released','The sound of time.','Anselm',1112547,2.9561,6.6,'Ye5YU9EaPKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35226,_binary '\0','/tIYjHvP09knUICfApvfG6ft3am9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502360',7.3,1801,'fa','آیه های زمینی','A satirical take on the mundane absurdities of life in modern-day Iran, these nine vignettes illuminate the lighter side of enduring under authoritarian rule. Whether choosing a name for a newborn, graduating from grade school, getting a driver’s license, applying for a job, or seeking approval for a film script, if you live in Iran, you best come fluent in Orwellian discourse.','/bfQkqoPXUrWLxDmt71LYWp5A2uZ.jpg','2023-10-05',77,'Released',NULL,'Terrestrial Verses',1112545,1.2858,7.4,'SRM-kQk6T8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35227,_binary '\0','/dZFrZniwRUlFz56D5zCoC3xaSsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502365',6.4,1613,'ja','首','Lord Oda Nobunaga plans to control Japan where rival warlords battle by waging war against several clans. His vassal Araki Murashige stages a rebellion and promptly disappears.','/DG3B7D0cLx3gmoySAwHVZ6QPeb.jpg','2023-11-23',131,'Released',NULL,'Kubi',795087,2.3291,6.9,'Sfy7-veCsAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35228,_binary '\0','/k7bPM2CFFpJfGgSmY1B9EG9xmnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502426',7.4,4590,'fr','Les Filles d\'Olfa','Between light and darkness stands Olfa, a Tunisian woman and the mother of four daughters. One day, her two older daughters disappear. To fill in their absence, the filmmaker Kaouther Ben Hania invites professional actresses and invents a unique cinema experience that will lift the veil on Olfa and her daughters\' life stories. An intimate journey of hope, rebellion, violence, transmission and sisterhood that will question the very foundations of our societies.','/iSpJ6fg1OOSO30IUkZskZDufVzN.jpg','2023-07-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Four Daughters',1069193,3.6192,7.4,'9sTl3F_qxTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35229,_binary '\0','/AspsIxsgWYlV2hL2WD2FHQo9eVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27502523',6.3,1439,'hi','कैनेडी','An insomniac former cop, Kennedy has been presumed dead for years. Yet, in secret, he continues to serve a corrupt system while seeking redemption. Halfway between thriller and film noir, Kennedy chronicles a violent and bloody vendetta in the dark streets of Mumbai. At the rate of the murders, Kennedy\'s character reveals itself more and more and sinks into a spiral that seems to have no way out.','/oi8PrMckw1zOrkfVxwo0o6h7I27.jpg','2023-05-24',147,'Released','Some ghosts refused to stay buried','Kennedy',1112552,2.04,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35230,_binary '\0','/hjWxngV6tidwDkfJDEgMjHD2KEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27503384',7.9,111761,'ja','PERFECT DAYS','Hirayama is content with his life as a toilet cleaner in Tokyo. Outside of his structured routine, he cherishes music on cassette tapes, books, and taking photos of trees. Through unexpected encounters, he reflects on finding beauty in the world.','/tvUHVSTJV9ITON3oyHaWp7oaAc8.jpg','2023-11-10',124,'Released','In a world of fleeting moments, find the beauty that lasts.','Perfect Days',976893,34.9979,7.824,'HTgWYojq-z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35231,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27510137',8.5,2731,'te','Brahmavaram PS Paridilo','A headless body found near the police station in Brahmmavaram. It follows the mystery of whose body it is, who the killer is, and why the body was left there. What mistake it is and how sometimes mistakes bring Justice ???','/AdJ98GwTs0FzaSn9YCgGz6NQSq5.jpg','2024-08-23',104,'Released',NULL,'Brahmavaram PS Paridilo',1542730,0.8174,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35232,_binary '\0','/vKqru6n1UWyd9469tozlASwJ7vb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27510150',6.1,2059,'ta','டிடி ரிட்டர்ன்ஸ்','Madhi and his friends hides a bag full of money and jewels in a haunted bungalow to ditch the police. When he goes to retrieve the bag, a ghost makes him play a survival game in order to leave with the bag.','/aautnOfweBUF74nmwRI2iSf8VdL.jpg','2023-07-28',125,'Released','Dare Demons','DD Returns',1153886,1.0604,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35233,_binary '\0','/fVV0A67kDjTTQ4CvUn8LoletRmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27510174',6.9,47528,'hi','स्त्री 2: सरकटे का आतंक','Following the events of \'Stree\', the town of Chanderi is being haunted again. This time, women are mysteriously abducted by a terrifying headless entity. Once again, it\'s up to Vicky and friends to save their town and loved ones.','/nfnhwfUEFuSOxxf4jDdBlY6Lccw.jpg','2024-08-15',143,'Released','Sarkatein Ka Aatank','Stree 2',1112426,2.4086,6.7,'VlvOgk5BHS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35234,_binary '\0','/myjVHnn5f1p393JQD2h6gcvmM34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27510257',7.2,7199,'ml','തലവൻ','The intense rivalry between two police officers—CI Jayashankar and SI Karthik takes a dark turn when a body is found in Jayashankar’s house, and he becomes the prime suspect in a murder investigation, which is led by Karthik, adding a layer of tension to their already strained relationship.','/142iirjj2365WQTaXgMrmjC0tng.jpg','2024-05-24',133,'Released',NULL,'Thalavan',1112108,1.0972,6.786,'jhUyy5DdUZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35235,_binary '\0','/ysyhp8PZ8A3FAdQSthLwNkxVJcz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27510455',6.5,1467,'ja','MONDAYS／このタイムループ、上司に気づかせないと終わらない','Akemi Yoshikawa discovers that her whole office is stuck in a time loop, repeating the same stressful work week over and over. Together with her colleagues she has to find out how to break the loop.','/kutBnfxGLMfhqGh5wxpdZ0evuum.jpg','2022-10-14',82,'Released',NULL,'Mondays',1040496,