L,'Life of Riley',255824,1.4538,5.2,'Irrf7HhSHTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35240,_binary '\0','/gnfj8rc8TDszQKrTfz5rFbOYaPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27518776',6.4,1482,'es','Segundo premio','A rock band has to record their third LP, which will either propel them to stardom or fade into oblivion. Despite executives’ reservations, their idea is to have the recording take place in New York. But everything complicates, and the creative process turns into a hellish ordeal. A love triangle with all its consequences unfolds, band members desert, romantic relationships shatter, rehearsals become rampant with drugs and alcohol, and the unbearable pressure from the record label leads to endless fights and arguments only interrupted by fleeting moments of happiness. Meanwhile, unknowingly, they will be composing an album that will leave a mark on an entire generation.','/4NtkEJNctcf2MztNBA6RX4RS9Iw.jpg','2024-05-24',111,'Released',NULL,'Saturn Return',977548,1.3616,5.8,'2GrCnVuIBhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35241,_binary '\0','/pfHvwpKwXeQ7GKD91YFFFBtLLJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27521477',7.2,3079,'ja','名探偵コナン 黒鉄の魚影（サブマリン）','While visiting Hachijo-jima, Conan sneaks aboard a security boat heading to the Pacific Buoy, an off-shore facility constructed near the coasts built to connect surveillance cameras used by police forces around the world. However, an engineer gets abducted! An eerie sound of a propeller hums underwater as a dark figure begins to creep toward Ai Haibara... When the forbidden Black Box is opened, the sealed-away past will surface above the treacherous waves!','/ksQ8uNgoWsVH6a0oPB6zx08pOwU.jpg','2023-04-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Black Iron Submarine',1047041,7.0532,7,'a9YyrgWpcMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35242,_binary '\0','/6NQqojkmxGe3sxs9bNx6Mi9BuOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2752200',6.7,41313,'fr','Jeune & Jolie','Isabelle, a 17-year-old student, loses her virginity during a quick holiday romance. When she returns home, she begins a secret life as a prostitute for a year.','/4RSjzqKIqL5g2OxVIEZQ6ksP1MW.jpg','2013-08-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Young & Beautiful',184314,1.6293,6.51,'mdOlnXTSTw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35243,_binary '\0','/efIliFJKKKALLO31pxLq3WqguC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27524853',6.3,1738,'nl','Witte Wieven','In a medieval Dutch village, a young woman is caught between her faith, fanatic townsfolk and the dark forces lurking in the woods.','/gGStwXLjGe9WaodCCgeVwkDDwS3.jpg','2024-01-25',61,'Released','Prayers won\'t save you.','Heresy',1219739,3.9766,6.2,'4N2JrbBopXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35244,_binary '\0','/vmHJn96rbCfY04lAot87YsJJjHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27525239',4.7,3570,'te','రుద్రంగి','Set during the 1940s, Bheem Rao Deshmukh, a ruthless monarch and womanizer, rules Rudrangi and treats the local people there as his slaves.One day Bheem Rao comes across a woman named Rudrangi, and he falls for her beauty. Bheem Rao badly wants to have a sexual encounter with Rudrangi, and tyrannizes an entire village of Rudrangi fulfill his lust.','/mqls4AP0wQ5x3OjzCfRDUrHVWbd.jpg','2023-07-07',142,'Released',NULL,'Rudrangi',1032302,1.2521,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35245,_binary '\0','/f3VHMqJj9vDv754eeOAlmLrsMS0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27525298',5.7,1359,'ml','ഒരു ജാതി ജാതകം','When a girl, supposedly an expert in palmistry, requests Jayesh to display his hand, he eagerly obliges. But when she tells him that this will be the worst time of his life, it surprises him.','/hELYemcQscoLRRTwml4BK9uYxAy.jpg','2025-01-31',122,'Released',NULL,'Oru Jaathi Jaathakam',1149783,1.2187,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35246,_binary '\0','/dohX75Ie64QZUm5jEkpxHeDo9qM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2752688',6.6,11193,'en','Rosewater','In 2009, Iranian Canadian journalist Maziar Bahari was covering Iran\'s volatile elections for Newsweek. One of the few reporters living in the country with access to US media, he made an appearance on The Daily Show with Jon Stewart, in a taped interview with comedian Jason Jones. The interview was intended as satire, but if the Tehran authorities got the joke they didn\'t like it - and it would quickly came back to haunt Bahari when he was rousted from his family home and thrown into prison.','/wBqskkwzm8evtfdjGsgPx1qypjk.jpg','2014-11-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Rosewater',222649,2.137,6.4,'GGOYHIqmmiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35247,_binary '\0','/93fusVc494JCzYpi9TickKBscqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2752724',7.3,1244,'en','Money for Nothing: Inside the Federal Reserve','Nearly 100 years after its creation, the power of the U.S. Federal Reserve has never been greater. Markets and governments around the world hold their breath in anticipation of the Fed Chairman\'s every word. Yet the average person knows very little about the most powerful - and least understood - financial institution on earth. Narrated by Liev Schreiber, Money For Nothing is the first film to take viewers inside the Fed and reveal the impact of Fed policies - past, present, and future - on our lives. Join current and former Fed officials as they debate the critics, and each other, about the decisions that helped lead the global financial system to the brink of collapse in 2008. And why we might be headed there again.','/9u6isLoLFlmSbEYZ2koTp8wbQYe.jpg','2013-09-06',104,'Released','The first film about the NEXT crisis.','Money for Nothing: Inside the Federal Reserve',221800,1.2708,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35248,_binary '\0','/22qysYEwRuULLU9Ep8IkxPFOUnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2752758',4.2,18605,'en','Devil\'s Due','An unexpected pregnancy takes a terrifying turn for newlyweds Zach and Samantha McCall.','/56zW5kl6b10UNIXpQZTUXV2iygC.jpg','2014-01-08',89,'Released','Not all miracles come from God.','Devil\'s Due',79316,5.0533,4.7,'hjo7iO6Ghtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35249,_binary '\0','/iQY3kJ2oqHqmcSm32xPfkFF4xW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2752772',5.3,68544,'en','Sinister 2','A young mother and her twin sons move into a rural house that\'s marked for death.','/hF6ORyihtAWHqKkIQI8BSpLQyON.jpg','2015-08-19',97,'Released','Some things you can\'t unsee.','Sinister 2',283445,9.2983,5.896,'45zJGfEoUAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35250,_binary '\0','/tBRSSfgqOAq7YlG8udcoJIBm2FG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27530512',4,28125,'kn','ಟಾಕ್ಸಿಕ್','A powerful drug cartel pulls the strings behind a facade of sun-soaked beaches as a gritty, violent underworld power struggle emerges during the crumbling of Portuguese colonial rule.','/tZ8eSBXbza96vzCYeVTG9RBJ78E.jpg','2026-08-26',192,'Released',NULL,'Toxic: A Fairy Tale for Grown-ups',1213243,20.9212,8,'EfluEyQ5QIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35251,_binary '\0','/hyvDUr0OK3JSSU27KcnU2Mvpnuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27531109',6.9,1608,'fr','Le Ravissement','Lydia, a midwife very invested in her work, is in the middle of a breakup.','/evcCra9puM8pkaWUTkYwuCEnb3o.jpg','2023-10-11',97,'Released',NULL,'The Rapture',995757,3.1335,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35252,_binary '\0','/1fL2S8LKxCVE9KoPRBXeagmBtex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27534307',6.8,147889,'en','Speak No Evil','When an American family is invited to spend the weekend at the idyllic country estate of a charming British family they befriended on vacation, what begins as a dream holiday soon warps into a snarled psychological nightmare.','/dA4N6uWOnEMgbxXwFX7qX7adzs8.jpg','2024-09-11',110,'Released','Hear no evil.','Speak No Evil',1114513,18.3976,7.1,'FjzxI6uf8H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35253,_binary '\0','/x9d7iSZNn6LNBzYHbM6x0vhrCPW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27534328',6.9,6834,'ko','귀공자','Han, a Filipino-Korean boxer hits the final punch against his opponent at an illegal game and returns home with a few dollars to pay for his mother\'s surgery.','/pGDT06SpSbhDXlwnEMinKZblmtj.jpg','2023-06-21',118,'Released','The chase is on.','The Childe',1057001,4.8053,7.15,'8gvCPmB4RfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35254,_binary '\0','/5rPKfawUTGbZL23uQlBPJWsMgun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2753778',7.1,4865,'en','The Death of \"Superman Lives\": What Happened?','The Death of \'Superman Lives\': What Happened? feature film documents the process of development of the ill fated \"Superman Lives\" movie, that was to be directed by Tim Burton and star Nicolas Cage as the man of steel himself, Superman. The project went through years of development before the plug was pulled, and this documentary interviews the major filmmakers: Kevin Smith, Tim Burton, Jon Peters, Dan Gilroy, Colleen Atwood, Lorenzo di Bonaventura and many many more.','/oned45Htl78YYkf1ByyodDmLzZ0.jpg','2015-05-01',105,'Released',NULL,'The Death of \"Superman Lives\": What Happened?',279144,2.384,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35255,_binary '\0','/wZB3KwGK0AXSjMrGobiLYQRrGeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27539086',7.1,4388,'ta','800','Muttiah Muralitharan\'s inspirational journey shedding light on the challenges and triumphs that defined his illustrious cricket career is brought together here.','/8IhUIXCoKobODeq3FbTet9gMAfx.jpg','2023-10-06',158,'Released',NULL,'800',752936,1.2397,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35256,_binary '\0','/pDqFksduF0wKgaIuX4KGun1VrIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27540185',8.2,9698,'ta','சித்தா','Easwaran, a young government employee gets the shock of his life when his niece Sundari goes missing. After initially wrongly accused of kidnapping her, he eventually comes to know that a child abuser has kidnapped her and he makes it his mission to rescue Sundari.','/5JdoPaXlLt4fYu2V8Ug12QRiQ89.jpg','2023-09-28',139,'Released',NULL,'Chithha',1115253,1.7178,7.732,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35257,_binary '\0','/16tXEu1C3GCZZ0uPcA91DlWINbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27540217',5.3,13660,'ta','குட் பேட் அக்லி','AK, a powerful gangster, surrenders to the police, in hopes that his wife and son will live a peaceful life. When he is released 17 years later, he learns that his son is falsely accused of serious crimes. To protect him, he is forced to go back to his old ways, facing enemies, both old and new.','/8DbYYluzdiGDAZzsaP7DWGbwfLd.jpg','2025-04-09',139,'Released',NULL,'Good Bad Ugly',1259024,2.3342,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35258,_binary '\0','/q8UyN4XhpmChtneZXdZ8fktQka6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27540542',8,43599,'te','లక్కీ భాస్కర్‌','A middle-class bank clerk who longs to trade stability for adventure gets more than he bargained for when he unexpectedly becomes a wealthy man.','/a47JQFl9L7VDa79tEvnTOJe0rPa.jpg','2024-10-30',151,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Baskhar',1239511,3.5891,7.7,'Kv5RKsqVe-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35259,_binary '\0','/pztQG3jKVQEgf8JZAVKLt885EyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27541778',6.6,1589,'ml','അനോമി','Zaara, a relentless sister seeking answers in her brother\'s unresolved case, confronts a police officer after days of failed investigation. As faith in the system erodes, she pursues the truth on parallel paths, leading to a haunting revelation.','/j0ZLUMdBimCAkblfcaBlrGzzYoq.jpg','2026-02-06',137,'Released',NULL,'Anomie',1309121,2.4588,5.3,'T1KYD7PsOeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35260,_binary '\0','/tZ3yWC0H3HUtIBkxeqyQhaw9EOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27542289',8,13477,'ta','போர் தொழில்','Loganathan, a senior cop is asked to mentor Prakash, an academically bright but faint-hearted rookie and this unlikely duo team up to investigate a series of murder cases, and 