:09.000000','tt27587174',6.3,1424,'sv','Take a Chance','Gert van der Graaf, an infamous stalker, reveals how his childhood crush on Abba superstar Agnetha Fältskog turned into an obsession that shaped the rest of his life, thus showing how compulsive fandom can become criminal obsession.','/7G4oGhna5MHSWxfoSlUvXag5GbA.jpg','2023-05-19',88,'Released',NULL,'Take a Chance',1117736,1.5001,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35284,_binary '\0','/6p0ZlZW4wp7nUOGEZgO6lxyswdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27587485',7.7,2951,'cs','Vlny','At the end of the 1960s, when the air is filled with rock-and-roll and student rebellions are changing the world, the older of two brothers joins a prestigious newsroom of the public radio broadcaster. Not long after, he finds himself in the middle of a dangerous conflict between journalists and the secret service.','/sXxvWOBdWDJwWXmX4nKgQsWLLKC.jpg','2024-08-01',131,'Released','A broadcast that will change history.','Waves',1251621,2.4226,7.4,'pxSeWimkAOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35285,_binary '\0','/5CB1O52TIYCqYuftPQNraWLmMEh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27587529',6.2,1951,'da','Mørkeland','Ulrik Torp, once a fearless investigative journalist who is now tackling unemployment and a midlife crisis. He finds himself in the middle of a new political conspiracy.','/1KCiUkHlRUAzWnYtlHvtWLyeSq0.jpg','2024-08-06',99,'Released',NULL,'Kingmaker',1290697,1.421,6.1,'oKEBRypGSpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35286,_binary '\0','/4JuoO0XywrCDeHLy4kTB9FU5U2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2758880',8,59526,'tr','Kış Uykusu','Aydın is a hotel owner and a retired actor in rural Turkey. As winter emerges he begins navigating the conflicts within the relationships with his wife, sister and existence.','/95j83qOqH3Ivz4RYkaSjGT0VSNr.jpg','2014-06-13',196,'Released',NULL,'Winter Sleep',265169,3.5712,7.523,'zKSLXIjhj-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35287,_bi