21210',4.9,18860,'en','Ice Road: Vengeance','Big rig ice road driver Mike McCann travels to Nepal to scatter his late brother’s ashes on Mt. Everest. While on a packed tour bus traversing the deadly 12,000 ft. terrain of the infamous Road to the Sky, McCann and his mountain guide encounter a group of mercenaries and must fight to save themselves, the busload of innocent travelers, and the local villagers’ homeland.','/cQN9rZj06rXMVkk76UF1DfBAico.jpg','2025-06-27',113,'Released',NULL,'Ice Road: Vengeance',1119878,23.157,6.227,'K6lJh9ADfbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35310,_binary '\0','/wgYx4MwezeoAkRVAJsYdOMAMeWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2762334',5.2,11489,'hi','मैं तेरा हीरो','Seenu loves Sunaina but they\'re chased by a stalking cop, an infatuated beauty and her mafia don dad - can Seenu\'s heroics work?','/bupZH3i1SAaLLC0OgYMSLDZN63Q.jpg','2014-04-04',128,'Released',NULL,'Main Tera Hero',262903,1.8402,5.646,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35311,_binary '\0','/qPJZ1N2JoLggeKUqw8Clo5Pggr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27623406',5.4,2568,'en','I Don\'t Understand You','Stranded in rural Italy without transportation or language skills, an American couple on the verge of adopting tries to reconnect during a disastrous vacation, as their fears and relationship problems threaten to boil over.','/h8bXP9F4fedvmbzXhsrlC1KPoNU.jpg','2024-03-08',96,'Released','Their Italian getaway? They\'re killing it.','I Don\'t Understand You',1229262,3.0535,5.4,'fgXrFNeVwN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35312,_binary '\0','/nhsC7Q1Zb5n2p4H3UKy422zP5XC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2762506',7.3,35425,'pt','Bacurau','Bacurau, a small town in the Brazilian sertão, mourns the loss of its matriarch, Carmelita, who lived to be 94. Days later, its inhabitants notice that their community has vanished from most maps.','/tBa4zMGzZUco26XT3WfZZCwQ76i.jpg','2019-08-29',131,'Released','If you come, come in peace','Bacurau',446159,3.7713,7.6,'LKTejyk9ZIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35313,_binary '\0','/AjYurkrjL3A1D2jD2vyU7dABM9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27626564',6.9,1669,'hi','Chaar Lugaai (चार लुगाई )','Chaar lugaai (चार लुगाई ) follows four women whose husbands work in distant cities, leaving them to find their own ways of dealing with loneliness and desire. Three of them try to get involved with the same young man from the village, while the fourth stands by them without judgment. But when the young man dies in an accident, their private lives suddenly become a serious problem. What starts as an attempt to protect themselves slowly turns into a tense game of lies as a police investigation begins closing in on them.','/ctbnnfZaxAZuoaJWv2wkZnKPqeG.jpg','2023-05-19',121,'Released','Don\'t toss the seed !','Chaar lugaai',1510241,1.5167,4,'xdadvbfRG6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35314,_binary '\0','/xZjnJupgEYI5fDVY9siyiiGKtK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27629220',5.2,2172,'en','Xeno','A teenage girl develops an otherworldly bond with an alien after it crash-lands in the desert. As government agents close in, she must protect her new friend, while uncovering a secret that could change the fate of both their worlds.','/bXJD04oDre4ZiW6CapzBuJyyp4w.jpg','2025-09-19',103,'Released','One bond. Two worlds.','Xeno',1119377,4.0566,6.755,'73mpV0yAz0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35315,_binary '\0','/vkr2KGu10vCHbK1SM5q2AtWA4TM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2762970',6.3,6743,'en','Cloud 9','Set high atop snow-capped mountains in the adrenaline-fueled world of competitive snowboarding, the Disney Channel Original Movie “Cloud 9″ tells the inspiring story of two snowboarders who must overcome self-doubt to learn that achieving their dreams is possible.','/1Pe9r7In5HqKUtwug6T3ZdVWHiG.jpg','2014-01-17',90,'Released','Nothing\'s Impossible.','Cloud 9',245473,3.4744,6.9,'Yx0y7Pq84Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35316,_binary '\0','/rTpNrsyhpOZPqW2qsyNHLxyarvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2763304',7.1,142905,'en','T2 Trainspotting','After 20 years abroad, Mark Renton returns to Scotland and reunites with his old friends Sick Boy, Spud and Begbie.','/xlbpCwa9OXXIiNgXcwuompHFIk9.jpg','2017-01-27',117,'Released','Face your past. Choose your future.','T2 Trainspotting',180863,11.1155,6.933,'EsozpEE543w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35317,_binary '\0','/lKUDtVwq5CXDwFeogS8FTbCQTGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2763790',7,1667,'en','The Wipers Times','When Captain Fred Roberts discovered a printing press in the ruins of Ypres, Belgium in 1916, he decided to publish a satirical magazine called The Wipers Times - \"Wipers\" being army slang for Ypres. Full of gallows humour, The Wipers Times was poignant, subversive and very funny. Produced literally under enemy fire and defying both authority and gas attacks, the magazine proved a huge success with the troops on the western front. It was, above all, a tribute to the resilience of the human spirit in the face of overwhelming adversity. In his spare time, Roberts also managed to win the Military Cross for gallantry.','/pEXhc597WElAatzoAShHqZDDWOd.jpg','2013-09-11',92,'Released','In dark times, they chose to make light','The Wipers Times',220674,1.6103,6.3,'HH9Kvv56AHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35318,_binary '\0','/6w101LGjadxjWjqVBvFFrFjyawo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27640680',6.4,1721,'es','La Dama del Silencio: El caso Mataviejitas','Between 1998 and 2005, a wave of murders targeting elderly women hit Mexico City, triggering the hunt for — and capture — of a most unlikely suspect.','/wB6ez9v9HzSLplIy6m00SPIkuH7.jpg','2023-07-27',111,'Released',NULL,'The Lady of Silence: The Mataviejitas Murders',1142216,1.684,7.68,'ka1zMqnwMSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35319,_binary '\0','/91YPiJcY7q8wwtk958TwlZka3hD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27641085',5.4,2468,'id','Sijjin','Irma falls in love with Galang, her cousin who already has a wife and children. Irma is very obsessed and wants to be the only woman in Galang\'s life. Irma comes to the shaman to send black magic to Galang\'s wife. Since then terror and mystical disturbances, possession and death have occurred in Galang\'s house. However, the threat also targeted Irma herself.','/dnKod1VGfTR44CCvsABd8D0ifVK.jpg','2023-11-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Sijjin',1127087,2.3558,5.5,'WyU4MbsCjYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35320,_binary '\0','/jaIeuFiasQ7KeJntmyNgSHmJEia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2764784',7.3,22484,'de','Phoenix','In the aftermath of WWII, German-Jewish cabaret singer Nelly has to undergo facial reconstructive surgery following her survival from Auschwitz. Without recognising Nelly, her former husband Johnny asks her to help him claim his wife’s inheritance. To see if he\'s betrayed her, she agrees, becoming her own doppelgänger.','/rJuKu5Rpg92AkzyC5rbYbqsNPI9.jpg','2014-09-25',98,'Released','A Gripping Noirish Study of Treachery, Identity and Survival.','Phoenix',254578,3.5027,6.8,'K4yAqUGBBbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35321,_binary '\0','/aMvgLH2BbpEO2a1naJGx9TXabnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27648380',3.6,2526,'mr','Var Padharavo Saavdhan','Siddhant is a news anchor who falls in love with Aanal and they decide to get married. On the day of their engagement, Aanal unexpectedly proposes to Siddhant to move into her fathers house after their marriage. What will Siddhant do?','/2MP0AIXsi6Q39R7lQbgIbvho4yv.jpg','2023-07-07',135,'Released',NULL,'Var Padharavo Saavdhan',1150566,0.4344,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35322,_binary '\0','/fD6a5x95GMNmU04NsUqe0RlNvl8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27651263',6,2431,'nl','Verliefd op Bali','Three women, three generations, one island... an island to fall in love with! 