he caretaker\'s son disrespects age-old traditions, wants to challenge generational ties, and is influenced by the awakening culture.','/uBCkPBJRoNccOFN6RHvgXoesBRu.jpg','2023-06-09',126,'Released',NULL,'O.Baby',1120580,0.8975,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35327,_binary '\0','/n4hNYvzD0xjpYban1aIHuK90L8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27656274',5.9,2206,'te','Anveshi','Anveshi , Starring VijayDharanDatla, SimranGupta, AnanyaNagalla in the lead Roles, Music Composed by ChaitanBharadwaj, Background score by Simon S King, Written Andi Directed by V J Khanna, Produced by T Ganapati Reddy Under the banner of Aruna sree entertainments.','/jktsMp8RTKKbDJW9wo5ICy16Rjg.jpg','2023-11-17',137,'Released',NULL,'Anveshi',1199148,0.5642,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35328,_binary '\0','/9ewYb0LIBJNds8ZMoobKYUd647g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27657135',6.8,40297,'en','Saturday Night','At 11:30pm on October 11, 1975, a ferocious troupe of young comedians and writers changed television forever. This is the story of what happened behind the scenes in the 90 minutes leading up to the first broadcast of Saturday Night Live.','/oCf5O6uxooTvRwKVnLHwGqZUifq.jpg','2024-09-27',109,'Released','The revolution begins at 11:30.','Saturday Night',1120911,6.0863,6.656,'CV16GHIqtGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35329,_binary '\0','/k6NYEpD5QUtyfdRseOxb29b1zi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27657791',6.3,2185,'te','గామి','Shankar is a wounded, reluctant and reclusive aghora on a quest to find the cure for his very rare human condition – the one that will be cured, only when he can confront and conquers the haunting ironical questions of his life.','/nruKcKWmuP7ce7sBGBNViHJaZrZ.jpg','2024-03-08',147,'Released','His Biggest Fear is Human Touch. His Deepest Desire is also, Human Touch.','Gaami',886385,1.0852,6.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35330,_binary '\0','/akTll16NkiPoNrFyg0E7qrj98NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2766104',5.4,1331,'en','Ploey: You Never Fly Alone','A plover chick has not learned to fly when his family migrates in the fall. He must survive the arctic winter, vicious enemies and himself in order to be reunited with his beloved one next spring.','/pQIKecVvsEEexALNuyPj9q4JmSN.jpg','2018-03-30',83,'Released',NULL,'Ploey: You Never Fly Alone',506596,5.222,6.084,'42GfRs9er68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35331,_binary '\0','/p8rcQU2QSr0Dw78WjYLULqBjkoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2766268',5.6,1568,'es','El inventor de juegos','Young Ivan Drago\'s newfound love of board games catapults him into the fantastical and competitive world of game invention, and pits him against the inventor Morodian, who has long desired to destroy the city of Zyl, founded by Ivan\'s grandfather. To save his family and defeat Morodian, Ivan must come to know what it is to be a true games maker.','/5X2IqHXicO3miUlenOdnGhZWnn2.jpg','2014-07-03',112,'Released','Make your move','The Games Maker',262788,2.2098,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35332,_binary '\0','/33S0Ie8izrclNs9qn3VJAYoD7ro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27664022',5.1,2172,'kn','ವೃತ್ತ','Vritta centers on siddharth a quiet, withdrawn man whose life takes a dark and twisted turn after one impulsive decision.One night. One unexpected phone call. One wrong turn. And that’s all it takes to spiral into the unknown. What begins as a simple night drive unravels into something far more disturbing — a haunting journey through isolation, guilt, and fractured realities. As the silence deepens and the night stretches on, siddharth finds himself trapped in a circle he can’t escape. A circle called vritta.','/oNPao9volH0jAA1jULlQ6hCOmAe.jpg','2025-08-01',113,'Released',NULL,'Vritta',1520294,0.6892,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35333,_binary '\0','/cxcS2pce34TTgm1r5VJGlC5Fenk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27664183',4.9,1289,'te','The Story of a Beautiful Girl','Lovable girl with big dreams vanishes, triggering media frenzy and investigation. What happened to her? Mystery unfolds as search for answers begins. After her disappearance, the girl\'s loved ones and the public are left to wonder.','/20650cErzJqyu4LFfcxt0kfXtuQ.jpg','2023-05-12',132,'Released',NULL,'The Story of a Beautiful Girl',1127506,0.8659,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35334,_binary '\0','/fdIxr2vzEypp0nC2bWiGg2jCLPl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27665778',7.1,1931,'en','Horizon: An American Saga - Chapter 2','Explore the lure of the Old West and how it was won—and lost—through the blood, sweat and tears of many. Spanning 15 years before, during, and following the Civil War, from 1859 to 1874, embark on an emotional journey across a country at war with itself, experienced through the lens of families, friends and foes all attempting to discover what it truly means to be the United States of America.','/2Ot7mpKYgqZfkGRaeV2kaHqKFkS.jpg','2024-09-07',190,'Released','The American saga begins this summer.','Horizon: An American Saga - Chapter 2',1120368,4.2332,6.8,'X5yOSu4R2ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35335,_binary '\0','/kYvei8iNz1CQVMQeC7O6XZSqtz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27671386',7.7,2191,'en','Maruva Tarama','At a Goa restaurant, Anvi meets a naval officer for arranged marriage talks. Though beautiful and from a wealthy family, she hides a secret - her heart belongs to another. She declines his proposal.','/u8bDUD6bK3hTfVPgftCBIobU4R2.jpg','2025-11-28',112,'Released',NULL,'Maruva Tarama',1636925,1.218,0,'tx-uMz6p_KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35336,_binary '\0','/oU9WaOwdaxmO6HDKKVf5O3GnrO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27671792',6.1,1320,'hi','विजय 69 (Vijay 69)','An adventurous, foul-mouthed former swimming coach reaches for record-breaking glory when he attempts a triathlon at 69 years old.','/tSQzRaYyKEjM8gEyhqayU4rhbdU.jpg','2024-11-08',112,'R