uried secrets and face the truth about the sacrifices and choices they made.','/beLZhuHT97849WkWgty2X1hkWUa.jpg','2025-05-01',88,'Released','You can\'t escape the curse.','Rosario',1297028,4.1937,5.5,'0S0me9gHK00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35341,_binary '\0','/1nn7nCFRTKeWOXbtjrFxfSvf1EI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27674982',7.4,25881,'en','The Ballad of Wallis Island','An eccentric lottery winner who lives alone on a remote island tries to make his fantasies come true by getting his favourite musicians to perform at his home.','/haS6bnqDqZoi5sYcCPJWaj2yMbB.jpg','2025-03-28',100,'Released','He\'s getting the band back together.','The Ballad of Wallis Island',1122099,4.2912,7.275,'GjbVZWVWzPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35342,_binary '\0','/qtSY2SAL5QApuCUD0sXqyzgHYnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27675583',5,3554,'nl','Bad Boa\'s','When an overeager community officer and a reckless ex-detective are forced to team up, plenty of chaos ensues on the streets of Rotterdam.','/7bcndiaTgu1Kj5a6qyCmsWYdtI.jpg','2025-07-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Almost Cops',1374534,8.9918,5.892,'QsMBhTskZC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35343,_binary '\0','/5yZIKAPCjqm8t2r19vlzuasxbOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27676959',4.4,1496,'en','Lazareth','Lee is an aunt whose life mission is to protect her orphaned nieces, Imogen and Maeve, from a self-destructing world, raising them in isolation until an outsider threatens their peaceful existence.','/36o8ancoKDKW1sstzMi0YYkQkpU.jpg','2024-05-10',86,'Released','Lazareth must be protected at any cost.','Lazareth',1123278,2.7085,6,'N_kZ6P1Rhz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35344,_binary '\0','/l6KeC0gjFtEDDthUo5eVlOxDcEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27678883',6.7,6295,'hi','Controll','Abhimanyu, a brilliant IMA cadet\'s seemingly perfect life is shattered when his friend cum brother-in-law commits suicide. Abhimanyu wants to find out who or what drove Dev to suicide, but the more he tries to find out, the more he gets trapped in the intricate web. He learns that Dev was scammed by an organised network. He vows to unmask the organisation that had trapped and scammed Dev. How Abhimanyu and his IMA friends dismantle the scammer\'s network and bring justice to thousands of people forms the rest of this stylish, action-packed, thrilling adventure.','/x4D59ZzGcaROt2ZGtSNCsvslM8F.jpg','2025-10-10',116,'Released',NULL,'Controll',1561205,1.5756,3,'1GEdtPL6Vnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35345,_binary '\0','/rr3eD3DFxaKG7LFZBa2aKxMqueI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27679443',6.2,1538,'en','Reading Lolita in Tehran','In 1979, amidst censorship and religious extremism, a revolutionary literature professor in Tehran gathers seven of her most dedicated female students to immerse themselves in banned literary classics.','/69WQXk3Omh0IKles3Pcmlhvo3En.jpg','2024-11-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Reading Lolita in Tehran',1096846,3.4682,7.3,'11FiYgU71UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35346,_binary '\0','/5PbtDm52osa3WvW9BDIePxlvaoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2767948',6.2,3867,'it','Benvenuto Presidente!','In a small mountain village lives a man with a challenging name, Giuseppe Garibaldi (one of Italy\'s \"fathers of the fatherland\"), but everybody call him with the nickname Peppino. Love fishing, the company of friends, the library where he works as a precarious employee. He is an optimistic person even if his child accuse him of being a wannabe. One day, due to a mess of politicians, an amazing thing happens: Peppino is mistakenly elected President of the Italian Republic. Pulled out from his quiet life, is to play a role for which he knows he is obviously inappropriate, but his common sense and his instinctive gestures are incredibly effective, except for the etiquette, for which he is in trouble. The inflexible and fascinating Deputy Secretary General of the Presidency of the Republic, Janis Clementi, is anxious to no avail in an attempt to regulate the unpredictable actions of the President...','/gDs0UPzIeqUgYL0qIaWepJ7Uk9v.jpg','2013-03-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Welcome Mr. President!',178915,1.6784,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35347,_binary '\0','/ydFtw0hbwozGyW72kw3A0uWCiW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27679608',6.1,20547,'hi','फ़तेह','Ex-Special Ops officer Fateh Singh springs back to action when a girl falls prey to a cybercrime syndicate. Racing against time, can he bring down the mafia?','/cw8DitAELYtWSD1P8yd0hzufVHj.jpg','2025-01-10',131,'Released','Never underestimate a nobody','Fateh',955496,1.9255,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35348,_binary '\0','/uaB1DimUo578ETyDsfturtmUZbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2768084',7.1,1950,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太のひみつ道具博物館','Doraemon and his friends travel to the 22nd century to look for his golden bell, which was stolen by a notorious thief called Kaito DX.','/2GdSk2j7pbuEnuyJibH7YLKHwos.jpg','2013-03-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita\'s Secret Gadget Museum',218726,4.8852,6.5,'TsU4W_xMrFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35349,_binary '\0','/qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27681354',6.3,43846,'en','In the Grey','A covert team of elite operatives are living in the shadows. When a ruthless despot steals a billion-dollar fortune, they\'re sent to take it back—an impossible heist that erupts into a deadly game of strategy, deception and survival.','/dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg','2026-05-13',97,'Released','When billions get stolen, meet the pros who steal it back.','In the Grey',1122573,37.1792,7.573,'nufP15iN4GE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35350,_binary '\0','/n3JeGELHa9V6k9mL81ItMxWLSS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27682129',3.7,4139,'en','Prey','A young couple is compelled to leave their Christian missionary station in the K