00000','tt27757690',7,3765,'te','జీబ్రా','Surya is a street-smart bank employee, in a bid to protect his loved one, gets entangled in a complex multi-crore scam. He must do whatever it takes to prove his innocence.','/rCGgmmMD63pKH7lnmVJ5MMLQfOm.jpg','2024-11-22',164,'Released','Luck Favors The Brave','Zebra',1035998,0.8656,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35405,_binary '\0','/7jFpkdhPn1s7tc7S71wR64qpVWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27757805',5,19677,'hi','बेबी जॉन','John\'s peaceful life with daughter Khushi is disrupted by a sex-trafficking gang. Revealing his past as DCP Satya, he seeks revenge for his family\'s murder, saving minor girls and punishing the criminals, before starting anew.','/5Oqsh17dq0cIRFPynPNy5elmyxW.jpg','2024-12-25',162,'Released',NULL,'Baby John',1083241,2.437,6,'lVjieoMPN-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35406,_binary '\0','/cS9J8ZDj9OPqwylrRRBbDvX6Zh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2776074',6.1,2007,'fr','Angélique','The incredible destiny of Angélique: a beautiful girl who found in her love for Joffrey Peyrac the strength to fight injustice and submission in a century plagued by power struggles, inequality and the oppression.','/vLnWjVLuf5IK4SZcn9VPgkWlmaO.jpg','2013-12-18',112,'Released',NULL,'Angélique',222230,2.9343,6.5,'A6cFA0u5_Io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35407,_binary '\0','/lRD9eJmoGl46I1q97otA3zvFU23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2776106',6.3,3441,'pl','Płynące wieżowce','Kuba attends an art opening with his girlfriend of two years and bumps into Mikal. The connection between these two young men is instantaneous and intoxicating, and despite opposition from all sides, he allows Mikal into his life. The results go beyond anything he could have imagined. This intimate and bold second feature from Polish director Tomasz Wasilewski captures the often-complicated consequences of finding love where others do not want it.','/igRklNw4dMSooyJGW88DcaW3wTh.jpg','2013-11-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Floating Skyscrapers',174372,1.2935,5.8,'_oSoBh7_i-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35408,_binary '\0','/miFiBFHoWBi9wMg527arqhFAOlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2776344',7.2,7451,'th','พี่มาก..พระโขนง','Mak\'s friends just want to protect him, but his wife Nak won\'t let a small thing like her own death get in the way of true love.','/5gY0EPvTdeGjEEIQ7337ZxHXV55.jpg','2013-03-28',112,'Released','The legendary love story of pee mak and his ghost wife nak.','Pee Mak',184219,3.5001,7.207,'B9xbj_UK1pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35409,_binary '\0','/fnWwohqskLftnFZ49ibiofzo1qo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27766440',6.6,7759,'en','The Salt Path','The profound story of husband and wife Raynor and Moth Winn, who embark on a 630-mile trek after being forcibly removed from their home. Hoping that in nature they will find solace and a sense of acceptance, they walk through the beautiful but rugged coastlines of South West England - a journey that is exhilarating, challenging, and liberating in equal measure. THE SALT PATH is a powerful portrayal of home, and how it can be lost and rediscovered in the most unexpected ways.','/yBtmFkjzPzd6KvNgoJwwsm1nyXL.jpg','2025-05-01',115,'Released','Life. One step at a time.','The Salt Path',1127625,18.1944,6.7,'TK5j6lQk7CE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35410,_binary '\0','/xvUHdXIqRBOdjdebWPWBHTEQ6p7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27766538',6.7,3718,'it','La città proibita','The son of an indebted restaurant owner joins a foreign girl in search of her sister. Together, they’ll have to fight side by side against the most ruthless members of the Roman criminal underworld.','/44ifThrLAZQST7OTcibqTwNuDA5.jpg','2025-03-08',138,'Released','Vengeance is her destiny.','The Forbidden City',1127674,4.1456,6.9,'E02CbJ9dCQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35411,_binary '\0','/156zFVuXIUUZ3hhUbS7CiYRvwpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2776878',6.6,17469,'en','Thank You for Your Service','A group of U.S. soldiers returning from Iraq struggle to integrate back into family and civilian life, while living with the memory of a war that threatens to destroy them long after they\'ve left the battlefield.','/z8OKWw6DAZAOyz8F421euawr3Hs.jpg','2017-10-26',109,'Released','For your courage. For your love. For your sacrifice.','Thank You for Your Service',347629,5.2796,6.6,'GTl5SHYJxz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35412,_binary '\0','/yzgTMSFkhMdCG1VtMnChGI6rKxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27773954',5.6,3013,'en','The Thing with Feathers','Following the death of his wife, a young father\'s hold on reality crumbles, and a strange presence begins to stalk him from the shadowy recesses of the apartment he shares with his two young sons.','/j3kM0tMW7EQaOrit0JW9NvoPPrp.jpg','2025-10-17',99,'Released',NULL,'The Thing with Feathers',1127628,4.9426,6.4,'13xzmFy2z8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35413,_binary '\0','/gEWw5gy1i2jhXthQulNiGAWtB1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27774999',5.7,1656,'en','Bonjour Tristesse','At the height of summer, 18-year-old Cécile is relaxing by the French seaside with her father and falling in love with her new boyfriend. The arrival of her late mother\'s enigmatic friend turns her world upside down.','/bHqkaTLL1aPcpMzbvu8kFckEpi.jpg','2025-03-13',111,'Released',NULL,'Bonjour Tristesse',1127648,3.7665,6.1,'hgd4fHW3loM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35414,_binary '\0','/dAeubkAjzTCoP3VFFxu0Btm4mFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27775403',5.7,9388,'en','Riff Raff','A retired hitman\'s life is turned upside down when his ex-wife and son arrive unannounced during the holidays because they are on the run from his former mob associates.','/xPSur71bxvFVdQ6RdKv0yaVKT2n.jpg','2025-02-27',103,'Released','Crime is a family affair.','Riff Raff',1127767,5.5534,5.754,'2UleI__TC04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35415,_binary '\0','/88D5pSq2BRckkV1fjkGzyUjZTAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2778674',6.9,2892,'ta','பத்ரி','Badri (Vijay) is a troublemaker and a source of heartburn for his father (Kitty). So the father pins his hopes on his elder son, Vetri (Riyaz Khan), to win the kickboxing championship. Janu (Bhumika Chawla), Badri\'s neighbour, is in love with him but it is just one-sided as Badri considers her a good friend and a source of money (and since her dad is a garage owner, his gateway to new cars to impress the other girls). He falls in love with Mamathi (Monal), a rich girl, and poses as a rich guy to impress her. But he soon realises his mistakes and when his brother becomes bedridden, he decides to redeem himself in his father\'s eyes by fighting in the championship match. He finally redeems himself by defeating his opponent and at the same time, accepts Janu\'s love.','/vywiSMBCsnXyWTwSD5KcYKkviYM.jpg','2001-04-16',160,'Released',NULL,'Badri',69653,1.1295,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35416,_binary '\0','/feWZmzNPLrJo0cBy5ORlGeMkaJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27788968',7.2,2983,'hu','Magyarázat mindenre','It’s summer in Budapest, high school student Abel is struggling to focus on his final exams, whilst coming to the realisation that he is hopelessly in love with his best friend Janka. The studious Janka has her own unrequited love with married history teacher Jakab—who had a previous confrontation with Abel’s conservative father. The tensions of a polarised society come unexpectedly to the surface when Abel’s history graduation exam turns into a national scandal.','/dIof786gtEiJjAGBxrAaxDrWnCU.jpg','2023-10-05',151,'Released',NULL,'Explanation for Everything',1075989,2.1185,6.8,'O9jDHRf2gUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35417,_binary '\0','/fhnIYFqIiPu2nPjCbX7a4qn93bU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27789180',6.5,3215,'sv','Hypnosen','André and Vera are a young entrepreneurial couple. They get the opportunity to pitch their female health app at a prestigious competition. Before going there, Vera tries hypnotherapy to quit smoking. From this point, her attitude changes and André starts to behave unexpectedly.','/5e0lbHdHd33FTjsutp9p2oyazLZ.jpg','2024-03-08',100,'Released',NULL,'The Hypnosis',1005972,2.3626,6.4,'3mWglWbcPfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35418,_binary '\0','/yPc9aqsKKMJty4KmwrdxKFRiBtf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27791865',5.2,2047,'en','Amy Schumer: Emergency Contact','Amy Schumer gets real about lasering her face, postpartum sex, her baby-naming disaster and chewable Viagra in this cheekily candid stand-up special.','/yi3rC99fntOrrdX3Dg54cM5cKK6.jpg','2023-06-12',51,'Released',NULL,'Amy Schumer: Emergency Contact',1128612,1.743,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35419,_binary '\0','/kGP3hLDNQLEp2E8xCwnWuXQ68eH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27791972',4.8,4192,'en','Outbreak','A State Park Ranger and his wife, grappling with the disappearance of their teenage son, face a mysterious outbreak that threatens not only their relationship, but in the end, their grip on reality.','/86veNrARvGRyBRiGT94Lxpy5Z4S.jpg','2025-02-20',88,'Released','It starts as an infection. It ends in devastation.','Outbreak',1217585,3.3318,5.8,'xSt_vQS7-18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35420,_binary '\0','/ewlNu82GwEI0PKeEEGL0dU5dMb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27795356',6.6,1980,'ko','비공식작전','In Beirut 1986, during the Lebanese civil war a Korean diplomat is taken hostage without a trace. Two years pass and long forgotten, a young diplomat Min-jun receives a phone call proving that the hostage is still alive. With the given mission, Min-jun is sent to Beirut to save the hostage with a bag of ransom money.','/yTyi44d1dcX5CiQrIQPkeydqTfS.jpg','2023-08-02',132,'Released','Two men. Bag of money. No support.','Ransomed',581395,2.8612,6.664,'XRxSpCJaKcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35421,_binary '\0','/csCeW5q2iIdTWQ76Mc10hv3PpUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27795377',6.1,2245,'ta','காதலிக்க நேரமில்லை','Does the idea of a perfect life leading to love, marriage and babies exist? Shriya finds it a challenge, especially when she meets men like Siddarth who think marriage is a recipe for disaster, and babies should be banned. When times are changing and relationships are evolving, the idea of love remains timeless- the more you resist it the more you will fall in love.','/nSgPlMtvKJGyiUivXDRGANUyP5v.jpg','2025-01-14',143,'Released',NULL,'Kadhalikka Neramillai',1211999,1.3849,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35422,_binary '\0','/puH2BKhG0bPzK3Oxg4QB93C0i8Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27795526',7.1,1527,'en','High & Low – John Galliano','Fashion designer John Galliano was widely recognized as one of the most successful names in 1990s and 2000s couture, until his career abruptly ended when he was caught on camera in 2011 hurling antisemitic and racist insults at bystanders in Paris.','/x9wmCRczb3iGrWGqnxyIPdJDQfp.jpg','2024-03-08',116,'Released',NULL,'High & Low – John Galliano',1129123,2.8228,6.1,'BLfmrzrCqZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35423,_binary '\0','/vYu0TDdMeDJs4T1sJaxI98WQ4t4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27796126',6.4,3211,'en','Islands','In this twisty thriller, a tennis coach at a tropical resort finds himself at the center of a missing persons mystery. Tom teaches tennis during the day and parties at night. When an enigmatic tourist arrives, Tom is unable to shake the feeling he has met her before. Tension and attraction grow, until her husband disappears, and the police suspect Tom.','/mnNYETN1kxmf3DbUSDTGGaUBEHs.jpg','2025-05-08',123,'Released',NULL,'Islands',1128547,2.1238,6.155,'MifpmLyraBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35424,_binary '\0','/kYWk8TW5TkpCWkB0mkUm72N0lb8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27802490',6.9,31096,'ko','파묘','After tracing the origin of a disturbing supernatural affliction to a wealthy family\'s ancestral gravesite, a team of paranormal experts relocates the remains—and soon discovers what happens to those who dare to mess with the wrong grave.','/6dasJ58GGFcC62H9KuukAryltUp.jpg','2024-02-22',134,'Released','The vicious emerges.','Exhuma',838209,10.554,7.7,'BLPprtcADkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35425,_binary '\0','/7h62JtLPbyAqvPggtVjahPLUjG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27802912',6.5,5882,'ta','ஏஸ்','Kannan, with a past comes to Malaysia to turn over a new leaf. But when he realises that the girl he loves needs money to get out of a difficult situation, he commits a robbery that makes him the target of a fearsome gangster and the girl’s stepfather, an immoral cop.','/8N9ET0MxfaYi1R2a8my0x3JCAxW.jpg','2025-05-23',154,'Released',NULL,'Ace',1132152,1.242,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35426,_binary '\0','/yXwJzc6beR82pg6R3BMaurH4lwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27804164',6.4,1696,'nl','Julie zwijgt','As the star player at an elite tennis academy, Julie’s life revolves around the game she loves. When her coach falls under investigation and is suddenly suspended, all of the club’s players are encouraged to speak up. But Julie decides to keep quiet...','/HscPMTxowVUG4I20uWEdnD3PaT.jpg','2024-10-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Julie Keeps Quiet',1187308,2.9067,6.103,'E6PxvQCECmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35427,_binary '\0','/apMl96DIrewME0s87rP733yb37Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811009',4.5,2896,'en','Monster on a Plane','An exotic animal turns into a monster and becomes a deadly danger for all passengers.','/9fBcq5WiH3z4YGjS2iVESRKxcW4.jpg','2024-11-07',88,'Released',NULL,'Monster on a Plane',1270125,3.3981,4.962,'xTlBOhtlSx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35428,_binary '\0','/mO9oOVXM8tTlC11VFM4FBBNnL3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811040',6.6,7226,'ko','범죄도시 4','\'Monster Cop\' Ma Seok-do investigates an illegal online gambling business led by a former STS Baek and an IT genius CEO Chang. Ma proposes an unexpected alliance to Jang and begins hunting down the criminals.','/kfdVbOzwsKy65eaizDnBfxAJ95p.jpg','2024-04-24',109,'Released','Time for the ultimate wipeout.','The Roundup: Punishment',1017163,8.254,7.23,'F_fxEAMv7ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35429,_binary '\0','/1umiZBQ6oUbyKATwyxAVRlDELnd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811096',6.8,1499,'fr','Le Roman de Jim','Aymeric runs into Florence, a former coworker, one evening in Saint-Claude in the Haut-Jura. She is six months pregnant and single. When she gives birth to Jim, Aymeric is there. They spend happy years together until Christophe, Jim\'s biological father, shows up... It could be the start of a melodrama, it\'s also the start of an odyssey into fatherhood.','/tUqCflwDzyPwmv8J5rUrVLoQUY.jpg','2024-08-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Jim\'s Story',1102938,2.2135,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35430,_binary '\0','/wAow3w58FGNdWUMpPdddOtnM3A0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811248',6.4,3110,'de','Le assaggiatrici','In autumn 1943, in Gross-Partsch, 26-year-old Rosa, who had come from Berlin to stay with the parents of her husband Gregor, who was fighting on the Russian front, was taken by the SS to a mysterious place. Forced to taste a dish, she joins the group of tasters responsible for checking that the food destined for Hitler is not poisoned.','/j1BMHOfmEARIPeJr32GAyROaFlj.jpg','2025-03-27',123,'Released','Every meal could be their last.','The Tasters',1291712,4.0724,6.6,'DasVReZy2N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35431,_binary '\0','/iOIc1rD53iF5D5y5pVGEs8uUTVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811632',7.3,3569,'de','Silent Friend','In the heart of a botanical garden in a medieval university town in Germany stands a majestic ginkgo tree. This silent witness has observed over a century the quiet rhythms of transformation across three human lives. At three distinct moments across the 20th and 21st centuries, these people — each carrying their own questions and inner struggles — inevitably find themselves drawn into the presence of this tree, full of mystery and meaning.','/mZjkRpTFfcdsTmtIAzKVM87I94R.jpg','2026-01-15',147,'Released',NULL,'Silent Friend',1168719,7.3212,7.2,'72SfEyxoZrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35432,_binary '\0','/dMbTVD7ylqa9p7o0QN7bCoPZeGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27811640',7.3,1267,'hu','Véletlenül írtam egy könyvet','Nina loves to make up stories, she wants to become a writer. Though she has her creative talent from her filmmaker father, there’s just one problem: Her clumsy magician brother Junior is bored of her stories. And since her mother died early, it’s difficult for Nina when a new love comes into her dad’s life. With the guidance of a bohemian writer next door, Nina uses writing to process the loss of her mother and open her heart to a new family member and first love. And suddenly, Nina realizes, her life is becoming a novel!','/yvxn795NbOeFpKTGVAaGIvT95s3.jpg','2025-01-30',98,'Released',NULL,'I Accidentally Wrote a Book',1142501,2.0658,6.9,'suqQOjGG_eU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35433,_binary '\0','/gsQJOfeW45KLiQeEIsom94QPQwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27812086',5.2,17302,'en','Cleaner','When a group of radical activists take over an energy company\'s annual gala, seizing 300 hostages, an ex-soldier turned window cleaner suspended 50 storeys up on the outside of the building must save those trapped inside, including her older brother.','/mwzDApMZAGeYCEVjhegKvCzDX0W.jpg','2025-02-19',97,'Released','The stakes are a thousand feet high.','Cleaner',1125899,6.5109,6.6,'4KIOLMv2ItI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35434,_binary '\0','/iuW4CPRcaTZzTRDr8iLg2KYdKCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27813235',5.9,22433,'en','The Surfer','A man returns to the idyllic beach of his childhood to surf with his son. When he is humiliated by a group of locals, the man is drawn into a conflict that keeps rising and pushes him to his breaking point.','/gm9Ou0dkxhb1vcrkB6uRhoifcHC.jpg','2025-04-11',100,'Released','Don\'t live here, don\'t surf here.','The Surfer',1128655,8.4503,5.725,'A7Bo6cyfWho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35435,_binary '\0','/tWg0atZFVFPKPuqzzely3dABPF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27813285',6.2,1408,'en','Mystic Christmas','During the holidays, Juniper reconnects with the owner of the pizza shop in to Mystic, Connecticut, where she\'s working at the rehabilitation center and aquarium.','/nYKLBXEOPfw2UK1FPLeIcrJgVji.jpg','2023-10-28',84,'Released','Love gets a seal of approval','Mystic Christmas',1142715,1.7292,5.6,'hWwYxn7kKaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35436,_binary '\0','/hbSUc2PM1UWBP5wefqsms7hAwXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2781516',5.6,8238,'en','WolfCop','It\'s not unusual for alcoholic cop Lou to black out and wake up in unfamiliar surroundings, but lately things have taken a turn for the strange...and hairy. WolfCop is the story of one cop\'s quest to become a better man. One transformation at a time.','/kOhgErWiWKX2yg4xEXfG2yTFti5.jpg','2014-06-06',79,'Released','Here Comes The Fuzz','WolfCop',262840,2.4552,5.229,'f_P4C8x9S28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35437,_binary '\0','/fO29Ccn3GT3FX3jCzXZNcG8ZqkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27816710',6.6,5463,'ml','എബ്രഹാം ഓസ്ലർ','The story revolves around the personal and professional lives of veteran cop Abraham Ozler, ACP Trichur, who at one time has to take up a serial killing case and the mysterious hunt begins','/rBFEad9Yp2LtZNKsEbmWKruOOP2.jpg','2024-01-11',144,'Released',NULL,'Abraham Ozler',1184247,1.3059,6.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35438,_binary '\