ch Zafer, Gazanfer finds the solution by asking for help from an old friend. This time, the Mermer family will have to make one last heist to reunite with their children.','/pxdmeAKAjeoMIPBrhgULHAZct60.jpg','2023-12-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Mortal World 2',1137064,1.4272,5.974,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35517,_binary '\0','/nKXnqssHmh6miZU3jyG5Mz1jpQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2793490',6,24388,'en','Starry Eyes','A hopeful young starlet uncovers the ominous origins of the Hollywood elite and enters into a deadly agreement in exchange for fame and fortune.','/t1sIumVCl91XThMoJqUjpERYeAM.jpg','2014-07-29',96,'Released','She would kill to be famous.','Starry Eyes',254194,2.6144,6.1,'J6eayrT26l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35518,_binary '\0','/nffhhbdrEvIXPJCt30JqA0jWbuv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27935495',7.6,1319,'zh','我们一起摇太阳','A young woman who needs a kidney transplant wants to marry someone who will be able to donate a kidney, and meets a young man who has a brain disease.','/neJkXriBWdkND9YMviujP2Ni8bx.jpg','2024-02-10',129,'Released',NULL,'Viva La Vida',1212009,2.0969,7.6,'5fX6nP4ou4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35519,_binary '\0','/yrO8MHXReLdvKhf1qtSjSrpm7gE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27936770',7.2,7719,'hi','भक्षक','A struggling local journalist begins a dogged investigation into harrowing cases of abuse being covered up at a shelter for young girls.','/2eCELoyf0l3njFKfn3oddo3JaRG.jpg','2024-02-08',134,'Released','A story that must be told.','Bhakshak',1227136,2.0433,7.233,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35520,_binary '\0','/loPDNyjCZItCEDYFHjg9Vn8dhFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2793930',7.1,4069,'ta','மரியான்','The film is an emotional journey of a common man to an unknown place with the hope to come home and lead a better life. The film revolves around a story of human survival adapted from a newspaper article of a real-life crisis event, when three oil workers from India were kidnapped and taken hostage in Sudan.','/f7bIwoSW7B55n2UJqg0z9pYK9aT.jpg','2013-07-19',145,'Released',NULL,'Maryan',191805,1.4247,6.043,'zB4b_7ddiLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35521,_binary '\0','/vFkZh28i2UkLFTSnvNbybe90HcX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27940347',5.1,6248,'hi','RIWAJ','Riwaj is a powerful and thought-provoking drama that highlights the struggles of women caught in the grip of oppressive traditions. At its core is Zainab (Myraa Sareen), a courageous woman who refuses to be a victim of triple talaq. Stripped of her dignity and abandoned by the law, she is left to fend for herself in a society that seeks to silence her. But instead of succumbing to despair, she rises-challenging deep-rooted injustices and fighting for her rights, freedom, and identity.','/gjMsJM64RHVpZ0MWHJmLB8Gcv1T.jpg','2025-03-07',130,'Released','Riwaj is a compelling and hard-hitting drama that delves into the struggles of women trapped in the shackles of oppressive traditions.','RIWAJ',1449539,0.5383,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35522,_binary '\0','/wZpQkvbhNPFaQUnnf4n75x4ugiq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27940442',6.1,11593,'hi','Blackout','Lenny, a crime reporter, makes a life-altering choice to pocket a case of stolen jewels to transform his mundane life. However, his good fortune takes a turn for the worse when he gets entangled with a big gangster. How will he get out of this mess?','/3na9yLIz6j2Q44dzMEHWeSDg4Ef.jpg','2024-06-07',116,'Released',NULL,'Blackout',1248965,1.3773,5.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35523,_binary '\0','/m59RdlL8pSDzRUuYq28yuWL4Re6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2794596',4.8,2522,'tr','El-Cin','A group of friends were haunted respectively with a supernatural forces due to their faulty deed against a little snake.','/rgAQcvMeDgfPFzdqlsrcvckh9Qi.jpg','2013-04-05',96,'Released',NULL,'The Jinn',343775,1.6614,4.893,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2