to bring her there after he’s settled down, a Chinese woman sets out on a journey to be reunited with him.','/vRUsEXHm9iJgXuf8k4BiTLCnUb0.jpg','2024-11-22',111,'Released','A film over 20 years in the making.','Caught by the Tides',1136837,2.5775,6.7,'ZbsAxSWwgd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35528,_binary '\0','/lMcqdjzULJqJpyKnvRBwWhvJMQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2796318',6.1,2962,'hi','Mickey Virus','When Delhi Police comes across an unusual case revolving around hacking they seek help of an expert who thinks like them only to come across a lazy hacker Mickey Arora.','/5FKtKKCmprBQ2sGrCclmVQ1hjVl.jpg','2013-10-25',135,'Released','Meet the weirdest hacker of Dilli...','Mickey Virus',228648,0.8804,5.4,'3FLcWzeZzjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35529,_binary '\0','/9oGIWV2FLr7N5kjOGjByHypNTWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2796678',4.5,1337,'en','The Opposite Sex','The story of Vince, New England\'s most successful divorce attorney. To Vince, life is one big competition, and losing is unacceptable. This also applies in his dating life with his love \'em and leave \'em approach. Then Vince meets Jane, who is beautiful, successful and also extremely driven. Together they enter into a series of entertaining wagers with each other where the winner gets to decide the fate of the loser.','/4OGyobNioLlo1aj4ioxxmsssSCj.jpg','2015-01-22',96,'Released','A battle of the sexes, winner takes all.','The Opposite Sex',301748,3.854,4.5,'fR4COuXHFdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35530,_binary '\0','/rFEiCYvMncNmK1sw3RfSCLevg3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2797106',7.5,1622,'ko','집으로 가는 길','Jeong-yoon and Jong-bae own a car body repair shop together that gets in financial trouble. To help cover the losses and take care of her family, Jeong-yoon decides to smuggle thirty kilograms of cocaine.','/qzfUze20XvWAzIBRDeqP0ZtoppE.jpg','2013-12-11',131,'Released','Isolated in an unknown word lost innocence, lost communication.','Way Back Home',242458,2.0424,7.6,'Gj1HD97c6iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35531,_binary '\0','/g9ROWD3h20sztOKcNNt0hzSB5OP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2797242',6.6,6076,'hi','Bombay Talkies','One hundred years of Hindi cinema is celebrated in four short stories showcasing the power of film.','/jToHRUGY86MVkloVFgKVD090j90.jpg','2013-05-03',127,'Released',NULL,'Bombay Talkies',190940,2.438,6.311,'njzTBH8mZLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35532,_binary '\0','/wYABiefgxiIU9GyZdDiKBdSADYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27972552',7.2,1379,'gu','Mom તને નહીં સમજાય','Devoted mother Aashka sacrifices her career to raise Meera and Kabir while husband Kunal gets consumed by work. Feeling neglected, she leaves but mentors students needing maternal care. Her absence makes the family realize her worth.','/7BG2oM7K3QWN0SW8JTQQ22crhiG.jpg','2025-01-10',118,'Released',NULL,'Mom Tane Nai Samjay',1416945,1.4218,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35533,_binary '\0','/njuO8TJQ4QSy3kxnuUgOCapnuDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27975905',6,3579,'en','Paris Christmas Waltz','Emma relinquishes her job so a colleague with a family will keep his. Contemplating life’s next steps, Emma meets a professional dancer, Leo whose love for competitive dancing is waning, until a once in a lifetime opportunity arises for the novice to join the pro and sweep all of Paris off its feet.','/zyMGmj4zDSNNUdJyzqbu9Lk0tEO.jpg','2023-11-19',84,'Released',NULL,'Paris Christmas Waltz',1127936,2.2642,6.5,'0a7pVLHa3eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35534,_binary '\0','/zz8MVR5evxGUnVQ4LXEN5RR4pnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2798456',4.7,2072,'en','Scintilla','From a torturous cell in Africa, Abel Powell is released and given the chance to regroup his team of skilled mercenaries for one last job. A top scientist will guide them half a mile underground through an ex-Soviet bunker to extract the vital specimens and information being paid for by a mysterious backer, but what they seek should never have been found!','/5PvVipzu0O6jH0DEXgucRAPWx8b.jpg','2014-02-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Scintilla',259830,1.5473,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35535,_binary '\0','/ytCi1wg6YHpYcFRWCO2jpzN31Kf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27986457',6.5,15087,'en','She Rides Shotgun','Newly released from prison and marked for death by unrelenting enemies, Nate must now protect his estranged 11-year-old daughter, Polly, at all costs. With scant resources and no one to trust, Nate and Polly forge a bond under fire as he shows her how to fight and survive—and she teaches him the true meaning of unconditional love.','/nvqW8mOm818QDio3GKKmPLK8kXj.jpg','2025-07-31',120,'Released','All a father needs is a fighting chance.','She Rides Shotgun',1196573,8.9941,7.1,'U9OkHjOnQPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35536,_binary '\0','/qcHOh5PoygMtPbhpeBC0VUNNtAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27987046',6.6,7509,'ko','전,란','In the Joseon Dynasty, two friends who grew up together — one the master and one the servant — reunite post-war as enemies on opposing sides.','/hg9OeaCRSpazrfqYyEFr6BDaZW8.jpg','2024-10-02',126,'Released','An era of chaos, a battle against destiny.','Uprising',1075676,4.2816,7.031,'TqfaCAA1UeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35537,_binary '\0','/zgsxJpxiVaGpUFXKr6zujPWQvou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27987407',6.2,4047,'fr','Cash','Determined to even the scales and profit from his thankless job, a factory worker schemes to traffic luxury perfumes from under his employer\'s nose.','/yBnY6elyOlEk6bKfxEoaHFaqwai.jpg','2023-07-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Gold Brick',1140056,3.3265,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35538,_binary '\0','/gzwTW6USyUchsDKXIKGQIGjqCQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27989067',5.7,52224,'hi','Lust Stories 2','Four eminent Indian directors explore sex, desire and love through short films in this sequel to 2018\'s Emmy-nominated \'Lust Stories\'.','/p5x729JI6wZs9hCqX7tc7oH87ih.jpg','2023-06-29',132,'Released',NULL,'Lust Stories 2',1136736,8.8819,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35539,_binary '\0','/9trZvBr44UGedUOiGo3jgSUw13e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2798920',6.8,398563,'en','Annihilation','A biologist signs up for a dangerous, secret expedition into a mysterious zone where the laws of nature don\'t apply.','/4YRplSk6BhH6PRuE9gfyw9byUJ6.jpg','2018-02-22',115,'Released','Fear what\'s inside.','Annihilation',300668,17.624,6.451,'89OP78l9oF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35540,_binary '\0','/tzbYCxJ8hgCXStHihwNGWe1Fdpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27989255',5.6,1285,'pl','W nich cała nadzieja','A woman, who may be the last human on Earth, struggles to survive with only her robot companion. As she battles the harsh realities of her existence, the stakes intensify when her once-trusted robot turns against her.','/eTuJI5HtppGBmjHi3L9BI3Scwrt.jpg','2023-11-24',88,'Released','There are worse things than being alone.','The Last Spark of Hope',1153470,3.4185,5.768,'VieqDg86ig0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35541,_binary '\0','/gSWPreTUbZqqfjboaXJnHpXYgpO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27991355',3.3,1559,'en','Cellphone','Wynne, who is suffering PTSD from the death of her fiancé, starts seeing disturbing images on her cell phone about her future. If she doesn\'t figure them out in time, she will die.','/fe15BYAlUaFi1cHHgGjfe3vRMYE.jpg','2024-03-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Cellphone',1233776,1.3072,3.9,'t_6m1wOk0YE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35542,_binary '\0','/9wmzKxkmnsoW5gdvW7Iq1mBcKNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2799166',4.7,29321,'en','The Pyramid','An archaeological team attempt to unlock the secrets of a lost pyramid only to find themselves hunted by an insidious creature.','/joPb4PUPP7xClD6XPiQ7laBEtZf.jpg','2014-12-04',89,'Released','You Only Enter Once.','The Pyramid',282813,5.4045,5.3,'v0Yo9xasRKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35543,_binary '\0','/4Yr1efAiQ55YdV9R7N4WOntpmZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27995594',6.3,29156,'hi','मुंज्या','A young man\'s visit to his native village unveils a family secret and a vengeful spirit, Munjya, who wants to get married. Now the young man must fight to protect himself and his love from Munjya\'s clutches leading to a humorously chaotic and terrifying adventure.','/ylYdXu0SM79Qs7vOz6q7mBxanVD.jpg','2024-06-07',121,'Released',NULL,'Munjya',1187058,1.5426,6.205,'8X3uF80H5LU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35544,_binary '\0','/gC1kJpDPtaogbq7N543si20jC0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27996020',6.4,41925,'hi','Jolly LLB 3','The third part of the Jolly LLB trilogy brings back Jagdish Tyagi and Jagdishwar Mishra for the biggest face-off as penurious widow Janki Devi Solanki awaits justice against business tycoon Haribhai Khaitan in a satire on the judiciary, justice and the gulf between the privileged and the people on the other side of the spectrum.','/bwRoU9p5GvjxgPfmIgsfcJ4ydng.jpg','2025-09-19',156,'Released',NULL,'Jolly LLB 3',1015981,2.6089,6.6,'eSgJ8PfSUSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35545,_binary '\0','/yg3wkYCBQnLjd4xFOYZaFXMH30M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt27996716',7.1,1477,'bg','Уроците на Блага','Blaga is a seventy-year-old recently widowed former teacher and a woman of firm morals. When telephone scammers con her out of the money that she had saved for her husband’s grave, her moral compass slowly begins to lose its bearings…','/kn9mGezVAbg7hhWvgMnBIhw46cS.jpg','2024-01-19',114,'Released',NULL,'Blaga\'s Lessons',1137196,1.7412,6.7,'qAUiVj6ypCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35546,_binary '\0','/xGd7vtT9AQAe9uq15GlCaCLKUKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2800038',4.3,4253,'en','Atlas Shrugged: Part III','In a post-apocalyptic America, the iron fist of the totalitarian government seeks to crush one mysterious man named John Galt, who has the power and influence to change everything...','/wR7NM125F63zxECZKCVMzibkWpZ.jpg','2014-09-12',99,'Released','Who is John Galt?','Atlas Shrugged: Part III',199933,3.1353,4.5,'EW0Ocr0Ikpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35547,_binary '\0','/2rIsWqpyyFIS6zJgUGoh1fTQ7Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2800050',7.3,1609,'en','A Beautiful Planet','A breathtaking portrait of Earth from space, providing a unique perspective and increased understanding of our planet and galaxy as never seen before. Made in cooperation with the National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA), the film features stunning footage of our magnificent blue planet — and the effects humanity has had on it over time — captured by the astronauts aboard the International Space Station (ISS).','/9naxphfpDgtArLPKnf0dJgGo7bS.jpg','2016-04-16',45,'Released','Experience Earth like never before.','A Beautiful Planet',365997,3.9184,7.1,'WzbHi7Lbz00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35548,_binary '\0','/xSTedn34WWuOk5V60UK3ZXWwkXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2800240',7,48844,'fr','Qu\'est-ce qu\'on a fait au Bon Dieu ?','A catholic French couple sees their life upside down when their four daughters get married to men of different religion and origins.','/bkAiSLxLJJEZXZZqgNna5BWcBIy.jpg','2014-04-16',94,'Released','4 marriages, 2 long-faces','Serial (Bad) Weddings',262391,6.0501,6.7,'xmwfpf9lBwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35549,_binary '\0','/29O4XcNhzKvhLb4DiGQ934XXM5f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2800340',6.3,5197,'sr','Na mlečnom putu','Spring in wartime. Each day a milkman crosses the frontline on a donkey, dodging bullets to bring his precious wares to the soldiers. Blessed with good fortune on his mission, loved by a beautiful villager, a peaceful future seems to await him… until the arrival of a mysterious Italian woman turns his life upside down. Thus begins a story of passionate, forbidden love that will plunge them both into a series of fantastic and dangerous adventures. They have been joined by fate, and nothing and no one seems able to stop them… Two-times Palme D\'Or winner Emir Kusturica directs and stars in this story of love and war, rich in emotion, comedy and adventure.','/uD0DcS9ZwmK7Awwlt0S8LwWREcL.jpg','2016-02-03',125,'Released',NULL,'On the Milky Road',255160,2.564,6.5,'uIM6Pwh3Hbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35550,_binary '\0','/5B9zJ1tYi74aIOTrWtKWD9oAS4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28004697',4,2290,'ta','தூக்குதுரை','In the 18th Century, Tributary Monarch Nirpathunga Varman\'s diadem became the centerpiece of an annual carnival. In 1996, a forbidden love affair leads to tragedy, revenge, and a cursed spirit. Two decades later, a stolen diadem resurfaces, triggering the return of a vengeful spirit.','/eL4UwXVauTXF3CTeRxrzhs3UjZ3.jpg','2024-01-25',125,'Released',NULL,'Thookudurai',1051379,0.7323,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35551,_binary '\0','/kQ35sVT8EBlsX9yilHi1zP4jd3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28007064',7.7,8998,'hi','सुपरबॉय्ज़ ऑफ मालेगाँव','The residents of Malegaon look to Bollywood cinema for a much-needed escape from daily drudgery. Amateur filmmaker Nasir Shaikh gets inspired to make a film for the people of Malegaon, by the people of Malegaon. He bands together his ragtag group of friends to bring his vision to life, thereby bringing a fresh lease of life into the town.','/kLMLaZa0Mu4BqPhA2eYbduFjcD0.jpg','2025-02-27',128,'Released','There are no rules in filmmaking.','Superboys of Malegaon',1226572,4.2587,7.591,'9O3ukqnnVNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35552,_binary '\0','/g7Ccid5kuD7A8hXWlsQiNfwOxaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28014327',6.8,28300,'en','Mayday','When a U.S. Navy pilot on a top-secret mission during the Cold War gets trapped behind enemy lines, his only chance at survival is to form an alliance with an eccentric ex-KGB agent.','/hVXjX1jLZ1ljFSNGXpjJfbTUOa7.jpg','2026-09-03',111,'Released','A friendship with major red flags.','Mayday',1137844,67.5427,8.011,'om5Un9X720M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35553,_binary '\0','/ag66gJCiZ06q1GSJuQlhGLi3Udx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28015403',7,238665,'en','Heretic','Two young missionaries are forced to prove their faith when they knock on the wrong door and are greeted by a diabolical Mr. Reed, becoming ensnared in his deadly game of cat-and-mouse.','/fr96XzlzsONrQrGfdLMiwtQjott.jpg','2024-10-31',111,'Released','Question everything.','Heretic',1138194,17.8145,7,'O9i2vmFhSSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35554,_binary '\0','/wh4CUg4h7fAXrev0GxOqUWtBPyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2801746',7.2,6487,'es','Hawaii','Eugenio spends the summer looking after his aunt and uncle’s house - a place that once belonged to him - while seeking inspiration for a screenplay he is writing. Martín, currently unemployed, offers to handle various repairs around the house. The two met long ago as children but had not seen each other since. However, their renewed connection is built on deception: Martín has nowhere to sleep but lies to Eugenio about it, while Eugenio seems interested in Martín as something more than just a friend.','/vr1BHMvWzLfde0RcH0DpuYFtvR0.jpg','2013-04-12',106,'Released',NULL,'Hawaii',199851,2.0291,7.037,'CQolZplzcns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35555,_binary '\0','/c4sKPgyJj19GBCAvUjpPRiiA45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2802136',5.5,17990,'en','Home Sweet Hell','Don Champagne seems to have it all, but when his wife, Mona, learns of his affair with a pretty new salesgirl, she will stop at nothing to maintain their storybook life.','/vETciJiWTLD0AdDHUANb8HkFdJ5.jpg','2015-03-13',98,'Released','Psycho Wife. Unhappy Life.','Home Sweet Hell',276839,5.6354,5.439,'7DzcOqxr184','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35556,_binary '\0','/qzUIOTk0E3F1zjvYjcBRTKUTgf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2802144',7.7,784523,'en','Kingsman: The Secret Service','The story of a super-secret spy organization that recruits an unrefined but promising street kid into the agency\'s ultra-competitive training program just as a global threat emerges from a twisted tech genius.','/r6q9wZK5a2K51KFj4LWVID6Ja1r.jpg','2015-01-24',129,'Released','Manners maketh man.','Kingsman: The Secret Service',207703,26.5761,7.618,'Th_KrhqmHk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35557,_binary '\0','/ycOp8gMtlfW7pDPL1YiejU1DVn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2802154',7.6,60596,'ru','Левиафан','In a Russian coastal town, Kolya is forced to fight the corrupt mayor when he is told that his house will be demolished. He recruits a lawyer friend to help, but the man\'s arrival brings further misfortune for Kolya and his family.','/dwmHSBBiu2ow271zrQ33rPKZDSC.jpg','2014-09-24',141,'Released',NULL,'Leviathan',265180,4.0971,7.373,'2oo7H25kirk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35558,_binary '\0','/eamXj7xMBPcSgCYT4AilPMqbzmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28022731',8,2584,'en','Stolen Dough','\"Stolen Dough\" is the remarkable story of Anthony Mongiello. An Italian-American whose patent was stolen by Pizza Hut. What follows are the real life events of a 1 Billion dollar lawsuit','/pH95afFuDG6ck0vFLmR2XlFHpqm.jpg','2023-04-30',46,'Released','The Greatest Fraud In Food History','Stolen Dough',1278606,2.0816,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35559,_binary '\0','/8UI2Zm3sKTVVDzM34B0KbxSVuML.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28023652',5.8,3542,'te','మాయా పేటిక','Follows the journey of a brand new smartphone that changes hands from one person to another and how the lives of all who possess it starting from popular actress Payal and her fiancee Pranay, Mayor Malliswari, Corporator Kameshwar Rao, car mechanic Ali, Aasra, Watchman Narayana, his wife, thief Srinu get affected.','/g1ujQuYNHdw5WX47f5Asw3KHUml.jpg','2023-06-30',142,'Released',NULL,'Maya Petika',1048309,0.9466,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35560,_binary '\0','/9nlSHunbDNrIYNKD03Z53baqrzc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28023902',6.6,8193,'hi','जब खुली किताब','When Anusuya confesses to her husband, Gopal, that she cheated on him with another man a few months into their five decade-long marriage, all hell breaks loose. Angry and hurt, Gopal decides to seek divorce while he struggles to keep the rest of the family oblivious to his and Anusuya’s blistering secret. What follows is an impassioned, often hilarious deep-dive into the lives of Gopal and Anusuya while they manoeuvre the rocky roads of their relationship, rediscovering the meaning of love and togetherness.','/jOBGisbjCKaM6w7eLdkIyZcVRrn.jpg','2024-11-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Jab Khuli Kitaab',918785,1.4496,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35561,_binary '\0','/oweut3EYuRba00Xv0o0G6JUrLua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28024755',5.4,1570,'hi','ड्राई डे','When his wife makes a vow to abort their baby due to his alcoholism, Gannu, the biggest loafer of Jagodhar sets out on a protest to ban alcohol in his town all the while grappling with his own drinking habits!','/lse7qPwWpYi0bdjmjrXfam7KpXg.jpg','2023-12-22',128,'Released','This revolution will start with a hangover','Dry Day',1216709,0.9965,7.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35562,_binary '\0','/p5b5Y5l7qJyqzGqk1OhQ2qPX328.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28026215',5.5,6905,'en','Guns Up','When a job goes horribly wrong, an ex-cop and family man who moonlights as a mob henchman has one night to get his family out of the city.','/3RokBWEkQqJRZEVP3DPwGm5MYh6.jpg','2025-05-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Guns Up',1181540,8.0686,6.478,'em64F7k27ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35563,_binary '\0','/wdbrAbyYucapX2EZnb0YkbA5GJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28036417',7.8,3049,'ja','青春ブタ野郎はランドセルガールの夢を見ない','Finally, the day of Mai\'s high school graduation has arrived. While Sakuta eagerly waits for his girlfriend, an elementary schooler who looks exactly like her appears before him. Suspicious, and for all the wrong reasons... Meanwhile, Sakuta and Kaede\'s father suddenly calls, saying that their mother wants to see her daughter. She was hospitalized because Kaede\'s condition had been too much for her to bear, so what could she possibly want now?','/AuXbMRrtfFNVNSq5Dk0gBVXFGZy.jpg','2023-12-01',75,'Released',NULL,'Rascal Does Not Dream of a Knapsack Kid',1086591,3.8776,7.742,'EvWwJf60W2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35564,_binary '\0','/oZMpjEvO19ILidHNmRn1QTkXgpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28036831',6.6,1311,'ja','化け猫あんずちゃん','Precocious tween Karin finds herself abandoned by her father in rural Japan. Living in a temple with her grandfather, she meets Anzu, a giant \"ghost cat\" and notorious layabout tasked with looking after her. Distrustful of her new guardian, Karin sabotages Anzu\'s odd jobs for the townsfolk and befriends the eccentric local forest spirits. In an effort to win Karin over, Anzu accidentally makes a deal with the devil, and all Hell breaks loose.','/rJSSc7vbLseCOjsgDnCKtVNs9Qe.jpg','2024-07-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Cat Anzu',1030588,3.8816,6.9,'091CA9bUBZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35565,_binary '\0','/mguy0nefEUY7NKruffpLO3Stj3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28037987',6.3,60180,'hi','सैयारा','Two artistic souls find harmony through music despite their contrasting worlds. As feelings deepen, age and circumstances challenge their undeniable bond.','/hQBIsi3ZfBYEayMc3GhcEmJVkss.jpg','2025-07-18',150,'Released',NULL,'Saiyaara',1241634,5.3682,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35566,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2803940',3.5,3585,'en','Misogynist','A male chauvinist guru guides his best prodigy through the art of controlling women, only for the student to find out he is not everything that he seems.','/abeUqOM7MX7JElV2lGkpzK5kp6c.jpg','2013-12-07',76,'Released','Sometimes it\'s easier to hate.','Misogynist',323705,0.839,2.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35567,_binary '\0','/e3VPAcFubKalOhnvHaoq4E2iq8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2804026',6.4,4634,'hi','औरन्गज़ेब','Yashwardhan, a corrupt businessman, is suspected of grave crimes by the police. Inspector Ravikant kidnaps Yash\'s son, Ajay, and replaces him with a lookalike, Vishal, to expose his criminal deeds.','/6Yw4WZXekBFd9R0LYXj1vQWJCr7.jpg','2013-05-17',137,'Released','Son. Brother. Successor. Emperor.','Aurangzeb',188306,0.064,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35568,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28054637',5.7,2308,'kn','Chilli Chicken','Chilli Chicken follows the lives of five Northeastern boys working at a Chinese restaurant. Based on true events, this film is written and directed by Prateek Prajosh. The cast includes BV Shrunga (known for \"19.20.21\"), Manipur actor Bijou Thaangjam (from \"Mary Kom\"), Jimpa Sangpo, alongside Harini Sundararajan, Victor Thoudam, Nityashree, Padmaja Rao, and others. This movie promises to captivate audiences with its unique blend of social commentary, drama, and comedy.','/5Aa0A7pN7IuKqen0nYuD7pIKzqf.jpg','2024-06-21',123,'Released',NULL,'Chilli Chicken',1305602,0.5976,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35569,_binary '\0','/1NRdvblC1cGu9gkd4R0almqZ1F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28055434',5.2,1688,'en','Close to You','A trans man returns to his hometown for the first time in years. On his journey, he confronts his relationship with his family, reunites with a first love, and discovers a newfound confidence in himself.','/9vCHM2IVdLI7dsamnrhPPGdcu9h.jpg','2024-08-16',99,'Released',NULL,'Close to You',1139467,2.9371,5.8,'TpieCTUhtLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35570,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2805676',3.8,1534,'en','Ascent to Hell','When a realtor shows an old New York factory building to a group of would-be investors, they are unwittingly caught in its tragic and sinister history.','/rh04IITaloiCLgaRESxBrCRmUEo.jpg','2017-03-16',80,'Released',NULL,'Ascent to Hell',447315,0.9016,5.9,'_T55P4ilGOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35571,_binary '\0','/kqpVQfGQyADVGX0ZhAO2KvvYOZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2805748',4.2,1508,'en','Grave Halloween','After inadvertently unleashing an ancient curse, a documentary crew of American exchange students is haunted by angry spirits in Japan\'s infamous Suicide Forest.','/SSr17CBHhh0gmno7rThPaDrcsN.jpg','2013-10-19',89,'Released','No one survives in the suicide forest.','Grave Halloween',229839,2.3615,4.5,'NJxdvF0S1bQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35572,_binary '\0','/cyioqnbisy1tLvrHFJDgHwbU9lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2806390',5.9,1234,'en','Milton\'s Secret','11 year-old Milton Adams is growing up in an uncertain world. With his parents constantly stressing about their careers and finances, and the neighborhood bully tormenting him, Milton feels his whole world is in crisis. But when his Grandpa Howard comes to visit, he discovers anxiety about the past and worrying about the future only make things worse and prevent him from finding true happiness moment to moment.','/iMn025BdcE3Ok5xrgxETOhZ1Nn3.jpg','2016-09-30',88,'Released','Be here. Now.','Milton\'s Secret',410694,1.6815,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35573,_binary '\0','/zLj0peaxy5y2SlC6wNIQ4V0pfqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28066777',6.3,19779,'en','Orion and the Dark','A boy with an active imagination faces his fears on an unforgettable journey through the night with his new friend: a giant, smiling creature named Dark.','/N2ddXhBX5kqwA9flbm2yqFtX6b.jpg','2024-02-01',90,'Released','Hello Darkness, my new friend.','Orion and the Dark',1139829,10.2705,6.5,'cEU3tnJrouE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35574,_binary '\0','/fp2IhvCILO0i3MEHaK0HUuD4kYN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2806788',6.9,14433,'hi','फुकरे','The paths of four dream-chasing college friends cross with an array of colourful characters, from a tough-talking Punjabi female don to a Jugaad Baaz college watchman. Mayhem ensues.','/wAXcxLLFKeqFdlhORajj4pZrPTz.jpg','2013-06-14',137,'Released','Going Cheap!','Fukrey',199139,1.549,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35575,_binary '\0','/z4nGKYC1aj2qy5fEKYiZQsdrEPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28070202',6.4,3448,'en','Queen of the Ring','In a time when pro wrestling for women was illegal all over the country, a small town single mother embraces the danger to change culture as she dominates America\'s most masculine sport to become the first million dollar female athlete in history.','/o5ugZxTNHFFm1gAt4eYJbFVKsBK.jpg','2025-03-07',140,'Released','How far would you go for a dream?','Queen of the Ring',1144932,4.5127,6.8,'jXBbdsWsJM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35576,_binary '\0','/kZvYVhYYVL4MxLbDeBo9QJd0LRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28073548',5.6,5234,'en','Love Is in the Air','A fiercely independent pilot fighting to keep her family business afloat starts to fall for the man sent by corporate to ground her operation forever.','/cAn1tvopkqATQ0AfV4LK08ReAvp.jpg','2023-09-28',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Is in the Air',1167725,4.4987,6.189,'O2JI6EldneY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35577,_binary '\0','/xWjschjsn5GlZNM6e40NK88BRv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2807410',5.6,3936,'te','రుద్రమదేవి','Rudraba, daughter of Ganapatideva, the emperor of the Kakatiya dynasty, was officially designated a son through the ancient Putrika ceremony and given the name Rudradeva so that she could succeed her father after his death. Despite opposition, she became of the most prominent rulers of the Kakatiya dynasty and one of the few ruling queens in Indian history.','/55HwFA0pJlxbL8QqvzLFWsFH1fM.jpg','2015-10-09',165,'Released','The Warrior Queen','Rudhramadevi',315009,1.3585,5.15,'EqeZ0tDTzGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35578,_binary '\0','/njSqJRgV4U9J7u73saYjSbiQ60V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28074691',5.9,5181,'te','ఈగల్','A journalist pieces together the story of Eagle, a former professional sniper who falls in love with Rachana, and on a mission to redeem himself by working towards eradicating illegal arms from this world.','/mjQN27x0Dfkmsi3SRRkAIatOr2p.jpg','2024-02-08',156,'Released',NULL,'Eagle',1150478,2.1151,4.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35579,_binary '\0','/w5bafQ2YCDizQHM2wLBoPlpseNy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28075055',7.2,3465,'kn','ಟೋಬಿ','An estranged man deemed to be a beast vows to break free from the evil world and transform himself for his foster daughter.','/duuhplJUxzKqpX54F96igKddvLW.jpg','2023-08-25',153,'Released',NULL,'Toby',1139698,1.7116,7,'3TM85uXST6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35580,_binary '\0','/5z1ciMqskvl4opeq1NjAGlweOn5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28075881',6.3,70852,'hi','दो पत्ती','A puzzling investigation leads a no-nonsense cop down a dark path involving the vicious rivalry between twin sisters and the volatile man they both love.','/wbXSE68cDwqUPsHJcpdu7I5kSLK.jpg','2024-10-24',128,'Released','A truth hidden in every lie.','Do Patti',1148172,3.3773,6.8,'i4uHAM1BF6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35581,_binary '\0','/frJh77mFFc5AKMDIaX6S89tQ6rc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2807624',6.8,1787,'pl','Układ zamknięty','The film is set in the Tricity in 2003, ten years after the end of communism in Poland. The plot, apparently based on the real-life experiences of Kraków businessmen Lech Jerzorny and Paweł Rey, is about three young, talented businessmen who open a high-tech factory. This comes to the attention of the local state ‘mafia’, the local Prosecutor, played by Janusz Gajos, and tax office boss, played by Kasimierz Kaczor, who are both jealous and would like to make money for themselves. We are in Poland, so success must be punished.','/2Ie0imHnQ1X5WNfQQx7RpZPvCvl.jpg','2013-04-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Closed Circuit',226702,1.8722,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35582,_binary '\0','/wICQv6x5mK7rGmjyLlpGHSu19uR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28076316',5.2,5628,'hi','जासूस शेरदिल','For Detective Sherdil, crime-solving is his superpower. But can his wit, intellect and street-smart instincts help him crack the murder mystery of the industrialist Pankaj Bhatti?','/gqLrdGer0xvG5ezas7Qe3alqMzV.jpg','2025-06-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Detective Sherdil',1230555,1.3567,4.4,'OIIYp340R6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35583,_binary '\0','/aXyCINHbxFBa9ZlQ9lSYeg1hAIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28076784',6.8,3933,'zh','孤注一掷','A depressed programmer and a model decide to seek gold as a seemingly good job opportunity, but they inadvertently become involved in a well-planned Internet scam.','/b3DBoHSGPIlqZclfZc6lHcVvGPz.jpg','2023-08-05',130,'Released',NULL,'No More Bets',1121612,4.1836,6.949,'-4x7bVqclYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35584,_binary '\0','/bZMZu3af1BMEj4AigsccjMAPk6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28078628',6.7,1870,'en','Soul on Fire','After a horrific accident leaves his body scarred, a young boy strives to live and show everyone what is possible with the help of his family, his faith, his community, his longtime idol\'s kindness, and the entire city of St. Louis.','/iUMmG3Q0JyAuSx9QpIiMFhI5zDo.jpg','2025-10-10',111,'Released','You get one life. Make yours matter.','Soul on Fire',1196791,4.1244,7.476,'CslVGLETWps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35585,_binary '\0','/t0pNv9NR1R1R2GFXubxmjT6iU4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28082769',7.1,38516,'en','September 5','During the 1972 Munich Olympics, an American sports broadcasting crew finds itself thrust into covering the hostage crisis involving Israeli athletes.','/3kcQOLwYKGPwyjiynFsvP8vHvRn.jpg','2024-11-07',94,'Released','The day terror went live.','September 5',1211472,8.2278,6.975,'Azud40CQ3IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35586,_binary '\0','/argJlxQHbXAzyH8fKnjLfoEyDcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28083456',6.7,19841,'en','Is This Thing On?','As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex faces middle age and an impending divorce, seeking new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family—forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.','/YD6QzcokTMe3EViM0hLbNCxf4y.jpg','2025-12-19',121,'Released',NULL,'Is This Thing On?',1140498,7.8482,6.56,'TE5v3U79i6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35587,_binary '\0','/xQaR8zugXXGaQjscn77K38GKrV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28087226',3.8,1464,'en','Cinderella\'s Revenge','Cinderella finds freedom from her wicked stepmother with the help of her fairy godmother. Only this time, they unleash a plan of bloody vengeance.','/cYB3SHhITJSbRoisgn9QQTP8YkZ.jpg','2024-04-26',85,'Released','This ain\'t no fairy tale','Cinderella\'s Revenge',1140847,2.5808,5.637,'-cVRbBSpXrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35588,_binary '\0','/ppLv2F7dhvI3wxaEoOP1E0OyBPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28088049',6.3,4738,'es','Amarga Navidad','Elsa is an advertising director whose mother dies during a long December holiday. She works non-stop and, without realizing, doesn’t give herself time to mourn her mother’s absence. After a crisis, Elsa decides to travel to the island of Lanzarote accompanied by her friend Patricia, who also needs to get away from the city. The story of these characters runs parallel to that of a screenwriter and film director, exploring how life and fiction are inseparably linked, sometimes painfully so.','/kiPGcHX0YT49nrab76G0bqw3gHW.jpg','2026-03-20',111,'Released','You’re confusing fiction with reality.','Bitter Christmas',1088548,8.256,6.2,'NUvdMKtFXBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35589,_binary '\0','/tTDfDHqGkRgBTL4Tw8mU0iwkW8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28088571',4.7,1364,'en','Eye for an Eye','Anna, grieving the sudden death of her parents, relocates from New York to a small Florida town to live with the grandmother she has never met. Isolated, vulnerable, and in need of friends, she finds brief solace in the company of two local teens. But when she becomes complicit to their unforgivable act of violence, she finds herself ensnared by Mr. Sandman – the twisted soul of a tormented child who haunts bullies’ dreams before feasting on their eyeballs when they finally wake - Anna must right her wrong before becoming a victim of this gruesome curse.','/lpepbfVziHJLhVoxTEKs8ok00iu.jpg','2025-07-03',101,'Released','You can\'t escape your dreams.','Eye for an Eye',1199869,4.2201,6,'1Bhjt0G5pcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35590,_binary '\0','/uKhBujLqYCcfU1kaxXHNCEyZnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28089700',6.6,36994,'hi','रेड २','Set seven years after the events of the first film, it follows the return of IRS officer Amay Patnaik, who is attempting to take down a seemingly benevolent politician.','/562SAxZP1sLuYqDDTuODu3hdGyx.jpg','2025-05-01',139,'Released','Amay Patnaik is Back!','Raid 2',1227128,2.5687,6.45,'kQF1gl7nLaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35591,_binary '\0','/h7VptulPVCJUIvWCE2HzXdHljkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28089784',8.8,106598,'hi','ਸਤਲੁਜ','Triggered by the search for his missing aunt, human rights activist Jaswant Singh Khalra takes on a broken system in a courageous fight to uncover the conspiracy behind thousands of disappearances and extrajudicial killings during the nadir of Punjab’s period of insurgency.','/hm4ou83RwLVwNj3HsmQuqC1qkWy.jpg','2026-07-03',164,'Released','Challenge the Darkness','Satluj',1155818,3.3996,7.9,'WtL3YbjUJN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35592,_binary '\0','/20UhxASP1EpVQ5KIVsGtEwT0d84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2808986',6.4,3836,'ja','TOKYO TRIBE','In an alternate Japan, territorial street gangs form opposing factions collectively known as the Tokyo Tribes. Merra, leader of the Wu-Ronz tribe of Bukuro, joins forces with heavy-hitting gangster Buppa of Buppa Town. With Buppa\'s support, Merra aims to initiate a gang war between the Wu-Ronz and the Musashino Saru, and in a confrontation between the two attempts to kill Kai of the Musashino Saru. The inadvertent murder of Kai\'s friend Tera (a Musashino Saru member beloved by all Tribes since before their formation) leads to the joining of forces between all of the Tribes in an all-out war against Merra and Buppa.','/cpvQrnZwGvzG0moL4oMdmKMYKDB.jpg','2014-08-30',116,'Released','Let Sion Sono take you on a tour of Tokyo\'s underbelly for a night of turf wars & rap battles.','Tokyo Tribe',240566,2.904,6.512,'yE6uWRwZc2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35593,_binary '\0','/l96HCNQuThtKAb3d1Rw9xnxU8ei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28090020',3.6,1487,'ml','വിവേകാനന്ദന്‍ വൈറലാണ്','A seemingly normal person\'s dual life is upended when he becomes infamous overnight. He struggles to reconcile his new public persona with his true self.','/A7NDEc22p7mysitCzXVrlVxMHja.jpg','2024-01-19',121,'Released',NULL,'Vivekanandan Viralanu',1179389,1.0241,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35594,_binary '\0','/aVURAVMksgcpTWQEPJ2Nnu1XlXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28090350',6.9,1658,'es','Una quinta portuguesa','The disappearance of his wife leaves Fernando, a quiet geography teacher, completely devastated. Aimless, he assumes another man’s identity as a gardener on a Portuguese estate, where he forms an unexpected friendship with the owner, stepping into a new life that isn’t his own.','/9Xu3KumdXHDpUOR9inJoAMtIcrM.jpg','2025-05-09',114,'Released',NULL,'The Portuguese House',1440171,2.016,6.7,'lfHoDwJL2F4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35595,_binary '\0','/pQymralrVwqatSF0lg9C9LMKa5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28090490',5.9,1708,'ja','怪物の木こり','A self-proclaimed psychopath, coldblooded lawyer Ninomiya becomes obsessed with stopping an ax-wielding serial killer who\'s made him their next target.','/w4JykK8lELrPMq4yqkIoZ6xDMe7.jpg','2023-12-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Lumberjack the Monster',1137142,2.373,6.3,'d_Ir55nSA2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35596,_binary '\0','/wcjlAaNE9pFK4Av5WBbDBmJ9Wc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28097834',6.3,1395,'en','The Mission','American Christian missionary John Chau was murdered when he tried to illegally contact and convert some of the world’s last uncontacted indigenous people. Through exclusive interviews and archival footage of John’s journey, THE MISSION explores themes that strike deep at the heart of religion, colonialism, and anthropology, questioning where we draw the line between faith and fanaticism, exploration and exploitation, imagination and destruction.','/uGmeAMvTlgvziM2CVDhl9Dumwe5.jpg','2023-10-13',103,'Released','There\'s a fine line between faith and madness.','The Mission',1117644,2.1101,6.3,'afg1V6WOM80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35597,_binary '\0','/nc0HY9uI2vlyICm5N2epdiMTgfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28101019',5.8,1667,'te','సత్యభామ','ACP Satyabhama confronts her haunted past, diving into a high-stakes investigation to find a missing man. As she unravels dark secrets in various towns cloaked in shadows, redemption hangs in the balance. Will she triumph over the past or be consumed by its shadows?','/7I0VTzrqJ4erQHNjrwwhAA5rOTv.jpg','2024-06-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Satyabhama',1177157,1.4482,5.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35598,_binary '\0','/e5bFtChejaGio218NejT0jXgSux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28102562',5.8,49740,'hi','थम्मा','Two destined lovers battle supernatural forces, family ties, and nature itself to defend their forbidden romance in a mystical world where ancient powers and prophecies threaten to keep them apart.','/udkbDwBbysCGEydt0FHnl9dVO2k.jpg','2025-10-21',149,'Released',NULL,'Thamma',1196364,3.3742,6.6,'Mod_oXpftJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35599,_binary '\0','/kxwqhfIuPAlptZI5hgxoxmK7XLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28103733',6.6,1433,'de','One for the Road','As a construction manager, drinking is more of a normality for Mark than not drinking. In addition to his work on construction sites, during business dinners and sprawling Berlin party nights, there is always a reason for him to fully indulge in alcohol intoxication. When he tries to drive his car out of a no-parking zone in a drunken stupor one night, he is promptly checked and immediately loses his driver\'s license. For Mark, this is reason enough to make a bet with his best friend Nadim: He wants to manage not to touch any alcohol until he has his driver\'s license again.','/7DqPake4eaECbpHuXZdwaQ5ayOZ.jpg','2023-10-26',115,'Released',NULL,'One for the Road',897833,1.7553,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35600,_binary '\0','/iWzu3dVJGNfQUkLfK9xpTWoi5mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28105944',5.5,7390,'es','A través de mi ventana 3: A través de tu mirada','After the events of the summer, Ares and Raquel they don\'t see a way forward in their relationship and decide to go separate ways. But when they meet again in the winter in Barcelona, the love and desire they feel for each other is undeniable. Will they be able to find a way to get back together?','/gwpTgtwVAwmvivBN8rAQABpx9Am.jpg','2024-02-23',105,'Released',NULL,'Through My Window 3: Looking at You',1139566,6.9466,6.87,'G_WsQNsfx1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35601,_binary '\0','/vZaIAIX5XcXLsF4jRSp5x7wsRzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28106766',6.3,2287,'ko','밀수','During the 1970s, in Kunchon, there were women divers who were able to dive without equipment, including two best friends Choon-ja and Jin-sook, Jin-sook\'s brother and Hammer. They always collected seafood under water for living. But, as fewer factories started to be built near the beach, the women divers started to have trouble with what they were doing for living. Without any choice, the ship crews decided to join the smuggling business in the water to seek a way for their living. But the smuggling business in their village got too big for Jin-sook\'s family to handle and the peaceful village was gradually broken.','/j8Jx4vpBG258jPxd4o0kOLDwTvm.jpg','2023-07-26',129,'Released','Unload. Procure. Deceive.','Smugglers',783110,3.3697,6.5,'2wo9q_4_YKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35602,_binary '\0','/b1PmdOB577WosIeimPv7WTdkDLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28117942',6.1,1923,'ja','みなに幸あれ','A young woman\'s visit to her grandparents\' home leads to the discovery of what\'s brought them happiness, a revelation that will lead her to question her choices, sanity and reality itself.','/vwWYIcVkDb8twv0unOCcriYCSrD.jpg','2024-01-12',89,'Released','Happiness on earth has a limit.','Best Wishes to All',1136558,1.59,6.6,'nxtXsGlQ6fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35603,_binary '\0','/4gFJqcoty12iJeDCoW3GwcQ0sup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2811878',5.6,1865,'fr','Les rencontres d\'après minuit','Around midnight, a young couple and their transvestite maid prepare for an orgy. Their guests will be The Slut, The Star, The Stud and The Teen.','/knBzPNsPZFqrfS5JO8LgE7jZqNK.jpg','2013-09-08',92,'Released',NULL,'You and the Night',191718,1.9522,5.9,'Mg-9pXblTxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35604,_binary '\0','/1aOPPkXASkd2By3EKIw66Ilx5qF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28129054',5.1,4113,'en','Take Cover','A burned-out professional sniper finds himself trapped in an all-glass penthouse by a lethal competitor and must find a way to survive and escape with little to no cover between him and the killer.','/xNLiMNyFzKTL9PVIEulG55Hei8j.jpg','2024-10-04',89,'Released','Make your shot...','Take Cover',1094974,6.8039,6.382,'D7cgrAZOAw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35605,_binary '\0','/uRjkD3DBBSQH9Yv0mXzAkEER8PN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28131427',7.1,6041,'zh','狗阵','Released from jail, Lang returns to his hometown in Northwest China. As part of a dog patrol tasked with clearing stray dogs before the 2008 Olympics, he bonds with a black stray. The two lonely souls embark on a new journey together.','/dWssO0oGC6b3PtN5uarGuVp66Uv.jpg','2024-06-15',116,'Released',NULL,'Black Dog',1249423,3.881,7.142,'1rqJHP7xtmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35606,_binary '\0','/1DTIRhw4cpLJlHlrPPbKzq6amHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28131433',6.2,7354,'zh','射雕英雄传：侠之大者','Under Genghis Khan, the Mongolian army pushes west to destroy the Jin Dynasty, setting its sights on the Song Dynasty next. Amid internal conflicts among martial arts schools, Guo Jing unites the Central Plains\' warriors to defend Xiangyang, embodying courage and loyalty in the fight for the nation.','/fUCFEGFlMIFet9ja72JDAeG1he8.jpg','2025-01-29',147,'Released',NULL,'Legends of the Condor Heroes: The Gallants',1185528,6.1993,7.1,'uyIPBAmY1hY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35607,_binary '\0','/3FgFKX1gW21LzjT0Yniflaqmhpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28142095',6.1,32515,'hi','तेरे इश्क़ में','A psychology student attempts to rehabilitate a volatile young man, before evolving into a doomed romance.','/7FsHlW9z7gDhDE4EXAE2WcXUVQj.jpg','2025-11-28',169,'Released','Some souls are meant to collide. Some love stories are destined to burn brighter.','Tere Ishk Mein',1142921,1.8714,5.4,'9AJsFRNJGZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35608,_binary '\0','/zafjILdj6K91LOX4w4lCD48utxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28142896',5.7,7425,'en','Weekend in Taipei','A former DEA agent and a former undercover operative revisit their romance during a fateful weekend in Taipei, unaware of the dangerous consequences of their past.','/qSc0AUvs8mRy00R9y8QYEHWIAQ9.jpg','2024-09-19',101,'Released','Pack for a long weekend.','Weekend in Taipei',1167271,9.282,6.505,'GlRRhAF5TVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35609,_binary '\0','/7iaq6J5N9NJ7YP11qssGcrfo1WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2814362',2.1,4626,'en','United Passions','An epic, untold story that brings to life the inspiring saga of the World Cup and the three determined men who created it. Driven by their vision and passion, three men, overcame their doubts and fought obstacles and scandals to make the World Cup a reality. Spanning the tumultuous 20th Century, this timeless saga celebrates the event that became the most popular sporting event in the world.','/oQhVvz3N86DdHnYGsZ9Y2420II5.jpg','2014-06-19',110,'Released','Every dream has its own rules','United Passions',271331,2.6152,3.5,'cKLNPlwxTPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35610,_binary '\0','/dSRFLFbykiSndcPzweMcD2ToohT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28150132',5.6,4066,'en','Omni Loop','Diagnosed with a black hole growing inside her chest and stuck in a loop reliving the last five days of her life, a 55-year-old wife and mother from Miami, Florida decides to solve time travel in order to go back and be the person she always intended to be.','/aKrwq3HeyFcl5MXb7tcsileoF9I.jpg','2024-09-20',111,'Released','You can\'t outrun your future.','Omni Loop',1143128,3.8736,6,'2URmAUEII9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35611,_binary '\0','/yMgVnqtKhvXAjPifqyH6Im0ozSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2815030',6,3830,'en','Killing Kennedy','Drama documentary based on Bill O\'Reilly\'s and Martin Dugard\'s 2012 non-fiction book \"Killing Kennedy: The End of Camelot\". It follows the parallel lives of John F. Kennedy and Lee Harvey Oswald from the winter 1959-1960 to those fatal days in Dallas in November 1963, when they both died within two days after each other and were buried on the same day - John F. Kennedy in a state funeral in Washington D.C., broadcast live both to Europe and the Pacific, while Oswald was buried in Forth Worth at a small funeral where the attending reporters were asked to act as pallbearers.','/oKhgsXzQggIcSO4lOdj1q7cr3Lr.jpg','2013-11-10',87,'Released',NULL,'Killing Kennedy',235093,2.3975,5.794,'rMvaN1rxbLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35612,_binary '\0','/cXU6IyG3hd85VaHe11P8M7ZXqcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2815072',4.5,4559,'en','Indigenous','A group of five American friends on the cusp of adulthood travel to Panama to relax and reconnect. They befriend a local woman in their hotel bar—and despite some ominous whispers—she goes against the specific instructions of her brother and brings the Americans on a daytrip into the pristine falls at the nearby jungle. What begins as an innocent outing to a picturesque waterfall quickly turns terrifying after she suddenly goes missing. As night closes in, the friends realize too late the truth behind the rumors—the legendary, blood-sucking Chupacabra is now stalking them.','/m4ZzYr8gmjJl56b7v4LxA3tVcc8.jpg','2014-04-20',86,'Released','There are places you should never visit. This is one of them.','Indigenous',265018,1.5241,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35613,_binary '\0','/iBlOUre9b1H4qbfOOClmuYEVnl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28151876',6.9,4531,'zh','热辣滚烫','After an argument with her younger sister, Le Ying moves out on her own. She meets a boxing trainer and starts boxing.','/eD1mfjEeDUOAAsptZjQA6skrdJy.jpg','2024-02-10',129,'Released','To win, at least once.','Yolo',1229349,3.5127,6.8,'4WBs9wwWLqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35614,_binary '\0','/gr7N3zCtXeUNCDnXa0DPKCq2bRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28152455',6.6,1591,'tl','Rewind','Mary loves John for as long as she can remember. But after years of marriage, John\'s priorities shift, leading to a strained relationship with Mary, which causes a tragic accident that takes away Mary\'s life. Until one day, John gets an extraordinary proposition - to rewind time and save the life of the woman he loves.','/i8UjdAwezeFHHR4opNb3LxDCQWC.jpg','2023-12-25',112,'Released','Do you make time for what matters most?','Rewind',1143183,1.4291,6.9,'_31Tod1VvLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35615,_binary '\0','/vKjcGYGONld7jXAWACgYDMYzygi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28152535',5.1,2526,'en','Christmas on Windmill Way','Mia Meijer gets ready for the Christmas Market Dutch Bake-Off and suspects that her grandmother, Ann, will walk away with the cherished Golden Rolling Pin thanks to her Kerststol, a traditional Dutch fruited Christmas bread. But Mia\'s world is rocked when she learns that Ann was having financial troubles and had to sell the land deed to the Windmill Way property in her family for generations. Making matters worse, the buyer is Mia\'s former boyfriend, property developer Brady Schaltz, who must let Mia and Ann know the Meijer family-owned heritage Dutch sawmill, renowned for the past 90 years for its fine millwork and beautiful wooden furniture, will be torn down to put up a luxurious resort.','/bRDWHhiVLllPWBU2ADV61acyqT7.jpg','2023-12-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Christmas on Windmill Way',1150521,2.7061,5.9,'HmB2XmKx_0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35616,_binary '\0','/qMneo4vk6e42lS8UqYIfG9xf7ol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28153480',6,5078,'hi','वेदा: संविधान के रक्षक','A court-marshalled soldier with a traumatic past helps a young girl from \'lower\' caste and an aspiring boxer work towards her dreams despite her hostile environment.','/wK0p210TWMH4P3isT1bI0FVEuZ9.jpg','2024-08-15',151,'Released','One extraordinary soldier, one ordinary girl will fight to protect the Constitution of India','Vedaa',1148486,1.6987,5.913,'eGfYMhdKR0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35617,_binary '\0','/yTO1DjhDhighlGwfjgDywjlw3E8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28155718',7.1,1420,'en','That Peter Crouch Film','That Peter Crouch Film is the true story behind football\'s most unlikely hero. Belittled for his height and shunted from club to club, all logic suggests that he should not have had a successful career. The film explores the long, arduous journey to reach the top - filled with twists, stumbling blocks, self-doubt, and alienation. After nearly 25 years since signing his first professional contract, Peter Crouch has only one question to ask himself... how did he get here?','/1RDmyyj5s2fxMetZFQYkOKk7s4Y.jpg','2023-06-22',85,'Released',NULL,'That Peter Crouch Film',1131845,1.5083,6.8,'PEsws05F0JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35618,_binary '\0','/maRJmkEt9GnWjVMqEETdc9Mf6Ng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2815902',6.2,7739,'en','The Childhood of a Leader','The chilling story of a young American boy living in France in 1918 whose father is working for the US government on the creation of the Treaty of Versailles. What he witnesses helps to mold his beliefs – and we witness the birth of a terrifying ego.','/xf1MGzVzEpoWrE5ztcBf7Mhu0Sz.jpg','2016-05-13',116,'Released','Witness the birth of a terrifying ego.','The Childhood of a Leader',330982,2.6709,6.1,'rjYv5U3cOh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35619,_binary '\0','/j0Xeb9a4zDpYdkXEEZhfPjz71UN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28171985',6,1784,'fr','La Tour de glace','Jeanne, a 15-year-old orphan, witnesses the shoot for a film adaptation of the fairy tale The Snow Queen, and she becomes fascinated by its star, Cristina, an actress who is just as mysterious and alluring as the Queen she is playing.','/b68s4eH45pRE8giLVM5tFUgVDcj.jpg','2025-09-17',118,'Released','Colder than ice, her kiss pierces the heart.','The Ice Tower',1143440,3.236,5.8,'STQFog0jQ94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35620,_binary '\0','/rc4gftC3BOULuhvE6BDrzpvVJS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28172032',5.5,1441,'en','Escape from Germany','1939, Hitler\'s army was closing borders, and 85 American missionaries were in Germany serving their church. The escape of these missionaries from Nazi Germany is one of the most dramatic events to occur in modern LDS history.','/ImLwjncbby96zBhPyI2mDRplnX.jpg','2024-04-11',97,'Released','A world war is only days away.','Escape from Germany',1129508,1.8982,6.6,'_0i927_oGGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35621,_binary '\0','/5WjuuYiFdqkJPsXU7SqoTVXcX7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2818178',5.8,4319,'da','Når dyrene drømmer','Teenage Marie lives on a small island with her father and catatonic mother. Virtually friendless and sullen, Marie begins to experience frightening changes in her body that mark her as a dangerous threat.','/7fbKZ1fiVJQAisje8noLiDcK1H4.jpg','2014-06-12',84,'Released','The truth is known to all but one.','When Animals Dream',270668,1.582,5.6,'4geYD__tqCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35622,_binary '\0','/mNlZG1jxZpdMv4RKbvsi03Ym5dA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28182053',4.7,5115,'te','The Constable','A small-town constable\'s peaceful life in Mokila takes a dark turn when mysterious killings disrupt the village. Alongside his loyal partner and an intriguing admirer, he must solve a case that tests his resolve.','/gSeIBH35sYRsrjBlDfEy6eLpj7L.jpg','2025-10-10',130,'Released','Constable Telugu Movie','The Constable',1428868,1.365,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35623,_binary '\0','/pzvnnpJmCtSZMw44WYVEqldhn17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28182736',6.3,13943,'en','Puppy Love','After a disastrous first date, wild-child Nicole and socially-anxious Max vow to lose each other’s numbers until they learn that their dogs found a love match, and now puppies are on the way! The hilariously mismatched Nicole and Max are forced to become responsible co-parents, but may end up finding love themselves.','/zjpsW3sflsoxahFyFujvTnWUuqV.jpg','2023-08-22',106,'Released','One bone can change everything.','Puppy Love',1143319,6.5161,7,'04Qr0Yj0hAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35624,_binary '\0','/gADH3GDCchEIFgASyEQfz12zurS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28184712',7.8,14163,'ta','பார்க்கிங்','An elderly man and a youngster, fight over a much-coveted parking spot, let their egos get the better of them and the clash brings out their ugliest sides.','/xcKk5IILXOzAfY69lvKhhGcIt9J.jpg','2023-12-01',127,'Released',NULL,'Parking',1174777,1.1358,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35625,_binary '\0','/yvRsIN0eF58IqJRJxHeKgNfqMEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28185525',5.9,1714,'bn','বাঘা যতীন','Jatindranath Mukherjee is an Indian independence activist. He is the principal leader of the Jugantar party that is the central association of revolutionary independence activists in Bengal.','/oqTh7TYdAnZTHLfgyHPPUSXwXMw.jpg','2023-10-19',138,'Released',NULL,'Bagha Jatin',1003038,1.1621,6,'AHXJv_Wh2-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35626,_binary '\0','/kY6SdYpsvyaGletzZSEljzPeAWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2818654',6.8,6052,'th','รักที่ขอนแก่น','In a hospital, ten soldiers are being treated for a mysterious sleeping sickness. In a story in which dreams can be experienced by others, and in which goddesses can sit casually with mortals, a nurse learns the reason why the patients will never be cured, and forms a telepathic bond with one of them.','/pK5y82ISbaBWa87R5neub8qojDk.jpg','2015-09-02',122,'Released',NULL,'Cemetery of Splendor',298721,2.2647,5.981,'45t465swmXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35627,_binary '\0','/wwDZQv0X86y5JT8U1ASWoxFltK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28188089',5.5,2419,'en','A Royal Date for Christmas','Bella Sparks, owner of Bella’s Boutique, takes on a demanding new client named Stefan, who needs to be outfitted for a week of high-stakes meetings and events after his luggage goes missing. Imagine Bella’s reaction when she accidentally discovers Stefan is actually Stefan William Francis Brown, the Duke of Tangford.','/eL9cdpKgHDSI87fH1xmBss6uga1.jpg','2023-11-25',84,'Released',NULL,'A Royal Date for Christmas',1142780,2.4911,5.8,'qw4hS2-sjVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35628,_binary '\0','/zJiFqAi3MbibP0m2dWXUhWD3o9A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2819358',7.2,1909,'bn','গয়নার বাক্স','Shirshendu Mukhopadhyay\'s famous tale of 3 generations of women & their changing position in society,seen in relation to a box of jewels, handed down from one generation to the next. A film by Aparna Sen.','/v0H3pgHolg2kGt0MUKBIeTMol4y.jpg','2013-04-11',141,'Released',NULL,'The Jewellery Box',213763,0.9513,6.781,'DALwfzF16dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35629,_binary '\0','/d1uy470ELS3pedvffTisHmO2FSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28199950',5.1,2347,'te','సీతా ప్రయాణం','Chef Seetha survives an accident and seeks to thank her saviors. She falls for stranger Abhishek, who hides a secret. When truth surfaces, she must choose between love, honesty, and her future.','/nML3XMBRK7WOv0duexoF8A3RnHI.jpg','2026-02-14',150,'Released',NULL,'Seetha Payanam',1566740,1.9961,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35630,_binary '\0','/pMF2SjW0tNYt8Qe7hOZpAIEBCfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2820008',4.3,3091,'en','The Perfect Husband','Viola and Nicola are going through a rough time. To overcome this crisis, they decide to spend a weekend in a remote cabin belonged to Nicola\'s parents. Just a couple of days together to heal their wounds, , but everything will take a turn for the worst, when a sneaking suspicion become pure madness. What was supposed to be a quiet trip will suddenly slip into a deadly nightmare.','/whgaDlMzKkyU2z4MbiknqmzkKGJ.jpg','2014-12-04',85,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Husband',308152,1.0935,4.2,'l8E7fY6jFGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35631,_binary '\0','/ehzI1mVcnHqB58NqPyQwpMqcVoz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2820852',7.1,444930,'en','Furious 7','Deckard Shaw seeks revenge against Dominic Toretto and his family for his comatose brother.','/ktofZ9Htrjiy0P6LEowsDaxd3Ri.jpg','2015-04-01',138,'Released','Vengeance hits home.','Furious 7',168259,24.149,7.212,'4vYQby_hDDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35632,_binary '\0','/ukKnj6ne3wVQuYLM2DMzwTh2f17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2821088',6.1,4031,'fr','Les Salauds','Marco returns to Paris after his brother-in-law\'s suicide, where he targets the man his sister believes caused the tragedy – though he is ill-prepared for her secrets as they quickly muddy the waters.','/zSgi7jVGP8jNMhAUpU2v34eaxcS.jpg','2013-08-07',100,'Released','A neo-noir nightmare.','Bastards',179109,2.9093,5.7,'D__eY2cVF5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35633,_binary '\0','/fzNINclonK6Qy0NQx8kfc4ESde5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2821314',7.1,1961,'en','The Rise and Rise of Bitcoin','A documentary about the development and spread of the virtual currency called Bitcoin.','/nUzeZupwmEOoddQIDAq10Gyifk0.jpg','2014-10-03',96,'Released',NULL,'The Rise and Rise of Bitcoin',292607,0.9586,7,'0S4dSXTnfms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35634,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28213147',5.6,3911,'ml','ചെക്ക്മേറ്റ്','In a tangled web of power and love, the lives of a pharmaceutical company CEO, a failed Don, a grieving widower, and a shrewd lawyer intersect when a mysterious woman is kidnapped, sparking a chain of events in New York City\'s unde