 requirements seizes a Mexican cantina and force the staff to engage in a late night of gaming, food and libations. The only caveat is what\'s on the menu.','/ruskUcYFAy6ctl2ZlTsXqJ7kPCD.jpg','2015-10-02',98,'Released','You are what you eat','Gravy',262169,1.9133,5.4,'7MMoEmg5JhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35643,_binary '\0','/vHiTIgoIoF1rjnjeC4n3qYaZ7Ua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2822672',6,6644,'en','Rock Dog','When a radio falls from the sky into the hands of a wide-eyed Tibetan Mastiff, he leaves home to fulfill his dream of becoming a musician, setting into motion a series of completely unexpected events.','/7RXi2afiNJGU8EB79SD8HYoSz4O.jpg','2016-07-08',90,'Released','A new breed of rock star','Rock Dog',333667,6.1551,6.314,'UVwFM2PukSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35644,_binary '\0','/r7FXeAexcl9PwCLk2VbGrOogIno.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28226738',5.1,2365,'te','EVOL','Revolves around two married couples entangled in a complex web where trust is eroded, shocking betrayals are revealed and lives spiral into an intricate web of intrigue.','/buXclUbb5mcZyug4TXzBrlYLsEP.jpg','2024-08-15',117,'Released','A Love Story in Reverse','EVOL',1329146,1.3861,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35645,_binary '\0','/o08Xfl4R8XPIxtb8HhTMmFbYeo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2822742',5.9,2746,'fr','3 cœurs','A twist of fate leaves a hapless accountant romantically torn between two sisters.','/f0tgGgZZrotBcWTEPGYADrPbJM7.jpg','2014-09-09',100,'Released','Three intertwined destinies, a truth that overturns love and destiny.','3 Hearts',283701,2.8878,5.5,'qSsM7Fh7rwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35646,_binary '\0','/vvYE5UJ8llqJLYrfEdRgud1Duol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28228231',5.9,23663,'bn','প্রিয়তমা','Shumon finds himself entangled in the arms of a politician\'s silly daughter, an encounter that would forever alter the course of his existence. Her sudden demise leaves an indelible mark on Shumon\'s life, shattering his world and leaving him forever transformed.','/bbVlVUS5KAO0XLKhSr5oNbbRXbG.jpg','2023-06-29',142,'Released',NULL,'Priyotoma',1032048,1.1606,6,'oy7FY3k3TJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35647,_binary '\0','/lPUAGC40VdIzO9g1cdH59e6Npmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2822864',5.1,1337,'en','Run the Tide','When their drug abusing mother is released from prison determined to rebuild their family, Rey kidnaps his younger brother Oliver and escapes their desert home for the California coast.','/6QwGnsw1Dk1aU8jtnfg5j13RK31.jpg','2016-12-02',100,'Released','Don\'t fight the tide. Run it.','Run the Tide',353074,2.2145,5.4,'zo3q7SDedr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35648,_binary '\0','/vyJxZSLdgCmUEZlc6OhyJUDqTjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28230296',5.6,8076,'en','It Feeds','A clairvoyant therapist confronts her own personal demons while trying to save a young girl who believes a malevolent entity is feeding on her.','/rV4DQSJq0ESOv7NYUIZG0e0jCux.jpg','2025-04-17',102,'Released',NULL,'It Feeds',1145221,5.4994,6.7,'1UZRwA788Wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35649,_binary '\0','/4lfP1eVs5Q3Gk0K2kn1RvWs5alH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2823054',6,101455,'en','Mike and Dave Need Wedding Dates','Mike and Dave are young, adventurous, fun-loving brothers who tend to get out of control at family gatherings. When their sister Jeanie reveals her Hawaiian wedding plans, the rest of the Stangles insist that the brothers bring respectable dates. After placing an ad on Craigslist, the siblings decide to pick Tatiana and Alice, two charming and seemingly normal women. Once they arrive on the island, however, Mike and Dave realize that their companions are ready to get wild and party.','/alWBdyvXf1LSixnn1IfID5HMtLx.jpg','2016-07-07',98,'Released','They needed hot dates. They got hot messes.','Mike and Dave Need Wedding Dates',316023,7.876,