riends have a fresh idea: they want to stage Shakespeare\'s \'Hamlet\' in Grand Theft Auto. But even in a virtual world, reality intrudes in a wild and trippy film shot entirely inside the ultra-violent video game.','/61pws82KZEssg883HG3kwN16cRw.jpg','2024-12-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Grand Theft Hamlet',1234397,1.6448,6.5,'MLpGIHjwhNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35658,_binary '\0','/z4eDL8l0Q9yshJrXQqO1zp0QQPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2824852',4.8,2245,'en','Deadly Virtues: Love. Honour. Obey.','A home invasion irrevocably changes the lives of all involved in ways neither victims nor perpetrator could have imagined','/5uCkeMxYv7WNqko2oMWt7IuvV5G.jpg','2014-12-06',87,'Released',NULL,'Deadly Virtues: Love. Honour. Obey.',258947,2.4275,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35659,_binary '\0','/gZMxWasedXCUOTv2ZpCJiAMkTtH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28248897',4.7,4078,'en','Tyler Perry\'s Divorce in the Black','Ava, a young bank professional is devastated when her husband Dallas abandons a marriage she is determined to fight for until fate intervenes, revealing Dallas\' wicked deeds that have trashed their marriage, and once upon a time sabotaged Ava\'s destiny to be loved by her true soulmate.','/d5X03SA51Ezd02iF9BCjWXC9X9F.jpg','2024-07-11',121,'Released','Fear has no place in love.','Tyler Perry\'s Divorce in the Black',1213742,6.7508,7.259,'yGi0O0zDSjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35660,_binary '\0','/eT1L3IVcHUL58wLn48E5dxlea3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28249919',6.1,45265,'en','Presence','A couple and their children move into a seemingly normal suburban home. When strange events occur, they begin to believe there is something else in the house with them. The presence is about to disrupt their lives in unimaginable ways.','/xZIGHoHj0DF0zdibwa66cRWHdHO.jpg','2025-01-17',84,'Released','In this house there is a presence.','Presence',1140535,9.731,6.1,'Ay4MJZH6_K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35661,_binary '\0','/RAVryc4jb0Ouc0hdQ8po2RHJiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2825120',5.7,1844,'ja','クローズ EXPLODE','A month after Genji Takiya graduates, a new battle for supremacy at Suzuran All-Boys High School begins. Transfer student Kaburagi Kazeo combats Kagami Ryohei for the coveted top spot, amidst a brewing inter-school conflict with Kurosaki Industrial High.','/h4Zm4kxN1G3wa5bdmeMUxkb7js5.jpg','2014-04-12',129,'Released',NULL,'Crows Explode',253451,3.2106,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35662,_binary '\0','/69kwyBRuR2S3uEttJpb6ALc0MkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2825230',6.2,3795,'en','Blood Punch','Milton, a college dropout, was only supposed to cook meth for one day. Broken out of rehab by a brash young woman and her trigger-happy (\"ex\") boyfriend and driven to a remote cabin the woods, Milton finds himself drawn into a dangerous love triangle gone haywire. The couple\'s deadpan half-truths spin around Milton like a song on repeat. They seem to read him like an open book, until a mysterious message opens his eyes to his cursed existence. With unlimited ammunition, any hunting tool they could desire, and an ever-growing body count, for what did Milton really sign up?','/qQZkm86UV5qiRPbcWQOPN6iF6HN.jpg','2014-02-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Blood Punch',257117,2.7771,6.431,'mIXEK0NYunk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35663,_binary '\0','/nmPzYjRPAd3iVOgrLXlvh6HuvRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28252563',6.7,10729,'ta','மதராஸி','A man with a psychological disorder overcomes trauma and confronts his nemesis in a fast-paced action film with romance and unique elements, exploring themes of resilience and redemption.','/dw3Dllz1gV7186m7clqNDnI9R28.jpg','2025-09-04',168,'Released',NULL,'Madharaasi',1297181,3.4004,6.818,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35664,_binary '\0','/5CQoyy8bd1DSffnmtm1rGRlOcz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28252581',5.1,1631,'kn','Mr.ರಾಣಿ','Raja dreams of becoming an actor but is forced by his parents to become an engineer. While struggling to become an actor, he accidentally gets a chance to play a girl\'s role and goes on to become the No. 1 actress.','/5o6J0pwop2vodl23yHKJVMJNHMS.jpg','2025-02-07',128,'Released',NULL,'Mr.Rani',1430515,1.9205,0,'4F5zGb1NBl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35665,_binary '\0','/bqFFk4saxd8igGTgJNiCh7gi7bA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28252641',7.1,3210,'kn','Krishnam Pranaya Sakhi','Krishna, a business tycoon, meets Pranaya, an orphan who runs an orphanage. Krishna, worried that his socio-economic status may separate him from Pranaya, pretends to be a driver and becomes employed by Pranaya. Pranaya soon learns about Krishna\'s identity, but she later accepts his love.','/y5giArJfFI2dBySP0KxV8riTipn.jpg','2024-08-15',161,'Released','Love finds it\'s way.','Krishnam Pranaya Sakhi',1330592,0.95,6.2,'t_l9FfmQpsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35666,_binary '\0','/beEZ7W8D0YsxbbnhknMZAZ1YCfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28252660',1.6,1280,'ru','Свидетель','A Russian war propaganda film about a virtuoso violinist from Belgium witnessing war crimes.','/pCCvmwbCxAfAFCZDGi3wMxwEkJC.jpg','2023-08-17',127,'Released',NULL,'The Witness',1151188,0.6998,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35667,_binary '\0','/wnNw9FnJJCtbXogcPK5Jg0AQjo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28252935',5.2,1407,'ta','டீசல்','During the 1980s, Manoharan was a leader in the city\'s crude oil smuggling business. Manohar opposed Patanis dream of setting up a private port that would become a hub for the black market oil trade. He looted a large quantity of oil from the pipeline to blackmail the government into fulfilling his dream. Finally, the Vasu finds the missing oil.','/A3jv9cICPkVHx48h2NZXW4c1ZnP.jpg','2025-10-17',145,'Released',NULL,'Diesel',985379,1.6891,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35668,_binar