nter in a squat in North Kent. Bug doesn’t have much time for his kids, and Bailey, who is approaching puberty, seeks attention and adventure elsewhere.','/wKshd6n8EKrwbE2fLOUqC4TSG6O.jpg','2024-11-08',119,'Released','Is it too real for ya?','Bird',1128752,5.4534,7.2,'1PFnYr3dm1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35677,_binary '\0','/iani6lXW3h3d89MuwV6d7ULMhGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28282020',6.9,1780,'es','Señora Influencer','Fatima, a woman in her forties, becomes an online overnight sensation. Sofi and Cami, a pair of young influencers, will try to take advantage of Fatima\'s sudden popularity by pretending to be her friends, unbeknownst to them that they messed with the wrong person!','/lgEXNBnFsq8oTck1C2giSvnTjzz.jpg','2023-11-02',99,'Released','They messed with the wrong profile!','Like or Die',1150112,2.195,7.7,'22Esik3I3m8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35678,_binary '\0','/tBC3WPftmUYEzRRw51dXWcoYt6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28282716',7,8272,'hi','Trial Period','A working single mother\'s world turns upside down when her inquisitive son demands a new father on a 30-day \'Trial Period\'.','/kpGnnQ0zu1Utxh8F0QUgZ9d2hol.jpg','2023-07-21',125,'Released','Father on rent','Trial Period',1149268,1.1486,6.091,'nVaFJnbvf-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35679,_binary '\0','/pXs3GE1LzDO2xUX2S4sO6iBAA5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28282872',3.6,5515,'te','మిస్టర్‌ బచ్చన్','Just four days before wedding, a fiercely honest Income Tax officer Bachchan’s life takes a dramatic turn when he is reinstated from suspension and tasked with raiding the home of the powerful and ruthless politician Mutyam Jaggaiah.','/55TWpe9GvJEx2dq8fWoroIbJRvI.jpg','2024-08-15',160,'Released','The Only Hope','Mr Bachchan',1232219,1.4119,2.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35680,_binary '\0','/en0NbTEjf3qKokHvwGeaq9DBPIP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28283547',4.9,5963,'en','The Rats: A Witcher Tale','To pull off a daring heist, a gang of six misfit outlaws will have to do something they\'ve never done before: trust each other — and a washed-up Witcher.','/1T0kO1cgR430AC9I6jurMOezKwg.jpg','2025-10-29',83,'Released',NULL,'The Rats: A Witcher Tale',1571470,8.3159,5.386,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35681,_binary '\0','/iBrvaJcVNc3boMqKGr4gyYAwemW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28284984',5.5,1350,'ko','리볼버','Su-young, a police detective who went to prison for someone else, is surprised when a mysterious woman named Yoon-sun arrives to collect her on her day of release. As she discovers that the promised compensation for her time behind bars has vanished, Su-young embarks on a mission to reclaim what rightfully belongs to her.','/GjWuUi2SyR3yYc3iz9zr8MlCzF.jpg','2024-08-07',114,'Released','Now, keep your promise.','Revolver',1089223,2.313,5.8,'tszPovkdvjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35682,_binary '\0','/yDpoG6pOgIsKR4i24Y9NJ8Yvgyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28287106',6,1906,'en','Christmas on Cherry Lane','Three couples at different parts of life navigate big turning points in their lives over the holidays.','/ggZsX97GTu47mhQ7jz04gAFcxAG.jpg','2023-12-09',84,'Released','Home is where the story takes you.','Christmas on Cherry Lane',1180665,2.5086,6.2,'MVUnXVgnznI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35683,_binary '\0','/n7Hjz2YOSK5UgnJslO2PDKtMoQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2828840',6.8,1359,'ko','전설의 주먹','Three men who share a past participate in a mixed martial arts reality show where they have to fight against other contestants to win the prize money.','/eAfBO77XyugIUX1qBQygD15jVAF.jpg','2013-04-10',153,'Released','The world\'s largest live fight show.','Fists of Legend',180651,2.2559,7.108,'ipsnuom-_ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35684,_binary '\0','/gDyLcjvmdAhmYqjCMwZ9PndnAVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28288786',7.8,24563,'ml','പ്രേമലു','Sachin, a carefree graduate, crosses paths with Reenu, a spirited IT professional, in Hyderabad. As their friendship deepens, unspoken feelings, career ambitions and life choices challenge their bond.','/uPpmBjY3znUqGY8kYwI5xvOrSc0.jpg','2024-02-09',155,'Released',NULL,'Premalu',1149791,3.4091,7.8,'OnxChVgg6N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35685,_binary '\0','/sgrq5vVkqews59EJpUCgikthW77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2828884',5.9,1264,'en','Hoovey','The true and inspiring story of the Elliott family, who refused to surrender, instead turning to one another and their faith in the worst of circumstances, to rebuild their lives, their boy, and their dreams... together. Step by grueling step, with faith, love, and the tireless work of a mother and father to save their family, their farm, their dream, Hoovey learns to walk again. To read again. To dribble and shoot a basketball again. And yes, to dream again himself. Then stepping out in his faith, back onto the hard court, to live that dream of playing this game once more...','/jgN0zkX4rDJQbz5fhnmVPLKMP2u.jpg','2015-01-31',90,'Released','Rebounding From Death\'s Door','Hoovey',305747,1.6136,6.5,'3ciZCMegwuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35686,_binary '\0','/2gsviqijXE3fN7UcDrfVjeiQcV3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2828954',5,2692,'en','7 Minutes','When three young criminals lose a stash of drugs, they end up owing money to a ruthless drug lord. With time running out, they plan a daring robbery to raise the cash to settle the debt.','/1qOWQEisrKKGWCfBwSN6cSOgw0a.jpg','2014-10-26',92,'Released','Don\'t get caught.','7 Minutes',200511,2.7178,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35687,_binary '\0','/6gycezbvc8iHSune1Evq79dcYIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2828996',4.7,26682,'en','A Haunted House 2','After exorcising the demons of his ex, Malcolm starts afresh with his new girlfriend and her two children. After moving into their dream 