hopathic Multi-Millionaire Life Coach','The Psychopath Life Coach',1208174,0.7357,1,'qlVsr1rqY9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35710,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28329159',5,1558,'ml','ഞാൻ ഇപ്പൊ എന്താ ചെയ്യാ?','A tale of urban angst trapping two individuals during the pandemic lockdown that eventually leads to murder.','/zHEbkT4VtNQGK6cMKaPyViEDPRr.jpg','2023-07-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Njaan Ippo Entha Cheyya?',1157985,0.9329,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35711,_binary '\0','/bRYAXMSYXPsNbtAUmgxCbecS0BZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2833074',7.4,1900,'fr','1987','In 1987, Ricardo is seventeen years old. This summer, Ricardo has a busy schedule: lose his virginity, find a way to get into bars, get a car and spend time with his friends. In order to make fast money, Ricardo decides to use his Italian connections to take a shortcut via the world of crime. But things don\'t go so smoothly.','/h5Od9rVwDBJ9FEtfyxJxjakaoZA.jpg','2014-11-23',105,'Released',NULL,'1987',280218,1.0885,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35712,_binary '\0','/gDkePcszTeHCiYzaWdv59zkCk4H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28332337',6.7,2779,'en','Eephus','As an imminent construction project looms over their beloved small-town baseball field, a pair of New England rec-league teams face off for the last time. Tensions flare up and ceremonial laughs are shared as an era of camaraderie and escapism fades into an uncertain future.','/zDdzvIVGkAUfUMi7mJykgEu5ynu.jpg','2025-01-01',99,'Released','Two teams. One last game.','Eephus',1226777,1.6001,6.9,'7g-bxQwmU0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35713,_binary '\0','/b4vPyaCEP53fVDBj0HqFukICiyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28336131',6.1,2284,'fr','Elyas','Elyas, a former Special Forces soldier who has become paranoid since a mission in Afghanistan, is recruited to ensure the safety of Amina and her daughter Nour, 13 years old, both of whom came from the Middle East for the holidays. As he takes office, Elyas senses something is up.','/mXEv9qa9W03bWR8fqxrHwrqxRXf.jpg','2024-07-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Elyas',1154215,4.8256,6.166,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35714,_binary '\0','/ycHSpZu32dtbG9T8wZTnISRbf1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28338336',7.8,1302,'en','Guiding Emily','Emily\'s life changes after losing her eyesight, while a guide dog struggles with training. Through a series of missed encounters both overcome their obstacles and find each other.','/amJHrFXIDI5tubfelFiUux0THvu.jpg','2023-09-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Guiding Emily',1150513,1.7115,8.2,'oo3yNuTdHRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35715,_binary '\0','/lkzBusEFoXTQnxFMEsYAZ1QwRqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28349451',6.5,11539,'id','The Shadow Strays','Skilled in the art of killing, a young assassin defies her mentor to save a boy from a ruthless crime syndicate — and she\'ll destroy anyone in her path.','/7UYeDUzFIscGVr0mo7isvnrVYvO.jpg','2024-09-10',145,'Released','Violence is her only option.','The Shadow Strays',1151949,10.0611,7.267,'jsKo8nvOfck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35716,_binary '\0','/9sCYvQNrLmSYqgVne8iH9bsutw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28351127',7.3,3218,'te','శ్వాగ్','The eternal battle of the sexes is played out across several generations of a family who seek to obtain a fortune.','/59j909O4PVE7vZxFU0JzuDzLuo7.jpg','2024-10-04',157,'Released','Swaganika Vamsaniki Swagatham','Swag',1252542,1.2399,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35717,_binary '\0','/d898vaxI1klRWTEq4CFXq9kaSxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2835548',6.2,3204,'fr','Grand Central','A young unemployed man finds work at a nuclear power plant and begins an illicit affair with the fiancée of one of his senior workmates.','/qH0LA0KJNr6f98agFNxJ8OvrY7W.jpg','2013-08-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Grand Central',186991,2.6865,5.6,'G_0kYJ8izhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35718,_binary '\0','/9jRWk8xxPxs1HhyjUcwgh0jtpuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28355490',4.6,2725,'tr','Romantik Hırsız','After learning that the art thief she has been chasing is her ex-lover, an officer working for Interpol concocts a plan to catch him red-handed.','/niVtvS9Kf8G1VDPSqurqHkaSSwm.jpg','2024-03-13',99,'Released',NULL,'Art of Love',1248795,3.6392,6.4,'f77agh-CZ-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35719,_binary '\0','/s5iqa1trf5fLjZrYI38aF0n8YUr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28358950',7.5,11414,'ml','നേര്','\'Neru\' is an enthralling legal and emotional drama that delves into the life of Sara, a blind sculpture artist on a quest for justice following a harrowing incident. Against the backdrop of the Indian legal system, this gripping story takes viewers through a rollercoaster of emotions, unveiling layers of deceit and ultimately exploring themes of redemption.','/38jB3gR4LxrJyIaHCgQQsdJa2YW.jpg','2023-12-21',152,'Released','Seeking Justice','Neru',1164370,1.7418,7.233,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35720,_binary '\0','/eaadGOWEwKa0nIK6QaP3s1jpYvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2836166',4.6,1417,'en','Punk\'s Dead: SLC Punk 2','Punk\'s Dead, the sequel to 1999 cult hit SLC Punk, is a punk romp through the Utah hinterlands. Ross, Penny and Crash, young outsiders from different tribes, embark on a road trip to a huge punk show. Ross, 19, is the love child of Trish and Heroin Bob, who died before Ross was born. During their odyssey, and with the help of a healthy dose of drugs, alcohol and punk music, Ross shreds his darkly Gothic outlook and embraces life. His mother Trish, who raised Ross alone in her steam punk shop, discovers that he is in a crisis. She recruits his \'uncles,\' Bob\'s old SLC gang, to help find him. When all collide at the concert, they are forced to deal with their unresolved relationships with Bob.','/AptQQxD4HMNMZZQuVD1XKojCJiZ.jpg','2016-02-11',75,'Released','A young punk\'s odyssey.','Punk\'s Dead: SLC Punk 2',194188,1.6734,4.5,'UcUY8Jjr9kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35721,_binary '\0','/kmYhYcUeiYotsY85BtgoMKK1dXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2836202',5.4,1933,'it','Oltre il guado','After a wildlife biologist (Marco Marchese) becomes trapped on the wrong side of the river while collecting data, he comes across an abandoned village. Taking shelter, he begins to suspect he may be sharing the grounds with more than just boar and deer.','/sPF4vXawuzGxhK41QuKNhgj0e08.jpg','2013-06-21',87,'Released','Come closer...and see!','Across the River',210079,1.7399,5.3,'4RTNz6pNtcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35722,_binary '\0','/dOk0w3HXQx0KwS08VQAt7rKEeWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2836252',5.3,1580,'fr','Fiston','Alex is in love with Sandra since childhood but has never dared approach her.He asks Antoine, a lonely writer to help him seduce her, because in his time he was the only one to conquer the heart of the mother.','/rXyvlWfEgVazefy4aRpgfcgeqx8.jpg','2014-03-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Junior',252607,1.547,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35723,_binary '\0','/uB5lBDiyZVQ36sTUTHk93j7S7g0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28362963',7.5,24774,'hi','चेकमेट','An assassin gets hired for a job that throws him in a murky pool of mishaps, eventually leading to a baffling secret.','/iNHIZmXD7dE921JWwSgB3YcIJya.jpg','2023-07-11',112,'Released',NULL,'Checkmate',1153067,0.8201,5.1,'QtSMmKZe8_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35724,_binary '\0','/oUsHMyRdKX0RqApHeC0Dt2h07o3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28363568',4.4,1474,'tr','3391 Kilometre','Would you fall in love with a person whose voice you haven\'t heard for months, whose face you haven\'t touched, you can\'t smell, you don\'t even have the chance to pass by the same street, you can\'t even be in the same photo, who is miles away from you, even by seas, islands and cities?','/wQp5H2QxaTVdyYZhcDMSk4tdAdb.jpg','2024-01-12',109,'Released','A story of long-distance love.','3391 Kilometers',1155739,1.8008,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35725,_binary '\0','/b4WXm5ahmtubYXy3wqHUG2nUKoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28363783',3.5,27381,'hi','अल्फा','When Sita, a highly trained assassin raised in isolation as a super-soldier by a rogue commander, discovers the dark truth about her family and her stolen childhood, she teams up with her long lost sister to take down her creator and his illicit military program.','/bPtRt3ajQ0EkyeQ1O6iJwAIi9Py.jpg','2026-07-02',141,'Released',NULL,'Alpha',1122030,11.3842,5.054,'YP1uSAggr6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35726,_binary '\0','/mKJb6AwKErlDTQVKgtsCqIAf2ZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28364203',4.7,2154,'hi','Non Stop Dhamaal','Satinder (Annu Kapoor), a film director with big dreams of working with famous stars, teams up with his friend Amar (Manoj Joshi), a struggling film writer, to find someone who can invest in their new film project. As the story unfolds, it takes us through a whirlwind of confusion, emotional moments, and loads of comedy.','/gxDjPPJsa6u5Cs0V4WDj11iqMsj.jpg','2023-08-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Non Stop Dhamaal',1166734,1.0607,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35727,_binary '\0','/d2LcfSjPO0L8esuRXqhQU10JzpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28364355',6.6,5659,'ml','വർഷങ്ങൾക്ക് ശേഷം','Set in the 1970s and \'80s, a man of many talents and an aspiring filmmaker come together in their shared ambition of making it big in the magical world of cinema. As they struggle with a burning desire to prove themselves, can their friendship survive the test of time?','/dVLqE9aEszo8yrc8TDk3bloYHHS.jpg','2024-04-11',165,'Released',NULL,'Varshangalkku Shesham',1151560,1.24,6.05,'50GJ7D_00NA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35728,_binary '\0','/xWYGs7o0lExX7XzdwyCFLZJ5C1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28364592',5.3,2198,'ru','Кракен','A Russian missile submarine disappears without trace during a secret mission in the Greenland Sea. A vessel is deployed to search for it, captained by the brother of the missing submarine’s commander. The search crew is tasked with locating the submarine and preventing a top-secret weapon from falling into enemy hands. Meanwhile, a geological research operation at the North Pole awakens the Kraken, a giant deep-water monster with an incredible ability to camouflage and an uncanny intelligence. As the search party narrows in on the missing submarine, they will encounter the legendary creature of the deep.','/c97Xlokfn4M6ZOQmt7OfXfLDwd5.jpg','2025-04-17',134,'Released',NULL,'Kraken',1258151,3.7721,6.73,'vuWiJCnIc6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35729,_binary '\0','/ka859fSJaVpTgM5rjkgtTq55UKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2836628',5.1,1702,'en','Johnny Frank Garrett\'s Last Word','When a young man is executed for committing murder, he leaves behind a curse letter, promising vengeance for all those connected to his unfair trial.','/l2ggnCpQwfnNKe5PVp3ENp0H6Jm.jpg','2016-03-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Johnny Frank Garrett\'s Last Word',310043,1.7399,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35730,_binary '\0','/xsnpgM2Si1hG7daLP1XE7uAfKKH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28366647',4.8,1490,'pl','Freestyle','Trying to check out a recording from his debut album, a street rapper and his friend run into trouble when a major drug deal turns into a total disaster for them.','/x6HrGmmpVUX8XBI9Vg4hbSsdBCX.jpg','2023-09-22',88,'Released',NULL,'Freestyle',1152797,1.3817,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35731,_binary '\0','/fuv2TxJb1retWu3XMwsVJqm8ylr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28366692',6.1,4164,'en','Janet Planet','In rural Western Massachusetts, 11-year-old Lacy spends the summer of 1991 at home, enthralled by her own imagination and the attention of her mother, Janet. As the months pass, three visitors enter their orbit, all captivated by Janet.','/i4qK3vQS4MD8OKhIkqSe3UK6OuH.jpg','2024-06-21',113,'Released','Everything changes in an instant.','Janet Planet',1037035,6.6681,6.2,'_aBF_v0gvpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35732,_binary '\0','/fgWZZzGk5SBcQSapa9Q1B4qlxWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28372289',6.9,1968,'ta','பரம்பொருள்','Aadhi, A troubled young man who desperately in need of money crosses path a self-centric police officer Maithreyan, during a theft. They both get involved in an idol smuggling and face the repercussions.','/9MeB5UtD7UPT22Vn10d8Ialvk19.jpg','2023-09-01',147,'Released',NULL,'Paramporul',1169883,1.1616,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35733,_binary '\0','/98OAz4zmtYAy022xdArKRgogqi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2837336',4.3,4024,'en','Amnesiac','The story of a man who wakes up in bed suffering from memory loss after being in an accident, only to begin to suspect that his wife may not be his real wife and that a web of lies and deceit deepen inside the house where he soon finds himself a prisoner.','/dazYq2JoKpKjtVySA9vmLCv16J.jpg','2015-08-14',90,'Released','What he can\'t remember is killing him.','Amnesiac',351043,2.7713,4.595,'A7y6yKruHdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35734,_binary '\0','/8bRIfPGDnmWgdy65LO8xtdcFmFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2837574',6.7,53045,'en','The Old Man & the Gun','The true story of Forrest Tucker, from his audacious escape from San Quentin at the age of 70 to an unprecedented string of heists that confounded authorities and enchanted the public. Wrapped up in the pursuit are a detective, who becomes captivated with Forrest’s commitment to his craft, and a woman, who loves him in spite of his chosen profession.','/a4BfxRK8dBgbQqbRxPs8kmLd8LG.jpg','2018-09-27',94,'Released','This story is mostly true.','The Old Man & the Gun',429203,6.024,6.4,'IdLQb9zN9OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35735,_binary '\0','/bhJT9N8Z4dORg8wsb9XleD5vaah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28377588',6.6,7170,'hi','Ground Zero','An Indian army officer embarks on a mission leading to India’s most successful counter-terrorism operation in history.','/x5YK8MkjL1vVsXxnGWifEOK2tJl.jpg','2025-04-25',137,'Released',NULL,'Ground Zero',1221198,1.0987,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35736,_binary '\0','/jijTbvaz8q8Fpega331tBFwQm3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2838678',6.6,5443,'en','A Royal Christmas','A young working girl with a blue-collar background is surprised when her new fiancé announces he is actually a prince of a small sovereign country in Europe. After the couple quickly takes off to spend the holidays at his family’s sprawling, royal castle, she must work hard to win over her disapproving and unaccepting future mother-in-law—the Queen—and find out if love truly can conquer all.','/r7wDZesIEdn9UJgqBLzulbFRhCr.jpg','2014-11-21',90,'Released',NULL,'A Royal Christmas',299582,2.3529,6.7,'Kua76tb2W54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35737,_binary '\0','/bmwtnqvzuuIlpcwy6kS8stSXHsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2841572',7.2,1939,'he','ערבים רוקדים','A young Arab is caught between cultures as he is sent to a prestigious Jewish boarding school in Israel in the 1980s.','/8cIW83Z4AJkPxhYUe2E97rwefGf.jpg','2014-07-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Dancing Arabs',282502,1.4211,6.5,'sdlBEyFMeg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35738,_binary '\0','/dLTRfeMseMZNylf7ezaHdwuVPAg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28419896',4.5,1353,'en','Street Trash','A group of homeless misfits must fight for survival when they discover a plot to exterminate every homeless person in the city.','/plOI2sV2bRZUkcngCNfz2zlU1Ip.jpg','2025-01-10',85,'Released','Melt the rich.','Street Trash',990204,1.5026,4.636,'sSsmGGQ2GcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35739,_binary '\0','/mRyCfbc3vZblB8slswmwovrEhTR.jpg','2026-1