:09.000000'),(35770,_binary '\0','/rJsHZLgwJDrhaXIePEF9a8KkaA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28494851',7.5,9943,'hi','Stolen','The five-month-old baby of impoverished tribal woman Jhumpa Mahato is stolen. Two brothers, Gautam and Raman, who witness the kidnapping, try to help her and become embroiled in the complexities of the investigation.','/xR5Endhjm4soY6fPgXY0jrpDZvL.jpg','2023-08-02',94,'Released','No good deed goes unpunished','Stolen',1156202,1.3695,7.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35771,_binary '\0','/g67QcnmbgLXZ3TCNjkUIo2oYwDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28497675',4.9,1844,'pt','Maníaco do Parque','An infamous serial killer who assaulted and killed several women in the \'90s, gets on a collision course with a young journalist eager for the truth and a career-changing article.','/xUIaDutJAWyfWEyZRcqaNWcoR55.jpg','2024-10-12',103,'Released','A Brazilian serial killer.','The Park Maniac',1156212,1.6421,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35772,_binary '\0','/k3xS5HuixDQXRFg4eX9vLohuGjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28498159',4.8,1568,'en','The Other','Unable to conceive, a couple seeks to build a family with a young orphan, survivor of tragic childhood. But their act of love turns to horror when they realize the violence in their foster\'s past has returned to destroy the new family.','/kE6FV8Lc9Aqir6OlgaNgnbFcy9E.jpg','2025-04-26',99,'Released',NULL,'The Other',1162858,4.0531,6.3,'ikQWID749hI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35773,_binary '\0','/i275mAQP4KhPtYUpMUgBGMmK4WN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28500290',4.6,1503,'en','Grizzly Night','On August 12, 1967, in Montana\'s Glacier National Park, the unthinkable happened: that same night, nine miles apart, there were not one—but two—fatal grizzly bear attacks.','/3ppOwa6PEtGsIiDPdZHUbEqgIY7.jpg','2026-01-30',93,'Released','Two attacks. One night.','Grizzly Night',1249508,7.3807,6.3,'K9QiCL3W-q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-