ant! This is surprising with her being a young hardened judge with strict morals. But what is more surprising is that, according to paternity testing, the child\'s father is none other than Bob, a criminal from the prosecution charged with an atrocious attack! Ariane doesn\'t remember any of what has happened, so she has no idea what to expect...','/6vCLklvrl7ogr6DywSV3v5XyKk9.jpg','2013-09-07',82,'Released',NULL,'9 Month Stretch',200713,2.3253,6.432,'nzZBp0NYRxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35795,_binary '\0','/nCRLG0OzsP4U5IddWCIZzDoAWLA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28539705',6.6,2436,'ta','ஸ்டார்','Follows a youngster Kalai and his aspirations of becoming a \'Star\' in the Tamil Film Industry. Born in a lower-middle-class family, will Kalai overcome all his struggles to emerge as a Star?','/c74qjGjs6XEKYDTYc1bxRzRkigT.jpg','2024-05-10',157,'Released','The Universe always falls in Love with a Stubborn Heart','Star',1276338,1.4533,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35796,_binary '\0','/96chPcURxg5thGyLqxO6otyxHFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28540171',3.9,23358,'hi','Welcome To The Jungle','A group of quirky characters gets stuck in a dangerous jungle during a chaotic mission. Filled with confusion, criminals, and hilarious situations, they must work together to survive and find their way out.','/1JlfUuvvX5xLP2LIDah4JhWUtTx.jpg','2026-06-25',170,'Released','Fake film. Real jungle. Real danger. Real idiots!','Welcome To The Jungle',1169516,5.1017,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35797,_binary '\0','/usECtTaJPG8TDIilRXWm0rfLfbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2854394',3.4,3959,'en','Hot Bot','Hot Bot is the hilarious journey of two sexually repressed and unpopular teenage geeks who accidentally discover a life-like super-model sex bot.','/fHUxi5HjpVjSpw5JKgGgiriVbGO.jpg','2016-03-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Hot Bot',385317,2.6558,4.3,'4AFUW-svw2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000')