12',140,'Released',NULL,'Heer Express',1525636,1.042,5.3,'ORdm2BEIl5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35889,_binary '\0','/pwsSGCxAJ8ZKvkcpSDxMBEjCwSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28754394',5.4,1821,'en','Monster Inside: America\'s Most Extreme Haunted House','Russ McKamey is the creator of the world\'s \"most extreme haunted house\" - McKamey Manor. He is also a manipulative abuser, according to three people who realize the horror is never over once you decide to enter the Manor.','/5qXF43ZW6liSInXRXDdNpnxphAb.jpg','2023-10-12',80,'Released','A true story of real terror.','Monster Inside: America\'s Most Extreme Haunted House',1168842,1.383,6.1,'vYexezLbQDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35890,_binary '\0','/pCswOJxaoRjOLGuhWEagoResqHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28755837',6,2111,'ml','ജയ് ഗണേഷ്','In the unforgiving shadows of sympathy, Ganesh Gangadharan, a paraplegic designer, wrestles with his inner demons, striving for a semblance of normalcy.','/5t06YuOR93cqD2egserG91MhD4X.jpg','2024-04-11',125,'Released','Drive. Thrive. Survive.','Jai Ganesh',1168528,0.8233,5.5,'Opt0jkNtCTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35891,_binary '\0','/yLtSpzKeGKx5aa4oTLV8y00RxHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28756876',6.2,4596,'en','Einstein and the Bomb','What happened after Einstein fled Nazi Germany? Using archival footage and his own words, this docudrama dives into the mind of a tortured genius.','/hWRKHXKfu2WJGICdVpKZ0jEKsbp.jpg','2024-02-16',77,'Released',NULL,'Einstein and the Bomb',1168709,4.2291,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35892,_binary '\0','/4Unl45xJNZmEHv0cTMXUSBmoRhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2875926',7,2781,'ku','My Sweet Pepper Land','Baran, a war hero, becomes sheriff of the capital and refuses to bow down to a tribal chief.','/qYBudGM3Sik7NEJg9mqmzj6fyZ0.jpg','2014-03-20',86,'Released','A Kurdish western!','My Sweet Pepper Land',188765,1.8412,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35893,_binary '\0','/3g5gCox9WTtKFYaSmtOXdtxYC8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28763074',5.7,4467,'id','Badarawuhi di Desa Penari','Mila must return a mystical bracelet to the \"Dancing Village,\" unaware that Badarawuhi - a mysterious, mythical being who rules the village - awaits her.','/A4kY5RKiPJ0sRknU4NojItr93Jr.jpg','2024-04-11',122,'Released','What mysteries will be revealed in the dancing village?','Dancing Village: The Curse Begins',1176166,2.6686,5.855,'dkbwPpPJCLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35894,_binary '\0','/1eg3lmXN8BU9NVFBPXiIgK9Tkx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2876428',7.6,3168,'en','Guten Tag, Ramón','After five failed attempts to go to the United States, 18-year-old Ramón decides to look for a friend’s aunt in Germany, but never finds her. With no papers or money, and without knowing the language, he barely survives living on the street until he meets Ruth, an old retired nurse who doesn’t speak Spanish. Beyond language barriers and prejudices, they discover that solidarity and humanity make life bearable.','/7xaQAc01TZOHEku2uC520OIENWx.jpg','2013-10-21',119,'Released',NULL,'Good Day, Ramon',242575,1.6634,7.9,'3ndNBS0ZdTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35895,_binary '\0','/2TyF1dCr3iknkO0c8h5v8Ys97qQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28766949',6.2,5716,'th','ยูเรนัส 2324','Bonded in their youth and separated by tragedy, an astronaut and a free diver bend the laws of space and time in their efforts to be together again.','/zTD9HytRG1nfP5pdOAYmPyXj05d.jpg','2024-07-04',148,'Released','Love is bigger than the universe and deeper than the ocean.','Uranus 2324',1167366,2.3913,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35896,_binary '\0','/kPDhJ0abEc8OCulKgE1PNLzRj68.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28769440',5.8,2591,'es','Descansar en paz','A debt-ridden father takes advantage of an unforeseen situation to disappear and live off the grid under a false identity. But a chance event occurs and the temptation to want to know his family resurfaces.','/rQTpmzVlg55Fj0IXnkhzOyBP6kz.jpg','2024-03-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Rest in Peace',1106049,2.159,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35897,_binary '\0','/x6IRyKjmjgRiexFGBtPmhwwzkLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2877104',6.9,3195,'ta','எதிர் நீச்சல்','Kunchithapatham\'s unique name becomes the butt of joke and ridicule for others. He relates his failures to his name and wants to change it. He meets an astrologer who is popular in giving fancy names that could bring luck to people. His named his changed to Harish and soon after his luck changes.','/i8ZM9Z8EOFb6sQknTuhsvklDXe6.jpg','2013-05-01',134,'Released',NULL,'Ethir Neechal',151363,1.3503,6.4,'JHaTrO-ANpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35898,_binary '\0','/mCprpDjgemFqjKvfbxDJUfR9JWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2877108',8.2,13673,'ta','சூது கவ்வும்','Dass specialises in small time kidnapping and has his own set of rules. The primary and most important among them is not to get involved with influential people. Three jobless youngsters meet Dass and the four take up an assignment for a hefty sum that throws away this primary rule and end up being chased by a dreaded policeman.','/xItyli68pnToohrriXVhWlKe15B.jpg','2013-05-01',138,'Released','Rules Can\'t Be Broken','Soodhu Kavvum',189227,1.5775,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35899,_binary '\0','/cywr26aku0SRTvn1ks6HRoF4SGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28772978',6.1,2322,'fi','Hevimpi reissu','The world\'s hardest - and weirdest - heavy metal band Impaled Rektum is serving their sentence in Norway\'s nicest prison. They receive word that guitarist Lotvonen\'s parents\' reindeer herding farm is about to come under the hammer. It will take a big gig and big money to save the farm. A breakout ensues and a trip to the world\'s biggest heavy festival, Wacken in northern Germany begins. The higher the target, the bigger the obstacles. This is what the boys will experience on their epic journey to the main stage of Wacken - every metalhead\'s heaven.','/fSCxOGXm7mfEU6Y5VEAufnDZPOx.jpg','2024-10-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Heavier Trip',716808,1.5183,6.7,'zpV9V-EcwtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35900,_binary '\0','/mje7UHKBiIOQglqoXIRlU4rFHVl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28784834',6.4,1251,'it','Il corpo','Rich entrepreneur Rebecca Zuin has died from an alleged heart attack, raising suspicions on the part of a police inspector after her body disappears from the morgue. When her handsome young husband becomes a suspect, he starts thinking she may have faked her death to sadistically torment him.','/AdimvmZwDiItYRzMerSiSakX0q4.jpg','2024-11-28',115,'Released','Nobody is innocent.','The Body',1198877,2.6069,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35901,_binary '\0','/mFt9CKVUhoT6V84tSsA0EQk4HEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28789314',6.1,2374,'kn','ಮಾದೇವ','A stoic villager named Maadeva falls for Parvathi, discovering emotions and human bonds. As he opens his heart to life and relationships, conflicts with rival families test his newfound understanding.','/kdEWBpXscXN6MNUFi6NJhZaSiR5.jpg','2025-05-30',135,'Released',NULL,'Maadeva',1494159,0.8028,0,'lsLsirMSvXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35902,_binary '\0','/56VfTGANetZ5IIYQsXuciNePM28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28793125',6.9,5391,'sv','Den svenska länken','Swedish Foreign Ministry bureaucrat Gösta Engzell, overlooked during WWII, rescued thousands while turning supposedly neutral Sweden into a moral force. His efforts challenged the status quo and left a lasting humanitarian legacy.','/ytruJRp7Ba82IU6s8yAY0HPw5xr.jpg','2026-02-13',102,'Released',NULL,'The Swedish Connection',1261188,5.3073,7.381,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35903,_binary '\0','/k8TRjMqUkS3dv3PluvNkZ6rXC58.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28800663',6.5,3535,'ml','Paradise','An Indian tourist couple arrive in the hill country of crisis ridden Sri Lanka to celebrate their 5th wedding anniversary. But, when things take an unexpected turn, conflicts deepen revealing cracks in their relationship.','/pYl7ydDvidoaM2Q8pLx8rGn8WRg.jpg','2024-06-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Paradise',1170659,0.8269,6,'LHlMvrSVR0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35904,_binary '\0','/oH6Pan7upyAPY8sGSJ1WmYmTcuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28802657',6.1,14135,'hi','दे दे प्यार दे २','When Ashish meets his girlfriend\'s parents for the first time, their age difference sparks outrage and a madcap plot to drive him out of her life.','/g3J7r2t3L9HEgyWMX0Fki04Swtu.jpg','2025-11-13',146,'Released',NULL,'De De Pyaar De 2',1214835,2.6875,6.6,'59aIp7SfIIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35905,_binary '\0','/vtHPTu4oS6jZCETuSrXbWXXwNl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28803144',7.6,1684,'ta','அலங்கு','Centres around the clashes between Kerala\'s political group and Tamil Nadu\'s tribal youths.','/Rmovt5T8GD3gX8Y6rvWmw6b0Yl.jpg','2024-12-27',131,'Released',NULL,'Alangu',1384671,0.8733,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35906,_binary '\0','/l5afi0epnkLp761GTpYe1GVZy4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2880448',7,1483,'en','Chaos on the Bridge','Canadian acting legend William Shatner takes viewers inside the creation of Star Trek: The Next Generation, the bold attempt in 1986 to recreate the success of the original television series, in which Shatner played Captain James T. Kirk.','/r8yenzDNnHmIfP0es7n2xzOJTSQ.jpg','2014-08-25',59,'Released','The Untold Story Behind an Iconic Sci-Fi Franchise','Chaos on the Bridge',347497,1.7354,6.9,'DvNdCjc-3Ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35907,_binary '\0','/5fcgVd59PJabzJsBaZqYJUXYJ4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2881034',7.3,1852,'bn','প্রলয়','The story revolves around a brave heart Barun Biswas, who raised voice against numerous gang rapes in a village called Dukhiya. Dukhiya, where gang rapes had become a festival. These were celebrated by some political criminals.','/vUwK6raCjkY5x1SwN4PTdoFTTzc.jpg','2013-08-09',122,'Released',NULL,'Proloy',236031,1.2878,6.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35908,_binary '\0','/DO8hv826sNyll2pW7lW6aShREE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28810493',5.6,5101,'en','The Devil on Trial','Explore the first – and only – time “demonic possession” has officially been used as a defense in a U.S. murder trial. Including firsthand accounts of alleged devil possession and a shocking murder, this extraordinary story forces reflection on our fear of the unknown.','/qqPIhVKPHePyGqQxbo4gpznsJsA.jpg','2023-10-17',81,'Released','Did the devil do it?','The Devil on Trial',1171989,3.956,5.9,'7YPoyoCR9K4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35909,_binary '\0','/stBBSoTudhuGosaX3pcGHKWQcuS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28812582',5.6,29222,'hi','आँखों की गुस्ताखियाँ','When a blind musician and a theatre artist meet on a train and travel through the majestic Himalayas, they fall in love regardless of their apparent flaws. What happens when life takes over?','/bH4aCEYqF6JMAlfulFmmG0pSN8.jpg','2025-07-11',141,'Released',NULL,'Aankhon Ki Gustaakhiyan',1238170,0.9237,6.8,'JbCwz-1OHWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35910,_binary '\0','/wVJG3u5Ru9tInxYiTCrJr4MpJ7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28814949',8,26223,'en','TAYLOR SWIFT | THE ERAS TOUR','A concert film documenting Taylor Swift\'s record-breaking Eras Tour (2023-2024). Filmed during the Los Angeles shows, the film captures the tour\'s ten acts, each representing a different musical era from Swift\'s career. The film showcases over 40 songs, elaborate stage productions, and Swift\'s performance.','/jf3YO8hOqGHCupsREf5qymYq1n.jpg','2023-10-13',169,'Released','It\'s been a long time coming.','TAYLOR SWIFT | THE ERAS TOUR',1160164,5.8492,8.2,'5UBl0rLEl0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35911,_binary '\0','/x3mF2JRMwaKXZBIdiRHrUq2W5ux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2881698',5.1,5331,'en','Skinwalker Ranch','In 2010 “Skinwalker Ranch” gained media attention after experiencing a wide range of unexplained phenomena. Reports ranged from UFO sightings to livestock mutilation, but maybe most notable was the disappearance of ranch owner Hoyt Miller’s eight-year-old son Cody on November 11, 2010. Close to a year later, Modern Defense Enterprises has sent a team of experts to document and investigate the mysterious occurrences, which only escalate upon their arrival. Tensions rise as the team must decide how far they will go to unlock the mysteries of “Skinwalker Ranch.” The group debates whether the answers are worth risking their lives for, or if they should just call off the investigation and leave the ranch—that is, if leaving is actually an option…','/gqEfe007ZEa8WwWZAXl57zu4o0s.jpg','2013-10-30',86,'Released','There is a place The Unexplained calls home','Skinwalker Ranch',224815,1.9879,5.3,'o-dgQwP-miQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35912,_binary '\0','/ctzeHu8S4pubfRYy38fxQPSKbqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28818121',7.1,2219,'en','3 Bed, 2 Bath, 1 Ghost','A ghost from the 1920s refuses to leave the home just listed by Anna, a new real estate agent. Worse, the spirit is convinced she cannot \"pass over\" until she gets Anna back together with her ex.','/hrOWLQxK7zXybn7RUqBRLYxzPqP.jpg','2023-10-07',84,'Released',NULL,'3 Bed, 2 Bath, 1 Ghost',1160972,2.3203,7,'p6Z0hoZFJHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35913,_binary '\0','/jBnnkkXRZ0pV3Tw31Z2ALO638wA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28820189',7.3,3226,'te','MAD','Set in an engineering college and revolves around the antics of the students there, primarily the boys, who get a kick out of torturing the hostel warden.','/rPcCHNdyqwfck4UkvbUPuZyao4f.jpg','2023-10-06',124,'Released',NULL,'MAD',1187075,1.863,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35914,_binary '\0','/8lL13GCrlOii2KvMaSom2rC16Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28821371',6.3,12830,'fr','MadS','A teenager stops off to see his dealer to test a new drug before heading off for a night of partying. On the way home, he picks up an injured woman, and the night takes a surreal turn.','/hLJJT2vTGPSRKlTOBe68xjQCCob.jpg','2024-10-25',89,'Released',NULL,'MadS',1262983,4.4323,6.434,'Vm6_MDnj3Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35915,_binary '\0','/1fYIvYIwAWID27ZsmpOzAcEDOCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28821588',5.8,4067,'fr','Le Mangeur d\'âmes','When the disappearance of children and bloody murders multiply in a small mountain village, an old legend shrouded in sulphur reappears... Commander Guardiano and Captain of the Gendarmerie De Rolan are forced to join forces to uncover the truth.','/8XsQVmGQukwIVDM88Aa0C7L5hCp.jpg','2024-04-24',111,'Released',NULL,'The Soul Eater',1084863,4.225,6.184,'aCJgWqMpgMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35916,_binary '\0','/viPf6kTYU0LyryNPhGfQExxGbcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2882328',7.9,25652,'hi','Ugly','When a 10-year old girl goes missing, her stepfather races against time to investigate the kidnapping.','/7hsSumOuh6OO7PgsH7A58I46j8.jpg','2013-05-17',128,'Released',NULL,'Ugly',191726,1.567,7,'4ougQY2-zpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35917,_binary '\0','/vpna0mCmq9SUGgrIZdOBDarisFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2883352',4.7,2977,'en','White Settlers','Young urban couple Ed and Sarah are set to begin a new life when they move from London into an isolated borders Scottish farmhouse. After falling in love with the 19th century Castle Farm and seeing its potential as a fixer-upper they are anxious to get started on the renovations. In bed on their first night Sarah thinks she can hear noises in the darkness but Ed is disbelieving saying it’s her imagination playing tricks. Persisting in her fear they are not alone in the house, she forces Ed to investigate. When he doesn’t return after a scarily long period, she goes downstairs to investigate only to be confronted by a welcoming committee of masked intruders. As she desperately searches for Ed, a terrifying game of cat and mouse ensues with the mysterious assailants. But what do they want and what horrors do they have planned for the two newcomers?','/4ZHn7bRe83Y6ZGd5chL5kNJUqZI.jpg','2014-09-05',83,'Released','They don\'t belong here.','White Settlers',279968,1.3965,4.6,'WGA7R-4uThM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35918,_binary '\0','/kC1IdzVibYoLrAVrtky7sWI4kPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28833698',6.1,1548,'de','Zwei zu Eins','After the fall of the Berlin Wall, a communist family discovers a bunker full of money soon to be worthless. With the help of their neighbors, they embark on a race against time to enter the capitalist world in style.','/xsPzWqghFcKSgcts1Ixw5roLi5U.jpg','2024-07-25',116,'Released','The best things in life are free.','Two to One',1208284,2.6785,6.3,'xkLIK_TSdp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35919,_binary '\0','/759wfisWoD7eJZmi1wi6Y0cW3jw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2883434',6.7,14617,'en','Black or White','A grieving widower is drawn into a custody battle over his granddaughter, whom he helped raise her entire life.','/hOxxudUwgh5KGC7LtxDCkkwn1YP.jpg','2015-01-30',121,'Released','There\'s more to family than what you see.','Black or White',253331,3.2574,6.8,'yqlE-7PP7Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35920,_binary '\0','/b9Pz2q4mikCXHABrc4wYdoi117d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2883448',6,1345,'en','Cash Only','Elvis Martini is in deep trouble. His dilapidated Detroit apartment building is about to be foreclosed on by the bank; most of his tenants are behind on rent; he\'s in big debt to bookies and his daughter\'s school. He finds some ill-gotten cash in an evicted tenant\'s apartment and it briefly keeps the wolves at bay, but it brings out a bigger wolf, one that wants his stolen money back. When his daughter is kidnapped by the mysterious menace he\'s accidentally messed with, Elvis has 24 hours to come up with $25K - cash only.','/yTck6GtitvERKNfalHmW65ZCFSg.jpg','2015-07-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Cash Only',350839,1.6506,5,'REDIRmYcCUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35921,_binary '\0','/uK2q3uZO6yd5aS9C6u1mJmtGdgU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28834646',6.5,1408,'sl','Kaj ti je deklica','Introverted 16-year-old Lucia befriends a popular student after joining an all-girl choir at Catholic school. When the choir travels to a convent for a weekend of rehearsals, Lucia starts to navigate the unfamiliar surroundings, complex teenage social structures, and her own sexual awakening.','/etH5TJk18eua1i4xke8E2rYEpqB.jpg','2025-08-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Little Trouble Girls',1019871,4.4712,6.8,'Rm9m7u-NsN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35922,_binary '\0','/igVNCpS132rOqrnDsrVYW5HCIsM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2883512',7.3,254001,'en','Chef','When Chef Carl Casper suddenly quits his job at a prominent Los Angeles restaurant after refusing to compromise his creative integrity for its controlling owner, he is left to figure out what\'s next. Finding himself in Miami, he teams up with his ex-wife, his friend and his son to launch a food truck. Taking to the road, Chef Carl goes back to his roots to reignite his passion for the kitchen -- and zest for life and love.','/hyp8EXDmO4dSC8V6Q5jU7gD1kcg.jpg','2014-05-08',114,'Released','Starting from scratch never tasted so good.','Chef',212778,7.2971,7.114,'5xlHJAEaf-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35923,_binary '\0','/gkJkemR5EUFYRrO6YFZFFMKZIru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2884018',6.6,62112,'en','Macbeth','Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth murders his king and takes the throne for himself.','/a5NEpil29Uns1wEYF8k99qVgj1T.jpg','2015-09-22',113,'Released','All hail Macbeth that shall be king','Macbeth',225728,4.6005,6.4,'017nWFKsshY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35924,_binary '\0','/k2GUm99l4EBV3LzVqwr97zV3DoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28840429',5.9,2216,'en','Ice Cold: Murder, Coffee and Jessica Wongso','This documentary delves into the unanswered questions surrounding the trial of Jessica Wongso — years after the death of her best friend, Mirna Salihin.','/duv6wtHMuN74HF7UuLjvUUrn8dB.jpg','2023-09-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Ice Cold: Murder, Coffee and Jessica Wongso',1172499,0.9054,6.3,'CmWAcjlOzd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35925,_binary '\0','/cr8pv3Iel9T5Z3WTJX5VqvdIpAm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2884206',7.3,142476,'en','I Origins','A molecular biologist\'s study of the human eye has far-reaching implications about humanity\'s scientific and spiritual beliefs.','/k9y9RQ5T2qcCALoVVHjIgAxRICb.jpg','2014-07-18',106,'Released',NULL,'I Origins',244267,9.0066,7.565,'sEGppIgwKf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35926,_binary '\0','/jFJzscHXN9vbHRobRZZ49PkrJvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2885364',5.1,14578,'en','Willow Creek','Looking to make a splash online with his research videos into the existence of Bigfoot, Jim and his girlfriend Kelly take a camping trip to the small town of Willow Creek, California, and the surrounding mountains where the infamous footage of the supposed sasquatch was filmed.','/79JtBWsWmG6zhektBbwq0u8r9pE.jpg','2013-05-02',80,'Released','Believe the legend... fear the truth.','Willow Creek',185460,1.9174,5.1,'3RIibha5YaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35927,_binary '\0','/zHkJDrEGfvgo86bIhhHDYXl9iJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2885628',5.6,5580,'en','Nina Forever','Rob is grief-stricken following the death of his girlfriend Nina, but after a failed suicide attempt he begins to move on from the tragedy and falls for his colleague Holly. Holly loves Rob and tries to help him through his grief – even if it means contending with Nina, who comes back from the dead, bloody and broken, every time they make love.','/jiEXXGnNMLRmlvmchDZkPNdbhXD.jpg','2016-01-19',98,'Released','A fucked up fairy tale','Nina Forever',323694,1.7391,5.3,'1Ibup6I1vEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35928,_binary '\0','/aMD179LsRq3oyFeAUSjij3dDtRX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28856462',7.6,3967,'id','Agak Laen','Four friends, working in a haunted house ride at a night market, unintentionally cause the death of an elderly man with heart disease through fright. They decide to bury his body within the haunted house, which turns out to be beneficial for the attraction... at least for a little while.','/lUOwyPbDD9Agl3pHQVHGbZE0TvI.jpg','2024-02-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Agak Laen',1175161,1.9765,7.194,'y7tZL3zjE_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35929,_binary '\0','/7W9IRzYMu5ioZdJJXAuEwqBALZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28857146',8,6030,'kn','ಸಪ್ತ ಸಾಗರದಾಚೆ ಎಲ್ಲೊ - ಸೈಡ್ ಬಿ','Manu is released from prison and strives to rekindle his love with Priya.','/7DIsSaRDmmyDViTwfl9RqV9zQTn.jpg','2023-11-17',146,'Released',NULL,'Sapta Sagaradaache Ello - Side B',1168102,1.6018,7.104,'Lov_011EEHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35930,_binary '\0','/5UlQDjIuJ0t8q4anVxzkW06FrDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28865980',6.8,4540,'en','American Symphony','Musician Jon Batiste attempts to compose a symphony as his wife, writer Suleika Jaouad, undergoes cancer treatment.','/skfO62LOEg805x9fMYeEDQRorXP.jpg','2023-11-24',104,'Released',NULL,'American Symphony',1171816,2.6746,6.544,'wKSMsdq8ONs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35931,_binary '\0','/k1jt991hPYk1SeT01F6ieSzpY4f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2886632',7.5,2727,'sr','Енклава','Nenad, ten years Christian boy from a Serbian enclave, determined to create a proper community burial for his late grandfather, crosses enemy lines and makes friends among the Muslim majority in deeply divided, war-torn Kosovo.','/k9YsHoZSosaVcwgQhj0yIVoA2eG.jpg','2015-03-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Enclave',333846,1.6625,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35932,_binary '\0','/wu0IdDztqil6cTE2KCzCljBouLg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2886926',7.3,1894,'pt','Os Gatos Não Têm Vertigens','Jô is kicked out of home by his father on his birthday. Having no place to go, he takes refuge in the terrace of Rose, who just lost her husband.','/fHzuZLYGWF7GLgMD4l7LWqdivjt.jpg','2014-09-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Cats Don\'t Have Vertigo',280633,1.1646,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35933,_binary '\0','/w3bhwlkr8nI8vdv55IKuJMtT46c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28870064',6.7,4209,'te','Tantiram','Balachandran avoids interaction with women, preferring to seek time alone due to a traumatic past with his mother. Everything changes when he meets the beautiful Alagini, who changes him into a jovial and loving person. However, wedded bliss doesn\'t last when a tricky supernatural entity enters Balachandran\'s life.','/vTvQXnK2U3vtTMhHOVGteOud3av.jpg','2023-10-06',99,'Released',NULL,'Tantiram',1181893,2.0655,5.8,'OfafhADikUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35934,_binary '\0','/iNF1V0adYX4Q6xEjU4ga5zNrEfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2887322',5.5,2240,'en','The Saratov Approach','An inspirational true story. On what seemed like any other day, Elders Travis Tuttle (Corbin Allred) and Andrew Propst (Maclain Nelson) are approached by Nikolai (Nikita Bogolyubov) to teach a friend. But then the missionaries experience the unimaginable - they are kidnapped, beaten, and held for ransom. While their families, friends, and the world pray for their safe release, Tuttle and Propst are tested physically, emotionally, and most of all spiritually.','/iRBQn1zWbtw5YbxjbuAPHqL81qg.jpg','2013-10-09',101,'Released','Kidnapped, Ransomed, Delivered','The Saratov Approach',224076,1.4333,6,'V84ZyMsQ1Pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35935,_binary '\0','/ld3PIgbveWOPF2B8s5iwENDk7YM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28876088',7.3,1409,'sk','Otec','The life of a man after he experiences forgotten baby syndrome, unintentionally leaving his infant daughter in the back seat of his car.','/eQZxm6cSRwrXT4410slJnJhGbdd.jpg','2025-09-11',99,'Released',NULL,'Father',1516518,1.9109,6.5,'Y0T_5i6ZE98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35936,_binary '\0','/19Shb0Xn0PeLXA4CkT2TIIvxaR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2888046',7,65460,'cn','葉問3','When a band of brutal gangsters led by a crooked property developer make a play to take over the city, Master Ip is forced to take a stand.','/8PvinaGEqzf1rrfFAxiXujJnCtI.jpg','2015-12-24',105,'Released','The legend continues, the grandmaster returns.','Ip Man 3',365222,5.8364,7,'-6-Uq1D_o2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35937,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2889234',6.2,1781,'ta','தீய வேலை செய்யனும் குமாரு','A man falls in love with a woman, a new recruit in his company. He seeks guidance from the `Love Guru\' to win her heart, but problems arise when the guru learns that the man is in love with his sister.','/hf1kqqTjUrPM6maD6KCgqwU9GNB.jpg','2013-06-14',125,'Released',NULL,'Theeya Velai Seiyyanum Kumaru',190663,0.8575,5.4,'UsjQKtjr4e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35938,_binary '\0','/mzFrOTrXcHBmosdDL04Yv12GnRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2891070',6.8,3750,'fr','Hippocrate','Benjamin is meant to be a great doctor, he’s certain of it. But his first experience as a junior doctor in the hospital ward where his father works doesn’t turn out the way he hoped it would. Responsibility is overwhelming, his father is all but present, and his co-junior partner, a foreign doctor, is far more experimented than he is. This internship will force Benjamin to confront his limits… and start his way to adulthood.','/qOwNCoSG0Kxwj13IboP4lNOJkpD.jpg','2014-09-03',101,'Released','Diary of a French Doctor','Hippocrates',271724,2.1415,6.5,'Lc61Di-g-E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35939,_binary '\0','/icCQi9Tnyx86C987IoIFchxqMof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2891174',7.1,42034,'en','99 Homes','After his family is evicted from their home, proud and desperate construction worker Dennis Nash tries to win his home back by striking a deal with the devil and working for Rick Carver, the corrupt real estate broker who evicted him.','/6Zul5Spndok1WriSMfiyQFbAyLY.jpg','2015-09-25',112,'Released','Greed is the only game in town.','99 Homes',283235,5.3768,6.809,'sfttvNCIJvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35940,_binary '\0','/gWIyXGdzd2s1OFSXEa199EPQ92S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2893490',5.5,8480,'en','Manglehorn','AJ Manglehorn is an aging, ordinary guy in a small town. He nurses his sick cat, squeezes out a conversation with the local bank teller every Friday, and eats at the same place every day. But there is more to Manglehorn than meets the eye: he’s an ex-con who, 40 years ago, gave up the woman of his dreams for a big ‘job’. After a dramatic effort to start over, Manglehorn faces a terrifying moment and is unmasked as a guy with a very, very dark past.','/ms27YhpvgE5b0JIwaNiWw6EDC8g.jpg','2015-06-03',97,'Released','You get one shot at life. Try not to miss.','Manglehorn',254905,3.0031,5.426,'fA41l0Gtzpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35941,_binary '\0','/OEIcLCcHAdIXq8jWOBUNd6nkXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2893780',5.5,1967,'en','Convict','Set in the dark and old Parramatta prison built by the original convicts our lead character Ray a war veteran finds himself serving 18 months for manslaughter after defending his fiance. He soon realizes that the prison boss has it in for him and does everything possible to break Ray even going after his fiance.','/mnvkok7eVau9Fg8BMDuwmk8JCZw.jpg','2014-01-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Convict',245527,2.6396,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35942,_binary '\0','/fvUWuX1S9CPd3ojPj2TvY371ln9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28937890',7.4,1218,'th','เพื่อน(ไม่)สนิท','A group of high school students who dream of making films set out to make a short film based on the life of a classmate. However, they discover a secret that could change their vision of filmmaking forever.','/i3uTKXGNRrRCeCNIFvmpmDCmo5b.jpg','2023-10-26',129,'Released','Filmmaking is Friend-Making.','Not Friends',1093215,1.8129,7.364,'2ZZtD18W2Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35943,_binary '\0','/wUp0bUXaveR40ikBhDgWwNTijuD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28943278',4.7,2396,'en','Heart of the Hunter','A retired assassin is pulled back into action when his friend uncovers a dangerous conspiracy at the heart of the South African government.','/n726fdyL1dGwt15bY7Nj3XOXc4Q.jpg','2024-03-28',108,'Released','One man. One mission. One target.','Heart of the Hunter',1181548,3.706,5.766,'KSCFWJvcYXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35944,_binary '\0','/ick2XJQrRCa711VtGOr2G6Xk4OR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2896036',7,6907,'es','Vivir es fácil con los ojos cerrados','Spain, 1966. An English teacher who travels to Almería when he hears that John Lennon is making a film there befriends with a 16-year-old boy who has run away from home and a young girl who also seems to be running away from something.','/zqjtRmZuTxfIKTfxKCOKYThI9hU.jpg','2013-10-31',108,'Released','1966. They were looking for John Lennon and found themselves.','Living Is Easy with Eyes Closed',209415,3.0945,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35945,_binary '\0','/6DfHl4CE88x7Rt9oyARQQm6bHXD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28961625',5.2,1447,'kn','ಮಾರ್ಕ್','Mark is suspended from his police duties for his unruly yet effective ways of operating, but when 18 children are abducted and found dead, races to catch the criminals. With only 18 hours left, he must confront powerful foes and use unconventional tactics to succeed.','/6LTDv6XHiHN0N77QIFg2tidVvhh.jpg','2025-12-25',144,'Released',NULL,'Mark',1510339,2.0646,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35946,_binary '\0','/54gMF1WVh92setXVJOZCQ8M9bnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2896932',6.7,1256,'en','Repeat Attenders','The theatre. Each year, millions of people attend to escape reality. But for a select few, the theatre IS their reality, with some of them seeing the same show hundreds of times. They are Repeat Attenders. 5 years in the making, Repeat Attenders is a groundbreaking feature documentary, that delves into the psychology behind the extreme superfans of broadway musicals. They reveal their lives. They reveal their obsessions. Now it\'s their time to be in the spotlight.','/AjVuiZMfqp6uslcy3q9jZK7StYA.jpg','2020-02-19',80,'Released','The theatre. Each year, millions of people attend to escape reality. But for a select few, the theatre IS their reality.','Repeat Attenders',673368,0.8944,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35947,_binary '\0','/xtl3LaCTveZkArTv0DgvDDrXptl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28970408',6.4,4249,'te','Matti Katha','Set in a rustic village near Hyderabad, this evocative story follows three college-bound friends, their youthful joys, and the loss of cherished ancestral land. A gripping family drama unfolds, unveiling a village leader\'s sinister conspiracy.','/hceweZ2pcrZ2a40pqBEGegTbO4W.jpg','2023-10-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Matti Katha',1190487,0.7135,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35948,_binary '\0','/7Hw8vb40Q33nbmXREHtbZjwOwAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28970800',8.9,1268,'hu','THEVR10: A dokumentumfilm',NULL,'/euaIvm9Z5AaPKRQSLkmmYbQ3fiZ.jpg','2023-10-05',112,'Released',NULL,'THEVR10: A dokumentumfilm',1174716,0.6992,9.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35949,_binary '\0','/ce7Yf72dvF4t409i5beC5xWe2M3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28989465',6.3,3591,'te','అలా నిన్ను చేరి',NULL,'/lzmQLunkSKIy5sPedTwhgJ3yMtQ.jpg','2023-11-10',158,'Released',NULL,'Alaa Ninnu Cheri',1069928,0.7003,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35950,_binary '\0','/3H8u03qr9se2pCv3QTHR1gxSa9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28995566',6.7,1733,'de','Duell am Abgrund','Fearless alpine climbers Ueli Steck and Dani Arnold enter into a death-defying rivalry to set speed records on the Swiss Alps\' great north faces.','/tI9ybrWLiVLljLsNoqEjQF36oG4.jpg','2023-10-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Race to the Summit',1174725,2.023,6.877,'wEzoqk5jdMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35951,_binary '\0','/82C04rTiXYZ7c8XZv91Nu53w82Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28996126',6.3,104451,'en','Nobody 2','Former assassin Hutch Mansell takes his family on a nostalgic vacation to a small-town theme park, only to be pulled back into violence when they clash with a corrupt operator, a crooked sheriff, and a ruthless crime boss.','/svXVRoRSu6zzFtCzkRsjZS7Lqpd.jpg','2025-08-13',89,'Released','Nobody ruins his vacation.','Nobody 2',1007734,20.9767,6.917,'-5X2pt95cIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35952,_binary '\0','/fvpe6SoahGJSXAyaR3fGtJn9WOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28997111',6.9,3821,'ml','ആനന്ദപുരം ഡയറീസ്','After facing rough times in life, Nandini, a resilient and tough woman returns to Law College to finish her education. She finds solace in new friendships. Unknowingly she gets into dangerous conflicts that threaten the social fabric of society.','/ms9eCf2pSNlQQy4mW7UQuzBf2Sm.jpg','2024-03-01',114,'Released',NULL,'Anandapuram Diaries',1177652,0.799,3,'6zpG2K0x3m4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35953,_binary '\0','/1NIAoD8mWBfmqRpZiXVrxcAH873.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt28999532',4.9,2200,'en','Beezel','Over six tumultuous decades, three unwitting guests of a cursed New England home stumble upon a sinister secret dwelling beneath its floors - an eternal witch with an insatiable thirst for the flesh of the living.','/a9gZxhG98LATZJGy1vWssyjVkk.jpg','2024-09-20',82,'Released','The blind witch waits.','Beezel',1291594,2.5275,5.5,'0CGire4Yqg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35954,_binary '\0','/iYhqWVoyai3Pw0pHlhcdKnY2gQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29002920',6.7,1650,'te','శివంగి','A fearless software engineer fights workplace harassment, societal blame, and a murder accusation--only to uncover a dark conspiracy behind her husband\'s tragic accident.','/hLBNrwJXzHMM530UhljYFLIa6Ek.jpg','2025-03-07',122,'Released','Lioness','Shivangi',1443590,0.6951,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35955,_binary '\0','/gry8VX2ssomFFv0ogcmlv3ZGUWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29002950',7.2,5599,'zh','狂野时代','In a world where humanity has lost the ability to dream in exchange for eternal life, one creature remains entranced by the fading illusions of the dreamworld. This monster, adrift in reverie, clings to visions no one else can see - until a woman appears. As she allows him to dream one final time, his life of different identities is replayed as they journey through his century of existence.','/4asJAxshXzQriox6tnIoEnWN1nu.jpg','2025-11-22',159,'Released','What is it that, once lost, you can never get back?','Resurrection',878608,6.3162,7.157,'ZIJezWgFUEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35956,_binary '\0','/vDxJRmdsDYIxx6KE0hquDuaKOo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29005755',5.9,1369,'ko','천박사 퇴마 연구소: 설경의 비밀','For generations, the eldest son of the village has been the protector, but the current heir, Dr. Cheon, is a fake exorcist who doesn\'t believe in ghosts. Using his penetrating insight into people\'s minds, he performs fake exorcisms and resolves cases brought to him. However, Yoo-kyung, a client who can see ghosts, approaches him with an offer too tempting to refuse. With his assistant In-bae, Dr. Cheon heads to Yoo-kyung\'s house, and gets involved in a series of strange phenomena. As they delve into the mysteries there, they uncover the secrets of a talisman known as \'Seolkyung\'...','/g4W8RsmWdDXFNMzOCd2DrLyvUsH.jpg','2023-09-27',98,'Released','Fate has chosen him, evil will hunt them!','Dr. Cheon and the Lost Talisman',950253,4.0916,6.2,'9sAW21mZ1oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35957,_binary '\0','/vIdqIpOsWspGoKoHnHncUOtJ7RZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2900624',5.2,19669,'en','All Hallows\' Eve','While watching two children on Halloween night, a babysitter finds an old VHS tape in the kids\' trick or treat bag. The tape features three tales of terror, all linked together by a murderous clown.','/bSe8CBqK8HkbP6sqZWzcJfQV9Ci.jpg','2013-10-29',82,'Released','Come Out and Play.','All Hallows\' Eve',231001,4.5648,5.655,'jsMPc4C5rYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35958,_binary '\0','/hV2fuvlVpbdcqOsBb03xXMT9AcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29007820',6.4,1274,'en','Christmas at the Chalet','When ex TV host and socialite Lex finds herself faced with the possibility of spending Christmas sharing a luxury chalet with her son, ex husband and his new girlfriend, she volunteers to work in the chalet to avoid things getting too close to home, while documenting her every move for a new wave of followers loving this new chapter of her life.','/m9GivfCh53JVGQzCX868FtrWPQ0.jpg','2023-11-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas at the Chalet',1173912,2.2007,6.1,'hCbBDlh1qbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35959,_binary '\0','/wCRul5KlCJgrx5dS98fUxNJtMdJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2900822',4.7,3239,'en','Torment','Newlyweds Cory and Sarah Morgan take Cory\'s 7-year-old son Liam up to the country for some much needed family time. When it appears as if Liam has run away, psychological suspense becomes straight-out horror, as Sarah and Cory must now confront a sadistic cult-like family who have been hiding in the house all along and have taken Liam for themselves.','/d65LSiq6UzqCE6DC7Bh5uiYIjZq.jpg','2013-10-11',82,'Released','Welcome to the family.','Torment',227877,1.6319,4.8,'EpRg80M2HMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35960,_binary '\0','/jlqan4iTqliIjIRivtqDDRJh2H5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29008225',6.4,15878,'en','Fackham Hall','A new servant embarks on an unlikely relationship with the youngest daughter of a prominent English family. Simultaneously, rivalries are spilling over in the Davenport family, led by the Lord and Lady as they also weather the epic failure of the wedding of their eldest daughter to her caddish cousin.','/fwpdRe6WGmzqXFEJYJVepDQ6jrw.jpg','2025-12-05',97,'Released','Born to aristocracy. Bred for idiocy.','Fackham Hall',1175174,6.4937,6.7,'_HRsV3dHEpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35961,_binary '\0','/3MPwbz1ILBWs3LGTOuM4NirvBj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2901736',7.2,5239,'zh','爸妈不在家','During the late 1990s, a busy working-class Singaporean couple hires a Filipino woman as a maid and nanny to their young son.','/AfVMrZHiZQW8ONm6Rok3afvHbXB.jpg','2013-08-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Ilo Ilo',188598,2.0672,6.8,'ISovsVvX8Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35962,_binary '\0','/lwVjPBhsbmvieSEUDh6rNrDZ5sS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2901962',4.8,1280,'fi','Kummeli V','Four stories about Finnish life intersect. In the first one, drum artist Monkki Mähönen arrives for a renovation job at his old band mate\'s summer villa. Second story revolves around wannabe motorcycle gang and its leader Jouni who are being humiliated at a village shop. Thirdly in the 1960s, a star reporter Erkki \"Likasanko\" Sysimetsä starts writing a once in a lifetime story about the womanizing of Arvo Hakala, a pipe organ repair man. In the fourth story, a fantasy and sci-fi film director Kurt \"Kurre\" von Riikonen is looking for financing of his upcoming movie Excalibur IV with catastrophic consequences.','/iRixKn4TZk0rvpTrsfmoZN3krrW.jpg','2014-02-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Towards the Day of Doom',257668,1.0007,5.4,'WsVWItZflcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35963,_binary '\0','/cRd7McduJ2KzhBKgx0sT5suIZJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29026239',5.5,3876,'ml','ചീന ട്രോഫി',NULL,'/2zk4yV9Gxo0YVa9yFxBsY9QT93g.jpg','2023-12-08',122,'Released',NULL,'Cheena Trophy',965294,0.6182,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35964,_binary '\0','/qLp9td9ZfOe7G6wHhrepKtIH5Qe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29028515',7.2,8464,'en','Wasteman','Taylor\'s hopes for a fresh start post-parole are jeopardised by cellmate Dee\'s arrival. As Dee takes Taylor under his wing, a vicious attack tests their bond, forcing Taylor to choose between protecting Dee and his own chances at freedom.','/lKK9ImwpoTCwDZKgYpjIIJCnlf0.jpg','2026-02-20',91,'Released','A bold new vision of life inside.','Wasteman',1307373,6.1161,7.319,'uaOextY7REM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35965,_binary '\0','/qhgssXpwgT3WLGhWwZxi5pBi0E0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2902898',6,1739,'en','Ashens and the Quest for the Gamechild','Ashens goes on a quest to find the legendary and elusive piece of electronic tech known only as the GameChild.','/kLM94Ek2yui3GtszhF61oBxfQCS.jpg','2013-08-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Ashens and the Quest for the Gamechild',212481,1.8385,6.1,'W5NhwyFzQyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35966,_binary '\0','/tiKNQUipxfKQQXuUFnBprXtL7kM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29031019',6.7,3567,'ko','30일','A married couple who received a divorce settlement lose their memories in an accident. With amnesia, they fall in love again, so their families try to restore their memories to finalize the divorce.','/ihOMYU3KNEIynH145qlhsfZIwlc.jpg','2023-10-03',119,'Released','We must recover our memories to say goodbye!','Love Reset',1052433,3.439,7.454,'H8KsoY8q8tM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35967,_binary '\0','/pdW32dO2FHSHIkXYFAB19RvbIDc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29033964',5.9,2082,'en','Diary of a Wimpy Kid Christmas: Cabin Fever','A hilarious and heartfelt holiday tale centered around everyone\'s favorite disaster-prone middle school student, Greg Heffley, which finds him desperately fighting to stay off Santa\'s naughty list as the family prepares for a major winter snowstorm.','/CgWUleumTXrFL6AsQKjpcuwWyN.jpg','2023-12-07',64,'Released','Get ready for the wimpiest Christmas ever!','Diary of a Wimpy Kid Christmas: Cabin Fever',1123093,11.9076,6.678,'Ny-Z8-iuZxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35968,_binary '\0','/amkJr6HP8VeGNDleHmnfnpV10bQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2904608',6.5,7644,'en','Turks & Caicos','The second movie in David Hare\'s Johnny Worricker trilogy. Loose-limbed spy Johnny Worricker, last seen whistleblowing at MI5 in Page Eight, has a new life. He is hiding out in Ray-Bans on the Caribbean islands of the title, eating lobster and calling himself Tom Eliot (he’s a poet at heart). We’re drawn into his world and his predicament when Christopher Walken strolls in as a shadowy American who claims to know Johnny. The encounter forces him into the company of some ambiguous American businessmen who claim to be on the islands for a conference on the global financial crisis. When one of them falls in the sea, their financial PR seems to know more than she\'s letting on. Worricker soon learns the extent of their shady activities and he must act quickly to survive when links to British prime minister Alec Beasley come to light.','/sbDqSsAhKGybpZk5vGpDRg6cSRx.jpg','2014-03-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Turks & Caicos',260202,3.3973,6.3,'SeZG9M9zrnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35969,_binary '\0','/gUp091KVfT6rVXzcQ3QSSQ4eysf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2904626',6.6,4986,'en','Salting the Battlefield','David Hare concludes his trilogy of films about MI5 renegade Johnny Worricker with another fugue on power, secrets and the British establishment. Johnny Worricker goes on the run with Margot Tyrell across Europe, and with the net closing in, the former MI5 man knows his only chance of resolving his problems is to return home and confront prime minister Alec Beasley.','/2K38pRnuSWEW4VnEDCk65GZin5h.jpg','2014-03-27',93,'Released',NULL,'Salting the Battlefield',260339,2.6811,6.258,'HO_gxK5SsUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35970,_binary '\0','/g3TFClgl6eVSTl8IRMg5m9qNX2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2905082',4.9,5780,'en','Alex & the List','Alex, a lovable, unassuming dog trainer is in love with a great woman - Katherine - smart, talented, from a good family. Katherine adores Alex\'s quirky sense of humor, honesty and capacity to listen. Having decided to pop the question, Alex is blindsided when Katherine produces a detailed list of well-thought-out \"improvements\" she feels will tweak Alex on their way to becoming the ideal couple. Alex instinctively rejects the suggestion that he needs to change anything. But with the threat of a new competitor, Alex decides to \"do the list.\" Guided by a coterie of friends that include: Dave, Alex\'s loyal childhood buddy, best female friend Lily, her husband Michael, and their 8 year old son, Nicky, Alex\'s journey has him reconsider and question his beliefs, values and world.','/bvQvLPMtOuj4slgOCZTUrS0Gyjl.jpg','2018-05-04',112,'Released','Every woman has a list, she just wrote it down.','Alex & the List',333676,1.7819,5.5,'y6c2dmfW64o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35971,_binary '\0','/8zYSFlklM8n2fxyb0it1lT1P8La.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2905674',3.1,2512,'en','Jurassic City','When a top-secret laboratory is unexpectedly breached, thousands of rampaging raptors are unleashed on Los Angeles! A black-ops unit is mobilized to contain the creatures before they cause city-wide chaos. Simultaneously, a truckload of raptors is rerouted to a nearby prison. Upon their escape, these ferocious flesh-eaters are beyond containment. This is Jurassic judgment night for smoking hot sorority girls, sinister scientists, muscle-bound military and doomed death-row inmates! It\'s about to get bloody in Jurassic City!','/vhpcMRNjB1hiKJPS4QPpmV5Mpvn.jpg','2015-01-09',88,'Released','Throwing L.A. Back to the Stone Ages','Jurassic City',315024,1.9794,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35972,_binary '\0','/5CLk7T0CRleLE169ebeTFeZLw4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2905768',6.9,1940,'te','సాహసం','Gowtam is a guard employed by a security agency. One rainy night, he finds out that his grandfather has a treasure stashed away in Pakistan which was his place before partition happened. Srinidhi is a staunch devotee and her goal is to visit a Hindu temple which is located in Hinglaj, Pakistan. Gowtam’s treasure is located in and around that temple. Gowtam joins Srinidhi’s journey to Pakistan temple where they have a security guy (Ali) helping them. Meanwhile, Sultan takes over the Pakistan’s archeology department’s team that is searching for treasure in the same area. The rest of the story is all about how Gowtam manages to get hold of diamonds which rightfully belongs to him.','/lv58sg5qrzjRRAg6rDbHUXJIxdw.jpg','2013-07-12',160,'Released',NULL,'Sahasam',208417,1.2057,6.227,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35973,_binary '\0','/nVY9UgnTf1GYHk2tsFuacTEUpcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2905772',7.6,11420,'tr','Sen Aydınlatırsın Geceyi','In a small town in Anatolia, whose inhabitants possess various supernatural powers but still have to deal with ordinary problems, Cemal helps out in his father’s barbershop and, in his free time, acts as a football referee.','/lgQkEMe7rLvwYRA7dVL9ipCYdYN.jpg','2013-11-01',107,'Released','man is created of \'anxiety\'','Thou Gild\'st the Even',193544,1.0768,7.262,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35974,_binary '\0','/rIm7D7PrQoEmnCx9YSPTdSYr35g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2905838',5.7,28302,'hi','बैंग बैंग','A young bank receptionist gets mixed up with Rajveer Nanda, a man who has a mysterious background.','/ixX899bXT1pMXWOXJW4s7JmrEZh.jpg','2014-10-02',153,'Released',NULL,'Bang Bang!',283589,2.5734,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35975,_binary '\0','/AdBXP8e6K3FYdDrMx3Wr6WZqCYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2906216',7.2,278262,'en','Dungeons & Dragons: Honor Among Thieves','A charming thief and a band of unlikely adventurers undertake an epic heist to retrieve a lost relic, but things go dangerously awry when they run afoul of the wrong people.','/v7UF7ypAqjsFZFdjksjQ7IUpXdn.jpg','2023-03-23',134,'Released','No experience necessary.','Dungeons & Dragons: Honor Among Thieves',493529,20.9029,7.357,'9LLOLEBlVIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35976,_binary '\0','/yBNrCX1CjxapHwmBdzf5HL9KRrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29063558',5.3,1954,'pa','ਜੱਟ ਐਂਡ ਜੂਲੀਅਟ 3','A police officer aspires to marry his well-off boss and joins her on a trip to the UK to track down a woman.','/sZl16hpuT09oVWPhL3JeRRUfTOf.jpg','2024-06-27',135,'Released',NULL,'Jatt & Juliet 3',1184243,1.2515,7.9,'xEkVUPvYNUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35977,_binary '\0','/qIQkaCbKHI0zcxuaVLtsJZZgUG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2907640',6.1,1924,'ja','L♡DK','Aoi Nishimori\'s parents moved to another city for work, but Aoi didn\'t want to transfer to a new high school. She stays behind and lives in an apartment by herself. Shūsei Kugayama moves in next to Aoi\'s apartment. Shūsei is a very popular student at their high school. Due to a mistake, Aoi makes the sprinkler go off in his room. Until Shūsei\'s room is fixed, he stays with Aoi.','/eG9DY0msm6s1rTedBjql0Nmv4WL.jpg','2014-04-12',113,'Released',NULL,'L♡DK',297755,1.9308,6.7,'Pv1Zeafjwr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35978,_binary '\0','/sCCv0SGBFygz9CJYHuz012a0vHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2908228',6.4,7212,'en','My Little Pony: Equestria Girls','Via a magic mirror, Twilight Sparkle travels into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.','/3tQM3PUDn9i2iq0HP7yLlQsQ0ya.jpg','2013-06-16',72,'Released','The magic of friendship never changes.','My Little Pony: Equestria Girls',201676,3.8026,7.5,'c3hBtBibN_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35979,_binary '\0','/8YNNyQiPZlF9qv5EGOUK20mnXVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2908446',6.2,274185,'en','Insurgent','Beatrice Prior must confront her inner demons and continue her fight against a powerful alliance which threatens to tear her society apart.','/dP5Fb6YRfzmCQtRbHOr2kO7tJW9.jpg','2015-03-18',119,'Released','Defy reality.','Insurgent',262500,17.443,6.361,'HzoOnfO9nLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35980,_binary '\0','/coQ2NtQbLEmrIVE2CnzCr5j3hYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2908856',6.4,11051,'en','My Old Lady','Mathias Gold is a down-on-his-luck New Yorker who inherits a Parisian apartment from his estranged father. But when he arrives in France to sell the vast domicile, he\'s shocked to discover a live-in tenant who is not prepared to budge. His apartment is a viager—an ancient French real estate system with complex rules pertaining to its resale—and the feisty Englishwoman Mathilde Girard, who has lived in the apartment with her daughter Chloé for many years, can by contract collect monthly payments from Mathias until her death.','/hPLAUrmJkXdv1sEtIqk9EwXvmbH.jpg','2014-09-09',107,'Released','He\'s in the will. She\'s in the way.','My Old Lady',282296,3.4379,6.203,'Ck35r6E4VRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35981,_binary '\0','/iVmQqLbm2PzNga069mWOEB1WLFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2909116',6.6,6567,'zh','狼图腾','In 1969, a young Beijing student, Chen Zhen, is sent to live among the nomadic herdsmen of Inner Mongolia. Caught between the advance of civilization from the south and the nomads\' traditional enemies - the marauding wolves - to the north; humans and animals, residents and invaders alike, struggle to find their true place in the world.','/WHE5b5pO3lLyStt5cA2vMLYPI4.jpg','2015-02-19',116,'Released',NULL,'Wolf Totem',309302,2.6927,6.511,'LIwWa-WkCak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35982,_binary '\0','/lhYqY9c0LAJrfuKI46Q4ymiS3R9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2909476',4.4,1642,'en','Puncture Wounds','After returning home from a traumatic tour of duty in Iraq, John finds himself struggling with PTSD. What little peace he had managed to build around him is shattered one fateful day when he rescues a local call girl from a group of violent Aryan Brotherhood pimps. Having killed several of the high-ranking brotherhood during the rescue, John and his family are now the prime targets of Hollis, the ruthless criminal leader of the group.','/AwtKX0bf7fCCeBzbCcWELhADTaH.jpg','2014-08-04',96,'Released','Pain runs deep.','Puncture Wounds',252830,2.1601,4.5,'wBsoP9sU9Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35983,_binary '\0','/dC15RaDX4mmPB0omILrjTKMGy6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29101725',5.6,2294,'en','Killing Faith','In the summer of 1859, a widowed physician reluctantly agrees to take a recently freed slave and her mysterious Caucasian daughter on a five-day journey through the bloody West to find a distant town\'s Faith Healer. The woman believes her daughter is possessed. The doctor believes she simply carries The Sickness. Either way the fact remains that every living thing the girl touches mysteriously dies.','/lzqqjVZsQu8NZOeAYZffP5FKnRy.jpg','2025-10-03',108,'Released','No hope. No mercy. No turning back.','Killing Faith',1200320,4.4846,6.264,'XMnm5bpyI7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35984,_binary '\0','/oMUDVhNnIhSOfMKE60joozzNbUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29102598',6.6,1710,'fr','Le Fil','Jean Monier is a disillusioned lawyer, appointed to defend Nicolas Milik, a man accused of murdering his wife. While everything points to his guilt, Monier takes up the case, convinced of his innocence.','/xMRuEL73DJrIDKvMyLU7v5ksBv8.jpg','2024-09-11',115,'Released',NULL,'An Ordinary Case',1136394,1.9413,6.5,'NIewaQovEDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35985,_binary '\0','/7DsPcLMbybqpl7nNMcwzPCM4VKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2910274',6.7,27303,'en','Obvious Child','An immature, newly unemployed comic must navigate the murky waters of adulthood after her fling with a graduate student results in an unplanned pregnancy.','/vAVuQuboHiqc6ClsFeWQXBHJkOX.jpg','2014-06-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Obvious Child',248774,3.7164,6.4,'hIIYGBPxG_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35986,_binary '\0','/vwFUnEdmC901H11FErNSoYgoyMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2910508',4.3,3595,'en','Dark Summer','Follows the tale of a 17-year-old on house arrest for the summer. When his mother is away on business, a horrifying incident occurs, followed by an even more terrifying presence in the house.','/hDyV0R7RGgpEm9AUdFbA0movkM6.jpg','2015-01-09',81,'Released','Some crushes last forever','Dark Summer',306969,1.9023,4.4,'CIg98n18v3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35987,_binary '\0','/oxZh9qhkxfOczKmTang0j9a06Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2910814',6,73548,'en','The Signal','On a road trip, Nic and two friends are drawn to an isolated area by a computer genius. When everything suddenly goes dark, Nic regains consciousness – only to find himself in a waking nightmare.','/r5v3gzfxtnO9bKebs5Ujee6LLP1.jpg','2014-03-15',97,'Released','R U Agitated?','The Signal',242095,6.4278,6.029,'uehQEldYkTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35988,_binary '\0','/1sNgT3UZ98ObJdLgIKaIOecwzeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2910904',7,71537,'en','The Dressmaker','In 1950s Australia, beautiful, talented dressmaker Tilly returns to her tiny hometown to right wrongs from her past. As she tries to reconcile with her mother, she starts to fall in love while transforming the fashion of the town.','/5Loofmo5GTt1Qe2Dz5ERLVlN98T.jpg','2015-10-29',118,'Released','Revenge is back in fashion.','The Dressmaker',298382,8.3025,6.995,'uPCyjqGH914','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35989,_binary '\0','/6i29AyCu1aKAbzbmQITTmOF2cVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2911342',6.3,3621,'zh','龙之谷：破晓奇兵','For years, the land of Altera has observed an uneasy peace between the humans, the elves, and the beasts who are loyal to the legendary Black Dragon. But when the dragon wakes from its hibernation, mobilizing a force of beasts to make war, a small band of humans and elves unite in a search for the secret road to the dragon’s lair.','/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg','2014-05-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Nest: Warriors\' Dawn',257932,4.0833,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35990,_binary '\0','/e3gVl1gnxEFKLTF6pn6KRqUPi9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29114029',5.2,15640,'it','Fabbricante di lacrime','Adopted together after a tough childhood in an orphanage, Nica and Rigel realize that unexpected but irresistible feelings pull them together.','/uoBHsxSgfc3PQsSn98RfnbePHOy.jpg','2024-04-03',106,'Released',NULL,'The Tearsmith',1127166,8.8586,6.5,'qEh_90RnlD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(35991,_binary '\0','/eZxDEvh3F3QPn1UA14xEVhGY5pT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29114624',4.5,2331,'hi','छोटा भीम और दम्यान का श्राप','Chhota Bheem and his friends set out to fight Damyaan, a demon blessed with immortality. However, it is not as easy as they thought it would be.','/vfevWnj94IWCIlSBGEPqbDeP66a.jpg','202