 with troubled paths, find themselves in the middle of one last bank job.','/526uxanwv4mMK0YTxjVrsmMXXo2.jpg','2014-09-11',94,'Released','Brothers in arms for life.','American Heist',250066,4.7945,4.8,'QY_IOn0fsc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36030,_binary '\0','/cPlbPVaWwXxAOKyNrFmYT5Kl38E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29233347',6.1,2860,'en','Christmas in Notting Hill','Football star, Graham Savoy, has always been too busy for love, but when he comes home to Notting Hill for Christmas, he changes his mind after meeting the one person who has no idea who he is.','/qZ4DpLKt1uVpjwbApyuJIkD1OaZ.jpg','2023-11-25',84,'Released','When life gives you London','Christmas in Notting Hill',1142710,2.1237,6,'rLVc-jCOqjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36031,_binary '\0','/sq7vMgd85moUMuEATFXV0PdwiEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29233371',7,1870,'en','Mystery on Mistletoe Lane','When moving to a new town, Heidi and her kids discover a Christmas mystery with the help of the local handyman.','/4QQBgZxhcjWfy3VXap52WGNobD4.jpg','2023-11-09',84,'Released','Every home has a history of mystery','Mystery on Mistletoe Lane',1180844,1.7953,6.2,'exUYjcDHH0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36032,_binary '\0','/46w4o8JvZEdBmxYitxRu1VxxoR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29233395',7,1408,'en','Sealed with a List','Carley is determined to get through her list of abandoned resolutions from last year and enlists the help of coworker Wyatt.','/bTqVu19sejNUyboLSjHOS5H7Y4T.jpg','2023-12-16',84,'Released','Life happens between resolutions.','Sealed with a List',1180688,2.6344,6.5,'PO7lPcYR_qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36033,_binary '\0','/5gahHJqBW3LOb9FOdoFHQGChN0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29233518',6.6,3197,'en','My Norwegian Holiday','JJ, grieving the loss of her grandmother, jumps at the chance to join a new friend, Henrik, on a trip to Norway to discover her grandmother’s hi