es in and they begin a forbidden affair.','/yBnfwE2aUXyZojWQNSYjBz62qzG.jpg','2024-06-13',131,'Released','The biggest betrayal comes from the closest people we know.','Ipar Adalah Maut',1181068,3.3486,6.7,'5qRWqIlUIrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36038,_binary '\0','/8zn4VxGlyhEyIjoHDpdkf4cw9io.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2924336',7.1,1778,'lt','Lošėjas','Paramedic Vincentas is a passionate gambler, who is forced to make radical decisions to return the debts. An idea strikes Vincentas to create an illegal game related to his profession. Love, life and death will be at stake.','/hMmpJeQBQ5Wc8Ai9Yg3TyaGDI5f.jpg','2013-09-25',109,'Released',NULL,'The Gambler',258771,1.4932,6.3,'wmqWQeH6hj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36039,_binary '\0','/z0yrbMYnUIF8kKxnNMSFGAWoG3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2924392',4.5,3365,'en','Higher Power','When the Universe decides what it wants, it\'s pointless to resist. With his family\'s life at stake, Joseph Steadman finds himself the unwilling test subject of a maniacal scientist in a battle that could save the world – or destroy it.','/cplMeBlGdkpDzypHRKZ64BrpLoL.jpg','2018-05-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Higher Power',513324,3.7515,5.1,'QXIF3hcStc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36040,_binary '\0','/g71VsfD0z0howaXHJ8St5RQdg9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29244163',7.1,1875,'en','Round and Round','While Rachel is stuck in a time loop, reliving the night of her parents\' Hanukkah party, she leans on the boy her grandmother is trying to set her up with to make it out.','/aD577q2UGNbVMQze5LM0bV755dP.jpg','2023-12-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Round and Round',1180682,2.0986,6.7,'PY1-nQQmxA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36041,_binary '\0','/lHjRpv4QjiZRiFNkB3XGvnwD2p2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2924442',4.4,3999,'en','The Pact II','The sequel is set just weeks after Annie Barlow\'s deadly confrontation with the Judas Killer. I