w',287499,2.3104,6.773,'6zy3F0WVDK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36072,_binary '\0','/tEo06xzWWs4UojzoGZPSrgsJ3QQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29298085',6.9,1929,'es','Marco: la verdad inventada','Enric Marco, a Spanish trade unionist, claims to be a survivor of Nazi concentration camps.','/l5trCq9c5rlZf5QJKM6iQHMA7u6.jpg','2024-11-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Marco: The Invented Truth',1195100,2.1963,6.9,'0xWeO-r1Bqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36073,_binary '\0','/5DJTJJxNgAh57FSOMCsHq1MzIeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2929890',6.1,2012,'fr','L\'Homme qu\'on aimait trop','In 1976 in Nice, Agnes, the daughter of the owner of the Palais de la Méditerranée, falls in love with an older lawyer.','/yKSOj7pyAgEVsPbU3oV9duVLfLC.jpg','2014-05-21',122,'Released',NULL,'In the Name of My Daughter',270899,2.2735,5.613,'DAImc6tvpmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36074,_binary '\0','/x3kiDiE4gHOvBISO3qvgtKNCDcg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29301456',6.2,7036,'hi','फ़रे','An orphan genius, Niyati, gets a scholarship to attend an elite school. But she soon gets entangled in a cheating racket after she helps a rich but academically weak classmate during the exams.','/4ihdqS2PvRcjN1i9ozQxtyoKvBX.jpg','2023-11-24',109,'Released','High rewards. Higher risks.','Farrey',1185638,2.2244,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36075,_binary '\0','/2WCpiFmRqXyu5y7WoZjEa3CJbiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29313285',7.6,6142,'fr','Amélie et la métaphysique des tubes','The world is a perplexing, peaceful mystery to Amélie until a miraculous encounter with chocolate ignites her wild sense of curiosity. As she develops a deep attachment to her family\'s housekeeper, Nishio-san, Amélie discovers the wonders of nature as well as the emotional truths hidden beneath the surface of her family\'s idyllic life as foreigners in post-war Japan.','/qoqDvTUVPoZJWw24AjGDt3J4tZN.jpg','2025-06-25',77,'Released','When you\'re three years old, you see everything and understand nothing.','Little Amélie or the Character of Rain',682012,6.9281,7.888,'-k0jMFivyT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36076,_binary '\0','/r1zkXclXRldtzTqg6wM7e0X7Sqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2931376',2.7,1220,'en','The Wake','A group of friends attend the wake of a child they accidentally killed with their car. Once at the wake, they find themselves trapped and stalked by a masked assailant.','/73QJi3atWyro0nOXUGXRhvLsMgi.jpg','2017-07-04',86,'Released',NULL,'The Wake',464001,0.9698,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36077,_binary '\0','/cu5Qk2QHxOyyMrD3Bq93DxgmJer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29319990',7.3,8775,'zh','周處除三害','The arrogant, third most-wanted criminal in Taiwan, decides to get rid of the top two competitors and crowns himself the most-wanted criminal before dying.','/9FhZ9VC999qeOWH2ytbangUMMt4.jpg','2023-10-06',134,'Released','To hunt evil, is to face the evil within.','The Pig, the Snake and the Pigeon',1046090,4.3307,7.312,'tFyzEsPcyrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36078,_binary '\0','/5JIdbM1SPymEge4f0pMy23Zj26m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2932536',5.7,66315,'en','47 Meters Down','Two sisters on Mexican vacation are trapped in a shark observation cage at the bottom of the ocean, with oxygen running low and great whites circling nearby, they have less than an hour of air left to figure out how to get to the surface.','/2IgdRUTdHyoI3nFORcnnYEKOGIH.jpg','2017-05-25',89,'Released','No way out. No way up. No chance in hell.','47 Meters Down',403119,9.5442,5.8,'VNVZBg20APg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36079,_binary '\0','/3oWls0d7V1LmNaEqqLwDB6xQlzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2933004',5.4,1778,'sr','Panama','A thriller that depicts how digital communication, pornography and vanity obstruct true emotions and love.','/vCc5PPD3iQL6gNVGMyVikZjHsp2.jpg','2015-05-16',105,