p from Mumbai to Pune. Inspired from the real events that happened in Chennai.','/kmufUYUXRapulEBNyn744oejb0A.jpg','2016-05-06',104,'Released','It took 150 minutes to save a life and create history.','Traffic',396488,1.1798,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36122,_binary '\0','/Z3mSxuPRNiFYxf1LBoGz3YrJzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29402528',6.6,2044,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の地球交響楽','When a malevolent entity intent on eradicating music from the world surfaces, Nobita and his friends must unite with supernatural companions to safeguard the planet.','/1W5Kg4K27U3dx9Kxb8DaE6WFLHI.jpg','2024-03-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon the Movie: Nobita\'s Earth Symphony',1148677,4.613,6.7,'fAfFd2jRT0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36123,_binary '\0','/8msRXbrsDcw4baS1cEcZhgSpx9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29415777',7.1,2456,'te','Jithender Reddy','The movie depicts the life of a courageous Jithender Reddy who rises as a student leader, fighting for the rights of his fellow students and inspired by his mentor`s guidance.','/1OQxIJc9CzZXZcJlN5f07eiORQj.jpg','2024-11-08',136,'Released',NULL,'Jithender Reddy',1383698,1.1515,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36124,_binary '\0','/zfk4GDKKVHesE2BXJYMZ7gU8yHa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2942016',5.6,1633,'en','Actor for Hire','A bald, out of work actor finds immediate and overwhelming success when he discovers the power of persona in the form of a cheap wig.','/kxKHzgqMocnoL8GHjznSTE3GDk4.jpg','2015-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Actor for Hire',340195,1.003,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36125,_binary '\0','/yHJFrVMvpplL8elpJiu2EEQ21o6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29423112',6,1260,'fi','Luottomies-elokuva: All in','When Tommi doesn\'t get the promotion he was hoping for from his father-in-law Johan, he decides to get into the investment business to buy his dream house with his wife, Harriet. However, things are complicated by the fact that Tommi is easily fooled and the money from the old apartment, more than half a million euros, disappears in a pyramid scheme. When Tommi is in danger of losing Harriet for good, his loyal friend Juhis takes the reins. Juhis plans a rescue operation that kind of works.','/6EZZeV1Ew958ZV2kEFMZa1UDP0g.jpg','2024-02-16',94,'Released',NULL,'Luottomies-elokuva: All in',1141496,1.3604,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36126,_binary '\0','/l6O6m3O33NsL10qDFQT1RhjMD4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29424168',6.4,1421,'en','Inside','After being transferred from juvenile to adult prison, Mel Blight is taken under the wing of both Mark Shepard, Australia’s most despised criminal, and Warren Murfett, a soon to be paroled inmate. As a paternal triangle grows between them, we see that even the worst of men have a little bit of good inside that will be their undoing.','/fNblwtRfaeIlLlM5kFrgUZYpE0a.jpg','2025-02-27',104,'Released',NULL,'Inside',1225582,1.6805,6.2,'VamkEUq62Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36127,_binary '\0','/nVqFGxVAQtumFcD01pUvWQVtxnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2942512',6.7,1551,'ko','우리 선희','Sunhi, a film major graduate, visits her school to ask her Professor Choi for a recommendation letter to study in U.S. Knowing the professor favors her, she expects a good recommendation from him. Out from her shell after a long time, Sunhi also ends up meeting two men from her past: Munsu, her ex-boy friend, and Jaehak, a director who graduated from the same film school. Through the encounters between Sunhi and the three men, they give each other an \'advice on life\' with good intentions. The three men who all have strong interests in her are led to guess and define her, unable to tell how she really feels inside. Strangely, the mentioned advices and traits of her are similar and seem to pass from one person to the next. The words of \'advice on life\' seem doubtable and slip away as the three men\'s thoughts on Sunhi becom