e Harry Potter films, David Holmes\' work has been seen worldwide by millions of people. Tragically an on-set accident ended what David calls \"the best job in the world,\" leaving him paralyzed. Like the on-screen character he helped bring to life, David is determined to continue seeking adventure and living life to the fullest despite mounting obstacles.','/pL8BuguWW1ZRksHIMwuK9UD4ROd.jpg','2023-11-13',89,'Released',NULL,'David Holmes: The Boy Who Lived',1190725,2.7168,7.2,'1tWi5BiXqCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36177,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2949296',6.5,1944,'es','I Am Your Father','David Prowse is an eighty years old actor, who has lived behind Darth Vader\'s mask during three decades. A group of Star Wars fans find out why he has been apparently forgotten by Lucasfilm during thirty years, and decide to give him back the glory he never had. This is their last opportunity.','/skaTUxPbcFQz9gvYmdWBBTjQ1wx.jpg','2015-10-05',83,'Released','You know the movies. You know the villain. Now meet the man.','I Am Your Father',362610,1.7198,6.5,'QbExdNBjOfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36178,_binary '\0','/z1fzWsGB2ePLFrTJcsynLpP7hnB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29495090',6.3,1228,'cn','焚城','Hong Kong’s historic first radiation disaster blockbuster! After a fire accident triggers a radiation leakage, the entire city suddenly finds its survival hanging by a thread. In order to tackle the impending catastrophe, expert Simon Fan joins the emergency crisis response team led by Acting Chief Executive Cecilia to tackle this catastrophic disaster. With the lives of 7 million people on the line, the fire brigade is tasked with stopping the spread at all costs by entering the radiation zone. Facing this unprecedented calamity, will Hong Kong wake up to an overnight annihilation?','/zPOA4HOJ9u6e3laL1gUQjCzIHCF.jpg','2024-10-25',136,'Released',NULL,'Cesium Fallout',1305642,2.6825,6.738,'D6aCzVWvhqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36179,_binary '\0','/1QHbGiBxHemoIcPTcKYavdsvydX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29495600',6.7,1340,'ml','താൾ','Vishwa has an enhanced OCD condition, which causes problems in her love life, but she refuses to acknowledge it. So, Mithran decides to convince her that she is imagining him so that she realises that she has a problem and seeks treatment.','/fVJx6HOLdEZDfx0rVTqRCLhyW22.jpg','2023-12-08',125,'Released',NULL,'Thaal',1189534,0.8509,3,'Nl0vO6IYfKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36180,_binary '\0','/8Fu8NpShJHamigDjdv9Ykft6Agd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2949626',5.1,2097,'nl','Toscaanse Bruiloft','Tuscan Wedding, the new romantic comedy from the creators of Loving Ibiza. Together with her father Tom and stepmother Marla, Sanne runs Casa Matrimonio, a luxurious villa in sunkissed Italy. The estate is located in Tuscany, a beautiful region where many couples go to have their perfect wedding. In Casa Matrimonio guests come together to celebrate love and life. A Tuscan Wedding is the apotheosis of everyone’s visit to the country side. And for some the villa is all too familiar as they return again and again: because some people only marry twice.','/lPnGLMcRtXUuE98OPnB0oWv4kC6.jpg','2014-01-30',109,'Released',NULL,'Tuscan Wedding',242257,2.3964,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36181,_binary '\0','/cOyVMNbUeQ25LGjoaygX00MiIGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29499132',6.4,1463,'en','Navigating Christmas','Recently divorced Melanie brings her son to a remote island for Christmas, where she connects with a lighthouse owner.','/lhymboC8cUSr2thd1P0VJjvGgHw.jpg','2023-11-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Navigating Christmas',1180814,1.3119,6,'M0QVi_roBP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36182,_binary '\0','/t4XjfL8KdnSbr6D5ukK5ySaiske.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29499210',6.8,1784,'en','Holiday Hotline','Upon leaving London and working at a cooking hotline, Abby connects with an anonymous caller — a single dad who Abby unknowingly is also smitten with in real life.','/8kPrCp4N4wvT0KY4Eht3kxpSS6B.jpg','2023-11-19',84,'Released','Ready to talk turkey?','Holiday Hotline',1180811,1.6098,6.8,'gziQ4ZQajqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36183,_binary '\0','/olFrXt0DbDxk1k2SDc82hwLkSSK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2950052',6.1,4682,'en','Bravetown','After an accidental drug overdose, a talented teenage DJ goes to live with his estranged father in a small Army town, where he gets to the bottom of his own pain and learns empathy for others.','/aM5c1cu9dqt8Rqrv1FdMna4oThD.jpg','2015-05-08',112,'Released','Life hurts. Love heals.','Bravetown',300666,2.6763,6.7,'7Zh_qWaBumc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36184,_binary '\0','/iLMY7hbzkJddAqc8SdjpjyijyxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2950236',6,2248,'en','The Living','After beating his wife in an alcohol-fueled rage, a man (Fran Kranz) tries to redeem himself, while his brother-in-law (Kenny Wormald) hires a hit man to kill him.','/7ZfC3X5cendwBWsu8GIBPrOSO1L.jpg','2014-06-26',89,'Released',NULL,'The Living',282248,1.2301,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36185,_binary '\0','/NuInEJcmZtt2edyUR1EYgNn1QI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2950330',5.4,1588,'nl','De Poel','Two families go camping illegally in a forest, and set up their tents near a beautiful pond, far away from the daily hubbub. However, they soon discover that the pond contains a mysterious force, which will not allow them to leave. Rot and decay strike, and madness follows.','/dAx6FduPUI25BDUQnWXrNUYx3H7.jpg','2014-05-01',76,'Released',NULL,'The Pool',256771,1.884,4.7,'qWEMhZS-f8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36186,_binary '\0','/npIJfNBWVwJUMJJ5Gvtx5EKw3D8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2950418',7.3,10294,'en','Greater','The incredible true story of the greatest walk-on in the history of college football.','/t