e Galapagos Islands, which interweaves an unsolved 1930s murder mystery with stories of present day Galapagos pioneers. A gripping tale of idealistic dreams gone awry, featuring voice-over performances by Cate Blanchett, Diane Kruger, and Gustaf Skarsgard.','/fUZPUzv5GUxYcycPFudBLLU8S39.jpg','2014-04-03',126,'Released',NULL,'The Galapagos Affair: Satan Came to Eden',223632,1.8052,6.4,'Wf2txEIcg6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36225,_binary '\0','/enbr7jaQySYFKojOQrVQFGkwrvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29606499',6.9,8166,'hi','Veera Dheera Sooran: Part 2','Kaali is a provision store owner and a loving husband and father, is brought back into the life of crime, when his former boss\'s son is being hunted by the police.','/d5SRMF7GR021P8Xai4y7F3HTWv5.jpg','2025-03-27',162,'Released',NULL,'Veera Dheera Sooran: Part 2',1198208,2.6424,6.897,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36226,_binary '\0','/1U6BizPeYgC6lYTijQnNozS1vMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29606526',6.4,10337,'te','ది గర్ల్‌ఫ్రెండ్‌','A college literature student falls for a charming man with a domineering streak, forcing her to confront the toxic truth of his desire.','/8cYve5muYPeWKvSEfFdkmWDyyDa.jpg','2025-11-07',138,'Released',NULL,'The Girlfriend',1196348,1.8724,6.405,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36227,_binary '\0','/z6qMaqU9clsrqyAPIclFlVtZjyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29607491',6.8,4458,'nl','Hardcore Never Dies','17-year-old Michael dreams of a future as a pianist, but his music education is not going smoothly. In his search for inspiration, he receives help from an unexpected source: his brother Danny introduces him to the emerging Rotterdam “gabber” music scene. Michael is drawn into a world of hard beats, brotherhood and drugs. When Danny\'s drug business reaches international proportions, the brothers must fight for their lives.','/fdmh5Fl77CRBRWi2HzboS4cGL6l.jpg','2023-11-09',108,'Released','ROTTERDAM. 1996. 180 BPM.','Hardcore Never Dies',1103789,1.4592,6.51,'A89og2S1Bpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36228,_binary '\0','/nn2HYaPRiOytno9pxC652ULRzfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29608104',5.9,4668,'ml','ടർബോ','An Idukki jeep driver attracts the ire of the head of a shady criminal syndicate after his friends uncover a large-scale financial scam.','/CBRqel4Yzm8BS4fTMScYA1fQLD.jpg','2024-05-23',150,'Released',NULL,'Turbo',1195394,1.4512,5.088,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36229,_binary '\0','/bNgxtB19C56xd57uEmnXF66knD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2960930',5,17835,'en','Extraterrestrial','Five friends set out to a cabin in the woods for a fun weekend getaway that is, until extraterrestrial visitors turn it into a fight for their lives. The group is pulled from their reverie when a flickering object crashes deep in the woods. As they investigate, the friends stumble across an alien spacecraft, and its inhabitants have not arrived in peace.','/mmiG916iIh6w378qBjRfTonqOWb.jpg','2014-10-17',101,'Released','They do not come in peace.','Extraterrestrial',265016,3.5093,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36230,_binary '\0','/55hRgXkbvHoc9dL58S9HAGyxmZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29609422',5.9,3738,'th','ธี่หยด','When a remote village is plagued by a deadly curse, one brother must fight to save his family from a terrifying supernatural threat.','/48TDjSJpCdJ4SBOHZX3G5IjaV02.jpg','2023-10-25',121,'Released','The haunted, calling voices will follow you everywhere.','Death Whisperer',1134433,4.8798,7.4,'avtdfHis_3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36231,_binary '\0','/dRZTa9F3EUveLGvz5ISLpKXfj2h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29613587',7.1,3969,'hi','मस्त में रहने का','A man chooses an old widower\'s home for his first robbery, kicking off a set of events that have them both look at life in a new way and with new companions in the starkness of the city of Mumbai.','/l2y2693EHKtrpNtOuy0goF38XZX.jpg','2023-12-08',127,'Released','When strangers become friends, life becomes amazing','Mast Mein Rehne Ka',1198725,1.2357,7.393,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36232,_binary '\0','/1pmXyN3sKeYoUhu5VBZiDU4BX21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29623480',8.1,237651,'en','The Wild Robot','After a shipwreck, an intelligent robot called Roz is stranded on an uninhabited island. To survive the harsh environment, Roz bonds with the island\'s animals and cares for an orphaned baby goose.','/wTnV3PCVW5O92JMrFvvrRcV39RU.jpg','2024-09-12',102,'Released','Discover your true nature.','The Wild Robot',1184918,57.3736,8.309,'67vbA5ZJdKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36233,_binary '\0','/3SpTGHgsQUXiBGBhDXQL2BVnlIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29625386',5.9,3185,'hi','कपकापी','In a men\'s hostel, seven bachelors try to summon a spirit via Ouija board.','/9m1lSId0hswbOZZozQanUVyf21D.jpg','2025-05-23',138,'Released','aatma ji darshan do na','Kapkapiii',1262669,1.4385,4.3,'6QudgN2wmv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36234,_binary '\0','/z2TeugkpWa1bYHjzlCVa5Y58cSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2962726',4.7,7910,'en','The Anomaly','A former soldier is taken captive and awakens in the back of a van where he learns that he only has less than 10 minutes to figure out how he got there.','/s56VZf9TsFmRSJ549nCI8RgKTr.jpg','2014-06-19',97,'Released',NULL,'The Anomaly',269173,3.2413,5,'K-8biU0JPCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36235,_binary '\0','/3qjYgi0CjhXSrt1Sv1VFk26y5Yo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2962876',7,17208,'en','The Road Within','A young man with Tourette\'s Syndrome embarks on a road trip with his recently-deceased mother\'s ashes.','/1lkp87orcl6IjrdJJTJPnY2gEoc.jpg','2014-10-24',100,'Released','On the road. But a little bit off.','The Road Within',228108,2.7139,6.81,'sE9so4izwuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36236,_binary '\0','/Lxee36cGzUgzthpDar2yinQgKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2962984',5.2,5656,'en','Girlfriend\'s Day','When he\'s caught up in a deadly conspiracy, an unemployed greeting card writer must create the perfect card for a new holiday to save his skin.','/dC86zUwQXuYS84sNIL5GyjRmD1h.jpg','2017-01-24',70,'Released',NULL,'Girlfriend\'s Day',346650,2.9939,5,'A2L0100_Yp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36237,_binary '\0','/6jR6IZkX7USdRsAzoq7BTqKFgqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2963232',4.9,4886,'en','The Hunters','Imagine if all mythical artifacts, from Jason\'s Golden Fleece to Cinderella\'s glass slippers, were real. Well, they are -- and for centuries, a secret society called the Hunters has been sworn to protect them from an evil force called the Krugen.','/ubR6x50z4aLflgzJcw7X7HflKKr.jpg','2013-10-25',85,'Released','For centuries, a secret organization has protected the world\'s treasures... Meet the next generation.','The Hunters',231474,2.887,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36238,_binary '\0','/tOZ6kU5KRbYDR6SAxHzP6Jd1AX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2963262',5.8,1564,'fr','Limonov: The Ballad','A revolutionary militant, a thug, an underground writer, a butler to a millionaire in Manhattan. But also a switchblade-waving poet, a lover of beautiful women, a warmonger, a political agitator, and a novelist who wrote of his greatness. Eduard Limonov’s life story is a journey through Russia, America, and Europe during the second half of the 20th century.','/xCZzUVMX8FjPSV4fYtGE5K2J5jr.jpg','2024-09-05',133,'Released',NULL,'Limonov: The Ballad',495278,5.1264,6.4,'PnrXUXIoxXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36239,_binary '\0','/83Qc7meKHX8asNv5pn159B7pJlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29633969',5.8,1968,'sv','Jönssonligan kommer tillbaka','After years on the run, Sickan reunites with Vanheden, Harry and Doris for another coup. The plan, timed to the smallest detail, is to steal a complete T-Rex skeleton from the Natural History Museum and sell it to the unscrupulous businessman Wall Enberg for 320 million SEK. However, they have not counted on Rigmor Gren, an aged policewoman, obsessed with the idea of ​​bringing Jönsson to justice before she herself retires.','/nF5vmjqSp5Uccx94MDEoASzh3Xo.jpg','2024-12-06',104,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang Returns',1196918,1.544,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36240,_binary '\0','/6m3K1hizm5yoguOsAcIjNSECn5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29634843',6.4,7678,'en','40 Acres','Hailey Freeman and her family are the last descendants of African American farmers who settled in rural Canada after the Civil War. In a famine-decimated near future, they now struggle to safeguard their farm, as they make one last stand against a vicious militia hell-bent on taking their 40 Acres.','/3zCEo21Y9wVFBgGhgDVWCyvMZ47.jpg','2025-07-02',113,'Released','Get off our land.','40 Acres',1319951,5.5007,6.6,'O9sloHiZvmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36241,_binary '\0','/8o1b4G5Uv5EFQ64Sicz1ae7WLsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29638896',5.7,3625,'te','నారీ నారీ నడుమ మురారి','A young man\'s life turns upside down when he finds himself caught between two women, leading to an unexpected love triangle filled with emotions, misunderstandings, and tough decisions. As relationships intertwine, he must confront his feelings, face reality, and choose what truly matters, blending romance with heartfelt family drama.','/jFBu7tS0mlEZwYTkjJcKH48bV4m.jpg','2026-01-14',143,'Released',NULL,'Naari Naari Naduma Murari',1417849,1.3278,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36242,_binary '\0','/olvianPYwBME3IAUCnd9oYAyqwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2964120',7.5,4395,'ja','WOOD JOB! ～神去なあなあ日常～','After failing his university entrance exam, Yuki Hirano sets his eyes on the role of a forestry trainee. Setting off for training he doubts his decision many times, but eventually after passing the training course, he is sent to Kamusari Village for a year of work experience - where he becomes assimilated with the beauty of nature and the warm-hearted people of the village.','/gvo0367R3pWJJrwGDRMMOCZnSwY.jpg','2014-05-10',116,'Released',NULL,'Wood Job!',274817,2.8598,7.4,'-ykkmueiMHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36243,_binary '\0','/70BCK1K4rhGA2BuLZrbMbyf9WL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2964360',6.3,2548,'en','Finding Normal','Dr. Lisa Leland is a brilliant surgeon with absolutely no bedside manner. She is leaving her practice at UCLA Hospital to move to the Hamptons where she will join her boyfriend as a concierge doctor, treating the rich and famous. As she drives cross-country to her new life she hits a tractor in Normal, North Carolina and her BMW is wrecked. Dr. Leland is found guilty of speeding and ordered to do community service as a doctor in Normal, population 332. In a town with no wi-fi, no lattes and no credit cards, Lisa Leland begins to find herself and discovers what a meaningful life is all about.','/bzHG85Lny28W5DjxrwPiw2bDVY5.jpg','2013-05-18',90,'Released','Slow down to see normal','Finding Normal',209920,1.6443,6.7,'kCZktHVyUiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36244,_binary '\0','/6zKjoOOb3OZnZuiHtQZn4Kd69Gq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29644189',6,70393,'en','Black Phone 2','Four years after defeating The Grabber, Finney Blake is struggling with life after captivity. When his younger sister Gwen begins receiving calls in her dreams from the Black Phone and seeing disturbing visions of three boys being stalked at a winter camp, the siblings become determined to solve the mystery and confront a killer who has grown more powerful in death and more significant to them than either could imagine.','/vBOpqxW0SDhACwEO2LZT29DuNG2.jpg','2025-10-15',114,'Released','Dead is just a word.','Black Phone 2',1197137,18.9266,6.6,'FCHsEEen4HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36245,_binary '\0','/cZgURfEy9F6jruidM1mJefIDgLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29644530',7.3,2635,'el','Φόνισσα','It is the early 20th century on a dystopian Greek island. Hadoula, a widow who lost her husband, loannis Fragkos, at a young age, is a woman who has learned how to survive in a male-dominated and extremely patriarchal society. Hadoula carries a difficult burden within her. Like a baton passed on to her from her mother, and the generations before her, she is meant to accept the belittling and degradation of women. Hadoula reacts. Her personal, internal revolution soon comes forth. The victims of her outburst are the little girls of the island, whom she sets free from the social and economic burden that their existence entails by taking their lives. Her actions will bring her face to face with the law. She leaves her home and escapes to her refuge, nature. But as much as her faith and morals dictate that she did the right thing, her trans-generational trauma follows her everywhere. And the end comes as redemption.','/8mqv3FZSiHXOjpee7pNNNUUJFm8.jpg','2023-11-30',96,'Released','Caress me. Kiss me. Don\'t you love me?','Fonissa',1196489,0.9132,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36246,_binary '\0','/z1d0c7oh7YGV4tjkn80GxHuAqUn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2964654',6.4,2261,'en','Finding Christmas','Single mother Ryan has just about given up on dating after her divorce, happily accepting her young son as the most important man in her life. That all changes when Ryan\'s brother Owen, also feeling unlucky in love after a bad breakup, swaps his home in their small North Carolina town with New York City adman Sean.','/1mgLKQYIY9HGyEl7pF54Y6OVG1.jpg','2013-12-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Finding Christmas',249057,1.0869,6.4,'qW0aE-Wd3ZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36247,_binary '\0','/q8blBwffuaexW9QMNC2Pa3wqgqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2965408',6.1,3159,'en','Lost on a Mountain in Maine','When twelve-year-old Donn Fendler gets tired of waiting for his father and brothers to join him on the summit of Maine\'s highest peak, he decides to find his own way back to camp. But Donn doesn\'t count on a fast-moving fog that obscures the path. He doesn\'t count on falling down an embankment that hides him from sight. And he doesn\'t count on taking a turn that leaves him alone to wander aimlessly for nearly two weeks in the empty mountain wilderness.','/elKEzHpbdoTMkK0IpUKcK6x1Ttl.jpg','2024-11-01',115,'Released','80 miles. 9 days. 1 step at a time.','Lost on a Mountain in Maine',1197619,3.4158,7,'EKD4cVv2l0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36248,_binary '\0','/znDbUAz0uPgc329iHBiobnnYA2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2965412',6.7,20465,'en','Comet','When a chance encounter brings together the cynical Dell and the quick-witted Kimberly, the stage is set for a tempestuous love affair that unfolds like a puzzle. As the film zigzags back and forth in time — from a meteor shower in LA, to an encounter in a Paris hotel room, to a fateful phone call — an unforgettable portrait of a relationship emerges.','/4zOOSa5zyJDvqDDKFwUQVMK6eDe.jpg','2014-12-05',91,'Released',NULL,'Comet',276908,2.7843,6.6,'_gCbQfodpok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36249,_binary '\0','/gYhheyDkKanBAN2JAi7ZuPiwH36.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2965466',5.8,28506,'en','Last Shift','Rookie police officer Jessica Loren has been assigned the last shift at a closing police station and must wait for a hazmat crew to collect biomedical evidence. Ordered not to leave the station under any circumstances, Jessica comes to learn that it\'s more than just an outdated station, it\'s home to the ultimate embodiment of evil and his devoted bloodthirsty followers. Jessica is left to fend for herself in the Devil\'s playground.','/oSTFMqFpVB4yq9SOIxBp8xZ9jh5.jpg','2014-10-25',87,'Released','All Hail the King of Hell','Last Shift',296065,4.6501,6.3,'3p0KIrh8hyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36250,_binary '\0','/k9aG4g8Q1ZE53cnzyRpAzNlSFst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2965842',6,1804,'sv','Vadelmavenepakolainen','Mikko Virtanen feels like a Swedish soul trapped in a Finnish body. Full of disgust for everything Finnish, he sees Sweden as heaven. Upon meeting a suicidal Swedish psychologist Mikael Anderson, he seizes an opportunity for an identity switch. Raspberry Boat Refugee is a comedy about cultural differences in the Nordic countries, their nationalism and, not least, prejudices about our neighbours. It also proves how futile it is to try to escape oneself.','/enDEY6Ye0BWyFxYNki9hBtZ1Emd.jpg','2014-08-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Raspberry Boat Refugee',293491,1.3203,5,'QA3cf1qT3mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36251,_binary '\0','/dctSXut3PqTRIWHbKjnsLzPKZus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2966760',7,2129,'en','Pantani: The Accidental Death of a Cyclist','In 1998 Marco Pantani, the most flamboyant and popular cyclist of his era, won both the Tour de France and Giro d\'Italia, a titanic feat of physical and mental endurance that no rider has repeated since. He was a hero to millions, the saviour of cycling following the doping scandals which threatened to destroy the sport. However, less than six years later, aged just 34, he died alone, in a cheap hotel room, from acute cocaine poisoning. He had been an addict for five years. This is the story of the tragic battles fought by the most important Italian cyclist of his generation; man verses mountain, athlete verses addiction, Marco Pantani verses himself.','/ihZ4y3OwHzytzTY0K6MFo7ueFU4.jpg','2014-02-17',96,'Released','Every man has his own mountain to climb','Pantani: The Accidental Death of a Cyclist',258614,1.118,6.9,'xfN3uxk-vRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36252,_binary '\0','/bUskzsM9bRSo7nVBxzRzEfRWZVF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967006',6.6,16567,'en','The Trip to Italy','Years after their successful restaurant review tour of Northern England, Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon are commissioned for a new tour in Italy.','/gbdN1MGJI2vIV9yKqDkAsazWQIT.jpg','2014-04-24',108,'Released','Anyone for seconds?','The Trip to Italy',242088,3.0739,6.4,'DtlEQ6y8Rp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36253,_binary '\0','/qBPrU3oA1s3eFvPVmq4vNnkRymU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967008',4.6,5452,'en','The Face of an Angel','Both a journalist and a documentary filmmaker chase the story of a murder and its prime suspect.','/100pHE252kgwxwVNbiflYV9j1yi.jpg','2014-09-06',100,'Released','Forget the truth, find the story.','The Face of an Angel',254024,3.4693,5.031,'ag_I15RBl-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36254,_binary '\0','/iRaWDcGpKCynIXpCewle2YwQffL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967224',5.2,58378,'en','Hot Pursuit','Straight-arrow policewoman Cooper is excited and thrilled about her next assignment. Her task is to escort Daniella Riva, a wisecracking Colombian beauty, from San Antonio to Dallas so both she and her husband can testify against a drug lord. Plans go awry when Mr. Riva gets ambushed, leaving Daniella a widow. Cooper and her witness must now use their wits to escape from crooked cops and murderous gunmen, while not killing each other in the process.','/lobNOBHuJQCP9ZYAf86MBMwRrmZ.jpg','2015-05-08',87,'Released','Armed and sort of dangerous.','Hot Pursuit',268920,8.6052,5.7,'6qBRBS8pL-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36255,_binary '\0','/vxqhrvL20tC1pdQBInV9RKcWr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967226',4.5,3024,'en','Killing Hasselhoff','A man in a high stakes celebrity death pool quickly loses everything - his business, his bank account, his home, his fiancé. He snaps, then realizes the only way to get his life back on track. He\'ll have to murder his own celebrity. He\'ll have to kill Hasselhoff.','/9BQqALg8ffCn5ZkYZKEtAgR29HF.jpg','2017-08-29',81,'Released','Don\'t Hassle The Hoff.','Killing Hasselhoff',353440,3.2946,4.5,'Fbj8Db5ipTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36256,_binary '\0','/nFKxirrjjSTbz2rryfJvvG5MLkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967286',7.8,11842,'ja','劇場版 STEINS;GATE 負荷領域のデジャヴ','One year after the events of the anime, Rintarou begins to feel the repercussions of extensive time travel, and eventually completely fades from reality. Kurisu, being the only companion to remember him, now must find a way to bring him back.','/bXhogkZCR0aOQ077rfMULYbDmtH.jpg','2013-04-20',90,'Released','No one knows what the future holds. That’s why its potential is infinite.','Steins;Gate: The Movie - Load Region of Déjà Vu',225745,5.4916,7.6,'kUkcQb-K3KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36257,_binary '\0','/rF7Z0pXXHfrloD3EpfIyg8TD4zi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29674465',6.5,2149,'bn','দরদ','A series of sudden murders unfold in the city of Varanasi, targeting prominent individuals. The escalating violence shocks the local police as they grapple with the growing list of victims. As the investigation progresses, an auto driver named Dulu Mia emerges as the key suspect. The police must unravel the mystery behind the serial killings and uncover the motives driving these tragic events.','/bo7ZgNWKKnAF1K4MoBZwCGFBbEO.jpg','2024-11-15',156,'Released',NULL,'Dorod',1150425,0.8483,5,'wecVphaD9_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36258,_binary '\0','/dnpSUzbvUy1sULcLddMMpUXsCAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2967578',6.8,5825,'ko','은밀하게 위대하게','Three elite North Korean sleeper agents live under cover for so long that they believe their cover stories are their real identities. They are shocked when they are ordered to kill one another or face death at the hands of an elite hit team.','/n5ESZzOGxnmugkLvyd45wOsn0mg.jpg','2013-06-05',124,'Released','Playing the fool for the Dear Leader.','Secretly, Greatly',199584,2.808,7,'8yOHaNWBlIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36259,_binary '\