ased',NULL,'Murder Company',1285247,2.944,5.9,'NKIAEVuLETI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36262,_binary '\0','/lVgb8ebWu0H1hphBUw31m6gKDYW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2968804',4.4,5085,'en','Drive Hard','A former race car driver is abducted by a mysterious thief and forced to be the wheel-man for a crime that puts them both in the sights of the cops and the mob.','/wSujXhZJPvwKtMhIAuIuXZ93gYO.jpg','2014-10-03',96,'Released','This heist is about to go into overdrive.','Drive Hard',256092,3.8639,4.3,'5Sy9OQBYlVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36263,_binary '\0','/g5knEDTOzgCPi9Jiii4LhMHzOIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2969050',6.9,3419,'de','Dampfnudelblues','After the forcible transfer to his Bavarian home village, an ex-criminal cop investigates the death of a school principal who he thinks had lots to hide.','/mlE9wNxyzGQPJm26Fn8eBr1H1gx.jpg','2013-07-31',87,'Released',NULL,'Dampfnudelblues',209232,1.6232,6.81,'K4POzMIsKTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36264,_binary '\0','/vsjRTe4XnP9QF4PVzyfVDjIJAZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2969522',7.4,9282,'ko','몽타주','A woman\'s child is kidnapped and killed after paying the ransom. 15 years later, a mysterious figure is seen visiting the site of killing and another kidnapping occurs using the same methods. The woman teams up with a detective to catch the killer once and for all.','/vEgquyjTJXuhYpacJIivoOmDUcs.jpg','2013-05-16',120,'Released','It\'s not over yet. He has returned after 15 years.','Montage',195276,2.8049,7.269,'kV5Hom6_GxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36265,_binary '\0','/bE4XWNy9CZD4TbJoFlRejbjI71X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2969656',7.1,9330,'ko','감시자들','Ha Yoon-ju becomes the newest member of a unit within the Korean Police Forces Special Crime Department that specializes in surveillance activities on high-profile criminals. She teams up with Hwang Sang-jun, the veteran leader of the unit, and tries to track down James who is the cold-hearted leader of an armed criminal organization.','/bAFMP3p06OAbEcOdPpmtP143oSO.jpg','2013-07-03',119,'Released','Remember everything about the untraceable target.','Cold Eyes',204553,3.9852,7.5,'SH15-Aj57fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36266,_binary '\0','/zKmAOcB6Y0FQd6R1Vm873INJ952.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2969776',5.3,1898,'fr','Le Crocodile du Botswanga','Leslie Konda young talented French footballer spotted in his teens by Didier , a small-scale agent who was able to take under his wing , has signed its first contract striker in a large Spanish club . At the same time, his growing reputation and its origins Botswanga , small, poor state of Central Africa, earned him an invitation by the President of the Republic in person Babimbi Bobo , a football enthusiast, freshly installed in power after a coup military state. Leslie therefore went for the first time in the country of his ancestors accompanied by Didier to be decorated by the President Bobo which quickly turns out, despite his great humanist discourse be a megalomaniac and paranoid dictator under the bad influence of his wife .dropoff window Hardly have they landed Bobo enters into a sordid deal with Didier put pressure on his player so that it plays for the national team : Crocodiles of Botswanga ...','/hur2WyJDF37HqbmA6NCxPqd3BTy.jpg','2014-02-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Le Crocodile du Botswanga',248390,1.3007,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36267,_binary '\0','/h3yehz4IURNhKbKvJZV2EneKudN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29702934',5.1,5828,'ta','சிலநொடிகளில்','What happens when your fate is messed up and you are trapped in your past? When a married cosmetic surgeon Raj Varadhan from London falls in love with his model girlfriend Maya Pillai who accidentally dies due to drug overdose, his life takes him on an unexpected ride! Will he be able to hide his secrets from his wife Medha?','/qPJ2vdnzAc6W7sJ5