o a lawless badland, a fearless huntsman springs into action to rescue a teenager abducted by a mad doctor.','/zVMyvNowgbsBAL6O6esWfRpAcOb.jpg','2024-01-26',107,'Released','One last hunt to save us all.','Badland Hunters',933131,8.7301,6.7,'7u3zBVAxx_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36276,_binary '\0','/e034NcsMOyC1M9d9q1s4IQFdlRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29722945',3.6,2323,'en','Don\'t Turn Out the Lights','Reuniting for an unforgettable weekend, a group of high school friends takes a break from their separate lives at college to travel by RV to a musical festival. Their exciting weekend plans quickly unravel as they find themselves fighting to survive each other and the unknown.','/81DfMbLBzrO51fyau7t3YCff3VE.jpg','2024-07-12',109,'Released','It\'s safer in the dark.','Don\'t Turn Out the Lights',1186023,2.0898,4.4,'6RMxIBMppwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36277,_binary '\0','/22xVcTBVURFMHsFw8lNYeLFYj7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2972362',7,5984,'ko','화이: 괴물을 삼킨 아이','After being kidnapped as a small child and raised by the five men who abducted him, a teenage boy is now forced to join their life in crime.','/cDffUvnm2TaLxQYWTy0PnohSGNP.jpg','2013-10-09',125,'Released','Raised to be a killer.','Hwayi: A Monster Boy',214910,3.4794,7.4,'VaUH60v_Ze4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36278,_binary '\0','/eyC9ezPoOWFTplsWcmXaLo5NKWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2972482',6.8,4159,'ko','군도: 민란의 시대','In 1862, amidst the rule of the late Joseon dynasty in Korea, a band of fighters named Kundo rise against the unjust authorities.','/yAiANYk9aocISH5To89qwC8ZF8x.jpg','2014-07-23',137,'Released','Out of darkness a new hope arises.','Kundo: Age of the Rampant',281780,2.9704,6.64,'6eRQ17wv2FU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36279,_binary '\0','/tqVecLU8um6HDk5KFESBC1Md6dk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29730305',7,2721,'de','Pfau - Bin ich echt?','Matthias is a master of pretense, from cultured boyfriend to perfect son or marital coach. He makes a career of being someone else. The real challenge begins when he has to be himself.','/beSHeoX1KDSfUBcfeEIkx23oPu.jpg','2025-02-20',102,'Released','Am I Real?','Peacock',1245728,3.413,6.9,'TsVpWX0nVyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36280,_binary '\0','/zJAHuHPJndk2Z2wnOvOvp4IJT0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2973408',7.7,1842,'en','David Bowie: Five Years','Featuring a wealth of previously unseen archive, this film looks at how Bowie continually evolved: from Ziggy Stardust to the Soul Star of Young Americans, to the ‘Thin White Duke’. It explores his regeneration in Berlin with the critically acclaimed album Heroes, his triumph with Scary Monsters and his global success with Let’s Dance. With interviews with all his closest collaborators, David Bowie - Five Years presents a unique account of why Bowie has become an ‘icon of our times’.','/dFIa89v7Tk1AsJImbxnpk8OwNwX.jpg','2013-05-25',90,'Released','An intimate portrait of five key years in David Bowie’s career.','David Bowie: Five Years',197393,1.9123,7.531,'vkMtlsYNuTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36281,_binary '\0','/2KVVziH6rYGp6HPFtbnztl1nnYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2973516',6.2,2479,'ko','더 웹툰: 예고살인','A web-comic artist finds that a series of murders are occurring that have a disturbing resemblance to the images in her work.','/9ojbUahh8McTbR92Qf69ocWnggE.jpg','2013-06-27',104,'Released','Spirits Never Forget.','Killer Toon',204260,2.1498,6.709,'SBoxMWZ_Pk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36282,_binary '\0','/1bfM65fgDxGQxybkc8S0e7wrWfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2973854',5,1891,'pl','Disco Polo','Young wannabe musicians from the province decide to write hit song and gain the top of the charts in order to become legends of disco polo','/vbPLAtvFJ4v5AMQIGmmHDkBkGUk.jpg','2015-02-27',107,'Released',NULL,'Disco Polo',346443,1.0942,5.1,