OtV7P8JLBl.jpg','2015-12-17',92,'Released','Fast & furry-ous.','Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Road Chip',258509,11.3354,6.033,'V8_W5cZWLZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36287,_binary '\0','/blfZnm6StMPnTY35kaooPBCsSVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2975578',6.4,174267,'en','The Purge: Anarchy','One night per year, the government sanctions a 12-hour period in which citizens can commit any crime they wish -- including murder -- without fear of punishment or imprisonment. Leo, a sergeant who lost his son, plans a vigilante mission of revenge during the mayhem. However, instead of a death-dealing avenger, he becomes the unexpected protector of four innocent strangers who desperately need his help if they are to survive the night.','/qwqHHZLZSUvMkAMQ47ymtfjEifY.jpg','2014-07-17',103,'Released',NULL,'The Purge: Anarchy',238636,15.7998,6.619,'3mfRasMXmL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36288,_binary '\0','/5fX1oSGuYdKgwWmUTAN5MNSQGzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2975590',6.4,799145,'en','Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice','Fearing the actions of a god-like Super Hero left unchecked, Gotham City’s own formidable, forceful vigilante takes on Metropolis’s most revered, modern-day savior, while the world wrestles with what sort of hero it really needs. And with Batman and Superman at war with one another, a new threat quickly arises, putting mankind in greater danger than it’s ever known before.','/5UsK3grJvtQrtzEgqNlDljJW96w.jpg','2016-03-23',152,'Released','The greatest gladiator match in the history of the world.','Batman v Superman: Dawn of Justice',209112,26.1116,6,'0WWzgGyAH6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36289,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2976172',6.2,1867,'hi','सिक्स्टीन','Welcome to sixteen\'s world. A world where growing up has speeded up multifold times from the time you and me were kids.','/zpR2oqdayuzQUDe0B60wVzlZ99k.jpg','2013-07-12',138,'Released',NULL,'Sixteen',232143,1.327,5.643,'TBW9NgHea6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36290,_binary '\0','/mVmrmMhNCPNEukA50RzO78SEV95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2976176',7.8,1765,'hi','Lakshmi','Based on true events, Lakshmi is a story of heroism and untold courage. Lakshmi, a 13 year old girl is kidnapped and sold into prostitution. Thrown into this horrific, inhuman world where she is raped and brutally beaten she barely survives with the help of the other girls and her own will to never give in. Finally she is rescued in a police raid. Against all odds, Lakshmi shows courage where everybody else fails. Resisting all pressure - violent threats, coercion and bribes, she stands up in court and in a landmark case in India, succeeds in putting the traffickers behind bars.','/2rM2sDBjaEVaeWMZ8Ka7n1WXOIn.jpg','2014-03-21',115,'Released','Lakshmi is a story of hope, courage and victory!','Lakshmi',260267,1.5293,6,'Wf4hOMpKlEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36291,_binary '\0','/lWD6ONegGtHJyjd4P3PFc1KelJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2976182',3.2,8290,'hi','रॉय','A love triangle revolving around the lives of a filmmaker, a thief and their mutual love interest.','/9ZPWt2LMqwCAVy4F9YlmLSlQ6S7.jpg','2015-02-11',146,'Released',NULL,'Roy',316900,1.53,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36292,_binary '\0','/4A5HH9HkCPqAwyYL6CnA0mxbYjn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29768333',6.3,4204,'fr','Balle perdue 3','Car genius Lino returns to conclude his vendetta against Areski and the corrupt commander who ruined their lives in this turbo-charged trilogy finale.','/qycPITRqXgPai7zj1gKffjCdSB5.jpg','2025-05-06',111,'Released',NULL,'Last Bullet',1144430,4.4331,6.548,'r2u9GifyDg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36293,_binary '\0','/u5NWHVhZ6HWc1fXnqn82cMar5St.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29768334',7.5,115643,'en','Train Dreams','A logger leads a life of quiet grace as he experiences love and loss during an era of monumental change in early 20th-century America.','/jnaOmD9PmAkNjgVtCn17o7clOYe.jpg','2025-11-05',102,'Released','The extraordinary story of an ordinary life.','Train Dreams',1241983,14.1105,7.3,'6voWeM-xQ4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36294,_binary '\0','/nS0ZhRWncmNTTTopaqJHMvP3pz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2976920',6.8,2321,'fr','Violette','Born out of wedlock early in the last century, Violette Leduc meets Simone de Beauvoir in postwar Saint-Germain-des-Près. An intense lifelong relationship develops between the two women authors, based on Violette\'s quest for freedom through writing and on Simone\'s conviction that she holds in her hands the destiny of an extraordinary writer.','/jo9AfceTbWND9uPjbZCFvzWyJgT.jpg','2013-09-06',132,'Released',NULL,'Violette',209282,1.9002,5.9,'Lzhp2PCOWfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36295,_binary '\0','/zOjrGd5m7UNYxKuzHL00tvS2vDv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2977090',5.8,3550,'en','Alex of Venice','After her stay-at-home husband leaves her, a workaholic lawyer finds that she is not completely up to the tasks of caring for her young son, ailing father and household all by herself.','/6Ko4A0fC06dE40QQqw1wfKEao4r.jpg','2015-04-17',86,'Released','Her life is just getting started. Again.','Alex of Venice',259958,2.7992,5.9,'FpLBd14-Txk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36296,_binary '\0','/gQimJqYMKCkwHIo8wwYKhmnCfBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29780866',5.2,4285,'en','Icefall','A young Indigenous game warden arrests an infamous poacher only to discover that the poacher knows the location of a plane carrying millions of dollars that has crashed in a frozen lake. When a group of criminals and dirty cops are alerted to the poacher’s whereabouts, the warden and the poacher team up to fight back and escape across the treacherous lake before the ice melts.','/5Byv6nznAb2Izd0gHpODOXnuSbo.jpg','2025-10-16',99,'Released',NULL,'Icefall',1242