,'After a young couple moves into a remote farmhouse with their infant son, the woman\'s struggles with postpartum psychosis begin to intensify... as the house reveals secrets of its own.','/cO9ywQ2AMHM9EoBJsJGH1Gl9U5L.jpg','2022-06-17',102,'Released','In this house, you\'re never yourself. And never alone.','Abandoned',880841,2.6877,5.8,'rNON4M0Sr6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36310,_binary '\0','/AbZZz3QwbCrF1hpJfvtl0uZBGGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980210',6.1,50205,'en','A Hologram for the King','Alan Clay, a struggling American businessman, travels to Saudi Arabia to sell a new technology to the King, only to be challenged by endless Middle Eastern bureaucracy, a perpetually absent monarch, and a suspicious growth on his back.','/wmjWGb2tqtOA4XPnK1tpIfzRtSQ.jpg','2016-04-22',98,'Released','How far will you go? To find yourself.','A Hologram for the King',270010,5.0711,5.8,'wZzSZ_8OCY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36311,_binary '\0','/oIvSfhtq4VQWupoarzgYbQVm1BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29802145',5.6,1485,'ml','എന്ന് സ്വന്തം പുണ്യാളൻ','Thomas, a reluctant priest is forced into ordination to fulfill his mother\'s vow. His peaceful existence at the church mansion is disrupted when a young woman, seeking refuge from her troubles, unexpectedly arrives. To complicate matters, a mischievous thief sneaks into the same room, setting the stage for a series of chaotic and humorous encounters. As the unlikely trio navigates misunderstandings and dilemmas, they uncover heartfelt connections and unexpected revelations in this entertaining tale of faith, humanity, and redemption.','/w6pvJOS8aItPlig6lFEUQXPFy7w.jpg','2025-01-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Ennu Swantham Punyalan',1200214,0.8492,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36312,_binary '\0','/x6i6ktXpzsrFKyg5MOxTugxLB5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980472',6.4,20563,'en','Just Before I Go','Ted Morgan has been treading water for most of his life. After his wife leaves him, Ted realizes he has nothing left to live for. Summoning the courage for one last act, Ted decides to go home and face the people he feels are responsible for creating the shell of a person he has become. But life is tricky. The more determined Ted is to confront his demons, to get closure, and to withdraw from his family, the more Ted is yanked into the chaos of their lives. So, when Ted Morgan decides to kill himself, he finds a reason to live.','/rEwXZIOh3CLVA5JJmxT5kaYY6ff.jpg','2015-04-24',95,'Released','Ending it all was only the beginning.','Just Before I Go',258099,4.6053,6.393,'LoGzbn_HVsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36313,_binary '\0','/dh2QT3TPtAQf057yeLpNMuaJlmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980516',7.7,510711,'en','The Theory of Everything','Once a healthy, active young man, Hawking received an earth-shattering diagnosis at 21 years of age. With Jane fighting tirelessly by his side, Stephen embarks on his most ambitious scientific work, studying the very thing he now has precious little of – time.','/7kwcLFNt887saoQAL7EY0XnW7VI.jpg','2014-11-07',123,'Released','His mind changed our world. Her love changed his.','The Theory of Everything',266856,11.5471,7.822,'6NEtaNmTgwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36314,_binary '\0','/xw9B2Wsz1RiPQt9dWrG4tjJxEu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980554',6.1,4909,'en','The Girl in the Book','The story of a young writer\'s transformation when her past invades her present.','/zVvOHOz5848dZ5x7mGqxBWzsPmS.jpg','2015-06-13',86,'Released','She\'s ready to reclaim her story.','The Girl in the Book',339145,3.0566,5.8,'b_CM0FIcoKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36315,_binary '\0','/tooNIFHXIY3rBjCMLCET8yC8cIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980592',6.7,115697,'en','The Guest','A soldier introduces himself to the Peterson family, claiming to be a friend of their son who died in action. After the young man is welcomed into their home, a series of accidental deaths seem to be connected to his presence.','/gvlEFHu9FuYLmBZwsARTtuNIiDO.jpg','2014-09-05',101,'Released','Be careful who you let in.','The Guest',241848,9.2452,6.625,'9tyL6OzBMt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36316,_binary '\0','/1Bmx197oS7RELUYfgT2Alhroo1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980626',7.5,4980,'en','Twinsters','Adopted from South Korea, raised on different continents &amp; connected through social media, Samantha &amp; Anaïs believe that they are twin sisters separated at birth.','/zU6hCAaOXj55xjJR6BeSZu3iWBo.jpg','2015-07-17',90,'Released','Two lives. Changed forever. With just one click.','Twinsters',324325,1.1612,7.3,'1txduZwL2Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36317,_binary '\0','/jUaZAbdpNl33VHprUl4qEohXn8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980648',7.3,91979,'en','The Hundred-Foot Journey','A story centered around an Indian family who moves to France and opens a restaurant across the street from a Michelin-starred French restaurant.','/1vFhSr7INoulu18smHqicft05i8.jpg','2014-08-06',122,'Released','Life\'s greatest journey begins with the first step.','The Hundred-Foot Journey',228194,7.2267,7.3,'_kgUXVQiJYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36318,_binary '\0','/4DryRw1Jyh2c7r8glVayvyhNngP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2980706',5.9,22250,'en','Planes: Fire & Rescue','When world-famous air racer Dusty learns that his engine is damaged and he may never race again, he must shift gears and is launched into the world of aerial firefighting. Dusty joins forces with veteran fire and rescue helicopter Blade Ranger and his team, a bunch of all-terrain vehicles known as The Smokejumpers. Together, the fearless team battles a massive wildfire, and Dusty learns what it takes to become a true hero.','/pOmteFeBDI9FJOPTDvYJYFeAtdp.jpg','2014-07-17',83,'Released','When others fly out, heroes fly in.','Planes: Fire & Rescue',218836,10.903