ild','Irishwoman Mary Reynold\'s journey from rank outsider to winner of a Gold Medal at the Chelsea Flower Show.','/l5NNAlT7GpWHLt6cHwbuFn2V7oa.jpg','2015-03-26',100,'Released','Throw a lifeline to the wilderness.','Dare to Be Wild',348896,1.9144,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36335,_binary '\0','/ewdOfBDitwOBb9byB9oaGp6YP2h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2989524',6.7,14384,'en','Carrie Pilby','Awkward, isolated and disapproving of most of the people around her, a precocious 19-year-old genius is challenged to put her convictions to the test by venturing out on to the NYC dating scene.','/IHuNvCTOsSox1Gj4ykHImrC5EL.jpg','2017-03-31',98,'Released','Live your life before it passes you by','Carrie Pilby',317560,3.1858,6.824,'nLiUc1OKKQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36336,_binary '\0','/jH4iGFXJO7yoQfiwLFT9tgC5mj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt29900584',6.1,1652,'te','ది ట్రయల్','SI Rajeev is assigned to interrogate Roopa regarding her husband Ajay\'s accidental death. Discovering that Roopa is also an SI, Rajeev investigates further and uncovers unexpected revelations in the case.','/4w27ravUZqy9Hbfzvi8GuQnr2QZ.jpg','2023-11-24',97,'Released',NULL,'The Trial',1228548,0.7303,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36337,_binary '\0','/qulaFkn5A5HZ2KMRbMj7N8DsuzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2990126',5.8,4778,'en','100 Streets','Three extraordinary stories covering infidelity, adoption, and a drug dealer turned actor intertwine as characters meet in the streets of London.','/1s5j2raM0vSQ5pqB41TKN44oO0d.jpg','2016-11-11',93,'Released','Anybody can take a wrong turn.','100 Streets',334532,2.4447,6,'FErEVqr3LUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36338,_binary '\0','/zQVsXIPXU040BnFtBmzoOfYGcDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt2990140',7,94886,'en','The Christmas Chronicles','Siblings Kate and Teddy try to prove Santa Claus is real, but when they accidentally cause his sleigh to cras