ampion in boxing, escapes to Macau from the loan sharks and unexpectedly encounters Qi, a young chap who is determined to win a boxing match. Fai becomes Qi\'s mentor and rediscovers his passion to fight not only in the ring but for his life and the cares.','/oH1RCNz7EPXVJeNwVULCKdrqDrD.jpg','2013-08-15',122,'Released',NULL,'Unbeatable',213015,2.3898,6.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36387,_binary '\0','/k0BGeu3Pis9yXZOcMQvPGsJGisu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3003800',6.3,1886,'de','Amour fou','Heinrich wishes to conquer death through love, and when he meets Henriette, the wife of a business acquaintance, she expresses interest in a suicide pact when she learns she has a terminal illness.','/apP5NBwevSugvjssfoUvZ0KMj3K.jpg','2014-05-16',96,'Released','Love can\'t be chosen...','Amour Fou',266044,1.3726,6.5,'RQSzwxQuuCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36388,_binary '\0','/Aar7tDVedd6jXp6S2CmQmaBwHZt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3004544',6,2221,'en','Pete\'s Christmas','An overlooked middle child finds himself in the unexpected spotlight when he realizes his family\'s terrible Christmas day keeps repeating. As the only one experiencing the day over and over, he decides to use his unique gift to give the holidays a makeover and his family a Christmas they will never forget.','/kUThHZFYM6mEH3REIQ76BGMdkAi.jpg','2013-11-16',86,'Released','It’s Christmas... Every... Day...','Pete\'s Christmas',237710,2.2692,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36389,_binary '\0','/uPT0OSTReNiI15Lo9bRv7bNUK9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3004746',4.9,1969,'en','I Am Here','Successful businesswoman Maria has achieved everything except what she wants the most - a baby of her own. She decides to deal with the matter by herself and embarks on a desperate and dangerous journey in order to make her dream come true.','/yA06Duc3TgvDvIJn72sOB0G19mH.jpg','2015-06-12',97,'Released','Fear nothing. Risk everything.','I Am Here'