,3.0071,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36444,_binary '\0','/zyT8A0tZOyOlizq8HkDvbIEPj0U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3020226',6.3,1470,'en','Storm Rider','When her father is put into jail, the spoiled teenager Dani loses everything. Forced to live with her uncle Sam on a farm without horses to ride and to train a sad Dani takes care of a young mule and learns what really counts.','/ria6voEQWcfHpik3hybEqufOyf4.jpg','2013-10-22',90,'Released','Courage Weathers All Storms','Storm Rider',232898,1.896,6.5,'KsimF_fwPbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36445,_binary '\0','/4BJ5IJHjjSBbLLvh4NFSTFbSDlS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3020666',7.3,1668,'en','Unbranded','Documentary about four friends on a 3,000 mile journey across the American West on horseback.','/wL47H2ntJkkpWWrIZNygIVFKxuc.jpg','2015-04-25',106,'Released','Four men, sixteen mustangs, three thousand miles.','Unbranded',338614,1.4969,7,'swX4BLbmBNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36446,_binary '\0','/s6qH2TwlRWzSfKhFeDAJFzNI54A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3021360',6.7,11668,'en','Faults','Claire is under the grip of a mysterious new cult called Faults. Desperate to be reunited with their daughter, Claire\'s parents recruit one of the world\'s foremost experts on mind control, Ansel Roth.','/syUVk09hC701h3C1pjaB69LXwJi.jpg','2014-03-06',90,'Released','Sects, cults, and mind control.','Faults',243526,2.3451,6.6,'pnnbhJSX75U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36447,_binary '\0','/3HlXIpB2pZlUlcWKIYthpmiEjjN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30215084',4,7513,'en','This Is Me…Now','An intimate, fantastical and narrative-driven reflection of Jennifer Lopez\'s journey of self-healing and self-love in an immersive world where music and visuals intertwine, revealing the challenges faced and the triumphs achieved.','/nEMSjYpT0B7uxNwu1kEU8fTycs4.jpg','2024-02-15',65,'Released',NULL,'This Is Me…Now',1217343,5.0089,5.4,'Os