','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36460,_binary '\0','/6OnoMgGFuZ921eV8v8yEyXoag19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30253266',4.8,2903,'en','The Painter','An ex-CIA operative is thrown back into a dangerous world when a mysterious woman from his past resurfaces. Now exposed and targeted by a relentless killer and a rogue black ops program, he must rely on skills he thought he left behind in a high-stakes game of survival.','/UZ0ydgbXtnrq8xZCI5lHVXVcH9.jpg','2024-01-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Painter',1211957,4.6027,5.997,'rZe3fRnZr78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36461,_binary '\0','/lqwwGkwJHtz9QgKtz4zeY19YgDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30253473',6.2,106513,'en','Materialists','A young, ambitious New York City matchmaker finds herself torn between the perfect match and her imperfect ex.','/eDo0pNruy0Qgj6BdTyHIR4cxHY8.jpg','2025-06-12',116,'Released','Some people just want more.','Materialists',1136867,13.2196,6.273,'9gjeXsTsxqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36462,_binary '\0','/ayQhlLDXyXigLkn1U41oZmDWoPV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30253514',7,1312,'en','Pavements','\'90s indie-rock band Pavement reunites for their sold-out 2022 tour. But as preparations get underway, surreal tributes emerge: an off-Broadway musical adaptation of their songs, a museum devoted entirely to the band’s legacy, and a shamelessly awards-baiting Hollywood biopic.','/9ZCWGDGk1GJGQtlu2X5gDVbnU0v.jpg','2025-05-02',128,'Released','\"You\'ve been chosen as an extra in the movie adaptation of the sequel to your life\"','Pavements',1063307,2.6593,6.7,'UvR4aihyRXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36463,_binary '\0','/mZGsJUzQ4dONUBccxhImBqxaSQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30254719',5.9,12840,'ko','전지적 독자 시점','Kim Dok-ja, an ordinary man in his 20s, is the only reader of an obscure web novel titled \"Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse\". After having read the last chapter, the novel suddenly becomes reality, and its omnipotent hero Yu Jung-hyeok appears before Kim. As the only person who knows how to survive in this world, Kim and his companions strive to save the world by writing his own, new ending.','/uXdKubg6wHG9poAsKweUM1zQpdy.jpg','2025-07-23',120,'Released','A novel known only by me has become reality.','Omniscient Reader: The Prophecy',1131759,8.7627,7.4,'fKx01zhEs2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36464,_binary '\0','/phJM1oPu1f185vxgqhv0wt2JE7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3026144',4.8,1393,'en','The Sound and the Fury','A look at the trials and tribulations of The Compson siblings, living in the deep south during the early part of the 20th century.','/b6U8GH0NLR3y9YDUzoiAP72xqAd.jpg','2015-10-23',101,'Released','Man is the sum of his misfortunes','The Sound and the Fury',287636,2.4417,5,'AAGbPpgDG6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36465,_binary '\0','/qx9r2keMWhYZgnncVR9DiNvfFnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3026488',6.5,10702,'en','Alone in Berlin','Berlin in June of 1940. While Nazi propaganda celebrates the regime’s victory over France, a kitchen-cum-living room in Prenzlauer Berg is filled with grief. Anna and Otto Quangel’s son has been killed at the front. This working class couple had long believed in the ‘Führer’ and followed him willingly, but now they realise that his promises are nothing but lies and deceit. They begin writing postcards as a form of resistance and in a bid to raise awareness: Stop the war machine! Kill Hitler! Putting their lives at risk, they distribute these cards in the entrances of tenement buildings and in stairwells. But the SS and the Gestapo are soon onto them, and even their neighbours pose a threat.','/8BuRgEY3dMw8usxelybUS1K3NMd.jpg','2016-02-15',103,'Released','The truth was their resistance.','Alone in Berlin',334522,4.1784,6.722,'lQaGazGtaZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36466,_binary '\0','/3gsetWFUGQy54cIduqNN9IPh3tY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3026824',6.3,1816,'en','Solo','Manuel meets Julio in a chat room and sexual sparks ignite when they meet in person. As their relationship develops, secrets from their pasts cause problems with intimacy and trust.','/rnNNgQgfJmmWlethoJKC2HsdXDt.jpg','2013-07-13',76,'Released','Who are you hooking up with tonight?','Solo',230168,2.1822,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36467,_binary '\0','/Adg0gp8kGKXUSe8emJByRbvweGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30268321',6.7,7970,'en','Eleanor the Great','94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein tries to rebuild her life after the death of her best friend. As a result, she moves back to New York City after living in Florida for decades.','/9XTM42IJST6lwPxtK2iUwNaFvCT.jpg','2025-09-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Eleanor the Great',1212271,5.6518,6.799,'wZ6l2ue--KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36468,_binary '\0','/54BOXpX2ieTXMDzHymdDMnUIzYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30274401',5.1,46751,'en','Five Nights at Freddy\'s 2','One year since the supernatural nightmare at Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizza, the stories about what transpired there have been twisted into a campy local legend, inspiring the town\'s first ever Fazfest. With the truth kept from her, Abby sneaks out to reconnect with Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, and Foxy, setting into motion a terrifying series of events that will reveal dark secrets about the real origin of Freddy\'s, and unleash a decades-hidden horror.','/udAxQEORq2I5wxI97N2TEqdhzBE.jpg','2025-12-03',104,'Released','You there?','Five Nights at Freddy\'s 2',1228246,17.7955,6.6,'NQypHE9_Fm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36469,_binary '\0','/A1UxV47akI0LYiNcIwifTVGEqfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3028018',7.1,2833,'ja','青の祓魔師 劇場版','The atmosphere in True Cross Academy is lively and boisterous in the days leading up to the grand festival held once every 11 years. During this time, Okumura Rin is entrusted with the responsibility of suppressing the berserk Phantom Train. In the midst of his mission, he meets a devil whose appearance is that of a young boy.','/sstaOUvPmMYzeWbYaeDXrYWBp44.jpg','2012-12-28',88,'Released',NULL,'Blue Exorcist: The Movie',201223,2.982,7.2,'0O7b4nTRy2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36470,_binary '\0','/gsiQXIxCtikLSg0Q4t19Z90ApS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3028362',8.1,1534,'bn','শব্দ','The film revolves around the life of Tarak, a foley artist of Bengali film. Tarak\'s job is to create ambient sounds for films, but, he gradually gets trapped in his own world, a world full of sound.','/9AsqkCutZrf0QmyZiQliJUU5F6n.jpg','2013-11-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Sound',246406,1.2248,7.219,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36471,_binary '\0','/ivheLLbhksFbNWTml7KtUCsfFAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3028412',5.6,1347,'es','Por un puñado de besos','A girl. A boy. A love story. But also about dreams, fears, life, true love, friendship and how we deal with it. And a secret between them...','/boN7qOZXh2B7AW3Nr7yzCnTtdIy.jpg','2014-05-16',98,'Released','Life is Worth Living.','For a Handful of Kisses',258751,3.1492,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36472,_binary '\0','/6FbFI2VNpDvnxKb7fugLKXZWso9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30287778',6.3,2722,'ko','베테랑 2','The veteran detective Seo Do-cheol and his team at Major Crimes, relentless in their pursuit of criminals, join forces with rookie cop Park Sun-woo to track down a serial killer who has plunged the nation into turmoil.','/gAtP0usArK5gVOBObnsENKLwML8.jpg','2024-09-13',118,'Released','Don\'t cross the line.','I, the Executioner',995926,3.802,7,'Xo8qEsdBaXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36473,_binary '\0','/haX32ZQxOgDWcJO5sTiTUEE1Ulr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30292390',5.5,5325,'de','Sebastian Fitzeks Der Heimweg','Klara is going to die today unless she kills her husband instead. The Calendar Killer has given her that impossible choice. When Jules starts his night shift at a telephone safety helpline for lonely women on their way home, Klara\'s call reaches him. He soon becomes her last hope for survival and races against time to save her.','/bnciRmZZSdyqp7HcrAwNG0mObaP.jpg','2024-06-17',93,'Released',NULL,'The Calendar Killer',1388694,5.834,6.2,'YMDEgVUPmG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36474,_binary '\0','/xybpplsyjNPpP9tr9uQb5PvwWWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30294282',7.1,1541,'en','Porcelain War','Under roaring fighter jets and missile strikes, Ukrainian artists Slava, Anya, and Andrey choose to stay behind and fight, contending with the soldiers they have become. Defiantly finding beauty amid destruction, they show that although it’s easy to make people afraid, it’s hard to destroy their passion for living.','/qaj6qrQOHHW7mm914ML32v7UcY.jpg','2024-11-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Porcelain War',1214527,1.3007,6.635,'JPxIHYUXeEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36475,_binary '\0','/3p3obY40P58eWejW08rls6dlq8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3029476',5.6,6544,'en','Pressure','Four divers are stuck deep underwater in a vessel after a freak storm destroys their ship. Will they survive?','/6vVL8WmU4WC39hHg44CBVE5Wv6h.jpg','2015-06-04',91,'Released','Hold your breath.','Pressure',252164,2.5276,5.6,'doEriZxhcBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36476,_binary '\0','/4UXfZjqt0C5kHTROotrsnfDYCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3029556',7.5,16444,'ja','るろうに剣心 伝説の最期編','Shishio sets sail in his ironclad ship to bring down the government. In order to stop him, Kenshin trains with his old master to learn his final technique.','/3sw2YRF0UR4jeZJ2yvpgk4qvMQK.jpg','2014-09-13',135,'Released','Every battle has an end… but some legends live forever.','Rurouni Kenshin Part III: The Legend Ends',221732,5.0683,7.689,'vEJo1BSBGPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36477,_binary '\0','/q3jiq1PRpOGnRScbj3cur7RkZYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3029558',7.5,20351,'ja','るろうに剣心 京都大火編','Kenshin has settled into his new life with Kaoru and his other friends when he is approached with a request from the Meiji government. Makoto Shishio, a former assassin like Kenshin, was betrayed, set on fire and left for dead. He survived, and is now in Kyoto, plotting with his gathered warriors to overthrow the new government. Against Kaoru\'s wishes, Kenshin reluctantly agrees to go to Kyoto and help keep his country from falling back into civil war.','/gI2xYpJPQOsmFblvowkW2IgEHkC.jpg','2014-08-01',138,'Released','Fate Hangs On His Sword.','Rurouni Kenshin Part II: Kyoto Inferno',221731,5.7086,7.6,'-ti5Y9jAor0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36478,_binary '\0','/e8npsTfpBZa8T0TQqyZSwD9RNu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30308957',5.2,2006,'sv','Kärlek fårever','A Stockholm couple plans to get married on the gorgeous island of Gotland, where family-imposed traditions turn their most important day into a disaster.','/e2yAyz0PR43aIxnGjv9HJryHBys.jpg','2025-02-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Love Forever',1214481,2.7735,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36479,_binary '\0','/iytQNneOp4lNSKktRh9T6Fo3UXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3031654',8.2,7728,'it','Ennio','A portrait of Ennio Morricone, the most popular and prolific film composer of the 20th century, the one most loved by the international public, a two-time Oscar winner and the author of over five hundred unforgettable scores.','/lEuLAubp74HYztEyNYpEx3AoqOu.jpg','2022-02-17',156,'Released',NULL,'Ennio',396194,7.3569,8.3,'q5WBbULw_0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36480,_binary '\0','/kEvBFfqCtJvtvwZcrprAT3dSvij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30317033',6.8,2994,'en','Sebastian','Max is a 25-year-old freelance writer and aspiring novelist who seems well on his way to success in London’s cultural spheres. Yet by night, he finds a different kind of exhilaration as a sex worker with the pseudonym Sebastian, meeting men via an escorting platform. Max uses his experiences as Sebastian to fuel his stories and the worthy debut novel that he has been longing to write, finally seems within reach.','/22JTGme2MLETmvhHQdiKP78S5Qf.jpg','2024-08-02',110,'Released','How far would you go for the story?','Sebastian',1067485,2.1549,6.3,'Ah_6fikWOak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36481,_binary '\0','/vzO729sITNJ1jB6Y9AJpIhlbvb2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30317302',6.5,4344,'en','Bitconned','In this true-crime documentary, three guys exploit the freewheeling cryptocurrency market to scam millions from investors and bankroll lavish lifestyles.','/dDHpIF5mcAkeiv3r8KlMkksr7b9.jpg','2024-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Bitconned',1213997,1.8133,6.455,'UDqRvMmuUcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36482,_binary '\0','/jD1oLRnLSKiLhutjiZ6OzgCgBsr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30319503',7.3,16757,'en','Dìdi (弟弟)','In 2008, during the last month of summer before high school begins, an impressionable 13-year-old Taiwanese American boy learns what his family can\'t teach him: how to skate, how to flirt, and how to love your mom.','/3UCTNaZgxW6BbeHMMTe6uL07MpV.jpg','2024-07-26',94,'Released','For anyone who\'s ever been a teenager.','Dìdi (弟弟)',1158915,4.3645,7.2,'e6gve8GtSuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36483,_binary '\0','/13H7aiwQsiEDok54b1OFDTz7u1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30319516',6.7,4283,'en','Good One','On a weekend backpacking trip in the Catskills, 17-year-old Sam contends with the competing egos of her father and his oldest friend.','/yesxQtWrG5vCrNsnG3TrXiOfpOZ.jpg','2024-08-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Good One',1122618,2.931,6.6,'sfgjVKoMb4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36484,_binary '\0','/3IPj6hUlhGvb7xkdQGXbIMjp6lb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30319555',7.5,1804,'en','Frida','An intimately raw and magical journey through the life, mind, and heart of iconic artist Frida Kahlo. Told through her own words for the very first time — drawn from her diary, revealing letters, essays, and print interviews — and brought vividly to life by lyrical animation inspired by her unforgettable artwork.','/qfPjPZF2AqB2XnXPFcHlYtlQRS3.jpg','2024-03-08',87,'Released','Her truth. Her art. Her words.','Frida',1214523,1.5705,6.8,'dlrqxAgdY58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36485,_binary '\0','/3CwKraydx0pon9wRrysJXmDMVJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30319830',7.1,4555,'en','Skywalkers: A Love Story','Two real-life daredevils test the limits of their love and trust by illegally scaling one of the world\'s tallest buildings to perform an acrobatic stunt.','/33w8SfE5VsXfj7QnqBb3R3mSdFE.jpg','2024-07-12',101,'Released','What will they risk to touch the sky?','Skywalkers: A Love Story',1214488,2.3152,7.2,'8jA1KpESAqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36486,_binary '\0','/xoguYBNxXhyiQasTZyIxaYMjcUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30319854',7,4033,'en','Sugarcane','An investigation into abuse and missing children at an Indian residential school in Canada ignites a reckoning on the nearby Sugarcane Reserve.','/9Xx4o4MVSDv0pojOzoHMH5y85hB.jpg','2024-08-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Sugarcane',1158874,3.0367,6.985,'CisI_WFPDOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36487,_binary '\0','/6GIRELnBhvqj8AS8v8ao64OSrR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30320410',6.8,1466,'es','Sujo','When a hitman is murdered, he leaves behind Sujo, his beloved 4-year-old son. The shadow of violence stalks Sujo at every stage of his life. As he grows into a man, Sujo will discover that fulfilling his father\'s destiny seems inevitable.','/Aljgp27QB1JNHSQOHXXsMlR8Ck9.jpg','2024-08-21',127,'Released','Orphaned by violence. Shaped by legacy. Defined by destiny.','Sujo',1214508,2.8118,6.782,'-Sn9KCFoqBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36488,_binary '\0','/xXR8BCRUMUbrPQ1QAumbL0x93fV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30320576',7.5,1675,'no','Ukjent landskap','In a forest in Norway, a family lives an isolated lifestyle in an attempt to be wild and free, but a tragic event changes everything, and they are forced to adjust to modern society.','/4Wd3wMa3IHS5AAtn1v1uxL438ty.jpg','2024-04-15',84,'Released',NULL,'A New Kind of Wilderness',1208994,1.5685,7.8,'FITaku0UkZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36489,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3032074',7.6,1253,'bn','ব্যাচেলর','Intertwined story of a group of friends living together and their romantic complications.','/cgEYY2AnHijgw0nYxwRce5ej8gq.jpg','2004-01-31',148,'Released',NULL,'Bachelor',421718,1.2457,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36490,_binary '\0','/b4WIBVLsVWYP74zOxVUVN3xEErz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30321095',7.5,8495,'en','Ghostlight','When melancholic construction worker Dan finds himself drifting from his wife and daughter, he discovers community and purpose in a local theater\'s production of Romeo and Juliet. As the drama onstage starts to mirror his own life, he and his family are forced to confront a personal loss.','/aqSuuJdNYmx1Gsd0J8lqfzMADfE.jpg','2024-06-14',115,'Released',NULL,'Ghostlight',1214469,3.8802,7.184,'R1TycuGX4Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36491,_binary '\0','/p8o3o3oETlAZxfQf10T6vJG8eZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30321133',7.4,14112,'en','Will & Harper','When Will Ferrell\'s good friend Harper comes out as a trans woman, they take a road trip to bond and reintroduce Harper to the country as her true self.','/1xbYcoEb9gqezNnLgjWcZI5Hlsl.jpg','2024-09-12',114,'Released',NULL,'Will & Harper',1214506,5.3673,7.3,'PRZ1ELeGepo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36492,_binary '\0','/z31pODVM3uUB4bvirzxHdxrJIzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30321146',5.5,31959,'en','In a Violent Nature','The enigmatic resurrection, rampage, and retribution of an undead monster in a remote wilderness unleashes an iconic new killer after a locket is removed from a collapsed fire tower that entombed its rotting corpse.','/hPfWHgq07nXbeldwEGxWB4JqwtE.jpg','2024-05-31',94,'Released','Nature is unforgiving.','In a Violent Nature',1214509,4.8737,5.5,'4BVW7axwtQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36493,_binary '\0','/xlkojbJMcuEPoZlBEciH36wQcze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3032282',4.7,3405,'en','Eden','After their plane crashes off the coast of a deserted Pacific island, the surviving members of an American soccer team find themselves in the most dire of circumstances with limited resources, dwindling food supply and no rescue coming any time soon. Team spirit evaporates as disagreements cause the group to separate into factions - a violent one lead by an unbalanced ruler, and a compassionate one led by a selfless player.','/nVtCuhdg1mYjMMFdUKqijgrAWAS.jpg','2015-09-18',97,'Released','Survive at any cost.','Eden',360339,1.6106,5.2,'ZlLlGz_d4zE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36494,_binary '\0','/nVRLa3jrEZG24qMkv4VBMdNckt6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3032300',6.5,1459,'fr','Oggy et les Cafards','Ever since the world was born, two forces have been locked in perpetual battle. Their struggle is so Manichean, so ferocious, so Herculean that it makes the clash between good and evil look like a game of checkers! This ancestral duel is so ancient and so merciless that it can only be, Oggy against the Cockroaches!','/dKUMAflFNp7sWGPjOSqw16J0X72.jpg','2013-08-07',81,'Released',NULL,'Oggy and the Cockroaches: The Movie',205048,2.9003,7.281,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36495,_binary '\0','/ORO3R5kDBMmBbt102vM9tlsV3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30324320',5.3,4144,'en','Marching Powder','Middle-aged Jack, arrested for drugs, strives in six weeks to repair his marriage, curb a bullying in-law, and guide his stepbrother in the right direction, but all efforts fail as his life spirals further out of control.','/iDzRpQpzNE0W8hwbJMQuMLzcbVB.jpg','2025-03-07',96,'Released','A rom-com with a kick.','Marching Powder',1253003,1.7322,5.9,'VPZ4NY-HKP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36496,_binary '\0','/nVMpA0JPnfeu6R9sf7sTDwhTh5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30325268',6.6,1742,'fr','Trois amies','Joan is no longer in love with Victor, but it pains her to feel she is being dishonest with him. Alice, her best friend, reassures her: She herself doesn’t feel passionate about her partner Eric and yet their relationship is smooth sailing. She has no idea he is having an affair with Rebecca, their mutual friend. When Joan finally decides to leave Victor and he disappears, the lives of the three friends and their relationships are turned upside down.','/s2mk1ElcP9xBhd4QHtUvXYMH8qs.jpg','2024-11-06',117,'Released',NULL,'Three Friends',1137245,3.1734,6.226,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36497,_binary '\0','/w7zwirlAMFqYb0RHDyBaTImL6fB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30326556',9,2164,'te','Paagal vs Kadhal','Innocent Karthik adores the unpredictable Priya, while innocent Amrutha has feelings for the eccentric Dr. Manoj. Priya inflicts emotional pain on Karthik in the guise of love. Amrutha\'s love for Manoj remains unreciprocated.','/7yCUIg1pHeue4eqH8egMhJ3IO1S.jpg','2023-12-29',111,'Released',NULL,'Paagal vs Kadhal',1218519,0.9902,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36498,_binary '\0','/fIbr7oWorx5rOzdjOiIFtfFUXzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30327451',7.4,7381,'fr','En fanfare','A world-famous orchestra conductor discovers the brother he never knew he had — a school cafeteria worker who plays trombone in a local marching band. Detecting his brother\'s exceptional musical talent, he takes it upon himself to rectify the injustice of fate.','/6lATJ42bWGAIQ0cG2dzSZD8bNcL.jpg','2024-11-27',102,'Released',NULL,'The Marching Band',1000866,7.9879,7.26,'bhfCXPYIKs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36499,_binary '\0','/koHoI4EebSVv4vgI1Fh3KAIaYo6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30327762',6.7,2273,'lt','Akiplėša','Dreaming of an escape from the bleakness of their hometown, two teens form a unique bond at a local modeling school, where the promise of a better life pushes girls to violate their bodies in increasingly extreme ways.','/knG84vSv8kRMeopgIcrTpsYYHSs.jpg','2025-03-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Toxic',1315091,12.0214,6.59,'ImMyk4qlN3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36500,_binary '\0','/18qzbskGhbAPjkFrtgPw1utxIF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3033080',3.2,1377,'en','Extinction','Deep in the Amazon jungle a group of scientists are on a dangerous mission. When their guide suddenly abandons them, they find themselves in a savage and hostile environment. However, things turn deadly when they find they are in the middle of a hunting ground for a pack of prehistoric predators long thought extinct.','/oep1iDOJsoe2uD067iWNQdTDSqQ.jpg','2014-08-24',100,'Released','Nature Has Evolved','Extinction',279988,1.5644,3.9,'fMSwwRWIVKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36501,_binary '\0','/dzfPFqBQmlWhgRtw8SVNWRQOYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30332302',5.7,1696,'en','Kill Me Again','Charlie, a notorious serial killer known as the Midnight Mangler finds himself trapped, reliving the same violent night over and over. Initially embracing his grisly urges, Charlie soon becomes desperate to escape the endless nightmare.','/tPUC1q4zfxxoAPvz9ssF5QQ0sYk.jpg','2025-08-08',108,'Released','Some nightmares never end','Kill Me Again',1514364,2.8816,6.1,'zCXDXma-kfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36502,_binary '\0','/vk3yW9BkdRwzRJ2FlfbDuCGKN6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3033478',6.8,1388,'en','Necessary Evil: Super-Villains of DC Comics','A documentary detailing the epic Rogues\' Gallery of DC Comics from The Joker and Lex Luthor, Sinestro, Darkseid and more, this documentary will explore the Super Villains of DC Comics.','/jwmQO1KieVUWLqgP4PMyl1r4fVZ.jpg','2013-10-23',99,'Released',NULL,'Necessary Evil: Super-Villains of DC Comics',229979,2.2109,6.8,'9peY-v1pfFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36503,_binary '\0','/6MdqcSsK7JG0pXzJ7a2I9ief5yX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3033948',4.4,1626,'en','Echoes','A young writer experiences visions during episodes of sleep paralysis, and she retreats with her boyfriend to an isolated house in the desert. As the visions worsen, she teeters on the edge of insanity as she uncovers a life-threatening secret.','/3Af5FJEmhdUkRH4Hg9dRNJbWaR4.jpg','2014-07-05',88,'Released','The truth is a nightmare.','Echoes',328763,1.3899,4.2,'W_xochl3GAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36504,_binary '\0','/rfgcVizKcydtxctXr4C1nFOxScx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3034258',5.8,2691,'pt','Meu Passado Me Condena: O Filme','The immature and cheap douche bag Fábio Clóvis marries the pseudo-intellectual Miá and they travel in a cruise to Europe on board of a fancy passenger vessel. Fabio and Miá are invited to have dinner with the wealthy Beto Assunção and his gorgeous wife Laura in a VIP restaurant on the vessel. Soon Fábio discovers that Beto was Miá\'s boyfriend and Miá learns that Fábio had a crush on Laura that was his classmate. Meanwhile the cynical chamber maid Suzana Mello and her estranged husband, the entertainer Wilson, make a bet that Fábio and Miá will split before the end of the trip and poison their relationship. When the ship arrives in Casablanca, Fábio meets his bothersome childhood friend Cabeça that affects their honeymoon.','/gWakumkwCwcsnVvAW7I2gCgQpcT.jpg','2013-10-25',102,'Released','You\'ve never seen a honeymoon like this','Meu Passado Me Condena: O Filme',228202,1.5213,6.423,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36505,_binary '\0','/8dlna8rRcf5gDCRzEsjtHizpj1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30343021',7.3,32783,'en','Song Sung Blue','Based on a true story, two down-on-their-luck musicians form a joyous Neil Diamond tribute band, proving it\'s never too late to find love and follow your dreams.','/xStmzLprgzqjzfvpBI7uTbcRpwQ.jpg','2025-12-15',133,'Released','Inspired by a legend. Bound by a dream.','Song Sung Blue',1371185,8.9804,7.4,'ZqU7iiHFCzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36506,_binary '\0','/fH4pbzTCP1EWbZ1BoCtx7lgRb1F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30343126',6.8,2446,'en','Miss You, Love You','Forced to plan her late husband\'s funeral with her estranged gay son\'s assistant, a blunt, grieving widow forms an unlikely bond with the total stranger as confronting their shared grief surfaces deep family secrets and long-held resentments.','/aVt8ubqnuBU8R5MVNbuf9OTy8sa.jpg','2026-05-29',98,'Released','People have a funny way of growing on you.','Miss You, Love You',1232667,4.2754,6.6,'qriWSK376U0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36507,_binary '\0','/jSHqYTHCOasL7LgOCopUZi2dfxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3034594',5.5,1661,'en','Nowhere Safe','After two girls cruelly impersonate her online in a \"reverse cyber bullying\" plot, Ashley\'s reputation is ruined and she and her mother flee a growing threat to their lives. Starting over at a new school, romantic interests and the poignant lessons from an eccentric history teacher draw them out of seclusion until they realize confronting a hurtful past is essential to ensure a brighter future.','/f1bWiFnw0D4aMGN8Fu9ldvHWEqN.jpg','2014-10-05',93,'Released','Cyberbullying...Nowhere to run...Nowhere to hide','Nowhere Safe',279973,1.5231,6.5,'kMLJLFfwJV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36508,_binary '\0','/sjwGBJC3g8yypSYq8gKAd0yVlzv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3034728',8,2591,'ml','Left Right Left','Roy and his friends expose the misdeeds of Sahadevan, a corrupt politician, and soon the friends are found murdered. Later, when Roy dies of an illness, Jayan discovers Roy and Sahadevan\'s past.','/7GGP0ZQLeuT0Fm2yjR4LARTP99c.jpg','2013-06-14',167,'Released','Revolution is home made','Left Right Left',206167,0.8894,7.017,'11dkHJyjfdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36509,_binary '\0','/4AMAfqTnYsYESpZwJ3eXAOKg4al.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30364726',6.7,1237,'ko','시민덕희','After losing her laundry store to a fire incident, a single mom Duk-hee receives a call from a bank offering a generous upfront loan so she takes it right away. But soon after, she finds out that she has become a victim of a voice phishing scheme. Devastated, Duk-hee turns to the police for help, only to be more disappointed that there is no hope of retrieving her money. At the moment of despair, Jae-min, the phisher who tricked her, rings her phone once again to tip Duk-hee off about the criminal organization that locked him up and coerced him to make voice phishing calls from China. With that call, Duk-hee makes up her mind to investigate this case for herself and take a plane to China with her friends.','/gF2yhuzy1o0uVWuKQ799LwDXH1V.jpg','2024-01-24',113,'Released','Good citizens gone mad.','Citizen of a Kind',696047,2.2421,7.5,'2ruW5HBv3aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36510,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3036548',3.1,1621,'en','Reminiscence','There are worlds, there are humans and there are Others. But there is only one Time which is the border between worlds. What if time breaks down? Reminiscence based on true events and physics, telling the story of a couple that trying to experiment the unproved parallel time and black-hole theories. They traveled to a town called Cesme for their research. But what they will face is much beyond the human mind.','/81qcpZgtkc1M6QKiIp9lJUOwatn.jpg','2014-10-14',120,'Released','Time is the only border between worlds. What if time breaks down?','Reminiscence',215976,0.6982,2.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36511,_binary '\0','/x9mXPRYMaxDfmUrZWCKOe6Wgjee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3036740',1.8,9316,'hi','हमशकल्स','A comedy centered around three people who each have a lookalike of a lookalike, all with the same name.','/jl2BKSOuCH5g1a6Yt4FmbOujEe7.jpg','2014-06-20',160,'Released','Nine Times The Fun','Humshakals',273505,1.4193,3.198,'z8FL_K0XhAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36512,_binary '\0','/rEFPBkMhSZ1Z6Zf88uaB4sM8tjS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3037164',7.1,4146,'hu','Tiszta szívvel','Two physically handicapped youngsters make friends with a paralysed hitman and are commissioned by a local mafia boss. They have little to lose although things are never as they first appear. The boundaries between fantasy and reality blur as the unlikely heroes stumble from one close encounter to the next and we gain an unusual insight into their lives on the periphery of society.','/uycU7uKMU5H5Un4DMPQXNV5IogI.jpg','2016-04-28',105,'Released','Now they’re calling the shots','Kills on Wheels',393695,1.3466,7.09,'d0eVHpSCLds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36513,_binary '\0','/pJrvgPCTYaNJJmeQej6ICBiGbgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3037582',7.6,3744,'uk','Поводир','American boy Peter and blind minstrel Ivan are thrown together by fate amidst the turbulent mid-30s Soviet Ukraine.','/njhVyqgNDBbfy5TqKyfIPImleec.jpg','2014-11-12',120,'Released',NULL,'The Guide',293122,1.5018,7.86,'Hkjc6d2kiXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36514,_binary '\0','/8DZ5vx36QoYoJkekDG2JChGaRpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3038142',5.2,2950,'en','Inner Demons','INNER DEMONS follows an \'Intervention\'-style reality show crew that films an episode about a sixteen-year old girl, a former A-student, who is fighting addiction but may in fact be suffering from something even more destructive: demonic possession. The movie is an inquiry into the truth about her - with symptoms that straddle the disturbing and scary intersection between insanity, addiction and true possession.','/62S9KjZqhgGrJoZIf83FeOb4LDa.jpg','2014-06-13',85,'Released','Exorcise caution.','Inner Demons',274899,1.2391,5.2,'fWHFOq6UuYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36515,_binary '\0','/nusKn1Kkjz4NsAKXBswjJVOwMXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30387012',5.8,21358,'hi','बॉर्डर २','Three idealistic soldiers in the Indian army, navy and air force face grueling combat conditions in this film set during the 1971 Indo-Pak war.','/AmrCgmDPEJ6QxllS1rhjYwgO9Wb.jpg','2026-01-23',201,'Released',NULL,'Border 2',1213898,4.8251,7.583,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36516,_binary '\0','/kEY6RjklHdwJfg5Wxnu20aAc618.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3038708',5,12926,'en','Iron Sky: The Coming Race','29 years after the events of Iron Sky, the former Nazi Moonbase has become the last refuge of mankind. Earth was devastated by a nuclear war, but buried deep under the wasteland lies a power that could save the last of humanity - or destroy it once and for all. An old enemy leads our heroes on an adventure into the Hollow Earth. To save humanity, they must battle the Vril, an ancient shapeshifting reptilian race, and their army of dinosaurs.','/l5t2Nf1F7iQUKTrODg93xmQzZLj.jpg','2019-01-25',93,'Released','Let\'s make Earth great again','Iron Sky: The Coming Race',302349,4.7564,5.2,'URTPgGEhmNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36517,_binary '\0','/u4vzkyQFGuTJ1l2SS9jZmYZG4fr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3039472',5.3,1395,'en','Return to... Return to Nuke \'Em High aka Vol. 2','Following the events of Volume 1, the mutated glee club continue their violent rampage in Tromaville. Chrissy and Lauren, two innocent lesbian lovers, must fight not only the Cretins, mutants, and monsters but also the evil Tromorganic Foodstuffs Conglomerate. Can they, and Kevin the Wonder Duck, save Tromaville High School and the world?','/2YC1JNgGGHrCXDT83UCpdcWLFmV.jpg','2017-01-15',85,'Released',NULL,'Return to... Return to Nuke \'Em High aka Vol. 2',207680,2.2532,6.5,'nbgdwz9qcgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36518,_binary '\0','/byFQpmElaxa4sPwS0d9qQMTtygw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30395619',7.3,11249,'ja','「鬼滅の刃」絆の奇跡、そして柱稽古へ','Tanjiro undergoes rigorous training with the Stone Hashira, Himejima, in his quest to become a Hashira. Meanwhile, Muzan continues to search for Nezuko and Ubuyashiki. A recap of Kimetsu no Yaiba episodes 55–56, with new footage and special end credits.','/3daOEMQCOGU2n9EbUC0PICnUCek.jpg','2024-02-02',103,'Released','The roar of victory.','Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba -To the Hashira Training-',1216221,10.6301,6.5,'TcuxuwtIhtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36519,_binary '\0','/qLWD7I1Lnadu7IrM8XPhnDD9ZAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30395629',6.4,1461,'ar','أحلام العصر','A retired football star, notorious and oppressed by the media, cooperates with his daughter in an opportunity to take revenge on the social media portal. The more they dive into the dream of fame and stardom, the greater their involvement.','/17Lj1nimCkhk5hlIxnMHgIOXMyB.jpg','2024-05-02',195,'Released',NULL,'Fever Dream',1114740,1.0761,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36520,_binary '\0','/fMrqfn0gaHf2ZRV1Tlr7vCE5r5O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30398905',5,1333,'de','Woodwalkers','Humans who can shapeshift into animals struggle to integrate with others without revealing their special abilities. As a group, they strive to inform and institute change in the perspective of deforestation and the importance of natural habitats. However, when that cannot happen, they\'re forced to take matters into their own hands.','/bC1r04ohuxv5feaGDzQ0lXz7Bbl.jpg','2024-10-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Woodwalkers',1241894,4.7855,6.4,'_Z1iwECnjeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36521,_binary '\0','/pSjRDluxao3wVcTUG6DKanVlrcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30400277',5.7,4534,'en','Kiss of the Spider Woman','Valentín, a political prisoner, shares a cell with Molina, a window dresser convicted of public indecency. The two form an unlikely bond as Molina recounts the plot of a Hollywood musical starring his favorite silver screen diva, Ingrid Luna.','/c8zDeDq0Uatjly6Fh4ycmWuoLYy.jpg','2025-10-09',128,'Released','It\'s time to step back into the spotlight.','Kiss of the Spider Woman',1214684,6.9506,5.8,'9DoylxHhxr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36522,_binary '\0','/5TTOv7NNIBju8bwFAUn6LeqlQnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30400822',7.3,2879,'bn','রাজকুমার','A journey of a son separated from his mother during the 1971 war. A son embarks on a quest to reunite with his mother in the United States, the profound impact of his search leaving an indelible mark and shattered his life forever.','/rffRoSsf0v7GEM9f5mvuoiMdyO9.jpg','2024-04-11',142,'Released',NULL,'Rajkumar',1032030,1.3769,5.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36523,_binary '\0','/4iiIIBk4Aw2GpSfrkvk8GWiwOxd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3040510',2.8,1317,'it','Fuga di cervelli','Five friends forge their resumes and enroll to Oxford in orders to help one of them end up with the girl he\'s in love with.','/kfZXag3DkaHfakSrojG92C2R2Gy.jpg','2013-11-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Brain Drain',238930,1.3272,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36524,_binary '\0','/1o64gSrLtGjB37rNyQdEpixpaR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30406302',6.2,1941,'ta','பெருசு','After discovering their father dead, two estranged brothers are shocked to find something inside him is still alive. What should have been a day of somber mourning breaks Into a complete bedlam as the two sons try to conduct the funeral as discreetly as possible. Forced to navigate nosy relatives, hidden family secrets, and their own strained relationship with their father, the brothers must hold it all together—or risk letting everything unravel.','/avD34sOjy6KbU1w6Xy9LhHYg60c.jpg','20