ynical 34-year-old, drinks a mysterious champagne on Christmas Eve and wakes up seventeen years in the past, sharing a room with her 17-year-old self. Given the chance to change the worst Christmas of her life, she attempts to fix past mistakes, only to discover surprising truths about her family that may help her mend her present-day relationships.','/m3QeiZlAbixGwddpAaEBBhThzmx.jpg','2013-11-23',83,'Released','This Christmas she must revisit her past to change her future.','Kristin\'s Christmas Past',239347,2.4143,5.9,'cdqyV2MbGtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36538,_binary '\0','/hwqoL2dmIIHvRkVj7ofphlsnMg6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3043630',3.3,2576,'zh','小时代','When four best friends try and move forward in their work and personal life, they realize that trying to live their life\'s dream is more difficult than they imagine -- especially in the high fashion world of Shanghai.','/pVjXRBCDKItPfXsEFiV0xJZghhu.jpg','2013-06-27',116,'Released','Older but stronger...We call it friendship','Tiny Times',209049,1.4663,4.535,'i6j4u8DeaK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36539,_binary '\0','/xjEEy1Ykrq0caDMUIQa2exiuEEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3044244',6.7,6769,'it','Le meraviglie','In the Tuscan countryside, a family of traditional honey farmers struggles to make ends meet. The household consists of only daughters—four of them—led by the eldest, Gelsomina, who takes on the responsibilities of the family. When a small boy is sent to stay with them for rehabilitation, their routine is disrupted. As financial troubles threaten their home, Gelsomina sees an opportunity in a reality TV contest searching for \'Italy’s Most Traditional Family.\' Willing to expose their secluded life for the prize money, she clashes with her father’s rigid ways in a bid to secure their future.','/u5Z23Rt9OKhQc61wPPwrDs4psdi.jpg','2014-05-22',112,'Released',NULL,'The Wonders',265226,2.7139,6.8,'UyEmDbPtAwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-1