d. Investigations pointed to Gregório Fortunato, chief of Vargas\' personal guard, as the orderer of the frustrated assassination. This incident was one of the most importants in the history of Brazil.','/tAOyDRHraKlJlG5o9br4jxvJbwF.jpg','2014-05-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Getulio',259719,1.086,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36552,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30460694',8.3,2145,'te','Currency Nagar','A thrill-seeking robber stumbles upon a fortune in a deceased magician’s abode. But the cash has a voice of its own, and it spins stories of greed, lust, and doom that expose the dark side of avarice.','/654BEHtpMt5GNCgh1SZDY1qfYJ1.jpg','2023-12-29',125,'Released',NULL,'Currency Nagar',1243159,2.156,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36553,_binary '\0','/6xqvokwceVpLJ2ms06Adrs6sNa6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30467885',6.7,3649,'de','Führer und Verführer','As Minister of Propaganda, Joseph Goebbels creates films and pictures used to prepare the Germans for Total War and the Holocaust. When the war is lost, he conceives his last staging, the most radical propaganda act still possible to him.','/iK5rrNUSNUMOWyPUQAHo6WsjOho.jpg','2024-07-11',123,'Released',NULL,'Goebbels and the Führer',1219576,2.8257,6.6,'HIqeLlET_LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36554,_binary '\0','/gqTz24ZRsCP6AKjARmEivY7m0cK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30472557',8.3,68346,'ja','劇場版 チェンソーマン レゼ篇','In a brutal war between devils, hunters, and secret enemies, a mysterious girl named Reze has stepped into Denji\'s world, and he faces his deadliest battle yet, fueled by love in a world where survival knows no rules.','/pHyxb2RV5wLlboAwm9ZJ9qTVEDw.jpg','2025-09-19',100,'Released','Lost Love, Flower, Chainsaw.','Chainsaw Man - The Movie: Reze Arc',1218925,29.7213,8.557,'EPaoHkV0dYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36555,_binary '\0','/upDUDOlpGBPGwV6A4vs0y2Whzg0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30475122',7.7,3193,'ja','MONSTERS 一百三情飛龍侍極','A samurai\'s path leads him to a young waitress whose hometown was destroyed by a dragon. He doesn\'t want any trouble — but it finds them anyway.','/yG8QKnaiz7JoIMh3oxdm0JJN6IG.jpg','2024-01-21',26,'Released',NULL,'Monsters 103 Mercies Dragon Damnation',1230393,3.7414,7.2,'Q6tmyHjEFcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36556,_binary '\0','/cZmOrIOkJ2SNfVdiO85dUbOAYnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30476486',7.8,8616,'ja','劇場版ハイキュー!! ゴミ捨て場の決戦','Shoyo Hinata joins Karasuno High\'s volleyball club to be like his idol, a former Karasuno player known as the \'Little Giant\'. But Hinata soon learns that he must team up with his middle school nemesis, Tobio Kageyama. Their clashing styles form a surprising weapon, but can their newfound teamwork defeat their rival Nekoma High in the highly anticipated \'Dumpster Battle\', the long awaited ultimate showdown between two opposing underdog teams?','/ntRU0OA4etGGiMMmH1Yw0bnaMdW.jpg','2024-02-16',84,'Released','Let\'s play a game that can\'t be repeated.','HAIKYU!! The Dumpster Battle',1012201,9.2842,7.8,'6X8kZCzF3zI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36557,_binary '\0','/vd7OvudVEAzO9QG5c80Qdf9mKqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30476518',7.6,3320,'zh','小小的我','Liu Chunhe, suffering from cerebral palsy, bravely breaks through the shackles of body and mind to realize the dream stage for his grandmother, while trying to find the coordinates of his own life. After experiencing a summer transformation, he finally embarked on a new journey.','/rLj287mA1tp4hZmd69umb1rOZu8.jpg','2024-12-27',131,'Released','Don\'t accept fate, accept spring scenery.','Big World',1278101,9.5232,8.7,'DPCZaofIKuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36558,_binary '\0','/kZot7eNLTyJCqtYTFcdjgfq5RLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30487077',5.5,1363,'en','Thine Ears Shall Bleed','In the 1860\'s American West, a minister and his family are traveling in a covered wagon when they hear a mysterious sound coming from the woods. Believing the sound to be God, they worship it, until they discover the sound is something much more sinister.','/bakEMfTTqxIb0Ej1VTmE3nWr86e.jpg','2024-07-09',102,'Released',NULL,'Thine Ears Shall Bleed',1304429,1.6943,6.4,'sEnCdfn7jGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36559,_binary '\0','/4So4aDgPRkspivwd0WEZu9x1GVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30494321',5.4,1471,'it','Ricchi a tutti i costi','When a grandmother falls for a cheeky suitor with dubious intentions, her family devises a secret plan to protect her life — and their inheritance.','/azv9ekvJr1Vz6gNZa6QyaIbeiHG.jpg','2024-06-04',90,'Released',NULL,'The Price of Nonna\'s Inheritance',1175156,2.7385,5.604,'Jji4A2TekfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36560,_binary '\0','/u3Cfe21Cmv5cWs5VnFCz15HdfKO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30496762',4.9,19095,'hi','माँ','A mother and daughter encounter a demon in a village where girls have been disappearing.','/kc5n7LJUmvBsVxzAla1ONN8kouP.jpg','2025-06-20',133,'Released','Hell is here, so is the goddess.','Maa',1389158,2.3477,6.8,'lVvMbXiJjko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36561,_binary '\0','/hOcz6CfSiE8QrjuIuy6vPLeHDOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30504474',4.4,4639,'tr','Erdal ile Ece','The story of a married couple who experience funny conflicts in their relationship.','/skSnBU4oPAXsstH3r56y0p7QExC.jpg','2024-02-22',107,'Released',NULL,'Erdal and Ece',952063,0.9613,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36562,_binary '\0','/g70uNy3hRqEcU0ilBTtcuBFlizx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30505698',6.6,42092,'en','Friendship','Suburban dad Craig falls hard for his charismatic new neighbor Austin, and his attempts to make an adult male friend threatens to ruin both of their lives.','/eikAu9gPJTQQmwFwa1zX5Hfz96P.jpg','2025-05-09',100,'Released','Men shouldn\'t have friends.','Friendship',1239655,5.7942,6.417,'cmSPwZIZu6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36563,_binary '\0','/9W8kRM6eMSrgUK5Z7NI7CmdQ5wE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30505839',6.6,1586,'en','Blind Date Book Club','A bookstore owner finds love and direction in life after agreeing to review a famous author’s new novel in her blind-date-with-a-book club.','/9fwY72YdYuQW8hzC3bQXFVc8QRi.jpg','2024-04-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Blind Date Book Club',1249342,1.867,7.14,'kZeMxWrofok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36564,_binary '\0','/eq24kKsd5S1NCZDrQ2fBkKDkWle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30515931',6.1,3156,'ko','크로스','In the ultimate test of marriage, an agent-turned-househusband gets tangled in a perilous mission with his detective wife, who\'s clueless about his past.','/aE9WqOApdRYsowsGE0118dyA4c9.jpg','2024-08-08',100,'Released','From a dear nemesis of a husband to a hot summer action ally.','Mission: Cross',1002088,3.5487,6.965,'hKYZrznkYZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36565,_binary '\0','/6o6pDoUZ5XbSfNN64OErtcUkF5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30516366',6.3,4049,'ja','Chime','A chef\'s life is disrupted by a chime that brings with it an increasing sense of dread.','/s6bBgT11fFHwKrzrFluCoKfcjdU.jpg','2024-08-02',45,'Released',NULL,'Chime',1219556,2.9031,6.776,'S5Dir3JrhQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36566,_binary '\0','/9c8AaLr1eeC6kGiyyWTUkQ6V0El.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30519830',6.8,1829,'fr','Hiver à Sokcho','In the snowy seaside town of Sokcho, 25-year-old Soo-Ha works at a guesthouse. She drifts between her mother’s fish stall and her boyfriend until a French artist’s arrival stirs questions about her identity. As winter deepens, Soo-Ha and the artist form an unspoken connection through food and art.','/tVF00d1iCOpEnPx73tUGzsh1uaV.jpg','2025-01-08',104,'Released',NULL,'Winter in Sokcho',1001010,3.0209,6.6,'Q1HV4Zgcy2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36567,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30521753',4.9,2163,'kn','ಶೇಷ 2016','Shesha 2016 is a gripping crime thriller set over one chaotic night at a remote police station on the Karnataka-Kerala border. When an abusive officer is brutally murdered, a lone female cop gets trapped in a deadly cat-and-mouse game with a cryptic caller. It’s a gritty, fast-paced watch filled with intense suspense and dark secrets.','/g3MKavT8VNBdkvI8ln9h7jpbaj3.jpg','2026-03-06',122,'Released',NULL,'Shesha 2016',1647712,1.1853,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36568,_binary '\0','/cRu4ISJZWOSmg9zKE4CXHWk3aiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3053228',3.5,12976,'en','Day of the Dead: Bloodline','In a world overrun by zombies, military personnel and survivalists live in an underground bunker while they seek a cure.','/3jM4C1wJxHLWlF4tcSyyv6fnJPR.jpg','2017-12-29',90,'Released','Join the undying war.','Day of the Dead: Bloodline',485415,5.3822,4.68,'3hhFT3vCeko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36569,_binary '\0','/e50DTFe9hOgCEDfinYkAhZojoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3054798',6.4,2839,'ko','협녀, 칼의 기억','While in medieval Korea, a young girl sets out to revenge the betrayal and the death of her mother. But therefore she must face one of the most powerful men and warriors of the Goryeo Dynasty.','/dqf7fnJXoPvKdVD33w4KYl3qB55.jpg','2015-08-13',120,'Released','The fated Battle of the Three Swords.','Memories of the Sword',348689,2.9462,6.59,'LQP8FrqyFm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36570,_binary '\0','/vyVej06dqHnOuj6hhHWl4LuSU7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3055402',5.9,3362,'en','SuperBob','After six years without a date, Robert, the world\'s only superhero, is looking for love. The only barrier to his plan is that he regularly has to save the world, so he needs to get some time off if he is to meet his superwoman.','/9asWkGz7p2pYsvQkEmQpXMYfHRj.jpg','2015-10-16',82,'Released','Saving the world is easy. Dating is a nightmare.','SuperBob',339362,1.8425,6,'gyHN3_ZUyuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36571,_binary '\0','/pJg0uCexeVKmr24x9OFvs7lwRlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30561103',4.1,1623,'en','Brute 1976','In 1976 a group of people in the desert for a photo shoot, stumble upon an abandoned town called Savage. But they are not alone. A family of masked psychopaths have claimed Savage as their own and are hell bent on living up to its name.','/jrbYuJNMRPzdQ5RZ2FGKfQbD1Qz.jpg','2024-03-13',105,'Released','Land of the Free...Home of the Depraved!','Brute 1976',1221415,1.6728,4.7,'Shc46p9u_3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36572,_binary '\0','/wH8CJShhPfG702ORVgynWlguHoG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3056436',5.3,2309,'ta','மான் கராத்தே','Five friends meet a mystic in a forest who grants their wish — a newspaper from the future. They decide to get rich by using their knowledge of the future. They focus their efforts on Peter, a carefree youth from Royapuram, who is predicted by the newspaper to win a boxing match and present the prize money of Rs. 2 crores to the five friends. However, they are perplexed when they discover that Peter has absolutely no knowledge of boxing.','/42c3XPDLEkbmELwvsbDdan0E425.jpg','2014-04-04',154,'Released',NULL,'Maan Karate',259837,1.1123,4.8,'EzuT3f80P8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36573,_binary '\0','/xJlCgOEcGlCmAXi02PvMDDjdIiH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30580186',7.4,3900,'fa','پیرپسر','In an Iran weighed down by a struggling economy, two middle-aged brothers live with their bullying father. A man prone to rages and driven by chauvinism, the father’s abusiveness found his second wife leaving him. Now he picks on his eldest son, while the younger sibling fantasises about ways to kill his father. When the man rents out the flat above to a young woman, with intentions of marrying her, the woman’s attraction to the older son slowly pushes this profoundly damaged family to breaking point.','/6TmnS420vtbDSaS6US95QJRSZ4f.jpg','2025-06-11',192,'Released',NULL,'The Old Bachelor',1219608,1.1905,6.3,'lDCQkgdkTZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36574,_binary '\0','/aQGJvf9HImYm20oB2AxaLx2rCy5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3058674',5.1,1929,'en','VANish','Three thugs kidnap Emma, the daughter of a drug kingpin, and have no idea that murderous blood that runs through her veins. As time passes, the unlucky threesome finds themselves in danger from the police, gangsters and their captive.','/mcJRjOHunsv2NV4GMopqb4sQ4mG.jpg','2015-02-24',79,'Released','The just kidnapped the wrong victim.','VANish',298032,1.2353,4.5,'CNQGoLx1nds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36575,_binary '\0','/o5pSgHibKD0vPtXiGztSTZTWiHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30590474',5.8,2291,'ta','நிலவுக்கு என் மேல் என்னடி கோபம்','Prabhu, a young chef, is ready to move forward with an arranged marriage when his past love, Nila, unexpectedly reenters his life, challenging his plans and emotions.','/j5krlz9U40ZWaspQXa5CtQUikXl.jpg','2025-02-21',131,'Released','An Usual Love Story','Nilavuku En Mel Ennadi Kobam',1222049,2.8407,6,'M3nu9ftN1_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36576,_binary '\0','/8a3PCNWfXblAwPzjXZbOaHJKMP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3059638',5,1865,'hu','Coming Out','This is the story of present-day Hungary\'s most famous gay celebrity who openly admits his homosexuality and fights for gay rights in a society where so many alternative values are denied. But then something happens and he is shocked to discover his growing interest in the female of the species.','/jSsBOmgR2S0mudmeorjiRITLpMc.jpg','2013-12-05',91,'Released','Ready or not','Coming Out',258133,1.7333,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36577,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3059656',7.5,1832,'sr','Ničije dete','The movie is based on the fascinating, true story of a feral boy whom hunters found among wolves in a forest in the mountains of Bosnia-Herzegovina (BiH) in the mid-1980s. The boy was sent to the institution for children in an attempt to socialize him and got the Muslim name – Haris. Contrary to most predictions, he was developing and making friends quickly. When the war in BiH broke out in 1992, Haris got the letter from local Bosnian authorities which asked for his immediate return. Upon returning to BiH, he had nowhere to go. While wandering aimlessly, he came across a group of soldiers that gave him a gun and took him with them','/u3VV113xG8cXnQx6CNzCZ6A4PUN.jpg','2014-09-01',103,'Released',NULL,'No One\'s Child',291156,0.6791,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (36578,_binary '\0','/krz73dvSqUXruODzl5QhgmucbDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3059786',6.7,2136,'fa','دهلیز','Behzad, who has been in prison for manslaughter for a long time, has a son who does not know about him. When he is introduced, the son goes through a conflict. Then, as a family, they go to the victim\'s family seeking consent so Reza would be released.','/mEY95qjOWJJv3HAHtpYXgFggDU9.jpg','2013-07-30',91,'Released',NULL,'The Corridor',250113,1.0953,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36579,_binary '\0','/dbgc3w4TcdeqweB76rGKJpoM1UH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3059816',5.1,1912,'en','The Wannabe','Based on true events, The Wannabe, a story about Thomas, a man obsessed with Mafia culture during the 1990s in New York City. When Thomas’s failed attempts to fix the trial of infamous mobster John Gotti gets him rejected by the people he idolizes most, he sets off on a drug infused crime spree with his girlfriend and longtime mob groupie, Rose, by brazenly robbing the local Mafia hangouts.','/54BzzzvfHD0iS41QSfdp3u7hpIT.jpg','2015-12-04',90,'Released','Respect isn\'t earned. It\'s stolen.','The Wannabe',333387,2.4076,5.1,'BTmp6kZrsuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36580,_binary '\0','/qhDxEJmtInaPaNp6VEyXF5iV8jy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3060492',7.2,10821,'en','Before I Disappear','At the lowest point in his life, Richie receives a call from his estranged sister, asking him to pick up his eleven-year-old niece from school. What begins as a simple favor turns into a nighttime odyssey through New York City, where the two form an unexpected bond.','/fVn4g01k6uEFdOsv7lNcJYvcldR.jpg','2014-10-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Before I Disappear',253254,2.3213,6.688,'bosMzZh916I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36581,_binary '\0','/jIcgArgzCMhsBCwDm61MLK0XmBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3061202',7.6,4741,'ml','നീലാകാശം പച്ചക്കടൽ ചുവന്ന ഭൂമി','Kasi and Suni are close friends who studied together in an engineering college. Assi, who comes to Kerala to study engineering under the North East quota falls in love with Kasi. Certain incidents that follow set Kasi and Suni on a road trip to Nagaland on two motorcycles. The incidents that happen during this road adventure forms the film.','/yKvrZ53FBY9EzH2kLy4KdeyPpub.jpg','2013-08-09',142,'Released',NULL,'Neelakasham Pachakadal Chuvanna Bhoomi',209419,1.4933,7.075,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36582,_binary '\0','/cBgrdobrGu59xmrzuiEw1An9C7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3061836',5.9,6500,'nl','Welp','Over-imaginative 12 year-old Sam heads off to the woods to summer scout camp with his pack convinced that he will encounter a monster...','/m3IJum2fBtkHG1zfF4aia2PhiLL.jpg','2014-10-29',85,'Released','Be prepared.','Cub',284270,2.0771,5.5,'KKVo-MP2Ajc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36583,_binary '\0','/xmBJ9nezUteqowdYfrW8383LHd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3062074',4,22025,'en','Sharknado 2: The Second One','A freak weather system turns its deadly fury on New York City, unleashing a Sharknado on the population and its most cherished, iconic sites - and only Fin and April can save the Big Apple.','/GgZOBSNIkxz3qA66Jauv6VvIc.jpg','2014-07-31',95,'Released','Shark happens!','Sharknado 2: The Second One',248504,4.8402,4.6,'fWY4-u9Ewdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36584,_binary '\0','/y3w1fdR3QfYy22ryvhRl6YyHohs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3062096',6.2,204459,'en','Inferno','After waking up in a hospital with amnesia, professor Robert Langdon and a doctor must race against time to foil a deadly global plot.','/5T6iVetK5AB1kgwAEKbDM2hTZJU.jpg','2016-10-13',122,'Released','His greatest challenge. Humanity\'s last hope.','Inferno',207932,11.4929,6.103,'RH2BD49sEZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36585,_binary '\0','/eshkakDIN3nwZZt6uvYKW15BPSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3062170',5.8,1308,'de','Buddy','Inexperienced guardian angel, Buddy arrives to assist Eddie with getting his life back on track, but instead only causes more chaos.','/uWGfl0DHyUvCdXLdQmC3n5bZsPR.jpg','2013-12-25',94,'Released',NULL,'Buddy',246894,1.3632,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36586,_binary '\0','/78tCQfbPpBq3wmPxPPh7hQ0P6md.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3062742',6.1,1547,'en','Break Point','Jimmy Price is a reckless man-child on the last leg of his career as a doubles tennis player. When his latest partner drops him, he realizes he\'s officially burned all of his bridges on the pro circuit. He decides to make one last ditch effort to revive his career, reaching outside of the tennis world and convincing his childhood partner -- his estranged brother Darren, now an apathetic substitute teacher - to team up with him. The mismatched pair, with the help of a unique 11-year-old named Barry, make an unlikely run at a grand slam tournament and are forced to re-discover their game, and their brotherhood.','/cKijmjp6yyzUY9VdE4mWJy3xJxS.jpg','2014-03-08',90,'Released','Even if they win, they\'re lost.','Break Point',250572,2.1417,5.8,'4CvcMHShHe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36587,_binary '\0','/aFhOFFf1TdU1tCX8LhWbpozucr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3062880',7.7,7240,'he','גט: המשפט של ויויאן אמסלם','The trial story of Viviane Amsalem\'s five year fight to obtain her divorce in front of the only legal authority competent for divorce cases in Israel, the Rabbinical Court.','/wu0FRMPgoY7BxuLpwApHZt6nWz9.jpg','2014-06-25',115,'Released',NULL,'Gett: The Trial of Viviane Amsalem',270403,1.8338,7.535,'Y9yZoUPAHkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36588,_binary '\0','/uacWG9bF6xMBKW0qNBTMLC8GBif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30629563',4.9,1452,'ar','جرس إنذار','At a strict girls school, a mysterious fire blazes out of control. Now everyone\'s questioning whether it was an accident — or arson.','/8Gw