year-old Irving Zisman is on a journey across America with the most unlikely companion: his 8 year-old grandson, Billy.','/dDSMzBEaM0LYSy9Muo0zsCo77Vh.jpg','2013-10-22',92,'Released','Real people. Real reactions. Real messed up.','Jackass Presents: Bad Grandpa',208134,5.9577,6.194,'_MSrAwfagG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36593,_binary '\0','/znc4p9S2177ClNnTlJHr1CSOIkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3064298',6.8,59838,'en','Man Up','A 34 year old single woman, Nancy, hung-over again, exhausted by the endless fruitless set ups by her friends, traveling across London to toast another 10 years of her parents\' successful happy magical marriage runs in with a 40 year old divorcee, Jack, who mistakes her for his 24 year old blind date. Nancy, deciding to go with it, happens to hop on the most chaotic yet hilarious journey of her life which neither of them will ever forget.','/tJskXY0qQcc21UzkGPyiGRKw2md.jpg','2015-05-29',88,'Released','If you can\'t get a date... just steal one!','Man Up',332340,4.3726,6.6,'kLtSNWOao-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36594,_binary '\0','/moOIMMc2GENmlBahGS8t4NSPlKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3064338',5.6,5985,'pt','Mutant Blast','Maria, a fearless soldier, and TS-347, a man with superhuman strength, are being pursued by a military cell responsible for scientific experiments that have resulted in a zombie apocalypse. On the way, they will meet Pedro, a man with few ambitions and a great hangover. Together, they will try to escape to a safe place, but complications will cross their paths in the form of a nuclear bomb.','/mlpCYl0WgPy7toZFDIFrbGESEdK.jpg','2019-10-24',84,'Released',NULL,'Mutant Blast',543593,1.5607,5.9,'T03HgYPwOeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36595,_binary '\0','/hlfwix95IlY8201nm3ovoaOmvuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3064356',6.5,2108,'en','The Beat Beneath My Feet','Teenage boy Tom lives with his single mum in a flat in South London. Into the flat below moves Steve, an anti-social former Rock God who faked his death 8 years ago. Tom agrees not to reveal his secret on condition that he teaches him the dark arts of Rock Guitar.','/e8OPRJ4rvgNOFAKKWc1T9OEW8Mu.jpg','2014-09-25',89,'Released','Live your dreams','The Beat Beneath My Feet',314011,2.1023,6.4,'PJo9qTVTN0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36596,_binary '\0','/vAdfsCSVjseTfv38jN8W8nZDoyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30644187',4.4,1649,'tr','Mutluyuz','Close friends Ferhat and Aslı realize that they need to be together after they are abandoned by their lovers. In the third year of their marriage, things are no longer going well. Ferhat tells Aslı that they are going on vacation and takes Aslı to a hotel for couples therapy, hoping to improve their relationship.','/x1WYpRymI9IBKAM1o889P3ug7PQ.jpg','2023-12-29',95,'Released',NULL,'We Are Happy',1222903,0.6812,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36597,_binary '\0','/cjhq1eBLXgKq1xHDFeUnYzu61H6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30645201',5.3,30208,'en','Honey Don\'t!','Honey O\'Donahue, a small-town private investigator, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church.','/fJm3kmd9NLZWypMas7g34oNFgbk.jpg','2025-08-21',89,'Released','She only has two desires, and one of them is justice.','Honey Don\'t!',1149504,11.6512,5.543,'Jzr6pHIZAI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36598,_binary '\0','/hUAfTSYJObgEFxThLRnnY45SGzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3065132',7,4927,'en','He Named Me Malala','A look at the events leading up to the Taliban\'s attack on the young Pakistani school girl, Malala Yousafzai, for speaking out on girls\' education and the aftermath, including her speech to the United Nations.','/lOYrqRKhOrPd5RvWoyTw71KVI6z.jpg','2015-09-12',87,'Released','One child, one teacher, one book and one pen can change the world.','He Named Me Malala',338928,2.0422,6.7,'3ghiYve6k68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-1