n','The Editor','A one-time (and now one-handed) master film editor toiling in the cinematic sweatshops of 1970s Italy becomes the prime suspect in a series of brutal murders.','/xFRFBJTmFJ4PMQvOv2VpRTbFdO.jpg','2014-09-11',95,'Released','He\'ll leave you on the cutting room floor!','The Editor',285840,1.4892,5.6,'d7zoICSi1-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36604,_binary '\0','/wG3tyHfukOMfpBASJFhmXxIvbC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3068192',4.5,4117,'en','Grace','A unique horror film told from the first-person perspective of Grace - a naive, virginal college freshman trying to deal with campus culture and her outgoing roommate as an evil entity takes over her body and unleashes chaos.','/6ikvuPIo1kGuRQz70l3ecissZLS.jpg','2014-10-28',87,'Released','Innocence ends in blood','Grace',289416,2.4026,5.062,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36605,_binary '\0','/ekZ7j7ElSFurRgqSalcP622YGrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3068194',6.4,27869,'en','Love & Friendship','From Jane Austen’s novella, the beautiful and cunning Lady Susan Vernon visits the estate of her in-laws to wait out colorful rumors of her dalliances and to find husbands for herself and her daughter. Two young men, handsome Reginald DeCourcy and wealthy Sir James Martin, severely complicate her plans.','/xEQ5mmz43Fjmrz2KFSpz8ykUjec.jpg','2016-05-26',94,'Released','A lady never reveals her tactics.','Love & Friendship',296360,5.1027,6,'wrKRrnNif90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36606,_binary '\0','/9TzKDTsH45q0XdmlOBVACz3FvPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3068466',5.1,2232,'en','Christmas Belle','With her California hometown in the rearview mirror, Belle heads north on business to catalog the sale of a large mansion. While the job is a dream, the client, Hunter Lowell, is not. But, as the two spend more time together, his icy demeanor begins to melt. Although their relationship is budding, Belle’s long-time suitor, Tony, arrives, sending mixed signals to Hunter while adding chaos to the holiday season.','/sh822zcLjxGfF2BogCOLLNCPvSu.jpg','2013-12-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Belle',245792,1.9643,5.7,'KXyQpj7nlkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36607,_binary '\0','/jAOpZDgy4eMY6o6oGdUiXk4SqvE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30691214',5.2,7041,'en','Forbidden Fruits','Free Eden employee Apple secretly runs a witchy femme cult in the basement of the mall store after hours - with fellow fruits Cherry and Fig. But when new hire Pumpkin challenges their performative sisterhood, the women are forced to face their own poisons or succumb to a bloody fate.','/nSlKzxvXWOeDC9qZiwkhGuTAKkq.jpg','2026-03-26',103,'Released','The coven just clocked in.','Forbidden Fruits',1450527,10.4052,5.8,'0nyUCq9k7_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36608,_binary '\0','/omimB6pzNeYXJpmHpJhyfmZSyJG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30691223',7,1607,'it','Berlinguer: La grande ambizione','Secretary of the most influential Communist Party in the Western world, Enrico Berlinguer challenged the international balance by seeking to bring the Communists to government in Italy and achieve socialism in a democratic country. From 1973, when he escaped an attack by the Bulgarian secret services, to the assassination of his main ally Aldo Moro in 1978, not forgetting his trips to Moscow and the covers of Time: the story of a man who wanted to change the world, but failed.','/nOszJZETEGjZRCPfZJdDqxHpHiG.jpg','2024-10-31',122,'Released',NULL,'The Great Ambition',1193421,1.8003,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36609,_binary '\0','/jNfvBQipPh3ONrHHuhWTBbrUgRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3069758',6.8,8987,'tr','Dabbe: Cin Çarpması','Ahead of her wedding, Kübra is possessed by demons. When an examination reveals more horror, her friend, a psychiatrist, tries to perform an exorcism.','/j537aN6h9w06VipRHqFHnuFB1Ef.jpg','2013-08-02',134,'Released','If the eyes belong to the djinn, the records belong to the Satan.','D@bbe 4: The Possession',254712,2.7112,6.273,'1PLhwhQX2iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36610,_binary '\0','/zLfbpkO2b8Gb3fhM54xnmKtKFBD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30700695',7.1,2108,'en','Lilies Not for Me','Haunted by a forbidden affair, a young man in a 1920s “conversion” clinic finds hope in a compassionate nurse who challenges the era’s cruel norms.','/kUYt0YYohZ7O4G6E7NO9FTKmJ2q.jpg','2025-04-30',99,'Released','Love cannot be cured.','Lilies Not for Me',1315655,2.9988,6.6,'WQ-vGYWD-5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36611,_binary '\0','/twH6h5ggDqcTftSdENgdWZYmPU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30701950',7.1,2439,'bn','খাদান','Shyam comes from the remote areas of Purulia to work as a laborer in the coal mines of the Damodar Valley. The story of Mohan and Shyam will proceed with their rise, reckoning of friendship.','/lP6cxFBUVbf3YR2ems4GDllUXaN.jpg','2024-12-20',135,'Released',NULL,'Khadaan',1153230,2.0338,6.5,'uMB71TgHsQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36612,_binary '\0','/u875yEigO3nAsCpkSgM1IvTcOFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3070936',6.9,4911,'en','Shrek the Musical','Put out of his swamp solitude by a wicked tyrant\'s order, grumpy ogre Shrek goes on a journey – accompanied by a chatterbox donkey – to retrieve a beautiful princess from a tower, unaware that she has secrets all her own.','/k3uIgE9obtdQnshufhzQlLKZW1Z.jpg','2013-09-17',130,'Released','Believe all ogre again.','Shrek the Musical',381696,3.5254,7.116,'UPSPj3kx3Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36613,_binary '\0','/2l10RwJKugMS0Tn5TFYntQTpRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3071192',5.4,1280,'en','Cruel Summer','Young Autism sufferer Danny enjoys the serenity and solitude of camping. That\'s all about to change when enraged teens Nicholas, Calvin and Julia find him, each with their own agenda for wanting to see Danny suffer.','/99ClkvkRfI4BaHO1eNO3bnnxRl5.jpg','2016-08-27',78,'Released','One Day Changes Everything','Cruel Summer',384452,0.7876,5.1,'xK5uXvZkb5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36614,_binary '\0','/owFK2ZO4fTQz5IyPWUzUX6lxYUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3072182',6.8,2295,'en','Christmas in Conway','Duncan Mayor decides the perfect Christmas present for his terminally ill wife, Suzy, is a ride on a real Ferris wheel, set up in their very own back yard. As a young man, it was the perfect place for a wedding proposal. Now, years later, in order to relive the experience with his wife, Duncan will go to any length to make their fantasy become a reality.','/wF0jcqPfIz0Se5LNFVpu7dkb6Go.jpg','2013-12-01',97,'Released','He gave her a gift this town will never forget.','Christmas in Conway',240820,2.1421,5.8,'gwaGIMMDJMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36615,_binary '\0','/agxzi8QIXWnZgLxwHck8wdjfYk7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3072482',6.7,109838,'en','Hardcore Henry','Henry, a newly resurrected cyborg who must save his wife/creator from the clutches of a psychotic tyrant with telekinetic powers, AKAN, and his army of mercenaries. Fighting alongside Henry is Jimmy, who is Henry\'s only hope to make it through the day. Hardcore Henry takes place over the course of one day, in Moscow, Russia.','/ik1uZyiMSxF9HqrgRKUNfMCfr3z.jpg','2015-09-12',97,'Released','First they made him dangerous. Then they made him mad.','Hardcore Henry',325348,8.3699,6.4,'4JVgQzBG5Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36616,_binary '\0','/bHiAoVHdoubtWUnNkQMuAWdb02O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3072732',6.3,3200,'de','Jim Knopf und Lukas der Lokomotivführer','A young orphan boy Jim Button, his best friend Luke and a magical steam engine called Emma travel across the world in search of the truth about where Jim came from. Battling pirates and dragons, outsmarting make-believe giants, they must travel through the Forest of a Thousand Wonders, beyond the End of the World to find the hidden Dragon City.','/pkJEkOOr1qn5HLGGhkJ0bTTPVET.jpg','2018-03-29',109,'Released',NULL,'Jim Button and Luke the Engine Driver',422742,3.3169,6.383,'a8hspczg-R4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36617,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3073256',6.9,8818,'bn','নিঃস্বার্থ ভালোবাসা','Rising model Meghla falls in love with a business magnate Ananta, but he soon finds out that Meghla was using him to become successful in her modeling career.','/e5wG8YEoCnnfbcYn60qrmIQ5k2H.jpg','2013-08-08',151,'Released',NULL,'Nisshartho Bhalobasha: What Is Love!',467043,0.9129,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36618,_binary '\0','/cVoEIvjuyMh2P04n8T1rwHbuHix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3073490',6.2,1226,'en','Committed','An accidental meeting between a man being pressured to propose to his girlfriend and a runaway bride.','/4GRFAerhVuSsfQTDgFQrYApEfBs.jpg','2014-04-06',86,'Released','Α story about boy meets bride','Committed',282762,1.8999,6.2,'4_yHiszzLpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36619,_binary '\0','/jas9AaeGWZjT1qcbvuPjccnS56e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30742355',5.1,25639,'hi','सन्नी संस्कारी की तुलसी कुमारी','Two former lovers in Delhi try to rekindle old flames, leading to amusing mix-ups and deceptions. As chaos unfolds, a new unexpected romance blooms. Who will find their happy ending amid the confusion?','/h3lncTnK86R8XylpXgpe0JfU1wm.jpg','2025-10-02',136,'Released','Four people. Two heartbreakers. One wedding.','Sunny Sanskari Ki Tulsi Kumari',1248454,1.6968,5.792,'syPu-cu6toQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36620,_binary '\0','/go58BqpA6WYL1pzKsb2chi7qx9H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30743549',2.4,4581,'en','The Mouse Trap','It\'s Alex\'s 21st Birthday, but she\'s stuck at the amusement arcade on a late shift so her friends decide to surprise her, but a masked killer dressed as Mickey Mouse decides to play a game of his own with them which she must survive.','/3ovFaFeojLFIl5ClqhtgYMDS8sE.jpg','2024-08-23',80,'Released','This is not the funhouse.','The Mouse Trap',1225377,3.5613,4.1,'HL1C2RAOZ6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36621,_binary '\0','/ohXCOIJQX6TbOSWtsUuYjGgJ0Bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3074578',4.8,1341,'en','The Surface','Two strangers, both at the end of their rope, suddenly meet in the middle of the unpredictable waters of Lake Michigan.','/4JNyPLxwlqreQMSzZ5lTr59h2Zb.jpg','2014-10-09',86,'Released','Sometimes you look for the end. Sometimes it looks for you.','The Surface',290714,1.466,5,'vlcgPgfGZXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36622,_binary '\0','/pE76KNQO3AgYp2iLNxK0yUdlIZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3074610',6.9,2615,'es','Pelo malo','A nine-year-old boy’s preening obsession with straightening his hair elicits a tidal wave of homophobic panic in his hard-working mother, in this tender but clear-eyed coming-of-age tale.','/l4VwgcnoFu4QPh7jAimT8ritFur.jpg','2014-04-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Bad Hair',214138,1.1324,6.566,'VQyWW53ii1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36623,_binary '\0','/4IM2CnUVQMEXS2YaY0YNBwSkcRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3074732',6.8,3652,'is','Hross í oss','A country romance about the human streak in the horse and the horse in the human. Love and death become interlaced and with terrible consequences. The fortunes of the people in the country through the horses\' perception.','/6eYTn4BrD8ycb3rqlXzd6oPEME4.jpg','2013-08-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Of Horses and Men',217708,2.1268,6.9,'zne8tM9B2_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36624,_binary '\0','/vGe38lBYBOLp0jthuBOIVGap4fM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3074780',7.4,3497,'en','Supermensch: The Legend of Shep Gordon','Supermensch documents the astounding career of Hollywood insider, the loveable Shep Gordon, who fell into music management by chance after moving to LA straight out of college, and befriending Janis Joplin, Jim Morrison and Jimi Hendrix. Shep managed rock stars such as Pink Floyd, Luther Vandross, Teddy Pendergrass and Alice Cooper, and later went on to manage chefs such as Emeril Lagasse, ushering in the era of celebrity chefs on television.','/6cUD0vmz2ZCXeejLpPXkP2hJexl.jpg','2013-09-07',75,'Released',NULL,'Supermensch: The Legend of Shep Gordon',209416,1.9677,7.074,'Zd0VOkPOrV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36625,_binary '\0','/3HkuzTqpMl2K9K0xJCwmGOAW4h8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3074952',4.1,1716,'en','Welcome to Willits','Deep in the Northern California woods, in the heart of the notorious Emerald Triangle, lies a remote cabin. The residents struggle to fight off the repeated attacks and abductions by mysterious creatures that have plagued them for years. When a local pot farmer is caught up with a wayward group of campers, the situation quickly escalates into total carnage.','/6KvFXyg3T3nQ94y7V14l9tbB6x9.jpg','2016-11-11',82,'Released','Not your typical cabin in the woods story...','Welcome to Willits',406112,2.3041,4.3,'oD_C9ATfJR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36626,_binary '\0','/p96S6KlDD71BMhNGLqf7zvEVlCL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30750109',6.1,1749,'id','Pemandi Jenazah','Lela, a mortician, finds something odd about the body of her mother who died suddenly. Trapped in sacred tension and a tense horror journey, Lela discovers another oddity in the body of the corpse she was bathing.','/1ZTrQWpuhxMr32uC1fQBRnkVYlf.jpg','2024-02-22',107,'Released',NULL,'The Corpse Washer',1223799,3.4985,6.6,'YVpYr5Y15OY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36627,_binary '\0','/8jcg4AkchMvAHAhaDQC9M93oegC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30750859',5.2,1482,'fa','تمساح خونی','I am a crocodile, a bloody crocodile! A wounded person who has lost his whole life and has nothing to lose... but still he wants to take big risks!','/xDZUW23Gvt5mDNutSKswaL8OQJe.jpg','2024-02-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Alligator Blood',1236435,0.8918,7.5,'eivhN_8Argk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36628,_binary '\0','/uGOvItLCr8tENmizfGnRxoovURx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3075360',7.6,3670,'kn','ಗೂಗ್ಲಿ','Googly is a 2013 Kannada romantic comedy film directed by Pawan Wadeyar and produced by Jayanna Combines. Yash and Kriti Kharbanda are the lead actors while Ananth Nag and Sadhu Kokila play the primary supporting roles. The film released on 19 July 2013 and opened to a fantastic response at the box office. The film was declared a \"Blockbuster\".','/msmmN0U0Pp9eZsxwiMlj9MIlAAm.jpg','2013-07-19',144,'Released','Love Spin!!!','Googly',267618,1.5246,6.417,'QhhbBpzR2eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36629,_binary '\0','/yi3nA7nM0cfr5JeAhmSEodTLYLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30764843',5.8,2008,'fa','صبحانه با زرافه‌ها','The story is about some close friends who go to their friend\'s wedding. They go there and when they go to the bathroom, they find a stairwell and use drugs there. They take the groom (their friend) there and the groom.','/1fCcKHeQervHuURiZ7NZ20WcBLH.jpg','2024-02-03',98,'Released',NULL,'Breakfast with Giraffes',1236291,0.9673,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36630,_binary '\0','/3vvA1WuP4wVTmuyOKUhdJLzIUWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30766504',7,2338,'en','On Falling','Aurora, a Portuguese migrant, works as an order picker in a warehouse in Edinburgh, Scotland. Caught between the walls of a huge distribution centre and the solitude of her own room, Aurora tries to seize every opportunity to resist the alienation and isolation that threaten her identity.','/kBnNDABP0rIkXdxJV3OcyOlTLT3.jpg','2025-03-07',101,'Released',NULL,'On Falling',1225624,2.1928,7,'hMlBMSdU7IY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36631,_binary '\0','/kODNw6GJNdgldUMEhKPlCw8wQCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3076658',7.6,340095,'en','Creed','The former World Heavyweight Champion Rocky Balboa serves as a trainer and mentor to Adonis Johnson, the son of his late friend and former rival Apollo Creed.','/1BfTsk5VWuw8FCocAhCyqnRbEzq.jpg','2015-11-25',133,'Released','Your legacy is more than a name.','Creed',312221,16.2077,7.408,'JQ9OhBYjTds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36632,_binary '\0','/n6IPjfSwyKqLungH8EHX3ZldodS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30766582',4.1,4524,'en','Screamboat','A late-night boat ride turns into a desperate fight for survival in New York City when a mischievous mouse becomes a monstrous reality.','/wi4IVtL0hTVT5kiiGXbhOo1ugsi.jpg','2025-03-20',102,'Released','A scream is a wish your heart makes.','Screamboat',1225572,4.0033,5,'2i8nGYZlrPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36633,_binary '\0','/jhUDIVZ5egYbWq5ySR4TFUgULuN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30767334',5.7,1366,'fa','بی‌بدن','the film refers to a famous criminal case of the 90s. The case of the murder of Ghazaleh Shakur by Arman Abdul Ali, which went back and forth several times until the execution stage...','/yuF5QSLuRhNbTsr7euuB9LOXULe.jpg','2024-03-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Bodiless',1239257,1.2501,4.5,'Fa0RsZEA5Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36634,_binary '\0','/fewzhxSnXiHYfqx6HmVEK6bMs0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30769141',4.9,3945,'pa','ਜੱਟ ਨੂ ਚੁਦੈਲ ਤਕਰੀ','Jallaludin thinks all women are evil and refers to them as `chudail`. On a trip out with his married friend, he convinces them to divorce their wives but to his surprise he falls in love with Rani. He gets married to her within a week, only to realise that she is actually a ghost (chudail). What will Jallaludin`s next plan of action be? Will he be able to fight against Rani or will he succumb to the fear?','/3LC5hxRbscA5Yi5E6eNJLKrFW84.jpg','2024-03-15',154,'Released',NULL,'Jatt Nuu Chudail Takri',1184246,0.8695,9,'D4LyZPfnznE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36635,_binary '\0','/hI7WJqDDTQZpmu4yQRA1wFxN75D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3077060',5.7,1701,'en','House of Versace','A chronicle of Donatella Versace\'s triumph over tragedy by carrying on her brother\'s powerful legacy after his 1997 murder.','/KcdMm5ViaROesA7FnRuuRhguV.jpg','2013-10-04',85,'Released','Every Empire has a Fall and Rise','House of Versace',226360,2.2787,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36636,_binary '\0','/omcxgWYYbNOxUPahj1IGNrY4Aeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3077108',6.5,5169,'en','Appropriate Behavior','Shirin is struggling to become an ideal Persian daughter, politically correct bisexual and hip young Brooklynite but fails miserably in her attempt at all identities.','/vRuAZqThUY4j03at79q4Foe9FIT.jpg','2015-03-14',90,'Released','Being without a cliché to hold onto can be a lonely experience.','Appropriate Behavior',249916,1.721,6.3,'IjZ80dLFFfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36637,_binary '\0','/mYzmWGhy9PZ6xUo0D4i3bBRdX2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3077214',6.9,46753,'en','Suffragette','Based on true events about the foot soldiers of the early feminist movement, women who were forced underground to pursue a dangerous game of cat and mouse with an increasingly brutal State.','/y706qec117bN2S7XgCs2Yz8jEfv.jpg','2015-10-16',106,'Released','Mothers. Daughters. Rebels.','Suffragette',245168,4.9768,7.2,'Y4jBXQM7mIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36638,_binary '\0','/jqLuBwPcb054zQjH6NN7EOo6CNz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30779704',6.5,2141,'te','హనీమూన్ ఎక్స్‌ప్రెస్','Eeshan and Sonali, a recently married young couple,find themselves at a crossroads in their relationship, facing problems that lead to a painful separation. Unable to rekindle magic even after therapy from counselors, the couple decide to seek help from an old couple radiating unwavering romantic energy, whom they meet on the road, leading to a strange, yet interesting journey.','/uCt5k3coJbOF02hwXVT9gV59a2W.jpg','2024-06-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoon Express',1339339,0.8755,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36639,_binary '\0','/84DgFoFDppvf3i5MKZzOctx9HFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30781967',6.6,2496,'ar','نسور الجمهورية','George Fahmy, Egypt\'s most adored actor, is pressured to star in a film commissioned by the highest authorities. He reluctantly accepts and finds himself thrown into the inner circle of power. Like moth drawn to flame, he begins an affair with the mysterious wife of the general overseeing the project.','/f9MzpMfbBL4PknhKqoQpIUdskTl.jpg','2025-09-19',128,'Released',NULL,'Eagles of the Republic',1220566,6.7178,6.89,'GU93JJ5NUho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36640,_binary '\0','/mWp3poJpVIkorwjvLJWO2n8lCFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3078242',7,12104,'el','Miss Violence','On the day of her birthday, eleven-year-old Angeliki jumps off the balcony and falls to her death with a smile on her face. While the police and Social Services try to discover the reason for this apparent suicide, Angeliki\'s family keep insisting that it was an accident. What is the secret that young Angeliki took with her? Why does her family persist in trying to \"forget\" her and to move on with its life?','/pEGEVgqLwhDV8ZGG5DK7NHDIU3T.jpg','2013-09-09',99,'Released',NULL,'Miss Violence',211052,2.077,6.919,'4txNVRIpcok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36641,_binary '\0','/3Nf45IBLyZVKQvHAQfPrKXVdCMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3078296',6.2,4753,'it','Il ragazzo invisibile','Michele is thirteen year old, shy, unpopular at school, and in love with Stella. After wearing a costume for a Halloween party, he finds out that he\'s invisible.','/rmuU1ExeIZ6tKlr0690cSs7WY59.jpg','2014-12-18',100,'Released','The power to disappear is only the beginning.','The Invisible Boy',303542,2.9252,6.271,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36642,_binary '\0','/5g4yQT6leUr6VJFKsUCzTt2OLCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30783769',7,14174,'hi','Kaam Chalu Hai','Manoj Patil\'s happy life takes a tragic turn when he loses his daughter in an accident caused by a pothole. When the authorities refuse to hear his complaints, he takes matters into his own hands.','/5Fw5log9OJLSCKdbZDpeyLNUSgM.jpg','2024-04-19',82,'Released',NULL,'Kaam Chalu Hai',1274217,1.0664,6,'0x3vWR7-Ki0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36643,_binary '\0','/86GuiqoYEVWmuTCafT1ZGqdGe2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30784256',6.4,5053,'fr','Le Deuxième Acte','Florence wants to introduce David, the man she’s madly in love with, to her father Guillaume. But David isn’t attracted to Florence and wants to throw her into the arms of his friend Willy. The four characters meet in a restaurant in the middle of nowhere.','/lc5ZJA4C55n6nzNtkNnDwOvpEtD.jpg','2024-05-14',80,'Released',NULL,'The Second Act',1161108,4.3145,6.083,'s8lLhVBMBoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36644,_binary '\0','/aGgr2Q07AcyiWPGODoofgZDUEHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30788842',5.3,19139,'en','Love Hurts','A realtor is pulled back into the life he left behind after his former partner-in-crime resurfaces with an ominous message. With his crime-lord brother also on his trail, he must confront his past and the history he never fully buried.','/skPPVeHoTTVVSJlb0Ib5vrqiuA4.jpg','2025-02-06',83,'Released','You can\'t break up with your past.','Love Hurts',1226406,9.726,5.667,'frYVyUDIwiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36645,_binary '\0','/AflLdFIPKGQFVWhDSyedLo6aAR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30789086',4.5,2893,'en','Control Freak','A motivational speaker, plagued by an uncontrollable itch on her head, becomes infected with a parasitic demon from her homeland.','/qcOksMzsmPPA41c3DkCD47sElDU.jpg','2025-03-12',104,'Released','It\'s in your head.','Control Freak',1286663,6.0609,5.58,'ZxJ-raCdP6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36646,_binary '\0','/fBb6T77WXD75kGQ7ZWX1IFecJ61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3079016',4.6,3963,'en','We\'ll Never Have Paris','Quinn, a neurotic man, is diagnosed with a harmless eye condition and soon after his life spirals out of control. He second-guesses his plans to propose to his longtime girlfriend, Devon, after his beautiful coworker, Kelsey, confesses that she has a crush on him. After a conversation with his best friend, Jameson, he clumsily tries to explain his doubts to Devon, but his possible proposal turns into a break-up. When Devon flees to Paris, he follows her in a last-ditch effort to win back \"the one.\"','/zX0JHMQbo41xCRXSKBJCYQ8fpHq.jpg','2014-10-01',89,'Released','Based on a true story... unfortunately.','We\'ll Never Have Paris',253287,2.5899,4.8,'AgGQm63rWaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36647,_binary '\0','/wfFh9YR4aHTo6u13mgeWWkFOu96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30790226',7.3,2645,'te','వీరాజీ','A stand-up comic, gynecologist, hotel manager, police officer and a drug addict, among others reach an abandoned mental asylum by a mysterious host, who informs them that they would all be dead by dawn for their past sins and proceeds killing. Will they live to see another day?','/djqzmdCGaBsyXvbGq0uhG6EeXnN.jpg','2024-08-02',97,'Released',NULL,'Viraaji',1324663,0.7468,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36648,_binary '\0','/vCHi1IdIE83zopbUdgIzangXbcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30790971',5.6,1497,'ro','Klaus & Barroso','A bartender-combiner urgently needs to pay off a debt. He persuades his brother, a fiery bouncer, to arrange a bachelor party together, without the knowledge of the owners of the club where he works.','/6gXelVWYjkkrfnS86g8BJ4imNha.jpg','2024-01-16',87,'Released',NULL,'Klaus & Barroso',1231550,1.6633,6.9,'_a5yaGJiwEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36649,_binary '\0','/eHEGPHKHTVhWdXzBQcrTATz9M0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3079380',7,276566,'en','Spy','A desk-bound CIA analyst volunteers to go undercover to infiltrate the world of a deadly arms dealer, and prevent diabolical global disaster.','/vPBmfMHxQvRRNGYD5S5ko2KnX56.jpg','2015-05-06',120,'Released','She\'s a risk they had to take.','Spy',238713,11.8155,6.832,'AcVPM3kscww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36650,_binary '\0','/rTNMyZ5JcrfKnPamaYOo9wzq3m5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30795948',6.9,7039,'fr','Un p\'tit truc en plus','To escape the police, a father and his son are forced to find refuge in a summer camp for young adults with mental disabilities, taking on the role of an educator and a boarder. The beginning of troubles and a wonderful human experience that will change them forever.','/hhL8QC7O6fFfwgV6pDf1WSOxGcY.jpg','2024-04-18',89,'Released',NULL,'A Little Something Extra',1152014,4.0444,7.1,'_xXtpZvtXyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36651,_binary '\0','/Amb16QpgV4ZxdU8C80SW6JNySp9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30796448',7.9,16899,'en','The Greatest Night in Pop','On a January night in 1985, music\'s biggest stars gathered to record \"We Are the World.\" This documentary goes behind the scenes of the historic event.','/jDz4wFujk94tQP9Sx6EMKDULvkn.jpg','2024-01-19',96,'Released','The untold story behind \"We Are the World.\"','The Greatest Night in Pop',1226841,6.2791,7.9,'MD3oU1gowu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36652,_binary '\0','/zoItRZ13m3ODM3OiMqZzCGyiTHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30798502',6.9,2292,'te','Sriranga Neethulu','Follows three characters from diverse backgrounds in their mid twenties. How consequences arise because of their flaws and what struggles they go through?','/pt9rIRYd8jowOlTmJCa6sUkMTRf.jpg','2024-04-11',122,'Released',NULL,'Sriranga Neethulu',1274480,0.7029,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36653,_binary '\0','/iDJ0ljbQsqld29cQXxQ76qT9dgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30798612',6.6,18105,'hi','Crazxy','A renowned surgeon, Abhimanyu Sood is carrying ₹5 crores for a hush hush settlement that will save him from going to jail, when he gets a chilling phone call—his 16-year-old daughter, Vedica, has been kidnapped. The ransom? The exact amount he is carrying right now. Is this even a real kidnapping—or an elaborate trap?','/nWxEtbryAPP7gI0TtNYejoAUJlr.jpg','2025-02-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Crazxy',1370264,1.5934,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36654,_binary '\0','/aZ8HkgNpcFElM5TKMwBySsX90WF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30804400',7.1,1655,'ne','शम्भाला','In a Himalayan polyandrous village in Nepal, newly married and pregnant Pema tries to make the best of her new life. But soon, her first husband Tashi vanishes on the trade route to Lhasa. Accompanied by her monk de facto husband, Karma, she embarks on a journey into the unforgiving wilderness to find him, evolving into a quest of self discovery and liberation.','/vKjZCLhmgGGv4ydpO5w503yZRR3.jpg','2024-09-13',150,'Released',NULL,'Shambhala',1234593,1.4697,7.8,'N2EXOwDgrIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36655,_binary '\0','/otYaFP7WKuzgaFFtqNrBnXbJYsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30807200',7.5,3018,'hu','Fekete pont','Ten-year-old Palkó has just moved home to Budapest from Berlin and observes the daily life of an ordinary Hungarian elementary school with confused amazement. Juci, the young teacher just started working there. She is the only one who understands Palkó, as in their own way, they are both suffering from the same, sometimes grotesque educational system.','/vm5wzLbSNZ01CpxIFcIlkKFtojG.jpg','2024-09-19',119,'Released',NULL,'Lesson Learned',1309745,1.645,7.4,'DkzaH0sRqMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36656,_binary '\0','/gjUk32ohE9A05Y4NK9bbkCkAgMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30810787',7.2,3986,'no','Drømmer','Johanne falls in love with her teacher and records her fantasies and feelings in writing. Together with her mother and grandmother, they debate the literary potential and whether to publish it.','/ctBhKsd2AGlubApDf7VogbFKRlG.jpg','2024-10-04',111,'Released',NULL,'Dreams',1228682,3.4459,6.9,'ijqwWwGdHZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36657,_binary '\0','/uMD8XurrO3MY8M84S3dxqZLX87A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30810792',7.1,2206,'no','Kjærlighet','Marianne, a doctor, and Tor, a nurse, avoid relationships. After meeting on a ferry where Tor seeks casual encounters, Marianne explores the possibility of spontaneous intimacy, questioning societal norms.','/dm1nMJ64sTeQBYxXV76R0u4sq9Z.jpg','2024-11-10',120,'Released',NULL,'Love',1228685,2.6282,6.8,'tmYu9dtfwDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36658,_binary '\0','/wVka8VehiZXjUAgXo1MG9EKnr4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3081268',4.4,6274,'en','Reaper','Criminals and a beautiful but cunning hitchhiker must battle a supernatural force known as the Reaper.','/qptmMcqLdwLjLa7hXimDrjLOfwe.jpg','2014-10-06',90,'Released','Death to the wicked','Reaper',298026,1.3812,5.5,'VTq9GYw6v-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36659,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30816925',6.8,2086,'te','Ground','Group of friends go to a playground around the corner, to play Cricket, on a typical Sunday. However, that special day has unexpected events in store for them.','/EP3F2XO4uFoNl6dRzHZVIQNOS3.jpg','2024-02-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Ground',1302681,0.5032,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36660,_binary '\0','/7HATFCB88pCbTyFytbUM48aZtpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30818546',6.7,3693,'ml','ഹൃദയപൂര്‍വ്വം','Sandeep, a middle-aged bachelor who recently got a heart transplant, travels to Pune to attend the engagement of his heart-donor’s daughter, Haritha. Her engagement gets broken and Sandeep injures his back on the same day, forcing him to stay back in Pune for a few weeks, in his heart-donor’s house – who was an adventurous Colonel.','/j6M2odS1RqGEUPKirIvB1VZ9i6Y.jpg','2025-08-28',151,'Released',NULL,'Hridayapoorvam',1314784,2.1212,6.737,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36661,_binary '\0','/huXWIOCkaS91oWMyMgMfY2EVNcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30818815',2.3,9415,'hi','Mastiii 4','Three frustrated husbands seek freedom from their dull marriages. A wild idea promises escape and excitement. But what follows is anything but expected.','/99rpDOk540UDaCMlJSonpSvQCPm.jpg','2025-11-21',142,'Released',NULL,'Mastiii 4',1228827,1.6937,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36662,_binary '\0','/6GtcIO9bY77iDJcG5GlnnRekW2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30825000',6.1,3333,'kn','Nimma Vasthugalige Neeve Javaabdaararu','The title means \"You are responsible for your belongings.\" As humans, we develop profound attachments to our belongings, which often intertwine with our deepest insecurities. Unfortunately, many of these insecurities manifest in reality.','/bhVgR4Rq4UCzwreNFMh1GpBuKfy.jpg','2025-01-10',132,'Released',NULL,'Nimma Vasthugalige Neeve Javaabdaararu',1414580,0.6243,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36663,_binary '\0','/ysLlsAxwgNSxBWHCgTKJrmjxpRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30825738',6.8,108217,'en','The Mandalorian and Grogu','The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.','/uwMKWjcNID0D9jjplsjkQS2OrB4.jpg','2026-05-20',132,'Released','If you\'re searching for new adventure, \"this is the way.\"','The Mandalorian and Grogu',1228710,80.0038,7.462,'IHWlvwu8t1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36664,_binary '\0','/wE1TZtB5G1fdiln3PPnnLhExuCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30826955',4.5,2004,'en','Stand Your Ground','Former Special Forces operative, Jack Johnson, uses the Stand Your Ground law to seek vengeance for his wife’s murder, igniting a brutal war against a local crime lord’s family and ending in an explosive showdown.','/u4GW1qTNjooEFSXDBVDMmYb52qC.jpg','2025-05-09',100,'Released','Their town, his war.','Stand Your Ground',1296504,4.2047,4.5,'Y6MGlxlSYGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36665,_binary '\0','/fBZ9cWUI1yB9Fcs2eoYZ4mmMUmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30827810',6.6,8692,'en','I Love Boosters','A group of shoplifters take aim at a cutthroat fashion maven by stealing from her stores and reselling them at a lower price — what they call \'fashion-forward philanthropy\'.','/4pNKIUFy7tkZiBx0rnSmG9ysRy.jpg','2026-05-21',113,'Released','Booster: Somebody who steals clothes from a store and sells them at a discount price, aka community service.','I Love Boosters',1227877,7.1436,6.2,'I1xZegSgN8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36666,_binary '\0','/glHM6zcxVRKXwZzzMpGp7IaxMZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3082826',6.3,2380,'en','Kelly & Cal','Punk-rocker turned suburban mom, Kelly, is nostalgic for a life she can no longer have and uncertain of a future she doesn’t yet fit in. Seventeen-year-old Cal is frustrated at his lack of control over the hand he\'s been dealt. When the two strike up an unlikely friendship, it\'s the perfect spark needed to thrust them both back to life.','/91KrAdhUwgqUcVD4gyhCnSiVEH3.jpg','2014-03-07',107,'Released','Outcasts in life. Allies in suburbia.','Kelly & Cal',253270,1.4665,6.2,'eHQ_WImurh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36667,_binary '\0','/qP3Iv3SfK63rJUeahjqBLtTGRGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3082854',6.4,8758,'da','Kollektivet','A funny and moving story of family and free love set in a freewheeling 1970s commune. When Anna and Erik inherit a huge house, they gather a motley crew of cohabitants to reinvigorate their lives, forcing them to reconcile their new values with old habits.','/evGoMMVXiIOQ1KwSMVnbzHBfX6I.jpg','2016-01-14',111,'Released','You Choose Your Family','The Commune',308409,2.0172,6.3,'tL_swe-UIg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36668,_binary '\0','/mZT5eXy9Tapf85LV62hkfaVp2Of.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3082898',4.9,12999,'en','Kickboxer: Vengeance','Eric and Kurt Sloane are the descendants of a well-known Venice, California-based family of martial artists. Kurt has always been in older brother, Eric\'s shadow, as he lacks the instincts needed to become a champion. Against Kurt\'s concerns, Eric accepts a paid offer and travels to Thailand to challenge the Muay Thai champion Tong Po and fails with dire consequences. Kurt sets out for revenge. He trains with his brother\'s mentor, Master Durand, for a Muay Thai fight against the merciless champion, Tong Po. Durand first thinks Kurt is impossible to train, but through a series of spiritual exercises and tests, Durand discovers that Kurt has a deeper strength that will carry him through his final showdown with Tong Po.','/9suFyXDE1MhZ8I8tuhmTd0fJ7G8.jpg','2016-07-14',90,'Released','The legend returns.','Kickboxer: Vengeance',308529,4.9657,5.076,'kYxarObwhnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36669,_binary '\0','/ch8rKF1a5WXFDcxi2AKfmnaMBk7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30829309',6.9,1729,'zh','飞驰人生2','Former champion driver Zhang Chi teaches at a driving school in troubled times, relying on his reputation to make ends meet. A failing automobile factory offers to sponsor Zhang Chi in the last Bayinbrook Rally.','/tYCsMelHCecCvhWsrvR9NsZcT1D.jpg','2024-02-10',121,'Released',NULL,'Pegasus 2',1228891,4.169,7.204,'Z8zkSjSrf78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36670,_binary '\0','/jIyfHkH8QrwddgryGKD4zzlyus3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3083008',6.5,20641,'en','The Program','An Irish sports journalist becomes convinced that Lance Armstrong\'s performances during the Tour de France victories are fueled by banned substances. With this conviction, he starts hunting 