Released','**Vegan Alert:** Viewers discretion advised','Shakhahaari',1230559,1.3266,8.5,'HnzVItXIMro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36697,_binary '\0','/oLdMVXIgl1F2UO8QytexwOMstnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089326',7.2,7985,'es','Magical Girl','The father of a terminally ill girl is determined to grant his daughter\'s last wish, a ridiculously expensive collectors\' costume from a Japanese TV series. The request will drive him into a journey within his city\'s dark underbelly.','/k4wEvvSIqfYVdOQ3oQSkUFPzJ9K.jpg','2014-09-07',127,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Magical Girl',282983,2.5072,7.3,'7S_QWUsqXEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36698,_binary '\0','/pY6gDWUjRmh785MRVHLgnqM9fV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089388',7.8,8884,'en','Tim\'s Vermeer','Tim Jenison, a Texas based inventor, attempts to solve one of the greatest mysteries in all art: How did Dutch Master Johannes Vermeer manage to paint so photo-realistically 150 years before the invention of photography? Spanning a decade, Jenison\'s adventure takes him to Holland, on a pilgrimage to the North coast of Yorkshire to meet artista David Hockney, and eventually even to Buckingham Palace. The epic research project Jenison embarques on is as extraordinary as what he discovers.','/vEF0f8dktdp4NbUbpi0xSzwUAY8.jpg','2013-12-06',80,'Released',NULL,'Tim\'s Vermeer',212063,1.7612,7.26,'CS_HUWs9c8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36699,_binary '\0','/1Ss82WvXXANNwrfaumHGvbTiE2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30895834',8.3,2048,'en','Giannis: The Marvelous Journey','A documentary that chronicles the extraordinary odyssey of NBA mega-star Giannis Antetokounmpo from an impoverished childhood in Greece as the son of Nigerian immigrants to the very top of the basketball world.','/heOqng8QyxEFOuHdF6p4HGw70Zn.jpg','2024-02-19',109,'Released',NULL,'Giannis: The Marvelous Journey',1231942,2.0925,7.2,'z7GbDaCYChw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36700,_binary '\0','/uL2s9Snfjb9AvImGGQLDnMpfzge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089630',4.3,31957,'en','Artemis Fowl','Artemis Fowl is a 12-year-old genius and descendant of a long line of criminal masterminds. He soon finds himself in an epic battle against a race of powerful underground fairies who may be behind his father\'s disappearance.','/tI8ocADh22GtQFV28vGHaBZVb0U.jpg','2020-05-29',94,'Released','Remember the name.','Artemis Fowl',475430,8.2207,5.517,'rA0NnDagh28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36701,_binary '\0','/9iemEC0cGDNyRepa3leXJNkUwkX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089778',7.1,11025,'nl','De Behandeling','Inspector Nick Cafmeyer seems to have it all - looks, brains and a successful career. But a dark cloud hangs over his life: since the age of nine, he has been haunted by the unsolved disappearance of his younger brother, Bjorn. Plettinckx, a known sex offender, was questioned but quickly released. Plettinckx lives close by and takes fiendish pleasure in harassing Nick. Then, when a disturbing case comes to light involving a missing nine-year-old, Nick heads a massive search which turns into a relentless manhunt.','/nzVhjAjEaugzs0CSmEO50W5mTcc.jpg','2014-01-29',131,'Released',NULL,'The Treatment',251577,1.8808,6.922,'soY98iY6V7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36702,_binary '\0','/2j6oPdrEaV4IgFeQXfwdSIPfIiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089922',6.4,1401,'nl','Image','Eva Hendrickx is an ambitious young journalist working on the team of television legend Herman Verbeeck. She\'s determined to bring a story about the riots in the suburbs of Brussels. While the city spins further away in a spiral of violence, Eva meets Lahbib, a Moroccan with a heavy past. He escorts her into his complex and hard world. Meanwhile, Herman Verbeeck sees a way to exploit Eva\'s story in the ever-competitive mediagame...','/tEq2Eh82CfneoKAELyf7B1xliWJ.jpg','2014-11-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Image',290930,1.4744,6,'6JvQiMZ_si8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36703,_binary '\0','/Au8DwMTKM0lTZR6po1lOVuKimBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3089978',7,1391,'da','Sorg og glæde','Filmmaker Johannes and his wife, schoolteacher Signe, experience the biggest sorrow and misfortune one can ever imagine. Nevertheless, in all the hopelessness they must try to reach for mutual and mature love in order to continue life after death.','/1SXWEctfQZFlHZ9oBMjelj9J1em.jpg','2013-09-25',107,'Released',NULL,'Sorrow and Joy',191293,1.6142,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36704,_binary '\0','/cu8MhEooVMLKkyCEUJwCMksM4e6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3090252',7.2,4117,'en','Dinosaur 13','Two years after the discovery of \"Sue,\" the largest and most complete Tyrannosaurus Rex skeleton found to date, government officials seize the remains and claim that \"Sue\" was stolen from federal land.','/g61IWIorF82G0hIlLduWVJTUB6t.jpg','2014-04-26',95,'Released','The true tale of one of the greatest discoveries in history.','Dinosaur 13',249170,0.7659,6.9,'YJKUR26ELa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36705,_binary '\0','/hSeke0l21nBSxOCKldpjnYHqJda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3090634',6.4,5634,'fr','Eden','Paul, a teenager in the underground scene of early-nineties Paris, forms a DJ collective with his friends and together they plunge into the nightlife of sex, drugs, and endless music.','/9Cy49FxqqcW4ybj1EWtTaahRIRv.jpg','2014-11-19',131,'Released','When you start a revolution, the hardest beat to find is your own.','Eden',283330,2.868,5.8,'_4yhW36jY8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36706,_binary '\0','/9eVx87O18kLs7LpsOrruOU45jXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3090670',6,6213,'en','Advantageous','In a near-future city where soaring opulence overshadows economic hardship, Gwen and her daughter, Jules, do all they can to hold on to their joy, despite the instability surfacing in their world.','/xVJdSbDxKTanwZtD6qUyc7cGNpG.jpg','2015-06-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Advantageous',308457,1.8961,6,'DGhJBWGhlkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36707,_binary '\0','/9MuwxjnVPGweFwo4cZPbXM2iRX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30908405',6.4,3919,'en','The Last Rodeo','A retired rodeo legend risks it all to save his grandson. Facing his own painful past and the fears of his family, he enters a high-stakes bullriding competition as the oldest contestant ever. Along the way, he reconciles old wounds with his estranged daughter and proves that true courage is found in the fight for family.','/62nu9AEIeyDNCQ2xJabq7gwb2zR.jpg','2025-05-22',118,'Released',NULL,'The Last Rodeo',1380682,3.5717,7.5,'ADuANCCW1iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36708,_binary '\0','/j5qvBqyxpM5yXhBbmC1tXtlbL51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3091126',5.5,1244,'en','My Santa','A young, single mother, Jen, begins to lose her faith in the magic of Christmas. However, when she takes her son Eric to see the local mall Santa, Jen immediately feels an attraction and connection with Chris, the young, attractive man filling the suit. As they begin spending time together, she begins to rediscover her belief in Christmas.','/33bPoqn5OfkYHR3rZAdY904XBK6.jpg','2013-11-29',84,'Released',NULL,'My Santa',240911,2.207,5.2,'h3C0n7T4imw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36709,_binary '\0','/7SrLzxOBJyI62JCD94HDIHKvQ1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3092076',4.8,1955,'fr','Les Trois Frères : Le Retour','Three brothers are reunited on the occasion of the death of his mother. The three are in a difficult stage of their lives due to economic difficulties: Bernard is a failed actor, Didier pretends to be a professor of philosophy when, in fact, is selling sex toys and Pascal lives off a rich sexagenarian. Accompanied by Sara, the teenage daughter of Bernard, they live surprising encounters while new problems appear.','/v5bjUXo1FHLZQO6nfwWcoc9D6lW.jpg','2014-02-12',106,'Released',NULL,'The Three Brothers: The Return',246320,1.6427,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36710,_binary '\0','/ui1nbPcT6AlkoCQ9WLROB2br0yb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3092552',7.6,3483,'pl','Chce się żyć','Mateusz is an intelligent, romantic young man tragically trapped inside his own body, suffering from severe cerebral palsy that makes speech and controlled movement nearly impossible. Born into a loving family, Mateusz’s protected world is shattered when circumstances place him in an institution where he is misunderstood and mistreated. Featuring an astonishing, virtuoso lead performance, Life Feels Good beautifully recounts the true story of one man’s extraordinary efforts to endure in the face of impossible odds.','/fbLgertKok0jUk83zrqZTN2OMtT.jpg','2013-10-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Life Feels Good',226437,2.2711,7.285,'W0f6ytq65MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36711,_binary '\0','/kx8KQwmUYb5IVrN182PHU1trTXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3092790',6.1,1944,'en','Two Down','After surviving an explosion in Iraq, Mr. Thomas leaves the infuriating desk job the army had created for him and enters the underground world of the contract killer. His brother, Sam, had been caught selling on army secrets to the highest bidder and is now working for the illusive Harry Montagu. They use Mr. Thomas as a very effective way of eliminating problems they encounter in their business. That is until Mr. Thomas begins to question whom these problems are that he is removing, and why they deserve this fate.','/2gSGwjTnHsK5I4fnYBQk8AIYfi1.jpg','2025-03-22',92,'Released','Sometimes a stranger is the only person you can trust','Two Down',489050,0.8355,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36712,_binary '\0','/1BYXvAEapZIb3QXPLKm7Wm67TFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3093286',4.9,2297,'en','The American Side','Following a mysterious suicide at Niagara Falls, a low-rent detective unravels a conspiracy to build a revolutionary invention by enigmatic scientist, Nikola Tesla.','/rdqAwpAFE4ssEq4eFEwshIP6TeE.jpg','2016-04-14',103,'Released','There are three sides to every story. The truth, the lie... and the American Side.','The American Side',343010,1.3735,4.7,'C3-mtipB14s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36713,_binary '\0','/y9nmEriiwz1AXJsXn0QWbMwnrdu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3093522',3.7,4465,'en','Cymbeline','War erupts between dirty cops and outlaw bikers as a drug kingpin tries to protect his empire.','/uNajzrrYttWofGj3zu672J3NUbA.jpg','2014-09-03',97,'Released','Kings Queens Soldiers Bikers War','Cymbeline',240745,3.3076,3.9,'tf_tm6AYA3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36714,_binary '\0','/yuDDViMJppRKiDXTGXpHdofhkgx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3093546',6.3,7335,'en','Listen Up Philip','Anger rages in Philip as he awaits the publication of his second novel. He feels pushed out of his adopted home city by the constant crowds and noise, a deteriorating relationship with his photographer girlfriend Ashley, and his own indifference to promoting the novel. When Philip\'s idol Ike Zimmerman offers his isolated summer home as a refuge, he finally gets the peace and quiet to focus on his favorite subject: himself.','/rHfrGEdTEW20W6L26qbJ0DFNDKo.jpg','2014-10-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Listen Up Philip',251736,2.0108,5.8,'XQrf8hT6Z-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36715,_binary '\0','/iZ0JKB82ZZOhynFOeJKWjhekDpE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3094236',5,1769,'en','Helicopter Mom','Maggie Cooper thinks it would be really cool if her son Lloyd were gay. So cool, in fact, that she outs him to the entire school.','/7ODRMt3nn5wvhIoaxeAC0kOvXIe.jpg','2015-04-24',81,'Released','Ruining his life... One nag at a time.','Helicopter Mom',273610,2.6482,5,'kxEJWWME9BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36716,_binary '\0','/hkAurWfk0Y3J9Z8YkLxefvOEK85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3094252',5.4,1868,'en','Echoes of War','A Civil War veteran returns home to the quiet countryside, only to find himself embroiled in a conflict between his family and the brutish cattle rancher harassing them.','/s594RW4LJ6SEzpcO2qyiTEmCJ3W.jpg','2015-05-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Echoes of War',333594,1.539,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36717,_binary '\0','/ay6UW9Tg5MP7fgukGyEXg2NLYkb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3094816',4.3,2475,'es','Diet of Sex','Married couple and the wife cannot enjoy sex. In order to help the husband sees a sex therapist who makes suggestions. Very sexy movie with see all lovemaking and nothing left to the imagination.','/ohlVnmy1Eeica9yzfwuZZppmk1B.jpg','2014-02-14',72,'Released','Comedy, food, drama and love','Diet of Sex',324230,0,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36718,_binary '\0','/bBleQSVXH97a0G2oF9MDAYCOlLG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30953759',8.2,56346,'ar','لا أرض أخرى','This film made by a Palestinian-Israeli collective shows the destruction of the occupied West Bank\'s Masafer Yatta by Israeli soldiers and the alliance which develops between the Palestinian activist Basel and Israeli journalist Yuval.','/bVlXZnI24U4QPlGvggUbeShMhz8.jpg','2024-11-01',92,'Released',NULL,'No Other Land',1232493,4.7538,8,'-pI2IXKtlew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36719,_binary '\0','/ptHXfOc0gEIG8CrieQ3t8MUBuiP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30954952',5.4,2052,'en','Safe House','Trapped in a high-security safe house after a terrorist attack in downtown Los Angeles, six government agents realize they must survive not just the enemy outside, but the potential traitor among them.','/jlQW7qPp9j6yGqiIEcB3uNYbjys.jpg','2025-10-30',90,'Released','Betrayal is the ultimate weapon.','Safe House',1522923,7.2233,6.479,'eMfRemG2tUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36720,_binary '\0','/3xKJ0nyUTlySmMBCpOcsuSnFPI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30955489',5.7,71935,'en','Until Dawn','One year after her sister Melanie mysteriously disappeared, Clover and her friends head into the remote valley where she vanished in search of answers. Exploring an abandoned visitor center, they find themselves stalked by a masked killer and horrifically murdered one by one...only to wake up and find themselves back at the beginning of the same evening.','/bLY5yN4MKVynZ2HMZWElTOGBgBe.jpg','2025-04-23',103,'Released','Every night a different nightmare.','Until Dawn',1232546,16.044,6.3,'2b3vBaINZ7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36721,_binary '\0','/xkjWiRQtrenqGRWO2Enry2JIl4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30956852',3.6,3251,'en','Popeye the Slayer Man','A curious group of friends sneak into an abandoned spinach canning factory to film a documentary on the legend of the \"Sailor Man,\" who is said to haunt the factory and local docks.','/nVwu3mN7hr1yF467pGct3yQFM41.jpg','2025-03-21',88,'Released','He is what he is.','Popeye the Slayer Man',1388366,3.9955,5.3,'cGRfu8WD8RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36722,_binary '\0','/w0I6KQ3r9DdNZ0tIsD1CA67Hr6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3095734',5.7,20764,'en','Monster Trucks','Tripp is a high school senior with a knack for building trucks who makes an incredible discovery - a gas-guzzling creature named Creech. To protect his mischievous new friend, Tripp hides Creech under the hood of his latest creation, turning it into a real-life super-powered Monster Truck. Together, this unlikely duo with a shared taste for speed team up on a wild and unforgettable journey to reunite Creech with his family.','/aUzNybWqURfeg9BveLr4GOVCkti.jpg','2016-12-21',104,'Released','Two different worlds. One monster team.','Monster Trucks',262841,7.8741,6.1,'Fd0GdvApn-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36723,_binary '\0','/4NrQiY1xHPYoRcJh3KEsYid1aLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30958950',6.1,1636,'cn','臨時劫案','A fierce robber has plotted a major heist. But unfortunately, his plan was unintentionally foiled by two dispirited middle-aged best friends, and the stolen cash disappears.','/3yZx8wV4YtrgJI6O0vPtDKIDXWh.jpg','2024-01-19',98,'Released',NULL,'Rob N Roll',991197,1.8681,5.9,'rUUEfrXMFbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36724,_binary '\0','/wQotaner8FU5SBnYvyFJADPGlzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30959158',4.6,1490,'pl','Zabij mnie, kochanie','A winning lottery ticket has grave consequences for a married couple when they start hatching plans to kill each other for the prize money.','/wbfDIr5dKx4fri5by7NSIht0Y7M.jpg','2024-02-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Kill Me If You Dare',1232943,2.1041,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36725,_binary '\0','/sXVGgWSHpKyb8QSkOyorqTy99M7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3096712',6.9,2261,'ja','白ゆき姫殺人事件','A beautiful cosmetics company employee is found dead in a gruesome state. What\'s more, it becomes apparent that one of the victim\'s colleagues, a homely woman named Miki, has gone missing. Television director Akaboshi attempts to interview as many of Miki\'s friends and acquaintances as he can find, eliciting miscellaneous information from them.','/8xlgARZowpGglrIcUvEXQCnn2vS.jpg','2014-03-29',126,'Released',NULL,'The Snow White Murder Case',253454,1.9365,6.4,'JhJctheblzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36726,_binary '\0','/3qChINgl623ir2L7NLZijpmypXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3096858',5.6,5674,'en','They\'re Watching','An American TV crew gets trapped in a centuries-old web of revenge, horror, and blood, when their home improvement show is attacked by angry Eastern European villagers out to kill the show\'s star.','/yPLi2PlEEbetgUkaFPESBAMG9Qw.jpg','2016-03-25',95,'Released','Which House? Witch House.','They\'re Watching',383535,1.5704,5.6,'pGsrpiyu2Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36727,_binary '\0','/qYXnMDuwaApMRtV8JunFmieZo8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30970235',7.8,28988,'hi','आर्टिकल 370','Ahead of a major constitutional decision which rendered the Article 370 of the Indian state ineffective, special agent Zooni Haksar is tasked with a secret mission to quell violence in the conflict-ridden region.','/9VTemjHMpyxzfC3JsG2aFy8Bf9Y.jpg','2024-02-23',158,'Released','An incredible operation that changed India forever','Article 370',1233531,1.7542,7.1,'Nwce9WwkcMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36728,_binary '\0','/gj3fKMX0wIutRczipEk4nMWxsZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3097084',6.6,4630,'en','Camp Takota','With her personal and professional life in shambles, Elise ends up having to take a job as a counselor at her old summer camp. There, she reunites with two estranged friends who attended camp and never left. When the future of the camp is put in jeopardy, the three friends must band together to save it, changing the course of their lives forever.','/dDYjufoRoksf486uQM0oIjuSMA1.jpg','2014-02-14',102,'Released','You\'re never too old to go back','Camp Takota',251227,1.6671,5.671,'i4g9N6fIsJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36729,_binary '\0','/o9EyEeZRzB8npp65rynWDI3ef7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3097204',6.4,49642,'en','The Inbetweeners 2','Neil, Will and Simon receive an invite from Jay to join him in Australia whilst on his gap year, who promises them it’s \'the sex capital of the world\'. With their lives now rather dull compared to their hedonistic school days and legendary lads holiday, it’s an offer they can’t refuse.','/xP328XWLccsitiTTClWGTNlwz48.jpg','2014-08-06',96,'Released','Four reasons to get out of Australia.','The Inbetweeners 2',242022,3.3132,6.1,'G-O6OU03CSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36730,_binary '\0','/6za18wAVGMr5VsEnDXeLfL4ujjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30972054',5.9,6664,'de','Das Kanu des Manitu','Abahachi, the Apache chief, and his white blood brother Ranger fight tirelessly for peace and justice - but a new, up-and-coming gang is making life particularly difficult for them! They lure Abahachi and Ranger into a trap in order to get their hands on the legendary “Canoe of Manitou”.','/8d5Qnz2LGbu0kr7RCwdX8E55mYT.jpg','2025-08-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Manitou\'s Canoe',1233066,3.0095,6.591,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36731,_binary '\0','/acfd8XGsi64apGvuIQEN7YgkUxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30973261',7,1649,'es','Soy Nevenka','In the year 2000, Nevenka Fernández, 24 years old, Councilor for Finance in the Ponferrada City Council, suffered relentless persecution, both sentimental and professional, by the mayor, a man accustomed to doing his will politically and personally. She never decides to report, although she knows that she will have to pay a very high price: her environment does not support her, the society of Ponferrada turns its back on her and the media subjects her to a public trial. A story inspired by real events that turns its protagonist into a pioneer by taking an influential and popular politician to court for sexual and workplace harassment for the first time.','/aE2lnlUhXaD3enmbxAmgGjb3MPS.jpg','2024-09-27',117,'Released','This is a true story.','I Am Nevenka',1235922,2.4593,6.9,'btZynwc6SUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36732,_binary '\0','/HGmX2QmO1a67a1awAfHFEnDCiF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30973842',4.2,2052,'fr','Le Jardinier','Every year the Prime Minister has a list of all kinds of troublemakers eliminated in the name of the famous Reason of State. Serge Shuster, Special Adviser to the President of the Republic, finds himself on this list, better known as the Matignon List. Condemned to certain death and at the heart of an implacable plot and a state secret that also put his family in danger, Serge, his wife and children have only one hope left - their gardener, Léo, who hates it when « slugs » invade his garden... Especially those that want to kill innocent families.','/5T9WR7vIOnHm6xhVt5zBuPbBgt1.jpg','2025-01-30',109,'Released',NULL,'The Gardener',1255788,5.2223,6.014,'a4NMxIBEdYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36733,_binary '\0','/d3rvdCFRHydPhb9bxnMBUFMEA9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3097396',6.2,5569,'en','What Josiah Saw','A family with buried secrets reunite at a farmhouse after two decades to pay for their past sins.','/sfKY55tfwyg0D0m9aWibmRoKLq4.jpg','2021-08-13',120,'Released','You do what need be done then.','What Josiah Saw',696605,2.5059,5.9,'5_pt4fLyMTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36734,_binary '\0','/dEiaE6YREbDShETjbesBHBTbTUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3098306',5.3,2519,'fr','Sous les jupes des filles','A story about 11 girls living in Paris. Each of them has its own problems: career, love life, children. Every girl has their complexes and virtues. They always look elegant, hiding their inner feelings. Will they reach all the goals and overcome all their difficulties?','/4WNwP0APsrliRFHg5rTDuinCbuu.jpg','2014-06-04',116,'Released','A film by women for women ... and men who appreciate','French Women',273169,2.6812,5.731,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36735,_binary '\0','/nIppFbmQC65A5anMGeeIn7Dc1zw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30983618',6.8,2120,'te','Mudo Kannu','Begins with an interview between retired S.P Chandrakanth and Journalist Aadinarayana. The Journalist prompts Chandrakanth to recount some of his service memories and chandrakanth delves into the story of goutham.','/n2hNxvMiDLZR87V5E6ZuvxfZhce.jpg','2024-01-26',99,'Released',NULL,'Mudo Kannu',1460786,1.0961,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36736,_binary '\0','/ijchao39geCZIPmxZJS8MWVd0sh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30985064',4.5,1499,'ta','மெட்ராஸ்காரன்','A minor argument between two strangers escalates into a life-altering conflict, exploring how a seemingly insignificant event can drastically alter a person\'s perception and circumstances.','/zw4imaAGB8cWa4mrwABxHiVS0KR.jpg','2025-01-10',121,'Released',NULL,'Madraskaaran',1233332,0.9567,0,'l7n7o6UXxi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36737,_binary '\0','/e2qltOMg9UbHxWXaG3MbBboenzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3098754',6.5,2259,'el','Κοινός Παρονομαστής','Four men meet in a coffee bar, where they discuss their views on life, love, and the opposite sex. As their conversation progresses, they realise they have far more in common with each other than they anticipated.','/yldpZEihAfm7XSHrkm7naILycCj.jpg','2014-12-11',80,'Released',NULL,'Common Denominator',297419,1.036,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36738,_binary '\0','/gxO51FVgADhYGGnnRPIlutVqb30.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30988739',6.7,98038,'en','Black Bag','When intelligence agent Kathryn Woodhouse is suspected of betraying the nation, her husband – also a legendary agent – faces the ultimate test of whether to be loyal to his marriage, or his country.','/hHPovtU4b96LHcoeEwRkGHI5btw.jpg','2025-03-12',94,'Released','It takes a spy to hunt a spy.','Black Bag',1233575,23.6187,6.375,'Du0Xp8WX_7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36739,_binary '\0','/vt5UhqjyWYbmJdZhrQsWpRCqCra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3098874',5.4,4383,'en','How to Build a Better Boy','After inadvertently inputting the qualities of the ideal boyfriend into a high-tech government computer, two social outcasts named Mae and Gabby must contend with Albert, a cybernetic sweetheart with only one directive: to treat Mae to the perfect highschool romance.','/ivo09vYN76w3epqAv9jS9BEXi5N.jpg','2014-11-18',90,'Released','Never underestimate two girls with a plan.','How to Build a Better Boy',286987,3.8742,6.3,'CuI8CgFRgiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36740,_binary '\0','/cQJG1D2oO4SH7k8LFNMijMBcVK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt30989795',6.8,2043,'te','I Hate You','Childhood friends separate when one studies abroad. The one who stayed becomes an artist. When her friend returns with a new boyfriend, the three grow close, but their relationship becomes complicated.','/zt9YPBeBpOHkpZSsJRNO9FOxU3o.jpg','2024-02-02',117,'Released',NULL,'I Hate You',1568593,0.7395,0,'30noGcW41Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36741,_binary '\0','/bQSfsZDaBWZCHI8Z2nrN1hkR6EG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3099498',5.4,75027,'en','Tusk','When his best friend and podcast co-host goes missing in the backwoods of Canada, a young guy joins forces with his friend\'s girlfriend to search for him.','/pA2SgITmH0lzet9Nn5cxeinRKMv.jpg','2014-09-19',102,'Released','A truly transformative tale','Tusk',246403,8.6581,5.55,'BCQJnOn0ru0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36742,_binary '\0','/1eM6CsDTwRmxgnigzz8pitLlUKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3100274',6.2,14772,'en','Manhattan Night','Porter Wren is a Manhattan tabloid writer with an appetite for scandal. On the beat he sells murder, tragedy, and anything that passes for the truth. At home, he is a dedicated husband and father. But when Caroline, a seductive stranger asks him to dig into the unsolved murder of her filmmaker husband Simon, he is drawn into a very nasty case of sexual obsession and blackmail--one that threatens his job, his marriage, and his life.','/d40J0y6Ha1eakPrmfyEHoKFQrSB.jpg','2016-05-20',113,'Released','No reporter can resist a siren.','Manhattan Night',311667,6.0048,5.9,'5Vah3WwkfWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36743,_binary '\0','/er1tTzpgkPrHq5G15ZyW2mJDAqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3100636',6.4,1635,'en','52 Tuesdays','Sixteen-year-old Billie’s reluctant path to independence is accelerated when her mother reveals plans for gender transition, and their time together becomes limited to Tuesdays. This emotionally charged story of desire, responsibility, and transformation was filmed over the course of a year—once a week, every week, only on Tuesdays.','/Ak1Zqkd0eSzpCKuGWVvTVjOjKAG.jpg','2014-05-01',114,'Released','One day a week, every week for a year','52 Tuesdays',244801,0.9015,5.2,'Y5WcMzEYRGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36744,_binary '\0','/psI57FEB10aMshBVaNO0f5OUkRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3100678',4.3,2100,'en','House of Manson','An unflinching chronicle of Charles Manson, the ex-con who was able to amass a dedicated following of young people in the late 1960s. The era of peace and love was ultimately brought to its knees following his orchestration of the notorious Sharon Tate and LaBianca murders, which sent a shockwave throughout the U.S.A and the world. To this very day, Manson remains a fascinating figure in today\'s world and remains incarcerated... Prepare to enter the mental and depraved world of Charles Manson.','/n5CHGaycGzwVzw4ITHi4bjPguy1.jpg','2014-10-18',98,'Released','It was the summer of \'69....','House of Manson',372174,1.3036,4.5,'Z3pbuWut0fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36745,_binary '\0','/k1Bj2kQ6swUsCCbc7mKfaTQYtfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3101132',4.6,2760,'en','Ghoul','A small group of Americans travel to Ukraine to film a documentary about the cannibalism epidemic that swept through the country during the famine of 1932. After being lured deep into the Ukrainian forest for an interview with one of the last known survivors, they quickly find themselves trapped in a supernatural hunting ground.','/w81FaOmWowyvP01Or3XHy8RzFxO.jpg','2015-02-26',86,'Released','Hunger takes many forms…','Ghoul',329205,1.4287,4.6,'i8kT4_PEvgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36746,_binary '\0','/5xo5Ygihyjm7yofV4cBHwXA6bmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31013030',7.3,2298,'ar','رحلة 404','A few days before she travels to Mecca to perform Hajj, Ghada faces an emergency which forces her to reach out to people from her tainted past with whom she had cut off contact in order to collect a large sum of money. So, as she collects the money, will she manage to go to Mecca, or get tangled up in the past\'s webs?','/nRVky0Rhf8cgzwKOcxpHTBhULrB.jpg','2024-01-24',103,'Released',NULL,'Flight 404',1232790,0.9723,7.4,'uikXt5S0iSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36747,_binary '\0','/gtIr9Cy7yIdgzVJdBSnaf2AgzlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31015216',6.7,3470,'fr','Dahomey','Thousands of royal artifacts of Dahomey, a West African kingdom, were taken by French colonists in the 19th century for collection and display in Paris. Centuries later, a fraction returned to their home in modern-day Benin. This dramatized documentary follows the journey of 26 of the treasures as told by cultural art historians, embattled university students, and one of the repatriated statues himself.','/9d8KvJ3OjUq9rwuM743QPQO48aL.jpg','2024-09-11',68,'Released',NULL,'Dahomey',1101256,1.8621,6.5,'5YNac-cOugg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36748,_binary '\0','/3p1bD9QYA41lb5MBijhYee70Fxz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31015278',7.4,10746,'fa','کیک محبوب من','Mahin lives alone in Tehran since her husband’s death and her daughter’s departure for Europe, until an afternoon tea with friends leads her to break her solitary routine and revitalize her love life.','/gs6XHzRPZWBMUbFkZUwMDgNz0li.jpg','2024-07-11',97,'Released',NULL,'My Favourite Cake',1234591,2.9815,7.3,'xtXuKWlOPzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36749,_binary '\0','/u3JuBKQTuyfvWy7Rm01Ugej6Qs5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31015344',6.3,1465,'ko','여행자의 필요','Iris, a woman abroad in Seoul, teaches French and English in an idiosyncratic fashion that allows her to pursue her own philosophical and personal interests. Through four encounters over a single day, Iris probes students and strangers for information about poetry, their own histories, and their relationship to their egos.','/eDimH4UKv1qsXdnFePXuDZb3cA4.jpg','2024-04-24',90,'Released','When paths cross, souls discover each other.','A Traveler\'s Needs',1146410,2.2988,6.5,'NT3b_8KeRjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36750,_binary '\0','/apCxL7HURoO80r3DFgbIrTtWl2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31015496',6.2,20961,'hi','जुगनूमा','In the late 1980s in the Himalayas, a man\'s life is turned upside down by a series of mysterious fires destroying his fruit orchards. As he struggles to stop the outbreaks, the escalating mystery forces him to confront not only the truth behind the blazes but also the long-hidden secrets of his family and his own past.','/xpFx3aG0CpK3CMo62BuUlqu5ySD.jpg','2025-09-12',119,'Released',NULL,'The Fable',1234603,1.1829,5,'r4TuwOFF2Hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36751,_binary '\0','/aJkOBOdbzUc788VDGJp3nEAlC3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31022050',5.7,27152,'en','Our Little Secret','After discovering their significant others are siblings, two resentful exes must spend Christmas under one roof — while hiding their romantic history.','/gkydRYX3VTqMIjJGDT7kXJ6SrfZ.jpg','2024-11-27',101,'Released','Have yourself a very awkward ex-mas.','Our Little Secret',1234811,3.1875,6.2,'fcc9G9PXTEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36752,_binary '\0','/hUH2J6XNG8nFXAAidHqKEIGbREp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3102206',3.3,1998,'en','Zodiac','Global disasters begin to occur after archaeologists unearth a 2,000-year-old astrology artifact. A rogue scientist is the key to deciphering the artifact to avert the end of the world.','/sczgdIDuzYZqZOoQ29BRM3O5nU8.jpg','2014-08-16',89,'Released','The Signs are Everywhere','Zodiac',285135,2.4289,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36753,_binary '\0','/ngb7JtZOCH3OmBK6CSybj0pFaZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3102208',6,1947,'ro','#Selfie','Yasmine , Roxi and Ana run away to the seaside two days before their finals to have the time of their lives.','/xBs0t7n4qtEZcjRSjcqjJnz73se.jpg','2014-05-09',123,'Released',NULL,'Selfie',317467,0.9619,