 herself. Based on the best-selling novel by Ann Leary.','/a0tSiNq9Ze4ucWFU6oRPd4OEGJr.jpg','2021-09-15',103,'Released',NULL,'The Good House',633657,3.0484,6.1,'jK_KcgHwA0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36769,_binary '\0','/qSpva0nlXsXJtmUL9gh372z60fp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31049718',5.9,3753,'en','They Called Him Mostly Harmless','When an unidentified hiker is found deceased in the Florida wilderness, authorities release a sketch. Multiple hikers call in claiming to have met the man. There\'s only one problem – he never told them his name. It would take two years, thousands of devoted internet sleuths, and a miracle of science to identify him, and that\'s when the trouble really starts.','/i3Ngi39RT9kxTPyGN5CwK2XEZrk.jpg','2024-02-08',89,'Released','After he was found, the search began.','They Called Him Mostly Harmless',1105868,1.3258,6.222,'fTwZtZZSDPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36770,_binary '\0','/zeHB7aP46Xs3u4aFLuAq2GFeUGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3104988',6.9,211525,'en','Crazy Rich Asians','An American-born Chinese economics professor accompanies her boyfriend to Singapore for his best friend\'s wedding, only to get thrust into the lives of Asia\'s rich and famous.','/1XxL4LJ5WHdrcYcihEZUCgNCpAW.jpg','2018-08-15',121,'Released','The only thing crazier than love is family.','Crazy Rich Asians',455207,11.7325,7.04,'ZQ-YX-5bAs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36771,_binary '\0','/5ZSwZPKgcTJJwhxjbOHeoBTVaKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31050020',7.1,2780,'en','Once Upon a Deadpool','A kidnapped Fred Savage is forced to endure Deadpool\'s PG-13 rendition of Deadpool 2, as a Princess Bride-esque story full of magic, wonder, and zero Fs.','/w6Jk8BHohhoKBUcxGeSyDQGWGWc.jpg','2018-12-11',118,'Released','Yule believe in miracles.','Once Upon a Deadpool',567604,7.6315,7.1,'PCf03KXyzIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36772,_binary '\0','/gIClklFGYBe0uiOoiP2vtocJbss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31050594',6.2,81987,'en','Mercy','In the near future, a detective stands on trial accused of murdering his wife. He has ninety minutes to prove his innocence to the advanced AI Judge he once championed, before it determines his fate.','/pyok1kZJCfyuFapYXzHcy7BLlQa.jpg','2026-01-19',100,'Released','Prove your innocence to an AI judge or face execution.','Mercy',1236153,19.2074,7.1,'7H7Djx17l8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36773,_binary '\0','/fuRRTlFH4qazNjUSAmnmGMyNq29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31050620',5.7,3737,'en','Inheritance','When Maya learns her father Sam was once a spy, she suddenly finds herself at the center of an international conspiracy. As she seeks answers, Maya herself becomes a target and must quickly learn the skills of her father.','/aZGpn6GTtLFkkJ0LmeHtifL1Jw8.jpg','2025-01-24',101,'Released','Who are you spying on?','Inheritance',1297860,2.9692,5.925,'AokDDpO3Yh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36774,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31051322',8.4,2098,'te','ముఖ్య గమనిక','A young constable stumbles into a deadly maze. The tragic murder of his father, coinciding with the disappearance of a husband, ignites a chase for the truth, forcing him to confront hidden dangers and protect what\'s dear.','/gFozskWxgxksa70KTHZRyIeBnmU.jpg','2024-02-23',125,'Released',NULL,'Mukhya Gamanika',1246981,0.8498,0,'uOKjYtBBGYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36775,_binary '\0','/Al1THat6GRVFQGdN3N7DUDphajm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3105350',4.4,1611,'ru','Вычислитель','Ten prisoners condemned to exile on a hostile planet XT-59 must pave the way through swamp to reach the Islands of Happiness, the only safe area on the planet, before the harsh climate or the underground horrors kill them all.','/h7PAPCeHkGUEiFVHcos3clNG6OR.jpg','2014-12-18',83,'Released',NULL,'Calculator',316269,6.8879,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36776,_binary '\0','/1PYqEnB0pcgcZkr0rgLdU8DQp8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31064317',7.4,2974,'hi','Fear','Sindhu\'s world is shattered when her boyfriend vanishes. Held captive in a mental asylum, she must confront the evil forces driving her madness and confront the terrifying truth about her own past in order to escape and uncover the truth.','/wiOllBLVEf9nT3jNqU9WS4flb17.jpg','2024-12-14',115,'Released',NULL,'Fear',1400562,0.5924,6,'PyoDvSkHbck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36777,_binary '\0','/h48ND78vpvThxmCaCVCYa3KNRzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3106464',7,2742,'en','Garage Sale Mystery','Jennifer Shannon can always find a diamond in the rough, when it comes to garage sales, that is. Whether it\'s a new antique to sell at her consignment shop, an Atari game for her son or a piece of furniture for her handy husband Jason to refurbish, she has made a career out of her treasure hunting prowess. When a string of burglaries hits her town, Jennifer\'s keen eye for detail and her natural problem solving instincts even help her see the connection between these burglaries and local garage sales! Jennifer works with Detective Adam Iverson to investigate her theory that the perpetrators of the burglaries are fellow garage sale regulars. The case escalates to dangerous levels when Jennifer discovers the dead body of her friend. Even though the deceased\'s husband, Ben Douglas, finds nothing missing in their house, and the police label the death as accidental, Jennifer suspects that the death may be related to the burglaries.','/AiPSRVR3tAsyWKmJnAyzbYC6u6C.jpg','2013-09-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery',221791,2.5166,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36778,_binary '\0','/oqWTbBixgF8XwqzGeFWMzkNwqAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31064841',6.9,8186,'en','Piece by Piece','A unique cinematic experience that invites audiences on a vibrant journey through the life of cultural icon Pharrell Williams. Told through the lens of LEGO® animation, turn up the volume on your imagination and witness the evolution of one of music\'s most innovative minds.','/fmOPcP8WRvm8cok4Hz3REwD7rlJ.jpg','2024-10-10',94,'Released','Turn up the volume on your imagination.','Piece by Piece',1236419,6.2853,7.1,'7Bc6trBc1kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36779,_binary '\0','/34EbptrkxVuGVMb1k8lYJdHJmHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31065246',3.5,2248,'en','Helloween','During the sinister killer clown craze of 2016, Dr. Ellen Marks, aided by investigative journalist John Parker, trace the source of the phenomena to one of her patients - incarcerated, charismatic serial killer Carl Cane, who is using his insidious clown symbolism to recruit an army of the disenfranchised and launch a murderous anarchist movement from London across the globe. With Cane escaped and on the run on October 31st can they stop him before he unleashes hell on earth on Halloween?','/lFPmEa3b3TH1j5ObdiU4F1xqgcg.jpg','2025-09-05',80,'Released',NULL,'Helloween',1355583,1.565,4.5,'Apo49CxMwek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36780,_binary '\0','/o30iuvWcb09UtxW5gDIPVhYkdb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31065630',6.5,1239,'hu','Árva','A young boy after the Hungarian uprising of 1956, raised by his mother with the tale of an idealized dead father, has his world turned upside down when a brutish man appears, claiming to be his true parent.','/dfctdEbc5324nwkkUSdhFZJ83Yj.jpg','2025-10-23',132,'Released',NULL,'Orphan',803208,3.1193,6.2,'ttF-uKy81ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36781,_binary '\0','/rHpsTUZR3G12iJjFU4W6Q0aUxOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31068337',6.4,1392,'en','An American in Austen','Harriet, who thinks that no real man compares to Mr. Darcy, is transported into Pride and Prejudice and gets an unexpected chance to find out. Starring Eliza Bennett and Nicholas Bishop.','/aPurbvRNfJ3KOlSLXFPoD07Cazg.jpg','2024-02-07',84,'Released','Romance Doesn\'t Always Go By The Book','An American in Austen',1221678,1.8253,6.8,'5hmxygeFcsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36782,_binary '\0','/3uMTh3QhxCk5Ihk3v6qZSznLb1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3106846',7,1764,'fr','Gabrielle','Gabrielle is a young woman with Williams syndrome who has a contagious joie de vivre and an exceptional musical gift. Since she met her boyfriend Martin, at the recreation centre where they are choir members, they have been inseparable. However, because they are \"different,\" their loved ones are fearful of their relationship. As the choir prepare for an important music festival, Gabrielle does everything she can to gain her independence. As determined as she is, Gabrielle must still confront other people\'s prejudices as well as her own limitations in the hope of experiencing a love far from the \"ordinary\".','/bE2GYdImWm6UZeAv7DNkihALm27.jpg','2013-09-20',104,'Released',NULL,'Gabrielle',215031,1.569,6.348,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36783,_binary '\0','/2p5i3FNsaYmTYxZzdsR678SEi4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3107070',5,1229,'en','Believe Me','Desperate, broke, and out of ideas, four college seniors start a fake Christian charity to embezzle money for tuition.','/ytFtUBlFOq7TVOkWMVq0brHWz6J.jpg','2014-09-26',93,'Released','It\'s only a sin if you get caught.','Believe Me',285270,1.7555,5.4,'7sZ1HlEJueI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36784,_binary '\0','/wyMd7nQ1REmWTc1OHfr08BCGpdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3107166',6.4,21750,'en','Pimp','An urban love story set on the hard streets of the Bronx. A struggling female pimp, named Wednesday, grows up learning the game from her dad. Once he\'s gone she\'s left to look out for her prostitute mother and girlfriend Nikki.','/aLFt9swGFQpujVXzbj9LWowjX6C.jpg','2018-11-09',86,'Released','All Girl. All Pimp.','Pimp',417688,3.7803,6.238,'IIfWzTDMyVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36785,_binary '\0','/uRO5nmMj6qVwdtFcdL8XPhOs8Rn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3107246',5.7,1534,'ta','இரண்டாம் உலகம்','A young man\'s lover dies in a freak accident, saddened by this he tries to kill himself by driving his car over a hilltop. A portal opens through an alternate universe and, rescued by his look-alike, he finally meets his lover.','/4iIZotqK2zkbWUADRGkDItwnxiA.jpg','2013-11-22',158,'Released','How far will you travel for love?','Irandam Ulagam',69510,1.548,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36786,_binary '\0','/6tTC2ooNo2KMgjosWCPfTOSOevE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31078761',7.7,4200,'ja','余命一年の僕が、余命半年の君と出会った話。','With only a year left to live, 17-year-old Akito finds new meaning in life by bringing joy to a terminally ill girl who has just six months remaining.','/173FD4a0rpSF30z4CoWx6qdx8Ry.jpg','2024-06-26',119,'Released',NULL,'Drawing Closer',1291559,7.1328,8.433,'WMpngmDc7Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36787,_binary '\0','/9CIPFIgFhKQd3ExuhQ0N3NmyxCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3108158',6.5,6577,'ja','渇き。','When Kanako, a model daughter and a brilliant student, disappears, her mother asks her ex-husband, a violent former policeman, to find her. As his investigation progresses, his idealized image of Kanako cracks: the girl hides a dark life that her father can not even imagine.','/y7JSRcBg1Wm3ZoMI3xsRm6L6N0m.jpg','2014-07-04',118,'Released','Say goodbye to reason.','The World of Kanako',251981,3.3524,6.394,'He0oQJC9pzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36788,_binary '\0','/cAiIfkihKJS6LF9nZEqXRZrtDY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3108244',5.4,6719,'en','Capsule','1959: Guy is an experienced British fighter pilot who is in command of Britain\'s first manned mission to space. He has trained for this for three years at the height of the Cold War and now he is alone in space, suffering Hypoxia, with a malfunctioning capsule. He has limited contact with the UK, some unusual communication with the US and some unorthodox communication with Tyuratam deep in Soviet Russia. Can he get home? Who will help him? Will he make the right choice?','/iLvS3Mwd9TXiIpGlzClO35N3tw6.jpg','2016-04-27',91,'Released','One Man, One Mission, One Choice','Capsule',395560,1.0564,5.1,'E3q7WPlPP4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36789,_binary '\0','/b0U2Bd5QJytSf1vTDBtgUpgQKXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3108604',2,2706,'en','American Poltergeist','A group of friends move into a vacation home with a sinister past in Fall River, Massachusetts. Suspicious of the home\'s owner, Taryn feels a strong connection to the house and finds herself at the center of one of the most deadly poltergeists in American history.','/ejVbDQBTTfTSuiUvIa7iBmgwJt0.jpg','2015-05-29',77,'Released','The haunting has come back home.','American Poltergeist',345931,1.197,2.9,'EClDvNulZuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36790,_binary '\0','/aj02AhFaRsAqtFtjbythaIwGvx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3108894',6.7,37757,'en','The Tender Bar','JR is a fatherless boy growing up in the glow of a bar where the bartender, his Uncle Charlie, is the sharpest and most colorful of an assortment of quirky and demonstrative father figures. As the boy’s determined mother struggles to provide her son with opportunities denied to her — and leave the dilapidated home of her outrageous if begrudgingly supportive father — JR begins to gamely, if not always gracefully, pursue his romantic and professional dreams, with one foot persistently placed in Uncle Charlie’s bar.','/m6Ej3F4tYTOHD26fvX1zN9bcEUg.jpg','2021-12-17',104,'Released','Between the ones who love you and the ones who leave you is the journey of a lifetime.','The Tender Bar',727293,5.7592,6.557,'5-DS9vtLeEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36791,_binary '\0','/hQm1TYIRhYOfn554laLBnvx5e5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31100572',8.7,2638,'