 and humanity.','/c63KcoUHfr4c0BeeUzG2zB5qhuy.jpg','2024-06-05',113,'Released','Anytime, anywhere, you can meet them again.','Wonderland',635996,2.8129,7.027,'NFIRWIGxWl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36876,_binary '\0','/caFldsjpNl6kk36WlR1hGxdqkDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3125472',7.3,7207,'zh','归来','Lu and Feng are a devoted couple forced to separate when Lu is arrested and sent to a labor camp as a political prisoner during the Cultural Revolution. He finally returns home only to find that his beloved wife no longer remembers him.','/muXZscRYs9DNTBPvvhheBBlrxTO.jpg','2014-05-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Coming Home',259943,3.2192,7.3,'x-7nW7muBv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36877,_binary '\0','/5rpJwtIXntYcKRONrT5EKSAMX1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3125652',5.9,4981,'it','Pasolini','We are with Pasolini during the last hours of his life, as he talks with his beloved family and friends, writes, gives a brutally honest interview, shares a meal with Ninetto Davoli, and cruises for the roughest rough trade in his gun-metal gray Alfa Romeo. Over the course of the action, Pasolini’s life and his art are constantly refracted and intermingled to the point where they become one.','/tmlo7J7FjX6XJA7iNRPGqjx5atx.jpg','2014-09-25',87,'Released','A kaleidoscopic look at the last day of Italian filmmaker Pier Paolo Pasolini in 1975.','Pasolini',283700,1.7358,5.667,'yXpl3f3qs1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36878,_binary '\0','/57LEr2CScU29AwdaYg7OlUGBdR2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3127022',6.5,19078,'en','The Bookshop','Set in a small English town in 1959, a woman decides, against polite but ruthless local opposition, to open a bookshop, a decision which becomes a political minefield.','/nh2ZpwuTKjY0tTGcsGu7TwOpT4p.jpg','2017-11-10',110,'Released','A town without a bookshop is no town at all.','The Bookshop',444539,5.7977,6.5,'3KgMW3rowXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36879,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3127636',3.6,1456,'fa','رسوایی','A beautiful girl named Afsaneh who is living in Downtown has economic problems and her family offers to marry her to their landlord whose wife had pass away. At a night she went to a clergyman and...','/l6wF0O1LsSnSgLk84fmljx88ZwV.jpg','2013-04-17',102,'Released',NULL,'Scandal',385837,0.6968,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36880,_binary '\0','/bqYBlzidXG5wkCn9KCceMooNexT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3127698',7.2,2036,'de','Freistatt','Summer 1968. 14-year-old Wolfgang is deported from his family in the secluded Church Welfare Institution sanctuary. One thing is clear for Wolfgang: His yearning for freedom, he will not soon buried in the bog.','/fSyAmVOVOit6PYo0A3emPzOTYRG.jpg','2015-06-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Sanctuary',315196,1.9678,7.204,'7C5QDrPCzOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36881,_binary '\0','/qoTVkPKwXp3TUP2WVzrQlsmuMR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3127902',7.5,2040,'en','Dealt','Sixty-two year old Richard Turner is renowned as one of the world’s greatest card magicians, yet he is completely blind. This is an in-depth look at a complex character who is one of magic’s greatest hidden treasures.','/kGyxFPZ42UhSXeWRh3RkP0Fiz62.jpg','2017-10-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Dealt',438440,0.9686,7.5,'F__DQ1ruYck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36882,_binary '\0','/3MphYnIcLOqy5oVkDTZUiaGfPtN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31281659',5.5,5414,'en','Merv','When their beloved dog Merv loses his spark after their split, Anna and Russ are forced into the world\'s most awkward co-parenting arrangement. Hoping to shake Merv out of his funk, Russ takes him to Florida for a much-needed getaway-only for Anna to show up unexpectedly. As Merv slowly gets his groove back, turns out fixing their dog\'s broken heart may lead to a few sparks of their own.','/nfGlYjINEcGtxV46viW4olwHHSz.jpg','2025-12-09',105,'Released','A different breed of romantic comedy.','Merv',1255775,4.5107,5.9,'YsQXu_9-7qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36883,_binary '\0','/s6eh24u2kJjSiITYxvGVTS6rnev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3128900',5.8,12295,'en','Miss Meadows','Miss Meadows is a school teacher with impeccable manners and grace. However, underneath the candy-sweet exterior hides a ruthless gun-toting vigilante who takes it upon herself to right the wrongs in the world by whatever means necessary. For Miss Meadows, bad behavior is simply unforgivable.','/fpYXvWGKPwk51UTk8hqo0qE13qk.jpg','2014-09-12',88,'Released','She doesn\'t play well with others.','Miss Meadows',261037,4.5628,5.87,'O1Qb3_7mauw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36884,_binary '\0','/8jvoctIYJ3Kx7Hqb39PC46gH2CM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3129484',7.1,1238,'de','Master of the Universe','He was one of Germany\'s leading investment experts with an income of several million Euros per day. Now, he sits on one of the upper floors of an empty bank building in the middle of Frankfurt, overlooking a skyline of glass and steel. And talks. In an extended mix of a monologue and an in-depth interview, which is as frightening as it is fascinating, he shares his inside knowledge from a megalomaniac parallel world where illusions are the market\'s hardest currency. Marc Bauder\'s \'Master of the Universe\' is based on meticulous research and provides us with geniune insight into the notoriously secretive and self-protective \'universe\' of which our nameless protagonist experiences himself a master. Where other films on the financial meltdown have focused on the epic nature of larger-than-life business, Bauder probes the mentality that made it possible in the first place. A tense drama where psychology meets finance - two things that are more closely linked than you would like to believe.','/pcaxlNmtMDJdyPFCcUmZdjEjYpi.jpg','2013-11-07',88,'Released',NULL,'Master of the Universe',246308,1.7925,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36885,_binary '\0','/8rECi529Ep0fS0bXKjZl643DvK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3129564',7.1,6250,'fr','Diplomatie','On the night of August 24, 1944, the fate of Paris rests with General von Choltitz, who plans to destroy the city on Hitler\'s orders. As the general prepares to detonate explosives throughout the capital, Swedish consul Raoul Nordling uses diplomacy in a desperate bid to convince him to defy the orders and save Paris.','/p4G0i0a5NJphxCrYOZIrcYlz15O.jpg','2014-03-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Diplomacy',253239,3.6071,7,'Jjwr-I1jYLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36886,_binary '\0','/3EhEkWjcHfgVHkMEfKVjOqJQDip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3130560',6.3,1406,'de','Schneeflöckchen','Hunting down the murderer of their families in an anarchic Berlin of the near future, the outlaws Tan and Javid find themselves trapped in the wicked fairytale of a mysterious screenplay that entangles them in a vicious circle of revenge – apparently all written by a clueless dentist.','/xmcNlnRLm1e3hwrQRr8b1L4myKx.jpg','2017-09-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Snowflake',371042,1.7896,6.5,'_5SZ7aiw6Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36887,_binary '\0','/nfuzvk5swY6elXszM3kraLfgW2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31306866',4.3,2427,'en','I Heart Robots','Years after a robot apocalypse, Terra ventures away from her secluded compound to take her lovable robot companion West to save what\'s left of a dying world.','/knd85FajslJuehXKldfQzlsdEMo.jpg','2024-08-11',76,'Released',NULL,'I Heart Robots',1338341,1.6577,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36888,_binary '\0','/psAGX272PFGdpKmSJI4x8sGPciZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31308201',5.3,3280,'en','Tinsel Town','A washed-up Hollywood action hero is tricked into starring in a small English town’s chaotic Christmas pantomime, where a straight-talking dance instructor and his estranged daughter just might help him rediscover the magic of the season.','/9YxpBl5CRAaBiQhQG7uZ86Jw2Hv.jpg','2025-11-28',94,'Released','Star-struck at Christmas.','Tinsel Town',1430593,3.3464,5.8,'ES_TPm2c9Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36889,_binary '\0','/h4cq5eGcPN2j2YDTitHl4V9FaM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31311161',6.4,1359,'te','చౌర్య పాఠం','Four aspiring criminals plan to rob the local bank at India\'s most richest and peaceful village, on the pretext of shooting a documentary. But their heist plans are disrupted when they discover the seemingly tranquil community harbors sinister secrets.','/1YLMmspugk0Td4cNBynfqmhZXxf.jpg','2025-04-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Chaurya Paatam',1472031,0.9333,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36890,_binary '\0','/avf83LbIvRCVxTJjjpdyDwBZxB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31312310',6.2,1495,'ta','ஓஹோ எந்தன் பேபி','Ashwin goes to actor Vishnu Vishal’s office to pitch a script and ends up narrating his love story. What the actor thinks to be an interval is Ashwin’s climax, it actually is a stoic end to his romantic relationship with Meera. With Vishnu Vishal’s pursual, Ashwin must confront his former lover again, to complete his story and begin his debut directorial.','/ffnBY54B4Etmu0UCpMXiJNNTlRV.jpg','2025-07-11',129,'Released',NULL,'Oho Enthan Baby',1329271,1.6045,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36891,_binary '\0','/cY6IXwtmc8xdznDlw2eegB8OGx1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31313835',6.8,3172,'en','Stans','A revealing, edgy, and disarmingly personal journey into the world of superfandom, told through the lens of one of the world\'s most iconic and enduring artists, Eminem, and the fans that worship him.','/jqIvV9wWIA5h1UREfCcnBBlcr6Q.jpg','2025-08-06',102,'Released','Your biggest fans, these are...','Stans',1244999,2.06,7.038,'78XgzEytwSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36892,_binary '\0','/hu0S4QPE1p6UNcYUSDcrINKwwzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31314185',5,1573,'en','The Greatest Love Story Never Told','Follow Jennifer Lopez as she attempts her most daring project yet: independently producing a new album and cinematic original that explore her twenty-year journey to self-love.','/czYawYBFfmSYowzBAS6AkNq9ngs.jpg','2024-02-26',87,'Released','Behind the scenes of a dream.','The Greatest Love Story Never Told',1246030,3.1766,6.5,'WL-ClLQT54s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36893,_binary '\0','/3lEV4CoKoeT2cZ4fbKEJugZcw6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31314296',5,22536,'en','The Woman in the Yard','In the aftermath of her husband\'s death, widow Ramona\'s struggle to raise her two kids is hindered by the arrival of a mysterious woman with supernatural abilities.','/n0WS2TsNcS6dtaZKzxipyO7LuCJ.jpg','2025-03-27',88,'Released','Don\'t let her in.','The Woman in the Yard',1244944,6.1514,5.6,'1s-Ko4J3mWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36894,_binary '\0','/6ic1CVzOFrnlWp1g6tPgAXUAjVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3131456',6.8,4562,'en','A Very Merry Mix-Up','Shop owner Alice Chapman is nervous to meet her future in-laws at Christmas, especially because she is arriving ahead of her new fiance Will Mitchum. Alice\'s trip becomes more stressful when her luggage is lost and her phone is damaged, leaving her no way to find Will\'s family!','/7WwGwKE9yMB90EsXduuPTX3iBbL.jpg','2013-11-10',86,'Released',NULL,'A Very Merry Mix-Up',238749,2.5422,6,'llpTYlMZzzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36895,_binary '\0','/aJgTPBIkB5rovcF9FjUMl05W10D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31314745',3.9,3314,'en','Trust','A Hollywood starlet seeks refuge in a secluded Airbnb following a high-profile scandal, only to find herself at the mercy of hardened criminals on the hunt for a score.','/n9GS1mUAVMiC3gBn9rb8jrDoK4D.jpg','2025-08-22',90,'Released','You can hide but you can\'t run.','Trust',1244953,3.1416,5.379,'UgalwGXCAFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36896,_binary '\0','/2QL65MG9LKDgLPep34SXjvJPSYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3131532',6.2,2110,'en','Catch a Christmas Star','Nikki Crandon is one of the biggest pop stars on the planet. Whether she\'s singing the National Anthem or promoting her latest album, everyone knows who she is—none more so than New Jersey high school basketball coach and widower Chris Mitchell, who was Nikki\'s first love in high school. When Chris\' 10-year-old daughter Sophie finds out her dad still has feelings for the singer, she takes matters into her own hands. With her 8-year-old brother Jackson in tow, Sophie succeeds in reuniting the two. But when a misunderstanding and the growing glare of the public spotlight threaten Chris and Nikki\'s happiness, one can only wonder: will fame get in the way of a Merry Christmas?','/40nMble3uFagwJ7ffagvefbcKCJ.jpg','2013-11-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Catch a Christmas Star',238304,2.2638,6.4,'ITQ5gnQQvXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36897,_binary '\0','/cKD0aevBKDZUGe1f1JIR4MZOztD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31316096',6.6,3867,'en','Hack Your Health: The Secrets of Your Gut','Delve into the digestive system with this lighthearted and informative documentary that demystifies the role gut health plays in our overall well-being.','/7D7qEdPHCKVHihtaJDAys2HAi0L.jpg','2024-04-26',80,'Released',NULL,'Hack Your Health: The Secrets of Your Gut',1266701,2.0543,6.7,'VwfuJr07P_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36898,_binary '\0','/aallzBqsaiDYAmDKwUOm68z973R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31316162',6.9,1608,'te','ఎనిమిది వసంతాలు','A talented karate student embarks on a journey of self-discovery where she experiences both love and loss.','/z6mVibOXbNw9grRX689MfrbIQsl.jpg','2025-06-20',138,'Released',NULL,'8 Vasantalu',1370032,1.862,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36899,_binary '\0','/pQ4cATCoPsTELJmqjh1X6TIv1kE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3131744',2.4,2029,'fa','اخراجی ها ۳','The war is over and the deportees are back to their homes and each is after his life. A TV-show is trying to meet some old veterans of war. One of them who is very sick should go to hospital but they late and he is near to meet death. This cause his other friends (the deportees) who now are each with a different look to come visit him.','/enz3HtLYfVGN8N6omkxAuH5ucn0.jpg','2011-07-29',113,'Released',NULL,'Deportees 3',538800,1.0168,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36900,_binary '\0','/fnvTC96lA7pf8ZlMKI2FgBZ86AP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31322753',7.3,16633,'en','Twinless','Two men who lost their respective twin brothers develop a growing friendship after meeting in a support group. However, both harbor long-hidden secrets that threaten to tear them apart.','/9vaw9Az5tPLMjNLj426KgKsp0k8.jpg','2025-09-04',100,'Released','We\'re all just looking for someone who gets us.','Twinless',1245347,6.3794,7.207,'dTVJeEb69e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36901,_binary '\0','/dJTUyaWhtNN0HTshnFN4VKaFxLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3132632',6.3,1368,'en','Misery Loves Comedy','Do you have to be miserable to be funny? More than sixty comedians—including stand-ups, writers, actors, and directors from the US, Canada, and abroad—take on this question, sharing anecdotes and insights with lively enthusiasm.','/wjYla0vnZ3HtzAS6JxINNrZ3wY5.jpg','2015-01-23',94,'Released','Kevin Pollak explores the dark side of comedy in this fascinating documentary.','Misery Loves Comedy',316067,2.1737,6.1,'3v2ewpePpO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36902,_binary '\0','/cpEkmwroTnuCJwurvR3rxQQLY4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3132658',1.1,1360,'hu','Elment az öszöd','In 2017, three inmates - a former prime minister, an online journalist and a prison guard - await their sentences at Budapest’s Kozma Street Prison, each haunted by the spring 2006 elections, the Őszöd speech leak, the MTV siege and the October 23 protests at Astoria. As they relive those pivotal moments, their memories intertwine to reveal how that year’s political upheaval reshaped Hungary’s future.','/oXqrEuMahwc8KwIyNUtKimuKFRs.jpg','2013-05-22',77,'Released',NULL,'Elment az öszöd',330283,0.5802,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36903,_binary '\0','/mMh8hpc5pq9txyC91aMXXfo11P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3132714',7.5,2062,'fr','Marie Heurtin','Marie Heurtin is born both blind and deaf. Sister Marguerette wins her trust and teaches her how to express herself.','/xEOVzmg8KFfypgFNqahvHDK7DPU.jpg','2014-08-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Marie\'s Story',286595,2.6581,7.5,'7HG-bDNEumw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36904,_binary '\0','/uISJbRzKwt8XNZT0r9o1WaMF61Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3134058',7.2,3248,'pt','Tim Maia','Biopic of Brazilian singer Tim Maia, from his childhood in Rio de Janeiro until his death at age 55, including his passage by the US, where he discovers a new style of music and is arrested for theft and drug possession.','/eZOOkfjr8YVhRsQvZxPUeqw49cx.jpg','2014-10-30',140,'Released',NULL,'Tim Maia',286256,1.0143,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36905,_binary '\0','/zSxlrLOtKP6yVwC1aNsJzjDHi43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3134422',6.1,1433,'en','Gold','An offbeat comedy about an estranged father who returns to his hometown after an absence of ten years in order to reconnect with his daughter and ex-wife but unwittingly finds himself responsible for almost destroying all their lives.','/d0MpfuJKEjPhdVRxHEhrU1Obh6b.jpg','2014-02-20',88,'Released','He came looking for a second opportunity and he found...','Gold',273964,1.3085,6.3,'q2CtPlgu3xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36906,_binary '\0','/2c9zNZJL0ZdagD6JbmU3hH4hovs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31349844',6.7,1851,'en','Runner','A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.','/yBKMAIj7clP42UkFejhGDBBoTpb.jpg','2026-09-07',97,'Released','Next-day delivery isn\'t an option.','Runner',1377237,284.8046,8.3,'B6Z9MM1LhEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36907,_binary '\0','/9ZzJxEg9zyyGIZx3eplHojYsZ5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31349852',6.1,1432,'en','Savage House','Against the backdrop of 18th century England, a massive pox outbreak, and Jacobite uprising – Sir Chauncey Savage and Lady Savage blindly pursue a better life. It\'s not without a tinge of irony that their family name is the Savages, for this is a Savage House indeed, filled with duels, decadence, and bloodshed.','/uF2qGFP5uL7UWk9h1xDZpWV2P8t.jpg','2026-06-05',114,'Released','Polite society has never been so Savage.','Savage House',1245859,7.1024,6.922,'4VIIZlzqdKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36908,_binary '\0','/5DLUByGgl2UXOn00UHvbnaIk34F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31350080',6.5,1493,'ka','აპრილი','Nina, an OB-GYN, faces accusations after a newborn\'s death. Her life undergoes scrutiny during investigation. She persists in her medical duties, determined to provide care others hesitate to offer, despite the risks.','/9DJadZoQfmSzxe3E5uB7dISfc3L.jpg','2025-01-29',134,'Released',NULL,'April',1064021,1.962,6.8,'1DhpfI-HL3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36909,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3135556',5.1,3210,'en','Jimmy Vestvood: Amerikan Hero','A wannabe private investigator wins the Green Card lottery and moves to America to pursue his dream only to find himself embroiled in a conspiracy to start the next world war.','/wLao42G2BwQAbjxkwtU6i8ruuxv.jpg','2016-03-13',84,'Released','Heroes are not born, they are imported.','Jimmy Vestvood: Amerikan Hero',299641,2.2026,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36910,_binary '\0','/pHSTy4aFEcBnslMACAawkr6oum5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3136112',6.5,5839,'en','Shelter','Hannah and Tahir fall in love while homeless on the streets of New York. Shelter explores how they got there, and as we learn about their pasts we realize they need each other to build a future.','/1EtMTtKDLp2MGhddZuLgeGZVbRk.jpg','2014-09-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Shelter',287426,2.6128,5.9,'A-tn-F7ZKfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36911,_binary '\0','/w8KWrI1vblfCx8GyqS9alh2nLAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3136646',6.1,2121,'ru','Духless 2','Max Andreev thought the best place to start a new life would be at the other end of the world. What he didn\'t know, is that you can\'t outrun your past.','/m6nHvgio8iRvX9ZND1RTHJd0TUW.jpg','2015-03-05',107,'Released','He must face a diffucult choice.','Soulless 2',327982,1.5487,5.48,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36912,_binary '\0','/nVF5CPRqtG3DQHyhGBMH4Sdb7VL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3136752',6.3,1846,'fr','Le Dernier diamant','Simon, a burglar on probation, agreed to go on the biggest shot of his life: The flight of the \"Florentine\", a mythical diamond set auction by its owners. To succeed, he must approach Julia, expert diamond for sale which is a considerable personal and family issue. Beyond a jigsaw particularly daring, Julia Simon will lead to a destiny she could not imagine.','/fpsQKT0YHlDQ6Rzv0xbpPEfbe13.jpg','2014-04-30',108,'Released',NULL,'The Last Diamond',269714,2.3936,6.4,'T5aZyC4MIIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36913,_binary '\0','/s8V0zRZXDgO0r7H1SspJNX7G87H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31368823',7.8,1337,'bn','কাছের মানুষ দূরে থুইয়া','A Tale of Touch. ‘Kacher Manush Dure Thuiya’: is a story of going away for the needs of life, and returning to the stirring of feelings. This long-distance relationship saga unveils the poignant struggles of lovers separated by thousands of miles – a narrative steeped in the complexities of distance, evoking doubt, mistrust, anger, and resentment, ultimately culminating in separation. It\'s a poignant portrayal of the profound longing for physical closeness, encapsulated in the simple yet profound act of a hug, bridging the chasm between distant hearts.','/ftcDry2KkYDkuZNjhkRQmDTudTl.jpg','2024-02-22',144,'Released',NULL,'Kacher Manush Dure Thuiya',1240463,2.042,7.167,'qr7iNwGbm_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36914,_binary '\0','/Afs2EfDfnacxLa2qSZ4ji9LEsru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3137630',6.3,23251,'en','David Brent: Life on the Road','A camera crew catches up with David Brent, the former star of the fictional British series, \"The Office\" as he now fancies himself a rockstar on the road.','/lhUKeZj7VlWAtavAzTLwClDWSpI.jpg','2016-08-19',96,'Released','The boss is back','David Brent: Life on the Road',339792,2.719,6.1,'2THODznVOt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36915,_binary '\0','/zGRlP8SEyYDLjnvtXKTBGzuOVBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3137764',5.6,7827,'en','Staten Island Summer','Pals Danny and Frank spend the summer after high school working as lifeguards while figuring out their future.','/mAG2oqObFOR58bUI8A2DQCkRlcf.jpg','2015-06-30',108,'Released','No regrets.','Staten Island Summer',343934,2.6506,5.6,'C5I2bgxbBHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36916,_binary '\0','/z3Q8cbwmtsVdkPDCX10XawVG3bc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138104',3.5,18684,'en','The Hungover Games','Each year, drunk people are selected to participate in torturous games the morning after a big night out. There\'s no sunglasses, no water, and no headache medicine. \"The Hungover Games,\" a film that manages to merge the premises of both \"The Hunger Games\" and \"The Hangover\" and throw in references to \"Ted,\" \"Django Unchained,\" \"The Lord of the Rings,\" \"Carrie,\" \"The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills\" and whatever else crossed the writers\' fevered brains during the probably very drunken \"development process.\"','/sOqB812jWYgcHCyT2PVEk3RBtSm.jpg','2014-02-01',86,'Released','The odds are so not in their favor.','The Hungover Games',244688,2.7522,4.1,'_Qcf8TVX2zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36917,_binary '\0','/12r1Oi9NRBgvguZYE1mpFXkdsh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138122',5,4448,'en','Into the Ashes','With an honest job and a loving wife, Nick Brenner believed he had safely escaped his violent, criminal history. But his old crew hasn\'t forgotten about him or the money he stole, and when they take what Nick now values the most - his wife - he has nothing left to lose. Confronted by the town sheriff, who is also his father-in-law, Nick must decide if he will stay on his new path or indulge in his need for revenge and force his enemies to pay for what they have done.','/xSTsGP8EUVk26L1khj6uOv2n3f9.jpg','2019-07-19',97,'Released','From the fire, vengeance will rise.','Into the Ashes',609189,2.734,5.1,'g0KBinxAXl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36918,_binary '\0','/6x17FmycXbfcD3nhPU5WFXU8knU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138344',5.4,3892,'en','Baked in Brooklyn','A recent college graduate decides to sell marijuana on the streets of Manhattan after losing his job at a consulting firm. He soon meets the girl of his dreams. With an unsupportive girlfriend, an increase of clienteles, and the growing threats of being caught or killed, he soon realizes he is in way over his head.','/9P66ST8IackgLaHmfOk0EoQwYg5.jpg','2016-10-14',86,'Released',NULL,'Baked in Brooklyn',417877,1.6549,5.2,'mnvluj1ofGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36919,_binary '\0','/yZHzTJDP9gWDNfcXNiogxgL7rzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138558',4.8,6323,'en','Preservation','Three family members head deep into the woods for a hunting trip that doubles as a distraction from their troubles at home. When all of their gear is stolen, they turn on each other, but soon realize there are much more treacherous forces at work.','/ppoOXtJZBPXq9Qf2v9pxaa8UeQg.jpg','2014-08-22',90,'Released','Man is the only animal that kills for fun','Preservation',265019,2.3257,4.9,'9XcEo7aL67I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36920,_binary '\0','/tDM4UAaHxMrvODGIUj9ZixmyVmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138698',7.3,5159,'ja','傷物語〈Ⅰ鉄血篇〉','One day, Koyomi Araragi encounters the horrifying vampire, Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade A.K.A. the \"King of Apparitions.\" He saves the fatally wounded Kiss-shot by offering his blood at the expense of his own life as a human. Now Koyomi has to face the vampire hunters to retrieve Kiss-shot’s limbs which were taken by these hunters...','/vftYhVOdvMCmb0dQIRIKmUYG9TU.jpg','2016-01-08',63,'Released',NULL,'Kizumonogatari Part 1: Tekketsu',357786,4.1355,7.715,'4lt0rT_nmvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36921,_binary '\0','/gFJ9i3eANzMo8kpowofbFQMHJyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3138782',7.6,15921,'tr','Mucize','1960s Turkey countryside. A newly assigned teacher finds out that the solitary village is missing a school. He gets fond of the village people and especially a disabled man. The teacher helps the village to build a new school and educate the children and the disabled man.','/baXozaGF8180QrZFuqlPrlLqCQc.jpg','2015-01-01',136,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle',321050,2.2784,7.1,'CwQsmRDRdMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36922,_binary '\0','/7rmSMnH5HDHWWil6tYmxPlH8vqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31390893',6.7,23724,'mr','राजा शिवाजी','Chronicles the rise of young Shivaji Bhonsale, who challenged the might of established empires to found the Maratha kingdom and lay the groundwork for \'Swarajya\' (self-rule) during a turbulent period of Indian history.','/hljQF3Ly6PzQe7iaNs9fmFuBYWj.jpg','2026-05-01',195,'Released',NULL,'Raja Shivaji',1247165,2.1918,5.9,'3CXt4GtjLmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36923,_binary '\0','/qiZwhpP9K4n4aGimBGxIghFndB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31392065',7.3,4850,'en','Federer: Twelve Final Days','Originally a home video never intended for public viewing, this film captures the final chapter in Roger Federer\'s legendary tennis career, featuring Roger, his family, and his three main rivals: Rafael Nadal, Novak Djokovic, and Andy Murray.','/kunqcryDeYZxBg4ESat2We5qRtD.jpg','2024-06-10',88,'Released','A legend leaves the court.','Federer: Twelve Final Days',1247031,2.4475,7.3,'4rF8U2DnMz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36924,_binary '\0','/6Ypt0zspYChnZM6JWVOirbUaBx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31392609',7.9,23330,'th','หลานม่า','M, a university dropout low on money and luck, volunteers to take care of his terminally ill grandmother, in the hope of pocketing an inheritance.','/9Xa0Grd2jq2lM2gqcoTB4F9TjMd.jpg','2024-04-04',126,'Released','Never underestimate a grandma\'s love for her family.','How to Make Millions Before Grandma Dies',1103621,7.8792,8.1,'HrVX_nHNIUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36925,_binary '\0','/5gcE6zZaakUyqyHvq0UCXkXdjB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3139538',6.2,2776,'en','Amira & Sam','Sam, a soldier who had served in Afghanistan and Iraq, meets Amira when he visits her uncle, Bassam, who had served as Sam\'s Iraqi translator. Bassam and Sam have a special bond due to their time together in the war. Initially Amira does not trust him because he was an American soldier and her brother was killed by a bomb from American troops in the war. Sam\'s cousin, Charlie, asks Sam to help him with illegal hedge funds unbeknownst to Sam at the time. Amira is staying with her uncle Bassam since her father died. She sells bootlegged films on the street corner but is forced to stay with Sam after getting busted; immigration officials begin pursuing her. As the film progresses, Sam and Amira fall in love.','/jrvIQcbEwEyj7i0zhPdqj2WLJkm.jpg','2014-05-30',90,'Released','The only place they belong is together','Amira & Sam',272602,1.6261,6.023,'eLugRqOwFEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36926,_binary '\0','/9NN8QD9TvrYxgPfH6LK8HJkpjJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3139756',5.1,6870,'en','Black Mountain Side','A group of archaeologists working in Northern Canada uncover a strange structure dating over ten thousand years before the present. The team soon finds themselves isolated when their communication systems fail and they begin to feel the effects of solitude.','/pvhyPlGGL7iwc1ykjZSRc0gRw6b.jpg','2016-01-26',99,'Released','There is something under the ice…','Black Mountain Side',267852,1.5182,5.2,'hcrq-P0ZkTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36927,_binary '\0','/1BqoXxXahujGXSLUfefs3bmUSZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3140100',7.1,29200,'da','Fasandræberne','Denmark, 2014. A former police officer asks Carl Mørck, head of Department Q, to find out who brutally killed his young twins in 1994. Although a local inhabitant confessed and was convicted of murder, Carl and his partner Assad soon realize that there is something in the case resolution that is terribly wrong.','/gnXZXx5rDHfymhB7jCDdBjWgm2j.jpg','2014-10-02',116,'Released',NULL,'The Absent One',254201,4.406,7.008,'x9Zq_Op5LJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36928,_binary '\0','/132H5ZPmuIbULbZCESvqmPw29eB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31402484',7.5,1594,'ar','الست','Ailing from a sickness that threatens to silence her forever, Umm Kalthoum, the greatest Egyptian singer the world has ever known, takes to the stage one final time for her most important performance yet, one with the potential to heal a nation broken by the shadow of a great defeat. As she slowly steps onto the stage to deafening chants and applause, fearful for her health and country, a legend finds herself walking down memory lane, reminiscing on her humble beginnings and the seven decade journey of triumphs, failures, defying social conventions, and loves lost that followed.','/chQtoBTPpMMq1yAjdLUvflaoI5h.jpg','2025-12-10',161,'Released','The voice they couldn\'t silence. The star they couldn\'t contain.','El Sett',1246595,1.8765,6.444,'kJyGfAcS8nQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36929,_binary '\0','/qIM5iwCjg3qnYnIeix2UDbmZg3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31410930',7.4,1496,'es','No estás sola: La lucha contra La Manada','Through key testimonies, this documentary looks at a gang rape that took place during the 2016 San Fermín festival and sparked protests worldwide.','/vupMzfqjhr6U75D9AqmuFikcafi.jpg','2024-02-23',103,'Released',NULL,'You Are Not Alone: Fighting the Wolf Pack',1238400,1.8189,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36930,_binary '\0','/b28RiKlALbdC2Dmnndt93MBt76h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31411349',7.2,4881,'fr','La Venue de l\'avenir','When four distant cousins inherit a 19th-century home in Normandy, they decide to visit and examine their family history. No one has lived there since the 1940s, and the cousins are intrigued by all of the items they find there, little things that help them to understand their ancestor, Adèle Vermillard. Jumping back and forth in time, they meet the mysterious Adèle, whose bohemian lifestyle, and her relationships with the leading artists of the time, changes their lives.','/hPj1RiuhW72lIfa8UrIncDGSSD0.jpg','2025-05-22',126,'Released',NULL,'Colours of Time',1235304,5.5851,7.348,'_sTdOm2BID8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36931,_binary '\0','/huiMxOvrv8VJoOOJuYeimbCSG4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31412707',6.2,1272,'de','Die drei ??? und der Karpatenhund','A call for help from gallery owner Mr. Prentice leads the three detectives into a new adventure: his apartment is said to be haunted. When the Carpathian dog, a valuable work of art, is also stolen, events spiral out of control because all the residents have a motive. As the suspects are eliminated one by one, the three detectives find themselves in the middle of their most exciting case yet.','/jPPJxIreUdG1AS71xlrwHZTK8u2.jpg','2025-01-23',108,'Released',NULL,'The Three Investigators and the Carpathian Dog',1219537,1.9745,6.292,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36932,_binary '\0','/xFSJuU7QLaQKpCd3MoJwibkKBPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3141498',6.4,3457,'de','Der Nachtmahr','After a massive party one evening, 17-year-old Tina begins experiencing nightmares in which she is haunted by an unusual creature.','/b6x4snE3eJzc5LwLuNcD3gbKOxZ.jpg','2015-07-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Nightmare',346641,2.2159,6.387,'xrQkasMhy6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36933,_binary '\0','/fcJO190JXVfFQaF04RWYqugLDrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31416854',6.6,2586,'ml','ആനന്ദ് ശ്രീബാല','Follows the missing person case of Merin Joy and how an ordinary man with a tragic past gets wrapped in the investigation.','/gnt2GVTgwbiY63HQtIE5VsFQNxU.jpg','2024-11-15',134,'Released',NULL,'Anand Sreebala',1243975,0.9889,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36934,_binary '\0','/x5a43cuGbe6LfsmS2gXm8HSYhns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3141912',4.8,3548,'ja','女体銃 ガン・ウーマン GUN WOMAN','A brilliant doctor on a quest for revenge buys a young woman and trains her to be the ultimate assassin, implanting gun parts in her body that she must later assemble and use to kill her target before she bleeds to death.','/4zbT9LhgIvU7bcfKz5XixhJrYZx.jpg','2014-02-28',86,'Released','Kill the target before you bleed to death!','Gun Woman',258750,2.2403,5,'cGkhgk5jRcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36935,_binary '\0','/ecaX1qD7G40gvG8FVRAxDLSGkjn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3142232',5.2,11763,'hi','हीरोपंती','Two young people find love despite the violent landscape in which they live.','/o5QOtVJvt5dtiJiJTjv1