nary '\0','/iLVOwwgsO4vfqH7olBfGR23jf9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3142872',7.1,11893,'tr','Bi Küçük Eylül Meselesi','A beautiful girl who has everything. A sudden car crash, and her heart stops for a few minutes. When she wakes up, everyone assures that everything’s alright. But she knows it isn’t. Because she cant remember her final month; a September of her life is missing.','/pUDlxXGJjv8FoNJRusmacfUcwEZ.jpg','2014-02-14',102,'Released',NULL,'A Small September Affair',256546,1.3661,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36941,_binary '\0','/7CRI8G7pm0HjEptiEEPiCMv3GEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3142958',6.1,5357,'tr','Su ve Ateş','A pretty young girl falls for an enigmatic, shy man who sweeps her off her feet. She becomes pregnant but is not allowed to tell him. His advisers are adamant. Back home, they have set up a wedding with the daughter of an antagonistic family and marriage will put an end to the blood feud between them.','/7Q91NanJYGIUljUM7STDLECllyq.jpg','2013-11-15',113,'Released',NULL,'Water and Fire',271954,2.4683,7.9,'fpkJDT2d59Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36942,_binary '\0','/qspghhpOyaBGgZDJoCbV2o9WNMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31433402',5.1,27376,'en','Fear Street: Prom Queen','Who will be voted queen at Shadyside High\'s 1988 prom? For underdog Lori, competition is cutthroat even before someone starts killing off the candidates.','/gevScWYkF8l5i9NjFSXo8HfPNyy.jpg','2025-05-23',90,'Released','Winning just might be the death of you.','Fear Street: Prom Queen',1001414,8.3649,5.3,'gYbnjaK5nsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36943,_binary '\0','/be5SIsRGMckO8tU9lrLcIik70Dy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31434030',6.2,43761,'fr','Dracula','In late 15th-century Eastern Europe, Prince Vlad II’s bride is brutally murdered. As a result, he renounces God and damns Heaven itself. Cursed with eternal life, Vlad is reborn as Dracula, an immortal warlord who defies fate in a blood-soaked crusade to wrench his lost love back from death.','/ykyRfv7JDofLxXLAwtLXaSuaFfM.jpg','2025-07-30',130,'Released','He renounced his faith to become immortal. Passion, anger, vengeance, and hatred will be unleashed into the modern world.','Dracula',1246049,18.5598,7.252,'3OBLPpuOM10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36944,_binary '\0','/cLssF0xlmylNr7cg6ogLD6a24gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31434046',6.5,8466,'el','Μην ανοίγεις την πόρτα','Far from civilization, in a frozen forest on an inhospitable mountainside, a group of researchers is attacked by an unidentified figure. The sole survivor, a young biologist, takes refuge in the isolated cabin of a mysterious man.','/jTdupsyvx9VW4vP4jRy9x5PfeEE.jpg','2024-04-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Open the Door',1250264,0.7913,7,'nqDECA1WknY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36945,_binary '\0','/30jbD8Er4aB7FbfUbyZLORMDnJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31434639',7.1,116970,'en','Warfare','A platoon of Navy SEALs embarks on a dangerous mission in Ramadi, Iraq, with the chaos and brotherhood of war retold through their memories of the event.','/l39TlELomwysfsr37vrvCV6rmaQ.jpg','2025-04-09',95,'Released','Everything is based on memory.','Warfare',1241436,13.7753,7.064,'JER0Fkyy3tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36946,_binary '\0','/3I3eNgsqxA1TxMjpmm7rglP5WVa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31435586',7.9,2604,'te','Valari','What happens when your past comes back to haunt you in the most supernatural way? And what if you don\'t even remember it?','/tD6KoIon6m5P0Du76MNGkGL4QYX.jpg','2024-03-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Valari',1254651,0.6689,5,'HC8IDgxAOhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36947,_binary '\0','/7Ybes6Kwr6au7vewTXtesRwcrxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31435642',5.5,1232,'te','ఓమ్ భీమ్ బుష్','Three friends united by their passion for science and their quest for discovery, in search of treasure hidden within the Sampangi Mahal, venture into the village of Bhairavapuram, where locals fear a ghost of Sampangi living in the dreaded palace.','/x1dtomYuwo0vkeXyu6GY1OSxO7L.jpg','2024-03-21',135,'Released','No Logic Only Magic','Om Bheem Bush',1248487,1.145,6,'JBE1CxmIHQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36948,_binary '\0','/d96aw1mabl8OlJnbb91td2UCl7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3143606',4.8,3634,'en','TimeCrafters: The Treasure of Pirate\'s Cove','While searching for lost treasure, time traveling pirates end up in the modern day and do battle with unlikely foes: a group of kids with the latest in techy gadgetry.','/hlEF0i2maAC2Ebjma1Ss5yKCsBE.jpg','2020-12-12',105,'Released',NULL,'TimeCrafters: The Treasure of Pirate\'s Cove',657032,2.1551,5.7,'xBQfCRCGe3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36949,_binary '\0','/alo20exRRwPj1vhqrjbmaee9op9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3144098',6.7,5256,'ko','동창생','The son of a North Korean spy decides to follow in his father\'s footsteps to protect his little sister.','/ybM400b3vesnoNzOlTlAmHeEYPq.jpg','2013-11-05',113,'Released','He\'ll stop nothing to save her.','Commitment',235704,3.6463,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36950,_binary '\0','/teYQQEAWAoOslEpbRFtoNGpRT4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3144266',3.3,1596,'en','The Last House on Cemetery Lane','Screenwriter John Davies has grown tired of living in London and moves to an old manor house in a sleepy West Wales village to get out of the rat race. At first he enjoys himself, embracing the quieter pace of life and starting a relationship with his beautiful neighbour Cassie Konrad. But strange, unexplained occurrences begin to occur in the manor house. John discovers he is surrounded by a supernatural presence and begins to research the house\'s past, discovering secrets more terrible than he ever imagined. It is now up to John to right the injustices of the past and finally lay to rest the spirits which haunt the Last House on Cemetery Lane.','/oOWBKMOpBgbHg7dJ4FzJYLY3ev5.jpg','2015-02-17',81,'Released','Evil Has A New Home','The Last House on Cemetery Lane',324986,0.9203,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36951,_binary '\0','/vt37v6ouquokPYeEg3xqkzKjHRj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31450182',6.1,8938,'en','Amber Alert','A ride-share turns into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse after it follows a car fitting the description of an AMBER Alert.','/vkrmJ2fStfnvsLfBw55nimnjcd5.jpg','2024-09-27',91,'Released','Two strangers are her only hope.','Amber Alert',1248753,4.954,7.1,'2aCr7-oJ0JQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36952,_binary '\0','/j3S4HeOPsn7AWEb6GibMOBm1XpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31450914',7.5,1847,'ko','청설','A job seeking dreamer Yong-jun works part-time at his parents\' lunch box house. Yeo-reum lives only to support for hearing-impaired swimmer sister. One day, Yong-jun meets Yeo-reum while delivering lunch boxes and falls in love at the first sight. Yeo-reum slowly opens her heart to warm-hearted Yong-jun.','/dNCp17yK9L0pANvKTb6tWECQj4Q.jpg','2024-11-06',109,'Released','Even without sound, I can hear your heart.','Hear Me: Our Summer',1160981,3.9191,7.717,'kMDYNQRRJWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36953,_binary '\0','/ebrd6JoIAu7r8dCiI2Hze2DKGvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31450976',6.4,1960,'es','Los Tigres','Antonio and Estrella are diving siblings. He works in maritime works, she studies underwater life and assists him. Its precarious economy could improve after finding cocaine hidden in the hull of a ship anchored in Huelva.','/5X4VLfrBSvHas5VnzivaLl7PoFM.jpg','2025-10-31',109,'Released',NULL,'The Tigers',1464374,3.0452,6.211,'Pczmpo6WZhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36954,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31451148',1.2,3037,'te','బాయ్స్','Three friends embark on a quest to find girlfriends but planning the perfect date takes an unexpected turn, revealing that love\'s path is filled with surprises.','/6X18xWvH0wivYUs93NRdpTwi7Ox.jpg','2024-03-08',129,'Released',NULL,'We Love Bad Boys',1471367,0.7484,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36955,_binary '\0','/uFtetLeIniQ9r4VEIz3pdEE9PrX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3145220',5.8,2096,'en','Hits','A talentless teen will do anything to get on TV\'s \"The Voice.\" Meanwhile, her father, a municipal worker, creates an uproar when a video of his rants at City Hall goes viral.','/w7TdwnSh5McR5J28ZHTvttTKaCi.jpg','2014-01-21',96,'Released','Based on a true story... that hasn\'t happened yet.','Hits',242083,1.4779,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36956,_binary '\0','/QXmiloTQBrYkYVN74abhL9gT8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3145422',7.3,8552,'en','The After','Eight strangers are thrown together by mysterious forces and must help each other survive in a violent world that defies explanation.','/y7WQYH1TRXUWehDCh8L7UH6VXGM.jpg','2014-02-06',60,'Released',NULL,'The After',347520,1.879,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36957,_binary '\0','/qSOMdbZ6AOdHR999HWwVAh6ALFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31456973',3.3,5013,'en','Alarum','Two married spies caught in the crosshairs of an international intelligence network will stop at nothing to obtain a critical asset. Joe and Lara are agents living off the grid whose quiet retreat at a winter resort is blown to shreds when members of the old guard suspect the two may have joined an elite team of rogue spies, known as Alarum.','/ckyYZf5cGTSOwF8LWIRqeThyh18.jpg','2025-01-16',95,'Released','One hell of a vacation.','Alarum',1249289,7.6291,5.574,'D0EnSmg7seM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36958,_binary '\0','/uOQgMhYyu7dkXdHoRkCqZIF32M6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31457736',7.2,1859,'ja','キングダム 大将軍の帰還','Depicts a continuation of the \"Battle of Mayang\", an all-out war against the neighboring country Zhao that Shin and Wang Ki fought in in the previous work \"Flame of Fate\".','/qZKKwXyZ92K0mIRpf2FbCkQa7oO.jpg','2024-07-12',146,'Released',NULL,'Kingdom: Return of the Great General',1241320,3.6182,6.813,'UO_xNbCyIDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36959,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31459006',7.2,1399,'ml','ദി സസ്‌പെക്ട ലിസ്റ്റ്','The Suspect List is a riveting corporate thriller delving deep into the clandestine world of a prestigious company. The narrative unfolds as the CEO, Vineeth takes charge to unravel the mystery behind alleged misconduct implicating seven senior officials from different departments. As the plot thickens, Vineeth emerges as an unwavering force determined to expose the culprit and decipher their motivations. Through a relentless pursuit of truth, he leads an investigation that peels back the layers of corporate dynamics, revealing a web of relationships, power plays, and hidden agendas.','/pegyyLrF7CuwrHf4W0wVUlw7RyU.jpg','2024-02-19',107,'Released',NULL,'The Suspect List',1250042,1.1489,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36960,_binary '\0','/eLRuEg6wcJf6aFgy8UBrnN8DmN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3146022',7.7,1268,'en','Be Natural: The Untold Story of Alice Guy-Blaché','The epic life story of Alice Guy-Blaché (1873–1968), a French screenwriter, director and producer, true pioneer of cinema, the first person who made a narrative fiction film; author of hundreds of movies, but banished from history books. Ignored and forgotten. At last remembered.','/o5fz4qNgI5nfDirf6UcX0SpAG6T.jpg','2018-12-07',103,'Released','She saw the future through the camera lens','Be Natural: The Untold Story of Alice Guy-Blaché',520270,2.6852,7.2,'bPUJRtrp_EE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36961,_binary '\0','/a9quMrUTdE1uCfQ6fLYS0RjJrGe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3146360',6.9,6117,'fr','Belle et Sébastien','Belle and Sebastian is set high in the snowy Alps during the Second World War. The resourceful Sebastian is a lonely boy who tames and befriends a giant, wild mountain dog, Belle – even though the villagers believe her to be ‘the beast’ that has been killing their sheep.','/fMVm4iKiu8M2AEgBNsnkIS71iwx.jpg','2013-12-18',104,'Released','Two great friends. One grand adventure.','Belle and Sebastian',204668,3.9007,6.9,'lsHJK0bgyRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36962,_binary '\0','/p1YoGMPGlTFh6VxSugBviSMhEgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31464940',6.3,2232,'te','Kaliyugam Pattanamlo','The story revolves around identical twins, Vijay and Sagar. While Vijay leads a normal life, Sagar exhibits troubling behavior, leading to his placement in a mental rehabilitation center. Years later, Sagar remains unchanged, while Vijay becomes an engineering student.','/52HrWjk6auzcDjJ0uPR0yYYvxxY.jpg','2024-03-29',145,'Released',NULL,'Kaliyugam Pattanamlo',1294414,0.658,0,'4qsw4BaJLSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36963,_binary '\0','/rrTKWLU0JBYKWSJd8abzXq3LjyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3147312',6.1,11518,'en','Desierto','A group of Mexican emigrants attempts to cross the Mexican-US border. What begins as a hopeful journey becomes a harrowing, bloody and primal fight for survival when a deranged, rifle-toting vigilante and his loyal Belgian Malinois dog chase the group of unarmed men and women through the treacherous borderland. In the harsh, unforgiving desert terrain, the odds are stacked firmly against them as they discover there’s nowhere to hide from the unrelenting, merciless killer.','/67Ue5or6ZPScqkagC3EJSOYuzyR.jpg','2015-04-12',88,'Released','A chase where only the strongest survive.','Desierto',258363,3.3544,6.165,'HlvgZfPUlqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36964,_binary '\0','/4TMkOnI6rCYxqD059aeeQSBv5mc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31474158',6.6,2055,'ja','名探偵コナン 100万ドルの五稜星（みちしるべ）','A message has arrived from Kid the Phantom Thief, that he will steal a Japanese sword belonging to wealthy Onoe Family in Hakodate, Hokkaido. Conan and Heiji Hattori, who happened to be in Hakodate, are on the case to capture Kid. Coincidentally the family lawyer of Onoe is found murdered in the warehouse district, apparently slaughtered by a Japanese sword. The suspect is an investor/arms dealer who is said to be after Onoe family’s hidden treasure. In the North among cherry blossoms, the exciting hunt for treasure begins!','/ctboIRYQHYJMge6M6fgcwrhREsj.jpg','2024-04-12',110,'Released','Missing samurai swords, an unsolved mystery from the Great Edo period, the battle for treasure begins...','Detective Conan: The Million-Dollar Pentagram',1209217,10.101,6.9,'53bmmVls3Fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36965,_binary '\0','/5hEhO1RbzUvY74Ulc4deHkUjuM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31474455',8.3,4531,'en','Bahumukham','Tanveer, an aspiring actor, moves to the city after leaving a detention center. He meets Disha, his therapist, for mandatory counseling but hides dark secrets, posing a threat.','/ilAhfkCnpYR5deJAlalOemWp7Gi.jpg','2024-04-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Versatile',1340209,0.4898,0,'BjoGMGD4ytI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36966,_binary '\0','/9Acx9CPQkjUSkthOPhVQvm9pCyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148268',6.2,2100,'bn','মিশর রহস্য','Al Mamun, an Egyptian business tycoon, asks his friend Kakababu to help him decode some hieroglyphic symbols that will help trace the will of his teacher, Mufti Mohammad.','/22NlvhCvIfIuoztBLIWjzwUSvts.jpg','2013-10-11',151,'Released',NULL,'The Egyptian Mystery',256457,1.2147,5.921,'HFfUfbJVz8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36967,_binary '\0','/ewy2aJDFtqMzCrDg0wsZ3G2MOpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148348',5.8,12043,'en','Let Us Prey','Rachel, a rookie cop, is about to begin her first night shift in a neglected police station in a Scottish, backwater town. The kind of place where the tide has gone out and stranded a motley bunch of the aimless, the forgotten, the bitter-and-twisted who all think that, really, they deserve to be somewhere else. They all think they\'re there by accident and that, with a little luck, life is going to get better. Wrong, on both counts. Six is about to arrive - and All Hell Will Break Loose!','/7X5VhHwDaSLkrDoifRbfvGZJxFP.jpg','2014-04-17',92,'Released','Darkness Shall Rise','Let Us Prey',276488,40.821,5.73,'J5Cskj8Asas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36968,_binary '\0','/1um3EJQlJoSiRI34MVIoG610OzR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148502',7.4,37065,'hi','तमाशा','Meeting while on vacation, Ved and Tara sense a connection but vow to keep their real identities a secret. Years later, their paths cross again.','/8Ktf15qGVFYQ6CdBtBgCDM96UMC.jpg','2015-11-27',139,'Released','Why Always The Same Story?','Tamasha',339274,1.6509,7,'o-e5eWVCzx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36969,_binary '\0','/y3PcQfhWQf7MTh2BApJ01cJsO6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148528',5.1,1923,'pt','Até Que a Sorte nos Separe 2','After all the trouble in the first film, Tino and Jane have more fun adventures. Still tasting bitter failure, they see a light at the end of the tunnel with uncle Olavinho’s unexpected inheritance. However, the will carries an unusual request: the rich uncle wants his ashes to be scattered throughout the Grand Canyon. The couple takes the opportunity of the trip to fulfill this wish and decides to go to Las Vegas and end up getting into comical situations. Big time spender Tino will fall into the greatest temptations and indulge in the casinos of the gambling city.','/DOmK1UXPulQWLj3xdArcHKGQ9C.jpg','2013-12-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Till Luck Do Us Part 2',228177,1.399,5.772,'9krX7Kwsz6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36970,_binary '\0','/heUNlGeZEN1uWKhgwX5SmZ6MqBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148576',6,1349,'ja','新宿スワン','Shiratori Tatsuhiko works as a scout for talent agency Burst in Kabukichō, Shinjuku\'s red light district, recruiting young girls for the adult entertainment industry. In a business where money means everything, Tatsuhiko finds himself in a constant struggle between rival scouts and the Yakuza.','/8vaygIvgXTq5Ffv0LvpB8QFYfks.jpg','2015-05-30',139,'Released',NULL,'Shinjuku Swan',262650,2.1744,5.5,'PEMyQN6nKqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36971,_binary '\0','/sPU9KWoPYt9z8ZbI6iLlF6Xvsje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148834',6.2,8137,'en','The House of Magic','Thunder, an abandoned young cat seeking shelter from a storm, stumbles into the strangest house imaginable, owned by an old magician and inhabited by a dazzling array of automatons and gizmos. Not everyone welcomes the new addition to the troupe as Jack Rabbit and Maggie Mouse plot to evict Thunder. The situation gets worse when the magician lands in hospital and his scheming nephew sees his chance to cash in by selling the mansion. Our young hero is determined to earn his place and so he enlists the help of some wacky magician\'s assistants to protect his magical new home.','/3R13g2XgblynIrQGF8geFZJPNvR.jpg','2013-12-24',85,'Released','One lost little cat. One magical adventure.','The House of Magic',202575,7.3291,6.3,'Z6VKG3lZEIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36972,_binary '\0','/9kWrpH6ay2aSMnbObsWFkWZM2KG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3148952',7.3,1783,'de','Der Kreis','A young teacher in Zurich in the 1950s falls in love with a transvestite star but is torn between his bourgeois existence and his commitment to homosexuality. He joins a gay organization that is eventually seen as the pioneer of gay emancipation in Europe.','/dhnq72LZG1pXbHEGwHVvWDpleNc.jpg','2014-09-18',102,'Released',NULL,'The Circle',255890,1.39,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36973,_binary '\0','/jHlodFQ7WcmVWYi6HAAc2Ox9rPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3149038',7.1,31448,'en','X+Y','Struggling to connect with those around him, a teenage math prodigy trains for the International Mathematical Olympiad, where a budding romance with a fellow contestant breaks through his emotional walls and teaches him that love cannot be calculated.','/jYkfSWb9rlTTzvLclCuJwm48kbl.jpg','2015-03-13',111,'Released','Is there a formula for love?','X+Y',278236,3.5844,6.7,'2XtfvY0rMfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36974,_binary '\0','/ii6Fy0Fp3FpbDwxPDehoNVAuGZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31493275',3.9,2278,'te','మార్కెట్ మహాలక్ష్మి','A young man pursues a relationship with an independent street vendor. Despite their differences, he tries various ways to convince her to marry him.','/o4hGFXlNxig8vgM3G3mbggwPM33.jpg','2024-03-28',133,'Released',NULL,'Market Mahalakshmi',1259884,0.6697,0,'syHvzsTnolg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36975,_binary '\0','/vMxOmgmBGegjVObjlb8ugsjGgkD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31495504',6.5,16909,'de','Der Tiger','A German Tiger tank crew is sent on a dangerous mission to rescue the missing officer Paul von Hardenburg from a top-secret bunker behind enemy lines. As they make their way through the lethal no-man\'s land, they must confront not only the enemy, but also their own fears and inner demons. Fueled by the Wehrmacht\'s methamphetamine, their mission increasingly becomes a journey into the heart of darkness.','/65Jr1JAgWlu9em8zHhAfrNJJQBt.jpg','2025-09-18',117,'Released',NULL,'The Tank',1252037,12.7701,7.1,'4uZWlKGRZis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36976,_binary '\0','/etWCiglAhvJSKW0l7epoZKtkJrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3149900',4.8,1749,'en','The Hunted','Chasing their dream of landing their own hunting show, Jake and Stevie head to the dense, secluded mountains of West Virginia. Equipped with only their bow and camera, they have just three days to kill a monster buck big enough to grab the attention of the network...and they\'ve found him. But the sun has set, and they realize they\'re not alone.','/l34Zwkl914ZmnrZ4Mi6wwlRYZvZ.jpg','2014-09-09',88,'Released','Be Careful What You Hunt','The Hunted',292108,1.2072,5.1,'4CLDt5DvnOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36977,_binary '\0','/9AbL76J8pCKNhyNzdEg8e2SQ4LJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31499750',6.2,8200,'en','Lowlifes','The survival instincts of a road-tripping family are put to the test when they have no other choice but to stay the night at a remote homestead.','/vxTyYoIRgutvzMpB97XAC8FhJiH.jpg','2024-04-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Lowlifes',1272890,3.4784,6.292,'BM-wQapkXrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36978,_binary '\0','/3ei7CUfR3KGN91Ovgs2AUBKCTfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3150966',5.4,2760,'en','Rise of the Footsoldier: Part II','On 6 December 1995, three Essex gang members were brutally murdered in cold blood. In early 1997, the perpetrator has yet to be brought to justice. An associate of the men, still mourning the loss of his friends, is convinced that it’s only a matter of time before he’s next.','/lWF5wNTHGzjpKitS4vZ5DxYAm9B.jpg','2015-12-12',111,'Released','Soldier Enforcer Survivor','Rise of the Footsoldier: Part II',373321,2.6005,5.4,'ZudQc8bs2ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36979,_binary '\0','/4m8yq8vEVGVcmOxO39j1Yz8ry1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31510396',7.5,3060,'en','The Bloody Hundredth','Meet the real-life airmen who inspired Masters of the Air as they share the harrowing and transformative events of the 100th Bomb Group.','/5GnpAw5BaQBNqYd4wE1IptYEVKd.jpg','2024-03-14',63,'Released','The true story of the men who inspired Masters of the Air.','The Bloody Hundredth',1251636,7.4629,7.2,'ZkYOtyp3hKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36980,_binary '\0','/da1mXvCrQrFcw6BxovCavBFbIvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31511689',4.9,11704,'en','Vicious','When Polly receives a mysterious box, it comes with one rule: place inside something she needs, something she hates, and something she loves. If she doesn’t obey, it will consume everything—and everyone—she’s ever known.','/shKGDGrwqmc9x2aTJcQszoXinq0.jpg','2025-08-06',98,'Released','Give it something you hate, something you need, something you love.','Vicious',1251717,5.1828,6,'tSx8ubSBFN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36981,_binary '\0','/vfkzNcVzTRCq3C2jYIZtIjSdwf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31513578',6.3,2140,'th','ธี่หยด 2','Three years after his sister\'s death, Yak relentlessly searches for the dark spirit that killed her in hopes of seeking revenge.','/A0fHnpVX8vYQCmvETllWJQ30Mi6.jpg','2024-10-10',112,'Released','The haunted, calling voices will be utterly terrifying.','Death Whisperer 2',1247019,6.7984,7,'ZCEuUcE9oZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36982,_binary '\0','/4mKczHAW4XPDXGk7V5k7Ui3dgUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31514146',8.3,64080,'en','I Swear','Diagnosed with Tourette Syndrome at 15, John Davidson navigates his way against the odds through troubled teenage years and into adulthood, finding inspiration in the kindness of others to discover his true purpose in life.','/vUwyhNWBKkSwK8ELvEeBRwV724h.jpg','2025-09-22',121,'Released','I blink. I twitch. I jump. I click. I whistle. I shout.','I Swear',1317149,16.8592,8.3,'10ynpduiRpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36983,_binary '\0','/zldmp4sCWa8A54aQKOjOiidLJud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31514262',6.2,17829,'hi','वाइल्ड वाइल्ड पंजाब','Four friends road-trip across Punjab to help one of them get over an ex-girlfriend, but are quickly caught in a fiasco like no other.','/5EpIjplAtUiFyjR6C2gYN6xPiCP.jpg','2024-07-10',111,'Released','The whackiest break-up trip ever','Wild Wild Punjab',1252455,1.5096,6.5,'CIrK-7VDkbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36984,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3151738',5.6,1863,'hu','Megdönteni Hajnal Tímeát','Dani was always the good boy at school and is about to get married. He bumps into Tímea Hajnal, who is now a top model but is trying to get over a humiliating break-up. After a few glasses of wine, they fall into each other’s arms, which wouldn’t be so bad on the face of it, but there’s a tiny problem: Bögöcs, the bad boy of the class, has been recording everything on his mobile phone, and he’s thinking of using it to finally be able to fulfil his teenage dream - to sleep with Tímea. He threatens to show the video to Dani’s fiancée if he doesn’t take steps to set things up for him with Tímea. The pressure very quickly starts to have consequences for Dani’s relationship with his bride-to-be, as she starts to nag him chronically. The wedding is fast approaching, and Dani has to do something…','/ynpa0woalSB4uuGDrQ7vUpoPPNU.jpg','2014-02-13',93,'Released',NULL,'What Ever Happened to Timi',258135,0.9998,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36985,_binary '\0','/s1ge9SG2zfJdMeZ69VMEbxeKuAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31519456',6,13257,'en','La Dolce Villa','When his daughter decides to buy a crumbling Tuscan villa, Eric rushes to Italy to talk her out of it — and instead finds beauty, romance and new purpose.','/sEma5RN8aZ5Yu2Dkefyn5ULdlc1.jpg','2025-02-12',99,'Released','He went to rescue his daughter, but Italy had other plans.','La Dolce Villa',1252377,5.0728,6.336,'zBFSEbZNvhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36986,_binary '\0','/mKYhqETZav92rLBZxk8VE1DyHBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3152130',3.9,1672,'sv','Sune på bilsemester','Sune and his family discovers an old painting that could be worth a fortune. There\'s only one problem, it lacks a signature. Follow the Anderssons in a wacky roadtrip through Europe, filled with crazy fun.','/4DxZkNfmXhnN1s49LhthusdkD4E.jpg','2013-12-25',95,'Released',NULL,'The Anderssons Hit the Road',264357,1.2852,4.4,'iCEUCQIFCYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36987,_binary '\0','/sv3clpwOSSZO1c8i9uX4zig6Lzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31522415',6,26545,'hi','सिकंदर का मुकद्दर','After an unsolved diamond heist, a hard-nosed cop’s pursuit of his key suspect turns into obsession, until they finally face each other — and the truth.','/eWUh4rgxtgypgnOa6uGMnUt01ux.jpg','2024-11-29',143,'Released',NULL,'Sikandar Ka Muqaddar',1252470,1.7665,5.7,'sqoBgJiLQck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36988,_binary '\0','/2A2Ckh2RqPhu4KSexCga0ARqJxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31523149',5.6,1614,'vi','Một Bông Hoa Mong manh','Thach Thao is a beautiful girl with an angelic beautiful voice, and the first time she sang on stage at Itango Club, Thao immediately caught the eye of a music producer named Son. Then, she was invited to cooperate in filming a music video called \"A Fragile Flower\". After the music video was released, Thach Thao became a renowned singer. She is beautiful, talented, so many men love her. Then, which man will Thao\'s heart belong to? And what is the dangerous disease that she encountered?','/egR3nykprnHV4etxNFgHvJS3x9b.jpg','2024-03-29',96,'Released','Your Heart\'s Song, Your Life\'s Journey','A Fragile Flower',1252569,1.1569,7,'OhGTIJtS46U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36989,_binary '\0','/sJjuXNHNT7PfzcgkqM3oSIkVOXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3152592',5.6,33683,'en','Scoob!','In Scooby-Doo’s greatest adventure yet, see the never-before told story of how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and how they joined forces with young detectives Fred, Velma, and Daphne to form the famous Mystery Inc. Now, with hundreds of cases solved, Scooby and the gang face their biggest, toughest mystery ever: an evil plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to stop this global “dogpocalypse,” the gang discovers that Scooby has a secret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone ever imagined.','/jHo2M1OiH9Re33jYtUQdfzPeUkx.jpg','2020-07-08',94,'Released','Mystery loves company.','Scoob!',385103,9.5405,6.975,'GzlEnS7MmUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36990,_binary '\0','/ppueqApDDVU6xuDEoCyZ6FEPhp9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3152602',6.7,3183,'it','Il giovane favoloso','In 19th-century Italy, Giacomo Leopardi channels his debilitating illness and isolation into poetry.','/4Lv3SME2Dz8WNOrP1xqFXCL9aJI.jpg','2014-10-16',137,'Released',NULL,'Leopardi',283704,1.5722,6.807,'IUzVfdub6Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36991,_binary '\0','/9O6pLFE630h7IxslegYR9CV64aE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3152624',6.2,147817,'en','Trainwreck','Ever since her father drilled into her head that monogamy isn\'t realistic, magazine writer Amy has made promiscuity her credo. As much as she enjoys an uninhibited life free of commitment, Amy is really in a rut. While writing a profile about charming and successful sports doctor Aaron Conners, she finds herself actually falling in love for the first time -- and what\'s more, Aaron seems to really like her too. Amy starts to wonder if it\'s time to clean up her act and face her fears.','/wrY629UTCUAKLJ4CxQXz6DCE7pr.jpg','2015-07-17',125,'Released','We all know one.','Trainwreck',271718,9.182,5.8,'YgkciW7ip4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36992,_binary '\0','/4D7vkNkdDnAxYkmvpRaSO9diqhq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31529147',4.6,6909,'te','ఒడేల 2','A savior, Odela Mallanna Swamy, protects a village from evil forces.','/xG5SdRKXjWupcwXj2JJLOSX0PiS.jpg','2025-04-17',150,'Released',NULL,'Odela 2',1257693,1.3774,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36993,_binary '\0','/aLFgodLsNUeFhXPywAXevew7Xp7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3153582',5.6,3341,'en','Listening','For years, we have tried to harness the power of the human mind… and failed. Now, one breakthrough will change everything. Beyond technology. Beyond humanity. Beyond control. David, Ryan, and Jordan hope the telepathy invention will solve all their problems, but the bleeding-edge technology opens a Pandora’s box of new dangers, as the team discovers that when they open their minds, there is nowhere to hide their thoughts.','/yrmNdnf0njvaH5TrX8wuHJdtIis.jpg','2015-09-11',100,'Released','Hide your thoughts.','Listening',331592,1.3509,5.7,'wSY5jFSOl8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36994,_binary '\0','/cri20wZDTl1X5QpxlWCSJ4HSpTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3153634',8.2,12504,'ko','소원','After 8-year-old So-won narrowly survives a brutal sexual assault, her family labors to help her heal while coping with their own rage and grief.','/x9yjkm9gIz5qI5fJMUTfBnWiB2o.jpg','2013-10-02',122,'Released','We won\'t let her shed tears again.','Hope',255709,10.535,8.401,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36995,_binary '\0','/eyqQc3XeGYIpJa1SSkmRg6zXw3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3154310',5.9,6703,'en','Walt Before Mickey','Based on the book \"Walt Before Mickey\" covers the early years of Walt Disney\'s career. The legendary Walt Disney had a tumultuous childhood, yet he was determined to overcome obstacles in his path, before the creation of his first iconic character: Mickey Mouse.','/o1JYnewI5WTDAUAAlZdgnAzDdPs.jpg','2015-08-05',107,'Released','The true story of a boy whose dreams built a kingdom','Walt Before Mickey',278247,2.1547,6.4,'MaOZiu-hnTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36996,_binary '\0','/3MlOHhso0ui9ww2JQ6mQ6PGLk3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155242',5.8,4283,'en','Partisan','On the edge of a crumbling city, 11-year-old Alexander lives in a sequestered commune alongside other children, their mothers, and charismatic leader, Gregori. Gregori teaches the children how to raise livestock, grow vegetables, work as a community - and how to kill. With the birth of a new baby brother weighing on his mind, Alexander begins to question Gregori’s overpowering influence on the children and their training to become assassins. Threatened by his increasing unwillingness to fall in line, Gregori’s behavior turns erratic and adversarial toward the child he once considered a son. With the two set dangerously at odds and the commune’s way of life disintegrating, the residents fear a violent resolution is at hand.','/4x7gzun1Llfgt9AtMj9Jx8druIF.jpg','2015-04-29',98,'Released','Protect the ones you love','Partisan',306482,1.4309,6.1,'sutAdO2fNBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36997,_binary '\0','/6oxnVw91yzv9fYwGaz941Mwlwbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155298',6.4,73531,'en','Luther: The Fallen Sun','A gruesome serial killer is terrorizing London while brilliant but disgraced detective John Luther sits behind bars. Haunted by his failure to capture the cyber psychopath who now taunts him, Luther decides to break out of prison to finish the job by any means necessary.','/tvX2JltXjmpHLQ7BBijyVc9STv4.jpg','2023-02-24',129,'Released',NULL,'Luther: The Fallen Sun',722149,10.1699,6.6,'EGK5qtXuc1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36998,_binary '\0','/aRQWgjhP0ECCgBgZJHIet8lVChD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155328',6.2,10544,'en','Win It All','A gambling addict faces a conflict when entrusted with keeping a bunch of money that isn\'t his.','/aEc69JY0azD9PwYtwS2RFwoyFOT.jpg','2017-03-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Win It All',397442,2.59,5.7,'ScKPEIg62eI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(36999,_binary '\0','/ec1gKII0QQK7FT7bdiJC49i3zz8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155342',6.5,5544,'en','All Together Now','An optimistic, talented teen clings to a huge secret: she\'s homeless and living on a school bus. When tragedy strikes, can she learn to accept a helping hand?','/4QIpIHoYdlt9ekD6mSIxe0FylpR.jpg','2020-08-28',92,'Released','When you\'re about to lose everything, a little hope can go a long way.','All Together Now',615466,2.3234,6.7,'2-B0HD1jcyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37000,_binary '\0','/pSjmZ1QczwP76gCtxaA3le0MyJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155604',7.2,6319,'ru','Географ глобус пропил','Victor Sluzhkin signs on as a teacher of geography in a secondary school in his native Perm (in the Urals) and gets lost in a haze of hard vodka, desperate love for a nymphet-like student and the stress of educating teenagers. Geographer, as the students immediately dub Sluzhkin, attempts to escape from the grueling, dull, stultifying reality of Russia\'s provincial life in a rafting tour to the Urals. Accompanied by wild, adventure-seeking adolescents, faced with the numerous grim surprises of the nature, Geographer is poised to find himself and his own truth.','/iyWyVgDHYkjejwAQQrUCQXuZYjO.jpg','2013-07-26',120,'Released',NULL,'The Geographer Drank His Globe Away',225235,1.8223,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37001,_binary '\0','/qgEl6jnzVtpwU6BtTm5DNlCiGZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155654',6.3,2674,'ko','숨바꼭질','Sung-soo has everything a man could want: a beautiful wife and children, a comfortable home and luxury car, and plenty of money in the bank. When he learns that his estranged brother, Sung-chul, has gone missing, haunting memories of their troubled past urge him to visit his brother’s apartment in search of answers.','/z11Dd1r8BQhCLhLfRh1x5QuzMRw.jpg','2013-08-14',107,'Released','Stop peeping at me.','Hide and Seek',214209,1.906,6.6,'88sL5w_R61o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37002,_binary '\0','/zQKBXCU3FMxkUDXzFYy1cqXL1wM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31556612',7.6,11560,'en','We Will Dance Again','A music festival symbolizing peace, freedom, and eternal love transforms into a horrifying nightmare of terror. Survivors, marked by death and trauma, reconstruct the event through their perspectives, embodying the lost innocence and beauty of youth, forever scarred by the tragic events that unfolded. This is a horrifying glimpse through the eyes of the individuals who endured the brutal October 7th onslaught at the Nova Music Festival.','/A80B9mX3mDtHray9DraXteQAqgU.jpg','2024-08-23',91,'Released','Surviving October 7th.','We Will Dance Again',1254258,1.5822,7.3,'NiEZ24ODaXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37003,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155720',4.2,2291,'en','There\'s No Such Thing as Vampires','A group of teenagers encounter vampires in a remote outpost.','/u0bD8SKpsPNaGLWkbU6uaj0jiip.jpg','2020-08-28',81,'Released','Something to Sink Your Teeth Into.','There\'s No Such Thing as Vampires',518800,1.946,3.3,'zuCx3e0QfjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37004,_binary '\0','/6xKruvPxzeMNLVph1TFctGSDuGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3155734',2.3,4228,'en','Dark Moon Rising','A group of shape-shifting werewolves descend upon a small town in search of a girl who is re-born once every 2000 years. She holds the key to their survival and all will die who stand in their way.','/x8KdYKUqA13kwQrkUoNB4ijKbZM.jpg','2015-08-04',85,'Released','Pray for the Sunrise','Dark Moon Rising',352988,1.2648,3.1,'B4ljhXFBV4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37005,_binary '\0','/vymiAnbaDBXkwHiDMqDqmTgp5Zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31565654',5.3,1800,'ar','شهر زي العسل','Two newlyweds on their honeymoon discover that they are different in almost every way — but can these opposites attract?','/hexGT0QCxYpp1e35GStVzwgzmuW.jpg','2024-04-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoonish',1257750,3.1695,6.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37006,_binary '\0','/cVqQdzqo0ymSFJqU87bIiHV8bA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31567422',5.9,16523,'en','Night Always Comes','Facing eviction in a city her family can no longer afford, a woman plunges into a desperate and increasingly dangerous all-night search to raise $25,000.','/1jDo1nG7rtjaaQGpr6e73x9i9Xp.jpg','2025-08-15',108,'Released','$25,000. 1 night. No other options.','Night Always Comes',1254624,7.7403,6.1,'Gd44vTsTUhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.0