ience the pulsating energy and excitement of \"\'D-DAY\' THE FINAL\" on screen, everything from the exquisite sounds traversing the boundary between \"21st Century Pop Icon\" BTS member SUGA and solo artist Agust D, electrifying performance, explosive energy, to special duet stages featuring fellow BTS members RM, Jimin, and Jung Kook.','/A4IzXiX0LjIn3BQHRCcePXzaE4M.jpg','2024-04-10',84,'Released',NULL,'SUGA | Agust D TOUR \'D-DAY\' THE MOVIE',1254724,1.3998,6.8,'4mtUOuK7TOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37011,_binary '\0','/5AsIFZ2AJC7JcGpq40aRPuRuaRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31589922',5.1,1257,'tl','Rita','Rita, who finds herself alone when husband Ariel works abroad. They both find solace and sexual satisfaction in other people. When Ariel comes back, they both act like nothing happened. But will this keep their marriage from falling apart?','/pXENxAzOBrTSDJGxDcUnlNTNmWr.jpg','2024-03-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Rita',1241752,51.1142,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37012,_binary '\0','/q4sUaE27mE07aGVlM2u9l0TgN4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31592660',5.8,1851,'id','Sumala','An evil spirit seeking vengeance returns to plague the town that wronged her sister. Based on a chilling urban legend.','/cOBX9x98TUSJFM6gfY7eDjZwIuh.jpg','2024-09-26',113,'Released',NULL,'Sumala',1260594,3.8682,7.2,'aMaMeKHH6iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37013,_binary '\0','/pzXld2twRCjHh2cgVs7O9ZYVEhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3159564',7.5,6363,'tr','Benim Dünyam','At 2 Ela lost her ability of seeing and hearing because of a severe illness. And then she became a total disappointment of her family due to her untamed behaviors. But everything changed after an unorthodox teacher stepped into their lives to educate Ela while healing himself.','/zzQsIu4ydRMIIbd38VNkPmGEOdg.jpg','2013-10-25',100,'Released',NULL,'My World',236317,1.8101,7.5,'-zxlCHXONDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37014,_binary '\0','/qq9LLjycYRL20hWjLtnvksEAjum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3159708',4.3,7756,'hi','Welcome Back','A pair of reformed gangsters try to find a husband for their newly discovered sister, but complications arise due to mistaken identities.','/xnRIT3ggVcJxGWylKw85n6pteLp.jpg','2015-09-04',153,'Released',NULL,'Welcome Back',357563,1.6758,4.93,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37015,_binary '\0','/sTYseHnxMFFxzPjU0nsgouU8VJX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3159812',7.2,1995,'en','Monster High: 13 Wishes','It’s a new school year at Monster High, and the little sister of Clawdeen Wolf, Howleen, is determined to be more fangtastic than ever. Her dream of popularity turns out to be easier than anyone imagined when she stumbles upon a genie named Gigi Grant who grants her not 3, but 13 Wishes! But the ghouls quickly learn to be s-careful what you wish for because each wish comes with a dark side, and soon the student disem-body of Monster High is turned upside-down! Join Frankie Stein, Clawdeen Wolf, Draculaura and the rest of their creeperiffic ghoulfriends as they journey deep inside the magic lantern to save the very soul of Monster High… while flashing their killer style every step of the way!','/eEZJMmzDNUNKoJw6jfmGVWeqqhJ.jpg','2013-10-08',73,'Released','Be scare-ful what you wish for','Monster High: 13 Wishes',212470,4.7091,7.8,'WepVzzdY2XQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37016,_binary '\0','/sZuJ62yoHP14JY0ri219vnX1GTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31598703',6.8,11994,'hi','तन्वी द ग्रेट','Autistic young Tanvi Raina learns of her deceased Indian Army father\'s dream to salute the flag at Siachen Glacier. Despite barriers facing those neurodivergent in military service, she resolves to complete his mission.','/jytZfJtjJnw7Yn2zW52wcbPYVXQ.jpg','2025-07-17',160,'Released','Different...but no less','Tanvi the Great',1282557,1.465,6.2,'7dVdYE6wWQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37017,_