Sik (Sung Dong-Il) and Flight Attendant Ok-Soon (Chae Soo-Bin).','/68jNkFi61MQjrJEqj2up5wZ4w5R.jpg','2024-06-21',100,'Released','One passenger with a different destination.','Hijack 1971',1147710,6.7668,6.8,'UxyutkXQnvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37021,_binary '\0','/pBx0E5y6E59d2u5u6x60mDVfHJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3162938',7.7,7530,'en','The True Cost','Film from Andrew Morgan. The True Cost is a documentary film exploring the impact of fashion on people and the planet.','/x7oDFes0HCWAYAwlEA5b3TCqX9S.jpg','2015-05-29',92,'Released','Who Pays the Price for Our Clothing?','The True Cost',339065,1.7803,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37022,_binary '\0','/yTz0uICWvbcBLAR3D0PUXDjSYv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31629757',6.6,1556,'en','Slay','After a booking mistake, four drag queens find themselves performing for a mostly unwelcoming crowd, but when vampires attack, the crowd looks to the queens to save the day.','/r8yevwmnISUYA9OiIjbjZsVtLbN.jpg','2024-03-22',98,'Released','These queens hit the stage, and slay all night.','Slay',1258745,1.1983,5.9,'WY7AwXW4RbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37023,_binary '\0','/a91PiW94vysNPsprJr9YgvZpUHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3163224',3.9,1235,'en','The Carrier','England has been overrun by a pandemic with no apparent cure. As the infection continues to spread, safety - for a lucky few - looms in the form of a damaged 747 set to seek solace abroad. It\'s only once the plane is airborne that the survivors discover the infection made it onto the flight with them.','/w3JG5HtOaF2p8mlBHkTgGWfaXyQ.jpg','2015-07-15',90,'Released',NULL,'The Carrier',378088,1.2177,3.9,'Ev0YMwAe1S8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37024,_binary '\0','/1tWKLKikvbjXSFkPFI2qblEi4iE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3163304',7,2366,'he','מיתה טובה','A group of friends at a Jerusalem retirement home build a machine for self-euthanasia in order to help their terminally ill friend. When rumors of the machine begin to spread, more and more people ask for their help, and the friends are faced with an emotional dilemma','/tVMP8ubbNRCJlw8QEUqNEpG1h2o.jpg','2014-09-03',90,'Released',NULL,'The Farewell Party',287483,1.1934,6.6,'jEGFO_4czXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37025,_binary '\0','/BrVFbzSTx9s8GWDmmBgkWmaYcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3163336',5.9,3636,'en','Uncle Nick','A drunk uncle attempts to score with his flirtatious step-niece on Christmas Eve.','/7cCOVw563woaCw0fUmC7mRGchmx.jpg','2015-12-04',93,'Released','Nothing ruins Christmas like family.','Uncle Nick',367732,2.1807,5.8,'G445k45KGr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37026,_binary '\0','/2nKAQpPZsjhYwT1qOYarpggOVXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31639439',6.9,3184,'ml','ഭരതനാട്യം','A man makes a startling discovery following his father\'s sudden hospitalization and attempts to prevent his family\'s secret from reaching the local townsfolk.','/btudnkSd6VsQQZ4r6ldp7jRhTwf.jpg','2024-08-30',121,'Released',NULL,'Bharathanatyam',1321820,1.094,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37027,_binary '\0','/cgmtlExKZsy3vHQfNS6jeBC7bKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3164198',6.3,1335,'en','Ballet 422','The film shadows Justin Peck, wunderkind choreographer of the New York City Ballet, as he undertakes the Herculean task of creating the company’s 422nd original piece. Following the creative process from its embryonic stages to its highly anticipated premiere, BALLET 422 is a powerful celebration of the skill and endurance of New York’s most talented dancers—as well as those who remain hidden in the wings.','/tI9qj9OrcTzjdQiwtqKmp5ryeKY.jpg','2014-04-19',75,'Released',NULL,'Ballet 422',261857,1.3227,6.4,'2f-AvMve1NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37028,_binary '\0','/wldeDiuEBhYi1Q4FjSHzAQ3yS80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3164256',5.5,13384,'en','Rock the Kasbah','A washed-up music producer finds one last shot at redemption with a golden-voiced young girl in Afghanistan. However, when jealousy gets the better of a disgruntled ex-boyfriend, he decides to oppose the young star with talent of his own.','/jGNOsJjpsJ4yWe3InuiXgYk8VuW.jpg','2015-10-22',100,'Released','Opportunity rocks where you least expect it.','Rock the Kasbah',253414,3.5359,5.4,'4PKOefvGpNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37029,_binary '\0','/8aQYGyXKCohzoTjjxWzANPV2VBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31645789',3.3,1219,'en','The Hangman','Troubled father Leon takes son camping in Appalachia. Local cult summons evil Hangman demon. Son goes missing. Leon must confront cult, monster to find him amid rising body count.','/rij9Eh4RVXyPet8A1BNU8pDvtmu.jpg','2024-05-30',98,'Released','Give the devil his due.','The Hangman',1257586,2.8562,5.8,'eahg749ugzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37030,_binary '\0','/mLjOL0xdIEj0mDrY26gwv6Mbohm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31646879',7.1,1565,'te','తెప్ప సముద్రం','Set in Theppa Samudram village, Vijay, An auto driver, is head over heels for crime reporter Indu. SI Ganesh is responsible for handling cases of missing school girls. Will they be able to find the missing girls and uncover the culprit behind their disappearance?','/mE45LoTOnKQ3wOEQdMJVq9Aa8Hm.jpg','2024-04-19',133,'Released',NULL,'Theppa Samudram',1281743,0.9351,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37031,_binary '\0','/mrSxv3NgqVQfbWXjMN0igI3Uca8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31648020',7.6,3709,'cn','破·地獄','Despite the pandemic sending most industries into recession, debt-ridden wedding planner Dominic (Dayo WONG) gets a miraculous chance to turn things around when a funeral planner retires and passes the baton to him. His creative gimmicks for funerals help his business find unexpected success, but Dominic’s biggest obstacle is winning the approval of respected and sternly traditional Taoist priest, Master Man (Michael HUI). After some unordinary funerals, Dominic gradually understands Master Man’s code of ethics and the meaning behind each farewell.','/9Ret10DkYVs45Ooa8yvU23x3L5i.jpg','2024-11-09',126,'Released',NULL,'The Last Dance',1226141,3.2505,7.9,'06k-8byklbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37032,_binary '\0','/jwpuuVDAzLbtqm3tgQeQcbZyUtU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3165178',5.4,1508,'de','Halbe Brüder','Julian, Yasin and Addi learn from the executor of their deceased mother\'s will that the three men, who had previously been complete strangers, are brothers. The news hits like a bomb. A German family man with a penchant for tricks, a spoiled, ambitious Turk and a rapping African – the three siblings immediately hate each other and it would all be nice if their paths were to separate again soon.','/27PaaXyZ87pl3xOhGTCei6gzjIe.jpg','2015-04-09',117,'Released',NULL,'Half Brothers',328039,2.0627,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37033,_binary '\0','/z2JC9jdfoiJc9b7ppg9wnQX2Y1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3165608',1.6,18030,'en','Justin Bieber\'s Believe','A backstage and on-stage look at Justin Bieber during his rise to super stardom.','/WxwzHNSumoYLP15QppvomGJJYr.jpg','2013-12-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Justin Bieber\'s Believe',229296,3.8656,6.873,'c7yWNSHCpeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37034,_binary '\0','/40ZRzvdkuCPNCSbdcImc5o4JGdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3165612',6.5,52161,'en','Sleeping with Other People','Can two serial cheaters get a second chance at love? After a one-night stand in college, New Yorkers Lainey and Jake meet by chance twelve years later and discover they each have the same problem: because of their monogamy-challenged ways, neither can maintain a relationship. Determined to stay friends despite their mutual attraction, they make a pact to keep it platonic, a deal that proves easier said than done.','/thYomS3wTYDTRZaM98ADMfBiDxm.jpg','2015-06-26',100,'Released','A romantic comedy with commitment issues.','Sleeping with Other People',288036,5.2107,6.274,'RG3Q2ua5izw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37035,_binary '\0','/adTfzw4tPdrPdLd8idOsepcP8mP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3165630',5.2,5689,'en','The Benefactor','A newly married couple are forced to navigate the all-consuming interest of a powerful, mysterious, and possessive philanthropist.','/uL0fCJuT0ERaKVM8ftduLlhObaM.jpg','2015-12-23',90,'Released','His help comes at a price.','The Benefactor',328901,2.7682,4.9,'DcBhkJfDNf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37036,_binary '\0','/gmCqVEvEE32fqBw8M1TZdpxtxOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3165632',3.3,1988,'en','5th Passenger','Set in the aftermath of an oppressive class war, a pregnant officer aboard an escape pod must struggle to survive with her remaining crew when a mysterious and vicious life form attacks, determined to become the dominant species.','/f8hfZCD2fSsz6LE6FA5uk5mMv11.jpg','2018-05-30',89,'Released','Question your humanity','5th Passenger',352548,2.5594,4.246,'vEZGWQSApak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37037,_binary '\0','/swcQcBI1ZBBvYvbq7wf4QZ0knM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3166500',5.5,2418,'no','De nærmeste','When Charlotte, 27, meets her brother Henrik, 35, for the first time as an adult, it becomes an encounter without boundaries, between two people who don\'t know what a normal family is. How does sibling love manifest itself if you have never experienced it before? Homesick is an unusual family drama about seeking a family, and breaking every rule to be one.','/cuO7fTeecF5ngAVOvGmKFKd3W7H.jpg','2015-03-27',106,'Released',NULL,'Homesick',308403,5.2423,5.2,'WoX3ozn_5n0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37038,_binary '\0','/dqRwVrZeRKzRQZI5keNilDpDklS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3168230',6.8,70577,'en','Mr. Holmes','In 1947, long-retired and near the end of his life, Sherlock Holmes grapples with an unreliable memory and must rely on his housekeeper\'s son as he revisits the still-unsolved case that led to his retirement.','/iNnHMoj2oldH7O9uL08iGhfHzh.jpg','2015-06-19',104,'Released','The man behind the myth','Mr. Holmes',280996,10.3254,6.5,'KSsf17Exa4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37039,_binary '\0','/xKEOBTIAG4eIOJi33jo9NA8KdAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3168808',7.3,1324,'en','A Murder in the Park','Documentary filmmakers assert that Anthony Porter - a former death-row inmate who was spared the death penalty thanks to the efforts of a college journalism program - was actually guilty, and an innocent man was sent to prison.','/g0wME5TyTTdvUXtp2Qsp4kF7XCC.jpg','2015-06-26',91,'Released',NULL,'A Murder in the Park',343880,1.1872,7.2,'jMa6cxG2yDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37040,_binary '\0','/c15Fg4jvclF5VjxCi1mtjUg4a6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31688586',7.3,12185,'fr','Nouvelle Vague','After writing for Cahiers du cinéma, young Godard decides making films is the best film criticism. He gets Beauregard to fund a low-budget feature, creating a treatment with Truffaut about a gangster couple.','/AfE7DZ0DPgme6I58dlYp1Bo9xeN.jpg','2025-10-08',106,'Released','Everyone loves the new wave.','Nouvelle Vague',1254808,6.5161,7.2,'795BXtBR2u4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37041,_binary '\0','/847yaUgwPVZT7NuGYb8qilxD3Pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3169000',5.9,2107,'en','Hats Off to Christmas!','Mia, the loyal and hard-working manager of a quaint neighborhood Christmas hat shop, is blindsided when her boss asks her to train his son Nick for a vacant upper-management position that Mia had her eyes set on.','/6M12HqmbA9yruOOQjJ9jZ7X1GrT.jpg','2013-12-15',83,'Released',NULL,'Hats Off to Christmas!',244027,2.251,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37042,_binary '\0','/A0FeRPihXjMDN9bdoKsOzIC7zl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31691389',6.8,3358,'fr','Une langue universelle','Winter. Somewhere between Tehran and Winnipeg. Negin and Nazgol find a sum of money frozen deep within the sidewalk ice and try to find a way to get it out. Massoud leads a group of befuddled tourists upon an increasingly-strange walking tour of Winnipeg historic sites. Matthew leaves his job at the Québec government and embarks upon a mysterious journey to visit his estranged mother.','/wS5pdSFLjzFzBCwa8kTE368jb4U.jpg','2024-09-20',89,'Released','This film longs to hold you.','Universal Language',988397,2.1432,7,'y-373fptEXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37043,_binary '\0','/tqLjEqOELHek2zfZ1d3vknG7Dfu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3169706',7.8,65753,'en','Pride','In 1984, a group of LGBT activists decide to raise money to support the National Union of Mineworkers during their lengthy strike. There is only one problem: the Union seems embarrassed to receive their support.','/Kc3vbqO0X4VRnjACGNoWLNQvHo.jpg','2014-09-12',120,'Released','Based on the inspirational true story.','Pride',234200,5.3917,7.687,'LoDhhLgobt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37044,_binary '\0','/tat8iWSCCL4AyUWRblAHoVdHrU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3169740',6.6,2191,'en','The Falls: Testament of Love','Picking up five years after the doomed romance between Mormon missionaries RJ and Chris, though their lives have taken radically different paths, the death of a mutual friend unexpectedly reunites the two men at a time when both are attempting to establish their adult lives. As old feelings of love and regret are rekindled, RJ and Chris must once again confront their seemingly impossible love.','/jUU0zpGhImxHJchsZvhZBMrPez2.jpg','2013-12-10',124,'Released','A new testament begins...','The Falls: Testament of Love',242648,2.149,6,'0WEMeWxU_LU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37045,_binary '\0','/g1AKuu59k5tC9Cukjns0VmH1wiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3169770',6.6,11653,'es','El desconocido','While Carlos, a banking executive, takes his two kids to school in his car, he gets a phone call telling him that there is a bomb under the seats and he must to gather a large amount of money; otherwise, his car will blow up.','/s8L5mN9USLpuSM9Pl7c5UC9unYj.jpg','2015-09-21',101,'Released','Drive or die','Retribution',351145,3.0126,6.72,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37046,_binary '\0','/qElvJvnwPBYu9JOM9nrsvHbdfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31702278',6.6,1256,'it','Il Nibbio','Baghdad, 2005. After Italian journalist Giuliana Sgrena is kidnapped by insurgents, veteran SISMI negotiator Nicola Calipari is tasked with rescuing her, but interference from US forces in Iraq compromises his mission.','/ns0qUI7Y8cK5g6XSvRHmNANAN99.jpg','2025-03-06',109,'Released',NULL,'The Negotiator',1192174,1.9615,7.1,'sI2Xx3eTpdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37047,_binary '\0','/zWRvFjcCoQ4M5LTU4WAy90AuJP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31702438',5.5,3493,'ml','ഹലോ മമ്മി','Boney, a carefree man finds his life turned upside down after marriage when hes forced to deal with the restless spirit of his obsessive-compulsive mother-in-law.','/gscmBqhpsbqy52pPaxiCbiqkukR.jpg','2024-11-21',136,'Released',NULL,'Hello Mummy',1239991,0.7886,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37048,_binary '\0','/u6vlZN9aXosNY5PkkWPHJGKz36Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31703444',3.2,1590,'ro','Buzz House: The Movie','The next season of Buzz House is the most ambitious yet. Selly has prepared many surprises for the participants: secret competitors, an isolated villa in the forest that can only be reached by boat and a costumed employee, set to scare them, to have a thrilling exit. Everything is planned in detail. What\'s not in the plan, though, is for a real psychopath to show up, kill the \"scary\" employee, take his costume and terrorize our competitors for real. Do rivalries still matter when you\'re being run over with an axe? Do friendships still matter when you have to risk your life for them? Who will manage to escape and how?','/b9UHxRBkKn5TXBRYK82R5OIxL6y.jpg','2024-04-23',93,'Released',NULL,'Buzz House: The Movie',1265662,1.6223,5,'MSBs8UrKWO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37049,_binary '\0','/Nb6eUFJ1pxwT8MHAeSSyLypvQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3170458',5.8,2224,'en','A Violent Separation','1983. In a quiet Midwestern town, a young deputy covers up a murder at the hands of his brother triggering a series of events that sends them and the victim\'s family towards a shattering climax.','/yNlLMfrfPExwqLZSOFbqmkawIpg.jpg','2019-05-17',106,'Released','Nothing loves you like your own flesh and blood','A Violent Separation',506815,1.7761,7,'e1ykmzfVRBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37050,_binary '\0','/cGV6R2vzT4TYIabf3JgmrOISQ0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3170832',8.1,484813,'en','Room','Held captive for 7 years in an enclosed space, a woman and her young son finally gain their freedom, allowing the boy to experience the outside world for the first time.','/2hHDMeYyZjbGWn0BeNH1cTMxuM7.jpg','2015-10-16',118,'Released','Love knows no boundaries.','Room',264644,9.3762,7.987,'6C6fZ-fwDws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37051,_binary '\0','/pHTJV8JDKgCTZEyJb8yOu13T9dU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3170900',6.9,1705,'da','Idealisten','A whistle blower attempts to reveal the secret behind a nuclear disaster that occurred during the height of the Cold War.','/fkv50FtuuvJTBmQ1HFSbzMr2TFx.jpg','2015-04-09',114,'Released','He revealed the lie, so we could know the truth','The Idealist',335490,1.4536,7.3,'08rItPDDHYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37052,_binary '\0','/fCO18PpHSdrjs0YHigztBmv5XuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3170902',7.1,12020,'ar','ذيب','Set in the Arabian Desert of 1916, the film follows Theeb, a young Bedouin boy, and his brother Hussein as they leave the safety of their tribe to venture on a treacherous journey at the dawn of the Great Revolt. If Theeb is to survive he must quickly learn about adulthood, trust and betrayal.','/qixAor6q0GDPXcMEVgVi2fnWMb9.jpg','2014-10-26',100,'Released',NULL,'Theeb',287628,1.695,6.73,'gqkWiWvxoGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37053,_binary '\0','/ethGwemVpYCyxBbeeYuSLbd5Qzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31709812',6.6,1250,'jv','Sekawan Limo','In this quirky horror comedy, five hikers explore a mountain, casually heeding superstitious warnings - but later realize that one of them is a ghost.','/vDShtzKFKjXsFpQNbBY5ijSeLqF.jpg','2024-07-04',112,'Released',NULL,'Five Friends',1279914,1.9301,6.2,'ERZncVUuKlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37054,_binary '\0','/de3Nk3aylnE8Z4z7lGmVq9IG7qt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31710990',5.6,3947,'es','Dreams: Sueños','A powerful socialite and a promising ballet dancer begin a dangerous affair. When he secretly crosses the US-Mexico border, she takes desperate measures to protect their future together.','/zJCOHBvy4O6nIslbbxJ8tICn53d.jpg','2025-07-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Dreams',1134463,7.9971,6.1,'J6Al_zihrvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37055,_binary '\0','/2okfik8YwzSfdETpT5cUClSiGFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31711040',7.8,24127,'ja','ルックバック','Popular, outgoing Fujino is celebrated by her classmates for her funny comics in the class newspaper. One day, her teacher asks her to share the space with Kyomoto, a truant recluse whose beautiful artwork sparks a competitive fervor in Fujino. What starts as jealousy transforms when Fujino realizes their shared passion for drawing.','/4f2EcNkp1Mvp9wE5w7HKxcmACWg.jpg','2024-06-28',58,'Released','Manga drew them together. Life made them best friends.','Look Back',1244492,28.8953,8.181,'H6HOnlTnVwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37056,_binary '\0','/gFLXdnD8pu5fa4rkqV1NUAL8oxe.j