:21:09.000000'),(37060,_binary '\0','/giLoSoPXYTB4vtB5jOiRhhltL8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31713069',5.2,1312,'pl','Nic na siłę','After being tricked into dropping everything to save her grandmother\'s farm, big-city chef Oliwia falls for a handsome farmer who\'s hiding a secret.','/jsLJHJKpp3hjp8CC1XkJAwF3BxU.jpg','2024-03-27',111,'Released',NULL,'No Pressure',1257130,1.8346,5.349,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37061,_binary '\0','/mJWcwmYEohfpO2pZQ8eTZa52T8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3171764',4.1,3433,'sr','Mamula','Two young American women go on a Mediterranean vacation and uncover the watery lair of a killer mermaid hidden beneath an abandoned military fortress.','/uaXHRV41HPuj5bWbDdZdsxxEsPb.jpg','2014-03-08',94,'Released','Mysterious. Irresistible. Deadly.','Killer Mermaid',260030,2.686,4.7,'U09__KZJ_sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37062,_binary '\0','/oKpkhLNQuLgokAx7SVIs3uu4Ig7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3171832',5.9,25587,'en','iBoy','After an accident, Tom wakes from a coma to discover that fragments of his smart phone have been embedded in his head, and worse, that returning to normal teenage life is impossible because he has developed a strange set of super powers.','/z2pJigKnzgDL7RI5AlYf0eeoWTF.jpg','2017-01-27',90,'Released','His powers are his curse','iBoy',414190,3.7367,5.953,'FbEWtpSmJXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37063,_binary '\0','/xc7HgZxtMUqBgjnkdEjIK5Pfl0f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3171886',6.3,2229,'nl','Hartenstraat','Hartenstraat is set in the Nine Streets district of Amsterdam. It is a village in a big town and everyone seems to be looking for love. As the womanizer Bas, seniors Bep and Aart and the couple Rein and Jacob. The only one who is not looking for love is Daan. He lives here with his daughter Saar in Hartenstraat, where he has his own business as a caterer. Then Katje appears in his life. The pretty fashion designer opens a fashion boutique next door to Daan. When her catering unexpectedly cancels just before opening her shop Katje must appeal to Daan. That is asking for trouble since the two opposite each other in everything. Yet Katje also secretly has an eye on her neighbor, especially now that her current relationship with Thomas is not going strong.','/eWSQHOfEPh40gRq4NOqLjHzCWLu.jpg','2014-03-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Heart Street',251671,1.0363,6.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37064,_binary '\0','/sJ7nb4NcjLHvTOfYh2hxX3iR0s1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31719063',6.9,2229,'ta','வெப்பம் குளிர் மழை','The story revolves around Petthaperumal and Paandi in the village of Maaviduthukotai, Sivangangai. They both are a happily married couple for some time until the pressure of conceiving a baby falls on them and thereafter affect their emotional and physical bond. The societal stigma of not conceiving a baby is thrust on a woman. The fake masculine identity crisis thrust on a man. How as a married couple they overcome the society burden of back biting and the shame through various pressures from the closed circles to the outer circle. The heat cold and finally the rain of love unfolds in this movie Veppam Kulir Mazhai.','/zOGzycGyu67TiXZCves37CDZoL6.jpg','2024-03-29',132,'Released',NULL,'Veppam Kulir Mazhai',1258940,0.616,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37065,_binary '\0','/nKl5vyhbePNKhjLgGnyV6HIpGE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3172126',6.3,1647,'en','Undrafted','A team of misfit intramural baseball players become important to a player who was overlooked in the MLB draft, as he tries to come to grips with his dashed dream.','/TH9tigrIJ3lmkNESMHbsFCBXYL.jpg','2016-07-15',100,'Released','A story about life\'s strikeouts and home runs.','Undrafted',331393,1.6004,7,'sA0EX1s6Fnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37066,_binary '\0','/ArD1bN4HN4AQMD8lROutHrjRZ0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31723041',6.7,3002,'en','Jimmy Carr: Natural Born Killer','Jimmy Carr refutes the idea that you can\'t joke about anything these days with his edgy takes on gun control, religion, cancel culture and consent.','/5ntu2EZsk1HDaV7OjhZJT7OumSt.jpg','2024-04-15',60,'Released',NULL,'Jimmy Carr: Natural Born Killer',1262852,2.7745,6.4,'YLMMoPr_kSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37067,_binary '\0','/kHJlXiwxcMAf9R934f0ncEBAMXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31723358',4.1,2933,'es','Pídeme lo que quieras','After his father\'s death, Eric Zimmerman travels to Spain to oversee his company\'s branches. In Madrid, he falls for Judith and engage in an intense, erotic relationship full of exploration. However, Eric fears his secret may end their affair.','/yZXYCiZQPB7Ui6D5206W1zDKv8P.jpg','2024-11-29',114,'Released',NULL,'Tell Me What You Want',1252309,16.227,6.083,'MzNbhA4WFqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37068,_binary '\0','/3oBm46MgU1XRCgfnfqxXfYRuWg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31723382',7.2,1516,'en','Neal Brennan: Crazy Good','Comedian Neal Brennan riffs in this stand-up special on crypto, social media flexes, sex compliments, and the link between greatness and mental health.','/fwW5GGyfaaKzheCRQBv7UbOuwha.jpg','2024-04-08',53,'Released',NULL,'Neal Brennan: Crazy Good',1266741,0.8822,6.9,'wsJaoILz98Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37069,_binary '\0','/nF5BqPlOvBlrByY1ZD43kSm9iX2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3172520',6.3,1972,'it','Sacro GRA','After the India of Varanasi’s boatmen, the American desert of the dropouts, and the Mexico of the killers of drugtrade, Gianfranco Rosi has decided to tell the tale of a part of his own country, roaming and filming for over two years in a minivan on Rome’s giant ring road—the Grande Raccordo Anulare, or GRA—to discover the invisible worlds and possible futures harbored in this area of constant turmoil. Elusive characters and fleeting apparitions emerge from the background of the winding zone: a nobleman from the Piemonte region and his college student daughter sharing a one-room efficiency in a modern apartment building along the GRA.','/7vsmiudJxiYYQWlnv6OmMT3tH9E.jpg','2013-09-19',93,'Released','Tales from Rome\'s Ring Road','Sacro GRA',216790,1.5297,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37070,_binary '\0','/jUiH4T53kBjyflRgzVuD6aB8hQi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3172532',6.8,35792,'en','The Diary of a Teenage Girl','Minnie Goetze is a 15-year-old aspiring comic-book artist, coming of age in the haze of the 1970s in San Francisco. Insatiably curious about the world around her, Minnie is a pretty typical teenage girl. Oh, except that she’s sleeping with her mother’s boyfriend.','/5YlUrdYKuscD7pwf3yy9duVLbui.jpg','2015-08-07',102,'Released','Sex, drugs, and recordings of it all.','The Diary of a Teenage Girl',250124,5.2845,6.566,'G2M9kqb5wVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37071,_binary '\0','/a4bHIEPpXRSLp4b0sHRwHZeEOBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31727191',5.9,1317,'en','Preparation for the Next Life','Aishe, a Uyghur woman trained by her military father, migrates to New York City where she finds herself laboring in Chinatown’s underground kitchens. She fatefully encounters Skinner, a young American soldier who has just returned from three tours in the Middle East. While falling in love, they discover the possibility of a better life together than the ones they believed they were destined to live alone.','/8JbuKgQBc8KlXopF1eege54HNQ5.jpg','2025-09-05',116,'Released','Love isn’t an escape, it’s a reason to keep going.','Preparation for the Next Life',1314129,3.9721,5.9,'d-LdHBuxCvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37072,_binary '\0','/43vbVQDJlY7VoY3VPo8MipicxXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31727267',6.9,3574,'en','Sarah\'s Oil','Sarah Rector, a Black girl born in early 20th-century Oklahoma Indian Territory, believes there is oil beneath the barren land she’s allotted, and her faith proves right. As greedy oil sharks close in, Sarah turns to family, friends, and some Texas wildcatters to maintain control of her oil-rich land, eventually becoming among the nation\'s first Black female millionaires—at eleven years old.','/Av1CK61z33v2OBFLD1yF5rdRxQ1.jpg','2025-11-06',103,'Released','Inspired by a true story of faith and fortune.','Sarah\'s Oil',1325678,8.8658,7.923,'lcEOKJm_aLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37073,_binary '\0','/7IwBgIwoHtkQ0lYGbBbqKintSWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31728330',6.3,51791,'en','They Will Kill You','A woman answers a help wanted ad to be a housekeeper in a mysterious New York City high-rise, unaware that she is entering a community that has seen a number of disappearances over the years and may be under the grip of a Satanic cult.','/6oI4oQKTWMVUlr8Ivqydp28Ruu6.jpg','2026-03-25',94,'Released','Let them try.','They Will Kill You',1292695,17.8538,6.933,'AqNFJUihSHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37074,_binary '\0','/d2rMXJVFIdgP61RXhglBgPKCEHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31729526',6.3,1438,'te','హథ్యా','In Telugu State, influential politician J.C. Dharmendra Reddy is brutally murdered in his residence. Fearless cop Sudha takes on the case, diving into a web of secrets, deception, and lies. Can she uncover the truth, or will the system thwart her pursuit of justice?','/iD7ZM1vZXQ8A39b3UM0a44VKzQf.jpg','2025-01-24',148,'Released',NULL,'Hathya',1422602,0.6959,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37075,_binary '\0','/vLNpnZwxTqv1hxHoT1Bz6sxn3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3173524',5.6,1421,'it','Sotto una buona stella','A wealthy broker, Federico Picchioni, within two days forfeits his partner and work, finishing well to living with two children and granddaughter (abandoned by her father). He is, at this point, in the face of many difficulties of adjustment but finds comfort in the help of his neighbor.','/4JXtUrAKrfdiZa8dSZwuKWzTadS.jpg','2014-02-13',109,'Released',NULL,'Sotto una buona stella',255456,1.5726,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37076,_binary '\0','/g0JyeAe7kcsXyFWEv8Axa49yBRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3173594',6.1,12285,'en','Hacker','Alex, an immigrant from Ukraine comes to Canada and becomes involved with an online criminal organization called Darkweb. What starts off as a way to help his parents financially, soon becomes a personal vendetta against the entire banking system, when his mother is fired from her job at the bank','/gpYwKrP6s749b5Nzgm2174jKrpf.jpg','2016-09-15',95,'Released','He will find you. He will become you.','Hacker',413052,3.9323,6.26,'Va9cvA0zgwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37077,_binary '\0','/9XzWOwHn5sKFn0WdBSw56ISk6HN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3173910',6.8,17864,'hi','हँसी तो फसी','On the eve of Nikhil and Karishma’s engagement, Karishma’s wealthy father, Devesh Solanki, expresses his disapproval, believing Nikhil to be a lackadaisical young man. With one week to prove himself worthy to marry Karishma, Nikhil and Karishma\'s sister, Meeta, grow closer to each other.','/umLscI7JOZECRY7G9sICOid6MFT.jpg','2014-02-07',141,'Released','Love Goes Cuckin Frazy','Hasee Toh Phasee',251626,2.0519,6.6,'Xv5MG0LhaP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37078,_binary '\0','/xPbm6DJCn26NHvRwsuG9eGC0b3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3174376',6.2,56822,'en','Before I Wake','An orphaned child\'s dreams—and nightmares—manifest physically as he sleeps.','/sI9neTbF3ECdpf2MpC88EMGJH13.jpg','2016-04-07',97,'Released','Fear your dreams.','Before I Wake',301804,7.6922,6.498,'7-1jKAc3RGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37079,_binary '\0','/YP6FhLBnw8gwFb5RmL9i1Exm2c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31747163',6.1,13496,'en','What Jennifer Did','When Jennifer Pan calls 911 to report that her parents have been shot, she becomes the primary focus of a captivating criminal case.','/r3PJPXuSArGK8tM6lBUyPUTtIbJ.jpg','2024-04-09',87,'Released',NULL,'What Jennifer Did',1261924,2.263,6.2,'M-ppnYEAqSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37080,_binary '\0','/8wRTUjQGwCNmVcgnShmhf8MrAKy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3175038',6.6,25651,'hi','एक विलन','An ex-gangster re-enters the world of violence after his wife is murdered by a serial killer.','/tIMfMyCo7yeRqaRXmor5yJj14pV.jpg','2014-06-27',129,'Released','There\'s one in every love story','Ek Villain',276935,1.9167,6.542,'FLah0H5BYmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37081,_binary '\0','/AgI5J7wd3NY606u16hk00FiorXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3175438',4.6,1297,'es','Asmodexia','Eloy de Palma is an exorcist pastor roaming the darkest corners of the country with his granddaughter Alba. Their mission is to help those possessed by The Evil One, an infection of the soul that is spreading fast. Each exorcism is tougher than the one before, and every battle reveals a piece of Alba’s forgotten past – an enigma that if unconcealed could change the world as we know it.','/m9rhEvc1FvU1EnEkOgxEGF8W4YJ.jpg','2014-04-19',90,'Released','Hell awaits','Asmodexia',280016,1.3838,4.5,'bmwAGsofI-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37082,_binary '\0','/5vGgscEHUWAbaN0UObFOOefGRuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3175888',6.9,2563,'ur','دختر','In the mountains of Pakistan, a mother and her ten-year-old daughter flee their home on the eve of the girl\'s marriage to a tribal leader. A deadly hunt for them begins.','/zcsQI5pwMIeHHFNoUaApKuIYauJ.jpg','2014-09-18',93,'Released','A mother\'s extraordinary journey begins in the heart of Pakistan.','Dukhtar',287594,1.0614,6.7,'KsH8SHSurT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37083,_binary '\0','/rcSFqeNsUuqh6S7ON0I8zueLcVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3175936',6.2,1403,'zh','被偷走的那五年','He Man awakes from a coma thinking that she’s still on her honeymoon with her husband Xie Yu, but she gets a rude shock: there’s a five-year gap in her memory, and during that time the couple has divorced. Confused and desperate to figure out how their marriage crumbled, He Man seeks out her ex-husband and her ex-best-friend for answers.','/bQPAJcXbpWL2pxu2tcY1cCtyrIa.jpg','2013-08-29',111,'Released',NULL,'The Stolen Years',221112,1.3365,6.032,'7M94VB_7WAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37084,_binary '\0','/dN8WAVn08WgCkGhEYv52vEvO9eY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3176134',6.5,2067,'tr','Silsile','Cenk has just arrived back to Istanbul from the United States. Suppressed love slowly begins to resurface after he encounters Ece, a woman whom he had a romantic relationship with in the past. Suddenly, there is a robbery attempt in a quiet and gloomy house, which results in a crime being committed.','/jHmWm7S2pjL0j70p4dB5GOH1BKR.jpg','2014-03-07',103,'Released',NULL,'Consequences',314462,1.4078,5.8,'rtpeR3GHxKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37085,_binary '\0','/ysrAs9oomt7omDhICmM2XUNKYrw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3176980',5.5,3474,'en','Be My Cat: A Film for Anne','An aspiring filmmaker goes to shocking extremes to convince Hollywood actress Anne Hathaway to star in his film. First entry in Adrian Țofei\'s spiritual trilogy which includes We Put the World to Sleep and Pure.','/n03Okhxq86AqTbqrVvt8mu2OWYO.jpg','2015-03-01',87,'Released','\"I will change the world with you, Anne!\"','Be My Cat: A Film for Anne',328216,1.3329,6.2,'4VOmmyUFYEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37086,_binary '\0','/xuA7vrQJ6aorU0lpenN13Jk9eIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3177316',5.7,28762,'en','Honeymoon','On her honeymoon, a young bride sleepwalks into the woods surrounding a secluded cabin. When she returns, she looks the same—but something about her is terrifyingly different.','/8XPGgvhsJxFvmVH9xAm9q9J7Coy.jpg','2014-09-12',88,'Released','After the ceremony comes the ritual.','Honeymoon',254191,3.2369,5.4,'CFsrZjfQnp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37087,_binary '\0','/lzqfTGdgXyYJVrO6AjscS0NscR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3177332',4.4,2538,'hi','Horror Story','A group of 7 youngsters decide to spend a night at a reportedly haunted hotel to celebrate the farewell of one of them leaving for the USA. Despite people\'s warnings and other \"signs\" trying to ward them off from there, they enter the hotel, and then the truth dawns on them. Seven friends - Sam alias Samrat, Magesh, Achint, Neel, Neena, Sonia and Magi reunite after several years apart to celebrate the farewell of one of their friends, who is going abroad in order to pursue his career and fulfill his goals. The group soon learns about an abandoned hotel with strange stories around it. Much against warnings, they decide to spend a night at the hotel, and soon realize the mistake of their lives.','/79qQhOqEJUuRdfGw5NQnylGnRNE.jpg','2013-09-13',91,'Released',NULL,'Horror Story',242441,1,4.8,'pdljX50YAZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37088,_binary '\0','/omOIzarzHL4srQeLd5oPlzEReuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31777964',6.1,2363,'fr','Gourou','Matt, a charismatic coach, captivates crowds until he spirals into a disturbing downward spiral.','/oy9SBxmzL6pG5Lckh9o2Wa1IWBr.jpg','2026-01-28',126,'Released','Beware of your idols.','Guru',1259983,4.9925,6.023,'18dcAAAQoZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37089,_binary '\0','/dW6NGJrgeBjBB4TK6RDG9sXpJCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3178174',7.3,2472,'ja','ジョバンニの島','In the aftermath of the most devastating conflict mankind had ever experienced, the tiny island of Shikotan became part of the Sakhalin Oblast... and on the unhealed border in this remote corner of the world, friendship among children from two different countries timidly blossomed, striving to overcome language barriers and the waves of history. Inspired by true events.','/aqNDzNcxesN6CNGP4jInMVpqC5l.jpg','2014-02-22',102,'Released',NULL,'Giovanni\'s Island',239367,3.1211,7.5,'S2W1ED3Xc90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37090,_binary '\0','/2LWK3EYLVsY0tYBWS5KjwNBymWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3178292',8.7,2947,'kn','ಎ','A film director fades away from the industry after the failed love with the heroine of his movie. After being rehabilitated, he learns that some people conspired his fall and decides to take revenge.','/y3DH68oWOGMZ637tqYHfTGU4Bif.jpg','1998-02-12',148,'Released','I AM GOD, GOD IS GREAT','A',210763,1.0957,5.75,'5JbD2Qlc8OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37091,_binary '\0','/iHZ6NIQUZ1VbGmeeWA90S7ioyAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3178320',1.6,2703,'en','Diamond Cobra v the White Fox','Based on two magical necklaces, both Tarjella and Diamond learn how jealousy and a evil curse can hurt the lives of family. The gangster squad and Rhonda are on the search for the white fox. Detective Parks and Agent Holly McCall are investigating these murders happening around the necklaces.','/l8vnJBh7DrAdllTj4oFxyQc4H5e.jpg',NULL,113,'Released',NULL,'Diamond Cobra v the White Fox',1729658,1.1215,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37092,_binary '\0','/p1qQ9HjerdG2Xg4IopznsmaahDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31788773',6,2383,'ja','好きでも嫌いなあまのじゃく','A shy teenage boy\'s inability to say no is tested when a headstrong girl drags him on a mystical journey amid summer snow to find her missing mom.','/k69kkwsipkPn7Nzq488kHGQTPo.jpg','2024-05-24',112,'Released',NULL,'My Oni Girl',1231574,3.788,7.223,'sWhtovYy3E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37093,_binary '\0','/3Z5rtXdfY0QB5P6mw6OLPrGUUcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31795447',5.3,2800,'en','Ick','Science teacher Hank’s life changes when he reconnects with his first love and suspects that a new student may be his daughter—all while facing an alien threat in their town.','/AtfV5Rl0YHtibZWuwC9ilHcHugU.jpg','2025-07-27',93,'Released','Don\'t touch.','Ick',1218493,2.9922,6,'c0FwizGxiFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37094,_binary '\0','/llGQkYQxnwATVKRYvPTaGMCgQPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3179568',6.6,35140,'en','Men, Women & Children','Follows the story of a group of high school teenagers and their parents as they attempt to navigate the many ways the internet has changed their relationships, their communication, their self-image, and their love lives.','/dzFHIxCcvq2CZVFCsgz7n1z5oIM.jpg','2014-10-17',116,'Released','Discover how little you know about the people you know.','Men, Women & Children',243684,7.6478,6.5,'Ri2m3k2k7Qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37095,_binary '\0','/oICnEdejbYE0L917plaxtAoOQjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31796256',6.3,7437,'es','El lugar de la otra','After Chilean writer María Carolina Geel murders her lover, the case captivates shy legal secretary Mercedes, sparking a connection between the two women.','/jlnmzV9w2w85ch91HDnukQz1ynl.jpg','2024-09-30',96,'Released',NULL,'In Her Place',1247458,4.1431,6.1,'ytNY0WqUzvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37096,_binary '\0','/yjqUa6yohr56Uep18W0zsgbMGtl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31797432',6.1,7891,'en','The Last Redemption','In a land of swords and sorcery, bandits break from their gang to protect a little girl, pitting them against their old friends and former leader who was once like a father to them.','/xyKdcbzqX8pG17S4cLKURHlNlvN.jpg','2025-01-30',122,'Released',NULL,'The Last Redemption',1233243,1.851,5.1,'-pGDK0AjkTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37097,_binary '\0','/9MVdbQVNZA92fh4klywkNPbBeKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31800329',7.1,13519,'en','The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar and Three More','Four tales unfold in Wes Anderson\'s anthology of short films adapted from Roald Dahl\'s beloved stories, \"The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar\", \"The Swan\", \"The Rat Catcher\", and \"Poison.\"','/8gBOtLTs0GNMEZnisAK132o5V67.jpg','2024-03-14',89,'Released',NULL,'The Wonderful Story of Henry Sugar and Three More',1259365,4.2342,7.447,'C33ucZ0vuks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37098,_binary '\0','/livJ0uNa2Vk1SL8a1ZQNGHeznXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3180440',5.6,1354,'nl','Feuten: Het Feestje','The new academic year for student corps H.S.C. Mercurius with a huge enrollment party. Perpetual student Olivier de Ruyter gets into a minor conflict with the police, who are fed up with the nuisance Mercurius is causing in the neighborhood. Meanwhile, lawyer Bram Wagtmans is nostalgic for student life and decides to go all out with his friends at the club that evening, for the last time. First-year students and best friends Elias and Lieve also attend the party. Lieve is the ideal sorority girl, while Elias is only at the party because he is in love with Lieve. These are the ingredients for an evening that will get completely out of hand.','/jdizSSsEvanYlJlhWnAIS4j5xXv.jpg','2013-10-24',80,'Released',NULL,'Feuten: Het Feestje',223551,1.3631,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37099,_binary '\0','/apNfldKI3RiaukNwJzr8EjRG7Wc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31806049',5.5,28956,'de','Brick','When a mysterious brick wall encloses their apartment building overnight, Tim and Olivia must unite with their wary neighbors to get out alive.','/vTX9CxFNEQOlfXsgqec7xmc5UtD.jpg','2025-07-02',99,'Released','They want to leave – but their apartment won\'t let them.','Brick',1425045,6.7963,5.791,'fmi4Qc-cvis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37100,_binary '\0','/eciyOCAyvkXEONZmwgwP2542v4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31807233',7.5,2612,'zh','好东西','Wang Tiemei, a single mother, loses her job and moves, befriending neighbor Xiaoye who appears cheerful but is depressed. Their bond grows as Tiemei navigates relationships with her ex-husband causing trouble.','/d19YpGra7LRMYnOZQi9Vbn1jjhB.jpg','2024-11-09',123,'Released','Do some new stuff, talk some new topics.','Her Story',1260951,3.0946,7.587,'OKXNGLR6SPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37101,_binary '\0','/7nYZxYAb1vkLd1a5i7qDcH5kBsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3181776',5.5,17920,'en','Momentum','When Alex, an infiltration expert with a secret past, accidentally reveals her identity during what should have been a routine heist, she quickly finds herself mixed up in a government conspiracy and entangled in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with a master assassin and his team of killers. Armed with her own set of lethal skills, Alex looks to exact revenge for her murdered friends while uncovering the truth.','/49bPrxvgwUqEtvOfvTe3x92hEFV.jpg','2015-10-15',96,'Released','The heist gone wrong is not her only problem','Momentum',346808,4.4299,5.7,'-c-ICjI1EQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37102,_binary '\0','/96iXwJibeNW9RGEa58zYa0SQV6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3181822',4.7,48767,'en','The Boy Next Door','A recently cheated on married woman falls for a younger man who has moved in next door, but their torrid affair soon takes a dangerous turn.','/gicmSeLG6Uh7BF1r1mxZHUQ8r26.jpg','2015-01-23',91,'Released','A Moment She Couldn\'t Resist. An Obsession He Can\'t Control.','The Boy Next Door',241251,7.9665,4.952,'MgbBwovOOoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37103,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3181886',5,2335,'en','Love Is a Verb','Love Is A Verb is an examination of a social movement of Sufi-inspired Sunni Muslims that began in Turkey in the l960s and now spans across the globe. The group is called Hizmet, the Turkish word for \"service\" or The Gülen Movement after its inspiration and teacher, Fethullah Gülen, a man TIME magazine named as one of the most influential leaders in the world in 2013 for \"...preaching a message of tolerance.\"','/stUpQ0vKCsxmwO0nVHa1Tg0QK0r.jpg','2014-04-01',57,'Released',NULL,'Love Is a Verb',360150,1.0982,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37104,_binary '\0','/qe6da0fW3GUR4tMW0UHqpgjY1kI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3181898',4,1679,'en','Edgar Allan Poe\'s Lighthouse Keeper','Marooned on a remote peninsula and haunted by frightening specters, a young man must confront the grotesque denizens of the night, or heed the Lighthouse Keeper\'s cryptic warning to, \'Always keep a light burning!\'','/tH51iteHZdHshOB2e6lph5q7Wfw.jpg','2016-03-16',89,'Released','Always Keep A Light Burning!','Edgar Allan Poe\'s Lighthouse Keeper',388410,1.1593,4.7,'W6uNy_ln6R0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37105,_binary '\0','/6bcsmGa0WiCi2QwVWd1sxQAymmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3182596',7.2,1684,'ar','فتاة المصنع','Hiyam, a young factory worker, lives in a lower-middle-class neighbourhood, along with her co-workers. She is clearly under the spell of Salah, the factory\'s new supervisor. Believing that love can transcend their class differences, Hiyam relentlessly pursues a dream of the pair being together. However, when a pregnancy test is discovered in the factory premises, her immediate family and close friends accuse her of sinning. Hiyam decides not to defend herself and pays an enormous price in a society that fails to accept her.','/piz3YZIs1hIYEiNJQQ4whiyStQ3.jpg','2014-03-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Factory Girl',289039,0.9296,6.6,'yC5XwpFQoLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37106,_binary '\0','/m8iuaVJOMF43E8QcFoFYcbbcbAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3182620',6,4365,'en','Bitter Harvest','Set between the two World Wars and based on true historical events, Bitter Harvest conveys the untold story of the Holodomor, the genocidal famine engineered by the tyrant Joseph Stalin. The film displays a powerful tale of love, honour, rebellion and survival at a time when Ukraine was forced to adjust to the horrifying territorial ambitions of the burgeoning Soviet Union.','/n6qOtH7LWsv4UaxAfZ5uQjDnzBE.jpg','2017-01-31',103,'Released',NULL,'Bitter Harvest',403390,3.3766,5.9,'3SDY4jfN74A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37107,_binary '\0','/1DNoB7ZFBbpQRu8WSZ43M1Etph0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3182644',7.6,1536,'ta','மூடர் கூடம்','Four nobodies brought together by a quirk of fate decide to rob the house of a rich man. But things turn crazy when they arrive at his doorstep and find that the man is actually bankrupt.','/62OCurCtXlOX8oPL6WFi3N1LEBu.jpg','2013-09-13',149,'Released',NULL,'Moodar Koodam',221529,0.8479,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37108,_binary '\0','/2jllAxMf7dTMt1fw9A1slsaj6Fv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31828346',5.2,1970,'fi','Pikku Siperia','A pastor\'s faith turns upside down when a meteorite lands in his small Finnish town, its impact stirring up chaos and criminal intentions.','/hQuoiOMbkjGw3rjGnyXFAVjVIBH.jpg','2025-03-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Little Siberia',1362608,2.7185,5.994,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37109,_binary '\0','/fNtmDJGvQWetrqzwnoh2PcI1C0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31828532',6,1331,'no','På villspor','When chaotic single mother Emilie hits a new low, she looks to her brother for help. He has a brilliant plan: to enter a cross-country ski marathon.','/7uVdqyf7xiHeGjxhnRTKjGnO0Gm.jpg','2025-02-27',94,'Released',NULL,'The Wrong Track',1422179,2.5147,6.6,'2pjLXU4nEkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37110,_binary '\0','/A3XP3vGg4DGDhEH75GnyyjsDDm1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31828554',6.8,4525,'sv','Je m\'appelle Agneta','Craving a fresh start, recently unemployed Agneta accepts an au pair gig in Provence that turns into an indulgent escape — and an unexpected awakening.','/nrwtoBNGgbFz3iiCx43TLHoBBPq.jpg','2026-04-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Je m\'appelle Agneta',829487,4.3353,6.7,'zEV1hSRd25Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37111,_binary '\0','/lhepU4PTeLlGm8WQytEtH4CRs75.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3183402',5.9,1556,'es','Verónica','A female Psychologist who has stopped practicing medicine, decides to take the case of Veronica de la Serna, a young woman whose previous therapist has mysteriously disappeared.','/8WMfFaYKoCtki0mkdqFqIUYB1hC.jpg','2017-08-14',81,'Released','We all hide things even from ourselves','Veronica',423611,1.8246,5.9,'1_D1ktoKGnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37112,_binary '\0','/zmIFeh3xutkIFZBKYatzWF1XDu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3183630',7.5,8210,'pt','O Menino e o Mundo','Suffering because of his father\'s departure to the big city, a boy leaves his village and discovers a fantastic world dominated by bug-engines and strange beings. An unusual animation with various artistic techniques that portrays the issues of the modern world through the eyes of a child.','/g5Lyl1LtntJ0zJfOGynGeRE9kED.jpg','2014-01-17',80,'Released','Some dreams survive.','Boy & the World',223706,2.3602,7.351,'eqdrwu0NvY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37113,_binary '\0','/8Qsr8pvDL3s1jNZQ4HK1d1Xlvnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3183660',7.2,545529,'en','Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them','In 1926, Newt Scamander arrives at the Magical Congress of the United States of America with a magically expanded briefcase, which houses a number of dangerous creatures and their habitats. When the creatures escape from the briefcase, it sends the American wizarding authorities after Newt, and threatens to strain even further the state of magical and non-magical relations.','/h6NYfVUyM6CDURtZSnBpz647Ldd.jpg','2016-11-16',133,'Released','Explore a new era of J.K. Rowling\'s Wizarding World.','Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them',259316,24.2959,7.3,'ViuDsy7yb8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37114,_binary '\0','/10MiMMNzWeE53cHhSlfroPiO8vi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31844586',6.7,39487,'fi','Sisu 2','Returning to the house where his family was brutally murdered during the war, \"the man who refuses to die\" dismantles it, loads it on a truck, and is determined to rebuild it somewhere safe in their honor. When the commander who killed his family comes back hellbent on finishing the job, a relentless, eye-popping cross-country chase ensues.','/roCMOuMQ55Z2TxVx1vZZTevlo0n.jpg','2025-10-21',89,'Released','When they took his family, he took revenge.','Sisu: Road to Revenge',1223601,15.6737,7.3,'VmStqCXIgio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37115,_binary '\0','/gi88gFtqxVRZPT5AIWwwKzAuzHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3184934',6.5,9606,'fr','Une nouvelle amie','A young woman makes a surprising discovery about the husband of her late best friend.','/miW6zqiLFXY3uOrN4Ehpho2DMBB.jpg','2014-10-11',105,'Released','Your secrets, her lies.','The New Girlfriend',283726,2.7688,6.051,'KbSGOhnl9aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37116,_binary '\0','/4zyeIE8ceP95gehaPsgqamEYRuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31851518',6.4,5300,'en','The Choral','As World War I rages on, Dr. Henry Guthrie takes over a British choral society that\'s lost most of its men to the army. The community soon discovers that the best response to the chaos of war is to make beautiful music together.','/yQtms7CSM0CE0W6dYbLLAATb5rL.jpg','2025-11-07',113,'Released','They were divided by war. He united them in song.','The Choral',1262815,6.8513,6.435,'6zRVP-ZgMm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37117,_binary '\0','/iHT55IAd2qErJKhH8vCGKbZSniU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31852038',5.5,8898,'te','చీకటిలో','When crime anchor Sandhya’s best friend is found dead under suspicious circumstances, she embarks on a dangerous investigation that collides with a dark past. As secrets unravel, Sandhya must face her trauma and rise as a fearless voice for the silenced.','/pO86EjZb7QyGYk5RW4Xm4UWe5Uv.jpg','2026-01-23',126,'Released',NULL,'Cheekatilo',1263037,1.9888,5,'TsHj0sX5w3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:0