',91,'Released','The beast is in the East.','The Asian Connection',397003,2.4295,3.9,'q1rRTxpQ92I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37130,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3188492',4.1,1736,'en','Call of the Wolf','Kidnapped and trapped by a winter storm, this slow burn thriller follows two strangers who must outsmart an unseen killer.','/3xIw06nJsQiCKmfgzSh73nQtMqe.jpg','2017-02-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Call of the Wolf',438859,0.9962,4.3,'NjQ9zKhQ1wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37131,_binary '\0','/g1o5udFxZ8FPubJiLON7kXw5zIk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3188560',3,1233,'en','RoboCroc','A rocket carrying nano robots crash lands shortly after takeoff into a zoo. The bots are released and find their way into a massive crocodile. The croc, now programmed to kill, will target anything and anyone for its next meal.','/gsurzan9Ml5OyUR7ybzhqw60yz5.jpg','2013-09-14',84,'Released','Everybody Out of the Pool','RoboCroc',221737,1.5001,4.4,'pyaqFi4a8Es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37132,_binary '\0','/jvzPTf0nhsqAXodYT6ILKb99IA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31888477',7.3,19854,'en','Downton Abbey: The Grand Finale','When Mary finds herself at the center of a public scandal and the family faces financial strife, the entire household grapples with the threat of social disgrace. The Crawleys must embrace change as the staff prepares for a new chapter with the next generation leading Downton Abbey into the future.','/m1tLlMTCwc6oK6OjWTOI4b32wnA.jpg','2025-09-10',123,'Released','The time has come to say goodbye.','Downton Abbey: The Grand Finale',1289936,9.7591,7.065,'P_30wFRxlnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37133,_binary '\0','/kheKyltmCWOORRCBUpBFe9S5hHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31888759',4.5,2238,'ml','തയ്യൽ മെഷീൻ','Police Officer Shiva and his family move into a rented house where they encounter a sewing machine with supernatural powers.','/vpDgtD