6 15:21:09.000000','tt31898445',6.4,3079,'ko','탈주','After completing his required decade of military service and being honored as a hero, a North Korean sergeant makes a sudden shocking attempt to defect to the South, risking life and limb for the chance to finally determine his own destiny.','/qiYaXpjoPASnLwyts0ZOLBjZO0u.jpg','2024-07-03',96,'Released','Fear a meaningless life, not death itself.','Escape',921436,4.6448,7.267,'9mPzDILlt5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37138,_binary '\0','/ehX2ljRmDLyKS44rZz2kt4BkwkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31909270',6.5,9341,'en','Swiped','Whitney Wolfe uses extraordinary grit and ingenuity to break into the male-dominated tech industry.','/mEeFRU5ADkyP7JtOFFV8tYMm3zD.jpg','2025-09-09',111,'Released','Meet the woman who made the first move.','Swiped',1265344,6.9386,6.611,'8seUGDLZRIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37139,_binary '\0','/bmcLXmoGuGmKIvPlouQe3RIOJE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31914240',5.4,3123,'gu','ટ્રિશા ઓન ધ રૉક્સ','One fine Night Trisha (Janki Bodiwala) meets Vishal (Ravi gohil) at a party. Both of them are from different backgrounds and follow a different lifestyle. This meeting of both starts a super fun havoc with the cutest romance in their lives.','/k3zltzxeK7JpGd3lYH4OwzACHyj.jpg','2024-06-21',171,'Released',NULL,'Trisha on the Rocks',1283181,1.4952,6.3,'GUoym4BVIs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37140,_binary '\0','/n9Do4rv1Hl3QvQLMmT5w6pBadqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31917705',5.9,1698,'fr','Libre','Inspired by the true events of one of France\'s most notorious non-violent robbers, Bruno Sulak, in the 1980s. He led multiple heists, then captured public attention for his many daring escapes from police custody...always to reunite with his beloved lover and accomplice Annie, becoming both France\'s Public Enemy #1 and an icon of Freedom.','/b2YL2kncIqlcDcqly78AsOPJi6r.jpg','2024-11-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Freedom',1142518,4.3467,6.3,'vvOGbO0E-Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37141,_binary '\0','/xP0zAHkHRzlewfoPDGUfEEApo6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31922530',7.1,2654,'en','The Beach Boys','A celebration of the legendary band that revolutionized pop music, and the iconic, harmonious sound they created that personified the California dream, captivating fans for generations and generations to come.','/jqrKimzSHgXRJlYgDw9LYqtTXbC.jpg','2024-05-21',113,'Released','The definitive look at America\'s band.','The Beach Boys',1265066,3.7819,6.7,'F_Rspu3Xoi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37142,_binary '\0','/oOczvrnhpXUmqCbyKYFj4FQExAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31923069',6.6,29223,'en','Springsteen: Deliver Me from Nowhere','Bruce Springsteen, a young musician on the cusp of global superstardom, struggles to reconcile the pressures of success with the ghosts of his past.','/csBV3eq4RDjNg1acNQ8kwOZyPlZ.jpg','2025-10-22',120,'Released','Witness a true story of risking it all to fight for what you believe in.','Springsteen: Deliver Me from Nowhere',1230368,6.7596,6.6,'OuRX3n2LTlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37143,_binary '\0','/7AVjjrzoW2J6aAe8sDH5LD0YZtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31924094',3.5,2505,'ta','கஜானா','A group of greedy people were entering enchanted Forest in search of treasure and unexpectedly they over come hurdles in a mysterious way. did they find the solution and did escape from the hurdles in the forest','/4T15krfH63uSTk9wI4yIN7YcqkZ.jpg','2025-05-09',125,'Released',NULL,'Gajaana',985667,0.957,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37144,_binary '\0','/7emSrUyCqTklCCyLjMFhSsvEgty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31939390',6.9,2378,'te','అలనాటి రామచంద్రుడు','Siddhu falls in love with his classmate Dharani, struggles to confess his love owing to his introverted nature. As Siddhu gathers the courage to express his feelings, a shocking secret comes to light, throwing his life into turmoil.','/a9JjaHnmSMf6bBIFq2p3OoT0bfx.jpg','2024-08-02',156,'Released',NULL,'Alanaati Ramachandrudu',1325057,0.7438,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37145,_binary '\0','/rGcZhLzwOLz3OWWpYrelgP4HUIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31945132',6.4,17290,'ta','ரெட்ரோ','A man with a violent past seeks a fresh start, but the life he left behind resurfaces, forcing him to face old conflicts and redefine his future.','/pJPK57REXsaLydpOPgHwWAQMdqz.jpg','2025-04-30',162,'Released','Love. Laughter. War.','Retro',1265827,2.3749,6.313,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37146,_binary '\0','/uEKiqn1lE551lDgfvseVFH7OKZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3194532',5.6,3483,'ru','Горько!','Progressive and talented Natasha and Roma dream of a European wedding by the sea - but Natasha\'s stepfather procured a different scenario. Rough official of the city administration considers the celebration as a springboard for their careers, and seeks to arrange all the «how to». Young awaits an unforgettable evening in the restaurant «Golden» with a complete set of the tedious rites. Not fight, the guys decide to spend their dream wedding in secret from conservative relatives. But by accident both celebration come together.','/4WkssY4QM8Vs7ets0YVptnYSW3F.jpg','2013-10-24',100,'Released','Weddings Are For Getting Wasted','Bitterly!',229974,1.6009,5.6,'cEcaAY3gpZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37147,_binary '\0','/9TrM8NcvQ2otiEFGKddRBY3OC9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3194590',5,2284,'en','Dirty Weekend','During a layover in Albuquerque, work colleagues Les and Natalie discover more about each other than they ever thought possible. Anxious and irritable, Les is drawn back into the city by past experiences he can’t forget (even if he doesn\'t really remember the particulars of his previous drunken adventure). Natalie, refusing to leave his side, follows along as her own secrets are slowly revealed, leaving her feeling both vulnerable and unbound.','/xFaJh6KaoYz0IsS7TqCtsmBVsaK.jpg','2015-09-04',93,'Released','Some things are better left unsaid.','Dirty Weekend',333344,1.6271,4.9,'pAPrxhydKhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37148,_binary '\0','/9BHc5vRumXHMPPGZ8qCR5moOaqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3194622',3.9,1272,'en','Magnetic','On December 31st, the Earth will be destroyed. Everything you know will become nothing. Maybe it already has.','/GIhlW2ffvNG0fCg4Hla0tBNi5T.jpg','2015-03-29',80,'Released',NULL,'Magnetic',333333,0.782,7.4,'kRl0ZJXsrqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37149,_binary '\0','/dX97KfJa5wNJlSSq7NBEkYY8sWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31947573',6.3,2054,'en','Samudrudu','The lives of a fishermen community, capturing their struggles and agony when they have to deal with the many restrictions set on their livelihood by the higher authorities.','/dTuMpkujL0KRWZMrzzUrOmqSTaf.jpg','2024-10-24',124,'Released',NULL,'Samudrudu',1475953,1.3543,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37150,_binary '\0','/azvslh1OA6IrD43kRfUVgjYLl0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31948043',7.9,2791,'te','పోటెల్','An underprivileged villager and a victim of caste-driven politics in his village, forced to run away with his daughter Saraswati, but returns after undergoing a spiritual reincarnation, which in turn changes how the village receives him.','/k0RTkcYbGVbMLkCC5e8kTtGTPvO.jpg','2024-10-25',136,'Released',NULL,'Pottel',1375013,0.7109,6,'qJuc6NOZT54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37151,_binary '\0','/lOoE0S0NUaHF2ZsoootLf2ATO10.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31951179',6.9,4284,'bn','জংলী','Liza made a difficult decision at the moment of the birth of her illegitimate child in the hospital. So she had no choice but to abandon the child in the dustbin. As she was leaving the baby in a dumpster on the road behind the hospital in the dark of night, she came face to face with Dr. Tithi—the very doctor who had delivered Liza\'s baby in the operating theater. Tithi brought her back to the hospital and began to tell her a story. A story intertwined with Tithi herself, a 6-year-old girl named Pakhi, and a wild-hearted man named Johnny.','/y6AGAsNYdNcGL9CxF41QOZ1d04g.jpg','2025-03-31',152,'Released',NULL,'Jongli',1266359,1.2065,8.333,'uajQZqbj7qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37152,_binary '\0','/yQy9Y3p5INwkfTuHSnzYnz4MCV3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31956415',6.2,41305,'en','Freakier Friday','Years after Tess and Anna endured an identity crisis, Anna now has a daughter of her own and a soon-to-be stepdaughter. As they navigate the myriad challenges that come when two families merge, Tess and Anna discover lightning might indeed strike twice.','/9wV65OmsjLAqBfDnYTkMPutXH8j.jpg','2025-08-06',110,'Released','Here we go again.','Freakier Friday',1125257,19.0702,6.7,'IyJzhtJEtoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37153,_binary '\0','/1fpwEe2GvNjAq2MN2xxdifNZLBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3195644',6.1,131191,'en','Insidious: Chapter 3','A prequel set before the haunting of the Lambert family that reveals how gifted psychic Elise Rainier reluctantly agrees to use her ability to contact the dead in order to help a teenage girl who has been targeted by a dangerous supernatural entity.','/iDdGfdNvY1EX0uDdA4Ru77fwMfc.jpg','2015-05-28',97,'Released','This is how you die.','Insidious: Chapter 3',280092,18.6804,6.302,'bWd2MrMTYrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37154,_binary '\0','/7AA2NJklRlxjixL4VngaQbMsTZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31958285',7.3,3422,'ta','குடும்பஸ்தன்','Naveen\'s relationship with his parents becomes strained after he marries a oppressed-caste girl. Though they eventually reconcile, his sudden unemployment puts him in a difficult position. As financial pressures mount, Naveen must navigate societal challenges and personal struggles to regain stability and rebuild harmony within his middle-class family.','/xSF6fDlSKI1qrftN9OKOnBLvGZH.jpg','2025-01-24',153,'Released',NULL,'Kudumbasthan',1357713,1.818,7.182,'qfKpPq87bHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37155,_binary '\0','/q6tHgBlYpesjUL9NumNoGpePaGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31969600',7.5,15641,'ml','തുടരും','A taxi driver finds himself embroiled in a dangerous conspiracy after his car is confiscated by a corrupt police officer.','/uOTDBabtxHA6szYKQNQe9Y7rFlv.jpg','2025-04-23',164,'Released',NULL,'Thudarum',1261125,2.3896,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37156,_binary '\0','/7AypNX6eZrqyUPZl77jvwTfHgeV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31969779',5.2,24135,'hi','ओ रोमियो','What fate awaits a stonehearted gangster and bloodthirsty womaniser when true love claims him, helpless and unguarded? A gang war that shakes the entire underworld and crime syndicate to their very roots. A forbidden love; the tale of an unrequited passion.','/aTnIGrfVv03FIDsNDuabNsp9yFM.jpg','2026-02-13',178,'Released',NULL,'O\'Romeo',1275574,2.5907,5.647,'2M4hKmuBzUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37157,_binary '\0','/nycTuZi6aUt2PJ2eFbUBYUCuidA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3197274',7,2258,'en','Showbiz Kids','A documentary chronicling the shared experiences of prominent former child stars and the personal and professional price of fame and failure on a child.','/aEVsjuELwDr11eZ0iK39eQ8Ltcn.jpg','2020-07-14',95,'Released','The price of being a child star.','Showbiz Kids',585530,1.9758,6.8,'92EX29aeEMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37158,_binary '\0','/3CPQc1pgYu0iWr1UNk2nwy2ylDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31973693',6.6,62180,'en','The Roses','Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy and Theo: successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo\'s career nosedives while Ivy\'s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites.','/99O8HLHklXGzvF2TqiRqr7WddzT.jpg','2025-08-27',105,'Released','This marriage ain\'t big enough for the both of them.','The Roses',1267905,14.8204,6.638,'XkgMaS5gbaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37159,_binary '\0','/qJv6sRmbflGGyazciLZVXB4h3kg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3197766',6.7,7855,'cn','殺破狼2','While undercover officer Kit is taken prisoner by the syndicate, he befriends his keeper and discovers an organ trafficking ring.','/nyDqFt1veeCJ8UCu3UiMLDlzZOz.jpg','2015-06-18',120,'Released',NULL,'SPL 2: A Time for Consequences',331576,4.6499,6.985,'iah3S6lCPvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37160,_binary '\0','/An5y7Uo03yh2rGV8FSNppttBrt6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3198000',4.2,2498,'en','Teleios','A deep space mining vessel has been adrift for two years. It is suspected the crew brutally killed each other, but the reason for the bloodbath is unknown. A rescue crew is sent to find if there are any survivors, what happened and why.','/4jDlmsBB9i8vc10SVxgHfcrjE8t.jpg','2017-04-06',93,'Released','In a Perfect World...There is a Fatal Flaw.','Teleios',421443,2.4061,4.8,'2FEBtfUaVxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37161,_binary '\0','/ylq2JH1WSdvGrR9iqmHHDnAcfRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3198468',7.6,3710,'ml','നോർത്ത് 24 കാതം','Harikrishnan is a geeky software professional who suffers from an obsessive compulsive disorder. A harthal day sees him travelling to Trivandrum for a conference, and in the midst of the night, he ends up at Paravur railway station with two strangers - Gopalan a veteran politician and Narayani a social worker - for company.','/p5mmJFoAch1GxGpy2HMQ9M0eQ16.jpg','2013-09-14',125,'Released','Some times a simple journey can change your life forever','North 24 Kaatham',224057,1.2903,7.6,'e5ODC9I5TKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37162,_binary '\0','/qMs8e7rsYobUTK3g3zYOe98v1mg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31986077',8.7,2692,'te','Mercy Killing','Mercy Killing is the fight for justice according to the Constitution of India. The sets are in the coastal village of Kakinada. An unforgettable and heart-wrenching love story that happened in the life of a fisherman\'s family 14 years ago. Watch the acts of betrayal and emotional journey. Don\'t miss.','/39FGS3hrAeH7sQOP7jF2ZCZLVMG.jpg','2024-04-12',131,'Released',NULL,'Mercy Killing',1363064,0.4526,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37163,_binary '\0','/2zFHwJ4sLEW4EHdwRaeaBzMQ3oX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3198698',6.5,3504,'ja','劇場版 HUNTER×HUNTER -The LAST MISSION-','Isaac Netero is the chairman of the Hunter Association. Decades ago he sealed away Jed, a Hunter who had mastered the use of On, the dark \"shadow\" of Nen. Now On users have reappeared at the Heaven\'s Arena \"Battle Olympia\" tournament. For Netero, this is the last mission: to protect the Association and the world from a threat driven by hatred and the thirst for revenge. And he\'s going to need all the help he can get in order to succeed.','/zbmRzkxKeDjoYh5757d7RXiX2by.jpg','2013-12-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Hunter x Hunter: The Last Mission',239523,4.66,7,'DbylrrZ6C_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37164,_binary '\0','/f0vnkxDdPoBiM66WJVrwBshTT3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31989784',5.2,6034,'tr','Şımarık','A young man born into an oligarch family is so spoiled that he believes he\'s above the law. When he faces jail, his father decides to \'rehabilitate\' his son. An abandoned village is reconstructed, 19th century style. The spoiled brat \'goes back in time\', reincarnated as a serf, to learn how to appreciate life and to work hard.','/5d27nvK6UJM06qP2TuajoZAZopI.jpg','2024-12-20',111,'Released',NULL,'Son of a Rich',1285660,2.9924,5.595,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37165,_binary '\0','/haAekI7zBtffqILr90DkviTe9fk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt31998881',5.3,15223,'en','Oh. What. Fun.','Claire Clauster is the glue that holds her chaotic, lovable family together at the holidays. But this year, after planning a special outing for them, they make a crucial mistake and leave her home alone. Fed up and feeling under appreciated, she sets off on an impromptu adventure of her own. As her family scrambles to find her, Claire discovers the unexpected magic of a Christmas gone off-script.','/qynCyBKCJUUcj4wo4PE2aQVvote.jpg','2025-12-03',108,'Released','Come for the presents. Stay for the baggage.','Oh. What. Fun.',1261825,11.677,5.7,'FRfj0OHlcvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37166,_binary '\0','/fLJUO27NcQymwcBkNX4Na8NNk64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3200980',6.7,5607,'en','Where Hope Grows','Calvin Campbell is a former professional baseball player sent to an early retirement due to his panic attacks at the plate. Even though he had all the talent for the big leagues, he struggles with the curveballs life has thrown him. Today, he mindlessly sleepwalks through his days and the challenge of raising his teenager daughter. His life is in a slow downward spiral when it is suddenly awakened and invigorated by the most unlikely person – Produce, a young-man with Down syndrome who works at the local grocery store.','/gQmOsU2hA0PrGvxGjzty1S2OO3H.jpg','2014-04-06',95,'Released','An unexpected journey. An unexpected friendship.','Where Hope Grows',243352,5.5237,7.9,'-L10tIzZZrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37167,_binary '\0','/z562ScJUJRpJB1zWR7WGyTRbq1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32011999',6.3,1477,'en','Holiday Crashers','Best friends Toni and Bri, working at a card print shop, decide to crash the amazing Christmas parties from some of the shop\'s confidential invitations for a bit of harmless fun. Harmless that is, until Toni is mistaken for a lawyer and they get whisked away to a fancy corporate Christmas retreat in the snowy Vermont mountains by handsome business mogul.','/hcWk9ttwj4zXD0QduTkm377cToq.jpg','2024-10-19',84,'Released','Christmas schemes do come true','Holiday Crashers',1358987,1.789,6.5,'Fj-ZH-opWOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37168,_binary '\0','/mPNGcX1j5SFeDETkvcJA9POaNx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3201640',5.8,62960,'en','Extinction','A chief mechanic at a factory, haunted by apocalyptic nightmares, becomes a hero when Earth is invaded by a mysterious army bent on destruction.','/qjnNdjrZIdi7d316SjjkgEjJRSg.jpg','2018-07-15',96,'Released','We were not here first.','Extinction',429415,6.8969,6.1,'-ePDPGXkvlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37169,_binary '\0','/pRHv72VVgvubfP780Uavf2TSGz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3201722',4.2,1522,'en','Lumberjack Man','As the staff of Good Friends Church Camp prepares for a spring break filled with \"Fun Under the Son\", a demon logger rises from his sap boiler to wreak his vengeance and feast on flapjacks soaked in the blood of his victims.','/taXsvq2EpUTcU0QZtKYIYQ86C22.jpg','2015-10-16',105,'Released','Welcome to Summer Camp.','Lumberjack Man',356486,2.0204,5,'J47OSRORyk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37170,_binary '\0','/9GMWJm9qUNl0ay4UO5NNKQ8mbCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3201736',6,1913,'en','Run the Race','Reeling from his mother’s death and his father’s abandonment, Zach, an All-State athlete, finds glory on the football field, working to earn a college scholarship and the brothers’ ticket out of town. When a devastating injury puts Zach—and his dreams—on the sidelines, David laces up his track cleats to salvage their future and point Zach toward hope.','/1myP5YdjENipbKZYbONxZwPN8KK.jpg','2019-02-22',94,'Released','The weight of the world. The love of a brother.','Run the Race',507990,2.0967,6.8,'ZJAl7A6oTvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37171,_binary '\0','/e3UEHQQ6aj9eOJDFCiLV37X6J7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32020404',7.4,1399,'en','The Commandant\'s Shadow','While Hans Jurgen Höss enjoyed a happy childhood in the family villa at Auschwitz, Jewish prisoner Anita Lasker-Wallfisch was trying to survive the notorious concentration camp. At the heart of this film is the historic and inspiring moment – eight decades later – when the two come face-to-face. This is the first time the descendant of a major war criminal meets a survivor in such a private and intimate setting, Anita’s London living room. Together with their children, Kai Höss and Maya Lasker-Wallfisch, the four protagonists explore their very different hereditary burdens.','/tSrYAggl17tsY8rOakfZQurneNP.jpg','2024-05-29',103,'Released','His father murdered more than a million Jews at Auschwitz. She survived the camp against all odds. 80 years later, they come face to face.','The Commandant\'s Shadow',1277783,1.7386,7.2,'gMLOrFphspg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37172,_binary '\0','/nzvfltLNtIG7aChxbeoVRfpyIGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3202120',6.1,3548,'fr','Barbecue','On his 50th birthday, a man who\'s been watching his weight, health and temper all his life suffers a heart attack. He\'s been doing everything he was told he should do and it still didn\'t help. He decides to turn the page and let loose.','/f6qSHIFvo2NhvlbAi8WBehd4Xne.jpg','2014-04-30',98,'Released',NULL,'Barbecue',250349,2.2179,5.827,'A2ghPiPGf3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37173,_binary '\0','/s3pniDBtG52O26WySm6HY0YLVWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3202202',7.3,13254,'es','Palmeras en la nieve','Spain, 2003. An accidental discovery leads Clarence to travel from the snowy mountains of Huesca to Equatorial Guinea, to visit the land where her father Jacobo and her uncle Kilian spent most of their youth, the island of Fernando Poo.','/wqBmtHgsAMWbRUPLKaX90pSr3H.jpg','2015-12-25',164,'Released','Based on thousands of real stories','Palm Trees in the Snow',274109,4.3776,7.375,'FvIlsaBxs3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37174,_binary '\0','/o5x66WKv4j5pYCzgrphL8GKhW9H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3202500',6.9,1823,'hu','A berni követ','A fictional account of the 1958 attack against the Hungarian embassy in Bern. Based on a true story about the aftermath of the 1956 Hungarian revolution.','/fCOJsvbqnuXYNfcGFUpCS2zXB3S.jpg','2014-02-25',76,'Released','The Revolution Takes a Hostage','The Ambassador to Bern',257132,1.1413,6.9,'L12TgEojL0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37175,_binary '\0','/2urOiwOVe2bt2iEGOHuBvyq7yo9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3202890',5.2,7041,'en','Reclaim','After their newly adopted daughter goes missing in a small town, Steven and Shannon will stop at nothing to uncover the truth behind her disappearance and the dangerous secret behind the adoption agency they trusted. Risking their own lives, they will discover just what being a parent means and how far they will go to get their child back.','/cphb4lOZwv7Dt15YjysaaGQbiXg.jpg','2014-09-19',96,'Released','Take what\'s yours.','Reclaim',286654,2.2916,5.183,'Kk7XQqWy2VU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37176,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32029878',9.4,1785,'tr','Golden Opulence: 500 Years of Luxury in Anatolia',NULL,NULL,NULL,50,'Released',NULL,'Golden Opulence: 500 Years of Luxury in Anatolia',1618551,0.4272,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37177,_binary '\0','/A7ORUeMEexAAMeQy0YBL6ECosKf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203290',7.6,13743,'en','Free to Play','Follow three professional video game players as they overcome personal adversity, family pressures, and the realities of life to compete in a $1,000,000 tournament that could change their lives forever.','/ohLJT2UiFLsiw3SeXrbw6dxT7Fg.jpg','2014-03-19',75,'Released','One game will change their lives.','Free to Play',256561,1.3672,6.9,'R-RKqGaNq-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37178,_binary '\0','/1eLN4fAEFRxGteSnfXqUx0fsner.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32034405',7.9,1394,'hu','KIX','Handheld skate video meets hardcore social realism in a sensational film with the energy of a three-chord punk song and an unruly group of street kids in front of the camera, shot over 10 wild years of their young lives.','/rd2LT0oiro4INiYKEUWOZN3IkTG.jpg','2024-11-21',94,'Released','12 Years of troubles','KIX',1161396,1.6296,6,'Mx0TnmEjqbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37179,_binary '\0','/lVkIO3LzuTExYZ0ZMDVMDWygPtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32035059',6.5,2114,'te','నరుడి బ్రతుకు నటన','Sathya, a self-centered aspiring actor who lacks talent, believes he is meant to be famous. After facing rejection, he sets off on a journey through Kerala to learn about emotions and life. Stranded in the village of Kadamakkudy, he meets a mysterious man named D. Salman. The people he meets and the experiences he has change him in ways he never expected.','/2X54ZBnpq9MsE1JXd29jNeZxvRa.jpg','2024-10-25',125,'Released',NULL,'Narudi Brathuku Natana',1376117,0.8988,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37180,_binary '\0','/hFtgAVESS9EiIlvCmNCVs31SEYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203528',6.5,28547,'en','Bad Samaritan','A thief makes a disturbing discovery in the house where he breaks in. Later, when he returns to the same house with his partner in crime, things are no longer how he expected.','/ojCu9SLxAPwhhC2tXtHNdrTmxCH.jpg','2018-04-19',111,'Released',NULL,'Bad Samaritan',467632,4.7951,6.7,'dcObJoZftaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37181,_binary '\0','/saa1scU6UIBJi9bMEvLNzXXKnDD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203606',7.4,88044,'en','Trumbo','The career of screenwriter Dalton Trumbo is halted by a witch hunt in the late 1940s when he defies the anti-communist HUAC committee and is blacklisted.','/2RERIRnZkROSeHZAIf8PSxhzOqs.jpg','2015-10-27',124,'Released','Are you now or have you ever been...','Trumbo',294016,5.1409,7.171,'af4Ua6DUpzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37182,_binary '\0','/ysSUDoBeG5oIz7e4vkTtsuGBXfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203616',5.9,65844,'en','The Cobbler','Max Simkin repairs shoes in the same New York shop that has been in his family for generations. Disenchanted with the grind of daily life, Max stumbles upon a magical heirloom that allows him to step into the lives of his customers and see the world in a new way. Sometimes walking in another man\'s shoes is the only way one can discover who they really are.','/oMgBX4uqF1VIz95tD4iJggz6Ceh.jpg','2014-09-11',99,'Released','Saving the neighborhood one sole at a time.','The Cobbler',238215,7.16,5.874,'-1YdaG2Uapc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37183,_binary '\0','/oLHIzRF99r9PXF2rhDOe1cgqPPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203620',4.5,10366,'en','The Dinner','Two brothers and their wives meet up at a haute-cuisine restaurant to discuss what to do about a horrific crime that their sons committed together. As the quartet debate their options, the conversation reopens old wounds between the siblings.','/8rhlkQo3fqPlC9MH8wOHCu4XQjN.jpg','2017-05-05',120,'Released','How far would you go to protect your children?','The Dinner',401546,4.4906,4.5,'vLG4PRq6FAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37184,_binary '\0','/2Z0Pm7pLySHmaE16T5NINxcP7In.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203890',6.1,2096,'es','Amor a primera Visa','Rachel is an intelligent, modern-day woman constantly on the move. Primarily focused on her career as a diplomatic consul for the U.S. embassy, she\'s literally lived her life on the move, globe-trotting from city to city. Currently working in Mexico City and set to leave for London, Rachel\'s world turns upside down on the eve of her own goodbye party when she gets drunk and passes out on the street. Saved by Alejandro, a handsome Mariachi singer and single father, Rachel wakes up in his apartment with no recollection of how she got there. Nor does she remember that she rejected his visa the day before, which he desperately needs for his daughter. Romance unexpectedly blossoms between the two, but either sparks or fists will fly after she finds out his secret.','/lCXpl44L4cd4SeZ3YeooPeGcd2r.jpg','2013-10-05',111,'Released','Even with backup, he can\'t sing his way out of this one.','Pulling Strings',219553,2.1733,6.9,'3DC7xLjkqXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37185,_binary '\0','/bGupHntcldWhH1gUWAV3sjjhGE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3203910',7.6,6765,'ta','ராஜா ராணி','John and Regina, who dislike each other, are forced to get married and lead troubled lives. However, things take a turn when the couple suffers a sudden tragedy.','/szdy0Tmyc5zrz025JSTWx6EYICR.jpg','2013-09-27',160,'Released','There Is Love/Life After Love Failure','Raja Rani',224330,1.5807,7.223,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37186,_binary '\0','/6Kjby6GJxxjDpzzSDZipVph6ZY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32039267',6.7,2961,'ml','പെരുമാനി','When a mysterious stranger turns up at a remote village, superstitious locals begin to suspect he is a mythological figure. Meanwhile, rumours swirl about an unfaithful bride-to-be.','/uEx03XNu4PST3a5oCsf2TTaoYAj.jpg','2024-05-10',135,'Released',NULL,'Perumani',1245648,0.8494,5.5,'T877w1WykUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37187,_binary '\0','/lfVwTozLK9hbMXPjZTaEZ74CpKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3204144',6.6,6560,'fr','Les Combattants','Arnaud, facing an uncertain future and a dearth of choices in a small French coastal town, meets and falls for the apocalyptic-minded Madeleine, who joins an army boot camp to learn military and survival skills to prepare for the upcoming environmental collapse. Intrigued and excited by Madeleine’s wild ideas, Arnaud signs up for the boot camp himself. They soon realize that the boot camp is harder than they’d imagined, but the experience nonetheless cements them together as the couple continues to explore their young love.','/xC0QDynS4kQm2F3cQHWcR1Fx1lI.jpg','2014-08-20',98,'Released',NULL,'Love at First Fight',270343,2.0784,6.5,'p4HRqLX2cMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37188,_binary '\0','/muaflceN4wem4NTHXifCRj8upMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3204392',7.7,6017,'ja','夢と狂気の王国','Follows the behind-the-scenes work of Studio Ghibli, focusing on the notable figures Hayao Miyazaki, Isao Takahata, and Toshio Suzuki.','/ice7zuzzwcuKO5SJG7aTqYZC3EI.jpg','2013-11-16',118,'Released','A year inside the world of Studio Ghibli.','The Kingdom of Dreams and Madness',252511,2.6747,7.6,'cQ0QdgnYfwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37189,_binary '\0','/hqsT9dJOAH5hSyr02WJSZaGXSfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32045638',7.2,1469,'en','Branching Out','To help build a family tree, single mom Amelia tracks down her daughter\'s biological father. It becomes a journey of trust, love, and discovering the meaning of family.','/bKmjlkogYrU6O2uD3jMOMFhYj3O.jpg','2024-04-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Branching Out',1258761,1.5306,7.5,'XVUCrw7Ev2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37190,_binary '\0','/mnT5csbNdnAhktuMT6sgxjWltxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3204632',5.2,1465,'en','Like Me','After posting a video of herself robbing a convenience store, Kiya amasses a huge social media following. A reckless loner, she seeks some form of genuine human connection. Through her travels, she encounters a drifter, an Internet troll and a paint huffing outsider who are all pulled into her circle of chaos, junk food, and drugs.','/fwIohtH5SMaN9auXpYRcZ6jVzKx.jpg','2018-01-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Like Me',378631,1.0482,5.5,'WN6ndZINe5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37191,_binary '\0','/6iU9A1TtZKFB8222erj0UD0iYYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32047217',4.4,6500,'de','Delicious','During their vacation in the French countryside, a wealthy German family becomes entangled with a young hotel worker harboring sinister intentions.','/o1ZIvviAEuIHcH9x6sv112mSvTR.jpg','2025-02-18',102,'Released',NULL,'Delicious',1418522,2.6854,4.8,'wvYmnIZFtSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37192,_binary '\0','/HQES024QzKwPBO8YcKPCrgbF3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3205376',6.9,50517,'en','Slow West','In the Old West, a 17-year-old Scottish boy teams up with a mysterious gunman to find the woman with whom he is infatuated.','/j3PmbRZvf5KpNbapSjn8b0CpD6a.jpg','2015-05-15',84,'Released','Wanted Dead or Dead','Slow West',223485,5.1441,6.683,'8oAs_t_Z260','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37193,_binary '\0','/hWKtkjuHeFHCEm5RKGc3rw1Nnyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3205394',6.9,5953,'en','Roald Dahl\'s Esio Trot','Retired bachelor Mr Hoppy is hopelessly in love with his neighbour Mrs Silver, but she is only interested in her pet tortoise Alfie - until Mr Hoppy hatches an audacious plan.','/zr3VIk1jWxuEuECbEg2IyG7YuDb.jpg','2015-01-02',87,'Released','A retired bachelor has a thing for his neighbor who only shows affection to her pet tortoise.','Roald Dahl\'s Esio Trot',313867,3.2255,6.7,'165NXvc4JIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37194,_binary '\0','/c3c9qcUWA9u99RDipH3JL54FT6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32058735',5.8,26487,'hi','भूल चूक माफ','Ranjan, a small-town romantic boy from Banaras, lands a government job to marry Titli, but forgets to vow to Lord Shiva, causing him to be trapped in a time loop. A tale of love, fate, and redemption unfolds, as Ranjan tries to end the loop and get married.','/plWzFq6eVXOm8vpgJG0xUGmifHS.jpg','2025-05-23',121,'Released',NULL,'Bhool Chuk Maaf',1301632,1.447,6.118,'8E_IeWynvnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37195,_binary '\0','/hXVkzv6bIOC8W0BwScchaVTRZTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32060445',5.7,3396,'en','Sister Midnight','An arranged marriage in Mumbai, a cowardly, slacker husband and a slum of a house: the very ingredients that cause Uma to slowly transform into a feral and ruthless figure guided by her wildest impulses.','/6KV57QMXZXxkZB3LQHiUpPD2q16.jpg','2025-03-14',107,'Released',NULL,'Sister Midnight',1275248,2.1022,6.186,'MpC4Y4r8ftM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37196,_binary '\0','/zwSDvbnN51JqU1ULzPnEc22DkqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32063050',6.5,35589,'en','Bridget Jones: Mad About the Boy','Bridget Jones navigates life as a widow and single mum with the help of her family, friends, and former lover, Daniel. Back to work and on the apps, she\'s pursued by a younger man and maybe – just maybe – her son\'s science teacher.','/e5VR3nhLYG60znxaqU84wv4VSCb.jpg','2025-02-12',124,'Released','She\'s starting a new chapter. Just as she is.','Bridget Jones: Mad About the Boy',1272149,16.0835,6.35,'7sSNobjiep4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37197,_binary '\0','/cc48kfehVAkgG73BsPcFLMoxa8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32063098',5.9,26564,'en','Ballad of a Small Player','Amid the glittering casinos of Macau, a gambler running from his past—and his debts—becomes fascinated by an enigmatic woman at the baccarat table.','/yiXpXNiBWENaSJmdKfoT5DU0bL4.jpg','2025-10-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Ballad of a Small Player',1272166,8.9617,5.8,'z1B5W55TFyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37198,_binary '\0','/3fvrwIgHOiOQTuOTt4rDDMNF7IL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32065103',6.4,3094,'en','Secrets of the Neanderthals','This documentary delves into the mysteries surrounding the Neanderthals and what their fossil record tells us about their lives and disappearance.','/j0CWLFH50qVjEbPZ1TowFxjOVFW.jpg','2024-05-02',80,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of the Neanderthals',1255030,2.8622,6.642,'b5YtgLSU_sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37199,_binary '\0','/bZLEd10wI75F7u8eZKwi8WCZtFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32065777',6.5,5895,'te','నాగబంధం','A chosen warrior protects a