o, Colonel Birger Eriksen, commander of the undermanned Oscarsborg Fortress, makes a bold decision that changes the course of history.','/4JgvnUEggEMx6lEUu0eOq6XfMP7.jpg','2025-09-26',94,'Released',NULL,'Battle of Oslo',1272586,3.3013,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37204,_binary '\0','/gMDGov7yzowLP92yf8AzMkOrcfD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32080855',7.6,1851,'zh','大濛','Yue\'s brother was executed by the government. Determined to bring his body back home, Yue goes to Taipei alone and finds help in Chao Kung-tao, a discharged soldier. Two people with no relations become friends in need, embarking on a journey that could cost them their lives.','/nj1QyqHN48Wn66U9JYXIywNX8Nj.jpg','2025-11-27',134,'Released',NULL,'A Foggy Tale',1174334,3.65,7.6,'NJom40QgsZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37205,_binary '\0','/8y8pxJwYEK1WvQAfoZTwC601eD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32080876',7.8,19383,'ta','டிராகன்','Raghavan transforms from a school topper into a “bad boy” to score girls in college, but ends up a heartbroken dropout. He then cons his way into a successful finance career, but the lies keep building and maintaining the facade proves tricky.','/vKNJPuejtE6Xrp6RK6LKsQcbL8L.jpg','2025-02-21',157,'Released','Worst student of the decade.','Dragon',1273049,3.9109,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37206,_binary '\0','/4VIy13OpUSGFXYnX5ZHUFHWSK5N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32081990',7.1,2036,'te','Roudhra Rupaya','Adhya and abinaya are born sisters hailing from Hyderabad. They lost their parents at their child hood and relied upon their grand father there after. They usually take life as it comes and live with they have. Adhya has completed her education and serving at Telangana Tourism Department while abinaya is still persuing her degree. Adhya had raised her sister abinaya.','/20t46SAwPofAPBWiRuT7roQiyNu.jpg','2024-04-12',112,'Released',NULL,'Roudhra Rupaya',1374335,0.4835,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37207,_binary '\0','/f2sHokGVEOcJI1Fkgdf21XYhok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32083311',7,2861,'en','On Becoming a Guinea Fowl','On an empty road in the middle of the night, Shula stumbles across the body of her uncle. As funeral proceedings begin around them, she and her cousins bring to light the buried secrets of their middle-class Zambian family.','/6lMOpD8XVLKaB5uCsJXt1Fo7XNh.jpg','2024-12-06',99,'Released',NULL,'On Becoming a Guinea Fowl',1082938,3.4007,7.6,'P5BWTLZjYR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37208,_binary '\0','/vfbxysLCXrvcI8NdzeQTR1Kxfky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32084246',5.3,9372,'en','Mary','A miraculous conception. A merciless king. A murderous pursuit. Mary\'s journey to give birth to Jesus unfolds in this biblical coming-of-age epic.','/wpApuf1xky92ug8n5mP5aP7DiDy.jpg','2024-12-12',112,'Released','Her grace changed the world. Her courage lit the way.','Mary',1243381,3.9705,6.3,'d74vHvsACSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37209,_binary '\0','/doFNxTRqDMCLitu838v5Ciuw0si.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32085997',6.7,5196,'fr','Miséricorde','Jérémie returns to his hometown for the funeral of his former boss, the village baker. He decides to stay for a few days with Martine, the man\'s widow. A mysterious disappearance, a threatening neighbor and a priest with strange intentions make Jérémie\'s short stay in the village take an unexpected turn.','/7LVCXVdsGPPXRYGu5SRqgfVP96h.jpg','2024-10-16',104,'Released','Some confessions come with a body count.','Misericordia',1063574,2.7568,6.4,'U5wEV2fBcpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37210,_binary '\0','/gF46j4Lv1FaKHfhuSAMY5OSyO3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086032',7,2182,'fr','Le Royaume','Lesia, a teenager, is taken by a man to a villa where her fugitive father and his men are hiding. A war erupts, leading to death and a chase where father and daughter bond.','/6sR2P5P5SE8wZwMsfsLCO7J7Drp.jpg','2024-11-13',111,'Released',NULL,'The Kingdom',1079311,2.3855,7.1,'gbXODfsp1Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37211,_binary '\0','/momk3fWl6F61kgfObqfIVCWBzPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086034',7,4721,'fr','Vingt Dieux','In the western part of the French Alps: After the drunk driving death of his father, 18-year-old Totone must look after his younger sister. He pursues a €30k Comté cheese award he has no hope of winning. Good thing Marie-Lise takes a liking for him!','/A3C3TbcB5hIm4aPPU3eZJrMxBYc.jpg','2024-12-11',92,'Released','Cheese gets better with age… unless you’re the youngest ever Comté champion!','Holy Cow',1079310,2.7113,6.9,'Q55naIp7PCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37212,_binary '\0','/pq6IdEEXEfrcT8O1dzuqkPCUvVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086046',7.6,7820,'fr','L\'Histoire de Souleymane','As he pedals through the streets of Paris to deliver meals, Souleymane recounts his story. In two days, he has to go through his asylum application interview, the key to obtaining papers, but Souleymane is not ready.','/ns8tSpfBL63Y5Pi84C6Dzr3vlm4.jpg','2024-10-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Souleymane\'s Story',1158996,4.0981,7.516,'Rbs53_uMw9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37213,_binary '\0','/aCA4sHUWU8qaGXCw3TVD2qzzQXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086069',5.8,1219,'fr','Marcello Mio','Pressured from all sides by the figure of her father, Chiara Mastroianni decides to bring him back to life through her own self. She goes by the name of Marcello, dresses like him and asks to now be considered an actor, not an actress. The people around her believe this to be a temporary joke, but Chiara is determined not to give up her new identity…','/gr3oOAUYR4ttdYPfd1Nr9bUMCf5.jpg','2024-05-21',121,'Released',NULL,'Marcello Mio',1145608,1.7734,5.8,'zIi8zAYomZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37214,_binary '\0','/xrIicBg0Ac4oQ6cwUPKJxwtqhOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086077',7,14318,'ml','പ്രഭയായ് നിനച്ചതെല്ലാം','In Mumbai, Nurse Prabha\'s routine is troubled when she receives an unexpected gift from her estranged husband. Her younger roommate, Anu, tries in vain to find a spot in the city to be intimate with her boyfriend. A trip to a beach town allows them to find a space for their desires to manifest.','/ruImrzB4POsrgwCMozmOBV67zs5.jpg','2024-09-21',118,'Released',NULL,'All We Imagine as Light',927547,7.4184,6.8,'2mgQcpmYr_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37215,_binary '\0','/xRKxStA35m7vwO9LZWS7gEMfQ7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32086252',6,2328,'te','పారిజాత పర్వం','Two different gangs, one with Chaitanya, an aspiring filmmaker and his friend Harsha and another gang with Bar Seenu and his partner Parvathy, try to kidnap the same person which unfolds a big conspiracy.','/doGAzINwc6m8k170boSLk80DtwC.jpg','2024-04-19',133,'Released',NULL,'Parijatha Parvam',1276808,0.794,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37216,_binary '\0','/hQtDgmipKwos41K5vD2lIiSAF0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32089590',8.9,3193,'te','భలే ఉన్నాడే',NULL,'/pNQFUnBr3tobPoZKJyINEHj3tTe.jpg','2024-09-07',137,'Released',NULL,'Bhale Unnade',1321944,0.8462,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37217,_binary '\0','/29orFU2bT0cgvzN0ZbCItaQeyPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32089689',6,4574,'ml','മന്ദാകിനി','Aromal and Ambili tied the knot.Aromal was really excited and delighted to start a life with Ambili but on that wedding night an unlikely incident happened which will put the entire family in complex situation.','/m7SqXQMYQ3XxFqJ36fubgVYDZBO.jpg','2024-05-24',125,'Released',NULL,'Mandakini',1259108,1.0544,5.2,'cdcG9fYoCpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37218,_binary '\0','/xWBiXclrRmTggQHMRsIn84YHavs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32093575',4.8,56409,'en','Scary Movie','Twenty-six years after outrunning a suspiciously familiar masked killer, the Core Four are back in the killer\'s crosshairs and no horror movie IP is safe.','/znHT8peERZRWG1ME3r0Db0EV8k8.jpg','2026-06-03',96,'Released','Every line will be crossed.','Scary Movie',1273221,52.4836,6.375,'0fZ58S-7QP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37219,_binary '\0','/gnPIyudusp5s8ivkyBiNNYPL0Ik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32094375',4.3,6190,'en','Die Hart 2: Die Harter','The second film following Die Hart starring Kevin Hart','/hssPOvCwuSJ3RvuJCYe3P6yrKuK.jpg','2024-05-30',1,'Released',NULL,'Die Hart 2: Die Harter',1771512,2.2541,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37220,_binary '\0','/wOZvsn941QaQEIZWkeqJLXWPBcD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32095441',5.1,1221,'es','Mikaela','During the eve of the 6th of January, a record-breaking snowstorm sweeps across Spain. In the midst of its chaos, a group of robbers seizes the opportunity to hijack an armoured van. A few meters away is Leo, a finished policeman who has nothing to lose. With the unexpected aid of a young woman, he will try to stop the band from running away with their loot.','/jm6lNbpmKcxX6M0pieaKhP6hs3w.jpg','2025-01-31',90,'Released','A storm. A heist. A cop on the edge.','Mikaela',1315988,3.7044,6.2,'iAJcJqPY4zI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37221,_binary '\0','/mj3RFamNUleZB94zMWgGnJkQCAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32104007',6.9,13500,'en','Young Washington','Before he led a nation, George Washington was a young soldier thrown into a global conflict. With alliances crumbling and war closing in, he must choose who to trust and confront the leader he\'s becoming.','/6CdoTKnRQHJkjRGxTefFGkPQplB.jpg','2026-07-02',121,'Released','250 years of history begins with one man.','Young Washington',1308767,14.2942,7.8,'LJek-kc384w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37222,_binary '\0','/oOyFOEnucVpdbIQj5GIyHZfRhS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32105116',6.1,2341,'ml','പ്രിൻസ് and Family','Introverted bridal boutique owner, Prince, the town\'s most eligible bachelor, marries his polar opposite. Chaos and comedy ensue as their contrasting personalities clash in rural Kerala.','/bsFg2yv4zeOSbch0K3xxObrvux1.jpg','2025-05-09',134,'Released',NULL,'Prince and Family',1268170,1.2338,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37223,_binary '\0','/efLOHrBRRA8ICaRfIGygVcEi2Vm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32106176',4.6,5698,'hi','Kesari Veer','The movie narrates the tale of Hamirji Gohil, a brave warrior who fought against the Tughlaq Empire to protect the Somnath Temple and the Hindu faith.','/fRNg31Cz03qsx3EteqHhcQgLcTa.jpg','2025-05-23',161,'Released',NULL,'Kesari Veer',1412646,1.0837,6.7,'nDAZqAuk5eM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37224,_binary '\0','/hONTXxtQVSYySKW5f3nRndKUfhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3210686',5.8,20504,'en','Son of God','In the Holy Land, the Roman occupation has produced a cauldron of oppression, anxiety and excessive taxes levied upon the Jewish people. Fearing the wrath of Roman governor Pontius Pilate , Jewish high priest Caiaphas tries to keep control of his people. That control is threatened when Jesus arrives in Jerusalem, performing miracles and spreading messages of love and hope. Those who fear that Jesus will inspire a revolution decide that he must die.','/ayqHV0rHuAdMv8PS497W2OByGWk.jpg','2014-02-28',138,'Released','Their Empire. His Kingdom.','Son of God',235260,5.0341,6.829,'-Hsl5UG9O_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37225,_binary '\0','/nxfTX8gwgp9EI7HNEI0ptWLore6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3210830',6.1,1495,'pt','Os Homens São de Marte... E é pra Lá Que Eu Vou!','Successful at work, Fernanda is an example of women of the third millennium, free to make their choices and independent. Yet in her personal life she finds herself struggling to find a husband. Like other women of her generation, Fernanda put her personal life on hold to devote herself to her career and now suddenly feels her love life situation has become an emergency. Being single at 39 is quite different from being single at 29, after all \"the fertile egg has an expiration date\"!','/Aa0RQfTuGNgvOzNzhIT6G0KnB0U.jpg','2014-05-02',108,'Released',NULL,'Men Are from Mars... And That\'s Where I\'m Going!',227970,1.6415,6.657,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37226,_binary '\0','/usWuY9Xax6RixXUX3raFiRflAbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3211400',6.5,2906,'es','A cambio de nada','One summer, Dario flees the hellish environment of his home. Luismi, unconditional friend, a poor devil with pretensions of winning, and Antonia, an old woman who collects abandoned his motorcar furniture, become his new family. Three generations living together in a city too big to be alone.','/1a4LucsNHNsyl33ZVyiEaXbTHOK.jpg','2015-05-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Nothing in Return',326198,2.2485,6.4,'XIwPPoWPlmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37227,_binary '\0','/9BocSz94EKs6sicmKKnUrSMi9S7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32119268',7.1,1496,'pt','Baby','After being released from a juvenile detention center, Wellington finds himself alone and adrift on the streets of São Paulo, without any contact from his parents and lacking the resources to rebuild his life. During a visit to a porn theater, he encounters Ronaldo, a mature man, who teaches him new ways of surviving. Gradually, their relationship turns into a conflicting passion, oscillating between exploitation and protection, jealousy and complicity.','/2vOI8fX71B6QP4teu50Ml5DnKBg.jpg','2025-01-09',107,'Released',NULL,'Baby',1274746,3.5756,7.1,'BOLM5s0jVVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37228,_binary '\0','/fL1taHfNljQnbXTr6fbmrCnrCnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32121131',7.1,1644,'zh','逆行人生','A moment of impulsiveness turns Gao Zhilei into a \"stay-at-home\" individual, but he never expected his life to take a turn in the opposite direction. A series of changes compel him to take on his responsibilities as the head of the family. When life\'s burdens hit hard, he must confront himself and start anew.','/mxgOFXxwi2AkCEZbr795aQJYNKX.jpg','2024-08-03',121,'Released',NULL,'Upstream',1274925,2.1556,6.8,'L6IdMJ9pRgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37229,_binary '\0','/ox6qOu33CSE48bNcArrqqCp4NUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212232',5.4,17556,'en','I Am Wrath','A man is out for justice after a group of corrupt police officers are unable to catch his wife\'s killer.','/6NvLA3BP5ktLaZ1qdLY0oHsaqwD.jpg','2016-04-14',92,'Released','I lay my vengeance upon them.','I Am Wrath',332411,8.5293,5.781,'bLSGiaLz_sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37230,_binary '\0','/q9bvjUkpKltPE0S9oxci2pmD1Zx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32123395',3.6,2672,'en','Altered','In an alternate present, genetically enhanced humans dominate society. Outcasts Leon and Chloe fight for justice against corrupt politicians exploiting genetic disparity, risking everything to challenge the oppressive system.','/jVgLvefoKxVK92bdycXwN2a2Sem.jpg','2025-09-18',85,'Released','Fight the system. Change the world.','Altered',1309012,4.8524,5.585,'1L3MJyqAeOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37231,_binary '\0','/wOlNKlBeTUbWAJAbeXtq6VWai9v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212408',6.4,1359,'en','Beautiful Something','Four diverse gay men navigate art, sex and love in one sublime night.','/1q9PlHdGpQSJeO5wEZnGSKL8Xa3.jpg','2015-04-26',93,'Released','Beauty is in the unexpected.','Beautiful Something',349087,1.5582,5.2,'OsdiloOPucI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37232,_binary '\0','/lHWI3CbavsE1NfmH5QLS0vLSdVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212568',7.1,2003,'de','Beltracchi - Die Kunst der Fälschung','Wolfgang Beltracchi got away with forging art masterpieces for over 40 years. He may be egotistical and nihilistic, but his genius in undeniable. He managed to fool gallery owners, historians and investors with the stroke of a brush. This documentary follows his last days as a free man.','/lX9pKMa54j0ZDKAuuNDrAf15jXr.jpg','2014-03-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Beltracchi: The Art of Forgery',256314,1.6703,7.1,'TS6a3XochQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37233,_binary '\0','/qRH1FvjhIcmqPItexm6lypLwrsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212608',4.2,2728,'en','Algorithm: BLISS','Vic Beckett, a brilliant researcher, creates the ultimate App that taps into the pleasure center of the brain and transmits a feeling of nirvana to the user.','/lYtL1lK8zKPTbIzNlhUsCoswLVA.jpg','2020-06-02',99,'Released','Euphoria That Kills','Algorithm: BLISS',699465,1.153,4.2,'jwSSuQKva8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37234,_binary '\0','/476HYWACxnqLpDPoGQqPTiDEDK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32126803',8.5,3039,'zh','八月','The documentary marks the directorial debut of Chinese actor Zhang Zhehan, it documents his deeply personal journey of self-healing in the aftermath of a devastating cyber media storm in August 2021 that abruptly halted his acting career.','/2YjOwZmn1ZrGDt7JzWhZFFkbHvS.jpg','2024-04-14',53,'Released',NULL,'August',1278741,0.9181,9.5,'tAOl77RPzQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37235,_binary '\0','/8Jc9HBJQpFuk5QSB5XlaOoW5t23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32127524',5.4,3850,'tr','Takıntılar','The film, adapted from French writer Laurent Baffie’s play “Toc Toc,” revolves around the adventures of six individuals with obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) whose appointments with renowned psychiatrist Orhan Kerim Baykal overlap, only to find that the doctor is nowhere to be found.','/gMZGiMBsNx50a94ioI09nhnrBYf.jpg','2024-11-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Takıntılar',1285495,1.0081,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37236,_binary '\0','/qW5LsOjND9IqkySlFlsixO9hlAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212812',6.7,4101,'pt','Minha Mãe é uma Peça 2: O Filme','Dona Hermínia is back, but now rich and famous since she is the host of her own successful TV show. However, the overprotective character will have to deal with her children\'s departures, as Marcelina and Juliano decide to move out. In counterpart, she will welcome, as a visitor, her sister Lúcia Helena, who\'s been living in New York.','/eDApDWU6r9zxk9MZLc6rfnBb3vu.jpg','2016-12-22',88,'Released',NULL,'My Mom Is a Character 2',227932,1.7707,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37237,_binary '\0','/fBYPyoNqmhbDTrNFMK7PEm8J0eS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212830',6.8,1422,'en','Love Finds You In Sugarcreek','Will a mysterious stranger\'s past wreak havoc on a quiet Amish community after they\'ve opened their doors -- and hearts -- to him and his son?','/8munjaSfqp561Dj98GHRLZdFscd.jpg','2014-06-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Love Finds You In Sugarcreek',289225,2.1806,6.5,'qtYtXs07HI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37238,_binary '\0','/8jCs6O8dZq6Dg2sOuDx6AQryeuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32128317',6.4,2172,'es','Volveréis','After 15 years together, Ale and Alex choose an unconventional way to part ways: by hosting a party to celebrate their separation. Their unexpected decision leaves friends and family confused, forcing everyone to confront their own views on love, relationships, and new beginnings in this bittersweet, heartfelt story.','/jWHEfq6QRwPS9xRz4pzY3oBRSxD.jpg','2024-08-28',114,'Released',NULL,'The Other Way Around',1214118,3.0592,6.4,'-tLg3p8dVDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37239,_binary '\0','/54WscT5majJBU3MbeHLc2BOywdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3212904',5.4,14083,'en','Curve','A soon-to-be bride on her way to a wedding rehearsal is having second thoughts and decides to take a detour. Her car breaks down and a hitch-hiker offers help. Could it be fate?','/9AGJMNrUfBMIGkCeKNccQbj0Nyg.jpg','2015-08-31',86,'Released',NULL,'Curve',347754,3.9041,5.8,'n297-KgI5Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:0