,'In the early autumn of 1985 the police are seeing the consequences of a shocking and mysterious incident that took place in an isolated mountain hut in the Balkan Mountains. The film \"Roseville \" is artistic interpretations inspired by eyewitness accounts and clues found within the cabin.Vasil ( Kalin Vratchanski ) and Nadia ( Lydia Indjova ) are a young couple who arrive on holiday in \"Roseville\". There they meet the keeper George ( Plamen Manassiev ) and his best friend Dora ( Elena Petrova ). Later joining the gang is Stephen Court ( David Chokachi ) - an old associate of George. The presence of Vasil unlocked \" storm \" of unexplained events that will test the sanity of all. Everyone faces the the horror of their own fears and the invisible force that wants to control them, lurking in the dark and quietly knocks on the door to their minds.','/mmQnPUUdw6a1D9kkmDPRDQK08zj.jpg','2013-12-20',120,'Released','It\'s too late to be afraid','Roseville',291163,1.8086,5.6,'YABfWqjPlos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37245,_binary '\0','/k13za3wUhd8uejKJ2v9XQsRjxaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32135632',6.2,1236,'en','LifeHack','A thrill-seeking gang of teen hackers must pull off their riskiest heist yet when a woman blackmails them into targeting her crypto-billionaire father.','/ab8uFG6L3gKnog7ntrUdgo28hzK.jpg','2026-05-15',97,'Released','They\'re coming for your coin.','LifeHack',1285669,5.9963,7.036,'TxxUGasZUNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37246,_binary '\0','/kTx0OshQyYMMJ8EtWwV9DDKNf0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32135710',5.4,1731,'ml','ബ്രോമാൻസ്','Binto teams up with his brother\'s friends for a thrilling adventure to find him, leading to unexpected twists, discoveries, and unforgettable moments.','/2xzgtY0d7xbqeTWdF3tDgd5WeVM.jpg','2025-02-14',139,'Released',NULL,'Bromance',1274225,1.4053,5.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37247,_binary '\0','/9jiqrAgC9DoWKte8qc5gis0fWem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32135720',4.6,1286,'te','మాస్ జాతర','A transport officer battles a violent drug lord and his criminal clan.','/qvSyQdI2Mlpa5X7dRDBmIi30oHT.jpg','2025-10-31',144,'Released','మనదే ఇదంతా','Mass Jathara',1381405,2.1368,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37248,_binary '\0','/pTWmpKDCgZhJpNfCS8rEGTnkKB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32135732',8.5,5954,'kn','ದಿ ಡೆವಿಲ್','Rajashekar (Chief Minister of Karnataka) is framed, so his secretary recruits Krishna, a kindhearted lookalike, to impersonate the violent heir Dhanush. When the real Dhanush returns, both men clash for political power and Rukmini’s love. Krishna must protect Rukmini from Dhanush while also rising as a leader the people trust.','/gbL5xX5qo6LSsfnfEXN1BIPLKH.jpg','2025-12-11',167,'Released','The Hero vs The Devil','The Devil',1245535,1.9692,1.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37249,_binary '\0','/fm2g5jq1mE1WRjf4XJbWJznGpId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3213684',7,6973,'et','1944','The events of the war in 1944, from the Blue Hills to Sõrve Peninsula. Shown through the eyes of Estonian soldiers who had to pick sides and fight against fellow brothers. Choices have to be made, not only by the soldiers, but also by their loved ones.','/3DyGmQ53Tj4iSvYxMrj3x4o5kwy.jpg','2015-02-20',100,'Released','The first casualty of war is truth','1944',321303,2.069,6.9,'E6A4nLqOW6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37250,_binary '\0','/dMloNvayweggmvv0UD0iOJIkkbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32138452',5.9,11589,'fr','Ad Vitam','When he and his pregnant wife are attacked in their home, a former elite agent becomes trapped in a deadly manhunt tied to his own painful past.','/8qJfjFhNwpTONNAoE6gUSx2yGpg.jpg','2025-01-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Ad Vitam',1261501,4.2383,6.225,'gMmF9uWqzK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37251,_binary '\0','/xmPdcsxOXukLUcF7dJd2z2rmUpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32138523',7.7,8632,'sv','Avicii - I\'m Tim','Before Avicii, there was Tim. Through his own words, witness how a prodigious musical talent became one of the defining artists of his generation.','/bHrkrKQxYKem0ljWHPinIQK2gxy.jpg','2024-06-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Avicii - I\'m Tim',1275945,6.5597,8.1,'X8LHNaCHYsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37252,_binary '\0','/jtMzyOnIly9aciwV3z5TcczVstI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32139458',5.5,1521,'en','A Desert','A photographer’s road trip takes a dark turn when he befriends a reckless couple, plunging him into a nightmarish neo-noir spiral of unpredictable horror.','/vd194U3uHmxs5rZBV2QU7HNDdEf.jpg','2025-05-02',103,'Released',NULL,'A Desert',1276038,1.7966,6.1,'8uJVoj-GS0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37253,_binary '\0','/z3lw2NBdxhh2vfhDkZpHkAa0Tm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3214002',6.1,5672,'en','Video Games: The Movie','From executive producer Zach Braff and director Jeremy Snead, \"Video Games: The Movie\" is an epic feature length documentary chronicling the meteoric rise of video games from nerd niche to multi-billion dollar industry. Narrated by Sean Astin and featuring in-depth interviews with the godfathers who started it all, the icons of game design, and the geek gurus who are leading us into the future, \"Video Games: The Movie\" is a celebration of gaming from Atari to Xbox and an eye-opening look at what lies ahead.','/l5lIK1sM5UeCE2IozXdgv1oOSlA.jpg','2014-07-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Video Games: The Movie',269100,2.6457,6.2,'-9g19Y3FO18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37254,_binary '\0','/uJ0YJhV5aGYyTROazRuF0uNa6WR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32140747',6.4,1911,'en','The Christmas Quest','An archaeologist, her ex-husband who is a Norse language expert, search for legendary treasure in Iceland during Christmas. Others join the hunt, leading to a thrilling race to secure the treasure before the wrong people obtain it.','/iWdCr0xFWQP2ei05pFpduyrTxwg.jpg','2024-12-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Quest',1325912,1.3396,6.8,'4Z2KPvw55kU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37255,_binary '\0','/hHDNOlATHhre4eZ7aYz5cdyJLik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32141377',7.2,126743,'en','28 Years Later: The Bone Temple','Dr. Kelson finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike\'s encounter with Jimmy Crystal becomes a nightmare he can\'t escape.','/kK1BGkG3KAvWB0WMV1DfOx9yTMZ.jpg','2026-01-14',109,'Released','Fear is the new faith.','28 Years Later: The Bone Temple',1272837,24.0893,7.087,'EOwTdTZA8D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37256,_binary '\0','/mNAeTVzSMiBTRQkKYDmmBrbaP8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32141590',7.4,1735,'en','Witches','A deeply personal documentary that examines the relationship between cinematic portrayals of witches and the all-too-real experiences of postpartum depression by utilising footage that spans the entirety of film history alongside heartrending personal testimony.','/zdQLz6TmexpUBVKY1cLdf9EZTYB.jpg','2024-06-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Witches',1276031,1.6375,7.697,'_qwx5350Bj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37257,_binary '\0','/mhf4JUcIzn4kEJUFxJzm4qiYgQY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3214240',6.8,4163,'en','Snow Bride','When a reporter encounters the eldest son of a famous political family at a mountain retreat, she winds up pretending to be his girlfriend over Christmas so he can save face with his family. Should she secretly expose newsworthy scoops about the famous family in order to save her job, or trust that she\'s falling in love for real? Stars Patricia Richardson and Katrina Law.','/QiRWSeBSY2LJxpTXfN5QeyJoLX.jpg','2013-11-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Snow Bride',235662,1.811,6.3,'-XeOzredx9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37258,_binary '\0','/tjiLWxiRE1Cfgl77zMz0Ad5jkMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3214248',5.3,1699,'en','All Relative','Things couldn\'t be going better for Harry and Grace, a young New York City couple in love, until Grace\'s mother turns Harry\'s world upside down.','/frVEZwXCdrmcxM6G7rn5VTJtTwf.jpg','2014-11-21',85,'Released',NULL,'All Relative',298935,1.3668,5.5,'vxyRGF9ZxIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37259,_binary '\0','/oAiqaBzPB3wsfvplA4PHpaNpB9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3214286',6.8,2355,'en','Beyond the Brick: A LEGO® Brickumentary','A look at the global culture and appeal of the LEGO building-block toys.','/ojBg3yJfsqzi1maypHV7sW7COcn.jpg','2014-11-09',93,'Released','If you thought you knew the world of Lego, YOU DON\'T KNOW BRICK!','A LEGO Brickumentary',251471,2.6266,5.9,'hw53u2mtpMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37260,_binary '\0','/1Xxr8zwRZDNeUD65O9m663P6A5K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32147653',4.4,1690,'en','The Stranger in My Home','A handsome stranger\'s claim that a couple\'s 15-year-old daughter was switched at birth throws their perfect family into turmoil, unearthing shattering secrets.','/8rxFUdvtFwAxbyZfSBKPB2Vaal9.jpg','2025-06-23',94,'Released',NULL,'The Stranger in My Home',1389255,5.6104,5.6,'jGS4VKMQE_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37261,_binary '\0','/aeMwiZOalyFDPQhbdwT7kHeIRKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32149731',7.5,1891,'en','¡Casa Bonita Mi Amor!','Casa Bonita opened in 1974 in an unassuming strip mall. The massive \"Disneyland of Mexican restaurants\" is an Old West and Acapulco-inspired fever dream made famous by its indoor waterfall, cliff divers, and haunted caves, and was featured in a classic 2003 episode of South Park. When its creators, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, learn that Casa Bonita might close its doors for good, they attempt to preserve a crumbling piece of their childhood and Denver history.','/nEktirdxkXk42NuM8WGlUcP9D28.jpg','2024-09-06',88,'Released','¡Una película DOCUMENTARY espectacular!','¡Casa Bonita Mi Amor!',1278666,1.9168,7.3,'I4TkkS7xePY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37262,_binary '\0','/akBGSguhkAj1TXOdZUcL11e1hpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32149847',6.1,59399,'en','Drop','Violet, a widowed mother on her first date in years, arrives at an upscale restaurant where she is relieved that her date, Henry, is more charming and handsome than she expected. But their chemistry begins to curdle as Violet begins being irritated and then terrorized by a series of anonymous drops to her phone.','/hSQPSW8aLjsMBfwqGjgJ6HozTkp.jpg','2025-04-07',95,'Released','Everyone\'s a suspect.','Drop',1249213,10.2867,6.292,'bs_nFwh5eJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37263,_binary '\0','/qtHHjRkCPNHu7qBSQ2M8v7lYz3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32150119',7.6,1935,'en','The Thinking Game','Chronicles the extraordinary life of visionary scientist Demis Hassabis and his relentless quest to solve the enigma of artificial general intelligence.','/jNMzCuUIt5tfHYJEpCIef7oqkfI.jpg','2025-03-21',84,'Released',NULL,'The Thinking Game',1276011,1.1242,7.2,'J5XFYMsczy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37264,_binary '\0','/gLmtl78GANjceMGclJ6RR6GXniT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3215258',7,2877,'ta','வருத்தப்படாத வாலிபர் சங்கம்','Two fun-loving youngsters Bosepandi and his friend create a lot of nuisance to the villagers. After having fallen for the daughter of the village chief, Bosepandi needs to use his wits to marry her.','/mWXvOXdvS9j8Va9XFIE993yIGEA.jpg','2013-09-06',158,'Released',NULL,'Varuthapadatha Valibar Sangam',219818,1.3358,6.2,'ky4Yy8_KbZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37265,_binary '\0','/4AoJGNiwbkGKDFROfzYk4MQsVWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3215356',7.5,4400,'ta','வணக்கம் சென்னை','Tricked by a fraudster, Ajay and Anjali are forced to stay in the same flat. They gradually warm up to each other and start getting romantic notions but the arrival of Deepak, Anjali\'s fiance, puts them in a dilemma.','/cN5VIYKifPPgDZHa6gv1DOctfdN.jpg','2013-10-11',151,'Released',NULL,'Vanakkam Chennai',227062,1.4401,5.8,'K_qbqzA64lM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37266,_binary '\0','/88mJT3XKOENMw3A6Gj0owzN4KJV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3215518',6.7,1732,'ta','என்றென்றும் புன்னகை','Gowtham has a troubled childhood once his mother goes astray. He develops a dislike towards women in general and would often been seen in a pensive mood. Things change for the better when he bonds with Sri and Baby at school. They make a pact that they would never marry in life. When circumstances force Sri and Baby to deviate from this, the bonding of the trio breaks and Gowtham comes to understanding how his perceived misconceptions about life is so untrue.','/kggSe3wKy8fOfBO5VLqy4cyODMJ.jpg','2013-12-20',155,'Released',NULL,'Endrendrum Punnagai',243706,1.2206,6.438,'cbTl0pdow7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37267,_binary '\0','/kFK6FpbbEvVKDH956qTKEHB4Sfp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32155665',6,2268,'es','53 domingos','When three siblings agree to meet and discuss their aging father\'s future, their reunion spirals into bickering, bantering and reliving old grudges.','/olk6MkfHFWEpWmhQn6Mb4jNqspm.jpg','2026-03-26',78,'Released',NULL,'53 Sundays',1276704,5.2326,5.95,'WJ4x4b8iHsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37268,_binary '\0','/hskumwh02jQyE7TXymanIqdliGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32155764',7.5,1526,'mr','गुलकंद','At least 10 known health benefits of \'Gulkand\' (Rose-Petal Jam). This film is about the 11th and perhaps the most important benefit - Happiness—a film as sweet, fragrant and healthy as the condiment itself. Nostalgia re-creates relationship drama like no other emotion. When young lovers unite - the whole world conspires to challenge them at every step...but what happens when \'older lovers\' re-unite? Gulkand is one such rosy sweet story that celebrates the innocence; the high-strung emotions; the melodrama; the sweetness and the tragic-comedy nature of the perpetual global pandemic - love.','/64gl71tIpVPDwxYZKJNP1rbo1Xl.jpg','2025-05-01',146,'Released',NULL,'Gulkand',1442053,1.1959,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37269,_binary '\0','/ouOojiypBE6CD1aqcHPVq7cJf2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3215824',6,81868,'en','Those Who Wish Me Dead','A young boy finds himself pursued by two assassins in the Montana wilderness, with a survival expert determined to protect him, and a forest fire threatening to consume them all.','/xCEg6KowNISWvMh8GvPSxtdf9TO.jpg','2021-05-05',100,'Released','Nature finds a way.','Those Who Wish Me Dead',578701,13.4895,6.6,'sV6VNNjBkcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37270,_binary '\0','/iLzJg2Awh3OBazimfbPC1ZDqP05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3215826',5.3,2098,'en','Kids in Love','Drifting through his gap year with its internships and travel plans, Jack has always suspected there was more to life than this. A chance encounter with the beautiful and ethereal Evelyn swerves his life radically off course.','/m0lQkwoNSmD10D3efZ7AQN7mg4X.jpg','2016-08-26',87,'Released','Sometimes the only way to find yourself is to lose yourself completely','Kids in Love',396557,2.266,5.7,'jGf_XcGptuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37271,_binary '\0','/x0J0OMKwnX1eeVRQWeb2D05yd3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32159989',5.7,24870,'en','After the Hunt','A college professor finds herself at a personal and professional crossroads when a star pupil levels an accusation against one of her colleagues, and a dark secret from her own past threatens to come to light.','/ryF8QPGUGlo8gRB4OYKb4J0r3aJ.jpg','2025-10-09',139,'Released','Not everything is supposed to make you comfortable.','After the Hunt',1265063,13.4633,5.68,'A8R6DMlDtxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37272,_binary '\0','/dpbzuMANVn5LLZykzmn2EpMOuQa.