a whirlwind one-night-stand. Offering herself as an accomplice in his seductive crimes, the unhinged lovers embark on a deadly odyssey amplified by wild sex, unbridled jealousy, and passionate forays into the dark arts.','/7cRgaaD8EdM5hfw6lHSSSG8mEq8.jpg','2014-11-26',93,'Released','Fervidly dark lovesick horror inspired by the real-life criminal duo, the Lonely Hearts Killers.','Alleluia',269776,1.8021,5.9,'typEhbREaPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37281,_binary '\0','/qPWwUuUH2839fhw8fm0XX3Wg6bo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32186523',7,1769,'ro','Trei kilometri până la capătul lumii','Adi, a gay teenager, is spending the summer in his home village in the Danube Delta. One night he is brutally attacked on the street, the next day his world is turned upside-down. His parents no longer look at him as they did, and the seeming tranquility of the village starts to crack.','/gg8gyJ7LvQQVjojmStwBWitQOQg.jpg','2024-07-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Three Kilometres to the End of the World',1278338,2.2593,6.638,'OudbM7SLMpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37282,_binary '\0','/gAVt41nTbna5aNHQqfcyOqSTg9X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32186579',7.1,1608,'zh','一部未完成的电影','A film crew gathers in a hotel near Wuhan to resume production of a film that was interrupted ten years earlier, but an unexpected event once again disrupts the preparations.','/rzsiqXFxWal6bkuV2QK6zCKjpOF.jpg','2024-10-23',107,'Released',NULL,'An Unfinished Film',878607,2.3414,7.743,'2YycBG8PyTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37283,_binary '\0','/xOuQBNdlcEEQdjlGA8Gn6VZsDQT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32189369',8,2373,'te','మ్యూజిక్ షాప్ మూర్తి','Murthy, a man in his early 50s passionate about music, runs a music shop, faces pressure from his family to close the shop due to its lack of profitability. After a chance meeting with Anjana, Murthy delves into the challenging and exciting process of becoming a DJ and ventures to Hyderabad to achieve his dream against all odds.','/rBWdVurS2VxXisCWEVNPCPVHnHG.jpg','2024-06-14',127,'Released',NULL,'Music Shop Murthy',1304474,0.6863,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37284,_binary '\0','/s2Nbk4zmKscZ9mSElXD4K0XImgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32189846',5,8335,'ta','நிறம் மாறும் உலகில்','During a train journey, A ticket examiner narrates four tales of extreme parental sacrifice, exploring familial bonds through illness, estrangement, unexpected connections, and emotional turmoil, to a young woman','/wZicaPr8fPFm16Kc3N34LIEQRf7.jpg','2025-03-07',146,'Released',NULL,'Niram Marum Ulagil',1431271,1.008,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37285,_binary '\0','/fBxFzgRR5WEc9V8ToqPxWhswyXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3219194',6.2,1837,'en','Uncle John','In this tale of small town intrigue, an urbanite returns to his quiet hometown on an impromptu trip as his Uncle, widely respected in town, struggles to evade suspicion of a murder.','/bwSk0mr86hDSb72arBbSooaN65h.jpg','2015-03-16',114,'Released',NULL,'Uncle John',324150,1.4565,5.8,'9aeSqeGpnYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37286,_binary '\0','/rMhhK1iqPbUncZGoakMt7ClUYZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3219268',7.1,2360,'ta','இதற்குத்தானே ஆசைப்பட்டாய் பாலகுமாரா','An indolent youth finds himself in trouble when his life gets intertwined with that of a straight-laced banker who is tormented with his demands from his boss.','/4RbpRIPtU45lDY1mmJ0gRbusbe8.jpg','2013-10-02',144,'Released',NULL,'Idharkuthane Aasaipattai Balakumara',225701,1.1246,7,'FZuk8XAFLqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37287,_binary '\0','/5CdoqLaj2VjMkfXMwUtUwziQJDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32192973',5.3,1314,'en','One Spoon of Chocolate','After serving his country in the Army, Unique is falsely accused of assault and sent to prison. Once released, Unique sets up shop in Ohio to restart his life, linking up with his only surviving relative, Ramsey. There’s something insidious happening in this town, though, as its racist sheriff and his crew of similarly bigoted acolytes all have a knack for violence and share a gruesome secret pertaining to a recent string of missing young Black men. When they set their sights on Unique and turn his life upside down, the former soldier has no choice but to bring the ruckus down on the sheriff and his goons.','/ybO8oLgpXRhaPmHI6C2FUpxSRrK.jpg','2026-05-01',114,'Released','He has nowhere to go. They have nowhere to hide.','One Spoon of Chocolate',1290792,3.9483,5.5,'eYkhefDTiXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37288,_binary '\0','/yPXGTceIv5ApZ5SziDM8xqXb9Ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32194932',4.5,7684,'en','The Ritual','Two priests, one in crisis with his faith and the other confronting a turbulent past, must overcome their differences to perform a risky exorcism.','/uubL8yvtEBjz3V7DFQHjCuSQO8w.jpg','2025-04-18',98,'Released','You must have faith.','The Ritual',1278950,11.6847,5.9,'Y8zUTpO3JAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37289,_binary '\0','/lIX8hk8e5FqrryqOq88V1HLCFGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3219604',7.4,3668,'en','The Last Man on the Moon','The 1960s was an extraordinary time for the United States. Unburdened by post-war reparations, Americans were preoccupied with other developments like NASA, the game-changing space programme that put Neil Armstrong on the moon. Yet it was astronauts like Eugene Cernan who paved the uneven, perilous path to lunar exploration. A test pilot who lived to court danger, he was recruited along with 14 other men in a secretive process that saw them become the closest of friends and adversaries. In this intensely competitive environment, Cernan was one of only three men who was sent twice to the moon, with his second trip also being NASA’s final lunar mission. As he looks back at what he loved and lost during the eight years in Houston, an incomparably eventful life emerges into view. Director Mark Craig crafts a quietly epic biography that combines the rare insight of the surviving former astronauts with archival footage and otherworldly moonscapes.','/blQ4h5gcVWYKYVm9bykVmhWXvHN.jpg','2016-02-26',95,'Released','One man\'s part in mankind\'s greatest adventure','The Last Man on the Moon',276537,1.038,6.7,'p-JELHay33A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37290,_binary '\0','/fVcBnOqurJAKiX6E4GOUTBvC85U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3220192',5.4,2804,'sv','Jönssonligan - Den perfekta stöten','Charles Ingvar Jönsson gathers three criminals to take vengeance upon the people who killed his uncle.','/uUDcDA4AsUa51HRIiIfMJoqSfI3.jpg','2015-01-16',88,'Released','Revenge is best served with dynamite.','The Jönsson Gang - The Master Plan',308160,2.1012,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37291,_binary '\0','/1qjegraxHJVAJuwXlUrPzuLEs9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32203531',5.5,1974,'en','Frankie Freako','After calling a late-night party hotline that promises out-of-this-world fun, uptight yuppie Conor Sweeney must battle the pint-sized forces of evil unleashed through his phone line, led by the maniacal rock n’ roll goblin FRANKIE FREAKO.','/8xjOFXj0CHy5Mp6Wfsr2iIXTtZ5.jpg','2024-10-04',83,'Released','Fasten your freakbelts for a wild night.','Frankie Freako',1127407,1.8372,5.352,'DWIyVleAQL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37292,_binary '\0','/hBTOBzXTa5q1Hpxo7sWfXVBkpv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32204858',7.7,11315,'de','Heldin','Dedicated nurse Floria navigates the relentless pace of her hospital’s understaffed surgical ward with humanity and warmth. As her overnight shift intensifies, she is pushed to the brink in a race against time.','/2X2FZIYdXYNwDbStJhgeoVn0pWH.jpg','2025-02-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Late Shift',1356670,5.1168,7.845,'UlxEVrEhVes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37293,_binary '\0','/c8pbZDbtcKWW79HRN2aChaPtWNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32206571',6.9,4288,'te','Lorry Chapter 1','Harshavardan, an ex-convict mechanic, is tasked to deliver a lorry with a valuable load to Mumbai. He gets entangled with the villainous Pratap, who wants to become CM through illegal means.','/aKBAzaWPzs5AF9PC3PPXkxyIa7F.jpg','2024-08-02',183,'Released',NULL,'Lorry Chapter 1',1383433,0.519,0,'qbrgrD3Ztt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37294,_binary '\0','/8VOzkNlKdm63NCdVBsa12bhOiRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32210485',7.5,2148,'da','Det andet offer','During a hectic shift in the neurological department, skilled doctor Alexandra takes on extra responsibility. But a misjudgment ends in tragedy.','/aWXvKxtrh5kOQAUc7RTRBS6vBnS.jpg','2025-03-30',92,'Released',NULL,'Second Victims',1395177,2.3485,7.5,'S2fmm9Dl3UE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37295,_binary '\0','/4nBxazVPqf88v4omVqGJSUoX0lE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32214143',5.4,2934,'en','Gabby\'s Dollhouse: The Movie','When her beloved dollhouse is accidentally claimed by an eccentric cat lady during a road trip to Cat Francisco, Gabby embarks on a real-world adventure to reunite the Gabby Cats and rescue her most prized possession before it is too late.','/t6LLguAmu6iZUN8pWhT7Q0IcaQ5.jpg','2025-09-13',98,'Released','Hold on tight.','Gabby\'s Dollhouse: The Movie',1280282,10.8267,6.683,'S-GFCPEWqe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37296,_binary '\0','/bqqthiW4JzYK3hz9LrqNZQWbNz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32214413',6.3,4619,'en','The Wedding Banquet','Frustrated with his commitment-phobic boyfriend Chris and running out of time, Min makes a proposal: a green-card marriage with their friend Angela in exchange for her partner Lee\'s expensive IVF. Elopement plans are upended, however, when Min\'s grandmother surprises them with an extravagant Korean wedding banquet.','/48scEvAG0H4PBWTt86sJeazExpN.jpg','2025-04-18',103,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding Banquet',1278827,3.89