ds','A hedonistic teenager in Mumbai is busted for dealing drugs and goes to his estranged sister for help, but complications land her in jail.','/8HvQ7UEngiSQ7Nxj1lH0HW8kOpj.jpg','2018-04-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Clouds',440792,1.4423,6.407,'N6d5Vl4fGVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37309,_binary '\0','/cSJMk9Jar8SibFXL8JAF9p2fhKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3224458',7.2,95754,'en','A Beautiful Day in the Neighborhood','An award-winning cynical journalist, Lloyd Vogel, begrudgingly accepts an assignment to write an Esquire profile piece on the beloved television icon Fred Rogers. After his encounter with Rogers, Vogel\'s perspective on life is transformed.','/pgxn1siPnWbSOKUeovfC86OwhWU.jpg','2019-09-07',109,'Released','Neighbor. Icon. Friend.','A Beautiful Day in the Neighborhood',501907,11.5628,7,'-VLEPhfEN2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37310,_binary '\0','/AsQkevO5gIQXimaSZV93LuSN9nq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32244679',7.2,6562,'en','The Roast of Tom Brady','Offensive lines. Full-contact comedy. Kevin Hart hosts this all-star roast of NFL legend Tom Brady.','/guph6RgrrQSDQpDckGaIHLS5wzg.jpg','2024-05-05',179,'Released',NULL,'The Roast of Tom Brady',1278360,2.9178,6.7,'qL0if7ge4Bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37311,_binary '\0','/83NiekHNOZkLbPdjd5KTIOE92Tn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32244931',6.5,1633,'pl','Bokser','With only his wife by his side, a promising young boxer flees communist Poland to chase his dream of becoming the greatest fighter in history.','/hpFWUpjIT6eTPFoAUzVsGHcQHXT.jpg','2024-09-10',150,'Released',NULL,'Boxer',1280440,2.6431,7,'vjDF90_kTbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37312,_binary '\0','/dYGJ9cI3pUjCUITfxxsO5kEGKTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32245043',5.1,4498,'pl','Spadek','When their rich uncle passes, his mansion of intricate puzzles becomes the backdrop for his estranged family\'s quest to secure a portion of his wealth.','/A4UklDW0DYytzK5aydQIM3vw4dL.jpg','2024-06-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Inheritance',1279433,3.4901,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37313,_binary '\0','/ycOPrw6Pr4i7GBvryrrgTNYiD5u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32245158',6.3,4758,'pl','Napad','A young detective seeks the help of a discharged police officer, giving him the chance to reclaim his old life in exchange for solving a bank raid case.','/zrzKoiLUdKuKqtYOKS2orLRoUhv.jpg','2024-10-15',114,'Released',NULL,'Justice',1282138,3.0023,6.542,'L8lwqvHktSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37314,_binary '\0','/k5d7qZPIdOoVnQJkkvZPrDSFkLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32245467',5.9,1552,'en','Gaslit by My Husband: The Morgan Metzer Story','After a masked intruder assaults Morgan Metzer in her home, her estranged husband, Rodney, shows up minutes later. Questioned by the authorities, Rodney\'s story doesn\'t seem to add up, making him the prime suspect in the attack.','/8ZNcl3dkxGrkjQcZhRifBkPK1h3.jpg','2024-06-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Gaslit by My Husband: The Morgan Metzer Story',1302733,2.1085,5.68,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37315,_binary '\0','/gsLYR8uALrt2p33iOpqReNW6XyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32245870',4.6,2662,'hi','हैप्पी पटेल: ख़तरनाक जासूस','Chronically unsuccessful MI7 operative Happy Patel is finally assigned a mission in Goa, where he uncovers his Indian roots and must rescue a high-profile scientist from crime lord Mama. Unaware of his Indian heritage and armed with a comically British accent, Happy’s blunders trigger a string of chaotic mishaps that could lead him to expose a criminal network.','/vsCkxiY2c26C6y4RyTVkpdXIfCW.jpg','2026-01-16',122,'Released','India is for beginners.','Happy Patel: Khatarnak Jasoos',1282440,2.8635,6.15,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37316,_binary '\0','/qoUVkstQfGZlKlKdYC0T98kNrek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32246406',7.2,2551,'pl','Dom dobry','When Gośka meets Grzesiek online, she\'s sure he\'s her Mr. Right. Grzesiek is crazy about her, showers her with flowers, and proposes in Venice, but soon enough, the picture perfect romance starts to crumble, revealing a darker side.','/hUYfjMdyjHa1BaDREvRSZ56gxDy.jpg','2025-11-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Home Sweet Home',1035047,1.8947,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37317,_binary '\0','/2IIKts2A9vnUdM9tTC76B8tDmuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32246771',7.1,141039,'en','Bring Her Back','Following the death of their father, a brother and sister are sent to live with a foster mother, only to learn that she is hiding a terrifying secret.','/1Q3GlCXGYWELifxANYZ5OVMRVZl.jpg','2025-05-19',104,'Released','Family requires sacrifices.','Bring Her Back',1151031,21.8248,7.3,'1I15ttCedfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37318,_binary '\0','/sBmk1aaiepcBfC3l5NpEsdEoawP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32247943',6.6,2830,'de','Miroirs No. 3','After a car crash kills her boyfriend, piano student Laura is taken in by Betty, who witnessed the accident. Living with Betty\'s family brings comfort, but Laura starts questioning their intentions as time passes.','/fcy6ZmdrwzW8TtiDY4ZxDEDk6yl.jpg','2025-08-27',86,'Released',NULL,'Miroirs No. 3',1178602,4.5489,6.6,'PqNG8EWydW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37319,_binary '\0','/gVE1kL2du1WmANH0dwiHDM8pFhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32249644',5.5,1861,'en','Bad Tidings','Grumpy home-security expert Neil feuds with his neighbour Scott, who insists on keeping his Christmas lights illuminated all year round. Their tit-for-tat argument culminates in Neil triggering a power cut across the entire street on Christmas Eve. But when the local crime family decide to rob every house on the street that night, the pair must set aside their differences to defeat them.','/65uHWcpxDkIw6wpOyTVmFxEPWvL.jpg','2024-12-22',80,'Released','Two not-so-wise men save Christmas.','Bad Tidings',1271528,1.4615,6.5,'_mUBk8P56vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37320,_binary '\0','/hllN6WP6WpVe5Eu6gzFIzITKfk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32249940',7.2,2128,'de','Riefenstahl','Explores Leni Riefenstahl\'s artistic legacy and her complex ties to the Nazi regime, juxtaposing her self-portrayal with evidence suggesting awareness of the regime\'s atrocities.','/yl4AbKmwXR8bPVsbPyldD50yN8Y.jpg','2024-08-29',115,'Released',NULL,'Riefenstahl',1081077,2.5045,7.2,'7n5wKuahSZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37321,_binary '\0','/2ZE9Up6KwIDd1GEFUPA5KOCrJrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32251194',6,2585,'tr','İllegal Hayatlar: Meclis','The political party, which Mahsun, Şahin and Mehmet established as a front to secretly gamble, accidentally entered the parliament. As a result, the trio find themselves in a brand new world full of opportunities. The story, which starts with illegal casino management, is moved to the parliament.','/dAvnOVYUNm5GmD0JJgozsrrTxN6.jpg','2024-11-01',115,'Released',NULL,'İllegal Hayatlar: Meclis',1282689,1.118,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37322,_binary '\0','/t62n8FPCo4kJZYnsxkcLojgThJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32252801',7.1,3413,'en','Blue Heron','A family of six\'s fresh start on 1990s Vancouver Island unravels as their youngest child, Sasha, witnesses the increasingly dangerous behavior of her older brother, Jeremy.','/4hfMbVbYc2gsMnSE1K8Oc9LQH4j.jpg','2026-03-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Blue Heron',1184941,3.8463,6.6,'JeWg8wUlQVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37323,_binary '\0','/geyoGTi7sxY4Cmpi8CZpoMzylqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3225318',4.3,1484,'en','Wolf Mother','In an attempt to rectify their criminal past, a once successful Hollywood starlet, turn prostitute, and a petty, misogynistic thief, set out together to solve a high profile child abduction case in San Francisco.','/9o1jNZI0j1cx1FPycjJaX2tJjdO.jpg','2016-06-02',117,'Released','Zelda has some baggage','Wolf Mother',428015,1.5655,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37324,_binary '\0','/gGGRr6sTwVjrdJXcXYgrTfvTMhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32259219',6.2,5125,'ta','ப்ளடி பெக்கர்','A beggar\'s life takes an unexpected turn when a misadventure upends his daily routine. Can he navigate the bizarre, witty situations that follow?','/qimSmwXBFQpei25T3FBSTFeN31A.jpg','2024-10-31',139,'Released',NULL,'Bloody Beggar',1311073,0.9393,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37325,_binary '\0','/jUAWVC1tYjLIs9vd6Bx2Q6a7JeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32260498',8.6,2334,'en','Rite Here Rite Now','Whether you’re a devoted disciple looking to relive treasured memories of the GHOST live spectacle or among the curious uninitiated, RITE HERE RITE NOW will put you right there: putting your phones down and living in the moment—as a shadow of uncertainty looms—completely spellbound and in the thrall of this bombastic yet intimate cinematic portrait of GHOST.','/w3xJNhW5ZYuK3BySbsJiGDmKEiV.jpg','2024-06-20',144,'Released',NULL,'Rite Here Rite Now',1203397,2.5993,8.9,'GJVgZX-vQUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37326,_binary '\0','/AePlQ3osZShJmbNj8tzQ3NoMTQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32263401',6.1,2609,'fr','Reflet dans un diamant mort','When the mysterious woman in the room next door disappears, a debonair 70-year-old ex-spy living in a luxury hotel on the Côte d\'Azur is confronted by the demons and darlings of a lurid past in which moviemaking, memories and madness collide.','/5CdRxBu7jRDHjthkAL8vE0GdKUD.jpg','2025-06-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Reflection in a Dead Diamond',1013446,3.9189,6.152,'6Zv6zK8N9Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37327,_binary '\0','/zEsFCfW7c8x2X7q3uLbZYoGka7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32263577',3.8,2144,'en','Quantum Supremacy','In a future threatened by rogue robots and an all-powerful AI, Captain Monroe and his crew race to prevent humanity\'s downfall in Quantum Supremacy.','/oU9td2mvEu04rLGlynziVmNo16b.jpg','2026-02-16',77,'Released',NULL,'Quantum Supremacy',1297311,18.276,4.234,'0WRbz8XMHpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37328,_binary '\0','/gyReyZ09en6XIm4Xzo5ESMxeyuu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32267351',4.7,1258,'es','Nahir','One of the most controversial cases in recent years in Argentina, this movie is based on the true story of Nahir Galarza and the murder of her boyfriend that rocked the country. The youngest woman to be convicted and sentenced to life in prison in Argentina, but questions still remain- was this a crime of passion, or is the truth still yet to be fully discovered?','/3lCerAA6lArxaVskPqR586GJqB5.jpg','2024-05-22',108,'Released',NULL,'Nahir',1234783,1.3035,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37329,_binary '\0','/euUEDjof7fVX2t3nYFvLLN9ADK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32267691',6.7,8021,'en','Power Ballad','When Rick, a past-his-prime wedding singer, meets fading boy-band star Danny during a gig, the two bond over music and a late-night jam session. But when Danny turns one of Rick’s songs into the hit that reignites his career, Rick sets out to reclaim the recognition he believes he deserves - even if it means risking everything he cares about.','/sGgX2K0SJqw90Ju8TONdhDVwlzT.jpg','2026-05-18',99,'Released','It\'s time to set the record straight.','Power Ballad',1284016,9.8827,7,'-faiHUsbP_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37330,_binary '\0','/4rCArads48eoWTDplCqyXkHKuhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3226786',6.4,3357,'en','Bigger','The inspirational tale of the grandfathers of the fitness movement as we now know it, Joe & Ben Weider. Battling anti-Semitism, racism and extreme poverty, the brothers beat all odds to build an empire & inspire future generations.','/lLXKZJN71I6BjGEIjSdMppv9htO.jpg','2018-10-13',107,'Released',NULL,'Bigger',481370,2.4975,7,'UBdLrdX-Ov4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37331,_binary '\0','/1RhfevWmWCVHtEqxWBEjPOC5KG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32268156',5.5,57896,'en','The Last House','A family suddenly sealed inside their home must work together to survive against dwindling resources and the ominous threat keeping them trapped.','/6JU7E8Vv2M11egkctWVOScxWR75.jpg','2026-08-06',110,'Released','How long can you survive?','The Last House',1284041,27.8601,6.8,'MLxgaz2Zp1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37332,_binary '\0','/pmPXXniQlb4EdYY0gVZO90rf54F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32268691',6.2,2246,'en','Onslaught','When a rogue squad of genetically engineered super soldiers break loose in the desert, a badass Army sniper must unleash hell to protect her young daughter.','/cOGtvhc6Ij9KvzM6jZsfQyg0B0O.jpg','2026-09-02',92,'Released','They unleashed their deadliest weapon on us.','Onslaught',1284046,32.006,5.8,'06hhVL13HEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37333,_binary '\0','/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32273171',6,19175,'en','The Death of Robin Hood','Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.','/13MmRwmG5NmaMfU8qNrtgGXisiD.jpg','2026-06-18',123,'Released','He was no hero.','The Death of Robin Hood',1284465,77.6066,6.586,'tlSDDuWxO_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37334,_binary '\0','/vGVWjxlWRzevTG5R7E2HziDjueA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32275326',5.4,4269,'en','Find Your Friends','A sinister spin on twenty-something party culture, revealing the darkness beneath the carefree facade. What starts as a wild girls trip turns dangerous when hostile locals escalate tensions and Amber\'s past trauma surfaces. As the group fractures under toxic dynamics, their fun getaway transforms into a revenge-fueled nightmare.','/uFdpiH5zh8wMnOckYtwvVDM0SDE.jpg','2026-06-04',92,'Released','A party to die for.','Find Your Friends',1283636,5.395,4.643,'pT5y7-WwD8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37335,_binary '\0','/rakS8RAhKOMIplBi4RbluQg4Xqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32275943',5.9,4900,'fr','Alpha','Alpha, a troubled 13-year-old lives with her single mom. Their world collapses the day she returns from school with a tattoo on her arm.','/oUZlrGPTAtinic87FF7jIT6EHmN.jpg','2025-08-20',128,'Released','Love leaves a mark.','Alpha',1284460,6.5282,6.2,'3Jiax6tpDk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37336,_binary '\0','/4Gyp48lFkmcxu20Fs7ukhTIuzSn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32276246',4.4,2192,'en','The Curse of the Necklace','After separating due to his unpredictable alcohol infused temper, Frank try to win his wife Laura back by giving her a beautiful antique necklace he finds in an old 1938 evidence bag at the station. Unfortunately, the necklace is a conduit for the tormented soul of an evil boy from long ago, and Laura and her daughters find themselves in terrible danger from a little boy who no longer exists.','/tWrYpICZChiPwRnc8SkvxBFBE3y.jpg','2024-09-27',95,'Released',NULL,'The Curse of the Necklace',1293263,3.5732,5.657,'Jye9dIrxLt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37337,_binary '\0','/tTUr3JaMRhA7Jt64lmrskF7xNRO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32277931',7,1500,'ja','侍タイムスリッパー','A samurai who gets hit by lightning wakes up to find himself on a film set in the present day and starts to work as an extra on samurai films.','/oQbxGmLOqZrFLxLrfeIU4TGaOiU.jpg','2024-08-17',131,'Released',NULL,'A Samurai in Time',1287819,1.7745,7.1,'-6zf5xmhq2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37338,_binary '\0','/en6q9MmuuG6SBTEtlYmoGQPcYWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32278054',7.3,1913,'ta','ஹவுஸ் மேட்ஸ்','Karthick and Anu fall in love, get married and buy an old flat for their own. Many strange incidents happening in that house. They found out the reason and hand over the flat to the first owner Ramesh.','/1HeWmcvzXKyBrUxCFdbvEni4spb.jpg','2025-08-01',129,'Released',NULL,'House Mates',1433545,1.457,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37339,_binary '\0','/jLuGZc84MvPYCQomQg9DI72mstt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32278481',5.7,31217,'en','Enola Holmes 3','Adventure follows detective Enola Holmes to Malta, where her plans to tie the knot unravel when Sherlock\'s disappearance plunges her into a perilous case.','/7kRYHH9H9PjBFwz1FprbHB2AAjI.jpg','2026-06-30',109,'Released','Tis I do?','Enola Holmes 3',1202033,16.5576,6.7,'n_pEJjq-9xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37340,_binary '\0','/3LxSXQDhjdOrYmHDq9e1FQFENDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3228088',4.4,1461,'en','Spark: A Space Tail','Teenage monkey Spark and his friends, Chunk and Vix, are on a mission to regain Planet Bana - a kingdom overtaken by the evil overlord Zhong.','/4zj2KfykL4qvYCrbMv46Yd5vnYM.jpg','2016-04-22',91,'Released','Spark a revolution!','Spark: A Space Tail',322487,3.9087,4.9,'vSAppKS214U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37341,_binary '\0','/v2OWPUDP17dFxzLSeb3uqbZF1a8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32281200',6.9,1606,'en','Savoring Paris','Disillusioned with her life, Ella embarks on a soul-searching journey to Paris where she navigates love, self-discovery and cheese amidst the enchanting backdrop of The City of Love.','/863fQQrr7zzxPZXdSgXE5aEiz9p.jpg','2024-06-08',84,'Released','The best things in life are brie.','Savoring Paris',1285266,1.7143,6.577,'A7lVeuT90HQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37342,_binary '\0','/d3HvCcvR1JbLrloXYGb0QhRiOma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32284122',7,2490,'ta','ஆண் பாவம் பொல்லாதது','A year into their marriage, unable to distinguish between toxicity and mere misunderstandings, Sakthi decides to part ways with Siva. The couple navigate their separation, and whether they ultimately proceed with divorce forms the emotional climax.','/5eZzBvETRK8uDz3mUK0Feio2T5C.jpg','2025-10-31',120,'Released',NULL,'Aan Paavam Pollathathu',1435139,1.7362,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37343,_binary '\0','/gXhTZlA3U8DFqn0xWzfztJGu2dY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32284140',5.3,1562,'te','యేవమ్','In the small town of Vikarabad, Soumya, a rookie cop eager to prove herself, is paired with a sincere Officer Abhiram, to unravel the sinister motives of a serial offender Yugandhar, who targets young fan girls of stars, which turns out to be more dangerous than she imagined.','/hkDoVO3WujOZgh7TRpOjKkrBFkM.jpg','2024-06-14',123,'Released',NULL,'Yevam',1052300,0.9195,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37344,_binary '\0','/97U7d3GwOnDKAKVVbLEq65XyKP3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32284154',7.8,18283,'ml','രേഖാചിത്രം','Having recently served a suspension for gambling online while on duty, Circle Inspector Vivek Gopinath rejoins the police force and is looking to reclaim his lost honour. Awaiting him is a 40-year-old, unresolved murder mystery with a faceless victim.','/ulIAyiSVQZL1Ov6K2Tjf6wPlzFi.jpg','2025-01-09',139,'Released','An Alternate History','Rekhachithram',1290954,1.7513,6.923,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37345,_binary '\0','/6MKr3KgOLmzOP6MSuZERO41Lpkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3228774',7.3,301494,'en','Cruella','In 1970s London amidst the punk rock revolution, a young grifter named Estella is determined to make a name for herself with her designs. She befriends a pair of young thieves who appreciate her appetite for mischief, and together they are able to build a life for themselves on the London streets. One day, Estella’s flair for fashion catches the eye of the Baroness von Hellman, a fashion legend who is devastatingly chic and terrifyingly haute. But their relationship sets in motion a course of events and revelations that will cause Estella to embrace her wicked side and become the raucous, fashionable and revenge-bent Cruella.','/hjS9mH8KvRiGHgjk6VUZH7OT0Ng.jpg','2021-05-26',134,'Released','Hello cruel world.','Cruella',337404,18.7429,8,'gmRKv7n2If8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37346,_binary '\0','/w2ELcHBcIvbcXbtiGxEEJ5PiOBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3228830',7.3,1412,'en','Super Duper Alice Cooper','Emerging from the Detroit music scene of the 1970s in a flurry of long hair and sequins, Alice Cooper restored hard rock with a sense of showmanship, while simultaneously striking fear into the hearts of Middle America with the chicken-slaughtering, dead-baby-eating theatrics that would cement his identity as a glam metal icon. Meticulously crafted from rare archival footage, Super Duper Alice Cooper tells the story of the man behind the makeup, Vincent Furnier, the son of a preacher, who got caught in the grip of his own monster.','/A72W2mvQ5EZ4pzx96RjKyHYAfGJ.jpg','2014-04-17',86,'Released','Welcome to his nightmare.','Super Duper Alice Cooper',261814,2.2306,7.125,'nAuyznrcR5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37347,_binary '\0','/tEcHPtA7nomepPdI9Q9FJWVHwfz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3228886',6.2,1718,'tr','Ben O Değilim','Nihat, an introverted employee in a hospital cafeteria, is confused by Ayşe, a mysterious woman who just started working there as a dishwasher. Her obvious seductive approaches embarrass Nihat and make him nervous at the same time. Despite the rumors about her husband having been sentenced to many years in jail, Nihat reluctantly accepts Ayşe’s invitation to dinner at her house. This is the beginning of a strange and dangerous liaison. When Nihat discovers a picture of the woman’s husband and realizes that he looks astoundingly like him, the relation becomes even more toxic.','/minH3mw9tCgLovJCMi45gESmlr8.jpg','2013-11-09',125,'Released',NULL,'I Am Not Him',241187,1.2973,6,'Kg4npSwDt1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37348,_binary '\0','/e0wOvAVnpb4bJqsh4VmFz6aiupz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32292009',8.1,5170,'te','లగ్గం','Manasa and Chaitanya are engaged to be married, but when Chaitanya quits his job, will the wedding go through?','/6R5SxjwedJGotc4EprWYVg93qKc.jpg','2024-10-25',127,'Released',NULL,'Laggam',1375193,0.9757,5,'acJY41etfDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37349,_binary '\0','/n2SkAN9qCsaM5TZHDf2irjh79Q4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3229488',5,2895,'en','Boone: The Bounty Hunter','When fame-seeking reality show bounty hunter, Boone, attempts to bring down a drug lord and his empire, he uncovers more than he bargains for and learns that justice means more than ratings.','/akqKTfd6EbUQamcvVrJS1CxOdUH.jpg','2017-05-09',86,'Released','You can run but you can\'t hide','Boone: The Bounty Hunter',456781,2.9365,5.1,'KGsKYiZqFVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37350,_binary '\0','/kOUV5WbisWMg56d8eB45ZHEVxYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32298285',7,37696,'es','Sirāt','A man and his son arrive at a rave lost in the mountains of Morocco. They are looking for Marina, their daughter and sister, who disappeared months ago at another rave. Driven by fate, they decide to follow a group of ravers in search of one last party, in hopes Marina will be there.','/bzBtsLi17rK4G6kDvOXfUZfAhca.jpg','2025-06-06',115,'Released','This is the desert.','Sirāt',1151272,6.653,6.8,'3_9OkHX8ZiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37351,_binary '\0','/nItaRm9Kaz7xVkcIaFmxjlnfrME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32298956',4.5,1533,'en','The Passenger','Hassan, a Somali-American airport shuttle driver in Minneapolis, is struggling to make ends meet. When Lloyd, a stranded twenty-something at the airport, offers to pay Hassan to take him overland to Chicago, it seems worth the risk. But as the realization grows that his passenger is not what he seems, Hassan finds himself trapped in a terrifying ride that he can’t escape, knowing that saving himself might put countless others in danger.','/i9XqCdF0jrgqveYUaLjOSiRepIq.jpg','2026-06-05',93,'Released','No way out. No way back.','The Passenger',1285959,11.9281,5.675,'jMOow9j8oEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37352,_binary '\0','/i5kvIf73Vrxu4lYF6rby0yw4FX2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32299316',6.4,39574,'en','Dangerous Animals','A savvy and free-spirited surfer is abducted by a shark-obsessed serial killer. Held captive on his boat, she must figure out how to escape before he carries out a ritualistic feeding to the sharks below.','/9tk3Si960hg4E49eMt81dS7Qe9Z.jpg','2025-06-05',98,'Released','You\'re safer in the water.','Dangerous Animals',1285965,12.9609,6.462,'WR2btzjmmuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37353,_binary '\0','/n3Z93zadihMeZ2O7b0oIEzXhvhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3230082',6.3,3997,'fr','La chambre bleue','In their blue hotel room, a clandestine couple of two married lovers plan an impossible future, as death shutters their already frail tranquillity. Now, the noose tightens more and more around innocents and sinners; but, was there a crime?','/g7Yl3tNtdqKl7xfKw0gd5EGE5B2.jpg','2014-05-16',76,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Room',266034,2.7253,5.997,'1q0wmeq2_vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37354,_binary '\0','/vwA2EFiIHLxHiNHWDHIeMDVfFUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3230162',6.7,3272,'ja','2つ目の窓','On the Japanese island of Amami, despite lacking parental guidance, Kaito and his girlfriend Kyoko try to find their place in the world. While Kaito suffers from the absence of his father, who moved to Tokyo after his birth, Kyoko must come to grips with her mother’s terminal illness.','/wGylYtfMvKM7DwEI3CsdLTFJPTg.jpg','2014-06-01',121,'Released',NULL,'Still the Water',265193,3.7308,6.7,'npg8_sHQmbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37355,_binary '\0','/6lzUSTtISNJC3NVxjEqZkZiGPDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3230300',6.2,3841,'te','Doosukeltha','Chinna (Vishnu) is a very witty and resourceful person who knows how to get things done. As kids, Chinna and Piccheshwar (Vennela Kishore) have a tiff and Piccheshwar leaves the village in a huff. Piccheshwar’s outraged grandfather (Kota Srinivasa Rao) orders the execution of Chinna’s family, forcing them to flee as well. As the years go by, Chinna grows into a tall and fearless young fellow. He applies for a job as a journalist and he is sent on an assignment by his boss Avatar (Posani). The assignment is to conduct a sting operation on Minister Dilleeswara Rao (Pankaj Tripathi). Chinna succeeds in capturing incriminating footage, but he is caught and thrashed by the minister’s goons.','/4Fm5JEgF9u0fWkJZKEADsAMs7AS.jpg','2013-10-17',150,'Released',NULL,'Doosukeltha',241120,1.1357,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37356,_binary '\0','/aP7w2JPEDyIukrYxIGHmTrmYOWJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32304349',4.5,7317,'en','The Carpenter\'s Son','A remote village in Roman-era Egypt explodes into spiritual warfare when a carpenter, his wife and their child are targeted by supernatural forces.','/2Q44ofC6V9k6vJFToFwpwX86YUn.jpg','2025-11-13',94,'Released','Deliver us from evil.','The Carpenter\'s Son',1286185,5.9862,5.957,'3GSUbJB0oOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37357,_binary '\0','/m2e8GUES92IaXRCLxWElJnlZ34w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32306048',6,2701,'en','Ruth & Boaz','A talented singer leaves the Atlanta music scene and starts over in small-town Tennessee, where she finds love and new purpose but can\'t escape the past.','/mtMJEIHjeHcLtvP0tFPAptk1Var.jpg','2025-09-25',93,'Released',NULL,'Ruth & Boaz',1371189,4.1989,7.5,'TXPxYr5Efn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37358,_binary '\0','/aXAZEpPxpHfMYlP6GdEcEQT0dsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3230660',6.4,3240,'en','Cardboard Boxer','Gentle and broken, a homeless man fights others on video for money but soon finds comfort in an unlikely friend and the lost diary of a young girl.','/7PcdXBLsTaZKSO2aUONgPlZVriK.jpg','2016-09-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Cardboard Boxer',413452,3.0522,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37359,_binary '\0','/uU2PW41xQ2Ic3CFzVZfv96samm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32306650',6.9,2032,'en','Three Wiser Men and a Boy','Five years after the events of the first film, Christmas is once again just around the corner. In a crazy turn of events, possibly brought on accidently by the brothers themselves, the director of Luke’s son Thomas’ school holiday musical steps down. Luke, desperate to make his son’s stage dreams come true, enlists the help of his brothers Taylor and Stephan. The trio also find themselves meeting their mother\'s new boyfriend and the brothers grapple with their own feelings about this relationship. In true Brenner brother fashion, they are all in for a Christmas they will never forget.','/dis4s7NxEFigKawVNgQvkd48c1x.jpg','2024-11-23',84,'Released','They\'re a real dads act','Three Wiser Men and a Boy',1293279,2.3845,7.1,'IO2Vov72T3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37360,_binary '\0','/pq9opXVeTveQLchlHK1jcqyO9e8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3230668',6.4,4015,'es','Perdona si te llamo amor','A successful, attractive, intelligent and brilliant advertising executive is longing to finally find emotional stability in his life, and decides to propose to his girlfriend. After she refuses his proposal, his life takes a turn when a new young lady enters his life.','/ekvI7HVl0RcA4iaZOqNa8vqFwAN.jpg','2014-06-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Sorry If I Call You Love',261470,4.1338,7.514,'ohIrSR1m6QU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37361,_binary '\0','/eVXBp5BBskAj0RJ6pDSNPcBs1uI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32306991',6.6,15195,'en','Solo Mio','After Matt\'s dreams of a picturesque Italian wedding are shattered when his fiancée leaves him at the altar, he embarks on his planned honeymoon across Italy alone, immersing himself in the country\'s vibrant culture, food, and beauty, meeting Gia along the way.','/efSsZJaddeq0LOABZqpCXdMxv9P.jpg','2026-02-05',96,'Released','All roads lead to (being left in) Rome.','Solo Mio',1291335,10.8731,7.5,'433MYSlERJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37362,_binary '\0','/oukZHooYhO4zmu4WTSjqwCoAIt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32307524',7,2258,'en','Shark Whisperer','Marine conservationist and social media activist Ocean Ramsey fearlessly swims with sharks in this documentary about her risky mission to protect them.','/v0WEubJKWTfqYX8laBGIPI07Z7t.jpg','2025-06-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Shark Whisperer',1491570,3.5112,6.7,'EzFguo4vEAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37363,_binary '\0','/idz8GvESDaWlX31EcQoo4abJA3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32308382',5.9,4108,'te','పురుషోత్తముడు','Rachit Ram, heir to a multi-billion-dollar corporate conglomerate, sets off on his journey to fulfill a daunting challenge of living like a commoner for 100 days in the middle of nowhere with absolutely no money and privileges, while his aunt and cousin brother conspire together to make him fail his challenge.','/axtUeYtmVF14hPeQrZHx5PJGjMl.jpg','2024-07-26',122,'Released',NULL,'Purushothamudu',1321718,1.221,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37364,_binary '\0','/yjf0RWXeZ0FyStOD5e0i0KlnBVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32308418',6.6,4662,'en','How to Rob a Bank','In this true-crime documentary, a charismatic rebel in 1990s Seattle pulls off an unprecedented string of bank robberies straight out of the movies.','/vhBQOgig0bXCXIgHHyO8ipG47J9.jpg','2024-06-04',87,'Released',NULL,'How to Rob a Bank',1291143,4.9794,6.7,'w20aHhlRjDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37365,_binary '\0','/hWO3bXmW2G2T44uSWYFTana2BkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32308617',5.8,37002,'hi','सावी','Savi, a simple housewife, attempts a daring jailbreak to get her husband out of one of England\'s high-security prisons consisting of 400 inmates, 75 armed guards, and 60 surveillance cameras.','/adI8MKbKMViJe4KACtRhKufxNiv.jpg','2024-05-31',123,'Released',NULL,'Savi',1264800,1.1607,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37366,_binary '\0','/ny9dta8tcURvl3FsEEU5kjDvqLA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32310205',8.3,1636,'en','Udvegam','Mahindra, a 30-year-old lawyer, enjoys the peak of his personal and professional life until he takes on a controversial gang assault case. Representing the negative side leads to turmoil, as his career and love life begin to crumble under pressure.','/1qgbqP9hLS01MdDXN1oxHkFpc9I.jpg','2024-09-29',135,'Released',NULL,'Udvegam',1395509,0.4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37367,_binary '\0','/lvyU838cy3m0fKSfQIxN8grjxYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3231054',6.4,33873,'en','Risen','Clavius, a powerful Roman military tribune, and his aide, Lucius, are tasked with solving the mystery of what happened to Jesus in the weeks following the crucifixion, in order to disprove the rumors of a risen Messiah and prevent an uprising in Jerusalem.','/6hGh4z503k8wA8mLlmvwhTSGja.jpg','2016-02-18',107,'Released','Witness the manhunt that changed the course of human history','Risen',335778,9.6815,6.3,'OcTVLfn5i8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37368,_binary '\0','/qYDeQ67c5GxMXmGop9GfCG5Ns0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32313870',5.3,8508,'tr','Mavi Mağara','When Cem finds himself at the brink of losing the love of his life, Alara, he embarks on an expedition to the Blue Cave, Alara\'s most beloved archeological site, to feel close to her again.','/32hWYgxMOudSgA6tR8nlVTUtoOi.jpg','2024-10-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Blue Cave',1362101,3.5838,7,'ByJZauSZrAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37369,_binary '\0','/5Af8qDOesFEspcnsjIRUDwQZaYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32315584',5.1,3815,'en','Black Box','A routine domestic flight turns into the flight from hell through a series of inexplicable phenomena and raw terror. Surreal encounters blur the boundaries between reality and nightmare. Passengers fight against all the odds in an attempt to survive while combating bizarre technological malfunctions, accelerating supernatural events and alien influences.','/x6dsUKxz8O5rD3lzayJgvFpW58s.jpg','2026-06-25',85,'Released','What happened to Flight 298?','Black Box',1321008,17.4908,6,'y-nf8hUFd98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37370,_binary '\0','/bxmUcjjBIuZzm9l74aYWjg2wAF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32317640',6.1,1229,'mr','अल्याड पल्याड','Everyone stays away from the island village for three days every year. It is said that whoever stays behind will get killed by the spirits lurking in the village. What will happen when three friends accidentally get stuck there along with their boatman?','/thD5q8bhZHX3fq4gWK1cR5bEMDp.jpg','2024-06-14',129,'Released',NULL,'Alyad Palyad',1301330,1.2342,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37371,_binary '\0','/vM6UBr6rNZkU5pihzMZfcHAbWsf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32321317',6.9,24086,'en','Pillion','Colin, a timid man, meets Ray, a confident biker gang leader, who initiates him into a submissive relationship, challenging Colin’s mundane existence and prompting personal growth through their unconventional dynamic.','/7Pd6ChSQjSXy4snJiorSdzg2cG3.jpg','2025-11-28',107,'Released',NULL,'Pillion',1287141,10.556,6.5,'Gl8n5I-IIHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37372,_binary '\0','/iEGhoOc29l3QaaFzZ6TSKiwquQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3232156',7.2,1619,'ta','பாண்டிய நாடு','Sivakumar is a timid young man, with a loving family in Madurai. His brother, a government official, earns the wrath of Simmakkal Ravi, the all-powerful gangster in the city. When he is murdered, Sivakumar and his father Kalayanasundaram plan to take revenge, in their own separate ways.','/j9K3F5e6AHi4Cv6fvwJy7xA5tR6.jpg','2013-11-01',137,'Released',NULL,'Pandiya Naadu',231298,1.4193,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37373,_binary '\0','/mDVnHFcxxUJC9TQFVeKh1TJNBzh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32321803',5.6,3089,'en','The Get Out','A nightclub owner is on the verge of leaving his dangerous past behind for retirement with his girlfriend. When masked gunmen rob him and he finds himself squeezed by ruthless cartels, a mysterious newcomer arrives with an interest in buying the business. With danger closing in from all sides, he must navigate a deadly web of deception, power, and survival - where escape may no longer be an option.','/zlkeH0s7dDxcnuPcHBqAyXFUxqN.jpg','2026-06-18',111,'Released','The night life is dirty business.','The Get Out',1279493,20.7094,5.986,'oB6HNuKxLmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37374,_binary '\0','/lD8AzRc21Y19IstxSuNEpifoLKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32323252',6.6,19144,'en','Christy','Christy Martin never imagined life beyond her small-town roots in West Virginia—until she discovered a knack for punching people. Fueled by grit, raw determination, and an unshakable desire to win, she charges into the world of boxing under the guidance of her trainer and manager-turned-husband, Jim. But while Christy flaunts a fiery persona in the ring, her toughest battles unfold outside it—confronting family, identity, and a relationship that just might become life-or-death.','/fDsxBOmBFL57QtKM9kTJ3AQU8lD.jpg','2025-10-27',134,'Released','What does it take to become a legend?','Christy',1287322,7.0792,7.1,'hSHwFDPfeV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37375,_binary '\0','/cMvbQjivG65Qu2aRFUwpL6UdkJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32324361',7.8,1323,'te','బ్రహ్మా ఆనందం','Brahma Anandam is a Telugu romantic comedy entertainer movie directed by RVS Nikhil. The movie casts Raja Goutham, Priya Vadlamani, and Aishwarya Holakkal in the main lead roles along with Brahmanandam, Vennela Kishore, and many others..','/86E3yG6NStNJuN29KM2gRyyAAQA.jpg','2025-02-14',148,'Released',NULL,'Brahma Anandam',1418578,1.0618,5.8,'B2WVxBp0ngU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37376,_binary '\0','/sWVYLXD69FCfYg443SEnuWeQJD7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32327574',5.8,1713,'te','(MAD)²','After his wedding turns into a disaster, Laddu and his pals — Manoj, Ashok and Damodar — find themselves traveling to Goa for another wild adventure.','/cYGNd3oMRYsvM9gW4i0bzAclOUb.jpg','2025-03-27',127,'Released','THIS TIME, IT\'S MAD MAXX.','(MAD)²',1359490,2.2544,6.3,'x9jlQ0_K5Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37377,_binary '\0','/zQm5ogvBCQJpktZZohRJZsWrC01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32331377',6.2,8880,'en','The Luckiest Man in America','1984; Michael Larson, an unemployed ice-cream truck driver from Ohio, steps onto the game show \"Press Your Luck\" harboring a secret: the key to endless amounts of money. But his winning streak is threatened when the executives in the control room start to uncover his real motivations.','/etJwfiUR0gtQwH8shhwjRr5bARQ.jpg','2025-04-04',90,'Released','What\'s behind his winning streak?','The Luckiest Man in America',1288070,3.4693,6.285,'5Dw_pujgp5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37378,_binary '\0','/glxTXGCX0Sz0tac2OsPh6Dz2MaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3233224',6,7657,'tr','Patron Mutlu Son İstiyor','Sinan is sent to Capadocia by his boss, Isfendiyar to write a screenplay. As he waits for inspiration, Sinan finds himself running first into Eylul, the daughter of Izzet, who owns the hotel where he\'s booked to stay, and then into soap opera star Faruk, his former good friend and present enemy. It isn\'t long before cabdriver Lokman, who declares himself Sinan\'s \'chauffeur\' and Arif, a local farmer and horse breeder, are part of both Sinan\'s life and his screenplay. Although plentiful adventures among the magical fairy chimneys, colorful balloons and at the annual grape festival become like a movie for all involved, the happy ending awaited by the boss, Isfendiyar never happens. But the boss insists on his happy ending. And Sinan has to write that ending!','/kPj2zwMlSEYPC11GDNHrcDG6zga.jpg','2014-01-01',109,'Released',NULL,'Boss Wants a Happy Ending',258310,1.9111,5.5,'cNtgZC0kPXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37379,_binary '\0','/8GjH1BU5PtoqAlhMeXQ46eq9z1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32332404',5.5,22964,'en','Keeper','Liz and Malcolm escape for a romantic anniversary weekend at a secluded cabin. When Malcolm suddenly returns to the city, Liz finds herself isolated and in the presence of an unspeakable evil that reveals the cabin\'s horrifying secrets.','/mbGHijUc0C3fcM12l6ro6FgxIvg.jpg','2025-11-12',99,'Released','\"Like a surreal David Lynch movie.\"','Keeper',1288072,7.2105,5.7,'cwpusY785l4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37380,_binary '\0','/gQsjbxdjJUam7buy4U2TpVTiGSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32332915',5.9,6050,'en','I Want Your Sex','When a naive young man becomes the sexual muse for a renowned and provocative artist, his dream job quickly turns dangerous as he is drawn into an obsessive world of power, betrayal, and murder.','/pR7SIX3AwqdoD96OI44oLG98e7g.jpg','2026-07-29',90,'Released','Don\'t worry, you\'ll like it.','I Want Your Sex',1288059,33.0886,6.138,'kjkTmTmC1iA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37381,_binary '\0','/caBIySpwuFi2i7ynvHIlnxJLOdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32333324',7.8,7051,'en','Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall','Arkham Asylum has been destroyed, and all its inmates have been unleashed upon Gotham City. As Batman races to round up some of his greatest enemies, he is pushed to his physical and mental limits and into a final confrontation with a new threat: the man called Bane!','/360qdtu2hLnqMu8SVHMywn420w1.jpg','2026-06-23',79,'Released',NULL,'Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall',1560520,50.3