man crusade to avenge his boss\' death only to discover an international conspiracy.','/pu2VxGlpGwffOx292w18b1tv96j.jpg','2026-08-19',96,'Released','There\'s blood in the water.','Mutiny',1288445,224.3757,7.183,'2Iqvbe98Gb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37386,_binary '\0','/264gO7ZxUHh0jX2Ma7tfD6g7GUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32339528',6.3,2355,'te','S.I.T Special Investigation Team','ACP Partha Saradhi investigates the murder of a billionaire\'s wife, Navya and arrests her husband, Rahul. Soon, the case takes a turn when secrets about Navya\'s past and family are revealed.','/8uVuJEmwDivk059pqOHdbkXiRGW.jpg','2024-05-10',117,'Released',NULL,'S.I.T Special Investigation Team',1287603,1.1344,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37387,_binary '\0','/bTonah7ZVdrTrnnI9daCwH4KJIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32340580',4,1462,'tr','Siccîn 7','A woman intent on fulfilling the conditions of a ritual insinuates herself into a family home.','/be0WZZquz3cxlzebOV5ryd7J82T.jpg','2024-06-13',94,'Released','Are you ready to push the limits?','Sijjin 7',1289004,2.2773,3.367,'OjfK9jypiSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37388,_binary '\0','/jfk7UY1LvNNFu193u308hJKR20h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3234078',3.6,1261,'en','Gingerdead Man vs. Evil Bong','Serial killing cookie, Gingerdead Man, tracks down the lone survivor of his murderous rampage, who unleashes the Evil Bong once again.','/g5AefV3s6ojqbqC1Lh7vEAaBTf.jpg','2013-10-29',83,'Released','And Hell Rode With Them','Gingerdead Man vs. Evil Bong',231082,2.0606,3.6,'-eqxHsL7Y3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37389,_binary '\0','/kLNRJ3P48uqVb1NrbpJG7zxBDbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3234084',4.4,3490,'en','I Do... Until I Don\'t','In Vero Beach, Florida, a trio of couples at various points in their relationships become the subjects of a film about marriage being an antiquated idea that needs a reboot: Why not turn marriage into a seven-year deal with an option to renew?','/4hA1n7s4dM734QqxtAwMhDUL7ns.jpg','2017-09-01',103,'Released','Happily Ever After Is a Lot to Ask','I Do... Until I Don\'t',395474,2.4232,4.7,'qyHLlfYAkHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37390,_binary '\0','/f8jMUMOGqfbiLYrBzlmM4uxesRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3234122',6.3,5667,'en','Widow Clicquot','After her husband\'s death, Madame Clicquot flouts convention by assuming the reins of their wine business, defying her critics and ultimately revolutionizing the champagne industry, establishing her as one of the world\'s first great businesswomen.','/eYnHRMGtbbHt1XLNwgx2LNcUvsZ.jpg','2024-07-18',91,'Released','There is hope, however unpredictable.','Widow Clicquot',1042650,4.1025,6.6,'vOFBDabjZt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37391,_binary '\0','/AvYsEYnj8h0495UhBYEXqK7hkFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32351597',7.7,1491,'id','Agak Laen: Menyala Pantiku!','After repeatedly failing their missions, Detectives Bene, Boris, Jegel, and Oki are given one last chance: to go undercover in a nursing home in search of a fugitive wanted for the murder of the mayor’s child.','/fPJ9OjLgAQoLZrPeL6ZfQwNkfPK.jpg','2025-11-27',119,'Released','When you\'re the worst detectives on the force, a nursing home is where you hide','Agak Laen: Menyala Pantiku!',1287571,2.8495,8.3,'TauACNyt5mI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37392,_binary '\0','/v6sq8i4CWlucGMUrz1pXgiCntOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32352172',5.1,1559,'en','A Sudden Case of Christmas','An American couple bring their 10 year old daughter, Claire, to her grandfather Lawrence\'s hotel in The Dolomites, Italy. They usually come for Christmas but this year it’s August. The fact is they are breaking up, and once Claire realizes there’s not going to be a family Christmas this year, she insists on everyone making it out for Christmas in August. Claire, in collusion with her grandfather, plan ac