I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37400,_binary '\0','/8iPh3onZLleMTlswSiZcbyJ5uBk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32361990',8.4,2302,'hi','Return of the Jungle','Nine year old Mihir and his friends are faced with the daunting task of outwitting the biggest, meanest bully in school, Rahul Malhotra. To help them ride through this impossible journey, they turn to Thatha and his fantastic tales of inspiration from the ancient Jungles of India. Together, they must build a ruthless dinosaur, fight a nerve- racking game of cricket and travel all the way to Rajasthan, to rediscover the power of friendship, compassion and determination.','/kXxSc3cG5wAB2wolqX8j0QKNwjD.jpg','2026-05-29',105,'Released',NULL,'Return of the Jungle',1206167,0.8604,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37401,_binary '\0','/l9EJYB4rMXsigLsN8OL3h8yuSEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32362515',7.6,1915,'th','วิมานหนาม','When his partner Sek dies, Thongkam loses his property to his late love\'s eager family and must fight to reclaim the home they built together.','/eR63Z8mFuhxLDFf9XCyKVFEIUsF.jpg','2024-08-22',131,'Released','Reclaim what\'s Yours.','The Paradise of Thorns',1290206,2.5589,7.7,'hXOgMsyZxxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37402,_binary '\0','/6Zn4PaLwLHFJ2bw7s6B10fHiuAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32362695',7.7,12836,'ml','സർവം മായ','An atheist priest\'s life is upended after performing an exorcism, bonding with a charming spirit who helps him pursue music and heal his past.','/mgLY1aQayVX6dQ2DiylLAhjEG8w.jpg','2025-12-25',147,'Released',NULL,'Sarvam Maya',1473354,2.8219,7.806,'xXvE6_8lOoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37403,_binary '\0','/jlkvoHXKQHsgf15wp1AV1CTk4e7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32362890',5,33490,'en','Thrash','When a catastrophic hurricane slams a coastal town, stranded residents must survive rapidly rising waters swarming with ravenous sharks.','/adk8weka3O5648g3de4z3y4