time. Now two months shy of their deadline, both friends set off to do whatever it takes to avoid ending up as each other’s last resort.','/x2oJPcyydaL997oaDQhcCt4xGgD.jpg','2014-09-06',90,'Released','Sometimes love takes a little time.','The 10 Year Plan',267463,2.3151,6.789,'b7eCIfx1A6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37423,_binary '\0','/95pOesHmENMYpyAEptSwD2EsGTf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32394528',4.4,1599,'en','Hell Hole','Far away, in the desolate Serbian wilderness, a U.S.-led fracking crew uncover a dormant monster gestating inside a centuries-old French soldier. Now awakened and exposed in its most dangerously fragile state, it tears through the men on the grounds in search of a new womb.','/dT2xGjrjITvvApNnBsBE5ikO1im.jpg','2024-08-23',92,'Released','A hole new kind of hell.','Hell Hole',1287850,1.611,4.961,'WRxBvUN3FDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37424,_binary '\0','/6D2NsU3FIQVthPgjT6RAsX58qZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32394984',4.9,1951,'en','Brothers Under Fire','Captain Jordan Wright\'s squadron on leave for a wedding in Mexico encounters a murderous cartel. As Jordan tries to lead survivors to safety, war erupts between his squad and the cartel, forcing him into a battle to save his men.','/e5EKqk9V7N3w0WvYFhl6wSVrMp0.jpg','2026-04-15',99,'Released','He never planned to fight. But he refuses to fall.','Brothers Under Fire',1414413,12.4514,5.992,'4R6mxR53m10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37425,_binary '\0','/ncI1PlBcANixIkgQSnjsSRz4OyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32395062',4.6,1965,'en','Muzzle: City of Wolves','LAPD officer Jake Rosser endeavors to lead a peaceful life with his family and retired K-9 officer, Socks. However, tranquility dissolves into chaos when a gang targets them in a brutal attack. Alongside his new K-9 partner Argos, Jake launches into a relentless pursuit of justice, determined to protect his loved ones.','/8qTMRmC07XCGidnKQFLbRM3F