ghost haunts him, from which he had previously watched a horror movie. Later, a mentally disturbed woman enters and starts to kidnap girls. Watch to know how they both got connected! Don\'t miss.','/5xRZbs7pSDZOHjrySBa8aXmmyiT.jpg','2024-05-24',101,'Released',NULL,'Criminal or Devil',1377388,0.7869,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37434,_binary '\0','/vHvtlQGxJXLv5dU9iYrdNNPaQZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32427535',4.1,2341,'kn','Aarata','After celebrating Durga Parameshwari festival, controversy arises over neglecting sacred katte platform favoring its owner\'s family. An irresponsible father\'s negligence impacts his household and community.','/uPZV8segFQe3Dn7pTfmMOLxDMyn.jpg','2024-06-21',122,'Released',NULL,'Aarata',1760526,0.6697,0,'pVFkiVVBqcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37435,_binary '\0','/vCD8yudqsc4Bx6iEWdA0NN7I44u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3242756',3.2,2571,'en','The Redwood Massacre','​‘THE REDWOOD MASSACRE’ is about five adventurous friends, visiting the legendary murder site of Redwood. It has all the hallmarks of being an exciting and thrilling camping weekend away. They soon discover they’re not the only people in the mysterious location. The fun camping expedition soon turns into a nightmare as they are sadistically stalked by a mysterious unseen killer.','/tzMrAlzURdxRD0wpai3zTPozKAn.jpg','2014-09-28',82,'Released','Evil Doesn\'t Die Easily','The Redwood Massacre',339992,1.5041,3.881,'R_19yZFxzms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37436,_binary '\0','/81jteI5xIztDCFPhMXBTmT5MdW9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32429174',7.1,2342,'es','Calle Málaga','An aging Spanish woman in Tangier resists her daughter\'s plan to sell her home. She fights to keep her home, reclaims belongings and rediscovers love and desire.','/fWagBXNDk44UaupYtwQOAvDwGiT.jpg','2025-10-31',116,'Released',NULL,'Calle Malaga',1399462,3.3262,7.466,'FwtLBQpAnk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37437,_binary '\0','/bdSHWfYHBWxhNicGaoKTQ4ihW0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32429470',3.6,1382,'ar','الزرفة','Following a botched robbery, incarcerated friends Hamad, Ma’an and Sanad, in their attempt to escape, end up in a biographical film financed by eccentric Saudi magnate Abdullatif Al-Hanhouni, set in the same locations of their past heists.','/1IvWKDynuhMG9b4M3hshl37EaJj.jpg','2025-07-01',112,'Released',NULL,'Alzarfa',1295475,1.3236,6.7,'n5x5wmQz2kM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37438,_binary '\0','/kKF4gEiBDArhONlCcunHVgBp3bA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32430579',6.8,95903,'en','Crime 101','When an elusive thief whose high-stakes heists unfold along the iconic 101 freeway in Los Angeles eyes the score of a lifetime, with hopes of this being his final job, his path collides with a disillusioned insurance broker who is facing her own crossroads. Determined to crack the case, a relentless detective closes in on the operation, raising the stakes even higher.','/tVvpFIoteRHNnoZMhdnwIVwJpCA.jpg','2026-02-11',141,'Released','Always have an exit.','Crime 101',1171145,33.9345,7,'KeEHsuZ4Ja4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37439,_binary '\0','/wI5UulUUQgIXNRawd2NW9oaFJHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32432584',6.4,1464,'en','Jingle Bell Run','Self-described bookworm Avery is paired with retired hockey star Wes to compete in a holiday race across America. The team struggles through themed challenges until romance runs its course.','/rctASGYJTuAWVemZ4ZR1ZSj50T6.jpg','2024-11-16',85,'Released','Race to romance','Jingle Bell Run',1361135,1.3636,6,'CdW5MdKk_-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37440,_binary '\0','/hSdK33Mjsdfb8TpoUTI3A3OE3RO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32432654',6.4,3202,'en','Girls Like Girls','After her mother\'s passing, 17-year-old Coley navigates new feelings of intimacy with Sonya in rural Oregon, where both girls must overcome their mutual uncertainties and self-doubt to embrace their connection.','/gbP30EOIwUW0HZY9BwQMTRrk8uX.jpg','2026-06-18',95,'Released','Love begins when you let it in.','Girls Like Girls',1397485,11.4583,7.563,'ZC1kEknG2ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37441,_binary '\0','/fLxP0Pzmq5cbIdYltlqs2soGTcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32433627',6.8,1581,'de','22 Bahnen','Tilda\'s days are strictly structured: she studies, works at the supermarket checkout and looks after her little sister Ida - on some days she also has to look after her alcoholic mother. But this summer brings a change: Tilda receives a promising job offer for a doctorate in Berlin. Viktor also turns up, who, like her, always swims 22 laps in the swimming pool. When Tilda begins to believe that everything could be better, the situation at home spirals out of control.','/iSAv70EuzDqkxZGt5vJ1O3XkQyu.jpg','2025-09-04',102,'Released',NULL,'22 Lengths',1380070,2.5114,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37442,_binary '\0','/uJK0jjJ8QDOQw5lcNBwu059ht4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32434379',6.2,18769,'en','My Fault: London','18-year-old Noah moves from America to London, with her mother who\'s recently fallen in love with William, a wealthy British businessman. Noah meets William’s son, bad-boy Nick, and soon discovers there is an attraction between them neither can avoid. As Noah spends the summer adjusting to her new life, her devastating past will catch up with her while falling in love for the first time.','/ttN5D6GKOwKWHmCzDGctAvaNMAi.jpg','2025-02-12',119,'Released',NULL,'My Fault: London',1294203,18.2608,7.4,'14z9L_MwH5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37443,_binary '\0','/1hbk5QlyI07oTFEWwIiksRSlTaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32441275',7.2,1240,'es','Hermanos por accidente','Two sets of identical twins switched at birth in Colombia explore their complex history and new identities in this captivating documentary.','/lz1ZBXMiDZ3s8nBA4qrjFCvdMXV.jpg','2024-06-19',84,'Released',NULL,'The Accidental Twins',1304206,1.0321,7.4,'D5JXgPrdfsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37444,_binary '\0','/4AkTL4CfEDnHIgUEsMr8IjzB2TW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3244446',5.1,2450,'en','Bleeding Heart','Reserved yoga instructor May\'s peaceful, clean-living life is thrown out of balance by the arrival of her long-lost sister Shiva, a street-smart yet naive young woman trapped in an abusive relationship. May feels compelled to rescue the hapless Shiva, but she finds herself increasingly drawn out of her sedate world and deeper into Shiva\'s chaotic one.','/u04tUftlaqBsrpRCwqR6bKHgrVm.jpg','2015-04-16',80,'Released','Tied by blood. Bound by lies.','Bleeding Heart',332706,2.9632,5.01,'vniwsss3kks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37445,_binary '\0','/geB2fOjM2fXBmWbDGv1jWwrA46H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3244512',7.3,2973,'en','Charlie\'s Country','Blackfella Charlie is getting older, and he\'s out of sorts. The intervention is making life more difficult on his remote community, what with the proper policing of whitefella laws that don\'t generally make much sense, and Charlie\'s kin and ken seeming more interested in going along with things than doing anything about it. So Charlie takes off, to live the old way, but in doing so sets off a chain of events in his life that has him return to his community chastened, and somewhat the wiser.','/sqhOh1iFUgzDD0855ZRcCnV5sJ8.jpg','2013-10-12',108,'Released',NULL,'Charlie\'s Country',265349,1.4359,7.026,'qpcfNQ6tiiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37446,_binary '\0','/3T8zjFMH286tRDbTROLLprfIop2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32447822',6.9,1358,'hi','Love in Vietnam','A passionate cross-cultural romance unfolds between Vietnam and Punjab, inspired by the classic Turkish novel \'Madonna in a Fur Coat.','/or5aCixxUZOrPoE2LFw1PLMiZWV.jpg','2025-09-12',132,'Released',NULL,'Love in Vietnam',1536626,1.016,6,'ZZXx