 10','33 years after the infamous Rendlesham Forest UFO incident, three metal detector enthusiasts hunting for Saxon gold in the same region, capture incredible footage of UFO\'s whilst filming their expedition. As night falls and with their navigation equipment failing, they find themselves facing a terrifying encounter with an unforgiving alien presence.','/9ios4yceUMuYtiUIetd3Fhbpk4X.jpg','2014-10-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Hangar 10',297680,0.9545,4.1,'4HCwNn3e3-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37451,_binary '\0','/mvPFffXgQzWFG2fZwdBv0i8zf6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32461003',5.1,1378,'en','The Last Supper','In the days leading to betrayal, a gathering of disciples unravels into a web of secrets and hidden motives. As tensions simmer beneath the surface, trust is tested, and loyalty is questioned. The Last Supper becomes a night where nothing is as it seems, and every glance hides a deeper truth.','/fulEdvN5u6mIpwig7HcBnYpkJEQ.jpg','2025-03-14',114,'Released','All are welcome at the table.','The Last Supper',1380415,4.644,7.159,'-jwAbai7k0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37452,_binary '\0','/fv1ZIqHsq2juN7l8A2htKzLpEw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3246874',7,2664,'en','Wish Man','A motorcycle cop is still haunted by the traumatic separation from his father when he was a boy. After surviving a near-fatal accident and being framed for police brutality, his whole world falls apart. Unexpectedly, he finds hope in the shape of a terminally ill boy, who reunites him with his father after 28 years. To honor the boy, he creates the Make-A-Wish Foundation.','/pJGAUwBVql7dYGfAOpYYe0EmqZ7.jpg','2019-06-07',107,'Released','One boy\'s wish changed a man. One man\'s wish changed the world.','Wish Man',614564,2.3249,6.7,'Whd4Rah5ABg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37453,_binary '\0','/vnPFG9Mpg2bL0RrXsIxSJuBFsM2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32469000',3.9,2057,'ta','ஜென்ம நட்சத்திரம்','A team\'s treasure hunt leads them to a deserted bungalow, where they soon find themselves in a terrifying battle against paranormal dangers.','/slPH7HCWr6RrfGeVWjlK3nLFbMc.jpg','2025-07-18',120,'Released',NULL,'Jenma Natchathiram',1514063,0.7784,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37454,_binary '\0','/qMcVNK71eq1oWWbAt62ZLEkEQnO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32474264',6,3004,'te','కొరియన్ కనకరాజు','Possessed by a Korean spirit, Kanakaraju must navigate his new supernatural identity to protect his family and solve the spirit\'s murder.','/vUEb8v8W5ANRXhydogbmjXfRfni.jpg','2026-08-06',165,'Released',NULL,'Korean Kanakaraju',1423253,2.8333,6.7,'kq0X2owCVKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37455,_binary '\0','/7qMw4BkgvCLBev11Db5ygXNisaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32475217',6.5,2243,'ko','핸섬가이즈','Brothers Jae-pil and Sang-gu move into their dream rustic-style house in the woods. When unwanted visitors arrive and awaken a sealed evil spirit in the basement, a dark aura begins to envelop the house.','/x8QdSeTe02X8f1EcO7yk90lTGNi.jpg','2024-06-26',102,'Released','We ain\'t no ordinary troublemakers!','Handsome Guys',736720,2.8592,6.782,'8X4_gjfrb38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37456,_binary '\0','/kbvSneIEkEcxHZ3AayZUEN2xC1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3247714',5.7,37970,'en','Survivor','A Foreign Service Officer in London tries to prevent a terrorist attack set to hit New York, but is forced to go on the run when she is framed for crimes she did not commit.','/npyCpfYyYknFoY2iJPyfqp70FVX.jpg','2015-05-21',96,'Released','His next target is now hunting him.','Survivor',334074,8.547,5.7,'1lnEyZEoYJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37457,_binary '\0','/bxkGSdY7hw9DuZhDKlxjNSVFPvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32480186',5.9,2421,'ml','ഇഡി: എക്‌സ്‌ട്രാ ഡീസൻ്റ്','A controlling son\'s family try to prevent him from regaining his memory after he is hospitalised following a blow t