umble village and belonging to a lower-middle-class family, emerges as the top student in his college. However, everything changes when he notices the name \"Kumari\" written on the college walls.','/3Mn1nHLRhjo63zhOCvggPeJGsFv.jpg','2024-06-21',131,'Released','Punganuru - 500143','Prabuthwa Junior Kalashala',1307675,0.63,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37466,_binary '\0','/x75Yfp2ZnKERXFKcIgtPrgprNWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32525026',7.1,3292,'kn','Naale Rajaa Koli Majaa','On the day of Gandhi Jayanti, when meat sale is prohibited nationwide, an 11-year-old girl goes on a quirky adventure in pursuit of a forbidden chicken curry.','/3mderzoafSNXoLxI7rXREFDnAiQ.jpg','2025-05-09',91,'Released','WHERE IS MY CHICKEN CURRY?','Naale Rajaa Koli Majaa',1292701,0.9707,0,'2goF22uNg44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37467,_binary '\0','/868km79WWFuiTT1cbfqpubwWCFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3252786',2.8,1747,'en','Cowboys vs. Dinosaurs','After an accidental explosion at a local mine, dinosaurs emerge from the rubble to terrorize a small western town. Now, a group of gunslingers must defend their home if anyone is going to survive in a battle of cowboys versus dinosaurs.','/inxX7yOvXXFV9NiyO90CF7wIQZD.jpg','2015-05-19',89,'Released','Let the Best Species Win','Cowboys vs. Dinosaurs',337208,1.4073,4.2,'211MM3zxNwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37468,_binary '\0','/xlXogh5HpKAlj0KUGpTMkLvEQfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3253476',3.7,1239,'ta','All in All Azhagu Raja','The film is centered around Azhaguraja (Karthi), his friend and adviser Kalyanam (Santhanam) who runs a little known TV channel. He falls head over heels for at first sight with Devi Priya (Kajal Aggarwal) daughter of a rich businessman and the rest of the story is how he wins her in the end.','/gtQfcMghGPr3ptEXDbwgbMwdI3T.jpg','2013-11-02',150,'Released',NULL,'All in All Azhagu Raja',233015,1.5624,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37469,_binary '\0','/b39ychqwNK8XDFbX0tgf0F3yIA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3253624',7.3,11871,'en','Soaked in Bleach','Twenty years ago, Kurt Cobain was found dead of an apparent gunshot wound to the head. The world was told it was a suicide, but evidence would lead many people to believe it might be otherwise. The film investigates the possibilities that exist that Kurt Cobain\'s death might not have been a suicide, that the Seattle Police Department rushed their verdict, and the global media perpetuated lies and misinformation fed to them by Courtney Love that created the belief in many that Cobain killed himself—but when revealed to be lies—lead many to now question what happened.','/1ScpSMDQvwi28Dro1xwSOcKCVln.jpg','2015-06-09',100,'Released','The death of an icon comes to life','Soaked in Bleach',295595,2.2014,7,'E_TzmekRA_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37470,_binary '\0','/28PLbMHktbX8TnuEWSiTrRbI4p8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32536315',6.8,26206,'en','Blue Moon','On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator, Richard Rodgers, celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical, “Oklahoma!”','/dVU7SNc6dgStTVdtbPLQncWxsyZ.jpg','2025-10-17',101,'Released','Forgotten but not gone.','Blue Moon',1299655,19.6953,6.636,'qo7gRHip0lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37471,_binary '\0','/vpS6yEM8QWy2dq8kNPu989IUgT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3253650',7.8,8222,'el','Μικρά Αγγλία','Τwo sisters from the island of Andros, dubbed Little England because of its affluence, are both in love with the same man. Set in the Greek Civil War period and ending in the 1950s.','/ecjDCMBNVhRL2AS61JmJfb7R88V.jpg','2013-12-05',160,'Released','One home, one secret, one man, two sisters.','Little England',228339,1.0783,7,'CHTUqX7vXyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37