son, funding an escape plan managed by Leo’s brother, Yorgos. The fulfillment of his debt is the only thing that matters to Stratos, everything else is indifferent and he lives detached, surrounded by ghosts and fallacies. The day of the escape, the most important day of his life, is near…','/cX41oLxm8B7PCbN9r6SGFkKWneF.jpg','2014-03-27',137,'Released',NULL,'Stratos',254166,1.1109,6.8,'Z4fdIexEnME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37506,_binary '\0','/1EiESIhVU4529hXWEfPw2XIrWjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32598483',6.6,2507,'es','Goyo','A young autistic museum guide lives by a strict routine — until he falls in love with his coworker and must confront a whirlwind of new, intense emotions.','/fCjC1RRbEJUpDjM55RNUMXQen0b.jpg','2024-06-27',108,'Released',NULL,'Goyo',1191610,2.4275,7.03,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37507,_binary '\0','/wE6hsWdwK0QpV33B1MHXlpSJyqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32598986',6.7,1732,'te','Padmavyuham Lo Chakradhari','Explores the daily lives of people living in the Rayalseema region','/mDGbcosBk1GQ1OjKEs9oRIKSecF.jpg','2024-06-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Padmavyuham Lo Chakradhari',1426207,0.4385,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37508,_binary '\0','/wbdGDfXL2vZ5jnwhVhQBWpVbXub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3259968',5.7,1871,'cn','金刚王','In the 1930s , a Japanese cult called The Temple of Hades was ordered to cooperate with the Japanese military to destroy China. They buy so many young children from poor family , who will be trained as a lethal killing machine and serve the Empire of Japan. One of them is Vajra , who was forced by his captors to fight for the food , and accidentally causing the death of his brother. Several years later , Vajra grown up and become one of the biggest killer in the Hades sect. Vajra escapes to China and joins Shaolin , where he receives spiritual enlightenment and determined to support China against Japan.','/auxBaa6PjqX7SVrGXedryMHskV2.jpg','