TESUS4LmQiYMP7JzL8y29up1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32607174',6.3,2130,'hi','रौतू का राज़','Rautu ki Beli, an idyllic town in hilly north India, has been virtually crime-free for over 30 years. The inhabitants are bewildered when a school warden is found dead and the police begin investigating – under the leadership of Inspector Negi. Nothing is as easy as it seems when societal stigma, small-town laziness and ‘locals in denial’ get in the way of a seemingly straightforward case.','/asKw9WwRPFpuAwiGuarPCelE9Yx.jpg','2024-06-28',135,'Released',NULL,'Rautu ka Raaz',1206050,1.3353,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37514,_binary '\0','/mWGsTa8lqmpjvLhDsUCrqX0Dsuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32607369',5.2,1629,'ml','പൈങ്കിളി','Tale of Suku, who fakes insanity to escape the law. While faking insanity, he falls in love.','/hj2VTnrshKRFi6rUKd8neP4q8qO.jpg','2025-02-14',139,'Released',NULL,'Painkili',1290218,1.1668,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37515,_binary '\0','/xugEpZk9YQ0DIz1aFvH5HGkqpZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32612507',6.1,71782,'en','Lee Cronin\'s The Mummy','The young daughter of a journalist disappears into the desert without a trace—eight years later, the broken family is shocked when she is returned to them, as what should be a joyful reunion turns into a living nightmare.','/1q308iixueCU4pFtSYugNOevtNx.jpg','2026-04-15',133,'Released','What happened to Katie?','Lee Cronin\'s The Mummy',1304313,39.1821,7.852,'6wbMsDmJLCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37516,_binary '\0','/ldDp8ikhASbVTk7lw2t5fyM7jD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3261302',3.7,2284,'en','Dinosaur Island','The adventure begins when Lucas, a 13 year old boy, embarks on the vacation of a lifetime. When disaster strikes, Lucas finds himself stranded in a strange land littered with ghost ships and prehistoric creatures. While searching for other signs of life, Lucas hears a radio broadcast in the distance and is drawn into the jungle where he encounters a beautiful young girl who claims to have come from the 1950s. Together they set out on a quest to get home all the while uncovering secrets that will forever change the future.','/xOe4S3eGogWQk4H8NhVe6eNJZSO.jpg','2014-12-01',90,'Released','Their world is closer than you think.','Dinosaur Island',294093,1.6951,5.4,'U18sOypRW8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37517,_binary '\0','/vH0IXldpTM8J3MCT35khoeUMb5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32613601',6.7,1854,'zh','抓娃娃','Ma Chenggang, a wealthy man in Xihong City, worries that his eldest son is too spoiled to succeed him. Determined to raise a capable successor, he takes an unconventional approach. They conceal their wealth, moving the family to a dilapidated neighborhood, and maintain an illusion of poverty, so that his son could develop qualities such as hard work, knowledge, careful budgeting, physical fitness, and perseverance.','/jqGZEk4sLGGmIXBDQzxTuT1lZx2.jpg','2024-07-13',133,'Released',NULL,'Successor',1299537,3.8165,6.963,'5a-S4dDMsT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37518,_binary '\0','/9A0wQG38VdEu3DYh8HzXKXKhA6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32621553',5.5,1992,'en','Dora and the Search for Sol Dorado','Dora, Diego, and their new friends trek through the perilous dangers of the Amazonian jungle in search of the ancient and powerful treasure of Sol Dorado to keep it out of enemy hands.','/r3d6u2n7iPoWNsSWwlJJWrDblOH.jpg','2025-07-02',96,'Released','C\'mon, Vámonos!','Dora and the Search for Sol Dorado',1287536,6.6332,6.6,'92nh9E3B0do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37519,_binary '\0','/KKrsUGDXZfpeL3ddXTeGibmUHS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3262342',7.8,68923,'en','Loving Vincent','A young man arrives at the last hometown of painter Vincent van Gogh to deliver the troubled artist\'s final letter and ends up investigating his final days there.','/56sq57kDm7XgyXBYrgJLumo0Jac.jpg','2017-06-22',95,'Released','The truth is, we cannot speak other than by our paintings.','Loving Vincent',339877,7.1059,7.981,'2ZX7OANSoAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37520,_binary '\0','/4cazJU7Jjb5EukxmT7XRCoO9VnV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32627540',7.1,8798,'en','Watchmen: Chapter I','In 1985, the murder of a government-sponsored superhero draws his outlawed colleagues out of retirement and into a mystery that threatens to upend their personal lives and the world itself.','/tE2vZ6HdlmKaBh0wpsvHCf7HJKo.jpg','2024-08-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Watchmen: Chapter I',1155058,6.3669,7.4,'j-s-cxTnH2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37521,_binary '\0','/dGGjuaUR253aAZ2Zhto2Y9TR9l6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32627545',7.1,4973,'en','Watchmen: Chapter II','Suspicious of the events ensnaring their former colleagues, Nite Owl and Silk Spectre are spurred out of retirement to investigate. As they grapple with personal ethics, inner demons and a society turned against them, they race the clock to uncover a deepening plot that might trigger global nuclear war.','/4rBObJFpiWJOG7aIlRrOUniAkBs.jpg','2024-11-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Watchmen: Chapter II',1299652,4.9269,7.3,'VEX3fJMNxwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37522,_binary '\0','/lhUGNUm0eCl4SoZRL4nbQYs0HGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3262990',6.5,2279,'en','Brotherly Love','West Philadelphia basketball star Sergio Taylor deals with the pressures of fame while his brother and sister have their own issues with ambition.','/z8Fg0EcHvNLjvASg0h1FbwvrIXe.jpg','2015-04-24',89,'Released',NULL,'Brotherly Love',295886,2.4021,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37523,_binary '\0','/eBPynEM4bzqUqRPezWLmnK8LBOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32634271',6.3,1495,'zh','东极岛','Inspired by the real life rescue of over 300 British soldiers in 1942, Dongji Rescue is a rousing, action-packed story of heroism on the high seas. When the Japanese warship Lisbon Maru is torpedoed off the coast of Dongji Island, the lives of over 300 British POWs on board are at risk of being claimed by the sea. Their only hope is a small group of defiant Chinese fisherman who will do anything to rescue and protect them from their captors.','/nPo4VVucCQ8OLTzi4uehKB5kCTf.jpg','2025-08-08',134,'Released','Any Chinese can be a hero.','Rescue at Dongji',1305653,4.0618,8.3,'GeZ01JLg2F0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37524,_binary '\0','/1yYvCQ9RoAzfz909gYhPqIm7ZOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263520',7,1451,'en','Ivory Tower','As tuition spirals upward and student debt passes a trillion dollars, students and parents ask, \"Is college worth it?\" From the halls of Harvard to public and private colleges in financial crisis to education startups in Silicon Valley, an urgent portrait emerges of a great American institution at the breaking point.','/wL1djGpYcJwvKBQXQP8Q665xI4I.jpg','2014-06-13',97,'Released',NULL,'Ivory Tower',250660,1.1765,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37525,_binary '\0','/thCHgekGlsP2acWnm3NAbXyoGOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32635378',7.2,1497,'da','Ternet Ninja 3','In this 3rd installment Alex’s interest for Ninja missions is starting to vanish. He’ll rather spend his time with his friends and Checkered Ninja feels he is overlooked and is eager to engage in a new mission. The result of this is that Alex, by accident, ends up having a conflict with Marco, the bad boy boyfriend of Jessica, entangling him in a conflict he hasn’t asked for and he is pressured by Checkered Ninja to defend himself.','/sGUesG39H2LWZ6lUTwZXOqUHsxI.jpg','2026-01-01',84,'Released','You can ignore your problems, but you can\'t escape them','Checkered Ninja 3',1215638,5.1527,8.4,'coRdidSZRTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37526,_binary '\0','/pGN4hqoXRLEFsBfavVVY7XWtjZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263614',6.6,13086,'en','Kumiko, the Treasure Hunter','Frustrated with her mundane life, a Tokyo office worker becomes obsessed with a fictional movie that she mistakes for a documentary. Fixating on a scene where stolen cash is buried in North Dakota, she travels to America to find it.','/wZU05LeIZE6azWUCnjYhEHeCDHB.jpg','2014-11-13',104,'Released',NULL,'Kumiko, the Treasure Hunter',244563,3.1048,6.6,'WiyQSSzihFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37527,_binary '\0','/crbNJYMvfYQg9X6OjLoTkipoS50.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263718',6.1,1344,'tr','Deniz Seviyesi','Damla reluctantly returns to her Turkish summer town with her American husband. Her bitter past is soon to be unveiled.','/hdrvenm5FO1434k8tVXWMKOgwk.jpg','2014-11-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Across the Sea',321486,1.0285,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37528,_binary '\0','/oQ024BtJgArg8WI4zfuc2vkCJno.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263904',7.4,326233,'en','Sully','On 15 January 2009, the world witnessed the \'Miracle on the Hudson\' when Captain \'Sully\' Sullenberger glided his disabled plane onto the Hudson River, saving the lives of all 155 souls aboard. However, even as Sully was being heralded by the public and the media for his unprecedented feat of aviation skill, an investigation was unfolding that threatened to destroy his reputation and career.','/4vs83YcJ8TsabADDtaeCJ6ZTjYY.jpg','2016-09-07',96,'Released','The untold story behind the miracle on the Hudson.','Sully',363676,13.2612,7.206,'6Tbkbx4Hz8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37529,_binary '\0','/kbLpay8YkYOpOUMt6ud7DXGsCzH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32639066',6.7,1236,'ta','Rocket Driver','An autorickshaw driver frequently expresses discontent with life\'s aspects but harbors an ambitious dream of changing the world, though his actions fail to align with his aspirations.','/zDDPm4YdUpmKzVXdxMYdGRVylSp.jpg','2024-10-18',103,'Released',NULL,'Rocket Driver',1372609,0.615,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37530,_binary '\0','/9MeHubuKm7XJLx68LDEkE8yVnWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32639175',5,4723,'en','Dolly','Young Macy is abducted by a deranged, monstrous figure who wants to raise her as its child.','/oJJquv1sg5XMTIyNHxEm0KLo696.jpg','2026-03-06',83,'Released','Mommy knows best.','Dolly',1309083,10.5589,5.722,'LALT2B-Ubpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37531,_binary '\0','/mPfN4ExlmlHaxFapAD4EO1nXh3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263946',7.1,16412,'en','Trial by Fire','The tragic and controversial story of Cameron Todd Willingham, who was executed in Texas for killing his three children after scientific evidence and expert testimony that bolstered his claims of innocence were suppressed.','/Aeon31iP17ys9FesAK3bLycXI6v.jpg','2019-05-17',127,'Released','Stand for what\'s right. Fight for what\'s true.','Trial by Fire',481880,5.6007,6.973,'rrq6SOwyr5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37532,_binary '\0','/t8OT1XN70ldFOxPbbHl5ywoTLRW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3263996',7.4,2655,'en','The Overnighters','Desperate, broken men chase their dreams and run from their demons in the North Dakota oil fields. A local Pastor\'s decision to help them has extraordinary and unexpected consequences.','/pkDorP7Rj1wgxcYZx2aNeozRJP8.jpg','2014-10-10',102,'Released',NULL,'The Overnighters',250666,0.7457,7,'n_50-lKvqF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37533,_binary '\0','/cVzqqF4akx3TQgMPgJcn6Dc68a5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3264102',7.6,7484,'en','Red Army','A documentary highlighting the Soviet Union\'s legendary and enigmatic hockey training culture and world-dominating team through the eyes of the team\'s Captain Slava Fetisov, following his shift from hockey star and celebrated national hero to political enemy.','/y2e6I7A8AgNTfB1MeNZfhh9Q4ES.jpg','2015-01-23',85,'Released',NULL,'Red Army',256876,2.0165,7.34,'a_euhvZQMaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37534,_binary '\0','/tD9gHDBMUQaw07LKppyNnAWaK1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32641442',7.2,2038,'en','Merrily We Roll Along','Franklin Shepard is a talented Broadway composer who abandons his theater career and all his friends in New York in order to produce films in Los Angeles. The story begins at the height of his Hollywood fame and moves backwards in time, showing snapshots of the most important moments in Frank’s life that shaped the man he is today. (A live recording of the 2024 Tony Award-winning Broadway revival of Stephen Sondheim and George Furth\'s musical, filmed at the Hudson Theatre in New York City.)','/8h3uNPMdQKr7ffwAjU0aURFqIK.jpg','2025-12-04',145,'Released','Hey, old friend? How do we stay old friends?','Merrily We Roll Along',1306400,3.6901,6.9,'Ams0ROhWX0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37535,_binary '\0','/pgvn1tazqI9mZaRCNQUqNr3umvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32642156',5.8,2263,'fr','L\'Homme qui rétrécit','Paul, is an ordinary man who divides his life between his shipbuilding company, his wife Elise and their daughter Mia. During a sea trip, Paul finds himself confronted with a strange, unexplained meteorological phenomenon. From then on, Paul shrinks inexorably, without science being able to explain why or be of any help to him. When, by accident, he finds himself a prisoner in his own cellar, and while he is only a few centimeters tall, he will have to fight to survive in this banal environment that has become perilous. During this experience, Paul will find himself confronted with himself, with his humanity, and will try to answer the great questions of existence.','/5scjQRQq4i0zpbfyvWJX8LFEWjt.jpg','2025-10-22',99,'Released',NULL,'The Shrinking Man',1233506,6.3058,6,'dX1E-9jE4bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37536,_binary '\0','/kwNIQW7egAmI66sb0zIugMbpCfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32642706',6.8,146441,'en','The Rip','Trust frays when a team of Miami cops discovers millions in cash inside a run-down stash house, calling everyone — and everything — into question.','/4wsYWH73Hb1B6noGIFaRQSAkuXj.jpg','2026-01-13',113,'Released','Count the money. Count it again. Count on no one.','The Rip',1306368,25.4401,7.086,'yeR5bcbRPak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37537,_binary '\0','/cNmGq1bfUDhrZEHvJ77zwiWfoNA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32643830',5.3,7193,'id','Abadi Nan Jaya','An elixir unleashes the undead in a village. A family at odds with one another must unite and fight to survive as their hometown collapses.','/A6aJLPhtmin9ZTWC2h7dnrMHU4z.jpg','2025-10-22',118,'Released',NULL,'The Elixir',1306525,6.4139,5.945,'XL48F7LGoig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37538,_binary '\0','/cNGJApb7I2ko9fcUpPhFIv4F5Ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32644677',7.8,2058,'te','Sandeham','A newlywed couple gets into trouble when the husband discovers that his wife still has feelings for her ex-boyfriend. What will the consequences of this love triangle be? To what extent will he go to win his wife\'s love forever?','/fj8uVJUQCD2znWvy5S6e66gP2o4.jpg','2024-06-22',119,'Released',NULL,'Sandeham',1394454,0.4391,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37539,_binary '\0','/vdrj9Ff1uuDYOKx3ystId47DLBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32646557',6.6,1876,'fr','Enzo','Enzo, 16, defies his bourgeois family’s expectations by starting a masonry apprenticeship, a path far removed from the prestigious life they had envisioned for him. In their chic villa in the sun-drenched South of France, tensions simmer as relentless questions and pressures weigh on Enzo’s future and dreams. On the construction sites, however, Vlad, a charismatic Ukrainian colleague, shakes up Enzo’s world and opens the door to unexpected possibilities.','/cghjz7l78J8S3rr5EkzCrpr3bMS.jpg','2025-06-18',102,'Released',NULL,'Enzo',1277872,2.3325,6.515,'J7BrsNnpvW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37540,_binary '\0','/ljaRxXl7XzffsQU4LxFnaiIhglv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32648798',6,5796,'ko','계시록','A pastor who believes in divine revelation and a detective haunted by visions pursue a missing person case — exposing their own demons in the process.','/ak0HlRVsVzh8mvwIUZpZr0z6uqW.jpg','2025-03-20',122,'Released','With twisted faith, madness begins.','Revelations',1210938,4.5214,6.368,'5XcVSWOKVsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37541,_binary '\0','/29pJrsosphUdOMRDm4gCdhSkluI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32649961',6.8,4171,'zh','镖人：风起大漠','Dao Ma, the \"second most wanted fugitive,\" is entrusted by his benefactor, the chief of Mo family clan, to take on a mysterious escort mission-escorting the \"most wanted fugitive\" to Chang\'an.','/R84km7PJ0frFSNPmvIjG6LV1kg.jpg','2026-02-17',126,'Released','A grand martial arts feast is back!','Blades of the Guardians',1305781,18.7834,8.206,'7jkL4-uYriY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37542,_binary '\0','/9LMbfbuD1iCXfbk3IfdrZCqb1pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3265262',7.1,1863,'en','Pulp: a Film About Life, Death & Supermarkets','Pulp found fame on the world stage in the 1990s with anthems including ‘Common People’ and ‘Disco 2000’. 25 years (and 10 million album sales) later, they return to Sheffield for their last UK concert. In addition to performing, band members share their thoughts on fame, love, mortality — and car maintenance.','/3vziV0NRlthBfjFaBwYqq6dSh6a.jpg','2014-03-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Pulp: a Film About Life, Death & Supermarkets',253332,1.3993,7.2,'uDNz941vRXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37543,_binary '\0','/ihElDfjHdoMzgcaXp5vuv2r1bvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32654179',4.1,7123,'tr','Gelin Takımı','A group of female friends take a holiday bachelorette trip, where they let their hair down, flirting with strangers, and indulge in a party lifestyle.','/1zdd12EhiMeyoqSaKYGvbeH7FKh.jpg','2024-10-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Bride Squad',1288455,0.9667,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37544,_binary '\0','/arJFjv59hsTImNezz87EjMaPs8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3265462',7.2,3240,'ko','한공주','After being involved in a traumatic incident, 17-year-old Gong-ju is forced to change schools. Uncared for by her parents, her previous teacher arranges for her to hide away at his mother\'s place. It takes time for her past to catch up with her, but when it does the revelation is devastating.','/4aLNAcE52EaKy8Iydtxyz9rozQh.jpg','2014-04-17',112,'Released','I didn\'t do anything wrong.','Han Gong-ju',229304,2.8652,7.235,'FsQyHhusuP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37545,_binary '\0','/7t6f6VxA2ZXbbZSVctgt7bZG2DI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32654916',5.8,7115,'en','Soulm8te','After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.','/bNErActDctl6cdUGw9pnjSCmyhQ.jpg','2026-07-31',99,'Released','You can\'t turn off the power of love.','Soulm8te',1307118,56.4354,7.5,'DF9I1wLlXbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37546,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32655161',6.9,2145,'kn','Full Meals','Full Meals movie touches upon Love, Life, and Passion. In the Film, protagonist is a struggling Wedding Photographer who tries to attain his passion and prove himself. In this process he gets entangled in his personal and love life','/ilc0GjyRDHjg1Fv9dBjsUgeynPE.jpg','2025-11-21',133,'Released',NULL,'Full Meals',1531376,1.7981,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37547,_binary '\0','/2v6hzV33XZn1S4U40E4ZTYwP1eZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3266284',5.3,11678,'en','November Criminals','When Addison investigates the murder of his friend Kevin with the help of Phoebe, they discover that the truth is darker than they had ever imagined.','/j22QBwmEClhpGiRrELXiEBOw81D.jpg','2017-11-07',86,'Released',NULL,'November Criminals',317091,5.2196,5.282,'TImAMCQbwJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37548,_binary '\0','/h8oqzUTbz148vFO1edt8ak0yXeJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3266724',2.9,2810,'en','Black Rose','A Russian Police Major is enlisted by the LAPD to help solve a series of gruesome murders perpetrated against young women by a sadistic sociopathic killer on the mean streets of Hollywood.','/zvyRqhSJqc8ls5iTFiWPdhilgSY.jpg','2014-04-17',83,'Released','Russian In USA','Black Rose',272610,2.2993,2.8,'fyLFcvIrN20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37549,_binary '\0','/dmXCdGevDwKTRJUzXOZej9DyLeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3266948',5,1418,'en','Any Day','Following his release from prison, an ex-fighter meets a woman who helps him put his life back together.','/zerBCSeJmZ1nms75tck4nkvQHAN.jpg','2015-03-27',100,'Released','Never give up.','Any Day',332936,1.6837,5,'sBW5dKpYsWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37550,_binary '\0','/8kT4NFQfNZ2ig6Nj7FVeACTH9v1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3268340',6.7,3151,'en','Crown Heights','When Colin Warner was wrongfully convicted of murder, his best friend Carl King devoted his life to proving his innocence.','/ksTHqOb8bPPdbIsZXHnWX3NrgfH.jpg','2017-08-25',96,'Released',NULL,'Crown Heights',425507,1.6518,6.6,'P2sLyAAfQ2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37551,_binary '\0','/o85Xk5nCcx4NWlYKLm9ebrQaqMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3268458',8,18639,'en','The Internet\'s Own Boy: The Story of Aaron Swartz','Programming prodigy and information activist Aaron Swartz achieved groundbreaking work in social justice and political organizing. His passion for open access ensnared him in a legal nightmare that ended with the taking of his own life at the age of 26.','/6yfXtkVPWxeU3OonoKDem4Hrdbb.jpg','2014-06-27',105,'Released',NULL,'The Internet\'s Own Boy: The Story of Aaron Swartz',250658,4.4474,7.878,'o-PT1AZSdHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37552,_binary '\0','/tRkZRTqZ5kznXPZUCkwTLNJ3uyR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32684804',6.9,1397,'en','The Santa Class','Kate North reluctantly takes over her father’s struggling Santa School, where she and a colleague discover an amnesiac Santa Claus and must help him regain his memories through their training program to save both the school and Christmas.','/gxgpLCC1TJIwLauSJo4hTokAJD5.jpg','2025-12-11',84,'Released','A crash course in Christmas','The Santa Class',1361225,1.6591,8,'YKMwHx2yvgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37553,_binary '\0','/jeLEiX8my7cqEO7Ut5LOgc45Oet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3268668',5.4,7573,'en','Captive','Based on a miraculous true story that drew the attention of the entire nation, is the dramatic, thrilling, and spiritual journey of Ashley Smith and Brian Nichols. After being taken hostage by Brian in her own apartment, Ashley turns to Rick Warren’s inspirational book, The Purpose Driven Life, for guidance. In reading from the book, Ashley not only finds purpose in her own life, but helps Brian find a more peaceful resolution to a harrowing situation.','/rKOY6QwmnuZYPaMIvdmZQHjxDLI.jpg','2015-09-17',97,'Released','Faith. Redemption. Survival.','Captive',331190,3.0632,5.6,'Pld9pgO824o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37554,_binary '\0','/7OrGWuJ15RXiAVbUNFQ5w2IWVz8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3268850',7.5,3297,'en','Unrest','When Harvard PhD student Jennifer Brea is struck down at 28 by a fever that leaves her bedridden, doctors tell her it’s \"all in her head.\" Determined to live, she sets out on a virtual journey to document her story—and four other families\' stories—fighting a disease medicine forgot.','/rjkAUg2gbU64PVIkjK5Z5bqbGl7.jpg','2017-10-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Unrest',433033,1.1628,6.8,'JvK5s9BNLzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37555,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3269074',6.3,1334,'fa','دربند','This fascinating moral thriller is centered on the bristling relationship between two very different young women in contemporary Tehran. Nazanin (Nazanin Bayati) is a determined first year medical student. Since there is no free space in the university dorm and Nazanin does not have much money, she is obliged to share an apartment with Sahar (Pegah Ahangarani), a party lover who works in a fragrance shop. Sahar badly wants to migrate from Iran, so she’s borrowed money from a man in the bazaar. When this man makes an opportunistic complaint against Sahar, she is imprisoned. There have been some very some rocky times between the two roommates and their conflicting lifestyles, but Nazanin will now do everything she can to have her friend released.','/lLaMmmhxyNGW8hn1soI6JbSnHEo.jpg','2013-09-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Trapped',224458,0.9308,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37556,_binary '\0','/2TSUKa2x3WdmQmoWd4bLKOyBBg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3270108',5.9,5054,'en','Jackie & Ryan','A modern day train hopper fighting to be a successful musician and a single mom battling to maintain custody of her daughter defy their circumstances by coming together in a relationship that may change each other\'s lives forever.','/wKaYcvfZIMsCCZoHtgMr87MpU4Y.jpg','2014-09-01',90,'Released','Sometimes they stay. Sometimes they go.','Jackie & Ryan',289891,2.6334,5.9,'dCTmxBZsa4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37557,_binary '\0','/oa3eTHQAqLLryG0jF5DfxQoBC21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3270538',8,10285,'en','Requiem for the American Dream','Through interviews filmed over four years, Noam Chomsky unpacks the principles that have brought us to the crossroads of historically unprecedented inequality – tracing a half-century of policies designed to favor the most wealthy at the expense of the majority – while also looking back on his own life of activism and political participation. He provides penetrating insight into what may well be the lasting legacy of our time – the death of the middle class, and swan song of functioning democracy.','/z30fIUchddu5RPUN8JWFiDhk2yp.jpg','2015-04-18',73,'Released','Noam Chomsky and the PRINCIPLES of CONCENTRATION of WEALTH & POWER','Requiem for the American Dream',333377,2.1225,7.726,'zI_Ik7OppEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37558,_binary '\0','/yJYveyx1B0wxmCrHDh65CH3c4DO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3271700',6.4,1642,'ko','공범','A young woman\'s happy life with her father takes a downward turn when she begins to suspect that he\'s a kidnapper.','/ujxoYzbIQ2CuSYtt1fJJv3NMhJG.jpg','2013-10-24',95,'Released','Trust me. I\'m your father.','Blood and Ties',229878,1.9634,6.2,'P9Xq1fPSXVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37559,_binary '\0','/8yhWlFcJ8zCqjfCvLy3lWFuawR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3272066',5.9,71607,'en','Reminiscence','Nicolas Bannister, a rugged and solitary veteran living in a near-future Miami flooded by rising seas, is an expert in a dangerous occupation: he offers clients the chance to relive any memory they desire. His life changes when he meets a mysterious young woman named Mae. What begins as a simple matter of lost and found becomes a passionate love affair. But when a different client\'s memories implicate Mae in a series of violent crimes, Bannister must delve through the dark world of the past to uncover the truth about the woman he fell for.','/17siH6wJRQ2jZiqz9BWUhy1UtZ.jpg','2021-08-18',116,'Released','Don\'t look back.','Reminiscence',579047,8.6278,6.497,'_BggT--yxf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37560,_binary '\0','/8azdxVR1RU2BwTHmsocsGSCx1ho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3272570',7.3,3805,'en','All Things Must Pass','The explosive trajectory and tragic demise of iconic music retailer Tower Records, and the legacy of its rebellious founder Russ Solomon. Two hundred stores in thirty countries on five continents. In 1999 it made $1 billion. In 2006 it filed for bankruptcy. What went wrong?','/7oO565fLtDlx2Ief7Jn7YVsY0g.jpg','2015-10-16',94,'Released','The doors are closed. But the legacy lives on.','All Things Must Pass',324253,2.1453,7.2,'DAepjF6_N68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37561,_binary '\0','/qAJqYEz0utqsaPsMQvgjbUatUwv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32730754',5.9,27214,'tr','Rüzgara Bırak','A focused city worker and a laid-back surfer - both heirs to the same company - find they have plenty in common when they join forces in the boardroom.','/fbpnM5daEEV0WKqrYASypGvpWpS.jpg','2025-01-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Chasing the Wind',1318917,4.8633,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37562,_binary '\0','/9S95OFt0gc1k3ZiasYTk27VbWPl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3273636',7.2,2193,'de','Hin und Weg','Belgium, of all places. What\'s Belgium got besides chocolates and fries? No matter, this year it was Hannes\' and Kiki\'s turn to choose the destination of their annual bike tour with their closest friends. They all looks forward to the adventure, after all they know that what counts the most is the time they spend together. It\'s only after the tour has begun that Hannes tells his friends that he\'s suffering from an incurable disease. The trip is to be his last. At first, the group is shocked and helpless, but after they hit the road again, they embark on a wild and one-of-a-kind adventure. Through Hannes, they realize how precious life is. Equipped with a list of things that still remain to do, and aware that nothing will be the same after this trip, they celebrate life as they never did before.','/1Q5lEK3QJ6EyRCMJWArHweMtBs3.jpg','2014-08-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Tour de Force',285025,1.3391,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37563,_binary '\0','/iBMPI1Bkw3teMQWM8nz79alHRK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32740678',6.5,1291,'en','14','Just before the election, the sudden death of the son of the chief minister and a girl ignites a media frenzy and public speculation. This clash of egos sparks a covert investigation by retired IAS officers.','/iDNlyJZuDR35GqQozUYe2Uc2DFD.jpg',NULL,117,'Released',NULL,'14',1699881,0.7117,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37564,_binary '\0','/sa3TBhb5S4ppfDcUuiAq2MYKra2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32741341',7.5,7173,'ta','லீடர்','An ordinary man becomes trapped between warring criminal factions and law enforcement, forcing him to use his wits to survive while shielding his loved ones from the deadly crossfire that threatens to consume them all.','/eitNeP5lMT67piVVA8h31lb5keN.jpg','2026-04-03',136,'Released',NULL,'Leader',1504848,2.1345,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37565,_binary '\0','/jHYYfaiuU2glCNQeqLYaeqh8vbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32743167',4.4,3436,'en','Carved','On Halloween 1993, the staff of a historic pioneer village attraction must work together to survive the attack of a monstrous killer pumpkin set on revenge.','/9DKH4j80eR4qAcGDoShlUO7D0Is.jpg','2024-10-20',94,'Released','Ripe for revenge.','Carved',1308546,3.4168,4.9,'HLu0FoIgGCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37566,_binary '\0','/e4AyTx37zz9MhJEXKHTDlfseMzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32743685',7.6,3170,'en','Jaws @ 50: The Definitive Inside Story','The authorized documentary celebrating the film that redefined Hollywood, 50 years after its premiere. Featuring rare archival footage and interviews with acclaimed Hollywood directors alongside Steven Spielberg, top shark scientists, and conservationists, the film uncovers the behind-the-scenes chaos and how the film launched the summer blockbuster, inspired a new wave of filmmakers, and paved the way for shark conservation that continues today.','/kCvCb548scfD0HhkCAwBMKHey5b.jpg','2025-06-20',88,'Released','The movie you know. The story you don’t.','Jaws @ 50: The Definitive 