CbkbU6uglZJ.jpg','2013-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Behzat Ç.: Ankara Is on Fire',255161,1.7823,6.485,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37604,_binary '\0','/1JBRb4DvqCOJoDfa15RwIZbK0Sb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3283718',6.1,5982,'tr','Hükümet Kadın 2','Seven years before the first film, Xate, still living in her husband Aziz Veysel’s shadow, is about to become the region’s first female mayor when a routine morning send-off for Aziz turns explosive, reigniting the fierce rivalry between Xate and the power-hungry Faruk. Their conflict escalates further when there’s an unexpected call for snap elections.','/tNBXCxibM262iHQgHlLuQKmDTQU.jpg','2013-11-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Government Woman 2',255156,1.2972,5.7,'bEwt4ZcCrD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37605,_binary '\0','/ufkHAgmSDTyPiDAqK9GOB9JLQs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3283792',4.1,1323,'tr','Erkek Tarafı: Testosteron','The film, which captures a long conversation between seven men who take refuge in a restaurant after the wedding they attended is canceled, focuses on masculinity and the place of women in this world.','/52ZexuCBQ88OHReEIUyjPmoQqKZ.jpg','2013-11-22',115,'Released',NULL,'Erkek Tarafı: Testosteron',750715,0.9458,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37606,_binary '\0','/2eM5PVIrjN4CiVcpbHTjnntWVTW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3283804',7,6016,'tr','Tamam mıyız?','Temmuz is an openly gay sculptor living at a flat with his dog in Istanbul. He lives a bohemian lifestyle and has a happy go lucky, carefree, eccentric (such as believing in good luck charms) character, frequently distracting him from his work as a children\'s book illustrator, and eventually leading him to be abandoned by his boyfriend via e-mail. He is given solace and affection by her wealthy mother, who is fully supportive of him, and best friend and co-worker, Beste. In the meantime, he keeps seeing a young man in his dreams, who repeatedly calls him for help and rescue. One day he runs into this guy while getting on the bus, who is accompanied by his mother, and helps them get into their home as the young man was born without limbs. From then on, two lives would collide into each other, starting a brotherhood full of discoveries and mutual help.','/hEMltGaowYEbgVisstGsMwtcxlZ.jpg','2013-11-29',92,'Released',NULL,'Are We Ok?',255635,1.4237,6.3,'YrR7zcNv-Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37607,_binary '\0','/nTJ7G3zoXA8fIjsCqo0S5L6nQS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3283864',6.2,2219,'en','Some Freaks','A charming romance develops between a boy with one eye and an overweight girl, though when she loses weight after going to college, their relationship is tested in devastating ways they never dreamed would happen.','/v3S6tJCLfJ1HcDPOU8JtXn5c0xx.jpg','2016-07-24',97,'Released','It\'s weird not to be weird.','Some Freaks',402464,1.0989,6.1,'Pbf6zqhHJ0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37608,_binary '\0','/aNkEhnzjh4U4bYW3X2by8IOGOgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3284178',6.9,2593,'pt','As Mil e Uma Noites: Volume 1, O Inquieto','Every night, in danger of being beheaded, Scheherazade tells King Shahryar unfinished tales to continue them the following night, hence defying his promise of murdering his new wives after their wedding night. Scheherazade tells King Shahryar her stories but these are not those in the book. As in the book, these stories are tragic and comical, with rich and poor, powerless and powerful people, filled with surprising and extraordinary events.','/nB2Gbsv0tkdxDAK9XEdNcnoLOyZ.jpg','2015-06-24',125,'Released',NULL,'Arabian Nights: Volume 1, The Restless One',254736,1.9549,6.9,'_aJgLXhdUgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37609,_binary '\0','/61GhkX3C2gWOv2k9uowWjPxDaqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32843325',6.2,1969,'zh','封神第二部：战火西岐','Taishi Wen Zhong led the army of Shang Dynasty including Deng Chanyu and four generals of the Mo Family to Xiqi. With the help of Kunlun immortals such as Jiang Ziya, Ji Fa led the army and civilians of Xiqi to defend their homeland.','/dfUCs5HNtGu4fofh83uiE2Qcy3v.jpg','2025-01-29',145,'Released',NULL,'Creation of the Gods II: Demon Force',1155281,7.4593,6.4,'GR1LszelGoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37610,_binary '\0','/zsRlAkCNORkjTeaiMHQoM3GdMdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32843331',7.5,2766,'te','జనక ఐతే గనక','When his wife announces a surprise pregnancy, a man decides to sue the condom company he deems responsible.','/aAMn1DhI9lRlKNoLrLMTh3kU6iB.jpg','2024-10-11',138,'Released',NULL,'Janaka Aithe Ganaka',1357662,0.8345,5.75,'6eGXENFS024','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37611,_binary '\0','/nVHEjkA8vuEGJLfNUOmVW5md6yn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32843349',7.1,26274,'en','Sorry, Baby','Agnes feels stuck. Unlike her best friend, Lydie, who’s moved to New York and is now expecting a baby, Agnes still lives in the New England house they once shared as graduate students, now working as a professor at her alma mater. A ‘bad thing’ happened to Agnes a few years ago and, since then, despite her best efforts, life hasn’t gotten back on track.','/n8wZEQen5hDNRGzm4fY4sxWe5xe.jpg','2025-06-27',103,'Released','Welcome to the world.','Sorry, Baby',1205515,10.9332,6.9,'Rc0jgWoZo9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37612,_binary '\0','/zPZKSm30cdocTAAzn5I55gvatCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32857110',7.8,2033,'bn','Bohurupi','A mysterious dacoit is on the run. A supercop gets involved with him in a cat and mouse chase.','/aHLUTNxGZq2eALjdsw1u2EwumAy.jpg','2024-10-08',155,'Released',NULL,'Bohurupi',1257622,1.1956,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37613,_binary '\0','/nGYncNCfeAccyhhdGRgj3sbexPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3286052',5.9,32920,'en','The Blackcoat\'s Daughter','Two young women at a prestigious prep school are assailed by an evil, invisible power when they\'re stranded over winter break.','/jO2aHAiWgQSlpAIPGZikiMDdMXx.jpg','2017-03-31',94,'Released','Abandoned as a child. Raised by the dark.','The Blackcoat\'s Daughter',334536,4.8298,5.869,'8e_eL1u_uAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37614,_binary '\0','/ijy6b2frS9rkWGF7UYGRfUPtvoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32864330',5.1,2351,'ta','டெவில்\'ஸ் டபுள் நெக்ஸ்ட்டு லெவல்','A well-known movie critic is invited by a strange person to watch a special horror film. But once the movie starts, he finds himself trapped inside it. The world keeps shifting timelines, endless day-to-night cycles, non-linear narration, and scary things from horror movies come to life. To escape, he must either stop reviewing movies forever or find a way to defeat the ghost that trapped him.','/jS8XroVkuvsdXcCNnWUnaxj9XNX.jpg','2025-05-16',131,'Released',NULL,'Devil\'s Double Next Level',1421019,1.589,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37615,_binary '\0','/aAyK8XclSkfQCfVD9Aaj1E5zgEC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32864342',7.8,1756,'ta','ஜமா','A poignant tale of Kalyanam, a young Koothu artist, struggles to uphold his father’s legacy in traditional folk art amidst rivals suppressions , torn between his love, mothers wishes, societal expectations, and self-doubt in his quest to lead his own Jama.','/zWOwRCoSxtdSWpFhdEary3mgKlD.jpg','2024-08-02',133,'Released',NULL,'Jama',1316911,1.1022,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37616,_binary '\0','/t1jtkPLt5MhBQ0aPWgAXuO26mtN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3286484',5.9,1530,'en','Gangsta Granny','A young boy is bored spending time with his dull grandma until he discovers she\'s an international Jewel thief.','/2EdsmlXozdx6JcItKfIJZxRecaJ.jpg','2013-12-26',60,'Released',NULL,'Gangsta Granny',245739,1.8213,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37617,_binary '\0','/ua9cbCID72c1ViGWdfAzr1nTWu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3286560',5.1,5992,'en','The Last Face','Miguel, a heroic Spanish doctor, puts himself in harm\'s way to deliver medical treatment to the victims of military uprisings in Africa.','/egOM3BJgA44fR6YdiQJD51iQ4On.jpg','2017-01-11',130,'Released',NULL,'The Last Face',287904,4.9834,5.5,'7Ln9yRHVshQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37618,_binary '\0','/a6VXgWVWjSvUq0UsCPSgUQko4CQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32875624',5.1,4007,'hi','Haunted 3D: Echoes of the Past','A man seeks refuge in a remote Indian mountain mansion, fleeing his past. He discovers the house harbors sinister secrets, pain, and terror ready to torment him.','/tSmAFNckiqcKg7aFgjCFnhNqNbP.jpg','2026-06-12',140,'Released',NULL,'Haunted 3D: Echoes of the Past',1486860,3.5572,10,'MmWxmeChy9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37619,_binary '\0','/Av0ARGRFed2pmmlBWdPw8lqp7zN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32880190',6.1,9713,'te','కళింగ','A village is terrorized by a demonic entity and a deadly ancient curse.','/y62MzCi3Auwb1T4aGDPNE2gLyIE.jpg','2024-09-12',116,'Released',NULL,'Kalinga',1352962,1.098,3.8,'fUekk6TVeq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37620,_binary '\0','/ptcyGmBonW6mDQmrPhXbt6Rjrlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32880540',5.8,4001,'es','Zeta','Four Spanish ex-intelligence officers are assassinated simultaneously worldwide. The CNI discovers all participated in the covert \"Operation Ciénaga\" decades ago in Colombia. Zeta, the CNI\'s best operative, must hunt and protect the sole survivor, facing his deadliest global mission yet. Top Colombian agent Alfa will join Zeta, seemingly knowing more about \"Ciénaga\"\'s secrets than him.','/1cKLG9KMoCjsgFB8Nw1EuglteVi.jpg','2026-03-20',133,'Released',NULL,'Agent Zeta',1314786,9.5911,6.711,'d56tjzLzYZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37621,_binary '\0','/4unmV1WOdRJZSC99Jkmsrr5cLGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32880932',5.8,12434,'en','V/H/S/Beyond','The infinite playground of forbidden worlds and dangerous lifeforms offered by the sci-fi horror genre will lead to the biggest, maddest, bloodiest V/H/S ever.','/wXaf6VGNHIGU7qivapGOF7o4o4N.jpg','2024-09-20',114,'Released','No safe space.','V/H/S/Beyond',1190868,5.5746,6.592,'h1zNXVG6zTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37622,_binary '\0','/35PrpNA2NDFBUTn8KS3Qe8uFZli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32881480',8,2749,'id','1 Kakak 7 Ponakan','After the untimely death of his older sister and her husband, a struggling young architect suddenly becomes a \"single parent\" for his nieces and nephews. When the opportunity for a better life arises, he must choose between his love life, career, or his family.','/d8iIVE9KmkSITslMYD6WvHvbRFk.jpg','2025-01-23',131,'Released','Who else has to die?','A Brother and 7 Siblings',1310741,1.7993,8.4,'jaiqll7Ofqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37623,_binary '\0','/mtMpvqD409Zj6Rw0oSzmBowXYHy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3288290',7.7,2424,'sv','Swedish House Mafia - Leave the World Behind','A music documentary following the breakup of Swedish House Mafia and their subsequent One Last Tour. The largest electronic tour in history, selling over 1 million tickets in one week. Director Christian Larson captures the band in a unique fly on the wall manner as they call it quits and seek closure by going on the tour they had always dreamed of. With breathtaking live moments, huge laughs and dark lows, the band start to unravel why they came to the decision to end the biggest achievement of their lives to date to save their friendship. The film maps out three of the biggest stars in a scene which has gripped youth the world over and the psychology of the band. A film not to be missed.','/1A8OijwqAvBdCFJnXN1U8p7cXOi.jpg','2014-03-12',90,'Released','The film maps out three of the biggest stars in a scene which has gripped youth the world over.','Leave the World Behind',250578,1.208,7.1,'CGBNJmxJPTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37624,_binary '\0','/jrrBTFdaacnvCRF6HhTjnR9UX0p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32887283',6,1799,'da','De lydløse','In 2008, a group of men from Denmark and across Europe pull off the biggest heist of all time on Danish soil. Kasper, a boxer with few chances left in life, is offered the opportunity to plan the robbery by its foreign initiators.','/7NLY1jNwtZX1yVzwVoBeAhaBE8i.jpg','2024-10-31',110,'Released','The largest heist in Danish history.','The Quiet Ones',1261050,3.0486,5.8,'_LYIHKNLJTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37625,_binary '\0','/ecz0o5V0GhmbjVSWzTJ1neEigQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32887285',7,2165,'te','క','Set in 1970s Abhinaya Vasudev, an orphaned and happy-go-lucky postman, treats the Krishnagiri village populace as his extended family. When several women missing and Vasudev’s loved one is nearly abducted, he is determined to find answers.','/4Gj7cWuKmWXu1CxwtrzclBlnlm8.jpg','2024-10-31',149,'Released',NULL,'KA',1353436,2.0893,5.909,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37626,_binary '\0','/c8mmkd2qteMN5Bt3rbMquuwji8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32887317',6.6,5316,'ml','ഡൊമിനിക് ആൻഡ് ലേഡീസ് പേഴ്സ്','Dominic, a disgraced ex-cop turned detective, takes on a seemingly simple case to locate a purse\'s owner, which unveils a dark web of missing persons, murder, a stalker and the mysterious dancer Nandhita.','/n0CpetCTJwUN2ujVedn4UC2lKAk.jpg','2025-01-23',151,'Released',NULL,'Dominic and the Ladies\' Purse',1303576,1.721,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37627,_binary '\0','/jF0cgfoBkmJyknP2nii2NdhChWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32888226',7.2,2123,'de','Gelbe Briefe','The marriage of Derya and Aziz is under pressure after losing their jobs because of state arbitrariness and moving to Istanbul to live with Aziz\'s parents. They and their 13-year-old daughter Ezgi have to redefine their way of life.','/8Sxp3QIdamyoAfgLsUaGCQ1Z1ID.jpg','2026-03-05',128,'Released',NULL,'Yellow Letters',1315657,5.5737,7.2,'N_pQLLsSOWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37628,_binary '\0','/dYOH6BTxKmf1LTnQPZR3XxRvLrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32889884',7.3,2302,'en','Freefall: A Reckoning for Boeing','Following the highly publicized death of Boeing whistleblower John Barnett, the investigation continues into the once-iconic aviation giant, uncovering startling new revelations and insider accounts in the wake of a deepening corporate crisis..','/oadqt3V5c8j5ZIbYkdfQLcWzI4C.jpg','2026-08-14',95,'Released',NULL,'Freefall: A Reckoning for Boeing',1688804,4.5199,7,'7ZDSYBkcH2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37629,_binary '\0','/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32890033',6.3,31984,'en','Minions & Monsters','This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.','/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg','2026-06-24',90,'Released','Hollywood has a monster problem.','Minions & Monsters',1315772,116.0834,7.563,'V-O-uBaHk3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37630,_binary '\0','/15Zqzo6jTVpMUy5krO3m3s3K1vr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289080',3.5,6577,'en','Asylum of Fear','A team of paranormal investigators go on one last job to a haunted mental institution where children have reportedly gone missing. While searching for evidence of what is haunting the abandoned building, they stumble upon clues that reveal what made the former head doctor snap and go on a killing spree through the halls decades earlier. Unfortunately, the more they uncover, the more they struggle to make it out of the asylum alive because something inside wants that mystery to stay dead and buried.','/mxXaogii3ZVZ5PswHynsrWLG1dP.jpg','2018-01-09',79,'Released',NULL,'Asylum of Fear',497327,1.4647,5.4,'8bueTpJCwR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37631,_binary '\0','/hQyuTd670x8q1751XJ4a2s9zT5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289126',7.1,2305,'fr','Les Héritiers','At Léon Blum High School in Créteil, France, a history teacher decides to have her weakest 10th grade class participate in a national history competition.','/dHGRwKIDyrMjudTp1BlBKxe4Gvq.jpg','2014-12-03',105,'Released','Based on a true story','Once in a Lifetime',303483,1.6975,7.4,'UozgwCTAi8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37632,_binary '\0','/2JRMdlpUTOZJXLklhd6nXuMYohi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289362',7,3369,'es','A escondidas','At the age of 14 the world around you changes at a dizzying speed. But what if actually it\'s you that changing? What if these changes take you away from what up until now, has been your world? Ibrahim and Rafa are going to suffer these changes for themselves, experiencing first love in a way they never could have imagined. And having to keep it Hidden away.','/ooi46QLuAvPnV9cfsX8m9xbC40X.jpg','2014-10-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Hidden Away',258755,2.1484,7.5,'_iPqbBIftGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37633,_binary '\0','/oqLKzqL3SIh3ltX1R9kFGjE7yrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289712',5.6,12682,'en','Jenny\'s Wedding','Jenny Farrell is getting married. But how will her straight-laced family react when they find out that the woman they thought was their daughter’s roommate is actually her fiancée? As the old-fashioned Farrells attempt to come to terms with the prospect of a surprise daughter-in-law, they face a difficult choice: either adapt with the times or risk being left behind.','/lAMXZ8BVCCfyfhCSsvQRLG6cwxK.jpg','2015-07-31',94,'Released','Family is worth fighting for.','Jenny\'s Wedding',342474,4.5102,5.653,'WIw0yX8gIs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37634,_binary '\0','/q9hnJ9SzwcF30seRtXEzLd5l1gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289724',6.2,27896,'en','Welcome to Marwen','When a devastating attack shatters Mark Hogancamp and wipes away all memories, no one expected recovery. Putting together pieces from his old and new life, Mark meticulously creates a wondrous town named Marwen where he can heal and be heroic. As he builds an astonishing art installation — a testament to the most powerful women he knows — through his fantasy world, he draws strength to triumph in the real one.','/dOULsxYQFsOR0cEBBB20xnjJkPD.jpg','2018-12-21',116,'Released','You can\'t put this hero in a box.','Welcome to Marwen',351044,5.1033,6.493,'W6dy7xQ8NeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37635,_binary '\0','/jdaZ4QUC3YajBIUrqwdxv5YasD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289728',6,34658,'en','Equals','A futuristic love story set in a world where emotions have been eradicated.','/vP1i0dddTbLL3pyddrSCPnJa8S7.jpg','2015-07-15',102,'Released','Find your equal.','Equals',301875,4.545,6.1,'_RTN3HnQV3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37636,_binary '\0','/nHKscpZcAPkh97OsJJjyE5yaVE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32897959',6.1,91788,'en','“Wuthering Heights”','Tragedy strikes when Heathcliff falls in love with Catherine Earnshaw, a woman from a wealthy family in 18th-century England.','/3YBce6dTh1D5oCMITXk2S5QhPt.jpg','2026-02-11',136,'Released','Come undone.','“Wuthering Heights”',1316092,22.9339,6.646,'3fLCdIYShEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37637,_binary '\0','/gynX5j4nmZDLBmnRj4ts3EHtLPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32898016',5.5,2050,'en','Wynonna Earp: Vengeance','Wynonna Earp is coming home to battle her greatest foe yet: a psychotic seductress hellbent on revenge against her... and everyone she loves.','/xobQ2MsXEoKcs3OdWNvY4vdFeVy.jpg','2024-09-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Wynonna Earp: Vengeance',1242765,1.1344,6.7,'lO5fvagocjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37638,_binary '\0','/l7todZasCiGGrixozdTUUlDwrVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289944',6.8,2422,'en','The Christmas Ornament','Newly widowed Kathy plans to skip out on decking the halls and trimming the tree this Christmas, trying to avoid anything that will bring back memories of her late husband. When Kathy meets handsome Christmas tree shop owner Tim, their undeniable chemistry—along with an ornament Tim gives her that symbolizes hope—helps Kathy open up to the joys of the season again.','/aNfEqYoL7q1Pi6C9aMiaWjSVEnB.jpg','2013-11-16',83,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Ornament',238018,1.5369,6,'Vgnnvs3NLUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37639,_binary '\0','/2pOd80PQSJ9cUbli7PDeX59q3vQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3289956',6.8,168885,'en','The Autopsy of Jane Doe','Father and son coroners receive a mysterious unidentified corpse with no apparent cause of death. As they attempt to examine the \"Jane Doe,\" they discover increasingly bizarre clues that hold the key to her terrifying secrets.','/6K0wjP8kPCiPYy9PtXBGuypyt5I.jpg','2016-12-21',86,'Released','Every body has a secret.','The Autopsy of Jane Doe',397243,11.4372,6.845,'BNxsaFCzqxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37640,_binary '\0','/tnZ7SjnixogxRziArZSmWnrEAAh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32903026',8.2,7724,'ko','정국: 아이 엠 스틸','Jung Kook of BTS ascended to global stardom with his debut solo album GOLDEN. Through exclusive, unseen interviews and behind-the-scenes footage, alongside electrifying concert performances, this film showcases Jung Kook’s eight-month journey, capturing his unwavering dedication and growth. Join Jung Kook as he shares his remarkable rise to fame and heartfelt moments with ARMY around the world.','/hGHRhOibO4GLJi50QDWW9L5SauZ.jpg','2024-09-18',93,'Released',NULL,'JUNG KOOK: I AM STILL',1315707,1.4912,8,'LWkh_hXeEeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37641,_binary '\0','/4XbMQhxk2LQPpE0pHp9kgpE42c3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3290322',4.3,1350,'en','The Runners','A man races against time to save his teenage sister from human traffickers who want to sell her to a Mexican cartel.','/zbWhMIFVDq2nBFtR89V6CKcn7te.jpg','2020-07-14',94,'Released','They took his sister. They will regret it.','The Runners',688809,2.1398,4.4,'LQYur1MZ4nM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37642,_binary '\0','/gdVOvkG10Axz7mYnucVbzT9uT8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32903867',5,2343,'en','Traumatika','Mikey\'s night terrors become reality when his mother begins showing signs of demonic possession. What he\'s about to experience will haunt him for the rest of his life and claim countless lives across generations.','/jnINnXC7KHAVodspt9xIepEE9f6.jpg','2025-11-13',88,'Released',NULL,'Traumatika',1319482,2.6135,5.382,'7coc_S8mEeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37643,_binary '\0','/ubP32udfUdmxqHZREyvl1bv3HmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3290440',6.1,1315,'de','Das Zimmermädchen Lynn','Lynn Zapatek, a chambermaid in a large hotel, has a deathly fear of human interaction yet she craves intimacy. A chance encounter prompts her to emerge from her cocoon.','/nYlYPlUWvNKUxdhW3hMPHRFTNSX.jpg','2015-05-25',89,'Released',NULL,'The Chambermaid Lynn',293069,2.0388,5.4,'jh2Dl9DBWds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37644,_binary '\0','/1xmImfPNsiOoO0QMGBgN5FDeMFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3290676',7.1,1298,'te','ఉయ్యాల జంపాల','Close relatives, Suri and Uma Devi grow up together living next door to each other. They are made for each other but Suri takes a while to figure that out.','/UFezRzBPX5ciROHLHUqmNDcJIc.jpg','2013-12-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Uyyala Jampala',247501,1.4098,6.143,'vtKxPLsFH-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37645,_binary '\0','/wPdmV7krDw0CBuNFbPVFrJP6146.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3290688',4.6,2068,'hi','रिवाल्वर रानी','Alka Singh, the leader of a political party, and her obsessive love for Rohan Mehra, a rising star of Bollywood.','/iEDCDioMy1A8i5iGU