ll secrets are innocent','While the Wolf\'s Away',388284,3.295,7.99,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37665,_binary '\0','/vJ9D5uaOcQfeHrgPJSNjlyif3L3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3296204',5.6,1647,'it','Un boss in salotto','Cristina lives a peaceful life until her older brother Ciro, who has to attend a trial, asks to spend house arrests at Cristina’s home.','/2bBb7H7LMycRYb3omVbzlEoxihR.jpg','2014-01-01',101,'Released',NULL,'A Boss in the Living Room',247218,1.509,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37666,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3296276',5.1,1307,'en','Die Gstettensaga: The Rise of Echsenfriedl','A long time ago, the so-called \"Google Wars\" engulfed the whole world in a deadly chain reaction. Civilization came to a grinding halt. But there is still hope. This is the story of a new beginning...','/fJKz7msD1p7D00OmtSELytGjTHp.jpg','2014-03-10',72,'Released',NULL,'Die Gstettensaga: The Rise of Echsenfriedl',283087,1.0252,5.7,'BH_n8KcaSWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37667,_binary '\0','/gPkPbBewBNKHif7tHW82qHMG5Ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32965688',7.6,7426,'pa','ਸ਼ੌਂਕੀ ਸਰਦਾਰ','A mentor returns from prison to find his former proteges transformed. Their reunion stirs up complex bonds of loyalty and hidden tensions as they face their shared past and present challenges.','/Bx2FNrdYMRSgzihsC0VcG4omqw.jpg','2025-05-15',141,'Released',NULL,'Shaunki Sardar',1478644,0.8818,0,'Hkh7lLfJfao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37668,_binary '\0','/eAgKvahrg6EY521kEA11GwGvjY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3296658',7.2,15821,'is','Hrútar','In a secluded valley in Iceland, Gummi and Kiddi live side by side, tending to their sheep. Their ancestral sheep-stock is considered one of the country’s best and the two brothers are repeatedly awarded for their prized rams who carry an ancient lineage. Although they share the land and a way of life, Gummi and Kiddi have not spoken to each other in four decades. When a lethal disease suddenly infects Kiddi’s sheep, the entire valley comes under threat. The authorities decide to cull all the animals in the area to contain the outbreak. But Gummi and Kiddi don’t give up so easily – and each brother tries to stave off the disaster in his own fashion: Kiddi by using his rifle and Gummi by using his wits.','/pk75njhxcxTJAl0FJ1V2ROGIEy1.jpg','2015-05-28',93,'Released','This winter get sheepish.','Rams',336222,2.6234,7,'CNhvKi2fYbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37669,_binary '\0','/dVAScapt0EECC9jpvWHFBe2gybs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3296908',6.4,20113,'en','The Man with the Iron Heart','With the Third Reich at its peak in 1942, the Czech resistance in London plans the most ambitious military operation of WWII – Anthropoid. Two young recruits are sent to Prague to assassinate the most ruthless Nazi leader – Reinhard Heydrich, head of the Reich Security Main Office, the Gestapo and the architect of the Final Solution.','/ZVQfCY2DgCjrm8w2saXvT8Ao3B.jpg','2017-05-25',120,'Released','The true story of how the architect of the Holocaust was assassinated','The Man with the Iron Heart',339259,6.3569,6.5,'1Lk7-xcJxj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37670,_binary '\0','/7ghhzg8fFDVPJoB8ImahndG0wwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3297330',6.4,26035,'en','Good Kill','In the shadowy world of drone warfare, combat unfolds like a video game–only with real lives at stake. After six tours of duty, Air Force pilot Tom Egan now fights the Taliban from an air-conditioned bunker in the Nevada desert. But as he yearns to get back in the cockpit of a real plane and becomes increasingly troubled by the collateral damage he causes each time he pushes a button, Egan’s nerves—and his relationship with his wife—begin to unravel.','/oO9nK1bqssxRdNHFSFGiucffiA8.jpg','2015-04-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Good Kill',253626,4.4348,6,'c7ADAgsmI2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37671,_binary '\0','/nnHnrPM0z9PNpavva6U5jhctNsE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3297382',4.2,1916,'en','The Crash','In the not so distant future, a team of white collar criminals are enlisted by the Federal government to thwart a cyber-attack that threatens to bankrupt the United States of America.','/xEu4OsF4Ol0kkB94AMRyEHfvTVf.jpg','2017-01-13',84,'Released','It takes a criminal to catch a criminal','The Crash',362202,2.3543,4.5,'8Pqk7IYiGPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37672,_binary '\0','/r9XsWvSqLssTvlSKnUASfZ14Sc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3297792',4,2339,'en','Survivor','During their search for a habitable planet the last living humans crash-land on a barren world, inhabited by bloodthirsty aliens and mysterious post-apocalyptic warriors.','/aeWQXWeAmKNmzYaf42JMwznbjf0.jpg','2014-07-22',93,'Released','Alone. Stranded. Deadly','Survivor',281778,1.2397,4.3,'A0t2xJS-Z7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37673,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32982630',8.3,3111,'kn','My Hero','A white American and a Dalit boy guide in Maheshwar bond deeply. Learning of the boy\'s outcasting for touching an idol, the American helps end discrimination in the boy\'s village and reunites him with family.','/2LtJmxn5TlNIcCUuNNHjeGWeUu4.jpg','2024-08-30',141,'Released',NULL,'My Hero',1501726,1.4927,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37674,_binary '\0','/bxwQ7q9DzD8XbLsFpLM9VaWY1Ub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32982707',4.5,1423,'en','Russians at War','Anastasia Trofimova, a Russian-Canadian filmmaker, gains unprecedented access to follow a Russian Army battalion in Ukraine. Without any official clearance or permits, she earns the trust of foot soldiers and embeds herself over the span of a year with one battalion as it makes its way across Eastern Ukraine. What she discovers is far from the propaganda and labels pushed by the East or West: an army in disarray, soldiers disillusioned and often struggling to understand what they are fighting for.','/3g2S1oUQfQnqfDoKswPYfZt3wjS.jpg','2024-09-05',134,'Released',NULL,'Russians at War',1320382,1.0646,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37675,_binary '\0','/sb8Aq1RohASXyjT0uEOUUZJi5oI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32985279',6.4,20855,'en','Steve','Over one intense day, the devoted head teacher of a last-chance reform school strives to keep his students in line while facing pressures of his own.','/wmLoMyofbseLfxiGgk1Iz5H97c3.jpg','2025-09-19',92,'Released','A quiet storm of emotion.','Steve',1242404,3.8176,6.385,'5L8intrDcM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37676,_binary '\0','/n4JROtkeVBDDjOLW456ehXrIOO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3298600',6,1679,'fi','Kätilö','Helena has worked as a kind of midwife on the eve of the Lapland War. She wants to leave everything behind, and a suitable opportunity arises when she falls in love with a German-Finnish officer Johannes, who is leaving to German-led Titovka prison camp in the Soviet Union. Helena enlists into the camp as a nurse, where she experiences the brutality of war.','/jrc7lROhmzAHttKd4I9EkmAQSBr.jpg','2015-09-04',119,'Released','A midwife\'s forbidden love story... separated by war, joined by love at first sight.','The Midwife',350555,1.4947,5.8,'UossBRe7_eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37677,_binary '\0','/iVhkaPUv0bFEjSxjxAPuxoMLQtz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt32986431',5.3,2181,'en','Queens of the Dead','When a zombie apocalypse breaks out in Brooklyn on the night of a giant warehouse party, an eclectic group of drag queens, club kids, & frenemies must put aside their drama and use their unique skills to fight against the brain-thirsty, scrolling undead.','/mY8JqSMBSiXZh9EbGqUjpF6aacu.jpg','2025-10-24',101,'Released','They\'re dead...and they\'re eating.','Queens of the Dead',1318435,3.7005,5.8,'A_gUjCvASN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.00