 14 explores the fascinating world of plus-size models fighting to reshape the fashion industry and the beauty standards of society.','/8ZM6pRlGXxijz7qK2XDnP4ZH9LW.jpg','2018-09-22',108,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect 14',334933,0.8068,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37694,_binary '\0','/2hthvh4L1pHYZ5alepSqIAFYrRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33022710',8.4,5701,'en','Ocean with David Attenborough','David Attenborough takes viewers on a breathtaking journey showing there is nowhere more vital for our survival, more full of life, wonder, or surprise, than the ocean. Through spectacular sequences featuring coral reefs, kelp forests and the open ocean, Attenborough shares why a healthy ocean keeps the entire planet stable and flourishing.','/oAKzcqUCP3EK7rgAx9Jj8Futv8O.jpg','2025-05-08',85,'Released','If we save the sea, we save our world.','Ocean with David Attenborough',1448497,7.881,8.068,'cIZAdCtKT_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37695,_binary '\0','/rFLxECXOOvC4BmxdCdf4WCq4AyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33022813',7.4,2768,'ko','대도시의 사랑법','When a carefree woman learns that her closeted friend is gay, the two form an inseparable bond and find comfort in each other\'s company.','/oBsnMMFoELfqQ445Uvr2oWxm6mT.jpg','2024-10-01',118,'Released','Love without regrets, live life to the fullest.','Love in the Big City',1154154,3.7934,8,'mqYjCJwmnfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37696,_binary '\0','/f7yKgzjdHqbeH3jSSMAMXak9AgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3302654',6.7,2243,'en','Jane Wants a Boyfriend','A young woman with Asperger\'s tries to find her first boyfriend with a little help from her older sister.','/zhuIo1ajtzo6mK2EWBA5E6rWKVP.jpg','2015-11-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Jane Wants a Boyfriend',355890,1.7005,6,'7edGA343DGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37697,_binary '\0','/yDI3qXoKMGUGGz0E2zrkHw4PRt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3302706',6.7,8061,'en','Boychoir','A troubled and angry 11-year-old orphan from a small Texas town, ends up at a Boy Choir school after the death of his single mother. Completely out of his element, he finds himself in a battle of wills with a demanding Choir Master who recognises a unique talent in this young boy as he pushes him to discover his creative heart and soul in music.','/jh2xStYNXhSK5JYFUApMEqgn0yT.jpg','2015-03-27',103,'Released','Extraordinary talent needs extraordinary inspiration','Boychoir',286519,2.8353,6.8,'lMWl6-mlDD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37698,_binary '\0','/7KYqBgUtQGInqHVEMRnlyneuCpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3302820',8.1,27504,'en','Cowspiracy: The Sustainability Secret','Follow the shocking, yet humorous, journey of an aspiring environmentalist, as he daringly seeks to find the real solution to the most pressing environmental issues and true path to sustainability.','/h0Jz1VmY2qIFAQbkojaBNubhcJA.jpg','2014-07-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Cowspiracy: The Sustainability Secret',282297,2.4408,7.6,'nV04zyfLyN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37699,_binary '\0','/d5C5Wsx4fnMRA0tj9BK1kTPcgQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33028778',5.8,37037,'en','Primate','College student Lucy and her friends spend their vacation at her family\'s home in Hawaii, which includes her pet chimpanzee, Ben. However, when Ben contracts rabies after being bitten by a rabid animal, the group must fight for their lives in order to avoid the now-violent chimp.','/rKleYiEj4pFqxedTRWfujLooi84.jpg','2026-01-01',89,'Released','Something\'s wrong with Ben.','Primate',1315303,16.3187,6.47,'wo87F-va410','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37700,_binary '\0','/1sU4w7DLJbcKdYjPrLB9jeiIkfz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33028976',3.3,1769,'zh','731','Based on true events set during WWII in Northeast China, an ordinary man is thrust into a turbulent fate against the backdrop of the inhumane bacterial experiments conducted by the Japanese Imperial Army\'s notorious Unit 731.','/fh5X8CgTUc7ZbDVDx01OdKmFHiK.jpg','2025-09-18',125,'Released','Never forget.','731',1321624,2.5255,5.1,'CYc0uVAcotA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37701,_binary '\0','/mXRzeWQXDdfPuT9KckNjSdiWo6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029024',6.5,7168,'ta','இட்லி கடை','A simple man\'s search for success leads him to rediscover his roots.','/9ViF6UTWMh14gx77RvFALe5R6AL.jpg','2025-10-01',147,'Released',NULL,'Idli Kadai',1323880,3.57,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37702,_binary '\0','/30pNvXUYKA0nLBStE7QcR6cuVJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029123',9.1,3229,'ta','Hi :)','Two individuals initially exchange a simple \"Hi,\" but through a series of chance encounters, shared experiences, and deep conversations, they gradually develop a strong connection and eventually fall in love.','/9Vgmpa0tcCzkbXf9AY0zXrai1oi.jpg','2026-08-28',143,'Released',NULL,'Hi :)',1314279,17.7698,4.8,'LVmH0rgWZb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37703,_binary '\0','/qGPJ9AvOUpbpZjM6R7yqBDs4gsk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029380',6.3,1888,'fr','Marsupilami','David is tasked to deliver a mysterious package from South America, only to find out he is carrying a baby Marsupilami!','/kMhVs1XqmzXlD0mDQ4rTJh4Kvf1.jpg','2026-02-04',99,'Released','Hairy mess incoming!','Marsupilami',1145899,7.0019,6.4,'pXGuY9qcSe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37704,_binary '\0','/8c1NJLBziLfj9kQuXGpyAEGncMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029543',7.1,2594,'el','Υπάρχω','The touching story of a child from a Pontic refugee family who managed to survive and thrive against all odds, thanks to his immense talent and resilience in the face of social and personal challenges. Music, love, family, friends, fishing, creativity, people of the night, hardcore fans, and intense conflicts come together to create the mosaic of his life. This film is a tribute to legendary singer, Stelios Kazantzidis, whose voice touched the hearts of all Greeks around the world. A film for those who loved him and those who wish to discover him.','/l3BiYNrTGTviqbxMkkv2rwpxLRB.jpg','2024-12-19',132,'Released','I will always exist in the songs you hear.','Stelios',1329088,1.6576,7.5,'_wrr_rs9EZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37705,_binary '\0','/aBCV28DK9FKykwg4MHaLo5uCdG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3302962',5.6,4404,'hi','शादी के साइड इफेक्ट्स','An easy-going man ensures that the spark in his marriage stays strong by always apologizing and opting for the path of least conflict in his relationship. When his wife becomes pregnant and wishes to have the baby, he does not offer resistance, but is also not ready to be a father. How will their relationship evolve?','/mSIwlMSpxTIcTKqcrtG4e2VuBPe.jpg','2014-02-28',145,'Released',NULL,'Shaadi Ke Side Effects',254418,1.2251,5.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37706,_binary '\0','/vaJFSMNHdwBc8xA8R26MOOuHREG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029866',6,2197,'ja','Broken Rage','A seemingly unremarkable man called “Mouse” is caught by the police. In exchange for his freedom, he goes undercover, infiltrates a drug ring, and arranges a fake deal, but an unexpected turn of events occurs.','/zz5w71AcWoDuKbLfN89noaGUKKs.jpg','2024-09-06',66,'Released',NULL,'Broken Rage',1121914,1.8606,6.6,'PAAwtNhiMPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37707,_binary '\0','/9n78URb0Q3U8OjXQF98UNaw6MIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33029955',7.2,1806,'en','One to One: John & Yoko','An exploration of the seminal and transformative 18 months that one of music’s most famous couples — John Lennon and Yoko Ono — spent living in Greenwich Village, New York City, in the early 1970s.','/9SncSYtmHNJv2hwFkkHw6k8vNvX.jpg','2025-04-11',104,'Released','A war of love and transformation.','One to One: John & Yoko',1320392,2.6524,7.105,'oxagfYjeMV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37708,_binary '\0','/zMIAkebGFDHvGep2vYvDM27qhxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33030125',7.9,2101,'ar','البحث عن منفذ لخروج السيد رامبو','The story follows Hassan and his dog, Rambo, as they embark on a quest to save Rambo from Hassan\'s vengeful landlord, whom the dog attacked. Through his challenging journey across Cairo to find a safe haven for Rambo, Hassan confronts his deepest fears and rediscovers himself.','/7XPZOfZcuaBawXON9kHDwrrCeJR.jpg','2025-01-01',105,'Released','Rambo, don’t worry','Seeking Haven for Mr. Rambo',1170841,1.2082,7.4,'XjAYJkuYH4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37709,_binary '\0','/yZ3HXKFIK4dZ490oza0swR0tgtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33030347',6.2,1545,'tr','Hemme’nin Öldüğü Günlerden Biri','Eyüp works relentlessly under the blazing sun during a tomato harvest in southeastern Turkey, driven by the urgent need to settle an impending debt. After a clash with his supervisor, he roams the city in search of a radical solution.','/t7QjuzZAVJXnBBOPAHFZVkSr16p.jpg','2024-12-13',83,'Released',NULL,'One of Those Days When Hemme Dies',1320279,1.6762,5.8,'vSgYQxjydP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37710,_binary '\0','/mPjBP9cvdSnSrRLXs2sLBWeq8u5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33030375',8,6787,'ro','Anul Nou care n-a fost','The New Year That Never Came is a tragicomedy whose action takes place in a single day, before the revolution of 1989, in which the characters search for normality, safety, love, freedom and meaning in an absurd world.','/AxoszYlyv6qkFzRxLmlsc3pcs7.jpg','2024-09-27',138,'Released','The most unusual day.','The New Year That Never Came',1320276,1.7025,7.397,'5Q2CjH__Af8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37711,_binary '\0','/7UABiSiMvOKXU6kxNrStIUo2IVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33030403',7.2,2368,'fr','L\'Attachement','A young single father trying to find the strength to love. A feminist librarian, single by conviction, who’s decided that she won’t be a mother. A six-year-old child trying to find a place in a new family structure. By revealing their aspirations, their fears, their choices, Carine Tardieu depicts different ways in which humans create families.','/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg','2025-02-19',106,'Released',NULL,'The Ties That Bind Us',1096642,3.6363,7.153,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37712,_binary '\0','/vohINT54Cvez6xu2LyGTHYjUe28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33034103',6.6,17980,'en','Am I Racist?','Matt Walsh goes deep undercover in the world of diversity, equity, and inclusion. Prepare to be shocked by how far race hustlers will go and how much further Matt Walsh will go to expose the grift, uncovering absurdities that will leave you laughing.','/a0nfgpeRMORStotrouLoOBr00Pc.jpg','2024-09-13',101,'Released','It\'s not just a documentary. It\'s a social experiment.','Am I Racist?',1320637,1.9762,6.2,'c7PA_kshZh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37713,_binary '\0','/xACr1uSjnqRzw8COb7UUmPca1ZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3303446',6.5,2044,'ja','名探偵コナン・絶海の探偵','It’s a high-stakes mystery on the high seas! Enjoying a free prize cruise on a military ship, Conan and his friends find their relaxation interrupted by the threat of possible explosives on board! It’s a race against time to find the culprit and save the ship — and potentially the whole country!','/4QtpfeGuxWbfLMgBiP3u3MVws9M.jpg','2013-04-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Private Eye in the Distant Sea',228805,4.3351,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37714,_binary '\0','/cAwBPZDaDjllk1Geicgj21cDZTS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33034505',5.5,1837,'ta','பேச்சி','Five young trekkers and their tour guide embark on a weekend adventure in the Kollimalai hills. Despite warnings, they venture into a restricted area, unknowingly entering the domain of a malevolent spirit, which is hell bent on wreaking havoc in their lives. Did they survive the relentless onslaught and harrowing encounter with the supernatural force in the haunted woods?','/6Pla6xHgD0kep7S9z6KfXzi6B4l.jpg','2024-08-02',110,'Released','Fear has a New Name','Pechi',1321821,1.6894,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37715,_binary '\0','/xh6e4z9vawuXUt6G2MHkANQervv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3303728',6.8,4263,'ko','해무','A fishing-boat crew takes on a dangerous commission to smuggle a group of illegal immigrants from China to Korea.','/gnqv8hSNKfNZXKsJXMxJocDVGK7.jpg','2014-08-13',111,'Released',NULL,'Sea Fog',272691,3.0793,6.861,'PCdJz4yTg7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37716,_binary '\0','/aQzXICKh3oaJanWSsSRJ2epB9Z5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3303730',6.3,3249,'ko','인간중독','A secret, passionate affair happens in the summer of 1969 between Colonel Jin Pyeong, trapped in a loveless marriage with Soo Jin, and Jong Ga Heun, the Chinese-Korean wife of Captain Kyung Woo Jin.','/XdVqGnvRqCQXalcJPDGIeDn7Kj.jpg','2014-05-14',132,'Released','If I cannot see you, I can\'t even breathe…','Obsessed',269955,20.4891,6.7,'40NSEn733iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37717,_binary '\0','/lfrtpFaAFlS5ELUGa9iSpah6aNz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33037773',5.6,1940,'ml','സുമതി വളവ്','A haunted curve in 1990s Kerala, named after Sumathis tragic death, draws various people into supernatural encounters. As they experience strange events, the mystery of Sumathi and the roads dark history begins to unfold.','/3xIDlnwjMf7kCOpFq8GMmW8on95.jpg','2025-08-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Sumathi Valavu',1296338,2.3367,5.923,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37718,_binary '\0','/i8QHgJKnsd8csNBo8fH9wYW2Y9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33039440',6.1,15491,'en','The Wrong Paris','Dawn thinks she\'s joining a dating show in Paris, France, only to land in Paris, Texas. She has an exit plan — until sparks fly with the cowboy bachelor.','/A0KRoR842OgNByCfw9iFHbWoeR9.jpg','2025-09-11',107,'Released','Romance gets a Texas-sized reality check.','The Wrong Paris',1321439,8.0622,6.7,'SgKpEeduwh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37719,_binary '\0','/i0xXEW49jmEKksCsS18r8H6qfGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33039603',6.7,1875,'en','The Christmas Charade','A cautious librarian raised by home security experts finds herself in a real-life adventure when a blind date mix-up leads her into an undercover FBI operation. Forced to pose as the girlfriend of Special Agent Josh, she helps him track down an art thief targeting the Saint Nicholas Ruby at a Christmas Eve charity ball.','/1jgFIqG7haKpxXnckzTw9pzlG4v.jpg','2024-10-26',84,'Released','\'Twas the heist before Christmas','The Christmas Charade',1359867,1.4458,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37720,_binary '\0','/rFvtrvCikfM3VYxATu8trn7bPdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33040269',6.5,2209,'en','Ghuspaithiya','Ghuspaithiya goes deep into the complexities of modern-day digital threats and its impact on our personal and professional lives. It also exposes the influence of social media and the challenges it poses to trust and privacy.','/njUkW5MEWOBogouci5rfmF8TSDY.jpg','2024-08-09',134,'Released',NULL,'Ghuspaithiya',1327915,0.4586,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37721,_binary '\0','/2laIwMw0jIbxSFhbArclr9b1Pjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33041296',6.9,1442,'de','Wunderschöner','The main thing is sexy - no matter whether thin, fat, what skin color, young, old, we can all be sexy in different ways. Almost every woman grows up having to work on herself in order to remain desirable. Why? What if we stopped pushing ourselves into a sexy pose with all our might? What if we no longer fought for the right to be sexy, but were truly free? What if we stopped investing all our time and energy in being heard and the world started to hear us? A modern movie about modern women and men - who might be able to find a common language.','/9oTpuoJvqbsuf14GGSRdUn9bNP8.jpg','2025-02-13',132,'Released',NULL,'More Beautiful',1219555,2.4532,7.602,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37722,_binary '\0','/pUyj26hDObngIY9W2lSCeh7FLtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33044935',5.4,1306,'pa','ਸੈਕਟਰ 17','Pargat, son of Gurdit Singh, seeks vengeance against Tundilaat, who murdered his father and stole their ancestral land. During the 1947 partition, Gurdit was granted land in Chandigarh for his loyalty, but Tundilaat killed him to seize the valuable property. Fueled by revenge, Pargat grows up determined to destroy Tundilaat\'s empire in Uttar Pradesh. With the help of Rani, his love interest, and Balviro Chachi, her aunt, Pargat fights to dismantle the criminal empire. In a final confrontation, he kills Tundilaat, avenging his father and reclaiming his family\'s honour.','/tlJlod9Rps5ZcIXy5knfnreJUde.jpg','2024-11-15',146,'Released',NULL,'Sector 17',1379273,0.6238,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37723,_binary '\0','/c5d4ABtn7GJOzWIQ3bPIMIighfi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33046086',4.8,2141,'en','The House on Laura Anne Dr.','A young couple move to Florida for a fresh start only to realize their new home has something sinister lurking.','/3406OH7K3biq0fjwkAnAkEHb9id.jpg','2024-08-14',74,'Released',NULL,'The House on Laura Anne Dr.',1358329,0.6383,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37724,_binary '\0','/cz4vLJrmaV1zJlRYbxqtvLzeLWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33046197',6.4,54659,'en','The Wrecking Crew','Estranged half-brothers Jonny and James reunite after their father\'s mysterious death. As they search for the truth, buried secrets reveal a conspiracy threatening to tear their family apart.','/gbVwHl4YPSq6BcC92TQpe7qUTh6.jpg','2026-01-28',125,'Released','They fight like brothers. They wreck like legends.','The Wrecking Crew',1168190,34.4046,7.093,'v8R0xDczERo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37725,_binary '\0','/p6zsgnwEymmJO9YQcWOk5RjZjrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33050528',6.4,1591,'ja','劇場版プロジェクトセカイ 壊れたセカイと歌えないミク','Ichika is a high school musician who can enter a mysterious place called “SEKAI,” where she and her friends express their innermost emotions through music alongside Hatsune Miku. One day after giving a live performance, Ichika meets a new Miku that she has never seen before. No matter how hard this new Miku tries to sing, she struggles connecting with the hearts of her listeners. Miku must rely on the help of others to find a way to sing again.','/uiQ6wj8TPYHueuIJRsNlPruzogT.jpg','2025-01-17',105,'Released','My voice cannot reach anyone.','COLORFUL STAGE! The Movie: A Miku Who Can\'t Sing',1322752,5.4408,8.2,'3bD1dfiRMu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37726,_binary '\0','/7v5OAruBWfppcGtBbjbZoz1dXKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3305308',5.8,9715,'en','Trespass Against Us','Three generations of the rowdy Cutler family live as outlaws in some of Britain\'s richest countryside – hunting hares, ram-raiding stately homes, and taunting the police. Struggling to retain a way of life fast becoming extinct, Chad Cutler ends up caught between his father\'s archaic principles and trying to do right by his kids, whilst the full force of the law is finally catching up with him.','/qrzFIhudK8sjigTFVlCpYJXwjOt.jpg','2016-10-14',99,'Released','Blood is a brutal bond.','Trespass Against Us',256569,3.7397,5.793,'AJPNvcvKaZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37727,_binary '\0','/cbPKS384zgh0nmyWzoERFjdU3Ry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3305316',6.8,7492,'da','En chance til','Detectives and best friends Andreas and Simon lead vastly different lives; Andreas has settled down with his beautiful wife and son; while Simon, recently divorced, spends most of his waking hours getting drunk at the local strip club. But all that changes when the two of them are called out to a domestic dispute between a junkie couple, caught in a vicious cycle of violence and drugs. It all looks very routine – until Andreas finds the couple\'s infant son, crying in a closet. The usually collected policeman finds himself confronted with his own powerlessness and is shaken to his core. As Andreas slowly loses his grip on justice, it suddenly becomes up to the unruly Simon to restore the balance between right and wrong.','/89jXZYnP7RB6xTHhZCMUxk14HaZ.jpg','2015-01-15',103,'Released','How far would you go?','A Second Chance',254200,3.2931,6.611,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37728,_binary '\0','/63YOeswE6SlcJRnAqeqd4Hh5cbR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33053428',6.3,1495,'ar','X مراتي','The events of the film take place in a social and comedic context, where the psychiatrist Youssef is responsible for issuing a psychological report on the dangerous criminal Taha until he is released from prison, and he discovers that he is the ex-husband of his wife Sahar and the father of her son.','/aHMqJAcMlS1TAD6fW3Orv7Oj6s4.jpg','2024-07-24',115,'Released','Do you think he is married or not?','My Wife\'s Ex',1276086,1.6537,5.727,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37729,_binary '\0','/idRDmfGxrLD0SNBq5I2J6HC0dt5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33053440',6,14029,'en','Champagne Problems','A driven American exec heads to Paris determined to acquire a champagne brand by Christmas — and accidentally falls for the heir to the bubbly empire.','/a66w2eVNFHMgevJlw0d6f4TTrrD.jpg','2025-11-18',99,'Released','Christmas in France is always a good idea.','Champagne Problems',1323475,4.2748,6.1,'eba-EoMPBX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37730,_binary '\0','/A55iusDw8LmdOqtKZztgvsUM20s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33054635',5.5,6179,'te','సంతాన ప్రాప్తిరస్తు','A journey of facing life’s twists & tests with laughter and love!','/o35sT4PsRIQthzcNwgRV5uCJVIW.jpg','2025-11-14',139,'Released',NULL,'Santhana Prapthirasthu',1417854,1.1757,5.5,'C_7gZZTk4uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37