hi 2',1536580,1.2668,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37739,_binary '\0','/qfTGzbtqTBhz1krD0Zh5bCg5xlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3306776',5.7,1958,'ja','ベヨネッタ ブラッディフェイト','Bayonetta is an ancient witch who awakens from a five hundred-year slumber with no memory of her life. Armed with a gun in each limb, she embarks on a journey to rediscover her past, defeating all bloodthirsty angels that stand in her way.','/dfg7dqm0YX16D6QYDKDdh3Qi930.jpg','2013-11-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Bayonetta: Bloody Fate',242546,3.8269,6.937,'Ksw0Hsf2wwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37740,_binary '\0','/jg1OaJrj2sLERgVBfLjpBN0ml8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3306858',6.3,1403,'de','Als wir träumten','Andreas Dresen\'s adaptation of Clemens Meyer\'s novel about a group of East German friends right after the fall of the Wall.','/t5fiqFaoqTh4fS86Rgw7ieTBWk3.jpg','2015-02-10',117,'Released',NULL,'As We Were Dreaming',311301,1.3655,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37741,_binary '\0','/E812GNXYQqjJwN0cVPY3icHpaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33070884',6.2,2464,'en','The Brink of War','President Ronald Reagan races against time to salvage a deal with Soviet leader Mikhail Gorbachev that could dismantle nuclear arsenals—or ignite disaster. With pressure mounting on all sides, every word spoken brings the world closer to peace... or destruction.','/vCIQeQ2ynVqEjIvtbOXGnKtcgAX.jpg','2026-08-13',117,'Released','Not all battles are fought with bullets.','The Brink of War',192139,8.4685,7.2,'a-T0TlMN-RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37742,_binary '\0','/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33071426',7.1,127136,'en','The Drama','A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.','/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg','2026-04-01',105,'Released','Witness the wedding of the year.','The Drama',1325734,31.4433,6.895,'0ZDzsH3XG