es against natural disasters, giant snakes and violent criminals.','/hBxN6dwrANN1ic3a4G9x6JZcR3C.jpg','2025-12-24',100,'Released','A comedy so big it\'ll leave you breathless.','Anaconda',1234731,18.3719,5.8,'LFLyvzIZjK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37813,_binary '\0','/iTaZz25sfuJUN11kI0yNkcCHzwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3324494',6.4,3514,'fr','La prochaine fois je viserai le cœur','Between 1978 and 1979, the inhabitants of the Oise are in fear of a maniac who kills several hitchhikers and escape the police. He was then dubbed \"the killer of the Oise\" is actually a shy young policeman who will investigate his own murder, only to lose control of the situation.','/dmmMRTzEBukaVpBSoda0FjMX6mk.jpg','2014-11-12',111,'Released',NULL,'Next Time I\'ll Aim for the Heart',298459,2.1794,5.9,'8_fYnFVmeUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37814,_binary '\0','/uNA0OVk09Hbwflye3eBoOiGIKGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33245761',8,7432,'ml','വാഴ II','Four friends – Hashir, Alan, Ajin and Vinayak – are considered losers and troublemakers by parents, family and the school management. They face immense social pressure as they reach adulthood, embarking them on an emotional journey of self discovery and acceptance, where they finally learn to take up their responsibilities and find success.','/1yLZ7kExd0UGGbaZW4LxmYD4OIf.jpg','2026-04-02',162,'Released','Biopic of a Billion Bros.','Vaazha II',1336770,4.2165,7.609,'PYI_dy23AuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37815,_binary '\0','/yhFjGuEQupx7diVr2gvWnsNflRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33245905',6.2,3926,'hi','कहां शुरू कहां ख़तम','Meera is about to get married against her wishes and she decides to escape on the wedding day. On the run now, she bumps into a serial wedding crasher, who reluctantly decides to help her and the two develop an unlikely bond. Meanwhile, Meera’s family come to look for her and the chaos ensues when the circumstances make it seem like she has run away with him.','/mTBKtZVncz926NjPQvPoD2qsMgQ.jpg','2024-09-20',104,'Released',NULL,'Kahan Shuru Kahan Khatam',1341448,2.5155,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37816,_binary '\0','/zv7SNpV4iWrTF2FTwfWsqJuk5mR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33245951',6.9,3668,'hi','Interrogation','When a retired judge is found dead in his house, the cops find 4 suspects who visited him on the day of the murder. Soon, each confess to their reasons for hating the man. Who is the real killer?','/gO6sVcutuZNryfuOcQ1pn4kJw3u.jpg','2025-05-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Interrogation',1340486,1.217,4,'pptVmqU63FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37817,_binary '\0','/AbaRJXNmyLjG4tY48k2fhNNmuW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33247023',6.4,18122,'en','Splitsville','After Ashley asks for a divorce, good-natured Carey runs to his friends, Julie and Paul, for support. He’s shocked to discover that the secret to their happiness is an open marriage, that is until Carey crosses the line and throws all of their relationships into chaos.','/cX6MVLl99pMDUmM3XKPFN4UKB8j.jpg','2025-08-21',105,'Released','An unromantic comedy.','Splitsville',1337562,5.9238,6.3,'VrdSQSLD63Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37818,_binary '\0','/a7VEgrESjAnoAUgonPEDXkzol2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33249097',5.4,2023,'en','Affection','Afflicted by a mysterious condition that resets her memory, Ellie becomes trapped in a cyclical nightmare with a man who claims to be her husband. She soon must uncover the horrifying truth of her existence—before she forgets it all again.','/3b3wC8JFjURlMsFj9gqbv0SyTJs.jpg','2026-05-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Affection',1339210,4.3083,5.7,'64AZfPVYs2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37819,_binary '\0','/nAmWiXywgdDrReqtuiBlWoYvyp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33254177',8.8,3105,'te','అనగనగా','A school teacher uses innovative storytelling methods to help struggling students, overcoming various challenges to achieve his goal.','/ep3Bhk34epfWY1LrRfyqZli07Cl.jpg','2025-05-15',137,'Released','The Story','Anaganaga',1481230,0.7469,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37820,_binary '\0','/OO75q1cTWWXDmy52bB79yzpxBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33255286',5.8,3370,'fr','Chien 51','In the near future, Paris is divided into three zones that separate social classes, and no one can escape ALMA, a predictive AI that has revolutionized law enforcement. When ALMA’s creator is assassinated, Salia, a top agent, and Zem, a jaded cop, are forced to work together to solve a murder that may expose the dark secrets of the system they serve.','/olMvhbCRuhTbf6EMKxKGHi2on3L.jpg','2025-10-15',100,'Released','In a city divided, they fight for the truth.','Dog 51',1266798,5.2233,6.146,'nBizRrKtVc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37821,_binary '\0','/9kPh5C1yNyNuzjhTjfQc05irpI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33256586',6,4124,'en','Chiquita','On a fateful night amidst the rugged Texan landscape, Charles(60s), a biker recovering from a painful divorce, crashes into a valley and there he encounters a mysterious little girl. What unfolds that night, sets Charles on an unexpected and transformative journey of self discovery. What could be such a powerful experience that changes Charles\'s perspective on life for good? Dive into the enigmatic tale of this life-altering encounter.','/1Jqsf2HN01kyVT1m1BIcyJrFadM.jpg','2025-09-08',47,'Released',NULL,'Chiquita',1468660,1.0648,4.8,'5lDQ84k95_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37822,_binary '\0','/vPHKMsF14w0HOPv5FDSSuiMGjG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3326138',4.6,1960,'en','The Last Deal','A blackmarket cannabis dealer gets squeezed out of the business when marijuana becomes legal, and is forced to make one last deal with the people he should trust the least.','/pAjw1FsPVGxmZoEFkuGTv4WRrgn.jpg','2023-02-03',91,'Released','Fortune favors the bold.','The Last Deal',1042163,2.0375,5.3,'K9XAVk7OJsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37823,_binary '\0','/87Droa1ejQIyFdK4ZHyDZM4HiKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3326366',6.7,3287,'en','Whitey: United States of America v. James J. Bulger','A documentary that captures the sensational trial of infamous gangster James \'Whitey\' Bulger, using the legal proceedings as a springboard to explore allegations of corruption within the highest levels of law enforcement. Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Joe Berlinger examines Bulger\'s relationship with the FBI and Department of Justice that allowed him to reign over a criminal empire in Boston for decades.','/aNfl6Oh6yO46mOVo0NdQZpEg3Ic.jpg','2014-01-18',107,'Released','The FBI thought they had him. It was the other way around.','Whitey: United States of America v. James J. Bulger',246743,1.5909,6.4,'R2klCnCBHFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37824,_binary '\0','/rn9kyvc4ha4ChO2afSQdQIm8Aw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3326880',4.8,1282,'en','Laugh Killer Laugh','A jewel thief named Frank Stone is a very deeply disturbed, anti social, milquetoast who finds no joy or humor in anything - until he awakens from a deep coma.','/Acz5Ogbky6yCYU9wTgwYWmtDJw1.jpg','2015-04-25',100,'Released','You shoulda picked a better class of friends','Laugh Killer Laugh',331378,1.7501,4.5,'9liHHEQSCec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37825,_binary '\0','/9L5Ekpoy4zT6o00qKUmZTeTkaVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33270103',5.8,2296,'en','Honey Bunch','Diana\'s husband is taking her to an experimental trauma facility deep in the wilderness, but she can\'t remember why... As her memories begin to creep back in so do some unwelcome sinister truths about her marriage.','/rR6zS2sPpcjND92cCLmsuMNok7M.jpg','2026-01-23',114,'Released',NULL,'Honey Bunch',1339173,1.8015,5.8,'7bG6ymmZM7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37826,_binary '\0','/adSehPPtjXnw0bOzzESkyPnosqs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33270263',5.4,3760,'en','The Surrender','A fraught mother-daughter relationship is put to a terrifying test when the family patriarch dies, and the grieving mother hires a mysterious stranger to bring her husband back from the dead.','/t45V9B1kSvwVpupWie1t9e1YWXe.jpg','2025-11-06',95,'Released',NULL,'The Surrender',1339206,3.8984,5.8,'ypLKyzBPPTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37827,_binary '\0','/sOeR0Gh1F40z1Kb1PKdOZqfW8oE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3327624',5.3,15830,'en','Infini','A search and rescue team are transported through deep space to a distant mining colony to save the sole survivor of a biological outbreak. During their mission, they find a lethal weapon which is set to arrive on Earth within the hour.','/3RpZabrzEKiwoG5Y74HkX4rMQHM.jpg','2015-04-11',110,'Released','Search. Rescue. Destroy.','Infini',301728,2.7468,5.218,'usfgPPHTq3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37828,_binary '\0','/c0gtBfDyOrba9e5wnFjrxn8rxQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3327994',8.6,9281,'fr','Human','A collection of stories about and images of our world, offering an immersion to the core of what it means to be human. Through these stories full of love and happiness, as well as hatred and violence, it brings us face to face with the Other, making us reflect on our lives. From stories of everyday experiences to accounts of the most unbelievable lives, these poignant encounters share a rare sincerity and underline who we are – our darker side, but also what is most noble in us, and what is universal. Our Earth is shown at its most sublime through never-before-seen aerial images accompanied by soaring music, resulting in an ode to the beauty of the world, providing a moment to draw breath and for introspection. This film is a politically engaged work which allows us to embrace the human condition and to reflect on the meaning of our existence.','/l02W63OGQKYugJrs3Uw8nA9gii4.jpg','2015-09-12',191,'Released',NULL,'Human',359364,4.7213,8.4,'0-Retnj3TsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37829,_binary '\0','/nnPdlSktQOBnhPQnSibNBjFCZlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3328716',6.2,5069,'en','Paper Planes','Dylan discovers he has a talent for making paper planes. He has a chance to compete in a world championship, but he\'ll have to face bullies and self-doubt to do so.','/wpcAApL7oydxKeU2TR5y2RwNQ78.jpg','2014-08-10',96,'Released','If at first you don\'t succeed, fly, fly again!','Paper Planes',286875,2.7036,6,'h00GHmlFjCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37830,_binary '\0','/7VDTf1tSoDNP48S3iVfOBgtpCQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3328720',5.4,1612,'de','Doktorspiele','Andi has had an inferiority complex since childhood and not only has to deal with it, but also with girls, feelings and genitalia in different sizes.','/2kB1roIe7E9RrrkN7lH2TGhMNyT.jpg','2014-08-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Playing Doctor',323162,1.423,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37831,_binary '\0','/1TP9se05XsZnTbGdUFGPfLpDlDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33291011',8.2,2049,'te','#Lifestories','LifeStories is a film about 6 short stories taking the audience through the lives of the protagonists. Oscillating between joy, companionship, loneliness, camaraderie, guilt and unadulterated love.','/z8sOYWKIGCjfh8H0hcBAGBIUhkD.jpg','2024-09-14',101,'Released',NULL,'#Lifestories',1341441,1.22,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37832,_binary '\0','/17HPPumRKBmjLMOeCwhrN0AqBSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33291804',6.3,5596,'ml','മീശ','A forest guard, Midhun, invites his old friends to a reunion in the woods. What starts as a warm get-together slowly turns into a night of tension, betrayal, and survival, as secrets unravel and friendships crack under pressure.','/1SzqFfA4YSpUECHBntbz44NQj6A.jpg','2025-08-01',132,'Released',NULL,'Meesha',1290709,0.7036,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37833