of his restaurant\'s busiest nights. His father\'s emergency surgery, staff tensions and his former mentor Renzo\'s plans to take over push Sina to make tough decisions.','/bjHGT2f65Tim3YFJJci766FOgzH.jpg','2025-02-11',120,'Released',NULL,'Cooked',1392117,4.1681,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37849,_binary '\0','/npHXB310U9t5pklCM55DDJ2blWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33305581',3.7,2838,'en','Shiver Me Timbers','In Northern California during the summer of 1986, Olive Oyl, along with her cinema- obsessed friends and brother Castor, embark on a once-in-a-lifetime camping trip to witness the dazzling meteor shower accompanying the arrival of Halley\'s comet. But what starts as a serene evening of stargazing quickly turns into a harrowing nightmare when a meteor from the comet transforms Popeye, into a terrifying and unstoppable killing machine.','/o26avHeCyBUHDoHBYCaflWT6heZ.jpg','2025-03-20',74,'Released','I yam what I yam and that\'s all I yam.','Shiver Me Timbers',1375762,1.3493,4.9,'ny3Jc4GkSAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37850,_binary '\0','/8NGPUlR4xKQfgLaWCeXALGF3i27.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33305867',5.4,1456,'en','Spa Weekend','Four lifelong friends realize that somewhere between careers, relationships, families, and everyday responsibilities, they’ve forgotten how to take care of themselves and each other. Burned out and overdue for a break, the women escape to a luxury spa retreat for an unforgettable weekend dedicated to fun, laughter, and a lot of really bad decisions.','/uhx4YjT9YbSxrKVE7GWJdjI412J.jpg','2026-08-20',97,'Released','Friendship is a real trip.','Spa Weekend',1341138,23.6939,6.4,'9p7j3UvpEQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37851,_binary '\0','/iQodpfb5trczzmqxAgnsUYPw2rv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33305882',6.6,1862,'en','A Great Awakening','One of the most defining moments in American history is the story of an unlikely friendship between the Reverend George Whitefield and Benjamin Franklin.','/dXeeDRLGpTX1U97lWBAwQeeplsW.jpg','2026-04-03',129,'Released','Before the American Revolution, there was a revelation.','A Great Awakening',1341137,6.7871,7.4,'H4-rMC88ylQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37852,_binary '\0','/ixoj53VcZnU5784MCv35zJYlQ9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33306253',4.7,2245,'it','Io sono la fine del mondo','Forced to come back to Palermo to take care of his elderly parents, a deadpan driver-for-hire takes advantage of the situation to get back at the rigid authority figures who ruined his teenage years.','/5nDR8pgRvFmnhgpJnREdYQKYbys.jpg','2025-01-09',90,'Released',NULL,'I Am the End of the World',1386877,2.499,5,'xnmeTB3E4Yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37853,_binary '\0','/efMmUfbqfMTtheqjcWiHDtxcXbA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33307144',7.9,12509,'te','కోర్ట్: State vs. A Nobody','A determined lawyer takes on a high-stakes case to defend a 19-year-old boy, challenging a system that has already branded him guilty.','/4pEX67LJd7ZIqYWtksBtOgQEGcQ.jpg','2025-03-14',149,'Released',NULL,'Court: State vs. A Nobody',1424217,2.5486,7.35,'urrUjvUFhxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37854,_binary '\0','/pwyBBLEofnkRSyQ60oxjXCw9uGW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33307516',4.7,4325,'hi','किस किस को प्यार करूँ 2','Mohan wants to marry the love of his life, Sania, but destiny has a madcap plan! He ends up marrying three women of different religions and chaos follows.','/sqCgEMxOKvb949xbxn35Wcfn50S.jpg','2025-12-12',142,'Released',NULL,'Kis Kisko Pyaar Karoon 2',1339952,1.8222,5.346,'Eb9fIMlIiyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37855,_binary '\0','/7vnp32X0Yal0fFc2tV40TjRpHid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3330764',5.8,8997,'en','The Neighbor','In the town of Cutter, most people keep to themselves. But when John comes home to find his girlfriend missing, he sneaks into his neighbor\'s house, finding his girlfriend and several other kidnapped people tied up in the basement. When the neighbor come home, John is forced to get out of the house alive and lead the group to safety.','/6fvQVZ5Mc8s8dF6IJ5P4qjGzuZW.jpg','2016-08-19',87,'Released','We all have our secrets','The Neighbor',403642,2.7192,5.681,'Sa1uci4R5EM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37856,_binary '\0','/gUxI1DMkHch1nHygwGCMePvLtuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3331028',6.7,4994,'en','Imperial Dreams','A 21-year-old reformed gangster\'s devotion to his family and his future is put to the test when he is released from prison and returns to his old stomping grounds in Watts, Los Angeles.','/cEEsrLIH8LsGkuaU2Ql2FksewfT.jpg','2014-01-20',86,'Released',NULL,'Imperial Dreams',253154,2.9242,6.5,'ofYNrO77clY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37857,_binary '\0','/bZb27et2aHq6drC4OJBywEOzz2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33310930',4.9,2000,'ml','മൈനേ പ്യാർ കിയ','Searching for Nidhi in Madurai\'s streets, Aryan faces mounting danger and tension at every turn. Time runs short as he navigates growing chaos to stay alive.','/2eU8iygSmd7gY6K3TGVx2w3SPFh.jpg','2025-08-29',147,'Released',NULL,'Maine Pyar Kiya',1310779,1.4075,5.6,'Rf2YXZPmQpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37858,_binary '\0','/i0eR9O1FnCgBm1cH8WwqxGbAXMS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33311069',7.2,26312,'zh','火遮眼','After a criminal network kidnaps Wang Wei\'s daughter and the corrupt police refuse to assist him, Wei sets out on his own to locate her. Navin, a tenacious journalist whose wife has mysteriously vanished, is his only ally. In this explosive martial arts showdown, the unlikely duo fights the kidnappers ruthlessly driven by a furious vengeance.','/ivQ1Z3lI1xWvAeGDHBw3CCYZDGJ.jpg','2026-06-10',113,'Released','To save their loved ones, they will fight everyone.','The Furious',1280738,56.8704,8.193,'Avky8dVaqAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37859,_binary '\0','/7QirCB1o80NEFpQGlQRZerZbQEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33311244',5.4,9989,'es','Culpa nuestra','Jenna and Lion\'s wedding brings about the long-awaited reunion between Noah and Nick after their breakup. Nick\'s inability to forgive Noah stands as an insurmountable barrier. He, heir to his grandfather\'s businesses, and she, starting her professional life, resist fueling a flame that\'s still alive. But now that their paths have crossed again, will love be stronger than resentment?','/yzqHt4m1SeY9FbPrfZ0C2Hi9x1s.jpg','2025-10-15',110,'Released',NULL,'Our Fault',1156594,23.0307,7.362,'4ZDvKct1U4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37860,_binary '\0','/1dJ5lFzy8KifKXjkLshnbahPXpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33311744',6.3,1539,'fi','100 litraa sahtia','Middle-aged sisters Taina and Pirkko are famous for their Finnish farmhouse ale called “sahti”. The third sister, Päivi, is getting married, and she asks her sisters if they can make 100 liters of sahti for the wedding. Unfortunately, it’s too good not to drink it. The sisters wake up in a horrible hangover and realize they have drunk it all. They have 24 hours to find 100 liters of good sahti, or they will lose all the respect.','/mzcuxURPVLEDaeooIAOTcFENlLt.jpg','2025-03-28',88,'Released',NULL,'100 Liters of Gold',1204016,1.4186,7,'jRk52FiuGds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37861,_binary '\0','/yOFqBpJ0PEkBdQqalDEaeOiaKbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33312131',5.3,4430,'ko','사마귀','The secret society of contract killers falls into chaos, unleashing a new breed of assassins. With old rules in ruins, who dares claim the shadows?','/wuXW1OS7q6rlXN7SjL9LJ8xU0Je.jpg','2025-09-25',113,'Released','A new generation of rising killers.','Mantis',1267319,6.308,6.421,'PItlVyrf15U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37862,_binary '\0','/rJ7PB78ZcBaCPxQRLrZxh4M2Z0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3331548',5.4,3071,'en','Not Without Hope','A group of friends\' fishing boat capsizes off the coast of Mexico and they\'re left alone stranded at sea and struggling for survival.','/w5WJMJ6DWPFK0Gx0Ongh0FZBAlK.jpg','2025-12-04',119,'Released',NULL,'Not Without Hope',339849,6.5888,6.7,'rzDAcL3rOcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37863,_binary '\0','/1aABIiqBY7yoQESE8qWvR0w9bJZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3331846',7.4,11389,'ja','STAND BY ME ドラえもん','Sewashi and Doraemon find themselves way back in time and meet Nobita. It is up to Doraemon to take care of Nobita or else he will not return to the present.','/wc7XQbfx6EIQqCuvmBMt3aisb2Y.jpg','2014-08-08',94,'Released','Is Doraemon ending this summer?','Stand by Me Doraemon',265712,6.5401,7.452,'K4SMJcSyxYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37864,_binary '\0','/6jsyu5qmBxqdmlG2RCRizrczdMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33319697',6.2,1716,'ml','ഡിറ്റക്ടീവ് ഉജ്ജ്വലൻ','In the village of Plaachikkaavu, a local detective, Ujjwalan, must outsmart a mysterious figure in a deadly battle of wits, where his skills are put to the ultimate test.','/rVCNbMW2bmbPE2XaUMUsnA9YgAh.jpg','2025-05-23',124,'Released',NULL,'Detective Ujjwalan',278193,0.971,5.696,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37865,_binary '\0','/fACoy2VWw9lz1UbqrgtbIcSYi5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3332064',5.7,70138,'en','Pan','Living a bleak existence at a London orphanage, 12-year-old Peter finds himself whisked away to the fantastical world of Neverland. Adventure awaits as he meets new friend James Hook and the warrior Tiger Lily. They must band together to save Neverland from the ruthless pirate Blackbeard. Along the way, the rebellious and mischievous boy discovers his true destiny, becoming the hero forever known as Peter Pan.','/w8i0mZR7MEL7c3bXSsuYg7VJsew.jpg','2015-09-24',111,'Released','Every legend has a beginning.','Pan',266647,9.0313,6,'Y1wRv8vTpxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37866,_binary '\0','/sMk9cqDZY097v4IWz9xLdzuJBZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3332304',7.1,3538,'ta','திருமலை','Thirumalai, a mechanic, falls in love with Sweta, but her businessman father opposes the union and sends a gangster to break up the romance. Will their love prevail?','/kdWYGd1KnfsFuwpslVMLCDtS7EW.jpg','2003-10-24',160,'Released',NULL,'Thirumalai',69657,0.9459,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37867,_binary '\0','/tWJeQwwzGIZSUIDVK7IHRpigzzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33323522',6.9,1357,'en','Hasan Minhaj: Off with His Head','Hasan Minhaj delivers an unapologetic stand-up set about midlife identity struggles, race relations, political divides — and that fact-checking scandal.','/8qhRf12xSJht8RWapK8ND1Qx9IQ.jpg','2024-10-21',61,'Released',NULL,'Hasan Minhaj: Off with His Head',1352149,0.9949,7.2,'tu1mDH9X5qI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37868,_binary '\0','/8FLuDc1GhtTjAGTsCERkEKyxSO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33333712',6.4,2764,'ml','ദി പെറ്റ് ഡിറ്റക്ടീവ്‌','A couple of amateur sleuths attempt to solve the mystery behind disappearing pets, but become embroiled in far more sinister crimes.','/ydaAO8A9pIdtLN6K3hSAGVn08rH.jpg','2025-10-16',118,'Released',NULL,'The Pet Detective',1270908,1.2693,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37869,_binary '\0','/vnEdyQ0XL325M4jd1prEMNo4xlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33334267',6.4,7997,'hi','भारत भाग्य विधाता','Inside Cama Hospital, one of the sites targeted during the 2008 Mumbai terror attacks, nurses, ward boys, cleaners, lift operators, security personnel, and administrative workers keep 400 people alive while armed assailants struck the city around them.','/tf5lLrrikOswHKHpzW0UiHycJEx.jpg','2026-06-12',127,'Released',NULL,'Bharat Bhhagya Viddhaata',1351908,1.7019,6,'5xhDawcDVkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37870,_binary '\0','/uxRCrEMJlfCILQhkcDuDpadkQC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33335602',5.3,5191,'en','Maintenance Required','Charlie, the fiercely independent owner of an all-female mechanic shop, is forced to reevaluate her future when a flashy corporate competitor moves in across the street. Seeking comfort, she turns to an anonymous online confidant - unaware she\'s confiding in Beau, the very rival threatening her business. As sparks fly both online and off, the truth threatens to blow everything apart.','/lM7Q1y0pmHPWZCPmGkAWGKdgu6W.jpg','2025-10-07',100,'Released','Online... they’re anonymous soulmates. In real life they’re rivals.','Maintenance Required',1352755,6.2235,6.1,'6WSAUKWt7ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37871,_binary '\0','/eDZalaDn3ZnvKmKEwR4npWBVXgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33336815',7.4,1574,'en','Stopping the Steal','An inside account of President Trump\'s challenge to the results of the 2020 presidential election as told by former White House staff and appointees, including former Attorney General William Barr, and elected Republican officials in Arizona and Georgia who resisted pressure to change the results of the vote in their states.','/x7p4AhZK0X2w43P3pPoyYvfMY3b.jpg','2024-09-17',89,'Released','The inside story of 2020.','Stopping the Steal',1352173,1.6731,6.9,'DYiPxpSBhRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37872,_binary '\0','/4GcNJ8ZoxIbqZvvC4GM286FubJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33337007',7.1,5255,'mr','फसक्लास दाभाडे','The Dabhade family\'s wedding brings together laughter, chaos, and emotional moments as old conflicts resurface. Despite the tension, the family is reminded of the unbreakable bonds of love, loyalty, and shared history that define them.','/peJ5n5pBb3eQNIFqkfkvlI17JiX.jpg','2025-01-24',154,'Released',NULL,'Fussclass Dabhade',1415263,1.142,7.2,'VAUBZR4CiQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37873,_binary '\0','/mrc5RgWwcRsXOrFXNjFJRTDO9QB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33337133',3.9,2178,'te','Racharikam','Racharikam is a political action thriller set in the crime-infested Rachakonda. The film delves into intense village politics and societal struggles. The movie directed by Suresh Lankalapalli, and features Vijay Shankar, Apsara Rani, and Varun Sandesh in their pivotal roles.','/3mGo4QTUZLITICL9vgk0km0Vdfq.jpg','2025-02-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Racharikam',1435395,0.9295,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37874,_binary '\0','/xUVwlnl1zXcL04z857q8o0kY14k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33338697',7.6,2101,'en','The Bibi Files','Using never-seen-before interrogation footage, this investigation of Benjamin Netanyahu and his inner circle provides an unflinching gaze into the private world behind the headlines. Petty vanity and a sense of entitlement lead to corruption and the Netanyahus\' unwillingness to give up power. The extreme right senses opportunity in Bibi\'s weakness, and the dominos fall.','/aZTt7g857dGU9YUIIMHd5yNSKnY.jpg','2024-12-13',115,'Released',NULL,'The Bibi Files',1353263,1.8775,7.1,'E9wSXIvaNKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37875,_binary '\0','/7wbC6y2tLhEyvBppEdMS0p4N3EH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3333870',4.9,3865,'en','Antibirth','In a desolate community full of drug-addled Marines and rumors of kidnapping, a wild-eyed stoner named Lou wakes up after a crazy night of partying with symptoms of a strange illness and recurring visions. As she struggles to get a grip on reality, the stories of conspiracy spread.','/p4KSOLDlg1mY4SUbFL3Rd72CoMR.jpg','2016-09-02',94,'Released','She is waiting for him, but she does not know what is waiting for her. Neither do you...','Antibirth',332285,2.063,4.972,'Gx1K4yZW5Ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37876,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3333980',5.1,4081,'en','Flytrap','Flytrap mixes sci-fi with dark humor to tell the story of a reserved English Astronomer who becomes ensnared by the mysterious Mary Ann and her creepy and dangerous comrades. Held hostage in a twisted version of suburban San Fernando Valley, the Astronomer slowly uncovers the reason for his capture and the miserable fate that awaits him-and humanity-unless he acts.','/i02XnSonD1XjfusgjXMDBQj5HB.jpg','2014-12-10',81,'Released',NULL,'Flytrap',256509,1.9631,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37877,_binary '\0','/9f3YOHjVhoejYYtB9zZWCL5OlC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33343397',8.2,4090,'ja','DAN DA DAN: First Encounter','High schoolers Momo and Okarun, who debate about ghosts and aliens, investigate paranormal sites, encountering supernatural forces while awaking hidden powers to face the unknown. Theatrical event featuring the first three episodes of DAN DA DAN, and an exclusive interview with Yukinobu Tatsu and Shihei Lin, the author and editor of the original manga, Fuga Yamashiro (Director), and Shion Wakayama (voice of Momo) and Natsuki Hanae (voice of Okarun).','/1xZwPbfCgRnQvuwMieTkiRJS5Yl.jpg','2024-08-31',83,'Released','The battle of the occult starts now!','DAN DA DAN: First Encounter',1308681,2.8124,7.5,'APnjvV0YI2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37878,_binary '\0','/cb1nrnD4oWsIqmKfMhF8vO5Fela.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3334374',7.3,1328,'ur','مور','After the death of the family\'s matriarch, her husband and son must confront not only the corruption in society around them but the corruption within themselves.','/2nodpCaigKtWvZfUwckm6hDB3Et.jpg','2015-08-14',134,'Released',NULL,'Mother',227716,0.8,7.1,'izJYnHM8QG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37879,_binary '\0','/iSYEu96DTAgIxRD61rWXOQypr2a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3334418',5.3,3214,'en','Living Among Us','Vampires have just made themselves public! Now a group of documentarians have been granted access to spend some time with them and learn how they live and coexist with humans. But as reality sets in, the crew realize they are in for far more than they bargained for.','/8T2uRkdGifPQ1GGL4BNdXkrp4WQ.jpg','2018-05-08',87,'Released','They Always Were.','Living Among Us',481849,1.8261,6.1,'fwVzmpXhtbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37880,_binary '\0','/gpJr8wRED8BpBVaxM0eODQEBNwC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33348127',6,1242,'cn','尋秦記','In the Qin Dynasty, time-traveller Hong Siu-lung has lived in seclusion with his family for twenty years. Yet every step he takes remains under the watchful eye of his former disciple, now the Qin Emperor. On the brink of ultimate power after conquering the six warring states, the emperor is suddenly ambushed by a mysterious team wielding advanced weapons clearly originating from Hong’s time. Drawn together by fate again, Hong and Qin Emperor are forced to confront the long-buried conflict between them, because the future now depends on how they settle their past.','/m3YY0im3Y59VmiicgS0mfKVCdmb.jpg','2025-12-31',107,'Released','To save tomorrow, they must survive yesterday.','Back to the Past',650524,4.2696,6,'O22WwXOhb5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37881,_binary '\0','/3fNUHpIUVk4THb2CKScIZcdr1Kc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33349807',5.8,3072,'id','Pabrik Gula','A group of young men and women who work as seasonal workers in a sugar factory face terror from the kingdom of demons where the factory is located. They must find out the cause of the demons\' anger, before the terror ends their lives.','/z8Qy6WltFWdnMaQBowXrOr3Vfyg.jpg','2025-03-31',133,'Released',NULL,'Sugar Mill',1355126,4.4191,7.9,'HiQir_4xyms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37882,_binary '\0','/eteXClooai069UT0bmk7d64HAvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3335048',7.1,2064,'da','Stille hjerte','Three generations of a family gather over a weekend. The sisters Sanne and Heidi have accepted their terminally-ill mother’s desire to die before her disease worsens; but, as the weekend progresses, their mother\'s decision becomes harder and harder to deal with, and old conflicts come to the surface.','/ar3hlLoK