ker and Sylvester McCoy are keen to be involved. But do they manage it?','/oX9IR6VzhbIBzsiH247qztFbMru.jpg','2013-11-23',31,'Released','No Classics? No 50th!','The Five(ish) Doctors Reboot',246202,2.6416,7.8,'HuoiOhhbEv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37979,_binary '\0','/s3q2Hk5KZdwVyNekNZmg1bUhlPu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3356654',5.7,1503,'en','Lucky in Love','When Mira\'s April Fool\'s Day tricks materialize, she finds herself promoted to the perfect job, dating the perfect man and living in the perfect home. Mira\'s newly upgraded life even involves working with her CEO and her good friend, on a coveted work project. When these seemingly positive changes result in big challenges, Mira realizes that the pursuit of perfection is a fool\'s errand. In order to achieve a life that\'s perfect for her, Mira must let go of perfection and chase what brings her true happiness.','/mv91QcucVwSSaHb1KNtlK04KQqK.jpg','2014-04-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Lucky in Love',263627,1.724,5.763,'kTQlRHrnlrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37980,_binary '\0','/hVQbT0JTPSFvmmSE6vASWSOCTAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33586629',7.1,1779,'it','Primavera','A talented violinist, Cecilia, confined in an orphanage, meets Vivaldi who becomes her teacher. Under his mentorship and through his music, she gains courage to break free from the life she was destined for and pursue her passion.','/lu2sF3dRYGgzhLvoc9yZNSKtlFO.jpg','2025-12-05',111,'Released',NULL,'Primavera',1365683,3.2162,7.1,'J-fEjuVy5cQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37981,_binary '\0','/peablWxLLhbbxhvrX8aFAjPIGSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3359290',5.5,2559,'hi','Bobby Jasoos','A film that celebrates the aspiration of Bobby, who wants to become the number one detective in the old city area of Hyderabad.','/pJrV232nBTrRO5Zgz2Vj9LjMtR2.jpg','2014-07-04',121,'Released',NULL,'Bobby Jasoos',272420,1.0649,5.5,'WasrL2THRjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-