-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37985,_binary '\0','/dbr3eceKuGnKc9v5GaVTVtegZNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33603921',5.5,2853,'en','Joe\'s College Road Trip','To teach his sheltered grandson about the real world, Madea\'s foul-mouthed brother Joe takes the college-bound teen on a raucous cross-country road trip.','/jWGOCUlzF4aCVLwHoiuqWWfhcrA.jpg','2026-02-12',109,'Released','This ain\'t no field trip.','Joe\'s College Road Trip',1243460,5.0169,6.1,'wAFF7SwGY_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37986,_binary '\0','/54RLUt3GoWO6vilmC9pOuyh2L0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33610673',5.9,3558,'te','మెన్షన్ హౌస్ మల్లేష్','In a quiet village where gossip spreads faster than the wind, a swaggering young man becomes the talk of the town after his wedding night sparks unexpected rumours. What follows is a hilarious chain of misunderstandings, ego clashes, and small-town chaos. Mension House Mallesh is a lively rural entertainer packed with satire and nonstop laughter.','/ogAiSE22WPT98qD0W1vfibkqKPS.jpg','2026-03-06',121,'Released',NULL,'Mension House Mallesh',1647142,2.0977,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37987,_binary '\0','/Af907x5h9W1wVis8XrSd7ynTWuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33612209',6.3,113702,'en','The Devil Wears Prada 2','Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway\'s position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway\'s survival.','/xTI42pmsP5EDnvsNJPEDubwWBQO.jpg','2026-04-29',119,'Released','Icons reign forever.','The Devil Wears Prada 2',1314481,42.4871,7.047,'PMd1at7OwiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37988,_binary '\0','/4HXiEsWUEMzJNFwjJv6oUaocqJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3361792',6.8,51934,'en','Tolkien','England, early 20th century. The future writer and philologist John Ronald Reuel Tolkien (1892-1973) and three of his schoolmates create a strong bond between them as they share the same passion for literature and art, a true fellowship that strengthens as they grow up, but the outbreak of World War I threatens to shatter it.','/A7eYO3t7oZQdfJj5KlJBI7GhT9H.jpg','2019-05-03',112,'Released','A life of love, courage & fellowship.','Tolkien',468224,5.0541,6.912,'Girzu81oS8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37989,_binary '\0','/cncgtWj0PdJhtxFsYtldV3Ubtzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3364264',5.9,2278,'en','Adventures in Public School','A socially-awkward, home-schooled kid forces his way into public school against his suffocating, but loving, mother\'s wishes.','/m7prbaNnkmPlW3u87Yf8QYeJeNf.jpg','2018-09-06',86,'Released','A rebel without a clue.','Adventures in Public School',471515,2.1325,6.2,'Ul0BdWColUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37990,_binary '\0','/gjmI1YRCQ4h72npF05GQsC5t6nP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3365690',8,3297,'bn','জাতিস্মর','Rohit, a Gujarati, studies the life of Anthony Firengee, and in the process meets with a mysterious man Kushawl Hajra.','/7ijITG5hRDGpffIYpRjb0ONiVgW.jpg','2014-02-28',150,'Released','A Musical of Memories','Jaatishwar',256971,1.0735,7.775,'XYF_Vp8arb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37991,_binary '\0','/xxkuySNoMailIohAdqJQuyNbuOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3365778',7,8279,'fr','Respire','Charlie, a 17-year-old girl tortured by doubt, is thrilled when she becomes friends with Sarah, but when Sarah tires of Charlie and looks for a new friend, their relationship takes an ominous turn.','/z568idoup0lE4qxlUfQt4T1F7tO.jpg','2014-11-12',91,'Released',NULL,'Breathe',270400,2.7748,7.1,'cdWMxOAVHUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37992,_binary '\0','/jOziky3yY9cm7GZ4zNqelf54QrY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3367686',3.4,2842,'en','Awaken','A random group of people wake up on an Island where they are being hunted down in a sinister plot to harvest their organs.','/qq67VdhYp1JYLLRwqheAcLE9HQW.jpg','2015-07-07',89,'Released','A perfect vacation.','Awaken',322922,2.9166,3.8,'zwpaOE7sAPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37993,_binary '\0','/9vtBUoRL3YxzPqiqkugPmoZSlxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3368222',6.9,3062,'hi','Angry Indian Goddesses','A photographer invites her closest friends to vacation at her family\'s home in Goa in celebration of her upcoming marriage.','/qn7kTThiHtZHp7CAdpGSS9ik4ly.jpg','2015-12-04',115,'Released','Angels. Lovers. Victims. Killers. Buddies... Women.','Angry Indian Goddesses',358893,1.3879,6.8,'a-jyKun4yFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37994,_binary '\0','/1D0js6RC5MyryrFddFkQg9uibLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3368814',5.5,1243,'en','Killing Daddy','When Cassie\'s father finds himself vulnerable and bedridden, she believes she has the perfect revenge for her mother\'s death.','/l5zS9XOPws4cZ6te7Ard7Xi8PAO.jpg','2014-07-05',85,'Released','She\'s a daddy\'s girl... with a killer secret.','Killing Daddy',280874,1.2972,7.1,'aanZ_pTPyZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37995,_binary '\0','/lkhxxBNRn7AFkQBPnlARQeAIbAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3369670',6.6,1307,'hi','Children of War','Children of War is a movie based on the true events of the 1971 Genocide. Can we, in search of power, become animals? A genocide; neglected! The first use of rape as a weapon of war; undocumented! The lives of millions; unaccounted! The culprits; unpunished!','/rQDaJNM9Qcv2UaZQfnUYEksyvta.jpg','2014-05-18',160,'Released','Would you go to war for peace? A war child\'s search for acceptance and a nation inundated in blood.','Children of War',270567,0.8557,4.7,'P3xWa-pBtdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(37996,_binary '\0','/bxBpDzktYTDMpx7VrS6r6wNDeTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3369806',6.6,31421,'en','Max','A dog that helped soldiers in Afghanistan returns to the U.S. and is adopted by 