'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33744610',7,3162,'hi','घमासान','Set in the Hindi heartland, the story follows a cat and mouse chase against a ruthless dacoit. An honest IPS officer is determined to hunt him down, corrupt politicians notwithstanding.','/gZuN5Vh9ceBzTk9gl230kE9GrVD.jpg','2024-10-18',142,'Released',NULL,'Ghamasaan',1372059,2.1919,8,'OEvaXgDTPmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38004,_binary '\0','/uuAVFuH2nJVJDtfW8oOFJje0f2Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3374816',3.8,2273,'en','Wild in Blue','A story about a madman with a movie camera. He\'s a narcissist, nihilist, sexual sadist and killer of innocent women. His name is Charlie and WILD IN BLUE is his world: a place of evil, violence and perversion where only his camera tells the truth. He set out to make an honest film for you - no lies whatsoever - and after the madness and all the hate, you will love him.','/pmhDygZPCgcvX6ryeYp7sROphFn.jpg','2014-05-05',82,'Released',NULL,'Wild in Blue',337218,2.3016,4.2,'OG8SpHezW6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38005,_binary '\0','/pW5riDdhr3YMZ3GLscb7l7HrKvm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3374966',7.1,9418,'it','La mafia uccide solo d\'estate','While Arturo tries to gain the love of Flora, he witnesses the history of Sicily from 1969 to 1992, miraculously dodging the crimes of the Mafia and supporting as a journalist the heroic struggle of the judges and policemen who fought this infamous organization.','/d4UNLLbxEAHGKu35nQ2Wcmce4fV.jpg','2013-11-28',90,'Released','A Deadly Serious Comedy','The Mafia Kills Only in Summer',239877,2.6938,7.317,'BRAkYEZIKgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38006,_binary '\0','/aMqoTR7JbW7u37w7jbI190XGTBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3375286',4.3,2248,'fi','Bunny the Killer Thing','A group of seven young friends travel to a cabin in the dark woods of Finland for the weekend, where they have the misfortune of encountering a creature that\'s half-human, half-rabbit. In addition to satisfying its killer instinct, the ferocious creature also needs to satiate another pressing appetite.','/pShIldQSNMulPnvp6dlfSzMzW2w.jpg','2015-11-06',88,'Released','It\'s after your pussy!','Bunny the Killer Thing',343701,2.7172,4.5,'iJe_wCjf4IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38007,_binary '\0','/3pDfu71mrzSuFYyIfnKEjt8z4BC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33763941',5.5,21910,'en','Passenger','After a young couple witnesses a gruesome highway accident, they soon realize they did not leave the crash scene alone, as a demonic presence called the Passenger that won\'t stop until it claims them both turns their van life adventure into a nightmare.','/svrAzMTif4OmIjGJzC0W92d5O1o.jpg','2026-05-20',94,'Released','130 million people take road trips every year. 15,400 of them are never seen again.','Passenger',1368314,21.291,7.3,'eNIn8kW1kyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38008,_binary '\0','/twiVn9oFXOVR0uoYgawyEBlnFu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33764258',8.4,493590,'en','The Odyssey','Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.','/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg','2026-07-15',173,'Released','Defy the gods.','The Odyssey',1368337,343.1518,8,'AyIZ9tiiN8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38009,_binary '\0','/rOHZIArbvH0rKkM7tE3NF40SQUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33773297',6.7,2030,'te','Kallu Compound 1995','A Telangana village under prohibition in 1995, where a powerful toddy tapper, Pratap Goud, exploits villagers.','/q8DqVZtEaYDf8PXPNbKCG2JYAcy.jpg','2024-10-18',117,'Released',NULL,'Kallu Compound 1995',1475987,0.646,0,'ZHL-CM5oe5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38010,_binary '\0','/6ZRqXdoHHhHhWtbtGJqAzGKJU