orce within her to protect her new parents and to save herself.','/zvHlijzVA5hNOmy6vMi0vSlnlsh.jpg','2015-08-01',84,'Released',NULL,'June',341886,1.3634,4,'e9dLuOBFR-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38014,_binary '\0','/x9ps25gDY2Q6XD6yTMfDiPAelMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3380264',4.5,4772,'hi','किल दिल','Once upon a time in North India, two killers – Dev and Tutu - roamed free. Abandoned when young and vulnerable, Bhaiyaji gave them shelter and nurtured them to kill! All is normal in their lives until destiny throws free-spirited Disha into the mix. What follows is a game of defiance, deception and love.','/rs93Rh0oeJ4eYCpfn0GvkrtpSbQ.jpg','2014-11-13',127,'Released',NULL,'Kill Dil',296690,1.6904,5.085,'jEhnt70rCTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38015,_binary '\0','/tt0QtXBnUBq3Lt4WSkcORyAJ6YP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3381008',6.2,121432,'en','Grimsby','Wrongfully accused and on the run, a top MI6 assassin joins forces with his long-lost, football hooligan brother to save the world from a sinister plot.','/2jQGFmShpdflApc5oidJZ97m1d1.jpg','2016-02-24',83,'Released','Behind every hero is an embarrassing sibling.','Grimsby',267193,11.4911,5.95,'_YtclB_02wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38016,_binary '\0','/9bRA3SYXadsYTJ5QDcMH3zVBRcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3382148',2.8,4102,'hi','यारियां','A college student must win an inter college competition to save his college from being demolished by property builders.','/fZmL1C67pA0OHLGPITt0d2IODnM.jpg','2014-01-10',145,'Released',NULL,'Yaariyan',252053,1.1332,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38017,_binary '\0','/6xmO2S4NWFHnphunxCOUwF8xjdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3382842',1.8,1534,'en','The Mummy Resurrected','A team of archaeologists discover an ancient mummy, unleashing a deadly curse from its eternal tomb.','/nVPbuqzGTJCXzycYT4yOuducdm0.jpg','2014-03-01',80,'Released',NULL,'The Mummy Resurrected',268508,1.3769,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38018,_binary '\0','/x2WmIj5I5lmur68ZqrDkeQwJhrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33829315',6.9,2052,'en','Santa Tell Me','When Olivia, a successful interior designer, finds an old letter from Santa promising she’ll meet the love of her life by Christmas Eve — and that his name will be Nick — she’s stunned to meet not one, but three guys named Nick.” In addition to navigating three holiday romances, she finds herself drawn to a co-worker.','/zKvCa16DTB1gJJ9hdCpSHyWu9Ue.jpg','2024-11-09',84,'Released','Oh what fun it is to find a soulmate.','Santa Tell Me',1325888,1.7657,7.1,'jk7V1Cey7kk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38019,_binary '\0','/XnEL3q0DfkwIVus8Rg8EtKPWZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33829446',6.6,1290,'en','A Novel Noel','A successful New York book editor is chosen to run a bookstore in the small town of Saint Ives for the month of December.','/nP3Azz2qIKoWqJElHbYq8J3s0Pa.jpg','2024-11-21',84,'Released','See what\'s in store at the bookstore','A Novel Noel',1361244,1.5785,6.7,'6jzmLiSxuaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38020,_binary '\0','/b9fzM1OjMfEEkwYvmDvQf3QXUgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3384350',4.3,1973,'en','Worry Dolls','A brutal serial killer is finally gunned down in the middle of carrying out one last heinous act of bloody murder. In the maniac’s possession, a box of Guatemalan talismans, which mistakenly end up being sold as charm jewelry in Chloe’s Collectables thrift shop. Soon those who bought the Worry Dolls begin to act strangely out of character and cause another rash of senseless slaughter. An ancient curse is consuming the city and pits a hardened detective against the clock to save his 8 year-old daughter’s life.','/cXD8DxoEkyzpW5nbTNbDY1myz1J.jpg','2016-06-27',85,'Released','Worry to death','Worry Dolls',347757,2.4785,5.3,'0E6AKBZZMMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38021,_binary '\0','/zeeAr7XBDDfoLvJsr2LkFJ1aEWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3384904',2.6,2414,'en','Apocalypse Pompeii','When a former Special Ops commando visits Pompeii, his wife and daughter are trapped as Mt. Vesuvius erupts with massive force. While his family fights to survive the deadly onslaught of heat and lava, he enlists his former teammates in a daring operation beneath the ruins of the city of Pompeii.','/6hlmot2yGQEiRruT8hOAkoo7fUe.jpg','2014-02-18',88,'Released','See Naples and Die!','Apocalypse Pompeii',256284,1.6551,4.7,'hBSqOmeGs-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38022,_binary '\0','/3fZ5HvkrjaS34sZERshWm9koXdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33852162',5.9,7771,'fr','Vie privée','When renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the sudden death of a patient, she suspects murder. She mounts a private investigation, enlisting an odd assortment of quirky characters.','/grozteYTaspY4xaJRt3nw4zMtTs.jpg','2025-09-27',108,'Released',NULL,'A Private Life',1290432,8.0168,5.495,'2JabG5C6IU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38023,_binary '\0','/sTQNRqLbfCXolrb5CizAW1dj528.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3385516',6.8,499391,'en','X-Men: Apocalypse','After the re-emergence of the world\'s first mutant, world-destroyer Apocalypse, the X-Men must unite to defeat his extinction level plan.','/ikA8UhYdTGpqbatFa93nIf6noSr.jpg','2016-05-18',144,'Released','Only the strong will survive.','X-Men: Apocalypse',246655,23.5088,6.528,'COvnHv42T-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38024,_binary '\0','/6oyC0KcZPx9aqA1WkXtkfA1txXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3385524',7.2,41930,'en','Stan & Ollie','With their golden era long behind them, comedy duo Stan Laurel and Oliver Hardy embark on a variety hall tour of Britain and Ireland. Despite the pressures of a hectic schedule, and with the support of their wives Lucille and Ida – a formidable double act in their own right – the pair\'s love of performing, as well as for each other, endures as they secure their place in the hearts of their adoring public','/8qDBDXA8Od8gc4IQMnoXUKyj8Pf.jpg','2018-12-28',98,'Released','The untold story of the world\'s greatest comedy act.','Stan & Ollie',394741,5.6054,6.9,'D2zdFwgUYBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38025,_binary '\0','/AuGeSASWEoV4K2aCNFTqiSxLkVZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3386954',6.9,1900,'en','The Gabby Douglas Story','The true story of Gabby Douglas who becomes the first African American to be named Individual All-Around Champion in artistic gymnastics at the Olympic Games.','/hIsFplFgFXFMMBfK0Ei0i5qlRVt.jpg','2014-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Gabby Douglas Story',254065,2.9253,7.379,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38026,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3387094',7.1,1547,'ml','പുണ്യാളൻ അഗർബത്തീസ്','Punyalan Agarbattis is the story of Joy Thakkolkaran, a young entrepreuner from Thrissur. His new business venture \'Punyalan Agarbattis\' involves manufacturing agarbattis from elephant dung. Fragrance and quality of his incense sticks aside, its mosquito repellant capabilities too have pleased those who tried the samples. However, Joy suddenly has a new set of people and problems as \'Punyalan Agarbattis\' comes to a halt.','/bNFycwoBG0KjpcZJsrWqhprDDCR.jpg','2013-11-29',137,'Released',NULL,'Punyalan Agarbattis',241645,0.9767,7.308,'78AOQW3DtaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38027,_binary '\0','/cBlKxl2YSRVTLb1szSur8H3BNdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3387266',6.9,17860,'en','A United Kingdom','The inspiring true story of Seretse Khama, the King of Bechuanaland (modern Botswana), and Ruth Williams, the London office worker he married in 1948 in the face of fierce opposition from their families and the British and South African governments. Seretse and Ruth defied family, Apartheid and empire - their love triumphed over every obstacle flung in their path and in so doing they transformed their nation and inspired the world.','/xyhoW9qK7ZaDM1V4A6pPL9DWjn8.jpg','2016-11-25',111,'Released','The true story of a love that shook an empire','A United Kingdom',347026,5.0137,6.6,'LKPDNKdpys8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38028,_binary '\0','/snll1zUi2oxIah9qifXOvbfjcrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3387520',6.2,93149,'en','Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark','Mill Valley, Pennsylvania, Halloween night, 1968. After playing a joke on a school bully, Stella and her friends decide to sneak into a supposedly haunted house that once belonged to the powerful Bellows family, unleashing dark forces that they will be unable to control.','/uy0dNFbhRhHBLwpOGpcTw9UEwdX.jpg','2019-08-08',108,'Released','They\'re not just stories anymore.','Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark',417384,16.765,6.489,'7IQjZWz2JF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38029,_binary '\0','/c6GGumaw3bvhX15NXK30heuCnaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3387542',4.8,48134,'en','The Forest','Set in the Aokigahara Forest, a real-life place in Japan where people go to end their lives. Against this backdrop, a young American woman comes in search of her twin sister, who has mysteriously disappeared.','/1TohqCqMbaiuRLJPrPW0vnQP3lE.jpg','2016-01-07',93,'Released','Everyone comes here looking for a way out','The Forest',329440,7.214,5.2,'99_ZXddTnR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38030,_binary '\0','/xqhTXB86dkKe4jalwUFIjiFgaYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3387648',6,51460,'en','The Taking of Deborah Logan','What starts as a poignant medical documentary about Deborah Logan\'s descent into Alzheimer\'s disease and her daughter\'s struggles as caregiver degenerates into a maddening portrayal of dementia at its most frightening, as hair-raising events begin to plague the family and crew and an unspeakable malevolence threatens to tear the very fabric of sanity from them all.','/77i7EBUyQKOUiZeYQ5tWDGQb0AI.jpg','2014-10-21',90,'Released','Evil lives within you','The Taking of Deborah Logan',297608,7.1319,6.57,'DnZNojsjlQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38031,_binary '\0','/jT6M9DD1WMXlXdzDYaeQfo1sFh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33888131',5.8,6142,'hi','Aap Jaisa Koi','Shrirenu lives by tradition. Madhu lives unapologetically. When their paths cross, a tender romance unfolds — awkward, sweet but shadowed by patriarchy.','/qusjoDePti9etsaq9DgyYSj2Sq8.jpg','2025-07-11',115,'Released',NULL,'Aap Jaisa Koi',1391013,2.995,6.31,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38032,_binary '\0','/t3xRW2DeXjTPJQDYrh0Qdy9n5I8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33888205',7.4,2789,'te','ది గ్రేట్ ప్రీ-వెడ్డింగ్ షో','A young couple navigates the chaotic world of pre-wedding photography, facing unexpected hurdles and family drama as they try to capture their perfect moments before tying the knot.','/62BpFQYYThhxauHwd1JShob7XPz.jpg','2025-11-07',114,'Released',NULL,'The Great Pre-Wedding Show',1574296,1.1055,8,'zd98F_TNsJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38033,_binary '\0','/gPTHVWTLHq8i2KwfGnJpgvcU4Sw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33888334',7.6,1515,'de','Ach, diese Lücke, diese entsetzliche Lücke','At the age of 20, Joachim is unexpectedly accepted into the renowned acting school in Munich and moves into the villa with his grandparents, Inge and Hermann. Between the bizarre challenges of acting school and the eccentric, mostly alcohol-fueled rituals of his grandparents, Joachim tries to find his place in the world — without knowing what role he actually plays in it.','/knxomBCHcmYGTqDF5NnQaN9SLND.jpg','2026-01-29',137,'Released',NULL,'Oh, This Unspeakable Void',1356484,2.7277,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38034,_binary '\0','/jjAOd9SAGMDP31zlQVvDmRmlDPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33900751',6.8,1370,'en','Sugarplummed','Emily\'s wish for a picture-perfect Christmas comes true when a magical, optimistic movie character steps off the screen to help, but as things spiral out of control, she learns that true holiday perfection might look very different from what she imagined.','/oI4K0OiWzZ9DiGHJXatJgtVveED.jpg','2024-12-07',84,'Released','Her Christmas needs a little star power','Sugarplummed',1359060,1.8027,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38035,_binary '\0','/tAwCoEDFJ8Sfbr2ZblgRIqHLZJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33903431',7.1,1835,'en','Following Yonder Star','When a scandal upends a famous TV mother’s life ahead of the holidays, she heads to a luxury Vermont resort for Christmas. Upon arriving, a booking error leads her to a quaint B&B owned by an astronomy teacher.','/tIX3upo5WdwH83SIVVV3NcKKza0.jpg','2024-12-15',84,'Released','Love leading, still proceeding','Following Yonder Star',1360794,1.4899,5.8,'tRMyaxPKjnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38036,_binary '\0','/v6faF3jeSUKGuypAszSkuCrzG61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3390376',5.8,1457,'en','Selling Isobel','Based on a true story ~ Isobel goes for a job interview, gets locked in and sex trafficked for 3 consecutive days.','/7Jm77HUAtruqb3tMw58BG0inQ8x.jpg','2019-10-26',101,'Released','In America everything is for sale.','Selling Isobel',573537,1.704,5,'b3nkbqbcJLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38037,_binary '\0','/oAI33ddMSl9EltNl8LHxgYTYYCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3390550',5.1,2445,'en','The Barn','It\'s Halloween 1989, best friends Sam and Josh are trying to enjoy what\'s left of their final Devil\'s Night before graduating high school. But trouble arises when the two pals and a group of friends take a detour on their way to a rock concert, finding an old abandoned barn and awakening the evil inside. Now it\'s up to Sam and Josh to find a way to protect their friends and defeat the creatures that lurk within \"The Barn\".','/ysOfFEb9pZuV9IW8H6WeXPti4s8.jpg','2016-10-31',88,'Released','Trick-or-Treat, smell my feet... and DIE!','The Barn',378017,1.5513,4.8,'GlW8UGBeFDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38038,_binary '\0','/bbd3XvJfY5MppOoYKl447HKjKXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3390572',8,61676,'hi','हैदर','A young man returns to Kashmir after his father\'s disappearance to confront his uncle - the man he suspects to have a role in his father\'s fate.','/lOCotkHPODWdsRDMoLbSdLdVT3L.jpg','2014-10-02',150,'Released',NULL,'Haider',280795,1.8941,7.232,'ZmN_VSo8DOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38039,_binary '\0','/9DYCjWFD9iw5S7uunqqBj7lx77b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3393070',3.3,2063,'en','Android Cop','In the year 2045, a Los Angeles Police Department detective and his new android partner enter the Zone, a forbidden section of the city plagued with an unknown disease. There, they discover the source of the illness and attempt to stop it using the android\'s advanced technology and weaponry.','/pStgVcVSMNDykydPzMTuAiXAb50.jpg','2014-02-04',88,'Released','The Future of Law Enforcement','Android Cop',249021,3.3315,4,'7AgZebTmtiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38040,_binary '\0','/ww1eIoywghjoMzRLRIcbJLuKnJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3393786',6.2,195537,'en','Jack Reacher: Never Go Back','Years after resigning command of an elite military police unit, the nomadic, righter-of-wrongs Reacher is drawn back into the life he left behind when his friend and successor, Major Susan Turner is framed for espionage. Reacher will stop at nothing to prove her innocence and to expose the real perpetrators behind the killings of his former soldiers.','/cOg3UT2NYWHZxp41vpxAnVCOC4M.jpg','2016-10-19',118,'Released','Never give in. Never give up. Never go back.','Jack Reacher: Never Go Back',343611,18.1972,6.031,'DTBcGQWmQ1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38041,_binary '\0','/gEdMkJTxYJNhV7OBO65FHyI9KgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3394420',8.3,10349,'kn','ಉಳಿದವರು ಕಂಡಂತೆ','Malpe, a small fishing town on the Arabian Coast. Located 6 kms to the west of the temple town, Udupi. Malpe\'s beaches are washed clean everyday by the sea. The waves ensure that nothing gets left behind on the sands. But then, the waves cannot reach everything. It is the time of the year when Udupi and its surroundings are decked up to celebrate Sri Krishna Janmaashtami. Men and children walk the streets dressed up as characters from mythology. Teams painted as tigers are seen dancing to drum beats all around the town. But violence seems to be brewing in Malpe this Krishna Janmaashtami.','/b7Ee4DKKhNVYNV84rovdqcWXjgt.jpg','2014-03-28',154,'Released','As Seen by the Rest','Ulidavaru Kandanthe',262476,1.3479,7.741,'POJ_6EtGeMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38042,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3394510',5.8,1619,'kn','6-5=2','Six friends plan for a trek to an undisclosed mountain in the Western Ghats.','/VcihGrsVmZfpIR79TZ4AEh9GO9.jpg','2013-11-29',123,'Released','A Video Shot By Late Ramesh','6-5=2',343362,0.514,5.2,'h9GU75_WNX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38043,_binary '\0','/sTwYXYIw79TlBKRQ7Cdzev28vSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33949346',6.8,4344,'ta','மார்கன்','ADGP Dhruv, a seasoned high-ranking police officer haunted by a tragic past, grapples with a labyrinthine case, where every clue unearths a darker secret. As he uncovers clues linking to a mysterious swimmer, he races against time to stop a cunning serial killer driven by dark secrets.','/sgNetedu19Ar9LkUXGNheh9NL1D.jpg','2025-06-27',132,'Released',NULL,'Maargan',1425641,1.2968,6.176,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38044,_binary '\0','/qniTtPxL7kh899XeCl66SsmxAB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3395184',6.7,34365,'en','Spring','A young man in a personal tailspin flees the US to Italy, where he sparks up a romance with a woman harboring a dark, primordial secret.','/ghg3kgKDCFcX5ps1BXlgENNd3po.jpg','2014-10-08',110,'Released','Love is a monster.','Spring',241855,3.2122,6.6,'jsDX-0Z67U4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38045,_binary '\0','/9EeFO5EBLxewIKtqy2zByNGxOlC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3395582',5.4,1528,'en','Sun Choke','Janie’s just trying to get well. As she recovers from a violent psychotic break, she’s subjected each day to a bizarre holistic health and wellness regimen designed, and enforced, by her lifelong nanny and caretaker. But when she develops an obsession with a stranger, Janie\'s buried demons begin to surface.','/zS4dvm50qxLwvSPPI7u1luDiL8m.jpg','2015-10-01',89,'Released','There are a lot of ways this world can hurt you','Sun Choke',334026,1.302,5.1,'ZU9mAQOfpio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38046,_binary '\0','/kgOKS9cyVUOQ4B78EHsygmKnW0C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3395608',7.6,3157,'ur','O21','Two men only have 21 hours to stop a war between Afghanistan and Pakistan. An Afghan militant steals a microchip containing the names of people who want to exploit Afghanistan\'s mineral reserves.','/dRyTXw1Ap6LWPZomiMiFCuCRQt4.jpg','2014-10-06',124,'Released',NULL,'O21',308274,1.0234,6.5,'F45-WNylcEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38047,_binary '\0','/etiOwJqoCTsrfbsNiDTskRF2viB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3395908',7.2,1685,'ar','ساعة ونص','Based on the Ayyat train accident that killed 361 in 2002, this ensemble drama delves into the intense human stories of the passengers in a third-class coach car during the hour and a half before the crash.','/cmCqFO1SoR7ddjcRJ4psbm3J9Zn.jpg','2012-10-02',126,'Released',NULL,'An Hour and a Half',212864,1.2724,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38048,_binary '\0','/lEOdivf1rld5KU1pVsFTWBpdrWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3396114',5.9,1881,'en','Christmas in the Heartland','Kara and Jessie are two teenage girls from very different worlds, but with a little Christmas magic, they find they have much more in common than they ever imagined.','/IsZ70nRcxS9rcWNq65IM65EsVY.jpg','2017-11-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in the Heartland',485612,3.3606,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38049,_binary '\0','/8c1D8DZy3QXnGGvAKLdDKxiFzzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3396166',4.4,2664,'en','The Last Rescue','World World II: Shortly after D-Day, three American soldiers and two Army Corps nurses are stranded behind enemy lines. They take a high-ranking German officer as their prisoner and try to orchestrate an escape.','/l9ZaUvI4EW6sAHMsA5ig6tB7kow.jpg','2015-04-21',107,'Released','One soldier\'s battle for survival.','The Last Rescue',323901,1.7359,4.9,'Jr6VsJk2rEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38050,_binary '\0','/2oWglYwExFn9o8lp50t8biuIGdO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397160',6.7,2860,'de','Vor der Morgenröte','Before Dawn charts the years of exile in the life of famous Jewish Austrian writer Stefan Zweig, his inner struggle for the \"right attitude\" towards the events in war torn Europe and his search for a new home.','/6JE4oc4Lz5vl96KoQZEwbfO8Gwm.jpg','2016-06-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Stefan Zweig: Farewell to Europe',391663,1.79,6.457,'wCwEdhfxQDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38051,_binary '\0','/qt5scNafDllSLu4t5qUnL7poF7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397556',4.8,2473,'en','Lost After Dark','A group of teens sneak out of their high school dance to cruise around and have some unsupervised fun. When their car runs out of gas on a deserted road, they discover an old farmhouse and the cannibal killer living inside.','/u49uk8kA3qrmUY40GAsXCjjMFrb.jpg','2014-09-19',85,'Released','And you thought the \'80s were dead...','Lost After Dark',298865,1.4933,4.5,'ZOYf5mj5bKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38052,_binary '\0','/7wEo99rBCGz6FJfKZrTceud46nI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397754',5.9,6269,'en','10,000 Saints','A sweeping multigenerational story set against the backdrop of the raw, roaring New York City of the late 1980s; adoption, teen pregnancy, drugs, hardcore punk rock, the unbridled optimism and reckless stupidity of the young—and old—are all major elements in this heart-aching tale of the son of diehard hippies and his strange odyssey through the extremes of late 20th century youth culture.','/zZpQfrdXhNq5sqMMzDQkpqZQxXq.jpg','2015-08-14',113,'Released','Rage. Riot. Rebirth.','10,000 Saints',253406,3.7089,6,'ChYoufEDKCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38053,_binary '\0','/fx2cEuadZK28VHKkc0F1nFR96i0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33978029',6.5,74549,'en','Ready or Not: Here I Come','Moments after surviving an all-out attack from the Le Domas family, Grace discovers she’s reached the next level of the nightmarish game — and this time with her estranged sister Faith at her side. Grace has one chance to survive, keep her sister alive, and claim the High Seat of the Council that controls the world. Four rival families are hunting her for the throne, and whoever wins rules it all.','/13ZcJzSGEqVgDSqsS9U5EkQwPkV.jpg','2026-03-19',108,'Released','Double or nothing.','Ready or Not: Here I Come',1266127,27.2456,7.551,'7K3sNRm8J0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38054,_binary '\0','/fKPgObonYgPgCdu88yjV7Hpn7Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397884',7.7,549799,'en','Sicario','An idealistic FBI agent is enlisted by a government task force to aid in the escalating war against drugs at the border area between the U.S. and Mexico.','/lz8vNyXeidqqOdJW9ZjnDAMb5Vr.jpg','2015-09-17',122,'Released','The border is just another line to cross.','Sicario',273481,22.3177,7.43,'5PwwJ-18Y9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38055,_binary '\0','/lA3w7ZCiKm2uwKYLgyb0UV1qzFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397918',4.6,7702,'en','Harbinger Down','A group of grad students have booked passage on the fishing trawler Harbinger to study the effects of global warming on a pod of Orcas in the Bering Sea. When the ship\'s crew dredges up a recently thawed piece of old Soviet space wreckage, things get downright deadly. It seems that the Russians experimented with tardigrades, tiny resilient animals able to withstand the extremes of space radiation. The creatures survived, but not without mutation. Now the crew is exposed to aggressively mutating organisms. And after being locked in ice for 3 decades, the creatures aren\'t about to give up the warmth of human companionship.','/dGaRVjNHWQmCE7QsYnWtoD9fqyn.jpg','2015-08-07',82,'Released','Terror is just beneath the surface','Harbinger Down',296130,2.7419,4.5,'KjiCQgiM7-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38056,_binary '\0','/zWCocvlpKJ6yO5bNrma2H2iHJpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3397948',3.2,1227,'en','Zombie Ninjas vs Black Ops','In the clandestine research tower of a ruthless Japanese security and arms company, Saisei Security, scientist MALI awakens employed mercenaries killed in combat, their death giving rise to a new, vicious breed of zombie... ZOMBIE NINJAS. Trapped amongst unsuspecting civilians, including former tactical operative DILLON (Adam T Perkins), the ZOMBIE NINJAS commanded by a ferocious leader (Soa \'The Hulk\' Palelei) are unleashed in the inner city high-rise. They soon face off with the covert response mission deployed to fight back. This elite black ops team underestimates the brutality of their encounter, which ultimately tests their loyalty and friendship, resulting in a frightful assault between these two highly skilled lethal forces and DILLON thrust in the middle fighting for survival.','/e1E2YMpju9NU7SewuzyX3KcQGrm.jpg','2015-10-10',94,'Released','What doesn\'t kill you, will try and try again.','Zombie Ninjas vs Black Ops',364153,0.8004,2.6,'bfp6umEpC2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38057,_binary '\0','/dyacWrj0YmOJvZ5vKB2n4ysEL0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398048',4.2,3601,'hi','तेवर','A Kabaddi player rescues a young woman from an unwanted marriage and hides her in his home.','/gcFHdnmAAwx4kzg6DkNn5lLGDeP.jpg','2015-01-09',159,'Released',NULL,'Tevar',312809,1.0137,4.917,'LvMpWn2CNzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38058,_binary '\0','/5YnYOcShkPhcP4q4xZX52FzCHe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398052',6.1,6541,'hi','दावत-ए-इश्क','A deliciously romantic coming together of Gulrez “Gullu” Qadir a Hyderabadi shoe-sales girl disillusioned with love because of her encounters with dowry-seeking men; and Tariq “Taru” Haidar a Lucknawi cook who can charm anybody with the aroma and flavours of his biryani and kebabs.','/aGsDrtKQe0SnyecnJWdAeBo99u.jpg','2014-09-05',118,'Released',NULL,'Daawat-e-Ishq',291154,1.491,6.794,'rtsHlYO6TUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38059,_binary '\0','/DG4OvlSDL75Rl2WedGXrtK7BiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398066',4.2,2067,'en','Christian Mingle','A young, modern single woman enters the world of online dating looking for an instant soul mate.','/hWLXcrthWIJfle0VJY8r8IqnA32.jpg','2014-10-10',99,'Released','She went looking for Mr. Right... and found Him','Christian Mingle',296456,2.4016,5.7,'Z2eSj37_dHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38060,_binary '\0','/aiMCZmsIbKWq8JK2h3nvr0OHQyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33980854',4.8,1674,'en','Your Host','Four friends get trapped in a sadistic game show, forced to outwit a twisted serial killer while racing against time. Every move brings them closer to freedom or a gruesome fate.','/rG5Rm2l5PAvWK8623Bhu8xRShRC.jpg','2025-10-09',89,'Released','There is always a winner','Your Host',1372260,2.0715,5.894,'eA8eiT8CRxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38061,_binary '\0','/sQg9mZapqvudVi6TXOOKxKZofmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398252',3.4,4067,'en','Samurai Cop 2: Deadly Vengeance','25 years later after the events of Samurai Cop (1991), Detective Frank Washington is forced to team up with his long estranged partner Joe Marshall to solve a series of assassinations being committed by a secret group of female vigilante killers.','/yYoWUAzGe5PH8E3lltUiM1LzTD0.jpg','2015-10-09',90,'Released','They thought he was dead. He was just coolin\' off.','Samurai Cop 2: Deadly Vengeance',284460,2.7025,3.6,'996zhYei9Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38062,_binary '\0','/rVDOeOccg0K9tXuw6b9uOG6q4mf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398268',7.6,56332,'ja','思い出のマーニー','Upon being sent to live with relatives in the countryside due to an illness, an emotionally distant adolescent girl becomes obsessed with an abandoned mansion and infatuated with a girl who lives there - a girl who may or may not be real.','/vug1dvDI1tSa60Z8qjCuUE7ntkO.jpg','2014-07-19',103,'Released','Promise we\'ll remain a secret, forever.','When Marnie Was There',242828,10.2516,7.916,'XKhevpXX-wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38063,_binary '\0','/s7xmwFJQj99lICSGQkr8sQ7G9IA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33984333',6.5,4629,'fr','Un ours dans le Jura','Michel and Cathy, wed for longer than they can remember, lead a quiet but monotonous life in the mountains. When a bear bursts out in front of Michel’s car, accidentally killing two drug dealers and revealing a €2 million loot in the process, their life takes an unpredictable turn, especially when they decide to cover up the incident and keep the money! But their plan leads them to stumble upon an unexplained trail of dead bodies. More used to being honest than crooked, Michel and Cathy’s clumsy cover-up efforts soon put an interfering inspector hot on their trail.','/oovadj4TsgCuAGfd5LhDP19ZCYD.jpg','2025-01-01',113,'Released','Wild is the right word.','How to Make a Killing',1210732,6.6704,6.4,'94v0712fUQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38064,_binary '\0','/vGXZfAV77IcmHvt7ZvfXEfUecPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398436',5.2,2316,'de','German Angst','Horror anthology consisting of three episodes directed by Jörg Buttgereit, Andreas Marschall and Michal Kosakowski.','/7kSww7oRgQUmLbiyzAkyeUq94y9.jpg','2015-01-24',111,'Released','Love. Sex. Death.','German Angst',252596,1.8571,5.3,'H21mgUarHwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38065,_binary '\0','/e2ux9R577fPJH2uGXG0NTaEKeCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33986138',7.2,3214,'en','Beatles \'64','Featuring never-before-seen footage of the band and the legions of young fans who helped fuel their ascendance, follow McCartney, John Lennon, George Harrison and Starr as they land in New York City in February 1964 and solidify their status as the biggest band in the world.','/ny9fI756vTYVG3PrJwBUwXOeSBO.jpg','2024-11-24',108,'Released',NULL,'Beatles \'64',1371146,3.8456,6.565,'XLzMtQJnH8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38066,_binary '\0','/nUMclZJRRwREfeP8liJ7LOddjnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33987666',4.2,1341,'en','Speed Faster','Ace and his crew of elite street racers are forced into a high-stakes mission when a shadowy organization threatens someone close to him. In the aftermath of Four Amigos, they find themselves working for the infamous Church of Assassins, tasked with pulling off an impossible job. But as they push their limits, they uncover a chilling truth-failure was always part of the plan. Betrayal, speed, and survival collide in this adrenaline-fueled thriller where the real race isn\'t just for victory, but for their lives.','/dKYp9uUlDufvL0gWHve8nuzePdk.jpg','2026-01-23',87,'Released','THE CHAOS WAS NOT OVER','Speed Faster',1617852,5.1211,7,'3_iTX9mWMHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38067,_binary '\0','/ySQ9uB6VqP1M67SzMj5xZbCpRoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3398788',4.5,1906,'en','Hotel Inferno','Contract killer Frank Zimosa has been hired for a ridiculously lucrative mission by the rich and powerful Jorge Mistrandia. The objective: kill a couple of people hiding in one of his European hotels. What would look like one of the simplest jobs Frank has ever had is about to turn into a living nightmare. He will soon realize he\'s nothing more than prey for Mistrandia and his army of mutated henchmen that have been hiding in the hotel along with an ancient and unstoppable horror.','/h6uT2GISxo8jlQkpjqH6WY61z5G.jpg','2013-12-26',77,'Released','The First Splatter Movie in First Person View','Hotel Inferno',256742,2.0544,4.9,'hCklKATj4oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38068,_binary '\0','/1eAuwNBy34kkM3xkl202z4f1NiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33988385',6.1,11534,'ta','கருப்பு','In a world where justice falters, guardian deity Vettai Karuppu takes the guise of a lawyer to battle a corrupt legal system preying on the powerless.','/4KZXlZ5tTT6ghbW77gS4hSLkCd7.jpg','2026-05-14',152,'Released',NULL,'Karuppu',1367220,8.5377,6.563,'vH0Q5t_JUng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38069,_binary '\0','/rRzGhzcN6Q8iBvmxKo4qfLTgkMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3399024',6.7,18081,'fr','Samba','Samba migrated to France 10 years ago from Senegal, and has since been plugging away at various lowly jobs. Alice is a senior executive who has recently undergone a burnout. Both struggle to get out of their dead-end lives. Samba\'s willing to do whatever it takes to get working papers, while Alice tries to get her life back on track until fate draws them together.','/qHnUQ9zbuv4lM2eVms9FMp0TyA8.jpg','2014-10-15',118,'Released','Sometimes those with nothing have the most to lose.','Samba',269148,4.0101,6.35,'mRtU0FnLoXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38070,_binary '\0','/nVqGQh0oc3f9yfMAnHAS2kUWp0U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33990511',7.4,1806,'en','Megan Thee Stallion: In Her Words','With unprecedented access to the multi-faceted woman behind the persona, follow Megan Thee Stallion\'s journey on the road to stardom as she tenaciously navigates fame, grief, pressure and success, This documentary unpacks the Houston native\'s most vulnerable moments in a powerful way that allows fans to meet the real Megan Pete.','/AnRXiTNdcKIDlgz2hXMrE52C8l4.jpg','2024-10-30',112,'Released','Her story. Her life.','Megan Thee Stallion: In Her Words',1371206,2.7471,7.7,'VxQHsx7d_nU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38071,_binary '\0','/8itnqXk6DA5LXFPZaBcspgfWY4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3399112',7.2,1850,'en','No No: A Dockumentary','Dock Ellis pitched a no-hitter on LSD, then worked for decades counseling drug abusers. Dock\'s soulful style defined 1970s baseball as he kept hitters honest and embarrassed the establishment. An ensemble cast of teammates, friends, and family investigate his life on the field, in the media, and out of the spotlight.','/1ML2eqNfpLF5I0YqSkgVgFGohua.jpg','2014-01-20',100,'Released',NULL,'No No: A Dockumentary',250665,1.1723,7,'CtTiM4_sJJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38072,_binary '\0','/oLcUygjFGeB5YT6tiBX4jqxbUcV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3399484',3.8,7060,'en','The Sand','After an all-night graduation beach party, a group of hung-over students wakes up under the blazing sun to find their numbers somewhat depleted. An enormous alien creature has burrowed down deep and anyone foolish enough to make contact with the sand finds themselves at the mercy of a sea of flesh-eating tentacles. Will they ever be able to escape its carnivorous clutches?','/AiahhUWOvxUhH0QAj1hb5NDcWj9.jpg','2015-08-28',84,'Released','This beach is killer.','The Sand',347847,4.0051,4.984,'C4EhbML94Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38073,_binary '\0','/7aiQebqYUHbs2wZPhsTznuMWyeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33996087',5.8,3602,'en','Deathstalker','A powerful swordsman known as Deathstalker recovers a cursed amulet from a corpse-strewn battlefield. Marked by dark magic and hunted by monstrous assassins, he must face the rising evil and break the curse.','/nEI3DnzQC1afAjJOAizx6UX27pL.jpg','2025-10-10',103,'Released','Evil has many names. Adventure has only one...','Deathstalker',1253000,4.1693,5.9,'fAdo8drjc_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38074,_binary '\0','/A5FkracCv0UeQuRPtM0dcXlUzz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt33996113',5,53864,'hi','परम सुंदरी','In Kerala\'s picturesque backwaters, a North Indian and South Indian find unexpected love. Their cultural differences spark a hilarious and chaotic romance, full of twists and turns.','/uLPUsH3Fwe6mAU7n6WpMSDLdYCm.jpg','2025-08-29',136,'Released',NULL,'Param Sundari',1226354,1.5039,5.5,'fdWnfzsx-ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38075,_binary '\0','/nAMr4EqkjLXhYLuMs7f9ey4T3jf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3399896',5.3,6465,'en','Terminus','Following a near-fatal accident, David Chamberlain makes an unprecedented discovery that will not only determine the fate of his family, but of mankind.','/5c3ZPc4alC1Z7jK95Of8bkAjbu5.jpg','2015-01-30',94,'Released','The End Begins Here','Terminus',301729,1.6113,5.1,'XObwDThidmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38076,_binary '\0','/zyoHNsjDWdSk1gsWHkihntOkIEb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3399916',6.3,5551,'mi','The Dead Lands','Hongi, a Maori chieftain’s teenage son, must avenge his father’s murder in order to bring peace and honour to the souls of his loved ones after his tribe is slaughtered through an act of treachery. Vastly outnumbered by a band of villains led by Wirepa, Hongi’s only hope is to pass through the feared and forbidden “Dead Lands” and forge an uneasy alliance with a mysterious warrior, a ruthless fighter who has ruled the area for years.','/wdlRuuA2CtS0KtaVzAikZxVHRIk.jpg','2014-09-04',108,'Released',NULL,'The Dead Lands',283322,2.4864,6.1,'HaXxVKEtlIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38077,_binary '\0','/gvr8BISgEUnIWOwa8cedqf2vXMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34000241',8.3,3139,'hi','Mannu Kya? Karegga','In a campus filled with music, masti, and first love, Mannu\'s biggest exam is not just finding Jiya\'s heart but also his own purpose.','/pMUYfdV8iwwO84e5iZ7Y2GILzsQ.jpg','2025-09-12',141,'Released',NULL,'Mannu Kya? Karegga',1545576,0.9659,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38078,_binary '\0','/6mL5nKky03SQAAySCXl2pXBag8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3401748',6.5,3512,'en','Oddball','An eccentric chicken farmer, with the help of his granddaughter, trains his mischievous dog Oddball to protect a penguin sanctuary from fox attacks in an attempt to reunite his family and save their seaside town.','/8DoiFnHXzZhkyNyGw6s7DGpaauA.jpg','2015-09-17',95,'Released','Every underdog has his day.','Oddball',356905,2.6991,6.9,'P7AV2ZYlxvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38079,_binary '\0','/c0EGdtTBeYt6qAMQF49icl8l6fx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3401882',5.6,49296,'en','Fist Fight','When one school teacher gets the other fired, he is challenged to an after-school fight.','/huRhv4IZDk2ds0DIDkI6uxdmb6J.jpg','2017-02-16',91,'Released','After school. Parking lot. It\'s on.','Fist Fight',345922,6.9465,6,'6YVBj2o_3mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38080,_binary '\0','/hnhAvBOzbGCsOvTN934hPilm6CW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3401962',7.5,1289,'zh','狗十三','A 13-year-old girl deals with the issues brought about by her family\'s high-priced son.','/oT2Qc0re4F7cWhh5L9Z2ZDMII51.jpg','2018-12-07',119,'Released',NULL,'Einstein and Einstein',284593,1.2058,7.19,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38081,_binary '\0','/tW8H0Bn1vptVAS2SZASmkkl2K5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3402110',6.8,3006,'ko','타짜: 신의 손','Dae-gil has been skilled with his hands and has shown a strong desire for winning ever since he was a child. He will succeed his uncle and jump into the world of Tazza, risking his life in competition.','/lx5HsMSE8A6bPy3Vuaj5O0rGk2S.jpg','2014-09-03',147,'Released','The game is on.','Tazza: The Hidden Card',290865,4.5115,6.9,'o6qYB5ZmlEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.