rtying, and eventually realizing that he\'s in way over his head.','/kPfNAax3PbHj5pAYiO9mc9jDvzt.jpg','2018-07-26',107,'Released','One summer can change everything.','Hot Summer Nights',347866,5.613,6.6,'O5ROSS9ReUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38111,_binary '\0','/u6WxsS44PVxbJPJw2QXvsU40yzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3416670',5.8,2372,'en','The Independent','It\'s the final weeks of the most consequential presidential election in history. America is poised to elect either its first female president or its first viable independent candidate. Reporting history as it\'s made, an idealistic young journalist teams up with her idol, legendary journalist Nick Booker, to uncover a conspiracy that places the fate of the election, and the country, in their hands.','/jhlc1nsD8nnnGymEFaZ0twMH6M6.jpg','2022-11-02',108,'Released','Follow the lies. Find the truth.','The Independent',878183,4.5042,6.5,'88Dur9p1Yqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38112,_binary '\0','/utjThRtcnsj0GrDwNudjGdfmHfq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3416742',7.6,215776,'en','What We Do in the Shadows','Vampire housemates try to cope with the complexities of modern life and show a newly turned hipster some of the perks of being undead.','/a2rD3i3DBMeYbA34rBv6z3B9S3a.jpg','2014-06-19',86,'Released','Some interviews with some vampires.','What We Do in the Shadows',246741,7.4961,7.542,'IAZEWtyhpes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38113,_binary '\0','/jfesUBA5dUxlPw2E1M7fCahTHG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3416744',7.2,35065,'en','The End of the Tour','The story of the five-day interview between Rolling Stone reporter David Lipsky and acclaimed novelist David Foster Wallace, which took place right after the 1996 publication of Wallace\'s groundbreaking epic novel, \'Infinite Jest.\'','/3fEuVd8Xorwtk5kFVvyiNlOtcIw.jpg','2015-07-31',106,'Released','Imagine the greatest conversation you\'ve ever had.','The End of the Tour',2496