partment in Madrid and her only link to reality is the little sister she lost her youth raising. But one day, a reckless young neighbor, Carlos, falls down the stairwell and drags himself to their door. Someone has entered the shrew\'s nest... perhaps he\'ll never leave.','/7rgorbW4vCzZZHW5sEEczSjNqza.jpg','2014-09-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Shrew\'s Nest',284305,1.5472,6.9,'mSCO95qb4Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38118,_binary '\0','/jGAonbmaDrNlztfZjJqy14MKlaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3417854',4.9,6011,'en','Pocket Listing','A satirical thriller about L.A.\'s real estate roller coaster. Double crosses, adultery, murder, mistaken identity, and revenge ensues when a mysterious power player and his sultry wife hire a disgraced Los Angeles property broker to discreetly market and sell their Malibu villa.','/bnfGQD0ku046ueGDvF5PIkwrd23.jpg','2016-03-23',92,'Released','Rise. Ruin. Revenge. Real Estate.','Pocket Listing',346558,2.3374,6.5,'nncnJ9VHVmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38119,_binary '\0','/vqd8IPPOxOgWbh8LSZWe0OT4eU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3418604',7.7,1877,'id','Tenggelamnya Kapal Van Der Wijck','When a young man leaves home to fulfill the wishes of his late father, he meets and falls in love with a woman from a very different background.','/hyhCQa5COyRAOWz8joDgNcSUeQN.jpg','2013-12-19',163,'Released','What is the meaning of this life if you have erased my name from your heart?','The Sinking of Van Der Wijck',257194,1.4198,7.7,'e1c-wAT0b6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38120,_binary '\0','/fem2Q5hHroXEYsGWHOC7VMpj1cK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34190272',6.8,1593,'es','Enemigos','Chimo turns 18 years and comes from a humble and supportive family. Since childhood he was bullied and even today, while working multiple jobs and dreaming of starting his own business, he continues to face his bully: El Rubio. When Chimo has the opportunity for revenge, he never imagines what begins as an act of retaliation could turn into an unexpected friendship that\'ll change both their lives.','/dDdMirKIR693XxYc0k2NT3hwroj.jpg','2025-05-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Enemigos',1285406,1.5013,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38121,_binary '\0','/z80ZFwffj4l0yxeVxVr2Jk5mLst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3419894',6.6,2813,'ko','신의 한 수','A professional GO player gathers a team to help him carry out his revenge against the man who killed his brother.','/nCVLj5INdZtNHzbJAblU1eg3CNA.jpg','2014-07-03',118,'Released','War on the board.','The Divine Move',281298,3.0345,6.716,'kcR9fJh0LCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38122,_binary '\0','/3HhdWAOm11StKCjFEOQHJOm0M9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3420108',5.9,1866,'nl','Gooische Vrouwen 2','When Claire returns from Burkina Faso, she is totally transformed and her girlfriends barely recognize her. Cheryl discovers Martin is cheating on her yet again and for her, this time it\'s the last straw: she files for divorce. Anouk, also unhappy with her love life, threatens to develop an eating disorder. Roelien, however, accepts Evert\'s wedding proposal. Then, a fatal and thoroughly bizarre accident transports the girlfriends to the snowy mountaintops of Austria...','/oOqhEVUN1wFB5BWR0tOWVBpt9Cm.jpg','2014-12-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Gooische Vrouwen 2',294098,0.865,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38123,_binary '\0','/uoc358GH6Yl7TufbUKHkETPu64B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3420504',6.9,113761,'en','Finch','On a post-apocalyptic Earth, a robot, built to protect the life of his dying creator\'s beloved dog, learns about life, love, friendship, and what it means to be human.','/eEJtzD1F05xDipFEDY98CTH5yZn.jpg','2021-11-04',116,'Released','Take an unforgettable journey.','Finch',522402,6.9553,7.819,'-0bYWnP3jH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38124,_binary '\0','/amFxtFCoR48ECStYbsTqS15d0Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34207924',5,1794,'fr','Other','Alice returns home after her mother\'s death to find the house unchanged-and haunted by a dark presence. As fear builds, buried trauma resurfaces, and a terrifying truth is revealed.','/fo4Ew0RjP0FkFscmXbyJLGachOY.jpg','2025-07-09',95,'Released','You are beautiful.','Other',1314452,3.3001,5.558,'wtdTLWCDs2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38125,_binary '\0','/xzoLOeDF1n3oANNvtIfBZu8ZVAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3420850',5.7,1861,'tr','Bu İşte Bir Yalnızlık Var','A retired guitarist avoids suffering his mid-life crisis by spending time with her daughter and teaching kids how to play the guitar. Yet it\'s only until he makes a new girlfriend that he finally comes up with a solution to his crisis.','/rL7fm3A3m43piaGrQk4RYvMQqEk.jpg','2013-03-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Bu İşte Bir Yalnızlık Var',269596,2.0513,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38126,_binary '\0','/el4t1Pr911O6u6wjwOjKnxNTrSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3421514',6,9883,'fr','Supercondriaque','Romain Faubert is a 39 year old, single, medical photographer... and a raging hypochondriac. His doctor and only friend Dr. Dimitri Zvenka thinks he knows the cure for Romain: dating! But with the arrival of freedom fighter Anton Miroslav, everyone might get more then they bargained for...','/3J84HvgThJyBSqNaAiX9EuiIGwx.jpg','2014-02-26',107,'Released',NULL,'Superchondriac',248507,3.3535,5.5,'hHqNQkzU7cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38127,_binary '\0','/bALW6bJuN1VW2xRsx49Hy7JIejG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3422078',7.3,9131,'fr','Avril et le monde truqué','It\'s 1941, but France is trapped in the 19th Century, governed by steam and Napoleon V. Avril, a teenage girl, goes in search of her missing scientist parents.','/cenqAhHFJRGf08L8rgvHTlFrLuL.jpg','2015-11-04',106,'Released',NULL,'April and the Extraordinary World',340357,3.7199,7.1,'TAFNUhxQKeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38128,_binary '\0','/fQwgPxUH10FpM0o0wSQ6k5GeuyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3422094',7.4,2138,'es','La delgada línea amarilla','Five men are hired to paint the yellow line the road between two villages in Mexico forgotten. Aboard an old pickup truck, initiated the work of more than two hundred kilometers of asphalt and yellow paint to be completed in less than a fortnight','/bjcegq38wYxrQuCCmZWHfUfdem.jpg','2015-03-06',95,'Released',NULL,'The Thin Yellow Line',268854,2.4919,8.496,'K_NMyRjL8dM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38129,_binary '\0','/ojF11ogvdL7L2OhcaBOdOV8trVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3422462',4.5,1535,'hi','बैंगिस्‍तान','Two blundering terrorists with lofty ideologies, but ordinary talent, on a mission to change the world.','/zvZ4NHTmkpXuGD33HnvpFNvqNBs.jpg','2015-08-07',135,'Released','Two Aspiring Terrorists. One Identical Plan. No Damn Clue!','Bangistan',352099,1.0408,5.714,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38130,_binary '\0','/8hzQZktto5Je6anxWFB1oweIi46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3424690',4.8,4402,'en','Havenhurst','A troubled young woman takes up residence in a gothic apartment building where she must confront a terrifying evil.','/1Q9IqznNP8fgwvdWXwvNhNP5qK5.jpg','2016-08-22',80,'Released','Evil Lives Here','Havenhurst',403368,1.7209,5.1,'BVZNcwiOtuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38131,_binary '\0','/41zx3Tf5IusAWOv27wLDwN201gX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34247440',7.4,2011,'tr','Bir Cumhuriyet Şarkısı','During the Turkish artistic revolution of the 1930s, a group of pioneers staged Özsoy Opera, the first opera in the history of Turkish Republic.','/vY928WNocPnPOUzRtPx0fVmGIC2.jpg','2024-10-23',129,'Released',NULL,'Chords of Change',1277254,0.9706,5.8,'xC5zEa4VKhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38132,_binary '\0','/ickUXG5jIuBmjgiLIjseX8nlm6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34250044',6.3,1910,'en','Peter Hujar\'s Day','A recently discovered conversation between photographer Peter Hujar and his friend Linda Rosenkrantz in 1974 reveals a glimpse into New York City’s downtown art scene and the personal struggles and epiphanies that define an artist’s life.','/awq1O9RRi6JW74fDmGXJJGD5le8.jpg','2025-11-07',76,'Released',NULL,'Peter Hujar\'s Day',1159539,3.8573,5.6,'Rzp8uw-t-eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38133,_binary '\0','/YBSeCMORtdET4PV1gIJdfPAcHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3425034',6.5,3332,'it','Allacciate le cinture','Elena and Antonio seem not to be made for each other. They are too different in terms of character, life choices, worldview, and the way they relate to others. They are total opposites. However, they are overwhelmed by a mutual attraction they\'re trying hard to avoid; but to which they succumb to.','/8yDZUKQQLZQEPw1wRXS2ZNEsHqG.jpg','2014-03-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Fasten Your Seatbelts',258322,1.7703,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38134,_binary '\0','/gPY4KgNiQPhySIP6ysjPJOMhQCb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3426262',7.9,2436,'ta','பண்ணையாரும் பத்மினியும்','A kind and respected village landlord acquires a vintage Premier Padmini car from his friend and cherishes it more than anything else. Over time, the entire village grows attached to the car, forming an emotional bond with it. His wife, however, refuses to ride in it until he learns to drive, so he decides to surprise her with a ride on their wedding anniversary. But before he can fulfill his promise, the car is taken away due to unforeseen circumstances. Will they ever get it back? A deeply emotional tale of love, nostalgia, and the heartfelt connection between an elderly couple and their cherished car.','/ttmmm9CwXX137XcdSZV1X8VLIQO.jpg','2014-02-07',147,'Released',NULL,'Pannaiyarum Padminiyum',251636,1.2264,7.238,'zLxb7QBDGkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38135,_binary '\0','/6OnDSJThAbF6GxXNXNmcusGjBDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3427252',5.9,54753,'en','The Boogeyman','Still reeling from the tragic death of their mother, a teenage girl and her younger sister find themselves plagued by a sadistic presence in their house and struggle to get their grieving father to pay attention before it’s too late.','/pYwZdnXVnVxAr7dx4MEK7tTK9gI.jpg','2023-05-31',99,'Released','It\'s not real. It\'s not real. It\'s not real.','The Boogeyman',532408,13.1033,6.4,'DVUB1SeBXho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38136,_binary '\0','/hXc9jZuIfJ3lCrKJsZVwJM4anRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34276058',5.6,18381,'en','The Family Plan 2','Now that Dan\'s assassin days are behind him, all he wants for Christmas is quality time with his kids. But when he learns his daughter has her own plans, he books a family trip to London—putting them all in the crosshairs of an unexpected enemy.','/semFxuYx6HcrkZzslgAkBqfJvZk.jpg','2025-11-11',106,'Released','Deck the halls, dodge the bad guys.','The Family Plan 2',1363123,18.161,6.575,'dqolYtJGuf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38137,_binary '\0','/eM3sBpa0iqcmFxAhnmcTYXJ5zEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34280353',7.6,2556,'en','Music Box: Yacht Rock: A DOCKumentary','This documentary chronicles the rise, fall, and rise again of the soft rock epitomized by artists such as Christopher Cross, Michael McDonald, Kenny Loggins, Steely Dan, and Toto in the late 1970s and early 1980s. Retroactively dubbed \"Yacht Rock,\" the easy-listening genre came to be gently mocked and even dismissed by rock lovers and critics. However, it has since reclaimed its place in music history and is celebrated in this groove-infused film.','/ijERUgUNG1SGa3nOdUjthpmn31x.jpg','2024-11-14',95,'Released',NULL,'Music Box: Yacht Rock: A DOCKumentary',1370580,1.8517,6.9,'a55pyQsI3GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38138,_binary '\0','/z8PMsnvYs2t3fmKpK1ZYPMz4QQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34284946',6.4,4320,'ml','ഐ ആം ഗെയിം','A fearless gambler who trusts luck more than life gets caught in a series of crazy and unexpected events that turn his world upside down.','/h1ezPKcMYv5FHbHDuHcZfTbWTY5.jpg','2026-09-03',173,'Released','The Game is On!','I\'m Game',1250502,4.3303,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38139,_binary '\0','/5j8CrEqrFQGRoScB3Ds5pKIAcgn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3430416',6.6,3604,'nl','Schneider vs. Bax','On his birthday, a hitman reluctantly takes on the easy task of killing a writer, only to find the job a lot more difficult than expected.','/9dFuGHEnofYo8TLwmFcyD83qnaV.jpg','2015-05-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Schneider vs. Bax',333555,1.6477,6.176,'RvmTPcL6330','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38140,_binary '\0','/aK3JlVC0gmfLqzQ8WminN3aD1lx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3430548',6.4,2057,'en','Away','A story set in the north English seaside town of Blackpool and centered on two kindred spirits who form an unlikely friendship.','/yJUqPWeenyvAz6nXCdHrCrClbGd.jpg','2016-06-22',110,'Released','Two fractured souls. A million blinding lights.','Away',399220,1.3115,6.2,'7CGCkYKRq2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38141,_binary '\0','/7gw1p0K3AYtIut8MYHO226XYdEA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3431016',5.2,1351,'en','The Messenger','The Messenger is the story of Jack’s last melt down: a story of frustration and guilt, love and betrayal, family and blame. Unwillingly becoming embroiled in the unfinished business of Mark, a journalist brutally murdered in the local park and his television presenter wife, Sarah, to whom he’s desperate to say one last goodbye, Jack finds himself getting closer to Sarah, obsessed with passing on Mark’s message. Discovering hidden secrets and lies finally pushes the fragile Jack over the edge but there is hope when his estranged sister, Emma, gets in touch. Jack starts to remember the past they shared together and as the memories come flooding back, he confronts the truth about the death of his father.','/xMubDsMhzFliqN6Fz6R95exAQiV.jpg','2015-07-16',95,'Released','The dead have come calling.','The Messenger',316246,1.3038,4.9,'SEF2qkljqxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38142,_binary '\0','/pGaTNp5HG6vIWvq1eq50AcuPp7V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3432552',5.2,1622,'en','Goddess of Love','Enter into a baroque vortex of madness when an emotionally unstable woman is shattered after tremendous heartbreak. Brian was the love of Venus’ life and the thought of him having an affair with another woman begins her volatile descent into the dark side of psychosexual insanity.','/5zrBskQtkPzthObgssDuUTG7hcd.jpg','2015-08-31',96,'Released','Be Careful Who You Get Close To','Goddess of Love',347764,1.8464,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38143,_binary '\0','/g2QndaV69ghVJW06QQEUN1gOvy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34328066',6.9,1495,'en','Love Across Time','Chelsea is an American visiting England for work. While inspecting an old estate for its real estate potential, she notices some strange lights in the cellar. She discovers a \"portal\" of sorts that shows her the past (end of 1700s) and the dashing owner of the old estate. When an accident occurs, the gentleman (Charles) comes through and gets stuck in the present day.','/gVE1Dhazla9dEEpTjluVxYcfyJN.jpg','2024-11-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Love Across Time',1385142,1.9723,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38144,_binary '\0','/8sx4DrUZu4pNWiO3gCQ7ZLLkeFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3433074',4.2,5739,'en','Mrs. Brown\'s Boys D\'Movie','When Moore Street market-trader Agnes Brown finds her livelihood under threat from a ruthless developer, she and her family embark on a campaign to save her stall, aided as only the Browns will be by a motley troop of blind trainee Ninjas, an alcoholic solicitor, and a barrister with Tourettes Syndrome.','/xRCgK4l2LUclQYDkjdSmwinwkK5.jpg','2014-06-27',94,'Released',NULL,'Mrs. Brown\'s Boys D\'Movie',262340,2.3543,5.382,'ODn6o4yGUdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38145,_binary '\0','/gUdDeQXgPjjF8tD76C6kpjFVTIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3433358',6.5,2086,'fr','Elle l\'adore','Muriel Bayen, a divorced beautician and mother of two, loves to tell stories. She is a huge fan of this singer Vincent Lacroix, in fact she is a dedicated fan. One day Vincent knock on her door and ask for her help.','/rVBkZ5Crsk4SqN3fvtT4N7wiTOD.jpg','2014-06-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Number One Fan',270919,1.7466,6.1,'opvIfqqVKpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38146,_binary '\0','/EXNPelyKWOSvgkYBbn7WhFN1sa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34335405',6.3,3872,'ml','സൂത്രവാക്യം','The Story revolves around Christo Xavier, a circle inspector, who mentors 11th-class students in his spare time and turns his station into a community place to benefit the kids of the town. As his regular work and tutoring go on, one day he finds a suspicious electronic device from a student’s fair exhibit model.','/gwaOYtU5kdW1eefsvGcV74r8BBE.jpg','2025-07-11',113,'Released',NULL,'Soothravakyam',1399654,0.8832,4.5,'UhffV-U0RyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38147,_binary '\0','/epZEeCqidRtSBCerlsKW4ZeuMeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3433632',6.6,3128,'fr','L\'Affaire SK1','The hunt, capture and trial of Guy Georges, one of France\'s most notorious serial killers.','/w1TKSc5ml15JjlnYtsvM4fAEG8Z.jpg','2015-01-07',120,'Released',NULL,'SK1',307103,1.7715,6.9,'KefO9YIwNYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38148,_binary '\0','/tT4Sj743fIMX7w9D80B1vRG1lit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34338540',7.7,2323,'ar','٦ أيام','Yusef and Alia, former high school sweethearts separated by fate, are brought together years later, forced to confront their past and whether their rekindled love can withstand their changed lives. They must determine if they can navigate the complexities of their new realities to find a second chance at romance.','/eZ4vyiAfZXSyuKygWjmCCcDFd5P.jpg','2025-01-15',105,'Released','WHAT HAVE THE YEARS DONE TO US?','6 Days',1554938,1.2574,8.571,'hSZvUFoCgH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38149,_binary '\0','/nTkQBI8ldvPByIkxsemGxtKlr8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34339725',7.8,5522,'hi','मिर्ज़ापुर - द मूवी','The battle for Mirzapur’s throne intensifies as old enemies resurface and a new threat emerges in the form of Babban Babua, a ruthless businessman from Jaisalmer with ambitions of his own. As the Tripathis face enemies from both the past and present, loyalties are tested while Guddu and Bablu Pandit fight to establish themselves in the power struggle for Mirzapur.','/cdDKdCRyq6BYuNblpKUYqRPWvEg.jpg','2026-09-03',197,'Released','Witness the epic untold story.','Mirzapur: The Movie',1378537,8.5535,6.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38150,_binary '\0','/oWuYNOI1dbZ6bNbev4VxyhCrsGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34344071',7,1458,'en','Ronny Chieng: Love to Hate It','Ronny Chieng unpacks fertility treatment fiascoes, the dark side of men\'s self-help and scam-sensitive parents.','/pGoB87zqMKedBsdaAHYzMq2cE7u.jpg','2024-12-17',65,'Released',NULL,'Ronny Chieng: Love to Hate It',1391354,1.6189,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38151,_binary '\0','/m0rvRn5WG7pIrtVlLe5rSRQjVu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34350086',6.7,8450,'en','Buy Now! The Shopping Conspiracy','This subversive documentary unpacks the tricks brands use to keep their customers consuming — and the real impact they have on our lives and the world.','/n49IHIjqreWrIh6ty0aAxmR6SCs.jpg','2024-11-19',85,'Released',NULL,'Buy Now! The Shopping Conspiracy',1376704,3.2154,6.705,'OVfZw_eqJW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38152,_binary '\0','/xFjk2l1SGgvrMYlFIHGiP7BfvEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34365591',8.5,48843,'kn','ಮಹಾವತಾರ ನರಸಿಂಹ','Tyrannical demon Hiranyakashyap challenges Vishnu, proclaiming himself a god. However, his son Prahlad remains devoted to Vishnu, who appears as Narsimha to defeat the demon.','/uGTF87VyfjtwwqRlT2apQg5YnEp.jpg','2025-07-25',131,'Released','When faith is challenged, HE appears.','Mahavatar Narsimha',1383072,2.7694,7.3,'wkOYEhjAXyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38153,_binary '\0','/pT8LzOjvuF8EpHkk16trnSyA5bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3437608',7.7,1432,'en','Daughters of Mother India','This film examines how the fatal 2012 rape of a medical student has spurred India to start changing attitudes and laws about gender-based violence.','/3Jb2T2iJmlQL9MYxsCIzKjyQ12i.jpg','2015-05-01',45,'Released',NULL,'Daughters of Mother India',404449,0.6318,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38154,_binary '\0','/qRItTUp4SY6zXzWGpqjfmgSDKa9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34376523',7.1,4467,'te','శుభం','Set in the early 2000s, in the pre-internet days of coastal Bheemili, A group of married men band together to find solutions, after their wives get possessed while watching a cable TV soap opera serial.','/hl3jiH0YjLRUZXWY2xqHNNTi1Eg.jpg','2025-05-09',123,'Released',NULL,'Subham',1449364,1.8203,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38155,_binary '\0','/qBO0gOKQRfXNNGV5gWKttBxg9J5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34377012',6.9,2819,'tr','Mukadderat','Having lost her husband, Sultan seeks remarriage to escape her loneliness. Despite her son\'s objections and her daughter\'s criticism that it\'s \"too early,\" she is determined. To survive as a single woman, she breaks social norms, turns her house into a boarding house, opens a stall in the market, and enters male-dominated businesses. Her courageous stance inspires other women in the town and sparks the women\'s struggle for independence.','/yonelGVN7h4HSFC5H99EfzygiZe.jpg','2024-11-28',90,'Released','An Anatolia story.','Fate',1368165,1.0143,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38156,_binary '\0','/dd31qJxOarrHyGZwYsCzOjobQzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34378301',5.7,33188,'en','Tom Clancy\'s Jack Ryan: Ghost War','Jack Ryan is reluctantly pulled back into espionage when an international covert mission unravels a deadly conspiracy. Racing against time, he joins CIA allies Mike November & James Greer and sharp MI6 officer Emma Marlowe to battle a rogue black-ops unit in a high-stakes, deeply personal fight.','/8ehYxUh5MWE41AeE9gkHE8DKzvB.jpg','2026-05-20',107,'Released','No operation stays dark forever.','Tom Clancy\'s Jack Ryan: Ghost War',1380291,33.4516,6.9,'-4ZVFspRn3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38157,_binary '\0','/vO8OAeJQVz6po9Ki6pyo0E9iMx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3437892',7.3,3191,'en','Malibu Crush','Two best friends from Los Angeles embark on a road trip to find a now very successful and famous ex-girlfriend.','/8TszCQUjievKmO0i8eMpXQIQQSz.jpg','2022-07-07',77,'Released',NULL,'Malibu Crush',671821,1.5879,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38158,_binary '\0','/eO5hZJjuQRB675g2j9Y7BqDJrGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34379050',5.8,6270,'en','Night of the Reaper','A college student returns home for the weekend and reluctantly takes a babysitting job after a local babysitter is brutally murdered. When the town’s sheriff receives chilling evidence that the killing wasn’t an isolated incident, a deadly night unfolds as a masked killer sets the stage for another attack.','/aHPDlpoNuECG4bojvZiNaeYSbxJ.jpg','2025-10-30',93,'Released','Nothing is as it seems.','Night of the Reaper',1502943,3.3591,6.4,'yID7jDK0HYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38159,_binary '\0','/eAouIDoMDhLetm6CtmDKIGEaaCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34379051',6.8,2765,'en','By Any Means','In 1960s Mississippi, a young Black FBI agent is forced to partner with a notorious mafia hitman to investigate a wave of brutal civil rights murders.','/f4hdIed8vh10O8TkQ1CkHS8MQ3G.jpg','2026-09-02',107,'Released','The FBI couldn\'t crack it. So they called in the mob.','By Any Means',1380417,26.8414,7.537,'ej8pjisr0Pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38160,_binary '\0','/6AS9zVu3rUs7dj4N2ZNnKjI8YZ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34379307',6.5,7093,'en','Is God Is','Two sisters embark on an epic quest for revenge, confronting a charged family history that pushes them to extraordinary lengths.','/rCYQGHdoz7qwYsb6wXETJfUfDLX.jpg','2026-05-14',100,'Released','Make your daddy dead. Real dead.','Is God Is',1380316,9.1523,5.9,'pgtdkuNFoKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38161,_binary '\0','/6AYl4PU29o2WXUPZzAo56GVQs5r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34381258',6.8,17687,'en','Good Boy','Tommy, a volatile 19-year-old, revels in drugs, parties and violence. After getting separated from his friends on a drunken bender, he is abducted by a shadowy figure. He wakes to find himself imprisoned in the basement of a remote Yorkshire house, inhabited by a very strange family. But what unfolds is not what he could possibly expect.','/eWb841fMkSNly5gfL9J1N0xzVYI.jpg','2026-03-05',110,'Released','Some people only learn the hard way.','Good Boy',1381027,18.6797,7.3,'Qhe6GNgW8uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38162,_binary '\0','/dZpnAkiDfOXheFkvIwDFXEzhjeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34381460',5.8,1808,'zh','96分鐘','Former bomb disposal expert and his fiancée board a high-speed train. Also, a well-known physics teacher who was involved in an affair scandal, also boards the same train in order to win back his wife. At the same time, there\'s a bomb on the train!','/gWKZ1iLhukvLoh8XY2N4tMvRQ2M.jpg','2025-09-05',117,'Released',NULL,'96 Minutes',1271895,4.0406,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38163,_binary '\0','/ytZkViMYPwom22WbVskSBOrmKXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3438252',8.2,1462,'bn','অপুর পাঁচালি','Arko, a film student, invites Subir Banerjee, who played the legendary role of Apu, to attend an award ceremony in Germany. But the old man hesitates to accept the invitation.','/pZzxFGzJF1Bw6bQeBsDPP72gEhH.jpg','2014-04-25',107,'Released',NULL,'Apur Panchali',269561,0.9364,6,'qUlMg1jfN98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38164,_binary '\0','/ejvOMZ3vWAD9IYaFsHbB2Kntn3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34383084',5.9,2399,'ml','പെണ്ണും പൊറാട്ടും','When a woman and her dog face public hostility, a village\'s hidden tensions erupt. A stark examination of mob mentality, social judgment, and how communities can turn cruel when seeking to punish perceived wrongs.','/m9WNMd4pQFOB3l6GudBw2YwVsN9.jpg','2026-02-13',120,'Released',NULL,'Pennum Porattum',1054493,2.0687,5.8,'zT3KNjnBuQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38165,_binary '\0','/dumTOViXdC1B4E7ss2qw9bwa2r2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34383359',6.5,1376,'es','Votemos','At a downtown Madrid building, an ordinary meeting of neighbors commune to vote on a change of elevator. However, the event escalates into a full-blown conflict after the unexpected announcement that a new, mentally ill tenant will rent an apartment.','/rVYEP9R8fBe6sxrqc3gP1cAehYZ.jpg','2025-06-12',88,'Released',NULL,'All in Favor',1380651,2.0176,6.5,'cI2PivEdTes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38166,_binary '\0','/jVeYae744cR2ogx9ShQ3qXOcRiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34383465',5.6,2780,'fi','Yön lapsi','In Finnish forest, Saga and her husband Jon embark on a new chapter as parents. But Saga\'s joy is overshadowed by a chilling suspicion about their newborn, unbeknownst to Jon, causing a rift as she alone grapples with the disturbing truth.','/e9ALgOANOJbcFpw84MbafK3xvD2.jpg','2026-07-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Nightborn',964849,11.951,5.973,'dWePsu_Kd9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38167,_binary '\0','/6BHQS2rofh2kQrktroBH4TGrtXY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3438354',7,10399,'it','Smetto quando voglio','A university researcher is fired because of the cuts to university. To earn a living he decides to produce drugs recruiting his former colleagues, who despite their skills are living at the margins of society.','/zcDqnuSpdRoXuw3kmbMDxLkdgXR.jpg','2014-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'I Can Quit Whenever I Want',250219,1.7837,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38168,_binary '\0','/mrzu45wossOMSMPQ1YbwUpHirb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34383611',8,1406,'hr','Fiume o morte!','Through dramatic reconstruction and documentary asides, the spirit of Italian poet, playwright, journalist, aristocrat and army officer Gabriele D’Annunzio is captured, presenting the nascent fascism in his attempts to forge a new state in the aftermath of the First World War.','/A9CZmSeDJ54agVVvnZ9pqvfHLxX.jpg','2025-02-13',112,'Released',NULL,'Fiume o morte!',1403843,1.4914,8.107,'9WoBtAMbDEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38169,_binary '\0','/zPJlbTENntLjFP8LfkdZlomqNlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34385018',5.8,2239,'en','Jamie Foxx: What Had Happened Was...','Oscar- and Golden Globe-winning actor. Grammy-winning singer. Beloved comedian. Jamie Foxx returns to the stage to set the record straight.','/4KzwXRpiUA765QTDynsfdbQsqGN.jpg','2024-12-10',69,'Released',NULL,'Jamie Foxx: What Had Happened Was...',1353311,1.9086,6.5,'EF1QdY1knqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38170,_binary '\0','/hpBGCnzOvdtQoMyE48gvwp2y5yx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34385135',6.5,15356,'ko','군체','Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.','/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg','2026-05-21',123,'Released','Survive the hive.','Colony',1375646,220.6362,8.055,'LW6dpj1uCK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.00