e to physically change and become violent. A small group of survivors plans to vacate the city by heading to the coast.','/hiugiMqQKiWf8qlbb7iKgnka1T6.jpg','2014-09-16',82,'Released','The City of Angels Has Gone to Hell','Disaster L.A.: The Last Zombie Apocalypse Begins Here',298538,1.7129,5.4,'sZk-94Hoj0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38175,_binary '\0','/20ncMtoy9Cxy6OQxgXZemHoFymz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3440298',6.3,33305,'en','Descendants','A present-day idyllic kingdom where the benevolent teenage son of King Adam and Queen Belle offers a chance of redemption for the troublemaking offspring of Disney\'s classic villains: Cruella De Vil (Carlos), Maleficent (Mal), the Evil Queen (Evie) and Jafar (Jay).','/65DkgHPSLVjgr6IYkpY9Aqqqid5.jpg','2015-07-31',112,'Released','They\'re not bad. They\'re just born that way.','Descendants',277217,11.7802,7.182,'t4UUQqefajc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38176,_binary '\0','/nIh7npgLTsZyBl7TQpibZsz4hQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3442006',6.4,40386,'en','Cake','After having visions of a member of her support group who killed herself, a woman who also suffers with chronic pain seeks out the widower of the suicide.','/5GJEZovjtKisJxNMG6fBTCxNzZi.jpg','2014-09-07',102,'Released','Forgiveness is a bitter pill to swallow.','Cake',284276,5.2237,6.3,'ZktUjO9Xles','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38177,_binary '\0','/hJ1F3jZ8n08iwyzfvl4qdVTAsod.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34424694',8.4,3527,'pa','Dama Dum Mast Kalandar','Follows two friends navigating the pressures and comic complications of building stability abroad while struggling with the emotional pull of home and belonging.','/f3QLgWdla4VV4Me1bwhYTgvEHTO.jpg','2026-05-22',149,'Released',NULL,'Dama Dum Mast Kalandar',1744543,1.1724,0,'R4FU8eiMjLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38178,_binary '\0','/81nc96XgmsGUKbQneWMMgY06KrL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3442990',5.9,9509,'en','Lila & Eve','Lila, a grief-stricken mother reeling from her son’s murder, attends a support group where she meets Eve, who urges her to take matters into her own hands to track down her son’s killers.','/zGY41KlplvdPcUT0OeTu04ZPHke.jpg','2015-07-31',94,'Released','Torn by loss. Bound for revenge.','Lila & Eve',309581,3.0617,6.16,'ogfry3rFHDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38179,_binary '\0','/8ECv9LSLwRnisxoTAmCZBBl8E6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34433451',6.4,3558,'tr','Lefter: Bir Ordinaryüs Hikayesi','A football prodigy rises to fame, battling prejudice and inner turmoil on his quest for greatness. Based on the life of Turkish legend, Lefter.','/yKy6RsLEC7lloTcHPETgbaAQApq.jpg','2025-11-13',126,'Released',NULL,'Lefter: The Story of the Ordinarius',1386792,2.5584,7,'GmoXIOkteRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38180,_binary '\0','/rtv6da2U8poERiAZSAbCOePXzql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34434461',4.7,3150,'es','Dímelo bajito','Kamila has everything under control: studies, social life, her image... Everything except the unexpected return of her neighbors, the Di Bianco brothers, after seven years of absence. Thiago stole her first kiss, and Taylor was her best friend, but now their return will turn Kami\'s world upside down. Can the three overcome the past that binds them? Or will everything explode into pieces once again?','/6Z37lW0JfLdeFcgH9yaTyg6B9A6.jpg','2025-12-11',119,'Released',NULL,'Tell Me Softly',1379963,13.1409,6.311,'maaZ6St22b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38181,_binary '\0','/aY8QYqpeIvNVbl4fDCyZ5YFrxEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3444184',4.9,1957,'cn','賭城風雲','Retired gambling legend Ken returns to Macau, only to be drawn back into action when his daughter becomes entangled in a global mafia scheme. Using his unmatched skills, he must stop a dangerous plot and protect his loved ones.','/74qkCZDttfLifRAMOKwpFXPuXKr.jpg','2014-01-30',94,'Releas