/1',413576,1.1323,5.1,'btkT1LFZ1IU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38190,_binary '\0','/dgqBcgTzaUiSLvKJPDF9AbdFEMO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34459219',5.6,4864,'en','The Breadwinner','After his wife Katie lands a once-in-a-lifetime deal on Shark Tank that takes her on a prolonged business trip - lifelong breadwinner Nate Wilcox now has to fend for his family as a first-time stay-at-home dad.','/4apG9Xk6HQvV48JKEjSUeiebju7.jpg','2026-05-29',100,'Released','One dad. Three kids. Zero clue.','The Breadwinner',1440050,19.0516,7.11,'19PLc6hpTvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38191,_binary '\0','/4xN3phAX024b251CPhy8zvsXbBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34463310',6,1988,'zh','唐探1900','In 1900, the mysterious murder of a white woman and a Native American man in San Francisco\'s Chinatown triggers a race against time as the Chinese suspect and the Native American\'s adopted Chinese son work to uncover the truth while a politician seeks to leverage the Chinese Exclusion Bill as well as the prevailing xenophobia and racism to close down Chinatown and elect himself as the mayor.','/g3GsgIlH3fA4RxhNOAMvSbVWyfW.jpg','2025-01-29',135,'Released',NULL,'Detective Chinatown 1900',1357305,4.96,6.2,'7M9uRxxBkU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38192,_binary '\0','/lpHXhXKAp0127rvaxnpgZjXJmoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34464177',5.4,3196,'kn','Behind The Scenes','Behind The Scenes is a Kannada anthology film that tells five distinct stories, each directed by a different filmmaker: Prajwal MRs Baanigondu Elle Ellide, Sai Shrinidhis Coffee, Cigarettes and Lines, Kuldeep Cariappa NMs Hero, Rajesh N Shankadhs Blockbuster, and Apoorva S Bharadwajs SuMoha. Together, these narratives explore the deep influence of cinema on the lives of both creators and viewers, showing the sacrifices, dreams, and challenges filmmakers, actors, and crew members endure.','/rabqgyRcfbwGeh4wwhvtXmkJCud.jpg','2024-11-08',150,'Released',NULL,'Behind The Scenes',1381864,0.6784,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38193,_binary '\0','/agEhJpgOj6IQ1WwYJCBGnZvKs1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3446426',7.6,1869,'mr','Timepass','When Cupid strikes the very first time it sees no class or caste barrier. And though the path to reunite with a loved one seems arduous and almost impossible, it\'s this love which makes a person do good things. Love doesn\'t remain a Time Pass anymore.','/w2IaW55uiJNQTjsdoJU82Uk0Mn.jpg','2014-01-03',143,'Released',NULL,'Timepass',249677,0.9714,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38194,_binary '\0','/dgVpAJJxUXDz0Pw3MrNwaLRWfBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34466483',5.7,1514,'zh','惊天大营救','A veteran Muay Thai expert goes on a take-no-prisoners mission of revenge after his wife and daughter are brutally murdered by mysterious forces.','/nML8rOI4GOiiEsXgknuhZeUF8M7.jpg','2024-12-05',111,'Released',NULL,'Striking Rescue',1382406,6.2976,7.468,'uXfzJb-IUrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38195,_binary '\0','/vpuPY4UziUCxv7gYYoaZQ3LX7to.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34471850',5.2,4423,'en','Protector','Nikki\'s life is shattered when her daughter is kidnapped. Thrust into the criminal underworld while hunted by cops and military, she must fight to rescue her child.','/icOZpnGuH9YrEaW3wrw5GJaXGih.jpg','2026-02-20',90,'Released','Never get between a mother and her child.','Protector',1383731,13.9845,8.379,'IRKGIuL3728','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38196,_binary '\0','/hjHz3Nttria4DglKilLiVjS3exz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3447364',7.6,25852,'hi','डिटेक्टिव ब्योमकेश बक्शी!','Byomkesh, fresh out of college, agrees to investigate the disappearance of Bhuvan, a chemist. Assisted by Bhuvan\'s son Ajit, Byomkesh links the case to a larger conspiracy that will unsettle Calcutta.','/7IvuZioWIvj8UAIWJhGtLsqwwt.jpg','2015-04-02',139,'Released','1943 Calcutta... a war... a mystery... and a detective...','Detective Byomkesh Bakshy!',320295,1.7524,6.8,'ZG--GOpi_0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38197,_binary '\0','/jG52tsazn04F1fe8hPZfVv7ICKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3447590',7,33864,'en','Roald Dahl\'s Matilda the Musical','An extraordinary young girl discovers her superpower and summons the remarkable courage, against all odds, to help others change their stories, whilst also taking charge of her own destiny. Standing up for what\'s right, she\'s met with miraculous results.','/ga8R3OiOMMgSvZ4cOj8x7prUNYZ.jpg','2022-11-25',117,'Released','Meet the exception to the rules.','Roald Dahl\'s Matilda the Musical',668482,8.0702,6.8,'X5BTt0x4Bpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38198,_binary '\0','/qlfqDJ9Piv5ufzYA8j2319mwKZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34477910',5.4,2753,'en','Descendants: Wicked Wonderland','Now that the Queen of Hearts is nice and Cinderella is safe, things seem perfect for Red and Chloe… But little do they know that changing the past created a new villain — Maddox Hatter. When Maddox captures the Queen of Hearts, Red and Chloe must work alongside Red’s new sister Pink, Luisa Madrigal’s son Luis, and Maddox’s son Max to save her and Wonderland.','/xdhLAADGSse8KCrsDLBuM5b68Cg.jpg','2026-07-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Descendants: Wicked Wonderland',1318621,19.8166,7.5,'0Gg7x3xBqBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38199,_binary '\0','/8xL7Es2jwbBr7U2PPxXY7hJfd0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34479177',6,1685,'te','త్రిబాణధారి బర్బరీక్','Tribanadhari Barbarik (2025) tells the epic tale of Barbarik, grandson of Bhima, who rises in the modern age with his three invincible arrows to fight for the oppressed. Awakened in a world torn apart by greed and war, he is bound by his eternal oath to always stand with the weaker side. As ancient evils resurface and humanity faces its darkest hour, Barbarik must decide whether his power will save the world or lead it into eternal destruction.','/kROWntI6dunaPfN27lCu0NzyVNV.jpg','2025-08-29',129,'Released',NULL,'Tribanadhari Barbarik',1534964,1.3024,0,'pyp652xtEQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38200,_binary '\0','/bIDM2sMsOaCpKGB3EKLTTgH8kOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3448226',6,7655,'en','Rampage: Capital Punishment','A man takes over a TV station and holds a number of hostages as a political platform to awaken humanity, instead of money.','/pd5OlT9fHCnlsFnIcCbJTDZsJvE.jpg','2014-07-19',93,'Released','Land of the Free. Home of the Insane.','Rampage: Capital Punishment',250388,3.4761,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38201,_binary '\0','/ebuk1hNUHZ37oxwEx6rEpcCpqvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3449006',5.3,2964,'en','Found Footage 3D','A group of filmmakers sets out to make the first 3D found footage horror movie, but find themselves IN the first 3D found footage horror movie when the evil entity from their film escapes into their behind-the-scenes footage.','/w4TWtzylcZ86W9tUhzLzT5ccOsq.jpg','2016-08-29',101,'Released','A New Dimension in Terror','Found Footage 3D',353419,1.6359,5.4,'QtvXl26hJvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38202,_binary '\0','/jgySLjw9ZDKbnGf0VlhlHT7iHSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34490115',6.2,1275,'ko','히든페이스','Su-yeon, a cellist in an orchestra led by her fiancé and conductor Sung-jin, disappears one day, leaving behind only a video recording. Sung-jin is devasted over the loss of Su-yeon, but feels a strong attraction to Mi-ju, a cellist who fills in for his fiancée. Then one rainy night, Sung-jin and Mi-ju get swept away by their mutual desires for each other and commit an unforgivable act at Su-yeon\'s house.','/8H6pQ0g9MeWrJ9kZHREVkwLN8Pv.jpg','2024-11-20',113,'Released','Secrets revealed, fouled desire.','Hidden Face',936245,6.7187,5.2,'ILc5IVKqszY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38203,_binary '\0','/4BSwmhvoS9BOn6wz88gUp4GLVSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.0000