mans led by a ruthless Colonel. After the apes suffer unimaginable losses, Caesar wrestles with his darker instincts and begins his own mythic quest to avenge his kind. As the journey finally brings them face to face, Caesar and the Colonel are pitted against each other in an epic battle that will determine the fate of both their species and the future of the planet.','/3vYhLLxrTtZLysXtIWktmd57Snv.jpg','2017-07-11',140,'Released','For freedom. For family. For the planet.','War for the Planet of the Apes',281338,20.6668,7.225,'1TxqmlIv1Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38215,_binary '\0','/gcUOGVBi9iAJXqbEwoqkkuUsdCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3451230',6.3,10951,'en','High Strung','When a hip hop violinist busking in the New York subway encounters a classical dancer on scholarship at the Manhattan Conservatory of the Arts, sparks fly. With the help of a hip hop dance crew they must find a common ground while preparing for a competition that could change their lives forever.','/xfj4Vomg8h3I1hBHj4GfpduUfkv.jpg','2016-04-08',96,'Released','See the music. Hear the dance.','High Strung',382399,5.0432,7.036,'JctCSR1hSsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38216,_binary '\0','/ly3Chdp0iVFFdHBweyoSU0dXofr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3451498',6.1,1380,'ru','Быстрее, чем кролики','Three friends awake after a stormy party in a totally unfamiliar place in the company of strangers and try to understand how they got here, who are these people and what really happened on the eve of ...','/o6PqX5nAQeJFX9f6vponHYqBvMu.jpg','2014-01-01',99,'Released','After the party ends, the real confusion begins.','Faster Than Rabbits',253192,0.9617,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38217,_binary '\0','/yy9OMBYzBWznDZgu7xcmEmwY2HX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3451720',6.6,3150,'fr','Francofonia','Master filmmaker Alexander Sokurov (Russian Ark) transforms a portrait of the world-renowned museum into a magisterial, centuries-spanning reflection on the relation between art, culture and power.','/saCFbjXLlypGlX5UngU3iLbthGs.jpg','2015-11-11',87,'Released','An elegy for Europe','Francofonia',296449,1.6486,6.5,'yGF7vZALBQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38218,_binary '\0','/sMk4NhZ05imD02gM26is4kVgIVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3451984',4.6,1321,'en','Another Time','Eric, the top investment manager at his firm, is assigned to help Julia, the stunning owner of a recently acquired company. He falls for her, and realizes he has to go back in time to meet her before she becomes engaged.','/ahttmwx5ItzNa0jqLYl7iK7OXfD.jpg','2018-04-24',89,'Released','Reinvent the wold of love.','Another Time',337426,1.9769,5.5,'NDF188RnzG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38219,_binary '\0','/cjxZm3TH1gMSNAtGbzILxRUm0rp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34521433',3.9,1483,'ml','ജമീലൻ്റെ പൂവൻ കോഴി','Shanawas, a flirtatious taxi driver in Fort Kochi, faces a life-changing moment when his mother, Jamila, arrives unexpectedly.','/i72VEcbygZC2c33DFOvePspH6q.jpg','2024-11-08',122,'Released',NULL,'Jameelante Poovan Kozhi',1421134,0.829,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38220,_binary '\0','/3zUc5KC2qQAqyeuFT9XrX1mJtlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34525338',6.5,1328,'ar','الهوى سلطان','Sara and Ali have been close friends since childhood, and together, they face many different situations and problems with their friends and families, but some changes suddenly occur in their relationship.','/9u0k29SPyrrBotJEKBYuQ3h446W.jpg','2024-11-06',120,'Released','Do you think with your mind or your heart.. What is the problem if you think with both..!','El Hawa Sultan',1282417,1.0603,6.273,'ZI1kzTXiQnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38221,_binary '\0','/aUkG7cGpQUsjw7XD1dYmTLSwd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3452948',6.6,1669,'sv','Nånting måste gå sönder','A gritty story taking place in Stockholm, about the passionate love between the self-abusive Sebastian who wants to be a woman, and the easy-going Andreas who is certainly not gay.','/6xQjWEhJ2f1Ba3HjaI3uzQM9iZn.jpg','2014-03-28',84,'Released','I\'ve Never Loved a Boy Like You Before...','Something Must Break',249638,2.1166,6.2,'dvUUJZZ7WKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38222,_binary '\0','/ijOrGUZDu8FeXizcYAvOUf6RvUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3453052',5.7,2610,'en','10 Days in a Madhouse','Nellie Bly, a 23 year-old reporter for Joseph Pulitzer, goes undercover in the notorious Blackwell\'s Island women\'s insane asylum in order to expose corruption, abuse and murder.','/iTvJ5tc6Os90JXza9XfDktYlAOj.jpg','2015-11-20',111,'Released',NULL,'10 Days in a Madhouse',345003,1.9702,4.4,'5P3Tz3tLX90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38223,_binary '\0','/hvpr2cVsDOhUGXae1z070ap4QsQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3454424',6.4,2076,'en','Where Is Anne Frank','The film follows the journey of Kitty, the imaginary friend to whom Anne Frank dedicated her diary. A fiery teenager, Kitty wakes up in the near future in Anne Frank\'s house in Amsterdam and embarks on a journey to find Anne, who she believes is still alive, in today\'s Europe. While the young girl is shocked by the modern world, she also comes across Anne\'s legacy.','/ueIfY5LqYNBG1WVnkrZTdJq3TWc.jpg','2021-12-08',99,'Released',NULL,'Where Is Anne Frank',426242,4.2065,6.6,'Q8GXnnwqthY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38224,_binary '\0','/h8CkWlbjJ1FZIJhz5BNwyVbKhHb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3454574',6.4,3812,'en','Extraordinary Tales','Five tales by Edgar Allan Poe come to life thanks to a pictorical style animation, five tales that exude madness, pestilence, murder and torture.','/mGETWBPMDHgpdFVsJf8cYGsPWnz.jpg','2015-06-25',73,'Released',NULL,'Extraordinary Tales',329020,1.8632,6.54,'amniFA0UEKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38225,_binary '\0','/sTNzZZdIm7csFdgnvP20XmSJRTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34548722',7.5,5735,'id','Sore: Istri Dari Masa Depan','A young man living alone in Croatia encounters a woman who claims to be his wife from the future, sent on a mission to help him correct his bad habits and improve his lifestyle.','/rpqkqiqv1nl9MbdnOLKLbqqkJSj.jpg','2025-07-10',119,'Released','She came from the future with one mission: to give him a better life','Sore: A Wife from the Future',1385536,3.7229,7.4,'HiVzpboRpR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38226,_binary '\0','/tXTo0gbmH2pUzF2DNNMXcUBtqqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3455204',6.7,2166,'ja','名探偵コナン 異次元の狙撃手','A rash of sniper attacks leaves the streets of Tokyo empty and the public terrified to go outside. It’s up to Conan and his friends to find the culprit, but the case goes deeper than it seems. Military cover-ups, conspiracies and murder abound in this fast-paced, thrilling mystery!','/d08RKnmdcoCwlHOezazli8hmJH6.jpg','2014-04-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: Dimensional Sniper',257512,4.7595,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38227,_binary '\0','/cLjb7E4I1pL99KLquqdjxTUrCnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3455224',8.1,12862,'en','Virunga','Virunga in the Democratic Republic of the Congo is Africa’s oldest national park, a UNESCO world heritage site, and a contested ground among insurgencies seeking to topple the government that see untold profits in the land. Among this ongoing power struggle, Virunga also happens to be the last natural habitat for the critically endangered mountain gorilla. The only thing standing in the way of the forces closing in around the gorillas: a handful of passionate park rangers and journalists fighting to secure the park’s borders and expose the corruption of its enemies. Filled with shocking footage, and anchored by the surprisingly deep and gentle characters of the gorillas themselves, Virunga is a galvanizing call to action around an ongoing political and environmental crisis in the Congo.','/7ULqkiqpxWfQxNHRq5PeZjJQ3f6.jpg','2014-11-07',100,'Released','Conservation is war','Virunga',263614,1.9726,7.913,'PUFCtFtV3mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38228,_binary '\0','/u5NIwBWWO1qJkqjozt70TaS1O0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3455740',5.8,1538,'en','Set Fire to the Stars','An aspiring poet in 1950s New York has his ordered world shaken when he embarks on a week-long retreat to save his hell raising hero, Dylan Thomas.','/g4fKHifPZHUydrrySxhtyOvhy5L.jpg','2014-11-07',97,'Released','Never Meet Your Heroes','Set Fire to the Stars',277847,1.9959,5.6,'YEDVxZx8yk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38229,_binary '\0','/kj4Q9NHNLvdFx0PlfBSxo0mpmCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3455822',8,3742,'en','Night Will Fall','When Allied forces liberated the Nazi concentration camps in 1944-45, their terrible discoveries were recorded by army and newsreel cameramen, revealing for the first time the full horror of what had happened. Making use of British, Soviet and American footage, the Ministry of Information’s Sidney Bernstein (later founder of Granada Television) aimed to create a documentary that would provide lasting, undeniable evidence of the Nazis’ unspeakable crimes. He commissioned a wealth of British talent, including editor Stewart McAllister, writer and future cabinet minister Richard Crossman – and, as treatment advisor, his friend Alfred Hitchcock. Yet, despite initial support from the British and US Governments, the film was shelved, and only now, 70 years on, has it been restored and completed by Imperial War Museums under its original title \"German Concentration Camps Factual Survey\".','/lEsfJbN5BBw1wlqCvzxuBLGwitt.jpg','2014-06-07',75,'Released',NULL,'Night Will Fall',290802,2.7035,7.6,'fyNDfWK5ySs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38230,_binary '\0','/jzBWExXacS33rMQ2zLBrqIVweyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34564059',4.1,17829,'en','The Runner','Maia Marten, a brilliant London lawyer, has her life shattered by a single call on her morning run: her son has been taken. To get him back, she must keep running, obey every ruthless command, and trust no one-each second a test of how far a mother will go to save her child.','/uxCaBoYXsDC4A0SqTm3SISj0OwK.jpg','2026-09-03',86,'Released','One hour. One chance to save her son.','The Runner',1386315,90.1126,6.802,'zz4rsZLcauY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38231,_binary '\0','/7H4A5vZdVAN8fhwvb7G0Iren4rq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3457508',5.3,3490,'en','Damascus Cover','A spy navigates the precarious terrain of love and survival during an undercover mission in Syria.','/fstGX2lMtdPvDbrfg58MqB7kNzP.jpg','2017-10-23',93,'Released',NULL,'Damascus Cover',324538,2.424,5.5,'JIQNsPiv4Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38232,_binary '\0','/b4pL7cgFrFec47XaoERS56CU3fg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3457734',5.6,1684,'en','Fort Tilden','Twenty-something Brooklynites Allie and Harper are directionless, privileged, and just a tiny bit damaged. All they want is to get to the beach, where a drug-fueled afternoon with cute boys awaits them. Alas, the journey becomes needlessly complicated, as the girls’ bike ride from Williamsburg to Fort Tilden Beach is littered with a barrage of unfriendly circumstances and the realization that their life skills are more limited than they should be.','/fhm3SFtrcyzA1rGT00OnOeZ4WDF.jpg','2014-03-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Fort Tilden',253255,1.0883,5.6,'B5SL2-AZ2aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38233,_binary '\0','/9DZPzEnHXjc3Kexaynj9J6iqF3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34581826',4.8,3114,'en','Coyotes','Trapped in their Hollywood Hills home, a family fights for survival when caught between a raging wildfire and a pack of savage coyotes.','/fSzs9ZXYcrln0FRrjGIPCjuB6En.jpg','2025-10-02',91,'Released','Eat the rich.','Coyotes',1386827,3.5992,5.4,'DENZQmZZ1ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38234,_binary '\0','/kpjp9Wqj6U4wdv4oSEe9FLkNhaQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3458254',4.6,11407,'en','Patient Zero','After an unprecedented global pandemic has turned the majority of humankind into violent infected beings, Morgan, a man gifted with the ability to speak the infected\'s new language, leads the last survivors on a hunt for patient zero and a cure.','/5jOqatpfh0aKYhl6fN83RK69UtC.jpg','2018-09-14',87,'Released',NULL,'Patient Zero',295011,4.6648,5.274,'W9uddyaqAPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38235,_binary '\0','/kMrkqfjuPR4FlfaScrNNYuOEGHa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34584846',5.2,1369,'en','Man of War','When an aid worker vanishes in the first hours of war in Ukraine, a former Navy SEAL and CIA operative crosses into the shattered country to bring her home-facing mercenaries, shifting battle lines, and ghosts he thought he left behind.','/vt0RqHlqfUzeiBEVQvp43yY2076.jpg','2026-07-03',111,'Released',NULL,'Man of War',1705729,5.0962,6.6,'q0_t2HOsDsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38236,_binary '\0','/o8kdF2dZNzjEzuVZfgaSLUSVqNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3458510',5.2,8191,'en','Dude','Four best friends negotiate loss and major life changes during the last two weeks of high school.','/mtQyt1Tx3ppR18BZRUCQQ9VUPZW.jpg','2018-04-20',90,'Released','Growing up. Moving on. Lighting up.','Dude',399131,3.1913,5.526,'eIBQaDlR0tA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38237,_binary '\0','/a5p1OaLxqa9xCKxkq4IxENVuz9T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3458760',4.7,1663,'en','The Lucky Man','Traveling Route 66, a charismatic preacher, Reverend Johnny Jones, and his seductively beautiful Latina girlfriend, Rebecca, find their lives spiraling out of control as they travel from small town to small town; running their scam on the churches they encounter along the mother road. He\'s able to convince people he has the power to heal their illnesses and solve their most dreadful life experiences. But what the couple think is their scam begs the question does he really have the power? It\'s a question that haunts him and only intensifies his inner demons. Scarred for life, his childhood abuse from his evil father won\'t soon go away. He finds temporary refuge at the bottom of each bottle of tequila and endless grams of cocaine that goes up his nose. His childhood demons will not subside, neither will his vices. In the end, his powers serve as a blessing and a curse. Hang on tight while we follow this perilous couple\'s journey into the abyss of miracles and tragedy.','/3KTOtAiAM8XI3UMlVIeFBxGztvt.jpg','2018-01-16',98,'Released','When an evil childhood, cocaine addiction, and miracles collide, Rev. Johnny Jones is faced with being a man of the cloth, or a man on the run.','The Lucky Man',413138,1.3233,5.5,'oezhjbvNHXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38238,_binary '\0','/ue3u8mkMgvK28dOq1cexjl6kKVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3460152',6.3,1709,'es','Matar a un hombre','Jorge is a peaceful hard-working man who seeks a simple, quiet life for himself and his family. One day, he is mugged and humiliated by a gang of thugs led by Kalule, a delinquent from his neighborhood. This event infuriates his son as much for Jorge’s meek acceptance as for the act itself. The son, looking for retribution, ends up getting himself shot. Kalule is sent to jail and when he gets out 18 months later, begins a campaign of terror against Jorge and his family. The authorities do nothing, so Jorge decides to take matters into his own hands.','/pbXsjomsAYm15bQkBO6apKwMjNq.jpg','2014-10-01',82,'Released','Revenge is sour','To Kill a Man',250374,1.1915,6.1,'rBZJ5bQQLHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38239,_binary '\0','/7g1zO5t0bd27Iqn5ZUDJmksOGPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3460252',7.8,731063,'en','The Hateful Eight','Bounty hunters seek shelter from a raging blizzard and get caught up in a plot of betrayal and deception.','/jIywvdPjia2t3eKYbjVTcwBQlG8.jpg','2015-12-25',188,'Released','No one comes up here without a damn good reason.','The Hateful Eight',273248,22.9246,7.756,'GRG7fAPksbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38240,_binary '\0','/fQM7j8bLf4v9pFdNvR0tltLNhB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34604827',5,11031,'ta','ஃபையர்','A physiotherapist mysteriously disappears, triggering a police investigation. As officers question those connected to him, secrets unravel, and shocking truths come to light. Did he vanish, or was he murdered?','/4Nf52vNlQNJpSt2uFodMCdz99Dy.jpg','2025-02-14',132,'Released',NULL,'Fire',1398942,0.9886,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38241,_binary '\0','/heDGQR4sq9tNqTrlYahuxASqFly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34605805',5.6,1847,'tr','39 Derecede Aşk','Fatih and Kumru, a lawyer from different cities, team up for a case involving a cheating spouse. They spend 8 hours racing around Izmir gathering evidence, unexpectedly altering their plans and lives.','/b8nL536SEMBRcoHs5fipgO7991m.jpg','2024-12-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Love in 39 Degrees',1387198,2.5231,7,'pBmPCUeGy6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38242,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3460922',5.2,1398,'en','Sympathy, Said the Shark','During a storm, a young couple reluctantly lets their estranged friend inside. He\'s soaked, bloodied, and insisting that someone is trying to kill him.?The night is soon sent off the rails, as all three must confront dark secrets in the face of a powerful threat that comes knocking.? The story is told with innovative camera work, shifting from the explicit first person POVs of each main character.',NULL,'2015-02-18',86,'Released',NULL,'Sympathy, Said the Shark',376006,0.7231,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38243,_binary '\0','/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34610311',7,14449,'zh','捕风追影','Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.','/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg','2025-08-16',142,'Released','He\'s training a new generation of law enforcers for a dangerous mission to save the world from ruthless criminals.','The Shadow\'s Edge',1419406,72.509,8.293,'dDuzTlur3NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38244,_binary '\0','/z1hekwU7a7FUP6XvqDwJjxAbrXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34611082',5.8,36858,'en','Ladies First','An arrogant but charismatic ladies\' man finds his life of money, power and casual flings upended when he wakes up in a parallel world dominated by women.','/kjR56Yv17pbjTVBTMjqepvcus4f.jpg','2026-05-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Ladies First',1368881,9.9304,6,'yeetI2DfbaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38245,_binary '\0','/eGPSl6OL0c1oTBpHQxtbPhO2mPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3461252',8,31367,'ar','الفيل الأزرق','After a five-year hiatus, psychiatrist Yehia returns to work at Abbasiya Hospital. He’s assigned to evaluate a patient who turns out to be his old friend. As events unfold, Yehia uncovers dark secrets that challenge his understanding of reality.','/lPirLy8UKj2V6SyaWC8zXm5xeUS.jpg','2014-07-28',151,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Elephant',289510,2.648,7.1,'RIKclQFKFso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38246,_binary '\0','/97wDWUo4pWvl2B6ABSr2gr0hxWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3461828',4.3,1559,'en','Cat Run 2','A couple of fumbling best friends run a private detective agency and find themselves solving their next case in New Orleans, becoming embroiled in a web of sexy female spies and government conspiracy in the lively and character-filled backdrops of the Big Easy','/4GzDcNWovT05iKrSAPNGlRGuoQk.jpg','2014-08-19',97,'Released','The chase is on!','Cat Run 2',273621,1.7734,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38247,_binary '\0','/ciaJwWmeO4XY45IkGzwCcCYD0jN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3462002',6.8,3005,'en','Finders Keepers','In this documentary, recovering addict and amputee John Wood finds himself in a stranger-than-fiction battle to reclaim his mummified leg from Southern entrepreneur Shannon Whisnant, who found it in a grill he bought at an auction and believes it therefore to be his rightful property.','/4lp1NBwRd1zmxspN1MQUvS4qPE3.jpg','2015-06-22',82,'Released','One man\'s leg is another man\'s treasure.','Finders Keepers',319152,1.317,6.5,'wvR3lE6p1nI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38248,_binary '\0','/uV8p4b1L2MbhuwFxbHFpa0v4ISx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34621709',6.7,4327,'en','Sukhibhavaa','Two orphans marry and raise their son with love until the mother dies in an accident. The father leaves him at a hostel. The boy searches for his parents, learning about love along the way, but it eludes him. He seeks his first love.','/uOr78ZpuKCtosNf6VL78mKIf6Y9.jpg','2026-02-06',126,'Released',NULL,'Sukhibhavaa',1694108,1.3321,0,'zxXriLafHEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38249,_binary '\0','/MBtttM5Rc7VT3ceJXp2cv8DxV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34621892',6.9,5861,'it','FolleMente','On a first date in Rome, the inner voices of recently separated Piero and furniture restorer Lara speak aloud, exposing the true thoughts and anxieties hidden behind their conversation.','/j0FOPkEflJN0nnyCvjENWZ116Mq.jpg','2025-02-20',97,'Released','What are we hiding in our thoughts?','Somebody to Love',1312157,3.7457,7.1,'Tv6NzJZeKsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38250,_binary '\0','/rQXIm9oICpHCBpuHSJ3SwthBQYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34622232',5.3,3273,'en','F Valentine\'s Day','Gina hates her Valentine\'s Day birthday and travels to Greece to prevent her boyfriend\'s proposal. With help from vacationers Johnny and his sister Mickey, she schemes to delay it – while questioning her relationship.','/8zPExowfpfZOTpS1W4J7G27lH4H.jpg','2026-02-12',95,'Released',NULL,'F Valentine\'s Day',1429605,6.7847,6,'qHxAYI_YMb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38251,_binary '\0','/p60aQoBtOk5l6VwFgrji7atrCiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34623304',8.7,2184,'te','Drinker Sai','Heartbroken and spiraling into alcoholism, a jilted lover desperately pursues his former muse, unwilling to accept their relationship\'s end.','/t7hKwM0txUagQvtU0ZcJg7lRokX.jpg','2024-12-27',148,'Released',NULL,'Drinker Sai',1407473,1.8506,0,'cWQflkvQ3fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38252,_binary '\0','/ytMZEOxqslK1xSncIB6g5W0TGJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34623382',6.3,2221,'hi','ना जाने कौन आ गया','A love triangle. From Kaushal\'s breaking world to Tina\'s silent emotional conflict and Veer\'s transparent and blunt love, three hearts navigate guilt, longing, and impossible choices.','/jTQDTVXjmL071PzJbjlVr27YZu2.jpg','2026-03-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Na Jaane Kaun Aa Gaya',1633765,1.1328,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38253,_binary '\0','/fAKGXzLlFI4dnWNC3ZAu6wLYoSK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3462696',2.8,2992,'en','Tekken 2: Kazuya\'s Revenge','A young man, Kazuya Mishima, wakes up alone in an unfamiliar hotel room without any recollection of who he is or how he got there. He is tormented by flashes of his past and by the face of an ominous stranger. The next thing he knows, Kazuya is ambushed and kidnapped by an underground crime organization and, soon after, turned into a ruthless assassin. During a mission to assassinate a man named Brian Fury, Kazuya finds that his target harbors clues to his true identity. With the help of Fury and a female assassin, Kazuya follows the clues, leading him to the lab of his reoccurring flashbacks. Here, he will finally confront his past and the ominous man of his nightmares - Heihachi Mishima, face the ultimate betrayal, and learn the truth about who, and what, he really is.','/5e3b7xHJhpzl1p49JclT03VQVgU.jpg','2014-08-21',90,'Released','Survival Is No Game','Tekken 2: Kazuya\'s Revenge',286548,3.6151,3.9,'wS-xGuTYoe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38254,_binary '\0','/9Sd3RuIbnFCA4SX8CiBsp4x1XPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3462710',5.2,18283,'en','Unforgettable','Barely coping with the end of her marriage, Tessa Connover learns that her ex-husband, David, is now happily engaged to Julia. Trying to settle into her new life after moving in with David, Julia believes she has finally met the man of her dreams, the man who can help her forget her troubled past. Soon, Tessa\'s jealousy starts to consume her, and she will stop at nothing to turn Julia\'s paradise into the ultimate nightmare.','/jKyjJu3N0bcF9TzcyGLb0Nn6Uqq.jpg','2017-03-06',100,'Released','When love ends, madness begins.','Unforgettable',418437,3.5643,5.9,'iFXIBL617yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38255,_binary '\0','/slCqWqN1gtgOHDvQMZwsKJLCLoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3463106',5.6,10434,'en','The Cured','What happens when the undead return to life? In a world ravaged for years by a virus that turns the infected into zombie-like cannibals, a cure is at last found and the wrenching process of reintegrating the survivors back into society begins.','/qheJcFjQ3hAMroE8y6FpCg6jNeN.jpg','2017-11-24',95,'Released','The cure is just the beginning.','The Cured',469721,3.9724,5.507,'fSutgzDY_I4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38256,_binary '\0','/j5KuDZbVKZalltOuLMJMlFGiI8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3463178',6.8,2003,'fa','مریم مقدّس','In the year 16 BCE, the people of Jerusalem are awaiting the birth of the son of Imran. Instead of the much-anticipated \"Messiah\", a girl is born to Imran and Anna. The latter names her ...','/m6gIBrCqzNHGPwkaEET87UK9fh5.jpg','2001-07-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Saint Mary',321637,0.953,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38257,_binary '\0','/i3FuO7aSoVRoS63if3aetJYJJjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3463938',4.1,5254,'en','Haunting of the Queen Mary','When photographers Erin and Patrick are brought aboard the ship with their young son Lukas, they unleash a series of events that entwines their family with the ship’s dark past. As the terror unfolds around them they begin to realise there is more to this sumptuous ocean liner than meets the eye: its remarkable legacy masking violent secrets.','/y8uEuy1NhOwltHePRqvxcDDUJg1.jpg','2023-07-21',125,'Released','Evil has a new vessel.','Haunting of the Queen Mary',977013,3.7117,5.3,'JJg9K716auA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38258,_binary '\0','/iPDwl7QmVNqpTL4JHsENELuqRhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3464018',7,1278,'en','Patterns of Evidence: The Exodus','A debate rages over the credibility of the Bible. Most archaeologists today have concluded that there\'s no evidence that the Exodus of Israelite slaves from Egypt ever happened. Filmmaker Timothy Mahoney faces a crisis of faith: \"Is this foundation event of the Bible really just a myth?\" He embarks on a 12-year journey around the world to search for answers. The Exodus unlocks the mystery of this ancient saga, combining a scientific investigation with a retelling of the Exodus story to reveal an amazing pattern of evidence matching the biblical account that may challenge our understanding of history.','/w0IJ5ssLmxGObPAE0e0QFXkob24.jpg','2015-01-19',115,'Released','Patterns of Evidence is an engaging, visually pleasing and fascinating piece of filmmaking whatever one believes.','Patterns of Evidence: The Exodus',309882,1.3129,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38259,_binary '\0','/s48CvFbWoWHhSPgz2wW9Rffw04q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3464902',7.1,338113,'en','The Lobster','In a dystopian near future, single people, according to the laws of The City, are taken to The Hotel, where they are obliged to find a romantic partner in forty-five days or are transformed into animals and sent off into The Woods.','/7Y9ILV1unpW9mLpGcqyGQU72LUy.jpg','2015-10-15',119,'Released','An unconventional love story...','The Lobster',254320,13.9445,7.021,'LTNZmOJxuAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38260,_binary '\0','/sTuw5ARn1a795wtb63IFNxOddc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3465026',4.4,1581,'en','Palm Swings','After moving to Palm Springs, a young married couple puts their love to the test when they discover that their neighbors are swingers.','/e65F1qDaThjdmthr94SwrA4McaA.jpg','2017-10-03',95,'Released','Do you play?','Palm Swings',462181,4.8954,5.9,'VMItk3VEWHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38261,_binary '\0','/tBHI2KrVnsXzk4NJyg7Rg75rF75.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3465074',4.9,3745,'en','88','A young woman comes to in a roadside diner with no idea where she is or how she got there. Split between two timelines, she gets taken on a violent journey as she seeks out the person responsible for her lover\'s death.','/kbCZDINnj4rHhoZZUeXTsviYUkl.jpg','2015-08-05',88,'Released','There are two sides to every story.','88',307479,2.739,5.067,'Yz4oPXL5KRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38262,_binary '\0','/pEFHDd5NmaRcynE4rNAfynYjiiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3465456',5.3,1934,'zh','白发魔女传之明月天国','In the twilight of the Ming Dynasty, the Imperial court is plagued by corruption as tyrants rule the land. With the Manchurians preying on a weakened empire, war is imminent. To save the victims from suffering, sorceress Jade Raksha fights the soldiers that oppress people for their own gain. As payback, local officials pin the murder of Governor Zhuo Zhonglian on Jade, turning her and the members of her cult into wanted fugitives for a crime they didn\'t commit.','/2fzybbRNycYYqujAtLKHsf9UUmn.jpg','2014-02-14',104,'Released',NULL,'The White Haired Witch of Lunar Kingdom',257648,3.713,6.4,'k_T85qAkcQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38263,_binary '\0','/jfhQmWuJ5NGYoGiTNswGi09JEKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3465916',7.4,4777,'de','Kreuzweg','Maria finds herself caught between two worlds. At school this 14-year-old girl has all the typical teenage interests, but when she’s at home with her family she follows the teachings of the Society of St. Paul and their traditionalist interpretation of Catholicism. Everything that Maria thinks and does must be examined before God. And since the Lord is a strict shepherd, she lives in constant fear of committing some misconduct...','/gJgvoCG1GtGibgjg8ABBIVExZ0F.jpg','2014-03-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Stations of the Cross',254721,1.5461,7.011,'DeHiT4e4LZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38264,_binary '\0','/bEaTcjzuyBggKzGM3x4Jvo06TZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3465996',6.7,2199,'ta','வாயை மூடி பேசவும்','A mysterious illness declared as dumb flu spreads in a quaint hill station forcing the town\'s residents from speaking. Will the problems in the place increase due to this or will it lead to better communication?','/yMT4jyvnhvl1ZxN3g9hV0uXV5r9.jpg','2014-04-25',140,'Released',NULL,'Vaayai Moodi Pesavum',263494,1.2346,6.156,'FlWfeqhEyZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38265,_binary '\0','/bXtkVDYcwyg9II0cHk6zhtzZGc3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3467412',5.8,22518,'en','Extinction','And suddenly, overnight, the world came to a halt. Two men, two survivors, one kid, and hatred that separates them. A place forgotten by everyone, including the creatures that inhabit the Earth... until now.','/zwIDreu9pYCqKpv4jomqVM9yX1e.jpg','2015-08-07',110,'Released','When the undead can evolve, no one is safe.','Extinction',338676,5.7385,6.3,'fzcAoKQ_h_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38266,_binary '\0','/A2py1vRFhY9bNWZYFgR5QiOq4jG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3467914',6.4,1556,'en','Tommy\'s Honour','In 1866 St Andrews, Scotland, 15-year-old Tommy Morris is an avid golfer like his legendary and pioneering father, Tom Morris, now greenskeeper for The Royal and Ancient Golf Club of St Andrews, as well as the town\'s club- and ball-maker. The two-time winner of the first major golf tournament, The Open Championship, which he founded in 1860, Old Tom also established golf\'s standard of 18 holes per round. But young Tommy is beginning to chafe at his father\'s dictates, especially in the rapidly changing world they live in. Tommy soon outshines his father, winning The Open three consecutive times.','/4lb8ZVowimnyZ1N4OFWWJxjoJb8.jpg','2017-07-07',117,'Released','The pride of a father. The love of a wife. The soul of a rebel. The heart of a champion.','Tommy\'s Honour',399217,2.0264,6.5,'UgdRDee1Ssw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38267,_binary '\0','/qQ9i4mO2GrUFR3gLWjf8J6s3Wf3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34682248',4.1,29657,'pt','Baila, Vini','Vini Jr. has it all: talent, resilience and boldness. Follow his dancing, unpredictable feet on his inspiring journey to becoming a global soccer star.','/4ImGMcwpy4k2zmcXBSFYNK6kRr9.jpg','2025-05-15',106,'Released',NULL,'Vini Jr.',1390394,2.839,6,'Qy2I4liKGiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38268,_binary '\0','/dSSj6p3sUvc997V5zPJjfrVyFt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3468380',5.6,5711,'en','Which Brings Me to You','Two romantic burnouts, Jane and Will, are immediately drawn to each other at a mutual friend’s wedding. After a disastrous hookup in the coatroom, the two spend the next 24 hours together, trading candid confessions of messy histories and heartbreak, on the off chance that this fling might be the real thing.','/gspoAZ5p7G7D83OU9UFOmKICejw.jpg','2023-12-08',98,'Released','24 hours can change your life.','Which Brings Me to You',975043,5.2142,6.273,'9rpPaOBxDqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38269,_binary '\0','/sb76azrAXr9U13uEQxNP5e3fujY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34685692',6.3,34520,'en','Over Your Dead Body','A dysfunctional couple head to a remote cabin to \"reconnect\", but each has secret intentions to kill the other.','/kZCauMzAt9eMAhLMopCqnFw1Q5k.jpg','2026-03-14',105,'Released','Breakups are all in the execution.','Over Your Dead Body',1390300,19.4221,6.433,'pGxKTIegUZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38270,_binary '\0','/9GBiwvuJahvlfEQtuGhpS384Ei5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34688195',5.7,2180,'fr','Coutures','An American filmmaker faces challenges and self-discovery as she arrives in Paris for Fashion Week on a life-and-death journey.','/pie2ouNdXYKEMXtF2Kvj0H4LzOr.jpg','2026-02-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Couture',1390382,7.66,6.261,'lSw01dbUFXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38271,_binary '\0','/ftRkFtAGuHngHnLiOxktq0aCVMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469046',6.3,186145,'en','Despicable Me 3','Gru and his wife Lucy must stop former \'80s child star Balthazar Bratt from achieving world domination.','/e72KCMHNkbZ6USRJmABeqwmaJ5n.jpg','2017-06-15',90,'Released','Oh brother.','Despicable Me 3',324852,20.5694,6.468,'6DBi41reeF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38272,_binary '\0','/j5FNYFaSXmD3T0WAYDAvguEPVOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34691776',5.8,4083,'tr','Metruk Adam','After serving time in prison for his brother\'s crime, a man warily reunites with family, finding hope and healing in a life-changing bond with his niece.','/9jrhldzLHXia0uieyqK8UJ8PNAG.jpg','2025-08-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Abandoned Man',1495723,5.0546,7.319,'NU-H2KWTcx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38273,_binary '\0','/hyTS695IKdbZi49qcDLORSbXZcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469244',6,10503,'hi','फैंटम','Daniyal, whose journey to seek justice takes him from India to Europe, America and the volatile Middle East. However, he finds out that in a mission like this, there is always a price to pay, in this case, a very personal price.','/en6nlTMR7ZUqLvzZhEEDQU5IJxC.jpg','2015-08-28',136,'Released','A Story You Wish Were True','Phantom',353879,3.239,5.573,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38274,_binary '\0','/bM45I7MS07NPGNi5OFdNJAO6BS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469592',6.4,4772,'zh','黄飞鸿之英雄有梦','In 1868 during the late Qing Dynasty, rampant corruption on the Imperial Court inflicts much suffering in people\'s lives. For years, the Black Tiger’s fearsome boss Lei Gong has been trying to get rid of the leader of the Northern Sea. One of his latest recruits is Fei, a fearless fighter who takes the Northern Sea leader’s head after a fierce fight. Just as Lei Gong believes he has total control of the port, a new gang called the Orphans rises in power. Led by Fei’s childhood friend Huo, the Orphans are out to eliminate all the criminal power from the port…','/rQLhQytqw27NHUlmrArOIs4yQl.jpg','2014-11-20',131,'Released',NULL,'Rise of the Legend',294993,4.9892,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38275,_binary '\0','/jSxVqmHofYPXcJGt4CA28vtkc9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469798',5.9,8942,'es','Órbita 9','Helena, a young woman on a deep space mission, has been alone for 20 years. Her parents abandoned ship after a technical malfunction made it impossible for all three of them to reach their intended destination. Alex, an isolated engineer, is about to enter her life and turn her world upside down.','/1EbdFbUbY2K8MJbNAIGnZ7gGrRs.jpg','2017-04-07',95,'Released','Love will set you free','Orbiter 9',437311,3.5816,5.803,'zktLwAfuqog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38276,_binary '\0','/6qpPqn33a3XrsnOds4wKNinsIu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469910',6.7,10413,'zh','白日焰火','Two former cops start investigating the series of murders that tanked their careers when the killings begin again.','/3vVcDI8r2KOcsBFwu6Kyx6ntmqp.jpg','2014-06-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Black Coal, Thin Ice',255756,2.2595,6.516,'WXm1XcjP13E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38277,_binary '\0','/lv39Kkus0pLLn68tmSVnSX4Tw72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469918',7.2,1517,'de','Jack','Ten-year-old Jack has to take care of his little brother, six-year-old Manuel, every day from the time he gets up to the time he goes to bed. When Manuel suffers an accident, their lives change forever.','/4cLb755niFIB55tXlQKjaBwnEPQ.jpg','2014-10-09',99,'Released',NULL,'Jack',254323,2.2221,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38278,_binary '\0','/htzkep52UKS8o52sBqzPwlPdtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3469964',7.2,1824,'zh','推拿','The employees of a massage parlour share a close bond with each other as they all share a trait in common, they are all visually impaired.','/kLCtjuQiZqlWINKloqebWftRJY4.jpg','2014-02-17',114,'Released',NULL,'Blind Massage',256106,3.0519,7,'Tbzblq3b1Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38279,_binary '\0','/ctUt397YPPr7CeN4xijFXj9TREO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34705112',4.1,3063,'en','Busboys','A pair of idiot friends believe that if they become waiters, all of their problems will be solved. They aren\'t entirely wrong, but they aren\'t entirely right.','/z7aBU98usPaaFymldN6IcYRsHZr.jpg','2026-04-17',93,'Released','Some messes can\'t be cleaned up.','Busboys',1391074,3.8872,4.6,'SEVbq2DvsEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38280,_binary '\0','/z9ft5HYHzWcasR6SGcgeluxTznB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3470600',7.1,216881,'en','Sing','A koala named Buster recruits his best friend to help him drum up business for his theater by hosting a singing competition.','/rwopfpHqPCYBSgBuZwkaXXqHp14.jpg','2016-11-23',108,'Released','Auditions begin.','Sing',335797,18.2961,7.1,'GIgXWuLQPFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38281,_binary '\0','/gldjslzSiKJePvyJAgJ7cYK4XeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34706535',5.2,1294,'en','Reckless','A former convict on parole must outwit the police to get his share of an old heist.','/76jjEatL53KYooIrDQK9wsk4rm1.jpg','2026-02-07',91,'Released','Love, bullets and bad decisions.','Reckless',1449400,4.6288,6.4,'ykrxpIiiOQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38282,_binary '\0','/aFLlJ16Iq439taolf0VR88Dbe39.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3470928',6.2,1770,'pl','Kamienie na szaniec','To be defeated and not be - a victory. This is the motto that life is guided by three young friends: Alek, Sophy and Rudy. Scouts, high school graduates high school in Warsaw drifting ambitious plans for the future broken through September 1939. Entering adulthood in a very dramatic times, which puts them a choice - to survive at any cost, or to join the fighting for a free homeland, risking everything. The boys brought up in patriotic homes, shaped by the ideals of scouting, they decide to fight. They become soldiers, and although every scrape with death, they can live a full life.','/lQ06u4MiQx3EIN4T6S3M8CeeRSD.jpg','2014-03-07',111,'Released','Friendship. Courage. Freedom.','Stones for the Rampart',283389,1.4616,6.7,'xdF4xDe0eWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38283,_binary '\0','/nV2nQc3Y5h4zi3w3FMZOJAvpVOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3471098',6.2,19535,'en','Maggie\'s Plan','Maggie\'s plan to have a baby on her own with a sperm donor is derailed when she falls in love with John, an older married professor, destroying his volatile marriage to the brilliant and impossible Georgette. But three years later, married to John with one daughter, Maggie is out of love and in a quandary: what do you do when you suspect your man and his ex-wife are actually perfect for each other?','/irz7aLl87kGnwzdHoYs4iObLdFa.jpg','2016-04-27',99,'Released',NULL,'Maggie\'s Plan',312669,4.6349,5.7,'nAoEoWrOe8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38284,_binary '\0','/2mSG2hsJFUOYXRP0GqLJNXrAi3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34724163',3.9,2207,'en','Annihilator Unleashed','A reclusive ex-cartel enforcer is drawn back into bloodshed when he saves a singer from murder, leading to a confrontation with a vengeful crime lord seeking revenge against him.','/ve58p2OiWvTd8fO8AEIMmSI38jE.jpg','2026-01-06',119,'Released','His Past Wasn\'t Buried, It Was Waiting!','Annihilator Unleashed',1597017,1.6929,6.5,'JUU1V2GSpJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38285,_binary '\0','/gOtL2dsaU7EDS5ouVqwhXgOXw8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3472714',3.8,2055,'en','At Granny\'s House','A typical Midwest house. A sweet little old lady. When a caretaker moves in to help out, Granny\'s House becomes a macabre place of death - and love.','/vc100r8oc85XPWox3xK88aQfhyG.jpg','2015-05-30',83,'Released','Love hurts.','At Granny\'s House',379050,1.6655,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38286,_binary '\0','/ltSVhKIFVZuu8SMf23YG61ykVa8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3472892',4.9,3943,'tr','Sağ Salim 2: Sil Baştan','Salim decides to take the coffin of a deserted body to his hometown. But this journey turns into an adventure where Salih and his travel buddy Nihal fight against serial killers and bad guys. When Nihal\'s mom is taken hostage for revenge, things take an unplanned turn. Now they\'re wanted as serial killers and have to wear disguise to not get caught.','/495lDj8Cne3uJzYi9ojcaW1m9H7.jpg','2014-01-10',98,'Released','Salim decides to transport the coffin of a deserted body. But things don’t go as planned.','All Good 2 Back To Square One',271910,1.564,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38287,_binary '\0','/4vetbabOgDQzpitnAkEVRiZP4P5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3473654',7.1,15311,'en','Toy Story That Time Forgot','During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It\'s all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie\'s room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.','/kVOaFo8RaYQceHfTqbZGmV9R80q.jpg','2014-12-02',22,'Released','The battle for all toy kind.','Toy Story That Time Forgot',256835,7.2722,7.1,'1nJ7oRal3ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38288,_binary '\0','/1bAE9YexmEfAanXKaO1d9Ms4qKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3474600',7.6,4138,'ja','リトル・フォレスト 夏・秋','Fleeing heartbreak in the big city, Ichiko returns to Komori, her rural hometown. She battles summer\'s rain and humidity, bakes her own bread, grows hothouse tomatoes and tills the fields. During autumn, the time for pickling and preserving fish and sweet potatoes, Ichiko begins reaping rice and recalls her departure five years before.','/qDcoxRjv1bH29Hy8iTyOW1UnW9y.jpg','2014-08-30',111,'Released','Live off the land and recharge.','Little Forest: Summer/Autumn',294682,3.2807,7.774,'y1HGFawBgwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38289,_binary '\0','/3jxT6hCi5eDBseucDRo5c04qWCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3474602',7.6,3390,'ja','リトル・フォレスト 冬・春','Ichiko bakes a cake for an end-of-year party with her friends. In the depths of winter, making mochi and curry keeps the people of Komori warm. Later, spring brings thoughts of her absent mother as well as rice planting and sakura, and she begins to think of leaving Komori behind again.','/9T2DUtp2yUJnG0go0lIF9tTd8kG.jpg','2015-01-28',120,'Released','Farm cook eat to live.','Little Forest: Winter/Spring',336026,2.2155,7.818,'o1PFT10WEKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38290,_binary '\0','/r53UDpxpjNTRWskABlWA19TB7Sl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3474994',6.8,3478,'pt','Casa Grande','As a privileged teenager living in an affluent suburb of Rio de Janeiro, Jean has little to worry about beyond games, grades and girls. But as his overbearing father drags the family into debt, Jean is forced into a change of lifestyle which opens his eyes to the world beyond his \'casa grande\' - not least that of the feisty, mixed-race firecracker Luiza. Cultures, classes and generations collide in this engrossing coming-of-age drama from Brazil.','/e6xbFgfnpDilkxnXzDlEhYi9qnP.jpg','2014-01-28',117,'Released',NULL,'Casa Grande',268100,1.