ent relationship that she experienced with Georgio.','/kOhRkC7J3jpAgHGC0Uh3SoCqU4c.jpg','2015-10-21',125,'Released',NULL,'My King',329805,3.7067,7.1,'PtGbfRoZ0iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38303,_binary '\0','/3UICspmK2BD25L9nPiBobumXUVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3479208',6.7,1433,'ko','역린','Late 18th-century Joseon dynasty. The King is beleaguered and surrounded by traitors of the ruling elite. They plan to assassinate and replace him with a puppet. But the King has some aces up his sleeve that may help him defeat them all.','/1XybM4k3oDljyY2QzTsAUamxvYX.jpg','2014-04-30',135,'Released','Who Dares Kill The King.','The Fatal Encounter',269340,2.1852,7.2,'9lje2QybL0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38304,_binary '\0','/nwDOyXIaXtVWnD7MEtmmnANOThY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3479250',7,1407,'ko','남자가 사랑할 때','Tae-il lives a fast life as low level thug. He then learns that he has a terminal illness and not much time left to live. Then, for the first time in his life, he falls in love.','/cuyZXiAZtyuZZC60PICF5fGrJqh.jpg','2014-01-22',122,'Released','She becomes his reasons to live.','Man in Love',258313,3.0682,7.2,'baBM27BHfXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38305,_binary '\0','/4GbCLy8uia4nwc39CHOT0XHjnpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3479316',6,15457,'en','Parallels','An underground MMA fighter must confront his sister and his past in an adventure through parallel universes','/fqUallsX9KSSey1tw7AbujlOmOa.jpg','2015-03-01',83,'Released','What is the building?','Parallels',328595,2.5245,6.026,'uyknfocH8t4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38306,_binary '\0','/lk0qrFmTuyhCvMTutQ26RUM9pK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34794166',6.7,3234,'hi','निशानची','Twin brothers, identical looks but different values, face brotherhood, betrayal, love, and redemption. Their paths weave through crime into a deeper story of human nature and its results.','/aDI8pTr7QDs1QnDKCK