0','/jZNR5onRZijwyGr5iWbs3J9QcYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34819091',6.4,10663,'en','The Testament of Ann Lee','The extraordinary true legend of Ann Lee, founder of the devotional sect known as the Shakers, who preached gender and social equality and was revered by her followers as the female Christ.','/hBGg3IGRM7LM6ydMmDrl8mEx33Y.jpg','2025-12-25',137,'Released','The Earth will shake and tremble.','The Testament of Ann Lee',1401281,6.2193,6.3,'Rb0ZhiDD9J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38318,_binary '\0','/1YUDlWfCFpFSHk91Xw7fo7unTtF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3482062',5.1,2642,'en','Bad Roomies','Two guys find a beautiful young woman to take the place of their missing roommate. Everything seems fine until a horrible mistake on drunken night leads all three on a downward spiral.','/ejYslOKoRQdD3WWKqYEabwvPlSV.jpg','2015-12-01',93,'Released','Things will get complicated. Things will get messy. Things will get ugly. Things will get weird.','Bad Roomies',371442,1.5557,4.6,'YpFnl9_AcjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38319,_binary '\0','/j3IJJv4ETxKaslISCFFgs6tJax9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3483194',6.9,2359,'fr','Tu dors Nicole','Making the most of the family home while her parents are away, 22-year-old Nicole is enjoying a peaceful summer with her best friend Véronique. But when Nicole’s older brother shows up with his band to record an album, the girls’ friendship is put to the test.','/lCsnPN6GS9tvOBpmLosnvhZJqRL.jpg','2014-08-22',93,'Released',NULL,'You\'re Sleeping, Nicole',270886,1.4358,6.5,'o0ZHEtIXk3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38320,_binary '\0','/Ad9emg9n7CY5rpvTXIaSfcMKHXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3483612',6.8,8090,'hi','हमारी अधूरी कहानी','A single mother finds solace with a wealthy, but lonely hotel magnate, together they find love until her past comes back to confront her.','/joiHOPFGtmY45YwP7Bnm7KvzL8H.jpg','2015-06-12',129,'Released',NULL,'Hama