d a group of pirates led by Yeo Wol go after the lost treasure, but who will get to to it first?','/4qU1SW1b2Txf3Ge9rGlddDthSgx.jpg','2014-08-06',130,'Released','Those who conquer the sea will have it all!','The Pirates',285213,4.0702,7.023,'dOnUyuFaFDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38325,_binary '\0','/bjZOoA38Hp0bp3kABMP8ja2aAYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34852931',6,4895,'ml','അം അഃ','When Stephen, a road construction supervisor, visits Kavantha, an enigmatic yet beautiful mountainside village, he uncovers a series of heartwarming events that reveal love in its purest form.','/lsaplzFtU6dADWG9Sj2aneh2Ymx.jpg','2025-01-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Am Ah',1395534,0.8922,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38326,_binary '\0','/kDXYvEJj6IcWXZjojxZ7C4Y9dUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3486080',4.2,1831,'en','Lancaster Skies','Douglas, a broken, solitary, Spitfire Ace, must overcome his past to lead a Lancaster bomber crew in the pivotal aerial war over Berlin, in 1944.','/nOHm72CCU5vvrbWhqaDZMkwZ2IP.jpg','2019-02-27',98,'Released','Courage on high.','Lancaster Skies',517517,1.422,5.6,'nAa8NskyjIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38327,_binary '\0','/o9hCEAq5vqjPlsh1VGTP21hU0R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3486542',6.6,1867,'it','Mediterranea','Ayiva recently left his home in Burkina Faso in search of a way to provide for his sister and his daughter. He takes advantage of his position in an illegal smuggling operation to get himself and his best friend Abas off of the continent. Ayiva adapts to life in Italy, but when tensions with the local community rise, things become increasingly dangerous. Determined to make his new situation work he attempts to weather the storm, but it has its costs.','/84L8Qak3UAQ4qgY3xeXU4Siejem.jpg','2015-09-02',107,'Released',NULL,'Mediterranea',336660,1.8594,6.7,'1tza2aOL_xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38328,_binary '\0','/snobCf0u4ex9OKNNFuNQKmGe3gJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3486626',5.5,8232,'en','The Nut Job 2: Nutty by Nature','When the evil mayor of Oakton decides to bulldoze Liberty Park and build a dangerous amusement park in its place, Surly Squirrel and his ragtag group of animal friends need to band together to save their home, defeat the mayor, and take back the park.','/xOfdQHNF9TlrdujyAjiKfUhxSXy.jpg','2017-08-11',91,'Released','Get ready. Get set. Get nuts!','The Nut Job 2: Nutty by Nature',335777,10.5829,6.2,'nYif5QTYI9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38329,_binary '\0','/3NBOtCe3UShwYhXxVMHi1uzKPml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3487610',4.5,2432,'en','Malevolence 3: Killer','Martin Bristol returns to where it all began: the home where he was kidnapped from. But he is not the boy who disappeared over 10 years ago. Tortured and abused at the hands of his psychotic captor Graham Sutter, Martin is damaged beyond repair. Lurking in the shadows of suburbia, he stalks and kills without remorse. Special Agent William Perkins follows Martin\'s trail of terror, desperate to capture him before he kills again. Martin\'s family, mourning his disappearance for over 10 years, is informed not only that he is alive, but that he is responsible for the wave of murder sweeping through their town. Will they be able to reunite with their long-lost son before it\'s too late, or will Perkins have to use force to bring him down?','/rKS0D6mu9yEUyV4FrMcUKXGAl1b.jpg','2018-10-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Malevolence 3: Killer',537943,1.6505,4.613,'LfojADbtfm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38330,_binary '\0','/sQmmdVLzY0eVUSSZikvnUSRKLi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3487994',5.7,7681,'en','Bloodsucking Bastards','A down on his luck cubicle worker and his slacker best friend discover their new boss is a vampire who is turning their coworkers into the un-dead.','/ymDJQsmDSgQ4IGZAxW4aR0WpVAr.jpg','2015-08-28',84,'Released','Work. It sucks the life out of you.','Bloodsucking Bastards',317981,2.2223,5.559,'vI8VF5sUGQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38331,_binary '\0','/i0j7ul8F0ePoj3gz7KdauAiOFd6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3488056',3.5,2983,'en','10.0 Earthquake','Los Angeles is about to be hit by a devastating earthquake, and time is running out to save the city from imminent danger.','/xk2XMdPM29ETA491JVEBj1BhJ7F.jpg','2014-10-15',88,'Released','The end is near.','10.0 Earthquake',302666,3.0532,5,'UqdESixDyEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38332,_binary '\0','/dXb92YqAFGrlt5eVoPBh4RhyZK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34881149',8.3,1443,'pt','From the River to the Sea - Um Filme Sobre a Guerra em Israel',NULL,'/3iFmtROx5NIuXpJ1GuqvBZV3W7C.jpg','2024-10-07',140,'Released',NULL,'From the River to the Sea - Um Filme Sobre a Guerra em Israel',1368683,1.4154,8.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38333,_binary '\0','/A0rOMht0Z5tJ7QHGt7aIpfNvlT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3488184',5.6,1707,'en','7 Chinese Brothers','Larry is an unqualified, unemployable, inebriated prankster who rides a tide of booze onto the glorious shores of an undiscriminating Quick-Lube. Taking a part-time job vacuuming and washing windshields, Larry finds himself mixed up with hostile co-workers and unsatisfied customers, while also finding himself smitten with his lovely boss, Lupe Torrez. Will Larry keep it together long enough to win the girl, provide for man\'s best friend (his dog Arrow), and do his grandmother proud?','/k1vtozOhbk76ZmBJzKfmv1pev9i.jpg','2015-08-14',75,'Released','Failure has a new overachiever','7 Chinese Brothers',324245,1.5584,5.3,'K-jPsO_eT1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38334,_binary '\0','/5KqLlBfhkS58MVQ9ir4ttyGk2i6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3488328',5.1,7572,'en','Pound of Flesh','In China to donate his kidney to his dying niece, former black-ops agent Deacon awakes the day before the operation to find he is the latest victim of organ theft. Stitched up and pissed-off, Deacon descends from his opulent hotel in search of his stolen kidney and carves a blood-soaked path through the darkest corners of the city. The clock is ticking for his niece and with each step he loses blood.','/lLxgyIuENnjPLeNIoqwIg3XBwJ1.jpg','2015-05-07',104,'Released','The black market is about to get bloody.','Pound of Flesh',326284,3.8528,5.771,'RpTrypbMr-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38335,_binary '\0','/fwPrh4Pu2egP4oICJfKGTzNj0qM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3488462',6.6,7754,'de','Honig im Kopf','Before eleven years old Tilda\'s parents can put her beloved grandfather in an old people\'s home due to his progressing Alzheimer disease, she takes him on one last adventure that subliminally threatens to tear her family apart.','/82T8Yax4blLICBPRcdzeJ6tZzxa.jpg','2014-12-25',139,'Released',NULL,'Head Full of Honey',269258,1.9992,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38336,_binary '\0','/baIjN7xPyw2In1CuHACTgzcsF20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34886821',7.3,11399,'it','La grazia','As his tenure as President of Italy nears its end, Mariano De Santis faces wrenching decisions-both political and deeply personal. Amid these moral quandaries, he must confront his own conscience and seek guidance from those closest to him, including his confidante and daughter, Dorotea.','/lnPGzi7BNc17WtxXso16CjNjT5K.jpg','2025-12-05',133,'Released','A president. A pardon. A legacy.','La Grazia',1397364,6.3504,7.3,'zvQn44a_IHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38337,_binary '\0','/vAYMNOcGgFa7HtjvOdxQYPGntgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3488710',7.3,142363,'en','The Walk','The story of French high-wire artist Philippe Petit\'s attempt to cross the Twin Towers of the World Trade Center in 1974.','/tiESRqurrZwAC0hpERogOsBhjeg.jpg','2015-09-30',123,'Released','Every dream begins with a single step','The Walk',285783,10.8859,7,'4W6byFcD5uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38338,_binary '\0','/qHBnPZA3J6hSl9a3Q1JAQzDeo2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34888646',7.1,1796,'en','I Can Only Imagine 2','Following the breakout success of the song \'I Can Only Imagine\', MercyMe\'s Bart Millard is living the dream—sold-out arenas, a devoted fanbase, and a thriving career. But behind the spotlight, Bart\'s past threatens the family he\'s built, especially the fragile bond with his son Sam. When hopeful newcomer Tim Timmons joins the band for their biggest tour yet, he unknowingly brings a renewed gratitude to Bart\'s life through their unlikely friendship. Bart soon discovers that Tim carries hardships—and secrets—of his own, forcing him to face his past and repair his relationships with Sam and his wife Shannon before fame costs him what matters most.','/7McqI2S0tmfCPAP15Ivve9sa6cZ.jpg','2026-02-19',110,'Released','Some stories deserve an encore.','I Can Only Imagine 2',1405769,5.5912,8.3,'8MLqWdUOZYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38339,_binary '\0','/bdwv8Hsu4Bnz8aRbH5MQ9clQ0DG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34888871',5.5,14982,'en','Little Brother','A tightly wound realtor\'s picture-perfect life gets an extreme makeover when his lovably chaotic \"little brother\" suddenly reappears.','/hIJpXb7Xaje2mebN9ylsS7blQzP.jpg','2026-06-18',102,'Released','An uncomfortably touching comedy.','Little Brother',1397385,11.1842,6.4,'bWtrFcerKE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38340,_binary '\0','/tf5eJGsiRKKKAuCjDscEtFUgesH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3489470',6.5,2277,'fr','Pas son genre','Clement, a young philosophy teacher, is sent to Arras for a year. He meets Jennifer, a pretty hair stylist, and the two freely share their hearts and bodies as they try to overcome the cultural and social divide between them.','/zmiC4nYqOD6DYU5h9IMHT5WOwb1.jpg','2014-04-30',111,'Released','Opposites attract; but is that enough?','Not My Type',266537,2.0348,6.1,'RUxJx773WgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38341,_binary '\0','/o2ix0JA6LL5VzMkh3zXkECePrhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34895052',5.4,1856,'tr','Tur Rehberi','Ercüment is a showman but every single time he performs, it ends up being a disaster. After a while of being in between jobs, he finds himself as a tour guide due to his father\'s illness and he has to deal with senior people that are taking the tour just so they can commit suicide together.','/wu80BCy95v9Z5yfb9LHZz9eaibi.jpg','2025-01-01',109,'Released',NULL,'Tour Guide',1277192,1.3038,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38342,_binary '\0','/gYccdrj500hUA380HaVEhsYxfRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34896026',6.2,8647,'te','Legally Veer','A gripping murder case in Hata City tests the limits of justice. Veer, an aspiring lawyer, takes on a high-stakes defense against a criminal charge, battling through courtroom revelations and twists.','/8WKeDF6A3s6DGOs8iocVe3BBZxM.jpg','2025-03-07',142,'Released',NULL,'Legally Veer',1445070,0.5517,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38343,_binary '\0','/rFKbPDXBzgn4eYBdJXaAPEYIcyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34896285',6.1,1827,'it','Mica è Colpa Mia','Drowning in debt, two brothers concoct a plan to scam a wealthy heiress and save their home in Naples — but unexpected love soon complicates the scheme.','/kWBjdB6tP71ed4WTFxuqDZnWVk5.jpg','2025-01-01',101,'Released',NULL,'The Love Scam',1397854,3.7681,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38344,_binary '\0','/glL4pz6WUtzAc8j3sAxaz4uLwmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34901083',4.4,1304,'hi','Mission Grey House','Mission Grey House is a suspense thriller. A boy wants to become a police officer by any means, and to suffice his hunger he wears a police uniform on his own and starts fighting with goons and all. Knowing this Kiara\'s father who is an IG, asks about Kabir and he warns him about the consequences. She pleads his father to help Kabir to become an officer and she assures him that he will do his job with great responsibility, IG calls him and says \'main tumhe ek mission de raha hoon- Grey House. Tumhe ye pata karna hai yahan murder kyun ho rahe hain aur kaun kar raha hai, agar tumne ye pata kar liya to tumhara sapna main poora karunga and Kabir accepts. He goes to Grey House and gets trapped there. How he comes out of this? And how he finds the killer? How he saves his life? To know all of this you have to join us in the theatres and enjoy the film \"Mission Grey House\" with us.','/eeepVS81yLGvPC9dE35KW75dX5Y.jpg','2025-01-17',118,'Released',NULL,'Mission Grey House',1419486,0.8379,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38345,_binary '\0','/1eCDdnJul7qb6pePdWlKozoF8Fq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34905624',6.6,1345,'it','La vita va così','An elderly shepherd takes on big business when he becomes the only holdout against property developers building a luxury resort in his tiny Sardinian village.','/qvaD0vZ78w3hFuEBGyhpEkmHUOS.jpg','2025-10-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Life Is Life',1397375,1.8017,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38346,_binary '\0','/bWvGtxd3a6wW7ocQPlYza3ycpxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34906817',5.5,1279,'it','Non è un paese per single','A brilliant and intelligent love comedy that celebrates second chances and new horizons, starring a strong and determined woman who settles the score.','/nsROal9WTDvbB7ITBZZGrVOlz5z.jpg','2026-05-08',103,'Released',NULL,'No Place to Be Single',1317448,4.4453,6.7,'oQwCYDTFvBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38347,_binary '\0','/ybSA7fUbYHw8VeRiSJ7tgKJnYWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34910018',4.8,2253,'en','Sniper: The Last Stand','To stop an arms dealer from unleashing a deadly superweapon, Ace sniper Brandon Beckett and Agent Zero are deployed to Costa Verde to lead a group of elite soldiers against an unrelenting militia. Taking an untested sniper under his wing, Beckett faces his newest challenge: giving orders instead of receiving them. With both time and ammo running low in a race to save humanity, the team must overcome all odds just to survive.','/TVvIyCsFCmLk9MRLbAZi4X8f32.jpg','2025-01-21',99,'Released',NULL,'Sniper: The Last Stand',1410082,6.661,6.763,'YSwYhvG0Hy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38348,_binary '\0','/9aecROz2WTJVxO0MMKrMDQsx7F6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34915705',8.2,16361,'ta','டூரிஸ்ட் ஃபாமிலி','A quirky Sri Lankan family seeking a fresh start in India transforms a disconnected neighborhood into a vibrant community with their infectious love and kindness.','/rEffPihtdQXiXfRdfq7pPM5JDqa.jpg','2025-04-30',128,'Released',NULL,'Tourist Family',1398359,1.8593,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38349,_binary '\0','/uJB4JEG8bYBQQ2QupGTzvMdnW1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3491962',5.4,4056,'en','Outlaws and Angels','A gang of cold-blooded outlaws narrowly escapes a blood-soaked bank robbery in a grimy frontier town. With a notorious bounty hunter hot on their trail, these nefarious criminals desperately need a place to hide out before night falls. Fate brings them to the home of the Tildons, a seemingly innocent family with two feisty daughters. As the men settle in, an impetuous game of cat and mouse plays out during the cold, black night. Come morning, nothing will ever be the same.','/rEV31TbZoC9mBa0fjJVtw94Pnvf.jpg','2016-01-25',120,'Released',NULL,'Outlaws and Angels',376501,2.6124,5.6,'kogVY6dhGnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38350,_binary '\0','/q94sndPsWY9G6geV6BaokKn7G14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34927582',5.8,1742,'pa','ਬਦਨਾਮ','Following his release from prison, an outlaw with a tragic past challenges a ruthless crime boss for control of the local alcohol black market.','/qgEf4jlTkyhcj8cK44gnr36EKeS.jpg','2025-02-28',168,'Released',NULL,'Badnaam',1439583,0.9028,0,'mq9rDZ-PdIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38351,_binary '\0','/gmzmEvics2P3FDFTArj7G2JqwnE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3492838',6.9,2284,'sr','Поред мене','After being attacked by a group of masked hooligans, Olja discovers that some of her students were responsible. She decides to teach them a lesson by locking them in the school building and confronts them.','/62MoWStJ741nq9HTBhRLlV4TGEL.jpg','2015-07-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Next to Me',356029,1.2319,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38352,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34930449',6.5,2952,'mr','मंगला','It tells the inspiring story of a woman who, after surviving a brutal acid attack, refuses to be defined by society\'s rejection and follows her passion for music. Despite facing challenges in education and employment due to her disfigured face, Mangla\'s unwavering commitment to classical music propels her to earn a PhD and become a respected music teacher. Her powerful voice, often compared to that of Lata Mangeshkar, helps her rise above the prejudice she encounters. Mangla\'s journey is a powerful testament to the strength of the human spirit, proving that true beauty lies in resilience and talent.','/2Mv43ntJIbfBrNoo2fKH9Dj3iwA.jpg','2025-01-17',115,'Released',NULL,'Mangla',1415285,0.7758,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38353,_binary '\0','/5OMeQtPt4VNMnYet5pfAKXSC76S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34930723',5.8,1310,'pa','ਮਿਠਦੇ','A young man struggles to choose between staying to help his troubled village after high school or follow his heart to be with the girl he loves.','/aNSeCYQi1ufDueaLcclab51xnfr.jpg','2025-03-14',126,'Released',NULL,'Mithde',1447652,0.6276,2.2,'BzlH4NDy_JQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38354,_binary '\0','/wLVJWYHabSPs2WxFOs0vr8FANFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34936199',6.1,11296,'bn','দাগি','Nishan spent more than twelve years behind bars. The story begins as he steps out of prison, only to find that the world he left behind has changed drastically. Society refuses to accept him as one of its own. Thus begins Nishan\'s struggle to survive in an unfamiliar world.','/62pYJK98PFFT7HMGCsarVWExw5C.jpg','2025-03-31',140,'Released',NULL,'Daagi',1376255,1.3375,6.75,'80952qaL6P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38355,_binary '\0','/6ZZNqEJSorszn4NPuPBWE4xAwUr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34942608',6.1,2433,'ml','ബൾട്ടി','A star kabaddi player\'s life takes a dangerous turn when he\'s pulled into the criminal underworld.','/tpgbGGIM76Vk44KLxTNM2UkzmLG.jpg','2025-09-26',151,'Released',NULL,'Balti',1070157,1.3037,5.167,'iulDFgiGngQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38356,_binary '\0','/sEnwVITx3kufohbDqTqnpsQbola.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34945265',7.1,2051,'eu','Maspalomas','After breaking up with his partner, 76 year-old Vicente leads life the way he likes it in Maspalomas: he spends his days lying in the sun, partying, and looking for pleasure. An unexpected accident obliges him to return to San Sebastián and to the daughter he abandoned years ago. Vicente will have to live in a retirement home where he finds himself driven back into the closet and to conceal a part of himself that he thought was long resolved. In this new environment, Vicente must ask himself if he has enough time left to make his peace with others… and with himself.','/2g5UBmSaxqwavsDrUGlf4OX2Aj3.jpg','2025-09-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Maspalomas',1400214,1.7642,6.9,'8o6gkyinORg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38357,_binary '\0','/gFhOSjYtxrD1J76tI67RdKyyQXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3495000',7.3,15820,'hi','मर्दानी','A Mumbai police officer\'s search for a missing teenage girl leads her to the depraved world of child trafficking. What follows is a cat-and-mouse game between the officer and a ruthless mafia kingpin.','/fD1zfYXgMbDkgIt9ZrHfte6mWHE.jpg','2014-08-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Mardaani',287767,2.0037,6.7,'04E-jHtWrDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38358,_binary '\0','/3jsXJRxDr2rDItjeOtFcVcSvaHH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3495026',6.8,54098,'hi','Fan','A man who bears a striking resemblance to a renowned movie star becomes an obsessive fan, but when his fierce love is spurned by the star, he decides to destroy the star\'s life and reputation.','/ui7DYyQB4wsbBvom97KPNkldYWa.jpg','2016-04-14',138,'Released','World\'s biggest superstar got the universe\'s biggest fan!','Fan',377985,2.6756,6.23,'c3Um5TSz-ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38359,_binary '\0','/eEeZwT2B2VFZ8MbbIjnARdKK9Hf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3495030',7.4,22734,'hi','दम लगा के हईशा','A slim uneducated guy is pressured into an arranged marriage with an overweight college girl. The mismatched couple is challenged to compete in the annual wife-carrying race.','/c9TX2kH1rG7QYEl09flOVg82QdU.jpg','2015-02-27',111,'Released','Love comes in all sizes','Dum Laga Ke Haisha',325138,1.7697,7.2,'lFZpPpSU3k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38360,_binary '\0','/kU6wnWKAjKFysrDPfprAuU6uGwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3495184',5.6,1631,'es','Las ovejas no pierden el tren','A rural couple in crisis, who have a brother and sister with urban problems, and all of them trying to find a solution.','/lM1QyTM6Ra7r2E4ZiyIyRsMzwys.jpg','2015-01-30',103,'Released',NULL,'Sidetracked',300596,1.6193,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38361,_binary '\0','/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34956443',7.9,25897,'zh','哪吒之魔童闹海','After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.','/293Mo4GWf7Tl0TfAr5NFghqeMy7.jpg','2025-01-29',144,'Released','Witness a hero reborn.','Ne Zha 2',980477,31.2914,8.187,'ETlOSBR92Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38362,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34959070',7,1915,'te','Trimukha','When trying to solve unsolved serial killings, CID officer Shivani Rathod (Sunny leone) faces all dead ends. In a parallel screenplay, Hero (Yogesh) and team are detectives that tries to solve paranormal cases and untie horror incidents. After series of complex incidents both CID Shivani\'s police team as well as Hero Yogi\'s team fails in their respective missions. How do these two completely unknown and separate teams get connected ? Who is the serial killer that CID Shivani Rathod is looking for ? Does Hero Yogi and team succeed in solving unexplainable mysterious paranormal incidents involving ghosts and supernatural objects ?',NULL,'2025-03-25',120,'Released','Imagination is the eye of the soul','Trimukha',1418605,1.0718,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38363,_binary '\0','/2a3CC6VpCjqZ23Fe18GstMGg5Pj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34962891',7.1,33868,'en','The Perfect Neighbor','Police bodycam footage reveals how a long-running neighborhood dispute turned fatal in this documentary about fear, prejudice and Stand Your Ground laws.','/2NE7yN45zo19o4LJr6JFxDWmh2b.jpg','2025-10-10',97,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Neighbor',1400782,4.4385,6.829,'fNp85HGJtoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38364,_binary '\0','/cS4Pv2fn2MGYyFxAFccowVHJZ5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3496334',7.4,4926,'hu','VAN valami furcsa és megmagyarázhatatlan','Áron stands in his life as an average 29-year-old weirdo. He has many contemporary complexes, a fresh university degree, and a recent break up. His parents have to support him financially as he is still a job seeker and while Áron is agonizing on his lost love, he is always interrupted by something; it seems like he’s not the main character in his life.','/mUJJNNH3vTPJ8wSA1TyP9Try8ti.jpg','2014-07-10',96,'Released',NULL,'For Some Inexplicable Reason',293456,0.8805,6.9,'rbyOcZHGjZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38365,_binary '\0','/3Nx6Z0K8jY6ZYQdtU0nUFljmmBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3496372',4.6,4081,'en','The Intruders','After the traumatic loss of her mother, a teenaged girl tries to uncover the dark secrets behind her new home, in spite of her father\'s disbelief.','/7YodT3HO0FqM0csMY1otG01U6oE.jpg','2015-02-24',92,'Released','You can\'t lock out what lives inside.','The Intruders',322518,2.5892,5.345,'wtw7oMkdfHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38366,_binary '\0','/ygy06SVakmwvtYMljQRA74S9P8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34963732',6.6,3499,'en','Predators','In the mid-aughts, Dateline NBC\'s To Catch a Predator drew millions of weekly viewers to watch sting operations: men planning to meet minors for sex would instead be confronted by polished host Chris Hansen, then by the police — all on hidden camera.','/jq9BGaBpGmlrJJsFEMAVlfpLkYh.jpg','2025-09-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Predators',1400382,2.1493,6.46,'-fx52wd1QYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38367,_binary '\0','/3xX6XK0OPAhksHCMg66DIsT2aV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34964187',7.2,2502,'mk','Диџеј Ахмет','15-year-old Ahmet, from a remote Yuruk village in North Macedonia, finds refuge in music while navigating his father’s expectations, a conservative community, and his first experience with love — a girl already promised to someone else.','/n5OYq5veVaU2hRmOTZhUgl99VH5.jpg','2025-08-28',97,'Released',NULL,'DJ Ahmet',1400743,2.494,6.9,'GHBATVjjLWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38368,_binary '\0','/yZKLgaHKmJCrMsg5e1naV4JqY6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34964205',8.4,4956,'en','2000 Meters to Andriivka','Amid the failing counteroffensive, a journalist follows a Ukrainian platoon on their mission to traverse one mile of heavily fortified forest and liberate a strategic village from Russian occupation. But the farther they advance through their destroyed homeland, the more they realize that this war may never end.','/s1TC3QebWWWJ6CceqbBgAvJde8t.jpg','2025-07-23',108,'Released',NULL,'2000 Meters to Andriivka',1400789,3.326,8.098,'CirdrDSrjSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38369,_binary '\0','/3A0dDfZq5WxdDGt8qzmhFXqVZxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34965515',7.4,12925,'da','Mr. Nobody mod Putin','As Russia launches its full-scale invasion of Ukraine, primary schools across Russia’s hinterlands are transformed into recruitment stages for the war. Facing the ethical dilemma of working in a system defined by propaganda and violence, a brave teacher goes undercover to film what’s really happening in his own school.','/ss4NEGmPxgm4D73iMFeyjbE1m9b.jpg','2025-06-06',90,'Released','The incredible story of an ordinary Russian teacher who exposed Putin\'s propaganda machine.','Mr. Nobody Against Putin',1393151,4.8227,7.3,'9150MCMSrgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38370,_binary '\0','/edV0PMgSiSqPMghUNPWF0aWoPxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34965625',7.1,2520,'en','Prime Minister','A view inside the life of former New Zealand Prime Minister Jacinda Ardern, capturing her through five tumultuous years in power and beyond as she redefined leadership on the world stage.','/uJvaZaq4OxoNVjqoyjLd19qP7PG.jpg','2025-06-13',101,'Released','To rule is easy. To lead is hard.','Prime Minister',1400798,1.7109,6.6,'brEFCizM9ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38371,_binary '\0','/x0FZZWBE7Sp5Vz5ncn4wb8JyG5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34966013',7.5,3370,'en','Come See Me in the Good Light','In an intimate and joyful story of love in the face of loss, celebrated poets Andrea Gibson and Megan Falley find strength—and unexpected hilarity—in what might be their final year together.','/5AFbcDGT78cLZTyHTSDBohczjuO.jpg','2025-11-14',104,'Released','A love story in the face of loss.','Come See Me in the Good Light',1400780,5.0352,7.214,'t0B8sjxR7Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38372,_binary '\0','/saEkWul1fGNixEug2w6RtOmTws2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34966562',6.8,6203,'en','The Christophers','The estranged children of a once-famous artist hire a forger to complete his unfinished works so they can be \"discovered\" and sold after his death.','/s6oUrGMNl8hVh7fn0O8oF2rHwrM.jpg','2026-03-30',100,'Released','Art can be copied. Artists cannot.','The Christophers',1400357,5.8082,6.829,'42GkXhRVLUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38373,_binary '\0','/rU0P9XGl2thKlC7BbOdGc1mQFQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34966650',7.6,3348,'en','It\'s Never Over, Jeff Buckley','Rising musician Jeff Buckley had only released one album when he died suddenly in 1997. Now, never-before-seen footage, exclusive voice messages, and accounts from those closest to him offer a portrait of the captivating singer.','/rrKe8bC6UKFKvfZHvbwA9Bq5hkR.jpg','2025-08-08',106,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Never Over, Jeff Buckley',1400381,2.8348,7.702,'DRrcgLRX8Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38374,_binary '\0','/5rsOD7Ihsh6OxNW8VEm3v5ypkaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34966919',6,1654,'en','Magic Farm','A misguided American documentary crew working for an edgy media company travels to rural Argentina to profile a local musician, but their ineptitude leads them into the wrong small town. As they collaborate with locals to attempt to fabricate a viral trend, unexpected connections blossom, while a pervasive crisis looms unacknowledged in the background.','/9XGkkT6KAx5ZYNPGNEF6U34sUf7.jpg','2025-04-25',93,'Released','Fake it \'til you make it.','Magic Farm',1309962,1.7573,5.7,'ikF-JqTmA14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38375,_binary '\0','/kQ3V85ke3LKA4dnww2tH42bsZfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34967068',5,1569,'en','Touch Me','Two codependent best friends become addicted to the heroin-like touch of an alien narcissist who may or may not be trying to take over the world.','/drcloenCH7ZautM7hnd9r9WScNV.jpg','2026-03-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Touch Me',1400763,3.576,5.425,'vjWDJScsSuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38376,_binary '\0','/m9voXhtc1BM2Opa07co9iNQQHEA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3496790',5.3,1868,'en','Lez Bomb','A closeted young woman brings her girlfriend home for Thanksgiving, only to have her coming-out efforts thwarted by the unexpected arrival of her male roommate.','/tBiZAkXngPoT80iWxUI9ebSBXli.jpg','2018-11-09',91,'Released','This holiday, she\'s dropping some big news.','Lez Bomb',526034,1.8559,6.7,'lfZKa9e8kEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38377,_binary '\0','/ey6HaUwo4CJoOYDlJ0M90ykJ0dt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34977130',6.1,5020,'en','Don\'t Die: The Man Who Wants to Live Forever','In this documentary, wealthy entrepreneur Bryan Johnson puts his body and fortune on the line to defy aging and extend his life beyond all known limits.','/2M0CF7UsbpQ45xGuVRhExAhUWBj.jpg','2025-01-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Die: The Man Who Wants to Live Forever',1401905,2.7271,6.262,'kf9e1o7rUeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38378,_binary '\0','/81CU1x2f7hUsZF6WeCo6WQxYx7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34984715',8.2,4038,'te','దండోరా','In a remote village, over a single day, four characters respond differently to the death of an upper-caste man named Shivaji.','/hs3wQWyXPQEHxnMjXOXRoHY0dOG.jpg','2025-12-24',136,'Released',NULL,'Dhandoraa',1600883,2.028,6.5,'tcHOHuu3S90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38379,_binary '\0','/7FWlcZq3r6525LWOcvO9kNWurN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3498820',7.8,949023,'en','Captain America: Civil War','Following the events of Age of Ultron, the collective governments of the world pass an act designed to regulate all superhuman activity. This polarizes opinion amongst the Avengers, causing two factions to side with Iron Man or Captain America, which causes an epic battle between former allies.','/rAGiXaUfPzY7CDEyNKUofk3Kw2e.jpg','2016-04-27',147,'Released','United we stand. Divided we fall.','Captain America: Civil War',271110,35.4922,7.5,'43NWzay3W4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38380,_binary '\0','/gSPg799hzlaPft1ug2GhiEjgHXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3498956',6,1493,'en','Wedding Planner Mystery','Wedding Planner Mystery follows the exploits of a quirky but lovable event planner who makes murder as fun as can be. Homicide doesn\'t follow our heroine; she seeks it out. Using her circle of contacts, her friendship with a reporter and the same research skills that enable her to plan distinctive events - if an unsolved murder occurs in Seattle, Carnegie will find out about it.','/lR9umkxBR6fb44KKSkivDE8RU4R.jpg','2014-10-19',83,'Released',NULL,'Wedding Planner Mystery',300640,2.2092,6,'kW4MbAqeMXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38381,_binary '\0','/fZFEyWOC6ahwhKfw0czx3oexp9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3499048',7.5,6036,'es','Güeros','Set amidst the 1999 student strikes in Mexico City, this coming-of-age tale finds two brothers venturing through the city in a sentimental search for an aging legendary musician. Shot in black-and-white, Güeros brims with youthful exuberance.','/7JRxlC4CjaKeLN57mDK52uvkmIv.jpg','2014-04-17',111,'Released','Being young and not being revolutionary is an even biological contradiction.','Güeros',256057,1.1878,7.558,'cm49CH4qtSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38382,_binary '\0','/eWUJTW9HFDmlIACchS6Ohnk5Aom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3499096',7.1,44315,'en','Race','Based on the story of Jesse Owens, the athlete whose quest to become the greatest track and field athlete in history thrusts him onto the world stage of the 1936 Olympics, where he faces off against Adolf Hitler\'s vision of Aryan supremacy.','/ubbNizkhjEYw06XB7b0YMgsHXG1.jpg','2016-02-19',134,'Released','The incredible true story of gold medal champion Jesse Owens','Race',323677,6.9463,7.26,'Ho9KA_JF0sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38383,_binary '\0','/reLr5qPwMvYxK9IninlZT2qUxxL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34991535',5.2,3108,'de','Stromberg - Wieder alles wie immer','About twenty years ago, Germany got to know Bernd Stromberg and his team from the claims department at CAPITOL Insurance. Back then, there was nothing vegan in the cafeteria, and bullying and sexism were commonplace in the office. Since then, the world of work has changed enormously. But has Bernd Stromberg changed too?','/9MhUqFHxtl4SEvVdndG9wymvm78.jpg','2025-12-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Stromberg - Wieder alles wie immer',1400626,2.2259,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38384,_binary '\0','/2GHJGnF2jgnzeqT3XTHjHXgk5Fx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34992378',5.3,10961,'en','A Merry Little Ex-Mas','Recently separated, Kate hopes to celebrate one last perfect family Christmas with her soon-to-be ex-husband Everett and their kids before their divorce is final and the house is sold. But her holiday plans are hilariously derailed when Everett unexpectedly brings his younger, successful new girlfriend.','/w4ytu75uJ1b0AgPd0wLm7iZMsWJ.jpg','2025-11-12',91,'Released',NULL,'A Merry Little Ex-Mas',1401318,4.1301,6,'zLuOjCbDuwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38385,_binary '\0','/hB2af4Up4UpWhdm3MJoXNjH6izf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3499424',3,4687,'en','Hercules Reborn','When a young man\'s bride is kidnapped by an evil king, he turns to Hercules for help. The fallen hero has been living in exile, banished for killing his family, but the young man\'s courage inspires Hercules. Together, they fight to rescue the bride and reclaim the honor of Hercules.','/zustI9EStTWz2PxVmy8KvWVpJTP.jpg','2014-07-08',90,'Released','A fallen hero rises again!','Hercules Reborn',277594,0.8567,4.2,'UXza2zmk4GU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38386,_binary '\0','/xpv2C0iVImzjFTm6i6Ptr08RRTi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3499458',3.6,3703,'en','The Walking Deceased','A group of survivors from all walks of the apocalypse – an idiotic Sheriff with definite coma-induced brain damage, his hardass son and a hobo with only a crossbow to stave off the walking dead, four squabbling friends forced to survive this zombieland together, and a lonely zombie who just needs love to fully regain his warm body – leave their once-safe mall hideout in search of the rumored Safe Haven Ranch, a refuge untouched by the zombie virus that has ravaged humanity.','/ss6eqPxe9vmsYOxb3LGUs5mIXvq.jpg','2015-03-20',90,'Released','Imagine a World where the Dead are smarter than the Living','The Walking Deceased',312793,2.1691,5.1,'prVe4COs8Bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38387,_binary '\0','/thLzIvvlxk8cYzRH21Smo9Tc8Kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3499542',6.3,1303,'en','Black Ruby','Jules and Louis, hustlers and jazz musicians struggle to create a hit when a black-Hispanic escort named Ruby interrupts their lives distracting their music and causing Louis to fight his friend\'s debts away.','/wIQ80wQAvoSDe1HWN2ibiWtyvqF.jpg','2019-03-05',91,'Released',NULL,'Black Ruby',590767,1.5233,1,'H4hSFZiED2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38388,_binary '\0','/3GLkzqIXENA0qFfxKzmm1oKApDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt34996428',5.8,5409,'es','Homo Argentum','The film consists of 16 shorts that explore, with humor and social criticism, the characteristics of the Argentine identity.','/21WlZtv1GZgiD2qAVHOkg63LRmU.jpg','2025-08-14',98,'Released','16 mini-movies in 1 single big movie','Homo Argentum',1471345,3.0224,6.079,'_Tdk26fRQE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38389,_binary '\0','/ttOBvac1oW0OCCfFzZlXh3NeKyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35003538',8.1,6586,'en','EPiC: Elvis Presley in Concert','Long-lost footage from Elvis Presley\'s legendary Las Vegas residency in the 1970s woven together with rare 16mm footage from Elvis on Tour, and 8mm from the Graceland archive, plus recordings of Elvis telling \"his side of the story\" rediscovered during Baz Luhrmann\'s research for his 2022 film, Elvis.','/2K2NH5dforjT9kLcUC0eeBpdZkC.jpg','2026-02-18',98,'Released','Elvis sings and tells his story like never before.','EPiC: Elvis Presley in Concert',1445363,6.9086,8.2,'2s_dCvUgOBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38390,_binary '\0','/qpBLfTiEUcFksMWWrW6tudeBRVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3500528',7.8,3041,'th','คิดถึงวิทยา','Finding the diary of his predecessor, rural schoolteacher Song falls in love with its author, Ann, and sets out on a winding journey to find her.','/xRwVmXZBzh6lZgKPVxwUdJpPI9p.jpg','2014-03-20',109,'Released','Is it possible to love someone you\'ve never met before?','The Teacher\'s Diary',280913,2.7312,7.471,'ZC4aq1Jht3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38391,_binary '\0','/9SmI3VzBmZon9QjTYQBR8onBSa5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3500544',5.8,5778,'es','Perdiendo el norte','Two young Spanish men, with a university education, are tired of unemployment and decide to move to Germany. But soon they will find out that finding a better living is not as easy as they expected.','/mhZWzcIvU5ind2q56qDDoDwKZv1.jpg','2015-03-03',104,'Released','Based on Hundreds of True Stories (Unfortunately)','Off Course',264729,2.0968,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38392,_binary '\0','/41pWNOj2rqKSfsKayS4kAbzpsRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3501112',5.8,24878,'en','Security','An ex-special services veteran, down on his luck and desperate for work, takes a job as a security guard at a run-down mall in a rough area of town. On his first night on the job, he opens the door to a distraught and desperate young girl who has fled the hijacking of a Police motorcade that was transporting her to testify as a witness in a trial. Hot on her heels is the psychopathic hijacker and his team of henchmen, who will stop at nothing to extract and eliminate the witness.','/9FN5n8wGYrfSJaKGF9uObdKimIh.jpg','2017-03-04',87,'Released','It\'s going to be a long night.','Security',460846,5.4522,6.329,'zbOqeh8VYCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38393,_binary '\0','/mctcKx0Co9qe821DQuAjhoH33lw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3501416',7.2,8913,'ko','암살','In Japanese-occupied Korea, three freedom fighters are assigned a mission to assassinate a genocidal military leader and his top collaborator. But the plan goes completely awry amidst double-crossings, counter-assassinations, and a shocking revelation about one of the assassins\' past.','/h4waWHgfIaqcFfMQ38aKDs6Pkw3.jpg','2015-07-22',140,'Released','The country falls. The operation begins.','Assassination',291549,3.6575,7.3,'AynW_2b1CZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38394,_binary '\0','/pY9vGDtO6PKMZHvth3FCQkncgUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3501590',5.5,3443,'en','Ithaca','In a small town in California\'s San Joaquin Valley, 14-year-old Homer Macauley is determined to be the best and fastest bicycle telegraph messenger anyone has ever seen. His older brother has gone to war, leaving Homer to look after his widowed mother, his older sister and his 4-year-old brother, Ulysses. And so it is that as spring turns to summer, 1942, Homer Macauley delivers messages of love, hope, pain... and death... to the good people of Ithaca. And Homer Macauley will grapple with one message that will change him forever - from a boy into a man. Based on Pulitzer Prize-winning author William Saroyan\'s 1943 novel, The Human Comedy, ITHACA is the quintessential wartime tale of the Home Front. It is a coming-of-age story about the exuberance of youth, the sweetness of life, the sting of death and the modesty and sheer goodness that lives in each and every one of us.','/4g4siEftWGiIkGfvaPyyizmx61f.jpg','2015-10-29',96,'Released','One message will change everything.','Ithaca',305642,2.2044,5.2,'mDxzXszAfJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38395,_binary '\0','/vLmHH8jAy8Jq8uBsLucd3592WGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3501632',7.9,912991,'en','Thor: Ragnarok','Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.','/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg','2017-10-02',131,'Released','No hammer. No problem.','Thor: Ragnarok',284053,32.774,7.579,'ue80QwXMRHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (38396,_binary '\0','/AwsNOpBKp1znj9UCK5AhpbQXntS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35019435',6,2389,'ml','മിറാജ്','A woman joins forces with a journalist to investigate secrets her fiancé was keeping from her after she is informed he has died in a tragic train accident.','/yLkc12tgINrE7KzSpjsFJnG0C6d.jpg','2025-09-19',150,'Released','Fades as it get closer','Mirage',1404799,1.2425,5.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38397,_binary '\0','/3sOiKPZAP5YSCzD280CkmPiF3nE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3501994',7.3,1937,'hi','Hawaa Hawaai','Hawaa Hawaai is a story of the triumph of the human spirit; friendship and enjoying the journey of making ones dream come true. Arjun moves to the big city along with his mother and little sister. Out there he discovers a hidden world of in-line skating through coach Lucky, who mentors kids to become skating champions. While Arjun starts nursing the dream to learn skating under Lucky, his four friends get together to make this dream come true for him. In this endearing story of hope and aspirations, will Arjun\'s dreams take flight?','/pqLf2SlhM02EEzY9ZjYMXxumJdB.jpg','2014-05-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Hawaa Hawaai',268860,1.4565,7.233,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38398,_binary '\0','/yMgpIzfqHZXbEN8ar9EAHJvdYJj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35019998',6.4,8457,'ta','பராசக்தி','In a time of civil disobedience in the erstwhile Madras state, a ruthless intelligent officer turns up with a duty to track down rebels. Chezhian and his brother Chinndurai are of different personalities, one a hardworking fireman, the other a rebel. A deadly game of cat and mouse ensues as Chezhian is forced to abandon his peaceful ways to protect his people and takes on the mighty forces, culminating in a fierce battle for justice.','/cpKJGYU8Z1iSXzkgDl8vhazk5EQ.jpg','2026-01-09',163,'Released',NULL,'Parasakthi',965483,2.1389,6.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38399,_binary '\0','/eIbXyLAwhtdgqCFbBuBSX0d45Zp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35022209',9.3,5801,'te','Mission C1000','Hindu Atankwad and the Honey Trap is a film about a character named Ram who tries to stop terrorists from stealing a scientific formula. The movie explores themes of patriotism, cultural identity, and the fight against terrorism','/jrwKIZR9P7IWkP5oPe5Xlw1j3vH.jpg','2026-01-23',128,'Released',NULL,'Mission C1000',1647932,1.9926,0,'86qI0Sefg3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38400,_binary '\0','/kkNXcSVXSO5ddIka8tYlU6MFeaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3502488',6.8,1906,'ml','ഒരു ഇന്ത്യൻ പ്രണയകഥ','Oru Indian Pranayakatha is about the life of a young political leader and his association with a woman who comes unexpectedly into his life.','/l2li0Gj1T0x35mJ70MqCRnDJZB5.jpg','2013-12-20',150,'Released',NULL,'Oru Indian Pranayakadha',246214,1.0067,6.767,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38401,_binary '\0','/kmLl2PvSYw8aU7ueHpVeo0pvSeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3503068',5.9,2928,'en','DeadTectives','A team of reality TV paranormal investigators go to Mexico\'s most haunted house in the pursuit of better ratings. However, when the true dark secrets of the mansion begin to reveal themselves, the hapless team quickly discover that this house is no hoax. With zero genuine ghost-hunting experience, they have to figure out how to stop the ghosts and escape the house with their lives.','/o3Fo0GFHYzNVK5b1KjhyGYE05vy.jpg','2019-09-13',92,'Released','Fake hunters. Real ghosts. Complete dicks.','DeadTectives',541099,2.2114,5.854,'zzNNxgp_pmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38402,_binary '\0','/bvBeejsI7iJ0R1T8iL7gepOgyff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3503406',6.2,37250,'en','The Whole Truth','A defense attorney works to get his teenage client acquitted of murdering his wealthy father.','/iL3Bx4YOqYdAMlx4czLyygA09MC.jpg','2016-03-25',93,'Released','Do you solemnly swear...','The Whole Truth',331583,5.678,6.559,'XZj7DFQEWwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38403,_binary '\0','/awEO0Zz0rVk0sq0UR0NvM1hV00H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3503460',5.4,2375,'en','Embers','After a global neurological epidemic, those who remain search for meaning and connection in a world without memory. Five interwoven stories each explore a different facet of life without memory in a future that has no past.','/1pdOleZZ8jdXq7gPIdNvoRRcYrF.jpg','2015-09-18',85,'Released','The World Without Memory.','Embers',358644,1.3786,5.6,'52pvXorAZFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38404,_binary '\0','/eiAtdWjPdKoP1wiH60sjeAnO9GH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3503840',4.4,4340,'en','Absolution','When a contract killer (Steven Seagal) encounters a girl on the run from a dangerous mob boss (Vinnie Jones) with powerful political ties, running a human trafficking operation, he is torn between protecting the girl, and remaining loyal to the government agency that hired him.','/582SiBOAYRk17fou5lgOjdW7zNi.jpg','2015-05-04',91,'Released','Revenge has its own set of rules','Absolution',332976,2.5386,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38405,_binary '\0','/3haw0ndhE0MihQHvyIbU9etWpoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3504048',6.7,40231,'en','Housebound','When Kylie Bucknell is sentenced to home detention, she\'s forced to come to terms with her unsociable behaviour, her blabbering mother and a hostile spirit who seems less than happy about the new living arrangement.','/jPKEeHmUuoDnIaRs6VUqSr4qRGR.jpg','2014-09-04',111,'Released','Terror gets domesticated.','Housebound',253306,3.4934,6.569,'Ysde4KaFirk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38406,_binary '\0','/6Im67LbcTbGY3UfVZu1JGemLzZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35042637',4.4,2441,'en','Warlord','Revolt is on the horizon in the ancient city of Lloris, ruled with an iron fist by the merciless Sheriff and The Brute. Believing their mystical powers could help free the oppressed citizens from tyranny, a young human seeks out the aid of the reclusive elves and their legendary Warlord. However, with both sides harbouring secrets, and hiding their true motives, this tentative alliance between the humans and elves may bring about the downfall of them all.','/nS3KochvTBdSvNkHiLPxqN1cmUW.jpg','2025-05-16',101,'Released','A human fight for survival. An elven war for justice.','Warlord',1239115,2.2147,6.1,'e86VThGsXRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38407,_binary '\0','/wlTQGzRwTCS00SsTvAWJwbBU9wl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3504542',6.7,1532,'fr','L\'Enlèvement de Michel Houellebecq','In September 2011 writer Michel Houellebecq briefly disappeared off the face of the earth. Wild rumours began circulating on the Internet that he’d been abducted by Al-Qaeda or aliens from outer space. Some Twitter users even expressed relief that the controversial author was suddenly no longer around. This film now reveals what really happened: Three tough guys variously with impressive hairstyles and bodybuilder physiques carried off the star intellectual, taking him out of the daily stress of dodging autograph hunters and having his flat renovated and bringing him to a beautiful rural underdog idyll, full of dog grooming, bodybuilding demonstrations, junk cars and Polish sausages. But who was to pay the ransom?','/3Liu58WXxqNaY58oThNrmd8IlgK.jpg','2014-08-27',92,'Released','Only unmasked kidnappers spell trouble','The Kidnapping of Michel Houellebecq',255533,1.1921,6.5,'7H9TsLiRElM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38408,_binary '\0','/iqiBtCVCv8qHsLva8u9IYsHI1Vd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3504604',6.8,1768,'en','Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans','Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans interweaves stunning newly discovered footage and voice recordings with original interviews. It is the true story of how a cinema legend would risk almost everything in pursuit of his dream.','/uQGYyBBGWXgSv9PhgKbUoHS7azS.jpg','2015-05-16',102,'Released','The true story of a life changing passion','Steve McQueen: The Man & Le Mans',339934,2.1582,7.2,'0uKV4BHaWdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38409,_binary '\0','/wqcq91Trtek0yH00X78lz7fBf6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3504824',5.5,1899,'cn','那夜凌晨，我坐上了旺角開往大埔的紅VAN','On a night just like any other, a minibus full of passengers drives through a tunnel and arrives in another dimension; the eclectic group of passengers seek refuge in a deserted cafe and make a horrific discovery.','/dk7FyOT3g294P4BUJ09P4XGJ98D.jpg','2014-04-10',124,'Released',NULL,'The Midnight After',254526,1.6548,5.7,'NmmosDvJx8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38410,_binary '\0','/x1MiX7zp3vBUKONBfvW3v5cnHK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35048826',6.1,3202,'en','Broke','A bronc rider in denial about his fading rodeo career battles against brain injury and a sudden blizzard while reflecting on how it became so difficult to achieve his dreams.','/ooCDeGxZ5to9CRKxkBEAIWtoRA4.jpg','2025-06-10',104,'Released','Letting go can be harder than hanging on.','Broke',883954,4.2936,7,'kzgsb7zUEZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38411,_binary '\0','/kGHkZ3MXixqtpPNc6daSD6TJg2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3505016',6.4,2386,'ar','H دبووور','Film is in the form of satire, movie review the crises facing the Egyptian people, particularly the suffering of the popular classes . Belongs \"Haitham Daboor\" Ahmed Mekki, a rich family, cares about trivial matters Fashion and multiple love relationships, but it is exposed to a variable in his life and his father is an entry prison on charges of false tries to save his father, Haitham, which leads him to shift from one person to another measly serious and committed and engaged seriously with life, and in the context of the events is in love with Haitham \"Aroah\", the daughter of his driver, a girl from the popular','/k6HVlpxV5uwvlLfYgzdgyObBnqU.jpg','2008-08-01',106,'Released',NULL,'H Dabbour',57519,1.0485,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38412,_binary '\0','/7NUx7bQAD4lo9yMDbprvIblhWo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35050712',5.9,4843,'en','Saccharine','After succumbing to an obscure weight-loss craze involving the eating of human ashes, lovelorn medical student Hana finds herself haunted by the ghost of the person she\'s eating.','/bCHPB5WZy4T0Rerh1GTuQLzU0rF.jpg','2026-05-22',113,'Released','What\'s eating you?','Saccharine',1363387,14.1294,6.89,'uIY13LD3RUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38413,_binary '\0','/zjculDUDvQp8yYkbCwcIsdc2GnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35050958',6,2399,'tr','Evcilik','Fırat and Filiz are a couple in their 30s. Because their marriage has entered a period of stagnation, they go to a quiet, small hotel near Assos for a holiday. At the hotel, they meet Özkan and Aysun, local villagers who are running the entire hotel and the seaside restaurant. As Fırat and Filiz observe the relationship dynamics between the local couple, they start to mimick them. One day, while on a hike up a deserted hill, supposedly searching for a historical ruin, Filiz mimics Aysun’s way of speaking and seduces Fırat. The balance of power shifts in relationships, and the story moves toward an unexpected result.','/yXYLyeMFspuPBjJBYk72GXI5lCn.jpg','2024-12-27',97,'Released',NULL,'The Playroom',1316617,1.2448,6.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38414,_binary '\0','/cYTNVjLbbTiqMspFN3jbotLRCl1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35052447',6,1784,'ro','Cursa','To secure his brother\'s future, a gifted mechanic enters Europe\'s ultimate street race – and steps into a world of daring stunts and deadly rivalries.','/oTLcRCSuunNV8ML81VlU4spIpMi.jpg','2025-10-24',97,'Released',NULL,'The Race',1563616,2.4763,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38415,_binary '\0','/7gEEbwVvy1CR3wuh8xltpSZiAxh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3505712',5.7,4775,'en','Time Out of Mind','Evicted from his squat and suddenly alone on the streets, George is a man without a home. Struggling with his demons and desperately trying to connect with the daughter he abandoned, he navigates the system, hustling for change and somewhere safe and quiet to gather his thoughts. But the streets are relentless and soon, George finds himself teetering on the edge, alone and abandoned.','/856FAOM1FrHoxDqVFIUuUIwYOFW.jpg','2015-09-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Time Out of Mind',284294,3.6849,5.6,'rkDsYjuyZxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38416,_binary '\0','/opubkXrPWbXKXIv8hBsiamTmKoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35060353',5.3,1768,'en','The Wrong Girls','Two codependent best friends living paycheck to paycheck and bong rip to bong rip get caught in a case of mistaken identity that throws their lives into chaos.','/iEJshwO6g4WKTP4HJgCHRTJMWEd.jpg','2026-08-14',99,'Released','Best buds. Worst adults.','The Wrong Girls',1226699,5.5296,6.1,'zrcg8YHSys8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38417,_binary '\0','/6FNUA7QbugUvUlaxCipqoUjITjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3506302',5.7,2883,'es','La cueva','Three boys and two girls go backpacking from the city to a paradisiacal island. There they rent motorcycles, travel around the prettiest and most remote spots, camp out in the woods, on a coastal cliff, get drunk and swim in the sea. The following day they enter a deep, maze-like cave to explore it and get lost inside.','/vQgUNCouT5frFxeXx5mXRskOhWJ.jpg','2014-01-24',76,'Released','Screaming is not enough','In Darkness We Fall',253376,3.9771,5.9,'C7aInlInZl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38418,_binary '\0','/2TO6lV2qCgSi86Yod1nojO5dudn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35064377',7.5,2071,'kn','ಬ್ರಾಟ್','A son’s rebellion against his father’s strict moral code leads to a tense adventure. Kristy challenges Constable Mahadevaiah’s unwavering honesty as he pursues his own path.','/y6NVUbgHIz3SmrRSLU4xlfzL2Mi.jpg','2025-10-31',155,'Released','BRATism','Brat',1572107,1.2485,3.5,'35yDVbvExcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38419,_binary '\0','/7CJQvCO8aNKEewAFw90qvQ7fr1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35064672',6.5,30644,'hi','कॉकटेल २','A vacation in Sicily forces longtime partners Diya and Kunal to question their love and commitment after they reunite with Diya\'s old friend Ally.','/oIQmtByV1LtEQSwM4EpdLTyoSlM.jpg','2026-06-19',150,'Released',NULL,'Cocktail 2',1392469,4.7823,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38420,_binary '\0','/eIUIpp0RUn6QAYLNTFbchwmUW6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35064785',6.1,3068,'te','Barabar Premistha','In a village divided between Karmani and Dharmani lineages, Chandu and Bujjamma are born into rival sides of a feud and grown as enemies. When love blossoms between them, it disrupts the village\'s beliefs about loyalty, identity, and fate.','/Ae4eG39Jq0fFqDD1BMrfHH8ii4S.jpg','2026-02-06',134,'Released',NULL,'Barabar Premistha',1690504,1.5439,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38421,_binary '\0','/xiVBGmHruEiFHQyCOueNB0qDvgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3506934',7.5,1605,'ko','야간비행','Yong-ju, Gi-woong and Gi-taek used to be best friends in middle school, but in high school, Gi-woong becomes a member of the gang that bullies Gi-taek. As Yong-ju tries to fix this broken relationship, he realizes his special feeling toward Gi-woong.','/tYhQ4mCrDOu8AXvSC4etOItyXj7.jpg','2014-08-28',134,'Released','An uneasy flight of two broken boys.','Night Flight',256103,1.8107,6.9,'FKAvfZER9PI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38422,_binary '\0','/tnbL567RTtycQsZzI3P7bKmxCVs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3506970',7.7,3403,'ml','1983','Rameshan, who has great love for cricket, fails to become a cricketer in his life. However, he tries to fulfil his dreams through his son when he realises that the child too has a passion for it.','/k02dxV9sNizaW33dSX8uCgLboEv.jpg','2014-01-31',134,'Released',NULL,'1983',253535,0.9726,7.4,'bROIs4zMgjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38423,_binary '\0','/iZ0Y2kuiD249QPEplwzJ4ykY34E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3507558',4.6,1443,'fa','فرش قرمز','Reza is an artist who dreams of traveling to Cannes and meeting the gratest living figures of cinema. He travels to Paris to meet Steven Spielberg and Woody Allen and give his screenplay to them. In the end, Reza who has lost his money because of a fellow countryman, without meeting Spielberg, awaits in a corner of Cannes dreaming he\'s returning to Iran.','/aDfR9BECPdeDMlxYX7gUAN9P6IH.jpg','2014-02-02',78,'Released',NULL,'Red Carpet',331132,1.1406,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38424,_binary '\0','/6qd5asTVYH4MiKnEJ2RqUd0xp57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35076553',5.8,3342,'hi','इंस्पेक्टर ज़ेंडे','When serial killer Carl Bhojraj escapes prison and resurfaces in Mumbai, the determined Inspector Zende steps up to nab the cunning fugitive once more.','/dHGtwfVfY502veuMojfAkNbIBO9.jpg','2025-09-04',112,'Released',NULL,'Inspector Zende',1404864,2.3347,6.474,'SqIE6lj2IGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38425,_binary '\0','/4Ji6pFs0fdFK3GxloqUzWAUOA70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3508112',6.7,3544,'fa','‫عصبانی نیستم!','I\'m not Angry! is the story of Navid, a starred and expelled university student who - while trying to provide the least requirements of a normal life -, tries not to get angry when he is faced with the immoralities prevalent in the society, and does all he can to keep his love, Setareh.','/x7NUQTz99PaFOYkbKP4RtoYj1yt.jpg','2014-02-08',110,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Not Angry!',314449,0.943,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38426,_binary '\0','/18J7JnWOb9UqfQZHrTCLPz4CeyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3508840',6.3,19123,'zh','刺客聶隱娘','9th century China. Ten year old general’s daughter Nie Yinniang is abducted by a nun who initiates her into the martial arts, transforming her into an exceptional assassin charged with eliminating cruel and corrupt local governors. One day, having failed in a task, she is sent back by her mistress to the land of her birth, with orders to kill the man to whom she was promised – a cousin who now leads the largest military region in North China. After 13 years of exile, the young woman must confront her parents, her memories and her long-repressed feelings.','/10RcGMfzg2lIW1aLcR4ILfNbHK2.jpg','2015-08-27',105,'Released',NULL,'The Assassin',253450,5.7135,6.4,'YSoXoOAY1zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38427,_binary '\0','/sQGbhykhJ8FCQ6YDaxmIU8KNCqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3509114',5.5,1601,'en','Death Clique','Inspired by true events, a friendship rivalry between three high school girls escalates into a shocking act of violence, and soon one of them is dead. Now the dead girl\'s mom is determined to find her missing child... and get justice for her daughter.','/2YGY8r5ES2ZQpA1h9NpLVm2uCHa.jpg','2014-04-12',83,'Released','A jealous rivalry between three high school girls leads to a shocking crime.','Death Clique',264555,1.6234,5.7,'FU4wyXVSl7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38428,_binary '\0','/jgALYZV9nVEYK5jmv7dCOhWNLLw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3510372',7.5,5457,'ar','لا مؤاخذة','A Christian kid suddenly is forced to go to a public school after his father dies and because of a misunderstanding everyone thinks that he\'s a Muslim.','/tsTMz5ZKOifRpxEmRfq12xmVoOh.jpg','2014-01-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Excuse My French',270290,1.3778,7.132,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38429,_binary '\0','/cfXMnQfFHCUa3tIhng29EaVMTf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3510452',6.6,1522,'it','Incompresa','Rome, 1984, Aria is nine-year-old girl. On the verge of divorce, Aria\'s infantile and selfish parents are too preoccupied with their careers and extra-marital affairs to properly tend to any of Aria\'s needs. While her two older sisters are pampered, Aria is treated with cold indifference. Yet she yearns to love and to be loved. At school, Aria excels academically but is considered a misfit by everyone. She is misunderstood. Aria finds comfort in her cat - Dac and in her best friend - Angelica. Thrown out of both parents\' homes, abandoned by all, even her best friend, Aria finally reaches the limit of what she can bear. She makes an unexpected decision in her life.','/zQTZkicfwDJnkDdcgh8sH2Dsvmw.jpg','2014-06-05',103,'Released',NULL,'Misunderstood',266036,2.4467,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38430,_binary '\0','/xhvzbyZVf6C6Uf64fjeQhzd6UKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3510480',6.1,4616,'es','Anacleto: Agente secreto','Adolfo, a thirty something security guard, is going through a bad patch. Not only his lifetime girlfriend has just to finished with him to be a guy with no ambition but, moreover, he becomes the target of a series of thugs led by Vázquez, a dangerous criminal who has just escaped from jail. Also he discovers that his father has a double identity. He is not a farmer engaged in the production of cold meat – as Adolfo has believed all his life, but Anacleto, a secret agent who is a bit down and the man who locked Vázquez up in jail thirty years ago. Adolfo will have to leave his comfort zone and work with his father, the person that Adolfo get on worse with in the world to survive the revenge of Vazquez and while, between shootouts and chases, trying to get his girlfriend back.','/fRAlUIsJ0yfcAslfMIZOPm6ftUS.jpg','2015-09-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Spy Time',284514,2.3261,5.7,'dbUkcx2htEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38431,_binary '\0','/hD2SN5bbqxk0kcRmsATJkXObgnZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35111035',5.4,6764,'ja','Demon City 鬼ゴロシ','Framed for his family\'s murder and left for dead, an ex-hitman will stop at nothing to exact revenge on the masked \"demons\" who have taken over his city.','/fQ9hzto0cUuxjfzqNAiAnNJo8O7.jpg','2025-02-26',106,'Released','Killing isn\'t enough when there\'s hell to pay.','Demon City',1405338,8.685,6.801,'q-djvN7i5us','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38432,_binary '\0','/aaThu80ZRmN3OkKhDwLeJ33kHna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3511124',6.6,2128,'en','The Last Shaman','James, giving himself 12 months before he has \"a license to kill himself,\" sets off to the Amazon rainforest with hopes of finding a shaman who can save his life.','/52wrrla3cOVadcNNBNf3HVKeX7d.jpg','2017-05-12',83,'Released',NULL,'The Last Shaman',451474,1.7114,7.288,'L6IAbNEiKVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38433,_binary '\0','/4ZZiOP4Imzv6ULF9QczvfQ1VdEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35114460',6.2,2708,'ja','果てしなきスカーレット','After failing to avenge her father\'s murder, Princess Scarlet, wakes up in the \"Land of the Dead.\" In this world filled with madness, if she does not achieve her revenge against her nemesis and reach the \"No End Place,\" she will become \"Void\" and cease to exist. Can Scarlet find a way to live at the end of her endless journey?','/2O2tOyS4kvO9GtFPHpWmbXvfRQv.jpg','2025-11-21',112,'Released',NULL,'Scarlet',1406657,7.6335,6.9,'3mZbho4uM4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38434,_binary '\0','/mNUUt9neM0mNwL8CwYHbs5nkrtx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3511542',5.9,1623,'cn','魔警','By a strange twist of fate, dutiful Hong Kong policeman Dan saves the life of the leader of a violent gang of armed robbers. When they commit another crime, Dan is determined to put an end to their activities. He works with the leader, whom the gang had betrayed, to engineer a plan to wreak havoc within the gang and let the gangsters kill one another. But it becomes increasingly obvious to Dan and to his colleagues that Dan is suffering from a severe mental disorder, and Dan finds that instead of upholding the law as a righteous police officer, he has now become a fugitive wanted for murder.','/mzZv8NGmQMeM8WGCXqXXK0Fo3Oz.jpg','2014-04-17',112,'Released',NULL,'That Demon Within',253622,2.4189,5.619,'7ZRnB4BNq6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38435,_binary '\0','/lM2KRVmNgKaCwBdIuQcHIt8Z7NE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3511596',5.1,6228,'en','Close Range','A rogue soldier turned outlaw is thrust into a relentless fight with a corrupt sheriff, his obedient deputies, and a dangerous drug cartel in order to protect his sister and her young daughter.','/pzE3dfnmiNqjqLygS4HbMADFKa8.jpg','2015-11-19',80,'Released','Vengeance hits home.','Close Range',325173,3.201,6.5,'HmBnZpC-ri4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38436,_binary '\0','/7LCDyhUlV51C4dxXIBNMrupvazp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3511812',7.5,3198,'en','Stop at Nothing: The Lance Armstrong Story','A portrait of the man behind the greatest fraud in sporting history. Lance Armstrong enriched himself by cheating his fans, his sport and the truth. But the former friends whose lives and careers he destroyed would finally bring him down.','/rbkj11kIhZAApsfQ0hEQSqsP20Q.jpg','2014-05-27',100,'Released','You think you know this story? You don\'t.','Stop at Nothing: The Lance Armstrong Story',273997,1.5098,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38437,_binary '\0','/dd4i6Ay9IA7TpSXkycbmGZ2IALB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3512072',7.1,2356,'ja','海難1890','Two historical incidents that deepened the friendship between Japan and Turkey are connected in this story of friendship and compassion: In the night of 16 September 1890 the Turkish frigate Ertuğrul is caught up in a typhoon and sinks off the Japanese coast. Risking their own lives, local villagers are able to rescue 69 Turkish sailors. Although being very poor and having hardly to eat, the villagers share what little they have with strangers from a country 9,000 kilometers away. 95 years later, during the Iran-Iraq War, more than 300 Japanese are stranded in Tehran. In the morning of 19 March 1985 a Turkish Airlines aircraft takes off for Tehran to evacuate the Japanese. But the remaining Turks at Tehran Mehrabad Airport still need to be convinced that they won\'t be able to board their own country\'s rescue flight.','/u1hcwZFFKfA1hLqM7HWWEeyUuHh.jpg','2015-12-05',132,'Released','A Story of Friendship and Compassion','125 Years Memory',402455,2.686,7.8,'LhL6YYmuHds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38438,_binary '\0','/fNlbSr5xOFYAwR2A3pSyElTZOMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3512160',6.9,2056,'it','S is for Stanley','The incredible story of the Italian Emilio D\'Alessandro, personal driver of the great director Stanley Kubrick (1928-1999), who met Emilio by chance in London in 1971 and hired him, thus establishing a deep friendship that lasted thirty years and helped create four masterpieces of cinema. A moving tale about two seemingly opposing people who found their ideal travel companion far away from home…','/7TxRQ9JYCmyqDiRPzUtkm2U4Ry8.jpg','2016-05-30',82,'Released',NULL,'S Is for Stanley',399504,1.4356,7.476,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38439,_binary '\0','/f47cKJlC7qxuQy9pMvJCC7lEhJh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35124777',5.3,1371,'ta','பேபி பேபி','Baby & Baby follows two families eagerly anticipating the arrival of their newborns, only to be caught in an unexpected mix-up. What begins as chaos unravels into a hilarious yet emotional journey, where identities blur and bonds are tested. Amidst the confusion, love and laughter take center stage in this heartwarming tale of family, fate, and unexpected connections.','/rn2zLW90eooVKuDRt5h8oLZRHwA.jpg','2025-02-14',133,'Released',NULL,'Baby & Baby',1433161,1.2546,0,'cOmAdULrI2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38440,_binary '\0','/vgHYvn6RFVqFRjSFhgvLD7rxmIG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3512900',5,1785,'en','When Sparks Fly','A big city journalist is sent back to her small hometown to write a Fourth of July story and discovers the life and love she left behind are exactly what she\'s been missing.','/q0wlfkipg5bySrqRdaRkhfd66au.jpg','2014-06-28',84,'Released',NULL,'When Sparks Fly',279371,2.259,5.3,'H008ZQVAGh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38441,_binary '\0','/vivLzGFFDEAg9iXc61g2ogswiRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3513054',5.6,4750,'en','Last Days in the Desert','On his way out of the wilderness, Jesus struggles with the Devil over the fate of a family in crisis, setting himself up for a dramatic test.','/7vbP28axycrpchnGSIydUseNkh6.jpg','2016-05-13',98,'Released',NULL,'Last Days in the Desert',310119,4.1328,5.731,'g5Cu46Hf-o4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38442,_binary '\0','/2U2h8PpsaWn90jdtyG0tu9ZxttZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3513498',6.5,86977,'en','The Lego Movie 2: The Second Part','It\'s been five years since everything was awesome and the citizens are facing a huge new threat: LEGO DUPLO® invaders from outer space, wrecking everything faster than they can rebuild.','/QTESAsBVZwjtGJNDP7utiGV37z.jpg','2019-02-06',107,'Released','They come in pieces.','The Lego Movie 2: The Second Part',280217,14.9137,6.6,'XvHSlHhh1gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38443,_binary '\0','/qK7Ssnrfvrt65F66A1thvehfQg2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3513500',6.9,51525,'en','Chip \'n Dale: Rescue Rangers','Decades since their successful television series was canceled, Chip has succumbed to a life of suburban domesticity as an insurance salesman. Dale, meanwhile, has had CGI surgery and works the nostalgia convention circuit, desperate to relive his glory days. When a former cast mate mysteriously disappears, Chip and Dale must repair their broken friendship and take on their Rescue Rangers detective personas once again to save their friend’s life.','/7UGmn8TyWPPzkjhLUW58cOUHjPS.jpg','2022-05-20',99,'Released','It\'s not a reboot. It\'s a comeback.','Chip \'n Dale: Rescue Rangers',420821,