05',112,'Released',NULL,'Bad Girl',1403839,1.0631,6.875,'fJXlfLoZsYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38447,_binary '\0','/oL6sSV6HIcx4R6aOVc1LYPEeyVO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35146696',4,28349,'hi','तू मेरी मैं तेरा मैं तेरा तू मेरी','When a carefree NRI wedding planner and a headstrong novelist collide during a wild summer in Croatia, sparks fly in ways neither expected. What begins as playful clashes soon transforms into something deeper – only to be tested when love, family, and tradition pull them in opposite directions.','/uLO7ByOKZbRmA4r9ONEHWHZ6HIX.jpg','2025-12-24',144,'Released','Sometimes love lasts forever; but how long can you wait for your love?','Tu Meri Main Tera Main Tera Tu Meri',1407523,2.2835,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38448,_binary '\0','/dpxJsYFONEFN2fLdZ1LGvJDdERd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35148005',5.3,1728,'en','Achilles Returns','After many years, with help of Thetis and negotiations between Zeus and Hades, the Greek hero Achilles is released from the Underworld into the modern world.','/1K6o5Tdno278HYHmsxDQtjgxw5m.jpg','2026-05-25',50,'Released','The Greatest Warrior Awakens','Achilles Returns',1428299,3.7013,7.5,'EkKtvnmDZbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38449,_binary '\0','/a7Iiee4fk5fR5eEEtxVC6N31HXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3515524',6.7,2452,'en','Valentine Ever After','Big city girls Julia and her best friend Sydney take a trip to a dude ranch in Wyoming for a fun weekend getaway, but after a brawl at the local bar, the girls are sentenced to stay in town and perform community service. Along the way, Julia finds love and her true calling in life.','/zyRNgxw4pIeP5qGk1Cllcj8h2pE.jpg','2016-02-13',85,'Released',NULL,'Valentine Ever After',377432,1.6273,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38450,_binary '\0','/8zyQbsmMlXfLkcctjNz5YZZwpkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3515878',4.3,5343,'en','Do Not Enter','A group of young explorers investigates an old abandoned hotel, only to encounter a strange supernatural being and a competing group looking for a legendary hidden treasure.','/stM9N7eJmHKLmFR59JG4tLdN7Wk.jpg','2026-03-19',91,'Released','Getting in is hard, getting out is hell.','Do Not Enter',999136,13.7983,6.2,'jbbaNL6rfEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38451,_binary '\0','/6ReF04jaES8pYNf1OnG9rMDnros.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3516378',7.2,4801,'ko','수상한 그녀','An unappreciated old granny magically turns 20 years old again and decides to make the most of her newfound youth.','/kQcSCLOxqJlRyqAPnj4B0UTXIfF.jpg','2014-01-22',124,'Released','She\'s back... in her twenties!','Miss Granny',253065,2.7025,7.321,'H_wDiuRu8Jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38452,_binary '\0','/mzGALAbu5rnOSn1ZI8KkmHKLSyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35168834',5.3,1412,'en','Paradise Records','Cooper is trying to keep the doors of Paradise Records open with its motley crew of entertaining employees, even as the world works against him.','/Agwnq6bqpo0qgmN9SDMjVMpyubp.jpg','2025-06-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Paradise Records',1323010,2.5547,5.111,'NLKJFz01F5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38453,_binary '\0','/luhN8BAP0Df5CxWwm2VZZWXtaDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3517044',6.1,2262,'en','The Free World','Following his release from a brutal stretch in prison for crimes he didn\'t commit, Mo is struggling to adapt to life on the outside. When his world collides with Doris, a mysterious woman with a violent past, he decides to risk his newfound freedom to keep her in his life.','/8YzGqiaOzErI8i7VK57hUwbMudH.jpg','2016-09-23',100,'Released','Only love can truly set us free.','The Free World',371446,2.9513,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38454,_binary '\0','/nGjQJnE1k1E26Fd44agNSOs8Bl7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3517192',7.7,7297,'ml','ഓം ശാന്തി ഓശാന','Pooja Mathew, a spirited young girl, wants to have a love marriage in her life. Thus, she stops at nothing to impress Giri, who saved her once from a group of unruly men.','/9LmzSER1JP1dTqBf0eUnaeOE4Wb.jpg','2014-02-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Ohm Shanthi Oshaana',257160,1.7707,7.319,'M5-mzpNvnrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38455,_binary '\0','/24cIYXOGweHvzwnA0upNUZEbnLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3517306',4.2,1251,'en','Welcome to Curiosity','Four interconnected stories surrounding the escape from prison of a notorious serial killer.','/yqvkFTounpgOPQCZjkIczVGVmmD.jpg','2018-05-25',94,'Released','Curiosity. Will it kill you too?','Welcome to Curiosity',521926,1.0745,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38456,_binary '\0','/n8dZ4T2Mv2uQ7q3ost8od5VhRhw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3517870',6,12373,'en','Mine 9','Two miles into the earth, nine Appalachian miners struggle to survive after a methane explosion leaves them with one hour of oxygen.','/7hxM3HmO3vS8ZxPyFlXgI0tqXug.jpg','2019-04-12',83,'Released','9 miners. 2 miles underground. 1 hour of oxygen.','Mine 9',564898,2.1729,5.444,'OMWZZsbXWOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38457,_binary '\0','/iaUoSsfOkzoaV8QBUlaDmW0PkBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3518012',7.6,6779,'en','Best of Enemies','A documentary about the legendary series of nationally televised debates in 1968 between two great public intellectuals, the liberal Gore Vidal and the conservative William F. Buckley Jr. Intended as commentary on the issues of their day, these vitriolic and explosive encounters came to define the modern era of public discourse in the media, marking the big bang moment of our contemporary media landscape when spectacle trumped content and argument replaced substance. Best of Enemies delves into the entangled biographies of these two great thinkers, and luxuriates in the language and the theater of their debates, begging the question, \"What has television done to the way we discuss politics in our democracy today?\"','/fZoEfqzhuGEikvnVLLn5aJPhrm3.jpg','2015-07-31',87,'Released','Buckley vs. Vidal. 2 Men. 10 Debates. Television Would Never Be the Same.','Best of Enemies',319067,2.0847,7.2,'CzgfQvB2dvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38458,_binary '\0','/d6xUCcmyym9Clwk96giLFKeCoa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35182033',4.5,1539,'te','గేదెల రాజు','A feared rowdy-turned-politician, Gedela Raju, is murdered on the night of his political rise in Kakinada. As the investigation unfolds, seven interconnected lives-driven by secrets, ambition, and betrayal-lead back to one shocking truth behind his death.','/rXg6RAJzkhE3gQql14G3oiIXcRS.jpg','2026-04-24',121,'Released',NULL,'Gedelaraju Kakinada Taluka',1685630,1.2052,0,'SBX2RFgxzYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38459,_binary '\0','/rJMzSM1cga0NWwwh67EUFE3IJ8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3518988',7.2,2567,'en','Harmontown','A comedic, brutally honest documentary following self-destructive TV writer Dan Harmon as he takes his live podcast on a national tour.','/5HlxDzy3LZ26r5as5pLX7jYVcyC.jpg','2014-03-08',101,'Released','Sometimes the only way to self-improve is to self-destruct.','Harmontown',253292,2.6272,6.6,'KisiU9b_2EU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38460,_binary '\0','/4vxH3NrvQ9ghJTQrg2J8SNKvnD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520216',6.9,4998,'en','Fair Haven','After a long stint in gay conversion therapy, James, a young piano prodigy, returns home to his family farm and his emotionally-distant father, Richard. After Richard pressures James to give up his music career and take over the farm, James agrees as a way to make up for his past. Soon, however, James finds himself face-to-face with a former lover, Charlie, who wants to help him turn away from his new beliefs and family expectations and follow his dreams of studying music.','/r0IuzOfuSAHpcHIsEbPc00rf75Q.jpg','2017-03-03',90,'Released','Everyone deserves a chance at finding happiness.','Fair Haven',397992,1.9614,6.3,'f3zU4XQqiso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38461,_binary '\0','/bu5tRlmXFGTFPcXa89hmKuUNsku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520290',4.6,2025,'en','Blunt Force Trauma','Follows the journey of John and Colt, gunfighters and sometime lovers, on parallel but very different journeys through an underground dueling culture.','/7fGGcl2yZw3aUfHoOVR7LecU0OZ.jpg','2015-10-05',92,'Released','In the world of underground dueling, the only rule is to survive.','Blunt Force Trauma',360387,2.7499,5,'2Sw2vhayyvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38462,_binary '\0','/bUV1ObIIeCzIUKE4iucetXvFIh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520418',5.7,21440,'en','We Are Still Here','After the death of their college age son, Anne and Paul Sacchetti relocate to the snowswept New England hamlet of Aylesbury, a sleepy village where all is most certainly not as it seems. When strange sounds and eerie feelings convince Anne that her son\'s spirit is still with them, they invite an eccentric, New Age couple to help them get to the bottom of the mystery.','/f8Btwn93gNycI1tFo29Gy1zB5kv.jpg','2015-06-05',83,'Released','This house needs a family.','We Are Still Here',291272,3.2573,5.6,'FDJbCMvv9IU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38463,_binary '\0','/IlmVlHM1HEfPYMUJ7S2rIYPjM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520564',6.4,2181,'fa','ملبورن','Amir and Sara are a young couple on their way to Melbourne to continue their studies. However, just a few hours before the departure of their flight, they are unintentionally involved in a tragic event.','/tjnWSTpB2FiOP3HMsLPPKQT4qrP.jpg','2014-02-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Melbourne',290695,0.9588,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38464,_binary '\0','/3m1OyEg7X2nRbY76VeV4j25bh1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520698',5,1397,'en','Drumline: A New Beat','A girl from New York attends a college in Atlanta to join their once-famous marching band.','/bK4bMXT4xQoJRytBqSQS3FJmFBS.jpg','2014-10-27',101,'Released','#PassTheBaton','Drumline: A New Beat',299513,3.0459,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38465,_binary '\0','/FhQaiNL13MSs71xMin0vBqNjXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3520714',5.4,1314,'en','The Lighthouse','Two lighthouse keepers clash, making their duties difficult even before a freak storms hits and strands them at the lighthouse for months. Based on a true story.','/xkBdT6p7242LTfBdGuyrZNZSeOb.jpg','2016-07-08',102,'Released','There\'s no escaping the storm','The Lighthouse',426487,1.2363,5.2,'BAQrLXTTEEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38466,_binary '\0','/1hdorswm5HPxb81xq84H9gqveUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3521126',7.3,173025,'en','The Disaster Artist','An aspiring actor in Hollywood meets an enigmatic stranger by the name of Tommy Wiseau, the meeting leads the actor down a path nobody could have predicted; creating the worst movie ever made.','/2HuLGiyH0TPYxnCvYHAxc8K738o.jpg','2017-03-12',104,'Released','Based on the true story of one movie so bad it became infamous.','The Disaster Artist',371638,6.9169,7.1,'cMKX2tE5Luk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38467,_binary '\0','/eozLsgdW5VyUEdPDuDaBD4VB86o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3521134',8.2,15075,'en','The Look of Silence','An Indonesian man with a communist background named Ramli was brutally murdered when the \"Communist\" purge occurred in 1965. His remaining family members lived in fear and silence until the making of this documentary. Adi, a brother of his, decided to revisit the horrific incident and visited the men who were responsible for the killings and one survivor of the purge. These meetings uncovered sadistic details of the murders and exposed raw emotions and reactions of the killers\' family members about what happened in the past - much to Adi\'s disappointment.','/7TakQLT8gyzIMG8hX8RLTd5qROQ.jpg','2014-09-11',100,'Released',NULL,'The Look of Silence',267480,2.7002,7.8,'iUnMbG0FzdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38468,_binary '\0','/qLVNZFHYUR6Li64He67SWl6BHQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3521164',7.6,450363,'en','Moana','In Ancient Polynesia, when a terrible curse incurred by Maui reaches an impetuous Chieftain\'s daughter\'s island, she answers the Ocean\'s call to seek out the demigod to set things right.','/4JeejGugONWpJkbnvL12hVoYEDa.jpg','2016-10-13',107,'Released','The ocean is calling.','Moana',277834,8.2096,7.566,'C6PbWhWGUrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38469,_binary '\0','/bQPp6KQFKyMTPIikCafprd0os21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3521192',7.2,1489,'tr','Kırımlı','The human tragedy and the suffering of the Crimean Turks who were taken hostage as prisoners of war in German prison camps during World War II.','/WV6N6djqDLo0px5qsdQZ3NrqUd.jpg','2014-12-12',114,'Released',NULL,'Crimean',346296,1.559,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38470,_binary '\0','/gSmoqHhKrvYqgsmC4vLSVIW27cW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35217961',4.7,11053,'hi','बैदा','A former spy gets entrapped into the dark world of a man who has defied the cycle of time and death, bearing sinister abilities','/op8Edzg2xHeGiprxJDFUt1OdJfh.jpg','2025-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Baida',1452776,1.1295,3,'2b4MZqhkhNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38471,_binary '\0','/bXZcSDQoyXlzzUw9qxjZjiUSYov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35219851',5.7,10046,'en','My Secret Santa','A single mom needs a job. A ski resort needs a Santa. Disguised as a St. Nick lookalike, can Taylor fool a charming hotel heir into ho-ho-hiring her?','/tpOAzBasKPsKwsUtPZOx1Mzuqq3.jpg','2025-12-02',93,'Released','Single mom. Double life.','My Secret Santa',1441563,4.352,6.2,'I9Y5qYp8ro8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38472,_binary '\0','/8ltrJiiarpALgzz7CPp842jhokD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35220464',3.5,1524,'ar','ريستارت','Mohamed, a simple phone technician, dreams of marrying Afef, a young social media influencer. But when money stands in their way, they team up with their comedian family to pursue online fame.','/rD2D51wo3jaOIYGATsfKUEAqefz.jpg','2025-05-29',93,'Released',NULL,'Restart',1282404,1.4338,4.9,'thdQ5IyPJD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38473,_binary '\0','/3cVrg7tzSf5AgEecYWDOSAzXAeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35222590',6.5,34200,'ja','８番出口','A man trapped in an endless sterile subway passageway sets out to find Exit 8. The rules of his quest are simple: do not overlook anything out of the ordinary. If you discover an anomaly, turn back immediately. If you don’t, carry on. Then leave from Exit 8. But even a single oversight will send him back to the beginning. Will he ever reach his goal and escape this infinite corridor?','/nQXYTvm6AY4WmtcPskroqC7Skh.jpg','2025-08-03',95,'Released','Turn back.','Exit 8',1408208,19.3211,7.01,'DlRQ1oatOt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38474,_binary '\0','/3f5rBEc6ioRBO2CATDt4sKjEJnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3522806',5.8,105039,'en','Mechanic: Resurrection','Arthur Bishop thought he had put his murderous past behind him when his most formidable foe kidnaps the love of his life. Now he is forced to travel the globe to complete three impossible assassinations, and do what he does best, make them look like accidents.','/bG3Q6EFcngpPn7uPuQTzTuq9DgV.jpg','2016-08-25',99,'Released','Four continents. Three kills... Or the love of his life is dead.','Mechanic: Resurrection',278924,11.4985,6.073,'QF903RaKLvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38475,_binary '\0','/3C8yAIuXlH4BGCpTwEetIv0VBt8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35231039',7.5,6459,'ja','国宝','Nagasaki, 1964: Following the death of his Yakuza father, 15-year-old Kikuo is taken under the wings of a famous Kabuki actor. Alongside Shunsuke, the actor’s only son, he decides to dedicate himself to this traditional form of theatre. For decades, the two young men grow and evolve together – and one will become the greatest Japanese master of the art of Kabuki.','/a15F5KJ4mleusJR1YKP4zUyZaxG.jpg','2025-06-06',174,'Released',NULL,'Kokuho',1379266,6.0678,7.863,'htY9T0KCyRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38476,_binary '\0','/qEqvcwXH5skWfed1rgZq45FL36G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35237771',7,1826,'en','Ghost Elephants','In Angola\'s mist-shrouded highlands, three KhoiSan master trackers embark on a spiritual quest to rediscover the legendary \"ghost elephants\" of Lisima, creatures presumed lost but remembered in ancestral trance, ritual, and memory.','/h2zN5Oo89DjwY9Q4F8zto5MlnNb.jpg','2026-02-27',99,'Released','An epic search for a mythical giant.','Ghost Elephants',1451867,7.5068,7.621,'YoOD-2Wn7ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38477,_binary '\0','/4JBmKvRdJEsn8qHdWgMYrNFFiO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3524530',6.8,1221,'id','Comic 8','Eight young people from various reasons and motives coincidentally rob a bank at the same time. They had to work together to find answers to the puzzles, and find the best solution for all.','/e7LOkm4WDVBYAZgi5xaFQmBrPcp.jpg','2014-01-29',105,'Released','Stand up Comedians.. Bank Robbers.. Trouble Makers','Comic 8',285995,1.0754,6.2,'3DSldkw35n4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38478,_binary '\0','/7i6D8NmHoASGNlRTdnywwunopng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3525168',6.3,7712,'en','Dead in a Week (Or Your Money Back)','William has failed to kill himself so many times that he outsources his suicide to aging assassin Leslie. But with the contract signed and death assured within a week (or his money back), William suddenly discovers reasons to live... However Leslie is under pressure from his boss to make sure the contract is completed.','/f4ANVEuEaGy2oP5M0Y2P1dwxUNn.jpg','2018-09-12',90,'Released','Even assassins have to hit their targets','Dead in a Week (Or Your Money Back)',468219,3.6663,6.318,'NOGbwWDhnUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38479,_binary '\0','/cb4b4K3E2jBGaSjkuIkZHJHmoWG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35254624',8,5728,'ml','ബാലൻ - The Boy','A teenage boy searches for his missing mother following a turbulent childhood and her subsequent disappearance, exploring his search for closure and the truth about his past.','/boKxdR9tgXfkazf6yWgiDdleBy0.jpg','2026-06-19',140,'Released',NULL,'Balan - The Boy',1410937,4.423,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38480,_binary '\0','/izCwWpstY7LAm6eXIKliXACs6sK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3526286',3.1,4231,'en','#Horror','Inspired by actual events, a group of 12 year old girls face a night of horror when the compulsive addiction of an online social media game turns a moment of cyber bullying into a night of insanity.','/v9pTHwhpSWmPHU8i1pEt9VIG9Kg.jpg','2015-11-20',97,'Released','Death is trending.','#Horror',301325,1.8536,3.5,'5KEVbcPPNFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38481,_binary '\0','/lj3VTVCQ6aTNvCkGKEpOCyyPgvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3526408',5.5,1970,'en','Gus - Petit oiseau, grand voyage','Yellowbird lives in the ruins of an old house. He lacks the confidence to leave his home, no matter how much Bug, his labybird friend, tries to convince him to go out into the world. Attempts to toughen him up have had little success, so Bug seizes an opportunity that leaves Yellowbird unexpectedly finding himself the new leader of the flock that is migrating to Africa. Still, lacking faith in his own abilities and with danger and imminent failure lurking around every corner, our feathered hero is forced to either find the strength required to work with the team or bow out and stay hidden away forever.','/c8i4YGjJxMTiUCXi1wunEItkVTo.jpg','2014-10-17',90,'Released','...Ready for take off','Yellowbird',292795,4.1766,5.028,'DtDgItS_OgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38482,_binary '