ver a kidnapped newborn, unaware that the woman who took the baby is fighting a heartbreaking battle to finally call a child her own.','/nEyEFVdlmUdapDl77704aR8o59D.jpg','2026-01-23',125,'Released',NULL,'Baby Girl',1101020,2.6863,4.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38490,_binary '\0','/l4TpHAjyeP8AGjY4PJfRLWphwSU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3529110',4.7,1239,'en','Blood Moon','A stagecoach full of passengers and an enigmatic gunslinger are held hostage by two outlaws on the run from the law but events take an unexpected turn when the travelers are stalked by a mythical beast that only appears on the night of a blood red moon.','/16gNkbj4UxDgr1WIFYbnN7C89ke.jpg','2014-08-25',90,'Released','When its Red. You\'re Dead.','Blood Moon',280005,1.6188,5.7,'TXVu0NFhfqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38491,_binary '\0','/xUwp42fEd3TQDxNVObFB8WVijTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35291758',1.6,69560,'en','Melania','Offering unprecedented access to the 20 days leading up to the 2025 Presidential Inauguration — through the eyes of the First Lady-elect herself — step inside Melania Trump\'s world as she orchestrates inauguration plans, navigates the complexities of the White House transition, and reenters public life with her family. With exclusive footage capturing critical meetings, private conversations, and never-before-seen environments, Mrs. Trump returns to one of the world\'s most powerful roles.','/ba6Silct0Y4pyvrSv0Tj0Urmx9f.jpg','2026-01-30',105,'Released','Twenty days to history.','Melania',1413097,4.3178,3.5,'dxXJAqOU00g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38492,_binary '\0','/4SrsduRig5tQPE3EIsQhFWM3OWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3529198',7.2,4677,'en','My Little Pony: Equestria Girls – Rainbow Rocks','Music rules and rainbows rock as Twilight Sparkle and pals compete for the top spot in the Canterlot High \"Mane Event\" talent show. The girls must rock their way to the top, and outshine r