amily cabin in the mountains to evict a squatter. Buried resentment and bruised egos soon derail the plan and when the smoke clears they\'ve destroyed their car and burned down the cabin, leaving them stranded in the cold Rocky Mountain winter. With their very survival at stake, they must learn to work together as brothers to get back to civilization.','/aBgzu6P52dk6WcCCNrn882nLcxl.jpg','2014-01-29',89,'Released','Family is an uphill battle.','Mountain Men',309050,1.2977,5.5,'Vkp2xHI2_Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38497,_binary '\0','/d1n2ySWSanU34eEsluRjfrjRq52.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35298123',7.2,9802,'en','Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma','After years of slapdash sequels, the Camp Miasma franchise is handed over to an enthusiastic young director for resurrection. But when she visits the original’s star, a now-reclusive actress shrouded in mystery, the two women fall into a blood-soaked world of desire, fear, and delirium.','/6Q6Zo6GNXMLP600OJSh6MhW21um.jpg','2026-08-06',112,'Released','Blood. Lust.','Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma',1240889,63.416,6.3,'dimCiC_hdoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38498,_binary '\0','/eSZSS4TJ5W67OQp77AEx3T00DYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3530002',6.4,90859,'en','The Night Before','In New York City for their annual tradition of Christmas Eve debauchery, three lifelong best friends set out to find the Holy Grail of Christmas parties since their yearly reunion might be coming to an end.','/rfeNBaiMBg0UQsBQFv1qsjTjZWn.jpg','2015-11-20',101,'Released','Their past, present and future. All in one night.','The Night Before',296100,7.3223,6.092,'RI5diat7M7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38499,_binary '\0','/pz0wQh69Fc88xJgEBGCnr8RHmQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35300972',5.6,3836,'fr','Lune de miel avec ma mère','When his fiancée dumps him at the altar for her ex, a young man is left with no alternative but to go on his romantic h