ohn realize they will need each other to survive.','/cVSjSQryFUERYSdOmdgJ2m0eBte.jpg','2025-03-28',106,'Released',NULL,'Day of Reckoning',1414048,2.9425,5.9,'tZaje_sh97A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38512,_binary '\0','/fg04CQyJzuDJ82jm2meY37n9XyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3531824',6.5,148780,'en','Nerve','Industrious high school senior Vee Delmonico has had it with living life on the sidelines. When pressured by friends to join the popular online game Nerve, Vee decides to sign up for just one dare in what seems like harmless fun. But as she finds herself caught up in the thrill of the adrenaline-fueled competition partnered with a mysterious stranger, the game begins to take a sinister turn with increasingly dangerous acts, leading her into a high stakes finale that will determine her entire future.','/qmSpHC0CSNyNll9WhlwWYuwoQ28.jpg','2016-06-27',96,'Released','We dare you.','Nerve',328387,7.0412,6.993,'2PR9MOPTI7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38513,_binary '\0','/lukrFYF52mjYrECoDpTidp4g20l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3531852',6.5,7345,'hi','भूतनाथ रिटर्न्स','Boothnath vows to redeem himself when spirits tease him, and searches for a child to terrify. He befriends Akhrot, a slum kid, and helps him take on the country\'s most powerful politician.','/zMC0kbfcBSxVOAsFXxw9Pg1NBJ8.jpg','2014-04-11',152,'Released',NULL,'Bhoothnath Returns',264085,1.5193,6.22,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38514,_binary '\0','/5TKGbYKEwGrJlHFfTQzaz1FC5AJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3532216',7.2,236543,'en','American Made','The true story of pilot Barry Seal, who transported contraband for the CIA and the Medellin cartel in the 1980s.','/23ILgoPSO5ShKcTZOuiTVfqFAUB.jpg','2017-08-18',115,'Released','It\'s not a felony if you\'re doing it for the good guys.','American Made',337170,16.8537,6.9,'AEBIJRAkujM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38515,_binary '\0','/7rNkbQNwnTRL0fUEtudbGLQDBJj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3532278',6.8,2888,'en','Brothers of the Wind','The way of the eagle is to raise two chicks. The stronger is destined always to throw the weaker from the nest. Man also has his ways, often to hurt those closest to him. Lukas suffers at the hands of a father who has withdrawn since the loss of his wife. Killed whilst rescuing the infant Lukas, the boy now carries the burden of her death. Our eagle’s story begins in the nest. The first-born chick pushes his weaker brother to a certain death on the forest floor. But fate intervenes and the chick is found by Lukas. Naming him Abel, Lukas cares for the creature in secret, finding a love and companionship denied to him at home. But when the day comes to release Abel back into the wild, will Lukas find his own release into a new life?','/uA3urgwFH0ctZAAS61ohM9iGOB5.jpg','2015-12-24',98,'Released','Sometimes a friendship sets you free','Brothers of the Wind',378373,2.8706,7.1,'4bawKF8Cg3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38516,_binary '\0','/4TtfVgg7GHiYFtlIiEjZ3JHTz4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35323618',6.4,5207,'hi','The India Story','A community confronts the devastating impact of pesticide contamination as industrial negligence threatens public health. The fight for accountability exposes systemic failures in regulatory oversight and corporate responsibility.','/ocasYrRgkfKBdabKNPl8ttZuu7x.jpg','2026-07-24',130,'Released','India\'s Most Shocking Truth','The India Story',1682974,3.8694,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38517,_binary '\0','/kDp6yX9gfkHCYkfxkuIvliR1FYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3532608',7.2,4404,'en','The Fluffy Movie','Stand-up comic Gabriel Iglesias delights audiences during his sold-out \"Unity Through Laughter\" tour, which spans more than 400 cities in 23 countries. During his set, Iglesias -- nicknamed \"Fluffy\" -- pounces on topics like communicating with his teenage son, struggling with his weight, performing his concert tour across India, and handling the reappearance of his father after a 30-year absence.','/nD2B6gdFhmDdLeS2KjoM3vyJMBy.jpg','2014-07-25',114,'Released','EXPERIENCE A COMIC PHENOMENON LIKE YOU\'VE NEVER SEEN BEFORE.','The Fluffy Movie',256273,1.5884,6.954,'kC7yttviQCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38518,_binary '\0','/7zHjmdboB40NrxaGvTKZYDNdCOc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35327667',6.6,1275,'hi','Well Done C.A. Sahab!','Three accounting students search for their mentor Bhaskar Sharma, who taught them both finance and life through theater before disappearing. Years after their success under his guidance, they reunite to find him.','/AeeEbI604LBWI21Hkeask5JgYRm.jpg','2025-06-27',142,'Released',NULL,'Well Done C.A. Sahab!',1506821,1.1415,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38519,_binary '\0','/fWiaSsn1zPmZCZUxbBIVMl99kkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35331003',6.9,1476,'en','The North','A decade after they were best friends and roommates, Chris and Lluis set out on a 600 kilometer hike through the Scottish Highlands to reconnect with each other, nature and parts of themselves they lost.','/9VM5eHTgwTYk9ElQMRm9qMepwbT.jpg','2025-07-31',132,'Released',NULL,'The North',1434113,2.6059,6.741,'-SG46PKUCfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38520,_binary '\0','/q7G6cglNDn4DzhnLVO6LOLK3Aks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3533916',4.8,8581,'en','The Veil','30 years ago, when members of a religious cult known as Heaven\'s Veil take their own lives. The truth behind what really happened remains buried deep in the memory of the sole survivor, a five-year-old girl. Now as an adult she returns to the compound with a documentary crew. They soon discover something that is far more terrifying than anything they could have imagined.','/e9hB3QrBIUDSHCmwbceVxVgLRqv.jpg','2016-04-21',93,'Released','The dead come back','The Veil',257087,3.7703,4.9,'x6KWZDQJ7vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38521,_binary '\0','/Am2T4CauyiYXyGGFiOccMm7rcVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35340614',7,4466,'pt','O Último Azul','To maximize economic productivity, the Brazilian government orders elderly people to move to remote housing colonies. A 77-year-old woman refuses and embarks on a journey through the Amazon that will change her destiny forever.','/ua8XnJ450rhBTxkY2wpD2ITw7BJ.jpg','2025-08-28',86,'Released','The road to freedom might be a river.','The Blue Trail',1172265,3.7268,6.9,'nFQEUuodCQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38522,_binary '\0','/l50gIJNQKgMDnV5oSHax8bmXqn6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3534282',5.4,6282,'en','Don Verdean','Biblical archaeologist Don Verdean is hired by a local church pastor to find faith-promoting relics in the Holy Land. But after a fruitless expedition he is forced to get creative in this comedy of faith and fraud.','/qDRa5s8n0jEHW2SSE8Xn4HRI3Ue.jpg','2015-12-01',96,'Released','Fraud works in mysterious ways.','Don Verdean',309298,2.3339,4.9,'7Kf1WAcs6gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38523,_binary '\0','/l1sP2eSmbvmInZLhVXey48dW1C0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3534842',4.3,4274,'en','Finders Keepers','A haunted doll teaches one little girl why children shouldn\'t play with undead things.','/5817pI8hFBXqChubTM3XlHmVzpf.jpg','2014-10-18',85,'Released','No soul is safe','Finders Keepers',296626,2.5334,4.9,'7sDO8zFZ1iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38524,_binary '\0','/3bldksnYdErqWcibZA2YHBdn2nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35382678',6.6,1460,'ko','악마가 이사왔다','A pastry chef apprentice lives unaware she becomes a wild she-devil nightly. Her family hires their neighbor to watch her night version, as he falls for her day self while seeking to break her curse.','/1rX1K2aMyPMCUreKikhFcDRfeqQ.jpg','2025-08-13',113,'Released','Every night, she turns into a devil.','Pretty Crazy',873797,3.1606,6.9,'o9N1LQQ7Y9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-