ty is in their hands.','Mountainhead',1417059,5.2198,5.3,'27cN2_k0JF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38528,_binary '\0','/aKJqXLvqzWUjYMa2CSCCyKpMVUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3539664',7.2,4238,'fr','Dior et moi','Behind-the-scenes documentary revealing what goes on inside the colourful, privileged, and sometimes stressful Christian Dior fashion house.','/w1qBPXztk6C7eZxShmYcGWuiDUS.jpg','2015-03-06',90,'Released','He has a new vision. They have eight weeks to craft it.','Dior and I',261860,2.5699,7.308,'sUIvJQUhB5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38529,_binary '\0','/fvdmaGsUKJUrawm4YufvbbVmxps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3540016',6.7,1953,'kn','ಕೋಟಿಗೊಬ್ಬ-೨','Sathya, a real estate agent, whose lookalike brother Shiva, who moonlights as a robber. After he robs Rs 250 crores from a couple of businessmen, both brothers become the target of a corrupt cop, who is keen on nailing them.','/buvw8fyaV3ebSJjTcVijhvGZZSo.jpg','2016-08-12',162,'Released',NULL,'Kotigobba 2',389952,1.1774,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38530,_binary '\0','/zUmcuYkAbbl5YX4wabqdKLWSBlZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3540136',5.3,6555,'zh','战狼','A Chinese special force soldier with extraordinary marksmanship is confronted by a group of deadly foreign mercenaries who are hired to assassinate him by a vicious drug lord.','/9tGyxJcPUQclngSCcT18oEs80Yn.jpg','2015-04-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Wolf Warrior',335462,4.3476,6.222,'ec7LY8dLYSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38531,_binary '\0','/jWnNGMJvRjNCsrO5GrH8OZNFIdX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35410222',3.9,3757,'ta','மர்மர்','A group of Chennai-based Paranormal YouTubers ventures into a cursed forest in search of \"Seven Saptha Kannigal\" and the cursed spirit to record the real time paranormal experiences inside the cursed forest and got lost. Then The police force entered into the forest in search of YouTubers but they only found their broken camera\'s with the Paranormal recordings, and that recorded footage is the storyline of the MURMUR.','/p8l5foSB8PNUnLlXrh4ipo4EePW.jpg','2025-03-07',139,'Released',NULL,'Murmur',1434988,0.8345,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38532,_binary '\0','/wPEIVFbC6SDagg1HUgH02au6EDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3541080',4.4,3948,'en','Pod','A family intervention goes horrifically awry within the snowy confines of an isolated lake house.','/bL3wnFJ9mbsEsYyFC5bHhuJCft9.jpg','2015-03-16',76,'Released',NULL,'Pod',323366,1.1954,4.3,'eKeEvWeDwng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38533,_binary '\0','/rCYzSP07jCA1HuFvrwgaEAPHitT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35410859',7.7,3375,'ro','Fjord','Following the deaths of Mihai\'s parents, Mihai and Lisbeth Gheorghiu leave their life behind in Romania and move with their children to a remote village in Norway, hoping to rebuild their lives near Lisbeth\'s family. There, they grow close to their neighbors, the Halbergs, whose warmth gives them hope for a fresh start. But the fragile peace begins to unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s young daughter, Elia, arrives at school covered in bruises.','/rhKlzjAJCEKUjxEk1qwr4bgbXlG.jpg','2026-06-13',146,'Released','When does protection become control?','Fjord',1401459,8.3347,7.2,'0gdRZZVoinM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38534,_binary '\0','/3KB32UjT3iL6YziK7760YzSiOEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3541262',7.1,14264,'ko','명량','Admiral Yi Sun-sin faces a tough challenge when he is forced to defend his nation with just 13 battleships against 300 Japanese enemy ships in the Battle of Myeongryang.','/xx701fnV2e4BlQGwgISLYUG0DsG.jpg','2014-07-30',126,'Released','12 ships against a fleet of 330.','The Admiral: Roaring Currents',282631,4.281,6.975,'7PBIHkKi0wM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38535,_binary '\0','/ygIHxA8EB246fwnNlHn6gN1QCf4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3541524',5.3,10211,'en','Line of Duty','Frank Penny is a disgraced cop looking for a shot at redemption. When the police chief\'s 11-year-old daughter is abducted, Frank goes rogue to try and save her. But to find the girl, Frank will need the help of Ava Brooks, whose live-streaming news channel is broadcasting Frank\'s every move.','/h3mrc6JunZYFTmFas2gKilmw77q.jpg','2019-12-25',98,'Released','The clock is ticking. The world is watching.','Line of Duty',346709,6.5594,5.874,'HlicR75YXEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38536,_binary '\0','/wGaADy0OnZj1St7EGA90ygIlo0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35419807',7.6,1848,'or','ବୋଉ ବୁଟୁ ଭୂତ','Buttu and his mother live a modest life in an Odisha village, with Buttu dreaming of leaving for a better life elsewhere. However, a series of unforeseen events disrupt their lives. Will they overcome the challenges and realise their dreams?','/g8wFbBlKcngQnSJFUK2d5JrAWaT.jpg','2025-06-12',176,'Released',NULL,'Bou Buttu Bhuta',1448430,1.0365,8.5,'M1JaMbSCaSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38537,_binary '\0','/resjA0V2CB4fx5p332KNoNVQvfL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3542188',6.6,7273,'da','9. april','In the early morning of April 9, 1940, the Danish army is alerted: the Germans have crossed the border.','/hH1uhfE5eN4FzQIuj8WkdCAL7n0.jpg','2015-03-12',93,'Released',NULL,'April 9th',332179,2.2824,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38538,_binary '\0','/swo2Z70xnO8FPWbYR7IjzrY3Xff.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35423402',6.7,1737,'en','The Encampments','Students flooded Columbia University’s lawn to create the Gaza Solidarity Encampment in order to pressure their university to divest from the US and Israeli weapons companies. The film follows the central organizers of the encampment as they are thrust into the spotlight, face violent police repression and suspension, congressional pressure, and a media firestorm, all while fighting to attain their goal of divestment at any cost.','/4lSuKAurAjmSkrtLYhsPv5ewlSe.jpg','2025-03-28',80,'Released','Inside America\'s student uprising.','The Encampments',1418174,1.1359,7.8,'wD3fpHjwsbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38539,_binary '\0','/8oaEaGhpfpkVnL4NhEXj8zVJXj7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35431236',6.4,3538,'fr','L\'Accident de Piano','Social media sensation Magalie, known for posting shocking content, suffers a serious accident while filming one of her videos. She retreats to the mountains, accompanied by her assistant. Her peace is disrupted when a journalist begins blackmailing her.','/vdfAz6tvp67G9zxONtGF2Vjrnmg.jpg','2025-07-02',88,'Released',NULL,'The Piano Accident',1313144,3.3341,6.149,'FczpuEwxcWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38540,_binary '\0','/oDvBfDVgF6uthIPdRfC6zqqbvcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35434840',5,1436,'fr','Banger','When cops recruit a has-been DJ to bust a quirky criminal gang with ties to his rival, he spots a chance to mix his way back to the top with a banger.','/gPUMLcaT3lnxW8ugt4crxNGJTm2.jpg','2025-04-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Banger',1265623,3.1817,4.769,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38541,_binary '\0','/3y8XWDA1s6rC24w7PPdrDZ0bwS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3543918',3.6,1315,'en','The Second Coming of Christ','The journey of a woman scientist who, at the end of times, discovers that true Faith can bring Miracles.','/q7jtzzyRtPRu3pqo7wJX0KERYPZ.jpg','2018-03-06',92,'Released','For as in Adam all die, so also in Christ shall all be made alive.','The Second Coming of Christ',494031,2.0423,3.8,'7GlehRPuD7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38542,_binary '\0','/qP9Mky8eMnUoX3ILnKbpN3S8tsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544008',5.7,1233,'de','Boy 7','A teenager wakes up in a subway car with no memory of how he got there or who he is.','/mKuqzDZbJpzPHDQdPyNV5M64Cii.jpg','2015-08-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Boy 7',346830,2.1946,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38543,_binary '\0','/ozQRetn8gludoohSWu2BwTEyP8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544014',6.6,4018,'en','Akron','Benny, a college freshman at the University of Akron, Ohio meets and falls for fellow freshman Christopher at a football game. With the support of their families and friends they embark on a new relationship. But a tragic event in the past involving their mothers soon comes to light and threatens to tear them apart.','/7G92ackDnKzwqdBgqmR3xDsqHOE.jpg','2015-10-06',88,'Released','Love now.','Akron',361018,1.8437,7.2,'GNkx5CGQMRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38544,_binary '\0','/nfISD7hILE6UYqXGT1cubcgsxUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544082',7.1,36872,'en','45 Years','There is just one week until Kate Mercer\'s 45th wedding anniversary and the planning for the party is going well. But then a letter arrives for her husband. The body of his first love has been discovered, frozen and preserved in the icy glaciers of the Swiss Alps. By the time the party is upon them, five days later, there may not be a marriage left to celebrate.','/8elIJYYXWq2HpcZ6TgVMC9EwTnn.jpg','2015-05-29',95,'Released','Do we really know our loved ones?','45 Years',311291,3.5421,6.6,'qXAnjA9tAnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38545,_binary '\0','/zArKQrtZRb4lqjYXepBMLdegiDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544112',7.9,109051,'en','Sing Street','A boy growing up in Dublin during the 1980s escapes his strained family life by starting a band to impress the mysterious girl he likes.','/sUWpVlrvzU2SJbnVZqIeKulPKwk.jpg','2016-03-11',105,'Released','Boy meets girl. Girl unimpressed. Boy starts band.','Sing Street',369557,7.4752,7.9,'TxT30uAoSHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38546,_binary '\0','/cqeUlNP8q58qXmud6uBIeXCj3J9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544218',6.7,5031,'nl','Belgica','The story of two brothers who, even though they have absolutely nothing in common, open a bar together that quickly becomes a regular hangout for nighthawks. Despite the success, they must soon face up to the difficulties inherent in running a family business. Their brotherhood turns into rivalry, through no fault of their own.','/5HMeqtWczMYJ7z3e4GwdXIrj7XF.jpg','2016-03-02',127,'Released',NULL,'Belgica',330697,1.4436,5.986,'oz1yQcfEGX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38547,_binary '\0','/zjKsqMASzGLh21C2GT1fuaa9mDP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35444710',6.6,1633,'ja','名探偵コナン 隻眼の残像','As police inspector Yamato Kansuke pursues a certain man in the snowy mountains of Nagano, a shadow suddenly appears in his field of vision. While he\'s distracted, a rifle bullet fired by someone grazes his left eye and causes an avalanche accompanied by a roar. Ten months later, Kansuke, having miraculously survived the avalanche, receives a report that a researcher at the Nobeyama National Astronomical Observatory has been attacked.','/1wl6eAHbIDSz61tGwYTOKlSRvZb.jpg','2025-04-18',109,'Released','The once sleeping case is now awake ⎯','Detective Conan: One-Eyed Flashback',1396965,6.7527,7.2,'0XIxTr6Zl18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38548,_binary '\0','/s7tRhQ8oDJSdsy3YvDp04KtK9nC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3544734',5.1,7462,'en','Zapped','Zoey is a talented dancer whose organized life is rudely disrupted when she moves in with her new step-dad and three step-brothers, until she discovers a dog-training app that can get boys to obey her every command. But she soon learns that it isn\'t the cure-all she had hoped for.','/u33QFfbvChD5LNcuZD0LsSVnoa1.jpg','2014-06-27',94,'Released','Boys will be boys... but better','Zapped',278774,5.1464,6.1,'vcqcmib3eKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38549,_binary '\0','/kv80HefmgC1VpxL0fteWp359qid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35448218',7.1,1365,'te','ఎపిక్ - ఫస్ట్ సెమెస్టర్','Rohan, a middle-class student studying abroad due to family expectations, explores romance, identity, and growing up with honesty and emotional depth.','/vqt0fIHy8dkSpUtVcrN1NaaANl8.jpg','2026-09-10',150,'Released','An unfinished story.','Epic - First Semester',1408158,3.6769,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38550,_binary '\0','/qoA95biFj7fJG0PliltpWnU0hh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35448249',7.9,2078,'te','Sahakutumbaanam','An orphan discovers her neighbor\'s seemingly perfect life is a lie.','/gICJnkAs2aQ0nLWvlQlbde3rWz3.jpg','2025-12-19',135,'Released',NULL,'Sahakutumbaanam',1608706,1.7288,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38551,_binary '\0','/cEKnZxnCBiFWNfVl8eTi73cZFCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35453969',6.2,1621,'fr','Partir un jour','Cécile is about to open her own gourmet restaurant, finally making her dream come true, when suddenly her father has a heart attack and she is called back to the village where she was born. Far from the hubbub of Paris life, she runs into her teenage crush. The memories come flooding back, destabilizing her certainties.','/txzzgq2Rviv2Ljxnbh9Fy6gfDId.jpg','2025-05-13',98,'Released',NULL,'Leave One Day',1277884,2.1623,6.3,'qcyZMsj0TDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38552,_binary '\0','/70NEAKWMfqfnlSDgwLLaHPPYtwy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3546114',4.7,2880,'en','Anatomy of a Love Seen','A film within a film that explores love in all its painful and messy glory. Six months ago Zoe and Mal fell for each other while filming a love scene, which led to an intense, whirlwind affair, followed by a devastating breakup. Soon after their split, things get complicated when the two have to meet on set once more to re-shoot that fateful sequence.','/x3RZlpyRx1Fkn5BjleRADPL98oP.jpg','2014-07-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Anatomy of a Love Seen',286817,1.6485,5,'NM4Z79SFnLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38553,_binary '\0','/bebcNrTH8mritl8yYdbfeQZqBfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3546370',7.8,1629,'en','Road','Brothers addicted to speed at any price. Documentary following the motorcycle road racing careers, and fate, of the Dunlop family.','/fEDWUQyG1jvd3SbD8pwzEoVuWRA.jpg','2014-06-11',102,'Released','Brothers addicted to speed. At any price.','Road',276137,2.3184,7.3,'SLI2r8pyla0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38554,_binary '\0','/u7rEvzj3oCBvYtRu2yj3XEAmnNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3547306',4.9,3479,'en','Cut Throat City','Four boyhood friends return to New Orleans’ Lower Ninth Ward after Hurricane Katrina, to find their home decimated and prospects for work swept away. Turning to a local gangster for employment, the crew is hired to pull off a daring casino heist, right in the heart of the city.','/9702nIZf5EVxS3FrzycamQUlSjw.jpg','2020-07-31',123,'Released','Desperate times. Dangerous measures.','Cut Throat City',493065,5.8471,6.4,'87r31Z_d4LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38555,_binary '\0','/8ExGNeA74E5b9yT9yLJD2ET1mym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3547616',3.6,1773,'hi','All Is Well','A road trip, undertaken by Rishi Kapoor and Abhishek Bachchan, is later joined by their mother.','/hsruH6BJCDy5ELSB7u9oZKryf2M.jpg','2015-08-21',126,'Released',NULL,'All Is Well',355279,1.2785,5.611,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38556,_binary '\0','/9EzKM0ZLySzARIXIzg0XSfxaJ1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3547682',5.5,4620,'da','Sorgenfri','A family of four is quarantined in their home as a virulent strand of the flu spreads into town and they are forced to the extreme to escape alive.','/lz7B1aLKidzrfPS0pUseDGdMbIn.jpg','2015-09-29',85,'Released','Stay Home. Lock Up. Don\'t Breathe.','What We Become',356326,2.988,5.5,'h8pdTuDt6qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38557,_binary '\0','/nLLYm9qPtE6WwFSzDOHMUUfytcx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3547740',7.3,31629,'fr','La Famille Bélier','The whole Bélier family is deaf, except for sixteen year old Paula who is the important translator in her parents\' day to day life especially when it comes to matters concerning the family farm. When her music teacher discovers she has a fantastic singing voice and she gets an opportunity to enter a big Radio France contest the whole family\'s future is set up for big changes.','/kAQeZUZ1pMTSjSF3d6eBZClFGgN.jpg','2014-12-17',105,'Released',NULL,'The Bélier Family',304410,4.982,6.952,'v1fbTpzWjtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38558,_binary '\0','/njv1ukAwLKM5WFEGZ3MpEaXnzJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3547900',4.4,1469,'en','The Mirror','There is a long-held belief that mirrors act as gateways to another dimension. Some also believe the looking glass plays host to a world filled with evil spirits. Such superstition has been the basis for ancient folklore legends about haunting and possession. And one tale about a supposedly haunted mirror was picked up by the media in 2012. Both the Daily Mail and Huffington Post reported on how the owners of a recently purchased antique mirror left them dogged by bad luck, financial misery, strange sightings and death-defying illness. Now writer/director Edward Boase brings that horrifying story to the screen starring Jemma Dallender (\"I Spit on Your Grave 2\"), Joshua Dickinson and Nate Fallows (\"Whitechapel\") as flatmates who buy the same eerie antique on ebay and set up round the clock cameras in the hopes of capturing evidence of bumps in the night. You have been warned!','/n1pUEQuhju702gfA0XGsZz0nBNV.jpg','2014-09-08',88,'Released','Don\'t look...','The Mirror',279977,1.4584,4.1,'Rc8ERUflrjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38559,_binary '\0','/1FOSov1BN00fJAWl3fF91Bihykr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35492581',6.7,2629,'ro','Kontinental \'25','Orsolya is a bailiff in Cluj, the main city in Transylvania. One day she has to evict a homeless man from a cellar, an action with tragic consequences that triggers a moral crisis which Orsolya must weather as best she can.','/zilOI4BxPxKK3BbyJSHEdOTiTaJ.jpg','2025-06-20',109,'Released',NULL,'Kontinental \'25',1410189,3.3146,6.4,'b8-j8_kCg1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38560,_binary '\0','/hKC8k08rgIyXFVQXrp1izEAWwL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35495035',7,1686,'fr','L\'Affaire Bojarski','A Polish engineer relocates to France and becomes a legendary counterfeiter. Working solo, he crafts flawless fake francs worth millions over 14 years, earning the nickname \"Cézanne of counterfeit money\" for his artistic skill and output.','/9syq0YtiW9d9PpQ5fAgWBK6LAtb.jpg','2026-01-12',128,'Released',NULL,'The Money Maker',1376415,13.2632,7.1,'f_bbFLsJl9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38561,_binary '\0','/ydizf7MP7vOYK7bnDcqAvhFVYxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35495052',6,1869,'en','The Family McMullen','30 years after the events of The Brothers McMullen, romantic entanglements plague a now fiftysomething Barry McMullen and his twentysomething kids, as well as his brother Patrick and widowed sister-in-law Molly, who are also facing similar unexpected hurdles.','/foNIl77csO9GmsvCvTZ6ixt0fZf.jpg','2025-10-15',110,'Released','A new generation. A new love. And the same McMullens.','The Family McMullen',1548017,2.5851,6.1,'wwjYCkPH48w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38562,_binary '\0','/kq0IPrP0RJMcY2vHmdN4e38eUDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3549508',7.1,3456,'en','Nas: Time Is Illmatic','Time Is Illmatic is a feature length documentary film that delves deep into the making of Nas\' 1994 debut album, Illmatic, and the social conditions that influenced its creation.','/l3LCII4SY82fE5KMk8g9kzC851f.jpg','2014-04-04',74,'Released','The journey. The music. The legacy.','Nas: Time Is Illmatic',256503,1.8391,6.9,'_VNFCnS9c1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38563,_binary '\0','/v8c5GsavpRYvnZ4vYG3XjZ2M5pB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3550748',6,1385,'ko','가시','A high school teacher whose wife is about to give birth finds himself tangled in temptation and obsession when a student falls for him.','/k2RsuN3Nw3ljEuGdUMI5raEiF2a.jpg','2014-04-10',117,'Released','Love Hurts.','Innocent Thing',267466,3.204,6.532,'zbKFbCXTIkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38564,_binary '\0','/qdib0riaJfbnXxp12Hwn6ANNHSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35509393',4.3,6013,'kn','ಲ್ಯಾಂಡ್‌ಲಾರ್ಡ್','In a village crushed under a brutal landlord\'s rule, fear silences the poor, and justice is denied. When a young woman constable challenges the system and an innocent family is burnt alive, outrage erupts into a violent uprising. What follows is a costly fight to reclaim dignity, justice, and the power of the Constitution.','/wsRknSymCpLhKpjSUGRxGl6DaGY.jpg','2026-01-23',156,'Released',NULL,'LandLord',1613346,1.0345,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38565,_binary '\0','/hUXNwTLn18nTfDEhUCT94iBTqD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3551042',5.1,2376,'tr','Magi','Olivia, A New York-based journalist travels to Turkey when she receives news that her sister Marla is pregnant. Marla recently ended a relationship but decides to keep the baby and that\'s when sinister things begin to occur.','/b8qVPfvww6DPafD0QdC2pfNSSmM.jpg','2016-04-29',132,'Released','All human beings are damned!..','Magi',395955,1.1949,5.646,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38566,_binary '\0','/7cHPvy3aF1mDMX1zqmZRt8YE7Vr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35512499',5.6,4995,'ar','7 كلاب','Interpol agent Khalid Al-Azzazi joins forces with Ghali Abu Dawood from the 7 Dogs crime syndicate to fight drug trafficking.','/qK0l8mzBwiMV6N2lHTFccRVddLN.jpg','2026-05-27',123,'Released','Not all dogs stay loyal.','7 Dogs',1316427,5.7145,6.1,'Kki2D_5l5bM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38567,_binary '\0','/jVwvhKpw6a7c7JmHhMykKAn7buQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35513027',7.3,5317,'es','Los domingos','When Ainara announces that she wants to become a nun, chaos arises in her family. Is this a genuine desire or has she been influenced by the religious staff at her school? Or is this life-changing decision due to her father’s inattention and her mother’s absence?','/3682SbY3rsNKsQzFpPUKrWdGmmx.jpg','2025-10-17',112,'Released',NULL,'Sundays',1443576,5.5816,6.901,'wZheAzHOLcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38568,_binary '\0','/rcjWxhb8P5YVdrEYZk62lhQ3ehP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3551400',4,2420,'en','Unnatural','Global climate change prompts a scientific corporation to genetically modify Alaskan polar bears with horrific and deadly results.','/iUPOptmk5dQE8LZBhn8u9qfTwfx.jpg','2015-10-16',89,'Released','Some things were never meant to be.','Unnatural',356483,2.262,4,'soHRo3XCbzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38569,_binary '\0','/oz4HTAYTtT0p8kdruZOAKV20nh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35518081',3.9,5525,'tr','Aşk Sadece Bir An','A young man and woman from very different backgrounds fall in love but their relationship faces obstacles from his troubled past and her overprotective parents.','/rwiMs8Lr6FAjvXEiQzTJyxLqZee.jpg','2025-02-14',112,'Released',NULL,'Aşk Sadece Bir An',1422227,8.4437,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38570,_binary '\0','/sRVg5yfJJQ2emGhl6XPYJssilu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35518410',7,5494,'ml','ദൃഢം','A police officer arrives at a seemingly peaceful station but faces pressure when human remains are discovered. Given only a week to solve the murder, he must navigate demands from his department and an anxious public seeking swift justice.','/9JqWaizfeplMDEZGuJAZZUO4Xtp.jpg','2026-05-08',127,'Released','PROTECT. SERVE. SURVIVE.','Dridam',912378,5.0223,5.538,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38571,_binary '\0','/9Wf1xwPOycnxvdVnpr6Di381Zf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35519455',5.7,6924,'en','It Ends','A group of recent grads head out on a late night drive for grub, hoping to enjoy one final hangout before their paths diverge. Instead, they accidentally turn onto a never-ending, two-lane hellscape surrounded by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely ahead, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape it.','/6dfAGvZWbJnzWfSZ8gxFj63BNAH.jpg','2026-08-21',89,'Released','Some wrong turns last forever.','It Ends',1422011,124.1961,5.644,'9k7jckaHeuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38572,_binary '\0','/auF7VgRmYOgMuaIMoDC5lSVHrqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3551954',6.9,2402,'en','Raiders!: The Story of the Greatest Fan Film Ever Made','In 1982, three 11 year-olds in Mississippi set out to remake their favorite film: Raiders of the Lost Ark. It took seven turbulent years that tested the limits of their friendship and nearly burned down their mother\'s house. By the end, they had completed every scene except one... the explosive airplane scene. 30 years later, they attempt to finally realize their childhood dream by building a replica of the 75 foot \"Flying Wing\" plane from Raiders in a mud pit in the backwoods of Mississippi... and then blow it up! This is the story behind the making of what is known as \"the greatest fan film ever made.\"','/kaFbT76lzFpPhwX3vHWEgNGSgkU.jpg','2015-03-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Raiders!: The Story of the Greatest Fan Film Ever Made',329697,2.2347,6.7,'0TNq9BQZi8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38573,_binary '\0','/coon7luAq01HIUr4qWvujZ04EDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35520290',6.9,4419,'en','The Baltimorons','A newly sober man\'s Christmas Eve dental emergency leads to an unexpected romance with his older dentist as they explore Baltimore together.','/yZWcrfj3mFf9LGItIFwa7DSkedz.jpg','2025-06-29',101,'Released','They found themselves. Together. In Baltimore.','The Baltimorons',1421990,1.8549,6.2,'F6t-h68UuhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38574,_binary