neral Franco attends a dinner with his generals at the Palace Hotel.','/u8uNMBYtOltjapW228pZD8ILdNs.jpg','2025-10-17',106,'Released','The escape is served...','The Dinner',1433680,2.589,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38626,_binary '\0','/3qdg2DDLodZhj0dfra65G0EJ05i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3565904',6.8,1491,'en','Monster High: Frights, Camera, Action!','When Draculaura is led to believe she\'s the rightful heir to the vampire throne, she and her best ghoulfriends are whisked away to Transylvania for a royal coronation to die for. But they soon discover the hunt for the queen is not over yet. The Ghouls must locate an ancient artifact known as the Vampire\'s Heart in order to discover the identity of the true Vampire Queen. It\'s a fangtastic adventure that will lead them from the Tower of Londoom, to a haunted river boat in New Goreleans and finally to the glamorous boo-vie lots of Hauntlywood. Could this be the moment when Draculara finally receives her vampire powers and discovers screams really can come true?','/iKlKv2OGQ4XhLWgHGxRyPx7WlSt.jpg','2014-03-25',72,'Released','Fabulously freaky!','Monster High: Frights, Camera, Action!',260234,4.5898,7.5,'0sbg3dZPFz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38627,_binary '\0','/wzjBMsWSBfGQdgV92hNWsk28pm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35661996',7.6,1573,'mr','दशावतार','When evil rises, divinity manifests to defeat it. An aging Dashavatar folk theater performer faces life\'s storms, guided by the wisdom of this traditional Konkan art form blending myth, music, and dance.','/61Fas5XznRHRoQiyqkXZDL3EFLe.jpg','2025-09-12',152,'Released',NULL,'Dashavatar',1539455,0.8764,7.3,'WJCDHxohs8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38628,_binary '\0','/wdWNkrtlMfXNkhO6NG2Wfcxe8y0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35665459',6,1562,'te','K-ర్యాంప్‌','Kumar, a spoiled rich kid who lives life by his own rules, falls in love with Mercy, a beautiful girl with a big secret