ory of control, vengeance, and survival where compassion vanishes and only the ruthless endure.','/53FATyQirV8BuBcrsQMGPvGKgCu.jpg','2026-05-14',119,'Released','THE HUNTER','Kattalan',1065834,3.9454,5.5,'xlTJlHyhCWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38633,_binary '\0','/rdtylu8IGowaxKGRKN9fFbdwSuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35669009',4.9,5173,'th','ปากกัด ตีนถีบ','In a fight for survival against a horrifying army of zombies, a former Muay Thai fighter must use skill, speed and grit to save his girlfriend.','/yHYj2t3NzsjkHVYa0bPri4sMBsg.jpg','2025-07-08',96,'Released','This barehanded fighter will knock down a horde of zombies.','Ziam',1429744,4.6856,6.823,'ATjGbAL8hWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38634,_binary '\0','/dydvEc82Z6ptEx3aAubzJawesiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35669125',4.7,3231,'en','This Is Not a Test','Sloane and four classmates take cover in Cortege High to escape a world plagued by the infected. As danger relentlessly pounds on the doors, Sloane begins to see the world through the eyes of those who actually want to live and takes matters into her own hands.','/oZqxDDByIei1UVDgw7ZBXJCHHtI.jpg','2026-02-20',102,'Released','School\'s out for the zombie apocalypse.','This Is Not a Test',1428990,5.6567,5.6,'DXAjPhglafE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38635,_binary '\0','/lnUZ7XaKQ9JJULhMuR5A4SMEdwF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3567194',6.4,2745,'en','Red Dog: True Blue','When eleven-year-old Mick is shipped off to his grandfather\'s cattle station in Western Australia, he befriends a scrappy, one-of-a-kind dog that will change his life forever.','/xdiOalO1uNG0avUk51UwfyeTP1v.jpg','2016-12-26',88,'Released','Every legend has a beginning.','Red Dog: True Blue',403570,3.5026,6.6,'tlMpALk85DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38636,_binary '\0','/qY7zVZ7liULhfRoXg4c9Xl83LcR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35672862',6.7,62628,'en','Hokum','When novelist Ohm Bauman retreats to a remote inn to scatter his parents\' ashes, he is consumed by tales of a witch haunting the honeymoon suite. Disturbing visions and a shocking disappearance forces him to confront dark corners of his past.','/x6rHcQFiYcczLQPrmxXPAicm54E.jpg','2026-04-29',108,'Released','We\'ve been expecting you.','Hokum',1430077,21.2671,6.837,'jP2nDyQWBOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38637,_binary '\0','/o51GktmDgLPLYFXn7iZDQxmNHPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3567288',6.3,179180,'en','The Visit','A brother and sister are sent to their grandparents\' remote Pennsylvania farm for a week, where they discover that the elderly couple is involved in something deeply disturbing.','/hDrToKMpKYTdwdpOhshL8ko6WVp.jpg','2015-09-10',94,'Released','No one loves you like your grandparents.','The Visit',298312,9.7118,6.3,'YfQnRjkuvaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38638,_binary '\0','/tYT4DdVw1utDPE4QIsBHxlKHai8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35672930',5.4,1589,'en','Sidelined 2: Intercepted','Freshman star quarterback Drayton struggles with the weight of expectations after a devastating setback, while dancer Dallas begins to question the future she thought she wanted. As their high school relationship begins to unravel under the pressures of distance and self-discovery, they’ll learn that the bravest versions of themselves emerge when they let life redirect them.','/sEIP1pTVXa8BJaYSuVeVG3wFN10.jpg','2025-11-27',100,'Released','When it\'s all on the line, hold on tight.','Sidelined 2: Intercepted',1429520,9.427,7.085,'CMjCOp6bRwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38639,_binary '\0','/8nchwqjrC1YGT8aNNsHtGz87VTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35674521',6.3,3251,'en','Rose of Nevada','When a fishing boat, the Rose of Nevada, lost with all hands 30 years ago, mysteriously reappears in the old harbour of a forgotten Cornish village, for those who remember, it’s surely a sign. The boat must go out to sea again and maybe then the luck of the devastated village will turn. Young father Nick and enigmatic newcomer Liam join captain Murgey, and they head to sea. But when they return, satisfied with their haul, something is amiss – they’ve slipped back in time, and the villagers greet them as if they are the original crew.','/1x34FPfKP8uYO7LlzopbHpJFGAh.jpg','2026-04-24',114,'Released',NULL,'Rose of Nevada',1399525,4.1235,6.181,'HafsUWXP3UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38640,_binary '\0','/yd7QS0Ru4GQqRMnKvxgfxfOOdyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35674559',5.5,2910,'ta','ஜென்டில்வுமன்','A major turnaround of events takes place in the lives of Aravind and Poorni, a newly married intimate couple, when her sister visits for a job interview. Aravind mysteriously disappears, leading to revelations of his affair with a client. As authorities investigate, tensions rise between the women amid growing suspicions.','/xbF4NfyaQra7GkGR5OZAWglVhUE.jpg','2025-03-07',113,'Released',NULL,'Gentlewoman',1431043,0.7609,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38641,_binary '\0','/f30alhDnRnqXxZc6GIc2blDHsyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3567666',4.8,6209,'en','Stratton','A British Special Boat Service commando tracks down an international terrorist cell.','/iH5ioYSYZiWI2cCaYmCikaNcSP3.jpg','2017-07-06',94,'Released','The enemy has a weapon. So do we.','Stratton',348389,4.1433,5,'a5ulfQrF578','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38642,_binary '\0','/ciDzjGb8xSubQ9pBdQeN71EeEHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3568002',7,4836,'en','The Witness','A brother\'s journey to unravel the truth about the mythic death and little known life of Kitty Genovese, who was reportedly murdered in front of 38 witnesses and has become the face of urban apathy.','/6dtcCLAsIfQaqrjtLoO3qjF3sDK.jpg','2015-10-06',86,'Released',NULL,'The Witness',356332,0.9986,6.6,'KIDL_tY84IY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38643,_binary '\