prison to court, a police officer learns about the chain of events that led to the young man\'s conviction for violence.','/mltVJD7mBayiw1BubwUL0cx6T1c.jpg','2025-12-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Sirai',1487142,2.2031,6.545,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38647,_binary '\0','/nUMxXcgdQOtphcObnIbokw7dRZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35692176',6.2,1238,'tr','Cam Sehpa','When Zehra and İbrahim, a couple adjusting to new parenthood, argue over a coffee table, it seems like a harmless domestic spat. Wanting to assert himself for once, İbrahim insists on buying it. But when he’s left alone to assemble it, he makes a single irreversible mistake — and begins spiraling into a pit of lies, panic, and performative calm as he tries to hide the truth from the people he loves the most.','/keGMCONOSK0omAk1uMdilSftePd.jpg','2026-02-20',88,'Released','You’ll laugh… and then regret it!','The Turkish Coffee Table',1408493,1.6847,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38648,_binary '\0','/v8zOcynvSd6IW3FzZrvst2HJ53s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3569230',6.9,226872,'en','Legend','Suave, charming and volatile, Reggie Kray and his unstable twin brother Ronnie start to leave their mark on the London underworld in the 1960s. Using violence to get what they want, the siblings orchestrate robberies and murders while running nightclubs and protection rackets. With police Detective Leonard \"Nipper\" Read hot on their heels, the brothers continue their rapid rise to power and achieve tabloid notoriety.','/4shf5Alq4KWCKqrAAQe0JGJHYp5.jpg','2015-09-09',132,'Released','Love, fight, live, rule like a legend.','Legend',276907,12.667,7,'3pHZpqu8fes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38649,_binary '\0','/tRUGWVtqZfUkSVHueBFfcHAZyPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3569356',3.5,6094,'en','Not Cool','Former prom king Scott returns home for Thanksgiving break and gets dumped by his long-term girlfriend. With his world turned upside down, Scott strikes an unlikely friendship with former classmate Tori, an ugly duckling who blossomed in her first semester of college, and they embark on an outrageous adventure through their hometown. But when Scott and Tori start falling in love, they realize that a few months away may have changed them more than they realized.','/ikLuZGHTYTVYHDBPsN8dPnoVnYd.jpg','2014-09-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Not Cool',292483,1.9946,3.3,'nqRxlXWu-E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38650,_binary '\0','/pmh5zE5vRGrJ6GVidKLaHJK0Uf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35694565',6.2,3195,'te','సింగిల్','Vijay, a bank employee, falls in love with Purva at first sight and attempts to get closer to her in hopes of winning her affection. Meanwhile, Harini who secretly harbours feelings for Vijay, begins to follow him—turning his love life into a comedic triangle.','/3cX5JISvLrOrwfb0gCOV7Mz7if0.jpg','2025-05-09',127,'Released',NULL,'#Single',1428301,1.7781,5.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38651,_binary '\0','/sv12y5tWaE4seAy53tMbCapvSE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35695538',7.3,2613,'en','My Father\'s Shadow','Two young brothers explore Lagos with their estranged father during the 1993 Nigerian election crisis, witnessing both the city\'s magnitude and their father\'s daily struggles as political unrest threatens their journey home.','/aF8AFFh3LJpF8An0KUM8SdTwfVt.jpg','2025-09-19',93,'Released',NULL,'My Father\'s Shadow',1432605,3.4306,7.3,'50ICTaEuQxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38652,_binary '\0','/ydXxKE3km4qsoqunO6g5SpbKhD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3569782',8.2,14962,'ta','ஜிகர்தண்டா','A budding director endeavors to research a merciless gangster for making a film on gangsterism. But his secret attempts to conduct the research fail when he gets caught for snooping.','/oDcQE70RYc78iBYgHRknl64QKTu.jpg','2014-08-01',170,'Released','A Gangster Musical Story','Jigarthanda',270766,1.9753,7.6,'_T8n-EHr4ZE','YouTube','Trai