When she discovers that there is a health problem behind it, everything takes an unexpected turn: food tastes better, music reaches her like never before, and desire awakens her will to live without fear.','/xveTFM80yTfN1lYQibdqQE0Kc8C.jpg','2025-10-09',122,'Released','A love letter to life.','Three Goodbyes',1433339,2.9728,7.053,'u_dMDb43-Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38656,_binary '\0','/99kPumVhMd5r7z2zVKavqDeq2uX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35705898',6.9,8797,'gu','Jai Mata ji Let\'s Rock','An 80-year-old woman faces four wild options after a government program disrupts her life: revenge on family, rekindling romance, living luxuriously, or choosing it all in this comedy about family surprises','/vG47TunjxEWW2fqFRhbtElUpoqI.jpg','2025-05-09',118,'Released',NULL,'Jai Mata ji Let\'s Rock',1478613,0.8764,0,'uktY5jB0QUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38657,_binary '\0','/qxOnOEKlrwd8b5krR456OFE1Bm3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35705915',7.6,2691,'en','Andrew Schulz: LIFE','In this razor-sharp yet heartfelt special, Andrew Schulz unpacks the wildest moment of his life — becoming a father.','/yA2LhLNIW5tUGyLtaMuLg9NvvBJ.jpg','2025-03-03',60,'Released',NULL,'Andrew Schulz: LIFE',1435760,6.2889,7.3,'03LyjOA3ztM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38658,_binary '\0','/hR0QpzOO2Gx1Lt7KxqKFWZvj5Vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35712605',7.8,2293,'ta','ஜி.டி.என்','G.D. Naidu overcomes challenges and defies a repressive colonial regime to become one of India\'s greatest innovators.','/aAbvbKbNU6YyYDZ5ntSQcOygliw.jpg','2026-08-07',147,'Released','Feared by the British... forgotten by his countrymen.','G.D.N',1489543,6.9827,6,'DC11NRrn9Vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38659,_binary '\0','/1M8MgXc9UifZFA8qeC2gG4UCQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35715953',6.7,5076,'en','Urchin','Mike, a rough sleeper in London, is trapped in a cycle of self-destruction as he attempts to turn his life around. Along the way, he encounters unexpected chances for a fresh start.','/zc8n3hm3S2VxFxlNH1MNN28LVMa.jpg','2025-10-03',99,'Released','You\'re going to be just fine.','Urchin',1283320,5.4163,6.8,'4cJL6vmYOeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38660,_binary '\0','/dFdFQaffaBNBNM5hzinc6Q0oWDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35718349',4.6,1583,'en','Relationship Goals','When TV producer Leah Caldwell aims to become the first woman running New York\'s top morning show, her ex competes for the same role. Leah stays focused on her career, until chemistry with her ex challenges her priorities.','/o7dVxvZIKnAB7k1eeeWp2k14Es7.jpg','2026-02-04',96,'Released','Work just got complicated.','Relationship Goals',1433842,6.4501,6.4,'MeCJampyYW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38661,_binary '\0','/8v7CBqnCIyaQejMV8rh87NjX5sE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3572132',5.1,1938,'ja','呪怨－終わりの始まり－','A school teacher visits the home of a boy who\'s been absent from school for a long period of time, unaware of the horrific tragedy which occurred in the boy\'s household many years ago.','/d9AWoR6Goi1ZQH9K8EZy8VDi0zF.jpg','2014-06-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Ju-on: The Beginning of the End',259233,2.6006,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38662,_binary '\0','/jLncLuPE5kOascGrvN39jgQHVJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35723557',7.1,5962,'ta','இதயம் முரளி','A young man navigates the complexities of unrequited love, finding that even as years pass and life takes unexpected turns, certain emotions remain deeply embedded in his heart.','/89FVZLNurx7Y0lhGrwYXyRHmKnh.jpg','2026-07-10',164,'Released','The One Side','Idhayam Murali',1432631,5.7285,6.3,'7RCeBn0n9IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38663,_binary '\0','/jwWLS6N6hePsR9UrL67MQN9MGwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35727678',4.7,3845,'hi','एक दीवाने की दीवानियत','When Vikramaditya, a powerful politician falls for a strong-willed superstar Adaa , their passionate romance quickly spirals into a dangerous game of obsession and pride. As emotions clash and tempers rise, Adaa makes a life-altering choice.','/eQGzsELM0n6FOngNRGEIx9nqDwV.jpg','2025-10-21',141,'Released',NULL,'Ek Deewane Ki Deewaniyat',1434543,2.4529,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38664,_binary '\0','/ohp0ZrioXFTe3v9HyqSiN510DAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3573598',5.2,2334,'en','London Road','London Road is a musical drama that documents the events of 2006, when the quiet rural town of Ipswich was shattered by the discovery of the bodies of five women. The residents of London Road had struggled for years with frequent soliciting and kerb-crawling on their street. When a local resident was charged and then convicted of the murders, the community grappled with what it meant to be at the epicentre of this tragedy.','/8t4KNPc7SOecTWHf6IkKhQWYxgt.jpg','2015-06-12',91,'Released',NULL,'London Road',328483,1.5063,5.5,'EdqidjIsSu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38665,_binary '\0','/ufVCGoqEHOCahpXwDguGIq8CxAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35741123',6,1287,'ta','ஹார்டின்','Fate tosses a couple into an unexpected situation with an ex-girlfriend in the mix.','/7xvMocNLZov64aOU1X3BRWawjD7.jpg','2026-06-26',119,'Released',NULL,'Heartin',1434102,1.6105,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38666,_binary '\0','/53lN3qoCbrYcfhKdSKf5POpJYEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3575156',5.6,1602,'ta','மத கஜ ராஜா','Raja, a witty and fearless young man, becomes entangled in a conflict with a corrupt industrialist while trying to protect his family, friends and the woman he loves.','/hrOnr0eIdBI2Zpeh4EMLmWe58XA.jpg','2025-01-12',142,'Released',NULL,'Madha Gaja Raja',280951,1.6162,4,'VxwoH2YrtzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38667,_binary '\0','/AdHUsmg3zh1N5eTPoOh8ip9NP2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3576038',6.9,1937,'en','The Search for General Tso','From New York City to the farmlands of the Midwest, there are 50,000 Chinese restaurants in the U.S., yet one dish in particular has conquered the American culinary landscape with a force befitting its military moniker—“General Tso’s Chicken.” But who was General Tso and how did this dish become so ubiquitous? Ian Cheney’s delightfully insightful documentary charts the history of Chinese Americans through the surprising origins of this sticky, sweet, just-spicy-enough dish that we’ve adopted as our own.','/wSPlCpa4LMN3xYNBdW6XcFUcSGu.jpg','2014-04-20',71,'Released',NULL,'The Search for General Tso',261041,0.8584,6.4,'7z0hmBIR8BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38668,_binary '\0','/sSjyXL9xngmHQXtiOO6xOS3NfGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3576060',6.8,1768,'en','Point and Shoot','At first glance, Matthew VanDyke—a shy Baltimore native with a sheltered upbringing and a tormenting OCD diagnosis—is the last person you’d imagine on the front lines of the 2011 Libyan revolution. But after finishing grad school and escaping the U.S. for \"a crash course in manhood,\" a winding path leads him just there. Motorcycling across North Africa and the Middle East and spending time as an embedded journalist in Iraq, Matthew lands in Libya, forming an unexpected kinship with a group of young men who transform his life. Matthew joins his friends in the rebel army against Gaddafi, taking up arms (and a camera). Along the way, he is captured and held in solitary confinement for six terrifying months.','/6hUKnGZTVK8Hyx1mMluX0qMMlac.jpg','2014-04-19',82,'Released',NULL,'Point and Shoot',264166,0.7345,6.4,'kyhYl7tOQr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38669,_binary '\0','/5rop1hL6sCQZy3vqBOqrmHLRPBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3576084',7.2,4807,'he','אפס ביחסי אנוש','Filmmaker Talya Lavie steps into the spotlight with a dark comedy about everyday life for a unit of young female Israeli soldiers. The human resources office at a remote desert base serves as the setting for this cast of characters, who bide their time pushing paper, battling for the top score in Minesweeper, and counting down the minutes until they can return to civilian life. Amidst their boredom and clashing personalities, issues of commitment—from friendship to love and country—are handled with humor and sharp-edged wit.','/o47GwtgXRD6k8qxcJseQK2Fa9C0.jpg','2014-06-26',97,'Released',NULL,'Zero Motivation',261825,1.1316,6.4,'SV4ptfyaQFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38670,_binary '\0','/9MJifKtwH3hSDPSqguyvFfgdmtA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35766629',6.7,10826,'en','Goodbye June','Four siblings\' lives change drastically when their ailing mother takes a turn for the worse over the holiday season.','/ygsMOnttVCekvJZgvmnvaemxPHA.jpg','2025-12-12',116,'Released','A good goodbye... It\'s all that matters.','Goodbye June',1435092,7.9673,6.5,'vIDoYSWCuzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38671,_binary '\0','/tBY8hN4inRzOwUwfvhBUHo00pIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3576728',7.5,19385,'en','Bilal: A New Breed of Hero','A thousand years ago, one boy with a dream of becoming a great warrior is abducted with his sister and taken to a land far away from home. Thrown into a world where greed and injustice rule all, Bilal finds the courage to raise his voice and make a change. Inspired by true events, this is a story of a real hero who earned his remembrance in time and history.','/ncWuEzxnXqssxRfHghZuUAIezCo.jpg','2016-09-08',109,'Released','The power of one','Bilal: A New Breed of Hero',332718,5.6444,6.8,'VhrZBHwOMUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38672,_binary '\0','/n2yg9V0XQLuyn8euNxyKfyZfF0G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3576842',6.5,1671,'es','Elvira, te daría mi vida pero la estoy usando','Elvira had a fight with her husband, he went to purchase some cigarettes but he never came back, now Elvira is searching for him.','/AsN46YJ0OvzA0gPMQNNT10GUhye.jpg','2014-10-24',101,'Released',NULL,'Elvira I Will Give You My Life But I\'m Using It',267797,1.5821,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38673,_binary '\0','/fTnBp9hqcnKfZ56ccwxxZ2iogGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3577624',6.8,24793,'en','A Perfect Day','Somewhere in the Balkans, 1995. A team of aid workers must solve an apparently simple problem in an almost completely pacified territory that has been devastated by a cruel war, but some of the local inhabitants, the retreating combatants, the UN forces, many cows and an absurd bureaucracy will not cease to put obstacles in their way.','/musAGdMpfvxhNvEnxXgmzcjBxWL.jpg','2015-08-28',106,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Day',321751,6.3132,6.7,'I7-c66mbzXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38674,_binary '\0','/lqThNsJ3NUsIZDLvbts6n9YESVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3578504',6.7,4268,'en','Korengal','Korengal picks up where Restrepo left off; the same men, the same valley, the same commanders, but a very different look at the experience of war.','/kTJF1NOX0HYCRmiuM42F7qjZOxW.jpg','2014-05-30',84,'Released','This is what war feels like','Korengal',267872,1.5764,6.6,'_lsLV8vPB-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38675,_binary '\0','/oDvmpIo6zBalZw3wOqTnA3IegOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3578794',7.6,1262,'en','Robot Chicken DC Comics Special II: Villains in Paradise','The Robot Chicken crew takes a peek at what happens when the DC villains end up on the same beach as the DC heroes on spring break!','/oeM92UDXNqvOcm5fpTeWsyGKsuX.jpg','2014-04-06',22,'Released',NULL,'Robot Chicken DC Comics Special II: Villains in Paradise',263484,1.706,6.8,'KuRhuT_y3ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38676,_binary '\0','/jYAojzHx3RxX7RrrMHUfzCvOLYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3579250',6.3,1466,'en','The Tree That Saved Christmas','Twenty years after saving a frail sapling from a cutting crew, Molly Logan learns that the bank is foreclosing on her parents\' Christmas tree farm. Can the tree she spared rescue the holiday?','/aRyeyXgKLSdEEWoswbN5PW5PmPl.jpg','2014-11-30',90,'Released','Miracles do come true.','The Tree That Saved Christmas',307022,1.8487,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38677,_binary '\0','/gE2mT5Abyb0em6xqsgqJlJ3dvXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3579488',5.2,1384,'en','For Better or For Worse','Wendy is finally settling in to single life after the death of her husband. She runs a successful wedding planning company with the help of her friend Roseanne. Wendy\'s business and values are challenged when Marco, a charming but irritating divorce attorney, opens shop right next door!','/dw4af3Ybdk6e6OdR2EYrmL7bx0q.jpg','2014-07-19',84,'Released',NULL,'For Better or For Worse',284166,2.2992,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38678,_binary '\0','/9R2YxSFjA3JEYFVYXfc4X7PAK8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3579524',7.1,3235,'ja','攻殻機動隊ARISE border:3 Ghost Tears','Posing as lovers on vacation, Motoko and Batou work to try to stop a terrorist organization whose symbol is the Scrasath. Meanwhile, Togusa investigates a murder of a man who possessed a prosthetic leg manufactured by the Mermaid\'s Leg corporation.','/nrMr4ht4CgX4tyseN1uYVHXENJN.jpg','2014-06-28',59,'Released',NULL,'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 3: Ghost Tears',240341,3.8853,6.792,'1o0HSqtLT-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38679,_binary '\0','/pP3r67XAzSppcswU0CP49yZgMot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3579808',6.9,2052,'ru','Страна ОЗ','In Yekaterinburg over the Christmas period, shop assistant Lenka Shabadinova experiences a number of incredible events and unexpected meetings.','/yPcejuI7ouDpDwc9Na2szgxfgZ1.jpg','2015-06-10',95,'Released',NULL,'The Land of OZ',370902,2.0481,6,'bMJ8GbCJHyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38680,_binary '\0','/4iUbPG0YuoH4u55WjhPieFWv1C1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3579990',6.6,2274,'ko','피끓는 청춘','A comedy romance movie about the last generation of youths and their passionate romance based in Hongseong, Chungcheong Namdo in the 1980s.','/cgs8jEDecLuRVCM49qDbeBvGblC.jpg','2014-01-22',121,'Released','Totally Energized.','Hot Young Bloods',252067,2.5286,7.064,'GlS4-FmaJZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38681,_binary '\0','/nP9ELJ8KYUTZzq0YmKTGOjk3qar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3580052',6.2,1833,'en','Trailer Park Boys: Live in F**kin\' Dublin','The boys head to Ireland after winning a contest to see Rush but are arrested by immigration and must perform a community service puppet show.','/f0yLbxDO44HRow75vJUSyZfidr9.jpg','2014-05-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Trailer Park Boys: Live in F**kin\' Dublin',274326,1.1363,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38682,_binary '\0','/ktSsmJ6h2IeQgxFwUOQ9ZOxbUP3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3580748',6.2,2241,'en','Tyson\'s Run','When fifteen-year-old Tyson attends public school for the first time, his life is changed forever. While helping his father clean up after the football team, Tyson befriends champion marathon runner Aklilu. Never letting his autism hold him back, Tyson becomes determined to run his first marathon in hopes of winning his father\'s approval. With the help of an unlikely friend and his parents, Tyson learns that with faith in yourself and the courage to take the first step, anything is possible.','/n1YApVTO1gHudv7avTRSSvUqIDR.jpg','2022-03-04',103,'Released','With each step comes the determination to take another.','Tyson\'s Run',860852,3.1379,7.704,'hEqSj5esw7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38683,_binary '\0','/exnFsbb9c3fDutTsgtJSWcDmZm0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3581652',7.1,144993,'en','West Side Story','Two youngsters from rival New York City gangs fall in love, but tensions between their respective friends build toward tragedy.','/yfz3IUoYYSY32tkb97HlUBGFsnh.jpg','2021-12-08',156,'Released','A city divided. Their love will challenge everything.','West Side Story',511809,10.3869,6.905,'09GTCZvsk0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38684,_binary '\0','/4AX0SJKG1aA2PMaixK6mOoOKEfx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35820129',5.7,1353,'de','Mission Santa – Ein Elf rettet Weihnachten','An underdog elf, driven by his unwavering passion for the holidays, becomes the North Pole\'s only hope of saving Christmas from a vengeful hacker.','/t0OORtaTEQGbkATnR0Qfa5t4wgP.jpg','2025-11-06',91,'Released','Where every wish is just a click away!','Mission Santa: Yoyo To The Rescue',1455686,1.8442,5.2,'AlQq_lAiceQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38685,_binary '\0','/dJDQp5KVM0AeyiM4IWlkwrYJJma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3582020',6.5,3376,'en','Jawbone','A former youth boxing champion, Jimmy McCabe is a man in search of hope but looking in all the wrong places. When he hits rock bottom he turns to his childhood boxing club and the only family he has left: gym owner Bill corner man Eddie and promoter Joe. Back in training, years after anyone thought he was a contender, he risks his life, as he tries to stand tall and regain his place in the world.','/kvL3CZRILLJ9STxRadGXI0MOeac.jpg','2017-05-12',91,'Released',NULL,'Jawbone',436932,2.545,6.1,'6lsnYP-8zd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38686,_binary '\0','/dfH7tbHEujr5o7yVKEduCbzgCt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35825882',5.1,1706,'tr','Kalender Pide','Kalender runs a small restaurant, inherited from his father. Ten years ago, after the death of his wife, he became increasingly withdrawn. He\'s averse to innovation and averse to taking risks, and his shop is struggling. The recent opening of a new-generation restaurant, Pidburger, only makes things worse. However, with the arrival of Öcü, a transformation begins, and they embark on numerous adventures to save the shop.','/wJ8wb0b4v8msHcZKqSjOY3WECCZ.jpg','2025-05-02',106,'Released',NULL,'Pita Hall',1471161,2.0466,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38687,_binary '\0','/yU85xdxN3rmt4RgGPb2na1SSjdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35829169',5.6,1247,'de','Fabian und die mörderische Hochzeit','Hapless con artist Fabian crashes a quirky winter wedding, planning to steal a valuable gift meant for the bride. But when a murder disrupts his scheme, Fabian finds himself unexpectedly drawn into solving the mystery. A thrilling murder mystery comedy packed with dark secrets.','/2T4gc5njZ0JJVYLn6Q8VxS9RoM6.jpg','2026-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Fabian and the Deadly Wedding',1436061,4.9861,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38688,_binary '\0','/nfNaAiiILjYRc2CKkId1ZfPTtlh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35836025',7.3,5347,'ta','விஸ்வநாத் & சன்ஸ்','A celebrated Olympian shooter travels to America looking for a donor to help his sick child — but unexpected romance complicates his search.','/mLsvCffzpxxDwC7yVLJSLLjgzoq.jpg','2026-08-14',161,'Released',NULL,'Vishwanath & Sons',1408162,32.2695,7.109,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38689,_binary '\0','/6Ur2AfJX7i83WaxkLTWNgoArGQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3584354',5.6,3886,'en','Man Vs.','As host of his own hit TV series, \'MAN VS\', Doug Woods is forced to fend for himself for five days in remote locations with no crew, food, or water, only the cameras he carries on his back to film his experiences. Doug\'s in the remote woods for a routine episode, until he\'s awoken by an earth-shaking crash. Things get weirder as it becomes clear Doug isn\'t alone. Someone or something is watching him.','/k7neRfPEhjruZIBg99Sqs0yBVUk.jpg','2015-11-13',85,'Released','5 days surviving in the wild. This time he might not be alone.','Man Vs.',343112,1.2275,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38690,_binary '\0','/7cQKUEcRkw2EeK7KDn8eRqS3XkC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3584496',4.3,11336,'en','Mermaid Down','A mermaid is ripped from the ocean by a fishing crew only to be tortured and to have her tail cut off. A seemingly helpful stranger intervenes, but then locks her away in an institution for mentally disturbed young women, where no one believes she is a mermaid. With no way out, she is forced to count on her survival instincts, and fight for her life at all costs.','/oB281saxibom0KC3Ndz81aJJtaa.jpg','2019-10-15',91,'Released','They exist.','Mermaid Down',504631,3.6033,6.4,'a821lgf7HhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38691,_binary '\0','/5R4KbfpKWXbhiEZTV3RmZ0uZGgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3585004',5.3,1485,'zh','钟馗伏魔：雪妖魔灵','The story of Chinese legendary anti-hero Zhong Kui, a young man endowed with mysterious powers who is forced into a battle among the realms of Heaven, Earth and Hell in the course of his attempt to save his countrymen and the woman he loves.','/mqnmSE5OMzBKbQw8iyKnaQ6nVdI.jpg','2015-02-19',118,'Released',NULL,'Zhongkui: Snow Girl and the Dark Crystal',299822,2.1834,5,'ra3f7CNhj78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38692,_binary '\0','/9pdoEzieGdUTlRWTAO7QP8q1tIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35851026',6.5,1376,'ko','야당','Navigating both the criminal underworld and law enforcement agencies, professional snitches called \"yadang\" provide covert information about the drug world to prosecutors and police. When a drug bust at a party attended by high-profile second-generation VIPs entangles those involved into a dangerous conspiracy, a seasoned yadang must do everything in his power not just to make it out on top, but alive.','/y7dsDbG8zVWkrkyOhA6ckZXX1uC.jpg','2025-04-16',123,'Released','Blowing the nation\'s drug scene wide open.','Yadang: The Snitch',1137179,4.1166,6.894,'qdgVwlTaVC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38693,_binary '\0','/xUraEpm9EoxqGLeRK1J13RUAYi2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35851696',8.7,1332,'mr','आता थांबायचा नाय!','Based on a true story, employees at the Brihanmumbai Municipal Corporation are concerned about potential layoffs. However, Assistant Commissioner Uday encourages them to enroll in night school to complete their education for a better future.','/p5MdqQBW9bk3g5WkNjxUk55fWeI.jpg','2025-05-01',138,'Released',NULL,'Ata Thambaycha Naay!',1446710,0.7491,7,'WzJSgij42lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38694,_binary '\0','/pS7VXwb1sNk79F5GzgtEP5YzEHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35856133',8,1601,'fr','La Bataille de Gaulle - Partie 2 : J’écris ton nom','Part two of a two-part biopic following French army officer Charles De Gaulle\'s life and political commitment between 1940 and 1945, and trace his development towards a political career.','/tcypmwT43pt5jWiUyy2BomyPD1Y.jpg','2026-06-26',159,'Released',NULL,'De Gaulle: Liberté',1165369,9.6049,7.796,'J6MRNchmZkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38695,_binary '\0','/71AoDrq47CetxlGeWa1rHnKepLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3587396',7.7,3633,'en','Only the Dead','A searing account of war correspondent Michael Ware\'s seven years reporting in Iraq--an extraordinary journey that takes him into the darkest recesses of the Iraq War and the human soul.','/ozqfofwYfzjh5AneTArpr68yuX4.jpg','2015-06-11',78,'Released','How Far Would You Go to Understand the True Nature of War','Only the Dead',344170,1.0175,7.4,'iubIoXda8Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38696,_binary '\0','/m4FEubjmtytpMDchQfDmbJKHOG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35882698',6.8,5159,'en','The Twister: Caught in the Storm','In May 2011, a massive tornado ripped through Joplin, Missouri. With pulse-pounding firsthand footage, this documentary goes inside a deadly twister.','/ggXb37lX9gW4SR7kpMaraXDFeFR.jpg','2025-03-18',89,'Released',NULL,'The Twister: Caught in the Storm',1437446,2.9322,6.711,'2o0eLtapwr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38697,_binary '\0','/n3F2O09BBD3juuAYzV6pSc4T0Xa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3588588',3.8,6032,'en','Backtrace','The lone surviving thief of a violent armored car robbery is sprung from a high security facility and administered an experimental drug.','/gM14jePY6dxg3ORWJCJN3YpQOWh.jpg','2018-12-14',92,'Released','Some crimes never let you go.','Backtrace',512412,3.8588,4.946,'INDleu1aHyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38698,_binary '\0','/4BSJVRQ3EsHMIVZSiKz1l58jDhg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35892608',5.9,34235,'en','undertone','The host of a popular paranormal podcast becomes haunted by terrifying recordings mysteriously sent her way.','/2PFgFMnrdCPXWiZl1PUvky7Mo9D.jpg','2026-03-12',94,'Released','It wants to be heard.','undertone',1480387,16.2904,6,'1_TRSEcMvR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38699,_binary '\0','/hAKmqmL4o4lybYUduFmAPXSI5Ts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3589450',6.4,2132,'ko','몬스터','Bok-Soon runs a street stall, cares for her younger sister, and is feared by many because of her quick temper. When Tae-Soo murders her sister, rage consumes her completely as she stalks the killer.','/9Y1zHJ227zOWqv5OMXG3WrijqVA.jpg','2014-03-13',113,'Released','If I find you, you\'re dead.','Monster',259129,2.3243,6.6,'X2w-zAihnnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38700,_binary '\0','/aT37cVXZI0UzVvqqKRmcmaoGKs2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3590482',8.4,3235,'gu','બે યાર','In the desperation to earn quick money, two best friends put their moral values at stake and end up losing their pride and dignity. They then choose a wrong path to set things right and snatch back what was rightfully theirs.','/8CpqWJ6sQ7o0wS2prgI5RWzpeZO.jpg','2014-08-29',155,'Released',NULL,'Bey Yaar',299049,0.8948,7.6,'aRyNGHbNsaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38701,_binary '\0','/AtBwNjgIXTIEvyfuKRk8ex3bKiF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3591436',6.2,2784,'en','Night Owls','After workaholic Kevin has a drunken one night stand with the beautiful train-wreck Madeline, he\'s horrified to discover that she\'s actually his boss\' jilted ex-mistress. When she takes a bottle of sleeping pills, Kevin is forced to keep her awake... and over the course of the night the two begin to fall for each other.','/wRzddgMNFWfoYbE0hiyWxYNt5Gg.jpg','2015-12-04',92,'Released',NULL,'Night Owls',324291,1.9477,6.2,'Ku4RjA3uir4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38702,_binary '\0','/2l9yXhNtLC5SHa81m3MtLfpoXTr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3591568',7.2,1930,'en','Marvel Studios: Assembling a Universe','A look at the story behind Marvel Studios and the Marvel Cinematic Universe, featuring interviews and behind-the-scenes footage from all of the Marvel films, the Marvel One-Shots and \"Marvel\'s Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\"!','/41Ke02UzYoPsiTc3YbomPGiQKMl.jpg','2014-03-18',43,'Released',NULL,'Marvel Studios: Assembling a Universe',259910,3.8978,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38703,_binary '\0','/qVgxgT0e360pkY6q9pmXf9MIizp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35918041',8.7,3443,'te','Pelli Kaani Prasad','A son\'s marriage aspirations collide with his father\'s traditional dowry expectations, leading to a journey of spiritual guidance and family reconciliation.','/CjXfBkDHv1ESLBuTIlbRaRvaGB.jpg','2025-03-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Pelli Kaani Prasad',1449928,0.7721,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38704,_binary '\0','/olz73f1yVWu5JlLDi8lI98Yekvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35919514',7,1383,'en','Fukushima: A Nuclear Nightmare','The definitive account of Japan’s struggle as it faced a nuclear catastrophe while still reeling from the devastation of an earthquake and tsunami.','/nL2f1g1cMPUsPmFWB71qHqjyVFd.jpg','2026-02-20',90,'Released','Nine days to save a nation.','Fukushima: A Nuclear Nightmare',1439660,3.0098,6.971,'aKTmUdQQoZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38705,_binary '\0','/GTiP96n6NYfN91CF0S92PSKxl0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3591984',7,2254,'ru','Белые ночи почтальона Алексея Тряпицына','The film represents life in a godforsaken Russian village. The only way to reach the mainland is to cross the lake by boat and a postman became the only connection with the outside world. A reserved community has been set up here. Despite the modern technologies and a spaceport nearby the people of the village live the way they would in the Neolithic Era. There is neither government nor social services or jobs. The postman\'s beloved woman escapes the village life and moves to the city. Postman\'s outboard engine gets stolen and he can no longer deliver mail. His normal pattern of life is disrupted. The postman makes a decision to leave for the city too but returns before long with no certain reason. The script is based on real characters\' stories. People from the village play their own parts in the film. The search for the protagonist lasted for over a year.','/4oGXORt06TvdkTCPE7JJ5xykG0j.jpg','2014-10-14',90,'Released',NULL,'The Postman\'s White Nights',283703,2.9199,6.698,'fHLEzHkk64I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38706,_binary '\0','/qUTXVONhIelFdBXvSJW6rPWv9LN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35922832',8.3,2369,'en','Ozzy: No Escape from Now','Ozzy Osbourne faces his identity and mortality after his world stops. Dealing with health issues and Parkinson\'s, he questions if he can perform again while music remains his life\'s cornerstone.','/7xlmn0xpEYiqGN7bINAbEUjNqbr.jpg','2025-10-07',120,'Released','An intimate look at Ozzy\'s final act.','Ozzy: No Escape from Now',1508191,2.7513,8.3,'RxBYxFZccks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38707,_binary '\0','/9Mu7BXpYD8CN22NBXjGOEayD9QW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35927674',7.3,2886,'ar','سيكو سيكو','Two cousins, both from a middle-class background, finally see their dream come true when their inheritance is rightfully returned to them following their uncle’s death. Soon after, and to their shock, they discover that the inheritance is in the form of illegal goods. To liquidate these goods, they create an elaborate mobile game to sell them through it. They call this game… “Siko Siko”. The cousins enjoy a brief moment of spectacular success before a mob boss appears in their lives, claiming to be the real owner of the goods!','/rIld9XgXWS7YYZOdJf6O1KPLYYV.jpg','2025-03-30',120,'Released',NULL,'Siko Siko',1316416,2.3173,7.474,'dLSdsqr2rQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38708,_binary '\0','/r4QdvtKyjj0tk8ozI01oVnZHYn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3593046',6,4642,'en','Lost in the Sun','A small time crook and a newly-orphaned teenage boy team up to perform a string of robberies.','/hANP0oWUR1B0uiHB7no2jsjhsoN.jpg','2015-11-06',95,'Released','How far can one man go?','Lost in the Sun',360203,3.2861,5.901,'fpp5m6c0-jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38709,_binary '\0','/zDeysedOIBBJ5487HQRr0hf9aWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35931046',7.2,1460,'en','Bono: Stories of Surrender','Through words, music, and mischief, Bono pulls back the curtain on his deeply personal experiences that have shaped him as a son, father, husband, activist, and U2 frontman.','/9Xv9uRyeYO1xwZXOoOI2cdfofrM.jpg','2025-05-16',86,'Released','U2\'s frontman explores life and music in a reimagining of his acclaimed stage show.','Bono: Stories of Surrender',1440718,4.2008,6.8,'p6U1sDbzraE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38710,_binary '\0','/xfdbPe4c6yyZqYQz9TxuaNnmDla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3593120',3.2,1378,'en','The Device','Abby and Rebecca reunite to spread their mother\'s ashes at the family lake house, and uncover the nefarious object that divided them years earlier.','/Au9Z1AX9utgMZQazAHnZG2NQYsS.jpg','2014-12-16',90,'Released','The invasion has begun','The Device',288445,2.3283,3.5,'pHJr4-dD2uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38711,_binary '\0','/2ruHJZW2JaHoMvc4x5ZTv2w0bv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3593926',6.8,2072,'en','The Memory Book','Budding photographer Chloe (Ory) comes from a family of failed romances. At a local flea market, she stumbles upon an old photo album from the 1970s, chronicling the ideal romance of a happy couple (Hindle and Barbeau). Unable to find her own \"true love,\" she sets out to find the couple in the album and prove that true love exists. Along the way, she meets Gabe Sinclair (Macfarlane), a mysterious, but charming bartender, who seizes the opportunity to join Chloe\'s mission and soon finds himself falling in love with her. With limited resources, the two go on an adventure, searching for clues that will lead them to the couple, and hopefully to true love. As the search continues, Chloe begins taking an interest in Gabe, but won\'t let these feelings distract her from her mission to find the couple. Will Chloe learn to give up her fear of falling in love and finally find true happiness?','/skuMO29zxv86vIpP7OTdroDa8oy.jpg','2014-07-26',83,'Released',NULL,'The Memory Book',288899,3.6975,6.4,'oTfdUcL2-_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38712,_binary '\0','/rHjNt4SbHYg0Mhs6LTyGWaH7wgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3594826',5.5,2475,'zh','道士下山','A monk leaves his monastery and ventures out into the real world for the first time in his life, and ends up in an adventure with a kung-fu master who is guarding a special artifact.','/eS2wMBnOCBUB3g58andUYIVkICF.jpg','2015-07-03',113,'Released','Ruthless defines a champion, principal creates a hero.','Monk Comes Down the Mountain',345235,3.5767,5.183,'dY00f9yH130','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38713,_binary '\0','/j4oYX4LgNnoRYHnkafGYeyVLULi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35948720',7,5211,'tr','Başka Bir Sen','Mümtaz and Derya are condemned to live out their last moments each day in someone else\'s skin.','/vfEbhAzhKavunGOFiOknVtY0NiD.jpg','2025-03-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Another You',1425617,2.223,6.8,'iZbFfGoeBIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38714,_binary '\0','/3VtmfgtiIO4w8HPSY7xL0sSOCHj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3595298',4.5,26258,'hi','प्रेम रतन धन पायो','While recovering from an assassination attempt four days before his coronation, a stern prince is replaced by a romantic lookalike.','/pCxT9c2E0YhzxsSkweVW2ELO3mS.jpg','2015-11-11',164,'Released',NULL,'Prem Ratan Dhan Payo',362136,1.8951,5.3,'Vd4iNPuRlx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38715,_binary '\0','/uLiSmZ9fgPUXervqksgrwvrrjfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt35955855',6.6,3503,'en','Con Mum','A chef\'s life is upended when a jet-setting, champagne-sipping, hotel-hopping woman claims to be his long-lost mother.','/iA5ZHflyzsxmR09Ce53w9Ng0tIx.jpg','2025-03-24',88,'Released',NULL,'Con Mum',1442440,1.6766,6.8,'vDu1cdkDURM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38716,_binary '\0','/kqxutpfTc3QjFqZ6IMso54Hxtug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3595848',6.3,2287,'en','Northpole','Northpole, the magical city where Santa and his elves live and work is in trouble. Families around the globe have gotten too busy to enjoy the season together, and Northpole depends on their holiday happiness to keep running. In the hopes of turning things around, a determined young elf befriends a little boy with a lot of spirit. His skeptical journalist mom doesn’t have room in her heart for anything but the facts, so it’s going to take a little nudge from his charming teacher to create an unbeatable Christmas team to turn around this town and share the importance of the season with the whole world.','/1J0eisyWjmaZLXYDszjWbNpnKt9.jpg','2014-11-15',81,'Released',NULL,'Northpole',299579,2.3643,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38717,_binary '\0','/5KvBRntpoOXKTHVC01UeVAelwJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3595966',7.5,1712,'es','Conducta','Meet Chala, an eleven year-old boy with a hard life and strong respect for Carmela, his sixth grade teacher. The pair develops a solid bond, but after Carmela suffers an accident, things get complicated…','/rmIZ7OvY5Ey37AnfSdAXkQNKpMV.jpg','2014-01-16',108,'Released',NULL,'Behavior',259460,1.6993,7.517,'Pz-PbXdg_H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38718,_binary '\0','/nc1FxcLeYgVcwut41kZA5SzOlGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3596200',6.6,1358,'en','Trailer Park Boys: Live at the North Pole','Bubbles and the other boys get a letter from a TPB fan club president in Minneapolis, Minnesota to do a live show at the State Theatre for Christmas. Ricky goes along with it to make nice with Santa Jesus God after a rough-up the previous year, while Julian brings along Randy to sell 60/40 raffle tickets and make some money. Mr. Lahey sneaks along to spoil the boys\' fun.','/h4miiFkrgi1cCobpfjuarMhkddY.jpg','2014-11-15',88,'Released','Santa Fights Dirty','Trailer Park Boys: Live at the North Pole',303742,1.507,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38719,_binary '\0','/rVnuWG3CeyHfjbG6SeXHvtrJvEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3596492',6.9,2406,'no','Mot Naturen','Out of Nature is a journey inside Martins head. A family father in his 30s living in a small town of Norway. He feels alienated in his own life and longs to get away. Away from his job, away from his family, into the woods, up to the mountains. While spending a weekend alone on a hiking trip, he is forced to confront the way he lives his life. Out of Nature is an original, funny and tender film about how to take part in your own life as a husband, father and son.','/jyJh85EhX33VvZcUNADq7Jpoopi.jpg','2014-09-19',80,'Released','Who are you when no one is watching?','Out of Nature',285176,1.1041,6.3,'MgjGCOJpxBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38720,_binary '\0','/fTuTaGq7cBFJSf7akXvlWTgzctI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3597108',4.4,1927,'en','Plan Z','One man has a plan for a zombie outbreak, when one occurs it will take all his will to stick to it and all of his courage to change it.','/3QNxsHN9uaVQMVBWI15dagFBqre.jpg','2016-03-19',90,'Released',NUL