 while his four sons, having secured their own fortunes, fixate on one thing-the diamond ring on his finger.','/hEhL2lXcVcH0tuVheHyf8CeFDRY.jpg','2025-03-07',117,'Released',NULL,'Pariwar',937846,0.8897,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38728,_binary '\0','/ziupKeRs39HJf0m6V9F4vPxxCuP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3602128',5.6,4805,'en','Night of the Living Deb','After a one night stand Deb wakes up in the middle of a zombie apocalypse.','/a7vz8oqTL90aHZcvGGIpUZEIQIm.jpg','2015-05-30',84,'Released','It\'s a Rom-Zom-Com!','Night of the Living Deb',343284,2.659,5.3,'T3rZXmf0oAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38729,_binary '\0','/qHT2pn1vGcSeqJhVz72cQ8rfcA3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3602422',4.2,2549,'en','Shed of the Dead','Trevor is \'between jobs\'. He spends his days avoiding his nagging heifer of a wife by hiding out in his allotment shed and painting figurines for his wargames with his agoraphobic friend, Graham, and dreaming of his heroic alter-ego, the battle mage Casimir the Destroyer. When Mr Parsons, one of the other allotment tenants, petitions to have Trevor removed from his disgrace of a plot (he\'s not there to grow stuff!) an argument ensues that leaves Trevor with a corpse to hide. Unfortunately, this untimely accident coincides with the zombie apocalypse and Mr Parsons\' return is just the beginnings of Trevor\'s problems. More pressing is whether or not he should try and save his wife and her beautiful best friend, who both he and Graham have a thing for.','/xuX9EokwsbBC9MF7D2N75gLMir8.jpg','2019-05-20',86,'Released','An unlikely hero\'s tale of blood, sweat, and shears !','Shed of the Dead',511778,1.6757,4.9,'VW-q9LpSojU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38730,_binary '\0','/hJRJJWUtjETvUL4T7VwXufbvJNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3603808',4.7,6043,'en','The Diabolical','When a single mother and her two young children are tormented by an increasingly strange and intense presence in their quiet suburban home, she turns to her scientist boyfriend to take on the violent forces that paranormal experts are too frightened to face.','/7hGRSbGChh9RY4Luw0PqPLcOJEc.jpg','2015-03-16',86,'Released','Evil is timeless.','The Diabolical',323370,2.4917,5.017,'WW_uPxP_KVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38731,_binary '\0','/lAgGMwtpxQryb9AgKZ5n3ygnbFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3605266',5.8,1272,'en','Everything Beautiful Is Far Away','On an isolated desert planet, a man who is looking for parts to repair his robotic companion teams up with a young woman searching for an imaginary lake.','/71KHPoAOTeOiIpgelNkXCwSkU5p.jpg','2017-06-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Everything Beautiful Is Far Away',459974,1.9296,6.7,'C_kQNdSPy7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38732,_binary '\0','/9DclZBBDxMrbcqNS81Pjz8opZTW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3605418',4.9,117035,'en','Knock Knock','When a devoted husband and father is left home alone for the weekend, two stranded young women unexpectedly knock on his door for help. What starts out as a kind gesture results in a dangerous seduction and a deadly game of cat and mouse.','/cUC4rUb1Cs2KMaZ6RD4uYUEEwls.jpg','2015-06-26',99,'Released','One night can cost you everything.','Knock Knock',263472,13.3538,5.39,'1vGZWY5MFY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38733,_binary '\0','/4mlS1MitcOqdPLhxEFyk9Qwf5rr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3606752',6.7,157483,'en','Cars 3','Blindsided by a new generation of blazing-fast racers, the legendary Lightning McQueen finds himself pushed to the brink—and suddenly, the champion who once ruled the track is fighting just to stay in the race. With his career hanging in the balance, McQueen must turn to an ambitious young race technician with a plan of her own, draw strength from the legacy of the late Fabulous Hudson Hornet, and risk everything on one last shot at glory.','/zg5RDxvIIAKsucjuU2EZJIHEIvz.jpg','2017-0