yZqhFJDenLfgF1VygOOCNmAdS1P.jpg','2026-05-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Iron Maiden: Burning Ambition',1642859,5.6655,8.507,'pD_H2u79tp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38766,_binary '\0','/vtfxurymOnYIUMcFIPzy0JKCx6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36164099',6.5,2010,'en','Beyond the Drumlins','The leaves have started to change, but Professor Jonathan Rust is still woefully ill prepared for the coming semester. With the help of a fellow professor, his teaching assistant, an old friend and a hired hand, the team searches for a suitable dig site for the archeology department\'s field work. The expedition is quickly derailed when a member of the team mysteriously vanishes.','/tN9pKWwyzHVW9hvgUbRfXcKCcKc.jpg','2025-11-09',95,'Released','What A Beautiful Place To Die.','Beyond the Drumlins',1443768,1.1436,5.2,'12Xcq9ezRLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38767,_binary '\0','/9W0aXF5HhGilDHloymf7sTCne8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3616916',6.6,47021,'no','Bølgen','Although theorised, no one is really ready when a mountain pass above the scenic and narrow Geiranger fjord in Norway collapses and creates a tsunami over 300 feet high. A geologist is one of those caught in the middle of it.','/nUra0UF9MLlTRZH9LCA8xYvhd6D.jpg','2015-08-28',105,'Released','It was only a matter of time.','The Wave',336882,7.4683,6.7,'QPIOV-tCaEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38768,_binary '\0','/xaQpm2vKptcy05nxrBuYs0mjnaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36187149',6.3,7039,'ml','മസ്തിഷ്‌ക മരണം','Plunging into a virtual reminiscence challenge to assuage his sorrow, a heartbroken dad uncovers a shocking revelation about Frida Soman, his long-admired icon and globally beloved luminary.','/vJrDoDEJzx6jF71dvocT3bgCzFB.jpg','2026-02-27',147,'Released',NULL,'Masthishka Maranam',1444032,1.0947,5.5,'bIp3rb0LArE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38769,_binary '\0','/6LpnsToxRww4wsFDX4HUcNKTNF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36187539',7.4,1221,'fr','Les Rayons et les Ombres','Jean and Otto, a French newspaperman and a young German Francophile, are fighting for peace in Europe. Jean’s daughter, Corinne, is launching a brilliant acting career in the film world, but war breaks out and France is occupied. The two friends have a major role to play in this new France. Jean becomes a big press baron and an ardent advocate of collaboration with the occupying forces, while Otto becomes the Reich’s ambassador in Paris. Corinne, meanwhile, finds herself thrown into the lion’s pit.','/cSWYnBFJroVGtf6QeDLAeqhojiS.jpg','2026-03-18',199,'Released',NULL,'The Rays and Shadows',1318335,6.0332,7.538,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38770,_binary '\0','/nkPy7mL0DoRAJ4cxiVUjRBv80XF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3618822',5.2,7953,'en','The Big Fat Stone','Frank D\'Angelo\'s drama about a homeless man\'s roller coaster ride of success and failure.','/2JjoC53cyD73wWRbNDv0Y4XMz2E.jpg','2014-01-01',110,'Released','Even a tiny drop of water can make a splash','The Big Fat Stone',337084,1.5306,3.2,'NiTjCsgIXFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38771,_binary '\0','/5E8ewc2EFM75AI8SZEtyS93S60R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36188425',8.4,2375,'te','పాంచ్ మినార్','When Chotu`s surprise party for his don father ends in tragedy, he inherits the criminal empire and uncovers his uncle Murthy`s deceit. Meanwhile, Kittu, a struggling cab driver pretending to be deaf, becomes entangled in danger after unknowingly helping twin murderers.','/iq7WEDY0iBTf6UglfmvGXycxp9L.jpg','2025-11-21',134,'Released',NULL,'Paanch Minar',1585219,1.2701,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38772,_binary '\0','/6tpvIOtArFdyd5oo3FbcWAVj0NN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3619070',4.1,2634,'en','Along Came the Devil','After a troubled childhood, Ashley searches for a connection, and unknowingly invites in a demonic force, which leaves her loved ones fighting for her soul.','/tEiu83QxMMWWD8gWUtXR4piF1Iw.jpg','2018-08-10',89,'Released','An exorcism unlike any other.','Along Came the Devil',409056,2.5091,5.5,'UQFuhqCdXIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38773,_binary '\0','/6kG35rPSRRbxOywwkZOYiBKH9zM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3619772',4.4,2672,'hi','Hate Story 2','A young photographer from Mumbai uses her mind to play games with a prominent Hindu rightist leader.','/y5fg6O5ttxvh2wkMY1fUchLfZSL.jpg','2014-07-18',130,'Released','Back With a Vengeance','Hate Story 2',282346,1.3405,4.319,'1JY8rA7fVnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38774,_binary '\0','/uGRsumiQNvmKiadHClMhNmTV6iE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3619854',3.3,1890,'hi','Creature 3D','People attend their first halt in a newly opened lodge in deep forest, but something is waiting for them.','/nbfirdO1slPZjzIcZoMev00bpUC.jpg','2014-09-12',134,'Released',NULL,'Creature 3D',292830,1.2806,3.222,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38775,_binary '\0','/7f9ZaTwyqQOJtNWUS7xZgWQOzSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36201830',6,4250,'hi','सिस्टम','When Neha Rajvansh, a privileged public prosecutor, meets Sarika Rawat, a courtroom stenographer from a humble background, their lives are thrown into upheaval where power defines truth, blurring the system and raising a question of what justice truly means to them.','/ddSTqsxOoXs77xnKpP7XBPqiero.jpg','2026-05-22',124,'Released',NULL,'System',1431071,2.4766,7,'AdZ_I4ySZoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38776,_binary '\0','/myaD8V3v4SE9WgUGjPTAnxIGbMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36203068',6.6,2097,'te','Anaganaga Australia Lo','An Indian former Chief Minister receives a high-stakes call from Melbourne, Australia, demanding a ransom of 100 crores in exchange for a top-secret that could jeopardize their political party\'s future with elections around the corner.','/3FvOm9sBuQRGKhVTCqEqnSazI0L.jpg','2025-03-21',161,'Released',NULL,'Anaganaga Australia Lo',1457310,0.6294,0,'-OuSOyjhots','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38777,_binary '\0','/lR7OLuWiLayCgVa2TEFcOydWoyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3620418',5.8,2523,'nl','Boy 7','When Sam regains consciousness in the middle of a crowded subway, he doesn\'t know how he got there, where he came from nor his own name. He franticly searches for his identity, using the contents of his backpack. Slowly but surely he realizes his life is in great danger.','/tOmYnPiCsmEWn8pmLQ523Nt5wGd.jpg','2016-02-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Boy 7',297239,1.8316,5.58,'kdSn9OkZmnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38778,_binary '\0','/sHS4oMEcyfmdhyvnVH7enSq9Bo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3620452',3,2119,'en','Don\'t Fuck in the Woods','A group of friends are going on a camping trip to celebrate graduating college. But once they enter the woods, the proverbial shit starts to hit the fan.','/y3Q7Qkt67LXCEXSxpWlFY18G5WT.jpg','2016-10-25',73,'Released','You\'re going to need protection!','Don\'t Fuck in the Woods',359053,1.7636,4,'gHzjml8t45M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38779,_binary '\0','/c1CjIhI75zzHgnVlx2SPpeSsuj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3620762',4.5,2485,'en','Anguish','A new girl in a quiet town, Tess tries to manage her psychosis while adjusting to her new life with her mom. After stumbling upon the shrine of Lucy, a hit and run victim, Tess finds herself overwhelmed by hallucinations of the dead girl and starts to question her sanity again. When the spirit possesses Tess’s mind and soul, mother and daughter are at a loss for where to turn next for salvation: religion or medicine? Both institutions have failed them to date but faith leads them to the house of Sarah, Lucy’s mother, who has been despondent since the accident. All together with time working against them, Sarah is desperate to believe that Lucy is still alive in Tess but neither parent wants to give up on their daughter. Now that she understands what is happening to her, ultimately Tess must decide whether she wants to keep fighting or succumb to her affliction.','/i4fi7D0Qik2fj1lJaY4wijsl8q4.jpg','2015-07-21',91,'Released','Her nightmares come when she\'s awake.','Anguish',347944,1.4341,4.7,'cR4-6q_-uPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38780,_binary '\0','/kmRXmyAeY3Dq99PzzC6BI9gQMrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36215872',8.4,2067,'te','Raju Gari Dongalu','In 1999, a businessman(marwadi) named Raja Natwarlal Seth operated large scale businesses in a town called Kothapatnam. Unknowns to many, he was also involved in hawala transactions even maintained a secret syndicate for these operations.','/e5b00tiX0FYpE9Sw6PZJD5QlcQu.jpg','2025-03-21',115,'Released',NULL,'Raju Gari Dongalu',1698108,0.4579,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38781,_binary '\0','/evIA1lwyios3jmNx52Z53S2SlH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3621802',5.8,2479,'es','Muerte en Buenos Aires','Detective Chávez, a family man and a tough cop, is put in charge of the investigation into a homicide that took place in the most exclusive circles of high society 1980s Buenos Aires. At the crime scene, Chávez meets officer Gómez, nicknamed The Goose, a good-looking rookie who becomes his right-hand man and goes undercover as bait to catch the murderer.','/aZeOKwAoumS8Qmx8sSY68LcQoMc.jpg','2014-05-05',93,'Released','Nothing is what it seems.','Death in Buenos Aires',296778,1.8033,5.9,'vCDrRrwpMXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38782,_binary '\0','/pid6eklnLNn5vy9TGdaqOVm3J6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3622110',5.1,15988,'en','Don\'t Knock Twice','A mother desperate to reconnect with her troubled daughter becomes embroiled in the urban legend of a demonic witch.','/rxiz9zHLrqC5JfKVPbkKBboiSzI.jpg','2017-01-12',93,'Released','Pray she doesn\'t answer.','Don\'t Knock Twice',420245,4.8373,5.511,'PA9qsPkNI6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38783,_binar