rows himself into a one-night stand with Sam, a casual encounter which fast becomes something much stronger.','/f5fiFSCTYJeQynEfxEPZu2hOeQe.jpg','2015-07-09',84,'Released','We can\'t always have what we want.','Soft Lad',350827,0.8853,5.7,'DhRXMarDnlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38790,_binary '\0','/miZXbQIeK3d6ExIMFagh9hPxW7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3625136',6.2,4448,'en','Detours','A newly single New Yorker must re-locate to Florida for her dream job. She drives south with her widowed dad, her mom\'s ashes in a coffee can, and a GPS with a mind of its own.','/wJ1AjWNHZbsRQzmiyNYbipaYOvc.jpg','2016-04-20',81,'Released','What we seek isn\'t always what we need.','Detours',365359,1.8261,4.9,'KQO-ucdsXbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38791,_binary '\0','/eysLFHTx8Q46UDBgjf3f7dCCiH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3625352',5.4,1280,'en','Summer of Blood','Lousy lover and egocentric Eric Sparrow is dumped by his girlfriend after rejecting her marital proposal. After a few failed dates his luck turns when a chance encounter with a vampire turns him into a sex god.','/fhSq361JYGHgoztfC8IayhLZc2t.jpg','2014-10-17',86,'Released',NULL,'Summer of Blood',265449,1.0802,4.8,'hsWxdAmsc1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38792,_binary '\0','/2Y68g3DwKiu9UiK8UPwwW78yocQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3625516',3.6,1307,'en','MindGamers','A group of young bio-engineers discover they can use quantum physics to transfer motor-skills between human brains. Believing this to be a first step towards a new intellectual freedom, they freely distribute the technology. But as the mysterious past of one of their group is revealed, dark forces emerge that threaten to subvert this technology into a means of mass control. DxM takes the mind-bender thriller to the next level with an immersive narrative and breath-taking action.','/wZrEydcc5gTWWQjqp3pMMD8x8Wr.jpg','2015-10-04',97,'Released','A sub-atomic fight for the subconscious.','MindGamers',362583,1.9996,4.7,'Gb62EQyJFyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38793,_binary '\0','/85UNzqnXTw3MgIo3urCGb2bHCfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3626180',7.4,4573,'en','The Christmas Secret','While her life is falling apart, single mother Christine finds a magical family heirloom that leads to love and good fortune during Christmas.','/tCaU7Hl9d7Ey3X9OokZoPsq7WfO.jpg','2014-11-23',90,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Secret',310972,2.6303,6.799,'TDFF5IIJOHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38794,_binary '\0','/jiMjZTYCVfzHvhADWdj7ziFXhx5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3626440',7.4,1615,'en','Mr. Dynamite: The Rise of James Brown','James Brown changed the face of American music forever. Abandoned by his parents at an early age, James Brown was a self-made man who became one of the most influential artists of the 20th century, not just through his music, but also as a social activist. Charting his journey from rhythm and blues to funk, MR. DYNAMITE: THE RISE OF JAMES BROWN features rare and previously unseen footage, photographs and interviews, chronicling the musical ascension of “the hardest working man in show business,” from his first hit, “Please, Please, Please,” in 1956, to his iconic performances at the Apollo Theater, the T.A.M.I. Show, the Paris Olympia and more.','/v05MOph9k9ztFhW424paaY61QAC.jpg','2014-04-27',115,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Dynamite: The Rise of James Brown',297603,1.5847,6.9,'5DxogZblRL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38795,_binary '\0','/o0UGl6icA4DbhmDNgdZ5AWvuTtM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3626476',6.3,34957,'en','Vacation Friends','When a straight-laced couple that has fun with a rowdy couple on vacation in Mexico return to the States, they discover that the crazy couple they met in Mexico followed them back home and decide to play tricks on them.','/cCyJeTAct07ORPJPHyzxCrVtZzh.jpg','2021-08-27',103,'Released','They came home with 