 country’s top television channel, taking the staff and a prominent minister, who was there for an interview, hostage. While the nation\'s law enforcement agencies race to uncover the identity of the mastermind behind the attack, the mastermind reveals himself live on the channel’s program, exposing the stories of ordinary people who have fallen victim to high-level corruption. Thus begins a rampage against the injustices of the system.','/iplMLlXU1BgmTz4xviILTOlECYL.jpg','2025-06-07',129,'Released','Chaos has a new name.','Taandob',1396122,1.8763,7.833,'IGClyOEA1Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38804,_binary '\0','/dLw4YK72fW4dF82nnLFDbeXotSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36300841',6.4,12510,'hi','आवारापन २','Once a feared gangster, Shivam lives hidden away from his past, with no faith left in God or himself. But when fate pulls him into Bangkok\'s cartel war and forces him back into the darkness he swore never to return to, Shivam must choose what he is willing to live for, when there is nothing left to lose.','/lD3J6zTbWkVtPYuSUuuBwpuKMCO.jpg','2026-08-14',142,'Released','From The Shadows To Settle An Old Debt With Death.','Awarapan 2',1444466,8.1333,6,'1ya87ENCRj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38805,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3630228',6.1,1218,'en','Perfect on Paper','Portland book editor Natalie Holland has chosen the wrong guy – another underachiever – once again. With her life going nowhere fast, she accepts a job offer from publisher and friend Avery Goldstein and moves to Los Angeles. A woman of depth and principle, Portland chic Natalie is a fish out of water in LA. Things only get worse when she learns she’s been hired to edit the latest romance novel from bestselling author Beverly Wilcox, a powerful, glamorous and intimidating figure straight out of \"The Devil Wears Prada\".','/owJbhX0kevW6Qcc1ZhvZSNxNPAD.jpg','2014-09-20',82,'Released',NULL,'Perfect on Paper',289520,1.1387,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38806,_binary '\0','/8Fl8B1TRkcjkU9VMp9ex9mV6949.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36302733',6.9,6126,'ml','ഡീയസ് ഈറെ','Rohan\'s affluent lifestyle spirals out of control as he becomes convinced there is a supernatural entity in his home. As he starts to uncover the mystery, he is drawn into unexpected worlds and alliances, along with the horrors that lie ahead.','/123DlTiiezgLaJruVe7RiSi0RFf.jpg','2025-10-30',115,'Released','The Day of Wrath','Diés Iraé',1396869,2.3643,6.472,'iRD0TJMNZbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38807,_binary '\0','/hL5EIk48251OXlbIbRJq3yaBHk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36304003',5.4,22261,'en','72 HOURS','To save his career, a 40-year-old ad exec joins a crew of twentysomethings for a wild Miami bachelor party after they mistakenly add him to a group chat.','/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg','2026-07-20',105,'Released','The night is young. He isn\'t.','72 HOURS',949838,13.1677,6.743,'N-J-HR3quc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38808,_binary '\0','/n2Lx80fUrEp8OZOjfBNx0a7d37u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36307021',8.4,3176,'en','Hadestown: The Musical','The tragic love of Orpheus and Eurydice is intertwined with the complex relationship of Hades and Persephone. Eurydice, struggling with poverty, is lured to the industrial underworld of Hadestown by Hades, while Orpheus, a struggling musician, ventures down below to bring her back. (Filmed live at the Lyric Theatre, London, featuring the core five original Broadway cast members.)','/iJNVygzkuOSCOdCPNI1nLSeF7sz.jpg','2026-07-23',141,'Released','The myth. The musical.','Hadestown: The Musical',1439808,4.4417,8.87,'76Q5TWHslOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38809,_binary '\0','/4SO6pbGJTpM9YYovYxFLY3MXqZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3631112',6.5,213862,'en','The Girl on the Train','Rachel Watson, devastated by her recent divorce, spends her daily commute fantasizing about the seemingly perfect couple who live in a house that her train passes every day, until one morning she sees something shocking happen there and becomes entangled in the mystery that unfolds.','/AhTO2QWG0tug7yDoh0XoaMhPt3J.jpg','2016-10-05',112,'Released','What you see can hurt you.','The Girl on the Train',346685,11.8971,6.4,'-CKPj4O5_9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38810,_binary '\0','/bQPWY2u154jJ5koDp9KcM67Wioi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36313062',7.3,1684,'fr','Le rêve américain','No one would have bet on Jérémy, stuck behind the counter of a video store, or on Bouna, who cleans airports. With no money, no connections, and painfully poor English, who could have predicted they’d one day become big-name agents in the NBA? What they lack in experience, they will make up for in audacity, while remaining true to their one credo, doing business with a human touch. Scouting raw talent while improvising their way up, they’ll fake it until they make it – chasing their American Dream and landing multi-million-dollar deals.','/hQagR2IJiVN2FBFWmuz7XOQdVOF.jpg','2026-02-18',122,'Released',NULL,'The American Dream',1365378,3.1389,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38811,_binary '\0','/fJAih1oPnIKCOj8pH2mM2gAGlb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36329718',4.7,5070,'ml','916 കുഞ്ഞൂട്ടൻ','A man with a small frame but a massive presence leads a double life as a beloved villager and a sharp city tycoon. As love and secrets collide, he must prove that true worth comes from the mind, not the size..','/5ryScjLTAfNl38PQYlWvSMafgu2.jpg','2025-05-23',115,'Released',NULL,'916 Kunjoottan',1427824,1.0471,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38812,_binary '\0','/ohUhHOqW8cM59Ay5UjqplLzJbH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36331860',4.3,6044,'en','Love Me Love Me','After her brother\'s death, June moves to Milan for a fresh start, finding comfort in Will, the perfect honor student at her new international school. But when his troubled best friend James—hiding a dangerous life in clandestine MMA fights—sparks a rivalry that quickly turns into irresistible attraction, June must choose between safety and a love that upends everything she thought she wanted.','/jfwHKRHRE2X4NTexdzblaioHH51.jpg','2026-02-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Love Me Love Me',1317672,14.7744,6.11,'B7prWpweShU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38813,_binary '\0','/oquMboQfqtfFMNW9SSHpm0EVGHU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3634940',6.2,2284,'ko','표적','At the same time as murder suspect Yeo-hoon is brought unconscious to the emergency room following a shooting incident, an assailant breaks into the house of Tae-jun, the emergency room\'s doctor in charge, and kidnaps his wife. The kidnapper calls the doctor and tells him to bring Yeo-hoon to him. To retrieve his wife, Tae-jun has no option but to save the patient and sneak him away before the police can notice.','/rbYb65lmQgDPzd2VuC8QoF8wPQZ.jpg','2014-04-30',98,'Released','The hunt is on.','The Target',267467,2.3728,7,'LL5kJYZnNv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38814,_binary '\0','/xfq3xAl856lI6WcaNmkEflxGDfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36351149',6.8,3945,'en','Oklahoma City Bombing: American Terror','This gripping documentary revisits the shocking 1995 bombing of an Oklahoma City federal building, the deadliest act of domestic terrorism in US history.','/1n7CuKBshPOBtWFg5xomRr19Ydt.jpg','2025-04-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Oklahoma City Bombing: American Terror',1455132,3.2192,6.8,'Q9EFda4HaUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38815,_binary '\0','/2TWIlmhE06ghspeQLEX1VmnEBiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36352591',6,5782,'en','You, Me & Tuscany','When a woman crashes at an empty Italian villa, posing as the owner\'s fiancée, she discovers an unexpected romance that could transform her life.','/mJS0IF7Af3WpPRhSTDT6rGpiLzw.jpg','2026-04-09',105,'Released','She came for the pasta and got lost in the sauce.','You, Me & Tuscany',1455079,7.8251,7.3,'09kuFgvohIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38816,_binary '\0','/jJ1oftjko741KtcP4T6KEQ64Mtc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36363838',6.6,2159,'te','Mana Iddari Prema Katha','Mana Iddari Prema Katha is an intense love story of two souls who feel destined for each other. Through real-life struggles, emotional highs and painful lows, their hearts collide, connect, and fight to stay together against all odds.','/gR1rhIgQ373NtWDbYHVut1HFQqo.jpg','2025-04-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Mana Iddari Prema Katha',1620638,0.4066,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38817,_binary '\0','/eTodr0PX3fIDM4VFKJakpPGMZbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36364273',3.3,2450,'en','Holy Ghost','A kidnapped girl in Augusta claims her rescuer was Jim, a deceased cop. Detective Wells probes the case as another child vanishes, revealing old murders and raising questions about a ghostly presence.','/z1lwn6GWAjJ7CSn80ZcURb0Cj4G.jpg','2025-08-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Holy Ghost',1528660,1.7131,6.1,'7Fv7jBCgGXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38818,_binary '\0','/tgLt7dCPmGmZeQNh9tEQGcK1S9B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3636776',6.2,1450,'hi','Samrat & Co.','A young, beautiful and rich girl, Dimpy Singh, approaches Samrat Tilakdhari, a private investigator, with a strange case. Their garden got ruined for reasons that appear natural but are not known; leading horticulturists have examined the fading plants but they have not been able to identify the probable reason. Further, her father\'s favorite horse died; once again the reason for the pre-mature death remains a mystery. That\'s not the end; Dimpy\'s father Mahendra Pratap Singh, otherwise a very strong and balanced man, has been experiencing deteriorating health. All these aspects when combined makes the case sound weird and that grabs the attention of Samrat. Samrat along with his assistant friend, Chakradhar Pandey, visits the huge estate of Mahendra Pratap Singh. As he starts investigating, he discovers lots of mysterious facts.','/17e7J9YXfKzQb3B1AFvy8bf0eqw.jpg','2014-04-25',125,'Released','Get Ready for the Dilchasp Rahasya Ride','Samrat & Co.',266556,0.9252,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38819,_binary '\0','/khlCb0Qm9xhQyrLOwD9aM4hoJK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36376123',5.5,12722,'hi','Ajey: The Untold Story of a Yogi','Follows the personal and spiritual journey of Ajay Mohan Singh Bisht, detailing his transformation into one of India\'s most influential political leaders.','/dW4rKpAMTYSw9YvBrTX2FaKIQpv.jpg','2025-09-19',148,'Released','The Untold Story Of A Yogi','Ajey: The Untold Story of a Yogi',1455440,1.2455,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38820,_binary '\0','/myxbgobjPN13kdKBrVneiyc3tmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3638012',6.5,9660,'ja','Appleseed Alpha','The Third World War (2099–2126) devastated part of the Earth. Former nations are reforming while new powers emerge, and groups of humans struggle to survive in ruined cities. The story follows Deunan Knute and her partner Briareos as they search for the legendary city of Olympus.','/yISvzOlV0x1D667oRcUBxxDR0LZ.jpg','2014-05-28',93,'Released','To find Olympus, they must fight to survive.','Appleseed Alpha',269650,3.0915,6.796,'4DtWCjogd1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38821,_binary '\0','/1tF5g4JxxVejxYqRFnicrmaYKEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3638298',7.2,1289,'en','Child of Rage: A Story of Abuse','Beth Thomas is a six year old girl suffering from reactive attachment disorder as a result of being sexually abused as a child. This documentary consists of interviews with Beth, followed by her treatment and partial recovery at a special center for kids.','/bu5C5m2wZ1hZ1Lu4Vt9CoGL8DRu.jpg','1990-08-15',27,'Released',NULL,'Child of Rage: A Story of Abuse',127124,1.0492,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38822,_binary '\0','/sgVPO6fgi6FzD3IbpkHvqjfa5hq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3638396',7,9817,'en','Closet Monster','A creative and driven teenager is desperate to escape his hometown and the haunting memories of his turbulent childhood.','/mJYAloVKf20Ko5OE9F9VSfAvmXY.jpg','2016-07-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Closet Monster',353728,2.515,7,'PfWyVZBNvZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38823,_binary '\0','/45YsBuYO3qSiVNXdMj40MOO2lWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3638644',7.2,1523,'ne','सेतो सूर्य','Young Pooja lives with her mother in a village in Nepal. Though saddened by the death of her grandfather, she is secretly thrilled at the prospect of meeting the man she hopes may be her father — Chandra, a former Maoist guerrilla who is returning home after a decade-long civil conflict.','/5XUuWAWwjb4OUgB3r8holAZzc7r.jpg','2016-12-09',87,'Released',NULL,'White Sun',412212,1.4243,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38824,_binary '\0','/kDRkOFPkjYjubhiIcvurBKuLSRI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36388163',6.3,10460,'ta','டியூட்','Childhood friends Agan and Kural are inseparable. When Kural encounters romantic troubles, Agan must balance his hidden feelings for her with his desire to ensure her happiness.','/oLUbL4RtynlTtKd1byseeOCkIZO.jpg','2025-10-17',140,'Released',NULL,'Dude',1321108,2.7125,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38825,_binary '\0','/cdR0qwyaMfuZRfTYEixUmRnmdop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3640424',7.1,181638,'en','Allied','In 1942, an intelligence officer in North Africa encounters a female French Resistance fighter on a deadly mission behind enemy lines. When they reunite in London, their relationship is tested by the pressures of war.','/sV4lXM32quwminL3TP36nlNPp7Q.jpg','2016-11-23',124,'Released','The enemy is listening.','Allied',369885,11.1916,6.809,'-hQGiozwHiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38826,_binary '\0','/8aKRUSBxQBokoz0CvP9e7OYgnbD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3640682',6.2,6295,'en','I Smile Back','Laney is an attractive, intelligent suburban wife and devoted mother of two adorable children. She has the perfect husband who plays basketball with the kids in the driveway, a pristine house, and a shiny SUV for carting the children to their next activity. However, just beneath the façade lie depression and disillusionment that send her careening into a secret world of reckless compulsion. Only very real danger will force her to face the painful root of her destructiveness and its crumbling effect on those she loves.','/8ufYyCJsID2ufc493ZkJocdkPCY.jpg','2015-10-23',85,'Released','Love desperately, live recklessly.','I Smile Back',307946,2.2686,6.2,'gTRqt4s64SE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38827,_binary '\0','/ht9MCD7zFQ1Wav5zKdZmZ7wp0GR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3640710',7,1460,'en','Kim Dotcom: Caught in the Web','The larger-than-life story of Kim Dotcom, the \'most wanted man online\', is extraordinary enough, but the battle between Dotcom and the US Government and entertainment industry—being fought in New Zealand—is one that goes to the heart of ownership, privacy and piracy in the digital age.','/lXEUqP9TmWvbnq8VcbJY7qMv7oD.jpg','2017-03-13',108,'Released','The most wanted man online.','Kim Dotcom: Caught in the Web',438471,1.3816,6.6,'M8iTRn8GUWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38828,_binary '\0','/qTwn0p318YB4oXvQSIhSrhuTcpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36410586',4.5,3343,'hi','राहु केतु','In the magical world of writer Churu Lal Sharma, his unlucky creations Rahu and Ketu spring to life, causing hilarious chaos instead of fighting corruption. When the mischievous Meenu Taxi steals Churu\'s mystical notebook, the bumbling duo are dragged into absurd adventures that land them in the middle of a drug mafia.','/zjgWWOIsEqYNSa1fGRr82mBo3gv.jpg','2026-01-16',140,'Released',NULL,'Rahu Ketu',1457939,1.5703,2.833,'JeQZW8E5TB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38829,_binary '\0','/3Gjo73aMqNWxNdBa7PeEj7AXJ3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36424914',6,1566,'fr','Falcon Express','When a train unexpectedly starts up, taking only pets with it, the animals discover that Hans, a badger with a grudge is behind it all. While the crash seems inevitable, the animals can count on Falcon, a roguish Raccoon who will do anything to save them.','/b10qy1KwrfmH0MGS2rBUJ0BxgYB.jpg','2025-07-02',86,'Released','Adventure off the rails.','Pets on a Train',1107216,6.8143,7.155,'O36tpGmAkTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38830,_binary '\0','/aCm3ZE47TWMzrFq50BSNZvNaU57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3642618',7.2,2644,'de','Das ewige Leben','Brenner returns to Graz, the city where he grew up. When confronted with his old friends, his former girlfriend and the major sin he committed when he was young, murders and a fateful gunshot to the head result. After Brenner comes out of a coma, he begins to search for the person who tried to kill him - however, everybody claims that he himself is responsible. In the beginning Brenner was at the end of his rope, but he could face a new beginning in the end.','/lSQ9fgPwhZfcFKxChHjHrbEiDLm.jpg','2015-03-05',123,'Released','Now something has happened again...','Life Eternal',277967,1.654,7.088,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38831,_binary '\0','/pZDB6mPwaeImc4NqGmcIJHaoGBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36435352',5.8,1766,'ta','பிளாக்மெயில்','Trapped in escalating blackmail, Mani faces mounting danger as crime, passion, and greed intertwine, exposing hidden truths and changing allegiances throughout his ordeal.','/ppZRUMG5JnQo2JDvgDYRRWHDkje.jpg','2025-08-01',121,'Released','Don\'t Trust Anyone','Blackmail',1505291,1.0034,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38832,_binary '\0','/2bkkKlk6GuEYZ4DL7mfSGSvxyB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3643544',5.2,4394,'en','Glass Jaw','Glass Jaw is the redemption story of Travis Austin, a one time champion boxer who goes to prison and loses everything. After his release, he experiences the trials and tribulations of redeeming his reputation, his belt, and his true love.','/jGLF31gkOWHSJVh6xQQPG0JlNpU.jpg','2018-10-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Glass Jaw',553884,2.4817,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38833,_binary '\0','/oo8GVyvODffulZtxx6QWzRkrBxK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36440312',7.8,2384,'ja','DAN DA DAN: Evil Eye','Momo and Okarun set out on their latest adventure, traveling to a hot springs town home rented by Jiji, Momo\'s childhood friend and former crush, with the goal to solve the mystery surrounding his family. When they arrive, strange locals derail their investigation before it can properly begin, and the group soon learns there\'s more lurking under the surface of the town than they could possibly have imagined. Theatrical event featuring four episodes of the anime, including the first three episodes of the second season, and an exclusive interview with series co-directors Fuga Yamashiro and Abel Góngora.','/qXwBSbBUIHLIoUCnfC0sjEjZ4Rw.jpg','2025-05-30',93,'Released','He\'s coming.','DAN DA DAN: Evil Eye',1458844,3.1637,7.7,'91zk0WAkxpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38834,_binary '\0','/jEFPa8cqhTm3GYHH9qRbJbXimQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3645014',3.5,2051,'hi','The Xposé','This is a dramatic chain of events in the most glamorous ,swinging era of Hindi films... the 1960s. It was a decade when film stars tasted success and carried their larger than life screen image on to real life with unbridled pomp and splendour. It was during this time that two ambitious films were made... Ujwal Nirmal Sheetal and Reena Mera Naam. The latter became a runaway hit while the former was struggling at the box office.','/banahHkzFfTQlIriqTbmxw3xvRc.jpg','2014-05-16',113,'Released','Desire. Scandal. Murder.','The Xposé',270417,1.5974,4.5,'2GDC0QyIWm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38835,_binary '\0','/hxCJcyDnR964ja5mzExvb8UlHLG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36451817',6.6,4100,'te','రాకాస','Returning home after a decade, an NRI chasing romance inadvertently awakens an ancient darkness long feared by his village. As the threat intensifies, love turns deadly and life hangs in the balance.','/sXwVJJMIPB4duU1mWbagt5ikUtq.jpg','2026-04-03',130,'Released','A homecoming nightmare!','Raakaasa',1451078,5.3296,5.95,'TJ5dpuZ1cAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38836,_binary '\0','/biR1Du8yECTyV9DYhexzcZJZgyg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36454677',7.8,1729,'ta','மெட்ராஸ் மேட்னி','An aging sci-fi writer is challenged by his caretaker to write about the life of a common man. Reluctantly, he begins the story of Kannan, an auto rickshaw driver, and his family—only to discover that ordinary life holds unexpected depth and drama.','/gydwfpaMZtTdR5zOgLSPRWDoEJg.jpg','2025-06-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Madras Matinee',1488301,0.8029,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38837,_binary '\0','/8nv5MUtEBMX4DDkrFkDhkppRxuD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36456563',6.2,2177,'pt','Magalhães','At the dawn of the modern era, Portuguese explorer Ferdinand Magellan leads an expedition under the Spanish crown in search of the first westward route to the Spice Islands. He embarks on a perilous journey across the uncharted Pacific, where his fleet faces starvation, mutiny, and the psychological toll of endless seas. Upon reaching the shores of Cebu, Magellan is pulled into a fatal conflict with the natives by his drive to spread Catholicism, culminating in his tragic doom.','/pmFeUueU7BWLVnHrYI1FD7VnxtH.jpg','2025-09-10',164,'Released',NULL,'Magellan',975335,3.8569,6.3,'8h7rriQD1qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38838,_binary '\0','/jfzGjZnDYVoID62ogWVRifMdl9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36457300',5.7,2480,'ml','പ്രകമ്പനം','A group of students\' lives are thrown into chaos after one of them is possessed by the spirit of an elderly woman.','/fos5qG9mDHoeKD21saC0qp7wFkw.jpg','2026-01-30',128,'Released',NULL,'Prakambanam',1398014,2.1062,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38839,_binary '\0','/mlkOIAgd9OfNpKNMQDLYIJus9VV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3645988',6.5,8793,'de','Abgeschnitten','A coroner finds a capsule in the head of a heavily mutilated corpse, containing a phone number and single word: the name of his daughter.','/927kgdzuNNHX6wubSbqi50kZse0.jpg','2018-10-11',132,'Released',NULL,'Cut Off',436387,2.8982,6.587,'tw0padxF1gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38840,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36461715',7,2170,'mr','Bol Bol Rani','Aabhas a journalist arrives in village to cover a chilling story. He finds about Maya whose arrested for killing her husband but everyone fears talking about her. He first meets Ravdya a drunkard who tells that Maya was caged and tortured by her husband, then her neighbor Gandha revels Maya was fast forward girl living with a caring husband but she cheated on him for her boyfriend and was addicted to drugs. Finally a village driver tells Maya and her husband were living happily as perfect couple. But things changed when her past lover arrived back in her life. All three people have different versions of their stories with one common link that Maya possibly killed her husband','/jblubtkbCrBRmEcqGn3psUDG3Pt.jpg','2026-07-17',125,'Released','Follows an enigmatic woman at the center of a mystery involving kidnapping, murder, and unraveling secrets, where every character hides something and the truth remains elusive.','Bol Bol Rani',1739352,1.2693,10,'xEdb7D9ohXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38841,_binary '\0','/6ZSShTmCOXoUsVE66NJz8fvMn8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36462227',6.8,1451,'en','Britain and the Blitz','Documentary looking back at a Britain during the darkest days of WWII using stunning new archived footage and interviews with people who lived through it.','/yimg7ZM08WoNOPLKhtfLRvVC6M.jpg','2025-05-05',77,'Released',NULL,'Britain and the Blitz',1462776,2.4802,7.217,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38842,_binary '\0','/3UuNxoThmvXPUEe7k8TaBnjapoc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3646344',6.4,1346,'it','Vergine giurata','Years after declaring her eternal virginity and opting to live life as a man in the mountains of Albania, Hana looks to return to living as a woman as she settles into a new existence in modern-day Milan.','/piSe5rV0crFgHHJgXrjrTwGNJmi.jpg','2015-03-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Sworn Virgin',319998,1.3184,5.609,'FqepPRFB2MM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38843,_binary '\0','/3AGZKVr2DPT9H53gYtkSEC1tK1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36463894',7.4,63220,'en','Predator: Killer of Killers','While three of the fiercest warriors in human history—a Viking raider, a ninja in feudal Japan, and a WWII pilot—are killers in their own right, they are merely prey for their new opponent: the ultimate killer of killers.','/2XDQa6EmFHSA37j1t0w88vpWqj9.jpg','2025-06-05',85,'Released','The hunt begins.','Predator: Killer of Killers',1376434,12.8459,7.775,'eWzPKrNoSyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38844,_binary '\0','/k4MZdogt1DZX0b2tlkr17EFUvP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36464353',8.3,5335,'en','My Mom Jayne','Through deeply personal interviews with her siblings and an examination of the photographs, letters, and belongings left behind, Mariska assembles a new portrait of her mother Jayne Mansfield, an extraordinary and complex woman.','/6KpfMouMavYr1UwTz6612YhYjbs.jpg','2025-06-20',106,'Released','Reclaiming her mother\'s story. And her own.','My Mom Jayne',1461714,5.1188,8,'fZM6m_GJhr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38845,_binary '\0','/n8zyMFJWmG54KaLgLnKrsmVP4jW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3646462',7.7,14662,'tr','İtirazım Var','Selman is a former boxer who once was interested in anthropology, an extraordinary imam who now works in a mosque. One day, while praying in the mosque, gunshots are echoed. One of the people inside collapses and dies. The police come to the scene and collect the first evidence and start the investigation process. He takes action after this event and decides to resolve the case through some people and circumstances he suspects. Every clue leads to an unexpected point and the events become increasingly mysterious.','/sIoARCZEJA69wAkyOZWvZW4hRUs.jpg','2014-04-18',115,'Released','I Love Trouble','Let\'s Sin',265351,1.2567,7,'HvXQszltsrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38846,_binary '\0','/dSHJ9JRiuGwhhdS819ifScoYx7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3646946',7.9,4472,'ja','劇場版「進撃の巨人」後編～自由の翼～','As the Trost District is reclaimed from the Titans, Eren is taken under the wing of Captain Levi and his squad, who decide to try and teach him to master his mysterious abilities.','/53iOetezK5fJsABy1XykJw4WRq3.jpg','2015-06-27',120,'Released',NULL,'Attack on Titan: Wings of Freedom',330081,4.799,8.185,'Xq3fTk_9xfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38847,_binary '\0','/tebcp0UUNmLui8kHhqozp3TmEqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3647110',5.9,1692,'en','My Boyfriends\' Dogs','The owners of a small diner are surprised one rainy evening when, just after close, a young woman wearing a wedding dress with three dogs in tow begs to come into their restaurant. What follows is the young woman\'s retelling of how she arrived at this curious junction in her life and how, through the search for the right man, she ended up as a runaway bride with three new dogs.','/ffNqpSglkigE2eIVFGSXUYihFCN.jpg','2014-10-18',84,'Released',NULL,'My Boyfriends\' Dogs',298317,2.475,6.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38848,_binary '\0','/7ocFvtRnNXwrNJLJRWa0kKVPRW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36472392',6.3,4948,'ml','ചത്താ പച്ച: The Ring of Rowdies','In the heart of Fort Kochi, three brothers and their crew of unlikely misfits stumble into the wild world of WWE-style costumed wrestling. What begins as a scrappy hustle soon explodes into a riot of masks, egos, and full-blown madness, all set against the backdrop of a city that never plays by the rules. But can their brotherhood survive when the real fight begins outside the ropes?','/wYXy20uC7aW7ArJJDRWR5E8dDL1.jpg','2026-01-22',134,'Released',NULL,'Chatha Pacha: The Ring of Rowdies',1439594,1.5015,5.8,'U1npyTU93q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38849,_binary '\0','/eHxk7bc6vGEWOeHfKmYBMhOzUAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36473825',6.4,1372,'en','Sarah Silverman: PostMortem','After losing her parents, Sarah Silverman finds laughter and solace in celebrating their lives, from deathbed binge-watching to an ill-timed fart.','/hPBERJFecTqReSO0jqcfL6branG.jpg','2025-05-19',63,'Released',NULL,'Sarah Silverman: PostMortem',1462313,1.3203,6,'G_11gmV0_I8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38850,_binary '\0','/oSG5OOrS5nmuwwyjscduRZnSVTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36474012',7.3,3662,'nl','Voor De Meisjes','A near-fatal accident involving their teen daughters upends the lives of two families as they consider how far they\'re willing to go to save their child.','/8g8kx20bZCJ2nqCwORfRLTbKYWf.jpg','2025-10-02',103,'Released','Necessity knows no law, especially when it concerns your child. Right?','Our Girls',1457705,2.4713,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38851,_binary '\0','/9OaseUgtF0nFwbJIzSpRYxKRmVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3647498',6.4,71262,'fr','Blood Father','An ex-con reconnects with his estranged teenage daughter while fighting to keep her alive after she becomes a target of violent drug dealers.','/2HHfIEM4ezgzS2OwrhlpkGBBmhG.jpg','2016-08-11',88,'Released','A father makes his own justice.','Blood Father',309886,6.7921,6.166,'eGvTRG-iud8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38852,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36491337',8.7,1229,'hi','His Story of Itihaas','It is a true story about a physics teacher who stands up against the system to question the wrong and distorted history told to Indians for generations in the schools.','/v1m5cCWqzouFDVIXD6M60kSHAPG.jpg','2025-05-30',144,'Released',NULL,'His Story of Itihaas',1483123,0.7315,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38853,_binary '\0','/105dMBJGgkM0SzgjV62KzlMDdG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36491632',7.1,3474,'it','Le città di pianura','A couple of jovial life-long drunkards run into a shy architecture undergrad, whose way of seeing things will be transformed as the trio wanders from pub to pub in search of a buried treasure.','/b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg','2025-09-25',98,'Released',NULL,'The Last One for the Road',1462322,2.9219,7.451,'5kYHufR72P0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38854,_binary '\0','/zhoMwQofjgVec5Sin05hWECJtVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36491653',7.4,39386,'fr','Un simple accident','An unassuming mechanic is reminded of his time in an Iranian prison when he encounters a man he suspects to be his sadistic jailhouse captor.','/eNYGj2DG3n8OrVPTfYunpPW9uas.jpg','2025-10-01',104,'Released',NULL,'It Was Just an Accident',1456349,9.6848,7.16,'9oHw2ubyWE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38855,_binary '\0','/7O5qZ4h2SnBwMBa7qs8X53lU6cX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36491858',7.1,1343,'en','A Newport Christmas','A charitable and spirited Newport socialite in 1905 finds out her father intends for her to become engaged to a man she’s never met at the upcoming Christmas Eve ball. When she wishes for a different life, a man appears — and she somehow time-travels to 2025.','/bNWUsEOg7HzHlZmSTVKuZ6SglxM.jpg','2025-11-02',84,'Released','She\'s ahead of her time. He has history to prove it.','A Newport Christmas',1537560,1.8673,8.1,'2SASGrMMk54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38856,_binary '\0','/2yZmwuXiQw58GiXwJwGNYtsDrEL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36499994',6.1,4638,'tr','İki Dünya Bir Dilek','Twenty-one years after a magical meeting at a children\'s hospital, Bilge and Can suddenly begin hearing each other\'s voices telepathically. What seems like a miracle soon reveals a hidden secret, as fate-reuniting them after decades-has much more in store.','/mZcwX1aN2RdCLwamxdkoINIhVAm.jpg','2025-11-24',118,'Released',NULL,'Two Worlds One Wish',1522377,7.2237,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38857,_binary '\0','/wgxy48L6vnk85R7Z2xNftO3lr86.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3651326',6.5,1668,'fr','L\'Ombre des femmes','Pierre and Manon are poor. They make documentaries with nothing and they live by doing odd jobs. Pierre meets a young intern, Elisabeth, and she becomes his mistress. But Pierre will not leave Manon for Elisabeth; he wants to keep both.','/v6rwTr6OyjNR3Ny3pseM5ecGEIv.jpg','2015-05-27',73,'Released',NULL,'In the Shadow of Women',315865,2.3422,5.528,'PgEsUvsnOZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38858,_binary '\0','/yS6TBGmujniHIeKXqBgb7ZhMvpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3652142',4,2310,'en','Espionage Tonight','In a reality TV show created by the U.S. government about spies, audiences go on fake undercover missions, but fact cannot be easily distinguished from fiction.','/hcfShtdG3kh1NxGcWsXvyb1td8Z.jpg','2017-10-24',85,'Released',NULL,'Espionage Tonight',463016,1.8309,3.2,'B9-IGcUpjSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38859,_binary '\0','/chEF9JE4fsS6sfgHjcqlXD2nGJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3652526',6.7,6297,'it','Fuocoammare','Capturing life on the Italian island of Lampedusa, a frontline in the European migrant crisis.','/fKZCS6IBTyGX7Sl67eMLSGHFsQn.jpg','2016-02-18',114,'Released','More than 17,000 people were reported to have died trying to cross the Mediterranean in the last 15 years...','Fire at Sea',377151,2.6755,6.7,'qR5l9XDaxK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38860,_binary '\0','/h5HzPvqOwLksuBC8JoG15ZaRfGd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3652862',6.3,5817,'en','Morris from America','13-year-old Morris Gentry has just relocated with his single father, Curtis to Heidelberg, Germany. Morris, who fancies himself the next Notorious B.I.G., is a complete fish-out-of-water—a budding hip-hop star in an EDM world. To complicate matters further, Morris quickly falls hard for his cool, rebellious, 15-year-old classmate Katrin. Morris sets out against all odds to take the hip-hop world by storm and win the girl of his dreams.','/10unUByLjh0FeNDJHXuNQZFmQFN.jpg','2016-08-19',89,'Released','Nothing rhymes with Germany','Morris from America',352890,2.1062,6.2,'AKhFNgFdbDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38861,_binary '\0','/kJQ56bguSWbXAzN7EK1RUekfY0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36544524',7.9,5970,'es','Un poeta','An aging poet finds purpose mentoring Yurlady, a talented teen, though exposing her to the poetry scene might be unwise. His own poetic pursuits led nowhere, leaving him a stereotypical obscure writer.','/o0MRVa3XMUUIxiSCZYaJ1jGXdk.jpg','2025-08-28',123,'Released',NULL,'A Poet',1465563,4.6461,8.768,'Ia4PVP0qtO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38862,_binary '\0','/wxnTq3k94yf0xqytw3QKcv1yDx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3654680',3.2,1482,'es','Vampyres','Victor Matellano directs this tale set in a stately English manor inhabited by two older female vampires and with their only cohabitant being a man imprisoned in the basement. Their lives and lifestyle are upended when a trio of campers come upon their lair and seek to uncover their dark secrets, a decision that has sexual and blood-curdling consequences.','/b41M28V6GcA94NAvn24SVz6qfvB.jpg','2015-09-25',79,'Released','Lust for blood','Vampyres',320678,1.7138,4.6,'ZinTJFP9YDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38863,_binary '\0','/xn4qe52O0gwfapVT9aOZOPA4wQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3654796',6.4,41584,'en','Creep 2','After finding an ad online for “video work,” Sara, a video artist whose primary focus is creating intimacy with lonely men, thinks she may have found the subject of her dreams. She drives to a remote house in the forest and meets a man claiming to be a serial killer. Unable to resist the chance to create a truly shocking piece of art, she agrees to spend the day with him. However, as the day goes on, she discovers she may have dug herself into a hole from which she can’t escape.','/a0m7WciFnBqpcyH1Yi8i4tdvk0k.jpg','2017-10-06',80,'Released',NULL,'Creep 2',396493,3.5664,6.341,'l_0sBk50Qr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38864,_binary '\0','/hKggiaE1hfA6Z31ezA9NfUFFLLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3654964',7.1,1915,'en','Art and Craft','For several decades, gifted and incredibly prolific forger Mark Landis compulsively created impeccable copies of works by a variety of major artists, donating them to institutions across the country and landing pieces on many of their walls. ART AND CRAFT brings us into the cluttered and insular life of an unforgettable character just as he finds his foil in an equally obsessive art registrar.','/btMgA6RKOXWq5HaUjz00PJ6Nh2m.jpg','2014-09-19',90,'Released','He puts the artist in con artist.','Art and Craft',265929,0.9804,7.1,'tudaAQ8VOBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38865,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655326',4.3,31068,'en','Life Is a Dream','It\'s an incredible heartbreaking story of son Valentino Morales left alone by his father at 7 years old with 3 brothers and his Mother. Valentino decides to go the road between New York, Dominican Republic and Venezuela to find him.','/fvcOwGRBXStLcFbCCjwlpQDKBIM.jpg','2014-01-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Life Is a Dream',1360458,1.4928,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38866,_binary '\0','/gT7MXlPs7ohpdefR5cdgdPx1zsf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36553678',6.7,1589,'ko','좀비딸','Jung-hwan is a gruff but loving zookeeper who specializes in training wild beasts. His teenage daughter, Soo-ah, is going through puberty and a full-blown dance obsession. Their days are full of bickering and bonding... until one day, Soo-ah becomes infected by a zombie virus that has swept across the globe. Refusing to give up on his daughter, Jung-hwan takes her to a quiet seaside village called Eunbong-ri, where his mother Bam-soon lives. In a world obsessed with rooting out the infected, Soo-ah shows strange signs of awareness - responding to music, her grandmother\'s sharp taps with a back scratcher, and even faint traces of human language. Determined to protect her at all costs, Jung-hwan draws on his years of experience training tigers and begins a secret mission to tame and retrain... his zombie daughter.','/4wk90VHnjy9dWRZPkXMMyphftLG.jpg','2025-07-30',114,'Released','My daughter is a zombie. The last remaining zombie in the world.','My Daughter Is a Zombie',1306816,4.0139,7.358,'_YzAg0trHxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38867,_binary '\0','/jnp2UslgvNbH0gpaFjNFJEYjOJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655374',6.6,5670,'tr','Mandıra Filozofu','Mustafaali, as a person who left the modern life behind him and lives in Cokertme Village, spends his days by reading books. Mustafaali, a person who is against working, satisfies all his vital needs from the blessing of nature. Cavit, on the other hand, is a rich businessman who lives in Istanbul. He has worked in his entire life and all he matters is to work, to earn and to make savings. Cavit\'s life becomes upside down after he met Mustafaali when he wants to buy Mustafaali\'s land to build a boutique hotel in Cokertme Bay. Living far from the modern life in his small land under the natural circumstances, Mustafaali\'s philosophy confuses Cavit who is a person from a big city.','/gYWGNOoQi6DD8PEVQB8QDO2ER7R.jpg','2014-04-04',109,'Released',NULL,'Mandıra Filozofu',297298,1.4425,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38868,_binary '\0','/61x4IXb92ZPhqBJvzVW6Et9pvmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655414',6.2,7819,'es','Cien años de perdón','Valencia, Spain. On a rainy morning, six armed men in disguise assault a bank. But what seemed like an easy heist, quickly goes wrong with nothing unfolding as planned, and mistrust quickly builds between the two leaders of the gang.','/elEaCDGOymaTePaM7oL41WaT0aC.jpg','2016-03-03',96,'Released','Who can you trust?','To Steal from a Thief',351809,4.167,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38869,_binary '\0','/yJ9HQ4OrFouSj8kRF9opf8s7yGE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655522',6.9,10624,'fr','Bande de filles','Oppressed by her family setting, dead-end school prospects and the boys law in the neighborhood, Marieme starts a new life after meeting a group of three free-spirited girls. She changes her name, her dress code, and quits school to be accepted in the gang, hoping that this will be a way to freedom.','/qZ52DlSVguX0WHYoiOD464IIONd.jpg','2014-10-22',112,'Released','You don\'t have the full story. Until you know hers.','Girlhood',266082,3.0269,6.5,'eo1TSLr6NTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38870,_binary '\0','/83nuPWN5oirkil4YID6XTYqoxco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655682',3.7,5636,'en','Let\'s Be Evil','A woman enters an underground bunker where gifted children use augmented reality technology to wreak havoc.','/8HGEJzi4y1rajNtV7SBWeofTPIp.jpg','2016-08-05',83,'Released','Evil see. Evil do.','Let\'s Be Evil',376579,1.528,4.2,'HXI_xAJFi4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38871,_binary '\0','/3I7MBgBtOzphZREhooY7l1LB7DB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3655972',6.8,4038,'es','El Olivo','Alma’s family has been producing quality olive oil in the Baix Maestrat area of Spain’s Castellón for generations. Yet changing pressures in the industry have made their traditional practices economically untenable, and the family is now in the mass-production poultry business. Alma’s grandfather has not spoken in years. Sadness envelopes him, and he no longer wants to eat. His sons—Alma’s father and uncle—are impatient with him, but Alma understands her grandfather. She realizes he has been grieving for a thousand-year-old olive tree that the family has uprooted and sold to pay some debts. (A sadly common reality in Castellón at present.) Unable to bear the idea that her grandfather could die without seeing this terrible wrong corrected, Alma undertakes a quixotic mission to locate the tree and return it to the family orchard, so that her grandfather may have peace in his final days.','/uyWCqamhJImIwLdPgSmXNn2UwX5.jpg','2016-05-06',96,'Released','Never lose touch with your roots.','The Olive Tree',366505,1.4671,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38872,_binary '\0','/p0YEx9BNSAJt7RH41OOH7fRtTMV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36575995',6.9,3164,'ta','Kadukka','In a peaceful village, Two Young best Friends fall for the same Beautiful Girl. What starts as friendship soon turns into a comedy-filled Love war. Each tries to win her heart with charm, tricks, and emotions, but the girl has a surprise of her own is shown in a Comedy Suspense with Fun filled power packed manner.','/k4p4QoWK4kdzyEWrD0XapdBS9Tx.jpg','2025-08-29',123,'Released',NULL,'Kadukka',1478844,1.4782,0,'AyzYDqpVyNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38873,_binary '\0','/vRdHKjKOpT1HoAp6JkfvdrnphH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36580119',7.5,4806,'en','The President\'s Cake','While people across 1990’s Iraq struggle to survive, 9-year-old Lamia has been selected to prepare a cake to celebrate the President’s birthday. In a landscape of fear and scarcity, where basic ingredients are nearly impossible to find, Lamia sets out on a determined journey throughout the big city in search of eggs, flour, and sugar. Accompanied by her grandmother, her loyal friend Saeed, and her pet rooster Hindi, she navigates vendors and police officers along the way.','/uSrozVUxIUaer6FIUHHFtOdbqj8.jpg','2026-01-22',106,'Released',NULL,'The President\'s Cake',1464883,5.978,7.4,'8i3idbVnC6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38874,_binary '\0','/cSiQqEN2IbNxWXNZ2YLd32DSVrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36580813',5,1218,'ml','പ്ലൂട്ടോ','Vicky, down on his luck after multiple failed businesses, accidentally befriends an alien named Pluto. Both considered losers, they navigate life together while a gang of thugs attempts to capture the alien.','/pPxsw4KnZbsklyHUCTKSCHKaC8F.jpg','2026-07-30',131,'Released',NULL,'Pluto',1444088,1.4348,2,'CLyFnH-Lu90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38875,_binary '\0','/w7hqriNqhyGZb30mPDmBW6tFyMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36586751',6.4,1240,'de','Extrawurst','At a tennis club in rural Germany, preparations for the summer party are led by Heribert. When a separate grill is suggested for Erol, the club\'s only Muslim member, tensions flare. What begins as a simple discussion quickly turns into a debate about societal and personal conflicts, threatening to tear the club apart.','/vZqnXMNzEsHi1YYbuM4QNtc1bEV.jpg','2026-01-15',98,'Released',NULL,'The Holy Grill',1427838,2.878,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38876,_binary '\0','/sBkt74K37VWbsAyuNe6Rk8PBvLm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36587142',7.1,2767,'ta','ஆரோமலே','Ajith, a romantic dreamer faces reality when forced to work at a matchmaking agency under Anjali,a pragmatic, grounded woman, devoid of dreamy illusions. Their conflicting ideologies become the foundation of a relationship that’s as charming as it is unfiltered.','/80YOW8UVr1ublMX2Q638MCdS2Q4.jpg','2025-11-07',127,'Released',NULL,'Aaromaley',1489510,1.6191,6.733,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38877,_binary '\0','/5knrDzDDQQ4vIk4IXFUBcR2dOYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3658772',5.3,19225,'en','Misconduct','An ambitious lawyer finds himself caught in a power struggle between a corrupt pharmaceutical executive and his firm’s senior partner. When the case takes a deadly turn, he must race to uncover the truth before he loses everything.','/agQHIsW5nLbKS5exd79NhUw9uY8.jpg','2016-02-05',106,'Released','Ambition can be deadly.','Misconduct',373314,4.2373,5.6,'9nEHwVFcDXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38878,_binary '\0','/wcXcAI1S9N9DG7SvjNTGGCxVlsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36589928',6.6,1675,'en','Our Hero, Balthazar','Eager to impress his activist crush, a wealthy New York teenager follows an online connection to Texas, where he\'s convinced he can stop an act of extreme violence.','/mxVTarvl5OLoU9YWIYygby6R0KI.jpg','2026-03-27',96,'Released','Take a shot at friendship.','Our Hero, Balthazar',1465557,4.1573,6.4,'BjmkWI96YLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38879,_binary '\0','/nMbK6zeHGjKtph5odcyHrNkVmLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36590288',7.5,1354,'en','Depeche Mode: M','Depeche Mode: M captures the band\'s 2023 Mexico City shows, blending concert footage with interstitial elements, exploring music, mortality, and Mexican culture\'s relationship with death.','/qz0EgfYwfrqhC2yTIqNkSY4P2Jo.jpg','2025-10-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Depeche Mode: M',1465711,1.4805,8.198,'Ju9IRHOQTkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38880,_binary '\0','/yzdMGn8IRHSGuV8AIzw19wkRU2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36590417',6.8,8116,'en','Don\'t Say Good Luck','Sophie Birenbaum is ready for the spotlight as the lead in her high school musical — until she\'s suddenly facing more drama at home than on the stage.','/dgTKahWonzVLeN8Lm22WR2S7D0A.jpg','2026-08-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Say Good Luck',1504358,9.6162,7.283,'bvWqHSFkO5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38881,_binary '\0','/kieO4beSjRrjROR21p7iFmoeQsJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36591419',5.2,2369,'en','Man Finds Tape','Pulled in by a series of strange and unexplainable video clips, a brother and sister team up to investigate the events captured in the footage, only to discover a shocking secret that’s overtaking their small-town Texas community.','/1WMaJEwwsw8ALCo1mRGjjTV5e8T.jpg','2025-12-05',86,'Released','Can you see it.','Man Finds Tape',1465986,2.3179,5.564,'jN9gk6zpf7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38882,_binary '\0','/nqfgAh16N1w5T5LVodFG30QhnKP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36592065',6.6,8233,'en','A Deadly American Marriage','A chilling 911 call. A gruesome scene. What really happened inside a family\'s quiet suburban home? Murder or self-defense? Told from both sides, this documentary explores Jason Corbett\'s brutal death.','/yzPpsg2HX6BcavbE43NzpgDig9F.jpg','2025-05-09',103,'Released',NULL,'A Deadly American Marriage',1466938,2.7019,6.516,'0PPSFCWO_cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38883,_binary '\0','/lzMS0CI3FLQYC5EgJoWeIaEt0lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3659388',8,1030149,'en','The Martian','During a manned mission to Mars, Astronaut Mark Watney is presumed dead after a fierce storm and left behind by his crew. But Watney has survived and finds himself stranded and alone on the hostile planet. With only meager supplies, he must draw upon his ingenuity, wit and spirit to subsist and find a way to signal to Earth that he is alive.','/5BHuvQ6p9kfc091Z8RiFNhCwL4b.jpg','2015-09-30',141,'Released','Bring him home.','The Martian',286217,30.5113,7.708,'Ue4PCI0NamI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38884,_binary '\0','/dJ4sqrmX2KviF8HBKlLrDedUhnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36596965',9.1,3842,'ta','மண்டாடி','A fishing captain applies his maritime knowledge in a traditional boat race along Tamil Nadu\'s coast during a festival, leading a six-person team against other crews.','/cDFW9BI1PSqrBWu8W0ZoeUQivEM.jpg','2026-09-10',153,'Released',NULL,'Mandaadi',1465943,7.4418,8,'VOHaf-0DV-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38885,_binary '\0','/pA910gOJxtGLRdNmiiUfEKYLZFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3659786',7.8,6877,'en','Marvellous','Dramatisation of the true story of the life of Neil \"Nello\" Baldwin. Born with a mild learning disability but without the burden of social embarrassment &amp; how his inexhaustible ability to see the good in any situation overcame any stigma society tried to label him with.','/6enWpJ7IAN54krCOXQDrbMRcuCb.jpg','2014-09-25',90,'Released','I always wanted to be happy, so I decided to be.','Marvellous',295144,2.1115,7.1,'f0k566wcK64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38886,_binary '\0','/iyIYSfyMTRlaLQWzKWxNRPVkt8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36598036',7.6,3765,'zh','南京照相馆','During the 1937 Nanjing Massacre, a postman poses as a photo developer, helping Japanese forces while secretly sheltering Chinese refugees. He later risks his life evacuating them and revealing evidence of the atrocities.','/rx9xTly73NssFHPg9gKrX9tJdDI.jpg','2025-07-19',137,'Released','Every Chinese will not forget the history.','Dead to Rights',1500536,4.2728,7.9,'_PX1WNbKdAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38887,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36600605',6.7,2170,'kn','ಸೆಪ್ಟೆಂಬರ್ 21','A caregiver navigates the emotional strain of caring for a man living with Alzheimer\'s disease, exploring the quiet struggles of memory loss, disorientation, and the toll the condition takes on families who face it daily.','/eZAeggg94EjoFOhO3ABobkSZQEN.jpg','2026-05-22',124,'Released',NULL,'September 21',1747494,1.4246,0,'0zF8cRQ0P_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38888,_binary '\0','/joZY6JcpItspa0BdOYehsJRyWNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3660370',6.4,1597,'fr','Party Girl','Angélique is a 60-year-old bar hostess. She still likes to party, she still likes men. At night, she makes them drink, in a cabaret by the French-German border. As time goes by, clients become rare. But Michel, her regular client, is still in love with her. One day, he asks Angélique to marry him.','/woul0s4PWeTRbeQH4TdBqOr19Gq.jpg','2014-08-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Party Girl',266030,1.9064,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38889,_binary '\0','/2MIJOoBXGTN4igYeibSz7tlImLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36604797',6.3,1445,'en','Holiday Touchdown: A Bills Love Story','The Quinns and DeLucas have lived next door to each other for decades in the shadow of Highmark Stadium – the home of their beloved Buffalo Bills. With their longtime friendship rooted in being proud members of Bills Mafia, the two clans have enjoyed cherished traditions that revolve around cheering for their favorite team – especially at the holidays when they celebrate the last home game before Christmas.','/hpkykimE5Rx8nsDoB0skhycCTTH.jpg','2025-11-22',84,'Released','Go for four. You might find forever','Holiday Touchdown: A Bills Love Story',1485002,1.842,6,'CDAHGnyv_sY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38890,_binary '\0','/ze70dN2RVtfLms86dV1Eo0j4Vyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36606532',6.4,1339,'tr','Adile Naşit','A biopic about Turkish actress Adile Naşit (1930—1987), who was featured in many ensemble casts in classic comedy films.','/nIlaVCFJuMrIgAIPyHefHVExL3w.jpg','2025-12-04',119,'Released',NULL,'Adile Nasit',1555918,1.3392,3.3,'moTq-Uobigo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38891,_binary '\0','/ztEbGnKWoNmMlGDRQa2nB06GQpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3660770',7.2,4367,'en','Monkey Kingdom','A newborn monkey and its mother struggle to survive within the competitive social hierarchy of the Temple Troop, a dynamic group of monkeys who live in ancient ruins found deep in the storied jungles of South Asia.','/xLnHomaE6zR0NWlBIz3Tj1z4YH9.jpg','2015-04-16',81,'Released','Adventure is in Full Swing.','Monkey Kingdom',295592,4.4375,7,'Qwh6_bMcGl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38892,_binary '\0','/eq0N54GnErEcTJtTWu7UOzqfKPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3660850',6.2,1419,'en','The Assault','After a cheerleader is sexually assaulted by the high school football team, she must overcome her shame and use the evidence gathered from the subsequent social media firestorm to piece together the night that she can\'t remember in her fight for justice. Based on the true story of the Steubenville, Ohio rape case.','/2FiIO8LD1Nla75SBcO7psMdskOs.jpg','2014-09-20',90,'Released','It was the night she can\'t remember, but the town will never forget.','The Assault',295237,1.6346,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38893,_binary '\0','/wQhe2YJnB9AAS08RqwMeKN2ywUr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3661210',7.1,90578,'en','The Dig','As WWII looms, a wealthy widow hires an amateur archaeologist to excavate the burial mounds on her estate. When they make a historic discovery, the echoes of Britain\'s past resonate in the face of its uncertain future‎.','/dFDNb9Gk1kyLRcconpj7Mc7C7IL.jpg','2021-01-14',112,'Released','Nothing stays lost forever.','The Dig',532865,6.6879,6.851,'JZQz0rkNajo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38894,_binary '\0','/d4AxVtIK6P4iJgbgjK8os3e2Uk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3661298',6.2,6307,'en','Septembers of Shiraz','In this adaptation of the critically acclaimed debut novel by Iranian American author Dalia Sofer, a secular Jewish family is caught up in the maelstrom of the 1979 Iranian Revolution.','/1s2xayFVgYEQb8DxnmNCJZMXgGp.jpg','2015-09-15',110,'Released','Based on true events','Septembers of Shiraz',352179,2.8491,5.9,'3ptoFRNK5Bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38895,_binary '\0','/umRu7cN3wIf1kRbCdhQkx6cVGZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3661394',6.6,14309,'en','The One and Only Ivan','A gorilla named Ivan who’s living in a suburban shopping mall tries to piece together his past, with the help of other animals, as they hatch a plan to escape from captivity.','/wDOyGAiTaXvjKGmnmXsoFO7zItt.jpg','2020-08-21',93,'Released','It\'s never too late to discover who you are.','The One and Only Ivan',508570,6.8548,7.331,'MK9i6l7oao4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38896,_binary '\0','/mmfWd1hhnK9Xq6uory8fHWMuLCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36615506',5,1507,'en','Project MKHEXE','Tim films his brother Sean\'s funeral after his suicide, then uncovers Sean\'s fixation with a nonexistent online urban legend about a failed government mind control experiment.','/lBHqB18SoTOZ4Ob0expDnf7QSov.jpg','2025-04-28',113,'Released','What we fear we create.','Project MKHEXE',1468706,0.9907,5.4,'tBLbb8WMG7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38897,_binary '\0','/1NegG8bZRn3Fc1wluAbMeR19rym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36616410',7.7,11204,'ml','എക്കോ','In the misty hills of Kaattukunnu, an aging woman and her servant boy struggle to survive the ghosts of the past, as the hunt for Kuriachan — a legendary dog breeder and outlaw — blurs the line between myth, memory, and vengeance, revealing that even in absence, he still rules the hills.','/tXdFEmtqLm8tewIErDJgnbTS9qs.jpg','2025-11-21',127,'Released','From The Infinite Chronicles of Kuriachan','Eko',1070186,1.7699,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38898,_binary '\0','/A80v57u74OPylOmG3FNpxrJbEzV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3661798',7,3576,'ko','도희야','Sent from Seoul to serve in a remote coastal village, a policewoman gets involved in the life of a mysterious teenage girl who is abused by both her father and her grandmother.','/clsf4ahm1KYucXxTZBEOZ3YJUyp.jpg','2014-05-22',119,'Released','I\'ll do my best. I\'ll do anything.','A Girl at My Door',266058,2.9498,6.918,'Hgi0a_kGTvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38899,_binary '\0','/wRnHDeItfhPBt7tUQ54rpD2uA0r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3661988',6.9,3623,'ml','7th ഡേ','Even though crime branch officer David Abraham is on suspension, he engages himself in the investigation of a case on Christmas night which is not yet recorded in the crime records.','/A5gnTlftMu15Tu6JcZRfwI76sWh.jpg','2014-04-12',134,'Released',NULL,'7th Day',264450,1.5407,6.204,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38900,_binary '\0','/wG6yUcgv4xaj64KX7SSPEwBGXW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36619926',6.9,8475,'en','Heartstopper Forever','It\'s a new school year for the Truham-Higgs gang. As Nick and Charlie\'s relationship deepens, their thoughts turn to life after the last bell rings.','/r4lVJVO1BeBb11cBcXBdbHc9e9k.jpg','2026-07-14',110,'Released','Love like there\'s no ending.','Heartstopper Forever',1468683,8.8852,7.237,'locuQ-skySE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38901,_binary '\0','/2FQnGgZb8E94xl9fUWspnJZB4xj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3662066',5,3700,'en','One More Time','Beautiful aspiring rock star Jude is stuck in a rut - relegated to recording commercial jingles and lost in a series of one night stands. When she is evicted from her Brooklyn apartment, she is forced to move into the Hamptons home of her wealthy - and selfish - father Paul Lombard, an over-the-hill, Sinatra-esque crooner angling for a musical comeback.','/yrZ1azTISRD91tcYCeMk7lhhYgc.jpg','2016-04-08',98,'Released','The hardest act to follow is your father\'s.','One More Time',321030,1.8495,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38902,_binary '\0','/v5U0s7HZGbZY8q6SXK6aFykSuDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3662308',6,5299,'es','Belzebuth','While leading a police investigation of a massacre in a public school at the border of Mexico and U.S.A, special Agent Emanuel Ritter links this strange case to the coming and rising of the ancient demon Belzebuth. But in order to stop the trail of upcoming infanticides, Ritter shall have to confront himself before dealing with the forces of good and evil.','/em79Vu871uUVZEpBY6qkO5O6psP.jpg','2019-01-11',114,'Released','Don\'t stop praying','Belzebuth',373226,2.9471,7.2,'Tu4-xnBvfi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38903,_binary '\0','/nOQYly08Rv5fepk67i4wy43Oyyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36626888',8.1,16973,'hi','ओह माय डॉग','In Assam, 14-year-old Apu embarks on a desperate quest to rescue his beloved dog, Momo, after he is kidnapped. Elsewhere, in Bihar, a devoted dog named Oscar sets out on a perilous journey to find his kidnapped owner, a 15-year-old child labourer. As their journeys unfold, it becomes clear that the two kidnappings may be connected to a larger, sinister plan.','/zzHV3rmS07lrFkcHXFx2J9JhZwJ.jpg','2026-08-06',150,'Released',NULL,'Ohh My Dog',1727563,2.0223,0,'Hkv1-F5-EaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38904,_binary '\0','/rfMWciUEZkqL9AiNcTedhtXQHr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36628923',7.3,7887,'ml','സംഭവം അദ്ധ്യായം ഒന്ന്','Three Kerala Police officers venture into a mysterious forest on the Kerala-Tamil Nadu border to find a missing officer. They encounter strange time-related phenomena, uncovering the hidden secrets of Velloorkkatt forest.','/4ASKGsPMbzChx0YX5Pqc9HFXQm3.jpg','2026-03-06',127,'Released',NULL,'Sambhavam Adhyayam Onnu',1469458,3.7492,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38905,_binary '\0','/hS4FcOM5y71FurkBQgDLTBxmWZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36629665',4.4,3623,'en','Her Private Hell','When a mysterious mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis, unleashing a deadly and elusive entity, a troubled young woman searches for her father. Her quest collides with an American GI on a harrowing odyssey to rescue his daughter from Hell.','/pyIDpB5iZMRB5PdV9an146QEXAl.jpg','2026-07-23',110,'Released','Revenge wears leather.','Her Private Hell',1469342,14.3799,5.437,'C7E-0t1TfzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38906,_binary '\0','/kTUmV1dxBc5edzyU1J3lr5GmPNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3663040',4.8,3469,'en','Heatstroke','On a family trip in the African desert, a research scientist unintentionally travels off course and is brutally murdered by an arms dealer. His girlfriend is put to the ultimate survival test as she attempts to evade the killers and protect his teenage daughter.','/w1WLAWoC4DcJmYumkdHNhhMMRQ6.jpg','2013-12-19',92,'Released','Run. Fight. Survive. The hunt is on.','Heatstroke',278334,1.4823,5.1,'pS-2u8gcnY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38907,_binary '\0','/pSvZcHQtgwCmyUrR265AHbmi5x9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36631507',5.9,1723,'fa','زن و بچه','Mahnaz, a 40-year-old widowed nurse, struggles with her rebellious son, Aliyar, who has been suspended from school. Family tensions reach a peak during the betrothal ceremony with her new boyfriend Hamid, and a tragic accident occurs. In the aftermath, Mahnaz will be forced to confront betrayal and loss, and to embark on a quest for justice.','/ucDOgWEfQK014P1CoHdfdL6jO4t.jpg','2025-07-23',131,'Released',NULL,'Woman and Child',1430386,1.968,5.4,'PXyb_-CAgNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38908,_binary '\0','/pme7D46PxaOdNWika46q5VUS2CR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36639986',6.8,2183,'es','Soy Frankelda','A gifted young writer in 19th-century Mexico journeys into her subconscious and comes face to face with characters from her own spooky stories.','/hDzllxB1TQ7uUxVvjnGHirJJovt.jpg','2025-10-23',104,'Released','What you imagine has long been imagining you.','I Am Frankelda',1119090,7.5112,8.04,'diRwnGRr-Ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38909,_binary '\0','/A2fQstUG5OwJuq8DlwBXJKgQzNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36640622',8.2,3002,'en','Louis Theroux: The Settlers','Fourteen years after his first visit, Louis Theroux meets some of the growing community of religious-nationalist Israelis who have settled in the occupied West Bank.','/iT1J9zYzEY069wF546RJmuYO5m4.jpg','2025-04-27',62,'Released',NULL,'Louis Theroux: The Settlers',1466013,2.7963,8.447,'zesI26Xi0Fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38910,_binary '\0','/wFqJMVP0nrsgKeA2kwshRkIz1fw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36642456',7.7,16950,'hi','हक़','In 1980s India, Shazia Bano takes her husband to court after he abandons her and their children, sparking a national battle over faith, women’s rights, and justice.','/tO7OI5MyzPSiVmlXXnlBKlAJH92.jpg','2025-11-07',136,'Released',NULL,'Haq',1417941,2.4811,7.5,'YPUV--sT2oQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38911,_binary '\0','/gM1kQRPwOVW1Eos5tVWqcYmHR5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36647890',3.7,4373,'en','The Mortuary Assistant','Rebecca Owens, a recent mortuary science graduate takes a night shift job at River Fields Mortuary. Initially, the job seems straightforward — embalming bodies, completing paperwork, and keeping things tidy. But once Rebecca starts working the night shift, things take a dark turn.','/72AoFPC5TY4DfJwXXS9rPwPeReD.jpg','2026-02-13',91,'Released','Alone with the dead.','The Mortuary Assistant',1470130,17.7406,5.233,'YtY6JoPX5MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38912,_binary '\0','/3LDkNxsIvzkUVZcgH1xRsdGflpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3665486',7.3,1277,'en','Skid Row: Los Scandalous','See what makes Skid Row tick, a tell all, never before seen, raw documentary about the harsh reality of the street life in Los Scandalous - Skid Row. The homeless capital of The United States. Watch through my lens, as I show the true gutter life in Los Angeles; from prostitution, homelessness, hard addiction, the drug dealers perspective, police corruption and the system designed to keep them all there. My name is Shanks Rajendran and I\'m a 28 year old Australian filmmaker. I shot this documentary to uncover the truth about Skid Row, the people, the place, and the politics behind it.','/aD5M2UVTeKgktK4X8WRBJJmsYyK.jpg','2014-07-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Skid Row: Los Scandalous',287488,0.4856,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38913,_binary '\0','/4l31EfSNkjhuO0DJvrP7CWMy9x7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3665498',5,5376,'en','Beyond the Sky','A documentary filmmaker travels to a UFO convention in New Mexico where he meets a local artist with a dark secret. As they follow a trail of clues they discover disturbing sightings and question all they believe when they become immersed in the enigmatic culture of the Pueblo Indians.','/jACLTZ5Kt54CBEYOx7FSBJd8QFf.jpg','2018-09-21',85,'Released','Are they real?','Beyond the Sky',478528,3.3169,5,'tgIGff9H9ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38914,_binary '\0','/dotEMpAXmAp6lAYulMVK4lqKFiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3666024',7.5,42675,'fr','La tortue rouge','The dialogue-less film follows the major life stages of a castaway on a deserted tropical island populated by turtles, crabs and birds.','/wOBU3SLjQ9358Km9YWYasPZyebp.jpg','2016-03-27',81,'Released',NULL,'The Red Turtle',337703,6.974,7.426,'4lwrzNqEUOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38915,_binary '\0','/8e1ua0s7xKo4nO9Z6ia6CMqpVm0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36673871',4.8,1962,'en','Bigfoot: Blood on the Farm','\" Bigfoot Blood on the Farm \" is a tense, heart-pounding thriller about family, survival, and the terrifying unknown that lurks in the shadows of the woods. Two sisters find themselves alone on their rural farm, facing an unimaginable terror. \" Bigfoot \". With the farm isolated and no one else around to help, the sisters must quickly shift from surviving farm life to surviving the fight of their lives.','/mqd0pCJF3jACSS8xHaFqjp72Bbn.jpg','2025-06-01',70,'Released','“One farm. One family. One nightmare they never saw coming.”','Bigfoot: Blood on the Farm',1484513,1.1302,3.2,'Z_OZXCBycgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38916,_binary '\0','/n0Ft9Dh1yAiOHvntnjhsdHT28nk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3667610',6.6,1642,'pl','Ziarno prawdy','A big shot prosecutor Teodor Szacki divorces his wife and leaves Warsaw to “start a new life” in picturesque town in south­east Poland ­ Sandomierz. After a short while he is called in to investigate a strange and mysterious murder case. Alienated in provincial reality he struggles to find a killer, when he stumbles upon more victims. While the investigation continues he realizes that all murders are connected to alleged historical Jewish ritual killings. Those murders prompt a wave of anti­Semitic hysteria in the town. In his investigation Szacki must wrestle with the painful tangle of Polish­Jewish relations and real findings of his work ­ that roots of some legends arefantasy, not a grain of truth…','/bHZxpZdHUvFMuA8DbFjNWlkGDxn.jpg','2015-01-09',116,'Released',NULL,'A Grain of Truth',278677,0.9783,6.3,'YHgfQrNYY0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38917,_binary '\0','/srxYer1Xl8y7qcviSXqYfDjehL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3667648',5.7,3267,'fr','Une heure de tranquillité','Michel, who\'s crazy about jazz, has just found a rare album that he dreams of quietly listening to in his living room. But the world seems to have conspired against him: his wife chooses this moment to divulge an ill-timed revelation, his adult son makes a surprise visit, one of his friends knocks on the door, while his mother keeps calling him on his smartphone. Not to mention that today the residents in his apartment building are holding their annual House Party. Manipulative and a liar, Michel is ready to do anything to have a moment of peace and quiet. Is it still possible, in this day and age, to just have one hour of peace?','/d5csriJUa3Evyv8r2IJANnuJlE.jpg','2014-12-31',79,'Released',NULL,'Do Not Disturb',298614,2.7395,5.3,'wUdRizsjkgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38918,_binary '\0','/4af4bNauDti5Nrny3M4QtJ2U7Eo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3667792',5.1,2536,'en','Natural Selection','Tyler is a young man who is desperately seeking direction from a world that seems to have abandoned him. Searching for answers he looks to his new friend Indrid who appears to have it all figured out.','/acuvfhljS3xlRw6fSOIMXjmJ2Qy.jpg','2016-08-26',100,'Released','At our darkest time, a moment will come that will define who we are.','Natural Selection',364690,1.6171,5.3,'TmukwfURTIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38919,_binary '\0','/svJsGnv59BT1AHHsCn7TonnglPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3668162',8.3,28722,'ml','ബാംഗ്ലൂർ ഡെയ്സ്','A fun roller coaster ride about three young people, Aju, Divya and Kuttan who are cousins, reach Bangalore to dream, discover & explore!','/iFMyZw1DTGvZ8hPa0eTseSFiRT1.jpg','2014-05-30',172,'Released',NULL,'Bangalore Days',268660,1.7256,7.6,'uVpHL5g4buY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38920,_binary '\0','/epghjQKoDlwQ2vGYDQzMAFoJHRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36690044',6.8,1410,'zh','震耳欲聋','Lawyer Li Qi, driven by greed, becomes embroiled in a fraud case against deaf individuals, abandoning his deaf family background in pursuit of fame and fortune.','/6aKzErXjKJl2yaJ5mALN0jDVZhH.jpg','2025-10-02',125,'Released',NULL,'Sound of Silence',1466319,2.6771,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38921,_binary '\0','/a8lqXYJwBTzk4Xxcbo04Z7iYtkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3671086',3.6,3811,'en','Natural Born Pranksters','The world’s three most notorious, ballsy, and outrageous pranksters come together for the first time to unleash the most epic pranks in an outrageous feature-film event. Jam-packed with cameos from some of YouTube’s biggest stars, watch as Roman Atwood, Dennis Roady, and Vitaly Zdorovetskiy take fearlessness and unbelievable social experiments to the next level.','/hjqANfedlqmhVoMbHiNJQ9BSuNA.jpg','2016-04-01',90,'Released','The Pranks Just Got a Whole Lot Bigger... We Measured.','Natural Born Pranksters',383524,1.4478,4.2,'2dmqsY3_1uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38922,_binary '\0','/ihNGNOjeu0BbMur8JpcEy0dVmUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3671480',6.5,1423,'hu','Szabadesés','An old woman flies past six floors after jumping from the roof of her apartment block. Six stories on the poor state of humanity, told with humour and rare imagination to the accompaniment of a pulsating soundtrack from Amon Tobin. A woeful burlesque set in the present by one of Europe’s most original contemporary filmmakers.','/A57TsWWlWK0PiWgzXra2JQykVbw.jpg','2014-09-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Free Fall',286313,1.1118,5.6,'A7u1FjEBsos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38923,_binary '\0','/geJLQjNXuLhEz5Nr8bTOBIUAn2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3671542',7.5,14366,'en','Holding the Man','Tim and John fell in love while teenagers at their all-boys high school. John was captain of the football team, Tim an aspiring actor playing a minor part in Romeo and Juliet. Their romance endured for 15 years in the face of everything life threw at it – the separations, the discrimination, the temptations, the jealousies and the losses – until the only problem that love can\'t solve tried to destroy them.','/dF04CHO27xbNL0Zn0JJ0QdC7SNU.jpg','2015-08-27',128,'Released','A love story for everyone.','Holding the Man',337960,3.3955,7.673,'JOURNEMfHls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38924,_binary '\0','/y4hDOkRKW6UXQK4G0aAovbVb4d2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3672120',5.5,5567,'en','Pottersville','Maynard, a beloved local businessman is mistaken for the legendary Bigfoot during an inebriated romp through town in a makeshift gorilla costume. The sightings set off an international Bigfoot media spectacle and a windfall of tourism dollars for a simple American town hit by hard times. When Brock Masterson, reality TV’s “Monster Hunter,” arrives to hunt the beast, Maynard agonizes over whether to come clean, destroying the rebirth of his beloved town, or perpetuate the inadvertent hoax.','/tQneEIQWTcwnt7R6FGJJDXPGiCJ.jpg','2017-11-10',85,'Released','It\'s a magical life','Pottersville',413990,1.8638,4.8,'Jqf8h5Uip6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38925,_binary '\0','/cyLD6FSHYeWhkJq5DBaAlOzP1y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36722524',8.2,4709,'pa','ਗੁਰੂ ਨਾਨਕ ਜਹਾਜ਼','The film is based on a true incident of 20th century popularly known as Komagata Maru incident. The film unveils a poignant chapter in history when a group of Indian Sikh immigrants aboard a Japanese steamship named Komagata Maru arrived in Vancouver carrying 376 passengers from India. Canada, enforcing discriminatory immigration laws, denied entry to most passengers who were of Indian descent. After two months of legal battles and protests, the ship was forced to return to India. The incident highlights racial prejudices and immigration policies of the time, symbolising a struggle for Equality and Justice.','/aB3Rvx7S25HBog1TZuuGoqBYXoJ.jpg','2025-05-01',140,'Released',NULL,'Guru Nanak Jahaz',1469409,1.0058,0,'4xPks078zY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38926,_binary '\0','/2HI6PbPaONpSaoif44INBf5jR87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3672640',5.1,2864,'fi','Luokkakokous','Luokkakokous is a story about three men that travel back to their hometown to attend their high school class reunion.','/bQ1SKVLmN5HDNPAAlH9o48SYYtz.jpg','2015-02-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Reunion',327476,1.0984,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38927,_binary '\0','/21fNILK2g4tzsY6IHWXc7Plujne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3672742',6.7,31371,'en','Turbo Kid','In a post-apocalyptic wasteland, an orphaned teen must battle a ruthless warlord to save the girl of his dreams.','/ArUqADkwycYtNVuXSoSXVrdJ8iJ.jpg','2015-08-14',95,'Released','This is the future... This is the year 1997.','Turbo Kid',310135,3.1578,6.5,'AFlZ6pVtnv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38928,_binary '\0','/rnNkUJlo03a8D0utxiOrADstaMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3672840',5.9,22678,'zh','天將雄師','Huo An, the commander of the Protection Squad of the Western Regions, was framed by evil forces and becomes enslaved. On the other hand, a Roman general escapes to China after rescuing the Prince. The heroic duo meet in the Western Desert and a thrilling story unfolds.','/hrEbZNZQ385i4snYWyCDpYrEofO.jpg','2015-02-19',127,'Released','When the Eagle meets the Dragon','Dragon Blade',300168,4.4454,6.4,'lwMlpp8GIAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38929,_binary '\0','/xawDFjfjBmtKYC29bZOYnYPGa8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36733027',7.8,2733,'zh','浪浪山小妖怪','The Little Pig Yao decides to leave Langlang Mountain to join the pilgrimage. On the journey west, what trials will the little monsters face? In the end, will they achieve their dreams and live as they truly desire?','/mCa8Pb4L0X56gxV1sIQkLJ2RKz0.jpg','2025-08-02',118,'Released',NULL,'Nobody',1304434,5.2469,7.9,'XmpXSsyqPjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38930,_binary '\0','/lqtzWKCpejXdKb22cav5bB6MqSR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3674140',8.4,25533,'fr','Le sel de la terre','During the last forty years, the photographer Sebastião Salgado has been travelling through the continents, in the footsteps of an ever-changing humanity. He has witnessed the major events of our recent history: international conflicts, starvations and exodus… He is now embarking on the discovery of pristine territories, of the wild fauna and flora, of grandiose landscapes: a huge photographic project which is a tribute to the planet\'s beauty. Salgado\'s life and work are revealed to us by his son, Juliano, who went with him during his last journeys, and by Wim Wenders, a photographer himself.','/jRmQNj8NacAHJnzwfvFvglKSGB6.jpg','2014-08-29',110,'Released','A Journey With Sebastião Salgado','The Salt of the Earth',265297,3.7393,8.1,'OivMlWXtWpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38931,_binary '\0','/uHavtqbnMDcwqVK9Y94ZQSWxtCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36741457',6.6,6268,'it','Il falsario','Toni Chichiarelli arrives in Rome with the dream of becoming a painter, but his talent leads him elsewhere — from art galleries to state secrets. Between art, crime, and power, his signature ends up everywhere — even in the history of Italy.','/qNEL6chkH2s6gwvt0Jt9NfiXG8m.jpg','2025-10-19',110,'Released',NULL,'The Big Fake',1443762,4.7219,6.622,'OMeOauwYjRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38932,_binary '\0','/fog8Vbeg1KOZAucucPxgYpXJ0a0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36751759',7.6,2644,'en','Wick Is Pain','Witness the never-before-seen footage and true story behind the John Wick phenomenon – from independent film to billion-dollar franchise.','/ctZ9bjmCYyfFt3cUepc9axr0zHs.jpg','2025-05-09',127,'Released','How the legend was made.','Wick Is Pain',1472668,4.1774,7.4,'LaEjB78QLSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38933,_binary '\0','/rFgdmHbxEocgmzExT3StrRuY4xb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36754289',5,2098,'de','She Said Maybe','When German-raised Mavi learns she belongs to a superrich Turkish dynasty, new family expectations quickly turn her world and love life upside down.','/ujNDflVpoFsBqlbVt58pc7lT1WR.jpg','2025-09-18',108,'Released',NULL,'She Said Maybe',1509871,3.667,5.9,'GUqTDNseybk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38934,_binary '\0','/e6TCQXru1XiQd3EnqqrPsPWcnpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3675486',6.6,1302,'uk','Майдан','A chronicle of the civil uprising against the regime of Ukrainian president Viktor Yanukovych that took place in Kyiv in the winter of 2013/14. The film follows the progress of the revolution: from peaceful rallies, half a million strong in the Maidan square, to the bloody street battles between protesters and riot police.','/4HXNO4yenXTTbfvVZ15Zw4Zrfqg.jpg','2014-07-24',130,'Released','Uprising in Ukraine','Maidan',270926,0.911,7.8,'JrZAnlIgZpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38935,_binary '\0','/5ChnLSVeO4cjP4whfIl1NLyW2Qk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3675568',7.6,4072,'en','Merchants of Doubt','Spin doctors spread misinformation and confusion among American citizens to delay progress on such important issues as global climate change.','/iECkpYVKr2BhPbqXZxGxZNspiw5.jpg','2014-11-08',96,'Released','How a handful of scientists obscured the truth on issues from tobacco smoke to global warming.','Merchants of Doubt',288789,0.9862,7.4,'j8ii9zGFDtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38936,_binary '\0','/iEByNu6MFEUIgUGTRTktivHQvNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3675748',5.5,4834,'ja','極道大戦争','When young protege Akira Kageyama is bitten by his dying vampire boss, Genyo Kamiura, he must get used to his new powers before seeking revenge.','/4ZgZOfNImgWcIdldUHGYBVWsYW6.jpg','2015-05-21',115,'Released','The Great War of the Underworld.','Yakuza Apocalypse',283127,1.972,6.014,'uaA6KyiuPaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38937,_binary '\0','/wsEpStPYrsWyZMBJqDZdQA0KZll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3676026',5.5,1953,'fa','Tabaghe Hassas','After an unexpected incident happens for a middle-aged man\'s wife\'s corpse, he gets very depressed, anxious and violent.','/q3296yGGelxNNtCBe4NH0hRUWoj.jpg','2014-03-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Sensitive Floor',331136,0.6352,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38938,_binary '\0','/iySTZNLl10GCzBLSLJrK3GHhsWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3677412',7.3,2619,'en','An Open Secret','An investigation into accusations of teenagers being sexually abused within the film industry.','/qYaoQIfOpF6aRLfAtioPQhk4iXT.jpg','2014-11-14',99,'Released','Be courageous. Report it. Life gets better.','An Open Secret',294368,1.8378,6.9,'1JpHUaMBARU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38939,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36774478',8.3,2568,'mr','क्रांतिज्योति विद्यालय मराठी माध्यम','Students and teachers from a Marathi school come together to save their school from demolition, as an international school is set to be built in its place. Personal challenges merge with institutional struggles as they seek preservation of Marathi-medium schools and their local culture, while also acknowledging the need for change.','/xoswfeiBUEnWzBfixEvRbCUIwpV.jpg','2026-01-01',149,'Released',NULL,'Krantijyoti Vidyalay Marathi Madhyam',1597670,1.5406,8.5,'bPvWVuqfz1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38940,_binary '\0','/q1Zd6AccSzwrYvjwwyqGB7Qg1jI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3678782',7.4,29132,'hi','बदलापुर','After his wife and son are killed, a young man finds out the man behind the murder and fights against him, along committing some big mistakes.','/9bbJBjCcyjYyMG9kW38X55tgiYu.jpg','2015-02-20',134,'Released','Don\'t miss the beginning.','Badlapur',323517,1.8286,7,'9KEoZanqlOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38941,_binary '\0','/1kn8EqMAuYu6gpK2xU0GunjavVv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3678938',6,15710,'hi','हम्प्टी शर्मा की दुल्हनिया','A girl from Ambala, Kavya Pratap Singh, is about to be married. When she visits Delhi to shop for her \'dhai lakh ka Ghagra\'(wedding dress worth Rs. 2.5 Lakh), she meets Humpty Sharma, a carefree Delhiite, and falls in love with him.','/kiqZEW6ZmFducXGeikKI5WcQZEI.jpg','2014-07-11',133,'Released',NULL,'Humpty Sharma Ki Dulhania',276928,1.8795,6.4,'DY2nO95RCok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38942,_binary '\0','/hlxtErEvEe3kpd8ifyUnOTejkM2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3679000',5.4,8123,'hi','एबीसीडी 2','Childhood friends Suresh and Vinnie want to become successful dancers. To fulfill their dreams, they form a dance group with their friends and compete in a hip-hop contest in Las Vegas.','/7S0heTpQydVBSYl6yBxmqVyentQ.jpg','2015-06-19',154,'Released',NULL,'ABCD 2',336790,1.9419,5.762,'IKUtAC-dwFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38943,_binary '\0','/qXO9MCiFIvrC1N4gTJmvLvcqb6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3679040',3.9,42156,'hi','किसी का भाई... किसी की जान','Bhaijaan, a self-defense trainer lives happily as a bachelor with his three brothers Moh, Ishq and Luv and uses violence to settle disputes. When his brothers, who’ve already found partners, come together to fix a match for him, Bhagya Lakshmi, Bhaijaan decides to mend his ways for his lover\'s sake. All hell breaks loose when he learns about Bhagya\'s family facing threats from their haunting past.','/yJ2JqgfWniQLnXPM5WkM7f1rqaY.jpg','2023-04-21',144,'Released',NULL,'Kisi Ka Bhai... Kisi Ki Jaan',966719,1.6408,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38944,_binary '\0','/9J2Zk5U3JlMa5zVNDP4dgmBBtY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3679060',5.2,10266,'hi','ढिशुम','When India\'s top cricketer is kidnapped in the Middle East, a loose cannon and a rookie cop are tasked with finding him before the high-stakes match with Pakistan.','/sY58lhquOEISrpcIzbKNV6qHgvG.jpg','2016-07-29',120,'Released',NULL,'Dishoom',393441,1.6337,5.495,'DU6IdS2gVog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38945,_binary '\0','/6tDhr9CRWQ1xWm4LbS7fIVzNFSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36793656',7.7,5812,'te','బకాసుర రెస్టారెంట్','A group of five youngsters decides to make a wish, but it backfires as it leads them to unveil a supernatural force around them.','/pyznPP82WBdWOYvKHbQq9bDv4Ng.jpg','2025-08-08',158,'Released',NULL,'Bakasura Restaurant',1529088,1.0017,5.75,'TsuJbNdaBJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38946,_binary '\0','/3sfpzXdMRwGDD9FD5fdduMyMxMV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3680410',7.2,4481,'en','Last Cab to Darwin','Rex is a loner, and when he\'s told he doesn\'t have long to live, he embarks on an epic drive through the Australian outback from Broken Hill to Darwin to die on his own terms; but his journey reveals to him that before you can end your life, you have to live it, and to live it, you\'ve got to share it.','/2MuEECBQKHTfrDY0HJuLRWwCNTJ.jpg','2015-08-06',124,'Released','It\'s never too late to start living.','Last Cab to Darwin',337958,1.8011,6.8,'7A1LiNMrqLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38947,_binary '\0','/9FqD7cbUlV9z0Yzs4DLZhkeYyAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36812691',5.5,2522,'te','ప్రేమిస్తున్నా','A boy struggles to express his love to a girl he loves deeply, but she fails to understand his mental state. The burning flame in a loving heart seeks solitude and comfort, making it difficult to express emotions through words.','/4f5ynafEmhJKIrfmDkbWcHzBoDy.jpg','2025-11-07',178,'Released',NULL,'Premistunnaa',1579304,2.8607,0,'BgmCoV8GsYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38948,_binary '\0','/lAlZ9Gw5k9TGcUBz6Ll9vrs1nrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36812903',6.3,1426,'da','Rejseholdet: Det Første Mord','Denmark in 1927. The ambitious police officer Otto Himmelstrup leads the newly formed Special Unit, which is tasked with assisting local police in solving particularly difficult crimes. When a body is found in a burnt-out summer house in Esbjerg, Otto and his team begin to unravel an unusual murder mystery, revealing power struggles and corruption among the city’s elite. The closer the unit gets to the truth, the more dangerous it becomes. Soon, Otto finds himself not only battling powerful enemies but also confronting his own dark side in his quest to solve the case.','/2V6dGTHGrq79U765qfnHYP7HFu0.jpg','2025-08-25',125,'Released',NULL,'Special Unit - The First Murder',1387190,2.8714,7.1,'6BDxjHqc-_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38949,_binary '\0','/459fTVY8BDiQ3ETpjLX48zgZsgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3681422',7.3,4224,'ta','உத்தம வில்லன்','Superstar Manoranjan learns that he has only a few days to live and approaches his mentor, director Margadarisi to direct his next project — a folklore-ish comedy about a man who keeps cheating death and his role in saving a kingdom. Meanwhile, he has to sort out his personal lives, which involves an estranged son and a daughter from the love of his life.','/4mwnjii4zreLDTYIDM2OxcuQUTu.jpg','2015-05-01',173,'Released',NULL,'Uttama Villain',273870,1.3467,6.75,'mwOFWJUOpv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38950,_binary '\0','/znkCTx5USFLlDLA7jCntICX7HAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3681440',6.9,1239,'ta','யாமிருக்க பயமே','Kiran gets his dad\'s property and decides to turn it into a hotel. Intriguingly, all the customers who come to stay there, dies inexplicably. What\'s happening?','/y3W5wJ1dmXsTxhz7OjRQdGPoKbQ.jpg','2014-05-09',130,'Released',NULL,'Yaamirukka Bayamey',263497,1.1117,6.6,'7utXPKENd-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38951,_binary '\0','/wHmlXGkLGrQ86MQw4QE5Lhhmdn0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt3681442',7.7,1940,'ta','முண்டாசுப்பட்டி','Gopi, a photographer, and Azhagu, his assistant, get stuck in Mundasupatti, a village where having photographs taken is bad omen. And, Gopi falls for Kalaivani, the village headman\'s daughter who is about to get married.','/bDTxGNCMWCctxhbtibPFrdeHdzf.jpg','2014-06-13',148,'Released',NULL,'Mundasupatti',270772,1.1286,7.179,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38952,_binary '\0','/e8A6wYBmJSgPZH0dX42j65X0Fza.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36815135',5.4,1708,'te','గుర్రం పాపి రెడ్డి','A mysterious con man curates a team to swap a dead body from a grave. Chaos follows over a botched plan, royal family members, and secrets that can threaten people in power.','/fo7TpR3Pyfxl7DjT3VlvMFgFeOd.jpg','2025-12-19',160,'Released',NULL,'Gurram Paapi Reddy',1518070,1.3747,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000'),(38953,_binary '\0','/lvqxVKCUbhH83skNczVK9xWb5t4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:09.000000','tt36822418',6.5,2294,'hi','गवर्नर','Set against Indias 1990 economic crisis, Governor follows Raman, a reluctant bureaucrat unexpectedly appointed as the Governor of the RBI when the nation stands on the brink of bankruptcy. As inflation rises, fuel runs low, and panic spreads, Raman must navigate political pressure and a collapsing system to prevent the country from falling apart.','/Anukm4NH6MM025vUQ9ykpWQXnFn.jpg','2026-06-12',122