 to cope as betrayal poisons their marriage.','/l3wevYWTpiZSUEM5B0Q8c21ALAD.jpg','2026-07-22',93,'Released','The truth behind a perfect marriage.','Elize: Shadows of a Woman',1487861,18.1554,7.5,'KiKnd3cusPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39043,_binary '\0','/n3guCVACMbY3YZ0hLQaBx4JNgsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704298',5.5,2484,'en','Vincent N Roxxy','A small town loner and a rebellious punk rocker unexpectedly fall in love as they are forced on the run and soon discover violence follows them everywhere.','/pK5pEto2thTo8fRcSQIJc63IbSK.jpg','2016-04-18',110,'Released','Outrun. Outdrive. Outlive.','Vincent N Roxxy',300672,2.2416,5.5,'Kx9_VnS_rLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39044,_binary '\0','/8pPoIJJ7ylLULMbpHNWdg8Ab7CF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704352',6.7,5153,'en','Bessie','The story of legendary blues performer, Bessie Smith, who rose to fame during the 1920s and \'30s.','/kanAZsL3kZwFWRuR6tqLvNrEFco.jpg','2015-05-16',107,'Released','Survival began with a song','Bessie',330544,2.0475,6.4,'P-tynW1jqzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39045,_binary '\0','/ApCT32tQjQZ7we8GVedIuY5F0Oj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704416',5.8,7216,'en','Digging for Fire','Tim and Lee are married with a young child. The chance to stay at a fancy home in the Hollywood Hills is complicated by Tim\'s discovery of a bone and a rusty old gun in the yard. Tim is excited by the idea of a mystery, but Lee doesn\'t want him to dig any further, preferring that he focus on the family taxes, which he promised to do weeks ago. This disagreement sends them on separate and unexpected adventures over the course of a weekend, as Tim and his friends seek clues to the mystery while Lee searches for answers to the bigger questions of marriage and parenthood.','/rJjT0uoqWl2ETSshtNg3Wv2MkMT.jpg','2015-08-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Digging for Fire',295490,2.9001,5.2,'E9OgBzdzEsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39046,_binary '\0','/rLo9T9jEg67UZPq3midjLnTUYYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704428',7.3,264804,'en','Elvis','The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.','/qBOKWqAFbveZ4ryjJJwbie6tXkQ.jpg','2022-06-22',159,'Released','The Man. The Legend. The King of Rock & Roll.','Elvis',614934,14.4796,7.4,'Gp2BNHwbwvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39047,_binary '\0','/mfP8XBN3qyXVmqH4YfDnUBA1y1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704538',4.2,22132,'en','V/H/S: Viral','As the streets of Los Angeles overflow with camera-wielding gawkers seeking to capture images of a bizarre police pursuit, the same people who sought to exploit the suffering of others for amusement on the Internet become the stars of a gruesome viral video from which no one gets out alive.','/xe4S3x4Kq1UqCsDZdtLCeYt9moY.jpg','2014-11-21',81,'Released','Mayhem goes viral.','V/H/S: Viral',267806,5.3889,4.8,'AnDqtpd32Qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39048,_binary '\0','/7sgceUpkyQUT7HhlLYx164OPifF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3704700',6.6,26405,'en','Brain on Fire','Susannah Cahalan, an up-and-coming journalist at the New York Post becomes plagued by voices in her head and seizures, causing a rapid descent into insanity.','/kEwI53HNDO0ajSUWh4HSsGrlF6l.jpg','2017-02-22',88,'Released','It\'s not supposed to happen. Be prepared when it does.','Brain on Fire',340027,4.8043,7,'VZn6G0M9wNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39049,_binary '\0','/g5uP9JdlWktdBcaj5tZKpWbILqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37049996',6.1,3105,'ml','വലത് വശത്തെ കള്ളൻ','A police officer being investigated for his role in a woman’s death rushes to save his son from her vengeful father.','/ko4cEKcBHcCNbGok2YxnlD4u16N.jpg','2026-01-30',135,'Released','Confession of a broken soul','Valathu Vashathe Kallan',1427822,2.5096,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39050,_binary '\0','/pULQ0mpwndS8Xj9yokTnqw1bugM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3705388',6.3,1603,'it','Il nome del figlio','Paolo is an outgoing and handsome real estate broker married to Simona, a beautiful woman from the rough outskirts of Rome who has become an author of spicy bestsellers and is pregnant with their child. Betta, Paolo’s sister and her husband Sandro organise a dinner party with Paolo, Simona and their childhood friend, the eccentric musician Claudio. During the lively gathering Paolo reveals what he would like to name his son, causing reactions to steam up and a torrent of revelations to follow reaching climactic proportions.','/f17lML6pYWA5OAQe9tHiM480sVc.jpg','2015-01-22',89,'Released',NULL,'An Italian Name',320028,1.9241,6.3,'qwVKDXw3TB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39051,_binary '\0','/6K51xq7nKPyiPW4VbU25Xvqsmjo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3705412',6.3,21022,'en','Deathgasm','Two teenage boys unwittingly summon an ancient evil entity known as The Blind One by delving into black magic while trying to escape their mundane lives.','/e4dF2KRSZ0l7PaZg3XvSsCMAeNZ.jpg','2015-08-28',86,'Released','Evil is coming...','Deathgasm',323373,3.2051,6.3,'qz3kt1gh0OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39052,_binary '\0','/5GFZEBbwCpUgY0KBggrhGRfrcDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3705822',2.8,4581,'en','Moontrap: Target Earth','A long forgotten ancient spacecraft discovered on Earth. Investigations carried out by Scout transport her to the moon whereupon she meets the impressive machines preserving the wisdom of that long lost civilization.','/cqMH1aIvOUjeF9S0fog0zdntHtH.jpg','2017-02-07',81,'Released',NULL,'Moontrap: Target Earth',443297,1.5984,4.5,'e-m7k7Y3vDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39053,_binary '\0','/xicKILMzPn6XZYCOpWwaxlUzg6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3706352',6.2,32405,'en','All the Old Knives','When the CIA discovers one of its agents leaked information that cost more than 100 people their lives, veteran operative Henry Pelham is assigned to root out the mole with his former lover and colleague Celia Harrison.','/g4tMniKxol1TBJrHlAtiDjjlx4Q.jpg','2022-04-08',102,'Released','Secrets kill.','All the Old Knives',294793,7.7088,6,'6s7NziAetNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39054,_binary '\0','/vZ0TD8nM7Yi53c6UTIbUyYiiegL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3707104',5.8,22977,'en','Mine','After a failed assassination attempt, a soldier finds himself stranded in the desert. Exposed to the elements, he must survive the dangers of the desert and battle the psychological and physical toll of the treacherous conditions.','/dYmkd3azwbamZ3wsIsMXQY5evjH.jpg','2016-10-06',107,'Released','Stand your ground','Mine',345009,4.635,6.6,'hzUj42eaHEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39055,_binary '\0','/eZ5ePF3gTut3tg0UyXxwiopaVN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3707106',5.3,23861,'en','By the Sea','Set in France during the mid-1970s, Vanessa, a former dancer, and her husband Roland, an American writer, travel the country together. They seem to be growing apart, but when they linger in one quiet, seaside town they begin to draw close to some of its more vibrant inhabitants, such as a local bar/café-keeper and a hotel owner.','/oEyeG4UyAQvYIJiFpUV57Q3PTDp.jpg','2015-11-12',122,'Released','When we die on the inside, the outside is left wandering dangerously by the sea.','By the Sea',314385,6.3498,5.5,'LRXPszwv4Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39056,_binary '\0','/j8pbIA3bn6KAh2FtS3R9jpvjNd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3707114',7.4,5879,'en','Janis: Little Girl Blue','Janis Joplin is one of the most respected and iconic rock & roll singers of all time, a tragic and misunderstood figure who captivated millions of listeners and blazed new creative trails before her death in 1970 at age 27. Director Amy Berg explored Joplin\'s story in depth. A portrait of a complicated, driven and often beleaguered artist. Joplin\'s own words recount a series of letters she wrote to her family over the years. Janis was a vessel of energy when she sang. Her rapid rise and untimely death changed music forever.','/qosDLnAcHRAUjgmZIU0c1ktEhx2.jpg','2015-09-09',106,'Released',NULL,'Janis: Little Girl Blue',321974,1.8,7.3,'-oRLyBgz8W0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39057,_binary '\0','/sxs1ME8rwQIccp7SL37fRgt0sFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37079110',6.4,2005,'ml','ഉയിർ','SI Ajeeb, a probationary officer posted in a Kerala town, investigates the mysterious death of an unidentified woman whose decomposed body is found in a well. Despite a lack of evidence and official support, he relentlessly pursues the truth with the help of ASI Joy while battling his own psychological struggles. Inspired by true events, the film follows his quest for justice in a case that changes his life forever.','/r512xdTd9aXjpIxjY2JlhvJYvIb.jpg','2026-06-26',138,'Released',NULL,'Uyir',1451486,1.8911,5.25,'DyTziQOTNK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39058,_binary '\0','/szbrULGgcOIVEvP73wHlUQSK6xo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3708886',5.8,22087,'en','War on Everyone','Two corrupt cops in New Mexico set out to blackmail and frame every criminal unfortunate enough to cross their path. Things take a sinister turn, however, when they try to intimidate someone who is more dangerous than they are. Or is he?','/iJAe5fBN90JbFj7AhZpyorY2W7i.jpg','2016-10-07',98,'Released','They have the right to remain violent.','War on Everyone',333663,3.7952,5.7,'YkQgZGNMdv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39059,_binary '\0','/u0AAEDWsHwogilTHOXFuHRL9MYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3709344',7.3,5883,'hi','City Lights','Deepak Singh was an ex army person and owned a small garment shop in a Rajasthani village. When his life struck by a tragedy, he migrates to Mumbai, with his wife and young child, hoping for a better life. However, upon arriving, he soon discovers the challenges of life in a big city.','/rrzypABFDyTpwbTLbmsXU9A8qEM.jpg','2014-05-30',126,'Released','How far will you go for the love of your family?','City Lights',277223,1.0801,7.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39060,_binary '\0','/3WbsKRDvwWLNgzD1BL99iUhvnac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3709442',4.4,1840,'en','Quarries','To escape her abusive boyfriend, Kat joins a wilderness expedition with a group of women, all of whom are struggling with the uncertainty of life. What was supposed to be an opportunity for personal discovery quickly becomes a fight for survival, forcing each one to discover the strength within themselves that they didn\'t even know they possessed. While being brazenly chased by a pack of predators, the strong quickly set themselves apart from the weak. In a battle of will, stamina, and heart, these very virtues present themselves at the most crucial moment. With death looming, each is left with what is truly important - the strength within oneself.','/134cvqia2qmJ0gG4hszaK87iuPW.jpg','2016-10-26',83,'Released','They just keep coming ...','Quarries',444689,1.5381,5,'RKG_NaL5fu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39061,_binary '\0','/nLRGsXpf0uieHDXzTvr9PZQRqDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3709552',5.7,2227,'en','The Last Witness','An ambitious young journalist uncovers the horrific slaughter of 22,000 Polish officers during World War II, a secret kept hidden for far too many years.','/v4d6UHuQ2gpsaN38pMSZ42Fj6hi.jpg','2018-05-11',97,'Released','When war ends, the fight for the truth begins.','The Last Witness',519956,2.2511,5.8,'eMmC6z4NMIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39062,_binary '\0','/pBeB38aB3FfzPqCrSoxZpvLHxjt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37096260',6.7,1232,'it','Le cose non dette','Carlo and Elisa are a successful couple. He’s a university professor and writer facing a creative block; she’s a brilliant, sharp-witted journalist, known for her internationally published editorials. They live in Rome, moving between accomplishments and routine, affection and something that might be fading. In search of new energy, they travel to Morocco with their lifelong friends, Anna and Paolo, and their thirteen-year-old daughter Vittoria—bright, curious, a little eccentric. Tensions soon rise.','/1o0FTRrtcPFboam4pZRbkwPnDTX.jpg','2026-01-29',114,'Released',NULL,'Things We Don\'t Say',1473635,3.2437,6.925,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39063,_binary '\0','/xEltXHglK9Gcjc4ejglsqTaA78E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3709678',6.6,1491,'en','Haganenet','A teacher discovers in a five year-old child a prodigious gift for poetry. Amazed and inspired by this young boy, she decides to protect his talent in spite of everyone.','/8Ep4YJmjOU1663Ex3t9ortiSEgf.jpg','2014-09-10',120,'Released',NULL,'The Kindergarten Teacher',270646,1.2954,5.8,'Ewo2SA4qVVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39064,_binary '\0','/jMBv63WxQPVNtd4O331gExKaTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3711164',8.1,4056,'ta','சதுரங்க வேட்டை','A con artist is caught by the cops and is swindled off the money by his own partners. Meanwhile, a person who he had scammed hires a gangster to finish him off. Can he outwit these people and turn over a new leaf?','/z0WAnLRpndYWP7abNv7kzSyhi4W.jpg','2014-07-18',145,'Released',NULL,'Sathuranga Vettai',281992,1.2618,8.063,'RPcG9DFBO9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39065,_binary '\0','/4IcuPObausEjqhx4HRtEUIVfPet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3711466',6.8,3276,'ru','Кухня в Париже','A restaurant in Moscow is forced to shut shop after they end up ruining a crucial political dinner involving the president. The entire team then decides to relocate to Paris to redeem themselves.','/gB0bjZZULhS4sj234nF6zJyUaD3.jpg','2014-05-01',106,'Released','Bon appétit!','Kitchen in Paris',267481,2.2748,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39066,_binary '\0','/nyX2zXQ8eePITQNG7aj8RldHGgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3711510',5.9,7291,'es','El aviso','Ten-year-old Nico receives a threatening letter and now his life is in danger. No one seems to believe him except one person that he doesn\'t know.','/zHyLc0TpcufC3ELL4yFlKHS3fAN.jpg','2018-03-10',92,'Released','Only the past can help you solve the future','The Warning',508018,2.2299,6.1,'ILXsQiXPB00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39067,_binary '\0','/9kZ8rmRwzi3eBfgbVWuJiIlAGLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3712822',5.6,1655,'en','Splitting Adam','After accidentally stumbling into his uncle\'s mysterious \"tanning bed\", Adam learns the answer to all of his problems - multiple Adams. With his new collection of clones, Adam is hopping on one wild summer ride with an epic splash.','/mmqV1kSZ0ycLYJ1lGwEsC4sO8pI.jpg','2015-02-16',100,'Released','Mo\' Adams. Mo\' Problems.','Splitting Adam',325813,2.3092,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39068,_binary '\0','/1GEAX8f4glSfLH73tRuvQoaAEEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3713030',5.6,6133,'en','I Am Michael','The controversial true story of a gay activist who rejects his homosexuality and becomes a Christian pastor.','/sO9Z55Js4sEuXXe9qQjCULiPjg8.jpg','2015-01-29',98,'Released','One man. Two lives.','I Am Michael',291869,2.6461,5.511,'KLF1qYHALJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39069,_binary '\0','/tv1cMZ3fmVTKH1FiNljjMrCvyz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3713166',5.6,88312,'en','Unfriended','While video chatting one night, six high school friends receive a Skype message from a classmate who killed herself exactly one year ago. At first they think it\'s a prank, but when the girl starts revealing the friends\' darkest secrets, they realize they are dealing with something out of this world, something that wants them dead.','/8byPxREr3BqBNyyij5WHVSOVtYk.jpg','2014-06-18',83,'Released','Online, your memories last forever. But so do your mistakes.','Unfriended',277685,6.1536,5.6,'Lgj4GjqCFlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39070,_binary '\0','/11VUcExUxkTkAU6U2OaBLy9xaF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3713222',7.7,1987,'en','The Long Road to War','We all learned in schools that the WWI began with the assasination of Franz Ferdinand done by a young Bosnian Gavrilo Princip. In fact, the war was brewing much longer.','/17Nt1WL3xmETh6bzlfrt64UCbOq.jpg','2018-10-17',117,'Released',NULL,'The Long Road to War',515290,0.7627,6.8,'KhgaxG6EW44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39071,_binary '\0','/pczt6HbCAinr0rYoCspN1yzCgLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37137016',6.2,1366,'bn','গৃহপ্রবেশ','In a fading North Calcutta Rajbari, Titli clings to routine after her husband Shaon vanishes. As Durga Puja nears, Megh arrives, an unexpected guest who brings warmth and a painful revel of thought. Amid rituals and memories, unspoken grief surfaces, stirring buried emotions, silent longing, and the ache of unfinished stories.','/8mRBuaEPaix3AAtPZdsH7IszYHP.jpg','2025-06-13',151,'Released',NULL,'Grihapravesh',1156976,0.6322,4,'lmyoV40DrnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39072,_binary '\0','/gaHuzoJQAEAam57xAZBrW9aaaxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3713944',4.4,2068,'fr','Les Profs 2','The worst teachers of France landed in England for an ultra-secret mission. With Boulard, the King of the Dunces, they are parachuted in the best school of the country, and they will apply their famous methods on the future of the nation.','/mT0pVXvbwg3p7X0Q31JuLb4u74C.jpg','2015-07-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Serial Teachers 2',325844,1.9516,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39073,_binary '\0','/mwqm4YiqlxOtmbo0Zxm5evZpw0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3714720',6.6,15806,'en','The Hollars','Aspiring New York City artist John Hollar returns to his Middle America hometown on the eve of his mother’s brain surgery. Joined by his girlfriend Rebecca, eight months pregnant with their first child, John is forced to navigate the crazy world he left behind.','/57azlJsftQyxuQ2EXl0I1JodwjA.jpg','2016-08-25',88,'Released',NULL,'The Hollars',325346,4.1687,6.3,'x9SvEAm7S6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39074,_binary '\0','/fOr8mVCk148fKOCLvx3FPRLNPil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3715122',6.5,2746,'it','L\'attesa','In the vast rooms of a beautiful Sicilian villa, Anna receives an unexpected guest. Twenty-something Jeanne has arrived from France, declaring herself to be the girlfriend of Anna’s son, Giuseppe, who has invited her to the house to spend Easter together. But this is news to Anna, and Guiseppe is not yet there...','/fxWlMDP1vmr85VWiLPTTLL43fTx.jpg','2015-09-17',100,'Released','Waiting for a lost love, every moment becomes an eternity.','The Wait',330348,1.6537,6.3,'15GR_v9s2fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39075,_binary '\0','/fMRrTziefy0c6v45IUyByGjZCRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3715152',6.5,4430,'en','Shooting Stars','The inspiring origin story of a basketball superhero, revealing how LeBron James and his childhood friends become the #1 high school team in the country, launching James\'s breathtaking career as a four-time NBA Champion, two-time Olympic Gold Medalist and the NBA\'s all-time leading scorer.','/zLQHNW0XVT7IWjUahBlpVSba3sC.jpg','2023-06-02',116,'Released',NULL,'Shooting Stars',970284,4.2934,7.8,'VcRqxzS0I68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39076,_binary '\0','/pqdOXcE2zSSM2qnSBTt0O81Oq6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3715320',6.6,71046,'en','Irrational Man','On a small town college campus, a philosophy professor in existential crisis gives his life new purpose when he enters into a relationship with his student.','/ipAqhEWRzEuD6aXlAWIvEEF1KUe.jpg','2015-07-17',95,'Released',NULL,'Irrational Man',282984,4.9808,6.5,'5Wf-ouBdYY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39077,_binary '\0','/aLulOrEbBua5D5lsTlo3a204dih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3715406',6.7,6262,'en','Atari: Game Over','The Xbox Originals documentary that chronicles the fall of the Atari Corporation through the lens of one of the biggest mysteries of all time, dubbed “The Great Video Game Burial of 1983.” Rumor claims that millions of returned and unsold E.T. cartridges were buried in the desert, but what really happened there?','/69VCXTki2gDutUhndJgU8UHlvxA.jpg','2014-11-19',66,'Released','Truth is stranger than legend...','Atari: Game Over',284470,2.2335,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39078,_binary '\0','/tN6naervaf5HEHY5DJ0YQs8fTGU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3715854',6.9,1923,'ja','バクマン。','Moritaka Mashiro doesn\'t want to follow in the path of his uncle who worked as a manga artist, but ultimately died because of exhaustion. Moritaka Mashiro figures he will graduate from school and work at an office. Things change though when falls in love with a girl at school. The girl, who hopes to become a voice actress, tells Moritaka they can marry, but only after they both achieve their dreams. Moritaka then teams up with fellow classmate Akito Takagi to publish their first manga.','/kaf6zS27Oll9ja55PYMC7OpB8oa.jpg','2015-10-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Bakuman',327536,2.2268,6.4,'AjuyrRTqfkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39079,_binary '\0','/4QTWMWtrBkN5PdsL4XX5Pp27VIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37161355',5.7,5835,'hi','दादी की शादी','A grandmother’s mishap with a social media post causes consternation amongst her children and threatens the prospect of her granddaughter’s wedding.','/hKbQjE5ZcZUpuzApEjyoVCUWwdx.jpg','2026-05-08',150,'Released',NULL,'Daadi Ki Shaadi',1464795,2.7426,4.714,'q2zwd3OVcnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39080,_binary '\0','/bccUtSQMXlZ5Cy2pYGuxg4bwHAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37161651',6.9,3204,'te','చెన్నై లవ్ స్టొరీ','Two young people navigate their first experience of love, dealing with its powerful emotions and obstacles while discovering the delicate nature of newfound romance.','/hACM25xigqIYeRgylB0epf34hmk.jpg','2026-07-24',184,'Released',NULL,'Chennai Love Story',1443136,2.582,5.9,'Zns2yEWQ7U0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39081,_binary '\0','/5VApPDSRlONQV2gXugyz1yj7qZm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3716530',7.1,75002,'fr','Elle','When Michèle, the CEO of a gaming software company, is attacked in her home by an unknown assailant, she refuses to let it alter her precisely ordered life. She manages crises involving family, all the while becoming engaged in a game of cat and mouse with her stalker.','/z446adpGUVXXPxrLpKBGnYBcofk.jpg','2016-05-25',131,'Released',NULL,'Elle',337674,5.1392,6.6,'IEnhx82_In4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39082,_binary '\0','/uquCfeCjt19p3ozyQeXL6uT8rtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3717016',5.9,3885,'en','After the Ball','After the Ball, a retail fairy tale set in the world of fashion. Kate\'s dream is to design for couturier houses. Although she is a bright new talent, Kate can\'t get a job. No one trusts the daughter of Lee Kassell, a retail guru who markets clothes \"inspired\" by the very designers Kate wants to work for. Who wants a spy among the sequins and stilettos? Reluctantly, Kate joins the family business where she must navigate around her duplicitous stepmother and two wicked stepsisters. But with the help of a prince of a guy in the shoe department her godmother\'s vintage clothes and a shocking switch of identities, Kate exposes the evil trio, saves her father\'s company -- and proves that everyone can wear a fabulous dress.','/wY4xxrH2Ue7FKifqMSFw9TYZDca.jpg','2015-02-27',101,'Released','Fairytales are always in fashion','After the Ball',309924,3.191,6.3,'Dze8Cmr9sns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39083,_binary '\0','/lK9R56dfj182Uz4THzEZ5vrUEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3717068',7.6,