ising his cello in the upstairs flat – a relationship which quickly becomes very disturbing.','/3LD2EaAxV09Md3RK5gIYx0RQw7X.jpg','2019-09-25',89,'Released','The fear will find you.','Cordelia',514743,1.548,5.1,'vmV3yrGktbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39141,_binary '\0','/wqe6GXolmOtRTYxImtZQkKH35EA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3735246',7.3,43024,'hi','बाजीराव मस्तानी','Peshwa Bajirao married to Kashibai, falls in love with Mastani, a warrior princess in distress. They struggle to make their love triumph amid opposition from his conservative family.','/eXKHjELZAbF7cVd9fzYMhvSsXDI.jpg','2015-12-18',158,'Released','The love story of a warrior','Bajirao Mastani',362045,2.7058,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39142,_binary '\0','/62wRJMteoEpZFiYCEhb7M3oSSJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3735332',3.3,5511,'en','Alienated','After seeing a UFO, a man and his skeptical wife are forced to confront their relationship issues.','/lA9dkkWNAhTciLmzgTTH92bVP4k.jpg','2016-03-19',81,'Released',NULL,'Alienated',353314,0.7944,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39143,_binary '\0','/tJ2357NwUVMnTNVPXioH4cokeaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3735554',4.7,1317,'en','Freetown','A group of native Liberian missionaries make a desperate cross-country trip through their war torn country to save one of their own.','/3taXQzp71zB0ojIPGVcJ2OA1cab.jpg','2015-04-08',113,'Released','The true story of faith, courage, and survival.','Freetown',305044,1.9936,5,'HauDzOxMcvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39144,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37369334',4.4,1307,'en','Living in the Cemetery','A mother haunted by trauma becomes overprotective of her daughter, but when the daughter falls in love, their bond fractures. As buried secrets emerge, both must confront whether forgiveness can heal old wounds before it\'s too late.','/ye2K4Kl8AQLx94XFjuyrpHy3FmH.jpg','2026-02-13',104,'Released','A place