ouded in secrecy.Police investigation reveals thirty fingerprints on bodies of deceased, but only one fingerprint is found on the last victim, creating a complex puzzle.','/y1SlMiY354kg9YFYktWKeRyrXSF.jpg','2025-07-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Paramapadha Sopanam',1745352,1.3289,0,'y3zccn77ksk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39149,_binary '\0','/2yXUUFYFEDHVkqH4GFqhwGbkOHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3737988',6.8,1939,'el','Τετάρτη 04:45','Stelios Dimitrakopoulos has 32 hours left before he loses everything. From the jazz bar he painstakingly keeps running for years, to his own family. The Romanian gangster who lent him money, now demands the debt to be paid. The middle-man and former friend, makes Stelios take care of illegal errands. His wife is seriously thinking of abandoning him, and a night club owner, not thinking about the consequences, finally starts to stand up for himself. Christmas is coming, the clock is ticking, and the tree in Stelios\' house must be decorated.','/djs2pElQx5fpQWYcuEXIoYkA2gH.jpg','2015-03-12',116,'Released','One man, one city, 32 hours.','Wednesday 04:45',323396,0.9181,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39150,_binary '\0','/m8af6o4QvIenUykItCJbj6rv9i3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3739110',5.8,5266,'en','The Yellow Birds','Two young soldiers, Bartle and Murph, navigate the terrors of the Iraq war under the command of the older, troubled Sergeant Sterling. All the while, Bartle is tortured by a promise he made to Murph\'s mother before their deployment.','/rSeZHcgmiNs6s5vfuIKHcQm84eA.jpg','2018-05-24',96,'Released','There Are Moments That Test Us And Choices That Define Us','The Yellow Birds',383585,3.2355,6,'jegKZ0av8Wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39151,_binary '\0','/wkPjuqGf7uPMCVu7osZhkRPb8Ht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37392885',5.7,2834,'hi','Murderbaad','A Jaipur tour guide\'s romance with an NRI unravels when a fellow tourist goes missing. As suspicion mounts, he vanishes-sparking a nationwide hunt that leads to one of modern India\'s most shocking crime twists.','/70kbo9qJ3i98CRVyKP0DfYQoJLe.jpg','2025-07-18',153,'Released',NULL,'Murderbaad',1510251,0.8798,0,'P0sXly2DL-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39152,_binary '\0','/ks0ic20DhI3JEXTtDo4Mqqzv3SD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37403476',6.9,3062,'en','So Long Valley','A missing woman\'s sister seeks help at Manali police. As authorities investigate her disappearance between Shimla and Manali, a taxi driver becomes suspect. The case reveals shocking twists about victim\'s role and hidden puppeteers.','/79USk0ejV1r2WOF9IBTv63AVMiC.jpg','2025-07-25',124,'Released',NULL,'So Long Valley',1519380,0.6477,0,'HZ6okhVPp28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39153,_binary '\0','/nE6sFxIB15GDiRVcoMUGtojd5ga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3740778',6.9,7113,'zh','山河故人','The life of Tao, and those close to her, is explored in three different time periods: 1999, 2014, and 2025.','/zMg4uP2Ev8lIZr1kOvHrPOM8teA.jpg','2015-10-30',127,'Released',NULL,'Mountains May Depart',314388,2.8167,6.96,'qc1ZKyhMG6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39154,_binary '\0','/kWCgJgvxjW39fZxQ99ocbkbFPO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3741316',5.1,2738,'en','Bare','A young woman\'s friendship with a drug-dealing drifter evolves into a lesbian romance.','/x9zfITPWEbMzRhw3Ci3bMwn8kz0.jpg','2015-10-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Bare',333091,1.7733,4.5,'vBwH0vHVyMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39155,_binary '\0','/lZc28Tk0m92CIzzi60qJwieLYMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3741632',6.7,10810,'en','The Leisure Seeker','A runaway couple go on an unforgettable journey from Boston to Key West, recapturing their passion for life and their love for each other on a road trip that provides revelation and surprise right up to the very end.','/1IOnJzgbgVj85vDEIf1fPmCQ7KP.jpg','2018-01-03',112,'Released','A Once in a Lifetime Roadtrip They Will Never Forget','The Leisure Seeker',449749,4.7939,7.1,'jvx4Kmf7_gY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39156,_binary '\0','/uovH5k4BAEPqXqxgwVrTtqH169g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3741700',6,232384,'en','Godzilla: King of the Monsters','Follows the heroic efforts of the crypto-zoological agency Monarch as its members face off against a battery of god-sized monsters, including the mighty Godzilla, who collides with Mothra, Rodan, and his ultimate nemesis, the three-headed King Ghidorah. When these ancient super-species, thought to be mere myths, rise again, they all vie for supremacy, leaving humanity\'s very existence hanging in the balance.','/mzOHg7Q5q9yUmY0b9Esu8Qe6Nnm.jpg','2019-05-29',132,'Released','Long live the king.','Godzilla: King of the Monsters',373571,19.6721,6.682,'KDnKuFtdc7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39157,_binary '\0','/ycABRSIK1Ff10Tc2A6WJHagp1Co.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3741834',8,269036,'en','Lion','A five-year-old Indian boy gets lost on the streets of Calcutta, thousands of kilometers from home. He survives many challenges before being adopted by a couple in Australia; 25 years later, he sets out to find his lost family.','/kCELJH1tCmaRLqvwIgKDb09aEaw.jpg','2016-11-24',118,'Released','The search begins','Lion',334543,11.29,8,'GKkk-hDigTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39158,_binary '\0','/h4W6VcoaTfJtw2jYYkfx7Ll2EKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3741860',7.3,1511,'en','Awake: The Life of Yogananda','An unconventional biography by Oscar nominee Paola di Florio and Sundance winner Lisa Leeman about Hindu mystic Paramahansa Yogananda who brought yoga and meditation to the West in 1920 and authored the spiritual classic \"Autobiography of a Yogi,\" which became the go-to book for seekers from George Harrison to Steve Jobs.','/nPiUpBhb16F2bAw7EWg4Jo7hjyF.jpg','2014-10-10',87,'Released','Reveal your Self','Awake: The Life of Yogananda',290504,1.7936,6.7,'IpwkHfTG5Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39159,_binary '\0','/i36GRwzuD6yIhgrhHgygp818Nxm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3742284',7.2,15094,'hi','NH10','Meera and Arjun are professionals living in Gurgaon. On their way to a luxurious desert holiday they stop on a Highway dhaba for dinner, where they witness a young girl being picked up by a bunch of hoodlums. Arjun chooses to step in, unmindful of the danger ahead.','/1PPUgbQE9UVrgPyMif8urLSIKWb.jpg','2015-03-12',115,'Released','No Turning Back','NH10',330431,1.4888,6.9,'A9icNqWlylw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39160,_binary '\0','/9h5BsxRmxLAvASADo2VcTlTUdb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3742378',7.8,19645,'pt','Que Horas Ela Volta?','After leaving her daughter Jessica in a small town in Pernambuco to be raised by relatives, Val spends the next 13 years working as a nanny to Fabinho in São Paulo. She has financial stability but has to live with the guilt of having not raised Jessica herself. As Fabinho’s university entrance exams approach, Jessica reappears in her life and seems to want to give her mother a second chance. However, Jessica has not been raised to be a servant and her very existence will turn Val’s routine on its head. With precision and humour, the subtle and powerful forces that keep rigid class structures in place and how the youth may just be the ones to shake it all up.','/u1tDQun2iJAzersd94S8P47WEOL.jpg','2015-06-04',112,'Released',NULL,'The Second Mother',310569,5.787,8,'fXEYqXE4_sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39161,_binary '\0','/heaHpK33jbxr2k9J8rwF1wT96HY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3743042',5.2,5368,'fi','Bodom','Four friends are spending the night at Lake Bodom, where unsolved murders took place many years ago. The young men are determined to venture into the dense forest to solve the mystery.','/1TsJAKryXxzAsViYZktlqzxdZEx.jpg','2016-08-19',90,'Released','No happy campers her