hing about. Everyone around her denies that her boyfriend Neil ever existed. As Lily begins to doubt her own sanity, memories of Neil resurface, causing her to encounter unexplainable incidents. While desperately searching for the truth of her past life, she questions her entire existence; but in the end, she discovers the meaning of true love.','/cyYeQjHw9t40ydVdhf3SgJT4WML.jpg','2016-04-29',95,'Released','How can the one you love...not exist?','Pali Road',385397,1.4562,4,'Y-voJPKBpFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39166,_binary '\0','/tql3kTLmF2FFeSVIlafFJiZfcfk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37443891',6.6,5165,'hi','रात अकेली है - द बंसल मर्डर्स','When members of the Bansal family are found murdered, Inspector Jatil Yadav uncovers a trail of greed, betrayal and secrets tied to a deadly conspiracy.','/8EpDSwnjMBc9dmTPEYBF4Bixmwf.jpg','2025-11-27',136,'Released',NULL,'Raat Akeli Hai - The Bansal Murders',1415974,2.1767,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39167,_binary '\0','/gseFlPbavFpTdsWmqhrmRcf8CLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3745620',7.6,8380,'pl','Bogowie','Set in communist Poland of the 80s the movie depicts early career of cardio surgeon Zbigniew Religa.','/5oDW4t1K8xAFeU0meO7PoVHPq8S.jpg','2014-10-10',121,'Released',NULL,'Gods',298040,1.3401,7.678,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39168,_binary '\0','/lP5kcBL67k4aduIEzlSTVRR4RBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37457638',4.7,1335,'pt','Família, Pero no Mucho','A Brazilian father finds a worthy opponent when he meets his daughter\'s Argentine in-laws, and a trip to Bariloche becomes the stage for a fun international rivalry.','/sJTEJDlUwuXet2s8Ou6MUryqpQh.jpg','2025-07-17',80,'Released',NULL,'Almost Family',1429834,2.5411,6.2,'84tcb4DWxdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39169,_binary '\0','/e5IdZ1OEWMYxTeu51tI67gXvfpn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37458112',6.7,6176,'ta','கர','A thief tries to go straight, but when 