 15:21:10.000000','tt3746298',4.7,4171,'en','Vendetta','A hard-nosed detective deliberately commits a crime to get thrown in prison, allowing him the chance to seek vengeance on a criminal serving a life sentence for brutally murdering his wife.','/7hfZbdtuxmbDbXZocYOVQNmUeXy.jpg','2015-06-12',90,'Released','Get ready for hell in a cell','Vendetta',332177,3.0874,5.387,'b8FWcvOCj3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39174,_binary '\0','/yTL3cV6sLI0sdhaSS8796OkWCH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3746824',5.8,3652,'ru','Волки и овцы: бе-е-е-зумное превращение','In a magical faraway land, in a picturesque little village nestled among green meadows and rolling hills, lives a flock of carefree sheep. But their pastoral and stress-free life is interrupted when a pack of wolves sets up camp in the nearby ravine.','/4R28oIV65bElWcXlavPV0kRbmSZ.jpg','2016-04-22',85,'Released','You can be whatever you want. The main thing is you remain yourself!','Sheep & Wolves',394759,3.3269,6.2,'vX5tltuCJMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39175,_binary '\0','/t9HChjSJi8B1PXSVh5Ec3pcDsAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3748172',6.5,143924,'en','Gerald\'s Game','When her husband\'s sex game goes wrong, Jessie (who is handcuffed to a bed in a remote lake house) faces warped visions, dark secrets and a dire choice.','/32dippiypDdaKv7XFEfUlQ7kPup.jpg','2017-09-29',104,'Released','Some games you play. Some you survive.','Gerald\'s Game',343674,7.3083,6.399,'twbGU2CqqQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39176,_binary '\0','/dpVCvwNaKRE8bKQDNwVP4vIR90U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3748440',5.7,18184,'en','Blue Mountain State: The Rise of Thadland','With Blue Mountain State football star Thad Castle recently signing a multi-million dollar NFL contract, his teammates and college life seem like a distant memory. However, when a new school dean threatens to clean up the BMS image by auctioning off the infamous Goat House, Alex, Sammy and the boys must find a way to convince him to get involved. Despite his new fortune and fame, there is one small favor that Thad needs done before he saves the day: the biggest booze-and-sloot fest in BMS history. Welcome to Thadland!','/rZz8AmDvFqUY4tBcD69ou3OfiWx.jpg','2016-02-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Blue Mountain State: The Rise of Thadland',288171,3.5154,5.576,'0Mk53gR8ZMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39177,_binary '\0','/oYNKh0FwArUfryI6GaKcbfWVPl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3748512',7.3,7674,'en','Hitchcock/Truffaut','Filmmakers discuss the legacy of Alfred Hitchcock and the book “Hitchcock/Truffaut” (“Le cinéma selon Hitchcock”), written by François Truffaut and published in 1966.','/hzNasVeTKenNnS8eS4EOtQA5TVY.jpg','2015-09-05',81,'Released','The greatest story Hitchcock ever told','Hitchcock/Truffaut',339751,3.0423,7.221,'hgAvkXH4dmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39178,_binary '\0','/6t8ES1d12OzWyCGxBeDYLHoaDrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3748528',7.8,765812,'en','Rogue One: A Star Wars Story','A rogue band of resistance fighters unite for a mission to steal the Death Star plans and bring a new hope to the galaxy.','/i0yw1mFbB7sNGHCs7EXZPzFkdA1.jpg','2016-12-14',133,'Released','Empires are built on fear. Rebellions are built on hope.','Rogue One: A Star Wars Story',330459,14.8151,7.51,'Wji-BZ0oCwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39179,_binary '\0','/lmDBCAFJjXQwU7kDYbdN2pV9sAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3748918',5.8,4033,'en','To Your Last Death','In order to save her siblings, a young woman takes on her father and the powerful entity known as Gamemaster, who ensnares humans into diabolical plots while her species gambles on the outcome.','/btV7OWc6IbjrwZiB75klmgi3CsY.jpg','2019-11-30',91,'Released','DON\'T HESITATE TO AXE','To Your Last Death',366171,2.3694,5.5,'dOiloIlRXu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39180,_binary '\0','/eDjSr4ukYkW