eversible path in both of their lives.','/xvycfI4PRusKfqvzmkb8xqO0g48.jpg','2025-10-29',123,'Released',NULL,'The Sleeper',1557848,4.1872,5.8,'LKWjfdEioaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39189,_binary '\0','/j4YdIxiZwz2MqyqYAdiHeoh0y8V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37537155',5,1648,'ml','ആശകൾ ആയിരം','A social media enthusiast chases fame until a major film production arrives in his neighborhood, suddenly bringing his dreams of stardom within reach in ways he never imagined.','/dn025nJaG2ZKDA19ymPfZWUwPEH.jpg','2026-02-06',128,'Released',NULL,'Ashakal Aayiram',1509694,1.5302,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39190,_binary '\0','/sRyDDrKoePH7GR0Im4u7woS05nv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37537243',8.1,2959,'te','మారెమ్మ','In a village bound by ancient traditions, the Maremma Goddess festival is a time of both reverence and fear. Every 12 years, a male bull is sacrificed to the deity, yet with each ceremony, calamity befalls the villagers. Despite their efforts, the elders fail to prevent disaster. Determined to break the cycle, they enact a new decree: any household whose bull bears a male calf in the next 100 days must offer it to the goddess. As the deadline approaches, the fate of the village hangs in the balance, and the true test of their resolve begins.','/bDaDOhXgsm7R2WUPuLUBhbOjayX.jpg','2026-09-10',135,'Released',NULL,'Maremma',1604274,1.363,0,'cq6FkXNvsmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39191,_binary '\0','/qmWypRw88VYp35oTQn0a1sqdZRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37538172',5,3691,'en','Bodycam','A call to a quiet suburban home unleashes unthinkable carnage when two officers mistakenly shoot a man and his infant child, spiraling the tragedy into a fierce, unrelenting fall into the unknown.','/xFpBNcG3Dlr8mYF5Kz9Tizs3Pxn.jpg','2026-03-12',75,'Released',NULL,'Bodycam',1510745,6.124,5.904,'Ga5xa3iyXKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39192,_binary '\0','/uYVxuLVZsxnJfX