r of 1957. Ex-racecar driver, Enzo Ferrari, is in crisis. Bankruptcy stalks the company he and his wife, Laura, built from nothing ten years earlier. Their tempestuous marriage struggles with the mourning for one son and the acknowledgement of another.','/LyCOcGqOTyTmaXu2TK8LfGveIb.jpg','2023-12-14',131,'Released',NULL,'Ferrari',365620,12.0972,6.365,'8oOVNMjM1Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39204,_binary '\0','/oPc24kKGypbbdudP9QaOLuBcX70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3758708',6.4,4667,'en','The Hippopotamus','Disgraced poet Ted Wallace is summoned to his friend\'s country manor to investigate a series of unexplained miracles.','/t22HMoKaltblnHEEoCI560u8A7r.jpg','2017-03-08',86,'Released','A beast of a comedy.','The Hippopotamus',442750,2.1663,6.4,'cXXSH5SU72s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39205,_binary '\0','/klQJJGLRxyZUoiWusZ5GA3qAtiq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3758814',5.7,57787,'en','The Ice Road','After a remote diamond mine collapses in far northern Canada, an ice road driver must lead an impossible rescue mission over a frozen ocean to save the trapped miners.','/gl1dlX9sKYpiKujq80Yxve7l4yg.jpg','2021-06-24',108,'Released','This mission is on thin ice.','The Ice Road',646207,11.6412,6.7,'-zjikObAJHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39206,_binary '\0','/A4EkwT2bPQ88bWtGFo1yodySxPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3758852',4.5,2850,'en','Blood Money','Three friends on a wilderness excursion must outrun a white collar criminal hellbent on retrieving his cash, but soon their greed turns them against each other. A modern re-telling of Treasure of the Sierra Madre (1948).','/yCvcvsP3w4CyiB3CLTxwaHBpKro.jpg','2017-10-14',100,'Released','Greed has a price','Blood Money',422821,2.6132,5,'cFQvVD5y81I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39207,_binary '\0','/xC0XeQOlbA8T7TVs4PiGvH5krDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3759298',6.6,7443,'en','Ashes in the Snow','The coming-of-age tale of 16-year-old Lina Vilkas who is deported to Siberia amid Stalin\'s reign of terror in the Baltic region during WWII. An aspiring artist, she secretly documents her harrowing journey with her drawings.','/wRMgle7vPFvSMq5R76JhsH54W4S.jpg','2018-10-12',99,'Released','One girl\'s voice breaks the silence of history','Ashes in the Snow',390874,4.039,6.4,'NYA1i-WPaI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39208,_binary '\0','/bJcsrbkhzJvT1plcHv5rtyKiUny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3759416',6.9,17206,'fr','Astérix : Le Domaine des dieux','In order to wipe out the Gaulish village by any means necessary, Caesar plans to absorb the villagers into Roman culture by having an estate built next to the village to start a new Roman colony.','/oppvIr8jmTXEVkzRHtipxcmvdQ5.jpg','2014-11-26',85,'Released',NULL,'Asterix: The Mansions of the Gods',170522,5.8338,6.8,'_Npe5FV_dTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39209,_binary '\0','/uwCrmXg12dZ39lsgAzp1kU6oji9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37601032',1.2,2426,'ru','Последний богатырь. Колобок','Kolobok decides to change his fate and unwittingly becomes the partner of the humble baker Tikhon.','/jPKQThX15zNRaYdbEhmnJEjGjWT.jpg','2026-08-06',109,'Released',NULL,'The Last Warrior: Kolobok',1513703,2.9488,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39210,_binary '\0','/t0E9QkFboPW4S3E0q8gOBjsla2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37605189',7.4,1277,'ta','போகி',NULL,'/ocopY7ViBiq1Kf34iKOsPq9mitt.jpg','2025-08-01',113,'Released',NULL,'Bhoghee',1515780,0.5772,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39211,_binary '\0','/377Bqi11cmWEQeOAs7GOkCEfazk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37605896',7.5,2832,'en','S4: The Bob Lazar Story','Over 35 years after Bob Lazar\'s revelations, this documentary exposes secrets of a facility the government still denies. Featuring Lazar\'s testimony, recreations, and new evidence, it reopens a case that continues to spark global curiosity','/sQB50PgwLfftaRdNB36eJxtH3AZ.jpg','2026-04-03',114,'Released',NULL,'S4: The Bob Lazar Story',1462146,2.4678,8.333,'nqA_8tq3hlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39212,_binary '\0','/ur8KwyzeUzOKSY5H8loqMSsmHS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3760922',6,38113,'en','My Big Fat Greek Wedding 2','The continuing adventures of the Portokalos family. A follow-up to the 2002 comedy, \"My Big Fat Greek Wedding.\"','/lfPqApnLVPsYfdbpSHNnHIxTdmd.jpg','2016-03-23',94,'Released','People change. Greeks don\'t.','My Big Fat Greek Wedding 2',302688,6.084,6,'JQ-1Ts3BChM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39213,_binary '\0','/gEmfDfgsXcCOwNpu3FzleWrsPHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3760966',5.6,1893,'en','Consumed','When Sophie\'s son, Garrett, develops a mysterious illness, she embarks on a search for answers. This leads her into the controversial world of Genetically Modified Organisms (GMOs) where a sociopolitical battle rages between organic farmers and big biotech corporations. As her desperation grows, so too does her quest for knowledge. And the deeper she goes, a more heightened sense of danger develops that preys on her state of mind, as she attempts to discover the root cause of her son\'s illness.','/iFVLNunKsXWZ7dvdhUkKlZtmxrD.jpg','2015-06-01',97,'Released','What are you eating?','Consumed',333665,2.5008,5.6,'mbf4PdXZfWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39214,_binary '\0','/aFOcAeIRaoUGOkXeHDbpnhdwauC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3762912',7.1,5901,'en','Betting on Zero','Controversial hedge fund titan Bill Ackman is on a crusade to expose global nutritional giant Herbalife as the largest pyramid scheme in history while Herbalife execs claim Ackman is a market manipulator out to bankrupt them and make a killing off his billion dollar short.','/oNG4VITQkGd9iXHv0Ds7vmZdGYp.jpg','2016-03-17',104,'Released','The ultimate shakedown','Betting on Zero',385805,1.3899,7.05,'epNmVLtpkZA','YouTube','