 partner is murdered.','/cQvc9N6JiMVKqol3wcYrGshsIdZ.jpg','2018-07-19',121,'Released','There is no equal.','The Equalizer 2',345887,23.8937,6.795,'EiaVnU18pcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39226,_binary '\0','/uFPub6JjLi8IZbgZmecS2VI2kCC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3766382',2.7,1389,'en','Public Disturbance','Feature film inspired by the pranks performed by the comedy troupe The Janoskians.','/1hVjwCDRa01fSh27nmXXrc1VGMa.jpg','2018-08-28',84,'Released',NULL,'Public Disturbance',471860,1.3444,5.5,'Exq_SlzHrfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39227,_binary '\0','/ktopqLrHDZRBBI984IxDvAJBoKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3766394',6.6,23671,'en','Hello, My Name Is Doris','A self-help seminar inspires a sixty-something woman to romantically pursue her younger co-worker.','/tV7MKM6xFGzO3zhYTC7rDmx5B4Y.jpg','2015-11-27',95,'Released','She\'s not ready to act her age','Hello, My Name Is Doris',320588,4.5698,6.3,'ZxfwqNvrl78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39228,_binary '\0','/muPnU1xs5cYkE1lXZ8c15n7TyHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37670615',4.9,2269,'en','The Truth About Jussie Smollett?','The shocking true story of an allegedly fake story that some now say might just be a true story. With first-hand interviews from those at the helm, including investigating police, lawyers, journalists and Jussie himself, this compelling documentary invites the audience to decide for themselves who is telling The Truth About Jussie Smollett?','/iRR9Ri2GX3c5bikrz1Zuj4u5bkl.jpg','2025-08-21',87,'Released',NULL,'The Truth About Jussie Smollett?',1517212,2.0397,5.5,'ZSfAsfU7Nu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39229,_binary '\0','/vzp67r6jkw59gLU20EyOP9N8J7L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37671707',5.4,3165,'te','Not All Movies Are the Same: Dual','After losing everything to a personal mistake, a young man stumbles into a parallel world where a family is trapped by zombies. Driven to save them, he must navigate this deadly reality and fight for survival-and redemption','/wvHzhN4dSZC9gw66w09GTaf0egx.jpg','2025-11-28',97,'Released','Not All Movies Are The Same','Not All Movies Are the Same: Dual',1601101,0.6847,6,'bpy05bQ1Xp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39230,_binary '\0','/AsnZYgCKfB4OXvzoJrw4Ld7mp89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37671737',6.3,1309,'en','Buffet Infinity','As an endlessly expanding monster buffet threatens to engulf their small Alberta county, a group of local business owners star in low-budget TV commercials that conceal a sinister conspiracy and the emergence of unfathomable supernatural powers.','/c9h2p2qBSb5ThgBtNPWZNQDqvEX.jpg','2026-04-24',93,'Released','You are on the menu.','Buffet Infinity',1495041,2.8375,4.4,'9OFRihhrbEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39231,_binary '\0','/w0q9xW1nekWkKVIkwEjB9mxjH23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3767278',4.6,3060,'en','Bayou Caviar','Rodney is a former boxing champ who, after a deathbed visit to his trainer and mentor, is propelled into reclaiming victory for his now simple life as a nightclub bouncer. He partners with a no-nonsense, lesbian photographer and an aspiring starlet to make a compromising tape with Isaac—a married, devout, Orthodox Jewish real estate mogul—that sets off a chain of events that brings down an empire.','/up28fmhXm5eZjasXEZ352NdxDLq.jpg','2018-10-05',111,'Released','A man\'s desires never tasted so sweet…','Bayou Caviar',529981,2.298,4.6,'wlsXCOCRAwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39232,_binary '\0','/uTyXPP72WPqqYnA9PjxApmFM3ux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3767372',7.6,37332,'hi','पीकू','A taxi driver is caught between a dysfunctional relationship between a woman and her father as he drives them to Kolkata.','/yo7EZWiLpLGhqs3YnlDGDBPjfTb.jpg','2015-05-08',123,'Released','Motion Se Hi Emotion.','Piku',332835,1.691,7.2,'oeiKUlUUNQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39233,_binary '\0','/fPLUMQFdjHZWe38lgxPSwuBi062.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37674426',6.7,22712,'en','Unknown Number: The High School Catfish','Vulgar, taunting texts blow up the phones of a teen and her boyfriend. Who\'s sending them — and why? This twisty documentary reveals the shocking answer.','/nu3LtgefE2lsgYw1hxHZFoBXk9U.jpg','2025-08-28',94,'Released',NULL,'Unknown Number: The High School Catfish',1517772,5.4049,6.751,'m9gNXyfTK80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39234,_binary '\0','/dvdZItPwnRukloJYOK9HQBPNYq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37674658',7.1,1573,'en','Stiller & Meara: Nothing Is Lost','Ben Stiller tells the story of his parents—comedy icons Jerry Stiller and Anne Meara—exploring their impact on popular culture and at home, where the lines between creativity, family, life, and art often blurred.','/zJuzuanxfc7D7Kqz4qYQqsDhRY3.jpg','2025-10-17',98,'Released','Comedy is hard. Marriage is harder. Jerry and Anne somehow juggled both.','Stiller & Meara: Nothing Is Lost',1517758,4.5874,6.5,'mxLBXJpSn5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39235,_binary '\0','/39RIvioR4KJWMnzjjZGUWOoQxzv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37675037',6.3,1247,'en','Maddie\'s Secret','A plucky dishwasher leaps to viral superstardom at a trendy food content creation company. While her life seems picturesque — complete with an adoring husband, ride-or-die best friend and a cupboard full of woman-owned ethically-sourced chili crisp to boot — mounting professional pressures threaten to reawaken a hidden secret from her troubled past.','/vADal7sH7E9xFr4w2k4V3EPSzF6.jpg','2026-06-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Maddie\'s Secret',1517868,2.7315,5.8,'IjfX8l5XrF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39236,_binary '\0','/2JHJtATet58dzGpEwFek0kKGJFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37676033',5.7,10645,'en','V/H/S/Halloween','A collection of Halloween-themed videotapes unleashes a series of twisted, blood-soaked tales, turning trick-or-treat into a struggle for survival.','/bvMKSZtN8KAdtlKoYbEi1Zhyaou.jpg','2025-09-19',115,'Released',NULL,'V/H/S/Halloween',1373445,6.5329,6.227,'l8XxoeV5LRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39237,_binary '\0','/cKh6CWjtaSEqaHvPOjmkdxPBFFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37707854',8.3,1320,'bn','কেউ বলে বিপ্লবী, কেউ বলে ডাকাত','A biopic of Ananta Singha. Some calls him dacoit, some calls him a rebellion. This adaptation gives the viewer a chance to know him as a whole, a person and as a revolutionary communist leader.','/vT3VllVhSFw2D7t2M91WmM7Dsqc.jpg','2026-08-14',144,'Released',NULL,'Keu Bole Biplobi, Keu Bole Dakat',1478476,1.5741,7,'Kc_cmgRDTy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39238,_binary '\0','/ypM5lRVfKOxU2zDc3uPMoQENKbr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3771510',2.5,1320,'en','Demon Tongue','Four paranormal students get much more than they bargained for at a secluded beach volleyball complex.','/9EDV47lFdjU5BtMTLzgspOaw8dW.jpg','2016-06-21',85,'Released','Don\'t trust what they say.','Demon Tongue',404582,1.01,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39239,_binary '\0','/zyBhDZaQwDgaKzCycIetW7mgqSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3771536',6.1,13854,'hi','शिवाय','Shivaay , a fearless Himalayan mountaineer covered in Lord Shiva tattoos, heads to Bulgaria to fulfill his nine-year-old daughter Gaura’s wish of seeing her mother Olga, who abandoned them years ago. But their plan goes for a toss when the little girl gets kidnapped in the foreign land. Rescuing her from the masked child-traffickers becomes his only reason for survival.','/2BWgVSH1cbTHtaD11Ckf9JLmT7B.jpg','2016-10-28',153,'Released',NULL,'Shivaay',370992,1.6949,5.9,'poLjq0u4_5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39240,_binary '\0','/cronpF9P2qBfyKPB5ykzI3goS00.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3771626',7,1689,'en','The Brainwashing of My Dad','A filmmaker examines the rise of right-wing media through the lens of her father, whose immersion in it radicalized him and rocked the foundation of their family. She discovers this political phenomenon recurring in living rooms everywhere, and reveals the consequences conservative media has had on families and a nation.','/gITVueWeMsfqVy5qkRzME7YOuFa.jpg','2015-07-29',90,'Released','The truth behind the right-wing media machine that changed a father--and divided the nation','The Brainwashing of My Dad',385581,1.4271,6.3,'813V_GId5N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39241,_binary '\0','/71AwUbnqsXrPHJBwHpfGEEawSqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37718411',6.5,1808,'ko','살인자 리포트','The story of a serial killer, Yeong-hoon, who murdered 11 people, offering a special interview with Seon-joo, a veteran reporter who is desperate for a scoop.','/dl0sMMjMkdkziSGeSwiQ1DAb6Ci.jpg','2025-09-05',108,'Released','Eleven killed. One interview request.','Murderer Report',1151766,4.0714,7.167,'K7ScXpLhh6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39242,_binary '\0','/qePsU1MoMFMmjP4yNUfm29QkQ2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3772640',7,1522,'tl','She\'s Dating the Gangster','Seventeen-year-old Athena Dizon unwittingly plays a trick on resident heartthrob and bad boy Kenji de los Reyes. All of a sudden, she finds herself pretending to be his girlfriend to make an ex jealous; however, she falls in love with him.','/8VPZww0CN5jL1x315DChDiSVP02.jpg','2014-07-16',105,'Released',NULL,'She\'s Dating the Gangster',282761,2.0562,7.616,'mPOQxwSBm54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39243,_binary '\0','/gzOamXAMuBpWFcCitMdEoAVAjCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37737315',7.7,6412,'ta','29','A quirky 29-year-old named Sathya embarks on an unexpected journey of laughter, unlikely friendships, and self-discovery. Through hilarious misadventures and chance encounters, he slowly sees life\'s bigger picture - its surprises, joys, and second chances.','/aQZ4OxzaYTN7cRN7fALi9BhPucp.jpg','2026-05-08',149,'Released',NULL,'29',1510769,4.1261,6.778,'1CTq0JH3d-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39244,_binary '\0','/yyNO9eYv5LGiozNX3mkjrQdquv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37738006',4.2,1263,'en','1000 Men and Me: The Bonnie Blue Story','Adult content creator Bonnie Blue announced that she’d slept with 1057 men in 12 hours. Exploring the polarising debate around Bonnie and the pornification of our society, the film follows her over the most eye-opening six months of her life.','/5dcgoyf8nt6Xt4VSR6Nrn6nwhuz.jpg','2025-07-29',60,'Released',NULL,'1000 Men and Me: The Bonnie Blue Story',1522126,21.1726,5.21,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39245,_binary '\0','/twJCIxNdCisqx5ByfWa2c1mNvG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37740754',6,3429,'bn','যত কাণ্ড কলকাতাতেই','A young detective enthusiast follows in the footsteps of legendary Bengali sleuth Feluda when a decades-old mystery resurfaces during Durga Puja, testing his skills against a puzzle that once stumped his hero.','/sr98r1QX0F7mjilCr96SnPGqamK.jpg','2025-09-25',127,'Released',NULL,'Joto Kando Kolkatatei',1046732,1.0198,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39246,_binary '\0','/fTJ46xQ2yWWhuzPHNeqjX6VTzYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3774092',6.1,1277,'fr','Amnesia','A young composer moves from Berlin to the island of Ibiza and begins a friendship with an elderly woman whose painful past has caused her to reject everything to do with Germany, including her native language.','/xu0b7fLpDPMwSMVQ1Yl5jB97Mu6.jpg','2015-08-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Amnesia',336197,1.5431,5.5,'GJGhSOKgG90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39247,_binary '\0','/mYZYVrQ2ghU3m79q7byeLzNXo1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3774114',7.3,174539,'en','Snowden','CIA employee Edward Snowden leaks thousands of classified documents to the press.','/yfK7zxNL63VWfluFuoUaJj5PdNw.jpg','2016-09-15',135,'Released','The only safe place is on the run.','Snowden',302401,1