ly killed on impact. A moment later, when the corpse stands up and walks away, it could be a hallucination or something far more extraordinary.','/4RnmHtCLtbBHD9jagVlcSzJTWX6.jpg','2016-04-23',126,'Released','Welcome to ZQN World.','I Am a Hero',276624,4.2182,7.5,'sZu3sVK3JOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39255,_binary '\0','/aNakNZ4DNSOnBue4KxvuDVQwspb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3776826',6.2,8994,'en','Operation Avalanche','In 1967, four undercover CIA agents were sent to NASA posing as a documentary film crew. What they discovered led to one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.','/3ngw7s1fa0eJL19fJ6Jw0bTQg3n.jpg','2016-09-16',94,'Released','It\'s not a lie if you believe it.','Operation Avalanche',376453,3.3025,6.1,'BJ6IPQ2lTeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39256,_binary '\0','/yBEhk3IE0PhwRB14AwReyGadT8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3777462',6.6,1754,'de','Wir sind die Neuen','Three old friends from college move back in together in an apartment in Munich for financial reasons.','/pIC9lDrT75JrvhhHfwH0GFdW5m.jpg','2014-07-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Wir sind die Neuen',271433,1.3766,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39257,_binary '\0','/ysgxKFFzED1tJStfSijBX2oHrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3777860',5.9,1359,'en','Mammal','After Margaret, a divorcée living in Dublin, loses her teenage son, she develops an unorthodox relationship with Joe, a homeless youth. Their tentative trust is threatened by his involvement with a violent gang and the escalation of her ex-husband\'s grieving rage.','/l8bHUNWu1EMvVV5LGcdWFSUwJay.jpg','2016-04-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Mammal',371462,6.1214,6.3,'GDgquKyfFgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39258,_binary '\0','/rKmt9wwtRZ971JgqI6M4mfFLiWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3778010',4.6,3835,'en','Dead Awake','Kate Bowman (Jocelin Donahue) is an average social worker who, after the sudden death of her twin sister, is investigating the mysterious deaths of other people who died in their sleep. Shortly before their deaths, the victims all reported a supernatural force that appeared to them while they were suffering from sleep paralysis. When Kate investigates further into the case, she opens herself up to the creature\'s wrath and soon finds herself and her family suffering from an ancient evil.','/2962UpmXU2flDWCQj9ImeHfWXRG.jpg','2016-09-28',99,'Released','An ancient evil. Trapped in a world of darkness. Waiting for someone to believe.','Dead Awake',406107,3.0523,5.2,'nHrDy8-e-wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39259,_binary '\0','/trlblEape52f3nwe0gbLPrzuqPS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3778086',6.6,1932,'en','Sleeping Giant','A coming-of-age tale that turns on three teenagers who are having a vacation by a lakeside.','/5Dm6m1TevlMUXtllGKUTxMQrnsG.jpg','2015-05-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Sleeping Giant',336666,0.8463,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39260,_binary '\0','/sRv5hOQhglGYutG9VNprgbUYcZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3778354',6.6,2010,'en','Bear with Us','Bear with Us is a crazy romp about a guy who attempts to propose to his girlfriend in the most romantic way possible, but his plan starts to fall apart when a Ravenous bear stumbles on their charming cabin in the woods. Think \"Jaws\" but much funnier and with a bear instead of a shark. It\'s a total comedy of errors that takes a comical look at just how far we\'ll go to preserve our relationships.','/9ZQ18eD9dib8Sv2dN17a5mW0Bms.jpg','2016-04-01',94,'Released','Mating season is about to get grizzly.','Bear with Us',353398,1.0544,5.8,'3VZmc5gasPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39261,_binary '\0','/y9jGaGNn1dQDhPkhMumXaLize73.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3778644',6.9,414850,'en','Solo: A Star Wars Story','Through a series of daring escapades deep within a dark and dangerous criminal underworld, Han Solo meets his mighty future copilot Chewbacca 