urage Found','Journey\'s End',438259,4.7236,6.3,'936z-F_nEEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39266,_binary '\0','/lUk8egK2jCJEHkId0ox3oKO3Al6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3780812',6.2,1540,'tr','Kendime İyi Bak','An introvert romancer delves into a reality check after he finds out that he was risen to the bait by his deceased former lover. He breaks up with his girlfriend and starts searching for answers.','/jkijMtTOuIUXY8ZxHrK1f9Ppb2Y.jpg','2014-04-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Kendime İyi Bak',278317,1.0046,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39267,_binary '\0','/p8ZyxnEHpXCz1L9sSwcoxiS7Pw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37809949',7.6,10587,'hi','Dulhaniya Le Aaeegi','Navya, the only daughter of powerful businessman Devi Prasad, is set for a grand wedding that soon goes off track due to unexpected twists. As secrets unfold and egos clash, the celebration turns into a modern-day swayamvar.','/dNLoaglvhEYvDGSXnn1mBvE7PVG.jpg','2026-07-24',127,'Released',NULL,'Dulhaniya Le Aaeegi',1720201,1.14,0,'Tw1je1iQs4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39268,_binary '\0','/hnFIRIozlfqwLxFxv8WAhWGcCac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3781118',6.6,2748,'uk','Носоріг','Ukraine, 1990s. Young Vova, cruel and tenacious, struggles to find his place among the ruthless members of the underworld in a city where crime and corruption reign.','/wFxS2vvXJFGCCVWlPYzpCcLQagf.jpg','2021-12-10',100,'Released','Made in Ukraine','Rhino',807888,1.3504,6.5,'4nQnefmgZGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39269,_binary '\0','/ptgoTztfxbz0qFo129FwyisORRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3781476',6.1,6148,'zh','捉妖记','Young monster kids try to make peace between the world of humans and the world of the monsters.','/csMASFudtPSyVEFl4qq2Sm5lflM.jpg','2015-07-16',118,'Released',NULL,'Monster Hunt',334298,4.2756,6.5,'JSRZMCfTgs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39270,_binary '\0','/1EnWmmNKlf9v5pJtYbIp1H5mzzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3781616',2.7,1350,'en','Checkmate','Six people are thrown together during an elaborate bank heist where any move can alter the outcome. Is it coincidence, or are they merely pawns in a much bigger game.','/gG4iRaSrivB7hWtzwkM9UsQ7nma.jpg','2015-07-03',102,'Released',NULL,'Checkmate',356841,2.2623,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39271,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3781762',3.6,5084,'en','1915','Exactly 100 years after the Armenian Genocide, a theatre director stages a play to bring the ghosts of the past back to life.','/9ibdeIAkRJQYjaE44uWBCYTFUbv.jpg','2015-04-17',82,'Released','100 years after the Armenian genocide.','1915',332286,1.1653,3.2,'gyo-G3dhMRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39272,_binary '\0','/5hoFISBEjSKjy0CWzgfUd26nSu1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37836776',1,7053,'tr','Kadıköy Boğası','A big-budget epic follows a man facing financial abuse who must overcome his struggles before he can tackle bigger challenges. His destiny hangs in the balance.','/2ulEUD7ibzfb0hxcVKpd9xnFpVJ.jpg','2025-08-22',83,'Released',NULL,'Kadıköy Boğası',1516729,1.8342,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39273,_binary '\0','/lLyXd3Q4Gek1QvlsZzpoGCDigSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3783746',6.4,3138,'en','A Novel Romance','Romance novelist Liam Bradley (Dylan Bruce) has already found massive success with three books written under the pen name Gabriel August, but he\'s mysteriously unknown to his legions of readers. With his first book written as a way to heal after a broken relationship, Liam has slowly become disheartened with writing strictly for romantic fantasy, something evident to a sweet, but honest, journalist who reviews books, Sophie Atkinson (Amy Acker), whom he meets by chance on a plane. The two begin a tentative relationship in Sophie’s home town of Portland, Oregon, where Liam has come to find inspiration for his newest entry. Liam’s agent puts him on the spot with a long-planned reveal of Gabriel August’s true identity, but Sophie doesn’t know of his public persona. The longer Liam avoids telling her the truth, the deeper a hole he digs for himself. Will their romance survive once his true identity comes to light?','/cLgHUoemiSv3TqoCOnb8oiYdRVX.jpg','2015-01-10',83,'Released','True love in false covers.','A Novel Romance',311181,1.6191,6,'jF2EDesP9Bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39274,_binary '\0','/nlPCdZlHtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3783958',8,778477,'en','La La Land','Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.','/uDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg','2016-12-01',129,'Released','Here\'s to the fools who dream.','La La Land',313369,28.4333,7.9,'0pdqf4P9MB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39275,_binary '\0','/bz75Gf7OPIJiq9lfrAesRK5h7SC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3784160',8.1,6793,'en','Valley Uprising','In the shady campgrounds of Yosemite valley, climbers carved out a counterculture lifestyle of dumpster-diving and wild parties that clashed with the conservative values of the National Park Service. And up on the walls, generation after generation has pushed the limits of climbing, vying amongst each other for supremacy on Yosemite\'s cliffs. \"Valley Uprising\" is the riveting, unforgettable tale of this bold rock climbing tradition in Yosemite National Park: half a century of struggle against the laws of gravity -- and the laws of the land.','/9wjZdG4K1zkKmlh5DS2xxiEEVPK.jpg','2014-09-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Valley Uprising',294959,2.018,7.7,'o86TpaSBcWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39276,_binary '\0','/u8jNoaGnhcElSlTNr3cuqqRv6pK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3784222',6.5,1771,'es','La patota','Paulina is a young lawyer with a promising career in Buenos Aires, who chooses to go back to her home town. Her father, Fernando, is a well known judge. Against his will, Paulina decides to teach in a suburban high school as part of an inclusion program. One night, after the second week working there, she\'s brutally assaulted by a gang. With the disapproval of the people around her, she decides to go back to work, in the neighborhood where she was attacked, without realizing that her attackers may be even closer than she thought.','/l2G3YO44XGJmKoWHqmQBS1USqTL.jpg','2015-06-18',103,'Released',NULL,'Paulina',336664,2.3939,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39277,_binary '\0','/tUkatbcKhkDOe3of4FVxEIDyQg2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3784652',4.8,1865,'en','A Few Less Men','Travel plans for three men go horribly wrong with a race against time to return Luke home.','/1FR3KCSLB6b9WMrZPir0JioMvcQ.jpg','2017-03-09',96,'Released','A lot more laughs!','A Few Less Men',413391,2.6418,5.4,'qqh9IMkwGx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39278,_binary '\0','/sZTN1vekXmOoyyCIyR1xGgPtQz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37846979',1,4787,'id','Merah Putih: One for All','In a quiet village eagerly awaiting Indonesian Independence Day, a group of children are chosen to be the \"Tim Merah Putih\" to guard the sacred flag, the flag that is always flown during the annual August 17th ceremony. However, three days before the ceremony, the flag goes missing. Eight children from various cultural backgrounds—Betawi, Papua, Medan, Tegal, Central Java, Makassar, Manado, and Chinese—unite in a heroic mission: to save the mysteriously missing sacred red and white flag.','/16Ly9vDNfXl7RrlMtUUiJJjm1Ac.jpg','2025-08-14',70,'Released','KAMI KECIL.. TAPI CINTA KAMI UNTUK MERAH PUTIH... TAK PERNAH KECIL','Merah Putih: One for All',1526