21:10.000000','tt3788052',7,2942,'en','Corner Gas: The Movie','It’s been a few years, and there’s still not a lot going on 40 kilometers from nowhere. But that’s all about to change as the fine folks of Dog River, Saskatchewan face their biggest crisis ever. Brent and the gang discover that the town’s been badly mismanaged, leaving residents with little choice but to pack up and leave. As residents make one last rally to save Dog River as they know it, they discover a devious plan by a corporate chain that would change life for Dog Riverites forever.','/3Foy86VCs8MZhTieDsglSTm4xMU.jpg','2014-12-03',90,'Released','Dog River Has Always Been Flat. But Now It\'s Flat Broke.','Corner Gas: The Movie',298533,2.3668,6.1,'Rfz8WXysf6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39283,_binary '\0','/bsX48DvTzlqpHsLEaBM3aJEamXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37887424',5.4,1500,'en','The Knock Knock Man','A group of teens dare each other to summon a mysterious figure from an old urban legend but what was suppose to be a harmless game turns deadly when one of them breaks an unspoken rule, unleashing the terrifying entity into the real world. Now hunted one by one, the friends must uncover the dark origins of the legend and find a way to banish the spirit before the knocking comes for them next.—Joseph Mazzaferro','/2GVbMJnciDlYNAbFjoebr6Z8knk.jpg','2026-01-16',75,'Released','Horror has a new name - The Knock Knock Man','The Knock Knock Man',1618086,0.9298,4,'2SwscliPZM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39284,_binary '\0','/wCwZ4ljSsWyZyTiyk1tGQtBHTDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37893389',8.2,2498,'te','Bāhubali: The Epic','When a mysterious child is found by a tribal couple near a roaring waterfall, they raise him as their own. As he grows, Sivudu is drawn to the world beyond the cliffs, where he discovers the ancient kingdom of Mahishmati, ruled by a cruel tyrant, haunted by rebellion, and bound to his past. What begins as a quest for love soon unravels a legacy of betrayal, sacrifice, and a forgotten prince.','/z9YIo2qscyaXYgRqIdRJtND3bw8.jpg','2025-10-29',224,'Released',NULL,'Bāhubali: The Epic',1511417,6.7237,6.5,'q8nbZbHRcEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39285,_binary '\0','/tkRcmn2ZpXq3k6JEeilgVXGAVJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37894980',8,1997,'ml','ആശ','Follows a stubborn, short-tempered widow named Aasha who gets into a tense altercation with a volatile man named Jeemon following a minor road accident.','/dZyMVwRhI0Y1ANDRM4sAk7P4hYC.jpg','2026-09-11',127,'Released',NULL,'Aasha',1513475,0.9408,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39286,_binary '\0','/zGbfaJpIFoUBYJJMm0ypQWPlKP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37895011',8.4,7121,'te','రావు బహదూర్','Plagued by guilt and fear, an eccentric aristocrat retreats into his ancestral manor, creating an alternate world that deeply blurs reality and imagination.','/9hzKAJImKEHBz0vnF5EazPMA8D4.jpg','2026-07-02',169,'Released','Doubt is a demon.','Rao Bahadur',1443961,2.7147,6.8,'aevbXGQKlw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39287,_binary '\0','/f3tBk0gXJuupvxFuYznyLdxswsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt37897558',6.7,1889,'ta','அதர்ஸ்','A detective investigates alarming health issues in IVF babies, revealing a dark plot involving illegal steroids, mystery donors, and corrupt fertility clinics - all orchestrated by someone exploiting people\'s desire for children.','/2rdDxephzH5bpp3Z5aKf55evRbA.jpg','2025-11-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Others',1531058,1.2969,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39288,_binary '\0','/V4ei73IZFuKjz9316gAKI4GAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3791216',7.2,16348,'en','All the Way','Lyndon B. Johnson\'s amazing 11-month journey from taking office after JFK\'s assassination, through the fight to pass the 1964 Civil Rights Act and his own presidential campaign, culminating on the night LBJ is actually elected to the office – no longer the \'ac