 and make away with a lump sum amount but once he realizes who Jeeva really is, Kathir turns a crusader.','/y8hvai0Y96Fz1yqyvtAG0hnATuZ.jpg','2014-10-22',167,'Released',NULL,'Kaththi',263475,1.6164,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39319,_binary '\0','/fywyPmuSNfgfW9ArqjTTCWUEblP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3801438',5.1,2899,'en','Grumpy Cat\'s Worst Christmas Ever','A lonely cat living in a mall pet shop has a sour outlook on life until, in the midst of the holiday rush, she’s swept up into a robbery and a friendship with a human girl.','/2GZAMXRkEWs6WhL6M04uSRzF5iw.jpg','2014-11-29',90,'Released','Ho ho no.','Grumpy Cat\'s Worst Christmas Ever',300441,2.2503,4.6,'PrSPuBYm-Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39320,_binary '\0','/itBMOcmbrpfEGheHQIgq7Tr0s0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38023049',6.3,1768,'ro','Vecina','The quiet life of a group of apartment neighbors is turned upside down when a 55-year-old woman named Doina moves in next door. A maniacal lawsuit enthusiast, Doina demands absolute silence in the building. Tensions rise and chaos unfolds as the neighbors decide to fight back.','/ei0DvzKK1izu4yxlNpVWGYnm3E1.jpg','2025-09-30',89,'Released',NULL,'Vecina',1545859,1.5894,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39321,_binary '\0','/qzMgRWUHYY2tYmir7stqWeyOrmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38023177',8.5,1506,'en','Listers: A Glimpse Into Extreme Birdwatching','Two brothers dive into competitive birdwatching, living in a van for a year while traveling across the country to participate in a Big Year contest.','/fYhAPsF8672PALtbS8pl04y4lSy.jpg','2025-08-19',119,'Released',NULL,'Listers: A Glimpse Into Extreme Birdwatching',1757612,0.9975,8,'FLWCsw9CdcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39322,_binary '\0','/zgfN6Nx0fRntM6lmIWx0vzB2xmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3802576',6.4,15736,'hi','ब्रदर्स','David and Monty, estranged half-brothers, train in mixed martial arts to earn a livelihood. However, things change when the two are forced to compete against each other in the final tournament.','/kjZv4IbGdn84Bxqt3aBB6zlWZPK.jpg','2015-08-14',155,'Released','Blood Against Blood','Brothers',330037,2.4878,6.4,'QuRSCU0tOKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39323,_binary '\0','/nxHa0qR8gYw5cnXcEaIqOmtQth3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3802668',5.8,3292,'te','గోవిందుడు అందరివాడేలే','Balaraju, the head of his village, lives with his wife Baby along with his two sons Chandrasekhar Rao and Bangari and two daughters. He helps Chandrasekhar become a doctor and builds a local hospital. On the day it opens, Chandrasekhar comes back home with his lover Kausalya, also a doctor. Both express their wish to marry and settle abroad, which upsets Balaraju, leading to their separation. 25 years later, Chandrasekhar, a successful doctor in London, tells the story to his son Abhiram and daughter Indu. Abhiram decides to go home to Balaraju and attempt a reconciliation. He meets his friend, Bunny, at the airport and goes to the village on Bunny\'s bike the next day.','/2JfAO5xeAvTme6t4QUgGUQpA6S6.jpg','2014-10-01',160,'Released',NULL,'Govindudu Andarivaadele',295590,1.8289,4.845,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39324,_binary '\0','/ntHGUdeosYWniQbYc13Gm2jAL3c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3803860',4.3,11519,'ta','புலி','A virtuous soldier Magadheera aka Puli (Tiger) vows to save his people from the rule of a cruel queen and her treacherous Marshal. Does good triumph over evil?','/jOaQRIwweY6pkqp7TEZpklNqrvd.jpg','2015-10-01',155,'Released',NULL,'Puli',330420,1.642,4.108,'U9kCY9psgOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39325,_binary '\0','/Ww7giejmMP9S1WOOdS0NWGW1Pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3804730',5.9,1817,'en','Naughty & Nice','A cynical radio host is banished to Colorado, where he has an on-air spat with a hopeless romantic. Soon, their antagonistic relationship sparks the interest of the whole town.','/rKEge46QIXAzZiclJbMI4UEF69F.jpg','2014-11-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Naughty & Nice',303601,2.6107,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39326,_binary '\0','/AuR7KCVMgMJXSXB1HHLJHYfhpiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3805180',6.7,1317,'ru','Все и сразу','Tim and Dan - fellow losers from a provincial town. Studies over, they don\'t want to work and don\'t have girlfriends. On the way to a dream and hope to get everything at once guys are taken to perform the task of the local bandits.','/hNsmPpl3zLG36jr4EIEd5P8I4pa.jpg','2014-06-05',93,'Released',NULL,'All at Once',280422,0.7894,6.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39327,_binary '\0','/op4LeiwsiQOsy6a6SxCHvf6YiiY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38063392',8.5,10892,'hi','मिशन मुँह दिखाई','Mission Muh Dikhayi follows Anjana, a modern woman who marries Devesh, an engineer from Delhi. Two days later, the Muh Dikhayi ritual ignites culture clash, emotional conflict, and a struggle between modern values and tradition.','/mq7lwaiQTsl8vC2hsT7RClfrJkQ.jpg','2025-08-30',53,'Released',NULL,'Mission Muh Dikhayi',1604783,1.0054,7,'5tY24sfzNeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39328,_binary '\0','/yiLXTCyOtXiWuJx38piaR6Gh5hh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38077500',6.6,3921,'te','Trikaali','A writer\'s creations step out of his stories, haunting his reality and demanding justice. As fiction and truth collide, he becomes a prisoner in a terrifying narrative beyond his control.','/bGN0pSFQexZQsRa9SwTrAW4eIQr.jpg','2025-09-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Trikaali',1550300,1.1797,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39329,_binary '\0','/ii8xJbKqiUTzTGvd45c0Q2yH4Nj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38077601',6.9,2858,'bn','রান্না বাটি','In the bustling, nostalgic lanes of North Kolkata, Sumit Dasgupta, a 40-year-old software engineer, lives a routine-driven life with his teenage daughter, Mohor. Ever since his wife, Supriya, passed away unexpectedly a year ago, Sumit has been struggling to balance his demanding job and single parenthood.','/yWqxcN4zIZUBkVA69Aly1JG1uXP.jpg','2025-11-07',122,'Released',NULL,'Ranna Baati',1413916,1.1335,5,'2zgdxBe5XgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39330,_binary '\0','/5ymJuqUWwQZ7yq63UE8DNpFBELr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3808342',7.4,54859,'hu','Saul fia','In the horror of 1944 Auschwitz, a prisoner forced to burn the corpses of his own people finds moral survival trying to save from the flames the body of a boy he takes for his son, seeking to give him a proper Jewish burial.','/9ZcX6NjCJam5uwkooXffhHI29Lj.jpg','2015-06-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Son of Saul',336050,4.6375,7.126,'PSabBa9IWYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39331,_binary '\0','/rIrDwlVOtktU0GBIMwjXSHLLgbu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3809308',6.8,2734,'it','Noi e la Giulia','Five down-on-their luck strangers meet by chance while looking at a property in the country none of them are able to afford. They decide to join forces and risk everything to turn it into a B&B, only for the local mafia to show up demanding their \"fair\" share.','/9aGQXfLk95fVWGrHHT8bzCnYKVw.jpg','2015-02-19',115,'Released',NULL,'The Legendary Giulia and Other Miracles',325690,1.802,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39332,_binary '\0','/28xIxuw60UNZ3Tsz1tT5Gg7MS67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38095263',6.4,1840,'es','27 noches','When a woman is admitted by her daughters to a psychiatric clinic for her carefree ways, an expert must judge if she is ill or simply wants to enjoy life.','/kVMUTLFbfQvNYdFHiexTDnSHntV.jpg','2025-09-19',108,'Released',NULL,'27 Nights',1327769,3.0784,6.4,'T9PEcUpiW6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39333,_binary '\0','/ejkeSSwniw6t1YvVp2S53PJBGZR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3810602',3.3,1911,'tr','B.O.K.: Bi O Kalmıştı','Hayati Altuntaş lives a meager life with his family. His brother Bekir, on the other hand, lives in luxury, running the jewelry stores he inherited from his wife\'s father. Hayati goes out every day to look for work, but luck is not on his side. On the other hand, he gambles away what little he has. His wife Saniye and his brother Bekir, among others, have all become the subject of gossip because of his situation. All Hayati has left are his dreams...','/vHc7VrA3SM2XXkR4oC1VTbLWIYW.jpg','2016-06-17',95,'Released',NULL,'B.O.K.: Bi O Kalmıştı',450928,0.7827,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39334,_binary '\0','/zCQC3FgiFxg4amid5rWLVvguZlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3810760',6.6,17119,'en','Minimalism: A Documentary About the Important Things','How might your life be better with less? The popular simple-living duo The Minimalists examines the many flavors of minimalism by taking the audience inside the lives of minimalists from various walks of life.','/2QXHf52RxGbw1PYrCtbD99iZdBV.jpg','2015-09-26',79,'Released','How might life be better with less?','Minimalism: A Documentary About the Important Things',392553,1.9356,6.6,'0Co1Iptd4p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39335,_binary '\0','/7ii9IZgiHc1aNUnLTsNWriIzNr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3810810',6.6,1295,'es','Nadie nos mira','Nico is a famous actor in Argentina, but in New York, nobody takes notice. He needs to juggle bartending, babysitting and odd jobs to keep himself afloat. But when old friends from Buenos Aires come to visit, he needs to juggle the image of his old life with the reality of the struggling actor in New York City.','/y9uuN60YIXOmdQMi73B4PCdVoNL.jpg','2017-05-18',102,'Released',NULL,'Nobody\'s Watching',454449,1.5367,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39336,_binary '\0','/5Y4tdRAzb3XMrxxw5q5YY6GKxM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3810932',8.2,5837,'te','దృశ్యం','Rambabu, a cable operator, lives with his beloved wife Jyothi and two daughters. One day, his family inadvertently gets involved in a grave crime and he must go to great lengths to protect them.','/ujH3QanyIVzlTVst80Upk0Tmr2c.jpg','2014-07-11',150,'Released','Visuals can be deceiving.','Drushyam',279450,1.2019,7.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39337,_binary '\0','/xnyGhzrfqENfFoiNZ9z4oy63Z9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3811906',6.2,123145,'en','Malignant','Madison is paralyzed by shocking visions of grisly murders, and her torment worsens as she discovers that these waking dreams are in fact terrifying realities with a mysterious tie to her past.','/dGv2BWjzwAz6LB8a8JeRIZL8hSz.jpg','2021-09-01',111,'Released','A new vision of terror.','Malignant',619778,11.0549,6.748,'IGP7AB776CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39338,_binary '\0','/44aEUVjYtOLOBHZB55b3AXpdzA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3811986',5.5,2598,'fr','Une famille à louer','Forty-year-old Paul-André is a timid, rather introverted man. Rich but alone, he is deeply bored and ends up concluding that what he needs is a family. Violette, a forty-year-old full of energy, is threatened with eviction and is afraid she\'ll lose custody of her two children. Paul-André then proposes a totally above the board contract to rent the family in exchange for him paying off Violette\'s debts. For better and for worse..','/nMOBnUiGVPhn5NtNChSLyu8N0Tf.jpg','2015-08-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Family for Rent',342281,2.747,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39339,_binary '\0','/gtKglOSEq3d4MgQE4VsrT1sRkd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38121182',6.6,5442,'ja','劇場版 呪術廻戦「渋谷事変 特別編集版」×「死滅回游 先行上映」','A veil abruptly descends over the busy Shibuya area amid the bustling Halloween crowds, trapping countless civilians inside. Satoru Gojo, the strongest jujutsu sorcerer, steps into the chaos. But lying in wait are curse users and spirits scheming to seal him away. Yuji Itadori, accompanied by his classmates and other top-tier jujutsu sorcerers, enters the fray in an unprecedented clash of curses — the Shibuya Incident. In the aftermath, ten colonies across Japan are transformed into dens of curses in a plan orchestrated by Noritoshi Kamo. As the deadly Culling Game starts, Special Grade sorcerer Yuta Okkotsu is assigned to carry out Yuji\'s execution for his perceived crimes. A compilation movie of Shibuya Incident including the first two episodes of the Culling Games arc.','/v0s3dx6am0RzfsuK3KdEy8ZoCDs.jpg','2025-11-07',88,'Released',NULL,'JUJUTSU KAISEN: Execution',1539104,14.159,6.1,'Vo7G5Y212Gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39340,_binary '\0','/k9GObZbUUUxOjlRjY172GVroeSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38123566',7.6,6904,'ta','வித் லவ்','Sathya reluctantly agrees to a blind date arranged by his sister and meets Monisha. They discover they attended the same school years ago. Bonding over shared memories and old crushes, they reconnect with their past and grow closer.','/mKVSozOhy9to5AFfIX1tsDDFrFK.jpg','2026-02-06',141,'Released',NULL,'With Love',1508564,3.1719,6.8,'09M9_khkgRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39341,_binary '\0','/a5i8RqFcYiC7VZeDER5GEP48zQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3812366',7.8,6956,'ko','국제시장','Duk-soo lost his father and younger sister while taking refuge during the Korean War. He leaves for Germany to work as a miner and enters the Vietnam War. He wishes to find his sister.','/8CAnvwZmUARHDwEcqr89YifBUkm.jpg','2014-12-17',126,'Released','One promise can shape a lifetime.','Ode to My Father',313108,3.9176,7.386,'LpvfBfxjNPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39342,_binary '\0','/erNAhcSYrDMXQqAU1TVthYyFA71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38128726',5.8,3495,'en','Stop! That! Train!','Best friends and train stewardesses Tess and DeeDee trade their dreary shifts on the Stank Rail for the glitzy Glamazonian Express. However, when a catastrophic Stormaganza threatens to crash the high-speed train into Celebration, Florida, the duo in coach must join forces with the snobby first-class attendants, a hot but dimwitted co-conductor, and fabulous US President Judy Gagwell to save the day.','/w90dGS6D2lVO4aO5rdQ8QECrUGY.jpg','2026-06-12',90,'Released','The greatest trainwreck in herstory.','Stop! That! Train!',1541560,9.635,4.9,'yx2YuoAnwlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39343,_binary '\0','/qNwmXl9QyK37cmZHaLEU1xZyZd6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3813310',6.3,36911,'en','Cop Car','Two kids find themselves in the centre of a deadly game of cat and mouse after taking a sheriff\'s cruiser for a joy ride.','/6MCvmPcMdbmdsIeRNQhKzLcZorP.jpg','2015-07-08',88,'Released','Their first drive could be their last.','Cop Car',310133,4.1699,5.989,'MBK_9GlVlc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39344,_binary '\0','/zi9cBLPEokXHqobOxsQrfF87Sz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3814316',6.7,1719,'fr','Le Nouveau','Benoît, the new kid at school, is bullied by a gang of arrogant boys. Determined not to be pushed around, Benoît organizes a big party, but only three students turn up. What if this bunch of losers was to be the best gang ever?','/tg7MuAFkD8MW35MkWcbrLnkeiWQ.jpg','2015-12-23',81,'Released',NULL,'The New Kid',358430,2.1727,6.2,'lzx_9rpcdLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39345,_binary '\0','/emeGqHLdjkLG0WufyPghTttLz6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3814486',7.1,2045,'nl','Bloed, Zweet en Tranen','Blood, Sweat and Tears is a story about the life of Andre Hazes, a Dutch popular singer. It shows three crucial phases in the life of Hazes: his youth (in the 1960s), his breakthrough (1980s) and the last year of his life (early 2000s).','/aNrh6DfTngUvi7WdpTjLTPzYbTU.jpg','2015-04-02',111,'Released','The movie about Andre Hazes','Blood, Sweat and Tears',327237,1.2536,6.8,'SLfW0Hc-5BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39346,_binary '\0','/rPLZrQDs8ozEfTVqhusXucSgWcp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3814808',6.5,2691,'en','Funny Cow','A comedian uses her troubled past as material for her stand-up routine, trying to rise up through the comedy circuit by playing Northern England\'s working men\'s clubs.','/y29y4QNrO3a2I1iWKnIZGP5l1N8.jpg','2018-04-20',103,'Released','When life knocks you down... stand up.','Funny Cow',419916,2.0943,6.3,'5qDFb7qUV30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39347,_binary '\0','/qJGioJgsqpoDUiAztWcxCB3vn2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3815136',7,2562,'en','My Beautiful Broken Brain','A profoundly personal voyage into the complexity, fragility and wonder of the human brain, after Lotje Sodderland miraculously survives a hemorrhagic stroke and finds herself starting again in an alien world, bereft of language and logic. This feature documentary takes us on a genre-twisting tale that is by turns excruciating and exquisite - from the devastating consequences of a first-time neurological experiment, through to the extraordinary revelations of her altered sensory perception.','/onm7B851Jk90Krcw9cfBdkTRhyg.jpg','2014-11-21',84,'Released','Life is like a dream','My Beautiful Broken Brain',381071,1.2675,7,'VSfpA3AEKmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39348,_binary '\0','/ozid94SG8Kt79SNgdwvSDY8YDWU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3815424',7.1,1392,'ar','٣٠٠٠ ليلة','Iman, a young newly wed Palestinian bride, is arrested and incarcerated in a top-security Israeli prison where she gives birth to a baby boy. As she struggles to survive and raise her child behind bars, she is torn between her instinct as a mother and the difficult decisions she must make, finding through her relationship with the other prisoners - both Palestinian and Israeli – the time and space to reflect, develop and mature as a young woman.','/uU3lQDzrFHLsoNIHqRs3hUMNMOy.jpg','2015-10-15',103,'Released',NULL,'3000 Nights',358905,1.0725,6.2,'YmFLZf3W8AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39349,_binary '\0','/p74ymjILNdkKwtL3DAJwP2I7Snr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3815480',5.6,2032,'en','Stranded in Paradise','When a driven HR exec loses her high-powered job, she travels to Puerto Rico in an attempt to save her career at a business conference. But as the trip quickly becomes a disaster and a hurricane shuts down the whole island, she meets a handsome world traveler who gives her a new perspective on finding passion in life and love.','/mvfKbcP1dMo5a4tijQ7ReZFH62B.jpg','2014-08-09',84,'Released',NULL,'Stranded in Paradise',286071,1.6805,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39350,_binary '\0','/8GrZPOKMqJiqKCc8sCjWQ1LJbXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3816372',4.7,1703,'en','The Unauthorized Saved by the Bell Story','The Unauthorized Saved by the Bell Story delves into the experiences of six unknown young actors placed into the Hollywood spotlight, exposing the challenges of growing up under public scrutiny.','/r6carqRHObNUtlJVKcrIye6A85H.jpg','2014-09-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Unauthorized Saved by the Bell Story',287241,1.1226,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39351,_binary '\0','/3QyZefxeAuoUshAwpliuhaTwDPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3816458',5.2,9992,'en','Dead Rising: Watchtower','A group of people fight to survive in a zombie infested town.','/95gMn5GwR6rPHmmHfDyEs0pO2U7.jpg','2015-03-27',118,'Released',NULL,'Dead Rising: Watchtower',293771,4.1827,5.2,'c8pcAnOTwPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39352,_binary '\0','/nqwQmuINGUj72OadSnNN2JN6gNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38164776',8.4,1410,'uk','Антарктида','Scientists live and research in Antarctica, facing isolation and harsh conditions. They study climate change, glaciers, and wildlife while maintaining Ukraine\'s presence on the continent.','/1YQC0GFgxA8YgK7fn4TB3nYI62Q.jpg','2025-09-04',86,'Released',NULL,'Antarctica',1518749,0.8564,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39353,_binary '\0','/v2lzXdjug3Ui8y0gjBeBm3hxD2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3816614',3.7,1486,'en','Turkey Shoot','In the near future, a Navy SEAL framed for war crimes is offered a chance for freedom by participating in a TV show that requires him to outwit other professional killers to survive.','/8f3twszUfCtInJo0VB1Bz3ptx0e.jpg','2014-12-04',90,'Released','It\'s live. With death.','Turkey Shoot',301730,3.2031,4.2,'ebeWVDHrshc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39354,_binary '\0','/ypdHCkZhB77WkEBQq0MUE1aOncl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3817848',7,1312,'en','Turtle Power: The Definitive History of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles','In the spring of 1984, a strange new comic book sat beside cash registers in select shops, too big to fit in the racks, and too weird to ignore. Eastman and Laird\'s Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles presented a completely original breed of super hero. It was too bizarre, too crazy. It broke all the rules and should never have worked. Until it sold out. Again and again and again. For 30 years. Now, peek under the shell and see how this so-called \"happy accident\" defied every naysayer to become one of the most popular and beloved franchises in the world.','/8O4Y6fNxHaHwiI8SQpQekCJlnfz.jpg','2014-08-12',98,'Released','A Look Under The Shell','Turtle Power: The Definitive History of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles',280276,1.8663,7.4,'6qbymj_yAfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39355,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3817950',8.7,1364,'mr','Dr. Prakash Baba Amte: The Real Hero','Dr Prakash Baba Amte : The Real Hero is a Marathi film on biopic of Dr. Prakash Amte featuring actors like Nana Patekar and Sonali Kulkarni.','/nv1co884L3deosL70pj3CDZiyVo.jpg','2014-10-10',119,'Released','Prakash Baba Amte','Dr. Prakash Baba Amte: The Real Hero',297752,1.2423,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39356,_binary '\0','/cwCZRUjsAsmKEFFepNFZy6AJpZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3817962',6.2,1329,'fr','À trois, on y va','Charlotte is cheating on Micha with Mélodie. Not suspecting a thing, yet feeling neglected, Micha in turn cheats on Charlotte. But also with Mélodie. For Mélodie, things are topsy-turvy. She lies to both of them. She is privy to each of their lies. And is in love with both of them at the same time.','/4hFczO5WuLSAZYZlbXAJIwVJZ5n.jpg','2015-03-25',86,'Released',NULL,'All About Them',299715,1.69,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39357,_binary '\0','/6dnjLlULpq34601kAgYhxrWAufH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3818286',5.9,1246,'en','Alex & Eve','Alex, a Greek Orthodox schoolteacher, falls for Lebanese Muslim lawyer, Eve. The relationship is forbidden by both families, and thus the emotional dilemma of \'Alex and Eve\' is created.','/1mqsEAkrTC9RY7WDmVvQpYv6JdJ.jpg','2015-10-22',131,'Released','Nothing can keep them apart... except their parents!','Alex & Eve',347538,1.2697,5.7,'b2ePlVvQBwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39358,_binary '\0','/wvxHxYZSnn3LJ7Gpl5Ti4ef5ZgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38183872',6.9,1592,'en','Christmas Above the Clouds','When a workaholic CEO tries to skip Christmas by flying to Australia, she’s in for the flight of her life. Haunted by her past, present, and future, she’s forced to confront the choices that led to her success yet left her flying solo. With the help of three quirky spirits and a surprise reunion with her ex, she might just rediscover the magic of Christmas—and the love she thought she’d lost.','/sMHF7beWXqWzXqtclqrz6vd95xV.jpg','2025-11-08',84,'Released','A magical flight through Past, Present, and Future','Christmas Above the Clouds',1537081,2.0281,7.2,'xhkbZ3n_Yd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39359,_binary '\0','/usrUizny0dLNJTrrJSxsvu5V0z0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3819668',7.1,26048,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 復活の「F」','One peaceful day on Earth, two remnants of Frieza\'s army named Sorbet and Tagoma arrive searching for the Dragon Balls with the aim of reviving Frieza. They succeed, and Frieza subsequently seeks revenge on the Saiyans.','/soq3AxjALdBfdPAm8H7yuMmNL5Y.jpg','2015-04-18',93,'Released','The worst wish in history, that is the beginning of despair.','Dragon Ball Z: Resurrection \'F\'',303857,10.588,6.9,'5z_nWwKBiRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39360,_binary '\0','/6cMXtzw9gJ9Xk2jhVpsotX90paw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38202962',6.7,2179,'ml','അവിഹിതം','A drunken man\'s encounter sets off a chain of gossip in a town of secrets. As whispers spread, a woman\'s hidden past threatens to tear everything apart.','/gPHdHjoUK2Hft5XpyYQ4s7XqxrE.jpg','2025-10-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Avihitham',1531405,1.3468,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39361,_binary '\0','/anuk1ovYcugX62Etd3YMeepahZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3820450',3.5,1604,'en','All American Bikini Car Wash','An enterprising college student agrees to run his professor\'s Las Vegas car wash to avoid flunking out of school. But it\'s Vegas gone wild when he decides to staff it with gorgeous bikini-clad girls.','/yOcUeObxfwPRAxH0KghQ0O7eJd7.jpg','2015-08-29',95,'Released','What happens in Vegas...','All American Bikini Car Wash',364708,3.1316,4.5,'GFgtpl2NNRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39362,_binary '\0','/lplhIdFpgi0KQJszI9pRgnj1feO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38218065',5.7,1505,'en','R.L. Stine\'s Pumpkinhead','When his brother disappears and everyone forgets he existed, Sam must unravel the mystery before Finn is gone forever.','/gRJFFA9lK9pLikEIMcetgkmOGTj.jpg','2025-10-17',91,'Released',NULL,'R.L. Stine\'s Pumpkinhead',1551003,2.6816,6.6,'gqmrfVrPJlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39363,_binary '\0','/hZZBwFOkOI84ohdPP6cXSL9l5zf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3822388',7.9,5463,'ta','மெட்ராஸ்','A portrayal of the lives of the people living in North Madras, focusing on the politics inside the slums and how their plight remains the same, despite the political class luring them constantly during elections.','/hbaUw4NzU7Zd6QGj7HMNohfWpIT.jpg','2014-09-26',156,'Released',NULL,'Madras',280948,1.2555,7.778,'4wBsmjHc62g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39364,_binary '\0','/gw9nXilG4CzcqLGxZjI8x9HCbkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3822396',7.9,9736,'ta','வேலையில்லா பட்டதாரி','Raghuvaran, who is unemployed for years, gets his dream job but a powerful rival is keen to put him down. Can he take on his adversary?','/fQ8JzXRf68xlzyquLn7TEe3S2Nh.jpg','2014-07-18',133,'Released',NULL,'Velaiyilla Pattathari',262970,1.7583,7.551,'fZOwwAzI9jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39365,_binary '\0','/kuPzbd0j1zN9J9tNBJgoCKvsk4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3822818',7.2,4395,'de','Nackt unter Wölfen','Taking place at the Concentration camp Buchenwald at the end of March 1945, prisoner Hans Pippig discovers in a carrying case of an incoming prisoner a Jewish child. If reported the three-year-old is sure to die. On the other hand, a violation of the rules of the camp would threaten the long prepared uprising of the concentration camp prisoners against the SS.','/ksZ5rGI4SE3nk1It96IyBjzvCf4.jpg','2015-04-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Naked Among Wolves',333696,1.9743,7.3,'oovA6-YDg0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39366,_binary '\0','/9efaxnGdZJCIf7AMmYJWCesAi1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3823018',6.8,1787,'is','Þrestir','The story follows a 16-year-old Icelandic boy, Ari, who lives with his mother in Reykjavík. She has to leave the country for a new job, sending him back to the small town of his youth. There he finds his old friend, suddenly a young woman with a tricky romantic relationship; and his father has become a victim of the financial crisis.','/9btyS69uTEqsmHMoVDwXYp8O3iv.jpg','2015-10-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Sparrows',334922,1.479,6.4,'bvNw3WqecEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39367,_binary '\0','/7k6ybzFPEpGIjsnqk9L5UxVJGva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3823098',6.6,2978,'en','Edie','To try and overcome a lifetime of bitterness and resentment, 83-year-old Edie decides that it is never too late. After packing an old camping bag, she leaves her life behind and embarks on an adventure she never got to have... climbing the imposing Mount Suilven in Scotland.','/5L9bDg7f3AycCagYwgwaKa52yKe.jpg','2018-05-25',102,'Released',NULL,'Edie',460064,1.3555,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39368,_binary '\0','/8SjSMwj3CyFvIYVJ7qX6UnPRzsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3823116',5.8,2559,'de','Überflieger - Kleine Vögel, großes Geklapper','Orphaned at birth and raised by storks, teenage sparrow Richard believes he is one of them. But when time comes to migrate to Africa, his stork family is forced to reveal his true identity and leave him behind in the forest, since he is not a migratory bird and would not survive the journey. Determined to prove he is a stork after all, Richard ventures south on his own. But only with the help of Olga, an eccentric owl with an imaginary friend and Kiki, a narcissistic, disco-singing parakeet, does he stand a chance to reach his goal and learn to accept who he really is.','/aKwgGlhdhdbx0duJhCRojkEZXgU.jpg','2017-04-28',85,'Released','Their adventure is the destination.','A Stork\'s Journey',378111,5.4613,6.077,'jNJAKIQmpRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39369,_binary '\0','/eSW8frBUo3cuEtHQIojQLRaxg8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3823392',7.4,3046,'hi','Love Sonia','Inspired by a real story of young girl\'s journey escape from the world of international sex trafficking.','/qiCMgBHncFnH9IGn5KPWRz0hEDv.jpg','2018-09-14',126,'Released',NULL,'Love Sonia',444000,2.4344,7.147,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39370,_binary '\0','/98uiDns59GUw26SQSCFmuSHTki3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38235625',4.7,1759,'es','Boulevard','Hasley, a girl with a list of unfulfilled dreams, and Luke, a complex and vulnerable boy marked by a tragic past, find refuge on the boulevard where they discover if love can conquer all.','/sQS3zYJznspQwNSCv9LMc5VHQST.jpg','2026-04-10',113,'Released',NULL,'Boulevard',1595852,13.0907,7.433,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39371,_binary '\0','/eUERZRVjCTNdgnESlQxyaOJ2d4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38238651',4.1,1290,'en','The Internship','A CIA-trained assassin recruits other graduates from her secret childhood program, The Internship, to violently destroy the organization. The CIA fights back with deadly force.','/fYqSOkix4rbDiZW0ACNnvZCpT6X.jpg','2026-01-13',91,'Released',NULL,'The Internship',1584215,11.3893,6.4,'uXRFha7MLTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39372,_binary '\0','/tHXjEDIz7RHEj7PFSoDkgbNM5zt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3823994',3.2,1513,'en','Aaliyah: The Princess of R&B','The story of R&B singer and actress Aaliyah; namely, the highs and lows of her career, her romantic pursuits, and the events leading up to her death in 2001 at the age of 22.','/czfLJDH44TRs7TZU19pOyt2UYtf.jpg','2014-11-15',85,'Released','The story of the music sensation, from her discovery on the TV show','Aaliyah: The Princess of R&B',303616,2.2995,6.526,'hoHrzUWemFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39373,_binary '\0','/tg0aXAvX4qKCkpPQImNEE0e90Pf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824344',6.9,1485,'en','Monster High: Freaky Fusion','While attempting to help Frankie Stein learn more about her freakycool scaritage, the fashionably fierce ghoulfriends travel back in time to the first day ever of Monster High! There, they meet Sparky, a skullastic teen with an obsession for creating life. But when Sparky follows the ghouls through a killer time portal to modern-day Monster High, the event results in eight of them fusing together into four creeperiffic hybrid Monsters. Now, they\'ll really have to work together to control their bodies in the big Bitecentennial Play and stop one of Sparky\'s experiments from destroying imperfectly perfect Monster High!','/qO48cuDRwZvokPxvbAR4rzdFcYz.jpg','2014-10-06',73,'Released',NULL,'Monster High: Freaky Fusion',290727,3.8788,7.8,'eRhN3iWAzao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39374,_binary '\0','/96uT2hcW12ekUjfoNTatJzmxeth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824412',5.5,8005,'en','Results','Two mismatched personal trainers\' lives are upended by the actions of a new, wealthy client.','/9mQafhsspuLrlr5RUAKVMZdcZsF.jpg','2015-05-29',105,'Released','Fighting fit','Results',294132,2.3734,5.1,'XoM_dM7tQvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39375,_binary '\0','/7AIcbGlCq3I4QnNJ2nCZm3fPoif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824432',6.8,1274,'ta','சலீம்','Salim, a model doctor and a do-gooder, breaks down when he loses his job and rejected by his fiance. He turns into a vigilante to teach the powerful a lesson...','/6wfJOTtf4DqRKutC4bWKJpPWm0.jpg','2014-08-29',150,'Released',NULL,'Salim',280873,1.1982,6,'vuYfgo-D5H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39376,_binary '\0','/q18pdMKGX4wSHaT3lllt5jLjp8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824458',7.1,43601,'en','Tangerine','It\'s Christmas Eve in Tinseltown and Sin-Dee is back on the block. Upon hearing that her pimp boyfriend hasn\'t been faithful during the 28 days she was locked up, the working girl and her best friend, Alexandra, embark on a mission to get to the bottom of the scandalous rumor. Their rip-roaring odyssey leads them through various subcultures of Los Angeles, including an Armenian family dealing with their own repercussions of infidelity.','/EKLR5c61XQzBTeMokFrmS3kdt8.jpg','2015-07-10',87,'Released','Shit floats to the surface','Tangerine',308084,5.0445,6.9,'ALSwWTb88ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39377,_binary '\0','/2DwSRqFuqZoGqbJVkuAFsulYVQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824648',6.9,17888,'en','Big Time Adolescence','A seemingly bright and mostly innocent 16-year-old named Mo attempts to navigate high school under the guidance of his best friend Zeke, an unmotivated-yet-charismatic college dropout. Although Zeke genuinely cares about Mo, things start to go awry as he teaches Mo nontraditional life lessons in drug dealing, partying, and dating. Meanwhile, Mo’s well-meaning dad tries to step in and take back the reins of his son’s upbringing.','/iaoIzpakgSm0IQEz3edfAttr4YC.jpg','2020-03-13',91,'Released','Under his influence.','Big Time Adolescence',539617,4.2073,7.165,'t3PcDo4YcnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39378,_binary '\0','/AvtRgZCHQn54gxUAcjIqJUzdmZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3824950',5,1327,'cn','摆渡人','Chen Mo, a bar owner, listens to his customers\' heartbreaks and helps them navigate their lives during their hard times while dealing with his own tragedy.','/bUmEGmnHaVqL0oinAKEbVKEaz1w.jpg','2016-12-23',128,'Released',NULL,'See You Tomorrow',345674,2.2237,4.5,'I-SUKMwssmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39379,_binary '\0','/hZt2oHJm0u54IVq2FvAWomSI4JF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3825638',7.3,14729,'de','Im Labyrinth des Schweigens','A young prosecutor in postwar West Germany investigates a massive conspiracy to cover up the Nazi pasts of prominent public figures.','/lCnzlBatc1Rsciny0tRwxb9dnwL.jpg','2014-11-06',122,'Released',NULL,'Labyrinth of Lies',287495,3.5173,7.2,'6jGxe6auuTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39380,_binary '\0','/6aik3nFoFDacqmJwIPf2A1XEnVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3825698',7.5,1252,'hu','Anyám és más futóbolondok a családból','Over the course of four generations, a family in Hungary confronts poverty, political turmoil and a life that\'s perpetually on the move.','/pfEXBKzu1DcFJyQcd5vJkRdC8Ta.jpg','2015-11-05',112,'Released',NULL,'Mom and Other Loonies in the Family',371006,1.8475,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39381,_binary '\0','/9Ctpyp442Rj0nkkO0IC6GB7jSDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3825738',6.4,3027,'it','Scusate se esisto!','Serena Bruno is an architect who studied and got several masters in different countries of the world but she decides to go back to Italy so she can live and work there. She will soon find out that her native country is not as open minded and she will struggle to find a job that she truly loves and is passionate about. Along the way she will meet Francesco a gay man who will help and support her throughout her journey.','/2vCcy7EGI4xnVXsY51y9tIRsEWL.jpg','2014-11-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Do You See Me?',298729,2.0832,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39382,_binary '\0','/hglxbNCHvsWa3eq7yGRD0oAcwiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3826338',5.1,1376,'en','Pants on Fire','Jack Parker has always skated by on his lies, especially the one about Mikey, an underprivileged (and made-up) teen who Jack \"tutors\"... until one day \"Mikey\" shows up for real, and all Jack\'s lies start coming true.','/cMT9wbyLRfyUwUMVLmEGBVedAgC.jpg','2014-11-09',85,'Released','Liar liar.','Pants on Fire',304441,2.5579,5.753,'raYsuSaNN7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39383,_binary '\0','/bgneM7nHQVl8SxbL5FkupFLJ1Fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38265603',8.1,3213,'ml','പ്രഥമ ദൃഷ്ട്യാ കുറ്റക്കാർ','Follows a woman constable who joins the police force through appointment after the death of her husband.','/zcxFgdE2aHOQq3tlKDDn6RYdVWr.jpg','2026-09-11',161,'Released',NULL,'Pradhama Drishtya Kuttakkar',1544847,2.4485,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39384,_binary '\0','/bRhPcbtPfnrfJPllQtYY7SWoLbu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38267486',7.4,1604,'ta','நூறு சாமி','Selvi, a widowed mother, devotes her life to raising her two sons in a conservative village. Years later, unfulfilled life comes back into focus, challenging deep-rooted traditions. As family and society strongly oppose change, Selvi must choose between societal expectations and her own happiness.','/1dKmZB9KVSOA6mq6Oa2t6HYd8E1.jpg','2026-06-19',131,'Released',NULL,'Nooru Sami',1544326,2.1764,0,'Rc7Km9V0wT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39385,_binary '\0','/29oZX9CRie8qCSsrQWaLQil4ThT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3826834',6.9,1346,'ru','Класс Коррекции','Lena is a bright, disabled girl who, after years spent studying at home, is keen to get back to school. She is assigned to a special class for disabled pupils who have to present themselves before a school commission at the end of the year in order to prove that they merit being moved back into a \"normal\" class. Her enervated teachers, however, show absolutely no desire to motivate the students and help them improve; on the contrary, they try to quash right from the start any interest Lena shows in more complex study material. Nevertheless, Lena soon involves herself in the school routine and gets together with classmate Anton. Yet their transparent happiness is not to everyone\'s liking and repercussions soon follow.','/qI1UG7ukCqPSRi3BVKE71cJ0zby.jpg','2014-09-25',98,'Released',NULL,'Corrections Class',285021,1.3223,6.1,'hiJq_jB4_g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39386,_binary '\0','/3Di33VsNiTNSEXKFvIgoebiBRVR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3826866',4.5,4391,'en','The Girl in the Photographs','Small-town store clerk Colleen is eager to escape her tedious existence and annoying boyfriend. Then gruesome photos of murdered women start appearing.','/tHq78AyplquMh5fogT0QGGYhzUF.jpg','2015-09-14',98,'Released',NULL,'The Girl in the Photographs',354220,2.2367,4.9,'8QJie9p9-jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39387,_binary '\0','/A805E3bj8RcZvgQOiTuFMiUHiYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3827540',3,1593,'en','Invasion: Planet Earth','On the same day that Tom Dunn finds out that he is to become a father again, the people of Earth become plagued with terrifying visions of the end of the world. When a gigantic, all-consuming alien mothership launches a ruthless attack, chaos and destruction follow. The ultimate war for Planet Earth is about to begin...','/29sq0JjJslhPKhWjfMJVJ9fSmVw.jpg','2019-12-05',98,'Released','They\'re coming.','Invasion: Planet Earth',641370,2.2457,5.2,'1nqEqJWl4OY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39388,_binary '\0','/mtkxx39Rn3HtErAvRzIO3pLrgDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3827684',4.8,3436,'en','The Hollow','When a U.S. congressman\'s daughter passing through a small town in Mississippi dies in a mysterious triple homicide, a team of F.B.I. agents descends to investigate, the team\'s brilliant but jaded lead agent battling demons both past and present, as his beautiful, tough-as-nails partner tries to hold him and the case together. They find a struggling and corrupt sheriff\'s department, a shadowy and much-feared figure, who seems to be pulling all of the town\'s strings from his mansion on the edge of town and a local victim with a strange connection to a number of the town\'s most prominent figures.','/wrKVZdV3K3BKlQdIbiMQ3uYIRBT.jpg','2016-10-07',128,'Released','High-profile murder, low-profile town','The Hollow',417056,1.8408,4.7,'guFyYjxyOY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39389,_binary '\0','/vBSLlsShxtIwC3zQfymWUrarm6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3827868',5.7,2164,'en','A Frosty Affair','A rom-com about the adventures of a small town teacher, Kate Carter, going back to the city for her wedding. After a blizzard strikes, she is forced to travel with a stranger named Redford who leaves her questioning her future plans.','/ArlNMipfH89GrpQ6Ifjy74hPHid.jpg','2015-10-03',90,'Released',NULL,'A Frosty Affair',376244,1.866,5.6,'SJdFnr7fIXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39390,_binary '\0','/pWq3jl2WBlD17x1CkprNeCe2cGG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38283987',5.1,2348,'hi','One Two Cha Cha Chaa','So, Fuel Up, Gear Up, Level Up and Fasten your seat belts for the wildest and wackiest road trip of all time.','/cWfX0Pog0ZHgTKY3glhIjvkWxgB.jpg','2026-01-16',160,'Released','One Two Cha Cha Chaa','One Two Cha Cha Chaa',1617536,2.0206,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39391,_binary '\0','/o0Ai0yCq1jyLE3K55Nk3bAl4D9h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38286171',5.7,1733,'ml','ഉന്മാദം','Haunted by his past, a police constable reopens an unsolved cold case. As hidden secrets surface, he must confront truths that challenge his beliefs forever.','/6AIMHBUY6PCHVYASWZ0GcTA9Kph.jpg','2026-07-31',141,'Released',NULL,'Unmadham',1545486,4.9899,6.2,'rGEw9hP0jlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39392,_binary '\0','/aZ7xFnf3ArZaX3A1NujXDsn83A3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3828858',5.6,1471,'en','Lost & Found','Sent to spend the summer with their uncle on a remote island, young brothers Andy and Mark learn that their eccentric grandfather once owned the island, but vanished without a trace…taking with him the secret to a vast fortune. Delving into the mysterious past of the island, the brothers discover that their grandfather designed a complex treasure hunt, a hunt that could lead to unimaginable wealth and heal their broken family – if they can find it in time. Sinister forces also search for the money and will stop at nothing to keep the boys from their quest. As the adventure unfolds, the boys learn that the bonds of family are the most valuable riches of all, and that some family secrets can’t stay buried forever.','/7XrnrcZB0HqWqAGQfmDextQTU2G.jpg','2016-02-22',90,'Released','The greatest treasure lies within.','Lost & Found',389272,2.6761,5.4,'vhmXY17g3ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39393,_binary '\0','/b96OdaJce7Zu70NYe8vmlfOQUUN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3829266',5.3,164711,'en','The Predator','When a young boy accidentally triggers the universe\'s most lethal hunters\' return to Earth, only a ragtag crew of ex-soldiers and a disgruntled scientist can prevent the end of the human race.','/a3eWGF6YPF7No5Rbtjc8QpDvz7l.jpg','2018-09-05',107,'Released','The hunt has evolved.','The Predator',346910,13.2586,5.617,'50_Ala5BKBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39394,_binary '\0','/frIVSxnqgQfEOedXxZHH5y3lSJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3829378',5.8,6900,'en','Stephanie','After a mysterious global crisis, a young girl is left alone to hide from a malevolent power that stalks her home. Her parents eventually return and the struggle begins to save their daughter.','/8H4zWxkF2GgWgIyfcrBnrVYYK7G.jpg','2017-04-27',86,'Released',NULL,'Stephanie',333357,2.1381,6.2,'fyYHSElyJVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39395,_binary '\0','/zaX6d5GCtb2CmOH9jrHBl58xxBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3829920',7.6,93838,'en','Only the Brave','Members of the Granite Mountain Hotshots battle deadly wildfires to save an Arizona town.','/db5IkOJu9UHktrKroNktw1Z8ARY.jpg','2017-09-22',133,'Released','It’s not what stands in front of you, it’s who stands beside you','Only the Brave',395991,15.5467,7.485,'DSHk_BHQxp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39396,_binary '\0','/dBkJwhX1kFpnwicXyckg1y2Bus1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3830162',7,11719,'da','Krigen','Company commander Claus Michael Pedersen and his men are stationed in Helmand, Afghanistan. Meanwhile back in Denmark, with a husband at war and three children missing their father, everyday life is a struggle for Claus\' wife Maria. During a routine mission, the soldiers are caught in heavy Taliban crossfire. In order to save his men, Claus makes a decision that ultimately sees him return to Denmark accused of a war crime.','/iBiGQf5qz6HSKKk10aejFGLMclj.jpg','2015-09-10',115,'Released','Duty goes beyond the battlefield.','A War',348674,3.2988,6.6,'AbYZfqTaSP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39397,_binary '\0','/2c72ElZ8UkgwVp2w8TJ1AbIGCO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3830998',7.2,1320,'ja','LUPIN THE IIIRD 次元大介の墓標','Lupin & Jigen have their sights set on a treasure called the Little Comet, which is located in the heavily fortified country of East Doroa. During the heist, Jigen is almost killed by a sniper named Yael Okuzaki. His specialty is preparing tombstones for his targets before executing them. It\'s said that no one can survive after Yael makes their tombstone.','/rFzjrIk8hPoWsZzE42iCUlZgu0p.jpg','2014-06-21',51,'Released','Here lies Daisuke Jigen with .357 Magnum died 1st Apr, 19... Rest in peace.','Lupin the Third: Jigen\'s Gravestone',260516,4.0139,7.4,'N9AuACG76Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39398,_binary '\0','/k10NsRRy2S1GSzMGiy4cMS7Uvk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3831344',5.4,2130,'en','Amelia 2.0','After his wife Amelia suffers an aneurysm that leaves her bedridden and slowly dying, police officer Carter Summerland searches for a way to revive her. He\'s approached by Wesley Enterprises pioneering a new program to extend life through robotics, they get caught in a public debate over human’s relationship with technology and her right to exist.','/toFTyct7YWAaCy3Gz0lq074hiDk.jpg','2017-08-04',89,'Released','Life after death.','Amelia 2.0',469799,1.7162,5.5,'vDUlaZZxmbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39399,_binary '\0','/c5RgeZszp75puLH9NXOyZkyvWiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3831810',5.7,7441,'en','Big Driver','Tess Thorne, a famous writer, is determined to seek revenge on the man who brutally assaulted and raped her on a desolate New England road.','/wm2CQU8EjKG75acaMhv9iqnunf.jpg','2014-10-18',87,'Released','Murder is a two-way street.','Big Driver',297961,2.7154,5.7,'RNofY4Nq1gU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39400,_binary '\0','/wtDRdoHSKIY5zhv8pwy4WuOcoTD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3832096',3.8,12370,'en','Cabin Fever','While staying at a remote cabin for a week-long vacation, a group of five college friends succumb to an infectious, flesh-eating disease.','/yJQLWoizC5zBjVk9dr2Qo1K1TCI.jpg','2016-02-12',99,'Released','You can\'t run from what\'s inside.','Cabin Fever',298584,4.089,4.746,'eiTS5qztePA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39401,_binary '\0','/oCCvZEbqCCcALQtah8HJm9Ja4HT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3832914',6.5,17787,'en','War Room','The family-friendly movie explores the transformational role prayer plays in the lives of the Jordan family. Tony and Elizabeth Jordan, a middle-class couple who seemingly have it all – great jobs, a beautiful daughter, their dream home. But appearances can be deceiving. In reality, the Jordan’s marriage has become a war zone and their daughter is collateral damage. With the help of Miss Clara, an older, wiser woman, Elizabeth discovers she can start fighting for her family instead of against them. Through a newly energized faith, Elizabeth and Tony’s real enemy doesn’t have a prayer.','/unxQeVUi5DH01r7ZNvAHwpvX7UK.jpg','2015-08-28',120,'Released','Prayer is a Powerful Weapon','War Room',323272,4.8344,7.9,'mIl-XY9t_Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39402,_binary '\0','/n1RohH2VoK1CdVI2fXvcP19dSlm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3833480',6.9,48733,'en','The Outpost','A small unit of U.S. soldiers, alone at the remote Combat Outpost Keating, located deep in the valley of three mountains in Afghanistan, battles to defend against an overwhelming force of Taliban fighters in a coordinated attack. The Battle of Kamdesh, as it was known, was the bloodiest American engagement of the Afghan War in 2009 and Bravo Troop 3-61 CAV became one of the most decorated units of the 19-year conflict.','/saN1UywIQMQNXYx2ag9j2tPwaVl.jpg','2020-06-24',123,'Released','The mission was survival.','The Outpost',531876,8.6732,6.9,'f4LM9a02q9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39403,_binary '\0','/39KhoUC6UA451ygjyncb26ovEUi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3833520',7,2551,'en','Jack of the Red Hearts','A teenage con artist tricks a desperate mother into hiring her as a live-in companion for her autistic daughter.','/40NhRnY2p6hyUiAvWd2aNiNEl9p.jpg','2016-02-26',102,'Released',NULL,'Jack of the Red Hearts',342464,2.3847,7.1,'BuBGuv0uf14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39404,_binary '\0','/2pd2uIvfmVXiAgBPQIAgUuGvVM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3833822',7.3,3646,'en','Daft Punk Unchained','Daft Punk Unchained is the first film about the pop culture phenomenon that is Daft Punk, the duo with 12 million albums sold worldwide and seven Grammy Awards. Throughout their career Thomas Bangalter and Guy-Manuel de Homem-Christo have always resisted compromise and the established codes of show business. They have remained determined to maintain control of every link in the chain of their creative process. In the era of globalisation and social networks, they rarely speak in public and neither do they show their faces on TV. This documentary explores this unprecedented cultural revolution revealing a duo of artists on a permanent quest for creativity, independence and freedom.','/cZhguyhaCAcRCSEn1QUHPCDSKzk.jpg','2015-06-24',85,'Released',NULL,'Daft Punk Unchained',346401,2.4685,7.2,'7nRYZK20i2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39405,_binary '\0','/ow0fjNLTQeI8trA3oH3d1szqdl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38347292',7,1356,'en','Single on the 25th','After Nell’s family cancels holiday plans at the last minute, she decides to spend the week of Christmas having fun on her own — and crosses paths with her neighbor, who is “happily unattached.”','/5tYw1fstvTdpH6wInqY23oTIiiI.jpg','2025-12-07',84,'Released',NULL,'Single on the 25th',1545997,2.884,7.7,'8jm7ne3WYBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39406,_binary '\0','/pNs1xqone5M2bJ9PPUYcp8zA4Xo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38349049',7.5,1308,'bn','প্রজাপতি ২','Joy lives in London with his daughter. He wants his parents to stay with them in London, but his father, who runs a hotel in Kolkata, refuses to go to London.','/tPU0QGXdK26qDG886gstiP5HQPY.jpg','2025-12-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Projapati 2',940550,1.2504,4,'SdJgFAjY0Co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39407,_binary '\0','/uzwFejh6UlbeMh1EFqD1JIEbed3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3834956',4.3,1699,'ar','مهمة في تل ابيب','Amal lives in Paris and works as a spy for Israel. She repents and decides to repent. She uses the Egyptian ambassador to make an appointment with the Egyptian intelligence chief, whom she confesses. She agrees to be a double agent after she passes a polygraph. She is asked to travel to Tel Aviv to film a dangerous tape of Israeli weapons and strategic plans in case of war with Egypt from the Defense Ministry building. Amal\'s mission succeeds in smuggling the film. But Israeli intelligence discovers its deception. He received a kind of brutal torment, which Egyptian intelligence agents could smuggle from the hospital to Egypt.','/gRa9MSs9aOXRYhgJjukfoGvMKHx.jpg','1992-06-11',117,'Released',NULL,'Mission In Tel Aviv',332871,0.7885,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39408,_binary '\0','/7Whk4F7xQYF5eUwJp50Oa8GvpVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38350059',6.2,6419,'it','Buen Camino','Checco\'s life is a comfortable and luxurious one, and it couldn\'t be otherwise, considering he\'s the only son of Eugenio Zalone, a wealthy sofa manufacturer. Stranded by the pool in his luxurious villas, with an unspecified number of Filipinos serving him, a very young Mexican model as a girlfriend, and vacationing on his yacht with friends who share his passion for not wanting to work; it seems like a truly enviable life, considering he lacks nothing, absolutely nothing. Actually, no. Something is missing. It\'s his underage daughter, Cristal, named after the famous French sparkling wine, who has suddenly disappeared without a trace. Urgently summoned to Rome by his ex-wife, Linda, he finds himself facing the responsibilities of fatherhood for the first time, trying to find the girl—a very complicated task, considering he knows absolutely nothing about Cristal and her life.','/gYvlK73gKsJAaGjndyyiaZerEFb.jpg','2025-12-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Buen Camino',1472638,3.1327,6.287,'fi10nVislwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39409,_binary '\0','/fJ53qYWJTLOfI2x0csL1vVYfUpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3835080',5.1,25087,'en','31','Five carnival workers are kidnapped and held hostage in an abandoned, Hell-like compound where they are forced to participate in a violent game, the goal of which is to survive twelve hours against a gang of sadistic clowns.','/jHkIIkP4O0vUkSACcizOPZQIiF7.jpg','2016-09-15',102,'Released','Welcome to hell.','31',284564,3.3639,5.4,'_SBHFmLkF-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39410,_binary '\0','/mCA7ZzQyqPOlfpEi041JWy09Wgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38353198',7.3,2514,'kn','ವಲವಾರ','Amid the misty hills of Sakleshpur, Karnataka, Valavaara unfolds as a sweeping coming-of-age drama about brotherhood, loyalty, and the weight of responsibility. Kundeshi, a quiet boy from a struggling farming family, has always lived in the shadow of his younger brother, Kosudi - their father\'s clear favorite. When the boys take their pregnant cow out to graze, it vanishes into the countryside and tramples a neighbor\'s field, setting off a desperate search. With their father\'s return looming, Kundeshi must track down the animal before disaster strikes. His journey through rugged terrain and simmering family tensions forces him to confront his own insecurities and discover what it truly means to grow up. Lyrical and emotionally charged, Valavaara is a poignant portrait of rural childhood, responsibility, and the fragile bonds that hold families together.','/lJrUUot5rK5iq97iQbK1rvCHgPT.jpg','2025-12-05',113,'Released',NULL,'Valavaara',1623912,1.2637,6,'q95vVeOrjfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39411,_binary '\0','/elepOKWDoaHMKJPuOL0LAl1XXpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38353919',6.7,1246,'en','Three Wisest Men','Luke is expecting twins, Taylor is debating a life-changing job, and Stephan is planning a wedding — all while their mom is planning to put the family home up for sale.','/yTMNjavrgr6BrYSb3BN7gRXPBcV.jpg','2025-11-15',84,'Released','Gold, Frankincense, and Brenner','Three Wisest Men',1537084,2.0112,7.3,'165bKm1HfME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39412,_binary '\0','/lbQEafYg1HPmRQALqS6QKCdnB3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38354934',6.9,1383,'en','We Met in December','Two strangers meet on a layover and fall for one another — but forget to exchange numbers. The next day, they fly to Chicago separately, just miss each other, and “embark on separate quests to find one another.\"','/wJfUBJXLDBkDzLvFTj8hKqF6Xy3.jpg','2025-11-27',84,'Released',NULL,'We Met in December',1547918,2.356,6.9,'cRbwPoZ3D7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39413,_binary '\0','/9GnoKfvrLBmuAchlDzxAQmz1kzF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38354965',6.2,1379,'en','She\'s Making a List','Naughty or Nice inspector Isabel Haynes doesn’t anticipate anything out of the ordinary when she’s assigned to evaluate 11-year-old Charlie Duncan. However, soon, Isabel falls for Charlie’s widowed father Jason, which makes her question the rigid rules of her job. As Christmas approaches, Isabel must choose between following the holiday algorithm or following her heart.','/rpqNhO6PtTrBsuEh10O3rAVWDg1.jpg','2025-12-06',84,'Released',NULL,'She\'s Making a List',1516208,1.8896,6.8,'Ky-StLOMr1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39414,_binary '\0','/4sPWtENcuxkMWTt2EBqQPtWTeSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3835608',7.6,1973,'te','ఊహలు గుసగుసలాడే','Venky, who aspires to become a newsreader, must face the challenges posed by his boss, Uday. Things get worse when Uday seeks Venky\'s help to woo a girl in return for his desired post.','/mjdE0IHq06phpwnsRy8Fb8lA4wt.jpg','2014-06-20',131,'Released',NULL,'Oohalu Gusagusalade',280548,0.9639,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39415,_binary '\0','/2pHCO95Lgp0FTN0P4ZxJHDOzukV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38365045',5.7,1879,'zh','泥娃娃','Hsu-Chuan, who works at a game company, accidentally brings home a broken clay doll from a haunted house while developing a new horror VR game. Unexpectedly, his pregnant wife, Mu-Hua, a cultural relic restorer, develops an obsession with the doll and relentlessly tries to repair it. As strange things begin to happen in the house, Mu-Hua\'s condition deteriorates, and Hsu-Chuan, at his wits\' end, seeks help from a spiritual medium, Ah-Sheng. Meanwhile, the horrifying secret hidden behind the clay doll begins to surface.','/laxF5iCQbfSqjDIsoaBOJtz2C1N.jpg','2025-10-09',111,'Released',NULL,'Mudborn',1526650,6.2979,7.153,'I--CxbFKzPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39416,_binary '\0','/rmwyGjvG2SPox7jVudJXWu1YrQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3836512',4.8,11084,'en','Ratter','Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn\'t realize is that she\'s sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn\'t enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.','/vSwYyxa12OqcrVnW6qPGqIBFyh2.jpg','2015-01-24',80,'Released','At this moment someone could be listening... watching... recording...','Ratter',320048,2.6214,5.2,'8l6BwYMhyYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39417,_binary '\0','/9s2PNsFIRhJs0lzw7BikZsRK83e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38367304',6.8,1321,'en','Taylor Swift | The Official Release Party of a Showgirl','The exclusive world premiere of the music video \"The Fate of Ophelia\", along with behind-the-scenes footage from the music video shoot, brand new lyric videos, and Taylor Swift\'s personal reflections on songs from her 12th studio album, The Life of a Showgirl.','/j1N6ke2AnMBpri63lNy3mUmKLAY.jpg','2025-10-03',89,'Released',NULL,'Taylor Swift | The Official Release Party of a Showgirl',1548738,1.936,6.7,'9YOfEeMVR9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39418,_binary '\0','/3MguM8JHmKcAxPvncKtTzUo3Ndb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3836958',6.7,8289,'hi','शमिताभ','A mute, aspiring actor joins forces with a man who has a powerful voice. Together they take the film industry by storm, but will their egos get in the way?','/3D5FG0oceTEpgLrz1v8aFWja3wn.jpg','2015-02-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Shamitabh',323426,1.5313,6.008,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39419,_binary '\0','/aca5n9HCAkNcHvKEfy8eo7YCWWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3837196',6.6,1557,'ko','하이힐','Ji-wook is a virile detective with a reputation, but deep down in his heart, he always considered himself as a woman and finally decides to get a transsexual operation. However, his plan falls apart as vicious gang members start their revenge on him.','/u45gBnx1FBgMccThUAFpoqOMBms.jpg','2014-06-01',125,'Released','I killed her in me.','Man on High Heels',267573,2.272,6.9,'OJA6GRDNuIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39420,_binary '\0','/4DdYcU8JplSPIgtfstqLQLvkQRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3838034',5.1,1973,'fr','Seuls','Five kids wake up in a world where everybody has disappeared.','/6VjlQBcM5573XopM07a07dsI6BM.jpg','2017-02-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Alone',420950,1.5027,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39421,_binary '\0','/xxlrS9wjrvElMVoUkF2KCd8zSBp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3838728',5.4,3764,'fr','Bang Gang (une histoire d\'amour moderne)','Biarritz. Sixteen-year-old George, the high school hottie, falls in love with Alex. To get his attention, she initiates a group game with Alex, Nikita, Laetitia and Gabriel. They will discover, test, and push the limits of their sexuality.','/1F2SDyc8eZVqbZZo6kORJsfGcyT.jpg','2015-08-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Bang Gang (A Modern Love Story)',327040,1.5215,5,'IffkNbVBl8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39422,_binary '\0','/oOVWuXkxQRYwUpd0Jg7QVxlMd2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3838992',4.3,16742,'en','Yoga Hosers','Two teenage yoga enthusiasts team up with a legendary man-hunter to battle with an ancient evil presence that is threatening their major party plans.','/cc40P3lKEiK0H8ZSd8hmBBI0HEV.jpg','2016-07-08',88,'Released','Do your \'wurst...','Yoga Hosers',290825,4.4187,4.7,'AAK0u60D66w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39423,_binary '\0','/8BhdR1eqbIO6RxIg2EN279EK9BR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38394613',7.2,1419,'ta','ரைட்','A desperate father searching for his missing son finds himself trapped inside a police station when a mysterious entity seals the station building, forcing those within to confront their secrets as a deadly game.','/yA3g7UZeYkku6kfmrbikZ745PTQ.jpg','2025-09-26',120,'Released',NULL,'Right',1551138,1.1976,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39424,_binary '\0','/iYXLgv5NjRn00nyYahnkdaXCm6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3839880',6.2,12917,'en','Infinity Chamber','A man trapped in an automated prison must outsmart a computer in order to escape and try and find his way back to the outside world that may already be wiped out.','/mSrHOslaoLifXW2wOPbVfwjg7x3.jpg','2016-12-03',103,'Released','Justice is automated. Your fate is secure.','Infinity Chamber',428948,1.9203,6.3,'TJtoRyVTJ_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39425,_binary '\0','/vHH5dhK0dYJQROX211GWu4bAkO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3839906',7,2333,'fa','شیار ۱۴۳','Olfat is raising her children in hardship. She has one daughter and one son called Yonos who works in Kerman copper mine. One day, she finds a note at home with this massage \"My friends and I are going to enter the war as soldiers\". After reading this note, Olfat and his friend\'s parents got worried about their sons. When operation Valfajr failed, they received news about Yonos\'s friend. Olfat is waiting for her son too. As she finds out that the Iraqi radio announces the Iranian captives\' names, she ties a radio on her back and carries it everywhere.','/atl0RkMnjn8uXHqdYebMWzqeSzn.jpg','2014-11-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Track 143',309321,1.0094,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39426,_binary '\0','/vkzeh2G7Gwapo4J1eqGWRph2hCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3841424',7.8,49811,'da','Under sandet','In the days following the surrender of Germany in May 1945, a group of young German prisoners of war is handed over to the Danish authorities and subsequently sent to the West Coast, where they are ordered to remove the more than two million mines that the Germans had placed in the sand along the coast. With their bare hands, crawling around in the sand, the boys are forced to perform the dangerous work under the leadership of a Danish sergeant.','/7TOYH2VDnYbXpBKlrkdQZUSC3Du.jpg','2015-12-03',100,'Released','They survived the second World War, now they must survive the cleanup','Land of Mine',335578,4.4395,7.8,'4Kao3t0NBMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39427,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3841866',6,2106,'es','Felices 140','A group of friends and family reunite at the fancy new holiday home of a woman who is about to turn 40.','/zH1qx4R9npBTbCUyl2m4jd7di4K.jpg','2015-04-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Happy 140',327383,0.914,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39428,_binary '\0','/3rQj2EGEPk821lxqxyRV6qk7jID.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38428491',6.4,1245,'kn','Love U Muddu','Love you Muddu is a Romantic drama film starring Siddu N, Rajesh Nataranga and reshmaa L.','/1c400UHZu3aqRPqOZlcHm7crliB.jpg','2025-11-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Love U Muddu',1581326,0.8185,4.5,'dRJn9hycQxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39429,_binary '\0','/vxbu74eYk6gf30vp4arFrR6D4bo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38428591',6.3,2766,'ta','வட்டகானல்','Kathiravan raises three orphans—Sathya, Surya, and Shiva—as his own, grooming them to unknowingly support his illegal mushroom drug empire. Despite being used as pawns, the trio remains loyal out of love. After killing his former boss and seizing control of the business, Kathiravan earns the wrath of Radha, the boss’s widow, who plots revenge. Meanwhile, Varsha, a local woman and love interest of Sathya, plans to transfer her estate to its workers. Threatened by this, Kathiravan manipulates the employees, turning them against her. As Varsha’s life hangs in the balance, Sathya and Radha must confront Kathiravan—leading to a climactic reckoning.','/kU7x4Ki24zE6i8sFluM6Xf9mcg3.jpg','2025-11-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Vattakhanal',1551992,0.7006,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39430,_binary '\0','/4VJv4v6sdATCxvu3UDdHOYcumhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3843088',7.9,1460,'bn','আসা যাওয়ার মাঝে','Set in the crumbling environs of Calcutta, Labour of Love is a lyrical unfolding of two ordinary lives suspended in the duress of a spiralling recession.','/4CyVgbl4FCebAHfYMyyf7hk9aJ7.jpg','2015-06-26',81,'Released',NULL,'Labour of Love',292391,1.0999,6.8,'PFObwB9TAwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39431,_binary '\0','/8cAtMxn5unNCpuVQ318d4Uf4jUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3844362',6.1,18184,'en','The Overnight','Alex, Emily, and their son, RJ, are new to Los Angeles. A chance meeting at the park introduces them to the mysterious Kurt, Charlotte, and Max. A family “playdate” becomes increasingly interesting as the night goes on.','/8DDEGc6vifxxYdkym3G99AMlITG.jpg','2015-06-19',79,'Released','Get into the swing of things','The Overnight',308024,4.327,5.94,'xq2MhdSqX7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39432,_binary '\0','/7g7A8N2witZmN0OjsdV7IjBHvrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3844876',5.8,2493,'en','The Legend of Ben Hall','Ben Hall is drawn back into bushranging by the reappearance of his old friend John Gilbert. Reforming the gang, they soon become the most wanted men in Australian history.','/AnG9xnxkRNeva4J0PwPBYUwWyn5.jpg','2016-12-01',139,'Released','Legends never die','The Legend of Ben Hall',425774,2.2099,6,'2gY7Je_sQU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39433,_binary '\0','/19arxyeA6qoK1lhk4rQ98rWFvMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3844962',4.7,1243,'en','Dead Body','Nine high school kids celebrate graduation at a secluded home in the wilderness. They fight, philander, and feel nostalgic as they embark on a life away from home, in college. Once the party dies down they play a game: Dead Body. But when one party-goer takes the game too far, actually murdering the other guests one by one, it\'s up to the group to set aside their tensions, and ferret out the murderer before it\'s too late.','/hI4sNhgBIaqYEkHs19S0NwONcHP.jpg','2017-10-17',85,'Released','Nine friends. One cabin. No witnesses.','Dead Body',375580,0.7971,5.1,'PjT8bGNS7gA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39434,_binary '\0','/x4Am9WtOSxEsfeBqU216n7ZA7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3845670',6.1,9038,'ko','서울역','When a zombie virus erupts from Seoul Station, a young woman fights to survive on the streets while her boyfriend and father track her down.','/4O9pQggt8V7a9g6brsyZx2zEHRj.jpg','2016-08-17',92,'Released','It all started here.','Seoul Station',389868,3.3401,6.534,'8ixcvYnaLP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39435,_binary '\0','/mrYoBknZhVI7jMsEe4nbbHLgLKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38457052',6.1,4713,'en','Aileen: Queen of the Serial Killers','Aileen Wuornos remains a rarity: a female serial killer. From childhood abuse to death-row revelations, this documentary revisits her life and crimes.','/iBCorGTwpXhIOeWwTA21HC5Rprx.jpg','2025-10-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Aileen: Queen of the Serial Killers',1550569,4.8031,6.917,'cN0PebFoXyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39436,_binary '\0','/5e1J5ujqAmsTb3dbGR9wtfgtS54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3845822',7,1320,'nl','De Boskampi\'s','Rik and his dad Paul are bullied by the kids in their neighbourhood. Rik wishes his dad would be tougher. Inspired by a mafia movie he saw on TV, Rik fantasizes about being the son of a mafia boss. Everybody would show him respect. So when his dad is promoted and they move to a new town, Rik decides to tell everybody his dad really is a Mafia boss - but what happens when his lies turn against him?','/gGmD5EBTLV8VWuwYcTQFC2vcI32.jpg','2015-04-29',102,'Released',NULL,'The Little Gangster',332349,1.0729,7.015,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39437,_binary '\0','/c12dMn87U7i1IY2pPdgc9lTZUZi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3845960',7.7,1760,'en','Cocaine Cowboys: Reloaded','In the 1980s, ruthless Colombian cocaine barons invaded Miami with a brand of violence unseen in this country since Prohibition-era Chicago. Cocaine Cowboys is the true story of how Miami became the drug, murder and cash capital of the United States. But it isn\'t the whole story - Pulling from hundreds of hours of additional interviews and recently uncovered archival news footage, Cocaine Cowboys has been RELOADED: packed with footage and stories that have never been told about Griselda Blanco, the Medellín Cartel, and Miami\'s Cocaine Wars, with firsthand accounts by hit man Jorge \'Rivi\' Ayala, cocaine trafficker Jon Roberts, smuggler Mickey Munday, and others. Cocaine Cowboys: Reloaded recreates Miami\'s Cocaine Wars like you\'ve never experienced it.','/uixZKF7KcVhdLfcWfYggnODmeQO.jpg','2014-04-08',152,'Released','How Miami became the cocaine capital of the United States!','Cocaine Cowboys: Reloaded',314407,0.9221,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39438,_binary '\0','/iG9eFJvbBCgVgikoDlLV91URbxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3846334',6.9,1221,'es','Gilda: no me arrepiento de este amor','The life and death of the tropical singer Gilda.','/weRetbMsMr0NjTHYCuKWPcWgwCZ.jpg','2016-09-15',118,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Gilda',416680,1.9983,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39439,_binary '\0','/hItxQ4gE3Eu7vq4HKw78y9YG8AS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38466379',6.2,5061,'en','My Father, the BTK Killer','Raised by a man leading a monstrous double life, the daughter of the BTK serial killer shares her chilling story.','/47EblKlcEQ4lHdTVnay4P1d6thf.jpg','2025-10-09',94,'Released',NULL,'My Father, the BTK Killer',1550785,4.3917,6.7,'XjS3CIJ8zFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39440,_binary '\0','/xXhta1NIKn09IXy0mfp68cabdWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3846674',7,143098,'en','To All the Boys I\'ve Loved Before','Lara Jean\'s love life goes from imaginary to out of control when her secret letters to every boy she\'s ever fallen for are mysteriously mailed out.','/hKHZhUbIyUAjcSrqJThFGYIR6kI.jpg','2018-08-17',100,'Released','The letters are out.','To All the Boys I\'ve Loved Before',466282,12.4025,7.6,'555oiY9RWM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39441,_binary '\0','/cclFrieHULgbuCovZHIeOZ58DLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3847642',4.1,1776,'en','Kill Order','A troubled high school student discovers the truth behind his hidden abilities.','/7GsmOsf7M7jUhrav17l3Vx2ekIR.jpg','2017-11-06',77,'Released',NULL,'Kill Order',487620,2.2113,5.2,'6td9nmtQjVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39442,_binary '\0','/vQkIAFCtxLrkWk6S2LeTrvx5nJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3848888',4.8,3430,'hi','The Shaukeens','Three friends in their 60s try to do everything that they couldn\'t do in their younger days - before death arrives.','/hAAzlXKdYtheXSVrWQKTQ6Dy0oR.jpg','2014-11-07',124,'Released',NULL,'The Shaukeens',297019,1.0927,4.481,'xfGt3qCJEXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39443,_binary '\0','/39kYR86XoJId5RBtuYjZzkNQty1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3848892',7.9,63679,'hi','Baby','A nascent elite team of the Indian intelligence system perpetually strives to detect and eliminate terrorists and their plots. Officer Ajay leads his team to destroy one such potentially lethal ploy in their biggest operation yet.','/mcCAHyv4kuVJ7oYrgMpYvVPdLyf.jpg','2015-01-23',160,'Released','History is made by those who give a damn','Baby',314389,2.6146,6.8,'-Yu_2nyOP5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39444,_binary '\0','/nfigXYjs8j1Esmfo7ha2jGvxI2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3848938',3.7,2571,'hi','Mr. X','After an explosion at a chemical factory gives him the power of invisibility, a former officer of the law becomes a vigilante in order to take revenge on those who have wronged him.','/uNaJnX3LDy6E2HvR50mgQ53Qvu2.jpg','2015-04-17',125,'Released',NULL,'Mr. X',329909,1.0824,4.92,'5nCicl_EFnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39445,_binary '\0','/maqWuGL2ACUowMVq30MrAD12a7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3849692',4.3,2431,'en','Operator','When the daughter of veteran 911 call center operator Pamela, and her estranged husband Jeremy, a Senior Police Officer, is kidnapped and held hostage, they are left desperate, with no choice but to follow the kidnapper\'s rules: send messages through dispatch for all police and fire units to scatter to remote locations throughout the city where they are met with chaos. Not knowing who or why, they must race against the clock to make the choice of their lives: save the city — or save their daughter.','/6XHpAyRg8KikNG3gZnAM5vE7hsw.jpg','2015-08-21',88,'Released','Whats your emergency?','Operator',362185,2.099,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39446,_binary '\0','/fPjsLSiD8iXhLX3PaR8USs5Cxkh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3849938',6.4,1432,'de','Ostwind 2','Summer vacation. Mika is overjoyed to see Windstorm again. But then she discovers strange wounds on the belly of Windstorm, for which no one has an explanation. Yet this is Kaltenbach verge of bankruptcy! With a heavy heart Mika decides to participate in a variety tournament in which beckons a high prize money. But during training affects Windstorm distracted, often he runs away easily. Mika pursued the black stallion until deep into the forest and is quite surprised: From the thicket a seemingly magical gray mare appears and the two horses dance around lovingly. Suddenly, a strange boy named Milan appears, who says the mare had escaped him. He claimed that he could Help Mika to win the tournament. But is there still time to save Kaltenbach?','/8OBjiVZwjGlYDMG5bGmtJkdpr6B.jpg','2015-05-14',103,'Released',NULL,'Windstorm 2',334354,2.835,7.3,'5BLVqhUtLCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39447,_binary '\0','/4Yihb0wD1Jd2sQtNrKo9TOs8S3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3850214',7.2,92315,'en','Dope','Malcolm is carefully surviving life in a tough neighborhood in Los Angeles while juggling college applications, academic interviews, and the SAT. A chance invitation to an underground party leads him into an adventure that could allow him to go from being a geek, to being dope, to ultimately being himself.','/n6u00imN7AX2NiyWUc5kTgHXmEf.jpg','2015-06-19',103,'Released','It\'s hard out here for a geek.','Dope',308639,5.122,7.041,'jzm-SwQfYqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39448,_binary '\0','/zjWtaInjqJ88LOCUpvqdH0w6gUQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38504130',6.8,2968,'pa','ਗੋਡੇ ਗੋਡੇ ਚਾਅ 2','In a vibrant Punjabi village, women take charge of wedding festivities once dominated by men. Their spirited struggle to preserve this newfound power leads to comic chaos, as the sidelined men plot to reclaim their former glory—only to be outsmarted at every turn.','/ixaCAzYYO8NzYwJUg6v7Dy7qfxx.jpg','2025-10-22',150,'Released',NULL,'Godday Godday Chaa 2',1554048,1.1405,0,'JyuQkMRg32U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39449,_binary '\0','/yUddY9gsx4xFyJ145VFMHRWgZEb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38504137',7.1,4020,'de','Babo - Die Haftbefehl-Story','Personal interviews with Haftbefehl and those closest to him reveal the story behind the German rap icon as he takes a brutally honest look at his life.','/nFoKuQj5O4XJ8t0O0pQ4TJ5WR5G.jpg','2025-10-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Babo: The Haftbefehl Story',1557993,3.0569,6.7,'7_17zRLHE24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39450,_binary '\0','/ja84ZZwiwNuUIc8IobIn0WCPHYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3850496',6.6,3841,'en','Chronic','David is a nurse who works with terminally ill patients. Dedicated to his profession, he develops strong relationships with the people he cares for. But outside of work, it\'s a different story altogether.','/4ba59xT5lZ5AXApL6xPhGqn7LUq.jpg','2015-10-21',93,'Released','The last patient','Chronic',337104,1.924,5.873,'ZcDYv0Zoke0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39451,_binary '\0','/h3X1YZXNeklLNKRVOS6DHGRosog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3850590',6.2,95424,'en','Krampus','When his dysfunctional family clashes over the holidays, young Max is disillusioned and turns his back on Christmas. Little does he know, this lack of festive spirit has unleashed the wrath of Krampus: a demonic force of ancient evil intent on punishing non-believers.','/sAolMRD9rFSTU7tssfFuLEJJa7w.jpg','2015-11-26',98,'Released','You don\'t want to be on his list.','Krampus',287903,7.4418,6.206,'h6cVyoMH4QE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39452,_binary '\0','/9tmP58zz7dfiBwVe5seTLCykQGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3850798',6.2,1341,'mr','लय भारी','Sumitra travels to Pandharpur to find a ray of hope, after Sangram killed her husband and son and took over their business.','/knRrQBBsDiFPPzENpHXU9eQgxGq.jpg','2014-07-11',158,'Released',NULL,'Lai Bhaari',304274,1.4335,6.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39453,_binary '\0','/k8p6fA6YPvEcqmvbCuBQKmbIT3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38525492',6.8,10444,'hi','Bhagwat - Chapter One: Raakshas','A seemingly simple case of a missing girl, Poonam, puts Inspector Vishwas Bhagwat on a chase to find the culprit behind a sinister trail of disappearing girls. What happens next?','/hXVDG74ykzadnIHtPpV8eZWwtZB.jpg','2025-10-17',128,'Released','When the predator meets the protector, the real game begins!','Bhagwat - Chapter One: Raakshas',1554037,1.3082,6.885,'7uBy1gkgWxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39454,_binary '\0','/d7wGFF8LtsLfXUy8X2i3p2ojO9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3853452',6.1,2468,'ja','暗殺教室','A mysterious creature destroys part of the moon and then warns that, if it is not destroyed before March of the following year, Earth will be next. It also demands to become the homeroom teacher of Class E, a third-year class at Kunugigaoka High School.','/h752DXxIvf4diBtnVd6JRQCm0OV.jpg','2015-03-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Assassination Classroom',349176,3.7662,7.2,'fQtJgO1T_Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39455,_binary '\0','/ptISaxb6sZ5Jvt2r7An9hBbejQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3854234',7.3,3047,'es','El patrón, radiografía de un crimen','This incredibly disturbing story follows the exploitation of an apprentice butcher, Hermógenes, and his trial after he murders his boss in broad daylight. Hermógenes, a farmhand from northern Argentina, relocates to Buenos Aires in search of a better life for himself and his young wife, but soon finds himself at the mercy of a corrupt boss. The film is based on a thorough investigation of a real event that happened in Buenos Aires 10 years ago. Almost every scene in the film is inspired by real facts or based on well documented daily practices of the “meat business” and its environment. Both a shocking exposé of unscrupulous practices in the meat industry and a heart-wrenching personal story, El Patrón became one of the most successful Argentine films of 2014.','/tqM5b356wYON9VcIKUTOONRUL7P.jpg','2014-10-12',98,'Released','Until when is it possible to exploit a man?','The Boss: Anatomy of a Crime',314572,1.5213,7.5,'h2eV-cSMpIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39456,_binary '\0','/8p2VGTmBHKXjOZQJ9D1fT5Jr6qr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3855240',6.3,1872,'nl','Schone handen','Sylvia has turned a blind eye for too long to husband Eddie\'s flourishing drug business. When his dealing takes a (deadly) turn for the worse, however, her need to protect the lives and futures of her young children compel her to flee. But Eddie will stop at nothing to keep his wife inside the ‘family\'.','/68mACTcrUSy6CEIwBVkWlQnc03X.jpg','2015-09-10',100,'Released','Nobody leaves the family','Clean Hands',348315,1.0273,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39457,_binary '\0','/tzlgd1gzYxtzCfwoxT6lEls1v7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3856042',5.7,4289,'en','Bad Hair Day','Monica is desperate to be prom queen, but on the big night, her hair is an uncontrollable mess. Meanwhile, FBI agent Liz Morgan is on the hunt for a jewel thief who is looking for a stolen necklace, which Monica has in her possession. Soon, she and the agent chase the jewel thief, and she\'s whizzed on a wild adventure in the city.','/i1Vum1dbHkFVF0aqb1cNR0OSkD0.jpg','2015-02-13',90,'Released','The road to prom can be a big hairy mess.','Bad Hair Day',317198,4.3061,6.4,'6ZN_7CrnHB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39458,_binary '\0','/rDyXQbdm5ql8N1Gm2yf4Cirru1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3856408',7.6,2506,'en','Making Waves: The Art of Cinematic Sound','The history of cinematic sound, told by legendary sound designers and visionary filmmakers.','/jafF7jcl116rzohZydL1VfK1y2e.jpg','2019-10-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Making Waves: The Art of Cinematic Sound',595841,3.8879,6.9,'WsIE4x3xU0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39459,_binary '\0','/swelLWmdNwZVU403GG5L2pDtaaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38573318',4.4,1892,'ml','ഡോസ്','Bodies begin to pile up in a hospital meant to save lives, forcing a doctor with a troubled past to confront buried secrets when a woman from his past returns. As the investigation deepens, each revelation becomes more dangerous than the last.','/wuEQbDF5jHaOOAMGiXWmDRz9imG.jpg','2026-05-22',140,'Released',NULL,'Dose',1516529,1.5246,2,'_ZlWpPcMlig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39460,_binary '\0','/oqblGh9vRXFBV9Auu8St5i50njr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3858372',7.1,9006,'fr','Mune, le gardien de la lune','When a faun named Mune becomes the Guardian of the Moon, little did he had unprepared experience with the Moon and an accident that could put both the Moon and the Sun in danger, including a corrupt titan named Necross who wants the Sun for himself and placing the balance of night and day in great peril. Now with the help of a wax-child named Glim and the warrior, Sohone who also became the Sun Guardian, they go out on an exciting journey to get the Sun back and restore the Moon to their rightful place in the sky.','/fWjm8AH9YqkRUR2yf4y1mDIvj0O.jpg','2015-02-05',86,'Released',NULL,'Mune: Guardian of the Moon',323661,7.1735,7.3,'X-YuxDOO8pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39461,_binary '\0','/hktEE2DGrsZu5wdYO776YSrFE2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38589147',4.7,3162,'te','Chiranjeeva','What happens when one man starts seeing everyone’s future? A hilarious socio-fantasy ride filled with chaos, charm, and twists of fate!','/xVjBadMUMB2iHiUVtaUxZHGkFHY.jpg','2025-11-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Chiranjeeva',1576463,1.858,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39462,_binary '\0','/Ary1sG0AHn4V1DFrwV7g72Fomq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38589464',6.6,1926,'it','Non abbiam bisogno di parole','A teenager, the only hearing member of a deaf family, finds her voice and learns to believe in herself through her passion for singing.','/4Tf0qTA73XLhBnfP6YgvqtLZBnt.jpg','2026-04-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Feel My Voice',1620551,4.874,6.873,'jcDax7jiSqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39463,_binary '\0','/3jEuzzKf95v5e4GdTouBpyl6Dc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3859076',6.8,22843,'en','Truth','As a renowned producer and close associate of Dan Rather, Mary Mapes believes she’s broken the biggest story of the 2004 election: revelations of a sitting U.S. President’s military service. But when allegations come pouring in, sources change their stories, document authenticity is questioned, and the casualties begin to mount.','/qmpMRABYbQjgtxwJ6xMPc8KskzA.jpg','2015-10-16',125,'Released','Based on the story behind the story.','Truth',300693,4.3724,6.547,'3-9Y1kQYj5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39464,_binary '\0','/pHdCS3FerQhAklu2JDEgpIuv5fP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3859272',6,13840,'en','Tragedy Girls','McKayla and Sadie, two death-obsessed teenage girls, use their online show about real-life tragedies to send their small Midwestern town into a frenzy and cement their legacy as modern horror legends.','/3UgRc3vpOiW9HOAD7oBa16xQ21E.jpg','2017-10-20',98,'Released','Friends who slay together, stay together','Tragedy Girls',413857,6.1298,6,'3GmFP7pfz1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39465,_binary '\0','/57b4FmA9aSNE6wiL439DlKFS5TY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3859304',6.1,14608,'en','The Bronze','In 2004, Hope Ann Greggory became an American hero after winning the bronze medal for the women\'s gymnastics team. Today, she\'s still living in her small hometown, washed-up and embittered. Stuck in the past, Hope must reassess her life when a promising young gymnast threatens her local celebrity status.','/Ah2nD3Kml59svErVsz6DUsxlJ8.jpg','2016-01-22',108,'Released','There\'s no place like third.','The Bronze',308453,4.3951,6,'f_1D9wSeVsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39466,_binary '\0','/jtYhUNYtx4LXdCUiFFjUL9yDzSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3859310',5.7,13387,'en','How to Talk to Girls at Parties','In 1970s London, a teenage outsider named Enn falls in love with a rebellious alien girl named Zan, who has come to Earth for a party. Together, they navigate the complexities of intergalactic culture and the trials of first love.','/v6mPfyGshwXd1R6kQlMEyZ8Zu2s.jpg','2017-10-06',103,'Released','Some girls are out of this world.','How to Talk to Girls at Parties',341689,5.1569,6,'cUzWGT3L34w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39467,_binary '\0','/yiFXlhZpUcRbs6io14UAF8i1SDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3859980',5.7,13887,'hi','मोहेंजो डरो','During the Indus valley civilization, an Indigo farmer strives for the justice and protection of the city of Mohenjo-Daro and its civilians from an evil politician.','/3k4ESzzPCQHwjPYJoI489Fk2jZc.jpg','2016-08-11',176,'Released',NULL,'Mohenjo Daro',402672,2.2689,6.1,'UPZ5FKEB02I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39468,_binary '\0','/7YtpumXXnVSQOgqAKQDeDeieF7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3860294',5.6,1373,'it','Ogni maledetto Natale','Massimo Marinelli Lops and Giulia Colardo meet by chance in Rome and fall in love. Giulia asks Massimo to spend Christmas Eve with her family.','/nfPHGoD5LawbLgDYrJD7GqguExb.jpg','2014-11-27',96,'Released',NULL,'Ogni maledetto Natale',306523,0.9027,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39469,_binary '\0','/tiIpajUBpLMNWMEzpjRBxo0jCbD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3860916',6.3,53253,'en','Cargo','After being infected in the wake of a violent pandemic and with only 48 hours to live, a father struggles to find a new home for his baby daughter.','/cdPSUck4tBRvRu6DFk6XciDrssn.jpg','2017-10-06',105,'Released','The future is fragile.','Cargo',425972,4.1105,6.4,'W5QJW0M5pik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39470,_binary '\0','/5tFt6iuGnKapHl5tw0X0cKcnuVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3861390',6.2,89307,'en','Dumbo','A young elephant, whose oversized ears enable him to fly, helps save a struggling circus, but when the circus plans a new venture, Dumbo and his friends discover dark secrets beneath its shiny veneer.','/A7XkpLfNH0El2yyDLc4b0KLAKvE.jpg','2019-03-27',112,'Released','Soar to new heights.','Dumbo',329996,9.9605,6.583,'7NiYVoqBt-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39471,_binary '\0','/1s1r4OOdnU8VX2inALVTA2q94uY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38626703',7.1,1499,'ko','왕과 사는 남자','In a remote mountain village of 15th-century Joseon, humble headman Heung-do hears a rumor that any village hosting an exiled nobleman will be blessed with abundance and fortune. Hoping to bring prosperity to his impoverished community, he eagerly submits a petition to host one—unaware that his guest is none other than the fallen monarch, deposed boy-king Danjong.','/3CnVA1jAA64Q3qNVAW8DekCu19b.jpg','2026-02-04',117,'Released','1457 Joseon, a story untold by history.','The King\'s Warden',1321179,8.5764,7.2,'YOWP0DiW8po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39472,_binary '\0','/dFdLszJppFerIo1UrLo7pl7fqmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3862750',5.6,12065,'en','The Perfect Guy','With a fulfilling career and a loving relationship, lobbyist Leah Vaughn seems to have it all. Things come crashing down when Dave, her long-term boyfriend, disagrees with her future plans for marriage and a family. The resulting painful breakup leaves Leah heartbroken, until she meets the charming and handsome Carter Duncan. Soon, the budding romance turns dangerous as Carter reveals his volatile nature, forcing Leah to break up with the man she thought was Mr. Right. She soon realizes that Carter doesn\'t want to let her go.','/k1U3ROFFCVbu9H63lKYMbXEHeJI.jpg','2015-09-11',100,'Released','Trust one, fear the other.','The Perfect Guy',304372,4.4446,5.7,'CikoxQ4ytI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39473,_binary '\0','/bBFOFiL40TEv5fZ9waigXmoR6Yr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3863484',6.9,3556,'en','King Jack','Growing up in a rural town filled with violent delinquents, Jack has learned to do what it takes to survive, despite having an oblivious mother and no father. After his aunt falls ill and a younger cousin comes to stay with him, the hardened 15-year-old discovers the importance of friendship, family, and looking for happiness even in the most desolate of circumstances.','/mguFl12DkIljwp8Kal04q04FeLw.jpg','2015-04-17',81,'Released',NULL,'King Jack',330916,1.3404,6.347,'R9wvSLoUsFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39474,_binary '\0','/n9QCm8uagvmXH476u5qFQsW8HkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3863552',8.1,113673,'hi','बजरंगी भाईजान','A young mute girl from Pakistan loses herself in India with no way to head back. A devoted man with a magnanimous spirit undertakes the task to get her back to her motherland and unite her with her family.','/vhlliI7HZZlWfo5d6CiyfBAGLrW.jpg','2015-07-17',159,'Released',NULL,'Bajrangi Bhaijaan',348892,3.7656,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39475,_binary '\0','/vSJfVy4jyJ7ETF8HbAdOFX8QyCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3863870',6.1,2706,'de','Ich bin dann mal weg','Based on the book \"Ich bin dann mal weg\" by Hape Kerkeling where the author describes his journey on the Way of St. James, a pilgrimage route, and the people he encounters there.','/mfALps3CfdqpK5gOtnFTzfQbrE3.jpg','2015-12-24',92,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Off Then',361403,1.832,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39476,_binary '\0','/ldTZHMPQV9T3bAFvwmj5zur481F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3864024',5.5,9707,'en','Lazer Team','Four losers are thrust into the position of saving the world when they stumble upon a UFO crash site and become genetically equipped to the battle suit on board.','/obySpAUFzBBhP86miJnreeGUEtR.jpg','2016-01-27',102,'Released','Mankind\'s darkest hour needs our brightest team.','Lazer Team',279096,2.0112,5.5,'KI6DD6SulPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39477,_binary '\0','/lXSJETt0cbiemixfHuBpopAg8pT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3864056',6.4,30462,'en','The Goldfinch','A boy in New York is taken in by a wealthy family after his mother is killed in a bombing at the Metropolitan Museum of Art. In a rush of panic, he steals \'The Goldfinch\', a painting that eventually draws him into a world of crime.','/5Jx9VyVPiK9GQ7ouKLkTUYnZSQ4.jpg','2019-09-12',149,'Released','The story of a stolen life.','The Goldfinch',472674,8.3691,7.1,'IcG06hZooHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39478,_binary '\0','/nxZDr6UZIhgYJev4yUzWTPZXQ3G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3864060',6.8,5620,'en','Unstoppable','With the unwavering love and support of his devoted mother Judy and the encouragement of his coaches, Anthony Robles fights through adversity to earn a spot on the Arizona State Wrestling team. But it will demand everything he has, physically and mentally, to achieve his ultimate quest to become an NCAA Champion.','/xanYKxuFkDPrMngvm1NSHVGOEjS.jpg','2024-12-06',123,'Released','Never give up.','Unstoppable',1101448,8.7891,5.3,'A3bRHILxH0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39479,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38651421',8.7,1292,'bn','হাঁটি হাঁটি পা পা','*Haati Haati Paa Paa* follows a young woman and her elderly father as they navigate love, duty, and loneliness in a changing world. It portrays the daughter’s struggle to care for her aging father, highlighting modern family conflicts and the deep, unspoken bond that transcends generations.','/uJBg5qG1nsqjJQAJZ1DUE1gv5GO.jpg','2025-11-28',124,'Released',NULL,'Haati Haati Paa Paa',1390095,0.899,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39480,_binary '\0','/mLxSEZV5UCl48SlYSZMcCrSGD28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38651971',8.9,4204,'mr','गोंधळ','Suman, the trapped wife in Maharashtra\'s Gondhal rituals, conspires with Gondhali Saheba to kill Anand\'s cousin. They carry out an escape that jeopardizes her soul amid drum-driven ritual and divine omens, blurring the distinction between salvation and damnation in a citywide verdict of fire, blood, and awe.','/j8yda2b6RD7NMlbV7NaUAj6hr5G.jpg','2025-11-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Gondhal',1576389,3.8485,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39481,_binary '\0','/vMQoRVN1M3xjEtiyatBatTmd68I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3865478',5.7,2156,'pl','11 minut','The lives of urbanites intertwine in a world where anything can happen at any time.','/qZ07UY5rEbvygj87YeOZElk7hDW.jpg','2015-09-02',83,'Released',NULL,'11 Minutes',314371,1.3895,5.5,'A14strYUETY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39482,_binary '\0','/nyzkDSnZzYfEYJVCwD8MGebnGPg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3867086',5.3,3287,'ar','صنع في مصر','The film revolves around three young men who face many problems and crises in their lives from unemployment to marriage plans and achieve their targets','/5jvDNUO9bgYMfmXgHfpV9ulRtkS.jpg','2014-07-28',102,'Released',NULL,'Made in Egypt',300568,1.0085,5.233,'0b-AAXxu9wE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39483,_binary '\0','/lcWOH5YqzE6d54kGSsP1npibYcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38672269',5.6,1541,'hi','Me No Pause Me Play','Me No Pause Me Play is a heartwarming and empowering story of women navigating life\'s transitions, rediscovering their strength, and redefining identity beyond age, delivering a powerful message of awareness and acceptance around menopause.','/nMItbnyJaH6mkxxCOpKIcOm18gS.jpg','2025-11-28',140,'Released',NULL,'Me No Pause Me Play',1590920,1.4139,0,'9yjdBQV1j7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39484,_binary '\0','/uVADYkJi5YpIEs0WW0yfXdCV1Oj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38672581',6,1290,'sv','Doktor Glas','The lonely doctor Gabriel Glas despises society\'s superficiality - until the fashion designer Helga enters his life. She\'s trapped in a destructive marriage, and Gabriel sees his chance to save her. Soon, they are caught in a web of lies, desire, and power. The deeper Gabriel is drawn into the relationship, the more moral boundaries he crosses - with catastrophic consequences.','/ZyGry1dnMmMnN7Zeyz783ko3XY.jpg','2026-02-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Doctor Glas',1592203,4.2401,7.5,'w5W2ZuBzlvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39485,_binary '\0','/w4aTYTHpm97iTN1UGIC9kFZIuc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38673135',8.9,1688,'en','Taylor Swift | The Eras Tour | The Final Show','Filmed at the end of Taylor Swift\'s record-breaking Eras Tour in Vancouver, B.C., this complete, in-depth 45-song concert includes the complete \'The Tortured Poets Department\' set and special mashups.','/c11km7kLK2F30fTNHP5Si9m8foG.jpg','2025-12-11',207,'Released','It was the end of an era, but the start of an age.','Taylor Swift | The Eras Tour | The Final Show',1562010,3.3675,7.932,'S1MO3bRG9qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39486,_binary '\0','/5MaWBfAxdlbsqDpq8mjCBNVoLM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38674977',6,2594,'ta','மேட் இன் கொரியா','A woman from a small town in Tamil Nadu moves to South Korea — a place she always dreamed of — but struggles to find her footing in a foreign land.','/n6gCKjagOFsU4arFngUq2QqR1jv.jpg','2026-03-12',113,'Released',NULL,'Made in Korea',1561687,4.0404,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39487,_binary '\0','/7cQjb8cRbRjF5tM5gOCnqsvC0iT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38681567',5.4,1804,'ta','ஸ்டீபன்','A psychiatrist evaluating a self-confessed serial killer unravels a twisted web of trauma, deceit, and psychological manipulation—only to question if the killer is truly guilty or just another victim in a larger, darker game.','/yUURUJzeSTc47T2VeNw7nZwZ8VJ.jpg','2025-12-05',124,'Released',NULL,'Stephen',1561955,2.7071,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39488,_binary '\0','/2D3W3Jp0VYsLhXTEfnvhbMvQEzk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38681832',5.9,3562,'pl','Kolory zła: Czerń','Investigating the disappearance of children in a remote Polish town, prosecutor Leopold Bilski must unravel a sinister local legend before it\'s too late.','/reeKdj7BSznr7wSGzAtIMrPFgKo.jpg','2026-06-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Colors of Evil: Black',1560681,7.0524,6.731,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39489,_binary '\0','/6HBbzW5D7StUBRi0yO6ZEq9rNB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38682795',5.2,2189,'zh','宗师叶问2','In 1950s Hong Kong, British merchants and Chinese triads have joined forces to expand their territory, forcibly demolishing factories without regard for public welfare. This move draws fierce opposition from Ip Man, standing up for the workers, he faces pressure from all sides. Framed for murder, he is sent to prison. Within the prison walls, the triads set multiple deadly traps. Can Ip Man overcome these trials, escape the danger, and clear his name?','/m3Low6jJrKXHSYFpXNkmYsG1Q6I.jpg','2026-07-22',94,'Released',NULL,'Ip Man: Kung Fu Legend',1628071,10.7625,6.9,'cqlZSRvH7BU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39490,_binary '\0','/eaknBFnMg8fPlwlegBaPtQfhyF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38693888',7,8962,'ta','யூத்','Youth follows Praveen, a 15-year-old boy who enters adolescence determined to find true love before school ends. As he goes through multiple relationships and heartbreaks, he slowly begins to understand what love truly means. Along the way, the experiences shape his growth, maturity, and outlook on life.','/odMKGyeC2rGuvr3Yy7S8txD0sFx.jpg','2026-03-19',141,'Released',NULL,'Youth',1542352,5.2653,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39491,_binary '\0','/3O0zf2AOwO4QziJFrvaIIAGSx6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3869392',2.8,1899,'en','Abandoned Dead','A security guard, trapped in a run-down inner-city medical clinic, is terrorized by supernatural forces which threaten to overtake her.','/z4PtlPsd4P4JD8UjraRPeb5smJV.jpg','2015-11-04',77,'Released',NULL,'Abandoned Dead',370664,1.551,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15: