ismissed as outdated, they decide to reinvent themselves. What begins as a daring YouTube channel sting soon spirals into danger, loss, and a shocking revelation—with twists and turns—all part of their bold second film. Their vision ultimately wins over the producer, marking the true beginning of their filmmaking journey.','/kqWfVxa6RO39EvtkZ7te3euWvXY.jpg','2025-10-31',118,'Released',NULL,'THADAI ATHAI UDAI',1562718,0.9512,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39496,_binary '\0','/4IrZC1uuaDpGScO4TDyEe4E4bq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3874544',6.3,161864,'en','The Boss Baby','A story about how a new baby\'s arrival impacts a family, told from the point of view of a delightfully unreliable narrator, a wildly imaginative 7 year old named Tim.','/9MsQJKe4cUAGxc7R2NGaFQLqOPc.jpg','2017-03-23',97,'Released','Born leader.','The Boss Baby',295693,7.8234,6.45,'Ud8j5GaqH3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39497,_binary '\0','/xtEjwbuALzw1Ci3lHgL3d7JrQy5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38747537',6.2,2256,'el','Καποδίστριας','The story of the statesman Ioannis Kapodistrias from his time as foreign minister of Russia all the way to Greece\'s independence in the 1820s.','/a0ltj3wSFURugiuTgQpYbJbTgLR.jpg','2025-12-25',128,'Released','Give me the homeland I desire.','Kapodistrias: The Governor',1593115,3.3274,4.2,'pYDMv5BtmWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39498,_binary '\0','/tDSynHH8SL1Fzd4U2PSxANwOWsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38748101',6.4,3007,'kn','ಮೋಡ ಕವಿದ ವಾತಾವರಣ','Moda Kavida Vaatavarana is a youthful romantic thriller centered around two couples who arrive at a scenic resort, each carrying their own emotional baggage and untold stories. As relationships are tested and unexpected connections emerge, a series of mysterious events unfold, leading to suspense, romance, humor, and surprising twists that change their lives forever.','/fnw5dlo8c1eWKMo5YMPkcA3vLCk.jpg','2026-06-26',120,'Released',NULL,'