e illusions collapse and human truths emerge.','/h6nITbbSobZ0EwU6Dcw6LGZOZYA.jpg','2026-03-21',153,'Released',NULL,'Bonolota Express',1542995,4.187,8.647,'ZTZUaHsfR8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39510,_binary '\0','/20DmwmWoXzbEWyGLOryIG0IqY71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt38798360',5.5,1455,'ta','Yellow','A corporate worker\'s impulsive decision to leave her desk job leads to a transformative solo adventure, where strangers become friends and comfort zones fade into distant memories.','/zC62Ps1vXYoxfrVu7u5RDK1SmyO.jpg','2025-11-21',136,'Released',NULL,'Yellow',1608032,1.7051,0,'Kkv1s-if_NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39511,_binary '\0','/tjo48bBTRicg4331EWMe1BWKZY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3881026',4.6,2625,'fi','Rendel','Rendel, a masked superhero, becomes blinded by his desire for revenge against a sinister criminal organization.','/tZiNrIRYblaJZE9m0M80IU1E2zP.jpg','2017-09-22',105,'Released','Revenge begets revenge.','Rendel',397852,2.393,5.5,'UOFsBeKKUcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39512,_binary '\0','/A6zWQZQblw6asm0SbryjeBjgCfw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3881680',6.2,5721,'en','Waffle Street','The true story of Jimmy Adams, a V.P. of a $30 billion hedge fund, who loses his job and winds up working as a waiter at a waffle shop. Amidst the greasy madness of the 24-hour diner, Jimmy befriends Edward, an ex-con grill master who serves up hard lessons about life, finance, and grits.','/cEwd2dCQogFt0oZpfnDwQ88x5wz.jpg','2015-09-24',86,'Released',NULL,'Waffle Street',386501,1.7067,6.1,'l4S_QCByqCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39513,_binary '\0','/9tVTKBCoEluEXtp06mTxJSUhLTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3881700',6.2,3068,'en','Kept Woman','Jessica and her fiancé Evan have just moved from the city into their dream home on a quiet suburban street. Soon after, Jessica catches her seemingly friendly new neighbor, Simon, in a strange lie and 