00000','tt3907858',6.2,2446,'it','Sei mai stata sulla luna?','Giulia is 30, single and working a high-end fashion job that allows her to travel and lead a dream life in Milan and Paris. However, a chance meeting with charming, down-to-earth farmer Renzo will makes her realize she\'s missing the most important thing in life—true love.','/fWRLpKGReqctrIBv2KGDciTryFW.jpg','2015-01-22',115,'Released',NULL,'Ever Been to the Moon?',320302,2.3578,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39583,_binary '\0','/zPzJ3DAUjpJoiBm4jODt50QEEr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3908142',6.3,24640,'en','The Love Witch','A modern-day witch uses spells and magic to get men to fall in love with her, with deadly consequences.','/q6mZjCwGn9KCTrStTRM88pui0is.jpg','2016-11-11',121,'Released','She loved men... to death','The Love Witch',374052,5.5364,6.4,'BbgGPdQ9Cqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39584,_binary '\0','/hPhobnkFyB4xg12wkAPAHc3uGDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3908598',6.3,2501,'en','Lamb','In the wake of a collapsed marriage and his father\'s death, David Lamb hopes to regain his own sense of goodness by focusing his attention on Tommie, an awkward and unpopular 11-year-old girl. Convinced he can help her avoid a destiny of apathy and emptiness, David takes her on a road trip from Chicago to the Rockies to initiate her into the beauty of the mountain wilderness. The journey shakes them in ways neither expects.','/aj0pgKR4dWlRRb1Q05JGQtwxHbj.jpg','2015-10-20',93,'Released','Innocence walks a fine line.','Lamb',324284,1.5073,6.1,'r0Hk_Dq9CLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39585,_binary '\0','/xAH5thNqiYe8BC4d6Kh4S0Yi16S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3908634',5.4,1395,'en','With This Ring','After attending their friend Elise\'s wedding to Nate on New Year\'s Eve, Trista, a career-­driven talent agent, Viviane, a successful gossip columnist, and Amaya, a struggling actress, make a pact to get married within the year to either a new love or a man waiting in the wings. But the close friends face their own set of challenges - Trista has not gotten over her commitment-­phobic ex-­boyfriend Damon, Viviane is secretly in love with Sean, the father of her son, and Amaya is desperate to break up her boyfriend Keith\'s unhappy marriage so they can live happily ever after. Each woman starts the year with high hopes and dreams of what will happen over the next 12 months... but will they all make it to the altar?','/9R48sYK97CSQXqFnh1tLCwyyyQ1.jpg','2015-01-24',105,'Released',NULL,'With This Ring',321160,1.6527,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39586,_binary '\0','/mIwAKve6nYXe9gSduC4Wwe9Unj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3909336',7.3,9616,'el','Ένας άλλος Κόσμος','Three separate narratives each following a love story between a foreigner and a Greek. Each story represents a different generation falling in love during a time of socioeconomic turmoil that dominates Southern Europe as a whole, only to connect as a single story in the end.','/3ZMfmZdGnt9J5ZGrSJfmc62ig31.jpg','2015-12-17',113,'Released',NULL,'Worlds Apart',350845,1.8655,6.5,'Le8xXf3xmqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39587,_binary '\0','/6RMG0sMxZdTJyXbCr0bK9o5uFif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3910416',6.6,1231,'en','Escape Artist','A socially and politically frustrated young man with a troubled past vents his frustrations through a social networking website and unwittingly sparks a revolutionary social movement.','/vNsVod94dzLNPKXlePnGoj4fhDN.jpg','2017-03-22',106,'Released','You\'re Being Lied To','Escape Artist',525482,1.0446,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39588,_binary '\0','/l437c1NjyPl6jL1qZla7WeUlxFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39105882',6.5,4485,'tr','D.I.S.C.O.','The operation, which has been carried out in secret by the D.I.S.C.O. intelligence agency for a long time, fails because of Agent Ertan. Ertan, who was suspended from the organization, goes on vacation with his wife Seda. Here, the path crosses with Bandırma Hair Dryer First Zafer and his wife Aynur. Zafer, who learned about Ertan\'s profession, has only one condition to be silent. To finish Ertan\'s unfinished operation together. Because the organization that the organization is after is in the same hotel and the fate of the operation is in the hands of Ertan. Ertan, who has never been a field agent in his life, embarks on the operation by having to include Zafer. The unexpected support of Seda and Aynur will change everything.','/jHXxVDqA130tXf8O20OHLDom4hD.jpg','2026-01-01',102,'Released',NULL,'D.I.S.C.O.',1555331,4.0767,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39589,_binary '\0','/qQGFziyXTWGP4YLajCxqCkvdHbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3910602',7.4,3977,'en','I Am Chris Farley','I am Chris Farley tells his hilarious, touching and wildly entertaining story - from his early days in Madison, Wisconsin, to his time at Second City and Saturday Night Live, then finally his film career (which included hits like Tommy Boy and Black Sheep). The film showcases his most memorable characters and skits from film and television and also includes interviews and insights from his co-stars, family and friends - including the likes of Christina Applegate, Dan Aykroyd, Mike Myers, Bob Odenkirk, Bob Saget and Adam Sandler.','/kljSSGgT4bHsL3Ivou5akIcWSrr.jpg','2015-07-27',96,'Released',NULL,'I Am Chris Farley',345944,2.7366,7.09,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39590,_binary '\0','/mnJKjl0FwI81pIoRVlIqrb9Fal4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3910736',4.1,3507,'en','Gun Shy','A mega-platinum, aging rock star\'s supermodel wife is abducted by pirates while vacationing in Chile.','/ugzaRtgrf2MBCUawgiE6xayXXIE.jpg','2017-09-08',91,'Released','Rock Out with Your Glock Out','Gun Shy',430682,3.7714,4.6,'nE1BqKC02Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39591,_binary '\0','/wrAf9aoLHCybHRT0F9XhqdFppqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3910814',6,3508,'en','All We Had','A mother struggles to make a better life for her daughter.','/fnOb1xstKaHY6IR3ujPPobGR6DX.jpg','2016-12-09',105,'Released',NULL,'All We Had',389630,3.7372,5.505,'Sl90LWbuyVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39592,_binary '\0','/578jrGVEN4a5rxJGtkt9sMI2w6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39108319',7.3,2609,'te','ఇరుముడి','An alcoholic with a violent past—living peacefully with his daughter beside a waterfall—decides to take Ayyappa Deeksha (a 41-day spiritual vow and period of intense austerity) at her request.','/dVFtTKMWW1aq7aWq30wjwOP6W3J.jpg','2026-08-20',152,'Released',NULL,'Irumudi',1441228,8.5756,6.5,'lqlYx4MdsAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39593,_binary '\0','/s9KTqzmvfdGwWKTT46MmcIoPpI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39109585',7,2234,'te','ఈశా','Four friends set out to challenge blind beliefs, only to be drawn into a mysterious spiritual encounter that changes their lives forever.','/87MhKILHPwcForDY0HxzII4tPvA.jpg','2025-12-25',127,'Released',NULL,'Eesha',1601310,1.4556,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39594,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39115096',6.4,3066,'fr','Nirvaagam Porupalla',NULL,NULL,NULL,129,'Released',NULL,'Nirvaagam Porupalla',1595283,0.4125,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39595,_binary '\0','/fug20H3qffP941XVDJCnpY61GVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39122419',6.7,1531,'ta','ஹேப்பி ராஜ்','A city romance meets a rural family invasion. What follows is chaos, comedy, and heartfelt moments. The story unfolds as a joyful entertainer that explores love, cultural clashes, and the importance of family bonds.','/8hmB6KNUFFzChYJxngIp063H2YR.jpg','2026-03-27',159,'Released',NULL,'Happy Raj',1518247,2.2469,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39596,_binary '\0','/dlYqT4INqj1mKI7OmFXHKN86as6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39122441',7.7,14739,'ta','ஜாக்கி','The film Jackie is based on the ancient goat fighting tradition of Madurai. In a village in Madurai, Ramar and Karthi enter their goats into a goat fight competition. Ramars goat wins the competition. Envious, Karthi tries to take revenge on Ramar and his goat, causing various troubles for Ramar. Ramar thwarts these attempts and protects his goat.','/69zi48P9NIwPq7qdssxQ8qqbBNG.jpg','2026-01-23',147,'Released',NULL,'Jockey',1552952,1.1524,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39597,_binary '\0','/yt7kUJ42heOePCPAdzvsAZP7lJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39130911',5,3651,'tr','Sonunda Sen','The funny story of Aslı, an advertising executive who doesn\'t want to be alone on Valentine\'s Day.','/mKxTnUGXtctAOzrfPUC3xWBqMsY.jpg','2026-03-27',91,'Released',NULL,'Love At Last',1582328,3.2704,5.286,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39598,_binary '\0','/1wruGeuequY1PumBfEgCEifpGb5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39131664',7,1264,'en','Kumail Nanjiani: Night Thoughts','After nearly a decade away, Kumail Nanjiani returns to Chicago, where he got his start in standup, in a new special that tackles anxiety, the perils of buying drugs pre-legalization, and most importantly, cat medication.','/qOvbKZHzBFQrmjmK9D0Lg7sz8co.jpg','2025-12-19',55,'Released',NULL,'Kumail Nanjiani: Night Thoughts',1529419,4.7423,7.2,'MACAGhfzxWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39599,_binary '\0','/mTO4LT6BlWNcnZqEh7I6XGmlLMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3913244',6.6,1630,'en','The Carer','Dorottya is a young Hungarian actress with a burning desire: to make it on the English stage. Legendary actor, Sir Michael Gifford suffers from an incurable disease, and has one desire: be left alone. When Dorottya becomes his carer they both hope their wish will be fulfilled.','/rp4ODEZ2MOfNktAbq0u2hu90Nvy.jpg','2016-08-05',89,'Released',NULL,'The Carer',399231,2.2346,6.6,'-Hu0duNTy4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39600,_binary '\0','/br4Ra4dRpvR0R7a1zPPkOwGkcky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39139925',8.2,72130,'hi','धुरंधर: द रिवेंज','As rival gangs, corrupt officials and a ruthless Major Iqbal close in, Hamza\'s mission for his country spirals into a bloody personal war where the line between patriot and monster disappears in the streets of Lyari.','/ov8vrRLZGoXHpYjSY9Vpv1tHJX7.jpg','2026-03-18',235,'Released','The story of the unknown men unfolds.','Dhurandhar: The Revenge',1582770,8.7526,7.3,'NHk7scrb_9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39601,_binary '\0','/n2WschLfgBrF2Dj0SkdCL94q2jC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39140662',6.7,6562,'en','Kidnapped: Elizabeth Smart','Elizabeth Smart\'s harrowing abduction at 14 from her family\'s Utah home unfolds through her own words and never-before-seen material in this documentary.','/8yuMPfz154d0PqX5PFXmgCCuTGd.jpg','2026-01-20',91,'Released',NULL,'Kidnapped: Elizabeth Smart',1595481,3.45,7.274,'suZtQp5Vmo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39602,_binary '\0','/5UbrkhiZRcQQYaRegdTIY0Hz9Rb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3914332',6.3,2898,'en','Dean','A comedy about loss, grief, and the redemptive power of love. Dean is a NY illustrator who falls hard for an LA woman while trying to prevent his father from selling the family home in the wake of his mother\'s death.','/qnGl6lcpZEJ4L9e24FSfcCCTd95.jpg','2016-04-16',94,'Released','A comedy about tragedy.','Dean',305342,1.6443,5.8,'kvSsvigjLEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39603,_binary '\0','/7y8zWGEjs7tresw4Hzkkf4TdkcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39143902',6.4,17105,'en','Leviticus','Two teenage boys must escape a violent entity that takes the form of the person they desire most: each other.','/gnAsZvBygplNpp8PtjoTEYv3VPB.jpg','2026-06-17',88,'Released','It will never stop.','Leviticus',1564614,26.9652,6.8,'WXuK0vlFxII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39604,_binary '\0','/lIvkPPTAHBpKhifdczZH0s8eozB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39150120',6.8,2162,'en','The AI Doc: Or How I Became an Apocaloptimist','A father-to-be tries to figure out what is happening with all this AI insanity, and explores the most powerful technology humanity has ever created... and what\'s at stake if we get it wrong.','/A610QT1gWjhJ1dJrXP9qMm4JMLr.jpg','2026-03-27',105,'Released','The future is not automatic.','The AI Doc: Or How I Became an Apocaloptimist',1596335,5.8798,6.986,'xkPbV3IRe4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39605,_binary '\0','/l7HNjyfnxJRL22iyxcyAjukTjP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39150248',9.5,1739,'pa','The Great Punjab Robbery','Three robbers with strange names seize an ordinary bank in Punjab. No demands. No ransom. Just cryptic riddles sent to the cops, each one leading deeper into the mystery.','/a68I3uiB8HkpTIugUeUhpCLnStL.jpg','2026-08-07',165,'Released','How do you stop three robbers with no plan, no fear, and nothing to lose!','The Great Punjab Robbery',1657464,2.3528,6,'G58TCA0uVtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39606,_binary '\0','/v1qPfEjfrms7Xw8BrTU7HZnxJrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3915160',5.6,1384,'en','Back to Christmas','Saddened about spending another Christmas alone, Ali meets Ginny, a quirky and spunky woman, at a diner on Christmas Eve. Ali tells Ginny that she was to be married on New Year\'s Eve last year, but over the course of the holidays she and her fiancé unexpectedly split. When Ali explains that she would do everything differently if she could go back in time, Ginny tells her that \"sometimes people do get second chances.\" The following morning, Ali wakes up to find herself transported back to that Christmas before her planned wedding. While she sets out to avoid the mistakes of her past, she learns that changing the course of history is no easy task.','/5Rc98arcNFgPQTJaTJCISudzIsG.jpg','2014-12-20',86,'Released','Sometimes You Do Get a Second Chance','Back to Christmas',313945,1.5467,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39607,_binary '\0','/jr8tSoJGj33XLgFBy6lmZhpGQNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3915174',7.9,231328,'en','Puss in Boots: The Last Wish','Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.','/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg','2022-12-07',103,'Released','Say hola to his little friends.','Puss in Boots: The Last Wish',315162,34.6328,8.218,'RqrXhwS33yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39608,_binary '\0','/y5haKgSz1hCDatwIOMuqZ1CFKPW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39162904',7.6,4956,'en','Queen of Chess','A Hungarian girl dreams of conquering international men’s chess. After a 15-year battle against world champion Garry Kasparov and her domineering father, Judit Polgár revolutionizes the sport’s patriarchal culture to become one of the greatest chess prodigies in history and the greatest woman chess player of all time.','/ag5TZNcK3vHdCCpZIY8syjwzgfr.jpg','2026-01-27',93,'Released',NULL,'Queen of Chess',1596291,5.4192,7.532,'8pmJgtLKBXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39609,_binary '\0','/9DDNQfevFOFSbgK420zJtTwWuH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3916700',7.3,1926,'te','రన్ రజా రన్','Raja, son of a vegetable vendor, is a simple man. His girlfriends dump him because of his honesty. However, things take a turn when he meets his true love Priya, the daughter of a police commissioner.','/52BPtUGKJzAjjJMIb6t68ksTSm3.jpg','2014-08-01',126,'Released',NULL,'Run Raja Run',284837,1.0916,6.368,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39610,_binary '\0','/lNZmUwIxNjn2KqwzaPvmi221rG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39167354',6.3,2747,'kn','ನಾನು ಕರುಣಾಕರ','A struggling assistant director in the Kannada film industry battles personal pride and financial hardship as he tries to grant his young son\'s wish for a toy car, only to face choices that test his self-worth, family bonds, and deepest dreams.','/viUyZ6k8cFT7vTXpenDcS0RpHtZ.jpg','2026-04-02',136,'Released',NULL,'Nanu Karunakara',1713004,0.5283,0,'gbUEwlcn6qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39611,_binary '\0','/sNXbUjitLOrneM8OevlSRln86XI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3916762',4.8,2333,'te','రభస','US return student Karthik pledges to marry his uncle Dhanunjay\'s daughter Indu, which was his mother\'s wish. A small family feud ends with both the families getting separated. He joins Indu\'s college to convince her to marry him, but mistakenly assumes Bhagyam as Dhanunjay\'s daughter. Later, Karthik realizes that Indu is his cousin but she is already in love with another guy. He gets entangled in a risky situation when he tries to help a stranger. The rest of the story is all about how he controls the damage and fulfills the wish of his mother.','/bB7yaQDe6KfIFOQgUD09VIksr04.jpg','2014-08-28',153,'Released',NULL,'Rabhasa',307614,1.7646,4.625,'lB6XZOFeAXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39612,_binary '\0','/xm5VK4ugFbYv26pFoK591gYqG4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3917118',6.9,1871,'en','Hector','Hector has been living on the motorways for years. His once comfortable family life has been replaced by a never-ending tour of service stations that offer him shelter, anonymity, washing facilities and food. The story follows his journey south from Scotland on his annual pilgrimage to a temporary Christmas shelter in London where he finds comfort, friendship and warmth. Over the course of his Homeric journey, Hector decides to reconnect with his long estranged past. As his previous life catches up with him, the story of how he came to be leading a marginal life begins to emerge.','/6TXtmcu56lte0gv2EsAS4sqOIaZ.jpg','2015-12-11',87,'Released','A little bit of hope can go a long way','Hector',345470,1.3428,7.2,'DLLtPTYDWtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39613,_binary '\0','/3eWyOWBd6Z9BbxZJ8ObY22jm7mS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3917210',7.4,6386,'en','Life, Animated','At three years old, a chatty, energetic little boy named Owen Suskind ceased to speak, disappearing into autism with apparently no way out. Almost four years passed and the only stimuli that engaged Owen were Disney films. Then one day, his father donned a puppet—Iago, the wisecracking parrot from Aladdin—and asked “what’s it like to be you?” And poof! Owen replied, with dialogue from the movie. Life, Animated tells the remarkable story of how Owen found in Disney animation a pathway to language and a framework for making sense of the world.','/dAbgluMr621IDx0fvyzVOYtAhEX.jpg','2016-07-01',91,'Released','When he fell into silence, movies gave him back his voice','Life, Animated',376233,1.6213,7.4,'C-kFjO007GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39614,_binary '\0','/fCzwanhBhsQpv5SdsfzEyyzOUtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39172356',8.9,2071,'te','Fighter Shiva','Village dreamer Shiva comes to Hyderabad to become a director.Rejected and desperate, he joins the drug mafia to fund his film. As he rises, violence consumes him. With cops chasing and gangsters betraying him, Shiva chooses to fight back.','/5hMS3qklkbhSNGd3eo4NMTasytD.jpg',NULL,132,'Released',NULL,'Fighter Shiva',1736082,1.2785,0,'k9c6nXL8_SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39615,_binary '\0','/czHYg6LQ5926OL8wj5kC09pNR12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3917506',5.6,3749,'en','Benny Loves You','Jack, a man desperate to improve his life, throws away his beloved childhood plush, Benny. It’s a move that has disastrous consequences when Benny springs to life with deadly intentions!','/3RE9DNBCvuso5OPZPg71ryntNjx.jpg','2019-11-21',94,'Released','Don\'t throw him out.','Benny Loves You',647302,1.8503,5.8,'8VZG778rYEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39616,_binary '\0','/usKCKmo1UcVsz0t3NNbkPXCmyk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3917710',5.9,4063,'en','The Baker','A quiet, stoic man, lives a monk-like existence in self-imposed exile. When his estranged son is killed in a drug deal gone bad, he is left to look after a granddaughter he never knew existed, and he is forced back into a life he tried to put behind him.','/ijzMEf8ZhGiz0f1mb2zeuTVjXj2.jpg','2023-07-27',100,'Released','Careful who you cross.','The Baker',823395,5.8034,6.28,'G_R8scO_HEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39617,_binary '\0','/18aMpDlBYsspkcImjKNmlELXLWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3917908',8.5,2353,'hi','An Insignificant Man','After the anti-corruption protests, Arvind Kejriwal along with his team members forms a new political party to fight the Delhi elections.','/oHfx4HeO86jikupQvCas7AaPDxN.jpg','2016-10-06',100,'Released',NULL,'An Insignificant Man',411010,0.834,6.4,'9iCWYwtyVy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39618,_binary '\0','/jzDjIHDknKz9jhTvBF9aSeoax1V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39182439',6.6,2528,'ta','கான் சிட்டி','Follows a struggling family whose lives change when a receipt printer starts generating money after a lightning strike, leading to public chaos when society discovers the money-making machine.','/pJ4UwvLpek1jK8d540Ho8xI08iL.jpg','2026-06-26',150,'Released',NULL,'Con City',1596008,2.0109,5.4,'TuN_dKpxCgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39619,_binary '\0','/k5OFuW1NdI1Lt57nzXEjxwd8zGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3918368',5.5,2303,'ja','ポケモン・ザ・ムービーXY 破壊の繭とディアンシー','In the underground Diamond Domain, where many Carbink live, the Mythical Pokémon Diancie serves as ruler. The Heart Diamond that sustains the land is beginning to fall apart, and Diancie is not yet strong enough to create a new one. While seeking help from the Legendary Pokémon Xerneas, Diancie encounters a group of thieves who want to take control of its diamond-producing power–and who awaken the Legendary Pokémon Yveltal from its cocoon in the process! Can Ash and his friends help Diancie discover its true power, stop Yveltal’s rampage, and save the Diamond Domain?','/rA0KbJZbBt2fMmZs8bwPZnzFfDc.jpg','2014-07-19',76,'Released','When destruction rises, can life prevail?','Pokémon the Movie: Diancie and the Cocoon of Destruction',303903,4.2948,6.7,'v7SS33mFv5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39620,_binary '\0','/v0dl0D9cCvj4eNgVR7QZvixakaf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3918546',6.9,1621,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: All That Glitters','When her friend Martin turns up murdered just hours after auctioning off an abandoned storage unit full of unique items to Jennifer, she is immediately pulled on the case as a key eyewitness. Working with Detective Lynwood, Jennifer helps single out a disgruntled customer as the prime suspect, while she and her business partner, Danielle, sift through boxes from the auction.','/cuscqZp7dIaQXvLOr4NPhfGfmS.jpg','2014-10-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: All That Glitters',300778,1.8687,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39621,_binary '\0','/6bwWbChnViFHfvkY8HyybHKyVmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3918584',7.1,2210,'pt','Mais Forte que o Mundo: A História de José Aldo','The Story of longtime UFC Featherweight champion and the struggles facing him on the road to the top.','/j4oW0FlldK57LPVd8GPJDD12Ow5.jpg','2016-06-16',107,'Released',NULL,'Stronger Than The World',372518,1.894,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39622,_binary '\0','/uP6xHZ1hnCQUmsk38e7w1HXygcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3918776',6.2,1549,'en','Love by the Book','Bookstore owner Emma believes in fairy tales. Although she has yet to be swept away by prince charming, she sees real knight in shining armor potential with a new suitor, Landon. As Emma balances time with Landon and saving her bookstore with once irritating business consultant, Eric, however, she weighs storybook romance against genuine commitment. While she sorts out her feelings toward Landon and Eric, as well as toward love and romance, Emma begins to realize that fairytale endings aren\'t always by the book.','/iDnzTu6BgqDXgWfmAsRrl14hZFC.jpg','2015-01-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Love by the Book',317110,1.9392,6.3,'SZGoxVrCwgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39623,_binary '\0','/jdXBBuoRR3jPkRQNE6cYTj5eesG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3919218',5.5,3912,'en','How to Plan an Orgy in a Small Town','In high school Cassie Cranston was slut-shamed out of the wholesome and repressed town of Beaver’s Ridge following a humiliating attempt at losing her virginity. Now, years later, a big city sex columnist, Cassie returns home to bury her mother and finds a chance for revenge when her prudish childhood nemesis insists she helps her old friends plan an orgy.','/f7poipkBYz3cBF0rMdzYtzVWtdO.jpg','2015-09-19',102,'Released','Love thy neighbour.','How to Plan an Orgy in a Small Town',356300,3.1156,5.1,'VngP-ydQ3E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39624,_binary '\0','/unXrjADknsh0kiQOT7hddvoiOhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39195606',7.1,1524,'ro','Băieți de oraș: Golden Boyz','After a distant relative dies, Malone stands to inherit 9 million euros — but he must earn a university degree to get his hands on the money.','/cuZx5VOMMZ9Saj7ccfFKPrq0gTG.jpg','2026-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'City Boys: Golden Boyz',1629095,2.47,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39625,_binary '\0','/9ZHsabj8Wdvxn8wbaoDPTiYRwZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3919598',3.9,1298,'en','The Inhabitants','A young couple gets more than they bargained for when they buy an historic bed and breakfast in New England only to discover that the old house is hiding a dark secret within its walls.','/rSTpOi0TqwqsHG9zPR4eatC4EHJ.jpg','2015-10-13',90,'Released',NULL,'The Inhabitants',359255,1.209,3.8,'m6h9r0EwLKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39626,_binary '\0','/AqB1