: The Messenger of God',315859,2.2042,6.7,'AedBPzbgcZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39630,_binary '\0','/sEcWQzk7uTBNMrWnMGD6hfDmrEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39216314',8.1,1578,'ko','스트레이 키즈: 더 도미네이트 익스피리언스','Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage and intimate interviews with the band, Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience is an epic concert film that gives fans both a spectacular front-row seat and unique access to their favourite band.','/8pi8IZ2lqJB0k0XKgh2b89OYqYd.jpg','2026-02-04',146,'Released',NULL,'Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience',1600421,3.8867,9.1,'2R8MBgJWn4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39631,_binary '\0','/fuUxK1UNaT4LK1S4NtqCH0mqkig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3921694',4.7,1510,'en','The Madness Within','Russ Washington is a successful businessman on top of the world. But when Addiction, secrets, and faulty relationships send him spiraling down the rabbit hole, will he continue to plummet or find the strength to carry on.','/uDyA0su06KD7HdpNfZiL0xFrlg8.jpg','2019-12-06',97,'Released',NULL,'The Madness Within',653358,0.7646,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39632,_binary '\0','/d8YV61996Zq00UqSVBV9K8KJgN4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3921852',5.8,2795,'en','Barbie and the Secret Door','A shy princess discovers a secret door in her kingdom and enters a magical world full of magical creatures. She meets a mermaid and a fairy who tell her about a spoiled ruler threatening them.','/i4BIMP1KZmERVwt4BFXKeBBIDvJ.jpg','2014-08-30',81,'Released','You never know what you can do unless you try.','Barbie and the Secret Door',285733,3.6675,7.161,'azhDCKCm750','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39633,_binary '\0','/idPUsCppKdSfbeuCKG5122UNqNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3922350',4.7,2117,'en','Headless','In this \"lost slasher film from 1978,\" a masked killer wages an unrelenting spree of murder, cannibalism, and necrophilia. But when his tortured past comes back to haunt him, he plunges to even greater depths of madness and depravity, consuming the lives of a young woman and those she holds dear.','/yPMVb8HqCkWh9hVWbAVtBJEyGkV.jpg','2015-02-28',86,'Released','Unearthed. Uncensored. Unleashed! The most shocking film you\'ve never seen!','Headless',326415,1.2671,4.5,'iO0ThR4ylm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39634,_binary '\0','/ohHq0PZvDWeFOVtY1QRG04y3zJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3922798',7.2,48809,'en','The Siege of Jadotville','Irish Commandant Pat Quinlan leads a stand off with troops against French and Belgian Mercenaries in the Congo during the early 1960s.','/adrno1y0mKpMwjSlMQojZEUk82V.jpg','2016-09-19',108,'Released','The Irish army\'s forgotten battle','The Siege of Jadotville',334517,4.3737,7.101,'rHNtzyXvyLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39635,_binary '\0','/pXEs3ZY701aRKarE8ja56sBQAuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3922816',6.6,5755,'en','The Daughter','In the last days of a dying logging town, Christian returns to his family home for his father Henry’s wedding. While home, Christian reconnects with his childhood friend Oliver, who has stayed in town working at Henry’s timber mill and is now out of a job. As Christian gets to know Oliver’s wife Charlotte, daughter Hedvig, and father Walter, he discovers a secret that could tear Oliver’s family apart.','/jdHe8nyuvn67XBq0JQEwkNGUQ9I.jpg','2015-10-09',96,'Released','It Takes An Outsider To See The Truth Inside.','The Daughter',292010,2.139,6.3,'TaC-SrFdRZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39636,_binary '\0','/5SGAJrTVpWXKNdEwspTG9s60YOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3922818',6.4,59185,'en','The Space Between Us','A young man raised by scientists on Mars returns to Earth to find his father.','/lRBl9mfvUbZeaAyXoP09XwPOo0W.jpg','2017-01-26',121,'Released',