10.000000','tt3949638',5.8,1369,'te','పవర్','Ravi Teja plays a young man desperate to become a police officer, who becomes embroiled in a plot to pose as his lookalike in order to re-capture an infamous thug from rogue cops. The film revolves around two similar looking people, Baldev Sahay - a corrupt ACP in Kolkata and Tirupathi - a person aspiring to become a police officer in Hyderabad. The home minister of Kolkata recruits Tirupathi to play as Baldev to catch a gangster rescued by Baldev. Rest of the story is all about why Baldev became a corrupt cop and how Tirupathi executed the unfinished mission of Baldev.','/ss0DcmUNQ6XaBwPfxJA7lktKhCi.jpg','2014-09-12',147,'Released','Unlimited','Power',292139,1.3052,5.583,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39671,_binary '\0','/u9S16gXvAO9QbeNu8Y81fUwgWm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3949650',7,1872,'ja','映画ドラえもん 新・のび太の大魔境 ～ペコと5人の探検隊～','Nobita is followed by a stray dog on his way home and decides to help it find its original owner with the help of Doraemon. They find out that the dog is actually a prince in its homeland in Africa.','/emyPseWayexgw83IFMrK3b6VqFF.jpg','2014-03-08',109,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: New Nobita\'s Great Demon - Peko and the Exploration Party of Five',285812,3.6701,6.2,'ACFjlYJVbKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39672,_binary '\0','/egVHpPXhD0cy5UZlgiFy2Zpy1tB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3949658',5.8,4635,'es','Los parecidos','Eight people experience a strange phenomenon while waiting for a bus at a remote station on a rainy October night.','/gFySRlyCiay9wsqPUcIIyXf2VwL.jpg','2015-09-25',89,'Released','7 billion people in the world or just one?','The Similars',268105,1.4589,6,'boijiFOz46A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39673,_binary '\0','/41objfan7PDTBG5MFXQl4ownQzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3949660',5.9,107748,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Out of the Shadows','After supervillain Shredder escapes custody, he joins forces with mad scientist Baxter Stockman and two dimwitted henchmen, Bebop and Rocksteady, to unleash a diabolical plan to take over the world. As the Turtles prepare to take on Shredder and his new crew, they find themselves facing an even greater evil with similar intentions: the notorious Krang.','/euVaCiCWz3AALcQXHT6aUqdGUo6.jpg','2016-05-30',112,'Released','Raise some shell.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Out of the Shadows',308531,15.3107,6.061,'HeaugHGd1Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39674,_binary '\0','/gtKfBooVh7HCFdZ4TIYD1v3lHrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3949952',7.4,1936,'en','Alison','Raped. Disemboweled. Nearly decapitated. Dumped on the outskirts of a nature reserve, dead - or so they thought. She needed a hero that night, so that\'s what she became. This is Alison\'s tale. A tale of monsters, miracles and hope.','/gtl1K7AEf3hhttvntfJ9SdE8jtO.jpg','2016-08-12',80,'Released',NULL,'Alison',520089,1.2243,6.9,'DZ3cwAOxn-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39675,_binary '\0','/nfDKBXAr6unKPB6cVCQz6FSJUm0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3950078',6.4,3587,'zh','智取威虎山','Yang Zirong disguises himself as a bandit to infiltrate and destroy a bandit group. He joins hands with a hostage, and together, they fight against the warlord, Hawk.','/7seDCoxCBa3O4bUbA4xlKtRfs2U.jpg','2014-12-24',141,'Released',NULL,'The Taking of Tiger Mountain',294992,4.5525,6.639,'2Ix2hbUHigE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39676,_binary '\0','/5EtIPq9ytaz5w1wTx1tbA0nwU6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3951252',5.7,1985,'en','A Wife\'s Nightmare','Liz, just returned home after a mental breakdown, has to welcome a relative stranger into her home when Caitlin, a young, vivacious woman, claims to be her husband\'s daughter.','/6lQSthsrAN4l4MUX6yF0pXcmqXx.jpg','2014-12-27',85,'Released',NULL,'A Wife\'s Nightmare',314127,3.9995,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39677,_binary '\0','/qR5vWSS