3,'pt','O Pátio das Cantigas','A New age remake of a portguese classic, Pátio das Cantigas shows the lives of a neighbourhood in the Old Lisbon, including their desires, happiness and sadness, always with a good humour.','/jqI3Ih94XuxHAbwhKzBtN7n9gxP.jpg','2015-07-30',108,'Released',NULL,'The Courtyard of the Ballads',335602,1.1295,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39738,_binary '\0','/h5gtFY4vfvSRGBZjEgcHt6lvwgb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3983674',7.6,2918,'en','The Mask You Live In','Compared to girls, research shows that boys in the United States are more likely to be diagnosed with a behaviour disorder, prescribed stimulant medications, fail out of school, binge drink, commit a violent crime, and/or take their own lives. The Mask You Live In asks: as a society, how are we failing our boys?','/7436ZhdHSvCojPYinu1eFgpgCjH.jpg','2015-01-05',88,'Released','Is hyper-masculinity harming boys, men and society at large?','The Mask You Live In',224972,1.5398,7.6,'hc45-ptHMxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39739,_binary '\0','/nff8IXmguJGBxYVNVXwS8Z5kEkD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3984356',5.1,4146,'en','Only','After a comet releases a mysterious virus that begins to kill all of the women in the world, a young couple\'s relationship is severely tested. They hide out (from both the illness and the savages who hunt the remaining women) in their over-sterilized apartment. Ultimately the duo escapes their self-imposed quarantine to head to the wilderness.','/1qFSX4rwNq75j8t79S2Dqg5VsQb.jpg','2020-03-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Only',597233,2.3881,5.2,'hXrW6pJyySk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39740,_binary '\0','/8sqvC5hU5QOkYHUnhZIoFKz87BA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3986420',5.3,3200,'en','Trust','Set in the glamour of the New York and Paris art scenes, gallery owner Brooke Gatwick and her newscaster husband Owen Shore, face temptation, jealousy, twists and mystery when two seductive newcomers enter their lives.','/ndFgjUUquqb0PCNH4IYemFoeo57.jpg','2021-03-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Trust',795230,3.0806,6.4,'cFYaADDJI6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39741,_binary '\0','/wdW0WZ6UgQu6D7CCgNxqnxIIdwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3986532',7.4,2994,'en','Tig','An intimate documentary that follows Tig Notaro, a Los Angeles based comedian, who just days after being diagnosed with invasive stage II breast cancer changed the course of her career with a poignant stand-up set that became legendary overnight. It explores Tig\'s extraordinary journey as her career ignites and as her life unfolds in grand and unexpected ways, all the while continuing to battle a life-threatening illness and falling in love.','/40KabvxAhRc0ZAIWTduRYvgl0iH.jpg','2015-04-23',95,'Released','Finding life in the face of death.','Tig',318225,1.2781,7.2,'eO7kJ0j4Qzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39742,_binary '\0','/nvCMi8ZhH1Z8i9ZFHYrXBl8uBw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3986820',6.5,58333,'en','The Endless','Two brothers return to the cult they fled from years ago to discover that the group\'s beliefs may be more sane than they once thought.','/uVHPBTLb6Sj1Eso9HzyBAOMRheM.jpg','2017-11-05',112,'Released','Time is a prison.','The Endless',430231,7.0994,6.3,'_DTbx7c7ez8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39743,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3986932',5.8,1739,'en','Black Widows','Three friends enact an innocent revenge on one\'s rapist but things spiral out of control resulting in the deaths of each of their lovers.','/niXigybGWvwSCWsGEB58wqgOqs3.jpg','2016-08-05',78,'Released','Some relationships are worth killing for....','Black Widows',410144,1.497,4.3,'ijAsnjcE7Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39744,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39875868',5.9,2194,'bn','কর্পূর','In 1997, University Exam Controller Moushumi Sen disappeared amid a 50-crore scam. She fled to London, according to headlines, but a silenced police officer suspected a more sinister political conspiracy. Two decades later, journalist Anupam reopens the case, unearthing a labyrinth of institutional rot. Is she dead or hidden?','/xX5gmgn5eiED2S2EBTS9SkMYReh.jpg','2026-03-19',145,'Released',NULL,'Korpur',1493079,1.5189,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39745,_binary '\0','/kWt0BUdYOdt95N5RQJ0zkUnIfmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39910244',5,3389,'ml','അച്യുത അവതാരം','A family\'s quiet life is upended by a devastating cyber scam that leaves them shattered. Determined to fight back, one woman takes on the digital underworld in a courageous battle for justice, hope and those she loves.','/pH5QDBV55imyvC31MMdxTtHUT6t.jpg','2026-07-17',130,'Released',NULL,'Achyuta Avataaram',1738292,1.6719,0,'Khz9QMYJ7RU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39746,_binary '\0','/frJzRmqrtaakV7Hq0tIDglzQ2gL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3991066',5.1,1763,'en','A Dogwalker\'s Christmas Tale','Spoiled 21-year-old Luce Lockhart faces a tough decision when a handsome new friend asks her to help protect a dog park from her wealthy employer.','/cInkAcLdI4dWYqL9IQ7tmMmg9yC.jpg','2015-11-15',80,'Released',NULL,'A Dogwalker\'s Christmas Tale',365756,1.9947,5.8,'R70bRDAs6CE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39747,_binary '\0','/8KFAnl84oi6QSjFDCIGFgZPiOph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3991412',6.3,15871,'en','The 9th Life of Louis Drax','A psychologist who begins working with a young boy who has suffered a near-fatal fall finds himself drawn into a mystery that tests the boundaries of fantasy and reality.','/jCM4BpOoCAjs6lKHDCm66kE2XR1.jpg','2016-09-01',108,'Released','A mystery beyond reality.','The 9th Life of Louis Drax',294795,4.9232,6.4,'NTX29bZLsew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39748,_binary '\0','/4g7xJ4EdaMIPuJrtZTOk8ePbGlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3993732',4.8,1846,'ru','III','A small European town, where sisters Ayia and Mirra live, gets struck down by an unknown disease which takes many lives. Following their mother\'s death, the younger sister falls ill. Having realized that conventional medicine is useless in the face of the sister\'s disease, Ayia seeks help from Father Herman, a parish priest and a close family friend. In his house she finds books that are very far from the conventional religion. She gets to know that only penetration into Mirra\'s sick subconscious mind and discovery of the true cause of her disease will give her a chance to save her sister. Ayia is ready to go through this terrifying ritual, dive into the depths of the subconscious mind, and face the demons residing there. But will she cope with her own fear when she discovers the mysteries of her sister\'s past? Since the closer to the bottom of the ocean, the darker it gets.','/dad6DDNXKihLtoSaGpDlU9VLRCA.jpg','2015-03-02',80,'Released','Since the closer to the bottom of the ocean, the darker it gets...','III',329013,1.3447,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39749,_binary '\0','/6Ibe7vMZdBDYDbeeu1xM7jA9OUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3993802',3.8,1841,'en','Christmas Icetastrophe','This Christmas, a super frozen object is going to slam into the Earth. In the middle of a small town, and very quickly, dreams of a \"White Christmas\" will turn into a FROZEN NIGHTMARE.','/vVmKjZLrLKBiAklTbkVzVbPc4SW.jpg','2014-12-20',82,'Released','Destruction Reigns','Christmas Icetastrophe',301816,0.961,5.3,'MFrW5fU_mtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39750,_binary '\0','/9XCnndiIzsWibZhxPoo8EV04fzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3993886',6,4918,'en','All Day and a Night','While serving life in prison, a young man looks back at the people, the circumstances and the system that set him on the path toward his crime.','/8xiV8j18GhWnnrfMGaDR0E5oOif.jpg','2020-05-01',121,'Released','Born. Gangster. Repeat.','All Day and a Night',530956,3.0542