s engaged to another man.','/60jGGOP1xuj2P95mYva6lWgFUBr.jpg','2015-03-20',153,'Released',NULL,'100 Days of Love',331330,1.8905,6.2,'73AFF7k--zA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39755,_binary '\0','/xt2JT3ola4A68X1g9jRDiy2MV6j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3995416',6.6,1303,'tr','Toz Bezi','Nesrin and Hatun are two Kurdish cleaning women living in Istanbul. While Nesrin tries to survive with her little daughter, trying to understand why her husband left her, Hatun dreams of buying a house in the district where they clean.','/8FasU8TRReYzx2IGRpmdER37x8P.jpg','2015-12-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Dust Cloth',382487,2.5048,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39756,_binary '\0','/k1Mv27DDUkoiCeEPMAqnSD1fUQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt39954649',5.6,2084,'te','అమరావతికి ఆహ్వానం','When Amaravathi calls, fear answers. This gripping narrative combines spine-tingling visuals and powerful performances into an edge-of-the-seat thriller that explores a chilling summons from the unknown.','/7ZnhoaSgmm5wMMWfKXStA9MrKd4.jpg','2026-02-13',141,'Released',NULL,'Amaravathiki Aahvanam',1637127,1.3911,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39757,_binary '\0','/81xRBAA8f0TmBgzEHiWMUeSoc9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3996396',7.6,4023,'te','యాత్ర','The film focus especially on the period from 1999-2004 when YSR undertook his famous Padayatra which ultimately proved instrumental in catapulting him to a comprehensive victory in the 2004 polls.','/glQx23PN3btfziiIMb7AT4B9uE0.jpg','2019-02-08',126,'Released','He wanted to leave a footprint in history. Instead, he left one in the hearts of people.','Yatra',521714,1.15,6.071,'rQq32oiMa54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39758,_binary '\0','/rRNp6KMqiN4ThbQj3WrE8uzsMf2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt3997238',6,2144,'en','Do I Sound Gay?','What makes a voice “gay”? A breakup with his boyfriend sets journalist David Thorpe on a quest to unravel a linguistic mystery.','/vJuiiHt0d5sicgDBtXwr6kdKErZ.jpg','2015-07-10',77,'Released','A documentary about finding your true voice.','Do I Sound Gay?',288301,2.1721,5.6,'R21Fd8-Apf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39759,_binary '\0','/bwsGEeiEnKqsZ9vm3G82as8xUu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40001699',7,1962,'pt','Quinze Dias','An insecure teenager\'s vacation plans are ruined by an unexpected visitor: his neighbor and school crush who will spend two weeks sleeping at his house. The days that promised peace, tranquility and epic series marathons end up bringing a whirlwind of feelings and unresolved issues.','/y3zqa6qmLz2C2bUImOgYs6JxDNT.jpg','2026-06-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Here the Whole Time',1418582,5.2423,7.375,'Xh2_PnOoAS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39760,_binary '\0','/46knzmOFFEC62Dy98OnBeFActy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4000670',7.2,1507,'en','Mifune: The Last Samurai','An account of the life and work of legendary Japanese actor Toshirō Mifune (1920-97), the most prominent actor of the Golden Age of Japanese cinema.','/nklWhTBnbFw0NutlupxNbDB9TZZ.jpg','2016-12-02',81,'Released',NULL,'Mifune: The Last Samurai',413782,2.6471,7,'hQ1dkl1ul-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39761,_binary '\0','/9MArKFeNR5DqjKHZJ0nwZGnQy4f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4000870',5.5,3932,'en','Addicted to Fresno','Two co-dependent sisters, a recovering sex addict and a lonely lesbian who work as hotel maids in Fresno, go to ludicrous lengths to cover up an accidental crime.','/lFoDP8JBZFA0r0wMgPGvQyi6IrA.jpg','2015-10-02',85,'Released','They always find a way to get off.','Addicted to Fresno',301629,2.2937,5.2,'JRlVn4cKxJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39762,_binary '\0','/nPrNWHY7Oqa3PGsfS9i4R8haQ5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4000956',4.9,1710,'en','Brother Nature','Roger, a straight-laced politician has big plans to propose to his dream girl at her family\'s lake house. But everything goes awry when he meets his potential brother-in-law Todd: a full-time camp counselor with a heart of gold and a wild sense of fun, pining to be Roger\'s best friend, and ultimately catapulting him into a series of unfortunate events. As Roger tries to take a stand amidst outrageous fishing excursions, propulsive water jetpacks and American history-themed musicals, he realizes that being a part of a new family may be more difficult than he\'d thought.','/jEaUqbtlOvg0bfnPaPh1Bd0MoAu.jpg','2016-09-09',97,'Released','Crazy is relative','Brother Nature',292834,2.5707,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39763,_binary '\0','/e4JBtKcKKBwWBshgYnY5NBMAckK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4002772',6.2,1440,'en','Once I Was a Beehive','After losing her father to cancer, a teenage girl reluctantly joins her new step-cousin at a summer camp for Mormon girls.','/zOV0bO2ZSnwsu9JsiujZFHr1kY7.jpg','2015-08-14',119,'Released','A girls camp movie based on thousands of true stories.','Once I Was a Beehive',339928,1.8225,6.3,'zCKFBOkL8e8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39764,_binary '\0','/2itnmzqS7PhG4cd5lcoYT2UH3pm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4003046',6,5154,'tr','İncir Reçeli 2','After losing his great love Duygu and spiraling into despair despite directing the film İncir Reçeli, Metin’s nights of singing his own songs at a bar take a turn when newcomer bartender Gizem arrives. Both scarred by past heartbreaks, Metin and Gizem must learn to trust and heal if they are to discover whether a new love can blossom between them.','/7prnyv5OnRoQv3YIqN97Ib3dDQj.jpg','2014-10-17',103,'Released',NULL,'Fig Jam 2',313822,1.1757,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39765,_binary '\0','/6BA61fw8P4tVYK6OP6BelzlpbBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4003066',4.6,5763,'tr','Deliha','A woman desperately seeking for a man to love. When he finally arrives, she overlooks him.','/kQqpC4qYqQqFTt9DZYjsz3s1yHv.jpg','2014-11-13',107,'Released',NULL,'Deliha',309853,1.0857,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39766,_binary '\0','/xjRtu8lwnLTZp0oM8cvf5GuM1fo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4003070',7.9,6756,'ar','تراب الماس','Taha works as a pharmacist and lives a normal life with his disabled father. When a mysterious murder occurs, Taha\'s world changes forever. He starts tracking down many secrets that leads him to unlocks a whole melancholic world of crime!','/kAaszSEwhgERJLdg8Ppm4qSwagn.jpg','2018-08-16',150,'Released',NULL,'Diamond Dust',515224,1.9505,7.6,'9cO54cwkN1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39767,_binary '\0','/1UAjYFLLQYOzFd0Ud6YQq2HoubU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4003440',6.8,107969,'en','The House That Jack Built','Failed architect, engineer and vicious murderer Jack narrates the details of some of his most elaborately orchestrated crimes, each of them a towering piece of art that defines his life\'s work as a serial killer for twelve years.','/bMUGNkPaHOurcBK9g3XpJx3fxuO.jpg','2018-10-04',152,'Released','If you feel like screaming... you definitely should.','The House That Jack Built',398173,8.3494,7.1,'8RcExsA-8FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39768,_binary '\0','/kP1YDYEs0Hns0Psm5tztsHJeaut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40036552',4.6,1227,'te','Mr. Work from Home','A young corporate worker relocates to his village and works remotely. While there, he develops a passion for agriculture and applies his expertise to modernize farming practices.','/2fGML9MV1iODxPctkAKfggUO722.jpg','2026-05-15',130,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Work from Home',1749087,1.2494,0,'850mw3ETSgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39769,_binary '\0','/44DF7aWgmzbY13Mn3QquED3UNnB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4003774',6.4,2077,'en','Meet the Mormons','Meet the Mormons examines the very diverse lives of six devout Mormons. Filmed on location and across the globe, Meet the Mormons takes viewers on a journey into the day-to-day realities of individuals living in the U.S., Costa Rica, Nepal and beyond. From their individual passions to their daily struggles, each story paints a picture as rich and unique as the next while challenging the stereotypes that surround the Mormon faith.','/ylSpCMd2qGrr3FXsdd1f0HNdPMd.jpg','2014-10-10',78,'Released','Six ordinary individuals. Six extraordinary stories.','Meet the Mormons',291854,1.0905,5.7,'n2Y8Jalsf54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39770,_binary '\0','/6gtlv8NYhzEeRyfbIbfeXp5KVJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4005402',7,60089,'de','Colonia Dignidad – Es gibt kein Zurück','A young woman\'s desperate search for her abducted boyfriend draws her into the infamous Colonia Dignidad, a sect nobody ever escaped from.','/p7oGFkMGaQR27R1olN9RoMzg4vS.jpg','2016-02-12',106,'Released','There is no turning back','Colonia',318781,6.2949,7.2,'SiVAGDTmlpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39771,_binary '\0','/u4huTFYxr1hgrtmRq1Jj7wDicgi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4006302',6.1,19664,'en','Level 16','The teenage girls of Vestalis Academy are meticulously trained in the art of being “clean girls,” practicing the virtues of perfect femininity. But what exactly are they being trained for? Vivien intends to find out.','/kILAL9kJdW3f6wk9Ai0tavgi6mp.jpg','2018-02-20',102,'Released','Purity has a price.','Level 16',548066,4.2582,6.7,'qgtN95CJaDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39772,_binary '\0','/w9Q0LJoRhvKR5h8EschGzOWHax3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4007248',5.9,7542,'en','Hurricane Bianca','A teacher from New York moves to a small town in Texas, gets fired for being gay, and returns disguised in drag to get revenge on the people who were nasty to him.','/91XhA0n4Z0Fnyzsp7ARW7fVcmwn.jpg','2016-06-03',84,'Released','Revenge is a bitch.','Hurricane Bianca',400547,2.5998,6.1,'S3cW4vLdREQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39773,_binary '\0','/txwVlBT7v1KM2czWSBPxK2s309E.