00','tt4009278',5.7,15510,'en','Intruders','Anna suffers from agoraphobia so crippling that when a trio of criminals break into her house, she cannot bring herself to flee. But what the intruders don\'t realize is that agoraphobia is not her only psychosis.','/5zRiFh5d1hWmYDqcYKz6uSUXKnl.jpg','2015-06-12',90,'Released','They Should Have Left Her Alone','Intruders',333674,2.7867,5.9,'VUxySz-eJj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39778,_binary '\0','/4WeepGC2ySw8HCn7eBcIvWBvkv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4009460',1.3,17380,'en','Saving Christmas','Kirk is enjoying the annual Christmas party extravaganza thrown by his sister until he realizes he needs to help out Christian, his brother-in-law who has a bad case of the bah-humbugs.','/6MLSD1OYGDWkCk05m7vA1xCrfKr.jpg','2014-11-14',79,'Released','Put Christ Back in Christmas','Saving Christmas',295884,1.7826,1.8,'z5-yA66kaVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39779,_binary '\0','/ihVYceEJZxitmyvSKIrFoctfrKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4010302',5.4,1493,'ta','அரண்மனை','Aranmanai is about a family that wants to sell their ancestral home. The supernatural elements they discover there in the aranmanai (palace) lead to some bone-chilling moments.','/lYeQu0lYBRcg1s5za5hxfF6NFfU.jpg','2014-09-19',161,'Released',NULL,'Aranmanai',280116,1.1682,5.2,'W_dUezR125o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39780,_binary '\0','/efcRBPSdezpRunQLWjvbSEkyZXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4010862',4.6,1920,'en','Massacre on Aisle 12','A hardware store employee\'s first night on the job is disrupted by the discovery of a dead body and a duffel bag full of cash. He and his co-workers soon descend into madness as they try to figure out a solution to their predicament in this unsettling horror comedy.','/gY6Loe2thVMKIckYMbHGsdlvCQe.jpg','2016-11-05',83,'Released','Slashing everything in store!','Massacre on Aisle 12',437041,1.2835,4.8,'ucraC5qKc6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39781,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40108671',6.2,1466,'te','Uttutta Herolu','4 friends of the Cult Gang are chosen as heroes in a film,but shooting stops due to financial issues.To save their dream,they do kidnapping for money and get trapped in risky trouble involving faction leader Rami Reddy.Will they survive?','/gKHpECWxs66agybDhoPp13Nfb6B.jpg','2026-02-27',121,'Released',NULL,'Uttutta Herolu',1730816,1.01,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39782,_binary '\0','/j8qDbfN7EwQsOpfEw96R3lbJyE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4010918',7.1,3564,'ko','사도','Ancient Korea, July 4, 1762. The Crown Prince Hyojang, posthumously named Sado, son of King Yeongjo of Joseon, is accused of treason. Thus, the king asks him to commit suicide, but his closest vassals prevent it, so the king orders the prince to get inside a wooden rice chest, where he suffers deprivation of food and water.','/fxucCjHL566llnZC3TfWTdReHee.jpg','2015-09-16',126,'Released','The ways of a royal household.','The Throne',315439,2.4095,7.1,'H0UHmzoece8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39783,_binary '\0','/uu57PfeFUg6ELa7Uue70Lqca8UE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4011010',4,1753,'en','Red Billabong','In the Australian Outback, two brothers discover old secrets and family lies. As their friends start to go missing they fear they are being stalked by someone or something from their worst nightmares - But is it just - A story? A legend? A hoax? Or is it real?','/2bhjpG6aq8i0VKs1pU4kw96cLy3.jpg','2016-08-25',113,'Released','An ancient Australian legend has now been unleashed...','Red Billabong',360924,1.3387,4.4,'wD_D2PuXjW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39784,_binary '\0','/qqkAHTXdjUuMELepCq3jr0Ygpr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4012254',6,2222,'en','A Cookie Cutter Christmas','Two longtime rivals and elementary school teachers duke it out during the holidays in a Christmas cookie bake-off, but their real feud ignites over a shared interest in a handsome single dad. With both determined to win the prize and the romance, their competitiveness could jeopardize what matters most this Christmas season.','/2RxFyWQqExYSyWsKrHqrOojIEm6.jpg','2014-11-09',86,'Released',NULL,'A Cookie Cutter Christmas',299578,2.1223,6.1,'BAkSyUPC8cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39785,_binary '\0','/a9pabnVTuzqHm09KOHjeCXk10Gt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4012424',7.1,2266,'pt','O Filme da Minha Vida','The sierras of southern Brazil, 1963. The son of an French man and a Brazilian woman, Tony is a young man with a profound love of cinema and poetry. After graduating from college he returns to his small town in rural Brazil, to find out that his father had left for good, back to France. Tony then looks for the company of his fathers friends in search of information and references of a lost male role-model. He becomes a school teacher and a male figure to kids, in an attempt to provide them with something he lacks himself. A series of developments lead him to a surprising final lead on his fathers\' whereabouts and reasons for leaving.','/7ESfxMWXQpYCHgDJWnCH9ywMbQu.jpg','2017-08-03',113,'Released','I arrived and he left. The rest, I can\'t tell.','The Movie of My Life',341244,1.5828,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39786,_binary '\0','/bMJ0h7EiLxtUq8Bd6KeZeQkV9Dn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4015500',7.2,21795,'en','The Tale','An investigation into one woman’s memory as she‘s forced to re-examine her first sexual relationship and the stories we tell ourselves in order to survive.','/aguq47xq3qhN807rSyz4lJyhAkX.jpg','2018-01-20',115,'Released','Our past is always present.','The Tale',369523,4.008,7.1,'tXpYsr3AL4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39787,_binary '\0','/1JFE0brZLlBsiAMW1kviD7DiKJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016226',7.8,3516,'en','The Resurrection of Jake The Snake','A fallen professional wrestling superstar battles his past demons in a struggle to reclaim his life and the family that has given up on him.','/ahtoXEU9n40QmwnwStAk7Mqz4Z8.jpg','2015-01-23',93,'Released',NULL,'The Resurrection of Jake The Snake',324181,1.6939,7.5,'Lc7eK8C94wM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39788,_binary '\0','/nnrUONMmZvHaARckCzCV64rlbaf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016294',4.1,2659,'en','The Midas Touch','Felix, a young advertiser, is down on his luck. Ridiculed by his boss and suffering from unrequited love he knows that something has to change, when the chance of a lifetime appears completely out of the blue. He acquires \"The Midas Touch\" - the ability to conquer every woman with a mere touch. Enjoying life to the fullest for a brief period of time, Felix quickly notices that evil forces are after his new \"talent\" and \"The Midas Touch\" soon gets completely out of hand.','/JcMqluuD9QrN4LSSnzarDR1QAa.jpg','2020-11-20',109,'Released','Be careful what you wish for!','The Midas Touch',777250,1.0858,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39789,_binary '\0','/p8F6LmypMF64UZgK1nf3QX3osrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016312',7.1,18170,'en','The Book Of Vision','Eva, a mysterious doctor, searches for an answer to her urgent dilemma as she unravels Dr. Anmuth\'s Book of Vision. Henry gets involved in her life and is forced to confront his own nature, as Eva faces the biggest decision of her life.','/wK3utfBLqkKV7rS0tssOw8xwZvr.jpg','2021-07-08',100,'Released',NULL,'The Book Of Vision',498587,2.6134,6.015,'qyL3iOjaY2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39790,_binary '\0','/j7HnXSnxPnROgxsUCVy79cv6Jvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016588',6.7,3180,'en','Surprised by Love','The story of a young businesswoman who tries to convince her uptight parents to accept her current boyfriend and instead finds herself falling for an old high school flame.','/9ozs4hUFvbnh24XG86JMWKrQz7P.jpg','2015-01-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Surprised by Love',315134,1.7282,6.4,'j13zF_DEmwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39791,_binary '\0','/9o9ci7ZH9chSy8B7YXCBYih8Kkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016934',8.1,208424,'ko','아가씨','1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.','/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg','2016-06-01',145,'Released','You\'re the one being tricked.','The Handmaiden',290098,25.6755,8.175,'6sVYumzrKvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39792,_binary '\0','/3igN3WJmYEBNl68BbgcRpKflUVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016942',7.1,2629,'ja','攻殻機動隊ARISE border: 4 Ghost Stands Alone','The upcoming installment\'s story takes place amidst signs of postwar reconstruction in the winter of 2028. Tensions are rising in New Port City as demonstrations are held concerning the interests of foreign cartels. This leads to a shooting incident involving riot police. It all started with a cyberbrain infection released by the terrorist \"Fire Starter.\" An independent offensive unit led by Makoto Kusanagi entrusts the suppression of the situation to their ghosts and aims for their own justice. Below the surface of the incident, lies the \"tin girl\" Emma and the \"scarecrow man\" Burinda Junior. As Kusanagi deals with the incident, she draws near to what those two ghosts were seeking.','/dNlPBbpsyZCHDbYa4VxZOCj3RiI.jpg','2014-09-06',59,'Released',NULL,'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 4: Ghost Stands Alone',279254,3.6606,6.933,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39793,_binary '\0','/jGWH1IlmFINVhsSrsko3j3W4vNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4016994',7.5,2849,'ro','De ce eu?','Cristian, a young idealistic prosecutor whose career is on the rise, tries to crack a case against a senior colleague accused of corruption. The dilemma of choosing between his career and the truth weighs heavily on his shoulders. Looking further to solve the case, he enters a danger zone paved with unexpected and painful revelations.','/vuxgkkRS42O6BhHt6ojjRcz9SCK.jpg','2015-02-27',125,'Released','Based on a true story','Why Me?',317463,1.3713,6.7,'BDg5uPNhctw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39794,_binary '\0','/hnVbBBQMztst5gbmXsp7oyQTCaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4019426',6.6,4066,'zh','绣春刀','In the late Ming Dynasty, three sworn brothers who serve as the imperial secret police are dispatched to hunt down Wei Zhongxian, a eunuch politician who had been forced to resign from his influential post and exiled from Beijing. The brothers return successfully from their quest, only to find that their task was but the beginning of a strange conspiracy.','/d2mXV6VXqpxxv5Zet9xc2rKVpJz.jpg','2014-08-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Brotherhood of Blades',291692,3.8177,6.662,'dQTfGVorWMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39795,_binary '\0','/j7xtt1lTvqInvyAke7RfrhzTEQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4019560',4.4,18150,'en','Exposed','After witnessing a miracle, a young Latina woman experiences strange things as a police detective searches for the truth behind his partner\'s death.','/nM26QosEfgjEegONCiNNrYMBTxD.jpg','2016-01-22',102,'Released','Some secrets are better left buried.','Exposed',331962,6.6616,4.927,'su72UDDUPko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39796,_binary '\0','/5kIngCnY62WIQwN4ng0OChXgY8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4020156',8.2,1405,'en','National Theatre Live: A Streetcar Named Desire','As Blanche’s fragile world crumbles, she turns to her sister Stella for solace – but her downward spiral brings her face to face with the brutal, unforgiving Stanley Kowalski.','/fM9SrvHcn5Raw0kV5jcYpKOPlxu.jpg','2014-09-16',174,'Released',NULL,'National Theatre Live: A Streetcar Named Desire',291289,2.0335,7.9,'Mb6DNYWViYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39797,_binary '\0','/dlV2XKessikY1fEk0BGsJPvSSqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4020624',5.6,7155,'ta','லிங்கா','After being turned down by the ruling Britons, the rightful heir to a famous dynasty inspires local villagers to build a dam themselves. A small-time thief reforms after learning about the role played by his grandfather in building a dam.','/595P2VmfbSOegsfAWK9A5j9MFoG.jpg','2014-12-12',174,'Released',NULL,'Lingaa',300425,1.6068,5.014,'J57G8IRjoWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39798,_binary '\0','/bMW1ayIR3aRquUmvtXEPDxkmOtb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4023852',4.4,1632,'hi','Welcome 2 Karachi','On a drunk night, Shammi suggests that he and Kedar leave for America on a cruise, even though they laugh it off in that instance, in a freak accident by the sea, Kedar and Shammi who are supposed to manage a wedding baraat on a cruise, leave without the baraatis only to lose their direction and land up in Karachi, Pakistan.','/5k9J53bv3MtJlUti4vVUedK5PMd.jpg','2015-05-28',131,'Released',NULL,'Welcome 2 Karachi',342291,1.1132,4.3,'pUlMjB3uaQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39799,_binary '\0','/uKLCO7f8oo7hsM4lkYFD2TXIRrw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4024104',7.1,1411,'ko','상의원','Lee Gong-jin, a young tailor, helps the Queen with her dress and both fall in love with each other. However, his success catches the ire of Jo Dol-seok, the royal tailor, who vows retribution.','/zrWD1J3CRamqGgHm5UgH9jN0Iqi.jpg','2014-12-24',127,'Released','A passion for beauty and power that changes history.','The Royal Tailor',314327,3.788,7.103,'vPiUPfibhH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39800,_binary '\0','/vQez4QOPsojrYdqUpmcLuidl8Xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4024210',5.5,1272,'en','unINDIAN','Single mum Meera is an Australian of Indian origin. Smart and independent, she has carved out a successful life for herself and her daughter...despite family pressure to find a \'nice Indian match\'. Then Meera meets Will, a blonde, blue-eyed Aussie charmer. But falling in love with an Australian is not only scandalous - it\'s unIndian! Does she do what her family wishes, or follow her heart?','/e5hpOt5NMgnpsKcmPAsSNo73Smy.jpg','2015-10-15',102,'Released','A cross-cultural comedy.','unINDIAN',354150,1.5838,5.7,'n4DCrXOTVlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39801,_binary '\0','/xv1FL0ue0B4tLuIQdrxkI0zVFcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4024546',5.5,2005,'fr','Bis','Éric and Patrice have been friends since high school. Over the years, they have both taken very different paths: Éric has become a hedonist, has a string of girlfriends and is always on the look out for a new one; Patrice has become a monogamous father with a very ordered life. After a drunken evening, the two childhood friends find themselves cast back into 1986, when they were 17 years old. This return to the past is a dream opportunity to try to change the path their lives will take. What will they do with this second chance?','/fuW0Qp1Wrnc3NjPslRwKevUKtJW.jpg','2015-02-18',98,'Released','They are back in 1986','Bis',323020,2.2153,5.3,'0I3aWywgKpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39802,_binary '\0','/m5pSZ8n6ZsDfhIMFc0hqXyjTP6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4024814',5.2,2898,'de','Fucking Berlin','Sonia breaks the perhaps most exciting time of her life, because the 20-year-old moves to Berlin for a mathematics study. Once there, she soon began to build up a new circle of friends, and then she fell in love with the kind, but irresponsible Ladja. There is only one big catch: the dear money is a bit scarce and therefore Sonia one day, financially, but also from curiosity, the path to prostitution. From now on, it leads a brisk double flight, which can fly at any time. Her experiences are ambivalent, as part-time she often gets into difficult situations, but also gets to know nice people, while she enjoys life just as a student. But how long can it maintain the double game?','/rgCF7K2NBj8Xnnk8v7fQtXltJrJ.jpg','2016-06-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Fucking Berlin',376969,1.8765,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39803,_binary '\0','/pyTlvf27mjoDxYMr4u04zHXuXJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4024944',6.2,1907,'hi','Main Aur Charles','In the 1980s, Charles, an enigmatic con man and a vicious killer and Commisioner Amod Kanth are embroiled in a game of cat and mouse.','/sETdbhC6YsgtQZpMQkighZmtWxN.jpg','2015-10-30',119,'Released',NULL,'Main Aur Charles',361129,0.9383,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39804,_binary '\0','/fGjqCsoJttbTxkrcWfupuT1xLQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4025514',7.4,23392,'it','Suburra','A gangster known as \"Samurai\" wants to turn the waterfront of Rome into a new Las Vegas. All the local mob bosses have agreed to work for this common goal. But peace is not to last long.','/ml6iNvTVrWxDusMhbizphQjCHPw.jpg','2015-10-14',130,'Released','Rome will fall','Suburra',356296,2.9546,7.288,'AYwpxrt7ZLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39805,_binary '\0','/xiuajyMaOp28XOab8NNxzkLHbsB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4026034',7.2,2406,'en','Hired Gun','A documentary film about session and touring musicians that are hired by well-established and famous bands and artists. These people may not be household names, but are still top-notch performers!','/vAaMNrlkIDIVYH39SL0eUsRjQCx.jpg','2017-06-29',99,'Released','Out of the Shadows, Into the Spotlight.','Hired Gun',386128,1.3935,7.1,'P9VXLyh-BXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39806,_binary '\0','/308b0oKxDsVNRDjG9g9bjR5SalJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4026562',4.7,2115,'en','Hollows Grove','A young filmmaker documents his ghost-hunting, reality show friends as their routine investigation of an abandoned orphanage turns into a nightmare from which they can\'t escape.','/vGBYU0HeS2UFAFz63iP1lMrnsAM.jpg','2014-10-21',81,'Released',NULL,'Hollows Grove',298609,1.4868,4.8,'dlQLD__67PI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39807,_binary '\0','/hWvaWEpCAbaOc9VpLkrJFsMTfL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4027270',6.1,1544,'zh','太平轮（下）：彼岸','A story of three couples and their intertwining love stories set in 1940s Taiwan and Shanghai, centered around the 1949 sinking of Taiping.','/zZr58P3WKR8IpvhioLCD4CG6waa.jpg','2015-07-30',131,'Released',NULL,'The Crossing II',295273,1.9755,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39808,_binary '\0','/5gdCKBnWC6EokPcwlaljJ2NBlfw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4027504',6.4,2203,'en','Lazy Eye','Passions reignite and hidden secrets revealed when a graphic designer in Los Angeles reconnects with an ex-lover he hasn’t seen or heard from in 15 years. Over the course of a weekend at a vacation house in the desert, they must determine whether or not they have a future together.','/5PMqXRm4ICv4JeSBMQP84fNlw7H.jpg','2016-11-11',87,'Released','An ex-love story.','Lazy Eye',399417,1.6593,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39809,_binary '\0','/oL7boKrLfbsTNlCplrJ26UkJoYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4028134',3,2155,'en','Lake Fear','Four girls go to a cabin in the woods, which is inhabited by evil. This cabin then ensnares them in a labyrinth of macabre as they must battle their way out.','/jXchehxiyWvKrV8PzjDKYjDwLMv.jpg','2014-12-01',89,'Released','It\'s been waiting...to get under your skin','Lake Fear',356690,2.3592,4.262,'lTnAflp89G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39810,_binary '\0','/4hAhZ66n5iasGtSYHTFg6oGdJk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4028464',7,30485,'no','De uskyldige','Four children become friends during the summer holidays, and out of sight of the adults they discover they have hidden powers. While exploring their newfound abilities in the nearby forests and playgrounds, their innocent play takes a dark turn and strange things begin to happen.','/dqvkxOLmnHgDOqZlT7GgMWEQViR.jpg','2021-09-03',117,'Released',NULL,'The Innocents',660942,4.9817,6.919,'3kwiM2u9-Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39811,_binary '\0','/trtFAmf4IcndxSh5tIfLwxPyW67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4029412',3.6,4632,'en','Panama','An ex-marine is hired by a defense contractor to travel to Panama to complete an arms deal. In the process he becomes involved with the U.S. invasion of Panama, and learns an important lesson about the true nature of political power.','/u9DzgsmssidygWuORgYzhi317vj.jpg','2022-03-17',95,'Released','The revolution is heating up.','Panama',628878,3.0272,5.1,'PXX6ftZHteo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39812,_binary '\0','/p2qtXoAAPs5grMwxsZkDmUHv3Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4029998',6.5,1665,'en','My Life Directed by Nicolas Winding Refn','A documentary directed by Winding Refn\'s wife, Liv Corfixen, and it follows the Danish-born filmmaker during the making of his 2013 film Only God Forgives.','/tH83eBJ10SrhJhOPnl4mv0ofp23.jpg','2015-02-27',58,'Released',NULL,'My Life Directed by Nicolas Winding Refn',291868,1.8856,6.4,'L4ENePj7Xxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39813,_binary '\0','/AhL1bS7GnKLF280kXGNeOi04KFS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4030442',4.9,3809,'en','From the Dark','A couple on a trip through the Irish countryside find themselves hunted by a creature who only attacks at night.','/gNFVq2Zb4lFQZNdSBRAE8CBCBcA.jpg','2014-04-14',90,'Released','Pray for dawn.','From the Dark',291865,1.4898,5.6,'2PJjxjDSmHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39814,_binary '\0','/9NHAlsuQkMv4IyAR1gLkGrE7XoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4030600',4.3,27942,'en','The Bye Bye Man','When three college students move into an old house off campus, they unwittingly unleash a supernatural entity known as The Bye Bye Man, who comes to prey upon them once they discover his name. The friends must try to save each other, all the while keeping The Bye Bye Man\'s existence a secret to save others from the same deadly fate.','/bape74Eeli5NJ6x4UKuUr604xXh.jpg','2017-01-12',96,'Released','Don\'t think it. Don\'t say it.','The Bye Bye Man',292280,7.4343,5.207,'2X2QJAa3FTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39815,_binary '\0','/zWafJY58fq3i9mpCHkjNLO0elxf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4031126',3.5,1865,'en','Lycan','When six college kids in a sleepy Southern town are assigned a group project to rediscover a moment in history, one of them sets in motion a horrific fate when he proposes they head into the Georgia backwoods to tackle the legend of Emily Burt, the Talbot County werewolf.','/bStFPau3sMO4v1XqEuDHsAdZgEf.jpg','2017-08-04',87,'Released',NULL,'Lycan',440020,1.7589,4.4,'HAllgEkos8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39816,_binary '\0','/xL0mMT8yZHEkY6KfhkFnNIXPHAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4033926',6.5,1637,'en','Rats','Based on Robert Sullivan’s bestselling book, Morgan Spurlock and his team travel around the world to bring viewers face to face with rats while delving into humans’ complicated relationship with the creepy creatures.','/plypMjxhpRo5IyMm9Pmlxj3WpJb.jpg','2016-09-23',84,'Released','A new documentary from Super Size Me\'s Morgan Spurlock','Rats',410794,0.735,6,'qZdw6lJu0gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39817,_binary '\0','/axIGPUM5E6TT6rs3IAVc7FuL0PZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4034208',6.1,2245,'ca','La propera pell','A teenager who went missing and was presumed dead returns home after eight years to find a family deeply affected by his disappearance. Gradually, doubts arise about whether he really is the missing boy or an impostor.','/qqSw804KsjYMeHNxXwWGZ8s23qw.jpg','2016-10-21',100,'Released',NULL,'The Next Skin',348555,1.2891,5.8,'TRR51GjL8cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39818,_binary '\0','/fjk4eE8Ypke4YLv5A3ArDH4GzYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4034228',7.8,363266,'en','Manchester by the Sea','After his older brother passes away, Lee Chandler is forced to return home to care for his 16-year-old nephew. There he is compelled to deal with a tragic past that separated him from his family and the community where he was born and raised.','/o9VXYOuaJxCEKOxbA86xqtwmqYn.jpg','2016-11-17',138,'Released','I can\'t beat it.','Manchester by the Sea',334541,15.4676,7.549,'NxQmuJnrjxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39819,_binary '\0','/xo6Sedrdj4DVnh4ZEzDM4D0QQYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4034354',6.9,142733,'en','Swiss Army Man','Alone on a tiny deserted island, Hank has given up all hope of ever making it home again. But one day everything changes when a dead body washes ashore, and he soon realizes it may be his last opportunity to escape certain death. Armed with his new “friend” and an unusual bag of tricks, the duo go on an epic adventure to bring Hank back to the woman of his dreams.','/xE2QfqvAGI8n8ckIiy9FzS9XF94.jpg','2016-06-24',97,'Released','We all need some body to lean on.','Swiss Army Man',347031,6.083,6.913,'4v92gXetGqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39820,_binary '\0','/1CDUzgUuTTCV5LzoyRdmbcayQJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4034452',6.5,10111,'en','Hyena Road','Three different men, three different worlds, three different wars – all stand at the intersection of modern warfare – a murky world of fluid morality where all is not as it seems. A unique and dramatic look at the Canadian Army in Afghanistan.','/zdn34Jx3rRkhDGsD0qcB0cA1HzB.jpg','2015-10-09',120,'Released','One bullet can change everything','Hyena Road',316042,3.5684,6.858,'168LvOIoUUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39821,_binary '\0','/euAyS2Z9VXf0A8F2IOC2SOLZNdA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4035268',5.7,2344,'fr','Cosmos','Two young men seek the solitude of the country; their peace is disturbed when a set of random occurrences suggest to their susceptible minds a pattern with sinister meanings.','/wquuj8Xlum4rUXCahVWbYSHpdzN.jpg','2015-12-03',102,'Released',NULL,'Cosmos',315868,1.7981,6.5,'4GfS3zr-N20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39822,_binary '\0','/sCMgVQSSStso689J1N4EYc547ke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4035898',4.7,3836,'en','The Evil in Us','While on a fourth of July holiday, six best friends fall victim to the insidious plan of a terrorist organization when they unknowingly take a bio-active drug that transforms them into bloodthirsty cannibals.','/5hjpfY7faXYclLRK0DDPPWtShyp.jpg','2016-08-19',91,'Released',NULL,'The Evil in Us',396004,2.1942,5,'kM7g9V4xlUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39823,_binary '\0','/o7WlgJCVD1bUN2Ig4a8Y4hWZB1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40381358',7.6,4083,'hu','Tavaszi szél - az ébredés','Follows the birth of a political and social movement from the inside, with Péter Magyar as its face. For more than a year, the filmmakers accompanied him on country tours, campaign sites, and background conversations, as well as being present in those quiet, intimate moments – many times in his own home – that have remained hidden from the public until now.','/9mvoVo2I7HeODEjFl1ryH66sc5x.jpg','2026-03-12',101,'Released','The Awakening','Spring Wind - The Awakening',1645551,2.6194,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39824,_binary '\0','/ggOz8X6UnMkfxQb9koKpWb4eSnc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4041382',6.8,1575,'en','Gourmet Detective: A Healthy Place to Die','When Henry is invited as a guest speaker at a luxury resort spa, he quickly finds himself at the center of another murder. With Maggie at his side, our favorite duo must not only find the killer but be careful they don\'t become his latest victim.','/6tNpD8NCMojed9X9bYyi4IrXpaI.jpg','2015-08-02',84,'Released',NULL,'Gourmet Detective: A Healthy Place to Die',348631,2.1509,6.7,'ZBVKbSjKONY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39825,_binary '\0','/gY6kVEUqOkVu6B6FARpgHwjoKW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4042818',6.1,8403,'en','The Death & Life of John F. Donovan','A decade after the death of an American TV star, a young actor reminisces about the written correspondence he once shared with the former, as well as the impact those letters had on both their lives.','/2bhI7Ivk7VmvUaJaDTxJUgOXp1E.jpg','2019-03-13',123,'Released',NULL,'The Death & Life of John F. Donovan',291984,4.3512,6.859,'Zr86uisFYsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39826,_binary '\0','/pNDmV7AY84jgw2bMB34DF4aWKdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4042994',6.8,3136,'ja','世界から猫が消えたなら','A postman learns that he doesn\'t have much time left to live due to a terminal illness. A devil then appears in front of him and offers to extend his life if he picks something in the world that will disappear. The man thinks about his relationships with ex-friends, ex-lovers, relatives and colleagues who will be sincerely sad when he dies.','/efi1s160pIiADWDEkx0eQCVcYyq.jpg','2016-05-14',103,'Released',NULL,'If Cats Disappeared from the World',390930,1.8218,6.77,'uArkZ8hnRG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39827,_binary '\0','/2r4KjntMBwCPITn2R7AvPsxv4wC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40430802',3.5,1477,'ml','ഡർബി','A campus entertainer who follows a group of college students navigating friendship, rivalry, love, and ambition. What begins as carefree fun soon turns into intense competition as campus pride and personal egos come into play.','/zaTTuhOJMTzlSRx7kvzVZevc2wQ.jpg','2026-03-27',135,'Released',NULL,'Derby',1070170,2.4583,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39828,_binary '\0','/godZeVdLEH6YFOBPajdLkAvhy5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4044364',8,60370,'en','Citizenfour','In June 2013, Laura Poitras and reporter Glenn Greenwald flew to Hong Kong for the first of many meetings with Edward Snowden. She brought her camera with her.','/nOVhX69EAxtSKEEnr5UcSd5UVci.jpg','2014-10-10',113,'Released',NULL,'Citizenfour',293310,2.7738,7.736,'PX2uyP9QGjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39829,_binary '\0','/8q6AJYqJzZPrNSbttcwslXx7QgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4044464',5.1,2140,'en','Adulterers','On a steamy New Orleans afternoon, Sam Deuprey decides to surprise his beautiful wife, Ashley, for their anniversary and comes home early. But Ashley is not alone in the bedroom. She and her lover, Damien are about to learn how far a jealous husband will go.','/7weaBxcimjsN9zi89Dfk4fZFCUE.jpg','2016-01-05',97,'Released','Love. Betrayal. Vengeance.','Adulterers',376004,3.674,6.195,'rY6yhyDyEdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39830,_binary '\0','/gVPjIcYo1gTaACF43OMsralrcUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4045450',5.1,51388,'en','I Know What You Did Last Summer','When five friends inadvertently cause a deadly car accident, they cover up their involvement and make a pact to keep it a secret rather than face the consequences. A year later, their past comes back to haunt them and they\'re forced to confront a horrifying truth: someone knows what they did last summer…and is hell-bent on revenge.','/8FP2ObEGIiQYQCf83gL4ZVzwZF8.jpg','2025-07-16',111,'Released','You get the ending you deserve.','I Know What You Did Last Summer',1083433,17.2967,5.6,'9QABNfDhSxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39831,_binary '\0','/rl5ZF4RhGiBsH3DC9HnKaGpgeH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4045894',5,1341,'en','Get the Girl','A wealthy young man is conned into staging a fake kidnapping in order to be a hero and win the affection of a girl he\'s madly in love with. But when one of the hired kidnappers is accidentally killed during the charade, he\'s forced to actually save her life while not revealing that it\'s been a ruse all along.','/ooDZ9Z9ze3Q9UXrNzicMvM5WoRY.jpg','2017-01-27',87,'Released','Love makes you do crazy things','Get the Girl',433621,1.5183,5.1,'Qpb5FBgwGgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39832,_binary '\0','/4mcOCiR06dqQ5eoEJcG3zvonjOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4046784',6.3,312877,'en','Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials','Thomas and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD’s vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.','/mYw7ZyejqSCPFlrT2jHZOESZDU3.jpg','2015-09-09',131,'Released','The maze was just the beginning.','Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials',294254,16.049,6.731,'-44_igsZtgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39833,_binary '\0','/4jnbE4Ldv0zsKE5eZPtPflGTxCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4047104',7.6,1998,'ta','எனக்குள் ஒருவன்','A man suffering from insomnia is tricked into buying a drug, Lucia, that makes his desires come true in his dreams, blurring the line between fantasy and reality.','/qUvOdFTawfEle7WTuLeukGBNSKu.jpg','2015-03-06',136,'Released',NULL,'Enakkul Oruvan',307002,0.879,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39834,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4047112',8,2432,'ta','ஜீவா','Jeeva is the story about an ardent cricket fan and his dream to play international matches. How he manages to balance his love life and achieve his cricketing dreams forms the plot of the movie.','/sLOlBn38T6YcV9bb1I6PAEebZJO.jpg','2014-09-26',128,'Released',NULL,'Jeeva',294655,1.0799,7.094,'NvEJOGoSfMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39835,_binary '\0','/97zsSRAK1mrV6pd7JssmBsnb0Hz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4047140',5.4,1565,'ta','பூஜை','Anna Thandavam, a big shot who arranges for contract killers, plans to murder Sivakkozhundhu, a cop. His plan goes bust after Vasu, a heroic young man, rescues the ADSP. Meanwhile, Thandavam also gets into problems with Vasu\'s family...','/8ZDix6C0DO8lW10vnEklotMky8K.jpg','2014-10-22',154,'Released',NULL,'Poojai',297125,1.2773,5.222,'imq3oDkPhw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39836,_binary '\0','/nLxero3KYcKTZHGTeutrM7TkJpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4047350',6.4,2007,'en','The Hacker Wars','h)ac(k)tivist-noun: a person who uses technology to bring about social change. The Hacker Wars - a film about the targeting of (h)ac(k)tivists, activists and journalists by the US government. There is a war going on- the war for our minds. The Hacker Wars.','/uSLkyiw4AYQa7GknELYgyVw6L2L.jpg','2014-10-17',91,'Released','The War has already begun!','The Hacker Wars',296941,0.9695,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39837,_binary '\0','/pMkOPu1haWNROEAg5LTzjKQymWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4047846',7.1,1360,'nl','Home','After 17-year-old Kevin is released from prison for violent behavior he goes to live with his aunt and her family including Sammy, his cousin. While apprenticing as a plumber he starts to integrate with Sammy’s group of friends who are still in high school. Like all teenagers they just want to party and ignore any responsibilities, but one of them is hiding a problem at home that will put the entire group in jeopardy.','/ngH0tom6WGO0LgDX7gpFzaMWf21.jpg','2016-09-03',103,'Released',NULL,'Home',411037,1.9196,7,'DFhOFoC-hwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39838,_binary '\0','/hJcWvo06Pze18parZGOjbfh7m9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4048050',6.7,4008,'fr','Trois souvenirs de ma jeunesse','Paul is preparing to leave Tajikistan, while thinking back on his adolescent years. His childhood, his mother\'s madness, the parties, the trip to the USSR where he lost his virginity, the friend who betrayed him and the love of his life.','/aCOt7X4JoGz5MlGVX7nog5TDEzv.jpg','2015-05-20',123,'Released',NULL,'My Golden Days',315575,2.3325,6.652,'v4D7XhKZoTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39839,_binary '\0','/dwBdfo10gulOpTpmlJMczr5GhZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4048272',7.3,55651,'de','Toni Erdmann','Convinced that his daughter has forgotten how to laugh, a father shows up unannounced while she\'s living abroad and bombards her with outrageous jokes.','/v3gf7T8hb8aYv05X2jHmxJQWPZr.jpg','2016-07-14',162,'Released','Life is just passing by...','Toni Erdmann',374475,4.6955,6.9,'Ym8ZpHhxcl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39840,_binary '\0','/o6mncf8M3UR4W4ppHYuzwVI9AWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4048668',6,4789,'en','Band of Robbers','A comedic thriller that re-imagines Mark Twain\'s iconic literary characters of \"Huckleberry Finn\" and \"Tom Sawyer\" as grown men in current day.','/3gI49YGN95dfipPoofOdQlEkqqr.jpg','2016-01-15',95,'Released','From Mark Twain\'s iconic books','Band of Robbers',333675,2.2521,5.9,'OhaGtecRbH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39841,_binary '\0','/dMy6C8tcvXNFuOdL6pdppmvAgia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4052050',5.3,10542,'en','He\'s Out There','On vacation at a remote lake house, a mother and her two young daughters must fight for survival after falling into a terrifying and bizarre nightmare conceived by a psychopath.','/pi9Zo4uIATSe8cQ96cCOWJ1qdGw.jpg','2018-10-25',89,'Released',NULL,'He\'s Out There',431185,3.9371,5.9,'IDRt1CyWjNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39842,_binary '\0','/89ZSaf9Ofm7oDounnCOu4ktGI9e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4052882',6.3,155495,'en','The Shallows','While surfing on a secluded beach, Nancy finds herself in the feeding grounds of a great white shark. Though stranded only 200 yards from shore, survival proves to be the ultimate test of wills, requiring all of her ingenuity, resourcefulness, and fortitude.','/bnBV7hZmLuA0Si5Aop481sPF2RY.jpg','2016-06-24',86,'Released','What was once in the deep is now in the shallows.','The Shallows',332567,11.9015,6.4,'EgdxIlSuB70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39843,_binary '\0','/gpLMx5JhKzK5cGrhv7fXiLJH4M9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4054004',5.1,2249,'en','Virtual Revolution','Paris 2047. Most of the population spend all their time online, connected into virtual worlds, and don\'t care anymore about reality. A shadow agent, Nash, working for one of the multinational companies behind these virtual worlds, is tracking down terrorists who threaten the system...','/lxB6QUCLcmAgdYbSVhpdKYbTPQA.jpg','2016-10-12',92,'Released','The Revolution did happen. Just not the way they thought it would.','Virtual Revolution',401294,1.6279,5.1,'uk_jMDn7A3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39844,_binary '\0','/bxN9vWp9SYw6IYmM4yqu18CMaQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40541175',4.7,1684,'te','Dark Night','Hema and Arun’s bond begins with a chance accident and grows closer with time. But with Hema already married, emotions start to complicate everything. Will this connection cost her the life she has built?','/fgE9wVdrImP2bCXsom4wgPEdlNZ.jpg','2026-03-13',117,'Released',NULL,'Dark Night',1666400,0.9753,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39845,_binary '\0','/eRpVvbvvO7UCA2vTGant3kq1zSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4054654',4.8,10592,'en','Dog Eat Dog','Ex-cons Troy, Mad Dog, and Diesel are hired by an eccentric mob boss to kidnap a baby and hold it for a large ransom. When the abduction goes awry, the men find themselves on the run from the mob and the cops. Vowing to stay out of prison at all costs, getting away with the crime is a matter of life and death.','/ve6qJRjs2OUsXLIHLson3j4eVTB.jpg','2016-11-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Dog Eat Dog',354979,4.7511,5.132,'0EBcYOpS2iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39846,_binary '\0','/xfZ2u86Tui0aTKcPYcKGStzxWZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4054952',7.4,4818,'ja','劇場版「Fate/stay night [Heaven’s Feel]」Ⅰ.presage flower','Ten years after the Fourth Holy Grail War, a devastating clash between Masters and Servants, another war erupts. Shirou Emiya, whose father fought in the first battle, was leading a peaceful life with the warmhearted Sakura Matou. But when hidden forces begin to stir, Shirou resolves to fulfill his father’s dying wish, protect Sakura, and fight for the Holy Grail.','/6nEtmBg07DA5BWjcrmD49rxHsVQ.jpg','2017-10-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Fate/stay night: Heaven\'s Feel I. Presage Flower',283984,4.3652,7.4,'4rTEWyfE_nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39847,_binary '\0','/ycGFcMLv6xlj0EzxKhbZHhXT1vb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4056738',6.1,8796,'en','Do You Believe?','When a pastor is shaken by the visible faith of a street-corner preacher, he is reminded that true belief always requires action. His response ignites a journey that impacts everyone it touches in ways that only God could orchestrate.','/89fJ4hV9fCB01EvhhLOgjMJI4A6.jpg','2015-03-20',115,'Released','12 unique lives. 12 different stories will bring them all together.','Do You Believe?',309425,3.3085,6.782,'ogIX2Q7tEdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39848,_binary '\0','/mJbEcp6qEqE7OcfecjzUPKBzL9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40572470',8.1,1445,'te','దీవానా','Munna, an ordinary boy in an ordinary world, sees a beauty that feels beyond his reach. While he struggles to become worthy of her, she is quietly learning to leave.','/3QkUCZep8cWBcu3982OrYitb9L1.jpg','2026-06-19',153,'Released',NULL,'Deewana',1649874,2.8956,4,'f-ok5QZNGVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39849,_binary '\0','/68chxvkKe8Zty1MNY1cCoBAKWs1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4057376',6.8,7387,'ru','Он - дракон','In the midst of the wedding princess Miroslava is kidnapped by a dragon and carried away into his castle on the remote island. Mira left everything behind in the past - family, friends and groom. Now the only things she had were a stone cage and a mysterious young man named Arman ... but who is he and what is he doing on that island? Miroslava will know the truth too late: loving a dragon will reveal the bitter truth - love is scary.','/9R9mwkXs0W78WMzh4M1yFP7v7RP.jpg','2015-12-03',110,'Released',NULL,'I Am Dragon',370964,4.8696,7.199,'DrLgUOeCeyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39850,_binary '\0','/9ADmkRHERE3zsy6hrfFfOIRNHJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4057632',7.2,2912,'fr','Nous trois ou rien','An Iranian family survives the shah and the ayatollah and moves to France. This story follows the family through it all. Despite the politics, revolution, prison, beatings, assassinations and suicides this is a comedy.','/aPYtRdJwt85OgZIUBZ5tHgmfyCO.jpg','2015-11-04',102,'Released',NULL,'All Three of Us',364137,2.5077,7.5,'IS-RD1CHEvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39851,_binary '\0','/ltsFodtv3niSjoveURcJAkTAcpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4058012',6.3,10588,'en','96 Souls','A university research scientist, about to lose funding and status, has a lab accident and discovers he can see people\'s true intentions -- making his situation even worse.','/bN98WDPCKtewXT8sfJgD8sGM5fk.jpg','2016-06-03',112,'Released','See what isn\'t there.','96 Souls',446594,1.3512,4.4,'NLCwBNQa0-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39852,_binary '\0','/u1dnUsnf2TVzPQNcpa1gZXwPC4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4058210',6.3,1816,'pt','Operações Especiais','In a crime-plagued area of Rio de Janeiro, a team of honest cops, including a determined rookie, fights corruption and mistrust on all sides.','/nq7iMDsMGhctGWYdA5SUCOZdNOl.jpg','2015-10-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Operações Especiais',363925,1.171,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39853,_binary '\0','/5kgm1kubnGUwhd8oEqKa9lfW2hY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4058500',6.8,5470,'fr','Un Homme idéal','A struggling writer finds a shortcut to fame, but a blackmailer threatens to ruin his perfect life.','/dgmgPPPI3APwLHXRvxaGCWGf3FE.jpg','2015-03-18',103,'Released',NULL,'A Perfect Man',322125,1.9755,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39854,_binary '\0','/3m7252MFY0YkOrr7SmnPEhuSha6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4058618',5.9,6212,'en','The Thicket','An innocent young man, Jack, goes on an epic quest to rescue his sister Lula after she has been kidnapped by the violent killer Cut Throat Bill and her gang. To save her, Jack enlists the help of a crafty bounty hunter named Reginald Jones, a grave-digging alcoholic son of an ex-slave, and a street-smart prostitute. The gang tracks Cut Throat Bill into the deadly no-man’s land known as The Big Thicket — a place where blood and chaos reign.','/ukqWWQrJRgJym6dsTt1x3EwR2Kp.jpg','2024-09-05',105,'Released','Death comes fast in Texas','The Thicket',395817,7.9521,6.393,'X2Ff_QHDNVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39855,_binary '\0','/qPwGvbhKPel3OHPcby5O7Nwqbhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4058836',2.4,4359,'en','I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu','Following her rape, Jennifer Hills wrote a bestselling account of her ordeal and of the controversial trial in which she was accused of taking the law into her own hands and brutally killing her assailants. In the small town where the rape and revenge took place, the relatives of the rapists she killed are furious that the court declared her not guilty and resolve to take justice into their own hands.','/hrD8fU6tA1Pzh4ybxG4iN5TbVdU.jpg','2019-04-23',148,'Released','Vengeance thy name is woman.','I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu',369196,4.0618,3,'hm9IfhqhFcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39856,_binary '\0','/6OsRCfP25pcy7yWOVrUA7t8ADuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4059702',3.8,13512,'en','AmeriGeddon','A dire warning of a wake up call of what might be our future when a globalist terrorist organization aligned with the United Nations disables the United States power grid and institutes Martial Law. It will take a dedicated family of patriots armed with strong survival skills and the remains of the Second Amendment to save America and reclaim its freedom.','/47SDujdaNHdK4lrkcfS6HVM0u9z.jpg','2016-05-13',90,'Released','You were WARNED','AmeriGeddon',395938,1.7393,4,'vHO7jUuhOWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39857,_binary '\0','/gPgv2zstVv2uLHIZ3tkb1B1XK82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4060544',3.7,2478,'zh','舞出我人生之舞所不能','Two young people from different social classes put aside their differences and come together to form a dance group and win a championship in China.','/yS5lcaUfFsl7gUT5mSEylECzoqN.jpg','2019-06-26',100,'Released',NULL,'Step Up: Year of the Dance',593680,3.0487,6.1,'jRlVV38txiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39858,_binary '\0','/fbtQjNqEwFS1vA8Lbq9XVE1NUEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4060576',4.6,3951,'en','Lavalantula','Giant lava breathing tarantulas – Lavalantulas – erupt out of ancient volcanos in the Santa Monica Mountains, raining death and destruction upon Los Angeles. With the City of Angels on the verge of incineration, only a washed up ‘90s action hero actor stands in the way of this monstrous swarm of bloodthirsty creatures who burn their victims alive.','/fOcUwBJ2eOekwqBtJZncnrshtos.jpg','2015-07-25',83,'Released','Fire Burns... Lava Bites','Lavalantula',294562,2.4774,4.8,'AY_Cp3rRR3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39859,_binary '\0','/o4ym626hChKwhnoTG5ecjhmlqjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4060866',4.1,3328,'en','Code of Honor','Colonel Robert Sikes is on a mission to rid his city of crime. As a stealthy, one-man assault team, he will take on street gangs, mobsters, and politicians with extreme prejudice until his mission is complete. His former protégé, William Porter, teams up with the local police department to bring his former commander to justice and prevent him from further vigilantism.','/zoNvd5DNrQwGjc9lVit7rJMYFQY.jpg','2016-05-06',107,'Released','There is no honor in revenge.','Code of Honor',389425,3.6349,4.1,'dcX1IyfPXtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39860,_binary '\0','/uxn2Y3zgi0ejkIFQdLWpNRA0h17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4061010',5.3,11437,'en','Blackway','A young woman newly returned to her hometown becomes the subject of harassment by a man named Blackway, an ex-cop turned violent crime lord who operates with impunity in this small community on the edge of the wilderness. Forsaken by the local townspeople—and advised by the Sheriff to leave town—Lillian decides instead to take a stand against her sociopathic stalker, and enlists the help of ex-logger Lester and his laconic young sidekick.','/e1ThQ0GGQ2IQ3bwSTR7mB406QV5.jpg','2015-10-03',90,'Released','Sometimes revenge is the only answer.','Blackway',359790,3.6276,5.319,'wA09LSnRZcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39861,_binary '\0','/rJFerFqrKx6jL2i9TjbMNAx5ptd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4061620',7.1,15281,'en','Firebird','At the height of the Cold War, a troubled soldier forms a forbidden love triangle with a daring fighter pilot and his female comrade amid the dangerous surroundings of a Soviet Air Force Base.','/uECWNRjCEwewHBjt0leyZiAyiXb.jpg','2021-10-29',107,'Released','Risk everything, trust no one','Firebird',797838,3.9096,7.4,'D7XT9OWifHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39862,_binary '\0','/dC1JJcTphwDOvva5BVWtM6nMsUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4062524',2.8,1282,'tr','Sabit Kanca 2','Sabit Kanca\'s landlord, Uncle Rıfat, wants to marry Rencide Posuk, whom he saw on television. However, Rencide does not like Uncle Rıfat when they first meet. It is up to Kanca to reconcile them, and he is forced to do so because of his accumulated rent debts. While Kanca is trying to resolve the situation, Turabi, the ex-boyfriend of Rencide\'s daughter Zeliş, also gets involved. When Turabi kidnaps Rencide to marry Zeliş, whom he is obsessively in love with, the situation escalates. Of course, it is Sabit Kanca\'s responsibility to resolve the situation.','/3ycbfHOyO0hUDVvT9DyCx6p8fjz.jpg','2014-10-24',94,'Released',NULL,'Sabit Kanca 2',334661,0.9125,2.1,'55eR3U8FcIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39863,_binary '\0','/qRjahAq8JVoJBT2x18x2A01kxZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4062536',6.9,155672,'en','Green Room','Members of a punk rock band and a tough young woman are forced to fight for survival after witnessing an act of violence at a skinhead bar.','/evZicaR7nXe4LiD9G6QYTorcJGO.jpg','2016-04-15',95,'Released','One way in. No way out.','Green Room',313922,9.4034,6.719,'1iwZtccz8Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39864,_binary '\0','/zvQL0mlcaEcmnMg1Crm9YlgVS6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4063178',5.4,1644,'en','The Dog Lover','Sara Gold is a young girl on a quest to save man\'s best friend. When she goes undercover to take down a dog breeder suspected of wrongdoing, she quickly finds out she might be on the wrong side of right. Sara must make a decision: to continue and follow the orders of her organization, United Animal Protection Agency, or trust her instincts and the boy she\'s fallen in love with.','/sDPBBKZAIP6r2OaLfNBSI1hdp2Q.jpg','2016-07-08',101,'Released','She ended up on the wrong side of right.','The Dog Lover',394047,2.2944,6.3,'ym4E7DcRExU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39865,_binary '\0','/eYkvV6sEKT6KAsteLkXqC2DkonC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4064498',6.4,1621,'de','Wo willst du hin, Habibi?','Ibrahim, a young German of Turkish descent, leads a double life, living with his tradition-bound family and spending his days looking for a respectable job. But outside his parent\'s apartment, Ibo (as he\'s called by his family and friends) is a confident gay man who works in a sex shop and is on the hunt for Mr. Right.','/aocD4Aje3DtGa4pIvEcaUiE8qWT.jpg','2015-10-01',80,'Released','Love, crime & an impossible friendship.','Where Are You Going, Habibi?',394148,2.409,6.2,'bf2LBDyOcIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39866,_binary '\0','/7xcvW5BL7WttEAPNTYYc6P7oy2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065212',4.6,1934,'en','My Bakery in Brooklyn','Brooklyn, New York. After the sudden death of their aunt Isabelle, Vivien and Chloe inherit her historic bakery. Vivien wants to keep up the tradition; Chloe feels that the business needs to be modernized. But when notified that they are about to be evicted, the two do not hesitate to work together to preserve the family legacy.','/JMQhYg65RQkpZhjeL4tPJVhIQ.jpg','2016-06-30',101,'Released','The sweet spot where anything goes','Bakery in Brooklyn',398891,2.4986,5.2,'69PgbLUzPsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39867,_binary '\0','/IorAAceTVBGg6Nf3b9X0DiibC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065308',6.1,1376,'it','Andiamo a quel paese','Valentino and Salvo, unemployed and in search of fortune and recommendation, leave Palermo for Valentino’s home town, Monteforte, where they will try to survive the Italian crisis by opening some sort of hospice.','/vcUKXHI7uOLJeLdresvwHlRpGfs.jpg','2014-11-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Go to the Country',301272,1.3105,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39868,_binary '\0','/kXi5VvOMtjpsWg6bbWfEvFECkBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065316',6.4,2252,'en','Best Christmas Party Ever','With the holidays approaching, a young party planner arranges a special Christmas party for a New York toy store. When a powerful corporation threatens to shut her down, she decides to follow her heart, moving forward with the party plans and finding true love in time for Christmas.','/agoyhbjPUsPZH7kBBK445RjingQ.jpg','2014-12-13',88,'Released',NULL,'Best Christmas Party Ever',299590,2.288,6,'fa-UQH95Qo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39869,_binary '\0','/4vn6RFptNH06W3jMNDumUgNLFte.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065324',5.9,1616,'en','The Christmas Parade','A popular network morning host finds herself humiliated on the air by her fiancé and disappears to a small town. While there, she helps a budding artist save a community art center for the town\'s kids, by helping them with their float for the annual Christmas Parade.','/xbFcTozizElEXP9uAxtTXbQa8mn.jpg','2014-12-14',83,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Parade',299591,1.3584,5.2,'ZPL58QbS4mA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39870,_binary '\0','/qPrTosB5nj0foje2dWxLK3TgLtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065336',7.5,1930,'en','Signed, Sealed, Delivered for Christmas','With a duty to deliver every last letter before Christmas, the beloved quartet of post office detectives—Oliver, Shane, Rita and Norman—are working around the clock to redirect Santa’s mail just as Oliver runs into his former Sunday school teacher. When they receive an emotional last-minute plea not meant for Saint Nick, but instead written to God, they must delay their own travel plans to make sure one little girl doesn’t lose her Christmas joy—something Oliver and Shane are also struggling to find as they each face painful holiday memories. With a little guidance from a mysterious post office volunteer, Jordan, the Postables are more surprised than anyone to discover they\'ve been a part of more than one miracle on this Christmas Eve.','/yoMg33yFaBs7JYt2pPAoe0E6q0Z.jpg','2014-11-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Signed, Sealed, Delivered for Christmas',308686,2.0903,6.8,'h7QDbfGEmL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39871,_binary '\0','/1TfScGaKVx1beBjSYoHKa76Jbqp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065340',4.4,1656,'en','Arthur & Merlin','In dark ages Britain, a time of magic and legend, a powerful druid is bent on destroying the Celtic people. Arthur, a banished warrior, and Merlin, a hermit wizard, embark on a heroic quest to stop the druid and save their people, before the Celts are lost forever and become a myth themselves.','/lItiYAN3Md0KFWSPvzw2TtB7pAE.jpg','2015-04-17',103,'Released','The Legend Begins','Arthur & Merlin',336149,1.8303,5,'KHX2QxiWE1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39872,_binary '\0','/oiE1b40PftzOpG5sZtRBYy6XBdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065414',7.3,1445,'en','A Good American','A Good American tells the story of the best code-breaker the USA ever had and how he and a small team within NSA created a surveillance tool that could pick up any electronic signal on earth, filter it for targets and render results in real-time while keeping the privacy as demanded by the US constitution.','/grtFcL23smodQNnXg2c6r5trWDX.jpg','2015-09-23',100,'Released','How our security was sold for money','A Good American',369168,0.9715,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39873,_binary '\0','/4lI768UFQXijUf9TlfWDnxS1nlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065552',7.7,14978,'fi','Tuntematon sotilas','The film follows Finnish army machine gun company in Continuation War against Soviet Union, 1941–1944. Based on Väinö Linna\'s best selling novel Tuntematon Sotilas (The Unknown Soldier) and the novel\'s uncensored version, Sotaromaani (A War Novel).','/dR37hrF6YDMSJCT4r30tOYzVath.jpg','2017-10-27',179,'Released','Finland, behold, thy daylight now is dawning.','Unknown Soldier',400728,3.2417,7.404,'NTYesNj_sBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39874,_binary '\0','/3UVCjEK3BITk3lrjuHTWLYRZ4Vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4065842',6.8,1357,'ja','家族はつらいよ','A husband and wife have been married for 50 years. For her birthday, the husband asks the wife what she wants for her birthday present. She replies that she wants a divorce. The wife\'s divorce announcement sends the entire family into chaos.','/7KarFzFYCUTLKKnUJ9L7Bo51Q2o.jpg','2016-03-16',108,'Released',NULL,'What a Wonderful Family!',389972,1.8373,7.282,'yz55D5k6FkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39875,_binary '\0','/8caeHarzL4rpFe6EWYFof5fjnY7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40667368',8.2,2148,'mr','बाप्या','In coastal Konkan, an ordinary family and their tight-knit town face change, identity, and buried emotions when an unexpected return from the past upends their settled lives.','/yVOBzsMG1efTuvOY3p1TYYOdZLI.jpg','2026-05-15',147,'Released',NULL,'Baapya',1608247,1.0206,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39876,_binary '\0','/kB4vc2xdKXKenivdrTSvmgm7QLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4067084',7,2907,'ar','الجزيرة ٢','Following the events of the first part, Mansour Al-Hefni escapes from prison and reunites with his son Ali and brother to return to the island to recover what they have lost. Mansour must stand against his old love Karima while the leader of the travelers tribe Sheikh Jaafar enters the conflict for rulership','/5vpv1j2Ah9JzvKYdxY4thet2evA.jpg','2014-10-01',158,'Released',NULL,'The Island 2',300810,1.2365,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39877,_binary '\0','/erFmrKdUrJhiPXuVu4PeKNZ743G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4067106',6,4781,'en','According to Ben Adams','Bored with his usual routine, the devil gets arrested just to see what will happen.','/wqbSlGUPfgUC8o0y8fbWxoc1Dlb.jpg','2016-04-13',105,'Released',NULL,'According to Ben Adams',528599,0.9716,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39878,_binary '\0','/aZW4mYjM3iuIdj72hswbnLT2GG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4067256',6.4,2664,'en','Recipe for Love','Lauren Hennessey has always loved to cook and is a proud perfectionist at her job at \"Food & Entertainment Magazine\'s\" test kitchen while she dreams of being able to finally afford culinary school in Paris. When her boss offers her a bonus if she agrees to ghostwrite the cookbook of a difficult celebrity chef, Lauren sees her dream becoming a reality as soon as she can tame the notorious bad boy chef in question, Dexter Durant. Slowly peeling back the layers of Dexter\'s tough-guy persona, she starts seeing a different, vulnerable side to this big-shot chef. Suddenly, their dueling culinary styles become the perfect complement in the kitchen and an attraction between them starts to boil over.','/ufxmSBb5CbmxdruL45WQYsW4mEI.jpg','2014-10-11',81,'Released',NULL,'Recipe for Love',293205,2.0412,5.9,'pAuV1XbpBLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39879,_binary '\0','/kPKwqHl2rYsi9rFWJWA6afKdmlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4068576',7.3,41481,'en','The Nightingale','In 1825, Clare, a 21-year-old Irish convict, chases a British soldier through the rugged Tasmanian wilderness, bent on revenge for a terrible act of violence he committed against her family. She enlists the services of an Aboriginal tracker who is also marked by trauma from his own violence-filled past.','/wEzqFiatOJSbGBu6pb8z5sQuZt1.jpg','2018-09-23',136,'Released','Her song will not be silenced.','The Nightingale',400090,5.9343,7.1,'K1n00SrhDXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39880,_binary '\0','/8p6bSZrhS4Mw5RcCDXlGKwZGNWG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4071086',6.4,1715,'de','Wild','An anarchist young woman breaks the tacit contract with civilization and fearlessly decides on a life without hypocrisy or an obligatory safety net.','/l6k6lwelksvyNhikBaXFGNTX8y5.jpg','2016-04-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Wild',371464,1.4244,6.1,'AB3vAZLB2-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39881,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4071498',6.4,1446,'en','Life in Color','With no place to live, two strangers are stuck house sitting together. At odds, Mary and Homer soon realize the gravity of their situation and the necessity of joining forces, making money and pulling themselves out of the emotional hole they have lived in for years. This grounded romantic dramedy explores the hidden issues we all bury beneath the surface in a raw and touching way with humor and honesty. The cast includes, Josh McDermitt from The Walking Dead, Jim O’Heir from Parks and Recreation, Adam Lustick from Harvard Sailing Team, and Fortune Feimster from Chelsea Lately. Life in Color marks Katharine Emmer’s directorial debut. She also wrote, produced, edited and stars in the film.','/yPsyTRhS4nTCp9ZhWtzDgqHS0Nt.jpg','2015-03-14',86,'Released',NULL,'Life in Color',324286,1.2666,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39882,_binary '\0','/r5GXidBpKAqpzMzFTfBIxIqXlAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4072326',6.8,11731,'en','Ali and Nino','Muslim prince Ali and Georgian aristocrat Nino have grown up in the Russian province of Azerbaijan. Their tragic love story sees the outbreak of the First World War and the world’s struggle for Baku’s oil. Ultimately they must choose to fight for their country’s independence or for each other.','/k678ohrP2DcfgElWZl2mxdO3vEd.jpg','2016-01-27',100,'Released','While the world was falling apart, they were falling in love.','Ali and Nino',371741,2.1846,6.494,'CDKjS2KL098','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39883,_binary '\0','/rlyI0CQaq5ZhPDhCa9vo3FTeHtO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4073682',6,1787,'en','Buğday','The global corporations have established cities and agricultural zones in areas where the climate is relatively good. These cities are populated by the elites, while the immigrant masses struggle with hunger and epidemics. For unknown reasons, the city’s agricultural plantations have been hit by a genetic crisis - and, as a result, by massive crop failure. Professor Erol Erin, a seed genetics specialist learns of Cemil Akman, a fellow scientist. Apparently, Cemil wrote a thesis about the recurrent crisis affecting genetically modified seeds - but the work was banned by the corporation..','/iVsdS41QLiBwEgLQtSZwWqZKs1N.jpg','2017-11-24',127,'Released',NULL,'Buğday',315840,2.2321,5.765,'BglePHle5Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39884,_binary '\0','/bhXTEJ8Oed7Ye7ig09qcilaaQr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4073696',6.8,1578,'en','The Go-Between','An elderly man pieces together his childhood memories after finding his diary from 1900, which he wrote when he was 13 years old.','/p3A7B8HEVruKqffvKvJovb8mcVT.jpg','2015-09-20',90,'Released',NULL,'The Go-Between',360695,1.6443,6.8,'sgYwwe1SL2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39885,_binary '\0','/5BxrMNGl3YDiWgHCVJu8iLQoJDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4073790',5.7,40971,'en','The Darkest Minds','After a disease kills 98% of America\'s children, the surviving 2% develop superpowers and are placed in internment camps. A 16-year-old girl escapes her camp and joins a group of other teens on the run from the government.','/8NdQneXBYVbBKt81bFhXiyThe0h.jpg','2018-07-25',105,'Released','The ones who changed will change everything.','The Darkest Minds',445651,8.4995,7.021,'L4YtUUk6lcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39886,_binary '\0','/sbUqaPCrTtexOuTuk5T3SBtlr6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4073890',2.7,3332,'en','Andron','A group of people are plunged into a dark, claustrophobic maze, where they must fight to survive, as the outside world watches.','/xVyHjAwCVYcoCQQHyc1zQH9DSoU.jpg','2015-11-08',100,'Released','Only one survives','Andron',395883,1.9855,3.6,'1FiPImddhz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39887,_binary '\0','/iow3SnZy3arN1eRyrEETuxUNMah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4074304',7,1557,'en','Pervert Park','Florida Justice Transitions is home to 120 convicted sex offenders. Like in many other U.S. states, sex offenders are not allowed to live within 1000 feet of places frequented by children. Because of this, many sex offenders live under bridges or in woods – or in Palace Mobile Home Park – known as Pervert Park. The crimes committed by the residents range from simple misdemeanors to horrendous acts unbearable to contemplate.','/85B8T6E4soJaYO38aCbqWiJjX52.jpg','2014-11-06',77,'Released',NULL,'Pervert Park',302502,1.5734,6.4,'9qOhXyfodpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39888,_binary '\0','/sUUePqQspPsXDR8XUC8DZUXMfTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4074364',5.7,4453,'da','The Model','When emerging fashion model Emma gets a chance to pursue her dream of becoming an international top model, she leaves her everyday life in Denmark behind, and moves to Paris. At a photo shoot in her new hometown, she meets the attractive photographer Shane White and they fall in love. But their relationship soon turns into a dangerous obsession for Emma.','/8kxdItrqseNI0jVana5Qi960kiI.jpg','2016-02-11',105,'Released',NULL,'The Model',348677,1.8205,5.8,'ZFh8psc_2AE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39889,_binary '\0','/ypwa0zn0BFNQGp21wBqX9b8sGFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4074502',6.9,1388,'de','Dark Star: HR Gigers Welt','An account of the life and work of Swiss painter, sculptor, architect and designer H. R. Giger (1940-2014), tormented father of creatures as fearsome as they are fascinating, inhabitants of nightmarish biomechanical worlds.','/iYnI4fSAzJ0PmzhRPF0XyrpVMys.jpg','2014-10-23',96,'Released','The Artist Who Designed Ridley Scott\'s Alien','Dark Star: H. R. Giger\'s World',295317,1.4087,6.9,'BGbqX_9bsWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39890,_binary '\0','/l2eQ14FPfdm8Wc7PLb2dx1BCMzc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4074928',5.9,5753,'es','Proyecto Lázaro','Marc, a successful, ambitious man, is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and is given a few months to live. Unable to accept death, he decides to cryogenically freeze himself. The love of his life is devastated. Seventy years later, Marc becomes the first cryogenic resuscitated person in history. But this doesn\'t happen in the idealized way he dreamt of.','/3FsN7qGW1U7Oi52vx3eVoGn9r8H.jpg','2016-12-13',112,'Released','Immortality is only a matter of time.','Realive',399612,2.2524,6.058,'xQ5Ht9psEDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39891,_binary '\0','/yiMkPecuBN1ln4qL14W11VDlc4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4075322',4.4,1235,'ru','Савва. Сердце воина','A fairytale about a grand life journey of a 10-year old boy Savva devoted to help his Mom and fellow village people to break free from the vicious hyenas.','/rNF4FPFOEDsh91HoBoKvzz4ARCK.jpg','2015-11-12',85,'Released','You need only wish with all of your heart!','Savva. Heart of the Warrior',367961,3.0224,5.5,'hJJ6qA_mTMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39892,_binary '\0','/iwDIPo3ZqHKbNjUC6ncfNPTIk1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4075520',6.4,1753,'nl','Ventoux','A group of friends reunite after 30 years to climb the Mont Ventoux again. Memories to a happy youth but also new discoveries from the past. One person is not present at the reunion. Why is that? What happened?','/kwBNWk3O6nl7MrwTOHrxWRTyo76.jpg','2015-05-14',108,'Released',NULL,'Ventoux',328692,1.0121,5.7,'Se2mdg4otU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39893,_binary '\0','/8mvYcUFJ20h2lKHKeBr2px824XW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076058',7,2419,'de','Wir sind jung. Wir sind stark.','On 24th August 1992 in the eastern German city of Rostock, a rampaging mob, to the applause and cheering of more than 3,000 bystanders, besieged and set fire to a residential building containing, among others, more than 120 Vietnamese men, women, and children on what has since become known as \"The Night of the Fire.\" The riots became a symbol of xenophobia in the just-reunited Germany. This film recounts the incident from the perspectives of three very different characters.','/4x4AZaukJLCkHiY8p9UXyjNiH2U.jpg','2014-10-21',123,'Released',NULL,'We Are Young. We Are Strong.',302376,1.8472,6.8,'d1ukKLgU8VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39894,_binary '\0','/qjFtDMY5fuVlMtQA8GuA5eXPcpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076756',7.2,1378,'en','Being Evel','In the history of sports, few names are more recognizable than that of Evel Knievel. Long after the man hung up his famous white leather jumpsuit and rode his Harley into the sunset, his name is still synonymous with the death-defying lifestyle he led. Notoriously brash, bold, and daring, Knievel stared death in the face from the seat of his motorcycle, but few know the larger-than-life story of the boy from Butte, Montana.','/4SQZ8c6C0pb7n8cUkcAciUMB9mI.jpg','2015-01-23',100,'Released','Risk everything. Regret nothing.','Being Evel',317655,2.27,6.7,'3MFAQ368E3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39895,_binary '\0','/1ee7AmCE5S40A8kCinvhFtNMLYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076760',4.5,5565,'en','Diablo','A young civil war veteran is forced on a desperate journey to save his kidnapped wife.','/6uAVDyWhkXfaMo09hNpyqR0xkFp.jpg','2016-01-08',83,'Released','Beyond Hope. Beyond Regret. Beyond Salvation.','Diablo',362703,2.6119,4.9,'xL9F-Irm5tQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39896,_binary '\0','/2Lu1jb8kv93ciXYhmUlsj0E2RK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40769151',6.6,2990,'hi','The Great Grand Superhero: Aliens Ka Aagman','Follows a grandfather and grandson whose relationship transforms through the child\'s imagination when they encounter aliens.','/6CYmHknTN2UGGhqQUZh4tqQ6fEr.jpg','2026-05-28',112,'Released',NULL,'The Great Grand Superhero: Aliens Ka Aagman',1653208,3.552,8,'ZHz0pOzPEi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39897,_binary '\0','/pJrdDQzBtCGoFBV0Kcm8HHF82wX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076926',4.3,1974,'en','The Heyday of the Insensitive Bastards','Seven vignettes explore the difference between fantasy and reality, memory and history, and the joy and agony of the human condition.','/15Qhcj5lZsJDKS4p98jMX2plgjs.jpg','2015-03-25',97,'Released',NULL,'The Heyday of the Insensitive Bastards',333033,2.0361,4.8,'LKfKhy7z6dI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39898,_binary '\0','/wpDlX8vEHnJSvHCrprMtVM5tDnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076934',5.9,2499,'zh','我的特工爷爷','A retired bodyguard who has settled into a corner of the world where China, Russia and North Korea meet as he suffers from early dementia finds a new friend in a young girl. When her life is threatened by her father\'s connection with a local crime lord, the bodyguard must call upon his long forgotten skills to save her.','/kF4myFLIDxqsuce5swGLWP6XKze.jpg','2016-04-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The Bodyguard',315669,3.1192,5.854,'i_O-c3p6T-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39899,_binary '\0','/1BOrGO9c86ctTeZxECYsmoxHwjL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4076980',4.7,2018,'en','The Throwaways','Notorious hacker Drew Reynolds is captured by the CIA and given a proposition - work for them or spend the rest of his life in prison. Agreeing on the condition that he can form his own team, he puts together a group of \"throwaways\" - the people deemed expendable and seemingly the worst in the organization.','/1265SilA4N4Q09SAnKguZjbuARJ.jpg','2015-01-30',90,'Released','The best last resort','The Throwaways',321621,2.3232,5.3,'qeWSjQ0QEwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39900,_binary '\0','/fBa5MMLvKkA3HZoQ4OTTfZwe2A9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4078160',4.3,1716,'en','The Lesson','Two schoolboy delinquents learn a lesson that they will never forget when a teacher at the end of his tether decides to abduct them.','/23WGyMPRLTfmDT3vxr3vgltTDkU.jpg','2015-08-31',98,'Released','You\'re Going to Learn... Even if it Kills You.','The Lesson',347763,1.3265,4.1,'fFuz1VUwaZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39901,_binary '\0','/7uL8JLW5cQzHqCFeX8NlTsXu26B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4078856',7.7,2564,'zh','心迷宫','An unrecognizable, charred corpse discovered in a remote mountain village in China connects three local stories.','/1ertjhiOTYVIhh5VBI1SHe0evid.jpg','2015-10-16',119,'Released','A maze built on lies.','Deep in the Heart',292362,1.7386,7.64,'tSwypOz2zfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39902,_binary '\0','/ggLdxFk95plcwhZGIA0pBqXyRzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4079152',7.2,2386,'zh','烈日灼心','A \"Chinese noir full of sublimated homoeroticism\" . The story of three brothers raising a little girl they found as a baby. These sworn brothers are not related by blood, but by a long-standing acquaintance and a serious crime they committed seven years ago. The movie features a homosexual love scene that was handled in a relatively straightforward manner.','/arJkaMoHTy9h0oHflsWOVN9FLI3.jpg','2015-08-27',133,'Released',NULL,'The Dead End',344556,1.8143,7.561,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39903,_binary '\0','/2iqLoDsatVBwAvHTEzI71p3qBe9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt40792117',6.5,13855,'en','The Crash','A teen slams her car into a building, killing her boyfriend and his friend. What seems like a tragic accident becomes a murder case.','/veskdPx4YUTmkrFrTs6zRJ8VV4E.jpg','2026-05-14',95,'Released','Was it an accident?','The Crash',1662317,7.5153,6.9,'fODfHjrBz6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39904,_binary '\0','/qZYPy2wpiFVTxPY0bdRhTOwH7Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4079782',5.8,1253,'fa','استراحت مطلق','A divorced woman leaves Damghan with her child to live and work in Tehran but her ex-husband does everything in his capability to force her to go back.','/gM89VWsGwaVJVWMbvqzZK3rMex4.jpg','2015-03-05',76,'Released','Who said Tehran is yours!?','Absolute Rest',356213,1.5339,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39905,_binary '\0','/er8rO5NUKsoodEsU2HTse60m7Yp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080028',6.1,1457,'fa','۱۳','The lack of communication between the mother and the father of a 13 year old, leads inevitably to a divorce. During this ordeal their son, feeling out of place, befriends some troubled older kids and gets involved in murder.','/Ammyc0A8xZHMDTBcQGdDgqXEjp.jpg','2014-12-18',90,'Released',NULL,'13',263825,0.9097,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39906,_binary '\0','/4FEYojMXZaWKoSJnHOl5Bazn7F9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080386',6.2,1887,'pa','ਸਰਦਾਰ ਜੀ','A ghost hunter uses bottles to capture troublesome spirits.','/f44yO1FafCLn0KM75LFRnFRo3Yn.jpg','2015-06-26',141,'Released',NULL,'Sardaarji',346081,0.9355,6.3,'MuMcSiIqCpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39907,_binary '\0','/iDDRsDWxndkKE2XvS3aV7BFkYbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080598',7.1,3206,'ja','百円の恋','Slacker Ichiko gets into a fight with her younger sister and begins to live on her own, working the late shift at a 100 yen shop. On her way home, she passes a gym and meets boxer Kano who trains there in silence...','/7qbXJNb6Q7ludf5vOKptDrBniQL.jpg','2014-11-15',114,'Released',NULL,'100 Yen Love',314606,2.8818,7.232,'cjSW303IjLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39908,_binary '\0','/qRb5bl5tRMUX4it5e4RXXWCJOgX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080672',6,5385,'fr','Papa ou maman','Florence and Vincent Leroy are a model couple. They have great jobs, a perfect marriage and delightful children. And now they want their divorce to be an equal success. But when they are both simultaneously promoted to their dream jobs, their relationship becomes a nightmare. From that moment on, the gloves are off, the two exes declare war and will do everything in their power to NOT have custody of their children.','/mkn4hk62ZPlYWMknLuIccvomNm5.jpg','2015-02-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Daddy or Mommy',319341,2.2874,6.1,'bGE5WtXWcCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39909,_binary '\0','/aWNknDl5kGZTgjqfeIKxdZaKGmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080728',7.7,75664,'sv','En man som heter Ove','Despite being deposed as president of his condominium association, grumpy 59-year-old Ove continues to watch over his neighbourhood with an iron fist. When pregnant Parvaneh and her family move into the terraced house opposite Ove and she accidentally backs into Ove’s mailbox, it sets off a series of unexpected changes in his life.','/a41uvFqze4PI7N3E9jPNwN9ypV.jpg','2015-12-25',116,'Released','Misery hates company.','A Man Called Ove',348678,8.3523,7.605,'E6-XUIS3DUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39910,_binary '\0','/yH0zuzEDzvsRYI7AEBpLmxBSJ61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080768',6.7,6378,'fr','La Belle Saison','In 1971, a young woman moves from the French countryside to Paris and begins a passionate love affair with a feminist leader.','/ugqdTcTEiIl37jv0QiSUlpplEke.jpg','2015-08-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Summertime',273153,3.7573,6.7,'_rPKZJCMX6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39911,_binary '\0','/mwinEfBlXy2Upsc4J07PZDT1JPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080858',5.3,1386,'tr','Tut Sözünü','Yalçın and Bahadır are two close friends with contrasting personalities. However, Yalçın\'s unexpected death painfully separates the two friends. One day, Bahadır, who misses Yalçın\'s crazy antics, hears a knock on his door. He finds himself face to face with the ghost of his crazy friend Yalçın, whose death he mourns deeply! Moreover, he is not alone; he is accompanied by an Italian trapeze artist named Bernardo. Yalçın is stuck in limbo because he failed to keep a promise, and the only person who can help him fulfill that promise is his close friend Bahadır. Yalçın must fulfill his promise within three days, as this is the only way he can find peace. Meanwhile, Bahadır tries to help him but ends up getting into trouble. Additionally, his platonic love for Demet, whom he works with but can’t bring himself to confess his feelings to, adds another layer of complexity to his adventure.','/ohpLLZbTgRoIuFTR39r1LnwPGfJ.jpg','2015-01-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Tut Sözünü',345881,1.5669,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39912,_binary '\0','/euCBYT2HASDMuaxu23yXDuzy3ju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4080956',6.8,29440,'en','A Prayer Before Dawn','The amazing true story of Billy Moore, an English boxer incarcerated in Thailand’s most notorious prison. Thrown into a world of drugs and violence, he finds his best chance to escape is to fight his way out in prison Muay Thai tournaments.','/toYs3tZrHbSKJS1hmiTY1fJnPjm.jpg','2018-05-24',116,'Released','The fight starts from inside.','A Prayer Before Dawn',448776,5.4814,6.7,'MARcjtu0Gtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39913,_binary '\0','/tKzyG0SlG7vQq4VFsUnaW41Rhst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4081260',6.3,2098,'pl','Służby specjalne','After many controversies Poland\'s biggest military intelligence and counter-intelligence agency (commonly known as WSI) is liquidated, but its place is immediately taken by a new, secret military organization. Forced to deal with obscure cases, Its three members soon begin to doubt both their mission and the people they work for.','/wcYidEs2bb5WGEET3aizdgNMbVg.jpg','2014-10-03',110,'Released',NULL,'Secret Wars',299608,0.8343,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39914,_binary '\0','/kB1Qrsg189eDz4Ej3ABXtLudClq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4081630',6.7,19188,'en','The Valet','World famous movie star Olivia faces a PR disaster when a paparazzi snaps a photo of her with her married lover, Vincent. The hard-working valet Antonio accidentally appears in the same photo and is enlisted to pose as Olivia’s new boyfriend as a cover-up. This ruse with Olivia thrusts Antonio into the spotlight and unexpected chaos.','/q7FmdJHKMLIC4XgWfcFRIu2iVdL.jpg','2022-05-11',123,'Released','Never judge a couple by their cover.','The Valet',810171,5.187,7.5,'1iyz4d8WoqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39915,_binary '\0','/yTPqQuNglLEOMSZfRQzp7gxB8IQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4082068',7.2,18099,'fr','Dheepan','Three war-torn strangers posing as a family flee Sri Lanka’s civil war to start over in a troubled Paris suburb, but their past traumas resurface as they struggle to survive in their new environment.','/80wJKQZYa9FHrxfaTVxXePmXni7.jpg','2015-08-26',115,'Released','When the war continues to rage in your heart and mind','Dheepan',314402,2.7334,6.8,'LAKOk022hVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39916,_binary '\0','/unJCp2SEd8P1g4YUvMSQ9iinl1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4082596',6.7,1556,'en','The Russian Woodpecker','As his country is gripped by revolution and war, a Ukrainian victim of the Chornobyl nuclear disaster discovers a dark secret and must decide whether to risk his life and play his part in the revolution by revealing it.','/wMdRokZMhqloXScU2dxH6jawabz.jpg','2015-01-31',80,'Released','Chernobyl & War in Ukraine','The Russian Woodpecker',319092,1.1539,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39917,_binary '\0','/phLsAeWuhni69Mbor4MYhAnfjlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4083052',5.4,1233,'en','The Vessel','Ten years after a tsunami destroyed a small-town elementary school with all the children inside, a young man builds a mysterious structure out of the school\'s remains, setting the town aflame with passions long forgotten.','/1ZStXAHcKMPn4xcfnFBZheB9lr5.jpg','2016-09-15',86,'Released','Is a miracle just a tragedy, narrowly avoided by chance?','The Vessel',402423,1.6258,5.3,'F6_gmpEAdo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39918,_binary '\0','/EqOcsbtYIb9cncsp8mZhDvQHYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4083076',5.6,1539,'pt','O Candidato Honesto','João Ernesto Ribamar is a corrupt politician running for the presidency. He is in the runoff election, ahead on the polls, when he receives a \"mandinga\" (curse) from his grandmother, which makes him unable to lie. Now the problem begins: How to win an election by telling only the truth?','/dNFjUdDmyJmAST6qOz2ie10UwTP.jpg','2014-09-05',110,'Released','He is a politician. He is honest. Believe it or not.','The Honest Candidate',254439,1.4853,6.013,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39919,_binary '\0','/tF7Wf2wMk2uC4eICnNusfWw0o72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4083572',4.3,9032,'en','Urge','A group of friends on holiday on an island experiment with a new designer drug that makes them lose their ability to control their urges.','/9OxOFZc