,'Dil Dhadakne Do',338065,2.6553,6.9,'ZlIaiLoBEvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39958,_binary '\0','/8LNnEmkoVWqQ44ukbmrf2iYBGMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4110972',7.6,2793,'ml','വെള്ളിമൂങ്ങ','Mamachan is a forty-year-old man, who gets involved in politics due to his father. He becomes a national leader and contests for elections. In the course of his work, he meets a young girl and falls in love with her. As fate would have it, she turns out to be the daughter of the woman he loved in his youth.','/oHsnFhbJt8OtzLeTqjp13GmMbLl.jpg','2014-09-25',129,'Released',NULL,'Vellimoonga',296902,1.8264,7.386,'2nGCbaDPAes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39959,_binary '\0','/akZ9jTTzvBOx3CeTVCo9WyhxL5q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41110859',5.6,13182,'hi','आखरी सवाल','Vicky, a brilliant but volatile scholar who ignites a national firestorm when he publicly accuses his legendary mentor, Professor Gopal Nadkarni, of institutional bias. What begins as a faculty dispute is quickly hijacked by a sensationalist news anchor and an ambitious political activist, turning a private disagreement into a televised \"intellectual trial\" watched by millions.','/9CXBZH6sRJpFTMSaY3wj1jx98F4.jpg','2026-05-15',117,'Released',NULL,'Aakhri Sawal',1600771,3.3078,1,'8jbOt2bOUtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39960,_binary '\0','/2kQ71k6dq7DVNYuYY9ylNvRFKTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41111628',5.3,2587,'es','Los creyentes','After her mother\'s sudden death, Ruth returns to her hometown and reunites with her father, whose odd behavior makes her question what really happened.','/ltuAheARdaUHbaS8lX1ZPrNOXe5.jpg','2026-07-24',106,'Released',NULL,'The Truthers',1659155,8.3415,5.695,'IvL0oT13djs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39961,_binary '\0','/5MCz0aqi0yLFPsj0RxfvAnSDyLm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4113114',4.9,2095,'en','Lethal Seduction','High School senior Mark Richards has never minded his overprotective widowed mother, Tanya, and is a good son to her as he prepares to go off to Princeton in the fall. However, when he comes under the sexual spell of the rapacious, manipulative older woman Carissa Barrington, he finds himself in the middle of two strong, unreasonable women--one of whom is insane...','/h03nz09KkWX4WBcopq7h7Cxd6um.jpg','2015-07-11',80,'Released',NULL,'Lethal Seduction',348346,6.0519,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39962,_binary '\0','/cHqW7H2Nzez4JEwKKTo0CYQtEla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4113846',5,1970,'en','Delusion','Three years after the death of Frank\'s wife a mysterious woman appears. As their attraction grows Frank struggles with reality and his loss. He tries to start over not knowing his choices could lead him to his own downfall.','/yIU8XDnf5ObvpZoAzv85V55jzhG.jpg','2016-10-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Delusion',423144,1.452,4.2,'MaH1IOP-Uq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39963,_binary '\0','/homTx1TmRkmk8tt42PuWtlLABa6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4114744',7.5,19324,'tr','Unutursam Fısılda','An old pop singer who has Alzheimer\'s returns to her old house where she remembers her old days of climbing the stairs of fame and fortune while trying to deal with her older sister who holds her responsible for her ruined life.','/91cc9UlIwJBJwi8O8qVls4SVm72.jpg','2014-10-29',123,'Released',NULL,'Whisper If I Forget',300490,1.8422,7.3,'u9x2S9d_1zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39964,_binary '\0','/qj27CyUSjwTLmkUjqJkRI5Ih3Uy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4114762',3.8,3750,'tr','Aşk Sana Benzer','A young girl, with a troubled past, and a young boy fall in love in a small but beautiful town.','/xyiIXiFnwHcdg6n9tvYxQHkn45E.jpg','2015-01-22',115,'Released',NULL,'Love Like You',320060,1.5922,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39965,_binary '\0','/izoKE21TB289yHsBYGO1WyGjTub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41157050',6.1,1681,'en','Sleeping Dog','Investigative journalist Jeremy Corbell emerges as a key figure in a dangerous fight to uncover the truth about UAPs, driven by rare access and knowledge few possess. As his pursuit deepens, so do the risks of exposing what was never meant to be seen.','/yosFDSuHlWwIfM0QTZN8a4OxPPO.jpg','2026-05-08',98,'Released','The cover-up is crumbling, and one journalist is breaking it wide open.','Sleeping Dog',1659169,3.3594,6.7,'Kx_anJdFlL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39966,_binary '\0','/fq9C9hnxJX8zBCtUWhKi4nbfqgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4115752',8.2,4441,'bn','চতুষ্কোণ','Four famous directors and old friends are reunited together by an unknown producer to make a film. They have to make four short story in this film with one common theme: Death.','/6NhorrHcB3GYDqgYiXQmDDQnZtu.jpg','2014-09-26',148,'Released','Death... Fair and square.','Chotushkone',302632,1.3875,7.433,'9uNrGCBIgo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39967,_binary '\0','/txg43Ozkc4X1YGWlmijkipb1Ojq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4116030',6.3,4498,'en','Lady Chatterley\'s Lover','An early-20th-century tale of love across class boundaries which tells the legendary and romantic story of Lady Chatterley’s affair with her gamekeeper. Jed Mercurio’s adaptation of DH Lawrence’s classic.','/6RwYNmcMfsTmOtnNm5PC6LNuy0K.jpg','2015-09-06',89,'Released','Love Knows No Boundaries','Lady Chatterley\'s Lover',354743,6.0584,6.295,'5aex-lGfZF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39968,_binary '\0','/rWYtghaUJSDvQm4jmXiCPXBHUdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4116284',7.3,197598,'en','The Lego Batman Movie','A cooler-than-ever Batman must face the usual villains as the Joker plots a takeover of Gotham City. But when Bruce Wayne accidentally adopts a teenage orphan who wishes to become his sidekick, he’s forced to give up his lone-vigilante ways and learn to work with others.','/e1TliRWOdXQ73pRunbpFiGst6Kd.jpg','2017-02-08',104,'Releas