tt4119278',4.9,7194,'en','All Roads Lead to Rome','Maggie is an uptight, single mother and college writing teacher from New York City. In an effort to reconnect with her troubled teen daughter Summer, she decides to embark on a journey to a Tuscan village where she frequented in her younger days. Upon arrival, Maggie runs into Luca a handsome former lover who is still a bachelor and lives with his eighty-year-old mother Carmen. Summer (missing her “bad boy” boyfriend in NYC) and Carmen (secretly planning a wedding against Luca’s wishes to MARCELINO, her one true love in Rome) impulsively steal Luca’s car and race off to Rome. Maggie and Luca quickly pursue allowing the two mismatched couples to spend some time together and develop a new understanding of each other.','/usBaQ6oqSBcooG36ClRuhC3W7dq.jpg','2016-01-14',90,'Released','Sometimes first love deserves a second chance...','All Roads Lead to Rome',298583,3.766,5,'peYvl4WEz5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39973,_binary '\0','/xVThZqhO8xySycTKXd2TJCmssvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4119590',7,1271,'ja','イニシエーション・ラブ','Set in Shizuoka and Tokyo, Japan in the late 1980\'s. Takkun is a university student in Shizuoka attempting to find a job. Mayu is a dental hygienist. They meet through a blind date and begin to date, but Takkun finds a job in Tokyo and goes there. They begin a long distance relationship, but their relationship breaks down.','/kfWtj2VC3D4MZHrY2p7p2DzCDzm.jpg','2015-05-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Initiation Love',345731,1.8069,7.4,'bWd7nkebJ0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39974,_binary '\0','/mwl0MTfVZk6GPizobnSS8bFWCTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4120176',6.9,15486,'fr','L\'Avenir','Nathalie teaches philosophy at a high school in Paris. She is passionate about her job and particularly enjoys passing on the pleasure of thinking. Married with two children, she divides her time between her family, former students and her very possessive mother. One day, Nathalie’s husband announces he is leaving her for another woman. With freedom thrust upon her, Nathalie must reinvent her life.','/6MAAJJ51y2RUa1gvvVje4s0FB7W.jpg','2016-04-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Things to Come',374465,3.3842,6.5,'CiT9mmMrIak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39975,_binary '\0','/bBl5kEyRs4YKAIn3lFa95hyhA1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4120210',6.1,2459,'fr','Valley of Love','A story of two famous actors who used to be a couple. They reunite after the son\'s death and receive a letter asking them to visit five places at Death Valley, which will make the son reappear.','/vQwKE2Y3mE8G6nNqqQnVnkuG90z.jpg','2015-06-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Valley of Love',337107,1.9064,5.9,'yx9UMnoefH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39976,_binary '\0','/3ulQnjkoheWuDgvxtFFlmSxds8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4121610',7,1299,'nl','Tulipani: Love, Honour and a Bicycle','After losing his farm during the floods of 1953, a romantic Dutch farmer is tired of getting his socks wet. He cycles to Italy and decides to grow tulips in the sweltering heat of Puglia.','/lXScwvpQ21RLr9ztG8N1X2Oot6F.jpg','2017-09-08',92,'Released','Love, honour and a bicycle','Tulipani: Love, Honour and a Bicycle',471617,1.606,6.5,'WvD3_odcsRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39977,_binary '\0','/jUcoMDqIQoF5qurqR1Vnhh7cGXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4122118',6.5,1565,'en','Love Finds You in Charm','A young Amish woman, who isn\'t satisfied with her path at home, visits a cousin for the summer. Over the summer, she is exposed to another world, finds friendship and more. Soon she must choose and come to terms with the life she wants.','/mGWw4foAzmPvtr6DSd3XIgzbEpC.jpg','2015-06-06',93,'Released','She broke their rules and found herself','Love Finds You in Charm',343369,1.8668,6.2,'J48zA7lN5Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39978,_binary '\0','/i3rRY0EKYhSpyOLRAQ7iB05zhAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4123430',6.5,335067,'en','Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of Grindelwald','Gellert Grindelwald has escaped imprisonment and has begun gathering followers to his cause—elevating wizards above all non-magical beings. The only one capable of putting a stop to him is the wizard he once called his closest friend, Albus Dumbledore. However, Dumbledore will need to seek help from the wizard who had thwarted Grindelwald once before, his former student Newt Scamander, who agrees to help, unaware of the dangers that lie ahead. Lines are drawn as love and loyalty are tested, even among the truest friends and family, in an increasingly divided wizarding world.','/fMMrl8fD9gRCFJvsx0SuFwkEOop.jpg','2018-11-14',134,'Released','Fate of one. Future of all.','Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of Grindelwald',338952,13.0392,6.8,'5sEaYB4rLFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39979,_binary '\0','/zGLHX92Gk96O1DJvLil7ObJTbaL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4123432',6.2,195515,'en','Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore','Professor Albus Dumbledore knows the powerful, dark wizard Gellert Grindelwald is moving to seize control of the wizarding world. Unable to stop him alone, he entrusts magizoologist Newt Scamander to lead an intrepid team of wizards and witches. They soon encounter an array of old and new beasts as they clash with Grindelwald\'s growing legion of followers.','/3c5GNLB4yRSLBby0trHoA1DSQxQ.jpg','2022-04-06',142,'Released','Return to the magic.','Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore',338953,23.0153,6.622,'DaM_wL1ZOM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39980,_binary '\0','/9bEcxtvuoR3mtIbNDMjA13iHkbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4123650',4.3,1628,'en','Alterscape','After a failed suicide attempt, a young man coping with loss and depression, submits to a series of trials that fine-tune human emotions, but his unique reaction to the tests send him on a journey that transcends both physical and perceived reality.','/qUCn2oXPWqIrnWkpoIIKnI9ampn.jpg','2018-02-23',90,'Released','Reality is just a reflection','Alterscape',445872,1.7339,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39981,_binary '\0','/ot1qNzXY5DAcTGbDdIWUS4Lahpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4125300',7.1,2767,'ja','花とアリス殺人事件','After transferring to Ishinomori Middle School, Tetsuko \"Alice\" Arisugawa overhears her classmates discussing a strange rumor. The previous occupant of her seat, a nondescript \"Judas,\" is missing and presumed murdered. Amidst dealing with her mother\'s undesired meddling in her affairs and warding off her classmates\' bullying, the troubled Alice starts to investigate the mystery surrounding Judas\' disappearance. The trail of clues leads her to the house of her next-door neighbor, the quirky and reclusive Hana Arai.','/j9zJ3Dx90DmOTeEMx5K6BQN9J0W.jpg','2015-02-20',98,'Released','Don\'t step on the fish in the pool.','The Case of Hana & Alice',311054,2.5507,7.3,'bZdR1OQqTIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39982,_binary '\0','/lHFsMi0uprGSD25sIR1OVeqFiFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126304',7.3,19233,'en','Cartel Land','In the Mexican state of Michoacán, Dr. Jose Mireles, a small-town physician known as \"El Doctor,\" shepherds a citizen uprising against the Knights Templar, the violent drug cartel that has wreaked havoc on the region for years. Meanwhile, in Arizona\'s Altar Valley—a narrow, 52-mile-long desert corridor known as Cocaine Alley—Tim \"Nailer\" Foley, an American veteran, heads a small paramilitary group called Arizona Border Recon, whose goal is to halt Mexico’s drug wars from seeping across our border.','/bNNP8IYV1VZKsS5CRavRpRDWV06.jpg','2015-07-03',101,'Released',NULL,'Cartel Land',317952,2.104,7.2,'xC5bpPfltOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39983,_binary '\0','/eE0OFbntOMVB7pWIcyUlwbjb2IU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126312',7.2,2055,'en','3 ½ Minutes, 10 Bullets','Black Friday, the day after Thanksgiving November 2012, four boys in a red SUV pull into a gas station after spending time at the mall buying sneakers and talking to girls. With music blaring, one boy exits the car and enters the store, a quick stop for a soda and a pack of gum. A man and a woman pull up next to the boys in the station, making a stop for a bottle of wine. The woman enters the store and an argument breaks out when the driver of the second car asks the boys to turn the music down. 3½ minutes and ten bullets later, one of the boys is dead. 3½ MINUTES dissects the aftermath of this fatal encounter.','/fDYefxDiAy5SufELGMIlrKQEks6.jpg','2015-10-02',98,'Released',NULL,'3 ½ Minutes, 10 Bullets',320349,1.3016,7.3,'RKbCoRA__UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39984,_binary '\0','/me6X0Wd4ioaNHdaNjllyZA9OkbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126394',5.5,3541,'en','Darling','A young woman slowly goes crazy after taking a job as the caretaker for an ancient New York home.','/rwG616V3jPAZBBxZSqF7cjlyf9t.jpg','2015-09-24',78,'Released','Terror Beyond Comprehension','Darling',352372,1.2412,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39985,_binary '\0','/rUKBVL69thoZLUCXESm5zCyLODL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126434',6.1,1515,'en','Before the Fall','It\'s a classic case of opposite attraction: Handsome Ben Bennet is a gay, affluent, stylish attorney at the top of the genteel social set in southern Virginia, while Lee Darcy is a rough-hewn welder with a secret that he nightly tries to blot out with an excess of liquor.','/kDxNN8m3Ntp1hsltjEK3mVAR3Ka.jpg','2017-04-21',100,'Released','A re-imagining of Pride and Prejudice.','Before the Fall',416480,1.3772,5.4,'NFPc8SA1FUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39986,_binary '\0','/tNoeXAKFL6sgpUYADRIGBOYiqsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126438',6.1,11753,'en','The Ones Below','A young affluent couple expecting their first child hits it off with the new couple that moves in downstairs, until a dinner party between them ends in a shocking accident.','/iOMFKPLZG9DI1EhZfkqxhkum4vw.jpg','2016-03-11',86,'Released','How well do you know your neighbors?','The Ones Below',356842,2.3849,6,'nnTfVYYAa8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39987,_binary '\0','/997ToEZvF2Obp9zNZbY5ELVnmrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126476',5.3,77505,'en','After','Tessa Young is a dedicated student, dutiful daughter and loyal girlfriend to her high school sweetheart. Entering her first semester of college, Tessa\'s guarded world opens up when she meets Hardin Scott, a mysterious and brooding rebel who makes her question all she thought she knew about herself -- and what she wants out of life.','/u3B2YKUjWABcxXZ6Nm9h10hLUbh.jpg','2019-04-11',106,'Released','After your first, life is never the same.','After',537915,14.965,7.104,'2ZAdcWHuCmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39988,_binary '\0','/gUebSn2HgWchRx2sUwYAXpbxCfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126568',4.2,5729,'en','Cage Dive','Three friends from California are filming an audition tape for an extreme reality game show. They document their journey to Australia where they will be doing their most dangerous activity: Shark Cage Diving. A catastrophic turn of events leaves them in baited water full of Great White Sharks, turning their recording into a blood chilling diary of survival...And death.','/3uUO9eDxHeDREIX77BaQiI88ajp.jpg','2017-08-11',80,'Released','First you find the sharks. Then they find you.','Cage Dive',420707,4.8342,4.6,'hS2-t77lDz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39989,_binary '\0','/7mYZNOVoHgQoW24VBuCv1rNwMQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4126694',5.7,2220,'en','1 Night','Thirty-something Elizabeth must decide whether to salvage her disappointing relationship with Drew. Meanwhile, Bea, a worrisome teenager, reconnects with her introverted childhood friend, Andy, at their high school prom. Past and present collide as two couples explore love over the course of one night at a hotel.','/geYX4v0Jy3PvzFei8QL1educKxh.jpg','2016-10-14',80,'Released','Love can happen at any time.','1 Night',416691,1.7418,6.2,'zFELeadAK04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39990,_binary '\0','/rVvEWYiKNxSp4GgISTlhx74Ibf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4128102',6.9,1358,'en','Marvel: 75 Years, from Pulp to Pop!','In celebration of the publisher\'s 75th anniversary, the hour-long special will take a detailed look at the company\'s journey from fledgling comics publisher to multi-media juggernaut. Hosted by Emily VanCamp (S.H.I.E.L.D. Agent Sharon Carter), the documentary-style feature will include interviews with comic book icons, pop culture authorities, and Hollywood stars. The special also promises an \"extraordinary peek into Marvel\'s future!\" Might Marvel release the first official footage from next year\'s Avengers: Age of Ultron or Ant-Man? If they do, you\'ll know about it here.','/biud0bsRfQryGBfcTXN2ep6ODwM.jpg','2014-11-04',42,'Released',NULL,'Marvel: 75 Years, from Pulp to Pop!',299969,2.7611,6.8,'6yIpLslyQLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39991,_binary '\0','/vgQ6JsosGLaNMzrsTEpf4KGH8O7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4129428',6.4,14072,'hi','जग्गा जासूस','A gifted teenage detective searches for his missing father with his ladylove assistant.','/qXZCEyFkNe5cm7xfkUDvV41Xnfh.jpg','2017-07-14',180,'Released',NULL,'Jagga Jasoos',401285,1.3845,6.1,'YheC-4Qgoro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39992,_binary '\0','/zW0hp6O61wzWhf1IES7raTBpSS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4129870',5.7,12554,'en','White Girl','Summer, New York City. A college girl falls hard for a guy she just met. After a night of partying goes wrong, she goes to wild extremes to get him back.','/kng43UXWxdYAkst1ggnX4PfOe5Z.jpg','2016-09-02',88,'Released',NULL,'White Girl',336011,4.4398,5.664,'zXDr-mZkRTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39993,_binary '\0','/1PipezrxUePfphAH0tF5TSmiMUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4129876',6.9,2895,'de','Winterkartoffelknödel','A policeman suspects that several bizarre deaths in the same family were murders and that the killer is a mysterious woman who just moved to the village.','/aaHdUviVHsyEk5yGiN796JfKRXL.jpg','2014-10-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Winterkartoffelknödel',289984,1.4653,6.936,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39994,_binary '\0','/fZEVyHIKdLzDFC29W6JCeaJwvUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4130484',4.8,6406,'en','Demon House','Mass hysteria breaks-out over an alleged demonic possession in an Indiana home. Zak Bagans then buys the house, sight unseen, over the phone. He and his crew soon become the next victims of the most documented case of demonic possession in US history.','/80gFuW9wIeKEaswSspSGjSEOcDE.jpg','2019-12-01',95,'Released','View at Your Own Risk!','Demon House',474104,1.0965,5.3,'qOa5KSX8_ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39995,_binary '\0','/83LbQ6xMURQYO03Ilqdr3kwLBxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4131496',5.9,22980,'en','The Vanishing','Three lighthouse keepers on an uninhabited island off the coast of Scotland discover something that isn\'t theirs to keep.','/owYLROHpJWbYWEHjaEvDsnoz4Ux.jpg','2019-01-04',108,'Released','What\'s left when the light goes out?','The Vanishing',449459,6.0153,5.8,'xVez1uCdndc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39996,_binary '\0','/mvfVoQr733lDIBbEbqEbyiAgx0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4131686',7.9,3369,'ku','دەمەوێ بژیم','I Want to Live is a documentary on the lives of Kurdish Refugees from Syria, living in refugee camps in Kurdistan. Shot on location, it is set against the Syrian civil war and the ISIS (Islamic State) attacks upon Kurdistan. Told through the eyes of a young boy, Shndar, living with Thalassemia disease, he searches for an immediate treatment as he ages without losing hope, leaving his home amid simmering ethnic and religious hatred to live the life of a refugee. The film tells stories of daily life on the camp and outside of it. More than being a film on the life of refugees, it is an intimate character study and gripping tale of innocent lost amides wars, a meditation on life, death, war, peace, and tolerance.','/w9wU0FQDkOrGm3yTbCphtVaGq0O.jpg','2015-01-03',106,'Released',NULL,'I Want To Live',793997,0.7518,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39997,_binary '\0','/weMAgPEcyduqNCZkEhJHoZZq6Uk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4131800',6.1,9185,'en','My Little Pony: The Movie','A new dark force threatens Ponyville, and the Mane 6 – Twilight Sparkle, Applejack, Rainbow Dash, Pinkie Pie, Fluttershy and Rarity – embark on an unforgettable journey beyond Equestria where they meet new friends and exciting challenges on a quest to use the magic of friendship and save their home.','/AiJRCzcZSVs9xPHoEKZRp80TyTA.jpg','2017-10-05',99,'Released','Discover a different breed of hero.','My Little Pony: The Movie',335360,9.1295,7.3,'kIv_ConaZ1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39998,_binary '\0','/d5D79mQ3jKquIW00WadMEa4iOq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4135076',6.5,1223,'sv','Jätten','A film about Rikard, age 30. He is autistic and severely disfigured. He lives in a home for disabled people. He was separated from his mother as a three-year-old, and this continues to torment him today. To deal with life\'s trials, Rikard escapes into a fantasy world in which he\'s a 50-meter-tall giant.','/cStiZ56V7Gk7WNYmDcTQXJ2Ayh6.jpg','2016-10-14',86,'Released',NULL,'The Giant',407204,1.8006,5.9,'k23VFDVZu_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(39999,_binary '\0','/T30UlW0ipg2nAVJ3fbkeF8MNA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4135218',6.7,8212,'en','Cyberbully','A chilling real-time thriller featuring a teenager, Casey, battling with an anonymous cyber-stalker.','/q9IBBA6ypk0LEaOgDdutVK0NPzY.jpg','2015-01-15',62,'Released','When you go online, who can you trust','Cyberbully',317144,2.4242,6.366,'Py4C67OUO1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40000,_binary '\0','/bA7ACUoJZ6NDAx6ukEN1JhC9LQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4135844',7.1,3491,'es','Ixcanul','María, a 17-year-old Kaqchikel Maya, lives with her parents on a coffee plantation at the foot of an active volcano. She is set to be married to the farm\'s foreman. But María longs to discover the world on the other side of the mountain, a place she cannot even imagine. And so she seduces a coffee-harvester who wants to escape to the USA. When this man leaves her behind, María discovers her own world and culture anew.','/pbFZWO51YxMvEDR9lufn7tBjS80.jpg','2015-01-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Ixcanul',320001,1.0373,6.758,'EJfvKnLPqFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40001,_binary '\0','/qgGdqp8qQlWN4X3ygxtzcqCGnaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4136056',7.6,6759,'en','The Seven Five','Meet the dirtiest cop in NYC history. Michael Dowd stole money and dealt drugs while patrolling the streets of \'80s Brooklyn.','/prCuFhowUc6YmcyJvd2AP1E50WA.jpg','2015-08-14',104,'Released','In 1980\'s Brooklyn, The Most Dangerous Gangsters Were New York City Cops.','The Seven Five',320882,1.2983,7.3,'KLhJGMszVS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40002,_binary '\0','/x5zHw4qTZ1aP4Lrcv49coRluvxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4136084',6.8,62665,'en','Florence Foster Jenkins','The story of Florence Foster Jenkins, a New York heiress, who dreamed of becoming an opera singer, despite having a terrible singing voice.','/1HAdtUchzWEo0LMFHrgD2UBIBS3.jpg','2016-05-06',110,'Released','Every voice deserves to be heard.','Florence Foster Jenkins',315664,4.7745,6.7,'9rRVCNffvKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40003,_binary '\0','/dbbrFq5J7RhAF3uephOUo7GNhIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4136094',4.8,2195,'ru','Русская Лолита','Very loosely based on Nabokov’s ‘Lolita’, this is the story of a writer renting 