certain.','/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg','2018-04-25',149,'Released','An entire universe. Once and for all.','Avengers: Infinity War',299536,99.9965,8.244,'6ZfuNTqbHE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40035,_binary '\0','/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4154796',8.4,1487384,'en','Avengers: Endgame','After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos\' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.','/ulzhLuWrPK07P1YkdWQLZnQh1JL.jpg','2019-04-24',181,'Released','Avenge the fallen.','Avengers: Endgame',299534,121.8788,8.245,'AMSITikqKiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40036,_binary '\0','/dKFTYg8vWj5ZpsR4SVmueAssyZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4154916',5.5,45777,'en','Replicas','A scientist becomes obsessed with returning his family to normalcy after a terrible accident.','/hhPBTAn9b4TYOxc1JYNsX4BFAlW.jpg','2018-10-25',107,'Released','Some humans are unstoppable','Replicas',300681,5.9187,6,'bKdpGHazAqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40037,_binary '\0','/q5uZqd324Tug2xWxL72j18ZzK2Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4155534',5.8,4602,'en','Animal Crackers','A family must use a magical box of Animal Crackers to save a rundown circus from being taken over by their evil uncle Horatio P. Huntington.','/dxFqZiO5MqqVoFZuWOjTdjmDh6d.jpg','2018-07-21',104,'Released','A magical adventure in every bite','Animal Crackers',315064,5.2127,6.371,'6yrtrDjmw5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40038,_binary '\0','/yn9HiusdSXztun9bRQDIjaPOOGs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4156700',4,1390,'ru','Горько! 2','Hoping to break a big jackpot Natasha\'s stepfather does the financial gamble than substitutes his business partners. The whole 