26-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4158096',6.3,54001,'en','Free Fire','Set in Boston in 1978, a meeting in a deserted warehouse between two gangs turns into a shoot-out and a game of survival.','/olpgs0OPE8sdBGcuuWhKYzxAwN4.jpg','2017-03-31',91,'Released','All guns. No control.','Free Fire',334521,5.8371,6.2,'G_yyIfhhR8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40043,_binary '\0','/lVqieu4aigBr9MxymTqf8BIBmpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4158594',5.1,4604,'en','Boar','In the harsh, yet beautiful Australian outback lives a beast, an animal of staggering size, with a ruthless, driving need for blood and destruction. It cares for none, defends its territory with brutal force, and kills with a raw, animalistic savagery unlike any have seen before.','/8wxEPJzfgO0jiaZVz2pFQvYoXqm.jpg','2018-06-17',96,'Released','In the Outback no one can hear you squeal.','Boar',416724,1.633,5.3,'f3bHpU01z3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40044,_binary '\0','/aefR29q5J8RrtDS5k0dFEdKmzl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4158624',6,7360,'en','3 Generations','A teenager transitions from female to male, and his family must come to terms with that fact.','/g4kR79ndKP6gZFHXe70sY7TUOZ7.jpg','2016-10-27',87,'Released','A Family In Transition','3 Generations',300667,3.6424,6.357,'4ord940o470','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40045,_binary '\0','/smyrXdVLhD9tUhBoNoo2TBaSu0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4158834',6.3,2203,'de','8 Seconds','Esra leads two parallel lives. In her daily life the vivacious and spirited Esra adores her family but feels caged in her relationships. In her dream life, she yearns to discover the identity of the man who visits her dreams. While in waking life she struggles in vain, in her dream life she evolves in secret. But what if waking and dreaming were never separate and the real secret is shored by all?','/vBihBbfxwozeD1sEz7O5aBFmmA1.jpg','2015-02-27',120,'Released',NULL,'8 Seconds',348750,1.3036,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40046,_binary '\0','/xvTPAvnXXZ5ZBDQrDiwbkS3uvgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4158876',6.8,13100,'en','Other People','David, a struggling comedy writer fresh off from breaking up with his boyfriend, moves from New York City to Sacramento to help his sick mother. Living with his conservative father and much-younger sisters for the first time in ten years, he feels like a stranger in his childhood home. As his mother’s health declines, David frantically tries to extract meaning from this horrible experience and convince everyone (including himself) that he\'s \"doing okay.”','/3JgG3p4FY0fNSgJneNWnVno7X9j.jpg','2016-09-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Other People',371449,4.335,6.384,'8uMM7SH1Hh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40047,_binary '\0','/d8FrVeFmUMAJUQZJ6VT6JG5drXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4159044',6.6,1220,'da','Kysset','A romantic drama set in Denmark in 1913, the story follows Anton, a noble and conscientious young man whose top priority is to complete his training as a cavalry officer. During a training session, he orders his platoon to help Baron von Løvenskjold and finds himself invited to a ball at the castle, where he meets the baron’s beautiful daughter Edith who has been in an accident and ended up in a wheelchair.','/xMeBWGON5bKJkQRZm9k5stP6LF5.jpg','2022-10-15',116,'Released',NULL,'The Kiss',1030009,3.1639,6.5,'JHYpqzOcpIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40048,_binary '\0','/w9foHvG0UobfoPzvwT32Q6nsY3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4159182',5.5,3227,'fr','La Dame dans l\'auto avec des lunettes et un fusil','She’s the most beautiful, most short-sighted, most sentimental, most perplexing, most obstinate, most untrustworthy and most troubling of heroines. The lady in the car has never seen the sea. On the run from the police, she keeps telling herself that she’s not crazy… Only...','/jXSL3rD2BKcUMACoh8tA6LKyEW3.jpg','2015-08-05',93,'Released',NULL,'The 