'A group of teens break into a blind man\'s home thinking they\'ll get away with the perfect crime. They\'re wrong.','/dSxHyPZ2nipSfvdft4IhQKjk5eZ.jpg','2016-06-08',89,'Released','This house looked like an easy target, until they found what was inside.','Don\'t Breathe',300669,15.3135,7.019,'76yBTNDB6vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40053,_binary '\0','/eHHb9hBLV6vnUyQglkG1WqRwx9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4160726',6.4,1472,'sr','Bićemo prvaci sveta','The story about the founders of the famous \"Yugoslav Basketball School\" and the first gold medal at the Championships in Ljubljana in 1970, is based on real events and is dedicated to personalities who have contributed to the emergence and development of basketball in their country.','/3ZIdX1aANmIPpkoGKP1cEEPmmBd.jpg','2015-02-26',125,'Released',NULL,'We Will Be the World Champions',331600,0.9768,3.6,'0Yum5lz8z48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40054,_binary '\0','/uQ657md7aJM56fKiqbRUdZcedBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4161438',6.5,1458,'fr','La rage du Démon','An investigation on the rarest and most controversial French movie in the history of early cinema: a fascinating, lost and dangerous short film which causes violent reactions to those who watch it.','/f4bXpdK7zLVjtm1yOTk08JzRi3p.jpg','2016-01-30',60,'Released','The most dangerous movie of all time is also one of the first.','Fury of the Demon',406454,1.3572,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40055,_binary '\0','/46hp8s3IN8SjR8K4ukrWr32gQu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4161564',6.2,1233,'fr','L\'Effet aquatique','Samir, a lanky crane operator in Montreuil, falls madly for Agathe. As master swimmer at the pool Thorez he decides to take swimming lessons with her. But the lie does not last three lessons - Agathe hate liars. Chosen to represent the Seine-Saint-Denis, Agathe flies to Iceland for the 10th Congress of the International Masters Swimming. Samir has no choice but to fly in turn also.','/boN4R7vdMzfs6QYV9CWI2ZEOV3f.jpg','2016-06-29',82,'Released',NULL,'The Together Project',389044,1.7567,6,'VI72mDmfTtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40056,_binary '\0','/oBter8Y5p2ZFUwWgQ1T9pulGFTJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41617470',4.4,3271,'es','Deseo','Lucero’s life appears immaculate: a wealthy household, a devoted husband, and two children who embody the promise of a perfect family. Yet beneath this surface simmers a quiet dissatisfaction. When Matías, a young swimming coach hired by her husband, enters their lives, Lucero finds herself pulled into a risky and consuming relationship. As secrecy, desire, and jealousy tighten their grip, the boundaries within the family begin to collapse, placing mother and daughter in a dangerous emotional triangle that threatens to shatter everything Lucero has built.','/3bEqHqeaQlFykaLQ7N4gDkIvL5w.jpg','2026-05-07',97,'Released',NULL,'Desire',1668364,19.3901,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40057,_binary '\0','/7gKpLioKidd4Nl5zZJMIeI1LIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4161932',6.4,1496,'nl','Prins','A troubled teenager attempts to conquer the girl he\'s in love with, who seems out of reach. He\'s lured into criminal activities and becomes alienated from family and friends.','/pAYHv33e8KmkAGzZ5dczlSL4zp9.jpg','2015-02-06',78,'Released',NULL,'Prince',324259,0.8208,6.762,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40058,_binary '\0','/fdJh9wgbCZWeSESTHOpX5b1B6c1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4161962',5.2,3043,'es','Ahora o nunca','Narrates the preparation for a wedding of a Spanish couple in which everything goes wrong.','/u0spUWBehJTLqchm9oZpR0m9aDK.jpg','2015-06-19',91,'Released',NULL,'It\'s Now or Never',300601,1.3134,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40059,_binary '\0','/6Fueh9poh3alPhAiM1xGuV6c5GF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4163020',5.5,15654,'en','Tales of Halloween','Ten stories from horror\'s top directors. Ghosts, ghouls, monsters, and the devil delight in terrorizing unsuspecting residents of a suburban neighborhood on Halloween night. This creepy anthology combines classic Halloween tales with the stuff of nightmares.','/fc4YBCqjfXv8EZpV5MpNsKPW3fY.jpg','2015-10-16',97,'Released','One town. One night. Ten chilling stories.','Tales of Halloween',306964,3.553,5.7,'C2tA1e8UAZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40060,_binary '\0','/3WsSRr2tEA0hCuEc1AavQ0Fka3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4163224',4,5172,'en','Most Likely to Die','A group of former classmates gather for a pre-party at one of their homes the night before their 10-year high school reunion, and one by one, they are brutally slain in a manner befitting each\'s senior yearbook superlative.','/4lesaz8ReKloTAyhFzbZIiwYfbQ.jpg','2015-08-30',81,'Released','One killer reunion.','Most Likely to Die',347762,2.2033,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40061,_binary '\0','/r87bYTbEKReVTSsZ3Wy15rkKKw3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4163264',6.3,6332,'fa','نهنگ عنبر','Arjang, who was born before the revolution in Iran, has been in love with his childhood sweetheart, Roya, for the past 40 years. Roya, however, has brought him nothing but trouble. Now 50, and having experienced a revolution, a war, a divorce and both poverty and wealth, Arjang finds himself still in love with Roya.','/r9D2e7X5yqBTLEMCMfTXENvfhMY.jpg','2015-05-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Sperm Whale',363566,0.7,5.1,'0BUfBZ19QXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40062,_binary '\0','/uETSwIud6TRC7XFW3hLQK5meMg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41635245',7.5,6277,'en','The Amazing Digital Circus: The Last Act','With Caine gone and the circus dark, the cast are left with only the mistakes and traumas of their pasts to keep them company. As the prospect of eternity closes in around them, they discover the truth about the Digital Circus and its history. Will they come to terms with what they uncover, or will they make... the other choice? Also, presumably at some point someone says something funny, because this ending can’t be THAT depressing, can it? A theatrical screening of episode 8 and the all new, hour-long episode 9.','/uoZeXWuUS2z2F7VaC1iS5RS5cnk.jpg','2026-06-03',93,'Released','Watch the finale of the viral internet phenomenon in theaters, early!','The Amazing Digital Circus: The Last Act',1667198,7.9751,8.8,'qQilWg28HMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40063,_binary '\0','/4HXIpsYWf4mFLI3vMWjpIaCbKII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4163644',6.4,1892,'fr','Comme un avion','Michel, a fifty year old man, graphic designer, decides to change the urban lifestyle and go on an adventure. Fascinated by airmail, he dreams at Jean Mermoz when he\'s on scooter. One day, Michel sees a picture of a kayak.','/vo74Vic2ZM6E4MkVbFnAabO4hUn.jpg','2015-06-10',105,'Released',NULL,'The Sweet Escape',343702,2.3058,6.6,'7nbNlX-n_Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40064,_binary '\0','/rjK7JGPe7CbhwjfNLx6DQgRaN2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4163668',6.5,5239,'en','The Eichmann Show','The behind-the-scenes true life story of a groundbreaking producer, Milton Fruchtman, and blacklisted TV director Leo Hurwitz who, overcoming enormous obstacles, set out to capture the testimony of one of the war\'s most notorious Nazis, Adolf Eichmann, who is accused of executing the \'final solution\' and organising the murder of 6 million Jews. This is the extraordinary story of how the trial came to be televised and the team that made it happen.','/6cu8bEgtpX6ITxmI4JmiiCjU4OG.jpg','2015-01-20',90,'Released',NULL,'The Eichmann Show',316715,2.8796,6.675,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40065,_binary '\0','/5YbJULkUKodLwtIVInhmiHCZlyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4164468',7.6,2089,'zh','賽德克‧巴萊：彩虹橋','After the uprising at Wushe, Mona Rudao faces a guerrilla war against the militarily superior Japanese and Seediq clans. He and his followers must fight for their dignity and honor so that they can truly be \"Seediq Bale\" or \"real men.\" Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 2: The Rainbow Bridge is Part two of the two-part, four-hour Taiwanese edition of the film Warriors of the Rainbow.','/wrgpoEhfgptkYGtIxEaYqlxChv8.jpg','2011-09-30',132,'Released','A man rises up to lead his people in a brave and risky struggle for freedom in this epic-scale historical drama.','Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 2: The Rainbow Bridge',313230,2.0889,8.1,'3L_PNQgQ49w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40066,_binary '\0','/fhOjL0ArVthQNUueMkfs2AfkAQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4167720',5,3754,'en','The Pack','Man’s best friend becomes his worst nightmare when a horde of bloodthirsty wild dogs descends upon a family’s farmhouse in a fang-bearing fight for survival.','/qe8Xue6kXAj4Cf42Phz7R165LAz.jpg','2015-08-05',90,'Released','Born to hunt. Driven to kill.','The Pack',344854,1.9126,5.7,'UcMH31xdvUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40067,_binary '\0','/dO7gQiU7m4IMIBko6hkjWyGznDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4168188',7.8,8319,'pa','ਚਾਰ ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦੇ','Ajit Singh, Jujhar Singh, Zorawar Singh, and Fateh Singh, the four sons of Sikh Guru Gobind Singh Ji, sacrifice their lives in an important battle against the Mughals.','/nQp114D7CO8kkuNzHldxogmbYFN.jpg','2014-11-06',128,'Released',NULL,'Chaar Sahibzaade',303457,1.043,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40068,_binary '\0','/1PkYoTgQl2kYFw6p5kGeBpxKWDj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4169146',6.7,2334,'en','Give Me Liberty','When a riot breaks out in Milwaukee, America\'s most segregated city, medical transport driver Vic is torn between his promise to get a group of elderly Russians to a funeral and his desire to help Tracy, a young black woman with ALS.','/dua9PHGjGE8dmnYyp6CyfFUbO0Y.jpg','2019-07-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Give Me Liberty',565720,2.3143,6.535,'YR8nVCExVo4','YouTube