195278',7.3,17525,'tr','Bana Masal Anlatma','The story of a minibus driver and a fairytale princesss nestling under the wing of timeless friendship in an ordinary neighborhood.','/5BQsiWKFhaeLRUeOEpVZsYPQjDv.jpg','2015-01-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Telling Tales',332534,1.1861,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40125,_binary '\0','/kEQee6JM5EtDGMcofa75enQ2B45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4195368',7.3,4694,'ja','ビリギャル','A high school girl, Sayaka Kudō was the bottom of the class. After a year, she improved her deviation value from 30 to 70, then passed Keio University that is considered one of the most difficult to enter in Japan.','/m53V2l1A5imyTvXDlxltc49hZfU.jpg','2015-05-01',117,'Released','Miracles can happen to you!','Flying Colors',349498,3.3518,7.5,'oyqqcgpWzsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40126,_binary '\0','/gTo9VPjYsP6FD89HdzAKfjA7qH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4196450',6.6,22769,'en','The Birth of a Nation','Nat Turner, a former slave in America, leads a liberation movement in 1831 to free African-Americans in Virginia that results in a violent retaliation from whites.','/vlbvPL3uXem7JaVWM2mVHJLkRqW.jpg','2016-09-09',120,'Released','The Untold Story of Nat Turner','The Birth of a Nation',339408,6.1393,6.6,'i18z1EQCoyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40127,_binary '\0','/qkEnklEGDFy4TRVhuHFn2DI2BP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4196566',5.1,25983,'en','The Deliverance','Ebony Jackson, a struggling single mother fighting her personal demons, moves her family into a new home for a fresh start. But when strange occurrences inside the home raise the suspicions of Child Protective Services and threaten to tear the family apart, Ebony soon finds herself locked in a battle for her life and the souls of her children.','/og1FteMFRInoQnlZeWqEn8XpXHh.jpg','2024-08-16',111,'Released','Every family has its demons.','The Deliverance',930600,8.6669,6,'PDcDagDcwPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40128,_binary '\0','/7mHeyU0a538bgguOeF57I8ZroSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4196776',6.6,260217,'en','Jason Bourne','The most dangerous former operative of the CIA is drawn out of hiding to uncover hidden truths about his past.','/xA7N41glw17MBQtcWSm2eBlBRuG.jpg','2016-07-27',123,'Released','You know his name.','Jason Bourne',324668,16.8427,6.4,'F4gJsKZvqE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40129,_binary '\0','/o6Stnc0pn1I2Bpz6yrrZXKq6qEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4196832',5,2143,'en','Is That a Gun in Your Pocket?','Spurred by a gun incident at a school, the women of one Texas town lead a movement to get rid of guns by withholding sex from their husbands.','/cPXvtB9VytQDhzEC4bSEbRrX064.jpg','2016-09-16',95,'Released','They have their men by the barrels.','Is That a Gun in Your Pocket?',410348,1.7889,5.9,'NPPz6i8_nbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40130,_binary '\0','/y6jpd3c1UFoouBmIVWZMCGVyQmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4196848',7.6,34802,'en','Mr. Church','A unique friendship develops when a little girl and her dying mother inherit a cook - Mr. Church. What begins as an arrangement that should only last six months, instead spans fifteen years.','/5fCfZEQwcbuqVPyMu7pN5XNpK5V.jpg','2016-09-16',104,'Released','He was the one person she could always count on.','Mr. Church',374461,4.6898,7.4,'SuKnGsYM51U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40131,_binary '\0','/as0dcDSa2umqUy2untKNnbt4gT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4197642',7,2557,'en','A Date for Mad Mary','\"Mad\" Mary McArdle returns to Drogheda after a short spell in prison for something she\'d rather forget. Back home, everything and everyone has changed. Her best friend, Charlene, is about to get married and Mary is maid of honor. When Charlene refuses Mary a \'plus one\' on the grounds that she probably couldn\'t find a date, Mary becomes determined to prove her wrong.','/cAOkKIF8tJXdOOyHOIl6F8qDJgc.jpg','2016-09-02',82,'Released',NULL,'A Date for Mad Mary',405473,1.781,6.4,'PgAkhspus8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40132,_binary '\0','/q5L3aXchoCgwbZbwWl5FjhGmuYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt41983440',5.2,1584,'de','23 000 Leben','A group of young people sets sail for the Mediterranean to save the lives of refugees — a mission that puts their ideas of law and justice to the test.','/cNYTQKXvlSI62WacK35SfL22xs2.jpg','2026-07-02',112,'Released',NULL,'23 000 Lives',1656220,8.1887,6.09,'89dugTvBEWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40133,_binary '\0','/9RykqvfLhZ47ZHEmQUjyMI64zDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4199898',4.9,5282,'en','Playmobil: The Movie','Marla is forced to abandon her carefully structured life to embark on an epic journey to find her younger brother Charlie who has disappeared into the vast and wondrous animated world of Playmobil toys.','/zPQzLZnfVw9fbXyxxglyOsmQBlu.jpg','2019-06-10',99,'Released','Let adventure lead you home.','Playmobil: The Movie',366668,6.3489,5.741,'xgyP9GG9Ecw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40134,_binary '\0','/kSxIfzsTLfSiInjU3KUCbrpetiL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4200442',6.6,3002,'en','A Bone to Pick: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery','A librarian with a sharp mind for murder, Aurora Teagarden is known around her small town as a master sleuth. When her friend Jane unexpectedly dies and leaves Aurora everything in her will, she also leaves a troubling murder mystery haunting her neighborhood. It is up to Aurora to piece together the clues—including a skull, its missing skeleton and a suspicious group of neighbors—and solve the murder before she becomes the unlikely killer’s next victim.','/rqpbgbIlErLBO39Y2kpYCi39Xxa.jpg','2015-04-04',83,'Released',NULL,'A Bone to Pick: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery',325078,2.8566,6.9,'C1JEC7zh6yA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40135,_binary '\0','/7SL4tcgbCo0BRsjbFwWuh3g1J7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt42009731',7.9,1349,'en','Travis Barker: Louder Than Fear','After surviving a devastating plane crash that nearly took his life, legendary and electrifying drummer Travis Barker embarks on a raw and redemptive journey in this intimate portrait of the man behind the tattoos who transformed pain into power.','/nFjdTYHi7tRjijf3utArceQFtRi.jpg','2026-06-13',101,'Released',NULL,'Travis Barker: Louder Than Fear',1695225,3.5855,8.1,'QOsVdlr0Q1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40136,_binary '\0','/4MBGeluANg9jTgauXsQ6FikQ7cB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4201004',5.6,2485,'de','Der Nanny','Young industrialist Clemens Klina doesn\'t have time for his children and accidentally hires a man who actually came to him, seeking revenge, as a nanny for them.','/p2a4Qzbj4bbqgro1MN3eITsDMm4.jpg','2015-03-26',110,'Released',NULL,'The Manny',308187,2.3018,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40137,_binary '\0','/qoy6hNdQaJgkzQrvq645QyntMeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4203284',6.4,1604,'es','Voley','While spending New Year\'s Eve with a group of friends at his grandfather\'s cabin, a flirtatious young man unexpectedly falls for one of his guests.','/bm8UHjLE8Spvsr1tsV8oiRtirnW.jpg','2015-03-12',95,'Released','We all cheat.','Volley',331424,0.9975,5.7,'9VQtnzPrPL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40138,_binary '\0','/nJgIGyCQIVxht2ktEto1cMkexb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4205416',7.7,2969,'es','Nacido en Gaza','This documentary focuses on the devastating violence of the Israel-Palestine conflict and its effects on the children of Gaza.','/xTyG1C02GAmD7giNbgnTDKV4g69.jpg','2014-12-12',69,'Released',NULL,'Born in Gaza',300521,1.0843,7.8,'yQJVhL3AKPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40139,_binary '\0','/sCtJkYwBrJm8mygRrDGyluf1gSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4205718',3.5,4029,'en','Intersect','A group of young Miskatonic University scientists invent a time machine, only to learn that they are being manipulated by mysterious, unseen forces from another dimension.','/e6hgmD0P133bW5EH1kfhscwXN2a.jpg','2020-02-12',119,'Released','Never is safe.','Intersect',736509,1.9883,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40140,_binary '\0','/c10ZUWOWaTR9JWUzZBug5Apx2Nc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4205896',3.7,3077,'en','Night Walk','Modern day Romeo and Juliet, star crossed lovers are torn apart by cultural tensions between the East and the West. Sarah takes her American boyfriend Frank to her home country in the Arab world.','/9OPt32Q1B6iJtWuo0288QjUIvK7.jpg','2019-10-05',97,'Released','Faith is the only escape.','Night Walk',594399,2.0631,4.6,'CDYB1ylV70E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40141,_binary '\0','/wIk6HgsIyEJTnfxSm0HniJDrcsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4206218',6.8,4608,'es','The Propaganda Game','North Korea. The last communist country in the world. Unknown, hermetic and fascinating. Formerly known as “The Hermit Kingdom” for its attempts to remain isolated, North Korea is one of the largest sources of instability as regards world peace. It also has the most militarized border in the world, and the flow of impartial information, both going in and out, is practically non-existent. As the recent Sony-leaks has shown, it is the perfect setting for a propaganda war.','/rDuEM9FHmRCmdrpQlkBacxLmxqF.jpg','2015-10-03',94,'Released',NULL,'The Propaganda Game',359746,1.0383,6.9,'YGir3buLI8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40142,_binary '\0','/bhg1MGVy9gVVH6QlyUDRNxtHdpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4207112',7.5,5196,'en','Score: A Film Music Documentary','Music is an integral part of most films, adding emotion and nuance while often remaining invisible to audiences. Matt Schrader shines a spotlight on the overlooked craft of film composing, gathering many of the art form’s most influential practitioners, from Hans Zimmer and Danny Elfman to Quincy Jones and Randy Newman, to uncover their creative process. Tracing key developments in the evolution of music in film, and exploring some of cinema’s most iconic soundtracks, \'Score\' is an aural valentine for film lovers.','/hlass0Pq1j6WD6JAucH3mXBoWo4.jpg','2017-03-16',94,'Released',NULL,'Score: A Film Music Documentary',426410,3.1381,7.188,'6vzZdXhql3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40143,_binary '\0','/rHfsJn9leXZWpiNIFbOoWko9yT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4209174',4.2,1340,'en','Chimera Strain','A brilliant but disturbed scientist freezes his children alive, while he races to cure their deadly genetic disease by decoding the DNA of the immortal Turritopsis jellyfish.','/5ksNuAeuVf5Oxwj0Y6lCwYotD1P.jpg','2018-02-24',80,'Released','DO YOU WANT TO LIVE FOREVER?','Chimera Strain',507220,1.9414,4,'3HkzV4n66AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40144,_binary '\0','/rHcBZ6ZKCe4FalWHyvBGsyMsh0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4209788',7.4,205990,'en','Molly\'s Game','Molly Bloom, a young skier and former Olympic hopeful becomes a successful entrepreneur (and a target of an FBI investigation) when she establishes a high-stakes, international poker game.','/zrGQwKNmAz5awZI2V1k5M4eTTTN.jpg','2017-12-07',141,'Released','Deal with her.','Molly\'s Game',396371,12.5689,7.154,'9v-pw0ZQRLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40145,_binary '\0','/6TMMB8aubywndZDH658Tu1l6HuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4210080',6.5,7560,'en','The Confirmation','A divorced father reconnects with his son when they track down a stolen toolbox over the course of a weekend.','/4FTN4G64s2hfZ9uvpXCeipt4khZ.jpg','2016-03-18',101,'Released',NULL,'The Confirmation',347881,3.1117,6.4,'kZiyaxhPAgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40146,_binary '\0','/e0GXVVzZgkdBAuiyAwzz1rsMrqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4211044',6.3,4380,'en','Adult Life Skills','Anna is stuck: she’s approaching 30 and has just moved back to her rural home-town, and into a shed in her mother’s backyard. She spends her time working a menial job at a local boating center and hides in the depths of her imagination, making movies with her thumbs. Irritated by her childish behavior, Anna\'s mother insists that she move out of her shed and on with her life. When a troubled young boy starts hanging around, the two form an unlikely bond. Through their strange yet mutually beneficial friendship, Anna slowly begins to confront her perpetual state of arrested development.','/1XiqACmd8cNOtD0pjxBoS7kWnGH.jpg','2016-06-24',96,'Released','There\'s no badge for growing up.','Adult Life Skills',390592,2.2571,6.2,'Bk6OxjwL5Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40147,_binary '\0','/hX6jtlcsyGR5LMOP4Q26LREiUlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt42111190',6.9,1594,'pa','Oye Bhole Oye 2','A simple village boy refuses to sell his land when a powerful company offers big money, even as his own family gives in. As he stands alone, his fight turns from a personal struggle into a larger battle to protect his roots and expose the truth behind the project.','/ftGotnuSroCGI2R0EgzwMX3tmAt.jpg','2026-06-12',142,'Released',NULL,'Oye Bhole Oye 2',1688935,1.2679,0,'tyG9hgWzD6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40148,_binary '\0','/ssmjSDtQ2qI49evzLU8GY5PHKAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4211312',5.5,4862,'en','The White King','Djata is a care-free 12-year-old growing up in a brutal dictatorship shut off from the outside world. When the government imprisons his father, Peter, and Djata and his mother Hannah are labeled traitors, the boy will not rest until he sees his father again.','/cmMQKG8ca4xZLy9BtpXMfLXoIR2.jpg','2016-06-18',89,'Released','The hardest thing to break is the human spirit.','The White King',364410,1.4806,5.3,'AAysTz6d5so','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40149,_binary '\0','/410blM5fXyd6EbKUjVw5xtz7pK4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4213806',5.9,3649,'es','Toro','Toro (Spanish for \"Bull\") is a young con man and the right hand of Romano, a powerful mob boss in Torremolinos, Málaga (Andalusia, south to Spain). After Toro decides to leave Romano to get a life free of crime, his last sting fails, resulting one of his brothers dead and he sent to jail. Five years later, Romano realizes that López, Toro\'s older brother, is robbing him money from his tourism business and he orders to kidnap Diana, López\'s little daughter, until this one get back the money. Without options, López visits Toro, now a touristic driver with the third grade prison close to get the parole, who only wants to be free to marry his girlfriend Estrella. When Toro accepts to help López and both meet Romano looking for a solution, Toro ends attacking Romano\'s men and fleeing with Diana, trying to escape from Romano\'s revenge. But Romano starts a ruthless searching for they three, meanwhile Toro counts the hours to back the prison according to the third grade...','/4VTgL6uCdR90w1qKInmidWSd3OB.jpg','2016-04-22',105,'Released',NULL,'Toro',364615,1.6332,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40150,_binary '\0','/j1DzfqxQxv240taJlTlQEYZLKdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4215332',5.3,1633,'en','Barbie in Princess Power','Barbie is Kara - a modern-day princess with a normal life. Kissed by a butterfly which gives her superpowers and allows her to become a Super Sparkle, she is ready to save the kingdom from evil - were it not for her jealous cousin who is also kissed by the butterfly and becomes her rival and nemesis. Watch as Super Sparkle and Dark Sparkle learn that together they can become a great team for good once they learn the power of friendship.','/nCviAdChxibrKRZfvG7MZ2wsqdR.jpg','2015-01-29',74,'Released','Take flight with a new kind of princess!','Barbie in Princess Power',316322,3.944,6.1,'Qc5NxgIPq7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40151,_binary '\0','/f5QHgN2zKunxMItGaD3breD8UFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4215810',6.1,2417,'en','River','In the south of Laos, an American volunteer doctor becomes a fugitive after he intervenes in the sexual assault of a young woman. When the assailant\'s body is pulled from the Mekong River, things quickly spiral out of control.','/teP6JTcdPlXr6bBT9fZ7TTiGLWP.jpg','2016-03-11',95,'Released','Run for your life','River',353732,1.4391,5.807,'pwWILF80q7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40152,_binary '\0','/rFjeGAA4cW8PEuVbzayDGLg07l6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4216902',6.2,4712,'fr','Arès','In a near future, the world order has changed. With its 10 millions of unemployed citizens, France has now become a poor country. Its people wavers between rebellion and resignation and find an outlet in the shape of TV broadcast ultra brutal fights in which the players are legally doped and unscrupulous.','/sVKz7eKtSkVGjKaSWo065XTkWk9.jpg','2016-11-23',80,'Released',NULL,'Ares',415132,3.4783,6.038,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40153,_binary '\0','/i7Bt46BmvQjXopW80KydvlLcAdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4216908',6.5,2555,'fr','L\'Hermine','When a feared judge of the French court, Xavier Racine, encounters a French-Danish juror, Ditte Lorensen-Coteret, at a murder trial, their shared past is slowly uncovered.','/d3Z1HeAn9sdCIn9SlFONAMZtmzJ.jpg','2015-11-18',98,'Released',NULL,'Courted',329809,1.8299,6.1,'q1mfsielz0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40154,_binary '\0','/5ftbLnEQ4ELHooQNCoJl7MaX6dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4216934',6.2,2096,'de','Frau Müller muss weg!','Because of their children\'s bad grades, some parents want the teacher Mrs. Müller gone. They meet with Mrs. Müller and try to convince her to leave the class.','/i3GEv91OC3DnqNC4w2HZhni0w2b.jpg','2015-01-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Frau Müller muss weg!',315335,1.8172,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40155,_binary '\0','/wwARk7hRIfHfh2n2ubN6N7lvTne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4216984',5.6,45361,'en','Wolf Man','With his marriage fraying, Blake persuades his wife Charlotte to take a break from the city and visit his remote childhood home in rural Oregon. As they arrive at the farmhouse in the dead of night, they\'re attacked by an unseen animal and barricade themselves inside the home as the creature prowls the perimeter. But as the night stretches on, Blake begins to behave strangely, transforming into something unrecognizable.','/wpSDzTBfF0Eeo5lzu2w9FTujGqd.jpg','2025-01-15',103,'Released','Protect your own.','Wolf Man',710295,11.548,6.141,'kAw4PH2IQgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40156,_binary '\0','/usGRxcuvOCXiI5kQm0H3EKSmTxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4217392',5.2,12466,'zh','功夫瑜伽','Two professors team up to locate a lost treasure and embark on an adventure that takes them from a Tibetan ice cave to Dubai, and to a mountain temple in India.','/rL6XM4fsr1cM5mN2flEhQ8jQter.jpg','2017-01-27',107,'Released',NULL,'Kung Fu Yoga',383785,5.0395,5.875,'DkPluechlNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40157,_binary '\0','/tkri1hMrb1FhWfb2bWpprsvq9Sd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4218572',6.8,109809,'en','Widows','A police shootout leaves four thieves dead during an explosive armed robbery attempt in Chicago. Their widows have nothing in common except a debt left behind by their spouses\' criminal activities. Hoping to forge a future on their own terms, they join forces to pull off a heist.','/d31SGJSaX29ba5ZUbZcesGoDE7I.jpg','2018-11-06',129,'Released','Left with nothing. Capable of anything.','Widows',401469,10.0803,6.5,'nN2yBBSRC78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40158,_binary '\0','/eDw3ydtUpCE541mBFnEnSHyYuaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4218696',6.2,35225,'en','The Wall','An American sniper and his spotter engage in a deadly cat-and-mouse game with an Iraqi sniper.','/8POAZwZpp24l1IgKKM8ZRAQ2kid.jpg','2017-05-12',90,'Released','This isn\'t war. It\'s