ased',NULL,'Love Oh Love',1579405,1.6981,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40162,_binary '\0','/cRgm6oLSXSnCR2J9BSkYapoUxdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4222522',6.7,1534,'en','The Christmas Shepherd','Sally Brown, a successful children\'s book author and Army widow loses her late husband\'s German Shepherd, Buddy, only to later find him adopted by a new family - single father Mark Green and his teenage daughter Emma. Each finds a sense of Christmas spirit as they struggle to decide with whom the dog really belongs.','/8fnt1ReSDl02kqYM5mT1bZGMTqB.jpg','2014-11-23',84,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Shepherd',299583,1.7971,6,'CsgUGiNpba8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40163,_binary '\0','/j8q5okXQkJFd1V1uNB9HKYtBDDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4222718',6.9,2602,'th','ไอฟาย..แต๊งกิ้ว..เลิฟยู้','Desperate to go to the U.S. to win back his girlfriend, Yim hires a tutor to teach him English. But things don\'t go according to plan.','/xUh33slN3QQVko2c7HybnPQgN6C.jpg','2014-12-10',116,'Released','A grammatically incorrect love story.','I Fine..Thank You Love You',332506,2.4098,7,'MoFNUxnPQXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40164,_binary '\0','/s6rOAn4l2bvie6CxFCy4l54ZVns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4224478',5.2,1411,'en','The Subjects','Eight strangers go into a locked room for clinical trials on a new drug that gives them superpowers.','/9vZnD9Dwa9m3miNvASKzHqbWgnz.jpg','2015-10-08',80,'Released','Not everyone is meant to be a hero','The Subjects',347258,1.0675,5.4,'ZKDXGyC0f2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40165,_binary '\0','/c2okBqLRH8doadzIMcKC9RemlQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4225012',5.9,3336,'en','A Little White Lie','A handyman living in New York City is mistaken for a famous and famously reclusive writer and brought to a university where he is to deliver a keynote address.','/ne9ninjEnyaRkZQnNAZuPVYgpgu.jpg','2023-03-03',101,'Released','The truth is in