You Die','Wrecker',365805,1.9144,4,'hneV_QG8kt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40170,_binary '\0','/7O4RcjTNHLFuogbjbF7sWPIxIXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4228294',6.7,2353,'fr','Les Cowboys','Drama about a father and son who set out to find their missing daughter/sister with the help of an American headhunter.','/8pi1CLkSGSQyUC0gBjIYtUkyDRG.jpg','2015-11-25',114,'Released',NULL,'Les Cowboys',336811,1.5381,6.4,'_oQygjAoRPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40171,_binary '\0','/zTSPHhBsaw2T6dwj5HnG8rZoXzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4228378',8.5,1569,'kn','ಶ್!','When a movie crew arrives to shoot their film at an estate, they are haunted by the supernatural elements of the lonely house on the estate. Things get worse when the people of the estate and crew start disappearing.','/xrXiz7UlpxklohwOu7rDpqM1l2G.jpg','1993-12-03',135,'Released',NULL,'Shhh!',331456,1.0037,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40172,_binary '\0','/pVMbIolu6dWhtpY68nHIRiE7gf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4228746',4.5,1653,'hi','Zid','A journalist, who is still in love with his ex-girlfriend, becomes the obsession of his landlord\'s daughter.','/wRh3OeUmzouuqkBymWh4WSuWFkL.jpg','2014-11-28',128,'Released','Come Play With Fire','Zid',310123,1.7215,3.8,'bArdCUba1EI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40173,_binary '\0','/rSWv4coph16vM5yOaOFXE1Y6qgY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4228810',7.1,4000,'fr','Au nom de ma fille','In 1982, André Bamberski learns about the death of his 14 year-old daughter, Kalinka, while she was on vacation with her mother and stepfather in Germany. Convinced that Kalinka’s death was not an accident, Bamberski begins to investigate. A botched autopsy report raises his suspicions and leads him to accuse Kalinka’s stepfather, Dr Dieter Krombach, as the murderer. Unable to indict Krombach in Germany, Bamberski attempts to take the trial to France, where he will dedicate his life to Kalinka’s justice and the imprisonment of Krombach.','/lVYfYQBBvs6yb7pChIBJ6R4vsrK.jpg','2016-03-16',87,'Released',NULL,'In Her Name',381262,3.1633,6.756,'9yfTEjo5n90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40174,_binary '\0','/n1BjnpeFJ8hVXae8SIlkjJ7BkJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4229236',7.5,33563,'en','Cobain: Montage of Heck','Hailed as one of the most innovative and intimate documentaries of all time, experience Kurt Cobain like never before in the only ever fully authorized portrait of the famed music icon. Academy Award nominated filmmaker Brett Morgen expertly blends Cobain\'s personal archive of art, music, never seen before movies, animation and revelatory interviews from his family and closest friends.','/hQEkK4WnTtQXIp5QOnVTsK3xYRM.jpg','2015-03-23',132,'Released',NULL,'Cobain: Montage of Heck',319075,3.3747,7.621,'DsB6SzPV9B0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40175,_binary '\0','/9D4vcFHiqXyKgcO9lkX3JLL1DwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4229298',4.9,2512,'en','The Unspoken','In 1997 the close-knit Anderson family vanished from their home without a trace. No bodies were ever found and no explanation satisfied curiosity. For 17 years the house has remained undisturbed...until now. This eerily expert frightener is further enlivened by terrific performances from ‘Suits’/’Arrow’ star Neal McDonough and SILENT HILL/THE TALL MAN/TIDELAND’s Jodelle Ferland.','/pWLDlwcR10Zevqx5RyzMR0nHsI2.jpg','2015-10-24',90,'Released','The root of all evil awaits.','The Unspoken',363689,2.1057,5.1,'ejU68A13jrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40176,_binary '\0','/pnxtkmyIkuUAdRK1NgnZnUWnUOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4229938',5.4,2662,'it','Il ricco, il povero e il maggiordomo','A wealthy broker, his loyal butler, and a poor street seller all see their social positions change in a twist of fate.','/fjnOjxruO6rmUwF2nnnoynYhUHf.jpg','2014-12-11',102,'Released',NULL,'The Rich, the Pauper and the Butler',310126,1.3276,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40177,_binary '\0','/57C62vctec2g9S6qbQrxTnSBmvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4230700',5.4,6912,'en','Complete Unknown','Tom’s birthday dinner party is turned upside down by the unexpected arrival of Alice, an old flame who changed her identity and vanished without a trace 15 years prior.','/sdn5uNsxo0HBhTL4RuTLP0swnmO.jpg','2016-08-26',90,'Released','You are who you say you are.','Complete Unknown',373476,3.3144,5.161,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40178,_binary '\0','/yh6T7vhtDbsxLSTU4SHI7zUkMcP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4232066',6.9,1335,'hi','Once Again','After a chance phone call leads to daily conversations, a widowed restaurant owner and a lonely film actor plan to finally meet in person.','/rVmtLeXqh66Xo91DckVX9B9t9aD.jpg','2019-04-24',101,'Released',NULL,'Once Again',546241,1.2623,6.188,'KBcfQNMR180','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40179,_binary '\0','/eNwr5UbRWn6724zvY1i7oV74Iog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4232610',5.7,4605,'fr','Antigang','As a rowdy team of detectives clashes with their disciplined new boss, they must catch a vicious band of robbers who are wreaking havoc on their city.','/nHIcxyXEKUNVJ0psIrjNyld1XWL.jpg','2015-08-19',92,'Released','Good cops. Bad Attitude.','Antigang',348060,3.8372,5.9,'9J-UZAFb0J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40180,_binary '\0','/80X7M2z3xZLBoRVrLV8qqFeX8I8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4234734',5.3,2382,'en','Babysitter\'s Black Book','When her parents\' financial problems threaten Ashley\'s dreams for college, the high school whiz kid takes matters into her own hands. She and her girlfriends turn their babysitting business into a wildly successful escort service for dads. But in this small suburban community, nothing stays secret for long.','/lH8aKsjxVx1sxbV4XLIEuczsscP.jpg','2015-02-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Babysitter\'s Black Book',326923,2.6047,5.5,'f1cGl5q44W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40181,_binary '\0','/yDweA3PYT3EuZ26aFsuPpxtdC4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4234740',4.7,1490,'tr','Hayalet Dayı','Ozan and Caner, searching for a place to call home, finally find the perfect house after a long and arduous search. The house they find at an extraordinary price turns out to be truly extraordinary, and amusing events follow them everywhere. Unfortunately, the deceased owner of the old mansion they rented is stuck in limbo, and only Caner and Ozan can see him. Helping this old soul cross over peacefully is now the task of these two young men. The mission they embark on to find peace in the house drags them into a series of events that are as comical as they are emotional.','/uQZqKrFwmsGQ4KLo6QRX5paoWgG.jpg','2015-05-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Hayalet Dayı',364394,0.8312,4.4,'qf26CrNWr_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40182,_binary '\0','/Agt0eZRu9N7W17FJDNMOqYlqNDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4235644',6,1609,'ja','屍者の帝国','The story takes place in 19th century Europe, and revolves around John Watson. He is scouted by the government to become a secret agent. However, Watson lives in a world where \"Frankensteins\"—human corpses that are re-purposed with a false soul in order to use them as laborers—are used to improve industrial development.','/gtfQzn3lRnJ2P3CcE8yxOtXPHTC.jpg','2015-10-02',120,'Released','The dead will inherit the Earth.','The Empire of Corpses',342588,2.6601,6.201,'CF0wVpPhTck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40183,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt42362291',7.3,1577,'en','Jeena Dil Se','A youthful gang\'s carefree existence spirals into delightful pandemonium after secrets emerge and misunderstandings multiply. Between musical moments and romantic entanglements, they find the courage to live authentically.',NULL,NULL,138,'Released',NULL,'Jeena Dil Se',1713546,0.4413,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40184,_binary '\0','/j0QTgRqNpOs8SsaabVAIhVlXfJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4238858',6.6,5312,'en','The Fits','While training at the gym, 11-year-old tomboy Toni becomes entranced with a dance troupe. As she struggles to fit in, she finds herself caught up in danger as the group begins to suffer from fainting spells and other violent fits.','/ujK85shn2lY3yJrleXa8wThgVrI.jpg','2016-06-03',72,'Released','Why fit in when you can dance to your own beat?','The Fits',358807,1.3029,6.4,'jfHnykLOjH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40185,_binary '\0','/oKMLvGOlEl7BVRHHJxH7NE3W8gc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4239726',6.9,4904,'en','Tanna','In a traditional tribal society in the South Pacific, a young girl, Wawa, falls in love with her chief’s grandson, Dain. When an inter-tribal war escalates, Wawa is unknowingly betrothed as part of a peace deal. The young lovers run away, refusing her arranged fate. They must choose between their hearts and the future of the tribe, while the villagers must wrestle with preserving their traditional culture and adapting it to the increasing outside demands for individual freedom.','/iKk0Nu3dytbDzX1SFwYJvUreQW.jpg','2015-10-16',104,'Released','Two tribes. One love.','Tanna',359151,2.3274,6.617,'LnR8pUoPJZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40186,_binary '\0','/oH38nxLfCe8Pgefo6CJq3XoiKj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4240406',5.9,2534,'cs','Lída Baarová','Salzburg, Germany, 2000. The elderly Czech actress Lída Baarová tells a journalist the tumultuous story of her rise to fame in 1930s Berlin and her passionate relationship with the sinister Joseph Goebbels, Minister of Propaganda of the Third Reich.','/lViWHUj8m4XT7KsUTZiKVtYIedm.jpg','2016-01-21',111,'Released','She turned down Hollywood to become Goebbels\' lover: Lída Baarová','The Devil\'s Mistress',376972,1.8032,6,'o4ckFEz7Nd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40187,_binary '\0','/xo8pEtEQGsqZN33bJk7pF6tLnEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4240654',5.9,6570,'tr','Siccîn','Öznur is a young and beautiful woman. She has had a platonic love since childhood to Kudret, who is her cousin. Kudret, however, is married to a woman named Nisa and is very happy. Jealous, Öznur uses terrible black magic to change this so that she and Kudret will be together. However, she is not prepared for the evil that this spell unleashes.','/fYbhwSIVl42JA4f6rs3MeE2wR4s.jpg','2014-09-26',96,'Released','Magic is a sin.','Sijjin',334175,2.1123,5.74,'v2Ay_K2zlR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40188,_binary '\0','/32ufgYX8KckBiSKK1zCitOWEKea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4241904',5.3,2920,'en','The Way We Weren\'t','Charlotte and Brandon meet online just after their previous relationships have imploded; in an effort to make themselves more appealing, they have fudged, exaggerated, re-imagined, and outright lied about their pasts in an attempt to be each other\'s perfect match. Now that they\'ve said their \"I do\'s\" they are about to get a funny, hellish, and eye-opening look at just who they\'ve vowed to spend the rest of their lives with. Will familiarity breed contempt... or bliss?','/65hQc40FxKSpigISbC6ssUM0658.jpg','2019-02-12',93,'Released','Get ready to fall badly in love.','The Way We Weren\'t',580522,2.5124,5,'LCpXtPVYaRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40189,_binary '\0','/AgZuokxo8EQ8n0EeehoWNxeoY4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4242158',5.4,2078,'zh','港囧','When Xu Lai goes on vacation with his wife and extended family, he gets a chance to meet his former lover. However, his brother-in-law foils his plans and he becomes a suspect in a murder case.','/5hXxdYsFdKIFe5jp2uHiGOITlmx.jpg','2015-09-25',114,'Released',NULL,'Lost in Hong Kong',361613,2.3595,5.7,'sq6Gn76xCOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40190,_binary '\0','/rG2jdLdj4U55MgI3g9f85w2th1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4244162',4.6,21859,'en','Beta Test','While testing the latest first person shooter from global game developer, Sentinel, video game champion Max Troy discovers the events happening within the game are being reflected in the real world. He soon determines that the game\'s protagonist is real-life Orson Creed, an ex-Sentinel employee who is being remotely controlled by the corporation for reasons unknown. As virtual and real worlds collide, Max and Creed must join forces to unravel the conspiracy before the game\'s sinister events escalate and overwhelm the city.','/zKisJfMxpp0KfX4P3VyDrH0edg6.jpg','2016-07-22',88,'Released','The Game is Real','Beta Test',401123,1.798,5.2,'8pxujcICULQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40191,_binary '\0','/4LrL40XecjGLRpX5I2gzMTUt04l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4244994',7.3,210465,'en','The Last Duel','King Charles VI declares that Knight Jean de Carrouges settle his dispute with his squire, Jacques Le Gris, by challenging him to a duel.','/zjrJE0fpzPvX8saJXj8VNfcjBoU.jpg','2021-10-13',153,'Released','The true story of a woman who defied a nation and made history.','The Last Duel',617653,13.889,7.396,'mgygUwPJvYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40192,_binary '\0','/Gn7CHQKw5rgQrnVQhvGnlOaD8F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4244998',6.6,72477,'en','Alpha','In the prehistoric past, Keda, a young and inexperienced hunter, struggles to return home after being separated from his tribe when bison hunting goes awry. On his way back he will find an unexpected ally.','/afdZAIcAQscziqVtsEoh2PwsYTW.jpg','2018-08-17',97,'Released','Leaders are born from survival','Alpha',399360,7.9987,6.572,'uIxnTi4GmCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40193,_binary '\0','/5gWhwqXKVXXtzFgxEmnQ7kAh0si.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4246894',7.2,1881,'nl','The Paradise Suite','The lives of six people, who seem to have nothing more in common than their faraway homelands, become inextricably linked in Amsterdam, the city they have chosen as their new home.','/ZfRRNNfDdfeTYj8QD4EzIOCSi9.jpg','2015-10-29',118,'Released',NULL,'The Paradise Suite',358083,1.3994,6.6,'yBxz3h3uhos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40194,_binary '\0','/A05oY6IWx2YVeTXVgVfkgjeb6mC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4247144',5.5,1596,'nl','Bon Bini Holland','Robertico is forced to pay 200.000 gulden in damages due to a dodgy dealing. He pretends to be a business man to obtain an investment from the rich Ken Maduro. Until he falls in love with Ken\'s daughter.','/h9H7KrorUlf3fYxJXOcI5QkZAYk.jpg','2015-12-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Bon Bini Holland',366887,1.1603,5.5,'QD22ZCHnS08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40195,_binary '\0','/9TIt5pwoXAJG7dHksYDr3qcMU2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4247492',6.6,1355,'fr','Les démons','While Montreal is in the throes of a string of kidnappings targeting young boys, ten-year-old Felix is finishing his school year in the seemingly quiet suburb where he lives. A sensitive boy with a vivid imagination, Felix is afraid of everything. Little by little, his imaginary demons begin to mirror those of the truly disturbing world around him.','/xNY5V7DFVWYdADWbTlZj7YiVlEn.jpg','2015-10-30',118,'Released',NULL,'The Demons',361571,1.5915,6,'3Tkk3gvapjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40196,_binary '\0','/cBwB9apqeapq6CIrpG1FrzKkIJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4247618',6.8,4098,'en','The Dresser','One fateful night in a small English regional theatre during World War II a troupe of touring actors stage a production of Shakespeares King Lear. Bombs are falling, sirens are wailing, the curtain is up in an hour but the actor/manager Sir who is playing Lear is nowhere to be seen. His dresser Norman must scramble to keep the production alive but will Sir turn up in time and if he does will he be able to perform that night? The Dresser is a wickedly funny and deeply moving story of friendship and loyalty as Sir reflects on his lifelong accomplishments and seeks to reconcile his turbulent friendships with those in his employ before the final curtain.','/zu1RH6FJxRH3tavMrt1hSTSh6PP.jpg','2015-10-31',109,'Released',NULL,'The Dresser',364902,4.161,6.2,'WVW-eUWam4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40197,_binary '\0','/b3JaW6qY9bI1rHPExd37Y77YRdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4247682',2.9,2265,'en','All Girls Weekend','High school friends reunite after many years to spend a weekend in the mountains, but when everything goes wrong, there is no time for girl bonding.','/6eNRMSAqSyZvfS3cpBGn4uDrdFL.jpg','2016-07-12',86,'Released','Nature is a bitch','All Girls Weekend',405932,1.1751,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40198,_binary '\0','/aAoFi6Tg3bFifCtsqwDjkhjLWOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4250566',7.3,3303,'de','Nebel im August','A Yenish boy is placed in a mental hospital and experiences the Nazi euthanasia program. Aware of what was happening and attached to friends, the lad attempts to sabotage the program. The film addresses the complexities of the program director, the lives of the child victims, and the struggles of the child protagonist. More than five thousand children died in the Nazi euthanasia program.','/1nq8Q278MsQOVDtjGzVqgW9Nn5H.jpg','2016-09-29',126,'Released',NULL,'Fog in August',380075,2.0877,7.4,'iJ26uLet1Ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40199,_binary '\0','/2mDVTroprdV4oNYv8P9gaLFAFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4253360',6.4,1440,'ko','히말라야','Based on true events, renowned mountaineer Um Hong-gil sets out on a mission to Everest to retrieve his late junior climber\'s body and faces the greatest challenge of his life.','/7ySHI3GAwxrhqgTdRwYvpTh3tO9.jpg','2015-12-16',125,'Released','There is no turning back at the top of the world.','The Himalayas',374111,2.3636,6.6,'2nOsV7qgzDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (40200,_binary '\0','/7jqMCRjnAPXTbjvm3y9tZ2kWBiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4253744',5,3466,'tr','Çakallarla Dans 3: Sıfır Sıkıntı','Brother Gokhan, Accountant Servet, Meatball Necmi and Del Piero Hikmet are released from prison on probation and they join group therapy in order to be reintegrated to society.','/7fNAIanGhqUUMyBVymDuuUn7JRP.jpg','2014-12-05',102,'Released',NULL,'Dance with the Jackals 3',336292,1.6964,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40201,_binary '\0','/x73AAxWEF0gLbecippq7ONHw2ag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4254584',6.4,4753,'en','Kicks','When his hard-earned kicks get snatched by a local hood, fifteen-year old Brandon and his two best friends go on an ill-advised mission across the Bay Area to retrieve the stolen sneakers.','/5lW7mFOQW5wPlCIT0gUuYbhNtVP.jpg','2016-09-09',80,'Released','They aren\'t just shoes','Kicks',385736,2.1921,6.671,'wWV2hK4HVEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40202,_binary '\0','/bQOhQ4Ch6Yjr4gqlwPTeuiAiZtl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4255110',5.1,5766,'en','Contracted: Phase II','Picking up directly where the previous film left off, the story follows Riley, one of the last people to come in contact with Samantha, as he scrambles to track down those responsible for the outbreak before the highly contagious disease not only consumes his body, but the world as we know it.','/jTFrI6BWcFDwBaXT2fPjQAb8amt.jpg','2015-07-05',78,'Released','Protection is out of the question','Contracted: Phase II',345468,3.1069,5.367,'MMS8M_EpC9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40203,_binary '\0','/rq9kv233eEKnYfe8r5fi8SP5T7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4255196',4.3,1914,'en','Before the Fire','Deep in the throes of a global pandemic, up and coming TV star, Ava Boone, is forced to flee the mounting chaos in Los Angeles and return to her rural hometown. But as she struggles to acclimate to a way of life she left behind long ago, her homecoming attracts a dangerous figure from her past – threatening both her and the family that serves as her only sanctuary.','/bAwtbmCzhFwKf2wN6QQH301ylbO.jpg','2020-03-14',92,'Released','There\'s no place like home','Before the Fire',671145,1.6418,5.7,'C5XMjhhlR5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40204,_binary '\0','/oZwwwezJFlHmQGBRJDLmENXwOIt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4255304',5.9,48445,'en','The Void','In the middle of a routine patrol, officer Daniel Carter happens upon a blood-soaked figure limping down a deserted stretch of road. He rushes the young man to a nearby rural hospital staffed by a skeleton crew, only to discover that patients and personnel are transforming into something inhuman. As the horror intensifies, Carter leads the other survivors on a hellish voyage into the subterranean depths of the hospital in a desperate bid to end the nightmare before it\'s too late.','/5UYFGPDGFIPGlO4vU1dqzJi3MNd.jpg','2016-09-22',90,'Released','There is a Hell. This is worse.','The Void',378018,5.2521,6,'IkmSNt4moNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40205,_binary '\0','/uQViA6gDNHaEfO6ryDybvoX9QWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4255626',5.9,2037,'fr','Toute première fois','Jérémie, 34, wakes up in an apartment he doesn\'t know, next to a woman he doesn\'t know. She is Adna, a stunning Swedish woman who is as funny as she is sweet. Is this the beginning of a fairy tale? Not quite, since Jérémie is about to get married—to Antoine.','/s0L9olKKjcUOiU4JOuq8fJuXTNH.jpg','2015-01-28',98,'Released',NULL,'I Kissed a Girl',319340,1.3857,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40206,_binary '\0','/29VoISagzOfJcuuhFzKQg9ZmEUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4257858',8,42682,'en','Going Clear: Scientology and the Prison of Belief','The film profiles eight former members of the Church of Scientology, shining a light on how they attract true believers and the things they do in the name of religion.','/zWHQYR9srde9nZjU6Dot8qTjoni.jpg','2015-01-25',120,'Released',NULL,'Going Clear: Scientology and the Prison of Belief',318224,3.8974,7.6,'ixgd38EZIR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40207,_binary '\0','/wePpxpU1eNZnHCChP5xGNJrGKY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4257926',7.1,32247,'en','Miracles from Heaven','When Christy discovers her 10-year-old daughter Anna has a rare, incurable disease, she becomes a ferocious advocate for her daughter’s healing as she searches for a solution. After Anna has a freak accident and falls three stories, a miracle unfolds in the wake of her dramatic rescue that leaves medical specialists mystified, her family restored and their community inspired.','/hz9VF1TfaM0D04pYneSXUkNeOZv.jpg','2016-03-17',119,'Released','How do we explain the impossible?','Miracles from Heaven',339984,7.0222,7.5,'CldGTG6iVrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40208,_binary '\0','/wNEsxab6cURjjoEMkIC3uhrmSZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4257940',6.1,6903,'en','The Lost Husband','Trying to put her life back together after the death of her husband, Libby and her children move to her estranged Aunt\'s goat farm in central Texas.','/ouwKjq9SshrAzb2KIwa057O2I6N.jpg','2020-04-10',109,'Released','It\'s never too late to find yourself.','The Lost Husband',686142,5.3452,6.737,'kkfzi1PBS2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40209,_binary '\0','/ohUTuwlqSQgFcSe084K8r6b0yGv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4258292',7.3,11204,'ta','என்னை அறிந்தால்','Sathyadev, who is on a career break, is forced to put on his cop shoes ones again to save Thenmozhi, a young woman who is the target of a criminal organ harvesting group, led by a ghost from his past.','/hGQYVXiB16I7pPqQVSGqvgWIMkQ.jpg','2015-01-29',176,'Released',NULL,'Yennai Arindhaal',300983,2.0342,6.942,'B7c87SWQg-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40210,_binary '\0','/uM4oQFdL3VMyAoPT81i8T80ygsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4258698',6.3,9763,'en','Southside with You','Chronicles a single day in the summer of 1989 when the future president of the United States, Barack Obama, wooed his future First Lady on an epic first date across Chicago\'s South Side.','/fEbIZkufqHFMeSpwxH270txk5Ao.jpg','2016-08-26',80,'Released',NULL,'Southside with You',310888,2.6637,5.629,'yhd-yvMjImU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40211,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4260766',2.2,1575,'tr','Yapışık Kardeşler','Conjoined twins Halim and Selim have led a carefree life in their small village but, unable to find suitable brides, journey to Istanbul in search of marriage prospects.','/pZeiawbHTClEf5NWUuGmqiS6NFC.jpg','2015-01-30',103,'Released',NULL,'Yapışık Kardeşler',326470,1.4442,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40212,_binary '\0','/u1tERbLDYPtgEaWSS9uJZrdCAkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4261326',3.7,1779,'en','2307: Winter\'s Dream','In 2307, a future soldier is sent on a mission to hunt down the leader of the humanoid rebellion.','/hMEYVCklgfmQziL573tZGtOFH34.jpg','2018-08-09',101,'Released','The hunt is on','2307: Winter\'s Dream',415671,1.892,3.9,'gNCW_M8FIlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40213,_binary '\0','/lG8T8NMJHfBgxvobVBMy0rFR2OM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4262142',6.6,11220,'en','Cleveland Abduction','A single mother becomes Ariel Castro\'s first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.','/j2iCc5fjyJvKRQAW7d6XWwDFzmr.jpg','2015-05-02',88,'Released','Based on a true story.','Cleveland Abduction',336845,4.2309,7.237,'Ts3wIQZu1Tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40214,_binary '\0','/323vRUtChjvMWFAJjxIFKMO1Vlg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4262174',6.1,4394,'en','First Girl I Loved','Seventeen-year-old Anne just fell in love with Sasha, the most popular girl at her L.A. public high school. But when Anne tells her best friend, Clifton—who has always harbored a secret crush on her—he does his best to get in the way.','/cDIM1XSv4a4UpNUU7xe7w4nAMTQ.jpg','2016-10-18',91,'Released',NULL,'First Girl I Loved',352498,2.9112,6.269,'Byn7FW7wmFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40215,_binary '\0','/kOEEbW4Przzqouj0K2661d2wazW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4262516',3.4,3879,'hi','Sanam Re','A story about the man who is confused with his love life finds solace in his birthplace with his childhood love.','/kgZNHHZacK3iO18d7agg9iYQYWp.jpg','2016-02-12',120,'Released',NULL,'Sanam Re',382717,1.2737,5.958,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40216,_binary '\0','/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4262980',6.9,46991,'ja','シン・ゴジラ','When a massive, gilled monster emerges from the deep and tears through the city, the government scrambles to save its citizens. A rag-tag team of volunteers cuts through a web of red tape to uncover the monster\'s weakness and its mysterious ties to a foreign superpower. But time is not on their side - the greatest catastrophe to ever befall the world is about to evolve right before their very eyes.','/jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg','2016-07-29',120,'Released','A god incarnate. A city doomed.','Shin Godzilla',315011,10.5839,7.2,'3qX1ZU3jcfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40217,_binary '\0','/zi2oYYNSSv7t44iSt5YrxHX9PYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4263482',7,359698,'en','The Witch','In 1630, a farmer relocates his family to a remote plot of land on the edge of a forest where strange, unsettling things happen. With suspicion and paranoia mounting, each family member\'s faith, loyalty and love are tested in shocking ways.','/zap5hpFCWSvdWSuPGAQyjUv2wAC.jpg','2016-02-19',92,'Released','Evil takes many forms.','The Witch',310131,18.5297,7.002,'97OQ7MQC5Ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40218,_binary '\0','/qhrGfvWueot3aI3yV2pK824hMub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4264426',4.9,6126,'en','Bite','While on her bachelorette party getaway, Casey, the bride to be, gets a seemingly harmless bite from an unknown insect. After returning home with cold feet, Casey tries to call off her wedding but before she\'s able to, she starts exhibiting insect like traits. Between her physical transformation and her wedding anxiety, Casey succumbs to her new instincts and begins creating a hive that not only houses her translucent eggs, but feeds on the flesh of others. As her transformation becomes complete, Casey discovers that everything can change with a single bite.','/oHoqxVKgXUiz0gGQ23AZPPLgUXd.jpg','2015-07-29',90,'Released','Your fear is her appetite','Bite',347642,1.8471,5.5,'2ssS9DmZ8D4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40219,_binary '\0','/5ywx5ci0WWvIDE26vKY8m5JFbvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4265508',5.2,6878,'en','Amateur Night','Guy Carter, an insecure expectant father unable to find work in his field, accepts a job driving hookers around Los Angeles. One long and crazy evening proves to our hero that he is, in fact, up to the task of fatherhood.','/dzJFu1F0miZKHbR7tRIX6cQcI8c.jpg','2016-08-12',89,'Released','Every job has pros and cons','Amateur Night',376581,3.6688,5.527,'aqcAdkSKJDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40220,_binary '\0','/e8Pal51vkszoJdX98hzUL1cqjZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4265596',6.5,1228,'ja','ミックス。','To get revenge on her ex-boyfriend and to help revive her late mother\'s tennis table club, a table tennis prodigy decides to take part in a mixed doubles table tennis tournament.','/l9fnb7KzW2AFZxF0J9k62b3or8V.jpg','2017-10-21',119,'Released','There are no losers in the game of life','Mixed Doubles',472310,1.8051,6.479,'qEZiIGT1WFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40221,_binary '\0','/jl3MxtAPzviIW1D77vQaYrzLLqG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4265964',6.7,1290,'bn','বাদশাহী আংটি','Feluda and his cousin Topshe goes to Lucknow with Topshe\'s father to spend the Puja vacation. They arrived at the house of Dhirendra Kumar Sanyal, a friend of Topshe\'s father. That evening Dr. Shrivastav also came to Dhirendra Kumar Sanyal and tells him about last night, a thief tried to steal his \'Ring of Aurangzeb\' (The Emperor\'s Ring) which was given to him by Pyarilaal Seth. After the incident Dr. Shrivastav has been afraid and asks Dhirendra Kumar Sanyal to keep the ring safe. Dhirendra Kumar Sanyal agreed and keeps the ring to his home. But someday the ring goes missing from there. Then Feluda and Topshe started investigation for the culprit. Meanwhile, Feluda meets an interesting person in doctor\'s neighborhood, Mr. Bonobihari Sarkar. Bonobihari babu has ferocious and poisonous creatures like crocodile, African tiger, hyena, rattlesnake, scorpion and black widow spider in his own home.','/kS2GgXu7AKiOxgtGUs48ylUHVfe.jpg','2014-12-19',109,'Released',NULL,'Badshahi Angti',407681,1.1573,7.455,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40222,_binary '\0','/pSkrHRFAC8ZC6b04L7Z2PA0aIq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4266076',6,19698,'fr','La nuit a dévoré le monde','After waking up to find himself all alone in an apartment where a massive party was being held the night before, Sam is immediately forced to face a terrifying reality: the living dead have invaded the streets of Paris.','/2rR2PxT0clt1Hhw5Cv0YGk5DD2H.jpg','2018-03-07',94,'Released',NULL,'The Night Eats the World',457955,4.2329,6,'1NDCUS6W2oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40223,_binary '\0','/74oUxVDraj6ujwo3uwNDiQrQ8pU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt42664750',6.6,3414,'te','First Time','For the first time on Earth, two aliens arrive on a mysterious mission to spread their race, only to encounter supernatural forces and long-buried secrets. Their journey becomes strangely connected to two ambitious engineering students.','/6GV4XhZEYUFrpdWqGmn4MIfZuje.jpg','2026-05-22',108,'Released',NULL,'First Time',1705563,0.4793,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40224,_binary '\0','/zmhNStGN7DIGaFHQ0wERqCULGfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4266638',7.1,10977,'en','Krisha','When Krisha returns to her estranged family for Thanksgiving dinner, past demons threaten to ruin the festivities.','/xN4xhl5HYhfO9W8Y1ZZEnqmQEip.jpg','2016-03-18',82,'Released',NULL,'Krisha',323929,2.7843,6.8,'wnX_lLuENfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40225,_binary '\0','/u3ZOKKSonIVzNFlDwPd2kPypXy6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4267026',6.4,37534,'en','Hell House LLC','Five years after an unexplained malfunction causes the death of 15 tour-goers and staff on the opening night of a Halloween haunted house tour, a documentary crew travels back to the scene of the tragedy to find out what really happened.','/xUSCQEbbAy3Lv6r00RfXtdxhRDX.jpg','2015-10-16',91,'Released','New York\'s Scariest Haunted House Tour','Hell House LLC',359246,4.7159,6.48,'neYifrEDSFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40226,_binary '\0','/kE3TGDkKBaU9bd3XyHVk5FYPjxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4269118',5.4,3177,'en','Seven in Heaven','Teenagers Jude and June spend seven minutes in a locked closet and emerge in a hostile and dangerous alternate world.','/elReufFR4NYFiBVRsD0wB2F6FDf.jpg','2018-10-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Seven in Heaven',500535,2.1354,5.7,'gFLUAQG_gEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40227,_binary '\0','/i9GDLxkRCLFBXbAOSMxexEBBdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4269310',3.5,4546,'en','Chronicle of a Serial Killer','What goes through the mind of a serial killer as he meticulously plots his crimes, researching his victims and entrapping them while they are none the wiser?','/ohF3X2lYtP8sKHLhM8kWenTxNes.jpg','2020-10-01',99,'Released','evil in. evil out.','Chronicle of a Serial Killer',815078,1.4241,1.6,'7niEZ6kXT6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40228,_binary '\0','/msgEmGD3xIgvLBVAfLnQakPeLFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4269746',5.6,3009,'en','The Matchbreaker','When an idealistic romantic gets fired from his day job, he is offered a \"one-time gig\" to break up a girl\'s relationship for her disapproving parents. This \"one-time\" gig spreads through word-of-mouth and he ends up becoming a professional match-breaker. However, he ends up falling for one of his clients and must figure out how to balance his secret job with his love-life.','/m9RWMUNtaFZpYKtB8HH5Yg11P5G.jpg','2016-10-07',94,'Released','True love can just wait.','The Matchbreaker',413417,1.1667,6,'krbC2ZODinE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40229,_binary '\0','/981JWyvhMIGcRnObFDw38CJjOvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4270452',5.7,1418,'en','Seven Stages to Achieve Eternal Bliss','A small-town couple finds the perfect apartment in the big city, except there\'s one catch: the apartment is home to the ritualistic suicides of a deranged cult.','/thb424IgPjgJS1mBE6FGLglpfll.jpg','2020-03-06',93,'Released','A cult cult comedy','Seven Stages to Achieve Eternal Bliss',502104,2.1515,5.2,'Hd3MVoqbvG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40230,_binary '\0','/kiVn09vghnscMWMqlX8uoQuXtMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4270516',6.7,18135,'en','Grandma','Self-described misanthrope Elle Reid has her protective bubble burst when her 18-year-old granddaughter, Sage, shows up needing help. The two of them go on a day-long journey that causes Elle to come to terms with her past and Sage to confront her future.','/4LW20TF4NfQgHj5rZs0d0cgxRjV.jpg','2015-06-04',78,'Released',NULL,'Grandma',309304,3.8764,6.4,'I0hJ7NHDglU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40231,_binary '\0','/xNYtAQvY7thNemdkqVbP2X3S16b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4271730',3.8,1994,'hi','अलोन','Conjoined at birth, Anjana and Sanjana were twin sisters who lived by one promise made to each other - \'We will always be together. We will never separate\'. Mysterious circumstances lead to the death of one while the other survived. Years later, the ghost of the dead comes back to haunt the surviving sister. Why was the promise broken?','/ftaw15yhtjPT9EBrXtqXpiyzXHM.jpg','2015-01-16',133,'Released','She was Never Alone.','Alone',318898,1.5493,4.867,'e0pdoezNhmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40232,_binary '\0','/uvzzMrSADS3FTBOt4xxfdyLXhXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4271820',7.4,8180,'ta','ஓ காதல் கண்மணி','Aadi and Tara fall in love but both hate the idea of marriage and plan to separate when their lives take them to different countries. However, as they grow closer, their emotions are not easily managed.','/dup1prHufHMpD3Z3MkCkbxCuFlI.jpg','2015-04-16',139,'Released','Plans open tomorrow.','O Kadhal Kanmani',329135,1.8954,7.028,'2mBG4vlhcCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40233,_binary '\0','/x7i70dfvEXuV6o7nN9J8P4KCM6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4271918',7.6,17863,'en','An Inspector Calls','Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.','/qZLDqf9poquJwY5uY6ZWK1yqsSb.jpg','2015-09-13',88,'Released',NULL,'An Inspector Calls',359305,2.5398,7.402,'bWvwdxJeYCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40234,_binary '\0','/5qNBH6tY6Jihzo9SqzvrJFHMPgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4272866',7.6,30365,'ja','バケモノの子','Kyuta, a boy living in Shibuya, and Kumatetsu, a lonesome beast from Jutengai, an imaginary world. One day, Kyuta forays into the imaginary world and, as he\'s looking for his way back, meets Kumatetsu who becomes his spirit guide. That encounter leads them to many adventures.','/kRofx67xkbnJ6pAVcHdeMyBm4OM.jpg','2015-07-11',119,'Released','In a world of beasts, he found a family.','The Boy and the Beast',315465,5.5348,7.91,'PkNtujKPZtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40235,_binary '\0','/keX3XBX34vUDDULvcohfzPXIU8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4273292',6.8,32952,'fa','زیر سایه','After Shideh\'s building is hit by a missile during the Iran-Iraq War, a superstitious neighbor suggests that the missile was cursed and might be carrying malevolent Middle-Eastern spirits. She becomes convinced a supernatural force within the building is attempting to possess her daughter Dorsa, and she has no choice but to confront these forces if she is to save her daughter and herself.','/bsHpzc7mVbJfZBaD0EISJkm3f3H.jpg','2016-09-30',84,'Released','Fear will find you.','Under the Shadow',375012,2.683,6.492,'G_ATX4C8Pmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40236,_binary '\0','/s9q3uNEjqHnLDgPX78Yfaoy8p1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4273562',6.8,4190,'ja','遊☆戯☆王 THE DARK SIDE OF DIMENSIONS','Having faced each other on countless occasions, Yugi and Kaiba again put their pride and experience to the test in a duel that transcends dimensions.','/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg','2016-04-23',130,'Released','Back to the stage of battle.','Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions',366170,6.0756,7.6,'JefCnvhwp0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40237,_binary '\0','/x2U0R60Z7hmJxZixzsGZfjFJbve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4273800',6.8,92337,'en','The Good Nurse','Suspicious that her colleague is responsible for a series of mysterious patient deaths, a nurse risks her own life to uncover the truth.','/rSq6cq0LCcbro10jbEaPTEb3WmW.jpg','2022-10-19',121,'Released','Based on the unthinkable true story.','The Good Nurse',541134,8.3885,6.874,'e0DQevX-GZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40238,_binary '\0','/qZlAyN4y6Tff6mtTD2y2or2EBon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4273886',7.3,9165,'ko','뷰티 인사이드','Woo-jin, a furniture designer who wakes up in a different body every day, falls for Yi-soo, a woman he meets through his work.','/z5gpjqQwo0h8rMvBLedRXfHHDKb.jpg','2015-08-20',127,'Released','Love has many faces.','The Beauty Inside',338729,3.4349,7.652,'zQvPJjDRMcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40239,_binary '\0','/4aayWDmt7fTohr6JvaE1fgB9PXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4276206',4.1,1468,'en','The Secrets of Emily Blair','Desperate to save his fiancée from a demon that has possessed her soul, a man turns to his longtime priest for help.','/89sJ2bR7q7W58vOwA5kU68rGrUT.jpg','2016-10-01',95,'Released',NULL,'The Secrets of Emily Blair',418930,2.1163,4.3,'oMAXLOXixVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40240,_binary '\0','/6ilMT6VCADu5F1Xr9LjiVxQSXPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4276752',5.9,4773,'zh','寻龙诀','Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.','/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg','2015-12-18',127,'Released',NULL,'Mojin: The Lost Legend',299824,2.9815,6.238,'ULv0MppLxYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40241,_binary '\0','/5WparwIlAtSZW0tcWbK2NHEZJC6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4276820',7.2,209127,'en','The Founder','The true story of how Ray Kroc, a salesman from Illinois, met Mac and Dick McDonald, who were running a burger operation in 1950s Southern California. Kroc was impressed by the brothers’ speedy system of making the food and saw franchise potential. He maneuvered himself into a position to be able to pull the company from the brothers and create a billion-dollar empire.','/8gLIksu5ggdfBL1UbeTeonHquxl.jpg','2016-11-24',115,'Released','He took someone else\'s idea and America ate it up.','The Founder',310307,15.4033,7.2,'oprJX5BomEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40242,_binary '\0','/bLaoov3N0ZtcaIuxbmNT3tjCi24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4276834',5.6,1366,'en','A Perfect Christmas List','As a last wish, a recently hospitalized grandmother, Evie, tasks her daughter and granddaughter, Sara, with a list of festive accomplishments to do together before Christmas, hoping that the adventure of the experience will repair their relationship. Along the way, Sara discovers an unlisted Christmas adventure of her own.','/aR6lVOHd5YRPRkxTPLpl4tquZmP.jpg','2014-12-14',86,'Released','She\'s making a list. and checking it twice...','A Perfect Christmas List',314283,1.7139,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40243,_binary '\0','/eG5ybEjFQDlLIZUsSvMvH7LTbZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4278962',4.4,2688,'en','All Through the House','A deranged masked Santa-Slayer comes to town for some yuletide-terror. He leaves behind a bloody trail of mutilated bodies as he hunts his way to the front steps of the town\'s most feared and notorious home.','/f6SDQW6fH5jojqXkN3fQwPgUWNJ.jpg','2015-10-31',80,'Released','There is a CREATURE stirring...','All Through the House',373048,0.9758,4.5,'NW3UiE70CCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40244,_binary '\0','/x9bnxn4vEPzEdNca79wcZFKuxeg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4279116',4.3,1881,'en','Alien Invasion: S.U.M.1','An aggressive race of aliens took over Planet Earth and humanity\'s at its end, living in giant bunkers below ground. Young Military rookie S.U.M.1 (Iwan Rheon) is sent to the surface to save a group of unprotected survivors.','/RSEWZD65hUkfl4vwx75DYiVcet.jpg','2017-03-11',95,'Released','Control your fear','Alien Invasion: S.U.M.1',457665,2.6608,4.7,'fteYxvnznaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40245,_binary '\0','/vmv1YheiolLyiEeBGcGsBRAt0QR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4280430',5.9,2352,'en','A Christmas Kiss II','At a Christmastime event, Jenna shares an impromptu, unforgettable kiss with the dashing billionaire, Cooper Montgomery. Unaware of his intentions and fearful of getting hurt in another relationship, Jenna vows to resist his charms, but begins to realize his affection is real as the two spend more time together.','/dUhwBavwK7h1dfXJi470Iya5ofK.jpg','2014-12-13',90,'Released','This Christmas, expect the unexpected.','A Christmas Kiss II',311093,2.2927,5.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40246,_binary '\0','/naNXYdBzTEb1KwOdi1RbBkM9Zv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4281724',5.5,98102,'en','Terrifier','A maniacal clown named Art terrorizes three young women on Halloween night and everyone else who stands in his way.','/fjXqhGmaeQpB73WerhrYU6HlyV5.jpg','2018-01-25',84,'Released','You never forget your first kill.','Terrifier',420634,11.9482,6.3,'1EyzlnWsZCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40247,_binary '\0','/x7HsQ8z8dWFOOsVoDbpBXwKgPYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4282872',3.1,1715,'en','Dead Story','When a young couple – Anne and Harold – moves into a new home without knowing it was a site of horrific murders, Anne\'s loneliness and strange behavior makes their relationship complicated, especially after Anne meets \'Mary\', a dark presence from which she can\'t escape.','/y6hdIzJLrxoozzgsOIvOBoXnHjl.jpg','2017-01-20',81,'Released','At the site of horrific murders, a dark presence has been awakened, driving a young bride to commit the unthinkable.','Dead Story',340185,0.9822,3.8,'QiLTOHNJrLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40248,_binary '\0','/rNQidfAhK1AtuYJ2NFw1kE24aRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4283358',7.2,1859,'fr','Les Saisons','Jacques Perrin and Jacques Cluzaud travel throughout Europe to film brown bears, wild horses, wolves and other animals in their natural habitat.','/r4qXN4TSGsKjJDCU0hvgEfufVFK.jpg','2016-01-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Seasons',352342,1.2094,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40249,_binary '\0','/kgUgjHh4LZaICxc8cwfEBSBcheA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4283892',7.3,2658,'en','Chasing Trane','An account of the life of the brilliant jazz musician John Coltrane (1926-67), a gifted saxophonist, an extraordinarily talented thinker whose original, avant-garde work has impacted and influenced people all over the world. A story about music\'s ability to entertain, inspire and transform.','/pb09v5koCU7GrxCJNfRnliPRIKD.jpg','2017-04-14',99,'Released','The John Coltrane documentary','Chasing Trane',411012,2.0653,7.3,'xApMCjrc-VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40250,_binary '\0','/xfMbreyyytL6vo0qsjIhUwEcMAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4284010',7.6,15499,'en','What Happened, Miss Simone?','The film chronicles Nina Simone\'s journey from child piano prodigy to iconic musician and passionate activist, told in her own words.','/8XpM91NVq6IyCnDkiWf4xjHpewK.jpg','2015-01-22',101,'Released','Her story. Her voice.','What Happened, Miss Simone?',318044,2.2293,7.397,'MtnmncV74uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40251,_binary '\0','/zhXmJnPIoncBQ2TY8IEWc4s9vbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4285496',7.8,26098,'es','El abrazo de la serpiente','The epic story of the first contact, encounter, approach, betrayal and, eventually, life-transcending friendship, between Karamakate, an Amazonian shaman, last survivor of his people, and two scientists that, over the course of 40 years, travel through the Amazon in search of a sacred plant that can heal them. Inspired by the journals of the first explorers of the Colombian Amazon, Theodor Koch-Grunberg and Richard Evans Schultes.','/t3Lmw8jvm7tpik0lSkub8hU4oRW.jpg','2015-05-25',125,'Released','A poetic and haunting journey into a lost world.','Embrace of the Serpent',336808,2.9921,7.7,'4ff7TcnqHUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40252,_binary '\0','/6tCQeVgL3m3ibw6PrqZV21L8f1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4285960',4.8,1335,'en','The Sublet','The Sublet is a suspense driven psychological thriller about Joanna, a new mom coping with her baby alone in an odd sublet apartment. As her husband neglects her to focus on his career, Joanna questions her sanity as she discovers a violent past to the apartment and suspects that the building may be haunted.','/afOTBFYb2ou293LcdXcxuDmN749.jpg','2015-11-07',82,'Released',NULL,'The Sublet',365432,1.3889,4.7,'oM8OPxZVkSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40253,_binary '\0','/oGD1dZvojZssnd9Ua6RUalEEHQu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt42863533',7.2,12664,'en','Maternal Instinct','Police pull over a woman who claims she just gave birth. But the baby — and the blood — aren\'t hers. Twisted lies unravel in this true-crime documentary.','/dOWWCLSwXS1MBtGEFeItbloiUEN.jpg','2026-06-11',97,'Released',NULL,'Maternal Instinct',1699155,5.1975,7.118,'fzW61JgRbNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40254,_binary '\0','/lUtEGL2EfRcxwre0wmKY7H7XfOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4286666',6.1,2291,'en','In-Lawfully Yours','Following both the death of her father-in-law and a divorce, Jesse, a New Yorker, returns to a small town to live with her now widowed mother-in-law. Jesse struggles to fit in with the local townsfolk who don’t welcome her with open arms to say the least. Jesse becomes acquainted with the local pastor, her widowed brother-in-law, falling in love with him, much to the dismay of the community. Things get even more complicated when her ex-husband comes calling, suspiciously trying to win her back. Between her love life and entangled in-laws, Jesse is tested as she seeks the answer to where she truly belongs.','/lPw7jUWNHsvunlVlEAStHnfdGZg.jpg','2016-09-06',85,'Released','Sometimes a second chance comes when you least expect it!','In-Lawfully Yours',412518,1.8888,6.2,'I_GV4DrCG_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40255,_binary '\0','/2NGBchckkORvJ94ojJWQDqgVvEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4287320',5.4,106065,'en','The Circle','A young tech worker takes a job at a powerful Internet corporation, quickly rises up the company\'s ranks, and soon finds herself in a perilous situation concerning privacy, surveillance and freedom. She comes to learn that her decisions and actions will determine the future of humanity.','/bQVqd5rWrx5GbXhJNuvKy4Viz6j.jpg','2017-04-27',110,'Released','Knowing is good. Knowing everything is better.','The Circle',339988,10.218,5.524,'QUlr8Am4zQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40256,_binary '\0','/GJEsypKc4bZZiyIyW1c9lcKzoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4287348',4.6,1358,'en','Isolation','Inspired by the true events of a couple vacationing on a remote island in the Bahamas who are hunted by a group of modern-day pirates, after their identities and their lives.','/2yTUJ2rKlcRaWAlATHU4fclL9YB.jpg','2016-05-11',86,'Released','Trust no one.','Isolation',380754,1.949,5.3,'CXiZugofjCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40257,_binary '\0','/2tN4Ugw62TzYDrqAWVA78ImA4Vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4287470',3.6,1260,'en','West of Hell','A gunslinger, a vengeful ex-slave, and a runaway board a midnight train to Atlanta. They discover that the train is haunted by a sinister force, and must fight to survive the night.','/oJcuslAltQP7bxAI4J7Jk7dxvbx.jpg','2018-06-12',80,'Released','This is the last stop','West of Hell',533938,1.8597,4.8,'zUpy7cB5sZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40258,_binary '\0','/d3oE6qW5nuRu3rcwccMr5n2fFMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4288636',7.1,7576,'en','James White','James White is a troubled twentysomething trying to stay afloat in a frenzied New York City. As he retreats further into a hedonistic lifestyle, his mother\'s battle with a serious illness faces a series of setbacks that force him to assume more responsibility. With the pressure on him mounting, James must find new reserves of strength or risk imploding completely.','/a7LzEt0y7CS9q5DGdUcIQ3JuBE5.jpg','2015-11-13',87,'Released','Sometimes we choose our path. Sometimes our path chooses us.','James White',312804,3.0281,6.606,'-z9sVBlz5K4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40259,_binary '\0','/8x70iUDCfdJ0tdJZlPhxiAv0FSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4288674',4.3,2082,'en','It Came from the Desert','New Mexico, present day. Brian and Lukas are off to the desert to join a kegger party and to celebrate Lukas’ victory in a motocross competition. His winning prize includes meeting The Deathinator, the biggest action star in the world. The party gets started under the hot desert sun, but Brian isn’t in the mood, so he wanders off and is soon joined by his friend, Lukas. They discover something strange in the desert which leads them into a secret military laboratory, where they discover the disturbing truth of what the government has been doing. Secret experiments on ants and spiders using DNA found in a meteorite which fell to Earth in 1951 has given birth to mutated giant ants which have overrun the facility. Now, it\'s up to Brian and Lukas to save the world from a giant ant invasion!','/mZsLtCJW1eJabOxlZrZfaalGIki.jpg','2018-09-07',90,'Released','Get ready to scream','It Came from the Desert',408490,2.206,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40260,_binary '\0','/bSGC22YaTcpntHRKZolgL3mS1YT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4289062',4.5,2298,'en','Bloodrunners','By 1933, Prohibition has proven a booming enterprise, where average citizens break the law, hide in the shadows and operate at night. The new world order has even lined the pockets of corrupt cops like Jack Malone. He collects a \'luxury tax\' from every bootlegger and scofflaw in the small town he has sworn to protect. While shaking down the newest speakeasy in the local underground, Jack and his men uncover a clan of vampires hell bent on taking over the town. Now Chesterfield, an ancient vampire, and his horde must hide their secret at any cost. The bloody result leaves several bodies and innocent townsfolk taken as lambs to await the slaughter. With nowhere else to turn, Jack joins forces with a busboy and a crazy preacher to save the town and make a final stand against Chesterfield and his vampires.','/proMObvstiaMhhiRGuzzi762ORg.jpg','2017-03-03',100,'Released','In a time of corruption, evil hides in plain sight.','Bloodrunners',327315,1.4016,4.8,'JoChqwSLcmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40261,_binary '\0','/s0q8WmfUi2FJmBZzHLjSH3ES7QQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4290746',7.5,2705,'ta','பிசாசு','A violinist experiences paranormal experience in his flat after a death of a girl who he tries to save due to accident. Later he realises that actually the spirit is helping him and he tries to find out who killed the girl by accident.','/u3dLe7SJa7FQeM5LICtkiw6LUA7.jpg','2014-12-19',114,'Released',NULL,'Pisaasu',311155,1.2492,6.73,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40262,_binary '\0','/f32kdqyJJZeAQBzGa7EPB6ZwMJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4290974',2.7,1341,'en','Taking Earth','The human race is thrown into chaos as an alien invasion takes control of the planet in an effort to find one boy out of 7 billion people who holds the power to destroy them.','/39z9HzGt72qG5wV8jXeCS8oL2tk.jpg','2017-05-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Taking Earth',447352,1.3495,3.9,'yevmeOCaErc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40263,_binary '\0','/3kkMrqMtHXvzGIhvT5woVPJSQWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4291066',7.8,2383,'en','B-Movie: Lust & Sound in West-Berlin 1979-1989','The wild West Berlin of the 1980s became the creative melting pot of pop subcultures: music, art and chaos. Before the Iron Curtain fell, anything and everything seemed possible.','/44BiWEueOk4XKDqt2SYDSc8tNDl.jpg','2015-02-05',94,'Released','If you can remember the 80\'s, you weren\'t there!','B-Movie: Lust & Sound in West-Berlin 1979-1989',318042,1.7646,7.7,'LWNjX2d8wIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40264,_binary '\0','/qnqXk1yjSxamhBel8tOgynMbnkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4291590',5.9,8103,'fr','Évolution','11-year-old Nicolas lives with his mother in a seaside housing estate. The only place that ever sees any activity is the hospital. It is there that all the boys from the village are forced to undergo strange medical trials that attempt to disrupt the phases of evolution.','/sLluKqBaGl0NLOFTtoXLXN9u9G6.jpg','2016-03-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Evolution',330770,1.8576,5.872,'QXf8VS6iK_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40265,_binary '\0','/wztoDoglCOuiEfzl1FS6mglBioF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4291600',6.8,30308,'en','Lady Macbeth','Rural England, 1865. Katherine, suffocated by her loveless marriage to a bitter man and restrained by his father\'s tyranny, unleashes an irresistible force within her, so powerful that she will stop at nothing to get what she wants.','/xWTJbhTwSTJmhLlX5xAOxPhdnXc.jpg','2016-12-12',86,'Released',NULL,'Lady Macbeth',410117,4.4518,6.565,'TubDRQQA3-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40266,_binary '\0','/jfh3OjNeBGbnJPzIdsgqRTsSKk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4291700',5.3,3150,'nl','Prooi','A zoo veterinarian gets caught up in a grisly adventure as she finds herself leading the city-wide hunt for a monstrous lion terrorizing the Dutch capital of Amsterdam.','/qhbzTFvj4sXGLXspHxpWrYCzReL.jpg','2016-10-13',110,'Released','On the loose... and he\'s hungry.','Prey',400610,2.0456,5.6,'2UpOuanIK_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40267,_binary '\0','/6PB6Ah7QG4MJwnCcfm8GKvrPRIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4293752',7,3145,'en','Gascoigne','A feature length, theatrical documentary on the life of Paul Gascoigne, one of the greatest footballers that ever lived: delving deep into his psyche, vulnerabilities, fears and triumphs.','/nnac1OwNpcdtQzHs7nhk5AtiJfC.jpg','2015-06-08',90,'Released','The man. The legend. His story. His words.','Gascoigne',343981,2.1963,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40268,_binary '\0','/s2ymiH8yTigrWZjoWvLOtZ9npB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4294052',4.7,6612,'ja','進撃の巨人 ATTACK ON TITAN エンド オブ ザ ワールド','Eren Yeager leaves to restore a break in the wall destroyed by a Titan. He comes under attack by the Titans and is cornered. Shikishima comes to his aid. The titans never stops attacking. Eren is now injured and tries to protect Armin, but is swallowed by a titan. A Titan with black hair appears and begins to expel the other titans.','/l9cJ5PKEkVJb6YUCiURtcMbTQ5D.jpg','2015-09-01',87,'Released','The world is merciless.','Attack on Titan II: End of the World',340382,5.8048,6.3,'Ux4sQG1Lvco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40269,_binary '\0','/9vGLk6bIhfeMBs7lFgTro5hrQVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4295126',6.3,1750,'es','Maikol Yordan de Viaje Perdido','Maikol Yordan (Mario Chacón) realizes his family farm is about to be sold by the bank to the evil G.F. Malavassi (Adal Ramones). So, in order to raise money to pay the debt, Maikol Yordan takes part in contests and promotions, and wins a travel to Europe, where his big adventure begins','/7cNCBmIkYfJ5pLqkxsFqlzndbMq.jpg','2014-12-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Maikol Yordan de Viaje Perdido',364868,1.1453,8.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40270,_binary '\0','/jeQluYHCVymJT9UmWRHXvnct7cS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4297380',4.1,1318,'en','Theresa & Allison','After a one night stand turns disastrous, Theresa finds herself drawn into a world of inhuman savagery, all the while tempted by the beautiful and immortal Allison.','/gL0LLTgs7fO5xhCTTawOrAQ08qP.jpg','2019-01-26',120,'Released',NULL,'Theresa & Allison',640209,0.9451,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40271,_binary '\0','/m2YuVWnbZH1pkxbBhNx4BR5F99n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4298958',7.4,14430,'ja','あん','The master of a dorayaki pastry store hires a 76-year-old woman whose talents attract customers from all over. But she\'s hiding a troubling secret. Life\'s joys are found in the little details, and no matter what may be weighing you down, everyone loves a good pastry.','/5YV0eoUBFQ4vKaN71SPtUte2YcD.jpg','2015-05-30',113,'Released','A small little Dorayaki shop on the outskirts of Tokyo.'