en with homicidal tendencies must hunt down and destroy a supernatural killer while keeping his own inner demons at bay.','/KXLopjRCCGRaKPMUndVoT9zKsl.jpg','2016-08-26',104,'Released','Every town has its monsters.','I Am Not a Serial Killer',381034,3.4318,6.298,'WQBnWWWU-gU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40280,_binary '\0','/suuzazQSFQCBlat4NUPC4461ILO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4305148',6.3,5670,'en','Lovesong','Neglected by her husband, Sarah embarks on an impromptu road trip with her young daughter and her best friend, Mindy. Along the way, the dynamic between the two friends intensifies before circumstances force them apart. Years later, Sarah attempts to rebuild their intimate connection in the days before Mindy’s wedding.','/43yEeZbFeFOah9mZWIIJe57STKS.jpg','2017-02-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Lovesong',371447,2.8112,5.7,'7xbr-l-m-Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40281,_binary '\0','/pZWvngm47TEmrnV6xDAoiIc16gP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43056433',9,2000,'te','Karmakhya','A mysterious visit to a grieving family pulls a young woman into a terrifying world of secrets, black magic, and haunting illusions. As disturbing events begin to blur the line between reality and nightmare, Kaamakhya finds herself trapped in a chilling chain of events rooted in a dark past that refuses to stay buried.','/sGVN0bh4xQtJIHiXFy2JyWVOiMd.jpg','2026-07-31',126,'Released',NULL,'Karmakhya',1741770,4.6699,0,'800-mrhBRyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40282,_binary '\0','/tsHgsMBIWn30nKu1DV47f7TMuMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4306300',7.3,2993,'kn','Mr & Mrs ರಾಮಾಚಾರಿ','Lovers Ramachari and Divya part ways when Divya begins to question Ramachari\'s love, trust and way of life. Will they reconcile?','/vYOzu404UMKcEp21ch3UBRfT2W.jpg','2014-12-25',157,'Released',NULL,'Mr & Mrs Ramachari',322173,0.9097,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40283,_binary '\0','/8vNnudew4feJmErSO1gew2nOC2n.j