 has escaped with his daughter.','/hfmtLWlLRJGMYZo1W0wBlDPJvzC.jpg','2015-02-19',110,'Released',NULL,'From Vegas to Macau II',329984,2.4549,5,'nuILtnvYEOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40291,_binary '\0','/ryfdvhVSL5WR6pUwQWgt1snHmj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4312676',4.9,1575,'ta','ஆம்பள','Three brothers return to their native village to mend the relationship between their estranged father and his sisters. However, to unite the family, the brothers are told to marry their cousins.','/jqGe0XmVkLIjRALf3WdDiHEms6r.jpg','2015-01-15',147,'Released',NULL,'Aambala',318572,1.5382,5.327,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40292,_binary '\0','/ch4z1lSj2kJSnlzJTe5JHBQh5Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4314716',3.3,1582,'en','Darkness Rising','Nearly murdered as a child by her mother, a woman (Katrina Law) returns to the house where her mom went mad.','/jPUJ0kRIVDiY9E10r9AEcqKtqmC.jpg','2017-06-30',81,'Released','Five must die','Darkness Rising',459068,1.6427,3.7,'0pyfKOyTMVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40293,_binary '\0','/fYo561rrxyv60CeuJUZoDTfIhp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4315956',6.2,1665,'ko','오늘의 연애','Whenever elementary school teacher Kang Joon-soo falls in love, he always gives too much of himself to the relationship. Yet despite that, he ends up being the one getting dumped by his girlfriends. Joon-soo has been friends for 18 years with Kim Hyun-woo, a weather forecaster whose beauty belies her witty tongue and aggressive manner.','/lQzEbsiV7kxYRiQv3YHk53U0cLW.jpg','2015-01-14',118,'Released','Friend zoned for 18 years. Can\'t we just start dating?','Love Forecast',313628,2.3785,6.7,'NA33xr7YgQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40294,_binary '\0','/jeA9eQ5QnP9ZNbXRztxXnYOn7o2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4316236',7.4,2237,'en','The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution','The story of the Black Panthers is often told in a scatter of repackaged parts, often depicting tragic, mythic accounts of violence and criminal activity; but this is an essential story, vibrant, human; a living and breathing chronicle of a pivotal movement that birthed a new revolutionary culture in America.','/uw0zW1jlC9Yf3rK0KFkKx9iEFYm.jpg','2015-03-08',113,'Released','ALL POWER TO THE PEOPLE.','The Black Panthers: Vanguard of the Revolution',319089,1.5683,7,'XUv-4Fzji0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40295,_binary '\0','/ryW0TzubzBC29U60MpyHJrLT56l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4319112',6.5,1908,'ko','기술자들','A wily safecracker is forced to help a mob boss pull off a $150 million heist, but smells a double-cross in the works.','/hTDccB9vKQLhep3vKGeg0opewS6.jpg','2014-12-24',116,'Released','Let\'s get down to business!','The Con Artists',300433,2.2949,6.871,'I3y1EnKMp6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40296,_binary '\0','/9mmubFO5AmcCcuQ6cFbBRwtwUv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43215564',8.1,12665,'hi','Uttar Da Puttar','Vastu, destiny and daily life, where unexpected events challenge beliefs about luck, direction and the power to shape your own future.','/gRx4Bc6GTwi8L3vq29bnciEuRgL.jpg','2026-07-24',103,'Released',NULL,'Uttar Da Puttar',1713420,1.2036,0,'9EISxkYkLEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40297,_binary '\0','/74vF474FSOLtecWak7SjA1CAmNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4323370',7.1,1260,'en','Survivor\'s Guide to Prison','Today, you\'re more likely to go to prison in the United States than anywhere else in the world. So in the unfortunate case it should happen to you - this is the Survivors Guide to Prison.','/bEWKMO2hDh6mEm4dV5e8Q97Ecxt.jpg','2018-02-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Survivor\'s Guide to Prison',461234,2.4199,6.4,'KfUh5wstN04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40298,_binary '\0','/o64X4AABYRSq6OtK1D233VwzstB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4323504',5.7,3848,'hi','Jazbaa','After her daughter is kidnapped, a lawyer is forced to defend a criminal in exchange for her daughter\'s freedom.','/lasy6dL6VgII8EJzvCxNhNsneuS.jpg','2015-10-09',119,'Released',NULL,'Jazbaa',360826,1.488,6.757,'nx7z1enCLWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40299,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4323536',7,1435,'en','The Emperor\'s New Clothes','An uproarious critique of the world financial crisis. Building on actor, comedian, and provocateur Russell Brand’s emergence as an activist following his 2014 book Revolution, where he railed against “corporate tyranny, ecological irresponsibility, and economic inequality\".','/blFBI5vZGxfqxd8zNuIAQNvUrFN.jpg','2015-04-24',107,'Released','The truth is, we\'ve been sold a lie.','The Emperor\'s New Clothes',333346,1.4435,6.4,'U4Geq8dM13k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40300,_binary '\0','/wFSXN4CaDfmUURbEbghhK6m7WPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4323594',7.3,10588,'es','Ya no estoy aquí','In Monterrey, Mexico, a young street gang spends their days dancing to slowed-down cumbia and attending parties. After a mix-up with a local cartel, their leader is forced to migrate to the U.S. but quickly longs to return home.','/AtfK71xkVaaHTZwU5mgfDgBqg9Y.jpg','2019-10-21',112,'Released',NULL,'I\'m No Longer Here',582927,2.1923,7.858,'ieeZ0mviFKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40301,_binary '\0','/in2Dg0WKaiLvBPjJZFVSxdnY8t4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4324242',5.3,2147,'tr','Çarşı Pazar','Kahraman is a naive and right-minded guy. In a lovely Anatolian town, he earns a living as an attendant in a Turkish bath inherited from his great grandfathers. One day, a wealthy constructor named Tuncay wants to demolish the bath and the marketplace it is located in, and build a mall in their place. Barber Cemil, Kahraman\'s enemy, convinces the craftsmen in the marketplace and collaborates with Tuncay to start the demolishment immediately. Kahraman does not want the marketplace he was born into to be demolished and he does not believe in the empty promises of Tuncay.','/g07VHnvcUUnPE4T4lvZS5NHemKo.jpg','2015-02-26',97,'Released',NULL,'Souk Bazaar',327301,2.0153,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40302,_binary '\0','/m0P79BEviRPHqINdpOKWug0faAh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4325400',7.3,1794,'en','APEX: The Story of the Hypercar','Rocket science meets the auto industry as \"APEX\" follows a thread that starts in the design studios and R&D labs where these \"fighter jets of the street\" are created, and leads to a perilous racetrack in Germany where drivers can reach new heights of speed and performance -- if they dare. Equal parts human drama and speed, \"APEX\" follows Swedish entrepreneur Christian von Koenigsegg, a lifelong sports car enthusiast on a personal quest to build a \"mega\" car whose golden ratio defies all expectations for a hypercar\'s velocity and power, while competing against the biggest names in motorsports for space on the world stage. With insights from top engineers and designers, \"APEX\" pulls back the curtain on the top-secret development facilities at Porsche, Ferrari, McLaren and Pagani, where awe-inspiring hypercars are imagined and built, and puts you inches from the action, as top drivers shake down the latest hypercars, flat-out on some of the world\'s greatest racetracks.','/8Z7ApLvY7uS6cNI6aPQaYS8hrbF.jpg','2016-03-29',85,'Released',NULL,'APEX: The Story of the Hypercar',389292,1.7916,6.541,'DMHLNcwysd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40303,_binary '\0','/yG8iQi4gX0tjUBAvMNsliES3Czy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4326444',7.1,35667,'es','Julieta','The film spans 30 years in Julieta’s life from a nostalgic 1985 where everything seems hopeful, to 2015 where her life appears to be beyond repair and she is on the verge of madness.','/z4aErD1RQQ3alpu3PoUu408HEVc.jpg','2016-04-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Julieta',332872,3.4718,7,'yoi4dbpqZmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40304,_binary '\0','/fuH0hf6S3U8OKjl1qa9JtkEaqLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4327510',6.7,1770,'en','Retake','A lonely, middle-aged man hires a male prostitute to recreate a road trip from his past.','/rU1lbdT61NbpGgFnyHdLprlII6o.jpg','2016-06-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Retake',399636,1.8267,6,'BQ-5T2wPCsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40305,_binary '\0','/krWx9CsOfW6nvsb1o1O3ThDYP1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4327752',5.6,3676,'en','Lady Bloodfight','Jane is a beautiful but troubled American girl backpacking through Japan, when her raw street fighting skills draw the attention of Oshima, Japanese karate champion, who recruits and trains her to fight in the vicious, all-female, underground martial arts tournament known as \"The Kumite\". After months of rigorous preparation, Jane is ready to face off against the deadliest female fighters in the world, including Ling, the Chinese apprentice of Oshima\'s nemesis. But other nefarious forces lie in the shadows, and Jane and Ling will have to unite on a journey that will take them from the gritty underworld of Hong Kong to the glitz of Macao, before deciding who really is the best female fighter on the planet.','/hDZzETrYegrB6pYpHKKzdwux6Km.jpg','2016-11-11',102,'Released','Fight for your life','Lady Bloodfight',289269,3.0017,6.55,'-t367_VUzoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40306,_binary '\0','/7Q5VGlmZeAcwphGVZNYw2MKPRxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4328094',4.1,5920,'en','Impossible Monsters','A psychology professor begins a case study with three subjects who are suffering from sleep paralysis. As the study goes on, what is real and what is dream become mingled with violent consequences.','/uIZd6zrWAYSeRhfUgbjgE5shdl2.jpg','2019-03-09',84,'Released','Everyone has nightmares. Most survive.','Impossible Monsters',598058,1.3351,3.9,'krKOhF8y83U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40307,_binary '\0','/bwpO9haOakRJ6pCEc0TxT7uEb2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4328642',5.2,1777,'en','Stalked by My Neighbor','A girl and her mother escape to suburban safety after a home invasion scares them out of the city, but they\'re soon menaced by a sinister figure.','/dU0c3qVTYKXcBPP2fIffdEPrThQ.jpg','2015-03-21',88,'Released','How well do you really know your neighbors?','Stalked by My Neighbor',333620,2.1154,5.7,'_zn3_QHzdI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40308,_binary '\0','/wsSKvROWvShhAGONDV7g9I9SlX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4328756',7.2,1762,'bn','Ebar Shabor','Kolkata police detective Shabor Dasgupta sets out to solve the murder case of Mitali Ghosh, a woman with a messy past. Her ex-husband Mithu Mitra, ex-boyfriend Pantu and friend Samiran are the prime suspects and so is her cousin Joyeeta. His investigation reveals a complex web of relationships gone sour that gives almost everyone a good motive.','/zdcVIudf64Ws2EQzwaS18HMjxmz.jpg','2015-01-02',126,'Released','the hunt is on...','Ebar Shabor',339745,1.3878,7.333,'Blcuyju71w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40309,_binary '\0','/6kDSk9rv4csmLTBtNJdmhnZ6cnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4328798',5.9,5625,'ta','மாஸ் என்கிற மாசிலாமணி','A conman gains the power to see and communicate with ghosts and decides to use it to make money. His happy-go-lucky lifestyle goes for a toss when a ghost who is his look-alike approaches him with an offer.','/qXJTn2ZMhrbs4TawcZfoI2Ifwws.jpg','2015-05-29',151,'Released',NULL,'Massu Engira Maasilamani',329134,1.5411,5.021,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40310,_binary '\0','/32YAjhXdFYVB4EQTdpFLPwhcm0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4328934',7.4,1992,'ta','தரமணி','An orthodox youngster and a free-spirited lady fall in love, only to understand that they are different in all aspects of life. How do they realise their complex requirements and mistakes?','/gJiEpvu32Tou3iLGZ8jVUMWuchk.jpg','2017-08-11',150,'Released',NULL,'Taramani',280167,1.0403,6.694,'hwXQrbI9vTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40311,_binary '\0','/o44QmvrLoBhCjrr8KUgFTZNlGvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4329098',5.1,1272,'en','Sugar Daddies','When a girl with a promising future finds herself in financial straits, she makes an agreement with an older man and struggles to keep it secret.','/WlLTpdyUgv22oHkB3AvWPDN0Zv.jpg','2014-12-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Sugar Daddies',318553,1.7032,4.6,'fGgibi5fnTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40312,_binary '\0','/vwwjjJqmle15BnkGqAvwDnkphA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4329242',5.9,2524,'en','Love Jacked','Maya, a headstrong 28-year-old with artistic ambitions – a strong contrast to what her father Ed wants: a dutiful daughter to run the family store. Ed is shocked when Maya takes her assertions of independence a step further and decides to travel to Africa for inspiration and returns with a fiancé who is not quite what he seems.','/quGrtVer6MPfAY6gEDm0JA1ugZ5.jpg','2018-12-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Love Jacked',537406,1.7727,6.1,'XeaZKWh1Rx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40313,_binary '\0','/6JA8xCgTTdxoj3jvHHC67lNvmxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4329800',6.9,1240,'pl','Carte Blanche','The true story of a high-school history teacher who decides to hide a progressive sight loss from everyone surrounding him - his colleagues, pupils, even the ones who really care about him, because of the fear of losing his job and trying to save his dignity. Due to a genetic disorder, Kacper is faced with a very real possibility of permanent blindness. Initially heartbroken, he attempts to hide his health problems from his bosses driven by his desire to keep his job and to help his students with the final exams. The only person who knows about Kacper\'s problem is his best friend Wiktor. Meanwhile, Kacper enters a relationship with his colleague Ewa, and tries to help a rebel student Klara, who hides a secret of her own.','/60bMfyMlBo0RAxANl0T9PdVJBtK.jpg','2015-01-23',106,'Released',NULL,'Carte Blanche',342765,1.9869,6.851,'oGcTuIeN9Nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40314,_binary '\0','/fBHfuMIp43iKo2mH1AbenNS9jIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4329806',3.4,1310,'en','Don\'t Sleep','After moving into a cottage together, two young lovers confront horrors of a forgotten childhood.','/jP0fjDDZaYGpuwD9as6tNn0ePPz.jpg','2017-09-29',101,'Released','Some dreams should never be remembered','Don\'t Sleep',467405,2.1781,5.4,'7oR04_eN5Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40315,_binary '\0','/AvcHGF89Zob4Ep2ZobJnBkheT2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4329810',7.3,5677,'en','QT8: The First Eight','A detailed account of the life and artistic career of legendary filmmaker Quentin Tarantino, from his early days as a video club manager to the scandalous fall in disgrace of producer Harvey Weinstein. A story about how to shoot eight great movies and become an icon of modern pop culture.','/rGPwMYUeygsUAmo0NS8IPlhQEfH.jpg','2019-10-21',103,'Released','There will always be blood, brilliance and controversy.','QT8: The First Eight',631143,5.3535,7.2,'3HysKzsSy1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40316,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4330758',7.9,34976,'en','Black Hawk Down','The story behind the infamous downing of an American Black Hawk helicopter by Somali gunmen.','/ecwQPm0IbcO4lT8r53nRhXsdXF8.jpg','1997-12-01',57,'Released',NULL,'Black Hawk Down',1387650,1.6444,7.444,'z9PPVWHjSBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40317,_binary '\0','/tbPB4LU2Xp4hSFl1yiYiu2Kpcfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4331970',7.2,7934,'fr','Quand on a 17 ans','Damien lives with his mother Marianne, a doctor, while his father, a pilot, is on a tour of duty abroad with the French military. At school, Damien is bullied by Thomas, who lives in the farming community up in the mountains. The boys find themselves living together when Marianne invites Thomas to come and stay with them while his mother is ill in hospital. Damien must learn to live with the boy who terrorized him.','/hC5cEEXTFg0pYvuqAfckP8EWR6G.jpg','2016-02-27',116,'Released','Adolescence is the only time when you learn something at all','Being 17',377154,2.6096,6.8,'kK14hdH1_o8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40318,_binary '\0','/7B2PrhvPnqraLjRKCGP11QLYTVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4332114',4.7,4934,'hi','Dolly Ki Doli','Dolly, an attractive woman, fakes marriages and runs away stealing all the precious belongings of the groom and his family. Dolly\'s modus operandi is to get her fake brother to identify prospective grooms &amp; then entice these men to fall in love with her. Attracted by her charms, these prospective grooms are ready to do anything for dolly including going against their parents\' wishes to marry her.','/8xn2K7FAa8JI8sXITW5M92b6u1Y.jpg','2015-01-23',98,'Released',NULL,'Dolly Ki Doli',320024,1.4121,5.2,'uzdu62XspwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40319,_binary '\0','/6y4748yU4dnrI7jF2loGscmiVXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4332232',6.5,116722,'en','Fractured','Driving cross-country, Ray and his wife and daughter stop at a highway rest area where his daughter falls and breaks her arm. After a frantic rush to the hospital and a clash with the check-in nurse, Ray is finally able to get her to a doctor. While the wife and daughter go downstairs for an MRI, Ray, exhausted, passes out in a chair in the lobby. Upon waking up, they have no record or knowledge of Ray\'s family ever being checked in.','/paZNRffT3kUckuRFKbeDBuX1YcZ.jpg','2019-09-22',99,'Released','Finding his family means facing the truth.','Fractured',568091,7.4835,6.766,'sCimThZW-Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40320,_binary '\0','/tX8j7o57l7usueur5iHdBHYBW9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4333674',7,7320,'hi','Hunterrr','An ordinary bachelor pursues girls like a hunter, but not with the intention of settling down in life.','/2NEEd6vpnLjPP2LaiT4WDcMvxZ9.jpg','2015-03-20',141,'Released',NULL,'Hunterrr',325892,1.4879,6.064,'ytDp30vuiCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40321,_binary '\0','/aQ06MnEDLh9X3ZOtY21UD2XB197.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4334266',5.2,38240,'en','The Bad Batch','After being exiled to a fenced-off wasteland, Arlen is kidnapped by a group of cannibals and goes on a journey to reunite a missing girl with her father.','/7o14VaMphEIzPwzeW6FP3A6zb4W.jpg','2017-06-23',119,'Released','Don’t play with your food.','The Bad Batch',316154,6.4987,5.253,'1NrjKgwqNOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40322,_binary '\0','/xMeeV9MqyH0vXhcTd3MYbVZQabA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4334482',7.2,2201,'es','Viva','When his estranged father returns, a hairdresser is forced to quit performing at the local drag club.','/a3PCUWfSEh8Oz1Ld2onU3d0yvcg.jpg','2015-11-08',100,'Released','Find your voice','Viva',359108,1.5812,7.3,'S097UTL057I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40323,_binary '\0','/IlQM0HLOwQPynbb32RWZDzHLdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4334636',7.4,1261,'en','Eddie: Strongman','Truck mechanic, husband and father of two, Eddie Hall wants to be the World\'s Strongest Man. This feature documentary vividly illustrates the sacrifices that this extremely driven man must make to chase his dream. He will stop at nothing. He trains, eats, sleeps and breathes strongman, competing all over the world and breaking records. He faces not only gargantuan competitors, but his own inner demons as he strives to leave behind the scars of his teenage years. This film gets under the skin of a man totally dedicated to becoming the greatest and offers an engrossing snapshot of an unforgettable character, Eddie - Strongman.','/nysNqwndKhfCq5QUG7hByNg5Vrh.jpg','2015-08-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Eddie: Strongman',379832,2.4092,6.8,'NeiZrGw_pTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.0