ldiers arrive in the city of Oslo. The King of Norway faces a choice that will change his country forever. The King\'s Choice is a story about the three most dramatic days in Norway\'s history, the royal family\'s escape and King Haakon\'s difficult choice after Nazi Germany\'s invasion of Norway.','/qulAxlraNWYrvtq2lIi6AakbeUs.jpg','2016-09-29',136,'Released','Three Days in April','The King\'s Choice',396616,3.4413,6.8,'rNtu-bCGi18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40344,_binary '\0','/cfAOHdMFeqkfpbTDTrUw9o3eXmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4354740',6.3,2594,'hi','Dharam Sankat Mein','The film revolves around a Hindu man (Paresh Rawal) who goes through an identity crisis when he discovers he was adopted as a son in a Hindu family but was born in a Muslim family. The journey starts with finding his real father.','/bjsXitRDmeQWIoUyQ3ZeUTonbkU.jpg','2015-04-10',129,'Released','From the directors of OMG - Oh My God!','Dharam Sankat Mein',335392,1.2419,6.7,'qNripK67rH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40345,_binary '\0','/EkVL43L6T6cid6cVTejF8xzaNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4354756',6.2,7584,'en','The Wave','A man on the verge of a promotion takes a mysterious hallucinogenic drug that begins to tear down his reality and expose his life for what it really is.','/rWFHGTfCOzMphfJW3DPdfbq7Vyp.jpg','2019-09-21',87,'Released',NULL,'The Wave',619263,2.7809,6.036,'yaljljNo6Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40346,_binary '\0','/aFLZIil7AVtSoN3UeJ7vowAR6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4355838',5.2,1616,'hi','अल्‍बर्ट पिंटो को गुस्‍सा क्‍यूं आता है?','Albert Pinto goes missing one day and his girlfriend and family start making rounds at the police station to track him down. Unknown to them, he is on his way to Goa to carry out his first assignment as a hitman.','/sPyEn5nH9FF8b7SpHwnyHMi7kBJ.jpg','2019-04-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Albert Pinto Ko Gussa Kyun Aata Hai?',596335,0.7647,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL