ya Govyala Jauya','Three friends win a free Goa trip and invite an old college buddy who brings a surprise guest. Their dream vacation turns into chaos as plans unravel. The unexpected companion becomes both the trip\'s highlight and its downfall.','/1mFf6olPNa6vs0hKx1aFGwrvYvP.jpg','2026-07-31',121,'Released','A movie about friends must be watched with friends!','Mamachya Govyala Jauya',1743690,1.0744,0,'1g5knkhaDSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40363,_binary '\0','/g1Y4fQidcbG1kWLIDRNXIN6xdit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4364194',7.6,121403,'en','The Peanut Butter Falcon','A down-on-his-luck crab fisherman embarks on a journey to get a young man with Down syndrome to a professional wrestling school in rural North Carolina and away from the retirement home where he’s lived for the past two and a half years.','/qyQcRGvdW3VtxHR4fSDgPOePEip.jpg','2019-08-09',97,'Released',NULL,'The Peanut Butter Falcon',463257,7.1547,7.4,'UNl9RqjLCwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40364,_binary '\0','/q7puSFAJfEtdPJKQSLMaj3TQEoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4364338',6.3,1401,'en','Cloudy with a Chance of Love','Quirky meteorologist Deb spends most of her time finishing the passionate pursuit of her meteorology Ph.D. The wind of change starts blowing, however, when a handsome news director recruits her to fill in as an on-air weather personality.','/6hSLIyPZchm7YQzN2xNlvXzoYto.jpg','2015-02-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Cloudy with a Chance of Love',317120,1.7082,6.1,'h-BVliHwjFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40365,_binary '\0','/srfVzOX1x9VX3ucqjMnO3NSQt1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4364860',6,1270,'en','Portrait of Love','A prominent fashion photographer returns to her small town roots at the request of a friend. Surrounded by both memories and loved ones, she must consider a choice between a successful future and rekindling both the love of her life and of her home.','/3Oy3mwbU2SjFCsjaKIRqCwMAJ1c.jp