one.','Ghost House',359228,2.7168,5.6,'p65FmVo7d8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40370,_binary '\0','/24P9tUH7YkZ3P7Bwn6Jpunknovq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4366830',7.2,10366,'en','Grease Live','After enjoying a holiday romance, high school students Danny and Sandy are unexpectedly reunited when she transfers to Rydell High, where she must contend with cynical Rizzo and the Pink Ladies.','/ygzNOhZ4yAbA3QYqFjIFzI6ctwP.jpg','2016-01-31',130,'Released','An electrifying LIVE television event!','Grease Live',348089,2.9301,7.053,'7gZWGRD0Glg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40371,_binary '\0','/1upwdMUTDkEI5vm22d4D09cFWkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43676563',7.9,1619,'en','Novak Djokovic: The Wolf in Winter','He\'s conquered every title in tennis, including an Olympic gold. So why is Novak Djokovic still playing? The Wolf in Winter embeds with the greatest tennis player of all time as he returned to the Australian Open in 2025, capturing the obsession, the preparation, and the fire that won\'t go out even when there\'s nothing left to prove.','/4VvaFy9Z5C879akw3XJ31XK4lWO.jpg','2026-08-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Novak Djokovic: The Wolf in Winter',1626188,7.0006,7.4,'UQaKzMuyjlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40372,_binary '\0','/f3jf8f5e1G9Ck1FlWA7PxP5XH9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4368098',3.7,1487,'en','The Creature Below','A young scientist discovers a malevolent entity which sets her on a bloody descent into the jaws of insanity.','/7v2UFFwgFauhKyb3CtjtqJDL8gU.jpg','2017-05-11',83,'Released','In the depths of our oceans...something has awoken','The Creature Below',404830,1.4123,4.4,'KcjoGkjnCqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40373,_binary '\0','/qASObnfUQXAonFUpYVcAcuwt4U5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4368496',6.6,3104,'en','Bridal Wave','With her wedding day rapidly approaching, an anxious bride-to-be has doubts about her pending marriage. At a romantic island resort, she encounters a handsome kindred spirit and must now decide if her \"perfect\" fiancé is really her true love.','/yZMUAsU9MxTDls737iU23XeywND.jpg','2015-10-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Bridal Wave',317114,2.1045,6.3,'7sod1pgPT1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40374,_binary '\0','/w2HSqxbdgkN6d6Rg5HvCUaMpG7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43685971',7.3,2060,'te','పళ్లబురుసు','A 70 year old widower asks his son to buy him a toothbrush for his toothache. When the son fails to do this simple errand, their already strained father-son relationship becomes comically worse through a series of escalating events.','/sZsHYS3ckPoSUBnEB5J3CiE3oBV.jpg','2026-08-14',140,'Released',NULL,'Pallaburusu',1750516,1.7129,0,'kXTdgb6QrsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40375,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43697353',9.2,2102,'en','Panchali Panchabhartruka','Four friends accidentally become entangled in the death of a foreign girl who is connected with an underworld don. They then deal with this problem and get out of it in a hilarious yet thrilling manner.',NULL,NULL,128,'Released',NULL,'Panchali Panchabhartruka',1772184,2.3386,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40376,_binary '\0','/1lafNmLIrcWXHlASKmyo2sEAIOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4370784',7.3,12353,'fr','Les Innocentes','Poland, 1945. Mathilde, a young French Red Cross doctor, is on a mission to help the war survivors. When a nun seeks for her help, she is brought to a convent where several pregnant sisters are hiding, unable to reconcile their faith with their pregnancy. Mathilde becomes their only hope.','/8ZSPkyzq80jBVezRlC80kvV6QZr.jpg','2016-02-10',115,'Released','Deeply moving and emotionally layered.','The Innocents',364051,5.7226,7.1,'JEeEekaqFiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40377,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt43718175',9,7474,'en','Tom & Cherry','When Tom suddenly disappears, a mysterious man named Cheer becomes part of an extraordinary journey that no one sees coming. Packed with laughter, emotions, unexpected twists, and heartwarming moments, Tom and Cherry is a wholesome family entertainer that celebrates the true meaning of love and togetherness.','/69YPZ7nEtd7KviVEjIiZ5HdxM35.jpg','2026-08-28',155,'Released',NULL,'Tom & Cherry',1755667,1.0515,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40378,_binary '\0','/4WGqXK1FHXKWlDXNkYlhWJmj6ME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4372240',7.3,4131,'en','78/52','The most famous murder scene in movie history comprises 78 camera settings and 52 cuts: the shower scene in Alfred Hitchcock\'s Psycho. 78/52 tells the story of the man behind the curtain and his greatest obsession.','/mJb3OTY0rc4dTUStQnxSeRacsTV.jpg','2017-10-13',91,'Released','78 shots & 52 cuts that changed cinema forever','78/52',359749,2.3467,7.1,'rNHwKKdirxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40379,_binary '\0','/9XjBHeSPs3au8YthC2HOMXN3cXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4372390',6.2,6905,'en','Detour','A young law student, grieving for his dying mother, struggles to decide whether he should kill his unfaithful step-father.','/yndZHxRY69kIhjVZPYX7fdBwPWg.jpg','2017-01-20',97,'Released','When you want someone dead, which road would you choose?','Detour',356500,1.7482,6.2,'nJmYiyVF2rQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40380,_binary '\0','/cbcgHdeqcZklpd7pL1if4fjNWn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4373956',6.4,3307,'tr','Tereddüt','Şehnaz, a young female psychiatrist from Istanbul, starts mandatory duty in a provincial town. Back in the city, she maintains a marriage that looks flawless on the outside. Elmas, a young woman on the verge of breakdown, opens a new path in her.','/um5XZsYoKCB2gt6I6dk7z1Yf01n.jpg','2017-12-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Clair Obscur',412200,1.2182,5.6,'t80nwmblvsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40381,_binary '\0','/dogn5nhIzS1MsXy0yMIKUAAPO6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4374286',6.1,3173,'ko','물괴','Ancient Korea, 1506. The tyrannical King Yeonsan-gun of Joseon is overthrown by his half-brother Jung-jong, whose reign begins with a blood bath. Over the years, traitors plot against him, sinking the kingdom into chaos. In 1528, frightened rumors come to royal palace, regarding a mysterious creature, known as Monstrum by the peasants.','/4O2xrVNRxu78Bs1CbBfFe3vnSQC.jpg','2018-09-12',106,'Released','An ancient man-eating monster awakens.','Monstrum',523593,2.7305,6.471,'DQsUp2JYZO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40382,_binary '\0','/sFhI2qDM2s5QdcdXQDxj4XxFEkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4374460',7.6,8597,'ro','Aferim!','Set in early 19th century Wallachia, Romania, a policeman, Costandin, is hired by a nobleman to find a Gypsy slave who has run away from his estate after having an affair with his wife.','/fQyRszfnlXPFqQSWlqvdDDo42Ze.jpg','2015-03-06',108,'Released',NULL,'Aferim!',319993,1.3824,7.4,'xH-UMRih_z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40383,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4374856',5.5,1299,'tr','Bir Varmış Bir Yokmuş','Nehir comes across to someone singing songs all night long. She likes what she listens so much that she goes after this mysterious musician.','/mbI3K7LTRm2m2PukeboHlNQ65VO.jpg','2015-03-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time',336111,1.1791,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40384,_binary '\0','/5wD99V5JOTIEeZnqj4CvkeBCqu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4375268',4.1,1738,'en','Arbor Demon','An adventurous woman with a secret from her husband insists they go for a romantic camping trip in a remote wood to reconnect and share some quality time. But their idyll is shockingly cut short after a group of nearby hunters are brutally killed by a mysterious creature. Trapped inside their tent, the couple is forced to help one of the injured hunters and together they plan their escape. Is there really something supernatural hidden in the forest? Or is it just their imaginations running riot. Soon they must determine if the real threat is inside or outside their enclosure','/7mJea8gSFBwTSdrKxDkzEsgCD0y.jpg','2016-08-26',92,'Released','Don\'t breathe','Arbor Demon',405551,1.3325,4.9,'ja4BV1pFCSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40385,_binary '\0','/xfLMCz9I9HMFMUwKwPYKipv33in.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4375438',7.2,12746,'es','El club','In a secluded house in a small seaside town live four unrelated men and the woman who tends to the house and their needs. All former priests, they have been sent to this quiet exile to purge the sins of their pasts, the separation from their communities the worst form of punishment by the Church. They keep to a strict daily schedule devoid of all temptation and spontaneity, each moment a deliberate effort to atone for their wrongdoings.','/cSLJxkNyKLnfNtyR16bzlHKBQW7.jpg','2015-05-28',97,'Released',NULL,'The Club',319995,2.1749,6.898,'e8c2DYoF7lA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40386,_binary '\0','/yfk8GEw5AflJUeuPagD2478lGhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4377864',7.6,3107,'es','El botón de nácar','The ocean contains the history of all humanity. The sea holds all the voices of the earth and those that come from outer space. Water receives impetus from the stars and transmits it to living creatures. Water, the longest border in Chile, also holds the secret of two mysterious buttons which were found on its ocean floor. Chile, with its 2,670 miles of coastline and the largest archipelago in the world, presents a supernatural landscape. In it are volcanoes, mountains and glaciers. In it are the voices of the Patagonian Indigenous people, the first English sailors and also those of its political prisoners. Some say that water has memory. This film shows that it also has a voice.','/g0Vwz4s8Uhm2M9QhA95oh307Mke.jpg','2015-10-15',82,'Released',NULL,'The Pearl Button',319994,1.744,6.9,'Atra27D18g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40387,_binary '\0','/svOEqS1bBwwwJzvm9PrgY5xNQFu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4377952',6.7,1671,'ar','Zinzana','\'Zinzana\' is a psychological thriller set in a prison. Our hero finds himself locked in a cell with no I.D and no memory of what happened the night before. But being unable to make bail is the least of his problems when he\'s forced to play a madman\'s twisted game in order to save his family\'s lives.','/f0ETYftQdJKHzeHNQn2oM522lW6.jpg','2015-09-24',96,'Released',NULL,'Rattle the Cage',346615,0.8823,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40388,_binary '\0','/t098nulsb7y0yHPw1SiROWu3fuA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4378628',6.3,1291,'en','Westwood: Punk, Icon, Activist','The remarkable story of iconoclastic fashion designer Vivienne Westwood as she fights to maintain her brand’s integrity, her principles and her legacy.','/lguug8k8l7J6RJgaauTsmMH23LE.jpg','2018-03-09',78,'Released',NULL,'Westwood: Punk, Icon, Activist',478426,2.1717,6.3,'qvYmFcAegH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40389,_binary '\0','/w84SPnxlP3ikEhcWnSLAH8j5qad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4379180',5.9,2044,'fr','Enragés','After a bank job goes badly wrong, three desperate criminals take a young woman and a father and child hostage - it\'s the beginning of a frantic and violent road trip that not all of them will survive.','/b1fyTGVZtk07UBA1jixAELNmAAF.jpg','2015-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Rabid Dogs',344120,2.5072,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40390,_binary '\0','/904CrE3Mtp7buTpTnvKKz6Vhan5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4379536',6.1,1494,'it','Slam - Tutto per una ragazza','Samuele is 16 and has a passion for skateboarding. He has big dreams: going to university, move to California, and travel, but things change when he meets Alice, who could be the girl of his life.','/2BJV0Q5IhyLk2nwH9zt9klVGoa1.jpg','2016-11-20',100,'Released',NULL,