 with her fiancé, unsure of her marriage and their future. She relives her disastrous wedding day, put together by her fiance’s overbearing mother, over and over until, with the help of his brother, she begins to face her biggest fears and discover what she really wants in herself and in her life.','/kgC8KPpl8z2EhKtc5eY2svyGHTB.jpg','2015-02-06',84,'Released',NULL,'I Do, I Do, I Do',317118,2.2756,6.2,'K03geKk5hW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40395,_binary '\0','/flz1hSZTUl5wNs2i4nmcyX8Tg7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4381236',5.8,9763,'en','The Greasy Strangler','Ronnie runs a Disco walking tour with his son, Brayden. When a sexy woman takes the tour, it begins a competition between father and son for her love. It also signals the arrival of an oily strangler who stalks the streets at night.','/lsIJ8iTA2DK12SNTKf0vLKh1BGm.jpg','2016-06-03',93,'Released','BULLSHIT ARTIST!','The Greasy Strangler',320413,2.3222,5.549,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40396,_binary '\0','/bV7eAcBrYb57PwjpQ2ODT6VyFPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4382552',6.1,19209,'en','Hot Girls Wanted','A first-ever look at the realities of the professional “amateur” porn world and the steady stream of 18-to-19-year old girls entering into it.','/75ot83QOkc02vujyzmIbumQCU6Y.jpg','2015-01-24',84,'Released','Porn, the internet and the girl next door.','Hot Girls Wanted',318256,4.4925,6.1,'o2dQojRHX9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40397,_binary '\0','/80EyJ7GHK4rCJTQdw9j7fu3kR6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4382824',5.2,9931,'en','Army of One','Gary Faulkner is an ex-con, unemployed handyman, and modern day Don Quixote who receives a vision from God telling him to capture Osama Bin Laden. Armed with only a single sword purchased from a home-shopping network, Gary travels to Pakistan to complete his mission. While on his quest, Gary encounters old friends back home in Colorado, the new friends he makes in Pakistan, the enemies he makes at the CIA - and even God and Osama themselves.','/tUmo47WFeFRIQktGXYxWnSZXO6P.jpg','2016-11-04',93,'Released','One Man\'s Wildly True Quest To Capture Osama Bin Laden','Army of One',336445,3.2878,5.2,'HjRqok3v72U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40398,_binary '\0','/pak4TKvX3j7sqXcjwQCh5yzpUbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4382872',4.1,12509,'en','Extraction','When a former CIA operative is kidnapped by a group of terrorists, his son learns there is no plan for his father to be saved—so he launches his own rescue operation.','/1Cn5pxPi5XedW0oH0Xr6GibmmVZ.jpg','2015-12-18',92,'Released','Vengeance runs in the family.','Extraction',326425,5.2841,4.506,'W6nT9cLtX0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40399,_binary '\0','/sOZlPgdE2w96UiMfJaTSGIWPMW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4383288',6.7,2072,'fr','Polina, danser sa vie','Polina is a young dancer from a modest family. After years of ballet academy, she is accepted by the Bolshoi; still, she decides to try and audition of a modern dance company in France. She makes it, but her journey will not end there...','/kfM05D5whQjEEr4zk8GgfAL6aJI.jpg','2016-11-16',112,'Released','Breaking The Rules Can Change Your Life.','Polina',414372,2.7825,6.6,'ngo754ypNiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40400,_binary '\0','/5HnHEodzdN7thQRMfncWdle8ybD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4383594',5.3,26075,'en','Nine Lives','A stuffy businessman finds himself trapped inside the body of his family\'s cat.','/i457G22lL9t2yhEFdYz5Nd1M5DV.jpg','2016-08-03',87,'Released','His life just got put on paws.','Nine Lives',322240,8.0544,5.8,'_jHA97HzhxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40401,_binary '\0','/uEGZJr6lWnbSVvXK8TbKefIEzVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4384088',7,3736,'ja','怒り','A man brutally murders a married couple and leaves the word “ikari” (“rage”) written with their blood. The killer undergoes plastic surgery and flees. At three different locations in Japan, a male stranger appears. People suspect that the stranger might be the murderer.','/tO1rD0bNOaxnvhtEUu08Bvhhn7c.jpg','2016-09-17',142,'Released',NULL,'Rage',359344,2.3555,6.898,'GbvcbQn1Zqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40402,_binary '\0','/z0ADqEc2aIvnI12Zj9HxLxM2Hiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4384350',7.2,1472,'ml','പിക്കറ്റ് 43','While guarding an Indian picket in Kashmir, Hareendranath meets Mushraff, a Pakistani soldier. Later, the two form an unlikely bond of friendship and confide in each other their deepest feelings.','/eCWCbFwj0YkXpdsHf7xA0LEp2d9.jpg','2015-01-23',135,'Released',NULL,'Picket 43',324496,1.3207,6.219,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40403,_binary '\0','/5eZ8kRSlD8P8a42y9GEGl1yAqOb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4385888',7.3,52865,'en','20th Century Women','In 1979 Santa Barbara, California, Dorothea Fields is a determined single mother in her mid-50s who is raising her adolescent son, Jamie, at a moment brimming with cultural change and rebellion. Dorothea enlists the help of two younger women – Abbie, a free-spirited punk artist living as a boarder in the Fields\' home and Julie, a savvy and provocative teenage neighbour – to help with Jamie\'s upbringing.','/mso2rEr9i0MilRIOao5HaWFipS9.jpg','2016-12-28',119,'Released',NULL,'20th Century Women',342737,5.8017,7.308,'6JnFaltqnAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40404,_binary '\0','/gaQ7tZK0udTsiFE4b35vX4GdG2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4386242',5.6,2604,'en','R.L. Stine\'s Monsterville: The Cabinet of Souls','Teenage friends must resist the spell of an evil showman staging a house of horrors show in their small town.','/z3qgKFySWDs7vCjMn5gSxGV2fpI.jpg','2015-09-29',85,'Released',NULL,'R.L. Stine\'s Monsterville: The Cabinet of Souls',362105,2.8462,6.6,'lvRQfGLLTiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40405,_binary '\0','/4dwGiIWlXiHIfjmCuZR6owCHEuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15: