92770',5.6,6120,'en','Always Shine','On a trip to Big Sur, two friends, both actresses, try to reconnect with one another. Once alone, the women\'s suppressed jealousies and deep-seated resentments begin to rise, causing them to lose their grasp on not only the true nature of their relationship, but also their identities.','/gTDt04LtD1IUn8FWamBbKUBOQXq.jpg','2016-11-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Always Shine',385737,3.0159,5.4,'wp4blJoV9h4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40409,_binary '\0','/3tm15se4TJzXDIwdgO2oXThbHPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4393278',3.8,1364,'ru','Что творят мужчины! 2','Four friends from the first movie are back in the saddle. This time they\'re not only returning to the big sex world but also helping the state on the important mission.','/u4kbHJl7Cxm3pwFFrGDITQyo6ln.jpg','2015-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'What Men Do! 2',314952,1.403,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40410,_binary '\0','/dFSutwRIKqk1MgFyTNv7GblgEi2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4393514',8.1,3832,'en','Bitter Lake','An experimental documentary that explores Saudi Arabia\'s relationship with the U.S. and the role this has played in the war in Afghanistan.','/8TIXHoByfOPv7d88cM4OGxhTUx7.jpg','2015-01-24',135,'Released',NULL,'Bitter Lake',321109,1.7579,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40411,_binary '\0','/8Ojzoujd80NUScBe0IWscqRDwUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4396042',6.3,1759,'ja','ヒロイン失格','Hatori Matsuzaki is a female high school student. She has a crush on her childhood friend Rita Terasaka and believes he will eventually choose her as her heroine, but Rita Terasaka begins dating Miho Adachi. Meanwhile, the most popular male student, Kosuke Hiromitsu takes an interest in Hatori Matsuzaki.','/lg4lHPvbNMZ0QiROTQ2Q7TrwsA1.jpg','2015-09-19',112,'Released',NULL,'No Longer Heroine',341540,2.0416,6.6,'JImBbaP8HHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40412,_binary '\0','/sbu5cZj81YMexlU4CFuCXZPU2jy.