her - and with the curse that haunts them.','/qoqFM6t9wlBITWKRogJUompoClh.jpg','2017-10-05',93,'Released',NULL,'The Lodgers',429467,3.3868,5,'YLSV-41h2LQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40416,_binary '\0','/qEpPGlkq4WYjACFPrKe6B3uLtXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4400028',6.3,2406,'es','Sin hijos','Gabriel has been separated for four years now. Since then his 8 year old daughter is the center of his life. Completely avoiding getting involved in a new romantic relationship, Gabriel focus all his energy in his daughter and work. This plan gets spoiled when Vicky, a platonic love from his adolescence, now a beautiful and independent woman appears in his life. When romance is about to start, she puts one condition: She would never get involved with a man with children. She just does not want children in her life. When Gabriel is confronted with this, he says he has no children. From that moment on his life becomes a torment, playing every trick at hand in order to hide his child and belongings from Vicky in every date.','/8ABPcRThqfqv7o9ohhkLKEc6gZ2.jpg','2015-05-14',90,'Released',NULL,'No Kids',342163,1.4197,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40417,_binary '\0','/fe82BHTxxHOgPnDtope4SnJhwXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4400038',7,8712,'fr','Chocolat','Chocolat the clown, the first black stage performer in France, goes from anonymity to fame after forming an unprecedented duo with fellow performer Footit in the very popular in Belle Epoque Paris. But easy money, gambling, and discrimination take their toll on their friendship and Chocolat\'s career.','/zDyyy24J9q0pqmOzqM6w51S2Ntq.jpg','2016-02-03',119,'Released','The true story of the first black artist.','Chocolat',369778,2.5651,6.8,'oS_VOZHAMl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40418,_binary '\0','/eENjQIJA9bJlKaXqrJ1KOmqej7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4400058',6.4,8662,'fr','Babysitting 2','Franck and his girlfriend Sonya, plus some of their friends go on holiday in Brazil. Franck, his friends, two girls and Sonya\'s grandmother leave to visit a cave, but everything goes wrong and their crazy adventures begin.','/8kDHjMLw5knh0AYdp9iIeUt5AYZ.jpg','2015-12-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Babysitting 2',331836,3.929,6.3,'jZFmZk02rIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40419,_binary '\0','/uHp7nzzU63qRuMP8MpQkmwRNRct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4400174',6.7,1541,'fr','À peine j\'ouvre les yeux','Tunis, summer 2010, a few months before the Revolution: Farah, 18 years old, has just graduated and her family already sees her as a future doctor. But she doesn\'t have the same idea. She sings in a political rock band, has a passion for life, gets drunk, discovers love and her city by night against the wishes of her mother Hayet, who knows Tunisia and its dangers all too well.','/rSdUEsu3vAgUepn2iJzYLS5LEvU.jpg','2015-12-23',98,'Released',NULL,'As I Open My Eyes',356381,1.5934,6.5,'kgx_48jQAmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40420,_binary '\0','/1BNnnrwOPRAJER3tzAKU659cpYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4400994',6.3,8806,'en','The Ballad of Lefty Brown','Aging sidekick Lefty Brown has ridden with Eddie Johnson his entire life. But when a rustler kills Eddie, Lefty is forced from his partner’s shadow and must confront the ugly realities of frontier justice.','/p4L5DM3ZeEuAawFxd2ftgISQMZQ.jpg','2017-12-15',105,'Released','He never wanted to be the hero','The Ballad of Lefty Brown',438457,3.1723,6.3,'Sv2khM97ylU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40421,_binary '\0','/c5CExhFeNFx9xmCGUrMb3BEwxhf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4401006',5.5,3640,'en','Eat Locals','In a quiet countryside farmhouse, Britain\'s vampires gather for their once-every-fifty-years meeting. Others will be joining them too; Sebastian Crockett, an unwitting Essex boy who thinks he\'s on a promise with sexy cougar Vanessa; and a detachment of Special Forces vampire killers who have bitten off more than they can chew. This is certainly going to be a night to remember... and for some of them it will be their last.','/rYnvcrmNkkZXXmzzmUJ2ura95A9.jpg','2017-04-06',93,'Released','Guess Who\'s Coming To Dinner?','Eat Locals',412758,3.6101,5.1,'1Wd_xYluz_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40422,_binary '\0','/zITvAwjvdyjC8a0mhdjPbNwjAis.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4404474',1.3,7223,'de','Kartoffelsalat','When a deadly zombie virus infects a school in Germany it remains on the student Leo to save the world.','/bsXgl4X4dwYZ8TLwIObekN1z0qt.jpg','2015-07-23',81,'Released',NULL,'Potato Salad: Don\'t Ask!',340401,0.886,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40423,_binary '\0','/v2eeTmdRGJGU6sGfoAHHEBRwMCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4405860',3.2,1522,'en','Dead 7','A ragtag group of gunslingers try to make their way in a post-apocalyptic world. The twist to this world is that it’s just not barren and dangerous, it’s also filled with flesh-eating zombies. The gunslingers will find themselves stranded in a town and forced to make a choice on either to save the citizens of the town or save themselves.','/9Lbr89rVnLHfp8zXVKiuM4gia3V.jpg','2016-04-01',89,'Released','Larger Than Life!','Dead 7',384450,1.717,4.238,'-gf5tZPycdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40424,_binary '\0','/p3ZII4uLzv2y2FV4XUqBYNfmLN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4410000',6,3383,'de','Luis und die Aliens','11-year-old Luis makes friends with three loveable little aliens, who crash their UFO into his house. In return for Luis\' help in finding the home-shopping channel stuff they came for, they save Luis from boarding school - and an exciting adventure follows.','/5oq7s5ru4hjp83mi4fWSJ0L7yUA.jpg','2018-05-09',86,'Released','Extraterrestrial. Extra trouble.','Luis and the Aliens',432383,4.1146,6.49,'C7jPsACD-O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40425,_binary '\0','/ymjOGuWAe1yv1ZUR5XFTbmDWBOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4411234',4.6,4373,'en','Slice','In a spooky small town, when a slew of pizza delivery boys are slain on the job, two daring survivors set out to catch the culprits behind the cryptic crime spree.','/bznkSqWqj43DhzHrbLehsr6ncb0.jpg','2018-09-10',82,'Released','Dead. In 30 minutes or less.','Slice',347392,2.1875,4.441,'i5LUKX97bNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40426,_binary '\0','/wbA13Xns8EtbIubDOPLl7kCYYA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4411504',6.9,15342,'es','El clan','In Argentina, between 1982 and 1985, the Puccios, a well-established family of San Isidro, an upper-class suburb of Buenos Aires, kidnap several people and hold them as hostages for a ransom.','/m6iPqGhtIAgGRQcfqxSYbRrlK3F.jpg','2015-08-13',109,'Released','The true story of Argentina\'s most notorious crime family','The Clan',352161,4.2443,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40427,_binary '\0','/kN8SMfKfca655F97pqRnWPmFAiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4411584',6.6,20483,'en','The Secret: Dare to Dream','A widow with three children hires a handyman to fix her house during a major storm. When not doing home repairs, he shares his philosophy of believing in the power of the universe to deliver what we want.','/5mCqEeBA0MW7H6akFrFQXJu68rU.jpg','2020-04-16',107,'Released',NULL,'The Secret: Dare to Dream',550231,5.9756,7.3,'76PmxBH-oBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40428,_binary '\0','/gD9JOmzP5jGbb273Abp9ZVG2lnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4411596',6,22484,'en','My Cousin Rachel','A young Englishman plots revenge against his mysterious, beautiful cousin, believing that she murdered his guardian. But his feelings become complicated as he finds himself falling under the beguiling spell of her charms.','/lLPm7mjg8a8Y5veds4fhSWwvlFS.jpg','2017-06-08',106,'Released','Did she or didn\'t she?','My Cousin Rachel',413998,3.8043,5.7,'Gp_8OYkGds0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40429,_binary '\0','/6O51sHUFjZrGSX0evVU3pq2yMMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4411618',6,4791,'en','In Dubious Battle','In the California apple country, 900 migratory workers rise \'in dubious battle\' against the landowners. The group takes on a life of its own—stronger than its individual members, and more frightening. Led by the doomed Jim Nolan, the strike is founded on his tragic idealism—\'courage, never submit, or yield\'.','/bC7N0pUc6RzuDqSNHsV0VXk06Cq.jpg','2016-10-08',110,'Released',NULL,'In Dubious Battle',337844,8.3367,5.8,'JLJM9uTS8Nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40430,_binary '\0','/9O1o7ExYmS9uTYMCY3vI2mQcCaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4412362',6.1,5120,'es','Mi gran noche','Coslada, near Madrid, Spain, October 2015. Hundreds of extras are trapped in a huge stage where they pretend with hysterical joy that they are celebrating a party that will be broadcast on television on New Year\'s Eve. But more than a week later, the clash between several staff members threatens to prolong indefinitely such a maddening nightmare.','/tcXv39wbVtx9uU756M6yg5GrPgV.jpg','2015-10-23',98,'Released',NULL,'My Big Night',335053,2.1449,5.4,'Kqd0jBFJrmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40431,_binary '\0','/DRPH4RxU6dQqZUfATtJfCUyVJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4412528',6,2322,'en','Two Lovers and a Bear','Set in a small town near the North Pole where roads lead to nowhere, the story follows Roman and Lucy, two burning souls who come together to make a leap for life and inner peace.','/q8anLL9m6ON7kTJ4Pbcuofls4gQ.jpg','2016-10-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Two Lovers and a Bear',325373,2.8165,6.481,'cFyg2AuD86M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40432,_binary '\0','/peNZduz6TMnA1NbGTGkCjsLACtC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4413338',5.4,2441,'es','Abzurdah','A disenfranchised 16-year-old girl connects to an older man on the internet and after a brief one-sided affair descends into obsession and anorexia.','/wH28FUPq2wjp23GXqMmzhOdvLcD.jpg','2015-06-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Abzurdah',353989,1.9343,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40433,_binary '\0','/rqP4jHyEyov7UAolOVBflesChME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4414438',5.6,1702,'en','It Had to Be You','Sonia is a jingle writer who\'s always dreamt of a big and exciting life. Surprised by a sudden proposal and subsequent ultimatum from her easy-going boyfriend, Chris, Sonia has to decide whether she\'ll join the ranks of her married friends or take a leap and pursue her fantasies. A whimsical romantic comedy that\'s raunchy and yet gentle, \'It Had To Be You\' explores the choices women face today while satirizing cultural expectations of gender and romance.','/s4Y9aARoFp4DuBnrCyRi9pE83Lj.jpg','2016-10-21',85,'Released','First comes love, then comes... maybe?','It Had to Be You',383208,2.1334,5.5,'skUILrCSwtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40434,_binary '\0','/9AKN9jgCXqziM2fEFyLDOTUMCrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4415016',6.8,2940,'ko','스물','A story about three friends who just turned twenty; an age where you can do whatever you want, love whoever you want with opportunities abroad.','/7gbSJNW1g4cSUJJr3SN1TFa6xZt.jpg','2015-03-25',115,'Released','Our roaring but embarrassing twenties.','Twenty',331251,2.175,7.1,'MYruHOXRoZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40435,_binary '\0','/pSIBkQCRD87QFFZ4HnFGYBivJNo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4415326',5.9,2111,'ta','காக்கி சட்டை','Mathimaran, a police constable, wants to do something worthy of his job and stumbles upon an organ trafficking ring run by Durai that is exploiting immigrant labourers. But, with Durai\'s connections inside the force and in politics going deep, can the cop succeed?','/A8h5JQpCETjUedYiSk4blar2c3.jpg','2015-02-26',157,'Released',NULL,'Kaaki Sattai',280168,1.2234,5.5,'leCsVj8SKyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40436,_binary '\0','/gh5pdz3aoMpPuOnafOq3N1PWlPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4416518',3.4,2958,'en','Shark Lake','Meredith Hendricks happens to be the best cop in her quiet town on Lake Tahoe. When a black-market exotic species dealer named Clint is paroled from prison, something he let loose begins to make its presence known. Swimmers and land-lovers alike begin to become part of the food chain at an unbelievable rate. Meredith and her team discover that they\'re not just hunting one eating machine, but a whole family of them. Not everyone will make it out alive, but those who do will never forget this summer at Shark Lake.','/rAvFko64iscEmDQkVnmc8rpmqCw.jpg','2015-10-02',92,'Released','In this lake you have to fight to survive','Shark Lake',299553,3.6933,3.5,'uU_ZvIup-3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40437,_binary '\0','/xiSHrPzADdCQCl7rSsHEQdSOnLq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4417186',6.6,1383,'en','The Reluctant Nanny','IT guru Libby gets more than she bargained for when, after losing her job, she reluctantly agrees to help a cop with fostering two abandoned kids.','/lDZrzx4meXZ7KDatp9N90lD3e5U.jpg','2015-02-14',100,'Released',NULL,'The Reluctant Nanny',338778,1.8349,6.4,'LcNt8AcqHxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40438,_binary '\0','/ikz3QJJWaU8cBoZ81XRX0wret18.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4417510',6.9,2988,'te','నేను శైలజ','Hari (Ram), a DJ in Vizag, proposes to many girls none of them accept his love. One day he sees a beautiful girl Sailaja (Keerthi Suresh) and also impresses her but doesn\'t propose to her fearing that he would be rejected. Hari spends some good times with Sailaja and right when he proposes his love, she rejects him point blank. An upset Ravi continues with his life and as time passes by, he gets a huge clue which could help him getting back his love.','/buQQUkoBTjt3nJftJLh8WqQ5cfX.jpg','2016-01-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Nenu.. Sailaja...',376998,1.4427,6.212,'i916BRRHoTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40439,_binary '\0','/8tM3fnRPDdZqOWeTDOBgTczFYF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4417522',6.7,2626,'cn','踏血尋梅','Based on a real murder case where a dismembered corpse of a murdered 16-year-old prostitute girl was found in Hong Kong in 2008.','/lJnbylQaFllFjw98uKk5tYmyJxw.jpg','2015-11-13',98,'Released','Human nature begins where truth ends. Welcome to the murder without a body.','Port of Call',334557,2.0241,6.537,'BIOpyvgBgkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40440,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4418168',6.1,1492,'fa','عصر یخبندان','In the tenth year of marriage, Babak and Manizheh face the biggest challenge of their life. Financial problems and difficult social situation cause Babak to work very hard and this leads to a deep gap between him and his wife, in a way that Manizheh starts a new relation, the relation which leads her to addiction and immorality. On the verge of her complete collapse, she wakes up to the truth that she has lost her life.','/lQ7FbG2UwmrSHrEiIKkwgec4b2y.jpg','2015-06-24',106,'Released',NULL,'Ice Age',385048,0.6775,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40441,_binary '\0','/63SqsJgPbkIZ0in3qXEymlgovjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4418398',5.2,1512,'en','We Still Steal the Old Way','The explosive follow-up to We Still Kill The Old Way (2014). Regarded as the best in the business, The Archer Gang is an aging criminal outfit who carry out a daring robbery, but are caught mid-heist. They are sentenced to do time in Britain\'s toughest prison. Once inside, they encounter their old nemesis Slick Vic Farrow (Billy Murray) who is intent on murdering the gang. The old-school criminals need to use all their wits to stage a daring escape, while dodging Slick Vic, and setting in motion a chain of events which leads to an explosive prison riot.','/5X6nNscyG0SFgTiCxkZTf7zg3Cj.jpg','2017-01-09',90,'Released','As Bank Jobs Go This Ones Worth Doing a Bit of Time For','We Still Steal the Old Way',351281,2.0207,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40442,_binary '\0','/yhJNDvrsZOsgOaRRvg9ivRKbkHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4419196',5.3,2511,'ru','Матильда','It portrays the memories of Matilda Kshesinskaya and her love affair with the last Tsar of Russia, Nicholas II. Matilda, a Polish-born ballerina from the Mariinsky Theatre in St. Petersburg, had a brief and intense romance with Nicholas between 1892 and 1894, before Nicholas married Alexandra Feodorovna and was crowned Tsar after his father\'s death. It also explores their relationship, facing societal pressures and interference from Nicholas\'s mother, Empress Maria Feodorovna, as well as Matilda\'s involvement with other members of the imperial family, the Romanovs, such as Grand Duke Sergei Mikhailovich and Grand Duke Andrei Vladimirovich.','/kFXGRh6zIgX4e9x4ym4C4l5aVLo.jpg','2017-10-25',130,'Released','Love That Changed An Empire','Mathilde',376540,2.6634,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40443,_binary '\0','/j0WqwIfrrzDgvnEBXbzM41ulpWY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4419364',5.1,12411,'en','Holidays','An anthology feature film that puts a uniquely dark and original spin on some of the most iconic and beloved holidays of all time by challenging our folklore, traditions and assumptions.','/5FXtPtetZaB0giJEqC6mOLBr15A.jpg','2016-04-22',104,'Released','Every one has a dark side.','Holidays',323262,3.0466,4.9,'F1ISGjuP960','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40444,_binary '\0','/oI5uHu7lrQ0mBBH1c8OHCAkCq4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4419684',4.7,18229,'en','In the Lost Lands','A queen sends the powerful and feared sorceress Gray Alys to the ghostly wilderness of the Lost Lands in search of a magical power, where she and her guide, the drifter Boyce, must outwit and outfight both man and demon.','/dDlfjR7gllmr8HTeN6rfrYhTdwX.jpg','2025-02-27',101,'Released','She seeks the power to free her people.','In the Lost Lands',324544,13.5726,6.35,'CMyrp5Vk3mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40445,_binary '\0','/xy4kRFTxMbPeWBKcQkijJ8i1DFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4420110',5.9,4426,'en','Invisible Sister','Teenager Cleo\'s school science project goes quite awry, causing her popular older sister Molly to go invisible.','/seWQvVIzb5xBjHW0Y1h4jvokxZN.jpg','2015-12-10',78,'Released','What you see is only half the story','Invisible Sister',360605,5.5449,6.7,'eQCvyvME6x0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40446,_binary '\0','/x4yZrzpiVhdWV6Q5KURqiezChbV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4420704',7.6,16945,'en','Kedi','A profile of Istanbul and its unique people, seen through the eyes of the most mysterious and beloved animal humans have ever known, the Cat.','/o7SB4YELcuVGUMIXeunWZ8rbx4h.jpg','2017-01-08',79,'Released','A cat meowing at your feet, looking up at you, is life smiling at you...','Kedi',392011,3.8149,7.509,'lKq7UqplcL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40447,_binary '\0','/erCT3TNffZUfN7lSs8XhNR0vgUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4422164',5.1,2065,'en','Smoking Guns','A young gambler makes a large, risky bet on a horse race. When the odds turn in his favour, more than one party has sudden interest in the winning betting slip, and they\'ll do anything to get their hands on it.','/bMciPw4bLtdFtUaTwMoeXCfcYFk.jpg','2016-06-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Smoking Guns',448988,1.1901,5.5,'WN8IJ5lcL74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40448,_binary '\0','/7iZXhAACaHkt3kfMZhE4h51YrFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4425064',6.9,6832,'en','Steve Jobs: The Man in the Machine','When Steve Jobs died the world wept. But what accounted for the grief of millions of people who didn’t know him? This evocative film navigates Jobs\' path from a small house in the suburbs, to zen temples in Japan, to the CEO\'s office of the world\'s richest company, exploring how Jobs’ life and work shaped our relationship with the computer. The Man in the Machine is a provocative and sometimes startling re-evaluation of the legacy of an icon.','/6SqoLu7N5LgngPrmbUQ9k809cwA.jpg','2015-08-07',129,'Released','Bold. Brilliant. Brutal.','Steve Jobs: The Man in the Machine',324308,2.9314,6.6,'SrlPyKxdMX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40449,_binary '\0','/iyYXsaEYR3nPy5bUEChvRcVpQh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4425152',6.1,1385,'sv','Pojkarna','Kim, Bella and Momo are three fourteen-year-old girls who discover a fantastic flower with magic qualities: by drinking its nectar they are transformed into boys and they enter a new world. At first they enjoy their newly found freedom, but soon Bella and Momo realize that there are downsides to it. Kim however gets seriously addicted…','/tqr7NqUBwgXTCJALwcQNk4njkso.jpg','2015-10-16',106,'Released',NULL,'Girls Lost',356218,1.196,5.7,'I_LcfnlYLec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40450,_binary '\0','/Aa9Lx6gotP0szl9tlt5SPCN08oF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4425200',7.4,578850,'en','John Wick: Chapter 2','John Wick is forced out of retirement by a former associate looking to seize control of a shadowy international assassins’ guild. Bound by a blood oath to aid him, Wick travels to Rome and does battle against some of the world’s most dangerous killers.','/hXWBc0ioZP3cN4zCu6SN3YHXZVO.jpg','2017-02-08',122,'Released','Never stab the devil in the back!','John Wick: Chapter 2',324552,26.0829,7.346,'ChpLV9AMqm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40451,_binary '\0','/201mKrWi37SE1YkdqRP7rE3QamK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4426464',4.9,2558,'en','Arctic Dogs','Animals band together to save the day when the evil Otto Von Walrus hatches a sinister scheme to accelerate global warming and melt the Arctic Circle.','/5YHjyjd2N0ZXcnGuB8G1nIa6h9t.jpg','2019-11-01',92,'Released','Time to run with the big dogs!','Arctic Dogs',416153,8.3772,5.983,'MD6u7h7Z8uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40452,_binary '\0','/oiuTKjrRKSuh4EfFCwno0mFMDm5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4426656',6.3,1277,'fr','Ni le ciel, ni la terre','Afghanistan, 2014. As the withdrawal of troops approaches, Captain Antarès Bonassieu and his squad have been assigned a surveillance mission in a remote valley of Wakhan, on the border of Pakistan. Despite Antarès and his men’s determination, control of the secluded valley will slowly fall out of their hands. One dark night, soldiers begin to mysteriously disappear in the valley.','/ehewOFIcDyG6Fm3B7SG3bXHENuz.jpg','2015-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'The Wakhan Front',336663,1.6054,6.3,'3g6UOh365hM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40453,_binary '\0','/sNJ3fBAq37dcx3rbjrMuV8S7bkQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4426738',6,2485,'en','Animals','Longtime friends and party lovers Laura and Tyler navigate life and love in Dublin, Ireland but find themselves drifting apart when Laura becomes engaged.','/tQyvlLavdNz8xg1vn3Dt7ZC5SnK.jpg','2019-08-02',109,'Released','Some friendships are wild at heart','Animals',513340,1.3044,5.5,'_FN_zr4rQzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40454,_binary '\0','/2gz9HwqZA7xtTgkBZUdhwbhYrhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4427060',6,2849,'pt','Beira-Mar','A lonely beach on the southernmost coast of Brazil is the scene for two friends, on the brink of adulthood, to explore their understanding of themselves and one another. Martin has been sent by his father to retrieve what appears to be an inheritance-related document from the family of his recently deceased and estranged grandfather. Tomaz accompanies him, seemingly hoping to regain some of their former closeness. The two boys shelter themselves in a glass house, in front of a cold and stormy sea.','/7RGHChP3CB033cIMOZYp2Dx3pQg.jpg','2015-06-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Seashore',322740,2.1297,6.2,'6KAaE5WuSuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40455,_binary '\0','/qMLQKZjmD9aUYJGaNXxCviZMgMn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4427076',6.9,2448,'ru','14+','Alex glides his mouse tenderly over online images of Vika. He has been smitten ever since he saw her with her friends and cannot get her out of his head. Unfortunately, Vika is beyond Alex’s reach because he\'s not welcome in her neighborhood. Nonetheless, Alex sneaks into a disco at her school and finds up the courage to ask her to dance. Moments are intense as Alex feels infatuation for the first time.','/qzFbkoJkI1GaOuIwarRxcpKQ9P3.jpg','2015-02-07',100,'Released',NULL,'14+',325388,1.9485,6.873,'sVNPJEfrZFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40456,_binary '\0','/fQb9M4De7Yg5mbq9LPPmMoqMSVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4427800',5.6,1635,'en','Walkaway Joe','A young boy named Dallas goes on a search for his pool-hustling father after he abandons their family. Dallas is determined to bring his father home when he meets Joe Haley, a drifter wrestling with a past he\'d rather forget, who feels responsible for Dallas\' safety and reluctantly takes him in.','/tRbh3zYElDge6UTdobkozAD1gzN.jpg','2020-05-08',89,'Released','Can\'t win without a little hustle','Walkaway Joe',553593,2.6733,6,'nnIL4RHnj80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40457,_binary '\0','/92PJmMopfy64VYjd0HvIQaHGZX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428398',5.8,7689,'en','Paws of Fury: The Legend of Hank','A hard-on-his-luck hound finds himself in a town full of cats in need of a hero to defend them from a ruthless villain\'s wicked plot to wipe their village off the map. With help from a reluctant mentor, our underdog must assume the role of town samurai and team up with the villagers to save the day.','/wMDUDwAArpfGdtTTZ25SfwngGwt.jpg','2022-07-14',94,'Released','Time to mark some territory.','Paws of Fury: The Legend of Hank',366672,8.8466,6.6,'A_hkjvjx2ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40458,_binary '\0','/9mVgtyhmkQtsJkq5Fu4OhuU0155.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428728',6.3,5639,'fr','Braqueurs','One of the members of a gang of thieves commits a serious mistake that force them to work for a ruthless gang of drug dealers, endangering the future of the team, their lives and those of their families.','/zq4QUvbPS2bf6mesCPW04awrBoJ.jpg','2016-05-04',78,'Released','Thieves against dealers.','The Crew',393717,1.8332,6.2,'8ZSCIdMnA6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40459,_binary '\0','/jDg6THtbmJlbPA4P8vY2RPaNUZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428762',5.9,2834,'fr','Éperdument','A man, a woman. A prison director, his inmate. An impossible love, a true story.','/bYZKngNLoj1nEmQS9lyKW4trsHM.jpg','2016-03-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Down by Love',381255,2.9755,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40460,_binary '\0','/qJy1TAgMi0FmPVmrjedgfri63kc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428788',6.9,5911,'fr','Marguerite','Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera.','/lfIleyisIzYfvUNXTLIfJjHiJz6.jpg','2015-09-16',127,'Released',NULL,'Marguerite',352157,2.0194,6.3,'MxBykgkKWuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40461,_binary '\0','/l8w1tqlQeLBckOpL2UaMDPGr9BI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428800',5.2,1220,'fr','Marguerite et Julien','Julien and Marguerite de Ravalet, son and daughter of the Lord of Tourlaville, have loved each other tenderly since childhood. But as they grow up, their affection veers toward voracious passion.','/yUUJ8gTY4wJGTKHgQqQe9fM4fLP.jpg','2015-09-30',105,'Released',NULL,'Marguerite & Julien',330294,1.7731,5.7,'EDlwcOgZga8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40462,_binary '\0','/s14TKXCYH8dotfBIBuanNaYyBst.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4428814',6.8,7199,'fr','La Loi du marché','At the age of 51 and after 20 months on unemployment, Thierry starts a new job that soon brings him face to face with a moral dilemma. How much is he willing to accept to keep his job?','/fMsOEBcAeBL74xWMUj6hgDv4l1y.jpg','2015-05-19',93,'Released',NULL,'The Measure of a Man',329712,3.0364,6.58,'SlLUzvHlNlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40463,_binary '\0','/e6WQoHeD1lomknxc0a65Ae1sfVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4429128',8.4,9641,'ta','பாபநாசம்','A cinephile tries to protect his family by hiding a heat-of-the-moment murder committed by his daughter by taking cues from the films he has watched. With the victim the son of a cop, can he get away with it?','/b756U7HaJF0ooVsxv2YddXIFPuk.jpg','2015-07-03',181,'Released',NULL,'Papanasam',330421,1.2855,7.885,'qTnYaTYl9RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40464,_binary '\0','/nN4Gs3vZAOJ1D6FRtrwbU9VGYwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4429160',6.5,6649,'ko','레드슈즈','Princes who have been turned into Dwarfs seek the red shoes of a lady in order to break the spell, although it will not be easy.','/MBiKqTsouYqAACLYNDadsjhhC0.jpg','2019-07-25',92,'Released','Your true self is the fairest of them all','Red Shoes and the Seven Dwarfs',486589,7.4457,7.672,'NB3mZMyxcM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40465,_binary '\0','/m4QQi9OBnSGfymR6rdBhSwAuxYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4429194',5.8,10407,'en','Paris Can Wait','Anne is at a crossroads in her life. Long married to a successful, driven but inattentive movie producer, she unexpectedly finds herself taking a car trip from Cannes to Paris with Jacques, a business associate of her husband. What should be a seven-hour drive turns into a carefree two-day adventure replete with diversions involving picturesque sights, fine food and wine, humor, wisdom and romance - reawakening Anne\'s senses and giving her a new lust for life.','/jLzfHNU1JldQpC5TNEvQMnWQxx6.jpg','2016-09-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Paris Can Wait',375867,5.8369,5.9,'HTrT6QSqnGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40466,_binary '\0','/AbxCR6bIKh9JKyb9WqRsI8Z79Uf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4430136',7.2,17710,'hi','Pyaar Ka Punchnama 2','After falling in love, three roommates experience changes in their lives.','/2EjMwAPh8ILLZloqr5U42BCoWMe.jpg','2015-10-16',136,'Released',NULL,'Pyaar Ka Punchnama 2',363413,1.4369,6.5,'tC-HGUhxyyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40467,_binary '\0','/5jxesZtbjNtsDitSBvK1amtd7o2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4430212',8.2,110895,'hi','दृश्यम्','When his family stares down the barrel of criminal charges, a commoner channels his street smarts and knowledge of action films to tie the long arm of the law into an investigative Gordian knot.','/gIClWRv5OSe8rl5Koi0AeUcCZ9Z.jpg','2015-07-30',163,'Released','Visuals Can Be Deceptive','Drishyam',352173,2.8758,7.5,'64xJLmcA2K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40468,_binary '\0','/k0jRj8VZQVJkmmSC84KEJctBScA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4431208',7.4,1960,'en','Ice Guardians','On-ice enforcers struggle to rise through the professional ranks of the world\'s most prestigious hockey league, only to be confronted with a new found fight for the existence of the role itself.','/tVHylGMKtF8Fs1ILYLvffpbbkUD.jpg','2016-09-12',108,'Released',NULL,'Ice Guardians',413361,1.3522,7.1,'BzqIoa5z8gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40469,_binary '\0','/eMrwl3wkMfUpD3PIV6KfFvFYtM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4431392',7.5,1521,'te','మళ్ళీ మళ్ళీ ఇది రాని రోజు','An unfortunate incident separates a state-level athlete from his lover, who then moves to Malaysia. Years later, she returns to India but certain misunderstandings threaten to keep them apart.','/s0UHAKFzQcodqK1xfDtquzLjfiN.jpg','2015-02-06',139,'Released','Life is Waiting',