lanet and the six crew members are ready for their mission. But what they find are giant mutated humanoid cockroaches with incredible physical strength. The crew members are easily wiped out, but not before sending a transmission back to Earth. Now, humanity will send elite warriors to exterminate the mutated bugs and claim back Mars.','/z1A7bajfwadBi5eAgXiWDMpY5i9.jpg','2016-04-29',109,'Released','We\'re the ones who will survive.','Terra Formars',330070,3.3762,6.1,'NPXMtJNdxaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40474,_binary '\0','/ahDW25VDFZZHxL5ngrhSm5JVT0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4433890',6.4,2618,'is','Eiðurinn','When his daughter\'s criminal boyfriend becomes an increasing threat to the family, a father must take action to protect them.','/t21ngzRZXfDq5WYBDfLtwHdJv68.jpg','2016-09-06',110,'Released',NULL,'The Oath',346658,1.9001,6,'cF4GTyS0lFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40475,_binary '\0','/1y4krc1zQf1R7qXiioHZsg9EsBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4434004',7.7,34502,'hi','उड़ता पंजाब','Drug abuse and the darker side of Punjab rear their heads in the intense, interwoven tales of a policeman, a doctor, a migrant worker, and a rockstar.','/c7BXGhHwvK1AfDCmfPTtw5LsuIU.jpg','2016-06-17',148,'Released','Drugs di maa di.','Udta Punjab',398535,1.835,7.3,'A5VoQO_vgns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40476,_binary '\0','/uwnAbCfrxDeWKqxAMas6ZnmAqfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4434688',6.5,8367,'en','The Spirit of Christmas','A woman falls in love with a man who is somewhat unavailable.','/ynWcaW8ZrtBeuzgUyEXR30A2TAT.jpg','2015-11-28',91,'Released','This holiday could be the start of a new beginning.','The Spirit of Christmas',367544,2.7069,7,'JrwC1NdRZw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40477,_binary '\0','/qgirkEXAOznx1w9pXH143W3Ch5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4435072',2.6,49437,'te','లైగర్','The journey of Liger, from Karimnagar to Mumbai, from a nobody to a competitor, in his search for recognition while navigating his weaknesses, relationships, and love life.','/bBZJAdfmcwhyvkwK1XajnHECdoY.jpg','2022-08-25',138,'Released','Saala Crossbreed','Liger',787163,2.098,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40478,_binary '\0','/p8fKTEXw3PDvKSnrFTmyMWmRQXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4435082',5.9,1582,'en','Running Wild','Stella Davis is a widow who saves her ranch by working with convicts to rehabilitate a herd of wild horses that wandered on to her property. Stella must fight prejudice, greed, bureaucracy and vanity (including her own) to finally understand that there is no better remedy to misfortune than helping another living creature.','/v5K2odrXNvbZLYl7gFB9WCimN8S.jpg','2017-02-10',100,'Released','What you fight for defines who you are.','Running Wild',430406,2.6393,6,'jkJPE8wFFUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40479,_binary '\0','/eRXLgylXsWxHGdBwsjksE4MfddF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4437216',5.7,8374,'en','Goat','Reeling from a terrifying assault, a nineteen year old enrolls into college with his brother and pledges the same fraternity. What happens there, in the name of \'brotherhood,\' tests him and his loyalty in brutal ways.','/kQBy81VxGA20wbwouOruNyucCnG.jpg','2016-09-23',103,'Released','Cruelty. Brutality. Fraternity.','Goat',337874,2.4404,5.367,'7ftRLo6nKcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40480,_binary '\0','/zgckZ4VZM4UoZlwVS1Dk8mPwqiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4438848',5.7,138902,'en','Neighbors 2: Sorority Rising','A sorority moves in next door to the home of Mac and Kelly Radner who have a young child. The Radner\'s enlist their former nemeses from the fraternity to help battle the raucous sisters.','/eyjcLLwxuRXACbglIbwWwaXK9DN.jpg','2016-05-04',92,'Released','It\'s parenthood vs. sisterhood.','Neighbors 2: Sorority Rising',325133,12.2405,5.816,'EIe7nR0lvk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40481,_