1:10.000000'),(40484,_binary '\0','/8ZWLPmb3SHaKxJQedWVes526jOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4441098',4.7,2269,'en','Cold Moon','Cold Moon takes place in tiny Babylon, Fla., where the granddaughter of Clark’s character is murdered by a mysterious assailant, her body sunk into the black waters of the Styx River — the river where her parents disappeared from their boat a decade earlier. Suspicion falls on a duplicitous banker and his wealthy father, played by Stewart and Lloyd.','/2qbgaZothXrCMohpY7CzsMcZeMo.jpg','2016-10-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Cold Moon',354125,2.2276,4.7,'-0Oc6EhoMAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40485,_binary '\0','/g2whpuYHWLh4cWfu9km24pm9Ofp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4441150',4.2,3254,'en','Salt and Fire','A scientist blames the head of a large company for an ecological disaster in South America. But when a volcano begins to show signs of erupting, they must unite to avoid a disaster.','/3UkmGmAIJPLpBH2TXzNDO8kykkw.jpg','2016-12-07',98,'Released','Sometimes redemption is out of reach','Salt and Fire',340488,2.3235,4.9,'YWLb1rFurzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40486,_binary '\0','/fMt4fwqy0C908DwHDHpn65z1ku0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4441280',5.9,7901,'es','El cadáver de Anna Fritz','Anna Fritz is a beautiful and famous actress. Suddenly her body is found in a hotel and the news of her death goes around the planet. The young, shy caretaker Pau works at the hospital where they carried the body of Anna Fritz. He and his friends decide to take pictures of the body of Anna Fritz. They decide they could make love to her and nobody would know. They are in front of Anna Fritz ... and can do with it what they want.','/wbGlMrymGFhYE8CTDVc7xwPUD6j.jpg','2015-03-15',72,'Released',NULL,'The Corpse of Anna Fritz',323372,5.9384,6.853,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40487,_binary '\0','/1slbKMn1K491qQPjxZAIi4cieXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4441422',4.7,3001,'en','Hangman','Returning from vacation, the Miller family find their home has been broken into. After cleaning up the mess they continue with their lives, shaking off the feeling of being violated. But little do they know the nightmare has just begun.','/oFycPIlZahNAodgnOMG9Anv4Hds.jpg','2015-03-14',85,'Released','Who You Fear Is Already Inside','Hangman',324803,1.6611,4.8,'_kXo0AWpWCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40488,_binary '\0','/v8VSkHabQytkXr6aAo2gopDFzXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4442130',4.8,4229,'en','Wild Horses','Texas Ranger Samantha Payne reopens a 15-year-old missing person case, and uncovers evidence that suggests that the boy was likely murdered on a ranch belonging to wealthy family man, Scott Briggs. When Scott’s estranged son unexpectedly returns home during the investigation, Samantha becomes even more convinced that the Briggs family was involved, and will stop at nothing to discover the truth about the boy’s death - even putting her own life in jeopardy.','/77iVwo0oBaHRk4sFOBcMCh71xlr.jpg','2015-06-05',100,'Released','No one is above the law.','Wild Horses',324333,3.0341,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40489,_binary '\0','/aVRftyaWV96LtWKwZ4SonTgBxtY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4442604',6.6,1429,'en','Donald Cried','Returning home to working class Warwick, Rhode Island, Peter Latang encounters childhood friend Donald Treebeck for what starts as a simple favor and turns into a long van ride into two friends past.','/ew6S4JzNPO14g6ATb7uDQiOtTvt.jpg','2017-03-03',85,'Released','Some people can take a hint. And some people are Donald.','Donald Cried',381009,1.5904,6.3,'RCIn6eYUwK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40490,_binary '\0','/hFybK0MfGhHkkavMLV5AdDr7umO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4442758',7.4,8922,'te','టెంపర్','Daya is a corrupt cop who joins hands with the local don. When Daya\'s girlfriend gets kidnapped, it triggers Daya to go against Vasu and his empire, leading him to uncover a bigger motive behind the kidnapping.','/hA793thpccdoAHSOZ5GNbtdSQlC.jpg','2015-02-13',147,'Released',NULL,'Temper',325699,1.9681,6.457,'SQgRN5tu1f4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40491,_binary '\0','/r7RdSJWKeqgQ6ZsxM08d2xRoKor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4443658',6.5,53284,'en','Better Watch Out','On a quiet suburban street tucked within a \'safe neighborhood\', a babysitter must defend a twelve-year-old boy from strangers breaking into the house, only to discover that this is far from a normal home invasion.','/liI4c3GYaKuAo4FsCF4RKvFFqbV.jpg','2017-10-06',89,'Released','You might be home but you\'re not alone.','Better Watch Out',406994,5.9961,6.649,'J-NDfv6Vx7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40492,_binary '\0','/8uofqUSp83cRsZ4GAKy00lAxqHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4443784',3,1407,'en','Roboshark','What starts off as a typical day on the streets of Seattle soon becomes a terrifying bloodbath, when a great white shark devours an alien space probe…and ROBOSHARK is born. The U.S. military comes after it with guns blazing, but it’s the power of social media that puts an ambitious newscaster and her tech-savvy daughter ahead of everyone else in the race to stop the destruction.','/w9odZRm3gk2NEhuhX0eoYGzhQ0J.jpg','2015-07-23',87,'Released','IT\'S A HYBRID OF HORROR.','Roboshark',349135,1.2567,3.7,'BHDDN6Pi6ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40493,_binary '\0','/z0wG7DxTwiIXaVMyf4cRWmSJ5Ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4444438',6.6,3399,'en','As You Are','Set in the early 1990s, \"As You Are\" is the telling and retelling of a relationship between three teenagers as it traces the course of their friendship through a construction of disparate memories prompted by a police investigation.','/44IZLl6wD8aI8HXbJLqiMqEFtph.jpg','2016-12-08',110,'Released',NULL,'As You Are',371445,1.9433,6.914,'fkVe4fEn7W0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40494,_binary '\0','/prwUcE8aw8GXSXUUvqu2UYFWfyM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4444762',5,1423,'de','Heimatland','An apocalyptical storm threatens to wipe out an entire country. A state of emergency is raised while mayhem breaks out.','/1WL0wAjiMtm7iG7XBAntNjHcaYP.jpg','2016-07-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Wonderland',367584,1.1286,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40495,_binary '\0','/hAfGwwnugpeFHa7QmVgySLy34Hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4444956',5.2,8478,'en','Once Upon a Time in London','Billy Hill and Jack \'Spot\' Comer were among the most notorious criminals in London up until the 1950s. Dramatising the violent reign of two of London\'s most notorious gangsters, Billy Hill (Leo Gregory) and Jack \'Spot\' Comer (Terry Stone), ONCE UPON A TIME IN LONDON charts the legendary rise and fall of a nationwide criminal empire that lasted until the mid-fifties and which paved the way for the notorious Kray Twins and The Richardsons. This is the story of their rise and fall.','/8q0XUs50t12CP9Movhb5SkzBPpI.jpg','2019-04-19',111,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in London',468339,2.3574,5.3,'rO-l5p0RXz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40496,_binary '\0','/c2geGSk3h5VKRFeSdgSZi4AyOgM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4446258',5.8,1672,'ta','ரோமியோ ஜூலியட்','Aishwarya, an air hostess, wants to marry a millionaire, but mistakes Karthik, a gym trainer, for a rich guy and woos him. She calls off the romance when she discovers that he isn\'t well off, but Karthik will not let her leave that easily.','/3KOmLC3hDwEt0JLjrMqErCiCxyr.jpg','2015-06-12',151,'Released',NULL,'Romeo Juliet',280942,1.1232,5.925,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40497,_binary '\0','/2gqKjG8gjE5nV487ruz1tXZRgVs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4446318',7.6,1585,'ta','ராஜதந்திரம்','Three small-time criminals take up an offer to rob one of the biggest jewellery shops in the city. Will they be successful in their attempt, given that the store\'s owner, a ruthless man, is aware of the plan?','/lleQVSqodyrV0EXPwTlwNeE699y.jpg','2015-03-13',135,'Released',NULL,'Rajathandhiram',330399,1.3137,6.889,'NlI3H_udS6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40498,_binary '\0','/5Fo0SnaEAI8OmzQk0HH0w30RW8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4446472',6,2464,'en','Porto','Jake and Mati are two outsiders in the northerly Portuguese city of Porto who once experienced a brief connection. A mystery remains about the moments they shared, and in searching through memories, they relive the depths of a night uninhibited by the consequences of time.','/2jsNrAJx3z1uzrw4Jg1XIvOl7Cv.jpg','2017-07-27',75,'Released',NULL,'Porto',374471,1.2981,5.6,'-3T78VfGyes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40499,_binary '\0','/y1yuiUaCqVaLoWQz6dAXDrd97Je.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4447076',6.8,1447,'fr','Rosalie Blum','Vincent Machot knows his life by heart. He shares it between his hair dressing salon, his cousin, his cat, and his too-invasive mother. But life sometimes holds surprises, even for the most prudent of people... He crosses paths with Rosalie Blum by accident. She is a mysterious and solitary woman whom he is sure he has already met. But where? Intrigued, he decides to follow her everywhere, in the hope of knowing more about her.','/pqOu8C8puyyrpUSv943Rxk3Htx1.jpg','2016-03-23',97,'Released',NULL,'Rosalie Blum',381353,1.4076,6.4,'1tqhxFfjFxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40500,_binary '\0','/av6vU407JIDYTsHVHVd24rngVQy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4447108',4.5,1442,'en','Level Up','Gamers enter virtual reality video game contest for money only to realize things are not the way they seem.','/fJWrGdHbiKZj132Ksq5JKa60bsM.jpg','2016-08-26',84,'Released','One Life Remaining','Level Up',403434,1.7082,4.9,'Hnc77KF87ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40501,_binary '\0','/1X8BeHlDB8rEyiyRkjD8DAHlwQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4448304',5.7,1312,'en','Liar, Liar, Vampire','When ordinary boy Davis suddenly becomes famous at school as people start to believe he\'s actually a vampire, vampire expert Cameron helps him act like a real vampire.','/nCVQCntHI0f8QdgFzS8OMA2ys1H.jpg','2015-10-12',66,'Released','Will they fool the school?','Liar, Liar, Vampire',363807,2.7974,6.9,'SpinCcd6u7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40502,_binary '\0','/94JL7EYGjhQpKAkFgpMVxft54ge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4449576',7.9,3734,'fr','Demain','Climate is changing. Instead of showing all the worst that can happen, this documentary focuses on the people suggesting solutions and their actions.','/h6GBWqZXrZyXwGzY5O4mUc3rAjB.jpg','2015-11-15',118,'Released','All around the world, solutions exist','Tomorrow',371492,3.4159,7.8,'F16SUg83Tlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40503,_binary '\0','/p21Agr3yF2dR2jSmTLbQvNMBgdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4450396',6.6,2993,'en','My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Friendship Games','Canterlot High meets its rival school, Crystal Prep Academy, in a competition that’s a long-standing tradition – The Friendship Games. Sunset Shimmer is tasked with keeping magic out of the games to avoid the appearance of impropriety while she and her friends compete against Crystal Prep’s top students led by someone with an equal amount of interest in Equestrian magic – this world’s TWILIGHT SPARKLE.','/ih6vNDVWAeSYJYoQAk03Gykl1DJ.jpg','2015-10-24',72,'Released',NULL,'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Friendship Games',349158,3.4137,7.5,'gdjgJb0ovxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40504,_binary '\0','/nut9EQcHIJyjuOpAbfdN7rEuXUi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4450706',6.1,5976,'tr','Kocan Kadar Konuş','A traditional Turkish woman tries to find love and is forced by her family members to get married.','/oNVxifvq27gXnN2agCDZePTp1Ay.jpg','2015-03-20',108,'Released',NULL,'Husband Factor',332788,1.1573,5.5,'ErLvd8xpYW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40505,_binary '\0','/40KIc8piqrF1kwM7l8aInuz3aD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4451458',7.5,7098,'es','Poesía sin fin','A portrait of the director’s young adulthood, set in the 1940s–1950s, in the electric capital city of Santiago. There, he decides to become a poet and is introduced, by destiny, into the foremost bohemian and artistic circle of the time.','/iJTWnSa3YOnD15zMME3ox9GP8XA.jpg','2016-03-23',128,'Released',NULL,'Endless Poetry',325385,2.7271,7.4,'suyruCTA2I4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40506,_binary '\0','/qLDNgDuFCAwLTLUXzHmCpQfH79Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4454930',4.3,1776,'en','HoneyBee','A quiet town is jumpstarted by the arrival of an enigmatic family; a statuesque mother named Louisa and her gorgeous teenage sons. Sixteen Year-Old Hilary is working hard to get good grades, hoping to escape the small town life a long line of relatives lived before her. With the arrival of the mysterious family just weeks before school is to let out, life suddenly becomes appealing. Hilary\'s father is instantly charmed by Louisa, while she herself finds a strong connection to middle son Kadin, ignoring her dubious instincts. As the town falls under the hypnotic spell of the young men, no one but Hilary sees the peculiar loyalty that holds them together and the lengths they will go to give their mother what she needs until it\'s far too late.','/7j83sJKfx8EcZsrx8ukeasJpmd3.jpg','2016-06-13',94,'Released',NULL,'HoneyBee',383145,1.6353,3.8,'ivRGjvD9KsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40507,_binary '\0','/2POOiTt4tj8zukpNUeZIlhwymD7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4456270',7,1600,'en','The Sunshine Makers','The story of Nicholas Sand and Tim Scully, the unlikely duo at the heart of 1960s American drug counter-culture. United in a utopian mission to save the planet through the consciousness-raising power of LSD, these underground chemists manufactured a massive amount of acid, including the gold standard for quality LSD, \'Orange Sunshine,\' all while staying one step ahead of the Feds.','/d55zpzt7c2Oai8rKoW0stOVS5NB.jpg','2015-11-01',101,'Released','Two warriors for peace, a vat of chemicals and an LSD cookbook. What could possibly go wrong?','The Sunshine Makers',434336,0.6328,6.8,'OvYPy4LT3fA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40508,_binary '\0','/eWCeRLTavVwPt3uOGUF1ewzwH6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4456850',5.9,5500,'en','Adventures in Babysitting','Two teen rival babysitters, Jenny and Lola, team up to hunt down one of their kids who accidentally ran away into the big city without any supervision.','/t12bYhmv7LIcHT4TGGpW6WaMV2W.jpg','2016-06-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Adventures in Babysitting',360606,4.2567,7.2,'9nIuu8TYBxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40509,_binary '\0','/ptUrbK7OFACnuH6wsmPeVBUv9dN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4456982',4.8,7957,'en','No Deposit','Mickey Ryan falls from grace due to a series of downward spiraling events beyond his control. With his life turned upside down, Mickey tries valiantly to resolve his issues but hooks up with the wrong people who blind him with anger and hate.','/6k5CmLEgclZepGRAEyEfd858DaG.jpg','2015-04-24',80,'Released','Anger and hate are a total eclipse of the soul','No Deposit',334645,1.6579,3,'uuM1i6l-cqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40510,_binary '\0','/xYddV2h5i50iB2jHFGAwS4TLJ7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4457020',7.2,1473,'es','El Jeremías','In Sonora, Mexico. Jeremías, an eight year old, who finds out he is a gifted child initiates a journey of self discovery. When an opportunistic physiologist makes contact with Jeremías, a new world of experiences open up to him but at the expense of being away from the family he loves. Jeremías must choose between this exciting but lonely new world he finds himself in or returning home to his loving family.','/iLJ817Xa8TuZsGRghuPmtkVdV4k.jpg','2016-10-21',98,'Released','What does he want to be when he grows up?','El Jeremías',296867,1.5162,6.867,'e9EIKJZga_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40511,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4457038',5,3012,'en','La Trattoria Sitcom','A comical look at the lives of three grown men who still live with their mother. As a family they decide to open an Italian restaurant. They soon find the restaurant business a challenge full of surprises that create humorous situations. But the Valentinos stick together through all the ups and downs because they are family.',NULL,'2015-06-27',22,'Released',NULL,'La Trattoria Sitcom',1207108,0.9162,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40512,_binary '\0','/hgg4VH9vtujHTh87wI5KIYNSwPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4457344',6.3,10498,'en','Dave Made a Maze','Dave, an artist who has yet to complete anything significant in his career, builds a fort in his living room out of pure frustration, only to wind up trapped by the fantastical pitfalls, booby traps, and critters of his own creation. Ignoring his warnings, Dave’s girlfriend Annie leads a band of oddball explorers on a rescue mission. Once inside, they find themselves trapped in an ever-changing supernatural world, threatened by booby traps and pursued by a bloodthirsty Minotaur.','/f2sMi0iBt44E0M5jmSCaOAnGVZp.jpg','2017-08-18',81,'Released','He thought of everything but a way out.','Dave Made a Maze',433941,3.6212,6.373,'AAvk33B9oo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40513,_binary '\0','/1yuQwmBGJ9rIh4aFEid2x4Y4VTC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4457678',4.5,4475,'en','Blue World Order','After a nuclear war decimated the northern hemisphere, the surviving population in the south become desperate and violent competing for scarce resources. Society crumbles and an infectious bacteria threatens to destroy those who remain. In an attempt to rebuild civilization, a self appointed government called \'The ORDER\' distributed an immunization to the bacteria, via a massive Electro-Macnetic Pulse (EMP). Secretly, the Order also delivered a bio-tech virus through the EMP, giving them the power to control the population. One man remains immune to the Order\'s virus - Jake Slater. Now Jake scavenges the wasteland searching for a way to keep his unconscious daughter alive, unaware she is the last child on Earth, and the key to the survival of mankind.','/bI2vkXvx0z9xw0fYmCaVO4bo05y.jpg','2017-03-03',115,'Released',NULL,'Blue World Order',384545,1.5352,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40514,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4458206',1.7,27568,'tr','Kod Adi K.O.Z.','Political and social processes in recent and current Turkish political history.','/jeqLUvdsZBLvzx5SxYQXafGZm4h.jpg','2015-02-13',114,'Released',NULL,'Code Name K.O.Z.',328345,1.092,1.682,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40515,_binary '\0','/aO93DGGuklxwCPdxprY5Pj18xgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4458368',4.4,1225,'ja','呪怨 ザ・ファイナル','Following the events of Ju-on: The Beginning of the End, Mai, the older sister of elementary schoolteacher Yui Shono, goes to look for her sister, who disappeared after a year while working in an elementary school. Mai soon discovers the Teriyaki household who tells her about what happened to her sister. Mai will now uncover the dark secrets of Ju-on and will try to end the curse once and for all.','/A95Q8XlMK9MsJKJAMbmi4JjMiNj.jpg','2015-06-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Ju-on: The Final Curse',347946,1.8778,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40516,_binary '\0','/xibgD3AwggPzQbXvw3G25Trlm5V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4459134',5.4,1329,'en','Frank and Penelope','A tale of love and violence when a man on his emotional last legs finds a savior seductively dancing in a run-down strip club. And a life most certainly headed off a cliff suddenly becomes redirected - as everything is now worth dying for.','/5NpXoAi3nEQkEgLO09nmotPfyNa.jpg','2022-06-03',112,'Released','Prey for love.','Frank and Penelope',899294,5.9289,7.4,'0p0JHBNjjRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40517,_binary '\0','/oJIve4VPGXt9dpa2WcKOBeFb782.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4459156',7,4104,'de','55 Steps','The inspiring true story of Eleanor Riese, a mental illness patient herself, who brings a class action suit to give competent mental patients the right to have a say in their medication while they\'re in a hospital, and Colette Hughes, the lawyer appointed to her case.','/lZOzJBELeg0c24msieggqWVvjB1.jpg','2018-03-01',115,'Released','Justice is won step by step.','55 Steps',445456,3.6698,6.706,'i0m2Tlbb43c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40518,_binary '\0','/iBSiLRtDVEG01emyZKv2IzdNuH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4460176',7,4019,'en','All of My Heart','A young caterer’s life suddenly changes course when she inherits a country home and learns she must share it with a career obsessed Wall Street trader. At first, these opposites do not attract, but feelings begin to change when they find themselves having to work side-by-side to restore their newly acquired home.','/nCAvpheAApLv9LtvMW0tjywkz6B.jpg','2015-02-14',81,'Released',NULL,'All of My Heart',317121,2.453,6.876,'PkRAkkjd6sA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40519,_binary '\0','/9zf3qNrPrOgy6AqLyty9wFSUqFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4460190',7,1499,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: The Deadly Room','A sleuthing garage sale maven suspects foul play when her friend dies in an old house with a cursed reputation. Even though police evidence - and even webcam footage of the death – point to natural causes – this mysterious death in a cursed” home poised for multi-million dollar sale seems too coincidental. Putting her keen instincts to work, she examines a few key suspects. As she digs into this deadly mystery, she uncovers clues that bring her closer to the truth, and even put her own life in danger.','/xANcH7loLZSJ7UIBgC8IOPLNDir.jpg','2015-04-11',84,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: The Deadly Room',325071,1.8795,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40520,_binary '\0','/gurN4f1nhogNMxBE71C6p0ncrEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4460792',6.8,8698,'en','Calm with Horses','In darkest rural Ireland, ex-boxer Douglas \'Arm\' Armstrong has become the feared enforcer for the drug-dealing Devers family, whilst also trying to be a good father to his autistic five-year-old son, Jack. Torn between these two families, Arm\'s loyalties are truly tested when he is asked to kill for the first time.','/svqlPJDCaKGSRFDk8a3zp19xjwf.jpg','2020-03-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Calm with Horses',574396,3.5644,6.3,'Xbrj1wDl3iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40521,_binary '\0','/eF7MPvR0mlXTDJkNTGwcjCjwDKl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4460800',4.8,9200,'en','The Kitchen','Izi\'s close to escaping The Kitchen, one of London\'s last remaining housing estates. But when young Benji enters his life, he faces some hard decisions.','/tV0hK1BiqYrYlehChv4WJXIWgmZ.jpg','2023-10-15',109,'Released','Strong roots grow in unlikely places','The Kitchen',956262,3.914,4.814,'GgT5cEV5Qt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40522,_binary '\0','/5Sq3jy07hfk8Y6M00EhJrikGA4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4460854',5,1626,'en','Chronically Metropolitan','A case of writer\'s block inspires a young novelist to return home to New York City and reconnect with his engaged ex and his bohemian parents.','/aTodvV3YXQqk1k9x5zOgoq4ywBn.jpg','2016-06-24',86,'Released',NULL,'Chronically Metropolitan',414455,1.6952,5,'8GANy6lZ1X4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40523,_binary '\0','/xnyJF7OawXEIcUKbkpC6KJ6MDbn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4462372',5.6,1633,'en','AWOL','A young woman in the Army must make tough decisions when her love for an older woman causes her to question just where she is going. Adapted from Deb Shoval\'s 2011 short film of the same name.','/lFEJwxiX6sNJ21DHDUJsJHLYi9.jpg','2017-05-19',82,'Released',NULL,'AWOL',356752,1.2874,5.5,'jqKRKw_SyKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40524,_binary '\0','/8K5S5W0te4FJ0GVRHcPYPETWwLA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4463816',5.4,27631,'en','Terminal','In the dark heart of a sprawling, anonymous city, two assassins carry out a sinister mission, a teacher battles a fatal illness, and an enigmatic janitor and a curious waitress lead dangerous double lives. Murderous consequences unravel in the dead of night, as their lives intertwine at the hands of a mysterious criminal mastermind who is hell-bent on revenge.','/xi7pA3lL6Wb78p6Y6PgWoHDMjrM.jpg','2018-05-10',95,'Released','Revenge never looked so good','Terminal',385332,5.4041,5.52,'P1LU_M4qL9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40525,_binary '\0','/hwaYxb8nm7ADQRgUIsqUTsDwgyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4463894',6.4,62849,'en','Shaft','JJ, aka John Shaft Jr., may be a cyber security expert with a degree from MIT, but to uncover the truth behind his best friend’s untimely death, he needs an education only his dad can provide. Absent throughout JJ’s youth, the legendary locked-and-loaded John Shaft agrees to help his progeny navigate Harlem’s heroin-infested underbelly.','/joNpwk3wQXpiv6d2bPemjWj3CBd.jpg','2019-06-14',111,'Released','More Shaft than you can handle.','Shaft',486131,5.3821,6.527,'G3JFXYZNxD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40526,_binary '\0','/3ZsdNB7yBfSICrn7SjFFJmhYq7V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4464394',4.2,3047,'en','The Gracefield Incident','On August 16, 2013, the Supreme Court mandated the CIA to declassify files that had been kept secret for the past 75 years. Visual records of documented paranormal events were released to the public. The following incident took place in Gracefield, Quebec.','/lWZsV3dJfpWlEQG1Yn7GUSmrxdh.jpg','2017-07-21',95,'Released','Some things can\'t be unseen','The Gracefield Incident',327253,1.2862,4.7,'qP7VjuDLAlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40527,_binary '\0','/16aJtXO6lObbBUr11IvkjB1QD1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4465564',4.6,123093,'en','Fifty Shades Darker','When a wounded Christian Grey tries to entice a cautious Ana Steele back into his life, she demands a new arrangement before she will give him another chance. As the two begin to build trust and find stability, shadowy figures from Christian’s past start to circle the couple, determined to destroy their hopes for a future together.','/w3qa274gvca9t8pkUoG8nfQgTU3.jpg','2017-02-08',118,'Released','Every fairy tale has a dark side.','Fifty Shades Darker',341174,14.2192,6.5,'TUnylyz5mqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40528,_binary '\0','/7eaLWxA98VoqtaYIli6DOVURHsm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4465572',6.8,8804,'en','American Woman','A young grandmother in a small Pennsylvania town raises her daughter\'s child after the girl disappears. All the while, a desperate search for her continues.','/jNK6NoDOJIC70abBGFITXcyO88n.jpg','2018-06-07',111,'Released','Never lose hope.','American Woman',339976,3.0648,6.3,'l43skoy-_qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40529,_binary '\0','/fkVNy4cJOQVTelANXu0wh5wQ8hL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466362',5.6,1743,'fr','Connasse, princesse des cœurs','Thirty-year-old Camilla, realizes that she doesn\'t have the life she deserves and decides that the only destiny worthy of her is that of a royal princess.','/9IfGbf7L0ke3QYApCvFgv7POxUq.jpg','2015-04-29',80,'Released',NULL,'The Parisian Bitch',325848,2.1533,5.8,'3ec8j5AaYYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40530,_binary '\0','/dFiyjd2FTjKipUlNMcSe7h8IpOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466490',7.3,6209,'ro','Sieranevada','Back from a professional trip to Paris, a neurologist at the pinnacle of his career has to pick up his wife so that they can attend a family meal to commemorate his father, who died a year before. At his mother\'s flat, the guests are waiting for the priest to arrive while arguing about all kinds of things connected and unconnected with the world’s events and wars.','/q48ZKaoCQg5nVJvfXBRzMTl38Fa.jpg','2016-08-03',173,'Released',NULL,'Sieranevada',374452,1.7276,6.8,'QElR86-l4nI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40531,_binary '\0','/eMg53MAM6XAEK4EZ4hBmuikzzLL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466544',6.5,1587,'fr','Fatima','Fatima, an Algerian-born woman who now lives in France with her two teenage daughters, with whom she is barely able to communicate.','/btzQZUQv2jsJ3M8EDyaSsM7YlBx.jpg','2015-10-07',79,'Released',NULL,'Fatima',336807,1.1892,6.2,'s0qh3K9hYgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40532,_binary '\0','/73tdSfOeMW91kdLdKnbxEcWt2gT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466648',6.3,1440,'bs','Smrt u Sarajevu','Sarajevo on 28 of June, 2014. At the Hotel Europa, the best hotel in town, the manager Omer prepares to welcome a delegation of diplomatic VIPs. On the centenary of the assassination that is considered to have led to World War I, an appeal for peace and understanding is supposed to start from here. But the hotel staff have other worries: having not been paid for months, they are planning to go on strike. Hatidza from the hotel laundry is elected strike leader even though her daughter Lamija, who works in reception, is firmly against industrial action. Meanwhile, in the sealed-off presidential suite, a guest from France rehearses a speech. Elsewhere, a television reporter conducts interviews about war and its consequences. Was Gavrilo Princip, the 1914 assassin, a criminal or a national hero? What long shadow does his deed cast into the present?','/uppKv3dGvMFUJeMAJBzqGVrCjzU.jpg','2016-05-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Death in Sarajevo',377156,1.1723,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40533,_binary '\0','/8evrj3SBDnrWxXExle9z6wvsMT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466864',4.8,3039,'fr','Les Nouvelles Aventures d\'Aladin','A pair of losers working at department store plan to rob the place after it closes. When a bunch of kids show up begging for a story, the men launch into an improvised version of Aladdin.','/el4obM1DT1o4k7xGowuhtrUmW13.jpg','2015-10-14',101,'Released','Action, romance, and lots of magic.','The New Adventures of Aladdin',344268,3.383,4.7,'agKe_7YQzwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40534,_binary '\0','/cVaCZtH5kl0cftYgH3l8j0q54nF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466894',5.5,3516,'fr','Sahara','A young cobra and his scorpion best friend go on a journey across the Sahara desert to save a new-found love.','/4YYaBvush9fAcXdpyowXEXDEbjm.jpg','2017-02-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Sahara',423453,3.2282,5.968,'90EyWL5eTcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40535,_binary '\0','/eLYf7wM4d7amt4p4nb9AnlNrlrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4466936',6.6,7432,'fr','Un peu, beaucoup, aveuglément','He invents puzzles. He’s committed body and soul to his work and needs silence to be able to concentrate. She is an accomplished pianist and can’t live without music. She must prepare for a competition that could change her life. They are going to be forced to coexist without seeing each other.','/7SeDsqYCmCFO7fNTzQ3GFp97sg8.jpg','2015-05-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Blind Date',334878,2.317,6.4,'6F2gaqo3QS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40536,_binary '\0','/vrjYmiCYa5ZcViMHYq73rctvtnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4467202',3.6,3121,'hi','Hero','After meeting the chief of police\'s pretty daughter, a gangster kidnaps the girl. During the journey they fall in love and the gangster decides to set her free.','/esBeEnXx8tSCcGF4DKwwESxsAp8.jpg','2015-09-11',145,'Released','Rebels. Love. Freedom','Hero',358996,1.2374,5.797,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40537,_binary '\0','/kQYMG1FEZjXYsd6GrzLBcPh7TMS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4467262',4.7,3413,'hi','कट्टी बट्टी','A man falls in love with a woman because of her outlook on life. They are in a relationship for five years until a sudden turn of events causes a problem in their relationship.','/3Q2gzibVqJI7Bt6jYELtLfWEdYw.jpg','2015-09-18',138,'Released',NULL,'Katti Batti',330636,1.0561,5.35,'a23GO0NXOtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40538,_binary '\0','/uUDcK4Ao4JVyySHGZH3bDOmaCCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4467626',5.9,4427,'en','Scare Campaign','A popular prank TV show, Scare Campaign, has been entertaining audiences for the last 5 years with its mix of old school scares and hidden camera fun. But as we enter a new age of online TV, the producers find themselves up against a new hard edged web series that makes their show look decidedly quaint. It\'s time to up the ante, but will the team go too far this time, and are they about to prank the wrong guy?','/nX4jNviujO0jn9P4F2w5eUWtoGf.jpg','2016-03-17',76,'Released','Careful Who You Prank','Scare Campaign',370178,2.0244,5.7,'_HgVYJWclDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40539,_binary '\0','/rq63u5290HJ6k42J5Mfi8KNu8Rl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4468634',6.4,17490,'en','Certain Women','Three strong-willed women strive to forge their own paths amidst the wide-open plains of the American Northwest: a lawyer forced to subdue a troubled client; a wife and mother whose plans to construct her dream home reveal fissures in her marriage; and a lonely ranch hand who forms an ambiguous bond with a young law student.','/jIfW4p27B30zSfGCohB2S4cTRz4.jpg','2016-09-25',107,'Released',NULL,'Certain Women',340487,6.2087,6,'F1tozi_ULZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40540,_binary '\0','/kRVUMsXFzhuXjr20JcCGc6TapxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4468740',7.8,116335,'en','Paddington 2','Paddington, now happily settled with the Browns, picks up a series of odd jobs to buy the perfect present for his Aunt Lucy, but it is stolen.','/1OJ9vkD5xPt3skC6KguyXAgagRZ.jpg','2017-11-05',104,'Released','Magic. Mystery. Marmalade.','Paddington 2',346648,12.6864,7.485,'07Um1PY_P4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40541,_binary '\0','/2WyJHm7LWd9tbABn7Gt6LywZDgU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4470266',5.6,3520,'en','Numb','Husband and wife, Will and Dawn, are in financial crisis after learning the job Will was counting on to salvage their financial future has disappeared in the midst of a market collapse. They set out to drive home on the winter highway back to their city, and in a moment of altruism, pick up siblings Lee and Cheryl, a pair of hitchhikers on their way to start a new life. In the midst of the night they nearly collide with an old man wandering on the snowy highway, hyperthermic and horrifically frostbitten. While searching for his ID they discover a wad of cash, a hand drawn map with GPS coordinates, and a single gold coin inside his coat. Will and Dawn reluctantly go along with Lee’s plan to report him to the police as a John Doe and pocket the money. In an attempt to save their financial struggles, all four venture off into the snowy wilderness in search of the buried gold.','/1QeDMwG19nc9UNKpomIzI0aCsQU.jpg','2015-12-06',86,'Released','The only thing more blinding than snow...is greed.','Numb',352364,2.2381,5.4,'m28Z5-rI1BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40542,_binary '\0','/4pHYJwm1jl5qWdaK69MSUJXFXOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4470288',4.2,2928,'en','Abnormal Attraction','In a world where mythical creatures are real, monsters and humans are forced to coexist; and as prejudice and insecurity pulls everyone apart, three separate storylines manage to come together.','/4JuKQfbbzge3Iyk5c6hcIOmeQFD.jpg','2018-03-01',107,'Released','Where it\'s weird to be normal.','Abnormal Attraction',579296,1.4186,4.2,'suJhUxvLUDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40543,_binary '\0','/2Eewgp7o5AU1xCataDmiIL2nYxd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4471908',5.5,8294,'en','Prizefighter: The Life of Jem Belcher','At the turn of the 19th century, Pugilism was the sport of kings and a gifted young boxer fought his way to becoming champion of England.','/x3PIk93PTbxT88ohfeb26L1VpZw.jpg','2022-06-30',106,'Released','The birth of boxing.','Prizefighter: The Life of Jem Belcher',943822,4.6561,6.1,'DSh3j_PtMMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40544,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4472084',5.1,1416,'en','Traffic 2 - Inside Child Protection','A highly controversial sequel from the creators of the original film which was eventually banned by the Judicial system. Featuring interviews from experts who have researched the multi-billion \"child trafficking\" industry, parents who have lost their children to the care system, whistle-blowers within the trade and many shocking secret recordings of UK public employees at work. Traffic 2 highlights what the main stream media is not allowed to cover and what the Local Authority do not want you to see. Welcome to the very dark world of \"Child Protection.\"',NULL,NULL,95,'Released',NULL,'Traffic 2 - Inside Child Protection',443247,0.4447,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40545,_binary '\0','/9tTELw3Pz0sHKMrcXoQZaIehU5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4472596',3.6,2300,'en','The Hollow','It\'s Halloween eve on Shelter Island, and the small town is preparing for a killer storm. But the dark clouds gathering over the island are bringing with them a curse one-hundred years in waiting. As the woods give birth to an ungodly and insatiable creature of fire, bones, and earth, three sisters must scramble to stay alive through the long dark night of the Hollow. For it\'s not something you can kill. It\'s only something you can try and survive.','/v0k9gjdxjrG2vQKxRRrrjStTLiG.jpg','2015-10-24',90,'Released','You cannot kill it, you can only survive it','The Hollow',361042,2.2431,4.7,'HYvp4BkcpcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40546,_binary '\0','/yACIBxj6UasMqnLx79QzbmrPNh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4473370',5.4,1234,'ja','みんな！エスパーだよ！','Shy high schooler Yoshirō and his friends mysteriously develop psychic powers, leading to chaotic and often erotic comedic situations as the virginal ESP teens try to understand their new gifts.','/3JBH43btcgOp283vpi9j24MJrwh.jpg','2015-09-04',115,'Released','We save the world.','The Virgin Psychics',350725,4.0272,5.5,'ntYowWH8W2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40547,_binary '\0','/zeph43b9OoIKM7nt145go53MoOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4475992',3.2,2135,'en','Belly of the Bulldog','With nowhere else to hide, a group of mercenaries and their prisoners take cover inside a long abandoned Bulldog tank. But, while they try to keep the forces outside at bay, the real enemy is already among them, locked inside the \'Belly of the Bulldog\'. After collaborating closely with Ben Wheatley on FREE FIRE, HIGH-RISE, A FIELD IN ENGLAND and KILL LIST, director Nick Gillespie makes his feature debut.','/eyUjNiotZ0uXWdvYC9EYoARjajj.jpg','2015-10-24',84,'Released','There\'s no turning back.','Tank 432',363690,1.9375,3.8,'kEUvT2nozMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40548,_binary '\0','/2OlaeKSohqs8d2yYe2W9ZeP70Uh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4476736',8.4,2637,'en','National Theatre Live: Hamlet','As a country arms itself for war, a family tears itself apart. Forced to avenge his father\'s death but paralyzed by the task ahead, Hamlet rages against the impossibility of his predicament, threatening both his sanity and the security of the state.','/w8Vr3dHGgHIjUGjKgVH2tkMcll6.jpg','2015-10-15',217,'Released',NULL,'National Theatre Live: Hamlet',396227,2.1703,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40549,_binary '\0','/anlGttJ4JYluG98pPptBNvjJRXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4477292',6,7621,'en','Cosmos','Three astronomers accidentally intercept what they believe to be a signal from a distant alien civilization, but the truth is even more incredible than any of them could have imagined.','/kDAr2tO1hfZKeDBunuK6hnBFSPY.jpg','2019-11-08',128,'Released','Only they will hear. Only they will believe.','Cosmos',639771,2.613,5.9,'4j-PzuxcKcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40550,_binary '\0','/9ywA15OAiwjSTvg3cBs9B7kOCBF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4477536',4.6,84654,'en','Fifty Shades Freed','Believing they have left behind shadowy figures from their past, newlyweds Christian and Ana fully embrace an inextricable connection and shared life of luxury. But just as she steps into her role as Mrs. Grey and he relaxes into an unfamiliar stability, new threats could jeopardize their happy ending before it even begins.','/jjPJ4s3DWZZvI4vw8Xfi4Vqa1Q8.jpg','2018-01-17',110,'Released','Don\'t miss the climax.','Fifty Shades Freed',337167,24.9065,6.7,'nJCc5HRPxYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40551,_binary '\0','/feLcWM4lSq4fNSRZomeKVDBBOLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4479380',5.3,23660,'en','SAS: Red Notice','An off-duty SAS soldier, Tom Buckingham, must thwart a terror attack on a train running through the Channel Tunnel. As the action escalates on the train, events transpire in the corridors of power that may make the difference as to whether Buckingham and the civilian passengers make it out of the tunnel alive.','/6Y9fl8tD1xtyUrOHV2MkCYTpzgi.jpg','2021-08-11',120,'Released',NULL,'SAS: Red Notice',595743,8.0496,5.819,'GWSfMde1Sx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40552,_binary '\0','/4RiHhCGwTCWwgDP8FYM33GHC3UA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4480398',3.9,2539,'en','Attack of the Killer Donuts','A chemical accident turns ordinary donuts into blood thirsty killers. Now it\'s up to Johnny, Michelle, and Howard to save their sleepy town from...Killer Donuts.','/jYvWEvt9k2Zn2g5kCjicu51E6Pt.jpg','2016-07-17',98,'Released','We\'ve eaten them for years, now it\'s their turn!','Attack of the Killer Donuts',400649,2.5482,4.1,'M6RBv5vzzTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40553,_binary '\0','/tTFa9eCeaxMAhXzZG6hclGo7bhB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4480494',6.1,1696,'es','La noche que mi madre mató a mi padre','Isabel is torn between the need to feel valued as an actress and her insecurities and contradictions. One night, she hosts a very special dinner: her husband Ángel, who is a scriptwriter, and Susana, Ángel\'s ex-wife and film director, want to convince Argentinian actor Diego Peretti to star in a movie. But at some point something unexpected happens that surprises everyone and disturbs the evening.','/5khUZ1QWNUNd9Ryq56kRbDU1959.jpg','2016-04-29',94,'Released',NULL,'The Night My Mother Killed My Father',367613,1.6378,5.9,'agu_vZjDIiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40554,_binary '\0','/lI67HmQNahD9NV77r06qmIlbn9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4480940',5.7,1773,'en','Angels in the Snow','In Angels in the Snow, the affluent, yet troubled Montgomery family hits the road for a special Christmas in the mountains.','/qmMahviTDwv6uRehlGxWNbTuoOc.jpg','2015-11-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Angels in the Snow',365762,2.4083,6.4,'yT7SWbNlPkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40555,_binary '\0','/FqmgG2cTm9SFuhy6k1FaVV5DxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4481066',7.2,11172,'en','Giant Little Ones','Two popular teen boys, best friends since childhood, discover their lives, families, and girlfriends dramatically upended after an unexpected incident occurs on the night of a 17th birthday party.','/j4U3nFK1JcvfCm9SyBta2g0eTwU.jpg','2019-01-03',93,'Released','Love without labels. Live without regrets.','Giant Little Ones',537681,2.8647,7.1,'G9Sqjsm8urw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40556,_binary '\0','/aH63TQfTFgAT8tYZs0CjDsqfMo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4481414',7.6,162013,'en','Gifted','Frank, a single man raising his child prodigy niece Mary, is drawn into a custody battle with his mother.','/7YB2YrMwIm1g8FyZtlvmVDfRnAT.jpg','2017-04-07',101,'Released','How do you create an ordinary life for an extraordinary girl?','Gifted',400928,13.2783,7.988,'x7CAjpdRaXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40557,_binary '\0','/piRIyhNNSIbAus9oYBRdiOKgnZ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4481514',5.6,51106,'en','The House','When Scott and Kate Johansen’s daughter gets into the college of her dreams it’s cause for celebration. That is, until Scott and Kate learn that the scholarship they were counting on didn’t come through, and they’re now on the hook for tuition they can’t begin to afford. With the help of their friend and neighbor Frank also in need of a major payday they decide to open an illegal casino in his suburban house, risking everything together on a Vegas-style bacchanal where money flows, inhibitions are checked at the door, and all bets are off.','/hkmWkVgirei79bwds23Hr0lWSXS.jpg','2017-06-29',88,'Released','If you can\'t beat the house, be the house.','The House',345914,6.0425,5.6,'bp1-if1rJiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40558,_binary '\0','/fawLymabqlVtuZfVB76jWdP9Dyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4482938',6.9,1437,'nl','Tonio','After 21-year-old student Tonio dies in a traffic accident, his novelist parents face sorrow and regret as they suffer the agony of losing their only child.','/jV1Ytc4s0aWWioWqQvoAQ2ifuIX.jpg','2016-10-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Tonio',411656,0.7883,5.7,'YyOlVdCRmm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40559,_binary '\0','/aup58gdd5xZy85TqXkgewtnb6jU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4483220',5.2,5081,'en','The Funhouse Massacre','Six of the worlds scariest psychopaths escape from a local Asylum and proceed to unleash terror on the unsuspecting crowd of a Halloween Funhouse whose themed mazes are inspired by their various reigns of terror.','/poG8CdJlgSqkJ7JVtcVyeVBAapN.jpg','2015-11-13',90,'Released','Murder is all part of the show','The Funhouse Massacre',363889,2.4211,5.3,'xQ3PCZ6bbkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40560,_binary '\0','/yzSOaCvNfSFlWjsZZn1vT13u9PX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4486148',4.7,1912,'hi','शिमला मिर्ची','While on holiday, Avi meets Naina and falls in love with her. Smitten, he decides to stay and work in her cafe. He confesses his love in a letter, however it\'s Naina\'s mother who mistakenly reads it.','/4dqnJvZpTB1YvuLbgEvBSjxo7BS.jpg','2020-01-03',129,'Released','When write goes wrong.','Shimla Mirchi',455004,1.3711,0,'MvDe9fKyK14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40561,_binary '\0','/azFMUsxP0Dy1ZbVLCsZNZ1IcKqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4486986',5.4,14882,'en','All I See Is You','After a successful experimental surgery restores her eyesight, a young woman sees her marriage spiral in a disturbing direction.','/wc9MgFWuBl3VS72w6VtiZXTgN79.jpg','2017-08-10',110,'Released','An obsessive love story.','All I See Is You',345923,5.799,5.2,'zTTaFg2Sq9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40562,_binary '\0','/A4EYBTiUFUS1av5xb5GDjvouJJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4489416',7.3,7143,'ja','心が叫びたがってるんだ。','A young girl had her voice magically taken away so that she would never hurt people with it, but her outlook changes when she encounters music and friendship. Will Naruse be able to convey the anthem of her heart?','/7bJHM6t6j3YLjDNTwe4hyghKqSr.jpg','2015-09-19',119,'Released','Beautiful word, beautiful world.','The Anthem of the Heart',364111,4.268,7.594,'5yu1K66vEPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40563,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4490762',6.4,1805,'en','Traceroute','Artist and life-long nerd Johannes Grenzfurthner is taking us on a personal road trip from the West Coast to the East Coast of the USA, to introduce us to places and people that shaped and inspired his art and politics. Traceroute wants to chase and question the ghosts of nerddom\'s past, present and future. An exhilarating tour de farce into the guts of trauma, obsession and cognitive capitalism. Features interviews with Matt Winston, Sandy Stone, Bruce Sterling, Jason Scott, Christina Agapakis, Trevor Paglen, Ryan Finnigan, Kit Stubbs, V. Vale, Sean Bonner, Allison Cameron, Josh Ellingson, Maggie Mayhem, Paolo Pedercini, Steve Tolin, Dan Wilcox, Jon Lebkowsky, Jan \"Varka\" Mulders, Adam Flynn, Abie Hadjitarkhani, Kelly Poots...','/oDelXRjk8DBPdmjr5gcXr8ulJBr.jpg','2016-04-28',120,'Released','A Personal Journey Into The Uncharted Depths Of Nerd Culture, A Realm Full Of Dangers, Creatures And More Or Less Precarious Working Conditions','Traceroute',390353,0.7376,6.3,'-Ma6ZhVTbH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40564,_binary '\0','/NOxlVMEOr9GcqVfbMBru72TvMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4494718',6.3,6437,'en','Final Portrait','Paris, 1964. The Swiss sculptor and painter Alberto Giacometti, one of the most accomplished and respected artists of his generation, asks his friend, the American writer James Lord, to sit for a portrait, assuring him that it will take no longer than two or three hours, an afternoon at the most.','/qkzgkapX0cUEdWSJXnqvAZolRzU.jpg','2017-08-03',87,'Released','The search for perfection never ends','Final Portrait',345317,3.0663,6,'TSzSVdfRmD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40565,_binary '\0','/xFYpUmB01nswPgbzi8EOCT1ZYFu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4495098',7.1,138949,'en','Gran Turismo','The ultimate wish-fulfillment tale of a teenage Gran Turismo player whose gaming skills won him a series of Nissan competitions to become an actual professional racecar driver.','/51tqzRtKMMZEYUpSYkrUE7v9ehm.jpg','2023-08-09',135,'Released','From gamer to racer.','Gran Turismo',980489,17.6456,7.692,'GVPzGBvPrzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40566,_binary '\0','/a7tQzNPWNKVoIS4Mxi7dGjN05jV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4497338',5,2021,'en','Interrogation','After the FBI receives a threat that endangers the entire city, an interrogator and an I.T. specialist are plunged into a series of mind games with a criminal mastermind, desperately racing against time to uncover the villain\'s true agenda as they fight to protect thousands of lives.','/49WtQewB8rVORiWFVxOiRsxtFKI.jpg','2016-08-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Interrogation',414719,2.1317,5.8,'cue7lbxIGX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40567,_binary '\0','/wUXZ8KjLreDJPW3RCZTxrgJkb3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4497416',3.2,4530,'en','Lake Placid vs. Anaconda','A giant alligator goes head to head with a giant Anaconda. The town sheriff must find a way to destroy the two monsters before they kill the whole town.','/niqnnjhw5W4J66Psn6GFGreLwes.jpg','2015-04-25',92,'Released','Crocs on the dock. Snakes on the lake.','Lake Placid vs. Anaconda',336560,6.5614,5,'u_AIV9c0FWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40568,_binary '\0','/wtenyFz8VcTkY6gjr3hWtxLBCAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4497686',4.8,1551,'es','Atroz','After they\'re arrested, the horrific crimes of two serial killers are revealed via confiscated videotapes. These tapes contain brutal murders displaying pure human wickedness, the background, paraphilias and psyche of these murderers.','/7x43axWAQjFXGJfp99Ys76YcjGt.jpg','2018-10-26',79,'Released',NULL,'Atrocious',300906,2.249,6.7,'DQU-Bo1oR8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40569,_binary '\0','/d7So2MQFXu0WBCMD3v4zBkDw858.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4499228',4.9,2859,'en','Gehenna: Where Death Lives','A group visits Saipan to search for locations for their company\'s newest resort. As they find what they think is the perfect spot, they discover a hidden bunker on the property which they decide to explore. However, they soon find out that curiosity can kill. As each member faces their most private secrets and the secrets of the bunker itself, the results lead to a most shocking conclusion.','/VLRxwqEIMKQNf4CSdKotNSu86A.jpg','2016-10-06',107,'Released','The Most Shocking Conclusion Awaits You...','Gehenna: Where Death Lives',403283,2.2162,5.1,'8NnnPiNik20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40570,_binary '\0','/pySViZ55m6GtRRxUZG30s7mAb2T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4500734',3.8,1969,'hi','Ek Paheli Leela','It is a reincarnation story about the love between Leela and her lover, which is left incomplete because one of them has been murdered. The story comes to circle after 300 years; when Leela has taken birth as Meera and her lover\'s character is also reborn.','/mW2UYZWtyWstkO8xno99FMlnEB9.jpg','2015-04-10',145,'Released',NULL,'Ek Paheli Leela',334875,1.2671,4.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40571,_binary '\0','/zGCfnZ3bCowMY9So9ZGpsyuOYl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4500922',6.3,196367,'en','Maze Runner: The Death Cure','Thomas leads his group of escaped Gladers on their final and most dangerous mission yet. To save their friends, they must break into the legendary Last City, a WCKD-controlled labyrinth that may turn out to be the deadliest maze of all. Anyone who makes it out alive will get answers to the questions the Gladers have been asking since they first arrived in the maze.','/s8K0US4tUEoOrQ1LDh0eppuwGDx.jpg','2018-01-10',143,'Released','The end will be WCKD.','Maze Runner: The Death Cure',336843,15.9709,7.076,'4-BTxXm8KSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40572,_binary '\0','/zKwpFXBoZa3DZXIctZPpcWJBAmh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4501244',6.2,137050,'en','Why Him?','A dad forms a bitter rivalry with his daughter\'s young rich boyfriend.','/eezFoKz7bXgdbjeieeCYJFXPKSu.jpg','2016-12-22',111,'Released','Of all the guys his daughter could have chosen...','Why Him?',356305,11.5996,6.4,'CO6qLC4cL8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40573,_binary '\0','/9RdDCAdZ8PL2qo6pJGRU1vY0UYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4501268',6.6,16089,'hi','महाराज','Based on a real-life historic court case, a bold journalist questions a revered leader\'s immoral behavior.','/lsuUGtUzrzEnlIUjVRSqFNUMZEz.jpg','2024-06-21',132,'Released',NULL,'Maharaj',1171099,2.3205,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40574,_binary '\0','/cybFHenEWTvppsMTiVd5LduxVni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4501454',6.3,15330,'en','The Meddler','With a new iPhone, an apartment near the Grove, and a comfortable bank account left to her by her beloved late husband, Marnie Minervini has happily relocated from New Jersey to Los Angeles to be near her daughter Lori, a successful (but still single) screenwriter, and smother her with motherly love. But when the dozens of texts, unexpected visits, and conversations dominated by unsolicited advice force Lori to draw strict personal boundaries, Marnie finds ways to channel her eternal optimism and forceful generosity to change the lives of others - as well as her own - and find a new purpose in life.','/rzj9ZSleGgsKkY3q6sDDoAxjSu0.jpg','2016-04-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Meddler',337154,5.1372,6,'Y2KtQz2bhLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40575,_binary '\0','/5QQ4nNfs1ANq12mvRldIzqdhiY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4503598',5.4,15851,'en','Emelie','After their regular babysitter cancels, the Thompson family turns to her friend, Anna to supervise their children while the parents go out to celebrate their anniversary. At first Anna seems like a dream come true to the kids, allowing them to eat extra cookies and play with things that are usually off-limits, but as her behaviour becomes increasingly odd, the kids soon find out that her intentions are dark and twisted—and she is not who she seems to be.','/2HSqJtos2qHVoC00StzNRVpNExe.jpg','2016-03-04',82,'Released','I\'m your new babysitter','Emelie',329010,2.095,5.3,'XZoLut2Ti0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40576,_binary '\0','/fiAajUeBuLK22AIZKwaWLms1npg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4503900',6.3,2084,'en','Thought Crimes','Dubbed “The Cannibal Cop,” former NYPD officer Gilberto Valle was charged with conspiring to kidnap and eat women but argued it was all a fantasy. His story made headlines both for its disturbing details and its potential to kick off a trend of thought-policing across the nation. Featuring intimate interviews with Valle and insights from experts, Thought Crimes explores if someone can be found guilty for their most dangerous thoughts.','/3rUzwQqgJwEp7dlWURW7dHyNISQ.jpg','2015-05-11',81,'Released','Can you be found guilty for your most dangerous thoughts?','Thought Crimes',333382,1.031,6.2,'hyxRLyvGm2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40577,_binary '\0','/crFk9m8DK9lNqlOa7AGTvYsO6Qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4503906',5.9,2885,'ja','ポケモン・ザ・ムービーXY 光輪の超魔神 フーパ','Ash, Pikachu, and their friends come to a desert city by the sea. Here they meet the Mythical Pokémon Hoopa, which has the ability to summon things—including people and Pokémon—through its magic rings. After a scary incident, they learn of a story about a brave hero who stopped the rampage of a terrifying Pokémon long ago. Now, the threat that has been bottled up for years is in danger of breaking loose again.','/6kXRevMC1XSywmxqqRHuBcZlROT.jpg','2015-07-18',73,'Released','A power unbound. A battle of legends.','Pokémon the Movie: Hoopa and the Clash of Ages',350499,5.8024,6.8,'bxTxlKvQFU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40578,_binary '\0','/k27fGtCqjP85cv4RTV2fJDUNDxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4504044',5.9,31687,'en','The Prodigy','A mother concerned about her young son\'s disturbing behavior thinks something supernatural may be affecting him.','/yyejodyk3lWncVjVhhrEkPctY9o.jpg','2019-02-06',92,'Released','What\'s wrong with Miles?','The Prodigy',532671,7.9507,6.2,'BC4cyYRxjFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40579,_binary '\0','/k0JrvNgVugzaxc91Ho3TQQ5wX2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4504438',7.4,2236,'en','Dream/Killer','In 2005, 20-year-old Ryan Ferguson was convicted and sentenced to 40 years in prison for a crime he did not commit. dream/killer is the story of how his father Bill embarked on 10-year campaign to prove Ryan’s innocence. The film is chock-full of incredible characters. From the questionable District Attorney Kevin Crane, and the highly-confused witness Chuck Erickson, to the high-powered Chicago attorney Kathleen Zellner, the doc depicts both a highly flawed justice system, as well as one that can work brilliantly.','/i5n4GgwB2CEUHHmFzpiuAupCJZx.jpg','2015-04-19',107,'Released','Convicted of murder, based on a dream','Dream/Killer',333099,1.1948,6.8,'uAtd-lOvoZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40580,_binary '\0','/fVBFQQPoWCbhJdT9tWtHIifw7ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4505208',6.7,3003,'fr','La Vache','An Algerian man\'s life-long dream finally comes true when he receives an invitation to take his cow Jacqueline to the Paris International Agriculture Fair.','/vkEvayLdaQFO34cPnwjGw9LAr0T.jpg','2016-02-17',91,'Released',NULL,'One Man and his Cow',377799,2.1878,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40581,_binary '\0','/6l2AnSkbutV89LFqqNohXZGvTm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4505260',4.6,3801,'tr','Niyazi Gül Dörtnala','Professor Niyazi Gül is an animal-loving veterinarian who possesses the unique ability to speak with animals. Living a quiet life in İzmir while developing a secret formula with his assistant, Hediye, his world is turned upside down when Sultan and Rıza drag him into a chaotic horse racing scheme.','/3nLAFwuC1w3uHvarpRMwyynp0LW.jpg','2015-05-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Niyazi Gül Dörtnala',340426,1.3444,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40582,_binary '\0','/r3kBahPQWDd4t4DD1hyLGJdkkj2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4505432',5.2,1579,'de','Unsere Zeit ist jetzt','Dawid, Vanessa and Ludwig are the finalists at a pitch-competition for a movie about the German Rap phenomenon CRO. As the three youngsters work out their extraordinary film ideas, they must fight through unexpected personal challenges.','/p8RVrULtKSXBOWW4nXEKxCp30bB.jpg','2016-10-06',118,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Believe the Hype',392346,1.4813,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40583,_binary '\0','/zVxpQ2S1nkDDElRIwjFEwWRXjDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4505666',6.9,2266,'en','Prescription Thugs','Americans consume 75% of the world’s prescription drugs. After losing his own brother to the growing epidemic of prescription drug abuse, documentarian Chris Bell sets out to demystify this insidious addiction. Bell’s examination into the motives of big pharma and doctors in this ever-growing market leads him to meet with experts on the nature of addiction, survivors with first-hand accounts of their struggle, and whistleblowers who testify to the dollar-driven aims of pharmaceutical corporations. Ultimately his investigation will point back to where it all began: his own front door.','/7V6sDOLCNXcqHsqToGDACbK3HGE.jpg','2016-01-22',86,'Released','Is there really a war on drugs?','Prescription Thugs',333375,1.8662,6.4,'anDTez2fVVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40584,_binary '\0','/4xAYXf0seFqQqItJ5qx20w78FlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4505830',7.3,4573,'en','Jesse Stone: Lost in Paradise','Police Chief Jesse Stone now presides over the quiet, seaside village of Paradise, Massachusetts. When the facts don\'t add up in a brutal Boston-area murder case, Jesse opens an investigation filled with surprises, unlikely suspects and grave danger. Though it\'s widely believed the murder was committed by an incarcerated serial killer, Jesse suspects another killer is at large and is hell-bent on bringing him to justice.','/gw5ax5lElk0G1MRDFIQT4V8xUZU.jpg','2015-10-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Jesse Stone: Lost in Paradise',361263,3.3947,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40585,_binary '\0','/hS8dnyPq0kIopLx74KJjSzb6wEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4508712',6.5,2075,'el','Ουζερί Τσιτσάνης','During World War II in Greece, under the submission of Germans, one Christian, Giorgos, falls in love with a Jewish, Estrea, something completely forbidden. Can they and their families overcome all the obstacles, along with racial discriminations and hardship? The story mainly takes place in an ouzeria, in which Tsitsanis works, one of the greatest Greek composer, librettist and singer in the 20th century.','/xrUic9oheDDVhCxxzEgfXTTjhBC.jpg','2015-12-03',112,'Released',NULL,'Ouzeri Tsitsanis',371818,0.8696,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40586,_binary '\0','/eFNG8fCUd8rpaZEVtSMcM6mND4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4508986',6.5,3938,'tr','Senden Bana Kalan','On his 18th birthday, wealthy but spoiled Ozgur(Ekin Koc) gets a surprise from his deceased grandfather\'s will. He has to leave his luxurious life in Istanbul and graduate from a public school in a small village on the Aegean coast. After falling for Elif(Neslihan Atagul), a secretive classmate, Ozgur begins to understand the importance of this tiny and seemingly trivial village.Adapted from the South Korean romantic drama, \'A Millionaire\'s First Love\'.','/2PNN0GdTjfz3dHlPwvgZIBS0ooC.jpg','2015-04-17',116,'Released',NULL,'What\'s Left of You',338924,1.7424,7.3,'QObRGAmcql4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40587,_binary '\0','/rgzN7PXYGxHj3MmxSjHV9wSpnTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4509840',3.4,1599,'en','The Rift','The satellite has vanished and the only clue is a trail leading to a small village nestled on the outskirts of forest line. As the team begins to investigate they quickly discover that something else came back from space, something not of this world. As their time runs out, the team must battle to unlock the terrifying truth behind the ill-fated mission.','/x9afKy5myZgCj7MdAbnh78jpLkG.jpg','2016-04-28',90,'Released','Death is dead','The Rift',386172,1.35,3.6,'mHeRUF0E9O4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40588,_binary '\0','/eykpPHuG4lNeIYEJ6gBz5rxYjou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4510398',4.1,2498,'en','4Got10','Brian Barnes (Johnny Messner) wakes up in the desert wounded and with no memory and no idea why he\'s surrounded by eight bodies, a van with four million in cash and a van full of cocaine. Brian is pursued by not only notorious drug lord Danny Perez (Danny Trejo) who desperately want his money back, and DEA Agent Rooker (Dolph Lundgren), but also a by the corrupt Sheriff Olson (Michael Pare) who will stop at nothing to get his hand on the new found fortune. On the run, Brian discovers the more he remembers the less he wants to know about who he really is.','/A8UEl6UEg8ZgXJ5ZJpPcjfzggkz.jpg','2015-09-11',141,'Released','The good, the bad, and the dead.','4Got10',362046,2.0303,5.2,'LxyrtTJb0ak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40589,_binary '\0','/1jSXnWo7Nyh264EyxsUrZz3vqWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4511200',6.5,7661,'de','Manifesto','An edited version of Rosefeldt\'s installation work of the same name, Manifesto is an outstanding tribute to various (art) manifestos of the nineteenth and twentieth century, ranging from Communism to Dogme, in connection with thirteen different characters, including a homeless man, a factory worker and a corporate CEO, who are all played by Cate Blanchett. A striking humorous audio-visual experience.','/eszm6c7GxD0ztbRQpqkG04P8iui.jpg','2017-05-10',98,'Released','ALL CURRENT ART IS FAKE','Manifesto',382127,2.8057,6.773,'fXHJs8DypZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40590,_binary '\0','/HWM06N7na7bM5qnnHJUitUgxoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4511460',7.1,2224,'ml','ആട്','Triumph in a local Tug-of-war tourney gifted Shaji Pappan and his gang, a cute but naughty little goat \'Pinky\'. Their attempts to dump the goat, unknowingly, interrupts few groups of smugglers, who are in race for the \'Neelakodiveli\'.','/dP1Xoc3X76Q97OUCpQTN9hftUST.jpg','2015-02-06',141,'Released','Oru Bheegara Jeevi Aanu','Aadu',326282,1.7449,6.85,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40591,_binary '\0','/lXqEHxM2x6u9jlwT1byMS8QJkln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4511566',3.3,2625,'en','Navy Seals vs. Zombies','A team of highly skilled Navy SEALS find themselves embarking on the battle of their lives when they come face-to-face with the undead. After a deadly outbreak occurs in New Orleans, the SEALS must fight for their lives, and the city, against an army of zombies.','/oTvwjUMXjeKxAXY2Cggy5DZweMn.jpg','2016-03-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Navy Seals vs. Zombies',361159,2.9563,5.1,'l65kXubSkBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40592,_binary '\0','/4MLjm9ghDgx2cccqdKDRhBla9VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4513316',6.7,5992,'en','Novitiate','In the early 1960s, during the Vatican II era, a young woman training to become a nun struggles with issues of faith, sexuality and the changing church.','/ntsyazWKclgwObVftWVVAEBcvRq.jpg','2017-10-27',123,'Released',NULL,'Novitiate',411976,4.1072,6.5,'8kKexutLfE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40593,_binary '\0','/p0pqnu9URsFzYwo55QbS3bfAamU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4513674',6.6,85263,'en','Café Society','The story of a young man who arrives in Hollywood during the 1930s hoping to work in the film industry, falls in love, and finds himself swept up in the vibrant café society that defined the spirit of the age.','/q9fohCRpQ7m8OTyi82fxa3B86te.jpg','2016-05-11',97,'Released','Anyone who is anyone will be seen at Café Society.','Café Society',339397,6.8605,6.4,'4NRQPTE2Y-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40594,_binary '\0','/EnDlndEvw6Ptpp8HIwmRcSSNKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4513678',7,243447,'en','Ghostbusters: Afterlife','When single mom Callie and her two kids Trevor and Phoebe arrive in a small Oklahoma town, they begin to discover their connection to the original Ghostbusters and the secret legacy their grandfather left behind.','/sg4xJaufDiQl7caFEskBtQXfD4x.jpg','2021-11-18',124,'Released','Discover the past. Save the future.','Ghostbusters: Afterlife',425909,19.2482,7.301,'G_ua10EMbSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40595,_binary '\0','/dFWpEJP085Snh3O0kKP0bCC65RA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4515070',7.5,3687,'te','ఎవడే సుబ్రమణ్యం','A corporate man who sets out on a journey of self-discovery and heads to the Himalayas.','/tyR4gGikluyrYPeHTtkA0UuRIQa.jpg','2015-03-21',160,'Released',NULL,'Yavade Subramanyam',332831,1.6612,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40596,_binary '\0','/tmsfABTLoVmSIrieQ61haVu7J1t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4515684',6.7,3344,'ro','Comoara','Costi is a family man whose cash-strapped neighbor makes him an intriguing proposition: help him find the fortune reportedly buried somewhere on the grounds of his family’s country home in Romania and split the profits.','/1tdjQwf2lnViMSAmh6ZqNs8owLa.jpg','2015-12-03',89,'Released',NULL,'The Treasure',334924,1.2482,6.3,'ot_EibshNo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40597,_binary '\0','/k2EaHqkJB5u40akY8EG2Prf7ZbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4515762',5.4,2061,'en','Another WolfCop','An alcoholic cop experiences blackouts and starts turning into a werewolf when the full moon appears in the sky.','/amvOMZgMGCg7sxScBJZOFdirlqD.jpg','2017-12-01',82,'Released','The hairy arm of the law.','Another WolfCop',346652,2.7765,5.6,'PQSWV1psH2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40598,_binary '\0','/aZlTqqHgV3JOsXayMV11YIk2F0U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4516040',5.2,3384,'en','Benji the Dove','A tender tale of four boys rapidly coming to terms with school, bullies, friendship and loyalty. Based on the critically acclaimed Icelandic children’s book by Fridrik Erlingsson.','/xmEYgWWoHusRKFu713hnpLq554Q.jpg','2017-07-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Benji the Dove',719013,1.4807,5,'pmbjDsBHcGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40599,_binary '\0','/rklZURN3r1M7CcmtDISjzWsCWrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4516162',7,8815,'it','Martin Eden','The tale of an individualist proletarian in a time marked by the rise of mass political movements. In early 20th-century Italy, illiterate sailor Martin Eden seeks fame as a writer while torn between the love of a bourgeois girl and allegiance to his social class.','/3lkrx1xQI4tOuvug4zZURKxQfet.jpg','2019-09-04',129,'Released',NULL,'Martin Eden',582873,3.5594,6.991,'66f3BFtAmZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40600,_binary '\0','/r4AdG25KFnUHLChYbGDJfUxoov7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4516352',4.1,1918,'en','Bethany','Claire and her husband find themselves moving back into Claire\'s childhood home only to have the abusive and traumatic memories of her mother come back to haunt her. As her husband starts to get more work, Claire finds herself mixed up in a fog of past and present with a mysterious figure haunting her memories. What is this small figure that is trying to reach out to her, and what does it want?','/5Ohl5ebLGtzMezOqYTOVbdMXQWy.jpg','2017-04-07',90,'Released',NULL,'Bethany',444109,1.7867,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40601,_binary '\0','/nucX6dbVV3aWJk16rUCMbZXYQSU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4518234',7.5,2206,'tr','Kalandar Soğuğu','Mehmet is a man living with his family in a mountain village in the Black Sea region. He earns his living by breeding a few animals, while passionately looking for a mineral reserve on the mountains, but his pursuit is seen useless by his family. Devastated by vain efforts, his hope is renewed with a competition. Mehmet will attend the bull fight held in Artvin, but he returns from Artvin completely lost, once again. This simple story pictures the naive portrait of a touching life, a life struggle in hardship and the relationship between nature, animals and human beings.','/94eZ1ox44Y6MY3Ku9XEcriI3l22.jpg','2016-09-16',138,'Released',NULL,'Cold of Kalandar',400812,2.1785,7.212,'X69BX4OoiNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40602,_binary '\0','/26IcEYINAatfk7aDzJlCw5a80UB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4518260',5.3,1694,'en','Albion: The Enchanted Stallion','A twelve-year-old girl is transported by a magical black stallion to the mystical world of Albion, where she discovers that she alone is the key to saving an entire race of people.','/8icK5oiUXbzOmYewdZ2ErufD81w.jpg','2016-05-01',120,'Released','An ordinary girl. An extraordinary journey.','Albion: The Enchanted Stallion',450509,2.6485,5.7,'_ha1ktlnuio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40603,_binary '\0','/aRSk4nWAlSuabUTqtMO5tPpgYoD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4519006',6.3,3696,'en','Abandoned','In 1989 the trimaran Rose Noelle set sail from Picton, New Zealand, bound for Tonga with four crew. After a freak wave capsized the yacht, they drifted for 119 days before landing on Great Barrier Island.','/9iUsETntqb2hCZnM5wwlH0IWZ8Y.jpg','2016-03-02',86,'Released','Sea of Terror','Abandoned',356987,2.528,5.9,'etP3e_oNF-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40604,_binary '\0','/eRQ0q3T4MJfQc433Swn5SwXOm87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4519400',3.2,1259,'en','Check Point','In Port City, North Carolina, a vagrant discovers plans for an invasion. His attempts to warn law enforcement are ignored but when the Sheriff notices odd interactions with other townsfolk, he begins to look into the claim of a sleeper cell living amongst the locals.','/wVeCqZYoAq8SK0CtDxERo2Ze9co.jpg','2017-03-07',97,'Released','Run. Hide. Or Fight.','Check Point',442094,2.125,6.1,'GtsE7JsQwOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40605,_binary '\0','/dGBtcFm7cSWzmAl4eLtVfG2GylE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4519488',7.3,1325,'en','မုဒြာရဲ့ခေါ်သံ','When US-raised Jaden returns to his birthplace Myanmar, to search for his roots, he discovers a shocking truth, a new love and ultimately a possible future in his homeland.','/jZE5aOFwXxjEAQjrjbXDL3XWO6l.jpg','2018-03-16',95,'Released','He returns to find his roots but the truth changes everything','Mudras Calling',511442,0.9222,10,'abplnDyLohY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40606,_binary '\0','/qItGkEGWBTF7lvkiNK8GXGRe7Vr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4519742',5.7,2291,'tr','Mandıra Filozofu: İstanbul','Mustafali is a man liberated from all ambitions, living in Çökertme Cove, keeping to his own life style. But due to the sickness of his father, who had left him and his mother years ago, he had to come to Istanbul. Mustafali\'s philosophy will perplex Istanbul, a city that had been living happily with its own truths before Mustafali came along.','/yznUWtDszMkvDTeUg7QKuRMcmjE.jpg','2015-03-13',109,'Released',NULL,'Mandıra Filozofu: İstanbul',343739,0.8875,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40607,_binary '\0','/qmUZk1xbMXlg7QyKmGLFF42Z268.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4520340',4.8,1439,'en','Last Girl Standing','She survived a brutal massacre, but lost her life. What happens to the final girl once the credits have rolled? Five years ago, a masked killer brutally murdered a group of friends. Since then, Camryn, the lone survivor, has tried to make sense of the homicidal events and struggled to reclaim her shattered life. Wracked with guilt and paranoia, can Camryn ever have a normal existence again or is she destined to cope alone forever? Part slasher movie, part character study, take a penetrating and intimate look at what happens to the remaining true victim of every horror movie.','/mBAHzXTewsqTmr73KeYEc3C5YQ9.jpg','2015-08-31',91,'Released','What happens after the horror movie?','Last Girl Standing',347848,1.3901,5,'qv8jWvgxnpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40608,_binary '\0','/uub6fTaLGatAvbXHYVn3yZOgedb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4520364',5.9,50137,'en','Morgan','A corporate risk-management consultant must determine whether or not to terminate an artificial being\'s life that was made in a laboratory environment.','/iqEFG5ldyeLIFPp7mMI7ZmS7Upm.jpg','2016-09-01',92,'Released','Don\'t let it out','Morgan',377264,6.0414,5.8,'rqmHSR0bFU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40609,_binary '\0','/AoSZyb37ljMAxw0RdeQEBHKtgcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4520988',6.8,223652,'en','Frozen II','Elsa, Anna, Kristoff and Olaf head far into the forest to learn the truth about an ancient mystery of their kingdom.','/mINJaa34MtknCYl5AjtNJzWj8cD.jpg','2019-11-20',103,'Released','The past is not what it seems.','Frozen II',330457,30.335,7.223,'-o8JGxdEKIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40610,_binary '\0','/lGEQgPswUFSTvJfb9WCfNSCTiFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4522922',5.4,1348,'en','Tales from the Lodge','Tales From The Lodge is a fresh take on the portmanteau horror-comedy genre. An isolated lodge somewhere in England. Five old university pals, now nudging 40, gather for a weekend to scatter the ashes of their friend, Jonesy, who drowned himself in the lake three years earlier. They settle in for a fun evening, entertaining each other with stories of murders, ghosts, zombies and possessions, but as day turns to night, the gang become aware of another horror story unfolding around them - And this one is real.','/mQUIAwsebsOEq7CR8KUfM8HP9ft.jpg','2019-03-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Tales from the Lodge',580633,1.7548,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40611,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4523112',7.1,4218,'tr','Selam: Bahara Yolculuk','Follows a young teacher from Turkey whose goal is to establish a school in Kyrgyzstan.','/jBuUpkYV8ZxHfT42FCVkLfQ9vL2.jpg','2015-03-13',126,'Released','We are seeking a good death not a good life.','Selam: Bahara Yolculuk',330999,0.9891,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40612,_binary '\0','/dThAjrzpodn7ECrmuVWgRjIdAXO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4523530',4.6,1289,'en','Valley of the Gods','A mix of fantasy and sci-fi, the film entwines Navajo lore with a reclusive trillionaire and his would-be biographer, creating a fascinating, mysterious and idiosyncratic vision of America.','/fupAqM723ApKgjDPhM2TYCPYLHp.jpg','2020-09-17',131,'Released',NULL,'Valley of the Gods',331044,3.3314,5.2,'hROwySjzLj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40613,_binary '\0','/keWxkQoYWeEINYbdI8rye4oHCbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4523910',6.8,4502,'es','Chicuarotes','Cagalera and Moloteco are two teenagers from San Gregorio Atlapulco who are desperate to get out and move up and away from oppressive circumstances. When they hear of an opportunity to buy a spot in the electrician’s union, which could transform their lives, they quickly devolve into the criminal, adult underworld of Mexico City in a bid to buy their freedom.','/vN43s4gcqANLuVn5ImuTyb673iz.jpg','2019-06-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Chicuarotes',571391,1.7402,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40614,_binary '\0','/4drwEjJXxGmGSOJwjCnwVBrUU6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4524418',3.9,1330,'en','Warfighter','Rusty Wittenburg is a Navy SEAL struggling to balance his family life and his job. He fights daily to maintain the line between reality and the nightmares his PTSD conjures up for him. Dedicated to his team and his mission, he is willing to give the ultimate sacrifice for his fellow brothers and teammates.','/7h9pn5dDOYAkJ3DhttkcXIoWIux.jpg','2018-06-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Warfighter',486606,1.3888,4.7,'LxhMvO05JdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40615,_binary '\0','/pO6Jh1vtj5GBIeV0xNFaPxtnC3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4525270',4.1,1378,'en','Stormageddon','What happens when you ask the most powerful computer program, run by the most powerful computers, to follow, listen and predict human behavior? The program learns, becomes sentient and begins to behave like a human. When a master computer program, Echelon, takes over America\'s entire online system, our country is threatened to be brought to its knees. Hacking into DARPA, Echelon gains the ability to manipulate the weather, create earthquakes, and cause a level of destruction unlike anything the country could ever imagine. But how do you stop a computer program when it has control over any and every defense you have?','/loZHFn4RoTeh4t1I4hS01DRYF7q.jpg','2015-11-18',90,'Released','The Echelon Disaster','Stormageddon',370097,2.473,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40616,_binary '\0','/pr1TtTQQnGU1VKdCFsKTbotOADh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4526546',5.4,5252,'en','Edge of Winter','When two brothers are stranded by a brutal winter storm with an unpredictable father they barely know, the boys begin to suspect their supposed protector may be their biggest threat.','/mgvdyOJV1Xv6XzhENFphtyW9XVV.jpg','2016-07-31',89,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than a father\'s love.','Edge of Winter',402446,2.3237,5.8,'_El-zhWD3io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40617,_binary '\0','/8dH1LJKGR6Q7KTxJPB04UUqgmsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4526950',6,2304,'en','Perfect Match','When an engaged couple can’t agree on anything, the mother of the groom hires a wedding planner and an event planner to help put together the wedding of their dreams. The two planners are as different as night and day, but as they too learn to compromise, they discover opposites do indeed attract and can combine to produce incredible results!','/sBdSYs5IVVigcoFPImFopbQO9c4.jpg','2015-06-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Match',344123,1.9621,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40618,_binary '\0','/10wHo9VmDvBW9wtSZ26bgjm9GKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4530422',6.6,117832,'en','Overlord','On the eve of D-Day, a team of American paratroopers crash behind enemy lines and come face-to-face with a Nazi threat unlike any the world has ever seen.','/l76Rgp32z2UxjULApxGXAPpYdAP.jpg','2018-11-01',110,'Released','Stop the unstoppable.','Overlord',438799,9.0974,6.7,'USPd0vX2sdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40619,_binary '\0','/ts2CQBbdPYRoq7yTovmDoRw7sTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4530884',5.1,18040,'en','I Spit on Your Grave III: Vengeance Is Mine','Jennifer Hills is still tormented by the brutal sexual assault she endured years ago. She’s changed identities and cities, reluctantly joining a support group where she begins to piece together a new life. But when her new friend’s murderer goes free and the tales of serial rapists haunt her, Jennifer will hunt down the men responsible and do what the system won’t – make them pay for their crimes in the most horrific ways imaginable. Only this time, no jury may be able to save her.','/qosIFCddpZjoMdsrkcQWB4UGm3o.jpg','2015-10-01',91,'Released','This time it gets even more brutal.','I Spit on Your Grave III: Vengeance Is Mine',357096,7.0661,5.8,'rKfwJtXXMkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40620,_binary '\0','/2APnLMsz8Vg5SNGwCMV3seVbW7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4531694',4.8,2146,'fr','Pattaya','Franky and Krimo dream of leaving the grey grime of their neighborhood behind and of traveling to the famous and diabolical Thai beach resort of Pattaya. To get there cheaply, the two friends have the crazy idea of registering, unbeknownst to him, the local little person for the Thai Dwarf Boxing World Championship. But what was supposed to be a dream vacation will transform into the most insane and dangerous adventure of their lives.','/w6KJ8OwoP7CbsDgxKnaRfIMm6Yc.jpg','2016-02-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Good Guys Go to Heaven, Bad Guys Go to Pattaya',277839,1.8582,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40621,_binary '\0','/a9jZrU7LJk6mAUjmkbEmTiC52l0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4532038',5.7,28666,'en','The War with Grandpa','Peter is thrilled that his Grandpa is coming to live with his family. That is, until Grandpa moves into Peter\'s room, forcing him upstairs into the creepy attic. And though he loves his Grandpa, he wants his room back - so he has no choice but to declare war.','/ltyARDw2EFXZ2H2ERnlEctXPioP.jpg','2020-08-27',98,'Released','Old school vs new cool.','The War with Grandpa',425001,9.3458,6.4,'U18vQk1n4tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40622,_binary '\0','/f1YWapMqpX0rzndBUoqDaZGPYn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4532404',5.5,1877,'en','Marching to Zion','Documentary tracing the history of the Jewish people from the destruction of the temple in AD 70 to the modern-day nation of Israel. Through scriptural and historical evidence, DNA, mathematics, and testimony from rabbis and pastors, it attempts to answer the question, \"Who are God\'s chosen people?\".','/hmRylXn8dNesf94Uuyj8APpuciX.jpg','2015-03-26',101,'Released','In thee shall all nations be blessed','Marching to Zion',346873,0.6322,5.2,'zyEybulIwKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40623,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4532764',6.8,2909,'fa','رخ دیوانه','The story of a young friends who met on the Internet and a fun way to bet on a complex and daunting fall. The path to a new understanding of life and society for Each of them.','/9IajFiB1ieRXMAQDGZR3Os8PJ8V.jpg','2015-03-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Crazy Rook',370838,0.996,6.1,'lXUeFobUbZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40624,_binary '\0','/2TUh3DOVEkL0GiOoKNVagjjHOAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4532818',6.7,1618,'en','Sophie and the Rising Sun','In a small Southern town in the autumn of 1941, Sophie’s lonely life is transformed when an Asian man arrives under mysterious circumstances. Their love affair becomes the lightning rod for long-buried conflicts that erupt in bigotry and violence with the outbreak of World War ll.','/csvqNng0vpRdEgE06aLuq44i3G9.jpg','2016-01-27',116,'Released',NULL,'Sophie and the Rising Sun',371743,2.3434,6.7,'E5nSoWkT8Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40625,_binary '\0','/9KKT8qPAII0VJMpviThOTMLN0Wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4532826',5.4,87573,'en','Robin Hood','A war-hardened Crusader and his Moorish commander mount an audacious revolt against the corrupt English crown.','/AiRfixFcfTkNbn2A73qVJPlpkUo.jpg','2018-11-03',116,'Released','The legend you know. The story you don’t.','Robin Hood',375588,12.8236,5.9,'ne7eStct3Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40626,_binary '\0','/axCqDdiznyQxmTO2hjYjDPYHZvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4535650',5.1,42529,'hi','दिलवाले','Raj is a Mafia member. One day he meet a girl (Meera) while chasing by his rival gang and falls in love with her. Later he finds out that this girl is the daughter of the leader of his rival gang. Yet their love story continues until he was shot by his girlfriend upon a deep misunderstanding. After that incident these two lovers lives separate until their siblings fallen in love. With this new love story their paths intertwines again.','/pYgPu6hhOr61knwbestTx4vSdMb.jpg','2015-12-18',158,'Released',NULL,'Dilwale',370665,3.1037,6.6,'AHuOo1DLcRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40627,_binary '\0','/fhRYE1ndGmKtnb00R9ZMolngcU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4536768',5.5,9838,'en','Science Fiction Volume One: The Osiris Child','Set in the future in a time of interplanetary colonization, an unlikely pair race against an impending global crisis and are confronted by the monsters that live inside us all.','/3sx69bH2n2tgvknvq2VROJ6lEXS.jpg','2016-02-17',95,'Released',NULL,'Science Fiction Volume One: The Osiris Child',354282,6.6276,5.6,'lXy5GTk7_c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40628,_binary '\0','/lpByVKyDvEaMJAFn7cADocSZJ7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4537888',4.5,4113,'en','The Monster Project','A group of aspiring filmmakers interview three individuals who claim to be monsters. However, unique incidents start to occur when they start filming.','/1E0JW9zqFwOO7w0HiuEPo6N7HBl.jpg','2017-08-18',98,'Released','Do You Believe in Monsters?','The Monster Project',462036,2.2063,5.196,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40629,_binary '\0','/4Y0eLVkUwThX9pt1uqVoWoCtvcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4537896',6.5,49455,'en','White Boy Rick','The story of Richard Wershe Jr., a teenager who became an undercover informant for the police during the 1980s, and was ultimately arrested for drug trafficking and sentenced to life in prison.','/l15r2aLqdifXM9GFsJLkOq5Y8SI.jpg','2018-09-14',111,'Released','In 1980s Detroit, Ricky Wersche Jr. was a street hustler, FBI informant and drug kingpin—all before he turned 16.','White Boy Rick',438808,7.1343,6.352,'qns48PtK2io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40630,_binary '\0','/75D2p6Sy7X1uFu3SWB8u7DUanEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4537986',5.3,3969,'zh','追捕','Accused of a murder he didn\'t commit, a prosecutor sets out on a mission to clear his name.','/8wq8KOGL3LAvODvnnn8dh8LTyMy.jpg','2017-11-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Manhunt',372782,2.8411,5.6,'1RqQr-nUy18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40631,_binary '\0','/o5y3pqSo409eNUrj1bQQSGVw2DM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4538670',5.4,4968,'en','In Full Bloom','Set shortly after the end of World War II, a philosophical boxing drama of two fighters from opposite worlds (USA and Japan) who are pulled together for a questionable fight arranged by their unscrupulous managers and the Yakuza.','/yAEEX18LgxzhTbo5NZKpqUL5HVP.jpg','2019-06-19',88,'Released',NULL,'In Full Bloom',608813,2.356,6.8,'MWex5DnbTjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40632,_binary '\0','/hD2JAEBW9ikYNmiWRcexKkRZWgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4538916',6.8,7992,'en','Finding Your Feet','When her life is turned upside down upon discovering her husband\'s affair, Sandra Abbott seeks refuge in London with her estranged older sister Bif. She begins to find her feet again after letting Bif drag her along to a community dance class.','/p54LOicUXx2T5U5nIEJCIOhsAhk.jpg','2017-12-26',111,'Released','Everyone Deserves a Second Dance','Finding Your Feet',426030,2.8181,7,'6-Cp6ba2Y0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40633,_binary '\0','/cRtFsijFloplP2tjvP8ndlqFiqC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4539114',7.3,1312,'ja','劇場版 境界の彼方 -I\'ll Be Here- 未来篇','The battle is over, and they can go about their normal lives now... or so they thought. With no time to rejoice after miraculously saving Mirai from Beyond the Boundary, Mirai lost all her memories. Akihito, now a high school senior, starts to avoid Mirai thinking it’s for the better. Not aware of Akihito’s feelings, Mirai tries to get closer to Akihito. Then, someone who knows of Mirai appears in front of the two. With Akihito’s troubles in vain, Mirai once again sets forth on a battle that forces her to look within.','/qkXH0FuFEMVbEcX9ypFA9tQhlzl.jpg','2015-04-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Boundary: I\'ll Be Here – Future',333622,3.2103,7.4,'U7F0Z88GMZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40634,_binary '\0','/qoPeEiFmhlR35LBm1tPmQzKiB6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4539828',6.9,1971,'en','Love on the Air','When a radio host gets dumped by her boyfriend on-air and soon has her break up exposed even further by a shock jock, she needs to regain her confidence while working with the same man who humiliated her in front of his viewers.','/uIGoakOBipOe5Glht3dxIvmaZvY.jpg','2015-09-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Love on the Air',352851,1.952,6.8,'eooJjQsxXME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40635,_binary '\0','/2CHRCwkr5yoA9xdihzHrXL3eNre.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4540434',4.6,3399,'en','Paradox','A group of scientists are experimenting with time travel, and they manage to send one of their group ahead in time one hour. But when he comes back, he tells them that they’ll all be dead within the next hour unless they shut the machine down.','/nkjDIxzRwFMDvANnpdEIcT4whQe.jpg','2016-04-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Paradox',376292,1.3406,4.6,'O3NbTILaL0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40636,_binary '\0','/hnWBg0qgYa7LxVnTdVYUbAPLctc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4540710',7.5,89860,'en','Miss Sloane','An ambitious lobbyist faces off against the powerful gun lobby in an attempt to pass gun control legislation.','/ptfvQlqe2xJiMSewSj52qAVq5z0.jpg','2016-11-25',133,'Released','Make sure you surprise them.','Miss Sloane',376290,9.176,7.4,'5k8KaMdPYTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40637,_binary '\0','/ygphgOzTOQtQcBPRdp9ax3BBWsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4544278',5.2,1220,'ru','Три богатыря: Ход конем','The court horse Gaius Julius Caesar to his misfortune overhears boyars and learns about a conspiracy against the prince. What to do? Protect a prince no one! Heroes away - catch a robber Potanyu, Dragon on vacation, the army on maneuvers ... But if the bad guys are going to take over the world, to someone it is necessary to save him? Who is he, a hero who will come to the rescue? Of course, the horse Julius! This Strategy and the \"grand strategist\". He would save all, but if you do not save, then at least try. Most importantly, to the rescue of the world did not turn a complete disaster.','/eXVT7e7pztUdSOF891mdUoC3v2j.jpg','2015-01-01',74,'Released',NULL,'Three Heroes and Julius Caesar',314946,0.9993,6.3,'p3dqRlWJpeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40638,_binary '\0','/gHSnrw3RvJ99TnV2ELqcGfD77Pn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4544696',4.3,1244,'it','Leibstandarte: My Honor Was Loyalty','Captain Ludwig Herckel a devoted and patriotic soldier of the SS Leibstandarte fights in every major conflict from the Eastern front to the battle of the bulge. Fiercely loyal to his country and his brothers in arms, loved by his men, Herckel will face his greatest battle yet when he discovers the truth about the Nazi regime.','/nU4oFu7ys6TwdvYWcMazDeNQ6xK.jpg','2015-06-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Leibstandarte: My Honor Was Loyalty',383001,1.6012,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40639,_binary '\0','/wkQILlNmrcOzJjFnfwyIOVh0Yim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4545630',4.6,3165,'te','సర్దార్ గబ్బర్ సింగ్','Gabbar Singh arrives at the empire of Rathanpur to save the princess and the civilians from the ruthless criminal Bhairav Singh.','/3auYD4ZYKDa3bCvEKzihzHunOMU.jpg','2016-04-15',163,'Released','Guts, Guns and Love','Sardaar Gabbar Singh',371811,1.3945,4.2,'JoYJga1A_UY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40640,_binary '\0','/rrAMFTuTFHYI6INtyPnOYyoGTO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4547056',6.6,69885,'en','The Girl with All the Gifts','In the future, a strange fungus has changed nearly everyone into thoughtless, flesh-eating monsters. When a scientist and a teacher find a girl who seems to be immune to the fungus, they all begin a journey to save humanity.','/vdCD8z55a4RNmHQDPIpuMFqoY2B.jpg','2016-09-23',111,'Released','Our greatest threat is our only hope.','The Girl with All the Gifts',375366,8.3926,6.6,'HjGkB_oWTe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40641,_binary '\0','/gSArEgFJb4qUYpjhqMApcKmD7Ye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4547120',2.2,6963,'en','San Andreas Quake','When a discredited L.A. Seismologist warns of an impending 12.7 earthquake, no one takes her seriously. Now on her own, she races desperately to get her family to safety before the earthquake breaks Los Angeles apart from the mainland.','/4dx0K5ZbdhQDfcyBqqHJFH1OW71.jpg','2015-05-19',90,'Released','The world, split in two.','San Andreas Quake',339533,2.0548,4.3,'w-fSiFJcw9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40642,_binary '\0','/wqBBbzbJcQKFjmq79Vw1ixcO6Ga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4547194',6.1,33641,'en','I Kill Giants','Sophia, a new high school student, tries to make friends with Barbara, who tells her that “she kills giants,” protecting this way her hometown and its inhabitants, who do not understand her strange behavior.','/cvit6HDbXHE6W5kGPd47jd0wthQ.jpg','2017-11-15',106,'Released','I find giants, I hunt giants','I Kill Giants',419831,5.1933,6.2,'n7Jg-eo8nBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40643,_binary '\0','/udfwuMcRuuBLnacgMorkWHz42qt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4547938',6.7,2892,'en','Katie Says Goodbye','A kindhearted seventeen-year-old in the American Southwest turns to prostitution to fulfill her dream of a new life in San Francisco.','/sMCqawbXXxzE5yRIfAS0lxCjpME.jpg','2018-03-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Katie Says Goodbye',412595,2.5754,6.5,'EN_h-BwII5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40644,_binary '\0','/rZXwDWwW3bMaoeHJ0wnSsON8roD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4549224',5.4,1256,'en','The Standoff','At Big Jim’s Auto Depot there’s only one rule. The last man – or woman – standing wins. Eight teens enter, one teen leaves. Actually, all eight teens leave, but only one leaves with the ride of their dreams. To reach that dream, they’re going through a nightmare. Keep your hand on the car. That sounds simple enough, but two days of sleep deprivation and fierce competition can make things awfully hard.','/5FxwA8I8WJgx1eSfQiSR2ZDdRIA.jpg','2016-09-20',90,'Released','They\'re driving each other crazy.','The Standoff',408151,1.3109,5.5,'-DosgO9X5k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40645,_binary '\0','/5d6m8CIBQcHeiwr6R5ou4wxO9Vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4550098',7.4,342520,'en','Nocturnal Animals','Susan Morrow receives a book manuscript from her ex-husband – a man she left 20 years earlier – asking for her opinion of his writing. As she reads, she is drawn into the fictional life of Tony Hastings, a mathematics professor whose family vacation turns violent.','/mdLDgQBD0va09npSQX5Zgo2evXM.jpg','2016-11-04',116,'Released','When you love someone you can\'t just throw it away.','Nocturnal Animals',340666,12.7117,7.4,'JOsEU5oYpTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40646,_binary '\0','/wSV6fx2m22xvqfZZPjvROMpmLFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4550420',6.1,5156,'en','My Blind Brother','Love for the same woman causes conflict between an over-achieving blind athlete and the brother who made him that way.','/eD1YeAGlYvdxab3PZV66wAyd2Dx.jpg','2016-09-19',85,'Released','Romantically Challenged.','My Blind Brother',381040,2.0665,5.9,'5jCQBCfJGhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40647,_binary '\0','/gRY0ymocsUbgmRD6lKhu0Oam6de.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4551314',6.4,2045,'fr','Un petit boulot','An unemployed factory worker takes a job as a hit man to make ends meet.','/vVeuJYiy2bIXqlpu0GsZnVU0Oa9.jpg','2016-08-31',107,'Released',NULL,'Odd Job',402907,1.4024,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40648,_binary '\0','/btTpt2VAdDyKHdgvrRZeLUdv2HU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4551318',7.1,2170,'ru','Рай','The historical drama set during the Second World War centres on three people whose paths cross: a Russian aristocratic emigrant and member of the French resistance, a French collaborator and a high-ranking German SS officer.','/kI3BSS2pzKimLa8uHk6ap8Ole3o.jpg','2016-09-01',130,'Released',NULL,'Paradise',408539,1.7125,7,'lBVw0LXD_2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40649,_binary '\0','/9v7tJP1CROJAz4vBacfnigm5SjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4552118',7.5,11527,'en','Looking: The Movie','Patrick returns to San Francisco for the first time in almost a year to celebrate a momentous event with his old friends. In the process, he must face the unresolved relationships he left behind and make difficult choices about what’s important to him.','/tQdda275rJqNi6Ifrf3ntWBsXDj.jpg','2016-07-24',85,'Released','The End Is A New Beginning','Looking: The Movie',371738,2.9116,7.1,'N0Zf9FchOXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40650,_binary '\0','/u3MEYUcPy43BvfKVMiOReFxvw4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4552298',7,1742,'de','Das Versprechen','Derek and Nancy Haysom were brutally murdered in their house in Lynchburg, Virginia, on March 30, 1985. Suspicion fell on their daughter Elizabeth and her boyfriend Jens Söring. They flee to Europe, but are caught and extradited to the U.S. Elizabeth is sentenced to 90 years in jail for incitement to murder, Jens Söring to two life sentences. Karin Steinberger, Marcus Vetter and their team spent over three years researching this case, which achieved world-wide notoriety. They uncovered new evidence, including the fact none of the blood samples found at the scene of the crime belonged to Jens Söring.','/af43DiWkC8Ndn9LTurEsdhFLCHR.jpg','2016-10-27',131,'Released','Love Is The Ultimate Weapon.','Killing for Love',402919,2.0022,6.1,'XP8MMhU7aLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40651,_binary '\0','/p2y3RhQZZfzLY1xFGHaXTpqWkhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4552524',4.8,12546,'en','Jeruzalem','When a couple of American young adults fly to Israel to visit the city of Jerusalem, a biblical nightmare falls upon the city.','/hYkfUKjWlVP6GVqIW5wL2ruREGZ.jpg','2016-01-22',94,'Released','On Judgement Day, Hell Shall Inherit The Earth.','Jeruzalem',339547,2.9098,5.545,'QTIwfN-4hZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40652,_binary '\0','/6xeJYLYGF746QFnIdccXZ6I2m1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4554212',6.3,1514,'en','Milada','Pre-WWII Czech democratic politician Milada Horáková was one of the first victims of the communist regime in Czechoslovakia. Opposing the 1948 coup but not leaving the country, she was arrested and tried for treason on fabricated charges in a show trial broadcast on the radio.','/zp6Cvp1VVaPz5Ort9liGtF8Z2dZ.jpg','2017-11-02',130,'Released','She fought for her country\'s freedom at the cost of her own.','Milada',494282,1.5342,6.7,'NKbvYs_-Sto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40653,_binary '\0','/rb6FW2I8YEuywwQTSYauxCesZu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4554690',7.8,1927,'en','The Automat','The 100-year story of the iconic restaurant chain Horn & Hardart, the inspiration for Starbucks, where generations of Americans ate and drank coffee together at communal tables. From the perspective of former customers, we watch a business climb to its peak success and then grapple with fast food in a forever changed America.','/7MVOSC8HTtPx9S3T7QeXCggUe1f.jpg','2021-09-02',79,'Released',NULL,'The Automat',729830,1.5214,6.8,'HWNkIsLEny4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40654,_binary '\0','/6prkTmEEsB3f9hhKBzUePLe27b2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4555426',7.4,245907,'en','Darkest Hour','In May 1940, the fate of World War II hangs on Winston Churchill, who must decide whether to negotiate with Adolf Hitler or fight on knowing that it could mean the end of the British Empire.','/xa6G3aKlysQeVg9wOb0dRcIGlWu.jpg','2017-11-22',125,'Released','Never give up. Never give in.','Darkest Hour',399404,13.212,7.355,'JQAYFbcgf60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40655,_binary '\0','/Aehy9RDBSkHSSbQHj9z2IRPUB8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4555594',5.5,2009,'en','How Sarah Got Her Wings','Good Samaritan Sarah Fitzpatrick has a fatal accident just before Christmas, and finds herself in the lobby before the gates of Heaven. Certain that she will be let in, she is shocked to find that her name is not on the reservation list. However, she is granted the chance to return to Earth as an \"angel in training\" with the requirement to help a soul in need. Sarah has the 12 days before Christmas to secure her place on the list leaving her in the race for her after-life.','/elhXcxDrYUbVH7p5dTMv2k5JlDm.jpg','2015-12-06',88,'Released','Sometimes you need a helping hand.','How Sarah Got Her Wings',369059,2.1816,5.916,'O9Icg-5GJAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40656,_binary '\0','/9d6xZxHLbWR3R0BJMK4iDnhfsFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4556370',3.9,4613,'en','Altitude','A female FBI agent is offered millions to help a thief escape from a hijacked airplane.','/1pSk6DU0oY7BWTK4F9keqjeCxB7.jpg','2017-04-14',86,'Released',NULL,'Altitude',443700,3.3519,4.9,'A9ok2APAjTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40657,_binary '\0','/w8lo7gKlKCpvfD1yUt3mguECWS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4557014',6.7,3661,'ml','ഒരു വടക്കൻ സെൽഫി','Umesh, a loafer, leaves his home town and goes to Chennai to become a film-maker when his father asks him to manage their grocery store. A selfie that he takes in Chennai changes his life forever.','/jkVR9ufZELPcgWViPGJ6D0Y5ss8.jpg','2015-03-27',143,'Released',NULL,'Oru Vadakkan Selfie',332830,0.8373,6.5,'7s0uX2u6b5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40658,_binary '\0','/rcYoFja1KidJlTzQCHoxLHaw1AO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4557208',3.7,3134,'en','Armed Response','The story follows a team of highly trained operatives who find themselves trapped inside an isolated military compound.','/ozhEmqMpJMPg6Rz9lJ0AFhZaGMI.jpg','2017-08-04',93,'Released','No retreat. No mercy.','Armed Response',450932,3.6278,5.1,'0p8Cl8_wQew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40659,_binary '\0','/ryxQnjjh8gtU94uif5E9f8h01Dt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4557956',5.8,5899,'en','Crash Pad','Hopeless romantic Stensland thinks he\'s found true love with an older woman, Morgan, only to learn that she\'s married and that their fling is merely an instrument of revenge against her neglectful husband, Grady. Initially out for blood, Grady finds himself strangely sympathetic to Stensland\'s plight and decides to get revenge on his wife instead.','/zyZkoztIEPpFJfkFSL3o5CG5NqA.jpg','2017-10-27',93,'Released','He finally met the love of his life... Then he met her husband.','Crash Pad',390053,3.5105,5.599,'HfLuNqpK7yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40660,_binary '\0','/k866Cz4Wg9IZEduVQsfBJ2StoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4558042',5.9,1616,'en','Elstree 1976','A documentary about ten very different lives connected by having appeared onscreen wearing masks or helmets in Star Wars.','/3Uxfci6YhO6xII49WVU9DVzYsnX.jpg','2015-10-09',90,'Released','Behind the masks. Beneath the helmets. Big people. Small roles.','Elstree 1976',322506,1.5886,6.2,'w7oPx38pn9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40661,_binary '\0','/VL9dy8OsdpVbGaeT2Ld9V7s0Ng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4558200',6.5,9591,'en','Crown Vic','One memorable night in the life of veteran patrol officer Ray Mandel and his trainee, ambitious rookie cop Nick Holland in the LAPD\'s Olympic Division. With two cop killers on the loose and hunting for more targets, Mandel and Holland must contend with a city about to boil over, as well as Jack VanZandt, an unhinged rogue cop out for payback running wild in their patrol zone.','/aUFuuUMd4nMbt3pdzulnFRxbY6e.jpg','2019-11-01',110,'Released','Right and Wrong Isn\'t Always Black and White','Crown Vic',524659,5.683,6.2,'EZ3CFfA7BkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40662,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4558362',5.3,18115,'tr','Bizim Hikaye','A son tries to restore the honour of his father, who was imprisoned during the 1980 military coup.','/oCGg8H9oDIxFMKM3cOT9KooUiPE.jpg','2015-03-27',102,'Released',NULL,'Bizim Hikaye',376050,1.7856,6.9,'4I2GTR5_FwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40663,_binary '\0','/nvZuBYHUGbrFl3LmDnmbRgrQ8xa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4558376',4.9,16250,'en','Downhill','Barely escaping an avalanche during a family ski vacation in the Alps, a married couple is thrown into disarray as they are forced to reevaluate their lives and how they feel about each other.','/ruLqLb2bfWKykckxVlVZayuBOgW.jpg','2020-02-06',87,'Released','A different kind of disaster movie.','Downhill',560391,3.8991,5.2,'AY5SrKf_2ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40664,_binary '\0','/lklNfJR2c6OcK3XynwbAMuipgvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4558396',6.5,1704,'de','Egon Schiele: Tod und Mädchen','Vienna, Austria, 1910. The young painter Egon Schiele is a rising artist, provocative and free, whose work, characterized by eroticism, shocks as much as it fascinates art lovers.','/lRG0Y9im6hblgJrnwup6SY3r1Pr.jpg','2016-10-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Egon Schiele: Death and the Maiden',416574,2.8365,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40665,_binary '\0','/YmrlTsqhmFsWo50QawaKTHOql7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4559006',5.9,29427,'hi','ऐ दिल है मुश्किल','Ayan falls in love with his soulmate, Alizeh, but she doesn’t reciprocate the feeling. Later, a relationship with Saba helps him realize Alizeh’s value in his life, irrespective of their relationship status.','/hlDOF4UhUqrYY7gqLk3Rl0Fx4ns.jpg','2016-10-27',158,'Released',NULL,'Ae Dil Hai Mushkil',393445,2.0067,6.4,'Z_PODraXg4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40666,_binary '\0','/p18H6kQKlPajCUI5lGJICBHxVqJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4559046',5,12914,'hi','हाउसफुल 3','A father doesn\'t want his three daughters to get married. Now, it\'s up to three men to try to and convince the father that they\'re a good fit for his daughters.','/6Udose5F7a9SdNf8HlNMovtDMM9.jpg','2016-06-03',140,'Released',NULL,'Housefull 3',391779,1.7186,5.081,'TlZM9kuqw38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40667,_binary '\0','/HWN8qve56lvX0obp5YQs5hV7mS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4559932',6.5,1348,'ru','Призрак','An aircraft designer becomes a ghost after a sudden death. Now he needs to engage a help of seven-grader in order to finish all his unaccomplished tasks.','/2njykKt6eASXbrMENEcLkDLZZ6Y.jpg','2015-03-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Ghost',332512,1.5448,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40668,_binary '\0','/eKGjQNJ6sbSB1LoIeNoGXG0HozV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4560008',6.9,14659,'en','This Beautiful Fantastic','Set against the backdrop of a beautiful garden in the heart of London, this contemporary fairy tale revolves around the unlikely friendship between a reclusive young woman and a cantankerous old widower. Bella Brown is a beautifully quirky young woman who dreams of writing and illustrating a successful children’s book. After she is forced by her landlord to deal with her neglected garden or face eviction, she meets her match, nemesis, and unlikely mentor in Alfie Stephenson, a grumpy, loveless, old man who lives next door who happens to be an amazing horticulturalist.','/22b9jLGJ8OVzlEnWzqF0yRy5Na3.jpg','2016-10-20',100,'Released','Life blooms in enchanting ways.','This Beautiful Fantastic',352490,4.1251,7.1,'c-aOWzQ4dF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40669,_binary '\0','/2nOMUnQ4OtsKVTmpp3og7MYt4oG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4560436',6.1,94734,'en','Mile 22','An elite group of American operatives, aided by a top-secret tactical command team, must transport an asset who holds life-threatening information to an extraction point 22 miles away through the hostile streets of an Asian city.','/2L8ehd95eSW9x7KINYtZmRkAlrZ.jpg','2018-08-16',94,'Released','Option 1: Diplomacy. Option 2: Military. Meet Option 3.','Mile 22',347375,11.242,6.278,'3CVV8X01824','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40670,_binary '\0','/65uaQK0WE6onMLmswihdduH93xH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4562518',7.5,14498,'es','El ciudadano ilustre','After refusing big and prestigious awards all over the world, Mr. Mantovani, Literature Nobel Prize winner, accepts an invitation to visit his hometown in Argentina, which has been the inspiration for all of his books. It turns out that accepting this invitation is the worst idea of his life. Expect the unexpected when you have used real people as characters in your novels!','/bH63pZizNIJoYCE6kkVoj1lzkK.jpg','2016-09-08',118,'Released',NULL,'The Distinguished Citizen',408537,2.391,7.3,'2f5La9q2_k8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40671,_binary '\0','/e6glkS41QMMgrpvvrV29QAN9oke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4563070',4.4,1362,'tr','Oflu Hoca\'nın Şifresi','A famous imam from Northern Anatolia gets into competition with contractor Ahmet to become the president of a football club which is called \'Doganspor\'. Moreover, the imam also appears as a guest on a television show to answer funny questions about Islam.','/8RB3vy60Kdrtnb5GfDNzpmbYr9P.jpg','2014-10-31',95,'Released',NULL,'Oflu Hodja\'s Code',346098,1.5538,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40672,_binary '\0','/v4H8Hl9h5bn6sn3GAt7QAjibH5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4565400',4.3,1304,'en','Child Eater','A simple night of babysitting takes a horrifying turn when Helen realizes the boogeyman really is in little Lucas\' closet.','/5oyUNNUMmXBNSbBltvbPhVa43kP.jpg','2016-10-28',82,'Released','The young ones taste the best','Child Eater',417501,1.1517,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40673,_binary '\0','/ab9RFSA8ZBFl2MWe3g0YFkqgeNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4565520',4.8,18366,'en','The Layover','When their plane is rerouted due to a hurricane warning, two single female best friends find themselves competing for the same guy during an extended layover in St. Louis.','/kb9osnqanXRpkpm1bnSqAhKoq5T.jpg','2017-09-01',88,'Released','The flight is off. The fight is on.','The Layover',339404,7.4131,5.4,'lvhnNd0RoT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40674,_binary '\0','/zMrk2G3XsnfYKiIp1NEfdtvDyBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4566758',5.8,168705,'en','Mulan','When the Emperor of China issues a decree that one man per family must serve in the Imperial Chinese Army to defend the country from Huns, Hua Mulan, the eldest daughter of an honored warrior, steps in to take the place of her ailing father. She is spirited, determined and quick on her feet. Disguised as a man by the name of Hua Jun, she is tested every step of the way and must harness her innermost strength and embrace her true potential.','/aKx1ARwG55zZ0GpRvU2WrGrCG9o.jpg','2020-09-04',115,'Released','Loyal. Brave. True.','Mulan',337401,13.2218,6.817,'KK8FHdFluOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40675,_binary '\0','/cQQXvzcX62oEpyzh6aWGBYbTNI4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4567486',4.8,2151,'en','The Mind\'s Eye','Zack Connors and Rachel Meadows were born with incredible psychokinetic capabilities. When word of their supernatural talents gets out, they find themselves the prisoners of Michael Slovak, a deranged doctor intent on harvesting their powers.','/vwyhFGCaSpqR9nvWpt9CRnr6oDY.jpg','2015-08-05',87,'Released','Mind Over Matter.','The Mind\'s Eye',336265,2.0386,4.9,'BYHrUKeps38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40676,_binary '\0','/6HouHhflWhOd3O5liLFjHD25ipC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4568370',5.1,1815,'fr','Blind Sun','​Greece. A seaside resort struck by a heavy heat wave. Water is scarce and violence is ready to explode. Ashraf, a solitary immigrant, is looking after a villa while its owners are away. On a dusty road crushed by the sun, he is stopped by a police officer for an identity check...','/ySVxUy02s40KeTlRC19aFn5e1g9.jpg','2016-04-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Blind Sun',336226,1.1979,4.5,'M1Vf7RuOJWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40677,_binary '\0','/4fMatdLEIgBuqzHXRkLh2KyVaZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4569240',6.5,1239,'es','Un monstruo de mil cabezas','When Sonia receives the news that her husband’s cancer has progressed to a critical stage, she races to secure the insurance company’s approval for the care that can help him.','/wToNyO8nPExJGcIEryIj0EEuW3Z.jpg','2016-03-30',74,'Released',NULL,'A Monster with a Thousand Heads',296865,1.8126,5.9,'s8vu7MzJ4jQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40678,_binary '\0','/lWcNlDMmZ6xJVoCZjhFxqVl0TIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4572514',7.3,123410,'en','Patriots Day','In the aftermath of an unspeakable act of terror, Police Sergeant Tommy Saunders joins courageous survivors, first responders and investigators in a race against the clock to hunt down the Boston Marathon bombers before they strike again.','/mIDxsJTrOC7NhgOo3GziiHyKfsQ.jpg','2016-12-12',133,'Released','The inside story of the world\'s greatest manhunt.','Patriots Day',388399,11.8414,7.1,'_c9IpI_pNGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40679,_binary '\0','/sYnrdolxonyMucMezj8PMVBRlVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4572792',6.6,30933,'en','The Book of Henry','Susan, a single mother of two, works as a waitress in a small town. Her son, Henry, is an 11-year-old genius who not only manages the family finances but acts as emotional support for his mother and younger brother. When Henry discovers that the girl next door has a terrible secret, he implores Susan to take matters into her own hands.','/suLFg4UjvM5BoDipg2Wu3gZ802T.jpg','2017-06-16',105,'Released','Never leave things undone.','The Book of Henry',382614,6.337,7.472,'Nd60i3ZnLOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40680,_binary '\0','/pL4jkJqXvW2ZnmjooF0LavaIVF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4572820',7.6,5119,'en','For the Love of Spock','The life of Mr. Spock, as well as that of Leonard Nimoy, the actor who played him for almost fifty years, written and directed by his son: Adam.','/1pDgqNx9GdW82QJU4Rc6egT3YAG.jpg','2016-09-09',105,'Released','Live long...','For the Love of Spock',338544,3.0163,7.4,'VwbdeyymCU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40681,_binary '\0','/plKhuh3JKxihPcFl9hM4bN5VdOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4573394',8,42291,'az','Endless Corridor','\"Endless Corridor\" is the definitive account of an agonizing human rights tragedy in which hundreds of Azerbaijanis massacred after Armenian Forces stormed the city of Khojaly during the Nagorno-Karabakh War. It happened in 1992, but the full story never been told throughout the world until now.','/tPdtDGgYbxyeZEJ5xpNxP1Ww7OM.jpg','2014-06-07',51,'Released','The only thing necessary for the triumph of evil is for good men to do nothing','Endless Corridor',401114,2.327,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40682,_binary '\0','/2SEgJ0mHJ7TSdVDbkGU061tR33K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4573516',5.9,9554,'en','Sleight','A young street magician is left to take care of his little sister after his mother\'s passing and turns to drug dealing in the Los Angeles party scene to keep a roof over their heads. When he gets into trouble with his supplier, his sister is kidnapped and he is forced to rely on both his sleight of hand and brilliant mind to save her.','/eLk7yoWxK4S0xkV24YWoPKbIsbf.jpg','2017-04-28',89,'Released','You can change the cards you\'re dealt','Sleight',347882,1.7964,5.442,'RFiaZ5VHY7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40683,_binary '\0','/laBm6qAJ3z4HXcG1ixKsCfDFBhX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4573800',5.1,3990,'en','A Deadly Adoption','Things go awry when an author and his wife welcome a pregnant woman into their home, with plans to adopt her baby.','/mfMoNq0nYec5RImmCiW0Guj3Bcg.jpg','2015-06-20',84,'Released','The birth of a plan gone wrong.','A Deadly Adoption',343921,2.1595,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40684,_binary '\0','/zy4zTAS6R58cogMHDXs3E6KgsKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4574654',4.5,1682,'en','Beneath the Leaves','Four small-town boys are kidnapped by James Whitley, a warm-eyed psychopath. His grotesque pursuit to reunite orphaned children with their deceased birth parents is halted when the boys escape and he is arrested. Fifteen years later Whitley flees during a prison fire and decides to see his mission through. Detective Larson, once Whitley\'s prior victim, is removed from the case due to impartiality leaving his partner, and lover, Detective Shotwell to solve the case. Fueled by rage and a chance of redemption, Detective Larson chases the steadfast psychopath on his own only to fall back into the same trap he once escaped as a child.','/dCu6Pi4YUtgvR2uOSeVieYdu7iK.jpg','2019-02-08',90,'Released','Be patient and wait for due harvest.','Beneath the Leaves',575745,1.7849,4,'HrQ-sN1-c4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40685,_binary '\0','/gCC7IsbkGvkejzjTf4aRYZKe4O3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4575328',4.3,10115,'en','2036 Origin Unknown','After the first manned mission to Mars ends in a deadly crash, mission controller Mackenzie \'Mack\' Wilson assists an artificial intelligence system, A.R.T.I. Their investigation uncovers a mysterious object under the surface of Mars that could change the future of our planet as we know it.','/v3StJTYXbU3OZ26Vh1PbczqfyCD.jpg','2018-06-08',94,'Released','The origins of our existence have remained a mystery...until now','2036 Origin Unknown',448916,2.7604,4.686,'9HKoPnraoLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40686,_binary '\0','/hnh4oqnGPlVFEMUuw41nYxKRYf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4575576',7.2,91752,'en','Christopher Robin','Christopher Robin, the boy who had countless adventures in the Hundred Acre Wood, has grown up and lost his way. Now it’s up to his spirited and loveable stuffed animals, Winnie The Pooh, Tigger, Piglet, and the rest of the gang, to rekindle their friendship and remind him of endless days of childlike wonder and make-believe, when doing nothing was the very best something.','/i6Ytex4d3CdfIKJFxB5v5vh24vb.jpg','2018-08-01',104,'Released','Sooner or later, your past catches up to you.','Christopher Robin',420814,10.3918,7.292,'-pYG1THEnUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40687,_binary '\0','/6u7MIOKpUgvOpfo6V7DdnAVTS6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4575930',6.5,1353,'en','Custody','When a hard-working single mother, Sara Diaz, has her children taken from her after she is suspected of injuring her son, Ally Fisher, a recent law school graduate, is assigned to represent her case before Judge Martha Schulman, a veteran of the Family Court System.','/9HBvD29HeQf0DeQx2ec4TgmRtS7.jpg','2016-04-17',104,'Released',NULL,'Custody',390401,3,6.9,'IbtLwewhtCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40688,_binary '\0','/f2yrxYqXr1RSJwgF9Ek1ULI21Ap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4576612',6.9,2287,'fr','Comment c\'est loin','After ten years of doing nothing, Orel and Gringe are in their mid 30s and they struggle to finish their first rap album. Their texts are mostly sex jokes and booze stories and reflect the everyday life they have in a small town from France. The problem is that they never really finished a song and when their producers want to meet, they have to face a new challenge : finish their first song in the next 24h. Their old issues, the fear of failure, their alcoholic friends and annoying girlfriends won\'t help them to do so, or will they ?','/jhZtyj9BYECjWVRKUJPQCNNYsMM.jpg','2015-12-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Comment c\'est loin',366564,1.619,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40689,_binary '\0','/6jmArQQBcBcqz2cPkUJKljJUvrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4577344',3.8,1784,'en','ClownTown','Whilst on their way to a concert four friends get sidetracked and stranded in a seemingly abandoned town and whilst looking for help find themselves stalked and terrorised by a gang of violent clown dressed psychopaths who will stop at nothing ensnaring them into their sinister blood thirsty games.','/Uqx7NitLn4CO1syvTqN6Bb3F6A.jpg','2017-07-21',86,'Released','They\'ll rip out your funny bone','ClownTown',403964,2.0376,4.4,'UUS3NEsuqUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40690,_binary '\0','/8DSy5xZzDOukQpWCUs91bN1HCwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4578118',4.9,8742,'en','Rupture','A single mom tries to break free from a mysterious organization that has abducted her.','/41MCf9bzSpqhr7EAu95su0XdjVQ.jpg','2016-11-04',102,'Released','Face your fears.','Rupture',345925,2.9545,4.915,'F2SSdtQUX5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40691,_binary '\0','/9HcXzYUnnwyFu9WSEM2IOxd2VhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4581576',5.7,28854,'en','Aftermath','A fatal plane crash changes the lives of Roman and Jake forever. Roman loses his wife and daughter in the accident, while Jake loses his mind—as he happens to be the air traffic controller who failed to avert the nightmare. Rage and revenge engulfs Roman and Jake finds himself swamped with guilt and regret.','/25oWTCGqIik4gUTMidx3L8DI4Bt.jpg','2017-02-28',94,'Released','All he had left was revenge','Aftermath',390051,7.1246,5.739,'oUXUm6he2-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40692,_binary '\0','/70Z7iqAqFkxMgXOI52jn6TqmYPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4584862',5.4,1334,'ml','ഭാസ്കർ ദി റാസ്കൽ','Businessman Bhaskaran Pillai builds a large commercial empire until his wife dies. Under pressure from his son, Bhaskaran goes on a trip where he meets Hima, a small-business owner.','/b9KclZQQPrcVXkZYqAQ3KZBSVi0.jpg','2015-04-14',154,'Released',NULL,'Bhaskar The Rascal',332686,1.1595,4.909,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40693,_binary '\0','/j9EnOhzCoB2YZZtDPncoiY7J9GM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4585660',6.2,5750,'da','Klovn forever','Frank and Casper\'s friendship is put to a test, when Casper decides to leave Denmark to pursue a solo career in Los Angeles. Determined to win his best friend back Frank chooses to follow Casper insuring an eventful trip.','/pJmykPqHSTNJYfytCZ7GJfi7ZLf.jpg','2015-09-24',99,'Released','Friends forever?','Klown Forever',310602,1.5373,5.8,'-u7dVzaU4Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40694,_binary '\0','/4cYyHddXpKbPA17vbrQHIm9bFW2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4586626',2.7,2193,'en','Showdown in Manila','The film unfolds in Manila, Philippines, and in the jungles of the island of Boracay on a tropical island in the privacy of living Russian middle-aged man (Alexander Newsky). But the quiet life interrupted by the murder of one of the locals. In order to protect the daughter of the slain Filipino bandits Russian guy have to remember the past, he tried to bury.','/pQGE2nZ6OQKSDWekXyfiBYWFMxA.jpg','2016-02-18',86,'Released','Pimps & Bandits. One Tropical Island. Trouble, Death, Mischief.','Showdown in Manila',339406,2.0583,3.321,'k68Yv2xBNqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40695,_binary '\0','/o9KozfQnqi9LO4nHSPyudIf44r0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4587366',5.6,5364,'en','Eliminators','A former US Federal Agent must abandon the witness protection program and come out of hiding when his London home is invaded in error due to a wrong address. When the event ends with multiple homicides, the news triggers those hunting him to send Europe\'s most dangerous assassin to kill him. Now on the run with his daughters life in jeopardy, a determined father must get her to safety before the people he\'s been hiding from tracks him down.','/pUB91wOMQrmkforP7ntIMy2zkdn.jpg','2016-12-09',95,'Released','A former agent. A lethal assassin. Game On.','Eliminators',421313,3.3131,6.353,'bMykCXayH7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40696,_binary '\0','/gpVg9EA5tieNCxmPtx9KTbUKXrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4587656',6.3,11015,'en','The Star','A small but brave donkey and his animal friends become the unsung heroes of the greatest story ever told: the first Christmas.','/tEbDvivUfsCupngKIfMJJ725eAD.jpg','2017-11-15',86,'Released','It takes many tails to tell the greatest story ever.','The Star',355547,9.4976,6.5,'7anAON-7K48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40697,_binary '\0','/3yCRAFt5zUP0Yzna1Sa3u8KD0xk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4587740',6.1,2770,'en','A Christmas Melody','Kristin has just had to close her small Manhattan clothing boutique to return to her Ohio home town and live in her parents\' former home. It\'s an adjustment for Kristin and her young daughter— especially when she runs into her former high school rival. Kristen and Emily struggle to find their new normal with the help of the hunky local music teacher.','/uetNOoUIwmeavHYnimc8B9tnDOq.jpg','2015-12-19',83,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Melody',366018,2.5004,6,'ArsKV7oZgFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40698,_binary '\0','/23p68n4rJP8O3gve2ecRBJNL9MT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4587780',6.4,1967,'en','Unleashed','When a cosmic event turns Emma\'s dog and cat into two perfect guys, Emma reconsiders her outlook on dating, hilariously works out her trust issues, and ultimately learns to love herself.','/zpTg32caIadhYln2cLRKHWDkGHQ.jpg','2017-08-25',96,'Released','Love is a four-legged word.','Unleashed',345937,1.755,6.152,'XLNUaYgenTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40699,_binary '\0','/z1tUjEnweJuWKP5rGbPiwOODzmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4589186',6,1701,'fr','Saint Amour','Every year, Bruno makes a tour of all the wine stands, without setting foot outside the Show’s premises and without ever finishing his wine trail. This year, his father suggests they finish it together, but a real wine trail, across the French countryside. Accompanied by Mike, a young, quirky taxi driver, they set off in the direction of France’s major wine regions. Together, they are going to discover not only the wine trails, but also the road that leads back to Love.','/A9wTBWnx6nKitul3vjKHrRKjWRk.jpg','2016-03-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Saint Amour',358725,1.6463,5.7,'6crBuRQ7_cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40700,_binary '\0','/7NRGAtu8E4343NSKwhkgmVRDINw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4589218',5.4,143472,'en','Five Nights at Freddy\'s','Recently fired and desperate for work, a troubled young man named Mike agrees to take a position as a night security guard at an abandoned theme restaurant: Freddy Fazbear\'s Pizzeria. But he soon discovers that nothing at Freddy\'s is what it seems.','/7BpNtNfxuocYEVREzVMO75