593108',7,3953,'hr','Zvizdan','Three different love stories, set in three consecutive decades, in two neighbouring Balkan villages burdened with a long history of inter-ethnic hatred: this is a film about the dangers – and the enduring strength – of forbidden love.','/16ya0jVWtxojF57aL2KJciZxKKB.jpg','2015-05-12',123,'Released','Three decades. Two nations. One love.','The High Sun',336206,1.2991,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40710,_binary '\0','/hIvfxtGALM1dXzjblVzMkdkwc5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4593154',6.5,1582,'el','Καλάβρυτα 1943','A lawyer, who represents the German government against the Greek reparation claims for Nazi crimes in World War II, travels to Greece and meets one of the remaining survivors of the Kalavryta massacre that took place in 1943.','/ktl0QiGJBkrP3VwXxqYZNx7PPLd.jpg','2021-11-11',99,'Released',NULL,'Echoes of the Past',844227,1.4175,6.6,'VX3qKai2uiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40711,_binary '\0','/1SaLu98tQh1xRlS6xMIbliouJhK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4593196',5.8,1491,'en','Population Zero','In 2009 three young men were killed in a remote part of Yellowstone National Park. Authorities never found the murderer. He found them! Hours after the trio were gunned down, Dwayne Nelson confessed to the crime. Despite this Nelson was allowed to go free because of an American Constitution loophole. Documentarian Julian T. Pinder travels to Yellowstone in a compelling chase for truth behind a crime that should have rocked the nation. How did a guilty man go free? In his hunt for answers Pinder risks his own life when he finds evidence that could re-open the case years later.','/wuq82DjPmnsTtCngKCLO13bvwOE.jpg','2016-04-26',84,'Released','The only thing more shocking than the crime itself are the bizarre events that followed.','Population Zero',408219,1.3757,5.8,'KKrDwxvN2uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40712,_binary '\0','/wmlQqGUdS0zTSipyHQGLcC6d93G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4594834',5.9,11381,'en','Chi-Raq','A modern day adaptation of the ancient Greek play Lysistrata by Aristophanes, set against the backdrop of gang violence in Chicago.','/goT9g4Lem6mwkwmehR3mOGJXLBQ.jpg','2015-12-04',127,'Released','No peace. No piece.','Chi-Raq',340275,2.8067,5.7,'FEbeUK4EAbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40713,_binary '\0','/5k3LdPahZNPu7ineIgzEOq9AHcX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4594836',5.8,4759,'en','Darc','To bring down a global human trafficking ring, an Interpol agent recruits the help of a brutal criminal with inside knowledge of the yakuza.','/bBxHNF0risAugpPJeAgLkiUW0P1.jpg','2018-05-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Darc',521647,2.6314,6.15,'56BaU33u0Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40714,_binary '\0','/iHc14vucwUMl6WuvQa4iPfoEdy9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4595186',6.4,60852,'en','Luckiest Girl Alive','A successful woman in New York City finds her life upended when she is forced to confront a dark truth that threatens to unravel her meticulously crafted life.','/e0vrbTmTf2ZcW5CIS9qJ8FDbsU9.jpg','2022-09-30',113,'Released',NULL,'Luckiest Girl Alive',799546,5.4396,6.49,'B_XUlbPW-eY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40715,_binary '\0','/pDQDfAVSf9g0OI11r7RFo44tLyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4595882',7.1,59127,'en','Can You Ever Forgive Me?','When a bestselling celebrity biographer is no longer able to get published because she has fallen out of step with current tastes, she turns her art form to deception.','/y9pDvBdvU8Z5QjQ6Y4oF0Cq7p5j.jpg','2018-10-19',106,'Released','Her greatest work will be her biggest crime.','Can You Ever Forgive Me?',401847,5.1808,6.8,'UvJIaNsf_bY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40716,_binary '\0','/2wvwMW9AJHsME3BbRgtkaHkmYO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4596814',7.2,8293,'te','సన్నాఫ్ సత్యమూర్తి','The son of a rich businessman struggles to save his father\'s wealth after his demise. 