der.','Monstrous',811656,2.8358,5.9,'4bRnHRf6zv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40747,_binary '\0','/3dhuShnYmB0UOQrn8v8gT9DBf0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4624424',6.8,73462,'en','Storks','Storks deliver babies…or at least they used to. Now they deliver packages for a global internet retail giant. Junior, the company’s top delivery stork, is about to be promoted when he accidentally activates the Baby Making Machine, producing an adorable and wholly unauthorized baby girl...','/pwGolX8JmGJhhcUjO5SJt38Uk0m.jpg','2016-09-22',87,'Released','Find Your Flock','Storks',332210,9.5092,6.69,'-m0aIyOEe60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40748,_binary '\0','/uPFvwlf5oZxAB2UIejGL907OyoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4627104',4.5,3163,'en','Flight World War II','International Flight 42 is on course, when all of a sudden a massive and weird storm crops up around the plane. This sends the plane back in time to the year 1940- smack dab in the middle of WWII! Now, the crew and passengers must not only find a way back to their time, but fight off the Axis powers.','/m1CTPba4qdZ0AgbyHQHGX4XRUE5.jpg','2015-06-02',90,'Released','The greatest battle that never happened!','Flight World War II',343070,3.9282,4.6,'GgRBVDzITNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40749,_binary '\0','/s2DfqY2ZT1qdF9d6zRymX6xmbqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4627352',6.8,3324,'en','Shepherds and Butchers','A lawyer takes on a case of a prison guard in South Africa who is traumatized by the executions he\'s witnessed.','/7FXWOKxJmVRUO5oP7qXQXaJmvHg.jpg','2017-05-12',106,'Released','Death belongs to God alone','Shepherds and Butchers',382883,2.2177,6.3,'iPVOtTJ4qHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40750,_binary '\0','/E7hhuSZ1U5xymN2Olg2EOr4N4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4627382',6.9,88137,'en','Roofman','A former Army Ranger and struggling father turns to robbing McDonald’s restaurants by cutting holes in their roofs, earning him the nickname \"Roofman.\" After escaping prison, he secretly lives inside a Toys “R” Us for six months, surviving undetected while planning his next move. But when he falls for a divorced mom drawn to his undeniable charm, his double life begins to unravel, setting off a compelling and suspenseful game of cat and mouse as his past closes in.','/wXDFtcnYtevleGzCmAD2ReQnJ4l.jpg','2025-10-06',126,'Released','Based on actual events. And terrible decisions.','Roofman',1242419,17.5731,7.052,'GXecSGmQDEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40751,_binary '\0','/dAHEASP8tI4SyZE979gxHFtMTLx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4629032',6.8,2292,'ru','А Зори Здесь Тихие...','It is late spring of 1942, and the Great Patriotic War is in full swing. A long way off from the front-line, at some God-forgotten junction, the Germans make an air landing operation in an attempt to get through to the Kirov railway and the White Sea - the Baltic Sea Canal. These aren\'t just ordinary paratroopers. This is a team of seasoned and highly trained infiltrators, the elite of the Waffen-SS, superhumans. The only thing in their way is an anti-aircraft artillery unit of corporal Vaskov and five young women in training. It may seem like a fight of local significance, but the countrys main strategic transportation artery is at stake. Can the corporal and his \'petite newbies\' prevent Nazi sabotage and at what cost? Television version: An extended version made out of four 45 minute episodes was released on Channel One Russia, on 9 May 2016. Available on PrimeVideo.','/hPeYCHutYtsHibDiSDAfJ4SYedk.jpg','2015-04-30',111,'Released',NULL,'The Dawns Here are Quiet',338517,2.8217,6.764,'DJ3OH0k0syI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40752,_binary '\0','/6kGg5jANkqrQK7X8EJUJCNi9n0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4629266',7.2,4322,'zh','Born in China','Venturing into the wilds of China, \"Born in China\" captures intimate moments with a panda bear and her growing cub, a young golden monkey who feels displaced by his baby sister, and a mother snow leopard struggling to raise her two cubs.','/c8xdrR1ZtCXMmaxyxYwaGSndvV9.jpg','2016-08-12',76,'Released',NULL,'Born in China',355277,3.2898,7.334,'IvrYjm-1mOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40753,_binary '\0','/ti8GDEpvSvXakpIE96nmdqNY18R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4630444',6.2,5587,'en','Being Charlie','Charlie is a troublesome 18-year-old who breaks out of a youth drug treatment clinic, but when he returns home to Los Angeles, he\'s given an intervention by his parents and forced to go to an adult rehab. There, he meets a beautiful but troubled girl, Eva, and is forced to battle with drugs, elusive love and divided parents.','/iYr2MGPOCNiTF5IzrO6ZmoMKbSH.jpg','2016-05-06',97,'Released','Charlie is reckless. Charlie is defiant. Charlie is adrift.','Being Charlie',358895,2.9255,6.145,'_SDAKgyqKNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40754,_binary '\0','/hZuFiZJJTKzmP4haYPA6aiRso99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4630550',6.5,11083,'fr','La Fille inconnue','Jenny, a young doctor who feels guilty after a young woman she refused to see winds up dead a few days later, decides to find out who the girl was, after the police can\'t identify the young woman.','/owxEl8EMMTwiy73L5n5zM9jaTws.jpg','2016-10-05',106,'Released',NULL,'The Unknown Girl',340481,2.7638,6.178,'4TYCCPYdGTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40755,_binary '\0','/3IJ8kG8i84PncXkSovu0PaZQfjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4630562',6.6,278669,'en','The Fate of the Furious','When a mysterious woman seduces Dom into the world of crime and a betrayal of those closest to him, the crew face trials that will test them as never before.','/dImWM7GJqryWJO9LHa3XQ8DD5NH.jpg','2017-04-12',136,'Released','Never give up on family.','The Fate of the Furious',337339,15.3415,6.849,'-9FU7Ia-BKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(4