-11-04',90,'Released','Every Place Has a Past.','The Charnel House',347127,1.4791,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40760,_binary '\0','/zrorHYxfdql7XX0bABNot55Aibk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4633690',7.3,115492,'en','Shot Caller','A newly-released prison gangster is forced by the leaders of his gang to orchestrate a major crime with a brutal rival gang on the streets of Southern California.','/qLmLz2wtyYvmW8Ult3l2ngOnW8v.jpg','2017-07-07',121,'Released','Some criminals are made in prison','Shot Caller',339692,8.5899,6.97,'8wAtS2RMkdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40761,_binary '\0','/1ntePsIqeklfmrQJqZPncCydsqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4633694',8.4,816363,'en','Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse','Struggling to find his place in the world while juggling school and family, Brooklyn teenager Miles Morales is unexpectedly bitten by a radioactive spider and develops unfathomable powers just like the one and only Spider-Man. While wrestling with the implications of his new abilities, Miles discovers a super collider created by the madman Wilson \"Kingpin\" Fisk, causing others from across the Spider-Verse to be inadvertently transported to his dimension.','/iiZZdoQBEYBv6id8su7ImL0oCbD.jpg','2018-12-06',117,'Released','Enter a universe where more than one wears the mask.','Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse',324857,39.3804,8.401,'g4Hbz2jLxvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40762,_binary '\0','/6vTv4OEy7Qq4FGeDpWxBsAXyTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4635372',8.1,36098,'hi','मसान','Four lives intersect along the Ganges: a low caste boy in hopeless love, a daughter ridden with guilt of a sexual encounter ending in a tragedy, a hapless father with fading morality, and a spirited child yearning for a family, long to escape the moral constructs of a small-town.','/wgcPR6Weth2yJDo5wBdNqW2TD6J.jpg','2015-07-24',109,'Released',NULL,'Masaan',336203,1.9683,7.1,'SKJfBo3xMW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40763,_binary '\0','/x0hCTWLX1vaWoDafR6vMUtGwhfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4635548',6.5,1985,'ur','Wrong Number','A story of a middle class guy, passionate about becoming an actor and prove his worthiness to his family. Ditching a job interview as a favor from a father to his son, the story leads to new endeavors.','/z9JmyMmXT1WEvpGbQRpowdUtGqB.jpg','2015-07-18',133,'Released',NULL,'Wrong No.',383056,1.0027,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40764,_binary '\0','/fw6etdxY7L0LW7EoZiW8dAgHRHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4635936',6.9,2520,'de','Schweinskopf al dente','As he tries to win back his ex-girlfriend, a lethargic Lower Bavarian police officer gets sidetracked by a panicky boss and an escaped psychopath.','/w2qzsWnc4NPLcVjZmtQvVHN2do4.jpg','2016-08-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Schweinskopf al dente',350160,1.6519,6.97,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40765,_binary '\0','/8ZHWQ6LSpR0IwbyvEDfzx5lXoSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4636042',6.7,2197,'es','Las elegidas','Sofia, 14 years old, is in love with Ulises. Because of him, in spite of him, she is forced into a prostitution network in Mexico. To set her free, Ulises will have to find another girl to replace her. Adapted from Jorge Volpi’s novel, set in the world of juvenile prostitution.','/a0Zpnhi8ltBEETEdrCroBKynNDh.jpg','2015-08-02',105,'Released','You will not believe in love again','The Chosen Ones',336201,2.2061,6.302,'r0JVZ4OkAI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40766,_binary '\0','/zunxtWUyAPKiWEHOrDO2AjeCRFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4636046',6.3,2178,'fa','ناهید','A young divorcee living with her son in a small northern city of Iran, wants to marry the man she has fallen in love with. According to the current rules, the father has the custody of children; however, her ex-husband has granted her that right on the condition that she doesn’t remarry. Struggling to keep both of her beloved ones, she has to think about the third option: Temporary Marriage (Sighe). However, this will get her into a predicament, as despite its being legal, Sighe is not well-received by the society at all. Would temporary marriage be a good solution for her?','/u9D9KTf9ps5h7H3NHitleMJB0ng.jpg','2015-11-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Nahid',336212,1.3252,6.371,'FZ7NDjzJqcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40767,_binary '\0','/tjjgn7dkE2gtTsh8If9kkksgqvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4636298',6.8,2343,'ja','orange-オレンジ-','A girl mysteriously receives advice from her future self and as a result her group of friends, along with a newly arrived, troubled classmate, learn how to be better friends and a better community.','/24bpPkmOTfgOAnKBpeIgFM6pD6x.jpg','2015-12-12',139,'Released','If I had known what would happen, I would have done things differently. I would have stayed by your side','Orange',359171,2.8241,7.3,'fCd0ZAZ0h1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40768,_binary '\0','/qWxgWY7rfbEuCZS4LzqS5dNulEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4638148',5.3,4651,'en','Braid','Two drug dealers on the lam seek refuge inside their mentally unstable friend’s mansion. But in order to stay, they have to participate in her elaborate—and increasingly dangerous—game of permanent make-believe.','/sp8dzGdwBh3cDU8ygyjtoejfZzI.jpg','2019-01-10',85,'Released','Everyone plays. Nobody leaves.','Braid',510284,1.984,5.7,'12MwotP2tz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40769,_binary '\0','/puAmHhymh1Iq8x9LqfxvrAQSSOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4640206',8.4,8713,'hi','Sachin: A Billion Dreams','Sachin Tendulkar plays himself in this sports-docudrama that traces the life and times of one of the world’s biggest cricket phenomenas.​','/ysOy2g2NcDRszOM8YF14aru82fy.jpg','2017-05-26',139,'Released',NULL,'Sachin: A Billion Dreams',401552,1.7234,7.386,'8gTeE6pa4Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40770,_binary '\0','/9jfjlXj9GGZDK2vEWMKe9OETfad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4641248',6.3,1459,'fr','Le voyage au Groenland','Thomas and Thomas are going through a rough patch: they are both thirty-something actors living in Paris. They randomly decide to leave the city and fly away to Kullorsuaq, one of the most remote villages of Greenland, where Thomas\' father Nathan lives. Among the Inuit community, they will discover the charms of the local customs and their friendship will be challenged.','/aVHA9WrWlTudWzfGY0gKAM1ghKY.jpg','2016-11-30',98,'Released',NULL,'Journey to Greenland',396920,1.3093,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40771,_binary '\0','/cUaCo18ykzvpeaCKjSCmicMRQz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4642044',5.1,4197,'en','Riot','Copper Jack Stone purposefully orchestrates a bank robbery in order to be thrown into prison with the notorious Russian kingpin Balam. Balam is more than just a mob criminal; he\'s a very cunning and dangerous lord who controls the police force from behind bars. Balam lives in prison as a cover for his real power, which is King of the city. His cell is a lavish private room built specifically for him, inaccessible to most in the depths of the prison structure. Even the warden fears venturing into his area of the prison. However, even surrounded by his loyal henchmen and guards in his sectioned off fortress, Balam doesn\'t know Jack is coming for him to avenge his family, who Balam murdered in cold blood. Balam is tough... but Jack is tougher.','/5Q2pHzDfJ8QlUA2vx2yAXWJkof7.jpg','2015-09-27',88,'Released','Caged to kill.','Riot',360055,4.6149,5.586,'GuNTnECwQsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40772,_binary '\0','/8n4aiFihHkFLsezZIY4Rp34jH9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4642192',7.3,7846,'de','Trautmann','The story of a man whose love for football, for England and for the love of his life, Margaret, saw him rise from Nazi \'villain\' to British hero. Bert Trautmann, the German goalkeeper won over even his harshest opponents by winning the FA Cup Final for Manchester City in 1956 - playing on with a broken neck to secure victory.','/nNPsc5USXEr90FoFaXXljaC1O3r.jpg','2018-12-05',114,'Released','He won her love and our hearts and minds','The Keeper',489763,2.723,7.4,'fn3gUlcF-9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40773,_binary '\0','/h1sVzrbPrsNoNFlpzh2TGWuDyru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4642970',3.9,2064,'en','Llamageddon','A killer llama from outer space crash lands on Earth and brings death and destruction to everyone in its path.','/gKRBmTbBYth3w1dluAmWoQdJPMo.jpg','2015-04-20',69,'Released','A Wooly Terror from Space!','Llamageddon',569957,1.4593,4.958,'lXBLv71E3bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40774,_binary '\0','/hYUNtgzEqaOnzfuUCsLD0b0yyTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4643432',7,1581,'fr','Dans les forêts de Sibérie','Fed up with the hectic, senseless world he lives in, Teddy decides to settle down alone in Siberia, in the midst of winter, in a hut by the shore of Lake Baikal. After an initial period of elation in front of the splendor and magic of unspoiled nature, Teddy soon finds himself confronted with the less glossy side of things : solitude, extreme cold, the necessity to find food, danger... One night Teddy gets lost in a blizzard and would be doomed to a certain death, were it not for Aleksei, a Russian convict living hidden away in the forest nearby, who rescues him in extremis. Friendship soon blossoms between the two men...','/gAZhLgt9HOdTWj3bFDNPAOzo40l.jpg','2016-06-15',105,'Released',NULL,'In the Forests of Siberia',395452,1.7036,6.774,'yvMFofZlfzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40775,_binary '\0','/Ant957vTnlFwOvyLdCu0OKrPCe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4643580',5.8,1411,'es','Un gallo con muchos huevos','Toto has grown and now is a young cock. An evil rancher tricks the female owner of the ranch where they live and forces her to bet the property in a cockfight in the arena. Toto is the only option to defend their home, so he must train in just one week and win the championship of the arena.','/6ZkiGjyBcP1KAbpBYHwdVclpYqa.jpg','2015-09-04',99,'Released',NULL,'Huevos: Little Rooster\'s Egg-Cellent Adventure',264419,4.2639,7.028,'_rf8BshVm7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40776,_binary '\0','/5MFI9VPex4QO4JosxJfCueA12Qu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4643844',6.6,4775,'it','Se Dio vuole','The son of an atheist, authoritarian father, believed to be liberal, wants to become a priest.','/xsgsVyYxXoeM5gQHHNHXNl6fyUN.jpg','2015-04-09',87,'Released',NULL,'God Willing',335051,1.694,6.5,'YyqSHKH-E4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40777,_binary '\0','/cq7FaG52CHG6ASOCd7riKuBpOCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4644302',6.8,1882,'ur','Bin Roye','An ambitious girl seeks out her destiny and true love , when tables start to take a turn she meets a man who gives her a completely new perspective to life and love.','/iymGOzYJWgYqGb3sB2GjmpO077q.jpg','2015-07-17',116,'Released',NULL,'Bin Roye',349006,1.875,6,'zqf6VenDRLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40778,_binary '\0','/xESy6kg2k4JsGzHU0ILkOL9qYec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4644382',6.7,5176,'zh','西游记之大圣归来','The all-powerful Monkey King once roamed freely between Heaven and Earth, but after angering the Gods, he was imprisoned within an ice cage deep within the mountains. 500 years later, monsters attack a small village and a child flees to the mountains. Unknowingly, the child releases the Monkey King from his curse. With the help and encouragement from this special child, Monkey King saves the village from the evil monsters.','/xHme10Y5jVdH8KeSGgStndjatF5.jpg','2015-07-10',89,'Released',NULL,'Monkey King: Hero Is Back',351694,3.9354,6.938,'v33o9deALkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40779,_binary '\0','/rnNj2g7BhPIjxs0WR5VS2f0im7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4645330',6.8,25552,'en','