tt4651466',6.3,10615,'en','Joe Bell','The true story of a small town, working class father who embarks on a solo walk across the U.S. to crusade against bullying after his son is tormented in high school for being gay.','/9HfQD60w6f6PPkfdiI6ipJSw0bD.jpg','2020-09-14',93,'Released','Redemption is a journey you can\'t take alone.','Joe Bell',552269,3.2935,6.5,'Q9hNIzP6ycM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40791,_binary '\0','/zci26eN6YKEg9gPLUp3wB5eqcEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4651520',6.2,142233,'en','Bad Moms','When three overworked and under-appreciated moms are pushed beyond their limits, they ditch their conventional responsibilities for a jolt of long overdue freedom, fun, and comedic self-indulgence.','/u9q10ljhkLj0tNCjlVqe3DCjoU4.jpg','2016-07-28',100,'Released','Party like a mother.','Bad Moms',376659,12.0477,6.479,'2RZbwGItfd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40792,_binary '\0','/gzginYrMyQUBHgT29GRhzrr113t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4651666',5.6,1599,'en','Camera Store','On the eve of the transition from film to digital, the longtime denizens of a camera store confront their personal issues in this darkly comic story.','/jsnP7Tat547TESHT2mp3aABGH47.jpg','2016-12-09',99,'Released',NULL,'Camera Store',429135,1.6959,5.8,'qQWGgE6w0jg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40793,_binary '\0','/rpsuxOvGgVBKmQELkPPNigjW9qO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4652532',5.4,6144,'en','The Warriors Gate','After a mysterious chest opens a gateway through time, teen gamer Jack is transported to an ancient empire terrorized by a cruel barbarian king. Jack will need all of his gaming skills as he battles to defeat the barbarian, protect a beautiful princess, and somehow find his way back home.','/8l2DHcrCTgy1XuFHZmL2BbClJVO.jpg','2016-11-18',108,'Released',NULL,'The Warriors Gate',413658,4.7019,6.596,'DTixFRwNKq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40794,_binary '\0','/oSS43fHkamqQzgqXVOUD9q6Hq4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4652650',6.7,17480,'en','Please Stand By','A young autistic woman runs away from her caregiver in order to boldly go and deliver her 500-page Star Trek script to a writing competition in Hollywood. On an adventure full of laughter and tears, Wendy follows the guiding spirit of Mr. Spock on her journey into the unknown.','/yKhrjxmbdCjdxROc7lJhmfZ9trx.jpg','2018-01-26',93,'Released','Boldly go.','Please Stand By',338768,5.299,6.766,'1LIzNUOkUqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40795,_binary '\0','/45e2hqAi4jjqGmbD6rqrWn6rANP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4653586',4.5,3436,'en','The Drowning','A psychiatrist faces his past, present and future when he finds himself involved in the treatment of a young man recently released from prison for a murder committed when the boy was just 11 years old.','/2wBAtIPUvBK4FORbXXAocy2qxFL.jpg','2016-10-08',95,'Released','If evil exists, can it be transformed?','The Drowning',420260,2.2126,4.5,'06ZGnJAd84U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40796,_binary '\0','/acrobzwFeqaK4sMbxxBp4ULY9CH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4654844',6.9,1449,'en','Bitcoin: The End of Money as We Know It','A documentary exploring how money and the trading of value has evolved, culminating in Bitcoin.','/cWrR0aGwodD4bXjSwBFVvwKvw1k.jpg','2015-07-18',60,'Released','A Documentary About Money - And the Controversial Crypto-Currency Bitcoin','Bitcoin: The End of Money as We Know It',349086,0.846,6.6,'lUF6klWuB38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40797,_binary '\0','/y8YJ0yEFe7hDUcJlXIVJWKh2dRm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4658324',6.9,1456,'en','Garage Sale Mystery: The Wedding Dress','Jennifer Shannon has made a career of finding rare garage sale treasures to resell at the consignment store she owns with her business partner, Dani. When she finds a wedding dress that was worn on the day a groom went missing, Jennifer uses her knack for solving puzzles to investigate this unsolved cold case. After meeting the dress’s original owner, Helen, and finding traces of blood on the dress, Jennifer digs deeper into the decades-old mystery with the help of Detective Lynwood, and the support of her husband, Jason. With every clue that Jennifer uncovers, she gets closer to either finding the long-missing groom, or uncovering a wedding day murder.','/xae9wfwffK0QQ0VT8nyQkj19RvW.jpg','2015-08-09',83,'Released',NULL,'Garage Sale Mystery: The Wedding Dress',348630,1.7445,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40798,_binary '\0','/rVD8VZjxoglyEFjT017u89k2W84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4658578',6.8,2099,'en','Love Under the Stars','Young at heart graduate student Becca strikes up an unlikely friendship with Emily, a quiet girl who recently lost her mother. With every passing play date chaperoned by Emily\'s father, Becca helps Emily come out of her shell and cope with her loss, and Emily teaches Becca to take on adult responsibilities. When a romance develops between Becca and Nate, though, the two must learn to balance their new relationship with Nate\'s responsibility to Emily, and with Becca\'s responsibility to finish her education.','/hx2jS5Jv8Dx5tdb9YpdSTpHed3Q.jpg','2015-08-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Love Under the Stars',354980,1.7773,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40799,_binary '\0','/Ai4t9pqKnApzeN6G2bjC5M9D1N5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4658770',8.5,3157,'bn','Belaseshe','A story of relationships that explores the intricacies of the married life, of life-long companionship, of promises and expectations and love.','/9Vk11czZi8TUim4bOyxZIPgPByK.jpg','2015-05-01',141,'Released',NULL,'Belaseshe',400655,0.9914,6.944,'KmzItQaDON4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40800,_binary '\0','/uCQHvkb2GX9obScSpMr58KS3rrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4659056',7.9,6700,'da','Der kommer en dag','Set in the blooming 1960s, the film centres on two young brothers who are instantly robbed of their lives when they are placed in a boy\'s home forgotten by time. Armed only with a vivid imagination and a fickle hope, the boys engage in the frightening battle against Headmaster Heck and his lethal tyranny. The film is based on actual events.','/5uhyTqMnbhKODsah5MA2AO0drPt.jpg','2016-04-21',119,'Released','Some have power, others have bravery.','The Day Will Come',348675,2.3935,7.557,'pK_Q5TO4O8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40801,_binary '\0','/Al4VabdLNPYjZWmcyWTYzZB5l3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4660736',6.6,1915,'ms','Apprentice','When ambitious young correctional officer Aiman is transferred to the country\'s highest-security prison, he catches the attention of the seasoned chief executioner Rahim. Aiman\'s desire to become the hangman\'s apprentice is not only professional but born of an unspeakable urge to reconnect with a past that haunts him.','/vp6ZqO6No0NbfcpwSmcQCyLU2SZ.jpg','2016-06-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Apprentice',391709,1.05,6.9,'AxY3zZCqeTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40802,_binary '\0','/y7Hl129EQtxvAS3ERMUvcojpAc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4660980',5.8,7890,'en','The Bad Education Movie','Mr Wickers takes his class on a final trip to Cornwall, which descends into chaos as they encounter a local separatist group.','/vogRAk91jydEuP11xRJSVbaVBnr.jpg','2015-08-21',90,'Released','Best school trip ever!','The Bad Education Movie',348296,2.8742,5.768,'gSLFUsHAXTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40803,_binary '\0','/vRongtodPwC2LLhbOaPFSnJjsEl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4661798',5.9,4891,'en','Joshy','After his engagement ends badly, Josh decides to take advantage of his bachelor-party plans in Ojai, California, with the few friends still willing to join him. Focused on drugs and their own hangups, his self-absorbed friends refuse to confront the elephant in the room and ask Josh how he’s feeling. As welcome and unwelcome guests stop by, Josh will attempt to find some closure over this weekend with the guys.','/qccbXBSGXopEmDN9BoFeWV5EgDA.jpg','2016-08-12',93,'Released','Wedding\'s off. Party\'s on.','Joshy',352695,2.4991,5.637,'AIuTnHvLVMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40804,_binary '\0','/uWTUq6jZjcuTWeMildcGCHUQqoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4662396',3.9,2690,'en','Sable','Caught between her dreams of a better life, a rich mobster who thinks he owns her and an unstable boyfriend who has just killed a man, Sable must take control of her own life or she may find herself dead by dawn.','/8XIaasOxl1yiWm9vlnckzYdbjtw.jpg','2017-02-22',85,'Released','Careful what you wish for.','Sable',454514,1.1954,5,'vUDjnmTJZl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40805,_binary '\0','/rcwSeOaSy8Ph71VHw6EzwB36uoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4662412',7.6,1641,'en','Signed, Sealed, Delivered: From Paris with Love','The Postables, Oliver, Shane, Rita and Norman, explore the mystery of true love as they deliver divorce papers to one couple the same day Oliver\'s missing wife reappears.','/q03Qy0JLnrE72Dfbva4di9k57Xb.jpg','2015-06-06',84,'Released',NULL,'Signed, Sealed, Delivered: From Paris with Love',338485,2.0633,7,'2RgHcg51QOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40806,_binary '\0','/uLMtVKZ073DT2iAYkA0J9IEJ882.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4662420',5.8,8585,'en','All Nighter','When a globe-trotting, workaholic father trying to visit his daughter on a last minute layover in Los Angeles discovers that she’s disappeared, he forces her awkward, nervous ex-boyfriend, still nursing a broken heart, to help him find her over the course of one increasingly crazy night.','/ciNUrbNv871umQ3IqvIOjet4s4E.jpg','2017-03-10',86,'Released','The fastest way to get over an ex? Stay up all night with her dad.','All Nighter',352501,3.5054,5.7,'k8NZ1taP-Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40807,_binary '\0','/gGOJqkpJ6xRyu9YMikSKC6LyoRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4663548',6.3,2343,'en','All Saints','Michael Spurlock decides to trade in his corporate sales career to become a pastor. Unfortunately, his first assignment is to close a country church and sell the prime piece of land where it sits. He soon has a change of heart when the church starts to welcome refugees from Burma. Spurlock now finds himself working with the refugees to turn the land into a working farm to pay the church\'s bills.','/sIE5BafMU0gPYOqBSiYzTxmHqGM.jpg','2017-08-25',108,'Released',NULL,'All Saints',450806,2.6829,6.2,'IaMfIvCTY-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40808,_binary '\0','/l2KA5mBDz5NwHCle3kIfXN8tVtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4663992',7.1,2018,'es','La tierra y la sombra','Alfonso is an old farmer who has returned home to tend to his son, who is gravely ill. He rediscovers his old house, where the woman who was once his wife still lives, with his daughter-in-law and grandson. The landscape that awaits him resembles a wasteland. Vast sugar cane plantations surround the house, producing perpetual clouds of ash. 17 years after abandoning them, Alfonso tries to fit back in and save his family.','/se4W7dzlEFGpQYge73Nx9IfMh5P.jpg','2015-07-23',97,'Released',NULL,'Land and Shade',336669,1.3807,7,'UG3citOqODI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40809,_binary '\0','/27wJFhmfT7UHkVBVajTrD6v7HgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4665630',5.4,6583,'da','Swinger','Munch-Fals’ script follows Adam, who has so far been spoiled by life – a good job, a lovely wife, an expensive villa, an independent son – but still it isn’t good enough. Even the swinger weekend trips he has been taking with his wife have become a joyless routine, and his youthful optimism and appetite for life are distant memories. Then, one day, at another swingers’ club, he does what swingers don’t do – he falls in love.','/onpa3W5Q4oUqiaa6vVdp473Q6XI.jpg','2016-09-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Swinger',412013,3.7426,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40810,_binary '\0','/bb5BtQv2hfbgKMOcWtnu5y5RlPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4666726',6.9,18107,'en','Christine','In 1974, television reporter Christine Chubbuck struggles with depression and professional frustrations as she tries to advance her career.','/enZy6Yx6sjdOXxcnQVC200RjeKM.jpg','2016-10-14',123,'Released','The shocking true story that changed the face of television.','Christine',339405,3.1542,6.9,'Nwo_V3SiQHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40811,_binary '\0','/9yXhuQ5rLpKEyiDFl9kxSQyu7QN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4667084',5.3,1635,'en','The Unseen','A man, who years earlier mysteriously abandoned his family and isolated himself in a small northern town, returns for one last chance to reconnect with his troubled daughter. When she goes missing, he risks everything to find her, including exposing the fact that he is becoming invisible.','/fNZeKZ2U6hAZRH9HouFN5tdEarf.jpg','2016-07-17',110,'Released',NULL,'The Unseen',399611,1.8901,5.8,'LXQDoW2IsoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40812,_binary '\0','/y6VYJEvzWhTCXrrv0ubiczOpVND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4667094',3.6,24976,'en','Fifty Shades of Black','An inexperienced college student meets a wealthy businessman whose sexual practices put a strain on their relationship.','/nkGhv7WMbyX7tL8CJkvMY3S2lW.jpg','2016-01-28',92,'Released','Way shadier than gray.','Fifty Shades of Black',351819,7.8127,4.885,'m5dM_MPytkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40813,_binary '\0','/xywle3yMnKbbuUaFhDMtGo1n6aw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4667854',5.3,8396,'en','Siren','A bachelor party becomes a savage fight for survival when the groomsmen unwittingly unleash a fabled predator upon the festivities.','/dAEodQQODOtOlhiQQTW7n1eS9ft.jpg','2016-12-02',82,'Released','No man can resist her. All men should.','Siren',355506,3.844,6,'tbimw-wAuUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40814,_binary '\0','/viO8iowUtKxOmHAJmtRL5HEmkS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4668808',7.1,1228,'en','What Our Fathers Did: A Nazi Legacy','Can you imagine what it means to grow up as the child of a mass murderer? Hans Frank and Otto von Wächter were indicted as war criminals for their roles in WWII. Nazi Governors and consultants to Hitler himself, the two are collectively responsible for thousands of deaths. But what stood out to Philippe Sands were the impressions they left on their sons. While researching the Nuremberg trials, the human rights lawyer came across two men who re-focused his studies: Niklas Frank and Horst von Wächter. The men hold polar opposite views on the men who raised them.','/n7i41SR4QDKJnpGoClt6rrvOqiw.jpg','2015-04-19',90,'Released',NULL,'What Our Fathers Did: A Nazi Legacy',333356,0.9417,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40815,_binary '\0','/d4pIsjOiPz8CUhkBCXFJVxSwNDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669186',6,10339,'en','Kevin Hart: What Now?','Comedian Kevin Hart performs in front of a crowd of 50,000 people at Philadelphia\'s outdoor venue, Lincoln Financial Field.','/lFg4tx0jAYkgrcm1bPBlM0FbQvH.jpg','2016-10-14',96,'Released','The comedy event of the year.','Kevin Hart: What Now?',339927,2.6773,6.467,'d3R4rxv33sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40816,_binary '\0','/zE78a3ytDf6ZI9EK9RBs2W74lRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669210',6.5,1322,'el','Νοτιάς','It is a movie following the coming-of-age for a boy; the story begins in the mid-60s, continues all through the 70s, and finishes in 1981. He is a creative young man facing the troubles of the first pangs of love and we observe the way he tries to handle them within his social surroundings, his family, and environment.','/gY1UTd4cwAKjGF423s0HKUvbeni.jpg','2016-01-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Mythopathy',377565,0.9907,5.8,'spLrwd7LNlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40817,_binary '\0','/1nQLjdiGjl8R76DTbjd3TRqgsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669252',6.2,6921,'en','Georgetown','Ulrich Mott is an eccentric and versatile social climber with grandiose plans to affect United States foreign policy. Encouraged in his attempts by his strategically chosen (and much older) wife, the well-connected journalist Elsa Brecht, Mott has a knack for making himself indispensable and impossible to ignore. The only one seemingly immune to his charms is Elsa\'s daughter Amanda, who might simply disapprove of her mother marrying a much younger man - or perhaps she senses something more sinister beneath the smooth-talking surface?','/pfBZObVPRNFA47jU22iaYH19Rdy.jpg','2019-05-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Georgetown',339395,3.7704,5.938,'-ch3BdXOgyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40818,_binary '\0','/4CEwPhuexYCi3I3ASaaOGTeP4sB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669264',6.5,27246,'en','Beirut','In 1980s Beirut, Mason Skiles is a former U.S. diplomat who is called back into service to save a colleague from the group that is possibly responsible for his own family\'s death. Meanwhile, a CIA field agent who is working under cover at the American embassy is tasked with keeping Mason alive and ensuring that the mission is a success.','/s2qIeFsI9TskZr1LkSwljQDh5nl.jpg','2018-04-11',109,'Released','Beirut, 1982: The Paris of the Middle East Was Burning','Beirut',399248,3.9685,6.287,'SagsqxiVStM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40819,_binary '\0','/93kwn65NnKX5SaTFmFWJBwx28km.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669278',3.5,2313,'en','The Sound','A writer who studies the paranormal believes that low frequency tactile sound is the cause for reported ghost sightings in an abandoned subway station. In an attempt to debunk the sightings, she breaks into the station to record evidence.','/swghccaPcYwO2tvf1Wv8mpeNLUn.jpg','2017-09-29',92,'Released',NULL,'The Sound',441647,1.8855,4.7,'Ju9HJRb1A04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40820,_binary '\0','/oaDTXNmyqeNEEBat3h4ijiu27jv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669296',6.6,22908,'en','Lords of Chaos','A teenager\'s quest to launch Norwegian Black Metal in Oslo in the 1990s results in a very violent outcome.','/5jDShbwEsILXa2AAmAbOLxyNwyq.jpg','2018-09-20',118,'Released','Based on truth and lies.','Lords of Chaos',426249,3.5369,6.789,'E4l6IJVX2bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40821,_binary '\0','/iRl2k4TMhfESV2W3ygu3OmIVVwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669788',7.1,42754,'en','On the Basis of Sex','Young lawyer Ruth Bader Ginsburg teams with her husband Marty to bring a groundbreaking case before the U.S. Court of Appeals and overturn a century of sex discrimination.','/izY9Le3QWtu7xkHq7bjJnuE5yGI.jpg','2018-12-25',120,'Released','Her story made history','On the Basis of Sex',339380,6.8135,7.328,'28dHbIR_NB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40822,_binary '\0','/scpWtLGk723uoc2Ke8cFvvYEKpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669954',7.4,1630,'vi','Tôi Thấy Hoa Vàng Trên Cỏ Xanh','After and act of violence leaves his brother Tuong paralyzed, Thieu discovers the true meaning of brotherhood.','/fOF8EmgVeoNkayCkem0RWa3LUa5.jpg','2015-10-02',103,'Released',NULL,'Yellow Flowers On the Green Grass',361996,1.5116,6.9,'IdptyJajjSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40823,_binary '\0','/zjvX2vJmm3f25JujVEp5DEu2eKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4669986',7,38755,'en','Loving','In 1958, in the state of Virginia, the idea of interracial marriage was not only considered to be immoral to many, it was also illegal. When Richard and Mildred fall in love, they are aware of the eyes staring at them and the words said behind their backs. It\'s when they get married, however, that words and looks become actions, and the two are arrested. The couple decide to take their case all of the way to the Supreme Court in order to fight for their love. Based on a true story.','/teNPeDIRGWxtvMaJsNa7lw5IgiL.jpg','2016-11-04',123,'Released','All love is created equal.','Loving',339419,4.1983,6.7,'33g-ZHBQdNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40824,_binary '\0','/jhiEMUkuA4VGKfyvKd31BEG3YSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4670016',4.5,4971,'en','Wolves at the Door','Four friends gather at an elegant home during the Summer of Love, 1969. Unbeknownst to them, deadly visitors are waiting outside. What begins as a simple farewell party turns to a night of primal terror as the intruders stalk and torment the four, who struggle for their lives against what appears to be a senseless attack.','/kizBwSEfvJFEOuYfwbOGtWZit3v.jpg','2016-10-21',73,'Released','When night falls, the wolves will hunt.','Wolves at the Door',363111,5.1162,4.9,'ENznX3rF6kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40825,_binary '\0','/j0gs2ROuekTCy9X4oSfYxbOZ6by.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4671002',5.8,4606,'en','American Fable','When 11-year-old Gitty discovers that her father, Abe, a good and beloved farmer, is holding a wealthy man hostage in their abandoned silo in order to save their suffering farm, she befriends the captive in secret. As the truth unfolds about who he is and what will happen if he escapes, Gitty chooses to confront the thin line between reality and fiction.','/8nPw1b17fsM4xxyKs1iuGLmufOq.jpg','2017-02-17',96,'Released',NULL,'American Fable',381064,1.779,6.1,'RfQkdIoDjQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40826,_binary '\0','/o7MJbUO1CVV36aAqXC8hWC9w1sh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4671274',7.2,2539,'ja','リップヴァンウィンクルの花嫁','A woman hires actors and strangers to pretend to be her friends and family at her wedding.','/vBg6R0XcrpsECIThvRmuOdjg1Mi.jpg','2016-03-17',179,'Released',NULL,'A Bride for Rip Van Winkle',382170,2.3846,6.851,'xkYUxu0X3mM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40827,_binary '\0','/x3d9lqBUNb2DumTbl8y9TouvK2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4671326',6.4,3612,'en','Prisoner\'s Daughter','Released from prison with terminal cancer, Max tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter and the grandson he’s never known. When his daughter’s abusive, drug-addicted ex-husband reappears, Max’s violent past comes back to haunt them all.','/2NYd7jKFnilcIOUfDI8o2TOuCmu.jpg','2023-06-30',98,'Released',NULL,'Prisoner\'s Daughter',865382,2.7502,6.2,'Kba-W1IqA3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40828,_binary '\0','/3CY9cow0Oizei7pp5m2NgssHyCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4675030',3.7,3651,'hi','ग्रेट ग्रांड मस्ती','Amar, Meet and Prem go into a small town where they encounter a \'femme fatale\' in the form of Ragini. Ragini is everything they had dreamed of, but she slowly turns into their worst nightmare!','/559bTjMQH24qwxdft4QppvUy8IT.jpg','2016-07-15',127,'Released',NULL,'Great Grand Masti',403862,1.2806,3.837,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40829,_binary '\0','/9Ras4ys6rr51mwdIgFZCzk9rAUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4676508',6,1638,'fa','شاهزاده روم','Princess of Rome, Mellika, granddaughter of Great Caesar. The story talks about her move from Byzantium in the 9th century, to avoid her marriage with Krytos, and brings her to Baghdad to become the mother of Imam Mahdi, the Savior.','/e2I41ElBtMNz0tsgm6knRBamzc2.jpg','2015-11-04',76,'Released',NULL,'Princess of Rome',387268,0.8636,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40830,_binary '\0','/6D3nXTNmDBbOzyFER1wqy66ibm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4677134',5.9,2229,'en','Homeless Ashes','A young runaway ends up homeless with no choice but to try to survive life on the streets.','/aQ066tli26Q4tmVVZw3s9F6UrUF.jpg','2019-09-23',117,'Released','Homeless, not invisible','Homeless Ashes',618830,1.2381,7,'RuzoPUTMWL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40831,_binary '\0','/7b65xb3CgjbmYmWO4RPeuqI0bg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4677578',6.7,1622,'no','Løvekvinnen','Eva Arctander is born with hypertrichosis, meaning that she is covered from head to toe with fine blonde hair. Her father is so ashamed of her that he hides her away from the world in their apartment. However, Eva’s nanny fights for her right to be treated like everyone else.','/3jE3pFIN42ykmgcMLwDGjqwcmUI.jpg','2016-08-26',126,'Released',NULL,'The Lion Woman',377690,2.1964,6.8,'Km6r3MrNc-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40832,_binary '\0','/mCDtYK962oCEqNBZ7nWkheBXCIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4677924',4.2,2606,'en','Woodshock','Theresa, a haunted young woman spiraling in the wake of profound loss, is torn between her fractured emotional state and the reality-altering effects of a potent cannabinoid drug.','/oXbgY04zMSqMKdNLTcSMP6m5sSF.jpg','2017-09-22',101,'Released',NULL,'Woodshock',396777,1.9892,4.4,'RpscZ_YD-ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40833,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4679136',6.6,1490,'en','I\'ll Sleep When I\'m Dead','An energetic and fast-paced bio-doc that examines the story behind one of the most prolific and well-known DJs working today: Steve Aoki.','/1Hbq1mXv1cRBAV7UfbxixXdev1Z.jpg','2016-04-15',82,'Released','The loud life of Steve Aoki','I\'ll Sleep When I\'m Dead',390782,1.844,6.4,'WYrittJaatM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40834,_binary '\0','/d8FBRbCNsAU25YScpKCT3dp46gD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4679210',8.3,28919,'ml','പ്രേമം','Three stages in George\'s life, and three girls he encounters in each stage.','/wfMgsfDrtouYOM6MbrkHtU96Xij.jpg','2015-05-29',157,'Released',NULL,'Premam',341895,2.0025,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40835,_binary '\0','/1ddf2Kq1hC7SgV02E3pyLAC26lq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4680182',6.2,75783,'en','Colossal','A woman discovers that severe catastrophic events are somehow connected to the mental breakdown from which she\'s suffering.','/4VOyofBd1pexblxtDZYtYIk7NI4.jpg','2017-04-06',109,'Released','There\'s a monster in all of us',