o survive.','/hkmz9rxgcweizXNElozGeKwmAJE.jpg','2016-01-22',101,'Released','Nature just got gangster.','Hunt for the Wilderpeople',371645,10.6061,7.642,'XTk3DpccpUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40884,_binary '\0','/sEbtzGOgAo1A16geR9jRSHTgDRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4698718',6.5,1798,'en','The Bridge','The sweeping tale of Molly Callens and Ryan Kelly, two young students who share a profound friendship their first semester in college, a time that becomes the defining moment of their lives.','/xkr1V9MUR5nDmlp0GoIbUAz4puo.jpg','2015-12-06',89,'Released',NULL,'The Bridge',366630,1.8789,6.2,'lguDROurZdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40885,_binary '\0','/9MuOJJ3V99YBwOafgYC6D2qimvr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4698792',5.5,1637,'en','V.C. Andrews\' My Sweet Audrina','Living in her family\'s secluded mansion, Audrina is kept alone and out of sight and is haunted by nightmares of her older sister, First Audrina, who was left for dead in the woods after an attack. As she begins to question her past and her disturbing dreams, the grim truth is slowly revealed.','/x7e3vdrJ20TuKnyluycIxVTqNzM.jpg','2016-01-09',85,'Released',NULL,'V.C. Andrews\' My Sweet Audrina',377186,4.5241,5.4,'cUkdcCJC7nE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40886,_binary '\0','/j0xUhsJ6Z9z5hk17dpWmqRiadh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4699202',6.4,2648,'hi','गुड़गांव','A real estate baron Kehri Singh manages \'Preet Real Estate\' which he runs in his daughter\'s name whom he consider\'s to be his lucky mascot. A sidelined and insulted Nikki Singh is ignored by his father and is considered to be insolent, useless and unlucky. In order to pay off a huge debt to a local criminal, Nikki sets off a chilling event that forces his father to revisit his dark past and confront a brutal truth.','/jWdvx1EaGzQRu43ulw1bj0cjDjn.jpg','2017-08-04',107,'Released',NULL,'Gurgaon',432140,1.0188,5.214,'_oUl9NfYlS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40887,_binary '\0','/7SIyCeKoLDhGGVfElwf37cdSykS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4699388',6.3,10083,'fr','Un homme à la hauteur','Diane is a well-known lawyer, divorced for three years. She loses her mobile telephone and receives a call from the person who finds it. That person is Alexandre, a charming man and the perfect gentleman. They make a connection over the phone and agree to meet up the following day. But when Alexandre arrives, there\'s a surprise in store when Diane discovers he is only 4\' 6\" tall. From that moment on, Diane tries to overcome the prejudices of society and her own fears to experience the best time of her life...','/vBOioZKaGacNtx8G7qZeTPqemk7.jpg','2016-05-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Up for Love',366514,4.3543,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40888,_binary '\0','/nEgdpyeaJ1gjh7tY3bKWeESJnbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4699534',5.8,2320,'es','Tenemos que hablar','Nuria is a young girl with a good life, a boyfriend to marry him and a parents who love her, but a problem: she still is married with Jorge. Former CEO, Jorge lives almost in the ruin together his ex boss and friend Lucas. After two years separated, Jorge doesn\'t forget her, but Nuria tries to ask him files for divorce when she wrongly discovers that Jorge has tried to commit suicide jumping by a window. Feeling responsible by it, Nuria talks with her parents Miguel and Patricia, according cheat Jorge for that he beliefs that they aren\'t divorced and Miguel didn\'t lose his company due to the Jorge\'s bad business inversions that ruined his parents-in-law, in order to get the divorce without pain for anybody. The real problem is what when the lies accumulate, the situation is each time more dangerously out of control.','/rkHj0IzLI1bHZOyrnnKD3aUkY3R.jpg','2016-02-26',91,'Released',NULL,'We Need to Talk',347666,1.6991,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40889,_binary '\0','/hMANgfPHR1tRObNp2oPiOi9mMlz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4701182',6.7,211976,'en','Bumblebee','On the run in the year 1987, Bumblebee finds refuge in a junkyard in a small Californian beach town. Charlie, on the cusp of turning 18 and trying to find her place in the world, discovers Bumblebee, battle-scarred and broken. When Charlie revives him, she quickly learns this is no ordinary yellow VW bug.','/fw02ONlDhrYjTSZV8XO6hhU3ds3.jpg','2018-11-22',114,'Released','Every hero has a beginning.','Bumblebee',424783,13.1667,6.7,'fAIX12F6958','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40890,_binary '\0','/gSz01IaN06BrCMFwCbUeBPh9X1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4701660',6.2,11131,'zh','美人鱼','When Xuan\'s real estate project threatens the home of mermaids, Shan is sent to stop him. When they fall in love, he is encouraged to cancel the project. However, he must save them from bigger danger.','/8YVB8VxQqx3J1FtOVvoHybBKNPS.jpg','2016-02-08',94,'Released','Half Fish, Half Human, 100% Assassin.','The Mermaid',381890,5.4424,6.556,'6yJCJIZP9iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40891,_binary '\0','/2OpJhmQ5zZjYRn0CynNcWgFQkow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4701688',7.1,3877,'ta','டிமான்டி காலனி','Four friends go into a haunted mansion on a whim but they do not realize that they have returned home with an evil spirit, from which escape might be impossible.','/4v0rLDCAV0CuZTAoeu8CDPBkksB.jpg','2015-05-22',116,'Released','He will kill us.','Demonte Colony',341420,1.1624,6.971,'so6-G5pfmtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40892,_binary '\0','/dWE2Ja6FSMIBZgiBXGv30RCo1hh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4701702',6.9,4587,'zh','老炮儿','Many years ago Mr. Six was a notorious gangster. That was back when there was still such a thing as honour among thieves, when criminals earned respect and maintained principles. These days Mr. Six is all but forgotten, a living relic residing in a narrow alley. One day Six\'s son, Xiaobo, is abducted by some spoiled punks after he scratches their precious Ferrari. Mr. Six realizes that he must do whatever it takes to get his son back — even if that means returning to the life he thought he had left behind.','/hVttIfMDjQwHdVpUYhxdBamkl02.jpg','2015-12-18',134,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Six',357940,2.4615,6.82,'M5mo87QHVg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40893,_binary '\0','/o3XZUwX37gqhpoQcBpqturGTF3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4701724',6.1,25598,'en','Early Man','Dug, along with his sidekick Hognob, unite a cavemen tribe to save their hidden valley from being spoiled and, all together as a team, to face the menace of a mysterious and mighty enemy, on the turf of an ancient and sacred sport.','/5iW2rntwLZoGlFCYYy8TjHyblbw.jpg','2018-01-26',89,'Released','Bronze vs. stone - clash of the ages.','Early Man',387592,9.9888,6.1,'GC5FIWUFfUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40894,_binary '\0','/qG4ud24Ei178ECDksmB1VZ2lleQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4702346',5.9,4719,'en','Scott and Sid','From their first encounter as teenagers in high school, Scott and Sid seem unlikely friends. Scott is a shambolic dreamer, intent on carving out his own path in life and holding up a metaphorical middle finger to anyone who tries to stop him. He is a quintessential troubled teen: on his fifth high school by the age of fifteen, alienated from his peers, crippled by recurring nightmares and disliked by his own foster parents. Sid, on the other hand, wants nothing more than to be liked. An unconfident, awkward recluse through circumstance, Sid\'s impoverished and dysfunctional background leave him no time for friends and no money for hobbies.','/oZKpqyKmIjcborsPIBRn3ah17JR.jpg','2018-03-09',100,'Released','The difference between your dreams and reality is a leap of faith.','Scott and Sid',497658,1.0263,6.4,'N1B4LptcrjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40895,_binary '\0','/3tYQHSuQiJUh9bPiMqyTtzo3tgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4702826',5