igators realise there is more at stake than just their professional reputation. For once they have stumbled onto the real thing, but this time it\'s their own lives at stake.','/hVz7Gr9HWnzXQBev3CJC8EoftHG.jpg','2017-03-01',83,'Released','A New Breed Of Ghost Hunter','Ghosts of Darkness',423536,1.0683,5.2,'C6V1k5YP4N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40899,_binary '\0','/iiHsbj3rxD5kTnfLrCPxgbJm8ka.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4706888',4.3,7381,'en','Laid in America','Two foreign exchange high-school students are kidnapped during their quest to get laid on their last night in America.','/k25RzkhFUFk2x2LF52ZgKaEdHeH.jpg','2016-09-26',86,'Released','You\'ll always remember your first time','Laid in America',347630,2.1431,5.2,'CDfkcx5Wl3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40900,_binary '\0','/qbKOtluFahEStM2dJduDd3xAEXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4708346',5.3,1718,'en','Without Name','A land surveyor working in an unnamed woodland area is disturbed and beguiled by a strange silhouette that moves amongst the trees.','/ppXrjiMiPLYlPmbpKMLzDUygpoF.jpg','2017-05-05',93,'Released','A psychotropic faery story','Without Name',376576,1.0537,5.2,'PBpojEpyJEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40901,_binary '\0','/2DirovVOZFzVkCovrjySFEHp52t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4708348',5.7,4195,'ko','경성학교: 사라진 소녀들','A sickly girl Ju-ran transfers to a new sanitorium boarding school to regain health. But she discovers that students are disappearing and notices abnormal changes happening to her body. She suspects the school for what\'s happening and tries to discover what secret is hidden.','/2dbPWcZi6nqG0ruy609khAoyFwd.jpg','2015-06-18',99,'Released','The lost girls, suspicious school, and abnormal changes...','The Silenced',342657,2.1917,6.492,'3S8der09eGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40902,_binary '\0','/3ZGSYAq35qLWnCSkDoB7BUkqc2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4711762',6.8,1639,'en','Churchill\'s Secret','British Prime Minister Winston Churchill suffers from a stroke in the summer of 1953 that\'s kept a secret from the rest of the world.','/1N53Kw74mGfa8LhBtrpFLhg3lXm.jpg','2016-02-29',101,'Released',NULL,'Churchill\'s Secret',381167,1.9828,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40903,_binary '\0','/iY5y6Cj5AMUKqeNdroJayIeZSzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4711924',4.7,3092,'en','Monolith','A mother and her son plan a surprise visit to Los Angeles to see her husband/his father. Halfway there they get into a terrible accident in the middle of nowhere and now must fight to survive.','/gyI1M8toCUr6xlVnVqXOdATg9gY.jpg','2016-05-12',81,'Released','Technology can be your best friend or your worst enemy.','Monolith',408381,2.966,5.4,'hvIBaZnpMw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40904,_binary '\0','/urxxW3XsfmaURRefxALv6Wr7qHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4712076',6.1,3670,'en','The Long Dumb Road','Two guys serendipitously meet at a time when they both find themselves at personal crossroads and decide to embark on an unplanned road trip across the American Southwest.','/nGfKFEnKqSVaM0I2xxUnDeLx7t4.jpg','2018-11-09',91,'Released','Somewhere between Texas and L.A., S#!T GOT WEIRD','The Long Dumb Road',457243,2.2222,5.6,'ZoxHlMXNCdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40905,_binary '\0','/ufqytAlziHq5pljKByGJ8IKhtEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4712810',5.9,77789,'en','Now You See Me: Now You Don\'t','The original Four Horsemen reunite with a new generation of illusionists to take on powerful diamond heiress Veronika Vanderberg, who leads a criminal empire built on money laundering and trafficking. The new and old magicians must overcome their differences to work together on their most ambitious heist yet.','/oD3Eey4e4Z259XLm3eD3WGcoJAh.jpg','2025-11-12',112,'Released','Unlock the illusion.','Now You See Me: Now You Don\'t',425274,27.8053,6.448,'-E3lMRx7HRQ','YouTube','Trailer',