eir plans are revealed by an uninvited house guest.','/uMNPRkBpQVDiMHD4OIdc2J7lFFd.jpg','2016-04-06',86,'Released','There are only two things wrong with money: too much or too little.','Money',422874,2.5506,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40911,_binary '\0','/cE6vIWWQ9uKHVLG7RWymEsuVe2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4716560',6.6,1938,'sv','The Swedish Theory of Love','Internationally Sweden is seen as a perfect society, a raw model and a symbol of the highest achievements of human progress. The Swedish Theory of Love digs into the true nature of Swedish life style, explores the existential black holes of a society that has created the most autonomous people in the world.','/cIWmCBiIZsqioNpMVyTtoBVRfNr.jpg','2015-11-15',76,'Released',NULL,'The Swedish Theory of Love',370203,1.1286,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40912,_binary '\0','/fSOY4SAUa0GyaDv9AxgjZE2fuYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4717194',1.7,3789,'tr','Sihirbazlık Okulunda Bir Türk','Mehmet, who lives in one of Istanbul\'s middle-class neighborhoods, is the only child of his family. Despite being intelligent, he has never been successful in life due to his mischievousness. Realizing that he will not succeed in the university entrance exam, he begins to think of lies to tell his family, fearing their reaction. Shortly before the exam results are announced, his life changes when he receives a letter from Spellcraft School of Magic and Wizardry. Fearing his parents\' reaction to the idea of a wizardry school, he lies to them, telling them he has been accepted into a school abroad, and embarks on a magical adventure.','/5xc9KBnMDP8tTddPKvFctHTd9Wr.jpg','2015-05-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Sihirbazlık Okulunda Bir Türk',342302,1.0661,2.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40913,_binary '\0','/1HwTbEN3SFiFWxChqVXddxquKHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4717402',6.7,5895,'fr','Mutafukaz','Angelino is just one of thousands of deadbeats living in Dark Meat City. But an otherwise unremarkable scooter accident caused by a beautiful, mysterious stranger is about to transform his life... into a waking nightmare! He starts seeing monstrous forms prowling around all over the city... Is Angelino losing his mind, or could an alien invasion really be happening this quietly...?','/oSMIKsznGYzGfdl611kgEJF889.jpg','2018-05-23',95,'Released',NULL,'MFKZ',461615,3.0574,7.101,'k1Qor3xMfW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40914,_binary '\0','/nJYI9MbOalAu81yBJarJxSNyanP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4718500',6.4,2239,'ko','손님','Shortly after the Korean war, a father and a son are wandering through the country and make a stop in a remote village, where strange and dangerous happenings occur.','/nkX9UdSXNpfDU5Hn7dACaYs7LYe.jpg','2015-07-09',107,'Released','This is what death sounds like.','The Piper',345888,1.8469,7.135,'tPycF54GGIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40915,_binary '\0','/6XRw1b4jKOdkQnTCJptWAGHm02S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4718770',7.1,2705,'en','The Wiz Live!','Winner of 7 Tony Awards, including Best Musical, The Wiz was a massive Broadway hit which spawned a dismal feature film starring Diana Ross and Michael Jackson. Executive Producers Craig Zadan and Neil Meron have assembled a Tony-winning creative team, the imaginative Cirque du Soleil Theatrical and a diverse cast of showstoppers designed to create an eye-popping new take on the musical unlike anything ever seen.','/eZab0jSfiWpawjg6xqedbkwtFU0.jpg','2015-12-03',111,'Released','Ease on down the road to Oz!','The Wiz Live!',353311,1.7476,7,'ZEzGASUFvHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40916,_binary '\0','/geQgwdQBNYOVoUKK2oBB0ILilIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4720596',4.7,3387,'en','Curvature','Helen tries to cope with the recent death of her husband, a scientist who killed himself right when he was on the verge of successfully completing the invention of a time machine. One day, she receives a phone call, and a voice suspiciously resembling her own voice warns her that she’s in danger. Is it possible Helen has time travelled? And what could have led her to do something like that?','/wQ1CwqwGCNZHAkMC0HyEoWYJwzI.jpg','2017-10-08',90,'Released','Changing the past changes everything','Curvature',475961,2.6789,4.926,'FFaWxDD1C10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40917,_binary '\0','/3UcoX8gVusWaQI1jKQj2MOdf9zV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4720702',5.2,14979,'en','Bushwick','When an unknown military force invades Bushwick, a Brooklyn neighborhood, young student Lucy and war veteran Stupe must rely on each other to escape and survive.','/9fGjmzxdiKWsrlY3syrm2aXeTq7.jpg','2017-08-25',94,'Released','The new civil war has begun.','Bushwick',430354,4.0678,5.22,'3GgKghKUOnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40918,_binary '\0','/A2wS0nQsR6EJZxTHzRi3tURIDTY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4721124',6.8,17157,'en','The Exception','Nothing is as it seems in this riveting World War 2 thriller as a wary soldier goes to investigate a mysterious German monarch at his secluded mansion, leading him into a web of deceit and a dangerous love affair with a local Jewish woman.','/nNCS7JdLFzLKaqtce4lzjtGfdp4.jpg','2017-06-02',107,'Released','One duty. One desire. One decision.','The Exception',339987,4.4296,6.9,'ld4eE2HU-ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40919,_binary '\0','/m20HptmxO1QfAVzDDqqWJi5TyZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4721400',6.6,4415,'es','Desde allá','Armando, a 50 year man, seeks young men in Caracas and pays them just for company. One day he meets Elder, a 17 years boy that is the leader of a criminal gang, and that meeting changes their lives forever.','/iAJDa3lBKCB5YBE9QiXEFSnXNZl.jpg','2015-09-10',93,'Released',NULL,'From Afar',352162,3.3438,6.094,'dGxY3tu9mDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40920,_binary '\0','/2N391Zp3MwPrpTCp2hdo2zQyzqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4725842',4,4142,'fr','Girls with Balls','All girls volley ball team The Falcons end up stranded in the middle of nowhere after their mini-van breaks down. Little do they know they landed in degenerate hunters\' territory and the hunt is on. Thus begins a very long night where they must run for their lives and test their team spirit. But the girls are more resourceful than it appears. In the heart of the forest, the tables are about to turn between hunter and hunted...','/cd7WFEjGgcpOSKRYbQoTCDkdhIX.jpg','2019-07-26',77,'Released','They\'re gonna smash the slasher!','Girls with Balls',449684,2.3374,4.2,'9X0GMOcZnYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40921,_binary '\0','/1pPTG1UeVeoLNGNUfYshiSoyoen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4726636',6,5155,'fr','Ma Loute','Summer, 1910. Inspectors Machin and Malfoy investigate the mysterious disappearances of several tourists on the beautiful beaches of Slack Bay, where a strange community of fishermen lives.','/7P1fgJAuKxzFCgEU3B3YS9c4Oz.jpg','2016-05-13',122,'Released',NULL,'Slack Bay',371865,2.8328,5.5,'VjR02NU9rsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40922,_binary '\0','/xzA3eDQQamDA9RHa510PaGiZdrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4727512',7.5,14541,'te','శ్రీమంతుడు','Harsha, a multi-millionaire guy who has everything but there is something else he\'s looking for and in the process he adopts a complete village trying to bring change in the people.','/qHSgSMZUiIqKCe76PBs6QuA6MRM.jpg','2015-08-07',163,'Released',NULL,'Srimanthudu',353533,1.8067,6.8,'EZGapI7yjh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40923,_binary '\0','/gVs4zFnqpKyrqvYpYU4vdDAJiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4728338',5.6,22383,'tr','Ali Baba ve 7 Cüceler','Ali Senay and Ilber, the two partners of Senay Cüccaciye, sell garden dwarfs. When their company starts to dwindle, they decide to participate in a gardening fair in Sofia with the plan to meet new people from the sector in an attempt to drum up new business. Things don\'t go as planned as they find themselves crossing paths with the wrong people hell bent on causing world chaos.','/x5o8vK2BJlXU8qtgNoNNIObJ1rw.jpg','2015-11-12',114,'Released',NULL,'Ali Baba and the 7 Dwarfs',366759,1.6448,4.98,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40924,_binary '\0','/pmtTR2s4hxi3Wu2jTA7GX5o2IcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4728386',5.8,11167,'en','Killing Ground','A couple\'s camping trip turns into a frightening ordeal when they stumble across the scene of a horrific crime.','/tvGAHwX3DsEeJbA9BHL5s114Xw2.jpg','2017-08-24',88,'Released','A remote campsite. An abandoned tent. A romantic getaway to die for.','Killing Ground',409617,2.6128,6.06,'CmAaEiHu_9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40925,_binary '\0','/cbdRRFrA4fAZFWLV1nHmS4zCkQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4728582',5.6,3942,'sv','En underbar jävla jul','A comedy about the new alternative family and how different family situations and relationships come to a head during the premier family weekend.','/zl1OZ5bRvHm1KhAiR7OVYvtfz8A.jpg','2015-11-13',108,'Released',NULL,'A Holy Mess',365839,1.8888,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40926,_binary '\0','/cYQvXNPZLow73lhspVQ7CYlT3Mi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4729430',8.2,242517,'en','Klaus','A selfish postman and a reclusive toymaker form an unlikely friendship, delivering joy to a cold, dark town that desperately needs it.','/q125RHUDgR4gjwh1QkfYuJLYkL.jpg','2019-11-08',97,'Released','A true selfless act always sparks another.','Klaus',508965,10.9811,8.216,'taE3PwurhYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40927,_binary '\0','/vZw7cUeCj0n0o9hmubL0rSUYEhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4729560',5.5,2180,'en','The Little Vampire 3D','Tony, a thirteen-year-old boy on vacation in rural Germany, is fascinated by the idea of vampires. Meanwhile Rudolph, a vampire of \"similar\" age (313!), encounters trouble when his clan is threatened by a dangerously obsessed hunter. Fate brings these two boys together, as Tony & Rudolph set off an action-packed battle to stop the villain, save Rudolph\'s family and learn the power of friendship.','/i9z2rBO4i5MhbvpEIxXZUoXSYUo.jpg','2017-10-04',83,'Released',NULL,'The Little Vampire 3D',442056,5.2098,6.098,'CB_-u2lMNxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40928,_binary '\0','/An5pwPYRBfUCXDxhcgt7rjwvj9G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4729896',6.9,2782,'en','Apostasy','A faithful Jehovah\'s Witness is forced to shun her own sister because of a religious transgression. As the separation draws out, she starts to question the meaning of God\'s love.','/zjhVHDCCl2nwR1yCPZX4xw819Se.jpg','2017-09-29',94,'Released',NULL,'Apostasy',473309,1.4531,6.8,'6Ubd7Je-d6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40929,_binary '\0','/nIB8kKXNukQEqPKB8nsfcemAShs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4729990',5.9,1293,'en','Slash','Freshman Neil\'s Vanguard stories are all he cares about...until he meets the older Julia, who pushes him to put his own fan fic online. When the website\'s moderator takes a special interest in Neil\'s work, it opens up a whole new universe.','/hmrhRg05zoR16hGeSfiMKIRpf6y.jpg','2016-03-13',101,'Released','Internet rule 34 / if it exists, there\'s porn of It.','Slash',347870,1.6252,5.8,'4I9alaSz6Gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40930,_binary '\0','/8DgTx71KiIkmVSrlybndpObKMbW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4730224',4.5,3926,'en','An Hour To Kill','Two assassins-for-hire have an hour to kill (so to speak) before their next hit. To help pass the time, they entertain themselves by regaling horror stories to one another. With bizarre titles such as \"Valkyrie\'s Bunker\" \"Assacre\" and \"Hog Hunters\" - which hit-man\'s story will be deemed most disturbing when all is said and done?','/NzFApOshG0JslkOMJGOs9xzPd9.jpg','2018-06-12',96,'Released','Before they make the hit, these gangsters shoot the sh!t','An Hour To Kill',545598,1.2377,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40931,_binary '\0','/aZoZ84J5ZvT31e1kCtvzugHk1NK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4730706',4.6,1492,'en','Bed of the Dead','Four twentysomethings find themselves stuck on a haunted antique bed where leaving means suffering a gruesome death. Plagued with frightening hallucinations, they must figure out the bed\'s secrets before they are ultimately picked off one by one.','/v1o1QrDi1JElS9lxwu78TKaNxw6.jpg','2016-07-16',88,'Released','There ARE monsters under your bed!','Bed of the Dead',405174,1.7942,5.1,'vQoYlRXzhyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40932,_binary '\0','/3uIHgW5SAaa8kP24aoFvgf9hjOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4730986',7.3,11108,'fr','Divines','In a ghetto where religion and drug trafficking rub shoulders, Dounia has a lust for power and success. Supported by Maimouna, her best friend, she decides to follow in the footsteps of Rebecca, a respected dealer. But her encounter with Djigui, a young, disturbingly sensual dancer, throws her off course.','/gOwIZPNFstt9BWUyekMzSF2Wzd1.jpg','2016-08-31',105,'Released',NULL,'Divines',393729,2.6393,7.648,'VT4YtWdK01M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40933,_binary '\0','/iNpFgFgeD8u00HyloswG2l6L5OV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4731008',5.4,7153,'de','Robinson Crusoe','On a tiny exotic island, Tuesday, an outgoing parrot lives with his quirky animal friends in paradise. However, Tuesday can\'t stop dreaming about discovering the world. After a violent storm, Tuesday and his friends wake up to find a strange creature on the beach: Robinson Crusoe. Tuesday immediately views Crusoe as his ticket off the island to explore new lands. Likewise, Crusoe soon realizes that the key to surviving on the island is through the help of Tuesday and the other animals. It isn\'t always easy at first, as the animals don\'t speak \"human.\" Slowly but surely, they all start living together in harmony, until one day, when their comfortable life is overturned by two savage cats, who wish to take control of the island. A battle ensues between the cats and the group of friends but Crusoe and the animals soon discover the true power of friendship up against all odds (even savage cats).','/oW2CeCoFJKD57iyml0vWGRKKPaI.jpg','2016-02-04',90,'Released','Just because you\'re stranded... doesn\'t mean you can\'t make some friends.','Robinson Crusoe',368940,5.075,5.8,'KNCjU9VEuNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40934,_binary '\0','/uXx9wjfJEzLlfqB8GW67SYBrhVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4731136',6.4,126677,'en','A Cure for Wellness','An ambitious young executive is sent to retrieve his company\'s CEO from an idyllic but mysterious \"wellness center\" at a remote location in the Swiss Alps but soon suspects that the spa\'s miraculous treatments are not what they seem.','/8QWJtne0pTsNoJ86KE993aQYTLW.jpg','2017-02-15',146,'Released','All of us are human. None of us are immune.','A Cure for Wellness',340837,9.9143,6.352,'4mcVodJmBlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40935,_binary '\0','/fbT7a7gYwAmAmnAKCYQ1UwBAXQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4731148',5.6,15706,'ru','Притяжение','After an alien ship crash lands in a Russian city, many who see the inside and the occupants start to question their own existence while others demand the aliens leave Earth.','/uMr2lXCh8PuGBhCIosjknQRv1iT.jpg','2017-01-26',117,'Released','The Earth is for Humans','Attraction',401513,5.3702,6.7,'lElqBmOEfPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40936,_binary '\0','/2U5reJUAR5BGxdXk3iXkSDXsdGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4733046',8.7,1477,'en','The Weight of Chains 2','\'The Weight of Chains 2\' is a documentary film largely dealing with the effects of the Washington Consensus economic doctrine on the newly established former Yugoslav republics, but also with neoliberalism as an economic concept. Through interviews with Noam Chomsky, Oliver Stone and many others, the author, Serbian-Canadian Boris Malagurski, attempts to analyze why so many people in the Balkans are disappointed with the systems imposed after the fall of socialism and how capitalism could be improved. Looking at the examples of Ecuador and Iceland, the film tries to uncover alternatives to the prevailing orthodoxies of Western economic dictates and help developing nations find their own way to shape their economies and their countries.','/wY1PmMYpF7kzovB2nbByKv74NfS.jpg','2014-11-25',124,'Released',NULL,'The Weight of Chains 2',408053,1.3799,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40937,_binary '\0','/hSE7U0RhFRIKRRbcXPMggZX5Hny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4733536',5,4596,'en','American Hero','Melvin, a reluctant hero who is far from super, has been suppressing his telekinetic powers for years with booze, drugs, and women. In the process, he has failed at practically everything, most of all as a parent to his son. After a brush with death, Melvin decides to use his powers for good and clean up the streets of New Orleans with the help of his best friend/definitely-not-a-sidekick, Lucille. For a man who can do the impossible, it might be a fight even he can’t win.','/uYHb5CG90zHp5CDj3dJDP98c77q.jpg','2015-12-11',86,'Released','From zero to superhero','American Hero',367551,2.1308,5.5,'StDQ_P99rPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40938,_binary '\0','/miOnymJ0dN2psWBB8Vleo3fUyrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4733624',6.6,47369,'en','Fatherhood','A widowed new dad copes with doubts, fears, heartache and dirty diapers as he sets out to raise his daughter on his own. Inspired by a true story.','/wvqO1gTAMZIFGi3Ioq1BN6KV95R.jpg','2021-06-18',109,'Released','In it, together.','Fatherhood',607259,5.7427,7.486,'T3mwUEoZdrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40939,_binary '\0','/x9Jogr7lAtiAMyZH2sj6LECfeb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4733640',6.3,25306,'en','The Limehouse Golem','A series of murders has shaken the community to the point where people believe that only a legendary creature from dark times – the mythical Golem – must be responsible.','/u9NnEq4Be7hhwSvkNf6dOAD8ppi.jpg','2016-10-18',109,'Released','Before the ripper, fear had another name.','The Limehouse Golem',369300,3.7646,6.246,'MCJp8-MebGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40940,_binary '\0','/nDr604DFPa8tJTr5j6Mzw2Z2K7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4733736',5.7,1446,'en','Double Daddy','A teen\'s life turns upside down when her boyfriend impregnates both her and a new student at school.','/hRCy7Db1mbtGhZGSxlyW3oTJJTb.jpg','2015-06-06',85,'Released',NULL,'Double Daddy',345054,1.9597,6.9,'AfPHIOVBd5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40941,_binary '\0','/zqQ9Cga8LdVz6Q2UlRT4sRIC0ap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4736550',7,25933,'en','The Great Hack','Data—arguably the world’s most valuable asset—is being weaponized to wage cultural and political wars. The dark world of data exploitation is uncovered through the unpredictable, personal journeys of players on different sides of the explosive Cambridge Analytica/Facebook data story.','/uIrGgUzasEUA7v8uChRhUUFzLwE.jpg','2019-01-26',114,'Released','They took your data. Then they took control.','The Great Hack',566222,2.7635,6.9,'iX8GxLP1FHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40942,_binary '\0','/cJmXtzMJM8dgYTlMysBPPSr0tB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4738174',6.6,4725,'fr','Bon Cop Bad Cop 2','Ward and Bouchard must face an important car theft ring that turns out to be a lot more than they bargained for: one where the stolen cars will serve as bombs in a well planned terrorist attack.','/sXP6WjVJGeZuqVQJVMMAf8CeGma.jpg','2017-05-12',126,'Released','It\'s okay America, we\'ve got your back.','Bon Cop Bad Cop 2',417489,3.1436,6.425,'oFwBOvlQpU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40943,_binary '\0','/JbsB9SIefeFo2ko56GflcNqERi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4738360',6.1,8254,'no','Birkebeinerne','Norway, 1204. A civil war between the birkebeiners —the king\'s men— and the baglers —supporters of the Norwegian aristocracy and the Church— ravages the country. Two men must protect a baby, the illegitimate son of King Håkon, who will be the future king and peacemaker, from those who want to kill him.','/vnOirhpqUu9L2hPf9iwmBmQHmtK.jpg','2016-02-12',99,'Released','A story of legendary bravery','The Last King',360249,3.1356,5.684,'NosnWov78HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40944,_binary '\0','/9EI0gQY9tAQ5y10oc30FpwFOYgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4738776',4.8,1656,'en','Half Magic','Three women use their newly formed sisterhood to fight against sexism, bad relationships and low self-esteem. Through embracing their wild adventures, they learn the secret to ultimate fulfillment.','/jBmxGPdosLFlkwBX7PGkhgXR1wn.jpg','2018-02-23',94,'Released','Getting ahead never felt so good.','Half Magic',345935,1.5533,5.3,'C5jcZGcMdaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40945,_binary '\0','/92KcP4koO0PPx1qjseAnVwn1aNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4741412',7.9,2905,'ta','உறியடி','A group of college students gets entangled in the scheme of a fledgling caste outfit that wants to turn into a political party.','/3WnTpHtMhJJOVytPwiQGko5KOP7.jpg','2016-05-27',126,'Released',NULL,'Uriyadi',400391,1.1786,7.74,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40946,_binary '\0','/n3kMjlUce7p280MLAMU4Qn2KVOj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4741708',7.3,2155,'fr','Le fils de Jean','Matthieu is a 33 year old Parisian who finds out that the father he never knew has died and decides to go to his funeral in order to meet his two siblings in Quebec. But once in Montréal, he realizes that nobody is aware of his existence or even interested in it. He is alone, in hostile territory…','/zQzu6Q2VafNQz7ojdUkf0rvo0lT.jpg','2016-08-31',99,'Released',NULL,'A Kid',382503,2.1739,7,'jb3u-gF7hYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40947,_binary '\0','/o8Z7sdmZXAGYkLXoIn4tfTSu3Qw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4741714',6.3,5309,'fr','Five','A young man paying the rent for himself and his lifelong friends ends up flat-broke and resorts to selling marijuana to pay the bills – only to get caught up in the dangerous world of drugs.','/qs4tQK0gLpwNmz2gmCYZQ3RQSpr.jpg','2016-03-30',102,'Released',NULL,'Five',381356,2.1231,6.967,'Qxz_1Nlq56g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40948,_binary '\0','/aAzddybAxNpcW5VlvmbjRTengog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4741768',4.1,1719,'en','By Any Means','A C-list celebrity gets kidnapped and held hostage after a night-club appearance. When the police interrogate the man she accuses, they question whether she\'s after justice or a front-page story.','/eltSajOLH2T8drL6wLM7mUfN0cB.jpg','2017-06-27',84,'Released',NULL,'By Any Means',461375,0.9421,4.1,'9VXsEMkYXVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40949,_binary '\0','/6kmAgF06vvFbp9mqhMsCiQMBjCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4742556',5.8,2821,'en','Accidentally Engaged','When unsuccessful actress Clarissa returns to her hometown for a wedding and tries to impress her old friends by claiming she\'s dating big time celebrity Chas Hunter, she suddenly finds herself in a comically false engagement when her lies go public and Chas decides to join the festivities in a stunt to escape bad press.','/lArOsPsD5e0W0paC7vReirclHNw.jpg','2016-03-05',86,'Released','Love Unscripted','Accidentally Engaged',417936,1.8474,6.2,'IDBaj98jIFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40950,_binary '\0','/fhYWAKXeEbhD20S3sp4RFaxiOG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4743226',3.2,5043,'en','Air Strike','An American pilot is sent to a Chinese province to teach a crew of would-be pilots how to fly war planes against the Japanese during World War II.','/ve7xmUK167YZloN8LnSyhKmmNgE.jpg','2018-10-26',127,'Released','They fought World War II\'s greatest battle.','Air Strike',345934,5.2939,5.1,'CQ_9UbnbZUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40951,_binary '\0','/bEaQiIjDENdSUu7LYaB3GKs7tag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4743562',3.6,2780,'en','The Last Heist','A bank heist descends into violent chaos when one of the hostages turns out to be a serial killer. Trapping the well-organized team of bank robbers in the building, the killer is now picking them off one by one.','/bEWg8x25wTCysai22ruQR5DDAig.jpg','2016-06-17',84,'Released',NULL,'The Last Heist',344906,2.1187,4.4,'fEWoA6INhd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40952,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4744086',5.7,6772,'hi','की एंड का','An unconventional woman, gains immense success in her professional life but things take a turn when she meets a guy, who wants to be a house husband.','/h0EdMN91ts85jN62UotOOUXa5Ho.jpg','2016-04-01',126,'Released','स्त्रीling पुलling samething!','Ki & Ka',390437,1.7446,5.454,'B2fxtycjf_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40953,_binary '\0','/8NJhybNBFswAIbUFUy7fZcfh8QM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4746484',6.5,2591,'fr','L\'économie du couple','Marie and Boris decide to get a divorce after 15 years of marriage. Tensions rise when cash-strapped Boris must continue to live with Marie and the two children while trying to figure out how to divide the assets.','/98Q38iZx8eHZLVuyFMF7dPMvyzJ.jpg','2016-06-08',98,'Released',NULL,'After Love',377278,2.3634,6.1,'mDpmIYR6kmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40954,_binary '\0','/lOlMW38YoOJd4WxFIGf2KbzCrCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4746506',6.5,2124,'it','Fai bei sogni','Turin, 1969. Nine-year-old Massimo’s idyllic childhood is shattered by the mysterious death of his mother. The young boy refuses to accept this brutal loss, even if the priest says she is now in Heaven. Years later in the 90s, adult Massimo has become an accomplished journalist. After reporting on the war in Sarajevo, he begins to suffer from panic attacks. As he prepares to sell his parents’ apartment, Massimo is forced to relive his traumatic past. Compassionate doctor Elisa could help tormented Massimo open up and confront his childhood wounds…','/6hVOxQX6Q7K6IsOJAw4D7zPIssX.jpg','2016-11-10',131,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Dreams',394260,2.4227,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40955,_binary '\0','/1MIs5fcBZ2F8f2tK98L6DxYtP4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4746516',6,1643,'fr','Orpheline','A young woman moves to Paris and has a brush with disaster. Grown-up at last, an accomplished woman thought she was safe from her own past. Gradually, these characters come together to form a single heroine.','/pZhoVY6vPBlS9LYPgyObR0HW84X.jpg','2017-03-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Orphan',408509,2.9961,5.5,'RjzRnqLbkb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40956,_binary '\0','/eQsellX1IeGaIjv1w4JBzoOrvmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4758646',6,53645,'en','War Machine','A rock star general bent on winning the “impossible” war in Afghanistan takes us inside the complex machinery of modern war. Inspired by the true story of General Stanley McChrystal.','/bU2Q2rCH5VFrJNKSyx6wSmQZFsX.jpg','2017-05-26',122,'Released','We\'re gonna liberate the sh** out of you.','War Machine',354287,7.7238,5.618,'JIO_BFCf8fU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40957,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4760382',7.9,2024,'en','Christian Audigier: The VIF','VIF is a one-of-a-kind cinematic documentary, taking us through the introspective life journey of fashion designer Christian Audigier. He created the brand \'Ed Hardy\', based on the designs of famous American tattoo artist Don Ed Hardy. After being diagnosed with MDS, an aggressive type of blood cancer, Christian is forced to accept what lies ahead of him.','/5U5imJuC7kRSASFwxY9ZkZ71yMJ.jpg','2018-06-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Christian Audigier: The VIF',531654,0.8792,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40958,_binary '\0','/dXQLVJxvScwtUtORAiaAxgikmtC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4761112',7.5,72810,'en','The Mauritanian','The true story of the Mauritanian Mohamedou Ould Slahi, who was held at the U.S military\'s Guantanamo Bay detention center without charges for over a decade and sought help from a defense attorney for his release.','/lIADEa6oH74uUapjsPbNRzxus8M.jpg','2021-02-12',129,'Released',NULL,'The Mauritanian',644583,9.7779,7.4,'7tmxxzZXLEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40959,_binary '\0','/2Dk9WG8R0PYlgZjo5F9iheKybpO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4761916',6.1,43669,'en','Unfriended: Dark Web','​When a 20-something finds a cache of hidden files on his new laptop, he and his friends are unwittingly thrust into the depths of the dark web. They soon discover someone has been watching their every move and will go to unimaginable lengths to protect the dark web.','/nOXuOeD07nZPT29IgiGT0S8PZH.jpg','2018-07-19',92,'Released','Death wants some face time.','Unfriended: Dark Web',505058,6.0435,6.284,'4DJAWGXkvq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40960,_binary '\0','/5ongvEmzV4H2fYQ4wPSNctgC9PA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4762824',5.5,4511,'en','The Legacy of a Whitetail Deer Hunter','A star of hunting videos strives to bond with his 12-year-old son on a wilderness trip but learns familial connections can\'t be forced.','/hOHduIbPV196GU0LMB1NFyR3IRl.jpg','2018-03-10',83,'Released',NULL,'The Legacy of a Whitetail Deer Hunter',311307,2.7766,5.172,'TIwccgV2whM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40961,_binary '\0','/fW8DfFDV3FcLUg7Zoors80muvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4763168',4.4,4827,'en','Kindergarten Cop 2','Assigned to recover sensitive stolen data, a gruff FBI agent goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher, but the school\'s liberal, politically correct environment is more than he bargained for.','/6iVUHy9P7gzaCbMjj13qc6t7my4.jpg','2016-05-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Kindergarten Cop 2',383121,4.9222,4.925,'NkfKechADow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40962,_binary '\0','/Uxsw2VqpHQqdrQGibrQl5VVk0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4765240',4.6,5018,'en','Astral','A detached university student faces the consequences of astral projection when he uses it to reconnect with his dead mother.','/chqJMjTTpPhQ64vgyXEPYL3luG5.jpg','2018-11-23',83,'Released',NULL,'Astral',419407,2.4397,4.8,'spyaXcMBh2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40963,_binary '\0','/AuKCLmUmdzhXPdaTaR8BMxc5Rv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4765284',5.8,79824,'en','Pitch Perfect 3','After the highs of winning the world championships, the Bellas find themselves split apart and discovering there aren\'t job prospects for making music with your mouth. But when they get the chance to reunite for an overseas USO tour, this group of awesome nerds will come together to make some music, and some questionable decisions, one last time.','/v4tbRRX0OSOHcgz2869rEjcBwOJ.jpg','2017-12-20',93,'Released','Last call pitches.','Pitch Perfect 3',353616,10.3845,6.5,'Hihto8onbUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40964,_binary '\0','/988uSYVia50SwVEeK0JXQ0uNDoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4766018',6.3,2969,'en','Family for Christmas','At the height of her career, investigative journalist Hannah Dunbar finds herself wondering what would have been had she stayed with the love of her life, Ben, 10 years before. When Santa Claus hears her “what ifs?” as a Christmas wish, he transports Hannah to a version of her life where she and Ben started a family.','/cmPYjnLUZv016tk2uNNQ4n44ktm.jpg','2015-07-11',90,'Released',NULL,'Family for Christmas',348393,1.3581,5.7,'QQTo_LoDxh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40965,_binary '\0','/oB5PLBusL5e6XrOmrtl4MfrepM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4766604',5.6,1305,'de','Highway to Hellas','The life of Jorg Geissner, a German banker, totally transforms with a visit to Paladiki Island, Greece. A business trip to check on a project called “Galapagos in Greece” by the islanders and for which his bank extended a loan and credit, brought him there. Being a German, he wants to investigate thoroughly, but Panos, a mini-mart owner, and the mayor try their utmost to sabotage him—to camouflage a not-so-good reality. After every single trial resulted in nothing because of the islanders’ secret meddling, Jorg’s trip becomes elongated, like The Odyssey’s, forcing him to contemplate the priorities and responsibilities in life again.','/2RqX9BLGM76S1Bwks2MZiR0cCsE.jpg','2015-08-06',89,'Released',NULL,'Highway to Hellas',334362,1.4181,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40966,_binary '\0','/q9cfRMQURKvPUvJ6AfOZb9M5w7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4766630',6.6,5325,'de','Wolkenbruchs wunderliche Reise in die Arme einer Schickse','The young Orthodox Jew, Motti Wolkenbruch, finds himself at a turning point. His beloved mother wants him to get married and presents one marriage candidate after the other. Unfortunately none of the woman pleases him, because they all look just like her. The situation gets even more complicated, when Motti secretly falls in love with the non-Jewish girl Laura, a so-called Shiksa.','/vtDQaXTLEP6AkAUrliCi9iTrgjK.jpg','2018-07-05',94,'Released',NULL,'The Awakening of Motti Wolkenbruch',486225,2.4945,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40967,_binary '\0','/yYNSWXTqo8eF6S0T1sLEMSrRzDc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4767274',7.7,2545,'en','Dolly Parton\'s Coat of Many Colors','\"Dolly Parton\'s Coat of Many Colors\" is based on the inspiring true story of living legend Dolly Parton\'s remarkable upbringing. This once-in-a-lifetime movie special takes place inside the tight-knit Parton family as they struggle to overcome devastating tragedy and discover the healing power of love, faith and a raggedy patchwork coat that helped make Parton who she is today. The film is set in the Tennessee Great Smoky Mountains in 1955. It is neither a biopic nor a musical about Dolly\'s whole life and performing career, but rather a family-oriented faith-based story about the incidents in her and her family\'s life around the time she was nine years old.','/nlwSzj95aWrwTTGQcynoS2K6YZO.jpg','2015-12-10',120,'Released',NULL,'Dolly Parton\'s Coat of Many Colors',371718,1.9406,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40968,_binary '\0','/ym5SlqMEpsQNPtDIE7KeVFL2qkz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4767950',6.2,3776,'en','A Christmas Detour','A bubbly bride-to-be’s Christmas plans take an unexpected turn when her holiday flight to New York is detoured and she encounters a cynical bar manager who has lost his faith in love. As she scrambles to make it back east for Christmas—and plan her upcoming wedding—she begins wondering if she’s marrying the right man, and learns a surprising lesson about love.','/ogBVg6Bowu3Y5zagUX4z8x2q4OL.jpg','2015-11-28',84,'Released',NULL,'A Christmas Detour',348634,2.0708,6.1,'BzzJtCQn0kM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40969,_binary '\0','/hgtQpT9d3Gpd60IpiA9bFCOSTl8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4768656',4.5,2811,'en','Howard Lovecraft & the Frozen Kingdom','After visiting his father in Arkham Sanitarium, young Howard Lovecraft accidentally uses the legendary Necronomicon to open a portal to a strange frozen world filled with horrifying creatures and a great adventure.','/5eKjZo8bGjzbEEw99Iy0hhLUQHF.jpg','2016-08-20',83,'Released','For Howard, things are about to get R\'lyeh crazy.','Howard Lovecraft & the Frozen Kingdom',409307,2.0518,4.7,'HHCdRCNJl9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40970,_binary '\0','/y9m021FLQARGxoTyQdJk4C27zCS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4768764',7,9429,'ko','베테랑','When an old collaborator gets severely injured, a veteran policeman tries to figure out the way to bring to justice the ultimately suspected aggressor, a spoiled young executive, heir to a mega corporation, who believes he is above the law.','/59KtPlcr2GQIudEA6B5KNY5NnBf.jpg','2015-08-05',123,'Released','The unstoppable. The untouchable.','Veteran',346646,4.5757,6.887,'38c0poYLV1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40971,_binary '\0','/vOPqsZ8DFfbeuwqjFh5hGW47nTD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4768776',7.1,5572,'ko','지금은맞고그때는틀리다','By mistake, film director Ham Chunsu arrives in Suwon a day early. With time to kill before his lecture the next day, Chunsu stops by a restored, old palace and meets an artist named Yoon Heejung. Together, they go to Heejung\'s workshop to look at her paintings, have Sushi with Soju for dinner, and get close. Later, they go to another café and have more drinks with Heejung\'s acquaintances. When asked if he is married, Chunsu is forced to reveal the fact that he is, and Heejung gets deeply disappointed...','/hATTFb4eTiEWfKK6e1mX0zcfSLb.jpg','2015-09-24',121,'Released',NULL,'Right Now, Wrong Then',354275,2.6418,7.015,'CVZyqZZVGAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40972,_binary '\0','/nfCXNs4DJBqHLXTw1W9T1tYwe01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4769214',5.9,2307,'en','Whisky Galore','The story of the inhabitants of the isolated Scottish island of Todday, in the Outer Hebrides, where gloom sets in as their wartime rationing of whisky runs out. When cargo ship the SS Cabinet Minister runs aground the shrewd islanders run rings around the buffoonish English Home Guard commander Captain Waggett and conspire to hide away cases of the precious amber nectar.','/A15APXObFPol0J1YqHp1nbAe1A7.jpg','2016-06-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Whisky Galore',399218,2.1469,5.9,'ClRUmO7_Bkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40973,_binary '\0','/mWMfqLQXl8vG9ZQ6ZoZKQZuTnvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4769430',6.4,1926,'en','Love Finds You in Valentine','Kennedy Blaine, a Californian girl, inherits a ranch in the small town of Valentine in Nebraska. Before she sells the property, she decides to spend the summer in her house and learn more about her family.','/ezne6rc2Zm4EQn86kjoZ2VIJZTN.jpg','2016-02-14',92,'Released','You don\'t know what\'s missing until you find it.','Love Finds You in Valentine',383256,2.717,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40974,_binary '\0','/bh5jnK2SeUw7iTbg9QHIi24S01Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4769824',7.8,14131,'ja','この世界の片隅に','Japan, 1943, during World War II. Young Suzu leaves her village near Hiroshima to marry and live with her in-laws in Kure, a military harbor. Her creativity to overcome deprivation quickly makes her indispensable at home. Inhabited by an ancestral wisdom, Suzu impregnates the simple gestures of everyday life with poetry and beauty. The many hardships, the loss of loved ones, the frequent air raids of the enemy, nothing alters her enthusiasm…','/9Z4H4M2F8OQTB04YC1Opds8MFBb.jpg','2016-11-12',130,'Released','Torn apart by war. Brought together by love.','In This Corner of the World',378108,4.1531,7.928,'-jBe-uHhlNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40975,_binary '\0','/rDZArKpxVhrLXrRYD9xF271klVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4769836',5.7,57997,'en','The Do-Over','The life of a bank manager is turned upside down when a friend from his past manipulates him into faking his own death and taking off on an adventure.','/z9VCm2E6gCAwbM2SELRawfqdXBO.jpg','2016-05-27',108,'Released','Dying was their first mistake.','The Do-Over',389053,8.152,5.7,'lZ1fKYmF4qU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40976,_binary '\0','/2d2FvR3UxELrEHnEY767ny6U1kA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4770142',5.6,1266,'en','The Wrong Car','A woman who was raped by a NetCar driver takes a job with the company to exact her revenge on her attacker after she becomes frustrated with the slow pace of the criminal Justice system.','/bGk7jpanb4udD2z63kscE9VDfaJ.jpg','2016-01-16',84,'Released','Who\'s driving you home?','The Wrong Car',378291,1.5491,5.7,'-Pg1Dral0lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40977,_binary '\0','/eVgEBhfjzlWZXbZQLhdxLbWlez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4771896',6.7,13208,'es','Tarde para la ira','Quiet Jose woos cafe worker Ana, but she is unaware he has intentions other than the purely romantic.','/qwNAEiNrCcOnVNXJCVHxCGEJjsc.jpg','2016-09-09',92,'Released',NULL,'The Fury of a Patient Man',411638,4.4215,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40978,_binary '\0','/rbOePwWWAj5JgvY4ellJZIJHqja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4771932',7.2,5317,'fi','Hymyilevä mies','Summer 1962 and Olli Mäki has a shot at the world championship title in featherweight boxing. From the Finnish countryside to the bright lights of Helsinki, everything has been prepared for his fame and fortune. All Olli has to do is lose weight and concentrate. But there is a problem – he has fallen in love with Raija.','/hFqz2dP3MYDml6hXWU2vaRN6Lf3.jpg','2016-09-02',95,'Released',NULL,'The Happiest Day in the Life of Olli Mäki',392807,3.6231,6.6,'dfGZRD9qtPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40979,_binary '\0','/tx2Dnfv8WuaAljYu452jwsl0DtU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4771956',6,1453,'fi','Tulen morsian','Anna is a 16-year old in a village where women are accused of witchcraft. It\'s based on the witch hunts on Åland, Finland in the 1600s.','/62E4iLpGZvxEwJAHQKK4Kfp0shz.jpg','2016-09-09',108,'Released','Åland witch hunts 1666','Devil\'s Bride',408194,1.2343,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40980,_binary '\0','/pZfpUMEJzw9BZHtXuZzzOrRxtMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4772188',7.8,153517,'lv','Straume','A solitary cat, displaced by a great flood, finds refuge on a boat with various species and must navigate the challenges of adapting to a transformed world together.','/z2sG41PxfL1hnL1mHbxzSREUtOf.jpg','2024-08-29',85,'Released','Disaster tore their world apart. Friendship will bring them together.','Flow',823219,17.3372,8.066,'82WW9dVbglI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40981,_binary '\0','/qovRIA5pon6lWg24CKTvSz4pFa0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4773054',6.8,2227,'fa','آخرین داستان','Kingdom of Jamkard, ancient Persia. After defeating the armies of Ahriman, embodiment of evil, King Jamshid, bearer of the light of Divine Power, abandons his people blinded by pride, determined to conquer new lands. Thus, by chance, Zahhaak becomes regent and undertakes the reconstruction of the devastated capital. But then Ahriman, who dwells in the heart of every human being, begins to poison his tormented soul.','/2rkSsAqSXCdVVaXUSLxqSlv83cX.jpg','2019-11-27',101,'Released',NULL,'The Last Fiction',432371,1.1138,6.9,'4FUvQ10A_fM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40982,_binary '\0','/zaKxmh0RRwERWk4Ge9Agk1kZDvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4776564',3.5,1910,'en','Weaponized','A damaged homicide detective (Johnny Messner) must prevent a grieving father from unleashing a \"robotic virus\" that he believes will destroy the terrorist cell that murdered his son, but at an unimaginable cost.','/tLnCAey9ZkVaUxOp2vahy3FBOls.jpg','2016-03-01',91,'Released','The Future of War is Here.','Weaponized',383140,1.7212,3.7,'OLgpUebFYTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40983,_binary '\0','/sOgj0Kk22lQq40kn19u83JOEZRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4776998',6.1,180590,'en','The Promise','Set during the last days of the Ottoman Empire, a love triangle develops between Mikael, a brilliant medical student, the beautiful and sophisticated artist Ana, and Chris, a renowned American journalist based in Paris.','/iDWer2VFikupdqDc7d5sxCWZ3gW.jpg','2016-12-02',133,'Released','Empires fall. Love survives.','The Promise',354859,6.7085,6.8,'gnwgMYeaqr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40984,_binary '\0','/skvI4rYFrKXS73BJxWGH54Omlvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4777008',6.6,134269,'en','Maleficent: Mistress of Evil','Maleficent and her goddaughter Aurora begin to question the complex family ties that bind them as they are pulled in different directions by impending nuptials, unexpected allies, and dark new forces at play.','/vloNTScJ3w7jwNwtNGoG8DbTThv.jpg','2019-10-16',119,'Released','Go beyond the fairy tale.','Maleficent: Mistress of Evil',420809,15.5323,7.292,'1qIziwbp_7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40985,_binary '\0','/mZeC9lt4eEXV9ksPSV2Fvh7eNRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4778106',5.5,1273,'it','L\'abbiamo fatta grossa','Yuri Pelagatti is a stage actor who is left jobless after a traumatic separation that resulted in his inability to remember his lines. Arturo Merlino is a shabby “investigator” who chases cats escaped from their homes. When Arturo and Yuri cross paths, Yuri is under the mistaken impression that Arturo is a consummate professional. He contracts Arturo to follow his ex-wife in order to find proof of her infidelity. But when he accidentally comes into the possession of a mysterious suitcase containing 1 million Euro, a series of hilarious troubles and daring adventures will result in an unpredictable finale…','/addAIA6JTAGxPH6EEHQPMumI4R6.jpg','2016-01-28',113,'Released',NULL,'L\'abbiamo fatta grossa',379873,1.3328,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40986,_binary '\0','/4COuLuRV17cBCwmzYo2yQiLH01P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4778500',7.4,2723,'ja','湯を沸かすほどの熱い愛','After being diagnosed with a terminal illness, Futaba resolves to spend her remaining time reuniting her broken family, reopening the long-closed bathhouse, and helping her shy daughter Azumi learn to stand on her own.','/eQPZQMBlwSZwJ5d3T21KhcWBjrQ.jpg','2016-10-29',125,'Released',NULL,'Her Love Boils Bathwater',412120,2.3444,7.391,'ekAEWVZjkrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40987,_binary '\0','/nJcWJK4ZuW265ED63440Y3QRlhD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4778988',6.5,9410,'en','LBJ','The story of U.S. President Lyndon Baines Johnson from his young days in West Texas to the White House.','/780oVVWLDHMx2DCn0xUHeOEw0na.jpg','2017-11-03',98,'Released','In America\'s darkest hour came an unlikely hero.','LBJ',353575,3.1275,6.4,'zBX-SYq3v3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40988,_binary '\0','/ppxlOnywKKpAtUiWWvIE6pgDzGs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4779326',5.6,4943,'en','The Water Man','Hoping to save his sick mother, a boy named Gunner and his friend Jo venture into the remote Wild Horse forest to search for a mythical figure who possesses the secret to immortality. When they go missing, Gunner\'s father Amos must immerse himself in his son\'s world to find them.','/krupbFlSTnnKIjpRryrg2CTdeIL.jpg','2020-09-13',92,'Released',NULL,'The Water Man',346687,3.3398,6.1,'Iu8IcplAr4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40989,_binary '\0','/ibKeXahq4JD63z6uWQphqoJLvNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4779682',5.7,232244,'en','The Meg','A deep sea submersible pilot revisits his past fears in the Mariana Trench, and accidentally unleashes the seventy foot ancestor of the Great White Shark believed to be extinct.','/eyWICPcxOuTcDDDbTMOZawoOn8d.jpg','2018-08-08',113,'Released','Pleased to eat you.','The Meg',345940,22.826,6.25,'X_HfzGwzVP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40990,_binary '\0','/c6sTTmEhCamDjF47bLv2PtisHYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4780662',7.6,3415,'ja','Happy Hour','Four women in their thirties reevaluate their relationships, both shared and private, after a startling revelation concerning one\'s marriage forces each of them to ask one of life\'s biggest questions: \"Am I who I want to be?\"','/qUSbCLhKyiO3BZn9ywYJwSOXBza.jpg','2015-12-12',317,'Released',NULL,'Happy Hour',354759,2.3319,7.4,'Zey1icUfbuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40991,_binary '\0','/4IvMs0GxI2ObYhleDydRi0qjVR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4781612',6.5,54288,'en','Imperium','Nate Foster, a young, idealistic FBI agent, goes undercover to take down a radical white supremacy terrorist group. The bright up-and-coming analyst must confront the challenge of sticking to a new identity while maintaining his real principles as he navigates the dangerous underworld of white supremacy. Inspired by real events.','/fEwo3gZfbeoovdcTyf4o4wATE1r.jpg','2016-08-19',109,'Released','Defend your nation. Become your enemy.','Imperium',374617,5.6283,6.454,'9KgWvvz3U-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40992,_binary '\0','/9W0SVxD5xXqdFi2YUW5eCsaDOzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4785440',6.9,1334,'ja','ちはやふる 上の句','When Chihaya Ayase was in the 6th grade of elementary school, she met Arata Wataya. Arata Wataya transferred from Fukui Prefecture. Taichi Mashima was Chihaya Ayase\'s friend since they were little. Arata got close to Chihaya and Taichi from the card game karuta. Four years later, Chihaya is a high school student. Chihaya learns that Arata, who went back to Fukui Prefecture, doesn\'t play karuta anymore. Believing they will meet Arata again, Chihaya and Taichi starts a karuta club at their high school.','/2eJQKiM6mz4qCFl7j6QVttaOuh2.jpg','2016-03-19',111,'Released','Getting stronger, devoting my entire youth','Chihayafuru: Part I',407936,1.492,7.1,'ZjNlJLjDzjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40993,_binary '\0','/40Z4MySeATE1H0DyRvE7souxZmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4786132',4.8,8620,'en','Lady-Like','When a quick-witted yet co-dependent college girl helps her best friend land a boyfriend, she\'s left on the outside looking in and is forced to deal with the realities of adulthood for the first time.','/v7V6T4RWR3eOUSRkOLJYByKu41a.jpg','2017-10-10',82,'Released','Girls will be girls.','Lady-Like',476921,1.478,4,'4Xb3TIW1v3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40994,_binary '\0','/xxyAStrE7vVeKto3dGDAKAZRM68.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4786282',6.3,154218,'en','Lights Out','Rebecca must unlock the terror behind her little brother\'s experiences that once tested her sanity, bringing her face to face with a supernatural spirit attached to their mother.','/AjZXonSbqC3LdSr8xCUzMiQksrM.jpg','2016-07-21',81,'Released','You were right to be afraid of the dark.','Lights Out',345911,10.2156,6.38,'6LiKKFZyhRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40995,_binary '\0','/zy1laRytpaHGv5LTcU2xFh6KsGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4788602',6.6,1261,'ja','映画ドラえもん のび太の宇宙英雄記','Nobita and friends decide to make a movie inspired by the space adventures of their heroes, but their fiction turns into a reality.','/pYVJgcuCU9swa7GEujygsRdkSQd.jpg','2015-03-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Doraemon: Nobita and the Space Heroes',350650,4.5808,6.242,'K08UTl2IBfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40996,_binary '\0','/kgVqSueLqS8yYyzHyv9mPTV1Oj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4788638',6.2,1229,'zh','破風','In the world of professional cycling, where teamwork demands individual sacrifice, the three leading sprinters of Team Radiant must confront their own egos and aspirations as the competition becomes increasingly tough. Arrogant cyclist Ming cares more about personal glory than the good of the team. His shy teammate Tian is unlucky in both love and sports. Finally, the third teammate, Korean Ji-won, is forced to confront the ethics of his manager.','/MLHiA66O6IZHOz2z9sge6fSna3.jpg','2015-08-06',125,'Released','Attitude is everything.','To the Fore',339562,1.915,6.605,'Z3_4N1DoFbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(40997,_binary '\0','/1Xd7KLYh34HFD6RWcp979eKCZ4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4788722',5.8,5513,'tr','Kardeşim Benim','Two resentful, singer brothers Hakan and Ozan who can\'t get along well. Meet again in their father\'s funeral. Even though they want to get back to their daily lives after the funeral, their father\'s will won\'t allow it. They will take a journey with their dead father\'