ir summer holiday on a camping at the beach. Officially to disseminate ashes of a grandfather, but foremost to finally get laid.','/dSE5JsBQEePuR2AZ3ZpgjSF6qhe.jpg','2016-07-07',77,'Released',NULL,'The Dirty Dutch',397582,0.8949,4.7,'GVHw9HhVd4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41025,_binary '\0','/ddDeX81Pmli814XlOCI5JGWmBK4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4814290',7.2,15217,'hi','Te3n','A grandfather, police officer and a priest join hands to investigate and find a missing child.','/yWntREFdME1ctbtG2s7C3eSh9ph.jpg','2016-06-10',136,'Released',NULL,'Te3n',377213,1.5481,6.923,'SeBCB5ERnps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41026,_binary '\0','/rdSFT7XM0cBfwvWhSRnWgO2tFI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4814436',7,3594,'en','A Country Wedding','A famous country singer set to marry a glamorous Hollywood actress returns to his small town roots. When he crosses paths with his childhood sweetheart and finally feels inspired to write songs again he reevaluates his life, his values and his opinion of true love. As his wedding day approaches, he must decide if he has chosen the right woman to be his wife.','/df63EX5PPlq9UDuXUteU9rIg2up.jpg','2015-06-27',84,'Released',NULL,'A Country Wedding',346489,2.5789,6.8,'WMa1F_hk9c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41027,_binary '\0','/htB4lYcSFjMcs3ukSVUbfNhJMT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4814760',5.6,8605,'en','Here Alone','A woman struggles to survive on her own in the wake of a mysterious epidemic, which has decimated society and forced her deep into the unforgiving wild.','/A975uoqpADhIXvREe6fNtTW3KBN.jpg','2016-09-16',97,'Released','Those who stay die','Here Alone',390582,3.244,5.4,'MavY6tMPio8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41028,_binary '\0','/b99d8ye8eT5k0inDHhdqINkiFrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4815122',6.2,50637,'en','Time Trap','A group of students become trapped inside a mysterious cave where they discover time passe