ased',NULL,'Go Away Mr. Tumor',354128,1.3162,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41036,_binary '\0','/72d7ea1TARJvbnIo3hkzklTmQsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4819560',6.6,2746,'zh','解救吾先生','Mr. Wu, a Hong Kong movie star, is kidnapped in Beijing by Zhang Hua\'s gang. The police quickly form a task force and begin the search, ignoring that detectives in charge have only twenty hours before the deadline.','/anGZgk3iSWxnL2KOgw1SYQwv0ns.jpg','2015-09-30',106,'Released','How much is your life worth?','Saving Mr. Wu',362154,1.7394,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41037,_binary '\0','/3OzLnECBANMTBtw16QDMcXcw0b7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4819576',5.1,1469,'zh','爵迹','Based on the novel of the same name, the film depicts the endless battles of four kingdoms as they fight for power and domination of the one ultimate realm.Based on his 2 beloved fantasy novels with 6 million copies sold, L.O.R.D is acclaimed writer and director Guo Jingming’s follow up to his Tiny Times films. The action-adventure odyssey is set in a world of warring Sorcerers, Lords and Beasts. The first CGI Film to come from China','/qIUDi1XDAREkarkwNzOOBgUzqyC.jpg','2016-09-29',113,'Released',NULL,'L.O.R.D: Legend of Ravaging Dynasties',369552,2.3154,7.079,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41038,_binary '\0','/idNowvOzUvJopJc0jFAuSGN0Ymr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4820224',6.5,1868,'en','Anne of Green Gables','Anne Shirley, an orphan, is fostered by farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla, who were expecting a boy to be sent them to help with their farm work. They accept Anne, who quickly endears herself to them and to the local villagers.','/naohj9jmNggrodVingNs1veCwXJ.jpg','2016-02-15',85,'Released',NULL,'Anne of Green Gables',397520,2.718,7.2,'CxBOwhANpcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41039,_binary '\0','/2lrEuswFU4KirfixZgvjRjvr1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4820312',2.6,1654,'en','Krampus: The