nstable schoolteacher whose married-with-kids life appears more orderly) and their domineering father, who gradually loses control over his family due to his wife\'s sudden illness and his own health troubles; these are the three individuals at the heart of this film, a touching story about the strength of family ties in a situation of imminent danger.','/1hSfuatrzihYWVfMkOnRZRVB2Co.jpg','2015-11-09',88,'Released','Two sisters. Two ways of life. One family drama.','These Daughters of Mine',363969,0.7858,6.1,'RV4wuUK8azI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41055,_binary '\0','/9VoU9AV6POqPSVXVR832BZDBAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4835940',6.8,1370,'en','Face 2 Face','Over a series of video chats, a teenage outcast reaches out to his childhood friend, but finds that behind the veneer of popularity and a seemingly perfect life, she hides a disturbing secret.','/lciZWx3qVPUxGnw9rzNBqNgQPuN.jpg','2017-04-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Face 2 Face',470901,1.2163,6,'6msoCKNKoME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41056,_binary '\0','/gG8RoDUbCBu7uyuYTNEhsfPcFG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4836110',7.3,1426,'lt','Emilija Iš Laisvės Alėjos','Soviet Lithuania in 1972. A young theatre actress is trying to make a difference and tell the forbidden story of repression in a play.','/pb5d7Sjb0Hb7FzFb4ekfnVjLFTB.jpg','2017-02-24',120,'Released','Freedom is forbidden.','Emilia',444098,1.5512,7.2,'E53k2tEUYCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41057,_binary '\0','/7XmHQ6QhL0v48c6hu5LEiEi1cou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4837062',7.2,1395,'ja','永い言い訳','A recently widowed writer whose wife died in a bus crash comes to terms with his grief—or lack of it—in caring for the children of a working man who also lost his wife in the same accident.','/yxCsNKSi08lf62gxvTiQaDy0yWa.jpg','2016-10-14',124,'Released',NULL,'The Long Excuse',391804,1.7641,6.8,'1w5oUgQhMag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41058,_binar