:21:10.000000'),(41065,_binary '\0','/bGgcTfGf8jggZZotx3uKpRF2zbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4844148',6.5,7203,'fr','Mia et le lion blanc','A young girl from London moves to Africa with her parents where she befriends a lion cub.','/zXfwBeYe0RnqsJ0dnBoFTB4SSrG.jpg','2018-08-02',98,'Released','Friendship is the wildest adventure of all','Mia and the White Lion',498248,6.0448,7.2,'u7trHXjb19I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41066,_binary '\0','/ezLKohe4HKsHQbwQwhv0ARo83NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4844150',5.4,5516,'en','A Babysitter\'s Guide to Monster Hunting','Recruited by a secret society of babysitters, a high schooler battles the Boogeyman and his monsters when they nab the boy she\'s watching on Halloween.','/bkld8Me0WiLWipLORRNfF1yIPHu.jpg','2020-10-14',95,'Released',NULL,'A Babysitter\'s Guide to Monster Hunting',624963,6.1439,6.2,'MKR33fJ_yPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41067,_binary '\0','/qFq2Ixo3XApoTp1H7JCTgLfGwVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4844288',6.1,2733,'ko','간신','The story of Joseon\'s tyrant king Yeonsan who exploits the populace for his own carnal pleasures, his seemingly loyal retainer who controls him and all court dealings, and a woman who seeks vengeance.','/1YpS9sXZ8bRrmPwULftGbfwImnR.jpg','2015-05-21',133,'Released','A tyrant king, a treacherous subject, and a woman seeking revenge.','The Treacherous',338803,9.46,6.1,'Vc165TX1TnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41068,_binary '\0','/5AhkjcqqRxBdpYZ0TeOuTCuOUYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4846232',7.3,159276,'en','Good Time','After a botched bank robbery lands his younger brother in prison, Connie Nikas embarks on a twisted odyssey through New York City\'s underworld to get his brother Nick out of jail.','/yE1c9hj5Hf8a9KplAdRdhADqUro.jpg','2017-08-11',102,'Released','Are you ready for a Good Time?','Good Time',429200,8.3828,7.2,'AVyGCxHZ_Ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41069,_binary '\0','/mRPvXooggmSav6wTiUXpnZE3OWG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4846318',7.2,10977,'en','Into the Inferno','With stunning views of eruptions and lava flows, Werner Herzog captures the raw power of volcanoes and their ties to indigenous spiritual practices.','/tQaRaolI7rYrDvlWCSqXxm1YTJP.jpg','2016-09-07',107,'Released','What we worship can destroy us','Into the Inferno',360029,2.0317,6.9,'YoSmPkWmG4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41070,_binary '\0','/rfkIeCaIHhN3K5wjJJqKmfUjYp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4846340',7.8,294062,'en','Hidden Figures','The untold story of Katherine G. Johnson, Dorothy Vaughan and Mary Jackson – brilliant African-American women working at NASA and serving as the brains behind one of the greatest operations in history – the launch of astronaut John Glenn into orbit. The visionary trio crossed all gender and race lines to inspire generations to dream big.','/9lfz2W2uGjyow3am00rsPJ8iOyq.jpg','2016-12-10',127,'Released','Meet the women you don\'t know, behind the mission you do.','Hidden Figures',381284,25.5141,8.048,'5wfrDhgUMGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41071,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4846952',8.5,4096,'pa','Angrej','Angrej is a 2015 Indian Punjabi-language film directed by Simerjit Singh. Written by Amberdeep Singh, the film stars Amrinder Gill, Sargun Mehta, Aditi Sharma in lead roles. Set against the backdrop of the declining British Raj, it tells the love story of a young man from the province of Punjab. Ammy Virk and Binnu Dhillon play supporting roles in the film. A tangled love story spawns lighthearted comedy in rural India circa 1945.','/eukKHm776O4IujOpElzfuzDNhA9.jpg','2015-07-31',137,'Released',NULL,'Angrej',352165,1.3195,8.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41072,_binary '\0','/kwAAWbgV0WzkeepNXTHFqL1EVA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4847546',3.8,1224,'en','Blood Feast','Fuad Ramses and his family have moved from the United States to France, where they run a American diner. Since business is not going too well, Fuad also works night shifts in a museum of Egyptian culture. During these long lonely nights he is repeatedly drawn to a statue representing the seductive ancient goddess ISHTAR. He becomes more and more allured by the goddess as she speaks to him in visions. Eventually he succumbs to her deadly charms.','/xpGSILt2ZbBR9kGCFGM58WPddOo.jpg','2016-08-27',96,'Released',NULL,'Blood Feast',353058,1.4044,3.9,'AswhdZP_mlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41073,_binary '\0','/qVdnT5cjhEYTd4pyDN6c5NKyJ2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4849176',4.9,3788,'nl','Sneekweek','Six friends go to party for a week during the \"Sneekweek\". But they are haunted by a secret from their past.','/biVZIlu3vyo2ToZjVc6daBveMMG.jpg','2016-01-28',113,'Released',NULL,'Scream Week',348320,1.8578,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41074,_binary '\0','/whNjsTOUVg2lZLCKgGhnACnmV8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4849438',8.2,136731,'te','బాహుబలి 2: ది కన్ క్లూజన్','When Mahendra, the son of Bāhubali, learns about his heritage, he begins to look for answers. His story is juxtaposed with past events that unfolded in the Mahishmati Kingdom.','/21sC2assImQIYCEDA84Qh9d1RsK.jpg','2017-04-27',167,'Released',NULL,'Bāhubali 2: The Conclusion',350312,6.1458,7.497,'qD-6d8Wo3do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41075,_binary '\0','/58m1VAHe27SkqRnNdR2rxkqVnWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4851630',8.3,12080,'ml','മഹേഷിന്‍റെ പ്രതികാരം','Mahesh, a studio photographer and owner of the studio. As the story moves on, Mahesh encounters an anonymous fight ending up with taking revenge that leads to certain realizations in his life.','/hmK9QUWpOaSs1H7tarzlMNqT60H.jpg','2016-02-05',121,'Released',NULL,'Maheshinte Prathikaaram',381691,1.5437,7.717,'_KY8Du4WWew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41076,_binary '\0','/fEQrmcbTdhmjBk5zN7j7khvSdec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4851640',6.8,3134,'zh','师父','Determined to pass down his art, the Final Master of Wing Chun is caught in a power struggle with malicious local officials and ultimately must choose between personal honor and his master’s dying wish.','/vjPavx5RipvydpVrca1MzwWkJxS.jpg','2015-12-10',109,'Released','Every betrayal begins with trust.','The Final Master',377823,2.3942,6.943,'sm35mEBsqQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41077,_binary '\0','/2jApwp78umL4dK9uSBJAngNDiG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4853102',6.4,66707,'en','Batman: The Killing Joke','As Batman hunts for the escaped Joker, the Clown Prince of Crime attacks the Gordon family to prove a diabolical point mirroring his own fall into madness.','/lrQ3LeNIN0nmviZ692seNBUl1Pq.jpg','2016-07-24',77,'Released','The madness begins.','Batman: The Killing Joke',382322,9.363,6.6,'ZQTqu1_iQkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41078,_binary '\0','/XI4zwcGBSFWNuMBgBdA5WVQ4Uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4853154',6.8,1336,'en','Bill Nye: Science Guy','Bill Nye is retiring his kid show act in a bid to become more like his late professor, astronomer Carl Sagan. Sagan dreamed of launching a spacecraft that could revolutionize interplanetary exploration. Bill sets out to accomplish Sagan\'s mission, but he is pulled away when he is challenged by evolution and climate change contrarians to defend the scientific consensus. Can Bill show the world why science matters in a culture increasingly indifferent to evidence?','/S8hd9NitC0zPD950cqOG1nM6Xa.jpg','2017-04-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Bill Nye: Science Guy',438468,2.1421,6.4,'HGmGNqPpMqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41079,_binary '\0','/wtd9gdvK36y2D3yAAchArknbIQu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4853290',4.7,2177,'en','Out Come the Wolves','At a cabin deep in the wilderness, a weekend of hunting turns to mayhem and a fight for survival when a pack of wolves attack a man, his female best friend and her fiance.','/kDijoX2DQlymtUL44lCxJ1JLsGL.jpg','2024-08-30',87,'Released','Now we are prey.','Out Come the Wolves',1216103,2.812,5.3,'Kve4hZ_DYOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41080,_binary '\0','/8veRW9Hb3cQZgAy28gqvJVo34O1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4855748',5.3,7522,'en','XOXO','XOXO follows six strangers whose lives collide in one frenetic, dream-chasing, hopelessly romantic night.','/5hbTuc8Lbw7N8RwMOc9bjAcSjuw.jpg','2016-08-26',92,'Released','Eat. Sleep. Rave. Repeat.','XOXO',352492,2.1728,5.9,'bUN5uSu_VQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41081,_binary '\0','/157QuwzU58D5RtXmkBl5iNaxigN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4857264',8,217247,'es','Contratiempo','Barcelona, Spain. Adrián Doria, a young and successful businessman accused of murder, meets one night with Virginia Goodman, an expert interrogation lawyer, in order to devise a defense strategy.','/fptnZJbLzKUHeNlYrAynbyoL5YJ.jpg','2017-01-06',107,'Released','Every story has two sides. The truth, only one.','The Invisible Guest',411088,14.0156,8.073,'epCg2RbyF80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41082,_binary '\0','/6F39LP6xVjEX3fAElohyNjsewnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4857596',6.2,1499,'fr','Adopte un veuf','When recently widowed, it is difficult to get used to a new life ... This is the case for Hubert Jacquin, who spends most of his time in his huge apartment, depressed, in front of his TV. One day, after a misunderstanding, his life will change. Manuela, a young and bubbly adventurer in search of a dwelling calls his home! At first reluctant, Hubert will quickly get used to the presence of this energy storm, who even manages to convince him to allow two other people to stay. There are many surprises in store for Hubert ...','/9FpgQeSFHn0wR0ybetcJ20nQyGb.jpg','2016-04-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Roommates Wanted',384371,1.3672,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41083,_binary '\0','/A28a6VEijdm9H4R3oZVOLdRqgNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4857886',6.5,1891,'hi','Do Lafzon Ki Kahani','Centered on ex-mixed martial arts artist Sooraj and sculptor artist Jenny. Their fate intertwines when their past are revealed in their blooming relationship.','/55fwqj0oX9JHOoxGzF7xqSFXgI5.jpg','2016-06-10',128,'Released','Love never hurts...Love heals.','Do Lafzon Ki Kahani',391766,1.6325,6.531,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41084,_binary '\0','/hX3kteYoGqvoPpSlqg6nryFL6xR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4858674',6.2,6603,'en','Stargirl','An unassuming high schooler finds himself inexplicably drawn to the free-spirited new girl, whose unconventional ways change how they see themselves…and their world.','/gwsrtzSrr7G6xjxsa7IwaAMHpEF.jpg','2020-03-10',107,'Released','Why be ordinary when you could be extraordinary.','Stargirl',382748,4.2771,7.385,'pTwCA-0koSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41085,_binary '\0','/9oI4ImMclu3l0OHaK7o9eELfL3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4859168',6.9,15004,'en','Then Came You','An American hypochondriac who is working as a baggage handler is forced to confront his fears when a British teenager with a terminal illness enlists him to help her carry out her eccentric bucket list.','/658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg','2018-12-05',97,'Released','Living in the moment is hard to do alone.','Then Came You',375785,5.5207,7.453,'SIkRfCKd7Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41086,_binary '\0','/8Cagu9KCOFeKyB9zcJQvIDaDmMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4859246',6.5,6193,'ta','மாரி','A feared local rowdy, known for his dominance in the streets and pigeon racing, finds himself at odds with a newly appointed police officer. As tensions rise, hidden motives and betrayals unfold, shaking the balance of power in the neighborhood.','/hlZIYvuEl6mIEbtJYM4NM7RXSjw.jpg','2015-07-17',138,'Released',NULL,'Maari',311166,1.2824,6.045,'W3XFChOz-Z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41087,_binary '\0','/7sl5aTWu804RNnHgpacw4e35Ug4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4861558',5.9,1309,'en','Ferrell Takes the Field','A documentary that follows Will Ferrell as he takes the field in five Major League Baseball training games, playing all nine positions for ten different teams in a single day.','/5Q5Ih02ycriCzCNOxDJ7jtqkt8E.jpg','2015-09-12',49,'Released','10 teams. 10 positions. One Will Farrell.','Ferrell Takes the Field',348819,1.56,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41088,_binary '\0','/975iIaVKrkJtQrB0dUZ10T4gK7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4862506',4.3,1711,'en','The Holly Kane Experiment','An obsessive psychologist attempts to reprogramme her subconscious mind, but when her actions become increasingly uncharacteristic she fears her experiment is dangerously out of control.','/sqGIavEQYwoCiFacC77bVyKM9tc.jpg','2017-03-25',103,'Released','Whose Thoughts Are You Thinking?','The Holly Kane Experiment',450100,2.4034,5,'ApYUE5zdSio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41089,_binary '\0','/ckQFF3q61P0gZHEISPTLohudf2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4863784',6.2,1315,'es','Te prometo anarquía','Miguel and Johnny know each other since childhood. They are dedicated to skate and have fun. To earn easy money and continue skating, they sell their own blood to a clandestine contact in a hospital. The activity becomes business until a large transaction is not as they imagined.','/38VsKKWIIynl5bDWGkm3DkT5scn.jpg','2015-08-09',89,'Released',NULL,'I Promise You Anarchy',317940,1.162,6.3,'CIEWiIabcJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41090,_binary '\0','/uBQenkKfBsb1uYTXFmrbbug3dD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4864584',3.3,1479,'en','Exorcist House of Evil','Based on a true story, shot in THE REAL EXORCIST HOUSE, a young woman returns to her old family home, the site of an infamous exorcism and discovers the devil never left. This film was shot in THE REAL EXORCIST HOUSE and during filming captured both audible and visible paranormal activity which has been left in the film giving those who dare to watch a unique look into one of the most infamous homes in America and possibly exposing them to the devil still lurking within.','/1TFODgQcPnqZ2QTn9QHN1gib4Wn.jpg','2016-05-02',93,'Released','THE REAL EXORCIST HOUSE','Exorcist House of Evil',400456,2.031,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41091,_binary '\0','/oHtJhwEYq9BzFgsSdoUhzwhHRf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4864624',5.7,2106,'en','Hollow in the Land','With their father in prison for murder, siblings Alison and Brandon are instantly considered suspects when a string of killings plagues their town, and they must fight to clear their names.','/972zKdDp4rJfu1IkOigiL97vsQh.jpg','2017-12-08',92,'Released','Small town. Big secret.','Hollow in the Land',352491,2.2576,5.4,'SPcB01kf5qU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41092,_binary '\0','/sM6P9HR36glkzk02A9vGfr3x1Qs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4864932',5.4,11942,'hi','बाघी','Ronny is a rebellious man, who falls in love with Sia but circumstances separate them. Years later, Ronny learns that Sia is abducted by a martial arts champion, Raghav.','/4IEqNeF3PzL06Y2YKsvi4uMGJ1q.jpg','2016-04-29',134,'Released','Be a Rebel','Baaghi',391629,2.1804,6.312,'8HQIKJBUsQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41093,_binary '\0','/5OEmPOFnr73dCnI8ylxtRhT24uC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4865436',4.6,3750,'hi','Hate Story 3','Siya appears to be the bone of contention between warring businessmen Aditya and Saurav. But this one runs deeper than your average love triangle.','/tJVh1ZHZNgR8nqV3j3iSy8fA6Bb.jpg','2015-12-04',126,'Released','Open Love. Hidden Hate','Hate Story 3',361131,1.8427,4.742,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41094,_binary '\0','/le5bVwKZisAyUZ64u6M0dcRX4qi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4866448',5.7,4020,'en','Most Beautiful Island','Chronicling one harrowing day in the life of Luciana, a young woman struggling to make ends meet while striving to escape her past. As Luciana’s day unfolds, she is whisked, physically and emotionally, through a series of troublesome, unforeseeable extremes.','/uRW4NGnfYHcV65QKnUC4Q5EyhVe.jpg','2017-11-03',80,'Released',NULL,'Most Beautiful Island',438436,1.6896,5.5,'CBLKI8ZoJ-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41095,_binary '\0','/bG8RcO3drl9x2iDwvb4bfVnaF8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4866712',5.2,1510,'es','El pregón','Two brothers, Juan and Richi, once had a duo act, Supergalactic, with a one-off pop hit in the 1990s. When the mayor of their hometown asks them to reunite, the two decide to overlook their differences for one last taste of stardom – and a quick payday. However, their fans, local traditions and hidden agendas complicate their plans','/andk1U3PJpnyFKYbFbZcm4aTKFx.jpg','2016-03-18',75,'Released',NULL,'Party Town',378087,0.9313,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41096,_binary '\0','/zeJCq3FU51GpGlkuGm2LLthL4hI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4867110',2.8,12498,'en','Swiped','James, a college freshman and computer genius, is enlisted by his womanizing roommate, Lance, to code the ultimate hook-up app. But when James discovers that his divorced mother is using the app, unexpected consequences ensue.','/cXlGDWGCB2zpmnUzYpQYgYhNrpS.jpg','2018-11-06',93,'Released','Get Ready for Disruption!','Swiped',535437,2.1875,4.429,'t37swly7KPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41097,_binary '\0','/oWiKZjVuR1UHy68sHHXVHO6Fk00.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4871980',5,4630,'en','The Perfect Match','Charlie is a charming playboy who doesn\'t believe in serious relationships. His best friends bet him that if he sticks to one woman for one month, he\'s bound to get attached. Charlie denies this yet accepts the seemingly easy challenge, until he cross paths with the beautiful and mysterious Eva. They may agree to a casual affair, but eventually Charlie is questioning whether he may actually want more.','/sAiF9gKhb3gPbnp9g5nNhrfTqpL.jpg','2016-03-11',96,'Released','It\'s what everyone\'s looking for.','The Perfect Match',378200,5.1041,5.57,'vKCFkFaIwU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41098,_binary '\0','/j8dF5qCN63TnpVn0hsVbZi3VnOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4872078',6,6926,'en','The Intervention','A weekend getaway for four couples takes a sharp turn when one of the couples discovers the entire trip was orchestrated to host an intervention on their marriage.','/yPgppin50E0pxKgL1lmKlFbhTF1.jpg','2016-08-26',90,'Released','What are friends for?','The Intervention',351242,2.706,5.9,'h7tAG38dU8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41099,_binary '\0','/xzTcVyCLqVUlNIZyPpICs80qoVr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4872162',4.7,2104,'en','Countdown','When a madman kidnaps a young boy and rigs him with explosives, Ray Thompson defies his captain and takes matter into his own hands. Now he must beat the clock and save the innocent child.','/ew6SAxLpyQ78h78Z7dudz0hcZ1U.jpg','2016-04-05',91,'Released','The Race To Save A Life Begins Now','Countdown',388862,2.2383,5,'I4vXH2T_AmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41100,_binary '\0','/eTvN54pd83TrSEOz6wbsXEJktCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4873118',7.5,216528,'en','Guy Ritchie\'s The Covenant','After an ambush, Afghan interpreter Ahmed goes to Herculean lengths to save US Army Sergeant John Kinley\'s life. When Kinley learns that Ahmed and his family were not given safe passage to America as promised, he must return to the war zone and repay his debt.','/kVG8zFFYrpyYLoHChuEeOGAd6Ru.jpg','2023-04-19',123,'Released','A bond. A pledge. A commitment.','Guy Ritchie\'s The Covenant',882569,18.9434,7.72,'02PPMPArNEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41101,_binary '\0','/qdUVHx6JB1gf5gY2mYHjYQVOnmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4874206',6.9,6503,'ru','Ученик','A high school student becomes convinced that the world is lost to evil and begins to challenge the morals and beliefs of the adults surrounding him.','/8bRX3YSXNWzCTMRtlFkWcJJeg1r.jpg','2016-04-12',118,'Released','The hypocrisy of religion and society that challenges all of us.','The Student',392817,1.7921,6.465,'toj5lQHgXuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41102,_binary '\0','/3a4iuzvp8HENaYRVzClbtAmeM03.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4874350',5.6,3363,'en','Shadow Fighter','A homeless ex-boxer and an inner-city kid\'s unlikely bond, helps them face their future, while fighting the tragedy from their past!','/nrAMBDxUr6Lw9Ovb7YAoCX4ReHT.jpg','2017-11-19',99,'Released','Before you can fight for the future, you have to fight the past.','Shadow Fighter',546898,1.1986,4.6,'JE2MRbKV0-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41103,_binary '\0','/b1pzSJI1QSs7jRfXK7qs9wVxqTi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4875150',6.7,2295,'pt','Elis','The film tells the story of the energetic and pulsating singer Elis Regina since her arrival in Rio de Janeiro at age 19 until her tragic and early death. Despite all the difficulties, success comes fulminant and the life of Elis Regina gained national and international recognition, becoming undoubtedly considered today the greatest Brazilian singer of all time.','/cf55SD27tKBrYMRqyfQ2LDeNyKs.jpg','2016-11-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Elis',360139,2.1243,7.208,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41104,_binary '\0','/8ebujMHFSSY459EoH8HqsmhF0uB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4875844',7.2,2399,'en','The 24 Hour War','In the early 1960s, Henry Ford II and Enzo Ferrari went to war on the battlefield of Le Mans. This epic battle saw drivers lose their lives, family dynasties nearly collapse, and the development of a new car that changed racing.','/pCoTRoYI7HlUlGIUwMh3yl6Uhrl.jpg','2016-11-20',99,'Released',NULL,'The 24 Hour War',359093,1.9468,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41105,_binary '\0','/cb6l8Aq7W9xUbfpLiygpIEADmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4875960',3.6,3728,'en','1 Interrogation','Detective Bill Daniels has spent the last 40 years in the interrogation unit. Some are criminals, some are victims. Faced with the truth, some lie, some are defiant and some find redemption.','/3vpaHL8Cw2TIi8PHjEXiJLLwb2O.jpg','2020-06-25',95,'Released','To see beyond the lies.','1 Interrogation',373858,1.3683,4.8,'cXvdGMa2lsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41106,_binary '\0','/6FzuNrApEc71aJ3CwwkpadbNled.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4876134',4.5,15660,'en','The Misfits','After being recruited by a group of unconventional thieves, renowned criminal Richard Pace finds himself caught up in an elaborate gold heist that promises to have far-reaching implications on his life and the lives of countless others.','/dPOyYnCkRbWAEem85N3VFpQODf5.jpg','2021-06-03',94,'Released','They\'re not bad guys. They just steal from them.','The Misfits',581644,7.8549,5.4,'X2CQ4EXkdSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41107,_binary '\0','/taXNzU9F5ldI6rNReq7mSgcHHdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4876952',4.8,2080,'en','Ripped','Two free-spirited stoners find themselves catapulted into 2016 after smoking some top secret pot created by the CIA in 1986. With 30 years of their lives lost, these now balding and overweight friends use their uncomplicated enthusiasm to get their lives back on track and figure out the modern world.','/x0wG7HmEM8udBzZCXu5Kl2mtUUc.jpg','2017-06-23',97,'Released','Time travel is a joint venture.','Ripped',352494,1.0221,4.6,'--uT_Ieh_vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41108,_binary '\0','/kTrgxhRSj2sun89bDbnGCPBiey6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4877122',3.5,81214,'en','The Emoji Movie','Gene, a multi-expressional emoji, sets out on a journey to become a normal emoji.','/60bTx5z9zL1AqCjZ0gmWoRMJ6Bb.jpg','2017-07-23',86,'Released','An adventure beyond words.','The Emoji Movie',378236,13.0924,5.368,'Rd85FEdJfTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41109,_binary '\0','/9c9X3HHlBKuPpvOcFIxlldS7TGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4878482',6.5,40739,'en','Dumplin\'','To prove a point about measuring up and fitting in, Texas teen Willowdean “Dumplin’” Dickson enters a local pageant run by her ex-beauty queen mom.','/xJAB1HrFUuOf2VkWPaZ4N2DACCo.jpg','2018-12-20',110,'Released','Find out who you are and do it on purpose','Dumplin\'',472734,3.5614,6.8,'k86KDFh_q6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41110,_binary '\0','/kIYjvWbIQKg3udciGh8Kl78XGPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881016',6.6,1290,'fr','No Home Movie','Akerman films her mother Natalia, an elderly woman of Polish origin, in her Brussels apartment. For two hours, we will see them eating, chatting and sharing memories, sometimes accompanied by Sylvaine, Chantal\'s sister. Also, and to show how small the world has become, Chantal remains in contact with her mother at other times of the year via Skype from lands as far away from Belgium as Oklahoma or New York.','/ucgxIsomVCOamUWRWD7P9gZ5Oe6.jpg','2016-02-24',113,'Released',NULL,'No Home Movie',354388,1.0335,6.5,'S0Z8N8w71lE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41111,_binary '\0','/aRV1oCudtxTvqzSIuw1dI9ZxZ0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881362',8,2947,'kn','ತಿಥಿ','In a remote village in South India, three generations of sons react to the death of Century Gowda, their grandfather, a 101-year-old man. The three story lines intertwine before converging at Century Gowda\'s \"Thithi\", the final funeral celebration eleven days after a death.','/7M5LZMjTiDay94bfY8no8UL2qzM.jpg','2016-05-06',123,'Released',NULL,'Thithi',355786,1.4073,7.74,'Q_NltD4Stv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41112,_binary '\0','/d6NHilDfaYgkyqEvP9KEvhxx9o9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881364',5.7,6491,'en','Anti Matter','Oxford PhD student Ana finds herself unable to build new memories, following an experiment to generate and travel through a wormhole. The story follows her increasingly desperate efforts to understand what happened, and to find out who—or what—is behind the rising horror in her life.','/9DUCdQ4rGn7uoJZcBqNehV5DeXG.jpg','2016-09-26',109,'Released','Once upon a SPACE and TIME…','Anti Matter',429101,1.3341,5.7,'NvRSMpb8Kt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41113,_binary '\0','/oebkVtSxqkPZ7ukSDINnJ3PdAW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881430',3,1405,'en','Strip Club Massacre','A young woman starting a new life is forced to take extreme measures against those around her after things go violently awry.','/lyl0BU6oH84ECo3uDF8L5C1f60t.jpg','2019-12-19',101,'Released',NULL,'Strip Club Massacre',452037,1.2839,3.4,'almoffO1Cyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41114,_binary '\0','/jRI4gyDI0I7jwbqN8QpT9psiGRm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881578',7.5,4048,'en','Zappa','With the help of more than 10,000 dedicated Zappa fans, this is the long-awaited definitive documentary project of Alex Winter documenting the life and career of enigmatic groundbreaking rock star Frank Zappa. Alex also utilizes in this picture thousands of hours of painstakingly digitized videos, photos, audio, writing, and everything in between from Zappa\'s private archives. These chronicles have never been brought to a public audience before, until now.','/qQVsDHZ2JZ4dEtAZVMmZqfH4xpG.jpg','2020-11-27',129,'Released','Save the Vault. Tell the Story.','Zappa',353047,2.7133,7.2,'U4F0rT0F6OQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41115,_binary '\0','/gBmrsugfWpiXRh13Vo3j0WW55qD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4881806',6.2,387600,'en','Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom','Three years after Jurassic World was destroyed, Isla Nublar now sits abandoned. When the island\'s dormant volcano begins roaring to life, Owen and Claire mount a campaign to rescue the remaining dinosaurs from this extinction-level event.','/x2Us3jR6ToMJjbcPbLimYoxf6xr.jpg','2018-06-06',129,'Released','The park is gone.','Jurassic World: Fallen Kingdom',351286,25.9203,6.523,'1FJD7jZqZEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41116,_binary '\0','/4hEp8ZAycjitk7UOX0VpfSFnwRU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4882376',7.2,22451,'en','First They Killed My Father','A 5-year-old girl embarks on a harrowing quest for survival amid the sudden rise and terrifying reign of the Khmer Rouge in Cambodia.','/5370jxJfZQY8TUZiiGkpNgvRwU9.jpg','2017-02-18',136,'Released',NULL,'First They Killed My Father',433247,5.1212,7.4,'5K_SpNqLwzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41117,_binary '\0','/OqvqvsPO3dvLaUbBi56bM24Rv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4882548',6.7,1958,'en','Burn Your Maps','A family in emotional turmoil is taken by surprise in this quirky adventure where an eccentric 8-year-old American boy, Wes, has an existential epiphany - He believes that he is in fact a Mongolian goat herder.','/l5jkLZoaaoVcMpzV5F5rOQDAYOs.jpg','2016-10-07',102,'Released','Sometimes you have to get lost to find your way home.','Burn Your Maps',352504,2.2383,6.926,'q35bysShewQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41118,_binary '\0','/uuOZwQMrRxQDFEUtFHwVNWMmdyg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4888834',8,7709,'ml','എന്ന് നിന്‍റെ മൊയ്തീൻ','Children of two renowned families fall in love amidst orthodox surroundings. When their inter-religious relationship is opposed, the two lovers\' situation is fraught with familial pressure, societal culture and blind arrogance.','/9COT6zivEblc23Rajf2q4SvyhSk.jpg','2015-09-18',167,'Released',NULL,'Ennu Ninte Moideen',360648,1.185,7.214,'graP-a1MxN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41119,_binary '\0','/swMwNrrkchqtRuc7lbYVDHDwwt3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4888982',3.5,2013,'en','The Control','To send humanity to a distant galaxy, the mysterious CEO of The Fuller Corporation must develop a cutting-edge computer-brain interface to keep his hibernating colonizers safe and sane for a journey of unknown length.','/rvXQwy9dWNtIZ9SnLIsgAMhCc3H.jpg','2018-04-26',94,'Released','Reality is the real mission.','The Control',481781,0.8079,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41120,_binary '\0','/bUPUyWVRiynbtMcHbWSlTquvmbA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4890452',7.7,1737,'en','Given','A young family leaves their home on Kauai. It is time to return to the itinerant path from which all things in their uncommon lives come; beginning and ending on a remote dot in the Pacific. They nomadically trace continents to places where waves meet their edges, envoys of aloha. It is what they will learn, what they bring others, what they will pass on to their children in the hyper-expanded classroom, the lab of direct being; a legacy passed from a father to his family.','/jsrX650umhno3p2j9nvUlAP4F0Z.jpg','2017-02-24',72,'Released',NULL,'Given',369821,1.155,7.4,'fRiZas-DhX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41121,_binary '\0','/5FYJ76O56x4QuSZLnEwuXYGIVrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4895668',6.9,2184,'pt','São Jorge','In 2011 Portugal began the so-called \"year of the Troika\" (EU, IMF and ECB budget cuts and economic restructuring), with the level of debt among the Portuguese people reaching staggering amounts and a growing number of families and companies unable to repay their installment loans. Jorge is an unemployed boxer on the verge of losing his son and his wife, who has decided to return to Brazil. As a means of paying off his debt and persuading his wife to remain in Portugal, Jorge accepts a job with a debt-collection agency, which will drag him into a world of violence and crime.','/sdKXQmMvbYiXIWNB0qrQ3NLckSI.jpg','2017-03-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Saint George',412660,0.8944,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41122,_binary '\0','/gpPEVP2HNUyq6ghtqcnZ8kZgM7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4895740',7.1,5053,'tr','Abluka','With Istanbul mired in political violence, Kadir is offered release after 15 years in prison if he’ll work as an informant. In a shantytown he stumbles upon his brother Ahmet, working for the city rounding up stray dogs and shutting himself in his home.','/bza9EaNrx20BrMFmbEsay5McPcf.jpg','2015-07-29',119,'Released',NULL,'Frenzy',352196,1.512,6.97,'aWDIYhXLmJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41123,_binary '\0','/lQzSMhkAl90iXPirjnLbRHkxApC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4896168',5.1,5522,'en','Bed Rest','After struggling to start a family, Julie Rivers becomes pregnant and moves into a new home with her husband. She\'s ordered to mandatory bed rest, and begins seeing ghostly happenings throughout the house.','/tiZF8b9T9fMcwvsEEkJ5ik1wCnV.jpg','2023-02-10',90,'Released','Fear never rests.','Bed Rest',917007,4.6772,6.191,'P1wZvRRJSvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41124,_binary '\0','/5VyhH13KKz41Uwl6NHmven0tpo0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4897358',3.3,1254,'en','The Raking','THE RAKING tells the story of a group of college students who set out to debunk an urban legend in Joshua Tree, California for their anthropology thesis, only to find that they become part of the legend themselves.','/aFJznR0Pry6we80vQkndCLfLzJl.jpg','2017-03-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The Raking',445602,1.1128,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41125,_binary '\0','/u0MkKzk3WwfrV7GgRTXVoFTP5TA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4897822',7.5,26596,'en','Where to Invade Next','To understand firsthand what the United States of America can learn from other nations, Michael Moore playfully “invades” some to see what they have to offer.','/58gW2Uty2cAsgBgwC58vT2Z9SVt.jpg','2015-12-23',121,'Released','Prepare to be liberated','Where to Invade Next',352208,3.2271,7.239,'WLLJDmusC2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41126,_binary '\0','/3wYxUh4sUK2oLhtcGMHEDi7FZ8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4898564',3.6,4274,'en','Red Devil','An intertwining tale of sex, drugs, rock and woe. Lives criss-cross and converge thanks to the most addictive drug in human history, Red Devil—which also happens to be the title of Savvas D. Michael’s tale of sex, drugs, and guns. An anonymous voice at the start of the film warns, “Once you’ve tasted the devil’s cum, everything else is dull and numb.” The current problem with the Red Devil drug is the supply has dried up. Addicts are so desperate for it they’re willing to kill for it…and they do.','/pbgi9JIRc9dMr8kS9zYVKppsUE4.jpg','2019-11-29',93,'Released','Everyone\'s getting smoked!','Red Devil',652048,1.327,5.5,'9FGIIm1m8lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41127,_binary '\0','/nN7iuNq9JRxCSNfTT9KdsMYXgSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4898730',3.7,5347,'en','Temple','Three American tourists follow a mysterious map deep into the jungles of Japan searching for an ancient temple. When spirits entrap them, their adventure quickly becomes a horrific nightmare.','/AjG0N5uWAWfF4HlYT2feb7tnFHo.jpg','2017-09-01',78,'Released','Say your prayers.','Temple',467239,1.7193,3.9,'fzOpgENP_w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41128,_binary '\0','/lrHfbfrEl9keXee7lLngtKtStS8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4899370',7.1,30470,'en','Megan Leavey','The true story of Marine Corporal Megan Leavey, who forms a powerful bond with an aggressive combat dog, Rex. While deployed in Iraq, the two complete more than 100 missions and save countless lives, until an IED explosion puts their faithfulness to the test.','/yq66hYkXFaj2DDqCkF6T2wT7VxQ.jpg','2017-06-09',116,'Released','Based on the true story of a marine\'s best friend.','Megan Leavey',424488,7.0274,7.259,'IGGcFbW__XI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41129,_binary '\0','/ldVlc16CVgreuzuv236HRMbmI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4899406',6.8,3717,'pt','Boi Neon','Iremar works at the rodeo in North East of Brazil. From his home, the truck he uses to transport the animals, he dreams of a future in the region\'s booming clothing industry.','/5UZOBQBxofQguD2jGgHxvZjqiLI.jpg','2016-01-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Neon Bull',314029,1.5896,6.7,'84cSaJqtyD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41130,_binary '\0','/63beODyAyu3NS49Wa2RrHmd8Mk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4899880',8.2,1496,'ur','شاہ','This film covers the story of this Legend\'s journey from homeless child in the streets of Layari,Karachi to become Olympian for his country PAKISTAN.','/lLLMdjWBjm5UXdQEYEvtukeKHRG.jpg','2015-08-13',109,'Released','After Every Fall, I Rise','Shah',398753,1.0659,8.4,'qTZfJfyD9TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41131,_binary '\0','/1cdCZmZjehqgf3IuTaiHtKcMFZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4900018',7.1,3873,'en','Keith Richards: Under the Influence','A portrait of Keith Richards that takes us on a journey to discover the genesis of his sound as a songwriter, guitarist and performer.','/bNx53hiIu5J8VsABlXwSP6pUhCh.jpg','2015-09-18',82,'Released',NULL,'Keith Richards: Under the Influence',360341,2.318,6.764,'NHh24Y9LrY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41132,_binary '\0','/ukPu5xYOBAnh5H46uK4aQOirW2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4900148',6.6,48396,'en','Elio','Elio, a space fanatic with an active imagination, finds himself on a cosmic misadventure where he must form new bonds with eccentric alien lifeforms, navigate a crisis of intergalactic proportions and somehow discover who he is truly meant to be.','/7z8jDiTZZco9moIKpTUImFtTy7o.jpg','2025-06-18',98,'Released','They asked for our leader. They got... him.','Elio',1022787,19.4537,6.9,'2w_K3CB8PuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41133,_binary '\0','/i9iDQ3lrW2mZHnSWWCLeefwurXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4900708',6.4,6967,'ja','クリーピー 偽りの隣人','After having narrowly escaped an attempt on his life at the hands of a psychopath, detective inspector Takakura quits active service in the police force and takes up a position as a university lecturer in criminal psychology. But his desire to get to the bottom of criminals’ motives remains, and he does not hesitate long when former colleague Nogami asks him to reopen an old case.','/5HyHEU2zstaH2LLQfDVAafqLrba.jpg','2016-06-18',130,'Released','That man isn\'t my father… he\'s a total stranger.','Creepy',380620,2.4917,6.7,'7kI_ACTcdEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41134,_binary '\0','/A1TQEghkN2QuHQTwrziA5ttfqib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4900716',7.7,34132,'hi','कपूर एण्ड सन्स','Returning home to visit their ill grandfather, two estranged brothers must confront their unresolved rivalry while their parents’ marriage frays.','/oPdcOInH8TqR5udDTDPiDuLSN90.jpg','2016-03-18',137,'Released','Since 1921.','Kapoor & Sons',374173,1.6428,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41135,_binary '\0','/vnNoIceM4vO8iKz7Pzk1ZGKdOuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4901304',7.5,1297,'zh','悲兮魔兽','Under the sun, the heavenly beauty of grasslands will soon be covered by the raging dust of mines. Facing the ashes and noises caused by heavy mining , the herdsmen have no choice but to leave as the meadow areas dwindle. In the moonlight, iron mines are brightly lit throughout the night. Workers who operate the drilling machines must stay awake. The fight is tortuous, against the machine and against themselves. Meanwhile, coal miners are busy filling trucks with coals. Wearing a coal-dust mask, they become ghostlike creatures. An endless line of trucks will transport all the coals and iron ores to the iron works. There traps another crowd of souls, being baked in hell. In the hospital, time hangs heavy on miners\' hands. After decades of breathing coal dust, death is just around the corner. They are living the reality of purgatory, but there will be no paradise.','/aoomIXBtZUZgge8qcV0yHmEhIV1.jpg','2015-11-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Behemoth',352202,1.2242,7.5,'BfO_0B6_YYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41136,_binary '\0','/1YhiocGm8aOwILGX7mwlkdbr0ph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4901306',7.7,78252,'it','Perfetti sconosciuti','During a dinner, a group of friends decide to share whatever message or phone call they will receive during the evening, with unforeseen consequences.','/3wknM629Vryofb1HNo2YnLQnQyn.jpg','2016-02-11',97,'Released','Everyone has three lives: A public life. A private life... and a secret life.','Perfect Strangers',381341,5.7397,7.85,'-lOUnBsjGuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41137,_binary '\0','/ghoeE63UBG8XKdMwOZkSY4wKAOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4901756',5.2,1777,'ru','Пиковая дама: Черный обряд','There is an ancient ritual known to humankind for more than a hundred years...According to the legend, an ominous entity known as The Queen of Spades can be summoned by drawing a door and staircase on a mirror in the darkness, and by saying her name three times. The Queen of Spades gets her energy from reflective objects; she cuts locks of hair from those asleep, and those that see her go mad or die. Four teenagers decide to call The Queen of Spades as a joke. But when one of them dies of a sudden heart attack, the group realizes they are up against something inexplicable and deadly dangerous.','/oBN7kp13viC1ND6RyqKxzQfw5ep.jpg','2015-09-10',94,'Released','Evil Lives In The Reflection','Queen of Spades: The Dark Rite',358962,2.4089,5.3,'1ku_z3zr7X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41138,_binary '\0','/bBlCqswxOBnj1HpolbGJv9qqtGs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4902012',7,1549,'en','Hurricane of Fun: The Making of Wet Hot','Exclusive behind-the-scenes footage offers a glimpse into the comic minds behind a \"Wet Hot\" summer-camp cult hit featuring many future stars.','/jJucJnv6VvFNzcC4VVovkh5e1gZ.jpg','2015-07-31',64,'Released','It was the low-budget summer camp movie that morphed into a cult hit. And the cast members are now movie and TV legends.','Hurricane of Fun: The Making of Wet Hot',352552,1.9276,6.4,'O2jLDzt__K4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41139,_binary '\0','/m3HkxnWHCkXZ9MieSW3nc4Aswfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4902266',4.8,1495,'zh','解码游戏','Li Haoming, a talented funny geek enjoys living in his own virtual world and suddenly is dragged into a real dangerous hacker game by mysterious men. Contemporary police cyber security team go under cover in Shanghai and Kuala Lumpur to capture cybercriminal gang and thwart their attempt to hack computer control system.','/ihnBeZ3KYqGhjr1XIoxmWMRaWWz.jpg','2018-08-03',99,'Released',NULL,'Reborn',542330,1.6675,7,'uxM6vsMNwXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41140,_binary '\0','/oAIYMSBmaxNaUEJIIdaI1mGAJU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4902716',5,6164,'en','Rebirth','A man\'s life is turned inside out after a visit from his college friend leads him into the unexpected.','/rBI7uS5DDfWBPfMmlxUvgn0PePa.jpg','2016-04-17',101,'Released','Behind each door could be your dream or your worst nightmare.','Rebirth',369033,1.7571,4.7,'M5lmzJ9g2BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41141,_binary '\0','/dWaGRBKrZldQ2xE1obhj5iriJLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4902904',6.3,2704,'en','The Resurrection of Gavin Stone','Gavin Stone, a washed-up former child star, is forced to do community service at a local megachurch and pretends to be Christian so he can land the part of Jesus in their annual Passion Play, only to discover that the most important role of his life is far from Hollywood.','/mby5ISXFVRFSDUkpFDGCZ4k5rTn.jpg','2017-01-20',91,'Released','If church can change him it will take a miracle.','The Resurrection of Gavin Stone',422114,2.4718,5.7,'Iw8p8LKBPRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41142,_binary '\0','/htGAkMVOAcakH9VdqCPUk9ipFrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4906164',5.3,1258,'en','Mercy Christmas','When Michael Briskett meets the perfect woman, his ideal Christmas dream comes true when she invites him to her family\'s holiday celebration. Dreams shattered, Michael struggles to survive once he realizes HE will be Christmas dinner.','/2jRVyg7YRPpq4SLaa047eVNJvwe.jpg','2017-11-28',83,'Released','Dinner is served.','Mercy Christmas',423383,1.9425,4.9,'yXqkNn4Em3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41143,_binary '\0','/5Ib6ZlG1eiqqBl8t33bunSGay9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4906960',4.9,5628,'hi','बादशाहो','Emergency has been declared in India. Maharani Gitanjali from one of Rajasthan\'s princely states has already lost her privy purse. Now, she fears that she will lose the last treasure chest of gold which has been forcibly taken away from her. So she asks her trusted lieutenant, Bhawani to step in and plan a heist.','/bIE8K6UCaVvtF7bvFQOQrAA4KuR.jpg','2017-09-01',136,'Released','1975 Emergency...96 Hours...600km...1 Armoured Truck...Millions in Gold...5 Badasses','Baadshaho',441894,1.7981,5.442,'Ny7fULat8ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41144,_binary '\0','/6X5UsOSSdUR2MRCbHGFdMiaGzNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4906984',5.7,6258,'hi','Azhar','The famous and idolized Indian cricketer Mohammad Azharuddin, known as Azhar, faces in court those who accuse him of match-fixing in exchange for large sums of money during the national team\'s tour of South Africa.','/jwvpI85cqfVfs3ioFHu4invTLeI.jpg','2016-05-13',130,'Released','Love him. Hate him. Judge him.','Azhar',391778,1.1161,5.688,'C1MOI8vaQos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41145,_binary '\0','/xyXE3m9PAgcrvpMxXTfmbrHo9p7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4907206',3.3,2358,'en','Turnt','This is a story of a young man named Kenny Stanford who had dreams of being an Successful artist in the music industry, but these dreams were cut short due to senseless street violence. His older brother Libaraiers Stanford lived by the laws of Money, Power and Respect. Due to the death of his brother, Libaraiers found himself on a new unlikely journey as a rap artist. He soon discovered that he possessed raw talent. This raw talent and his natural street persona birthed his rap name Rilla.','/zoED4hhzqrenk3iyMXPr09Ii9S6.jpg','2020-01-04',85,'Released',NULL,'Turnt',665778,0.7552,3,'WqQK3FuFncs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41146,_binary '\0','/alRXrkpzk7f11ZPIpaPPsfYp6KW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4908254',6.9,1865,'en','The Illegal','A gritty realistic story about a young film school student from middle-class India who\'s forced to drop out to support his family while staying in the United States as an undocumented worker.','/wh6K0nuzQx5DpOOd5WTxBjlAA2a.jpg','2021-03-23',86,'Released',NULL,'The Illegal',644784,0.8712,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41147,_binary '\0','/nhjWUf4wXsWZY9hKR1EoQOhjued.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4908644',8.3,21601,'en','Winter on Fire: Ukraine\'s Fight for Freedom','Over 93 days in Ukraine, what started as peaceful student demonstrations became a violent revolution and full-fledged civil rights movement.','/xGKMWhYsK3OxQ6ceqMnvXBfFd7G.jpg','2015-09-03',98,'Released','The next generation of revolution.','Winter on Fire: Ukraine\'s Fight for Freedom',355020,2.2647,7.863,'RibAQHeDia8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41148,_binary '\0','/wF1sbZOK6A8a0MwRh8M9DCWFkZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4909506',8.6,3982,'kn','ಗೋಧಿ ಬಣ್ಣ ಸಾಧಾರಣ ಮೈಕಟ್ಟು','Venkob Rao, a widower suffering from Alzheimer\'s disease, is moved to an old-age home by his son. When he goes missing one day, he crosses swords with criminals.','/4dImTMse7PPFGHPG6GQuwDng9fB.jpg','2016-06-03',143,'Released',NULL,'Godhi Banna Sadharana Mykattu',402109,1.4152,8.154,'aPk9fBdtugg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41149,_binary '\0','/xPqdtlmJ2EbfSxQkoyvghv3zs6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4909752',5.6,5349,'hi','रंगून','Julia travels to the Indo-Burma border to perform for the troops during the World War II, on the insistence of Billimoria, her lover. She finds herself in love with Jemadar Malik, a soldier there.','/dJ7N9N3zjCCsPIP8nDVPEH6fvSo.jpg','2017-02-24',167,'Released','Love. War. Deceit','Rangoon',392271,1.4913,6.1,'B-tC0wcIu24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41150,_binary '\0','/tdJkzbd9xytGWuqFgxqz8549Lbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4909984',6.1,1500,'tr','Albüm','A couple in their late 30’s sets out to prepare a fake photo album of a pseudo pregnancy period in order to prove their biological tie to the baby they’re planning to adopt.','/brGIZV0NBviWVo0rNU2aYWU6q93.jpg','2016-07-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Album',393518,1.3208,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41151,_binary '\0','/kEHu88JMh9Zh4RYcgK7Lo2YZwdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4911940',6.9,12208,'de','Tschick','Maik, a fourteen-year-old teenager, sets out on a road trip during summertime with Tschick, a new classmate, in a stolen car. The two share life changing experiences during the eventful journey.','/fMXPFsNFWgxi6NCmttI6GJq8pa8.jpg','2016-09-15',93,'Released','The Best Summer of All!','Goodbye Berlin',384664,2.4406,6.7,'ZAWPG3HU9KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41152,_binary '\0','/nxrXD2u72bzNmAgEeqLFOmG7XzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000','tt4911996',6.6,6807,'en','Goldstone','Indigenous Detective Jay Swan arrives in the frontier town of Goldstone on a missing persons inquiry. What seems like a simple investigation unearths an intricate web of crime, corruption, human trafficking, and coordinated exploitation of indigenous people’s land. Jay must bury his differences with young local cop Josh, so together they can bring justice to Goldstone.','/awXoAUuehhsOnCEdB7BYAetdK6r.jpg','2016-07-07',109,'Released','Where worlds collide.','Goldstone',393834,2.1818,5.992,'Zqa57fATkew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:10.000000'),(41153,_binary '\0','/5jn